[2]={nameES="01. Las nuevas aventuras de Bilbo Bolsón, capítulo 1",objectivesES={"Celeblír se encuentra al oeste de la Última Morada, cerca del pregonero.","Completa 'Miniaventura: Las nuevas aventuras de Bilbo Bolsón, capítulo 1'","No faltan las aventuras para un hobbit curioso y viajero. ¿En qué andará metido ahora Bilbo Bolsón?","Habla con Celeblír","Tu misión es encontrar a Bilbo Bolsón. ¡Habla con Celeblír para comenzar tu búsqueda!","01. Las nuevas aventuras de Bilbo Bolsón, capítulo 1"}},
[3]={nameES="01. Las nuevas aventuras de Elladan y Elrohir, capítulo 1",objectivesES={"Habla con Elladan fuera de la Biblioteca de Elrond","Elladan te espera fuera de la Biblioteca de Elrond.","Completa 'Miniaventura: Las nuevas aventuras de Elladan y Elrohir, capítulo 1'","Tu inspección del Bruinen te ha llevado a Echad Candelleth.\
\
Debes hablar con Elrohir.","Habla con Elrohir","Debes hablar con Elladan fuera de la Biblioteca de Elrond para comenzar tu inspección del Bruinen.","El señor Elrond ha confiado una misión secreta a sus hijos, Elladan y Elrohir, que los llevará hasta la Lothlórien. Debes acompañarlos.","01. Las nuevas aventuras de Elladan y Elrohir, capítulo 1"}},
[4]={nameES="02. Las nuevas aventuras de Bilbo Bolsón, Capítulo 2",objectivesES={"02. Las nuevas aventuras de Bilbo Bolsón, Capítulo 2","Celeblír se encuentra al oeste de la Última Morada, cerca del pregonero.","Completa 'Miniaventura: Las nuevas aventuras de Bilbo Bolsón, Capítulo 2'","No faltan las aventuras para un hobbit curioso y viajero. ¿En qué andará metido ahora Bilbo Bolsón?","Tu misión es encontrar a Bilbo Bolsón. ¡Habla con Celeblír para continuar la búsqueda!","Habla con Celeblír"}},
[5]={nameES="02. Las nuevas aventuras de Elladan y Elrohir, capítulo 2",objectivesES={"Completa 'Miniaventura: Las nuevas aventuras de Elladan y Elrohir, capítulo 2'","Tú y los gemelos han llegado a Echad Eregion.\
\
Elladan tiene algo que decirte.","Las Grandes Águilas pueden haber descubierto información importante para la misión de los gemelos.","Elrohir ha avistado una Gran Águila volando en dirección a Eregion.\
\
Habla con Elrohir en Echad Candelleth, en el Bosque de los Trolls, para continuar tu viaje.","Habla con Elladan.","02. Las nuevas aventuras de Elladan y Elrohir, capítulo 2"}},
[6]={nameES="03. Las nuevas aventuras de Bilbo Bolsón, Capítulo 3",objectivesES={"Completa 'Miniaventura: Las nuevas aventuras de Bilbo Bolsón, Capítulo 3'","03. Las nuevas aventuras de Bilbo Bolsón, Capítulo 3","Celeblír se encuentra al oeste de la Última Morada, cerca del pregonero.","No faltan las aventuras para un hobbit curioso y viajero. ¿En qué andará metido ahora Bilbo Bolsón?","Tu misión es encontrar a Bilbo Bolsón. ¡Habla con Celeblír para continuar la búsqueda!","Habla con Celeblír"}},
[7]={nameES="03. Las nuevas aventuras de Elladan y Elrohir, capítulo 3",objectivesES={"Habla con Elrohir","03. Las nuevas aventuras de Elladan y Elrohir, capítulo 3","La ira de la montaña puede hacer del Paso del Cuerno Rojo la etapa más peligrosa de tu aventura.","Después del inquietante viaje por el Paso del Cuerno Rojo, tu grupo ha llegado sano y salvo al Valle del Arroyo Sombrío.\
\
Debes hablar con Elrohir para ver cómo está.","La ruta elegida por los gemelos para llegar a Lórien cruza el Paso del Cuerno Rojo.\
\
Debes hablar con Elladan en Echad Eregion, en Eregion, para continuar tu viaje.","Completa 'Miniaventura: Las nuevas aventuras de Elladan y Elrohir, capítulo 3'"}},
[8]={nameES="04. Las nuevas aventuras de Bilbo Bolsón, Capítulo 4",objectivesES={"Completa 'Miniaventura: Las nuevas aventuras de Bilbo Bolsón, Capítulo 4'","Celeblír se encuentra al oeste de la Última Morada, cerca del pregonero.","04. Las nuevas aventuras de Bilbo Bolsón, Capítulo 4","No faltan las aventuras para un hobbit curioso y viajero. ¿En qué andará metido ahora Bilbo Bolsón?","Tu misión es encontrar a Bilbo Bolsón. ¡Habla con Celeblír para continuar la búsqueda!","Habla con Celeblír"}},
[9]={nameES="04. Las nuevas aventuras de Elladan y Elrohir, capítulo 4",objectivesES={"Completa 'Miniaventura: Las nuevas aventuras de Elladan y Elrohir, capítulo 4'","Elrohir está preocupado por las noticias que Gwaihir trajo sobre los lobos a lo largo del Anduin.\
\
Debes hablar con Elrohir en Echad Andestel, en Lothlórien, para continuar tu viaje.","Aunque casi has llegado a tu destino, el peligro aún puede acechar cerca.","Tu grupo ha descubierto una posible presencia de Huargos en Lothlórien.\
\
Debes hablar con Elladan para ver qué planean hacer los gemelos a continuación.","Habla con Elladan.","04. Las nuevas aventuras de Elladan y Elrohir, capítulo 4"}},
[10]={nameES="05. Las nuevas aventuras de Bilbo Bolsón, capítulo 5",objectivesES={"Completa 'Miniaventura: Las nuevas aventuras de Bilbo Bolsón, capítulo 5'","Celeblír se encuentra al oeste de la Última Morada, cerca del pregonero.","05. Las nuevas aventuras de Bilbo Bolsón, capítulo 5","Tu misión es encontrar a Bilbo Bolsón. ¡Habla con Celeblír para continuar la búsqueda!","No faltan las aventuras para un hobbit curioso y viajero. ¿En qué andará metido ahora Bilbo Bolsón?","Habla con Celeblír"}},
[11]={nameES="05. Las nuevas aventuras de Elladan y Elrohir, capítulo 5",objectivesES={"Habla con Elrond","05. Las nuevas aventuras de Elladan y Elrohir, capítulo 5","Completa 'Miniaventura: Las nuevas aventuras de Elladan y Elrohir, capítulo 5'","Armado con el conocimiento de que los Huargos ahora amenazan Lórien, tu grupo se pone en marcha para poner fin a sus maquinaciones.","Con la ayuda de los Galadhrim y nuevos suministros, tu regreso a Rivendel ha sido tranquilo.\
\
El Señor Elrond desea hablar contigo.","Los exploradores Galadhrim han avistado Huargos alrededor de la frontera norte de Lórien.\
\
Deberías hablar con Elladan fuera de Caras Galadhon en Lothlórien para comenzar a dirigirte al norte."}},
[12]={nameES="06. Las nuevas aventuras de Bilbo Bolsón, capítulo 6",objectivesES={"Completa 'Miniaventura: Las nuevas aventuras de Bilbo Bolsón, capítulo 6'","Celeblír se encuentra al oeste de la Última Morada, cerca del pregonero.","06. Las nuevas aventuras de Bilbo Bolsón, capítulo 6","Habla con Celeblír","Tu misión es liberar a Bilbo Bolsón de los trasgos. ¡Habla con Celeblír para comenzar!"}},
[13]={nameES="07. Las nuevas aventuras de Bilbo Bolsón, capítulo 7",objectivesES={"07. Las nuevas aventuras de Bilbo Bolsón, capítulo 7","Celeblír se encuentra al oeste de la Última Morada, cerca del pregonero.","Completa 'Miniaventura: Las nuevas aventuras de Bilbo Bolsón, capítulo 7'","Habla con Celeblír","Tu misión es liberar a Bilbo Bolsón de los trasgos. ¡Habla con Celeblír para comenzar!"}},
[14]={nameES="08. Las nuevas aventuras de Bilbo Bolsón, capítulo 8",objectivesES={"Completa 'Miniaventura: Las nuevas aventuras de Bilbo Bolsón, capítulo 8'","Celeblír se encuentra al oeste de la Última Morada, cerca del pregonero.","Habla con Celeblír","Tu misión es liberar a Bilbo Bolsón de los trasgos. ¡Habla con Celeblír para comenzar!","08. Las nuevas aventuras de Bilbo Bolsón, capítulo 8"}},
[15]={nameES="09. Las nuevas aventuras de Bilbo Bolsón, capítulo 9",objectivesES={"Celeblír se encuentra al oeste de la Última Morada, cerca del pregonero.","Completa 'Miniaventura: Las nuevas aventuras de Bilbo Bolsón, capítulo 9'","Tu misión es liberar a Bilbo Bolsón de los trasgos. ¡Habla con Celeblír para comenzar!","09. Las nuevas aventuras de Bilbo Bolsón, capítulo 9","Habla con Celeblír"}},
[16]={nameES="1. Interlude: Many Worries",objectivesES={"Your mind wanders as you contemplate the fate of Halbarad and the Grey Company in Dunland.","Your eye is drawn west across the map, beyond the borders of Rohan, and comes to rest upon the rocky hills of Dunland. You wonder what has become of Halbarad and the Grey Company since you left them.","As you study the contours of Gléowine's map, your mind is drawn to wonder what has befallen the Grey Company in the time since you left them.","Study Gléowine's map and complete 'Interlude: Many Worries'","1. Interlude: Many Worries","Your mind travels far as you study the map, musing on the fate of Halbarad and the Grey Company."}},
[17]={nameES="10. Las nuevas aventuras de Bilbo Bolsón, capítulo 10",objectivesES={"Celeblír se encuentra al oeste de la Última Morada, cerca del pregonero.","Tu misión es liberar a Bilbo Bolsón de los trasgos. ¡Habla con Celeblír para comenzar!","Completa 'Miniaventura: Las nuevas aventuras de Bilbo Bolsón, capítulo 10'","Habla con Bilbo en el Salón del Fuego","Bilbo Bolsón ha regresado al Salón del Fuego, en la Última Morada.","Habla con Celeblír","10. Las nuevas aventuras de Bilbo Bolsón, capítulo 10"}},
[18]={nameES="2. Interlude: One More Journey",objectivesES={"2. Interlude: One More Journey","Study Gléowine's map and complete 'Interlude: One More Journey'","Your mind wanders as you contemplate the fate of Saeradan and the Grey Company in Dunland.","As you study the contours of Gléowine's map, your mind is drawn to wonder what has befallen the Grey Company in the time since you left them.","Your mind travels far as you study the map, musing on the fate of Saeradan and the Grey Company.","Your eye is drawn west across the map, beyond the borders of Rohan, and comes to rest upon the rocky hills of Dunland. You wonder what has become of Saeradan and the Grey Company since you left them."}},
[19]={nameES="3. Interlude: The Ox and the Dragon",objectivesES={"Your eye is drawn west across the map, beyond the borders of Rohan, and comes to rest upon the rocky hills of Dunland. You wonder what has become of Radanir and the Grey Company since you left them.","As you study the contours of Gléowine's map, your mind is drawn to wonder what has befallen the Grey Company in the time since you left them.","Your mind wanders as you contemplate the fate of Radanir and the Grey Company in Dunland.","3. Interlude: The Ox and the Dragon","Study Gléowine's map and complete 'Interlude: The Ox and the Dragon'","Your mind travels far as you study the map, musing on the fate of Radanir and the Grey Company."}},
[20]={nameES="4. Interlude: Halros's Watch",objectivesES={"As you study the contours of Gléowine's map, your mind is drawn to wonder what has befallen the Grey Company in the time since you left them.","Study Gléowine's map and complete 'Interlude: Halros's Watch'","Your mind travels far as you study the map, musing on the fate of Halros and the Grey Company.","Your mind wanders as you contemplate the fate of Halros and the Grey Company in Dunland.","Your eye is drawn west across the map, beyond the borders of Rohan, and comes to rest upon the rocky hills of Dunland. You wonder what has become of Halros and the Grey Company since you left them.","4. Interlude: Halros's Watch"}},
[21]={nameES="4. Interlude: Halros's Watch",objectivesES={"Your eye is drawn west and north across the map, beyond the borders of Rohan, and comes to rest upon the pastoral quiet of the Shire. You wonder what has become of Halros since he elected to remain behind and watch the borders of that land.","Your mind travels far as you study the map, musing on the fate of Halros and the Shire.","Study Gléowine's map and complete 'Interlude: Halros's Watch'","Your mind wanders as you contemplate the fate of Halros and the Shire.","As you study the contours of Gléowine's map, your mind is drawn to wonder what has befallen Halros in the weeks since he elected to remain behind, in the Shire.","4. Interlude: Halros's Watch"}},
[22]={nameES="5. Interlude: Calenglad's Appeal",objectivesES={"Your mind travels far as you study the map, musing on the fate of Calenglad and the Grey Company.","Your eye is drawn west across the map, beyond the borders of Rohan, and comes to rest upon the rocky hills of Dunland. You wonder what has become of Calenglad and the Grey Company since you left them.","Your mind wanders as you contemplate the fate of Calenglad and the Grey Company.","5. Interlude: Calenglad's Appeal","Study Gléowine's map and complete 'Interlude: Calenglad's Appeal'","As you study the contours of Gléowine's map, your mind is drawn to wonder what has befallen the Grey Company since you left them."}},
[23]={nameES="6. Interlude: Pit of the Falcon",objectivesES={"6. Interlude: Pit of the Falcon","Your mind travels far as you study the map, musing on the fate of Golodir and the Grey Company.","Your eye is drawn west across the map, beyond the borders of Rohan, and comes to rest upon the rocky hills of Dunland. You wonder what has become of Golodir and the Grey Company since you left them.","Your mind wanders as you contemplate the fate of Golodir and the Grey Company.","Study Gléowine's map and complete 'Interlude: Pit of the Falcon'","As you study the contours of Gléowine's map, your mind is drawn to wonder what has befallen the Grey Company since you left them."}},
[24]={nameES="7. Interlude: Strength of Will",objectivesES={"7. Interlude: Strength of Will","Your eye is drawn west across the map, beyond the borders of Rohan, and comes to rest upon the cruel circle of Isengard. You wonder what has become of Lothrandir within the prisons of Saruman.","Your mind travels far as you study the map, musing on the fate of Lothrandir, still a captive of Saruman.","As you study the contours of Gléowine's map, your mind is drawn to wonder what has befallen Lothrandir in the prisons of Orthanc.","Your mind wanders as you contemplate the fate of Lothrandir in his captivity.","Study Gléowine's map and complete 'Interlude: Strength of Will'"}},
[25]={nameES="Nº 9, calle Aguamiel",objectivesES={"Angélica Boffin está encantada de verte a ti y a muchos de sus familiares que han venido a Nobotella para darle la bienvenida a su nueva casa.","Habla con Bingo Boffin en la calle Aguamiel","Dinodas, Camelia y Caléndula esperan fuera de la nueva casa de Angélica","Habla con Dinodas Boffin en la calle Aguamiel","Prisca Boffin, su hijo Griffo y su hija Esmeralda han llegado a la calle Aguamiel","Nº 9, calle Aguamiel","Prisca Boffin y muchos de sus hijos se han reunido en la calle Aguamiel para dar la bienvenida a Angélica a su nueva casa.","Angélica sale de su nueva casa","Bingo ha accedido a llevar el regalo de Angélica para que el resto podáis reuniros fuera de su nueva casa.","Dinodas y los otros Boffin han acordado reunirse contigo fuera de la nueva casa de Angélica en Nobtella, en la calle Aguamiel.","Todos los Boffin entran, charlando alegremente... excepto Dinodas","Reúnete con los Boffin fuera de la nueva casa de Angélica en la calle Aguamiel","Habla con Angélica Boffin fuera de su nueva casa","Habla con Prisca Boffin en la calle Aguamiel","Bingo ha llegado con el regalo para Angélica","Dinodas está fuera de la nueva casa de Angélica en la calle Aguamiel, muy satisfecho consigo mismo.","Dinodas está solo fuera del nº 9 de la calle Aguamiel.","Habla con Dinodas fuera del nº 9 de la calle Aguamiel","Bingo Boffin está en la calle Aguamiel con su prima Prisca y algunos de sus hijos."}},
[26]={nameES="A Bad Plan",objectivesES={}},
[27]={nameES="A Badger of Honour",objectivesES={"Talk to Arlach","Talk to Crithon","Crithon is concerned by the increased population of badgers surrounding the river leading to Pelargir.","Crithon has asked you to deliver your report to Arlach.\
\
Arlach can be found in Arnach.","A Badger of Honour","Crithon has asked you to drive away badgers around the river Erui south-west of Imloth Melui.","The badger problem has been addressed. You should report your progress to Crithon.\
\
Crithon is in Imloth Melui."}},
[28]={nameES="Un saco de trucos",objectivesES={"Derrota a Bidroi","Celofa puede encontrarse en el Refugio Sombrío, en los tramos septentrionales de las Fundaciones de Piedra, en Moria.\
\
Ahora que has derrotado a Bidroi, deberías regresar junto a Celofa para que pueda comenzar a enseñarte sus habilidades avanzadas de saqueador.","Bidroi derrotado","Un saco de trucos","Regresa junto a Celofa","El orco Bidroi puede encontrarse en el nivel inferior de la Segunda Sala, donde cayó presa de su desconcierto. La Segunda Sala se encuentra al norte de las Fundaciones de Piedra y al este de Zelem-Melek.\
\
Celofa espera con ansias compartir nuevas habilidades como saqueador avanzado, pero primero te ha encomendado una tarea sencilla: derrotar al orco Bidroi."}},
[29]={nameES="A Band of Ruffians",objectivesES={"A band of half-orcs and ruffians loyal to one called Sharkey has begun to dredge the Gladden Fields with equipment left behind from Saruman's failed search for the Ring.","Completado","You have defeated many half-orcs and ruffians at Sharkey's Slough.","Half-orcs and ruffians can be found at Sharkey's Slough in the Gladden Fields.\
\
Half-orcs and ruffians loyal to Sharkey have begun to use dredging machines Saruman long ago abandoned on the Gladden Fields to begin a new search.","A Band of Ruffians","After discovering the terrible destruction done to the Gladden Fields, Radagast is determined to halt the work of the band of ruffians loyal to Sharkey. You should defeat as many half-orcs and ruffians as you can at Sharkey's Slough.","You have defeated many of the half-orcs and ruffians at Sharkey's Slough. While it seems Sharkey has no shortage of followers, you have done much to disrupt his efforts in the Gladden Fields."}},
[30]={nameES="A Band of Travellers",objectivesES={"The Wheel and Cask can be found to the north-east in the First Circle of Minas Tirith.\
\
Polla has asked you to seek out her band's stagehand, Góthrik, who hasn't been seen since they arrived in Minas Tirith.","Habla con Robbo Moliespalda","Polla Stoutley can be found just outside the Stone Theatre in Minas Tirith.\
\
You have introduced yourself to the Cloudyheads and should now return to Polla.","Search for Góthrik in the Wheel and Cask tavern","You see a dwarf tucked away in the shadows of the tavern...","A Band of Travellers","Polla Stoutley can be found just outside the Stone Theatre in Minas Tirith.\
\
You have shooed away the workers in the Stone Theatre and should now return to Polla.","Talk to Polla Stoutley","Talk to Hollur","The other members of the Cloudyheads can be found near the entrance of the Stone Theatre.\
\
Polla has asked you to introduce yourself to the band before taking over Góthrik's duties.","Peculiar musicians known collectively as 'The Cloudyheads' have arrived in Minas Tirith and hope to put on an extravagant show in the City's beloved theatres.","Talk to Daenar","Góthrik can be found inside the Wheel and Cask tavern in the First Circle of Minas Tirith.\
\
You have found Góthrik in the Wheel and Cask, and should now ask him to return to aid the Cloudyheads in setting up their new performance.","Talk to Fróki","Polla Stoutley can be found just outside the Stone Theatre in Minas Tirith.\
\
Góthrik has decided to quit working with the Cloudyheads and has asked you to inform Polla of his resignation.","Talk to Góthrik","The Stone Theatre can be found in the northern section of the First Circle.\
\
Polla Stoutley has asked you to shoo away workers from the stage in the Stone Theatre so that her band can practice without distraction.","Talk to Gord Dunley","Daenar watches as you approach, but gives no reply as you introduce yourself. She merely smiles, and returns to walking about the garden."}},
[31]={nameES="A Banner Day",objectivesES={"The Elf Iavassúl and his companions are tasked with preventing the Orcs of Taur Morvith from closing in behind the main force of the Malledhrim.","Iavassúl is at Iavassúl's Watch, above Krul Lugu.\
\
You should return to Iavassúl and inform him that the Orkish banners have been destroyed.","Talk to Iavassúl at Iavassúl's Watch","A Banner Day","Orkish war-banners can be found in Krul Lugu below Iavassúl's Watch.\
\
Iavassúl has asked you to destroy several of the Orcs' war-banners to demoralize the Enemy."}},
[32]={nameES="A Barb Worth More",objectivesES={"Hûrlub the Bellower seems like a gentle creature. He has asked you to defeat spiders in Maj Khibi.","Talk to Hûrlub the Bellower","The spiders should be less likely to bother Hûrlub now. You should speak to Hûrlub in Phadâl Bimai.\
\
Phadâl Bimai can be found at the northern coast of Jeb Khâtel.","Hûrlub the Bellower does not seem to be hostile at all. He is agitated by the barbs of what seems to be spiders.","A Barb Worth More"}},
[33]={nameES="A Barricade In the Woods",objectivesES={}},
[34]={nameES="A Barricade of Light",objectivesES={"Gíshgi is uncomfortable with the nearby wights. She has a theory that they may fear flames enough that placing lit torches at the entrances to the crypts would keep the wights within, and has asked you to try it. There are crypt entrances at Gadim-ûn, Naxar Dâl, and the Crypts of Khâb Daku in north-eastern An Shêru.","You have placed lit torches at the entrances of the crypts in north-eastern An Shêru in an effort to ward off the wights and keep them inside, where they belong. You should return to Gíshgi in Gadim-ûn and tell her of your success.","Talk to Gíshgi in Gadim-ûn","Evil spirits possess the bodies of the Dead throughout the barrens of north-east An Shêru, causing them to rise and walk again. The Jatsakóri have been using their presence as an effective shield to hide from their Ordâkhai former masters.","A Barricade of Light"}},
[35]={nameES="A Bay of Barrels",objectivesES={}},
[36]={nameES="A Beacon of Hope",objectivesES={}},
[37]={nameES="A Beautiful Weapon",objectivesES={"A Beautiful Weapon","Elrond is in the Last Homely House in Rivendell, far from the Great River.\
\
You should bring the broken weapon to Elrond and see if his smiths can reforge it.","This weapon clearly was crafted during the Second Age, but it has been broken and ruined. Nevertheless, it still shines with great beauty.\
\
Perhaps in the forges of Elrond Halfelven, it might be reforged.","Bring the broken weapon to Elrond in Rivendell","You found a weapon of the Second Age, broken and ruined, but beautiful still. Perhaps it might be reforged...."}},
[38]={nameES="A Beloved Friend",objectivesES={"Water cascades over Lapis and she shakes and snorts happily!","A Beloved Friend","A bucket of water can be found along the Greylin near Khadâsh-gâra.\
\
Nagli Want-kin has asked you to aid him in bathing his beloved aurochs, Lapis. You should fetch a bucket of water as he asked and use it to bathe Lapis.","Nagli Want-kin can be found at Khadâsh-gâra in Elderslade.\
\
You have bathed Lapis and she seems to be very happy about it. You should talk to Nagli.","Talk to Nagli Want-kin","Pick up the bucket of water by the Greylin","Nagli Want-kin has many duties at Khadâsh-gâra, not the least of which is caring for his beloved aurochs, Lapis."}},
[39]={nameES="Un veneno beneficioso",objectivesES={"Un veneno beneficioso","Skûmfil se encuentra al sureste del Refugio Sombrío.\
\
Lar quiere acabar con los gredbyg que habitan en las profundidades de Skûmfil. Los insectos intentan reproducirse en los cadáveres abandonados por los orcos en Skûmfil y, si no se los detiene, podrían multiplicarse demasiado rápido para controlarlos. Lar también se pregunta si podrían ser el origen de la plaga que afecta a los orcos.","Skûmfil no es más que un vertedero, un lugar donde se arrojan a los orcos muertos de Moria cuando empiezan a apestar. Es allí donde dos enemigos se han reunido, cada uno con la intención de usar los cadáveres para sus propios fines. Los kergrim y otros carroñeros los utilizan como fuente de alimento, y los insectos, como lugar para poner sus huevos y engendrar futuras generaciones.","Lar se encuentra en el Refugio Sombrío, al noroeste de Skûmfil.\
\
Has luchado contra numerosos y variados gredbyg en Skûmfil y ahora debes regresar al Refugio Sombrío para informar a Lar de tu éxito.","Habla con Lar en el Refugio Sombrío"}},
[40]={nameES="A Beorninghús Tradition",objectivesES={"Habla con Grimbeorn","Grimbeorn can be found at the Beorninghús in the Beorning-lands.\
\
You should talk to Grimbeorn.","Grimbeorn invites many family and guests to a feast.","A Beorninghús Tradition"}},
[41]={nameES="A Better Future",objectivesES={"Gadda and Tatwine have set up their new free settlement on the farmstead where you planted seeds not long ago.","Tatwine is tending the fields at the abandoned farm.\
\
You should return to Tatwine with the goods you gathered.","Tatwine, happy with his new position as a free man maintaining the farming work you started, has invited you to join him in his maintenance of the farm.\
\
You should help Tatwine with the farm chores.","Return to Tatwine","A Better Future"}},
[42]={nameES="Un gigante de mejor tipo",objectivesES={"El gigante Arifael no parecía saber qué podría llevar a un gigante a bajar a Tâl Bruinen, aunque sí parecía preocupado.","Arifael vive en la ladera de Amon Nendir, al este del Páramo Alto, en el borde oriental del Bosque de los Trolls.\
\
Has ayudado a ahuyentar a los parientes lejanos de Arifael de las Montañas Nubladas. Deberías hablar con él.","Arifael vive en la ladera de Amon Nendir, al sur del Páramo Alto, en el borde oriental del Bosque de los Trolls.\
\
Arifael te ha pedido ayuda contra sus parientes lejanos de las montañas.","Has salvado a Arifael","Un gigante de mejor tipo","Habla con Arifael","DNT -- will not be seen"}},
[43]={nameES="A Bevy of Baubles",objectivesES={}},
[44]={nameES="Un pájaro en la mano",objectivesES={"Un número inusual de hendrevail, halcones del norte, ha comenzado a reunirse cerca de Othrikar, y Hlája Cantosaga teme que los Duramano los estén usando para espiar la mina.","Un pájaro en la mano","Hlája Cantosaga está en Othrikar.\
\
Hlája Cantosaga te envió a eliminar los hendrevail que se reúnen en las colinas de Othrikar. Debes regresar con él para informarle de tu éxito.","Hay halcones del norte por todas las colinas alrededor de Othrikar.\
\
Hlája Cantosaga te ha pedido que ayudes a los Enanos de Othrikar matando tantos hendrevail como puedas.","Regresa con Hlája Cantosaga"}},
[45]={nameES="A Bit of Breathing Room",objectivesES={}},
[46]={nameES="Un poco de Marrón",objectivesES={"La posada el Pájaro y el Bebé está en Cavada Grande. Harigario Fondolodoso está en Avenal.\
\
Harigario Fondolodoso te contó el horror que sintió al darse cuenta de que nunca había probado una \\qCerveza marrón de Bosqueoscuro\\q de el Pájaro y el Bebé. Como mintió y les dijo a otros que sí, te ha pedido, con la más estricta confidencialidad, que le traigas una jarra de esa cerveza para que pueda decir con toda sinceridad que ha probado un sorbo de cada cerveza, vino y licor que se pueda encontrar al oeste de las Montañas Nubladas.","Recogida una taza de Cerveza marrón de Bosqueoscuro","Recoge Cerveza marrón de Bosqueoscuro en el Pájaro y el Bebé","Has recogido Cerveza marrón de Bosqueoscuro","Recoge una jarra de Cerveza marrón de Bosqueoscuro","Un poco de Marrón","Se te ha encargado completar una entrega a un miembro de la Liga de las Posadas que se ha quedado varado lejos del festival esta temporada.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu bitácora de misiones cuando termine el festival actual. </rgb>","Lleva la Cerveza marrón de Bosqueoscuro a Harigario Fondolodoso","La Cerveza marrón de Bosqueoscuro se puede comprar en la posada el Pájaro y el Bebé, en Cavada Grande.\
\
Deberías comprar algo de Cerveza marrón de Bosqueoscuro para entregárselo a Harigario Fondolodoso, que espera en Avenal."}},
[47]={nameES="Un poco de brillo",objectivesES={"Las esencias se pueden conseguir de los limrafn en Barandalf, al norte de Dwaling.\
\
Perla Buenavista te ha pedido que consigas esencias de los limrafn de las dunas.","Perla Buenavista está en la casa de Hob Cimacolina, justo en el exterior de Dwaling.\
\
Perla Buenavista está deseando ver las esencias de limrafn que has conseguido para ella.","Un poco de brillo","Los hobbits no saben por qué o cómo la esencia de los limrafn retiene su brillo, e incluso tienen menos idea de cómo puede ser aplicado al vidrio. Todo lo que saben es que lo hace, y que puede hacerse.","Lleva las esencias a Perla Buenavista en Dwaling"}},
[48]={nameES="Un Toque de Blanco",objectivesES={"Lleva la falsa Cerveza Negra de Bosqueoscuro a Harigar Fondolodoso, en Avenal","Un Toque de Blanco","La Mata de Hiedra se encuentra en Hobbiton, en la Comarca.\
\
Deberías hablar con el tabernero de La Mata de Hiedra y recoger algo de Blanca Rama. Se usará como señuelo de la Cerveza Negra de Bosqueoscuro.","Has recogido la falsa Cerveza Negra de Bosqueoscuro","Harigar Fondolodoso se encuentra en Avenal, la aldea más septentrional de la Comarca.\
\
Deberías llevarle la falsa Cerveza Negra de Bosqueoscuro, que en realidad es Blanca Rama.","Recoge la falsa Cerveza Negra de Bosqueoscuro en La Mata de Hiedra, en Hobbiton"}},
[49]={nameES="A Bite to Eat",objectivesES={"Akûshu is concerned about the horses' distress while the caravan is stranded.","You have collected crunchy vegetables for the horses at the stranded caravan to snack upon. You should give one to each horse.","Talk to Akûshu","You have given each horse at the stranded caravan a crunchy vegetable to snack upon. You should talk to Akûshu.","A Bite to Eat","Akûshu has asked you to find crunchy vegetables for the horses to snack on to relieve their distress. Crunchy vegetables can be found along the river-bank just south of Eshadûr."}},
[50]={nameES="Un Enemigo Amargo",objectivesES={"Uno de los enanos de Líkmund ha descubierto una gran banda de trasgos en la Sala de la Escalera Alta del Camino de Durin.","La Sala de la Escalera Alta se encuentra al norte de la Cámara de la Encrucijada.\
\
Rink te ha pedido que derrotes a cualquier trasgo que habite en la Sala de la Escalera Alta.","Un Enemigo Amargo","Rink está en la Sala de la Encrucijada, al sur de la Sala de la Escalera Alta.\
\
Has logrado superar a varios de los trasgos en combate, y Rink espera noticias de tu hazaña.","Habla con Rink en la Cámara de la Encrucijada"}},
[51]={nameES="A Bitter Thaw",objectivesES={"Ice shards can be found blocking the door to the barn near Saxburg.\
\
You should clear away the shards of ice.","Cleared shards from the stable","Ice shards can be found in front of the stable near Portred.\
\
You should clear the shards to free Portred's horse.","Removed the shards of ice from the barn door","Remove ice shards from in front of the barn door","Clear the ice shards from Oswi's home","Cyneberg, stricken by grief from the loss of her father and Thrymm, has asked you to leave her alone.\
\
You should help the survivors in Scylfig break the strange ice left in the wake of the attack.","Cyneberg is in Scylfig.\
\
You have aided the villagers, and should now see if Cyneberg is recovered enough to speak with you.","Try to speak with Cyneberg again","With the attack on Scylfig over and many, many great losses counted, the survivors must begin to break the ice and recover from their grief.","Speak with Oswi in Scylfig","A Bitter Thaw","Speak with Saxburg","Cleared ice shards from Oswi's home","Oswi is baffled by the great ice-spikes, and exhausted from trying to chip away at them","Portred is too shaken by the terrifying events of the battle to free his horse","Ice shards can be found in front of the door to Oswi's home.\
\
You should clear the shards from Oswi's home.","Speak with Portred","Clear ice shards from the stable"}},
[52]={nameES="A Black Wind from the East",objectivesES={"Talk to Dagbert at Etheburg in the Brown Lands","Khundolar Easterlings can be found throughout the Brown Lands, but especially at their encampment, Lashkarg, to the south of Etheburg in the Brown Lands.\
\
Dagbert has asked you to defeat a few Khundolar Easterlings to prove to Céola that they can and must be dealt with immediately.","A Black Wind from the East","Dagbert is at Etheburg in the Brown Lands, north of Lashkarg.\
\
You should return to Dagbert with news of your success.","Dagbert wants to deal directly with the Khundolar and drive them forth from the Brown Lands."}},
[53]={nameES="A Black Wind from the East",objectivesES={"Khundolar Easterlings can be found throughout the Brown Lands, but especially at their encampment, Lashkarg, to the south of Etheburg in the Brown Lands.\
\
Céola has asked you to defeat a few Khundolar Easterlings to get an estimate of their strength.","A Black Wind from the East","Céola is at Etheburg in the Brown Lands, north of Lashkarg.\
\
You should return to Céola with news of your success.","After learning of Dagbert's treasonous association with the brigands led by the rogue Rohirrim captain Hafoc and the Easterlings, Céola feels forced into taking a more proactive approach to dealing with the Khundolar in the Brown Lands.","Talk to Céola at Etheburg in the Brown Lands"}},
[54]={nameES="A Blackroot Delicacy",objectivesES={"The most delicious mushrooms in the Blackroot Vale can be found in the caverns of Lhingroth, but so can the spiders of Tarlang's Peaks.","Deliver the silkencaps to Sidharan in Sardol","Sidharan can be found in Sardol.\
\
You have collected many silkencaps from the caverns of Lhingroth. You should deliver them to Sidharan in Sardol.","A Blackroot Delicacy","Silkencaps, a pale mushroom native to the Blackroot Vale, can be found in the caverns of Lhingroth in the hills to the south-east of Sardol.\
\
Sidharan has asked you to collect silkencaps from the caverns of Lhingroth, but he has warned you that spiders dwell in Lhingroth. You should collect the silkencaps and deliver them to Sidharan in Sardol."}},
[55]={nameES="Una Espada por una Vida",objectivesES={"Kenton Thistleway se encuentra en la sección más al sur de la Obra de los Espinar, al norte por el Camino Verde.\
\
Blake, el capitán de los bandidos, tomó prisionera a Maribell, la hija de Kenton Thistleway. Has rescatado a Maribell, quien ha regresado a Bree. Deberías regresar con Kenton para informarle de tu éxito.","Lofar se encuentra en la cabaña de piedra al norte del cruce de caminos de Bree.\
\
Kenton Thistleway te dijo que Blake, el capitán de los bandidos, matará a su hija a menos que reciba una nueva espada. Kenton te ha pedido que recuperes la espada de Lofar.","Habla con Lofar Bandadehierro","El campamento de Blake está en los campos de Bree, al noroeste de Bree, directamente al oeste del Puesto de Grimbriar.\
\
Cuando hablaste con Lofar, te dijo que la espada aún no estaba lista. Te instó a ir al campamento de Blake e intentar convencer al capitán de los bandidos de que no haga daño a la hija de Kenton. La espada estará lista pronto. También sugirió que lleves contigo a algunos guerreros experimentados, por si hay problemas.","Has rescatado a Maribell.","Mientras reunías los materiales que Kenton necesitaba para terminar su trabajo para Lofar Bandadehierro, el bandido Blake tomó prisionera a la hija de Kenton.","Una Espada por una Vida","Encuentra a Maribell Thistleway","Habla con Kenton Thistleway en la Obra de los Espinar"}},
[56]={nameES="A Blade of Flame and Fury, Part 1",objectivesES={"Speak with Mizâdi outside the tower of Kûr Anzar","A Blade of Flame and Fury, Part 1","Make your way to Mizâdi near the tower of Kûr Anzar","Mizâdi is ready to assault Kûr Anzar with her Hamâti warriors. Aid her in the battle for Kûr Anzar by defeating Barkhûshim and planting banners for Renewed Hamât in Kûr Anzar.","Speak with Mizâdi outside Kûr Anzar to begin the assault","Speak with Mizâdi outside the tower of Kûr Anzar.","Make your way through Kûr Anzar, tearing down Barkhûshim banners and replacing them with banners for Renewed Hamât. Defeat All-seeing cultists throughout Kûr Anzar.","Mizâdi waves you over to join her","Make your way to Mizâdi near the tower of Kûr Anzar.","Meet with Mizâdi outside the gates of Kûr Anzar to begin the assault."}},
[57]={nameES="A Blade of Flame and Fury, Part 2",objectivesES={"Speak with Mizâdi inside the tower in Kûr Anzar","A Blade of Flame and Fury, Part 2","Okhíso has fled inside the tower of Kûr Anzar. Mizâdi seeks your help in pursuing him and bringing his tyrannical reign to an end.","Speak with Mizâdi inside the tower in Kûr Anzar.","Speak with Mizâdi outside the tower in Kûr Anzar when you are ready.","Speak with Mizâdi outside the tower in Kûr Anzar when you are ready to go"}},
[58]={nameES="A Blade of Flame and Fury, Part 3",objectivesES={"Speak with Mizâdi near the tower of Kûr Anzar.","A Blade of Flame and Fury, Part 3","Speak with Mizâdi inside the tower in order to help Kûr Anzar from going up in flame!","Speak with Mizâdi about her plan to save Kûr Anzar","Speak with Mizâdi near the tower of Kûr Anzar","Kûr Anzar is aflame! Stamp out the straw fires and save as many residents as you can!"}},
[59]={nameES="Una hoja de renombre",objectivesES={"Una hoja de renombre","El nombre de un campeón lo precede, llevado por el viento por aquellos para quienes lucha. Aterrorizan a sus enemigos y levantan los corazones de los buenos en todas partes.","Ultan Azote de enemigos está en la puerta de Combe, al este de la ciudad de Bree.\
\
Te han dicho que hables con Ultan Azote de enemigos, un poderoso campeón que viaja por las Tierras de Bree, pues el enano podría ayudarte a ser más fuerte.","Ultan Azote de enemigos está en la puerta de Combe, al este de la ciudad de Bree.\
\
Has derrotado a los tres oponentes que Ultan Azote de enemigos te desafió a vencer y ahora deberías regresar victorioso con el enano.","Notas recopiladas de Ultan Azote de enemigos"}},
[60]={nameES="A Blade with Two Edges",objectivesES={"A Blade with Two Edges","Surodith, an Adúrhid warrior, has asked for your help culling the population of diseased boars and servals near Vartúlin, in Shakhdag and Tir Katar.","Speak with Surodith in Vartúlin","Surodith asks you to cull afflicted boars and servals plagued by the Lâg Dávrit in Shakhdag and Tir Katar. Shakhdag is north-west of Vartúlin. Tir Katar is directly north of Vartúlin.","Speak with Surodith in Vartúlin and report your success."}},
[61]={nameES="A Blaze for the South",objectivesES={"Angmar claims the central keep of the Ettenmoors, but the main army has yet to receive the news. The War-tyrant has ordered his soldiers to collect the materials needed to set a beacon fire.","Deliver the materials to Soldier Kaasak at Tol Ascarnen","A Blaze for the South","Head south from Tol Ascarnen into Hithlad to seek out the wood needed to build the signal fires to the south.\
\
Though your forces took Tol Ascarnen, the keep is woefully undefended, and Kaasak has ordered you to build a pyre to call in reinforcements from the south. You should make your way into the Ettenmoors and search for kindling, timber, and larger logs to build a beacon fire large enough to call in reinforcements to Tol Ascarnen."}},
[62]={nameES="A Blaze for the West",objectivesES={"Angmar claims the central keep of the Ettenmoors, but the main army has yet to receive the news. The War-tyrant has ordered his soldiers to collect the materials needed to set a large beacon fire.","Head south of Tol Ascarnen into Hithlad and the Grimwood forest to collect the wood needed to build the blaze.\
\
Though your forces took Tol Ascarnen, the keep is woefully undefended, and Kaasak has ordered you to build a pyre to call in reinforcements from the west. You should make your way into the Ettenmoors and search for kindling, timber, and larger logs to build a beacon fire large enough to call in reinforcements to Tol Ascarnen.","A Blaze for the West","Deliver the materials to Soldier Kaasak at Tol Ascarnen"}},
[63]={nameES="A Blaze in the Trees",objectivesES={"Make your way to the copse of trees in the woods on the western side of Tol Ascarnen. Make your presence know there.\
\
Paashum asked you to make your way into the small section of woods on the western shore of Hoardale near Tol Ascarnen. He hopes to send a force into the keep after setting the woods ablaze. You will need to be obvious enough to attract the enemy's attention.","Defeat is not an option!","You worthless sack! You failed!","A Blaze in the Trees","Stand in the open among the trees near Tol Ascarnen's western wall","The Orc-archer has seen you","Paashum is trying to make his superiors in Angmar's army notice him. To that end he has asked you to undertake a mission involving great risk but a potential for great success."}},
[64]={nameES="A Bold Rescue",objectivesES={"Odda has succumbed to the effects of the Mor-hai poison","Talk to the first captive and release him","You recognize this soldier as your ally Odda. He does not appear to be breathing, and despite your best efforts, you cannot revive him. Odda has already succumbed to the effects of the poison.","The entrance to the Orc-caves may be found along the western rock wall in the Wailing Hills, behind the Orc-camp that held Frithstan.\
\
The Rohirrim-captives are being held within caves by the Mor-hai Orcs.","Frithstan saw the other warriors being taken into this cave","Talk to the second captive and release him","Frithstan's soldiers have been captured and taken into a mountain-cave by the Mor-hai Orcs.","A Bold Rescue","The entrance to the Orc-caves may be found along the western rock wall in the Wailing Hills, behind the Orc-camp that held Frithstan.\
\
Frithstan believes that his men have been taken alive and are being held within the nearby Orc-caves.","Rescue the third captive from his cell","Frithstan can be found at his camp to along the road north of the Cuthstan.\
\
He awaits your return from the Orc-caves.","You have rescued the first soldier from captivity","You have rescued the second warrior from captivity","Return to Frithstan's camp and talk to Frithstan","Enter into the Orc-cave"}},
[65]={nameES="Un Libro Desgarrado",objectivesES={"Has encontrado un gran número de páginas dispersas en el Campamento de Asalto Tarkrîp.\
\
Sin duda estarán mejor en manos de la gente de Puente de Caballetes que en las garras de los astutos orcos.","Páginas de mapas antiguos pueden encontrarse en los orcos del Campamento de Asalto Tarkrîp.\
\
Debes recoger estas páginas, pues parecen tener cierta importancia histórica.","Completado","Recoge páginas de mapas antiguos de orcos Tarkrîp","Has descubierto una página de mapa antigua, aparentemente de valor histórico, en un orco abatido en el Campamento de Asalto Tarkrîp.\
\
Debes derrotar orcos Tarkrîp en el campamento de asalto y recoger cualquier otra página que encuentres.","Has descubierto una página de mapa antigua, aparentemente de valor histórico, en un orco abatido en el Campamento de Asalto Tarkrîp.","Un Libro Desgarrado"}},
[66]={nameES="Un Frontero de gran mérito",objectivesES={"Un Frontero de gran mérito","El Oficial adjunto Bodo Bonce se encuentra cerca del Agujero Municipal de Cavada Grande.\
\
Se te ha aconsejado que vayas a contarle tus muchas hazañas en beneficio de los habitantes de la Comarca."}},
[67]={nameES="Un Frontero de gran mérito",objectivesES={"Un Frontero de gran mérito","El Oficial adjunto Bodo Bonce se encuentra cerca del Agujero Municipal de Cavada Grande.\
\
Se te ha aconsejado que vayas a contarle tus muchas hazañas en beneficio de los habitantes de la Comarca."}},
[68]={nameES="Una cosecha abundante (Avanzado)",objectivesES={"Rosa se puede encontrar cerca del Árbol de la Fiesta y en Wistmead.\
\
Rosa Corneta quiere agradecerte por tu continua participación en el Festival de la Cosecha.","La cosecha es una temporada de recolección, y aquellos que recolectan más a menudo encuentran que son recompensados por proporcionar la mayor alegría a sus vecinos.","Hay muchas recompensas que esperan a los participantes del Festival de la Cosecha, y para aquellos que cosechen durante muchos días, ¡las recompensas serán aún mayores!","Una cosecha abundante (Avanzado)","Hay muchas cosas que hacer durante el Festival de la Cosecha. ¡Ven a unirte a todos en el Árbol de la Fiesta, en Wistmead, y en los vecindarios de viviendas, y participa en muchas actividades del Festival de la Cosecha durante cuatro días!","Habla con Rosa Corneta","Completa 'Una cosecha espiritual' cuatro veces más"}},
[69]={nameES="Una cosecha abundante (Final)",objectivesES={"Rosa se puede encontrar cerca del Árbol de la Fiesta y en Wistmead.\
\
Rosa Corneta quiere agradecerte por tu continua participación en el Festival de la Cosecha.","La cosecha es una temporada de recolección, y aquellos que recolectan más a menudo encuentran que son recompensados por proporcionar la mayor alegría a sus vecinos.","Una cosecha abundante (Final)","Habla con Rosa Corneta","Completa 'Una cosecha espiritual' cuatro veces más"}},
[70]={nameES="Una cosecha abundante (Intermedia)",objectivesES={"Rosa se puede encontrar cerca del Árbol de la Fiesta y en Wistmead.\
\
Rosa Corneta quiere agradecerte por tu continua participación en el Festival de la Cosecha.","La cosecha es una temporada de recolección, y aquellos que recolectan más a menudo encuentran que son recompensados por proporcionar la mayor alegría a sus vecinos.","Hay muchas recompensas que esperan a los participantes del Festival de la Cosecha, y para aquellos que cosechen durante muchos días, ¡las recompensas serán aún mayores!","Habla con Rosa Corneta","Una cosecha abundante (Intermedia)","Completa 'Una cosecha espiritual' cuatro veces más","Hay algo que hacer cada día durante el Festival de la Cosecha. ¡Ven a unirte a todos en el Árbol de la Fiesta, en Wistmead y en los vecindarios, y participa en muchas actividades del Festival de la Cosecha durante cuatro días!"}},
[71]={nameES="Una cosecha abundante (Introducción)",objectivesES={"La cosecha es una temporada de recolección, y aquellos que recolectan más a menudo encuentran que son recompensados por proporcionar la mayor alegría a sus vecinos.","Rosa se puede encontrar cerca del Árbol de la Fiesta y en Wistmead.\
\
Rosa Corneta quiere agradecerte por tu continua participación en el Festival de las Cosechas.","Completa 'Una cosecha abundante' cuatro veces","Habla con Rosa Corneta","Una cosecha abundante (Introducción)","Hay muchas recompensas que esperan a los participantes del Festival de las Cosechas, y para aquellos que cosechan durante muchos días, ¡las recompensas son aún mayores!","Cada día hay algo que hacer durante el Festival de las Cosechas. Ven y únete a todos en el Árbol de la Fiesta, en Wistmead y en los vecindarios, y participa en muchas actividades del Festival de las Cosechas durante cuatro días."}},
[72]={nameES="A Brazen Chieftain",objectivesES={"The brenin of the Dragon-clan settlement at the western edge of Pren Gwydh is somewhere within his encampment.\
\
You should defeat the head of this small band of cruel brigands, for it is by his orders that these enemies attack the lands and threaten the folk of Galtrev.","Defeat the Dragon-clan chieftain","Talk to Tomos","Tomos is waiting for you on the outskirts of the Dragon-clan settlement in western Pren Gwydh.\
\
You should return to Tomos with word of your success. The Dragon-clan will trouble the folk of Galtrev no more.","A Brazen Chieftain","Leading the Dragon-clan invaders who have settled on the western edge of Pren Gwydh is a bold chieftain with ambitions to conquer the undefended lands around Galtrev.","Defeated the Dragon-clan chieftain"}},
[73]={nameES="A Break in the Chain",objectivesES={"The Uruk, Asgája, can be found somewhere nearby the stockpile south of the road to Middlemead from Entwade in Kingstead.","Find and defeat Asgája","A hale Uruk atop an armoured steed rides forth","Talk to Thane Edric","A Break in the Chain","Thane Edric and his men struggle to repel the Uruk invaders of Kingstead while still maintaining control of the crossing into the Eastemnet.","Defeated Asgája","Thane Edric can be found inside the Mead Hall of Entwade in eastern Kingstead.\
\
You have slain the hardy Uruk, Asgája, and should now report your success to Thane Edric."}},
[74]={nameES="Un Breve Respiro",objectivesES={"Ayuda a Marget","Habla con Eluna","Ayuda a Madog y Teilo Gwyniad","Eluna quiere que ayudes a la gente de Lhan Garan.","Eluna te pidió que ayudaras a la gente de Lhan Garan.\
\
Ayuda a la gente de Lhan Garan.","Un Breve Respiro","Ayuda a Culhuc","Has ayudado a varias personas en el pueblo.\
\
Es hora de regresar con Eluna en Lhan Garan."}},
[75]={nameES="A Broken Snowman?",objectivesES={}},
[76]={nameES="A Broken Wheel",objectivesES={}},
[77]={nameES="Una paz negociada",objectivesES={"Con la migración de orcos y trasgos hacia las Tierras Solitarias occidentales, los Eglain intentaron reavivar sus antiguas relaciones comerciales con un elfo de Rivendel, al este. Sin embargo, se encontraron con grandes bestias torpes en el Camino y no se atrevieron a seguir adelante.","Frideric el Anciano espera noticias tuyas en Ost Guruth, al norte de las Piedras Abatidas.\
\
Después de ayudar a los Earth-kin, Kekkonen decidió enviarte a hablar con Frideric para decirle que desean convertirse en sus aliados.","Una paz negociada"}},
[78]={nameES="A Brood Apart",objectivesES={}},
[79]={nameES="Una multitud de Boffins",objectivesES={"Encuentra a Berilac Boffin","Habla con Prisca Boffin frente a su casa, en Norburgo","El Puente del Brandivino está al este del pueblo de Bolgovado, en la Comarca.\
\
Bingo te ha pedido hacer una breve parada en el Puente del Brandivino para disfrutar de las vistas.","Encuentra a Camelia Boffin","Habla con Bingo en el Puente del Brandivino","Encuentra a Griffo Boffin","La casa de Prisca Boffin está en Norburgo, justo al sur del Portal del Este.\
\
Has encontrado a todos los hijos de Prisca y ahora deberías volver a su casa para contarle que lo has conseguido.","La casa de Prisca Boffin está en Norburgo, justo al sur del Portal del Este.\
\
Bingo quiere visitar a su prima Prisca Boffin, que vive en Norburgo, un pequeño pueblo de los Gamos.","Prisca Boffin te ha dado algo de información sobre sus hijos que pueda ser útil para encontrarlos por Cricava, Norburgo y los Gamos:\
\
'A Angélica le encantan los animales. Siempre está buscando alimentar y dar de beber al ganado, ¡y hasta le gusta limpiar lo que ensucian! Si hay un animal en peligro, allí estará ella, tratando de ayudarlo.\
\
'A Berilac también le gusta ayudar con las tareas del hogar, ¡pero solo si lo llevan cerca de un lugar tranquilo y soleado donde dormir! Probablemente esté durmiendo en un montón de heno en algún lugar.\
\
'Camelia salió de casa con un cubo. Iba a sacar agua del pozo.\
\
'Dinodas ha estado enamorado de la joven Celandine Brandigamo desde algún tiempo. Ella podría saber dónde está.\
\
'Esmeralda adora ir a bailar al Pantano de los Sapos.\
\
'Fosco es raro entre mis hijos ya que le gustan el río y el ferry, ¡y quiere aprender a navegar! Probablemente esté soñando despierto no muy lejos de Balsadera de Gamoburgo.\
\
'Fui a la Feria de los Gamos hoy con Griffo más temprano, pero me harté pronto y volví a casa. Griffo puede que todavía esté allí. Se estaba dando un buen atracón cuando me marché.'","Encuentra a Esmeralda Boffin","Encuentra a Dinodas Boffin","Habla con Bingo en el exterior de la casa de Prisca, en Norburgo","Encuentra a Angélica Boffin","Bingo tiene parientes en el pueblo de Norburgo, justo al otro lado del Puente del Brandivino, y quiere visitarlos ya que pasará por allí durante su viaje.","Encuentra a Fosco Boffin","Una multitud de Boffins"}},
[80]={nameES="A Brother Lost",objectivesES={"A bow of Ranger make rests on the ground and its wood is warped and swollen...","Talk to Faramir, son of Ondoher","You notice a foot-print, but by its shape and size it seems to have been made by an Uruk-hai...","The Dead Marshes can be found to the west and north of Ondoher's Folly.\
\
Faramir believes his brother might be found somewhere in the Dead Marshes to the west of Ondoher's Folly. You should search for any sign of Artamir, son of Ondoher.","An Orc lies in the shallows of the marshes, but appears to have been dead for some time...","A Brother Lost","The murky water of the Dead Marshes churns violently...","Artamir, son of Ondoher, was lost in a great battle against the Wainriders and his accursed brother, Faramir, has long searched for him within the lands of the Wastes.","Faramir can be found on the plains south of Ondoher's Folly.\
\
You did not discover any sign of Artamir or any spirit that might appear to be him. You should now return to Faramir."}},
[81]={nameES="A Brother's Grief",objectivesES={"A Brother's Grief","Sorrow has overtaken Váko, who cannot bring himself to find his fallen brother's axe.","Talk to Váko","Reclaim the dwarf-axe","Borbák defeated","Defeat Borbák the Shearer","Borbák has been defeated and the dwarf-axe reclaimed.\
\
You should return the axe to Váko in Amdân. He waits for you in the Zhélruka camp.","Váko has asked you to help him recover his brother's axe. Taking the axe may catch the attention of the Orc Borbák.\
\
The axe can be found somewhere in Dursh Hûl."}},
[82]={nameES="Súplica de un Hermano",objectivesES={"Lleva el mensaje de Iivari a Oskari","Las dos facciones de los Hijos de la Tierra —los libres Suuri-lehmä y los Rauta-lehmä, que sirven a Angmar— se preparan para la guerra. Iivari, el Maestro de Guerra de los Suuri-lehmä, y su hermano Oskari se han encontrado en lados opuestos del conflicto.","Iivari está en el campamento de los Suuri-lehmä, al oeste de Fashat Laug.\
\
Oskari rechazó la súplica de su hermano y te dio una runa para que la lleves de vuelta a Iivari.","Lleva la runa de Oskari a Iivari","Súplica de un Hermano","Oskari está en algún lugar entre los campamentos de los Rauta-lehmä en Fashat Laug, en el este de las Quebradas del Norte.\
\
Iivari te ha dado un mensaje para que lo lleves a su hermano Oskari. Iivari espera que sus palabras puedan persuadir a su hermano y a otros Hijos de la Tierra para que regresen con los Suuri-lehmä."}},
[83]={nameES="A Brother's Word",objectivesES={"You agree with Herion that there is a powerful threat in Dor-en-Ernil which could endanger Aragorn and his army if the enemy makes it past Linhir.\
\
'I thank you for understanding as to why I cannot yet return to Linhir. It is dire that we quiet this threat before Linhir becomes the next victim. Barad Rill was just the beginning.\
\
'Aras will be your eyes. His experience will be valuable in blinding our enemy.'","Herion wishes you to speak with Aras of what he has seen","Search out Herion's encampment.","Aras can be found in Herion's encampment.\
\
You should speak with Aras about what he has seen.","Speak with Herion","Search for Herion and his encampment","Herion can be found at his encampment.\
\
You should speak with Herion about how you may be of assistance.","Herion's encampment is located somewhere south of Erchar's encampment, along the River Ernilos.\
\
You should search out Herion's camp.","Speak with Herion on how you might be of assistance","Now that Erchar and his men are properly armed, he sends you to find Herion and aid him so that they may both return to Linhir together.","Speak with Aras","A Brother's Word","Herion can be found in his encampment.\
\
You should speak with Herion.","Herion sees you and beckons you to speak with him"}},
[84]={nameES="A Brother's Work",objectivesES={"Talk to Herion","All the supplies bound for any rebuilding efforts come through Parth Rest.\
\
Herion has asked you to help Aras.","Talk to Aras","Aras has asked you to report your success with Lang Boha to Herion.\
\
Herion can be found at Parth Rest.","Talk to Aras in Parth Rest","Herion has asked you to help Aras with his work in Parth Rest.\
\
Aras can be found in Parth Rest.","Aras in Parth Rest has asked you to defeat wild crabs to clear the way for homes to be rebuilt.","You should report to Aras that the crabs have been cleared.\
\
Aras can be found at Parth Rest.","A Brother's Work"}},
[85]={nameES="A Brutal Reversal",objectivesES={}},
[86]={nameES="A Brutal Reversal",objectivesES={}},
[87]={nameES="A Bubbling in the Blood",objectivesES={"The grodbog blood bubbles, but is no longer boiling","Collect samples of grodbog blood (1/6)","Collect samples of grodbog blood (2/6)","Collect samples of grodbog blood (3/6)","Collect samples of grodbog blood (0/6)","Bring samples of gredbyg blood to Edbrit","A Bubbling in the Blood","Edbrit in the Rushgore was attacked by gredbyg on his way back from the Carcass of the Beast, and he wants to know what has happened to stir up the gredbyg so badly.","The grodbog blood is cool to the touch","Gredbyg can be found throughout the Rushgore.\
\
Edbrit has noticed that the blood of the gredbyg in the Rushgore seems to boil and bubble, and he thinks this is the cause of their newfound aggressiveness. He wants you to collect samples of their blood and bring them to him.","Collect samples of grodbog blood (4/6)","Edbrit is waiting for you to bring him samples of blood from the gredbyg in the Rushgore.\
\
Edbrit has noticed that the blood of the gredbyg in the Rushgore seems to boil and bubble, and he thinks this is the cause of their newfound aggressiveness. He wants you to collect samples of their blood and bring them to him.","The grodbog blood is boiling hot to the touch!","Collect samples of grodbog blood (5/6)"}},
[88]={nameES="Un Cubo Olvidado",objectivesES={"El cubo de Lornel fue dejado en algún lugar junto al río, al oeste de Idhobel.","Un Cubo Olvidado","Encuentra el cubo de agua a lo largo del río al oeste de Idhobel","Lornel está junto a la fogata en Idhobel.","Habla con Lornel en Idhobel","Lornel sonríe mientras le entregas su cubo de agua","Eres la segunda persona que se ofrece a ayudar a Lornel, y espera que demuestres ser más confiable."}},
[89]={nameES="Un Camino Accidentado",objectivesES={"Un Camino Accidentado","Bainthir está en Echad Candelleth, el campamento élfico en Tâl Bruinen.\
\
Has ayudado a despejar el camino que atraviesa Tâl Bruinen de muchos peligros y ahora deberías regresar con Bainthir para recibir tu recompensa.","Habla con Bainthir","Bainthir ha sido encargado de mantener despejado el camino a través de Tâl Bruinen.","El camino pasa al norte de Echad Candelleth y continúa hacia el sur a través de Tâl Bruinen.\
\
El sendero a menudo se ve obstruido por zarzas y piedras traicioneras y amenazado por ciervos de las quebradas. Bainthir te ha ofrecido una recompensa si le ayudas a mantenerlo despejado."}},
[90]={nameES="Encargo de Saqueador",objectivesES={"Un saqueador perfecciona su habilidad robando objetos de poco valor, pero estas incursiones son meros juegos cuando el destino de los Pueblos Libres está en juego.","Habla con Palma Rizopardo y viaja a Naerost.","Encargo de Saqueador","Palma Rizopardo te espera en la Posada Abandonada, en las Tierras Solitarias, justo al lado del Gran Camino del Este.\
\
Recibiste un mensaje misterioso que dice que una tal \\qPalma Rizopardo\\q quiere hablar contigo.","Palma Rizopardo está en la Posada Abandonada, en las Tierras Solitarias.\
\
Palma Rizopardo espera viajar contigo al escondite de los semiorcos que robaron la espada que mencionó.","Palma Rizopardo está en la Posada Abandonada, en las Tierras Solitarias.\
\
Palma Rizopardo quiere hablar contigo sobre tu exitosa infiltración en Naerost.","Lleva Medhrod a Palma Rizopardo."}},
[91]={nameES="A Burning Anger",objectivesES={}},
[92]={nameES="Una primavera ajetreada (final)",objectivesES={"Una primavera ajetreada (final)","Has participado en actividades del Festival de Primavera durante doce días. Deberías hablar con el sargento Tom en el Recinto del Festival de las Tierras de Bree o con Rhudamer Hirtul cerca del maestro de establos en Clegur.","Toda la Tierra Media celebra el regreso de la primavera a su manera.","Habla con Rhudamer Hirtul","Habla con el sargento Tom","Todos los días hay algo que hacer durante el Festival de Primavera. ¡Únete a todo el mundo y participa en las diversas actividades del Festival de Primavera durante cuatro días más!"}},
[93]={nameES="Una primavera ajetreada (intermedio)",objectivesES={"Has participado en actividades del Festival de Primavera durante ocho días. Deberías hablar con el sargento Tom en el Recinto del Festival de las Tierras de Bree o con Rhudamer Hirtul cerca del maestro de establos en Clegur.","Toda la Tierra Media celebra el regreso de la primavera a su manera.","Habla con Rhudamer Hirtul","Habla con el sargento Tom","Una primavera ajetreada (intermedio)","Todos los días hay algo que hacer durante el Festival de Primavera. ¡Únete a todo el mundo y participa en las diversas actividades del Festival de Primavera durante cuatro días más!"}},
[94]={nameES="Una primavera ajetreada (introducción)",objectivesES={"Todos los días hay algo que hacer durante el Festival de Primavera. ¡Únete a todo el mundo y participa en las diversas actividades del Festival de Primavera durante cuatro días!","Toda la Tierra Media celebra el regreso de la primavera a su manera.","Has participado en actividades del Festival de Primavera durante cuatro días. Deberías hablar con el sargento Tom en el Recinto del Festival de las Tierras de Bree o con Rhudamer Hirtul cerca del maestro de establos en Clegur.","Habla con Rhudamer Hirtul","Una primavera ajetreada (introducción)","Habla con el sargento Tom"}},
[95]={nameES="A Busy Day in Sen Chatâk",objectivesES={"Speak with Jûshal in Sen Chatâk","Return to Elder Jangâli in Sen Chatâk and let her know you have spoken with each of the villagers.","Elder Jangâli has requested you speak with Ahâto, Kôrzan, and Jûshal about their daily troubles and assist them where you are able. Each can be found within Sen Chatâk.","There are many things to do in the fishing village of Sen Chatâk. Elder Jangâli has requested you prove your worth by speaking with some of the local peoples and aiding them with their troubles.","Speak with Kôrzan in Sen Chatâk","A Busy Day in Sen Chatâk","Return to Elder Jangâli in Sen Chatâk","Speak with Ahâto in Sen Chatâk"}},
[96]={nameES="A Buzzing in the Reeds",objectivesES={}},
[97]={nameES="A Call To War",objectivesES={"Assist Gloin with 'Into the Fray'","There is much to be done in times of war.\
\
You should assist the dwarves in the War of Three Peaks.","The rally banner of Gabil'akkâ can be found at Zudramdân in Elderslade.\
\
You should rally for war at the banner of Gabil'akkâ.","Talk to Náth at Zudramdân","Assist Rísti Graver with 'The Tamers of Howlers' Notch'","Talk to Agátur the Boastful at Zarkul-sulûn","Stálskeg Ironbeard can be found at Annâk-khurfu.\
\
You should talk to Stálskeg Ironbeard to continue assisting the Gabil'akkâ.","A Call To War","Agátur the Boastful can be found at Zarkul-sulûn.\
\
You should talk to Agátur the Boastful at Zarkul-sulûn.","Assist Náin the Slakeless with 'The Commander of Zudramdân'","Assist Rísti Graver with 'Strength and Fury'","Talk to Náth at Zarkul-sulûn","Zudramdân can be found in Elderslade.\
\
You should talk to Náth at Zudramdân.","Talk to Rúzat  at Zarkul-sulûn","Agátur the Boastful, Náth, and Rúzat have all joined the War of Three Peaks.\
\
You should talk to Agátur the Boastful, Náth, and Rúzat at Zarkul-sulûn.","Talk to Stálskeg Ironbeard","The War of Three Peaks has begun!","Rally for war at the banner of Gabil'akkâ"}},
[98]={nameES="Un llamado a los aliados",objectivesES={"Un llamado a los aliados","Crannog está en su asiento de gobierno al oeste de la isla central en Aughaire, al sur de Fail-á-Khro.\
\
Una y Branan han llegado a la conclusión de que el momento de levantarse contra sus maestros Angmarim está casi llegado, y se debe solicitar la ayuda de Crannog en el esfuerzo.","Una mantiene su vigilancia dentro de Donnvail y quiere que lleves un mensaje fuera de la ciudad.","Branan está junto a la puerta principal de la ciudad de Donnvail, al noreste de Fail-á-Khro.\
\
Una te ha dicho que tus aliados pueden ayudarla en la lucha contra Angmar, pero si tus aliados no están cerca, aún puedes ayudarla llevando un mensaje a Branan."}},
[99]={nameES="Llamado a la Cena",objectivesES={"Llamado a la Cena","Una madre agotada tiene las manos llenas preparando una comida para sus cinco hijos.","Regresa con Rosentyl","Rosentyl Flutch te ha pedido que avises a sus hijos que ya es hora de comer.\
\
Los hijos de Rosentyl pueden encontrarse por Clegur.","Rosentyl está en Clegur.\
\
Deberías decirle a Rosentyl que ya avisaste a todos sus hijos para que vengan a disfrutar la comida que preparó"}},
[100]={nameES="A Camp in Ruin",objectivesES={"After the collapse of Barad-dûr, a torrent of debris has scattered all over eastern Dor Amarth. Those who survived the Mordor-host have built camps among these ruins and rubble. You should destroy their encampments before the Orc numbers begin to organize.","Orcs encampments can be found around Dor Amarth.\
\
You should destroy any Orc tents that you find.","You have destroyed many Orc tents in Dor Amarth on your conquests through Gorgoroth.","A Camp in Ruin","Completado","Destroyed many Orc tents in Dor Amarth.","Scattered all over eastern Dor Amarth, survivors of the Mordor-host have built camps among the ruins of Barad-dûr."}},
[101]={nameES="A Candle Flickers in the Dark",objectivesES={"Defeat the false archivists!","Speak with Khôltekh","Khôltekh has asked you to help him find and catch Sêkhta. He believes Sêkhta is an archivist, a historical scholar working and living in the Tor-gardens.","Speak with Khôltekh about his plan","Move over to the right of the group of archivists.","Speak with Khôltekh about his plan.","A Candle Flickers in the Dark","Move over to the right of the group of archivists","Speak with Khôltekh."}},
[102]={nameES="A Cap-wearing Snowman",objectivesES={}},
[103]={nameES="Enredo en la calle Aguamiel",objectivesES={"Dinodas le ha echado el ojo a una ventana lateral a través de la que podríais entrar en secreto al nº 8 de la calle Aguamiel para robar el regalo de vuelta.","Ve a ver si hay una ventana que podamos usar para entrar sin ser vistos.","Dinodas sonríe con orgullo y alivio después de la exitosa ejecución de la fechoría.","Habla con Dinodas Boffin en la calle Aguamiel y lleva a cabo su arriesgado plan","Busca una ventana lateral al nº 8 de la calle Aguamiel","Colocas la caja sobre la primera, y Dinodas también añade otra más","Si vais a usar esta ventana, necesitaréis bloquear la vista con una pila de cajas","Dinodas Boffin está listo para comenzar su arriesgada fechoría.","Enredo en la calle Aguamiel","Dinodas y tú colocáis una caja, pero necesitaréis algunas más","Habla con Camelia Boffin junto al nº 8 de la calle Aguamiel","Dinodas tiene un plan para arreglar su error.","Recoge una caja de la pila fuera de El Zorro y el Violín, en Nobotella","Camelia carraspea significativamente. ¡Habéis sido descubiertos!","Hay tantos hobbits entrometidos por los alrededores que necesitaréis apilar cajas fuera de la entrada lateral si queréis ocultar de su vista vuestra fechoría.","Hay tantos hobbits entrometidos por los alrededores que ecesitaréis apilar cajas fuera de la entrada lateral si queréis ocultar de su vista vuestra fechoría."}},
[104]={nameES="Un Estandarte de Capitán",objectivesES={"Lleva los estandartes de los Pueblos Libres a Jarl Brazodecobre","Habla con Jarl Brazodecobre y viaja a Ost Galumar","Jarl Brazodecobre está en el asentamiento minero de Othrikar, en las Quebradas del Norte.\
\
Jarl Brazodecobre espera para viajar contigo hacia las ruinas sobre las que quiere que alces tres estandartes de los Pueblos Libres.","Jarl Brazodecobre está en Othrikar, en las Quebradas del Norte.\
\
Jarl Brazodecobre espera hablar contigo sobre tu expedición a Ost Galumar.","Un Estandarte de Capitán"}},
[105]={nameES="A Captive Audience",objectivesES={"You and Girhâzi succeeded in getting Khûldim Umûn to tell you where the lost archive is. You should talk to Girhâzi.","Talk to Girhâzi","Complete Instance: A Captive Audience","A Captive Audience","Girhâzi has an idea for how to get Khûldim Umûn to divulge the location of the lost library of Dubarâkh, and she needs your help.","Talk to Girhâzi when you are ready to question Khûldim Umûn again."}},
[106]={nameES="A Captive Friend",objectivesES={"Complete all quests for Isteron","Complete all quests for Ramdir","Talk to Hestil","Hestil is at her camp near Parth Galen.\
\
You have aided many members of her band and should now return to Hestil to plan the rescue of Drafli Broadshield.","Cúfaron and Ramdir are on Parth Galen. Isteron and Maedal are somewhere in the East Wall.\
\
Hestil has provided you quite the list of tasks that need to be accomplished before their guardian can be rescued from the Orcs. Help Cúfaron, Ramdir, Isteron, and Maedal, wherever they may be.","Complete all quests for Maedal","Complete all quests for Cúfaron","Hestil wants to make a plan for rescuing her party's guardian, but first she needs her friends to prepare for the task.","A Captive Friend"}},
[107]={nameES="A Carving of History",objectivesES={"Khûr-pulo-Skâl wants to teach you about the history of the Woses.","It looks like Khûr-pulo-Skâl has finished carving","Wood carvings can be found in Drû Bhûta.\
\
Examine wood carvings to hear the history of the Drúedain.","Khûr-pulo-Skâl can be found in Drû Bhûta.\
\
Wait for Khûr-pulo-Skâl to finish carving.","Wait for Khûr-pulo-Skâl to finish carving","Find a suitable piece of wood for carving","This wood seems good for carving","This wood also seems good for carving","Suitable wood for carving can be found in Taur Drúadan.\
\
Find a piece of wood for Khûr-pulo-Skâl to make a carving for you.","Khûr-pulo-Skâl can be found in Drû Bhûta.\
\
You should bring the wood to Khûr-pulo-Skâl.","A Carving of History","Speak with Khûr-pulo-Skâl"}},
[108]={nameES="A Case of Fear",objectivesES={}},
[109]={nameES="A Cauldron of Iron",objectivesES={"Captain-General Makan wishes to strengthen the defences of Tol Ascarnen by building a terrible weapon to wield against those attacking the fortress.","Iron ore can be found in the Isendeep Mine to the north, in Arador's End, or from the goblins of Grothum to the north-east of Tol Ascarnen.\
\
Sergeant-at-Arms Gautr at Tol Ascarnen is working to forge an iron cauldron to fill with oil to be used against the forces of Angmar as they try to retake the keep from the Free Peoples. He has asked you to help collect the iron ore needed to forge the cauldron.","A Cauldron of Iron","Return the iron ore to Sergeant-at-Arms Gautr at Tol Ascarnen"}},
[110]={nameES="Una Causa de Preocupación",objectivesES={"Una Causa de Preocupación","Dol Ringwest se encuentra al oeste de Duillond.\
\
Calengil desea expulsar el mal de las ruinas de Dol Ringwest. Te ha pedido que te dirijas a las ruinas y busques al líder de los trasgos, Durglup.","Derrotaste a Durglup","Calengil quiere que destruyas al trasgo Durglup en Dol Ringwest. Cree que este trasgo es el líder de las fuerzas allí y, por tanto, responsable de la profanación de las ruinas.","Habla con Calengil en Duillond","Derrota a Durglup","Calengil se encuentra en Duillond, al este de Dol Ringwest.\
\
Durglup resultó ser un desafío para el que estabas bien preparado. Ya no contamina las ruinas de Dol Ringwest. Debes regresar ante Calengil de inmediato."}},
[111]={nameES="Un Motivo de Alegría",objectivesES={"Lleva la figurilla de madera a Tongannel","Un Motivo de Alegría","Nora Rastrojal te ha dado noticias inesperadas, pero felices: su esposo sobrevivió a su encuentro con los Gauredain.","Tongannel está en Echad Candelleth, el campamento élfico en Tâl Bruinen, en el Bosque de los Trolls, muy al este de Bree.\
\
Nora Rastrojal te ha dado la buena noticia de que el cuerpo que encontraste no era el de su esposo —pues sobrevivió a su prueba y regresó sano y salvo a Bree— y te ha pedido que lleves una de las figurillas de madera a Tongannel como muestra de amistad."}},
[112]={nameES="Un Motivo de Pesar",objectivesES={"Un Motivo de Pesar","Nora Rastrojal vive en algún lugar de la ciudad de Bree, muy al oeste del Bosque de los Trolls.\
\
Tongannel te ha pedido que lleves las figurillas de madera a Nora Rastrojal con la esperanza de que pueda venderlas y obtener suficiente dinero para vivir durante un tiempo.","No pudiste salvar al artesano Tim Rastrojal de los Gauredain, pero lograste recuperar sus figurillas robadas y llevarlas a Tongannel.","Lleva las figurillas de madera a Nora Rastrojal"}},
[113]={nameES="Una cueva en las colinas",objectivesES={"Find the cave entrance","Una cueva en las colinas","Frithgeir believes that Nár's ramblings refer to a cave in the eastern hills of Thrór's Coomb. If he is correct, there should be a great cache of weapons and armour awaiting you there.","The cave entrance is believed to be in the eastern hills of Thrór's Coomb in Enedwaith.\
\
Frithgeir has translated Nár's ramblings and believes they refer to a drake-guarded cave."}},
[114]={nameES="Una celebración en los Campos Verdes",objectivesES={"Una celebración en los Campos Verdes","La Fiesta de los Campos Verdes es una festividad muy preciada en la Comarca, que tiene lugar en la localidad norteña de Tejonera.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando termine el festival actual. </rgb>","Habla con Segismondo Nortuk en Tejonera","El Festival de Primavera ha terminado por este año","La Fiesta de los Campos Verdes se está celebrando en Tejonera, en la Comarca.\
\
Deberías hablar con Segismundo Nortuk en Tejonera para que te hable sobre el día que lleva el nombre del Toro Bramador."}},
[115]={nameES="A Celebration of Life",objectivesES={"After rescuing them from the gaol, several storytellers wish to honour you with the only reward they can muster; tales of their homeland. They rest in the relative safety of Ahâba.","You have heard Malgâras's tale","You have heard Dabâr's tale","Phardâli invited you to speak with others freed from the gaol-break. They wish to reward you with tales of Mûr Ghala, as they have nothing more to offer your for your noble act.","Having heard the tales and shared a night with those saved from an ignoble fate within the dungeons of Emax Dûl, you have questions for Dabâr and his tale of the blight. Speak with him at Ahâba.","Listen to Malgâras's tale: <rgb=#00ff00>Complete Celebration of Life - Glory</rgb>","A Celebration of Life","Listen to Dabâr's tale: <rgb=#00ff00>Complete Celebration of Life - Folly</rgb>","You have heard Vilgerâ's tale","Ask Phardâli Ink-fingers about the Fool King","Listen to Vilgerâ's tale: <rgb=#00ff00>Complete Celebration of Life - Grace</rgb>"}},
[116]={nameES="A Celebratory Feast",objectivesES={}},
[117]={nameES="Aparece una puerta de bodega",objectivesES={"Parece que recuerdas que Bilbo y Frodo, los últimos propietarios de Bolsón Cerrado, eran buenos amigos de los Gamyi en Bolsón de Tirada, al sur de Bolsón Cerrado, justo debajo del Árbol de la Fiesta.\
\
Debes hablar con Hamfast Gamyi, también conocido como el Tío Gamyi, para ver si Bilbo o Frodo le dejaron alguna pista sobre la ubicación de una llave para la bodega secreta.","Habla con el Tío Gamyi en Bolsón de Tirada","Habla con Lobelia Sacovilla-Bolsón en Bolsón Cerrado","Durante algunos trabajos de construcción para colocar un cuarto horno en el Árbol de la Fiesta, una pala raspó algo de madera enterrado en la ladera. El horno se olvidó rápidamente, y en su lugar se llevó a cabo una excavación de una puerta.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando finalice el evento con el que está asociada. </rgb>","Aparece una puerta de bodega","Lobelia Sacovilla-Bolsón está en Bolsón Cerrado, al norte y subiendo la colina desde el Árbol de la Fiesta.\
\
Debes hablar con Lobelia si estás interesado en entrar en la puerta recién excavada, que probablemente conduce a una bodega oculta de Bolsón Cerrado."}},
[118]={nameES="El coraje de un campeón",objectivesES={"El coraje de un campeón","Slade Ransford está en Ost Guruth, la Fortaleza en ruinas de las Tierras Solitarias.\
\
Slade Ransford espera viajar contigo a Ost Cyrn para llevar a cabo su plan de expulsar a los orcos que se han asentado allí.","Slade Ransford está en Ost Guruth, la Fortaleza en ruinas de las Tierras Solitarias.\
\
Slade Ransford ha estado preguntando por ti y desea que hables con él sobre algún encargo.","Slade Ransford está en Ost Guruth, la Fortaleza en ruinas de las Tierras Solitarias.\
\
Slade Ransford espera que hables con él sobre los acontecimientos en Ost Cyrn.","Habla con Slade Ransford y viaja con él a Ost Cyrn","Un verdadero campeón no se acobarda ni ante las mayores adversidades, sino que disfruta la oportunidad de poner a prueba sus habilidades contra tal fuerza."}},
[119]={nameES="Un encuentro fortuito",objectivesES={"Lagordal te ha pedido que investigues la cueva dúnadan en las colinas del noroeste.","Un encuentro fortuito","Un forastero se encuentra frente a la entrada de la cueva...","Las sospechas de Lagordal no se han confirmado del todo, pero puede que las respuestas yazcan ocultas en una antigua cueva dúnadan.","Alguien se interpone en tu camino, bloqueando la entrada de la cueva dúnadan.\
\
Deberías hablar con él.","Encuentra la cueva dúnadan","Habla con el forastero en la cueva dúnadan"}},
[120]={nameES="A Chance For Revenge",objectivesES={}},
[121]={nameES="A Change in Plans",objectivesES={"Meet Hórin at Skarháld","Hórin has sent the surveyors back to Skarháld, while you and he investigate the Orcs with greater stealth.","Use the whistle to summon Hórin if you become separated","Glimmerdeep lies upon Mount Thrumfall, north of Skarháld.\
\
You should complete a full survey of the Glimmerdeep mines and whatever must be done to that end.","A large Orc-like creature spots you!","Defeated Grísblog","Find the entrance to the Glimmerdeep","You should talk to Hórin.","A Change in Plans","Habla con Hórin","You should meet Hórin back at Skarháld.","You should talk to Hórin on the path to Glimmerdeep.","Defeat Grísblog before Glimmerdeep","You should search for the entranceway to the Glimmerdeep, north of Skarháld.","Help Hórin with 'The Depth of the Problem'","You should defeat any Orcs you come across on the path to Glimmerdeep."}},
[122]={nameES="A Change in the Tides",objectivesES={}},
[123]={nameES="Cambio de nombre",objectivesES={"Pregunta a Teodoro Tojo por un posible apellido para Spalvi","Spalvi está en las ruinas de Gwingris, en Eregion.\
\
Has luchado contra un buen número de enemigos por todo Eregion, y deberías contarle a Spalvi los títulos posibles que se te han ocurrido que podrían encajar con sus gustos.","Habiendo dejado de ser un Duramano, Spalvi desea adoptar un nuevo apellido.","Ahora que ya no es un Duramano, Spalvi quiere un nuevo apellido, y te ha pedido que hables con la gente de Gwingris en busca de ideas.","Cambio de nombre","Habla con Spalvi en las ruinas de Gwingris, en Eregion","Spalvi está en las ruinas de Gwingris, en Eregion.","Teodoro quería ayudar, pero su creatividad no estaba por la labor","Pregunta a Daegennan por un posible apellido para Spalvi","Thillosil fue de bastante ayuda, pero Spalvi todavía no tiene apellido","Daegennan no ha sido de gran ayuda","Pregunta a Thillosil por un posible apellido para Spalvi","Spalvi piensa que deberías pensar en ideas para su nuevo apellido mientras luchas contra los muchos enemigos que se pueden encontrar en Eregion."}},
[124]={nameES="A Changing Wind",objectivesES={}},
[125]={nameES="Un capítulo sobre los Elfos",objectivesES={"Un capítulo sobre los Elfos","Bingo está fuera de la entrada a Caras Galadhon, en Lothlórien.\
\
A Bingo se le ha concedido permiso para quedarse en Lothlórien por el momento, y desea aprovechar al máximo la oportunidad.","Encuentra a Pennasseth en Cerin Nauth, en Lothlórien","abla con Pennasseth en Cerin Nauth una vez más","Habla con Pennasseth en Cerin Nauth una vez más","Bingo está fuera de la entrada a Caras Galadhon, en Lothlórien.\
\
Pennasseth, la Guardiana de Historias, te ha entregado un montón de libros para dárselos a Bingo y ayudarle a escribir sobre los Elfos.","Bingo está junto a las cataratas al sureste de la Piedra de Durin, en Nanduhirion.\
\
Bingo está esperando a que hables con él antes de continuar el viaje.","La Piedra de Durin se alza orgullosa sobre el Lago Espejo, pero un campamento de orcos se encuentra a sus pies","Vuelve con Bingo fuera de Caras Galadhon con el montón de libros","Pennasseth, la Guardiana de las Historias, suele encontrarse en Cerin Nauth, en el lado occidental del claro de Cerin Amroth.\
\
Has obtenido un libro de historia y un libro de mapas de Pennasseth, pero ha indicado que no deberías llevárselos a Bingo todavía.","Pennasseth te entrega otro libro, pero una vez más levanta la mano.","Encuentra la Piedra de Durin junto a la orilla del Lago Espejo, en Nanduhirion","Pennasseth, la Guardiana de Historias, suele encontrarse en Cerin Nauth, en el lado oeste del claro de Cerin Amroth.\
\
Bingo quiere que encuentres a Pennasseth y le pidas prestado un libro sobre los Elfos de Lothlórien, para así comprenderlos mejor.","La Piedra de Durin se encuentra al sureste de la salida de Moria, en Nanduhirion.\
\
Bingo desea ver el monumento que mencionó Spalvi, y te ha pedido derrotar cualquier peligro en el Valle del Arroyo Sombrío que amenace la paz de ese lugar.","Pennasseth te entrega un tomo grueso, y luego levanta la mano cuando te dispones a marcharte.","Habla con Bingo fuera de la entrada a Caras Galadhon, en Lothlórien","Pennasseth, la Guardiana de Historias, suele encontrarse en Cerin Nauth, en el lado oeste del claro de Cerin Amroth.\
\
Has obtenido un libro de historia de Pennasseth, pero ha indicado que no debes devolvérselo a Bingo todavía.","Tú y Bingo habéis atravesado Moria con éxito, y ahora tu amigo aventurero se prepara para la siguiente etapa del viaje.","Habla con Bingo al sureste de la Piedra de Durin y viaja con él por todo Nanduhirion","Bingo quiere hablar contigo al sureste de la Piedra de Durin, no lejos de donde el Lago Espejo desemboca en una poza inferior.","Pennasseth, la Guardiana de Historias, suele encontrarse en Cerin Nauth, en el lado oeste del claro de Cerin Amroth.\
\
Has obtenido de Pennasseth libros de historia, mapas y arte, pero ha indicado que no debes llevárselos a Bingo todavía.","Pennasseth te entrega otro libro, ¡y parece que no será el último!","Habla con Bingo al sureste de la Piedra de Durin, justo más allá de las cascadas","Pennasseth sonríe... y parece que ya no le quedan libros."}},
[126]={nameES="A Charitable Spirit",objectivesES={"Tell Daley Utteridge that he inspired you to give away your hard-earned tokens","Donate one Yule Festival Token to Ted Ives","Barrett Nowell is moved by your generous gift","A Charitable Spirit","Donate one Yule Festival Token to Barrett Nowell","The beggars can be found throughout town, and you can earn Yule Festival Tokens by participating in events at Winter-home.\
\
Inspired by Daley Utteridge's wish to be more charitable with what little he has, you should collect many Yule Festival Tokens to gift to beggars who have nothing.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This quest will consume 5 Yule Festival Tokens.</rgb>","Jack Judson is moved by your kindness","Donate one Yule Festival Token to Bill Hyde","Regina Judson is moved by your generosity","Bill Hyde is moved by your good deed","Daley Utteridge has a great deal of good will towards the very poor in Winter-home, but sadly nothing to give. You are moved by his plight.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> NOTE: This quest will be removed from your quest log when the current festival ends. </rgb>","Donate one Yule Festival Token to Jack Judson","Daley Utteridge is in the workers' area in Winter-home.\
\
You should return to Daley Utteridge and tell him of your kindness to the beggars. You gave them your hard-earned rewards!","Donate one Yule Festival Token to Regina Judson","Ted Ives is moved by your gift"}},
[127]={nameES="Una fría corriente de aire",objectivesES={"Enciende las antorchas apagadas","Has encendido las antorchas de la sección sur de la Sala Vigesimoprimera que se habían apagado por una fría corriente de aire.","Una fría corriente de aire","Completado","Puedes encontrar antorchas apagadas cerca del arco sur de la Sala Vigesimoprimera.\
\
Deberías encender las antorchas para contrarrestar la fría corriente de aire.","Has devuelto algo de luz a la Sala Vigesimoprimera, y la inquietud ha disminuido, pero aún sientes una fría brisa. Estas antorchas deberán encenderse con frecuencia.\
\
No sientes ningún deseo de explorar al sur de la Sala Vigesimoprimera....","Las antorchas alrededor del arco sur se han apagado, y una fría corriente de aire cerca de esta sala te ha llenado de cierta inquietud."}},
[128]={nameES="Un viento helado",objectivesES={"Ruaraikh derrotado","Pasi se encuentra en Sûri-kylä, al noroeste del Umbral de Hierro.\
\
Deberías volver a ver a Pasi con las noticias de tu victoria.","Ruaraikh se encuentra en los campamentos Angmarim, al sureste de Sûri-kylä, cerca del Umbral de Hierro en el paso hacia Forodwaith.\
\
Pasi te ha pedido que derrotes a Ruaraikh y provoques el desorden entre los Angmarim.","Habla con Pasi","Un viento helado","Los Lossoth culpan al duro invierno de la invasión de los Angmarim y te han pedido tu ayuda para expulsarlos.","Derrota a Ruaraikh"}},
[129]={nameES="Un viento helado",objectivesES={"Talk to Kyrstig","Kyrstig can be found near Ibdêkh-buzru, the Thing-fold.\
\
You should talk to Kyrstig.","Ice grims can be found on the cliffs near Ibdêkh-buzru, the Thing-fold.\
\
You should defeat ice grims.","Un viento helado","Cold grims haunt the Father's Path high in the Welkin-lofts."}},
[130]={nameES="Una Revelación Escalofriante",objectivesES={"Calenthon está en su campamento en Nan Tornaeth, al noreste de la guarida del oso espectral.\
\
Debes regresar con Calenthon y contarle tu victoria sobre el oso espectral.","Has encontrado la fuente del frío... un oso espectral que también lleva un collar similar al que encontraste.","Una Revelación Escalofriante","La fuente del frío parece provenir de la zona suroeste de Nan Tornaeth.\
\
Debes investigar el origen de la sensación helada.","La fuente del frío parece provenir de la zona suroeste de Nan Tornaeth, no lejos del campamento de Calenthon.\
\
Debes investigar el origen de la sensación helada.","Investiga el origen de la sensación helada","oso espectral derrotado","Lleva el collar que encontraste a Calenthon","Encontraste un collar con runas en uno de los osos y casi te vence una inquietante sensación de frío.","Derrota al oso espectral","El oso espectral tiene su guarida en la zona suroeste de Nan Tornaeth, no muy lejos del campamento de Calenthon.\
\
Debes derrotar al oso espectral; tal vez así liberes a los demás osos de su locura."}},
[131]={nameES="A City Under Siege",objectivesES={"Adalmód asked you to aid the guards of Eaworth as they prepare for the coming Orc-siege.","Aurochs herds can be found to the south and the east of Eaworth, in the Entwash Vale.\
\
Offram has asked you to hunt aurochs for meat, hides, and ivory.","Bring the aurochs-meat, hides, and ivory to Offram at Eaworth","A City Under Siege","Offram is on guard outside the Eaworth Vendor Hall.\
\
You should bring the items you collected to Offram."}},
[132]={nameES="A Clandestine Meeting",objectivesES={"Kyrstig, the last of Ausma's scouts, can be found further up the Father's Path.\
\
You should find Kyrstig with Hórin.","Kyrstig is ready to give you her scouting report.\
\
You should talk to Kyrstig at Ibdêkh-buzru, the Thing-fold and complete 'Instance: A Clandestine Meeting'.","Hórin can be found near Ibdêkh-buzru, the Thing-fold.\
\
You should talk to Hórin.","Talk to Kyrstig by the Thing-fold and hear her report","Talk to Hórin by the Thing-fold","The time has come to continue up the mountain in search of Kyrstig, the last of Ausma's apprentices.","A flare shoots off from the top of the hill before you","A Clandestine Meeting","You have found the dwarf-fort known as Bagud-dum","You have found Kyrstig near Ibdêkh-buzru, the Thing-fold.\
\
You should talk to Kyrstig.","Kyrstig mentioned a dwarf-fort called Bagud-dum which seems to be the Angmarim's main base of operations in the Welkin-lofts.\
\
You should find Bagud-dum.","Find the entrance to the dwarf-fort of Bagud-dum","Find Kyrstig near the Thing-fold","Kyrstig waves as you approach","Hórin can be called with the summoning horn.\
\
You should talk to Hórin.","Talk to Kyrstig by the Thing-fold","Call Hórin and talk to him"}},
[133]={nameES="A Classy Snowman",objectivesES={}},
[134]={nameES="Un fuego purificador",objectivesES={"Un fuego purificador","Derrota a las arañas dentro de Jâr Obadal y prende fuego a su red de telarañas.","Jûkhtar se derrumba, muriendo, en una masa de extremidades temblorosas","Encuentra y derrota a Jûkhtar la Voraz en Jâr Obadal","Encuentra y derrota a Jûkhtar la Voraz en Jâr Obadal.","Las arañas salvajes dentro de las cuevas de Jâr Obadal han acosado durante mucho tiempo a viajeros y mercaderes a lo largo del Gran Camino. Prende fuego a sus telarañas y acaba con su amenaza de una vez por todas."}},
[135]={nameES="A Closing Threat",objectivesES={}},
[136]={nameES="Una nube de murciélagos",objectivesES={"Has recuperado la bolsa robada","Has derrotado a Carcharan en Gorotham","Derrota a Carcharan en Gorotham","Bats may be found throughout the Dourstocks. Carcharan may be found in a cave at Gorotham, north-east from Echad Mothelen, beyond Burgûl-stazg.\
\
Lavanferon has asked you to recover his lost satchel and to defeat the bats of Mirkwood, including the vampire, Carcharan.","Many dark and vile creatures dwell beneath the eaves of southern Mirkwood. Among these are terrible bats...some of which are creatures of an ancient age.","Lavanferon está en Echad Mothelen, al suroeste de Gorotham, más allá de Burgûl-stazg.\
\
Deberías devolver la bolsa a Lavanferon e informarle de tu victoria contra Carcharan.","Vuelve a ver a Lavanferon en Echad Mothelen","Una nube de murciélagos","Recupera la bolsa robada"}},
[137]={nameES="A Cloud of Despair",objectivesES={"Talk to Elladan and Elrohir at Haerondir","Elladan and Elrohir can be found on the eastern ramparts at Haerondir.\
\
You have spoken to Legolas, but he has not experienced what Echil described. You should now speak to Elladan and Elrohir instead.","A Cloud of Despair","Legolas can be found on the north-western ramparts of Haerondir.\
\
Echil has asked you to speak to the Elves at Haerondir as their resolve has not visibly faltered. You should speak to Legolas first.","Talk to Legolas at Haerondir","As the Host of the West approaches the Black Gate, a sense of despair has taken root in even the hardiest warriors."}},
[138]={nameES="A Clue to the Relic",objectivesES={"A Clue to the Relic","Find the item in Iothete's abandoned home","This home is as draughty as it was before, and you feel a strong chill","Iothete believes he knows something about the relic you have been sent to investigate, but he will not tell you. He wants you to bring him a small item first.","The item of which Iothete spoke can be found in his home in Dunfast.\
\
You should collect the item when you find it.","Bring the cold stone to Iothete","Iothete is at his small hut hidden in the woods of the northern Whitshaws.\
\
You should bring the stone fragment you collected to Iothete as he bid.","This ice-cold fragment is very similar to the formations you see on Núrzum, and on the land wherever he goes"}},
[139]={nameES="Una pista fría",objectivesES={"Una pista fría","Has encontrado al cultista desaparecido. Las Tierras Feroces resultó ser su perdición","Habla con Egwylf fuera del Salón de Hidromiel de Cliving","El agente desaparecido del Culto del Ojo Sangriento está en algún lugar de las Tierras Feroces.","Bingo adopta una expresión filosófica.\
\
'Ese cultista del Ojo Sangriento no debería haberse marchado solo. Creo que, si hubiera tenido amigos con él, quizá las cosas no habrían terminado así. Los orcos nunca fueron sus amigos. Pueden servir al mismo propósito oscuro, pero no eran amigos. No fue el frío de las Tierras Feroces lo que acabó con él. ¡Fue el frío en su corazón!'\
\
Bingo guarda silencio un momento, y luego sacude la cabeza.\
\
'O quizá sí fue simplemente el frío. ¡Aquí hace muchísimo frío, y estoy agotado! Nos llevó por todas las Tierras Feroces, y me duelen los pies. Me alegra que hayamos resuelto el misterio, pero estaré aún más contento cuando nuestra aventura nos lleve de regreso a tierras más cálidas.'\
\
<rgb=#00FF00>Después de completar esta misión, Berto Bartolín llegará cerca del maestro de establos en Forlaw, en las Tierras Feroces.</rgb>\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>La semana que viene: 'Berto Tiene una Palabra' (Nivel recomendado: 88)</rgb>","Este miembro del Culto del Ojo Sangriento vio su suerte torcerse en las alturas nevadas de las Tierras Feroces, y las crueles hechicerías de la región acabaron con él. No hará más daño, pero el Ojo Sangriento aún tiene otros servidores.\
\
Incluso en la muerte, el cultista estira la mano hacia **el broche** del Ojo Sangriento que yace junto a él en la nieve. Te preguntas si creyó que sus actos valieron la pena, pero lo único seguro es que ya no podrá responderte.","Esta nieve fue alterada por alguien que se movía con fuerza y sin cuidado.","Busca en las Tierras Feroces al agente desaparecido del Ojo Sangriento","Egwylf está fuera del Salón de Hidromiel de Cliving, en los Norcrofts.","Egwylf está en la ciudad de Forlaw, en las Tierras Feroces, al norte del maestro de establos.\
\
Has encontrado al cultista desaparecido del Ojo Sangriento y debes llevar el broche a Egwylf con la noticia de que ya no será una amenaza para Rohan.","He estado hablando con la gente de Forlaw, como haría un verdadero solucionador de misterios, y parece que algunos vieron a un hombre con una gema roja visitar al barbero de la ciudad. ¿Intentó cambiar su apariencia? ¡Tenemos que asegurarnos!'","Bingo está en la ciudad de Forlaw, en las Tierras Feroces, al norte del maestro de establos.","Habla con Bingo en la ciudad de Forlaw","El cultista del Ojo Sangriento finalmente sucumbió a sus heridas y a los elementos cerca de la Cumbre Solitaria, en las Tierras Feroces.","Lleva el broche del Ojo Sangriento a Egwylf en la ciudad de Forlaw","Willem Bigote está junto a varios sacos abandonados, pero tras olfatearlos brevemente apunta su nariz hacia el oeste. Debe de ser allí adonde fue el cultista del Ojo Sangriento después de agotar el contenido de estos sacos.","Recoges el broche y te asombras de su parecido con la Piedra de Roth.","Egwylf te ha pedido a ti y a Bingo que la ayuden a encontrar a uno de los agentes desaparecidos del Culto del Ojo Sangriento.","Examina el cadáver del hombre desesperado, cerca de la Cumbre Solitaria","Estos sacos contenían comida, pero ahora están vacíos.","La bolsa está llena de las monedas sucias que a veces usan los orcos."}},
[140]={nameES="A Collection of Seeds and Legs",objectivesES={}},
[141]={nameES="A Commanding Knock",objectivesES={"Borhador can be found in his hall above Ethring village.\
\
You should speak with Borhador.","Laerind can be found in Ethring village.\
\
You should speak with Laerind.","Speak with Borhador","Speak with Laerind","Borhador hears a loud noise outside and wants you to investigate as he fears a cave troll has come for him.","Borhador can be found in his hall above Ethring village.\
\
Borhador asks you to investigate a sound he heard.","Speak to Borhador","A Commanding Knock"}},
[142]={nameES="A Common Cause",objectivesES={}},
[143]={nameES="A Company Astray",objectivesES={"You have the broken waggon wheel. You should find someone in Iridír who can repair it.","The wheelwright, Aranbir, says he will make time to fix the waggon wheel if you fill in for his absent apprentice.","Take the repaired wheel","Horse traders Khâmi and Akûshu are stranded at Gha Nêkha, in the desert south-west of Eshadûr, with a broken waggon wheel.","Bring the repaired wheel to Khâmi","Bring the broken wheel to a wheelwright in Iridír","Complete Quest: Mending the Wheel","Take the broken wheel","You have completed the work of the absent apprentice, and Aranbir says the wheel is repaired. You should pick up the wheel to bring it back to Khâmi at Gha Nêkha, the outpost in southern Ambarûl.","Khâmi has asked you to take their broken wheel to Iridír to have it repaired. You should pick up the waggon wheel.","A Company Astray","You have taken the broken wheel to Iridír and had it repaired. You should return it to Khâmi at Gha Nêkha, south-west of Eshadûr."}},
[144]={nameES="A Company Divided",objectivesES={"A Company Divided","The Rohirrim guarding the Cuthstan have divided opinions of what should be done next.","Hygerad seems concerned about the warnings of his friend Odda","Talk to Nothelm about the Orcs","Talk to Hygerad about the Orcs","Nothelm frets about Lanbert's dismissal of the Orc threat","Odda can be found to the south of the Cuthstan, hidden to the south of the road.\
\
Lanbert sent you to speak with Odda.","Talk to Ithamar about the Orcs","Lanbert is at the Rohirrim-camp at the base of the Cuthstan.\
\
Lanbert is awaiting your return with the suitable weapons taken from Orcs.","Talk to Lanbert at the Cuthstan-camp","The Rohirrim are stationed at Lanbert's camp near the base of the Cuthstan.\
\
Lanbert has asked you to speak with the other soldiers in his company and convince them that the Orc-threat has been dealt with.","Ithamar is bothered by the scavenged Orc weaponry","Talk to Odda south of the Cuthstan"}},
[145]={nameES="A Company Divided",objectivesES={"Dolenthol can be found before Barad Cúron, the Tower of the Crescent Moon, in the Circle of Death.\
\
You have rejoined Faramir's company. You should talk to Dolenthal.","Find Dolenthal near Barad Cúron","A Company Divided","Dolenthal told you to meet him before Barad Cúron, the Tower of the Crescent Moon, in the Circle of Death.\
\
You have aided the Rangers you found as best you could, and should now seek out Dolenthal near Barad Cúron.","Lost bands of Rangers might be found in the Circle of Death.\
\
Dolenthol has asked you to search for lost bands of Rangers who became separated after Gothmog's forces attacked Prince Faramir's company.","Although Prince Faramir's company was successful in repelling an attack by the forces of Gothmog, some bands of Rangers have become scattered and lost in the Circle of Death.","Talk to Dolenthol","Barad Cúron looms overhead, but Prince Faramir's company has gathered outside an old hall","Faramir can be found outside Uialrond, the Dome of Evening in the Circle of Death.\
\
Dolenthol has asked you to speak to Faramir.","Talk to Faramir"}},
[146]={nameES="Un enigma desconcertante (opcional)",objectivesES={"Has vencido en la batalla","La Sala Decimosexta se encuentra al norte de las Fundaciones de Piedra, justo al sur de Sigin-tharâk, y allí es donde puede hallarse el vociferador de maldiciones Unur.\
\
Celofa desea que hagas lo que ella no pudo: invocar a Unur con tu pergamino y derrotarlo en combate justo. Es probable que tenga compañeros, así que asegúrate de llevar aliados contigo en esta empresa.","Derrota a Unur y a sus trols","La gran Rufián Celofa puede encontrarse en las Fundaciones de Piedra.\
\
Celofa espera noticias de tu aventura y desea enseñarte humildemente todo lo que sabe.","Regresa junto a Celofa","Celofa te ha propuesto un desafío para que aprendas mejor a usar el enigma que te dio.","Un enigma desconcertante (opcional)"}},
[147]={nameES="A Confrontation With Gúrbarash",objectivesES={"Gúrbarash appears","Lumrog can be found in Misthallow.\
\
You should find find and confront Gúrbarash in Lumrog.","Talk to Fanglind at Thokvist","The Gundabad encampment of Lumrog, led by the chieftain Gúrbarash, blockades much of Misthallow.","Fanglind can be found at Thokvist.\
\
You should talk to Fanglind.","Lumrog can be found in Misthallow.\
\
You should enter Lumrog.","Enter Lumrog","A Confrontation With Gúrbarash","Skarding can be found at Thokvist.\
\
You should talk to Skarding.","Stone slabs can be found around Lumrog in Misthallow.\
\
You should place the carcasses on the stone slabs.","Worms and avanc can be found throughout Misthallow.\
\
You should defeat worms or avanc and gather their carcasses.","Talk to Skarding Wargsbane at Thokvist","Summon and confront Gúrbarash the chief of Lumrog","Gúrbarash has been defeated"}},
[148]={nameES="A Conspiracy Born",objectivesES={"Speak with Sûlmur to request a sheaf of her papyrus","Amalíbi sent you to speak with Nangar about what you found and how best to proceed with this new knowledge. Return to Jirush and inform Nangar of all that transpired.","Zidemel sent you to the quarry north-west of Jirush to collect drams of scorpion blood to distill and create ink to create a proper curse.","Nangar is pleased with all you have done. He requests that you take the ink and the posting to Galamê. Galamê will use the ink and posting to create an Ordâkhai curse in Khârdu's hand.","Nangar sends you to visit Zidemel","Nangar is pleased and sends you on to Galamê","Galamê hands you a letter in Ordâkhin","Read the posting if you wish","Zidemel crafted the ink needed to make the curse","Galamê returns a letter to you written in Ordâkhin. He tells you it will incite violence between the two captains and asks that you deliver it to Nangar.","Return the scorpion blood to Zidemel at Jirush","Deliver the inciting letter to Nangar","Deliver the ink and the posting to Galamê in Jirush","Galamê requested you collect a sheaf of papyrus from Sûlmur in Ambarûl","You explain your need to Sûlmur. She hands you a sheaf of papyrus.\
\
'If we are to know freedom, we must band together. I cannot head south to aid the Khûdi, but I can supply you with a small amount of my papyrus.\
\
'Tell those who fight in the south. Should we drive our enemy out first, they will have our swords. Should they prevail, I beg they bring theirs to the north to aid us. And, when we are free, I shall expect their patronage.'","Malgat asked you to collect a note written by Khârdu","Speak with Malgat about the next steps","Malgat confirmed the posting was written by Khârdu. He then directed you to deliver the ink and posting to Nangar for further instruction.","Return to Jirush and speak with Nangar about Amalíbi","Galamê states he can replicate Khârdu's writing. The papyrus he has, however, is not the same quality as Khârdu uses, and to make the curse authentic he needs papyrus from the farmer, Sûlmur in Ambarûl.","Malgat confirms the posting is in Khârdu's hand","You collected a bounty posting","Speak with Zidemel and learn what is needed for ink","You share the details of your excursions for Amalíbi with Nangar. He ponders for a long moment.\
\
'I believe our leader is correct. The response should be personal. A slight against Jombahok from Khârdu presented plainly and openly. It must be something that outs the former as a scoundrel to his men. The unrest within Jombahok's ranks ensures no choice but retaliation.\
\
'Seek Zidemel's counsel on the best ink for an Ordâkhai curse. While you undertake the collection of whatever Zidemel requires, I will discuss with the other elders. Our time to unite and rise is nigh.'","Deliver the sheaf of papyrus to Galamê","Allow Malgat to confirm Khârdu wrote the posting","Amalíbi sends you to Nangar for a bit of guidance on how best to use this information. Nangar suggests that a retaliatory post placed within the encampment overlooking Jirush may serve the rebels well.","Malgat explained that Khârdu often pays travelling hunters bounties to clear beasts from the wastes of Khûd Zagin. He asks that you acquire a bounty posting and return it to him to validate Khârdu's handwriting.","Collect a bounty post written by Khârdu","Return to Nangar and show him the posting and ink","You found a posting near the Ordâkhai encampment south and east from Jirush. You assume it is written by Khârdu. Return the bounty posting to Malgat for confirmation.","Zidemel sent you to Malgat. Find him at his hovel in Jirush.","Zidemel bids you collect scorpion blood to make the ink","Deliver the inciting letter to Amalíbi at Ghalbûru","Nangar trusts the efforts of the other elders and appreciates your role in acquiring the letter. He puts his faith in you and the other elders and sends you to Amalíbi for the final decision.","Nangar believes Jombahok can be incited by Khârdu's words. He asks that you visit Zidemel to have the proper ink made to draft a curse from Khârdu toward Jombahok.","A Conspiracy Born","You acquired the eight drams of scorpion blood Zidemel needs to make the ink. Return the scorpion blood to Zidemel at Jirush.","Sûlmur provided you with a sheaf of papyrus and asked for Galamê's patronage. She then pledged her sword and asked you to request the swords of Khûd Zagin, should they overcome their Ordâkhai oppressors.","Nangar directs you to deliver the inciting letter to Amalíbi at Ghalburu"}},
[149]={nameES="A Continued Stubbornness",objectivesES={}},
[150]={nameES="A Controlled Pyre",objectivesES={}},
[151]={nameES="A Convincing Argument",objectivesES={"Talk to Thane Cútha","Thane Cútha is in the Mead Hall of Beaconwatch.\
\
Armed with more information about the Boar-tribe Orcs, provided by Cútha's own son, you should speak with the Thane of Beaconwatch once more.","Meregyth wants to make one last plea for help to Cútha.","A Convincing Argument","Meregyth stands near the Mead Hall of Beaconwatch.\
\
Cútha was firm in his position and would not falter. He did, however, give permission to Cúthing to assist in whatever capacity he was able. You should inform Meregyth of the unfortunate news.","Talk to Meregyth"}},
[152]={nameES="A Convincing Scarecrow",objectivesES={"Talk to Agelric","A Convincing Scarecrow","The crebain have been thoroughly surprised by Agelric's ruse. You should inform him of your success.\
\
Agelric can be found in central Garsfeld.","Having seen his others destroyed, Agelric of Garsfeld wants you to lure crebain by acting like a scarecrow in the fields surrounding Garsfeld.","Agelric of Garsfeld has lamented that none of his scarecrows have survived the crebain flocks that have terrorized the fields recently. He hopes that you can become a more persuasive replacement."}},
[153]={nameES="Un Vino Enrevesado",objectivesES={"Saerthuithel se encuentra en Echad Candelleth, en el Bosque de los Trolls.\
\
Deberías llevarle el Viejo Los Vientos, hábilmente disfrazadas como Vino del Brandivino, lo antes posible.","Un Vino Enrevesado","Carlo Bosqueoscuro se encuentra en El Pájaro y el Bebé, en Cavada Grande.\
\
Deberías recoger un Viejo Los Vientos en El Pájaro y el Bebé, que serán entregadas a Saerthuithel disfrazadas como Vino del Brandivino.","Recoge la falsa Cosecha del Brandivino en El Pájaro y el Bebé","Has recogido la falsa Cosecha del Brandivino","Lleva la falsa Cosecha del Brandivino a Saerthuithel en Echad Candelleth"}},
[154]={nameES="Un enemigo acorralado",objectivesES={"Habla con Miluimil en el campamento de Ivorel","Miluimil se encuentra en el campamento de Ivorel en las Hondonadas Enmarañadas.\
\
Deberías hablar con Miluimil sobre la huida de Gollum.","Un enemigo acorralado","Habla con Miluimil para viajar a las cuevas","Un grupo de orcos enviado desde la torre de Dol Guldur está cazando por las Hondonadas Enmarañadas al escurridizo Gollum.","Miluimil se encuentra en el campamento de Ivorel en las Hondonadas Enmarañadas.\
\
Miluimil te ha pedido que viajes con él a las cuevas del norte de las Hondonadas Enmarañadas e impidas que los sirvientes de Dol Guldur capturen a Gollum."}},
[155]={nameES="A Cost Yet Unpaid",objectivesES={"In an effort to prevent further tragedy from befalling the people of Blackroot Vale, Malthellam hopes to safe-guard the people of Alagrant and Sardol from the Enemy.","Talk to Calennen in Alagrant","DNT -- will not be seen","A Cost Yet Unpaid","Calennen can be found in the village of Alagrant to the south-west of Morlad.\
\
Malthellam has asked you to scout for threats to the south and ensure the safety of the people in the villages of Alagrant and Sardol."}},
[156]={nameES="A Costly Journey",objectivesES={"Ailing Stout-axes can be found in the Hall Under the Mountain.\
\
You have gathered 'healing draughts' and dried cloaks for the ailing Stout-axes and should now deliver them.","You have aided the ailing Stout-axes.","You have done well to aid the ailing Stout-axes in Erebor and eased the ills of their long journey north from Mordor.","A Costly Journey","With a few of his folk ailing from the long journey to Erebor, Náth hopes to raise their spirits.","Completado","Dried cloaks can be found near various fire-pits and forges in the Hall Under the Mountain. 'Healing draughts' can be found on feasting tables in the Hall Under the Mountain.\
\
Náth hopes to help ailing Stout-axes by giving them 'healing draughts' and the warmth of a dried cloak."}},
[157]={nameES="A Crack in the Iron Crown",objectivesES={"Talk to Múta outside Caivád Sâr","Múta can be found in Tûr Ágal, the tower at the centre of Caivád Sâr.\
\
After learning that a ruthless dwarf-lord named Brathar leads the Dourhands at Caivád Sâr, Múta has resolved to defeat this mysterious, new leader for the good of the Gabil'akkâ.","Múta can be found outside of Caivád Sâr in the War of Three Peaks.\
\
You were able to escape Tûr Ágal after learning of Brathar Crack-helm and the Dourhands' plans. You should talk to Múta.","Word has spread that a mysterious enemy has arrived at Caivád Sâr, threatening to turn the tide of the War of Three Peaks.","A Crack in the Iron Crown","Talk to Múta"}},
[158]={nameES="A Crack in the Works",objectivesES={"You may be able to get down to the device array through the network of strange pipes that seem to run through the area.\
\
Dagoras asked you to defeat the goblin-engineers working on Saruman's great device down in the rift beneath the western ward of Isengard.","A Crack in the Works","Saruman's servants have constructed a massive set of fell devices beneath Isengard. These engines are maintained by bands of goblin-engineers. Without their constant tinkering the whole array is likely to fall into disrepair.","Talk to Dagoras within the Ring of Isengard","Dagoras is hiding within the Ring of Isengard.\
\
You should return to Dagoras with news of your success."}},
[159]={nameES="Un espejo agrietado",objectivesES={"Los trasgos y orcos están atacando el espejo, intentando destruirlo.","Un espejo agrietado","El espejo que has encontrado está agrietado y corre riesgo de ser destruido.","Habla con Kúli en Guardia Orca","Kúli está en Guardia Orca.\
\
El enano Kúli estará interesado en esaber que el espejo está todavía a salvo.","Este espejo está agrietado, casi roto. Parece que los orcos y trasgos de la zona han estado utilizándolo como blanco de prácticas. Cuando te acercas para tocarlo, escuchas orcos acercándose.","El espejo está a salvo, por ahora"}},
[160]={nameES="A Creeping Sensation",objectivesES={"Talk to Mekhnet","Goblin-sapper defeated","Mekhnet has been keeping an eye on the opposite shoreline to the east of the the Kambráda encampment in Amdân.\
\
You should check to see if anything strange is happening there.","A Creeping Sensation","An inert sapper-bomb lies in the snow","Examine the bomb","Mekhnet harbours a concern that she'd like to put to rest.","A shrill yell sounds from behind you","Check the area","Mekhnet waits near the Kambráda encampment in the eastern part of Amdân.\
\
She will want to hear about the goblin-sapper and the bomb you found.","You have found nothing of note other than an inert sapper-bomb.\
\
Perhaps inspecting it will unlock more clues."}},
[161]={nameES="A Croft Too Far",objectivesES={"Gísil can be found inside the Mead Hall of Garsfeld.\
\
You should return to Gísil and let him know that you have completed his tasks.","Talk to Gísil","Gísil does not want to risk causing panic should his plan be revealed before the proper time, and thus has asked you to be discreet.","Gísil and Gísling can be found inside the Mead Hall of Garsfeld. Langar can be found in west Garsfeld.\
\
Gísil wants you to aid him and the people of Garsfeld with final tasks before the townsfolk evacuate to Snowbourn.","Aid Gísling","Aid Gísil","Aid Langar","A Croft Too Far"}},
[162]={nameES="Un grito de venganza",objectivesES={"Pukhal se encuentra al sur y luego al oeste de Anazârmekhem, en la zona noroeste de las Profundidades Llameantes.\
\
Garnyd te ha encargado que mates al orco Pukhal.","Derrota a Pukhal","Muchos enanos han sido asesinados por un orco llamado Pukhal, un guerrero temible entre los habitantes de Moria.","Habla con Garnyd en Anazârmekhem","Un grito de venganza","Garnyd se encuentra en Anazârmekhem, en las zonas septentrionales de las Profundidades Llameantes.\
\
Deberías regresar junto a Garnyd con noticias de tu éxito.","Pukhal derrotado"}},
[163]={nameES="Componentes de un plan astuto",objectivesES={"Gapi, un enano ubicado en Anazârmekhem, está organizando los trabajos para reparar los puentes del Cruce de las Cenizas y le gustaría que reunieras piezas de andamiaje para él.","Gapi está en Anazârmekhem, al noroeste de Hadâd-mezer.\
\
Deberías llevarle a Gapi las piezas de andamiaje que has reunido.","Se pueden encontrar piezas de andamiaje en los túneles al este de Hadâd-mezer y Bhraf-ru, ambos al sur de Anazârmekhem.\
\
Deberías recoger piezas de andamiaje para las reparaciones que se llevan a cabo bajo el Cruce de las Cenizas.","La madera escasea en Khazad-dûm, y los trozos de andamiaje que se encuentran por las Profundidades Llameantes podrían resultar útiles para los trabajos de reparación que se están llevando a cabo bajo el Cruce de las Cenizas.\
\
Debería haber una cantidad considerable de piezas de andamiaje repartidas por los túneles al este de Hadâd-mezer.","Lleva las piezas de andamiaje a Gapi en Anazârmekhem","Componentes de un plan astuto"}},
[164]={nameES="A Cure For All Ills",objectivesES={"The reveller says nothing, but departs with a sour look","Talk to Ioreth","Ioreth can be found in the High Hall in Minas Tirith (Midsummer).\
\
You have disposed of half-emptied bottles and removed noisy revellers from the High Hall. You should return to Ioreth.","A Cure For All Ills","As Midsummer revellers overtake the Houses of Healing in Minas Tirith, Ioreth's patience has begun to wear thin.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This quest will be removed from your quest log when the current festival ends.</rgb>","Half-emptied bottles and noisy revellers can be found in the High Hall in Minas Tirith (Midsummer).\
\
Ioreth has tasked you with disposing of half-emptied bottles of ale and wine and removing noisy revellers from the High Hall."}},
[165]={nameES="A Cure For Weariness",objectivesES={"After a long journey, Othor has arrived at Pelargir with a rag-tag group of Corsairs.","A Cure For Weariness","You have found the food stall in West Pelargir.\
\
You should talk to Jódha to order food.","This looks like the right place!","Talk to Jódha","You have found the food stall in West Pelargir and given your order.\
\
You should wait for Jódha to finish cooking.","According to Othor, there is a food stall run by Haradrim towards the southern end of West Pelargir.\
\
You should find it.","Barely any time as passed before Jódha calls out to you","Wait for Jódha to finish your order","Nasar waits near the West Pelargir gates.\
\
He seems to want to talk to you.","You have retrieved the food for Othor, Nasar, and the other Corsairs.\
\
You should return to them near the West Pelargir gates.","Find the food stall run by Haradrim","Talk to Nasar","Return to Othor near the West Pelargir gates","Before you can approach Othor, Nasar waves you over","For about ten seconds, Nasar squints at you with a look of intense concentration. His eyes then light up, and a grin spreads across his face.\
\
'Hah! I remember you! Othor didn't think I would, but I do! How could I forget the one who supplied me with all of that ale? Ah, here, let me help you distribute the food....\
\
'Othor hasn't told you why we came to Pelargir, has he? After the war, I went searching for other wayward Corsairs, and he came along to protect me. Not that I needed the protection, of course, but he's a good sort to have around!\
\
'That's how we all found each other. We may be stranded here with no ships to take us home, but at least we are not alone.'","Jódha has finished cooking your food.\
\
You should talk to her at her food stall in West Pelargir."}},
[166]={nameES="A Curious Hammer",objectivesES={}},
[167]={nameES="Un curioso número de osos",objectivesES={"Los osos deambulan por las colinas de Tyrn Fornech y se pueden encontrar especialmente en Nan Orngon, al este de Ost Forod.\
\
Parr Cortacostilla te ha pedido que le lleves cortes selectos de carne de oso de los osos que deambulan por Tyrn Fornech.","Un curioso número de osos","Parr Cortacostilla está en el antiguo puesto de vigilancia de Ost Forod, en las colinas de Tyrn Fornech, al oeste de Nan Orngon.\
\
Has recogido varios cortes selectos de carne de oso y deberías llevárselos a Parr Cortacostilla.","Lleva cortes selectos de carne de oso a Parr Cortacostilla","Parr Cortacostilla ha decidido que se conformará con unos deliciosos filetes de oso, ya que Evendim parece tener una sorprendente ausencia de jabalíes."}},
[168]={nameES="A Curse Festers Within",objectivesES={"Talk to Endela","A Curse Festers Within","The Huntsman refuses to give up the cursed child. You should intimidate them and scare them away.","Gerech the Addled wishes for you to find a cursed child that roams Langstrand.","Endela has revealed to you the terrible treatment she suffered. You should confront Gerech.\
\
Gerech the Addled can be found in Barad Faen.","Gerech forced your hand and has been defeated. You should tell Endela she is free.\
\
Endela can be found in the bluffs to the south-west.","Scare the huntsman away","Find the cursed child","A woman is being threatened by a huntsman!","You had no choice but to stop Gerech the Addled","The Huntsman has been scared away. You should reason with the cursed child.","Confront Gerech the Addled","Gerech the Addled has asked you to help with a cursed child who seems to be a sign for imminent doom to Anfalas.\
\
The cursed child can be found in the bluffs to the south-west."}},
[169]={nameES="Una maldición que no se ha levantado",objectivesES={"Un saqueador de tumbas angustiado necesita ayuda para levantar una maldición potencialmente mortal... Otra vez.","Ves como disminuye el miedo cuando reemplazas el collar","Vuelve con Nan Mabli","Arnail te ha pedido que devuelvas un collar robado a un túmulo cerca de Dol Ernil.\
\
Dol Ernil está en el noroeste de Cardolan.","Deberías decirle a Nan Mabli que has devuelto el collar robado a los túmulos.\
\
Nan Mabli está cerca de los túmulos al sur de Dol Ernil.","Una maldición que no se ha levantado","Devuelve el collar robado"}},
[170]={nameES="A Curse Unending",objectivesES={}},
[171]={nameES="A Curse for a Coward",objectivesES={}},
[172]={nameES="Un corte por encima",objectivesES={"Winsig can be found in the Mead Hall of Walstow.","Un corte por encima","Talk to Winsig","Winsig wants you to aid her in creating grim standards for Walstow. At Fastred's command, Orc heads shall only occupy one location in the Sutcrofts - the tip of a pike.","Orcs and their heads can be found in the camps of Ufum-mau and Ash Durub, located to the south-west and west of Walstow, respectively."}},
[173]={nameES="Un corte por encima",objectivesES={"Lleva la lucha a Ghasaphâr y sus corsarios. Oblígalos a abandonar su asentamiento en Kan Skûrja en el Cabo de Umbar.","Un grupo de Corsarios establecidos en el Cabo de Umbar ha estado atacando en la Bahía de Belfalas, hostigando barcos mercantes. ¡Llévalos a la lucha!","Derrota al Capitán Corsario Ghasaphâr.","Un corte por encima","Derrota al Capitán Corsario Ghasaphâr","Capitán Corsario Ghasaphâr derrotado"}},
[174]={nameES="A Daily Hunt",objectivesES={}},
[175]={nameES="A Dangerous Dare",objectivesES={"Talk to Glamion at the Hill of Erech","Talk to Thendor at the Hill of Erech","Talk to Berthalend","Find Randis at the Hill of Erech","Randis can be found at the Hill of Erech, in the Blackroot Vale.\
\
Thendor and Glamion believe Randis is trying to fulfil her dare: to touch the Stone of Erech. You should find Randis.","Talk to Randis at the Hill of Erech","Find Thendor, Glamion, and Randis at the Hill of Erech","You have found Thendor and Glamion, but Randis is not with them","Children of the Blackroot Vale often dare each other to approach the Stone of Erech, heedless of old warnings and the true danger that the Ruthless Dead now pose to them.","Randis can be found at the Stone of Erech, in the Blackroot Vale.\
\
You have found Randis near the Stone of Erech, but she is clearly uneasy. You should talk to Randis.","A Dangerous Dare","Thendor and Glamion can be found at the foot of the Hill of Erech near Lancrath, in the Blackroot Vale.\
\
You have found Thendor and Glamion, but Randis does not appear to be with them. You should talk to Thendor and Glamion.","Randis stands before the Stone of Erech, clearly uneasy","The dread upon your heart lessens as the Ruthless Dead vanish!","Berthalend can be found in Lancrath, in the Blackroot Vale.\
\
You have convinced Randis, Thendor, and Glamion to return to Lancrath. You should talk to Berthalend.","Thendor, Glamion, and Randis can be found at the Hill of Erech, to the west of Lancrath in the Blackroot Vale.\
\
Berthalend has asked you to find Thendor, Glamion, and Randis before they endanger themselves at the Hill of Erech."}},
[176]={nameES="Un desvío peligroso",objectivesES={"Spalvi está en el paso estrecho al norte del campamento de Glóin, en las Montañas Nubladas.\
\
Spalvi y sus hermanos fueron atacados por los nómadas Corcur en las Montañas Nubladas, y el enano fue dado por muerto y sus objetos de valor robados. Bingo se ha ofrecido para seguir a los nómadas Corcur hasta Helegrod y reclamar el tesoro de Spalvi, y el enano está esperando para hablar contigo.","Habla con Glóin en su campamento de las Montañas Nubladas, al norte de Rivendel","El enano que Bingo y tú encontrasteis en las Montañas Nubladas se ha recuperado de sus heridas y tiene una nueva aventura para proponeros.","Glóin está en su campamento en las Montañas Nubladas, al norte de Rivendel.\
\
Spalvi ha resultado ser un Duramano, ¡y a hobbit-cuestrado a Bingo! Necesitarás un plan si quieres rescatar al hobbit.","Habla con Spalvi en el paso estrecho","Un desvío peligroso","Habla con Spalvi en el paso estrecho y viaja con él a Helegrod","Spalvi, el nuevo amigo de Bingo, está en el paso estrecho en las Montañas Nubladas, al norte del campamento de Glóin, en el camino hacia la Fuente del Bruinen Norte."}},
[177]={nameES="A Dangerous Lair",objectivesES={}},
[178]={nameES="A Dangerous Mission",objectivesES={"Find Ordgar, who rode north-west","Hildith can be found in the Mead Hall of Grimslade in the Westfold.\
\
You should return to Hildith.","Dunward fears that Hildith's mission for the scouts may prove too dangerous when they are all split up.","Find Winmar, who rode north","The ground is trampled here, as if a great host of horsemen rode southward. Perhaps Cúthsig followed this trail.","(Assist Húnbrit)","A Dangerous Mission","The four scouts rode out west, north-west, north-east, and south-east from Grimslade.\
\
You should search for and assist the four scouts sent out by Hildith to search for Grimbold.","(Assist Gandalf)","Find Húnbrit, who rode east and south","Return to Hildith","The poor man has been killed, not unlike the many who rode out into the Westfold before him in recent times.\
\
It was perilous to venture out alone.","Find Cúthsig, who rode west"}},
[179]={nameES="A Dangerous Path",objectivesES={"Scout the ruins of Drauglad, south-east of the Stone-troll's Glade.","Begin your patrol at Barachen's Camp, which can be found in the hills South of the road as it runs East from the Last Bridge.","Scouted Drauglad","Report to Handarod and tell him the results of your patrol in the Western Trollshaws.","Find the glade occupied by a set of three petrified Stone-trolls. It lies somewhere in the hills North-east of Barachen's camp.","A Dangerous Path","Scouted the Ford of Bruinen","Scout the Ford of Bruinen, which lies South-east of the ruins of Drauglad.","The Rangers have heard rumours that agents of Angmar plan to cut the roads to Rivendell where travellers would pass through the Trollshaws. They have asked you to patrol the areas west of the Ford of Bruinen to provide warning should such an intrusion occur.","Visited Barachen's Camp","Scout the Stone-trolls' Glade","Visit Barachen's Camp","Scouted the Stone-trolls' Glade","Scout the ruins of Drauglad","Scout the Ford of Bruinen"}},
[180]={nameES="A Dangerous Pit",objectivesES={}},
[181]={nameES="Un camino peligroso",objectivesES={"Aragorn está en Rivendel, en una de las habitaciones de invitados de la Casa de Elrond, muy al este, dentro del Bosque de los Trolls.\
\
Ferrod te ha pedido que hables con Aragorn, diciéndote que con dedicación, manteniéndote en los caminos y viajando solo de día, puedes llegar a Rivendel a salvo.","Un camino peligroso","Habla con Aragorn en Rivendel","Ferrod te ha pedido que hagas el peligroso viaje a Rivendel para hablar con Aragorn."}},
[182]={nameES="Un camino peligroso",objectivesES={"Ofrith can be found within the trader's outpost, west along the road from Elthengels.\
\
Runald has made it safely to the trader's outpost and has taken the road south. He has asked you to give his thanks to Ofrith for his support.","Thank Ofrith at the trader's outpost for his help","Un camino peligroso","Help escort Runald's family to safety","Runald and his family await at the southern entrance to the village of Elthengels.\
\
Runald has asked you to help escort his family safely along the first section of their journey west.","Runald and his family have prepared their waggon, said their farewells, and are ready to begin their dangerous journey south to Edoras."}},
[183]={nameES="A Dangerous Trap",objectivesES={"You should return to Thurindol, who can be found at a small Ranger outpost hidden in the Slag-hills.","Thurindol has traps to trip up enemies within the Towers of the Teeth.","Return to Thurindol","Good places to hide traps can be found within the Towers of the Teeth.\
\
You should hide traps in rubble piles within the Towers of the Teeth.","A Dangerous Trap"}},
[184]={nameES="A Daring Escape",objectivesES={"Stanric is in the lock-house.\
\
You should free Stanric from his bonds.","Talk to Stanric","Help Stanric take back Stangard","A Daring Escape","Stanric is now in the Mead Hall, alone, in his proper place.\
\
You should speak with Stanric once more.","Stanric is alive, defying the lies of Sithric. It is clear that Stanric must be freed at once, so that justice may be done for this betrayal."}},
[185]={nameES="Un plan audaz",objectivesES={"Glóin tiene una idea de dónde los Duramano se han podido llevar a Bingo, y piensa que deberías intentar asaltar la fortaleza y rescatar al hobbit.","Escuchas algunos gritos provenientes de la parte sur de Gabilazan. ¿Es allí donde mantienen cautivo a Bingo?","Habla con Spalvi Duramano junto al agujero en la montaña","Encuentra el patio en la parte sur de Gabilazan","Spalvi Duramano está cerca del profundo y oscuro agujero justo al norte de Gabilazan, en las Montañas Nubladas.","Deja caer las provisiones de Gabilzan por el profundo y oscuro agujero","Los Duramano pueden encontrarse en la fortaleza de Gabilazan, en el Risco Alto de las Montañas Nubladas.\
\
Glóin cree que puedes averiguar dónde retienen los Duramano a Bingo Boffin si los atacas en la fortaleza de Gabilazan.","Spalvi Duramano está cerca de un profundo y oscuro agujero en la ladera de la montaña","Bingo estaba siendo retenido en una jaula en Gabilazan, ¡pero de alguna forma ha conseguido escapar!\
\
Deberías buscar en las laderas al norte de Gabilazan cualquier signo de la huida de Bingo.","Si Bingo ha sobrevido a la caída, estos suministros deberían ayudarlo... si no le caen encima.","Un plan audaz","Busca en las laderas al norte de Gabilazan cualquier señal de la fuga de Bingo","Spalvi Duramano está cerca de un profundo y oscuro agujero en la ladera de la montaña, justo al norte de Gabilazan. ¿Qué historia tendrá que contarte?","Spalvi Duramano ha cambiado de parecer y desea ayudarte a rescatar a Bingo.\
\
Spalvi ayudó a liberar a Bingo de Gabilazan, pero el hobbit cayó por un agujero durante la huida. El Duramano quiere ahora ayudarte a salvar a Bingo, y piensa que puedes conseguir fardos de comida y botellas de agua de Gabilazan para dejarlas caer por el agujero hacia Bingo, si el hobbit ha sobrevivido a la caída.","Habla con Spalvi Duramano junto al profundo y oscuro agujero","Spalvi Duramano está cerca del profundo y oscuro agujero justo al norte de Gabilazan.\
\
Has conseguido provisiones para Bingo, y deberías dejarlas caer por el agujero donde cayó, en caso de que el hobbit sobreviviera a la caída."}},
[186]={nameES="Un rescate audaz",objectivesES={"Gadaric Mascador se encuentra en La Posada Abandonada, al noroeste de las ruinas.\
\
Leofwenna te sugirió que fueras a verle, para que te recompensara por tu ayuda.","Leofwenna quedó atrapada en las ruinas del sureste cuando los trasgos tomaron el campamento de los Eglain. Desde entonces se ha estado escondiendo entre las ruinas y necesita ayuda.","Has llevado a Leofwenna a un lugar seguro","El arco que marca el final de las ruinas se encuentra al oeste.\
\
Leofwenna te ha pedido que la escoltes hasta la salida de las ruinas, para llevarla a la libertad. Está en la parte este, más allá del primer campamento trasgo al sureste de La Posada Abandonada.","Un rescate audaz","Habla con Leofwenna","Ve a hablar con Gadaric Mascador"}},
[187]={nameES="Un día oscuro",objectivesES={"Has obtenido Cerveza del Verraco del Páramo","Recoge una jarra de Cerveza del Verraco del Páramo","Devuelve la Cerveza del Verraco del Páramo antes de que se acabe el tiempo.","Un día oscuro","Recoge Cerveza del Verraco del Páramo en el Poney Pisador","Lleva la Cerveza del Verraco del Páramo a Lófi","Se te ha encargado completar una entrega a un miembro de la Liga de las Posadas que se ha quedado varado lejos del festival esta temporada.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu bitácora de misiones cuando termine el festival actual. </rgb>","Has obtenido una jarra de Cerveza del Verraco del Páramo","La Cerveza del Verraco del Páramo se puede encontrar en el Poney Pisador de Bree.\
\
Deberías pedirle a Cebadilla Mantecona una muestra de Cerveza del Verraco del Páramo.","La Posada del Poney Pisador se encuentra en Bree, lejos al sur de Forochel. Lófi está en Zigilgund, en Forochel, lejos al norte de las Tierras de Bree.\
\
Lófi te ha contado su triste historia: está sin la cerveza que necesita para completar el Desafío de la Liga de las Posadas. Te pidió si podrías traerle la cerveza que necesita, \\qCerveza del Verraco del Páramo\\q, que solo se puede encontrar en la Posada del Poney Pisador en Bree."}},
[188]={nameES="A Dark Flight",objectivesES={"Echil can be found in the Circle of Death in Minas Morgul.\
\
You have retrieved many arrows from slain merrevail and should now deliver them to Echil.","A Dark Flight","Deliver the stained arrows to Echil in the Circle of Death","Echil's men witnessed Lhaereth's merrevail abandon the Dead City and seemingly, her alliance with Ugrukhôr.","Arrows can be found embedded in slain merrevail in the Circle of Death and the Circle of Despair.\
\
Echil has asked you to retrieve spent arrows from slain merrevail, so his men might be better prepared for the battles ahead."}},
[189]={nameES="A Dark Gift",objectivesES={}},
[190]={nameES="A Dark Pact",objectivesES={"Malthellam can be found outside his home in Morlad.\
\
Malthellam has asked you to rally with Gúrion at the Hill of Erech in hopes of exposing the identity of the strange Man from Tarlang's Crown.","Talk to Malthellam in Morlad","Talk to Malthellam","Steward Malthellam seeks to expose and oust the strange invader from Tarlang's Crown before he can rally the Dead to his cause.","Malthellam can be found outside his home in Morlad in Blackroot Vale.\
\
You encountered Azruthor, a Black Númenórean sorcerer and one of the Heirs of Castamir. His grim task came to fruition, but he fled back to Tarlang's Crown.","DNT -- will not be seen","A Dark Pact"}},
[191]={nameES="Una Broma Oscura",objectivesES={"Lleva la falsa Cerveza del Verraco del Páramo a Lófi, en Forochel","Lófi se encuentra en Zigilgund, en Forochel, muy al norte, en las tierras heladas.\
\
Deberías llevarle la falsa Cerveza del Verraco del Páramo, que en realidad es Cerveza Lengua de Sapo disfrazada, antes de que sea demasiado tarde.","El Tronco Flotante se encuentra en los Ranales, en la Comarca.\
\
Deberías conseguir una pinta de Cerveza Lengua de Sapo de Ponto Hopsbloom, el tabernero de El Tronco Flotante.","Una Broma Oscura","Has recogido la falsa Cerveza del Verraco del Páramo","Recoge la falsa Cerveza del Verraco del Páramo en El Tronco Flotante"}},
[192]={nameES="Un oscuro tesoro",objectivesES={"Un oscuro tesoro","Derrota a la capitana Shêndi Ojogris","Se han reportado grandes tesoros enterrados en una isla poco transitada. Se te ha encomendado la tarea de recuperar el tesoro para ayudar a la restauración de Umbar.","Encuentra y derrota a la capitana Shêndi Ojo Gris","Encuentra y recoge el tesoro","Has derrotado a la capitana Shêndi Ojo Gris"}},
[193]={nameES="A Dark and Lonely Forest",objectivesES={"A Dark and Lonely Forest","Saeradan is at the Rohirrim scout-camp.\
\
Andreg told you to continue on to the Rohirrim scout-camp and let Saeradan know that he is scouting the wood to the south and east.","Andreg has accompanied you for some distance. Now the time has come to part ways.\
\
You should speak with Andreg.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Advancing this quest will no longer allow you to summon Andreg and will cancel any quests bestowed by him that are currently underway.</rgb>","Amlan told you to summon Andreg and accompany him to the Rohirrim scout-camp to meet with Saeradan.\
\
If you become separated from Andreg, you may summon him using the bird-whistle Amlan gave you.","Talk to Andreg","Talk to Saeradan at the Rohirrim scout-camp","The Rangers Saeradan, Amlan, and Andreg have tracked Gwyllion, the Old Woman of the Mountain, from the Windfells in Enedwaith to the Gravenwood of Dunland.","Aid Andreg with Eyes in the Forest"}},
[194]={nameES="A Dark and Lonely Forest",objectivesES={"A Dark and Lonely Forest","Saeradan is at the Rohirrim scout-camp.\
\
Andreg told you to continue on to the Rohirrim scout-camp and let Saeradan know that he is scouting the wood to the south and east.","Amlan told you to summon Andreg and accompany him to the Rohirrim scout-camp to meet with Saeradan.\
\
If you become separated from Andreg, you may summon him using the bird-whistle Amlan gave you.","Talk to Andreg","Talk to Saeradan at the Rohirrim scout-camp","The Rangers Saeradan, Amlan, and Andreg have tracked Gwyllion, the Old Woman of the Mountain, from the Windfells in Enedwaith to the Gravenwood of Dunland.","Andreg has accompanied you for some distance. Now the time has come to part ways.\
\
You should speak with Andreg.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Advancing this quest will no longer allow you to summon Andreg.</rgb>","Aid Andreg with Eyes in the Forest"}},
[195]={nameES="Un camino oscuro y secreto",objectivesES={"Ruidhriel está acampada cerca de la Colina Quemada, al noroeste de Echad Dúnann. Limlaer se encuentra a lo largo del camino, al suroeste de Echad Dúnann.\
\
Rinneldor te ha pedido que hables de nuevo con Ruidhriel y Limlaer para averiguar qué hay que hacer para confundir el rastro de la Compañía.","Habla con Rinneldor en Echad Dúnann","Rinneldor se encuentra en Echad Dúnann, al sureste de la Comida Quemada y al noreste del puesto de Limlaer.\
\
Debes regresar a Rinneldor con noticias de tu éxito.","Aunque la Compañía intentó cruzar la Puerta del Cuerno Rojo, se vieron obligados a retroceder. Tampoco había ninguna señal de que se dirigieran hacia el Paso de Rohan, lo que dejaba a Rinneldor con una sola opción: Moria.","Ayuda a Ruidhriel","Un camino oscuro y secreto","Ayuda a Limlaer"}},
[196]={nameES="A Dash of This and That",objectivesES={"Taskmaster Gukthor admits hating the taste of gruel, but has found that the seeds the rat-folk use to grow their leaf adds a nice bite to the mash he uses in his gruel. He has asked that you collect ten seeds for the evening meal.","A Dash of This and That","The rat-folk living south of Dâr-gazag along the river grow a plant that can be crushed to make a tasty spice.\
\
Taskmaster Gukthor waits for you to return with the brittle-leaf seeds.","Return to Taskmaster Gukthor at Dâr-gazag"}},
[197]={nameES="A Day Without Honey",objectivesES={"Honey jars can be found in Limlók.\
\
You should fill up the empty honey jars.","Trygvar, son of Runerik and Yrsa, has not eaten honey in over a day.","Honey can be found at the forest's edge in the eastern reaches of the Floodfells.\
\
You should gather honey for Limlók.","A Day Without Honey"}},
[198]={nameES="Una Flor Mortal",objectivesES={"La Flor de Skorgrím florece a lo largo del sendero que conduce a los Túneles de Piedramusgo, al noroeste del Patio de Frerin.\
\
Destruye las flores venenosas, para que no se propaguen por la ladera de la montaña.","Erynwen se encuentra en el centro del Patio de Frerin.\
\
Has destruido algunas plantas de la Flor de Skorgrím, como pidió Erynwen.","Una planta venenosa llamada \\qFlor de Skorgrím\\q amenaza la vida silvestre de Ered Luin. Sin alguien que detenga su propagación, la vida de muchas criaturas podría estar en riesgo.","Una Flor Mortal"}},
[199]={nameES="A Deadly Thirst",objectivesES={"There must be a source of fresh water somewhere in the Orc-mines.\
\
Edhere has asked you to find a source of fresh water for the miners who are dying of thirst.","Find a source of fresh water in the mine","Talk to Edhere in the Orc-mines","The slaves in the mining pit dare not drink the terribly polluted and poisonous water given to them by the Orcs.","Edhere is in the Orc-mines.\
\
You should return to Edhere and let him know that you have found fresh water.","You have found some fresh water","A Deadly Thirst","The exhausted miners can be found in the Orc-mines.\
\
You should bring the fresh water to the exhausted miners as Edhere requested."}},
[200]={nameES="A Deadly Threat",objectivesES={}},
[201]={nameES="Un trato que salió mal",objectivesES={"La Posada Abandonada se encuentra al suroeste del campamento Trasgo.\
\
Pengail te ha pedido que le ayudes a escapar de los Trasgos y que le lleves a la Posada.","Pengail dice que tenía la intención de comerciar con los Trasgos, cumpliendo sus obligaciones con Thomas Cardoso en Bree. Los Trasgos lo traicionaron y lo capturaron, y ahora planean venderlo a los orcos acampados en el Paso de Moscagua.","Un trato que salió mal","Has rescatado a Pengail","Habla con Pengail","Anlaf el Despojado se encuentra en la Posada Abandonada.\
\
Después de que le ayudaras a escapar y a encontrar la espada de su padre, Pengail te dijo que Anlaf el Despojado tiene los objetos de valor que dejó en su habitación. Te pidió que le informaras de que ya es libre y que te ofrecía una recompensa entre sus pertenencias."}},
[202]={nameES="Un trato que salió mal",objectivesES={"Habla con Erfith","Erfith se encuentra en una colina junto al camino cerca de la frontera de Ered Luin con la Comarca Allende.\
\
Has liberado con éxito a varios compañeros de Erfith de los trasgos en Lhúngobel. Debes hablar con Erfith.","Un trato que salió mal","Lhúngobel se encuentra junto al río Lune en el límite noroeste de la Comarca Allende.\
\
Erfith te ha pedido que liberes a sus compañeros que fueron capturados por los trasgos en Lhúngobel. Los Duramano se encuentran en las ruinas de Lhúngobel.","Después de intentar escapar de los malvados designios de Skorgrím Duramano huyendo de Ered Luin, Erfith y los suyos fueron atrapados por los trasgos en Lhúngobel."}},
[203]={nameES="Una tarea funesta",objectivesES={"Una tarea funesta","Se pueden encontrar tumularios entre los montículos y túmulos de los Edain, en la parte oriental del Haudh Lin.\
\
Glamír te ha pedido que destruyas los tumularios malignos del Haudh Lin.","La parte oriental del Haudh Lin sufre una terrible amenaza; siniestros tumularios merodean los antiguos montículos de los Edain, animados por espíritus maléficos.","Glamír espera en la ruina al sur de las Aguas Lúgubres, dentro del bosque de la parte occidental del Haudh Lin.\
\
Viajaste hasta los montículos y túmulos de los Edain en Haudh Lin y derrotaste a muchos tumularios."}},
[204]={nameES="A Decision Must Be Made",objectivesES={"Éothain is in Aldburg in the Eastfold.\
\
Arcil asked you to speak with Éothain and inform him of the decision, but also to deliver an apology.","Arcil has decided to deal with one Orc-threat at a time. Upon your mission to scout the Orc-camps you determined that the White Hand Orcs number far fewer than the unknown tribe.","Arcil is in the Mead Hall of Aldburg.\
\
Éothain has accepted Arcil's apology and asked you to deliver his response.","Talk to Arcil","A Decision Must Be Made","Talk to Éothain"}},
[205]={nameES="Un lugar profundo",objectivesES={"Regresa con Túbi Puñogrueso","Dagfinn está en Shemeldurj, en el noroeste de la Gran Excavación, cerca del Umbral de Durin.\
\
Debes decirle a Dagfinn que no encontraste nada prometedor en ningún lugar de Shemeldurj.","Dagfinn se fue a explorar Shemeldurj, una antigua sala de Moria.\
\
Debes buscar a Dagfinn en Shemeldurj para aliviar la preocupación de Túbi por su amigo.","Dagfinn te ha pedido ayuda para desenterrar antiguos tesoros enterrados","Un lugar profundo","Túbi Puñogrueso está en la cima de las grandes escaleras del Umbral de Durin, al oeste de la Gran Excavación.\
\
Debes regresar con Túbi Puñogrueso y contarle sobre la infructuosa búsqueda de Dagfinn.","Se pueden encontrar montones de escombros prometedores alrededor de Shemeldurj.\
\
Debes hurgar en varios montones de escombros prometedores para buscar tesoros antiguos.","Dagfinn está decidido a continuar su búsqueda frenética","Busca a Dagfinn en Shemeldurj","Dagfinn ha desaparecido para explorar la sala de Shemeldurj en la Gran Excavación.","Le explicas que has revisado muchos rincones de Shemeldurj, pero no encontraste nada prometedor, y quizás sería prudente que todos regresaran al Umbral de Durin.\
\
'¡No! No puedo creerlo. He atesorado ese mapa toda mi vida. No puedo aceptar que me haya llevado hasta aquí solo para encontrar esta sala vacía.'","Dile a Dagfinn que Shemeldurj parece estar tan vacío como parece"}},
[206]={nameES="Una reflexión profunda",objectivesES={"Regresa con Túbi Puñogrueso","La Cámara de la Reflexión Profunda está al este, a través del túnel desde el Umbral de Durin, luego al sur.\
\
Debes buscar en la Cámara de la Reflexión Profunda cualquier reliquia de interés.","Encuentra la Cámara de la Reflexión Profunda","El capullo está en la Cámara de la Reflexión Profunda, al oeste de la Gran Excavación.\
\
Debes buscar en el capullo cualquier cosa que pueda ser de valor para los enanos.","Ves un curioso capullo cerca del fondo de la cámara","Una reflexión profunda","Has derrotado a la araña que habitaba esta cámara","Túbi Puñogrueso tiene curiosidad por cualquier reliquia que pueda quedar en la Cámara de la Reflexión Profunda cerca del Umbral de Durin.","Túbi Puñogrueso está en la cima de las escaleras del Umbral de Durin.\
\
Debes regresar con Túbi Puñogrueso y contarle sobre tu búsqueda.","Examina el capullo"}},
[207]={nameES="Una defensa en la oscuridad",objectivesES={"Habla con Andyri y viaja a las cuevas de los trolls de piedra","Andyri está en Lin Giliath, en Meluinen, en las Quebradas del Norte.\
\
La elfa Andyri ha pedido tu ayuda y está esperando para hablar contigo.","Habla con Andyri en Lin Giliath","Andyri está en Lin Giliath, en Meluinen, en las Quebradas del Norte.\
\
Te han dicho que Andyri de Lin Giliath está buscando Vigilantes para una tarea importante.","Andyri está en Lin Giliath, en Meluinen, en las Quebradas del Norte.\
\
Has demostrado ser alguien valioso en la oscuridad de las cuevas de los trolls de piedra y ahora debes hablar con Andyri.","Una defensa en la oscuridad","La capacidad de un Vigilante para resistir grandes peligros no puede enseñarse: se obtiene mediante la dureza de una batalla desesperada."}},
[208]={nameES="A Defence of Marigolds",objectivesES={"Violed Isbrun is a good friend of Maur Tulhau's most respected farmer, Iago Glennudh. She is well-known for her knowledge of ways to protect gardens from pests.","Violed Isbrun's garden is in Maur Tulhau.\
\
You should bring the marigolds you collected back to Violed's garden and plant them.","Violed Isbrun is in Maur Tulhau.\
\
You should speak with Violed Isbrun again and let her know that you have done as she asked.","Marigolds can be found throughout the Gloomglens.\
\
Violed Isbrun has asked you to gather marigolds for her. She uses the flowers to defend her garden against small pests.","A Defence of Marigolds","Talk to Violed Isbrun at Maur Tulhau"}},
[209]={nameES="A Defensive Strike",objectivesES={"Your scouting mission to Eshadûr revealed that the Ordâkhai are preparing waggons full of explosive powder for an attack.","Talk to Ningêna at the Wrackwade","You have successfully destroyed the Ordâkhai powder-laden waggons in Eshadûr. You should now travel to the Wrackwade and talk to Ningêna, the Dumûri captain. The Wrackwade is a river crossing east of Iridír.","A Defensive Strike","The Ordâkhai waggons in Eshadûr, south of the Ikorbân River, must be destroyed to protect Dumûri control of the Wrackwade."}},
[210]={nameES="A Delivery for the Cooper",objectivesES={"Miruhir has asked you to move recovered flotsam from where it is stacked by the fence to Tregeth, who waits in town.\
\
Collect recovered flotsam.","Talk to Tregeth","One of Iáphel's coopers awaits a delivery of recovered flotsam.","Pick up the stack of planks in Iáphel","You have delivered the planks to Tregeth!","A Delivery for the Cooper"}},
[211]={nameES="A Delivery of No Importance",objectivesES={"A Delivery of No Importance","Mekhnet has plans to send a gift and a \\qgift,\\q but can't make the trip herself.","Talk to Lúka"}},
[212]={nameES="A Demon of the Mind",objectivesES={"Talk to Atta and complete 'Old and Mad'","Atta can be found in Hultvís.\
\
Ríkmar has told you to speak to a Woodman named Atta, the eldest man in Hultvís, who has refused to leave the settlement since the days of his youth.","Talk to Atta and complete 'Spirits of the Taken'","Atta can be found in Hultvís.\
\
You have learned more of Ubb from the children of Hultvís, and you have banished a number of sorrowful spirits in Avabárg. You should return to Atta.","Talk to Atta and complete 'Skulking the Wood'","Talk to Atta","Long met with derision by some of the people of Hultvís, Atta insists that he speaks true of the old legends and fears the return of a terrible creature that once haunted the vales.","Atta can be found in Hultvís.\
\
You have helped Atta by laying traps in the woods outside Hultvís. You should return to Atta and see if he is more willing to speak of what troubles him.","Atta can be found in Hultvís.\
\
Atta has told you of a terrible creature that once haunted the vales, but he dares not to speak its true name. You should aid him with another task and speak to the children of Hultvís to learn more of the creature called Ubb.","Atta can be found in Hultvís.\
\
Long met with derision and pity by his own people, Atta has refused to speak of what troubles him for many years. Perhaps if you aid him and earn his trust, he will be more willing to share his tale.","A Demon of the Mind"}},
[213]={nameES="A Den of Ill Intent",objectivesES={"The defender at Minlos beacon tells you that trouble is brewing at Tumladen.","Defeated Zagrazg","Talk to Cúdor","Cúdor has informed you of an Orc party which has begun to corrupt the bears of Grafeleg.\
\
Grafeleg can be found north of Tumladen.","You should tell Cúdor that the threat in Grafeleg has been addressed.\
\
Cúdor can be found in Tumladen.","A Den of Ill Intent","Defeat Zagrazg","The defender at Minlos beacon has asked you to speak to Cúdor in Tumladen.\
\
Cúdor can be found at Tumladen to the west of Minlos beacon."}},
[214]={nameES="Una cáscara desecada: el relato del fanático",objectivesES={"Todo lo que queda de Igash es una cáscara seca y repugnante, como si su cuerpo no fuera más que un envoltorio. Has recogido un pequeño fragmento de esta cáscara, que podría estudiarse más a fondo. Quizá deberías entregárselo a Narfi en la Sala Vigesimoprimera.","Pálmar se encuentra en Anazârmekhem.\
\
Narfi pudo darte muy poca información sobre la extraña cáscara, pero cree que su agente, Pálmar —destinado en Anazârmekhem— podría saber algo sobre el extraño fuego en los ojos de Igash.","Lleva la cáscara a Narfi en la Sala Vigesimoprimera","Habla con Pálmar en Anazârmekhem","Igash parecía ser distinto a otros orcos. Un fuego sobrenatural ardía tras sus ojos y, cuando cayó ante tu arma, dejó algo tras de sí; esta cáscara es ahora motivo de inquietud.","Una cáscara desecada: el relato del fanático","Narfi se encuentra en la Sala Vigesimoprimera.\
\
Has descubierto que Igash era algo más que un orco común y buscas respuestas a estas nuevas incertidumbres."}},
[215]={nameES="A Devastated Mother",objectivesES={}},
[216]={nameES="Una diferencia de opiniones",objectivesES={"Encuentra al Frontero capturado en Taerhad","Habla con el Frontero Halconherboso en el Toro Bramador","Libera al Frontero capturado en Taerhad\
\
Derrota al teniente de Zarquino","El Frontero Halconherboso se encuentra dentro del Toro Bramador en Quiebra Larga, en la Comarca Allende.\
\
Tras liberar al Frontero Halconherboso de los semiorcos en Taerhad, te ha pedido que te reúnas con él en El Toro Bramador. Debes hablar con el Frontero Halconherboso.","Mientras intentas liberar al Frontero, ¡escuchas una voz áspera detrás de ti!","Hay un Frontero capturado en alguna parte de Taerhad.\
\
Con la esperanza de que llamará la atención del teniente de Zarquino, Mal Matorrales te ha pedido que liberes a un Frontero capturado por los semiorcos en Taerhad.","El Frontero capturado se encuentra en lo alto de Taerhad en la Comarca Allende.\
\
Has encontrado al Frontero capturado en Taerhad. Debes intentar liberarlo y mantenerte alerta ante cualquier signo del teniente de Zarquino.","El Frontero Halconherboso se encuentra en Taerhad en la Comarca Allende.\
\
Has derrotado al teniente de Zarquino. Debes hablar con el Frontero Halconherboso y ayudar a liberarle de los semiorcos de Taerhad.","Habla con el Frontero Halconherboso en Taerhad","Una diferencia de opiniones","En lo alto de Taerhad, ves a un hobbit solitario encerrado en una gran jaula","Tras tratar con el Jefe y Zarquino, Mal Matorrales se encuentra atrapado entre dos líderes diferentes... y no le gusta ninguno."}},
[217]={nameES="Una diferencia de opiniones",objectivesES={"Una diferencia de opiniones","Talk to Yared","There are no rock-scrapers in this crate","The rock-scrapers demanded by Shegai will be in one of the crates of tools near Yared in Furukzahar.","Shegai knows that the dwarves who report to him have taken to playing games instead of working.","Yared stands by the stacks of crates in north-western Furukzahar.","Yared is by the crates of tools in north-western Furukzahar.","Search crates of tools until you find the rock-scrapers"}},
[218]={nameES="A Different Breed",objectivesES={"Sahard resides at his farm just east of the Faldham mead hall.\
\
Nothwulf believes that Sahard, an elder of Faldham, may be able to shed light on the reports of mysterious beasts seen to the east.","Sahard resides at his farm just east of the Faldham mead hall.\
\
Sahard wishes to discuss his plan with you.","Speak to Sahard","The láthbears seem to reside among the trees to the east of Sahard's farm.\
\
Sahard has given you food to be used as bait for luring out láthbears, so that you might take a closer look.","Speak to Sahard about the strange creatures","Inhere has been watching the láthbears at the northern edge of the woods.\
\
Sahard has asked you to seek out the Rohirrim, Inhere, to see what he may have discovered.","Speak to Inhere at the northern edge of the trees","A Different Breed","Some curious láthbears seem to be drawn out by your bait","Nothwulf has been disturbed by the crofter's reports and sightings of strange creatures lurking in the woods east of Faldham."}},
[219]={nameES="A Different Flora",objectivesES={"A Different Flora","Rhadrog can be found in Haerondir.\
\
You should speak with Rhadrog.","Burn the hauntreek you collected in the braziers found around Haerondir.\
\
The hauntreek will cause the fire to burn a strange blue colour.","Rhadrog has asked you to collect hauntreek from the ruins of Nuiharn, and then burn them in braziers around Haerondir.","‘I hear Anborn is sending you to Nuiharn. While you're there, can you do me a favour? There is a shrub that grows amongst the ruins, silver-coloured and scraggly.  We call it hauntreek.  It is valuable to us because it glows an eerie blue colour when burned. Why do we want that? I'll explain when you return.\
\
'Gather some hauntreek for me, and burn them in the braziers around Haerondir. The colour of the flames will change before your eyes!’","Hauntreek can be found in the ruins of Nuiharn, north-west of Haerondir.\
\
Collect hauntreek for Rhadrog.","Speak with Rhadrog"}},
[220]={nameES="Un Recuerdo Distinto de Rivendel",objectivesES={"Recoge el falso Blanco de Dorwinion de Sogadan, en Rivendel","Sogadan el Vinatero se encuentra en Rivendel, en la región del Bosque de los Trolls.\
\
Deberías comprar Tinto de Dorwinion a Sogadan, pero entregarlo a Lendasil haciéndolo pasar por Blanco de Dorwinion.","Has recogido el falso Blanco de Dorwinion","Lleva el falso Blanco de Dorwinion a Lendasil, en Edhelion","Un Recuerdo Distinto de Rivendel","Lendasil se encuentra en las Ruinas de Edhelion, en las Montañas Azules, esperando probar el Blanco de Dorwinion.\
\
Solo tienes vino falso para darle... en realidad, vino tinto. Deberías llevárselo de inmediato."}},
[221]={nameES="A Different Sort of Fishing",objectivesES={"Waterlogged crates can be found in the canals and in the harbour surrounding the Rovers' Yard in the Sail-haven of Umbar Baharbêl.\
\
Galyat has asked you to retrieve waterlogged crates that have sunken into the canals and harbour of the Sail-haven.","Deliver the waterlogged crates to Galyat","A Different Sort of Fishing","In the bustle of commerce on the streets, markets, and piers of Umbar Baharbêl, it is not uncommon for goods to accidentally end up in a canal or at the bottom of the harbour of the Sail-haven.","Galyat can be found near the Rovers' Yard to the east of the Harbour-warden's Tower in the Sail-haven of Umbar Baharbêl.\
\
You have retrieved a number of waterlogged crates from the canals and harbour of the Sail-haven in Umbar Baharbêl. You should deliver them to Galyat."}},
[222]={nameES="A Different Sort of Treasure",objectivesES={"Dolvir can be found on a hilltop to the east of Edhellond.\
\
You have destroyed a huge supply of Corsair ale, and should return to Dolvir with news of your success.","A Different Sort of Treasure","Barrels of ale can be found on the three Corsair ships moored at Edhellond.\
\
Dolvir has asked you to burn barrels of ale in hopes of shattering the morale of the Corsairs.","DNT -- will not be seen","Talk to Dolvir","Dolvir of Ost Lontir seeks to strike a harsh blow against the Corsairs of Umbar by destroying their supply of ale."}},
[223]={nameES="A Difficult Step",objectivesES={"Ulishár told you he was captured by the Ordâkhai in this area, and for him every step west is more difficult than the last.","Meet with Ulishár on the eastern bank of the dry Usâl River in An Shêru","Ulishár chuckles as the brigand escapes","A Difficult Step","Ulishár has prevented a brigand from escaping Zakhûr: a brigand with a familiar face.","Ulishár is outside Zakhûr.","Talk to Ulishár outside Zakhûr","Mashdagâl is outside Zakhûr.","Ulishár suggested that the two of you meet up at the cross-road south-west of Gadim-ûn.","Defeat brigands at Zakhûr (4/5)","Ulishár stands here.","Ulishár stands beside the dry river-bed","Ulishár has asked for the sword.","Talk to Ulishár on the western bank of the dry Usâl River in An Shêru","Ulishár stands by the eastern bank of the dry Usâl River in An Shêru.","Ulishár stands beside the road, gazing eastward","Talk to Ulishár at the cross-road south-west of Gadim-ûn","Meet with Ulishár at the cross-road south-west of Gadim-ûn","Pick up Mashdagâl's sword to accept his surrender","Talk to Ulishár on the eastern bank of the dry Usâl River in An Shêru","Mashdagâl breaks into a run!","North-east of Zakhûr, Mashdagâl has surrendered his sword to you.","Talk to Mashdagâl outside Zakhûr","Cross to the western bank of the dry Usâl River in An Shêru","Ulishár stands beside the road, gazing eastward.","Mashdagâl moves suddenly, attempting to escape!","Ulishár stands by the western bank of the dry Usâl River in An Shêru.","You hear Ulishár calling for you from outside Zakhûr to the north-east","Mashdagâl casts down his rusty blade","Ulishár spotted a camp of brigands to the east, and he believes you should oppose their plans before you continue westward.","Ulishár is ready to meet you on the western bank of the dry Usâl River in An Shêru. He pointed out a place to the north-west where you might climb out of the channel.","Ulishár asked to meet you on the eastern bank of the dry Usâl River in An Shêru.","Hand the sword to Ulishár","Ulishár follows you across the river-bed, breathing deeply as he arrives","Ulishár asks to see the surrendered sword"}},
[224]={nameES="Una Necesidad Urgente",objectivesES={"Kol está en Gabilshathûr, muy al oeste de los nidos de dragonzuelo.\
\
Has contado un buen número de nidos de dragonzuelo y ahora deberías regresar con Kol con la información que has reunido.","Una Necesidad Urgente","Hay nidos de dragonzuelo muy al este de Gabilshathûr, en el valle de Dolroth.\
\
Kol te ha pedido que recolectes huevos de dragonzuelo para complementar los víveres incomibles que ya proporcionaste.","Kol te dijo que las patas de norboglir y lenguas de babosa que trajiste eran repugnantes... demasiado repugnantes incluso para que un enano desesperado las coma.","Lleva los huevos de dragonzuelo a Kol"}},
[225]={nameES="A Dire Request",objectivesES={}},
[226]={nameES="A Disarming Blow",objectivesES={}},
[227]={nameES="A Disarming Strategy",objectivesES={}},
[228]={nameES="A Discerning Eye",objectivesES={"Govach has asked you to find his friend Dardreg at the lumber camp north of Melgobas.","A Discerning Eye","You found Dardreg at the lumber camp in Anfalas.\
\
You should talk to him.","That must be Dardreg!","Talk to Dardreg","A carpenter in Melgobas is fretting over the fact that his friend hasn't arrived yet.","Find Dardreg at the lumber camp"}},
[229]={nameES="Una glándula enfermiza",objectivesES={"Veúlfur se encuentra en la Sala Vigesimoprimera.\
\
Tras descubrir una glándula enferma en el Gurvand, la extrajiste y ahora debes entregársela a alguien que pueda comprender mejor su significado.","Descubriste esta glándula cuando el Gurvand fue abatido. Puede que a Veúlfur, en la Sala Vigesimoprimera, le interese este hallazgo.","Una glándula enfermiza","Cuando el Gurvand cayó, viste una llaga hinchada cubierta de lo que parecía ser una supuración fúngica que brotaba de su carne.","Lleva la glándula a Veúlfur en la Sala Vigesimoprimera"}},
[230]={nameES="Un tío lejano",objectivesES={"Donaith está en algún lugar muy al este de Aughaire, mucho más allá de Rammas Deluon.\
\
Eilig y sus hermanos en Aughaire desean que encuentres a su tío, perdido desde hace mucho tiempo.","Un tío lejano","Rammas Deluon impide que los hermanos Eilig, Machar y Torquil vean a su tío Donaith, que vive muy al este de Angmar."}},
[231]={nameES="A Distant Wailing",objectivesES={"A Daegul stands upon the island in the northern Isingmere lake.\
\
You should speak with the Daegul.","Search for whatever may have killed the man","Speak with the Daegul","You have found an empty fishing village on the edge of the Isingmere lake","Investigate the tower standing upon the island","Whatever killed the man on the road in the northern Writhendowns is likely nearby.\
\
You should search to the south, towards the Isingmere lake.","A tower stands alone upon an island in the northern Isingmere lake, filling you with dread when you look upon it.\
\
You should investigate the tower upon the island.","A Daegul beckons you....","A Distant Wailing","Something unnatural has killed this man upon this very road. He bears no marks or injuries. It appears that he has fallen where he stood.\
\
An eerie mist encircles him, and a faint wailing can be heard nearby....","Something unnatural has killed a man upon the road in the northern Writhendowns."}},
[232]={nameES="A Disturbance at the Gate",objectivesES={"Gárwig says nothing, his face like stone.\
\
Núrzum has truly crushed all that the old Reeve holds dear, and Wildermore seems as if it is ready to shatter at another blow.\
\
The White Hand is winning in this land....","A Disturbance at the Gate","Speak with Gárwig","Help Gárwig","Gárwig wishes to debate the courses of action Wildermore must take regarding the recent White Hand attacks.\
\
You should speak with Gárwig.","Gárwig is in the Mead Hall of Forlaw.\
\
You should speak with Gárwig.","Gárwig must decide what to do about Wildermore's dire situation."}},
[233]={nameES="Un asunto inquietante",objectivesES={"El comerciante Nithi está perturbado por el cráneo que le has traído de las tumbas. Piensa que este oscuro asunto debe ser investigado, pero no por él.","Lleva el cráneo a Glamir","Glamir se encuentra en las mismas ruinas que Nithi.\
\
Nithi te ha pedido que lleves el cráneo encantado al Elfo Glamir con la esperanza de que pueda hacer frente a la amenaza que representa.","Habla con Glamir","Un asunto inquietante"}},
[234]={nameES="A Disturbing Word",objectivesES={}},
[235]={nameES="A Dock Too Far",objectivesES={}},
[236]={nameES="A Doe in a Dragon's Nest",objectivesES={}},
[237]={nameES="A Dreadful Boar",objectivesES={"Gaerfalas is at the way-post atop Amon Angened, east of Fállug.\
\
You should bring the boar-meat you collected to Gaerfalas and tell him of Blacktusk's defeat.","Defeated Blacktusk at Fállug","Bring boar-meat to Gaerfalas atop Amon Angened","A Dreadful Boar","The Elves at the way-post atop Amon Angened provide supplies and provisions for the main force of the Malledhrim in the east.","Blacktusk and the Mirkwood boars may be found around the ruins of Fállug, west of Amon Angened.\
\
Gaerfalas has asked you to hunt Blacktusk and the Mirkwood boars for their meat.","Defeat Blacktusk at Fállug"}},
[238]={nameES="A Dreadful Treachery",objectivesES={"The watching stone is in Ered Lithui.\
\
You should defeat the spirit of the watching stone.","You have successfully defeated the treacherous watching stone and prevented the spirit from gaining more power.","A Dreadful Treachery","A watching stone has sought your assistance in purging evil from the Ered Lithui, but it has tricked you.","Defeated the spirit of the watching stone.","The breeze coming from the carven statue begins to intensify as dust blows into your face. The gratitude you felt from the watching stone has turned to spite. The stone's eyes begin to glow and you think you see the stone begin to move slightly.\
\
The watching stone has tricked you in order to serve its own, dark purpose. The stone must be stopped!","Completado","Defeated the spirit of the watching stone","Defeat the spirit of the watching stone"}},
[239]={nameES="A Dreary, Untidy Mess",objectivesES={"A Dreary, Untidy Mess","In the wake of the Battle of the Hornburg, you have received word of vast, startling destruction at Isengard.\
\
It is unknown what remains of Saruman's forces in Nan Curunír, but the only reported sightings tell of fewer than three dozen Dunlendings fleeing back into their lands.\
\
You have been summoned to scout the Wizard's Vale, seek any survivors, and discover what force has brought Isengard to ruin.","DNT -- will not be seen","Search for some sign of survivors outside Isengard","Survivors might be found along the road out of Nan Curunír to the north-west of the Westfold.\
\
You have received word of vast destruction at Isengard, and seek to investigate the aftermath in search of any survivors.","In the aftermath of the Battle of the Hornburg, Saruman and the people of Rohan alike deal with drastically changed circumstances."}},
[240]={nameES="Suministros a la deriva",objectivesES={"Suministros a la deriva","Tegwen Esparcilla se encuentra en el Embarcadero de los Comerciantes.\
\
Deberías volver con Tegwen Esparcilla con la madera de deriva que has conseguido.","La madera de deriva ha llegado a las orillas del río Brandivino y es un recurso que vale la pena recolectar para la Liga del Hacha.","Vuelve a ver a Tegwen Esparcilla con la madera de deriva que has conseguido"}},
[241]={nameES="Una bebida de lo más característica",objectivesES={"Una bebida de lo más característica","El Arado y las Estrellas se encuentra en Tejonera, en la Comarca.\
\
Deberías hablar con Halson Fondocuba en Tejonera, quien vende hidromiel, que luego será llevada a Nathalan ingeniosamente disfrazada como Bazofia.","Nathalan se encuentra en Aughaire, una ciudad de Angmar.\
\
Deberías entregar la \\qBazofia\\q —que en realidad es hidromiel— a Nathalan.","Has recogido el hidromiel. Será disfrazado como Bazofia para ti","Recoge hidromiel en El Arado y las Estrellas","Lleva la falsa Bazofia a Nathalan, en Aughaire"}},
[242]={nameES="Una bebida con el peor carácter",objectivesES={"Nathalan se encuentra en Aughaire, en Angmar, muy al norte de las Tierras Solitarias.\
\
Nathalan te comentó que, para apreciar verdaderamente el carácter de una bebida, debe consumirse en un entorno acorde a su esencia. Como bebida apropiada para Angmar, te ha pedido que recojas la peor bebida de todo Eriador: \\qBazofia.\\q Esta bebida solo se puede encontrar en la Posada Abandonada, en las Tierras Solitarias.","La Bazofia se puede comprar en la Posada Abandonada en las Tierras Solitarias.\
\
Un tabernero de la Liga de las Posadas te ha pedido que entregues un pedido de Bazofia de la Posada Abandonada para un miembro de la Liga de las Posadas que se encuentra varado en Angmar.","Has recolectado Bazofia....(¡Qué asco!)","Una bebida con el peor carácter","Recoge Bazofia de la Posada Abandonada","Se te ha encargado completar una entrega a un miembro de la Liga de las Posadas que se ha quedado varado lejos del festival esta temporada.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu bitácora de misiones cuando termine el festival actual. </rgb>","Lleva la Bazofia a Nathalan en Aughaire"}},
[243]={nameES="Una paliza en las profundidades",objectivesES={"Golpea una piedra profunda resonante y derrota a cualquier mal que sea atraído por el sonido","Hay aventureros de toda clase prestando su apoyo a la Guarnición de Hierro en Moria, pero estos Campeones, Guardianes y Cazadores no tienen lo que hace falta. Necesito un buen Luchador que sepa pelear y que no dependa de espadas, lanzas o flechas. ¿Eres tú? Si lo eres, ven a verme al Refugio Sombrío, en las Fundaciones de Piedra.\
\
Bardag Manogranizo, Luchador de renombre","Has recibido una carta de Bardag Manogranizo, convocando a Luchadores capaces y dispuestos a reunirse con él en el Refugio Sombrío, en las Fundaciones de Piedra.","El segundo combate es para ti; Fakhthal ha sido derrotado","El último y más formidable de los enemigos atraídos por tus travesuras ha llegado: ¡Maudágul emerge!","Bardag Manogranizo se encuentra en el Refugio Sombrío, en las Fundaciones de Piedra, en Moria.","Otra criatura de los Globsnaga se acerca pesadamente: ¡Thargur ataca!","Un terrible sonido de succión y raspado presagia la llegada de Úfauth el Oculto","Lleva la carta a Bardag Manogranizo en el Refugio Sombrío","Una paliza en las profundidades","Bardag Manogranizo describió una ubicación al noreste del lago, en las Fundaciones de Piedra, donde quiere que golpees piedras profundas y derrotes a las criaturas atraídas por los ecos.","Habla con Bardag Manogranizo en el Refugio Sombrío","El primer combate es para ti; Úfauth ha sido derrotado"}},
[244]={nameES="A Duty to King and Kin",objectivesES={"Find Dori and Company on the road into the Ered Mithrin","Once night has fallen, Dori and Company can be found outside the gates of Erebor.\
\
While Dori and the others begin their journey into the Ered Mithrin, Dori has asked you to deliver a share of his treasure to the ravens of Ravenhill in the hope that he might sooner learn of Nori's whereabouts. You should collect the share of Dori's treasure and prepare to travel to Ravenhill.","Coils of rope, waterskins, and bedrolls can be found throughout the Hall under the Mountain, including the New-lodes of Narathâk.\
\
Dori has asked you to collect coils of rope, waterskins, and bedrolls in preparation for the coming journey to the Grey Mountains.","Dori can be found inside Nori's home in Tumnuguhûd, the Dwelling-halls of Erebor.\
\
You have prepared all of the packs for Dori and Company. You should now speak to Dori.","Once night has fallen, Dori and Company can be found outside the gates of Erebor.\
\
Hoping to preserve the secrecy of their journey, Dori has asked the company to join him outside the gates of Erebor after dusk.","King Thorin III Stonehelm has granted Dori leave to pursue his brother into the Ered Mithrin, but now Dori must now form a company of his own.","Dori and Company can be found along the road into the Ered Mithrin.\
\
You have earned the aid of Arcah's conspiracy and should now follow the road into the Ered Mithrin to rejoin Dori and Company.","Dori and Company can be found along the road into the Ered Mithrin.\
\
You have discovered Dori and Company resting before a large stone structure along the road into the Ered Mithrin. You should talk to Dori.","Packs can be found throughout Nori's home in Tumnuguhûd, the Dwelling-halls of Erebor.\
\
Despite finding only four willing companions to join him on the journey to Thikil-gundu, Dori has asked you to prepare six packs in the event that Nori is found before he reaches the Steel Keep.","Dori can be found inside Nori's home in Tumnuguhûd, the Dwelling-halls of Erebor.\
\
You have gathered several coils of rope, water-skins, and bedrolls and should now deliver them to Dori at Nori's home.","Dori has gathered his Company beneath a tree on the banks of the River Running...","Once night has fallen, Dori and Company can be found outside the gates of Erebor.\
\
You have arrived outside the gates of Erebor to find Dori and Company assembled under a tree beside the River Running. You should speak to Dori.","Pick up the share of Dori's treasure","A Duty to King and Kin","Talk to Dori in Nori's home","Talk to Dori","Arcah can be found at Ravenhill to the south-west of Erebor.\
\
Dori has bidden you deliver a share of his treasure to the ravens at Ravenhill. You should ride swiftly and deliver the treasure to the raven-chief, Arcah.","Ravens can be found at Ravenhill to the south-west of Erebor.\
\
Arcah has accepted the share of Dori's shiny treasure in exchange for sending a few of her unkindness into the Ered Mithrin to seek for Nori. You should direct ravens to take flight and make for the Ered Mithrin.","You discover Dori and Company resting on the road into the Ered Mithrin!","Talk to Dori at Furuk-mekhem, the Southgate","Arcah casts an inquisitive gaze in your direction...","Meet Dori and Company outside Erebor after dusk","Talk to Arcah at Ravenhill","Deliver the coils of rope, water-skins, and bedrolls to Dori in Nori's home"}},
[245]={nameES="Deber de un enano",objectivesES={"Entrega las hachas de los Duramano a Refr Mercurio","Refr Mercurio te espera en la entrada de la cueva, al sur del Gran Camino del Este en las Tierras Solitarias, al norte de Thandobel.\
\
Debes regresar con Refr Mercurio con noticias de tu victoria contra los Duramano y traerle las hachas que tomaste como trofeos.","Los Duramano se encuentran en las ruinas de Thandobel, al sur de Refr Mercurio.\
\
Los enanos Duramano han roto sus lazos con sus hermanos al aliarse con los orcos. Refr Mercurio te ha pedido que vengues a los Duramano en nombre de los Pueblos Libres y que le lleves sus hachas como trofeo.","Deber de un enano","En Annunlos yace una ruina, abandonada desde hace mucho por los Eglain. Rebuscada y con solo las profundidades sin explorar, los Eglain dejaron las tumbas bajo la ruina, como es su costumbre. Sin embargo, la ruina ahora rebosa de vida otra vez, pues enanos, aliados con orcos, registran el lugar en busca de tesoros en sus profundidades."}},
[246]={nameES="Una Espada Forjada por Enanos",objectivesES={"Lofar Bandadehierro te ha dicho que alguien ha robado su última espada. Te ha pedido que averigües quién la robó y se la devuelvas lo antes posible.","Una Espada Forjada por Enanos","La mayoría de los herreros de Bree viven cerca de la Puerta Oeste o trabajan en la granja de Espinar, a lo largo del Camino Verde.\
\
Lofar te ha dicho que cree que uno de los herreros humanos robó su última espada. Cree que alguien como tú podría intimidar al ladrón para que confiese y devuelva la espada robada.","Habla con los herreros de Bree"}},
[247]={nameES="Un tenue destello de esperanza",objectivesES={"Habla con Gúthi en el Patio de Durin","Puedes encontrar a Gúthi en el Patio de Durin, en las Profundidades Llameantes del sureste.\
\
Deberías hablar con Gúthi.","Feggi te recomendó que viajaras al Patio de Durin para intentar advertir a Gúthi y a sus enanos de la amenaza de los Ghâsh-hai, con la esperanza de que llegar antes de que marcharan hacia una fortaleza repleta de orcos.","Un tenue destello de esperanza","Gúthi se encuentra en el Patio de Durin, al este del campamento de Feggi en Ânghumu-ru, y luego al sur a través de Hadâd-mezer. Encontrarás braseros apagados por el camino.\
\\Debes cruzar las Profundidades Llameantes hasta Gúthi, encendiendo los braseros que encuentres.","Descubre el Patio de Durin","Has encontrado el Patio de Durin"}},
[248]={nameES="A Fair Bargain",objectivesES={"The trader's outpost provides a valuable service to travellers and refugees alike, but desperation has turned some of the merchants towards greed.","The traders and merchants reside at the trader's outpost along the road west from Elthengels.\
\
Ofrith has asked you to speak with the other merchants and see that their practices remain fair to both seller and buyer.","A Fair Bargain","Convince the merchant Léodrim to maintain fair prices","Ofrith can be found at the trader's outpost, west of the village of Elthengels.\
\
Ofrith awaits word of the merchants' agreement to demand only fair prices of travellers and refugees.","You have convinced the merchant to charge a reasonable price","Convince the second merchant to maintain fair prices","Talk to Ofrith at the merchant-camp","Convince the first merchant to maintain fair prices"}},
[249]={nameES="Un rastro falso",objectivesES={"El lugar donde debes colocar un rastro falso se encuentra al suroeste de Limlaer y al oeste de Porth Cadlus.\
\
Limlaer te ha pedido que coloques rastros falsos para que los encuentren los exploradores del Enemigo.","Habla con Limlaer","Los espías del Enemigo buscan continuamente el rastro de la Compañía, poniendo en peligro su seguridad y su misión.","Limlaer está al suroeste de Echad Dúnann, a lo largo del camino de Nan Sirannon.\
\
Deberías volver a Limlaer e informar de que se ha tendido un rastro falso.","Has tendido un rastro falso","Un rastro falso","You have set the false trail"}},
[250]={nameES="A Familiar Blight",objectivesES={}},
[251]={nameES="A Familiar Face",objectivesES={}},
[252]={nameES="A Familiar Keepsake",objectivesES={}},
[253]={nameES="A Familiar Tactic",objectivesES={}},
[254]={nameES="Una despedida",objectivesES={"Entra en Nanduhirion desde la Primera Sala en Nud-melek","Una despedida","Bingo está listo para ver la luz del sol una vez más y quiere reunirse contigo en el Valle del Arroyo Sombrío.\
\
La salida de Moria está al este de la Primera Sala, en Nud-melek.","Bingo está fuera de la Puerta Este de Moria, en Nanduhirion.","Bingo respira profundamente el aire limpio, contento de haber salido de Moria","Bingo está en el lado oeste del Puente de Khazad-dûm.","Bingo está listo para despedirse de Moria y continuar su aventura al otro lado de las montañas.","Hay enemigos por todo Nud-melek, los niveles orientales de Moria.\
\
Bingo quería que derrotaras enemigos en Nud-melek mientras avanzas hacia el lado oeste del Puente de Khazad-dûm.","Bingo quería reunirse contigo en el lado oeste del Puente de Khazad-dûm, en Nud-melek.","Spalvi se ha quedado atrás y está junto a la Puerta Este de Moria, en Nanduhirion.","El Puente de Khazad-dûm está roto y ya no cruza el tramo","Reúnete con Bingo en el lado oeste del Puente de Khazad-dûm","Habla con Bingo en el lado oeste del Puente de Khazad-dûm","Habla con Bingo fuera de la Puerta Este de Moria, en Nanduhirion","Se pueden encontrar enemigos por todo Nud-melek, los niveles orientales de Moria.\
\
Bingo quería que derrotaras enemigos en Nud-melek mientras avanzas hacia la salida de Moria.","Habla con Spalvi fuera de la Puerta Este de Moria, en Nanduhirion"}},
[255]={nameES="A Fateful Decision",objectivesES={"With your patrol of the surrounding lands completed, Lord Ingmar has come to a fateful decision.","Talk to Tóla at Lord Ingmar's house","Reeve Ingbert is at the Mead Hall of Eaworth, south of Ingmar's home.\
\
Tóla requested that you speak with Ingbert and see if he can bring reason to Ingmar.","Talk to Ingbert in the Mead Hall of Eaworth","A Fateful Decision","Tóla is at Lord Ingmar's house in the northern part of Eaworth.\
\
Ingmar has asked you to let his wife, Tóla, know that he has decided to lead his men against Maustazg, regardless of his father's will."}},
[256]={nameES="A Father Ailing",objectivesES={"Delion's ward is within the Houses of Healing in the Sixth Circle. If you should get separated from Bereneth use Bergil's whistle to call her back.\
\
Delion will get to Araslant if you attend to some of the other wounded men in his ward.","Take an apple from the crate","The Greensward lies before the Houses of Healing in the Sixth Circle.\
\
Visit the Greensward with Bereneth. If you should get separated from her, use Bergil's whistle to call her back.","Araslant lies recovering in the Houses of Healing. If you should get separated from Bereneth, use Bergil's whistle to call her back.\
\
Now that you have given out the flowers, you should return to Bereneth's father, Araslant.","Talk to Bereneth","Araslant has drifted off to sleep","Bereneth will walk with you in the Sixth Circle. If you should get separated from her, use Bergil's whistle to call her back.\
\
Talk to Bereneth and see what she wishes to do next.","Return to Araslant","The water cup is in Araslant's room in the Houses of Healing.\
\
Bring Bereneth's father, Araslant, the cup of water for him to drink.","The man takes the flower with a grave and sorrowful face, holds it to his nose, and nods.","Took an apple","Shadowfax stands proudly in one of the stalls","Visit the Greensward","Meet Bereneth back at the Old Guest-house","Araslant lies recovering in the Houses of Healing. If you should get separated from Bereneth, use Bergil's whistle to call her back.\
\
Return to Bereneth's father, Araslant, and to see if he is still asleep.","Bereneth's father is a soldier who was wounded in the recent sortie. Help her visit him in the Houses of Healing.","Feed Shadowfax the apple","Bereneth will go with you in the Houses of Healing. If you should get separated from her, use Bergil's whistle to call her back.\
\
Talk to Bereneth and see what she wants to do.","Delion is in his ward in the Houses of Healing. If you should get separated from Bereneth, use Bergil's whistle to call her back.\
\
Find Delion the Healer and let him know Bereneth's father needs his help.","Bereneth wipes her face, concealing a tear.\
\
'I will come tomorrow, and the next day, and the next day, and the next day, until he is all well again.\
\
'Are those footsteps? Do you think the healer's coming? We'd better go!'","Araslant takes the cup of water","Araslant closes his eyes and sleeps","Bereneth will go with you in the Houses of Healing. If you should get separated from her, use Bergil's whistle to call her back.\
\
Talk to Bereneth and see what she has to say.","The Houses of Healing are in the Sixth Circle, on the northern side.\
\
Bereneth seems to be scared of going into the Houses of Healing by herself and would like you to accompany her. You can meet her before the entrance.","The High Stables are just north of the Pier in the Sixth Circle.\
\
Go with Bereneth to visit Shadowfax in the High Stables. If you should get separated from her, use Bergil's whistle to call her back.","Bereneth's father, Araslant lies recovering in the Houses of Healing. If you should get separated from Bereneth, use Bergil's whistle to call her back.\
\
Talk to Bereneth's father and try to learn how ill he is.","Shadowfax accepts the apple with gentle dignity.","Talk to Araslant","Bereneth will walk with you in the Sixth Circle. If you should get separated from her, use Bergil's whistle to call her back.\
\
You have found Shadowfax, Gandalf's steed. Talk to Bereneth.","The Houses of Healing are in the Sixth Circle, on the northern side.\
\
Go around Araslant's ward in the Houses of Healing and hand out the flowers you picked to the other wounded soldiers.","Bring Bereneth to her father","Bereneth runs off","The Greensward lies before the Houses of Healing in the Sixth Circle.\
\
Pick flowers for Bereneth on the Greensward. If you should get separated from her, use Bergil's whistle to call her back.","Delion turns immediately back to his work","The High Stables are just north of the Pier in the Sixth Circle.\
\
Feed Shadowfax an apple in the High Stables.","Delion is in his ward in in the Houses of Healing.  If you should get separated from Bereneth use Bergil's whistle to call her back.\
\
You should let Delion know you have attended to the wounded and ask him again to attend to Araslant.","Bereneth's father lies wounded within the Houses of Healing, which are on the northern end of the Sixth Circle.","Araslant lies in a ward of the Houses of Healing in the Sixth Circle. If you should get separated from Bereneth use Bergil's whistle to call her back.\
\
You should go back with Bereneth and let Araslant know that the healer will be with him soon.","Meet Bereneth before the Houses of Healing","Talk to Delion","Bereneth's father, Araslant lies recovering in the Houses of Healing. If you should get separated from Bereneth, use Bergil's whistle to call her back.\
\
Talk to Bereneth's father now that he's had something to drink.","Talk to the healer Delion","Bereneth will go with you in the Houses of Healing. If you should get separated from her, use Bergil's whistle to call her back.\
\
You should talk to Bereneth and reassure her about her father.","Bring Araslant the cup of water","Bereneth stands before the Houses of Healing, waiting for you","Find Shadowfax","The High Stables are just north of the Pier in the Sixth Circle.\
\
Take an apple from the crate in the High Stables to feed Shadowfax.","A Father Ailing","The Old Guest-house lies in the First Circle, just south of the City Gates.\
\
Meet Bereneth back at the Old Guest-house."}},
[257]={nameES="A Fearful Foe",objectivesES={"The Rangers know the lands of Ithilien well, and use their mastery of it to scare off encroaching foes who are easily unnerved in the shadows of Gondor's garden.","Talk to Rhadrog","Rhadrog can be found at Henneth Annûn in north-central North Ithilien.\
\
You have unnerved many of the Enemy's forces in North Ithilien and should now return to Rhadrog.","Orcs and Khundolar searchers can be found throughout central and north-central North Ithilien.\
\
Rhadrog has asked you to scare the forces of Mordor that are searching North Ithilien for the Rangers. You should <rgb=#FF00FF>roar</rgb> at the searchers while you remain hidden from their sight.","A Fearful Foe"}},
[258]={nameES="A Fearless Advance",objectivesES={"A Fearless Advance","Talk to Angbor in Pelargir","Angbor can be found by the eastern gate of Pelargir.\
\
You have rallied many of Angbor's men and should now return to Angbor.","Angbor's men can be found throughout the eastern half of Pelargir.\
\
Angbor has asked you to rally his men in Pelargir before he sets out into Upper Lebennin.","Lord Angbor of Lamedon makes ready to travel through Upper Lebennin as he leads his host to Minas Tirith."}},
[259]={nameES="A Feast of Mighty Beasts",objectivesES={"A Feast of Mighty Beasts","Rook can be found to the west of Snowbourn.","Rook wants you to hunt the most dangerous beasts in the Sutcrofts. He mentioned that they are nearby, but will not say more.","Talk to Rook","Rook is convinced that his avanc is merely hungry. However, he knows that the avanc will only eat the very best of meats and wishes you to confront the most dangerous creatures in the Sutcrofts."}},
[260]={nameES="Una Molestia Emplumada",objectivesES={"El camino corre hacia el norte desde Noglond a través del Valle de Thráin hasta la Mansión de Thorin.\
\
Ketill te ha pedido patrullar a lo largo del camino por el Valle de Thráin y reducir la cantidad de hendrevail. También mencionó que pueden encontrarse grandes números de hendrevail al sur del río, al sur de Noglond.","Ketill está en Noglond, al sur de la Mansión de Thorin.\
\
Debes regresar con Ketill e informarle los resultados de tu patrulla.","Habla con Ketill en Noglond","Feroces hendrevail plagan la Valle de Thráin, haciendo que viajar por la Valle sea peligroso.","Una Molestia Emplumada"}},
[261]={nameES="Un fulgor funesto",objectivesES={"Un fulgor funesto","Has disipado el fulgor funesto de Morrafn de este lugar maldito.","La tumba profanada de este claro pareció centellear brevemente con una extraña inquietud. Quizá fue solo un juego de luces, pero deberías investigar más de cerca.","Has dispersado las luces perversas de Morrafn","Investiga la extraña tumba","Completado","La extraña tumba se encuentra al noroeste del campamento de Mincham, en los Campos de Fornost.\
\
Debes investigar la extraña tumba."}},
[262]={nameES="Un resplandor mortal",objectivesES={"Las Excavaciones Tenebrosas se encuentran muy al sureste del Refugio Sombrío.\
\
Las pesadillas de Ymar continúan, y necesita que lo ayudes a librarse de ellas. Te ha pedido que te adentres en las Excavaciones Tenebrosas y mates a los gusanos luminiscentes de allí para que pueda descansar tranquilo.","Un resplandor mortal","Regresa con Ymar en el Refugio Sombrío","En las profundidades más oscuras de Moria, hay un lugar donde la única luz que brillaba provenía de las lámparas de enanos y hongos luminiscentes. Ahora estos túneles son más tenues que nunca y hogar de criaturas que existen solo en pesadillas. Sin embargo, ahí están, y los agentes de Veúlfur enviados al Refugio Sombrío encuentran poco consuelo al saber que hay algo en las Excavaciones Tenebrosas que ordena a los orcos a envenenarse de una manera que los entrega a una voluntad superior.","Ymar está en el Refugio Sombrío, muy al noroeste de las Excavaciones Tenebrosas.\
\
Encontraste a los gusanos luminiscentes en las Excavaciones Tenebrosas y los eliminaste, tal como te lo pidió Ymar."}},
[263]={nameES="El corazón de la Comunidad (opcional)",objectivesES={"Pada ha descifrado el texto musical que obtuviste y lo ha transcrito en una composición que ahora puedes leer e interpretar. Para poner en práctica tus nuevos conocimientos, Pada te ha encomendado adentrarte en Skûmfil y enfrentarte al rascabismos Dientefisura.","El corazón de la Comunidad (opcional)","Dientefisura se encuentra en Skûmfil, en Moria, al este del Refugio Sombrío, en las Fundaciones de Piedra.\
\
Deberías derrotar y registrar al rascabismos llamada Dienterreto en Skûmfil, pues es muy probable que el último fragmento del texto se halle en posesión de esa bestia.","Vuelve con Pada a las Fundaciones de Piedra","Pada aguarda tu regreso en las Fundaciones de Piedra de Moria.\
\
Has derrotado a Dientefisura y recuperado el texto perdido que faltaba en la composición. La obra completa debería ayudarte en tu camino para convertirte en un juglar verdaderamente heroico.","Dientefisura ha sido derrotado","Derrota a Dientefisura en Skûmfil"}},
[264]={nameES="Una curva femenina en el acero",objectivesES={"Este hacha parece idéntica a muchas otras hachas de manufactura enana que has visto en el pasado.","Has encontrado un hacha en los restos del campamento de Balin. Está atrayendo la atención de todos los enanos con los que te encuentras.","Una curva femenina en el acero","Hay enanos acampados en la Sala Vigesimoprimera.\
\
Has encontrado un hacha en los restos del campamento de la expedición de Balin. Llama la atención de cada enano que te encuentras. Quizás debieras preguntarle a alguien sobre ella.","Busca información sobre el hacha","Busca información sobre el hacha que has encontrado","Habla con Kafli en Guardia Orca","Kafli se encuentra en Guardia Orca, lejos hacia el sur de aquí.\
\
Te han dicho que hables con un enano llamado Kafli sobre el hacha."}},
[265]={nameES="Una curva femenina del acero",objectivesES={"Has encontrado el hacha de una enana. Los delicados grabados y la curva femenina del acero son inconfundibles. Todos los enanos con los que te has encontrado te miran de forma extraña cuando pasas frente a ellos portando este hacha.","Una curva femenina del acero","Kafli se encuentra en Guardia Orca, lejos hacia el sur de la Sala Vigesimoprimera.\
\
Te han dicho que hables con un enano llamado Kafli sobre el hacha que has encontrado.","Busca información sobre el hacha","Has encontrado el hacha de una enana. Los delicados grabados y la curva femenina del acero son inconfundibles.","Habla con Kafli en Guardia Orca","Hay enanos en la Sala Vigesimoprimera.\
\
Deberías quizás hablar con alguien sobre el hacha que has encontrado."}},
[266]={nameES="El nombre de la Rosa",objectivesES={"Recoge los dulces","Entrega los dulces a Manzanagria","Has entregado por error el ramo de Manzanagria en la casa equivocada.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro cuando finalice el festival actual. </rgb>","Los dulces de Rosa Calderero están en el callejón detrás de Avery Manzanagria.\
\
Rosa Calderero te ha pedido que recuperes sus dulces, que fueron dejados en la puerta equivocada.","El ramo está en un jarrón junto a la puerta incorrecta en la Escalera de los Eruditos, en Bree.\
\
Avery Manzanagria te ha pedido que recuperes el ramo de la dirección equivocada.","Los vecinos están en la Escalera de los Eruditos, en Bree.\
\
Avery Manzanagria te pidió que preguntaras a los vecinos por la dirección correcta.","Pregunta a un vecino por la dirección","Has recogido los dulces","Avery Manzanagria está en el mercado de Bree.\
\
Debes llevarle los dulces a Avery Manzanagria.","El nombre de la Rosa","Recoge el ramo del jarrón en la puerta equivocada","Entregaste el ramo a Rosa","Has recogido el ramo","Pregunta a un vecino por la dirección correcta","Le entregaste los dulces a Manzanagria"}},
[267]={nameES="Agitación festiva (Avanzado)",objectivesES={"Agitación festiva (Avanzado)","Habla con Mara Arenales","Cada día hay algo que hacer en Barranca Escarchada. ¡Cada día es Yule! ¡Ven y únete a todos en Barranca Escarchada y participa en muchas actividades del Festival de Yule durante cinco días más!","Mara Arenales desea agradecerle por su continua participación en el Festival de Yule.","Completa 'El espíritu de Yule' cinco veces más","Yule es una temporada de dar y recibir, y aquellos que más dan a menudo encuentran que reciben más a cambio."}},
[268]={nameES="Agitación festiva (Avanzado)",objectivesES={"Agitación festiva (Avanzado)","Habla con Mara Arenales","Mara Arenales desea agradecerte por tu continua participación en el Festival de Yule.","Completa 'En el espíritu de Yule' tres veces más","Yule es una temporada de dar y recibir, y aquellos que más dan a menudo encuentran que reciben más a cambio."}},
[269]={nameES="Una ráfaga festiva (Final)'",objectivesES={"Habla con Mara Arenales","Cada día hay algo que hacer en Barranca Escarchada. ¡Cada día es Yule! ¡Ven y únete a todos en Barranca Escarchada y participa en muchas actividades del Festival de Yule durante cinco días más!","Una ráfaga festiva (Final)'","Mara Arenales desea agradecerle por su continua participación en el Festival de Yule.","Completa 'El espíritu de Yule' cinco veces más","Yule es una temporada de dar y recibir, y aquellos que más dan a menudo encuentran que reciben más a cambio."}},
[270]={nameES="Una ráfaga festiva (Final)'",objectivesES={"Habla con Mara Arenales","Mara Arenales desea agradecerte por tu continua participación en el Festival de Yule.'","Una ráfaga festiva (Final)'","Yule es una temporada de dar y recibir, y aquellos que más dan a menudo encuentran que reciben más a cambio.'","Hay muchos regalos que esperan a los participantes del Festival de Yule, y para aquellos que celebran durante muchos días, ¡los regalos son aún mejores!'","Completa 'El espíritu de Yule' tres veces más"}},
[271]={nameES="Agitación festiva (Intermedio)'",objectivesES={"Cada día hay algo que hacer en Risco Invernal. ¡Cada día es Yule! ¡Ven y únete a todos en Risco Invernal y participa en muchas actividades del Festival de Yule durante cinco días más!","Habla con Mara Arenales","Cada día hay algo que hacer en Barranca Escarchada. ¡Cada día es Yule! ¡Ven y únete a todos en Barranca Escarchada y participa en muchas actividades del Festival de Yule durante cinco días más!","Agitación festiva (Intermedio)'","Mara Arenales desea agradecerle por su continua participación en el Festival de Yule.","Completa 'El espíritu de Yule' cinco veces más","Yule es una temporada de dar y recibir, y aquellos que más dan a menudo encuentran que reciben más a cambio."}},
[272]={nameES="Agitación festiva (Intermedio)'",objectivesES={"Habla con Mara Arenales","Agitación festiva (Intermedio)'","Mara Arenales desea agradecerle por su continua participación en el Festival de Yule.","Completa 'El espíritu de Yule' tres veces más","Yule es una temporada de dar y recibir, y aquellos que más dan a menudo encuentran que reciben más a cambio."}},
[273]={nameES="Una ráfaga festiva (Intro)",objectivesES={"Habla con Mara Arenales","Mara Arenales desea agradecerle por su continua participación en el Festival de Yule.","Una ráfaga festiva (Intro)","Cada día hay algo que hacer en Risco Invernal. ¡Cada día es Yule! Ven y únete a todos en Risco Invernal y participa en muchas actividades del Festival de Yule durante cinco días.","Completa 'El espíritu de Yule' cinco veces","Yule es una temporada de dar y recibir, y aquellos que más dan a menudo encuentran que reciben más a cambio."}},
[274]={nameES="Una ráfaga festiva (Intro)",objectivesES={"Habla con Mara Arenales","Mara Arenales desea agradecerle por su continua participación en el Festival de Yule.","Una ráfaga festiva (Intro)","Complete 'In the Spirit of Yule' three times","Yule es una temporada de dar y recibir, y aquellos que más dan a menudo encuentran que reciben más a cambio.'"}},
[275]={nameES="A Few Come Forward",objectivesES={}},
[276]={nameES="Faltan algunas páginas",objectivesES={"Se pueden encontrar lobos al este de Bolgovado.\
\
Sin las hojas faltantes, será imposible determinar quién disparó la flecha en la puerta de Wilimar Bolger, ni por qué. Wilimar sospecha que los lobos destrozaron el diario y te ha pedido que intentes recuperar las hojas de ellos.","El diario que llevaste de regreso a Wilimar Bolger tenía muchas hojas faltantes, gracias a que fue sacudido y desgarrado por algunas bestias salvajes.","Faltan algunas páginas","Lleva las hojas del diario a Wilimar Bolger"}},
[277]={nameES="A Field of Death",objectivesES={"Plant Léofdag's spear, Wrecend, in the ground at Kings' End","You have planted the spear and honoured Léofdag's memory","Search for the Riders Three at Kings' End","Fire and slaughter blanket the Pelennor Fields as the Riders Three draw closer to their foe's whereabouts.","Kings' End can be found near the centre of the Pelennor Fields at the site where Théoden King fell.\
\
You have arrived at Kings' End and should now seek out the Riders Three.","Talk to Burnoth at Kings' End","Talk to Hutha at Kings' End","A Field of Death","Burnoth, Hutha, and Ulf can be found at Kings' End.\
\
You have found the Riders Three at Kings' End and should now speak to them.","You have found the Riders, who now look much worse for the wear...","Battle your way to the centre of the Pelennor Fields","Foes can be found across the Pelennor Fields.\
\
Burnoth has asked you to aid in the Battle of the Pelennor Fields by defeating many of the Enemy's forces.","Burnoth can be found at Kings' End.\
\
You have honoured Léofdag's memory by laying his spear at the site where his King fell. You should now speak to Burnoth.","Enemies are on all sides! Hold the field and protect those you can!\
\
You have defeated many of the Enemy's forces and should now continue to aid the forces of Gondor and Rohan on the field.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Note: You must complete Book 6, Chapter 2 of Volume IV to advance this objective.</rgb>","Talk to Ulf at Kings' End","A small mound of earth can be found near the site where Théoden King fell at Kings' End.\
\
Hutha has asked you to plant Léofdag's spear near the site where Théoden King fell."}},
[278]={nameES="A Fighting Chance",objectivesES={"Bregdal has asked you to defeat foes in Dâr Mauzur and destroy Orkish barriers.","A Fighting Chance","Bregdal, a soldier of Gondor, has scouted Talath Úrui and found a fortified enemy encampment within the sprawling wreckage of Dâr Mauzur.","A notice is pinned to the board, signed by Bregdal:\
\
'Part of the Dâr Mauzur encampment in Talath Úrui has barricaded themselves in. A brave adventurer is needed to break down these barricades.'"}},
[279]={nameES="A Final Act",objectivesES={"Habla con Mara Sandydowns","Talk to Mara Sandydowns when you are ready to hear the choice she will ask you to make.","Mara Sandydowns can be found near the entrance to Winter-home.\
\
You should speak with Mara Sandydowns, for she is about to present you with an important decision.","Mara Sandydowns can be found near the entrance to Winter-home.\
\
Return and speak to Mara Sandydowns now that you have cast your lot one way or the other.","Go to Mara Sandydowns, for she wishes to speak with you","Mara Sandydowns can be found near the entrance to Winter-home.\
\
You should speak with Mara Sandydowns, for everyone says she is looking for you.","You have done and seen much in Winter-home and greater Frostbluff, and Mara Sandydowns thinks you are ready to get involved in some rather important plans.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> NOTE: This quest will be removed from your quest log when the current festival ends. </rgb>","A Final Act","Speak with Mara Sandydowns","Complete either Assist the Rich or Support the Poor","Mara Sandydowns can be found near the entrance to Winter-home.\
\
She is presenting you with a choice, either help the poor or help the rich of Winter-home."}},
[280]={nameES="A Final Blow",objectivesES={"Defeated Warden Khusóku","A new warden has emerged to claim control of Esh Mêkag prison.","Talk to Ebuzâm","A new warden has taken control of Esh Mêkag and is threatening to execute the thralls remaining inside.\
\
You should rescue the imprisoned thralls, and defeat the Ordâkhai inside Esh Mêkag prison.","The remaining thralls have been rescued and the new warden defeated.\
\
You should return to Ebuzâm.","Defeat Warden Khusóku","A Final Blow"}},
[281]={nameES="A Final Dignity",objectivesES={}},
[282]={nameES="Una incursión final",objectivesES={"Las obras hidráulicas son un enclave de gran importancia para los enanos que desean permanecer en Moria. Uno de ellos, el capataz Indrith, ha asumido la misión de reparar los canales del lugar. Las tareas que te encomendó condujeron al descubrimiento del Guardián del Agua.","Guardián del Agua derrotado","El Guardián del Agua mora en las Fauces Viles.\
\
Kaldi te advirtió de que el enemigo que habita en las Fauces Viles es capaz de arrastrar los propios corazones de quienes se le acercan hacia el olvido, si no cuentan con el gran poder de la luz de su lado. Sé cauteloso y ve acompañado de dos comunidades de tus aliados más firmes.","Derrota al Guardián del Agua","Una incursión final","Kaldi se encuentra en el campamento situado a las afueras de las Fauces Viles.\
\
Tu victoria sobre el Guardián del Agua será recordada como un gran triunfo entre los enanos.","Habla con Kaldi a las afueras de las Fauces Viles"}},
[283]={nameES="A Final Plea",objectivesES={"Determined to turn Váskmun Greytooth from his delusions of Manthríf's worth to him and his people, Gimli resolves to enter the Oath-taker's Horn and offer a final plea to the King of the Firehorns.","You hear muffled trumpeting as Eitur and two Firehorn warriors exit the Oath-taker's Horn!","You hear heavy hammer-falls inside the hidden gate. It seems the Firehorns have been ordered to seal it...","The main gate of the Oath-taker's Horn can be found in the vale far below the hidden gate.\
\
You have tried to enter the hidden gate and have found that the Firehorns have begun to seal it from within. You should now try the main gate.","A Final Plea","The gate mechanism can be found beside the main gate of the Oath-taker's Horn.\
\
You have arrived at the main gate of the Oath-taker's Horn. You should use the gate mechanism and call forth the Firehorns to deliver Gimli's message.","Talk to Gimli outside the Oath-taker's Horn","Gimli can be found along the causeway outside the Oath-taker's Horn.\
\
You were brutally attacked by the Firehorns, and they threatened the Dwarves of Durin's Folk. You should talk to Gimli and tell him what has happened.","Deliver Gimli's message to the Firehorns at the main gate of the Oath-taker's Horn","Deliver Gimli's message to the Firehorns at the hidden gate of the Oath-taker's Horn","Call forth the Firehorns and deliver Gimli's message","The hidden gate of Lûghash can be found in an alcove high above the main gate, accessible by a rear pathway leading onto the Spire.\
\
Gimli has asked you to deliver a message to the Firehorns in the Oath-taker's Horn. He hopes that King Greytooth might be convinced to treat upon the plains of Dor Amarth.","You discover a metal-wrought mechanism outside the main gate..."}},
[284]={nameES="A Final Reckoning",objectivesES={"Talk to King Thráin","The Battle of Azanulbizar has ended, but at unimaginable cost.","Dáin can be found at Amdân.\
\
After the burning of the dead at Azanulbizar, King Thráin and the survivors of the Sixth War of the Dwarves and Orcs have returned to Amdân. You should talk to Dáin.","A Final Reckoning","King Thráin can be found outside Muru Azog at Azanulbizar.\
\
After the defeat of Azog and the clearing of Orkish filth from Azanulbizar, King Thráin wishes to honour his father, Thrór. You should talk to King Thráin.","King Thráin can be found at Amdân.\
\
After the burning of the dead at Azanulbizar, King Thráin and the survivors of the Sixth War of the Dwarves and Orcs have returned to Amdân. You should talk to King Thráin.","Talk to King Thráin at Amdân"}},
[285]={nameES="Un Puñado de Flores",objectivesES={"Un Puñado de Flores","Tras el éxito al cortejar a la encantadora Rosa Calderero, Avery Manzanagria ha decidido asociarse con su amigo Gredlan Artemisa. Juntos crearán hermosos regalos y arreglos florales para enamorados.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro cuando termine el festival actual.</rgb>","Hay multitud de violetas en las Tierras de Bree. Hay multitud de prímulas en Ered Luin. Hay multitud de caléndulas en la Comarca. Gredlan Artemisa está en Bree.\
\
Avery Manzanagria te ha pedido recolectar flores por las Tierras de Bree, Ered Luin y la Comarca, y entregárselas a Gredlan Artemisa.","Recoge tantas flores como puedas en una hora"}},
[286]={nameES="Una comida adecuada",objectivesES={"El paso por las Tierras Solitarias se ha vuelto difícil con la llegada de los trasgos. Peor aún son sus mascotas, los temibles huargos que deambulan por las llanuras y atacan a los viajeros desprevenidos.","Lleva carne de lince al Viejo Artemisa","Se pueden encontrar linces en todo Nain Enidh -- el centro de las Tierras Solitarias -- al norte y noreste del campamento en el extremo este de Minas Eriol.\
\
El Viejo Artemisa cree que ha encontrado una forma de expulsar a los trasgos y huargos de las Tierras Solitarias, pero primero necesita que recojas carne de lince.","Una comida adecuada"}},
[287]={nameES="A Flanking Foe",objectivesES={"Gimli has rallied a group of inexperienced soldiers to help in defeating the Orcs who have crept through the culvert in an attempt to flank the wall's defenders. As Gimli advances to secure the Deep, the enemy catapults are causing destruction to the fortifications and stores beyond the wall. Brave labourers have attempted to salvage any supplies within the structures before they are lost in the ongoing siege.\
\
Merit Rating\
\
This quest starts with <rgb=#FFFF00>Partial</rgb> Merit Rating.\
\
<rgb=#00FF00>Moderate Merit Gain</rgb>\
* Labourer recovers supplies from store-house\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Moderate Merit Loss</rgb>\
* Rohirrim Labourer becomes defeated\
* Rohirrim Cadet becomes defeated","Aid Gimli in removing enemy threats that have managed to flank the defenders on the wall, while others work to rescue supplies from besieged structures within the deep.","A Flanking Foe"}},
[288]={nameES="A Flash of White",objectivesES={"You have successfully defeated the sabre-cat menacing the dwarves in Fellgát.\
\
You should talk to Náth.","Defeat Héormuth","You take one of the sabre-cat's fangs","Talk to Náth in Fellgát","Náth has told you about a huge white sabre-cat lurking somewhere near Fellgát.\
\
You should find and defeat the sabre-cat known as Héormuth.","A Flash of White","Náth has warned you of a dangerous predator lurking nearby."}},
[289]={nameES="Una bandada de dragonzuelos",objectivesES={"Una bandada de dragonzuelos","Perimbant te ha pedido que le traigas un granate imbuido que servirá como núcleo del hechizo que se invocará en tu arma. Pero desconoce dónde se puede conseguir tal gema.","Habla con Perimant para viajar a Pembar","Lleva un granate imbuido a Perimant","Perimbant se encuentra en Echad Dúnann, al oeste de las puertas de Moria.\
\
Debes volver junto a Perimbant para completar la mejora de tu arma.","Perimbant se encuentra en Echad Dúnann, justo al oeste de las puertas de Moria.\
\
Perimbant te ha pedido que hables con él cuando estés listo para viajar a las ruinas de Pembar para liberarla de la bandada de dragonzuelos.","Lleva el granate potenciado a Perimbant","En Eregion aún existen antiguas forjas élficas donde antaño se forjaban objetos de poder. Las ruinas de Pembar son uno de esos lugares, un sitio que Perimbant conoce bien."}},
[290]={nameES="A Flock of Seagulls",objectivesES={"A Flock of Seagulls","You have scared off many seagulls loitering around the harbour, as Maghôrdo asked. You should report to Maghôrdo at Furtherholm's harbour, near the waterfall.","Maghôrdo has asked you to scare off the seagulls loitering around the harbour.","Talk to Maghôrdo","Seagulls infest the harbour of Furtherholm."}},
[291]={nameES="Una flor para Nimrodel",objectivesES={"Una flor para Nimrodel","Deja la flor para Nimrodel junto a su estatua","Una estatua de Nimrodel se encuentra al norte de Pennasdir a lo largo del camino, más allá de las escaleras hacia Telain Galadhrim.\
\
Pennasdir te ha pedido que coloques una flor en el plato de plata a los pies de la estatua de Nimrodel.","Pennasdir se encuentra en Telain Glorelloth, en Caras Galadhon.\
\
Has dejado la flor para Nimrodel junto a su estatua y ahora deberías regresar a Pennasdir.","Habla con Pennasdir en Telain Glorelloth","Nimrodel fue el amor de Amroth, el Señor perdido de Lothlórien."}},
[292]={nameES="Un Estallido de Fuegos Artificiales",objectivesES={"Un Estallido de Fuegos Artificiales","Frustra a los hobbits entrometidos","Recoge las cajas de fuegos artificiales del carro.","<rgb=#FF0000>¡Oh no, todos los fuegos artificiales del final se han lanzado antes de tiempo!</rgb>","Prepara el espectáculo de fuegos artificiales en el punto de lanzamiento final","<rgb=#FF0000>¡El voluntario debe terminar su tarea!</rgb>","Prepara el espectáculo de fuegos artificiales en el segundo punto de lanzamiento.","Habla con Gandalf el Gris.","Prepara el espectáculo de fuegos artificiales en el segundo punto de lanzamiento","Habla con Gandalf el Gris para iniciar el espectáculo de fuegos artificiales.","Prepara el espectáculo de fuegos artificiales en el primer punto de lanzamiento","Recoge más cajas de fuegos artificiales del carro.","Hobbit entrometido frustrado","Habla con Gandalf el Gris","<rgb=#FF0000>¡El voluntario se ha rendido!</rgb>","Recoge aún más cajas de fuegos artificiales del carro.","Prepara el espectáculo de fuegos artificiales en el punto de lanzamiento final.","<rgb=#FF0000>¡No dejes que todos los fuegos artificiales del final se lancen antes de tiempo!</rgb>","Prepara el espectáculo de fuegos artificiales en el primer punto de lanzamiento.","Habla con Gandalf el Gris para iniciar el espectáculo de fuegos artificiales"}},
[293]={nameES="Un Estallido de Fuegos Artificiales - Diario",objectivesES={"Completa 'Un Estallido de Fuegos Artificiales'.","Un Estallido de Fuegos Artificiales - Diario","Un espectáculo de fuegos artificiales al día... ¡qué mejor manera de celebrar la ocasión!","Completa 'Un Estallido de Fuegos Artificiales'"}},
[294]={nameES="A Fly in the Web",objectivesES={"Find Captain Róglarg in the courtyard of Cirith Ungol","As you pass into Cirith Ungol, you see the works of Mordor clawing into the fortress!","An unseen force tries to bar your way, but it is overcome by your resolve...","A Fly in the Web","Captain Róglarg can be found in the courtyard of Cirith Ungol.\
\
You have disguised yourself as the Silent One and snuck into Cirith Ungol. You should now find Captain Róglarg.","Cirith Ungol can be found high above you on a mountainside of the Ephel Dúath to the north of Dath Nethryn.\
\
Legolas has asked you to disguise yourself as the Silent One and sneak into Cirith Ungol to learn more of the Orcs' plans and how they came to bargain with Shelob.","Legolas has asked you to disguise yourself in the Silent One's armour to learn what the Orcs of Cirith Ungol have planned for King Elessar's armies and how they came to bargain with Shelob.","Pass through the shattered gate of Cirith Ungol","The shattered gate of Cirith Ungol faces eastward from the entrance.\
\
You have entered Cirith Ungol and should now pass through the gate.","Captain Róglarg sees you and beckons you over.\
\
'Well, now! Where'd you get off to, Silent One? Even the Silent Watchers are upset you've come back!\
\
'Ah, but nowhere good, I bet. Offering more dead to Shelob, were you?'\
\
You nod.\
\
'Nar, I don't know why you bother. It's not as if Her Ladyship cares for you...or any of us!\
\
'Ah...what's that fine weapon you've got there? Nabbed it off one of the tarks, I bet!'","Disguise yourself as the Silent One and enter Cirith Ungol"}},
[295]={nameES="Una Afición por las Festividades (Avanzado)",objectivesES={"A medida que se acerca el día del solsticio de verano, los pueblos de la Tierra Media se reúnen para celebrar el gran Festival del Solsticio. ¡Disfruta del baile, la alegría y el amor con tu familia y amigos por tres días más!","Una Afición por las Festividades (Avanzado)","Habla con Faeleth en Minas Tirith (Solsticio de Verano)","Habla con el capitán Khâtaphos en Isla Remota, en las Islas Escudo","Completa 'Celebrando el Solsticio de Verano' tres veces más","Faeleth se encuentra en Minas Tirith (Solsticio de Verano).\
\
Faeleth te da las gracias por continuar celebrando el Solsticio de Verano.","Son muchos los regalos que aguardan a quienes participan en la celebración del Solsticio de Verano, pero para los que se suman a los festejos durante varios días, ¡los regalos son aún mayores!","A medida que se acerca el día del solsticio de verano, los pueblos de la Tierra Media se reúnen para celebrar el gran Festival del Solsticio. ¡Disfruta del baile, la alegría y el amor con tu familia y amigos!"}},
[296]={nameES="Una Afición por las Festividades (Final)",objectivesES={"A medida que se acerca el día del solsticio de verano, los pueblos de la Tierra Media se reúnen para celebrar el gran Festival del Solsticio. ¡Disfruta del baile, la alegría y el amor con tu familia y amigos por tres días más!","Habla con Faeleth en Minas Tirith (Solsticio de Verano)","Habla con el capitán Khâtaphos en Isla Remota, en las Islas Escudo","Completa 'Celebrando el Solsticio de Verano' tres veces más","Faeleth se encuentra en Minas Tirith (Solsticio de Verano).\
\
Faeleth te da las gracias por continuar celebrando el Solsticio de Verano.","Son muchos los regalos que aguardan a quienes participan en la celebración del Solsticio de Verano, pero para los que se suman a los festejos durante varios días, ¡los regalos son aún mayores!","Una Afición por las Festividades (Final)","A medida que se acerca el día del solsticio de verano, los pueblos de la Tierra Media se reúnen para celebrar el gran Festival del Solsticio. ¡Disfruta del baile, la alegría y el amor con tu familia y amigos!"}},
