\
Faeleth te da las gracias por continuar celebrando el Solsticio de Verano.","Son muchos los regalos que aguardan a quienes participan en la celebración del Solsticio de Verano, pero para los que se suman a los festejos durante varios días, ¡los regalos son aún mayores!","A medida que se acerca el día del solsticio de verano, los pueblos de la Tierra Media se reúnen para celebrar el gran Festival del Solsticio. ¡Disfruta del baile, la alegría y el amor con tu familia y amigos!","Una Afición por las Festividades (Intermedio)"}},
[298]={nameES="Una Afición por las Festividades (Intro)",objectivesES={"A medida que se acerca el día del solsticio de verano, los pueblos de la Tierra Media se reúnen para celebrar el gran Festival del Solsticio. ¡Disfruta del baile, la alegría y el amor con tu familia y amigos durante tres días!","A medida que se acerca el día del solsticio de verano, los pueblos de la Tierra Media se reúnen para celebrar el gran Festival del Solsticio. ¡Disfruta del baile, la alegría y el amor con tu familia y amigos durante cinco días!","Habla con Faeleth en Minas Tirith (Solsticio de Verano)","Habla con el capitán Khâtaphos en Isla Remota, en las Islas Escudo","Faeleth se encuentra en Minas Tirith (Solsticio de Verano).\
\
Faeleth te da las gracias por continuar celebrando el Solsticio de Verano.","Una Afición por las Festividades (Intro)","Completa 'Celebrando el Solsticio de Verano' tres veces","Son muchos los regalos que aguardan a quienes participan en la celebración del Solsticio de Verano, pero para los que se suman a los festejos durante varios días, ¡los regalos son aún mayores!","A medida que se acerca el día del solsticio de verano, los pueblos de la Tierra Media se reúnen para celebrar el gran Festival del Solsticio. ¡Disfruta del baile, la alegría y el amor con tu familia y amigos!"}},
[299]={nameES="Una Tarea Insensata",objectivesES={"Habla con Gil Plover fuera del laberinto en los Campos de Caballos","La entrada al laberinto de setos está cerca del área del festival en los Campos de Caballos, al norte de Bree.\
\
Gil Plover te ha desafiado a atravesar el laberinto, de principio a fin, antes de que se acabe el tiempo. El tiempo asignado es el mismo que su récord personal.","Gil Plover, el Maestro del Laberinto de Bree, te ha desafiado a atravesar el laberinto antes de que se acabe el tiempo. No debes demorarte entre los muros de setos.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro cuando finalice el festival actual. </rgb>","Has encontrado la salida","Entra en el laberinto de setos","Una Tarea Insensata","La salida del laberinto de setos debe de estar por aquí en algún lugar... ¿o no?\
\
Deberías intentar encontrar la salida antes de que se acabe el tiempo. Gil Plover salió del laberinto en poco más de un minuto; ¿podrás tú hacerlo en menos?","Encuentra la salida antes de que se acabe el tiempo","Se te ha acabado el tiempo","Has salido del laberinto"}},
[300]={nameES="La esperanza de un necio",objectivesES={"Busca alguna señal de Thorlák","Hjór se encuentra en Echad Dúnann, al suroeste de la Puerta del Cuerno Rojo.\
\
Debes regresar con Hjór y contarle lo que encontraste en la Puerta del Cuerno Rojo.","Hjór necesita ayuda para encontrar a su compañero Thorlák en Caradhras, conocido como el Cruel.","La esperanza de un necio","La carne de la cabra del Cuerno Rojo parece haber sido despellejada y limpiada por un experto.","Thorlák se dirigió a la Puerta del Cuerno Rojo, al noreste de Echad Dúnann.\
\
Hjór ha pedido que busques señales de Thorlák en la Puerta del Cuerno Rojo.","Habla con Hjór"}},
[301]={nameES="A Foothold in Mordor",objectivesES={"The Foothold camp is nearly empty","Mulnír sighs.\
\
'Yes, you have my word that we will send a report - just as soon as we have gathered our wits and made sense of this mess.'","You should find someone to talk to in the Foothold in Udûn and remind them of their duty to send regular reports up to High Captain Sador.","The encampment in Udûn, known as the Foothold, has not given any report in two days.","Talk to Mulnír","You should visit the Foothold in Udûn and remind them of their duty to send regular reports up to High Captain Sador.","Visit the Foothold in Udûn","Talk to Barathron","A Foothold in Mordor"}},
[302]={nameES="A Forest Without Frontiers",objectivesES={"Quickbeam's Huorn appears to be trying to draw your attention","The Huorn wanders off, fading into the shadows of the forest","Quickbeam's Huorn can be found at your side or can be called using your whistle.\
\
You have explored every part of the forest with Quickbeam's Huorn. You should release the Huorn back into the trees and speak to Quickbeam.","A Forest Without Frontiers","Quickbeam's Huorn wanders out of the shadows","In order to combat the creatures encroaching on Fangorn Forest, Quickbeam has granted you a Huorn companion to tend to these troubles, wherever they may be.","After exploring Fangorn Forest with Quickbeam's Huorn, the time has come to return to Derndingle. You gesture to the Huorn that it can return to the forest, and as it strides into the distance, you cannot help but feel it has grown to feel some sort of attachment towards you. It walks into the shadows, and is gone.\
\
As long as you remain in the forest, it is possible your paths will cross once more.","Talk to Quickbeam's Huorn","Quickbeam can be found at Derndingle in south-eastern Fangorn Forest.\
\
You have released your Huorn companion and should now speak to Quickbeam of what you have done.","Explore and protect Fangorn Forest with Quickbeam's Huorn","Talk to Quickbeam","DNT -- will not be seen","Quickbeam wishes for you to investigate various areas throughout Fangorn Forest.\
\
Quickbeam has asked that you explore Fangorn Forest and quell any problems you and his Huorn observe.","DNT -- Players will not see"}},
[303]={nameES="A Forest of Threads",objectivesES={"Speak with Authest","The Weft-mother can be found inside the spider infested cave.\
\
You should defeat the Weft-mother.","Authest, the caretaker of Eilendoth, has asked you to investigate the source of the spider infestation and halt the inpouring of these creatures.","The beacon of Eilendoth is located south-west of Ethring in Ringló Vale.\
\
You should speak with Authest.","A Forest of Threads","Perhaps the strange stone in the cave is what drove the Weft-mother into a frenzy","The source of spiders entering the Vale seems to be coming from inside the cave","Borhador can be found in The Crossing-hall.\
\
You should speak with Borhador.","Investigate the source of the spider infestation","Defeat the Weft-mother","Speak with Borhador","Spiders infest the woods in the western part of Ringló Vale.\
\
Stem the spider infestation in Ringló Vale."}},
[304]={nameES="Un cumpleaños olvidado",objectivesES={"Lóskarl es el residente más antiguo de la Ciudad del Lago, y podría decirte lo que recuerda de la muerte de Smaug. Várthrek te dijo que Lóskarl a menudo cuenta historias en la Posada Hueso de Dragón.'","Lóskarl te dijo que, cuando Bilbo y los enanos llegaron a Esgaroth, había Elfos de los Remos presentes. Si todavía están vivos, podrían decirte más de lo que él puede. Deberías visitar Loeglond y ver si puedes encontrar a estos Elfos de los Remos.'","Uno de los guardias en la entrada de la Ciudad del Lago podría decirte más sobre los últimos días de Esgaroth, justo antes de que el dragón Smaug fuera derrotado. En este aniversario de la llegada de Bilbo a Esgaroth, ¿qué recuerdan los habitantes de la ciudad del pequeño saqueador?","Un cumpleaños olvidado","Viaja a la entrada de la Ciudad del Lago y habla con los guardias","Viaja a Loeglond, la ciudad de los Elfos de los Remos","Habla con Bilbo en el Salón del Fuego, en Rivendel","Encuentra a Celethros en algún lugar cerca de las mazmorras de Felegoth, en Eryn Lasgalen","Los guardias asienten en señal de saludo cuando te acercas","Habla con Várthrek en la entrada de la Ciudad del Lago","Bilbo Bolsón se encuentra en el Salón del Fuego, en Rivendel.","Celethros se encuentra en algún lugar cerca de las mazmorras de Felegoth, en Eryn Lasgalen.","Mientras estás de pie en la orilla del Lago Largo, tus pensamientos se vuelven hacia las aventuras de Bilbo Bolsón y los Enanos de la Compañía de Thorin. El viejo hobbit te ha compartido parte de la historia, y has escuchado porciones de ella de otros que estuvieron allí o conocían los eventos. Hoy debe ser bastante cerca del aniversario de la llegada de Bilbo a Esgaroth, ¿no es así? La ciudad no duró mucho después de eso, pero tampoco el dragón Smaug.\
\
Tu curiosidad estimulada por estas reflexiones, decides hablar con los guardias en la entrada de la Ciudad del Lago y ver qué podrían decirte sobre el papel de Bilbo en los últimos días de Esgaroth.","Aprendiste que un número de Elfos de los Remos se encontraban en Esgaroth cuando los enanos y Bilbo llegaron para reclamar el Montículo Solitario. Si puedes encontrar a algunos de estos Elfos en Loeglond, podrían contarte más sobre su experiencia.'","Encuentra al residente más antiguo de la Ciudad del Lago y pregúntale sobre la muerte de Smaug","Encuentra a alguien en Loeglond que recuerde la llegada de la Compañía de Thorin","Uno de los guardias de la entrada de la Ciudad del Lago podría decirte más sobre los últimos días de Esgaroth, antes de que el dragón Smaug fuera derrotado. En este aniversario de la llegada de Bilbo a Esgaroth, ¿qué recuerdan los habitantes de la ciudad del saqueador?"}},
[305]={nameES="Una queja formal",objectivesES={"Habla con Bob Hojasverdes","Bob Hojasverdes está en la casa de Hob Cimacolina, en el Prado del Toro Bramador, en Dwaling.\
\
Habla con Bob Hojasverdes para conseguir acceso al gran agujero y entregar la carta.","Will Tuffin está en el gran agujero del centro de Dwaling.\
\
Entrega la queja formal a Will Tuffin.","Recupera la queja formal de Ronald Dwalkien","Hob Cimacolina está en su casa en el Prado del Toro Bramador, en Dwaling, al sur del centro del pueblo.\
\
Debes regresar con Hob Cimacolina con noticias de tu éxito y su carta.","Los rufianes que se han instalado en Dwaling son brutales y sin ley, y Hob Cimacolina ya está harto de sus maldades.","Hob Cimacolina está en su casa en el Prado del Toro Bramador, en Dwaling.\
\
Debes regresar con Hob Cimacolina y contarle la respuesta de Will Tuffin.","Toca el timbre y entrega la carta","Ronald Dwalkien está en la casa de Hob Cimacolina, en el Prado del Toro Bramador, en Dwaling.\
\
Hob Cimacolina te ha pedido recuperar la queja formal que pidió a Ronald Dwalkien redactar.","Regresa con Hob Cimacolina","Una queja formal","Has recogido la queja formal","Habla con Hob Cimacolina"}},
[306]={nameES="A Formidable Foe",objectivesES={}},
[307]={nameES="Una fortuna de espíritu festivo",objectivesES={"Habla con Mara Arenales","Cada día hay algo que hacer en Barranca Escarchada. ¡Cada día es Yule! ¡Ven y únete a todos en Barranca Escarchada y participa en muchas actividades del Festival de Yule durante cinco días más!","Completado.","Completa 'Agitación festiva (Intermedio)'","Una fortuna de espíritu festivo","Completa 'Agitación festiva (Final)'","Cada día hay algo que hacer en Barranca Escarchada. ¡Cada día es Yule! ¡Ven y únete a todos en Barranca Escarchada y participa en muchas actividades del Festival de Yule para recibir regalos!","Completa 'Agitación festiva (Avanzado)'","Hay mucho que hacer durante el Festival de Yule. ¡Participa a menudo para ganar maravillosos regalos!\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>(Hay doce días de misiones de participación en el Festival de Agitación y Espíritu de Yule. ¡Planifica en consecuencia!)</rgb>","Completa 'Agitación festiva (Intro)'"}},
[308]={nameES="Una abundancia de Espíritu de la Cosecha",objectivesES={"Una abundancia de Espíritu de la Cosecha","Completa 'Una cosecha abundante (Avanzado)'","Completa 'Una cosecha abundante (Intermedio)'","Complete 'Una cosecha abundante (Intro)'","Habla con Rosa Corneta","Todos los días hay algo que hacer en el Festival de la Cosecha, tanto en el Árbol de la Fiesta como en Wistmead, y también para Tratos o Trucos. ¡Participa en las actividades otoñales durante cinco días más!","Hay mucho que hacer durante el Festival de la Cosecha. ¡Participa a menudo para ganar maravillosos regalos!\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>(Hay veinte días de misiones de participación en Una cosecha abundante y Una cosecha animada. ¡Planifica en consecuencia!)</rgb>","Deberías volver con Rosa Corneta, a quien puedes encontrar cerca del Árbol de la Fiesta y en Wistmead.","Completa 'Una cosecha abundante (Final)'","Todos los días hay algo que hacer en el Festival de la Cosecha, tanto en el Árbol de la Fiesta como en Wistmead, y también para Tratos o Trucos. ¡Participa en las actividades otoñales y consigue regalos!"}},
[309]={nameES="A Foul Brew",objectivesES={}},
[310]={nameES="A Foul Folk",objectivesES={"A local elder has requested your aid in dealing with a band of marauding goblins to the north.","Return to Elder Jangâli in Sen Chatâk with news of your victory.","A Foul Folk","Return to Elder Jangâli in Sen Chatâk","Defeat goblins at Glúkroz to send a message that the goblin raiders there should stay far from Sen Chatâk. Glúkroz can be found north-east of Sen Chatâk."}},
[311]={nameES="Un bosque inmundo",objectivesES={"Los ucornos, los grandes árboles que se mueven libremente, y los guardianes de acebo se pueden encontrar por todo Glâd Ereg.\
\
Lithuilas te ha pedido que derrotes a los ucornos y a los guardianes de acebo que se han enfurecido. Te recomienda que lleves amigos contigo.","Algo maligno corrompe el corazón del bosque de acebos al sur de Gwingris, corrompiendo a las criaturas que una vez habitaron allí en paz.\
\
Se te ha encomendado la tarea de eliminar a esos guardianes de acebo y árboles que han sucumbido a la sombra y ahora atacan a quienes pasan por allí.","Un bosque inmundo","Habla con Lithuilas en Gwingris","Lithuilas está en Gwingris, al norte de Glâd Ereg.\
\
Lithuilas querrá saber de tu éxito."}},
[312]={nameES="A Fraught Decision",objectivesES={"A Fraught Decision","Speak with Raphûz at his home in Jirush","Raphûz requested your advice. You should speak with him about his concerns and confusion.","Raphûz explained his concerns and asked you to give him your advice.","Speak with Raphûz about his concerns","Raphûz wants to explain his decision. Speak with him at his home in Jirush.","Raphûz does not believe the woman is cursed by evil spirits and blames himself for her running into danger. He is torn between the promise he made to his parents and the obligation he feel he has to Ashâmi.","Tell Raphûz <rgb=#00FF00>no</rgb>, you would keep your promise","Tell Raphûz <rgb=#00FF00>yes</rgb>, you would follow your heart","Raphûz is waiting for your response"}},
[313]={nameES="Una cura de agua fresca",objectivesES={"Una cura de agua fresca","La fuente estancada de los orcos Globsnaga se encuentra en Dalgum-ru, al sur del Refugio de las Sombras.\
\
Lleva el odre de agua fresca al suministro de agua de los orcos.","Encuentra el suministro de agua de los orcos Globsnaga","Hay agua fresca en el pozo","Tyki sospecha que el hongo se está propagando entre los orcos a través del agua estancada y contaminada que todos beben. Cree que añadir agua limpia y fresca a su suministro podría ayudar a curarlos.","Llena el odre con agua fresca","Encuentra agua fresca","Tyki se encuentra en el Refugio de las Sombras, al norte de Dalgum-ru.\
\
Debes regresar a Tyki y informarle sobre los resultados de su cura con agua fresca.","Habla con Tyki en el Refugio Sombrío","El agua fresca se puede obtener en la pequeña cueva dentro del Refugio de las Sombras. La fuente estancada de los orcos Globsnaga se encuentra en Dalgum-ru, al sur del Refugio de las Sombras.\
\
Tyki quiere que añadas agua limpia al agua fétida de los orcos Globsnaga para intentar curarlos de su infección fúngica.","Esta agua es salobre y fétida","Vaciaste el odre en el agua de los orcos Globsnaga","Vacia el odre en el agua de los orcos Globsnaga","Llenaste el odre con agua fresca"}},
[314]={nameES="A Friend in Fangorn",objectivesES={"The Huorn has asked to follow you","The Huorn is pleased to have assisted you in your revenge upon the vicious Orcs who invade Fangorn.\
\
You release the Huorn, and it is a happier tree than it was before your chance encounter.","A strange old man in rags hails you from north of the White Hand encampment.\
\
You should speak with this stranger....","See what the Huorn wants","This Huorn bristles with eagerness as you approach. You did not notice it at first, but it has been watching as you stamped out Orc-fires and slew the Orcs who began the burning of the forest.\
\
He wishes to join you as you continue punishing the Orcs.","Talk to the old man who has been watching you","Complete Mourning Felled Friends","The Huorn from Wisewood's grove has seen your heroic efforts and is determined to help you as you continue.","The Huorn is near the Orc-camp on the north-east edge of Fangorn's eaves.","Complete Orcs in Fangorn II","Use the whistle to summon your new friend if you become separated","This admiring Huorn wishes to help you deal with the dense population of Orcs in the White Hand encampment.\
\
You should complete a number of tasks in the encampment, using the whistle to call your tree-friend for help if you become separated.","Complete No Rest for Enemies","Talk to the Huorn to dismiss him","A Friend in Fangorn","The Huorn follows you as you venture throughout the White Hand encampment. You can use your whistle to summon it if you become separated.\
\
You should speak with the Huorn.","The Huorn wishes to follow you. You should call it to your side now."}},
[315]={nameES="Un amigo en Ost Forod",objectivesES={"Mientras Calenglad se reúne con Gwindeth para conseguir el Silithar que Aragorn necesita, quiere que ayudes a Robin Sotopardo en Ost Forod.","Robin Sotopardo vive en Ost Forod, al noreste de Tinnudir en Tyrn Fornech, en Evendim.\
\
Calenglad ha decidido reunirse con Gwindeth para adrquirir el Silithar y te ha pedido que ayudes a Robin Sotopardo en su ausencia.","Un amigo en Ost Forod"}},
[316]={nameES="A Friend in a Sea of Distrust",objectivesES={}},
[317]={nameES="A Friend of Fram",objectivesES={"The Cabed Rhimdath can be found in the south-west of Misthallow.\
\
You should travel to the end of the Cabed Rhimdath.","Up ahead, Fanglind blocks the path once more","A Friend of Fram","Grazadh-gropor can be found in the south-east part of Misthallow.\
\
You should search Grazadh-gropor for signs of little-folk.","Léothred, the Rohirric scholar, recalls a curious story about Fram, and wishes to investigate.","Continue exploring the Cabed Rhimdath","Léothred can be found in Lyndelby.\
\
You should talk to Léothred.","Talk to Fanglind in the Cabed Rhimdath","Once again, you see Fanglind ahead of you on the path","Talk to Léothred at Thokvist","Continue learning the history of the Rohirrim with Léothred","Explore further into the Cabed Rhimdath","The Cabed Rhimdath can be found in the south-west of Misthallow.\
\
You should talk to Fanglind in the Cabed Rhimdath.","Léothred can be found at Thokvist.\
\
You should talk to Léothred.","The Cabed Rhimdath can be found in the south-west of Misthallow.\
\
You should explore the Cabed Rhimdath.","Talk to Fanglind at Lyndelby","This forested valley seems home to only the Taurogrim","This mountain pass looks rather treacherous","Lyndelby can be found in Misthallow.\
\
You should learn the history of the Rohirrim with Léothred.","Fanglind is just outside Lyndelby in Misthallow.\
\
You should talk to Fanglind.","Explore Grazadh-gropor for signs of little-folk","Head for the Cabed Rhimdath in Misthallow","Explore the Cabed Rhimdath","Travel to the end of the Cabed Rhimdath","The Cabed Rhimdath can be found west of Thokvist in Misthallow.\
\
You should head for the Cabed Rhimdath.","The path opens up to a valley with... bridges and houses. How can this be?","Learn the history of the Rohirrim with Léothred","Talk to Léothred at Lyndelby","Is that Fanglind ahead?"}},
[318]={nameES="Amistad con lo Salvaje",objectivesES={"Se te ha dicho que puedes aprender más secretos sobre cómo comunicarte con las criaturas salvajes de Radagast el Pardo.","Radagast el Pardo se encuentra en su torre dentro del campamento de los Eglain, en Agamaur.\
\
Se te ha indicado encontrar a Radagast el Pardo y aprender de él el arte de hablar con las criaturas de la naturaleza.","Amistad con lo Salvaje"}},
[319]={nameES="A Friend of the Woods",objectivesES={"Aid Mossbeard with Shattered Roots","Mossbeard is standing at your side, or can be called with your whistle.\
\
Mossbeard has requested your aid in expediting his journey through Balewood. If you aid in completing his tasks, he will be able to return to Barallas and the other Ents more swiftly.","Mossbeard is at your side.\
\
Mossbeard has communed with the trees of Balewood, and seeks to discover if they have spoken true. You should speak to him and learn what is to be done.","Talk to Barallas","Aid Mossbeard with Old Roots","Mossbeard is at your side.\
\
You have returned to Stonecliff and should now speak to Mossbeard before he tells the rest of his tale to the Ents.","Aid Mossbeard with Cruel Blades","You have arrived at Stonecliff to find Barallas and the others waiting for your arrival","Barallas can be found at Stonecliff in northern Balewood.\
\
You have aided Mossbeard with all of his tasks. You should now return to Barallas at Stonecliff.","Mossbeard is at your side.\
\
Mossbeard has requested your aid in exploring the Balewood before returning to Barallas.","Call Mossbeard to your side","Talk to Mossbeard","A Friend of the Woods","Stonecliff is in northern Balewood.\
\
You have learned much of these woods in your time with Mossbeard. You should now return to Barallas and the others at Stonecliff.","Mossbeard comes to your aid","Aid Mossbeard with Life in Darkness","Return to Stonecliff with Mossbeard","Mossbeard is at your side.\
\
Mossbeard has communed with the trees and now wishes to tell you of the forest's past before relating the remainder of the story to his fellows.","Mossbeard wishes to return to Barallas and the others, but seeks your aid in investigating the Balewood in an attempt to better understand the Orcs and Núrzum."}},
[320]={nameES="Un amigo de los reyes de antaño",objectivesES={"Dos estatuas de Elendil una vez se alzaron en las orillas sureste y suroeste de Tyl Ruinen, pero una estatua ha sido corrompida por las salamandras y la otra ha desaparecido, quizá recuperada por los cazatesoros de Ost Forod. Las Agujas de la Linde están lejos hacia el norte y el este de Valcorriente.\
\
Gwindeth quiere que restaures las dos estatuas de Elendil en Tyl Ruinen. Unos elfos de las Agujas de la Linde podrían ser capaces de preparar un brebaje purificador para la estatua corrompida. Gwindeth no ha podido ir a parar la estatua desaparecida o en qué condiciones estará.","Completa la misión: La estatua corrompida","Restaurada la estatua perdida de Elendil en Tyl Ruinen","Restaurada la estatua corrompida de Elendil en Tyl Ruinen","Gwindeth te ha contado que dos estatuas de Elendil se alzaban en las islas de Tyl Ruinen: una corrompida por las salamandras y la otra perdida.","Completa la misión: La estatua perdida","La Dama Azul está en Gwindethrond, tras la cascada de Valcorriente en el oeste de Emyn Uial, al suroeste de Tyl Ruinen.\
\
Has estaurado las dos estatuas de Elendil en Tyl Ruinen, como Gwindeth pidió, y deberías volver a ella para informarla.","Un amigo de los reyes de antaño"}},
[321]={nameES="Una amistosa bienvenida",objectivesES={"Habla con Brogdagnir en Tinnudir","Tham Ornen se encuentra al noreste de Tinnudir.\
\
Brogdagnir te ha pedido encarecidamente que derrotes a los Angmarim acampados en Tham Ornen.","Una amistosa bienvenida","Brogdagnir se encuentra en Tinnudir, al suroeste de Tham Ornen.\
\
Brogdagnir se alegrará de saber que los Angmarim han sido expulsados de Tham Ornen.","Tham Ornen ha sido ocupada por las fuerzas de Angmar. Se desconoce qué valor ven en las ruinas."}},
[322]={nameES="A Frightened Child",objectivesES={}},
[323]={nameES="Una espantosa falta de espíritu",objectivesES={"Walaric Valeoro se encuentra en Wistmead.\
\
Has ayudado a muchos hobbits a redescubrir el espíritu del Festival de la Cosecha. Deberías regresar con Walaric Valeoro.","Walaric Valeoro se ha preocupado de que los hobbits que visitan Wistmead no se estén divirtiendo, ¡ya sea espeluznante o no!","Una espantosa falta de espíritu","Se pueden encontrar hobbits sin ánimo por todo Wistmead.\
\
Walaric Valeoro está preocupado porque los hobbits que visitan Wistmead no están celebrando con el espíritu adecuado del Festival de la Cosecha. Deberías ayudarlos.","Habla con Walaric Valeoro"}},
[324]={nameES="A Full History",objectivesES={"Evan is just inside the entrance to Tûr Morva.\
\
You have spoken with Elladan and Elrohir concerning their knowledge of Dunlending history and should now report it to Evan. You may wish to be tactful.","Talk to Elladan in Tûr Morva","Talk to Penrod in Tûr Morva","Talk to Elrohir in Tûr Morva","A Full History","Evan of the Falcon-clan is mistrustful of Elves and wants to be sure you know it.","Talk to Evan in Tûr Morva","Elladan is south of the Brenin's house, by the ruins of the ancient fort near Tûr Morva. Elrohir is on a small rise overlooking the lake, west of the entrance to Tûr Morva.\
\
Evan wants you to ask Elladan and Elrohir what they know about Dunland. He thinks they, and all Elves, look down on the shorter-lived races.","Penrod is among the northern buildings of Tûr Morva.\
\
Evan has decided he is not as angry about Elves as he once was and wants you to tell Penrod."}},
[325]={nameES="A Furious Harvest",objectivesES={"Defeat marauding Huorns and gather cords of wood from the malevolent trees near Shádhag. Shádhag can be found north-west of Sormedân.","Return to Elder Jurmêna in Sormedân with the wood","Restless trees on the edge of Adagím have turned violent of late. Elder Jurmêna has requested your aid in bringing peace once more to the Moulder-grove.","A Furious Harvest","Return to Elder Jurmêna in Sormedân with the cords of wood."}},
[326]={nameES="A Game of Brigand-bashing",objectivesES={"Talk to Heburga, daughter of the Thane","Talk to Dala","A Game of Brigand-bashing","Heburga invites you to join a game","The children of Langhold are extremely impressed by your bravery in facing the salamanders of the Wold.","Play a game of Brigand-bashing with the children of Langhold","Heburga is in the centre of Langhold, surrounded by a number of admiring children.\
\
You should speak with Heburga to find out about brigand-bashing.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This quest is solo-only, and cannot be completed in a fellowship.</rgb>","The children of Langhold have invited you to play a game of Brigand-bashing.\
\
You should speak with Heburga to join the children in their game.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This quest is solo-only, and cannot be completed in a fellowship.</rgb>","Dala is at the north gate of Langhold.\
\
You should speak with Dala."}},
[327]={nameES="A Game of Hiding",objectivesES={"The Orcs are searching for Sager within the cellar","Find Cyneswith's son, Sager, in the cellar of the farmhouse","Search the Orcs within the estate for the cellar key","Cyneswith and Sager await your return on the outside of the estate.\
\
Sager has returned to his father's side. Cyneswith will be eager to see that you have rescued his son.","The cellar door is located behind the estate, where Cyneswith waits.\
\
With the cellar door unlocked, you may now enter to search for Sager.","The Orc with the cellar key is likely to be found inside of the estate that Cyneswith hides behind.\
\
Cyneswith has asked you to search for the cellar key among the Orcs pillaging within the estate.","A Game of Hiding","The key has unlocked the cellar doors","Cyneswith rests behind the estate, near the cellar door.\
\
You have found the cellar door's key and should return it to Cyneswith.","You have found the cellar key","Return to Cyneswith outside the farmhouse","Return to Cyneswith near the cellar entrance","Sager seems eager to return to his father","Cyneswith and his son were attacked by the invading Orcs and have found themselves separated. Cyneswith desperately needs to rescue his son before the Orcs can find him.","You recall Cyneswith's words of a fat Orc possessing the key","You should search for Sager within the cellar of the estate.\
\
You have entered the cellar of the estate and may begin searching for Sager, hopefully before the Orcs discover him.","Enter the cellar of the farmhouse"}},
[328]={nameES="Una partida de Hobbitravesuras — Plumas Voladoras",objectivesES={"Una partida de Hobbitravesuras — Plumas Voladoras","Hobbitravesuras es sencillo. Tú y tu equipo deben empujar a una gallina hasta la portería azul tantas veces como sea posible dentro del tiempo asignado. Protege tu portería roja para evitar que el otro equipo marque.","Toma un palo rojo del campo","No abandones el campo de juego","Juega una partida de Hobbitraverusas","Los palos rojos están en el campo.\
\
Haggo Boffin, el capitán de las Plumas Voladoras, te pidió que recojas un palo rojo del campo y te prepares para comenzar.","Marca tantos goles como puedas dentro del tiempo asignado."}},
[329]={nameES="Una partida de Hobbitravesuras — Plumas Voladoras - Campo 2",objectivesES={"Una partida de Hobbitravesuras — Plumas Voladoras - Campo 2","Los palos rojos están en el campo.\
\
nGorbulas Molinopiedra, el capitán de las Plumas Voladoras, te pidió que recojas un palo rojo del campo y te prepares para comenzar.","Hobbitravesuras es sencillo. Tú y tu equipo deben empujar a una gallina hasta la portería azul tantas veces como sea posible dentro del tiempo asignado. Protege tu portería roja para evitar que el otro equipo marque.","Toma un palo rojo del campo","No abandones el campo de juego","Juega una partida de Hobbitraverusas","Marca tantos goles como puedas dentro del tiempo asignado."}},
[330]={nameES="Una partida de Hobbitravesuras — Plumas Voladoras - Campo 3",objectivesES={"Hobbitravesuras es sencillo. Tú y tu equipo deben empujar a una gallina hasta la portería azul tantas veces como sea posible dentro del tiempo asignado. Protege tu portería roja para evitar que el otro equipo marque.","Una partida de Hobbitravesuras — Plumas Voladoras - Campo 3","No abandones el campo de juego","Toma un palo rojo del campo","Los palos rojos están en el campo.\
\
Olo Nudosabio, el capitán de las Plumas Voladoras, te pidió que recojas un palo rojo del campo y te prepares para comenzar.","Juega una partida de Hobbitraverusas","Marca tantos goles como puedas dentro del tiempo asignado."}},
[331]={nameES="Una partida de Hobbitravesuras — Plumas Voladoras - Campo 4",objectivesES={"Hobbitravesuras es sencillo. Tú y tu equipo deben empujar a una gallina hasta la portería azul tantas veces como sea posible dentro del tiempo asignado. Protege tu portería roja para evitar que el otro equipo marque.","Una partida de Hobbitravesuras — Plumas Voladoras - Campo 4","Los palos rojos están en el campo.\
\
Dimple Cavada, el capitán de las Plumas Voladoras, te pidió que recojas un palo rojo del campo y te prepares para comenzar.","Toma un palo rojo del campo","No abandones el campo de juego","Juega una partida de Hobbitraverusas","Marca tantos goles como puedas dentro del tiempo asignado."}},
[332]={nameES="Una partida de Hobbitravesuras — Picos de Acero",objectivesES={"Los palos azules están en el campo.\
\
Carnelian Ciñatiesa, la capitana de los Picos de Acero, te pidió que recojas un palo azul del campo y te prepares para jugar.","Una partida de Hobbitravesuras — Picos de Acero","No abandones el campo de juego","Juega una partida de Hobbitraverusas","Toma un palo azul del campo","Hobbitravesuras es sencillo. Tú y tu equipo deben empujar a una gallina hasta la portería roja tantas veces como sea posible dentro del tiempo asignado. Protege tu portería azul para evitar que el otro equipo marque.","Marca tantos goles como puedas dentro del tiempo asignado."}},
[333]={nameES="Una partida de Hobbitravesuras — Picos de Acero - Campo 2",objectivesES={"Los palos azules están en el campo.\
\
May Campotieso, la capitana de los Picos de Acero, te pidió que recojas un palo azul del campo y te prepares para jugar.","Una partida de Hobbitravesuras — Picos de Acero - Campo 2","No abandones el campo de juego","Juega una partida de Hobbitraverusas","Toma un palo azul del campo","Hobbitravesuras es sencillo. Tú y tu equipo deben empujar a una gallina hasta la portería roja tantas veces como sea posible dentro del tiempo asignado. Protege tu portería azul para evitar que el otro equipo marque.","Marca tantos goles como puedas dentro del tiempo asignado."}},
[334]={nameES="Una partida de Hobbitravesuras — Picos de Acero - Campo 3",objectivesES={"Los palos azules están en el campo.\
\
Belba Casadura, la capitana de los Picos de Acero, te pidió que recojas un palo azul del campo y te prepares para jugar.","Una partida de Hobbitravesuras — Picos de Acero - Campo 3","No abandones el campo de juego","Juega una partida de Hobbitraverusas","Toma un palo azul del campo","Hobbitravesuras es sencillo. Tú y tu equipo deben empujar a una gallina hasta la portería roja tantas veces como sea posible dentro del tiempo asignado. Protege tu portería azul para evitar que el otro equipo marque.","Marca tantos goles como puedas dentro del tiempo asignado."}},
[335]={nameES="Una partida de Hobbitravesuras — Picos de Acero - Campo 4",objectivesES={"Marca tantos goles como puedas dentro del tiempo asignado.","No abandones el campo de juego","Juega una partida de Hobbitraverusas","Toma un palo azul del campo","Hobbitravesuras es sencillo. Tú y tu equipo deben empujar a una gallina hasta la portería roja tantas veces como sea posible dentro del tiempo asignado. Protege tu portería azul para evitar que el otro equipo marque.","Una partida de Hobbitravesuras — Picos de Acero - Campo 4","Los palos azules están en el campo.\
\
Carnelian Piedesapo, la capitana de los Picos de Acero, te pidió que recojas un palo azul del campo y te prepares para jugar."}},
[336]={nameES="A Gentle Nudge",objectivesES={"Noriel has retreated to the Elf-ruins of Haldirith in Thinglad, at the centre of the forest, upon a hill.\
\
You should speak with Noriel.","Noriel wants you to frighten away the fishermen who have set up nets along the banks of the Anduin in Thinglad.","From a hiding place, <rgb=#FF0000>whistle</rgb> at the nearby fisherman to scare him","Wait a few moments","Find the Elf-outpost of Haldirith","The fisherman's nerves seem shaken","This is a good place to hide","Wait a few moments before continuing.","From a hiding place, <rgb=#FF0000>roar</rgb> at the nearby fisherman to scare him","The fisherman trembles with fear","The fisherman seems frightened","Eso pareció dar resultado","From a hiding place, <rgb=#FF0000>mumble</rgb> at the nearby fisherman to scare him","A Gentle Nudge","The fishermen's camp can be found along the banks of the Anduin in Thinglad.\
\
You should sneak to the camp, crouch in some undergrowth nearby, and perform tricks to try to frighten away the men.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This quest uses emotes. You must target the intended recipient of the emote in order for quest emotes to work.</rgb>","Wait a few moments before trying again.","From a hiding place, <rgb=#FF0000>clap</rgb> at the nearby fisherman to scare him"}},
[337]={nameES="Un Arma Suave",objectivesES={"Las ramas de madera de cerezo pueden encontrarse en los campos al sur de Duillond, junto al camino hacia Celondim, probablemente cerca de las bases de los árboles.\
\
Debes recoger madera de cerezo para reforzar las suelas de las botas usadas en el pisoteo de musarañas.","Deluraw se encuentra en Duillond, cerca de los hornos.\
\
Debes llevarle las ramas de cerezo que recogiste a Deluraw.","Lleva las ramas de madera de cerezo a Deluraw","Un Arma Suave","El zapatero del evento de Aplastamiento de Musarañas necesita más madera para las suelas especiales de las botas.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro cuando finalice el festival actual. </rgb>"}},
[338]={nameES="A Giant Possibly Named Hregmód",objectivesES={"Completado.","A terrible stone-giant walks among the hills of Misthallow. Rumour says he is called Hregmód, but none can remember who might have given him that name, for no one to see him up close has survived.","Search among the hills of Misthallow, and see if you can find the creature called Hregmód. Be wary none can remember who might have given him that name, as no one to see him up close has survived.","You have slain the stone-giant who stalked the hills of Misthallow and fed upon countless victims over the years. By doing so you have put an end to his reign of terror and learned that his name was in fact Hregmód, but now that he is slain you think it is best for that name to fade into obscurity, disappearing into the mists along this stretch of the Langflood.","You have heard rumours of a terrible stone-giant living among the hills of Misthallow who goes by the name of Hregmód, The rumours also include stories of the damage he's caused to the homes and lives of those dwelling here, person and creature alike. Putting an end to Hregmód, if that is truly his name, will be of little relief to his countless victims, but Misthallow will be made safer without him in it.","Defeat Hregmód, if that is his name","A Giant Possibly Named Hregmód","Completado","A terrible stone-giant walks among the hills of Misthallow. Rumour says that he is called Hregmód, and ending this creature would bring some amount of peace throughout the region.","Defeated the giant once called Hregmód"}},
[339]={nameES="A Giant!",objectivesES={}},
[340]={nameES="A Gift From Radagast",objectivesES={"Habla con Radagast","Radagast can be found in Rhosgobel.\
\
Wait for Radagast to find what he is looking for.","Radagast can be found in Rhosgobel.\
\
You should talk to Radagast.","Radagast pulls out a small pouch from his robes","Radagast the Brown invited you to his hidden dwelling in the southern end of Mirkwood to ask for your help in a vast undertaking.","Wait for Radagast","A Gift From Radagast"}},
[341]={nameES="A Gift Gone Astray",objectivesES={"Look for a young rider named Sithgar in Ost Rimmon, in the Beacon Hills.","Return to Guthláf","When you return to the Rohirrim bivouac, you should let Guthláf know that you found Sithgar in Ost Rimmon and helped him to ready his horse for travel again.","A Gift Gone Astray","Help Sithgar","Look for Sithgar","You should help Sithgar recover his horse and return to his Éored.","In the Rohirrim bivouac, Guthláf asks you to look for a young rider named Sithgar who fell behind."}},
[342]={nameES="Un Regalo para Amdir",objectivesES={"Amdir solo finge beber el té; se ve aún más pálido que antes...","Amdir está sentado al otro lado del camino de Celandine, en el centro de Archet.\
\
Debes llevar a Amdir el té restaurador de arándanos de Celandine para ayudarlo a recuperar su fuerza y su claridad.","Asegúrate de que Amdir beba el té de arándanos","Esta misión no puede completarse fuera de la introducción.","Un Regalo para Amdir","Regresa con Celandine y miente por el bien de Amdir","Celandine preparó un té medicinal de arándanos para Amdir, con la esperanza de que lo fortaleciera y animara contra la sombra que ha caído sobre él.","Celandine está al otro lado del camino de Amdir, en el centro de Archet.\
\
Debes regresar con Celandine y mentir en nombre de Amdir. Él no bebió su té, pero no quiere que ella se desilusione..."}},
[343]={nameES="Un Obsequio para la Doncella Elfa",objectivesES={"Un Obsequio para la Doncella Elfa","Arrod está en su puesto de vigilancia, en lo alto de las Gargantas del Bruinen, junto a unas antiguas ruinas.\
\
Narlinn ha rechazado el obsequio de Arrod y te ha pedido que se lo devuelvas.","Lleva el collar de Arrod a Narlinn","Narlinn está en Thorenhad, el campamento de los hijos de Elrond, en las Gargantas del Bruinen, al norte de las guaridas de osos.\
\
Arrod te ha pedido que entregues el collar a Narlinn, la doncella Elfa que es objeto de su devoción.","Devuelve el collar de Arrod a Arrod","Arrod ha confeccionado un collar para la doncella Elfa Narlinn, de quien está enamorado."}},
[344]={nameES="A Gift for the Future",objectivesES={"Return to Gôbezhir","You have invited Mêshaget to join you and Gôbezhir, so that the two of you can present him with a gift.","You went with Gôbezhir to present his masterwork axe to Mêshaget.","Complete Instance: A Gift for the Future","Completed Instance: A Gift for the Future","Gôbezhir has asked you to talk to Mêshaget and see if he will join the two of you. Mêshaget is in the courtyard of Jiret-menêsh.","A Gift for the Future","Gôbezhir Firmhand, master smith of Jiret-menêsh, has decided to give his life's masterwork as a gift to Mêshaget.","You have invited Mêshaget to join you and Gôbezhir, so that the two of you can present him with a gift. Gôbezhir is in the crafting area of Jiret-menêsh.","Talk to Mêshaget","Talk to Gôbezhir"}},
[345]={nameES="A Gift for the Master",objectivesES={"Eigár can be found in Lake-town.\
\
You should talk to Eigár.","Talk to Mervárth","Collect calamine ore","Mervárth would like to give a gift to Dagrun as congratulations for her new appointment. Help Mervárth gather the supplies needed.","Collect copper ore","Talk to Víthog the Forester","Collected calamine ore","Málmi the Ore Trader can be found in Erebor.\
\
You should talk to Málmi.","Copper and calamine ore can be found nearby in Erebor.\
\
You should collect a chunk of copper ore and a chunk of calamine ore.","Dagrun can be found in the Master's manor in Lake-town.\
\
You should talk to Dagrun.","A Gift for the Master","The scrap pile can be found near the forester's house.\
\
You should search the scrap pile for a good piece of wood.","Talk to Málmi","Málmi the Ore Trader can be found in Erebor, in the Hall Under the Mountain.\
\
You should talk to Málmi.","Rísta can be found in Dale.\
\
You should talk to Rísta.","Mervárth can be found in the Trade Commission Headquarters in Lake-town.\
\
You should talk to Mervárth.","This piece of wood will work!","Talk to Rísta","Talk to Dagrun","You realize that Mervárth forgot to mention what the gift is","Talk to Málmi in Erebor, in the Hall Under the Mountain","Málmi takes the ore from you. You watch as he swiftly transforms the rocks into a bar of pure metal. He hands it to you.\
\
'Since this is part of a gift for the Master of Lake-town, I will not charge you for my services. Give her my regards and tell her Lake-town has friends in Erebor!'","Collected copper ore","Víthog the Forester can be found in the Dale-lands west of Lake-town.\
\
You should talk to Víthog the Forester.","Talk to Eigár the Dock-worker"}},
[346]={nameES="Un regalo para el norte",objectivesES={"Habla con Ulfar","Ulfar ha regresado a Ojo de Aguja.\
\
Como has tenido éxito en tu misión, deberías volver con Ulfar para contarle lo sucedido.","Un regalo para el norte","El campamento de Olwir está en las zonas norte del Pantano de los Juncos.\
\
Ulfar ha decidido que el plan de Olwir debe ser detenido y te ha pedido que reúnas un grupo de guerreros para acompañarlo al campamento. Una vez allí, planea infiltrarse y matar a cualquier troll de piedra que los enanos de Olwir hayan capturado.","Por las órdenes que encontraste, Ulfar ha sabido que Olwir planea capturar un troll de piedra que merodea por el Pantano de los Juncos y entregarlo como regalo a los Duramano del norte. La vaca que robó a Filibert era el cebo para atrapar a la criatura."}},
[347]={nameES="Un regalo para el norte",objectivesES={"Enfrenta a Olwir","Acércate a la puerta","Debes encontrar una manera de entrar en el campamento enano. Tal vez desafiar a los enanos a un combate los haga abrir la puerta.","Espera a los Duramano","Has viajado a las afueras del campamento enano en el Pantano de los Juncos. Allí esperas poner fin al plan del enano Olwir de capturar un troll de piedra y dárselo como regalo al enano Skorgrím en el norte.","Desafía a los Duramano frente a la puerta","Los Duramano han abierto la puerta para responder a tu desafío. Deberías hacer algo que inicie el combate.","Has encontrado a Olwir y derrotado a los guardias que lo protegían. ¡Tiene un troll de piedra enjaulado! Deberías enfrentarte a Olwir.","Has encontrado a Olwir, y tiene un troll de piedra enjaulado. Deberías derrotar a los Duramano que lo protegen.","<rgb=#FF0000>Abofetear</rgb> al rastreador Duramano","Debes encontrar una manera de entrar en el campamento enano.","Los Duramano han abierto la puerta para responder a tu desafío.","Busca en el campamento a Olwir","Has encontrado a Olwir, junto con un troll enjaulado.","Has derrotado a los enanos que custodiaban la puerta. Deberías avanzar hacia el campamento en busca de Olwir o de un troll de piedra.","Derrota a los guardias de Olwir","<rgb=#FF0000>Desafía</rgb> a los Duramano frente a la puerta","Eh... está bien, ¡derrota al troll de piedra!","Parece que Olwir ya no es un problema, pero ahora tienes uno más grande: un troll de piedra que debe ser derrotado.","Derrota al troll de piedra","Un regalo para el norte"}},
[348]={nameES="A Gift for the Westemnet",objectivesES={"The steed is packed and ready for its journey to Edoras","Collect Fastred's pendant","Talk to Fastred","Having gathered your portion of Fastred's gift, you should load it onto the horse he mentioned earlier. \
\
The horse can be found outside the mead-hall.","Fastred wants to send a gift westward to distract Edoras from his blatant disregard for the King's decree. Grain, delicious cuisine of the Sutcrofts, and a pendant are the items he wishes to send.","Load Fastred's steed with the gifts","Collected Fastred's pendant","Food can be found in the Mead Hall and kitchens throughout Snowbourn. Grain can be found in the fields directly outside town. Fastred's pendant can be found in his home.\
\
Fastred wants you to help him prepare a gift of sorts to be sent to Edoras. He wishes for you to gather some portions of the gift while he handles his own preparations.","Fastred can be found in the Mead Hall of Snowbourn.","A Gift for the Westemnet"}},
[349]={nameES="A Gift from the Enemy",objectivesES={"Sun-touched Morgul-trolls can be found in the hills surrounding Henneth Annûn.\
\
Ereblen has asked you to return to the sun-touched Morgul-trolls you found previously and scrape patches of moss from them.","Deliver the moss to Ereblen in Henneth Annûn","The trolls of Mordor and Minas Morgul that turned to stone in North Ithilien now serve as an unexpected source of a valuable moss.","A Gift from the Enemy","Ereblen can be found in Henneth Annûn.\
\
You have gathered a suitable amount of moss from the sun-touched trolls and should now deliver it to Ereblen."}},
[350]={nameES="A Gift from the Kintai",objectivesES={}},
[351]={nameES="A Gift of Cheese",objectivesES={"Speak with Majâryan in the Court of Larinâsta","Deliver the cheese baskets to each of three customers in Zajâna.","Deliver the second cheese basket to the second customer","Return to the Court of Larinâsta in Zajâna and speak with Majâryan.","Pick up the cheese deliveries from Majâryan's table in the Court of Larinâsta in Zajâna.","Deliver the third cheese basket to the third customer","Deliver the first cheese basket to the first customer","Majâryan, a merchant in the Court of Larinâsta, has asked you to help with her cheese deliveries to local customers.","A Gift of Cheese"}},
[352]={nameES="Un regalo de oro",objectivesES={"Lleva el esqueje de mallorn a Nífdir","Nífdir is at his camp in the Drownholt, west of the Malledhrim outpost of Estolad Mernael.\
\
You should return to Nífdir to show him the seedling donated by Menassiel.","Menassiel can be found at Cerin Amroth in Lothlórien.\
\
You should speak with Menassiel and see if she will gift the Huorns of Mirkwood with a young mallorn, a light to dispel the shadows upon their wretched existence.","The Elf Nífdir is moved by the unhappy state of the Mirk-huorns and the tale of their slow loss of hope. He wishes to do something to alleviate their sadness and despair.","Un regalo de oro","Habla con Menassiel en Cerin Amroth"}},
[353]={nameES="A Gift of War",objectivesES={"Isengard has moved some advanced siege-craft south to attack Helm's Deep. You should count the different types of siege-craft to learn more of the enemy.","A Gift of War","Saruman's interest in war machinery has grown of late, for he now employs many siege-weapons for his intended attack upon Helm's Deep.\
\
Hopefully you can help the defenders of Helm's Deep with your knowledge of the enemy.","Completado","Siege-craft and war machines can be found in Shatorthum.\
\
You should examine the different types of weapons to learn of the technology that Isengard harbours."}},
[354]={nameES="A Gift of Warmth in Winter",objectivesES={"A Gift of Warmth in Winter","Renfaer has asked you to deliver Noriel's gift for the departing Rohirrim of Stangard.","Bring the gift of hides to Wynmar at his new camp","Wynmar and his men are at their new temporary camp on the southern river-bank of Thinglad.\
\
You should bring the hides to Wynmar as a final parting gift, a token of good will from the Elves."}},
[355]={nameES="A Gilded Veneer, Part 1: Sharûla",objectivesES={"Sharûla smiles confidently at you, but her eyes are cold","Sharûla stands outside her manor in the north-east reaches of the Upper Ward, just west of the Tor-gardens.","Hármelak is inside the Meeting-hall of Dâr Laja, waiting for your report of Sharûla's accounts.","Sharûla has invited you to study the documents and ledgers she has provided for Hármelak's perusal.","Nothing in the contents of these papers seem out-of-place or suspect","Hármelak has kept a close watch upon Khôltekh's dealings in Umbar-môkh, and she wants to ensure that his power does not threaten her own.","Talk to Hármelak in Dâr Laja","Talk to Sharûla outside her manor in the Upper Ward","Examine Sharûla's papers","A Gilded Veneer, Part 1: Sharûla","Sharûla's manor can be found in the north-east reaches of the Upper Ward, just west of the Tor-gardens.","The ledger records Sharûla's many business transactions, and seems above-board","Examine Sharûla's ledgers"}},
[356]={nameES="A Gilded Veneer, Part 2: Confused Bookkeeping",objectivesES={"A Gilded Veneer, Part 2: Confused Bookkeeping","Hármelak is inside the Meeting-hall of Dâr Laja, waiting for you to return from Tâkhdar with proof of Sharûla's misdeeds.","Smugglers within Tâkhdar, the Cellars of Umbar-môkh beneath the city, may possess records that will shed light upon Sharûla's misdeeds.","Hármelak has asked you to procure clear records from the smugglers of Tâkhdar that might shed some light on Sharûla's misdeeds.","Bring the confused records to Hármelak in Dâr Laja"}},
[357]={nameES="A Gilded Veneer, Part 3: An Unexpected Call",objectivesES={"Return to Sharûla's manor unannounced and unheralded","A Gilded Veneer, Part 3: An Unexpected Call","Zakhâz appears to be struggling with a difficult decision.","Wait for Zakhâz to make his decision","Hármelak has not given up on proving that Sharûla has committed some misdeed, and the Golden Queen wants your continued aid in service of that aim.","Hármelak wants you to return to Sharûla's manor in the north-eastern Upper Ward, on the edge of the Tor-gardens... but this time she wants you to return unannounced.","Talk to Zakhâz outside Sharûla's manor","Sharûla's steward, Zakhâz, guards the entrance to her manor in the Upper Ward.","Sharûla is nowhere to be seen, but her Steward guards the door inside"}},
[358]={nameES="A Gilded Veneer, Part 4: Another Residence",objectivesES={"Inside the lockbox you find papers to suggest Sharûla has funded Azagath's ventures","A lockbox in the middle of Sharûla's secret residence may contain evidence of her support for Azagath Sea-shadow.","According to Zakhâz, the entrance to Sharûla's second, secret residence is located in Tâkhdar, south of the stairs to Dâr Laja.","Sharûla's secret residence is a hideout for supporters of Azagath Sea-shadow!","Supporters of Azagath Sea-shadow come and go frequently throughout Sharûla's secret residence.","Bring the incriminating documents to Hármelak in Dâr Laja","Find Sharûla's second, secret residence in Tâkhdar","Zakhâz pauses for a long moment, steeling his resolve.\
\
'You know that Azagath Sea-shadow has apparently revealed himself a traitor to the Kindred? I believe that Lady Sharûla has taken in with a crowd of supporters who desire that he be reinstated to a position of power in the city! She keeps a second, secret residence in Umbar-môkh where she meets with these loyalists and plots to overthrow the remaining members of the Kindred, including Lady Hármelak! I can keep silent no longer!\
\
'The entrance to her secret residence is in Tâkhdar, south of the Meeting-hall stairs. Please, my friend... please show mercy to my lady. She has been led astray by the venomous whispers of those who follow Azagath. I know she will repent of her misdeeds.'","A Gilded Veneer, Part 4: Another Residence","Sharûla's steward Zakhâz told you that the lady of the house possesses a second, secret residence in Umbar-môkh beneath the city.","Hármelak is in the Meeting-hall of Dâr Laja. She will be pleased to see the documents you recovered that suggest Sharûla has continued funding Azagath's assorted ventures.","Search the lockbox in Sharûla's secret residence"}},
[359]={nameES="A Gilded Veneer, Part 5: Safety and Security",objectivesES={"Hármelak is inside the Meeting-hall of Dâr Laja, waiting for your report that her swords have been delivered.","A Gilded Veneer, Part 5: Safety and Security","Bring the shiny swords to Jaith outside the Meeting-hall of Dâr Laja","Jaith nods in recognition.","Concerned about the possibility that others among the residents of Umbar Baharbêl might seek to assist Azagath Sea-shadow, Hármelak wants her guards to be equipped with better weapons.","Hármelak's order of fresh swords for her personal guardsmen is ready to be picked up inside the Swain's Guild-hall.","Talk to Hármelak in Dâr Laja","Jaith appraises the collection of shiny swords you have brought.\
\
'These swords seem well-made, but are they really any better than the ones already wielded by Lady Hármelak's personal guardsmen? The only difference I can see is that these are much shinier.'","Jaith stands guard outside the Meeting-hall of Dâr Laja. He is waiting to receive the swords Hármelak ordered from the Swain's Guild-hall."}},
[360]={nameES="A Gilded Veneer, Part 6: Inquiries at Kheb Hanût",objectivesES={"A Gilded Veneer, Part 6: Inquiries at Kheb Hanût","Talk to Lashêm in Kheb Hanût","Talk to Okhmath in Kheb Hanût","Hármelak has heard there might be associates of Sharûla in the market of Kheb Hanût beneath the city, and she wants you to root them out.","Hármelak asked you to speak to merchants in the market of Kheb Hanût in north-west Tâkhdar and learn if any of them share Sharûla's loyalty to Azagath.","Talk to Dayêri in Kheb Hanût","Talk to Nagamûn in Kheb Hanût"}},
[361]={nameES="A Gilded Veneer, Part 7: Lashêm's Request",objectivesES={"Lashêm is waiting for you to deliver his misplaced parcels to him at Kheb Hanût, in Tâkhdar.","Lashêm smiles broadly as you approach.\
\
'You recovered my parcels! I thank you, friend. The dried squid contained within will bring me a fair profit, and I will raise a toast to the Golden Queen when I have a moment to do so.'","Bring the misplaced parcels to Lashêm in Kheb Hanût","The merchant Lashêm has a request to make of you concerning some of his parcels that were \\qmisplaced.\\q","Lashêm's parcels were \\qmisplaced\\q by a number of smugglers operating out of Sâl Bajat, and he needs you to recover them and teach the miscreants he will not be intimidated.","A Gilded Veneer, Part 7: Lashêm's Request"}},
[362]={nameES="A Gilded Veneer, Part 8: Hármelak's Order",objectivesES={"Talk to Lashêm in Kheb Hanût","Lashêm stands in disbelief, surrounded by guardsmen.","Lashêm's smile fades as guards arrive and draw their swords on him","The sound of approaching footsteps!","Talk to Hármelak's guardsman","Talk to Hármelak in Dâr Laja","Lashêm stands in stunned silence. Only the words of Hármelak can free him now.","A Gilded Veneer, Part 8: Hármelak's Order","Hármelak is in the Meeting-hall of Dâr Laja. Perhaps she will explain to you why Lashêm has been apprehended.","Hármelak moves to maintain order in Umbar-môkh as she does in Umbar Baharbêl above.","The sound of approaching footsteps echoes throughout Kheb Hanût.","Hármelak's guards hold Lashêm at swordpoint."}},
[363]={nameES="Un destello en la penumbra",objectivesES={"Al enano Darri lo puedes encontrar en la Vigésimo Primera Sala, en Moria.\
\\Tras haber encontrado varios espejos intactos, debes regresar con Darri e informarle de tu éxito.","Encuentra el cuarto espejo","Has registrado una descripción precisa de este espejo","Encuentra el primer espejo","Vuelve con Darri en la Vigésimo Primera Sala","Un destello en la penumbra","Encuentra el segundo espejo","Darri se ha estado preguntando cuál era el propósito de los antiguops espejos de Moria.","Encuentra el tercer espejo","Los cuatro espejos se encuentran en las esquinas de la Vigésimo Primera Sala, en Zelem-melek\
\
Debes encontrar los espejos y registrar su ubicación y rotación."}},
[364]={nameES="Un rayo de esperanza",objectivesES={"El espejo situado en las Fundaciones de Piedra es la única fuente de luz pura en estas profundidades estigias. Las cosas malvadas que se arrastran a menudo arruinan su alineación para restaurar la oscuridad.","Un rayo de esperanza","Drafli se encuentra en el Refugio Sombrío, en las regiones occidentales de las Fundaciones de Piedra.\
\
Deberías decirle a Drafli que has realineado el espejo.","Este espejo se encuentra solo en un terrible pantano de pasajes corruptos, con el hongo extendiéndose a su alrededor. Deberías informar a alguien en el Refugio Sombrío sobre el espejo que encontraste en las profundidades.","Habla con Drafli"}},
[365]={nameES="A Glimpse of Daylight",objectivesES={"Speak with Mizâdi in Iridír when you are ready to go","Speak with Mizâdi in Iridír","Speak with Mizâdi in Iridír when you are ready to go.","Speak with Mizâdi in Iridír.","A Glimpse of Daylight","A small moment of peace has given Mizâdi time to speak with Amalíbi, to see the consequences of her decisions."}},
[366]={nameES="A Glimpse of the Fall",objectivesES={}},
[367]={nameES="A Glow in the Corners",objectivesES={}},
[368]={nameES="A Gnarled Problem",objectivesES={}},
[369]={nameES="A Gnawing Worry",objectivesES={"Talk to Luned at Galtrev","Search for Leolin","Leolin, a friend of Luned, is late to return from his early morning venture onto Pren Gwydh's road.\
\
You should search for Leolin and encourage him to return to Galtrev to put his friend's fears to rest.","Luned worries about a friend who ventured out into Pren Gwydh to gather supplies for Galtrev. Like many other stout folk during these trying times, he has not yet returned.","The Warg that did this evil deed has been defeated, but revenge cannot bring back the dead","Luned is at Galtrev, worriedly awaiting news of her late friend.\
\
You should break the news that Leolin met an untimely end at the hands of a Warg.","A Gnawing Worry"}},
[370]={nameES="A Good Cleaning",objectivesES={}},
[371]={nameES="A Good Draught",objectivesES={"Tell Quickbeam how the draught affected the trolls.","Quickbeam has heard musings among the Wise that trolls might have once been Ents, twisted to dark forms. He is doubtful that this is the case, but if their twisted nature is in some manner similar to that of the Ents, then he believes it might be worthwhile to try an ancient draught upon them, meant to still the stirrings of maddened or fearful Huorns.","Stone-trolls patrol the uruk-encampment in eastern Nan Curunír.\
\
Quickbeam asked you to take the strange draught he provided and try splashing it upon the Stone-trolls. It may serve to soothe them or render them sleepy, as it is meant to do with the Huorns.","Talk to Quickbeam","A Good Draught"}},
[372]={nameES="Una grave corrupción",objectivesES={"Andreg is taking you to meet with Saeradan at the Rohirrim scout-camp; however, he needs help with his own mission first.","Andreg has asked you to collect leaves and bark covered in the strange corruption so that Saeradan might be able to examine it.","Una grave corrupción","You should bring the corrupted materials you collected to Andreg.","Bring the piles of oozing corruption to Andreg"}},
[373]={nameES="Un gran estruendo en la noche",objectivesES={"Lleva el polvo al Capitán Pasolargo","Has encontrado un barril explotado entre los escombros, cubierto de una fina polvora negra","Aggy Cavazaña recuerda una gran explosión en el pueblo, y que ningún guardia salvo ella se despertó por el ruido.","Un gran estruendo en la noche","El Capitán Pasolargo se encuentra en Puente de Caballetes.\
\
Deberías llevar el polvo que Encontraste Al Capitán Pasolargo.","Una pista sobre el gran estruendo oído en Puente de Caballetes puede encontrarse en algún lugar del pueblo.\
\
Aggy cavazaña te ha pedido que busques la fuente del caos Que arruinó puente de caballetes la noche anterior."}},
[374]={nameES="Un Gran Trasgo",objectivesES={"Derrota al Gran Trasgo","Un Gran Trasgo","El Gran Trasgo derrotado","El Gran Trasgo se encuentra en la sala del trono de la Ciudad de los Trasgos, al noreste del campamento de Glóin.\
\
Glóin habló con pesar del mal que acecha en el corazón de la Ciudad de los Trasgos. Luego te pidió que entraras en ese lugar maligno y derrotaras al Gran Trasgo antes de que su amenaza crezca demasiado como para contenerla.","Habla con Glóin en su campamento en las Montañas Nubladas.","Glóin recordó su experiencia junto a Thorin y la Compañía cuando se enfrentaron al Gran Trasgo durante su viaje con Bilbo Bolsón.","Glóin está en su campamento, justo fuera de la entrada a la Ciudad de los Trasgos.\
\
Entraste en la Ciudad de los Trasgos y exploraste lo más profundo de ese lugar hasta hallar la sala del trono. Allí derrotaste a Ashûrz, el Gran Trasgo. Con su caída, has quebrantado la fuerza de los trasgos de la Ciudad de los Trasgos y reducido la amenaza que representan para los pueblos del este y oeste de las Montañas Nubladas. Debes regresar con Glóin para informarle."}},
[375]={nameES="A Greater Enemy",objectivesES={}},
[376]={nameES="A Greater Foe",objectivesES={"Elaglar of Dol Amroth fears that the Corsair forces under Azruthor's rule in Tarlang's Crown will soon grow beyond control.","Harnion can be found off the side of the road leading through Tarlang's Crown, to the north of Edhellond.\
\
Elaglar has asked you to seek Harnion in Tarlang's Crown and investigate the Corsair forces massing there.","Talk to Harnion in Tarlang's Crown","A Greater Foe","DNT"}},
[377]={nameES="A Greater Mystery",objectivesES={}},
[378]={nameES="Un robo importante",objectivesES={"Las cajas de Gadaric se encuentran en las ruinas de Minas Eriol, al sureste de la Posada Abandonada, donde Gadaric espera tu regreso.\
\
Para ayudar a Gadaric y a los Eglain, aceptaste recuperar las mercancías que quedaron en Minas Eriol tras el ataque de los trasgos.","Lleva los paquetes de mercancías a Gadaric Mascador","Un robo importante","Gadaric Mascador es miembro de los Eglain, una tribu de Hombres que viven en las Tierras Solitarias. Se ganan la vida comerciando con los viajeros que atraviesan las Tierras Solitarias."}},
[379]={nameES="A Green Expanse",objectivesES={}},
[380]={nameES="A Grieving Father",objectivesES={}},
[381]={nameES="Una lealtad sombría",objectivesES={"Talk to Doron","While venturing through Ost Celebrant, Doron has noticed grim standards flying among the ruins. Doron wishes for you to recover symbols of the brigands' allegiance so that he and your Rohirrim allies may better understand the foe that faces them.","Brigands are camped throughout Ost Celebrant.","Doron is within Ost Celebrant. If he has left your side, he can be summoned with your horn.","Una lealtad sombría"}},
[382]={nameES="A Grim Trail",objectivesES={"Speak with Heshra, the herbalist, in the Khûtra Elder Hall","Elder Roshat has told you to speak with Heshra, the herbalist in the Khûtra Elder Hall, about the disease overtaking Khûtra.","Heshra needs your help tracking down diseased salamanders west of Khûtra along the shore in order to find out more about this strange disease.","Return to Heshra in Khûtra","Heshra, the herbalist needs your help collecting diseased salamanders outside of Khûtra in order to find out more about this strange disease.","A Grim Trail"}},
[383]={nameES="A Grim Warning",objectivesES={"Warn Amalíbi in Ghalbûru about Bârshud's advance","A Grim Warning","Speak with Mizâdi in Iridír","Warn Amalíbi at Ghalbûru's highest point about Bârshud's advance. Ghalbûru is located within Khûd Zagin, in the Ikorbân Valley.","Warn Girhâzi in Iridír about Bârshud's advance","Speak with Mizâdi in Iridír.","Warn Girhâzi in Iridír about Bârshud's advance. Iridír is located within Ambarûl, in the Ikorbân Valley.","The battle has been won, but this victory tastes bitter: Bârshud intends to cut through all of Khûd Zagin and Ambarûl with his army. Warn Amalíbi in Ghalbûru and Girhâzi in Iridír of his advance."}},
[384]={nameES="A Growing Despair",objectivesES={"Fuirion is moved by Túmir's gesture, but refuses to give up his pursuit of escape by any means","A Growing Despair","Míreth and Túmir are in Gladion's home in northern Lamedon.\
\
You should see if the children can think of anything to cheer up their uncle, as they know him best.","Help Túmir try to cheer up Fuirion","Help Míreth try to cheer up Fuirion","Fuirion is moved by Míreth's gesture, but refuses to give up his pursuit of escape by any means","You should go outside of Gladion's home to give Fuirion some space to think upon his niece's and nephew's kind gestures.","Fuirion's situation with his family has grown so painful for him that he was willing to risk his life to escape the people he loves most in the world.","Go outside to give Fuirion some space and time to think"}},
[385]={nameES="A Growling Menace at the Gate",objectivesES={}},
[386]={nameES="A Grím Encounter",objectivesES={"Defeat Gríma's bodyguards (0/6)","After he was banished from Edoras, it appears that Gríma Wormtongue went north of the road to Isengard. He is either avoiding the road, has business to attend to elsewhere, or both.","You have encountered Gríma Wormtongue on the plains just north of Edoras, and he appears to be travelling west towards Isengard with a host of Orc bodyguards. You should deal with the bodyguards and confront Gríma.","A Grím Encounter","Gríma would like to have a word with you after you defeated his bodyguards.","Talk to Gríma Wormtongue"}},
[387]={nameES="El Deber de un Guardián",objectivesES={"Habla con Severin Rodador y toma tu puesto en defensa de Puente de Caballetes","Un guardián debe endurecerse ante los peligros del mundo, pues se interpone entre esos males y toda la gente de bien.","Severin Rodador está en el pueblo de Puente de Caballetes, en las Quebradas del Norte.\
\
Severin Rodador espera escuchar que estás preparado para defender el pueblo de los orcos que lo amenazan.","Severin Rodador está en el pueblo de Puente de Caballetes, en las Quebradas del Norte.\
\
Severin Rodador ha enviado un mensaje desde Puente de Caballetes: el pueblo está bajo amenaza de ataque por parte de orcos saqueadores y debe ser defendido.","Severin Rodador está en Puente de Caballetes.\
\
Severin Rodador espera hablar contigo sobre tu defensa del pueblo durante el reciente ataque de los orcos.","El Deber de un Guardián"}},
[388]={nameES="A Guiding Blade",objectivesES={"The leaders of the Haradrim forces in Upper Lebennin bear vile missives from the Enemy detailing their plans for Gondor.","The letter can be found in your inventory.\
\
You have discovered orders carried by one of the Haradrim war-leaders and should now read it.","Read the missive to the Haradrim","Irodon can be found in Halach in south-eastern Upper Lebennin.\
\
You have uncovered the plans of the Haradrim in Upper Lebennin as well as Enemy's plans for Osgiliath. You should now return to Irodon in Halach.","You have found a missive and should now examine it!","Retrieve a missive from a Haradrim war-leader near the Erui","Haradrim war-leaders can be found along the banks of the Erui in eastern Upper Lebennin.\
\
Irodon has asked you to seek out any orders the Haradrim war-leaders might bear.","The missive tells of a great host gathering within the ruins of Osgiliath!","Deliver the missive to Irodon","A Guiding Blade"}},
[389]={nameES="A Half a Threat",objectivesES={"A Half a Threat","The Hobbits of Maur Tulhau believe there is a nearby village of hobbits turned wild from years of separation from their kin. Iolo Brochtû is interested in making peace with them.","Iolo Brochtû is at Maur Tulhau, north of Khoblún Utot.\
\
You should return to Iolo Brochtû with news of your discovery at Khoblún Utot.","Deliver the peace offering to the hobbits of the neighbouring village","The 'hobbits' are actually a kind of goblin","The 'hobbit'-village south of Maur Tulhau is inhabited by a strange variety of wild goblin.\
\
You should do your best to remove the threat of the goblins.","Talk to Iolo Brochtû at Maur Tulhau","The neighbouring village lies to the south of Maur Tulhau.\
\
Iolo Brochtû has asked you to deliver the peace offering to the hobbits of the neighbouring village."}},
[390]={nameES="A Hallowed Return",objectivesES={"Tamindur can be found at Abkân'aban in Gloomingtarn.\
\
After returning to Abkân'aban, Thrástan revealed himself to be a servant of the First Crafter named Tamindur the Forge-servant. You should approach Tamindur.","Talk to Hermáth Stormhammer at Abkân'aban","Hermáth Stormhammer can be found at Abkân'aban in Gloomingtarn.\
\
After gathering your allies and speaking with Tamindur, you are ready to depart for Watchers' Roost. You should talk to Hermáth Stormhammer.","Talk to Spall at Abkân'aban","You can't be certain, but Tamindur appears to smile at your gesture","Despite his stony gaze, Tamindur appears to be pleased at your approach","Spall can be found at Abkân'aban in Gloomingtarn.\
\
After repelling the Iron Crown from Abkân'aban and the revelation of Thrástan's true identity, your allies remain gathered at Abkân'aban. You should talk to Spall.","A Hallowed Return","Hersegg can be found at Abkân'aban in Gloomingtarn.\
\
After repelling the Iron Crown from Abkân'aban and the revelation of Thrástan's true identity, your allies remain gathered at Abkân'aban. You should talk to Hersegg.","Approach Tamindur at Abkân'aban","Talk to Tamindur","Tamindur can be found at Abkân'aban in Gloomingtarn.\
\
After returning to Abkân'aban, Thrástan revealed himself to be a servant of the First Crafter named Tamindur the Forge-servant. You should bow before Tamindur before speaking to him.","After the revelation of Thrástan's true identity and the defeat of the Iron Crown at Abkân'aban, the Gabil'akkâ has won a lasting victory in their efforts to reclaim Mount Gundabad.","<rgb=#FF00FF>Bow</rgb> before Tamindur at Abkân'aban","Hermáth Stormhammer can be found at Watchers' Roost in Gloomingtarn.\
\
After departing from Abkân'aban, you have returned to Watchers' Roost. You should talk to Hermáth Stormhammer.","Talk to Hersegg at Abkân'aban","Talk to Hermáth Stormhammer at Watchers' Roost","Tamindur can be found at Abkân'aban in Gloomingtarn.\
\
After returning to Abkân'aban, Thrástan revealed himself to be a servant of the First Crafter named Tamindur the Forge-servant. You talk to Tamindur."}},
[391]={nameES="A Halted March",objectivesES={"Herion can be found in Linhir in eastern Dor-en-Ernil.\
\
You have defeated many of the Corsairs and Haradrim in Lang Boha and should report your success to Herion.","Lang Boha can be found far to the west of Linhir in Dor-en-Ernil.\
\
Herion has asked you to weaken the forces at Lang Boha to keep them from advancing to the north.","A Halted March","Talk to Herion in Linhir","The Haradrim and Corsair forces have advanced northward in Dor-en-Ernil and now pose a great threat to the people of Gondor."}},
[392]={nameES="La alegría vuelve a Hobbiton",objectivesES={"El Tío Gamyi se encuentra delante de su agujero en Bolsón de Tirada.\
\
Deberías ir a decirle que has frustrado los planes de Lobelia","Habéis desbaratado el plan de Lobelia, quería quedarse para ella los mejores alimentos del banquete de Yule.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu diario de misiones cuando el festival actual haya finalizado.</rgb>","La alegría vuelve a Hobbiton"}},
[393]={nameES="A Hard Day's Work",objectivesES={"Collect the swords Nukûsh has forged for deliver to Numûru.","The flames leap to greet the dry crackling wood","Speak with Nukûsh in Urmâkh","Speak again with Nukûsh in Urmâkh.","Feed the wood into the fire in the forge.","Acquire iron ore and wood from outside Urmâkh to the east for Nukûsh, the blacksmith in Urmâkh.","Deliver Nukûsh's swords to Numûru in Urmâkh","A Hard Day's Work","Deliver Nukûsh's newly forged swords to Numûru in Urmâkh. Numûru can be found by Urmâkh's eastern gate.","Bring gathered wood and ore to Nukûsh in Urmâkh.","Bring gathered wood and ore to Nukûsh in Urmâkh","Feed the wood into the fire in the forge","Nukûsh the blacksmith has asked for your help in accomplishing his daily tasks, as his apprentice has joined Mizâdi's warriors."}},
[394]={nameES="A Hard-earned Meal",objectivesES={"Have dinner with Gladion's family","The healer can be found in the apothecary's shop in Dínadab.\
\
You should hasten to the healer to get help for Fuirion.","You hurriedly tell the healer that Fuirion has been grievously wounded, and bleeds alarmingly onto his brother's floor.\
\
'Fuirion wounded! What could that young man have been up to, to get himself so hurt? I will go right away.'","A Hard-earned Meal","Gladion has invited you for a home-cooked meal at his family's table.","Summon the healer to help Fuirion","Limril can be found inside her home in Dínadab in northern Lamedon.\
\
You should go into Gladion's home and speak with his wife Limril."}},
[395]={nameES="A Hasty Escape",objectivesES={}},
[396]={nameES="A Head Shorter",objectivesES={}},
[397]={nameES="A Healer's Aid",objectivesES={"Túmir saw Fuirion disappear earlier that day on a secretive adventure of sorts","Follow the healer to Fuirion","Bandage linens can be found hanging outside the shop. Kingsfoil grows wild in the fields around Dínadab.\
\
You should collect kingsfoil and bandage linens while the healer works on Fuirion.","Fuirion's family -- brother, sister-in-law, niece, and nephew -- are in Gladion's home in Dínadab, anxiously looking on.\
\
You should speak with the family members.","Míreth has noticed that her uncle has been more sad and distant than usual of late","Limril stares intently at Fuirion, brows knit in concern.","Gladion is shocked by his brother's injury; he has no information for you","A Healer's Aid","You feel as if you are missing something to Fuirion's tale...","The healer is in Gladion's home in Dínadab in order to assist the wounded Fuirion.\
\
You should speak with the healer again.","Limril is white and shaken as she expresses her worry for her husband's brother","Limril, white as a ghost, does not speak. Her eyes are fixed on her brother-in-law, alarmed and concerned.","Fuirion is in Gladion's home in Dínadab.\
\
You should question Fuirion about his wounds.","The apothecary shop is in southern Dínadab in northern Lamedon.\
\
You should bring the supplies to the shop.","Speak with the healer again","Bring the supplies to the shop","The healer has made for Gladion's home in Dínadab in order to assist the wounded Fuirion.\
\
You should run after the healer to see if you can be of any help.","Question Fuirion about his attack","Fuirion, pale from blood loss, his face drawn with pain, does not speak when you approach him.","You have urged the healer of Dínadab to rush to Fuirion's aid, as he lies grievously wounded at Gladion's home."}},
[398]={nameES="A Healing Hand",objectivesES={"Beehives, goat's rue, klamath weed, mistletoe, and sweet myrtle can be found throughout the Windfells. Look on trees for mistletoe and bee-hives. \
\
Saeradan has asked you to collect several herbs and bring them to him to be prepared for delivery to the Uch-lûth.","A Healing Hand","The Rangers of the Grey Company seek to acquire the good will of the Uch-lûth, the Dunlending clan inhabiting Enedwaith.","Saeradan is at Echad Saeradan in the Windfells of Enedwaith.\
\
You should bring the herbs you foraged to Saeradan.","Bring the herbs to Saeradan at Echad Saeradan"}},
[399]={nameES="Una comida abundante",objectivesES={"Una comida abundante","Encuentra y derrota al pollo particularmente agresivo en Shegdush, en la cima de la colina.","Tu misión es viajar a Shegdush y recolectar huevos y reducir el número de pollos y jabalíes en la zona.","Con un fuerte cacareo, un pollo particularmente agresivo ha aparecido para defender el rebaño.","Derrota al pollo particularmente agresivo en la cima de la colina"}},
[400]={nameES="A Heavy Loss",objectivesES={"Found the camp that Angârmu mentioned","Find Angârmu's beloved pet, Ershûr","Return to Angârmu with his beloved pet, Ershûr","A Heavy Loss","Find the camp that Angârmu mentioned","Found Ershûr","Look for Angârmu's pet, Ershûr, at the camp.","Angârmu has asked you to recover his beloved pet who has yet to come home.","Return to Angârmu in Malgâma near Zikrum-dûl with his beloved pet, Ershûr.","Angârmu has asked you to help him find his missing pet, Ershûr."}},
[401]={nameES="A Heavy Task",objectivesES={"Ruthless Tom guards the west gate.\
\
You should carry the shipment to Ruthless Tom.","Deliver the fourth box of supplies to the guard at the west gate","The package for Isengard has been delivered to the guard","The third Overseer is at the worksite just uphill and to the south from the second worksite.\
\
You should carry the first shipment to the third Overseer.","The first Overseer is at the worksite near the western gate of Galtrev.\
\
You should carry the first shipment to the Overseer.","Deliver the third box of supplies to the third worksite's Overseer","Gethin can be found recovering from a long day's work near the fourth worksite.\
\
You should return to Gethin and tell him that all of the boxes have been successfully delivered.","The package for Isengard has been delivered to the Overseer","Talk to Gethin at the fourth worksite","The second Overseer is at the worksite slightly up the hill from the first.\
\
You should carry the first shipment to the second Overseer.","A Heavy Task","Gethin is an old man, and no longer has the strength to lift the boxes he has been charged with delivering.","Deliver the second box of supplies to the second worksite's Overseer","Deliver the first box of supplies to the first worksite's Overseer"}},
[402]={nameES="A Helping Hand",objectivesES={}},
[403]={nameES="El botín escondido",objectivesES={"Lleva un barril de hierba para pipa a Longo Madriguera","El diario de Gerebert Tuk reveló que había aceptado un desafío para esconderse en uno de los carros de hojas de Longo Madriguera. Esilia Tuk te ha pedido que le ayudes a buscar a su primo.","El botín escondido","Esilia Tuk se encuentra en el centro de Alforzaburgo.\
\
Longo Madriguera aceptó decirte lo que sabía sobre Gerebert a cambio de un barril de hojas que había escondido en una guarida de osos. Sin embargo, cuando se lo llevaste, Longo te reveló que no sabía nada sobre Gerebert. Deberías volver con Esilia Tuk y contarle lo que ha pasado.","Las guaridas de osos se encuentran al sur de la granja de Longo Madriguera.\
\
Esilia Tuk te ha pedido que hables con Longo Madriguera sobre su primo Gerebert. Longo ha exigido que le hagas un favor antes de hablar. Te ha dicho que su hierba para pipa tiene mucha demanda, pero que su cosecha actual aún no está lista para la recolección. Te ha encargado que recuperes un barril de hierba para pipa que escondió en una guarida de osos durante el invierno."}},
[404]={nameES="A Hike Like No Other",objectivesES={"Talk to Ascwyn","A Hike Like No Other","Ettenmoors location visited","The Grimwood Lumber-camp is west of Glân Vraig. Lugazag is west of Glân Vraig, on the west side of the Hoarwell. The Isendeep Mine is far to the north-west of Glân Vraig. Tol Ascarnen is south of the Isendeep Mine, north-west of Glân Vraig. Tirith Rhaw is east of Tol Ascarnen and north-west of Glân Vraig. Observe your map to see who currently controls the location. Red locations are held by the Enemy, and blue by the Free Peoples.\
\
Sergeant-at-Arms Ascwyn explained that the contested locales throughout the Ettenmoors hold some manner of importance to the Free Peoples and the forces of Angmar and suggested that you visit each.","Sergeant-at-Arms Ascwyn is at Glân Vraig within the Coldfells.\
\
You have found your way through the Ettenmoors and located the Grimwood Lumber-camp, Lugazag Tower, Isendeep Mine, Tol Ascarnen and Tirith Rhaw. Now you should return to Glân Vraig and speak with Sergeant-at-Arms Ascwyn.","The Ettenmoors has several locations which allow for an advantage over the foe.","Visit the Grimwood Lumber-camp, Isendeep Mine, Tol Ascarnen, Tirith Rhaw, and Lugazag."}},
[405]={nameES="Indicios de manipulación",objectivesES={"Los nudos de este paquete parecen estar atados a toda prisa, y lleva un curioso símbolo marcado en tinta","Las cartas y los paquetes se encuentran por todo el Servicio Postal Rápido de Nobotella.\
\
El cartero Cavada te ha pedido que examines las cartas y los paquetes entregados desde la Comarca.","El cartero Cavada se encuentra en el interior del Servicio Postal Rápido de Nobotella.\
\
Después de examinar cartas y paquetes entregados desde la Comarca, has encontrado pruebas de manipulación y un tipo extraño de firma. Debes reportarlo al cartero Cavada en el interior del Servicio Postal Rápido en Nobotella.","Parece que este sobre fue abierto y reabierto rápidamente con algún tipo de resina","El cartero Cavada de Nobotella ha empezado a sospechar que alguien está interfiriendo en el Servicio Postal Rápido, manipulando el correo y ralentizando su entrega a los habitantes de la Comarca Allende.","Habla con el cartero Cavada en el Servicio Postal Rápido de Nobotella","Aunque la carta no tiene signos de manipulación, está arrugada y manchada de té","Este paquete no está sellado y la tapa está apoyada sobre él sin ajustar","El cartero Cavada se encuentra en el interior del Servicio Postal Rápido en Nobotella.\
\
Después de empezar a sospechar que alguien está manipulando el correo que llega a la Comarca Allende, el cartero Cavada te ha pedido que reúnas con él en el interior del Servicio Postal Rápido en Nobotella. Habla con el cartero Cavada dentro del Servicio Postal Rápido.","Indicios de manipulación","Reúnete con el cartero Cavada en el interio del Servicio Postal Rápido en Nobotella","El Servicio Postal Rápido está lleno de cartas y paquetes sin entregar","El Servicio Postal Rápido está en Nobtella.\
\
Después de sospechar que alguien está manipulando el correo que llega a la Comarca Allende, el cartero Cavada te ha pedido que te reúnas con él en el interior del Servicio Postal Rápido de Nobotella. Reúnete con el cartero Cavada en el Servicio Postal Rápido.","Parece que este sobre fue abierto y cerrado de nuevo con cera de un color diferente","Este paquete parece que ha sido marcado en tinta con un curioso símbolo"}},
[406]={nameES="A History of Bones",objectivesES={}},
[407]={nameES="Una Hobbit entre los Setos",objectivesES={"Hay un laberinto de setos en los Campos de los Caballos durante la Plantación de Primavera en Bree, y Sorrel Nortuk quiere que hables con su hermana Ranúncula antes de lanzarte a la aventurada exploración.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando finalice el festival actual.</rgb>","Habla con Ranúncula Nortuk en los Campos de los Caballos, en Bree","Una Hobbit entre los Setos","Ranúncula Nortuk se encuentra en los Terrenos del Festival, en Bree, disfrutando del laberinto de setos en los Campos de los Caballos.\
\
Deberías dirigirte al laberinto para transmitirle a Ranúncula los saludos de Sorrel."}},
[408]={nameES="Un Hogar Hobbit Lejos del Hogar",objectivesES={"Habla con el Alcalde Will Pieblanco fuera del Agujero del Agujero Municipal, en Cavada Grande","Tras un largo viaje desde las tierras del Valle de la Niebla que te condujo hasta la aldea fronteriza de Musgovilla, en la Ciénaga de los Cisnes, te has topado con un hobbit de lo más curioso. No es un hobbit ribereño de Lyndelby, ni uno de los Fuertes de la Ciénaga de los Cisnes, ni tampoco uno de sus escurridizos primos de los que se rumorea que habitan en Enedwaith: es un hobbit de una tierra llamada la Comarca.","Un Hogar Hobbit Lejos del Hogar"}},
[409]={nameES="Un caballito de juguete llamado Esperanza",objectivesES={"Reúnete con Annaethel en Sírlond","Habla con Annaethel una vez más","El conocimiento del regreso seguro de su hijo a Sírlond ha disipado la locura que aquejaba a Annaethel. Está volviendo al campamento y te pide que la encuentres allí.","Un caballito de juguete llamado Esperanza","El juguete y la carta de Mellanion han despejado la locura de los ojos de Annaethel. Deberías hacerle saber que su hijo está a salvo en Sírlond.\
\
Annaethel está en el centro de Cardolan, al sur de Sírlond.","Annaethel ha sido vista entre las ruinas al sur de Sírlond. Deberías llevarle el caballito de juguete y su mensaje de su hijo.\
\
Sírlond está en el centro de Cardolan.","Busca a Annaethel","Ella aprieta el juguete contra su pecho","Con Mellanion de vuelta a salvo en Sírlond, la búsqueda de Annaethel debe reanudarse, no sea que atraiga a otro niño."}},
[410]={nameES="Una guarida de lobos",objectivesES={"Habla con Nate Hojafrágil en la Granja de Espinar","Una guarida de lobos","Nate Hojafrágil explicó que los lobos al oeste de la Obra de los Espinar, cerca de la alta elevación de las Colinas Brandigamo, se acercan cada vez más a la granja cada noche. No permitirá que los caballos se trasladen al establo hasta que los lobos sean controlados.","Nate Hojafrágil está en la Granja de Espinar.\
\
Debes regresar con Nate Hojafrágil y decirle que los lobos han sido eliminados.","La guarida de lobos está al oeste de la Obra de los Espinar.\
\
Nate Hojafrágil te pidió que redujeras el número de lobos que merodean cerca de la Obra de los Espinar."}},
[411]={nameES="A Home on the Slade",objectivesES={"One of the dwarves appears to notice your approach...","You have discovered a small company of dwarves at an encampment in the foothills of Elderslade.","A Home on the Slade","The dwarf encampment can be found in the foothills of eastern Elderslade.\
\
After investigating the dwarf-encampment in Elderslade, your presence has caught the attention of one of the dwarves. You should speak to Nagli Want-kin.","Discover the dwarf encampment in Elderslade","Investigate the dwarf-encampment in Elderslade","While travelling through Elderslade, you have caught a glimpse of a strange sight. There appears to be a small dwarf-encampment in Elderslade, nestled in the foothills along the Greylin.\
\
None of your maps have such a location marked on them, and it appears to have been built much more recently than any of the ruins that remain in Elderslade.\
\
You should investigate the dwarf-encampment and attempt to learn why these dwarves have settled in Elderslade and so near to Mount Gundabad.","Nestled in the foothills along the Greylin, a curious company of dwarves has built a small encampment in Elderslade.","You have discovered a small company of dwarves at an encampment in the foothills of Elderslade. You should investigate the encampment and learn why these dwarves have settled in Elderslade.","Talk to Nagli Want-kin"}},
[412]={nameES="Un caballo en un pajar",objectivesES={"Busca al oeste más huellas","Habla con Bingo en Arboleda del Paso","Al norte de Puente de los Tejones, mientras buscabas a Bingo y Crinloca, encontraste a Hunfredo Rebuscón.","Encuentras varias huellas del tamaño de un poney que llevan hacia el oeste","El rastro de Crinloca lleva hacia el oeste del lugar donde te atacó el Nazgûl, adentrándose en los Valles de Piedra.","Habla con Hunfredo Rebuscón al norte de Puente de los Tejones","Egwylf te pidió buscar señales del paso de Crinloca cerca del lugar donde atacó el Nazgûl.","Willem Bigote parece haber captado el rastro y corrió cuesta arriba hacia un poblado en las alturas del sudoeste de los Valles de Piedra: Arboleda del Paso.","El suelo está ennegrecido y humeante donde te encontraste con el Nazgûl","Egwylf está buscando señales del paso de Crinloca en los Campos Amplios, donde atacó el Nazgûl.","Vuelve al lugar del ataque del Nazgûl, en los Campos Amplios","Busca a Bingo siguiendo una línea recta hacia el oeste desde el lugar donde atacó el Nazgûl","Egwylf está en el camino al norte de Puente de los Tejones, buscando huellas.","Habla con Egwylf cerca del lugar del ataque del Nazgûl","Las huellas están revueltas, pero Willem corre cuesta arriba hacia un poblado del sudoeste","Egwylf quiere regresar al lugar donde te separaste de Bingo y Crinloca. Fue al sureste de la Colina Boscosa, en los Campos Amplios, justo al suroeste del asentamiento invadido de Bardh-dorám.","Bingo y Crinloca llegaron a Arboleda del Paso, en los Valles de Piedra, y ahora te has reunido con ellos.","Busca a Bingo y a Crinloca en Arboleda del Paso","Un hombre de aspecto familiar te saluda al acercarte","Crinloca está bajo un árbol cargado de manzanas, masticando satisfecho","Las huellas llevan hacia algún punto al oeste de la carretera a Puente de los Tejones, donde encontraste a Hunfredo Rebuscón rumbo al Paso de Rohan.","Estas huellas no son claras, pero creo que continúan hacia el oeste. Creo que Crinloca llevó a Bingo por allí.'","Busca huellas de Crinloca cerca del lugar donde atacó el Nazgûl","Egwylf quiere intentar encontrar hacia dónde huyeron Crinloca y Bingo tras el ataque del Nazgûl.","Un caballo en un pajar"}},
[413]={nameES="A Horse in the Forest",objectivesES={"Lead Witherbreca back","Sithgar's horse has run off again - this time into the Drúadan Forest.","Talk to Bhis-weni-Mâr","Return to defend Witherbreca","Find Witherbreca","Search for Witherbreca deep in the Drúadan Forest.","Bhis-weni-Mâr looks at you with sad and frightened eyes. \
\
'Horse. Run.'\
\
He gestures off deeper into the woods.\
\
'Bad Ghûrdhos come. Horse run. You help?'","You should return to Bhis-weni-Mâr with Sithgar, and help negotiate the trade of a shield for the wayward horse.","A Horse in the Forest","Talk to Sithgar","Defeat the wood-trolls","Search for Witherbreca, who has run off into the Drúadan Wood.","Return to Sithgar","There is the horse, and she is surrounded by wood-trolls!","You discover Witherbreca standing close to a Wose","Now that you have defeated the wood-trolls, you should lead Witherbreca back to Sithgar and Bhis-weni-Mâr.","Defeat the wood-trolls surrounding Witherbreca in the Drúadan Forest.","Talk to the Wose","You should talk to the Wose standing by Witherbreca in the Drúadan Forest.","You led the frightened horse back through the forest","Sithgar stands in the Drúadan Forest, by Witherbreca and Bhis-weni-Mâr.\
\
You should talk to Sithgar and hear what he has to say.","You should talk to Bhis-weni-Mâr now that he, Witherbreca, and Sithgar are together in the Drúadan Forest.","Bhis-weni-Mâr looks both very serious and very sad.\
\
'No shield. Horse-man keep shield. Horse and forest... do not go... as one. Horse is good. Very good horse. Only must be calm. Must calm horse. Or horse run.'\
\
Bhis-weni-Mâr fixes his eyes on Sithgar, and through a sequence of words and gestures, makes it clear that he wishes to teach Sithgar how to calm and command Witherbreca, before he lets her go.","You should return to Sithgar in the Rohirrim bivouac, in Taur Drúadan, and tell him of the horse and the Wose."}},
[414]={nameES="A Horse-lord's Revenge",objectivesES={"Talk to Éorpwald outside of Thornhope","Derrota a Bidroi","You rescued Éorpwald, a wounded Rohirrim warrior, from Thornhope and helped him reach the relative safety of Béortnoth's camp.","Bidroi, Grish, and Rûkaz can all be found within the walls of Thornhope.\
\
Éorpwald asked you to take revenge upon Bidroi, Grish, and Rûkaz, three lieutenants of the invading forces, on behalf of Thane Wulfrad's family.","Éorpwald is encamped outside the walls of Thornhope.\
\
You should return to Éorpwald with news of your victory.","Bidroi derrotado","A Horse-lord's Revenge","Defeat Grish","Defeated Rûkaz","Defeated Grish","Defeat Rûkaz"}},
[415]={nameES="Un hogar hospitalario",objectivesES={"Elrond te ha sugerido que presentes a Bingo Boffin a Bilbo Bolsón en el Salón del Fuego.","El rugido de las cataratas es ensordecedor, pero la vista es preciosa","Encuentra Imdolen en el camino al norte de Rivendel","Bingo Boffin está en el Salón del Fuego, conversando alegremente con Bilbo Bolsón.","Encuentra el Refugio de Orladion","El lago de Hidhuinen es apacible y calmado","Encuentra las cascadas de Imladris en el puente sureste","Encuentra el mercado de Rivendel","Encuentra el lago de Hidhuinen","Bilbo está en el Salón del Fuego, en la Última Morada.\
\
Bingo se ha percatado de que el mapa de Rivendel dibujado por Bilbo tiene cierto parecido con el mapa que encontró en la Comarca.","Has encontrado a Bingo y Bilbo ya en plena conversación","Habla con Bilbo en el Salón del Fuego","Esta aguja sirve como un popular lugar de reunión para la gente de Rivendel","Muchas mercancías de calidad se venden en el mercado de Rivendel","El Refugio de Orladion es silencioso y apacible","Habla con Elrond en su biblioteca, en la Última Morada","Encuentra a Bilbo Bolsón en el Salón del Fuego","Habla con Bingo en el Salón del Fuego","El aire de Imdolen, en lo alto de Rivendel, es puro y fresco","Bilbo os ha proporcionado a Bingo y a ti con un mapa de localizaciones importantes de Rivendel.","Bingo y tú habéis explorado varias de las vistas más notables de Rivendel, y ahora deberíais volver al Salón del Fuego, en la Última Morada.","Habla con Bilbo en el Salón del Fuego, en la Última Morada","Encuentra la Aguja del Encuentro","Bingo y tú habéis llegado al valle escondido de Rivendel, y el hobbit está emocionado por empezar a explorar.","Devuelve el mapa a Bingo en el Salón del Fuego, en la Última Morada","Bilbo Bolsón está en el Salón del Fuego, en la Última Morada.","Bingo está en el Salón del Fuego, en la Última Morada.\
\
Has averiguado que Bilbo Bolsón es el responsable de haber dibujado el mapa que fue dejado en el libro de recetas que provocó que Bingo comenzara su aventura.","Elrond está en su biblioteca en la Última Morada, en Rivendel.\
\
Bingo ha ido a buscar algo de comida para W.B. y para él, y te ha encomendado la tarea de decirle a Elrond que otro hobbit ha llegado a Rivendel.","Un hogar hospitalario"}},
[416]={nameES="A House Divided",objectivesES={"A House Divided","You have freed many of the intimidated Stout-axes from the Oath-taker's Horn.","Intimidated Stout-axes can be found throughout the Oath-taker's Horn.\
\
Gimli has asked you to rescue any of the Stout-axes that do not wish to follow King Greytooth in his quest to recover the dwarf-rings and offer them a new home as part of Durin's Folk.","It remains uncertain if all the dwarves within the Oath-taker's Horn wish to follow King Greytooth in his quest to recover the dwarf-rings, but Gimli holds hope that a few might instead wish to ally with Durin's Folk.","You have done well to free the Stout-axes from the Oath-taker's Horn. It is likely that King Váskmun Greytooth will lead the Firehorns to ruin in his search for the dwarf-rings.\
\
Instead, you have offered the few remaining Stout-axes a new chance at freedom among Durin's Folk.","Completado"}},
[417]={nameES="A House Forged Anew",objectivesES={"Talk to Spakorth on the plains of Dor Amarth outside Lûghash","Spakorth can be found along the causeway outside Lûghash.\
\
You have been cast out of Lûghash by King Greytooth and the Firehorns. You should speak to Spakorth.","Overjoyed by the return of their King, Váskmun Greytooth, the Stout-axes of Lûghash have asked you and Gimli to share your tales of valour among the Free Peoples that they might learn more of the world beyond Mordor.","A House Forged Anew","Gimli can be found on the central level of Lûghash.\
\
King Váskmun Greytooth desires to hear Gimli's tales of valour. You should join Gimli in recounting your adventures in Middle-earth.","Talk to Gimli in Lûghash"}},
[418]={nameES="A House Full of Rot",objectivesES={}},
[419]={nameES="A House in Turmoil",objectivesES={"Talk to Adalmód at the Mead Hall of Eaworth","Adalmód informed you that Reeve Ingbert and his son were closeted in discussion.","Assist Botulf with Reassuring Words","Assisted Goldwine with Preparing for the Siege","Assist Pedwin with Courage from a Keg","Adalmód stands guard at the entrance to the Mead Hall of Eaworth.\
\
You should return to Adalmód now that you have done as he asked.","A House in Turmoil","Guards may be found throughout Eaworth.\
\
Adalmód has asked you to help the guards of Eaworth prepare for the coming siege.","Assisted Botulf with Reassuring Words","Assisted Pedwin with Courage from a Keg","Assist Goldwine with Preparing for the Siege","Assisted Offram with A City Under Siege","Assist Offram with A City Under Siege"}},
[420]={nameES="Un aullido en las colinas",objectivesES={"Encuentra a Nat Rapkins","Nat Rapkins cruzó los Saltos del Crepúsulo en el extremo norte del lago, al noroeste de Ost Forod, y nunca volvió. Robin Sotopardo quiere que busques por el extremo del lago cerca de los Saltos del Crepúsulo al cazador desaparecido.\
\
Robin Sotopardo oyó un aullido aterrador cerca de la costa por la noche y está preocupado de que Nat Rapkins haya caído ante alguna bestia malvada. Quiere que intentes encontrar al cazador perdido.","Robin Sotopardo te ha dicho que la gente de Ost Forod está preocupado por uno de los suyos, un cazador llamado Nat Rapkins, queien no ha vuelto de una cacería en el este de Emyn Uial.","Robin Sotopardo está en Ost Forod, al sureste de los Saltos del Crepúsulo, en la región de Tyrn Fornech de Evendim.\
\
Nat Rapkins te mencionó a los Gauredain en su último aliento y te dio su bolsa para que la devolvieras a Ost Forod. Debes llevarla a Robin Sotopardo.","Un aullido en las colinas","Lleva la mochila de Nat Rapkins a Robin Sotopardo"}},
[421]={nameES="Un aullido en el viento",objectivesES={"Un aullido en el viento","Además del campamento orco de Ashúrz Maufulug, los exploradores elfos han descubierto unas perreras con huargos y sus cuidadores trasgos no muy lejos hacia el este de la fortaleza de los orcos.","Goldínwen está en Echad Glamodúd, al norte de Maudhul-ulur.\
\
Deberísa volver a ver a Goldínwen con la noticia de que has derrotado a un buen número de huargos en Maudhul-ulur.","Habla con Goldílwen en Echad Glamodúd","Los huargos se encuentran en Maudhul-ulur, al sur de Echad Glamodúd.\
\
Goldínwen te ha pedido que derrotes a un buen número de huargos en las perreras cercanas."}},
[422]={nameES="Un Asado Humilde",objectivesES={"Culhuc está esperando oír tu opinión sobre su plato.\
\
Habla con Culhuc en Lhan Garan.","Estaba delicioso pero... algo duro","A Culhuc le gustaría que pruebes su plato más reciente.","Culhuc está en Lhan Garan, cerca del horno junto al sendero del paseo ribereño.\
\
Prueba el asado junto a Culhuc en Lhan Garan.","Prueba el avanc asado","Habla con Culhuc","Un Asado Humilde"}},
[423]={nameES="A Hunger for Vengeance",objectivesES={"Talk to Hárskor at Hadhodiant","With sudden agility, Durbkhat rushes past you and flees Fil Sulmog!","Sealed provisions can be found at Fil Sulmog.\
\
Hárskor has asked you to salvage any sealed provisions you can find at Fil Sulmog.","A harsh voice echoes through the air as a large Orc rushes forth!","A Hunger for Vengeance","After being waylaid on the road to Hultvís, Hárskor unwittingly discovered a cunning plot devised by the leader of the Orcs seeking shelter in Woodsedge.","Find and defeat Durbkhat at Fil Sulmog","Durbkhat can be found in the depths of the cave at Fil Sulmog.\
\
Determined to avenge the hurts done to the Beornings and Woodmen, Hárskor has asked you to find and defeat Durbkhat, a large Orc leading the Shapag-hai in Woodsedge.","Hárskor can be found in the eastern ruins of Hadhodiant.\
\
You have driven Durbkhat from Fil Sulmog and salvaged a great deal of provisions. You should return to Hadhodiant and deliver the provisions to Hárskor.","Ríkmar can be found in Hultvís.\
\
Hárskor has returned to the Beorning-lands to prepare a new shipment of provisions for Hultvís. You should deliver the provisions you salvaged from Fil Sulmog to Ríkmar and assure him that the Beornings will deliver more provisions in the coming days.","Deliver the sealed provisions to Ríkmar in Hultvís"}},
[424]={nameES="A Hunger for War",objectivesES={"You have destroyed many Orkish provisions at Bagûd-mekhem.","Orkish provisions can be found at Bagûd-mekhem.\
\
It appears that Gorgar has ordered that provisions be brought to Bagûd-mekhem in an attempt to draw out the War of Three Peaks. You should destroy Orkish provisions at Bagûd-mekhem.","Determined to outlast even the most concerted assaults of the Gabil'akkâ, Gorgar has ordered provisions be brought forth from the depths of Gundabad to maintain his hold on Bagûd-mekhem.","Completado","You have destroyed many Orkish provisions at Bagûd-mekhem, depriving Gorgar's forces of much-needed rations during the War of Three Peaks.","Determined to outlast even the most concerted assaults of the Gabil'akkâ, Gorgar has ordered provisions be brought forth from the depths of Gundabad. In addition to aiding his forces in maintaining their hold on Bagûd-mekhem, it seems Gorgar intends to draw out the War of Three Peaks.\
\
You should destroy these Orkish provisions and put an end to Gorgar's plot.","A Hunger for War"}},
[425]={nameES="A Hungry Inhabitant",objectivesES={"You have discovered a bucket full of fish","Langar is afraid his pet cat will starve if food cannot be provided.","Deliver food to Langar's cat and avoid Garsfeld guards","Delivered food to Langar's cat","Talk to Langar","Langar can be found in west Garsfeld.\
\
You should speak with Langar about the task he set for you.","The food can likely be found near the Mead Hall of Garsfeld.\
\
Langar has asked that you find food for his cat in Garsfeld. However, he worries that the guards will not take kindly to giving rations to a pet.","A Hungry Inhabitant","Rations can be found outside the mead-hall.\
\
Langar wants you to sneak a ration for his beloved pet without being caught.","Find food for Langar's cat"}},
[426]={nameES="A Hunt at the Fanged Lair",objectivesES={}},
[427]={nameES="A Hunt for Wolves",objectivesES={}},
[428]={nameES="Encargo de Cazadora",objectivesES={"Gytha Lainey está en el Campamento de Adso, en las Tierras de Bree, en el camino entre la ciudad de Bree y Los Gamos.\
\
Gytha Lainey está esperando para hablar contigo sobre tu defensa de la aldea de Sobrecolina.","Gytha Lainey está en el Campamento de Adso, en las Tierras de Bree, en el camino entre Los Gamos y la ciudad de Bree.\
\
Gytha Lainey te ha enviado un mensaje urgente solicitando tu ayuda.","Habla con Gytha Lainey y viaja hacia la Comarca","Encargo de Cazadora","Gytha Lainey está en el Campamento de Adso, en las Tierras de Bree, en el camino entre la ciudad de Bree y Los Gamos.\
\
Gytha Lainey está esperando para hablar contigo y luego viajar hacia la Comarca para interceptar a la partida de caza de Huargos que ha venido del norte en busca de uno de los suyos.","En tiempos de peligro, un cazador entrenado puede ser el único capaz de encontrar y derrotar una amenaza antes de que ataque."}},
[429]={nameES="A Joyful Chorus",objectivesES={}},
[430]={nameES="A Just Burial",objectivesES={"Speak with Erchar","Speak to Herion","A Just Burial","Herion decides to return to Linhir with Erchar who has waited for him.","Erchar can be found in the town of Linhir.\
\
You have finished your journey from western Dor-en-Ernil to Linhir, and should now speak with Erchar.","Herion can be found in his encampment in western Dor-en-Ernil.\
\
Herion asks you to travel with him back to Linhir."}},
[431]={nameES="A Just Reward",objectivesES={"Complete A Just Reward - Spoils of War","Jarl Gurthilm can be found to the south-east of Aragorn's camp on the border of Dagorlad.\
\
Jarl Gurthilm has offered you payment for the aid you gave to him and his men. You should discuss your choice with him.","A Just Reward","With their foes slain and the wealth of the Khundolar in their grasp, the Variags have decided to return to Khand once their final errand is finished.","Talk to Jarl Gurthilm","Complete A Just Reward - Honour Alone","Jarl Gurthilm can be found to the south-east of Aragorn's camp on the border of Dagorlad.\
\
You have made your choice and should now speak to Jarl Gurthilm before parting ways."}},
[432]={nameES="A Just Reward - Honour Alone",objectivesES={}},
[433]={nameES="A Just Reward - Spoils of War",objectivesES={"A Just Reward - Spoils of War","Talk to Blothára","With their foes slain and the wealth of the Khundolar in their grasp, the Variags have decided to return to Khand once their final errand is finished.","Blothára can be found to the south-east of Aragorn's camp on the border of Dagorlad.\
\
You have chosen to accept your share of the gold, and Blothára can deliver it to you when you are prepared."}},
[434]={nameES="A Key to Freedom",objectivesES={"Free Múta from her cage at Mur Shatraug, the Witch-gate","The Dourhands' summoning horn can be found along the road at Mur Shatraug, the Witch-gate.\
\
You have discovered the Dourhands' summoning horn and you should now sound it in an attempt to summon the Iron Crown key-warden.","You hear someone approach...","The Dourhands' summoning horn can be found at Mur Shatraug, the Witch-gate.\
\
Múta has asked you to seek out the Dourhands' summoning horn at Mur Shatraug, the Witch-gate and summon an Iron Crown key-warden. You should find the summoning horn at Mur Shatraug, the Witch-gate.","A Key to Freedom","Talk to Múta at Mur Shatraug, the Witch-gate","Múta can be found at Mur Shatraug, the Witch-gate.\
\
You have collected a single, small key from the Iron Crown key-warden. You should use it to attempt to free Múta from her cage.","Find the horn used by the Dourhands to summon the Iron Crown key-warden","Use the Dourhands' summoning horn and confront the Iron Crown key-warden","Beneath the arches of the Witch-gate, you discover a crude horn hanging from a post","Múta can be found at Mur Shatraug, the Witch-gate.\
\
You have collected a single, small key from the Iron Crown key-warden. You should return to Múta.","Múta can be found at Mur Shatraug, the Witch-gate.\
\
You have managed to unlock Múta's cage. You should talk to Múta.","As the Iron Crown key-warden falls defeated, you collect a small key from his belt","Despite the efforts of the Dourhands, Múta believes she may have discovered the key to her escape from the Witch-gate.","To your and Múta's surprise, the lock on her cage disengages!"}},
[435]={nameES="A Kindly Rescue",objectivesES={}},
[436]={nameES="A King Lost, A King Gained",objectivesES={"A King Lost, A King Gained","King Thorin III can be found at his throne in the Hall Under the Mountain.\
\
Gimli has offered an impassioned plea for the Stout-axes to be accepted as friends and kin to Durin's Folk. You should hear King Thorin's judgment on the matter.","Habla con Gimli","Gimli, son of Glóin, has returned to Erebor from the lands of Mordor and now seeks to ensure peace between the Dwarves of Durin's Folk and the Stout-axes of Dor Amarth.","Gimli can be found near King Thorin's throne in the Hall Under the Mountain.\
\
King Thorin III has passed his judgment on what is to be done regarding the Stout-axes. You should now speak to Gimli.","Hear King Thorin III's judgment"}},
[437]={nameES="A King's Rest",objectivesES={"King Elessar can be found in the Hall of the King.\
\
Arvedui has asked you to talk to King Elessar on his behalf.","With the coronation of Elessar, a king who has lingered in Middle-earth for far too long can finally rest.","Talk to King Elessar","A King's Rest","Arvedui fades away, his eyes brimming with tears of joy"}},
[438]={nameES="El hacha de un trabajador",objectivesES={"Lleva el hacha a Inufileg en Gwingris","Este hacha fue portada por un dunlendino, pero ves marcas que claramente no son obra de dunlendinos. Aunque no puedes determinar el origen, quizá uno de los elfos de Gwingris sepa algo más.","El hacha de un trabajador","Gwingris está en el extremo norte de Glâd Ereg.\
\
Deberías llevarle el hacha a los elfos de Gwingris.","Has encontrado un extraño hacha de los dunlendinos cerca de Gwingris, pero no reconoces la factura."}},
[439]={nameES="A Lack of Evidence",objectivesES={"Landroval can be found at the clearing of trees in the north-east section of Wailing Hills.\
\
Landroval must be informed of the results of your search for the sneaking creature.","Cocoons of spider-webbing may be found to the west of the hidden clearing, among the northern hills.\
\
Landroval has asked you to search among the spider-cocoons for any sign of the creature he was tasked with following.","The cocoon contains no evidence of the creature you are seeking","Talk to Landroval about what you have found","Landroval has been following the trail of a small shadowy creature and is uncertain if his mark has been ensnared by the spiders native to the region.","A Lack of Evidence"}},
[440]={nameES="A Lack of Support",objectivesES={"Herubrand is in the cellar of the farmhouse.\
\
You should bring the ill news of the mismanagement of the city's monies, as it may help explain why the situation in Woodhurst is growing worse.","A Lack of Support","Talk to Elda","Talk to Guard-captain Thurferth","Herubrand is in the cellar of the farmhouse.\
\
Herubrand should know what Elda had to say about the funds for the city guards.","Guard-captain Thurferth is near the centre of the city.\
\
You should return to Guard-captain Thurferth and inform him of the misplacement of funding that was intended for him.","Elda has not been seen since the council-meeting, but he should be somewhere in Woodhurst.\
\
You need to speak with Elda about the funding for the guards that has not been delivered.","Guard-captain Thurferth has not received funding from Woodhurst's leadership. His plea for assistance to the advisor responsible for the funds has fallen on deaf ears.","Talk to Herubrand","Wild beasts roam the lands around Woodhurst.\
\
Guard-captain Thurferth asked that you collect hides, bear-claws, goat-hooves, and venison to supply the garrison.","Return the supplies to Thurferth, near the centre of Woodhurst.\
\
Guard Captain Thurferth will be thankful for these supplies."}},
[441]={nameES="A Lady's Fears",objectivesES={"Lady Tóla summoned you to her house so that she could express her gratitude for your kindness and make a request of you.","Talk to Adalmód outside the Mead Hall of Eaworth","Adalmód stands guard outside the Mead Hall of Eaworth.\
\
You should speak with Adalmód to gain access to the Mead Hall of Eaworth.","A Lady's Fears"}},
[442]={nameES="A Lady's Pleasure",objectivesES={}},
[443]={nameES="A Land of Ash and Shadow",objectivesES={"Scout the causeway to ruins of Barad-dûr","Gimli can be found at the Ruins of Díngarth due south of the Isenmouthe in Dor Amarth.\
\
You have found evidence of dwarves in Mordor and collected one of their shields. You should bring the shield to Gimli and see what he makes of it.","The fallen dwarf and his goat can be found to the north of the causeway to Barad-dûr.\
\
You have found a fallen dwarf and his goat. You should examine them and collect his shield.","Deliver the dwarf-shield to Gimli at the Ruins of Díngarth","A Land of Ash and Shadow","The dwarf lies slain in armour of finer make than that of the Orcs...","Collect the fallen dwarf's shield","In Dor Amarth, the toppled ruin of Barad-dûr still looms over the wracked plains of Mordor, casting its shadows over unseen foes.","Examine the fallen dwarf","You notice what appears to be a dwarf and a goat lying still beside the causeway...","Wrought of dark steel, the shield remains unblemished despite the fate of its wielder","Far from wild, the goat is saddled and laden with various trinkets and supplies...","Examine the fallen dwarf's goat","The causeway extends to the south-east from the Isenmouthe, eventually leading to the foot of Barad-dûr.\
\
Legolas has asked you to scout the causeway leading to the ruins of Barad-dûr as he desires to learn what foes still lurk in the shadows of its toppled heights."}},
[444]={nameES="A Lapse in Judgement",objectivesES={"Malthellam can be found outside his house near the entrance to Morlad.\
\
You have delivered Lord Duinhir's notes and spoke to Lady Rosfin about providing counsel for the good of the vale, and should now return to Malthellam.","Lord Duinhir's notes can be found inside Malthellam's home in Morlad.\
\
Malthellam hopes to repair his friendship with Lady Rosfin, and has asked you to return her husband's notes to her.","Gather Lord Duinhir's notes","Talk to Malthellam","Bring Lord Duinhir's notes to Lady Rosfin","Lady Rosfin can be found outside Malthellam's home in Morlad.\
\
Lady Rosfin has honoured Malthellam's request and has arrived to serve as his counselor. You should now speak to her.","Lady Rosfin can be found atop Morlad outside her home.\
\
You have gathered Lord Duinhir's notes and should now return them to Lady Rosfin.","DNT -- will not be seen","Talk to Lady Rosfin outside Malthellam's home","A Lapse in Judgement","Malthellam seeks to heal his once strong friendship with Rosfin in light of his recent failures as steward."}},
[445]={nameES="Un Mundo Más Grande",objectivesES={"Meneldir dice que el ataque de los uruk contra Musgovilla es una señal de que no puedes evitar los peligros que se ciernen sobre la Ciénaga de los Cisnes. Te has convertido en parte de un mundo más grande.","Habla con Eleri sobre la Marca de la Mano Blanca","Un Mundo Más Grande","Meneldir luce una expresión preocupada.","Eleri se alza sobre los cadáveres de los uruk saqueadores, pensando en los acontecimientos del ataque.","Habla con Meneldir"}},
[446]={nameES="Un Mundo Más Grande",objectivesES={"Meneldir dice que el ataque de los uruk contra Musgovilla es una señal de que no puedes evitar los peligros que se ciernen sobre la Ciénaga de los Cisnes. Te has convertido en parte de un mundo más grande.","Habla con Eleri sobre la Marca de la Mano Blanca","Un Mundo Más Grande","Meneldir luce una expresión preocupada.","Eleri se alza sobre los cadáveres de los uruk saqueadores, pensando en los acontecimientos del ataque.","Habla con Meneldir"}},
[447]={nameES="Un Mundo Más Grande",objectivesES={"Meneldir dice que el ataque de los uruk contra Musgovilla es una señal de que no puedes evitar los peligros que se ciernen sobre la Ciénaga de los Cisnes. Te has convertido en parte de un mundo más grande.","Habla con Eleri sobre la Marca de la Mano Blanca","Un Mundo Más Grande","Meneldir luce una expresión preocupada.","Eleri se alza sobre los cadáveres de los uruk saqueadores, pensando en los acontecimientos del ataque.","Habla con Meneldir"}},
[448]={nameES="Un Mundo Más Grande",objectivesES={"Meneldir dice que el ataque de los uruk contra Musgovilla es una señal de que no puedes evitar los peligros que se ciernen sobre la Ciénaga de los Cisnes. Te has convertido en parte de un mundo más grande.","Habla con Eleri sobre la Marca de la Mano Blanca","Un Mundo Más Grande","Meneldir luce una expresión preocupada.","Eleri se alza sobre los cadáveres de los uruk saqueadores, pensando en los acontecimientos del ataque.","Habla con Meneldir"}},
[449]={nameES="Un Mundo Más Grande",objectivesES={"Habla con Meneldir y cuéntale sobre ti","El Hombre al que salvaste fuera de la aldea en llamas viste de forma extraña, pero parece lo bastante amistoso.","Un Mundo Más Grande","Meneldir, quien fue montaraz en el pasado, te ha pedido que le digas de dónde vienes."}},
[450]={nameES="Una Burla a los Perdidos",objectivesES={"Gísi está fuera del laberinto de setos, disfrutando aún más del infortunio de los elfos extraviados.\
\
Debes informarle a Gísi que su plan funcionó y que los elfos no parecen estar ni un poco más cerca de encontrar la salida.","A Gísi le divierte enormemente la situación de los Elfos perdidos en el laberinto y desea potenciar el humor de la escena con una pequeña broma. Colocar carteles por todas partes apuntando en direcciones diversas debería confundir aún más a los pobres elfos.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro cuando finalice el festival actual. </rgb>","Una Burla a los Perdidos","Habla con Gísi fuera del laberinto en los Campos de Caballos","Has colocado un cartel confuso","Dentro del laberinto de setos en los Campos de Caballos de Bree encontrarás postes ideales para colgar estos carteles confusos.\
\
Gísi te ha invitado a formar parte de su burla hacia los elfos pidiéndote que coloques carteles apuntando en todas direcciones. Con eso, los elfos estarán aún más perdidos... si es que eso es posible."}},
[451]={nameES="Una lección de Bilbo Bolsón",objectivesES={"Sterling Ganapié conoce a un saqueador legendario que podría enseñarte grandes lecciones, pero primero debes estar bien equipado.","Habla con Sterling Ganapié","Completa Utensilios de la noche","Sterling Ganapié no sabe dónde está Bilbo Bolsón.\
\
Sterling Ganapié cree que deberías buscar al legendario saqueador Bilbo Bolsón y ver qué puedes aprender de él.","Completa Artículos de astucia","Una lección de Bilbo Bolsón","Sterling Ganapié cree que podrías aprender algo de Bilbo Bolsón, cuya aventura como saqueador ha inspirado la imaginación de los niños hobbit durante años.","Sterling Ganapié está en Los Gamos, al oeste de Bree y al este del río Brandivino.\
\
Ahora que has adquirido tu nueva arma y armadura, deberías hablar con Sterling Ganapié."}},
[452]={nameES="Una lección de Boromir",objectivesES={"Completa: Artículos de Mando","Completa: Implementos de Guerra","Habla con Boromir en Rivendel","Boromir se encuentra actualmente en Rivendel, en una de las habitaciones de invitados de la Casa de Elrond.\
\
Dawn Stockard ha sabido que Boromir, un gran capitán de Gondor, ha venido al norte de Eriador y se está hospedando con los Elfos. Cree que podría enseñarte algunas de sus técnicas si hablas con él antes de que emprenda su viaje de regreso a casa.","Dawn Stockard se encuentra en la ciudad de Archet, al norte de Bree, en las Tierras de Bree.","Dawn Stockard ha sabido que un poderoso capitán ha llegado a Eriador desde el sur y piensa que podría estar dispuesto a hablar contigo.","Una lección de Boromir"}},
[453]={nameES="Una lección de Galdor",objectivesES={"Habla con Galdor en Rivendel","Habla con Aelindil en Tornhad","Completa 'Instrumentos de navegación'","Completa 'Artículos de ingenio'","Aelindil, en Tornhad en el Ángulo del Mitheithel, conoce a un marinero legendario que podría enseñarte grandes lecciones, pero primero debes estar debidamente equipado.","Aelindil ha sabido que Galdor, un elfo de los Puertos Grises, ha venido a Rivendel. Aunque su maestro, Círdan el Carpintero de Barcos, no lo acompañó en esta misión, el propio Galdor es conocido como un Marinero de gran renombre, y podría ayudarte a pulir tus habilidades.","Aelindil se encuentra en Tornhad, en el Ángulo del Mitheithel.","Una lección de Galdor"}},
[454]={nameES="Una lección de Gimli",objectivesES={"Completa los Artículos de Valor","Gwesgylliel está en Lin Giliath, en Meluinen, en las Quebradas del Norte.","Una lección de Gimli","Habla con Gimli en Rivendel","Gimli reside actualmente en Rivendel, en una de las habitaciones de invitados de la Casa de Elrond.\
\
Gwesgylliel ha sabido que un grupo de enanos llegó a Rivendel hace poco, y uno de ellos, Gimli, era un campeón. Este campeón enano podría estar dispuesto a enseñarte algunas de sus técnicas.","Habla con Gwesgylliel en Meluinen","Completa los Implementos de Osadía","Gwesgylliel ha oído que una compañía de enanos ha llegado a Rivendel, y que entre ellos hay un campeón enano, Gimli, que podría ayudarte a crecer en poder.","Gwesgylliel conoce a un campeón legendario que podría enseñarte grandes lecciones, pero primero debes estar debidamente equipado."}},
[455]={nameES="Una Lección de Legolas",objectivesES={"Artículos Completos de Descubrimiento","Fenton Marshley, impresionado por tu dedicación y habilidad, ha recomendado que hables con Legolas, un Elfo dotado de gran destreza en la caza.","Una Lección de Legolas","Fenton Marshley conoce a un cazador legendario que podría enseñarte grandes lecciones, pero primero debes estar debidamente equipado.","Fenton Marshley está fuera del Refugio de Cazadores, al este de la aldea de Archet y al norte de Bree, en las Tierras de Bree.","Legolas podría seguir en Rivendel, en una de las habitaciones de huéspedes de La Última Morada.\
\
Fenton Marshley se encontró con un grupo de Elfos en su travesía por el Bosque Negro y cree que uno de ellos aún podría tener enseñanzas para un cazador tan hábil como tú.","Completa Instrumentos de la Caza","Habla con Legolas en Rivendel"}},
[456]={nameES="Una lección de Lindir",objectivesES={"Baillindiel conoce a un juglar legendario que podría enseñarte grandes lecciones, pero primero debes estar adecuadamente equipado.","Baillindiel está en Celondim, el puerto élfico en Ered Luin.","Lindir se encuentra en el Salón del Fuego en la casa de Elrond en el valle de Imladris.\
\
Baillindiel cree que deberías hablar con Lindir, pues el Elfo podría proporcionarte más instrucción.","Una lección de Lindir","Completa Implementos de la Canción","Baillindiel cree que deberías hablar con Lindir, un Elfo en Imladris que podría darte alguna instrucción.","Completa Artículos de la Armonía"}},
[457]={nameES="Una Lección del Señor Elrond",objectivesES={"Isdi conoce a un Sabio legendario que podría enseñarte grandes lecciones, pero primero debes estar debidamente equipado.","Elrond está en la biblioteca de La Última Morada, en el Valle de Imladris.\
\
El Sabio Isdi cree que Elrond desearía hablar contigo, y que podrías aprender algo de sus enseñanzas.","Una Lección del Señor Elrond","Completa Artículos del Misterio","Isdi está en las ruinas de Edhelion, en las laderas sobre el Salón de Thorin, en Ered Luin.","Completa Instrumentos del Conocimiento"}},
[458]={nameES="Una lección de Samsagaz Gamyi",objectivesES={"Una lección de Samsagaz Gamyi","El enano Wáli está en el puesto de avanzada de Noglond, al sur de la Mansión de Thorin y al oeste de la ciudad enana de Gondamon, en Ered Luin.","Wáli oyó que Samsagaz Gamyi es un guardián extremadamente hábil, sin igual y sin comparación.","Completa los Instrumentos de Batalla","Completa los Artículos de Fortaleza","El paradero de Samsagaz Gamyi es actualmente desconocido para Wáli, pero cree que podría estar en Rivendel.\
\
Wáli cree que deberías hablar con Samsagaz Gamyi, de quien se rumorea que es un guardián de habilidad sin igual, con la esperanza de que pueda enseñarte una o dos cosas.","Habla con Samsagaz Gamyi en Rivendel","Wáli conoce a un guardián legendario que podría enseñarte grandes lecciones, pero primero debes estar debidamente equipado."}},
[459]={nameES="A Letter Belated",objectivesES={"Bring the buckle to Habdir","Landath has come along with you on the errand. If you should get separated, use Bergil's whistle to call him back.\
\
You have asked after Rhofin in the three locations. See what Landath has to say about it.","Find Habdir's wax and seal","Inquire at the Smiths' Market","Inspect the letter","Landath was supposed to deliver the letter three days ago. He is so upset he has asked you to examine the letter.","Rhofin isn't in the Court of Eärnil","The Old Guest-house lies in the First Circle, just south of the City Gates.\
\
Meet Landath back at the Old Guest-house.","Inquire at the Merry Swan","A letter that Landath was supposed to deliver got lost and turned up, worse for wear, in the Finding Place.","Rhofin isn't at the Smiths' Market","A Letter Belated","Check on Rhofin","Found Habdir's wax and seal","The Smiths' Market lies just north of the Pier, the Court of Eärnil lies south of the Pier, and the Merry Swan lies on the far south of the Third Circle. If you should get separated from Landath, use Bergil's whistle to call him back.\
\
Ask around the Third Circle for the whereabouts of Rhofin the Smith.","Landath has come along with you on the errand. If you should get separated, use Bergil's whistle to call him back.\
\
Talk to Landath now that the buckle has been safely delivered.","The Forges of Cirion are in the northern stretch of the Third Circle. If you should get separated from Landath, use Bergil's whistle to call him back.\
\
Based on the people who had seen Rhofin today, Landath believes he will be working in the Forges of Cirion.","Inquire at the Court of Eärnil","Rhofin sets to forging","Landath dashes off, leaving you to follow","The letter is crumpled and the seal is broken, but otherwise unharmed","Landath has come along with you on the errand. If you should get separated, use Bergil's whistle to call him back.\
\
You've watched some of the other smiths at work.","Landath has come along with you on the errand. If you should get separated, use Bergil's whistle to call him back.\
\
See what Landath wishes to do while Rhofin smiths the buckle.","The Forges of Cirion are in the northern stretch of the Third Circle. If you should get separated from Landath, use Bergil's whistle to call him back.\
\
Check on Rhofin to see if he is done with his work.","The Clothiers' Fellow-hall is in the Third Circle, just south of the Pier.\
\
Landath feels the letter can still be delivered if the seal is re-made. This can be done with Master Habdir's seal, found in the Clothiers' Fellow-hall.","Rhofin hands you the buckle","The Forges of Cirion are in the northern stretch of the Third Circle. If you should get separated from Landath, use Bergil's whistle to call him back.\
\
View some of the other smiths at work while you wait for Rhofin to finish.","Talk to Landath","Landath stands in front of the Old Guest-house, in the First Circle, just south of the City Gates.\
\
Show Landath that the letter has been re-sealed.","Rhofin isn't at the Merry Swan","Return to Landath","Re-seal the letter","Re-sealed the letter","Talk to Master Aglarang","Landath stands in front of the Old Guest-house, in the First Circle, just south of the City Gates.\
\
Tell Landath that the letter isn't in terrible shape.","Deliver the letter to Rhofin","Master Habdir can be found just south of the Pier in the Third Circle, inside the Clothiers' Fellow-hall.\
\
You should deliver the newly-forged buckle to Habdir, Master Clothier, who ordered it.","Meet Landath back at the Old Guest-house","Master Aglarang should be at the Smiths' Fellow-hall, in the northern part of the Third Circle. If you should get separated from Landath, use Bergil's whistle to call him back.\
\
The letter should be delivered to a smith named Rhofin. Find Master Aglarang and ask him where Rhofin can be found."}},
[460]={nameES="A Letter to Mêshaget",objectivesES={"Sâdikiz has given you a letter and asked you to deliver it to Mêshaget when you return to Jiret-menêsh.","You carry a letter given to you by Sâdikiz addressed to Mêshaget. You can't help but notice that the seal on the letter is poorly done and that you would be able to read it without arousing suspicion.","Bring Sâdikiz's letter to Mêshaget in Jiret-menêsh","A Letter to Mêshaget"}},
[461]={nameES="A Letter to a Lady",objectivesES={"Baranor thanked you for your help in Arnach and asked you to bear an important letter to Lady Vanyalos, in Imloth Melui.","Lady Vanyalos can be found in her hall, located on a rise to the north-east of the entrance to Imloth Melui, in Lossarnach.\
\
Baranor asked you to deliver a letter describing the attack on Arnach to Lady Vanyalos, who rules Imloth Melui while her husband Forlong is at war.","Bring the letter to Lady Vanyalos in her hall, on the north-east rise in Imloth Melui","A Letter to a Lady"}},
[462]={nameES="A Life Hangs on a Thread",objectivesES={"Hebil is in the Corsair encampment in northern Lamedon.\
\
You should speak with Hebil.","Gladion and Limril are at their home in Dínadab.\
\
You should speak with Limril.","Fuirion lies even more grievously wounded at Hebil's feet. If he is to be rescued, it must be done soon, but Hebil stands in the way.","Try to rescue Fuirion from Hebil and the Corsairs","Speak with Limril","A Life Hangs on a Thread","Fuirion lies in a pool of blood, breathing slowly. He is not dead, but it is clear that he does not have much time...."}},
[463]={nameES="El trabajo de una vida",objectivesES={"El trabajo de una vida","En una Isla Escudo remota, un distinguido erudito umbareño perdió su invaluable investigación cuando fue atacado por grandes escarabajos. Recupera la investigación y lleva la lucha a estas viles criaturas.","Recupera la investigación y destruye los nidos de Ghax-hophra.","Reina de la Colmena Ghax-hophra derrotada"}},
[464]={nameES="Una luz en el jardín",objectivesES={"Habla con Oxi en Jazârgund","Una luz en el jardín","Oxi está en Jazârgund, al este de Tharâkh Bazân en el Camino de Durin.\
\
Oxi se alegrará de saber que el espejo ha sido realineado y vuelve a ser útil.","Las criaturas en Tharâkh Bazân siguen manipulando el espejo allí.","El espejo en Tharâkh Bazân ha quedado inutilizable una vez más. Parece que las criaturas allí insisten en moverlo de su posición."}},
[465]={nameES="A Line to Be Crossed",objectivesES={"You've found Hedra outside the wreck of the Kêl Tezhor.\
\
You should talk to her.","Find Hedra near the wreck of the Kêl Tezhor","Startled, the girl whirls to face you, knife in hand. 'Who are you? What do you want?!'\
\
As you explain, she lowers her knife.\
\
'I should've known Anoch would tell someone eventually. The truth is, I... I wanted to avenge Father. Those Corsairs took him away and I couldn't even do anything about it. I thought, maybe if I muster up the courage to fight them off, they'd leave us alone forever. It sounds silly, doesn't it? Me, fighting all of those men...\
\
'And I want to. I want to run in screaming and tear them apart. I'm so angry. But I'm also so scared. I've never hurt anyone. I don't want to hurt anyone. But they hurt Father. He must be dead by now.\
\
'What am I supposed to do?'","Talk to Hedra","Anoch's sister has gone missing. The only clue you have is that she left for the wreck of the Kêl Tezhor, armed with her father's knife.","That must be Hedra!","A Line to Be Crossed","The location Anoch described sounds like the wreck of the Kêl Tezhor, which lies west of Melgobas.\
\
You should try and find Hedra there."}},
[466]={nameES="Un Poco Extra Nunca Hace Daño — Parte 1",objectivesES={"Habla con Dwalin en el Patio de Frerin","La Tienda de LOTRO ofrece cosméticos, potenciadores, acceso a contenido y una variedad de otros artículos. ¡Asegúrate de visitarla a menudo para ver qué hay de nuevo!\
\
<rgb=#00FF00>Aceptar y completar esta misión solo puede hacerse una vez por servidor. Si cierras sesión antes de completarla, será eliminada de tu registro de misiones y deberás aceptarla nuevamente. Esto te dará acceso a una misión tutorial especial para presentarte la Tienda de LOTRO.</rgb>","Un Poco Extra Nunca Hace Daño — Parte 1","Dwalin está en el centro del Patio de Frerin en Ered Luin.\
\
Debes hablar con Dwalin para aprender más sobre su oferta.\
\
<rgb=#00FF00>Esta es una misión tutorial para acceder a la tienda web.</rgb>"}},
[467]={nameES="Un Poco Extra Nunca Hace Daño — Parte 1",objectivesES={"Habla con Jon Helecharroyo en la Cabaña del Cazador","Jon Helecharroyo está en la Cabaña del Cazador cerca de Archet.\
\
Debes hablar con Jon Helecharroyo para aprender más sobre su oferta.\
\
<rgb=#00FF00>Esta es una misión tutorial para acceder a la tienda web.</rgb>","La Tienda de LOTRO ofrece cosméticos, potenciadores, acceso a contenido y una variedad de otros artículos. ¡Asegúrate de visitarla a menudo para ver qué hay de nuevo!\
\
<rgb=#00FF00>Aceptar y completar esta misión solo puede hacerse una vez por servidor. Si cierras sesión antes de completarla, será eliminada de tu registro de misiones y deberás aceptarla nuevamente. Esto te dará acceso a una misión tutorial especial para presentarte la Tienda de LOTRO.</rgb>","Un Poco Extra Nunca Hace Daño — Parte 1"}},
[468]={nameES="Un Poco Extra Nunca Hace Daño — Parte 1",objectivesES={"Skardi Doblafilos está en la herrería de Musgovilla.\
\
Debes hablar con Skardi Doblafilos para aprender más sobre su oferta.\
\
<rgb=#00FF00>Esta es una misión tutorial para acceder a la tienda web.</rgb>","La Tienda de LOTRO ofrece cosméticos, potenciadores, acceso a contenido y una variedad de otros artículos. ¡Asegúrate de visitarla a menudo para ver qué hay de nuevo!\
\
<rgb=#00FF00>Aceptar y completar esta misión solo puede hacerse una vez por servidor. Si cierras sesión antes de completarla, será eliminada de tu registro de misiones y deberás aceptarla nuevamente. Esto te dará acceso a una misión tutorial especial para presentarte la Tienda de LOTRO.</rgb>","Un Poco Extra Nunca Hace Daño — Parte 1","Habla con Skardi Doblafilos en su tienda."}},
[469]={nameES="Un Poco Extra Nunca Hace Daño — Parte 2",objectivesES={"Habla con el otorgador de la misión para completarla. <rgb=#00FF00>Debes comprar esta misión en la Tienda Web de LOTRO antes de poder completarla.</rgb>","Un Poco Extra Nunca Hace Daño — Parte 2","Habla con el otorgador de la misión para completarla.","Esta misión está pensada para mostrarte cómo interactuar con la Tienda de LOTRO.","<rgb=#00FF00>Esta misión debe desbloquearse una vez por tu cuenta y puede adquirirse en la Tienda de LOTRO. Completar la misión 'Un Poco Extra Nunca Hace Daño — Parte 1' no es obligatorio para continuar, pero proporcionará suficientes Puntos LOTRO para cubrir esta compra. 'Un Poco Extra Nunca Hace Daño — Parte 1' solo puede completarse una vez por cuenta.</rgb>\
\
Para comprar esta misión, haz clic en el botón en la parte inferior izquierda de la ventana de Diálogo de Misión que dice Desbloquear Misión. Esto te llevará a la interfaz de la tienda web. Desde allí, puedes elegir gastar Puntos LOTRO para obtener acceso a la misión.\
\
Puedes usar la tienda para una multitud de compras, incluyendo acceso a zonas de aventura, objetos consumibles, expansiones, recetas de artesanía, objetos cosméticos, monturas y mucho más.\
\
Aunque 'Un Poco Extra Nunca Hace Daño — Parte 1' solo puede completarse una vez por cuenta, esta misión, 'Un Poco Extra Nunca Hace Daño — Parte 2', puede ser completada por cada personaje.","<rgb=#00FF00>Esta misión debe desbloquearse una vez por tu cuenta y puede adquirirse en la Tienda de LOTRO. Has recibido suficientes Puntos LOTRO para cubrir esta compra gracias a 'Un Poco Extra Nunca Hace Daño — Parte 1'.\
\
Para comprar esta misión, haz clic en el botón en la parte inferior izquierda de la ventana de Diálogo de Misión que dice Desbloquear Misión. Esto te llevará a la interfaz de la tienda web. Desde allí, puedes elegir gastar Puntos LOTRO para obtener acceso a la misión.\
\
Puedes usar la tienda para una multitud de compras, incluyendo acceso a zonas de aventura, objetos consumibles, expansiones, recetas de artesanía, objetos cosméticos, monturas y mucho más.</rgb>"}},
[470]={nameES="A Little More for the Road",objectivesES={}},
[471]={nameES="A Little Piece of Home in Evendim",objectivesES={"A Little Piece of Home in Evendim","You have gathered a perfect cut of boar-meat, which brings to mind a tale of woe you overheard from a bard:\
\
'Poor Parr Chopley has left all he has known and struck forth into the world, finding himself in Evendim, in Ost Forod.\
\
'The sad little hobbit has been searching high and low for a little piece of boar to remind him of home.'\
\
Perhaps you should travel north to Ost Forod and seek out this hobbit. He may appreciate this prize piece of boar-meat.","Deliver the boar-meat to Parr Chopley in Ost Forod","This piece of boar-meat, while slightly discoloured, seems to be a wonderful cut of meat. Perhaps someone in Ost Forod might be really looking for something to hit the spot.","Parr Chopley is in Ost Forod in Evendim, far to the north of the Shire.\
\
You should bring the boar-meat to Parr Chopley."}},
[472]={nameES="Un pequeño toque de rojo",objectivesES={"Un pequeño toque de rojo","Lleva las escamas a Waldo Cerrohueco en Dwaling","Se pueden encontrar escamas cubiertas de arena en las salamandras de las dunas del sur del Barandalf, al norte y al este de Dwaling.\
\
Waldo Cerrohueco te ha pedido que recojas escamas cubiertas de arena de las salamandras, para poder hacer cristal rojo.","Waldo Cerrohueco está en casa de Hob Cimacolina, en el exterior de Dwaling.\
\
Waldo Cerrohueco querrá empezar a moler las escamas lo antes posible.","Cuando se muelen, las escamas de salamandra pueden utilizarse para fabricar cristal rojo.","Utilizamos muchos materiales para dar distintas tonalidades al vidrio. Uno de los colores de los que me encargo es el rojo. No es muy un color muy difícil de obtener, pero requiere una buena cantidad de material conseguir un carmesí brillante.\
\
'Las escamas de salamandra son el mejor material que he encontrado por aquí para fabricar vidrio rojo. Desafortunadamente nuestros suministros son escasos, así que no podemos hacer más rojo o naranja.\
\
Puedes encontrar escamas cubiertas de arena en las salamandras de las dunas del sur del Barandalf, al norte y al este de aquí. Si me consigues un puñado, te estaría agradecido.'"}},
[473]={nameES="Un Poco de Ambas",objectivesES={"Se pueden encontrar Uruks cerca de Tham Celechir, la Sala del Río Veloz, al norte de Idhobel.","Un Poco de Ambas","Lornel está junto a la fogata en Idhobel.","Lleva las espadas de Uruk a Lornel en Idhobel","Lornel quiere que sepas que no es solo un sanador, sino también un guerrero y un capitán."}},
[474]={nameES="A Local Supply",objectivesES={"A Local Supply","Mírthel recoils as you hand him the meat. The smell is quite foul.\
\
'Ah... not so edible, then. A shame. The deer are too sickly for our consumption, and the goats have succumbed to a fell sort of corruption that enables them to survive in this evil place.\
\
'Thank you for your efforts all the same. I will dispatch one of our Rangers for more rations.'","Mírthel has asked you to hunt some of the local wildlife and assess whether their meat can be eaten by the Rangers.","Mírthel has asked you to hunt some of the wildlife in Cirith Ungol to assess the edibility of the meat.\
\
You should hunt deer and dire-horns for their meat.","Talk to Mírthel","Mírthel is waiting for you to return with the meat."}},
[475]={nameES="A Lock with No Key",objectivesES={"Ask Khôltekh about his thoughts on the matter","Listen to Khôltekh's explanation.","A Lock with No Key","Listen to Khôltekh's thoughts on the key","Khôltekh has asked you back to his house once more, so he can think on the riddle of this key and access to Dâr Sêkhta.","Listen to Khôltekh's thoughts on the key.","Accompany Khôltekh to his study","Accompany Khôltekh to his study.","Listen to Khôltekh's explanation","Ask Khôltekh about his thoughts on the matter."}},
[476]={nameES="A Logical Appeal",objectivesES={}},
[477]={nameES="Un vigilante solitario",objectivesES={"Busca a Orthonn y habla con él","Un vigilante solitario","Orthonn se encuentra en su campamento cerca del río en Annúndir, no muy lejos del camino.\
\
Debes encontrar a Orthonn y hablar con él.","Amarion te ha pedido que ofrezcas tu ayuda y compañía a Orthonn, un Montaraz que tiene la misión de mantener un puesto de vigilancia en la espesura de Annúndir."}},
[478]={nameES="A Lonesome Tree",objectivesES={}},
[479]={nameES="A Long Bridge to Kasukhín",objectivesES={}},
[480]={nameES="Un largo eco",objectivesES={"Completa el segundo objetivo del diario","Divisas una mochila en la esquina nordeste de la Gran Excavación, situada junto a una gran grieta en el camino.\
\
Deberías registrar la mochila.","Wigfast escuchó un grito con un eco extrañamente largo al nordeste de Gazatmur, y se pregunta qué pudo haber sido ese sonido.","Cerca de la mochila hay un libro, un diario, con los objetivos de un enano anotados.\
\
Deberías completar los objetivos que pretendía el enano que murió.","Slagvi se encuentra en el Mirador de la Gran Excavación, en la Gran Excavación de Moria.\
\
Deberías contarle a Slagvi todo lo que has encontrado en el lado oriental de la Gran Excavación.","Habla con Slagvi en el Mirador de la Gran Excavación","Esta mochila podría indicar la fuente del extraño eco que escuchó Wigfast. Parece haber pertenecido a un enano, pero el enano no se encuentra por ninguna parte.\
\
Sospechas firmemente que cayó por la peligrosa grieta del camino. Pero ¿qué hacía tan lejos de cualquier asentamiento establecido en Moria?","Un largo eco","Completa el primer objetivo del diario","La fuente del eco puede encontrarse siguiendo las escaleras tras el escondite de Wigfast y, desde allí, dirigiéndote al noroeste hacia los niveles superiores.\
\
Deberías buscar el origen del eco.","Encuentra la fuente del eco","Investiga la mochila cerca de la grieta del camino","Esta zona coincide con las descripciones de Wigfast...."}},
[481]={nameES="A Long Journey for the Steeds",objectivesES={"The horses are now much less agitated thanks to your efforts.","This horse looks hungry","A Long Journey for the Steeds","Gapholt has become a haven for the Rohirrim who sought a safer place to live than the dangerous streets of Woodhurst.","There is a bag of horse-feed near the refugee waiting at the end of the line on the bridge trying to get into Gapholt.\
\
You should collect horse-feed from the bag.","The horses seem more calm now that you have given them a little food, and it seems they are less likely to become unruly and cause injury to themselves or others. Hopefully, whatever is delaying their entry will be resolved soon.","Completado","Collect horse-feed from the container","Many horses are agitated by the wait on the bridge after the long journey from Woodhurst.\
\
The refugee at the end of the line suggested that you feed them to help calm them down."}},
[482]={nameES="A Long Siege",objectivesES={"Talk to Dírion outside the Lower Stores, in the First Circle of the city","Merethien, the Master Foodmonger of the Council, is in the Dome of the Sun.\
\
Arodor told you that Merethien could use your assistance.","Mirudal, the Warden of the Stores, is in the Dome of the Sun.\
\
Arodor told you that Mirudal could use your assistance.","The Lower Stores are guarded to prevent unlawful access to the goods within","Go to the very back of the Upper Stores and use the Upper Stores Inventory","Go to the very back of the Lower Stores and use the Lower Stores Inventory","Inside the Upper Stores, you should compare the inventory with the actual goods being stored. Only by knowing the exact count of the foodstuffs available can Mirudal and Merethien properly ration them during a long siege.","A Long Siege","Dírion is outside the Lower Stores, just north of the main gate to the city, in the First Circle.\
\
You have discovered that the inventory of the Lower Stores does not match their contents: some food is missing.","Arodor has asked that you help the Council of Gondor inventory the supplies in the city in order to prepare for a long siege.","Inside the Lower Stores, you should compare the inventory with the actual goods being stored. Only by knowing the exact count of the foodstuffs available can Mirudal and Merethien properly ration them during a long siege.","The Lower Stores are located just north of the main gate to the city, in the First Circle.\
\
Something about Dírion's story does not convince you, and you think you should confront the guard about it.","Talk to Mirudal, Warden of the Stores, in the Dome of the Sun","Find the entrance to the Lower Stores, just north of the main gate to the city, in the First Circle","A thorough comparison reveals that the contents of the Upper Stores are properly accounted","The Lower Stores are located just north of the main gate to the city, in the First Circle.\
\
Mirudal gave you an inventory with which you can take stock of the goods within the Lower Stores.","Talk to Túlharil outside the Upper Stores, in the north-east section of the Fifth Circle","The inventory does not match the contents of the Lower Stores. Some food is missing.","Mirudal may be convinced, but your suspicions remain","Talk to Merethien, Master Foodmonger, in the Dome of the Sun","The Upper Stores are located in the north-east section of the Fifth Circle of the city.\
\
Mirudal gave you an inventory with which you can take stock of the goods within the Upper Stores.","The Upper Stores are guarded to prevent unlawful access to the goods within","Find the entrance to the Upper Stores, in the north-east section of the Fifth Circle","Confront Dírion outside the Lower Stores, in the First Circle","The Dome of the Sun is in the Sixth Circle of Minas Tirith.\
\
Dírion told you that he suspects rats have gotten into the Stores, and that explains the missing food. He asked you to tell Mirudal about it. The Warden of the Stores may want to lower his expectations for the food-rationing to come, as a result of the rats.","Return the inventories to Mirudal in the Dome of the Sun, and tell him about the rats"}},
[483]={nameES="A Long Siege - Forgive Him",objectivesES={"Talk to Dírion outside the Lower Stores, in the First Circle","Talk to Mirudal in the Dome of the Sun and tell him that Dírion will take care of the rats","Dírion has admitted to stealing food from the Stores he has been trusted with guarding.","A Long Siege - Forgive Him","Dírion is outside the Lower Stores, located just north of the main gate to the city, in the First Circle.\
\
Mirudal, Warden of the Stores, has asked you to thank Dírion for his duty to the city.","Mirudal, the Warden of the Stores, is in the Dome of the Sun.\
\
You have agreed to help Dírion with his deception, so that his family can have the food he stole for them. He asked you to tell Mirudal that he will take care of the rats, and the Warden need not worry about them any longer."}},
[484]={nameES="A Long Siege - Turn Him In",objectivesES={"Thalhír, the Warden of Laws, is in the Dome of the Sun.\
\
You have decided to report of Dírion's transgression to Thalhír, the Warden of Laws.","A Long Siege - Turn Him In","Talk to Thalhír in the Dome of the Sun","Dírion has admitted to stealing food from the Stores he has been trusted with guarding."}},
[485]={nameES="A Long-awaited Banquet -- Faramir",objectivesES={"The sapling of the White Tree can be found before the Tower of Ecthelion outside Merethrond.\
\
Faramir has asked you to bury a stone among the soil of the sapling of the White Tree.","As you cover the stone in soil, you consider the life of Denethor","With the One Ring destroyed and the Enemy undone, the Free Peoples of Middle-earth gather to Minas Tirith for a grand banquet commemorating the wedding of King Aragorn II Elessar to Queen Arwen Undómiel. Among the many in attendance, there sits the Steward of Gondor and Prince of Ithilien -- Faramir, son of Denethor.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This quest will be removed from your quest log when the current festival ends.</rgb>","Boromir's horn lies before Faramir in Merethrond.\
\
Faramir has asked you to inspect the horn of his fallen brother, Boromir.","Faramir can be found in Merethrond.\
\
You inspected Boromir's horn as Faramir asked. You should talk to Faramir.","A Long-awaited Banquet -- Faramir","Bury the stone in the soil beside the sapling of the White Tree","Faramir can be found in Merethrond.\
\
You have done as Faramir asked. You should return to Faramir in Merethrond.","Examine Boromir's horn","Cleft in twain after Boromir sounded it at Amon Hen, the horn remains an heirloom of Gondor","Talk to Faramir"}},
[486]={nameES="A Long-awaited Banquet -- Frodo Baggins",objectivesES={"Dark ink swirls inside the phial","Habla con Frodo","A Long-awaited Banquet -- Frodo Baggins","Frodo lets out a long sigh and chuckles to himself","The quill is well-used, but kept in good care","Collect a writing-quill","Frodo Baggins can be found in Merethrond in Minas Tirith (Midsummer).\
\
You have collected the writing-quill, phial of ink, and parchment. You should deliver them to Frodo at the wedding banquet in Merethrond.","Deliver the quill, ink, and parchment to Frodo in Merethrond","Writing-quills, phials of ink, and sheets of parchment might be found in either the Houses of Lore or the Blue Theatre.\
\
Frodo has asked you to gather a writing-quill, a phial of ink, and some sheets of parchment that he might begin to write on his adventures.","Frodo Baggins can be found in Merethrond in Minas Tirith (Midsummer).\
\
After delivering a quill, ink, and parchment to Frodo Baggins, he appears to have found himself unable to write. You should talk to Frodo.","With the One Ring destroyed and the Enemy undone, the Free Peoples of Middle-earth gather to Minas Tirith for a grand banquet commemorating the wedding of King Aragorn II Elessar to Queen Arwen Undómiel. Among the many who have attended, there sits a hobbit of unequalled renown -- Frodo Baggins, the Nine-fingered.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> NOTE: This quest will be removed from your quest log when the current festival ends. </rgb>","Wait for Frodo to decide how to start his tale of adventure","Collect a phial of ink","Frodo is deciding where to begin his tale of adventure."}},
[487]={nameES="A Long-awaited Banquet -- Gimli",objectivesES={"A pitcher of ale can be found at Gimli's table in Merethrond in Minas Tirith (Midsummer).\
\
Gimli has again asked you to drink with him as he shares his plans for the coming days.","Galadriel can be found in Merethrond in Minas Tirith (Midsummer).\
\
Gimli has asked you to speak to Galadriel on his behalf and see if she might wish to visit the Glittering Caves or return to Minas Tirith once the city gates are repaired.","With the One Ring destroyed and the Enemy undone, the Free Peoples of Middle-earth gather to Minas Tirith for a grand banquet commemorating the wedding of King Aragorn II Elessar to Queen Arwen Undómiel. Among the many in attendance, there sits a dwarf of the proud line of Durin's Folk -- Gimli, son of Glóin.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This quest will be removed from your quest log when the current festival ends.</rgb>","Gimli can be found in Merethrond in Minas Tirith (Midsummer).\
\
You have shared a drink with Gimli and should now listen to him.","A Long-awaited Banquet -- Gimli","A pitcher of ale can be found at Gimli's table in Merethrond in Minas Tirith (Midsummer).\
\
Gimli has asked you to drink with him as he shares his plans for the coming days.","Drink with Gimli again","<rgb=#FF00FF>Listen</rgb> to Gimli","Gimli gestures for you to listen to him","Drink with Gimli","Habla con Galadriel","Gimli can be found in Merethrond in Minas Tirith (Midsummer).\
\
Although seemingly flattered, Galadriel has politely declined Gimli's invitation. However, Galadriel did impart that she knows their paths shall cross once again.","As you tell Galadriel of Gimli's plans for the coming days and offer an invitation on his behalf, she begins to chuckle softly.\
\
'You may tell Gimli that I have not forgotten the manner of our meeting in Lothlórien, nor have I forgotten the manner of our parting. A gift given freely need not be repaid.\
\
'Although I must decline Gimli's invitation, do not think that I do so in unkindness. I look now to the West for that is where my future leads me. Yet, I know that our paths shall cross once more ere the end.\
\
'Do not let your hearts be troubled in times of such joy. Much still remains to be seen!'","Gimli can be found in Merethrond in Minas Tirith (Midsummer).\
\
You have shared another drink with Gimli and should again listen to him.","Gimli can be found in Merethrond in Minas Tirith (Midsummer).\
\
Gimli has finished telling of his plans for the comings days, but it seems he wishes to say something else to you.","Gimli excitedly gestures for you to listen again","Habla con Gimli"}},
[488]={nameES="A Long-awaited Banquet -- King Aragorn II Elessar",objectivesES={"Unquieted tables can be found throughout Merethrond.\
\
King Aragorn II Elessar has asked you to quiet tables in Merethrond that he might offer a toast.","With the One Ring destroyed and the Enemy undone, the Free Peoples of Middle-earth gather to Minas Tirith for a grand banquet commemorating the wedding of King Aragorn II Elessar to Queen Arwen Undómiel. At the head of the table beside Queen Arwen Undómiel, sits the King of Gondor and of the High King of the Reunited Kingdom  -- King Aragorn II Elessar.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This quest will be removed from your quest log when the current festival ends.</rgb>","Talk to King Aragorn II Elessar","King Aragorn II Elessar can be found in Merethrond.\
\
You have quieted all of the tables in the main hall of Merethrond. You should return to King Aragorn II Elessar.","A Long-awaited Banquet -- King Aragorn II Elessar"}},
[489]={nameES="A Long-awaited Banquet -- Legolas",objectivesES={"Legolas can be found in Merethrond in Minas Tirith (Midsummer).\
\
Gimli has politely declined Legolas's invitation. You should return to Legolas.","Gimli raises an eyebrow appraisingly","Gimli can be found in Merethrond in Minas Tirith (Midsummer).\
\
Your challenge seems to have gotten Gimli's attention. You should talk to Gimli.","A Long-awaited Banquet -- Legolas","Gimli can be found in Merethrond in Minas Tirith (Midsummer).\
\
You have collected ten bottles of wine as Legolas asked. You should now challenge Gimli to 'battle' Legolas in a contest of fortitude.","With the One Ring destroyed and the Enemy undone, the Free Peoples of Middle-earth gather to Minas Tirith for a grand banquet commemorating the wedding of King Aragorn II Elessar to Queen Arwen Undómiel. Among the many in attendance, there sits an Elf of Eryn Lasgalen -- Legolas, son of Thranduil.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This quest will be removed from your quest log when the current festival ends.</rgb>","Bottles of wine can be found in the kitchens of Merethrond.\
\
Legolas has asked you to collect bottles of wine in Merethrond.","Gimli can be found in Merethrond in Minas Tirith (Midsummer).\
\
Legolas has asked you to invite Gimli to join him in a contest of fortitude at the wedding banquet. You should talk to Gimli.","Habla con Legolas.","Habla con Gimli","Legolas can be found in Merethrond in Minas Tirith (Midsummer).\
\
Gimli has enthusiastically accepted Legolas's challenge. You should talk to Legolas.","<rgb=#ff00ff>Challenge</rgb> Gimli to 'battle' Legolas"}},
[490]={nameES="A Long-awaited Banquet -- Meriadoc Brandybuck",objectivesES={"Merry's pipe-weed might be found near the baths in the Southern Great Guest-house, among the High Stables, or near the end of the prow of Minas Tirith.\
\
Merry has asked you to find his supply of Longbottom Leaf in Minas Tirith.","Talk to Toldir","Return to Merethrond","Among all the crates, barrels, and hay-bales in the High Stables, you find no pipe-weed","Merry's pipe-weed can be found at the base of the stairs to the kitchens in Merethrond.\
\
Toldir informed you that he left Merry's pipe-weed in the kitchens of Merethrond. You should collect it.","Deliver the pipe-weed to Meriadoc Brandybuck","Toldir can be found in Merethrond.\
\
Upon entering Merethrond, Toldir tried to get your attention. You should talk to Toldir.","Collect Merry's pipe-weed in Merethrond","Search for Merry's pipe-weed in the High Stables","A small portion of the stock in Saruman's keeping, but more than enough for a banquet","Merethrond can be found near the Tower of Ecthelion in Minas Tirith (Midsummer).\
\
You did not find Merry's pipe-weed in any of the locations he mentioned. You should return to Merethrond and inform him.","Scattered petals from the wedding of Aragorn and Arwen lie nearby, but that is all","The comfort of the baths would be ideal for pipe-weed, but you find no sign of it","Search for Merry's pipe-weed in the Southern Great Guest-house","Merry can be found in Merethrond.\
\
You have collected Merry's pipe-weed and should now return it to him.","With the One Ring destroyed and the Enemy undone, the Free Peoples of Middle-earth gather to Minas Tirith for a grand banquet commemorating the wedding of King Aragorn II Elessar to Queen Arwen Undómiel. Among the many in attendance, there sits a hobbit of some renown -- Meriadoc Brandybuck.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This quest will be removed from your quest log when the current festival ends.</rgb>","A Long-awaited Banquet -- Meriadoc Brandybuck","As you enter Merethrond, Toldir tries to get your attention","Search for Merry's pipe-weed on the prow of Minas Tirith"}},
[491]={nameES="A Long-awaited Banquet -- Mithrandir",objectivesES={"Talk to Mithrandir","Collect the 'Chronicle of Arnor' in the High Guest-house","With the One Ring destroyed and the Enemy undone, the Free Peoples of Middle-earth gather to Minas Tirith for a grand banquet commemorating the wedding of King Aragorn II Elessar to Queen Arwen Undómiel. Among the many in attendance, there sits one of the Wise -- Mithrandir, the Wizard known beyond the lands of Gondor as Gandalf the White.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This quest will be removed from your quest log when the current festival ends.</rgb>","Mithrandir can be found in Merethrond in Minas Tirith (Midsummer).\
\
Mithrandir has not revealed why he needed the tomes from his guest-chamber. You should wait and see if he will soon reveal their purpose.","This dense volume is bound in leather","Mithrandir can be found in Merethrond in Minas Tirith (Midsummer).\
\
You have found the tomes that Mithrandir requested and should now deliver them to him at the wedding banquet.","Collect 'On the Line of Kings' in the High Guest-house","Mithrandir appears to notice your gaze","Deliver the tomes of lore to Mithrandir in Merethrond","Mithrandir can be found in Merethrond in Minas Tirith (Midsummer).\
\
Mithrandir seems prepared to discuss the purpose of the tomes he requested from his guest-chamber. You should talk to Mithrandir.","This heavy tome has been kept in remarkable condition","A Long-awaited Banquet -- Mithrandir"}},
[492]={nameES="A Long-awaited Banquet -- Peregrin Took",objectivesES={"Travel to the Old Guest-house","A Long-awaited Banquet -- Peregrin Took","The children can be found just outside the Old Guest-house in the First Circle of Minas Tirith (Midsummer).\
\
You have arrived at the Old Guest-house with the platters of food you gathered in Merethrond. You should offer it to the children that they might share it with the other inhabitants of the Old Guest-house.","Various platters of food can be found in the kitchens of Merethrond.\
\
Pippin has asked you to gather food from the kitchens of Merethrond that it might be give to the children and refugees seeking shelter in the Old Guest-house.","Deliver the sealed missive to Beregond","The Old Guest-house can be found in the First Circle to the south of the gates of Minas Tirith (Midsummer).\
\
Pippin has asked you to deliver the food you collected to the inhabitants of the Old Guest-house.","Beregond can be found in Merethrond in Minas Tirith (Midsummer).\
\
Pippin has asked you to give a sealed missive to Beregond.","A few of the children who dwell in the Old Guest-house appear to be waiting","Pippin can be found in Merethrond in Minas Tirith (Midsummer).\
\
You successfully delivered the platters of food to the inhabitants of the Old Guest-house. You should return to Pippin.","With the One Ring destroyed and the Enemy undone, the Free Peoples of Middle-earth gather to Minas Tirith for a grand banquet commemorating the wedding of King Aragorn II Elessar to Queen Arwen Undómiel. Among the many in attendance, there sits a hobbit of some renown -- Peregrin Took.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This quest will be removed from your quest log when the current festival ends.</rgb>","Pippin can be found in Merethrond in Minas Tirith (Midsummer).\
\
Beregond has learned the truth of his invitation to the wedding of King Aragorn II Elessar and Arwen Undómiel. You should talk to Pippin.","Deliver the platters of food to the children at the Old Guest-house","Capítulo 14: La Puerta Negra"}},
[493]={nameES="A Long-awaited Banquet -- Samwise Gamgee",objectivesES={"Talk to Samwise Gamgee","Sam has found respite in a small alcove beneath the main hall of Merethrond","A Long-awaited Banquet -- Samwise Gamgee","Meet Samwise Gamgee in a small alcove in Merethrond","With the One Ring destroyed and the Enemy undone, the Free Peoples of Middle-earth gather to Minas Tirith for a grand banquet commemorating the wedding of King Aragorn II Elessar to Queen Arwen Undómiel. Among the many in attendance, there sits a hobbit of some renown -- Samwise Gamgee.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This quest will be removed from your quest log when the current festival ends.</rgb>","Samwise Gamgee can be found in a small alcove of Merethrond, across from the High King and High Queen's table and down the stairs.\
\
Samwise Gamgee has asked you to accompany him to a small alcove in Merethrond where he wishes to speak further to you.","Samwise Gamgee can be found in a small alcove of Merethrond, across from the High King and High Queen's table and down the stairs.\
\
You have found Samwise Gamgee in a quiet alcove beneath the main hall of Merethrond. You should talk to Samwise Gamgee.","Samwise Gamgee can be found in a small alcove of Merethrond, across from the High King and High Queen's table and down the stairs.\
\
You have helped Samwise dispel his worrisome thoughts of the Shire. You should talk to Samwise Gamgee.","Samwise's worrisome thoughts can be found throughout Merethrond.\
\
Samwise Gamgee has begun to worry about the friends and family he left behind in the Shire. You should help him dispel these worrisome thoughts."}},
[494]={nameES="A Long-awaited Banquet, A Celebration Without End",objectivesES={}},
[495]={nameES="A Long-forgotten Relic",objectivesES={"You've gathered as much information as you can","You've gathered all the information you can from the townsfolk of Halrax. You now have a lead. You should talk to Ithurga.\
\
Ithurga can be found in Halrax.","All the witnesses had varying tales, but a professor has told us Shereb knows of this hammer.\
\
You can find Shereb in the most isolated part of Halrax.","Ithurga suspects this is a replica and wants you to confirm all the rumours about this hammer from the town's residents.","A Long-forgotten Relic","Talk to Ithurga","Confirm witness accounts 7/8","You delivered what seems to be a replica of a forgotten myth."}},
[496]={nameES="A Look Before the Leap",objectivesES={"In short time, the Variags have erected palisades and watch-towers","You have the ransom Jarl Akhiz demanded for two of Lady Glánhar's sons.","Meet Gondrad before Jarl Akhiz's camp at Bâr Nadhron.","The manor of Bâr Nadhron looms above, ruined. The cellar likely lies beneath","A Look Before the Leap","Explore the various entrances of Jarl Akhiz's camp in Bâr Nadhron.","The Variag camp is fully manned and armed - and well-guarded","The sheer number of arrows and corpses tell a tale of capture by brutal force","Bâr Nadhron has been burnt, and no doubt pillaged, ruthlessly","Return to Gondrad","Return to Gondrad just outside the camp at Bâr Nadhron.","Meet Gondrad at Bâr Nadhron"}},
[497]={nameES="A Looming Enemy",objectivesES={"A Looming Enemy","The shore is littered with the bodies of Orcs that drowned while fleeing the battle...","Patrol the shores of the Anduin to the north of Osgiliath","You discover the mangled remains of a Ranger who appears to have fallen a great distance...","Patrol the foot-hills of the Ephel Dúath to east of Bâr Aroth","Although the battle is ended, Thurindol fears that the Enemy will soon muster more of his forces against Gondor within North Ithilien.","Bâr Aroth can be found on a hillside to the north of the Cross-roads in North Ithilien.\
\
Thurindol has asked you to assess the Enemy's presence in North Ithilien before you continue your journey to the refuge.","A heavy shadow hangs over you, but you cannot spy what might have cast it...","Patrol the hill-top to the north of Bâr Aroth","Thurindol can be found at Aelin Veren.\
\
You have scouted the lands surrounding Bâr Aroth and should bring news to Thurindol at Aelin Veren.","Talk to Thurindol at Aelin Veren"}},
[498]={nameES="Una amenaza inminente",objectivesES={"Hablar con Avorthal","Ayuda a Erfith con 'Un trato que salió mal'","Avorthal se encuentra en una colina junto al camino cerca de la frontera de Ered Luin con la Comarca Allende.\
\
Has ayudado a Avorthal y a Athal a expulsar a los trasgos que cruzaron el río Lune, a liberar a los compañeros de Erfith que buscaban la paz, y averiguado el plan de los Duramano para convocar a sus malvados aliados a la antigua fortaleza de Sarnúr. Debes hablar con Avorthal.","Una amenaza inminente","Athal y Erfith se encuentran en una colina junto al camino cerca de la frontera de Ered Luin con la Comarca Allende.\
\
Avorthal te ha pedido que ayudes a Athal y al Duramano Erfith a expulsar a los trasgos que han cruzado a la Comarca Allende.","El elfo Avorthal y el enano, Athal vigilan de cerca Ered Luin y las tierras circundantes.","Ayuda a Athal con 'El Cazarrecompensas de Lhúngobel'"}},
[499]={nameES="Voluntad de un Sabio",objectivesES={"Isferon te dio el primero de los acertijos de Berenin.\
\
Isferon espera que puedas descubrir la solución al acertijo de Berenin y recoger la primera de tres llaves en el lugar que se describe.","Lleva la segunda llave de Berenin a Isferon.","Voluntad de un Sabio","Isferon te dio el tercero de los acertijos de Berenin.\
\
Isferon espera que puedas descubrir la solución al acertijo de Berenin y recoger la última de las tres llaves en el lugar que se describe.","Lleva la tercera llave de Berenin a Isferon.","Resuelve el tercer acertijo de Berenin y recoge una llave del lugar correcto.","Resuelve el primer acertijo de Berenin y recoge una llave del lugar correcto.","Habla con Isferon y viaja con él a la cueva.","Isferon está en el refugio de Duillond, en Ered Luin.\
\
Ahora que has resuelto el segundo de los tres acertijos que le dio su amigo Berenin, deberías devolver la llave que encontraste a Isferon en Duillond.","Un Sabio busca resolver todos los misterios del mundo, pero si decide compartir las soluciones con otros, eso suele ser una característica definitoria.","Isferon está en el refugio de Duillond, en Ered Luin.\
\
Te has convertido en parte de la búsqueda de Isferon para descubrir el legado de su amigo Berenin resolviendo los acertijos que dejó, y ahora Isferon espera viajar contigo a la cueva donde guardó las cajas cerradas de Berenin.","Isferon te dio el segundo de los acertijos de Berenin.\
\
Isferon espera que puedas descubrir la solución al acertijo de Berenin y recoger la segunda de tres llaves en el lugar que se describe.","Isferon está en el refugio de Duillond, en Ered Luin.\
\
Ahora que has resuelto el último de los tres acertijos que le dio su amigo Berenin, deberías devolver la llave que encontraste a Isferon en Duillond.","Isferon está en Duillond, el refugio en Ered Luin.\
\
Descubriste el legado de Berenin: un deseo de no ser olvidado por su amigo y de participar en un último juego de acertijos. Ayudaste a Isferon a no perder de vista la memoria de su amigo. Isferon está esperando para hablar contigo nuevamente.","Resuelve el segundo acertijo de Berenin y recoge una llave del lugar correcto.","Isferon está en el refugio de Duillond, en Ered Luin.\
\
Te han dicho que Isferon tiene un enigma que no puede resolver. Como Isferon es un Sabio muy erudito, este enigma debe ser realmente difícil.","Isferon está en el refugio de Duillond, en Ered Luin.\
\
Ahora que has resuelto el primero de los tres acertijos que le dio su amigo Berenin, deberías devolver la llave que encontraste a Isferon en Duillond.","Lleva la primera llave de Berenin a Isferon."}},
[500]={nameES="A Loss Unlooked-for",objectivesES={}},
[501]={nameES="A Lost Friend",objectivesES={"Nindorn can be found in northern Balewood.\
\
You have defeated the maddened Duskleaf. You should bring these ill tidings to Nindorn.","Search for Duskleaf near the Enting Hollow","Maddened by the pain Núrzum inflicted, Duskleaf was beyond saving. You must tell Nindorn what has happened","A Lost Friend","Talk to Duskleaf","Nindorn has sent you in search of his lost friend, Duskleaf, and hopes to have him join in his journey to Stonecliff.","Duskleaf can be found at the Enting Hollow.\
\
Duskleaf has appeared from the shadows, and you should now speak with him and try to convince him to rejoin the other Ents.","Talk to Nindorn","Sharp creaking pierces the silence as an Ent lumbers forth","Duskleaf can be found somewhere near the Enting Hollow in north-eastern Balewood.\
\
Nindorn has sent you in search of his lost friend, Duskleaf, and hopes to have him join in his journey to Stonecliff."}},
[502]={nameES="A Lost Hunter",objectivesES={"Search for Dírion's dog near the Hill of Erech","You have defended Dírion's dog, who now seems anxious to return home","A Lost Hunter","Talk to Dírion","DNT -- will not be seen","You have found Dírion's dog wandering the fields of Blackroot Vale alone. The air has chilled since your arrival, and the dog looks visibly distressed, gnashing his teeth and growling.\
\
Before you can even begin to discover what has disturbed him, the Dead rush forth!","Dírion's dog can be found somewhere east of Alagrant on the fields of Blackroot Vale.\
\
Sarnir has informed you that Dírion's hunting dog has gone missing, and has asked you to aid in its safe return.","Sarnir can be found in Alagrant in western Blackroot Vale.\
\
You have delivered Dírion's dog back into his care, and should now speak to Sarnir.","Dírion's hunting dog has gone missing amidst the troubles plaguing the vale, and Dírion now fears for his beloved pet's well-being.","Dírion can be found in Alagrant in western Blackroot Vale.\
\
You have rescued Dírion's dog from the Dead near the Hill of Erech and should now deliver the good news to him.","Talk to Sarnir"}},
[503]={nameES="A Lost Necklace",objectivesES={"Talk to Farasdúr in Egladil","You have found a finely-wrought necklace under the waters of a spring in Egladil.","Maliriel is in Imlad Lalaith in Egladil.\
\
You should bring the necklace to Maliriel to see if she knows to whom it belongs.","Beneath the waters of this spring you have found a valuable-looking necklace -- perhaps someone dropped it here when they came to draw water from the spring.\
\
One of the Elves in the Vineyards of Lórien may know to whom the necklace belongs.","Talk to Hadhelen in Egladil","Talk to Maliriel at Imlad Lalaith","Talk to Aesbrennil in Egladil","Talk to Glasnír in Egladil","A Lost Necklace","There are Elves throughout Egladil.\
\
You should speak with the Elves in Egladil and learn to whom the finely-wrought necklace belongs."}},
[504]={nameES="A Lost People's History",objectivesES={}},
[505]={nameES="A Lot of Bull",objectivesES={}},
[506]={nameES="Una locura se extiende",objectivesES={"Thornegil está en el Vado de Sarn.","Las criaturas que viven en Páramo Rojizo actúan con una locura que nunca antes habían mostrado, y deben ser tratadas antes de que hagan daño a la gente que vive cerca.","Una locura se extiende","Thornegil cree que el paso de los terribles Jinetes ha llevado a las criaturas de Páramo Rojizo a la locura.","Habla con Thornegil en el Vado de Sarn"}},
[507]={nameES="A Man Adrift, Part 1: Of Fruit and Ruffians",objectivesES={"You have found Râkariz and the deck-steward arguing about the shipment of fruit. You should inspect the fruit to see its condition.","Talk to Râkariz","Talk to Belondor in Dâr Laja","Râkariz and the deck-steward are still having a heated argument","A Man Adrift, Part 1: Of Fruit and Ruffians","You have inspected the fruit and confronted Râkariz with the knowledge that provisions from Khûtra have somehow been corrupted after the fall of Mâkhda Khorbo. You should return to Belondor and tell him what you learned.","The fruit is indeed rotten and inedible. You notice a stamp indicating that the fruit originated in Khûtra.","Find Râkariz and the deck-steward","A group of ruffians is causing trouble in the Fleet-fast near the Soldiers' Mess-hall. You should go there and teach them a lesson.","You have inspected the fruit in question, and it is indeed rotten. You noticed a stamp that indicated the fruit came from Khûtra. You should confront the fruitmonger Râkariz.","Inspect the shipment of fruit","At the nearby docks in the Fleet-fast, there is a dispute going on at one of the ships. A fruitmonger and a deck-steward are arguing about fruit shipment. You should find where they are.","Belondor has asked you to go to Umbar Baharbêl's Fleet-fast ward and handle two problems for him."}},
[508]={nameES="A Man Adrift, Part 2: An Act of Charity",objectivesES={"This looks like the location Belondor described","A Man Adrift, Part 2: An Act of Charity","Belondor has asked you to enter Ilmabiri, beneath the Sail-haven of Umbar Baharbêl, and locate his secret cache of savings.","You have collected Belondor's secret cache from its hiding place in Ilmabiri. You should bring it to Belondor in Dâr Laja.","Collect Belondor's cache","Belondor would like to start a Widows-and-Orphans fund and has asked for your help in retrieving his savings.","Find the location Belondor described","You have found the location Belondor described as the location of his hidden cache. You should retrieve the treasure.","Bring the cache to Belondor in Dâr Laja"}},
[509]={nameES="A Man Adrift, Part 3: Honouring Their Sacrifice",objectivesES={"Mêshka is commissioning a memorial for the crew of the Rebuke and has asked for your assistance in choosing a location.","A decent place but perhaps too out of the way","This is not a bad place, but too close to those ruffians","This area is high traffic but perhaps too crowded","Mêshka has asked for your help with a secret project.","Mêshka has requested that you meet her at the Fleet-watch Tavern, located at the southern end of the Fleet-fast, across from the Old Bastion Inn.","Many paths meet here, but it is being used for training","Scout between the Gate of Sorrows and the Stûna","You have scouted several possible locations for Mêshka. You should return to her at the Fleet-watch Tavern at the southern end of the Fleet-fast to tell her your findings.","Scout near the Lord's Gate","This is a nice spot but is currently used for stables","Scout the gate near the Parade Ground","Scout near the Fleet-gate","A Man Adrift, Part 3: Honouring Their Sacrifice","Talk to Mêshka at the Fleet-watch Tavern","Scout near the Sailors' Mess-hall"}},
[510]={nameES="A Man Adrift, Part 4: The Offer",objectivesES={"Tabrím, a member of the Order of the Eagle has asked you to bring an offer to Belondor.","Mêshka has spotted that the two of you are being watched. She suggests you confront the man at the Fleet-watch Tavern at the south end of the Fleet-fast.","Confront the person spying on you","Talk to Belondor in Dâr Laja","While talking with Mêshka, she notices that you are being watched.","A Man Adrift, Part 4: The Offer"}},
[511]={nameES="A Man Adrift, Part 5: Paying Your Dues",objectivesES={"Collect dues from the Fleet-watch Tavern","Collect dues from the fruit peddler","You have collected the dues from the traders in the Fleet-fast. You should return to Belondor in Dâr Laja.","You have collected the fruit peddler's dues","Talk to Belondor in Dâr Laja","Belondor has asked you to go to the Fleet-fast on his behalf and collect dues from the merchants there.","Collect dues from the Old Bastion Innkeeper","Collect dues from the fishmonger","You have collected the fishmonger's dues","Talk to the traders in the Fleet-fast and collect their dues.","Collect dues from the cloth dealer","You have collected the Fleet-watch Tavern's dues","You have collected the Old Bastion Inn's dues","You have collected the cloth dealer's dues","A Man Adrift, Part 5: Paying Your Dues"}},
[512]={nameES="A Man Adrift, Part 6: In Remembrance",objectivesES={"Everything for the memorial has been prepared. You should talk to Mêshka when you are ready to attend.","Talk to Belondor in Dâr Laja","You have invited the families of the slain crew members of the Rebuke. You should return to Mêshka at the Fleet-watch Tavern.","Talk to Pârnakh, Mairan's mother","Talk to Mêshka","Talk to Imâra, Sallax's wife","The memorial is now complete. It looks like Belondor wants to talk to you.","Talk to Okhâb, Hâkraph's brother","Mêshka has requested your help again at the Fleet-watch Tavern at the south end of the Fleet-fast.","A Man Adrift, Part 6: In Remembrance","Mêshka has asked you to visit each of the surviving family members of the crew of the Rebuke and invite them to the memorial she arranged.","Talk to Mêshka at the Fleet-watch Tavern","Talk to Ansham, Talkênza's wife","Meet with Mêshka at the Fleet-watch Tavern.","Talk to Bekhír, Khalmôz's son"}},
[513]={nameES="A Man Adrift, Part 7: A Meeting in the Dark",objectivesES={"You have arrived in Umbar-môkh, where you have joined Belondor and Tabrím. You should see what Tabrím has to say.","Talk to Tabrím","Talk to Belondor in Umbar-môkh","A Man Adrift, Part 7: A Meeting in the Dark","You have arrived in Umbar-môkh, where you are to join Belondor in meeting with Tabrím. You should talk to Belondor.","Belondor has already arrived","Find the meeting place in Tâkhdar; the Cellars","Travelling separately, Belondor has asked you to meet Tabrím and himself in Umbar-môkh at a place in Tâkhdar; the Cellars, east of Tilmakhím.","Belondor has agreed to a clandestine meeting with the Order of the Eagle and has asked you to accompany him.","Talk to Belondor","Tabrím has revealed that the Order of the Eagle knows that Azagath and Nakási were preparing to travel by land, not by sea. He put forth the Order's theory that the two went to Mâkhda Khorbo to retrieve something. Identifying what that was should help reveal their destination. You should talk to Belondor."}},
[514]={nameES="A Man Adrift, Part 8: Searching the Depths",objectivesES={"After returning to Mâkhda Khorbo with Belondor, you discovered that Azagath and Nakási took from the temple a map of inland areas east of Umbar. You should talk to Belondor in Dâr Laja, the Meeting-hall.","A Man Adrift, Part 8: Searching the Depths","Talk to Belondor in Dâr Laja","Belondor is ready to face his fears and return to Mâkhda Khorbo. He has asked you to accompany him.  You should talk to him when you are ready.","Talk to Belondor in Umbar-môkh; the Neaths","Belondor has asked you to accompany him as he returns to Mâkhda Khorbo in search of clues leading to Azagath and Nakási."}},
[515]={nameES="Un hombre llamado Estel",objectivesES={"Elrond está en la bilioteca de la planta alta de la Última Morada.\
\
Aragorn te ha pedido que lleves un mensaje al Maestro Elrond, seguro de que el señor de los elfos entenderá sus palabras. El mensaje que Aragorn te dijo que le transmitieras esto: 'Ahora sé lo que Gwindeth buscaba de mí en la oscuridad de las aguas, y estoy preparado para dárselo. Elendil era más sabio que yo.'","Un hombre llamado Estel","Habla con Elrond","Aragorn te ha dicho que conoce dónde se encuentra un Silithar con el que Hemeldir puede reforjar Narsil. Te ha dado un misterioso mensaje para que lo lleves a Elrond y te ha segurado que el señor Elfo lo entenderá."}},
[516]={nameES="A Man Called Sharkey",objectivesES={"A mud-caked helmet of the White Hand has seemingly been used as a crude shovel","Investigate Sharkey's Slough","Countless half-orcs and brigands have made camp at the old dredging site","As Sharkey's lieutenant falls defeated, you notice a stained missive protruding from his pocket","A tattered banner of the White Hand sways in the wind","After Saruman's search for the Ring ended in failure, the Gladden Fields laid undisturbed for many years. However, if rumours are to be believed, the remnants of the White Hand have been usurped by an upstart ruffian-lord called Sharkey who now seeks to claim the treasure of the Gladden Fields for his own.","A Shakh-hai of the White Hand has been viciously slain and left in the dredging pit","It seems that Sharkey has plans for a place called Tûn Melen","Find the leader of the forces at Sharkey's Slough","Signs of the White Hand can be found at Sharkey's Slough in the Gladden Fields.\
\
Fearing that Sharkey has driven out the remnants of the White Hand, Radagast has asked you to search for signs of Saruman's forces at Sharkey's Slough.","The slain Shakh-hai can be found in the dredging pit at the centre of Sharkey's Slough.\
\
You have found what appears to be the one-time leader of the White Hand forces in the Gladden Fields. You should examine the Shakh-hai's remains.","Examine the slain Shakh-hai in Sharkey's Slough","Sharkey's Slough can be found in the centre of the Gladden Fields.\
\
Through the help of his friend, Radagast has asked you to investigate Sharkey's Slough in the Gladden Fields and learn what became of the remnants of Saruman's forces in his absence.","As it dawns on you that this thrush must be the friend of which Radagast spoke, it lowers its beak to point at a small scroll bound to its leg. You take the scroll and begin to read it.\
\
The scroll contains hasty writing which you swiftly identify as the writing of Radagast the Brown. As you read on, Radagast writes of his growing concern about the sudden arrival of a ruffian-lord named Sharkey in the Gladden Fields. It seems Sharkey's Men have taken over an old dredging site once held by Saruman's forces, but it remains uncertain how a band of ruffians could overcome the warriors of the White Hand. Regardless, Radagast is of the mind that Sharkey intends to use Saruman's old dredging machines to ruin the Gladden Fields in a search for its lost treasures, and he fears that some of the Woodmen who left Hultvís might now be in service to Sharkey.\
\
You decide to investigate Sharkey's Slough.","A Man Called Sharkey","The leader of Sharkey's Men at Sharkey's Slough might be found in the dredging pit.\
\
It seems Sharkey's Men have driven out or slain many of the White Hand forces that remained in the Vales of Anduin. You should search for their leader and attempt to disrupt whatever plans Sharkey has for the Gladden Fields.","Sharkey's lieutenant was in possession of a missive containing Sharkey's orders.\
\
You should examine Sharkey's orders and see if they reveal more of Sharkey's plans for the Gladden Fields.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: 'Sharkey's Orders' must be used in your inventory and you must accept the quest 'Dredging up the Past' to complete this quest.</rgb>","Examine 'Sharkey's Orders'","As you examine the Shakh-hai, a harsh voice barks in anger!","Slain Orcs of the White Hand have been left to rot in the shallows"}},
[517]={nameES="A Many-coloured Cloak",objectivesES={"Bring the many-coloured cloak you crafted to Rook","A Many-coloured Cloak","A weaver's loom can be found near Rook's Hut.\
\
You should use the weaver's loom to weave the feathers into an iridescent cloak.","Rook is at his hut in Pren Gwydh.\
\
You should bring the iridescent, many-hued cloak you crafted to Rook, who wishes to be as great a Wizard as Saruman.","Crafted an iridescent cloak","Craft an iridescent cloak","Rook, an aspiring wizard, wishes to mimic the robes of Saruman by doing away with his drear colours and acquiring a many-coloured cloak.","Iridescent crow-feathers can be found in plenty on Rook's trained crebain.\
\
You should collect iridescent feathers from Rook's craban-flock."}},
[518]={nameES="A Map of the Past",objectivesES={"The south-east corner of the Doorward's map is missing","As you compare the maps, you see a distinct difference in the south-eastern corner of Adagím's border. On the map provided by Bêtam, there is an annotation citing the location where they would not go. When compared to the map of Mûr Ghala drafted by the scholars of Zajâna, the section of the mountain range is missing.","Valukhâri reviews your map and sends you to the library of Zajâna to look at the Doorward's map for comparison.","Return to Valukhâri at her post in Zajâna","Valukhâri sent you to the library to find the Doorward's map of Mûr Ghala. You should go there and compare the map provided by Bêtam.","Compare the maps of Mûr Ghala in Zajâna's library","After comparing the maps, it is clear the map the Doorwards crafted is missing a section to the far south-east of Adagím. You should return to Valukhâri and ask her about this.","You show Bêtam's map to Valukhâri.\
\
'This is a map of all Mûr Ghala. You will find a matching map within the library, here in Zajâna. Feel free to study any other maps you wish to while you are here.'","A Map of the Past"}},
[519]={nameES="La lista del mercado",objectivesES={"Reúne los productos de la lista del mercado","El mercado está muy concurrido, y muchos clientes en los puestos de venta tienen listas del mercado que deben completarse.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando finalice el evento con el que está asociada.</rgb>","Lleva los productos a Daisy Arenas","Eso no está en la lista...","Daisy Arenas está en su puesto en la Feria de los Granjeros de Delagua.\
\
Llévale a Daisy Arenas los productos que conseguiste.","Los productos de la lista del mercado se pueden encontrar por toda Delagua durante la Feria de los Granjeros. La lista está en tu inventario.\
\
Recoge los productos de la lista del mercado... ¡pero evita los que no estén en ella!","La lista del mercado"}},
[520]={nameES="Un Maestro del roble, No de los orcos",objectivesES={"El leñador Huel huye de los orcos que ahora habitan en Tharbad, y en su terror dejó atrás su hacha.","Encuentra el hacha perdida de Huel en algún lugar de Tharbad","Esta debe ser el hacha perdida de Huel","Huel te pidió que derrotaras a algunos de los orcos que ahora merodean por Tharbad, y que recuperaras el hacha que dejó atrás si puedes encontrarla.","Lleva el hacha que recuperaste al leñador Huel justo dentro de la entrada sur de Tharbad","El leñador Huel está justo dentro de la entrada sur de Tharbad.","Un Maestro del roble, No de los orcos"}},
[521]={nameES="A Master of Two Minds",objectivesES={"Náin the Slakeless can be found at Drenghól in the War of Three Peaks.\
\
You have defeated Narg-and-Mauz. You should report to Náin with news of this victory.","Defeat Narg-and-Mauz","After brokering an uneasy alliance between the forces of Gorgar the Ruthless and Hrímil Frost-heart, a powerful two-headed troll, Narg-and-Mauz, has taken command of the forces at Bagûd-mekhem.","A Master of Two Minds","Narg-and-Mauz can be found deep within Bagûd-mekhem.\
\
Náin has commanded you to defeat Narg-and-Mauz, the powerful two-headed troll that leads the forces at Bagûd-mekhem.","With a thunderous crash, Narg-and-Mauz falls defeated!","Talk to Náin at Drenghól"}},
[522]={nameES="Una Matriarca en el Hueco",objectivesES={"Derrota a Lebrennil","Gillemin Brandigamo cree que el gran nido de arañas también podría estar contribuyendo a la agitación del Bosque Viejo.","El nido de arañas se encuentra cerca del Claro del Sauce, al sur del antiguo campamento de Gillemin.\
\
Gillemin advirtió que debías tener cuidado con una matriarca dentro del nido de arañas.","Habla con Gillemin Brandigamo en el Bosque Viejo","Gillemin Brandigamo te espera en su nuevo campamento, al sudeste de la Colina del Viejo Muddyfoot.\
\
Debes regresar con Gillemin Brandigamo con noticias de tu éxito.","Una Matriarca en el Hueco","Lebrennil ha sido derrotada"}},
[523]={nameES="A Matter Of Honour",objectivesES={"As the jaw of the skull crumbles, a ghostly figure appears nearby","A peculiar skull is impaled on a nearby tree...perhaps this is the key to drawing the Oathbreaker captain forth.","The Oathbreaker captain is atop the hill to the west of Idmar's camp. You should attempt to speak to him now that he has revealed himself.","A Matter Of Honour","The Oathbreaker captain's men have sprung forth to guard him. They must be defeated if you are to continue your charge.","Talk to the shade-captain","Idmar wants you to track down and confront the leader of the shades. He has given you a token of his people, the descendants of Eorl, in hopes that the shade will recognize it. He has surmised that the leader must be stationed among the vast number of spirits at the camp to the west.","Examine the skull","The Oathbreaker captain lurks among his men atop the hill to the west.\
\
Idmar has asked you to find the captain of the shades.","Find a clue to the shade-captain's whereabouts","You notice a skull impaled and pinned to a nearby tree as a wave of dread passes over you"}},
[524]={nameES="A Matter of Doubt",objectivesES={"A Matter of Doubt","Andreg regrets his decision to have you hunt the dun oxen of the Windfells from which the Uch-lûth draw their herds.","The oxherds of the Uch-lûth are encamped at Uch Cadlus, south-east of Echad Saeradan.\
\
Andreg has asked you to deliver the ox-meat you collected to the oxherds of the Uch-lûth.","Bring ox-meat to the Uch-lûth oxherds at Uch Cadlus"}},
[525]={nameES="Una cuestión de comida",objectivesES={"Entrega las cabezas de jabalí a Roger Hawkling","Roger Hawkling es un cazador completo que aprovecha cada parte de los animales que caza. Te ha pedido que recolectes cabezas de jabalí para ayudarlo con la cocina que hace en el campamento de Adso.","Los jabalíes recorren los páramos alrededor del campamento de Adso y están esparcidos por los Campos de Bree del sur.\
\
Roger quiere que reduzcas la creciente cantidad de jabalíes salvajes y le traigas sus cabezas. Él cocina una delicadeza increíble con ellas.","Una cuestión de comida"}},
[526]={nameES="A Matter of Honour",objectivesES={"A Matter of Honour","Pleased with your assistance protecting their herds, the oxherds of the Uch-lûth have agreed to trade provisions to the Grey Company.","Bring the ox-meat to Andreg at Echad Saeradan","Wunne is at Uch Cadlus in the Windfells, south-east of Echad Saeradan.\
\
Andreg instructed you to return to Wunne and offer her your services should she need them again.","Andreg is at Echad Saeradan in the Windfells of Enedwaith, north-west of Uch Cadlus.\
\
Wunne has asked you to deliver a package of meat to the Grey Company.","Talk to Wunne at Uch Cadlus"}},
[527]={nameES="Un asunto de conocimiento",objectivesES={"La Biblioteca de Tham Mírdain se encuentra al sur y ligeramente al oeste de Echad Mirobel.\
\
Mientras te dedicas a purgar la Biblioteca de Tham Mírdain, debes prestar atención a cualquier tomo que pueda haber quedado intacto.","Un asunto de conocimiento"}},
[528]={nameES="A Matter of Lineage",objectivesES={"Talk to Mithrandir in the Citadel atop the city","Mithrandir expressed an interest in learning about your encounter with the creature Gothmog, in Osgiliath.","A Matter of Lineage","Mithrandir is in the Court of the Fountain, in the Citadel atop the city.\
\
Mithrandir is waiting to walk with you to the Old Archives, where he wants to learn what befell you in Osgiliath.","Talk to Mithrandir in the Citadel and travel with him to the Old Archives","Mithrandir is in the Citadel atop the city.\
\
You have returned from the Old Archives with Mithrandir, and he has obtained your vow of silence concerning Gothmog's lineage."}},
[529]={nameES="A Matter of Urgency",objectivesES={"A Matter of Urgency","Talk to Anborn at Haerondir","After learning of the intentions of the Black Númenórean, Burudagath the Bloodletter, you and Artamir have decided to return to Haerondir and warn the Host of the West of their new danger at Ondoher's Folly.","Anborn can be found at Haerondir.\
\
You have returned to Haerondir too late, and now Laeglaw fears Anborn has sent his men on a foolish errand. You should speak to Anborn and ask what you can do to aid him.","Haerondir can be found to the south of Ondoher's Folly in Dagorlad.\
\
You have learned much from the spirit of Faramir and should now deliver a warning to the Host of the West at Haerondir.","Laeglaw can be found in Haerondir.\
\
You have returned to Haerondir and have been spotted by Laeglaw and Mincham. You should speak to Laeglaw.","Mincham and Laeglaw look at once relieved and troubled by your return...","Talk to Laeglaw at Haerondir","Return to Haerondir with Artamir's warning"}},
[530]={nameES="Una cuestión de abrigo",objectivesES={"Una cuestión de abrigo","Roger Hawkling aceptó ayudar a Adso Henoloma ofreciendo su experiencia en la caza de osos en toda las Tierras de Bree. Desde su llegada, Hawkling ha observado una mayor necesidad de caza, desuello y tratamiento de pieles de oso para mantas, un producto que a menudo roban los bandidos.","Lleva los pelajes de oso a Roger Hawkling","Se pueden encontrar osos por los campos del sur de Bree, pero una gran manada de osos se halla al norte de la Guarida de los Forajidos, al noroeste del campamento de Adso.\
\
Roger Hawkling te ha pedido que vayas a cazar algunos osos y le traigas sus pelajes."}},
[531]={nameES="Un asunto en el Lago Espejo",objectivesES={"Has recibido una carta de Byrski Proadura, un enano de la Guarnición de Hierro apostado en el Valle del Arroyo Sombrío.","Byrski Proadura te ha enviado una carta pidiéndote que lo visites en el Valle del Arroyo Sombrío.\
\
Entrégale la carta a Byrski Proadura. Se encuentra en Mekhem-bizru, en el Valle del Arroyo Sombrío.","Lleva la carta a Byrski Proadura en Mekhem-bizru, en el Valle del Arroyo Sombrío","Un asunto en el Lago Espejo"}},
[532]={nameES="A Meal Unfit for an Orc",objectivesES={}},
[533]={nameES="Una comida para Hombres",objectivesES={"Los jabalíes y osos adecuados se encuentran al norte de Los Gamos, entre las Colinas de Brandi y la linde del Bosque Viejo. Ella Liriondo espera en Nuevoburgo, justo más allá de las puertas de Los Gamos.\
\
Ella Liriondo está recogiendo carne para abastecer la posada de Adso. La carne servirá para preparar comida que haga sentir más bienvenidos y como en casa a los Hombres que viajan por el Gran Camino del Este.","Una comida para Hombres","Ella Liriondo está trabajando para crear un menú digno de los Hombres en la posada de Adso. Está enviando aventureros a recoger carne de jabalí para abastecer las reservas de comida de la posada de Adso.","Lleva la carne de oso y jabalí a Ella Liriondo en Nuevoburgo"}},
[534]={nameES="A Measure of Morgul Steel",objectivesES={}},
[535]={nameES="A Meeting Missed",objectivesES={"In a newly dug cave north of Iáphel, you found a shredded pack. Does it belong to Igerna?\
\
You should bring it to Lúmar in Ost Arndir to find out.","Across the green hills of Pinnath Gelin, scouts work alongside, and many times ahead of, the local knights. Theirs is a small, but tightly organized group. Thus, when one of their number misses an appointed time to report in, tensions rise.","A freshly made cave has been blasted into the mountainside by goblins. You should search the cave.\
\
The cave is in north-western Pinnath Gelin.","Goblins are burrowing into the mountainside","Talk to Húrwen","Search the cave for Igerna","Húrwen spoke with Igerna, who continued on towards the mountains in search of more goblins.\
\
You should look for signs of Igerna in northern Pinnath Gelin.","Lúmar is concerned that his fellow scout hasn't reported back after making a trip north of Iáphel. Igerna was last seen heading to Elbery Farm in Pinnath Gelin, to speak with Húrwen.\
\
You should speak with Húrwen.","A Meeting Missed","Talk to Lúmar in Ost Arndír","A shredded pack lies here","You found a goblin camp!","Search the camp for Igerna","While searching for Igerna, you discovered that goblins have made a camp at the foot of the mountains.\
\
You should continue looking for Igerna in the goblin camp in north-western Pinnath Gelin.","Search for Igerna"}},
[536]={nameES="Una reunión con la Dama Azul",objectivesES={"Calenglad ha hablado con Gwindeth sobre la posibilidad de adquirir el Silithar para Aragorn, pero ha rechazado otorgarlo sin conocerte antes.","Una reunión con la Dama Azul","La Dama Azul vive en Gwindethrond, una cueva tras una cascada en Valcorriente, en colinas del oeste de Emyn Uial al otro lado del lago, al suroeste de Tinnudir y Tyl Ruinen.\
\
Calenglad ha concertado una reunción con Gwindeth y te ha advertido que le hables con respeto y honestidad. Solo Gwindeth puede granjearte acceso al Silithar que Aragorn necesita."}},
[537]={nameES="Un miembro necesitado",objectivesES={"Recoge una jarra de Cerveza Barbuda de Bombur","Te has encontrado con otro miembro de la Liga de las  Posadas llamado Múli. Te contó sobre el impactante descubrimiento que hizo al llegar a Othrikar: que había olvidado traer su cerveza favorita.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando termine el festival actual. </rgb>","Un miembro necesitado","Cerveza Barbuda de Bombur recogida","Jarra de Cerveza Barbuda de Bombur recogida","Lleva la Cerveza Barbuda de Bombur a Múli","La Mansión de Thorin se encuentra en Ered Luin, lejos al oeste de las Quebradas del Norte.\
\
Deberías comprar un poco de Cerveza Barbuda de Bombur al tabernero en el sótano de la Mansión de Thorin.","Recoge la Cerveza Barbuda de Bombur en la Mansión de Thorin","Múli se encuentra en Othrikar, en las Quebradas del Norte, lejos al este de Ered Luin.\
\
Múli te ha pedido que le traigas un poco de \\qCerveza Barbuda de Bombur\\q de la Mansión de Thorin. Una vez que tengas la cerveza, deberías llevársela a Múli en Othrikar."}},
[538]={nameES="La Presa de un Mercader",objectivesES={"La Presa de un Mercader","Radlaw se encuentra al norte de Clegur. El humilde mercader te ha pedido que liberes a sus amigos.","Los hobbits han sido liberados. El humilde mercader debería enterarse de esto.","Habla con el humilde mercader en Clegur","Un humilde mercader necesita ayuda para rescatar a sus amigos de Radlaw."}},
[539]={nameES="A Message From Stangard",objectivesES={"Landroval has bid you farewell","Talk to Landroval","An important message has been left for you near Landroval at the hidden clearing.","The message has been left for you near Landroval at his clearing in the north.\
\
Someone has left you a letter, which you may open and read.","Read the message that was left for you","A Message From Stangard","Sabert guards the north-eastern entrance to Stangard, in Eorlsmead.\
\
Sabert wishes to speak with you about the events that have transpired in Stangard during your absence.","Meneldor has bid you farewell","The Great Eagles wish to speak with you before you depart","Talk to Sabert at the north-eastern gate of Stangard","Talk to Meneldor","Landroval and Meneldor can be found at the clearing of trees in the north-east section of Wailing Hills.\
\
Landroval and Meneldor wish to speak with you once more, before you depart for Stangard."}},
[540]={nameES="Un mensaje del Capitán",objectivesES={"Encuentra al Montaraz que hace guardia a las afueras de Tornhad","Un mensaje del Capitán","Ves a un Montaraz vigilando hacia el noroeste","Has encontrado al Montaraz Calithil, que hace guardia a las afueras de Tornhad. Deberías hablar con él y entregarle la carta.","Habla con el Montaraz que hace guardia","Glorfindel te ha pedido que entregues una carta de Aragorn a los Montaraces de Tornhad.","Deberías buscar a un Montaraz a las afueras de Tornhad que esté vigilando, a quien debes entregar la carta. Tornhad se encuentra en la región sur del Ángulo del Mitheithel."}},
[541]={nameES="A Message Sent",objectivesES={}},
[542]={nameES="A Message Unsent",objectivesES={"A Message Unsent","Doron has relayed the tale of how he and his men came to be cursed. He now wishes for you to meet with one of his men, who has become aware of more sinister dealings in Parth Celebrant.","Cabed is near Ost Celebrant, on a small hill off the side of the road south.\
\
Doron has sent you to find the lost messenger, Cabed.","Talk to Cabed"}},
[543]={nameES="A Message for Fastred",objectivesES={"Find and talk to Fastred","Fastred's seat is vacant, but it appears one of his men has remained in the hall","Fastred can be found inside the Mead Hall of Snowbourn.\
\
After arriving in Snowbourn, Gísling wants you to speak with Fastred, Reeve of the Sutcrofts, about the perils facing his people.","Léofhelm is inside the Mead Hall of Snowbourn.\
\
Fastred is nowhere to be found. Perhaps one of his men will know of his whereabouts.","A Message for Fastred","Snowbourn is ruled by Fastred, a young and somewhat brutal Reeve.","Talk to Léofhelm"}},
[544]={nameES="A Message for the Pale Herald",objectivesES={"You warn Belzagar that unless the Tower of Cirith Ungol is held by an even larger garrison, it will fall to Shelob's brood and she will begin to consume the lands of Mordor in her wrath. You tell him to send word to Ugrukhôr in Udûn as well as Rûkhor the Pale Herald begging for aid in containing Shelob to the Ephel Dúath.\
\
Belzagar glares at you in silence.","Belzagar can be found in the turret of the Tower of Cirith Ungol.\
\
Legolas has asked you to attempt to convey his message of warning to Belzagar to again reinforce the Tower of Cirith Ungol.","Belzagar's book can be found near him in the turret of the Tower of Cirith Ungol.\
\
Since Belzagar did not seem to understand your message of warning, Legolas has advised you to write the warning yourself in Belzagar's book.","Legolas fears that the tide of battle will soon turn in Shelob's favour, and only by drawing the attention of Ugrukhôr and Rûkhor to Cirith Ungol will the Tower survive her wrath and keep her confined to the Ephel Dúath.","Talk to Legolas in the Tower of Cirith Ungol","Talk to Belzagar in the Tower of Cirith Ungol","Legolas can be found in the turret of the Tower of Cirith Ungol.\
\
You have delivered the message of warning to Belzagar and written it as such in his book. You should now speak to Legolas.","A Message for the Pale Herald","You hastily scrawl a message warning that Cirith Ungol shall soon fall to Shelob and her brood!","Scrawl a message of warning to the Gúrzyul in Belzagar's book"}},
[545]={nameES="A Message from Mizâdi",objectivesES={"Speak with Mizâdi in Urmâkh. Urmâkh can be found in Imhûlar, which is within the Ikorbân Valley.","Mizâdi, Shâra of Renewed Hamât, requests your presence in Urmâkh. She calls for your aid in investigating a disturbing report she has received from her scouts to the south.","A Message from Mizâdi","Speak with Mizâdi in Urmâkh","Mizâdi requests your presence in investigating a strange report she has received from her scouts."}},
[546]={nameES="A Message from Rhosgobel",objectivesES={"Habla con Radagast","Travel to Rhosgobel","Hopefully Radagast is home","A Message from Rhosgobel","Radagast has summoned you to his home of Rhosgobel for matters of importance.","Radagast can be found in Rhosgobel.\
\
You should talk to Radagast.","Rhosgobel can be found in Laerlad, in the Vales of Anduin.\
\
You should travel to Rhosgobel.","Radagast has called upon you to visit his home of Rhosgobel. While it is not certain what matters currently trouble Radagast, it is not often that he directly seeks you out for assistance. What ever the matter may be, it is surely to be important! You should seek travel to Rhosgobel as soon as you are able."}},
[547]={nameES="A Message from the Prince",objectivesES={"You have received an urgent summons from Dolenthal to aid Prince Faramir in the heights of the Dead City.","Find Dolenthol in the Circle of Death","Dolenthol and a number of Rangers stand amid a swath of slain Orcs","A Message from the Prince","Dolenthol can be found in the Circle of Death.\
\
You should talk to Dolenthol.","Talk to Dolenthol in the Circle of Death","Dolenthol can be found somewhere in the Circle of Death.\
\
Candúr has directed you to find Dolenthol in the Circle of Death and join Prince Faramir's company."}},
[548]={nameES="Un Mensaje de Agradecimiento",objectivesES={"Entrega la carta a Laenin en Celondim o a Bogi Excavadorprofundo afuera de la Mansión de Thorin","Un Mensaje de Agradecimiento","Never should be seen","Entrega la carta de agradecimiento a Laenin, el Guardián del Claro, en Celondim.\
\
Dwalin, el Señor de los barbiluengos, te envió una carta de agradecimiento por tus esfuerzos contra Ivar Manosangrienta. Su esperanza es que esta carta te gane alguna recompensa de parte de los Elfos o los Enanos.","Ayudaste a Dwalin y a los hijos de Elrond contra las fuerzas malignas que se agitaban en la Puerta de Thorin, y estos esfuerzos no han pasado desapercibidos. El Señor de los barbiluengos te envió un mensaje con la esperanza de que te traiga favor."}},
[549]={nameES="Un mensaje de agradecimiento",objectivesES={"Entrega la carta de agradecimiento al Alguacil Cardoso en Archet o al Cartero Gamonuevo en Cavada Chica.\
\
Jon Helecharroyo ha escrito una carta en tu nombre agradeciéndote tu ayuda contra los bandidos Montebruno que asaltaron y destruyeron gran parte de Archet recientemente. Espera que recibas alguna muestra de agradecimiento por parte de otros.","Un mensaje de agradecimiento","Entrega la carta al Alguacil Cardoso o al Cartero Gamonuevo.","Tu ayuda contra los bandidos que incendiaron y saquearon Archet es digna de gran reconocimiento por parte de la gente de la Comarca y de las Tierras de Bree. Jon Helecharroyo se ha asegurado de que recibas cierta muestra de favor."}},
[550]={nameES="A Message to the White Hand",objectivesES={}},
[551]={nameES="A Messenger from the South",objectivesES={"Speak with Nimasi in Kûr Anzar","Speak with Mizâdi in Kûr Anzar.","Let Nimasi know Mizâdi's decision.","Speak with the scout Nimasi in Kûr Anzar.","Another messenger from southern Imhûlar has come to call on Mizâdi with dire news.","Give the strange banner to Mizâdi in Kûr Anzar","Get Numûru's opinion on the situation","Relay Nimasi's gratitude to Mizâdi.","Take the banner Nimasi has brought from the south","Give the strange banner to Mizâdi in Kûr Anzar.","Relay Nimasi's gratitude to Mizâdi","Get Numûru's opinion on the situation.","A Messenger from the South","Take the banner Nimasi has brought from the south.","This is the same banner you saw before: a silver lion's head similar to Mizâdi's standard","Let Nimasi know Mizâdi's decision","Speak with Mizâdi in Kûr Anzar"}},
[552]={nameES="A Midsummer Getaway",objectivesES={"A visitor from the Shield Isles in The Bay of Belfalas invited you to visit the tropical island of Furtherholm during the Midsummer Festival.","Talk to Khâtaphos inside The Cracked Flagon","Ikhajât has offered to whisk you away to the island of Furtherholm, where you should introduce yourself to Khâtaphos.","Habla con Ikhajât","Welcome to Furtherholm!","Ikhajât has whisked you away to the island of Furtherholm, where you should introduce yourself to Khâtaphos.","A Midsummer Getaway"}},
[553]={nameES="A Midsummer Shine",objectivesES={"Talk to Skóri","Skóri can be found in Thorin's Hall.\
\
You have done your best to shine the beards of unkempt dwarves in Thorin's Hall. You should return to Skóri.","A Midsummer Shine","Many of the dwarves who dwell in Thorin's Hall wish to look their very best for the celebration of Midsummer.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This quest will be removed from your quest log when the current festival ends.</rgb>","Unkempt dwarves can be found throughout Thorin's Hall.\
\
Skóri has asked you to aid him in shining the beards of his kinfolk so that they might look their best for the celebration of Midsummer."}},
[554]={nameES="A Midsummer's Welcome",objectivesES={"Merilien can be found outside the Tower of Ecthelion in the Court of the Fountain in Minas Tirith (Midsummer).\
\
King Aragorn II Elessar has asked you to speak to Merilien, a Midsummer wedding-planner overseeing many of the season's festivities.","Talk to Merilien in the Court of the Fountain","Talk to King Aragorn II Elessar","King Aragorn II Elessar can be found in the Tower of Ecthelion in Minas Tirith (Midsummer).\
\
A Midsummer reveller has suggested that you present yourself to King Aragorn II Elessar before joining in the festivites in Minas Tirith.","A Midsummer's Welcome","Midsummer has come to Minas Tirith at last, and the people of Gondor and the lands beyond have gathered to celebrate together.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This quest will be removed from your quest log when the current festival ends.</rgb>"}},
[555]={nameES="Un deshielo invernal",objectivesES={"Pinja se encuentra en su casa, al suroeste de Pynti-peldot.\
\
Deberías regresar con Pinja con las Campanillas de invierno y las pieles.","Invitación de boda entregada","Entrega la invitación a Ella en Pynti-peldot","Regresa con Pinja con las pieles y las flores","Las Campanillas de invierno y las pieles blancas pueden obtenerse en Leijona-kotin, al sur de la casa de Pinja, situada al suroeste de Pynti-peldot en Itä-ma. Ella se encuentra en Pynti-peldot.\
\
Pinja te ha pedido que recojas campanillas de invierno y pieles blancas para su vestido de boda, y que entregues en mano una importante invitación a Ella en Pynti-peldot.","Has desempeñado un papel importante en el cortejo de Kaj y Pinja.","Un deshielo invernal"}},
[556]={nameES="A Minor Squabble",objectivesES={}},
[557]={nameES="La Esperanza del Juglar",objectivesES={"Leigh Putnam se encuentra en Puente del Caballete.\
\
Leigh Putnam espera hablar contigo sobre tu reciente aventura en la cueva de los refugiados de las Quebradas del Norte.","La Esperanza del Juglar","Aun cuando toda esperanza parece extinguida, un juglar digno mantiene a sus amigos en pie a pesar del peligro.","Habla con Leigh Putnam y viaja con ella a una cueva cercana","Leigh Putnam se encuentra en Puente del Caballete, en las Quebradas del Norte.\
\
Leigh Putnam ha enviado un llamado a los juglares para que ayuden a levantar el ánimo de la atribulada población de Puente del Caballete.","Leigh Putnam está en Puente del Caballete, en las Quebradas del Norte.\
\
Leigh Putnam espera hablar contigo sobre viajar a una cueva cercana para llevar esperanza a los refugiados que allí se esconden y, quizás, convencerlos de venir a la seguridad relativa de Puente del Caballete."}},
[558]={nameES="Una amenaza diminuta",objectivesES={"Derrota al glotón gruñidor","Una amenaza diminuta","Un glotón saltó sobre Mainio mientras se encontraba junto al lago.","Habla con Mainio","Has derrotado al glotón gruñidor","Mainio se encuentra en Kauppa-kohta, al sur de la carretera.\
\
Deberías regresar con Mainio para informarle de tu éxito contra el glotón gruñidor.","El glotón gruñidor se encuentra en un saliente junto al lago, cerca de la carretera que sale de Kauppa-kohta hacia el noroeste.\
\
Un glotón gruñidor saltó sobre Mainio y le dio un buen susto. Te ha pedido que investigues y te asegures de que los glotones no suponen una amenaza."}},
[559]={nameES="A Mirthless End",objectivesES={"Aid Dornach and complete 'The Will of Ugrukhôr'","Meet Dornach in Barad Arthir","Dornach rushes to your side","Deep in conversation, Dornach stands beside Candúr","Dornach can be found in the Circle of Despair.\
\
You are aiding Dornach in securing the Circle of Despair.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: If you lose sight of Dornach, you can summon him to your side with his horn.</rgb>","Dornach has returned to Barad Arthir.\
\
After securing the Circle of Despair, Dornach asked you to meet him and Candúr in Barad Arthir. You should return to them.","Dornach leads the effort to reclaim the Circle of Despair, once known as the Circle of Mirth, from the forces of Gothmog in Minas Morgul.","Aid Dornach and complete 'Tears of Minas Ithil'","A Mirthless End","Aid Dornach and complete 'Unstilled Waters'"}},
[560]={nameES="Una Brisa Traviesa",objectivesES={"Las cinco páginas de la carta de Istarien para Rilhathel se encuentran en los flets cercanos y en el área alrededor de Istarien.\
\
Las páginas de una carta muy privada que Istarien estaba escribiendo han sido esparcidas por los flets cercanos por una brisa traviesa, y ella quiere que las recuperes.","Istarien está en uno de los flets superiores de Telain Galadhrim.\
\
Has recuperado las páginas de la carta de Istarien y ahora deberías devolvérselas.","Lleva las páginas de la carta a Istarien","Una Brisa Traviesa","Istarien ha perdido, debido a una brisa traviesa, las páginas de una carta que estaba escribiendo."}},
[561]={nameES="A Missing Intruder",objectivesES={"Noriel wants to help you search for the missing Rohirrim hunter to speed along the intruding party's departure from Thinglad.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Use the whistle to summon Noriel to your side if you become separated.</rgb>","Busca al cazador desaparecido","Blood and arrows mark the earth here...","The missing hunter is surely nearby, south and east of the hunter's camp in Thinglad.\
\
You should search for the missing hunter.","A Missing Intruder","Noriel is nearby and can be summoned by whistle if you have become separated.\
\
You should speak with Noriel, your companion on this mission.","This brave hunter has been pierced by many unfriendly arrows and perished upon this hilltop in pursuit of his attackers.","Search the forest floor for signs of the missing hunter","Signs of the missing hunter can be found near the hunters' camp in Thinglad.\
\
You should search the woods around the camp for signs of the missing hunter's passage, or indications of where he might have gone.","Signs of the missing hunter can likely be found north-east of the hunters' camp in Thinglad.\
\
You should search the woods around the camp for signs of the missing hunter's passage or indications of where he might have gone.","Search for another sign of the missing hunter","More arrows and blood spatter, and the hunter's own bow","Talk to Noriel","Search for signs of the missing hunter","Strange arrows litter the earth here","The hunter has been slain by Orc-arrows","Another sign of the missing hunter looks to be not far from the first in Thinglad, just south of that spot.\
\
You should search the woods around the camp for signs of the missing hunter's passage or indications of where he might have gone.","Noriel can be summoned by using the Elf-whistle you were given.\
\
You should speak with Noriel."}},
[562]={nameES="Un Explorador Desaparecido",objectivesES={"Encuentra a Aeglas dentro de la Ciudad de los Trasgos","Busca a Aeglas en la Ciudad de los Trasgos, al norte de Rivendel, en las Montañas Nubladas.\
\
Glóin explicó que Elrond había enviado a un Elfo a investigar los movimientos de los trasgos en su fortaleza bajo la montaña. Temiendo que Aeglas haya sido capturado, confía en que aún puedas encontrarlo con vida en las profundidades de la ciudad trasga.","Glóin cree que un explorador enviado hacia el norte ha sido hecho prisionero por los trasgos de la Ciudad de los Trasgos.","Un Explorador Desaparecido"}},
[563]={nameES="A Mission to Bring Good Cheer",objectivesES={"Missions can be completed across Middle-earth.\
\
You should complete any mission.","Habla con Mara Arenales","Despite the Yule season, brave adventurers are still needed to complete missions across Middle-earth.","A Mission to Bring Good Cheer","Mara Sandydowns can be found near the entrance to Winter-home.\
\
You have completed a mission during the Yule Festival. You should talk to Mara Sandydowns."}},
[564]={nameES="A Missive to Adambel",objectivesES={}},
[565]={nameES="A Missive to Barthost",objectivesES={"A Missive to Barthost","Bring the missive to Nithi at Barthost","Collect the missive","Nithi can be found at Barthost.\
\
You should bring the missive to Nithi.","The missive can be found near Amroth in Echad-in-Edhil.\
\
You should collect the missive.","This missive should be delivered to Barthost at once!","King Amroth wishes to deliver a missive of tactical importance to Nithi at the small outpost of Barthost."}},
[566]={nameES="A Missive to Echad-in-Edhil",objectivesES={}},
[567]={nameES="A Mitten-wearing Snowman",objectivesES={}},
[568]={nameES="A Mockery for a Memorial",objectivesES={"Troll-stone can be found throughout the Brown Lands, in the desolation of the Entwives' gardens, and at the Stone-hole, north of Gnarlstump's camp.\
\
Gnarlstump has asked you to gather troll-stone so that he can build a memorial to the Entwives.","Bring the troll-stone to Gnarlstump in the Brown Lands","Gnarlstump is at his camp near the desolation of the Entwives' gardens in the Brown Lands.\
\
You should bring the troll-stone you collected to Gnarlstump.","A Mockery for a Memorial","The Ent Gnarlstump desires to build a memorial to the Entwives before he leaves the Brown Lands."}},
[569]={nameES="Un momento para Amroth",objectivesES={"Amroth fue un señor elfo que una vez gobernó en Lothlórien, pero se perdió en el mar y nunca más se le volvió a ver.","<rgb=#FF0000>Mira</rgb> a lo lejos en busca de Amroth","Un momento para Amroth","Los muelles circulares que se extienden hacia el Celebrant se encuentran al sureste de Caras Galadhon, al sur de Imlad Lalaith.\
\
Pennasdir te ha pedido que te coloques en uno de los muelles circulares que se extienden hacia el Celebrant y que <rgb=#FF0000>mires</rgb> a lo lejos en busca de Amroth.","Pennasdir está en Telain Glorelloth, en Caras Galadhon, al noroeste de los muelles.\
\
Has participado en la tradición de Pennasdir de buscar a Amroth por el Celebrant y ahora deberías regresar al Elfo.","Buscas a lo lejos el barco blanco de Amroth, pero no aparece","Encuentra uno de los muelles circulares que se extienden hacia el Celebrant","Habla con Pennasdir en Telain Glorelloth","Has llegado a los muelles"}},
[570]={nameES="Un momento de esperanza",objectivesES={"Un momento de esperanza","Un grupo herido de enemigos resulta un blanco fácil. Acaba con ellos antes de que puedan reagruparse y recuperar sus fuerzas.","Tu misión es ir a Maurûsh y atacar a los Orcos mientras están debilitados y evitar que recuperen sus fuerzas."}},
[571]={nameES="A Moment of Peace",objectivesES={"Talk to Chan-két Doloi","Chan-két Doloi can be found at Aelin Veren in central North Ithilien.\
\
Maendal has asked you to speak with Chan-két Doloi about his knowledge of the Enemy's plans.","It is uncertain if there can ever truly be peace between the peoples of Gondor and Harad, but the Haradrim prisoners have offered their aid to the Men of Gondor for the sake of their kinsmen.","A Moment of Peace","Talk to Maendal","Maendal can be found at Aelin Veren in central North Ithilien.\
\
You have spoken to Chan-két Doloi and should now return to Maendal."}},
[572]={nameES="A Moment of Silence",objectivesES={"Talk to Barallas","Húna is in the hidden cave with the other refugees of Byre Tor in southern Balewood.\
\
Barallas and the Ents have bid you farewell and offered a suggestion of how to weaken Núrzum for you to share with the Rohirrim of Wildermore. You should now return to the cave where the refugees have taken shelter and have them leave the forest while peace still holds.","A Moment of Silence","Barallas is at Stonecliff in the Balewood.\
\
After speaking with the other Ents, Barallas has asked to speak with you one more time before sending you on your way out of the forest.","Mossbeard wishes you well in your journey and remains hopeful that the forest will one day be free of winter's hold","Talk to Húna","In the wake of Voskor's death and the White Hand's defeat by the Ents, a moment of peace has returned to the Balewood along with the hope that the Byre Tor refugees may finally rejoin their fellows.","Mossbeard is at Stonecliff in the Balewood.\
\
In the wake of the attack on the White Hand, Barallas has asked that you speak to the other Ents before returning to the refugees of Byre Tor in the Balewood.","Talk to Mossbeard","Nindorn is at Stonecliff with the other Ents.\
\
In the wake of the attack on the White Hand, Barallas has asked that you speak to the other Ents before returning to the refugees of Byre Tor in Balewood.","Talk to Nindorn","Although he does not wish to involve himself in matters beyond the trees, Barallas bids you farewell and hopes that Núrzum will be defeated","Nindorn mourns the loss of Duskleaf, but thanks you for your aid in freeing the forest from the White Hand","Húna and the others will make for Forlaw as soon as they are able"}},
[573]={nameES="Una decisión importante",objectivesES={"Una decisión importante","Aragorn está en uno de los cuartos de la Casa de Invitados localizada al suroeste de la casa de Elrond.\
\
El herrero elfo Hemeldir te ha dicho que sin uno de los Silithair, cualquier espada forjada de los fragmentos de Narsil sería un arma inferior.","Hemeldir está en las forjas de Rivendel, en la esquina noroeste del valle.\
\
Aragorn ha decido que ha llegado la hora de reforjar Narsil, una de las reliquias de su linaje y la hoja que rompió el poder de Sauron en la batalla final de la Última Alianza durante la Segundad Edad.","Habla con Hemeldir","Aragorn ha decidido que ha llegado la hora de reforjar Narsil, la espada que se rompió cuando Elendil cayó en Orodruin.","Habla con Aragorn en Rivendel."}},
[574]={nameES="A More Secret Way",objectivesES={"A More Secret Way","Talk to Idhrenfair at Echad Idhrenfair","Saeradan fears that the road south into Dunland may be watched too closely, forcing the Rangers of the Grey Company to seek a safer route to Rohan.","Idhrenfair is at Echad Idhrenfair in the Gloomglens, north and west of Echad Saeradan.\
\
Saeradan has suggested you might help Idhrenfair seek a more secret path southwards."}},
[575]={nameES="A More Thorough Lockdown",objectivesES={}},
[576]={nameES="A Morgul Ailment",objectivesES={}},
[577]={nameES="A Morgul Remedy",objectivesES={}},
[578]={nameES="A Most Valuable Stone",objectivesES={}},
[579]={nameES="A Mounted Menace",objectivesES={}},
[580]={nameES="Una multitud de Durub",objectivesES={"Habla con Dómárr","Dómárr está descanando en una pequeña hoguera en el Gran Salón de Durin, al sur de la Sala Vigesimoprimera.\
\
Dómárr se alegrará de oír que las filas de los Durub han sido reducidas.","Los Durub, una tribu de orcos de Mordor que dicen ser los elegidos de Sauron, han establecido su campamento justo al sur de la Sala Vigesimoprimera.","Los orcos Durub se encuentran en Gazatu-ru, al sur de la Sala Vigesimoprimera.\
\
Dómárr te ha pedido que muestres a los Durub que no son bienvenidos en el Gran Salón de Durin.","Una multitud de Durub"}},
[581]={nameES="Un asesinato en Puente de Caballetes",objectivesES={"El comienzo del ligero rastro de sangre está en Puente de Caballetes.\
\
Deberías seguir el rastro y ver a dónde lleva.","El lugar del altercado se encuentra en Puente de Caballetes.\
\
Debes localizar el lugar del altercado.","Supervisa la reconstrucción de Puente de Caballetes","Habla con Nellie Bosquejo","Localiza el lugar del altercado","Aran Verduno está en Puente de Caballetes.\
\
Deberías hablar con Aran Verduno.","Hay sangre seca en este cuchillo, que coincide con la herida del cuerpo del guardia","Deberías volver a Puente de Caballetes y encerrar al bandido en la picota.","Sigue el tenue rastro de sangre","Nellie Bosquejo está en Puente de Caballetes.\
\
Deberías hablar con Nellie Bosquejo sobre el altercado.","Un asesinato en Puente de Caballetes","Esta tela rasgada parece formar parte de una capa","El pequeño cobertizo se encuentra junto al río, cerca de Puente de Caballetes.\
\
Deberías inspeccionar los alrededores del cobertizo.","Hay un ligero rastro de sangre que se aleja del lugar del altercado","El posible sospechoso del asesinato se encuentra en la zona norte del Bosque Salvaje.\
\
Deberías enfrentarte al sospechoso del asesinato.","Habla con Aran Verduno","Has derrotado al bandido exhausto","Con tu confesión, has absuelto a la Hermandad de los Leñadores de toda culpa.","Esta cuerda rota debió de servir para amarrar un barco aquí, durante algún tiempo","El lugar del altercado se encuentra en Puente de Caballetes.\
\
Debes investigar el lugar del altercado.","Enfréntate al sospechoso de asesinato","El pequeño cobertizo se encuentra junto al río, cerca de Puente de Caballetes.\
\
Deberías buscar más pruebas..","Busca en el Bosque Salvaje al sospechoso del asesinato","Hay que averiguar qué ha pasado aquí","La Hermandad de los Leñadores se ha enterado de un horrible crimen cometido en Puente de Caballetes.","Habla con el bandido exhausto en Puente de Caballetes","El bandido exhausto está en Puente de Caballetes.\
\
Deberías hablar con el bandido exhausto.","Quienquiera que haya asesinado al guardia debe de haber bajado río abajo en una pequeña embarcación.\
\
Deberías buscar al sospechoso del asesinato río abajo, en el Bosque Salvaje.","El cobertizo está vacío en estos momentos, y parece que la puerta ha sido forzada","El rastro continúa cuesta abajo, alejándose de Puente de Caballetes","Encierra al asesino en la picota de Puente de Caballetes","Parece que esta banda perteneció en algún momento a un bandido","Ahora que se ha detenido al asesino, esto debería absolver a la Hermandad de los Leñadores de toda culpa.","Esta moneda de la Hermandad de los Leñadores no pertenecía al guardia, que no era miembro de la misma","Las obras de reconstrucción continúan en Puente de Caballete.\
\
Deberías echar un vistazo a la reconstrucción de Puente de Caballete","Te encuentras con un bandido, empapado y sin aliento, cerca del río","El guardia está muerto y, por lo que parece, le han apuñalado en el estómago.","El rastro termina en un pequeño cobertizo"}},
[582]={nameES="A Mysterious Crofter",objectivesES={"Approach the old crofter","The Orc attackers have moved to attack the elderly crofter standing atop a cliff to the south of Snowbourn.","The old crofter is just ahead, standing atop a cliff to the south of Snowbourn.","As you approach, you notice two Orcs preparing to attack the crofter","A Mysterious Crofter","You have come across a ragged old man on a cliff overlooking a waterfall to the south of Snowbourn. Surely, he knows it is unwise to be outside with so many Orcs about.","The crofter is standing alone on a cliff overlooking a waterfall to the south of Snowbourn.","The stranger stares blankly at you, considering the situation that has just occurred. He pauses a moment, mouths something silently, and then begins to speak.\
\
'Thank you for your aid, stranger. Your assault was opportunely timed, I must say. Those Orcs had truly taken me by surprise.\
\
'I had come to visit a... friend of mine, but sadly, his home to the north appears to have been destroyed and I have heard naught of him in some time now...\
\
'You need not worry about me, stranger. The Orcs will trouble me not on my journey home, of this I am sure.'","Talk to the old crofter"}},
[583]={nameES="A Mysterious Old Man",objectivesES={}},
[584]={nameES="A Mysterious Ore",objectivesES={"Glowing ore can be found inside Kâm Lagúrz, the Brokencleft.\
\
You should mine the glowing ore for Atli Spider-bane.","A Mysterious Ore","Atli Spider-bane has requested an adventurer to mine a mysterious ore in Kâm Lagúrz, the Brokencleft.","A note hangs on the board, signed by Atli Spider-bane:\
\
'I spotted a glowing ore I've never seen before in the Kâm Lagúrz, the Brokencleft. If any of you are brave enough to venture inside, bring me some samples!'"}},
[585]={nameES="A Mystery Deferred",objectivesES={"Examine the fallen soldier","Brifard has finished his task to gather reeds with your help. The arrogance of the man is nearly overwhelming, and it would be a relief to be gone from him.","Search the road for Idmar and his men","A Mystery Deferred","You see a Rohirrim soldier on the ground nearby... perhaps this is one of Idmar's men?","Find Idmar and his men","Idmar and his scouts are along the road to the south-east.\
\
Brifard requests that you head south-east to meet his captain, Idmar, who has travelled with his men to deal with a mysterious task.","Uncertain what remains of the scouting party Brifard mentioned, you should continue south-east along the road and search for Idmar or any other Rohirrim.","You have come across a fallen Rohirrim. You should examine him and determine what fate befell him."}},
[586]={nameES="Un miedo sin nombre",objectivesES={"Encuentra y habla con Jari","Has escoltado a Jari de manera segura","Un miedo sin nombre","Jari planea intentar encontrar la fuente de la locura que afecta a las arañas que ha estado estudiando.","Jari se encuentra justo al oeste de la entrada de Tunzelgund, al este del Refugio Sombrío.\
\
Klintur te ha pedido que acompañes a Jari en su búsqueda de respuestas sobre la locura de las arañas.","Klintur se encuentra en el Refugio Sombrío.\
\
Debes regresar a Klintur y contarle sobre la criatura aterradora que encontraste con Jari.","Habla con Klintur en el Refugio Sombrío"}},
[587]={nameES="Un desastre natural",objectivesES={"Return the phials of huorn sap to Tankho","Search for the creature that defends the woods of Jâghimsa","Wood-troll herder defeated","Un desastre natural","Tankho asked you to deal with a creature that watches the moving trees in Jâghimsa, the forest to the north of Rhakatâb. He also asked that you collect tree sap while you are there.","Make your way north and east through the woods in the shadow of the mountains outside of Rakhatâb and search for evidence of the creature the workers say dwells at Jâghimsa. Collect the sap from the moving trees within the wood."}},
[588]={nameES="Un desastre natural",objectivesES={"Elimina al Gran ucorno.","Se te ha pedido que frenes el asalto de los huorns que saquean las carreteras del Cabo de Umbar.","Un desastre natural","Encuentra y elimina al Gran ucorno","Se te ha pedido que frenes el asalto de los ucornos que saquean las carreteras del Cabo de Umbar.","Encuentra al explorador"}},
[589]={nameES="A Natural Remedy",objectivesES={"A Natural Remedy","DNT -- Players will not see","Unknown to all save for the Ents and Huorns, the slime of Fangorn's slugs can be used to heal weak and dying trees.","This tree is in need of healing","Near the river Entwash, Quickbeam's Huorn suddenly becomes distressed as it tries to wipe viscous slime from one of its roots. It shambles to a nearby tree that has grown brittle and lifeless before smearing the slime onto its trunk. \
\
The trunk shows signs of renewed health, and although such a remedy seems unlikely, you decide to aid the Huorn in healing the other wounded trees nearby.","Slugs can be found in western Fangorn along the shores of the river Entwash.\
\
Quickbeam's Huorn wants you to heal wounded trees in Fangorn with slug-slime.","Wounded trees can be found in western Fangorn along the shores of the river Entwash.","You have healed many trees with slug-slime.","Completado","You have healed a number of trees in Fangorn, hopefully reversing damage done to them by the new inhabitants of the forest. \
\
Although your aid is not immediately noticeable, in time the trees will once again grow tall and green."}},
[590]={nameES="Un Estudio Natural",objectivesES={"Los herboristas de Gondor se han instalado en el Recinto del Festival de las Tierras de Bree en busca de conocimiento que confirme las teorías de su maestro, pero en el proceso se han vuelto una molestia para los asistentes del festival.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro cuando finalice el evento asociado.</rgb>","Bruidhír capta tu atención y te hace señas para que te acerques","Un Estudio Natural","Lleva las flores de Anorloth púrpura a Nethlas en el recinto del festival","Habla con Nethlas en el recinto del festival","Nethlas, nuevo aprendiz del maestro de hierbas de Minas Tirith, espera que le lleves flores de Anorloth púrpura al Recinto del Festival de las Tierras de Bree.","Haerandel está en el Recinto del Festival de las Tierras de Bree. Se ha interesado en los herboristas visitantes, y Bruidhír te pidió averiguar qué es lo que quiere y por qué.","Las espadañas amarillas pueden encontrarse en los bordes del Recinto del Festival de las Tierras de Bree.\
\
Nethlas pidió a un hobbit que le consiguiera espadañas para estudiarlas, pero el hobbit nunca regresó. Ahora te ha pedido que completes la tarea.","Nethlas está junto a la mesa de los herboristas en el Recinto del Festival.","Habla con Bruidhír en el recinto del festival","Nethlas ha pedido otra entrega de vino de primavera para su mesa de herboristas. Las botellas están al otro lado del recinto del festival.","Habla con Haerandel en el recinto del festival","Lleva las espadañas amarillas a Nethlas en el recinto del festival","El Anorloth púrpura puede encontrarse alrededor de los bordes del Recinto del Festival de las Tierras de Bree.","Nethlas asiente con la cabeza para reconocer tu presencia, aunque no parece tener intención de darte las gracias.","Recoge el vino de primavera en el recinto del festival","Bruidhír te ha llamado para que te acerques.","Nethlas, nuevo aprendiz del maestro de hierbas en Minas Tirith, está esperando que le traigas espadañas amarillas en el Recinto del Festival de las Tierras de Bree.","Nethlas ha solicitado una entrega de vino de primavera para su mesa de herboristas. Las botellas deberían estar al otro lado del recinto del festival."}},
[591]={nameES="Una amenaza cercana",objectivesES={"Ivoreth se ha dado cuenta de que no están a salvo en el campamento que ha elegido, y te ha pedido que mantengas a raya a los lobos y linces que acechan cerca mientras ella y Barhador se preparan para partir.","Has contenido a los lobos y a los linces y deberías volver con Ivoreth a su campamento en el Ángulo del Mitheithel para ver cómo se encuentra.","Los lobos y linces amenazan la seguridad de Ivoreth y Barhador. Se encuentran en la colina que hay justo al norte de su campamento, en el Ángulo del Mitheithel.","Vuelve con Ivoreth a su campamento","Una amenaza cercana"}},
[592]={nameES="A Necessary Compromise",objectivesES={"Talk to Chan-két Doloi","A Necessary Compromise","Ideal banner locations can be found along the road, in southern North Ithilien.\
\
Chan-két Doloi has offered knowledge of the Enemy's movements in exchange for warning his people not to pass through North Ithilien.","No longer wishing to involve his people in the affairs of the Dark Lord, Chan-két Doloi, a war-master of Harad, hopes to negotiate an uneasy peace.","Talk to Maendal","Maendal can be found at Aelin Veren.\
\
Chan-két Doloi has offered his knowledge of the Enemy's plans in exchange for the ability to warn his people not to pass through North Ithilien or raise arms against the Rangers. You should speak to Maendal about his plan.","Chan-két Doloi can be found at Aelin Veren, in central North Ithilien.\
\
You have planted the warning banners of Far Harad and should now return to Chan-két Doloi."}},
[593]={nameES="A Need for Gold",objectivesES={"Deliver the gold-adorned weapons to Grámi Hornhelm at Hammerstead","A Need for Gold","Gold-adorned weapons may be carried by any of the Jangovar within the Ironfold.\
\
Grámi Hornhelm has asked you to claim the weapons of the Jangovar to provide him and his smiths a swift source of gold.","As the Dwarves of Erebor want for iron, the Dwarves of the Ironfold have a great need for gold.","Grámi Hornhelm can be found at Hammerstead.\
\
You have collected many gold-adorned weapons from the Jangovar and should now deliver them to Grámi Hornhelm."}},
[594]={nameES="A Need for Interrogation",objectivesES={"Interrogated lazy Corsair","Interrogate the resting Corsair","Speak with Aras near Gaerlond","Interrogate the lazy Corsair","Corsair drunks can be found in Gaerlond, the ruins of a small fishing village.\
\
Collect information from Corsairs in Gaerlond.","Interrogate the besotted Corsair","Now that Dolgimil has been revealed as the leader behind the Dor-en-Ernil invasion, Aras asks you to seek out information as to Dolgimil's whereabouts.","A Need for Interrogation","It seems that Dolgimil is on the Dor-en Ernil coast","You ask the besotted Corsair where Dolgimil can be found.\
\
'I have not seen him. Though I wouldn't go looking for him you know. He's got a, *hiccup* stronghold.'","It seems that Dolgimil destroyed Barad Rill","Interrogated besotted Corsair","Interrogated resting Corsair","It seems that Dolgimil has a stronghold","Aras can be found just outside of Gaerlond.\
\
You should speak with Aras."}},
[595]={nameES="Una necesidad de piedras",objectivesES={"Lleva las piedras a Rothavron en el Vado de Sarn","Rothavron necesita piedras, y te ha pedido que las recojas de los muros del Vado de Sarn.","Rothavron está en el Vado de Sarn.","Los muros de piedra del Vado de Sarn no echarán de menos unas pocas de sus piedras.","Una necesidad de piedras"}},
[596]={nameES="A New Brood",objectivesES={}},
[597]={nameES="Un nuevo amigo",objectivesES={"Bingo está en el Claro de los Trolls de Piedra, en el Bosque de los Trolls.\
\
Has liberado a un lince de una cruel trampa a petición de Bingo, con quien deberías hablar.","El lince devora alegremente la carne, y después te mira de forma enigmática.\
\
Quizá Willem Bigotes sea un nombre apropiado, ahora que te paras a pensarlo.","Lleva la carne de ciervo al lince en el camino que cruza el Bosque de los Trolls","Encuentra la entrada de Rivendel, el valle escondido","Habla con Bingo de vuelta en el camino al sureste del Claro de los Trolls de Piedra","Bingo está fuera de la entrada al valle escondido de Rivendel.","El Claro de las Tres Figuras Sonrientes está al noreste de donde Bingo y tú habéis acampado para la noche. Bingo te ha sugerido volver al camino antes de poner dirección norte hacia el claro.","El viaje de Bingo os ha llevado a los dos hasta el Bosque de los Trolls, donde las colinas boscosas son el escenario de un nuevo capítulo de la aventura del hobbit.","Encuentra el Claro de las Tres Figuras Sonrientes","Habla con Bingo en el camino que cruza el Bosque de los Trolls","<rgb=#FF0000>Saluda</rgb> al lince para que deje de seguir a Bingo","Bingo está en el camino al sureste del Claro de los Trolls de Piedra, en el Bosque de los Trolls.\
\
Has intentado espantar al lince que seguía a Bingo, pero la criatura no ha querido marcharse.","Bingo ha visto a un lince capturado en una trampa en el Claro de los Trolls de Piedra, y te ha pedido que liberes a la pobre criatura.","Habla con Bingo en el Claro de los Trolls de Piedra","Un nuevo amigo","Bingo te ha pedido que le <rgb=#FF0000>hagas señas al lince</rgb> que os ha seguido de vuelta al camino para espantarlo.","La entrada al valle escondido de Rivendel está marcada en el mapa de Bingo, en las tierras altas orientales del Bosque de los Trolls.\
\
Bingo está listo para viajar a Rivendel, y te ha sugerido que vayas a la entrada del valle escondido donde se encuentra.","Habla con Bingo en la entrada del valle escondido","Has encontrado la entrada al valle escondido de Rivendel, y los centinelas elfos observan con aire sospechoso vuestro pequeño grupo.","El lince te mira fijamente con sus enormes ojos, pero no se mueve","Willem Bigotes está en el camino al sureste del Claro de los Trolls de Piedra.\
\
Has conseguido algo de carne de ciervo, y deberías llevársela al lince para ver si sacia su apetito.","Libera al lince de la trampa","Pueden encontrarse ciervas y venados por todo el Bosque de los Trolls, y de ellos deberías ser capaz de conseguir la carne de ciervo que Bingo te ha pedido.","Tres grandes figuas de piedra se alzan en el claro","Bingo está en el Claro de los Trolls de Piedra, en el Bosque de los Trolls.","Habla con el centinela en la entrada del valle escondido","Bingo está en el camino que cruza el Bosque de los Trolls, al sureste del Claro de los Trolls de Piedra.","Bingo quiere volver al camino, al sureste del Claro de los Trolls de Piedra, para continuar con su viaje.","Libre de la trampa, el lince se aleja con un repentino salto","Los centinelas elfos observan con aire sospechoso vuestro pequeño grupo"}},
[598]={nameES="Un nuevo amigo",objectivesES={"You have decided to take Faroth on your adventures into the Wastes and beyond. Faroth looks thrilled!","Talk to Faroth","Mablung has suggested that you take Faroth with you on your adventures. Will you accept?","Talk to Faroth if you would like to take him with you.","Un nuevo amigo"}},
[599]={nameES="Un nuevo engranaje",objectivesES={"El capataz Indrith se encuentra en la Casa de la Rueda, bajo la Gran Rueda, al suroeste de Hulwul-nefekh.","Las Obras Hidráulicas son un sitio de importancia para los enanos que desean permanecer en Moria. Uno de esos enanos, el capataz Indrith, se ha propuesto reparar el canal allí.","Un nuevo engranaje","El capataz Indrith cree que has arrancado un engranaje al intentar forzar la rueda de la Gran Rueda para que vuelva a girar. Cree que otro engranaje está ubicado en los túneles de la Gran Rueda.","Has recogido el engranaje","Encuentra un nuevo engranaje en los túneles de la Gran Rueda"}},
[600]={nameES="Una nueva gema - ¡Una boda!",objectivesES={"Una nueva gema - ¡Una boda!","Habla con el líder del Gremio de Joyeros en Minas Morgul","Las recetas de artesanía que debes crear se pueden trocar con el vendedor de Recetas Mejoradas.\
\
Forja un collar de ithilharn con patrón del gremio.","Habla con Aldúlf","Ejecuta la receta para un collar de ithilharn con patrón del gremio"}},
[601]={nameES="Una nueva gema - Brazalete",objectivesES={"Ejecuta la receta para un brazalete de ithilharn con patrón del gremio","Habla con el líder del Gremio de Joyeros en Minas Morgul","Habla con Aldúlf","Las recetas de artesanía que debes crear se pueden trocar con el vendedor de Recetas Mejoradas.\
\
Forja un brazalete de ithilharn con patrón del gremio.","El líder del Gremio de Joyeros te ha pedido que fabriques un brazalete de ithilharn con patrón del gremio para animar al líder del Gremio de Herreros.","Una nueva gema - Brazalete"}},
[602]={nameES="Una nueva gema - Anillo",objectivesES={"Una nueva gema - Anillo","Habla con el líder del Gremio de Joyeros en Minas Morgul","Habla con Aldúlf","Ejecuta la receta para un anillo de ithilharn con patrón del gremio","Al líder del Gremio de Joyeros le gustaría que le recordaran la belleza de épocas pasadas.","Las recetas de artesanía que debes crear se pueden trocar con el vendedor de Recetas Mejoradas.\
\
Forja un anillo de ithilharn con patrón del gremio."}},
[603]={nameES="Una nueva gema - Muestras",objectivesES={"Ejecuta la receta para un cabujón de ithilharn con patrón del gremio","El líder del Gremio de Joyeros te ha pedido que crees un cabujón de ithilharn con patrón del gremio para mostrarlo al Gremio de Eruditos para su estudio.","Habla con el líder del Gremio de Joyeros en Minas Morgul","Las recetas de artesanía que debes crear se pueden trocar con el vendedor de Recetas Mejoradas.\
\
Crea un cabujón de ithilharn con patrón del gremio.","Habla con Aldúlf","Una nueva gema - Muestras"}},
[604]={nameES="Una nueva cacería",objectivesES={"Has hecho que las tierras salvajes de Eregion sean más seguras para los Elfos de Gwingris. Ahora deberías volver a Spalvi con las noticias de tu éxito.","Habla con Spalvi en el exterior del campamento de Glóin en la zona de la Fuente del Bruinen Occidental en las Montañas Nubladas","Haley Pradodulce ha venido a las ruinas de Gwingris, al noroeste de Eregion, y quiere hablar contigo.","Spalvi ha accedido a viajar contigo a Gwingris, las ruinas en la esquina noroeste de Eregion, la siguiente etapa de vuestro viaje para encontrar a Bingo Boffin.","Habla con Haley Pradodulce en Gwingris","Le entregas la pequeña bolsa de discos de hierro a Haley, y le dices que Teodoro está a salvo.\
\
'Bueno, ya es algo, supongo. Dudo mucho que estuviera satisfecho con esta pequeña bolsa de baratijas, ¿pero quién puede decir qué tiene valor y qué no? A mi parecer, estos discos llevan la marca de la Mano Blanca, y ese es un símbolo que he visto en muchos de los enemigos que he encontrado en estas tierras.\
\
'Si Teodoro piensa que todo el tesoro está contenido en cajas fuertes, ¡quizá tenga que replantear mis lecciones y volver al principio!'\
\
La risa de Haley se apaga de repente. Su sonrisa se desvanece, reemplazada por una expresión de preocupación.\
\
'¿No piensas de verdad que lo cree, verdad? Oh, cielos.'","Glóin está en su campamento en la zona de la Fuente del Bruinen Oeste, en las Montañas Nubladas.\
\
Spalvi te ha pedido que hables con Glóin y averigües lo que puedas de la expedición a Khazad-dûm.","Habla con Glóin en su campamento en la zona de la Fuente del Bruinen Occidental en las Montañas Nubladas","Las ruinas de Pembar está al sureste de Gwingris, en Eregion.\
\
Haley Pradodulce envió a Teodoro Tojo a Pembar en búsqueda de tesoros (y a que aprendiera algo útil sobre búsqueda de tesoros), pero no ha vuelto y teme que haya tenido un encontronazo con los semiorcos que han ocupado el lugar... o quizá no haya encontrado Pembar, o podría haberse perdido, o podría simplemente haberse quedado dormido en algún matorral, o confundido algo con un tesoro...\
\
Pero si la causa de su retraso son los semiorcos que te ha contado, le gustaría que te ocuparas de solucionarlo.","Spalvi está en Gwingris, en el noroeste de Eregion, y está esperando para hablar contigo.","Spalvi ha oído que una expedición de enanos planea entrar en los antiguos salones de Khazad-dûm, y piensa que deberíais intentar seguirlos por si Bingo ha terminado en ese reino.","Una nueva cacería","Glóin te ha dicho que la Guarnición de Hierro busca entrar en Khazad-dûm, y ahora deberías hablar con Spalvi fuera de su campamento para trazar un plan.","Lleva el tesoro semiorco a Haley Pradodulce en Gwingris","Haley Pradodulce está en Gwingris, en el noroeste de Eregion.","Haley te saluda felizmente","Decepcionado, Teodoro te entrega la pequeña bolsa y decide encontrar un verdadero tesoro","Los rondadores del pantano y los dunlendinos se pueden encontrar por todo Eregion, y amenazan la paz de la zona.","Teodoro Tojo está escondido de los semiorcos en el centro de las ruinas de Pembar, en Eregion.","Habla con Teodoro Tojo en el centro de las ruinas de Pembar","Habla con Spalvi en Gwingris","Habla con Spalvi en Gwingris, en Eregion"}},
[605]={nameES="A New Master of Lake-town",objectivesES={}},
[606]={nameES="Un nuevo orco",objectivesES={"El extraño hongo que infecta el lado este de las Vetas del Cuerno Rojo parece haber afectado a las arañas e incluso el suelo ha sido transformado. ¿Qué impacto estará teniendo en los orcos de Moria y de la Mano Blanca que están en la zona?","Knakk está acampado en la pasarela elevada en la esquina noreste de las Vetas del Cuerno Rojo.","Un nuevo orco","Regresa con Knakk","Los orcos que se aventuraron en el área infectada parecen haber cambiado radicalmente. Eran orcos de Moria y de la Mano Blanca, que se han convertido en una nueva forma de orco fúngico. ¿Qué hongo habrá podido cambiar su cuerpo y comportamiento tan drásticamente, y tan rápido?","La nueva forma de orcos se encuentra hacia el este y sureste del campamento de Knakk en la pasarela sobreelevada."}},
[607]={nameES="A New Post",objectivesES={"Raphûz informed you he must move south along the dry river to a place called the Crossing of Sílabal or the Wrackwade. He wants to sit and speak with you again.","Speak with Raphûz at his post in Wrackwade","Raphûz wants to sit with you and discuss over a smoke and food about all that has transpired since his arrival in the Ikorbân Valley.","Raphûz was gone in the morning, having headed south to the Wrackwade. Find him there to see how he fares.","Complete the Instance: A New Post","A New Post"}},
[608]={nameES="Una nueva servidumbre",objectivesES={"Una nueva servidumbre","La Escalera Retorcida puede encontrarse más allá de las salas que salen de las mazmorras de Barad-dûr.\
\
Zôreth te ha ordenado que te presentes ante la Boca de Sauron para que puedas servir en la Ciudad Muerta.","El Rey Brujo de Angmar ha llegado a la Torre Oscura en busca de nuevos servidores para la Ciudad Muerta. Has sido elegido.","Antes de que puedas llegar a la Escalera Retorcida, encuentras a Lethi de pie entre una matanza","Habla con Lethi","Asciende por la Escalera Retorcida y preséntate ante la Boca de Sauron","Lethi puede encontrarse en las mazmorras de Barad-dûr.\
\
Antes de que pudieras llegar a la Escalera Retorcida, te encontraste con Lethi, de pie entre una matanza de Hombres, orcos y Hachetón. Deberías preguntarle a Lethi qué ha ocurrido."}},
[609]={nameES="Un Nuevo Brillo",objectivesES={"Brúni Yelmo de Piedra se encuentra entre los comerciantes de armaduras de la Mansión de Thorin, donde el canal atraviesa la montaña.\
\
Halli te ha pedido que lleves la armadura de su hermano a Brúni Yelmo de Piedra.","Un Nuevo Brillo","Entrega la armadura abollada a Brúni","A cambio de pulir la armadura de Halli, Brúni te pide que recojas las armaduras dañadas de los guardias en Noglond, la estación de paso al sur de la Mansión de Thorin.","Brúni está junto a los comerciantes de armaduras en la Mansión de Thorin.\
\
Deberías llevar la armadura que recogiste a Brúni para que la repare.","Lleva la armadura deslustrada a Brúni","Halli está en el Patio de Frerin, al sur de la Mansión de Thorin.\
\
Brúni te ha dado la armadura de Halli, limpia y pulida, para que la devuelvas a su dueño.","Halli te ha pedido que lo ayudes a mejorar la reputación de su hermano en la Guardia haciendo que su armadura deslustrada sea pulida.","Devuelve la armadura pulida a Halli"}},
[610]={nameES="A New Song",objectivesES={"A New Song","Anyâmat harbours aspirations of being a great shanty-man.","Talk to Anyâmat","Anyâmat has worked hard to write new verses for a shanty and would love to show them off to you.\
\
Talk to Anyâmat in Halrax."}},
[611]={nameES="A New Threat in Sen Chatâk",objectivesES={"Doorward Rokhâran has asked you to investigate reports of goblin attacks in Sen Chatâk, a fishing village to the north of Zajâna. Speak with Elder Jangâli there to find out more about the attacks.","Speak with Elder Jangâli in Sen Chatâk","A New Threat in Sen Chatâk","Speak with Elder Jangâli in Sen Chatâk. Sen Chatâk can be found in Kighân to the north of the city of Zajâna, within Mûr Ghala."}},
[612]={nameES="A Niece's Love",objectivesES={}},
[613]={nameES="A Noble Reward - Jirush",objectivesES={"Malgat should have finished your gift","Malgat explained he needed some time to complete a gift for you. He asked to wait for some time and then return to him for your reward.","A Noble Reward - Jirush","Malgat offered to provide you a gift. You only need wait a little while for him to finish his work. Adventure elsewhere for a few minutes and then return to him in Jirush.","Return to Malgat at his home in Jirush to receive his gift","Let Malgat complete his work","Enough time has passed. Malgat is likely done with the work on your gift. Make your way to his location in Jirush to claim your gift."}},
[614]={nameES="A Noble Trade - Jirush",objectivesES={}},
[615]={nameES="A Noble's Endeavour",objectivesES={"Frána is encamped outside the walls of Thornhope.\
\
You should bring the items you found to Frána.","Some of Frána's comforts may yet be found near the Mead Hall of Thornhope.\
\
Frána has rudely commanded you to find any of his comforts which may have survived the Orcs' attack and bring them back to him.","Collected Frána's cloak","Collect Frána's pillow","You rescued Frána, a minor nobleman of the House of Thornhope, who had hidden himself away during the Orcs' attack on the city.","Collect Frána's cloak","Collect Frána's robe","Collected Frána's pillow","Bring the items you found to Frána outside of Thornhope","A Noble's Endeavour","Collected Frána's robe"}},
[616]={nameES="A Northern Cousin?",objectivesES={"Talk to Rhus Cornchúthur in the Gloomglens","A Northern Cousin?","Rhus Cornchúthur is outside Maur Tulhau in the Gloomglens of Enedwaith.\
\
You should bring the Longbottom Leaf seeds to Rhus Cornchúthur.","Expert pipe-weed seeds can be purchased in the Shire.\
\
Rhus Cornchúthur has suggested that bringing him something of importance related to pipe-weed might earn you the trust of the Stoors of Enedwaith. Perhaps a supply of pipe-weed seeds from the Shire will appease him.","You wandered across a strange and suspicious hobbit in the wilds of the Gloomglens... a long-lost Stoorish brother, no doubt."}},
[617]={nameES="A Nose for Danger",objectivesES={"Glóin and Venko are at your camp-site in Misthallow.","You help Imák unpack some of his belongings","Imák was right, but he needn't be told this is one of the camp-sites you considered","Imák has fallen silent, and perhaps you should eat in silence and leave him be for a time.","Imák has asked you to help him unpack some of the belongings he brought with him from Skarháld.","Find and defeat the hunting warg Imák claims he can smell","Open the small coffer","Eat in silence, leaving Imák to his thoughts","A Nose for Danger","Talk to Glóin at your camp-site in Misthallow","Imák is very cross with you.","Talk to Imák at your camp-site in Misthallow","A small coffer among Imák's belongings has drawn your attention.","Talk to Venko at your camp-site in Misthallow","Suddenly a hunting-warg is upon you!","As long as you are travelling with Imák, you might as well try to get along with the bristly Stout-axe.","Imák says he can smell wargs prowling about to the south-east, and the bristly Stout-axe has sent you to slay one or more of the creatures before they attain the numbers to brave your camp-site.","Imák falls silent","Imák is at your camp-site in Misthallow.","Help Imák unpack his belongings"}},
[618]={nameES="Un encargo entrometido",objectivesES={"Los vendedores se pueden encontrar por toda la Feria de los Granjeros y la zona de Delagua. A Ernwyd Bolger se lo vio por última vez bebiendo grandes cantidades de cerveza. Se dice que a Opalessa Hojarena le encanta bailar. Se rumorea que Alric Corneta tiene una obsesión poco saludable por los hongos.\
\
Regaña a los vendedores que descuidaron sus obligaciones para ir a divertirse a la feria.","Convenciste a Alric Corneta de volver al trabajo","Parece que los vendedores del mercado se han dejado llevar por la Feria de los Granjeros, y una cliente entrometida ha notado este descuido en el servicio y te lo ha hecho saber.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando finalice el evento con el que está asociada.</rgb>","Encuentra a Alric Corneta y convéncelo de volver al trabajo","Encuentra a Opalessa Hojarena y convéncela de volver al trabajo","Convenciste a Opalessa Hojarena de volver al trabajo","Encuentra a Ernwyd Bolger y convéncelo de volver al trabajo","Regresa con Daisy Arenas","Un encargo entrometido","Daisy Arenas te espera en su puesto del mercado de la Feria de los Granjeros en Delagua.\
\
Regresa con Daisy Arenas y dile que has atendido a una cliente.","Convenciste a Ernwyd Bolger de volver al trabajo"}},
[619]={nameES="A Novel Idea",objectivesES={"A Novel Idea","Muzmák has asked you to hunt beetles in Ghax-hophra for beetle shells.\
\
Ghax-hophra can be found north of Kafagur.","Talk to Muzmák at Kafagur","Muzmák wants to attempt something he's never done before: record a story.","You've collected a wide variety of colourful beetle shells.\
\
You should bring them back to Muzmák at Kafagur."}},
[620]={nameES="Una Cantidad de Usos",objectivesES={"Bevan, uno de los guardias del pueblo de Musgovilla, ha oído que las plumas de Crébain podrían servir para varios usos útiles.","Una Cantidad de Usos","Bevan está en la puerta norte de Musgovilla, esperándote para que regreses con las plumas de Crébain que solicitó.","Los Crébain hostigan a los viajeros en el Viejo Camino del Sur, al norte de Musgovilla, y Bevan cree que sus plumas podrían tener una serie de usos.","Lleva las plumas de Crébain a Bevan en la puerta norte de Musgovilla"}},
[621]={nameES="Un par de tumbas vacías",objectivesES={"Derrota al señor de los túmulos Daethos en Dol Ernil","Bregach derrotado","Daethos derrotado","Derrota al señor de los túmulos Bregach en Dol Ernil","Un par de tumbas vacías","El Montaraz Faradan está preocupado por un par de poderosos seres reanimados que ahora caminan dentro de Dol Ernil.","El Montaraz Faradan está al suroeste de Calarphel en Tyrn Gorthad.","Habla con el Montaraz Faradan al suroeste de Calarphel en Tyrn Gorthad","Dos poderosos señores de los túmulos, Bregach y Daethos, ahora acechan en algún lugar dentro de Dol Ernil, en Tyrn Gorthad."}},
[622]={nameES="A Pale Grip",objectivesES={}},
[623]={nameES="A Pallid Tide",objectivesES={"Khûtra Elder Roshat has asked for your help culling the rising population of the dead near the Mâkhda Khorbo. The ruins of the Mâkhda Khorbo can be found in the hills to the east of Khûtra.","Return to Elder Roshat in Khûtra.","Return to Elder Roshat in Khûtra","Khûtra Elder Roshat has asked for your help culling the rising population of the dead near the Mâkhda Khorbo.","A Pallid Tide"}},
[624]={nameES="Una separación",objectivesES={"Habla con Ravaedron frente a la Cabaña del Helechal","Ravaedron te ha pedido que lo acompañes a despedirse de los últimos amigos que ha hecho en la Tierra Media, antes de partir hacia el Oeste.","Una separación","Ravaedron se encuentra frente a la Cabaña del Helechal, confundido y disgustado.","Habla con Ravaedron y ayúdalo a despedirse de sus amigos","Ravaedron se encuentra frente a la Cabaña del Helechal, preparándose para una triste despedida."}},
[625]={nameES="A Parting Gift of Good Will",objectivesES={"Renfaer has asked you to collect hides as a parting gift of good will towards the Men of Stangard, on behalf of Noriel.","Hides can be found on the bears and deer of Thinglad.\
\
You should collect hides from beasts you encounter to use as a gift for the Rohirrim.","Renfaer is near the centre of Thinglad.\
\
You should bring the hides you gathered to Renfaer.","Bring the hides to Renfaer","A Parting Gift of Good Will"}},
[626]={nameES="Una Reparación a Tiempo",objectivesES={"Entra en la Mansión de Thorin hacia el norte, luego ve al oeste hasta el Salón de los Comerciantes.\
\
Tindr te dio un poco de mortero para reparar las grietas en las paredes del canal.","Tindr está en el patio frente a la Mansión de Thorin.\
\
La fisura fue sellada. Deberías regresar con Tindr para informarle de tu éxito.","Se ha abierto una fisura en el gran canal enano que desciende desde la Mansión de Thorin, amenazando con inundar el Valle de Thráin.","Una Reparación a Tiempo"}},
[627]={nameES="A Path Now Travelled",objectivesES={"Patrol the second rally point","Patrolled the second rally point","Patrol the third rally point","Ardwyn has learned that the Rohirrim patrol which encountered the Dunlendings had ranged further north than usual, perhaps inciting the Dunlendings to attack.","The patrol path runs through the valley west of Forthbrond.\
\
Ardwyn has asked you to patrol several points for signs of the Dunlendings.","Patrolled the first rally point","Patrolled the third rally point","Ardwyn is at Forthbrond, east of the valley.\
\
You should report what you have seen to Ardwyn.","A Path Now Travelled","Talk to Ardwyn at Forthbrond","Patrol the first rally point"}},
[628]={nameES="A Path for Aragorn: Captains",objectivesES={}},
[629]={nameES="A Path for Aragorn: Orcs",objectivesES={"Aragorn will need the port of the Harlond cleared if he and his men are to make landfall with haste.","A Path for Aragorn: Orcs","Orcs can be found within the Harlond.\
\
You should defeat Orcs within the Harlond."}},
[630]={nameES="A Path for Aragorn: Siege",objectivesES={}},
[631]={nameES="A Path for Aragorn: Tents",objectivesES={}},
[632]={nameES="A Path for Aragorn: Trolls",objectivesES={}},
[633]={nameES="A Patron of Commerce",objectivesES={}},
[634]={nameES="A Peace-shattering Silence",objectivesES={"A Peace-shattering Silence","You have found nothing of import here","The earth around the tree's roots has been disturbed","Scout the Tree of Tribute","The Mustering Tree lies to the north-west of the Rohirrim scout-camp.\
\
Saeradan asked you to scout to locations for clues regarding the evil in the Gravenwood.","The Tree of Tribute lies almost due south of the Mustering Tree, south-west of the Rohirrim scout-camp.\
\
Saeradan wants you to scout two locations for clues regarding the evil in the Gravenwood.","Saeradan and his companions sensed a queer stillness about the Gravenwood when they arrived and are seeking answers as to why the forest would feel so empty.","Scout the Mustering Tree"}},
[635]={nameES="A Peaceful Repose",objectivesES={"Return to Vartúlin and plant the Sarláshi shoots at well-lit spots around Vartúlin.","Thórvilon, leader of the Kintai in Vartúlin, has asked you to gather fresh Sarláshi shoots from Róthirin, that they may grow into Sarláshi trees and be fashioned in Veróthi one day.","Speak with Thórvilon in Vartúlin","Speak with Thórvilon in Vartúlin.","A Peaceful Repose","Gather Sarláshi shoots from the grove of Róthirin. Róthirin is located east of Vartúlin."}},
[636]={nameES="A Peculiar Tomb",objectivesES={"Read the fourth grave-stone","Read the third grave-stone","A Peculiar Tomb","Idhrenfair, a Ranger who travels with the Malledhrim, shows more curiosity than the Elves for what has come to pass in the abandoned town. The shades that stir here are strange, and Idhrenfair would like to know the history of Audaghaim.","Talk to Idhrenfair at the Haunted Inn","The graveyard of Audaghaim can be found south of the Haunted Inn in the Dourstocks.\
\
Idhrenfair has asked you to search for any clues as to the history of Audaghaim in the town's graveyard.","The Haunted Inn can be found north of the graveyard of Audaghaim in the Dourstocks.\
\
You should return to Idhrenfair with your discoveries.","As you near this gravestone, you see that it is completely blank","Read the fifth grave-stone","Read the second grave-stone","Read the first grave-stone"}},
[637]={nameES="A Penchant for Buffalo (Daily)",objectivesES={}},
[638]={nameES="A Pendant in the Sand",objectivesES={"As you approach the man you notice that he seethes with wrath so smouldering it would make even the most hot-headed Rune-keeper blush.\
\
'Ah how could this be?! I could have sworn I was wearing it when we left the beach! Could I have left it there somehow?\
\
'Adventurer! Could I ask something of you? I was at Baj Khatûg with my dearest Zimâr this morning. There, he presented me with a beautiful necklace. I cannot find it now, and I'm terrified that I may have somehow left it on the beach! I'm to meet with him at the tavern tonight. He can't know that I lost it. Could you find it for me?\
\
'What does it look like? The gemstone is blue like his eyes and cut sharp like his clever wit! In the sun, it shines as bright as his smile!\
\
'Also it's on a sort of brown leather cord. Metal necklace chains irritate my skin.'","This blue faceted gem does indeed catch the sunlight. A small leather cord lies next to it","A Pendant in the Sand","Find Etinan's necklace","You have found the necklace and should return it to Etinan.\
\
Etinan can be found in Halrax.","Etinan has asked you to find the necklace his partner gave him on the beach of Baj Khatûg.\
\
Baj Khatûg is an island off the eastern shore of Zamarzîr.","Talk to Etinan","A resident of Halrax has lost something precious to him. No, not that precious."}},
[639]={nameES="A Percussive Pursuit",objectivesES={}},
[640]={nameES="Una Pluma Perfecta",objectivesES={"Lleva la pluma de vivos colores a Arrod","Incapaz de abandonar su puesto, Narlinn está preocupada por su amigo Arrod, de quien no ha tenido noticias en días.","Esta piedra blanca tiene marcas que señalan hacia el norte por el sendero","Has encontrado una pluma de vivos colores","Una Pluma Perfecta","Busca el nido del hendroval","Arrod está apostado en las Gargantas del Bruinen, sobre el acantilado que domina el camino hacia el este desde el campamento de Narlinn. Narlinn te indicó que buscaras la piedra blanca con marcas que señalan el camino al norte hacia Thorenhad; luego, que tomes ese camino, te desvíes hacia la derecha y rodees el acantilado.\
\
Hace días que Narlinn no recibe informes de su amigo Arrod, y te ha pedido que lo busques para saber si se encuentra bien.","Encuentra la piedra blanca con marcas que señalan el camino hacia Thorenhad","El hendroval hizo su nido entre las rocas al este del puesto de Arrod.\
\
Temiendo por su ave, Calendhroval, Arrod te ha pedido que revises el nido del hendroval que vio, en busca de alguna prueba de lo que pudo haber traído de su cacería.","Arrod está apostado en las Gargantas del Bruinen, sobre el acantilado que domina el camino hacia el este, al oeste del nido del hendroval.\
\
Deberías llevar la pluma que encontraste a Arrod.","Habla con Arrod"}},
[641]={nameES="A Perilous Drop",objectivesES={"You have cut loose many of the grappling hooks used by the Jangovar to scale Skald's Drop. While the Jangovar are not yet routed from the Ironfold, you have done much to hinder their efforts to gain a stronger hold on Utterby and the Iron Hills.","The steep face of Skald's Drop has long proven a valuable border to the Ironfold, but the Jangovar now seek to scale it in force.","Grappling hooks can be found along the edge of Skald's Drop in the Ironfold.\
\
After discovering that the Jangovar have been attempting to scale Skald's Drop, Slegi has asked you to destroy any grappling hooks you find.","A Perilous Drop","Completado","You have destroyed many of the grappling hooks used by the Jangovar at Skald's Drop."}},
[642]={nameES="A Perilous Parley",objectivesES={"Ambushers have jumped out of concealment on the way to meeting the ransomer. Defend yourself!","Glánhar's shrewd eyes go wide.\
\
'What? My four sons and husband went to war after the last beacon. Unless - but he holds only three sons? What can it then mean...?'\
\
Her face grows very sober.\
\
'I see. If this ransomer said not my name but only 'The Keeper of Ost Rimmon', then I shall play the prudent course and send another in my stead. \
\
'Now, where is that blasted fool Gondrad? Hoping to weather my wrath, it seems. Will you find the rascal for me? He is skulking somewhere in Ost Rimmon, I am sure.'","Go on to meet the ransomer","Lady Glánhar listens to your account of the meeting.\
\
'So it is a cunning wolf we are dealing with, then. Hm! Gondrad, I am not done with you, don't go creeping off. I must think a moment. What does this man stand to lose? To gain? What does he know that he has not said?'\
\
She falls silent with a frown.","There is nobody here. This must not be the meeting place.","Talk to the Variag Captain","Find Gondrad","Talk to Lady Glánhar","A Perilous Parley","The shepherd and Lady Glánhar stand at the centre of Ost Rimmon.\
\
Lady Glánhar cannot make out what the flustered shepherd is trying to tell her. You should speak to him yourself and see if you can get anything out of him.","The shepherd and Lady Glánhar stand at the centre of Ost Rimmon.\
\
You should tell the shepherd's message to Lady Glánhar: that she is to meet the captor on the eastern slope of Calenhad to bargain for the lives of her three sons.","Lady Glánhar stand at the centre of Ost Rimmon.\
\
You should return to Lady Glánhar with the Jarl Akhiz's demands.","Meet the ransomer","The the meeting-spot is south-east of Calenhad, on the bank above the river.\
\
Talk to the Variag Captain and learn what he wants for the lives of Glánhar's sons.","You hear a rustling. Ambushers jump out of cover!","Lady Glánhar asked you to find Gondrad, who should be found somewhere within Ost Rimmon.","A troubling message comes to Lady Glánhar of Ost Rimmon.","Continue looking for the meeting-spot, south-east of Calenhad, on the bank above the river.","Return to Glánhar","Go to the meeting-spot, south-east of Calenhad, on the bank above the river Sírnarthan.","A Variag captain stands waiting for you","Defeat the ambushers","Talk to the shepherd","Lady Glánhar stands at the centre of Ost Rimmon.\
\
You should go with Gondrad and learn what Lady Glánhar wishes to do about the ransomer."}},
[643]={nameES="A Personal Matter",objectivesES={"Nabatínu has asked you for the personal favour of checking on the welfare of his wife, Kugâna, a Jatsakóri still under the thrall of the Bokhóri sorceresses.","You tell Nabatínu about everything you and Faeron saw at the work camp.\
\
'Thank you for this news of Kugâna, though seeing Ombátha there bodes ill. She is the strongest of the Bokhóri, and is therefore the leader. As far as I can tell, she is the one who commands all of the Ordâkhai in An Shêru, but it would be news to me if she also commands these new Orcs.\
\
'Ombátha's mind is twisted with darkness, and she takes a great deal of pleasure in inflicting pain upon others. She is unstable, evil, and to be avoided at all costs. We must come up with a plan to free the others, and soon.'","Instance: A Personal Matter completed","Nabatínu has asked you for the personal favour of checking on the welfare of his wife, Kugâna, a Jatsakóri still under the thrall of the Bokhóri sorceresses. You should talk to Faeron at Gadim-ûn when you are ready to go, and the Ranger will accompany you.","Talk to Nabatínu","A Personal Matter","Talk to Faeron","Complete Instance: A Personal Matter","In the company of Faeron, you travelled to Gebarakór, where you witnessed the arrival of Ombátha, the leader of the Bokhóri. You also spotted Nabatínu's wife, Kugâna, who was alive but did not look well.","You should talk to Faeron at Gadim-ûn to ask if he will accompany you."}},
[644]={nameES="Una súplica personal",objectivesES={"Verdugo de Ekhamâti derrotado","Una súplica personal","Tu misión es alcanzar el campamento de Ekhamâti donde están reteniendo prisioneros y liberar a todos los que puedas. Luego, ponle fin al verdugo antes de que pueda hacer daño a más personas.","Al abrir su cámara, el verdugo te hace señas para que entres. ¡Derrotalo!","Derrota al verdugo de Ekhamâti"}},
[645]={nameES="Un montón de algas empapadas",objectivesES={"El campamento del Coloso está al norte del Barandalf.\
\
Uno de los montaraces en el campamento del Coloso podría estar interesado en ver las algas que has encontrado.","Las algas son viscosas y no parecen diferentes de otras algas de río; sin embargo, cuando tocan tu piel, sientes una sensación suave y calmante. Un Montaraz del campamento del Coloso podría estar interesado en esto.","Has encontrado un montón de algas empapadas dentro de los restos del rondador del pantano. Te calman la piel al tocarlas. Uno de los Montaraces del campamento del Coloso podría estar interesado en verlas.","Un montón de algas empapadas","Encuentra a un montaraz en el campamento del Coloso para hablarle sobre las algas que has encontrado"}},
[646]={nameES="Un peregrinaje al pasado",objectivesES={"El Montaraz Ferrit te ha pedido que transmitas sus disculpas a Calenglad, el líder de los Montaraces en la isla de Tinnudir en el Lago Evendim.","Un peregrinaje al pasado","Calenglad está en el campamento de Montaraces de la isla de Tinnudir, en la costa oriental del Lago Nenuial, al oeste de Parth Aduial en Evendim. Evendim se encuentra al oeste de las Quebradas del Norte, y al norte de la Comarca.\
\
El Montaraz Ferrif te ha pedido que hables con su líder Calenglad de su parte."}},
[647]={nameES="A Pillage Denied",objectivesES={"The invading army has overrun the wall and is attempting to raid and pillage the various resources found within the Deep. The store-houses and stockpiles of supplies must be protected from the vandals. The Rohirrim Siege schematics remaining in the coomb must be carried to a secure location, or they risk falling into the enemy's hands.\
\
Merit Rating\
\
This quest starts with <rgb=#FFFF00>Partial</rgb> Merit Rating.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Major Merit Loss:</rgb>\
* Supply crate is destroyed\
* Store-house is destroyed\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Moderate Merit Loss:</rgb>\
* Store-house guard is defeated\
 \
<rgb=#00FF00>Major Merit Gain:</rgb>\
* Schematics are delivered to the water-mill\
* Supplies protected from all enemy waves\
* Store-houses protected from all enemy waves","A Pillage Denied","The equipment store-houses and stockpiles of supplies must be secured before the invading army can destroy them. Schematics can be picked up and stored at the water-mill. The larger provisions must be defended from direct attacks.","You have defeated the assault upon the store-houses"}},
[648]={nameES="Un Lugar de Descanso",objectivesES={"Has completado \\qLa Carga de Frodo\\q","Bilbo Bolsón está en el Salón del Fuego, en el lado norte de la planta baja de la Última Morada. Gandalf el Gris está en los aposentos de Bilbo, en el lado sur.\
\
Elrond te pidió que tomes un descanso mientras estás en Rivendel y que hables con dos de sus invitados: Bilbo Bolsón y Gandalf el Gris.","Has completado el arco de misiones \\qEl Juego de del acertijo\\q","Habla con Elrond","El señor Elrond está en su biblioteca, en el piso superior de la Última Morada.\
\
Debes regresar con Elrond y hacerle saber que has cumplido lo que te pidió.","Completa el arco de misiones \\qEl Juego del acertijo\\q","Completa \\qLa Carga de Frodo\\q","Un Lugar de Descanso","Por orden de Elrohir, llevaste noticias del hombre demacrado a su padre, Elrond el Medio Elfo, quien te aseguró que pensaría en un plan para eliminar el mal en Nan Tornaeth."}},
[649]={nameES="Una plaga sobre nosotros",objectivesES={"Una plaga sobre nosotros","Devuelve la caja de yesca a Stanric en Ost Guruth","Stanric espera el regreso de su caja de yesca en Ost Guruth, al norte de Ost Cyrn.\
\
Prendiste fuego a los cadáveres y barriles en el campamento orco para evitar la propagación de la plaga. Deberías regresar con Stanric para informarle de tu éxito.","La fuente de la plaga se encuentra en los campamentos de los orcos en Ost Cyrn, al sur de Ost Guruth.\
\
A los orcos les importa poco la enfermedad que se propaga desde los cadáveres y barriles de vísceras que cubren su campamento. Stanric te dio su caja de yesca y te pidió que quemaras la enfermedad que se extiende desde Ost Cyrn.","A pesar de contar con un pequeño suministro de armas y armaduras, Stanric de los Eglain intenta organizar al menos una defensa mínima contra las bestias salvajes y peligrosas y otros enemigos que acechan las ruinas que los Eglain llaman su hogar."}},
[650]={nameES="Una plaga de ratas de las cavernas",objectivesES={"Se pueden encontrar rascacuevas en el norte del Bosque de los Trolls, en las gargantas al sur del campamento de Thoroniel.\
\
Thoroniel te ha pedido a ti y a tus compañeros que cacéis a los viles rascacuevas del norte del Bosque de los Trolls.","Thoroniel está apostada al norte de las gargantas infestadas de rascacuevas en el norte del Bosque de los Trolls.\
\
Debes regresar con Thoroniel e informarle que has cumplido su petición.","Una plaga de ratas de las cavernas","Los rascacuevas han descendido desde las Montañas Nubladas, asolando el norte del Bosque de los Trolls.","Habla con Thoroniel"}},
[651]={nameES="Una Plaga de Moscas",objectivesES={"Las moscas guadaña infestan el sur del Bosque de los Trolls, trayendo la amenaza de enfermedad a la región.","Hay moscas guadaña en el sur del Bosque de los Trolls.\
\
Mientras estés en el sur del Bosque de los Trolls, deberías purgar la infestación de moscas guadaña.","Una Plaga de Moscas"}},
[652]={nameES="Una Plaga de Lagartos",objectivesES={"Habla con Tinúriel en Echad Dúnann","Tinúriel está en Echad Dúnann, al noreste de Ulundín.\
\
Debes regresar a Tinúriel e informarle que has matado a muchos lagartos.","Una Plaga de Lagartos","Los grandes lagartos han estado devorando a muchas de las pequeñas criaturas de Eregion, despojando a la tierra de gran parte de su belleza.","Se pueden encontrar lagartos en Ulundín, en la punta sur de Emyn Naer, al suroeste de Echad Dúnann.\
\
Tinúriel te ha pedido que elimines a los lagartos que han estado matando a las criaturas nativas de Eregion."}},
[653]={nameES="A Plague of Ordâkhai",objectivesES={"A Plague of Ordâkhai","Destroy fortifications and defeat Ordâkhai at Ghât Lor. Ghât Lor can be found east of Vartúlin.","Artar Ildarthos has asked you to help buy time for the Adúrhid at Vartúlin by going to Ghât Lor and defeating many of the Ordâkhai making war on the Adúrhid.","Return to Artar Ildarthos at Vartúlin with news of your triumph","Return to Artar Ildarthos at Vartúlin with news of your triumph."}},
[654]={nameES="Una plaga de arañas",objectivesES={"Las arañas habitan en la sombra de Amon Ros, al oeste de Ost Guruth.\
\
Con un odio innegable hacia las arañas, Tortwil te pidió que entraras en las ruinas de Amon Ros para atacar a las viles criaturas que allí habitan.","Una plaga de arañas","Tortwil espera tu regreso en Ost Guruth, al este de Amon Ros.\
\
Debes regresar con Tortwil y contarle la destrucción que causaste entre las arañas. Debería alegrarse con tu éxito.","Desde mucho antes de que los orcos y los muertos se arrastraran hacia las Tierras Solitarias, los Eglain han tenido que lidiar con la amenaza de las arañas que habitan en las ruinas a lo largo del solitario tramo de Eriador. Ahora, a medida que las arañas son expulsadas de las profundidades de sus hogares en ruinas, se acercan cada vez más a Ost Guruth y amenazan a los Eglain que viven allí."}},
[655]={nameES="A Plan for Rescue",objectivesES={"The townsperson thanks you and flees to Ethring","A Plan for Rescue","The hamlet of Tungobel can be found north-east of Erchar's encampment.\
\
Rescue the townsfolk from the Corsair and Haradrim forces.","Erchar informs you of a hamlet to the north that may be under siege. He has asked you to rescue any survivors.","Erchar can be found at his encampment in the western end of Dor-en-Ernil, south-west of Tungobel.\
\
You should speak with Erchar.","Speak with Erchar and inform him of your success"}},
[656]={nameES="Petición de auxilio desde Barad Morlas",objectivesES={"Habla con Glavroleth en Echad Dúnnan","Glavroleth está al noreste de Porth Cadlus, en Echad Dúnnan.\
\
Deberías volver a ver a Glavroleth e informarle de tu éxito.","Un mensajero ha sido enviado desde Barad Morlas pidiendo ayuda de los dunlendinos acampados en Eregion.","Derrota al mensajero","El mensajero está al oeste de Porth Cadlus, al suroeste de Echad Dúnann y al otro lado del Nan Sirannon.\
\
Debes impedir que el mensajero dunlendino consiga refuerzos de Nan Sirannon.","Petición de auxilio desde Barad Morlas","El mensajero ha sido derrotado"}},
[657]={nameES="A Plea for Aid",objectivesES={"As you attempt to introduce yourself to the woman, she stands silent with the water lapping at her feet.\
\
Her visage is that of an amused smile as she turns and beckons you into the mere.","The mere can be found far to the north and slightly east of Linhir in Dor-en-Ernil.\
\
Tancestel has asked you to bring his river-stone to the great mere along the Gilrain.","DNT -- will not be seen","A Plea for Aid","A mysterious woman suddenly appears at the water's edge...","You have come upon the mere, and should find a place to set the stone","Search for the mere on the Gilrain","Roamingstar can be found in her glade in north-eastern Dor-en-Ernil.\
\
You have been ferried to a beautiful glade by the mysterious woman, and should now speak to her.","<rgb=#FF0000>Kneel</rgb> before the mysterious woman","Hoping to find any means to slow the advance of the Ruthless Dead, Tancestel begs you to call upon the fabled Sister of the Gilrain.","Talk to Roamingstar, Maiden of Gilrain","The mysterious woman can be found on the banks of the mere.\
\
You have placed the stone, and now a mysterious woman has appeared. If what Tancestel said is true, you should honour her by kneeling before her.","The mysterious woman can be found on the banks of the mere.\
\
You have honoured the mysterious woman and should now attempt to speak with her.","Talk to the mysterious woman","Follow the woman into the mere","The pile of river-stones can be found at the edge of the mere along the Gilrain.\
\
You have arrived at the mere on the Gilrain and should now place Tancestel's river-stone.","The mysterious woman looks as if she wishes to say something to you, but remains silent","The centre of the mere can be found in north-eastern Dor-en-Ernil.\
\
The mysterious woman has begun to walk into the centre of the mere. You should follow her.","Place Tancestel's river-stone on a pile of stones"}},
[658]={nameES="Un ruego de Lainedhel",objectivesES={"La Sargento de Armas Ascwyn se encuentra en Glân Vraig, en las Landas de Etten.\
\
Los emisarios del Capitán-General Lainedhel están buscando héroes dispuestos a adentrarse en las Landas de Etten para reforzar su pequeño contingente. Muchos maestros de establo han entrenado caballos que pueden llevarte a las Landas de Etten. Debes hablar con la Sargento de Armas Ascwyn al llegar allí.","Un ruego de Lainedhel","Una fuerza de Angmar amenaza con avanzar hacia el sur en Eriador. Un elfo solitario ha organizado un grupo de defensores para enfrentarse al ejército del norte y ha enviado emisarios a los Pueblos Libres en busca de héroes dispuestos a plantar cara al ejército de Angmar."}},
[659]={nameES="Una súplica desde Puente de Caballetes",objectivesES={"Una súplica desde Puente de Caballetes","Puente de Caballetes se encuentra al norte de Bree, a lo largo del Camino Verde. Dirígete allí y habla con la gente que considera este asediado pueblo su hogar.\
\
La carta te pidió que viajaras a Puente de Caballetes para hablar con sus habitantes.","Ha llegado una carta, y en ella encontraste una nota de la gente de Puente de Caballetes, al norte de las Tierras de Bree, a lo largo del Camino Verde."}},
[660]={nameES="A Plea to Wake",objectivesES={"Baillas has dug his roots too deep. You will have to find and save the injured man alone","Become <rgb=#FF0000>angry</rgb> at Baillas to rouse him","A Plea to Wake","You anxiously implore Baillas to wake up and help you track the lost man, but he stubbornly remains silent. You should do whatever you can to wake him up, as Gandalf bade you.","Try to <rgb=#FF0000>beg</rgb> Baillas awake","The Ent Baillas was concerned for the injured man who passed him by, but has not the energy to wake from his treeish slumber.","Baillas is near the centre of Fangorn's eaves.\
\
You should become <rgb=#FF0000>angry</rgb> at Baillas to wake him up and enlist his help in finding a man who may be in grave peril.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>You must select the intended target and perform an emote to advance this quest.</rgb>","Léofmar is somewhere in Fangorn, probably not far from his original camp-site. You should search to the north-west of the site.\
\
You should find Léofmar before it is too late.","Baillas is near the centre of Fangorn's eaves.\
\
You should <rgb=#FF0000>beg</rgb> Baillas to wake him up and enlist his help in finding a man who may be in grave peril.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>You must select the intended target and perform an emote to advance this quest.</rgb>","Find Léofmar","Baillas remains silent and still, with only his eyes alive to give you a bemused stare"}},
[661]={nameES="A Pointed Message",objectivesES={"Talk to Dagoras at Echad Dagoras","Defeat Lhew","A Pointed Message","The Dunlending deserters at Lhe Lhechu are led by a ruffian by the name of Lhew, whom Dagoras came to know during his imprisonment at the Dunlending camp.","You have defeated Lhew","Lhew is at Lhe Lhechu, south-west of Echad Dagoras.\
\
Dagoras has asked you to defeat Lhew, commander of the band of Dunlending deserters in Fordirith.","Dagoras is at Echad Dagoras, north-east of Lhe Lhechu.\
\
You should speak with Dagoras and let him know that Lhew has been defeated."}},
[662]={nameES="A Poke in the Eye",objectivesES={}},
[663]={nameES="El pendiente",objectivesES={"Encuentra el colgante y devuélveselo a su dueño.","El pendiente","El pendiente está demasiado bien elaborado como para pertenecer a un trasgo. Deberías preguntar a la gente de la Posada Abandonada o al montaraz Candaith, en su campamento al oeste de la Cima del Vientos, si saben a quién puede pertenecer el pendiente.","Descubriste un pendiente que llevaba un trasgo y reconociste inmediatamente que el objeto no podía haber sido fabricado por un trasgo.","El pendiente brilla al sol. No es un objeto fabricado por los trasgos, ya que su diseño es demasiado perfecto y simétrico. Alguien debe de haberlo perdido recientemente.\
\
Quizás Candaith o alguien de la Posada Abandonada sepa algo al respecto."}},
[664]={nameES="Un pobre guardia",objectivesES={"Talbot Hinton se encuentra en Puente de Caballetes.\
\
En los campamentos orcos al Norte de puente de caballetes, pudiste encontrar calderos con un líquido repugnante y recoger parte de su contenido.","Los campamentos orcos se encuentran al noreste de Puente de Caballetes.\
\
Deberías buscar en los campamentos orcos señales de que los Guardias de puente de caballetes fueron drogados antes del ataque, Probando La Inocencia De Talbot.","Lleva el somnífero a Talbot Hinton","Talbot Hinton afirma que no descuidó sus deberes de guardia la noche del ataque y que alguien pudo haberlo drogado a él y a los otros guardias.","Un pobre guardia"}},
[665]={nameES="Una Insignia de Cartero",objectivesES={"Una Insignia de Cartero","Habla con el maestro de correos de Bree","Habla con el maestro de correos de Bree para solicitar una Insignia de Cartero y ayudar a encontrar las invitaciones perdidas.","El maestro de correos de Bree puede otorgar Insignias de Cartero Honorarias a individuos que considere dignos de confianza."}},
[666]={nameES="Un cataplasma para nuestras heridas",objectivesES={"Los Trév Gállorg recolectan hierbas de las tierras bajas con las que tratan heridas y condimentan su comida.","Lleva las hierbas a Cána","La artemisa espinosa, la campanilla plateada y el levístico rojo se pueden encontrar en las tierras alrededor de Fail-á-Khro y la ciudad norteña de Donnvail: artemisa espinosa cerca de los estanques al suroeste de Fail-á-Khro; levístico rojo junto a las granjas fuera de Donnvail; y campanilla plateada junto a la fortaleza de Tór Gailvin, al este.\
\
Cána te ha pedido que recojas algunas hierbas para que pueda preparar un cataplasma y curar las heridas de los que resulten heridos en las batallas que están por venir.","Un cataplasma para nuestras heridas","Cána está en Fail-á-Khro, al norte de Aughaire, junto a la carretera.\
\
Cána te ha pedido que le lleves las hierbas que necesita para preparar un cataplasma curativo para su gente."}},
[667]={nameES="A Practice in Luring",objectivesES={"Hadorion seeks to sow chaos amongst Khâshap's rivals by framing him for acts of aggression.","You should tell Hadorion that you have created some chaos in the Gut and the fake sashes have been planted.\
\
Hadorion can be found in the Lower Ward.","A Practice in Luring","The plan to draw out Khâshap has begun. With rumours beginning to spread, Hadorion aims to create chaos amongst Khâshap's rivals."}},
[668]={nameES="A Precious Commodity",objectivesES={"A Precious Commodity","Amal is at the Woodman camp at the heart of the Rushgore.\
\
You should bring the avanc-hides you collected to Amal.","Bring the avanc-hides to Amal at the Woodman camp in the Rushgore","Avanc can be found throughout the Rushgore.\
\
Amal has asked you to hunt avanc for their hides.","Intrigued by the mortal qualities of the avanc, Amal has gained a curiosity as to the value of avanc-hides."}},
[669]={nameES="Un asunto urgente",objectivesES={"Un asunto urgente","Has recibido una carta de tu instructora en Bree en la que te pide que regreses a verla. Al parecer, hay algo que desea enseñarte.","Lleva la nota a Albra Bajoribera en Bree","Albra Bajoribera te envió una carta en la que solicita que la visites en la sala de entrenamiento de Bree.\
\
Entrega la carta a Albra. Se la puede encontrar en la sala de entrenamiento de saqueadores bajo la Puerta del Lodo."}},
[670]={nameES="Un asunto urgente",objectivesES={"DNT - 'Players should never see this.'","Un asunto urgente","Burt Nuevecuentos te ha enviado una carta pidiéndote que lo visites en el Poney Pisador en Bree.\
\
Entrega la carta a Burt Nuevecuentos en el Poney Pisador en Bree.","Has recibido una carta de tu entrenador en Bree en la que te pide que regreses para verlo. Al parecer, hay algo que desea enseñarte.","Lleva la carta a Burt Nuevecuentos en Bree"}},
[671]={nameES="Un asunto urgente",objectivesES={"Dawn Manzanadorada te envió una carta solicitando que la visites en la Cárcel de Bree.\
\
Entrega la carta a Dawn Manzanadorada. Se la puede encontrar en la Cárcel de Bree.","Un asunto urgente","Has recibido una carta de tu instructora en Bree en la que te pide que regreses a verla. Al parecer, hay algo que desea enseñarte.","Lleva la carta a Dawn Manzanadorada en Bree"}},
[672]={nameES="Un asunto urgente",objectivesES={"Un asunto urgente","Dalton Willow te ha enviado una carta pidiéndote que lo visites en Bree.\
\
Entrégale la carta a Dalton Willow. Se encuentra en la Escalera de los Eruditos en Bree.","Lleva la carta a Dalton Willow en Bree","Has recibido una carta de tu entrenador en Bree en la que te pide que regreses para verlo. Al parecer, hay algo que desea enseñarte."}},
[673]={nameES="Un asunto urgente",objectivesES={"Un asunto urgente","Lleva la carta a Tralli en Bree","Has recibido una carta de tu entrenador en Bree en la que te pide que regreses para verlo. Al parecer, hay algo que desea enseñarte.","Tralli te ha enviado una carta pidiéndote que lo visites cerca de la Cárcel de Bree.\
\
Entrega la carta a Tralli. Puede encontrarse cerca de la Cárcel de Bree."}},
[674]={nameES="Un asunto urgente",objectivesES={"Un asunto urgente","Biarn te ha enviado una carta pidiéndote que lo visites en la Escalera de los Eruditos de Bree.\
\
Entrega la carta a Biarn dentro de la Escalera de los Eruditos en Bree.","Lleva la carta a Biarn en Bree","Has recibido una carta de tu entrenador en Bree en la que te pide que regreses para verlo. Al parecer, hay algo que desea enseñarte."}},
[675]={nameES="Un asunto urgente",objectivesES={"Un asunto urgente","Flambard Tuk te ha enviado una carta pidiéndote que lo visites en Bree.\
\
Entrégale la carta a Flambard Tuk. Se encuentra cerca del Pabellón de Caza en Bree.","Lleva la carta a Flambard Tuk en Bree","Has recibido una carta de tu entrenador en Bree en la que te pide que regreses para verlo. Al parecer, hay algo que desea enseñarte."}},
[676]={nameES="Un asunto urgente",objectivesES={"Un asunto urgente","Oggur te envió una carta solicitando que lo visites en la Prisión de Bree.\
\
Entrega la carta a Oggur. Puedes encontrarlo en la Prisión de Bree.","Lleva la carta a Oggur en Bree","Has recibido una carta de tu entrenador en Bree en la que te pide que regreses para verlo. Al parecer, hay algo que desea enseñarte."}},
[677]={nameES="Un asunto urgente",objectivesES={"Un asunto urgente","Has recibido una carta de tu instructora en Bree en la que te pide que regreses a verla. Al parecer, hay algo que desea enseñarte.","Daisy Manzanadorada te ha enviado una carta solicitando que la visites en la Cárcel de Bree.\
\
Entrega la carta a Daisy Manzanadorada dentro de la Cárcel de Bree.","Lleva la carta a Daisy Manzanadorada en Bree"}},
[678]={nameES="Un asunto urgente",objectivesES={"Has recibido una carta de Brom Barbadehalcón, el entrenador de Luchador de Bree, en la que te pide que vayas a verlo.","Un asunto urgente","Brom Barbadehalcón te envió una carta solicitando que lo visites en la Cárcel de Bree.\
\
Entrega la carta a Brom. Se lo puede encontrar en la Cárcel de Bree.","Lleva la carta a Brom Barbadehalcón en la Cárcel de Bree"}},
[679]={nameES="Un asunto urgente",objectivesES={"Un asunto urgente","Has recibido una carta de Cebadilla Mantecona, el propietario del Poney Pisador en Bree.","Lleva la carta a Cebadilla Mantecona en el Poney Pisador","Cebadilla Mantecona te envió una carta solicitando que lo visites en el Poney Pisador.\
\
Entrega la carta a Cebadilla Mantecona. Puedes encontrarlo en el Poney Pisador, en Bree."}},
[680]={nameES="Una expedición previa",objectivesES={"Recupera las \\qotras órdenes\\q","Encuentra las \\qotras órdenes\\q","Lleva las \\qotras órdenes\\q a Ingifast en Guardia Orca","Ingifast ha escuchado recientemente a algunos orcos de la Mano Blanca murmurando sobre sus \\qotras órdenes.\\q","Los guardias de la Mano Blanca se encuentran en las Vetas del Cuerno Rojo, en los edificios llamados la Casa del Mineral, Menem-mezel, y Malmezel, al sureste de Guardia Orca.\
\
Ingifast queire que averigües más sobre las \\qotras órdenes\\q de la Mano Blanca. Te ha sugerido que empieces con los guardias de la Mano Blanca en las Vetas del Cuerno Rojo.","Recuperadas las \\qotras órdenes\\q","Una expedición previa","Ingifast está en Guardia Orca, al noroeste de la Casa del Mineral, Menem-mezel, y Malmezel.\
\
Ingifast estará interesado en ver la copia de las \\qotras órdenes\\q que has conseguido recuperar."}},
[681]={nameES="Una expedición previa",objectivesES={"Los grupos de asalto de la Mano Blanca se pueden encontrar en el camino despejado entre las dos tribus de orcos.\
\
Ingifast quiere que encuentres un grupo de asalto de la Mano Blanca y acabes con él.","Ingifast acampa en las escaleras que llevan a la Guardia Orca.\
\
Vuelve con Ingifast para contarle que has tenido éxito.","Una expedición previa","Los orcos de Moria llevan mucho tiempo minando las Vetas del Cuerno Rojo, pero hace poco la Mano Blanca se instaló allí y ha tomado el control de la región septentrional. Si la Mano Blanca logra hacerse con el control de todos los recursos del Cuerno Rojo, podría convertirse rápidamente en un enemigo formidable.","Derrota al grupo de asalto de la Mano Blanca","Regresa con Ingifast"}},
[682]={nameES="A Price To Be Paid",objectivesES={"You defeated Yigo and collected his debt","Bring your tithe to Ithurga","You defeated Akubis and collected her debt","You defeated Methen and collected his debt","Collect Yigo's debt","Collect Akubis's debt","Ithurga directed you to purchase a bag of coins that matter to him from the vault-keeper in Halrax. The vault is in the upper ward of the township. Return to Ithurga with your tithe.","Collect a<rgb=#00FF00> bag of gold coins</rgb>","You collected a bag of coins","You collected Dagan's debt","A Price To Be Paid","Ithurga wants you to collect debts from residents holding back their tithes. He directed you to scout the town for Methen, Akubis, Dagan, and Yigo to collect their debts.","Deliver the debts to Ithurga","Collect Methen's debt","To be accepted in Halrax, you must appease Ithurga, the stolid leader of the settlement.","Collect Dagan's debt","You collected the four debts. Return to Ithurga at his abode in lower Halrax."}},
[683]={nameES="A Prime Cut",objectivesES={"Place the desecrated ox-skull before the tent of the Ox-clan's captain","A Prime Cut","A company of Ox-clan warriors are encamped on the western edge of the Gravenwood, arrayed for war.","Talk to Cuthric","The Ox-clan captain's tent may be found within Rhuvel-cadlus, in the valley below Cuthric's post.\
\
Cuthric wants you to place a desecrated ox-skull before the tent of the Ox-clan's captain in an effort to goad him into single combat.","Placed the ox-skull before the tent of the Ox-clan's captain","Cuthric is hiding on the ridge above Rhuvel-cadlus.\
\
You should return to Cuthric and tell him that you have done as he asked."}},
[684]={nameES="A Prisoner to Stangard",objectivesES={"A Prisoner to Stangard","Using the coil of strong rope, you are able to safely secure Dargum. The beaten Uruk may be brought before the leaders of Stangard, Sithric and Stanric, for them to determine what should be done next.\
\
You will travel with all haste to Stangard with Dargum as your captive.","The Uruk-hai Dargum may be bound using the coil of strong rope near his tent along the river in the southern Wailing Hills.\
\
Odda has asked you to take the Uruk before Stanric if you could manage to capture him alive.","Dargum has been defeated, and he should now be taken before the leaders of Stangard to determine his fate.","Byrnstan can be found on duty in Stangard, outside the Mead Hall.\
\
Gadda is displeased with the command to release Dargum and has asked Byrnstan to express his concerns to you.","The strong ropes on the ground here would work well to bind the Uruk's hands. You may constrain him and take him safely before the leaders of Stangard for them to evaluate the situation.","Talk to Byrnstan in Stangard","Use the rope to bring Dargum before the leaders of Stangard"}},
[685]={nameES="Una promesa cumplida",objectivesES={"Una promesa cumplida","Entrega la armadura a Jarred Mason","A petición del Montaraz Gondranc, fuiste al campamento de los Hijos de la Tierra al noreste de Esteldín para recuperar un libro sobre el arte de la talabartería que Asikko, el líder de los Hijos de la Tierra, le había prometido. Con esos conocimientos, ha fabricado armaduras para la gente de Puente de Caballetes.","Gondranc reside en Esteldín, muy al norte y al este de Puente de Caballetes.\
\
Jarred Mason te ha pedido que regreses a Gondranc para darle las gracias por la armadura.","Jarred Mason es un herrero en Puente de Caballetes, muy al oeste y al sur de Esteldín, a lo largo del Camino Verde.\
\
Gondranc completó la armadura que había prometido al pueblo de Puente de Caballetes y solo le queda entregarla. Te ha pedido que actúes como su mensajero y lleves la armadura a un hombre llamado Jarred Mason."}},
[686]={nameES="A Promise Kept",objectivesES={}},
[687]={nameES="Una promesa de Truco o Trato",objectivesES={"Habla con Begonia Cavada","Una promesa de Truco o Trato","Begonia Cavada se encuentra en Wistmead, junto al Árbol de la Fiesta, y en el centro de todos los barrios residenciales.\
\
Begonia Cavada te dará un felpudo con dulces si prometes colocarlo y luego visitar a otros disfrazado.","Begonia Cavada quiere tener dulces del festival de las cosechas en los felpudos del vecindario que solo los disfrazados de forma aterradora puedan tomar.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando termine el festival de las cosechas. </rgb>"}},
[688]={nameES="Un Festival como Corresponde",objectivesES={"Habla con Forlad en el Jardín del Festival","Algunos Elfos prefieren ignorar por completo el problema de las musarañas.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro cuando finalice el festival actual.</rgb>","Un Festival como Corresponde","Las flores están convenientemente ubicadas fuera del Jardín del Festival, en los campos cerca de Duillond.\
\
Debes recoger flores para replantarlas en el Jardín del Festival.","Las macetas están en el Jardín del Festival de Duillond.\
\
Debes plantar en ellas las flores que recogiste.","Forlad se encuentra en el Jardín del Festival en Duillond.\
\
Debes ver si Forlad está satisfecho con tu trabajo."}},
[689]={nameES="A Quest for Answers",objectivesES={}},
[690]={nameES="A Question of Bloodline",objectivesES={}},
[691]={nameES="Una Rápida Revisión",objectivesES={"Marget te ha pedido que revises a sus amigos en Lhan Garan.\
\
Habla con Murig y Deryn.","Habla con Murig","Marget te pidió que revisaras cómo están sus amigos.","Habla con Deryn","Marget está esperando saber de ti cómo se encuentran sus amigos.\
\
Habla con Marget en Lhan Garan.","Habla con Marget","Una Rápida Revisión"}},
[692]={nameES="A Quiet Meal",objectivesES={"You relay what Limril said to you.\
\
'Ah, I see. I was afraid I had made some misstep.'\
\
He sighs and runs his hand down his face.\
\
'It has been a trying several months. We have all taken my brother's death very hard. Limril and I try to keep our spirits up especially in front of the children. As you can see, this does not always work.'","Supper has concluded and Gladion has moved outside for some fresh air.\
\
Speak to Gladion in the field next to his house.","Talk to Gladion","A Quiet Meal","Gladion has invited you to dine with his family again.","Gladion has invited you to join him and his family for dinner.\
\
Talk to him when you're ready to go inside."}},
[693]={nameES="Una carrera en el Agujero Embrujado",objectivesES={"Recoge pruebas de que llegaste al Ala Rastrera","Regresa con la prueba de tu expedición a Poppy Coto","Poppy Coto está fuera del Agujero Embrujado, junto al Árbol de la Fiesta.\
\
Debes regresar rápidamente a Poppy Coto con la prueba de que caminaste valiente y hábilmente en sus pasos dentro del Agujero Embrujado.","Recogiste pruebas de que visitaste el Ala Rastrera","Una prueba de tu visita a cada rincón del Agujero Embrujado se encuentra en cada uno de los niveles fuera del piso principal.\
\
Debes recoger pruebas de que has visitado las cuatro áreas principales del Agujero Embrujado y regresar antes de que se acabe el tiempo","Recoge pruebas de que llegaste al ático","Una carrera en el Agujero Embrujado","Recoge pruebas de que llegaste al sótano","Regresa antes de que se acabe el tiempo","Recogiste pruebas de que visitaste el ático","Poppy Coto, una hobbit muy ágil, te ha desafiado a visitar todos los rincones del Agujero Embrujado en un tiempo determinado.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando finalice el evento con el que está asociada. </rgb>","Se te ha acabado el tiempo","Recogiste pruebas de que visitaste el sótano","Recoge pruebas de que llegaste al Ala Telarañosa","Recogiste pruebas de que visitaste el Ala Telarañosa"}},
[694]={nameES="Una lluvia de lanzas",objectivesES={"Los trasgos lanzadores de lanzas se encuentran en la cima de Khadar-zarâm.\
\
Debes recoger lanzas de los trasgos letales.","Los trasgos lanzadores de lanzas amenazan a todos los que esperan descender la escalera de Khadar-zarâm. Debes recoger lanzas de los trasgos que se posan en la parte superior de la escalera, apuntando su malicia a los transeúntes que esperan salir de Moria.","Recoge lanzas de los trasgos","Has tomado las armas de los trasgos lanzadores de lanzas de Khadar-zarâm, haciendo que la escalera sea más segura para aquellos que desean salir de Moria por la puerta este.","Una lluvia de lanzas","Los trasgos lanzadores de lanzas amenazan a todos los que esperan descender la escalera de Khadar-zarâm.","Completado"}},
[695]={nameES="A Ranger's Loss",objectivesES={"Henneth Annûn can be found in north-central Ithilien.\
\
You have collected the brooch and should now return it to someone in Henneth Annûn.","The brooch is dusty and worn, but its beauty remains unblemished","Torngroth, the last of the Ranger refuges to fall, has fallen into the hands of the Enemy, and those that aided in its defence are now lost or slain.","While exploring Torngroth, you have discovered an ornate brooch in the abandoned Ranger hideout. It is unclear to whom the brooch belongs or if they yet live, but perhaps it would be best to deliver it to the Rangers at Henneth Annûn.","Collect the Ranger's brooch","Deliver the brooch to the Rangers at Henneth Annûn","The brooch can be found on the ground within Torngroth.\
\
You have discovered a worn Ranger's brooch within Torngroth and should collect it before returning to Henneth Annûn.","A Ranger's Loss"}},
[696]={nameES="A Rare Cut",objectivesES={"This terrible butcher's blade has taken a deadly toll upon the noble steeds of the Rohirrim and the tithed cattle of the Dunlendings alike.\
\
No doubt, the villainous butcher that wields it is somewhere nearby. Dispatching the fiend might be considered some form of reprisal to honour the mounts of the Rohirrim.","Defeated the Butcher","A Rare Cut","The goblin-butcher may be found somewhere in the caves of western Nan Curunír.\
\
You should dispatch the goblin-butcher for his foul crimes.","You discovered an enormous butcher's knife in the bowels of a goblin slaughter-house where the Rohirrim steeds were brought to serve as feed for the Wargs."}},
[697]={nameES="A Rare Dwarf",objectivesES={"Penrod is among the northern buildings in Tûr Morva.\
\
Lheu Brenin has asked you to speak with his Brehur, Penrod.","Arwel is delighted to meet a dwarf, considering how few he has seen, and tells you about another who visited the Brenin recently.","Lheu Brenin is outside his home on the upper-most level of Tûr Morva.\
\
You have examined the weapons and should now tell Lheu Brenin which weapon was a gift from the dwarf Lindar.","This axe is of fine dwarf-make, sharp and strong","Talk to Penrod in Tûr Morva","Most men would need two hands to wield this heavy sword","Lheu Brenin is outside his home on the upper-most level of Tûr Morva.\
\
Arwel, delighted at meeting a dwarf, thinks you should speak with Lheu Brenin about another dwarf who passed through Tâl Methedras recently.","Examine the sword on the table near Lheu Brenin","Talk to Lheu Brenin in Tûr Morva","This staff is well-balanced, and could be deadly in the right hands","Examine the axe on the table near Lheu Brenin","A Rare Dwarf","Examine the staff on the table by Lheu Brenin","Weapons are arrayed on a table next to Lheu Brenin.\
\
Lheu Brenin has asked you to examine the weapons on the table next to him and to identify which of them was Lindar's gift to him."}},
[698]={nameES="Una raíz rara",objectivesES={"Tharâkh Bazân se encuentra al oeste del campamento de Búkk en el Camino de Durin.\
\
Búkk te ha pedido que busques una raíz de planta específica que solo crece cerca de fuentes de agua fresca. Cree que puede encontrarse entre los arroyos de Tharâkh Bazân.","Una raíz rara","Búkk espera encontrar un tipo de raíz medicinal, que recuerda de su juventud. Sospecha que la planta puede encontrarse cerca de las piscinas de agua en Tharâkh Bazân.","Devuelve las raíces saludables a Búkk","Búkk se encuentra en el pequeño campamento en el extremo este de Tharâkh Bazân.\
\
Has recogido varias raíces cerca de fuentes de agua que parecen coincidir con la descripción de Búkk sobre las raíces de barro. Él espera tu regreso en el pequeño campamento de Tharâkh Bazân."}},
[699]={nameES="Una añada excepcional",objectivesES={"Devuelve los frascos de vino a Brethilwen","Los trasgos robaron un vino excepcional a la vinatera Brethilwen.","Una añada excepcional","Hay trasgos por todo el Viñedo de Limael, al noroeste de Celondim. Brethilwen se encuentra en unas antiguas ruinas que dominan el viñedo por el este.\
\
Brethilwen te ha pedido que recuperes frascos de vino de una añada rara y antigua de los trasgos que los robaron."}},
[700]={nameES="Una añada excepcional",objectivesES={"Has recuperado los frascos de vino de los trasgos que los robaron y recogido el resto de las uvas. Ahora deberías enfrentarte al líder de los trasgos, Pampraush.","Encuentra y derrota a Pampraush","Una añada excepcional","Se te ha pedido que recuperes frascos de vino de una cosecha rara y antigua de los trasgos que los robaron. Mientras estés en el Viñedo de Limael, deberías recoger las uvas restantes.","Los trasgos han robado un vino excepcional de la vinicultora Brethilwen y están ocupando actualmente el Viñedo de Limael en Ered Luin."}},
[701]={nameES="A Rat In the Garden",objectivesES={"Possible hiding-places can be found both within and without the Hall of the Gentle Hand.\
\
Brunil believes someone has poisoned her medicines and she wants you to check likely hiding-places.","Talk to Brunil in the Hall of the Gentle Hand","Brunil believes someone is poisoning her medicines, and she wants you to search for the culprit.","This seems to be an ideal hiding-place, but you find nothing suspicious","Brunil can be found within the Hall of the Gentle Hand, in Imloth Melui.\
\
Your search of possible hiding-places turned up nothing suspicious. You should return to Brunil and see if she is satisfied.","Despite the suitability of this hiding-place, you find nothing suspicious","A Rat In the Garden"}},
[702]={nameES="A Raucous Celebration",objectivesES={"Speak with Mizâdi at the top of Kûr Anzar.","Find the merchants of Kûr Anzar down the hill","You have retaken Kûr Anzar! Now is the time to celebrate! Help the local vendors and Kûr Anzar residents get settled upon their return to the city.","Speak with five vendors at the top of Kûr Anzar and offer your aid.","Speak with Mulnûri","Speak with Mizâdi at the top of Kûr Anzar","A Raucous Celebration","Speak with Mâkhbur","Clean up rubble piles for Urgu and hang posters for Mulnûri.","Speak with Urgu","Beckon the merchant Galpêsh outside the walls of Kûr Anzar","Speak with Hâdima","Speak with Numûru at the top of Kûr Anzar","Use the back gate of Kûr Anzar, then find the vendors down the hill and beckon them to follow you inside.","Speak with Numûru at the top of Kûr Anzar.","Speak with Galpêsh","You beckoned to the merchants of Kûr Anzar"}},
[703]={nameES="A Raw Deal",objectivesES={"Greyhide wolves can be found along the stream of water leading to the woods, south-east of the trader's outpost.\
\
Léodrim has agreed to adjust his prices, as long as you can procure him hides from the Greyhide wolves, so that he might manufacture more goods.","Léodrim awaits your return at the trader's outpost along the road west of Elthengels.\
\
You have secured Greyhide wolf-pelts for the trader Léodrim, so that he may lower the prices on his goods.","A Raw Deal","Ofrith wants the merchants at the trader's outpost to agree to reasonable prices for their wares, but Léodrim cannot lower his asking prices without the supplies to manufacture more goods.","Return the Greyhide-pelts to Léodrim"}},
[704]={nameES="A Reasonable Request",objectivesES={"Talk to Ninil","Wynmar wishes to make a gift of the flowers to fair Noriel, risking the displeasure of the Elves for overstaying his very temporary welcome in Thinglad territory.","A Reasonable Request","Wynmar is at the hunters' camp in Thinglad.\
\
You should speak with Wynmar once more to help him with what seems to be a harmless wish: to look upon the object of his love one last time.","Ninil is at Haldirith in Thinglad.\
\
You should speak with Ninil.","Help Wynmar see Noriel one last time before his departure"}},
[705]={nameES="A Reasonable Trade",objectivesES={"Meet with Gurthilm","Bring the payment to Gurthilm","Talk to Mablung","You should talk to Mablung, who can be found at the Ranger encampment in after-battle Osgiliath.","Collect supplies and payment scattered around the encampment in after-battle Osgiliath.","Mablung has asked you to meet with the Variag Jarl Gurthilm who has expressed a wish to parley.","Jarl Gurthilm can be found in after-battle Osgiliath.\
\
You should bring the payment to Variag Jarl and make sure he keeps to his promise.","Jarl Gurthilm can be found in after-battle Osgiliath.\
\
You should find the Variag Jarl and learn what he wants.","A Reasonable Trade","You should talk to Mablung, who can can be found at the Ranger encampment in after-battle Osgiliath."}},
[706]={nameES="A Reckless Rescue",objectivesES={"Talk to Molkha","Find the throne room","You have found the Scout Trio","Talk to Kyrstig","Scout-master Ausma has entered Shakhajât on her own, and though her apprentices were ordered to stay put, they are determined to come to her aid.","A Reckless Rescue","Kyrstig has a plan.","Ausma has been rescued from the clutches of Warlord Dushtalbúk!\
\
You should talk to Ausma in Bárgstad.","Talk to Scout-master Ausma","Meet the Scout Trio outside Shakhajât","You should search for the way to the throne room.","It is time to venture inside the fort with your scout allies.","Talk to Klúso","The throne room awaits you and your allies!","Kyrstig is waiting to hear what the other scouts have decided.","Complete 'Instance: To Ausma's Aid'","You should consult Klúso and Molkha."}},
[707]={nameES="A Recounting of the Sons",objectivesES={"You are surprised by an ambush!","Find the meeting location, a tree east of Bâr Nadhron, by the Mouths of the Entwash.","The party has met under a tree east of Bâr Nadhron by the Mouths of the Entwash.\
\
You should hear what Gondrad has to say.","Talk to Togbor","You have been set upon by more Variag assailants near the Mouths of the Entwash, east of Bâr Nadhron. Defeat them and do not lead them to the meeting place.","The party is under a tree east of Bâr Nadhron by the Mouths of the Entwash.\
\
You should hear what Togbor has to say.","Yet more Variags appear!","You have been set upon by Variag assailants near the Mouths of the Entwash, east of Bâr Nadhron. Defeat them and do not lead them to the meeting place.","Talk to Gondrad","Stay and defend your allies","After a close encounter with Jarl Akhiz and his men, it is time to reunite with the others.","The party has met under a tree east of Bâr Nadhron by the Mouths of the Entwash.\
\
You should hear what Togbor has to say.","A Recounting of the Sons","Stand where you were and fight","Find the meeting location, a tree east of Bâr Nadhron by the Mouths of the Entwash.","Find the meeting location"}},
[708]={nameES="A Refuge in the Rot",objectivesES={"Arrived at Sul Madásh","Ir a Sul Madásh","Bring Irsinith's letter to Orthél in Sul Madásh.","A Refuge in the Rot","Irsinith has given you a letter explaining how the rot is consuming Amûma. She has asked that you bring it to a scholar, Orthél, in Sul Madásh.","Speak with Orthél"}},
[709]={nameES="A Reliable Test",objectivesES={}},
[710]={nameES="A Reluctant Leader",objectivesES={"Kurtil stands by Gradrágh and the dwarves on the path above Maudhúl Vôr.\
\
You have talked to Gradrágh and he has given his grudging, conditional agreement. You should talk to Kurtil.","Scout the western approach","Talk to Kurtil","Raise the Flag","Scout the rear tents","No sooner have you raised the flag than the Nurnhoth Kurtil appears by your side","Gradrágh stands with Kurtil and the dwarves on the path above Maudhúl Vôr.\
\
Talk to Gradrágh the Overseer and convince him to join the meeting.","Raise the flag above the meeting place in Maudhúl Ghûg.","Scouted the western approach","Scouted the rear tents","Scout the meeting spot","Talk to Overseer Gradrágh","Scout the eastern approach","Scouted the forward tents","If Gradrágh will agree to join the meeting, many will follow. Without him, the endeavour falls apart.","You should talk to Kurtil in the meeting place at the back of Maudhúl Ghûg.","Scouted the meeting spot","You should travel to Maudhúl Ghûg, scout it out thoroughly, and thin the Orcs moving about there.","A Reluctant Leader","Scouted the eastern approach","Scout the forward tents"}},
[711]={nameES="A Reluctant Young Leader",objectivesES={"Agelwyn has found herself in an uncomfortable position as acting Thane of Marton during a very troubled time, and she does not feel up to the responsibility.","Agelwyn needs confidence to lead her people.\
\
You should speak with Agelwyn and encourage her to be strong.","Try to help Agelwyn be confident while her husband is away","Agelwyn is in the refugees' hiding spot north of Marton.\
\
You should speak with Agelwyn.","A Reluctant Young Leader","Speak with Agelwyn"}},
[712]={nameES="Un arco extraordinario",objectivesES={"Starkath puede ser encontrado fuera de las murallas de Kheledûl. Celairant está en el refugio de caza de Thrasi, al oeste de Kheledûl.\
\
Celairant te dijo que su arco fue robado a punta de espada por un duramano llamado Starkath y sus secuaces. Te ha pedido que persigas a Starkath y recuperes el arco.","Has recuperado el arco robado","Entrega el arco a Celairant","Un arco extraordinario","Recupera el arco robado","Mientras se dirigía a Duillond, un Elfo llamado Penglir se detuvo en el refugio de caza y le dio su arco al joven Montaraz Celairant. Celairant aceptó el regalo, pero se siente indigno de poseer algo tan hermoso."}},
[713]={nameES="A Remedy Most Fragrant",objectivesES={"Take a petal from a vibrant flower","Give the cave-claw in Ezôti's Flat a dose of remedy","You cannot recall the last time you saw a leaf so green","You have gathered all you need to create the remedy.\
\
Use the remedy-making supplies from your inventory to create the remedy.","Animals who have been kept in captivity require urgent aid.","The cave-claw seems happier","Use the remedy-making kit","Gûshida has given you a formula which can help the animals.\
\
Find the ingredients across the Upper Ward of Umbar Baharbêl.","The petal glows as if with its own light","Give the goat in Ezôti's Flat a dose of remedy","Talk to Gûshida's vendor","Give the boar in Ezôti's Flat a dose of remedy","You have given doses of remedy to each animal, and they all seem better for it. You should report to Gûshida.\
\
Gûshida can be found where you first met her in the Upper Ward of Umbar Baharbêl.","Pluck a clump of fragrant herbs","Give the bear in Ezôti's Flat a dose of remedy","He hands you a remedy-making kit for your use","A Remedy Most Fragrant","A fresh scent fills your senses with a pleasant sensation","The boar trots over to the baby bear and nuzzles it affectionately","You have gathered most of the ingredients you need. Now you need fresh water and honey from a vendor that Gûshida recommended.\
\
Gûshida's vendor is in the Upper Ward of Umbar Baharbêl.","Talk to Gûshida where you first met her in the Upper Ward","You have concocted several doses of remedy for the animals","You have created enough remedy and should give it to the animals in Ezôti's hiding place.\
\
Ezôti's hiding place is inside the Upper Ward of Umbar Baharbêl.","The bear lets out a mighty yawn and seems more at ease","The goat nuzzles your hand and bleats cheerfully","Pick a verdant leaf"}},
[714]={nameES="Un recuerdo de casa",objectivesES={"Has encontrado un collar en el cadáver de un semiorco en Nímbarth.\
\
Deberías encontrar a Meriona fuera de Nímbarth y preguntarle si reconoce el collar.","Un recuerdo de casa","Habla con Meriona","Habla con Riderch","Este collar, que encontraste en el cadáver de un semiorco, debe de haberse tomado como trofeo de alguien. Los materiales usados para fabricar el collar no son de aquí.\
\
Para que lo sepas, los únicos que han venido a Nímbarth son Meriona y sus exploradores, que vigilan desde fuera de las ruinas. Igual merece la pena preguntarle si reconoce el collar.","Meriona ha confirmado que el collar pertenece a Riderch\
\
Él se encuentra en el campamento de Siempreviva"}},
[715]={nameES="Un recuerdo de Rivendel",objectivesES={"Has recogido un vino blanco de Dorwinion","Recoge el vino blanco de Dorwinion en Rivendel","Recoge una copa de vino blanco de Dorwinion","El vino blanco de Dorwinion se puede encontrar en Rivendel, vendido por el viticultor Sogadan.\
\
Deberías viajar a Rivendel para comprar el vino blanco de Dorwinion que Lendasil ha pedido.","Lendasil se encuentra en las ruinas de Edhelion, cerca de la Mansión de Thorin en Ered Luin, al oeste del Bosque de los Trolls.\
\
Lendasil te ha pedido que recojas una copa de vino blanco de Dorwinion para ella del viticultor Sogadan en Rivendel. Una vez que tengas el vino, llévaselo de vuelta al Refugio de Edhelion.","Lleva el vino blanco de Dorwinion a Lendasil","Se te ha encargado completar una entrega a un miembro de la Liga de las Posadas que se ha quedado varado lejos del festival esta temporada.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu bitácora de misiones cuando termine el festival actual. </rgb>","Un recuerdo de Rivendel","Has recogido el vino blanco de Dorwinion"}},
[716]={nameES="A Renewed Defence",objectivesES={"Talk to Hubryt","A Renewed Defence","Hubryt can be found in central Walstow.","Hubryt of Walstow is concerned that the town is vulnerable to attack from the increasingly present Orc forces. He has suggested that you use the supplies of the town to construct new barricades along its border.","Hubryt mentioned that ideal locations for new barricades can be found scattered along the outskirts of Walstow."}},
[717]={nameES="Un informe para Taeras",objectivesES={"Un informe para Taeras","Hay que llevar un informe de la actividad en Amon Firn al Montaraz Taeras.","Taeras te ha sugerido que hables con Edrud Scurloc.\
\
Edrud se encuentra en la granja de los Scurloc, en el noreste de Cardolan.","Habla con Taeras","Calargyl te ha pedido que le lleves un informe a Taeras sobre lo ocurrido en Amon Firn.\
\
Taeras se encuentra en la granja de los Scurloc, en el noreste de Cardolan.","Habla con Edrud"}},
[718]={nameES="A Report of Orcs",objectivesES={"You untie the scout captain and he runs to safety","Merenir is in Imloth Melui, and will want to hear about your encounter with the Orcs in Ost Norhír.","Talk to Merenir in Imloth Melui","A Report of Orcs","The scouting party was sent south-east of Imloth Melui, and intended to investigate the old ruin of Ost Norhír.\
\
Merenir has asked you to look for the scouting party he sent in search of Orcs, and to bring his men back if that proves possible.","Free the scout captain from Ost Norhír","A scouting party was dispatched to investigate Egind's story of Orcs in Lossarnach, and none of the scouts have returned.","Search for the scouting party at Ost Norhír, south-east of Imloth Melui","Orcs have made a camp within the ruins of Ost Norhír"}},
[719]={nameES="Una petición para los Hijos de la Tierra",objectivesES={"Asikko está en el campamento de los Hijos de la Tierra, situado bordeando las colinas al norte de la entrada este de Esteldín.\
\
Para cumplir su obligación con Puente de Caballetes, Gondranc te ha pedido que obtengas un libro de conocimientos sobre el trabajo del cuero que Asikko, jefe de los Hijos de la Tierra, le prometió.","Habla con Asikko","Una petición para los Hijos de la Tierra","Cuando Gondranc de Esteldín viajaba hacia el norte desde Rivendel, le había prometido a un hombre de Puente de Caballetes que les ayudaría proporcionándoles armaduras para usar contra los Orcos."}},
[720]={nameES="A Respectable Gift",objectivesES={"Leave the Gêta's hall","Wait to be invited inside the halls of Jiret-menêsh","Take the Ordâkhai treasure","You have spotted a chest filled with treasure inside a tent at Onabóha. You should take the treasure as a gift for Châmelek Gêta.","You have shown Mêshaget the treasure taken from the Ordâkhai at Onabóha. You should wait to be invited into Châmelek Gêta's halls to meet with her.","Talk to Mêshaget","You have taken a chest fat with treasure from the Ordâkhai at Onabóha. You should return to Jiret-menêsh and show it to Mêshaget.","Present the gift to Châmelek Gêta","Talk to Mêshaget at Jiret-menêsh","To make her more amenable to your presence, he suggests you bring her a gift, a treasure stolen from the Ordâkhai at Onabóha, their camp to the south of Jiret-menêsh. You should travel to Onabóha.","Mêshaget would like to present you to Châmelek Gêta, his grandmother and the leader of Jiret-menêsh.","You spot a chest loaded with treasure","You have found Onabóha","Search for a worthy gift","You have met Châmelek Gêta, Lord of Jiret-menêsh and Mêshaget's grandmother. You should talk to Mêshaget about the encounter.","Mêshaget wants to introduce you to Châmelek Gêta, the leader of Jiret-menêsh. You should talk to Châmelek Gêta and present her with the gift you brought.","You have met Châmelek Gêta, Lord of  Jiret-menêsh and Mêshaget's grandmother. You should exit the Gêta's hall.","Find Onabóha","Time to go!","A Respectable Gift","You have found Onabóha, the Ordâkhai camp near Jiret-menêsh. You should search the camp for treasure."}},
[721]={nameES="Un ritual respetable",objectivesES={"La cuerda se encuentra en un campamento de exploradores justo al sur de Pynti-peldot, en Forochel. El trineo debe ser prestado por Altti el trampero, en Jänis-leiri, el campamento del Maestro de la Caza situado junto al camino hacia el oeste. Las pieles gruesas pueden obtenerse de muchas criaturas en Itä-mâ y sus alrededores.\
\
Kaj te ha pedido ayuda para conseguir ciertos objetos que necesita para preparar su ritual.","Has recogido un rollo de cuerda","Kaj se encuentra en Pynti-peldot, en Forochel.\
\
Has reunido los componentes del ritual y deberías regresar con Kaj.","Pide prestado un trineo a Altti","Un ritual respetable","Recoge un rollo de cuerda","Trineo prestado","Kaj, hijo de Ora, la jefa de los Lossoth, desea llevar a cabo un ritual antiguo y venerable.","Lleva los componentes del ritual a Kaj"}},
[722]={nameES="Un descanso del miedo",objectivesES={"Tangwen te ha pedido que repartas el té a los aldeanos de Herne que se refugian en la Posada de la Encrucijada.\
\
Herne está en el centro de Cardolan.","Un descanso del miedo","Has ayudado a Tangwen a hacer un delicioso té con la esperanza de reconfortar a los aldeanos de Herne.","Vuelve con Tangwen","Deberías llevar las flores de halconherboso y la lavanda a Tangwen.\
\
Tangwen está en Herne en el oeste de Cardolan."}},
[723]={nameES="Una noche apacible",objectivesES={"Habla con Bingo en el Último Puente, al este de Ost Guruth","Una noche apacible","Las piernas de Bingo están cansadas de la caminata desde Ost Guruth, y quiere encontrar un buen lugar para pasar la noche. Te ha dicho que hables con él en el Último Puente cuando quieras buscar un buen lugar para acampar.","Habla con Bingo en el Bosque de los Trolls, al este del Último Puente, al norte del camino","Bingo está al norte del camino, a una corta distancia al este del Último Puente, en el Bosque de los Trolls.\
\
Bingo ha tenido una noche apacible, a diferencia de ti.","Bingo ha decidido continuar su viaje y dejar atrás las Tierras Solitarias, pasando a las boscosas colinas del Bosque de los Trolls.","Habla con Bingo en el Último Puente y encuentra un buen lugar para acampar","Bingo ha decidido reevaluar el rumbo cuando lleguéis al Último Puente, en la frontera entre las Tierras Solitarias y el Bosque de los Trolls."}},
[724]={nameES="A Return to Shonith",objectivesES={"Raphûz and Ashâmi intend to leave Urmâkh to return to Lathagwid. They ask that you go to Shonith to share your description with Lathagwid. She may know the foe you witnessed. Lathagwid can be found near the oasis in Shonith.","Lathagwid cannot recall such an enemy","Ashâmi has chosen a path to pursue, seek out Raphûz to learn his path","Speak with Raphûz in the oasis of Shonith","Speak with Lathagwid at Shonith and describe what you saw","Speak with Ashâmi in the oasis of Shonith","Ashâmi and Raphûz discussed the threat the cultist made and want to consult with the Elves of Shonith. They hope you will visit them there.","Lathagwid could not recall a foe in all her long life. She told Ashâmi and Raphûz there is a dead land north of Imhûlar but could recall nothing more. Seek out Ashâmi in Shonith to speak with her about Lathagwid's response.","A Return to Shonith","Ashâmi is frightened and inspired by what she heard and what you have seen. She asked for time to think apart from Raphûz and determine the path she wishes to follow. She hopes Raphûz feels the same. Seek Raphûz in Shonith.","Raphûz looks tired.\
\
'Hello, my friend.\
\
'Ashâmi asked for time to think. My decision was an easy one. I have learned my father's homeland has people who are fierce, independent, and beautiful.\
\
'I have learned the people of the north need not be our enemy.\
\
'When the cultist spoke, I felt the shadow of true evil. Something shook me deeply.\
\
'These things changed me. I cannot cast my eyes toward a goal that does not safe-guard all. There is some great work at hand. I will go to Maurush and seek to discern the evil we face.\
\
'I hope Ashâmi and I can do this together.'"}},
[725]={nameES="A Reunion",objectivesES={"Find Rodwen's sword","A Reunion","Rodwen is at Hestil's camp, near Parth Galen in the East Wall.\
\
You have recovered Rodwen's sword and should bring it to her.","Bring the sword to Rodwen","Rodwen lost her sword in a battle with the Orcs and would love to see it again, but she thinks it very unlikely.","Wilferth is at the Rohirrim-camp in the East Wall.\
\
You remember returning a high-quality blade of Gondorian make to Wilferth from the Orc that possessed it. Perhaps this was Rodwen's blade."}},
[726]={nameES="A Revel Too Far",objectivesES={"A Revel Too Far","The banquets of Imlad Lalaith are known throughout Lothlórien for their festive nature -- but even among the Elves, overindulgance can become a problem.\
\
Maliriel has asked you to help keep an eye on the guests, during the <rgb=#FF0000>evening revels</rgb> to ensure that matters do not get out of hand, as they are occasionally known to do.","During the <rgb=#FF0000>evening hours</rgb>, find revellers in Imlad Lalaith who have indulged overmuch in wine and have become too loud or boisterous and remind them of their manners.","Speak with Maliriel at Imlad Lalaith","You should speak with Maliriel at Imlad Lalaith."}},
[727]={nameES="Un acertijo en una botella",objectivesES={"Determina qué botella debes elegir","No estaba bueno, sea lo que sea","Era una bebida maravillosa","La bebida te ha revitalizado","Habla con Adalgrim Buenavista fuera del Agujero Embrujado","La entrada a la Sala de las Telas de Araña se encuentra al otro extremo de la Bodega Principal.\
\
Debes llegar a la entrada de la Sala de las Telas de Araña antes de que se acabe el tiempo.","Usa la pista dentro del Agujero Embrujado para determinar de qué botella beber (esto te ayudará a orientarte en el recorrido)","Llegaste a la entrada de la Sala de las Telas de Araña","Encuentra la puerta al Sótano","Se te ha acabado el tiempo","Llegaste a la entrada de la Sala Reptante","La botella azul contenía un líquido nocivo","Las botellas se encuentran en la entrada del Agujero Embrujado.\
\
Debes usar la botella correcta para llegar a la entrada de la Sala Reptante, ¡pero ten cuidado de qué botella bebes!","Encuentra la puerta de salida del sótano","Llegaste a la entrada del Sótano","Tres botellas se hallan ante ti,\
Mas sus colores no deben confundirte,\
Pues si primero bebes\
Y luego piensas,\
Descubrirás que te aventajo.\
\
Cuando nos presentaron, no estuve de acuerdo contigo en absoluto.\
Pero te ayudé en nuestro segundo encuentro, ¿verdad?\
La última vez que nos vimos, no parecí afectarte de ninguna manera.\
¿Cuál botella soy?","Ve a la entrada de la Sala Reptante","La puerta al sótano es la salida de la Sala Reptante.\
\
Debes buscar la salida de la Sala Reptante antes de que se acabe el tiempo.","Adalgrim Buenavista se encuentra fuera del Agujero Embrujado, cerca del Árbol de la Fiesta.\
\
Debes regresar con Adalgrim Buenavista para informarle de tu éxito en el juego de acertijos.","Usa la pista para determinar qué botella elegir","La salida hacia el Árbol de la Fiesta es la misma puerta por la que entraste al Agujero Embrujado.\
\
Debes encontrar el camino de vuelta a la Entrada Principal.","Llega a la puerta de la Sala de las Telas de Araña","Las botellas se encuentran en la entrada al Sótano del Agujero Embrujado.\
\
Debes usar la botella correcta para navegar hasta la salida del Sótano, ¡pero ten cuidado de qué botella bebes!","Tenía un sospechoso sabor a agua","La puerta a la Sala Reptante se encuentra en algn lugar de la Sala de las Telas de Araña.\
\
Debes llegar a la puerta de la Sala Reptante\
antes de que se acabe el tiempo.","Definitivamente esa no era una buena botella para beber","Las botellas se encuentran en la entrada de la Sala Reptante del Agujero Embrujado.\
\
Debes usar la botella correcta para navegar hasta la salida de la Sala Reptante, ¡pero ten cuidado de qué botella bebes!","Un acertijo en una botella","Tres botellas se hallan ante ti,\
Mas sus colores no deben confundirte,\
Pues si primero bebes\
Y luego piensas,\
Descubrirás que te aventajo.\
\
La Botella Correcta:\
Llora lágrimas doradas a la luz del alba,\
Forma un poderoso escudo en lo alto del sol,\
Al atardecer, la lluvia cae en cascada,\
De noche, duerme desnuda en el lecho que hizo.\
\
La Botella Naranja tiene grabado un Guerrero.\
La Botella Blanca tiene grabado un Árbol.\
La Botella Azul tiene grabado una Nube.","Tres botellas se hallan ante ti,\
Mas sus colores no deben confundirte,\
Pues si primero bebes\
Y luego piensas,\
Descubrirás que te aventajo.\
\
La Botella Correcta:\
Sobre él yacen tus pensamientos,\
ten cuidado;\
Susurra tan afilado como la hoja de un cuchillo.\
Bajo tu pluma reposada,\
cuidado;\
En ondas tu confianza es traicionada.\
\
La Botella Naranja tiene grabado papel.\
La Botella Blanca tiene grabado un águila.\
La Botella Azul tiene grabado un sombrero.","Sigue los acertijos a través del agujero antes de que se acabe el tiempo","Regresa a la entrada principal del Agujero Embrujado","No sabía a casi nada","Lee la pista para determinar qué botella usar","Adalgrim Buenavista se encontró desconcertado por los acertijos de Bilbo repartidos por todo el Agujero Embrujado.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando finalice el evento con el que está asociada. </rgb>","Solo era agua","Tres botellas se hallan ante ti,\
Mas sus colores no deben confundirte,\
Pues si primero bebes\
Y luego piensas,\
Descubrirás que te aventajo.\
\
La Botella Correcta:\
La única certeza es la muerte en batalla,\
Pues al clavar mi espada, la pierdo.\
Desde entonces, la dulce vida debe vivirse a plenitud.\
\
La Botella Naranja tiene grabado un ladrón.\
La Botella Blanca tiene grabado monedas de oro.\
La Botella Azul tiene grabado una abeja.","La puerta a la Bodega Principal se encuentra al otro extremo del sótano.\
\
Debes regresar a la Bodega Principal lo más rápido posible.","Sabía a agua","Las botellas de poción que te permitirán moverte por la Sala de las Telas de Araña se encuentran en la entrada de la sala.\
\
Debes examinar la pista y seleccionar la botella correcta."}},
[728]={nameES="Un acertijo en una ciudad antigua",objectivesES={"Deberías intentar resolver el acertijo de Falgeirr Lengua Retorcida:\
\
Siseo como el tocino, nazco de un huevo,\
Tengo espina dorsal, pero piernas no tengo,\
Mudo de piel como cebolla, más quedo entera,\
Y larga como un mástil, quepo en cualquier agujero.\
¿Qué soy?\
\
La solución al acertijo se encuentra en algún lugar de las Vetas de Plata.","Resuelve el acertijo de Lengua Retorcida","Falgeirr Lengua Retorcida, un enano con una gran afinción por los acertijos, dejó mensajes por toda Moria para aquellos que poseyeran la clave para resolver sus extrañas runas y enrevesadas palabras. Y tú tienes esa clave.","Has encontrado una placa con las extrañas runas de Falgeirr Lengua Retorcida, el autor de los documentos que hallaste en Katûb-zahar. Al traducirlas, dicen lo siguiente:\
\
Siseo como el tocino, nazco de un huevo\
Tengo espina dorsal, pero piernas no tengo.\
Mudo de piel como cebolla, más quedo entera,\
Y larga como un mástil, quepo en cualquier agujero.\
¿Qué soy?","El acertijo de Lengua Retorcida sigue sin resolverse","Un acertijo en una ciudad antigua","Has resuelto el acertijo de la Serpiente. Hay otra placa en la pared este de esta sala."}},
[729]={nameES="A Riding in Need",objectivesES={"Ordlac sent you to put an end to the treacherous brigands who murdered Reeve Fríthild, but upon returning to Stoke, you found Lúfa, Ordlac's wife, awaiting you at the gate.","Thane Torferth is at Tordag's encampment, north-west of Stoke.\
\
Lúfa bade you seek out the aid of young Thane Torferth of Torsbury.","Bring Thane Ordlac's token to Thane Torferth","A Riding in Need"}},
[730]={nameES="Un Buen Desastre",objectivesES={"Tras la caída de Sauron, Danghát está frustrado por la cantidad de restos y escombros en Cirith Ungol.","Un Buen Desastre","Has limpiado una gran cantidad de escombros de Cirith Ungol.","Has limpiado una gran cantidad de escombros de Cirith Ungol. Te parece que Danghát difícilmente se quejará al capitán Róglarg, dado que gran parte de Cirith Ungol está en ruinas.","Pueden encontrarse escombro por toda Cirith Ungol.\
\
Danghát te ha pedido que ayudes a limpiar escombros de Cirith Ungol.","Completado"}},
[731]={nameES="Una recuperación justa",objectivesES={"Una recuperación justa","Naerost se encuentra justo al este de Amon Sûl, al norte de Hunulf Mascador.\
\
Hunulf Mascador le ha pedido que localice y mate a los esbirros que custodian las reliquias empaquetadas para su envío y que devuelva tantas reliquias como pueda a los Eglain.","Hunulf espera su regreso en el extremo este de Minas Eriol, cerca del puente sobre el desfiladero.\
\
Debe regresar con las reliquias recuperadas a Hunulf Mascador.","A la sombra de Amon Sûl, en el límite de Nain Enidh, se encuentran las ruinas de Arnor. Esas ruinas proporcionaron a los Eglain una gran cantidad de materiales para comerciar con coleccionistas en las Tierras de Bree... hasta la llegada de semiorcos procedentes del sur.","Entrega las cajas robadas a Hunulf Mascador"}},
[732]={nameES="Un Anillo que Se Extravió",objectivesES={"Un Anillo que Se Extravió","La tierra aquí está intacta, quizás hacia el sudoeste.","Has obtenido el anillo de la Sombra.","La Sombra Errante merodea por las Quebradas de los Túmulos del norte.\
\
Has encontrado el anillo de la Sombra Errante y ahora deberías devolvérselo a su dueño.","El túmulo de la Sombra Errante está en las Quebradas de los Túmulos del norte.\
\
Tu investigación te condujo a un túmulo donde la tierra fue removida recientemente por el movimiento de la pesada puerta de piedra que da acceso a la tumba dentro del montículo. Deberías registrar el túmulo en busca de señales que vinculen a la sombra con este lugar.","Busca el túmulo de la Sombra Errante.","La tierra aquí está intacta, quizás hacia el noroeste.","La tierra aquí fue removida recientemente.","La tierra aquí está intacta, quizás hacia el norte.","Una sombra que se encontró vagando por las Quebradas de los Túmulos --que no parece tener malas intenciones-- sintió el llamado de su hermano y lucha por apaciguar la fuerza que ha regresado para despertarlos.","Entrega el anillo a la Sombra Errante en las Quebradas de los Túmulos.","La tierra aquí está intacta, quizás hacia el oeste.","La tierra parece intacta; ve hacia el sur.","Tan críptico como parezca, la sombra está buscando algo. Quizás puedas registrar los muchos Túmulos a lo largo de las Quebradas de los Túmulos del norte en busca de pistas."}},
[733]={nameES="A Ring of Power?",objectivesES={}},
[734]={nameES="Un río lo atraviesa",objectivesES={"Los hobbits celebran el Festival del Lithe. Para ayudarles en su celebración, los enanos de la Mansión de Thorin te permiten capturar peces y llevárselos.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando finalice el festival actual.</rgb>","Un río lo atraviesa","Atrapa tantos peces como puedas en veinte minutos","Se puede pescar en el río que atraviesa la Mansión de Thorin.\
\
Láfi te ha dado algo de tiempo para capturar peces para el Festival del Lithe."}},
[735]={nameES="Un Camino Poco Transitado",objectivesES={"Nestael se encuentra en Echad Candelleth, el campamento élfico en Tâl Bruinen, justo al otro lado de la colina al sureste del puesto de Haradir.\
\
Haradir te pidió que te presentaras ante Nestael en Echad Candelleth, y ella te indicará cómo puedes ayudar.","Tras tu derrota del hombre demacrado Gúrdring en Nan Tornaeth, Elrohir te habló de Echad Candelleth, un campamento élfico en Tâl Bruinen, y te sugirió ofrecer ayuda a quienes lo custodian.","Echad Candelleth se encuentra en lo alto de una colina en Tâl Bruinen, al sureste de Thorenhad. Elrohir te dijo que tomes el sendero de tierra hacia el sur mientras asciende las colinas sobre la orilla occidental del río. Te aconsejó prestar mucha atención al camino, pues está cubierto de maleza y cruzado por arroyos, pero comentó que podrías encontrar un explorador a lo largo de él para guiarte al campamento.\
\
Elrohir te ha pedido ayudar a los Elfos de Echad Candelleth en su labor de mantener Tâl Bruinen libre de peligros.","Echad Candelleth se alza en lo alto de una colina en Tâl Bruinen, al sureste de Thorenhad. Elrohir te dijo que fueras hacia el este siguiendo el camino principal hasta el Bruinen, donde encontrarás otra piedra blanca marcadora.\
\
Elrohir te indicó que viajaras a Echad Candelleth para ayudar a la compañía de Candelleth, mientras él y Elladan informan a su padre de las amenazas que descubriste en Nan Tornaeth.","Un Camino Poco Transitado","Habla con un explorador elfo en Tâl Bruinen","Busca la piedra blanca que indica el sendero hacia Tâl Bruinen","Las marcas en esta piedra indican que debes tomar el sendero de tierra que parte hacia el sur desde el camino y asciende la colina.","Habla con Nestael"}},
[736]={nameES="A Road to Danger",objectivesES={"Speak with Galâmka","Speak with Galâmka in Ub Nishir.","Reach Ub Nishir to the north of Maurûsh","A Road to Danger","Found Ub Nishir","Reach Ub Nishir, the camp to the north of Maurûsh and speak with Galâmka","Sûzakh has given you directions to a hideout where you can learn more about the situation in Urash Dâr."}},
[737]={nameES="Un descanso en el camino",objectivesES={"Vuelve con Ivoreth con las zanahorias que has recogido","Las zanahorias silvestres crecen en una colina al sur de la ubicación de Ivoreth en el Ángulo del Mitheithel. Recoge zanahorias silvestres para unirte a Ivoreth a comer.","Ivoreth, la madre del Montaraz Halbarad, viaja a Tham Lumren y se ha detenido en el camino para descansar y comer. Te ha pedido que te unas a ellos y busques algunas zanahorias silvestres para que haya comida suficiente para todos.","Un descanso en el camino","Has recogido zanahorias silvestres para compartir la comida con Ivoreth. Deberías volver con ella a su campamento en el Ángulo del Mitheithel."}},
[738]={nameES="A Rocky Obstacle",objectivesES={}},
[739]={nameES="A Rough Road to Iáphel",objectivesES={"A Rough Road to Iáphel","Talk to Luingil in Echad Lendir","Luingil has asked you to clear the road north of Neekerbreekers and lynx.","Luingil is concerned about the fauna that presents a natural obstacle along their journey to Iáphel.","You have cleared a path on the central road to Iáphel in Pinnath Gelin.\
\
You should report your progress to Luingil in Echad Lendir."}},
[740]={nameES="Una ruta por Allende",objectivesES={"El jefe de correos Ganapié se encuentra fuera del Servicio Postal Rápido de Cavada Grande.\
\
El alcalde Will Pieblanco ha autorizado al jefe de correos Ganapié a modificar la ruta a Nobotella. Ahora comienza en Cavada Grande, pasa por Cavada Pequeña y sigue el camino hacia el norte hasta la Comarca Allende. Debes informar al jefe de correos Ganapié de la decisión del alcalde.","El cartero Cavada se encuentra fuera del Servicio Postal Rápido de Nobotella, en la Comarca Allende.\
\
Has logrado entregar el correo más reciente a la Comarca Allende y has burlado los planes del supuesto \\qOficial en Jefe\\q para tomar el control del Servicio Postal Rápido. Debes hablar con el cartero Cavada.","Esperando poner fin al autoproclamado \\qOficial en Jefe\\q y a la conspiración para tomar el control del Servicio Postal Rápido, el alcalde Will Pieblanco ha autorizado al jefe de correos Ganapié a tomar medidas drásticas para restaurar el servicio en la Comarca Allende.","Cuando entras en el Servicio Postal Rápido, Ónice Cotobajo te saluda","Habla con el jefe de correos Ganapié en Cavada Grande","Recoge las bolsas de Ónice Cotobajo dentro del Servicio Postal Rápido de Cavada Grande","Recoge el morral de la mesa del encargado de correos Ganapié","Una ruta por Allende","Ónice Cotobajo se encuentra dentro del Servicio Postal Rápido de Cavada Grande.\
\
El jefe de correos Ganapié te ha pedido que recojas las bolsas para la Comarca Allende de Ónice Cotobajo dentro del Servicio Postal Rápido de Cavada Grande.","La ruta revisada a Nobotella comienza en Cavada Grande, continúa hacia Cavada Pequeña y sigue el camino hacia el norte hasta la Comarca Allende.\
\
La bolsa de correo para la Comarca Allende se encuentra sobre la mesa del jefe de correos Ganapié, fuera del Servicio Postal Rápido de Cavada Grande. Debes llevar la bolsa al cartero Cavada en Nobotella.","Habla con Ónice Cotobajo en el Servicio Postal Rápido de Cavada Grande","Ónice Cotobajo se encuentra dentro del Servicio Postal Rápido de Cavada Grande.\
\
El jefe de correos Ganapié te ha pedido que recojas las bolsas para la Comarca Allende de Ónice Cotobajo dentro del Servicio Postal Rápido de Cavada Grande. Debes hablar con Ónice Cotobajo.","Habla con el cartero Cavada en Nobotella"}},
[741]={nameES="Una Runa de Restauración",objectivesES={"Gaelnath debería encontrarse en las Fundaciones de Piedra, muy al este de la Mansión de Thorin.\
\
Dwalin te indicó que recuperaras la piedra rúnica enana de la araña Gaelnath y se la llevaras a Márus.","Recoge la piedra rúnica de Gaelnath","Una Runa de Restauración","La araña Gaelnath ha robado una antigua piedra rúnica de fabricación enana.","Habla con Márus en el Refugio Sombrio","Piedra rúnica recogida"}},
[742]={nameES="Una Runa de Restauración: Echando una Mano",objectivesES={"Muchos Maestros Rúnicos buscan la Runa de Restauración, pero no todos pueden alcanzar sus metas por sí solos.","Ríon está justo afuera de la Decimosexta Sala.\
\
Debes regresar con Ríon e informarle de tu éxito.","Habla con Ríon fuera de la Decimosexta Sala","Helegfan se encuentra en la Decimosexta Sala, en el extremo sureste de Nud-Melek, justo al norte de las Fundaciones de Piedra.\
\
Ríon te ha indicado que ayudes a tus compañeros Maestros Rúnicos con su tarea final en el camino hacia obtener una Runa de Restauración.","Helefgan ha sido derrotado","Una Runa de Restauración: Echando una Mano","Derrota a Helegfan"}},
[743]={nameES="A Rushed Rescue",objectivesES={"The captured raft-elf is somewhere in Esgaroth-of-old.\
\
You should find the captured raft-elf.","Defeated Blengur","The raft-elf is in danger!","A Rushed Rescue","Talk to Mervárth","Find the captured raft-elf","Blengur can be found in Esgaroth-of-old.\
\
You should defeat Blengur.","Talk to the captured raft-elf","One of the raft-elves has been kidnapped by smugglers in Esgaroth-of-old. Rescue him before it's too late!","Mervárth is standing guard outside Esgaroth-of-old.\
\
You should talk to Mervárth.","The captured raft-elf can be found in Esgaroth-of-old.\
\
You should talk to the captured raft-elf.","Defeat Blengur"}},
[744]={nameES="A Ruthless End",objectivesES={}},
[745]={nameES="El saco de comida",objectivesES={"Belco Tejonera encontró una copia del Texto fundacional de la Comarca, pero no la entregará hasta que reciba algunos servicios a cambio.","Recoge el saco de comida","El saco de comida","El saco de comida se encuentra en la granja al norte de Hobbiton. Una vez que hayas recogido la comida, llévasela a Belco en Alforzaburgo.\
\
Belco te ha dicho que su cerda, la vieja Sally, tiene un apetito voraz y que necesita más comida si quiere satisfacerla. Te ha pedido que vayas a la granja y recojas un saco de comida."}},
[746]={nameES="Un ungüento para las picaduras",objectivesES={"Un ungüento para las picaduras","Los sapos se pueden encontrar en el Pantano de los Juncos, al oeste de Sobrecolina, más allá de Hobbiton, y también en el pantano justo al norte de los Ranales. Gammer Boffin está en Sobrecolina, una ciudad enclavada en el Bosque del Fardo.\
\
Antes de que puedas buscar nuevas reinas para las colmenas del granjero Ganapié, te envió a ver a Gammer Boffin para que te consiguiera un ungüento que te protegiera de las picaduras de las abejas salvajes; sin embargo, Gammer Boffin no tiene todos los ingredientes que necesita para preparar el ungüento. Te ha pedido que recojas algunas piedras de sapo para el ungüento.","Lleva las piedras de sapo a Gammer Boffin","El granjero Polo Ganapié necesita nuevas reinas de abeja para reemplazar a las que fueron asesinadas por osos. Antes de que puedas ir a buscar colmenas salvajes, necesitarás un ungüento para protegerte de las picaduras de abeja.","Gammer Boffin está en Sobrecolina, a una distancia considerable al norte de Alforzaburgo, al otro lado de Hobbiton.\
\
Antes de que puedas recoger nuevas reinas de abeja para el granjero Ganapié, necesitarás obtener los medios para protegerte de las picaduras de las abejas salvajes. Ganapié te dijo que consiguieras un ungüento especial de Gammer Boffin."}},
[747]={nameES="A Sample of Corruption",objectivesES={}},
[748]={nameES="A Sample of Ore",objectivesES={"Gâthlata lies to the south-east of Mithecad.\
\
Scattered throughout the small camp of Gâthlata, several piles of ore can be found. Eirien has asked you to collect a few samples of the ore and bring it back to her.","The Orcs of the Ashenslades have stockpiled ore at the camp of Gâthlata, awaiting shipment up to Dol Guldur.","Talk to Eirien at Mithechad","A Sample of Ore","Eirien is at Mithechad, north-west of Gâthlata.\
\
You should return the samples of ore to Eirien."}},
[749]={nameES="A Sapling Grows in the Ettenmoors",objectivesES={"While wandering through the woods of the Ettenmoors you discovered a sapling shaking in the soil. Odd, that a little sapling would move while you drew near. You investigate.","This was unexpected. Try once more to collect the sapling. Faranil, in Glân Vraig, wants to study the trembling little sapling.","You deliver the sapling to Faranil","Speak with Faranil at Glân Vraig","Search the Ettenmoors for the tremor that stirred the earth, collect it and return it to Faranil at Glân Vraig.","Find the source of the tremor Faranil felt","Having delivered the sapling to Faranil, you should now speak with the horticulturist to see what she may know of this little sapling.","Collect and deliver the sapling to Faranil at Glân Vraig","A Sapling Grows in the Ettenmoors","You attempted to extract the sapling"}},
[750]={nameES="A Sapling Grows in the Ettenmoors",objectivesES={}},
[751]={nameES="A Satchel Full of Secrets",objectivesES={}},
[752]={nameES="A Savvy Assistant",objectivesES={}},
[753]={nameES="A Scarf-wearing Snowman",objectivesES={}},
[754]={nameES="A Scattered Herd",objectivesES={}},
[755]={nameES="A Scholar's Fears",objectivesES={"Lieutenant Unferth wishes you to find books from the libraries of Rhudaur to support his fears. The more he learns from recovered notes and tomes, the more he believes that there is something within the Ettenmoors that the army of Angmar seeks.","A Scholar's Fears","The books and tomes Unferth desires may be carried by Orcs, Uruks, and possibly even goblins or trolls, which can be found throughout the Ettenmoors.\
\
Lieutenant Unferth has asked you to collect any books or tomes which might uncover what Angmar seeks in the Ettenmoors.","Talk to Lieutenant Unferth"}},
[756]={nameES="La lección de un erudito",objectivesES={"Coloca el jarrón reconstruido en la mesa de exposición","Colocas el jarrón en la mesa de exposición","La lección de un erudito","Glorenglir está en Rivendel y una mesa cercana sería un lugar adecuado para colocar el jarrón que te han dado.\
\
El erudito Deluros te ha pedido que pongas el jarrón que reconstruyó en la mesa cerca de Glorenglir, observes sus reacciones y luego vuelvas con él.","El erudito Deluros está en la biblioteca de la Casa de Elrond en Rivendel.\
\
Deluros espera saber si Glorenglir reconoció el jarrón que reconstruyó.","El erudito Deluros ha reconstruido un antiguo jarrón con los fragmentos que recuperaste en las Montañas Nubladas y busca enseñar una nueva lección a Glorenglir."}},
[757]={nameES="A Scholar's Request",objectivesES={"Habla con Grimbeorn","Léothred can be found at the front gate of the Beorninghús.\
\
You should talk to Léothred.","Grimbeorn can be found at the Beorninghús.\
\
You should talk to Grimbeorn.","Talk to Léothred","A Scholar's Request","Talk to Léothred at the front gate of the Beorninghús","Léothred, a Rohirric scholar, has arrived at the Beorninghús, seeking permission to travel the through the Vales."}},
[758]={nameES="A Scholar's Woe",objectivesES={}},
[759]={nameES="Un Explorador en las Gargantas del Bruinen",objectivesES={"Muchos exploradores fueron enviados a lo largo del Bosque de los Trolls para vigilar cualquier señal de maldad, y los hijos de Elrond desean saber si se ha descubierto algo.","Arrod vigila desde algún punto de las Gargantas del Bruinen, al sureste de Thorenhad, en una posición desde la que puede observar el camino.\
\
Narlinn te ha pedido que verifiques el estado de Arrod, quien actualmente explora las Gargantas del Bruinen, aunque probablemente esté más enfocado en cortejar a la doncella Elfa Faimir.","Un Explorador en las Gargantas del Bruinen"}},
[760]={nameES="Un explorador en Nan Tornaeth",objectivesES={"Habla con Calenthon","Busca la piedra blanca que marca el sendero correcto","Muchos exploradores fueron enviados a lo largo del Bosque de los Trolls para vigilar cualquier señal de maldad, y los hijos de Elrond desean saber si se ha descubierto algo.","Calenthon está en su campamento, al que se llega siguiendo el sendero hacia el norte en dirección a Ost Thondol y tomando la senda noroeste en la bifurcación.\
\
Elrohir sugirió que contaras con la ayuda de Calenthon para encontrar el origen del mal que ha agitado a las sierpes de Nan Tornaeth.","Se pueden encontrar sierpes en Nan Tornaeth, en el camino hacia el campamento de Calenthon, al que se llega siguiendo el sendero hacia el norte en dirección a Ost Thondol y tomando la senda noroeste en la primera bifurcación. Elrohir dijo que buscaras la piedra blanca que marca el inicio del sendero.\
\
Elrohir sugirió que derrotaras a varias sierpes en tu trayecto hacia Calenthon, con la esperanza de que pudieras encontrar alguna pista sobre la identidad del mal que los ha llevado a la locura.","Este debe de ser el sendero correcto hacia el campamento de Calenthon.","Un explorador en Nan Tornaeth"}},
[761]={nameES="Un Explorador en el Norte del Bosque de los Trolls",objectivesES={"Thoroniel está al sur de las Tierras Tejidas, un nido de arañas particularmente denso en la esquina noroeste del Norte del Bosque de los Trolls. Rochwen te dijo que tomes el camino hacia el este hasta la piedra marcadora y luego te desvíes hacia el norte para adentrarte en lo salvaje.\
\
Rochwen te ha pedido que ayudes a Thoroniel, que actualmente explora un nido de arañas en el Norte del Bosque de los Trolls. Deberías llevar aliados contigo.","Un Explorador en el Norte del Bosque de los Trolls","Muchos exploradores fueron enviados por todo el Bosque de los Trolls para vigilar cualquier signo de maldad.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Nota: Este arco de misiones está pensado para una comunidad completa.</rgb>","Habla con Thoroniel en el Norte del Bosque de los Trolls"}},
[762]={nameES="A Search for Answers",objectivesES={"Find Frethi the Explorer","The Secret Stone was originally found in Moria, so that is where you must begin your search for answers.\
\
You should travel to Moria and find Frethi the Explorer.","Many secrets still lie hidden within the Foundations of Stone.\
\
You should search for a clue to the origin of the Secret Stone with Frethi.","Find a clue to the origin of the Secret Stone","A Search for Answers","The switch reveals a hidden door!","Talk to Frethi","Enter the 'Secret Chamber' with Frethi","Frethi is investigating the Crown Chamber within the Foundations of Stone.\
\
You should talk to Frethi.","You have discovered the door to a secret chamber in the Foundations of Stone.\
\
You should enter the 'Secret Chamber' with Frethi.","By order of King Thorin Stonehelm, you must venture deep into Moria and discover the true purpose of the Secret Stone.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>This difficult treasure hunt will require community teamwork and resources outside of the game itself. Good luck!</rgb>"}},
[763]={nameES="A Search for Survivors",objectivesES={}},
[764]={nameES="Un Segundo Desafío",objectivesES={"Alla vitorea mientras te acercas.","Habla con Alla en el noreste de Musgovilla.","Alla está junto a un pajar en el noreste de Musgovilla. ¡Solo tienes cinco minutos para el viaje de regreso!","Alla te ha dado cinco minutos para llegar al lugar indicado a lo largo del camino, con vista de Tharbad.","Alla ha recibido un segundo desafío por parte del bravucón de Musgovilla, y necesita tu ayuda otra vez.","Llega al lugar marcado a lo largo del camino a Tharbad sin quedarte sin tiempo.","Este es el lugar que Alla describió. Qué extraño: una pala está abandonada en la tierra aquí.","Alla está junto a un pajar en el noreste de Musgovilla.","Un Segundo Desafío","<rgb=#FF0000>No te quedes sin tiempo antes de llegar al lugar correcto</rgb>","Regresa con Alla en el noreste de Musgovilla sin quedarte sin tiempo.","Se te ha acabado el tiempo"}},
[765]={nameES="Un segundo intento",objectivesES={"Mostraste tus bíceps al capataz Indrith","Las Obras Hidráulicas son un sitio de importancia para los enanos que desean permanecer en Moria. Uno de esos enanos, el capataz Indrith, se ha propuesto reparar el canal allí.","Indrith el capataz se encuentra en la Casa de la Rueda, bajo la Gran Rueda.\
\
Indrith quiere asegurarse de que eres lo suficientemente fuerte para ayudarlo a girar la rueda. Tal vez deberías <rgb=#FF0000>flexionar</rgb> para él.","Espera a que el capataz Indrith gire la rueda","Indrith el capataz se encuentra en la Casa de la Rueda, bajo la Gran Rueda.\
\
Después de mostrarle al capataz que eras lo suficientemente fuerte, de lo cual dudaba, ambos intentaron girar la rueda detrás de él. Se escuchó un ruido terrible y el capataz parecía desconcertado.","Acércate a la rueda para ayudar al capataz Indrith","Indrith el capataz se encuentra en la Casa de la Rueda, bajo la Gran Rueda.\
\
Indrith te ha pedido que lo ayudes a girar la rueda.","Habla con el capataz Indrith en la Casa de la Rueda","Un segundo intento","Muestra al capataz Indrith lo fuerte que eres <rgb=#FF0000>flexionando</rgb>"}},
[766]={nameES="Un plan secundario",objectivesES={"Un plan secundario","Has creado una distracción lo suficientemente grande como para que Meriona y sus exploradores lleven a cabo su misión.\
\
Deberías hablar con Meriona a las afueras de Nímbarth.","Habla con Meriona","Habla con Riderch en el campamento de Siempreviva","Debes acabar con semiorcos en Nímbarth para crear una distracción para Meriona y sus exploradores.","A pesar de las sospechas iniciales, los dunlendinos han decidido informarte sobre la situación.","Deberías volver a Tharbad a decirle a Riderch que sus hombres están a salvo.\
\
El campamento de Siempreviva está al sudoeste de Nímbarth."}},
[767]={nameES="Un club secreto",objectivesES={"Los saqueadores de todo Eriador se consideran miembros de un club secreto, una hermandad exclusiva de quienes practican el arte del sigilo.","Ponto Avena se encuentra en la aldea de Avenal.\
\
Ponto te espera para hablar sobre su plan para ocuparse del bandido de mal genio en Dwaling.","Un club secreto","Un saqueador llamado Ponto se encuentra en algún lugar de Avenal, la aldea hobbit en el extremo norte de la Comarca, casi en Evendim.\
\
Te han dicho que encuentres a un saqueador llamado Ponto, en algún lugar de Avenal.","Habla con Ponto Avena y viaja a Dwaling","Ponto Avena se encuentra en la aldea de Avenal.\
\
Ponto está esperando para hablar contigo sobre el robo del garrote del bandido."}},
[768]={nameES="A Semblance of Revenge",objectivesES={}},
[769]={nameES="A Sense of Home",objectivesES={}},
[770]={nameES="A Sense of the Past",objectivesES={}},
[771]={nameES="Una sombra de azul",objectivesES={"Lleva los guijarros deslustrados a Waldo Cerrohueco en Dwaling","Los guijarros deslustrados pueden encontrarse en posesión de los trasgos de la Cresta de la Hoja Sombría, al sur de Dwaling.\
\
Waldo Cerrohueco te ha pedido que consigas quijarros deslustrados de los trasgos que los han sacado del Brandivino.","Waldo Cerrohueco está en casa de Hob Cimacolina, justo en el exterior de Dwaling.\
\
Waldo Cerrohueco estará impaciente de ver los guijarros deslustrados que has conseguido para él.","Una sombra de azul","Los guijarros azules pueden machacarse para conseguir un polvo que hace que el vidrio parezca agua."}},
[772]={nameES="A Shadow Cast By Sea",objectivesES={"Talk to Hadorion in the Lower Ward","Hadorion plans to spread wild rumours about Khâshap in order to draw him out. The first step is to place these posters around the city to publicly paint a target on his back.","Hadorion has been pursuing a Corsair by the name of Khâshap since he showed in Anfalas. His pursuit has led him to the city of Umbar.","A Shadow Cast By Sea","There hang posters all around the Lower Ward of the city. This should create a stir amongst the residents. You should tell Hadorion.\
\
Hadorion can be found in the Lower Ward."}},
[773]={nameES="Una sombra en el campamento",objectivesES={"Burgûl-stazg se encuentra al noroeste de Echad Mothelen.\
\
Mothelen te ha pedido que reúnas información de los trasgos nerviosos que encuentres en Burgûl-stazg. Sin embargo, te ha advertido que evites que te detecten los guardias del campamento de trasgos.","Los desertores trasgos que deambulan por los Troncosombríos indicaban que algo que tramaban sus lideres en Burgûl-stazg era la causa de su deserción.","Descubre el misterio de Burgûl-stazg","Habla con Mothelen en Echad Mothelen","Mothelen está en Echad Mothelen, al sureste de Burgûl-stazg.\
\
Debes llevar la nota del desertor a Mothelen e informarle de lo que has averiguado.","Has encontrado la nota de un desertor","Una sombra en el campamento"}},
[774]={nameES="A Shameful Loss",objectivesES={"Saeradan is at the Rohirrim scout-camp in the Gravenwood of Dunland.\
\
Saeradan has spoken with the Rohirrim and is waiting upon you.","Talk to Saeradan to receive the pick-axe","When Saeradan asked you to search near the Mustering Tree and the Tree of Tribute for signs of other evil tokens, he gave you a pick-axe with which to dig them up... which you promptly lost.","Use the pick-axe in your inventory to accept the quest Seeking a Solution, then complete it","The Tree of Tribute lies to the west of the Rohirrim Scout-camp.\
\
You should return to the Tree of Tribute and complete the task Saeradan set before you.","Completed Seeking a Solution","A Shameful Loss"}},
[775]={nameES="A Shape on the Shore",objectivesES={}},
[776]={nameES="Un Escudo contra la Adversidad",objectivesES={"Oswin Leek está en la puerta norte de Bree.\
\
Has hecho lo que Oswin Leek pidió, y la granja de Burle Pierson está a salvo de los bandidos. El guardián Leek espera hablar contigo.","Un guardián formidable se reconoce por las cicatrices que lleva y las abolladuras en su armadura, pues siempre está al frente de la batalla, protegiendo a los suyos del peligro.","Burle Pierson está en su granja al sur de Bree.\
\
El formidable guardián Oswin Leek te ha pedido que ayudes a Burle Pierson a defender su granja de las incursiones cada vez más frecuentes de los bandidos.","Habla con Burle Pierson","El formidable guardián Oswin Leek está fuera de la puerta norte de Bree.\
\
Se te ha indicado que hables con Oswin Leek para recibir más instrucción en el camino del guardián.","Has defendido con éxito la Granja de Pierson","Un Escudo contra la Adversidad"}},
[777]={nameES="A Shiny Bauble",objectivesES={}},
[778]={nameES="La lista de la compra",objectivesES={"Daisy Arenas está en su puesto en la Feria de los Granjeros de Delagua.\
\
Vuelve con Daisy Arenas de inmediato con los productos que conseguiste.","Reúne los productos de la lista de la compra","Lleva los productos a Daisy Arenas","Eso no está en la lista...","El mercado está muy concurrido, y muchos clientes en los puestos de venta tienen listas de la compra que deben completarse.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando finalice el evento con el que está asociada.</rgb>","Los productos de la lista de la compra se pueden encontrar por toda Delagua durante la Feria de los Granjeros. La lista está en tu inventario.\
\
Recoge los productos de la lista de la compra... ¡pero evita los que no estén en ella!","La lista de la compra"}},
[779]={nameES="Una Escasez de Botas",objectivesES={"Una Escasez de Botas","Santmereth se encuentra en el Jardín del Festival de Duillond.\
\
Debes informarle a Santmereth que el envío de botas está nuevamente en camino gracias a tu ayuda al zapatero.","Has ayudado a Deluraw con una tarea","El evento de Pisoteo de Musarañas se está quedando sin las botas especiales no dañinas necesarias para repeler musarañas del Jardín del Festival de Duillond.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro cuando finalice el festival actual.</rgb>","El zapatero suele encontrarse cerca de los hornos de Duillond.\
\
Debes hablar con él para averiguar qué está retrasando su próximo envío.","Informa a Santmereth que el envío de botas vuelve a estar en marcha","Ayuda a Deluraw recolectando madera","Ayuda a Deluraw recolectando cordel","Ayuda a Deluraw recolectando fibras de lino"}},
[780]={nameES="Escasez de hierro",objectivesES={"Escasez de hierro","Para reparar los puentes de las Profundidades Llameantes, los enanos necesitan hierro para forjar refuerzos y soportes.","Se pueden encontrar espadas de los Ghâsh-hai en los propios Ghâsh-hai que merodean por las Profundidades Llameantes.\
\
Ulfied necesita espadas de los Ghâsh-hai para fundirlas y así obtener el hierro necesario para fabricar los soportes de reparación de los puentes.","Lleva las espadas de los Ghâsh-hai a Ulfied en el Cruce de las Cenizas","Ulfied está en el Cruce de las Cenizas, en la parte suroeste de las Profundidades Llameantes.\
\
Ulfied querrá comenzar a fundir las espadas de los Ghâsh-hai lo antes posible."}},
[781]={nameES="Un Tiro en la Oscuridad",objectivesES={"Answith is encamped near the tower west of Brôntrig.\
\
You should speak with Answith when you are ready to depart for Brôntrig.","Un Tiro en la Oscuridad","Ardwyn is at Forthbrond, north of Brôntrig.\
\
You should return to Ardwyn and speak with him regarding the defeat of the Rohirrim at Brôntrig.","Talk to Answith","Talk to Ardwyn at Forthbrond","The Rohirrim forces prepare to launch a pre-emptive strike against the village of Brôntrig in hopes of confounding the Dunlendings' own attack plans."}},
[782]={nameES="A Show of Force",objectivesES={}},
[783]={nameES="A Show of Goodwill",objectivesES={"Bring the trinkets to Girhâzi","You have collected proof that you have defeated eight Ordâkhai soldiers. You should bring the trinkets to Girhâzi in Iridír.","There is an Ordâkhai camp to the north-east of Iridír. You have been asked to go there and collect proof that you have defeated eight soldiers.","Girhâzi has asked you to prove that you are not her enemy by defeating Ordâkhai soldiers.","A Show of Goodwill"}},
[784]={nameES="A Shredded Bag",objectivesES={}},
[785]={nameES="Un resplandor enfermizo",objectivesES={"Observas una gran cantidad de gusanos extrañamente brillantes arrastrándose por los pies de los árboles de piedra en Nud-melek.","Los gusanos de las profundidades se encuentran en la Segunda sala de Nud-melek.\
\
Debes derrotar a los gusanos de las profundidades.","El ícor se encuentra en los gusanos de las profundidades de Nud-melek, en el lado oriental de la Segunda sala.\
\
Debes recoger el ícor de los gusanos de las profundidades.","Observas una gran cantidad de gusanos extrañamente brillantes arrastrándose por los pies de los árboles de piedra en Nud-melek.\
\
Deberías ver si el ícor de estos gusanos tiene propiedades luminescentes que podrían ser útiles para la expedición de los enanos.","Un resplandor enfermizo","Completado","Has recogido el valioso ícor brillante de varios gusanos luminosos, suficiente para recubrir varias lámparas.","Recolección de ícor de gusanos de las profundidades"}},
[786]={nameES="Un remedio sencillo",objectivesES={"Lleva la sal a Väinö","Un remedio sencillo","Muy al oeste, en Länsi-mâ, hay fuentes termales alrededor de las cuales pueden encontrarse rocas cubiertas de sal. Reúne sal de esas rocas y llévala de regreso a Väinö, en Norsu-leiri.","Regresa junto a Väinö en Norsu-leiri con la sal que hayas recogido.","La sal calcárea es una exportación esencial que los Lossoth de la Tundra Occidental comercian con los constructores de trineos de nieve del sur. La sal se utiliza para curtir tiras de cuero crudo, que se emplean como hilo."}},
[787]={nameES="Un vino sencillo",objectivesES={"Has recogido un vaso de Vino del Brandivino","Un vino sencillo","Has recogido Vino del Brandivino","Recoge un vaso de Vino del Brandivino","Saerthuithel se encuentra en Echad Candelleth, en Tâl Bruinen, lejos al este de la Comarca.\
\
Saerthuithel te ha pedido que le lleves un vaso de \\qVino del Brandivino\\q de la Perca Dorada. Una vez que tengas el vino, llévaselo de vuelta.","Recoge el Vino del Brandivino en la Perca Dorada","Se te ha encargado completar una entrega a un miembro de la Liga de las Posadas que se ha quedado varado lejos del festival esta temporada.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu bitácora de misiones cuando termine el festival actual. </rgb>","La Posada de la Perca Dorada se encuentra en el pueblo de Cepeda, en la Comarca.\
\
Deberías recoger un poco de Vino del Brandivino en la Perca Dorada para entregárselo a Saerthuithel.","Lleva el Vino del Brandivino a Saerthuithel"}},
[788]={nameES="A Sister's Concern",objectivesES={"Find Agalûnu","Kalkhadra asked you to go to Arwáth and check on Agalûnu. Arwáth is a forest in the northernmost reaches of Ambarûl.","You have found Agalûnu. You should talk to her and see if she is all right.","Talk to Agalûnu","Kalkhadra's sister, Agalûnu, has gone to the haunted forest of Arwáth and has not returned.","You have found Agalûnu","A Sister's Concern"}},
[789]={nameES="A Sister's Request",objectivesES={"A Sister's Request","Gella asked you to gather lavender anemones near the pond and white anemones near the keep in Lond Cirion.","Gella has asked you to gather some white and purple flowers for a crown she is making.","Bring the flowers to Gella by the pond in Lond Cirion"}},
[790]={nameES="A Slithering Menace",objectivesES={}},
[791]={nameES="A Small Act of Kindness",objectivesES={}},
[792]={nameES="A Small Hope",objectivesES={"A Small Hope","Avadhril asks you to look for seeds untouched by the Lâg Dávrit. She has previously had good luck scavenging unblemished seeds near Shakhdag and Tir Katar, among the wild servals and boars.","Return to Avadhril in Vartúlin with the seeds you've gathered","Return to Avadhril in Vartúlin with the seeds you've gathered.","Avadhril asks you to gather acorns and berry seeds untouched by the Lâg Dávrit in Shakhdag and Tir Katar. Shakhdag is north-east of Vartúlin. Tir Katar is directly north of Vartúlin."}},
[793]={nameES="A Small Task",objectivesES={"Maukatish can be found at Thorzhaf.\
\
You should speak with Maukatish.","Sleeping Orcs can be found in Thorzhaf.\
\
You should complete the tasks that Maukatish has given you.","Slop and drink tables can be found in Thorzhaf.\
\
You should complete the tasks that Maukatish has given you.","An Uruk in charge of the list of fighters for the pit-fighting tournament has a system of rules and is hard to sway.","Talk to Maukatish","A Small Task"}},
[794]={nameES="A Small Thing",objectivesES={"You found the pendant inside the coffer","Return the pendant to Sikût at Khanâg Gur","You have arrived at Zakhûr. Sikût has asked you to look for his missing pendant while you are in Zakhûr and return it to him.","You have arrived at Zakhûr","Find the pendant in the camp","A Small Thing","Go to the bandit camp at Zakhûr","You have found the pendant that Sikût asked you to look for in Zakhûr. You should bring it to him in Khanâg Gur.","Sikût has asked you to look for his missing pendant while you are in Zakhûr and return it to him. Zakhûr is an encampment east of Khanâg Gur in An Shêru.","A pendant given to Sikût by his late mother was stolen from him while he was unconscious."}},
[795]={nameES="A Smashed Crate",objectivesES={}},
[796]={nameES="A Smoking Fire",objectivesES={"Dry branches for kindling can be found throughout the Drownholt where the ground is a little higher, due west of Estolad Mernael.\
\
You should collect dry branches for the Elves at Estolad Mernael.","Rocheledh is in Estolad Mernael in the Drownholt, tending his sick horse.\
\
You should bring the dry branches for kindling to Rocheledh, who will be grateful for the cleaner camp-fires.","A Smoking Fire","Bring the branches to Rocheledh at Estolad Mernael","Most of the kindling immediately surrounding Estolad Mernael is very damp and causes the camp-fires to smoke and burn badly. Dry wood must be sought in other parts of the Drownholt's swampy terrain."}},
[797]={nameES="A Smouldering Fire",objectivesES={"Return to Amarêkh in Mekab-kuphâr with the book","Return to Ephrâti the bookseller.\
\
Ephrâti can be found in Tilmakhím in Takhdâr.","Amarêkh has asked you to go north to Tilmakhím for a new book.","Return to Ephrâti the bookseller","Ephrâti has asked you to deal with the rat menace.","Amarêkh has asked you to go north to a place called Tilmakhím, the Cross-roads. There the bookseller Ephrâti should have the book \\qA Smouldering Fire\\q for Amarêkh.","Return to Amarêkh in Mekab-kuphâr, in southern Khabârkhad, with the book.","A Smouldering Fire","Talk to the bookseller Ephrâti in Tilmakhím"}},
[798]={nameES="A Snappy Solution",objectivesES={"A Snappy Solution","Turtles can be found throughout the Rushgore.\
\
Frogildi has asked you to cull the numbers of the turtles in the Rushgore.","Frogildi recognizes the danger posed by the great turtles of the Rushgore and has a plan to control them.","Talk to Frogildi at the Woodman camp in the Rushgore","Frogildi is at the Woodman camp at the heart of the Rushgore.\
\
You should return to Frogildi with news of your success."}},
[799]={nameES="Una Amenaza Furiosa",objectivesES={"Encuentra la piedra blanca con marcas que señalan el camino hacia Thorenhad","El Elfo Fimgris ha notado que los lobos de las Gargantas del Bruinen han estado actuando de forma extraña y se pregunta qué podría haber puesto tanta rabia y miedo en sus ojos.","Los lobos de las Gargantas del Bruinen merodean en el valle entre el camino principal y Thorenhad. Fimgris te dijo que siguieras la carretera hacia el este hasta la piedra blanca y luego giraras al norte.\
\
Fimgris te ha pedido que derrotes a algunos de los lobos enloquecidos de las Gargantas del Bruinen con la esperanza de descubrir qué los ha perturbado.","Esta piedra blanca tiene marcas que señalan hacia el norte por el sendero","Una Amenaza Furiosa"}},
[800]={nameES="A Sneak Among the Leavings",objectivesES={"Look for more already-looted packs near the central road in Udûn, in hopes of finding the sneak.","Completado","This one was already looted. Is there anyone nearby?","It would seem there is someone sneaking into the abandoned soldiers' packs.","Found and defeated the pack-looting sneak.","Look for already-looted packs","Find and confront the sneak","You found and defeated the skulking goblin who was looting soldiers' packs, so the soldiers posted in Udûn won't have to worry about him.","A Sneak Among the Leavings","This soldier's pack has been looted already! It would seem there has been some furtive hand, slipping into the pockets of defeat."}},
[801]={nameES="Una escalada nevada",objectivesES={"Willem Bigotes te mira fijamente, posiblemente asintiendo","Habla con Bingo en el paso estrecho","Bingo está preocupado porque los lectores de su manuscrito no sean cautivados por el relato de su viaje, y quiere añadir algo de emoción a sus páginas.","Willem Bigotes se estira y bosteza. ¿Está aburrido o es que no está de acuerdo?","Bingo ha decidido parar para descansar un poco en el campamento de Glóin, en las Montañas Nubladas, cerca del camino que lleva al sur hacia Rivendel.","Una escalada nevada","Has encontrado a un enano herido en el paso estrecho entre las regiones de la fuente oeste y norte del Bruinen de las Montañas Nubladas, y deberías hacer lo que puedas para ayudarle.","El enano se recuesta de nuevo, exhausto y silencioso","Willbem Bigote bailotea alrededor, dándote la señal que necesitabas para recoger el puñado de hierbas","El enano parece haberse visto involucrado en una batalla recientemente, y le cuesta hablar. Sus heridas son muy graves.\
\
'¿Vas... ayudarme...?' logra decir, con gran esfuerzo. 'Los Corcur... emboscaron...'\
\
Su dolor es demasiado, y no puede decir nada más.","Aplica el puñado de hierbas medicionales al enano herido","Bingo te hace una señal para que te detengas al entrar en el paso estrecho: un enano yace aquí, ¡gravemente herido!","Bingo está en el paso estrecho al norte del campamento de Glóin, preocupado por las heridas del enano herido que encontraste.","Habla con el enano herido en el paso estrecho","Bingo está en el paso estrecho al norte del campamento de Glóin, preocupado por las heridas del enano herido que encontraste.\
\
'Tienes un puñado de hierbas (posiblemente) medicinales, y deberías llevárselas al enano herido.","Examina las hierbas que encuentres por la Fuente del Bruinen, manteniendo un ojo a las reacciones de Willem Bigotes","Bingo quiere viajar hacia el norte del campamento de Glóin hacia la zona de la Fuente del Bruinen Norte en las Montañas Nubladas, en un esfuerzo para añadir algo de emoción a su viaje.","Sus heridas son demasiado graves para que hable ahora mismo, pero parece entender que intentas ayudar. Aplica la cataplasma de hierbas, y sanará en cuestión de tiempo... de una forma u otra.","Viaja al norte del campamento de Glóin, hacia la zona de la Fuente del Bruinen Norte, en las Montañas Nublcadas","Habla con Bingo en el campamento de Glóin","Las bestias de las nieves y los rondadores de las nieves se pueden encontrar en todas las Montañas Nubladas.\
\
A Bingo le preocupa que su aventura adormezca a sus futuros lectores, y quiere añadir un poco de chispa a su viaje.","Bingo te ha pedido que busques en la zona de la Fuente del Bruinen hierbas que puedan ayudar a curar al enano herido que habéis encontrado. Te ha dicho que deberías vigilar las reacciones de Willem Bigote mientras examinas las hierbas para determinar si serán nocivas o beneficiosas."}},
[802]={nameES="A Softer Future",objectivesES={"Asórkho has given you preserved meat to give to the townsfolk of Halach, and asked you to keep his identity a secret.\
\
You should return to Irodon in Halach.","You have obtained a good amount of fresh boar meat.\
\
You should return and talk to Asórkho near the boar wallow.","Talk to Irodon in Halach","Asórkho regrets his actions during the war.","A Softer Future","Asórkho has asked you to hunt some more boars for fresh meat.\
\
You can find boars in the boar wallow north-east of Halach.","Talk to Asórkho"}},
[803]={nameES="A Solemn Gathering",objectivesES={"Mulnír looks as if he has one last thing to say to you","A Solemn Gathering","Collected Lachír's pack","Lay Lachír's belongings down","<rgb=#FF00FF>Mourn</rgb> with the others","You should return to the Foothold in Udûn now that the gathering to remember Lachír is over.","You should talk to Mulnír on the platform where the men have gathered to mourn Captain Lachír, across the road from the Foothold in Udûn.","Meet across the road","You should meet Mulnír and the other men up on the high platform across the road from the Udûn Foothold.","The mourners are gathered on the high platform across the road from the Udûn Foothold.\
\
You should talk to Mulnír again.","Return to the Foothold","The mourners are gathered on the high platform across the road from the Udûn Foothold.\
\
You should lay the Captain's belongings in the middle of the circle of mourners.","<rgb=#FF00FF>Listen</rgb> to Barathron","Talk to Mulnír","The mourners are gathered on the high platform across the road from the Udûn Foothold.\
\
Hear Othras' memory of Lachír.","Talk to Othras","Mulnír has asked you to collect what personal belongings of Captain Lachír you could find around the Foothold camp in Udûn.","Everyone is gathered in a solemn circle","The remaining men of the Udûn Foothold must come to terms with Captain Lachír's end.","You should talk to Mulnír in the Foothold camp in Udûn.","Mulnír has asked you to speak to gather the men around the Foothold in Udûn, and tell them where to meet.","The mourners are gathered on the high platform across the road from the Udûn Foothold.\
\
Listen to Barathron speak.","Collected Lachír's flagon","The mourners are gathered on the high platform across the road from the Udûn Foothold.\
\
You should mourn with the others.","The mourners are gathered on the high platform across the road from the Udûn Foothold.\
\
Hear Coldan's memory of Lachír.","All observe a grave, momentary silence","Talk to Coldan","Collected Lachír's book"}},
[804]={nameES="A Song Amongst the Waters",objectivesES={"Bring the song to Radagast and <rgb=#00FF00>sing</rgb> it for him","Radagast listens intently to the song you sing","<rgb=#00FF00>Listen</rgb> for the third fragment of Tauralindalë","Waters can be found at Rhosgobel.\
\
You should examine the waters to see if anything has changed.","<rgb=#00FF00>Listen</rgb> for the first fragment of Tauralindalë","<rgb=#00FF00>Listen</rgb> for the final fragment of Tauralindalë","Tauralindalë may be hiding in and around the waters of Laerlad.\
\
You should notate the parchment with the music that you have heard of the song of Tauralindalë.","<rgb=#00FF00>Listen</rgb> for the second fragment of Tauralindalë","This is a nice quiet place to stop and <rgb=#00FF00>listen</rgb>","You listen closely and hear part of a song","Radagast can be found at Rhosgobel.\
\
You should bring the song to Radagast.","Radagast needs your assistance in protecting Rhosgobel so that it will remain safe even when the Wizard is elsewhere in Middle-earth.","Habla con Radagast","Radagast can be found at Rhosgobel.\
\
You should talk to Radagast.","Tauralindalë may be hiding in and around the waters of Laerlad.\
\
You should <rgb=#FF0000>listen</rgb> around the waters of Laerlad for the song of Tauralindalë.","You write down the fragment of the song you hear","A Song Amongst the Waters","<rgb=#00FF00>Listen</rgb> for the fifth fragment of Tauralindalë","Notate the parchment with the section of Tauralindalë you heard","The waters shimmer!","<rgb=#00FF00>Listen</rgb> for the fourth fragment of Tauralindalë"}},
[805]={nameES="Una canción para la compañía",objectivesES={"Salta sobre una mesa cerca de Piper Prescott y canta la historia del almuerzo de Leland","Recogido: La historia del almuerzo de Leland","Tierras peligrosas y monstruos terribles crean grandes historias, pero los juglares experimentados saben que una sala llena de oyentes escépticos puede ser la cámara más aterradora de todas.","Leland Sotomonte probablemente está en la Puerta Oeste de la ciudad de Bree, a punto de partir hacia el escondite de unos bandidos.\
\
Piper Prescott, un juglar renombrado, te ha pedido que ayudes a Leland Sotomonte y compongas una canción sobre tu experiencia para cantarla en la sala común de El Poney Pisador.","Una canción para la compañía","Piper Prescott, un juglar renombrado, suele estar dentro de la sala común de El Poney Pisador, en la ciudad de Bree.\
\
Se te ha dicho que busques la enseñanza de Piper Prescott, un juglar aventurero de gran habilidad.","Las mesas cerca de Piper Prescott serían lugares ideales para cantar tu canción.\
\
Piper Prescott te ha dicho que saltes sobre una de las mesas cerca de él y cantes tu canción para los presentes.","La reacción del público es abrumadoramente positiva.","Piper Prescott está en la sala común de El Poney Pisador, en la ciudad de Bree.\
\
Ahora que has ayudado a Leland Sotomonte, Piper Prescott querrá escuchar la historia.","Piper Prescott está en la sala común de El Poney Pisador.\
\
Piper Prescott espera para dar su juicio sobre la interpretación de tu canción.","La gente reunida en El Poney Pisador espera para juzgar tu interpretación de \\qLa historia del almuerzo de Leland.'\
\
Has cantado tu historia y esperas el juicio.","Ayuda a Leland Sotomonte"}},
[806]={nameES="A Song of Screams",objectivesES={}},
[807]={nameES="A Song of Shurug-nîn",objectivesES={"Rahâzi stands here.","Glorfindel is at Khanâg Gur.","The mines once known as Lâkindar are in south-west An Shêru.","Talk to Rahâzi on the road to Lâkindar","Talk to Rahâzi at Khanâg Gur","Glorfindel is likely at Khanâg Gur, north of Damudûr.","Meet with Rahâzi on the road to Lâkindar in An Shêru","The wights and shades here should be defeated in memory of Shurug-nîn","A Song of Shurug-nîn","Rahâzi stands beside the road, gazing to the south","Rahâzi watches the road south toward Lâkindar.","Scout what has become of Lâkindar today","Talk to Glorfindel at Khanâg Gur, north of Damudûr","Talk to Glorfindel at Khanâg Gur","Rahâzi feels the loss of Surdûsha during the Dagor Carlanthir and desires to draw upon the inspiration of her heroine, Shurug-nîn.","Rahâzi asked to meet you on the road to Lâkindar, in south-west An Shêru.","Rahâzi is at Khanâg Gur.","The wights and shades of Lâkindar should be defeated in memory of Shurug-nîn."}},
[808]={nameES="Una Lanza en la Marca del Sur",objectivesES={"Andrew Roblebosque está en la Puerta Oeste de Bree.\
\
Has formado parte de la línea que defendió Bree del ataque; ahora debes hablar con el Vigilante Roblebosque.","Habla con Andrew Roblebosque y únete a su línea de Vigilantes","Andrew Roblebosque está junto a la Puerta Oeste de Bree.\
\
Se te ha indicado hablar con Andrew Roblebosque para participar en el entrenamiento con lanza que él dirige para los Vigilantes de las Tierras de Bree.","Una Lanza en la Marca del Sur","Andrew Roblebosque está en la Puerta Oeste de Bree.\
\
Una banda de bandidos marcha sobre Bree desde el sur, y Andrew Roblebosque te ha pedido unirte a su línea de Vigilantes para repelerlos.","Los Vigilantes suelen preferir la lanza, y un uso verdaderamente eficaz de ella debe ser enseñado por alguien que la haya empuñado con frecuencia y destreza en muchas batallas."}},
[809]={nameES="A Spear in the Heart",objectivesES={"Defeated Ulkúrzlam","Echad Sirion lies to the south of Durbúrz-stazg.\
\
You should return to Aemeldir with news of your victory against Ulkúrzlam and his soldiers.","Habla con Aemeldir en Echad Sirion","Defeat Ulkúrzlam at Durbúrz-stazg","A Spear in the Heart","The Elves of the Golden Host seek a way to cripple the Orcs of Durbúrz-stazg.","Durbúrz-stazg lies to the north of Echad Sirion.\
\
Aemeldir has asked you to defeat the Black Uruk Ulkúrzlam at Durbúrz-stazg. You will need to enter the encampment through the eastern gate."}},
[810]={nameES="Un pedido especial - Hoja",objectivesES={"Habla con el líder del Gremio de Armeros en Minas Morgul","Habla con Cottar Tunelero","Ejecuta la receta de una hoja con patrón del gremio","Ejecutaste la receta de una hoja con patrón del gremio","Las recetas de artesanía que debes crear se pueden trocar con el vendedor de Recetas Mejoradas.\
\
Forja una hoja con patrón del gremio.","El líder del Gremio de Armeros te ha pedido que forjes una hoja para completar un pedido del líder del Gremio de Herreros.","Un pedido especial - Hoja"}},
[811]={nameES="Un pedido especial - Guardamano",objectivesES={"Un pedido especial - Guardamano","Habla con el líder del Gremio de Armeros en Minas Morgul","Ejecutaste la receta de un guardamano con patrón del gremio","El líder del Gremio de Armeros te ha pedido que forjes un guardamano para completar un pedido del líder del Gremio de Herreros.","Las recetas de artesanía que debes crear se pueden trocar con el vendedor de Recetas Mejoradas.\
\
Forja un guardamano con patrón del gremio.","Ejecuta la receta de un guardamano con patrón del gremio","Habla con Cottar Tunelero"}},
[812]={nameES="Un pedido especial - Pomo",objectivesES={"Habla con el líder del Gremio de Armeros en Minas Morgul","Las recetas de artesanía que debes crear se pueden trocar con el vendedor de Recetas Mejoradas.\
\
Crea un pomo con patrón del gremio.","Un pedido especial - Pomo","Ejecutaste la receta de un pomo con patrón del gremio","El líder del Gremio de Armeros te ha pedido que forjes un pomo para completar un pedido del líder del Gremio de Herreros.","Ejecuta la receta de un pomo con patrón del gremio","Habla con Cottar Tunelero"}},
[813]={nameES="Un pedido especial - Vaina",objectivesES={"Un pedido especial - Vaina","Ejecuta la receta de una vaina con patrón del gremio","Habla con el líder del Gremio de Armeros en Minas Morgul","Ejecutaste la receta de una vaina con patrón del gremio","El líder del Gremio de Armeros te ha pedido que fabriques una vaina para completar un pedido del líder del Gremio de Herreros.","Las recetas de artesanía que debes crear se pueden trocar con el vendedor de Recetas Mejoradas.\
\
Crea una vaina con patrón del gremio.","Habla con Cottar Tunelero"}},
[814]={nameES="Una Carrera Contra el Tiempo",objectivesES={"Se te ha acabado el tiempo","Habla con Gil Plover fuera del laberinto en los Campos de Caballos","Una Carrera Contra el Tiempo","Gil Plover, el Maestro del Laberinto de Bree, te ha desafiado a atravesar el laberinto antes de que se acabe el tiempo. No debes demorarte entre los muros de setos.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro cuando finalice el festival actual. </rgb>","Has encontrado la salida","La salida del laberinto de setos está por aquí en algún lugar... ¿o no?\
\
Deberías intentar encontrar la salida antes de que se acabe el tiempo. Gil Plover salió en un instante comparado con el tiempo que te han dado.","Gil Plover está de pie cerca del laberinto de setos, que está muy cerca del recinto del festival de las Tierras de Bree, al norte de Bree.\
\
Deberías hablar con Gil Plover, para demostrarle que pudiste superar su reto y atravesar el laberinto en un tiempo admirable.","Encuentra la salida antes de que se acabe el tiempo","La entrada al laberinto de setos está cerca del área del festival en los Campos de Caballos, al norte de Bree.\
\
Gil Plover te ha desafiado a atravesar el laberinto, de principio a fin, antes de que se acabe el tiempo. El tiempo asignado es tres minutos.","Entra al laberinto"}},
[815]={nameES="Una cosecha animada",objectivesES={"Todos los días hay algo que hacer durante el Festival de la Cosecha. ¡Ven y únete a todos en el Árbol de la Fiesta, Wistmead y los vecindarios de viviendas y participa en muchas actividades del Festival de la Cosecha!","Una cosecha animada","Rosa se puede encontrar cerca del Árbol de la Fiesta y en Wistmead.\
\
Rosa Corneta quisiera agradecerte por tu participación en el Festival de la Cosecha hoy.","Rosa Corneta asiste al Festival de la Cosecha e invita a cualquier visitante a participar para ayudar a la Comarca a tener la mejor cosecha hasta ahora.","Habla con Rosa Corneta"}},
[816]={nameES="A Splintered Company",objectivesES={"Find and talk to the Ents in northern Balewood","Examinar al orco muerto.","You have come upon a field strewn with the corpses of Orcs and what appear to be the remains of an Ent","The hewn glade stretches away from the roadway in central Balewood.\
\
You have slain the hewers of which the note spoke, but there remains no sign of the moving trees it also mentioned. You should search the hewn glade and see if any Orcs have found such things.","Balewood hewers can be found to the north-west of Núrzum's Wrath in central Balewood.\
\
Húna and the others have supported your choice to seek out the Orc-hewers mentioned in Lomor's missive. The note mentioned they were stationed off the roadway near where Lomor was felled, so there you can begin your search for the trees that attacked the Orcs.","The Ents can likely be found to the north-east of the hewn glade based on the trail of Orcs.\
\
Other Ents appear to have escaped the grim scene you stumbled upon and travelled to the north. You should find and aid them before any other Orcs can discover their location.","An Ent lies slain among numerous Orcs, one of which appeared to be fleeing the battle","Search the hewn glade for signs of Huorns or Ents","The fallen Ent and Orcs can be found in the middle of the hewn glade in central Balewood.\
\
You have encountered the aftermath of a grim battle that occurred recently. You should examine the scene more closely to better understand what has happened.","A Splintered Company","The grim scene before you unfolded very recently, but in the distance you can see deep tracks in the snow that could only have been made by Ents and a trail of more slain Orcs leading deeper into the forest to the north.\
\
It appears the Ents have fled to the north. You should seek them out before any more harm can visit them.","The slain Orc is lying on the ground near the felled Ent.\
\
A slain Orc appears to have been making a run for its life before the Ent dealt its final blow. You should examine the Orc in hopes of better understanding what has occurred here.","You have noticed deep tracks and more slain Orcs leading away from the glade where the Orcs and Ent fell in battle. Perhaps some Ents made their way to safety.","Examine the fallen Ent and Orcs more closely","A grim trail of slain Orcs litters deep tracks that extend into the distance. It appears other Ents fled to the north..."}},
[817]={nameES="A Spy Among Us",objectivesES={"Talk to Alfbert","A Spy Among Us","You found a phial of poison","Thane Ordlac is in the Mead Hall of Stoke.\
\
You should bring the poison you found to Thane Ordlac.","Winegar is at the inn in Stoke.\
\
Thane Ordlac informed you that Winegar, Reeve Fríthild's physician, asked to speak with you privately.","When you returned from speaking with Alfbert at the inn, Thane Ordlac revealed that Engifu, the children's governess, had apparently thrown herself to her death in grief.","You should search Grimlac's body for evidence of foul play to bring to Thane Ordlac.","Search Grimlac's body","Alfbert is at the inn in Stoke.\
\
Perhaps Alfbert saw the stranger Winegar mentioned. You should speak with him.","Find Grimlac","The stranger, Grimlac, was seen headed out the north-east gate of Stoke on horseback.\
\
Alfbert directed you to follow after Grimlac.","Defeated Grimlac","Talk to Winegar","Bring the poison to Thane Ordlac"}},
[818]={nameES="A Stack of Troubles",objectivesES={"Someone needs to check the highest crate used in The Stacking Game for the rock-scrapers demanded by Shegai.","Check the highest crate used in The Stacking Game for rock-scrapers","Yared clasps your arm tightly and thanks you again","Bring the rock-scrapers to Yared","Bring the rock-scrapers to Shegai","Yared has remembered in which crate the rock-scrapers demanded by Shegai were packed.","A Stack of Troubles","Yared is waiting for you to descend and speak to him.","You retrieve the rock-scrapers from the crate, and once again hear cheers from below","Shegai is in the Armoury of Furukzahar."}},
[819]={nameES="A Standard Assault",objectivesES={"A Standard Assault","Fearing a united force, Gísil now wishes to bring the fight to the brutal half-orcs encamped nearby. He wants you to assault their camp and burn their standards.","The half-orc camp can be found to the north-east of Garsfeld.\
\
Gísil wants you to assault the half-orc camp and burn their banners.","Talk to Gísil at the Mead Hall of Garsfeld","Gísil can be found inside the Mead Hall of Garsfeld, south-west of the half-orc camp.\
\
You should return to Gísil with news of your success."}},
[820]={nameES="Una mirada desde lo salvaje",objectivesES={"Blökk puede encontrarse en la orilla oeste del lago.\
\
Mirja te ha pedido que mates al huargo Blökk para proteger Kauppa-kohta.","Mirja se encuentra en Kauppa-kohta.\
\
Con Blökk derrotado, deberías regresar con Mirja para informarle de tu victoria.","Derrota a Blökk","Habla con Mirja","Blökk, el huargo, acecha a lo largo de la orilla oeste del lago. Esta bestia está bajo la influencia del mal de Angmar y busca destruir a los Lossoth de Kauppa-kohta.","Una mirada desde lo salvaje"}},
[821]={nameES="Un giro sorprendente",objectivesES={"Horngaz se encuentra en algún lugar de las Fundaciones de Piedra.\
\
Celofa te ha pedido que obtengas el texto faltante del orco Horngaz.","Texto faltante encontrado","Celofa cree que el texto restante que acompaña al pergamino que encontraste antes está en posesión de un orco llamado Horngaz. Ese texto debe recuperarse para saciar su apetito por los acertijos.","Un giro sorprendente","Regresa junto a Celofa","Encuentra el texto faltante","Celofa se encuentra en las Fundaciones de Piedra.\
\
Deberías regresar junto a Celofa con el pergamino."}},
[822]={nameES="Una montura sin igual",objectivesES={"Una montura sin igual","Habla con Adamanda","Ayuda a Diamante a atrapar el lince","Adamanda está en la Comarca Allende.\
\
Habla con Adamanda Nortuk."}},
[823]={nameES="A Stern Lesson",objectivesES={"Return to Erna","Hear Bryn speak","Present the Snakewood","Collected puzzle box","A Stern Lesson","Present the coin of Dale","Collected Dale coin","Collect a dwarf-made puzzle box","Collect a Dale coin from the banker","The Queen Regent and her sons stand within the Great-keep in Dale.\
\
You should present Bryn and Erna with the coin of Dale.","The Queen Regent and her sons stand within the Great-keep in Dale.\
\
Hear more from Queen Regent Erna.","The Queen Regent and her sons stand within the Great-keep in Dale.\
\
You should present Bryn and Erna with the puzzle box.","The Queen Regent and her sons stand within the Great-keep in Dale.\
\
You should present Bryn and Erna with the Snakewood.","Queen Regent Erna holds her son Bryn to be answerable, in part, for Athálrik's misdeeds.","You should return to Queen Regent Erna with the items she asked you to gather, inside the Great-keep in Dale.","Collected Snakewood","Talk to King Bard II","The Queen Regent and her sons stand within the Great-keep in Dale.\
\
Bryn has grown tired of listening and speaks out of turn.","A coin can be collected from the banker in the Dale Crafting Hall, the wood from a foreign trader in the lower markets near the eastern gate, and the puzzle-box from a dwarf craftsman in Dale's upper markets, in the centre of town.\
\
Collect a gold coin of Dale, some Ilon-ôtin, or Snakewood, and a dwarf-made puzzle box for Queen Regent Erna.","Talk to Queen Regent Erna","Present the puzzle-box","Hear Erna's remonstrance","Collect Snakewood from a trader"}},
[824]={nameES="A Steward Without Counsel",objectivesES={"A Steward Without Counsel","Malthellam can be found near the entrance of Morlad in north-western Blackroot Vale.\
\
You have spoken to Lady Rosfin, who rebuffed Malthellam's request. She offered only Lord Duinhir's notes, which you should bring to Malthellam.","In the wake of his perceived failings as steward, Malthellam seeks to gain the counsel of Lady Rosfin.","DNT -- will not be seen","Deliver Lord Duinhir's notes to Malthellam","Collected Lord Duinhir's notes","Collect Lord Duinhir's notes","Lord Duinhir's notes can be found inside his and Lady Rosfin's home atop Morlad in Blackroot Vale.\
\
Lady Rosfin rejected Malthellam's offer based on his recent failure to protect Tingobel. She offered Lord Duinhir's notes and nothing more.","Talk to Rosfin atop Morlad","Lady Rosfin can be found outside her home atop Morlad in Blackroot Vale.\
\
Steward Malthellam has asked you to speak to Lady Rosfin on his behalf and persuade her to aid him as an advisor."}},
[825]={nameES="A Sticky Business",objectivesES={"Talk to Kúlthrak at Kafagur","You've collected enough spider-webs.\
\
You should bring them back to Kúlthrak at Kafagur.","A Sticky Business","The increase in wounded Kafagur hunters has left Kúlthrak bereft of spider-web bandages.","Spider-webs can be found at Maj Khibi, north-west of Kafagur."}},
[826]={nameES="A Sticky Harvest",objectivesES={"Return to Sênjar in Sormedân with the recovered honey","Sênjar, a farmer in Sormedân, has requested your aid in gathering honey from the angry bees of Medân Makhai.","Return to Sênjar in Sormedân with the recovered honey.","A Sticky Harvest","Sênjar, a local farmer in Sormedân, has requested your help in the harvest of honey from the local bees. These bees have become much more violent and aggressive since a new queen established herself over their hive. The bees can be found within the cave of Medân Makhai, north-west of Sormedân."}},
[827]={nameES="Un golpe contundente",objectivesES={"Has devastado la presencia de orcos en Skrithûrz-ulíma, haciendo que una pequeña zona de Zelem-melek sea menos peligrosa para la vulnerable expedición.","Los orcos de la Mano Blanca de Khazad-dûm pueden encontrarse en gran número en Skrithûrz-ulíma, cerca del centro de Zelem-melek.\
\
Ha llegado el momento de asestar un golpe decisivo contra los orcos de Moria.","El peligroso campamento de Skrithûrz-ulíma está lleno de orcos, lo que representa otro foco mortal en Zelem-melek.","Un golpe contundente","Completado"}},
[828]={nameES="A Stone Obstruction",objectivesES={}},
[829]={nameES="A Stone Obstruction",objectivesES={}},
[830]={nameES="A Stone's Throw",objectivesES={}},
[831]={nameES="A Stone-eater!",objectivesES={"Defeated Enaid-helgi","Talk to Rhus Cornchúthur in the Gloomglens","Defeat Enaid-helgi at night","A Stone-eater!","The hobbit Rhus Cornchúthur was surprised by your appearance, believing you to be a legendary creature called a Stone-eater.","Enaid-helgi appears at night upon a plateau to the north-east of Rhus Cornchúthur.\
\
Rhus Cornchúthur suggested that the mayor of his people might speak with you if you were to prove yourself to him. Slaying the demon-dog Enaid-helgi would go a long way towards that goal.","Rhus Cornchúthur awaits your return south-west of Enaid-helgi's hunting ground.\
\
You should return to Rhus Cornchúthur with news of your victory."}},
[832]={nameES="A Stony Welcome",objectivesES={"Hildith se encuentra en el Salón del Hidromiel de Bosque Oscuro.\
\
Deberías regresar a Hildith.","Return to Hildith","The unfriendly acting Thane, Hildith, grows concerned with the state of the Westfold, and summons a council to her, and does not wish to be disturbed while she calls the meeting.","A Stony Welcome","Townsfolk of Grimslade can be found in the town.\
\
You should speak to townsfolk of Grimslade."}},
[833]={nameES="A Stores' Inspection",objectivesES={"Report back to Náin the Slakeless","Náin the Slakeless, Lord of the Iron Hills, has taken charge of Zarkul-sulûn with hopes to steer the dwarves to victory.","Supplies can be found at Zarkul-sulûn.\
\
You should take inventory of supplies for Náin the Slakeless.","A Stores' Inspection","Náin the Slakeless can be found at Zarkul-sulûn.\
\
You should report back to Náin the Slakeless."}},
[834]={nameES="A Strange Absence of Nails",objectivesES={}},
[835]={nameES="A Strange Encounter",objectivesES={"You have found a new note, as well as possible clues to this scout's death.\
\
Rékkur will want to hear about your discoveries back at Annâk-khurfu.","Talk to Rékkur","A bat has delivered you a cryptic note. Where could this lead?","All of the scouts you talked to about the bat have mentioned Rékkur, a dwarf who may be interested in what you've found.\
\
He stands guard in front of Annâk-khurfu.","The corpse of a dwarf scout lies on the ground","The note contains directions to a specific location.\
\
Asking the scouts around Annâk-khurfu about this bat may give you some much-needed context.","The bat carries a piece of paper in its claws. As you approach, it recoils but then tentatively chirps, dropping the paper at your feet.\
\
Scrawled onto the paper are directions to an unnamed location, but nothing more.\
\
Perhaps you should ask scouts around Annâk-khurfu about this strange bat.","The note describes an overlook west of the path leading up to Zarkul-sulûn, a ruin west of Annâk-khurfu.\
\
Rékkur has suggested that you venture to that location to see what's there.","This note contains another location and an apology","Many footprints are Orkish, but the most recent set belongs to a Woman","Examina las huellas","A Strange Encounter","The scout holds a small, dead bat","Go to the overlook","The note has brought you to the body of a dwarf scout near Zarkul-sulûn.\
\
You should search the body and the immediate area for clues to what has transpired.","Read the note","Search the body"}},
[836]={nameES="A Strange Frenzy",objectivesES={"<rgb=#FF0000>Give</rgb> the strange runes to Voina","Strange runes and frenzied stone-claws can both be found in the north-western section of Máttugard.\
\
You should collect the strange runes and defeat the frenzied stone-claws that you encounter.","Talk to Voina","It is not just the gredbyg who have been worked up into a strange frenzy, but the stone-claws as well.","Voina can be found at Zidir-nesad, The Steepset, in Máttugard.\
\
You should give the strange runes to Voina.","Talk to Varthmath at Zidir-nesad","Voina can be found at Zidir-nesad, The Steepset, in Máttugard.\
\
You should talk to Voina.","Varthmath can be found at Zidir-nesad, The Steepset, in Máttugard.\
\
You should talk to Varthmath at Zidir-nesad.","A Strange Frenzy"}},
[837]={nameES="Un extraño mensaje",objectivesES={"Lleva el mensaje a Ornras en Echad Mirobel","Has encontrado un mensaje entre las pertenencias de un hombre de Angmar, caído en combate.","Al abrir el mensaje, aparecen las órdenes de un capitán de Angmar:\
\
'Debemos enviar fuerzas a las tierras élficas de Eregion y buscar allí, entre las ruinas, cualquier vestigio de su época pasada. Se deben registrar las ruinas más alejadas, pero el objetivo principal de nuestras fuerzas será la propia Forja del Anillo.\
\
'El caudillo Gûrsh estará al mando de esta expedición, lo que demuestra la gran ayuda que nos han prestado los orcos en nuestra guerra clandestina. Servidle bien.'\
\
El mensaje termina ahí. Es muy posible que los elfos presentes en la Forja del Anillo quieran conocer este mensaje. Se les puede encontrar muy al suroeste, en las ruinas conocidas como Echad Mirobel.'","Un extraño mensaje","Dirígete a las ruinas de Echad Mirobel, situadas en el extremo suroeste de Eregion.\
\
El mensaje que has encontrado habla del deseo de Angmar de rastrear las ruinas que quedan en busca de cualquier vestigio de poder o conocimiento que pueda utilizarse para reforzar aún más sus fuerzas en el norte. Menciona que un uruk llamado Gûrsh ha sido puesto al mando de la expedición.","No deberías ver esto"}},
[838]={nameES="A Strange Trail",objectivesES={"Another cluster of dead Orcs can be found to the north","Another pile of Orcs can be found north-west of the first in the eastern High Knolls.\
\
You should investigate the Orcs with Cyneberg.","You should talk to Cyneberg here","Talk to Cyneberg","The best path can be found south-west of Grimnesberg's crest. Cyneberg can be summoned using the whistle should you become separated.\
\
You should head south-west with Cyneberg to begin your return to Forlaw, and speak with her when she is ready.","You should speak with Cyneberg at an ideal resting spot","Another pile of Orcs can be found north of the first in the eastern High Knolls.\
\
You should investigate the Orcs with Cyneberg.","Summon Cyneberg to your side","Many more Orcs have been recently killed here","You and Cyneberg have decided that it's time to leave Grimnesberg and head back to Forlaw in defeat.","You have called Cyneberg to your side","Find the Orc-corpses to the north","A Strange Trail","Investigate the Orc-corpses to the north-west","Cyneberg kneels at a pile of slain Orcs in the northern High Knolls.\
\
You should speak with Cyneberg.","Cyneberg is reminded of Thrymm by this handiwork...","Investigate the Orc-corpses to the north","Cyneberg has given you a whistle to summon her.\
\
You should summon Cyneberg to your side.","Cyneberg did not kill these Orcs, and neither did you..."}},
[839]={nameES="Una sorprendente ausencia de jabalíes",objectivesES={"Habla con Parr Cortacostilla en Ost Forod","No has encontrado ningún rastro de jabalíes en Evendim","Pasa tiempo buscando jabalíes en Evendim","Parr Cortacostilla dejó que su estómago lo llevara demasiado lejos, vagando por los caminos del norte hacia Evendim, donde se topó con el rudo pueblo de Ost Forod. Sin embargo, no se ha dejado intimidar. Le apetece un buen y grueso filete de jabalí, pero le preocupa no haber visto ningún jabalí en todo Evendim.","Evendim es un lugar grande. Debería haber jabalíes en algún sitio.\
\
Parr Cortacostilla está convencido de que debe haber jabalíes en alguna parte de Evendim y quiere que pases algún tiempo buscando uno.","Parr Cortacostilla está en Ost Forod, el antiguo puesto de vigilancia en las colinas de Tyrn Fornech.\
\
No has encontrado ningún rastro de jabalíes en Evendim y deberías informar de tu triste descubrimiento a Parr Cortacostilla.","Una sorprendente ausencia de jabalíes"}},
[840]={nameES="Una Racha de Mala Suerte",objectivesES={"Habla con Teodoro Tojo en Avardin","Bingo está en la ciudad de Avardin, en las Tierras Brunas.","Habla con Bingo al este del centro de Galtrev, en Pren Gwydh","Ve al lugar descrito en el acertijo de Hunfredo para encontrar a Teodoro y Haley","Hunfredo Rebuscón está al este del centro de Galtrev, en las Tierras Brunas.","Habla con Haley Pradodulce en Avardin","Habla con Hunfredo Rebuscón en Galtrev, en las Tierras Brunas","Teodoro finalmente guarda silencio","Una Racha de Mala Suerte","Habla con Bingo en Avardin, en las Tierras Brunas","Teodoro Tojo está en la ciudad de Avardin, en las Tierras Brunas.","Bingo quiere viajar a Galtrev, en Pren Gwydh. Te encontrará dentro de la ciudad, al este del centro del pueblo.","Hunfredo te entrega un pequeño pergamino con algunas frases garabateadas","Habla con Teodoro Tojo en Avardin... otra vez","Haley Pradodulce está en la ciudad de Avardin, en las Tierras Brunas.","Bingo no ha llevado bien la partida de Willem Bigote, pero está intentando continuar su viaje.","Hunfredo Rebuscón te ha dado un acertijo que debes resolver. Debería indicarte el destino al que se dirigían Haley Pradodulce y Teodoro Tojo."}},
[841]={nameES="Un paseo por el Agujero Embrujado",objectivesES={"Recoge pruebas de que llegaste al Ala Rastrera","Regresa con Poppy Coto con la prueba de tu expedición","Un paseo por el Agujero Embrujado","Poppy Coto está fuera del Agujero Embrujado, junto al Árbol de la Fiesta.\
\
Debes regresar rápidamente a Poppy Coto con la prueba de que caminaste valiente y hábilmente en sus pasos dentro del Agujero Embrujado.","Recogiste pruebas de que visitaste el Ala Rastrera","Una prueba de tu visita a cada rincón del Agujero Embrujado se encuentra en cada uno de los niveles fuera del piso principal.\
\
Debes recoger pruebas de que has visitado las cuatro áreas principales del Agujero Embrujado y regresar antes de que se acabe el tiempo","Recoge pruebas de que llegaste al ático","Recoge pruebas de que llegaste al sótano","Regresa antes de que se acabe el tiempo","Recogiste pruebas de que visitaste el ático","Poppy Coto, una hobbit muy ágil, te ha desafiado a visitar todos los rincones del Agujero Embrujado en un tiempo determinado.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando finalice el evento con el que está asociada. </rgb>","Se te ha acabado el tiempo","Recogiste pruebas de que visitaste el sótano","Recoge pruebas de que llegaste al Ala Telarañosa","Recogiste pruebas de que visitaste el Ala Telarañosa"}},
[842]={nameES="A Stroll With Bergil",objectivesES={"Look out from over the City Gates","The Wrights' Market lies in the southern stretch of the First Circle.\
\
Bring the broken whisk to the tinker Amonel in the Wrights' Market, as Himnir asked. If you should get separated from Bergil, the whistle he gave you will call him back.","Oryat stands back, glowering at you","Go see the other soldiers","Oryat stands in the Second Circle, between the Feasting Hall and the tavern.\
\
Bergil has implored you to go and fight Oryat, to teach him a lesson. If you should get separated from Bergil, the whistle he gave you will call him back.","Bergil has invited you on a stroll around the First Circle of Minas Tirith.","Walked the wall south of the gate","You notice the Swan-knight Rossaran standing nearby, watching you","Meet Oryat","You intervened to keep Oryat from striking Bergil, and Oryat challenged you to what is surely an ill-advised duel.\
\
See where Bergil wishes to go now. If you should get separated, the whistle Bergil gave you will call him back.","The City Stables stand across from the gates.\
\
Bergil wishes to feed some apples the horses in the City Stables. If you should get separated, the whistle he gave you will call him back.","Walked the wall north of the gate","Bergil runs off, leaving you to follow him","Rossaran stands in the Second Circle, across from the Feasting Hall.\
\
After facing down the bully Oryat, you noticed the Swan-knight Rossaran standing nearby. See what he has to say. If you should get separated from Bergil, the whistle he gave you will call him back.","Oryat appears before you, a cruel sneer on his lips","Talk to Oryat","Oryat will be waiting in the Second Circle, between the Feasting Hall and the tavern.\
\
Bergil has implored you to go and fight Oryat, to teach him a lesson. If you should get separated from Bergil, the whistle he gave you will call him back.","Talk to Bergil","You see more soldiers","Tour the southern wall","Ranks of soldiers can be found near the City Gates.\
\
Take Bergil to see more ranks of soldiers.","A Stroll With Bergil","Bergil will accompany you on the stroll. If you should get separated, the whistle he gave you will call him back.\
\
See what Bergil has to say.","Go to see another rank of soldiers before the City Gates.\
\
Bergil will accompany you on the stroll. If you should get separated, the whistle he gave you will call him back.","Bergil will accompany you on the stroll. If you should get separated, the whistle he gave you will call him back.\
\
See where Bergil wishes to go next.","Rossaran the Swan-knight stands near the rude soldiers, inside the main gates of Minas Tirith.\
\
A swan-knight took note of the soldiers who were rude to Bergil, and seems to want to speak with you.","Return to Amonel the tinker","Looked out from over the City Gates","The Old Guest-house lies in the First Circle, just south of the City Gates.\
\
You have beaten Oryat and scared him from troubling the children in the First Circle... but he has threatened harm to any who trespass in the Second Circle. Meet Bergil back at the Old Guest-house, where he stays.","Go to see the ranks of soldiers before the City Gates.\
\
Bergil will accompany you on the stroll. If you should get separated, the whistle he gave you will call him back.","Oryat stands waiting for you, but he is not alone","Amonel is in the Wrights' Fellow-hall, in the southern stretch of the First Circle.\
\
Return to the tinker Amonel, to see if Himnir's whisk has been mended. If you should get separated from Bergil, the whistle he gave you will call him back.","Meet Bergil back at the Old Guest-house","Tour the northern wall","While touring the city walls with Bergil, you have crossed paths with Oryat, the soldier who berated Bergil earlier. You should intervene before he lays his hands on the boy.","As you turn away, a Swan-knight of Belfalas catches your eye","Himnir gives you the broken whisk","Ask Himnir for treats","Take some apples","Bergil will accompany you on the stroll. If you should get separated, the whistle he gave you will call him back.\
\
See what Bergil wishes to while you wait for the tinker to mend the whisk.","With a kindly smile, the knight turns his gaze away","Himnir smiles indulgently at Bergil.\
\
'Sweets not just for you, but also for the other children? Well, that is a bold thing to ask! Others would pay good coin for such a parcel of my goods. Ah, but who am I fooling? Like as not, I would have given it to you freely.\
\
'Today, however, I have an errand you may run to earn your treat. This whisk I use to whip up cream for my pastries has come apart, and it is my favourite whisk!\
\
'I ask you to bring it to Amonel, a tinker in the Wrights' Market, and beg her to set it right. In return, I'll have a bounty of sweets sent over for the whole lot of you.'","Amonel greets you and Bergil with a low sigh.\
\
'The whisk is not mended. Nor shall it be, for it is beyond repair. Himnir should not go so hard on so delicate a tool and I have told him so...\
\
'Nor will I send you to bear this ill tiding for me. Some things must be faced bravely. A knight cannot send someone in his stead to face the foe, nor can he shirk his duty and let innocents come to harm.\
\
'Go now. Somehow I think Himnir will send some sweets to your friends all the same.'","Enter the City Stables","The city walls can be reached via stairs from several points throughout the First Circle of Minas Tirith.\
\
Stroll with Bergil up upon the outer walls of Minas Tirith. If you should get separated, the whistle Bergil gave you will call him back.","You find a good view of the assembled soldiers","Tour the far northern wall","Took a handful of apples","Go see the ranks of soldiers","The horses have devoured the apples.","Talk to Rossaran","The Foodmongers' Market lies in the northern stretch of the First Circle.\
\
Help Bergil find the foodmonger Himnir and ask for a treat for all the children. If you should get separated from Bergil, the whistle he gave you will call him back.","Bring the whisk to Amonel the tinker","Defeat Oryat","Bergil will accompany you on the stroll. If you should get separated, the whistle he gave you will call him back.\
\
See where Bergil wishes to go first."}},
[843]={nameES="A Study in Reclamation",objectivesES={"Hermáth Stormhammer can be found at Watchers' Roost in Gloomingtarn.\
\
You have assisted Lokur and Vithin with their expeditions into Glittengrof and Ormgren, and Spall has completed the first part of his survey of Gloomingtarn. You should return to Watchers' Roost and talk to Hermáth Stormhammer.","Aid Spall with 'Surveying Ormgren'","Talk to Spall at Watchers' Roost","Talk to Spall","Talk to Lokur and assist the expedition in Ormgren","Much to Spall's surprise, Hermáth Stormhammer has permitted him to begin his survey of Gloomingtarn. However, Hermáth Stormhammer also wishes to learn what has become of his warriors, Lokur and Vithin, who led companies into the ancient tunnels of Gloomingtarn.","Vithin and Lokur can be found in Glittengrof and Ormgren, respectively. Spall can be found at your side.\
\
Hermáth Stormhammer has permitted Spall to conduct a survey of Gloomingtarn on the condition that you accompany him and also aid the expeditions in Glittengrof and Ormgren. You should aid Spall with his survey and receive reports from Lokur and Vithin, two warriors of Hermáth Stormhammer's expedition.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: If you become separated from Spall, use the horn he gave you to call him to your side.</rgb>","A Study in Reclamation","Spall can be found at Watchers' Roost in Gloomingtarn.\
\
Hermáth Stormhammer has permitted Spall to conduct a survey of Gloomingtarn on the condition that you accompany him. You should talk to Spall.","Aid Spall with 'Surveying Glittengrof'","Spall arrives at your side!","Talk to Hermáth Stormhammer at Watchers' Roost","Spall sets off to return to Watchers' Roost","Talk to Vithin and assist the expedition in Glittengrof","Spall can be found at your side in Gloomingtarn.\
\
You have helped Spall complete his survey of Glittengrof and Ormgren. You should talk to Spall.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: If you become separated from Spall, use the horn he gave you to call him to your side.</rgb>"}},
[844]={nameES="A Sudden Rescue",objectivesES={"Talk to Féli","Talk to Shúkurz","A Sudden Rescue","You have returned to Aslíf and should talk to Féli.","Return to Náin in Aslíf","Féli stops mid-argument with Náin and beckons you over","You should talk to Shúkurz and see what he has to say.","Four dwarf smiths are being held at Gazat-fark.\
\
One has been spotted on the ground level, and the other on the second floor. The others may be trapped in Durbángh -- behind the doors on the second floor.","You have rescued the dwarf smiths.\
\
You should return to Náin in Aslíf on the upper tier.","Whether or not Shúkurz is lying, the possibility of dwarf prisoners should be investigated.","Talk to Múta outside of Gazat-fark","Múta can be found outside Gazat-fark, located on the lowest level of Deepscrave and to the south-east of Aslíf."}},
[845]={nameES="A Sudden Uprising of Half-orcs",objectivesES={"A Sudden Uprising of Half-orcs","Half-orcs are growing in number in the woods near Grimslade, and Húnbrit has found the source: a large encampment.","Half-orcs can be found in their encampment south-east from the gates of Grimslade.\
\
You should defeat Half-orcs at Fushum Raus.","Completado","You have defeated a number of Half-orcs near Grimslade, but there are too many to uproot the entire encampment. You have done all that you could here."}},
[846]={nameES="A Summons Unanswered",objectivesES={"Talk to Reeve Athelward at the Mead Hall of Cliving","Talk to Thane Elfmar at the Mead Hall of Faldham","Feeling satisfied with the results of her training, Ides has asked you to return with a message to her father, Athelward. Reeve Athelward's attention is drawn south to another potential problem.","Reeve Athelward resides in his Mead Hall at the east edge of Cliving.\
\
Ides has asked you to return to Cliving to thank her father for his support and so that she may continue on her training without your mentoring.","Reeve Athelward has asked you to deliver a message to Thane Elfmar and his Riders","Thane Elfmar resides at the Mead Hall of Faldham, the southernmost town of the Norcrofts.\
\
Athelward wishes for you deliver a message: that Elfmar's Riders are to report to the city of Cliving for duty to the Reeve.","A Summons Unanswered"}},
[847]={nameES="A Summons by Craban",objectivesES={}},
[848]={nameES="A Summons to Mágla",objectivesES={"Thane Mágla can be found in the Mead Hall of Middlemead in north-western Kingstead.\
\
Éowyn, acting as steward of Edoras, has asked you to aid in gathering the people of Middlemead in preparation for the journey to Dunharrow.","Éowyn has asked for your aid in rallying the people of Middlemead to Edoras as Thane Mágla has not sent word.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Note: This quest will fail if you complete 'Trading Fates' before speaking to Thane Mágla.</rgb>","DNT -- Will not be seen","A Summons to Mágla","Talk to Thane Mágla in Middlemead"}},
[849]={nameES="Un día soleado de feria",objectivesES={"Campanula Redondo está emocionada de dar la bienvenida a los visitantes al Árbol de la Fiesta y los anima a participar en todas las actividades del festival.","Campanula Redondo quiere agradecerte por tu participación de hoy en la Feria Agrícola.","Cada día hay algo que hacer para el Festival de la Feria Agrícola. ¡Ven y únete a todos para celebrar otro año maravilloso y participa en las muchas actividades del Festival!","Habla con Campanula Redondo","Un día soleado de feria"}},
[850]={nameES="A Sunset Storm",objectivesES={"Céola is at Etheburg in the Brown Lands.\
\
You should return to Céola with news of your victory.","Céola is at Etheburg in the Brown Lands.\
\
When you are ready to begin the attack on Lashkarg, you should speak with Céola.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This instance quest is meant to be run Solo and cannot be run in a group.</rgb>","The Khundolar war-camp has become a threat too great to ignore. Something must be done or the Easterlings will overrun Rohan.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This instance quest is meant to be run Solo and cannot be run in a group.</rgb>","A Sunset Storm","Talk to Céola at Etheburg in the Brown Lands","Talk to Céola when you are ready to assault Lashkarg"}},
[851]={nameES="A Sunset Storm -- Repeatable",objectivesES={"Céola is at Etheburg in the Brown Lands.\
\
You should return to Céola with news of your victory at Lashkarg.","Céola is at Etheburg in the Brown Lands.\
\
You should speak with Céola when you are ready to depart for Lashkarg.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This instance quest is meant to be run Solo and cannot be run in a group.</rgb>","The Khundolar war-camp has become a threat too great to ignore. Something must be done or the Easterlings will overrun Rohan.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This instance quest is meant to be run Solo and cannot be run in a group.</rgb>","Talk to Céola at Etheburg in the Brown Lands","Talk to Céola when you are ready to assault Lashkarg","A Sunset Storm -- Repeatable"}},
[852]={nameES="Una Capa Superior de Piel de Lince",objectivesES={"Una Capa Superior de Piel de Lince","Los Elfos habitan en el valle oculto de Rivendel, en los límites orientales del Bosque de los Trolls.\
\
Atacado por el Lince del Páramo Alto, venciste a la bestia y descubriste que tus golpes no dejaron marca alguna en su piel. Tras retirar la piel con destreza, deberías buscar a un armero de armaduras ligeras que pudiera convertirla en una capa magnífica.","Mientras avanzabas por el Páramo Alto fuera de Rivendel, descubriste un lince peligroso. Tras una breve batalla en la que superaste a la bestia, descubriste que su piel estaba intacta.","Lleva la piel de lince a un armero élfico para que confeccione una capa","La piel de lince es hermosa y podría convertirse en una capa resistente y elegante. Debes encontrar a un Elfo habilidoso en trabajar armaduras ligeras para que confeccione una capa a partir de esta piel."}},
[853]={nameES="Un suministro por un suministro",objectivesES={"Deberías hacerle saber a Melia que has llevado a cabo su venganza contra los orcos.\
\
Melia está en el Campamento de Siempreviva, al noreste de Tharbad.","Melia te ha pedido que destruyas alijos de armas de orcos en Tharbad.\
\
Tharbad está en el sur de Cardolan.","Volver a Melia","Un suministro por un suministro","Los orcos que ocupan Tharbad han estado atacando a los viajeros y destruyendo o robando sus bienes. Ojo por ojo, como dicen."}},
[854]={nameES="Un exceso de armas",objectivesES={"Dôlo de Ekhamâti derrotado","Escapa del campamento antes de que lleguen los refuerzos","Tu misión es robar armas de un campamento de Ekhamâti cercano y derrotar a tantos soldados como puedas. Debes salir antes de que lleguen los refuerzos.","Derrota al dôlo de Ekhamâti","Un exceso de armas"}},
[855]={nameES="A Surplus of Spirits",objectivesES={}},
[856]={nameES="A Surprising Find",objectivesES={"Talk to the supplier in south-west Tadrent","She hands you a shiny golden needle","...and then races off in the direction of the haystack","Little Pip is by the northern entrance of Tadrent, in King's Gondor.","Wait for her response","Talk to Little Pip by the haystack in Tadrent, King's Gondor","Vexed Meldis stands in shock.","Bring the shiny golden needle to Vexed Meldis in Tadrent, King's Gondor","A supplier sells goods in the south-west corner of Tadrent, in King's Gondor.","Bring the shiny golden needle to Little Pip in Tadrent, King's Gondor","Little Pip has a plan to exact his revenge upon Vexed Meldis.","Vexed Meldis stands still for a moment...","Little Pip is by the haystack in question near the northern entrance to Tadrent, in King's Gondor.","A Surprising Find","Vexed Meldis stands by her home in western Tadrent, King's Gondor."}},
[857]={nameES="Un Sabor Sorprendente",objectivesES={"Lleva el guiso de sapo mejorado a Indor","Indor está en la hoguera de Echad Candelleth, en Tâl Bruinen.\
\
Wéthorm te ha devuelto el guiso de sapo y te ha pedido que transmitas sus felicitaciones a Indor por la mejora.","Un Sabor Sorprendente","Wéthorm te ha enviado de regreso con Indor con el guiso de sapo mejorado e insiste en que le entregues sus felicitaciones por haber mejorado la receta original."}},
[858]={nameES="A Swarm of Trouble",objectivesES={"A Swarm of Trouble","Your discovery of great insects among the burrows has both caused Gisalic concern and inspired brilliance.","Talk to Gisalic at the Woodman camp in the Rushgore","Gisalic is at the Woodman camp in the Rushgore, south-west of the insect-nest.\
\
You should return to Gisalic with news of your success.","Insects can be found at the nest, north-east of the Woodman camp in the Rushgore.\
\
Gisalic asked you to defeat many of the insects you discovered in the Rushgore."}},
[859]={nameES="Una espada quebrada",objectivesES={"Devolviste Gránung a Déornyd solo para descubrir que ahora tiene problemas con su otra espada.","Déornyd se encuentra en Pynti-peldot, al sureste de donde merodean los Gauradan.\
\
Deberías llevarle a Déornyd la espada de los Gauradan.","Los Gauradan merodean al norte y al oeste de Pynti-peldot, cerca de las Piedras Solitarias.\
\
Déornyd te ha pedido que sustituyas su espada rota por otra robada a uno de los Gauradan.","Una espada quebrada","Consigue para Déornyd una nueva espada de un Gauradan","Lleva la espada de los Gauradan a Déornyd en Pynti-peldot"}},
[860]={nameES="A Symbol of Dread",objectivesES={}},
[861]={nameES="Un símbolo de esperanza",objectivesES={"El orcanete y la guede que recolectaste pueden entregarse a Nethúr en Esteldín.","Un símbolo de esperanza","Los Montaraces de Esteldín necesitan provisiones.","La guede de las colinas y el orcanete de las colinas crecen en las colinas del este de Nan Amlug y Rhunenlad.\
\
Elúr te ha pedido que recolectes guede de las colinas y orcanete de las colinas para Esteldín.","Lleva las plantas tintóreas a Nethúr en Esteldín"}},
[862]={nameES="A Symbol of the Past",objectivesES={}},
[863]={nameES="A Tainted Flow",objectivesES={"You found more tracks along the river. Investigate them to see what you can learn.","Reach the mouth of the river","A Tainted Flow","Return to Talmûri in Burukíri and let her know it wasn't Ekhamâti soldiers poisoning the river, it was only animal carcasses that began to rot in the water.","These tracks appear to be from an animal. They continue to point upstream","Search further up the river","You found more tracks that point even further upstream. You have to be getting close now. Follow the river to find the source of the poison.","You discovered the source of the poisoned water to be rotting animal carcasses. Remove them to stop river's water from being tainted.","You arrived at the mouth of the river Talmûri told you about. Investigate the area and see if you can find any clues as to what may be causing the water to be poisoned.","You spot some tracks near the mouth of the river. Maybe they hold some clues","Talmûri has asked for your help investigating claims of a poisoned water source in the area. Travel north-west to the mouth of the river to see if you can find any clues as to the cause of the tainted water.","You see two animal carcasses. That must be the source of the poisoned water","Return to Talmûri in Burukíri","Talmûri has asked for your help investigating claims of a poisoned water source in the area. She suspects it may be the work of Ekhamâti soldiers.","The tracks are faded but appear to lead further up the river","You see more tracks along the river. These appear less faded than the others","Continue your search up the river","You found tracks near the mouth of the river Talmûri told you about. They pointed further upstream. Follow the river to see if you can find any more indications of the poison's source."}},
[864]={nameES="A Tale My Father Told",objectivesES={}},
[865]={nameES="A Tale My Mother Told",objectivesES={"You tell Raphûz what the inhabitants of Jirush told you of Nirgambâr.\
\
'Yes. I heard the same. A place of evil. If this is where I must go to earn Igbâl's respect, then I shall.'","A Tale My Mother Told","Raphûz decides to pursue wealth and asks you to help him determine if there are truly riches near Jirush he can acquire to pay Igbâl's price.","You explain your desire to learn the dangers of Nirgambâr.\
\
'The superstitious among us do not speak of the tombs. It is where the dead are meant to rest. They do not.'","Raphûz has chosen to pursue the cost Igbâl put on pursuing Ashâmi's hand. He wants to learn all he can from the people of Jirush about the Tomb of Nirgambâr before he ventures there.","You explain your desire to learn the dangers of Nirgambâr.\
\
'Like the temple that overlooks this outpost, the tombs have always been. None alive remember who built them. None in this outpost dare to enter the place.'","You explain your desire to learn the dangers of Nirgambâr.\
\
'None from this outpost would dare venture there. Some say that the spirits of the once thriving land fled into the bodies of the dead after the land was laid waste. They were quiet for centuries. In recent times, the dead stir. More recently, they move onto the land from deep within the tombs.'","You explain your desire to learn the dangers of Nirgambâr.\
\
'Nirgamâr is a place of horror. The Dead walk the land and the catacombs beneath. None who live remember when those halls were ancient. Perhaps the tombs are as old as the stars or older. All we know is the tombs are unnatural and evil.'","You explain your desire to learn the dangers of Nirgambâr.\
\
'There is an abundance of wealth within the deepest chambers. Thieves and robbers enter there all the time to acquire relics to sell to the Ordâkhai or to sacrifice at the temple above Jirush. No good comes from that place.'","You explain your desire to learn the dangers of Nirgambâr.\
\
'What more do you need to know? It is a tomb. The Dead there should rest, and yet they stir. Evil is in that place.'","You visited many of the inhabitants of Jirush and enquired about the Tombs of Nirgambâr. It sounds like a terrible place. You should return to Raphûz at his camp in Jirush with the information."}},
[866]={nameES="Un talismán encontrado",objectivesES={"Seguro que los semiorcos de Thelgarth tienen el talismán de la suerte de Maervellon. Seguro que sí.","Maervellon cree que por fin sabe dónde está su talismán. Desde luego, no se comporta como ningún Montaraz que hayas conocido antes...","Maervellon sigue a las afueras de la fortaleza de Thelgarth, en el Ángulo.","Un talismán encontrado","Habla con Maervellon fuera de Thelgarth"}},
[867]={nameES="A la caza del talismán",objectivesES={"Habla con Maervellon en Glynafon","Se pueden encontrar huargos entre los antiguos agujeros de Glynafon, en el Ángulo.","A la caza del talismán","Parece que este Montaraz es un poco más despistado de lo que pensabas, pues ahora cree que fueron los huargos quienes huyeron con su talismán.","Maervellon se encuentra cerca de los antiguos agujeros hobbit de Glynafon, en el Ángulo."}},
[868]={nameES="Un talismán perdido",objectivesES={"Parece que, de algún modo, un Montaraz ha perdido algo muy importante para él.","Un talismán perdido","Habla con Maervellon fuera de Eitheldir","Vuelve con Maervellon fuera de las ruinas de Eitheldir.","Mata orcos en el Ángulo y mantente alerta por si ves el talismán perdido."}},
[869]={nameES="A Tangle of Tales",objectivesES={"You should return to King Thorin in Erebor now that you have summoned Spall the Lore-master.","Spall can be found in the great hall of Erebor.\
\
You should go inform Spall the Lore-master that King Thorin wishes to speak with him.","A Tangle of Tales","Dwarves willing to share rumours can be found along the main passage and in the upper and lower wings of King Thorin's hall, in Erebor.\
\
Learn what you can of the rumours in Erebor.","Return to King Thorin","Fetch Spall the Lore-master","You should return to King Thorin in Erebor with news of the rumours you have heard.","King Thorin Stonehelm is perturbed by the number of rumours concerning the Iron Hills in Erebor."}},
[870]={nameES="A Tangled Mess",objectivesES={"Complete Finnvarth is Lost","Complete Bíli is Missing","Talk to Armund","Complete Dolmund Has Vanished","Talk to Armund in the Limlight Gorge","Complete Darfi Has Wandered Off","A Tangled Mess","Convince Armund to give up the Sawmill.","You should rescue the two missing dwarves, Finnvarth and Bíli, who disappeared somewhere to the east of the old sawmill in the Limlight Gorge.","Complete Gerfinn Has Gone Astray","The dwarf Armund and his companions have entered the Limlight Gorge in the hope of reopening an old sawmill on the edge of Fangorn forest. Discounting the tales of monsters and walking trees, the dwarves have begun working on the sawmill, but recently most of Armund's companions seem to have mysteriously disappeared.","You should speak with Dolmund in the old sawmill in the Limlight Gorge.","You should speak with Armund in the old sawmill in the Limlight Gorge.","Speak with Dolmund at the Sawmill in Limlight Gorge.","Talk to Dolmund","Armund  remains unswervingly oblivious....","Three more of Armund's companions remain missing within the Gorge, and morale among the band of dwarves remains low as Armund continues to drive them to complete the ill-advised venture.","Speak with Dolmund"}},
[871]={nameES="A Tangled Net",objectivesES={}},
[872]={nameES="A Tangled Net - Prelude",objectivesES={}},
[873]={nameES="Un gusto por el cangrejo",objectivesES={"Has derrotado a la matriarca de la camada de cangrejos","Derrota a la matriarca de la camada de cangrejos.","Un gusto por el cangrejo","Encuentra y derrota a la matriarca de la camada de cangrejos","Ayuda con la cosecha en las Islas Escudo recolectando frutos de mar de las trampas y luchando contra grandes cangrejos por sus pinzas.","Un nuevo chef ha estado entreteniendo a todo Umbar con sus deliciosas creaciones de cangrejo. Umbar se está quedando sin cangrejo. Ayuda con la cosecha en las abundantes Islas Escudo."}},
[874]={nameES="Un gusto por el cerdo",objectivesES={"Un gusto por el cerdo","Milo Bolger está en una granja al este de Bolgovado, vigilando a los lobos en las ruinas cercanas.\
\
Linda Bolger vino a Bolgovado buscando a alguien que pudiera ayudar con el problema de los lobos. Te ha pedido que hables con su esposo, Milo.","Milo Bolger está vigilando a los lobos al este de Bolgovado.\
\
Milo se alegrará de saber que has reducido el número de lobos con los que los hobbits de Bolgovado tendrán que lidiar.","Los lobos se encuentran al este de la granja de Milo y Linda Bolger, entre las ruinas.\
\
Linda Bolger te envió a hablar con su esposo, Milo, sobre los lobos que han entrado en la Comarca. Milo te pidió que reduzcas la manada antes de que se conviertan en una amenaza mayor.","Linda Bolger de Bolgovado está preocupada por una manada de lobos que ha invadido la Comarca y teme que pronto ataquen su granja de cerdos."}},
[875]={nameES="A Taste of Home",objectivesES={"Talk to Kúmri","Kúmri would like your help gathering berries so that he may have something to present to Onjópo in Pelargir.","You have found enough tart berries to satisfy Kúmri.\
\
Deliver the tart berries to Kúmri.","Kúmri has asked you to pick some berries outside of Ost Anglebed.\
\
Find tart berries in the fields east of Ost Anglebed.","A Taste of Home"}},
[876]={nameES="Sabor a primavera",objectivesES={"Sabor a primavera","Todos los días hay algo que hacer por el Festival de Primavera. Celebra el cambio de estación y participa en las muchas actividades del Festival de Primavera en el Recinto del Festival de las Tierras de Bree, la ciudad de Bree, Duillond en Ered Luin, Tejonera en la Comarca y Clegur en Ciénaga de los Cisnes.","Habla con Rhudamer Hirtul","Tus anfitriones quieren agradecerte por tu participación en el Festival de Primavera hoy. Deberías hablar con el sargento Tom en el Recinto del Festival de las Tierras de Bree o con Rhudamer Hirtul cerca del Maestro de establos en Clegur.","Habla con el sargento Tom","Muchas gentes de la Tierra Media celebran la llegada de la primavera con animados festivales en los que se anima a los visitantes a participar. ¡Hacerlo puede ser muy gratificante!"}},
[877]={nameES="Un Sabor de Guerra",objectivesES={"Faelleron está al sureste de Fanuidhol, en el límite de Lothlórien.\
\
Has derrotado a algunos de los orcos que amenazan el Bosque de Oro y ahora deberías regresar con Faelleron.","Has aceptado luchar contra los orcos en Fanuidhol, al noroeste de Lothlórien, por petición de Faelleron.","rgb=#FF0000>Mirar</rgb> a lo lejos desde las ruinas de Audaghaim, al sureste de la Posada Embrujada","Faelleron te entrega una nota que contiene su permiso para luchar contra los orcos","Habla con Faelleron en el límite noroeste del Bosque de Oro","Habla con Bingo en el límite noroeste del Bosque de Oro, cerca de Faelleron","Habla con Bingo dentro de la Posada Embrujada, en los Troncosombríos","Un Sabor de Guerra","Habla con Faelleron en el noroeste de Lothlórien","Este cementerio es antiguo, y la mayoría de las lápidas están desgastadas e ilegibles","Bingo está junto al fuego dentro de la Posada Embrujada, en los Troncosombríos.","Bingo ha llegado al Bosque Negro y, naturalmente, ha ido a la primera taberna que ha encontrado: la Posada Embrujada de los Troncosombríos, al oeste de Audaghaim.","Bingo está al sureste de Fanuidhol, en el límite de Lothlórien, junto a Faelleron.\
\
Has derrotado a algunos de los orcos que amenazan el Bosque de Oro y ahora deberías volver con Bingo.","La vista es impresionante, pero el puente se siente inestable y poco seguro","<rgb=#FF0000>Mirar</rgb> de cerca el cementerio olvidado al sur de la Posada Embrujada","Encuentra a Bingo Boffin dentro de la Posada Embrujada, en los Troncosombríos.","Obtén acceso al Bosque Negro completando 'Libro 9, Prólogo: La Orilla Oscura' hablando con Calengoth y completando su cadena de misiones hasta 'Asalto a la Colina'.","Habla con Calengoth en los muelles","Bingo te ha pedido que encuentres varios lugares cerca de la Posada Embrujada y que los <rgb=#FF0000>mirar</rgb> detenidamente para ayudarle a conocer la zona.","A pesar de su reputación, Bingo quiere ver el interior del Bosque Negro, pero los Elfos de Lothlórien están iniciando un asalto contra Dol Guldur y no desean poner en peligro al hobbit.","El pueblo de Audaghaim es una carcasa calcinada. Solo quedan los restos de los edificios","Faelleron está bajo un saliente en el borde noroeste del Bosque de Oro, cerca de la frontera con Fanuidhol.\
\
Bingo quiere demostrar que no tiene miedo a los orcos y quiere que os ofrezcáis voluntarios para luchar contra los enemigos de Lórien en Fanuidhol.","<rgb=#FF0000>Mirar</rgb> a lo lejos desde el puente junto a la cascada al este de la Posada Embrujada","Calengoth está en los muelles de Lothlórien, al oeste de Imlad Lalaith.\
\
Has obtenido el permiso para luchar contra los enemigos de Lothlórien que Bingo esperaba, y ahora él quiere que se lo muestres a Calengoth en los muelles.","Bingo ha obtenido permiso para seguir a la Hueste Dorada hacia el Bosque Negro. Ahora debes obtener acceso al Bosque Negro completando 'Libro 9, Prólogo: La Orilla Oscura' hablando con Calengoth en los muelles de Lothlórien y completando su cadena de misiones hasta 'Asalto a la Colina'."}},
[878]={nameES="A Tedious Search",objectivesES={"Search for Captain Lachír","At last, Iadan lifts his gaze. His eyes widen in surprise when he sees you are no common soldier. You explain that you have come looking for Captain Lachír.\
\
'Well now, we were hardly with him long, were we? Got a ways down the road, saw some refuse and he set us on it. Seemed to think some treasure, real treasure, might be just under the next bit of rubble. I cannot rightly say he set out with that in mind, but the idea seemed to seize him, somehow, if you understand me.'\
\
A distant look comes into his eyes.\
\
'It comes to me now that we may have been the lucky ones.'","Talk to the soldiers","Talk to Iadan again","You should talk to the soldiers you found scrabbling among the rubble.","A Tedious Search","Captain Lachír left with a search party yesterday and has not returned.","You find several soldiers scrabbling among the refuse on the ground","The Captain was last seen turning south off the main road as they made their way farther into Udûn.","The rummaging soldiers can be found east of the Foothold, south of Udûn's central road.\
\
Now that you have helped with the rummaging some, you should try talking to the soldiers again.","The rummaging soldiers can be found east of the Foothold, south of Udûn's central road.\
\
Several men were left to rummage among refuse. You should help them check chests to speed up their burdensome task."}},
[879]={nameES="A Tenuous Grasp",objectivesES={}},
[880]={nameES="Un Hilo Frágil",objectivesES={"Los Angmarim están al oeste de Gath Forthnír, cerca de Carn Dûm.\
\
Areneth dijo que una demostración de fuerza podría quebrar el espíritu de los Angmarim leales a Mordor. Te pidió que recogieras las armas de aquellos que derrotes.","Lleva las armas a Areneth","Los Angmarim, siervos del Señor Oscuro, amenazan a los Montaraces de Gath Forthnír.","Areneth está en Gath Forthnír, al este de Carn Dûm.\
\
Debes regresar con Areneth con las armas que capturaste.","Un Hilo Frágil"}},
[881]={nameES="A Terrible Foundation",objectivesES={"After purchasing the deed to the land upon which it sits from the Kindred of the Coins, Phenâsh hopes to demolish the ruins of the Shrine of He-Who-Sees-All in the Sail-haven.","Talk to Phenâsh at the Shrine of He-Who-Sees-All","A Terrible Foundation","Rubble can be found at the ruined Shrine of He-Who-Sees-All in the Sail-haven of Umbar Baharbêl.\
\
Phenâsh has asked you to help clear the rubble at the ruined Shrine of He-Who-Sees-All.","Phenâsh can be found at the ruined Shrine of He-Who-Sees-All in the Sail-haven of Umbar Baharbêl.\
\
You attempted to destroy the rubble at the Shrine of He-Who-Sees-All, but you were attacked by several frothing shrine-spirits. You should talk to Phenâsh."}},
[882]={nameES="A Test of Desolation",objectivesES={"Collect a sample of water at the Slag-hills","A Test of Desolation","Soil and mushrooms can be found somewhere within the southern reaches of the Dead Marshes or upon the battle plain. The Slag-hills can be found due east of Haerondir.\
\
Mílgamel has asked you to seek samples of mushrooms, soil, and the brackish waters of the Slag-hills. You should obtain these samples and then return to her.","After acquiring the sample of trollstrife, Mílgamel is curious to learn of the state of the water and soil in the Wastes, as well as that of any plants that still cling to life.","Mílgamel can be found at Haerondir.\
\
You have gathered the samples that Mílgamel requested and should now return to her at Haerondir.","Deliver the samples to Mílgamel at Haerondir","This foetid water is awash with small chunks of slag..."}},
[883]={nameES="A Test of Information",objectivesES={}},
[884]={nameES="Un ladrón en la noche",objectivesES={"Lleva los hongos de Maggot a Atherol Tuk","Habla con Atherol Tuk","Un ladrón en la noche","Los saqueadores de gran habilidad no se encuentran fácilmente hoy en día, especialmente si no desean ser encontrados.","Atherol Tuk está en el Campamento de Adso, sobre El Gran Camino del Este, entre Bree y Los Gamos.\
\
Atherol está esperando hablar contigo sobre tu expedición a la granja del granjero Maggot."}},
[885]={nameES="A Thirst for Blood",objectivesES={}},
[886]={nameES="A Thorn in Their Side",objectivesES={"Barallas can be found to the east of Drû Vádokan.\
\
You have dealt a crippling blow to the smiths of Isengard within the Balewood. Their tools are shattered, their numbers thinned, and their fires extinguished.","Orc-smiths and their tools can be found inside Drû Vádokan in north-west Balewood.\
\
Barallas has asked that you defeat the Orc-smiths in the Balewood and shatter their tools in hopes that their flames and axes will no longer be used against the inhabitants of the forest.","Talk to Barallas outside Drû Vádokan","The Orc-smiths of the Balewood fuel the war effort through their weaponry and fires throughout the forest. Until they are defeated and their tools destroyed, peace cannot return to the Balewood.","A Thorn in Their Side"}},
[887]={nameES="A Thorn in the Hand",objectivesES={"Completed The Rings of Isengard","Andras suggested only one course of action to remove the threat of Saruman's rings: enter Orthanc, face Saruman, take the rings, and destroy them.","Completed the Into the Pit of Abomination","Andras has asked you to enter the Ring of Isengard, the eaves of Fangorn, and the Pits of Isengard and disrupt Saruman's war-efforts.","Completed Dargnákh's Rage","Talk to Andras at the Ox-clan encampment","Completed Ringing of the Hammer","Complete Into the Pit of Abomination in the Pits of Isengard 3-man instance","Complete Dargnákh's Rage in the Dargnákh Unleashed 3-man instance","Andras is at the Ox-clan encampment in Nan Curunír.\
\
You should return at once to Andras with news of your success and your discovery within Saruman's Foundry.","Complete Ringing of the Hammer in the Foundry 6-man instance","Complete The Rings of Isengard in the Tower of Isengard 12-man Raid","Andras escaped from the dungeons of Isengard. From his vantage point in the Ox-clan encampment, he saw Isengard empty and march south. The opportunity to exact his revenge on Saruman of Many Colours was beyond his ability to resist, and he sent forth a call through the Boar-clan resistance to all who would heed to come to Nan Curunír and make a stand against the White Hand.","Complete Protecting the Forest in the Fangorn's Edge 3-man instance","Andras has asked you to enter Saruman's Foundry, defeat the wizard's acolyte, Penrith, and destroy the forge to prevent more weapons of evil power from coming into existence.","Andras is at the Ox-clan encampment in Nan Curunír.\
\
You should return to Andras and tell him that Saruman's rings of power have been destroyed.","Talk to Andras at the Ox-clan encampment in Nan Curunír","A Thorn in the Hand","Andras is at the Ox-clan encampment in Nan Curunír.\
\
You should return to Andras with news of your successes.","Completed Protecting the Forest"}},
[888]={nameES="A Threat Defanged",objectivesES={}},
[889]={nameES="A Threat Ended",objectivesES={}},
[890]={nameES="A Threat Unseen",objectivesES={"Examine the boot-print","Cabed is atop a small hill along the southern road in Parth Celebrant.\
\
You should bring the twisted blade to Cabed.","You do not see anymore boot-prints, but a glint in the distance across the water catches your eye","You see a fading boot-print in the mud nearby","You should examine the glint you saw in the distance.","Cabed has sent you to investigate the outskirts of Ost Celebrant near the Rushgore where he believes that an unknown force passed through before entering the ruin.","Follow the trail of boot-prints","Talk to Cabed","Examine the glint in the distance","You see another boot-print nearby","You see a trail of boot-prints leading into the distance","Find the wanderer's trail outside Ost Celebrant","You have found a dulled and twisted blade of strange make","A Threat Unseen","Cabed has sent you to track down a mysterious invader's trail. The trail ends at the bridge to Ost Celebrant, but Cabed is unsure where it begins."}},
[891]={nameES="Una amenaza de arañas",objectivesES={"Arco de Sprigley recogido","Cal Sprigley se puede encontrar al norte de las ruinas de la Posada del Tejón Loco en Archet.\
\
Después de que las arañas atacaran su granja, Cal Sprigley y su esposa huyeron a la seguridad de Archet. Atli Matarañas te ha pedido que hables con el granjero.","Recoge la caja fuerte de Sprigley","Cal Sprigley y su esposa te esperan al norte de las ruinas de la Posada del Tejón Loco en Archet.\
\
Cal y Holly Sprigley están esperando en Archet las pertenencias que recuperaste de su granja infestada de arañas. Deberías regresar a verlos de inmediato.","Saco de semillas de Sprigley recogido","Recoge el saco de semillas de Sprigley","La granja de Cal Sprigley ha sido invadida por arañas. El granjero y su esposa huyeron a Archet, dejando atrás sus pertenencias.","Una amenaza de arañas","Recoge el arco de Sprigley","La granja de Cal Sprigley está al sur del Capricho de Bronwe.\
\
Cal Sprigley te ha pedido que vayas a su granja y recuperes su caja fuerte, saco de semillas y arco. Con estas cosas, podría ser capaz de comenzar de nuevo.","Habla con Cal Sprigley en Archet","Lleva el saco de semillas, el arco y la caja fuerte a Cal Sprigley","Caja fuerte de Sprigley recogida"}},
[892]={nameES="A Threat from the Shore",objectivesES={"Frightened townsfolk can be found in Dínadab in northern Lamedon.\
\
You should question townsfolk about the sighting of corsairs.","You see tents sprawling as far as the eye can see in the shady swamp to the east...","Find the watchman and tell him about the Corsairs","The watchman cannot help, for all the soldiers of Dínadab have followed Prince Imrahil to war","The townspeople of Dínadab have reported sightings of Corsairs over the ridge to the east.","This townsperson reports having seen the beginning of a Corsair invasion of the town south of Dínadab","Speak with Gladion","Este es un buen punto de vista","Limril had a terrible dream about Fuirion, and woke to find him gone","This townsperson mentions that the invaders' tents could be seen from the east ridge","A Threat from the Shore","Gladion stands outside the Watchman's home in Dínadab in northern Lamedon.\
\
You should speak with Gladion about Fuirion.","The ridge that may offer a view of the Corsair camp can be found to the east of Dínadab.\
\
You should <rgb=#FF0000>look</rgb> over the ridge towards the east.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This quest requires emotes.</rgb>","<rgb=#FF0000>Look</rgb> eastward for signs of Corsairs from atop the ridge","Gladion is determined to rescue Fuirion","The Watchman of Dínadab can be found standing outside of his home in northern Lamedon.\
\
You should speak with the watchman.","Ask the watchman for help in rescuing Fuirion"}},
[893]={nameES="Una amenaza para Pembar",objectivesES={"Pembar se encuentra al noreste de Echad Eregion y al sureste de Glâd Ereg.\
\
Faenhilith te ha pedido que viajes a Pembar y elimines al padre de sierpes Nethgarch.","Aunque los sierpes de Pembar probablemente estén dirigidos por una matrona, no puede haber descendencia sin un padre.","Faenhilith está en Echad Eregion, al suroeste de Pembar.\
\
Debes regresar a Faenhilith e informarle de tu victoria sobre Nethgarch.","Nethgarch, padre de sierpes, derrotado","Una amenaza para Pembar","Habla con Faenhilith en Echad Eregion"}},
[894]={nameES="A Thunder of Boughs",objectivesES={}},
[895]={nameES="A Thunder of Drums",objectivesES={"Lúlstrok can be found in the north-western reaches of the Gladden Fields.\
\
A bunting has delivered a message on Radagast's behalf asking you to investigate and drive out the Orkish presence in the Gladden Fields.","Unmistakably held by the remnants of the Shapag-hai in the Vales, Lúlstrok is heavily-fortified","A Thunder of Drums","The leader of the Shapag-hai can be found somewhere in Lúlstrok.\
\
You should seek out and defeat the leader of the Shapag-hai in Lúlstrok.","A tribe of Orcs known as the Shapag-hai has invaded the Gladden Fields, polluting its marshlands and threatening the inhabitants of the Vales of Anduin.","As the sound of drums echoes through Lúlstrok, a harsh voice rises within the tent","Siege-towers can be found in Lúlstrok.\
\
Aware that the Shapag-hai have siege-towers for some as of yet known purpose, you have been advised to sabotage the Orcs' siege-towers and keep them from inflicting more harm on the Gladden Fields.","Investigate Lúlstrok","As you stand and curiously look at the bunting, it lowers its beak to point at a small scroll bound to its leg. You take the scroll and begin to read it.\
\
The scroll contains hasty writing which you swiftly identify as the writing of Radagast the Brown. As you read on, Radagast explains that a company of Orcs who survived the end of the War has now made camp at a place they call Lúlstrok in the Gladden Fields. Radagast's writing continues and he describes how until a few days ago the Orcs had apparently often feuded with the Men and half-orcs in the centre of the Gladden Fields, but they did not seem to pose a serious threat to the Wilderfolk. However, Radagast now fears they have been stirred by the words of a large Orc among their number and as a consequence, they have grown more bold in recent days. Troubled by the harm their siege engines might inflict on the Gladden Fields and concerned that the Orcs might soon attack the Beornings and Woodmen, Radagast concludes by asking you to drive off the Orcs and damage their siege engines beyond repair.\
 \
As the bunting remains perched nearby, you decide to investigate Lúlstrok.","Durbkhat falls defeated, but his last words echo in your mind","The bunting can be found near Lúlstrok in the Gladden Fields.\
\
You have done much to repel the Shapag-hai in the Gladden Fields, and you should now return to the bunting and send it to inform Radagast that you have drive out the Orkish presence in the Gladden Fields.","Find and defeat the leader of the Shapag-hai in Lúlstrok","Deliver tidings of the Shapag-hai's defeat to the bunting","The bunting appears to have awaited your return. It points its beak at its leg, and you realize it intends to return to Radagast with the scroll.\
\
You turn over the scroll and begin to write on the side Radagast left blank. You tell Radagast of victory over the Shapag-hai in the Vales of Anduin. However, you mention that the Orcs once loyal to Mazog now seek vengeance against the dwarves who escaped the downfall of the Iron Garrison. Whether they resurface in days soon to come or many years from now, the battle for Moria is not yet ended and a vigil must be kept.\
\
You roll the scroll and bind it to the bunting's leg. It chirps in what you take to be a friendly farewell and flies off."}},
[896]={nameES="A Time for Rebuilding",objectivesES={"A Time for Rebuilding","Some of the wooden fences around Thrymm's Farm are broken or in need of repair, and there are tools scattered about the farm. All of the tools and broken fences can be found in the fields.","The tools you picked up should be returned to Oter to be put away properly. He can be found by the large barn near the centre of Thrymm's Farm.","Bring the tools back to Oter","Thrymm's Farm, once a cornerstone of the Forlaw marketplace, has fallen on hard times of late. However, the farmers are working hard to repair the farm and prepare it for growing crops again."}},
[897]={nameES="A Time to be Alone",objectivesES={}},
[898]={nameES="A Timely Rescue",objectivesES={"You and Amarion have escaped from the Black Dens","Amarion is in the Black Dens, south-east of Echad Dagoras.\
\
Braigiar has asked you to find Amarion and rescue him from the Shadow-wolves.","Find Amarion the Ranger near the Black Dens","Help Amarion escape from the Black Dens","Amarion is at the Black Dens, south-east of Echad Dagoras.\
\
Amarion has asked for your help to escape from the Black Dens.","Amarion left camp to search the Black Dens where he believed he might find some way to destroy the Shadow-wolves -- but he has been gone too long.","Amarion is at Echad Dagoras, north-west of the Black Dens.\
\
You should speak with Amarion about your escape from the Shadow-wolves.","A Timely Rescue","Talk to Amarion at Echad Dagoras"}},
[899]={nameES="Una pizca de verde",objectivesES={"Los caparazones de los norbog de arena pueden parecer marrones por fuera, por por dentro son de un verde brillante.","Los caparazones de norbog pueden obtenerse de los nerbyg de arena en las dunas al sur del Barandalf, al norte de Dwaling.\
\
Perla Buenavista te ha pedido que consigas caparazones de los nerbyg que viven en las dunas.","Perla Buenavista está en la casa de Hob Cimacolina, justo en el exterior de Dwaling.\
\
Perla Buenavista querrá empezar a extraer el verde los caparazones de norbog tan pronto como sea posible.","Una pizca de verde","Lleva los caparazones de norbog a Perla Buenavista en Dwaling"}},
[900]={nameES="Un símbolo de valor",objectivesES={"Ragnarr Cuernollama fue a vivir entre los Hijos de la Tierra, pero una traición reciente los ha vuelto desconfiados.","Un símbolo de valor","Lleva el cráneo de urochs a Ragnarr.","Recoge el cráneo de urochs","Cráneo de urochs recogido","El cráneo de urochs se puede encontrar en el territorio de los huargos al noreste del campamento de los Hijos de la Tierra.\
\
Para recuperar la confianza de los Hijos de la Tierra, Ragnarr Cuernollama te ha pedido que recojas un cráneo de urochs del tótem en las colinas del este de Nan Amlug y se lo lleves al campamento de los Hijos de la Tierra. Un grupo de huargos merodea actualmente por este territorio."}},
[901]={nameES="A Torn Ledger",objectivesES={"The ledger is with Andras' belongings in his caravan on the northern road in Starkmoor.\
\
The pages should be placed back within the ledger.","The pages fit back within the ledger, and it closes smoothly. Care will need to be taken to make sure they do not fly out, but at least they have all been returned.","A Torn Ledger","Return the pages to the ledger","The ledger's pages detailed the items at Andras' estate that are ready for auction: a very important list for a man in desperate need of money.","It would take much more time than Andras has to reassemble this ledger from scratch. The pages must be found and returned.","Most of the pages of this ledger have been ripped out and taken. The few remaining pages appear to detail crop amounts and various household items. This is most likely an accounting of all goods Andras has at his homestead.\
\
The missing pages are vital if he is to put together a respectable auction. The Dragon-clan raiders must have taken the pages with them.","The missing pages of the ledger have been taken by the Dragon-clan raiders in the hills to the east of the broken caravan.\
\
You should recover the missing pages of Andras' ledger."}},
[902]={nameES="A Tortured Mind",objectivesES={}},
[903]={nameES="A Touch of Twistbeard",objectivesES={"A Touch of Twistbeard","Although Edash discovered a cure for the Orkish poisons used by Azog and his clan, it has proven difficult to maintain a supply of twistbeard.","Deliver the twistbeard to Thorin at Amdân","Twistbeard can found on rocks in Azanulbizar.\
\
Thorin has asked you to gather twistbeard for the Dwarves of the Haban'akkâ.","Thorin can be found at Amdân.\
\
You have collected a great deal of twistbeard and should now deliver it to Thorin."}},
[904]={nameES="Un Recorrido por Bree",objectivesES={"Tad Cortahoja está fuera del pabellón de caza, al que puedes llegar siguiendo el camino fuera de la Sala de Subastas de Bree hacia el oeste hasta su final.\
\
Se te ha indicado que hables con Tad Cortahoja.","La Sala de Subastas de Bree está al este, pasando la Puerta de los Leñadores, luego al sur.\
\
Dawn Manzanadorada te instruyó que hablaras con uno de los subastadores en la Sala de Subastas.","La Fuente del Jabalí está un poco al norte de la Sala de Artesanía de Tres Partos.\
\
Bonny Techador te dijo que hablaras con el Segundo vigilante Heathstraw en la Fuente del Jabalí en la Plaza del Mercado.","Un Recorrido por Bree","Dirígete hacia el sur al salir de la Taxidermia de Espinablanca; antes de llegar a la estatua del enano, gira a la izquierda, hacia el este, y avanza hasta la Escalera del Erudito. Entra y habla con Newbold Cortahoja.\
\
Clar Espinablanca te indicó que hablaras con Newbold Cortahoja dentro de la Escalera del Erudito.","Graeme Tenderlarch está en el Ayuntamiento de Bree, casi directamente al noroeste desde la Puerta Sur.\
\
Tad Cortahoja te dijo que regresaras con Graeme Tenderlarch.","Habla con un subastador","La Posada del Poney Pisador está al norte de la Plaza del Mercado.\
\
Lalia te ha indicado que hables con Cebadilla Mantecona, propietario de la Posada del Poney Pisador.","Habla con el Vigilante Cardoon en Bree","La Sala de Artesanía de Tres Partos se encuentra al norte del Ayuntamiento de Bree, pasando por la Puerta del Comerciante.\
\
Graeme Tenderlarch te ha pedido entrar en la Sala de Artesanía de Tres Partos y hablar con Bonny Techador.","Habla con Tad Gardener en la bóveda","Habla con Clar Espinablanca en la Taxidermia de Espinablanca","Harry Goatleaf se encuentra en la Puerta Oeste, al oeste de la casa de Lirio Hojarena.\
\
Lirio Hojarena te dijo que hablaras con Harry Goatleaf.","Habla con el alcalde Graeme Tenderlarch en el Ayuntamiento de Bree","Habla con Lirio Hojarena en su casa","Habla con Bonny Techador en la Sala de Artesanía de Tres Partos","Habla con Tad Cortahoja en el pabellón de caza","Habla con Newbold Cortahoja","El Vigilante Cardoon está al este de la Puerta Oeste de Bree.\
\
Harry Goatleaf te dijo que hablaras con el Vigilante Cardoon.","Encontrarás la Taxidermia de Espinablanca al otro lado del camino frente a la Bóveda de Bree.\
\
Te dijeron que hablaras con Clar Espinablanca en la Taxidermia de Espinablanca.","La Cárcel de Bree se encuentra siguiendo el camino hacia el este a través de Bree, mas allá del Ayuntamiento, luego girando hacia el sur.\
\
Mat Matosos sugirió que hablaras con Lirio Manzanadorada en la Cárcel de Bree.","Habla con Maud Dedalera en la bóveda","El Mercado de Lalia está justo al norte de la Fuente del Jabalí en la Plaza del Mercado.\
\
El Segundo-vigilante Heathstraw te ha sugerido que explores el Mercado de Lalia y hables con la propietaria.","Habla con Cebadilla Mantecona en la Posada del Poney Pisador","Habla con Mat Matosos en el Callejón del Mendigo","Mat Matosos se encuentra en el Callejón del Mendigo, al suroeste desde la Escalera del Erudito, luego al oeste bajo la Puerta del Lodo desde el Barrio de Piedra.\
\
Newbold Cortahoja te dijo que hablaras con Mat Matosos después.","La bóveda se encuentra al sur del Vigilante Cardoon. Él te dijo que siguieras el camino y buscaras el gran edificio de piedra protegido por dos guardias.\
\
El Vigilante Cardoon te indicó que hablaras con Tad Gardener o con Maud Dedalera en la bóveda.","Habla con el Segundo vigilante Heathstraw cerca de la Fuente del Jabalí","Habla con Lalia dentro del Mercado de Lalia","Habla con Harry Goatleaf en la Puerta Oeste","Habla con Lirio Manzanadorada en la cárcel de Bree","La casa de Lirio Hojarena está al oeste de la Posada del Poney Pisador.\
\
Cebadilla Mantecona te dijo que hablaras con Lirio Hojarena en su casa.","El alcalde de Bree, Graeme Tenderlarch, pensó que te gustaría familiarizarte con la ciudad propiamente dicha. Te ha enviado a la plaza para comenzar un recorrido por las calles y visitar la ciudad."}},
[905]={nameES="Un Recorrido por la Feria de los Granjeros",objectivesES={"Parece que el alcalde Pieblanco ha estado disfrutando un poco demasiado de la comida últimamente","En la Comarca, se suele pescar en el lugar de pesca que está justo al norte de Delagua.\
\
Dirígete al estanque para saber si la pesca forma parte de la Feria de los Granjeros.","Mmm... ¡Hongos!","Godo Ciñatiesa mencionó algo sobre un evento en la granja de Arenilla...","La Carrera de los Huevos parece una locura... ¡Ahora vayamos a Bamfurlargo!","Wymarc Cavada está en la granja de Arenilla en la Comarca, justo al este de Cavada Grande y Cavada Pequeña.\
\
Habla con Wymarc Cavada sobre la Carrera de los Huevos.","Viaja a Bamfurlargo para ver los deliciosos y tentadores hongos","La Pregonera del Festival, Caltha Tunelero, debería conocer un atajo a la granja de Arenilla.\
\
Habla con Caltha Tunelero una vez más.","Bamfurlargo, la famosa granja de Maggot, se encuentra en Marjala, en el extremo sureste de la Comarca. Allí es donde tiene lugar el robo de hongos. Se puede llegar a la granja viajando a caballo desde Delagua.\
\
Habla con Osbert Barroso en Bamfurlargo.","Habla con la pregonera del festival, Caltha Tunelero, en Delagua","Un caballo está listo para llevarte a la granja de Arenilla de inmediato","Habla con el alcalde Pieblanco en la Feria de los Granjeros","Caltha Tunelero, la Pregonera del Festival, está en la Feria de los Granjeros en Delagua.\
\
Habla con Caltha Tunelero para terminar el recorrido por la Feria de los Granjeros.","Habla con Godo Ciñatiesa en el estanque de Delagua","Habla sobre la Carrera de los Huevos con Caltha Tunelero, la pregonera del festival","Viaja a la granja de Arenilla para ver la Carrera de los Huevos","El alcalde Pieblanco se encuentra en el centro de Delagua durante el festival de la Feria de los Granjeros.\
\
Habla con el alcalde Pieblanco.","Un Recorrido por la Feria de los Granjeros"}},
[906]={nameES="A Trail Marked Indagir",objectivesES={"The spills are getting closer together","Search the waggon","This seems like the same substance you encountered in Thaurisgar. There is a trail of broken phials.\
\
You should follow the trail leading into Tumladen.","The bile spills have led to Tumladen and keep going further into town.","This one is headed into Tumladen","The waggon is abandoned with evidence of recent use.\
\
Inside the waggon are scattered phials of a green ichor that look eerily similar to you.\
\
Beside the waggon is a spilled phial. There could have been a struggle here.","The trail has led to a dead end","The trail is getting shorter and shorter and must end soon.","A Trail Marked Indagir","Follow the trail up the road","Talk to waggon driver","The trail seems to have led to a dead end.","Follow the trail further into town","You found an abandoned waggon with phials of a familiar substance. This could be the mode of transport Indagir used.\
\
You should search the waggon to support your theory.","This one leads up the road to the right","The bile spills seem to follow the road into Tumladen.","Indagir once again seems to have escaped","Follow the trail of spills into Tumladen","You found an abandoned waggon with traces of a vile ichor that reminds you of the same substance found in Thaurisgar.","It goes further into Tumladen","The trail of spilled substance has led you to an injured waggon driver.","It seems to follow the road","The scattered phials have left a trail","There is an injured waggon driver"}},
[907]={nameES="A Trail in the Entwash",objectivesES={"You spy a footprint leading farther into the marshlands","Look for a trail in the Mouths of Entwash that might lead you to Malhar.","You find a young man standing in the clearing","Go up the hill","Another footprint. He must have gone this way.","A streak of recently dried mud points up the hill","A Trail in the Entwash","The last clue in the trail points up a hill, deep in the Mouths of Entwash. You should see what is there.","The footprint is clear and it points north","Togbor believes his younger brother Malhar fled into the Mouths of the Entwash after escaping their captors.","Talk to the young man","Follow the trail in the Mouths of Entwash that might lead you to Malhar.","Search for a trail","Follow the trail","Talk to the young man in the clearing on the hill in the Mouths of Entwash.","Another footprint points northward"}},
[908]={nameES="A Trail of Vengeance",objectivesES={}},
[909]={nameES="A Traitor in the Midst?",objectivesES={"Bring the brigands' note to Thane Ordlac","A Traitor in the Midst?","You found a note signed with an 'S' upon the body of a brigand while trying to recover the goods stolen from Oserley.","DNT -- Will not be seen","Thane Ordlac is in the Mead Hall of Oserley.\
\
Dudsig asked you to bring the note you found to Thane Ordlac."}},
[910]={nameES="A Trap Sprung",objectivesES={"Tirneldir has asked you to return to Lindil back near the northern gate in upper Lond Cirion.","Search for Tirneldir at the fish traps outside the southern gate","A Trap Sprung","Arthiel said you might find Tirneldir near the fish traps to the south. Investigate to see if you can find out what happened to them.","Arthiel has not seen Tirneldir for some time and told you he may be at his fish traps to the south of Lond Cirion.","There was no sign of Tirneldir at the fish traps just outside of the southern gate in Lond Cirion, he may be at other traps nearby.","You have found Tirneldir outside of the southern gate in Lond Cirion. You should speak with him as he appears injured and scared.","You see an injured man near the building ahead","Speak with Tirneldir","Helped Lindil find her missing spouse","There is no sign of Tirneldir. You see more traps on the western shore","You have successfully defended Tirneldir","Check the area for signs of Tirneldir","Return to Lindil"}},
[911]={nameES="A Trap Upon Emyn Duir",objectivesES={"You have set all of Terna's traps in the Emyn Duir encampments. It would be best not to return to Halroth unless absolutely necessary, for if you were followed you might endanger the secrecy of the mission. But you know Terna would be satisfied by the thought of enemies stumbling into her traps within their own camps, and you can't help but smile.","Terna has devised a plan to trap enemy forces within their own encampments.","Set traps in Matum Graz","Set traps in Urshúlagar","Set many traps in encampments throughout Emyn Duir.","A Trap Upon Emyn Duir","Enemy encampments can be found throughout Emyn Duir.\
\
You should hide traps at these encampments to confuse the enemy forces within.","This is a good place to set a trap","Completado","Set traps in Angathrai"}},
[912]={nameES="Una Trampa para la Criatura",objectivesES={"Lleva las flechas a Wistan","Garbert está en su cabaña al sur de Echad Candelleth, en una bifurcación del río Bruinen.\
\
Deberías hablar con Garbert acerca de la criatura.","Garbert ha ideado un plan para atrapar a la criatura sigilosa.","Habla con Garbert y lleva a cabo su plan para capturar a la criatura","Habla con Garbert","Una Trampa para la Criatura","Garbert está en su cabaña al sur de Echad Candelleth, en una bifurcación del río Bruinen.\
\
Debes hablar con Garbert cuando puedas llevar a cabo su plan para capturar a la criatura.","Wistan está en su hoguera en Echad Candelleth, el campamento élfico en Tâl Bruinen, al norte de la cabaña de Garbert.\
\
Garbert sugirió que devolvieras las flechas de Wistan."}},
[913]={nameES="Una grieta traicionera",objectivesES={"El mineral se puede encontrar en los depósitos y en los rascacuevas que merodean la grieta al sur de Zelem-melek.\
\
Deberías recoger mineral de esta zona.","Has conseguido muchos minerales raros de la traicionera grieta en el sur de Zelem-melek.","Completado","Has descubierto una profunda grieta en los límites al sur de Zelem-melek, llena de depósitos de mineral sin explotar.","Una grieta traicionera"}},
[914]={nameES="A Treasure Recovered",objectivesES={}},
[915]={nameES="Un tesoro en azul",objectivesES={"Escapa antes de que aparezcan más Ordâkhai.","Recupera el segundo volumen del libro \\qLos Viajes de Kábuzar\\q de los Salones de Lajór en Zajâna.","Recupera \\qLos Viajes de Kábuzar Volumen II\\q","\\qLos Viajes de Kábuzar Volumen I\\q recuperado","Recupera el primer volumen del libro \\qLos Viajes de Kábuzar\\q de los Salones de Lajór en Zajâna.","\\qLos Viajes de Kábuzar Volumen II\\q recuperado","Escapa con los libros antes de que suene la alarma y lleguen más Ordâkhai.","Un tesoro en azul","Recupera \\qLos Viajes de Kábuzar Volumen I\\q","El Consejo de las Joyas ha robado un libro de gran importancia histórica para los Pohâni titulado \\qLos Viajes de Kábuzar\\q, separado en dos volúmenes. Ahora pretenden destruirlo. Por favor, recupera el libro de los Salones de Lajór.","Escapa con los libros antes de que lleguen más Ordâkhai."}},
[916]={nameES="A Tree-ish Slumber",objectivesES={"Quickbeam can be found at Derndingle in south-eastern Fangorn Forest.\
\
You have found one of Quickbeam's Huorns, and it seemed eager to return to his side. You should speak with Quickbeam.","Quickbeam's Huorn can be found to the south-west of Derndingle.\
\
You have found a Huorn that appears to be sleeping, but still aware. You should poke it and see if it responds.","This Huorn has been slain by the insects and wood-trolls of the forest","Search for Quickbeam's Huorn","Quickbeam desires to find Huorns he once tended in Fangorn Forest, as he will need all the help he can muster to reclaim the forest.","DNT -- Will not be seen","The Huorn stirs from its rest, and begins walking towards Derndingle","Talk to Quickbeam","Another of Quickbeam's Huorns can be found to the west of Derndingle.\
\
Quickbeam has asked you to seek out one of his Huorns in Fangorn Forest. After finding the first Huorn turned tree-ish, you should continue your search.","Quickbeam's Huorn can be found to the south-west of Derndingle in Fangorn Forest.\
\
You have discovered two of Quickbeam's Huorns, but they were slain or tree-ish. You should search for Quickbeam's Huorn in the last location he mentioned.","<rgb=#FF00FF>Poke</rgb> at Quickbeam's Huorn","A Tree-ish Slumber","This Huorn has gone tree-ish and will not awake as others might","One of Quickbeam's Huorns can be found to the north of Derndingle.\
\
Quickbeam has asked you to seek out one of his Huorns in Fangorn Forest as he hopes to ask for their aid."}},
[917]={nameES="Un temblor bajo los pies...",objectivesES={"Has derrotado a la amenaza en la escalera.","La fuente del temblor se encuentra en el campamento de trasgos de Khadar-zarâm, en la cima de la escalera.","Un temblor bajo los pies...","Completado","Al entrar en Khadar-zarâm, sentiste un gran temblor bajo tus pies...","Encuentra la fuente del temblor"}},
[918]={nameES="Un tributo de luz",objectivesES={"Los braseros se encuentran a los pies de las estatuas de los enanos a lo largo del borde norte de la Segunda sala de Nud-melek.\
\
Debes encender los braseros como tributo al fino trabajo en piedra de la época de Durin.","Svanr fue llamado a tu lado","Habla con Svanr en el Puente de Khazad-dûm","El Puente de Khazad-dûm está al este de los enanos de piedra en la Segunda sala.\
\
Debes viajar con Svanr al Puente de Khazad-dûm.","Svanr puede ser llamado con el cuerno.\
\
Debes hablar con Svanr.","Encuentra el Puente de Khazad-dûm con Svanr","Svanr está en el Puente de Khazad-dûm.","Un tributo de luz","Svanr ha sugerido que enciendas los braseros a los pies de las estatuas de los enanos que bordean la Segunda sala de Nud-melek.","Svanr desea encontrar el Puente de Khazad-dûm a continuación","Usa el cuerno de invocación para llamar a Svanr","Habla con Svanr (usa el cuerno para invocarlo)"}},
[919]={nameES="A Troublesome Shipment",objectivesES={"After helping to unload a ship, Tâbrim has reported that a strange creature escaped its crate and fled into the Sail-haven.","Henok can be found in a small alley in the Sail-haven.\
\
One of the Temámir, Henok, has arrived to collect his companion. You should talk to Henok.","Kindly offer the potato to the cave-claw","As you approach the cave-claw, you can tell that it is deeply distressed and overwhelmed by its new surroundings in Umbar Baharbêl.\
\
Deciding that it might be unwise to try to capture the creature yourself, you look about the alley and notice a few sacks of potatoes. You hope that offering it something in kindness might soothe the cave-claw's fears.","Sacks of potatoes can be found in a small alley in the Sail-haven.\
\
You have found the cave-claw, but it appears very uneasy. You should find something you can offer it to help calm it down.","A Troublesome Shipment","As Tâbrim suggested, the crate appears to have been broken from the inside!","The escaped creature can be found somewhere in the Sail-haven.\
\
Tâbrim informed you that the creature tore up some stonework as it fled into the Sail-haven. You should follow the damaged stonework and see where it leads.","The broken crate can be found near Tâbrim on the piers of the Sail-haven.\
\
Tâbrim has asked you to examine the broken crate. You should inspect the broken crate.","The stonework has been damaged by the frantic passage of the escaped creature","Collect a potato from one of the nearby sacks","To your surprise, a fearful cave-claw has taken refuge in this alley","Follow the trail of damaged stonework and find the escaped creature","Talk to Henok","Carefully approach the cave-claw","The cave-claw can be found in a small alley in the Sail-haven.\
\
You have found a fearful cave-claw, and it is clearly overwhelmed by its new home. You should carefully approach the cave-claw.","Examine the broken crate","That looks like a good one!","The cave-claw can be found in a small alley in the Sail-haven.\
\
You have collected a fine potato, and you should offer it to the frightened cave-claw.","Your kindness appears to have calmed the cave-claw, and you hear a voice behind you"}},
[920]={nameES="A Troubling Delay",objectivesES={"A Troubling Delay","Stanric is troubled by a late delivery from one of his men, Brifard, in Parth Celebrant. He wishes for you to seek out Brifard and discover why he is running so late.","Talk to Brifard","Brifard is stationed at a camp in northern Parth Celebrant near south-east Thinglad.\
\
Stanric has asked you to attend to one of his men, Brifard."}},
[921]={nameES="A Troubling Path",objectivesES={"Anborn recalls bringing Gollum forth to be questioned by Faramir shortly after his capture, and his fears for the journey of the Halflings and the gangrel-creature.","Talk to Anborn","Anborn can be found within Henneth Annûn in North Ithilien.\
\
Anborn has offered to tell you more of the strange Halflings and their time among the Rangers.","A Troubling Path","Anborn can be found within Henneth Annûn in North Ithilien.\
\
Anborn has finished his tale, and you should now ask him if there remains any more to tell.","Listen to Anborn's tale"}},
[922]={nameES="A Troubling Report",objectivesES={"The bridge along the Father's Path is out. You will need to find a way around.\
\
You should talk to Hórin.\
\
Use the summoning horn to call Hórin to your side.","Head south along the Father's Path","Find Molkha","The bridge along the Father's Path is impassable","A Troubling Report","A flare shoots up from the valley below","Molkha calls to you as you approach","Molkha has observed a troubling discourse between enemy forces.","You have found Molkha on the frozen lake south-west of Fellgát.\
\
You should talk to Molkha to receive her report.","Talk to Hórin in the valley","Speak to Molkha on the frozen lake south-west of Fellgát to hear her scouting report.\
\
You should complete 'Instance: A Troubling Report.'","Molkha should be somewhere near the frozen lake south-west of Fellgát.\
\
You should find Molkha with Hórin.","The time has come to travel high into the Welkin-lofts seeking Ausma's apprentices.\
\
You should head south with Hórin and travel along the Father's Path.","Talk to Molkha and hear her troubling report","Molkha should be somewhere near the frozen lake, south-west of Fellgát.\
\
You should talk to Molkha.","Talk to Molkha in the valley","Call Hórin and talk to him","Now that you have Molkha's report, it is time to move further up the mountain.\
\
You should talk to Hórin and decide how to proceed."}},
[923]={nameES="Un verdadero amigo / Una verdadera amiga de Holly Corneta",objectivesES={"Has recorrido toda la Comarca ayudando a devolver tartas en mal estado a Holly Corneta -- ¡no es poca hazaña!","Holly Corneta está al norte de la plaza principal de Hobbiton.\
\
Holly ha decidido darte una de sus recetas de tartas y te espera para hablar contigo."}},
[924]={nameES="Un verdadero amigo / Una verdadera amiga de Holly Corneta",objectivesES={"Has recorrido toda la Comarca ayudando a devolver tartas en mal estado a Holly Corneta -- ¡no es poca hazaña!","Holly Corneta está al norte de la plaza principal de Hobbiton.\
\
Holly ha decidido darte una de sus recetas de tartas y te espera para hablar contigo."}},
[925]={nameES="Un Verdadero Amigo / Una Verdadera Amiga del Correo Rápido",objectivesES={"El Maestro de Correos Ganapié está en Delagua, cerca del Agujero Municipal.\
\
El Maestro de Correos Ganapié te ha pedido hablar con él sobre algo.","Has ayudado a restaurar el buen nombre del Correo Rápido, y el Maestro de Correos Ganapié está encantado con lo que has hecho."}},
[926]={nameES="A Unique Taste",objectivesES={"A Unique Taste","Bíralad wants to treat the scouts of Sâr Marsag to a new meal and has asked you to gather crocodile meat and mushrooms from the Lair of the Shadlúgai to the north-east.","You have gathered mushrooms and crocodile meat that Bíralad needed for his recipe from the Lair of the Shadlúgai. Return to him in Sâr Marsag.","Return to Bíralad in Sâr Marsag"}},
[927]={nameES="A Valuables Lesson",objectivesES={"The ship docked to the east holds Kenza's valuables, but it also holds deadly mutineers.","A Valuables Lesson","Furious about the mutineers who stole her ship, Kenza wants you to help her retrieve her valuables from it.","Kenza is by the steps leading to the upper level in the Fleet-fast.","Bring her valuables to Kenza in the Fleet-fast"}},
[928]={nameES="La lista de vendedores",objectivesES={"La lista de vendedores","El mercado está muy concurrido, y muchos clientes en los puestos de venta tienen listas de vendedores que deben completarse.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando finalice el evento con el que está asociada.</rgb>","Reúne los productos de la lista de vendedores","Daisy Arenas está en su puesto en la Feria de los Granjeros de Delagua.\
\
Llévale a Daisy Arenas los productos que conseguiste.","Lleva los productos a Daisy Arenas","Eso no está en la lista...","Los productos de la lista de vendedores se pueden encontrar por toda Delagua durante la Feria de los Granjeros. La lista está en tu inventario.\
\
Recoge los productos de la lista de vendedores... ¡pero evita los que no estén en ella!"}},
[929]={nameES="A Vengeance of Sight",objectivesES={}},
[930]={nameES="A Venomous Culprit",objectivesES={"Erymeldir has asked you to do battle with the various spiders in the Limlight Gorge and gather the venom-glands from them. He hopes to discover which -- if any -- of the spiders might be responsible for Greylimb's affliction.","Talk to Twistroot the Ent","You should ask Twistroot about spiders in Fangorn Forest.","A Venomous Culprit","DNT","You should bring the venom-glands you collected from the spiders of the Limlight Gorge to Erymeldir at the Limlight Glade.","Bring the venom-glands to Erymeldir","Erymeldir has asked you and your allies to try to retrieve some poison-glands from the wandering spiders hunting the northern stretch of the Limlight Gorge, in the hopes of identifying the venom that has afflicted Greylimb the Ent.","Talk to Thickbark","You should ask Thickbark about spiders in Fangorn."}},
[931]={nameES="A Venomous Strike",objectivesES={}},
[932]={nameES="Una inaguración muy Boffin",objectivesES={"Habla con Bingo Boffin en la calle Aguamiel","Bingo Boffin está fuera de la nueva casa de Angélica en la calle Aguamiel.","Ahora que todo ha sido resuelto (esperemos) y todos los Boffin han vuelto, ¡es hora de que la fiesta de inauguración de la casa de Angélica comience!","Una inaguración muy Boffin","Habla con Prisca Boffin dentro del nº 8 de la calle Aguamiel y asiste a la fiesta de inauguración de la casa de su hija.","Prisca Boffin está en el nº 8 de la calle Aguamiel, y está lista para que la fiesta de inauguración de la casa empiece por fin."}},
[933]={nameES="A Very Brave Dog",objectivesES={"You have failed to lead Hírkha to safety","You have found Hírkha, a lost nether-hound as you travelled through Ilmabiri and have led her to safety at the guard post Kruha-sûrja. You should talk to Lebíthi.","You have found Hírkha, a lost nether-hound as you travelled through Ilmabiri. After introducing yourself to her, she seems willing to follow you. You should lead Hírkha to Kruha-sûrja, the guard post in the northern part of the sewers beneath the Sail-haven of Umbar Baharbêl.","Talk to Lebíthi","Lead Hírkha back to Lebíthi","You have been asked to stay on the look-out for a lost nether-hound as you travel through Ilmabiri.","A Very Brave Dog","You have found Hírkha, a lost nether-hound as you travelled through Ilmabiri. You should introduce yourself to her.","Introduce yourself to Hírkha","A child of the Sail-haven has lost her dog after it ran into the sewers chasing a rat. Lebíthi has asked you to keep an eye out for the dog while you traverse Ilmabiri.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This quest will fail if you are defeated or log out. If this occurs, it will be removed from your quest log and you will need to accept it again.</rgb>","Hírkha wags her tail and looks willing to follow you","You spot a small brown dog","Find the lost dog, Hírkha","Hírkha has reached safety"}},
[934]={nameES="Un Estómago Muy Vacío",objectivesES={"Los jabalíes salvajes, perfectos para carne o salchichas, pueden encontrarse merodeando por las afueras de Archet.\
\
Debes recoger carne de jabalí para la próxima comida de Mundo, para que no se muera de hambre.","Un Estómago Muy Vacío","Mundo Sacovilla-Bolsón aguarda tu regreso en la aldea de Archet.\
\
Debes llevar la carne de jabalí que recogiste a Mundo, quien probablemente se la coma toda. Solo esperas que sea suficiente para satisfacerlo.","Lleva a Mundo su almuerzo de carne fresca de jabalí","Esta misión no puede completarse fuera de la introducción.","Mundo Sacovilla-Bolsón, un compañero prisionero del campamento Montebruno, está naturalmente muy hambriento después del tormento, pues los hobbits tienen apetitos insaciables."}},
[935]={nameES="A Vicious Rumour",objectivesES={"Meet with Gûshida in the Upper Ward of Umbar Baharbêl about rumours relating to the mistreatment of animals.","Elder Ilaya has asked you to go to Umbar Baharbêl, the City of Corsairs, to investigate rumours of the mistreatment of animals by a man named Ezôti. You should meet with Gûshida in the Upper Ward.","A Vicious Rumour","Meet with Gûshida in the Upper Ward of Umbar Baharbêl"}},
[936]={nameES="A Vile Infestation",objectivesES={"Return to the Temámir Guard Captain Nûru","Return to the Temámir Guard Captain Nûru in Mekab-kuphâr, the Temámir outpost in the southern Khabârkhad.","A Vile Infestation","North of Mekab-kuphâr there is an area infested with spiders. You've been asked to thin their number, lest they over-run Khabârkhad and spill out into greater Umbar-môkh.","You've been asked to cull the number of spiders to the north of Mekab-kuphâr, in Nishabêt."}},
[937]={nameES="A Vile Trail",objectivesES={"Busca en el carro abandonado","Talk to Hadorion in Barad Faen","You found traces of a green ichor on the victim's clothes. You should report to Hadorion.\
\
Hadorion can be found in Barad Faen.","Talk to Hadorion","You found a shard of glass stained with the foul smelling ichor. You should return to Hadorion.\
\
Hadorion can be found in Barad Faen.","A body is found in the middle of the road through Barad Faen. Hadorion is investigating, and needs your help to catch the perpetrator.","Search the corpse","The clothes are stained with a green ichor, the stench is foul","Hadorion has asked you to search the body and see if you can find what he could not.","The woman has told you of someone new to town that seems distressed. You should search for them.","Hadorion wishes to speak to you in private, follow him into his hearth.","Follow Hadorion into the cabin","Talk to the distressed man","Look for his abandoned waggon","Hadorion has asked you to question the townsfolk of Barad Faen for more information on the mysterious ichor.","Talk to the anxious woman","The man has told you that his waggon was hijacked before arriving in Barad Faen and abandoned along the western exit of Barad Faen.","You found a shard of glass stained with ichor","Talk to the careful merchant","The substance is foreign to Barad Faen","Look for someone who is anxious and puzzled","The concerned merchant has told you the substance is foreign. You should question more townsfolk to see if they have noticed anything suspicious come through.","A Vile Trail"}},
[938]={nameES="A Vile Trail Marked by Sea",objectivesES={"You found a strange note with barely visible markings. Bring it back to Hadorion.\
\
Hadorion can be found in his cabin in Barad Faen.","Investigate the camp-site","Talk to Hadorion in Barad Faen","The note is barely readable. Maybe Hadorion can make sense of it.","Hadorion wants you to check on a new camp that has been erected to the north.","Hadorion has happened upon more information during his investigation.","A Vile Trail Marked by Sea"}},
[939]={nameES="A Vile Trail Marked by Shadow",objectivesES={"Hadorion wants your help preventing the culprit from making an escape by sea.","Solve the case of the Vile Trail","Hadorion has completed his investigation and needs your help to solve the case.","Talk to Hadorion","Hadorion wants to speak to you about further options pursuing Khâshap.\
\
Hadorion can be found in his cabin in Barad Faen.","A Vile Trail Marked by Shadow"}},
[940]={nameES="A Vile Trail Marked by Shadow",objectivesES={"Indagir, or Khâshap has made their escape. Talk to Hadorion for further instructions.","Hadorion wants your help preventing the culprit from making an escape by sea.","Follow Hadorion in confronting the true culprit to solve the case.","Hadorion has completed his investigation and needs your help to solve the case.","Confront Indagir","Talk to Hadorion","A Vile Trail Marked by Shadow"}},
[941]={nameES="A Vile Trail of Bile",objectivesES={"Follow the trail left by the suspicious figure","Search the camp-site","Follow the trail into the tree line","Talk to Hadorion in Barad Faen","The trail veers into the trees to a camp-site","The interloper dropped a strange looking cloth that should be identifiable. You should report to Hadorion.\
\
Hadorion can be found in his home in Barad Faen.","A witness saw a suspicious figure dart off following the western road during the night.","This shard is smaller. The trail keeps going","This shard matches. Keep following the road west","The smell is more foul on this. It continues west","This shard is quite large. The end is near","He was wearing a unique sash","The trail seems to follow the road west. Keep going","The trail has led you to an abandoned makeshift camp-site. Search for evidence of use.","A Vile Trail of Bile","Hadorion has asked you to pick up the trail of a suspicious figure spotted leaving Barad Faen at night.\
\
The trail should follow the western road."}},
[942]={nameES="Un villano revelado",objectivesES={"Has derrotado a Thrâng, y en el proceso, has aprendido que los Ghâshfra sirven al que todo lo ve. Eimyr, el jefe de los Eldgangs, debe ser informado de inmediato, porque ha sido engañado por el que todo lo ve y sin saberlo sirve a sus propósitos malvados.","Un villano revelado","Eimyr se encuentra en Norbar, en la Grieta de Nûrz Ghâshu.\
\
Has derrotado a Thrâng y tienes su arma como prueba de tu valor. Debes ir a Eimyr y contarle la traición del que todo lo ve.","Has derrotado a Thrâng y descubierto el complot del que todo lo ve.","Lleva la Espada de Thrâng a Eimyr en Norbar"}},
[943]={nameES="A Violent Slice of Winter",objectivesES={"Wherever Núrzum has decided to go, he has left Forlaw alone...for now","Wolves from distant lands now prowl the frozen plains to the south","You have come upon a great spire of ice and snow, and the chill in this spot cuts to your very bones. Uneasiness settles in as you stand in this place blinded by snow.\
\
You should look to the north, south, east, and west of this site for any signs of what you've encountered here.","This is a good spot to look eastward","The waters of the Isingmere are clear, and you see no sign of any artifact","A Violent Slice of Winter","The snow will be less blinding to the north, south, east, and west of this ice-spire near the Isingmere lake in the south-east Whithsaws.\
\
You should start by walking north and <rgb=#FF0000>look</rgb> for signs of what caused this strange structure to appear on the plains.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This quest requires emotes.</rgb>","Go north of the spire and <rgb=#FF0000>look</rgb> for signs","You have looked all around the ice spire for signs of what might have made it appear, and spied Núrzum's footprints heading westward.\
\
While it is clear that Núrzum left this strange mark upon the land, you saw no sign of any artifact or relic.","You have discovered a strange spire of ice and snow near the edge of the Isingmere, as if a terrible storm lingered in this one small spot.","Go south of the spire and <rgb=#FF0000>look</rgb> for signs","This is a good spot to look northward","Go east of the spire and <rgb=#FF0000>look</rgb> for signs","Investigate the ice-spire","Go west of the spire and <rgb=#FF0000>look</rgb> for signs","This is a good spot to look southward","Completado","This is a good spot to look westward","Núrzum's footprints lead away to the north-west, deeper into the Whitshaws, towards Dunfast"}},
[944]={nameES="Una visión de las profundidades",objectivesES={"Aunque los zapadores en la Piedra de Durin hayan sido detenidos, aún pudieron infligir graves daños a la sagrada roca.","Una visión de las profundidades","Lleva los fragmentos de la Piedra de Durin a Haflith en Mekhem-bizru","Haflith se encuentra en Mekhem-bizru, al noroeste de Uruk-gashan.\
\
Haflith querrá ver los fragmentos de la Piedra de Durin que has recogido.","Los fragmentos de la Piedra de Durin se encuentran en Uruk-gashan, al sur de Mekhem-bizru.\
\
Haflith te pidió que fueras a la Piedra de Durin y recogieras los fragmentos que los zapadores orcos habían roto."}},
[945]={nameES="Una visita a la Comarca Allende",objectivesES={"Habla con Caléndula Boffin cerca de Tham Amothir","Camellia Boffin y sus hermanos deberían haber llegado ya a Campotieso.","Bingo Boffin ha venido a la Comarca Allende para dar la bienvenida a su prima segunda Angélica a su nueva casa en Nobotella.","Bingo, Camelia, Caléndula y Dinodas se han reunido en Campotieso","Bingo está en Campotieso con algunos de sus primos segundos.","Habla con Dinodas Boffin y descubre el regalo de inauguración","Dinodas consiguió que un pintor elfo que pasaba por la Comarca pintase la nueva casa de Angélica.","Caléndula Boffin está cerca de las ruinas de Tham Amothir.","Habla con Dinodas Boffin en Gamwich","Según Caléndula, su hermano Dinodas tenía intención de visitar a un amigo suyo en Gamwich.","Camelia Boffin está en Campotieso, pero algunos de sus hermanos se han ido por ahí (como de costumbre).","Dinodas Boffin está en Gamwich, y está encantado de verte.","Dinodas sonríe radiante, rebosante de entusiasmo","Bingo está emocionado por ver el regalo de inauguración que Dinodas tiene preparado.","Habla con Bingo Boffin en Campotieso","Dinodas desvela el cuadro de la nueva casa de Angélica","Busca a Caléndula y derrota semiorcos en Tham Amothir (5/6)","Reúnete con Camelia Boffin y sus hermanos en Campotieso","Una visita a la Comarca Allende","Habla con Camelia Boffin en Campotieso","Camelia sonríe cálidamente mientras Bingo y tú llegáis","Escuchas los vítores de una niña hobbit cerca de las ruinas","Reúnete con los Boffins de vuelta en Campotieso","Los hermanos Boffin planean reunirse de vuelta en Campotieso, y les encantaría que te unieses.","Encuentra a Dinodas Boffin en Gamwich","Bingo está muy impresionado con el cuadro que Dinodas ha conseguido para Angélica.","Caléndula podría estar metiéndose en líos en Tham Amothir hacia el oeste, especialmente si hay semiorcos en las ruinas.","Dinodas te ve llegar y te indica que te acerques","Examina el cuadro de la nueva casa de Angélica"}},
[946]={nameES="A Visit to a Dreamer",objectivesES={"Lady Vanyalos can be found in the great hall on the north-east rise of Imloth Melui.\
\
Merenir has asked you to pay a visit to Lady Vanyalos, insisting that somehow she dreamed of you.","A Visit to a Dreamer","It seems that your appearance and the timing of your arrival in Imloth Melui bears a striking resemblance to a dream Lady Vanyalos had the night before.","Talk to Lady Vanyalos in her hall on the north-east rise of Imloth Melui"}},
[947]={nameES="A Visit to the Warren",objectivesES={}},
[948]={nameES="Un mensaje vital",objectivesES={"Habla con Laeginn en la Posada Embrujada","Primer hito alcanzado","Laeginn se encuentra en la posada de Audaghaim, en Troncosombríos.\
\
Lomdognir te ha encargado que le entregues el mensaje al elfo Laeginn.","Un mensaje vital","Lomdognir te ha pedido que le lleves un mensaje urgente a uno de sus compatriotas en Troncosombríos.","El segundo hito se encuentra más adelante en el camino al oeste de Emyn Lûm.\
\
Lomdognir ha trazado una ruta concreta que debes seguir con el mensaje que llevas.","Dirígete al primer hito","El tercer hito se encuentra en el camino, donde este gira hacia el norte, en dirección al pueblo abandonado de Troncosombríos.\
\
Lomdognir ha trazado una ruta concreta que debes seguir con el mensaje que llevas.","Segundo hito alcanzado","Dirígete al tercer hito","Tercer hito alcanzado","El primer hito se encuentra en el camino al oeste de Emyn Lûm.\
\
Lomdognir ha trazado una ruta concreta que debes seguir con el mensaje que llevas.","Dirígete al segundo hito"}},
[949]={nameES="A Voracious Fire",objectivesES={}},
[950]={nameES="Una apuesta de confianza",objectivesES={"Habla con Cariad","Cariad te espera en la entrada del refugio de los Cuan-lûth.\
\
Deberías hablar con él allí.","Una apuesta de confianza","Cariad ha sugerido despejar de crebain espías las tierras salvajes al noreste del refugio de los Cuan-lûth.","Un dunlendino llamado Cariad ha ofrecido que trabajéis juntos alegando un objetivo común."}},
[951]={nameES="A Wager: In the Wind",objectivesES={"Gradir said chickens could be found in the Court of Eärnil. The Ship's Prow lies at the very top of Minas Tirith, jutting out of the Citadel.\
\
Find a chicken and drop it off of the Ship's Prow to determine whether Gradir or Tawaris is right.","The soldiers Gradir and Tawaris can be found on the northern side of the Second Circle.\
\
Talk to Gradir to hear his side of the argument.","Find out what happened to the chicken","You drop the chicken and it sails downward, squawking loudly, but it is slowed by an unmistakable updraft!","Talk to Gradir","The soldiers Gradir and Tawaris can be found on the northern side of the Second Circle.\
\
Talk to Tawaris to hear his side of the argument.","You have been asked to help two soldiers settle a wager regarding the Ship's Prow and updrafts.","You should check the First Circle below the Ship's Prow to see what became of the chicken.","Talk to Tawaris","A Wager: In the Wind","The chicken appears somewhat wind-blown and disgruntled, but otherwise unhurt","Return to Gradir and Tawaris","The soldiers can be found on the northern side of the Second Circle.\
\
You should return to Gradir and Tawaris and tell them what happened with the chicken.","Carry the chicken to the Ship's Prow"}},
[952]={nameES="A Wager: Rot in the Gut",objectivesES={"Talk to Gradir","You manage to find the archer's shoulder and say something to him about his aim","The rotgut burns and roils within you, bringing tears to your eyes and making you stagger","The soldiers Gradir and Tawaris can be found on the northern side of the Second Circle.\
\
Hear what Tawaris has to say.","You give Gradir and Tawaris a wave","Gradir and Tawaris can be found on the northern side of the Second Circle.\
\
You should return to Gradir with the rotgut ingredients.","This is where Tawaris asked you to wave","Wave to Gradir and Tawaris","Gradir wants to share a drink of his rotgut with you. Unfortunately, he's all out.","Tap the left archer on the shoulder","You manage to brush against only a few shoulders as you stagger between the lined-up men","Collected Healer's Caustic","The soldiers can be found on the northern side of the Second Circle.\
\
You should return to Gradir and Tawaris so they can settle their bet.","Collect Healer's Caustic","Drink the rotgut","Walk between the last two ranks of men","Talk to Tawaris","You should drink the rotgut that Gradir prepared for you.","Gradir and Tawaris can be found on the northern side of the Second Circle.\
\
Hear what Tawaris has to say.","Standing after a drink of rotgut is not enough for Tawaris. He wants to see you tap the left-hand archer on the shoulder to compliment his aim, walk between the last two ranks of soldiers to his right, and then stand on the barrels and give a wave.","You should bring Gradir the items he needs to make rotgut: ale dregs from the Splintered Shield, hot brazier ash, and Healer's Caustic.\
\
All three ingredients can be found on the Second Circle: the dregs in the southern section, the brazier ash in the northern section, and Healer's Caustic at any healer's stall.","A Wager: Rot in the Gut","Return to Gradir","The soldiers Gradir and Tawaris can be found on the northern side of the Second Circle.\
\
Hear what Gradir has to say.","Climb on top of the barrel"}},
[953]={nameES="A Walk in the Glade",objectivesES={"There are three guardposts throughout the Pristine Glade.\
\
Maugan has asked you to go and check at each guardpost for any signs of Saruman's forces.","Talk to Guard Cai at the eastern guardpost","Talk to Guard Edrud at the southern guardpost","Maugan is preparing to defend the Pristine Glade against the onslaught of Saruman's forces.","A Walk in the Glade","Talk to Maugan at the Tree","Maugan awaits you at the Tree.\
\
You should return immediately to Maugan and let him know that Saruman is attacking the Glade.","Talk to Guard Ambras at the western guardpost"}},
[954]={nameES="Un poney errante",objectivesES={"Encuentra a Bill, el poney","La última vez que se vio a Bill, el poney, fue en Torech Andraug, al oeste de Echad Dúnann.\
\
Glavroleth te ha pedido que encuentres a Bill, el poney, y despejes un camino hacia la seguridad.","Glavroleth vio al poney de Sam Gamyi, Bill, vagando cerca de Echad Dúnann.","Has encontrado nada menos que a Bill, el fiel corcel de Sam Gamyi.\
\
Parece que Bill está en un aprieto en esta zona infestada de huargos.","Un poney errante","Has encontrado a Bill, el poney"}},
[955]={nameES="A War-like Word-hoard",objectivesES={"Heard the soldiers training","A War-like Word-hoard","Pillaged farmsteads and the enemy army can be found across the Pelennor, outside Minas Tirith.\
\
Dúrbethir asked that you find ruined farmsteads and gather charred wood and trampled wheat. He also asked that you hear for him the death-rattle of enemy soldiers and see the gleam in an enemy captain's eye in combat and defeat.","Found a sweaty rag","Found a cold knife","Talk to Dúrbethir in the Fourth Circle and ask how you can help him compose a war poem.","Observe the gleam in the eyes of a captain","Dúrbethir takes the items you have brought him and listens with a grave expression to the impressions you gathered. \
\
'Perhaps I asked too much of you - but yet, it is no more than we ask of every soldier here. Nevertheless, you have brought me ample inspiration. Let me ponder a moment....\
\
'Dark the day and bright the fire \
The fires in the trenches' veins\
Veins go cold and life expires\
Expiring joy and dread and pain\
Dark the day and blood shall flow\
Dark the day and still we go\
\
'Blood shall flow and fear shall clamour\
Clamour like the soldiers' cries\
Cries of fury, hope, and valour\
Valour chance and death defies\
Dark the day and still we go\
Dark the day and blood shall flow\
\
'There, it is done. I have wrought a song for war. Perhaps we will take these words to our graves. If that is so, take my thanks as well.'","Talk to Dúrbethir","Find a cold knife","Soldiers can be found training and making ready in the Second Circle.\
\
Dúrbethir asked that you go among the soldiers and listen to them train, as well as retrieve a cold knife and a sweaty rag.","Return to Dúrbethir","Return to Dúrbethir in the Fourth Circle of Minas Tirith.","The captain's eyes were wild and fey as he fought and fell","Help the old poet Dúrbethir compose a war-poem for the coming days.","Find a sweaty rag","Listen to the soldiers training"}},
[956]={nameES="El segundo mejor aliado de un Vigilante",objectivesES={"Piel de Colmillo Rojo recogida","Lleva los objetos recolectados a Hrotha en Ost Guruth, en las Tierras Solitarias","Sálvakh mora en Carn Dûm, en Angmar. Dushkâl, Brízrip y Thordragh pueden encontrarse en Urugarth, en Angmar.\
\
Hrotha necesita el tercer y último conjunto de objetos para completar su tarea.","El segundo mejor aliado de un Vigilante","Los barghests pueden encontrarse en Imlad Balchorth, en Angmar. Las arañas pueden encontrarse por toda Angmar.\
\
Hrotha necesita las colas de barghest y las hiladoras de araña para continuar.","Recoge los dientes del Gorthorog","Hrotha te ha ofrecido proporcionarte equipo hecho a mano.","Se dice que los uros canosos deambulan por las Montañas Nubladas. Colmillo Rojo merodea cerca de Torech Braignel, en el nordeste de Eregion.\
\
Hrotha requiere las pieles de uros canosos y la del gran jabalí conocido como Colmillo Rojo.","ecolecta la piel de Colmillo Rojo","Dientes de Gorthorog recogidos","Recoge una Runa de Presencia Maligna","Runa de Presencia Maligna recogida"}},
[957]={nameES="Un Huargo entre Lobos",objectivesES={"El rastro termina en una escena espantosa. Quizá el cuerpo del ciervo tenga pistas sobre el paradero del Huargo.","Inspecciona el ciervo abatido y prepárate para luchar.","Derrota al Huargo en las Piedras Aullantes.","Cledd te pidió derrotar al Huargo que ha pasado a comandar la manada de lobos cercana.","El Huargo no está aquí, pero encuentras algunas huellas de Huargo que seguir.","Las huellas continúan hacia el sur, hasta las Piedras Aullantes.","Hay un Huargo en las Piedras Aullantes.\
\
Encuentra y derrota al Huargo.","Has matado al Huargo de las Piedras Aullantes. Da la noticia a Cledd.","Un Huargo entre Lobos","Habla con Cledd","Sigue las huellas hacia el sur.","Sigue al Huargo hacia lo profundo de las Piedras Aullantes.","Cledd puede encontrarse cerca de la puerta oriental de Musgovilla.\
\
Habla con Cledd"}},
[958]={nameES="A Warning from Walstow",objectivesES={"The man suffered numerous blade wounds, but more curiously, harsh burns also mar his armour","You have come across the remains of a rider and his steed. You should examine his body and see if you cannot glean more information about what has occurred here.","Find the rider's trail","Talk to Cynelac","You see a felled horse and rider in the distance...","Fastred has reported that the rider was last seen along the road to the east.","Cynelac can be found outside the Mead Hall of Snowbourn.\
\
Having discovered a slain Rohirrim outside Snowbourn bearing the garb of Walstow, you have deduced that a great siege will soon befall the town.","Fastred has received word that a rider from Walstow was sighted outside the walls of Snowbourn, but was being pursued by Orcs and turned to engage in combat. If this rider can be found, his message might be of great importance.","A Warning from Walstow","Inspect the fallen Rohirrim rider"}},
[959]={nameES="A Warning to Tâg Fógarrach",objectivesES={}},
[960]={nameES="A Wary Extraction",objectivesES={}},
[961]={nameES="Un desperdicio de telarañas",objectivesES={"Iris Tunelero se encuentra en Wistmead.\
\
Has reunido varias arañitas en Scary y ahora deberías regresar con Iris Tunelero.","Se pueden encontrar telarañas curiosamente vacías en los arbustos de todo Wistmead.\
\
Iris Tunelero te ha pedido que pongas las arañitas que encontraste en algunos de los arbustos enredados de Wistmead.","Walaric Valeoro ha hecho grandes esfuerzos para preparar Wistmead para el Festival de la Cosecha, pero ha pasado por alto algunos detalles que no han pasado desapercibidos para los festivales observadores.","Se pueden encontrar arañitas de los Campos Verdes en Scary y su cantera.\
\
Esperando hacer más convincentes los arbustos entoilados de algodón en Wistmead, Iris Tunnelier te ha pedido que recolectes arañitas en Scary.","Iris Tunelero se encuentra en Wistmead.\
\
Has llenado varios arbustos enredados con arañas. Ahora deberías regresar con Iris Tunelero.","Un desperdicio de telarañas","Habla con Iris Tunelero"}},
[962]={nameES="A Watch on the Walls",objectivesES={"A large force of Orcs has made camp in the Harlond before the wall","Merenir wishes to speak with you before you depart from Imloth Melui.","Talk to Merenir","Merenir stands by the entrance to Imloth Melui.\
\
Lady Vanyalos has asked you to talk to Merenir, who has one last favour to ask you before you depart Imloth Melui.","Dindal the scout can be found high up in a secluded look-out, which can be reached by turning north off the east road from Imloth Melui.\
\
Now that you have looked out to the north-east, you should talk to Dindal again.","Gaze north-east from the look-out","Dindal the scout can be found high up in a secluded look-out, which can be reached by turning north off the east road from Imloth Melui.\
\
Dindal has asked you to stand by his side and look out to the north-east.","Dindal the scout can be found high up in a secluded look-out, which can be reached by turning north off the east road from Imloth Melui.\
\
Merenir has asked you to visit his scout, Dindal, at the look-out and assist in any way that you can.","You tell Dindal what you saw.\
\
'Your eyes are not poor. I have watched them for some time, and they are beyond count. All I can do is watch, but you are mighty and capable of much.\
\
'If you were to help us against these Orcs, what could you do? Hm....'","Find Dindal at the look-out","Talk to Dindal","A Watch on the Walls"}},
[963]={nameES="Una mirada atenta",objectivesES={"El campamento de los trasgos puede encontrarse a través de una grieta en el muro sobre las escaleras orientales.\
\
Túbi Puñogrueso te ha pedido que localices el campamento de los trasgos.","Jarmárr se encuentra cerca del campamento de trasgos de Snaga-maudhûl.\
\
Has localizado a la tribu de trasgos y has oído la voz de la que hablaba el jefe. Deberías hablar con el enano junto al camino.","Kambi, herido por un trasgo cerca del Umbral de Durin, habló de los desvaríos de su atacante. Túbi Puñogrueso quiere que el campamento de esta tribu sea localizado cuanto antes.","Una mirada atenta","Habla con el enano cerca del campamento de trasgos de Snaga-maudhûl","Has descubierto el campamento de los trasgos. Una voz profunda y áspera ladra órdenes secas.","Encuentra a la tribu de trasgos"}},
[964]={nameES="A Waxing Moon",objectivesES={"After the wards surrounding Barad Cúron were destroyed, the fell magic sealing Uialrond, the Dome of Evening has been undone.","Talk to Éowyn","Faramir can be found outside Uialrond, the Dome of Evening.\
\
Faramir is prepared to enter Uialrond and confront whatever evils lurk within. You should talk to Faramir when you are ready.","A Waxing Moon","Talk to Faramir","Faramir and Éowyn can be found outside Uialrond, the Dome of Evening in the Circle of Death.\
\
You have discovered a beacon of hope within Minas Morgul and heartened the Rangers of Ithilien. You should talk to Faramir and Éowyn."}},
[965]={nameES="A Way Home",objectivesES={"Talk to Captain Thandor","A Way Home","Though there is no ship to take the Corsairs home, hope is not lost.","You still have papers to deliver to Nasar and his companions.\
\
You should return to them near the West Pelargir gates.","Celebros has asked you to bring some sealed orders and a lockbox to Captain Thandor.\
\
He stands watch near the East Pelargir gates.","Talk to Nasar"}},
[966]={nameES="A Way In",objectivesES={"Talk to Mekhnet","A recently-arrived Mekhnet wishes to speak with you.","A Way In","Eyes are set on the goblin Thraunákh in Atrad-zarakh, but the Orc camp of Târ-kútoz remains an obstacle.","Talk to Lúka","Orc-sentries can be found in Târ-kútoz.\
\
You should defeat them to ensure easier access to Atrad-zarakh later.","You have defeated as many Orc-sentries as you could find.\
\
You should report back to Lúka in Ashmargathâl."}},
[967]={nameES="A Wayward Captain",objectivesES={"Defeat Hafoc","Defeated Hafoc","Because of their organized efforts, Céola suspects that the captain of the brigands is, in fact, a wayward member of the border-guard.","Talk to Céola at Etheburg in the Brown Lands","A Wayward Captain","The brigand captain can be found somewhere within Helstor, north of Etheburg in the Brown Lands.\
\
Céola has asked you to confront the leader of the brigands in the Brown Lands.","Céola is at Etheburg in the Brown Lands, south of Helstor.\
\
You should return to Céola with news of your victory."}},
[968]={nameES="A Wealthy Man",objectivesES={}},
[969]={nameES="Un arma de poder y gloria",objectivesES={"Hrotha forjará para ti un arma de poder y gloria, si le llevas los componentes adecuados.","Lleva los objetos recolectados a Hrotha en Ost Guruth, en las Tierras Solitarias","Recolecta la lanza de Bryok","Recoge un palo de cuentas ensangrentado","Lanza de Bryok recogida","Los tumularios pueden encontrarse en Angmar, Forochel, Annúminas y Helegrod. Los rascacuevas pueden encontrarse en Angmar y Sarnúr, en Ered Luin.\
\
Hrotha requiere los restos de tumulario y las garras de un número equivalente de rascacuevas de Gorothlad.","Gríshakrum, Kughûrz y Dafrim pueden encontrarse en Urugarth. Barashal mora en Carn Dûm.\
\
Hrotha necesita un palo de cuentas de los orcos Ongbúrz y el cuerno de Barashal el Gorthorog.","Cuerno carmesí de Gorthorog recogido","Palo de cuentas ensangrentado recogido","Los angmarim pueden encontrarse en Annúminas, en Evendim. Bryok vive en Forochel.\
\
Hrotha desea que le traigas los petos de los invasores angmarim en Annúminas y la lanza de Bryok el Gauradan.","Recoge un cuerno carmesí de Gorthorog","Un arma de poder y gloria"}},
[970]={nameES="A Weapon of Old",objectivesES={"You have repaired Penlhun's axe","A Weapon of Old","Bring Penlhun's axe to the mad dwarf in Thrór's Coomb","Talk to Aedh at the Lhanuch crafting hall","Penlhun Brehur, one of the leaders of Nan Laeglin, has asked you if you know of any way to repair the dwarf-axe handed down to him from his father. The axe was forged in Thrór's Coomb, and it is rumoured that at least one dwarf remains among the ruins. Alternatively, if you are a weaponsmith of considerable skill you might try a hand at repairing it yourself.","Penlhun Brehur is at the Brenin's Hall in Lhanuch, far to the west of Thrór's Coomb.\
\
You should return to Penlhun with his father's axe.","Repair Penlhun's axe","The mad dwarf dwells somewhere in the mountains surrounding Thrór's Coomb, far to the east of Lhanuch.\
\
Aedh told you to seek out a mad dwarf in the valley of Thrór's Coomb and see if he can repair Penlhun's axe. Alternatively, if you are a master weaponsmith, you might attempt to repair the axe yourself at the forge in Lhanuch.","Bring the axe to Penlhun","Aedh may be found in the crafting hall.\
\
You should speak with Aedh to learn if there is any way to reforge Penlhun's axe."}},
[971]={nameES="Mente Bien Ordenada",objectivesES={"Catálogo de Benton Recogido, Página Tres","Lleva el libro que buscaba a Dorset Roblealto","Mente Bien Ordenada","Dorset Roblealto suele estar profundamente en contemplación junto al Árbol Amarillo, al sureste de la aldea de Entibo, en las Tierras de Bree.\
\
Te han dicho que hables con Dorset Roblealto con la esperanza de que el Sabio pueda instruirte.","Ayuda a Dorset Roblealto a localizar el libro que busca","Habla con Dorset Roblealto","Hay muchos secretos por descubrir en las historias de los Pueblos Libres, esperando solo el estudio cuidadoso de un Sabio con habilidad y paciencia.","Dorset Roblealto suele estar profundamente en contemplación junto al Árbol Amarillo, al sureste de la aldea de Entibo, en las Tierras de Bree.\
\
Dorset está esperando para hablar contigo tras tu exitosa recuperación del libro que buscaba."}},
[972]={nameES="Una celebración bien merecida",objectivesES={"Puedes encontrar constructores y guardias enanos en los alrededores de la Sala Vigesimoprimera.\
\
Deberías llevar cerveza a los constructores y guardias en nombre del capataz Mögr, que cree que Zelem-melek pertenece ya a los enanos.","Has recogido un barril de cerveza","El capataz Mögr se encuentra en la Sala Vigesimoprimera de Moria.\
\
Deberías hablar con Mögr.","Lleva cerveza a Reinn","Puedes encontrar cerveza cerca del capataz Mögr en la Sala Vigesimoprimera.\
\
Deberías recoger algo de cerveza y llevarla a los trabajadores y guardias para que puedan celebrar su victoria.","Una celebración bien merecida","Reinn se encuentra en la Sala Vigesimoprimera de Moria, no lejos de Mögr.\
\
Deberías llevar cerveza a Reinn.","Recoge un barril de cerveza","Regresa con Mögr","Reinn no cree que los enanos de la Sala Vigesimoprimera deban bajar la guardia","Mögr, el capataz del próspero enclave de la Sala Vigesimoprimera, cree que la posición de los enanos es tan segura que ha llegado el momento de bajar la guardia y celebrarlo."}},
[973]={nameES="Una sala amplia y vacía",objectivesES={"No hay enemigos a la vista, pero algo llama tu atención","Regresa con Mögr con tus hallazgos","Habla con Reinn","El capataz Mögr, frustrado por la obstinación de Reinn respecto a la seguridad de Zelem-melek, quiere demostrarte que la Sala Vigesimoprimera es tan segura como puede ser.","Una sala amplia y vacía","Reinn se encuentra en la Sala Vigesimoprimera.\
\
Deberías escuchar lo que Reinn opina sobre tus hallazgos.","Mögr descarta los posibles peligros y problemas que has observado","Patrulla la zona este de la sala","Mögr se encuentra en la Sala Vigesimoprimera de Moria.\
\
Deberías volver con Mögr con un informe de lo que has visto durante tu patrulla.","Patrulla la zona oeste de la sala","Informas a Mögr de que los caminos están despejados, pero también de los problemas evidentes que has observado en la Sala Vigesimoprimera.\
\
'¡No hay enemigos, tal como dije! ¿Lo ves, Reinn? Es hora de abandonar tu cruzada contra que nuestra gente celebre la victoria al reclamar Zelem-melek para la expedición!'","Patrulla la zona sur de la sala","La Sala Vigesimoprimera es una enorme sala columnada que se extiende por el norte de Zelem-melek.\
\
Deberías patrullar la sala y comprobar si hay enemigos."}},
[974]={nameES="A Widow's Last Hope",objectivesES={}},
[975]={nameES="A Wily Servant",objectivesES={"You have discovered a servant from the household of Thornhope hiding in the ruins","While searching the ruins of Thornhope for survivors, you find a clever servant who managed to avoid the Orcs.\
\
You should help the servant to safety.","Máthild is at Béortnoth's camp, outside of Thornhope.\
\
You should speak with Máthild when you return to Béortnoth's camp.","Talk to Máthild","Talk to Máthild at Béortnoth's camp.","A Wily Servant","Máthild is hiding near the Mead Hall of Thornhope.\
\
You escort Máthild to safety.","While searching the ruins of Thornhope for survivors, you find a clever servant who managed to avoid the Orcs."}},
[976]={nameES="Una caminata ventosa por Wistmead",objectivesES={"Habla con Iris Tunelero","Walaric Valeoro se encuentra en Wistmead.\
\
Has explorado Wistmead y te has familiarizado con los otros miembros de su equipo. Deberías regresar con Walaric Valeoro antes de unirte a las festividades en Wistmead.","Ermentrude Henoloma, Halinard Bonce e Iris Tunelero se encuentran en Wistmead.\
\
Walaric Valeoro te ha pedido que explores Wistmead y te familiarices con los otros organizadores del festival. Deberías echar un vistazo.","Habla con Walaric Valeoro","Habla con Halinard Bonce","Habla con Ermentrude Henoloma","Wistmead encarna el espíritu del Festival de la Cosecha.","Una caminata ventosa por Wistmead"}},
[977]={nameES="A Wood Rife with Spiders",objectivesES={"A Wood Rife with Spiders","The spiders that roam the Dourstocks spill out from the Dreadweaver's Lair, making the forest all the more perilous for the Malledhrim.","Talk to Fernachar at the Haunted Inn","Spiders can be found throughout the Dourstocks.\
\
You should defeat many spiders to make the Dourstocks safer for the Malledhrim who wish to travel unhindered.","Fernachar can be found in the Haunted Inn in the Dourstocks.\
\
You should return to Fernachar with word of your success against the spiders."}},
[978]={nameES="A Word Deterred",objectivesES={"Ardwyn is at Forthbrond, to the south and east of Cadthorn's position.\
\
You should return to Ardwyn with Cadthorn's message.","A Rohirrim messenger disappeared when travelling to bring word to Forthbrond.","Find Cadthorn","A Word Deterred","Deliver Cadthorn's message to Ardwyn at Forthbrond","The missing messenger might be found somewhere to the north and west of Forthbrond.\
\
Ardwyn has asked you to find Cadforn, a messenger who is late returning to Forthbrond."}},
[979]={nameES="Una Palabra de Advertencia",objectivesES={"Habla con Laenin, el Guardián del Claro, en Celondim","El descubrimiento de un collar de fabricación trasga en el cuello de los lobos del valle de Nen Hilith genera seria preocupación entre los Elfos. Será necesaria una acción rápida, y aquellos capaces de hacer algo respecto a esta amenaza deben ser informados.","Regresa rápidamente a Celondim y habla con Laenin, el Guardián del Claro.\
\
Tu descubrimiento de un collar para lobos elaborado por artesanos trasgos ha resultado un hecho alarmante para los guardianes del claro. Se te ha encargado llevar esta noticia a su líder en el puerto élfico de Celondim.","Una Palabra de Advertencia"}},
[980]={nameES="A Worksite Overrun",objectivesES={"Radwig has relented to his mother Etta's desire to defend Floodwend, but you are not bound to remain in the city.","Radwig can be found in the Mead Hall of Floodwend.\
\
You should return to Radwig with the wood you gathered from the Worksite.","A Worksite Overrun","Wood can be found in the Warg-infested worksite east of Floodwend.\
\
You should collect wood from the abandoned worksite.","Bring the wood to Radwig in Floodwend"}},
[981]={nameES="A World of Trouble",objectivesES={"Search the fourth patrol point","Talk to Gwilum at Barnavon","After escaping the perils of Wulf's Cleft, you have arrived at the village of Barnavon in Carreglyn. There is little sense of safety in this place, though no one has yet made an overt gesture of hostility.","Search the first patrol point","There are no signs of Warg-riders here, but something has terrified the miners","The fourth patrol point is at Munfaeril's Shrine, upon the lake far to the north-west of Hen Turrau.\
\
Gwilum has asked you to patrol Carreglyn and discover whence came the Warg-riders plaguing his clan's land.","A World of Trouble","Gwilum is at the gate of Barnavon.\
\
You should return to Gwilum with news of your discoveries.","Warg-riders dare not come to this place","You find no evidence regarding the Warg-riders here, but there is a strange chain trailing into the water near the edge of the pond","The first patrol point lies to the south of Barnavon at Lhun Avanc.\
\
Gwilum has asked you to patrol Carreglyn and discover whence came the Warg-riders plaguing his clan's land.","There are signs of Dunlending activity at this tower, but no evidence pointing to the origins of the Warg-riders","Search the second patrol point","The third patrol point is at Hen Turrau, an old watchtower upon the hill west of the Barnavon Mine.\
\
Gwilum has asked you to patrol Carreglyn and discover whence came the Warg-riders plaguing his clan's land.","Search the third patrol point","The second patrol point is at the Barnavon mine, far to the east of Barnavon-town.\
\
Gwilum has asked you to patrol Carreglyn and discover whence came the Warg-riders plaguing his clan's land."}},
[982]={nameES="Una sierpe por los cuernos",objectivesES={"Una sierpe temible se oculta en lo más profundo de las cavernas.","Una sierpe por los cuernos","La morada de Thorgest está al noroeste de las cavernas de las sierpes.\
\
Debes regresar con Thorgest e informarle de que Ruinuan ha muerto a tus manos.","Habla con Thorgest","Un rugido resuena desde las cavernas más profundas. Una gran y temible sierpe debe habitar allí.\
\
Encuentra a la sierpe en lo profundo de las cuevas.","Ruinuan derrotado","Derrota a la temible sierpe en las cavernas","Un rugido resuena desde las cavernas más profundas. Una gran y temible sierpe debe habitar allí.","Entra en las cavernas","Una gran y temible sierpe debe morar en lo más profundo de estas cavernas.\
\
Encuentra a la sierpe adentrándote en las cuevas."}},
[983]={nameES="A Worrisome Crowd",objectivesES={"You should return to Torchún outside of the Houses of Healing and let him know you have dispersed a number of visiting well-wishers.","Too many visiting well-wishers around the Houses of Healing are getting in the way of the healers' work and need to be shooed away.","Return to Torchún","Torchún has asked you to disperse visiting well-wishers inside and outside the Houses of Healing, on the Sixth Circle of Minas Tirith.","A Worrisome Crowd"}},
[984]={nameES="A Worthy Distraction",objectivesES={}},
[985]={nameES="Una Prenda Digna",objectivesES={"Los barghests se encuentran en Angmar. Las sanguijuelas de azufre también se encuentran en Angmar.\
\
Dardúr necesita ahora zarpas de barghest y gotas del icor de las sanguijuelas de azufre.","Recolecta la piel de Helchuan","Lleva los objetos recolectados a Dardúr en Gondamon","Recolecta una Insignia de Mando","Cuerno grisáceo de Gorthorog recogido","Dardúr ha aceptado ayudarte a crear una prenda digna de un Maestro Rúnico de categoría.","Insignia de Mando recogida","Los ucornos y merodeadores habitan en Glâd Ereg en Eregion. Helchuan merodea cerca de los manantiales al norte de Zigilgund en Forochel.\
\
Dardúr desea que le traigas vides recogidas de las criaturas naturales en Eregion y la piel de la sierpe gélida Helchuan.","Una Prenda Digna","Recolecta un cuerno grisáceo de Gorthorog","Piel de Helchuan recogida","Lagmâs habita Urugarth y Târlug se encuentra en Carn Dûm, en Angmar.\
\
Dardúr necesita ahora una Insignia de Mando y un cuerno grisáceo de Gorthorog para completar tu recompensa."}},
[986]={nameES="A Worthy Offering",objectivesES={}},
[987]={nameES="A Worthy Trainer",objectivesES={"Orcs can be found throughout the Norcrofts.\
\
Ides has tasked you with dispatching Orcs in a timely fashion, in order to prove yourself to her.","Return to Ides at the training ground","A Worthy Trainer","Do not allow the timer to expire","Talk to Ides","Ides can be found training at the mill, north of the Rohirrim training grounds, at the northern edge of the Norcrofts.\
\
You have surpassed the challenge set forth by Ides, and she awaits your return.","Ides can be found training at the mill, north of the Rohirrim training grounds, at the northern edge of the Norcrofts.\
\
Edwulf has given you control of training Ides, but has counselled you about her headstrong nature.","Edwulf has abandoned the idea of helping Ides train. You have the opportunity to take his place as Ides's mentor, but not until your talents have earned her respect.","You have failed to impress Ides"}},
[988]={nameES="A Wounded Beast",objectivesES={"Return to Elder Ilaya in Khûtra.","A Wounded Beast","Return to Elder Ilaya in Khûtra","There is a large wounded salamander that needs to be healed with the salve given to you by Heshra, the herbalist. The salamander can be found west of Khûtra.","Administer the salve to Nekarkul on the shore to the west","Elder Ilaya has asked you to heal a large wounded salamander with the salve given to you by Heshra. The beast can be found west of Khûtra."}},
[989]={nameES="A Wounded Heart",objectivesES={"A Wounded Heart","A tear falls from her eye.\
\
'This means the world to me, friend. You are selfless. I have no words but ones of thanks for what you did for me.'","Recovered Filadal's Mother's necklace","Filadal told you of being forced to leave the oasis north-west of Shonith as her mother was set to fade. She fled, and only saw her mother surrounded by wrathful spirits before reaching her final rest. She wants a keepsake and vengeance before she fades.","You recovered the necklace from near one of the trees in the old oasis and defeated a good number of the wrathful spirits there. Return the necklace to Filadal.","Collect Filadal's Mother's necklace","Return Filadal's mother's necklace to her at Shonith","Filadal wants to recover her mother's necklace from the oasis north-west of Shonith and to bring vengeance on the wrathful spirits that drove her from the oasis before she could say good-bye."}},
[990]={nameES="A Wounded Soldier",objectivesES={"While scouring the ruins of Thornhope for survivors, you discovered a wounded soldier.\
\
You should help the soldier to safety.","Éorpwald is at Béortnoth's camp, outside of Thornhope.\
\
You should speak with Éorpwald when you return to Béortnoth's camp.","Talk to Éorpwald at Béortnoth's camp","You have found a wounded soldier from the household of Thornhope hiding in the ruins","Éorpwald is hiding behind a wall in Thornhope.\
\
You should escort Éorpwald to safety.","Talk to Éorpwald","A Wounded Soldier","While scouring the ruins of Thornhope for survivors, you discovered a wounded soldier."}},
[991]={nameES="El producto de un año (Final)",objectivesES={"Habla con Waldo Retumbo","Waldo Retumbo desea agradecerte por tu continua participación en el Festival de Aniversario.'","El producto de un año (Final)"}},
[992]={nameES="El producto de un año (Intermedio)",objectivesES={"Todos los años en primavera, el Festival de Aniversario tiene lugar para celebrar una ocasión muy especial. ¡Participa en las festividades para ayudar a marcar este hito con fuegos artificiales y buen humor!","Todos los días hay algo que hacer durante el Festival de Aniversario. ¡Ven y únete a todos y participa en muchas actividades del Festival de Aniversario durante tres días más!","Habla con Waldo Retumbo","El producto de un año (Intermedio)","Waldo Retumbo querría agradecerte por tu continua participación en el Festival de Aniversario."}},
[993]={nameES="El producto de un año (Intro)",objectivesES={"Todos los años en primavera, el Festival de Aniversario tiene lugar para celebrar una ocasión muy especial. ¡Participa en las festividades para ayudar a marcar este hito con fuegos artificiales y buen humor!","Todos los días hay algo que hacer durante el Festival de Aniversario. ¡Ven y únete a todos y participa en muchas actividades del Festival de Aniversario durante tres días más!","El producto de un año (Intro)","Habla con Waldo Retumbo","Waldo Retumbo quiere agradecerte por tu continua participación en el Festival de Aniversario."}},
[994]={nameES="Un Pretendiente en Bree",objectivesES={"Un Pretendiente en Bree","La casa de la dama es la primera o segunda puerta tras subir la Escalera de los Eruditos y cruzar el primer puente.\
\
Cebadilla Mantecona te indicó que coloques el ramo en el jarrón junto a la puerta de la casa.","Entregaste el ramo","Cebadilla Mantecona está en el Poney Pisador, en Bree.\
\
Aún preocupado por causar una buena impresión, Avery Manzanagria te ha pedido que entregues el ramo en la puerta de la dama. Había preguntado discretamente por su dirección sin éxito, pero prefiere que consultes a Cebadilla Mantecona, el posadero del Poney Pisador en Bree, para que te indique la casa correcta.","Avery Manzanagria está en la Plaza del Mercado de Bree.\
\
Debes regresar con Avery Manzanagria de inmediato.","Coloca el ramo en el jarrón","Has ayudado a Avery Manzanagria en su intento por cortejar a la mujer que desea, reuniendo flores raras para crear un hermoso ramo.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro cuando finalice el festival actual. </rgb>"}},
[995]={nameES="Incendio en Târ Stazg",objectivesES={"Incendio en Târ Stazg","Las tiendas de los semiorcos están en Târ Stazg, al noreste de Echad Dúnann, a lo largo de las montañas frente a la Puerta del Cuerno Rojo.\
\
Para expulsar a los desorganizados semiorcos de Eregion, Palanaer te ha encomendado la tarea de destruir sus tiendas.","Habla con Palanaer","Palanaer se encuentra en Echad Dúnann, al suroeste de Târ Stazg.\
\
Debes volver a Palanaer e informar de tu éxito.","Los semiorcos de Târ Stazg quedaron abatidos por la derrota de Akashpug, pero no fueron expulsados."}},
[996]={nameES="Abolish the Abominations",objectivesES={"Blaire is at the Boar-clan encampment, south of Lhan Colvarn.\
\
You should return to Blaire with news of your success.","Abolish the Abominations","The Abomination trolls can be found at Lhan Colvarn, north of the Boar-clan encampment.\
\
Blaire has asked you to thin the ranks of the Abominations by defeating some of the trolls.","Talk to Blaire at the Boar-clan encampment","The Abominations have become a problem for the inhabitants of the Dunbog, and Blaire is concerned that Saruman will use them against the forces of good."}},
[997]={nameES="Above His Station",objectivesES={"Collected the stolen sword","Bring the stolen sword to Wilferth","Above His Station","Wilferth is at the Rohirrim-camp in the East Wall.\
\
You have recovered the stolen sword and should return with it to Wilferth so he can see it.","The Orc with the unusually high-quality sword fled after the raid to the north-east and is probably within the camp the Mordor Orcs have established between Mansig's encampment and the Wold.\
\
Wilferth saw an Orc wielding a sword well above its station and wants you to reclaim it.","Wilferth thinks the Orcs and Uruks may have different reasons for being in the East Wall, but he knows that they are all your enemies, and an advantage to any one of them is a problem for your friends.","Find an Orc wielding a stolen sword and take it from him"}},
[998]={nameES="Above the Ashes",objectivesES={"Talk to Daelarth","Above the Ashes","Talk to Laerven","Angbor's men can be found in the eastern half of Pelargir.\
\
Angbor has asked you to question his men about strange things they claim to have seen in the hours preceding the battle in Pelargir.","Talk to Thamdir","Talk to Angbor in Pelargir","Lord Angbor has heard tales of a great beast flying in the darkened sky above Gondor and seeks to learn more of what his men have seen.","Angbor can be found inside the eastern gate in Pelargir.\
\
You have questioned his men and should now report what you have learned to Angbor."}},
[999]={nameES="Abyss of Mordath Raid Deeds!",objectivesES={}},
[1000]={nameES="Marco Ukhrash para toda la cuenta",objectivesES={"Recoge el Marco Ukhrash","Usa este objeto para otorgar un marco de retrato para toda la cuenta","Marco Ukhrash para toda la cuenta"}},
[1001]={nameES="Espíritu funesto maldito",objectivesES={"Espíritu funesto maldito","Los muertos ancestrales se han alzado en el Gran Túmulo.","Los espíritus funestos malditos se pueden encontrar en el ala inundada del Gran Túmulo."}},
[1002]={nameES="Accursed and Lost",objectivesES={}},
[1003]={nameES="Acolyte of the Necromancer",objectivesES={"Habla con Radagast","You should stand by Oroniel's side and face the dweller of Caras Tilion.","Someone - or something - has come to dwell in Caras Tilion.","Talk to Oroniel","Acolyte of the Necromancer","Radagast can be found at the tree nursery just outside of Felegoth.\
\
You should tell Radagast about what you have encountered at Caras Tilion."}},
[1004]={nameES="Acquaintance of the Adúrhid",objectivesES={}},
[1005]={nameES="Conocido / Conocida de los Ikorbâni",objectivesES={"Reach Acquaintance tier with the Ikorbâni","Your efforts to assist the Ikorbâni are noted among the people. To recognize your efforts, the leaders of the Shagâni at Iridír wish to honour you with a gift and thanks.","Visit Kildûg at Iridír to claim a gift","Your standing among the Ikorbâni earns you a gift. Return to Kildûg at Iridír to claim your reward.","You have honoured your word to assist the Ikorbâni in their efforts to restore their lands. You should return to Kildûg at Iridír to receive a reward for your continued assistance."}},
[1006]={nameES="Acquaintance of the Phetekâri",objectivesES={"Your standing with the Phetekâri grows. You should visit one of their assistants at Telperiën's Gate, Iridír, Jirush, or Urmâkh to claim a well-earned gift.","Visit Mashêm at Telperiën's Gate to claim your gift","Visit a Tale-warden's assistant at Iridír, Jirush, or Urmâkh","Acquaintance of the Phetekâri","Visit the Tale-warden Assistant, Mashêm at Telperiën's Gate, or any of the other Phetekâri quartermasters at Iridír, Jirush, or Urmâkh to claim a gift from the Tale-wardens of Umbar.","Your standing among the Tale-wardens earns you a gift. Return to one of their members' quartermasters to be rewarded.","Reach Acquaintance tier with the Phetêkari"}},
[1007]={nameES="Conocido / Conocida de los Temámir de Jiret-menêsh",objectivesES={"In the broken land of An Shêru, your efforts to assist the Dwarves of Jiret-menêsh have not gone unnoticed. Among the adventurous dwarves who dared leave the deep halls, your name and effort gain heft. Return to the quartermaster to see new wares awaiting those proven.","In the broken land of An Shêru, your efforts to assist the Dwarves of Jiret-menêsh have not gone unnoticed.","Reach Acquaintance standing with the Temámir of Jiret-menêsh","Speak with Semanísi at Jiret-menêsh","You stand by your agreement with the Temámir of Jiret-menêsh and assist in the recovery of the broken land. You should return to Quartermaster Semanísi to see what acclaim your deeds have wrought."}},
[1008]={nameES="Acquaintance with the City of Zajâna",objectivesES={}},
[1009]={nameES="Across the Chasm",objectivesES={"Habla con Hórin","Across the Chasm","Completa la instancia El Brilloprofundo","You should talk to Hórin at Skarháld.","Hórin believes you have seen the true threat of Glimmerdeep across the bridgeless chasm.","Join Hórin in 'Glimmerdeep'.\
\
You will find the instance on the Specific tab of the Instance Finder panel, under the Grey Mountains section."}},
[1010]={nameES="Across the Ikorbân",objectivesES={}},
[1011]={nameES="Los Hijos Perdidos de Addie",objectivesES={"Llevar el diario a Addie Trigal","Buscar a Amlach","Has encontrado el cadáver de Amlach.","Hay un lugar justo al entrar que algunos confunden con el Alto del Hombre Muerto.\
\
Addie Trigal dijo que su hijo Amlach iba a montar un campamento en el Alto del Hombre Muerto, pero no estaba allí cuando ella y sus guías llegaron. Teme que Amlach se haya perdido en el sur de las Quebradas de los Túmulos mientras buscaba a su hermano, Malin.","Los Hijos Perdidos de Addie","Addie Trigal, una mujer anciana y empobrecida, temerosa por sus hijos Amlach y Malin, se adentró en las Quebradas de los Túmulos en busca de sus hijos cazadores de tesoros.","Addie Trigal espera tu regreso entre la relativa seguridad que ofrecen los guías en el Alto del Hombre Muerto.\
\
Has encontrado al hijo de Addie Trigal, Amlach, muerto entre las lápidas en el sur de las Quebradas de los Túmulos. En su mano, sostenía un diario desgarrado. Deberías llevar el diario de vuelta a Addie, pues querrá saber el destino de sus hijos."}},
[1012]={nameES="Addressing the Discontent",objectivesES={}},
[1013]={nameES="Capítulo de Adelard",objectivesES={"Pervinca Tuk cometió el error de ayudar a sus primos Isembard e Imbert a gastarle una broma al anciano Adelard Tuk. Pervinca se escapó con el capítulo que él escribió para el Anuario de Alforzaburgo, e Isembard lo escondió.","Habla con Isembard Tuk","Capítulo de Adelard","Pervinca pensó que sus primos Isembard e Imbert Tuk podrían estar cerca del Gran Sauce al este de los Grandes Smials en Alforzaburgo.\
\
Pervinca te pidió que buscaras a sus primos Isembard e Imbert, quienes fueron a recuperar el capítulo de Adelard del Anuario, y ver qué les está tomando tanto tiempo.","Capítulo de Adelard recogido","Recoge el capítulo de Adelard","Lleva el capítulo de Adelard a Pervinca Tuk","Has protegido a Isembard e Imbert Tuk","Lleva el capítulo de Adelard de vuelta a Pervinca Tuk en los Grandes Smials.\
\
Después de sobrevivir a la gran idea de Isembard para bajar la bolsa con el capítulo de Adelard del árbol, finalmente tienes el capítulo en mano para devolvérselo a Pervinca."}},
[1014]={nameES="Adkhât-zahhar, the Houses of Rest -- Solo",objectivesES={"Defeat the risen dwarf-lords","Recoge el cuerno de invocación","Defeat Loknashra","Talk to Kyrstig","Defeated Loknashra","Use the summoning horn to call Kyrstig","Adkhât-zahhar, the Houses of Rest -- Solo","Defeat the wight of Vethúg Wintermind","Defeated the wight of Vethúg Wintermind","Deep in the Pit of Stonejaws, a grand tomb holds the remains of the many ancient dwarf-lords of Gundabad. The necromancer Loknashra, now empowered with the spirit of Drugoth, has returned to raise an army and claim her vengeance upon all those who wronged her.","Find and speak to Kytstig at the entrance of The Houses of Rest.","Defeated the risen dwarf-lords"}},
[1015]={nameES="Adkhât-zahhar, the Houses of Rest -- Tier 1",objectivesES={"Defeat the Wight of Vethúg Wintermind","Defeat the risen dwarf-lords","Defeat Loknashra","Defeated Loknashra","Defeated the Wight of Vethúg Wintermind","Adkhât-zahhar, the Houses of Rest -- Tier 1","Deep in the Pit of Stonejaws, a grand tomb holds the remains of the many ancient dwarf-lords of Gundabad. The necromancer Loknashra, now empowered with the spirit of Drugoth, has returned to raise an army and claim her vengeance upon all those who wronged her.","Defeated the risen dwarf-lords"}},
[1016]={nameES="Adkhât-zahhar, the Houses of Rest -- Tier 2",objectivesES={"Defeat the Wight of Vethúg Wintermind","Defeat the risen dwarf-lords","Defeat Loknashra","Defeated Loknashra","Adkhât-zahhar, the Houses of Rest -- Tier 2","Defeated the Wight of Vethúg Wintermind","Deep in the Pit of Stonejaws, a grand tomb holds the remains of the many ancient dwarf-lords of Gundabad. The necromancer Loknashra, now empowered with the spirit of Drugoth, has returned to raise an army and claim her vengeance upon all those who wronged her.","Defeated the risen dwarf-lords"}},
[1017]={nameES="Adkhât-zahhar, the Houses of Rest -- Tier 3+",objectivesES={"Defeat the Wight of Vethúg Wintermind","Defeat the risen dwarf-lords","Defeat Loknashra","Defeated Loknashra","Defeated the Wight of Vethúg Wintermind","Deep in the Pit of Stonejaws, a grand tomb holds the remains of the many ancient dwarf-lords of Gundabad. The necromancer Loknashra, now empowered with the spirit of Drugoth, has returned to raise an army and claim her vengeance upon all those who wronged her.","Defeated the risen dwarf-lords","Adkhât-zahhar, the Houses of Rest -- Tier 3+"}},
[1018]={nameES="Adkhât-zahhar, the Houses of Rest Tier 1 & 2 Deeds!",objectivesES={}},
[1019]={nameES="Adkhât-zahhar, the Houses of Rest Tier 3 Deed!",objectivesES={}},
[1020]={nameES="Adornment with Feathers",objectivesES={}},
[1021]={nameES="La entrega de Adso",objectivesES={"Toca la campana para llamar a Helechal o a su ayudante","Bill Helechal o su agente estará en la granja Viejo Dulcésped, al noreste del campamento de Adso Henoloma.\
\
Para reducir su deuda, Adso Henoloma te ha pedido que lleves una bolsa a un tal Bill Helechal. Te advierte que solo encontrarás a Helechal en el lugar acordado después de anochecer. Debes tocar el timbre para hacerle saber a Helechal o a su agente que has llegado.","Adso Henoloma, un Hobbit de Bree, dirige un albergue de caza y una estación de paso a lo largo del Gran Camino del Este. Para facilitar la construcción del albergue, su empresa se vio envuelta en asuntos poco recomendables y ahora tiene que hacer pagos.","La entrega de Adso","Habla con Adso Henoloma en su campamento","El campamento de Adso Henoloma se encuentra al suroeste de la granja Dulcésped.\
\
Adso Henoloma te envió a entregar un pago a la brutalidad de Bill Helechal y ahora espera tu regreso.","Lleva el paquete a Bill Helechal de noche"}},
[1022]={nameES="Advanced Signs",objectivesES={}},
[1023]={nameES="Adventures of the Trencher-woman: Malbarth",objectivesES={"Valdamarca Haith would like your help hunting and gathering from the grounds near Malbarth.","Talk to Valdamarca Haith","Adventures of the Trencher-woman: Malbarth","Valdamarca, the trencher-woman, takes your offerings and sets them aside.\
\
'Oh well this will make for a proper feast, won't it? Thank you, new friend.\
\
'When my business in Malbarth is complete, I wonder where the road will take me.'\
\
You tell her of an increasingly popular establishment in Pelargir.\
\
'How enticing! Maybe we'll meet again there someday.'","You have hunted enough boars and should return to Valdarmaica, the trencher-woman.\
\
Deliver boar meat to the trencher-woman.","The trencher-woman needs you to hunt wild boars around Lower Lebennin.\
\
Defeat wild boars around Lower Lebennin."}},
[1024]={nameES="Aerial Invaders",objectivesES={"Stained merrevail have invaded Minas Morgul and taken over the Circle of Madness.","Stained merrevail have taken over the third tier in Minas Morgul, the Circle of Madness.\
\
You should defeat stained merrevail.","Aerial Invaders","Faeron is stationed inside Barad Elenath, the Star-gazers' Spire.\
\
You should talk to Faeron.","Talk to Faeron"}},
[1025]={nameES="¿Miedo a la Oscuridad?",objectivesES={"Al derrotar a Talug, descubriste una nota escrita apresuradamente y con una caligrafía casi ilegible. Después de un tiempo, pudiste descifrar lo que decía.","Lleva el mensaje a Veúlfur en la Sala Vigesimoprimera","La nota dice:\
\
'Mazog, algo no está bien con ese Uruk Kranklûk. Los chicos también lo ven. Creo que sería mejor que empezáramos a prestar mucha atención a esas tropas que desaparecen en la profunda oscuridad de ese lugar sombrío. Podría haber algo más que hongos allí.'\
\
Quizás haya alguien en la Sala Vigesimoprimera que pueda ayudarte con esto.","Podría haber un enano que pueda ayudarte con la nota en la Sala Vigesimoprimera.\
\
La nota parece indicar que el general Talug tiene cierto grado de miedo y aprensión sobre lo que se encuentra en los lugares oscuros y profundos de Moria."}},
[1026]={nameES="After the Battle",objectivesES={"Speak with Imrahil","Imrahil can be found just outside the city walls of Minas Tirith","The Battle of the Pelennor Fields is at an end and Gondor has seen victory on this day. However, the city of Minas Tirith has succumbed to much death and destruction. Imrahil, Prince of Dol Amroth, has summoned you to his side as he begins the task of rebuilding the White City.","After the Battle","After the Battle of the Pelennor Fields, Imrahil has summoned you to aid the great city of Minas Tirith.","The horse to after-battle Minas Tirith can be found in the Threshold of the City, or in Minas Tirith pre-battle.\
\
Take the horse to after-battle Minas Tirith so that you may meet with Imrahil.","Imrahil can be found just outside the walls of Minas Tirith.\
\
You should speak with Imrahil.","Take the horse to Minas Tirith, After the Battle"}},
[1027]={nameES="After the Fall",objectivesES={"Disturbed by the presence of Angmarim still loyal to the Iron Crown in Elderslade, Glóin has asked you to rally with one of his scouts, Múta, and investigate the settlement of Caivád Sâr.","After the Fall","Find Múta at Caivád Sâr","Múta can be found somewhere near Caivád Sâr in northern Elderslade.\
\
Glóin has asked you to rally with one of his scouts, Múta, near the Angmarim settlement of  Caivád Sâr. You should travel north and find Múta.","You discover Múta keeping watch just outside Caivád Sâr","Múta can be found outside Caivád Sâr in northern Elderslade.\
\
You have found Múta and you should now talk to her.","Talk to Múta at Caivád Sâr"}},
[1028]={nameES="Después del Incendio",objectivesES={"Tharâkh Bazân está al norte y al este de Gloku-ru.\
\
Se te ha pedido que informes a Gerwith en Tharâkh Bazân sobre tu éxito en Gloku-ru.","Los trasgos han incendiado el puesto avanzado que una vez estuvo en Gloku-ru, y ahora amenazan con construir sus propias fortificaciones en el mismo lugar.","Habla con Gerwith en Tharâkh Bazân","Después del Incendio","El campamento de trasgos de Gloku-ru está al sur y ligeramente al oeste de la entrada de Zirakzigil y la Puerta de las Nubes.\
\
Kalman te ha pedido que derrotes a los trasgos que quemaron el campamento que una vez estuvo en Gloku-ru."}},
[1029]={nameES="After the War",objectivesES={"You have completed Tornir's tasks and should let him know.\
\
He can be found outside his house in Glaniath.","Tornir tries to keep up with his daily tasks.","After the War","Talk to Tornir","Tornir has asked you to chop firewood and pull weeds in his yard.\
\
His home is located in Glaniath."}},
[1030]={nameES="Epílogo: ...y Respuestas",objectivesES={"Habla con Egfrith en las mazmorras bajo Isengard.","La prisionera te resulta curiosamente familiar.","Epílogo: ...y Respuestas","Entrega la pequeña porción de comida a la prisionera indisciplinada en la celda de la izquierda de los calabozos.","Espera... ¿puede ser?","No cabe duda: es Egfrith, traidora de Rohan y sierva de Saruman.","El trabajo es duro y las condiciones deplorables bajo Isengard, y aun aquellos que sirven a Saruman siguen siendo prisioneros.","Egfrith ha sido encarcelada bajo Isengard, a pesar de su traición al reino de Rohan.","Egfrith calla y, tras un momento, parece no verte más.","El uruk malhumorado te dio una pequeña porción de comida para entregársela a una prisionera indisciplinada en la celda de la izquierda, en los calabozos.","La mujer no te mira a los ojos cuando le pasas la pequeña porción de comida a través de los barrotes."}},
[1031]={nameES="Epílogo: En memoria de los caídos",objectivesES={"Epílogo: En memoria de los caídos","Gorwen permanece junto a varios túmulos construidos recientemente en la aldea de Tornhad, recordando a quienes se perdieron en el Vado de Sarn y bajo Dol Ernil.","Gorwen permanece junto a varios túmulos construidos recientemente fuera de la aldea de Tornhad, recordando a quienes se perdieron en el Vado de Sarn y en Tyrn Gorthad.","Muchos Montaraces perecieron en el Vado de Sarn y en Tyrn Gorthad, y quienes sobrevivieron jamás olvidarán a sus amigos y parientes caídos.","<rgb=#00FF00>Lamenta</rgb> a los caídos en el Vado de Sarn y en Tyrn Gorthad","Habla con Gorwen junto a los túmulos en Tornhad"}},
[1032]={nameES="Contra Su Diseño",objectivesES={"Contra Su Diseño","Plagas molestas han excavado en los cimientos de la Torre Oscura....","Estás destinado a servir mediante el trabajo al Señor Oscuro.","Se pueden encontrar sierpes y ratas por todas las mazmorras de Barad-dûr."}},
[1033]={nameES="Against Their Nature",objectivesES={"After noticing strange and violent behaviour between animals of Blackroot Vale, Sarnir has asked you to investigate further.","The bear corpse you discovered can be found directly east of Alagrant.\
\
You have discovered a mauled bear corpse in the field of Blackroot Vale, and should examine it to determine what brought about its demise.","You have come across a freshly slain bear riddled with enormous bites and gashes","Examine the mauled bear","Sensing their prey is being stolen, maddened bears rush forth","Search for evidence of mauled animals outside Alagrant","DNT -- will not be seen","Against Their Nature","You can likely find slain creatures to the east of Alagrant, across the Blackroot.\
\
Sarnir has asked you to investigate the mauled animals that have been appearing near Alagrant.","Talk to Sarnir","Sarnir can be found in Alagrant in western Blackroot Vale.\
\
You have managed to survive a brutal attack after finding a mauled bear in the vale. You should report what you have found to Sarnir."}},
[1034]={nameES="Contra el frío",objectivesES={"Contra el frío","Los osos pueden encontrarse al sur de Sûri-kylä, al otro lado de la bahía de hielo.\
\
Nôra te ha pedido que ayudes a abastecer al pueblo de Sûri-kylä para el invierno consiguiendo pieles de oso.","Habla con Nôra","Un viento terrible sopla desde Angmar, trayendo con él un invierno glacial.","Nôra está en Sûri-kylä.\
\
Deberías llevar las pieles que has conseguido a Nôra."}},
[1035]={nameES="Against the Grain",objectivesES={"Orcs can be found at the silo to the east of Snowbourn.\
\
You should help the croft-guard defend the eastern silo.","Talk to a croft-guard to the east of Snowbourn","Orcs can be found at the silo to the north of Snowbourn.\
\
You should help the croft-guard defeat the Orcs attacking the northern silo.","Talk to a croft-guard to the south-east of Snowbourn","The second croft-guard can be found near the silo directly east of Snowbourn.\
\
Ecgar has asked you to aid the croft-guards in the fields of Snowbourn.","Orcs can be found fighting with Rohirrim near the south-eastern silo.\
\
You should help the croft-guard defend the south-eastern silo against the Orcs.","Talk to Ecgar","Against the Grain","Ecgar can be found in central Snowbourn.\
\
You should return to Ecgar and let him know that you have done as he asked.","The first Croft-guard can be found near the silo to the north of Snowbourn.\
\
Ecgar has asked you to aid the Croft-guards in the fields of Snowbourn.","The last croft-guard can be found at the silo to the south-east of Snowbourn.\
\
Ecgar has asked you to aid the Croft-guards in the fields of Snowbourn.","Ecgar has heard reports of vicious Orc-assaults being made on the grain-silos near Snowbourn. Food is already scarce, and they cannot afford to lose these supplies.","Talk to a Croft-guard to the north of Snowbourn"}},
[1036]={nameES="Contra la Manada",objectivesES={"Nogmeldir está en Vindurhal, al oeste de las ruinas de los gigantes.\
\
Debes regresar con Nogmeldir y contarle lo que has aprendido sobre los huargos de tempestad.","Contra la Manada","La exploradora elfa Glorwen, amiga de Nogmeldir, desapareció mientras cazaba cerca de las ruinas de los gigantes.","Los huargos ocupan las ruinas de los gigantes en la parte noreste del Paso Alto.\
\
Nogmeldir te ha pedido que combatas a los huargos para poner a prueba su fuerza y su número."}},
[1037]={nameES="Against the Shadow",objectivesES={"Against the Shadow","You have set many fires within Cirith Ungol.","Ruined scraps of wood and wreckage can be found throughout Cirith Ungol.\
\
Legolas has asked you to set fires in Cirith Ungol to repel the spiders of Shelob's brood.","You have set many fires within Cirith Ungol, and the light of the flames has worked to repel Shelob's brood for the moment.","Completado","Hoping to keep the spiders of Shelob's brood from overtaking the Tower of Cirith Ungol, Legolas has asked you to light bright fires within the walls of the fortress."}},
[1038]={nameES="Against the Stone-foe",objectivesES={"Talk to Gelbes","Gelbes is at Glân Vraig in the Ettenmoors. Speak with her to call a ranger to the Ettenmoors.\
\
The Rangers will assist in retaking Lugazag, but they request that you take the place of a Ranger in Eriador while they come to the Ettenmoors to fight in your stead.","Against the Stone-foe","Talk to Gelbes at Glân Vraig","Gelbes is at Glân Vraig in the Ettenmoors.\
\
A Ranger came to the Ettenmoors in your stead and fought valiantly, while you patrolled Eriador in his stead. You should now return to Gelbes.","Rangers have come to the Ettenmoors to stand against the trolls sent from Angmar. They seek assistance with their patrols from the heroes of the Free Peoples."}},
[1039]={nameES="Agal Dûn: Banners of Iron",objectivesES={}},
[1040]={nameES="Agal Dûn: Rituals of Iron",objectivesES={}},
[1041]={nameES="Agarnaith Skip",objectivesES={"Agarnaith Skip","Completion of this quest will allow you access to the Seregost endgame area for testing.","Talk to Lansu"}},
[1042]={nameES="Agarochir, guardián de Tirband",objectivesES={"Agarochir, guardián de Tirband","Eirieniel está en Echad Garthadir.\
\
Has derrotado a Agarochir, uno de los Númenóreanos negros tenientes de Amarthiel, y debes llevarle la noticia de tu victoria a Eirieniel.","Eirieniel te ha hablado de Agarochir, el Númenóreano negro que dirige a los Angmarim que controlan la corte de Tirband.","Agarochir se encuentra en la plaza de Tirband en la base de la gran torre de vigilancia, en el nivel más alto de la ciudad.\
\
Eirieniel te ha pedido que derrotes a Agarochir, uno de los Númenóreanos negros tenientes de Amarthiel, para que los Montaraces puedan tomar la plaza de Tirband."}},
[1043]={nameES="Agelwyn's First Command",objectivesES={"Agelwyn has decided upon her next course of action, and has asked for help in determining the best path for the refugees' escape towards Helm's Deep.","Scout the road to the east","Return to Agelwyn with your report","There are bodies on the road ahead...this way does not seem safe at all","The east road should be scouted by heading east and then south from the refugees' camp. The west road should be scouted by heading west through the woods. The river should be scouted by heading directly south-east.\
\
Agelwyn has asked you to scout possible routes towards Helm's Deep: the road to the west, the road to the east, and the along the river banks.","Scout towards the road to the west","Agelwyn's First Command","Agelwyn can be found in the refugees' hiding spot north of Marton.\
\
You should return to Agelwyn.","The river does not seem to be overrun by the enemy...yet.","Loud noises and felled trees everywhere indicate that this way does not seem safe","Scout the river to the south-east"}},
[1044]={nameES="Agoroth, el Narrowdelve",objectivesES={"Habla con Arvedui","Agoroth, el Narrowdelve","Complete 'Agoroth, the Narrowdelve' on any difficulty.\
\
Use the Instance Finder to enter Agoroth, the Narrowdelve.","Talk to Lothrandir","The time has come to enter Agoroth. You must reach the Helcessar before the Angmarim!","Habla con Elrond","Complete 'Agoroth, the Narrowdelve' on any difficulty","The Angmarim have been defeated and the Helcessar destroyed.\
\
You should speak to Lothrandir. He can be found inside Agoroth, inside Jä-reitti, or at the shipwreck of the Thoroval.","The Angmarim have been defeated and the Helcessar destroyed.\
\
You should speak to Arvedui. He can be found inside Agoroth, inside Jä-reitti, or at the shipwreck of the Thoroval.","You have won a great victory against Angmar and freed Arvedui from his fate.\
\
You should return to Elrond in Rivendell and inform him of your success.","Completed 'Agoroth, the Narrowdelve'"}},
[1045]={nameES="Agoroth, the Narrowdelve -- Solo",objectivesES={"En lo profundo de las tierras heladas de Forochel, se encuentra oculta la fortaleza arnoriana de Agoroth. Aunque ninguna alma viviente ha puesto un pie allí durante miles de años, ahora te encuentras en una carrera para alcanzar su cámara antes que las fuerzas de Angmar.","Use the summoning horn to call Lothrandir","Agoroth, the Narrowdelve -- Solo","Recoge el cuerno de invocación","Defeat Aigrith the Ashen","Defeated Rúcrog Hoarpelt","You have arrived inside the Narrowdelve.\
\
You should pick up the summoning horn. It will allow you to call Lothrandir to your side.","Defeated Aigrith the Ashen","Defeat Rúcrog Hoarpelt","Agoroth has been secured, but the Helcessar remains.\
\
Witness events as they unfold!","Witnessed the vision of Arvedui's demise","Witness the vision of Arvedui's demise","The Angmarim and Gauredain are attempting to breach Agoroth.\
\
You should defeat their leaders: Rúcrog Hoarpelt and Aigrith the Ashen.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>If you need assistance, use the Call Lothrandir skill to call Lothrandir to your side. If you lose access to this skill, pick up the summoning horn at the instance entrance.</rgb>"}},
[1046]={nameES="Agoroth, la Falla Estrecha -- Nivel 1",objectivesES={"En lo profundo de las tierras heladas de Forochel, se encuentra oculta la fortaleza arnoriana de Agoroth. Aunque ninguna alma viviente ha puesto un pie allí durante miles de años, ahora te encuentras en una carrera para alcanzar su cámara antes que las fuerzas de Angmar.","The Angmarim and Gauredain are attempting to breach Agoroth.\
\
You should defeat their leaders: Rúcrog Hoarpelt and Aigrith the Ashen.","Defeat Aigrith the Ashen","Defeated Rúcrog Hoarpelt","Defeated Aigrith the Ashen","Defeat Rúcrog Hoarpelt","Agoroth has been secured, but the Helcessar remains.\
\
Witness events as they unfold!","Agoroth, la Falla Estrecha -- Nivel 1","Witnessed the vision of Arvedui's demise","Witness the vision of Arvedui's demise"}},
[1047]={nameES="Agoroth, la Falla Estrecha -- Nivel 2",objectivesES={"En lo profundo de las tierras heladas de Forochel, se encuentra oculta la fortaleza arnoriana de Agoroth. Aunque ninguna alma viviente ha puesto un pie allí durante miles de años, ahora te encuentras en una carrera para alcanzar su cámara antes que las fuerzas de Angmar.","The Angmarim and Gauredain are attempting to breach Agoroth.\
\
You should defeat their leaders: Rúcrog Hoarpelt and Aigrith the Ashen.","Defeat Aigrith the Ashen","Defeated Rúcrog Hoarpelt","Defeated Aigrith the Ashen","Defeat Rúcrog Hoarpelt","Agoroth has been secured, but the Helcessar remains.\
\
Witness events as they unfold!","Agoroth, la Falla Estrecha -- Nivel 2","Witnessed the vision of Arvedui's demise","Witness the vision of Arvedui's demise"}},
[1048]={nameES="Agoroth, la Falla Estrecha -- Nivel 3",objectivesES={"En lo profundo de las tierras heladas de Forochel, se encuentra oculta la fortaleza arnoriana de Agoroth. Aunque ninguna alma viviente ha puesto un pie allí durante miles de años, ahora te encuentras en una carrera para alcanzar su cámara antes que las fuerzas de Angmar.","The Angmarim and Gauredain are attempting to breach Agoroth.\
\
You should defeat their leaders: Rúcrog Hoarpelt and Aigrith the Ashen.","Defeat Aigrith the Ashen","Defeated Rúcrog Hoarpelt","Agoroth, la Falla Estrecha -- Nivel 3","Defeated Aigrith the Ashen","Defeat Rúcrog Hoarpelt","Agoroth has been secured, but the Helcessar remains.\
\
Witness events as they unfold!","Witnessed the vision of Arvedui's demise","Witness the vision of Arvedui's demise"}},
[1049]={nameES="Aid for Brockbridge",objectivesES={"Collected iron bars","Arrow bundles can be retrieved from the market, iron bars from the miners, wood planks near the farm-house, and food from inside the farm-house.\
\
Herubrand asked you to gather supplies for Brockbridge.","Brockbridge is south and a little east of Woodhurst.\
\
Herubrand has asked you to take the supplies to Brockbridge and support his son Herefara.","Aid for Brockbridge","Collected planks of wood","Collected food stuffs","Collected arrow bundles","Bring supplies to Herefara in Brockbridge","Woodhurst sends aid to Brockbridge in the form of supplies, but not many men in Woodhurst are willing to fight against their brethren or the vast armies of the White Hand."}},
[1050]={nameES="Aid for the Enemy",objectivesES={"You have come to the freshest waters of the river.","Travel east to the source of the river flowing through Aelin Veren","Maendal can be found at Aelin Veren in central North Ithilien.\
\
You have offered a water-skin to each of the prisoners and should now speak to Maendal.","Talk to Maendal","The Haradrim prisoners can be found at Aelin Veren, in central North Ithilien.\
\
You have returned with the filled water-skins and should now offer them to the Haradrim prisoners.","The Rangers of Ithilien do not often show mercy to their foes, but to hold prisoners demands a certain watchful care.","Aid for the Enemy","The river that flows through Aelin Veren can be found in central North Ithilien.\
\
Maendal has asked you to fill water-skins in the eastern waters of the river flowing through Aelin Veren before giving them to the prisoners."}},
[1051]={nameES="Aid for the Refugees",objectivesES={"This man asks a hefty price for his home, and appears to have little sympathy for the plight of Langhold's people","Return to Cíllan in the refugee camp","Cíllan is waiting in the refugee camp outside Harwick to find out if there are any houses available for purchase in Harwick.\
\
You should tell Cíllan everything you found out.","Someone in Harwick must deal with the acquisition of houses in the city.\
\
You should speak with people in Harwick who may have homes for sale, so that she may begin to move her people out of the refugee camp and into more permanent homes.","Cíllan is at the refugees' camp outside of Harwick.\
\
You should find Cíllan and see how she fares.","This fearful townsperson has no interest in doing business with a wanted trespasser","This townsperson will report you to the guards if she sees you again","This townsperson only looks out for himself","The refugees from Langhold have built a makeshift camp outside of Harwick with the permission of the Reeve, but better housing is clearly needed.","Talk to Cíllan","Aid for the Refugees","This townsperson wishes he could help, but his home is far too small"}},
[1052]={nameES="Ayuda desde el Este",objectivesES={"Habla con Glavroleth en Echad Dúnann","Lengliel teme que los semiorcos de Barad Morlas y Pembar pidan refuerzos desde el este.","Ayuda desde el Este","Echad Dúnann se encuentra a lo largo de la carretera al sur y al este de Echad Eregion, en Nan Sirannon.\
\
Lengliel te ha pedido que busques a Glavroleth en Echad Dúnann."}},
[1053]={nameES="Aid from the Rangers",objectivesES={"Uirnen is at Glân Vraig in the Ettenmoors.\
\
You should return to Uirnen and inform him that you have fulfilled your duty.","Uirnen is at Glân Vraig in the Ettenmoors.\
\
The Rangers are attempting to augment the forces fighting in the Ettenmoors, but fear that committing too much to the battle will result in Angmar succeeding elsewhere. The Ranger Uirnen has asked you to speak with him if you wish to assist the Rangers with their duties.","Aid from the Rangers","A scarce few Rangers from Esteldín came east to the Ettenmoors to support Lainedhel's efforts against Angmar's army.","Talk to Uirnen at Glân Vraig","Speak with Uirnen and complete your patrol of the Ettenmoors as a Ranger (Cost: 500 Commendations)"}},
[1054]={nameES="Aid the Stonedeans",objectivesES={"Alongside Thane Torferth of Torsbury, you freed Stoke from Ordlac's control and saved Reeve Fríthild's children from a terrible fate.","Talk to Léoflac","Woodhurst lies to the north-west of Stoke, in the Stonedeans.\
\
You should find someone near Woodhurst who might give you some insight into the situation in the Stonedeans.","Talk to Lúfa","Talk to Reeve Fríthbert","Aid the Stonedeans","A herald from the Stonedeans arrived in the Mead Hall of Stoke.\
\
You should speak with the herald from the Stonedeans.","Lúfa, Edhild, and Reeve Fríthbert are in the Mead Hall of Stoke.\
\
Thane Torferth told you that Lúfa and the children wished to say their farewells to you before you depart.","Thane Torferth is in the Mead Hall of Stoke.\
\
You should speak with Thane Torferth again.","Talk to Torferth","Find someone near Woodhurst who might have some insight into the Stonedeans' travails","Talk to Edhild"}},
[1055]={nameES="Un poco de ayuda",objectivesES={"Nan Dhelu se encuentra al norte de las ruinas de Dol Vaeg.\
\
Cwendreda te ha pedido que estés atento a cualquier tesoro que puedas encontrar en las ruinas de Nan Dehlu. Ella cree que los tumularios que habitan en las ruinas pueden llevarlos consigo.","Un poco de ayuda","Las ruinas de Nan Dhelu siempre han despertado malos presentimientos en los Eglain, pero la llegada o aparición de los Muertos desde el interior de las ruinas les ha infundido aún más temor. Una valiente guerrera, Cwendreda, fue enviada para vigilar y recabar información sobre las ruinas, y ahora sus tareas recaen sobre ti, mientras el terror comienza a crecer desde el interior de aquellos salones que en su día fueron majestuosos.","Entrega los tesoros a Cwendreda en Dol Vaeg"}},
[1056]={nameES="Aiding Ashâgir",objectivesES={"Reach the Ashâgir hideout in the cliffs","Aiding Ashâgir","You found the refugees who remained in Ashâgir. Ask one of them if the are in need of help.","Gûzinir has asked you to go to Ashâgir and see if there are any refugees remaining there as they may be in need of help.","Reached the Ashâgir hideout","Speak with a nearby Ashâgir refugee","Gûzinir asked you to go to Ashâgir and see if there is anyone there in need of help."}},
[1057]={nameES="Aiding Kafagur",objectivesES={"You have helped the inhabitants of Kafagur.\
\
You should return to Zagdúr in Kafagur and talk to her.","According to Zagdúr, a Man was sighted outside of Kafagur.\
\
You should talk to the guard Grúshul for more information.","Aiding Kafagur","Talk to Grúshul","Zagdúr will need to be convinced that you mean no harm to the people of Kafagur.","Talk to Zagdúr in Kafagur","You should complete quests in Jeb Khâtel to win the Orcs' trust."}},
[1058]={nameES="Ayudando a Lhan Garan",objectivesES={"Talfryn te pidió ayudar a algunas personas clave dentro y alrededor de Lhan Garan.\
\
Ayuda a Eluna, Madog y Undeg.","Completa 'Aprendiendo a Pescar en Lhan Garan'","Completa 'Introducción a la Artesanía'","Ayudando a Lhan Garan","Talfryn te habló de varias personas que necesitan ayuda en Lhan Garan.","Completa 'Tratar con Cuencasangre'"}},
[1059]={nameES="Aiding Minas Tirith",objectivesES={"Aiding Minas Tirith","There is much to do to aid the people in Minas Tirith after the Battle of the Pelennor Fields.","People who need aid after the battle may be found either in the First Circle of the city or in the Houses of Healing in the Sixth Circle.\
\
You have been asked to aid the people of Minas Tirith as they recover from the Battle of the Pelennor Fields.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Completing this quest will fail any Aiding Minas Tirith quests not yet completed for the day.</rgb>"}},
[1060]={nameES="Aiding Sormedân",objectivesES={"Return to Elder Jurmêna in Sormedân","Speak with Sênjar in Sormedân","Speak with Khaljûn in Sormedân","Aiding Sormedân","Return to Elder Jurmêna in Sormedân and let her know you have spoken with each of the villagers.","There are many things to do in the farming village of Sormedân. Elder Jurmêna has requested you speak with some of the local peoples and help them to prove that you are a friend to the village.","Speak with Lurâkha in Sormedân","Elder Jurmêna has requested you speak with Sênjar, Khaljûn, and Lurâkha about their daily troubles and assist them where you are able."}},
[1061]={nameES="Una ayuda para la Recompensa",objectivesES={"Lleva cincuenta fichas a Meg Ganapié en Cavada Grande","Una ayuda para la Recompensa"}},
[1062]={nameES="Aiding the Dispossessed: Feeding the Cold",objectivesES={"Deliver the firewood and berries to Enkárvo","Enkárvo can be found in the Dorwinion camp, east and across the river from Dale.\
\
You should bring the berries and firewood you gathered back to Enkárvo.","The camps of the Easterling refugees are east and across the river from Dale.\
\
You should help the refugees by gathering firewood and blue berries for them.","The Easterling refugee encampments need more food and firewood than they can gather.","Aiding the Dispossessed: Feeding the Cold"}},
[1063]={nameES="Aiding the Dispossessed: Wolves In Waiting",objectivesES={"You should speak to Komúsi, who can be found in the Dorwinion camp, east and across the river from Dale.","You should defeat wolves in the areas around the refugee encampments, east and across the river from Dale.","Talk to Komúsi","Wolves still attack the Easterling refugees when they stray from their camps.","Aiding the Dispossessed: Wolves In Waiting"}},
[1064]={nameES="Aiding the Eastemnet",objectivesES={}},
[1065]={nameES="Ayudando a los Eldgangs",objectivesES={"Thrâng derrotado","Thrâng se encuentra dentro de la Grieta de Nûrz Ghâshu.\
\
Tortrygg te ha pedido que encuentres y derrotes a Thrâng, líder de los Ghâshfra en la Grieta de Nûrz Ghâshu.","Iorelen se encuentra en el campamento de Iorelen, sobre la Grieta de Nûrz Ghâshu.\
\
Debes llevar tu informe de la derrota de Thrâng a Iorelen y aprender cómo debes proceder.","Ayudando a los Eldgangs","La ciudad de gigantes de fuego de Norbar ha sido invadida por Orcos de fuego de Angmar.","Derrota a Thrâng"}},
[1066]={nameES="Ayudando a los Elfos I",objectivesES={"Ayudando a los Elfos I","Hadroneth está en Talan Haldir, a orillas del Nimrodel, al sureste de Nanduhirion.\
\
Has continuado tus esfuerzos contra los orcos invasores de Nanduhirion, matando a muchos de ellos e incendiando las barricadas que han levantado a lo largo del camino.","Satisfecho con tus esfuerzos en favor de los Elfos de Lothlórien, Hadroneth te ha pedido continuar tu campaña contra los orcos que han invadido Nanduhirion.","Los orcos se encuentran al noroeste de Talan Haldir, a lo largo del camino que atraviesa Nanduhirion hacia Moria. Han levantado barricadas frente a sus campamentos a lo largo de la ruta: Uruk-gashan, Drû-garmadh y Athmadhul.\
\
Hadroneth te ha pedido que derrotes orcos en Nanduhirion y que incendies las barricadas que construyen frente a sus campamentos a lo largo del camino."}},
[1067]={nameES="Ayudando a los Elfos II",objectivesES={"Lleva las armas orcas a Maethoron","Maethoron está en Talan Haldir, cerca de las orillas del Nimrodel, al sureste de Nanduhirion.\
\
Has robado armas de los campamentos orcos de Nanduhirion y has derrotado a más orcos emboscadores a lo largo del camino; ahora debes regresar con Maethoron para informarle de tu éxito.","Los campamentos orcos se encuentran a lo largo del camino que cruza Nanduhirion, al noroeste de Talan Haldir. Los orcos emboscadores también patrullan este camino y pueden hallarse en las afueras de esos campamentos.\
\
Maethoron te ha pedido continuar tus esfuerzos contra los orcos de Moria que han invadido Nanduhirion: derrotar a sus emboscadores a lo largo del camino y robar armas de sus campamentos.","Ayudando a los Elfos II","Satisfecho con tus esfuerzos en favor de los Elfos de Lothlórien, Maethoron te ha pedido continuar tu campaña contra los orcos que han invadido Nanduhirion."}},
[1068]={nameES="Ayudando a los Elfos III",objectivesES={"Meredhrandir está en Mekhem-bizru, el campamento justo fuera de la entrada oriental de Moria, muy al noroeste de Echad Andestel. Celegúien te dijo que siguieras la carretera hacia el oeste y luego al norte hasta llegar a Mekhem-bizru, y que evitaras a los orcos que merodean en Nanduhirion mientras transportas las flechas hacia Meredhrandir.\
\
Se te ha pedido llevar un lote de flechas a Meredhrandir en Mekhem-bizru.","Celegúien está en Echad Andestel, el campamento junto a las orillas del Nimrodel, al oeste de la frontera de Lórien.\
\
Has recuperado flechas de los cadáveres de orcos a lo largo del borde del Bosque de Oro, y ahora debes regresar con Celegúien.","Animada por tus esfuerzos en nombre de los Elfos, Celegúien desea que continúes la labor que iniciaste contra los orcos.","Toma un lote de flechas junto a Celegúien","Meredhrandir está en Mekhem-bizru, el campamento junto a la Puerta Este de Moria.\
\
Has llevado las flechas a Meredhrandir y ahora debes hablar con él sobre el viaje.","Ayudando a los Elfos III","Lleva las flechas élficas a Celegúien","Los cadáveres de orcos abatidos por los Galadhrim ocultos a lo largo de la frontera de Lothlórien, al este de Echad Andestel, pueden ser la fuente de más flechas que Celegúien desea recuperar. Ella te advirtió que no te acerques demasiado a la frontera, pues los Galadhrim dispararán si no te reconocen.\
\
Celegúien espera que recojas flechas de los cadáveres de orcos a lo largo del borde de Lórien."}},
[1069]={nameES="Ayudando a los Elfos IV",objectivesES={"Hay campamentos orcos a lo largo del camino que cruza Nanduhirion, al oeste y norte de Echad Andestel.\
\
Dindirith te ha pedido quemar la inmundicia orca en una hoguera dentro de uno de los campamentos orcos a lo largo del camino que cruza Nanduhirion.","Ayudando a los Elfos IV","Satisfecho con tus esfuerzos contra los orcos, Dindirith desea que sigas prestando ayuda a los Elfos de Lothlórien.","Puede encontrarse inmundicia orca a lo largo de las riberas norte y sur del río Nimrodel, al oeste de la frontera de Lórien.\
\
Dindirith te ha pedido limpiar una vez más las riberas del Nimrodel de la suciedad que las mancilla.","Dindirith está en Echad Andestel, fuera de la frontera de Lórien y al este de Nanduhirion.\
\
Has eliminado una vez más la inmundicia orca y debes informar a Dindirith.","Quema la inmundicia orca en una hoguera dentro de uno de los campamentos orcos en Nanduhirion","Dindirith está en Echad Andestel, al norte del camino que conduce a Lórien y al oeste de la frontera.\
\
Has recogido la inmundicia orca de las riberas del Nimrodel y debes llevarla ahora a Dindirith.","Lleva la inmundicia orca a Dindirith"}},
[1070]={nameES="Aiding the Healers of Dâr Tabib",objectivesES={"You have finished distributing medical supplies among the Dâr Tabib healers.","The healers of Dâr Tabib await fresh medical supplies.","Chakâr has asked you to deliver medical supplies to healers in and around Dâr Tabib.\
\
Dâr Tabib is located in the south-west area of the Tor-gardens.","Aiding the Healers of Dâr Tabib","Completado","You have finished distributing medical supplies among the Dâr Tabib healers, and in the process, alleviated some of their stress."}},
[1071]={nameES="Aiding the Stable-hands",objectivesES={"The festival has filled up the city stables of Minas Tirith with horses from all over, and the stable-hands are overwhelmed.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This quest will be removed from your quest log when the current festival ends.</rgb>","Aiding the Stable-hands","Return to Loborís","The horses that require attention can be found around the city stables.\
\
Loborís has asked you to groom or give treats to several of them.","Find a grooming brush from the equipment crate","Collected apples","Found a grooming brush","Collect apples from the apple crate","Loborís is working near the front doors in the city stables.\
\
She will want to hear that you've taken care of the horses.","Grooming brushes and apples are in crates at the back of the city stables.\
\
You will need both items in order to help Loborís with the horses."}},
[1072]={nameES="Aiding the Temámir",objectivesES={"You have found Cherêka, keeping watch over the road that leads to Jiret-menêsh from the city above. You should talk to her and give her the water Mísikir asked you to deliver.","You have delivered the water to Cherêka, and had a nice chat. You should return to Mísikir, who was near Jiret-menêsh's stable-master.","Find the guard watching over the road","Mísikir has given you a water-skin and asked you to find Cherêka, who watches over the road that all must take to approach the mountain-top. She should be somewhere nearby, looking down upon the road.","Khagâmi thanked you for getting her safely to Jiret-menêsh. Mêshaget appears to have something to say. You should talk to Mêshaget.","Talk to Mêshaget","Talk to Cherêka and give her the water-skin","You have come to the legendary dwarf-city of Jiret-menêsh, where some of the Temámir have come to the surface after one hundred years of sheltering in the mountain.","Mísikir tells you that a woman was recently looking for you, but does not know where she went. You should find Khagâmi in Jiret-menêsh.","You spot Cherêka","Talk to Khagâmi","Mêshaget needs to speak to the Lord of the city, Châmelek Gêta, and suggested you talk to Mísikir, the captain of the guard.","Talk to Mísikir","Aiding the Temámir"}},
[1073]={nameES="Aiding the Thane and His Daughter",objectivesES={"Cyneberg is in Scylfig.\
\
You should speak with Cyneberg.","These rations will allow the villagers to keep up their strength","Thane Cynegar and his daughter, Cyneberg, need help with preparing Scylfig for an Orc-assault.","Deliver the barrel of arrows to the waggon west of Cyneberg","Introduce yourself to Cyneberg, the Thane's daughter","Cyneberg welcomes you as best she can at this troubled hour","The battle-readying items you gathered can be distributed around Scylfig.\
\
You should bring the preparatory items to various points throughout Scylfig.","Arrows, wood slats, and food rations can be found at the cart near Cyneberg.\
\
You should deliver the battle preparations around town so that the people of Scylfig can brace for the looming Orc attack.","Speak with Cyneberg in the centre of Scylfig","The villagers here can now finish boarding up their homes","Deliver the food rations to the waggon north of Cyneberg","Cyneberg can be found in Scylfig, unloading battle-supplies from storage.\
\
You should assist Cyneberg, the Thane's daughter.","Deliver the wood slats to the waggon east of Cyneberg","Scylfig's archers will now be ready to fell many of the Orcs that dare to approach","Pick up the wood slats","Aiding the Thane and His Daughter","Pick up the food rations","Pick up the barrel of arrows"}},
[1074]={nameES="Aiglos",objectivesES={"Legolas can be found near Aiglos in Dor Amarth.\
\
You should speak with Legolas.","Confront the wounded devoted","Aiglos","Aiglos can be found in Dor Amarth.\
\
You should bring the corrupted idol you found to Aiglos.","Talk to Hithgol","Hithgol asks for you and Legolas to assess if Aiglos is at all retrievable in its current location.","The idol disintegrates in your hands as you hold it up to the glow of Aiglos","Find and defeat Rabôkhor","The devoted is overcome with conflicted beliefs","Rabôkhor, high priest of the Order of the Eye, can be found in Dor Amarth.\
\
You should find and defeat Rabôkhor.","Hithgol can be found at the Ruins of Díngarth.\
\
You should talk to Hithgol.","Collect a corrupted trinket","Rabôkhor drops an strange idol","Habla con Legolas.","The wounded devoted can be found near Aiglos.\
\
You should confront the wounded devoted from the Order of the Eye.","You confront the devoted member of The Order of The Eye and ask him why they seek the spear.\
\
'You know not the story? Indeed you are a fool, but I shall enlighten thee.\
\
'In Sauron's great trickery, an Elf bearing this mighty spear fell into the Dark Lord's trap. The Elf perished, releasing the spear from his grasp. Many thought the spear lost, but it was not, for the Dark Lord knew of it. When his strength returned, Sauron retrieved the spear and kept it high in his tower as a remembrance to all who dare defy his rule.\
\
'Rabôkhor, the leader of our sect, shall soon scale the spire and hold the spear in his hands.'\
\
You decide you must find this Rabôkhor and show The Order of The Eye that the spear can never be wielded by them.","Bring the corrupted idol near Aiglos"}},
[1075]={nameES="Sabueso enfermo",objectivesES={"Trae las semillas de hinojo a Eldo Swatmidge","Los niquebriques se encuentran principalmente en el sur de los Pantanos de Moscagua. La granja de Eldo Swatmidge está al oeste de los Pantanos y al este de Entibo.\
\
Longo Daegmund te envió a hablar con Eldo Swatmidge sobre una cura para su perro Gar, pero a Eldo le faltan las semillas de hinojo para preparar el remedio. Eldo te dice que los niquebriques tienen predilección por el hinojo y que quizá puedas encontrar semillas atrapadas en sus pinzas.","Longo Daegmund y su perro Gar están junto al carro de Ferdibrand Tuk, justo al oeste de la plaza del pueblo en Entibo.\
\
Eldo ha preparado un remedio herbal para curar a Gar de la enfermedad que lo aqueja y te ha pedido que se lo des para que lo beba.","Eldo Swatmidge vive al este de Entibo y al norte y este de la granja de la Viuda Froghorn.\
\
Longo Daegmund te ha pedido que hables con Eldo Swatmidge sobre la enfermedad de su perro y averigües si conoce algún remedio que pueda curarlo.","Gar te mira con tristeza. Parece estar muy enfermo.","El perro de Longo Daegmund, Gar, parece haberse enfermado, y Longo está preocupado por él.","Lleva el remedio herbal de Eldo a Gar","Sabueso enfermo","Gar olfatea el remedio herbal y luego lo bebe poco a poco. Finalmente, termina la mezcla.\
\
Longo te mira expectante.","Longo Daegmund está junto a su perro, Gar, al lado del carro de Ferdibrand Tuk, al oeste de la plaza del pueblo de Entibo.\
\
Longo espera ansioso para hablar contigo."}},
[1076]={nameES="Aklash, el líder de los soldados",objectivesES={"Derrota a Aklash","Aklash está en la sala del trono de la Ciudad de los Trasgos, al noreste del campamento de Glóin.\
\
Tralli Buscagemas te ha pedido que encuentres y derrotes al líder de los soldados del Gran Trasgo dentro de la sala del trono.","Habla con Tralli Buscagemas en el campamento de Glóin","Aklash, el líder de los soldados","La información obtenida de las cartas en Lengua Negra que recuperaste llevó a Glóin a ofrecer recompensas por derrotar a Aklash, el líder de los soldados de élite del Gran Trasgo.","Tralli Buscagemas está en el campamento de Glóin, justo fuera de la entrada a la Ciudad de los Trasgos.\
\
Entraste en la sala del trono del Gran Trasgo y encontraste a Aklash. Tras un combate arduo, lo derrotaste. Ahora debes regresar con Tralli Buscagemas.","Aklash derrotado"}},
[1077]={nameES="Akshir the Unrelenting",objectivesES={}},
[1078]={nameES="Alas for the Fallen",objectivesES={"Léoflad and her people have been massacred along the road to Aldburg, cutting short all hope of safety for the inhabitants of Entwade.","Agelman is at your side or can be rallied to your side by sounding your horn.\
\
Agelman has interrupted you, calling you aside before you could finish burying Léoflad. You should speak to him and discover what he wants.","Talk to Agelman","Bury Léoflad","The Entwade-slaying can be found in south-eastern Kingstead along the road through the forests of the Eastfold.\
\
Agelman has asked that you help him bury the victims of the White Hand attack to provide them some measure of peace.","Alas for the Fallen","Agelman calls out to you","Léoflad can be found amidst the wreckage along the road to the Eastfold in south-eastern Kingstead.\
\
You have aided Agelman in burying the people of Entwade, and have discovered Léoflad's body amidst the wreckage. You should bury her as well before speaking to Agelman."}},
[1079]={nameES="Aldburg Convenes",objectivesES={"Aldburg Convenes","Thane Arcil is in the Mead Hall of Aldburg.\
\
Thane Arcil has invited you to join him for dinner. He and Éothain will attempt to resolve their differences and determine a course of action to deal with the Orcs. You should talk to Arcil when you are prepared to enter the Mead Hall of Aldburg for dinner.","Talk to Arcil","Thane Arcil has invited you to dinner, where he and Éothain will discuss the Orc-threat and how best to proceed.","Both Arcil and Éothain stated their case about which Orc-tribe poses the greatest threat.\
\
You should speak with Arcil and let him know your thoughts."}},
[1080]={nameES="Aldstan's Decline",objectivesES={}},
[1081]={nameES="Ale-thieves",objectivesES={"You hear the calm, familiar slosh of ale within these barrels...","Barrel-racks can be found throughout the Hall Under the Mountain.\
\
Snállar has asked you to knock on various barrels of ale to try to expose the ale-thieves in Erebor.","After discovering several suspiciously empty barrels of ale, Snállar hopes to uncover the source of the theft.","Talk to Snállar","Ale-thieves","With a sudden crash, an ale-soaked cave-claw breaks out of one of the barrels!","Snállar can be found in the Hall Under the Mountain.\
\
You have driven off several ale-soaked cave-claws in the Hall Under the Mountain and should now return to Snállar."}},
[1082]={nameES="Tarea de Algraig: Porra de metal rota",objectivesES={"Alguien ha publicado una tarea para que se le entreguen porras de metal rotas. Se pueden entregar a cambio de una recompensa.","Tarea de Algraig: Porra de metal rota","Has entregado un número loable de porras de metal rotas.","Se busca: Porras de metal rotas tomadas de los enemigos derrotados de los Hombres de Enedwaith.","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir porras de metal rotas.","Entrega las porras de metal rotas en una caja de recolección"}},
[1083]={nameES="Tarea de Algraig: Oreja preciosa",objectivesES={"Se busca: Orejas preciosas de varias bestias que se pueden encontrar en Enedwaith.","Has entregado una valiosa colección de orejas preciosas.","Entrega las orejas preciosas en una caja de recolección","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir orejas preciosas.","Tarea de Algraig: Oreja preciosa","Alguien ha publicado una tarea para recoger las orejas preciosas de la fauna local. Se pueden entregar a cambio de una recompensa."}},
[1084]={nameES="Tarea de Algraig: Piel preciosa",objectivesES={"Tarea de Algraig: Piel preciosa","Se busca: Piel preciosa de varias bestias que se pueden encontrar en Enedwaith.","Entrega las pieles preciosas en una caja de recolección","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir pieles preciosas.","Has entregado una valiosa colección de pieles preciosas.","Alguien ha publicado una tarea para recoger pieles preciosas de la fauna local. Se pueden entregar a cambio de una recompensa."}},
[1085]={nameES="Tarea de Algraig: Vaina de espada preciosa",objectivesES={"Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir magníficas vainas de espada.","Alguien ha publicado una tarea para entregar magníficas vainas de espada. Se pueden entregar a cambio de una recompensa.","Entrega las magníficas vainas de espada en una caja de recolección","Se busca: Vainas de espada preciosas tomadas de los enemigos derrotados de los Hombres de Enedwaith.","Has entregado un número respetable de magníficas vainas de espada.","Tarea de Algraig: Vaina de espada preciosa"}},
[1086]={nameES="Tarea de Algraig: Piel desagradable",objectivesES={"Entrega las pieles desagradables a una caja de recolección","Tarea de Algraig: Piel desagradable","Se busca: Piel desagradable de varias bestias que se pueden encontrar en Enedwaith. Es mejor que no hagas preguntas.","Has entregado un montón de pieles desagradables.","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir pieles desagradables.","Se busca: Piel desagradable de varias bestias que se pueden encontrar en Enedwaith. Las preguntas no serán respondidas.","Alguien ha publicado una tarea para recoger piel desagradable de la fauna local. Se pueden entregar a cambio de una recompensa."}},
[1087]={nameES="Todo menos la sidra",objectivesES={"Has recogido una jarra de Sidra añeja de las Estrellas","Todo menos la sidra","La Posada del Poney Pisador se encuentra en Bree, al este de la Comarca.\
\
La Sidra añeja de las Estrellas debe ser comprada a Mantecona en el Poney Pisador.","Has recogido la Sidra añeja de las Estrellas","Lleva la Sidra Añeja de las Estrellas a Dedalera Cavada","Recoge la Sidra Añeja de las Estrellas en el Poney Pisador","Recoge una jarra de Sidra Añeja de las Estrellas","Se te ha encargado completar una entrega a un miembro de la Liga de las Posadas que se ha quedado varado lejos del festival esta temporada.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu bitácora de misiones cuando termine el festival actual. </rgb>","Dedalera Cavada se encuentra en Tejonera en la Comarca, al oeste de Bree.\
\
Dedalera Cavada te ha pedido que le recojas un poco de sidra \\qAñejada por las Estrellas\\q del Poney Pisador. Una vez que tengas la sidra, deberías llevársela a Dedalera."}},
[1088]={nameES="Todo Menos la Buena Sidra",objectivesES={"Has recogido la falsa Sidra Añeja de las Estrellas","Dedalera Cavada se encuentra en Tejonera, en la Comarca, esperando que le entregues la Sidra Añeja de las Estrellas.\
\
Deberías llevarle la falsa Sidra Añeja de las Estrellas —que en realidad es Sidra Abandonada— antes de que se acabe el tiempo.","Lleva la falsa Sidra Añeja de las Estrellas a Dedalera Cavada","Todo Menos la Buena Sidra","Recoge la falsa Sidra Añeja de las Estrellas en la Posada Abandonada","Anlaf el Despojado se encuentra en la Posada Abandonada, en las Tierras Solitarias.\
\
Deberías recoger la falsa Sidra Añeja de las Estrellas —en realidad, Sidra Abandonada— de manos de Anlaf el Despojado."}},
[1089]={nameES="All Fired Up",objectivesES={"Clay can be found on the banks of the pond north west of Bree. Willow sprays can be collected near a pond south of Bree. Cut pine wood can be found outside of Bree. Fine lace can be procured from the tailor Maud Tatter in Bree.\
\
Rona Turner has asked you to collect clay, willow sprays, firewood, and fine lace.","Return to Rona Turner","Bring the pottery materials to Rona Turner","Talk to Maud Tatter","All Fired Up","The demand for woodfired pottery is especially high during the wedding season of Midsummer. Artisans are overwhelmed with orders and need help gathering materials for their fine crockery.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This quest will be removed from your quest log when the current festival ends.</rgb>","Rona Turner is located in Bree.\
\
Bring the materials to Rona Turner."}},
[1090]={nameES="All Locked Up",objectivesES={"Turthoren the locksmith held spare keys to all the houses in Tungobel, until a half-troll stole them.","Each home in Tungobel has an unlocked door.\
\
Lock each door in Tungobel.","All Locked Up","Retrieve Turthoren's keys","Retrieved Turthoren's keys","Turthoren is near the village of Tungobel.\
\
Return the keys to Turthoren.","Turthoren's keys are on a half-troll in Tungobel.\
\
Retrieve the keys for Turthoren.","Return the keys to Turthoren"}},
[1091]={nameES="Batalla total",objectivesES={"Batalla total","Lleva la lucha a los orcos en su campamento en Sar-kidul.","Tu misión es llevar la lucha a los Orcos en Sar-kidul y eliminarlos.","Encuentra y derrota a Madmurúk","Encuentra y derrota a Madmurúk en Sar-kidul.","Madmurúk derrotado"}},
[1092]={nameES="Estabilidad en el frente occidental",objectivesES={"Habla con Orchalwë en Tinnudir","Estabilidad en el frente occidental","Orchalwë está en Tinnudir.\
\
Orchalwë se alegrará de saber que las orillas occidentales de Evendim están a salvo.","La nube oscura sobre las orillas occidentales del Lago del Crepúsculo se ha disipado y el ánimo de Ramalarga está por las nubes."}},
[1093]={nameES="All Roads Lead Back to Aldburg",objectivesES={}},
[1094]={nameES="Bien encordado",objectivesES={"Burgthryth está desconsolada por la destrucción de las mejores cuerdas de su laúd a manos de un dientes de sable particularmente agresivo y con poco oído musical.","Burgthryth te ha pedido que le traigas las tripas del kilpa-kita, Laulu-vihâja, con las que hará nuevas cuerdas para su laúd.\
\
Laulu-vihâja se encuentra en Kissa-sari, al suroeste de Jänis-leiri.","Es repugnante...","Lleva las tripas a Burgthryth en Jänis-leiri","Bien encordado","Habiendo recuperado un montón de tripas del mismo kilpa-kita que destrozó el laúd de Burgthryth, deberías llevárselo lo antes posible.\
\
Burgthryth se encuentra en Jänis-leiri.","Tripas de kilpa-kita encontradas","Derrota a Laulu-vihâja y recoge sus tripas"}},
[1095]={nameES="All That Glitters",objectivesES={"Khôltekh has asked that you return any valuables you see in Deshûkh, the Blood Market to him, so that he may return them to the families from which they were stolen. Deshûkh is located in Dil-irmíz, south-east of Mekab-kuphâr.","Return to Khôltekh in Dâr Laja, the Hall of the Kindred.","Khôltekh has asked that you return any valuables you see in Deshûkh.","Return to Khôltekh in the Hall of the Kindred","All That Glitters"}},
[1096]={nameES="All for Some Greens",objectivesES={}},
[1097]={nameES="All that Remains",objectivesES={"Hwitmon has allowed you to escort Inhild to the farm to say farewell","Escort Inhild to Randgar's farm to say good-bye","Speak to Hwitmon","All that Remains","Randgar's farm lies south of Cliving, along the road to the east.\
\
Inhild has been allowed to visit Randgar's farm in order to say farewell to the man she loved.","Inhild's distress over Randgar has given her an opportunity to visit his farm and to say farewell to her lost love.","Convince Hwitmon to allow Inhild to visit Randgar's farm","Hwitmon resides at his estate, just east of the central fountain in Cliving, with his daughter.\
\
Inhild would like her father's permission to visit Randgar's farm one last time to see what yet remains and to say farewell.","Hwitmon resides at his estate, just east of the central fountain in Cliving.\
\
Inhild and Randgar have asked that Hwitmon not be told the truth, as he would be happiest to believe that his daughter is with a wealthy man in Edoras."}},
[1098]={nameES="All the Players in the Game",objectivesES={}},
[1099]={nameES="Todo va bien",objectivesES={"Todo va bien","Buscando en el campamento orco, encontraste una rueda para el carro de Mattie Bosquerudo. Aunque la rueda es algo pequeña, debería de servir para llevar el carro y un cargamento de madera de vuelta a Puente de Caballetes.","Elsie Bosquerudo está en Puente de Caballetes.\
\
Mientras Mattie y Noll arreglan el carro y lo cargan con la madera que han recogido, Mattie te ha pedido que vuelvas a Puente de Caballetes y le digas a su mujer que está a salvo."}},
[1100]={nameES="Bien está lo que bien acaba",objectivesES={"Longo está junto al pozo en la plaza del pueblo de Entibo.\
\
Hiciste lo que Cancióndesauce indicó. Dile a Longo Daegmund que el pozo debería ser seguro para beber nuevamente.","El pozo de Entibo está al norte y al oeste del Manantial de Aguas Plateadas.\
\
Cancióndesauce te dijo que regresaras el cubo de agua al pozo de Entibo.","Cancióndesauce ha creado un remedio con las flores que le llevaste.","Habla con Longo Daegmund junto al pozo del pueblo de Entibo","Bien está lo que bien acaba","Recoge el cubo"}},
[1101]={nameES="Allies and Enemies",objectivesES={"Allies and Enemies","Talk to Haul at Echad Naeglanc","Echad Naeglanc lies to the south and east of Bledhun's camp.\
\
Bledhun has asked you to warn his allies regarding the evil ones who dwell in the Bonevales.","The wights of the Bonevales and the Dievlig pose a great threat to all the clans of Dunland."}},
[1102]={nameES="Aliados de Mordor",objectivesES={"Los enanos que se dirigieron desde la Sala Vigesimoprimera hasta la Guardia Orca parecen haber colocado trampas disuasorias para sus enemigos, pero ya no funcionan.\
\
Sin duda sería de gran ayuda para los enanos que defienden el puesto avanzado en los Filones del Cuernorrojo que estas trampas volvieran a estar operativas.","Has armado las trampas destinadas a frenar el avance de los Ghâsh-hai en el sur de Zelem-melek.\
\
Aunque los enanos no lo sepan, les has prestado un gran servicio.","Aliados de Mordor","Completado","Los enanos que se dirigieron desde la Sala Vigesimoprimera hasta la Guardia Orca parecen haber colocado trampas disuasorias para sus enemigos, pero ya no funcionan.","Las trampas se encuentran en las salas del sur de Zelem-melek, al oeste y al norte de la Guardia Orca. Los enanos las colocaron cerca de Gabil-mamach y Budkhul-tharâkh.\
\
Deberías armar las trampas que han dejado de funcionar para ayudar a hacer los pasajes más seguros frente a los enemigos de Khazad-dûm."}},
[1103]={nameES="Aliado / Aliada del Hamât Renovado",objectivesES={}},
[1104]={nameES="Ally of History",objectivesES={}},
[1105]={nameES="Ally of Sul Madásh",objectivesES={}},
[1106]={nameES="Ally of the Adúrhid",objectivesES={}},
[1107]={nameES="Aliado / Aliada de los Ikorbâni",objectivesES={"Your standing among the Ikorbâni earns you a gift. Return to Kildûg at Iridír to claim your reward.","Your efforts to assist the Ikorbâni are noted among the people. To recognize your efforts, the leaders of the Shagâni at Iridír wish to honour you with a gift and thanks.","Reach Ally tier with the Ikorbâni","Visit Kildûg at Iridír to claim a gift","You have honoured your word to assist the Ikorbâni in their efforts to restore their lands. You should return to Kildûg at Iridír to receive a reward for your continued assistance."}},
[1108]={nameES="Ally of the Phetekâri",objectivesES={}},
[1109]={nameES="Aliado / Aliada de los Temámir de Jiret-menêsh",objectivesES={"In the broken land of An Shêru, your efforts to assist the Dwarves of Jiret-menêsh have not gone unnoticed. Among the adventurous dwarves who dared leave the deep halls, your name and effort gain heft. Return to the quartermaster to see new wares awaiting those proven.","Reach Ally standing with the Temámir of Jiret-menêsh","In the broken land of An Shêru, your efforts to assist the dwarves of Jiret-menêsh have not gone unnoticed.","Speak with Semanísi at Jiret-menêsh","You stand by your agreement with the Temámir of Jiret-menêsh and assist in the recovery of the broken land. You should return to Quartermaster Semanísi to see what acclaim your deeds have wrought."}},
[1110]={nameES="Ally to the City of Zajâna",objectivesES={}},
[1111]={nameES="Alone in the City",objectivesES={"Search for Círgon in Egalmoth's Green in the Third Circle","Egalmoth's Green can be found to the north in the Third Circle.\
\
You were unable to find Círgon at the Baths and should now search Egalmoth's Green.","Talk to Círgon","The Baths of Belecthor can be found to the north in the Fourth Circle.\
\
Mílien has asked you to seek out her son, Círgon, at the Baths of Belecthor near their home or below in Egalmoth's Green.","After her husband left Minas Tirith to aid in the war, Mílien has grown increasingly concerned by her son's behaviour.","You see a young boy standing in Egalmoth's Green...","Círgon is not here. Perhaps he is in Egalmoth's Green below...","Alone in the City","Search for Círgon near the Baths of Belecthor in the Fourth Circle"}},
[1112]={nameES="A lo largo del Gran Camino del Este",objectivesES={"A lo largo del Gran Camino del Este","El campamento de Adso se encuentra al oeste, a lo largo del Gran Camino del Este, entre la puerta de Bree y Los Gamos.\
\
El Vigilante Grimbriar te envió para ayudar a Adso Henoloma a resolver los problemas que el hobbit tiene actualmente con los bandidos del sur.","Habla con Adso Henoloma en su campamento","El Vigilante Grimbriar te envió a investigar las denuncias de más actividad de sureños a lo largo del Gran Camino del Este. Un hobbit allí, Adso Henoloma, pidió ayuda contra ladrones y matones."}},
[1113]={nameES="Along the Rhachló",objectivesES={"Meet up with Oroniel","Along the Rhachló","You should patrol along the river Rhachló, looking out for any beasts corrupted by its waters.","Oroniel fears the corruption along the river Rhachló might be more widespread.","Oroniel has returned and can be found further south along the banks of the Rhachló.\
\
You should reconvene with Oroniel and discuss how next to proceed."}},
[1114]={nameES="A lo largo de la torre de guardia",objectivesES={"Mosco Fondolodoso está en Ost Guruth, al noroeste de Harloeg.\
\
Ahora que has enfrentado y dado muerte al Encharcado, regresa con Mosco Fondolodoso y cuéntale tu éxito.","Derrota al Encharcado","A lo largo de la torre de guardia","El Encharcado ha sido derrotado","Mosco Fondolodoso está preocupado por la defensa de Ost Guruth y te ha pedido investigar rumores sobre una criatura vil al sur.","El Encharcado puede encontrarse en las ruinas de Harloeg, al sureste de Ost Guruth.\
\
Mosco Fondolodoso te ha pedido que te encargues de una criatura Sin Nombre que, según los rumores, acecha en el sur de Harloeg. Mosco mencionó que probablemente estará cerca de un viejo altar de piedra.","Encuentra el lugar donde mora el Encharcado","Hallado el lugar donde mora el Encharcado","Regresa con Mosco Fondolodoso"}},
[1115]={nameES="Ambassador to the King",objectivesES={"King Thorin III can be found before his throne in the Hall Under the Mountain.\
\
Ambassador Spakorth has thanked King Thorin III for his mercy and offered the services of the Stout-axes to Durin's Folk.","Ambassador Sparkorth of the Stout-axes wishes to thank King Thorin III and pledge his people to the service of Durin's Folk.","Talk to King Thorin III","Ambassador to the King","Talk to Ambassador Spakorth before King Thorin III's throne","Ambassador Spakorth can be found before King Thorin III's throne in the Hall Under the Mountain.\
\
Ambassador Spakorth has asked you to accompany him to address King Thorin in Erebor."}},
[1116]={nameES="Ambush The Inventory",objectivesES={"Edenos has tasked you with destroying the enemies supplies in order to weaken their efforts to take the city.","Enemy supplies can be found on the Eastern side of Osgiliath.\
\
You should destroy enemy supplies.","Edenos is at the Palace of Eldacar.\
\
You should speak to Edenos.","Speak with Edenos","Ambush The Inventory"}},
[1117]={nameES="Ambush at the Heights",objectivesES={}},
[1118]={nameES="Ambushed on the River",objectivesES={}},
[1119]={nameES="Amdân Dammul, the Bloody Threshold -- Tier 1",objectivesES={"Amdân Dammul, the Bloody Threshold -- Tier 1","You have defeated the beasts, but Gorgar now intends to fight you himself!\
\
You must now face Gorgar the Ruthless and Ránulur, Chieftain of Wargs in the arena!","Defeat the Beasts of Slaughter","The final battle of the War of Three Peaks has begun. Prince Durin Stonehelmson of the Longbeards will lead the great force of united dwarves in an assault on the main gates of Gundabad. But the Orkish chieftain, Gorgar the Ruthless, has one final surprise in store for his enemies.","Defeated Gorgar and Ránulur","Gorgar's trap has been sprung, and you must now fight in his arena or perish.\
\
You should defeat Gorgar's Beasts of Slaughter.","Defeated the Beasts of Slaughter","Advance with the dwarf army","Defeat Gorgar and Ránulur","Prince Durin of the Longbeards is ready to lead the charge on Gundabad.\
\
You should advance with the dwarf army!"}},
