[1126]={nameES="Amon Fuin: The Coffers",objectivesES={}},
[1127]={nameES="Amon Fuin: The Cultists",objectivesES={}},
[1128]={nameES="Among the Refugees: Hunger and Cold",objectivesES={"The camps of the Easterling refugees are in the hills east of Dale.\
\
You should help the refugees by gathering firewood and blue berries for them.","The Easterling refugee encampments need more food and firewood than they can gather.","Enkárvo can be found in the Dorwinion camp, in the hills east of Dale.\
\
You should bring the berries and firewood you gathered back to Enkárvo.","Among the Refugees: Hunger and Cold","Bring the supplies to Enkárvo"}},
[1129]={nameES="Among the Refugees: Shards of Memory",objectivesES={}},
[1130]={nameES="Among the Refugees: Wolves at Bay",objectivesES={"You should defeat wolves in the areas around the refugee encampments, east and across the river from Dale.","Among the Refugees: Wolves at Bay","Return to Komúsi","Wolves still attack the Easterling refugees when they stray from their camps.","You should return to Komúsi, who can be found in the Dorwinion camp, in the hills east of Dale."}},
[1131]={nameES="Among the Thieves",objectivesES={"Thandor, the Gondorian Captain, can be located in the market east of Tol Ciryarani.\
\
You should speak with Thandor.","The ruffians can be found in the abandoned district to the north-east of Tol Ciryarani.\
\
You should defeat the ruffians who are harbouring Lorvegil.","DNT - Not Used","A band of thieves has taken over one of the districts of Pelargir, and Thandor is requesting assistance in their removal.","Among the Thieves","Talk to Thandor"}},
[1132]={nameES="An Absence of Supply",objectivesES={"Everything seems to be in order here","Not everything seems to be in order here","You should inventory the supplies and rations in Loeglond.","Talk to Sírithon","You should talk to Sírithon, who can be found in Loeglond.","One of the raft-elves of Loeglond has become convinced a thief is somehow stealing from their supplies.","Sírithon can be found at Loeglond.\
\
You should speak with Sírithon about the various missing supplies.","An Absence of Supply"}},
[1133]={nameES="An Account",objectivesES={"Get Zerlúk to resume his account","Once his coughing subsides, Zerlúk continues with his account.\
\
'He came charging out of the trees, a man possessed, his sword...his sword whirling around him in a wide arc. We had to...had to fight. He killed many of us, and we had to retreat. We doubled back on him as he made his way down the hill, and in the company of... many archers...many archers....'\
\
Zerlúk's laughter bubbles out of him noisily.\
\
'He gave me this gash across my belly, and I fell here...I pretended to be dead. The warrior did not last much longer than that. He was still...alive...when his friends arrived...but....'\
\
Zerlúk's breath has gone ragged, but he still has enough life to look up at you slyly.","Zerlúk is in the Dead Orc Glade, in the middle of giving you his account of what happened there.","Zerlúk is telling you his account of what happened at the Dead Orc Glade.","An Account"}},
[1134]={nameES="Un informe detallado",objectivesES={"Un informe detallado","Reinn todavía no ha regresado...","El capataz Mögr está en la Sala Vigesimoprimera.\
\
Deberías volver a ver a Mögr a la Sala Vigesimoprimera y hacerle cambiar su opinión sobre Zelem-melek.","Vuelve a ver a Mögr para entregarle el informe completo sobre Zelem-melek","Has averiguado mucho sobre los peligros ocultos en Zelem-melek, y deberías llevar un informe completo a Mögr en la Sala Vigesimoprimera."}},
[1135]={nameES="Una Tradición Cervecera en Peligro",objectivesES={"Recoge el tonel de cerveza","Una Tradición Cervecera en Peligro","Los Hombres de Bree celebran tradicionalmente el festival de Yule con un gran festín de jabalí y cerveza.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando finalice el festival actual.</rgb>","Lleva el tonel de cerveza a Wim Trigales","Wim Trigales se encuentra en los terrenos del Festival de Bree.\
\
Wim Trigales estará encantado de recibir el tonel de cerveza destinado a la degustación del festival de Yule.","Tonel de cerveza recogido","Los toneles de cerveza perdidos pueden encontrarse al suroeste de los terrenos del Festival de Bree, probablemente cerca del Camino Verde, no lejos de la granja de Espinar.\
\
Wim Trigales te pidió que recuperaras un tonel de cerveza para la degustación anual del festival de Yule."}},
[1136]={nameES="Una alianza con los enanos",objectivesES={"Preocupado por la mención de Skorgrím por parte del Señor del Trueno y por los informes de enanos hostiles ocupando una fortaleza en las Montañas Nubladas, Elrond te pide que hables con Glóin para solicitar que enanos y Elfos trabajen juntos contra las fuerzas de Angmar.","Una alianza con los enanos","Glóin está en el campamento montañoso de los enanos al norte de Rivendel.\
\
Elrond te ha pedido que hables con Glóin sobre un nuevo consejo contra Angmar."}},
[1137]={nameES="An Ally in Need",objectivesES={"Escort the wounded Elf to safety","An Ally in Need","Aid the fallen Malledhrim warrior in his escape from the war-torn fortifications of Gathbúrz, back towards Thangúlhad.","You have rescued the wounded Elf","One of the Malledhrim has been wounded, and fallen behind enemy lines. While the valiant warrior can still move, he can fight only weakly and requires your aid to escape from enemy territory.","Handelen is at Thangúlhad in Gathbúrz.\
\
You should inform Handelen of the aid you lent to the wounded Elf-warrior.","Talk to Handelen in Thangúlhad"}},
[1138]={nameES="An Ambusher Ambushed",objectivesES={"The trail of the Silent One's blood leads deeper into Rath Cail.\
\
Legolas has spotted an Orc with a similar stature and bearing fleeing deeper into Rath Cail. You should follow the trail of Orkish blood and see where it leads.","Legolas can be found in the Silent Haunt.\
\
You and Legolas have tracked the Silent One to what appears to be his refuge in Lhingris. The Silent One is nowhere to be found, but curious items have been laid in the cave.","You and Legolas have found a strange cave where Orkish bones are piled and picked clean...","An Ambusher Ambushed","The trail of blood leads deeper into Rath Cail!","Talk to Legolas in the Silent Haunt","Legolas spotted a wounded Orc of a similar stature and bearing to the Silent One travelling southward deeper into Rath Cail.","Follow the trail of the Silent One's blood deeper into Rath Cail"}},
[1139]={nameES="Una esperanza antigua",objectivesES={"La Bóveda de Durin se encuentra directamente al sur del pequeño campamento en Lamab-dûm, en la Gran Excavación.\
\
Debes encontrar la Bóveda de Durin y ver si es tan prometedora como su nombre sugiere.","Swerthir está en el pequeño campamento de enanos en Lamab-dûm, en la Gran Excavación.\
\
Debes regresar a Swerthir y contarle lo que has aprendido sobre el estado actual de la Bóveda de Durin.","Una esperanza antigua","No hay nada aquí más que polvo y temblores de la tierra","Regresa a Swerthir en Lamab-dûm","Swerthir está fascinado por la Bóveda de Durin al sur, pero le preocupa separarse de su grupo."}},
[1140]={nameES="Una Antigua Historia de Maldad",objectivesES={"Una Antigua Historia de Maldad","Para reconstruir la Llave del Túmulo, primero deberás buscar a los hermanos gemelos que poseen el primer fragmento. El segundo yace con un engendro; vivo desde tiempos que escapan a nuestro conteo. Estos son apenas dos fragmentos de un todo mayor.","Has adquirido la mitad derecha de la Llave del Túmulo.","Naerandir te ha dicho que conoce la historia de Othrongroth, el Gran Túmulo, pero que la realidad del lugar tal como existe ahora debe ser velada bajo el esplendor de la leyenda, para que el temor cauteloso no se convierta en terror absoluto.","Lee el libro de Naerandir para orientarte","Ensambla la llave en la Forja del Túmulo","El Gran Túmulo se encuentra en la cima de la colina, más allá del pequeño campamento. El primer fragmento de la llave está custodiado por dos demacrados en el laberinto del Gran Túmulo. El segundo fragmento lo posee un Señor Demacrado en otra parte del Gran Túmulo.\
\
Naerandir te pidió que entres al Gran Túmulo, Orthongroth, para purgar la tumba del mal. Te entregó un libro para ayudarte en tu aventura.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>La primera mitad de la llave se encuentra en la instancia del Gran Túmulo — Laberinto, mientras que la segunda mitad está en la instancia del Gran Túmulo — Thadur.</rgb>","Has adquirido la mitad izquierda de la Llave del Túmulo.","Una forja yace frente a una gran puerta dentro de los Túmulos. Es allí donde la llave deberá ser reforjada. No requerirá habilidad, pero sí tiempo.\
\
Consulta el libro de Naerandir si alguna vez te confundes sobre cómo reforjar la llave.","Habiendo obtenido los dos fragmentos de la llave, deberás buscar la forja.\
\
No necesitarás la habilidad de forjar armas, herramientas ni cotas de malla. La llave desea ser restaurada como fue concebida, para asegurar que los Muertos permanezcan en su sueño. Pero los Muertos que habitan dentro harán lo posible para impedir que la llave sea restaurada.\
\
Cuando el martillo golpee el yunque, comenzará tu prueba... Ruega a los Valar haber traído amigos leales y firmes que te acompañen hasta el final.","Consulta el libro de Naerandir para ayuda","Has recibido la Llave del Gran Túmulo","Más allá de los túneles, cargados de niebla y polvo, por escaleras ruinosas construidas en una era anterior a la nuestra, yace una puerta. Esa puerta conduce al lugar de descanso final de un gran líder de los Hombres, muerto hace mucho tiempo, y a una poderosa carcasa reclamada por las fuerzas leales al Rey Brujo.\
\
Fue para protegerlo que los artesanos forjaron la llave antes de su tumba. Una gran puerta, replicada varias veces, para sellar a los muertos fuera del alcance del mal. El mal, al parecer, resultó demasiado potente para que el mero metal pudiera resistirlo. Sin embargo, algo de poder debe permanecer, pues la llave está partida de tal forma que su refundición no requiere habilidades de artesano, sino que debe ser restaurada en la forja donde fue creada.\
\
Busca esa forja al pie de las escaleras ruinosas, en una fosa frente a la gran puerta.","Obtén la mitad derecha de la Llave del Túmulo","Obtén la mitad izquierda de la Llave del Túmulo"}},
[1141]={nameES="Una amenaza antigua",objectivesES={"Derrota a Thaurlach","Has derrotado a Thaurlach","Iorelen se encuentra en su campamento.\
\
Has matado a Thaurlach y deberías contarle a Iorelen tus hazañas.","Eimyr, el jefe de los Eldgang, se dio cuenta de la locura de sus acciones y ha decidido enfrentarse al mal ancestral que se encuentra en los salones de Nûrz Gâashu.","Una amenaza antigua","Glathlírel se encuentra vigilante fuera de Gorthban.\
\
Eimyr te ha indicado que busques a Glathlírel y la ayudes contra Thaurlach, un Balrog de Morgoth."}},
[1142]={nameES="An Angler's Advice",objectivesES={"This looks like the second fishing spot","An Angler's Advice","Catch a fish at the third spot","You caught a fish at each of the three locations Zildug recommended. You should return to Iridír and show your catch to the fisherman.","Return to Zildug in Iridír","Catch a fish at the first spot","Find the second fishing spot","Catch a fish at the second spot","You have found the third fishing spot Zildug described. You should throw the old bait and hook and see if it is as good a place to fish as Zildug says.","Find the third fishing spot","This looks like the third fishing spot","You have found the second fishing spot Zildug described. You should cast a line and see if it is as good a place to fish as Zildug says.","Zildug has shared with you the secret locations of his favourite fishing spots.","The first fishing spot is on a bridge crossing a stream east of Arwáth. You should go there and try catching a fish.","You have found the first fishing spot Zildug described. You should equip your fishing rod and see if it is as good a place to fish as Zildug says.","The third fishing spot is a dock on the Ikorbân, far to the south-east past the Wrackwade. You should go there and try catching a fish.","The second fishing spot is south along the same stream as the first. You should go there and try catching a fish.","Find the first fishing spot","This looks like the first fishing spot"}},
[1143]={nameES="An Answer Unspoken",objectivesES={"Help Kurtil up","DNT FLAG F","The slave Kurtil is lying on the southern edge of the Udûn basin, up atop a wooden structure.\
\
You should help Kurtil up off the ground.","Find Kurtil up the road","DNT FLAG C","The slave Kurtil stands on the southern edge of the Udûn basin, up atop a wooden structure.\
\
You should talk to Kurtil some more.","Talk to Kurtil","The Nurnhoth slave Kurtil has promised to unravel the secrets of the signal flags, if he can be trusted. Will he reveal the truth of a meeting among the dwellers of Udûn?","DNT FLAG 1","You should search for more signal flags south of the Udûn basin, on the road that leads up toward Mornaur.","An Answer Unspoken","DNT FLAG E","Kurtil greets you with a mischievous twinkle in his eye","The slave comes up unsteadily with a groan, but seems steady enough once up","Now that you have inspected more signal flags, you should look for Kurtil southward on the road that leads to Mornaur.","DNT FLAG D","DNT FLAG B"}},
[1144]={nameES="An Apprentice's Guide to Ithilien",objectivesES={"Survey the ruins of Bâr Aroth in Ithilien","Mílgamel can be found in the House of Remedies within the Masters' Tier of Minas Tirith (After-battle).\
\
Galathir has given his apprentice, Mílgamel, a daunting task, and he has asked that you aid her in completing it.","Survey the Houses of Healing in Osgiliath","Talk to Mílgamel in the House of Remedies","Habla con Mílgamel","Escort Mílgamel to Henneth Annûn","Survey the ruins of Aelin Veren in Ithilien","Talk to Galathir in the House of Remedies","Survey the island fortress of Cair Andros","Mílgamel can be found on the central causeway in Osgiliath (After-battle).\
\
You have found Mílgamel and should now speak to her about her plans for surveying Ithilien.","An Apprentice's Guide to Ithilien","Meet Mílgamel near the remains of the Great Bridge in Osgiliath (After-battle)","Talk to Mílgamel in Osgiliath (After-battle)","Mílgamel can be found along the central causeway in Osgiliath (After-battle).\
\
Mílgamel has asked you to meet her in Osgiliath before embarking on her survey of Ithilien.","Galathir can be found in the House of Remedies within the Masters' Tier of Minas Tirith (After-battle).\
\
Ioreth has asked you to speak with Galathir for she fears he might mislead a young apprentice in his tutelage.","You have found Mílgamel and she appears to be admiring the ruined city from the causeway...","Mílgamel can be found at your side or summoned by horn.\
\
Mílgamel has asked you to aid her in surveying the greater lands of Ithilien. You should bring her to each location she mentioned and confer with her once there.","Mílgamel can be found at Henneth Annûn.\
\
You have escorted Mílgamel to Henneth Annûn and should now speak to her about what is to be done next.","Mílgamel can be found at your side or summoned by horn.\
\
Mílgamel has finished her initial survey and has asked to be escorted to Henneth Annûn. You should speak to her once you arrive at Henneth Annûn.","Fearful of a young apprentice being miseducated by Galathir, Ioreth has asked you to join her on a daunting task.","Survey the roadway into Imlad Morgul","Talk to Mílgamel at Henneth Annûn","You have arrived at Henneth Annûn, and the cool glow of the cavern seems even more inviting than usual."}},
[1145]={nameES="Un ejército de ojos",objectivesES={"Una gran bandada de crebain procedente de las Tierras Brunas ha descendido sobre Eregion, buscando señales del paso de la Compañía desde Rivendel.","Thaliondir está en Gwingris, muy al oeste de los nidos de craban.\
\
Debes regresar a Thaliondir con noticias de tu éxito.","Habla con Thaliondir en Gwingris","Los crebain pueden encontrarse en el valle muy al este de Gwingris.\
\
Thaliondir te ha pedido que vayas y derrotes a los craban espías de Saruman.","Un ejército de ojos"}},
[1146]={nameES="An Audience Not Given",objectivesES={"Ningêna asked you to speak with the Khûdi envoy in the encampment. She cannot spare her time or any of her people to address the envoy's needs. You can find him not far from her location.","Show the coin to Sigênik, Rebel Contact","Sûkal provided you a coin and a general direction to the road south over the Wrackwade to reach Jirush, and a man named Sigênik. Sigênik is a contact for the rebels in Khûd Zagin.","An Audience Not Given","As you reveal the coin to the man, he holds up a hand.\
\
'The first lesson you must learn is discretion. There is an appearance of freedom here, but ever watchful are the eyes of the Ordâkhai on the rise to the north-west.\
\
'We struggle for the future of our land and people. Our leaders are few, hidden, for their safety and their families. The few who remain here are vigilant in their watch and defence. You bear a gift we sent north to our cousins in Ambarûl. If they sent you here, then you shall be tested.\
\
'Prove your value and integrity, and we welcome your assistance. Do not, and suffer the fate of our enemies.'","Sûkal gave you a coin to present Sigênik in Jirush south across the Wrackwade","Speak with Sûkal","An envoy from Khûd Zagin crossed the Wrackwade looking for an audience with Ningêna. Ningêna has no time or resources to spare the envoy and asked you to intervene."}},
[1147]={nameES="An Audience with the Boy King",objectivesES={"Meet Tuhâl in Dale","The King has decided to set aside land for the Easterling refugees!\
\
You should discuss the good news with Tuhâl!","Talk to King Bard","Tuhâl is travelling to Dale to meet with Queen Erna and King Bard.\
\
You should meet Tuhâl in Dale.","With the Jangovar plot ended, the Easterling refugees need somewhere to go. You must seek an audience with King Bard and Queen Erna to solve their plight.","Queen Erna and King Bard can be found in Dale.\
\
You should talk to Queen Erna.","Talk to Tuhâl","An Audience with the Boy King","Talk to Queen Erna"}},
[1148]={nameES="Una audiencia con los Cuan-lûth",objectivesES={"Habla con Cariad","Una audiencia con los Cuan-lûth","Cariad desea presentarte a Erlys, la mujer que lidera a este grupo de refugiados dunlendinos.\
\
Te espera frente al Refugio de los Cuan-lûth.","Cariad te espera frente al Refugio de los Cuan-lûth.","Tú podrías ser la clave del plan de Cariad."}},
[1149]={nameES="An Audience with the Doorwards",objectivesES={}},
[1150]={nameES="An Audience with the Hall-father",objectivesES={"Speak with Khôltekh about Inîk Jewel-brow.","Khôltekh has taken you into his trust, for now. He's asked you to accompany him to his house to speak more about his plans for Umbar.","Speak with Khôltekh about Inîk Jewel-brow","Listen to Khôltekh explain his plans for the Umbar-môkh","Speak with Khôltekh about his plans for the Umbar-môkh.","Speak with Khôltekh about his plans for the Umbar-môkh","Introduce yourself to the important-looking dwarf standing in Khôltekh's entry room","Listen to Khôltekh explain his plans for the Umbar-môkh.","Listen to the conversation between Khôltekh and Inîk Jewel-brow","Listen to the conversation between Khôltekh and Inîk Jewel-brow.","Introduce yourself to the important-looking dwarf standing in Khôltekh's entry room.","An Audience with the Hall-father"}},
[1151]={nameES="Una prueba",objectivesES={"Una prueba","Colmillo Rojo Enjaulado derrotado","El huargo está retenido en la parte norte de Kauppa-kohta.\
\
Valtteri, el líder de cazadores lossoth, te ha ordenado derrotar al huargo que su grupo ha capturado para ganarte el derecho a cazar con los Lossoth.","Derrota al Colmillo Rojo Enjaulado","Los ojos del huargo se abren de golpe mientras se alza sobre sus cuatro patas, listo para atacar.","Los cazadores lossoth de Kauppa-kohta practican sus habilidades de caza con los huargos que capturan.","Habla con Valtteri","Valtteri se encuentra en la parte norte de Kauppa-kohta, el puesto comercial lossoth.\
\
Ahora que has derrotado al huargo, deberías volver a hablar con Valtteri."}},
[1152]={nameES="Un autor ausente",objectivesES={"Willem Bigotes acepta a regañadientes no hacerle daño a Spalvi... por ahora","Encuentra a un topógrafo Duramano en algún lugar de la Ciudad de los Trasgos y hazte con sus mapas","Willem Bigotes bufa ante tu optimismo, pero a regañadientes agita sus orejas en señal de asentimiento. Ahora deberías volver con Spalvi y ver si ha averiguado algo útil del mapa que recuperaste.","Encuentra a Willem Bigotes en algún lugar del campamento de los Guaredain en la Fisura de Erforgh","Encuentra una de las entradas a la Ciudad de los Trasgos, en las Montañas Nubladas","Un autor ausente","Has llegado a una de las entradas secundarias de la Ciudad de los Trasgos","Bingo Boffin cayó a una profunda cueva durante su huida de Gabilazan, y ahora Spalvi Duramano quiere ayudarte a rescatar al desventurado hobbit.","Willem Bigotes ha ido en busca de Bingo a la Fisura de Erforgh, en la esquina suroeste del Paso Alto del Sur, y Spalvi quiere que te asegures de que está bien.","Los topógrafos Duramano enviados por Skorgrím Duramano nunca volieron de su misión de cartografiar los túneles de la Ciudad de los Trasgos. Si puedes encontrar sus mapas, podrías conocer la distribución de las cavernas bajo las Montañas Nubladas en las que Bingo ha caído.","Willem Bigotes lloriquea lastimeramente, y puedes ver claramente su frustración por la ausencia de Bingo, y que su búsqueda en la Fisura de Erforgh no ha sido fructífera. Le aseguras que no abandonarás al hobbit. Él olfatea ruidosamente, poco convencido.\
\
Le hablas sosegadamente al lince, diciéndole que con tus esfuerzos, los de Spalvi y los suyos, encontraréis la caverna en la que ha caído Bingo y lo traeréis de vuelta.\
\
El lince bufa, pero a regañadientes agita sus orejas en señal de asentimiento. Ahora deberías volver con Spalvi y ver si ha averiguado algo útil del mapa que recuperaste.","Has llegado a la entrada principal de la Ciudad de los Trasgos","Spalvi Duramano está en promontorio en la zona del Paso Alto del Sur en las Montañas Nubladas, al noroeste de la Fisura de Erforgh.","Habla con Spalvi en el exterior del campamento de Glóin en la zona de la Fuente del Bruinen Oeste","Habla con Spalvi en el Paso Alto del Sur","Lleva el mapa de los túneles de la montaña a Spalvi en el Paso Alto del Sur","Spalvi Duramano te ha dicho que se reuniría contigo en un promontorio en la zona del Paso Alto del Sur en las Montañas Nubladas una vez que hayas recuperado algunos mapas útiles de los topógrafos perdidos en la Ciudad de los Trasgos.","Encuentras un mapa de los túneles de la montaña en el cuerpo del Duramano","Spalvi quería reunirse contigo en el exterior del campamento de Glóin en la zona de la Fuente del Bruinen Oeste de las Montañas Nubladas."}},
[1153]={nameES="An Axe to Grind",objectivesES={"Talk to Quickbeam east of Isengard","Having watched thousands of his beloved trees felled by the axes of the Uruks, Quickbeam has determined to punish them for their transgressions... but he dares not show himself until his unnamed kindred have decided what to do about Saruman.","The Uruk wood-cutters who have destroyed the trees in Nan Curunír can be found in the Vale below.\
\
Quickbeam has asked you to defeat the Uruk wood-cutters who destroyed the trees in Nan Curunír.","Quickbeam is at his home on the north-eastern slopes above Nan Curunír.\
\
You should tell Quickbeam that you have driven away the Uruk wood-cutters for at least a short time.","An Axe to Grind"}},
[1154]={nameES="Una travesía hacia el este",objectivesES={"Tham Lumren se halla en el noreste del Ángulo.\
\
Deberías buscar a Thalathril en el campamento élfico de Tham Lumren.","Thalathril está cerca de la tienda grande en el campamento élfico.\
\
Deberías hablar con ella.","Tham Lumren se halla en el noreste del Ángulo.\
\
Merileg te ha pedido que lleves un informe a Tham Lumren, pero el camino está custodiado. Deberías hablar con los guardias para que te permitan entrar.","Habla con el guardia","Busca Tham Lumren","Una travesía hacia el este","Habla con Thalathril","Aunque el acceso al Ángulo es difícil debido a los ríos que lo rodean, a los elfos de Rivendel les inquieta la creciente presencia de los siervos del Enemigo."}},
[1155]={nameES="Un brillo inquietante",objectivesES={"Un brillo inquietante","Lleva el mineral a Svanr","Has recolectado varias piezas raras de mineral como trofeo de tus aventuras en Nud-melek.","El mineral de narfulz se puede encontrar en el borde del abismo en el centro de Nud-melek.\
\
Deberías recolectar mineral de narfulz en Nud-melek.","Has descubierto un mineral altamente inusual en las grietas de Khurjezer, removido por la fuerza que destrozó el puente y los pisos alrededor del abismo.","Desde la oscuridad de la gran grieta en Nud-melek asoma un mineral de brillo inquietante, uno que has oído nombrar como 'Narfulz' por los enanos. Es probable que lo que haya destrozado el puente y los pisos aquí también haya removido el Narfulz.\
\
Sería prudente recolectar este raro mineral mientras estás aquí, ya que puede considerarse un trofeo de gran valor."}},
[1156]={nameES="Una niebla inquietante",objectivesES={"El fuerte aroma de la tarta de moras agudiza tus sentidos... ¡y tu apetito!","Prueba un trago de Fognoggin","Halinard Bonce se encuentra en Wistmead.\
\
Has probado la Fognoggin de Halinard Bonce y la has encontrado bastante potente. Deberías regresar con Halinard Bonce.","La cerveza Fognoggin se puede encontrar en barriles con grifo en Wistmead.\
\
Halinard Bonce ha creado un brebaje casi infame y siempre cambiante conocido como Fognoggin. Deberías probar su receta más reciente.","Ejercicio, agua fría o un susto repentino podrían ayudar a aliviar los efectos de la Fognoggin. ¿Quién sabe qué más podría ayudar a disiparla?\
\
Has probado la nueva receta de la Fognoggin y deberías intentar encontrar una manera de hacer pasar su potente efecto.","No se siente muy bien, pero hacer algunos saltos parece ayudar.","Habla con Halinard Bonce","Qué desagradable. Sin embargo, te sientes un poco mejor...","No te sientes muy bien, pero hacer algunas flexiones parece ayudar.","Una niebla inquietante","Halinard Bonce ha ideado un brebaje de cerveza terriblemente potente, adecuado para el Festival de la Cosecha, pero sus esfuerzos han dejado a algunos de los asistentes al festival inquietos."}},
[1157]={nameES="An Eerie Gathering",objectivesES={}},
[1158]={nameES="An Egg! A Single Egg! One Egg!",objectivesES={"You have delivered the 'egg' to Ezôti.\
\
Report back to Ezôti in the Upper Ward.","Ezôti has asked you to find and paint a rock that looks reasonably like a roc egg.\
\
Search for a suitable rock outside the Gate of Songs in the north-eastern wall of Umbar Baharbêl.","You have delivered the 'egg'!","Pick up the 'egg' outside the north gate of Umbar Baharbêl","You have found the perfect sized rock. Now to paint it so it looks like a roc's egg.\
\
Paint the rock outside the gates of Umbar Baharbêl.","You have painted a rock to look like a roc's egg. It's time to deliver it back to Ezôti.\
\
Deliver the fake roc's egg to Ezôti in the Upper Ward of Umbar Baharbêl.","It looks just like the real thing!","An Egg! A Single Egg! One Egg!","This rock is the perfect size. Now you should paint it to look like an egg","This rock is too big","Talk to Ezôti","Paint the rock","A strange man puts on a 'show' in the Upper Ward of Umbar Baharbêl.","This rock is too small","Inspect rocks outside the city beyond the Gate of Songs (2/3)","You have inspected some rocks that did not fit the requirement.\
\
Inspect one last rock outside the gates of Umbar Baharbêl."}},
[1159]={nameES="Una hoja vacía",objectivesES={"Has descubierto una empuñadura negra en la bolsa del cinturón de un espectro orco dentro del Tesoro Olvidado.","Donde la hoja debería encontrarse con la empuñadura, solo hay un espacio delgado donde una vez encajó una hoja. Esta empuñadura es pesada y está forjada en un hierro muy oscuro, no hecho por la mano de los enanos.\
\
Quizás Garthar, que se encuentra en el Descenso Profundo, pueda ayudarte a descubrir los medios siniestros por los cuales se hizo este objeto.","Habla con Garthar en el Descenso Profundo","Una hoja vacía","Garthar se encuentra en el Descenso Profundo.\
\
Garthar puede ser capaz de proporcionarte algún conocimiento sobre la extraña empuñadura que encontraste."}},
[1160]={nameES="An Empty Quiver",objectivesES={}},
[1161]={nameES="An Empty Stomach",objectivesES={"An Empty Stomach","Baillas is in Fangorn Forest, hoping for news of an injured man who walked by him.\
\
You should find Baillas once more and ask the old Ent for help finding the Rohirrim.","This bush has been recently picked, but the berries look suspiciously inedible...","Talk to Baillas to ask him for help","The injured man was evidently very hungry and may have been tempted to eat from the questionable berry-bushes surrounding his camp-site.","This food sack is empty... there is not a crumb in sight. It is clear that the injured man has not had access to any food for quite a while.\
\
He may have scrounged for food nearby before abandoning his dangerous little encampment. You should see if there is anything edible-looking nearby.","If the injured man hunted for food, it is likely that he did not look far from the camp.\
\
You should search north-east and south-east of the camp for anything edible the Rohirrim man may have found. It is likely he will still be hungry after his failed attempt at setting up camp.","You explain to Baillas that you have examined several berry-bushes, and many have been picked over recently, but it is unlikely that these berries are edible.\
\
If these have been eaten by the injured man, his situation may be more dire than what the Ent first beheld."}},
[1162]={nameES="An End To Peace",objectivesES={"Landiach can be found outside Lord Duinhir's home at the peak of Morlad.\
\
Malthellam has asked you to speak to the remaining guards of Morlad in hopes that you will be able to aid them.","The people of Gondor have long enjoyed peace, but rumblings to the east and along the coast have thrust these people into war once more.","Belegant can be found on the second tier of Morlad by following the path that runs south-west.\
\
Malthellam has asked you to speak to the remaining guards of Morlad in hopes that you will be able to aid them.","Malthellam can be found near the entrance of Morlad, outside his home.\
\
You have spoken to the guards of Morlad, and should now return to Malthellam.","Talk to Malthellam","Talk to Ecthel","DNT -- will not be seen","Talk to Landiach","An End To Peace","Ecthel can be found near the entrance of Morlad in north-western Blackroot Vale.\
\
Malthellam has asked you to speak to the remaining guards of Morlad in hopes that you will be able to aid them.","Talk to Belegant"}},
[1163]={nameES="An End to Lending",objectivesES={"An End to Lending","Collected Déorun's hammer","Collected Déorun's lantern","Collect Déorun's loaned lantern","Déorun resides at his home at the southern end of Faldham, just oustide the mead hall.\
\
You have collected Déorun's many missing items, and may now return them to the anxious farmer.","Collect Déorun's loaned hammer","Crofter Déorun, has begun arrangements in anticipation for the expected attack on Faldham. In order to protect his home and family, he is in need of several items he has lent to his neighbours over the course of time.","Collected Déorun's hay-fork","Déorun's neighbours can be found within Faldham.\
\
Déorun has need of the items he has lent to the other people living around Faldham, including Haligmar, Enswith, Thurgyr, and Osin.","Collected Déorun's bow","Return the items to Déorun","Collect Déorun's loaned hay-fork","Collect Déorun's loaned hunting bow"}},
[1164]={nameES="El Fin de la Empresa",objectivesES={"Lleva las figurillas de madera de Tim Rastrojal a Tongannel","Has encontrado lo que queda de Tim Rastrojal, víctima de los Gauredain","Siguiendo la petición de Tongannel, viajaste hacia el sur en dirección a la Cresta de Acebeda, buscando al artesano Tim Rastrojal. Encontraste su carro destruido, una caja rota y vacía, y otros indicios de que fue atacado.","Rescata a Tim Rastrojal y recupera sus bienes","El Fin de la Empresa","Deberías buscar el campamento gauredain y rescatar a Tim Rastrojal, si aún vive, y recuperar sus bienes","Tongannel está en Echad Candelleth, el campamento élfico en Tâl Bruinen, al norte de Echad Gauradan.\
\
Has recuperado las figurillas de madera de Tim Rastrojal de los Gauredain que las robaron, pero Rastrojal fue asesinado. Deberías devolver los bienes a Tongannel.","Los Gauredain tienen su guarida en las colinas del suroeste de Tâl Bruinen, al sur de Eryn Singor.\
\
Por los restos, parece que los misteriosos Gauredain de los que habló Nestael cuando llegaste por primera vez a Echad Candelleth podrían ser responsables del ataque. Deberías buscar su campamento y rescatar a Tim Rastrojal, si aún vive, y recuperar sus bienes.","Los Gauredain tienen su guarida en las colinas del suroeste de Tâl Bruinen, al sur de Eryn Singor.\
\
Por los restos, parece que los misteriosos Gauredain de los que habló Nestael cuando llegaste por primera vez a Echad Candelleth podrían ser responsables del ataque. Deberías buscar su campamento y rescatar a Tim Rastrojal, si lo han tomado prisionero, y recuperar sus bienes.","Encuentra a Tim Rastrojal"}},
[1165]={nameES="El fin de la caza furtiva",objectivesES={"Al ayudar a Asmund, no has cumplido la petición de Limhendeth.","Limhendeth te ha suplicado que ignores cualquier petición de Asmund y que en su lugar informes de sus actividades a Glordirith en Lórien.","Glordirith está en el sureste de Lothlórien, en Imlad Lalaith en Egladil, a orillas del Anduin.\
\
Limhendeth te ha pedido que ignores cualquier encargo de Asmund y que informes de sus actividades a Glordirith en Lothlórien.","El fin de la caza furtiva","Habla con Glordirith en Imlad Lalaith"}},
[1166]={nameES="El fin de la caza furtiva",objectivesES={"Al ayudar a Asmund, no has cumplido la petición de Limhendeth.","Limhendeth te ha suplicado que ignores cualquier petición de Asmund y que en su lugar informes de sus actividades a Glordirith en Lórien.","El fin de la caza furtiva","Habla con Glordirith en Imlad Lalaith","Glordirith está en el sureste de Lothlórien, en Imlad Lalaith en Egladil, a orillas del Anduin.\
\
Limhendeth te ha pedido que ignores cualquier petición de Asmund y que informes de sus actividades a Glordirith en Lothlórien."}},
[1167]={nameES="El fin de la caza furtiva",objectivesES={"Al ayudar a Asmund, no has cumplido la petición de Limhendeth.","Limhendeth te ha suplicado que ignores cualquier petición de Asmund y que en su lugar informes de sus actividades a Glordirith en Lórien.","El fin de la caza furtiva","Glordirith se encuentra en el sureste de Lothlórien, en Imlad Lalaith en Egladil, a orillas del Anduin.\
\
Limhendeth te ha pedido que ignores cualquier petición de Asmund y que informes de sus actividades a Glordirith."}},
[1168]={nameES="An End to Âmbal",objectivesES={"Return the trophy to Caddabrand","Defeat Âmbal and collect a trophy from her","An End to Âmbal","Defeated Âmbal and collected a trophy from her","Âmbal's den can be found west of Caddbrand's camp.\
\
Caddabrand is hoping that by defeating the infamous matron, Âmbal, that you might gain fame and fortune, along with Caddabrand.","Caddabrand's camp lies to the east of Âmbal's den.\
\
Caddabrand awaits your return with the trophy at his camp.","Caddabrand has tracked a notorious wolf-matron to her den. He believes that taking a trophy from the beast will increase both profit and notoriety for the ones to complete the task."}},
[1169]={nameES="An Enemy Within",objectivesES={"An Enemy Within","You have found a weapon rack stocked with only a few blunted blades...","Nimithil can be found in the lowest section of Ost Anglebed with her guards.\
\
You have found a few pieces of concerning evidence in Ost Anglebed, and should return to Nimithil.","Ost Anglebed can be found in north-central Lebennin.\
\
Nimithil has asked you to search Ost Anglebed for signs of treachery from within the guard.","Talk to Nimithil","After hearing of many strange occurrences within Ost Anglebed from her guards, Nimithil has need of a discerning eye.","This barricade has been burned despite no attacks being made against Ost Anglebed...","The logs near the beacon of Anglebed have been doused..."}},
[1170]={nameES="An Ent in Search of Entwives",objectivesES={"An Ent in Search of Entwives","Return the Ent-draught to Gnarlstump","Pour the Ent-draught upon the ruined gardens of the Entwives","Gnarlstump, an Ent of Fangorn, has come to the desolation that was once the gardens of the Entwives, seeking signs which might point at the direction of their long-ago departure from the Brown Lands.","The gardens of the Entwives lie within the cliffs to the south-east of Gnarlstump.\
\
Gnarlstump gave you an Ent-draught and asked you to pour it upon the ruined gardens of the Entwives.","Nothing happens when you pour the Ent-draught, but you do see a large, white flower growing in the garden","Nothing happens when you pour the Ent-draught","This looks like a good place to pour the Ent-draught","Gnarlstump is encamped to the north-west of the gardens of the Entwives.\
\
You should let Gnarlstump know what you did and did not discover among the gardens.","This would be a good place to pour the Ent-draught"}},
[1171]={nameES="An Errand for Arwen",objectivesES={"Baradal suddenly stops and leaves the road","The village of Arhaim lies along the road in Duskenvale.\
\
You should travel to Duskenvale.","Travel south with Baradal","Continue to Arhaim","Baradal is standing by at the Beorning Watchpost between Duskenvale and the Gladden Fields.\
\
You should talk to Baradal.","An Errand for Arwen","Baradal has asked to travel with you to the village of Arhaim.\
\
You should take the road south with Baradal.","Orcs lie in wait along the road to Arhaim.\
\
You should defeat the Orc ambushers.","Baradal has suddenly stopped along the road to Arhaim.\
\
You should talk to Baradal.","Talk to Baradal","You have found Arhaim","Talk to Baradal to begin the journey","You can call Baradal to your side with Baradal's summoning horn.\
\
You should talk to Baradal.","Baradal, house-carle to Lady Arwen, has been assigned a task in the wilds of Duskenvale. As you are a good friend of Arwen's family, she has asked for your assistance."}},
[1172]={nameES="An Evil Fate",objectivesES={"Find Golvorn","Golvorn's captives are in the Orc-mines.\
\
You have defeated Golvorn, a strange and powerful Man who claims to have served Saruman in some fashion. What fate he intended for the slaves he took is unknown, but you can at least free them now.","An Evil Fate","Talk to Edhere in the Orc-mines","More slaves have disappeared of late. It seems that some mysterious Man has come through the deeper tunnels, and each time takes a few of the hardier slaves away with him. To what fate, no one can tell, but given the laughter of the Orcs and their deference to this figure, it must be an evil one, indeed.","Edhere is in the Orc-mines.\
\
You should return to Edhere and let him know that Golvorn's captives have been freed.","You have defeated Golvorn","The missing prisoners and the Man who took them might be found somewhere in the Orc-mines.\
\
Edhere asked you to seek his missing companions and the Man who took them.","The prisoner seems to slip in and out of a daze as you cut him free, but he quickly recovers his senses once the bonds are removed."}},
[1173]={nameES="An Evil Spirit!",objectivesES={}},
[1174]={nameES="An Excess of Orders",objectivesES={"Gorgar's orders are often carried by Orcs at Hanksar-mokh and Kulûg-mokh.\
\
Sigvith has asked you to collect orders from the Hanksar-mokh and Kulûg-mokh.","An Excess of Orders","Deliver the orders to Sigvith","Sigvith can be found near the gates of Mount Gundabad.\
\
You have collected a number of orders from the Orcs at Hanksar-mokh and Kulûg-mokh. You should deliver them to Sigvith.","The Orcs of Gundabad often carry orders on behalf of Gorgar the Ruthless and his lieutenants, but with many orders come many contradictions."}},
[1175]={nameES="An Expansive Graveyard",objectivesES={}},
[1176]={nameES="An Expected Delivery",objectivesES={"An Expected Delivery","Collect the weapon crate","The Hammerstead weapons have been crated and are ready for delivery.\
\
You should collect the weapon crate.","The weapons are ready to be taken to Járnfast","Talk to Hógur","Hógur is expecting this weapon shipment in Járnfast.\
\
You should talk to Hógur.","Although many weapons were stolen by the Easterlings, Grámi Hornhelm has asked you to deliver what weapons they can spare to Járnfast."}},
[1177]={nameES="Un asalto explosivo",objectivesES={"Destruye las máquinas de asedio y derrota a los Ordâkhai.","Makóto Dôlo lanza un desafío, provocándote para que lo enfrentes en combate","Encuentra y derrota a Makóto Dôlo.","Los Ordâkhai en Ghât Lor están construyendo máquinas de asedio para hacer la guerra contra la Reina Mizâdi y el Renovado Hamât. Destruye las máquinas de asedio y derrota a cualquier Ordâkhai que se mueva contra ti.","Un asalto explosivo","Derrota a Makóto Dôlo","Encuentra y derrota a Makóto Dôlo"}},
[1178]={nameES="An Explosive Job",objectivesES={"An Explosive Job","The Orcs hide bomb caches in the area between Ashmargathâl and Târ-kútoz.\
\
Lúka has requested that you safely destroy any caches you find.","Talk to Lúka","With the sapper-bomb's alchemical formula broken, it's time to destroy the Orcs' bomb caches.","You have scoured the area and destroyed all the bomb caches you could find.\
\
You should return to Ashmargathâl and give Lúka the update."}},
[1179]={nameES="Ojo para ese tipo de cosas",objectivesES={"Ojo para ese tipo de cosas","Habla con Gangur Lejavía al oeste del pueblo de Herne","Se pueden encontrar trozos de roca roja entre los afloramientos escarpados al oeste del pueblo de Herne.","Gangur Lejavía está esperando al oeste de Herne para que le muestres los trozos de roca que has recogido.","Gangur Lejavía se ha detenido en Herne solo por poco tiempo, pero si las rocas son interesantes podría convencerse de quedarse más tiempo.","Lleva los trozos de roca roja a Gangur Lejavía al oeste de Herne","Gangur Lejavía te pidió reunirte con él al oeste del pueblo de Herne, donde deseaba estudiar algunas de las curiosas rocas rojas que se encuentran allí."}},
[1180]={nameES="An Eye for an Eye",objectivesES={"Summon and confront the Haradrim Captain of Lang Boha","Aras can be found just north of the Haradrim camp, Lang Boha.\
\
You should speak with Aras.","The Haradrim Captain steps out from the back of the room and beckons you to speak with him","The Eye of Dolgimil has been defeated","The Captain of the Haradrim camp can be found in Lang Boha.\
\
Find and confront the Haradrim Captain.","Aras sends you into Lang Boha to decimate the Corsairs forces","Herion sends you to the Haradrim camp, Lang Boha, to hinder the destructive powers of the Corsair forces.","Speak with Aras at Lang Boha","Lang Boha can be found on the eastern shores of Dor-en-Ernil.\
\
Enter Lang Boha and hinder the Corsair forces.","An Eye for an Eye"}},
[1181]={nameES="An Eye for the Foe",objectivesES={"Wilferth considers himself something of an expert on Orcs and thinks he knows something about the Orcs in the East Wall.","Bring the arrows to Wilferth for inspection","An Eye for the Foe","Orcs and Uruks can be found throughout the East Wall, and even the warriors carry quivers of arrows.\
\
Wilferth has asked you to defeat Orcs and Uruks throughout the East Wall and to collect arrows from them for him to study.","Wilferth is at the Rohirrim-camp in the East Wall.\
\
You have collected several arrows from the Orcs and Uruks in the East Wall and should bring them to Wilferth for study."}},
[1182]={nameES="Un Ojo en la Tormenta",objectivesES={"Un Ojo en la Tormenta","Habla con Techeryn y viaja a Amon Sûl para recibir su lección","Techeryn está fuera de la Posada Abandonada, en el borde occidental de las Tierras Solitarias.\
\
La Maestra Rúnica Techeryn ha accedido a revelar más misterios de las runas y está esperando para hablar contigo.","Techeryn está en la Posada Abandonada, en el borde occidental de las Tierras Solitarias.\
\
Tu experiencia en Amon Sûl con Techeryn te ha enseñado más sobre la interacción entre las runas y el mundo natural. La Elfa espera hablar contigo sobre lo sucedido.","Techeryn suele encontrarse fuera de la Posada Abandonada, en el borde occidental de las Tierras Solitarias.\
\
Se te ha indicado hablar con Techeryn, una Elfa que puede darte mayor entendimiento sobre la relación entre runas y el mundo natural.","Habla con Techeryn en La Posada Abandonada"}},
[1183]={nameES="An Eye on the Enemy",objectivesES={"Patrol the fourth point in southern Gathbúrz","Handelen is at Thangúlhad in Gathbúrz.\
\
You should return to Handelen with the report of your patrol.","An Eye on the Enemy","Talk to Handelen at Thangúlhad","The first point is east of Thangúlhad. The second point is directly to the south-east of Thangúlhad. The third point is further south-east, near the gate of Dol Guldur. The fourth point is directly south of Thangúlhad.\
\
You should scout the waypoints of the patrol that Handelen has asked you to undertake and defeat any enemies that you might find there.","Handelen has informed you of Orc-patrols which wander throughout the southern reaches of Gathbúrz.","Patrol the first point in southern Gathbúrz","Patrol the third point in southern Gathbúrz","Patrol the second point in southern Gathbúrz","You have scouted this area"}},
[1184]={nameES="An Heirloom Lost",objectivesES={"Find the hidden store-room","The travelling merchant Labóni has lost a precious family heirloom to the ruffians of Umbar.","This is an exquisite pendant!","Labóni has asked you to investigate The Eastern Stores and retrieve his family heirloom.\
\
The Eastern Stores can be found on the east side of the Lower Ward in the Cistern.","You have found the Eastern Stores. The family heirloom must be hidden within.","You found The Eastern Stores and have obtained Khatrâxi, the Raindrop. You should return to Labóni.","This entrance is heavily guarded","An Heirloom Lost","Talk to Labóni","Find Khatrâxi, the Raindrop"}},
[1185]={nameES="An Honest Trade",objectivesES={"Ilzhâna can be found at Tilmakhím on the western side of Tâkhdar.\
\
Return to Ilzhâna with news of your exploits.","Speak to Ilzhâna","An Honest Trade","Ilzhâna, a cheerful but suspicious trader of unknown wares, has asked you to thin the number of smugglers, who she insists are not business rivals.","Smugglers can be found throughout Tâkhdar.\
\
Ilzhâna has asked you to thin the number of smugglers stalking Tâkhdar and interfering in her trade. She insists it's for the safety of the cellars, not because they are business rivals."}},
[1186]={nameES="An Honourable Exchange",objectivesES={"Rhuwalhan Brehur is at his home in Upper Barnavon.\
\
Eres has asked you to speak with Rhuwalhan Brehur and convince him to release the hostages he took to force the men of the Boar-clan to work the mine.","Talk to Rhuwalhan at his home in Barnavon","Eres is in Lower Barnavon.\
\
You should return to Eres with news of Rhuwalhan's refusal and defeat.","An Honourable Exchange","The Ox-clan of Barnavon, allied with Saruman the White, holds the remnant of the Boar-clan in thralldom and oppression.","Talk to Eres in Barnavon","Defeated Rhuwalhan"}},
[1187]={nameES="Un pueblo sin honor",objectivesES={"Descubriste un collar en uno de los semiorcos en el centro de las Tierras Solitarias. Quizás puedas preguntar a alguno de los Eglain si saben quién podría ser el verdadero dueño del collar.","Un pueblo sin honor","A primera vista, esto parece una pieza de joyería sin valor, pero al inspeccionarla más detenidamente descubriste una inscripción grabada en la parte posterior del colgante. \
\
'Te amaré por siempre y para siempre.\
\
- D'\
\
Debajo de esta inscripción está tallado el símbolo de los Eglain. Quizás algún miembro de los Eglain pueda ayudarte a encontrar al dueño de este collar?","Entrega el collar a su legítimo propietario","El rostro de Daegwalt se contrae brevemente en un gesto de angustia, antes de que reprima el dolor y esboce una sonrisa.\
\
'Este es de mi esposa. Se lo di antes de que viniéramos a vivir con los Eglain. Se perdió cuando ella fue alcanzada en Naerost. \
\
'Me has dado algo que no puedo recompensar de verdad, pero te daré algo que es importante para mí en un intento de pagarte.'","Mientras perseguías a los semiorcos, descubriste un collar que lleva una inscripción y la marca de los Eglain."}},
[1188]={nameES="An Ill Wind Blows",objectivesES={"An Ill Wind Blows","Talk to Thranduil","Talk to King Thorin III","Talk to Dagrun","After carefully collecting the pile of stone blocks, a nearby dwarf calls out to you...","Piles of stone blocks can be found in Erebor, logs can be found in the halls of Felegoth, crates of rations can be found throughout Dale, and barrels of water can be found in Lake-town.\
\
King Thorin III has asked you to aid the peoples of the North in preparing for battle against Vethúg Wintermind.","Talk to Erna","King Thorin III can be found in the Hall Under the Mountain.\
\
You have mistaken King Thorin's jest for an actual task. You should return to King Thorin.","Erna can be found in Dale, Dagrun can be found in Lake-town, and Thranduil can be found in Felegoth.\
\
King Thorin III has asked you to deliver a message of warning to the other strongholds of the North and ask that they prepare their defences as best they can before Vethúg Wintermind strikes.","Collect piles of stone blocks in Erebor (0/10)\
Collect logs of wood in Eryn Lasgalen (0/10)\
Collect crates of rations in Dale (0/10)\
Collect barrels of water in Lake-town (0/10)","King Thorin III can be found in the Hall Under the Mountain.\
\
You have warned the leaders of the strongholds of the North to prepare for the coming of Vethúg Wintermind as King Thorin asked. You should return to King Thorin.","After stoking the ire of the Herald of Winter, Karazgar has fled the North. The peoples of Eryn Lasgalen, Erebor, and the Dale-lands must now prepare to face a new foe."}},
[1189]={nameES="Una imaginación muy vívida",objectivesES={"Caron tiene una imaginación vívida, y puede imaginar cómo lucía Tharbad durante su apogeo.","Para el beneficio de Caron, miras sobre la ciudad inundada desde este punto de observación","Encuentra la parte norte del Gran Puente para Caron","Habla con Caron en las riberas del río al poniente de Tharbad","Una imaginación muy vívida","Caron está al poniente de Tharbad, en las riberas del río.","Esta es la parte del Gran Puente desde la cual Caron quería que <rgb=#00FF00>miraras</rgb>","Caron te ha pedido que derrotes a los orcos, que no tienen lugar en Tharbad tal como fue una vez. También quiere que <rgb=#00FF00>mires</rgb> desde la parte norte del Gran Puente que aún permanece sobre el agua, y le digas lo que ves.","<rgb=#00FF00>Mira</rgb> sobre la ciudad inundada desde la parte norte del Gran Puente"}},
[1190]={nameES="An Impossible Dwarf",objectivesES={"Hermáth Stormhammer can be found at Watchers' Roost in Gloomingtarn.\
\
Before you could learn much from Thrástan, the old dwarf appears to suffer from some unseen ailment. You should talk to Hermáth Stormhammer.","Thrástan raises his hand to greet you, but remains silent. You ask Thrástan how he came to dwell within Mount Gundabad. After a long pause, he begins to speak, but his voice is gravelly and weak.\
\
'I... I do not remember.'\
\
You ask Thrástan if he was among the Haban’akkâ of Thráin during the Sixth War of the Dwarves and Orcs. He shakes his head solemnly, but his face betrays a pained expression.\
\
'The memories... it is as if they are not mine. Even this name... I gave it to myself. It... was so... long ago....'","<rgb=#FF00FF>Hail</rgb> Thrástan and try to get his attention","Thrástan does not appear to notice your presence.\
\
He mumbles inaudibly to himself for a moment and then falls silent.","Thrástan can be found at Watchers' Roost in Gloomingtarn.\
\
Thrástan has become distraught in his attempt to answer your questions. You should try to calm Thrástan and urge him to continue trying to remember.","<rgb=#FF00FF>Calm</rgb> Thrástan and urge him to continue","Thrástan can be found at Watchers' Roost in Gloomingtarn.\
\
Thrástan has turned to look at you. You should talk to Thrástan.","Believing that no dwarf could have entered Mount Gundabad between the Sixth War of the Dwarves and Orcs and the arrival of the Gabil'akkâ, Hermáth Stormhammer is determined to learn how Thrástan came to dwell in Gloomingtarn.","The old dwarf turns his head slowly and his gaze falls upon you","After a moment, Thrástan shakes his head uneasily","Thrástan can be found at Watchers' Roost in Gloomingtarn.\
\
After you and Hersegg discovered an old dwarf alone in the caverns of Gloomingtarn, Hermáth Stormhammer has asked you to talk to Thrástan and uncover how he came to dwell in Mount Gundabad. You should talk to Thrástan.","As he falls silent once more, Thrástan gazes toward Abkân'aban, the Stone of Wakening","Thrástan can be found at Watchers' Roost in Gloomingtarn.\
\
Thrástan seems unaware of your presence. You should hail Thrástan and attempt to get his attention.","An Impossible Dwarf","Thrástan can be found at Watchers' Roost in Gloomingtarn.\
\
Thrástan does not appear to be able to answer your questions. You should talk to Thrástan.","Talk to Thrástan","Talk to Hermáth Stormhammer"}},
[1191]={nameES="An Incident in the Camps",objectivesES={"Talk to Enkárvo","Pressing news has come to King Bard II.","An Incident in the Camps","You should speak to Enkárvo, the man of Dorwinion, in the refugee camp, across the river from Dale.","Talk to the messenger","Go with the messenger","The messenger stands before King Bard II, inside the Great-keep in Dale.\
\
You should hear the messenger's tidings.","Talk to Prince Bryn","Talk to King Bard II","You should talk to the messenger who stands before King Bard II in the Great-keep in Dale, and learn where you must go to investigate the report of violence.","King Bard II, Queen Regent Erna, and Prince Bryn stand discussing the messenger's tidings in the Great-keep in Dale.\
\
You should hear what King Bard II and his regent mother, Erna, have to say in response to Prince Bryn and the messenger.","Talk to Queen Regent Erna","King Bard II, Queen Regent Erna, and Prince Bryn stand discussing the messenger's tidings in the Great-keep in Dale.\
\
You should hear what Prince Bryn has to say in response to the messenger."}},
[1192]={nameES="Un aumento de nerbyg",objectivesES={"A Mundarico Hojarena le preocupa la cantidad de nerbyg que han empezado a aparecer por todo Barandalf y teme que las criaturas se estén preparando para formar un enjambre.","Un aumento de nerbyg","Habla con Mundarico Hojarena en Dwaling","Se pueden encontrar nerbyg de las arenas en gran número en Barandalf, a ambos lados del camino que atraviesa las dunas de arena a lo largo del lado oeste del Brandivino.\
\
Mundarico Hojarena te ha pedido que derrotes a los nerbyg de las arenas en Barandalf antes de que formen un enjambre y traigan la destrucción en cualquier dirección que tomen.","Mundarico Hojarena está en Dwaling, al sur de Barandalf.\
\
Has derrotado a muchos de los nerbyg de las arenas que se han estado reproduciendo en Barandalf y deberías regresar a Mundarico Hojarena con la noticia de tus victorias."}},
[1193]={nameES="Una infestación de cangrejos",objectivesES={"Protege al Khâlbina y a su tripulación de las amenazas en su viaje a Jax Phanâl, en el Cabo de Umbar.","Investiga la fuente de la perturbación bajo cubierta.","Una infestación de cangrejos","Investiga la fuente de la perturbación bajo cubierta"}},
[1194]={nameES="Un Desastre en la Liga de las Posadas",objectivesES={"No fue muy amable, pero Jónar estará encantado","Habla con Laurel Sacovilla en el Patio de Frerin","Laurel Sacovilla te ha visto","No abandones la zona de degustación","Se te ha acabado el tiempo","Habla con Jónar en la Mansión de Thorin","La mesa de degustación está en el Patio de Frerin, justo al sur de la Mansión de Thorin.\
\
Debes esperar a que Laurel Sackville, la reclutadora de la Liga de las Posadas, se aleje.","La degustación de la Liga de las Posadas tiene lugar en el Patio de Frerin, en el patio exterior sur de la Mansión de Thorin. Solo puedes hablar con la reclutadora cuando no está distraída por sus tareas.\
\
Deberías ir a la degustación de la Liga de las Posadas y ver qué puedes hacer para sabotearla. Jónar ha dejado claro que no quiere que se unan más enanos a la Liga de las Posadas mientras él siga respirando.","Jónar, un habitante siniestro y hosco de la Mansión de Thorin, se ha vuelto cada vez más agrio ante el éxito de la Liga de las Posadas.","Escóndete detrás de los barriles cercanos hasta que Laurel Sackville se aleje","Has salido de la zona de degustación","La mesa de degustación está en el Patio de Frerin, justo al sur de la Mansión de Thorin.\
\
Debes añadir bazofia a las muestras de degustación entre rondas. Seguro que nadie lo notará...","Observa cómo se desarrollan los acontecimientos de la degustación","No dejes que Laurel Sacovilla vea tu travesura","Queda poco tiempo: la próxima ronda de degustaciones comenzará pronto","Este es un buen lugar para esconderse hasta que la reclutadora esté distraída","Jónar espera noticias de tus actos en la posada de la Mansión de Thorin.\
\
Deberías contarle a Jónar tu cruel y maravillosa victoria contra la reclutadora de la degustación de la Liga de las Posadas.","Laurel Sacovilla está distraída","Un Desastre en la Liga de las Posadas"}},
[1195]={nameES="Una inspiración para los hombres",objectivesES={"Hazel Kenton, una capitana de gran renombre, se encuentra en la Puerta Oeste de la Ciudad de Bree, en las Tierras de Bree.\
\
Te han dicho que hables con la capitana Kenton si deseas mejorar tus habilidades.","La marca de un gran capitán es la habilidad de inspirar a otros a la grandeza, y su lealtad y amistad son las recompensas más verdaderas.","Insignia de Harper recogida","Hilton Harper está en la obra de Espinar, al noroeste de Bree.\
\
Ahora que has recuperado la insignia robada, devolvérsela a Hilton Harper podría devolverle la confianza e inspirarlo a reincorporarse a la lucha contra los bandidos que amenazan los Campos de Bree.","Aldis Portavena ha sido visto en la Vigía de los bandidos, al norte de la Granja Vieja de Dulcésped, al oeste de Bree.Hilton Harper se encuentra en el campamento de obras de Espinar, al noroeste del pueblo.\
\
La Capitana Kenton te ha pedido que recuperes la insignia de Hilton Harper de manos de Aldis Portavena, el bribón que la robó.","Una inspiración para los hombres","Recoge la insignia de Harper","La capitana Kenton se encuentra en la Puerta Oeste de Bree.\
\
Hazel Kenton querrá saber que has logrado restaurar la voluntad de Hilton Harper de defender los Campos de Bree de aquellos que amenazan la paz.","Entrega la insignia de Harper a Hilton Harper"}},
[1196]={nameES="An Inspiring Presence",objectivesES={"Gamal has been charged with keeping an eye on the Easterling tribe that has secured a foothold in the Brown Lands, and he believes they draw inspiration from some new arrival in the area.","Gamal is in the Brown Lands, south of Etheburg.\
\
You have defeated some of the Khundolar Easterlings in the Brown Lands and should return now to Gamal.","An Inspiring Presence","Easterlings can be found throughout the Brown Lands, and message-shouters can be found near their established foothold at Lashkarg.\
\
Gamal has asked you to defeat Easterlings throughout the Brown Lands, and also to defeat some of the message-shouters that use the name Khoratón."}},
[1197]={nameES="An Intersection of Insects",objectivesES={"Asbaj-khîrfin can be found in the northern reaches of Máttugard.\
\
You should talk to Varthmath at Asbaj-khîrfin.","Assist Varthmath with \\qExploring Vâr Nuchur\\q","A workbench can be found at Asbaj-khîrfin.\
\
At the workbench, you should test the samples you have acquired.","An Intersection of Insects","The adventurous Beorning, Varthmath, has accompanied the dwarves in their efforts to reclaim Gundabad.","Assist Varthmath with \\qExploring Brúvraum\\q","Varthmath can be found nearby at a workbench","Asbaj-khîrfin can be found in the northern reaches of Máttugard.\
\
You should travel to Asbaj-khîrfin.","Travel to Asbaj-khîrfin","Varthmath can be found at Maergrind, The Noble Gate of Máttugard.\
\
You should assist Varthmath with his expedition in Máttugard.","Talk to Varthmath at Asbaj-khîrfin"}},
[1198]={nameES="An Invasion is Brewing",objectivesES={"The chieftain of the Dragon-clan invaders can surely be found at the main house in the Herd-lands, looking down upon the farm from on high.\
\
You should kill the chieftain and steal the plans for the invasion of Trum Dreng by the Dragon-clan.","Bring the map of the invasion route to Blodwen","An Invasion is Brewing","Blodwen awaits you in her hiding place near the river in the Herd-lands.\
\
You should return to Blodwen with the map you found and with the dire news that Murig has escaped you.","Collect plans for the invasion of Trum Dreng","Murig has escaped, but you have collected a map of the invasion route","The looters you harassed all spoke of the likelihood of an invasion upon all of Trum Dreng. Such an invasion would end with the Stag-clan being driven out of Dunland once and for all."}},
[1199]={nameES="An Investigation",objectivesES={"Ask Cynred why his jail-keys were on the floor of Stanric's home","You see something glinting on the floor of Stanric's home","Cynred glances from side to side with a look of panic on his face.\
\
'Sithric tells me I will be committing treason if I tell of what passed. You found the hint I left behind though: Stanric is not dead. Sithric is ordering him kept below.\
\
'The guards and I were ordered to lock him away, so we did. Sithric said he would have Stanric killed if I did not help, so I complied.\
\
'I will not stop you from righting this wrong. I cannot believe I ever trusted such a man as Sithric!'","Stanric's house is near the Mead Hall in Stangard.\
\
You should investigate Stanric's house, and do your best to keep beneath the notice of the residents of Stangard using what sneaking skill you can muster.","An Investigation","According to Cynred, Stanric is down below in the lock-house.\
\
You should find Stanric at once.","A key! It might unlock doors in the lock-house","Investigate Stanric's house","Investigate the glinting item","Cynred is at the lock-house in Stangard.\
\
You should find Cynred and ask him why his jail keys are in Stanric's home.","Avoid being spotted by unfriendly eyes","The circumstances of Stanric's death are certainly suspicious, so you decide to investigate further.","Cynred indicates that Stanric is detained within the lock-house, alive","You have been spotted by one of Sithric's men! You should make yourself scarce until the alarm has died down.","Find Stanric in the lock-house","Something glints on the floor of Stanric's house in Stangard.\
\
You should investigate the glinting object more closely."}},
[1200]={nameES="Una invitación a la Feria Agrícola",objectivesES={"Habla con la Pregonera del Festival, Caltha Tunelero, en la Feria Agrícola de Delagua","Caltha Tunelero, la Pregonera del Festival, se encuentra en Delagua mientras la Feria Agrícola se celebra.\
\
Habla con Caltha Tunelero para saber más sobre la Feria Agrícola.","Una invitación a la Feria Agrícola"}},
[1201]={nameES="An Invitation to the Festival",objectivesES={"An Invitation to the Festival","Many events are featured in the Yule Festival this year. Notable places to visit include: \
\
-The Thorin's Hall Inn \
-The Horsefields Festival Grounds (Bree)\
-The Party Tree (the Shire)\
-The Duillond Festival Area\
-The new Winter Region of Frostbluff \
\
This notice is meant to direct you to the new festival area.","You have been cordially invited to the Yule Festival celebration in the Frostbluff region, in the town of Winter-home.","Talk to the new Festival Stable-master in Michel Delving","Talk to the new Festival Stable-master in Celondim","Talk to the new Festival Stable-master in West Bree","Talk to the new Festival Stable-master in Thorin's Hall"}},
[1202]={nameES="Una Invitación al Festival de la Cosecha",objectivesES={"Una Invitación al Festival de la Cosecha","Puedes encontrar a Opal Buenavista en el Árbol de la Fiesta, en Hobbiton, un apacible pueblo de la Comarca.\
\
Deberías hablar con Opal Buenavista, quien te explicará los eventos del festival de este año.","Habla con Opal Buenavista en el Árbol de la Fiesta"}},
[1203]={nameES="Una invitación al Festival de Primavera",objectivesES={"Querido amigo:\
\
Hay muchos eventos de los que disfrutar durante el Festival de Primavera. Este mensaje tiene como fin guiarte hacia los Juegos de Primavera en Duillond y en los Campos de los Caballos de Bree.\
\
Tu recompensa será una guía de los eventos del festival, junto con un distintivo para que emprendas tu camino.","Habla con Maengamiel en el jardín de Duillond","Has recibido una petición de ayuda de los elfos jardineros de Duillond.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu diario de misiones cuando termine el festival actual. </rgb>","Habla con Gil Plover en el laberinto de setos en los Campos de los Caballos de Bree","El laberinto de setos se encuentra en los Campos de los Caballos de Bree, y el evento del pisoteo de musarañas se encuentra en Duillond.\
\
Deberías visitar ambos eventos si deseas saber más sobre ellos.","Una invitación al Festival de Primavera"}},
[1204]={nameES="Una invitación al Festival de Invierno",objectivesES={"Habla con Gísli Garrotefuerte en la Mansión de Thorin","Gísli Garrotefuerte se encuentra dentro de la nueva Arena del Festival, una sala de cerveza dentro de la Mansión de Thorin.\
\
Ve a ver a Gísli Garrotefuerte para que te explique los acontecimientos del festival de este año.","Ya está aquí el Festival de Yule, has sido formalmente invitado a participar en los emocionantes eventos de este año.","Una invitación al Festival de Invierno"}},
[1205]={nameES="An Iron Belly",objectivesES={}},
[1206]={nameES="Una Iniciación Irritante",objectivesES={"Óli todavía parece no estar convencido; deberías intentarlo de nuevo.","Jónar, un habitante siniestro y hosco de la Mansión de Thorin, se ha vuelto cada vez más agrio ante el éxito de la Liga de las Posadas.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando finalice el festival actual.</rgb>","Jónar te espera en la Mansión de Thorin.\
\
Deberías regresar con Jónar para darle la alentadora noticia de que lograste forzar a los enanos de la Liga de las Posadas a abandonar sus necias aspiraciones.","Convence a Kópur, de Noglond, para que abandone la Liga de las Posadas","Grímar aún no está convencido; inténtalo una vez más","Kópur no está convencido; deberías intentarlo de nuevo","Una Iniciación Irritante","Habla con Jónar en la Mansión de Thorin","Grímar no parece convencido; inténtalo de nuevo","Óli aún no está convencido; deberías intentarlo de nuevo.","Convence a Herluf de Ojo de Aguja para que abandone la Liga de las Posadas","Óli puede encontrarse en la Mansión de Thorin, en la misma posada donde se halla el propio Jónar.\
\
Jónar te ha exigido que te acerques a los enanos de la Mansión de Thorin que se han unido a la Liga de las Posadas y los acoses hasta que abandonen esa necedad y se unan, en su lugar, a la Asociación Cervecera.","Eso pareció dar resultado","Grímar, miembro de la Liga de las Posadas, puede encontrarse en Gondamon, en pleno corazón de Ered Luin.\
\
Jónar te ha exigido que te acerques a los enanos de la Mansión de Thorin que se han unido a la Liga de las Posadas y los acoses hasta que abandonen esa necedad y se unan, en su lugar, a la Asociación Cervecera.","Herluf aún no está convencido; deberías intentarlo de nuevo","Convence a Óli, de la Mansión de Thorin, para que abandone la Liga de las Posadas","Convénce a Grímar, de Gondamon, para que abandone la Liga de las Posadas","Kópur, miembro de la Liga de las Posadas, puede encontrarse en Noglond, en Ered Luin, al sur de la Mansión de Thorin, en el Valle de Thráin.\
\
Jónar te ha exigido que te acerques a los enanos de la Mansión de Thorin que se han unido a la Liga de las Posadas y los acoses hasta que abandonen esa necedad y se unan, en su lugar, a la Asociación Cervecera.","Herluf puede encontrarse en Ojo de Aguja, una aldea hobbit con muchos habitantes enanos, situada en el extremo noroeste de la Comarca.\
\
Jónar te ha exigido que te acerques a los enanos de la Mansión de Thorin que se han unido a la Liga de las Posadas y los acoses hasta que abandonen esa necedad y se unan, en su lugar, a la Asociación Cervecera.","Eso dio resultado","Kópur aún no está convencido; inténtalo una vez más"}},
[1207]={nameES="Una isla en el lago",objectivesES={"Calenglad está en el campamento de Montaraces en la isla de Tinnudir, al oeste del camino que cruza Parth Aduial y el cruce de caminos de Canadiach.\
\
Torogethir te ha pedido que lleves noticias a Calenglad de que sus esfuerzos en los Campos de Fornost van bien, y que Calenglad debe enfocarse en combatir a los saqueadores de tumbas que plagan Evendim.","Una isla en el lago","Torogethir te ha pedido que lleves noticias de sus esfuerzos en las Quebradas del Norte a Calenglad, un líder de los Montaraces."}},
[1208]={nameES="An Issue With Spying Wings",objectivesES={"You have defeated many spying crebain.","You have defeated many spying crebain and thwarted the enemies' plans of learning your battle strategies.","An Issue With Spying Wings","Completado","Cangoras has noticed increasing numbers of spying crebain on the Western side of Osgiliath that need to be dealt with.","Crebain can be found on the Western side of Osgiliath.\
\
You should defeat crebain."}},
[1209]={nameES="Un juramento renovado",objectivesES={"Habla con Orchalwë en Tinnudir","Orchalwë está en Tinnudir, al sur de Rantost.\
\
Orchalwë quiere hablar contigo sobre lo que le depara el futuro a Evendim.","Un juramento renovado","Los Montaraces en Tinnudir querrán hablar contigo sobre Rantost, los saqueadores de tumbas y lo que viene a continuación."}},
[1210]={nameES="An Oath to a Man",objectivesES={}},
[1211]={nameES="An Obstructive Foe",objectivesES={"Orc-ambushers have frequently attacked travellers along the road west from Elthengels. Guthléod, a trader, hopes that confronting the ambushers directly might help to reduce the number of attacks along the roads.","Guthléod can be found at his tent at the trader's outpost, west of the village of Elthengels.\
\
You have defeated many of the Orc-ambushers and should inform Guthléod that his request has been fulfilled.","An Obstructive Foe","Orc-ambushers have been frequently seen south of the road leading west from Elthengels.\
\
Guthléod has asked you to assault the ambushers directly in the hopes of preventing more of their attacks on unwary travellers.","Return to Guthléod at the merchants' camp"}},
[1212]={nameES="An Offering of Blood",objectivesES={}},
[1213]={nameES="Una ofrenda de paz",objectivesES={"Con la migración de orcos y trasgos hacia las Tierras Solitarias occidentales, los Eglain intentaron reavivar sus antiguas relaciones comerciales con un elfo de Rivendel, al este. Sin embargo, se encontraron con grandes bestias torpes en el Camino y no se atrevieron a seguir adelante.","Hay jabalíes que deambulan por todas partes al este, entre Ost Guruth y el Último Puente, y huargos que deambulan por la zona cercana a Ost Guruth, a lo largo del Gran Camino del Este. Frideric reside en el bastión en ruinas de los Eglain de Ost Guruth, al norte del Gran Camino del Este, en las Tierras Solitarias.\
\
Frideric te ha pedido que le ayudes a reunir una ofrenda de paz constituida por ancas de jabalí y pieles de huargo para las extrañas criaturas que viven cerca del Último Puente, en el extremo oriental del Gran Camino del Este.","Entrega las pieles y las ancas a Frideric","Una ofrenda de paz"}},
[1214]={nameES="Una ofrenda de paz, Segunda parte",objectivesES={"Entrega las carnes saladas y las pieles al líder de las criaturas","Con la migración de orcos y trasgos hacia las Tierras Solitarias occidentales, los Eglain intentaron reavivar sus antiguas relaciones comerciales con un elfo de Rivendel, al este. Sin embargo, se encontraron con grandes bestias torpes en el Camino y no se atrevieron a seguir adelante.","El campamento de las criaturas se encuentra al sur del Gran Camino del Este, cerca de las Piedras Abatidas, al sureste de Ost Guruth.\
\
Frideric el Anciano te ha proporcionado una caja con carnes saladas y pieles para que las entregues como ofrenda de paz a las criaturas cercanas a las Piedras Abatidas.","Una ofrenda de paz, Segunda parte"}},
[1215]={nameES="An Old Family Recipe",objectivesES={"Endunâm has asked you to collect beans found along the road travelling north-east to the old salt mines. He also needs pork loins from wild boars and fresh herbs, both from Shegdush far to the east.","Bring the ingredients to Endunâm in Iridír","An Old Family Recipe","Endunâm wants to recreate a dish his grandmother used to make but does not have all the ingredients he needs.","You have collected the meat, beans, and herbs for which Endunâm asked. You should bring the ingredients to him in Iridír."}},
[1216]={nameES="An Old Hunch",objectivesES={"Thranduil can be found in Felegoth.\
\
You should speak with Thranduil about the failed trap.","Thranduil can be found in Felegoth.\
\
You should bring the spider leg to Thranduil.","The Beorning takes a deep breath.\
\
'Ah... forgive me. My wits are returning. Grant me one more calming breath and I will tell my tale as it should be told. There. Now, then.\
\
'When the Elf-king closed off his realm, I was still within it, and therefore unable to return home. By good fortune I was in the company of these poor Elves, with whom I had traded many years and knew well. They kindly offered to lead me to Felegoth, where I might bide my time. \
\
'Thither we were going when, here on the path and without warning, spiders descended all about us! Me, they ignored - but fell upon each and every Elf with a strange and silent fury. \
\
'What I tell you is true. Look into my eyes. Look at the nature of their wounds. Come, we must go to Felegoth and tell the Elves of this!'","Some spiders, at least, remain in Mirkwood, and they bear a grudge against the Elves.","An Old Hunch","Catch a spider","This looks like an ideal place for a trap","This is a good spot for the trap","Wait and watch the trap","The last place anyone saw spiders was near the caravan that was attacked.\
\
You should wait and watch the trap to see if any spiders come.","Lay a trap to catch one of Iphantemel's spawn","It is not long before you hear something approach!","The last place anyone saw spiders was near the caravan that was attacked.\
\
You should use the sap to lay a trap for the spiders.","You should collect sap from trees in Eryn Lasgalen that the Elves have already tapped for sap collection.","Bring the spider leg to Thranduil","Talk to Thranduil","The sap can be taken from corrupted Huorns throughout Eryn Lasgalen.\
\
You should collect corrupted sap for a second attempt at laying a trap.","While the spider was too vicious for capture, its leg should provide Thranduil with clues","A good place for a trap might be closer to Felegoth, near the main road that runs through Eryn Lasgalen.\
\
You should use the corrupted sap to lay a trap for the spiders.","Set up another trap to catch a spider","Thranduil can be found in Felegoth.\
\
You should talk to Thranduil about the attack on the Elves at the caravan.","The trap is set!","Perhaps there is some part of the trap which is incorrect"}},
[1217]={nameES="Un viejo tesoro",objectivesES={"Lleva el pergamino restaurado y la crónica de batalla a Culang","No has encontrado ningún tesoro, solo un viejo libro mohoso","Este fragmento de pergamino parece interesante, pero es ilegbile. Quizá en combinación con otros fragmentos, el documento original pueda ser restaurado.","Culang se encuentra en Tinnudir.\
\
No has encontrado ningún gran tesoro; parece que el viejo tesoro fue saqueado hace mucho. Pero has recuperado un viejo libro: una crónica de la Batalla de Fornost. Quizás Culang pueda tener algo de interés en él, junto con el pergamino que restauró para ti.","Has encontrado un interesante fragmento de pergamino. Por sí mismo es ilegible, pero quizá en combinación con otros fragmentos el pergamino original pueda ser restaurado.","Pergamino restaurado recibido","El viejo tesoro está enterrado bajo un hito de piedra, al noreste de Tinnudir en las ruinas de Barad Rath.\
\
Culang te ayudó a reconstruir el viejo pergamino y te dio buenasnoticias: no solo indica dónde se encuentra un viejo tesoro, sino que el tesoro puede ser recuperado honorablemente, ya que no hay registros de los dueños originales.","Tinnudir, una isla al oeste de Emyn Uial, podría ser la residencia de un maestro del saber que pueda ayudarte a restaurar el pergamino.\
\
Has encontrado todos los fragmentos del pergamino. Ahora todo lo que tienes que hacer es juntarlos.","Los bandidos y saqueadores pueden encontrarse en muchos lugares del lago Evendim.\
\
Los bandidos y saqueadores de tumbas de Evendim podrían tener los fragmentos restantes del pergamino que encontraste.","Un viejo tesoro","Recupera el tesoro del antiguo alijo","Encuentra a alguien que te ayude a restaurar el pergamino a partir de sus fragmentos"}},
[1218]={nameES="An Omen from the East",objectivesES={"Talk to Doron","Doron can be summoned to your side by using your horn.","After searching the ruins of Ost Celebrant for signs of the Easterling invader, you have discovered a passageway under the fortress. Doron believes that this is where the Easterling has sought shelter.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This instance quest is meant to be run Solo and cannot be run in a group.</rgb>","An Omen from the East","Doron has brought you to the ruins of Ost Celebrant in search of the Easterling invader.\
\
Doron believes that the Easterling lurks somewhere in the tunnels below Ost Celebrant."}},
[1219]={nameES="Un túnel ominoso",objectivesES={"Es hora de avanzar en la Moria desde la seguridad del Umbral de Durin.","Túbi Puñogrueso está en la cima de las grandes escaleras del Umbral de Durin.\
\
Debes subir las escaleras y encontrar a Túbi Puñogrueso.","Un túnel ominoso","Encuentra a Túbi Puñogrueso en la cima de las escaleras"}},
[1220]={nameES="An Opportune Ambush",objectivesES={}},
[1221]={nameES="Un hombre ordinario",objectivesES={"Investiga el Cuerno de la Hoja en busca de un hombre sospechoso","Hay informes de desapariciones recientes en Sormedân. Investiga el Cuerno de la Hoja cercano para encontrar pistas sobre el culpable.","Se desploma, pero no hay cuerpo, nada más que tela en el suelo","Cae sin vida al suelo, rodeado de sus víctimas","Persigue y derrota al hombre de aspecto ordinario en el Cuerno de la Hoja.","Escuchas su voz, riendo, más profundamente en el Cuerno de la Hoja","Alguien se acerca tranquilamente hacia ti","Derrota a este hombre de aspecto ordinario en el Cuerno de la Hoja.","Derrota al hombre de aspecto ordinario","Un hombre ordinario","Investiga el Cuerno de la Hoja para encontrar al culpable de una serie de desapariciones recientes.","Persigue y derrota al hombre de aspecto ordinario más profundamente en el Cuerno de la Hoja.","Persigue y derrota al hombre de aspecto ordinario","Derrota al hombre de aspecto ordinario de nuevo"}},
[1222]={nameES="Un Collar Ornamentado",objectivesES={"Uno de los semiorcos de Barad Morlas llevaba un collar ornamentado, deberías devolverlo a Ladenthir.","Un Collar Ornamentado","Lleva el collar a Ladenthir en Echad Eregion","Este collar está cubierto de suciedad y mugre, pero brilla con un resplandor que se filtra a través de las manchas.\
\
Después de limpiar un poco la suciedad, puedes ver que se trata de un collar élfico hecho por una mano hábil. Deberías llevarlo a Ladenthir en Echad Eregion. Él podría arrojar más luz sobre su origen.","Ladenthir está en Echad Eregion, al sur de la Alta Acebeda.\
\
Debes llevar el collar a Ladenthir para una inspección más detallada."}},
[1223]={nameES="An Outstretched Hand",objectivesES={"Saeradan is at Echad Saeradan in the Windfells of Enedwaith.\
\
You should speak with Saeradan regarding his plans for the items you collected.","Complete Warmth for the Winter","Saeradan and several other Rangers have ventured into the Windfells as advance scouts for the Grey Company to help ensure that their purpose remains secret, but also to help provision the Company.","An Outstretched Hand","Completed A Healing Hand","Complete Feathers for Friendship","The Algraig goatherds are at Gavar Cadlus, north-east of Echad Saeradan, along the foothills of the Misty Mountains.\
\
Saeradan asked you to deliver the herbs, pelts, and feathers you collected to the Algraig goatherds as a peace offering.","Deliver the peace offering to the Algraig goatherds at Gavar Cadlus","Complete A Healing Hand","Saeradan, Andreg, and Amlan are at Echad Saeradan in the Windfells of Enedwaith.\
\
Saeradan has asked you to aid the Grey Company in their many tasks. He told you that he had a task for you, and that Amlan and Andreg might as well.","Talk to Saeradan at Echad Saeradan","Completed Warmth for the Winter","Completed Feathers for Friendship"}},
[1224]={nameES="An Outstretched Hand -- Repeatable",objectivesES={"Grufudh is at Gavar Cadlus, north-east of Echad Saeradan.\
\
Saeradan has asked you to deliver more pelts, feathers, and herbs to Grufudh the goatherd.","An Outstretched Hand -- Repeatable","Talk to Saeradan at Echad Saeradan","Grufudh of the Uch-lûth has agreed to trade with the Grey Company in exchange for medicines and goods.","Saeradan is at Echad Saeradan in the Windfells of Enedwaith, south-west of Gavar Cadlus.\
\
Grufudh told you to return to Saeradan with the thanks of his people and assurance that supplies will be sent.","Bring the pelts, feathers, and herbs to Grufudh at Gavar Cadlus"}},
[1225]={nameES="An Overdue Apology",objectivesES={"Cenedel has asked you to check Amon Lontir and see whether Orthor is there.\
\
Amon Lontir is located just outside of Ost Lontir.","An Overdue Apology","Look for Orthor at Amon Lontir","Talk to Orthor","A young boy named Orthor has disappeared from Ost Lontir.","You have found Orthor at Amon Lontir.\
\
You should talk to him.","Talk to Mildir at Ost Lontir","This boy matches Cenedel's description of Orthor!","Orthor has asked you to deliver an apology note to Mildir.\
\
Mildir can be found in Ost Lontir."}},
[1226]={nameES="An Overwhelming And Irritating Din",objectivesES={}},
[1227]={nameES="An Overwhelming Order",objectivesES={"Baldthorne, the blacksmith, requires help filling the rather large orders he has undertaken for weapons and armour.","An Overwhelming Order","Return the weapons and armour-pieces to Baldthorne","Baldthorne is awaiting the reclaimed weapons and armour at his smith in Elthengels.\
\
You have reclaimed the weapons and armour pieces, once taken by the Orcs from Rohirrim.","Orcs can be found scavenging in the fields around Elthengels.\
\
Baldthorne has asked you to recover any Rohirrim weapons or armour-pieces from the Orcs, to help him supply the guards and garrison."}},
[1228]={nameES="An Overwhelming Supply of Spears",objectivesES={"Bowstaves are scattered about the worksite.\
\
Wunne has asked you to help craft spears. You should collect many bowstaves. Once you collect them, they can be used from your inventory to craft spears.","An Overwhelming Supply of Spears","Wunne can be found at the fourth worksite in Galtrev.\
\
You should bring the spears you made to Wunne so that she can deliver them to Flint Ironheart.","Bring the spears you crafted to Wunne","An absurd number of spears must be made before the day's end, but Wunne only has two hands. There is no way she can finish the task on her own."}},
[1229]={nameES="Una dieta inaceptable",objectivesES={"Habla con Nökkvi en el Refugio Sombrío","Nökkvi se horrorizó al descubrir que los Sinnombre se han estado alimentando de los cadáveres de los enanos y siente que se debe poner fin a esta profanación.","Nökkvi se encuentra en el Refugio Sombrío, en las Fundaciones de Piedra.\
\
Debes regresar a Nökkvi para contarle sobre los entierros que realizaste.","Encontraste cadáveres de enanos en un lugar llamado Mazam-dûm, en la orilla este del lago que baña las Fundaciones de Piedra.\
\
Nökkvi te ha pedido que entierres los cadáveres de enanos que encontraste.","Una dieta inaceptable"}},
[1230]={nameES="An Unbearable Road",objectivesES={"Bears are hunting in the Roaring Hills to the south of the road where Oter and Stithwulf are camped.\
\
Stithwulf asked you to hunt the bears and bring back any unblemished hides that you are able to collect.","Stithwulf is at his camp in the Stonedeans, north of the Roaring Hills.\
\
Stithwulf would like to thank you for ensuring the safety of their camp and returning with hides.","Place the bear-hides on the waggon","Return to Stithwulf","An Unbearable Road","Placed the bear-hides on the waggon","Stithwulf and Oter's camp lies to the north of the Roaring Hills.\
\
Stithwulf asked you to bring any intact hides back to his camp to help bolster supplies for the long road.","Oter and Stithwulf will soon be leaving the Stonedeans. They camp along the road in relative safety while deciding where next to go and prepare by gathering supplies before they depart."}},
[1231]={nameES="An Uncertain Fate",objectivesES={"Gárwig is in Lornsettle, the Mead Hall of Forlaw.\
\
You should speak with Gárwig.","Cyneberg ran off to ready herself for a journey to the High Knolls to search for Thrymm.\
\
You should search for Cyneberg in Forlaw.","An Uncertain Fate","Cyneberg refuses to go to Byre Tor; she wishes instead to search the High Knolls for Thrymm","Gárwig would like you to see how Byre Tor fares, for to lose another city would be devastating for Wildermore.","Cyneberg continues to swear that Thrymm is alive, and waiting for aid","Gárwig wants Cyneberg to confront her loss","Tell Cyneberg that Gárwig wishes her to search Byre Tor","Tell Gárwig of Cyneberg's denial","Try to convince Cyneberg to return to Gárwig, and accept her grief","Tell Gárwig that Cyneberg will not obey","Gárwig is in Lornsettle, the Mead Hall of Forlaw.\
\
You should return to Gárwig.","Cyneberg has come to Lornsettle, the Mead Hall of Forlaw.\
\
You should speak with Cyneberg."}},
[1232]={nameES="An Uncharitable Feast",objectivesES={"Talk to the baker of Cliving","Giselmon can be found at her estate in the western section of Cliving.\
\
You may inform Giselmon that the vendors were pleased to help her send portions of her orders to be donated to the needy.","The baker has set aside food for the refugees","The butcher has set aside food for the refugees","Talk to the cheese-maker of Cliving","The cheese-maker has set aside food for the refugees","Giselmon has purchased large quantities of food in order to host a banquet, in the hopes of increasing her popularity. Isenyd has taken exception to this cause and has demanded that the food be donated to the refugee farmers who have been victims of the Orc-attacks.","Giselmon can be found at her estate in the western section of Cliving.\
\
Isenyd has asked you to convince Giselmon that hosting a banquet in times of great turmoil would be distasteful and cause her to lose popularity.","Talk to the butcher of Cliving","Talk to Giselmon in Cliving","The vendors can be found at their individual stands in the marketplace, west of the central fountain in Cliving.\
\
Giselmon has asked you to speak with the food-vendors in Cliving, in order to divert a large portion of her purchases to help those in need.","Convince Giselmon to donate food to the refugees","An Uncharitable Feast"}},
[1233]={nameES="An Uncomfortable Noble",objectivesES={}},
[1234]={nameES="Una captura poco convencional",objectivesES={"Pesca la pequeña y empapada bota","Pesca para buscar la bota perdida en el estanque cercano.","Una captura poco convencional","Devuelve la bota a Maggo Bonce","Has atrapado la pequeña y empapada bota","Maggo Bonce sujeta una vieja muñeca raída y te llama la atención a una bota que le falta.\
\
'Perdone, pero mi amigo el Sr. Piestanque ha perdido uno de sus zapatos en la charca. ¿Podrías recuperarlo? Dice que te recompensará generosamente por tus esfuerzos.\
\
'¡Creo que la veo brillar bajo el agua!'","Maggo Bonce está cerca del estanque al sureste de Nobotella.\
\
Entrega la bota a Maggo Bonce.","Tienes la misión de capturar la más esquiva de las presas: ¿una bota de juguete?"}},
[1235]={nameES="Un entendimiento",objectivesES={"Nekhtan estaba disgustado porque te eligieran a ti para participar en el Clúcath contra los Trév Duvárdain, viéndolo como una oportunidad perdida de llevar a cabo su venganza.","Un entendimiento","Raith is at Crannog's ruling-seat, west of the centre island of Aughaire.\
\
Nekhtan has told you that he is satisfied: you have proven to be worthy of taking his place in Clúcath against the Trév Duvárdain."}},
[1236]={nameES="An Uneasy Feeling",objectivesES={"Loose stones crunch underfoot, but you do not feel anything out of the ordinary","Cerdic is at the watch-post on the road in Parth Celebrant.\
\
You have investigated the sites Cerdic told you about, and should now return to him.","Examine debris by the crumbling corner in Ost Celebrant","Cerdic went to some other of the battlefield sites you did not search, but he was overcome by a powerful feeling of uneasiness.","The crumbling corner, the grassy river-overlook, and the stone bridge can be found in Parth Celebrant.\
\
Cerdic went searching some more locations of the ancient battlefield, and experienced strange sensations at some of them. He has marked them on your map and wants you to see what is happening at these sites.","The river rushes past far beneath you, but you feel nothing out of the ordinary","You feel nothing unusual by the bridge. Your prey did not travel this way.","Examine debris by the stone bridge","Examine debris by the grassy place overlooking the fast-flowing river","An Uneasy Feeling"}},
[1237]={nameES="An Uneasy Peace",objectivesES={"Talk to Arvellon","Arvellon can be found at the southern entrance to Glaniath in Upper Lebennin.\
\
You have urged the folk to seek shelter in Tumladen and should now return to Arvellon.","An Uneasy Peace","Arvellon's folk can be found throughout Glaniath in Upper Lebennin.\
\
Arvellon has asked you to convince his people to seek refuge in Tumladen.","The people of Glaniath have remained relatively sheltered from the horrors of war, but it is unclear how long this peace will last."}},
[1238]={nameES="Un flujo desigual",objectivesES={"Habla con Simbi en la sala Vigesimoprimera","Un flujo desigual","Kaldi desea que regreses con Simbi para informarle del regreso del Guardián.","Simbi se encuentra en la sala Vigesimoprimera, al noreste de las Obras Hidráulicas.\
\
Kaldi desea que lleves noticias del regreso del Guardián a la expedición."}},
[1239]={nameES="An Unexpected Confusion",objectivesES={}},
[1240]={nameES="An Unexpected Connexion",objectivesES={"An Unexpected Connexion","Talk to the accursed warrior at Tham Durlan","Artamir can be found at Tham Durlan in south-western Dagorlad.\
\
You have had a strange encounter with a shade of Gondor and should now tell Artamir about what you have seen and heard.","Artamir can be found at Tham Durlan in Dagorlad.\
\
The accursed warrior has not spoken to you since his arrival, but offered Artamir a grim warning. You should talk with Artamir about what is to be done.","As the shade wanders Ondoher's Folly, it wails names that seem both familiar and unknown all at once.","His words still fresh in your memory, the shade floats silently before you.\
\
The shade wailed the name Artamir, and spoke as if Artamir were his brother. Without pausing to consider the absurdity of what you are about to speak, you tell the shade that a man named Artamir is among your company in the ruins to the south.\
\
A puzzled expression washes over the shade's face, and his gaze swiftly shifts to meet your own. However, before speaking a word, he vanishes.","The accursed warrior has appeared at Tham Durlan in Dagorlad.\
\
You have told Artamir of the strange connexion between him and the accursed warrior, and now the shade has appeared at his side. You should try to uncover the shade's purpose in coming to Tham Durlan.","The shade stares at you, but remains silent.\
\
After a moment, he turns to Artamir and begins to speak.","Talk to Artamir","The accursed warrior has appeared beside Artamir and stares intently at the lore-master","Talk to Artamir at Tham Durlan"}},
[1241]={nameES="An Unexpected Crop",objectivesES={"Half-orcs can be found on the crofts surrounding Garsfeld.","An Unexpected Crop","Talk to Gísil","Gísil can be found inside the mead-hall of Garsfeld.","Garsfeld has recently been harried by an invading force of Half-orcs. Gísil wishes you to drive them off and reclaim the crofts directly outside of town."}},
[1242]={nameES="An Unexpected Encounter",objectivesES={"You're unable to read the majority of the messy scratch on the note but manage to discern that the goblins hail from Súlstrok, to the west of Umbar Baharbêl. They are here in an attempt to stage a rescue of their leader, Shakfut Slit-throat, who has gone to the arena to fight as a gladiator.","You have located the camp Nashôn described, but he was mistaken. This is not a camp for children.","Investigate the goblin camp","You have discovered a camp of goblins inside Ilmabiri. While investigating the camp, you have spotted a note indicating that they have recently come from Súlstrok to attempt to rescue their leader, Shakfut Slit-throat, from the fighting pits of the arena.","Find the camp Nashôn described","You have discovered a camp of goblins inside Ilmabiri. You should look around the camp for clues explaining why they are here.","You spot a note","An Unexpected Encounter","Nashôn has asked you to investigate an area of Ilmabiri beneath the Sail-haven of Umbar Baharbêl. There have been reports that lead him to believe that there is an encampment of homeless children there and he is concerned for their welfare.","Talk to Nashôn","You have discovered a camp of goblins inside Ilmabiri. While investigating the camp, you have spotted a note.","Read the note","Travel to the western areas of Ilmabiri and locate the camp of homeless children.","This does not appear to be a camp of children"}},
[1243]={nameES="An Unexpected Request",objectivesES={"A dwarf named Grímyr has asked to speak with you privately about some urgent matter.","Attend the 'Secret Meeting'","An Unexpected Request","Grímyr would like to speak with you privately.\
\
You should speak with him to attend the 'Secret Meeting'.","You have been accused of murder!\
\
You should talk to King Thorin.","Talk to King Thorin"}},
[1244]={nameES="An Unexpected Rescue",objectivesES={"An Unexpected Rescue","Release Magla from his bonds","A captured member of the Rohirrim is in need of rescue from the Orcs.","Magla has fled back to the Rohirrim-camp at the base of the Cuthstan.\
\
Magla is awaiting your return at camp. He has something to discuss with you.","Magla has been released from captivity","Magla remains captured in the southern Wailing Hills.\
\
Magla has asked you to release him from his bonds, so that he may escape the Orcs.","Talk to Magla at the Cuthstan-camp"}},
[1245]={nameES="An Unexpected Return",objectivesES={}},
[1246]={nameES="An Unexpected Story",objectivesES={"The Ungoledain are defeated and have fled, but you are not quite out of the woods just yet.","Habla con Radagast","Threkmóth asked you to check on Vaskorn's condition.","Talk to Vaskorn","Threkmóth can be found in Skoghús, in the south of Thornholt.\
\
Vaskorn is not feeling well. You should return to Threkmóth and update him.","An Unexpected Story","Radagast can be found in the north of the Thornholt woods.\
\
With Vaskorn's condition not improving, Radagast should be notified in case there is something he can do for the Beorning.","Talk to Stráhek the Stout in Skarháld","You should return to Stráhek the Stout in Skarháld and tell him what took place in the woods.","Talk to Threkmóth"}},
[1247]={nameES="An Unexpected Summons",objectivesES={"King Thorin III can be found before his throne in the Hall Under the Mountain.\
\
You travelled to Ravenhill and witnessed the return of the raven-chief, Arcah. King Thorin pledged to honour the old ways of friendship between Durin's Folk and the ravens of the North, and in return, Arcah sent her ravens to spy upon the plots of Karazgar and Vethúg Wintermind.","King Thorin III can be found before his throne in the Hall Under the Mountain.\
\
King Thorin III has received an urgent summons from Dís, the Keeper of Ravenhill, and has asked you to accompany him to Ravenhill. You should talk to King Thorin III when you are prepared.","Talk to King Thorin III","As the North awaits the coming of Vethúg Wintermind, King Thorin III has received an urgent and unexpected summons from Ravenhill.","An Unexpected Summons"}},
[1248]={nameES="An Unfair Exchange",objectivesES={"An Unfair Exchange","Rook is atop his avanc to the west of Snowbourn in the Sutcrofts.","Rook is furious that he is stranded on the fields of Rohan with no means to travel East. He believes your war-steed would be a proper replacement for his avanc.","Search Rook's avanc","Rook may have left some of his trappings on his avanc.","Rook is looking increasingly agitated. It appears that he has finally realized that his avanc has met its end.\
\
'You... you did this! But no matter, we can make a trade!\
\
'I will take that beautiful war-steed of yours, and you can have this avanc!'","Talk to Rook"}},
[1249]={nameES="An Unfortunate Few",objectivesES={}},
[1250]={nameES="An Unfortunate Man",objectivesES={"An Unfortunate Man","Talk to Gronu at his camp","Gronu's camp is just south of the river, in a small grove of trees, north of Harndirion.\
\
Culang has asked you to seek out the wounded hunter Gronu, who may need assistance.","The lone survivor of a vicious attack has made a small camp on the northern face of the hill beneath Harndirion."}},
[1251]={nameES="An Unfulfilled Errand",objectivesES={"Read the missive","Signs of the rider may be found west of the horse's corpse in the southern Whitshaws.\
\
You should search near the smashed boulders for signs of what became of the pursued and fleeing rider.","Pick up the messenger's missive","An Unfulfilled Errand","Search the rider","The decree asking the people of Dunfast to evacuate never reached them...","You have come upon the corpse of a steed of Wildermore whose rider is not with it. You should search for the rider, for he may yet live.","This horse was not lucky enough to survive his encounter with Núrzum, but his rider is not with him. What errand could have tempted a horse and rider to brave the frozen wilds in such a dangerous time?\
\
You should search for the rider and find out what became of his errand.","You have found the rider, and he is dead -- another life taken by Núrzum","Gárwig's decree never reached Dunfast or the towns beyond.\
\
Cyneberg will wish to hear of this dire turn of events.","The missive is in your inventory.\
\
You should read the missive found on the dead rider.","Search nearby for signs of the horse's rider","Another rock was thrown, but no sign of the rider can be found here","Another boulder...and nearby, a man sprawled in the snow","Collected the missive","Núrzum surely did this, likely throwing rocks at the fleeing rider.","Cyneberg has ridden on to the village of Dunfast in the central Whitshaws.\
\
You should bring the missive to Dunfast and show it to Cyneberg, and hopefully evacuate the people there if it is not too late.","Completado","The message borne by the rider has fallen not far from his side.\
\
You should pick up the message and see if you can bear it yourself, and fulfil the errand for which this poor man died.","Signs of the rider may be found near the horse's corpse in the southern Whitshaws.\
\
You should search near the wintry landmark for any signs of whoever braved such a dangerous errand."}},
[1252]={nameES="An Unguarded Enemy",objectivesES={}},
[1253]={nameES="Un héroe sin heraldo",objectivesES={"Un héroe sin heraldo","Reginald Guardián no solo se ha separado de su comunidad, sino que también parece haber perdido a su heraldo. Ambos se separaron durante una batalla contra los Angmarim en la cornisa de hielo al borde de la bahía de Forochel, al sureste de Sûri-kylä. Reginald espera que alguien más familiarizado con las tierras de Forochel pueda ayudarlo a encontrar a su heraldo perdido.","Has encontrado al heraldo perdido de Reginald Guardián","Encuentra al heraldo perdido de Reginald Guardián","El heraldo de Reginald se perdió en algún lugar de la cornisa de hielo, al sureste de Sûri-kylä, en el extremo este de la bahía de Forochel. Reginald Guardián se encuentra en Sûri-kylä, al noroeste de la cornisa de hielo.\
\
Reginald Guardián te ha pedido que busques a su heraldo y se lo lleves de vuelta a Sûri-kylä."}},
[1254]={nameES="An Unlikely Plea",objectivesES={"Jajax wants to avenge his men, who were slaughtered by Hebil","It is Jajax alone who calls for you","Jajax has come to the gate of Calembel looking for you, and his presence has alarmed the Gondorians.","Answer the summons from the Corsair at the gate","An Unlikely Plea","The Havens of Belfalas can be found by following the road south-west from Lamedon.\
\
You should travel to the Havens of Belfalas.","Jajax is at the gate of Calembel.\
\
You should speak with Jajax.","See what Jajax wants","The site of Hebil's massacre is south-west of Calembel.\
\
You should go with Jajax to the site where Hebil slaughtered Jajax's men.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: Use the whistle to summon Jajax if you become separated.</rgb>","The site of Hebil's massacre is south-west of Calembel.\
\
You should help Jajax avenge his men against Hebil.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: Use the whistle to summon Jajax if you become separated.</rgb>","The Corsair seeking you is at the main gate of Calembel in Lamedon.\
\
You should answer the summons of the Corsair, and find out what he wants.","Completado","Meet Jajax at the site of Hebil's massacre","Hebil was merciless. Not one of Jajax's men was left alive...","Help Jajax avenge his men"}},
[1255]={nameES="An Unnatural Hunger",objectivesES={"Brifard is located at the camp-site to the south-east of Thinglad.\
\
You should return to Brifard with news of your success.","Brifard is worried that the wolves have acquired a taste for Man-flesh.","Brifard has advised you to hunt down wolves in the nearby wolf-den to the north-east. This particular wolf-den has been nicknamed 'The Murderous Pit' by the Rohirrim of Stangard.\
\
Brifard wants you to cull the wolf-pack in response to their violence.","Talk to Brifard","An Unnatural Hunger"}},
[1256]={nameES="An Unnerving Display of Confidence",objectivesES={"Cíllan is concerned by the strange threatening behaviour of the brigands","The farmer whose lands were looted can be found west of Langhold, not far from the north gate.\
\
You should speak with the farmer and hear out the story of what befell him.","Find the brigand camp","Show the letter to Cíllan","Question the farmer about the attack","Eastmund has asked for a message of grievances to be brought to Thane Utred of Langhold.\
\
You should go to Thane Utred at once and deliver the message, and warn him of the forbidding brigand presence near Langhold.","You are unnerved by the sight of so many foes near Langhold","Bring Eastmund's message to the Thane","The farmer indicated that the small band of attackers may have gone south-west","Utred reads the letter with a scowl.\
\
'Fool Eastmund! He dares offer me terms of peace if I give up Langhold and the northern Wold to his brigand scum!\
\
'I will not send my folk away, and I will rally my riders and deal with the brigands at once. They should have been thankful for exile...it was a pardon. I will not be so forgiving next time.'","The leader of the brigands in the northern Wold seems overly confident despite the recent banishment of his people.","See if Utred heeds the warning after receiving his wife's counsel","Eastmund has yielded, and asked that a message be delivered to the Thane","Eastmund's Lair is along the western edge of the northern Wold.","Cíllan stands near the Thane in the Mead Hall of Langhold.\
\
You should show Cíllan the letter.","The foes amassed near Langhold appear to be very organized.\
\
You should seek the leader of this rabble and encourage him to return with his unruly followers to exile.","Confront the leader of the brigands about the group's aggressive positioning","Utred is in the Mead Hall in Langhold.\
\
You should speak with Thane Utred now that Cíllan has said her piece.","The Thane refuses to abandon Langhold over a brigand threat","An Unnerving Display of Confidence"}},
[1257]={nameES="An Unnerving Message",objectivesES={"The anonymous note asserts Gísling is a traitor to the Sutcrofts! You must show it to Fastred immediately","Fastred can be found in the Mead Hall of Snowbourn.\
\
You have found an anonymous note that asserts Gísling is a traitor to the Sutcrofts and warns Fastred himself to not trust his Thane's son.","Gísling worries that his presence in Snowbourn is not wanted, and asks that you aid Fastred in any way you can.","Talk to Fastred","Fastred can be found in the Mead Hall of Snowbourn.\
\
Gísling bade you return to Fastred with his response.","As you approach the oven, a crumpled note catches your eye","Fastred can be found inside the Mead Hall of Snowbourn.\
\
Gísling worries that his father's actions have hurt his station within the Sutcrofts and asks that you aid Fastred further as a gesture of good will.","The note can be found on a stool next to the oven in central Snowbourn.\
\
You have not found anyone acting suspiciously, but a hastily-scrawled note near the oven catches your eye.","The oven can be found in central Snowbourn to the east of the Mead Hall.\
\
Fastred has sent you in search of information about a potential threat to Snowbourn. Fastred mentioned that your search should begin near the oven as the spy has been tampering with food.","Gísling can be found in the northern part of Snowbourn.\
\
Fastred wishes to hear Gísling's thoughts on the note you discovered.","An Unnerving Message","Search central Snowbourn for evidence of a spy","Talk to Gísling in Snowbourn","Examine the crumpled note near the oven"}},
[1258]={nameES="An Unpleasant Host",objectivesES={"Defeat the White Hand pillagers at each farmstead","An Unpleasant Host","The abandoned farmsteads can be found south of Cliving, west of the road.\
\
Each farmstead has been occupied by a single White Hand pillager, who has recruited others to help defile the lands.","White Hand Orcs have taken to occupying and desecrating the once-peaceful farmsteads of the noble crofters of Cliving.\
\
The strongest among the Orc-infantry have taken to claiming each structure as their own personal habitat.","Captain Garmund can be found at the western watch-tower, just west of Cliving.\
\
Garmund will be most appreciative of your efforts to remove the White Hand Orcs from the occupied farmhouses.","Talk to Captain Garmund outside of Cliving","White Hand Orcs have taken to occupying and desecrating the once-peaceful farmsteads of the noble crofters of Cliving."}},
[1259]={nameES="Una comida desagradable",objectivesES={"El campamento de los gigantes está en Amon Môth, al suroeste de las Agujas Altas.\
\
Lithuifin te ha pedido verter su mezcla en el guiso de los gigantes.","Vertiste la mezcla de Lithuifin en el caldero del guiso de los gigantes","Habla con Lithuifin en las Agujas Altas","Una comida desagradable","Vierte la mezcla de Lithuifin en el caldero del guiso de los gigantes","Lithuifin está en las Agujas Altas, al noreste de Amon Môth.\
\
Debes regresar con Lithuifin y hacer tu informe.","El elfo Lithuifin está preocupado por los gigantes que han estado arruinando el bosque."}},
[1260]={nameES="An Unrelenting Hunger",objectivesES={"This Orc has been webbed and devoured by the spiders of Lhingris...","After arriving in Lhingris, Legolas has discovered a number of slain Orcs and fears that Ungwetári's children have begun to overrun the Ephel Dúath.","Slain Orcs can be found on the road to Durthang, slightly to the north and west of the ruined encampment.\
\
Legolas has asked you to examine the slain Orcs along the road to Lhingris to discover if Ungwetári has set her children upon the Orcs of Mordor.","Legolas can be found at the ruined encampment along the road to Durthang in Lhingris.\
\
While spiders have slain many of the Orcs in Lhingris, it appears that some Orcs have begun to fight amongst themselves as well. You should return to Legolas.","Talk to Legolas at the ruined encampment","An Unrelenting Hunger","This Orc was slain by arrows, and a shield of Udûn rests beside him...","Examine the uneaten Orc on the road to Durthang","The uneaten Orc can be found beneath an archway on the road to Durthang, slightly to the north and west of the ruined encampment.\
\
You have examined the slain Orcs near Legolas's encampment, but you have noticed one who does not appear to have been devoured."}},
[1261]={nameES="An Unsavoury Character",objectivesES={"Baziphâr is likely still hiding in Tâkhdar below Dâr Laja.\
\
Find Baziphâr and scold him for hiding below the city.","Hanâth is waiting at The Din of Arms in the Tor-gardens, in the western side of Umbar Baharbêl.\
\
Hanâth will surely be grateful to hear her husband has returned home.","Search for Baziphâr below Dâr Laja in Tâkhdar","Baziphâr is likely still hiding in Tâkhdar, below Dâr Laja.\
\
Find Baziphâr and scold him for hiding below the city.","Baziphâr is still hiding in Tâkhdar below Dâr Laja.","Scold Baziphâr and convince him to return home","Speak with Baziphâr","You chide Baziphâr for avoiding his responsibilities","Baziphâr is likely still hiding in Tâkhdar, below Dâr Laja.\
\
Baziphâr has agreed to return home, but you have a sneaking suspicion he needs to be scolded into compliance.","Baziphâr? Baziphâr!","Speak with Hanâth","An Unsavoury Character"}},
[1262]={nameES="Una Mano Invisible",objectivesES={"Faenhilith está en Echad Eregion, al suroeste de Pembar.\
\
Debes regresar a Faenhilith con noticias de tu victoria sobre Fauldush.","Sopla el cuerno de convocatoria y derrota al líder de los semiorcos","El cuerno de convocatoria se encuentra en la entrada sur de las ruinas de Pembar, al noreste de Echad Eregion.\
\
Faenhilith te ha pedido que regreses a Pembar y uses el cuerno de convocatoria orco para desafiar al líder de los semiorcos.","Has recuperado muchas reliquias y baratijas de los semiorcos en Pembar, pero Faenhilith sigue siendo cauteloso.","Has derrotado a Fauldush","Una Mano Invisible","Habla con Faenhilith en Echad Eregion"}},
[1263]={nameES="An Unsettling Alliance",objectivesES={}},
[1264]={nameES="An Unstable Source",objectivesES={}},
[1265]={nameES="Una aguja inehebrable",objectivesES={"El Frontero Cornizuelo está en la Puerta de los Juncos, justo al noroeste de Ojo de Aguja, en la Comarca.\
\
El Frontero Cornizuelo ha reclamado la carta y la bolsa del jefe de correos Ganapié. Debes hablar con el Frontero Cornizuelo.","Habla con el jefe de correos Ganapié en Cavada Grande","Habla con el Frontero Cornizuelo en la Puerta de los Juncos","Espera a que el Frontero Cornizuelo termine su inspección","Una aguja inehebrable","El Frontero Cornizuelo se encuentra en la Puerta de los Juncos, justo al noroeste de Ojo de Aguja, en la Comarca.\
\
Mientras intentabas completar la ruta a Nobotella, te ha detenido el Frontero Cornizuelo en la Puerta de los Juncos. Debes hablar con el Frontero Cornizuelo.","Habla con el Alcalde Will Pieblanco en Cavada Grande","El Alcalde Will Pieblanco se encuentra fuera del Agujero del Agujero Municipal, en Cavada Grande.\
\
Tras saber que hay alguien proclamando ser el \\qOficial en Jefe\\q ha estado interfiriendo con el Servicio Postal Rápido, el jefe de correos Ganapié ha insistido en que hables con el Alcalde Will Pieblanco. Debes hablar con el Alcalde Will Pieablanco.","Te vio un hobbit entrometido","Con un bufido, el Frontero Cornizuelo desliza la carta en su bolsillo y toma la bolsa","Con el correo para la Comarca Allende bajo la vigilancia del jefe de correos Ganapié en Cavada Grande, te preparas para llevar a cabo una prueba de la ruta del Servicio Postal Rápido a Nobotella, según las indicaciones del jefe de correos.","El jefe de correos Ganapié se encuentra fuera del Servicio Postal Rápido en Cavada Grande.\
\
La carta del jefe de correos fue confiscadapor el Frontero Cornizuelo en represnetación del Oficial en Jefe. Debes volver con el jefe de correos Ganapié y decirle lo que ha pasado.","<rgb=#FF0000>Evita a los hobbits entrometidos</rgb>","Recoge la bolsa 'llena' de la mesa del cartero Dospiés","El Frontero Cornizuelo está en la Puerta de los Juncos, justo al noroeste de Ojo de Aguja, en la Comarca.\
\
El Frontero Cornizuelo te ha pedido inspeccionar el contenido de la bolsa que estás llevando a Nobotella. Debes esperar a que el Frontero Cornizuelo termine su inspección.","La ruta a Nobotella empieza en El Cruce, continúa hacia Ojo de Aguja y pasa a través de la Puerta de los Juncos a la Comarca Allende.\
\
Has preparado una bolsa que contiene la carta del jefe de correos Ganapié para ser llevada en la ruta del Servicio Postal Rápido a Nobotella. Debes recoger la bolsa 'llena' de la mesa del cartero Dospiés y llevarla por la ruta a Nobotella por el camino de la Puerta de los Juncos."}},
[1266]={nameES="An Unusual Migration",objectivesES={"The stranger is located in western Sutcrofts along the shore by the Entwade.","You have discovered a peculiar man who appears to be riding an avanc. You should speak with him.","An Unusual Migration","Talk to the stranger","A strange man sits atop an avanc in the distance - you should speak to him, for surely he is an interesting fellow.","You have come across a most peculiar sight - a strange man appears to be riding an avanc eastward."}},
[1267]={nameES="An Unwarm Welcome",objectivesES={}},
[1268]={nameES="Un olor malsano",objectivesES={"El hongo emana un olor penetrante y nauseabundo","Has descubierto tres grupos de hongos en la Segunda Sala de Nud-melek. Lamentablemente, se ha extendido una plaga en Moria; ni siquiera los hermosos árboles de piedra están a salvo ahora.\
\
Te preguntas qué ha despertado las esporas y las ha hecho subir incluso a estos pasillos secos...","Svanr ha detectado un olor extraño durante su meditación ante los Árboles de Piedra de la Segunda Sala.","El olor es abrumador aquí","Un olor malsano","El olor se desprende del borde sur del patio en Nud-melek.\
\
Debes examinar la tercera fuente del olor.","El olor se desprende del borde sur del patio en Nud-melek.\
\
Debes examinar la segunda fuente del olor.","Encuentra la segunda fuente del olor","El olor parece venir de la zona sur del gran patio arbolado de Nud-melek.\
\
Svanr quiere que investigues el olor que ocasionalmente aparece para perturbar su homenaje silencioso.","Has descubierto tres grupos de hongos en la Segunda Sala de Nud-melek.","Completado","Encuentra la primera fuente del olor","Encuentra la tercera fuente del olor"}},
[1269]={nameES="An Uphill Battle",objectivesES={"An Uphill Battle","The Orc-roadway continues to the north and west.\
\
Having discovered a few Orc-stragglers, but no larger force, you should continue following the road deeper into the Balewood.","Signs of a battle litter the road here with a slain Huorn looming over its kills","You have discovered a few stragglers burning wood-trolls, but a larger force is absent","The Orc-roadway continues to the west.\
\
You have discovered the grim remains of a fight between the denizens of the Balewood and the White Hand. You should continue up the path to the west.","Talk to Barallas outside Drû Vádokan","You have come across the White Hand's holdings in the Balewood... a grim camp of Orcs built atop Brúndoron's shattered roots","Barallas believes the Orcs are losing their foothold in Balewood and wants you to scout along the Orc-roadway to the north-west.","Search the Orc-roadway for signs of the White Hand","The Orc-roadway can be found to the west of Barallas and the other Ents.\
\
Barallas has asked that you return to the Orc-roadway and see if the White Hand still holds firm control of the path.","The Orc-roadway through the Balewood continues up the hill to the west.\
\
The roadway is strangely clear here, but you should investigate the gruff voices you hear further up the hill.","Follow the Orc-roadway to the north-west","Follow the Orc-roadway further into north-west Balewood","The roadway is largely empty here, but you can hear raucous Orcs further up the hill","Follow the Orc-roadway further up the hill","Barallas can be found to the south of Drû Vádokan.\
\
Barallas and the other Ents will be curious to learn what you have discovered along the roadway. Barallas has travelled to meet you near the White Hand camp."}},
[1270]={nameES="El reinado de la anarquía",objectivesES={"Las tribus orcas están movidas y motivadas por fuertes líderes. La tribu de la Mano Blanca es dirigida por un fuerte estratega militar, mientras que la tribu de Moria es liderada por un capataz centrado en extrar hasta el último trozo de mineral de las Vetas del Cuerno Rojo.","Los líderes de los orcos se encuentran en algún lugar de los campamentos de su respectiva tribu.","Derrota al capataz de Moria","Encuentra el campamento de Knakk","Capataz de Moria derrotado","Knakk se encuentra en la plataforma elevada justo al norte del campamento de los orcos de la Mano Blanca, en el camino hacia la Gran Escalera.\
\
Se ha mantenido oculto de los orcos hasta ahora, pero sus exploradores han estado a punto de encontrarle en alguna ocasión. Estará feliz de saber que van a estar menos organizados durante un tiempo gracias a ti.","Derrota al estratega de la Mano Blanca","El reinado de la anarquía","Estratega de la Mano Blanca derrotado"}},
[1271]={nameES="Tumularios ancestrales",objectivesES={"Tumularios ancestrales","Los tumularios ancestrales se pueden encontrar en el Laberinto del Gran Túmulo.","Se han alzado muertos ancestrales en el Gran Túmulo."}},
[1272]={nameES="Ancient Equipment",objectivesES={}},
[1273]={nameES="Llamas antiguas",objectivesES={"Los viejos cadáveres se pueden encontrar por todo el Laberinto del Gran Túmulo.","Llamas antiguas","Los viejos cadáveres dentro del Laberinto del Gran Túmulo deben arder en llamas, no sea que vuelvan a levantarse."}},
[1274]={nameES="Llamas antiguas",objectivesES={"Los muertos ancestrales se han alzado en el Gran Túmulo.","Los braseros antiguos se pueden encontrar en el ala inundada del Gran Túmulo.\
\
Debes encender los braseros antiguos del Gran Túmulo.","Llamas antiguas"}},
[1275]={nameES="Antiguos Enemigos del Matarañas",objectivesES={"tli Matarañas está en la aldea de Archet, en las Tierras de Bree, muy al oeste de las Montañas Nubladas.\
\
Sigrun y Greip han descubierto que una plaga maligna de arañas ha echado raíces en las cavernas bajo Helegrod, y su reina es conocida por Atli Matarañas.","Antiguos Enemigos del Matarañas","Los exploradores de Glóin han descubierto que una prole venenosa de arañas y su vil reina se ocultan ahora bajo Helegrod."}},
[1276]={nameES="Guarida antigua",objectivesES={"Guarida antigua","Encontraste a Bethad en la cueva de Gorthorog","Busca a Bethad en la cueva de Gorthorog","La cueva de Gorthorog está en Malenhad, al este de Aughaire.\
\
Fonn te ha pedido que explores una cueva en Malenhad a la que se ha visto viajar a Gertheryg.","Bethad está en la cueva de Gorthorog en Malenhad, al este de Aughaire.\
\
A petición de Fonn, buscaste a Bethad en la cueva de Gorthorog. Lo has encontrado, pero parece herido.","Fonn ha sabido que se ha visto a Gertheryg viajando a una cueva en Malenhad. Ha enviado a un explorador para investigar, pero no ha regresado."}},
[1277]={nameES="Guarida antigua",objectivesES={"Guarida antigua","Fonn te ha pedido que explores las cuevas de Ologfil en Malenhad, al norte de Tyrn Lhuig, para conocer el destino de Bethad, que estaba investigando la presencia de gorthorogs.","Habla con Fonn en Tyrn Lhuig y cuéntale sobre el rescate de Bethad.","Habla con Fonn en Tyrn Lhuig","Encuentra a Bethad en Ologfil","Fonn ha aprendido que se han visto Gertheryg viajando hacia la caverna de Ologfil en Malenhad. Ha enviado a un explorador para investigar, pero el explorador no ha regresado."}},
[1278]={nameES="El antiguo registro",objectivesES={"Encuentras una página hecha jirones enterrada entre los escombros","El faro está en el extremo norte del Barandalf, al sureste del Coloso.\
\
Gaelnarthan te ha pedido que te aventures a las ruinas de un antiguo faro y encuentres cualquier resto de los registros que se guardaban allí.","El faro utilizado solía vigilar los barcos en la parte norte del Baranduin. El guardián tenía la tarea de mantener registros detallados de los naufragios y tragedias.","El antiguo registro","Gaelnarthan está en el Coloso, al noroeste de las ruinas del faro.\
\
Gaelnarthan estará ansioso por examinar la página que has encontrado.","Los escombros de aquí no contienen nada de valor","Busca entre los escombros del antiguo faro","Lleva lo que has encontrado a Gaelnarthan"}},
[1279]={nameES="Registros antiguos",objectivesES={"Las Ruinas Salvajes se encuentran al sur de Ost Galadh.\
\
Agorin te ha pedido que examines y recopiles los registros de los elfos silvanos de Ost Galadh que se encuentran en las Ruinas Salvajes.","Habla con Agorin en Ost Galadh","Agorin, la guardiana de los registros de los Malledhrim, te ha pedido que te adentres en las Ruinas Salvajes y recopiles información sobre los antiguos registros silvanos que se encuentran dispersos por las ruinas.","Agorin se encuentra en Ost Galadh, al norte de las Ruinas Salvajes.\
\
Vuelve a ver a Agorin y cuéntale lo que has descubierto sobre los registros de los elfos silvanos que alguna vez habitaron este lugar.","Registros antiguos"}},
[1280]={nameES="Rituales antiguos",objectivesES={"Lanza plumas en Reodh Fuil","Coloca el pescado cerca de la bahía","Has colocado el pescado en la piedra del ritual","Jalmari está en Sûri-kylä, en el extremo norte de la Bahía de Hielo de Forochel.\
\
Deberías volver a ver a Jalmari y contarle que has hecho lo que te pidió.","La piedra ritual está al sur, siguiendo la Bahía de Hielo, en las tierras ocupadas por los Angmarim. Reodh Fuil está al sureste de Sûri-kylä.\
\
Jalmari te ha pedido que lances plumas al viento en Reodh Fuil y coloques el pescado cerca de la Bahía de Hielo en la piedra ritual que no ha sido en las tierras ahora invadidas por los Angmarim.","Rituales antiguos","Coloca el pescado en la piedra del ritual","Los Lossoth tienen muchos antiguos ritos y rituales para apaciguar a los espíritus del cielo y el agua.","Habla con Jalmari","Plumas lanzadas al viento"}},
[1281]={nameES="Estatuas antiguas",objectivesES={"Robin Sotopardo está en Ost Forod, al este de Rantost en Tyrn Fornech, en Evendim.\
\
Has recuperado muchas piezas de estatua, y ahora debes llevarlas de vuelta a Robin Sotopardo para ver si pertenecen a la estatua que busca reparar.","Estatuas antiguas","Los saqueadores de Tyrn Fornech podrían llevar trozos pequeños de estatuas, mientras que trozos más grandes se encontrarían en su campamento de Rantost, la isla al oeste de Ost Forod.\
\
Robin Sotopardo ha sido inspirado por la estatua rota que recuperaste, con el sueño de restaurar la estatua completa y quiere que recuperes sus fragmentos.","Robin Sotopardo, animado por tu recuperación de la estatua rota que portaban los malogrados saqueadores que tuvo un encontronazo con unos osos en Nan Orngon, te ha encargado que recupes más de sus fragmentos.","Lleva los trozos de la estatua a Robin Sotopardo"}},
[1282]={nameES="Ancient Wards",objectivesES={"Ghân-buri-Ghân can be found in Drû Bhûta.\
\
You should speak with Ghân-buri-Ghân.","It seems that Ghâr-buri-Bhâm has finished working with the Púkel-men statue fragments you gave him","Ward pieces can be found near Púkel-men statues in the Drúadan Forest.\
\
You should collect ward pieces for the Woses.","You hand the fragments to Ghâr-buri-Bhâm. His expression remains serious and he begins to tinker away with bits of stone.","Ghâr-buri-Bhâm is in Drû Bhûta.\
\
You should bring the ward pieces to Ghâr-buri-Bhâm so that he can craft a new ward for the village.","Ghâr-buri-Bhâm is in Drû Bhûta.\
\
You should wait for Ghâr-buri-Bhâm to craft the ward.","Speak with Ghâr-buri-Bhâm","Speak with Ghân-buri-Ghân","Bring the ward pieces to Ghâr-buri-Bhâm","Ancient Wards","Ghâr-buri-Bhâm is in Drû Bhûta.\
\
You should speak with Ghâr-buri-Bhâm about the ward.","Ghân-buri-Ghân, chieftain of the Drúedain, asks of you to help collect ward fragments from Púkel-men statues so that the Woses may protect themselves from this new threat.","Wait for Ghâr-buri-Bhâm to craft the ward","The Wose looks up and hands you a mysterious object of intricate stonework. You are not sure how anyone could create something so detailed out of stone so quickly."}},
[1283]={nameES="And Is Extinguished",objectivesES={}},
[1284]={nameES="And Moored Beside",objectivesES={}},
[1285]={nameES="¡Y no vuelvas!",objectivesES={"Las reservas de comida de los trasgos se encuentran probablemente en Gazatmur, en el este de la Gran Excavación.\
\
Debes destruir las reservas de comida de Gazatmur para desmantelar este campamento que sirve como fortaleza establecida para el enemigo.","Wigfast está en su escondite justo más allá de Gazatmur en la Gran Excavación.\
\
Debes regresar con Wigfast.","Las reservas de comida de los trasgos se encuentran en Gazatmur y les proporcionan sustento durante largos períodos.","Regresa con Wigfast"}},
[1286]={nameES="Anduin Patrol",objectivesES={"Talk to Farasdúr near the Vineyards of Lothlórien","Farasdúr is near the Vineyards of Lórien, south of the Anduin.\
\
You should return to Farasdúr and tell him the results of your patrol.","The banks here are clear of enemies","The river Anduin flows north of Egladil, deep and wide, providing protection against assaults from the East.","Patrol the banks of the Anduin (2/4)","Anduin Patrol","Patrol the banks of the Anduin (3/4)","The river Anduin runs northwards from the Vineyards of Lórien.\
\
Farasdúr has asked you to patrol the banks of the Anduin and ensure that no enemy forces have gained a purchase on the west side of the river.","Patrol the banks of the Anduin (0/4)","Patrol the banks of the Anduin (1/4)"}},
[1287]={nameES="Anduin's Bounty",objectivesES={"Germund can be found in Hultvís.\
\
You have gathered a number of fish and should now deliver them to Germund.","Nets can be found along the eastern shores of the Anduin in Woodsedge.\
\
Germund has asked you to gather fish from nets along the Anduin.","The Woodmen of Hultvís often gather fish from the waters of the Great River, Anduin.","Deliver the fish to Germund in Hultvís","Anduin's Bounty"}},
[1288]={nameES="Angathrai: Fell Summoners",objectivesES={}},
[1289]={nameES="Angathrai: The Cursed Ravine",objectivesES={}},
[1290]={nameES="Anglach: Four to Open",objectivesES={"Collected crude marked stone","Search for more such stones and try to determine their purpose within Anglach in Udûn.","Defeated Gúrflak the ancient fire grim.","The door you opened held a great fire grim within it!","You have found a small stone, carved to a specific shape and with strange, grotesque symbols etched upon it.","This door has four broad divots, almost like key-holes, on its surface","Try to determine the strange stones' purpose within Anglach in Udûn.","The strange stones you found look as if they will fit in the divots in this door","The door lifts, a blast of hot air issuing from beyond it","Anglach: Four to Open","Find a use for the strange stones","Locked by old magic behind a great door in the very roots of Anglach was the fire grim Gúrflak, whose ages-old pent up fury roils there no longer.","Defeat Gúrflak the fire grim","Defeated Gúrflak","Completado","You have found a small stone, carved to a specific shape and with strange, grotesque symbols etched upon it. Are there others? And what is their purpose?"}},
[1291]={nameES="Anglach: Fragments of the Past",objectivesES={}},
[1292]={nameES="Anglach: Hammers Raised",objectivesES={}},
[1293]={nameES="Anglach: The Great Foundry",objectivesES={"Ongdrágh, Master of the Mines can be found deep within Anglach.\
\
You should defeat Ongdrágh, Master of the Mines.","Candúr can be found at the Udûn Foothold.\
\
You should return to Candúr and apprise him of your efforts.","Many foes await those who dare enter Anglach, the Great Foundry.","Defeat Ongdrágh, Master of the Mines","Talk to Candúr","Defeated Ongdrágh, Master of the Mines","Anglach: The Great Foundry"}},
