[1409]={nameES="Ashâmi's Challenge",objectivesES={"Ashâmi completed her task at Tir Katar. Return to her home in Urmâkh and discuss her next steps.","Ashâmi greeted you when you arrived outside of the serval den near Urmâkh. She waits for you to say you are ready to assist in hunting the diseased serval, Kanagir.","Ashâmi was attacked by a serval and gravely wounded in her youth. She asks for your help against the diseased serval she is tasked to kill to prove herself to Numûru. The serval camp is east of Urmâkh.","Meet with Ashâmi near the serval den east of Urmâkh","Ashâmi is tasked with going to the a serval den to kill a diseased serval there. She asks you to meet her there to assist her.","Ashâmi's Challenge","Complete Instance: Ashâmi's Challenge","Ashâmi's resolve is apparent.\
\
'I was ten when the serval attacked me. My father put the beast down immediately. My wounds became infected. I nearly died. My father wanted the wounds to heal on their own.\
\
'My mother took me to Lathagwid. It was only with her care I survived.\
\
'My fear of these cats is great. I think I shall need a bit of Raphûz's confidence. Maybe your help.\
\
'The serval's den is east of here, in central Imhûlar. Will you meet me there?'","Ashâmi signaled to you when you arrived at the den"}},
[1410]={nameES="Askâd-mazal, the Chamber of Shadows -- Solo",objectivesES={"Recoge el cuerno de invocación","Long ago, Durin the Deathless sealed away an evil being known as the Shadowed King. Driven by intense jealousy, he wears the face of the Father of the Longbeards and builds a kingdom deep beneath the earth; a twisted reflection of the dwarf hall above, a mockery of the grandness of Khazad-dûm. He must be defeated, or his demented visions may become reality.","Defeat the Shadowed King.","Talk to Frethi","Defeated the Shadowed King","Frethi is standing by inside Askâd-mazal.\
\
You should talk to Frethi","Use the Summoning Horn to call Frethi to your side.","Defeat the Shadowed King","Use the Summoning Horn to call Frethi","Askâd-mazal, the Chamber of Shadows -- Solo"}},
[1411]={nameES="Askâd-mazal, the Chamber of Shadows -- Tier 1",objectivesES={}},
[1412]={nameES="Askâd-mazal, the Chamber of Shadows -- Tier 2",objectivesES={}},
[1413]={nameES="Askâd-mazal, the Chamber of Shadows -- Tier 3+",objectivesES={}},
[1414]={nameES="Assault on Atrad-zarakh",objectivesES={"Raise a banner of the Haban'akkâ of Thráin at Atrad-zarakh","The Haban'akkâ of Thráin will be victorious!","Orcs, goblins, bats, and sapper-bomb crates can be found at Atrad-zarakh.\
\
King Thráin has commanded you to join in the assault at Atrad-zarakh. You should aid the Haban'akkâ of Thráin.","Upon the slopes of Bundushâthur at Atrad-zarakh, Orcs and goblins prepare sapper-bombs and tend the great-bats of Moria that they might overcome the Haban'akkâ of Thráin at Azanulbizar.","Assault on Atrad-zarakh","You have done much to hinder the Orcs and their vile allies at Atrad-zarakh.\
\
You should raise a banner of the Haban'akkâ of Thráin at Atrad-zarakh."}},
[1415]={nameES="Asalto a Audaghaim -- Diario",objectivesES={}},
[1416]={nameES="Assault on Bardh-dorám",objectivesES={}},
[1417]={nameES="Asalto a Dhúrstrok",objectivesES={"Asalto a Dhúrstrok","Completed 'Assault on Dhúrstrok'","Dhúrstrok is located in the catwalks north-east of Aslíf. The catwalks can be reached through the lift.\
\
Múta will meet you inside Dhúrstrok.","Complete 'Assault on Dhúrstrok' on any difficulty.\
\
Use the Instance Finder to enter Assault on Dhúrstrok.","Náin's fate is in your hands.","Talk to Múta","Shúkurz has returned with a wealth of information.\
\
You should talk to Múta and formulate a plan.","Complete 'Assault on Dhúrstrok' on any difficulty","You have rescued Náin and brought him back safely to Aslíf.\
\
You should talk to him.","Talk to Náin in Aslíf","Find Dhúrstrok"}},
[1418]={nameES="Assault on Dhúrstrok -- Solo",objectivesES={"Recoge el cuerno de invocación","Talk to Múta","Approach Náin","Defeated Mozrúk the Wind-rider","Náin is trapped behind a locked gate.\
\
Gorgar's generals, Gâdh-and-Shum and Mozrúk the Wind-rider, hold the keys.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>If you need assistance, use the Call Múta skill to call Múta to your side. If you lose access to this skill, pick up the summoning horn at the instance entrance.</rgb>","Use the summoning horn to call Múta","You have obtained the keys needed to free Náin.\
\
You should return to the gate to unlock and open it.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>If you need assistance, use the Call Múta skill to call Múta to your side. If you lose access to this skill, pick up the summoning horn at the instance entrance.</rgb>","Assault on Dhúrstrok -- Solo","You have unlocked and opened the gate to Náin's prison.\
\
You should approach him to make sure he has not suffered grave injuries.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>If you need assistance, use the Call Múta skill to call Múta to your side. If you lose access to this skill, pick up the summoning horn at the instance entrance.</rgb>","Defeat Gâdh-and-Shum","Abre la puerta","Múta has something to say.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>If you need assistance, use the Call Múta skill to call Múta to your side. If you lose access to this skill, pick up the summoning horn at the instance entrance.</rgb>","You should find Náin's location.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>If you need assistance, use the Call Múta skill to call Múta to your side. If you lose access to this skill, pick up the summoning horn at the instance entrance.</rgb>","Defeat Mozrúk the Wind-rider","Find Náin","You have found Dhúrstrok, Gorgar's stronghold.\
\
You should pick up the summoning horn to call Múta to your side.","High among the catwalks of Deepscrave lies Dhúrstrok, the stronghold of Gorgar the Ruthless. Somewhere within these aging halls filled with dwarf-relics, Gorgar's loyal generals have imprisoned Lord Náin. It is up to you to free him.","Defeated Gâdh-and-Shum"}},
[1419]={nameES="Assault on Dhúrstrok -- Tier 1",objectivesES={"You have found Dhúrstrok, Gorgar's stronghold.\
\
You should find Náin's location.","Defeat Mozrúk the Wind-rider","You have unlocked and opened the gate to Náin's prison.\
