You should return to the gate to unlock and open it.","Abre la puerta","Defeat Gâdh-and-Shum","Assault on Dhúrstrok -- Tier 1","Approach Náin","Defeated Gâdh-and-Shum","Defeated Mozrúk the Wind-rider"}},
