[1422]={nameES="Assault on Goblin-town",objectivesES={"Assault on Goblin-town","Goblins can be found in great numbers in the halls of Goblin-town in the Misty Mountains, far to the south and east of the North Downs.\
\
Handarod has asked you to defeat goblins in the depths of Goblin-town.","Talk to Handarod","Handarod is at Esteldín in the North Downs, far to the west and north of the Misty Mountains.\
\
You should return to Handarod and tell him of your attack on Goblin-town.","Handarod is concerned with rumours that the Great-goblin is preparing an assault upon the lands on either side of the Misty Mountains in an attempt to enlarge his realm during this time of chaos and war."}},
[1423]={nameES="Assault on Kala-gijak",objectivesES={"Assault on Kala-gijak","Go to Kala-gijak","Parsâ-dhug-Bhêr can be found in the village Bhol Rûdh.\
\
You should talk to Parsâ-dhug-Bhêr.","Faeron and the Red Sky Clan warriors are outside Kala-gijak, preparing to attack.\
\
You should meet up with Faeron.","Talk to Faeron","Complete: Take Out the Look-outs","Brogmaush can be found in the upper barracks of Kala-gijak.\
\
You should defeat Brogmaush with the aid of Faeron and Ghai-buri-Sêk.","Defeat Brogmaush","Complete: Disarming the Uruks","Talk to Parsâ-dhug-Bhêr","Faeron and the Drúedain have returned to the village of Bhol Rûdh.\
\
You should talk to Faeron.","Kala-gijak can be found in eastern Agarnaith.\
\
You should complete missions for Faeron in Kala-gijak.","Defeated Brogmaush","Kala-gijak can be found in eastern Agarnaith.\
\
You should go to Kala-gijak.","Faeron and the Red Sky Clan warriors are outside Kala-gijak, preparing to attack.\
\
You should talk to Faeron.","Arrived at Kala-gijak","The Drúedain of the Red Sky Clan are prepared for battle. Meet Faeron and Ghai-buri-Sêk outside Kala-gijak to begin the assault.","Complete: A Foul Brew","Faeron and the Drúedain charge into Kala-gijak!"}},
[1424]={nameES="Asalto a Khetsok",objectivesES={"Asalto a Khetsok","Girhâzi ha decidido que es hora de pasar a la ofensiva y ha ordenado un asalto al campamento Ordâkhai de Khetsok.","Obstaculiza los esfuerzos de los Ordâkhai en Ambarûl derrotando a los soldados y destruyendo sus provisiones en Khetsok."}},
[1425]={nameES="Assault on Tol Ascarnen",objectivesES={"Assault on Tol Ascarnen","Tokens of valour are bestowed at Glân Vraig. First Marshal Án is at the camp south of Tol Ascarnen.\
\
First Marshal Án wants to take the Tol Ascarnen back from the Enemy. He will not begin the assault until he knows that there are others who will stand with him. He told you to prove your worth by bringing him tokens of valour.","The host of Angmar swept into the central keep of the Ettenmoors and drove Captain-General Makan from Tol Ascarnen. This affront is more than an honourable dwarf can stand, and First Marshal Án will stop at nothing to take it back, though he wants assurances that the force he leads will stand beside him.","Deliver the tokens of valour to First Marshal Án at the camp south of Tol Ascarnen"}},
[1426]={nameES="Assault on the East Tower",objectivesES={"All levels of the east tower are being assaulted by Saruman's army. The Rohirrim labourers will attempt to erect barricades to slow the enemy, Legolas will defend the catapult at the summit, and the remaining siege equipment within the tower will be vulnerable to direct attacks from the waves of enemies upon the wall.\
\
Merit Rating\
\
This quest starts with <rgb=#FFFF00>Partial</rgb> Merit Rating.\
\
<rgb=#00FF00>Major Merit Gain:</rgb>\
* Labourer constructs a barricade\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Moderate Merit Loss:</rgb>\
* Munitions cache destroyed\
* Rohirrim Guard defeated\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Major Merit Loss:</rgb>\
* Rohirrim Labourer defeated\
* Constructed barricade becomes destroyed","Legolas is in need of aid in defending against a concentrated attack against the east tower. The Rohirrim labourers require protection as they construct their defensive barricades. The defenders will need your aid if they are to hold back the Orc assault.","Assault on the East Tower"}},
[1427]={nameES="Asalto a la guarida de los Espectros del Anillo",objectivesES={"<rgb=#00FF00>Has repelido el asalto del Enemigo en el Patio Interior. Ahora es el momento de reclamar el Antro de los Espectros del Anillo</rgb>","Las fuerzas de Dol Guldur no cederán su fortaleza tan fácilmente. Mantente firme y defiende lo que has reclamado de su ira.","Defiende el Patio Exterior contra el asalto","El Patio Exterior ahora pertenece firmemente a la Hueste Dorada. Es hora de avanzar más profundo y derrotar a los que protegen el Patio Interior.","<rgb=#00FF00>Has reclamado el Antro de los Espectros del Anillo. El corazón de Dol Guldur está ahora expuesto</rgb>","<rgb=#00FF00>Has repelido el asalto del Enemigo en el Patio Exterior. Ahora es el momento de reclamar el Patio Interior</rgb>","Toma el Patio Interior","Has reclamado el Patio Interior, pero los maestros de Dol Guldur no lo cederán fácilmente. Defiéndelo para poder asaltar la Torre.","El guardián del Patio Interior ha descendido de la torre. Derrota a él y reclama los patios y el exterior de Dol Guldur para la Hueste Dorada.","Asalto a la guarida de los Espectros del Anillo","Defiende el Patio Interior contra el asalto","Tomar los muros que rodean Dol Guldur dejará las defensas interiores debilitadas y vulnerables","El Patio Exterior protege la entrada a las mazmorras de Dol Guldur, pero lo más importante, las puertas del Patio Interior y el corazón de la fortaleza. Todos los que se encuentren en estas zonas deben ser eliminados para reclamar este lugar.","<rgb=#FF0000>El Enemigo está lanzando un asalto para recuperar el Patio Interior</rgb>","Toma el Patio Exterior","<rgb=#FF0000>El Enemigo está lanzando un asalto para recuperar el Patio Exterior</rgb>","Toma el Antro de los Espectros del Anillo"}},
[1428]={nameES="Asalto a la Guarida de los Espectros del Anillo: Incursión",objectivesES={"Tomar los muros que rodean Dol Guldur dejará las defensas interiores debilitadas y vulnerables","Asalto a la Guarida de los Espectros del Anillo: Incursión","Completa 'Asalto a la Guarida de los Espectros del Anillo con un grupo de incursión"}},
[1429]={nameES="Assault on Ânghum-maudhûl",objectivesES={"Talk to Harchador at Mithechad","Word has spread that the Orcs in Ânghum-maudhûl are preparing for a viscious counter-attack against Mithechad and the Malledhrim.","Assault on Ânghum-maudhûl","Ânghum-maudhûl lies to the south-east of Mithechad.\
\
Harchador has asked you to defeat the Orcs of Ânghum-maudhûl before they can muster their full strength.","Harchador is at Mithechad, north-west of Ânghum-maudhûl.\
\
You should speak with Harchador and let him know that you were victorious."}},
[1430]={nameES="Assemble the Amulet",objectivesES={"Assemble the Amulet","Several older cairn stones are scattered among the barrows in the Lich Bluffs. Perhaps the ancient writing may provide a clue to the past of the amulet that you recovered.","Talk to Lhudd at the Hall of Sanctuary","The ancient cairn-stones are located south of the Hall of Sanctuary, among the rolling hills and barrows.\
\
Lhudd has asked you to seek out ancient cairn-stones and place the amulet upon them. He believes that this may somehow help to mend the amulet.","Lhudd is at the Hall of Sanctuary in the Lich Bluffs.\
\
You should return to Lhudd with news of your discoveries."}},
[1431]={nameES="Assembling the Warriors",objectivesES={"Sacks and barrels of armour can be found throughout Underharrow in southern Kingstead.\
\
Ellen Fremedon has asked that you gather materials to aid in the defence of Underharrow. You should search for them in Underharrow.","Assembling the Warriors","Ellen Fremedon's distress grows as Underharrow is continually flooded by the people of Rohan, yet remains devoid of riders.","Sticks can be found along the southern border of Underharrow.\
\
Having gathered the components, you should now assemble warriors of Rohan to defend Underharrow using sticks placed near the settlement's edge.","Talk to Ellen Fremedon","Ellen Fremedon can be found outside the Mead Hall of Underharrow in southern Kingstead.\
\
You have built several warriors out of the materials Ellen suggested, and should now return to her."}},
[1432]={nameES="Assembly Call",objectivesES={"The hunters are encamped to the south-east of Lhan Rhos. The scouts are encamped to the north-east of Lhan Rhos. The Protectors of the Pristine Glade are encamped to the west of Lhan Rhos. Speak to Maugan under the tree.  He may need you to do additional work for him.\
\
Elder Déin has asked you to gather the people of the Dunbog for Assembly.","Elder Déin has agreed to call an Assembly of the Avanc-lûth.","Talk to Elder Déin in Lhan Rhos","You have called the protectors to Assembly","The Elders await your return at Lhan Rhos in the centre of the Dunbog.\
\
Having called the people of Dunbog to Assembly, you should return to the village and speak with Elder Déin.","You have called the hunters to Assembly","Call the scouts to Assembly","Assembly Call","Talk to Elder Dein","Call the hunters to Assembly","Call Maugan and the protectors to Assembly","You have called the scouts to Assembly"}},
[1433]={nameES="Assessing Fang Point",objectivesES={"The Wargs of Fang point have grown increasingly aggressive of late, and Agelmund wishes to know what has caused this change in their behaviour.","Captain Agelmund awaits you at Feldburg in the Wold.\
\
You should return to Captain Agelmund with your assessment of the Wargs in Fang Point.","You assessed the threats in the northern area of Fang Point","You assessed the threats in the southern area of Fang Point","Scout the northern den of Fang Point","Fang Point is south of Feldburg, with two dens associated with the same pack: one to the north, and one to the south..\
\
You should scout the north and south dens of Fang Point.","Scout the southern den of Fang Point","Assessing Fang Point","Return to Captain Agelmund in Feldburg"}},
[1434]={nameES="Assessing the Damage",objectivesES={"White Hand Orcs rush toward the overturned cart!","Assess the damage done to the overturned waggon","You were warned that the road to Aldburg may be frought with danger.","This Orc-attack has been quelled, but it is only a matter of time before another one occurs. Nevertheless, you have made travel somewhat safer between Aldburg and Edoras.","White Hand Orcs rush toward the overturned cart ready to attack.\
\
Defeat the White Hand attackers.","Completado","Assessing the Damage","The road from Edoras to Aldburg sees much traffic, which makes it an attractive place for Orcs to attack.\
\
You should be wary as you journey to Aldburg and deal with any threats as they arise."}},
[1435]={nameES="Evaluando las forjas",objectivesES={"Evaluando las forjas","Has descubierto una forja de los orcos de Moria","Knakk se encuentra en la plataforma elevada justo al norte del campamento de los orcos de la Mano Blanca, en el camino hacia la Gran Escalera.\
\
Knakk estará deseando oír cualquier actualización sobre los orcos que trabajan tan cerca de su campamento oculto. Es vital que sigan sin saber que se encuentra allí.","Encuentra el campamento de Knakk","Has descubierto una forja de los orcos de la Mano Blanca","Moria y los orcos de la Mano Blanca están trabajando duramente para extraer el oro del Cuerno Rojo y producir grandes cantidades de armas y armaduras para sus filas.\
\
Los orcos de la Mano Blanca se han atrincherado en la mitad norte de las Vetas del Cuerno Rojo, mientras que los orcos de Moria se esfuerzan por conservar la mitad sur.","Los orcos de Moria crearon forjas hace mucho para ayudarles a procesar y usar el mineral que conseguían de los generosos depósitos de las Vetas del Cuerno Rojo. La Mano Blanca ha invadido y tomado el control de algunas de esas forjas y amenazan con tomar las otras."}},
[1436]={nameES="Assessing the Menace",objectivesES={"Collected the guard's report","Collect the report from Nimish","Assessing the Menace","Girgish instructed you to visit Guard Nimish at the southern entrance of the Jax Phanâl outpost. Guard Nimish regularly informs the emissary of goings on along the southern road. Today, Girgish would like you to fetch the guard's latest report.","The emissary takes the note from you and looks it over. She audibly clicks her tongue and then speaks.\
\
'Interesting. I had hoped that the rumours were untrue, for one shipment intercepted is one too many. We shall need to respond.'","Khôltekh's emissary, Girgish, directs you to a soldier on watch duty that has reported the Haradrim further encroaching upon the city's limits.","Deliver the guard's report to Girgish","Nimish provided you a report on the latest movements by the Haradrim. Deliver the report to Girgish."}},
[1437]={nameES="Assessing the Situation",objectivesES={"Assessing the Situation","Find the guard post in the sewers","You have been asked to check on a group of guards that were sent into the sewers. You should introduce yourself to Nashôn, who appears to be in charge.","Belondor has asked you to check on a group of guards from the Fleet-fast that he has sent into the sewers under the Sail-haven of Umbar Baharbêl. Citizens have reported a problem with crocodiles coming out from the sewers and troubling them, but Belondor believes that this is just a symptom of a larger problem below.","You have been asked to check on a group of guards that were sent into the sewers beneath the Sail-haven. Their post can be found by entering Umbar-môkh through a door between The Wharf-gate and The Fisherfold.","You have found the guard post","Talk to Nashôn"}},
[1438]={nameES="Assistance by the Path",objectivesES={}},
[1439]={nameES="Assistance from the Golden Bears",objectivesES={"Deliver the tokens to Goldhead","Assistance from the Golden Bears","Goldhead is located at his den east and north of Tirith Rhaw.\
\
Goldhead requested that you bring proof of your loyalty and support of the cause of the Free Peoples in the Ettenmoors.","Tirith Rhaw has fallen to Angmar's army. Goldhead, the lord of the Morningthaw bears offered his assistance in exchange for proof that you are loyal to the bears and the cause of the Free Peoples."}},
[1440]={nameES="Assisted Research",objectivesES={"Deliver bat samples to Hórskur","The scholar Hórskur has been trying to study the bats of Grytholm, but with little success.","You have collected several bat samples for Hórskur, who is waiting outside of Tithzagáf.","Hórskur has asked for samples from the hostile bats in Tithzagáf, the cave on Grytholm.\
\
You can collect samples by defeating the bats and their masters.","Assisted Research"}},
[1441]={nameES="Assisting Blómgard",objectivesES={"Assisting Blómgard","Boars can be found in Laerlad in the Vales of Anduin.\
\
You should collect boar meat for the Woodfolk of Blómgard.","Evorik can be found in Blómgard.\
\
You should talk to Evorik.","The Woodmen of Blómgard have been unable to hunt in the woods due to a rise in the number of vicious beasts that lurk within.","Bring the boar meat to Evorik"}},
[1442]={nameES="Assisting Rhosgobel",objectivesES={"Habla con Radagast","Complete Rhosgobel: Calming the Wilds","Assisted Radagast throughout the Vales","Assisting Rhosgobel","Complete Rhosgobel: Cleaning the Tributaries","Radagast has an additional gift for your troubles in assisting his effort to restore the Vales of Anduin to the peaceful and beautiful place that it once was.","Complete Rhosgobel: Calming the Farm","Complete Rhosgobel: The Daily Egg","Complete Rhosgobel: Radagast's Garden","Radagast can be found in Rhosgobel.\
\
You should talk to Radagast.","Radagast has many tasks that need completing in the Vales of Anduin.\
\
You should assist Radagast in the Vales of Anduin.","Complete Rhosgobel: Cleaning the Anduin","Radagast has an additional gift for your troubles in assisting his effort to restore the Vales of Anduin to the peaceful and beautiful place that it once was. Once you have assisted him throughout the Vales, seek out Radagast, and he will reward you for your efforts."}},
[1443]={nameES="Assisting the Builders’ Fellowship",objectivesES={}},
[1444]={nameES="Assisting the Burgsmen's Fellowship",objectivesES={"Complete Quest: Finding a Breach in the Darkness","Heledon asks you to assist Rathon, the Warden of the Wells, in keeping the Cisterns out of the hands of the Enemy.","Rathon can be found at the northern end of the Fourth Circle of Minas Tirith.\
\
You should speak with Rathon and assist him with protecting the Cisterns.","Speak with Rathon","Assisting the Burgsmen's Fellowship","Speak with Heledon","Heledon can be found in Minas Tirith.\
\
Speak with Heledon."}},
[1445]={nameES="Assisting the Cook",objectivesES={"Sâghlem, the cook at The Cracked Flagon, is running low on a few key ingredients.","Bring the ingredients to Sâghlem","Sâghlem has asked you to collect three ingredients that grow on the slopes that rise above Furtherholm.","You have collected the ingredients for which Sâghlem asked. You should bring them to him in the kitchen of The Cracked Flagon in Furtherholm.","Assisting the Cook"}},
[1446]={nameES="Assisting the Herbalists: North Ithilien",objectivesES={}},
[1447]={nameES="Ayudando en la reconstrucción",objectivesES={"Hay un montón de leña en Puente de Caballetes.\
\
Deberías llevar los trozos de madera al montón de leña","Habla con Nessa Aliso","Ayudando en la reconstrucción","Por todo Puente de Caballetes se pueden encontrar trozos de madera.\
\
Deberías echar una mano y recogerlos.","Lleva los trozos de madera al montón de leña","Los constantes ataques han dejado Puente de Caballetes en mal estado, y la Hermandad de los Leñadores está haciendo todo lo posible por reconstruir el pueblo.","Nessa Aliso está en Puente de Caballetes.\
\
Deberías hablar con Nessa Aliso."}},
[1448]={nameES="Assisting the Smiths’ Fellowship",objectivesES={}},
[1449]={nameES="Assisting with Healing",objectivesES={"Mírthar's body appears lifeless when you arrived with the healing concoction. Inspect him to learn any more that you can.","Mírthar has succumbed to the blight. You find a scholar's mark on his clothing","You see a lifeless Mírthar on the ground","Return to Mírthar with the healing concoction","Assisting with Healing","You found Mírthar's scholar's mark when inspecting him. Bring it to the scholar Serâna in Sul Madásh, she would want to know of his fate.","Inspect Mírthar","Bring Mírthar's scholar's mark to Serâna","Lóburdith has helped you complete the healing concoction needed to save Mírthar. Hurry back and give him the medicine."}},
[1450]={nameES="En una encrucijada",objectivesES={"En una encrucijada","Habla con Erlys","A Erlys le gustaría hablar contigo antes de que abandones el Refugio de los Cuan-lûth.","Una furiosa Erlys ha exigido que la ayudes a liberar a Cariad."}},
[1451]={nameES="En casa entre los árboles",objectivesES={"Encuentra al corredor de los flets cerca de la entrada a la sala de artesanía","Habla con el corredor de los flets cerca de la sala de artesanía","En casa entre los árboles","Celechest te ha desafiado a demostrar tu familiaridad con Caras Galadhon en una carrera entre los árboles.","El corredor de los flets cerca de la entrada a la sala de artesanía en Telain Galadhrim está esperando para hablar contigo.","Has llegado al corredor de los flets a tiempo","El corredor de los flets se encuentra en un flet con un buzón en lo alto de Telain Galadhrim, cerca de la entrada a la sala de artesanía.\
\
Celechest te ha desafiado a llegar rápidamente a un cierto corredor de los flets."}},
[1452]={nameES="At Least Fifty Cats",objectivesES={"Find and pet ten of the cats to be found in Zajâna.","Return to Jarôba in Zajâna with the names and locations of the cats you have found.","Return to Jarôba in Zajâna","Jarôba has asked for your help in finding and feeding many of the cats in Zajâna.","At Least Fifty Cats"}},
[1453]={nameES="At Woods' Edge",objectivesES={"At Woods' Edge","Neither Hárskor nor his waggon can be found, and many dour glances rise to meet you...","Concerned that Hárskor has not returned from his errand, Grimbeorn has sent you to seek him in the Woodmen settlement of Hultvís.","Talk to Ríkmar in Hultvís","The settlement of Hultvís can be found far to the south of the Beorning-lands in Woodsedge.\
\
Grimbeorn has asked you to seek one of his kin, Hárskor, and aid the chieftain of the Woodmen, Ríkmar.","Ríkmar, chieftain of the Woodmen, can be found in the settlement of Hultvís in Woodsedge.\
\
Grimbeorn sent his kinsman, Hárskor, to Woodsedge bearing much-needed supplies for the Woodmen of the Vales of Anduin. However, Hárskor has not returned and you have found no sign of his passing in Hultvís.","Deliver Grimbeorn's message to Hárskor in Hultvís"}},
[1454]={nameES="At the Edge of Fangorn",objectivesES={}},
[1455]={nameES="En el borde del bosque",objectivesES={"En el borde del bosque","Los osos y los gusanos portadores de la enfermedad se encuentran en la frontera entre las Quebradas de los Túmulos del Sur y el Bosque Viejo.\
\
Bob Cardorojo quiere destruir a los osos enfermos antes de que propaguen su plaga por todo el Bosque Viejo.","Bob Cardorojo te dijo que los osos cerca de los límites del Bosque Viejo, en lo profundo de las Quebradas de los Túmulos del Sur, están siendo devorados desde dentro por gusanos tumularios.","Habla con Bob Cardorojo en el Alto del Hombre Muerto","Bob Cardorojo se encuentra en el Alto del Hombre Muerto.\
\
Debes regresar con Bob Cardorojo y decirle que el sombrío trabajo que pidió está completo."}},
[1456]={nameES="At the Gates",objectivesES={"Zhúdo can be found near Mount Gundabad.\
\
You have recalled the other scouts sent to Gundabad. You should return to Zhúdo.","Darfin, Rádek, and Sigvith can be found within the encampments of Hanksar-mokh and Kulûg-mokh at the gates of Mount Gundabad.\
\
Zhúdo has asked you to recall Darfin, Rádek, and Sigvith from their missions at the Orc encampments outside Mount Gundabad.","Talk to Zhúdo near Mount Gundabad","Zhúdo can be found near Mount Gundabad.\
\
You have found only one of Glóin's scouts, Zhúdo. You should talk to Zhúdo and learn what has happened.","Darfin appears to have been captured by the Orcs of Gundabad!","Find and aid Rádek","Find and aid Sigvith","In an attempt to gain more knowledge of Gorgar's plans, Glóin sent several scouts to the gates of Mount Gundabad. However, their return is long overdue.","You discover a Zhélruka sheltering near the approach to Mount Gundabad","Darfin, Zhúdo, Rádek, and Sigvith can be found near the gates of Mount Gundabad.\
\
Glóin's scouts have not returned from a mission to the gates of Mount Gundabad. You should search for them.","Rádek is surveying a stable of sorts at the gates of Gundabad","Find and aid Darfin","Find some sign of Glóin's scouts near the gates of Mount Gundabad","Sigvith appears to be leafing through a number of dirty papers","At the Gates"}},
[1457]={nameES="At the Mercy of the Anduin",objectivesES={"Golthor can be found in the tunnels beneath Osgiliath.\
\
You have dealt a harsh blow to the Orcs along the Anduin and should now return to Golthor.","Orc raft-builders and their designs can be found along the Anduin in southern Osgiliath.\
\
Golthor has asked you to sabotage Orkish bridge-rafts and slay their crafters.","Hoping to slow the advance of the Morgul-host, Golthor has sent you to destroy the bridge-rafts that ferry their forces to the western banks.","At the Mercy of the Anduin","Talk to Golthor"}},
[1458]={nameES="At the Mistress's Bidding",objectivesES={"Talk to Spakorth at Lûghash","Stout-axe expeditions can be found throughout Dor Amarth. \
\
Spakorth has asked you to seek the remaining Stout-axe expeditions in Dor Amarth. These expeditions can be found among the rocks and crevices to the south of the road to Lûghash. \
\
You should tell any Stout-axes you encounter to return to Lûghash.","The Stout-axes make for Lûghash!","At the Mistress's Bidding","Spakorth can be found outside the lower gates to Lûghash in Dor Amarth.\
\
You have recalled all the Stout-axes you could find. You should meet with Spakorth outside Lûghash.","Zôreth, Mistress of Lûghash, has sent the Stout-axes in her service to seek treasures that once belonged to the Dark Lord.","Scattered equipment lines the edge of this chasm. These Stout-axes met an unfortunate fate..."}},
[1459]={nameES="Athelward's Bounty",objectivesES={"Enter the cave where Zúrsnaga is hiding","The Uruk-hideout is south-west of Caddabrand's camp, beyond the entrance to the wolf-den.\
\
Caddabrand has tracked the Uruk, Zúrsnaga, to a cave south-west of the wolf den.","The Uruk-hideout is south-west of Caddabrand's camp, beyond the entrance to the wolf-den. Zúrsnaga lies hidden within the caves.\
\
Caddabrand has asked you to find and defeat the Uruk, Zúrsnaga.","Find and defeat Zúrsnaga the Uruk","Return to Caddabrand with news of Zúrsnaga's demise","Reeve Athelward has tasked Caddabrand with eliminating an Uruk-hai captain and has promised a large bounty for the task. Caddabrand is eager to split the reward with someone capable of doing the dirty work.","You notice Uruk-tracks leading deeper into the cave","Caddabrand's camp lies east of the Uruk-hai hideout and the wolf-den.\
\
Caddabrand will be eager to hear the news that Zúrsnaga has been defeated.","Athelward's Bounty","Found and defeated Zúrsnaga the Uruk"}},
[1460]={nameES="Athelward's Judgement",objectivesES={"Inform Garmund of his new role as Athelward's personal guardian","Léofcetel seems most displeased with his new rank","Léofcetel can be found at the western watch-tower, just west of Cliving.\
\
Reeve Athelward has judged Léofcetel worthy of the title of Captain of the Guard, receiving the role from his rival Garmund.","Léofcetel can be found at the western watch-tower, just west of Cliving.\
\
Captain Garmund wishes to have Léofcetel rejoin his men and to set aside their past differences.","Reeve Athelward resides within his Mead Hall, at the eastern edge of Cliving.\
\
Reeve Athelward has summoned you before him to discuss the matters of Garmund and Léofcetel.","Léofcetel has informed Reeve Athelward of Captain Garmund's disobedience, and Athelward must respond with fair judgement of each man.","Garmund can be found at the western watch-tower, just west of Cliving.\
\
Athelward has judged Garmund to be a valiant protector and has granted him the duty of becoming the Reeve's personal safe-guard.","Athelward's Judgement","Talk to Reeve Athelward at the Mead Hall","Inform Léofcetel of his promotion to Captain of the Guard","Talk to Léofcetel"}},
[1461]={nameES="El favorito de Atli",objectivesES={"Has recogido una jarra de cerveza Rompepicos","Has recogido la cerveza Rompepicos","Lleva la Cerveza Rompepicos a Óli","Recoge una jarra de Cerveza Rompepicos","Óli se encuentra en Hrimbarg, en las Montañas Nubladas, lejos al este de las Tierras de Bree.\
\
Óli te ha pedido que le lleves una pinta de \\qCerveza Rompepicos\\q de la Posada de la Comba y la Cresta.","La Posada de la Comba y la Cresta se encuentra en el pueblo de Combe, en las Tierras de Bree.\
\
Deberías viajar a Combe y recoger algo de Cerveza Rompepicos en la posada allí.","Se te ha encargado completar una entrega a un miembro de la Liga de las Posadas que se ha quedado varado lejos del festival esta temporada.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu bitácora de misiones cuando termine el festival actual. </rgb>","Recoge la Cerveza Rompepicos en la Posada de la Comba y la Cresta","El favorito de Atli"}},
[1462]={nameES="Ataque al alba",objectivesES={"Asegurad la entrada del campamento de Graug.","Derrotad a Graug y aseguraos de que el conocimiento sobre la ubicación de Esteldín esté a salvo.","Asegurad la puerta principal","<rgb=#00FF00>La entrada al campamento de Graug ha sido asegurada</rgb>","Buscad y destruid las catapultas que se encuentran fuera de la tienda de Graug. Esto permitirá a los montaraces asegurar el campamento inferior.","En lo más profundo de la noche, una partida de exploradores trasgos ha descubierto la ubicación del regugio de montaraces conocido como Esteldín. Los trasgos han huido a Dol Dínen, acabad con ellos antes de que puedan traer refuerzos.","Asegurad la puerta central","<rgb=#00FF00>La puerta este ha sido asegurada</rgb>","<rgb=#00FF00>Habéis asegurado la zona tras destruir las catapultas. Ahora podéis buscar y derrotar a Graug y a sus exploradores trasgos.</rgb>","<rgb=#00FF00>La puerta central ha sido asegurada</rgb>","Ataque al alba","Romped la puerta oeste o la puerta este de Dol Dínen y aseguradla.","Asegurad la puerta este","Romped y asegurad la puerta principal de Dol Dínen.","<rgb=#00FF00>La puerta oeste ha sido asegurada</rgb>","<rgb=#00FF00>Habéis derrotado a Graug y asegurado el conocimiento de la ubicación de Esteldín</rgb>","<rgb=#FF0000>No permitáis que ningún explorador trasgo escape.</rgb>","Has permitido que un explorador trasgo escape con el conocimiento de la ubicación de Esteldín","<rgb=#00FF00>La puerta principal ha sido asegurada</rgb>","Con el camino despejado a través de una de las puertas, la puerta central os cierra el paso, es el último obstáculo para alcanzar a los exploradores trasgos.","El patio ha caído. Ahora todo lo que queda es derrotar a Graug y destruir cualquier rastro de la información que hayan podido reunir.","Asegurad la zona.","Asegurad la puerta oeste","Asegurad la entrada del campamento de Graug, en la cima de la colina que domina la puerta central."}},
[1463]={nameES="Ataque al Amanecer - Incursión",objectivesES={"Ataque al Amanecer - Incursión","Completa 'Ataque al Amanecer' en un grupo de incursión","En lo más profundo de la noche, una partida de exploradores trasgos ha descubierto la ubicación del regugio de montaraces conocido como Esteldín. Los trasgos han huido a Dol Dínen, acabad con ellos antes de que puedan traer refuerzos."}},
[1464]={nameES="Attack on the Wailing Hold",objectivesES={}},
[1465]={nameES="Attacking the Lawless",objectivesES={}},
[1466]={nameES="Attacking the Unwelcome",objectivesES={}},
[1467]={nameES="Attercop, Attercop",objectivesES={"Lavanferon está en Echad Mothelen, al noroeste de la Guarida de Tejepavor.\
\
Deberías volver a ver a Lavanferon con la noticia de tu éxito.","Laehendiel derrotada en la Guarida de Tejepavor","Derrota a Laehendiel en la Guarida de Tejepavor","Habla con Lavanferon en Echad Mothelen","Attercop, Attercop","Muchas criaturas oscuras y malvadas habitan en las profundidades del sur del Bosque Negro. Las arañas son de las más temibles.","Pueden encontrarse arañas por todos los Troncosombríos. Laehendiel se encuentra en la Guarida de Tejepavor, al sureste de Echad Mothelen.\
\
nLavanferon te ha pedido que derrotes a un buen número de arañas y a su señora, Laehendiel."}},
[1468]={nameES="Mantos de uros",objectivesES={"Devuelve los mantos de uros a Gondranc","Mantos de uros","A solicitud del Montaraz Gondranc, fuiste al campamento de los Hijos de la tierra al noreste de Esteldín para recuperar un libro de conocimientos sobre trabajo del cuero que Asikko, El líder de los Hijos de la Tierra, le había prometido. Con esos conocimientos podrá fabricar una armadura mucho mejor para la gente de Puente de Caballetes.","Los uros pastan en las llanuras y colinas de Rhunenlad y del este de Nan Amlug.\
\
Gondranc descubrió en el libro de Asikko que los Hijos de la tierra usan los mantos de pelaje que crecen sobre los hombros de los uros para acolchar su armadura. Te ha pedido que caces uros y le traigas esos mantos."}},
[1469]={nameES="El Otoño No Dura",objectivesES={"Lleva la carne de jabalí a Bevan en la puerta norte de Musgovilla","Bevan está en la puerta norte de Musgovilla, esperándote para que regreses con la carne de jabalí.","Con el invierno acercándose pronto, Bevan sabe que los almacenes de Musgovilla necesitan ser abastecidos con carne de jabalí salada y conservada.","Los jabalíes musgosos habitan cerca del Viejo Camino del Sur, y resultarán una buena fuente de los filetes de jabalí que Bevan solicitó.","El Otoño No Dura"}},
[1470]={nameES="Avabárg: Buried Omens",objectivesES={"Avabárg: Buried Omens","Audvak of the Woodmen is concerned about the gloom that has descended upon Avabárg.","Audvak believes that destroying sorrowful relics may help lift the darkness that has settled upon Avabárg."}},
[1471]={nameES="Avabárg: Source of Gloom",objectivesES={"Defeated the Spirit of Gloom","Avabárg: Source of Gloom","Audvak of the Woodmen is concerned about the gloom that has descended upon Avabárg.","Defeat the Spirit of Gloom","The gloom of which Audvak spoke was not merely metaphorical, and has taken ethereal forms that must be defeated."}},
[1472]={nameES="Avabárg: Sunken Gloom",objectivesES={"Avabárg: Sunken Gloom","Audvak of the Woodmen is concerned about the gloom that has descended upon Avabárg.","The gloom of which Audvak spoke was not merely metaphorical, and has taken ethereal forms that must be defeated."}},
[1473]={nameES="Avabárg: Wayward Bones",objectivesES={"Avabárg: Wayward Bones","Audvak of the Woodmen is concerned about the gloom that has descended upon Avabárg.","Audvak asked you to collect restless bones from Avabárg so she might give them proper burials."}},
[1474]={nameES="Avanc for Every Need",objectivesES={"The avanc, to many beyond Dunland a mythical beast, serve as a staple for the people of the Dunbog.","Avanc for Every Need","Talk to Harri at the hunters' camp","Avanc can be found throughout the Dunbog.\
\
Harri has asked you to help him fight the mighty avanc."}},
[1475]={nameES="Avenging the Forest",objectivesES={}},
[1476]={nameES="Avenging the Innocent",objectivesES={"Trapjaw looks up from his grisly meal angrily, then leaps to his feet to attack!","Find Trapjaw","One of Ivorel's scouts has returned to tell of a deadly black dog named Trapjaw who was seen following Hal Tiller's trail two days ago. Ivorel believes that Trapjaw is likely responsible for his death.","Ivorel is at her camp in the Scuttledells, a distance south of Trapjaw's lair.\
\
You should speak with Ivorel and tell her that Trapjaw has been slain and that Hal Tiller is alive.","Trapjaw's lair lies a distance to the north-east of Ivorel's camp in the Scuttledells.\
\
Ivorel has tasked you with avenging Hal Tiller by hunting down the deadly black dog, Trapjaw, within the Scuttledells.","Avenging the Innocent","Habla con Ivorel en su campamento","Defeated Trapjaw"}},
[1477]={nameES="Avenging the Lost Farmers",objectivesES={"Edsig's Farm is now the Warg-riders' outpost! The farmers must be avenged...","The farmers killed by these Warg-riders have been avenged. But there is much more to be done.","The riders you defeated at Edsig's Farm will go a long way toward avenging those who lost their lives or homes to those Orcs.","Find out what has become of Edsig's Farm","Warg-riders are patrolling all over the area near Edsig's Farm. They keep watch on the road, and the surrounding farmlands, so approaching the farm undetected will not be easy.","Avenging the Lost Farmers","Edsig's Farm is near Gárferth's Farm, on the road south of Thrymm's Farm.\
\
Edsig's Farm was abandoned recently, but most of the Warg-rider attacks seem to have come from that direction.","Completado","Edsig's Farm was once a very productive farm for Forlaw. It wasn't abandoned like the other farms, but no one that worked or lived there has returned alive. They are all presumed dead, but nobody is quite sure what happened to the farm, though they suspect the enemy has destroyed it."}},
[1478]={nameES="Awake at Long Last",objectivesES={}},
[1479]={nameES="Awakening",objectivesES={"Hermáth Stormhammer can be found at Abkân'aban in Gloomingtarn.\
\
After defeating Allaban the Collector at Abkân'aban and the revelation of Thrástan's identity, Hermáth Stormhammer wishes to speak with you. You should talk to Hermáth Stormhammer.","Talk to Hermáth Stormhammer at Abkân'aban","Awakening","Hermáth Stormhammer can be found at Watchers' Roost.\
\
Determined to both repel the Iron Crown and escort Thrástan to the White Stone Forge, Hermáth Stormhammer has asked you to accompany him and his warriors to Abkân'aban, the Stone of Wakening. You should talk to Hermáth Stormhammer.","Talk to Hermáth Stormhammer","At Abkân'aban, the Stone of Wakening, the Angmarim of the Iron Crown seek to master the white forge of Durin the Deathless, forever defiling the hallowed caverns of Gloomingtarn."}},
