[1481]={nameES="Awash with Flames",objectivesES={"Awash with Flames","Douse flaming debris and rescue trapped civilians in Minas Tirith","A barrage of flaming projectiles loosed by the Enemy's catapults has come crashing down into the First Circle of Minas Tirith, trapping the innocent and setting the city ablaze. You must put out the fires and free the trapped civilians.","A barrage of flaming projectiles loosed by the Enemy's catapults has come crashing down into the First Circle of Minas Tirith, trapping the innocent and setting the city ablaze.\
