[1523]={nameES="Bait for the Big One",objectivesES={"Lure out the massive ukhrash from its pond north of Bárgstad and collect its chitin","Talk to Fúsi Gem-cutter","Fúsi is at Bárgstad in the Pit of Stonejaws.\
\
Now that you have collected the massive chitin, you should bring it back to Fúsi.","The chitin from this beast is massive!","Bait for the Big One","You should lure out the massive ukhrash from its pond north of Bárgstad.","You can find foul meat from ukhrâsh throughout the Pit of Stonejaws.","Fúsi Gem-cutter has requested your help with an unorthodox plan."}},
[1524]={nameES="Cebando a la Bestia: Envoltorio de Regalo",objectivesES={"Los cueros extraordinarios hervidos pueden ser preparados por los guardabosques de la Tierra Media.\
\
Hasta quiere que le lleves veinte cueros extraordinarios hervidos.","Lleva los cueros a Hasta","Hasta pide que quienes estén dispuestos a ayudarle reúnan los diversos ingredientes necesarios para atraer a la amenaza que se oculta bajo las Obras Hidráulicas.","Cebando a la Bestia: Envoltorio de Regalo"}},
[1525]={nameES="Cebando a la Bestia: Enganchado",objectivesES={"Lleva el acero de Khazâd a Hasta","Los lingotes de acero de Khazâd pueden ser elaborados por los Prospeccionistas de toda la Tierra Media.\
\
Hasta quiere que le lleves cinco lingotes de acero de Khazâd.","Cebando a la Bestia: Enganchado","Hasta pide que quienes estén dispuestos a ayudarle reúnan los diversos ingredientes necesarios para atraer a la amenaza que se oculta bajo las Obras Hidráulicas."}},
[1526]={nameES="Cebando a la Bestia: Caliente como el Fuego",objectivesES={"Cebando a la Bestia: Caliente como el Fuego","El aceite ígneo puro puede ser preparado por Eruditos en toda la Tierra Media.\
\
Hasta quiere que le lleves veinte contenedores de aceite ígneo.","Hasta pide que quienes estén dispuestos a ayudarle reúnan los diversos ingredientes necesarios para atraer a la amenaza que se oculta bajo las Obras Hidráulicas.","Lleva el aceite ígneo puro a Hasta"}},
[1527]={nameES="Cebando a la Bestia: Dándole Carne al Hueso",objectivesES={"Puedes pescar espinosos de tres púas en las Obras Hidráulicas.\
\
Hasta quiere que le lleves cinco espinosos de tres púas.","Cebando a la Bestia: Dándole Carne al Hueso","Lleva los peces a Hasta","Hasta pide que quienes estén dispuestos a ayudarle reúnan los diversos ingredientes necesarios para atraer a la amenaza que se oculta bajo las Obras Hidráulicas."}},
[1528]={nameES="Cebando a la Bestia: El Sabor de la Vida",objectivesES={"Puedes encontrar a Hasta en la Bodega Putrefacta, en las Obras Hidráulicas de Moria.\
\
Hasta quiere que le traigas diez frascos de salsa de menta y diez porciones de puré de papas reales.","Hasta pide que quienes estén dispuestos a ayudarle reúnan los diversos ingredientes necesarios para atraer a la amenaza que se oculta bajo las Obras Hidráulicas.","Lleva los objetos a Hasta","Cebando a la Bestia: El Sabor de la Vida"}},
[1529]={nameES="Baiting the Hook",objectivesES={"Torchuil is in Dol Amroth.\
\
Torchuil will be pleased to see the fish you caught.","Calembel Carp can be caught at Calembel to the north-east of Dol Amroth.\
\
Torchuil asked you to go to Calembel, gather some bait and catch some special fish.","Baiting the Hook","You have baited your pole, time to fish!","Calembel Carp are a delicacy in this area. However, they can only be caught when using a special type of bait, which must be found."}},
[1530]={nameES="Cebo en las trampas",objectivesES={"Has conseguido atraer a muchas de las presas hacia las trampas vacías que los Pueblos Libres han colocado en el Bosque Salvaje. Sin duda, tus esfuerzos serán recompensados.","Alguien ha puesto una tarea para colocar cebos en trampas vacías destinadas a la captura de caza menor.","Consigue cebo","Coloca cebo en trampas vacías","Cebo conseguido","El anuncio del tablón dice:\
\
'Se necesitan: trampas vacías llenas de cebo en el Bosque Salvaje para capturar caza menor. Coge el cebo de la caja que hay cerca. Se te recompensará por tu esfuerzo.'","Completado","El cebo se encuentra en un cofre cercano.\
\
Deberías recoger el cebo.","En el Bosque Salvaje se pueden encontrar trampas vacías.\
\
Deberías poner cebo en las trampas vacías.","Cebo en las trampas"}},
[1531]={nameES="Balewood: A Strong Resemblance",objectivesES={"Healing herbs are in short supply in Wildermore with the snows settling in, and you have been asked to search the Balewood for any surviving plants whose seeds may be used.","Ealswith is in Forlaw.\
\
You should return to Ealswith.","Balewood: A Strong Resemblance","<rgb=#FF0000>Completing Wildermore's Recovery will cancel this quest.</rgb>","Plants that might be used for healing purposes can likely be found throughout the south-eastern edge of the Balewood.\
\
You should search the south-eastern Balewood for promising plants.","Regresa con Ealswith"}},
[1532]={nameES="Balewood: Driving Back the Enemy",objectivesES={"The forces of Isengard can be found in the Balewood.\
\
You should ride to the Balewood and defeat the enemies of Wildermore.","Núrzum is dead, but the enemy still roams free throughout much of Wildermore.","Ealswith is in Forlaw.\
\
You should return to Ealswith.","<rgb=#FF0000>Completing Wildermore's Recovery will cancel this quest.</rgb>","Balewood: Driving Back the Enemy","Regresa con Ealswith"}},
[1533]={nameES="Balhest, señor de Ost Elendil",objectivesES={"Balhest derrotado","Balhest, señor de Ost Elendil","Balhest, uno de los tenientes Númenóreanos negros más fuertes de Amarthiel, está en Ost Elendil.\
\
Legrindavor te ha pedido que pongas fin a Balhest para que Ost Elendil pueda ser reclamada.","Derrota a Balhest"}},
[1534]={nameES="El orgullo de Balin",objectivesES={"Balin, hijo de Fundin, llegó a Moria hace años y probablemente acampó cerca de la Sala Vigesimoprimera.","El orgullo de Balin","En el campamento de Balin en Nud-melek se pueden encontrar insectos y otros enemigos.\
\
Deberás eliminar las criaturas enemigas del campamento de Balin.","Completado","El campamento de Balin se encuentra al oeste del Cruce Profundo, al norte de Khurjezer, que se encuentra al este de la Sala Vigesimoprimera.\
\
Busca en el campamento de Balin reliquias de la expedición y examina minuciosamente los restos del campamento.","Has descubierto un campamento que una vez estuvo habitado por Balin, hijo de Fundin, cuando lideró su propia expedición a Moria.\
\
Está completamente infestado de alimañas, pero quizás haya artefactos por descubrir que se encuentren cerca.","Has limpiado el campamento de Balin de la peor parte de su infestación, y ahora puedes investigar para encontrar reliquias u otros objetos de interés.","Elimina las plagas del campamento de Balin"}},
[1535]={nameES="Ballard Wilmer y el huargo blanco",objectivesES={"Ballard Wilmer y el huargo blanco","Los huargos blancos acechan las colinas de Tyrn Fornech, pero se pueden encontrar especialmente en las cercanías de la Hendidura del Ocaso, al norte de Ost Forod.\
\
Ballard Wilmer te habló de su angustioso encuentro con un huargo y te ha pedido que derrotes a algunos de los feroces huargos blancos de Tyrn Fornech.","Ballard Wilmer tuvo un encuentro con huargos blancos en las colinas de Tyrn Fornech y ahora tiene un miedo mortal a esas criaturas.","Ballard Wilmer está en el antiguo puesto de vigilancia de Ost Forod, en las colinas de Tyrn Fornech, al sur de la Hendidura del Ocaso.\
\
Has derrotado a muchos huargos blancos y ahora deberías informar de tu victoria a Ballard Wilmer."}},
[1536]={nameES="Ballistae of Madh-fushaum",objectivesES={}},
[1537]={nameES="Vendajes para Callum",objectivesES={"Vendajes recogidos","Vendajes para Callum","El campamento de Callum está en el extremo oeste del Pantano de la Rana, al oeste de Bolgovado.\
\
Con las hojas de retama que recogiste, Wilimar pudo preparar un ungüento en el que empapar los vendajes. Además de darle los vendajes a Callum, Wilimar te ha pedido que le digas a Callum que no le guarda rencor y espera que él haga lo mismo.","Llevar hojas de retama a Wilimar Bolger","La retama crece junto al agua, al sureste de Bolgovado.\
\
Wilimar ha decidido proporcionar vendajes a Callum para su herida, pero para ayudar en su curación, quiere empapar los vendajes en un ungüento hecho de hojas de retama. Te ha pedido que recojas estas hojas para él.","Recolectar vendajes","Wilimar Bolger se encuentra cerca de su agujero, al noroeste de Bolgovado.\
\
Wilimar ha decidido proporcionar vendajes a Callum para su herida, pero para ayudar en su curación, quiere empapar los vendajes en un ungüento hecho de hojas de retama. Te ha pedido que recojas estas hojas para él.","Al seguir leyendo el diario, Wilimar ha comenzado a sentir simpatía por Callum, el montañés que juró matarlo. Al conocer la dura vida de Callum en un reino lejano del norte, ha decidido ayudarlo y curar la herida que sufrió por el jabalí salvaje.","Llevar vendajes a Callum"}},
[1538]={nameES="Bane of the Council",objectivesES={"You defeated Iarvael","Defeat Iarvael","Bane of the Council","You must hunt down and defeat Iarvael, who is laired in the hills north of Bail Dílas.","Tell Handarod in Esteldín of your victory in Angmar.","The dread morroval Iarvael has been hunting down the Council of the North. You must gather your allies and destroy her before she discovers their refuge. Her lair lies somewhere to the north of Bail Dílas in Angmar."}},
[1539]={nameES="Bane of the Elvenking",objectivesES={"King Thranduil can be found in Felegoth.\
\
You have defeated Iphantemel and forever banished her blight from Eryn Lasgalen. You should talk to King Thranduil.","Talk to King Thranduil","Bane of the Elvenking","Despite uncovering evidence that Karazgar may still lurk in Eryn Lasgalen, King Thranduil has turned his attention to his hated foe of old: Iphantemel.","King Thranduil can be found in Felegoth.\
\
King Thranduil has asked you to accompany him and his warriors to Torech Emel in an effort to put an end to the blight of Iphantemel."}},
[1540]={nameES="Bane of the Serpent",objectivesES={"Bane of the Serpent","Defeated Rujateng","Complete Quest: The Eyes and The Blind","Complete Quest: Dwindling Rations","Gladhir has asked you to stop the Haradrim camped in the hills from discovering Haerondir and threatening the Host of the West.","Return to Gladhir","Complete Quest: Beneath the Snake","Enter Dûm Boha","You should find the Haradrim encampment of Dûm Boha, located on the western slopes of the Slag-hills.","You should return to Gladhir, who can be found at Haerondir.","There is much to be done to impede the Haradrim here","You should find and defeat Rujateng at Dûm Boha.","Complete Quest: The Poisoned Mind","Defeat Rujateng"}},
[1541]={nameES="Azote del Bosque",objectivesES={"Las máquinas de asedio y catapultas de Moria se encuentran en Drû-garmadh, al sureste de Mekhem-bizru.\
\
Alrekur teme las armas de asedio que se están construyendo en Drû-garmadh y quiere que destruyas varias máquinas de asedio y catapultas.","Azote del Bosque","Habla con Alrekur en Mekhem-bizru","Los orcos en Drû-garmadh han comenzado a construir máquinas de asedio y catapultas con las que guerrear contra los enanos de Khazad-dûm y los elfos del Bosque de Oro.","Alrekur se encuentra en Mekhem-bizru, al noroeste de Drû-garmadh.\
\
Alrekur estará encantado de saber que las máquinas de asedio y catapultas de Moria construidas en Drû-garmadh han sido destruidas."}},
[1542]={nameES="Expulsar a los espíritus",objectivesES={"Los espíritus malvados se encuentran en Imlad Balchorth, al oeste de Myrkworth.\
\
Sigar te ha pedido que destruyas a los espíritus malvados de Imlad Balchorth. Pueden encontrarse vagando por Imlad Balchorth.","A pesar del número de espíritus malvados que has expulsado de Imlad Balchorth, nunca parecen terminarse.","Expulsar a los espíritus","Sigar está en Myrkworth, al este de Imlad Balchorth.\
\
Tras destruir a los espíritus malvados como se te pidió, deberías volver a ver a Sigar en Myrkworth y contarle la tarea ha sido completada."}},
[1543]={nameES="Banishing Nightmares",objectivesES={"Banishing Nightmares","You have found a place to \\qscout\\q for Candron","Plagued by bad dreams and memories, a young boy has barricaded himself from the outside world.","Go to the top of the stairs near the Minardil statue","Candron has asked you to \\qscout\\q three places in East Pelargir.\
\
He mentioned the district with the destroyed Castamir monument, the top of the stairs near the Minardil statue, and the courtyard of Lord Sirgon's manor.","You have \\qscouted\\q all three places in East Pelargir.\
\
You should return to Heniawen in East Pelargir and talk to Candron through the door of their home.","Talk to Heniawen","<rgb=#00ff00>Look</rgb> at the top of the stairs near the Minardil statue","<rgb=#00ff00>Look</rgb> in the courtyard of Lord Sirgon's manor","<rgb=#00ff00>Look</rgb> in the district with the destroyed Castamir monument","Heniawen has asked you to reassure Candron that there is no danger in Pelargir.\
\
You should talk to him through the door.","You have helped Candron find the courage to leave the house.\
\
You should talk to Heniawen in East Pelargir.","Candron warily emerges from the house, but relaxes upon seeing Heniawen","Go to the district with the destroyed Castamir monument","Talk to Candron through the door","Go to the courtyard of Lord Sirgon's manor"}},
[1544]={nameES="Desterrando la oscuridad",objectivesES={"Los nigromantes de Imlad Balchorth se encuentran en las ruinas situadas en lo alto de las colinas del sur.\
\
El hechicero jefe de los nigromantes, el Maestro de los Espíritus, sin duda controla a Deluches, el capitán de los espíritus. Gautar te ha pedido que lo derrotes y así destierres a Deluches para siempre.","Gautar se encuentra en Valleoscuro, al este y un poco al norte de Eithel Úmfaer.\
\
Has derrotado a Deluches y desterrado al menos algunos de los espíritus crueles de Angmar. Deberías llevar estas buenas noticias a Gautar.","La aparición repentina de Deluches, el capitán de los espíritus crueles, te impidió desterrar a las criaturas del santuario.","Eithel Úmfaer se encuentra en el sur de Imlad Balchorth, al oeste de Valleoscuro.\
\
Deluches, el capitán de los espíritus crueles, ha sido convocado a Eithel Úmfaer, el santuario principal de Imlad Balchorth, donde debe ser destruido.","Desterrando la oscuridad"}},
[1545]={nameES="Banishing the Dishonoured",objectivesES={"Bagmund is at Aculf's camp in the Rushgore, north-west of Atburg.\
\
Eowils told you to return to Bagmund and let him know that you have dealt with Brúngwath.","Brúngwath is at Atburg, south-east of Aculf's camp in the Rushgore.\
\
Bagmund has asked you to drive Brúngwath from the Rushgore, in hopes that the shades will not return.","Defeated Brúngwath at Atburg","Talk to Bagmund at Aculf's camp in the Rushgore","Eowils knows that Bagmund will be pleased by your decision to help drive the shades from the Rushgore, but is concerned that they will return as long as their leader remains at Atburg.","Banishing the Dishonoured","Defeat Brúngwath at Atburg"}},
[1546]={nameES="Banishing the Shadows",objectivesES={"Umhen's isle lies to the south of Barad Angol, at the centre of the Bleakmere.\
\
Faerchiril has asked you to seek out and defeat the fell spirit Umhen and his minions.","Faerchiril is at Barad Angol due north of Umhen's isle, up the mountain.\
  \
You should return to Faerchiril and let her know that Umhen and his minions have been defeated.","Defeat Umhen","At the centre of the Bleakmere, there lies a small isle, upon which a fell spirit named Umhen has gathered his foul minions.","Talk to Faerchiril","Defeated Umhen","Banishing the Shadows"}},
[1547]={nameES="Banners of Umbar",objectivesES={"You have littered Hashadîr with the flags of Gondor, which will do much to dishearten the Corsairs who have begun to raid these southern lands.","Banners of Umbar","Banners of Umbar fly in Hashadîr, the Corsair camp south-west of Dol Amroth in Belfalas.\
\
You should replace the Corsairs' banners with Gondorian ones.","The Corsairs boldly fly their colours in Hashadîr, the encampment near Dol Amroth. \
\
You should replace their banners with Gondorian colours, for this land has not yet been claimed for Umbar.","Completado","The Corsairs boldly fly their colours in Hashadîr, the encampment near Dol Amroth."}},
[1548]={nameES="Banners of the Enemy",objectivesES={"Enter the field","You have struck the west banner's shield","You have struck the south banner's shield","Hit the east banner's shield","The four farms are spread out to the north, east, and west of the rock.\
\
Gladsnel asked you to throw a spear through four shields on Orc-banners.","You have struck the east banner's shield","Hit all of the shields rapidly","Gladsnel is in Cliving.\
\
Gladsnel will be pleased to hear that a spear was thrown through each of the four shields.","Hit the north banner's shield","The rock is south of Cliving.\
\
Gladsnel asked you to throw a spear through several shields on Orc-banners planted at Norcrofts farms.","<rgb=#FF0000>Completing Aiding the Eastemnet will cancel this quest</rgb>","You have struck the north banner's shield","Hit the west banner's shield","Talk to Gladsnel","South of Cliving, several shields have been placed on banners of the Enemy planted around former farmhouses.","Banners of the Enemy","Hit the south banner's shield"}},
[1549]={nameES="Estandartes de la Corona de Hierro",objectivesES={"Estandartes de la Corona de Hierro","Las fuerzas de Angmar suelen usar estandartes que muestran la imagen de la Corona de Hierro para identificar sus campamentos.","Orchalwë quiere que quemes los estandartes de la Corona de Hierro en el patio.","Habla con Orchalwë","Orchalwë querrá hablar sobre la quema de los estandartes."}},
[1550]={nameES="Banners of the Lady of Blight",objectivesES={}},
[1551]={nameES="Estandartes del Paso",objectivesES={"La Puerta del Cuerno Rojo se encuentra al noreste de Echad Dúnann.\
\
Rostoriel te ha pedido que retires los estandartes de los semiorcos de la Puerta del Cuerno Rojo.","Los semiorcos han colocado estandartes por toda la Puerta del Cuerno Rojo para proclamar su lealtad a Saruman el Blanco y reclamar esta zona como suya.","Habla con Rostoriel en Echad Dúnann","Estandartes del Paso"}},
[1552]={nameES="Banquet Preparations",objectivesES={"The Elf-lady Maliriel has long organized the great banquets of Lothlórien, held for honoured guests and special occasions. The strains of unrest and war have distracted many from the preparations needed, and she has asked you to aid the Elves responsible for completing the preparations for an upcoming banquet.","Galhíril can be found near the gate to Imlad Lalaith. Aesbrennil and Hadhelen can be found within the Vineyards of Lórien, south of Imlad Lalaith. Glasnír can be found at the entrance to the vineyards, south of Imlad Lalaith.\
\
Maliriel has asked you to help her and her companions to complete all the preparations for the upcoming feast.","Banquet Preparations","Talk to Maliriel at Imlad Lalaith","Maliriel is at Imlad Lalaith.\
\
You should report to Maliriel that all the banquet preparations she asked you to finish are complete."}},
[1553]={nameES="Banám Lugaun: Halting Progress",objectivesES={}},
[1554]={nameES="Banám Lugaun: Orders From Afar",objectivesES={}},
[1555]={nameES="Banám Lugaun: Orkish Might",objectivesES={"Banám Lugaun: Orkish Might","Defeated Laugshat","Defeat Laugshat","An Orc camp sits between Minas Morgul and Cirith Ungol, and troops and supplies use it as they move through the treacherous terrain.","The Orc encampment of Banám Lugaun watches Minas Morgul from across the Morgulduin River. The encampment seems to be a waypoint of sorts, with Orcs coming and going: some to the city of Minas Morgul, others over the mountains towards Cirith Ungol. It is important that the Orcs at this encampment are dealt with, and swiftly.","Defeat many Orcs and Uruk-hai in Banám Lugaun.","Completado","Orcs and Uruk-hai can be found in Banám Lugaun in Rath Dúath.\
\
You should defeat Orcs and Uruk-hai in Banám Lugaun.","You have defeated many of those encamped at Banám Lugaun and learned from the camp's leader that the Orcs here rally under the banner of Ugrukhôr.","Defeat Orcs and Uruk-hai in Banám Lugaun"}},
[1556]={nameES="Campamento de Barachen",objectivesES={"Campamento de Barachen","Habla con Barachen en su campamento en el Bosque de los Trolls","El campamento de Barachen se encuentra muy al este de Evendim, en el Bosque de los Trolls, justo al otro lado del Último Puente desde las Tierras Solitarias.\
\
Orchalwë te ha pedido que hables con su amigo Barachen.","Barachen tiene un pequeño campamento al este de Evendim, en el Bosque de los Trolls."}},
[1557]={nameES="Barad Guldur: Gruesome Relics and Tomes",objectivesES={"Barad Guldur: Gruesome Relics and Tomes","These odd trinkets are sure to interest the Elves","The Malledhrim have asked you and your companions to enter Barad Guldur in an attempt to strike at the heart of the forces of Dol Guldur.","These dusty shelves contain a book that will certainly be of interest to the Elves","Search amongst book-shelves","Anglú awaits you in Barad Guldur.\
\
You should hasten back to Anglú and tell him of your findings throughout the tower.","Search for any curious relics","The relics and tomes of the Necromancer can be found throughout Barad Guldur.\
\
You should keep an eye out for any useful clues or information that will aid the efforts of the Malledhrim as you ascend Barad Guldur.","Talk to Anglú in Barad Guldur","Search for notable objects","This foul tome will surely interest the Elves"}},
[1558]={nameES="Barad Guldur: The Deep Assault",objectivesES={"The Malledhrim have asked you and your companions to enter Barad Guldur in an attempt to strike at the heart of the forces of Dol Guldur.","You have broken through the forces in lower Barad Guldur","Anglú is in Barad Guldur.\
\
You should speak with the Elf-lieutenant Anglú for further instruction on your offensive.","Establish a staging point in Barad Guldur","Talk to Anglú in Barad Guldur","Barad Guldur is the mighty tower at the fortress of Dol Guldur.\
\
Once inside, Belvaer has asked you to sever the flow of enemy reinforcements streaming from the tower. Belvaer seems to think that the captain of the guard should be found soon after beginning your ascent of the tower.","Barad Guldur: The Deep Assault"}},
[1559]={nameES="Barad Guldur: The End of the Nightmare",objectivesES={}},
[1560]={nameES="Barad Nemorn: Morgul Warriors",objectivesES={}},
[1561]={nameES="Barad Nemorn: Statues of the Dark Lord",objectivesES={}},
[1562]={nameES="Barad Nemorn: Troll Teeth",objectivesES={}},
[1563]={nameES="Barad Nemorn: Vile Leaders",objectivesES={}},
[1564]={nameES="Barad Nemorn: Warg Masters",objectivesES={}},
[1565]={nameES="Barad Rill Runs Dark",objectivesES={"You should report your success at Gaerlond to Garvir.\
\
Garvir can be found at Barad Rill.","Garvir has asked you to assist in the cleansing of Gaerlond to the north-east.\
\
Fell creatures have been sighted and are scaring the workers.","Garvir told you that Herion once again needs your help. You should talk to Herion at Parth Rest.\
\
Parth Rest can be found to the north.","The efforts to rebuild the lighthouse have been hindered by the hauntings at Gaerlond.\
\
Gaerlond can be found to the north-east.","Talk to Herion at Parth Rest","Barad Rill Runs Dark","Talk to Garvir"}},
[1566]={nameES="Barad-dûr: Lore of the Past",objectivesES={"Bring the ancient tomes to Candúr","Collect ancient tomes","A wealth of lore awaits those who brave the Bones of Barad-dûr.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Warning: This quest requires Barad-dûr: Realm of the Black Word to be underway. If that quest has been completed or failed, you will be unable to exit and re-enter this instance in order to complete this quest.</rgb>","Bring the ancient tomes to Candúr.","Barad-dûr: Lore of the Past","Collect ancient tomes."}},
[1567]={nameES="Barad-dûr: Realm of the Black Word",objectivesES={"Defeat Kathanûl.","You ran out of time...","Defeat Kathanûl","Talk to Candúr","You should return to Candúr and apprise him of your efforts.","Defeated Kathanûl","A wealth of lore awaits those who brave the Bones of Barad-dûr.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Warning: This quest has a one hour time limit. The timer will begin upon accepting the quest.</rgb>","Barad-dûr: Realm of the Black Word"}},
[1568]={nameES="Barad-dûr: Ruins of Darkness",objectivesES={"Defeat Black Númenóreans in Barad-dûr","A wealth of lore awaits those who brave the Bones of Barad-dûr.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Warning: This quest requires Barad-dûr: Realm of the Black Word to be underway. If that quest has been completed or failed, you will be unable to exit and re-enter this instance in order to complete this quest.</rgb>","Talk to Candúr","Defeat Black Númenóreans in Barad-dûr.","Talk to Candúr.","Barad-dûr: Ruins of Darkness"}},
[1569]={nameES="Barging into the Barracks",objectivesES={"You have safely returned to Nashûbu.\
\
You should talk to Numûru.","Numûru has asked you to assist him with investigating the city guard barracks.\
\
You should talk to Numûru and complete 'Instance: Barging into the Barracks'.","Complete 'Instance: Barging into the Barracks'","Barging into the Barracks","El cuartel de guardias de Emax Dûl aún puede albergar un almacén de armas valiosas.","Talk to Numûru"}},
[1570]={nameES="Barrels Out of Blackroot",objectivesES={"Concerned that goods are being floated south into Tarlang's Crown on the river Blackroot, Gordir seeks to investigate a troubling theft of barrels from Sardol.","Barrels Out of Blackroot","DNT -- will not be seen","Gordir can be found near the river Blackroot to the west of Sardol.\
\
You have recovered as many barrels as you can find, and should now return to Gordir.","Barrels can be found on the shores of the river Blackroot in far south-western of Blackroot Vale.\
\
Gordir has asked you to recover barrels that were stolen from Sardol. He suspects someone has been using the river Blackroot to transport them south into Tarlang's Crown.","Talk to Gordir"}},
[1571]={nameES="Barricading the Homes",objectivesES={"The unprotected crofter homes can be found all around the town of Faldham.\
\
Thurgyr has asked you to place boards across the windows of the unprotected crofter homes in Faldham.","Speak to Thurgyr about the boarded windows","Collect sturdy planks from a wood pile","The wood pile can be found outside of Thurgyr's home.\
\
Thurgyr has asked you to collect planks from the wood pile, in order to help barricade the windows of homes.","You have collected several wooden planks","Barricading the Homes","Thurgyr can be found at his home at the southern edge of Faldham, just outside the mead hall area.\
\
Thurgyr should be pleased to hear that you have helped to protect the homes and families of his neighbours, in preparation for the siege.","Thurgyr has observed that many of the farmsteads around Faldham will be easy to breach for the attacking armies, even with locked doors. He has begun collecting planks of wood for barricading the windows of the homes."}},
[1572]={nameES="Tesoro de los Túmulos — Introducción",objectivesES={"Desde hace mucho, entre la gente de Bree se dice que grandes tesoros permanecen enterrados en los túmulos de las Quebradas de los Túmulos, pero pocos tienen el valor de ir a buscarlos.","Los túmulos están dispersos por las Quebradas de los Túmulos del Norte y del Sur. Tad Cortahoja está en el Pabellón de Caza de Bree, al este de las Quebradas.\
\
Tad Cortahoja te ha pedido que entres en los distintos túmulos de las Quebradas de los Túmulos y recuperes algunos de los tesoros que allí reposan.","Tesoro de los Túmulos — Introducción","Lleva los tesoros de los túmulos a Tad Cortahoja"}},
[1573]={nameES="Maestros arqueros tumularios",objectivesES={"Los muertos ancestrales se han alzado en el Gran Túmulo.","Los maestros arqueros tumularios se pueden encontrar en el ala inundada del Gran Túmulo.","Maestros arqueros tumularios"}},
[1574]={nameES="Tumularios",objectivesES={"Los muertos ancestrales se han alzado en el Gran Túmulo.","Los tumularios se pueden encontrar en el ala inundada del Gran Túmulo.","Tumularios"}},
[1575]={nameES="Bash, Block, and Fang",objectivesES={"Return to Sârwi in Sormedân with his recovered items","Recover Sârwi's wooden shield","You have recovered Sârwi's wooden \\qsword\\q","Sârwi, the young son of Sênjar, has asked you to retrieve his lost toys from the angry bees swarming in Medân Makhai.","Recover Fang","You have recovered Sârwi's wooden shield","Return to Sârwi in Sormedân with his recovered items.","Bash, Block, and Fang","Sârwi, the young son of Sênjar, has asked you to retrieve his sword, shield, and carved lion lost to the angry bees swarming in Medân Makhai. Medân Makhai can be found north-west of Sormedân.","Recover Sârwi's wooden \\qsword\\q","You have recovered Fang"}},
[1576]={nameES="Bat-idols",objectivesES={"Bat-idols","The morroval of Dol Guldur possess many idols in the form of bats.","Merrevail can be found at Sâd-en-Dagor in Dol Guldur, north-east of Helethir.\
\
Stirnir has asked you to collect bat-idols from the merrevail in Dol Guldur."}},
[1577]={nameES="Bats Among the Ruins",objectivesES={"Talk to Mírdiniel at the Haunted Inn","Bats Among the Ruins","Bats lend added protection to the stronghold of the morroval-inhabitants of Dannenglor.","Mírdiniel is at the Haunted Inn in the Dourstocks of Mirkwood, south of Dannenglor.\
\
You should speak with Mírdiniel and tell her of your efforts in dealing with the problem of bat-swarms in the woods.","Ruins-bats can be found in the ruined Elf-stronghold of Dannenglor, north of the Haunted Inn in the Dourstocks.\
\
Mírdiniel has asked you to defeat several bats in Dannenglor when you venture next into the wilds of the Dourstocks."}},
[1578]={nameES="Battle For the Upper Reaches",objectivesES={"Talk to Hetbrúda at Gazathrug's outpost","Talk to Hetbrúda at Zidir-nesad","Talk to Voina at Zidir-nesad","Zidir-nesad, the Steepset, can be found in the western part of Máttugard.\
