[1586]={nameES="Battle Task: Ultimate Slaughter",objectivesES={"Battle Task: Ultimate Slaughter","Battle in the Ettenmoors rages! You are called to slaughter the enemy in great numbers.","Speak with War-tyrant Akúlhun","Do your part in the battle. Slay the Free People where they are found and earn your place in the army of Angmar!","Brag to War-tyrant Akúlhun of your glorious efforts","Make your way into the Ettenmoors and slaughter all the Free People you find."}},
