[1599]={nameES="Battle for Hamât, Part 1",objectivesES={"Speak with Sârgud, the blacksmith in Iridír.","Battle for Hamât, Part 1","Speak with Girhâzi and Amalíbi in Iridír.","Bring the ore to Sârgud in Iridír","Speak with Sârgud, the blacksmith in Iridír","Speak with Amalíbi outside Iridír, in her encampment","Speak with Mizâdi in Iridír","Speak with Girhâzi in Iridír","Speak with Mizâdi in Iridír.","Bring the ore to Sârgud in Iridír.","Having found Bârshud's new location, the formidable fortress of Dun Shûma in Khud Zagin, Mizâdi asks you to gather supplies and help rally the local people for one last assault to rid Shagâna of Bârshud for good.","Gather ore for Sârgud in the hills north-east of Iridír.","Bring the supplies and shields to Numûru in Iridír.","Gather shields from Sârgud, the local blacksmith.","Bring the supplies and shields to Numûru in Iridír","Gather supplies and provisions from around Iridír."}},
[1600]={nameES="Battle for Hamât, Part 2",objectivesES={"Speak with Mizâdi in Khûd Zagin on the hilltop","Journey to Khûd Zagin and meet with Mizâdi outside of Dun Shûma","Mizâdi has tracked Bârshud to the fortress of Dun Shûma in Khûd Zagin. The time has come to meet Bârshud in pitched battle and defeat him for good.","Journey to Khûd Zagin and meet with Mizâdi outside of Bârshud's fortress, Dun Shûma.","Speak with Mizâdi in Khûd Zagin on the hilltop outside of Dun Shûma.","Speak with Mizâdi outside of Bârshud's fortress, Dun Shûma when you are ready to go.","Battle for Hamât, Part 2","Speak with Mizâdi when you are ready to go"}},
[1601]={nameES="Battle for Hamât, Part 3",objectivesES={"Push into Dun Shûma and end the threat of Bârshud!","Speak with Mizâdi in Dun Shûma","Battle for Hamât, Part 3","Speak with Mizâdi to begin the assault.","Speak with Mizâdi in Dun Shûma in Khûd Zagin.","Speak with Mizâdi to begin the assault"}},
[1602]={nameES="Battle for Maurûsh",objectivesES={"Speak with Galâmka","Speak with Galâmka about the battle.","The preparations are complete and Galâmka is ready to begin the battle to retake Maurûsh.","The time has come to fight for Maurûsh and retake the stronghold from the Orcs. All the preparations are complete and Galâmka is ready to lead the charge.","Battle for Maurûsh","Speak with Galâmka when you are ready to begin"}},
[1603]={nameES="Battle of Dol Baran: Bravely Fallen",objectivesES={"Rescue injured Rohirrim (0/4)","Rescued injured Rohirrim (4/4)","Rescued injured Rohirrim (3/4)","The Dunlendings relentlessly harry the Rohirrim soldiers atop Dol Baran, affording them little chance to rest or recover their wounded. Several soldiers lie upon the battlefield, seemingly beyond aid.","Wounded Rohirrim warriors lie atop Dol Baran, beyond the Rohirrim encampment.\
\
Captain Féarn has asked you to rescue injured Rohirrim warriors atop Dol Baran.","Captain Féarn can be found atop Dol Baran.\
\
You should return to Captain Féarn with tidings of your victory.","Rescued injured Rohirrim (2/4)","Rescue injured Rohirrim (1/4)","Talk to Captain Féarn atop Dol Baran","Rescue injured Rohirrim (2/4)","Rescued injured Rohirrim (1/4)","Rescue injured Rohirrim (3/4)","Battle of Dol Baran: Bravely Fallen"}},
[1604]={nameES="Battle of Dol Baran: Minding the Fort",objectivesES={"Battle of Dol Baran: Minding the Fort","Captain Féarn is atop Dol Baran.\
\
You should inform Captain Féarn of your victory.","The Dunlendings assaulting Dol Baran have set the makeshift fortifications alight.","Talk to Captain Féarn atop Dol Baran","Dunlendings are assaulting the barricades atop Dol Baran.\
\
Captain Féarn has asked you to defeat the Dunlending warriors by the barricades atop Dol Baran."}},
[1605]={nameES="Battle of Dol Baran: Testing our Strength",objectivesES={"Captain Féarn awaits your return atop Dol Baran.\
\
You should bring Captain Féarn news of your success.","The Dunlendings are mounting a series of attacks upon the hill-top of Dol Baran in an attempt to test the resolve of the Rohirrim defenders.","Talk to Captain Féarn","Battle of Dol Baran: Testing our Strength","Dunlending warriors can be found near the barricades atop Dol Baran.\
\
Grimbold has asked you to defeat Dunlending warriors by the barricades atop Dol Baran."}},
[1606]={nameES="Batalla del Camino Profundo - Incursión",objectivesES={"Completa 'Batalla del Camino Profundo' en un grupo de incursión","Batalla del Camino Profundo - Incursión","Defended el Camino Profundo frente a la embestida de los orcos, es el pasaje que conecta La Gran Excavación con las Obras Hidráulicas."}},
[1607]={nameES="Batalla de bolas de nieve (fácil)",objectivesES={"El campo de batalla de bolas de nieve se enuentra al sur de Farol Escarchado.\
\
Debes entrar en el campo de batalla.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>ATENCIÓN: Solo puedes participar en la batalla de bolas de nieve dentro de los límites del terreno desginado para ella.</rgb>","Entra en el campo de batalla de bolas de nieve","Este asalto ha terminado. Pronto empezará otra, y podrás continuar con la batalla.","(Haz clic derecho en las bolas de nieve para atacar a los objetivos seleccionados.)","Espera a que empiece la batalla de bolas de nieve","Batalla de bolas de nieve (fácil)","Te han desafiado a superar a los más habilidosos adversarios en la gran batalla de bolas de nieve en los campos de Risco Invernal.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro cuando finalice el festival actual.</rgb>","Debes esperar a que comience la batalla en el interior de los límites del campo de juego.","Puedes empezar a lanzar bolas de nieve a tus enemigos.","Ahora debes esperar a que la batalla comience","Puedes hacer bolas de nieve utilizando los montones de nieve repartidos por todo el campo de batalla. Aparecerán en tu inventario y serán destuidas cuando las lances a otro jugador.\
\
Debes recoger bolas de nieve y atacar a tus adversarios.","No has llegado al campo de batalla al tiempo. La siguiente ronda empezará en breve."}},
