[1617]={nameES="Bazanmanar's Foetid Pools",objectivesES={"The foetid pools are located near Bazanmanar.\
\
Golodhril has asked you to add drops of the antidote to the foetid pools.","Collect clay from Kurdushâlak","Bring the clay to Golodhril","Golodhril is located in Bazanmanar.\
