[1647]={nameES="Beasts of the Wyrmsgráf",objectivesES={}},
[1648]={nameES="Beating Back Brigands",objectivesES={"Return to Megorneth","Beating Back Brigands","With its defender lost at war, Munadhor Farm in Pinnath Gelin has been overrun by beasts and brigands.","You should let Megorneth know that you have defeated many Corsairs at Munadhor Farm.\
\
Megorneth is at Munadhor Farm in Pinnath Gelin.","Megorneth has asked you to drive away thieves who have come to plunder her farm.\
\
Corsairs can be found at Munadhor Farm."}},
[1649]={nameES="Ramo Hermoso — Opcional",objectivesES={"Entrega algunas flores a Star","Entrega las flores a los perros de Grimbeorn","Entrega algunas flores a Bud","Entrega algunas flores a Sprout","Recoge todas las flores necesarias para crear el ramo perfecto para el Beorninghús.","Entrega algunas flores a Rose","Ramo Hermoso — Opcional"}},
[1650]={nameES="Beautifying the Walk",objectivesES={}},
[1651]={nameES="La belleza de la tierra",objectivesES={"Habla con Brungos al noreste","Encuentra el lugar elegido por Ravaedron, justo al este de Thelgarth y bajo la colina sobre la que se alzan las ruinas","Ravaedron ha elegido un lugar justo al este de Thelgarth, bajo la colina sobre la que se alzan las ruinas, para pintar su regalo para Maddoc y Glenys Astaciervo.","Habla con Ravaedron en el lugar que ha elegido para pintar","Brungos y tú habéis defendido con éxito a Ravaedron desde esta dirección","Ravaedron te ha pedido que rastrees las orillas de los ríos que rodean y atraviesan el Ángulo en busca de piedras de pigmento adecuadas para hacer pinturas y tintes.","Demúr ha accedido a ayudarte a rechazar cualquier amenaza que pueda estorbar a Ravaedron mientras pinta, y te está esperando al suroeste.","Ravaedron te ha pedido que te reúnas con él a las afueras de Thelgarth, las ruinas situadas en lo alto de la colina más meridional del Ángulo, cuando encontraras suficientes piedras de pigmento.","La belleza de la tierra","Llévale las piedras de pigmento a Ravaedron, dentro de Thelgarth","Habla con Ravaedron al este de Thelgarth","Ravaedron ha tenido una revelación y ahora sabe cómo arreglar las cosas con sus amigos los Astaciervo antes de abandonar la Tierra Media.","Habla con Demúr al suroeste","Brungos ha accedido a ayudarte a rechazar cualquier amenaza que pueda estorbar a Ravaedron mientras pinta, y te está esperando al noreste.","Demúr y tú habéis defendido con éxito a Ravaedron desde esta dirección","Ravaedron se encuentra al este de Thelgarth y bajo sus ruinas.","Ravaedron ha empezado a pintar su regalo para Maddoc y Glenys Astaciervo, al este de Thelgarth.","Ravaedron está pintando un regalo para Maddoc y Glenys Astaciervo al este de Thelgarth y bajo sus ruinas."}},
[1652]={nameES="Because I Said So",objectivesES={"Bog-reeds be found the north-east area of the Dunbog. Nye is also encamped in the north-east Dunbog.\
\
Nye has intimidated you into fetching him more bog-reeds for bow-strings.","Talk to Nye at the scouts' camp","Because I Said So","The scouts of the Dunbog have tasked you with several gathering exercises. Nye specifically does not like you and has instructed you to do his task for him."}},
[1653]={nameES="Convirtiéndose en una espina",objectivesES={"Kósikul derrotado","Derrota a Kósikul","Tu misión es sabotear las máquinas de asedio que se han descubierto en un campamento de Ekhamâti cercano y eliminar a cualquier soldado que intente detenerte.","Convirtiéndose en una espina"}},
[1654]={nameES="Becoming a Tree-bearer",objectivesES={"Becoming a Tree-bearer","Speak with Thórvilon in Vartúlin","Go to the edge of Vartúlin then march north around the rock formation","Speak with Culvair the grove-tender in Vartúlin","Speak with Thórvilon in Vartúlin.","Thórvilon has given you the honour of being a tree-bearer for the Adúrhid. You are to transplant the first young tree saplings into the greater forests of Adagím.","Collect rich soil from around Vartúlin.","Speak with Culvair the grove-tender in Vartúlin.","Plant the young tree saplings in the forest just outside Vartúlin.","Go to the where the forest of Favrathór meets the edge of Vartúlin. Go to the edge of Vartúlin then march east and north around the rock formation. Plant the tree saplings there.","Go to Ulthral's nursery and carefully remove tree saplings for planting in the greater forest.","This seems the perfect place to plant these saplings"}},
[1655]={nameES="Chinches",objectivesES={"Examina la cama de Gamli","Gamli se encuentra en el campamento del Umbral de Durin.\
\
Deberías hablar con Gamli acerca de lo que encontraste en su cama.","Has encontrado insectos en la cama de Gamli","Habla con Gamli","La cama de Gamli se encuentra en el campamento del Umbral de Durin.\
\
Gamli parece preocupado por la posibilidad de que algo se esté escondiendo en su cama.","Chinches","Gamli el enano teme que algo pueda estar ocultándose entre sus mantas."}},
[1656]={nameES="Bedbugs Bite",objectivesES={"You replaced the first horse's bedding","Replace the bedding of the third horse","Talk to Éogar and inform him the bedding has been replaced","Replace the bedding of the first horse","The hay-piles can be found at Hengstacer Farm, in the field north of the stables.","Éogar can always use more help on his farm, and today he needs the hay for the horse's bedding replaced.","You replaced the fourth horse's bedding","That was not the right one...","You replaced the third horse's bedding","That was not the right one....","Billy, Bobby, Lizzie, and Henry are finicky about who gets attention first. They must be cared for in the right order.\
\
Éogar's old hay-fork is well worn and can be used on the dirty hay only so often before it breaks.","Replace the bedding of the fourth horse","Replace the bedding of the second horse","You replaced the second horse's bedding","Bedbugs Bite","Éogar may be found at Hengstacer Farm in the Horse-fields of Bree-land."}},
[1657]={nameES="Bedding of Bears",objectivesES={}},
[1658]={nameES="Bedraggled Dwarves",objectivesES={"Elgur is located in Amdân.\
\
You should return to Elgur.","The Haban’akkâ have been at war and away from home for months. Simple acts can do much to improve morale.","Bedraggled dwarves can be found in Amdân.\
\
You should distribute bone combs to bedraggled dwarves.","Return to Elgur","Bedraggled Dwarves"}},
[1659]={nameES="La gran tarea de las abejas",objectivesES={"Poliniza los grandes lirios de Lossarnach.","Comprueba si las abejas están listas para continuar.","<rgb=#FF0000>¡Debe sobrevivir al menos un gran lirio de Lossarnach!</rgb>","Escolta a las abejas de vuelta con Grimbeorn","Comprueba si las abejas están listas para partir","Poliniza el segundo campo de flores.","Comprueba si las abejas están listas para continuar","Habla con Grimbeorn.","Comprueba si las abejas están listas para volver con Grimbeorn","Comprueba si las abejas están listas para partir.","La gran tarea de las abejas","Escolta a las abejas de vuelta con Grimbeorn.","<rgb=#FF0000>¡Las abejas de Grimbeorn deben terminar su tarea!</rgb>","Poliniza los grandes lirios de Lossarnach","Grimbeorn y sus perros se quedarán aquí mientras ayudas a las abejas a orientarse por el bosque","Comprueba si las abejas están listas para volver con Grimbeorn.","Habla con Grimbeorn","<rgb=#FF0000>¡Se han comido un gran lirio de Lossarnach!</rgb>","<rgb=#FF0000>¡Una abeja se ha rendido!</rgb>","Poliniza el segundo campo de flores","Poliniza el primer campo de flores"}},
[1660]={nameES="El Gran Negocio de las Abejas — Diaria",objectivesES={"Completa 'El Gran Negocio de las Abejas'","El Gran Negocio de las Abejas — Diaria","Un juego diario: ¡la primavera es sencillamente maravillosa!"}},
[1661]={nameES="Bees' Big Breakfast",objectivesES={}},
[1662]={nameES="Beetles Among the Vines",objectivesES={"You should let Nordach know that you have helped to clear the Winbury vineyards of beetles.\
\
Nordach is at Winbury.","Talk to Nordach","Nordach seems to know where Igerna is, but won't share the information until you have helped clear his vineyards of an infestation of beetles.\
\
You should defeat beetles at Winbury, in northern Pinnath Gelin.","The vineyards of Pinnath Gelin are renowned for producing the finest wines and spirits. One of this year's delicate crops is playing host to a most unwelcome guest.","Beetles Among the Vines","Lúmar has asked you to search for signs of Igerna and speak to Nordach at Winbury.\
\
Winbury is in northern Pinnath Gelin.","Return to Nordach"}},
[1663]={nameES="Before They Become a Problem",objectivesES={}},
[1664]={nameES="Before the Battle Plain",objectivesES={"Countless members of the Host of the West are camped nearby...","Habla con Aragorn","Before the Battle Plain","Talk to Mithrandir at Aragorn's camp","Aragorn can be found in his encampment on the border of Dagorlad.\
\
You have spoken to Damrod and Mithrandir and should now speak to Aragorn.","Travel to Aragorn's camp on the border of Dagorlad","After securing the lands of Ithilien, the time has come to rejoin the Host of the West at their encampment on the border of Dagorlad, the battle plain.","Aragorn's camp can be found far to the north of Henneth Annûn on the southern border of Dagorlad.\
\
Anborn has asked you to rejoin Aragorn and the Host of the West at his encampment to the north.","Talk to Damrod at Aragorn's camp","Mithrandir and Damrod can be found within Aragorn's encampment on the border of Dagorlad.\
\
You have arrived at Aragorn's encampment and should now speak to your allies."}},
[1665]={nameES="Before the Heart of Darkness",objectivesES={"Before the Heart of Darkness","Search Aufaltor for signs of Nidhlas and his men","As Mithrandir begins his study of Thuringwath, you begin your search for the lost Rangers of Ithilien.","The footprints continue along the old roadway through Thuringwath.\
\
You discovered footprints on the old roadway through Thuringwath. You should follow them.","Mithrandir can be found near Aufaltor in Thuringwath.\
\
You have found Mithrandir standing before a great watching-stone in Thuringwath. You should tell Mithrandir what you have found.","You should examine the heap of discarded flesh.\
\
You discovered the Rangers slain from bloodletting, but a heap of flesh has caught your eye. You should examine it.","This flesh has been flensed from a Man, but the body is nowhere to be found","Aufaltor can be found in Thuringwath.\
\
You have followed the footprints to the base of a great fane. You should search the fane for Nidhlas and his men.","Examine the slain Rangers in Aufaltor","Nidhlas and his men might be found somewhere in Thuringwath.\
\
Mithrandir has asked you to continue ahead in search of Nidhlas and his men.","These Rangers have been bled, but a sickening heap of flesh catches your eye","Mithrandir stands transfixed before a great watching-stone in the form of a balrog","Examine the heap of flesh","Search for signs of Nidhlas and his men in Thuringwath","Slain Rangers can be found deep within Aufaltor.\
\
You have discovered a number of slain Rangers within Aufaltor. You should examine them.","Follow the footprints deeper into Thuringwath","Talk to Mithrandir","You notice footprints on the old roadway through Thuringwath","The footprints lead to the foundations of a great, deathly fane...","Mithrandir can be found in Thuringwath.\
\
You found a grisly scene at Aufaltor. You should return to Mithrandir.","Return to Mithrandir","The footprints continue along the old roadway through Thuringwath","You have discovered a number of slain Rangers in the depths of Aufaltor"}},
