[1672]={nameES="Befriending Critters: Get One's Goat",objectivesES={"You give a tasty treat to the goat!","Give a tasty treat to a Bindbole kid","Give a tasty treat to a Hollin Ridge goat","Speak with Radagast","Give a tasty treat to a Brandy Hills billy","Now what do we have here?","Da una golosina a una cabra del Páramo Alto","Radagast the Brown asks you help him rescue goats and bring them back to the safety of Rhosgobel.","Radagast can be found in Rhosgobel.\
\
You should speak with Radagast.","Befriending Critters: Get One's Goat","Goats can be found all over Middle-earth.\
\
Rescue goats using Radagast's calming treats.","Give a tasty treat to a Lune River goat","You give a tasty treat to the goat to calm him down!"}},
[1673]={nameES="Befriending Critters: Hop to it",objectivesES={}},
[1674]={nameES="Befriending a Behemoth",objectivesES={"You are finding it very difficult to befriend a young mûmak. Try again to use the Mûmak Trainers' Horn on young mûmakil at the Spent-lodes, and bring one back with you to Khanâg Gur.","Pick up the Mûmak Trainers' Horn","Oh, bother","Talk to Namâdi at Khanâg Gur","This is ridiculous...","Not again!","Go to the Spent-lodes","You are finding it difficult to befriend a young mûmak. Try again to use the Mûmak Trainers' Horn on young mûmakil at the Spent-lodes, and bring one back with you to Khanâg Gur.","Namâdi has asked you to use her Mûmak Trainers' Horn to train a young mûmak and bring it back to her at Khanâg Gur. You should use the horn on one of the young mûmakil.","That did not go as planned","Namâdi has recently come into possession of a horn that Ordâkhai Gânda use to direct and control mûmakil.","Uh oh...","<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: You must slot the horn as a skill. To do so, drag the 'Mûmak Trainers' Horn' item from your inventory to your skill bar. You then use the skill on a Young Mûmak to advance the quest.</rgb>","Try again to use the Mûmak Trainers' Horn on young mûmakil at the Spent-lodes, and bring one back with you to Khanâg Gur.","Try again to befriend a young mûmak using the horn","Befriend a young mûmak using the horn","This is Erakúndo, the Spent-lodes","You begin to wonder if it is even possible to befriend a young mûmak. Try again to use the Mûmak Trainers' Horn on young mûmakil at the Spent-lodes, and bring one back with you to Khanâg Gur.","Oh no...","Namâdi has asked you to use her Mûmak Trainers' Horn to train a young mûmak and bring it back to her at Khanâg Gur. You should go to the Spent-lodes in southern An Shêru.","Try once again to use the Mûmak Trainers' Horn on young mûmakil at the Spent-lodes, and bring one back with you to Khanâg Gur.","Namâdi has asked you to use her Mûmak Trainers' Horn to train a young mûmak and bring it back to her at Khanâg Gur. You should pick up the horn from atop the wall next to her.","Try once more to befriend a young mûmak using the horn","Befriending a Behemoth","You're pretty sure it is impossible to befriend a young mûmak by just using the Mûmak Trainers' Horn."}},
[1675]={nameES="Befriending the Beltáni",objectivesES={"Unusâli has decided she will not trust you until you prove yourself to the Beltáni.\
\
You should complete three quests in Ahâba to prove yourself.","The Beltáni chieftain, Unusâli, does not trust outsiders easily. She asks you to help the people of Ahâba with their work to prove yourself to her.","Unusâli has heard of your work for the Beltáni and is pleased.\
\
You should talk to Unusâli in Ahâba.","Befriending the Beltáni","Talk to Unusâli"}},
[1676]={nameES="Titanes aturdidos",objectivesES={"Habla con Lithuifin en las Agujas de la Linde","Titanes aturdidos","Ayuda a Remmenylf en Amon Môth","Ayuda a Lithuifin en Amon Môth","Los elfos tienen alguna idea de cómo aliviar el dolor de Ramalarga.","Ayuda a Erchiel en Amon Môth","Lithuifin está en las Agujas de la Linde.\
\
Lithuifin tiene un plan para expulsar a los gigantes para siempre.","Los gigantes que acampan en las orillas occidentales del lago son nuevos en Evendim."}},
[1677]={nameES="Behead the Snake",objectivesES={"Return to Dabôr the Breaker in Hulzidâr and inform him of Umâr's demise and the recovery of the journal.","Deep within Harkhaphâr, the Nêpharai are led by Umâr. Seek him out and defeat him.","Locate Umâr within Harkhaphâr and defeat him.","Return to Dabôr the Breaker in Hulzidâr and present him with the journal","Defeat Umâr","Behead the Snake","When Umâr falls, he leaves behind a small bound journal"}},
[1678]={nameES="Tras las rejas",objectivesES={"Talk to Dagoras at Echad Dagoras","Braigiar's companion Dagoras has been captured by the Dunlending deserters after going to negotiate an agreement with them.","Tras las rejas","Rescue Dagoras from Lhe Lhechu","Dagoras is being held in Lhe Lhechu, south-west of Echad Dagoras.\
\
You must free Dagoras and escort him from the Dunlending camp.","Dagoras ia at Echad Dagoras, north-east of Lhe Lhechu.\
\
You should speak with Dagoras at his encampment."}},
[1679]={nameES="Detrás de las Cascadas",objectivesES={"Explora la cascada del sur","Explora la cascada del noroeste","Lleva la alfarería a Drudwen","Explora la cascada del sudeste","Este esqueleto parece demasiado grande para ser de un hobbit","Las cascadas en el tranquilo pueblo de Clegur y sus alrededores pueden ocultar secretos.","Explora la cascada detrás del puente","La cascada atronadora no te permitirá avanzar más","Drudwen te ha pedido que explores las cascadas en Clegur y sus alrededores.\
\
Clegur se encuentra en el suroeste de la Ciénaga de los Cisnes.","Nada más que rocas y agua atronadora","Explora la cascada del este","Las rocas sobresalen detrás de la cascada rugiente","Explora la cascada del noreste","Has encontrado una pieza de alfarería antigua","Las rocas afiladas parecen ser lo único que hay aquí","Detrás de las Cascadas","Deberías informar a Drudwen con la alfarería y las noticias del esqueleto que encontraste detrás de las cascadas.\
\
Drudwen se encuentra en el pueblo de Clegur, en el sur de la Ciénaga de los Cisnes."}},
[1680]={nameES="Cumpleaños tardío",objectivesES={"Entrega el regalo a Frodo en Rivendel","Frodo Bolsón y su primo Bilbo -- aunque lo llama tío -- comparten el mismo cumpleaños, pero no han podido celebrarlo juntos durante diecisiete años.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu bitácora de misiones cuando termine el festival actual. </rgb>","Cumpleaños tardío","Frodo Bolsón está en la habitación de Bilbo en la planta baja de la Última Morada, en Rivendel.\
\
Bilbo Bolsón te ha pedido que le lleves un regalo de cumpleaños a Frodo a cambio.","Bilbo Bolsón está en el Salón del Fuego en la Última Morada, en Rivendel.\
\
Frodo Bolsón te ha pedido que le des las gracias a Bilbo por su regalo.","Entrega el regalo a Bilbo Bolsón","Bilbo Bolsón está en el Salón del Fuego en la Última Morada en Rivendel.\
\
Frodo Bolsón te ha pedido que le entregues un regalo de cumpleaños atrasado a Bilbo."}},
[1681]={nameES="El Texto de Belco",objectivesES={"Texto fundacional recuperado","Después de ayudarle en la granja, Belco Tejonera por fin le ha dado la copia del Texto fundacional de la Comarca que encontró entre las cosas de su madre.","Lleva el Texto fundacional a Brombard Colazorro","El Texto de Belco","Recupera el Texto fundacional","Brombard Colazorro está en la Casa de los Mathoms en Cavada Grande.\
\
Satisfecho con sus servicios, Belco Tejonera le ha exhortado a llevar su copia del Texto fundacional directamente al guardián Brombard Colazorro. No quiere que este documento acabe en manos de Adelard Tuk."}},
[1682]={nameES="Bells of Wrath",objectivesES={"You should return to Gaumar, who stands within the Great-keep in Dale.","Those discontented with the newly-arrived refugees have been leaving angry scrawls throughout Dale.","Bells of Wrath","Return to Gaumar","You should find angry scrawls on walls and doors throughout Dale and remove them."}},
[1683]={nameES="Las pertenencias se fueron de pesca",objectivesES={"Has recuperado la capa","Has recuperado la caña de pescar","Mosco Madriguera se encuentra en el estanque de Delagua, esperando que regreses con sus pertenencias encontradas.\
\
Deberías devolverle sus pertenencias a Mosco.","Has recuperado la comida perdida","Encuentra la caña de pescar de Mosco","Encuentra la capa de Mosco","Mosco Madriguera asegura haber enganchado el pez más grande que había visto jamás, pero al ser arrastrado de un extremo del estanque al otro, perdió su equipo de pesca y otras pertenencias por el camino. ¡Y para colmo, el pez consiguió escapar!\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando finalice el festival actual.</rgb>","Encuentra la azada de Mosco","Encuentra la comida de las once de Mosco","Lleva los objetos encontrados a Mosco Madriguera","Encuentra el cebo de la suerte de Mosco","Las pertenencias se fueron de pesca","Has recuperado la azada","Has recuperado el cebo de la suerte","Las pertenencias perdidas de Mosco están esparcidas por los alrededores del estanque y la zona cercana. Si lees la nota que te dio, quizá encuentres pistas sobre el paradero exacto de su equipo.\
\
Deberías reunir las pertenencias perdidas de Mosco y devolvérselas."}},
[1684]={nameES="Below the Dáinlik",objectivesES={"The Dáinlik can be found in the Ironfold.\
\
You should look out over the top of the Dáinlik.","The Dáinlik can be found in the Ironfold.\
\
You should investigate the base of the Dáinlik.","The strange creature has been defeated","This is a good place to <rgb=#FF0000>look</rgb> out over the Dáinlik","Rísti Graver can be found atop of the Dáinlik.\
\
You should talk to Rísti Graver.","Workers at the Dáinlik have seen shadowy things in the hills.","Talk to Rísti Graver","Nothing seems odd below, perhaps a closer inspection of the Dáinlik's base is in order","A shadowy creature attacks from a small crevasse at the base of the axe!","Investigate the base of the Dáinlik","Below the Dáinlik","<rgb=#FF0000>Look</rgb> out from atop the Dáinlik"}},
[1685]={nameES="Beneath Watchful Eyes",objectivesES={"One of Arcah's ravens can be found at the Rushgate.\
\
After speaking with the raven, Dori has learned that the other two ravens sent from Ravenhill have not returned. You should search for one of the ravens near the Rushgate.","The slain, frozen raven can be found on the ground before Stánbalk, the Stone Wall.\
\
You have found the frozen remains of a raven before Stánbalk, the Stone Wall. You should examine it.","The broken form of a raven lies frozen on the ground before Stánbalk...","Find the lost raven near Thikil-gundu","Dori and Company have stopped upon an overlook before Thikil-gundu...","Without so much as a croak, the raven takes flight...","Dori can be found on a hilltop overlooking Stánbalk, the Stone Wall of Thikil-gundu.\
\
You have found Dori and Company along the road to Thikil-gundu. You should now speak to Dori.","After discovering one of Arcah's ravens near to Óinsbridge, Dori and Company must now deal with unexpected threats if they are to make it to Thikil-gundu.","Search for the lost raven near the Rushgate","One of Arcah's ravens can be found at the Rushgate.\
\
You have found the raven at the Rushgate. You should now follow the road to Thikil-gundu to the east and rejoin Dori and Company.","Dori can be found somewhere along the road to Thikil-gundu.\
\
The raven has flown from the Rushgate. You should now find Dori and Company along the road to Thikil-gundu.","Gundabad black-arrows can be found along the Men Angrún, especially as it nears the Rushgate.\
\
The raven told Dori that cruel archers of Gundabad have been taking ravens' feathers for their arrows. You should defeat them and take their arrows.","Beneath Watchful Eyes","Talk to Dori on the road to Thikil-gundu","Examine the frozen raven, but remain on guard","Dori can be found on a hilltop overlooking Stánbalk, the Stone Wall of Thikil-gundu.\
\
You have learned that one of Arcah's ravens was slain by a cold-drake. You should return to Dori.","Deliver the raven-fletched arrows to Dori on the road to Thikil-gundu","A noticeably-agitated raven perches atop the crumbled stones of the Rushgate...","The raven perches silently....","You notice the raven's feathers are matted and frozen, but your attention is soon drawn skyward...","Direct the raven to fly to Dori and Company along the road to Thikil-gundu","The lost raven can be found somewhere near Stánbalk, the Stone Wall.\
\
Dori has asked you to seek the raven that flew near to Thikil-gundu.","Follow the road to Thikil-gundu and and find Dori and Company"}},
[1686]={nameES="Beneath the Earth",objectivesES={}},
[1687]={nameES="Beneath the Eaves",objectivesES={"Search the path to the ruins of Hadhodiant","Search the Old Ford","Examinar al orco muerto.","The road into the Beorning-lands can be found by following the road north from Hultvís.\
\
You found no sign of Hárskor or that he crossed the Old Ford. You should continue to follow the road north toward the Beorning-lands and search for Hárskor at the path to the ruins of Hadhodiant.","Search the crossway to the old forest road","The slain Orc can be found on the side of the road through Woodsedge near the path to the ruins of Hadhodiant.\
\
You have discovered the mauled remains of an Orc near the path to the ruins of Hadhodiant. You should examine its corpse before continuing your search.","His hair matted with black blood, Hárskor looms over a group of slain Orcs","The source of the scent can be found somewhere around the crossway to the old forest road.\
\
You searched the crossway to the old forest road as Ríkmar suggested, but found no sign of Hárskor. However, you notice a curious scent lingering in the air.","The Old Ford can be found far to the north-west of Hultvís.\
\
You found no sign of Hárskor at the crossway, but you learned that Orcs are trapping the roads in Woodsedge. You should continue to the next location that Ríkmar marked on your map: the Old Ford.","A honey-cake? As you pause to examine it, a sudden rustling betrays an ambush!","Ríkmar of the Woodmen has grown fearful that Hárskor and the provisions he bore have fallen into the hands of Orcs still lurking in Woodsedge.","Find the source of the scent at the crossway","You find no sign of Hárskor, but the scent of honey lingers in the air...","Follow the path to the ruins of Hadhodiant","The mauled Orc has been rent by countless claw marks and deep gashes","Hárskor can be found at the ruins of Hadhodiant.\
\
You have found Hárskor alive, if battle-weary, at the ruins of Hadhodiant. You should speak to him and learn what has happened.","You find no evidence that a waggon has passed across the Old Ford...","Beneath the Eaves","Talk to Hárskor at the ruins of Hadhodiant","The path to the ruins of Hadhodiant can be found in north-west Woodsedge.\
\
You discovered a slain Orc at the foot of the path to the ruins of Hadhodiant. Its wounds were deep and not unlike those made by a skin-changer. You should follow the path to the ruins of the old bridge and search for Hárskor.","You notice a slain Orc lying on the side of the road","The crossway to the old forest road can be found by following the road to the north of Hultvís.\
\
Ríkmar has suggested that you begin your search for Hárskor at the crossway to the old forest road."}},
[1688]={nameES="Beneath the Fold",objectivesES={"Nothing seems amiss as workers continue their efforts to clear debris","The shrieking ceases","Habla con Náin","Rísti Graver can be found at the Dáinlik in the Ironfold, while Aflur Smokebeard can be found at Hammerstead in the Ironfold.\
\
You should talk to Rísti Graver and Aflur Smokebeard.","Complete Below the Dáinlik","Investigate the eastern mine entrance","Talk to Rísti Graver","Investigate the entrances to the mine within Járnfast.","Investigate the southern mine entrance","Whispers through the Ironfold speak of rumblings beneath the ground and strange shadows lurking just out of sight.","Shrieking sounds surround you as a nameless beast leaps over the palisade","Complete Rumblings at Hammerstead","Talk to Aflur Smokebeard","Beneath the Fold","Náin can be found in Járnfast.\
\
You should return to Náin."}},
[1689]={nameES="Bajo el Árbol de la Horca",objectivesES={"Ted Abrojos se encuentra al este de Combe.\
\
Ted Abrojos te envió a recuperar el botín de su padre de debajo del Árbol de la Horca, pero descubriste que el árbol, entre otros, fue talado por los leñadores de Combe. Cavaste en varios lugares del campo, pero no encontraste señales del tesoro enterrado de Abrojos.","Encuentra el Árbol de la Horca","Aunque no hay forma de saber cuál tocón fue alguna vez el Árbol de la Horca, no estaría mal cavar cerca de algunos tocones en busca del tesoro.","El Árbol de la Horca está junto a la orilla del río al sur del puesto de la condestable Wren, al sureste de Combe.\
\
El padre de Ted Abrojos fue un ladrón en el bosque de Chet y supuestamente acumuló una gran riqueza. Ted cree que las ganancias mal habidas de su padre están enterradas al pie del Árbol de la Horca, que debería estar marcado con una X.","El bosque ha sido despejado","Ted Abrojos se ha quedado casi sin dinero y en una situación desesperada. Sin embargo, el rumor sobre la riqueza robada de su padre le ha dado algo de esperanza.","No encuentras nada de interés cerca de este tocón","Bajo el Árbol de la Horca","Lleva la piqueta de vuelta a Ted Abrojos"}},
[1690]={nameES="Beneath the Snake",objectivesES={}},
[1691]={nameES="Beórnida: La llegada repentina",objectivesES={"Habla con Hundi en Echad Dúnann","Tras un viaje de muchas leguas, has llegado a los Muros de Moria. ¿Cómo reaccionarán los enanos ante tu llegada repentina? No fueron especialmente amistosos con Beorn ni con nadie de su estirpe.","Beórnida: La llegada repentina","Hundi se encuentra en el campamento de Echad Dúnann, fuera de los Muros de Moria, en Eregion."}},
[1692]={nameES="Bereavement",objectivesES={}},
[1693]={nameES="Bayas",objectivesES={"Vuelve a ver al rascacuevas hambriento","Este rascacuevas parece hambriento. Deberías recoger bayas para él.","El rascacuevas parece menos hambriento.","Recoge bayas en el campo de tesoros para el rascacuevas hambriento.","Bayas","Recoge bayas para el rascacuevas hambriento.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> NOTA: Esta misión será eliminada de tu registro de misiones cuando termine el festival en curso. </rgb>","El rascacuevas todavía parece hambriento."}},
[1694]={nameES="Bert Tiene una Palabra",objectivesES={"Bingo está en Forlaw, al oeste del Salón de los Festines de Forlaw.","Habla con el guardia de Forlaw en la puerta oeste","Lleva los diversos artículos a Bert Bartolín en Forlaw","Bert Tiene una Palabra","Habla con Hunfredo Rebuscón en la ciudad de Dunfast","El sabio fue visto por última vez cerca de la puerta oeste de Forlaw.\
\
Bert Bartolín te pidió encontrar al sabio que llegó a Forlaw y comprarle algunas pociones y pergaminos.","Bert Bartolín está junto a los establos de Forlaw, en las Tierras Feroces.\
\
Hunfredo tomó la bolsa de monedas que te dio Bert Bartolín y te entregó a cambio varios artículos.","Hunfredo Rebuscón está en la ciudad abandonada de Dunfast, en las Tierras Feroces.","Tras un largo viaje, el enigmático Bert Bartolín finalmente ha decidido hablar contigo.","Hunfredo Rebuscón provocó una plaga de tritones congelados al pie de las montañas al oeste de Dunfast.","El guardia de la puerta nota que miras alrededor y te llama","Bert Bartolín está junto a los establos de Forlaw, en las Tierras Feroces.","Habla con Bingo en la ciudad de Forlaw","Encuentra al sabio en la puerta oeste de Forlaw","Habla con Bert Bartolín en Forlaw","Encuentra a Hunfredo Rebuscón en algún lugar al oeste de Forlaw","Hunfredo Rebuscón partió de Forlaw hacia el oeste, y Bert Bartolín te ha pedido seguirle la pista.","El sabio se ha ido. Deberías regresar con Bert para informarle.","Bert Bartolín está junto a los establos de Forlaw, en las Tierras Feroces.\
\
Bingo te dijo que Bert Bartolín quería hablar contigo.","Habla con Bert Bartolín en la ciudad de Forlaw","Uno de los guardias de la puerta oeste de Forlaw te ha llamado."}},
[1695]={nameES="Berto, Tom y Guille",objectivesES={"Encuentra a Berto, Tom y Guille","Has encontrado los restos pétreos de tres poderosos trolls de piedra.","Los abuelos de Garbert fueron expulsados de su aldea hace muchos años por tres trolls merodeadores, y Garbert quiere saber qué fue de aquellos villanos.","Garbert vive en su cabaña en Tâl Bruinen, a orillas del río.\
\
Has descubierto qué fue de los trolls Bert, Tom y Bill y has visitado la arboleda donde fueron convertidos en piedra. Deberías regresar con la noticia a Garbert.","Encuentra a alguien que conozca el destino de Berto, Tom y Guille","Berto, Tom y Guille","Los trolls que aterrorizaron la aldea donde vivieron los abuelos de Garbert seguramente encontraron su final en algún lugar de las tierras salvajes del Bosque de los Trolls. Garbert vive en una cabaña junto al río en Tâl Bruinen.\
\
Garbert te ha pedido que encuentres el lugar donde los tres trolls de los que habló encontraron su final y que descubras la historia de su caída."}},
[1696]={nameES="Best Banners Forward",objectivesES={}},
[1697]={nameES="Se sirve mejor frío",objectivesES={"Lleva patas y mandíbulas de gusanos a Indor","Indor está en la hoguera de Echad Candelleth, en Tâl Bruinen.\
\
Has recogido las partes de gusanos que Indor pidió y ahora debes llevárselas para que pueda añadirlas al guiso.","Indor está en la hoguera de Echad Candelleth, en Tâl Bruinen.\
\
Has triturado las partes de gusanos que recogiste y ahora debes llevar la pasta a Indor para que pueda añadirla al guiso.","La piedra de moler está cerca de la hoguera en Echad Candelleth.\
\
Indor te ha pedido que muelas las partes de gusano que recogiste para convertirlas en una pasta.","Tritura los pedazos de gusano en la piedra de moler","Hay gusanos por todo Tâl Bruinen.\
\
Indor te ha pedido que recojas varias partes de los gusanos de Tâl Bruinen para que pueda vengarse del enano que le jugó una broma.","Lleva la pasta de gusano a Indor","Wéthorm está en Thorenhad, en las Gargantas del Bruinen del Bosque de los Trolls, al norte de las guaridas de los osos.\
\
Indor te ha enviado a Wéthorm con su guiso de sapo y te ha pedido que observes bien la reacción del enano al dar su primer bocado. Indor quiere saborear su venganza contra el enano que lo engañó para probar el desagradable guiso de sapo.","Trituras los pedazos de gusano hasta hacerlos puré","Llévale a Wéthorm el guiso de sapo mejorado","Se sirve mejor frío","Indor ha decidido corresponder al mal humor de Wéthorm con una mala broma propia."}},
[1698]={nameES="Best-laid Plans: Skáilag",objectivesES={"As Fláthail falls defeated, the air of dread in Skáilag begins to lessen","Best-laid Plans: Skáilag","Fláthail can be found within the barrows of Skáilag.\
\
You have arrived to find Skáilag overrun by wights and other fell things. You should defeat Fláthail.","Delved into the steep hill-sides of Câr Bronach, the barrows of Skáilag are uninviting","In the barrows of Skáilag, sorcerers of the Iron Crown work to raise the remains of the Hill-men of Rhudaur into the service of Angmar once again.","Skáilag can be found to the east of Grúmachath.\
\
Rethvárd has informed you that the sorceress, Fláthail, endeavours to raise the Hill-men of Rhudaur at Skáilag. You should travel to Skáilag and defeat Fláthail.","Travel to Skáilag","Defeat Fláthail at Skáilag","You have defeated Fláthail at Skáilag.","With the defeat of Fláthail at Skáilag, the Iron Crown's plot to raise their ancient servants, the Hill-men of Rhudaur, has been undone. Your efforts have done much to ensure the success of the Zhélruka expedition in Câr Bronach.","Completado"}},
[1699]={nameES="Best-laid Plans: Toll Oivas",objectivesES={"Iärcagar and Uiagal can be found within the cavern of Toll Oivas.\
\
You have arrived to find Toll Oivas overrun by bat-wights and other fell things. You should defeat Iärcagar and Uiagal.","Travel to Toll Oivas","In the caverns of Toll Oivas, sorcerers of the Iron Crown animate the remains of bats into spies for Angmar.","Defeat Uiagal at Toll Oivas","As Iärcagar falls defeated, fell spirits begin to vanish from Toll Oivas","With the defeat of Iärcagar and Uiagal, the Iron Crown's plans to use bat-wights as spies against the Gabil'akkâ and the Orcs of Mount Gundabad have failed. Your efforts have done much to ensure the success of the Zhélruka expedition in Câr Bronach.","The greatest of Iärcagar's terrible experiments, Uiagal's lifeless remains fall to the ground","You have defeated Iärcagar and Uiagal at Toll Oivas.","Completado","Defeat Iärcagar at Toll Oivas","Toll Oivas can be found to the west of Grúmachath.\
\
Rethvárd has informed you that the sorcerer, Iärcagar and his pet, Uiagal, lead the Angmarim gathered at Toll Oivas. You should travel to Toll Oivas and defeat Iärcagar and Uiagal.","From within the cavern of Toll Oivas, the beating of bat-wings echoes into Câr Bronach","Best-laid Plans: Toll Oivas"}},
[1700]={nameES="Betrayal",objectivesES={"Hoital, the uruk leading the Orcs of Maustazg, revealed that the siege was being orchestrated by Saruman the White and that Lady Góda was working against Ingmar on behalf of Saruman.","Betrayal","Ingbert is in the Mead Hall of Eaworth.\
\
You should speak with Ingbert about his mother's betrayal.","Lady Góda stands near Ingbert in the Mead Hall of Eaworth.\
\
Grief-stricken, Ingbert has asked you to confront Góda about her betrayal.","Talk to Ingbert in the Mead Hall of Eaworth","Talk to Góda in the Mead Hall of Eaworth"}},
[1701]={nameES="Mantas mejores",objectivesES={"Lleva pieles suaves de lince al Viejo Artemisa","Los linces merodean por Nain Enidh, al este de la Cima de los Vientos y al norte del campamento en el extremo este de Minas Eriol.\
\
El Viejo Artemisa te pidió que recogieras pieles de lince para ayudar a Arinora a hacer mantas mejores para los huéspedes más acomodados de la posada.","Arinora está descontenta con el trato preferencial que Anlaf exige para los invitados de Bree, pero poco puede hacer al respecto. Mientras Artemisa está en el campo cazando huargos, piensa que también podría ayudar a su amiga Arinora.","Mantas mejores"}},
[1702]={nameES="Better Days",objectivesES={"Talk to Mekhnet","Mekhnet sits near the Kambráda encampment in the eastern part of Amdân. She might like to hear about how her fellow soldiers are doing.","Mekhnet has requested that you spend some time with soldiers who are resting around Amdân.","Happy memories are hard to come by during war. Mekhnet, an injured soldier, has a favour to ask.","Better Days"}},
[1703]={nameES="Better Late than Never",objectivesES={}},
[1704]={nameES="Entre lo almendrado y lo ácido",objectivesES={"Vuelve con Meregrot","Recoge la cesta de picnic","Meregrot está sentada junto al río, al sureste de Quiebra Larga.\
\
Lleva los champiñones y las fresas a Meregrot.","Entre lo almendrado y lo ácido","Vuelve con Rosalinda","Habla con Meregrot","El aire se llena de una mezcla de fragancias almendradas y cítricas.","Meregrot está sentada junto al río, al sureste de Quiebra Larga.\
\
Habla con Meregrot.","Las fresas crecen silvestre a lo largo de ciertos senderos, y los champiñones están por todo el suelo del bosque cerca del río de Quiebra Larga.\
\
Meregrot Nortuk te ha pedido que recojas fresas y champiñones silvestres.","Rosalinda Nortuk está en Quiebra Larga.\
\
Meregrot te ha pedido que le lleves la cesta de picnic a su hija Rosalinda.","A Meregrot Nortuk le gustaría llevar a casa para cenar algunos champiñones y fresas silvestres y así aliviar de trabajo a su hija, Rosalinda.","Meregrot está sentada junto al río, al sureste de Quiebra Larga.\
\
Meregrot Nortuk te ha pedido que coloques los champiñones y las fresas en la cesta de picnic que está en la manta junto a ella.","La cesta está llena una vez más","Coloca los champiñones y las fresas en la cesta de picnic","La cesta está junto a Meregrot, al sureste de Quiebra Larga.\
\
Meregrot Nortuk te ha pedido que recojas la cesta de picnic que está en la manta junto a ella y la lleves a su hija, Rosalinda."}},
[1705]={nameES="Beware of Skadhurn",objectivesES={"Somewhere in Duskenvale, the massive hart known as Skadhurn protects his herd.\
\
You should find and defeat Skadhurn.","You present the massive antlers to Goslim. His jaw goes slack.\
\
'You... you killed Skadhurn? The storytellers must know of this! They will tell the tale of your victory over that massive beast for years to come!'","The villagers of Arhaim tell the legend of a massive black hart that protects the deer within Duskenvale. Draw his ire at your own risk!","Talk to Goslim","Goslim can be found in the village Arhaim in Duskenvale.\
\
You should bring the antlers to Goslim.","Defeat Skadhurn","Beware of Skadhurn","You take the antlers as proof of your victory"}},
[1706]={nameES="Beyond All Light",objectivesES={"Dread-wards can be found in the Circle of Death in Minas Morgul.\
\
Faramir has asked you to destroy dread-wards so their magic in the Circle of Death magic might be undone.","Concerned that Gothmog has laid a trap for the Rangers of Ithilien, Faramir hopes to overcome the fell magic sealing the door to Uialrond, the Dome of Evening.","Faramir can be found outside Uialrond, the Dome of Evening in Minas Morgul.\
\
You have destroyed the dread-wards of Minas Morgul and should now return to Faramir.","Beyond All Light","Talk to Faramir at Uialrond, the Dome of Evening"}},
[1707]={nameES="Más allá de las murallas",objectivesES={"Debe completarse antes de la \\qIntroducción.\\q","Más allá de las murallas","La granja de Cal Sprigley se encuentra al sur del Capricho de Bronwe.\
\
El condestable Cardoso te ha pedido que vayas a la granja de Cal Sprigley y convenzas a Sprigley de traer a su familia a Archet, donde podrán estar protegidos de los Montebruno.","El condestable Cardoso está preocupado por su amigo Cal Sprigley, un granjero en las afueras del sur de Archet. La granja de Sprigley es vulnerable a un ataque de bandidos.","Habla con Cal Sprigley"}},
[1708]={nameES="Beyond the Burning Plain",objectivesES={"Talk to Legolas about Lhingris","Legolas can be found at the Ruins of Díngarth in Dor Amarth and Bregdal can be found on the border of Dor Amarth and Talath Úrui.\
\
When you have completed all you wish to do in Dor Amarth, you should speak to Legolas and Bregdal.","When you have completed all you wish to do in Dor Amarth, you should speak to Legolas about Lhingris and Bregdal about Talath Úrui.","Beyond the Burning Plain","Talk to Bregdal about Talath Úrui"}},
[1709]={nameES="Más allá de las Cataratas del Anochecer",objectivesES={"El tesoro podría estar bajo otro hito de piedra en algún lugar de Evendim, según el acertijo:\
\
  \\qEn lo alto de Dol Haedír, más allá de las Cataratas del Anochecer,\
  los hombres de linaje lupino mi secreto han de proteger.\\q\
\
Debes examinar el hito cuando lo encuentres en busca de alguna pista sobre la localización del tesoro.","Encuentra la solución al acertijo","El montaraz Culang ha sabido de un gran tesoro enterrado hace mucho tiempo por un terrateniente Dúnadan y quiere recuperarlo antes de que lo encuentren los saqueadores de tumbas.","El hito de piedra está rodeado de signos de excavación. Si una vez marcaba la localización del tesoro, seguro que ha sido encontrado.\
\
El hito lleva una inscripción, desgastada por el paso del tiempo.","La inscripción en este hito de piedra es apenas legible, pero se pueden distinguir las siguientes palabras:\
\
  \\qEn lo alto de Dol Haedír, más allá de las Cataratas del Anochecer,\
  los hombres de linaje lupino mi secreto han de proteger.\\q\
\
Este nuevo acertijo podría revelar la verdadera localización del tesoro.","Más allá de las Cataratas del Anochecer"}},
[1710]={nameES="Beyond the High-threshold",objectivesES={"Travel to Zudramdân","Beyond the High-threshold","Looming over Elderslade, the ruins of Zudramdân have been claimed by the Gabil'akkâ","After gaining a foothold at the dwarf-ruins of Zudramdân, Glóin hopes to expand the reach of the Gabil'akkâ in Elderslade.","Talk to Gárjan at Zudramdân","Gárjan can be found at Zudramdân.\
\
You have arrived at Zudramdân and should now speak to Gárjan.","Zudramdân can be found to the north-west of Annâk-khurfu in Elderslade.\
\
Glóin has asked you to travel to Zudramdân and rally with one of his scouts, Gárjan. You should travel to Zudramdân."}},
[1711]={nameES="Más allá del Ram Dúath",objectivesES={"Más allá del Ram Dúath","Los Montaraces Golodir y Corunir están en la ciudad de los Montañeses llamada Aughaire, al oeste de la salida norte del Ram Dúath.\
\
Arohir te ha pedido que busques a los Montaraces perdidos Golodir y Corunir, quienes hace mucho tiempo fueron enviados a Angmar.","Arohir te ha pedido que atravieses el Ram Dúath hacia Angmar para buscar un lugar llamado Aughaire. Los Montaraces llamados Golodir y Corunir han hecho de este lugar su hogar, pero nadie ha hablado con ellos en muchos años.","Busca a Golodir y Corunir"}},
[1712]={nameES="Bhol Rûdh: Ancient Lights",objectivesES={"Collect Wose lights","The Red Sky Clan of Bhol Rûdh is up against impossible odds in their conflict with the forces of Seregost.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Warning: This quest requires Bhol Rûdh: Siege of Corruption to be underway. If that quest has been completed or failed, you will be unable to exit and re-enter this instance in order to complete this quest.</rgb>","Bring the Wose lights to Candúr.","Bhol Rûdh: Ancient Lights","Collect Wose lights.","Bring the Wose lights to Candúr"}},
[1713]={nameES="Bhol Rûdh: Siege of Corruption",objectivesES={"The Red Sky Clan of Bhol Rûdh is up against impossible odds in their conflict with the forces of Seregost.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Warning: This quest has a one hour time limit. The timer will begin upon accepting the quest.</rgb>","You ran out of time...","Defeat Khoshúg the Reeking.","Bhol Rûdh: Siege of Corruption","Talk to Candúr","You should return to Candúr and apprise him of your efforts.","Defeated Khoshúg the Reeking","Defeat Khoshúg the Reeking"}},
[1714]={nameES="Bhol Rûdh: Trail of Blood",objectivesES={"The Red Sky Clan of Bhol Rûdh is up against impossible odds in their conflict with the forces of Seregost.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Warning: This quest requires Bhol Rûdh: Siege of Corruption to be underway. If that quest has been completed or failed, you will be unable to exit and re-enter this instance in order to complete this quest.</rgb>","Defeat infected Orcs on the path to Bhol Rûdh","Talk to Candúr","Defeat infected Orcs on the path to Bhol Rûdh.","Talk to Candúr.","Bhol Rûdh: Trail of Blood"}},
[1715]={nameES="Peces grandes, peces pequeños",objectivesES={"No hay logro mayor que atrapar un pez grande, viejo y pesado. Sin embargo, capturar demasiados peces pequeños puede hacer que uno se cuestione su habilidad como pescador.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando finalice el festival actual.</rgb>","Bollo Bolger se encuentra cerca del lugar de pesca en Delagua.\
\
Deberías hablar con Bollo Bolger y mostrarle el pez grande e impresionante que has atrapado.","Peces grandes, peces pequeños","Habla con Bollo Bolger","Se pueden atrapar peces (tanto grandes como pequeños) en el lugar de pesca de Delagua.\
\
Deberías intentar capturar muchos peces grandes sin atrapar demasiados pequeños. ¡Demasiados peces pequeños harán que tu suerte falle!"}},
[1716]={nameES="Grandes problemas",objectivesES={"Dob Hojarena, afuera de El Poney Pisador, te ha pedido que busques su mochila en la choza de piedra en lo profundo del Bosque de Brandi, muy al norte de Los Gamos.","Lleva la mochila a Dob Hojarena","Grandes problemas","Mochila de Dob Hojarena recolectada","Dob Hojarena fue ahuyentado de su comida por un gigante. Te ha pedido que recuperes su mochila."}},
[1717]={nameES="Big Stuff",objectivesES={}},
[1718]={nameES="Carta de Bilbo",objectivesES={"Lleva la carta de Bilbo a Lobelia","Lobelia está tardando demasiado en leer la carta. Debes insistirle para obtener información.","Bilbo dejó una carta para los habitantes de su amada Comarca en manos de Hamfast Gamyi, afectuosamente conocido por los vecinos como el Tío Gamyi.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando finalice el evento con el que está asociada. </rgb>","Lobelia sigue leyendo con avidez (no es de mucha ayuda)","Lobelia Sacovilla-Bolsón está en Bolsón Cerrado, al norte del Árbol de la Fiesta en la colina.\
\
Debes hablar con Lobelia sobre la carta de Bilbo.","Obviamente, Lobelia quiere quedarse con los tesoros de Bilbo para ella sola","Lobelia te ahuyenta y sigue leyendo","Carta de Bilbo","Pregunta al Tío Gamyi por la carta de Bilbo","El Tío Gamyi está afuera de su casa en Bolsón de Tirada.\
\
Debes preguntarle al Tío Gamyi si puedes mostrar la carta de Bilbo a Lobelia.","Lobelia Sacovilla-Bolsón está en Bolsón Cerrado, al norte del Árbol de la Fiesta en la colina.\
\
Debes llevar la carta de despedida de Bilbo a Lobelia, ya que podría dar alguna pista sobre la bodega cerrada de Bolsón Cerrado.","Has adquirido la carta de despedida de Bilbo","Lobelia parece confundida por la mención de la cuchara","Insiste a Lobelia para obtener información"}},
[1719]={nameES="El regreso seguro de Bill",objectivesES={"Bill parece contento de avanzar","Has encontrado a Bill. Su melena parece descuidada y tiene un brillo salvaje en los ojos, pero por lo demás parece ileso.\
\
Cuando intentas guiarle duda si seguirte o no, como si estuviera esperando a algo o alguien, mirando expectante hacia los muros de Moria.\
\
Persuadiéndolo lo suficiente, eres capaz de hacer que te siga.","Habla con un elfo en Echad Dúnnan sobre el paso de Bill","Coge las riendas para animar a Bill a seguirte","Habla con Bill el poney","El regreso seguro de Bill","Has encontrado a Bill el poney y debes escoltarle hasta un lugar seguro.","Los depredadores se aproximan...","Bill puede ser invocado utilizando el cuerno que tienes contigo. Las huellas de Bill pueden encontrarse yendo hacia el camino, seguidas de cerca por los huargos.\
\
Deberías encontrar las huellas de Bill para descubrir y derrotar a los huargos que intentan darle caza.\
\
(Puedes utilizar el cuerno de invocación para llamarlo en cualquier momento.)","Escuchas los aullidos de caza de los huargos cerca...","Has conseguido llegar al camino con Bill, y parece tener estar convencido de dejar las puertas de Moria atrás.\
\
Deberías hablar con Bill.\
\
(Puedes utilizar el cuerno de invocación para llamarlo en cualquier momento.)","Debes guiar a Bill el poney a un lugar seguro.","Has conseguido llegar al camino con Bill, y parece tener estar convencido de dejar las puertas de Moria atrás.\
\
Este pequeño y robusto poney llegará donde tenga que ir sin que tengas que seguir dándole empujoncitos, pero has hecho bien en persuadirlo para que saliera de territorio peligroso.","Glavroleth está en Echad Dúnnan.\
\
Deberías decirle a Glavroleth que guiaste a Bill hasta el camino."}},
[1720]={nameES="Bingo Regresa a Casa",objectivesES={"Bingo Regresa a Casa","El agujero hobbit de Bingo está en Cavada Grande, al norte del Ayuntamiento.","Bingo está a punto de llegar al final de su viaje.","Bingo está dentro de su agujero hobbit en Cavada Grande, al norte del Ayuntamiento.","Examina el aviso clavado en la puerta de Bingo","Habla con Bingo fuera de su hogar en Cavada Grande","Donnamira Tuk es la bibliotecaria de la biblioteca de los Grandes Smials, situada en lo alto de la colina en Alforzaburgo.\
\
Bingo ha acumulado muchas multas por retraso con el libro de cocina que dio inicio a su viaje, y te pidió que saldaras su deuda.","Myrtle Cenagales está de pie frente al hogar de Bingo, con los brazos cruzados en señal de desaprobación.","Hay un aviso clavado en la puerta del agujero hobbit de Bingo.","Habla con Donnamira Tuk en la biblioteca de los Grandes Smials y salda la deuda de Bingo","Habla con Bingo en el interior de su agujero hobbit, en Cavada Grande","Este es un aviso de retraso de la biblioteca. Ya tiene casi un año de antigüedad","Habla con Myrtle Cenagales fuera del hogar de Bingo en Cavada Grande","Bingo te entrega el libro de cocina con mucho retraso y el tesoro de los bandidos","La mansión Boffin se ha llenado de telarañas durante la prolongada ausencia de Bingo, y él te pidió que lo ayudes a ordenar.","Bingo está fuera de su agujero hobbit en Cavada Grande, al norte del Ayuntamiento.","Viaja al agujero hobbit de Bingo en Cavada Grande","Myrtle Cenagales está de pie frente al hogar de Bingo, con los brazos cruzados en señal de desaprobación"}},
[1721]={nameES="La carga de Bingo",objectivesES={"Habla con Bingo dentro de Stangard","Hay muchas amenazas en el Páramo del Este de Rohan que ponen en peligro a la gente de Langhold: salamandras, bandidos y orientales.\
\
Bingo quiere ayudar a la gente de Langhold luchando contra los peligros de El Páramo.","Bingo está fuera de la entrada principal de Harwick, al norte de la ciudad, en el Páramo.","Bingo está en el patio superior de Stangard.\
\
Sabert ha dejado claro que cruzar Rohan a pie y sin caballo no es una buena idea, y deberías volver con esa noticia para Bingo.","Sabert está en la puerta este de Stangard, el puesto avanzado del Rohan junto a las orillas del Gran Río.\
\
Bingo es reacio a montar un caballo en Rohan y quiere saber por Sabert si el reino es lo bastante pequeño como para recorrerlo a pie.","Bingo está en el patio superior de Stangard.\
\
Bingo espera hablar contigo para comenzar la larga caminata hacia Rohan.","Bingo está en la ciudad de Langhold, en la zona norte de El Páramo en el Este de Rohan.\
\
Has derrotado muchas amenazas en el Páramo para ayudar a la gente de Langhold.","Sabert parece a punto de echarse a reír otra vez ante la idea de cruzar Rohan a pie, así que decides no decir nada.","Habla con Sabert en la puerta este de Stangard","Habla con Bingo en la entrada de Harwick, en el Páramo","Bingo está dentro del pueblo de Langhold, en el área norte de El Páramo en el Este de Rohan.\
\
Has entrado en el reino de Rohan con Bingo, y el hobbit desea hacer algo por la gente de Langhold.","La carga de Bingo","Habla con Bingo en el pueblo de Langhold, en el Páramo","Bingo sabe que debe viajar al reino de Rohan, pero su miedo a los caballos hace que esa idea le resulte aterradora y enlentezca sus pasos.","Habla con Bingo en Stangard y camina con él hacia Rohan"}},
[1722]={nameES="Los pensamientos dispersos de Bingo",objectivesES={"Habla con Bingo en la Sala Vigesimoprimera","La memoria de Bingo ha regresado!","Bingo está en Sala Vigesimoprimera, listo para leer el manuscrito que ensamblaste.","Habla con Willem Bigotes en la Sala Vigesimoprimera","Bingo está en la Sala Vigesimoprimera de Moria.\
\
Bingo ha terminado de leer su manuscrito, y deberías hablar con él para ver si eso le ha ayudado a recuperar la memoria.","Spalvi dijo que se reuniría contigo en la Sala Vigesimoprimera después de que siguieras todas sus pistas.","Spalvi te dio varias pistas a seguir que podrían ayudarte a reunir las páginas perdidas del manuscrito de Bingo: \
\
'Los merrevail de la Fosa de los Colmillos podrían tener algunas páginas. Los orcos y los jinetes de huargos recorren grandes distancias por Zelem-melek, y podrían haber encontrado páginas. Se formó un consejo de guerra en Anazârmekhem, en las Profundidades Llameantes, y sus líderes podrían haber descubierto páginas. Los enanos de la Sala Vigesimoprimera que reciben mucho tránsito por sus servicios, como los guardianes de cofres o los bardos, también podrían haber conseguido páginas.'","Espera a que Bingo termine de leer el relato de su viaje","Spalvi Corazonrecio está en el campamento enano cerca de la Fosa de los Colmillos.","Por primera vez desde que Bingo desapareció, Willem Bigotes parece genuinamente feliz. Si escuchas con atención, quizá incluso oigas un zumbido en lo profundo: Willem está ronroneando satisfecho.","Spalvi y Willem Bigotes están en la Sala Vigesimoprimera, esperando ver si Bingo ha recuperado sus recuerdos.","Habla con Spalvi en la Sala Vigesimoprimera","Bingo ha terminado de leer su manuscrito... ¿ha funcionado?","Bingo está leyendo su propio manuscrito... ¡pero no lo sabe!","Tres páginas dispersas recogidas","Bingo Boffin está en la Fosa de los Colmillos.\
\
Spalvi te ha dado la página del manuscrito que Willem Bigotes encontró en Moria y cree que, si se la muestras a Bingo, podría ayudarle a recuperar la memoria.","Estás seguro de que Bingo casi recordó. ¡Si tan solo hubiera más páginas!","Lleva las páginas del manuscrito de Bingo a Spalvi en la Sala Vigesimoprimera","Dos páginas dispersas recogidas","Los pensamientos dispersos de Bingo","Bingo está en la Sala Vigesimoprimera de Moria.","Habla con Spalvi en la Fosa de los Colmillos","Lleva el manuscrito restaurado a Bingo en la Sala Vigesimoprimera","Muestra a Bingo la página seca de su manuscrito en la Fosa de los Colmillos","Página dispersa recogida","Has encontrado a Bingo, pero él perdió algo suyo mientras estuvo fuera: ¡su memoria!"}},
[1723]={nameES="Madre de los abedules",objectivesES={"Sendiel se encuentra en el Claro Apacible, al sur y ligeramente al oeste de Cerin Brethil.\
\
Deberías regresar con Sendiel con las semillas.","Se pueden encontrar musarañas en Taur Hith, en particular en la zona alrededor de Cerin Brethil, al norte y ligeramente al este del Claro Apacible.\
\
Sendiel te ha pedido que recuperes semillas de las musarañas.","Cantaste a los retoños de malbrethil para mejorar su salud. Ahora Sendiel desea aumentar su número.","Habla con Sendiel en el Claro Apacible","Madre de los abedules"}},
[1724]={nameES="Aves de presa",objectivesES={"Los morrovals utilizan varios percheros como nidos. Gúri cree que si se destruyeran, la colonia quedaría paralizada.","El campamento de los morrovals se encuentra en Skoiruzg, al este del campamento de la Fosa Colmilluda.\
\
Gúri te ha pedido que destruyas los percheros de los morrovals y derrotes a varios frondeadores.","Gúri está en el campamento de la Fosa Colmilluda, al oeste de Skoiruzg.\
\
Gúri se alegrará de saber que los percheros de los morrovals han sido destruidos y que el camino hacia el campamento está libre de ataques de los frondeadores.","Aves de presa","Habla con Gúri en el campamento de la Fosa Colmilluda"}},
[1725]={nameES="Pájaros de un mismo plumaje",objectivesES={"Los hendrevail han comenzado a anidar en Kamskut, una estructura de aspecto siniestro situada en las montañas al noreste de Othrikar.\
\
Deberías investigar Kamskut, pues este comportamiento de anidación seguramente no es natural.","Los hendrevail han comenzado a anidar en Kamskut, una estructura de aspecto siniestro situada en las montañas al noreste de Othrikar.","El Halconero Brúni está en Kamskut, en las Quebradas del Norte, al noreste de Othrikar.\
\
Debes derrotar a Brúni y a sus fauconeros.","Derrota a Brúni y a sus Halconeros","Pájaros de un mismo plumaje","Completado","Has derrotado a Brúni, un Halconero Duramano, y a sus compañeros en Kamskut."}},
[1726]={nameES="Birdwatching",objectivesES={}},
[1727]={nameES="Birth of the Eorlingas",objectivesES={"Continue learning the history of the Rohirrim with Léothred","Framsburg can be found in Misthallow.\
\
You should learn the history of the Rohirrim with Léothred.","Hlithseld is located in the north of Misthallow.\
\
You should talk to Léothred at Hlithseld.","Framsburg can be found in Misthallow.\
\
You should find Fram's silver horn, buried somewhere in the ruins of Framsburg.","Talk to Léothred at Hlithseld","Learn the history of the Rohirrim with Léothred","Léothred, the Rohirric scholar, seeks to learn more of his people's history in Misthallow.","Léothred can be found at Framsburg.\
\
You should talk to Léothred at Framsburg.","Find Fram's silver horn","Talk to Léothred at Framsburg","Birth of the Eorlingas","Talk to Léothred elsewhere at Framsburg","Travel to Hlithseld to rest","Hlithseld is located in the north of Misthallow.\
\
You should travel to Hlithseld and rest."}},
[1728]={nameES="Biting and Burning",objectivesES={"Wisewood the Ent is in the north-east corner of Fangorn's eaves.\
\
You should speak with Wisewood once more.","The Ent is perfectly still, but its eyes are open. You could swear that this one has an angry red gleam in his greenish eyes... or perhaps a flare of panic. It is hard to tell when his outward behaviour is so still.\
\
You smell smoke here and see the orange glow of fire. It is not hard to guess why this Ent may be angry.","You have found another sleeping Ent in need of assistance.","Biting and Burning","A Huorn stands near the White Hand encampment, watching your every move.\
\
You should approach the Huorn cautiously.","Approach the Huorn who watches you","The Huorn makes no move to attack you, but regards you with interest. It is likely that you and it have the same goals, for now."}},
[1729]={nameES="Biting the Hand that Feeds",objectivesES={"Biting the Hand that Feeds","Complete Guidance of the White Hand","Complete Servants of the White Hand","Evidence supports Gwilum's beliefs that the Warg-riders plaguing Carreglyn are in fact servants of Saruman the White... and that his own rulers are in league with them.","Talk to Amlan at his camp in the Gravenwood","Gwilum is at the gate to Barnavon.\
\
Gwilum has asked you to help him against the Warg-riders in the north.","Complete Hounds of the White Hand","Complete Summons of the White Hand","Amlan is encamped beneath the eaves of the Gravenwood.\
\
Gwilum asked you to bring word of your successes to the Ranger Amlan."}},
[1730]={nameES="Ataque a la Mano Blanca",objectivesES={"Ataque a la Mano Blanca","La Escuela de Tham Mírdain se encuentra al sureste de Echad Mirobel.\
\
Lefnuichen, un elfo de Echad Mirobel, te ha pedido que expulses por la fuerza a la Mano Blanca, ya que los uruks y los dunlendinos se han apoderado de la Escuela que, por derecho, pertenece a los elfos.","Los uruk-hai y los hombres de las Tierras Brunas controlan la Escuela de Tham Mírdain, y poco podemos hacer al respecto. He oído que hay pequeñas fuerzas que se dirigen a la Biblioteca de Tham Mírdain para hacer frente a la amenaza del norte. Espero hacer lo mismo contra los enemigos a los que nos enfrentamos desde el sur.\
\
La Escuela de Tham Mírdain fue en su día un lugar de aprendizaje donde se intercambiaban ideas libremente, y los elfos debatían asuntos importantes y conocimientos. Ahora yace en ruinas, pero las fuerzas de la Mano Blanca creen que aún puede haber algo dentro de esos muros que merezca la pena llevarse.\
\
Pido a cualquiera que desee ayudarnos que entre en la Escuela de Tham Mírdain y expulse a la Mano Blanca de ese lugar abandonado. Encontraréis la entrada al sureste de nuestra posición."}},
[1731]={nameES="Bits and Baubles",objectivesES={"Return to Yâshri with the valuable goods","Bits and Baubles","Find and recover valuable goods scattered amongst the Dead in Ghâr Mejet.","Return to Yâshri with the valuable goods.\
\
Yâshri can be found just north of Ghâr Mejet.","Yâshri has requested that you help recover items of value from Ghâr Mejet."}},
[1732]={nameES="Fronteras amargas",objectivesES={"Fredegar ya está trabajando en un plan para encargarse de Lotho y sus Fronteros","Habla con Lotho Sacovilla-Bolsón fuera de Ojo de Aguja","Fronteras amargas","Lotho Sacovilla-Bolsón se encuentra en el este de la Comarca Allende, fuera de Ojo de Aguja.\
\
Debes hablar con Lotho Sacovilla-Bolsón.","Habla con Fredegar Bolger","Lotho y algunos de sus compinches han llegado a la Comarca Allende","Lotho Sacovilla-Bolsón se encuentra en el este de la Comarca Allende, fuera de Ojo de Aguja.\
\
Debes viajar hacia Ojo de Aguja con Fredegar Bolger.","Fredegar Bolger planea disputar a Lotho Sacovilla-Bolsón el marcado oficial de las fronteras.","Hay un almacén secreto de la Guardia de Allende en los bosques entre Gamwich y Quiebra Larga.\
\
Debes hablar con Fredegar Bolger en el almacén de la Guardia de Allende.","Hay un almacén secreto de la Guardia de Allende en los bosques entre Gamwich y Quiebra Larga.\
\
Fredegar Bolger te ha pedido que te reagrupes en el almacén secreto de la Guardia de Allende.","Habla con Lotho Sacovilla-Bolsón entre Ojo de Aguja y la Comarca Allende","Fredegar Bolger se encuentra en el este de la Comarca Allende, fuera de Ojo de Aguja.\
\
Debes hablar con Fredegar Bolger.","Reagrúpate en el almacén secreto de la Guardia de Allende","Habla con Fredegar Bolger en el escondite secreto"}},
[1733]={nameES="Bitter Scenes in Audaghaim",objectivesES={}},
[1734]={nameES="Insignias Negras — Introducción",objectivesES={"Lleva las Insignias Negras a Cannuion en Tinnudir.","Los Angmarim, bajo el mando de Númenóreanos Negros, han ocupado la ciudad en ruinas de Annúminas.","Insignias Negras — Introducción","Se pueden encontrar Angmarim dentro de los muros en ruinas de Annúminas. Cannuion está en Tinnudir.\
\
Cannuion te ha pedido que le lleves las insignias negras de los Angmarim de Annúminas."}},
[1735]={nameES="Black Bolts",objectivesES={"Vatnar is concerned that the Orkish ballistae mounted around Gathbúrz pose a serious threat to Rodelleth's warriors.","Orkish ballistae can be found throughout northern Gathbúrz.\
\
Vatnar has asked you to destroy several Orkish ballistae to clear the way for the Malledhrim.","Talk to Vatnar in Thangúlhad","Vatnar is at Thangúlhad in Gathbúrz.\
\
You should return to Vatnar with news of your success.","Black Bolts"}},
[1736]={nameES="Desafío Negro",objectivesES={"Desafío Negro","Este tosco fragmento de texto está escrito en la Lengua Negra. Los garabatos extranjeros y apresurados no tienen significado para tus ojos. Se dice que los Elfos de Rivendel comprenden la lengua de Mordor. Quizá alguno de ellos pueda traducir el mensaje y revelar su propósito.","Encuentra a un erudito en Rivendel que pueda traducir el Lenguaje Negro.","El Enemigo habla un lenguaje terrible conocido como la Lengua Negra. Planes y mensajes al Falso Rey, sus generales y comandantes, son frecuentemente llevados al combate por sus secuaces.","Rivendel se encuentra en las Trollshaws, muy al sur de Angmar.\
\
Has descubierto un extraño texto, escrito en el Lenguaje Negro. Los Elfos de Rivendel podrían ser capaces de traducirlo."}},
[1737]={nameES="Black Fire on the Burning Mountain",objectivesES={"Mineral riches await those who brave the perilous cliff road circling Mount Doom.","Candúr se encuentra en Udûn.\
\\Deberías hablar con Candúr.","Completed The Burning Mountain: Black Fire.","You have successfully braved the mountain and gathered the requested ore.","A notice is pinned to the board:\
\
'Obsidian ore is plentiful upon Mount Doom. A brave adventurer is needed to gather this ore. Seek out Candúr in Udûn to learn more.'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Warning: This quest requires The Burning Mountain: Blood Wings to be underway. If that quest has been completed or failed, you will be unable to exit and re-enter this instance in order to complete this quest.</rgb>","Completado","Complete The Burning Mountain: Black Fire","Black Fire on the Burning Mountain"}},
[1738]={nameES="Black Flames",objectivesES={"The black torch on the wall before you casts twisted shadows upon the cavern floor....","Find the source of the Shadow-wolves' power","Amarion is at Echad Dagoras, north-west of the Black Dens.\
\
You should return to Amarion with tidings of what you found in the Black Dens.","The Black Dens lie to the south-east of Echad Dagoras.\
\
Amarion has asked you to enter the Black Dens and find the source of the Shadow-wolves' power.","Shadow-torches can be found throughout the caverns of the Black Dens.\
\
You should douse the torches within the Black Dens to break the strange enchantment that summons forth the Shadow-wolves.","Talk to Amarion at Echad Dagoras","Black Flames","The Shadow-wolves of the Black Dens are clearly no ordinary wolves. Some spirit of evil empowers them and guides them."}},
[1739]={nameES="Black Hearts",objectivesES={"Blackthorn can be found in the eaves of Fangorn, north of Tordag's encampment.\
\
You should bring the Black Huorn heartwood to the Ent Blackthorn.","Bring the black heartwood you collected to Blackthorn","The Ent Blackthorn is disturbed by the emergence of Black Huorns from the heart of Fangorn, which do not heed his voice.","Black Huorns may be found throughout the eaves of Fangorn bordering the Broadacres.\
\
Blackthorn asked you to bring him more of the black heartwood, so that he might learn the origin of the corruption.","Black Hearts"}},
[1740]={nameES="Black Hearts",objectivesES={"Bring the black heartwood you collected to Blackthorn","The Ent Blackthorn is disturbed by the emergence of Black Huorns from the heart of Fangorn, which do not heed his voice.","Black Huorns may be found throughout the eaves of Fangorn bordering the Broadacres.\
\
Blackthorn asked you to bring him more of the black heartwood, so that he might learn the origin of the corruption.","Black Hearts","Blackthorn awaits your return in the eaves of Fangorn, bordering the Broadacres.\
\
You should bring the black heartwood that you collected to Blackthorn the Ent."}},
[1741]={nameES="Black Huorns",objectivesES={}},
[1742]={nameES="Maldiciones Negras",objectivesES={"Rivendel está en el Bosque de los Trolls, al sur de Angmar.\
\
Has descubierto un extraño fragmento de texto, escrito en la Lengua Negra. Los Elfos de Rivendel podrían traducirlo.","Este tosco fragmento de texto está escrito en la Lengua Negra. Los garabatos extranjeros y apresurados no tienen significado para tus ojos. Se dice que los Elfos de Rivendel comprenden la lengua de Mordor. Quizá alguno de ellos pueda traducir el mensaje y revelar su propósito.","Encuentra a un erudito en Rivendel que pueda traducir el Lenguaje Negro.","El Enemigo habla un lenguaje terrible conocido como la Lengua Negra. Planes y mensajes al Falso Rey, sus generales y comandantes, son frecuentemente llevados al combate por sus secuaces.","Maldiciones Negras"}},
[1743]={nameES="Encantamientos Negros",objectivesES={"Encantamientos Negros","Rivendel está en el Bosque de los Trolls, al sur de Angmar.\
\
Has descubierto un extraño fragmento de texto, escrito en la Lengua Negra. Los Elfos de Rivendel podrían traducirlo.","Este tosco fragmento de texto está escrito en la Lengua Negra. Los garabatos extranjeros y apresurados no tienen significado para tus ojos. Se dice que los Elfos de Rivendel comprenden la lengua de Mordor. Quizá alguno de ellos pueda traducir el mensaje y revelar su propósito.","Encuentra un erudito en Rivendel que pueda traducir la Lengua Negra.","El Enemigo habla un lenguaje terrible conocido como la Lengua Negra. Planes y mensajes al Falso Rey, sus generales y comandantes, son frecuentemente llevados al combate por sus secuaces."}},
[1744]={nameES="Conocimiento Negro",objectivesES={"Rivendel está en el Bosque de los Trolls, al sur de Angmar.\
\
Has descubierto un extraño fragmento de texto, escrito en la Lengua Negra. Los Elfos de Rivendel podrían traducirlo.","Este tosco fragmento de texto está escrito en la Lengua Negra. Los garabatos extranjeros y apresurados no tienen significado para tus ojos. Se dice que los Elfos de Rivendel comprenden la lengua de Mordor. Quizá alguno de ellos pueda traducir el mensaje y revelar su propósito.","Encuentra a un erudito en Rivendel que pueda traducir el Lenguaje Negro.","El Enemigo habla un lenguaje terrible conocido como la Lengua Negra. Planes y mensajes al Falso Rey, sus generales y comandantes, son frecuentemente llevados al combate por sus secuaces.","Conocimiento Negro"}},
[1745]={nameES="Black Sails: Fallen Arms",objectivesES={"Talk to Langlas at the Camp of the Grey Host","Mandan is at the north-west entrance to Pelargir.\
\
You have gathered up a number of Corsair blades and should bring them to Mandan.","The Rangers of the Grey Company are hard at work in the port-city of Pelargir, cleaning up after the defeat of the Corsairs. The streets of Pelargir are littered with the weapons the Corsairs cast aside in their terror, and now it is up to the Rangers to remove the fallen arms.","Bring Corsair swords to Mandan at the north-west entrance to Pelargir","Black Sails: Fallen Arms","The Corsairs cast aside their blades when they fled from the Oath-breakers, and the fallen arms can be found at many places near the docks of Pelargir.","Mandan is inside the entrance to Pelargir.\
\
Langlas and Mandan are organizing the effort to gather up the weapons the Corsairs cast aside when they fled from the Oath-breakers at Pelargir.","Talk to Mandan at the north-west entrance to Pelargir","Langlas is at the Camp of the Grey Host, west of the port-city of Pelargir."}},
[1746]={nameES="Black Sails: Loading the Ships",objectivesES={"Techeron reluctantly thanks you for the supplies, though it lost him a wager","Techeron is on the Corsair flagship moored at the large southern dock in the Market Ward, in Pelargir.\
\
You have delivered some supplies to the flagship, and now Techeron wants to speak with you.","Lothrandir is upset at his condition, still weakened from his imprisonment in Isengard, and wants to help the Grey Company ready the ships.","Talk to Techeron on the Corsair flagship","There are crates that need to be carried to the Corsair flagship moored at the large dock on the south end of the Market Ward. Crates can be found by Radanir's position in the West-garth, near one of the bridges to the Market Ward.","Pick up the supply crate by Radanir in the West-garth","Lothrandir is at the Camp of the Grey Host, west of the port-city of Pelargir.","There are barrels that need to be carried to the Corsair flagship moored at the large dock on the south end of the Market Ward. Barrels can be found by Radanir's position in the West-garth, near one of the bridges to the Market Ward.","Black Sails: Loading the Ships","Pick up the supply barrel by Radanir in the West-garth","Talk to Radanir in the West-garth of Pelargir","Talk to Lothrandir in the Camp of the Grey Host","Radanir is in the West-garth of Pelargir, by one of the bridges that leads to the Court of the Ship-kings.\
\
Lothrandir has asked you to find Radanir and help him load the ships with supplies.","Techeron thanks you for the supplies"}},
[1747]={nameES="Black Sails: Secret Knowledge",objectivesES={"The crate does not contain that which you seek","Talk to Daervunn in the Camp of the Grey Host","Faeron is in the Court of the Ship-kings, in Pelargir.\
\
Ranger Faeron heard your conversation with Orthonn and has sought your attention.","Talk to Faeron in the Court of the Ship-kings","Amlan is in the Market Ward, in Pelargir.\
\
You found some maps of the Anduin and should bring them to Amlan.","Search crates in the Market Ward for river-maps","Bring the river maps to Orthonn in the Court of the Ship-kings","Orthonn is one of the lore-masters of the Grey Company, and can be found in the Court of the Ship-kings, in Pelargir.\
\
Amlan cannot read the maps of the Anduin you recovered, but thinks that Orthonn might be able to learn some useful knowledge from them.","Amlan is in the Market Ward in the port-city of Pelargir.\
\
Daervunn asked you to help Amlan find maps of the river Anduin to help Aragorn with his journey.","Black Sails: Secret Knowledge","Daervunn is at the Camp of the Grey Host, west of the port-city of Pelargir.","Bring the river maps to Amlan in the Market Ward","Daervunn sent Amlan into Pelargir to look for river-maps that will be useful for navigating the Anduin, but he has not yet returned.","Amlan did not yet search the crates in a small area in the north-eastern corner of the Market Ward, and they may contain the river-maps you seek.","Talk to Amlan in the Market Ward, in Pelargir","The Ranger Faeron, standing nearby, beckons you to speak with him","You find some folded parchments in the crate: maps of the Anduin's course"}},
[1748]={nameES="Black Sails: Voices of the Past",objectivesES={"Talk to Golodir somewhere south of Corunir, in Pelargir","Talk to Halbarad near the north-west entrance to Pelargir","Talk to Corunir in Pelargir, somewhere south of Halbarad","Halbarad is located in the large courtyard just inside the north-west entrance to the port-city of Pelargir.","Talk to Calenglad at the Camp of the Grey Host","Corunir left Golodir standing on a dock somewhere to the south, in the city of Pelargir.","Calenglad is at the Camp of the Grey Host, outside the port-city of Pelargir.\
\
Golodir was possessed of an unusually ill temper, and you should return to Calenglad and see what he thinks of the Grey Company's mood following the battle.","Corunir is somewhere south of Halbarad's position, in Pelargir.\
\
Halbarad has asked you to find Corunir and learn how Golodir fares after the passing of the Dead Men.","Black Sails: Voices of the Past","The Rangers of the Grey Company have helped deliver the port-city from danger, but their journey is not yet ended. Some of the Rangers are troubled by the things they have seen, and tensions run high among Aragorn's folk."}},
[1749]={nameES="Veneno negro I",objectivesES={"Miluimil se encuentra en el campamento de Ivorel en las Hondonadas Enmarañadas.\
\
Deberías regresar con Miluimil con las glándulas de veneno que has recogido.","Habla con Miluimil en el campamento de Ivorel","Veneno negro I","Las arañas Venenonegro pueden encontrarse en las cuevas del extremo norte de las Hondonadas Enmarañadas.\
\
Miluimil te ha pedido que recojas glándulas de veneno de la prole Venenonegro de las Hondonadas Enmarañadas para que pueda elaborar un antídoto contra el veneno de Delúris.","Los exploradores de Miluimil han informado de la existencia de una mortal reina araña llamada Delúris que acecha en las profundidades del norte de las Hondonadas Enmarañadas. Su veneno es tan letal que nadie que se haya atrevido a enfrentarse a ella ha sobrevivido.","NO DEBERÍAS VER ESTO"}},
[1750]={nameES="Veneno negro II",objectivesES={"Habla con Miluimil en las Hondonadas Enmarañadas","Derrota a Delúris","Tras ayudar a Miluimil a elaborar un antídoto a partir del veneno de su propia prole, ahora estás preparado para enfrentarte a Delúris, la reina de la prole de las Hondonadas Enmarañadas.","El nido de Delúris se encuentra en el norte de las Hondonadas Enmarañadas, al norte del campamento de Ivorel.\
\
Miluimil te ha pedido que te enfrentes y derrotes a la reina araña Delúris, y te ha proporcionado el antídoto contra su veneno.","Miluimil se encuentra en el campamento de Ivorel en las Hondonadas Enmarañadas, al sur del nido de Delúris.\
\
Deberías regresar junto a Miluimil para contarle la derrota de Delúris.","Veneno negro II","Has derrotado a Delúris"}},
[1751]={nameES="Black Wings",objectivesES={"Scuttledells crows can be found throughout the Scuttledells.\
\
Ivorel has asked you to hunt down Scuttledells crows to prevent them from finding her scouts or reporting back to Dol Guldur.","Black Wings","Habla con Ivorel en su campamento","Ivorel is at her camp in the Scuttledells.\
\
You should speak with Ivorel and tell her that many of the Enemy's flying scouts have been slain.","If Ivorel's scouts are to have any hope of moving without the Enemy knowing their every step, the crows of the Enemy will need to be kept at bay."}},
[1752]={nameES="Black-hearted Trees",objectivesES={"Corrupted Huorns can be found in the Black Heart of Fangorn.\
\
You should defeat many corrupted Huorns in the darkest part of the forest.","Defeat Huorns in the Black Heart","You have defeated many of the bloodthirsty Huorns of Greenroot's corrupted herd. The forest will not be so treacherous for the creatures who wind up lost in the Black Heart.","Black-hearted Trees","Completado","The trees in the Black Heart of Fangorn are evil to the core, coming after you without provocation, and with a worrisome bloodlust."}},
[1753]={nameES="Noche más negra",objectivesES={"Noche más negra","Devuelve los cristales a Gerwith en Tharâkh Bazân","Gerwith necesita los cristales de las cuevas que crecen en Tharâkh Bazân para reemplazar muchas de las fuentes de luz que han sido destruidas en toda Moria.","Gerwith está en el campamento en el extremo este de Tharâkh Bazân.\
\
Gerwith espera tu regreso con los cristales luminosos que pueden usarse como fuentes de luz.","Los cristales se encuentran en Tharâkh Bazân, al oeste de Jazârgund en el Camino de Durin.\
\
Gerwith te ha pedido que busques cristales naturales en Tharâkh Bazân para reemplazar los que han sido destruidos."}},
[1754]={nameES="Colmillo Negro",objectivesES={"Colmillo Negro derrotado","Regresa con Nogmeldir en Vindurhal y cuéntale que Glorwen ha sido capturada por los trasgos de la Ciudad de los Trasgos.","Colmillo Negro","Thorgest te dijo que podrías conocer el destino de Glorwen enfrentándote al líder de la manada, Colmillo Negro.","El desafío ha sido lanzado","El tótem del desafío está en el centro de las ruinas de Starkhath.\
\
Nogmeldir te ha pedido que encuentres el tótem y provoques al líder de los huargos, Colmillo Negro.","Encuentra el tótem del desafío y derrota a Colmillo Negro"}},
[1755]={nameES="Blackthorn's Revenge",objectivesES={}},
[1756]={nameES="Ladrones Montebruno",objectivesES={"Lleva la llave maestra de Rurik al condestable Vadosalvia","El condestable Vadosalvia recordó que un explorador mencionó haber oído a un recluta de Montebruno obedecer órdenes del sargento Manzaneda cerca del campamento principal de Montebruno.","El condestable Vadosalvia se encuentra cerca del centro de Combe.\
\
Tras encontrar y derrotar a Manzaneda, recuperaste la llave de él. Ahora debes regresar con el condestable Vadosalvia.","Se ha visto a Manzaneda entrando al campamento principal de Montebruno en la parte más al norte del bosque de Chet.\
\
Tras saber que Rurik solo era culpable de miedo, Vadosalvia recordó el nombre que Rurik proporcionó como un bandido dentro del campamento principal de Montebruno en el bosque de Chet. Vadosalvia quiere que busques a Manzaneda y obtengas la llave que le robó a Rurik.","Ladrones Montebruno"}},
[1757]={nameES="Objetos de valor de Montebruno",objectivesES={"Has encontrado un recibo","El condestable Vadosalvia se puede encontrar cerca del centro de Combe, con sus compañeros.\
\
Vadosalvia te envió a confrontar al líder de los Montebruno en la granja del Viejo Bauman. Encontraste un recibo firmado por un 'Rurik' en el cuerpo del Montebruno. El condestable Vadosalvia querrá saber sobre esto.","Buscar objetos de valor","El condestable Vadosalvia ha aprendido que los bandidos Montebruno han estado tratando de mantenerse trabajando en una granja que ocuparon en lo profundo del bosque de Chet, al este de Combe.","Objetos de valor de Montebruno","La granja del Viejo Bauman está en lo profundo del bosque de Chet, al final del camino hacia el este.\
\
El condestable Vadosalvia cree que si enfrentas al líder de los Montebruno en la granja del Viejo Bauman, podrías recuperar algunos de los objetos de valor que los Montebruno han robado.","Llevar el pergamino al condestable Vadosalvia","Llevar el recibo al condestable Vadosalvia en Combe"}},
[1758]={nameES="Filo de los dunledinos",objectivesES={"Llygad el Filo ha sido derrotado","Llygad el Filo lidera las fuerzas de las Tierras Brunas desde el interior de la Escuela de Tham Mírdain, cuya entrada se encuentra al sureste de Echad Mirobel.\
\
Faellion desea que derrotes al campeón para disuadir a las fuerzas de las Tierras Brunas de sus intenciones belicistas.","Acaba con Llygad el Filo","Filo de los dunledinos"}},
[1759]={nameES="Blade of the East",objectivesES={"Dagbert is at Etheburg in the Brown Lands.\
\
You should bring news of your victory to Dagbert.","The Khundolar have swept into the Brown Lands in preparation to descend upon the Riddermark like a double-edged sword.","Talk to Dagbert in the Brown Lands","Blade of the East","Khundolar Easterlings can be found at Lashkarg, south-east of Etheburg in the Brown Lands.\
\
Dagbert has asked you to enter Lashkarg, war-camp of the Khundolar, and defeat the Easterling warriors there."}},
[1760]={nameES="Blade of the East",objectivesES={"The Khundolar have swept into the Brown Lands in preparation to descend upon the Riddermark like a double-edged sword.","Khundolar Easterlings can be found at Lashkarg, south-east of Etheburg in the Brown Lands.\
\
Céola has asked you to enter Lashkarg, war-camp of the Khundolar, and defeat the Easterling warriors there in hopes that they will believe Etheburg's numbers greater than they truly are.","Blade of the East","Céola is at Etheburg in the Brown Lands.\
\
You should bring news of your victory to Céola.","Talk to Céola at Etheburg in the Brown Lands"}},
[1761]={nameES="Blades and Plows",objectivesES={}},
[1762]={nameES="Blades for the Coming Storm",objectivesES={"Radigond can be found in Díngarth.\
\
You should give the sharpened swords to Radigond.","Blunt swords can be found in Díngarth.\
\
You should gather blunt swords.","Blades for the Coming Storm","Give the sharpened swords to Radigond","Radigond, daughter of Huneric Hundred-slayer, has been tasked with maintaining Díngarth's weapon stores.","A grindstone can be found in Díngarth.\
\
You should sharpen the swords on the grindstone."}},
[1763]={nameES="Blades of the Enemy",objectivesES={"Blades of the Enemy","Using the information from the scouting report gathered from Emlû, Galâmka has asked you to take weapons from the Orcs in Maurûsh so they can arm themselves.","Galâmka has asked you to gather weapons from the Orcs in Maurûsh to help arm the fighters in Ub Nishir.","Give the weapons to Galâmka in Ub Nishir","Return to Galâmka in Ub Nishir with the weapons you have retrieved in Maurûsh."}},
[1764]={nameES="Blades of the Rebels",objectivesES={}},
[1765]={nameES="Mantas para los Enanos",objectivesES={"Hay osos de montaña que habitan en las Gargantas del Bruinen, en el Bosque de los Trolls.\
\
Mientras estés en las Gargantas del Bruinen, deberías cazar osos para obtener pieles.","Entrega las pieles que recolectaste a uno de los enanos acampados en Thorenhad","Mantas para los Enanos","Los osos de montaña que viven en las Gargantas del Bruinen proporcionarían abundantes pieles que los enanos podrían usar para confeccionar mantas.","Recolecta pieles de los osos de montaña de las Gargantas del Bruinen","Hay enanos acampando con los Elfos en Thorenhad, en las Gargantas del Bruinen.\
\
Debes entregar las pieles que recolectaste a uno de los enanos en Thorenhad."}},
[1766]={nameES="Blankets for the Winter",objectivesES={"Offram, pleased by your hunting prowess and offering of meat, hides, and ivory, has more tasks for you.","Sew warm blankets for the people of Eaworth","Talk to Offram outside the Vendor Hall in Eaworth","The infirmary's sewing-table can be found outside the infirmary in Eaworth.\
\
Offram asked you to sew warm blankets for the people of Eaworth.","Collected sewing-needles from Ordbéorth","Collect sewing-needles from Ordbéorth","People in need of warm blankets can be found throughout Eaworth.\
\
Offram wants you to deliver the warm blankets you sewed to the people of Eaworth.","Blankets for the Winter","Collected spools of thread from Nothgyth","Offram stands guard outside the Vendor Hall in Eaworth.\
\
You should let Offram know that you have delivered the blankets as he had asked.","Offram has given you the hides you need. Thread can be obtained from Nothgyth in the southern part of the city. Ordbéorth in the northern part of the city can provide sewing-needles.\
\
Offram has asked you to collect the hides, thread, and needles necessary to make warm blankets for the people of Eaworth.","Collect spools of thread from Nothgyth"}},
[1767]={nameES="Mantas de los lobos aulladores",objectivesES={"Lleva pieles de lobo a Arinora","Se pueden encontrar lobos en las ruinas de Minas Eriol al sur de la Posada Abandonada, en las Colinas de los Vientos al noreste y en el Paso de Moscagua al norte.\
\
Arinora de la Posada Abandonada te pidió que recogieras pieles de lobo para que pueda hacer mantas para los huéspedes de la posada.","Arinora está abrumada por las muchas responsabilidades que tiene para el mantenimiento de la Posada Abandonada.","Mantas de los lobos aulladores"}},
[1768]={nameES="Bleeding Heart",objectivesES={"Building a horn to summon reinforcements to Tol Ascarnen requires that several pieces be collected and assembled for an Orc to watch over and use when the Free Peoples make their assault against the fort.","The Leafcull Huorns make their home in the southern woods of Hithlad. Find the Huorn amonst the trees south of the Grimwood Lumber Camp in Hithlad, to the south-west of Tol Ascarnen.\
\
Angmar's forces at Tol Ascarnen are building a horn to call reinforcements to the fight when the Free Peoples return to assault the area. Kaasak has tasked you with collecting the heartwood of a Leafcull Huorn to act as the stand upon which the horn will rest. Damaging the heartwood will make it useless.","Bleeding Heart","Talk to Soldier Kaasak at Tol Ascarnen"}},
[1769]={nameES="La plaga en la mordida",objectivesES={"Tu misión es viajar al norte a Thalat Tîr para reducir el número de arañas despiadadas en la zona, así como traer muestras de su veneno para los eruditos de Sul Madásh.","La plaga en la mordida","Derrota a la matriarca de la plaga"}},
[1770]={nameES="Blight of the Thyrsir",objectivesES={"Blight of the Thyrsir","Although you came too late to save the livestock of Tríubad from the poisons of the Taurogrim, you have done much to help protect the Woodmen and other folk of the Vales of Anduin from their blight.","The gnarled branches of the Taurogrim contain a potent poison fatal to Men and beasts alike.","Livestock slain by the blight of the Taurogrim can be found throughout Tríubad.\
\
Fearing the blight of the Taurogrim will spread from those that succumbed to it, Vilibald has asked you to burn the remains of slain livestock at Tríubad.","You burned the remains of slain livestock at Tríubad.","Completado"}},
[1771]={nameES="Blight-weavers",objectivesES={"Return to Málacál near Sul Madásh and report your success of defeating spiders in eastern Adagím.","Málacál has asked that you travel to the east of Sul Madásh and help her and her hunters thin the number of blighted spiders that can be found.","Return to Málacál","Blight-weavers"}},
[1772]={nameES="Blinding the Enemy",objectivesES={}},
[1773]={nameES="Blinding the Enemy",objectivesES={}},
[1774]={nameES="Blinding the Enemy",objectivesES={"Corsair snipers can be found around Dol Brannor in Dor-en-Ernil.\
\
You have discovered a group of Corsairs led by a Haradrim War-master. You should defeat them before they can slay more travellers on the roads below.","Blinding the Enemy","Patrol Dol Brannor","The Haradrim and Corsairs have laid claim to Dol Brannor, and now their cruel archers use the beacon's perch to slay those who would dare to travel the roads below.","Defeat the Haradrim War-master at Dol Brannor","Dol Brannor can be found to north-west of Linhir in Dor-en-Ernil.\
\
Herion has asked you to patrol the beacon of Dol Brannor and defeat any of the Enemy's forces that have made camp there.","Talk to Herion in Linhir","Dol Brannor has been seized by Corsair sentries!","The Haradrim War-master has been defeated!","Herion can be found in Linhir in eastern Dor-en-Ernil.\
\
You have crippled the forces at Dol Brannor, at least for the moment, and should now return to Herion."}},
[1775]={nameES="Blinding the Eye",objectivesES={}},
[1776]={nameES="Blinding the Watching-stones",objectivesES={"Spakorth can be found outside the lower gates to Lûghash in Dor Amarth.\
\
You have forced Zôreth's fell spirits from the watching-stones, but some appear to have returned to her keeping in Lûghash. You should meet with Spakorth and tell him what has happened.","Zôreth, Mistress of Lûghash, has bound foul spirits to many of the intact watching-stones in Dor Amarth and now they keep watch on her servants and foes alike.","A fell spirit flies from the stone and begins to attack!","Talk to Spakorth at Lûghash","Forced from its stone vessel, the fell spirit turns and flees toward Lûghash!","Blinding the Watching-stones","Zôreth's watching-stones can be found along the causeway to Lûghash and Barad-dûr in Dor Amarth.\
\
Spakorth has asked you to challenge Zôreth's watching-stones and drive out the evil spirits bound to them.","Although it is unclear if a spirit dwells within it, the statue of the Enemy seems to resist your efforts..."}},
[1777]={nameES="Punto ciego",objectivesES={"Cráneo de enano adquirido","Obtén evidencia del paso del enano","Regresa con Brazofero en las Vetas del Cuerno Rojo","Brazofero te ha pedido rastrear el camino de un enano desaparecido y traerle cualquier evidencia que encuentres de su paso.","Se rumorea que el enano pasó por el corazón de las Vetas del Cuerno Rojo, cerca de la vía del carro minero que corre de este a oeste, justo al norte del pasaje que lleva a las Profundidades Llameantes.\
\
Deberías reunir pruebas de su paso y llevarlas a Brazofero, que desea conocer el progreso de la misión del enano.","Brazofero está en la Guardia Orca, en las Vetas del Cuerno Rojo de Moria, al noroeste del lugar donde encontraste los restos del enano.\
\
Deberías regresar junto a él con el cráneo, ya limpio de toda carne.","Punto ciego"}},
[1778]={nameES="Blockade of Variags",objectivesES={}},
[1779]={nameES="Blockade on Barazinbar",objectivesES={"Raise a banner of the Haban'akkâ of Thráin at Zaghúth","The Haban'akkâ of Thráin will be victorious!","Blockade on Barazinbar","You have done much to hinder the Orcs and their vile allies at Zaghúth.\
\
You should raise a banner of the Haban'akkâ of Thráin at Zaghúth.","Upon the slopes of Barazinbar at Zaghúth, the Orcs and goblins of Moria have constructed a blockade to hinder the Haban'akkâ of Thráin at Azanulbizar.","Orcs, goblins, Warg-riders, and barricades can be found at Zaghúth.\
\
King Thráin has commanded you to join in the assault at Zaghúth. You should aid the Haban'akkâ of Thráin."}},
[1780]={nameES="Blocking the Pass",objectivesES={"Although the Redhorn Pass remains blocked, your efforts to impair the defences of Zaghúth has loosened the Orcs' grip on Barazinbar.","While exploring the heights of the Redhorn Pass, you have come across the Orkish encampment of Zaghúth. Within Zaghúth, the Orcs have constructed a number of crude barricades to hinder the passage of the dwarves of the Haban'akkâ. In fact, it was this very blockade that forced the Haban'akkâ to approach Azanulbizar from the south instead of taking the Redhorn Pass.\
\
You should destroy the Orkish barricades at Zaghúth and help to make clear the way for the Haban'akkâ.","Orkish barricades can be found at Zaghúth.\
\
You should destroy Orkish barricades at Zaghúth.","Blocking the Pass","You have destroyed many Orkish barricades at Zaghúth.","Destroy Orkish barricades at Zaghúth","Completado","Discovered when the Haban'akkâ first attempted to travel to Azanulbizar, the Orcs of Moria have constructed a crude blockade on the slopes of Barazinbar, the Redhorn."}},
[1781]={nameES="Blogmal Blessings",objectivesES={}},
[1782]={nameES="Blood Flows Like Wine",objectivesES={}},
[1783]={nameES="Blood Flows Like Wine, Part 2",objectivesES={}},
[1784]={nameES="Blood Flows Like Wine, Part 3",objectivesES={}},
[1785]={nameES="Blood Flows Like Wine, Part 4",objectivesES={}},
[1786]={nameES="Blood Flows Like Wine, Part 5",objectivesES={}},
[1787]={nameES="Blood for Blood",objectivesES={"The Corsairs and Haradrim make ready once more for battle at Linhir as the Heirs of Castamir seek to avenge their fallen.","Talk to Erchar in Linhir","Erchar can be found in Linhir in eastern Dor-en-Ernil.\
\
Erchar has asked you to aid him in protecting Linhir from a renewed attack. You should speak to him when you are ready.","Erchar can be found in Linhir in eastern Dor-en-Ernil.\
\
You have defeated the attacking forces from Dor-en-Ernil and Lebennin, but at the cost of Garvir's life. You should speak to Erchar.","Blood for Blood","DNT -- will not be seen","Talk to Erchar"}},
[1788]={nameES="Blood in the Snow",objectivesES={}},
[1789]={nameES="Blood of Azog: A Lesson Hard-learned",objectivesES={"Durin can be found in the war-room at Annâk-khurfu.\
\
Náin the Slakeless has advised you to bring word to Prince Durin that he should stay his hand in the war and consult his father, Thorin, at the Lonely Mountain.","Talk to Agnar Brokentooth","Enemies can be found throughout the War of Three Peaks. Agnar Brokentooth, Lági Helmbiter, and Reithvald Red-ember of the Kharum-ubnâr can be found at Zarkul-sulûn and nearby encampments during the War of Three Peaks.\
\
Náin the Slakeless, uncle of Durin, has asked you to present Durin's plan to reclaim Mount Gundabad to Agnar Brokentooth, Lági Helmbiter, and Reithvald Red-ember. He has also asked you to slay enemies of the Gabil'akkâ in the War of Three Peaks.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: You may access the War of Three Peaks by using the Blazon of the Gabil'akkâ behind Durin in Annâk-khurfu or by taking a travel route from the stable-master outside Annâk-khurfu.</rgb>","Talk to Durin at Annâk-khurfu","Zarkul-sulûn can be found in the War of Three Peaks.\
\
Durin has asked you to return to the war-front and seek the counsel of his uncle, Náin, at Zarkul-sulûn.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: You may access the War of Three Peaks by using the Blazon of the Gabil'akkâ behind Durin in Annâk-khurfu or by taking a travel route from the stable-master outside Annâk-khurfu.</rgb>","Talk to Lági Helmbiter","Travel to Zarkul-sulûn in the War of Three Peaks","Although the din of war can be heard in the distance, Zarkul-sulûn is quiet","Náin the Slakeless can be found at Zarkul-sulûn in the War of Three Peaks.\
\
Durin has asked you to return to the war-front and seek the counsel of his uncle, Náin, at Zarkul-sulûn.","Náin the Slakeless can be found at Zarkul-sulûn in the War of Three Peaks.\
\
You have slain many foes in the War of Three Peaks, and you have heard the guidance of Agnar, Lági, and Reithvald in regard to Prince Durin's plan to reclaim Gundabad. You should return to Náin.","Eager to put an end to the War of Three Peaks, Durin has devised a plan to reclaim Mount Gundabad.","Blood of Azog: A Lesson Hard-learned","Talk to Reithvald Red-ember","Talk to Náin the Slakeless at Zarkul-sulûn","Durin can be found in the war-room at Annâk-khurfu.\
\
Glóin has asked you to speak to Durin."}},
[1790]={nameES="Blood of Azog: At Seventh Light",objectivesES={"Travel to Annâk-khurfu in Elderslade","Find Prince Durin and Hermáth Stormhammer in the war-room at Annâk-khurfu","With Hermáth Stormhammer near at his side, Durin appears both confused and awed","Hersegg can be found outside Annâk-khurfu in Elderslade.\
\
You have arrived at Annâk-khurfu in Elderslade and Hermáth Stormhammer has gone to speak to Prince Durin. You should talk to Hersegg.","Talk to Hermáth Stormhammer at Annâk-khurfu","Talk to Hermáth Stormhammer in the Hall Under the Mountain, in Erebor","King Thorin can be found at his throne in the Hall Under the Mountain at Erebor.\
\
After preparing for the journey to Elderslade, Hermáth Stormhammer has suggested the three of you speak to King Thorin. You should talk to King Thorin.","Talk to Durin at Annâk-khurfu","Dashing off, Hersegg enters Annâk-khurfu","Hermáth Stormhammer can be found before King Thorin's throne in the Hall Under the Mountain at Erebor.\
\
After bidding farewell to King Thorin, Hermáth and Hersegg appear ready to begin the journey to Elderslade. You should talk to Hermáth Stormhammer.","As Hermáth walks into Annâk-khurfu, Hersegg sighs","As you arrive at Annâk-khurfu, Hermáth and Hersegg look out upon Elderslade","Durin can be found in the war-room at Annâk-khurfu.\
\
After Hermáth Stormhammer's arrival at Annâk-khurfu, Durin appears equally confused and awed. You should find and talk to Durin.","King Thorin can be found in the Hall Under the Mountain, in Erebor.\
\
Hoping to set out for Elderslade, Hermáth Stormhammer has urged you to bid your farewells to King Thorin. You should find King Thorin in the Hall Under the Mountain.","Durin can be found in the war-room at Annâk-khurfu.\
\
You have returned to Annâk-khurfu at last. You should find and talk to Durin.","Find King Thorin in the Hall Under the Mountain, in Erebor","Hermáth Stormhammer can be found outside Annâk-khurfu in Elderslade.\
\
You have arrived at Annâk-khurfu in Elderslade. You should talk to Hermáth Stormhammer.","Annâk-khurfu can be found in Elderslade.\
\
You should travel to Annâk-khurfu in Elderslade with Hermáth and Hersegg.","After resolving to aid King Thorin Stonehelm and Prince Durin, Hermáth Stormhammer and Hersegg prepare to join the Gabil'akkâ at Elderslade.","Talk to King Thorin in the Hall Under the Mountain, in Erebor","Talk to Hersegg at Annâk-khurfu","Blood of Azog: At Seventh Light","You arrive at King Thorin's throne with Hermáth and Hersegg at your side"}},
[1791]={nameES="Blood of Azog: Brethren of Past and Present",objectivesES={"Blood of Azog: Brethren of Past and Present","<rgb=#FF00FF>Hail</rgb> Nár at Akrâz-zahar","Travel to Akrâz-zahar in the Dwelling-halls of Tumnu-dûm, in Erebor","Across the dimly-lit hall of Akrâz-zahar, you spot a young dwarf matching King Thorin's description","Hersegg stands behind a bar within Akrâz-zahar, dutifully cleaning plates and mugs.","Find Hersegg in Akrâz-zahar","As King Thorin prepares to call upon the Longbeards and their allies to muster to Mount Gundabad, his thoughts turn to the Kharum-ubnâr of the Lonely Mountain.","Nár can be found at Akrâz-zahar in the Dwelling-halls of Tumnu-dûm, in Erebor.\
\
Frithgeir hopes Nár might bid you well in your quest before he returns home to rest. You should hail Nár, and see if he wishes to say anything.","Hersegg can be found at Akrâz-zahar in the Dwelling-halls of Tumnu-dûm, in Erebor.\
\
After seeing Frithgeir and Nár off, you should return to your task and find Hersegg at Akrâz-zahar.","As you enter Akrâz-zahar, a familiar dwarf greets you!","Nár smiles happily, but he does not appear to notice you.","Frithgeir can be found at Akrâz-zahar in the Dwelling-halls of Tumnu-dûm, in Erebor.\
\
Nár's mind appears clouded, but he seemed to wish you well. You should talk to Frithgeir.","Nár shuffles for a moment, but his gaze soon fixes upon you","Hersegg can be found at Akrâz-zahar in the Dwelling-halls of Tumnu-dûm, in Erebor.\
\
You have found Hersegg at Akrâz-zahar. You should deliver King Thorin's missive to Hersegg.","Deliver King Thorin's missive to Hersegg at Akrâz-zahar","Talk to Frithgeir at Akrâz-zahar","Akrâz-zahar can be found in the Dwelling-halls of Tumnu-dûm, in Erebor.\
\
King Thorin has asked you to deliver a missive to Hersegg, granddaughter of Hermáth Stormhammer, at Akrâz-zahar that the wisdom of the Kharum-ubnâr might help guide Durin to victory. You should travel to Akrâz-zahar.","After a moment, Frithgeir and Nár depart Akrâz-zahar","Nár glances around Akrâz-zahar, seemingly unaware of your presence","Frithgeir can be found at Akrâz-zahar in the Dwelling-halls of Tumnu-dûm, in Erebor.\
\
Upon entering Akrâz-zahar, you have come across the dwarf, Frithgeir, and his companion, Nár. You should talk to Frithgeir."}},
[1792]={nameES="Blood of Azog: Fathers and Sons",objectivesES={"Listen to King Thorin's thoughts of his father, Dáin","King Thorin can be found at his throne in the Hall Under the Mountain at Erebor.\
\
You should talk to King Thorin.","Deliver the letters, parcels, and Durin's missive to King Thorin in the Hall Under the Mountain, in Erebor","King Thorin can be found at his throne in the Hall Under the Mountain at Erebor.\
\
Durin has written a missive to be delivered to his father, Thorin, at Erebor. You should deliver the letters, parcels, and Durin's missive to King Thorin at Erebor.","King Thorin can be found at his throne in the Hall Under the Mountain at Erebor.\
\
King Thorin is musing on thoughts of his son, Durin, and his father, Dáin.","With great relief, you set everything on the landing before King Thorin's throne","Talk to Durin at Annâk-khurfu","Blood of Azog: Fathers and Sons","Durin can be found in the war-room at Annâk-khurfu.\
\
You have collected all of the letters and parcels prepared by the Longbeards of the Gabil'akkâ. You should return to Durin.","As his thoughts turn to Durin, Thorin's voice swells:\
\
'I have always been the more cautious of Dáin's sons, and it has served me well. But for too long, I believed it would suit Durin in much the same manner.\
\
'It was not so long ago that I sequestered Durin in the Iron Hills while battle raged in the Dale-lands, but now my son leads an army to reclaim the Mountain-home. I dared not dream that Gundabad might be within reach, especially after the failure of the Iron Garrison, and yet, my son has proven its possibility, both to me and to all of Durin's Folk.\
\
'Durin is not as hot-tempered as my brother, nor is he as measured as his father—he is himself, and that is enough. Durin will err, as any dwarf will in his time, but I did not name him Durin that he would earn the name in his life—the name will earn him through his deeds.'","As he reminisces about Dáin, Thorin's voice softens:\
\
'What can be said of my father, Dáin, that has not been etched into the very history of Durin's Folk?\
\
'He was but a stripling when he slew the Great-orc, Azog, at Azanulbizar. It was he who answered the call of Thorin Oakenshield and defended the Lonely Mountain against Bolg and the goblins of the North, and in so doing, ushered in a time of peace between Men, Elves, and dwarves. And again, when the Enemy sent his servants to the gates of the Lonely Mountain, he died in defence of his people—a hero to his last breath!\
\
'But despite all of his great deeds, I knew him as my father. I was his son, and Durin, his beloved grandson.\
\
'I must confess that I often saw more of Dáin in Durin than I did in myself, but what greater dwarf could one aspire to be?'","Talk to King Thorin in the Hall Under the Mountain, in Erebor","Letters and parcels can be found within and without at Annâk-khurfu.\
\
Durin has asked you to collect the letters and parcels of Longbeards fighting in the War of Three Peaks before you depart for the Lonely Mountain.","King Thorin's mind turns to thoughts of Dáin and Durin","After seeking the counsel of his uncle, Náin, Durin has chosen to send word to his father, King Thorin III Stonehelm, at the Lonely Mountain.","Listen to King Thorin's thoughts of his son, Durin"}},
[1793]={nameES="Blood of Azog: Muster to the Mountain-home",objectivesES={"Deliver a missive to Garni at Erebor","Vísbur accepts the missive, and prepares to set off","Deliver a missive to Fregi at Erebor","King Thorin's riders can be found at the Lonely Mountain, Erebor.\
\
King Thorin has asked you to deliver missives to his riders at Erebor. You should deliver missives to King Thorin's riders.","After you delivered a missive to Hersegg, granddaughter of Hermáth Stormhammer, and learned of the Sixth War of the Dwarves and Orcs, King Thorin has tasked you with guiding his swiftest riders to send word of the muster to the Mountain-home.","King Thorin can be found at his throne in the Hall Under the Mountain at Erebor.\
\
You have delivered all of the missives to King Thorin's riders at Erebor. You should return to King Thorin.","Deliver a missive to Uddvar at Erebor","Talk to King Thorin in the Hall Under the Mountain, in Erebor","Deliver a missive to Vísbur at Erebor","Garni accepts the missive, and prepares to set off","Blood of Azog: Muster to the Mountain-home","Skalla accepts the missive, and prepares to set off","Deliver a missive to Skalla at Erebor","Fregi accepts the missive, and prepares to set off","Uddvar accepts the missive, and prepares to set off"}},
[1794]={nameES="Blood of Azog: The Sixth War",objectivesES={"Complete your study of Hermáth Stormhammer's account of the Battle of Azanulbizar","Blood of Azog: The Sixth War","Hersegg can be found at Akrâz-zahar in Erebor, the Lonely Mountain.\
\
You have listened to Hersegg's telling of Nár's tale as transcribed by her grandfather, Hermáth Stormhammer. You should talk to Hersegg.","King Thorin can be found at his throne in the Hall Under the Mountain at Erebor.\
\
You have finished your study of Hermáth Stormhammer's account of the Battle of Azanulbizar. You should return to King Thorin.","Talk to King Thorin in the Hall Under the Mountain, in Erebor","Talk to Hersegg and learn of 'Nár's Tale'","To the surprise of both you and the dwarf Hersegg, King Thorin's missive directed Hersegg to share with you her grandfather's account of the Battle of Azanulbizar.","Begin your study of Hermáth Stormhammer's account of the Battle of Azanulbizar\
<rgb=#FF0000>(Use 'Tales of Yore: Azanulbizar' in Akrâz-zahar to travel to Azanulbizar, T.A. 2799)</rgb>","Talk to Hersegg at Akrâz-zahar","Hersegg can be found at Akrâz-zahar in Erebor, the Lonely Mountain.\
\
Hersegg has offered to tell you Nár's tale as transcribed by her grandfather, Hermáth Stormhammer. You should talk to Hersegg."}},
[1795]={nameES="Blood of Azog: Will of the Stormhammer",objectivesES={"Talk to Hermáth Stormhammer at Vosh Torú","King Thorin can be found at Vosh Torú in the Lonely Mountain.\
\
After talking with King Thorin, Hermáth Stormhammer has agreed to aid Prince Durin and the Gabil'akkâ. You should talk to King Thorin.","King Thorin can be found at his throne in the Hall Under the Mountain at Erebor.\
\
King Thorin has asked you to accompany him to Vosh Torú for a meeting with one of the Kharum-ubnâr. You should talk to King Thorin.","Hersegg can be found at Vosh Torú in the Lonely Mountain.\
\
As King Thorin left Vosh Torú, Hersegg called you over. You should talk to Hersegg.","Determined to aid his son, Durin, and the Dwarves of the Gabil'akkâ to reclaim Mount Gundabad, King Thorin Stonehelm hopes to enlist the aid of an old friend.","Talk to Hersegg at Vosh Torú","Leave Vosh Torú and await Hermáth Stormhammer in the Dwelling-halls","Hermáth Stormhammer can be found outside Vosh Torú in the Lonely Mountain.\
\
Hermáth Stormhammer has equipped himself, and it appears Hersegg has convinced him to let her join the Gabil'akkâ. You should talk to Hermáth Stormhammer.","After a brief wait, Hermáth and Hersegg walk out of Vosh Torú","You should wait for Hermáth Stormhammer outside Vosh Torú.","Hermáth Stormhammer can be found at Vosh Torú in the Lonely Mountain.\
\
In an effort to aid King Thorin, Hermáth Stormhammer has agreed to travel to Elderslade and join Prince Durin and the Gabil'akkâ in the reclamation of Mount Gundabad. You should talk to Hermáth Stormhammer.","Talk to King Thorin","Talk to King Thorin at Vosh Torú","Wait for Hermáth Stormhammer outside Vosh Torú","Vosh Torú can be found in the Lonely Mountain.\
\
Hermáth Stormhammer has asked you to wait outside Vosh Torú as he equips himself. You should leave Vosh Torú and wait outside.","You have left Vosh Torú and should now wait for Hermáth Stormhammer","As King Thorin leaves, Hersegg calls you over","Blood of Azog: Will of the Stormhammer","Talk to Hermáth Stormhammer"}},
[1796]={nameES="Blood of My Blood",objectivesES={"Ayaluk directed you to a location north-west along the shoreline","Ayaluk is concerned that the overseer in Rakhatâb has injured or killed his brother Zûfan.","Find Ayaluk's brother Zûfan","It appears that trail rations were taken","Speak with Ayaluk in Rakhatâb","Ulanor found Zûfan before you and exacted the blood price for his debts. You need to deliver this sad news to Ayaluk.","Bring the sad news to Ayaluk in Rakhatâb","Ayaluk's brother is dead by Overseer Ulanor's hand","It appears an oil lantern was taken","It appears a pack was taken","Witness the tragedy","Ayaluk is concerned about his brother. He went missing several days ago after a visit from a collector of debts.","Zûfan likely went to the place where the siblings used to hide as children, north from the city and then west along the cliffs near the shoreline. Go there and ensure that the brother is well.","Blood of My Blood","You discovered that there was a missing pack, oil lantern, and trail rations taken from the home."}},
[1797]={nameES="Blood of My Blood - Epilogue",objectivesES={}},
[1798]={nameES="Sangre de Númenor",objectivesES={"The spear can be found somewhere in the southern reaches of the Dead Marshes.\
\
Faramir has asked you to seek the Wainrider spear that slew him in the Dead Marshes in the hope that it might grant you passage into Dol Acharn.","Sangre de Númenor","Faramir can be found near the foot of Dol Acharn.\
\
You have recovered the remains of the Wainrider spearhead and should now return it to Faramir.","Search the Dead Marshes for the spear that slew Faramir","An evil presence lingers about the Wainriders upon the hill of Dol Acharn, and it urges even the hardiest warriors away.","Deliver the spearhead to Faramir near Dol Acharn","You have recovered a rusting, rotted spearhead of early Easterling make"}},
[1799]={nameES="Blood of the Black Serpent -- Tier 1",objectivesES={"As the Battle of the Pelennor Fields intensifies, the Men of Harad rally around their King and fight to hold against the warriors of Gondor and Rohan alike.","Defeat the Princes of Harad","Blood of the Black Serpent -- Tier 1","Defeat Jarl Dauthar","Derrota a la Serpiente Negra","The Black Serpent rallies the Men of Harad to greater viciousness as the many forces of Sauron move against Minas Tirith. In addition to his sons, the strongest of the Enemy's forces creep onto the field in search of you and your fellows."}},
[1800]={nameES="Blood of the Black Serpent -- Tier 2",objectivesES={"Blood of the Black Serpent -- Tier 2","As the Battle of the Pelennor Fields intensifies, the Men of Harad rally around their King and fight to hold against the warriors of Gondor and Rohan alike.","Defeat the Princes of Harad","Defeat Jarl Dauthar","Derrota a la Serpiente Negra","The Black Serpent rallies the Men of Harad to greater viciousness as the many forces of Sauron move against Minas Tirith. In addition to his sons, the strongest of the Enemy's forces creep onto the field in search of you and your fellows."}},
[1801]={nameES="Blood of the King",objectivesES={"Nimithil can be found in the lowest section of Ost Anglebed with her guards.\
\
You have spoken to many folk of Ost Anglebed and should now seek out Nimithil.","Maerien is uncertain, but recalls folk loyal to Castamir in her line","Blood of the King","Thorgant only seems interested in surviving the war","Malthellim's folk can be found throughout Ost Anglebed.\
\
Steward Malthellim has asked you to speak to the people of Ost Anglebed about the various rumours surrounding the Heirs of Castamir.","Nembadir is disgusted by the Heirs and wishes them driven from Gondor","Celairoth is intrigued by the idea of a new King of Gondor","Steward Malthellim's curiosity grows as the rumours of the Heirs of Castamir continue to spread throughout Lebennin.","Doliel is fearful of the Heirs and thinks they shall bring ruin to Gondor","Talk to Nimithil in Ost Anglebed"}},
[1802]={nameES="Blood of the Mountain",objectivesES={"You have sealed many leaks within Járnfast.","You have sealed many leaks and prevented the River Carnen from flooding Járnfast. As a result, the Dwarves of the Ironfold will be able to work unhindered to repair the halls of Járnfast.","Completado","Leaks can be found throughout Járnfast.\
\
Holkur has asked you to aid the Dwarves of the Iron Hills in sealing leaks from the underground source of the River Carnen in Járnfast.","Blood of the Mountain","When the earth shook following Sauron's defeat, great tremors came to the Emyn Engrin and now the River Carnen spills into the halls of Járnfast."}},
[1803]={nameES="Blood of the North-men",objectivesES={"Beckberry bushes can be found on the islet of Avabárg.\
\
Hoping to ward off illness and regain his youthful strength, Germund has asked you to seek out beckberries on the islet of Avabárg.","Blood of the North-men","Deliver the beckberries to Germund","Native to the western reaches of Wilderland, beckberries are considered a delicacy to the Woodmen.","Germund can be found in Hultvís.\
\
You have gathered several handfuls of beckberries and should now deliver them to Germund."}},
[1804]={nameES="La manada de Ojosangriento",objectivesES={"Has derrotao al malvado Ojosangriento, silenciando los estremecedores aullidos que resuenan al sur de los Campos de Fornost.","La manada de Ojosangriento","Has derrotado a Ojosangriento","Has derrotado al malvado Ojosangriento, silenciando los estremecedores aullidos que resuenan al sur de los Campos de Fornost.","Derrota a Ojosangriento","Ojosangriento ronda por el sureste de los Campos de Fornost.\
\
Debes derrota a Ojosangriento y a su manada de barghests.","Completado","Ojosangriento, una bestia sombría de Fornost, ronda en las cercanías con su manada de fieros barghests. Debes eliminar al mortífero Ojosangriento."}},
[1805]={nameES="Pacto de sangre",objectivesES={"Has enfrentado a la Dama de Seda y has sabido que en realidad era la hermana de Lornë, Muirnë. Has derrotado a la Dama de Seda en combate y ahora debes llevar las malas noticias de vuelta a Lornë.\
\
Lornë se encuentra en Tyrn Lhuig, en Malenhad.","Regresa con Lornë y cuéntale lo que le ha pasado a Muirnë","Desafía a la Dama de Seda","La Dama de Seda está en la fortaleza angmarim de Bail Boglakh, que guarda el camino hacia el este de Angmar, al norte de Malenhad.\
\
Lornë te ha pedido a ti y a tus compañeros que enfrenten a la Dama de Seda en la gran torre de la fortaleza, con la esperanza de encontrar y liberar a su hermana Muirnë.","Lornë cree que la Dama de Seda tiene a su hermana Muirnë cautiva en la torre alta de Bail Boglakh.\
\
Ella te ha pedido que enfrentes a la Dama de Seda con la esperanza de liberarla por fin.","Pacto de sangre"}},
[1806]={nameES="Runas manchadas de sangre",objectivesES={"Runas manchadas de sangre","Los espíritus malvados y sus amos Angmarim se encuentran en Ost Elendil, más allá del puente de Ariant.\
\
Debes derrotar a los espíritus malvados en el interior de Ost Elendil y recuperar las runas cubiertas de sangre utilizadas por los Angmarim para controlarlos."}},
[1807]={nameES="Blood-stained Tree",objectivesES={"Find a veteran of many battles somewhere in the East Wall who can shed light on the bloodstained tree","If you are able to find a veteran of many battles and combats in war somewhere in the East Wall, he may be able to shed some light on what happened at the Dead Orc Glade.","Blood-stained Tree","A dark stain discolours the bark of a solitary oak at the outskirts of a glade filled with the bodies of dead Orcs. The sight of blood is unmistakeable, but whose blood was it? And where did the wounded warrior go?\
\
Someone who has seen many battles in war might be able to shed some light on what happened here.","You have found a dark stain on the large oak tree in the glade filled with the bodies of dead Orcs."}},
[1808]={nameES="Piedras de Sangre",objectivesES={"Las bestias de las colinas de Fasach-larran suelen llevar piedras de sangre que encuentran en el suelo. Muchas de estas criaturas tienen su hogar en Nád Nathair, al norte de Aughaire.\
\
Lakhina te ha pedido que derrotes a las bestias de las colinas y recuperes las piedras de sangre opacas que suelen llevar.","Lakhina está en la isla central de Aughaire, al este del asiento de Crannog.\
\
Has reunido piedras de sangre opacas de las bestias de las colinas en Fasach-larran y ahora debes devolverlas a Lakhina.","Lakhina se ha enterado del desafío que Crannog te ha impuesto y sabe lo que quiere que hagas.","Lleva las piedras de sangre opacas a Lakhina","Piedras de Sangre"}},
[1809]={nameES="Achassoth el sanguinario",objectivesES={"Achassoth el sanguinario","Derrota a Achassoth","Has derrotado a un líder de las fuerzas del mal en los Campos de Fornost.","Te has topado con Achassoth, una presencia aterradora en los Campos de Fornost...","Achassoth se encuentra en el centro de los Campos de Fornost, al norte del camino que conduce al oeste hacia Evendim.\
\
Debes derrotar a Achassoth, ya que este ser ha arrebatado toda calidez a los Campos de Fornost.","Completado","Sientes un odio cerniéndose sobre ti, y te das cuenta que cerca hay una presencia llena de furia.\
\
Te has topado con Achassoth, un ser terrorífico, en los Campos de Fornost. La sed de sangre de esta entidad fantasmagórica ha crecido al arrebatar la vida a las tierras que la rodean.","Has expulsado a Achassoth","Has derrotado a un líder de las fuerzas del mal en los Campos de Fornost: Achassoth el sanguinario, azote de los Hombres."}},
[1810]={nameES="Ala Sanguinaria",objectivesES={"Cuithorn te habló del gran dragonzuelo Ala Sanguinaria y te encomendó la tarea de matarlo.","Cuinthorn está en el Búth Sánkhas de Aughaire, al sureste del mercado.\
\
Cuinthorn espera escuchar sobre tu éxito contra Ala Sanguinaria y su camada de dragonzuelos.","Ala Sanguinaria gobierna su camada de dragonzuelos desde la cima de los acantilados de Nad Nathair, por encima de las laderas inferiores donde habitan las bestias de las colinas. Nad Nathair se encuentra al norte de Aughaire, en Fasach-larran.\
\
Cuinthorn te habló de Ala Sanguinaria, un poderoso dragonzuelo que ha reclamado la vida de muchos grandes héroes, y se preguntó si tú y tus aliados serían los que pondrían fin a su reinado.","Ala Sanguinaria"}},
[1811]={nameES="Bloody Nose",objectivesES={"Bloody Nose","The Dievlig patrol can be found upon the hill north of Echad Naeglanc.\
\
Naeglanc has asked you to defeat the remnant of the patrol which attacked him and his allies and bring him their sigils.","After their rescue, Naeglanc and his allies returned to their encampment.","Talk to Naeglanc at Echad Naeglanc in the Bonevales","Naeglanc is at Echad Naeglanc, south of the hill where you fought the Dievlig patrol.\
\
You should bring the sigils you collected to Naeglanc with news of your victory."}},
[1812]={nameES="Bloody Threshold Raid Deeds!",objectivesES={}},
[1813]={nameES="Flor de las Ciénagas",objectivesES={"Canaddal está apostado al inicio del sendero que conduce al Páramo Alto, muy por encima de las Ciénagas Floridas.\
\
Debes llevar la flor que recolectaste a Canaddal de inmediato.","Una flor rara crece en un lugar a lo largo del Bruinen llamado las Ciénagas Floridas, un sitio donde habitan Acechadores de Pantano. La flor es muy hermosa y se dice que posee maravillosas propiedades curativas.","Flor de las Ciénagas","La flor rara crece en las Ciénagas Floridas, a lo largo del Bruinen.\
\
Canaddal te ha pedido que recolectes una flor rara para preparar medicinas para los visitantes.","Recolecta la flor rara","Entrega la flor rara a Canaddal","Has recolectado la flor rara"}},
[1814]={nameES="Soplador de vidrio",objectivesES={"La forja de vidrio está junto a Mundarico Hojarena en Dwaling.\
\
Mundarico Hojarena te ha pedido que uses la forja para soplar algo de vidrio.","Habla con Mundarico Hojarena en Dwaling","Mundarico Hojarena está en Dwaling.\
\
Mundarico Hojarena estará interesado en escuchar cómo ha ido tu primera experiencia soplando vidrio.","Una vez todos los materiales han sido reunidos, el vidrio debe ser forjado en el fuego y soplado para darle forma.","Soplador de vidrio"}},
[1815]={nameES="Blown on an Ill Wind",objectivesES={}},
[1816]={nameES="Desafilando la lanza",objectivesES={"Un gran grupo de orcos ha establecido un campamento al suroeste de Esteldín, una avanzada que avanza hacia el noroeste desde su ejército principal en Dol Dínen.\
\
Debes derrotar al cacique de los orcos en este campamento. Con su derrota, los orcos Ongbúrz restantes no podrán actuar hasta que llegue un nuevo líder.","Derrota al cacique Ongbúrz","Has derrotado al cacique Ongbúrz, un orco cruel que lideraba el poder de Gurzlum.","Un gran contingente de orcos se ha desplazado hacia el suroeste, encabezando el grueso del ejército mientras marchan por las Quebradas del Norte. Son orcos de la tribu Ongbúrz de Angmar, astutos constructores de armas de asedio y defensas.","El campamento Ongbúrz está al suroeste de Esteldín, cruzando la Dehesa del Rey.\
\
Debes derrotar al cacique orco con la esperanza de que su muerte cause confusión entre los Ongbúrz.","Completado","Desafilando la lanza"}},
[1817]={nameES="Boar Hunters (Daily)",objectivesES={}},
[1818]={nameES="Matar jabalí",objectivesES={"create entity/npc/mn_boar/mn_boar_brandyhills_brokentusk.wc and kill it","Matar jabalí","Prueba de matar jabalí","Ve y mata un jabalí","Has terminado"}},
[1819]={nameES="Daga de Colmillo de Jabalí",objectivesES={"Daga de Colmillo de Jabalí","Tu encuentro con un jabalí feroz no muy lejos del Gran Camino del Este te permitió obtener un colmillo de sorprendente fuerza y belleza.","Un armero en Rivendel podría ser capaz de forjar el colmillo de jabalí que obtuviste en un arma mortal.\
\
Es posible que Rivendel albergue a un armero capaz de trabajar con el colmillo de jabalí que encontraste.","No ves ningún defecto en el colmillo. Un colmillo como este podría valer buen dinero entre los Hombres o despertar la admiración de los Enanos, pero en manos de un armero élfico podría convertirse en un arma letal. Un armero de suficiente habilidad podría vivir en Rivendel.","Lleva el colmillo perfecto de jabalí a un armero élfico en Rivendel"}},
[1820]={nameES="Jabalíes haciendo camas",objectivesES={"Ham Cardogris espera tu regreso en la Obra de los Espinar.\
\
Debes regresar con Ham Cardogris e informarle de tu éxito.","Los jabalíes pueden encontrarse por todos los campos del norte de Bree.\
\
Ham Cardogris te pidió que cazaras jabalíes para él.","Los jabalíes están por todas partes en Bree, pero no siempre son bienvenidos. Ham Cardogris no aprecia la cantidad de jabalíes que pisan los campos cercanos y quiere reducir su número, para que no destruyan algunas de las fuentes de alimento para los animales destinados a la Obra de los Espinar.","Jabalíes haciendo camas","Regresa con Ham Cardogris en la Obra de los Espinar"}},
[1821]={nameES="Boars by the Hathollant",objectivesES={"You have done as Branach asked. Return to him.\
\
Branach can be found at his farm, Cornworth, north-east of Farrowfold.","A family of farmers has been dealing with boars encroaching on their land.","Boars by the Hathollant","You have been tasked to hunt boars for food.\
\
The boars in question may be found at the Farrowfold, south-west of Cornworth.","Talk to Branach"}},
[1822]={nameES="Presumir",objectivesES={"Habla con Thrymur en la Mansión de Thorin","Presumir","Proclama tu destreza en la Mansión de Thorin","Valthor se encuentra en el Refugio Sombrío en Khazad-dûm, muy al este de la Mansión de Thorin.\
\
Thrymur te pidió que regreses con Valthor en Moria y le repitas lo que le dijiste.","Habla con Valthor en el Refugio Sombrío de Moria","Thrymur está cerca del trono de Dwalin en la Mansión de Thorin.\
\
Thrymur no quedó impresionado contigo. Deberías hablar con él nuevamente y proclamarle tus grandes hazañas.","Valthor considera que el orgullo en las propias habilidades es fundamental para un Campeón.","El trono de Dwalin se encuentra en la Mansión de Thorin, muy al oeste de Moria.\
\
Valthor te ha encargado que vayas y presumas de tus grandes hazañas ante el trono de Dwalin."}},
[1823]={nameES="Boatswains in the Ranks",objectivesES={}},
[1824]={nameES="Boffins sueltos",objectivesES={"Encuentra a Caléndula Boffin en las ruinas de Bâr Faroth","Esmeralda Boffin está en Quiebra Larga, bailando.","Fosco Boffin está junto al río, maravillado con un bote hobbit que se mece en el agua","Habla con Berilac y los","Boffins sueltos","Bingo está en Campotieso, y Dinodas cree que podría haber visto dónde han ido los otros hijos Boffin.","Habla con Bingo Boffin en Lhúngobel","Fosco Boffin fue aparentemente a buscar botes élficos en los ríos del oeste de la Comarca Allende.","Bingo Boffin te ha seguido a Lhúngobel.","Encuentra a Griffo Boffin","Fosco Boffin ha encontrado un bote hobbit en uno de los ríos de la Comarca Allende.","Habla con Griffo Boffin","Por supuesto, has encontrado a Esmeralda Boffin en pleno baile","Berilac soñó con un delicioso olor llegando desde la Granja de Cotonorte, al este: justo el olor que atrae la atención de su hambriento hermano Griffo.","Caléndula Boffin se ha adelantado a los Campos Viejos para detener las fechorías de los trasgos.","Griffo Boffin está cerca de un carro que trae comida de la granja de Cotonorte","Esmeralda ha visto a Caléndula yendo en dirección norte hacia Bâr Faroth","Habla con Esmeralda en Quiebra Larga","Bingo ha llegado, con una expresión de preocupación","Fosco te ha dicho que Caléndula fue hacia el norte en dirección a Lhúngobel, buscando enemigos que vencer.","Oyes que alguien te llama, pero no es Caléndula","Habla con Dinodas fuera del nº 8 de la calle Aguamiel","Habla con Fosco Boffin en la orilla del río","Habla con Bingo Boffin en Campotieso","Esmeralda no volverá a Nobotella hasta que participes en su competición de baile. ¡Será mejor que <rgb=#00FF00>bailes</rgb>!","Griffo Boffin está aquí, palmeándose la barriga con satisfacción","Nárnaz el Castigador ha encontrado a un aventurero hobbit mortífero en Bâr Faroth, para su desgracia.","Bingo Boffin ha llegado a Bâr Faroth.","Interpreta otro <rgb=#00FF00>baile</rgb> o el mismo... ¡con sentimiento!","Bingo ha oído rumores de una competición de baile en Quiebra Larga, y piensa que podría ser el lugar donde encontrar a Esmeralda.","Dinodas Boffin ha arruinado la fiesta de inauguración de la casa de su hermana Angélica (con tu ayuda). Ahora, su madre Prisca te ha pedido que le ayudes a enmendar las cosas.","Habla con Esmeralda Boffin en Quiebra Larga","Interpreta un <rgb=#00FF00>baile</rgb> a tu elección","Ahora que has encontrado a todos sus hermanos y hermanas, debes volver con Dinodas en el exterior del nº 8 de la calle Aguamiel, en Nobotella.","Encuentra a Fosco Boffin","Esmeralda parece complacida con tu interpretación","Un trasgo herido se debate en el suelo: ¿es obra de Caléndula?","Encuentra a Esmeralda en la competición de baile en Quiebra Larga","Berilac ha dormido durante todo el alboroto en Campoviejo.","Busca a Caléndula y derrota trasgos en Lhúngobel (5/6)","Habla con Nárnaz el Castigador cerca de Bâr Faroth","No hay nada que hacer: ¡tienes que <rgb=#00FF00>bailar</rgb>!","Esmeralda Boffin está bailando en Quiebra Larga.","Encuentra a Caléndula Boffin en Campoviejo y pon fin a las fechorías de los trasgos","Habla con Bingo Boffin en Bâr Faroth"}},
[1825]={nameES="Bog-lifters",objectivesES={}},
[1826]={nameES="Bogbereth",objectivesES={"Lunathron te habló de una gran y vil araña, Bogbereth, que caza en Himbar.","Bogbereth","Gath Forthnír está en la parte oriental de Himbar, al sur y al este de Torech-i-Bogbereth.\
\
Lunathron te pidió destruir a la gran araña, Bogbereth. Ahora que ya no existe, puedes regresar para reclamar tu victoria.","Bogbereth caza en el extremo noreste de Himbar, al oeste y luego al norte de Gath Forthnír.\
\
Lunathron te advirtió que no enfrentes a Bogbereth con menos que una partida de guerra completamente armada. Debe ser derrotada, o seguirá engendrando su vil prole."}},
[1827]={nameES="Prole de Bogbereth",objectivesES={"Las arañas están al noreste de Himbar.\
\
Lunathron te habló de la progenie de Bogbereth, las crías de araña que son custodiadas por los Angmarim.","Prole de Bogbereth","Lunathron está en Gath Forthnír, al este de Himbar.\
\
Mataste a muchas arañas y a sus guardianes Angmarim, asegurando que la progenie de Bogbereth no suponga una amenaza para los Montaraces. Ahora deberías regresar con Lunathron.","Bogbereth la Araña está aliada con la Corona de Hierro. Su progenie es custodiada por los Angmarim y utilizada como soldados de muchas patas."}},
[1828]={nameES="La curiosidad de Bogrian",objectivesES={"Folkath se encuentra en el campamento al borde oeste de la Fosa Colmilluda.\
\
Debes regresar con Folkath para contarle las noticias de tu éxito.","Habla con Folkath en su campamento en la Fosa Colmilluda","La reina morroval, Bogrian, se ha escondido. Folkath y los demás han comenzado a investigar dónde podría aparecer a continuación.","La curiosidad de Bogrian","Hadi reside en el campamento con Folkath, en el borde oeste de la Fosa Colmilluda.\
\
Folkath recomienda que le preguntes a Hadi lo que ha aprendido sobre el clan de Bogrian.","Busca a los exploradores en su lugar de encuentro habitual, al sur de la entrada de Tith-maudhul, e intenta escuchar su conversación antes de derrotarlos.","Habla con Hadi para descubrir lo que sabe","Hadi te ha hablado de un lugar desde el que podrías espiar a los exploradores de Bogrian"}},
[1829]={nameES="Bolder Every Day",objectivesES={}},
[1830]={nameES="Reforzar las Defensas",objectivesES={"Reforzar las Defensas","Recoge la caja de sierras","Recoge el barril de clavos","Recoge la caja de martillos","Los suministros robados se encuentran en los campamentos orcos al noreste.\
\
Elsie te dijo que los granjeros de los alrededores debían traerle un barril de clavos, una caja de martillos y una caja de sierras, pero sus granjas fueron invadidas y sus bienes robados. Te ha pedido que vayas a los campamentos orcos al norte, a lo largo del Camino Verde, y recuperes los suministros que los orcos esparcieron.","Elsie Bosquerudo recibió el encargo de conseguir los suministros necesarios para mantener las barricadas de Puente de Caballetes, pero ahora tiene dificultades para encontrar lo que necesita.","Has recogido el barril de clavos","Has recogido la caja de sierras","Has recogido la caja de martillos"}},
[1831]={nameES="Bolstering the Feeble",objectivesES={}},
[1832]={nameES="Bolvág the Cursed, Scourge of Agarnaith",objectivesES={}},
[1833]={nameES="Bombs and Bats",objectivesES={}},
[1834]={nameES="Bombs and Bats",objectivesES={}},
[1835]={nameES="El Aliento de Bombur",objectivesES={"Múli se encuentra en Othrikar, en las Quebradas del Norte.\
\
Deberías entregarle la Cerveza Aliento de Dragón a Múli en lugar de su querida Cerveza Barbuda de Bombur.","Barmy Nudoraíz se encuentra en El Dragón Verde, en Delagua.\
\
Deberías hablar con Barmy Nudoraíz y recoger algo de Cerveza Aliento de Dragón, que será entregada al pobre Múli en lugar de su querida Cerveza Barbuda de Bombur.","Lleva la falsa Cerveza Barbuda de Bombur a Múli","Recoge la falsa Cerveza Barbuda de Bombur en El Dragón Verde","Has recogido la falsa Cerveza Barbuda de Bombur","El Aliento de Bombur"}},
[1836]={nameES="Bonds of Oak and Iron",objectivesES={"Thromur can be found at Durin's Stone.\
\
You have aided in the defeat of Urro One-hand and routed Bolg and the other Orcs at Durin's Stone. You should talk to Thromur.","Thromur can be found at Amdân.\
\
Thromur, esquire of Frerin, has asked you to accompany him to confront Shálun. You should talk to Thromur.","Talk to Thromur at Durin's Stone","Bonds of Oak and Iron","After King Thráin and his vanguard set out to assault the gates of Khazad-dûm, a sudden revelation threatens to raise tensions between the Longbeards and the Zhélruka at Amdân.","Talk to Thromur"}},
[1837]={nameES="Hombre Hueso",objectivesES={"La sombra vaga por el norte de las Quebradas de los Túmulos.\
\
Debes regresar con la sombra e informarle que el Hombre Hueso ha sido derrotado y las sombras liberadas.","Hombre Hueso","La sombra no sabe exactamente dónde se encuentra el Hombre Hueso, salvo que está en algún lugar del sur de las Quebradas de los Túmulos.\
\
La sombra habló de los huesos de un hombre de Cardolan que ha vuelto a la vida y del juramento que él y su hermano hicieron.","Habla con la Sombra Errante","Una sombra que se encontró vagando por las Quebradas de los Túmulos --que no parece tener malas intenciones-- sintió el llamado de su hermano y lucha por apaciguar la fuerza que ha regresado para despertarlos.","Derrota al Hombre Hueso"}},
[1838]={nameES="Libro 1, Capítulo 1: Extraños en Acebeda",objectivesES={"Tulk se encuentra al este de la puerta en ruinas, cerca de los muros de Moria, al sureste de Eregion.\
\
Ráthwald os ha dicho que una expedición de enanos ha llegado a Acebeda para buscar a Balin en las salas de Khazad-dûm. Os ha dicho que ofrecierais vuestra ayuda a Tulk justo más allá de la puerta en ruinas donde él hace guardia.","Libro 1, Capítulo 1: Extraños en Acebeda","Una expedición de enanos ha llegado a Acebeda con la intención de reclamar las perdidas salas de Khazad-dûm."}},
[1839]={nameES="Libro 1, Capítulo 10: En las Quebradas de los Túmulos",objectivesES={"Libro 1, Capítulo 10: En las Quebradas de los Túmulos","las Quebradas de los Túmulos están al norte y al este a lo largo de la Vieja Ruta de los Túmulos. Los crebain se detuvieron a posarse en los árboles dentro de las Quebradas de los Túmulos, al sur a lo largo de la cresta, sobre los bordes del bosque.\
\
Tom Bombadil encontró los crebain dentro de las Quebradas de los Túmulos, pero también mencionó la presencia de una mujer. Debes mantenerte alerta.","La Vieja Ruta de los Túmulos está al norte del bosque de Andraste. La casa de Tom Bombadil está al oeste y al sur a lo largo de la Vieja Ruta de los Túmulos.\
\
Andraste reveló que el Señor de los Nazgûl había ido a un lugar llamado Othrongroth, pero no pudiste aprender nada más antes de su muerte. Tom Bombadil es el Maestro del Bosque y de las Quebradas de los Túmulos. Podría saber dónde se encuentra Othrongroth.","Tom Bombadil estaba complacido con los lirios que encontraste para Baya de Oro y te ha dicho dónde se pueden encontrar los crebain que estabas buscando. También te dijo que había una mujer allí esperando.","Habla con Tom Bombadil en su casa","Encontrar y derrotar a los crebain y su amo"}},
[1840]={nameES="Book 1, Chapter 10: Keepers of the History",objectivesES={"You convey Dorthaneth's warning about the Heirs of Castamir and the one they call 'the Scourge.' Lothíriel frowns, deep in thought.\
\
'I will take Dorthaneth's warning to heart, but I do not know a great deal about the people of Umbar or their leaders. Every child of Gondor knows the tale of Castamir the Usurper, of course, but his is a name from long ago and I thought his line was ended. I do not know.\
\
'My father has always said the finest way to combat a new foe is to learn as much of his history and temper as you can, before facing him on the battlefield. I think this is wisdom. To that end, I ask you to go to the libraries of Dol Amroth and speak to Pethebir, the master of the archives. He was my tutor, when I was just a child, and he believed I neglected my studies. This will not change his mind! But now I need information, and he will know where to find it. Learn from him everything you can about the Corsairs and their masters. Perhaps in so doing you will discover something we can use to our advantage.'","Talk to Lothíriel","Book 1, Chapter 10: Keepers of the History","Pethebir is at the libraries of Dol Amroth.\
\
Lothíriel believes the best way to prepare for the threat of the Corsairs of Umbar is to learn as much about their ways as you can, and to that end she has sent you to the libraries of Dol Amroth.","Talk to Nosseth and learn about Prince Imrahil and Lothíriel","Lothíriel is in the Great Hall of Dol Amroth.\
\
You have learned that Lothíriel is unhappily betrothed to her cousin Boromir, and should tell her of her intended's fate.","You have given Lothíriel the message from Dorthaneth, and she wants to prepare for the coming of the Heirs of Castamir by acquiring as much knowledge about them as possible.","Talk to Cirhael and learn about Umbar","Talk to Pethebir","Talk to Pethebir in the library of Dol Amroth","Pethebir has given you the names of several scholars who may be able to help you.","Talk to Naremil and learn about Gondor"}},
[1841]={nameES="Libro 1, Capítulo 10: Al Borde del Peligro",objectivesES={"Skardí Doblafilos está detrás del mostrador de su herrería en Musgovilla.","Libro 1, Capítulo 10: Al Borde del Peligro","Skardí te dedica un gruñido a modo de saludo cuando entras en su tienda.","Meneldir te ha recomendado que regreses a la herrería de Skardí Doblafilos en Musgovilla para reabastecerte antes de tu viaje hacia el norte, rumbo a los parientes de Meneldir.","Bregoleth se ha despedido de ti y de Meneldir, prometiendo llevar noticia de la amenaza de Saruman a Rivendel.","Habla con Skardí Doblafilos en su herrería en Musgovilla.","Regresa a la herrería de Skardí Doblafilos en Musgovilla.","Meneldir está en el campamento de Idhobel, en el Eregion Occidental.","Habla con Meneldir en Idhobel."}},
[1842]={nameES="Libro 1, Capítulo 11: Othrongroth",objectivesES={"Aprendiste de la mujer Andraste que el Señor de los Nazgûl estaba viajando a un lugar llamado Othrongroth. Si pudieras espiar al Rey Brujo en este lugar, podrías aprender más sobre sus planes.","Regresa a Tom Bombadil y reclama tu recompensa.\
\
Tú y tus aliados se enfrentaron a las oscuras profundidades de Othrongroth y salieron victoriosos.","Habla con Tom Bombadil","Libro 1, Capítulo 11: Othrongroth","Tom Bombadil ha accedido a mostrarte el camino a Othrongroth, un túmulo en las Quebradas de los Túmulos."}},
[1843]={nameES="Libro 1, Capítulo 11: El Cruce en Tharbad",objectivesES={"Egfrith sale del río, jadeando.","Habla con Egfrith en la ribera norte del Gwathló.","Reúnente con Meneldir en la ribera sur del Gwathló, al noroeste de Musgovilla.","La mujer de Rohan está en la ribera sur del Gwathló, reacia a separarse de su corcel.","Habla con la mujer en el cruce del Gwathló.","El siguiente tramo de tu viaje para acompañar a Meneldir hasta los Dúnedain te llevará a Tharbad, en el río Gwathló.","Habla con Meneldir en el cruce del Gwathló.","Meneldir ha completado el cruce y está exhausto en la ribera norte.","Egfrith casi ha logrado cruzar el Gwathló.","Habla con Meneldir en la herrería de Musgovilla.","Egfrith ha cruzado el río con éxito.","Libro 1, Capítulo 11: El Cruce en Tharbad","Habla con Meneldir en la ribera norte del Gwathló.","Espera a que Egfrith se reúna contigo en la ribera norte del Gwathló.","Encontraste a una mujer de Rohan en la ribera sur del Gwathló.\
\
La mujer te observa con curiosidad desde la grupa de su corcel.","Te duelen los músculos, pero los ásperos gritos de los orcos cercanos fortalecen tu determinación.","La mujer piensa un momento y luego, con pesar, desmonta de su corcel.","Meneldir te aconsejó considerar muy bien el cruce del Gwathló en Tharbad: el río tiene una reputación peligrosa donde atraviesa la ciudad.","Meneldir está dentro de la herrería de Skardí Doblafilos en Musgovilla, considerando tus próximos pasos.","El cruce del Gwathló ha sido peligroso por muchos años, desde la inundación del puente y la pérdida de un paso seguro a través de Tharbad.","Alcanza el punto medio del cruce del Gwathló.","Nada hasta el otro lado del peligroso río Gwathló.","Una mujer se sienta a lomos de un alto corcel en la ribera del Gwathló.","Meneldir está en la ribera sur del Gwathló, pensando cómo responder a la mujer de Rohan que encontraste."}},
[1844]={nameES="Book 1, Chapter 11: The Swan-knights",objectivesES={"Find the hidden villain near the beacon of Maegond","You have defeated the Corsair raiders, and now Nedhros can return","Find and talk to Rovalang somewhere in the Blackroot Vale","Some villain is hidden atop the hill by the beacon of Maegond, in Lamedon.\
\
Heledir has agreed to return to Dol Amroth, but has asked you to seek out the hidden villain he sensed near the beacon of Maegond.","Nedhros is on the hill of Amon Lontir, by the great beacon.\
\
Lothíriel has sent you to recall Nedhros, the swan-knight she sent out of the city into the lands of Belfalas.","Rovalang was near the Hill of Erech, in Blackroot Vale, when last you saw him.\
\
Lothíriel asked you to find Rovalang, the swan-knight she sent to Blackroot Vale.","Corsair raiders have scaled the hill in secret. Defeat their leader to demoralize them!","Heledir is by the beacon of Maegond, in Lamedon.\
\
Lothíriel has sent you to recall the Swan-knight Heledir, currently scouting on her behalf in Lamedon.","Find and defeat the Corsair leader near the beacon of Maegond","You assure Heledir you will search for the mysterious villain, and he can return","Book 1, Chapter 11: The Swan-knights","You defeated the Corsair leader near Maegond, and demoralized his allies","Rovalang will return to Dol Amroth, but he has a great evil to combat first!","Lothíriel agrees with Pethebir that, given the unexpected severity of the Corsair threat, the swan-knights should return to Dol Amroth.","Talk to Nedhros on Amon Lontir, in Belfalas","Talk to Heledir by the beacon of Maegond, in Lamedon"}},
[1845]={nameES="Libro 1, Capítulo 12: Los planes del Jinete Negro",objectivesES={"Trancos espera tu regreso en su habitación del Poney Pisador, en Bree. La entrada que lleva desde las Quebradas de los Túmulos al Gran Camino del Este está al norte.\
\
Regresa a Bree y dile a Trancos lo que has aprendido sobre los planes del Rey Brujo.","Habla con Trancos","Libro 1, Capítulo 12: Los planes del Jinete Negro","Tom Bombadil te rescató de las garras del señor de los túmulos, pero aprendiste mucho que podría ayudar a Trancos y su gente.","Para encontrar la habitación de Gandalf en la posada El Poney Pisador de Bree, debes girar a la izquierda al salir de la sala común, hasta que solo puedas girar a la derecha. La habitación está al final del pasillo, en la parte superior de las escaleras.\
\
Cebadilla Mantecona te ha dicho que Trancos ha abandonado El Poney Pisador, pero que Gandalf, un Mago de renombre, llegó y pidió hablar con cualquiera que estuviera buscando al Montaraz. Deberías hablar con Gandalf y contarle lo que has aprendido.","Cebadilla Mantecona atiende a sus clientes en la sala común del Poney Pisador.\
\
Has regresado al Poney Pisador, pero la puerta de la habitación de Trancos está cerrada con llave. Deberías hablar con Cebadilla Mantecona para ver si sabe dónde se ha ido Trancos.","La puerta de la habitación de Trancos está cerrada"}},
[1846]={nameES="Book 1, Chapter 12: The Shadow in Morthond",objectivesES={"Lothíriel is in the Great Hall of Dol Amroth.\
\
You faced a Nazgûl in the Blackroot Vale, and though it has been driven away formless to its master, this is a clear sign that the Great Enemy has Gondor much on his mind.","Talk to Rovalang on the Hill of Erech, in Blackroot Vale","Rovalang is on the slopes of the Hill of Erech, in the Blackroot Vale.\
\
With the help of Rovalang, you have driven off the Nazgûl that threatened to learn of Aragorn's passage with the army of the Dead.","Rovalang is on the slopes of the Hill of Erech, in the Blackroot Vale.\
\
The Nazgûl must be prevented from learning of Aragorn's passage with the army of the Dead, at any cost.","Book 1, Chapter 12: The Shadow in Morthond","If Rovalang saw a Nazgûl on its winged steed, it must be prevented from learning of Aragorn's passage with the army of the Dead, at any cost.","Talk to Rovalang and face 'The Shadow in Morthond'","Talk to Lothíriel in the Great Hall of Dol Amroth"}},
[1847]={nameES="Book 1, Chapter 1: A Real Adventure",objectivesES={"Rodwen is up some stairs north of the Tower of Ecthelion, beyond a doorway spanned by a flower garland, in Minas Tirith (Midsummer).\
\
Rodwen has asked to meet you outside the throne room, and away from listening ears. For what purpose does the expert wedding-planner seek this secret meeting?","Talk to Rodwen up some stairs north of the Tower of Ecthelion, beyond a doorway spanned by a flower garland, in Minas Tirith (Midsummer)","Book 1, Chapter 1: A Real Adventure","Your adventures during the War of the Ring gave you the honour of befriending both Aragorn, newly-crowned king of Gondor, and his bride-to-be, Arwen Undómiel, Elf-maid and daughter of Elrond of Rivendell. Their wedding approaches, and you have been invited to attend the ceremony in Minas Tirith on Midsummer's Day.","Talk to Rodwen in the throne room of Minas Tirith (Midsummer)","Rodwen the wedding-planner is in the throne room of Minas Tirith as Midsummer's Day approaches. The name is familiar, but the Rodwen you met was an adventurer who ran into trouble along the East Wall of Rohan in the company of her friends, and not a planner of weddings.\
\
You may use stable-masters at major towns and cities to advance to Minas Tirith (Midsummer) for the wedding festivities."}},
[1848]={nameES="Book 1, Chapter 1: A Real Adventure",objectivesES={"Rodwen is up some stairs north of the Tower of Ecthelion, beyond a doorway spanned by a flower garland, in Minas Tirith (Midsummer).\
\
Rodwen has asked to meet you outside the throne room, and away from listening ears. For what purpose does the expert wedding-planner seek this secret meeting?","Book 1, Chapter 1: A Real Adventure","Talk to Rodwen up some stairs north of the Tower of Ecthelion, beyond a doorway spanned by a flower garland, in Minas Tirith (Midsummer)","Your adventures during the War of the Ring gave you the honour of befriending both Aragorn, newly-crowned king of Gondor, and his bride-to-be, Arwen Undómiel, Elf-maid and daughter of Elrond of Rivendell. Their wedding approaches, and you have been invited to attend the ceremony in Minas Tirith on Midsummer's Day.","Rodwen the wedding-planner is in the throne room of Minas Tirith as Midsummer's Day approaches.\
\
You may use stable-masters at major towns and cities to advance to Minas Tirith (Midsummer) for the wedding festivities.","Talk to Rodwen the wedding-planner in the throne room of Minas Tirith (Midsummer)"}},
[1849]={nameES="Book 1, Chapter 1: Gallant as Elf-lords",objectivesES={"Book 1, Chapter 1: Gallant as Elf-lords","Elweleth is by the horses at Thorenhad, the camp of the sons of Elrond in the Trollshaws.\
\
Elrohir has told you to speak with Elweleth, for she will know where Radanir the Ranger has gone, if anyone will.","Elrohir is at Thorenhad, the camp of the sons of Elrond, north of the Bruinen Gorges in the Trollshaws.\
\
Pethelen has suggested a first step for your urgent errand: a visit with Elrohir at Thorenhad for an introduction to Radanir, one of the Dúnedain currently staying at Thorenhad.","Radanir is at the Laenan cave system, located in the north-west reaches of the Gladdalf, the wood-troll infested marshes of the North Trollshaws.\
\
You have spoken with Elweleth at Thorenhad, and she told you where to find Radanir the Dúnadan.","Elrohir is at Thorenhad, his camp in the Trollshaws.\
\
You have given Radanir the message for which you sought him, and he has agreed to join the Grey Company on its journey south. You should return to Elrohir now that you have dealt with the Orc raiding-party in the Laenan caves.","Talk to Elrohir at Thorenhad","Orc-warriors, Orc-defilers, and their leaders can be found within the confusing network of tunnels known as Laenan.\
\
Radanir has agreed to join the Grey Company on its journey south to aid Aragorn, but he wants you to deal with the Orc raiding-party he tracked through the Trollshaws.","Defeated Laenan Orc-leader","Talk to Elweleth at Thorenhad","You have been charged by Elrond of Rivendell with gathering Aragorn's Dúnadan kin throughout Eriador.","Talk to Radanir","Defeat Laenan Orc-leader"}},
[1850]={nameES="Libro 1, Capítulo 1: Al Servicio del Mago",objectivesES={"Habla con Meneldir en el callejón entre los edificios de Musgovilla.","El camino se extiende al noreste pasando Musgovilla y hacia Enedwaith. ¿Vinieron los Uruks de esa dirección?","Los cuerpos de los Uruks yacen en el camino donde entra en Ciénaga de los Cisnes desde Enedwaith.","Meneldir está en la plaza del pueblo de Musgovilla, esperando que regreses con noticias de la frontera con Enedwaith.","Este Uruk fue asesinado por una espada muy parecida a la que él mismo portaba.","Tegwyn ha escuchado gran parte de tu conversación sobre Saruman y los Uruks.","Uruks muertos yacen en el camino que entra en la Ciénaga de los Cisnes desde Enedwaith.","Lleva las espadas Uruk a Meneldir en la plaza del pueblo de Musgovilla.","Habla con Tegwyn en el callejón entre los edificios de Musgovilla.","Si los Uruks recién llegados a Ciénaga de los Cisnes están realmente al servicio del Mago Saruman, debes averiguar todo lo que puedas sobre su propósito y por qué los envió a esta tierra.","Libro 1, Capítulo 1: Al Servicio del Mago","Lleva las espadas Uruk a Skardí Doblafilos dentro de su tienda en Musgovilla.","Meneldir querrá examinar las armas que portaban estos Uruks.","Meneldir está en un callejón entre edificios en Musgovilla.","Examina uno de los Uruks muertos a lo largo del camino.","Busca señales de los Uruks donde la carretera entra en Ciénaga de los Cisnes desde Enedwaith.","Skardí Doblafilos estará interesado en las espadas Uruk que recuperaste.\
\
Skardí siempre trabaja duro en su tienda de Musgovilla."}},
[1851]={nameES="Book 1, Chapter 1: The Muster of the Rohirrim",objectivesES={"Talk to Radwine at the camp in Dunharrow, by Éowyn","Éowyn is at the muster of the Rohirrim, at Dunharrow.\
\
You have spoken with some worried soldiers of the camp, and should return now to Éowyn.","Book 1, Chapter 1: The Muster of the Rohirrim","Darláf shakes his head, but his mood is improved","Talk to Sídrac by the encampment's supplier","Talk to Éowyn at the camp in Dunharrow","Radwine is speaking to Éowyn at the camp in Dunharrow.","Talk to Darláf at the south-east road","Éowyn has called you to Dunharrow, where the muster of the Rohirrim is well underway. Troubles weigh heavily upon her brow, especially concerning your mutual friend Aragorn and a decision he has made of late.","Sídrac believes the fighting strength of Rohan is insufficient to aid Gondor","Bosa remains dissatisfied that his injury will keep him from war","Darláf, Sídrac, and Bosa can be found at the encampment in Dunharrow, south of Éowyn's position.\
\
Éowyn has asked you to comfort some of the Men at the encampment in Dunharrow, for they heard of Aragorn's departure and have begun to question the wisdom of Théoden's ride to Minas Tirith.","Talk to Bosa at the eastern camp-fire"}},
[1852]={nameES="Libro 1, Capítulo 1: Desenredando el Hilo",objectivesES={"Trancos está en su habitación de la Posada del Poney Pisador en Bree, que se encuentra girando a la izquierda por el pasillo que sale de la sala común hasta que sólo se puede girar a la derecha. La habitación está al final del pasillo, a la derecha de las escaleras.\
\
Terminada la amenaza de Amdir, deberías informar a Trancos y ver si hay algo más que quiera que hagas.","Habla con Trancos","Trancos te ha pedido que le ayudes a acabar de una vez por todas con el alboroto asesino de Amdir.","Trancos está en su habitación de la Posada del Poney Pisador en Bree, que se encuentra girando a la izquierda por el pasillo que sale de la sala común hasta que sólo se puede girar a la derecha. La habitación está al final del pasillo, a la derecha de las escaleras.\
\
Al caer la noche, Trancos te guiará contra Amdir y los Montebruno.","Libro 1, Capítulo 1: Desenredando el Hilo"}},
[1853]={nameES="Book 1, Chapter 2: Experts on the Subject",objectivesES={"Book 1, Chapter 2: Experts on the Subject","Two of the helpful hobbits that helped Isteron with some of the wedding preparations are relaxing nearby: Frodo Baggins and Samwise Gamgee!","Legolas stands by the pile of blue decorations, and despite his solemn expression you can tell he is also rather amused at the hobbits' prank.","Pippin is atop the wall south-east of the Plaza of the Fountain in Minas Tirith (Midsummer), very pleased with some recent mischief.","Frodo and Sam suggested that you follow the smell of pipe-smoke to find Merry and Pippin.\
\
Frodo and Sam provided some very helpful advice to Rodwen's wedding-planning friends, but Merry and Pippin seemed very amused about something, which strikes young Master Samwise as perhaps a troubling sign.","A faint smile flits across the Elf's face as he contemplates the pile of decorations, but he says nothing more.","You found the hobbits who helped Isteron: Frodo Baggins and Samwise Gamgee!","Examine the fruit of the hobbit's mischief at the base of the ramp from the Seventh Circle, in the Sixth Circle of Minas Tirith (Midsummer)","Follow the smell of pipe-smoke to the south-west in order to find Merry and Pippin","You need to find Cúfaron before it's too late","You have found a pair of amused hobbits, laughing and smoking","Find the helpful hobbits south of the Tower of Ecthelion in Minas Tirith (Midsummer)","The decorations are indeed, as Merry and Pippin suggested, overwhelmingly blue","The fragrant smell of pipe-smoke lingers on the air. Merry and Pippin came this way!","Talk to Legolas in the Sixth Circle of Minas Tirith (Midsummer)","Cúfaron is in the Sixth Circle of Minas Tirith (Midsummer).","Talk to Cúfaron in the Sixth Circle of Minas Tirith (Midsummer)","Merry is atop the wall south-east of the Plaza of the Fountain in Minas Tirith (Midsummer), very pleased with some recent mischief.","Isteron is outside the Tower of Ecthelion, in the Plaza of the Fountain, in Minas Tirith (Midsummer).\
\
Rodwen gave you some letters of introduction authorizing you to act on her behalf, and directed you to deliver them to her friend and ally Isteron.","Bring the letters of introduction to Isteron in the Plaza of the Fountain in Minas Tirith (Midsummer)","Rodwen asked you to help her with the final preparations for the Great Wedding, and out of respect for the bride and the groom you have agreed to do what you can.","Talk to Peregrin Took in Minas Tirith (Midsummer)","Talk to Samwise Gamgee in Minas Tirith (Midsummer)","Merry and Pippin, quite delighted with themselves, have caused some mischief. You should find Cúfaron at the base of the ramp from the Seventh Circle, in the Sixth Circle of Minas Tirith (Midsummer), and see if it is too late to undo their handiwork.","Talk to Frodo Baggins in Minas Tirith (Midsummer)","Talk to Meriadoc Brandybuck in Minas Tirith (Midsummer)","Follow the smell of pipe-smoke to the south-east in order to find Merry and Pippin"}},
[1854]={nameES="Libro 1, Capítulo 2: Comienzo de una Gran Aventura",objectivesES={"Libro 1, Capítulo 2: Comienzo de una Gran Aventura","La mayoría de los aventureros comienzan con humildes inicios, y pocos pueden ver al principio cuán grandiosa será su aventura.","Habla con Tegwyn dentro de la herrería de Musgovilla.","Skardí Doblafilos te pidió que recolectaras colmillos de jabalí, garras de crébain y piedras afiladas que pueda usar para diversos fines en el pueblo.","Busca fuera del perímetro de Musgovilla alguna señal del niño desaparecido.","Las huellas son antiguas, probablemente hechas durante el ataque Uruk a Musgovilla.","Skardí Doblafilos espera en su tienda en Musgovilla los objetos que recogiste.","Skardí Doblafilos te dijo que Tegwyn nunca volvió a su casa, y deberías revisar el perímetro del pueblo para encontrar al niño desaparecido.","Habla con Merion junto a la puerta este de Musgovilla.","Debes informar a uno de los guardias cercanos que Tegwyn está desaparecido de Musgovilla.","Huellas pisotean la tierra aquí en las afueras de Musgovilla.","Tegwyn ha estado molestando a Skardí Doblafilos toda la mañana, y el herrero quiere que hagas algo al respecto.","Lleva los colmillos, las garras y las piedras afiladas a Skardí Doblafilos en su tienda."}},
[1855]={nameES="Book 1, Chapter 2: The Ruthless Dead",objectivesES={"You rescued Elfdag from the Paths of the Dead and should speak to him at the camp in Dunharrow.","Elfdag is safe, but his words raise further questions","Radwine is at the camp in Dunharrow, by Éowyn.\
\
Radwine has asked you to dare the darkness of the Paths of the Dead in search of his friend Elfdag.","Book 1, Chapter 2: The Ruthless Dead","Talk to Éowyn at the camp in Dunharrow","Talk to Elfdag at the camp in Dunharrow","Talk to Radwine at Dunharrow and he will bring you to the Paths of the Dead","Elfhelm's grandson Elfdag may have foolishly entered the Paths of the Dead, and Éowyn wants you to save him, if he can be saved.","Éowyn is at the encampment in Dunharrow."}},
[1856]={nameES="Libro 1, Capítulo 2: En Ayuda de un Condestable",objectivesES={"Mientras Trancos se ocupa de algunos viajeros importantes que está esperando, te ha pedido que viajes a Combe y ayudes al condestable Sotomonte a asegurarse de que la amenaza de los Montebruno ha llegado a su fin.","El condestable Sotomonte merodea a menudo por el centro de Combe, al este y al norte de Bree.\
\
Trancos te ha informado de que tiene un asunto importante que atender, pero te ha pedido que vayas a Combe y animes al Condestable Sotomonte a investigar el antiguo escondite de los bandidos.","Libro 1, Capítulo 2: En Ayuda de un Condestable"}},
[1857]={nameES="Book 1, Chapter 3: A Little Wizard-Magic",objectivesES={"You retrieve Elf-fountains, which fall from the sky like gently shimmering rain","Take more fireworks out of the crate","You retrieve a few assorted squibs from the crate; not that impressive, but still important","You retrieve dwarf-candles, known for their angular shapes and geometric precision","Mithrandir is in the Sixth Circle of Minas Tirith (Midsummer).\
\
Cúfaron is hopeful that some of Merry and Pippin's chatter may have had a kernel of truth, and he wants you to find the wizard of whose fireworks they spoke.","There couldn't possibly be more, could there? Take more fireworks from the crate","Talk to Mithrandir in the Sixth Circle of Minas Tirith (Midsummer)","Bring the impressive collection of fireworks to Mithrandir in the Sixth Circle of Minas Tirith (Midsummer)","Mithrandir is in the Sixth Circle of Minas Tirith (Midsummer).\
\
You have retrieved a truly impressive amount of fireworks from Mithrandir's quarters, and should now bring them to the Wizard.","The crate of fireworks is in Mithrandir's quarters in the High Guest-house in the Seventh Circle.\
\
Mithrandir did not specify which of the fireworks to bring to him. Better take everything out of the crate, just to be safe!","Gandalf's crate of fireworks is in his quarters","You retrieve goblin-barkers, which explode with harsh goblin-like cries","Take even more fireworks out of the crate","Take some more fireworks out of the crate","Why stop now? Take additional fireworks out of the crate","You retrieve thunder-claps, which have previously been mistaken for actual thunderstorms","Cúfaron is trying to sort out the good advice he received from Merry and Pippin from the bad. He hopes their words concerning 'Gandalf's fireworks' can be believed.","How many could there be? Take even more fireworks from the crate","You are a little disappointed to find the crate is now empty","Mithrandir told you he has assembled quite a stock of fireworks during the days following the end of the war, and he keeps them in a crate in his quarters in the High Guest-house, located in the Seventh Circle.","Book 1, Chapter 3: A Little Wizard-Magic","You retrieve a few hand-held sparklers from where they rolled into the crate's corners","Take fireworks out of the crate","Find Gandalf's quarters in the High Guest-house in the Seventh Circle of Minas Tirith (Midsummer)"}},
[1858]={nameES="Libro 1, Capítulo 3: Montebruno Debilitados",objectivesES={"Habla con el Condestable Sotomonte","A petición de Trancos, has viajado a Combe para ayudar al Condestable Sotomonte a investigar si los bandidos de Montebruno han dejado realmente de ser una amenaza para el pueblo del bosque de Chet.","El antiguo escondite de los Montebruno se encuentra al sur del cuerpo de guardia de Combe, cerca de las Cataratas de Entibo, en el extremo noreste del estanque de Entibo.\
\
El condestable Sotomonte ha decidido que probablemente sea buena idea echar un vistazo al antiguo escondite de los Montebruno, para asegurarse de que no vuelven a reunirse allí. Sin embargo, te ha pedido que le acompañes.","Habla con el Condestable Sotomonte.\
\
Te has infiltrado en el escondite de los Montebruno y has derrotado a varios de ellos, a petición del Condestable Sotomonte.","Libro 1, Capítulo 3: Montebruno Debilitados"}},
[1859]={nameES="Libro 1, Capítulo 3: Entre el Barro y la Humedad",objectivesES={"Habla con Meneldir en Lhan Garan.","Busca a Tegwyn más al oeste en el Aguaestancada.","Habla con Meneldir junto a la espada de madera abandonada en el Aguaestancada.","Visita Lhan Garan en el borde oriental del Aguaestancada y averigua si hubo alguna señal de Tegwyn.","Merion te dijo que los niños del pueblo tienen prohibido aventurarse en el Aguaestancada... lo que hace muy probable que haya sido el destino de Tegwyn.","Meneldir te pidió que <rgb=#00FF00>escucharas</rgb> a Tegwyn.","Busca a Tegwyn al noroeste en el Aguaestancada.","Escuchaste una voz débil llamándote desde el noroeste en el Aguaestancada. ¿Es Tegwyn?","Escuchas, muy débilmente, a alguien llamándote desde el noroeste.","Meneldir ha llegado a Lhan Garan, en el borde del Aguaestancada.","Una espada de madera gastada se encuentra en el barro.","Meneldir está en el centro del Aguaestancada, al oeste de Colmillar.","Esto parece ser la espada de Tegwyn, abandonada en el Aguaestancada.","La aldea dúnlendina de Lhan Garan está al noreste de Musgovilla, en el lado oriental del Aguaestancada. Sería un buen lugar para comenzar a buscar a Tegwyn.","Meneldir ha llegado a Lhan Garan antes que tú.","<rgb=#00FF00>Escucha</rgb> a Tegwyn.","Has encontrado una espada de madera gastada abandonada en el barro del Aguaestancada.","Habla con Tegwyn en las zonas noroeste del Aguaestancada.","Escuchas sonidos de vida en la ciénaga, pero nada fuera de lo común.","Libro 1, Capítulo 3: Entre el Barro y la Humedad","Meneldir sugirió que continúes la búsqueda de Tegwyn más al oeste.","Has encontrado a Tegwyn en el Aguaestancada, sano y salvo.","Los avanc en el Aguaestancada serían un verdadero peligro para Tegwyn. Derrotar a cualquiera que encuentres solo puede ayudar en tus esfuerzos de rescate.","Meneldir se ha unido a ti en el Aguaestancada junto a una espada de madera abandonada.","Habla con Meneldir en el Aguaestancada, al oeste de Colmillar.","Examina la espada de madera abandonada.","Habla con Meneldir en el centro del Aguaestancada, al oeste de Colmillar."}},
[1860]={nameES="Book 1, Chapter 3: The Whisper of Death",objectivesES={"With great relief, you emerge from the cave. Now you must find a settlement","The cold air hangs heavily in the great open space","A man waves his greeting, and calls for your attention","Celegdal is at the entrance to Morlad, in the Blackroot Vale.\
\
You have defeated frenzied creatures in the Vale and should now return to Celegdal.","Journey to the Dark Door, the entrance to the Paths of the Dead","Buildings built by those who are Dead can be found beneath the Haunted Mountain, Dwimorberg.\
\
Éowyn has charged you with travelling the Paths of the Dead and coming by that way into Gondor, where she asks that you protect the people of Gondor from the threat posed by the Ruthless Dead.","The Paths of the Dead lead beneath the Haunted Mountain, Dwimorberg, to the Blackroot Vale.\
\
Éowyn has charged you with travelling the Paths of the Dead and coming by that way into Gondor, where she asks that you protect the people of Gondor from the threat posed by the Ruthless Dead.","Motivated by her concern for Aragorn and Elfdag's report of the Ruthless Dead, Éowyn has suggested a new course for you to follow.","Come safely through the Paths of the Dead to the Blackroot Vale","The town of Morlad is on a hill on the western side of the Blackroot Vale.\
\
Éowyn has charged you with protecting the people of Gondor from any threat posed by the Ruthless Dead.","Find the hilltop settlement of Morlad, in the Blackroot Vale","Book 1, Chapter 3: The Whisper of Death","Talk to Celegdal at the entrance to Morlad","Cold dread grips your heart as you approach the Dark Door once again","Journey through the Paths of the Dead beneath the Dwimorberg","The Dark Door is south-east of the camp at Dunharrow.\
\
Éowyn has charged you with travelling the Paths of the Dead and coming by that way into Gondor, where she asks that you protect the people of Gondor from the threat posed by the Ruthless Dead.","Celegdal has asked you to defeat frenzied or maddened creatures throughout the Blackroot Vale, especially near the town of Morlad, including any creatures that might be susceptible.","A man has called for your attention at the entrance to Morlad, in the Blackroot Vale."}},
[1861]={nameES="Book 1, Chapter 4: Atop Erech",objectivesES={"Mortal men stood here, and not long ago. Their booted footprints remain.","A sudden shout breaks the stillness. 'You there! What is your business here?'","Someone has seen you, silhouetted against the sky atop the Hill of Erech!","Celegdal thinks some great evil came out of the mountains and lingered at the Hill of Erech. He does not know the details, or how close to the truth his theory may prove...","The Hill of Erech is east of Morlad, in the Blackroot Vale.\
\
Celegdal believes that a great evil came out of the mountains and went to the Hill of Erech, and wants you to see if it is true.","Someone saw you while you searched the summit of Erech, and called out to you. You should descend the hill and see if this person is a friend.","Journey to the summit of the Hill of Erech, east of Morlad","If the Dead did gather here, tracks in the dirt show they were not alone","The ground here boasts many small depressions; men stood here, and recently","You have been seen against the sky atop the Hill of Erech!","The earth atop the Hill of Erech has been disturbed, and bears investigation.","Book 1, Chapter 4: Atop Erech","Descend the hill and find the man who called out to you"}},
[1862]={nameES="Libro 1, Capítulo 4: Diseños Oscuros",objectivesES={"Trancos está en su habitación de la Posada del Poney Pisador en Bree, que se encuentra girando a la izquierda por el pasillo que sale de la sala común hasta que sólo puedes girar a la derecha. La habitación está al final del pasillo a la derecha de las escaleras.\
Deberías Volver a Trancos y contarle lo que has aprendido sobre los Montebruno y el Enano Pálido.","Libro 1, Capítulo 4: Diseños Oscuros","Gracias a un bandido moribundo en el antiguo escondite de Zorrillero, supiste que el extraño Enano Pálido estaba intentando intimidar a los Montebruno para que continuaran su alianza con el Reino Brujo de Angmar."}},
[1863]={nameES="Libro 1, Capítulo 4: Uruks en la Ciudad Élfica",objectivesES={"Habla con Bregoleth en la pendiente hacia el sur.","Recuperas una flecha élfica del otro cadáver y escuchas a alguien llamándote.","Sacas una flecha de la espalda del Uruk. La flecha es de fina manufactura élfica.","Un Elfo en la pendiente hacia el sur ha llamado tu atención. ¿Mató ella a estos Uruks?","Sube por el sendero inclinado al sureste de Echad Terthas.","Habla con Duindil en Echad Terthas.","Dos cadáveres Uruk yacen en la hierba fuera de Caras Gelebren.","Habla con Meneldir en el Aguaestancada noroeste.","Meneldir está en el Aguaestancada noroeste, considerando las palabras de Tegwyn.","Tegwyn escuchó a los Uruks hablar sobre la antigua ciudad élfica al noreste del Aguaestancada, y parecía que muchas más criaturas que las que atacaron Musgovilla planeaban viajar allí.","Duindil supervisa el trabajo en el campamento de Echad Terthas, con vista a la antigua ciudad élfica.","Bregoleth acepta la devolución de sus flechas con una sonrisa.","Los cuerpos de dos Uruks yacen aquí en la hierba.","Duindil, un Montaraz en Echad Terthas, puede saber sobre los Uruks que marchan dentro de Caras Gelebren. Echad Terthas está ubicado al este del Aguaestancada.","Libro 1, Capítulo 4: Uruks en la Ciudad Élfica","Examina el otro cadáver Uruk.","Duindil te guió para espiar a los Uruks que ocupan Caras Gelebren, sugiriendo que subas por el sendero inclinado al sureste de Echad Terthas.","Duindil asiente en saludo cuando te acercas.","Encuentra Echad Terthas, el campamento del pariente de Meneldir, Duindil, al este del Aguaestancada.","Examina uno de los cadáveres Uruk."}},
[1864]={nameES="Book 1, Chapter 4: Vows, Speeches, and Oaths",objectivesES={"Gimli is in the Splintered Shield, in Minas Tirith (Midsummer).","You learned from Mithrandir that Gimli vowed not to emerge from the Splintered Shield until he determined the perfect words by which Arwen and Aragorn might plight their troth.","Talk to the proprietor of the Splintered Shield in Minas Tirith (Midsummer)","Drafli Broadshield is in the Splintered Shield in Minas Tirith (Midsummer).\
\
Drafli Broadshield has been working with Gimli to determine the proper vows for the Great Wedding. You should wake him up so you can hear the results.","Gimli blinks at you as you awaken him from his stupor","Gimli and Drafli's attempts to come up with the perfect vows for the Great Wedding are spread out on the table in front of the dwarves.","Talk to Gimli in the Splintered Shield in Minas Tirith (Midsummer)","Talk to Gimli in the Splintered Shield","Drafli awakens with a start, blinking the sleep and the drink from his eyes","Gimli is in the Splintered Shield, in Minas Tirith (Midsummer).\
\
You have awoken Gimli from the drink-induced slumber of his creative process. Perhaps you should ask him about his success coming up with the right vows for the Great Wedding.","Find Gimli in the Splintered Shield, located in the Second Circle of Minas Tirith (Midsummer)","Drafli Broadshield is in the Splintered Shield in Minas Tirith (Midsummer).","Wake Drafli Broadshield in the Splintered Shield in Minas Tirith (Midsummer)","Gimli is in the Splintered Shield in Minas Tirith (Midsummer).","Give the bundle of papers to Gimli in the Splintered Shield","Degilion, the proprietor of the Splintered Shield, is always behind the bar.\
\
Drafli and Gimli are in agreement: the ale of the Splintered Shield should flow without limit at the feast that will follow the Great Wedding. Now it is up to you to make the arrangements with the proprietor of the tavern.","Talk to Drafli in the Splintered Shield","Book 1, Chapter 4: Vows, Speeches, and Oaths"}},
[1865]={nameES="Book 1, Chapter 5: A Difficult Road",objectivesES={"Book 1, Chapter 5: A Difficult Road","Talk to Bandron by his cart in Tarlang's Neck","Bring the barrel of nails to Bandron by his cart in Tarlang's Neck","Talk to Galengam outside his shop in Calembel","Travel south-east through Tarlang's Neck into Lamedon","Find Nethadan somewhere south of Tarlang's Neck","A waggon has come to an early stop in Tarlang's Neck, and its driver could use your assistance.","Galengam is outside his shop in Calembel, south-east of Tarlang's Neck.\
\
Bandron has asked you to speak to his employer in the town of Calembel and explain some of the reasons for the delay.","Collect barrel of nails by Nethadan","Bandron is by his broken cart in Tarlang's Neck, between Lamedon and Blackroot Vale.\
\
You have picked up a barrel of nails from Nethadan and he asked you to bring it to his father so he can repair the cart.","You have met Rovalang, a Swan-knight of Dol Amroth. Recognising you for a great adventurer, he has asked you to journey into Lamedon and ensure that the people there are not endangered by the movement of the Dead.","Rovalang has asked you to travel south-east through Tarlang's Neck, and to help any people of Gondor who may have run afoul of the Dead in their passage.","You see a waggon ahead, motionless in the road. What has happened?","Nethadan has asked you to bring one of the barrels near him back to his father Bandron, in Tarlang's Neck.","If the Dead passed through here, they may have gone to Calembel. It is worth a look.","Nethadan went to the town of Dínadab in Lamedon, south-east of Tarlang's Neck, to recover supplies to fix his father's broken waggon, but he never returned. Bandron asked for you to find him."}},
[1866]={nameES="Book 1, Chapter 5: A Whisper of Unrest",objectivesES={"Gimli is in the Splintered Shield, in Minas Tirith (Midsummer).","Show the wrinkled note to Mithrandir in the Sixth Circle of Minas Tirith (Midsummer)","King Elessar is in the Tower of Ecthelion in Minas Tirith (Midsummer).","Question a woman of Gondor about the threat","Talk to Gimli in the Splintered Shield","The reminder of the Kin-strife in Gondor is an unpleasant one that may bode ill for the upcoming wedding of King Elessar and Arwen Undómiel.","Book 1, Chapter 5: A Whisper of Unrest","Mithrandir is in the Sixth Circle of Minas Tirith (Midsummer).\
\
Gimli wants you to show the scrawled threat to Mithrandir and get a Wizard's advice.","Talk to King Elessar in the Tower of Ecthelion in Minas Tirith (Midsummer)","These men insist they saw nothing","Question a man of Gondor about the threat","Someone in the Splintered Shield, in Minas Tirith (Midsummer), may have seen something.\
\
Someone in the Splintered Shield placed that note on the table while Gimli and Drafli were preoccupied with their ales. But who could have done this, and why would they risk notice by the dwarves or their powerful friends?","Ask Degilion, proprietor of the Splintered Shield, about the scrawled threat","These women insist they saw nothing"}},
[1867]={nameES="Libro 1, Capítulo 5: Bregoleth",objectivesES={"Bregoleth está cazando Uruks al noroeste de Caras Gelebren.\
\
Debes mostrarle a Bregoleth el informe Uruk que encontraste en una de las criaturas que merodeaban en Caras Gelebren.","Derrota Uruks en Caras Gelebren (9/10).","Bregoleth querrá ver este informe.","Lleva el informe Uruk a Bregoleth en la pendiente al noroeste de Caras Gelebren.","Los Uruks acechan las callejuelas de Caras Gelebren.\
\
Bregoleth te pidió derrotar a los Uruks que ahora merodean en Caras Gelebren.","Libro 1, Capítulo 5: Bregoleth","Al enterarse de que los Uruks andaban por Eregion, Bregoleth desvió sus pasos para investigar.","Este último Uruk aferraba un pedazo de pergamino en una mano.","Tomaste un pergamino arrugado del cuerpo de un Uruk que acechaba las callejuelas de Caras Gelebren.\
\
Debes leer el informe Uruk y aprender todo lo que puedas sobre el propósito de estas criaturas en Ciénaga de los Cisnes.","Lee el informe Uruk que recogiste."}},
[1868]={nameES="Libro 1, Capítulo 5: Los Otros Jinetes",objectivesES={"Libro 1, Capítulo 5: Los Otros Jinetes","Mientras estabas fuera investigando a los bandidos de Montebruno, cinco Nazgûl atacaron El Poney Pisador en busca de cuatro viajeros de la Comarca, que Trancos tenía bajo su protección. Trancos te ha dicho que hay un total de nueve Jinetes, y que debe conocer la ubicación de los otros cuatro.","El campamento de Lenglinn se encuentra en una elevación al norte del Portal del Este, junto al Gran Camino del Este, al oeste de Bree. \
\
Trancos te ha pedido que hables con Lenglinn, otro Montaraz, y averigües si ha visto a algún otro Nazgûl saliendo de la Comarca."}},
[1869]={nameES="Libro 1, Capítulo 6: La Ciudadela de Celebrimbor",objectivesES={"Libro 1, Capítulo 6: La Ciudadela de Celebrimbor","Lleva los artefactos que recogiste a Bregoleth al noroeste de Caras Gelebren.","Examina la estatua semienterrada en el centro de Caras Gelebren.","Bregoleth te pidió buscar en Caras Gelebren artefactos que puedan revelar el propósito de Saruman al enviar Uruks a Ciénaga de los Cisnes.","Examina la lámpara caída en el sureste de Caras Gelebren.","Este martillo, desgastado por los años, casi se deshace en tu mano.","Bregoleth espera tu regreso en la pendiente descendente al noroeste de Caras Gelebren con los artefactos que recogiste.","Ninguna de las lámparas que iluminaban Caras Gelebren por la noche sigue en pie.","Los antaño hermosos pilares de Caras Gelebren son ahora tristes recordatorios de la guerra.","Bregoleth te habló de la historia de Caras Gelebren, la gran ciudad del herrero élfico Celebrimbor, y de su preocupación por lo que Saruman podría estar buscando dentro de sus muros.","Examina el pilar dañado en el suroeste de Caras Gelebren.","Este plato antiguo está cubierto de una telaraña de grietas, volviéndolo inservible.","Recoge un artefacto del suroeste de Caras Gelebren.","Esta antigua estatua de Celebrimbor yace ahora semienterrada en la tierra.","Recoge un artefacto del sureste de Caras Gelebren.","Recoge un artefacto del centro de Caras Gelebren.","Este pequeño bolso ahora contiene solo polvo y astillas de roca."}},
[1870]={nameES="Libro 1, Capítulo 6: En la estela de los Jinetes Negros",objectivesES={"Deseando noticias sobre los otros Nazgûl, Trancos te envió al oeste, a las fronteras de la Comarca y Los Gamos, para hablar con Lenglinn, a quien había enviado para cuidar de un hobbit.","Los crebain han tomado posada al suroeste, justo más allá de su campamento.\
\
Lenglinn te dijo que los crebain siguieron a los Nazgûl y han tomado posada fuera de su campamento. Está seguro de que los pájaros son espías del enemigo y informarán sobre los movimientos en el oeste. Te ha pedido que te deshagas de ellos para evitar que hagan daño.","El campamento de Lenglinn está al noreste del nido de crebain.\
\
Con los crebain muertos, el enemigo tiene menos ojos vigilando Los Gamos y la Comarca. Habla de nuevo con Lenglinn y aprende qué más quiere que hagas.","Libro 1, Capítulo 6: En la estela de los Jinetes Negros"}},
[1871]={nameES="Book 1, Chapter 6: The Evenstar in Gondor",objectivesES={"Habla con Glorfindel","Talk to Arwen Undómiel outside the city","The party from Rivendell has been spotted to the north of Minas Tirith (Midsummer), and it is King Elessar's wish that you should greet them.","Book 1, Chapter 6: The Evenstar in Gondor","Your friends among the travelling party wish to greet you after their long journey.","Talk to Húrin the Tall at the gates to Minas Tirith (Midsummer)","Talk to Erestor","Habla con Elrohir","Habla con Elladan.","The party from Rivendell has been scouted from the walls of the city: the bride has nearly arrived, and the Great Wedding is soon to commence.","The Elves nod their greetings as you approach","Habla con Elrond","Habla con Galadriel","Welcome the party from Rivendell outside the gates of Minas Tirith (Midsummer)","Arwen Undómiel, Evenstar of her people, has come to Gondor. She wishes to speak with you.","Habla con Celeborn","Húrin the Tall, Warden of the Keys, is waiting for you to come down to the gates of the city so you may welcome the party from Rivendell.","Elrond smiles at you, his eyebrows raised with unexpected mirth. Even so, you know he feels a deep sorrow that his daughter will no longer accompany him to the Undying Lands."}},
[1872]={nameES="Book 1, Chapter 6: The Merchant",objectivesES={"Book 1, Chapter 6: The Merchant","Galengam has asked for your help to preserve the Cemenduril fields that are his livelihood and perhaps that of Gondor as well.","Galengam is outside his shop in Calembel.\
\
You have protected Galengam's farmers and collected a number of weapons wielded by the Corsair raiders. The merchant will be interested to hear how you have assisted his interests.","Talk to a Cemenduril farmer in the fields","Galengam's farmers can be found west of Calembel, working the flower fields.\
\
A wealthy merchant has asked you to protect the farmers that grow his Cemenduril crop from the attacks of any raiders that threaten.","Bring Cemenduril bundles and Corsair weapons to Galengam"}},
[1873]={nameES="Book 1, Chapter 7: A Wedding at Midsummer",objectivesES={"Talk to King Elessar outside the city and experience 'A Wedding at Midsummer'","Talk to Rodwen outside the feast-hall of Merethrond in Minas Tirith (Midsummer)","Book 1, Chapter 7: A Wedding at Midsummer","The Great Wedding will take place on Midsummer's Day, and it will be a time of celebration for all. Folk from lands near and distant will come to celebrate the joining of King Elessar and Arwen Undómiel.","Rodwen is pleased at how well the ceremony was conducted, and now she wishes to speak with you outside the feast-hall of Merethrond in Minas Tirith (Midsummer).","Talk to King Elessar outside the city","King Elessar has emerged from the city, eager to greet his bride, but first he has some words for you.","The time of the wedding has arrived!"}},
[1874]={nameES="Book 1, Chapter 7: Abandoned Refuge",objectivesES={"Book 1, Chapter 7: Abandoned Refuge","Galengam believes the Corsairs must have landed at the old refuge of Edhellond, in Belfalas.","Explore the north-west dock at Edhellond","Lathlorn has asked you to explore the abandoned refuge of Edhellond, defeating Corsair raiders and collecting any relics of historical interest.","An overlook of the refuge of Edhellond, west of Calembel in Belfalas, would be a good place to begin your stand against the Corsair raiders.\
\
Galengam has sent you to Edhellond to deal with some of the Corsair raiders.","An Elf stands atop the overlook, surveying the refuge of Edhellond","Lathlorn is on an overlook with a good view of the Corsair landing at Edhellond.\
\
You have defeated Corsair raiders throughout Edhellond and collected a number of forgotten relics, and should bring them now to Lathlorn.","The buildings along the southern court are intact, but empty","Explore the tallest tower at Edhellond","Explore the southern court of Edhellond","Talk to Lathlorn on the overlook near Edhellond","Lathlorn is surveying the situation at Edhellond, from an overlook that provides a good view of the refuge.","Corsair ships have moored at the docks of Edhellond","Find the overlook west of Calembel, in Belfalas, that provides a good view of Edhellond","This tallest tower at Edhellond once kept watch over the sea","Bring the relics to Lathlorn on the overlook near Edhellond"}},
[1875]={nameES="Libro 1, Capítulo 7: Llamada de cuerno de Los Gamos",objectivesES={"Libro 1, Capítulo 7: Llamada de cuerno de Los Gamos","El campamento de Lenglinn está al norte del Portal del Este, al noroeste de Cricava.\
\
Cuando hablaste con Fredegar Bolger, te dijo que los Jinetes Negros no lo habían capturado y por lo tanto no habían aprendido nada de él, pero se te escapó algo sobre un Anillo perteneciente al Enemigo. Mientras Fredegar hablaba, unos crebain volaron del cielo y lo atacaron, y aunque derrotaste a los crebain, dos se retiraron al Bosque Viejo. Deberías llevar estas noticias a Lenglinn.","La casa de Bolsón está en Cricava, casi al sudeste del Portal del Este, al sur del campamento de Lenglinn.\
\
Para determinar los movimientos de los Nazgûl, Lenglinn te ha pedido que investigues la casa de un Hobbit llamado Bolsón.","Trancos se encuentra en su habitación de la Posada del Poney Pisador en Bree, que se encuentra girando a la izquierda por el pasillo que sale de la sala común hasta que sólo se puede girar a la derecha. La habitación está al final del pasillo, a la derecha de las escaleras.\
\
Lenglinn te ha pedido que busques el consejo de Trancos sobre cómo encontrar al crebain que ha escuchado las palabras de Fredegar Bolger y ha escapado al Bosque Viejo. Teme que si el Enemigo se entera de que el Anillo que buscan ya no está en la Comarca, todo puede estar perdido.","El Llamada de cuerno de Los Gamos había alertado a Lenglinn de la presencia de los Nazgûl.","Investiga Cricava"}},
[1876]={nameES="Libro 1, Capítulo 7: El Señor de los Dones",objectivesES={"Habla con Bregoleth y escucha los años que pasó en Eregion, hace mucho tiempo.","Habla con Bregoleth en la pendiente al noroeste de Caras Gelebren.","Bregoleth ha accedido a hablarte de los años que vivió en Eregion y del Enemigo que vino a amenazar a su pueblo y a toda la Tierra Media.","El Montaraz Meneldir ha llegado. Le lanza una mirada interrogante a Bregoleth.","Libro 1, Capítulo 7: El Señor de los Dones","Habla con Meneldir en la pendiente al noroeste de Caras Gelebren.","Bregoleth ha accedido a hablarte de los años que vivió en Eregion, aunque los recuerdos de aquel tiempo le resultan dolorosos.","Bregoleth desea concluir su triste relato.","Meneldir ha regresado de su recado en Musgovilla."}},
[1877]={nameES="Book 1, Chapter 8: Dorthaneth",objectivesES={"Talk to Dorthaneth in the Cave of the Avorrim","Galdor is in the Cave of the Avorrim, in Belfalas.","Dorthaneth is within the Cave of the Avorrim, in Belfalas.","Dorthaneth is within the Cave of the Avorrim, in Belfalas.\
\
Lathlorn has sent you to speak with Dorthaneth, the leader of the Avorrim.","Book 1, Chapter 8: Dorthaneth","The Cave of the Avorrim is located in a cliff-wall overlooking the sea, on the road to Dol Amroth. Lathlorn described it in this way:  'If you follow the road south-west on the way to Dol Amroth, you will come to a rocky cleft in the ground to your right. Follow it down to a cliff-side path over the water, and you will come to the entrance.'","Dorthaneth is in the Cave of the Avorrim.\
\
Galdor, an emissary from Círdan the Shipright at Mithlond, has overheard the speech of the Corsair raiders, and is worried about the loyalty they display for their leaders.","Find Dorthaneth within the Cave of the Avorrim","Find the entrance to the Cave of the Avorrim, overlooking the sea","An Elf-maid stands on the bridge, deep in thought","Talk to Galdor in the Cave of the Avorrim","The entrance to a cave yawns in the cliff-side to your left: the hideout of the Avorrim","Lathlorn has told you how to find the location from which the Avorrim keep watch over Edhellond."}},
[1878]={nameES="Libro 1, Capítulo 8: El Señor de los Bosques",objectivesES={"La casa de Tom Bombadil está en el extremo oriental del río Tornasauce, en el Bosque Viejo.\
\
Trancos te dijo que buscaras a alguien llamado Tom Bombadil y le pidieras ayuda para encontrar al crebain que voló al Bosque Viejo.","Cuando estabas en Los Gamos investigando la incursión de los Nazgûl, hablaste con Fredegar Bolger, que te reveló información sobre Frodo Bolsón y el Anillo del Enemigo. Crebain atacó y puede que escuchara las palabras del hobbit.","Libro 1, Capítulo 8: El Señor de los Bosques"}},
[1879]={nameES="Libro 1, Capítulo 8: La Mano aferradora",objectivesES={"Bregoleth está al noroeste de Caras Gelebren, esperanzada en que pueda frustrarse el propósito de los Uruks en la Ciénaga de los Cisnes.","La derrota de Holmduf redujo la ferocidad de los Uruks bajo su mando.","Idhobel está ubicado en el Eregion Occidental, junto al camino que va hacia el norte en dirección a Tham Celechir.\
\
Meneldir y Bregoleth acordaron reunirse contigo en Idhobel después de que cada uno derrotara a su propio líder Uruk.","Habla con Bregoleth en Idhobel.","Bregoleth está en el campamento de Idhobel, en el Eregion Occidental.","Investiga los rastros de Uruks en el Eregion Occidental y derrota a un líder de guerra Uruk.","La derrota de Zagvar redujo la tenacidad de los Uruks bajo su mando.","Habla con Meneldir en Idhobel.","Habla con Bregoleth en la pendiente al noroeste de Caras Gelebren.","Bregoleth habló tristemente de la Guerra de los Elfos y Sauron, pero se niega a vivir en el pasado. Si algo puede obtenerse de sus recuerdos para prevenir nuevas tristezas hoy, hará todo lo posible por aprenderlo.","Libro 1, Capítulo 8: La Mano aferradora","La derrota de Fakhthal redujo la moral de los Uruks bajo su mando.","Rastros de Uruks que indican las ubicaciones de líderes de guerra Uruk pueden encontrarse en tres lugares distintos del Eregion Occidental.\
\
Meneldir te pidió investigar los rastros de Uruks dentro de la Ciénaga de los Cisnes y derrotar a uno de los líderes Uruk responsables."}},
[1880]={nameES="Book 1, Chapter 8: The Wedding Banquet",objectivesES={"King Elessar and Queen Arwen Undómiel have slipped away from the celebration and are in the throne room of Minas Tirith (Midsummer).","Mithrandir is outside the Tower of Ecthelion in Minas Tirith (Midsummer).","The ceremony was only the beginning of the Great Wedding. Now there is the wedding-feast to be considered, where persons great and small come together throughout the city to celebrate the union of King Elessar and Arwen Undómiel.","Talk to Merethien inside Merethrond, at a table on the east side of the hall, when you are ready to conclude the wedding-feast","Talk to Queen Arwen in the Tower of Ecthelion in Minas Tirith (Midsummer)","Merethien, the Master Foodmonger, can be found inside the great feast-hall of Merethrond, where the festivities continue.","Talk to King Elessar in the Tower of Ecthelion in Minas Tirith (Midsummer)","Talk to Mithrandir outside the Tower of Ecthelion in Minas Tirith (Midsummer)","Book 1, Chapter 8: The Wedding Banquet"}},
[1881]={nameES="Book 1, Chapter 9: A Message for Lothíriel",objectivesES={"You have come to the entrance to the docks of Dol Amroth","You have presented yourself to the guards at the entrance to Dol Amroth and should now find Lothíriel in the Great Hall of the city.","Dorthaneth has asked you to bring a message of warning to Lothíriel, who rules now in Dol Amroth.","You have come to the entrance of the great city of Dol Amroth","Book 1, Chapter 9: A Message for Lothíriel","The entrance to Dol Amroth is west of the Cave of the Avorrim.\
\
Dorthaneth has asked you to bring what she knows of the Heirs of Castamir and the Umbar raiders to Lothíriel in Dol Amroth. You should first present yourself to the guards at the gate of the city.","Talk to a guard by the entrance to Dol Amroth","Find Lothíriel in the Great Hall of Dol Amroth","Lothíriel is dark of hair, with a somewhat Elvish appearance","Travel to the entrance of Dol Amroth, and present yourself to the guards","Talk to Lothíriel in the Great Hall of Dol Amroth"}},
[1882]={nameES="Libro 1, Capítulo 9: Lirios para la Hija del Río",objectivesES={"Trancos te dirigió a hablar con Tom Bombadil, el maestro del Bosque Viejo, para pedir su ayuda en el rastreo de los crebain que huyeron al bosque.","Libro 1, Capítulo 9: Lirios para la Hija del Río","Lleva los lirios a Tom Bombadil","El río fluye hacia el oeste desde la casa de Tom Bombadil.\
\
Encontraste a Tom Bombadil y hablaste con la extraña criatura. Aunque al principio no estaba dispuesto a encontrar los crebain, al final cedió, si realizabas una tarea que consideraba mucho más importante. Desea que recojas lirios del río, cerca de alguien llamado Viejo Hombre-Sauce."}},
[1883]={nameES="Libro 1, Capítulo 9: El Salón del Río Veloz",objectivesES={"Encuentras un cuchillo corto de manufactura élfica enterrado en el montículo de escombros.","Tanto Meneldir como Bregoleth deben volver pronto a su gente con lo que han aprendido aquí, pero primero la guerrera élfica desea oponerse a los enemigos que acechan en Tham Celechir.","Bregoleth espera en Idhobel noticias de tus éxitos en Tham Celechir, el Salón del Río Veloz.","Busca montículos de escombros en Tham Celechir para encontrar artefactos notables.","Tham Celechir está ubicado en una colina al norte de Idhobel.\
\
Bregoleth quiere enfrentarse a los enemigos que ahora ocupan Tham Celechir, el Salón del Río Veloz.","Lleva el cuchillo élfico a Bregoleth en Idhobel.","Libro 1, Capítulo 9: El Salón del Río Veloz","Rebuscas en el montículo de escombros, pero no encuentras nada de interés."}},
[1884]={nameES="Libro 10, Capítulo 10: No confíes en él",objectivesES={"Mordrambor te mira con frialdad y no dice nada.","Mordrambor se encuentra en la prisión, en lo alto de las escaleras tras la puerta de la izquierda al entrar en la fortaleza de la isla de Tinnudir, en Evendim.\
\
Tadan te ha dicho que espera con ansias la visita de Laerdan, ya que vigilar a Mordrambor no resulta agradable, especialmente desde que el prisionero ha comenzado a recitar las hazañas de sus compañeros.","Mordrambor ha sido un prisionero útil, pero tanto Calenglad como Laerdan temen que aún conserve cierto poder para el engaño.","El Montaraz Tadan está de guardia en la prisión, en lo alto de las escaleras tras la puerta de la izquierda al entrar en la fortaleza de la isla de Tinnudir, en Evendim.\
\
Laerdan ha expresado su preocupación de que Mordrambor te esté manteniendo ocupado deliberadamente en Annúminas mientras Amarthiel busca a Narchuil con el palantír.","Laerdan se encuentra en su habitación, en lo alto de las escaleras tras la puerta de la derecha al entrar en la fortaleza de la isla de Tinnudir, en Evendim.\
\
Calenglad te ha dicho que Laerdan desea hablar contigo sobre el palantír y te ha pedido que intentes convencerlo de que los Dúnedain deben obtener una victoria decisiva en Annúminas antes de que sea posible recuperarlo.","Libro 10, Capítulo 10: No confíes en él"}},
[1885]={nameES="Book 10, Chapter 10: Recipe for Remedy",objectivesES={"Nona has asked you to throw the dried herb bundles you collected into the cooking fire in the cave chamber with the dying man. She hopes it will improve his condition.","Nona is worried about the survivors of Byre Tor in her care, and wants you to help them if you can.","The smoke of the burning herbs has slightly revived the most injured of Nona's survivors.","You have found Léodwig, the son of Harding. He has been grievously wounded by Núrzum","Nona is in her cave in the High Knolls, and is waiting for you to return with the dried herb bundles you collected.","Throw dried herb bundles into the fire in the other chamber","Bring the dried herb bundles to Nona in her cave","You have found the man you came into Wildermore to find, and should now tell your companions.","Orcs throughout the High Knolls may carry dried herb bundles.\
\
Nona has asked you to recover dried herb bundles the Orcs stole from Byre Tor to try and speed the recovery of the people in her care.","Talk to the dying man","Gléowine is in Nona's cave, and wishes to speak with you.","Book 10, Chapter 10: Recipe for Remedy"}},
[1886]={nameES="Libro 10, Capítulo 11: La contención de Guldurchir",objectivesES={"El Montaraz Tadan se encuentra en la prisión, en lo alto de las escaleras tras la puerta de la izquierda al entrar en la fortaleza de la isla de Tinnudir, en Evendim.\
\
Tadan te sacó de tu ensimismamiento, impidiendo que liberaras a Mordrambor y le entregaras Tann Morgul.","Libro 10, Capítulo 11: La contención de Guldurchir","Lleva Tann Morgul a Mordrambor","Mordrambor se encuentra en la prisión, en lo alto de las escaleras tras la puerta de la izquierda al entrar en la fortaleza de la isla de Tinnudir, en Evendim.\
\
Has logrado lo que Mordrambor creía imposible: derrotaste a Guldurchir y le arrebataste Tann Morgul. Ahora deberías llevar el artefacto a Mordrambor para demostrarle que estaba equivocado.","Mordrambor te ha dicho que uno de sus hermanos, un Númenóreano Negro llamado Guldurchir, posee un artefacto de gran maldad que será utilizado para destruir a los Dúnedain.","Lleva Tann Morgul a Tadan","Guldurchir se encuentra en Menelband, un patio situado en el nivel más alto de Annúminas.\
\
El Montaraz Tadan te ha indicado dónde encontrar a Guldurchir y espera que logres derrotar a este Númenóreano Negro antes de que se le permita usar la reliquia que porta, Tann Morgul, contra los Dúnedain.","El Montaraz Tadan está de guardia en la prisión, en lo alto de las escaleras tras la puerta de la izquierda al entrar en la fortaleza de la isla de Tinnudir, en Evendim.\
\
Mordrambor te ha hablado de Tann Morgul, el artefacto que porta uno de sus hermanos, y afirma que su poder puede destruir a los Dúnedain. Tadan desea hablar contigo sobre este nuevo acontecimiento."}},
[1887]={nameES="Book 10, Chapter 11: Return to Byre Tor",objectivesES={"Léodwig is still too exhausted to speak, which is good because you have no favourable news to report about Núrzum.","Léodwig is exhausted from his recent exertions, but you remember what he wanted: an end to the giant, an end to Núrzum. You are not yet certain how to bring this about.","Nona is in the other chamber of her cave in the High Knolls, and is waiting to speak with you.","Book 10, Chapter 11: Return to Byre Tor","Gléowine has determined that he can best help the survivors of Byre Tor by sending you to help them with their problems. He has asked you to speak to each of them and learn what it is they most want.","Return the stolen heirlooms to Elda in Nona's cave","Defeat Foshnu or Krítar in Byre Tor","Gléowine is in Nona's cave in the High Knolls, and will be pleased to hear of your successful return to Byre Tor.","Speak with Nona","You have done much good in Byre Tor, and should return to Nona's cave to tell the people in her care what you accomplished.","You save the other one for Ymma, when she is healthy enough for vengeance","Orcs in and around Byre Tor may possess stolen heirlooms for you to recover. The horses of Byre Tor can be found tied up at the stables near the top of the hill on which the city stands. Foshnu and Krítar will be somewhere within the city.\
\
You have learned what the survivors of the attack on Byre Tor under Nona's care desire of you, and now you should make certain you can accomplish what they want.","Léodwig remains too exhausted to speak.","Gléowine has realized that although he is no great warrior, he can still help the people of Byre Tor sheltered by Nona in his own way."}},
[1888]={nameES="Libro 10, Capítulo 12: Un medio para transportarlo",objectivesES={"Golodir se encuentra en el campamento de los Montaraces de Gath Forthnír, en el este de Angmar.\
\
Laerdan te ha enviado a hablar con Golodir para conseguir algún medio con el que recuperar el palantír de Amarthiel.","Laerdan ha descubierto la ubicación del palantír y ha determinado un medio para arrebatárselo a Amarthiel.","Mordrambor te mira con odio en los ojos, pero no dice nada.","Laerdan se encuentra en su habitación, en lo alto de las escaleras tras la puerta de la derecha al entrar en la fortaleza de la isla de Tinnudir, en Evendim.\
\
Tadan te ha dicho que Laerdan cree haber descubierto la ubicación del palantír y sabe cómo puede recuperarse.","Libro 10, Capítulo 12: Un medio para transportarlo"}},
[1889]={nameES="Book 10, Chapter 12: Núrzum",objectivesES={"Nona is in her cave in the High Knolls, preparing to depart for Byre Tor.","Nona has decided to return to Byre Tor to learn why Núrzum came there first, and perhaps discover some means of defeating the giant.","Talk to Nona and travel to Byre Tor","Book 10, Chapter 12: Núrzum","Horn and Corudan are in Nona's cave, and you should speak to them about the day's journey.","You have narrowly survived an encounter with Núrzum and should now speak to Corudan in Nona's cave."}},
[1890]={nameES="Book 10, Chapter 13: Searching the Balewood",objectivesES={"Talk to Corudan in Leaflock's mead","Corudan has decided that only the might of the Ents will have a chance of defeating Núrzum.","Corudan is in Leaflock's mead, in Balewood.","Find the glade of the oldest Ent in Balewood","Leaflock remains asleep.","You have come to Balewood to petition Leaflock the Ent for help against Núrzum.","Leaflock has gone back to sleep","Talk to the Ent and ask him for help against Núrzum","You and Corudan have stumbled upon the glade of an ancient and very tired Ent.","Somewhere in the Balewood, an old Ent sleeps. Only he will have the authority to order an attack upon Núrzum.","Book 10, Chapter 13: Searching the Balewood","A tall and craggy figure stands in this glade. You almost passed it by!"}},
[1891]={nameES="Libro 10, Capítulo 13: El plan llevado a cabo",objectivesES={"Laerdan se encuentra en su habitación en la fortaleza de la isla de Tinnudir, en Evendim. La habitación de Laerdan está en lo alto de las escaleras tras la puerta de la derecha al entrar en el torreón.\
\
Golodir te ha entregado una bolsa de tela finamente tejida que se utilizaba para cubrir el palantír en Carn Dûm cuando no estaba en uso. También te advirtió que no tocaras el palantír con las manos y que previnieras a Laerdan de no subestimar al enemigo.","Habla con Laerdan","El Montaraz Tadan se encuentra en la prisión, en lo alto de las escaleras tras la puerta de la izquierda al entrar en la fortaleza de la isla de Tinnudir, en Evendim.\
\
Laerdan ha dejado una nota para ti en su puerta, indicando que ha partido hacia Barad Tironn para enfrentarse a Amarthiel en solitario. Debes mostrar esta nota a Tadan de inmediato.","Recoge la nota de Laerdan","Laerdan considera que el momento de recuperar Annúminas ya ha pasado. Ahora toda la atención debe centrarse en arrebatarle el palantír a Amarthiel antes de que pueda descubrir la ubicación del perdido Narchuil.","Nota de Laerdan recogida","Calenglad se encuentra en el campamento de los Montaraces de la isla de Tinnudir, en Evendim.\
\
Mordrambor te ha revelado su propósito: enviar a Laerdan junto a Amarthiel en Barad Tironn y mantenerte ocupado con tareas triviales en Annúminas y Evendim mientras su ama hacía uso del palantír que posee. Debes llevar estas dolorosas noticias a Calenglad.","Libro 10, Capítulo 13: El plan llevado a cabo","Hay una nota clavada en la puerta de Laerdan","Lleva la nota de Laerdan a Calenglad","Mordrambor te observa con aire autosuficiente, con una media sonrisa dibujada en los labios, pero no dice nada.","Mordrambor se encuentra en la prisión, en lo alto de las escaleras tras la puerta de la izquierda al entrar en la fortaleza de la isla de Tinnudir, en Evendim.\
\
El Montaraz Tadan te ha contado que Laerdan pidió vigilar al prisionero por un tiempo, para que Tadan pudiera tomar un respiro del aire sofocante de la prisión. Durante ese lapso, Tadan cree que Mordrambor obró una vil hechicería sobre Laerdan que llevó al elfo a aventurarse solo en Barad Tironn. Deberías hablar con Mordrambor sobre esta traición.","Una nota de Laerdan está clavada en la puerta de su habitación en la fortaleza de la isla de Tinnudir, en Evendim.\
\
Has regresado de Gath Forthnír con una bolsa de tela finamente tejida con la que puedes transportar el palantír, pero Laerdan parece haberse marchado. Sin embargo, dejó una nota para ti en su puerta."}},
[1892]={nameES="Libro 10, Capítulo 14: El Ojo de Angmar",objectivesES={"Calenglad se encuentra en el campamento de los Montaraces de la isla de Tinnudir, en Evendim.\
\
Calenglad espera saber que tus aliados están preparados para el asalto contra Barad Tironn y la recuperación del palantír.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Esta misión está pensada para una comunidad. Si decides realizarla en solitario, recibirás un bono de inspiración, pero el desafío será muy grande.</rgb>","Habla con Calenglad y adéntrate en Barad Tironn en busca del palantír","Libro 10, Capítulo 14: El Ojo de Angmar","Calenglad se encuentra en el campamento de los Montaraces de la isla de Tinnudir, en Evendim.\
\
El palantír ha sido recuperado, pero Laerdan quedó a merced de un destino incierto en las profundidades de Barad Tironn, y Amarthiel logró ver aquello que buscaba en lo más hondo de la Piedra Videncia.","Habla con Calenglad","Calenglad ha tomado su decisión: el plan para recuperar el palantír de Barad Tironn se pondrá en marcha, pese al intento imprudente de Laerdan de enfrentarse a Amarthiel en soledad."}},
[1893]={nameES="Book 10, Chapter 14: Waking Leaflock",objectivesES={"Talk to Corudan in Leaflock's mead","Orcs can be found in Balewood, especially along the path called Núrzum's Wrath.","Show the White Hand equipment to Leaflock the Ent","You explain to Leaflock that Wildermore is held in the grip of an unnatural winter, and is at the mercy of a giant called Núrzum.\
\
The sighing of the wind through the branches is Leaflock's only response for many minutes. Then a rumbling sound slowly separates from the sound of the sleeping forest, and you realize he speaks again.\
\
'You use small names for big things, little one.'\
\
Somewhere snow falls from an upper branch and lands with a soft sound onto a drift.\
\
'Wildermore? Hooom... it is not a name I know...'","A sighing sound escapes from somewhere within the cracks of Leaflock's weathered face, but you see no other sign of wakefulness.","White Hand Uruks can be found at Núrzum's Wrath, in Balewood.\
\
Corudan thinks you should collect some White Hand equipment from Uruks in Balewood and show them to Leaflock.","Leaflock remains asleep.","You have raised quite a din fighting Orcs in Balewood, and should see if it was enough to waken Leaflock.","Book 10, Chapter 14: Waking Leaflock","You hold up the blade and helmet bearing the mark of the White Hand. For long moments it seems nothing will happen, until finally Leaflock's eye swivels open and fixes upon the Orc-weapons.\
\
'Hooom, brooooom. Why do you wake Leaflock... Leaflock...'\
\
A deep rumbling within the Ent goes on for some time, and you wonder if he is sleepily giving you his name in his own language.","Collected a White Hand helmet","You forgot the equipment?","You describe Núrzum to the Ent as best as you are able, trying to remember his form and features as you saw them amid the flying snow at Byre Tor. Leaflock shakes and quivers, becoming more animated than you have seen him.\
\
'Hroom! Broom! You said he was a giant! That is not just a giant!'\
\
A mighty and branch-like arm angrily spears a nearby drift, sending an explosion of snow skyward.\
\
'It may have been a giant once. Now it is more than that. You describe an unnatural combination. It was a giant. It was also a Huorn. Twisted! Corrupted!'\
\
Leaflock shakes angrily.\
\
'Broom! Boom! Leaflock will not allow this! Leaflock will deal with this!'","Leaflock shakes angrily.\
\
'Someone must pay for this, hoom, broom! Twisting a Huorn in this way! Hoom! Broom!'","Collect a White Hand blade from an Uruk in Balewood","Collect White Hand helmet from an Uruk in Balewood","You try to appeal to Leaflock's sense of duty, and speak of the hardships endured by the people of Wildermore at the hands of the Orcs and beneath Núrzum's trampling feet.\
\
'The lives of Orcs are short. They may hack and claw and burn for a time, but never for long. It is true of Men also, hoom... boom... broom.'\
\
Leaflock is silent as you gather your thoughts and try to devise another approach. Before you come up with something, the Ent unexpectedly speaks.\
\
'I do not know what beast is described by this name \\qNúrzum.\\q What do you mean by this name?'\
\
Upper branches creak and groan as a slight breeze picks up, and the forest all around seems to be listening.","Corudan has agreed to meet you back at Nona's cave after he is done speaking with Leaflock.","Leaflock stirs slightly, but remains otherwise asleep.","You are trying to waken Leaflock to your cause.","Corudan is in Leaflock's mead, trying to devise a means of waking the slumbering Ent.","Talk to Corudan back in Nona's cave","You found Leaflock the Ent within Balewood, but now you need to wake him to your need.","Collected a White Hand blade","Corudan is in Leaflock's mead.","You have collected some White Hand equipment from Orcs in Balewood and should show them to Leaflock. That may rouse the Ent to wakefulness."}},
[1894]={nameES="Book 10, Chapter 15: The Bloom",objectivesES={"Horn is in Nona's cave, waiting to speak with you when you are ready to take your meal.","Nona está en su cueva en las Altas Cumbres.","Gléowine is in Nona's cave, and you should speak to him to see how things have been while you and Corudan sought out Leaflock.","Horn is in Nona's cave, and you should speak to him.","Book 10, Chapter 15: The Bloom","Talk to Horn when you are ready to eat","You have returned to Nona's cave and should speak with your friends while you wait to see if Leaflock will take action against Núrzum."}},
[1895]={nameES="Book 10, Chapter 1: Exiles",objectivesES={"A jangling sound alerts you to a broken harp, which you pick up","Saruman's mounted minions threaten the people of Rohan throughout the Sutcrofts.\
\
Horn and Corudan think you should make the most of your exile from Edoras by continuing to combat Saruman's mounted minions in East Rohan.","Horn and Corudan are at the crossing of the Entwash, in the Sutcrofts, and desire to speak with you concerning your next steps.","Horn is at the crossing of the Entwash, in the Sutcrofts, and he will wish to see the battered harp you found.","Bring the battered harp to Horn at the crossing of the Entwash, in the Sutcrofts","Defeat Saruman's mounted minions in the Sutcrofts (4/5)","Book 10, Chapter 1: Exiles","A jangling sound alerts you to a broken harp crushed beneath your foe"}},
[1896]={nameES="Libro 10, Capítulo 1: La Campeona de Angmar",objectivesES={"Libro 10, Capítulo 1: La Campeona de Angmar","Amarthiel y sus esbirros han tomado Annúminas, la antigua ciudad de los Dúnedain, y Calenglad ahora lucha por trazar un plan con el que oponérsele.","Calenglad se encuentra en el campamento de los Montaraces, en la isla de Tinnudir, en Evendim.\
\
Laerdan ha escrito una carta para Calenglad explicando la amenaza que supone Amarthiel. Te ha pedido que leas la carta y se la entregues a Calenglad.","Entrega la carta de Laerdan a Calenglad.","A Laerdan se le ha dado una habitación en la fortaleza de la isla de Tinnudir. Su estancia está al final de un tramo de escaleras, a la derecha según entras en el torreón.\
\
Calenglad te ha dicho que Laerdan el Elfo ha llegado a Tinnudir portando información que podría ayudarte a combatir las fuerzas de Amarthiel en Annúminas. Dijo que Laerdan preguntó por ti por tu nombre."}},
[1897]={nameES="Book 10, Chapter 2: Gléowine",objectivesES={"Gléowine is in a drunken stupor, and pays you no mind.","Gléowine spits and splutters, choking on almonds and honeyed water, and wipes the green smear of raw cabbage from his forehead. He says nothing, though his actions speak loudly of his fondness for you.","An overpowering smell of ale greets you as you approach the drunken man","Alhild is near Gléowine by the barracks in Snowbourn.\
\
You have found Gléowine, but you need him to sober up before he will be of any use to anyone. Perhaps Alhild can be of help.","You remove a comb of dripping, delicious honey","Heiu hands you a bladder of cool, refreshing water","Collect a handful of Snowbourn almonds","Alhild has further information about the remedies she suggested","Obtain a bladder of water from Heiu","Horn is by his master Gléowine, outside the barracks in Snowbourn.\
\
You have found Gléowine and attempted to ease his drunkenness with Alhild's remedies, but none of them seem to have worked. Now Horn wants to speak with you.","Search for Gléowine near the barracks in Snowbourn","Talk to a guard at the entrance or stables of Snowbourn about Gléowine","Talk to Alhild, near Gléowine at the barracks","Collect a Snowbourn honeycomb","Book 10, Chapter 2: Gléowine","Gléowine is by the barracks in Snowbourn.\
\
You have obtained the ingredients for several drunkenness remedies and should now apply them to Gléowine in order to sober him up.","Guards at the entrance of Snowbourn or its stables may have seen Gléowine, if he lives.\
\
Horn hopes that his master Gléowine found his way safely to Snowbourn, despite much evidence to the contrary.","You have found Gléowine. He is alive, but very, very drunk.\
\
'Hey, you... you there... you? Stay out of my... my way, you? Hey!' he slurs.\
\
With that effort expended, Gléowine drifts back into his stupor.","Talk to Gléowine by the barracks in Snowbourn","You have found Gléowine in Snowbourn, but he is very drunk.","You reach into the bucket and pull out a handful of almonds","Horn is worried about the fate of his master Gléowine, whose broken and battered harp you found in the clutches of one of Saruman's minions.","The guard with whom you spoke did not recognize Gléowine from your description, but advised you to look for him near the barracks in Snowbourn, where many of the recent arrivals in the city have congregated.","Alhild knows where around Snowbourn to collect the ingredients for the various drunkenness remedies she mentioned.\
\
You need to collect the ingredients necessary to relieve Gléowine's drunkenness.","Give the honey, water, almonds, and cabbage to Gléowine to ease his drunken state","Talk to Horn by the barracks in Snowbourn"}},
[1898]={nameES="Libro 10, Capítulo 2: La marea de la batalla",objectivesES={"Libro 10, Capítulo 2: La marea de la batalla","Rosselloth se encuentra en el patio de Gwaelband. Gwaelband está al oeste de Men Erain, más allá de Minathranc, en la entrada frontal de Annúminas.\
\
Calenglad ha decidido que las fuerzas de Amarthiel deben ser contenidas en Annúminas para impedir que centre su atención en el palantír. Te ha enviado a hablar con Rosselloth para que te aconseje sobre cómo puedes ayudar.","Laerdan te ha dicho que el palantír debe ser arrebatado a Amarthiel a cualquier precio, pero Calenglad insiste en que recuperar Annúminas debe ser lo primero.","El montaraz Fainneleg se encuentra en Echad Garthadir, un pequeño campamento al suroeste de Gwaelband, en un nivel más elevado de la ciudad. Si los Montaraces controlan Gwaelband, la puerta ofrece un acceso sencillo al nivel superior. De lo contrario, deberás nadar hacia el oeste pasando el Puerto de Annúminas hasta Gaerannon y luego trepar por la ciudad para llegar a Echad Garthadir.\
\
Rosselloth te ha dicho que hables con Fainneleg, el montaraz que organiza la defensa de Annúminas.","Habla con Rosselloth"}},
[1899]={nameES="Book 10, Chapter 3: No Word from Wildermore",objectivesES={"Gléowine is on the wooden porch outside the Mead Hall in Harwick, in the Wold.\
\
Gléowine wishes to speak with you.","Horn and Corudan have learned some troubling news about the region of Rohan called Wildermore, and that has done for Gléowine what your various remedies could not.","Bring the map to Gléowine by the barracks in Snowbourn","Book 10, Chapter 3: No Word from Wildermore","Talk to Aldor Harding in the Mead Hall of Harwick, in the Wold","Britred left on an adventure by the south gate of Snowbourn. How far south did he get on his quest?\
\
You were told that Britred took Gléowine's map and went on an adventure. If you find him, he may return the map to you.","One of the children of Snowbourn may know where to find Gléowine's map.\
\
Gléowine wishes to travel with you to investigate the curious silence that has enveloped Wildermore, but first he wants you to recover the map he abandoned.","Britred tosses you the map, and runs back to Snowbourn","Talk to Gléowine outside the Mead Hall of Harwick, in the Wold","Talk to Horn by the barracks in Snowbourn","Find Britred south of Snowbourn","Horn and Corudan are by the barracks in Snowbourn.\
\
Gléowine wants to travel with you to investigate what has happened in Wildermore, but first he needs some of the possessions he gave away while in the depths of his despair.","Talk to Arnwi by the south gate of Snowbourn","Talk to Gléowine by the barracks in Snowbourn","Talk to Corudan by the barracks in Snowbourn","Aldor Harding is in the Mead Hall of Harwick, in the Wold.\
\
Fastred has no men to spare in an investigation of Wildermore, and has sent you to give Harding the unfortunate tidings.","Gléowine is by the barracks in Snowbourn.\
\
Gléowine has been brought back to sobriety by something, and seems ready to talk to you.","Gléowine is by the barracks in Snowbourn.\
\
You have recovered Gléowine's map and should return it to him.","Horn is by the barracks in Snowbourn.\
\
You have returned Gléowine's map and should now speak with Horn about your preparations to travel to Wildermore.","Gléowine stares at you with haunted eyes. It would seem something has cut through the stupor caused by his drink.\
\
'Something has happened in Wildermore? I... I was born in a small town there, and have not been back for years, but... if something has happened...\
\
'There is no reason for me to stay here, stranger. If you are going to investigate Wildermore, I would travel with you and... it is young Horn with you, is it not? He has a man's face and build now, but I still remember the years spent teaching him the lessons of history and the ways of music. He was... not the most diligent of students. I jest, of course. Who among us can say he was?\
\
'I abandoned my harp somewhere in the wild and gave away my other possessions when I thought I would have no further need for them. I cannot travel with you until I have them back again. Most of them were mere sundries, but there was a map I should not have given away. I feel foolish now, for it was a rare and precious thing and belongs not in the keeping of children.'","An optional Interlude has been unlocked for Gléowine's map"}},
[1900]={nameES="Libro 10, Capítulo 3: La batalla por Annúminas",objectivesES={"Habla con Gwonil y ayuda a defender su posición","Fainneleg se encuentra en Echad Garthadir, el campamento de los Montaraces en el nivel intermedio de Annúminas.\
\
Has hablado con Gwonil y con Torchirion y has derrotado a varios angmarim armados con arco en Annúminas, y ahora deberías regresar con Fainneleg para informarle de tus victorias.","Los Montaraces de Fainneleg están demasiado dispersos para defender la ciudad frente a los ataques repetidos de los esbirros de Amarthiel.","Gwonil se encuentra en los muelles del Puerto de Annúminas, al norte de Echad Garthadir. Torchirion se encuentra en Adannon, una pequeña puerta de la muralla de la ciudad, al oeste de los muelles, que da acceso a la orilla occidental del Lago Nenuial. Arqueros angmarim acechan por toda la ciudad, a menudo ocultos.\
\
Fainneleg te ha pedido que acudas con urgencia en ayuda de Gwonil y de Torchirion, pues teme que estos Montaraces no puedan resistir otro asalto a sus posiciones. También desea que derrotes a cualquier angmarim armado con arco que encuentres dentro de la ciudad.","Habla con Torchirion y defiende su posición","Libro 10, Capítulo 3: La batalla por Annúminas"}},
[1901]={nameES="Book 10, Chapter 4: A Man of the Wold",objectivesES={"The White Hand camp is crawling with enemies. How did they come to be here?","Find Thrymm's training camp","You have arrived in Scylfig, and should search for Wídfara and Léodwig","Wídfara is in Scylfig, in the Writhendowns.\
\
You have done as he asked, and should now return to Wídfara to hear more of his tale.","Talk to Horn in Scylfig","Corudan is in Scylfig.\
\
Corudan listened to Wídfara's tale, and may have some thoughts about it.","The White Hand has established a camp in the south-east corner of the Writhendowns. The abandoned fishing village can be found to the north-west of Scylfig. Thrymm Red-beard's training camp is to the east of Scylfig.\
\
Wídfara has agreed to tell you more of what happened in Wildermore if you help the people of the Writhendowns by facing down their foes near three significant locations.","Book 10, Chapter 4: A Man of the Wold","Travel to the town of Scylfig, in the Writhendowns of Wildermore","It is Corudan's hope that Gléowine remains still within Scylfig.\
\
Corudan wants you to find Gléowine if he remains in Scylfig.","Horn is in Scylfig with Corudan and Wídfara.\
\
You have comforted Gléowine and should now speak with Horn in Scylfig.","Find the possibly-haunted fishing town","Find Gléowine somewhere within Scylfig","Horn is standing by Gléowine on the porch outside the Mead Hall of Harwick.\
\
You should speak with Horn about your journey into Wildermore.","The men sent by Harding into Wildermore never returned, and now he wants you to see what has happened within the borders of that land.","This fishing village seems to be abandoned. What secrets does it retain?","Talk to Corudan in Scylfig","Find Wídfara or Léodwig within Scylfig, if they are to be found","Thrymm's training camp is packed with supplies and men eager for battle. But is it enough?","The town of Scylfig is located in the Writhendowns, in Wildermore, west of the Wold.\
\
Your companions have agreed that it is time to begin your search for Harding's men in Wildermore. You will begin with the town of Scylfig.","Find the White Hand camp in the south-east","Talk to Horn outside the Mead Hall in Harwick","Wídfara may be within the town of Scylfig, in the Writhendowns area of Wildermore.\
\
If Wídfara is within Scylfig, you should find him and learn why he has not returned to the Wold."}},
[1902]={nameES="Libro 10, Capítulo 4: Órdenes de marcha",objectivesES={"Libro 10, Capítulo 4: Órdenes de marcha","Entrega las órdenes a Fainneleg","Fainneleg se encuentra en el campamento de los Montaraces de Echad Garthadir, en el centro de Annúminas.\
\
Has recuperado las órdenes y deberías regresar de inmediato con Fainneleg.","Recoge órdenes de los angmarim en Gwaelband, Clorhir y Menelband","Fainneleg busca órdenes de los angmarim que ocupan el patio de Gwaelband, al noreste de Echad Garthadir, donde te encontraste con Rosselloth; de Clorhir, frente a los estanques de Glinghant, al este de Echad Garthadir; y de Menelband, en el nivel más alto de la ciudad.\
\
Fainneleg te ha hablado de tres ubicaciones inestables en Annúminas. Quiere que derrotes a los angmarim y registres sus cuerpos en busca de cualquier orden que puedan llevar. Si los Dúnedain controlan alguno de estos lugares, Fainneleg te indicó que busques los cuerpos de los angmarim que hayan podido caer en los combates; ellos también podrían haber llevado tales órdenes.","Fainneleg ha decidido que los Montaraces deben elaborar un plan para pasar a la ofensiva y tomar a Amarthiel por sorpresa."}},
[1903]={nameES="Libro 10, Capítulo 5: Hacer saltar la trampa",objectivesES={"Libro 10, Capítulo 5: Hacer saltar la trampa","Calenglad está en el campamento de los Montaraces en la isla de Tinnudir.\
\
Calenglad espera saber si aceptarás emprender la peligrosa misión de capturar a Mordrambor, uno de los lugartenientes Númenóreanos Negros de Amarthiel.","Habla con Calenglad y captura a Mordrambor","Calenglad está en el campamento de los Montaraces en la isla de Tinnudir.\
\
Fainneleg oyó unas noticias de Calenglad que renovaron su esperanza y te ha enviado con el viejo Montaraz para oírlas. Te dio las órdenes escritas en la Lengua Negra que reuniste en Gwaelband, Clorhir y Tirband, y dijo que quizá Calenglad las necesite después de todo.","Lleva el fajo de papeles a Calenglad","Calenglad está en el campamento de los Montaraces en la isla de Tinnudir.\
\
Tú y un contingente de Montaraces habéis capturado a Mordrambor, uno de los hechiceros Númenóreanos Negros jurados a Amarthiel.","Los Dúnedain han recibido noticias que llevan a Fainneleg y Calenglad a creer que su suerte podría estar a punto de cambiar"}},
[1904]={nameES="Book 10, Chapter 5: The Lord of Widows and Orphans",objectivesES={"Horn is outside the Mead Hall of Forlaw, in Wildermore.\
\
You have reassured scared villagers and should now return to Horn.","Book 10, Chapter 5: The Lord of Widows and Orphans","The assemblage stares at Gárwig with open mouth and gloomy countenance","Scared villagers can be found throughout Forlaw.\
\
Horn has asked you to reassure the people of Forlaw that their Reeve is working on some means of defeating Núrzum. That this is not exactly true does not seem to worry Horn very much.","Reeve Gárwig rules from within the Mead Hall of Forlaw, on the southernmost shore of the Isingmere.\
\
Horn has learned that the people of Wildermore do not have confidence in Reeve Gárwig, and thinks you should visit him and learn his plans.","Gárwig squints at you distrustfully.\
\
'Harding sent men to help me, and they were unable to provide any assistance at all! They got themselves eaten, or crushed, or lost in the snow, and worse than that: the survivors crawled back to my villages, bringing their rumbling bellies and broken limbs with them! They are of no use to anyone!\
\
'Where are my warriors? Where are the strong men of Rohan? Dead, or gone, or weakened by the cold and by hunger. All that remain in my hall are orphans and widows. They call me the Lord of Widows and Orphans, did you know that? Me, Gárwig, son of Céolgar, Reeve of Wildermore!\
\
'You cannot face Núrzum, but if you are willing to help there is no shortage of foes seeking to destroy my people! The uruk-hai have secretly been bringing supplies near to Forlaw, along the shores of the Isingmere. Defeat them and burn the barrels of supplies they have brought with them. Do this and you may forestall the end, for a time. Only for a time.'","Reeve Gárwig is in the Mead Hall of Forlaw, in Wildermore.\
\
You have attempted to hinder the movements of the uruk-hai on the shores of the Isingmere, and should return to Reeve Gárwig.","Talk to Reeve Gárwig in the Mead Hall of Forlaw","Horn is outside the Mead Hall of Forlaw.\
\
Reeve Gárwig has given up hope, but you are certain Horn has not, and should see what he intends.","The uruk-hai have a camp on the shore of the Isingmere, and Reeve Gárwig has asked you to burn their supply barrels and thin their number.\
\
Reeve Gárwig knows you cannot stand against Núrzum, so he wants you to try and combat some of the uruk-hai instead.","Talk to Horn outside the Mead Hall of Forlaw","Wildermore faces many dangers, and its Reeve may not be up to the task of defending its people."}},
[1905]={nameES="Book 10, Chapter 6: Fallow Ground",objectivesES={"Book 10, Chapter 6: Fallow Ground","Warg-riders can be found throughout the Fallows, in Wildermore, and some foe has shut the southern road into the Norcrofts.\
\
Horn has asked you to defeat Warg-riders in the Fallows and to investigate the southern road out of Wildermore.","Talk to Horn at Gárferth's Farm","Bring salvaged crops to the provisioner in Forlaw","Horn thinks the people of the Fallows could use your help against their enemies.","Gléowine is in Forlaw, and wishes to speak with you.\
\
You have brought some crops to the provisioner in Forlaw, and should now see what Gléowine has been doing.","The provisioner of Forlaw is in the southern courtyard of the city.\
\
You have salvaged some crops from an overrun farm in the Fallows, and should bring them to the provisioner at Forlaw.","Wargs and their riders stalk the Fallows, and many can be located Edsig's Farm, located in the southern reaches.\
\
Horn has asked you to defeat the Wargs and their riders in the Fallows, and to bring any salvageable crops you find from Edsig's Farm to the provisioner at Forlaw.","Talk to Gléowine in Forlaw","Horn is waiting for you at Gárferth's Farm, in the south-east reaches of the Fallows.\
\
You have defeated both Warg-riders and the uruk-hai at Kúthaus, and should now meet Horn at Gárferth's Farm, where he said he would be waiting for you."}},
[1906]={nameES="Libro 10, Capítulo 6: El secreto de las órdenes",objectivesES={"Con la captura de Mordrambor, la suerte de los Dúnedain podría estar cambiando. Si se logra que traduzca las órdenes que encontraste, el curso de la batalla podría inclinarse a favor de los Pueblos Libres.","Libro 10, Capítulo 6: El secreto de las órdenes","Muestra el fajo de papeles a Mordrambor","Mordrambor se encuentra prisionero en la fortaleza de la isla de Tinnudir, en Evendim. Al entrar en el torreón, la puerta de la izquierda conduce a unas escaleras que suben hasta la prisión.\
\
Calenglad te ha dado las órdenes que reuniste de los Angmarim en Annúminas para que se las muestres al prisionero Númenóreano Negro. Mordrambor conoce la Lengua Negra y debe ser obligado a traducir las órdenes para ti."}},
[1907]={nameES="Libro 10, Capítulo 7: Emisarios del Mal",objectivesES={"Has derrotado a Roibárd","Has derrotado a Mól Choluim","Mordrambor te habló de tres emisarios Angmarim enviados para comprar la lealtad de nuevos aliados para los ejércitos de Amarthiel en Annúminas: los saqueadores de tumbas de la isla de Rantost, en el extremo noreste del lago; los Gauredain, cerca del extremo noroeste; y los Kergrim, entre las tumbas de Men Erain, a lo largo del extremo sureste del lago.\
\
Mordrambor te habló de tres emisarios enviados en barco a través del lago Nenuial para comprar la lealtad de algunas de las fuerzas malignas que asolan Evendim.","Encuentra al emisario de Amarthiel ante los Kergrim","Libro 10, Capítulo 7: Emisarios del Mal","Mordrambor ha traducido las órdenes que recuperaste de los Angmarim en Annúminas y ha revelado un plan mortal para obtener más aliados en la lucha por la ciudad.","Has derrotado a Cailin","Encuentra al emisario de Amarthiel ante la gente de Rantost","Encuentra al emisario de Amarthiel ante los Gauredain","El Montaraz Tadan se encuentra en la prisión, en lo alto de la escalera a la izquierda al entrar en la fortaleza de la isla de Tinnudir, en Evendim.\
\
Has derrotado a los tres emisarios enviados por Amarthiel para reclutar nuevos aliados para la batalla de Annúminas, y ahora deberías informar de tus victorias a Tadan."}},
[1908]={nameES="Book 10, Chapter 7: Unnatural Winter",objectivesES={"Book 10, Chapter 7: Unnatural Winter","Gléowine is concerned about the home in which he grew up, in the town of Dunfast, and wants to see what has become of it.","The village of Dunfast is located in the middle of the Whitshaws, in Wildermore.\
\
Horn and Corudan agree that you should all journey to Gléowine's home, Dunfast, and see how it has been treated by this unnatural winter.","Talk to Corudan in Forlaw","Travel to the village of Dunfast, in the middle of the Whitshaws, in Wildermore","Talk to Gléowine outside Dunfast","Gléowine is outside the village of Dunfast, in the Whitshaws.\
\
Little moves among the houses of Dunfast, and Gléowine is very worried.","Talk to Horn outside Dunfast, in the Whitshaws","Horn is waiting to speak with you outside Dunfast.\
\
Nona reappeared again, but the reunion did not proceed as Horn wished. He is waiting to speak with you.","Talk to Horn in Forlaw","Talk to Gléowine and explore Dunfast together","Horn and Corudan are in the town of Forlaw, in Wildermore.\
\
Gléowine wants to visit Dunfast, the village in which he was born, to see how it has been affected by this unnatural winter.","The air is very still, and Dunfast seems unnaturally quiet","Gléowine is outside Dunfast, in the Whitshaws.\
\
Gléowine wants to investigate Dunfast with you, Horn, and Corudan, and is waiting to speak with you."}},
[1909]={nameES="Book 10, Chapter 8: Drifting Snows",objectivesES={"Corudan is outside Dunfast, in the Whitshaws.\
\
Horn is of little use to anyone, pining as he is over Nona. Perhaps Corudan will have some guidance.","Bring root vegetables to Corudan outside Dunfast","Book 10, Chapter 8: Drifting Snows","You have encountered Nona once again, but she has not changed her mind and refuses to travel with you. Horn does not know what to do, but Corudan sees the value in keeping the Rohirrim man occupied.","Horn is outside Dunfast, in the Whitshaws.\
\
Corudan has asked that you see how Horn is feeling.","Horn sighs wistfully and looks off into the distance.","Corudan is outside Dunfast, in the Whitshaws.\
\
You have done as Corudan asked, defeating Orcs and Warg-riders and collecting the root vegetables for which Nona asked.","Talk to Horn outside Dunfast","Orcs can be found throughout the Whitshaws. Root vegetables can be found at the bases of many trees in the area outside Dunfast.\
\
Corudan wants you to keep busy while Horn decides what he wants to do, and this involves defeating Saruman's minions in the Whitshaws and collecting the root vegetables Nona mentioned.","Talk to Corudan outside Dunfast","Horn sighs wistfully and gazes off into the distance. You wonder what he's thinking about, and decide you'll never know.\
\
Then you wonder if Corudan's dry wit has rubbed off on you permanently.","An optional Interlude has been unlocked for Gléowine's map"}},
[1910]={nameES="Libro 10, Capítulo 8: El mensaje del prisionero",objectivesES={"Mordrambor se encuentra prisionero en la cárcel, en lo alto de las escaleras a la izquierda al entrar en la fortaleza de la isla de Tinnudir, en Evendim.\
\
Has entregado el mensaje de Mordrambor a Laerdan tal como pidió, y el elfo te ha advertido que tengas cuidado con la traición del Númenóreano Negro, pues incluso prisionero supone un gran peligro. Si cumple su palabra, Mordrambor debería decirte ahora el lugar del próximo asalto planeado por Amarthiel contra Annúminas.","Mordrambor te ha dicho que Amarthiel planea nuevos asaltos en lugares concretos de la ciudad, pero solo te dirá dónde si entregas un mensaje en su nombre.","Mordrambor se encuentra en la prisión, en lo alto de las escaleras tras la puerta de la izquierda al entrar en la fortaleza de la isla de Tinnudir, en Evendim.\
\
Mordrambor ha estado murmurando sobre nuevos ataques contra la ciudad, pero se niega a darle más detalles a Tadan. Tadan espera que puedas obtener alguna información del prisionero.","Laerdan ha recibido una habitación en la fortaleza de la isla de Tinnudir, en lo alto de las escaleras tras la puerta de la derecha al entrar en el torreón.\
\
Mordrambor te ha dicho que Amarthiel planea nuevos asaltos contra la ciudad de Annúminas, pero solo revelará los lugares exactos si entregas el siguiente mensaje a Laerdan: 'Laerdan, tu tiempo está por terminar, tus errores pronto serán juzgados. Amarthiel te espera en Barad Tironn, donde se sentará a juzgarte.'","Libro 10, Capítulo 8: El mensaje del prisionero"}},
[1911]={nameES="Libro 10, Capítulo 9: Un asalto renovado",objectivesES={"Gwonil se encuentra en los muelles del puerto de Annúminas, al norte de Echad Garthadir. Torchirion está en Adannon, una pequeña puerta en la muralla de la ciudad, al oeste de los muelles, que da acceso a la orilla occidental del lago Nenuial.\
\
Calenglad te ha pedido que acudas con rapidez en defensa de Gwonil y Torchirion; según las palabras de Mordrambor, ellos soportarán el peso principal del último asalto de Amarthiel contra la ciudad.","Habla con Torchirion y defiende su posición","Has defendido con éxito la posición de Torchirion","Has defendido con éxito la posición de Gwonil","Calenglad está en el campamento de los Montaraces de la isla de Tinnudir, en Evendim.\
\
Mordrambor te ha pedido que informes a Calenglad sobre los lugares planeados para los próximos asaltos de Amarthiel: el puerto de Annúminas y la puerta de Adannon.","Libro 10, Capítulo 9: Un asalto renovado","Calenglad está en el campamento de los Montaraces de la isla de Tinnudir, en Evendim.\
\
Has defendido a Gwonil y a Torchirion de los asaltos anunciados por Mordrambor y ahora deberías regresar con Calenglad para informarle de tu éxito.","Habla con Gwonil y defiende su posición","A cambio de llevar su mensaje a Laerdan, Mordrambor te ha revelado los lugares del próximo asalto planeado por Amarthiel contra Annúminas."}},
[1912]={nameES="Book 10, Chapter 9: A Song for Byre Tor",objectivesES={"Defeat Orcs in Byre Tor until Gléowine has finished composing his song","The man stares foreward with sightless eyes, and his breathing is shallow and ragged. He makes no sign of seeing you.","Gléowine sings, 'A city on a hill she was, strong Byre Tor, fair Byre Tor.'","Gléowine sings, 'From each corner of the land all would ride.'","Gléowine looks at the city and sighs. 'Byre Tor has indeed fallen, as we feared.'","Gléowine sings, 'But the winter came, and with it an iron tide.'","Horn and Gléowine want you to defeat Orcs in the city of Byre Tor.\
\
Gléowine desires to compose a song about Byre Tor, and is using your battles with Orcs as inspiration.","The City of Byre Tor is in the High Knolls of Wildermore, located north of Dunfast along the road.\
\
Horn desires to see the city of Byre Tor for himself and then to proceed on to the cave of which Nona spoke.","Book 10, Chapter 9: A Song for Byre Tor","Nona está en su cueva en las Altas Cumbres.","Gléowine sings, 'And it was our day to comfort, our time to protect.'","The survivors Nona rescued from Byre Tor can be found throughout the two chambers of her cave.","Search the cave for Nona","Gléowine sings, 'To that city on the hill, strong Byre Tor, fair Byre Tor.'","If this is the cave of which Nona spoke, she will likely be somewhere inside.","Find the entrance to Nona's cave in the High Knolls","This man is close to death and his sightless eyes cannot focus on you. You wonder what it is he is seeing, and hope he soon will find peace from it.","This may be the entrance to Nona's cave, but there is only one way to know for certain","Talk to the dying man","Travel to the city of Byre Tor, in the High Knolls of Wildermore","Nona has asked you to speak with the survivors from Byre Tor, but has nothing else to say for now.","Horn is ready to follow Nona to the cave she mentioned in the mountains, but the road leads first to the city of Byre Tor.","Gléowine sings, 'From far across the plain her banners we espied.'","Nona's cave is in the north-western heights of the rocky crags in the High Knolls, in Wildermore.\
\
Gléowine has finished his song, and Horn is satisfied with the Orcs you have defeated in Byre Tor.","Gléowine sings, 'And she was a comfort in time of pain, time of want.'"}},
[1913]={nameES="Libro 11, Capítulo 10: Un Saquito de Gemas por una Caja de Llaves",objectivesES={"Libro 11, Capítulo 10: Un Saquito de Gemas por una Caja de Llaves","Ciudad de los Trasgos se encuentra en el Paso Alto, en las Montañas Nubladas, al noreste de Rivendel.\
\
Merilos te ha pedido que viajes a Ciudad de los Trasgos y recuperes un puñado de preciadas gemas de los trasgos que allí viven, mientras ella trabaja en reparar las llaves que encontraste en Delossad.","Lleva las gemas a Merilos","La joyera Merilos está en la Aguja del Encuentro, en Rivendel.\
\
Has conseguido un puñado de gemas de Ciudad de los Trasgos, como Merilos te pidió, y ahora deberías llevárselas a cambio de la caja de llaves que dejaste para reparar.","Has traído a Merilos la caja de llaves rotas para repararla, y te ha dicho que puede rehacer aproximadamente la mitad. El resto no tiene arreglo."}},
[1914]={nameES="Book 11, Chapter 10: The King Rides West",objectivesES={"Talk to Théoden in Meduseld and watch his company ride to war","Book 11, Chapter 10: The King Rides West","Théoden King is inside the Golden Hall of Meduseld, in Edoras.\
\
Éowyn has asked you to see if the King has any further commands before he rides west to Isengard.","Talk to Éowyn outside Meduseld, in Edoras","Éowyn is outside the Golden Hall of Meduseld, in Edoras.\
\
The King and his company have left Edoras, and Éowyn is in charge of making ready the evacuation of the city.","Théoden is now ready to ride west to Isengard... to war.","Théoden King is inside the Golden Hall of Meduseld, in Edoras.\
\
The King is waiting to speak with you before he rides west, to Isengard and war.","Talk to Théoden in Meduseld"}},
[1915]={nameES="Libro 11, Capítulo 11: Las Llaves Reparadas",objectivesES={"Lleva la caja de llaves reparadas a Candelleth","Merilos ha reparado tantas llaves como le fue posible, y ahora debes llevarlas a Candelleth.","Candelleth está en su campamento élfico en Tâl Bruinen.\
\
Merilos ha reparado tantas llaves como ha podido, y ahora debes llevárselas a Candelleth.","Libro 11, Capítulo 11: Las Llaves Reparadas"}},
[1916]={nameES="Libro 11, Capítulo 12: Prisionera de los Pueblos Libres",objectivesES={"Libro 11, Capítulo 12: Prisionera de los Pueblos Libres","Habla con Candelleth","Muildir está al sureste de Echad Candelleth, frente a la entrada de Delossad.\
\
Merilos ha reparado las llaves que encontraste, y Candelleth te pidió mostrárselas a Muildir y adentrarte en los secretos de Delossad en busca de Narchuil.","Habla con Muildir y desvela los secretos de Delossad","Candelleth está en su campamento en Tâl Bruinen.\
\
Has aprendido mucho en las profundidades de Delossad, pero lo más preocupante es la noticia de que Mordrambor y las fuerzas de Amarthiel han recuperado a Narchuil, el anillo que se creía perdido.","La joyera Merilos ha reparado muchas de las llaves que Sara Roblecorazón enterró frente a la entrada de Delossad, y ha llegado el momento de desvelar sus secretos."}},
[1917]={nameES="Libro 11, Capítulo 13: El Fracaso de Laerdan",objectivesES={"Libro 11, Capítulo 13: El Fracaso de Laerdan","Elrond está en la biblioteca de Rivendel.\
\
Candelleth te ha pedido que lleves a Elrond las terribles noticias de que Angmar ha recuperado a Narchuil.","En lo profundo de Delossad, Mordrambor te dio la terrible noticia de que Narchuil ha sido encontrada. Debes informar al señor Elrond.","Lleva el diario podrido a Elrond"}},
[1918]={nameES="Book 11, Chapter 1: Too Great a Need",objectivesES={"Talk to Horn in Nona's Cave","Hunbald is at Entwade, the Entwash Crossing in the Sutcrofts.\
\
Horn has resolved to return to Edoras, against the commands of the King. You, Horn, and Gléowine should present yourselves to Hunbald with this decision.","Habla con Horn en la Cueva de Nona en las Altas Cumbres de las Tierras Feroces","Talk to Hunbald at the Entwade, in the Sutcrofts","Danger threatens the kingdom of Rohan on all sides, and if nothing is done the land will be overrun by the forces of Saruman. Has the time come to defy the word of the King in order to save his people?","Talk to Corudan in Nona's Cave","Book 11, Chapter 1: Too Great a Need","Talk to Gléowine in Nona's Cave","Your companions are in Nona's Cave in the High Knolls of Wildermore.\
\
Horn wishes to speak with you about the road ahead.","Horn is in Nona's Cave in the High Knolls, in Wildermore.\
\
You have spoken with Gléowine and Corudan, and now Horn is waiting to see if you will accompany him to Edoras.","Corudan is in Nona's Cave in the High Knolls, in Wildermore.\
\
Horn has asked you to speak with Corudan and Gléowine about the course he has suggested."}},
[1919]={nameES="Libro 11, Capítulo 1: Vigilando los Caminos",objectivesES={"Libro 11, Capítulo 1: Vigilando los Caminos","Torogethir está en un pequeño campamento justo al oeste de la Puerta de Evendim hacia los Campos de Fornost, al nordeste de Tinnudir. Galthoniel tiene un campamento en una elevación con vista al Barandalf, al sudeste de Tinnudir y al este del poblado hobbit de Dwaling.\
\
Calenglad te ha pedido llevar noticias de posibles movimientos de los Angmarim fuera de Evendim a Torogethir y Galthoniel, los Montaraces encargados de vigilar los caminos.","Laerdan se ha perdido en los otrora orgullosos salones de Barad Tironn, y ahora los Dúnedain deben impedir que Amarthiel actúe según el conocimiento que obtuvo mediante el uso del palantír.","Calenglad está en el campamento de los Montaraces en la isla de Tinnudir, en Evendim.\
\
Has comunicado a Torogethir y Galthoniel lo que Calenglad ha deducido sobre los planes de Amarthiel, y permanecerán vigilantes ante cualquier señal de Angmarim saliendo de Evendim."}},
[1920]={nameES="Book 11, Chapter 2: Edoras",objectivesES={"Make your way into Edoras and meet up with Gléowine","Talk to Gléowine in Edoras, along the road","Hunbald has put his honour on the line, trusting that you and your companions mean no harm to Théoden or to the people of Rohan, and now you should ride for Edoras to bring warning to the King.","The time has come to climb the streets of Edoras to the entrance to the Golden Hall of Meduseld, there to await the judgement of Théoden.","Book 11, Chapter 2: Edoras","Climb the streets of Edoras to reach the entrance to Meduseld","Háma stands before you, and he bars the way to the Golden Hall of Meduseld.","Talk to Horn by the barrows outside the entrance to Edoras","The barrows outside the entrance to Edoras will be a good place to meet up with your companions.\
\
Hunbald has allowed you to cross the Entwash, and now you should ride to the entrance of Edoras.","Gléowine stops ahead and stares at a magnificent white horse","Before the gates of Edoras, burial mounds of Kings stand beside the road","Gléowine is on the road within the entrance to Edoras, by a majestic white horse.","Horn is by the barrows outside the entrance to Edoras.\
\
You have arrived at Edoras, and should speak now to Horn by the barrows.","Ride to the barrows outside the entrance to Edoras","Outside the Golden Hall of Meduseld, the doorward of Théoden bars your way","Talk to Háma outside the Golden Hall of Meduseld","You have come to Edoras and should now make your way up through the city."}},
[1921]={nameES="Libro 11, Capítulo 2: Mordrambor",objectivesES={"Calenglad ha decidido que, antes de que comiences tu búsqueda de Narchuil, debes aprender cuanto puedas sobre el anillo a través de Mordrambor.","Habla con Calenglad y enfrenta a Mordrambor sobre Narchuil","Calenglad se encuentra en el campamento de los Montaraces en la isla de Tinnudir, en Evendim.\
\
Calenglad ha decidido que, si lo enfrentáis juntos, tal vez podáis aprender del poder o la historia de Narchuil al interrogar a Mordrambor, y esta información podría ayudaros a recuperarlo antes que Amarthiel.","Libro 11, Capítulo 2: Mordrambor","Calenglad se encuentra en el campamento de los Montaraces en la isla de Tinnudir, en Evendim.\
\
Mordrambor ha escapado del torreón de Tinnudir. Muchos Montaraces murieron durante su huida, y ahora Calenglad intenta mantener unidos a los Dúnedain pese a estas pérdidas."}},
[1922]={nameES="Libro 11, Capítulo 3: Túmulos para los Caídos",objectivesES={"Calenglad se encuentra en el campamento de los Montaraces en la isla de Tinnudir, en Evendim.\
\
Has reunido piedras de Annúminas para usarlas en la construcción de túmulos para los Montaraces muertos durante la fuga de Mordrambor y deberías regresar ahora con Calenglad.","Lleva las piedras de Annúminas a Calenglad","Se pueden encontrar piedras de los edificios de Annúminas por toda la gran ciudad, y serían ideales para construir túmulos en memoria de los Montaraces caídos.\
\
Calenglad te ha pedido reunir piedras por las calles de la Ciudad de los Reyes para construir túmulos en honor de Tadan, Colhamnir y Carchammadel.","Libro 11, Capítulo 3: Túmulos para los Caídos","Calenglad teme por la determinación de los Dúnedain y los ha enviado a reunir piedras con las que construir túmulos para sus hermanos caídos."}},
[1923]={nameES="Book 11, Chapter 3: Théoden, Son of Thengel",objectivesES={"Book 11, Chapter 3: Théoden, Son of Thengel","Talk to Gandalf within Meduseld","Háma has grudgingly decided to allow you in to see the King, and will bring you inside the Golden Hall if you speak to him once more.","You have reunited with Gandalf within the Golden Hall of Meduseld, and should now speak to the Wizard.","It is a day for unwelcome visitors to the Golden Hall, according to Háma, the doorward of Théoden.","Talk to Háma and he will bring you before the King"}},
[1924]={nameES="Libro 11, Capítulo 4: Recuerdo",objectivesES={"Habla con Calenglad y viaja con él a Barad Rath","Libro 11, Capítulo 4: Recuerdo","Los Dúnedain de Tinnudir se han reunido para construir túmulos sobre los cuerpos de sus hermanos caídos, y Calenglad te ha pedido que participes también.","Calenglad está en el campamento de Montaraces de la isla de Tinnudir, en Evendim.\
\
El homenaje a los Dúnedain caídos fue interrumpido por la llegada de un cuervo enviado por Torogethir: las tropas de Amarthiel han iniciado la búsqueda de Narchuil.","Habla con Calenglad"}},
[1925]={nameES="Book 11, Chapter 4: Tidings Glad and Sorrowful",objectivesES={"Talk to Gimli in Meduseld","Théoden is more willing to listen to you, now that Gandalf has spoken words of truth to the King of Rohan.","Legolas smiles at you, but he is deep in thought and has nothing to say.","Talk to Théoden in Meduseld","Aragorn, Legolas, and Gimli wait to speak with you within the Golden Hall of Meduseld.","Talk to Háma outside Meduseld","After being apart for so long, you have reunited once again with Gandalf, Aragorn, Legolas, and Gimli, and eagerly press them for news about what befell them since last you saw them.","Talk to Aragorn in Meduseld","Book 11, Chapter 4: Tidings Glad and Sorrowful","Théoden has asked you to bring his commands to Háma, outside the Golden Hall.","Talk to Legolas in Meduseld"}},
[1926]={nameES="Book 11, Chapter 5: Chamber of the Worm",objectivesES={"You found a number of stolen items in Gríma Wormtongue's chambers, and should now present them to the King.","Háma has guided you to the chambers where Gríma Wormtongue kept his bed in Edoras, so you may carry out the King's desire that the room be searched for further tendrils of Wormtongue's treachery.","Háma should be told what you discovered in Wormtongue's chambers.","How many secrets remain to be discovered within Wormtongue's chambers?","These drawers contain linens and fine clothes, rumpled now and in disarray.","Find the entrance to Gríma Wormtongue's chambers in Edoras","Beneath the chair you find a golden key","Carved into the table is the crude representation of a crying eye","Gríma Wormtongue's former chambers can be found north-east of the bottom of the Meduseld steps, in Edoras.","Unlock the chest in Gríma's chambers","Gríma's chambers can be found north-east of the bottom of the Meduseld steps, in Edoras.\
\
How many secrets remain to be discovered within Wormtongue's chambers?","You found a number of stolen items in Gríma Wormtongue's chambers, and should confront him with them.","Inside the chest you find items too varied to belong to Gríma, including a valuable sword","Book 11, Chapter 5: Chamber of the Worm","This chest is tightly locked, and you possess no key for it.","This cabinet stands empty. Did someone get here before you?","You have found the entrance to Wormtongue's chambers. Do further treacheries await within?","A crude map lies on this table, but you cannot discern what it represents.","Present to Háma the stolen items you recovered in Gríma's chambers","Search Gríma's chambers for further sign of his treachery","Show the stolen items you recovered to Gríma in Meduseld","These books detail the geography and history of Rohan, but contain nothing of note right now.","A marked page in one of these books reads 'No Mere Wit, He.'","Show the stolen items to Théoden, in Meduseld"}},
[1927]={nameES="Libro 11, Capítulo 5: Viaje hacia el Este",objectivesES={"Encuentra la Cima de los Vientos","Al mirar hacia el este desde la Cima de los Vientos, viste una compañía de Angmarim cruzando el Último Puente hacia el Bosque de los Trolls.\
\
Has seguido a una compañía de Angmarim hacia el este, pero llegaron al Último Puente antes que tú. Debes viajar hasta el Último Puente y hablar con el explorador apostado allí para conocer noticias sobre los Angmarim.","Encuentra la cima de Amon Raith","Echad Candelleth está en Tâl Bruinen, al sur del Vado del Bruinen. Alphlanc te ha dicho que busques el sendero hacia el sur siguiendo la orilla del Bruinen y que avances por él hasta encontrar a uno de los exploradores de Candelleth, quien podrá guiarte al campamento.\
\
Alphlanc te informó que la compañía de Angmarim se internó en Tâl Bruinen y desea que viajes al campamento de su hermana Candelleth para advertirle del peligro que representan los Angmarim.","Libro 11, Capítulo 5: Viaje hacia el Este","<rgb=#FF0000>Mira</rgb> hacia el este desde la cima de Amon Raith","<rgb=#FF0000>Mira</rgb> hacia el este desde la Cima de los Vientos","Amon Raith es una colina elevada en las Quebradas del Norte, al sureste de los Campos de Fornost y al noreste de Puente de Caballetes.\
\
Calenglad te ha pedido que asciendas a la cima de Amon Raith y que <rgb=#FF0000>Mires</rgb> hacia el este desde las alturas.","Amon Sûl, la gran colina llamada Cima de los Vientos, se encuentra en las Tierras Solitarias.\
\
Calenglad te ha pedido que asciendas a la Cima de los Vientos y que <rgb=#FF0000>Mires</rgb> hacia el este desde las alturas.","Se ha visto a compañías de Angmarim abandonar Evendim y dirigirse hacia el este, en camino al Bosque de los Trolls en busca de Narchuil.","Muy al este, una compañía de Angmarim cruza el Último Puente","Muy al este, una nube de polvo marca el paso de los Angmarim"}},
[1928]={nameES="Libro 11, Capítulo 6: Una Tierra Sombría",objectivesES={"Candelleth está en Echad Candelleth, en Tâl Bruinen.\
\
Has derrotado a varios de los Angmarim que buscaban entre las ruinas, y ahora deberías regresar con Candelleth para ver si tiene información sobre dónde podría haberse ocultado Narchuil.","Le has contado a Candelleth por qué los Angmarim han venido a Tâl Bruinen, y ahora ella medita sobre los posibles lugares donde podría estar escondida Narchuil.","Libro 11, Capítulo 6: Una Tierra Sombría","Pequeñas ruinas pueden encontrarse dispersas por las colinas y valles boscosos de Tâl Bruinen.\
\
Candelleth te dijo que los Angmarim parecen tener un gran interés en las diversas ruinas de Tâl Bruinen. Mientras te enfrentas a varios de estos grupos de búsqueda, ella pensará en los lugares donde Narchuil podría haber sido escondida."}},
[1929]={nameES="Book 11, Chapter 6: The Cage",objectivesES={"Find the entrance to Éomer's chambers","You have found the entrance to Éomer's chambers, where until today he has been imprisoned by command of the King","You study the map of Rohan for a time, but few strategies present themselves to you that could stand against the armies of Saruman.","Théoden has been restored and now it is time to repair some of the other wrongs worked by Gríma Wormtongue in Edoras.","Gandalf is in the Golden Hall of Meduseld, and he will likely have some advice for you.","Talk to Éomer in his chambers","Bring Éowyn's favour to her brother Éomer","Éowyn accepts the embroidered cloth from you with surprise.\
\
'I remember this token! I gave it to my brother Éomer to bring him good fortune in battle, and he wore it on his ranging throughout the Mark! It must have been taken from him when he was confined to his chambers by my uncle's command! No. The command was my lord Théoden's, but the words were Gríma's, and my brother's confinement was carried out by those men Gríma selected. One of them must have taken this token from Éomer and given it to Gríma. Had I known this, I would not have allowed it!\
\
'Bring this token of mine to my brother, and tell him our uncle is restored! He is being confined to his chambers in Edoras, north of Meduseld.'","Éowyn is in the Golden Hall of Meduseld.\
\
Éomer has asked you to return to his sister, and to thank her for her sympathy and her worry.","Even imprisoned, Éomer has continued to plan for the defence of Rohan. He has asked you to study the map in his chambers so you may better understand the geography of the Kingdom.","Éowyn has asked you to return her favour to her brother Éomer, currently imprisoned at his chambers, north of Meduseld, in Edoras.","Return Éowyn's favour to her in Meduseld","Talk to Gandalf in Meduseld","Talk to Éowyn in Meduseld","Book 11, Chapter 6: The Cage","Study the map in Éomer's chambers","When you have fully studied the map in Éomer's chambers, you should return to him to learn what he thinks of the strategic situation in Rohan.","Éowyn is within the Golden Hall of Meduseld.\
\
Théoden has removed an embroidered handkerchief from the collection of stolen goods you recovered from Wormtongue's chambers, and wants you to return it to its original owner: his niece Éowyn."}},
[1930]={nameES="Libro 11, Capítulo 7: Un Aire Desagradable",objectivesES={"Investiga Eryn Singor con Lavanthir","Muildir está junto al estrecho desfiladero rocoso que conduce a Delossad, al sureste de Echad Candelleth. Lavanthir está frente a la entrada de Eryn Singor, hogar de los trolls silvanos en el noroeste de Tâl Bruinen.\
\
Candelleth te ha hablado de dos lugares en Tâl Bruinen que poseen un aire inquietante: unas ruinas élficas llamadas Delossad y Eryn Singor, guarida de los trolls silvanos. Dos de sus exploradores, Muildir y Lavanthir, están investigando estos lugares, y Candelleth te ha pedido que consultes con ellos para obtener orientación.","Candelleth ha señalado varios lugares dentro de los bosques de Tâl Bruinen donde podría estar escondido el anillo Narchuil.","Candelleth está en Echad Candelleth, en Tâl Bruinen.\
\
Has investigado tanto Eryn Singor como Delossad, pero no has encontrado señal alguna de Narchuil. Candelleth espera noticias de tu progreso.","Libro 11, Capítulo 7: Un Aire Desagradable","Investiga Delossad con Muildir"}},
[1931]={nameES="Book 11, Chapter 7: Commands of the King",objectivesES={"Talk to Théoden and see if he is willing to step outside his hall","Théoden is in the Golden Hall of Meduseld.\
\
Gandalf has asked the King to step outside the Golden Hall and look upon the city. You should speak now to Théoden and see if he is willing to do as the Wizard entreats.","Talk to Éowyn in Edoras, outside Meduseld","Book 11, Chapter 7: Commands of the King","Talk to Théoden in Meduseld","Aragorn, Éomer, and Gandalf are within the Golden Hall of Meduseld.\
\
Théoden King has determined his next course of action, and those who follow him have their orders.","Talk to Gandalf in Meduseld","Gandalf wishes for the King to step outside his hall and look upon the city, and to decide what can be done for the survival of Rohan.","Talk to Aragorn in Meduseld","Éowyn is outside the Golden Hall of Meduseld, in Edoras.","Théoden is in the Golden Hall of Meduseld, waiting to speak with you about his next course of action: war!","Talk to Éomer in Meduseld"}},
[1932]={nameES="Libro 11, Capítulo 7: Secretos de Eryn Singor",objectivesES={"Encuentra la cámara suroeste en Bar-e-Therchir","Esta cámara del suroeste no revela señal alguna de la presencia de Narchuil","Encuentra la cámara norte en Bar-e-Therchir","Lavanthir ha vigilado a los trolls silvanos que viven en Eryn Singor durante varias semanas y ha notado que los Angmarim hacen lo mismo.","Esta cámara del norte no revela señal alguna de la presencia de Narchuil","Encuentra la entrada a Bar-e-Therchir","Has encontrado la entrada a Bar-e-Therchir; ¿se halla Narchuil en su interior?","Los Dâg Taushakhu viven en las cámaras más profundas de Bar-e-Therchir, situada bajo Eryn Singor, hogar de los trolls silvanos en la esquina noroeste de Tâl Bruinen.\
\
Lavanthir te ha pedido que explores las cámaras más profundas de Bar-e-Therchir para ver si Narchuil está oculto allí y que derrotes a los Dâg Taushakhu.","Lavanthir está en el exterior de Eryn Singor, hogar de los trolls silvanos en Tâl Bruinen.\
\
Has derrotado a los Dâg Taushakhu en las profundidades de Bar-e-Therchir, pero no hallaste señal alguna de Narchuil.","La entrada a Bar-e-Therchir está en algún lugar dentro de Eryn Singor, hogar de los trolls silvanos en la región noroeste de Tâl Bruinen.\
\
Lavanthir cree que el aire desagradable que pesa sobre Eryn Singor emana de la caverna de Bar-e-Therchir y quiere que halles la entrada, derrotando trolls silvanos en el camino, y luego regreses con él.","Libro 11, Capítulo 7: Secretos de Eryn Singor"}},
[1933]={nameES="Libro 11, Capítulo 7: La Puerta de Delossad",objectivesES={"La puerta parece segura; los Angmarim no han logrado forzarla.","Muildir mantiene la guardia frente a las ruinas de Delossad, al sureste de Echad Candelleth.\
\
Has comprobado que la puerta que conduce al interior de Delossad aún está asegurada. Los Angmarim no han logrado abrirla. Debes regresar ahora con Muildir para informarle.","Encuentra la puerta cerrada en lo profundo de las ruinas de Delossad","Muildir ha vigilado las ruinas de Delossad y ha notado un gran interés de los Angmarim en el sitio derrumbado.","La puerta que conduce a las profundidades de Delossad está en la parte trasera de las ruinas al sureste de Echad Candelleth.\
\
Los Angmarim han estado registrando Tâl Bruinen buscando pistas sobre la ubicación de Narchuil. Muildir te ha pedido que verifiques que la puerta hacia las profundidades de Delossad aún esté segura.","Libro 11, Capítulo 7: La Puerta de Delossad"}},
[1934]={nameES="Book 11, Chapter 8: People of Edoras",objectivesES={"Convince Herith to obey the word of Théoden","By these stairs is a good place to read the proclamation","You read the proclamation aloud, and an old woman seeks to catch your eye","Éowyn has given you a proclamation to read at the two stairs south of the north-west entrance, to prepare the people of Edoras to leave the city.","Éowyn has given you a proclamation to read at the top of the stairs, north-west of Meduseld, to prepare the people of Edoras to leave the city.","Return the proclamation to Éowyn outside Meduseld","Baduhild reluctantly agrees to leave the city","Talk to a growling dissenter","Ethryth's belongings are at the top of the stairs north-west of Meduseld. The waggon to Dunharrow is near the outside walls to the north of Ethryth.","Éowyn has given you a proclamation to read by the entrance courtyard in the north-west, to prepare the people of Edoras to leave the city.","Éowyn is outside Meduseld, in Edoras.\
\
You have helped prepare the people of Edoras prepare to leave their city, and should return to Éowyn with a report of your success.","A small child, Derláf, has sought to get your attention.","Talk to Ethryth atop the stairs north-west of Meduseld","This market is a good place to read the proclamation","You read the proclamation aloud, and several people nearby begin to mutter darkly","Several of the people at the courtyard with two stairs need to be convinced of the wisdom of Éowyn's plan.","Ethryth is atop the steps north-west of Meduseld, and has sought to catch your eye.","You read the proclamation aloud, and several people nearby begin to grumble","Convince Colinan to obey the word of Théoden","After a brief discussion, Colinan agrees to leave Edoras","You leave Ethryth's belongings on the waggon, as she asked","You have failed to cow the growling dissenter","Read the proclamation aloud at the market north of Meduseld","Book 11, Chapter 8: People of Edoras","Read the proclamation aloud at the entrance courtyard in the north-west of the city","Éowyn has a great number of things to do before the people of Edoras can be evacuated to Dunharrow, and she needs your help to see them done.","Read the proclamation aloud at the stairs north-west of Meduseld","Pick up Ethryth's belongings","Growling dissenters insulted the King at the courtyard near the north-west entrance to Edoras.","This entrance courtyard is a good place to read the proclamation","You successfully cowed the growling dissenter!","Convince Anwynd to obey the word of Théoden","Read the proclamation aloud at the courtyard with two stairs, south of the north-west entrance to the city","Several of the people at the market north of Meduseld need to be convinced of the wisdom of Éowyn's plan.","Talk to Derláf at the entrance courtyard in the north-west of Edoras","Herith listens to your words and eventually agrees to obey the King","You read the proclamation aloud, and a small child seeks to catch your eye","Éowyn has given you a proclamation to read at the market north of Meduseld, to prepare the people of Edoras to leave the city.","Convince Baduhild to obey the word of Théoden","Anwynd grumbles, but reluctantly agrees to leave Edoras"}},
[1935]={nameES="Libro 11, Capítulo 8: La Cabaña Calcinada",objectivesES={"Candelleth está en el campamento élfico de Echad Candelleth, al suroeste de la Cabaña Calcinada, en Tâl Bruinen.\
\
Has descubierto el diario de Sara Roblecorazón en las ruinas de una cabaña quemada en Tâl Bruinen y debes mostrárselo a Candelleth de inmediato.","Revisas algunos de los escombros, pero no encuentras nada","Candelleth te contó que Idhreneth informó haber alejado a una pequeña compañía de Angmarim de los restos quemados de una cabaña.","Libro 11, Capítulo 8: La Cabaña Calcinada","La Cabaña Calcinada está al noreste de Echad Candelleth.\
\
Idhreneth derrotó a una pequeña compañía de Angmarim que registraba los escombros de la Cabaña Calcinada, y te ha pedido buscar en las ruinas para descubrir qué estaban buscando.","Idhreneth está cerca de la Cabaña Calcinada, no muy lejos al noreste de Echad Candelleth.\
\
Candelleth te ha pedido que hables con una de sus exploradoras, quien derrotó a varios Angmarim junto a la Cabaña Calcinada.","Encuentras un diario podrido entre los escombros, pero aún parece legible","Registra los escombros de la Cabaña Calcinada","Lleva el diario podrido a Idhreneth","Idhreneth está al otro lado del agua desde la Cabaña Calcinada, al noreste de Echad Candelleth.\
\
Has encontrado un diario podrido entre los escombros de la Cabaña Calcinada, pero aún parece legible. Deberías leerlo y mostrárselo a Idhreneth."}},
[1936]={nameES="Book 11, Chapter 9: Seeds of Treachery",objectivesES={"Talk to Éowyn outside Meduseld","These weapons are out of place. Why were they moved here?","Book 11, Chapter 9: Seeds of Treachery","This strongbox is scorched, as if it was set on fire, but the blaze did not spread.","Hebeca was an ally of Wormtongue. But are there others?","Léofing was an ally of Wormtongue. But are there others?","Éowyn has given you some writings from the search of Gríma's chambers, and wants you to find out where in the city these clues might refer.","Éowyn has uncovered some evidence that allies of Gríma Wormtongue seek to undermine her efforts to bring the people of Edoras to safety.","Éowyn is outside Meduseld, in Edoras.\
\
You discovered several allies of Wormtongue working to hinder Éowyn's efforts in Edoras, and should report back to her that they will no longer be a problem.","Did someone put this pile of timber here with plans to set it ablaze?"}},
[1937]={nameES="Libro 11, Capítulo 9: El Diario de Sara Roblecorazón",objectivesES={"Encuentras una caja de llaves rotas enterrada bajo el arbusto frondoso","Candelleth está en su campamento en Tâl Bruinen.\
\
Has recuperado una caja de llaves rotas bajo un arbusto en las ruinas de Delossad, conocido antaño como Sithad. Debes llevar la caja a Candelleth.","Lleva la caja de llaves rotas a Merilos","Has recuperado el diario de Sara Roblecorazón, y podría contener el secreto del paradero de Narchuil.","Revisas bajo el arbusto, pero no encuentras nada","Lleva la caja de llaves rotas a Candelleth","Delossad se encuentra al sureste de Echad Candelleth, en Tâl Bruinen.\
\
Candelleth está convencida de haber resuelto el acertijo del diario de Sara Roblecorazón: cree que el lugar llamado Sithad es un antiguo nombre de Delossad, las ruinas al sureste de Echad Candelleth.","La joyera Merilos se encuentra en la Aguja del Encuentro, en Rivendel.\
\
Has encontrado una caja de llaves rotas que Sara Roblecorazón enterró en Delossad en tiempos pasados. Candelleth te ha pedido que se las lleves a Merilos para que pueda rehacerlas.","Busca las llaves mencionadas en el diario de Sara Roblecorazón","Libro 11, Capítulo 9: El Diario de Sara Roblecorazón"}},
[1938]={nameES="Libro 12, Capítulo 10: Medias Verdades",objectivesES={"Habla con Elrond en Rivendel","Libro 12, Capítulo 10: Medias Verdades","Elrond se encuentra en Rivendel, en el Bosque de los Trolls.\
\
Debes hablar con Elrond de inmediato.","Habla con Elrond en su biblioteca","Descubriste en Barad Dúrgul que Narchuil había sido parcialmente deshecho y que ahora yace en dos fragmentos, de los cuales solo uno se encontraba en Barad Dúrgul.","Elrond se encuentra en Rivendel, en el Bosque de los Trolls.\
\
Gwathryn te pidió que llevaras a Elrond la mitad de Narchuil que recuperaste.","Habla con Elrond para asistir a su Consejo"}},
[1939]={nameES="Book 12, Chapter 10: Rumours of Battle",objectivesES={"Travel to Helm's Dike, the entrance to the Deep, in the Westfold","Talk to Nona by Brockbridge","Travel to the entrance of Brockbridge, in the Stonedeans","Talk to Horn by Brockbridge","You have come to Helm's Dike, at the mouth of the Deep","Helm's Deep is in the southern reaches of the Westfold.\
\
You and Corudan have decided to travel to Helm's Deep in search of the King, while Horn and Nona seek out the Falcon Clan raiding party.","Talk to Herefara in Brockbridge","Thane Léoferth is in the Mead Hall of Brockbridge.\
\
Herefara has asked that you speak with the Thane before you investigate the turmoil in the Westfold.","Herefara is by the barricades on the southern side of Brockbridge.\
\
You have arrived at Brockbridge and should now speak with Herefara.","The town of Brockbridge is located to the south of Woodhurst.\
\
Herubrand has asked you to speak with his son Herefara in Brockbridge.","Corudan is by the southern side of the span, in Brockbridge.","Book 12, Chapter 10: Rumours of Battle","Talk to Corudan by Brockbridge","Talk to Gamling at Helm's Dike","Horn and Nona are on the southern side of the span, by Brockbridge, in the Stonedeans.","Herubrand has asked you to travel to the town of Brockbridge to help his son Herefara against the Dunlending invaders.","Gamling is at Helm's Dike, at the mouth of the Deep.","You have arrived at Brockbridge and should now find Herefara","Talk to Thane Léoferth in the Mead Hall of Brockbridge","Léoferth is very weak, and cannot speak above a whisper.\
\
'You... come from... Edoras? What... news?'\
\
You tell the Thane that the King has ridden to Isengard to wage war against Saruman's forces, and Léoferth's face slowly forms a rictus grin.\
\
'Good... good! That is... the strength... the strength I remember. My son... Háma... surely rides with... with the King. He is his most... most loyal...'\
\
Léoferth's voice fades into nothing and his eyes seem far away. You nearly turn away when his eyes close, but then he speaks once more.\
\
'Help the... help the King. The Riddermark... must not... must not fall. The Eorlingas... will... will...'\
\
You respectfully wait for more, but the Thane is lost in his own thoughts, and no longer sees you."}},
[1940]={nameES="Libro 12, Capítulo 1: El Encargo de Elrond",objectivesES={"Has regresado de los parajes salvajes de Tâl Bruinen con noticias que preocupan a Elrond de Rivendel.","Calenglad está en Tinnudir, junto a la orilla oriental del lago Nenuial, en Evendim.\
\
Elrond te ha pedido que regreses con Calenglad y comiences la búsqueda del señor elfo Laerdan.","Libro 12, Capítulo 1: El Encargo de Elrond"}},
[1941]={nameES="Book 12, Chapter 1: Message for Harrowdale",objectivesES={"Ordwald, the blacksmith of Underharrow, has a shop to the south of the Mead Hall.\
\
Ellen Fremedon has asked you to carry a heavy barrel of spears from Ordwald's shop back to her.","The town of Entwade is to the north-east of Edoras.","Éowyn has asked you to bring word to Ellen Fremedon of Harrowdale that the people of Edoras will soon be seeking shelter in her lands.","Talk to Horn at the entrance to Underharrow","Book 12, Chapter 1: Message for Harrowdale","Pick up a barrel of armour from outside Ordwald's shop","You set down the barrel of swords beside some others","You set down the barrel of spears beside some others","Horn is at the entrance to Underharrow, in Harrowdale.\
\
Horn has come with you to Underharrow, and he wishes to speak with you by the entrance to that city.","Ordwald, the blacksmith of Underharrow, has a shop to the south of the Mead Hall.\
\
Ellen Fremedon has asked you to carry a heavy barrel of armour from Ordwald's shop back to her.","Travel to the town of Entwade, in Kingstead, and help its people with their troubles","Ellen Fremedon is in Underharrow, in Harrowdale.","After you have helped the people of Entwade, travel to the entrance of Underharrow","Pick up a barrel of spears from outside Ordwald's shop","Ordwald, the blacksmith of Underharrow, has a shop to the south of the Mead Hall.\
\
Ellen Fremedon has asked you to carry a heavy barrel of swords from Ordwald's shop back to her.","Ellen Fremedon is outside the Mead Hall in Underharrow.","Pick up a barrel of swords from outside Ordwald's shop","Talk to Ellen Fremedon","The town of Underharrow is in Kingstead, to the south of Edoras.\
\
Éowyn has asked you to bring the news to Ellen Fremedon in Harrowdale that the people of Edoras will soon be sheltering on her lands.","The people of Entwade have many concerns with which you can help","You set down the barrel of armour beside some others","You have arrived at Underharrow"}},
[1942]={nameES="Book 12, Chapter 2: Too Near to Dunharrow",objectivesES={"Habla con Horn en la Puerta Oscura, en El Sagrario","Horn is at the entrance to Underharrow, in Kingstead.\
\
You have impressed Ellen Fremedon with your selfless actions on her behalf, and should let Horn know of the experience.","Talk to Horn by the entrance to Underharrow","Talk to Horn at the entrance to Underharrow","Book 12, Chapter 2: Too Near to Dunharrow","Horn is by the entrance to Underharrow.\
\
Ellen Fremedon has made her displeasure clear to you, and has nothing else to say.","Ellen Fremedon is outside the Mead Hall of Underharrow, in Kingstead.\
\
You have collected Orc sigils and Warg teeth and should bring them to Ellen Fremedon to show her that she does not fight alone to defend her people.","Ellen Fremedon is displeased at the large numbers of people who now seek shelter in her lands, and worries about the dangers that lurk in Harrowdale.","Horn listens with amusement as you recount Ellen Fremedon's grateful acknowledgement of the help you provided to her people.\
\
'Are you surprised by the Lady of Harrowdale's transformation? You should not be. There is no more certain way to attain the friendship of a ruler than by helping ease the problems of the ruled. We are, all of us, on the same side now. Only Saruman gains to profit if we squabble among ourselves.\
\
'We have delivered the message, and we have somewhat eased its sting. It is time to move on to the next stage of our duty.'","Bring the Orc sigils and the Warg teeth to Ellen Fremedon","Orcs and Wargs can be found throughout Harrowdale.\
\
Horn wants you to collect Orc sigils and Warg teeth from the invaders throughout Harrowdale."}},
[1943]={nameES="Libro 12, Capítulo 2: Un Destino Indigno",objectivesES={"Según Calenglad, no todo está bien en Annúminas. Los Angmarim actúan con febril actividad dentro de la ciudad en ruinas, y una gran fuerza también ha regresado a Angmar.","Has recogido las Órdenes de Amarthiel","Registra a los Angmarim derrotados en Annúminas","Puedes encontrar Angmarim por toda Annúminas.\
\
Calenglad cree que podrías hallar información sobre el paradero de Laerdan entre los Angmarim.","Calenglad está en Tinnudir, al norte de Annúminas.\
\
Debes regresar con él y entregarle las Órdenes de Amarthiel.","Libro 12, Capítulo 2: Un Destino Indigno","Lleva las Órdenes de Amarthiel a Calenglad"}},
[1944]={nameES="Libro 12, Capítulo 3: Barad Tironn",objectivesES={"Puede que Laerdan aún se encuentre en Barad Tironn, en Annúminas.\
\
Calenglad te ha indicado acompañar a Forchon a Barad Tironn para continuar la búsqueda de Laerdan.\
\
Forchon se encuentra en Tinnudir, sobre la orilla occidental del lago Nenuial, en Evendim.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Esta misión está diseñada para una comunidad. Si decides emprenderla en solitario, recibirás una bonificación de inspiración, pero el desafío será grande.</rgb>","Calenglad está en Tinnudir, sobre la orilla occidental del lago Nenuial, en Evendim.\
\
Deberías hablar con Calenglad y contarle tus acciones en Barad Tironn.","Las órdenes que recuperaste de los Angmarim contienen pistas sobre el paradero del Señor Elfo Laerdan.","Libro 12, Capítulo 3: Barad Tironn","Habla con Forchon y entra a Barad Tironn"}},
[1945]={nameES="Book 12, Chapter 3: In Éomer's Absence",objectivesES={"The building is in poor repair, and seems near to falling down","This building is in very poor repair","Talk to Arcil in the Mead Hall of Aldburg","The craftsmen sent by Arcil are camping outside the walls of Aldburg, to the south-east.\
\
Arcil is unable to get the people to listen to him, so it comes to you to remind the craftsmen of their obligations.","The craftsmen sent by Arcil to repair the walls of Aldburg have a camp outside the city, south-east of the walls.\
\
Arcil told you that if you think you can get the craftsmen to work, you are welcome to try.","Arcil is inside the Mead Hall of Aldburg.\
\
You have gotten the workers outside Aldburg to begin working again, and should report of your success to Arcil.","You have come to Aldburg, the home of Éomer","Book 12, Chapter 3: In Éomer's Absence","Look at the buildings by the Mead Hall in Aldburg","Look at the buildings in the south-west corner of Aldburg","Arcil is in the Mead Hall of Aldburg.\
\
You have learned that Aldburg has fallen into disrepair, and Arcil has had difficulty maintaining its rule in the absence of Éomer.","Talk to a loutish worker","Talk to Arcil inside the Mead Hall in Aldburg","Talk to Tirweld in Aldburg","The loutish worker yields, and pledges to begin working","Horn is by the entrance to Aldburg, in the Eastfold.\
\
You have come to Aldburg with Horn, to see if Éomer's worries about his home are well-placed.","Find the camp of craftsmen Arcil sent to repair the Aldburg city walls","You have found the craftsmen sent by Arcil, but they are busy feasting and drinking","The boorish worker yields, and pledges to begin working","Talk to Horn at the entrance to Aldburg","Éomer has asked you to see how his home of Aldburg is being maintained in his absence.","Talk to a boorish worker","Horn wants you to explore the city of Aldburg so you can see if his first impression of its poor state was wrong.","Talk to Páda in the south-west corner of Aldburg","Travel to the entrance of Aldburg, in the Eastfold","Horn will meet you at the entrance to Aldburg, in the Eastfold.\
\
You have agreed to journey to Aldburg to see how his home fares while Éomer rides with the King."}},
[1946]={nameES="Libro 12, Capítulo 4: En persecución del Enemigo",objectivesES={"Calenglad ha enviado por delante a Gwathryn, uno de los hombres más hábiles de su compañía, a Tármunn Súrsa para espiar los movimientos del Enemigo.","Gwathryn está en Tármunn Súrsa, al este de Carn Dûm, en Angmar.\
\
Calenglad te ha enviado a hablar con Gwathryn, uno de sus exploradores en Angmar.","Libro 12, Capítulo 4: En persecución del Enemigo"}},
[1947]={nameES="Book 12, Chapter 4: The Missing",objectivesES={"Nona, Horn, and Corudan are in the town of Aldburg, in the Eastfold, and wish to speak with you.","Impressed with your success motivating the workers in Aldburg, Arcil wants you to find another group that has gone missing.","Talk to Arcil in the Mead Hall of Aldburg","The waggon is abandoned and there are signs of struggle. Tracks lead south","Talk to Corudan in Aldburg","Talk to Nona in Aldburg","Find the waggon of craftsmen in the Everholt","A number of craftsmen took a waggon from Aldburg into the Everholt to collect timber.\
\
Arcil has asked you to search the Everholt for the waggon of craftsmen, and to convince them to do the work they are supposed to do.","Follow the tracks south to the cave and complete 'Instance: The Missing'","Tracks lead south from the abandoned waggon in the Everholt to a cave entrance.","Book 12, Chapter 4: The Missing","Arcil is in the Mead Hall of Aldburg, in the Eastfold.\
\
Horn has asked you to report of your success in the Everholt to Arcil in the Mead Hall.","Talk to Horn in Aldburg"}},
[1948]={nameES="Book 12, Chapter 5: Eyes of Edoras",objectivesES={"Horn is by the barrows outside Edoras, in Kingstead.\
\
Horn has asked you to tell him when you are ready to walk through the streets of Edoras with him and your companions.","Book 12, Chapter 5: Eyes of Edoras","You have made good on your promise to Éomer and have provided for the continued maintenance of Aldburg. Now you should see how Éowyn's work has progressed.","Talk to Éowyn outside Meduseld, in Edoras","Talk to Horn by the barrows outside Edoras, in Kingstead","Talk to Horn by the barrows outside Edoras, and walk with him through the streets","Horn will speak to you again by the barrows outside Edoras, as he did once before.","Éowyn is outside Meduseld, in Edoras.\
\
You have learned that an ally of Wormtongue's attempted to sabotage the evacuation efforts, but may have fled the city."}},
[1949]={nameES="Libro 12, Capítulo 5: Guardianes extraños",objectivesES={"Gwathryn cree que Laerdan fue llevado a Sammath Baul, que actualmente está custodiado por los brutales Tarkrîp.","Sammath Baul se encuentra en Carn Dûm, al oeste de Tármunn Súrsa.\
\
Gwathryn te ha ordenado reducir la horda Tarkrîp y obtener la llave de Sammath Baul de Lozudurkh.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>La Piedra Élfica centelleante podrá usarse en un objetivo próximo de esta misión para acceder a la bonificación de inspiración si juegas en solitario o en una comunidad pequeña.</rgb>","Usa la Piedra Élfica para obtener inspiración","Este es un buen lugar para invocar el poder de la Piedra Élfica","Regresa con Gwathryn con la llave de la puerta de Sammath Baul","Recupera la llave de la puerta de Sammath Baul","Gwathryn está en Tármunn Súrsa, al este de Sammath Baul.\
\
Debes regresar con Gwathryn con la llave de la puerta de Sammath Baul.","Libro 12, Capítulo 5: Guardianes extraños","Lozudurkh reside en el cuerpo de guardia de la puerta de Sammath Baul. El cuerpo de guardia está a la izquierda de la puerta de Sammath Baul y tiene dos antorchas frente a él.\
\
Aún debes derrotar a Lozudurkh y obtener la llave de Sammath Baul.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Usar la Piedra Élfica te permite acceder a la bonificación de inspiración cuando juegas en solitario o en una pequeña comunidad.</rgb>","Llave de la puerta de Sammath Baul recuperada"}},
[1950]={nameES="Libro 12, Capítulo 6: La huida de Laerdan",objectivesES={"Has obtenido la llave de la puerta de Sammath Baul, y Gwathryn está preparado para liderar un asalto contra la terrible prisión.","Elrond está en Rivendel, en el Bosque de los Trolls.\
\
Debes viajar hacia el sur y hablar con Elrond.","Libro 12, Capítulo 6: La huida de Laerdan","Habla con Gwathryn y entra en Sammath Baul"}},
[1951]={nameES="Book 12, Chapter 6: Through the Net",objectivesES={"Talk to Reeve Fríthild in the Mead Hall of Stoke","The town of Stoke is located north of Edoras, in the Broadacres.\
\
You have given Éowyn your word that you will travel to Stoke to find the ally of Wormtongue that fled the city. He wears a blood-red brooch, but otherwise his appearance remains unknown to you.","Someone seems to have carelessly run through this nest, ripping it in twain","Reeve Fríthild is in the Mead Hall of Stoke, in the Broadacres.\
\
You have learned that a suspicious man left the town, heading west, and may have joined with the Orcs. You should report what the child Adgyth saw to the Reeve.","You find booted footprints in the mud at the base of this fence","These leaves have been scattered, but it might only have been the wind","Corudan has called a halt just outside the entrance to the town of Stoke.\
\
You should speak to Corudan and ask him what he has found.","Talk to Adgyth on the northern reaches of Stoke","You have found a discarded helmet, but whose helmet is it?","Search either the Norcrofts or the town of Stoke for sign of Wormtongue's ally","Corudan calls a halt as you approach the entrance of the city","Reeve Fríthild is in the Mead Hall of Stoke.\
\
You have pursued Wormtongue's secret ally to Stoke, but he escaped into the city and discarded the brooch by which you would know him. Now you must warn the Reeve of the danger he poses.","Talk to Wigbald by the southern entrance to Stoke","Talk to Corudan outside the entrance of Stoke, in the Broadacres","A deadly ally of Gríma Wormtongue's seeks to escape capture, and his trail leads into the Broadacres.","Book 12, Chapter 6: Through the Net","You found a discarded helmet, and nearby a small child has sought to get your attention.","Wigbald thinks you should investigate the Norcrofts, in East Rohan, but your instincts tell you that Wormtongue's ally is still somewhere in Stoke.","Wigbald is at the southern entrance to Stoke.\
\
Reeve Fríthild has heard your warning about the mysterious foe that may have come to Stoke, and thinks you should speak with Wigbald at the southern entrance to the city. He may have seen something.","This banner is broken, as if it had been brought down upon something with great force","Travel to the entrance of Stoke, in the Broadacres","This mound of earth indicates a scuffle of some sort took place here","Lleva el broche Ojosangriento a Fríthild en el Salón del Hidromiel de Stoke"}},
[1952]={nameES="Book 12, Chapter 7: Burning Secrets",objectivesES={"You cannot tell how long it has been since Wigbald was slain, but it seems he suffered a blow to the head from some heavy object. Dirt and mud on his clothes indicate that he was killed somewhere else and then dragged into the heavy grass.\
\
As you stare down at the body of the slain guard, something that has bothered you since you heard the news from Adgyth slowly resolves itself.\
\
This is not the same Wigbald with whom you spoke when you arrived at Stoke.","Talk to Reeve Fríthild in the Mead Hall of Stoke","Talk to Adgyth in the Mead Hall of Stoke","Talk to Corudan outside the south gate of Stoke","Bring the torn map of Stoke to Reeve Fríthild in the Mead Hall","If Wigbald's body lies in the tall grass on the eastern side of Stoke, who did you speak to at the south gate who claimed to be Wigbald?","Defeat Orc and half-orc raiders from Bardh-dorám (7/8)","Corudan is outside the south gate of Stoke.","Examine the body of slain Wigbald, in the eastern part of Stoke","The man you spoke to is gone, and left no sign","Adgyth is in the Mead Hall of Stoke, with Reeve Fríthild.\
\
You have returned to Stoke to be greeted with troubling news: Adgyth stumbled upon a dead body.","Return to the south gate of Stoke and look for the man who claimed to be Wigbald","If this is Wigbald, who was it with whom you spoke at the south gate of town?","Reeve Fríthild is in the Mead Hall of Stoke.\
\
Corudan has pieced together what must have happened to Wigbald, and you should relate this information to the Reeve.","If this is the body of Wigbald, who was it you spoke with at the entrance to Stoke?","You have found a torn map of Stoke, and should return it to Reeve Fríthild in the Mead Hall.","The camp called Bardh-dorám is to the west of Stoke.\
\
Reeve Fríthild has asked you to defeat Orcs and half-orcs at the camp of Bardh-dorám, and to keep alert for sign of their plans.","You pry a torn map from the clutches of your fallen foe","The village of Stoke is threatened by Orcs from Bardh-dorám and the ally of Wormtongue that fled from Edoras.","Adgyth says she found Wigbald's body on the eastern side of the town of Stoke.","Book 12, Chapter 7: Burning Secrets"}},
[1953]={nameES="Libro 12, Capítulo 7: Nuevas de Narchuil",objectivesES={"Gwathryn está en Tármunn Súrsa, al este de Carn Dûm, en Angmar.\
\
Elrond te ha ordenado volver con Gwathryn y buscar la ubicación de Narchuil, el anillo de Amarthiel.","Libro 12, Capítulo 7: Nuevas de Narchuil","Has descubierto que el anillo Narchuil está siendo guardado en Barad Dúrgul, en Carn Dûm; debes regresar con Gwathryn e intentar recuperarlo."}},
[1954]={nameES="Libro 12, Capítulo 8: Un enemigo incansable",objectivesES={"Gwathryn está en Tármunn Súrsa, al este de Barad Dúrgul.\
\
Debes llevar las órdenes de las piedras vigilantes a Gwathryn.","Barad Dúrgul está al oeste de Tármunn Súrsa.\
\
Gwathryn te ha enviado a derrotar a los guardianes angmarim de la puerta y a aprender cuanto puedas sobre las piedras vigilantes en silencio.","Libro 12, Capítulo 8: Un enemigo incansable","Lleva las órdenes de las piedras vigilantes a Gwathryn","Elrond te ha ordenado regresar a Tármunn Súrsa y buscar el escondite del anillo de Amarthiel, Narchuil."}},
[1955]={nameES="Book 12, Chapter 8: Hill Tribes and Horse-lords",objectivesES={"Book 12, Chapter 8: Hill Tribes and Horse-lords","Nona and Horn are at the northern entrance to Woodhurst, in the Stonedeans.","You have arrived at Woodhurst, in the Stonedeans","Talk to Herubrand in the hideout on the outskirts of Woodhurst","Herubrand is in the hideout on the outskirts of Woodhurst.\
\
You have defeated many Dunlending invaders and should report of your success to Herubrand.","Talk to Briant in the hideout on the outskirts of Woodhurst","Dunlending invaders can be found throughout the Stonedeans, especially in Woodhurst.","Talk to Horn by the entrance to Woodhurst","Travel to the entrance of Woodhurst, in the Stonedeans","Woodhurst is located in the northern stretches of the Stonedeans, west of the Broadacres.","Heremond has died. His wife Briant or his son Herubrand must rule Woodhurst now in his stead.","Herubrand is in the hideout on the outskirts of Woodhurst.\
\
Briant has told you to speak with her son Herubrand about the situation in Woodhurst.","Reeve Fríthild believes that the man you pursue has gone westward, into the Stonedeans.","Talk to Nona by the entrance to Woodhurst","Briant is inside her son's hideout, in Woodhurst. You do not know where Reeve Heremond is. The hideout is on the outskirts of Woodhurst.\
\
You should find Reeve Heremond or his wife Briant in Woodhurst, and convey the message from Reeve Fríthild that Woodhurst may be in danger."}},
[1956]={nameES="Book 12, Chapter 9: The Soothsayer",objectivesES={"Horn is at the entrance to Woodhurst.\
\
Heruband has offered to bring you before the soothsayer Hildegard, but first you should see what Horn and Nona think of the prospect.","Herubrand believes that he is invincible and cannot be slain by the Dunlendings that invade the Stonedeans.","Nona is at the entrance to Woodhurst.\
\
Heruband has offered to bring you before the soothsayer Hildegard, but first you should see what Horn and Nona think of the prospect.","Book 12, Chapter 9: The Soothsayer","Horn and Nona are at the entrance to Woodhurst, in the Stonedeans.\
\
You have had a curious encounter with the soothsayer, Hildegard, and should now speak of the experience with your companions.","Talk to Horn at the entrance to Woodhurst","Talk to Horn by the entrance to Woodhurst","Talk to Herubrand and go with him to meet the soothsayer","Talk to Nona at the entrance to Woodhurst","Herubrand is in the cellar of his hideout, on the outskirts of Woodhurst.\
\
Horn and Nona have agreed to meet with the soothsayer, with varying degrees of excitement, and now you should tell Herubrand you are ready to go.","Talk to Nona by the entrance to Woodhurst","Herubrand is in the cellar of his hideout, on the outskirts of Woodhurst.\
\
You have returned from meeting the soothsayer Hildegard, and should report now to Herubrand.","Talk to Herubrand in his hideout, in Woodhurst"}},
[1957]={nameES="Libro 12, Capítulo 9: Las armas del Enemigo",objectivesES={"Libro 12, Capítulo 9: Las armas del Enemigo","Las órdenes que recuperaste de los Angmarim en Barad Dúrgul parecen confirmar que Narchuil se encuentra allí.","Habla con Gwathryn","Gwathryn está en Tármunn Súrsa, en Angmar.\
\
Debes presentar tu informe a Gwathryn de inmediato.","Gwathryn está en Tármunn Súrsa, en Angmar.\
\
Gwathryn te ha pedido entrar en Barad Dúrgul y recuperar el anillo Narchuil. Narucham te espera dentro de la fortaleza.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Esta misión está diseñada para una comunidad. Si decides emprenderla en solitario, recibirás una bonificación de inspiración, pero el desafío será grande.</rgb>","Recupera Narchuil","Mitad de Narchuil recuperada"}},
[1958]={nameES="Libro 13, Capítulo 10: Un Regreso Triunfal",objectivesES={"Libro 13, Capítulo 10: Un Regreso Triunfal","Aragorn está en una de las habitaciones de invitados de la casa de Elrond.\
\
Elrond te ha pedido que hables con Aragorn acerca de tu encuentro con la sombra de Arvedui, su antepasado.","En la cueva donde Aearil pereció, te enfrentaste a Mordrambor, y Saija reveló ser en realidad Amarthiel, usando una vez más sus poderes de engaño. Sin embargo, recuperaste un fragmento de anillo mientras Mordrambor y Amarthiel combatían.","Habla con Aragorn en Rivendel.","Elrond está en la biblioteca, en el piso superior de la Última Morada, en Rivendel, en el Bosque de los Trolls.\
\
Arvedui confirmó que el fragmento de anillo era la mitad perdida de Narchuil y te pidió que lo llevaras a Elrond en Rivendel.","Lleva el fragmento de anillo a Elrond en Rivendel"}},
[1959]={nameES="Book 13, Chapter 10: The Hornburg",objectivesES={"Day has dawned, and with it comes new hope for Rohan.\
\
Gléowine has hurried off to hear what has happened, but Thurketel is nearby and his face speaks volumes.","The long night wears on and Saruman's forces show no sign of relenting.","Gléowine is gone, but Thurketel excitedly takes the banner from you","Book 13, Chapter 10: The Hornburg","Talk to Cenric and complete 'Storied Tale: The Hornburg' <rgb=#00FF00>OR</rgb> complete 'The Hornburg' from the Epic Battles Panel","Day has dawned, and with it comes new hope for Rohan.\
\
Thurketel is by the map table west of the Hornburg.","Talk to Gléowine by the map table near the western wall of the Hornburg","Pick up the banner leaning against the western wall, and time will pass","In the hours before dawn, the forces of Saruman press their advantage.\
\
Gléowine is on the first level, west of the Hornburg.","In the hours before dawn, the forces of Saruman press their advantage.\
\
<rgb=#00FF00>There are two ways to participate in the defence of the Hornburg. You can speak to Cenric for the Storied Tale, a story-focused experience. Or you can use the Epic Battles Panel for a more gameplay-intensive experience.</rgb>\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>To participate in the defence of the Hornburg, open the Epic Battles Panel and select 'The Hornburg' from the menu. After you successfully complete the defence, you will be returned to the location from which you entered it.</rgb>"}},
[1960]={nameES="Book 13, Chapter 11: Dawn Comes",objectivesES={"Talk to Gimli on the field of victory","Day has dawned, and with it comes new hope for Rohan.\
\
Thurketel has asked you to go out the front gate, and see what has become of the battle.","Day has dawned, and with it comes new hope for Rohan.\
\
Éomer is on the field of battle, trying to accept the surrender of some surviving Dunlending warriors.","You have found Aragorn and Théoden, astride their steeds, on the field of victory","Talk to Théoden on the field of victory","Day has dawned, and with it comes new hope for Rohan.\
\
Gandalf has arrived at Helm's Deep. What part did he play in the victory?","Talk to Gandalf on the field of victory","Talk to the frightened Dunlending warrior by Éomer","The Dunlending warrior stares at you suspiciously, and says nothing.","The Dunlending warrior stares at you with fear in his eyes.\
\
'I know what the horse-men do to their captives, and I will not let that happen to my men! This strawhead says they will be spared, but how can I trust this man, who weighs the value of a horse above that of his own children? The horse-men burn their captives alive, and feed upon the dead! Saruman saw it with his sorceries!'\
\
You assure the Dunlending warrior that this is simply one more lie of Saruman's, and that Éomer is a man of honour. The warrior's fear abates slightly, but it will take some more time before he is at ease. In time the lies of Saruman will be proven to be falsehoods. You leave Éomer to his charges.","Day has dawned, and with it comes new hope for Rohan.\
\
Aragorn and Théoden are outside the walls of the Deep, on the field of victory.","The coming of the dawn has brought with it the end of the battle, and renewed the hopes of Rohan.","Talk to Aragorn on the field of victory","Talk to Éomer on the field of victory","Day has dawned, and with it comes new hope for Rohan.\
\
Gandalf is on the field of victory before the walls of Helm's Deep.","Day has dawned, and with it comes new hope for Rohan.\
\
Éomer is overseeing the surrender of many Dunlendings following the battle.","Find Aragorn and Théoden on the field outside the gates","Day has dawned, and with it comes new hope for Rohan.\
\
Legolas and Gimli are somewhere on the field of victory.","Book 13, Chapter 11: Dawn Comes","Talk to Legolas on the field of victory"}},
[1961]={nameES="Libro 13, Capítulo 11: Narchuil Va al Sur",objectivesES={"Habla con Laerdan","Recuperaste la mitad perdida del anillo Narchuil y la devolviste a Elrond en Rivendel. Elrond te envió luego a hablar con Aragorn acerca de tu encuentro con la sombra de Arvedui, último rey de Arthedain.","Laerdan está en sus aposentos en la Última Morada.\
\
Aragorn te pidió que lo buscaras y le hablaras de tu investigación de Narchuil.","Libro 13, Capítulo 11: Narchuil Va al Sur"}},
[1962]={nameES="Book 13, Chapter 1: The Lay of the Land",objectivesES={"Follow the road that runs from Helm's Dike to the Hornburg","Find Théoden and Éomer outside the keep of the Hornburg","Háma and Déorwine have a great deal to do to reinforce the guard-house","Talk to Théoden outside the keep of the Hornburg","Déorwine believes the guard-house doors will not last, if tested","Find the guard-house of the Hornburg","Talk to Gimli at Helm's Dike","You have arrived at Helm's Deep as the King's men prepare to defend the Hornburg.","Háma is neither confident nor without hope, but he seeks to make his father proud","Book 13, Chapter 1: The Lay of the Land","Legolas waves a greeting as you approach","Gimli is confident","Aragorn believes the Hornburg's defences are not strong enough","Thurketel sees you and heartily calls a greeting","Talk to Sigferth atop the wall","Talk to Háma at the guard-house of the Hornburg","Sigferth is incredibly confident","Talk to Thurketel along the road from the Dike","Legolas fears he will run out of arrows before the battle is done","The Deeping Wall provides a sturdy defence for the Hornburg, and allows its defenders a commanding view of the gorge.","Théoden is confident the Hornburg will not be breached","Talk to Legolas atop the wall","Théoden and Éomer are overseeing the preparations outside the Hornburg.","A road runs from Helm's Dike through the valley and to the Hornburg.","Aragorn is outside the keep of the Hornburg, alongside Éomer and not far from Théoden.","Talk to Déorwine at the guard-house of the Hornburg","Éomer is worried that the battle will be neither easy nor quick","Thurketel is confident","Find Legolas atop the Deeping Wall","Talk to Éomer outside the keep of the Hornburg","The guard-house provides a sturdy defence for the Hornburg.","Talk to Aragorn outside the keep of the Hornburg","There is a maelstrom of activity outside the walls of the Hornburg"}},
[1963]={nameES="Libro 13, Capítulo 1: El Camino hacia el Norte",objectivesES={"Laerdan está en sus aposentos, en el primer piso de la Última Morada.\
\
Elrond te ha pedido que hables con Laerdan y averigües qué curso de acción piensa seguir.","Libro 13, Capítulo 1: El Camino hacia el Norte","Habla con Laerdan","El Consejo de Narchuil no terminó como Elrond había previsto, y teme que Laerdan pueda actuar con precipitación en su búsqueda de Narchuil."}},
[1964]={nameES="Libro 13, Capítulo 1: El Camino hacia el Norte",objectivesES={"Laerdan está en sus aposentos, en el primer piso de la Última Morada.\
\
Elrond te ha pedido que hables con Laerdan y averigües qué curso de acción piensa seguir.","Libro 13, Capítulo 1: El Camino hacia el Norte","Habla con Laerdan","El Consejo de Narchuil no terminó como Elrond había previsto, y teme que Laerdan pueda actuar con precipitación en su búsqueda de Narchuil."}},
[1965]={nameES="Book 13, Chapter 2: Final Preparations",objectivesES={"You can use one of the mats near Aragorn to sort the iron goods contributed by the farmers of Westfold.","Book 13, Chapter 2: Final Preparations","Pick up one of the training dummies near Éomer","Legolas is atop the wall.\
\
You have carried a training dummy to the top of the wall and Legolas has caught your eye.","Éomer has asked you to carry one of the nearby training dummies up to the wall by Legolas, the better to draw fire away from the defenders.","Gamling is at Helm's Dike.\
\
There is always work to be done to get ready for battle, and Gamling will tell you what he needs.","Corudan has gone down to the Dike, beyond the walls of the Hornburg.\
\
Legolas told you that Corudan planned to scout the armies of Saruman, and you should speak to him before he leaves.","Gamling has asked you to carry a barrel of iron goods from Helm's Dike to Aragorn outside the keep of the Hornburg.","With all of the goods set on the mat, you see one or two useable pieces","Retrieve iron goods from a barrel near Aragorn, outside the keep of the Hornburg","Talk to Corudan by his horse at Helm's Dike","Talk to Legolas atop the wall","With a third of the goods set out on the mat, you see little of use","Aragorn is outside the keep of the Hornburg, and wishes to speak with you.","With most of the goods set on the mat, you still see little of use","Pick up the barrel of iron goods near Gamling, in Helm's Dike","You retrieve a pile of iron goods from the barrel","Talk to Gamling at Helm's Dike","Barrels of iron goods from the farmers of Westfold can be found outside the keep of the Hornburg, near Aragorn.\
\
Aragorn has asked you to sort through an iron goods barrel using one of the nearby sorting mats.","Use the mat near Aragorn to sort through the iron goods","Talk to Éomer outside the keep of the Hornburg","Talk to Aragorn outside the keep of the Hornburg","Aragorn is desperate to ensure that the Hornburg is well-defended before Saruman's forces arrive.","Éomer is outside the keep of the Hornburg.","You set down the barrel of iron goods, and Aragorn nods gratefully","You set the dummy atop the wall and hope it will draw fire away from the defenders"}},
[1966]={nameES="Libro 13, Capítulo 2: Los Hombres de las Nieves de Forochel",objectivesES={"Una sombra de duda se cierne sobre Laerdan, y teme abandonar Rivendel en busca de Narchuil.","Habla con Lassi","Habla con Dáthi","Dáthi está en Kauppa-kohta, en la tierra de Forochel, al norte de Evendim y más allá de la Puerta del Norte.\
\
Laerdan te ha pedido que vayas a Forochel y hables con el comerciante enano Dáthi. Puede que el enano sepa por dónde comenzar la búsqueda de Narchuil.","Lassi está en Sûri-kylä, al norte y al este a lo largo de la Bahía de Hielo de Forochel.\
\
Dáthi te habló de la última visita de Laerdan y de la llegada de los Angmarim. Te dijo que hablaras con Lassi si esperas recuperar Narchuil antes que los Angmarim.","Libro 13, Capítulo 2: Los Hombres de las Nieves de Forochel"}},
[1967]={nameES="Libro 13, Capítulo 3: Favor de la Resistencia",objectivesES={"Libro 13, Capítulo 3: Favor de la Resistencia","Para obtener el favor de Yrjänä, debes realizar tres tareas para el pueblo Lossoth.","Sini está en las afueras de Sûri-kylä.\
\
Has encontrado a Urmas y ahora deberías volver con Sini para informar de tu éxito.","Urmas encontrado","Sini está en las afueras de Sûri-kylä.\
\
Lassi te indicó que hablaras con Sini sobre las tareas necesarias para obtener el favor de Yrjänä.","Urmas fue visto por última vez dirigiéndose hacia el sur, en dirección a Itä-mâ.\
\
Sini te ha pedido que te adentres en lo salvaje para encontrar a Urmas.","Encuentra a Urmas","Habla con Sini"}},
[1968]={nameES="Libro 13, Capítulo 3: Favor de la Fortaleza",objectivesES={"Emeli está cerca de la entrada de Sûri-kylä.\
\
Debes buscar a Emeli si deseas obtener el favor de la fortaleza.","Para obtener el favor de Yrjänä, debes realizar tres tareas para el pueblo Lossoth.","Recolecta el colmillo de Paksu-karva","Libro 13, Capítulo 3: Favor de la Fortaleza","Entrega el colmillo de Paksu-karva a Emeli","Habla con Emeli","Emeli está en Sûri-kylä, frente a la cabaña de vapor.\
\
Debes devolverle a Emeli el colmillo de Paksu-karva como señal de tu éxito.","Paksu-karva fue visto por última vez entre sierpes al sureste, a lo largo de la Bahía Helada.\
\
Emeli te pidió que busques a Paksu-karva y le lleves su colmillo como prueba de que has completado la hazaña de fuerza requerida.","Colmillo de Paksu-karva recogido"}},
[1969]={nameES="Libro 13, Capítulo 3: Favor de la Sabiduría",objectivesES={"Jalmari está en Sûri-kylä, cerca de la cabaña de vapor.\
\
Debes volver con Jalmari con la solución a su acertijo.","Libro 13, Capítulo 3: Favor de la Sabiduría","Elige el primer objeto","Elige el tercer objeto","Elige el segundo objeto","Elige el quinto objeto","Elige el cuarto objeto","Para obtener el favor de Yrjänä, debes completar tres tareas para el pueblo Lossoth.","Los objetos se encuentran junto a Jalmari.\
\
Jalmari te ha pedido que uses sabiduría para ordenar ciertos objetos importantes para los Lossoth. Te dijo lo siguiente sobre ellos:\
\
'El calor es de gran importancia en estas tierras congeladas, así que el fuego es un compañero valioso. Aún más importante es el agua, porque sin agua no hay vida.\
\
'Aun con fuego y agua a tu alcance, estas tierras no son seguras. Una persona sabia llevará consigo armas resistentes para protegerse, aunque primero debe tener alimentos suficientes para darle la fuerza necesaria para manejarlas.\
\
'Sobre todo, un viajero en estas tierras debe tener ropa lo suficientemente abrigada para protegerse del frío cuando no puede encender fuego.'","Jalmari está en Sûri-kylä, cerca de la cabaña de vapor.\
\
Lassi te indicó que hablaras con Jalmari para recibir su guía y así ganarte el favor de Yrjänä.","Habla con Jalmari"}},
[1970]={nameES="Libro 13, Capítulo 3: El Favor del Caudillo",objectivesES={"Los Lossoth son un pueblo desconfiado y no te ayudarán a menos que ganes el favor de su caudillo, Yrjänä.","Libro 13, Capítulo 3: El Favor del Caudillo","Yrjänä está en la Gran Cabaña de Sûri-kylä.\
\
Ahora que has completado las tareas requeridas, deberías hablar con Yrjänä.","Obtén el Favor de la Fortaleza","Habla con Yrjänä","Obtén el Favor de la Resistencia","Obtén el Favor de la Sabiduría","Jalmari está dentro de Sûri-kylä, cerca de la cabaña de vapor. Emeli está frente a la cabaña de vapor. Sini se encuentra en las afueras de Sûri-kylä.\
\
Lassi te ha dicho que debes completar tres tareas antes de poder hablar con Yrjänä. Si deseas saber más, deberías volver a hablar con él."}},
[1971]={nameES="Book 13, Chapter 3: Night Deepens",objectivesES={"Aragorn speaks to you in hushed tones.\
\
'The next few hours will sorely test us all, my friend, but none more than the King of Rohan. It will be Théoden's resolve, as much as the strength of his fighting men, that will govern our chances of survival. He will not speak plainly to me, or to any of us, on this matter. It is not his way, nor the way of most who rule.\
\
'Find Gléowine and ask him what he makes of the King's mood and temperament. I cannot tell if the King is putting on a brave face, but Gléowine has served him for many years and will know better than I the truth of this. I last saw the minstrel below us, by a pile of straw near the western wall.'","As the night deepens, battle approaches the defenders of the Hornburg.","Gamling gestures at you, and seeks to catch his breath","Gléowine is on the lowest level of the fortress, by a pile of straw near the west wall.\
\
Aragorn wants to determine the mood of Théoden, but has sent you not to the King but to Gléowine to learn it.","Talk to Gléowine near the map table by the western wall","Talk to Gléowine, by the map table near the western wall, after midnight","The sound of fighting reaches your ears... the battle is joined!","Book 13, Chapter 3: Night Deepens","It is after midnight at Helm's Deep.\
\
Gamling is by the map table with Gléowine, on the lowest level of the fortress, by the western wall.","It is after midnight at Helm's Deep.\
\
Gléowine is by the map table, near the pile of straw by the western wall.","Talk to Gamling by the pile of straw near the western wall","Study the map table near the western wall, by Gléowine, and time will pass","Gléowine wants you to show him on the nearby map table what the night may hold for the defenders of Helm's Deep.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Interacting with the map table near Gléowine will allow time to pass. Action will resume after midnight, when the battle is joined.</rgb>"}},
[1972]={nameES="Book 13, Chapter 4: Helm's Dike",objectivesES={"Book 13, Chapter 4: Helm's Dike","Talk to Thenca and complete 'Storied Tale: Helm's Dike' <rgb=#00FF00>OR</rgb> complete 'Helm's Dike' from the Epic Battles Panel","It is after midnight at Helm's Deep.\
\
Gimli and Legolas are on the Deeping Wall. Gamling told you to take the eastern stairs up onto the wall in order to reach them.","Talk to Legolas on the Deeping Wall","Talk to Gimli on the Deeping Wall","Helm's Dike is under attack, and Gamling seeks your help in defending it from Saruman's forces.","It is after midnight at Helm's Deep.\
\
Aragorn wishes to speak with you atop the Deeping Wall.","Gamling has asked for your help defending Helm's Dike.\
\
<rgb=#00FF00>There are two ways to participate in the defence of Helm's Dike. You can speak to Thenca for the Storied Tale, a story-focused experience. Or you can use the Epic Battles Panel for a more gameplay-intensive experience.</rgb>\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>To participate in the defence of Helm's Dike, open the Epic Battles Panel and select 'Helm's Dike' from the menu. After you successfully complete the defence, you will be returned to the location from which you entered it.</rgb>","Talk to Aragorn on the Deeping Wall","Talk to Gamling by the pile of straw near the western wall","It is after midnight at Helm's Deep.\
\
Gamling is by the pile of straw on the lower level of the fortress, by the western wall."}},
[1973]={nameES="Libro 13, Capítulo 4: La Mano de Angmar",objectivesES={"Ve con Yrjänä a encontrarte con tu rival","Habla con Yrjänä","Completaste las tres tareas que te encomendaron los Lossoth, ganando su favor y el derecho de hablar con Yrjänä.","Yrjänä está en la Gran Cabaña de Sûri-kylä.\
\
Debes hablar con Yrjänä acerca de las amenazas de Mordrambor.","Libro 13, Capítulo 4: La Mano de Angmar","Yrjänä está en la Gran Cabaña de Sûri-kylä.\
\
Yrjänä te informó de que otro ha venido reclamando Narchuil y buscando la ayuda de los Lossoth para encontrarlo."}},
[1974]={nameES="Book 13, Chapter 5: A Need for Words",objectivesES={}},
[1975]={nameES="Libro 13, Capítulo 5: El Mito del Monstruo",objectivesES={"Habla con Arvedui","Arvedui ronda los restos de un gran barco élfico congelado en la Bahía Helada de Forochel.\
\
Has descubierto la sombra de Arvedui, último rey de Arthedain, rondando los restos del barco élfico que había venido a rescatarlo hace tanto tiempo. Puede que la sombra conozca el paradero de Narchuil.","Habla con Saija","Busca el cuerpo del monstruo marino en la Bahía Helada de Forochel","El Númenóreano Negro Mordrambor llegó a la aldea de los Lossoth exigiendo la lealtad de su pueblo, infundiendo temor en sus corazones.","Saija está en Näky-kolo, al noroeste de Kuru-leiri.\
\
Yrjänä te pidió que acudieras a la sabiduría de Saija para encontrar Narchuil.","El cuerpo del monstruo marino del que habló Saija yace en la Bahía Helada de Forochel, al este de Kuru-leiri.\
\
Saija te indicó que buscaras Narchuil, o noticias de él, sobre el cuerpo del monstruo marino visible en la Bahía Helada de Forochel.","Has encontrado a la sombra de Arvedui, último rey de Arthedain","Libro 13, Capítulo 5: El Mito del Monstruo"}},
[1976]={nameES="Book 13, Chapter 6: Atop the Wall",objectivesES={"Aragorn has decided to lead a sortie through the postern gate in the Deeping Wall, in order to strike against the forces of Saruman.","It is after midnight at Helm's Deep.\
\
<rgb=#00FF00>There are two ways to participate in the defence of the Deeping Wall. You can speak to Thurketel for the Storied Tale, a story-focused experience. Or you can use the Epic Battles Panel for a more gameplay-intensive experience.</rgb>\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>To participate in the defence of the Deeping Wall, open the Epic Battles Panel and select 'The Deeping Wall' from the menu. After you successfully complete the defence, you will be returned to the location from which you entered it.</rgb>","Book 13, Chapter 6: Atop the Wall","It is after midnight at Helm's Deep. Rohirric Swordsmen can be found in the open space between the Hornburg and the Deeping Wall.\
\
Aragorn has asked you to gather swordsmen to accompany him on a sortie beyond the wall.","Talk to Legolas atop the Deeping Wall","It is after midnight at Helm's Deep. Legolas is atop the Deeping Wall, accessible from ground-level by the eastern staircase.\
\
Aragorn has sent you to watch over the battle alongside Legolas.","Talk to Aragorn by the postern gate below the north-west tower","Éomer is below the north-west tower, by the postern gate.\
\
You have survived an attack on the Deeping Wall, and should see how Éomer and Aragorn fared in their sortie.","It is after midnight at Helm's Deep. Aragorn and Éomer are by the postern gate, below the north-west tower.\
\
You have given word to several swordsmen that Aragorn plans a sortie through the postern gate, and should see if that be enough.","Talk to Éomer by the postern gate","Talk to Thurketel and complete 'Storied Tale: The Deeping Wall' <rgb=#00FF00>OR</rgb> complete 'The Deeping Wall' from the Epic Battles Panel"}},
[1977]={nameES="Libro 13, Capítulo 6: Las Minas de los Enanos",objectivesES={"Encuentra el libro de heráldica","Habla con Arvedui","Al hallar los restos del barco que vino a llevar al rey Arvedui de vuelta a los Puertos Grises, hiciste un descubrimiento aún más sorprendente: la sombra del propio Arvedui.","Arvedui está entre los restos del barco élfico, hacia el norte a lo largo de la Bahía de Hielo, en Talvi-mûri.\
\
Después de entregar el libro, deberías regresar con Arvedui para recibir más indicaciones.","Libro 13, Capítulo 6: Las Minas de los Enanos","El libro de heráldica yace en las minas de los enanos donde Arvedui y su gente se ocultaron en Länsi-mâ.\
\
Arvedui te pidió que encontraras el libro de heráldica, abandonado en las antiguas minas de los enanos, y que lo llevaras a un Montaraz acampado en Forochel.","El Montaraz está acampado en Sûri-kylä.\
\
Ahora que has encontrado el libro de heráldica, como indicó Arvedui, debes entregárselo al Montaraz del que habló el antiguo rey.","Entrega el libro de heráldica a un Montaraz acampado en Forochel","Has encontrado el libro de heráldica"}},
[1978]={nameES="Book 13, Chapter 7: Defending the Deep",objectivesES={"Gléowine wants you to set the fallen barrel of weapons upright.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Interacting with the tipped-over barrel near Gléowine will allow time to pass. Action will resume in the hours before dawn, with the next onslaught of the enemy.</rgb>","Find the breach in the Deeping Wall","Book 13, Chapter 7: Defending the Deep","Talk to Gléowine by the map table west of the Hornburg","You set the barrel upright and replace the fallen weapons where they belong","Talk to Théoden outside the Hornburg","Saruman's attack on Helm's Deep continues, and the battle is beginning to take its toll on the fortress and on its defenders.","Sensing victory, Saruman's forces muster just beyond the breach","In the hours before dawn, the forces of Saruman press their advantage.\
\
<rgb=#00FF00>There are two ways to participate in the defence of the Deeping-coomb. You can speak to Háma for the Storied Tale, a story-focused experience. Or you can use the Epic Battles Panel for a more gameplay-intensive experience.</rgb>\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>To participate in the defence of the Deep, open the Epic Battles Panel and select 'The Deeping-coomb' from the menu. After you successfully complete the defence, you will be returned to the location from which you entered it.</rgb>","In the hours before dawn, the forces of Saruman press their advantage.\
\
Théoden King is outside the Hornburg.","Set the tipped barrel near the western wall upright, and time will pass","Talk to Aragorn on the second level, outside the Hornburg","Talk to Gimli by the postern gate","In the hours before dawn, the forces of Saruman press their advantage.\
\
Aragorn wants you to hurry to the breach in the Deeping Wall, east of the Hornburg, and help the survivors in the aftermath of the blast.","It is after midnight at Helm's Deep.\
\
Gimli is by the postern gate, below the north-west tower.","In the hours before dawn, the forces of Saruman press their advantage.\
\
Aragorn is on the second level, outside the entrance to the Hornburg.","Talk to Sigferth by the breach","Talk to Háma and complete 'Storied Tale: The Deeping-coomb' <rgb=#00FF00>OR</rgb> complete 'The Deeping-coomb' from the Epic Battles Panel","It is after midnight at Helm's Deep.\
\
Gimli has asked you to check on Gléowine by the map table west of the Hornburg."}},
[1979]={nameES="Libro 13, Capítulo 7: El Marinero Perdido",objectivesES={"Libro 13, Capítulo 7: El Marinero Perdido","Habla con Saija","Para ganarte la confianza del espíritu inquieto de Arvedui, realizaste un acto de bondad por él y entregaste un tomo perdido a uno de los descendientes de su linaje.","Saija está en Näky-kolo, al noroeste de Kuru-leiri.\
\
Arvedui te dijo que el capitán del barco élfico no pereció con su navío y sugirió que buscaras la sabiduría de Saija para conocer el destino de Aearil y su tripulación."}},
[1980]={nameES="Libro 13, Capítulo 8: Una Tormenta Oscura",objectivesES={"Habla con Saija","Realiza dos tareas para Saija","Saija está en Näky-kolo, al noroeste de Kuru-leiri.\
\
Saija te dirá lo que necesitas saber, pero quiere que realices dos tareas para ella.","Libro 13, Capítulo 8: Una Tormenta Oscura","Saija está en Näky-kolo, al noroeste de Kuru-leiri.\
\
Ahora que has completado las dos tareas que te encomendó, deberías hablar con Saija nuevamente.","No solo encontraste los restos del barco élfico que había llevado al rey Arvedui desde las costas de Forochel, sino que hallaste también a la sombra del propio Arvedui."}},
[1981]={nameES="Libro 13, Capítulo 8: Una Prueba del Frío",objectivesES={"Saija te ha encomendado dos tareas que debes realizar antes de que te revele su conocimiento.","Saija está en Näky-kolo, al noroeste de Kuru-leiri.\
\
Habiendo derrotado a los gigantes de hielo, debes regresar de inmediato con Saija.","Habla con Saija","Se pueden encontrar gigantes de hielo al sur y al oeste de Näky-kolo.\
\
Saija te ha encargado derrotar a los gigantes de hielo que descendieron de las montañas. También sugiere atraerlos a las aguas termales para debilitarlos.","Libro 13, Capítulo 8: Una Prueba del Frío"}},
[1982]={nameES="Book 13, Chapter 8: Secret Ways",objectivesES={"In the hours before dawn, the forces of Saruman press their advantage.\
\
Gimli is in the Glittering Caves, and wanted to speak with you about the next phase of the battle.","In the hours before dawn, the forces of Saruman press their advantage.\
\
Aragorn has asked you to find Gimli in the Glittering Caves. The entrance to the caves is south of the Deeping Wall, where the stream runs out of the mountains.","Talk to Gimli and secure the Glittering Caves","Book 13, Chapter 8: Secret Ways","Find Gimli in the Glittering Caves","In the hours before dawn, the forces of Saruman press their advantage.\
\
Gimli is in the Glittering Caves, waiting to speak with you.","In the hours before dawn, the forces of Saruman press their advantage.\
\
Gimli has been forced into the Glittering Caves during the fighting.","Aragorn has heard that Gimli may have been pushed back into the Glittering Caves during the fighting, and wants you to find the dwarf and assist him.","You have found Gimli. He seems tired, but is otherwise healthy enough","Talk to Gimli in the Glittering Caves"}},
[1983]={nameES="Libro 13, Capítulo 8: Espíritus de Angmar",objectivesES={"Saija te ha encomendado dos tareas que debes realizar antes de que te revele su conocimiento.","Habla con Saija","Saija está en Näky-kolo.\
\
Ahora que has derrotado a numerosos espectros del hielo, deberías volver con Saija tal como te indicó.","Libro 13, Capítulo 8: Espíritus de Angmar","Se pueden encontrar espectros del hielo sobre Näky-kolo, al sur y oeste del lugar.\
\
Saija te ha encomendado desterrar a los espectros del hielo de las costas de Forochel."}},
[1984]={nameES="Book 13, Chapter 9: Glittering Caves",objectivesES={"The battle has come to the Glittering Caves, and the people of Rohan that shelter there must be protected!","In the hours before dawn, the forces of Saruman press their advantage.\
\
Gimli is in the Glittering Caves, and wishes to speak with you after pushing back the latest assault.","In the hours before dawn, the forces of Saruman press their advantage.\
\
Aragorn is on the second level, outside the Hornburg, and Gimli wants you to report to him of the dwarf's successes.","Talk to Éomer and complete 'Storied Tale: The Glittering Caves' <rgb=#00FF00>OR</rgb> complete 'The Glittering Caves' from the Epic Battles Panel","In the hours before dawn, the forces of Saruman press their advantage.\
\
<rgb=#00FF00>There are two ways to participate in the defence of the Glittering Caves. You can speak to Éomer for the Storied Tale, a story-focused experience. Or you can use the Epic Battles Panel for a more gameplay-intensive experience.</rgb>\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>To participate in the defence of the Glittering Caves, open the Epic Battles Panel and select 'Glittering Caves' from the menu. After you successfully complete the defence, you will be returned to the location from which you entered it.</rgb>","Book 13, Chapter 9: Glittering Caves","Talk to Aragorn outside the Hornburg","Talk to Gimli in the Glittering Caves"}},
[1985]={nameES="Libro 13, Capítulo 9: El Sendero de Aearil",objectivesES={"Habla con Arvedui","La sombra de Arvedui se encuentra en la Ruina del Thoroval, al norte y al este a lo largo de la Bahía de Hielo, en Talvi-mûri.\
\
Habiendo recuperado un fragmento del anillo entre las pertenencias de Aearil, deberías buscar a la sombra de Arvedui y comunicarle el destino de quien intentó rescatarlo, además de averiguar si el fragmento que hallaste es realmente la mitad perdida de Narchuil.","Saija te reveló la ubicación de una cueva donde los Lossoth creen que el capitán del segundo barco élfico pudo refugiarse tras el naufragio.","El capitán elfo, o sus pertenencias, podrían aún encontrarse dentro de la cueva.\
\
Saija sugirió que volvieras a hablar con ella para buscar la cueva, y que te guiaría hasta allí.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Esta misión está pensada para una comunidad. Si decides afrontarla en solitario, recibirás una bonificación de inspiración, pero el desafío será grande.</rgb>","Encuentra a Narchuil","Has encontrado un fragmento de Narchuil","Libro 13, Capítulo 9: El Sendero de Aearil"}},
[1986]={nameES="Libro 14, Capítulo 10: Tras la Pista de Angmar",objectivesES={"Libro 14, Capítulo 10: Tras la Pista de Angmar","Newbold Cortahoja te dirigió a la tumba de Maenadar el Artesano, pero llegaste demasiado tarde para recuperar la herramienta de forja de Celebrimbor.","Eglamír se encuentra en Celondim, en las Montañas Azules, muy al oeste de las Tierras de Bree.\
\
Newbold Cortahoja te sugirió que regresaras con Eglamír para recibir más consejos.","Habla con Eglamír en Celondim"}},
[1987]={nameES="Libro 14, Capítulo 11: Los Grandes Fuelles de Mirobel",objectivesES={"Habla con Yrjänä en Sûri-kylä","Libro 14, Capítulo 11: Los Grandes Fuelles de Mirobel","Yrjänä se encuentra en Sûri-kylä, en Forochel, muy al norte y al este de Celondim.\
\
Eglamír cree que los esbirros de Amarthiel podrían estar tratando de encontrar la guarida de un dragón que quizá aún habite en Forochel, cuya piel podría usarse para reparar los fuelles de las forjas de Mirobel. Te sugiere viajar al norte helado y hablar con la jefa lossoth Yrjänä.","Newbold Cortahoja ya no pudo ayudarte y te sugirió regresar con Eglamír en Celondim."}},
[1988]={nameES="Libro 14, Capítulo 12: La Piel de Bregmor",objectivesES={"Encuentra y entra en la guarida de Bregmor","Libro 14, Capítulo 12: La Piel de Bregmor","Yrjänä se encuentra en Sûri-kylä, muy al este de la guarida de Bregmor.\
\
No lograste impedir que Angmar se apoderara de la piel del dragón Bregmor y ahora deberías regresar con Yrjänä para darle la noticia.","Habla con Yrjänä en Sûri-kylä","Eglamír cree que los esbirros de Amarthiel podrían estar buscando la piel del dragón de Forochel para reparar los grandes fuelles de Mirobel, las Forjas de los Anillos de Eregion, y te envió a informarte sobre Bregmor con Yrjänä, la jefa de Sûri-kylä.","La guarida de Bregmor se encuentra muy al oeste de Sûri-kylä, al sudeste de Jotunstath.\
\
Yrjänä te contó que el dragón Bregmor aterrorizó Forochel en otro tiempo, pero ya no lo hace. También indicó que no arriesgaría a su gente para guiarte hasta la guarida de Bregmor, dejándote valerte por tu cuenta.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Esta misión está pensada para una comunidad. Si decides emprenderla en solitario, recibirás un bono de inspiración, pero el desafío será considerable.</rgb>"}},
[1989]={nameES="Libro 14, Capítulo 13: Esperanzas Frustradas",objectivesES={"No lograste frustrar las maquinaciones de Angmar en Forochel, dejando a les servidores de Amarthiel libres para reavivar las forjas de Mirobel.","Libro 14, Capítulo 13: Esperanzas Frustradas","Habla con Eglamír en Celondim","Eglamír se encuentra en Celondim, en las Montañas Azules, lejos al sur y al oeste de Forochel.\
\
Yrjänä te dijo que regresaras con Eglamír para informarle de tu fracaso."}},
[1990]={nameES="Libro 14, Capítulo 14: Una Carga Pesada",objectivesES={"Habla con Elrond en Rivendel","Libro 14, Capítulo 14: Una Carga Pesada","Elrond se encuentra en Rivendel, en el Bosque de los Trolls, muy al este de Celondim.\
\
Eglamír sugirió que lleves noticias de tu fracaso a Elrond, en Rivendel.","Con la piel del dragón Bregmor y la herramienta de forja de Celebrimbor, no hay nada más que Eglamír sepa que Amarthiel necesite para reavivar las forjas de Eregion y reforjar a Narchuil."}},
[1991]={nameES="Libro 14, Capítulo 15: La Perdición del Norte",objectivesES={"Habla con Elrond en Rivendel","Con tus derrotas en las Tierras de Bree y en Forochel, ya queda poco por hacer salvo arrojarte contra las fuerzas de Amarthiel en un intento vano por poner fin a sus planes.","El capitán de la guardia Glorenthol se encuentra en Delossad, en Tâl Bruinen.\
\
No lograste detener a Amarthiel, pero finalmente fue derrotada con el regreso inesperado de Mordirith. Narchuil ha caído en manos del Rey Falso, y Amarthiel es ahora prisionera de los Pueblos Libres. Deberías hablar con el capitán de la guardia Glorenthol.","Viaja a Mirobel e intenta detener a Amarthiel","Libro 14, Capítulo 15: La Perdición del Norte","Puedes llegar a Mirobel viajando muy al sur, hasta las tierras de Eregion.\
\
Elrond te ordenó viajar a Mirobel y hacer todo lo que esté a tu alcance para detener a Amarthiel.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Esta misión está pensada para una comunidad. Si decides emprenderla en solitario, recibirás un bono de inspiración, pero el desafío será considerable.</rgb>","Elrond se encuentra en la biblioteca de la Última Morada en Rivendel.\
\
El capitán de la guardia te indicó que hables con Elrond acerca de tu misión en Mirobel.","Habla con el capitán de la guardia"}},
[1992]={nameES="Libro 14, Capítulo 1: Muchas provisiones",objectivesES={"Laerdan te envió con Filegnaneth para reunir provisiones para el viaje a Eregion, pero ella no tiene la fina miel de trébol que necesita para hacer lembas, el pan de camino de los elfos.","El cocinero experto se encuentra en Cavada Grande, en la Comarca, muy al oeste de Rivendel. Filegnaneth está en Rivendel, en el Bosque de los Trolls, muy al este de la Comarca.\
\
Filegnaneth te ha pedido viajar a la Comarca y comprar miel de trébol fina al cocinero experto allí.","Libro 14, Capítulo 1: Muchas provisiones","Lleva la miel de trébol fina a Filegnaneth"}},
[1993]={nameES="Book 14, Chapter 1: The Battle Is Won",objectivesES={"Talk to Éomer on the field of victory outside the Hornburg, after sunrise","This man insists that his injuries are not severe, and will not take a poultice","Book 14, Chapter 1: The Battle Is Won","Éomer is on the field of victory outside the Hornburg, after sunrise.","Gandalf has asked you to bring healing poultices to injured men in Helm's Deep, and the King has asked you to bring his command to any men nearby who own swift horses.","The battle has been won, and now the defenders of Helm's Deep recover from their hurts and look to the future.","Erkenbrand is on the field of battle outside the Hornburg, after sunrise.\
\
Théoden asked you to find Erkenbrand on the field of victory and to thank him for his timely arrival.","Talk to Théoden on the field of victory at Helm's Deep, after sunrise","Théoden King is to the south of Gandalf, on the field before the Hornburg, after sunrise.\
\
Gandalf has given you a number of healing poultices and wants you to tend to the hurts of the King and his men.","Talk to Erkenbrand on the field of victory outside the Hornburg, after sunrise","Déorwine is inside the fortress of the Hornburg, after sunrise.\
\
Éomer thinks you should rest for a few hours inside the fortress of the Hornburg, before going with the King's company to the Ring of Isengard to confront Saruman.","The man agrees to ride forth at once","This man regretfully owns no horse swift enough to carry the King's tidings","Talk to Déorwine inside the fortress of the Hornburg, after sunrise"}},
[1994]={nameES="Libro 14, Capítulo 1: La heráldica de Lindon",objectivesES={"Encuentra el peto de Laerdan","Libro 14, Capítulo 1: La heráldica de Lindon","Dolendath se encuentra en Imlad Balchorth, al sur y oeste de Myrkworth.\
\
Golodir sugirió que podrías encontrar el peto de Laerdan en Dolendath, el lugar donde su ejército se refugió por primera vez en Angmar.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Esta misión está pensada para una comunidad. Si decides completarla en solitario recibirás una bonificación de inspiración, pero el desafío será grande.</rgb>","Lleva el peto de Laerdan de vuelta a Golodir en Gath Forthnír","Laerdan te envió a Gath Forthnír para pedirle su peto al montaraz Golodir.","Peto de Laerdan encontrado"}},
[1995]={nameES="Libro 14, Capítulo 1: El largo camino al sur",objectivesES={"La puerta de la habitación de Laerdan parece estar cerrada con llave, y una nota ha sido clavada cerca","Habla con Elrond en Rivendel","Habla con Golodir en Gath Forthnír","Libro 14, Capítulo 1: El largo camino al sur","Has leído la nota de Laerdan","Habla con Laerdan en Rivendel","Laerdan se está preparando para viajar a Eregion, pero necesita tu ayuda para terminar sus preparativos.","Laerdan está en la Última Morada de Rivendel.\
\
Debes volver cuanto antes junto a Laerdan con noticias de tus éxitos, pero también de los retrasos resultantes.","Filegnaneth se encuentra en el Salón del Fuego en Rivendel. Nat Tajada está en Tinnudír, en Evendim, muy al oeste y al norte del Bosque de los Trolls. Golodir está en Gath Forthnír, en Angmar, muy al norte del Bosque de los Trolls.\
\
Laerdan te ha pedido realizar varias tareas en su nombre.","Elrond está en su biblioteca en la Última Morada de Rivendel.\
\
Debes contarle de inmediato a Elrond acerca de la nota de Laerdan.","Habla con Nat Tajada en Tinnudír","Habla con Filegnaneth en Rivendel"}},
[1996]={nameES="Libro 14, Capítulo 1: El corcel Arel",objectivesES={"La Mansión de Thorin está en Ered Luin, muy al oeste y al sur de Evendim.\
\
Nat Tajada te ha pedido que hables con el maestro herrero de la Mansión de Thorin y obtengas algunos moldes de acero enano para cubiertos.","Lleva los moldes de acero enano para cubiertos a Nat Tajada en Tinnudír","Laerdan te ha pedido que hables con Nat Tajada, un hombre de Ost Forod que supervisa el establo de Tinnudír, sobre enviar su caballo Arel a Rivendel.","Libro 14, Capítulo 1: El corcel Arel"}},
[1997]={nameES="Book 14, Chapter 2: Allies Unexpected",objectivesES={"Book 14, Chapter 2: Allies Unexpected","Talk to Déorwine and rest before setting out with the company","Déorwine is inside the keep of the Hornburg, after sunrise, at Helm's Deep.\
\
Déorwine is waiting for your word, and then he will prepare a place for you to rest before setting out for Isengard with the King.","Halbarad is on the road beyond the Fords of Isen.\
\
You have both been through much, and Halbarad greatly wishes to hear what has transpired since last you spoke.","Sometimes the best allies are those that arrive when they are not expected.","Aragorn is beyond the Fords of Isen, and wishes to speak with you."}},
[1998]={nameES="Libro 14, Capítulo 2: El rastro de Laerdan",objectivesES={"Habla con Elrond en Rivendel","Las noticias se vuelven más nefastas a cada momento. Ay de Laerdan.\
\
'No queda tiempo que perder... ¡debemos actuar de inmediato!'","Libro 14, Capítulo 2: El rastro de Laerdan","Has encontrado una nota dejada por Laerdan en la que indica que ha salido de Rivendel con la intención de llevar los fragmentos de Narchuil a Amarthiel.","Elrond está en su biblioteca en la Última Morada de Rivendel, al este del establo.\
\
Ladrochan te dijo que Laerdan había dejado Rivendel hace dos días. Debes volver a ver a Elrond con esta información de inmediato.","Ladrochan, el maestro de establos, se encuentra en las caballerizas de Rivendel, al oeste de la Última Morada.\
\
Elrond te ha dicho que hables con Ladrochan para saber cuánto tiempo hace que Laerdan dejó Rivendel.","Habla con Ladrochan en el establo de Rivendel"}},
[1999]={nameES="Libro 14, Capítulo 3: Arrojando luz",objectivesES={"Paquete examinado","Este paquete fue evidentemente dejado atrás a propósito, pues está terriblemente gastado y probablemente no habría sobrevivido a un largo viaje.","Mapa de Eregion examinado","Examina el diario de Laerdan","Bobina de cuerda examinada","Elrond quedó consternado por la partida secreta de Laerdan. Ahora recaen dudas sobre el honor del señor elfo, y Elrond desea conocer la verdad tras su desaparición.","Libro 14, Capítulo 3: Arrojando luz","La habitación de Laerdan está en la Última Morada de Rivendel.\
\
Elrond te ha pedido que registres los aposentos de Laerdan en busca de cualquier cosa que revele su propósito completo.","Elrond está en la biblioteca de la Última Morada en Rivendel.\
\
Has encontrado un diario en la habitación de Laerdan. Podría revelar los planes de Laerdan.","Este diario contiene muchas entradas, pero estaba abierto en un pasaje en particular...","Registra la habitación de Laerdan","Encuentras una bobina de cuerda que Laerdan claramente había planeado llevar consigo, pero que aparentemente olvidó en su apuro por marcharse.","Este mapa muestra una ruta dibujada desde Rivendel hacia el sur, hasta Eregion, pero no contiene ninguna otra pista."}},
[2000]={nameES="Book 14, Chapter 3: The Flooded Ring",objectivesES={"Gandalf stands by the Pillar of the Hand, on the way to Isengard.","Book 14, Chapter 3: The Flooded Ring","The very walls of Isengard have been damaged by some mighty force","A curious stillness covers the land, and pools of water stand near the road","Talk to Gandalf by the Pillar of the Hand","Many purposes now collide within the Ring of Isengard.","You have found Merry and Pippin at the gate of Isengard.","Aragorn has asked you to ride along the road to Isengard, and to keep your eyes peeled as you go.","Ride along the road north to Isengard, and remain alert","Gandalf has warned you that you might not recognize Isengard since last you saw it.","Ride north to the gate of Isengard"}},
[2001]={nameES="Libro 14, Capítulo 4: El prisionero de Sammath Baul",objectivesES={"La entrada en la que el diario estaba abierto detallaba el encarcelamiento de Laerdan en Sammath Baul y las torturas que sufrió a manos de Amarthiel y sus esbirros.","Mientras lees el diario de Laerdan, descubres que él cree haber visto a su hija Narmeleth allí, en Sammath Baul. Esta entrada es bastante inquietante...","En su diario, Laerdan se refiere a su \\qvisita de Narmeleth\\q como una epifanía. Llegó a creer que podría liberarla entregándole Narchuil, el anillo de Amarthiel.","Termina de leer el diario","Mientras registrabas los aposentos de Laerdan, descubriste su diario, con el pasaje que había leído marcado claramente.","Lee más del diario de Laerdan y experimenta 'Sesión: El prisionero de Sammath Baul', o bien lee la versión abreviada","Libro 14, Capítulo 4: El prisionero de Sammath Baul","Empiezas a leer más sobre el encarcelamiento y las torturas de Laerdan...","Deberías leer más en el diario... podría darte algunas pistas sobre los propósitos de Laerdan.","Mientras está encarcelado en la fortaleza de Sammath Baul, Laerdan soporta torturas tanto físicas como mentales. El engaño será, como siempre, el aliado más cercano de Amarthiel: cuando se presenta ante el cautivo con la apariencia de su hija Narmeleth, Laerdan revela su secreto más profundo: la ubicación de la segunda mitad de Narchuil. Permanece oculta en Forochel, pero si ambas mitades del anillo roto fueran reunidas, podría ser reforjado.\
\
'¡Podría salvarte!', jura Laerdan a la villana que toma el rostro de su hija, incluso mientras Amarthiel deja la protección del prisionero al capitán de Sammath Baul y a sus Sangradores. Héroes de los Pueblos Libres llegan para liberar a Laerdan del cautiverio, aunque no del engaño en el que Amarthiel lo ha atrapado..."}},
[2002]={nameES="Book 14, Chapter 4: Took and Brandybuck",objectivesES={"The gate-house is filled with rubble, and the flood-waters have reached here too","Book 14, Chapter 4: Took and Brandybuck","Pippin smiles at you amiably.","Merry and Pippin have made themselves quite at home at Isengard, but much of their story is still a mystery to you.","Bring the pipe-weed to Merry outside the gate-house","Aragorn is outside the gate-house at Isengard, and wears a concerned expression.","Merry is outside the gate of Isengard.","Enter the gate-house and look for the pipe-weed Merry mentioned","Aragorn nods at you, but says nothing.","Merry asked you to go inside the gate-house and bring out some more of the pipe-weed they found there."}},
[2003]={nameES="Libro 14, Capítulo 5: La caída de Laerdan",objectivesES={"Elrond se encuentra en la biblioteca de la Última Morada, en Rivendel.\
\
Deberías volver con Elrond de inmediato y contarle lo que has descubierto.","Habla con Elrond","El diario de Laerdan contenía una horrenda descripción de su encarcelamiento y tortura en Sammath Baul.","No aprendes nada más del diario de Laerdan aparte de los detalles de su encarcelamiento y de sus encuentros con Amarthiel y Narmeleth, reales o imaginados. Elrond quizá entienda estas cosas mejor que tú.","Libro 14, Capítulo 5: La caída de Laerdan"}},
[2004]={nameES="Book 14, Chapter 5: Wizard to Manage",objectivesES={"Gandalf listens to your account closely, especially the last words of the dying Orc.\
\
'It is said that the last words spoken by the dying are the truest you will ever hear, and I do not doubt that this Orc believed them. But I do not.'","Almost every bone in this Orc's body seems to be broken. What could have done this?","Book 14, Chapter 5: Wizard to Manage","Treebeard believes you should search within the Ring of Isengard for any sign of your captive friend.","Treebeard is by the base of Orthanc.\
\
Gandalf has asked you to speak with Treebeard while he considers what to do about Saruman.","Explore north of Orthanc","An Ent lies here, his skin burned and scorched","Talk to Gandalf by the base of Orthanc","Aragorn is concerned that Saruman may have further tricks up his sleeve.","Gandalf is at the base of Orthanc, considering what to do about the Wizard waiting within.","Explore west of Orthanc","Explore south of Orthanc","Talk to Treebeard at the base of Orthanc","The Orc laughs weakly, and breathes his last","This must have been the site of a great battle, for many corpses float in the water here","Gandalf is at the base of Orthanc, waiting to hear what you discovered in your search of the flooded Ring.","Talk to Gandalf at the base of Orthanc","A nearby Orc coughs up blood and snarls weakly at you"}},
[2005]={nameES="Book 14, Chapter 6: The Drowning Pits",objectivesES={"Find the entrance to the Isengard Depths, north of Orthanc","Surly scavengers can be found throughout the Isengard Depths.\
\
Golodir has asked you to defeat the scavengers that lurk within the flooded depths of Isengard, for one of them might know of Lothrandir's location, if the Ranger still lives.","A key drops from the scavenger's hand. Could Golodir have been right?","Talk to Golodir in the Isengard Depths","Golodir is in the flooded depths beneath Isengard, waiting to hear the results of your search.","An entrance to the Isengard Depths can be found north of the tower.\
\
Gandalf believes Lothrandir may still live, and wants you to search for news of him in the caverns below Isengard.","Book 14, Chapter 6: The Drowning Pits","You steel your resolve and prepare to enter the flooded deeps below Isengard","Golodir also searches the Isengard Depths for news of Lothrandir.","Gandalf does not believe that Lothrandir perished beneath Isengard, and wants you to search for him.","Defeat surly scavenger (5/6)"}},
[2006]={nameES="Libro 14, Capítulo 6: El destino de Laerdan",objectivesES={"Elrond se encuentra en su biblioteca en la Última Morada de Rivendel.\
\
Elrond desea hablar contigo acerca de lo que ha descubierto en el diario de Laerdan.","Habla con Elrond","Libro 14, Capítulo 6: El destino de Laerdan","Habla con Elrond sobre el destino que puede aguardar a Laerdan y experimenta 'Sesión: El destino de Laerdan' o lee la versión abreviada","Elrond está en su biblioteca en la Última Morada de Rivendel.\
\
Has hablado con Elrond sobre el destino de Laerdan, llegando a una conclusión funesta.","Creyendo que solo Narchuil puede restaurar la mente quebrada de su hija Narmeleth, Laerdan viaja a las antiguas forjas de anillos de Eregion. Cuando llega y se enfrenta al engaño de Amarthiel, lucha valerosamente, pero tiene pocas esperanzas y termina siendo superado.\
\
Ahora Amarthiel solo necesita reforjar las dos mitades rotas de Narchuil usando artes prohibidas para cumplir sus fines malignos...","Elrond quedó alarmado por la entrada del diario que le describiste, temiendo lo peor para Laerdan."}},
[2007]={nameES="Book 14, Chapter 7: Lothrandir",objectivesES={"Talk to Halbarad north-west of Orthanc","Talk to Halbarad north-west of Orthanc, within the Ring of Isengard","Book 14, Chapter 7: Lothrandir","Halbarad has found a number of locked doors behind one of which Lothrandir might be held.","Halbarad is in the Ring of Isengard, north-west of Orthanc, looking for Lothrandir.\
\
Halbarad is waiting to go with you to search further buildings in Isengard for Lothrandir.","Halbarad is in the Ring of Isengard, north-west of Orthanc, looking for Lothrandir.\
\
Golodir has asked you to return to the surface and to help Halbarad with his search for the captive Ranger.","Halbarad is north-west of Orthanc.","Talk to Halbarad and continue his search for Lothrandir"}},
[2008]={nameES="Libro 14, Capítulo 7: Los estragos del tiempo",objectivesES={"Busca a Eglamír en Celondim","El diario de Laerdan trae a Elrond preocupaciones mayores que solo el destino de Laerdan...","Elrond habló de un elfo llamado Eglamír que podría vivir en Celondim, en Ered Luin, muy al oeste de Rivendel y del Bosque de los Trolls.\
\
Elrond te contó que Celebrimbor, sabiamente, no registró muchos de los detalles de la forja de anillos en el saber de Eregion. Sin embargo, Elrond encontró numerosas referencias a un elfo llamado Eglamír que podría saber más.","Libro 14, Capítulo 7: Los estragos del tiempo"}},
[2009]={nameES="Book 14, Chapter 8: Allies of the King",objectivesES={"Talk to Pippin by the foot of the steps","Aragorn listens to your account of Lothrandir's rescue.\
\
'I am pleased to hear my kinsman is safe! I wished often that my friends might be close at hand, but I did not give voice to that desire, for I would not have wanted them put in danger. It is well that Lothrandir has emerged from the pit of Isengard unharmed.\
\
'Saruman emerged too, but not for long, and though he has returned to the tower I feel that his threat is ended! Gandalf will tell you more, if you would listen. I suspected some further mischief of Saruman, and I was not wrong to expect it! But all is ended now, and safely.'","Lothrandir has been rescued from the clutches of Saruman, but what has become of the Wizard himself?","Aragorn is on the stairs at the base of Orthanc.","Talk to Théoden on the steps of Orthanc","Talk to Aragorn at the base of Orthanc","Talk to Gandalf on the steps of Orthanc","Book 14, Chapter 8: Allies of the King","Halbarad has come to the base of Orthanc.","Gandalf, Théoden, and Pippin all witnessed the confrontation with Saruman and wish to speak with you about the Wizard's schemes.","Talk to Halbarad by the base of Orthanc"}},
[2010]={nameES="Libro 14, Capítulo 8: Un Amigo de los Elfos de Eregion",objectivesES={"Libro 14, Capítulo 8: Un Amigo de los Elfos de Eregion","Descubre a alguien en Bree que tenga conocimiento sobre las Quebradas de los Túmulos","Newbold Cortahoja se encuentra en el Archivo de la Escalera de los Eruditos, en Bree.\
\
Te aconsejaron buscar a Newbold Cortahoja para averiguar más sobre la ubicación de la herramienta de forja de Celebrimbor.","Para aprender más sobre el saber de los Anillos de Eregion, Elrond te envió a Eglamír, un elfo de Eregion que ahora reside en Celondim.","Bree se encuentra en las Tierras de Bree, muy al este de Ered Luin.\
\
Eglamír habló poco del saber de los Anillos de Eregion, pero sí te dijo que el herrero de anillos Celebrimbor entregó una herramienta de forja a un hombre de las Tierras de Bree. Sugiere que encuentres a alguien en Bree que sepa dónde está el túmulo de aquel hombre.","Habla con Newbold Cortahoja"}},
[2011]={nameES="Libro 14, Capítulo 9: Los Túmulos de Haudh Iarchith",objectivesES={"Habla con Newbold Cortahoja en Bree","Newbold Cortahoja está en el Archivo de la Escalera de los Eruditos, en Bree.\
\
Llegaste demasiado tarde a la tumba de Maenadar y la encontraste saqueada. Angmar llegó primero. Deberías regresar con Newbold Cortahoja para averiguar si sabe algo más.","Eglamír te envió en busca de alguien con conocimiento de las Quebradas de los Túmulos y de la herramienta de forja de Celebrimbor.","La tumba de Maenadar el Artesano fue perturbada recientemente y todas las reliquias que pudieran haber reposado allí han sido retiradas...","Encuentra la tumba de Maenadar el Artesano","La tumba está vacía de reliquias","La tumba de Maenadar se encuentra en el pequeño túmulo junto a la entrada de Haudh Iarchith, en la parte sur de las Quebradas de los Túmulos.\
\
Newbold Cortahoja te dijo que la herramienta de forja puede encontrarse en la tumba de Maenadar el Artesano.","Libro 14, Capítulo 9: Los Túmulos de Haudh Iarchith"}},
[2012]={nameES="Libro 15, Capítulo 10: La espada rota de Dúnachar",objectivesES={"Narmeleth está en la habitación antigua de su padre en Gath Forthnír, en las tierras del norte de Angmar.\
\
Narmeleth te ha dicho que hables con Golodir y averigües qué ha pasado con la espada rota de Dúnachar.","Narmeleth cree que conoce la debilidad de Mordirith.","Golodir está en su habitación en Gath Forthnír.\
\
Narmeleth te ha dicho que hables con Golodir y averigües qué ha pasado con la espada rota de Dúnachar.","Habla con Narmeleth en Gath Forthnír","Libro 15, Capítulo 10: La espada rota de Dúnachar"}},
[2013]={nameES="Libro 15, Capítulo 11: El regalo final de un padre",objectivesES={"Golodir está en Gath Forthnír, en las tierras del norte de Angmar.\
\
Debes volver a Golodir con la empuñadura rota de Dúnachar.","Narmeleth piensa que el hecho de mostrar la empuñadura rota de Dúnachar a Mordirith debilitará su voluntad.","Recupera la empuñadura rota de Dúnachar","La tumba de Lorniel se encuentra en las colinas del norte de Gorothlad, al sur de Nan Gurth en Angmar.\
\
Golodir te ha dado la ubicación de Dúnachar y te ha otorgado permiso para recuperarlo.","La empuñadura rota de Dúnachar recuperada","Libro 15, Capítulo 11: El regalo final de un padre","Lleva la empuñadura a Golodir","Golodir escucha tu relato del plan de Narmeleth y asiente.\
\
'Llevé la empuñadura rota de Dúnachar conmigo cuando enterré a mi querida Lorniel, y junto a su tumba sigue estando. Después de su muerte la llevamos lo más lejos que pudimos bajo el amparo de la oscuridad; descansa en la cima de una colina en las laderas del norte de Gorothlad.\
\
'Si la espada de Dúnachar te ayudará en tu lucha contra Mordirith, te doy permiso para recuperarla.'"}},
[2014]={nameES="libro 15, Capítulo 12: Solo queda una esperanza",objectivesES={"Habla con Glorfindel en Rivendel","Habla con Failloth en Rivendel","Narmeleth está en Gath Forthnír, en las tierras del norte de Angmar.\
\
Ella te ha pedido que reúnas amigos y hables con ella de nuevo para comenzar el asalto final.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Esta misión está destinada a una comunidad. Si eliges emprender esta misión solo, recibirás un bono de inspiración, pero el desafío será grande.</rgb>","Habla con Elrond en Rivendel","Failloth está en la plaza de la Última Morada en Rivendel.\
\
Elrond te dijo que recuperaras el legado de Laerdan de Failloth, la encargada de Rivendel.","Habla con Golodir en Gath Forthnír","Narmeleth busca poner fin a Mordrambor y Mordirith de una vez por todas.","Gath Forthnír está en las tierras del norte de Angmar.\
\
Golodir te dijo que llevaras la empuñadura a Narmeleth en Gath Forthnír.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Esta misión está destinada a una comunidad. Si eliges emprender esta misión solo, recibirás un bono de inspiración, pero el desafío será grande.</rgb>","Entrega la empuñadura a Narmeleth","Rivendel está en la esquina noreste del Bosque de los Trolls.\
\
Golodir te envió a hablar con Glorfindel y traerle noticias de la derrota de Mordirith.","Gath Forthnír está en las tierras del norte de Angmar.\
\
Debes hablar con Golodir en Gath Forthnír.","Ataca Gador Gúlaran","Elrond puede ser encontrado en la Última Morada en Rivendel.\
\
Glorfindel te dijo que entregaras tus noticias al maestro Elrond.","libro 15, Capítulo 12: Solo queda una esperanza"}},
[2015]={nameES="Libro 15, Capítulo 1: Un destino extraño",objectivesES={"Habla con Glorfindel en Rivendel","Glorfindel puede encontrarse fuera de la Última Morada hacia el sudeste, mirando hacia las Cataratas de Imladris.\
\
Elrond te ha pedido que hables con Glorfindel.","Habla con Narmeleth en Delossad","Delossad está al suroeste de Rivendel en el Tâl Bruinen, al este de la cabaña de Garbert.\
\
Glorfindel te ha pedido que interrogues con Narmeleth en Delossad.","Elrond comparte tus preocupaciones sobre Amarthiel y ha pedido al señor Glorfindel que se ocupe de este asunto.","Libro 15, Capítulo 1: Un destino extraño"}},
[2016]={nameES="Libro 15, capítulo 2: Una amenaza para los Dúnedain",objectivesES={"Esteldín está en las Quebradas del Norte, una tierra al noroeste del Bosque de los Trolls.\
\
Narmeleth desea que viajes a Esteldín y adviertas a Halbarad sobre el espía.","Habla con Halbarad en Esteldín","Libro 15, capítulo 2: Una amenaza para los Dúnedain","Narmeleth ha abandonado sus caminos malvados y ha ofrecido su conocimiento para ayudar a los Pueblos Libres."}},
[2017]={nameES="Libro 15, Capítulo 3: La carga de la prueba",objectivesES={"Halbarad está en Esteldín, en las Quebradas del Norte.\
\
Vuelve a hablar con Halbarad para informarle de que uno de los refugiados ha desaparecido.","Debes ayudar a demostrar que Narmeleth dice la verdad interrogando a los refugiados de Angmar.","Los refugiados están fuera de la biblioteca, cerca de la sala de artesanía, viendo a los montaraces entrenar, y junto al maestro de establos en Esteldín.\
\
Halbarad no está convencido de las intenciones de Narmeleth, pero te ha permitido interrogar a los refugiados de Angmar.","Libro 15, Capítulo 3: La carga de la prueba","Habla con Halbarad en Esteldín","Alis ha desaparecido"}},
[2018]={nameES="Libro 15, Capítulo 4: El destino de Esteldín",objectivesES={"Encuentra a la refugiada desaparecida","Libro 15, Capítulo 4: El destino de Esteldín","Halbarad te ha pedido que busques a la refugiada desaparecida y la lleves de vuelta a Esteldín.","La refugiada puede encontrarse en el paso más al este entre las Quebradas del Norte y Angmar.\
\
Halbarad te ha pedido que busques señales de la presencia de la refugiada desaparecida.","Espía refugiada derrotada","Halbarad está en Esteldín, en las Quebradas del Norte.\
\
Deberías volver a Halbarad e informarle que la refugiada era una espía.","Habla con Halbarad en Esteldín"}},
[2019]={nameES="Libro 15, Capítulo 5: El Anillo de la Verdad",objectivesES={"Habla con Narmeleth en Delossad","La advertencia de Narmeleth sobre el espía resultó ser cierta y demostró sus buenas intenciones a Halbarad.","Narmeleth está en Delossad, en Tâl Bruinen.\
\
Halbarad te ha pedido que le des las gracias a Narmeleth por su ayuda para salvar a Esteldín.","Libro 15, Capítulo 5: El Anillo de la Verdad"}},
[2020]={nameES="Libro 15, Capítulo 6: Hija de la discordia",objectivesES={"Narmeleth permanece prisionera en Delossad, al sur del Bosque de los Trolls.\
\
Ve a hablar con Narmeleth para que te cuente su trágica historia.","Habla con Narmeleth en Delossad","Libro 15, Capítulo 6: Hija de la discordia","Delossad está en el Bosque de los Trolls, al suroeste de Rivendel.\
\
Narmeleth desea hablar contigo allí.","Escucha el relato de Narmeleth y experimenta 'Sesión: Hija de la discordia' o lee un relato abreviado","La verdad de la advertencia de Narmeleth le ha ganado cierta confianza.","Durante la Segunda Edad, el Señor Oscuro llegó a Eregion con una apariencia noble para seducir a los Elfos con la promesa de un conocimiento secreto. Cautivó a Narmeleth, alejándola de la protección de su padre Laerdan y del pueblo de Celebrimbor, y las semillas de su corrupción son sembradas..."}},
[2021]={nameES="Libro 15, Capítulo 7: El Concilio Final",objectivesES={"Glorfindel está en Rivendel, al sureste de la casa de Elrond.\
\
Narmeleth te ha pedido que hables con Glorfindel de su parte.","Habla con Glorfindel","Libro 15, Capítulo 7: El Concilio Final","Glorfindel está en Rivendel cerca de las cataratas de Imladris, al sureste de la casa de Elrond.\
\
Deberías volver y hablar con Glorfindel en Rivendel.","Acompaña a Glorfindel al Concilio Final","Narmeleth te contó la trágica historia de su caída y su transformación en Amarthiel, la Campeona de Angmar.","Acompañaste a Glorfindel al Concilio final"}},
[2022]={nameES="Libro 15, Capítulo 8: Solo lo justo",objectivesES={"Habla con Narmeleth en Delossad","Libro 15, Capítulo 8: Solo lo justo","Delossad se encuentra en el sur del Bosque de los Trolls, al suroeste de Rivendel.\
\
Narmeleth ha pedido hablar contigo de inmediato.","El concilio de Glorfindel decidió liberar a Narmeleth de su prisión y pedirle que ayudara a combatir a Mordirith."}},
[2023]={nameES="Libro 15, Capítulo 9: El regreso de una campeona",objectivesES={"Habla con Golodir en Gath Forthnír","Narmeleth está lista para comenzar su viaje a Angmar.","Gath Forthnír está en el norte de Angmar, al noreste de Imlad Balchorth.\
\
Narmeleth está lista para viajar a Gath Forthnír y hablar con Golodir.","Libro 15, Capítulo 9: El regreso de una campeona"}},
[2024]={nameES="Libro 2, Capítulo 10: Los criadores de los Muertos",objectivesES={"Los hombres demacrados residen probablemente en las ruinas, al este de Haragmar.\
\
Radagast te habló de los hombres demacrados, nigromantes al servicio de Sauron, responsables de la aparición de estos tumularios. Te pidió que derrotaras a los cantores de guerra y le trajeras sus sellos. Así podrá determinar a qué Señor Demacrado sirven.","Radagast está preocupado por la causa de la corrupción en los pantanos. Siente que los tumularios son un síntoma de un mal mayor.","Lleva los sellos a Radagast el Pardo en Ost Guruth","Libro 2, Capítulo 10: Los criadores de los Muertos"}},
[2025]={nameES="Libro 2, Capítulo 11: El Intérprete de Piedras",objectivesES={"Radagast quiere descubrir qué atrajo a una criatura como Ivar al Pantano Rojo. Cree que uno de los Eglain podría proporcionar información.","Libro 2, Capítulo 11: El Intérprete de Piedras","Aric se encuentra al sur de Ost Guruth, más allá de Talath Gaun, en Harloeg.\
\
Radagast habló de un hombre llamado Aric el Intérprete de Piedras... Este último podrá contarte la historia del Pantano Rojo.","Habla con Aric el Intérprete de Piedras en Harloeg"}},
[2026]={nameES="Libro 2, Capítulo 12: El desafío de un hombre muerto",objectivesES={"Libro 2, Capítulo 12: El desafío de un hombre muerto","Mientras investigabas el origen de los espectros del Pantano Rojo, Radagast te envió a un hombre llamado Aric el Intérprete de piedras. Aric insinuó que los muertos podrían tener las respuestas que buscas.","Habla con Emelin en Ost Haer","Habla con Emelin","Has vencido a los hombres de Emelin","Emelin acecha la zona llamada Ost Haer.\
\
Aric habló de una sombra llamada Emelin. Si demuestras tu valía ante la sombra, quizás te dé la información que buscas.","Emelin acecha la zona llamada Ost Haer.\
\
Emelin te ha encargado que derrotes las apariciones de sus guerreros muertos. Si lo consigues, te ayudará. Si fracasas, puedes perecer."}},
[2027]={nameES="Libro 2, Capítulo 13: En la Emprise del Señor demacrado",objectivesES={"Derrota a Brudhraw","Libro 2, Capítulo 13: En la Emprise del Señor demacrado","Los tumularios y su líder se encuentran al oeste de Ost Haer, en Nindor.\
\
Emelin te dijo que el Señor demacrado Ivar Manosangrienta reanima cuerpos para ser sus soldados. Debes eliminarlos a ellos y a su líder, un ser llamado Brudhraw.","Emelin te habló de su fracaso al proteger a una de las Doncellas del Río y de la maldición que él y sus hombres sufrieron como consecuencia. Aceptó ayudarte si cumplías una tarea para él.","Habla con Emelin en Ost Haer","Emelin está en Ost Haer, al norte.\
\
Has vencido al señor de los túmulos Brudhraw. Ahora deberías regresar junto a la sombra llamada Emelin.","Brudhraw derrotado"}},
[2028]={nameES="Libro 2, Capítulo 14: Historia de la Doncella Roja",objectivesES={"Radagast el Pardo está en la torre al final de la vía principal de Ost Guruth.\
\
Emelin te contó su triste historia y te instruyó para que regresaras junto a Radagast el Pardo.","Has derrotado al señor de los túmulos y has traído un atisbo de paz a Emelin y sus hombres, los guerreros caídos de Arthedain.","Habla con Radagast el Pardo en Ost Guruth","Libro 2, Capítulo 14: Historia de la Doncella Roja"}},
[2029]={nameES="Libro 2, Capítulo 15 (Solo): El Paso Rojo",objectivesES={"Radagast te ha dicho que miembros de los Eglain, liderados por Elsa y Eriac, han entrado en Agamaur, los pantanos del norte del Pantano Rojo.","Radagast el Pardo se encuentra en la torre al final de la avenida principal de Ost Guruth.\
\
Radagast el Pardo espera para llevarte al paso hacia Agamaur. Cuando estés preparado para partir, vuelve a hablar con Radagast.","Habla con Elsa en Agamaur","Elsa se encuentra en el campamento, dentro de las ruinas.\
\
Deberías hablar con Elsa sobre tu victoria en Agamaur.","Habla con Radagast el Pardo en Agamaur","Libro 2, Capítulo 15 (Solo): El Paso Rojo","Los Eglain y las sombras de Arthedain han establecido un pequeño campamento en las ruinas. Elsa te espera para hablar contigo.\
\
Tu combate contra las aguas oscuras de Ivar ha sido una victoria, o eso parece. El Señor Demacrado se retiró hacia el norte, perseguido por Radagast el Pardo, y no ha sido visto desde entonces.","Habla con Radagast el Pardo en Ost Guruth"}},
[2030]={nameES="Libro 2, Capítulo 15: (Comunidad) El Paso Rojo",objectivesES={"Radagast te ha dicho que miembros de los Eglain, liderados por Elsa y Eriac, han entrado en Agamaur, los pantanos del norte del Pantano Rojo.","Radagast el Pardo se encuentra en la torre al final de la avenida principal de Ost Guruth.\
\
Radagast el Pardo espera para llevarte al paso hacia Agamaur. Cuando estés preparado para partir, vuelve a hablar con Radagast.","Habla con Elsa en Agamaur","Libro 2, Capítulo 15: (Comunidad) El Paso Rojo","Elsa se encuentra en el campamento, dentro de las ruinas.\
\
Deberías hablar con Elsa sobre tu victoria en Agamaur.","Habla con Radagast el Pardo en Agamaur","Los Eglain y las sombras de Arthedain han establecido un pequeño campamento en las ruinas. Elsa te espera para hablar contigo.\
\
Tu combate contra las aguas oscuras de Ivar ha sido una victoria, o eso parece. El Señor Demacrado se retiró hacia el norte, perseguido por Radagast el Pardo, y no ha sido visto desde entonces.","Habla con Radagast el Pardo en Ost Guruth"}},
[2031]={nameES="Libro 2, Capítulo 16: Agamaur asegurado",objectivesES={"Con la ayuda de las sombras de Arthedain, los Eglain resistieron las fuerzas de Ivar.","Lleva la carta de Elsa a Frideric el Anciano","Lleva el paquete de Elsa a Hana","Libro 2, Capítulo 16: Agamaur asegurado","Habla con Elsa la Valiente","El pasaje a Haragmar está al sur. Ost Guruth está al oeste de Haragmar.\
\
Elsa te dio una carta para entregar a Frideric solicitando suministros para su campamento. También te pidió que entregaras un paquete a su hermana, Hana. Ambos se encuentran en Ost Guruth.","Frideric está en el patio de Ost Guruth.\
\
Hana se alegró de recibir el paquete de Elsa y de saber que ella está cuidando de ella y de todos los Eglain.","Recogida de la carta y el paquete de Elsa","Elsa está en el campamento de Agamaur.\
\
Radagast te agradeció por tu ayuda y te pidió que hablaras con la mujer Eglain llamada Elsa."}},
[2032]={nameES="Libro 2, Capítulo 1: Nuevos Residentes",objectivesES={"Bósi se encuentra en la Cámara de la Encrucijada, en la entrada sur del Camino de Durin, al norte de la Gran Excavación.\
\
Has derrotado a muchos de los gredbyg en la Gran Excavación, ayudando a que el área sea más segura para los enanos de Bósi.","Bósi ha establecido su centro de mando en la Cámara de la Encrucijada, una sala de guardia que alguna vez se utilizó para vigilar tres pasajes que conducen más profundamente en Moria.","Libro 2, Capítulo 1: Nuevos Residentes","Los gredbyg se pueden encontrar por toda la Gran Excavación, al sur y al oeste de la Cámara de la Encrucijada.\
\
Bósi te ha pedido que elimines a los feroces gredbyg dentro de la Gran Excavación. Estos insectos representan una amenaza para la seguridad de los enanos."}},
[2033]={nameES="Libro 2, Capítulo 1: El levantamiento de los orcos",objectivesES={"Libro 2, Capítulo 1: El levantamiento de los orcos","Candaith, el Montaraz que vigila el Gran Camino del Este mientras atraviesa las Tierras Solitarias, se ha enterado de la presencia de orcos en las Colinas de los Vientos.","Los orcos de la Mano Blanca infestan las Colinas de los Vientos, al oeste del campamento de Candaith.\
\
El Montaraz Candaith te ha ofrecido su ayuda para encontrar a Radagast el Pardo a cambio de que le ayudes contra los orcos de las Colinas de los Vientos.","Candaith está en su campamento, al pie de la Cima de los Vientos, en las Colinas de los Vientos.\
\
Mientras luchabas contra los orcos, Candaith comenzó su búsqueda de Radagast el Pardo.","Habla con Candaith en su campamento"}},
[2034]={nameES="Libro 2, Capítulo 1: Algo Acecha en Tharbad",objectivesES={"Egfrith sugirió que te encargues de los orcos en las hogueras al oeste, al otro lado del puente roto, para que los tres puedan planear vuestro paso por la ciudad ocupada y más allá.","Ayuda al hombre que combate con los orcos al oeste","Meneldir y Egfrith descansan en la ribera norte del Gwathló.","Habla con Egfrith en la ribera norte del Gwathló","El hombre ha vencido a los orcos, pero te observa con cautela cuando te acercas","Habla con Meneldir en la ribera norte del Gwathló","El desconocido te observa con cautela.","Egfrith se sobresalta de pronto","Tus compañeros han oído orcos merodeando por las ruinas de Tharbad, lo que podría significar problemas para los habitantes del Antiguo Cardolan y de las Tierras de Bree al norte.","La ropa de viaje que viste el hombre no puede ocultar que es un guerrero experimentado. Los cuerpos de los orcos a sus pies también lo dejan claro.","Libro 2, Capítulo 1: Algo Acecha en Tharbad","Un hombre lucha con orcos al oeste del puente roto en Tharbad. ¡Podría necesitar tu ayuda!","La luz brilla sobre las armas de un hombre que lucha más al oeste","Explora las hogueras al oeste del puente roto en Tharbad","Habla con el desconocido que mata orcos en Tharbad","Los orcos merodean las ruinas de Tharbad y deben ser enfrentados por cualquier persona decidida que los encuentre."}},
[2035]={nameES="Book 2, Chapter 1: The Ships of Gondor",objectivesES={"Noreth is the captain of the Rosigil, the easternmost of the ships docked at the wharf at Dol Amroth.\
\
You have done as Captain Noreth asked, and should now speak with her about what you saw.","The deck of the Alphroval, northernmost of the ships docked at the wharf in Dol Amroth, will give you a good vantage from which to look at the Sea-gate.\
\
Captain Maeral wants you to look at the Sea-gate from where you stand on the deck of his ship.","Noreth wants you to stand on the deck of her ship and <rgb=#FF0000>look</rgb> through the Sea-gate","Noreth is the captain of the Rosigil, the easternmost of the ships docked at the wharf at Dol Amroth.\
\
Lothíriel has asked you to visit the captains at the wharf, in order to assess the sea-worthiness and battle-readiness of their ships.","You see the gathered Corsair fleet beyond the Sea-gate","Lothíriel knows that further battles approach, and she wants you to judge the sea-power currently at her disposal in Dol Amroth.","Maeral is the captain of the Alphroval, the northernmost of the ships docked at the wharf at Dol Amroth.\
\
Lothíriel has asked you to visit the captains at the wharf, in order to assess the sea-worthiness and battle-readiness of their ships.","You see an enormous ship, larger than the rest. It must be the flagship of Umbar","Talk to Captain Noreth of the Rosigil, the easternmost ship docked at the wharf","The deck of the Rosigil, easternmost of the ships docked at the wharf in Dol Amroth, will give you a good vantage from which to look through the Sea-gate, there to see whatever it is that Captain Noreth wants you to see.\
\
Captain Noreth wants you to look through the Sea-gate from where you stand on the deck of her ship.","Book 2, Chapter 1: The Ships of Gondor","Talk to Captain Maeral of the Alphroval, the northernmost ship docked at the wharf","Maeral is the captain of the Alphroval, the northernmost of the ships docked at the wharf at Dol Amroth.\
\
You have done as Captain Maeral asked, and should now speak with him about what you saw.","Cirnaith is the captain of the Súlrohir, the southernmost of the ships docked at the wharf at Dol Amroth.\
\
Lothíriel has asked you to visit the captains at the wharf, in order to assess the sea-worthiness and battle-readiness of their ships.","Talk to Captain Cirnaith of the Súlrohir, the southernmost ship docked at the wharf","<rgb=#FF0000>Look</rgb> at the Sea-gate from the deck of the Alphroval"}},
[2036]={nameES="Libro 2, Capítulo 2: Un mensajero orco",objectivesES={"En su búsqueda de señales de Radagast, Candaith siguió a un mensajero que salía del campamento orco en el Paso de Moscagua, pero no pudo averiguar qué mensaje llevaba el orco antes de que su cacería se interrumpiera por los crebain alados.","El mensajero orco se encuentra sin duda en uno de los campamentos enemigos de Glumhallow, al oeste del campamento de Candaith, al pie de la Cima de los Vientos.\
\
Un mensajero orco partió desde el Paso de Moscagua hacia los campamentos orcos dispersos por las Colinas de los Vientos. Candaith te pidió que interceptaras al mensajero orco y que volvieras con sus órdenes.","Recoge las órdenes de los orcos","Lleva las órdenes de los orcos a Candaith","Libro 2, Capítulo 2: Un mensajero orco","Órdenes de los orcos recogidas"}},
[2037]={nameES="Libro 2, Capítulo 2: Boromir, Hijo de Gondor",objectivesES={"Boromir está al noreste, en Tharbad, evaluando la situación y planificando sus próximos pasos.","Has recuperado el fardo robado y debes devolvérselo a Boromir","Boromir, Capitán de Gondor, ha solicitado tu ayuda para enfrentarse a las dificultades que encontró en Tharbad.","En su prisa por escapar, el ladrón orco intentó vaciar parte del contenido del fardo robado, que ahora está esparcido al oeste de la posición de Boromir en Tharbad.","Devuelve el fardo robado a Boromir al noreste","Habla con Meneldir en la ribera norte del Gwathló","Libro 2, Capítulo 2: Boromir, Hijo de Gondor","El ladrón orco que huyó con el fardo de Boromir probablemente esté al suroeste de su posición en Tharbad.","Recupera el fardo de Boromir del ladrón orco en algún punto al suroeste","Lleva las provisiones dispersas a Boromir en su posición en Tharbad, al este","Boromir ha accedido a volver contigo para conocer a tus compañeros mientras decide su próximo paso.","Regresa con Meneldir y Egfrith a la ribera norte del Gwathló","Boromir está al este, en Tharbad, evaluando la situación y planificando sus próximos pasos.","Meneldir se pone de pie de un salto cuando tú y Boromir se acercan","Meneldir mira a Boromir con sospecha, entornando los ojos."}},
[2038]={nameES="Book 2, Chapter 2: Two Messengers",objectivesES={"Return to the Súlrohir and study the situation","Talk to Lothíriel in the Great Hall","Lothíriel is in the Great Hall of Dol Amroth.\
\
You have a message for Lothíriel from an emissary of Umbar, asking her to treat with his master on the deck of the flagship Night-jewel.","The ships docked at Dol Amroth are trapped at the wharf by the Umbar fleet, unable to leave.","Umer, an emissary of Umbar, has passed through the Sea-gate under a flag of peace. He wishes to speak with you on the docks on the eastern side of Dol Amroth.","You have sent the crew of the Súlrohir back to their ship, and should now return to the wharf on the eastern side of Dol Amroth and see if the situation has changed.\
\
There has been a commotion on the jetty that points north-east into the water. You should investigate and learn what has happened.","The crew of the Súlrohir are making as much merriment as they can in the Harper's Court on the west side of the city of Dol Amroth.\
\
Captain Cirnaith, fearing embarrassment, wants you to recall his crew to the Súlrohir.","Talk to Umer, the Emissary of Umbar","Book 2, Chapter 2: Two Messengers"}},
[2039]={nameES="Libro 2, Capítulo 3: Muy Lejos de Gondor",objectivesES={"Libro 2, Capítulo 3: Muy Lejos de Gondor","Boromir descansa en la ribera norte del Gwathló, relatando su viaje a ti y a tus compañeros.","Habla con Boromir en la ribera norte del Gwathló.","Meneldir desconfía un poco del Capitán de Gondor y le ha pedido oír la historia de su viaje hacia el norte, y la razón de él.","Habla con Boromir y escucha el relato de su viaje.","Meneldir ha pedido al Capitán de Gondor que relate la historia de su viaje hacia el norte, y Boromir parece dispuesto a contarla."}},
[2040]={nameES="Book 2, Chapter 3: Balakhôr the Scourge",objectivesES={"Lothíriel listens impassively as you give her the message from the emissary of Umbar.\
\
'Thank you for bringing this message to me. Something must be done, that much is certain! But what, I wonder?'","Talk to Tologlor in Ethring","The town of Ethring is in the Ringló Vale, on the road to Pelargir.\
\
Lothíriel has asked you to travel through the Ringló Vale and Dor-en-Ernil to help the folk of those lands and bring warning to the people of Pelargir.","Talk to Noreth on the docks","Book 2, Chapter 3: Balakhôr the Scourge","The skies over Ethring are covered in shadow","Lothíriel is in the Great Hall of Dol Amroth.\
\
Balakhôr the Scourge has boasted of his plan to you, and now that you know his course you should bring word of it to Lothíriel.","You were cast from the deck of the Night-jewel, and have managed to struggle back to the dock.\
\
Captain Noreth has fished you from the water, and wants to hear what happened on the Night-jewel.","Talk to Lothíriel and help her decide what to do about Balakhôr's proposal","Tologlor in the town of Ethring has tried to catch your eye. His expression is one of frightened concern.","Lothíriel needs your help to decide what should be done.\
\
Lothíriel is in the Great Hall of Dol Amroth, considering Balakhôr's proposal.","Travel to the town of Ethring, in the Ringló Vale","Talk to Lothíriel in the Great Hall of Dol Amroth","Balakhôr the Scourge has sent an emissary to Dol Amroth to request that Lothíriel come to treat with him on the deck of his flagship, the Night-jewel."}},
[2041]={nameES="Libro 2, Capítulo 3: Maestro de guerra Uzorr",objectivesES={"Maestro de guerra Uzorr derrotado","Derrota al maestro de guerra Uzorr","Órdenes del maestro de guerra Uzorr obtenidas","Libro 2, Capítulo 3: Maestro de guerra Uzorr","Consigue las órdenes del maestro de guerra Uzorr","Lleva la carta orca a Candaith","Candaith está en su campamento, al pie de la Cima de los Vientos, en las Colinas de los Vientos.\
\
Has salido victorioso contra el maestro de guerra Uzorr y has obtenido una carta que seguramente contiene sus órdenes del poder que comanda a los orcos que se han aventurado en las Tierras Solitarias.","El maestro de guerra Uzorr se encuentra en la Grieta Desolada, al noroeste del campamento de Candaith, al pie de la Cima de los Vientos.\
\
Candaith te ha pedido que encuentres y mates al maestro de guerra Uzorr y que busques en el campamento una carta que contenga sus órdenes.","Candaith ha sabido de la existencia de un maestro de guerra entre los orcos llamado Uzorr. Su derrota sería un golpe fatal para ellos."}},
[2042]={nameES="Libro 2, Capítulo 4: Una luz en la oscuridad",objectivesES={"El campamento de Candaith está al pie de la Cima de los Vientos.\
\
Has encontrado una roca cubierta de runas y has hecho un calco de las marcas. Deberías volver a ver a Candaith, tal vez él sepa algo sobre el significado de estas runas.","La Cima de los Vientos se alza sobre el campamento de Candaith.\
\
Candaith te pidió que buscaras en la Cima de los Vientos algo fuera de lo común y que le trajeras cualquier noticia o prueba que pudieras encontrar.","Lleva el calco de roca a Candaith","Has tomado un calco de las runas en la roca y lo has guardado en tu mochila","Mientras Candaith regresaba de su viaje por las tierras del este, vio destellos de luz blanca en la cumbre de la Cima de los Vientos, como relámpagos, aunque no había tormenta.","Libro 2, Capítulo 4: Una luz en la oscuridad","Busca en la cima de la Cima de los Vientos algo inusual"}},
[2043]={nameES="Book 2, Chapter 4: The Dawnless Day",objectivesES={"Dark shadows cover the skies of the Ringló Vale, and the people of Ethring fear what it might mean.","The torch illuminates the surrounding area","The torch sputters to life","Tologlor is at the entrance of the town of Ethring, waiting for you to return with news of your successes against the Orcs. He also awaits delivery of any suitable tinder you have found.","The light of the torch blazes against the darkness","The light of the torch keeps the darkness at bay","Bring suitable tinder to Tologlor at the entrance to Ethring","Book 2, Chapter 4: The Dawnless Day","Talk to Tologlor at the entrance to Ethring","Tologlor is at the entrance to the town of Ethring, in the Ringló Vale.\
\
You have lit some of the torches throughout Ethring, trying to drive back the darkness that overpowers the Vale and its people.","Standing torches can be found throughout Ethring. You should relight any of them that have gone out.","Orcs can be found to the north-east of Ethring, in the Ringló Vale. Suitable tinder can also be found to the north-east.\
\
Tologlor has asked you to defeat Orcs made bold by the continuing night that blankets the Ringló Vale, and to gather suitable tinder to light the town's torches."}},
[2044]={nameES="Libro 2, Capítulo 4: Las Palabras de Bregoleth",objectivesES={"Meneldir ha pedido hablar contigo a cierta distancia de los demás, justo al noreste del campamento.","Meneldir no está del todo convencido de que Boromir sea de fiar: ¿deberíais viajar juntos los cuatro desde Tharbad?","Meneldir desea hablar contigo sobre sus inquietudes acerca de Boromir, el Capitán de Gondor.","Encuentra una brecha en el muro exterior de Tharbad más hacia el oeste","Muestra el mapa a Boromir en el campamento","Hacia el noroeste ves actividad entre edificios alejados de Tharbad","Meneldir y los demás planearon reunirse contigo en el camino al norte de Tharbad.","Habla con Meneldir en el campamento","Meneldir aprieta en tus manos un mapa viejo y descolorido del Antiguo Cardolan","Reúnete con Meneldir a poca distancia de los demás, hacia el noreste","Muestra el mapa a Egfrith en el campamento","Boromir permanece en la fogata cerca de la ribera norte del Gwathló.\
\
Meneldir te entregó un mapa gastado del Antiguo Cardolan para mostrárselo a Boromir y a Egfrith.","Boromir, con su relato concluido, estudia los rostros de tus compañeros. Meneldir le devuelve la mirada con estoicismo.","Libro 2, Capítulo 4: Las Palabras de Bregoleth","Habla con Meneldir en el camino justo al norte de Tharbad","Egfrith permanece en la fogata cerca de la ribera norte del Gwathló.\
\
Meneldir te dio un mapa gastado del Antiguo Cardolan para mostrárselo a Boromir y a Egfrith.","Las colinas onduladas de Páramo Rojizo podrían ocultar cualquier cantidad de peligros","<rgb=#00FF00>Mira</rgb> hacia la campiña circundante","Meneldir sugirió que explores la campiña fuera de Tharbad desde diversos lugares dentro de la ciudad, derrotando a los enemigos que encuentres allí, para asegurar tu paso por la ciudad inundada.","Encuentra una brecha en el muro exterior de Tharbad al noroeste","Meneldir ha regresado al campamento.","Esta brecha en el muro debería proporcionar una buena vista de la campiña","Habla con Meneldir","Habla con Meneldir hacia el noreste, lejos de tus otros compañeros"}},
[2045]={nameES="Libro 2, Capítulo 5 (Comunidad): Recuperar la Cima de los Vientos",objectivesES={"Mientras escalabas la Cima de los Vientos, Candaith trabajó arduamente para traducir la carta que recuperaste de la Grieta Desolada. Su traducción está completa y las noticias que descubrió son graves.","Candaith está en su campamento al pie de la Cima de los Vientos.\
\
Candaith te espera para hablar sobre los extraños eventos que ocurrieron en la cima de Amon Sûl.","Habla con Candaith","Libro 2, Capítulo 5 (Comunidad): Recuperar la Cima de los Vientos","Candaith está en su campamento al pie de la Cima de los Vientos.\
\
El montaraz Candaith te pidió que lo ayudaras a expulsar una compañía de Orcos de la Cima de los Vientos. Te dijo que reuniera aliados y regresaras a él cuando estuvieras preparado.","Habla con Candaith y recupera la Cima de los Vientos con una comunidad"}},
[2046]={nameES="Libro 2, Capítulo 5 (Solo): Recuperar la Cima de los Vientos",objectivesES={"Mientras escalabas la Cima de los Vientos, Candaith trabajó arduamente para traducir la carta que recuperaste de la Grieta Desolada. Su traducción está completa y las noticias que descubrió son graves.","Libro 2, Capítulo 5 (Solo): Recuperar la Cima de los Vientos","Habla con Candaith","Candaith está en su campamento al pie de la Cima de los Vientos.\
\
Candaith te espera para hablar sobre los extraños eventos que ocurrieron en la cima de Amon Sûl.","Habla con Candaith y recupera la Cima de los Vientos","Candaith está en su campamento al pie de la Cima de los Vientos.\
\
El Montaraz Candaith te pidió que lo ayudaras a expulsar a una compañía de orcos de la Cima de los Vientos."}},
[2047]={nameES="Book 2, Chapter 5: Beset By Foes",objectivesES={"Search the Corsair camp to the north-east of Linhir for Roniel","Ingalad has told you of a lighthouse to the south-west, from which you might get a good view of the progress of the Corsair fleet. He also wishes for you to defeat the Corsairs and Haradrim that plague Dor-en-Ernil.","The yellow-haired doll has seen better days. Did Roniel drop her here?","If Roniel did flee Linhir to the north-east, and dropped her doll as she passed the Corsair camp, she may have continued in that direction. You should continue your search to the north-east.","Collect ragged doll from the Corsair camp","Talk to Roamingstar by the Gilrain","A ragged doll in the Corsair camp north-east of Linhir has caught your attention","Roniel is not here, but a ragged doll catches your eye. Did it belong to her?","You tell Ingalad that his brother asked you to check on him.\
\
'I am doing as well as I can under the shadow of this oppressive night, but that is not the only worry occupying my mind. We are beset by foes on all sides, and they press us most cruelly. Corsairs harry our coast, and the Haradrim they bring on their ships disembark and burn our fields.\
\
'If you seek to learn the progress of the Corsair fleet, there is a lighthouse to the south-west that would provide a good vantage point. The way will be thick with Corsairs and Haradrim, and perhaps your efforts against them will ease our burden somewhat.'","Ingalad is in the town of Linhir.\
\
You have scouted the progress of the Corsair fleet and defeated many of the foes that plague Dor-en-Ernil.","Ingalad is somewhere within the town of Linhir, in Dor-en-Ernil.\
\
Tologlor of Ethring has asked you to check on his brother Ingalad in the town of Linhir.","A beautiful woman stands by the river, keeping watch on the sleeping Roniel. You should learn what you can about this woman.","Tologlor has asked you to check on his brother Ingalad in the town of Linhir, to the south of Ethring in Dor-en-Ernil.\
\
Tologlor is worried for his brother, who lives in the town of Linhir.","Find Barad Rill, the lighthouse in Dor-en-Ernil, to the south-west of Linhir","Book 2, Chapter 5: Beset By Foes","The darkness that covers the Ringló Vale flowed out of the south-east. What evil has the shadow wrought in Dor-en-Ernil?","You have found the town of Linhir, which straddles the River Gilrain","Ingalad believes that Roniel may have fallen prey to Corsairs at a camp to the north-east, and wants you to search for the child.","A girl sleeps by the banks of the river. You have found Roniel.","Travel to the town of Linhir, in Dor-en-Ernil","Talk to Ingalad in Linhir","The lighthouse has been toppled. Beyond, the Corsair fleet continues on its course","Continue searching north-east of the Corsair camp for Roniel"}},
[2048]={nameES="Libro 2, Capítulo 5: La Posada de la Encrucijada",objectivesES={"El aire está silencioso, el viento quieto. ¿Dónde están los guardias?","Boromir está dentro de la Posada de la Encrucijada.","Maddoc te da una jarra de cerveza con un fuerte aroma a canela","Habla con Boromir dentro de la Posada de la Encrucijada","Aberthol te observa con nerviosismo","Entra en la Posada de la Encrucijada, la taberna de Herne, en busca de respuestas","Maddoc te indica cómo encontrar la casa de Aberthol en la parte norte de Herne","Libro 2, Capítulo 5: La Posada de la Encrucijada","Habla con Aberthol dentro de su casa","Meneldir está dentro de la Posada de la Encrucijada.","La Posada de la Encrucijada, la posada en el cruce de caminos, está cerca del camino del sur que pasa por Herne.\
\
Algo ocurrió en Herne que ha alterado a sus habitantes. Quizá las respuestas estén dentro de la Posada de la Encrucijada, la posada en el cruce.","Coloca la jarra de cerveza especiada sobre la mesa de Aberthol","Aberthol está dentro de su casa, observándote a ti, a tus compañeros y a la jarra de cerveza especiada que le trajiste.","El interior de la posada está oscuro y silencioso","Llamas a Boromir y a Egfrith para que se unan a ti","Aberthol vive en la parte norte de Herne.\
\
Maddoc te contó que algo le ocurrió a Aberthol hace cuatro noches, y el anciano podría hablarte si le sueltas la lengua con una jarra de su cerveza especiada favorita.","Una jarra de cerveza especiada, puesta en su mesa, podría alentarlo a contar lo que le ocurrió.","Aberthol, al parecer sobrecogido por sus visitantes, ahora está dispuesto a contarte su historia.","Presenta a Boromir ante Aberthol","Habla con Aberthol dentro de su casa en la parte norte de Herne","El hombre te mira con ojos recelosos y se apresura a entrar en su hogar","Encuentra la entrada sureste de la aldea de Herne, junto al camino al noroeste de Tharbad","Maddoc se aclara la garganta","Habla con el aldeano cercano","Aberthol sonríe. 'Eso es distinto', dice","Maddoc, el posadero de la Posada de la Encrucijada, está detrás del mostrador.","Aberthol espera que lo presentes a tus compañeros.","La aldea de Herne se encuentra en el cruce de caminos al noroeste de Tharbad, y la posada allí es un destino popular para viajeros del Viejo Camino del Sur.","Habla con Maddoc dentro de la Posada de la Encrucijada","Herne se encuentra al noroeste de Tharbad, a lo largo del Viejo Camino del Sur.\
\
Meneldir te dijo que cuando vino por aquí por última vez, la posada en el cruce de caminos era un agradable refugio para viajeros, y debería seguir siéndolo.","Algo no va bien en la aldea de Herne.\
\
Quizá uno de los habitantes pueda explicar lo ocurrido.","Presenta a Egfrith ante Aberthol","Habla con la aldeana cercana","Como su vecina, la mujer te fulmina con la mirada y se apresura a entrar en su casa","Habla con Meneldir dentro de la Posada de la Encrucijada"}},
[2049]={nameES="Libro 2, Capítulo 6: Protegido por los Eglain",objectivesES={"Encuentra a un miembro de los Eglain y pregúntale por el paradero de Radagast el Pardo.\
\
Has trabajado mucho y arduamente para ganarte la confianza de los Eglain. Ahora debes preguntarles por el paradero de Radagast el Pardo.","Habla con Gadaric Mascador en La Posada Abandonada","Puedes montar el caballo de Candaith o dirigirte a pie a La Posada Abandonada, en el borde de la Pantano de Moscagua y las Tierras Solitarias, a lo largo del Gran Camino del Este.\
\
Candaith te agradeció tu ayuda y advirtió que los Eglain deben entender que tus intenciones son justas antes de permitirte una audiencia con Radagast el Pardo.","Libro 2, Capítulo 6: Protegido por los Eglain","Encuentra y habla con un miembro de los Eglain en La Posada Abandonada o en su campamento en Nain Enidh","La investigación de Candaith sobre el paradero de Radagast el Pardo lo llevó al descubrimiento de que está bajo la protección de los Eglain. Ha hablado bien de ti a uno de sus miembros, Gadaric Mascador, pero advirtió que no revelarían la ubicación del Sabio de Pardo sin la seguridad de que tus intenciones son buenas."}},
[2050]={nameES="Book 2, Chapter 6: Roamingstar",objectivesES={"Book 2, Chapter 6: Roamingstar","Roniel has awoken, and you should speak to her and ensure that she is all right.","Roniel stirs. She is nearly awake.","Flat stones can be found at several locations to the west of the Gilrain, in Dor-en-Ernil, south-east of Roamingstar.\
\
Roamingstar has given you a number of pebbles to leave on flat stones west of the Gilrain, south of her waterfall glade.","Roamingstar feels a connexion to the lands through which the Gilrain flows, and has asked you to protect them.","Roamingstar is waiting for you to return from the errand on which she sent you.","Roniel's mother Mornil is back in the town of Linhir, in Dor-en-Ernil. She is by the fountain in the north-east court of Linhir.\
\
You have found the missing child and sent her back to her mother.","Talk to Roamingstar by the banks of Gilrain","Talk to Roniel on the banks of the Gilrain","Roamingstar is silent, lost in her thoughts.","Roniel has returned to Linhir, but her mother Mornil does not believe her story.","Talk to Roniel in Linhir","Roniel says nothing, but the look on her face is smug and satisfied.","Talk to Mornil in Linhir","Roniel sets a small pebble on the edge of the fountain","You have returned Roniel safely to Linhir, and should tell Ingalad of your success.","Talk to Ingalad in Linhir"}},
[2051]={nameES="Libro 2, Capítulo 6: La Noche de la Espera",objectivesES={"Meneldir está dentro de la Posada de la Encrucijada.\
\
Debes regresar con Meneldir y contarle lo que aprendiste de Aberthol.","Meneldir sugirió que tú y tus compañeros cacéis animales en la Pradera de Juncos para obtener carne, recojáis leña para los braseros del pueblo y aviséis a la gente de Herne para que se refugie esta noche tras los seguros muros de la Posada de la Encrucijada.","Habla con Bledri dentro de su casa","Habla con Meneldir dentro de la Posada de la Encrucijada y espera a que caiga la noche","Habla con Meneldir fuera de la Posada de la Encrucijada","Los braseros se encuentran frente a la Posada de la Encrucijada en la villa de Herne, esperando que tú y tus compañeros los llenéis con leña.\
\
Meneldir espera mantener a raya los males que amenazan Herne manteniendo los braseros encendidos toda la noche.","Meneldir está dentro de la Posada de la Encrucijada.\
\
Los preparativos han concluido, y la noche se acerca.","Libro 2, Capítulo 6: La Noche de la Espera","Habla con Linnet junto a la fuente en la parte norte de Herne","Meneldir está dentro de la Posada de la Encrucijada, esperando oír sobre los preparativos del pueblo para la noche que se avecina.","Habla con Aldyth dentro de su casa","Aberthol te contó su encuentro con los jinetes oscuros que pasaron por Herne, y del miedo que desde entonces se cierne sobre el pueblo. ¿Puede hacerse algo para salvar Herne?","Meneldir está fuera de la Posada de la Encrucijada tras los sucesos de la larga noche.","Habla con Meneldir dentro de la Posada de la Encrucijada"}},
[2052]={nameES="Libro 2, Capítulo 7: Preguntas",objectivesES={"Meneldir cree que deberías limpiar la evidencia del ataque de los tumularios en Herne para ayudar a calmar los temores del pueblo.","Meneldir está fuera de la Posada de la Encrucijada en la aldea de Herne.","Con tu ayuda y la de tus compañeros, los aldeanos de Herne sobrevivieron la peligrosa noche.","Boromir está junto al sendero de tierra que lleva al sur hacia Minhiriath.","Habla con Meneldir fuera de la Posada de la Encrucijada en Herne","Lleva el equipo descartado a Meneldir en Herne","La escritura de Egfrith cubre la parte frontal del pergamino","Habla con Meneldir en el borde de Minhiriath","Meneldir está en la aldea de Herne, repasando una y otra vez los sucesos de la noche.","El brazo reptante cierra un puño furioso y deja de moverse","Meneldir está junto al sendero de tierra que lleva al sur hacia Minhiriath.","Egfrith te escribió una carta, confiándola a Aberthol.","Aberthol señala una hoja de pergamino boca abajo sobre su mesa","Habla con Boromir fuera de la Posada de la Encrucijada en Herne","El brazo caído de un tumulario, olvidado durante la batalla, ¡repta para atacar!","Habla con los aldeanos de Herne y averigua qué pasó con Egfrith","Da vuelta al pergamino que Egfrith dejó con Aberthol","Habla con Boromir en el borde de Minhiriath","Meneldir está en Herne, reflexionando profundamente sobre el ataque de los tumularios de la noche anterior.","Egfrith no parece estar dentro de la Posada de la Encrucijada","Libro 2, Capítulo 7: Preguntas","Es probable que Egfrith haya huido directamente hacia el sur para evitar el difícil vado de Tharbad.\
\
Tú y tus compañeros debéis intentar impedir que Egfrith escape mientras se dirige a Isengard y a su amo Saruman.","Meneldir no ha visto a Egfrith desde el ataque de los tumularios. ¿Quizás regresó a la posada?","Encuentra a Egfrith dentro de la Posada de la Encrucijada","Meneldir detiene vuestra persecución de Egfrith","Termina de limpiar tras el ataque de los tumularios","Egfrith dejó una nota para ti y tus compañeros. Está boca abajo sobre la mesa de Aberthol.","Boromir está en Herne, disgustado por los muertos que caminan y los sucesos de la noche anterior.","Egfrith está desaparecida. Quizá alguno de los aldeanos sepa adónde fue.","Lee las palabras de la carta de Egfrith","Alcanza a Egfrith al sur de Herne antes de que pueda escapar","Meneldir cree que deberías limpiar la evidencia del ataque de los tumularios en Herne para calmar las mentes y temores de los aldeanos."}},
[2053]={nameES="Libro 2, Capítulo 7: Radagast el Pardo",objectivesES={"Radagast el Pardo vive en reclusión en una torre de las ruinas de Ost Guruth, el lugar que los Eglain llaman hogar. Busca su consejo.\
\
Gadaric y Hunulf Mascador creen que tus intenciones son buenas y te han proporcionado la ubicación de su invitado más estimado.","Libro 2, Capítulo 7: Radagast el Pardo","Habla con Radagast el Pardo en su torre de Ost Guruth","Has ganado la confianza de los Eglain, y ellos te han confesado que Radagast el Pardo, otro miembro del orden de Gandalf, reside actualmente en una torre de Ost Guruth.","Habla con Radagast el Pardo"}},
[2054]={nameES="Book 2, Chapter 7: Thorongil's Visage",objectivesES={"You have found Thorongil, and he is, as you suspected, Aragorn, son of Arathorn","Talk to Ioron in Linhir","Find Thorongil outside Pelargir, in Lebennin","Ioron is south of Ingalad, in Linhir.\
\
The folk of Linhir are concerned for the safety of Ioron, who has been acting peculiarly for several hours.","The man Ioron believed to be Thorongil is in fact Aragorn, son of Arathorn.\
\
Ioron asked you to find Thorongil, great hero of Gondor, and you have found him outside Pelargir.","Bring Southron and Umbar badges to Aragorn outside Pelargir","The man Ioron believed to be Thorongil may be approaching the gates of Pelargir, in Lebennin.\
\
Ioron asked you to find Thorongil, great hero of Gondor.","Book 2, Chapter 7: Thorongil's Visage","Ingalad is very grateful for the help you have provided the people of Linhir, and hopes you can do the same for the folk at Pelargir.","Talk to Ioron, the dancing man in Linhir","Corsairs and Haradrim can be found throughout Lebennin.\
\
Ioron wants you to defeat Corsairs and Haradrim throughout Lebennin, bringing the badges of rank they carry to Thorongil outside Pelargir.","Ioron stops dancing, but his smile grows wider than ever","Ioron is south of Ingalad, in Linhir.\
\
You have spoken with Ioron and he insists that the winds of hope are on the rise. Has he truly gone mad, as the people of Linhir suppose?"}},
[2055]={nameES="Libro 2, Capítulo 8: Un Viaje en Soledad",objectivesES={"Meneldir accedió a reunirse contigo en la puerta norte de Herne, donde ambos continuaréis el viaje para encontrar a su amigo Narndir.","Habla con Meneldir en la puerta este de Herne.","Hiriente por la traición de una compañera, el Capitán de Gondor ha decidido continuar su viaje en soledad.","Meneldir está en el camino que conduce a Minhiriath, contemplando la decisión de Boromir.","Reúnete con Meneldir en la puerta este de Herne.","Meneldir se reunirá contigo en la puerta este de Herne, donde ambos continuaréis el viaje para encontrar a su amigo Narndir.","Habla con Meneldir junto al borde de Minhiriath.","Libro 2, Capítulo 8: Un Viaje en Soledad"}},
[2056]={nameES="Book 2, Chapter 8: The Battle of Pelargir",objectivesES={"Aragorn makes ready to lead his forces into the port city of Pelargir and reclaim it from the Corsairs of Umbar.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>To participate in the battle, open the Epic Battles Panel and select 'Retaking Pelargir' from the menu. After you successfully complete the battle, you will be returned to the location from which you entered it.</rgb>","Talk to Aragorn at his camp outside Pelargir","The Corsairs have taken the port city of Pelargir, and now the time has come to drive them into the sea!","Book 2, Chapter 8: The Battle of Pelargir","Aragorn is outside the city of Pelargir, and wishes to discuss the course of the battle with you.","Complete 'Retaking Pelargir' from the Epic Battles Panel"}},
[2057]={nameES="Libro 2, Capítulo 8: El Pantano Rojo",objectivesES={"Los merodeadores de pantano vagan por Haragmar, al este de Ost Guruth.\
\
Para entender qué causa la corrupción del pantano, Radagast necesita la musgo presente en los nidos de los merodeadores de pantano.","Una aura de corrupción llevó a Radagast el Pardo al Pantano Rojo. Necesita ayuda para descubrir la fuente de este mal.","Radagast espera en Ost Guruth, al oeste de Haragmar.\
\
Deberías regresar junto a Radagast el Pardo con la musgo que has encontrado.","Libro 2, Capítulo 8: El Pantano Rojo","Lleva el musgo de pantano a Radagast el Pardo"}},
[2058]={nameES="Book 2, Chapter 9: Even In Darkness",objectivesES={}},
[2059]={nameES="Libro 2, Capítulo 9: Los muertos hinchados",objectivesES={"Los tumularios se encuentran más adentro de Haragmar, la parte sur del Pantano Rojo, al este de Ost Guruth.\
\
Radagast te envió de regreso al pantano para derrotar a los tumularios que están ensuciando la tierra con su maldad.","Radagast el Pardo espera en la torre al norte del camino principal de Ost Guruth.\
\
Deberías regresar junto a Radagast el Pardo con noticias de tu batalla contra los tumularios de Haragmar.","Has descubierto tumularios en Haragmar, la parte sur del Pantano Rojo, lo que alarma a Radagast el Pardo. Sospecha que las potencias de Angmar están involucradas.","Libro 2, Capítulo 9: Los muertos hinchados","Habla con Radagast el Pardo en Ost Guruth"}},
[2060]={nameES="Libro 2, Prólogo: A la ayuda de la Orden",objectivesES={"Habla con Candaith en su campamento de las Tierras Solitarias","Saeradan se encuentra en su cabaña al norte del Camino Verde, en las Tierras de Bree.\
\
Saeradan el Montaraz puede saber dónde deberías reunirte con Radagast el Pardo.","Habla con Saeradan en su cabaña del Camino Verde","Radagast el Pardo, junto con los Montaraces del Norte, se ha dirigido hacia el este, a las Tierras Solitarias, en busca del origen de un gran mal.","Libro 2, Prólogo: A la ayuda de la Orden","Candaith se encuentra en su campamento de las Tierras Solitarias.\
\
Saeradan no sabe dónde se dirigió Radagast cuando salió de la cabaña del Montaraz. Sospecha que Candaith, el Montaraz que vigila las Tierras Solitarias, podría tener información sobre el paradero del Mago."}},
[2061]={nameES="Libro 3, Capítulo 10: Espectro del Miedo Gris",objectivesES={"Halbarad y los Montaraces del Vado de Sarn solicitan tu ayuda para encontrar a sus camaradas desaparecidos y enfrentarse al servidor del Rey Brujo responsable de gran parte de los males que asolaron Cardolan en años pasados, y ahora de nuevo en el presente.","Habla con Halbarad y ve con él a registrar la fortaleza","Halbarad se encuentra en el campamento de Gorwen, al sur de Dol Ernil, lamentando la pérdida de Meneldir y la huida del Miedo Gris.","Halbarad se encuentra en el campamento de Gorwen, al sur de Dol Ernil, preparándose para registrar la fortaleza en busca tanto de su Montaraz desaparecido como de Meneldir.","Libro 3, Capítulo 10: Espectro del Miedo Gris","Habla con Halbarad en el campamento de Gorwen, al sur de Dol Ernil"}},
[2062]={nameES="Libro 3, Capítulo 11: La amistad de los Dúnedain",objectivesES={"Halbarad cree que brindarás gran ayuda a los Dúnedain a medida que te fortalezcas y continúes tus aventuras en las Tierras Solitarias o en las Quebradas del Norte.","Halbarad te indicó que te reunieras con otro de los Dúnedain, un montaraz llamado Candaith, que acampa cerca de la base de la Cima de los Vientos, en las Tierras Solitarias.","Libro 3, Capítulo 11: La amistad de los Dúnedain","Continúa tus aventuras en las Tierras Solitarias o en las Quebradas del Norte y alcanza el nivel 32.","Habla con Candaith en su campamento cerca de la base de la Cima de los Vientos."}},
[2063]={nameES="Libro 3, Capítulo 12: En un Valle del Norte",objectivesES={"Libro 3, Capítulo 12: En un Valle del Norte","Candaith tiene palabras de advertencia y consejo para ti antes de que partas en el último tramo de tu viaje.","Candaith te sugirió que partieras hacia Rivendel sin demora.","Habla con Candaith y parte hacia Rivendel sin demora.","Habla con Elrond en su biblioteca","Elrond se encuentra en la biblioteca de su hogar, en Imladris."}},
[2064]={nameES="Book 3, Chapter 1: A Need for Secrecy",objectivesES={"Haradrim fleeing in the direction of the town of Erynos, east and north of Aragorn's camp, must be defeated before they can bring word of his victory at Pelargir.\
\
Aragorn has asked you to find tracks left by terrified Haradrim near the town of Erynos.","Aragorn is at the Camp of the Grey Host, to the north-west of Pelargir.\
\
You have tracked down and defeated the Haradrim warriors that fled from Pelargir.","The sorcerer breathes his last, but his mocking smile remains","Find and defeat terrified Haradrim near Erynos (2/3)","You hear a woman's voice hailing you from the town of Erynos, to the north","As you study the tracks, you feel eyes upon you. Someone hides nearby!","Talk to the Haradrim Sorcerer near Erynos","The threat of the Corsairs is over, but Aragorn does not have any time to rest. He has another charge for you, one that must be completed with haste and with utmost secrecy.","Book 3, Chapter 1: A Need for Secrecy","Talk to Thurineth at the gate of Erynos","Thurineth has some news for you at the gate of Erynos.\
\
You defeated several of the Haradrim that fled from Pelargir, and a woman has hailed you from the gate of Erynos.","Thurineth saw a Haradrim sorcerer creeping around the outer wall of the town of Erynos, and wanted you to defeat him before you leave.","You hear a rustling in the brush. Someone watches you from nearby!","Talk to Aragorn at the Camp of the Grey Host"}},
[2065]={nameES="Libro 3, Capítulo 1: Un explorador demasiado entusiasta",objectivesES={"Encuentra a Rokur y préstale tu ayuda","Brogur está seguro de que el momento se acerca para que los enanos recuperen Moria, y no es el único: muchos enanos están haciendo excursiones peligrosas en túneles profundos.","Libro 3, Capítulo 1: Un explorador demasiado entusiasta","Encuentra a Útrygg y préstale tu ayuda","Rokur y Útrygg están explorando Zelem-melek. Partieron por el pasaje sur que sale de la Sala Vigesimoprimera, pero desde allí nadie sabe a dónde fueron.\
\
Brogur te ha pedido que prestes cualquier ayuda a los enanos Rokur o Útrygg si te encuentras con ellos mientras exploras Zelem-melek.","Brogur se encuentra dentro de la Cámara de Liderazgo en de la Sala Vigesimoprimera, en Zelem-melek.\
\
Has defendido a un enano demasiado entusiasta de ser derrotado por un explorador uruk, y ahora deberías hacer tu informe a Brogur.","Has defendido a Rokur del explorador uruk.","Has defendido a Útrygg del explorador uruk."}},
[2066]={nameES="Libro 3, Capítulo 1: Los Parientes de Meneldir",objectivesES={"Un furioso graznido señala la llegada de espías emplumados.","Meneldir te ha pedido que continúes hacia el norte por el Camino Verde en dirección a las Tierras de Bree.","El cuerpo de un Montaraz yace entre los matorrales.","Meneldir se detiene y mira alrededor, la preocupación marcando su ceño","Meneldir de pronto da un grito y corre hacia el noroeste","Meneldir se ha detenido en el Camino Verde.","Libro 3, Capítulo 1: Los Parientes de Meneldir","Meneldir te dijo que sentía ojos observando a los dos. ¿Espías?","Habla con Meneldir junto al cuerpo","Un cuerpo yace aquí entre los matorrales","Averigua lo que Meneldir ha descubierto","Habla con Meneldir en el Camino Verde","Busca en los alrededores con Meneldir","Meneldir está listo para continuar su viaje para encontrar a los Dúnedain en las Tierras de Bree.","Viaja al norte por el Camino Verde en dirección a las Tierras de Bree"}},
[2067]={nameES="Libro 3, Capítulo 1: El Montaraz de los Campos",objectivesES={"Libro 3, Capítulo 1: El Montaraz de los Campos","Según los informes que llegan del oeste y del sur de las Quebradas del Norte, Halbarad cree que el Enemigo avanza en muchos frentes. La fuerza de Esteldín está casi agotada y Halbarad piensa que debe convocarse un consejo de los Pueblos Libres. Antes de hacerlo, desea más información sobre los movimientos del Enemigo.","Mincham se encuentra en su campamento en el extremo sur de los Campos de Fornost.\
\
Halbarad te ha pedido que hables con Mincham para saber si el Enemigo ha retomado las ruinas de Fornost, la antigua capital de Arnor."}},
[2068]={nameES="Book 3, Chapter 1: Secrets of Zudrugund",objectivesES={"Book 3, Chapter 1: Secrets of Zudrugund","Nár is somewhere within Zudrugund.\
\
You have searched the book-shelves pointed out to you by Frithgeir, but have learned little that seems relevant to Nár's mysterious knowledge of the Grey Company's intentions.","(You found some torn pages, which seem to have undergone a great deal of use over the years. The words are very large, and every page has an illustration drawn in a fanciful style.)\
\
Kári was a little dwarf.\
Smaller than you or me.\
And wherever Kári went\
He took his axe... or three.\
\
One axe for his left hand.\
One axe for his right.\
One axe to carve the roast\
He ate most every night.\
\
Now one day the Orcs did call.\
They came right up to the gate.\
'Come on out!' they said,\
'We'll have a feast! Don't be late!'\
\
The dwarves knew what that meant.\
They knew it very well.\
If they went to see the Orcs\
They'd not hear the dinner bell.\
\
Do you know what Kári said?\
He said it loud and clear.\
'I will go to see the Orcs,\
And give them things to fear!'\
\
'But you're so little!' said the dwarves.\
They told him not to go.\
But Kári went; he would not stop\
'Till he faced the Orcs below.\
\
The Orcs laughed, 'What can you do?\
Just hold still, we'll get the skewers.'\
They turned their backs, and that was that!\
So we call him Kári Orc-hewer.","Candaith is at a camp-site of the Grey Company in a grove of trees east of the Dunlending village of Lhanuch, in Nan Laeglin.\
\
Corunir has sent you to speak with Candaith to see if he has thought of a reason for Nár to have mentioned the Paths of the Dead.","(You found a parchment, yellowed and old, tucked away between the covers of a thin book and apparently forgotten.)\
\
Hail, Thráin, King under the Mountain!\
\
Preparations for leaving the Coomb are well underway, and it will not be long before our people are ready to depart for the Blue Mountains. The great wheels in the depths will turn without them; I wonder for how long?\
\
I am writing this letter to express my concern about Nár. You know as well as anyone the things he has seen, and his service to your father cannot be questioned. He deserves much better than he has gotten. He seems not even to see me, these days, though I must endure the retelling of my own exploits two, four, or a dozen years in the past. It makes me sad to think of it now, and his excitement in each recounting, the previous one forgotten, saddens me all the more.\
\
This is why I must ask your permission to remain, when the others go. Nár will not go to the Blue Mountains, and I wish to stay here to look out for him. My son, too, wishes to stay; he is young, and knows nothing of our real home; this to him is no exile, but the Blue Mountains would be. I do not want to deprive Frithgeir of the only home he has known.\
\
I will do whatever you command, of course. But this is my desire, if it be your wish to grant it.\
\
Hervin Drake-slayer","Frithgeir has pointed out book-shelves in Zudrugund where Nár has spent time recently, at the shelves south-east of Frithgeir, surrounding an illuminated statue.\
\
You should investigate book-shelves where Nár has shown recent interest, hoping it will prove instructive.","Nár nods in your direction, and a wide smile creases his old face.\
\
'You have brought the gem-stones? Good, good! These will do very nicely!'\
\
He seems not to realize that you have brought no gem-stones. This is going about as well as you expected.","Corunir is in Zudrugund, the dwarf-hall in Thrór's Coomb.\
\
You have spoken to Nár about what you found in the book-shelves you were pointed to by Frithgeir, but have learned little of use. You should report of your efforts to Corunir.","A serious complication has arisen in regard to the quest of the Grey Company: how does the dwarf Nár have knowledge of its potential road?","(A slim book, 'Herbs and Plant-life of the Coomb,' is resting atop several others, as if it had been recently removed and carelessly returned to a shelf.)\
\
It is my hope that these musings on the great variety of plant-life found within the Coomb will be of help to those who, by want or need, find themselves uncertain of a herb's utility or a vegetable's properties. It is clear that such knowledge is fading in my people; Thrór has commanded the opening of a new wing in the mines beneath Zudrugund, but my own studies have been, of a necessity, self-directed. I do not complain! The gems they have taken from the old wing stir my heart as much as they do any of my fellows; but there is as much to be learned from the green as there is from the stone.\
\
But I ramble, as I often do when called upon to defend my interest!\
\
(This is followed by several pages of notes on various plants that grow on the slopes of Thrór's Coomb. One of the pages has been turned sideways and ear-marked, and catches your eye.)\
\
This next herb is easily found throughout the Coomb; simply follow your nose, and on a day of calm weather, its sweet smell will guide you most easily to patches of Hulwul-harâz growing on the grassy slopes. The name, in fact, means 'Sweet Warder,' and the Dunlendings with whom I have spoken believe the smell to drive away evil beings.\
\
When the herb is crushed and added to water containing the petals of the Nijam-mujdu and the fruit of the Kibil-luwz, steeping the solution for an hour produces a strange-smelling brew that I have noted for its ability to provide clarity of thought and heightened reasoning. It does seem that its effectiveness dulls with repeated use, and the brew should therefore not be over-used.","Frithgeir is in the library at Zudrugund.\
\
Corunir has asked you to speak with Frithgeir about Nár, in hopes that he can reveal the source of his friend's unexpected knowledge of the Grey Company's possible road."}},
[2069]={nameES="Book 3, Chapter 2: Grey Host, Black Sails",objectivesES={"Talk to Angbor at the Camp of the Grey Host","Aragorn is at the Camp of the Grey Host, waiting for your report on the preparations of the Corsair ships.","Aragorn has a plan: he wishes to sail up the river on the deck of the Corsair ships, coming to the aid of Minas Tirith to the surprise of its enemies.","Aragorn smiles in farewell","Book 3, Chapter 2: Grey Host, Black Sails","Talk to Aragorn at the Camp of the Grey Host","Angbor the Fearless is at the Camp of the Grey Host, waiting to speak with you.\
\
Aragorn is ready to depart for Minas Tirith on the Corsair ships, and has asked you to travel overland with Angbor and his men to learn the state of the war.","Aragorn has asked you to help the members of the Grey Company prepare to depart on the Corsair ships bound for Minas Tirith.\
\
<rgb=#00FF00>Rangers at the Camp of the Grey Host have begun to perform Aragorn's tasks. Help them with their 'Black Sails' quests to fulfill his wishes.</rgb>"}},
[2070]={nameES="Libro 3, Capítulo 2: El Cuerpo entre los Matorrales",objectivesES={"El cuerpo de un Montaraz muerto ha revelado que algo terrible ha sucedido a los Dúnedain en Cardolan.","El cuerpo de Narndir yace junto al camino en Cardolan. ¿Qué le ocurrió a este amigo de Meneldir?","Habla con Meneldir junto al cuerpo","El Montaraz Halbarad grita órdenes a los suyos en el Vado de Sarn.","Examina el cuerpo de Narndir","Es evidente que Narndir lleva muerto varios días. Sufrió varios cortes de espada en la espalda, y por las marcas en la tierra a su alrededor parece que fue arrollado por alguien a caballo mientras huía.","Meneldir está junto al cuerpo de su amigo caído, lleno de dolor, ira y confusión.","Viaja al Vado de Sarn y averigua qué ocurrió allí","Hay señales de una batalla reciente en el Vado de Sarn","Habla con Halbarad en el Vado de Sarn","Meneldir murmura unas palabras junto al cuerpo de su amigo, y tú tienes la cortesía de no escucharlas.","Libro 3, Capítulo 2: El Cuerpo entre los Matorrales"}},
[2071]={nameES="Libro 3, Capítulo 2: Las puertas de Fornost",objectivesES={"Mincham se encuentra en su campamento en el sur de los Campos de Fornost.\
\
El Montaraz Mincham necesitará escuchar tu informe sobre las defensas en las puertas de Fornost.","Mincham cree que el Enemigo ha regresado a Fornost, pero no puede determinar la fuerza de las tropas allí, ya que se acercaron a la ciudad desde el norte.","Libro 3, Capítulo 2: Las puertas de Fornost","Las Puertas de Norburgo se encuentran al norte del campamento de Mincham.\
\
Mincham cree que la única manera de determinar la fuerza de las tropas de Angmar en Fornost es probar las defensas levantadas en sus puertas. Te ha pedido que elimines orcos y huargos y le traigas un informe sobre la resistencia allí."}},
[2072]={nameES="Libro 3, Capítulo 3: Caída una vez más",objectivesES={"Libro 3, Capítulo 3: Caída una vez más","Halbarad se encuentra en Esteldín.\
\
Mincham te ruega que lleves la noticia de la presencia de Angmar en Fornost a Halbarad.","Después de informarle sobre tus batallas contra los orcos y huargos que guardan las puertas de Fornost, Mincham dedujo que era como Halbarad temía: Angmar ha enviado una gran fuerza para reclamar y fortificar Fornost."}},
[2073]={nameES="Book 3, Chapter 3: Fearless",objectivesES={"Find the Crossings of Erui, east of Tumladen","Talk to Angbor outside the entrance to the vale of Tumladen","Tumladen has become home to many displaced refugees","The road into Upper Lebennin passes through the port-city of Pelargir.\
\
Angbor has asked you to travel east into Upper Lebennin and to defeat many of the Haradrim there.","Find the entrance to the vale of Tumladen, in Upper Lebennin","Haradrim threaten to overrun the Crossings of Erui","Aragorn has given you an important mission: to travel by land the route he takes by ship, and come in that way to Minas Tirith to find Gandalf or Faramir.","Many refugees from elsewhere in Gondor can be found throughout the vale of Tumladen.","Angbor has come to the entrance to the vale of Tumladen.\
\
You have learned that folk have been evacuated from Minas Tirith, and the war is about to be joined. You should find Angbor and tell him what you have learned.","Angbor wants you to travel east of Tumladen to the Crossings of Erui, and to defeat the Haradrim camped there.","Talk to Angbor on the small hill west of the Crossings of Erui","The vale of Tumladen is in the northern reaches of Upper Lebennin.\
\
You have defeated many Haradrim in Upper Lebennin and should now find the vale of Tumladen.","Angbor keeps watch on a hill just to the west of the Crossings of Erui.","Book 3, Chapter 3: Fearless"}},
[2074]={nameES="Libro 3, Capítulo 3: Halbarad de los Dúnedain",objectivesES={"La corazonada de Meneldir era correcta. Ahora estará insufrible","Tú y Nethúr habéis salido victoriosos sobre los lobos","Habla con Nethúr al sureste del Vado de Sarn","Lleva los alijos de Montaraces que pidió Halbarad al Vado de Sarn","Libro 3, Capítulo 3: Halbarad de los Dúnedain","La corazonada de Meneldir resultó cierta: los jinetes negros dejaron un amuleto atrás, y probablemente atrajo a los tumularios al Vado de Sarn en los días posteriores al ataque.","Tus dedos cierran sobre algo en la tierra: un amuleto en forma de calavera hecho de hueso","Rebuscas en el montón de tierra pero solo encuentras lombrices","Habla con Meneldir en el Vado de Sarn","Meneldir está en el Vado de Sarn, donde ayuda a sus parientes a recuperarse del ataque reciente.","Lleva el amuleto en forma de calavera a Meneldir en el Vado de Sarn","Halbarad de los Dúnedain organiza la recuperación de los Montaraces encargados de defender el Vado de Sarn tras el ataque ocurrido hace algunos días.","Los Montaraces encargados de la defensa del Vado de Sarn pueden utilizar tu ayuda. Halbarad también pidió que recuperes algunos alijos de suministros cercanos, con los cuales los Dúnedain podrán reabastecer el Vado de Sarn.","La tierra ha sido removida en varios lugares cerca del Vado de Sarn, y Meneldir cree que deberías examinar algunos de esos montículos de tierra. Tiene la sospecha de que los jinetes negros dejaron algo atrás, como hicieron en Herne.","Tú y Galasebdir habéis triunfado sobre los tumularios","Busca la tierra removida alrededor del Vado de Sarn para confirmar la sospecha de Meneldir","Halbarad supervisa la recuperación de los Dúnedain tras el ataque de los jinetes negros en el Vado de Sarn.\
\
Has recuperado varios alijos de Montaraces y debes llevarlos a Halbarad.","Habla con Galasebdir al noreste del Vado de Sarn"}},
[2075]={nameES="Libro 3, Capítulo 4, Parte I de III: Un llamado a los Enanos",objectivesES={"Tanto Dori como Hannar deberían estar en Othrikar, que se encuentra al norte de Esteldín.\
\
Halbarad te dijo que los Enanos de Othrikar son buenos barbiluengos que fueron sometidos por los Duramano durante muchos años, aunque recientemente se han liberado de ese yugo. Aunque todavía son presionados por los Duramano, Halbarad te ha pedido que les lleves la noticia del Consejo de Esteldín.","Para enfrentar la amenaza de Angmar, Halbarad ha decidido que debe convocar un consejo de los Pueblos Libres de las Quebradas del Norte: el Consejo de Esteldín.","Libro 3, Capítulo 4, Parte I de III: Un llamado a los Enanos","Habla con Dori o Hannar"}},
[2076]={nameES="Libro 3, Capítulo 4, Parte II de III: Liberando a Dori",objectivesES={"Libro 3, Capítulo 4, Parte II de III: Liberando a Dori","Hannar se encuentra en las minas de Othrikar.\
\
Después de escoltar a Dori a un lugar seguro, te dijo que regresaras a Othrikar y hablaras con Hannar.","Has escoltado a Dori a un lugar seguro","El campamento Duramano donde Dori está retenido se encuentra al oeste de Othrikar. Busca en las ruinas donde Dori está cautivo.\
\
Hannar te dijo que los enanos ni siquiera considerarían ir al Consejo de Esteldín, a menos que Dori fuera liberado de los Duramano. Como enviado de los Montaraces, te dijo que debes liberarlo si esperas contar con el apoyo de los enanos en el Consejo.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Esta misión está pensada para una comunidad. Si decides realizarla solo recibirás una bonificación de inspiración, pero el desafío será grande.</rgb>","Encuentra a Dori","Cuando llegaste a Othrikar, trayendo noticias del Consejo de Esteldín, Hannar te dijo que Dori, el emisario de los barbiluengos de Erebor, había sido capturado por los Duramano."}},
[2077]={nameES="Libro 3, Capítulo 4, Parte III de III: Los Enanos Vendrán",objectivesES={"Halbarad se encuentra en Esteldín.\
\
Hannar te pidió que informaras a Halbarad que los Enanos de Othrikar han aceptado venir al Consejo.","Libro 3, Capítulo 4, Parte III de III: Los Enanos Vendrán","Tras rescatar a Dori de las garras de los Duramano, tanto Dori como Hannar acordaron que los Enanos de Othrikar acudirán al Consejo de Esteldín."}},
[2078]={nameES="Book 3, Chapter 4: Another Difficult Road",objectivesES={"The Rammas Echor, which blocks the way to the Pelennor, is besieged by the enemy","<rgb=#FF0000>Look</rgb> within the Harlond, near the docks","The docks of the Harlond have been seized by the enemy","You are near the entrance of the Harlond, gateway to the Pelennor","Angbor has asked you to travel to the meeting of the roads just south of Imloth Melui, in Lossarnach, to learn the state of the war in that land.","Nethadan is somewhere within Imloth Melui, looking for a purchaser for the Cemenduril liquor.","Angbor is ready to cross into Lossarnach, continuing the journey toward Minas Tirith and the onset of war with the forces of evil.","The Harlond appears to have been devastated by the attack of a large force","Book 3, Chapter 4: Another Difficult Road","Bandron has asked you to go to Harlond and <rgb=#FF0000>look</rgb> at certain locations to determine whether it is safe for him to go that way: the entrance of the city, the docks, and the gate in the Rammas Echor, the Pelennor's encircling wall.","<rgb=#FF0000>Look</rgb> within the Harlond, near the entrance of the city","You are near the docks of the Harlond","You are near the gate in the Rammas Echor","Bandron is on the road south of Imloth Melui, waiting for his son Nethadan to return.","Find the meeting of the roads just south of Imloth Melui, in Lossarnach","Talk to Bandron on the road south of Imloth Melui","Bandron and Nethadan have stopped their waggon south of Imloth Melui, in Lossarnach, and you should find out what has brought them here and why they have stopped.","Bandron is by his waggon in Lossarnach, south of Imloth Melui.\
\
You have investigated the port of the Harlond and found that it is occupied by the enemy. Bandron will not be able to go that way.","A waggon is stopped in the road. You recognize its driver from his exasperated expression","Talk to Angbor on the road south of Imloth Melui","Talk to Nethadan in Imloth Melui","Angbor is standing by Bandron's waggon on the road south of Imloth Melui, in Lossarnach.","<rgb=#FF0000>Look</rgb> within the Harlond, near the gate of the Rammas Echor"}},
[2079]={nameES="Libro 3, Capítulo 4: La Noche Cae sobre el Vado de Sarn",objectivesES={"Habla con Halbarad y escucha lo que les sucedió a los Montaraces.","Libro 3, Capítulo 4: La Noche Cae sobre el Vado de Sarn","Halbarad está en el Vado de Sarn.","Habla con Halbarad en el Vado de Sarn.","Agradecido por la ayuda que brindaste, Halbarad ha accedido a contarte lo que ocurrió en el Vado de Sarn hace apenas unos días.","Halbarad está en en el Vado de Sarn.\
\
Halbarad ha accedido a contarte lo que les sucedió a los Montaraces en el Vado de Sarn hace solo unos días."}},
[2080]={nameES="Libro 3, Capítulo 5, Parte I de III: Un llamado a los Elfos",objectivesES={"Para enfrentar la amenaza de Angmar, Halbarad ha decidido que debe convocar un consejo de los Pueblos Libres de las Quebradas del Norte: el Consejo de Esteldín.","Libro 3, Capítulo 5, Parte I de III: Un llamado a los Elfos","Gildor Inglorion se encuentra en la arboleda élfica de Lin Giliath, al sur de Esteldín.\
\
Halbarad te dijo que la arboleda élfica fue atacada recientemente por Trolls de Piedra. Expresó su preocupación de que los Elfos de Lin Giliath estén demasiado ocupados lidiando con las consecuencias de este ataque como para acudir al Consejo."}},
[2081]={nameES="Libro 3, Capítulo 5, Parte II de III: Cuidando la arboleda",objectivesES={"Regresa con Gildor en Lin Giliath","Libro 3, Capítulo 5, Parte II de III: Cuidando la arboleda","Este parece ser un buen lugar para invocar el poder de la piedra élfica","Gildor se encuentra en Lin Giliath.\
\
Con el uruk Drukordh derrotado, deberías regresar con Gildor y darle esta buena noticia.","Cuando llegaste a Lin Giliath, Gildor te dijo que los orcos al oeste planean atacar la arboleda élfica.","Drukordh se encuentra en los rincones más profundos y al sur de Nan Wathren.\
\
Gildor te dijo que si el uruk Drukordh fuera derrotado, Lin Giliath estaría lo suficientemente seguro para que él pudiera acudir al Consejo de Esteldín. Te advirtieron que no lo enfrentes sin la ayuda de aliados.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Usar la piedra élfica te permite acceder al beneficio de inspiración estando solo o en una pequeña comunidad.</rgb>","Busca y derrota a Drukordh"}},
[2082]={nameES="Libro 3, Capítulo 5, Parte III de III: El Poder de los Elfos",objectivesES={"Libro 3, Capítulo 5, Parte III de III: El Poder de los Elfos","Tras derrotar al Uruk Drukordh, Gildor te dijo que los Elfos de Lin Giliath acudirán al Consejo de Esteldín.","Halbarad se encuentra en Esteldín.\
\
Gildor te pidió que le lleves la noticia a Halbarad de que los Elfos han aceptado venir al Consejo de Esteldín."}},
[2083]={nameES="Book 3, Chapter 5: Into Ithilien",objectivesES={"You have been given permission to cross into Ithilien and seek Faramir's Rangers at Bâr Húrin, as long as you defeat Haradrim in those woods as you go.","Find the secret ferry among the reeds in the eastern reaches of Lossarnach","Talk to Duilin at Bâr Húrin, in South Ithilien","The woman guardedly considers you as you approach","Book 3, Chapter 5: Into Ithilien","A friend of Gondor operates a secret ferry across the river among the reeds that border the Anduin, on the eastern side of Lossarnach.\
\
Angbor has asked you to enter Ithilien by yourself while he seeks to assail the Harlond with his army.","Duilin is at the camp of Faramir's Rangers, at Bâr Húrin in South Ithilien.\
\
Duilin of the Blackroot Vale has called your name and beckoned you to speak to him.","Find the camp of Faramir's Rangers at Bâr Húrin, in South Ithilien","Angbor and his four thousand men must get to Minas Tirith, but the only acceptable road for such a force leads through the south-gate of the Rammas, which is held by a large enemy force.","You have crossed into Ithilien and seek Faramir's Rangers at Bâr Húrin.","Talk to the secret ferrywoman","A Gondorian man calls your name, and beckons to you"}},
[2084]={nameES="Libro 3, Capítulo 5: Las Quebradas del Sur",objectivesES={"Habla con Handarod en Sírlond","Handarod te saluda con un gesto cansado","Elfos acampan al este del río cerca de Caranost.\
\
Meneldir cree que algunos de los Montaraces dispersos probablemente se dirigieron a uno de los campamentos élficos al otro lado del río desde Caranost.","Handarod cree que otros Montaraces se reúnen en la Granja de Scurloc, al noreste.","Encuentra a los Montaraces que se dirigieron a la Granja de Scurloc, al noreste de Caranost","El Montaraz Malenfang vigila la Granja Scurloc, en las Quebradas del Sur.","Halbarad te encargó prestar ayuda a aquellos de su linaje que fueron dispersados por las Quebradas del Sur tras el ataque de los Jinetes Negros en el Vado de Sarn.","Peligrosos enemigos acechan las Quebradas del Sur, dificultando que los parientes dispersos del Montaraz Handarod lleguen a Sírlond. Él te ha pedido que hagas lo que puedas para ayudar.","Habla con Malenfang en la granja de Scurloc","Handarod reúne a los Montaraces en Sírlond, un campamento élfico al otro lado del río desde Caranost, la antigua capital de Cardolan.","Malenfang asiente cuando te acercas.","Meneldir está en el Vado de Sarn.\
\
Meneldir está deseoso de partir en busca de sus parientes dispersos.","Habla con Meneldir en el Vado de Sarn","El Montaraz Handarod está en Sírlond, esperando noticias de tu éxito en las Quebradas del Sur.","Busca Montaraces dispersos en un campamento élfico al otro lado del río","Malenfang te saluda con un gesto cuando te acercas","Libro 3, Capítulo 5: Las Quebradas del Sur"}},
[2085]={nameES="Libro 3, Capítulo 6, Parte I de III: Un llamado a los Hombres",objectivesES={"Para enfrentar la amenaza de Angmar, Halbarad ha decidido convocar un consejo de los Pueblos Libres de las Quebradas del Norte: el Consejo de Esteldín.","Nellie Bosquejo se encuentra en Puente de Caballetes.\
\
Halbarad te advirtió que Nellie podría estar tan ocupada con la defensa de Puente de Caballetes que no verá la importancia de asistir al Consejo de Esteldín.","Libro 3, Capítulo 6, Parte I de III: Un llamado a los Hombres","Halbarad se encuentra en Esteldín.\
\
Al recibir tu mensaje sobre el Consejo de Esteldín, Nellie Bosquejo se negó rotundamente a venir, diciendo que la defensa de su ciudad estaba por encima de cualquier otra preocupación. Debes regresar con Halbarad y darle su respuesta."}},
[2086]={nameES="Libro 3, Capítulo 6, Parte II de III: La Defensa de Puente de Caballetes",objectivesES={"Habla con Halbarad","Al regresar de Puente de Caballetes con la negativa de Nellie Bosquejo de unirse al Consejo, Halbarad te informó que una gran fuerza de orcos se dirigía a Trestlebridge.","Libro 3, Capítulo 6, Parte II de III: La Defensa de Puente de Caballetes","Viaja con Halbarad a Puente de Caballetes y ayuda en su defensa.\
\
Halbarad te dijo que los orcos que avanzan sobre Trestlebridge son de la tribu Ongbúrz, más poderosa. Los habitantes no podrán defenderse solos. Halbarad te indicó que reunieras aliados y volvieras con él.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Esta misión está pensada para una comunidad. Si decides afrontarla solo recibirás un bono de inspiración, pero el desafío será grande.</rgb>","Nellie Bosquejo se encuentra en Puente de Caballetes.\
\
Junto a Halbarad, ayudaste a defender Trestlebridge de los orcos que intentaban destruirla. Al final de la batalla, Nellie Bosquejo pidió hablar contigo."}},
[2087]={nameES="Libro 3, Capítulo 6, Parte III de III: Los Pueblos Libres de Puente de Caballetes",objectivesES={"Libro 3, Capítulo 6, Parte III de III: Los Pueblos Libres de Puente de Caballetes","Después de que tú y Halbarad ayudaron a su pueblo, Nellie Bosquejo juró aportar toda la fuerza que el pueblo de Puente de Caballetes tiene a su causa. Vendrán al Consejo de Esteldín.","Halbarad se encuentra en Esteldín.\
\
Nellie Bosquejo te ha pedido que informes a Halbarad que ella asistirá al Consejo de Esteldín."}},
[2088]={nameES="Libro 3, Capítulo 6: Peligro en Todas Direcciones",objectivesES={"La mesa de la Granja de Scurloc servirá como un buen lugar para ordenar los fragmentos de las órdenes que recuperaste.","Malenfang cree que podrías encontrar más información sobre el propósito compartido de los semiorcos y los trasgos en las ruinas de Haudh Nirui, al noroeste de Amon Firn.","Debes leer el fragmento de pergamino que encontraste en el cuerpo del semiorco.","Las órdenes que recuperaste han sido reducidas a fragmentos por los trasgos de Haudh Nirui, y será necesario ordenarlas y reconstruirlas antes de poder leerlas.","No del todo...","Esto podría ser...","Lee las órdenes de los semiorcos","Malenfang está en la Granja de Scurloc, esperando ver cualquiera de las órdenes de semiorcos que hayas recuperado.","Se pueden encontrar semiorcos cerca de Amon Firn, en las Quebradas del Sur.\
\
Malenfang te ha pedido que busques cualquier orden que los semiorcos puedan estar llevando.","Encuentras un fragmento de pergamino en el cuerpo del semiorco","Has reensamblado los fragmentos de las órdenes dirigidas a los semiorcos y trasgos de las Quebradas del Sur, colocándolos en una forma legible que parece tener sentido.","Meneldir ha llegado y querrá ver las órdenes que reconstruiste.","Ordena los papeles en la mesa de la Granja de Scurloc","Coloca los fragmentos de las órdenes en la mesa de la Granja de Scurloc","Habla con Meneldir en la Granja de Scurloc sobre lo que has aprendido.","Derrota semiorcos en Amon Firn y encuentra cualquier orden que puedan llevar","Ya casi...","Libro 3, Capítulo 6: Peligro en Todas Direcciones","Lleva las órdenes de los semiorcos a Malenfang en la Granja de Scurloc","Examina las órdenes reconstruidas en la mesa de la Granja de Scurloc","El Montaraz Malenfang ha aprendido lo suficiente sobre la actividad de sus enemigos en las Quebradas del Sur como para estar preocupado."}},
[2089]={nameES="Book 3, Chapter 6: Sons of Blackroot",objectivesES={"Talk to Duilin at Bâr Húrin, in South Ithilien","You have encountered Duilin and Derufin of the Blackroot Vale, becoming entangled in their quest to hunt the giant Mûmakil the Haradrim have brought to Gondor.","Book 3, Chapter 6: Sons of Blackroot","Duilin is at Bâr Húrin, in South Ithilien.\
\
The Mûmak hunt did not go as planned, but Duilin and Derufin do not seem to mind.","Talk to Duilin and hunt the mighty Mûmakil","Duilin is at Bâr Húrin, in South Ithilien.\
\
You have grudgingly agreed to help Duilin and Derufin hunt the mighty Mûmakil, in return for their help finding Faramir."}},
[2090]={nameES="Book 3, Chapter 7: Osgiliath Overrun",objectivesES={"Find Faramir or his men within the Osgiliath Culverts","You have recovered one of the messages sent by Gothmog to his forces in Osgiliath, and should bring it to Damrod among the culverts beneath the city.","You find a parchment clutched in a dead hand, buried under stones!","You dig through the rubble, but find nothing of use","Search the south-western area of Osgiliath for one of Damrod's men","You have found Gelnor, but he is alone and there is no sign of Faramir","Book 3, Chapter 7: Osgiliath Overrun","Faramir and his men may be found within the Osgiliath Culverts beneath the city, if they still stand against the armies of the enemy.","Talk to Damrod among the Osgiliath Culverts","Gelnor saw an Orc runner crushed beneath falling stones near a fountain to the east, and he wants you to dig through the rubble in search of the message it carried.","A Gondorian soldier clutches at his wounds and beckons to you","Orcs can be found throughout Osgiliath, and Damrod hopes that you might find Faramir or soldiers with news of him in the south-western area of the city.","Bring the Orc-message to Damrod among the Osgiliath Culverts","You have found the city's defenders, but Faramir is not with them","Inthol told you that he last saw Faramir and Gelnor racing to the north-west area of Osgiliath, pursued by a frightful commander of the enemy forces named Gothmog.","Damrod and the few Gondorian soldiers that still defend Osgiliath can be found among the culverts beneath the city.","Duilin and Derufin have agreed to travel with you to Osgiliath. There you hope to learn the state of the defences and what has become of Faramir.","Damrod takes the parchment from you and reads the crude writing.\
\
'I cannot read much of this message, but I can understand enough of it to know it means trouble.'","Search the north-western area of Osgiliath for another of Damrod's men"}},
[2091]={nameES="Libro 3, Capítulo 7: La Ruptura de Arnor",objectivesES={"Habla con Handarod en Sírlond","Debes llevar el diario al lugar que describe: la esquina suroriental de Tyrn Gorthad","El diario de Narndir describe una ubicación en las zonas surorientales de Tyrn Gorthad.\
\
Debes viajar al lugar descrito por el diario y leer allí las páginas correspondientes.","La escritura es tan evocadora que casi puedes imaginar los horrores que aquí sucedieron","Malenfang está en Scurloc Farm, esperando oír lo que aprendiste de los papeles que descifraste.","Debes llevar el diario al lugar que describe: la sala del trono en Caranost","La escritura es tan evocadora que casi puedes oír el sonido de la batalla","Contempla la imagen del Rey Tarondor II","El diario de Narndir describe la sala del trono de Caranost, ubicada en el punto más alto de la ciudad en ruinas.\
\
Debes viajar al lugar descrito por el diario y leer allí las páginas correspondientes.","Has recuperado el diario de Narndir, en el que registró muchos pensamientos sobre la historia de Arnor y los reinos que le siguieron.","Contempla la imagen del Rey Artandil","Busca el escondite del diario de Narndir","Contempla la imagen de Amondir, Señor de Tyrn Gorthad","Presencia la última aventura del Príncipe Amondir","Habla con Malenfang en la granja de Scurloc","Handarod está en Sírlond, al otro lado del río frente a Caranost, y puede conocer a alguien que pueda contarte sobre el Miedo Gris.","Narndir guardaba sus diarios en un lugar secreto en las Quebradas del Sur, pero Handarod conocía su ubicación. El escondite está bajo una de las torres orientales de Caranost, en un hueco bajo la torre.","Encuentra el escondite del diario de Narndir en un hueco bajo la torre más oriental de Caranost","Dentro del pequeño cofre encuentras un diario encuadernado en cuero, atado con un cordón","La escritura de Narndir ha traído importantes figuras del pasado de Cardolan a tu imaginación en el sitio de la Batalla del Monte de los Muertos, Amon Firn.","Lee el diario de Narndir mientras estés en la sala del trono de Caranost, ubicada en el punto más alto de la capital arruinada de Cardolan","Contempla la imagen del Rey Brujo","Lee el diario de Narndir mientras estés en las zonas surorientales de Tyrn Gorthad","Debes llevar el diario al lugar que describe, en Amon Firn","Este lugar coincide con la descripción que te dio Handarod","Habla con Meneldir en las zonas surorientales de Tyrn Gorthad","Contempla la imagen de Amondir","Libro 3, Capítulo 7: La Ruptura de Arnor","La escritura es tan evocadora que casi puedes imaginar al Rey Tarondor II allí.","El diario de Narndir contiene un relato de la Batalla del Monte de los Muertos, y describe un sendero claro en el lado norte de la colina que permite a los viajeros acercarse bastante al monumento en lo alto de Amon Firn.\
\
Debes viajar al lugar descrito por el diario y leer las páginas correspondientes cuando estés allí.","La escritura de Narndir habla de terribles hechos cometidos por fuerzas de gran maldad entre los túmulos de Tyrn Gorthad.","Los trasgos y semiorcos hablan en voz baja acerca de algo llamado el Miedo Gris, un aparente servidor del Rey Brujo responsable de algún mal terrible en los años posteriores a la caída de Arnor.","Meneldir se encuentra cerca, contemplando los túmulos de Tyrn Gorthad.","La escritura de Narndir es tan evocadora que casi puedes imaginar al Rey Tarondor II presente en la sala del trono que estableció en Caranost tras la ruptura de Arnor.","Este parece ser el lugar del que Narndir escribió","Lee el diario de Narndir mientras estés cerca de la cima de Amon Firn, subiendo por el sendero ubicado en el lado norte de la colina","Lee el diario de Narndir"}},
[2092]={nameES="Libro 3, Capítulo 7: El Consejo Reunido",objectivesES={"Aragorn se encuentra en una de las habitaciones de invitados de la Casa de Elrond en Rivendel, que se halla en el Bosque de los Trolls.\
\
Halbarad te ha pedido que lleves noticias de la invasión de las Quebradas del Norte a su jefe, Aragorn, y que obtengas su consejo.","Habla con Aragorn en Rivendel.","Los Elfos, Hombres y Enanos de las Quebradas del Norte han acordado asistir al Consejo de Esteldín, pero el jefe de Halbarad aún no ha sido informado de los acontecimientos que han tenido lugar allí.","Libro 3, Capítulo 7: El Consejo Reunido"}},
[2093]={nameES="Book 3, Chapter 8: Gothmog Appears",objectivesES={"Book 3, Chapter 8: Gothmog Appears","Talk to Damrod among the Osgiliath Culverts","Derufin can be found among the Osgiliath Culverts beneath the city.\
\
Damrod has asked you and Derufin to find the great ram, Grond, and damage or destroy it before it is pulled out of Osgiliath into the Pelennor.","You managed to damage Grond, but learned an unsettling truth about the identity of Gothmog, a commander of the forces in Osgiliath.","Talk to Derufin among the Osgiliath Culverts and go with him to search for Grond","Talk to Derufin among the Osgiliath Culverts","Damrod is with his men among the culverts beneath Osgiliath.","The forces of the Enemy have brought a terrible weapon to Osgiliath, and you must destroy it before it can be used against Minas Tirith."}},
[2094]={nameES="Libro 3, Capítulo 8: Los Últimos Días de Cardolan",objectivesES={"Habla con Handarod en Sírlond","Orcos, semiorcos o trasgos en las Quebradas del Sur o en Páramo Rojizo pueden haber robado las páginas perdidas del diario de Narndir, y deberías recuperarlas si puedes.","Meneldir te espera en el campamento de Gorwen, al sur de Dol Ernil, para tu regreso tras investigar en la fortaleza.","La escritura es tan evocadora que casi puedes imaginar la terrible visión que aguardaba al Príncipe Ostir","Una pequeña caja reposa aquí, pero su cerradura está rota y está rodeada de huellas de orco","Has restaurado el diario de Narndir, y quizá ahora puedas descubrir por qué se retiraron páginas de él.","Lee el diario restaurado de Narndir","Los escritos de Narndir han evocado la imagen del Miedo Gris para inquietar tu mente.","Libro 3, Capítulo 8: Los Últimos Días de Cardolan","La mesa de la Granja de Scurloc servirá como buen lugar de trabajo para reensamblar el diario de Narndir.","Contempla la imagen del Miedo Gris","Puede que hayas encontrado otro escondite secreto de Narndir, pero es posible que los orcos o sus aliados lo encontraran primero.","Handarod vio una vez a Narndir comportarse de manera extraña cerca de una ruina cuadrada solitaria junto al camino en Páramo Rojizo, al noroeste de Herne.","Busca la extraña ruina cuadrada junto al camino en Páramo Rojizo donde Handarod vio una vez a Narndir comportarse de forma extraña","Abre la pequeña caja de madera y busca las páginas perdidas del diario de Narndir","La caja de madera está vacía, ya saqueada de su contenido por orcos, semiorcos o trasgos","Las páginas rasgadas encajan a la perfección, y el diario de Narndir ha sido restaurado","Handarod está en Sírlond, el campamento élfico al otro lado del río desde Caranost.\
\
Meneldir se pregunta si Handarod sabrá qué ocurrió con las páginas perdidas del diario de Narndir.","Meneldir te dijo que se reuniría contigo frente a Dol Ernil tras aprender lo que pudieras del diario de Narndir.","Narndir describe la muerte de Ostir, Último Príncipe de Cardolan, con tal detalle que su relato dolería a cualquier amigo de los Dúnedain o de su pueblo.","Muestra el diario de Narndir a Meneldir justo al sur de Dol Ernil, en Tyrn Gorthad","Lee el diario de Narndir junto al trono en Dol Ernil","Lleva el diario de Narndir a Meneldir en el campamento de Gorwen, al sur de Dol Ernil","Vuelve a ensamblar el diario de Narndir en la mesa de la Granja de Scurloc","Varias de las páginas siguientes han sido arrancadas del diario. ¿Fueron retiradas por Narndir o por otra mano, y con qué propósito?","El diario de Narndir describe la sala del trono de Dol Ernil, ubicada al norte del campamento de Gorwen y por varias escalinatas arriba.\
\
Deberías viajar al lugar descrito por el diario y leer allí las páginas correspondientes.","Este parece ser el lugar del que Narndir escribió","Meneldir te devuelve el diario","Contempla la muerte de Ostir, Último Príncipe de Cardolan, tal como la describen los escritos de Narndir"}},
[2095]={nameES="Libro 3, Capítulo 9: Muerte en las Quebradas de los Túmulos",objectivesES={"Meneldir está en el campamento de Gorwen al sur de Dol Ernil, interesado en oír de tus logros por Tyrn Gorthad.","El hedor de muerte y descomposición llena tus fosas nasales al acercarte a esta esquina","Libro 3, Capítulo 9: Muerte en las Quebradas de los Túmulos","Habla con Gorwen en su campamento al sur de Dol Ernil, en Tyrn Gorthad","Halbarad sugirió que ambos regresáramos al campamento de Gorwen al sur de Dol Ernil.","Regresa al campamento de Gorwen al sur de Dol Ernil, en Tyrn Gorthad","El aire bajo la mesa de piedra se siente viciado y estancado","El Rey Brujo ha obrado gran mal en Tyrn Gorthad, y los Montaraces necesitan tu ayuda para oponerse a sus siervos y a sus oscuros propósitos.","Habla con Halbarad en el campamento de Gorwen al sur de Dol Ernil","Un aura de temor aprieta tu corazón al acercarte al muro occidental","Halbarad está en el Vado de Sarn.\
\
Meneldir te pidió que llevaras las espadas ancestrales que recuperaste a Halbarad para que puedan ser destruidas y su mal disminuido.","Lleva las espadas ancestrales a Halbarad para que sean destruidas","Gorwen está en su campamento al sur de Dol Ernil, en Tyrn Gorthad.\
\
Meneldir te pidió que vieras qué ayuda necesita Gorwen para combatir los males de Tyrn Gorthad.","Gorwen te dio varias tareas que ayudarán a combatir los males de Tyrn Gorthad.","Un peso desagradable reposa pesadamente sobre las piedras bajo el muro imponente","Habla con Meneldir en el campamento de Gorwen al sur de Dol Ernil","Halbarad y algunos de los suyos han llegado al campamento de Gorwen en Tyrn Gorthad, pero tanto Meneldir como Gorwen ya han desaparecido. ¿Han ido a enfrentarse solos al mal?","Gorwen aguarda tu regreso en su campamento al sur de Dol Ernil, en Tyrn Gorthad.","Meneldir y Gorwen se han ido"}},
[2096]={nameES="Libro 3, Prólogo: Fuegos en el Norte",objectivesES={"Sigue el camino hacia el oeste hasta llegar a la Posada Abandonada. Candaith está en un campamento al norte de la Posada Abandonada, al noroeste de la Cima de los Vientos.\
\
Frideric te dijo que un Montaraz desea hablar contigo sobre asuntos urgentes.","Halbarad está en las Quebradas del Norte, al norte de Meluinen.\
\
El amigo Montaraz de Candaith necesita ayuda con urgencia.","Libro 3, Prólogo: Fuegos en el Norte","Orcos del norte están arrasando las Quebradas del Norte y poniendo todo a fuego y sangre a su paso."}},
[2097]={nameES="Book 4, Chapter 10: Herdsmen of the Starkmoor",objectivesES={"Nona is by the farmland in the north-western reaches of the Starkmoor.\
\
You scouted the farmland in the north-western Starkmoor and should speak with Nona.","Talk to Nona in the Starkmoor","There is a farmhouse in the north-western corner of the Starkmoor.\
\
Nona wants you to scout the farmhouse atop the slope to the west to see if it is held by those loyal to Saruman.","Scout the sheep-enclosure","Nona is by the farmhouse in the north-western reaches of Starkmoor.\
\
Nona has agreed to meet you in the Starkmoor to scout for the information Lheu Brenin needs.","Book 4, Chapter 10: Herdsmen of the Starkmoor","The farmhouse has been abandoned by its rightful owners","Some of the sheep have been killed and left to rot","Scout the planted field","Scout the farmhouse atop the north-western hill","Nona has agreed to accompany you on your information-gathering journey through Dunland for Lheu Brenin.","The field is full of grains, planted but yet to be harvested"}},
[2098]={nameES="Book 4, Chapter 10: The Defence of Minas Tirith",objectivesES={"Complete 'The Defence of Minas Tirith' from the Epic Battles Panel","Mithrandir is in the besieged city, at the south-eastern area of the Second Circle.\
\
<rgb=#00FF00>Minas Tirith is besieged! You may examine the model of the city in the Dome of the Sun to travel between states of the city.</rgb>","The city of Minas Tirith is besieged, and the forces of Mordor assault the wall.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>To participate in the defence, open the Epic Battles Panel and select 'The Defence of Minas Tirith' from the menu. After you successfully complete the defence, you will be returned to the location from which you entered it.</rgb>","Prince Imrahil rallies the defenders of Minas Tirith as the forces of Mordor assault the walls of the city.","Book 4, Chapter 10: The Defence of Minas Tirith","Talk to Mithrandir in the besieged city, at the south-eastern area of the Second Circle"}},
[2099]={nameES="Book 4, Chapter 11: Hammer of the Underworld",objectivesES={"Complete 'Hammer of the Underworld' from the Epic Battles Panel","Mithrandir is in the besieged city, at the south-eastern area of the Second Circle.\
\
<rgb=#00FF00>Minas Tirith is besieged! You may examine the model of the city in the Dome of the Sun to travel between states of the city.</rgb>","The city of Minas Tirith is besieged, and the great ram Grond creeps closer to the gate.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>To participate in the defence, open the Epic Battles Panel and select 'Hammer of the Underworld' from the menu. After you successfully complete the defence, you will be returned to the location from which you entered it.</rgb>","Mithrandir rallies the defenders of Minas Tirith as the great ram Grond creeps ever close to the gates of the city.","Book 4, Chapter 11: Hammer of the Underworld","Talk to Mithrandir in the besieged city, at the south-eastern area of the Second Circle"}},
[2100]={nameES="Book 4, Chapter 11: Into the Dunbog",objectivesES={"Nona is along the road that runs south out of the Starkmoor into the Dunbog, near a natural arch of stone.\
\
Nona has asked you to help the people of the Starkmoor with their problems, especially at Avardin to the south, and to meet her by the road into the Dunbog when you are satisfied.","Book 4, Chapter 11: Into the Dunbog","You should help the people of the Starkmoor before moving south to meet Nona in the Dunbog.","Help the people of the Starkmoor as much as you can, and when you are ready to move on, find Nona by the road into Dunbog"}},
[2101]={nameES="Book 4, Chapter 12: Outliers",objectivesES={"Talk to Nona in the Dunbog","The scout stares at you warily, but does not attack","Judging from the symbols that decorate their camp, these Men are of the Avanc-lûth clan","You have come to the outskirts of the Dunbog on Lheu Brenin's information-gathering errand.","Book 4, Chapter 12: Outliers","Nona is to the north of the rocky outcropping that marks the boundary between the Starkmoor and the Dunbog.\
\
You have scouted the border of the Dunbog and should return to Nona.","Determine whether the scout by the rocky outcropping is friendly","A Dunlending-scout is by the large rocky outcropping that stands by the entrance to the Dunbog, and to the south-west of her is a small camp belonging to her people.","Scout the small camp of Dunlendings south-west of the rocky outcropping"}},
[2102]={nameES="Book 4, Chapter 12: The Darkest Hour",objectivesES={"Mithrandir is in the besieged city, at the south-eastern area of the Second Circle.\
\
Grond has broken the gate, and now Mithrandir seeks to confront the Witch-king before that terrible foe can enter the city.\
\
<rgb=#00FF00>Minas Tirith is besieged! You may examine the model of the city in the Dome of the Sun to travel between states of the city.</rgb>","Talk to Peregrin Took at his post in the Seventh Circle","Talk to Mithrandir in the besieged city and travel with him to the gate","Peregrin Took is in the Seventh Circle of the city, at his post.\
\
You have shaken away the remnants of the terrible prophecy Denethor spoke to you, but you cannot forget the images his words raised in your mind. To convince yourself that it was simply a tale, you should find Peregrin and ensure he is well.","Book 4, Chapter 12: The Darkest Hour","It is the darkest hour for Gondor and Middle-earth. Has all hope been lost?"}},
[2103]={nameES="Book 4, Chapter 13: Land of Iron",objectivesES={"Help the people of Dunbog as much as you can, and when you are ready to move on, find Nona in Carreglyn","You should help the people of the Dunbog with their worries, then meet up with Nona in the town of Barnavon, in Carreglyn, when you are satisfied.","Book 4, Chapter 13: Land of Iron","You must help the people of the Dunbog as much as you can, then meet with Nona in Carreglyn."}},
[2104]={nameES="Book 4, Chapter 13: Time Yet Remains",objectivesES={"You have heard Denethor's tale of what he expects from the siege of Minas Tirith, and should convey the Steward's words to Mithrandir before the hour grows too late.","Book 4, Chapter 13: Time Yet Remains","Mithrandir is in the Court of the Fountain on the Seventh Circle of Minas Tirith.\
\
Peregrin Took has suggested that you tell Mithrandir about your audience with Denethor, the Steward of Gondor.","Talk to Mithrandir in the Court of the Fountain"}},
[2105]={nameES="Book 4, Chapter 14: Bribing Gold",objectivesES={"Nona is in the village of Barnavon, in Carreglyn.\
\
You have retrieved the bribing gold and should bring it to Nona.","Bring the bribing gold to Nona","Book 4, Chapter 14: Bribing Gold","Nona wants you to recover some of the gold that has been paid to Dunlendings by Saruman's agents.","Hostile Dunlendings in Barnavon carry the gold with which they were bribed.\
\
Nona wants you to defeat hostile Dunlendings throughout Carreglyn, but especially in the upper village of Barnavon, and take the bribing gold from them."}},
[2106]={nameES="Book 4, Chapter 15: Friends in the Gravenwood",objectivesES={"You must help the people of Carreglyn stand against Saruman, if you can, and when you are satisfied, Nona thinks you should meet up with the Rangers in Gravenwood.","Help the people of Carreglyn as much as you can, and when you are ready to move on, find Amlan on the western border of Gravenwood","Talk to Saeradan at the Rohirrim scout-camp","Talk to Théodred at the Rohirrim scout-camp","Book 4, Chapter 15: Friends in the Gravenwood","The Ranger Amlan is east of Carreglyn, just over the border with Gravenwood.\
\
Nona wants you to help the friendly people of Carreglyn as much as you can and to then meet up with the Rangers in Gravenwood when you are satisfied.","Théodred is at the Rohirrim scout-camp in Gravenwood.\
\
You have encountered Saeradan again and he has introduced you to Théodred, the son of the king of Rohan.","Saeradan is at the Rohirrim Scout-camp, east of Amlan's camp in Gravenwood.\
\
Amlan told you that a small party of Rohirrim have come to Gravenwood and are meeting with Saeradan."}},
[2107]={nameES="Book 4, Chapter 16: The Watchful Presence",objectivesES={"Aside from the Dunlendings, you feel no unusual or mysterious presence","Check near the mustering tree for signs of a watchful presence","Théodred's men have felt the watchful presence at an old tree to the north-west of his camp, and in the back of Uvel-cadlus, the Dragon-clan camp to the north.\
\
Théodred wants you to see if you can sense a watchful presence at the places his men experienced such feelings.","The woods remain still and quiet. You feel no presence here","Check in the back of Uvel-cadlus for signs of a watchful presence","Talk to Théodred at the Rohirrim scout-camp","Book 4, Chapter 16: The Watchful Presence","The stillness of Gravenwood has Théodred and his men on edge, and they have asked for your help to set their minds at ease.","Théodred is at his camp in the eastern reaches of Gravenwood.\
\
You have sought out the watchful presence in Gravenwood, but did not experience anything unusual."}},
[2108]={nameES="Book 4, Chapter 17: Return to Tûr Morva",objectivesES={}},
[2109]={nameES="Book 4, Chapter 18: The Captive",objectivesES={"Talk to Lheu Brenin and travel with him to speak with the captive","The emissary from Isengard that Lheu Brenin has imprisoned is not doing well, and the leader of the Falcon-clan wants you to try and learn something of Saruman's plans before the captive dies.","Talk to Fâsh in Isengard","<rgb=#FF0000>If you left the Isengard Depths without the Reminder of Captivity in your inventory, go to the cart just to the right of the gate of Isengard and use it to return to the Depths.</rgb>\
\
You have been taken prisoner and brought to Isengard. The Falcon-clan has betrayed you, and you are now the prisoner of Saruman.","Lheu Brenin is outside his home in Tûr Morva.\
\
Lheu Brenin has asked you to come with him to speak with his captive.","Book 4, Chapter 18: The Captive"}},
[2110]={nameES="Book 4, Chapter 19: The Caverns of Isengard",objectivesES={"Complete 'Heavy Lifting' for your Uruk-hai overseer","You have been imprisoned beneath Isengard and must now report to Fâsh, an Uruk-hai charged with maintaining the work of the Saruman's thralls.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>If you need to resummon your Uruk Overseer, use the Shackles you now have within your inventory and he will appear.</rgb>","Return to Fâsh in the centre of the caverns","Fâsh has assigned an Uruk-hai to keep an eye on you in the caverns beneath Isengard and to give you work. If your overseer wanders off for some reason, rattling your shackles should make him come running.","Complete 'The Slop' for your Uruk-hai overseer","Complete 'Kill Ten Rats' for your Uruk-hai overseer","Book 4, Chapter 19: The Caverns of Isengard","Fâsh is in the centre of the caverns beneath Isengard.\
\
You have finished a series of tasks for your Uruk-hai overseer and should return to Fâsh."}},
[2111]={nameES="Libro 4, Capítulo 1: Preparativos para las galerías occidentales",objectivesES={"Los enanos Slóthi, Sigdan y Thálfi están en la Cámara de la Encrucijada, en la entrada sur del Camino de Durin, al norte de la Gran Excavación.\
\
Bósi teme que la guerra se acerque, y quiere que las defensas de la Gran Excavación estén listas.","Ayuda a Slóthi con sus preparativos","Ayuda a Sigdan con sus preparativos","Bósi se encuentra en la Cámara de la Encrucijada, en la entrada sur del Camino de Durin, al norte de la Gran Excavación.\
\
Has ayudado con los preparativos para que la Gran Excavación esté lista para la guerra y ahora deberías reportarte con Bósi.","Libro 4, Capítulo 1: Preparativos para las galerías occidentales","Ayuda a Thálfi con sus preparativos","La historia registrada en el Libro de Mazarbul ha llenado a Bósi de temor, y sabe que los enanos en la Gran Excavación de Moria deben prepararse para la guerra."}},
[2112]={nameES="Book 4, Chapter 1: The Broken Causeway",objectivesES={"Check fallen soldier","You check for signs of life, but this man has been dead for some time","The safety of Minas Tirith is threatened by the foes that have come to the Pelennor Fields. Men fled from the occupation of the Causeway Forts and fell not far from Osgiliath.\
\
Duilin and Derufin have asked you to search for survivors injured while fleeing from the Causeway Forts, and to defeat foes on the Pelennor.","You check for signs of life, but this man has already succumbed to death","Book 4, Chapter 1: The Broken Causeway","This man did not survive. It seems the enemy hewed his body after he fell","Osgiliath has been lost, and the defenders who still remain in the city must escape to the Pelennor.","Duilin and Derufin are outside the Causeway Forts, on the eastern side of the Pelennor Fields.","Duilin is outside the Causeway Forts, on the eastern side of the Pelennor Fields.\
\
Osgiliath has fallen to the enemy, and the men there can no longer mount an effective resistance.","Talk to Duilin outside the Causeway Forts, on the eastern end of the Pelennor Fields","Talk to Derufin outside the Causeway Forts, on the eastern end of the Pelennor Fields"}},
[2113]={nameES="Book 4, Chapter 1: The Departure of Lhanuch",objectivesES={"Halbarad is in the centre of Lhanuch, in Nan Laeglin.\
\
You have spoken with Prestadír and Braigiar about the paths into Dunland.","Talk to Prestadír in Lhanuch","Prestadír and Braigiar, in the centre of Lhanuch, are considering the two paths the Grey Company will take to enter Dunland.\
\
Halbarad has asked you to consult with Prestadír and Braigiar about his proposed routes into Dunland.","Book 4, Chapter 1: The Departure of Lhanuch","Talk to Halbarad in Lhanuch","Halbarad is in the centre of the village of Lhanuch, in Nan Laeglin.\
\
You have been told that Halbarad is assembling the Grey Company in preparation for its departure and should travel to Lhanuch for the last of the preparations before departing.","Talk to Braigiar in Lhanuch","The time has come for the Grey Company to travel south into Dunland, continuing its dangerous mission to reach Aragorn in time to be of help."}},
[2114]={nameES="Libro 4, Capítulo 1: ¿Dónde está el Caballo y el Jinete?",objectivesES={"Libro 4, Capítulo 1: ¿Dónde está el Caballo y el Jinete?","Elladan está en su campamento de Thorenhad, en la ladera noroeste de las Gargantas del Bruinen, al norte de las guaridas de osos.\
\
El Señor Elrond te ha pedido que prestes tu ayuda a sus hijos Elladan y Elrohir, quienes actualmente buscan al Nazgûl desaparecido.","Siervos del Enemigo persiguieron a Frodo Bolsón hasta el Bruinen, y aunque el hobbit y sus amigos fueron salvados y las criaturas terribles derrotadas por el poder de Elrond, no todos los Nazgûl han sido localizados."}},
[2115]={nameES="Book 4, Chapter 20: In the Presence of Saruman",objectivesES={}},
[2116]={nameES="Book 4, Chapter 21: Servants of Saruman",objectivesES={"Morflak has assigned one of his lackeys to keep an eye on you within the Ring of Isengard.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>If you need to resummon Morflak's Lackey, use the Shackles you now have within your inventory and he will appear.</rgb>","Complete 'Trivial Business' for Morflak's lackey","Complete 'Their Best Interests' for Morflak's lackey","Book 4, Chapter 21: Servants of Saruman","Complete 'Raiding the Larder' for Morflak's lackey","Morflak has assigned one of his lackeys to keep an eye on you within the ring of Isengard and to give you work. If this Uruk-hai wanders off for some reason, rattling your shackles should make him come running.","Return to Morflak within the Ring of Isengard","Morflak is waiting to speak with you within the ring of Isengard."}},
[2117]={nameES="Book 4, Chapter 22: Feed the Prisoners",objectivesES={"Dulan in the kitchens has tried to catch your eye.\
\
You should talk to Dulan and see what he wants.","It is time for you to squeeze out the dirty rag into the slop bucket in the kitchens.","Barkh is in the kitchens below Isengard, south-west of the main cavern.","Return the dirty rag to Barkh in the kitchens","Talk to Barkh in the kitchens","Baldgar wants to speak with you. He is in the dungeons below Isengard.","Fâsh is in the caverns beneath Isengard, accessible by a door directly north of the tower. Once in the depths, you should take the sloping paths downward to Fâsh's command.\
\
Morflak has sent you to deliver a message to Fâsh and to do more work for him.","Barkh is in the kitchens beneath Isengard, south-west of the main cavern.\
\
Fâsh has sent you to help out in the kitchens once again.","Uruk-hai meals can be found on the tables in the kitchens below Isengard.\
\
Dulan has secretly given you a small quantity of poison and wants you to add it to one of the Uruk-hai meals.","Quietly add the poison to an Uruk-hai meal","You tip the slop into the bucket, and it makes a sickening sound","Fill up a bucket of slop from the slop bucket in the kitchens","The floor of the kitchen is covered in slop.\
\
Barkh has given you a dirty rag and wants you to clean the slop up off the floor.","You secretly add the poison to the Uruk-hai meal and return to your task","Book 4, Chapter 22: Feed the Prisoners","Dulan has tried to catch your eye. Talk to him without attracting attention","Talk to Baldgar in the dungeon","Dulan silently hands you a quantity of poison","Talk to Fâsh in the Isengard Depths","Morflak wants you to report to Fâsh with the message that you no longer need a guard to watch your comings and goings. Fâsh is to keep you busy until Morflak has need of you.","Barkh wants you to fill a pan from the slop bucket in the kitchens and carry it to the bucket in the dungeons from where the prisoners are fed, as you did before.","Slop covers the floor of the kitchens below Isengard.\
\
Barkh wants you to clean up the slop.","Use the slop bucket in the kitchens to squeeze out the dirty rag"}},
[2118]={nameES="Book 4, Chapter 23: The Wizard's Vale",objectivesES={"Baldgar is forming an escape plan, and he says a fellow prisoner is the key to its success.","Talk to Acca and experience 'Session: The Wizard's Vale' or read the shortened account instead","The plans of a Wizard cannot remain entirely secret to the steward who runs his household. When Acca learns that Saruman has captured his former ally Gandalf the Grey, the steward finds himself conflicted. It takes little time for such worries to be noticed by one who is only too eager to speak of these doubts to his master...","Book 4, Chapter 23: The Wizard's Vale","Acca is imprisoned in the dungeons below Isengard.\
\
Acca, once the steward of Isengard, has agreed to tell you the story of his fall.","Acca is in the dungeons below Isengard, located in the north-west corner of the main cavern.","Acca has told you the story of his fall and has warmed up to you. He is waiting to speak with you.","Baldgar is in the dungeons below Isengard.\
\
Acca has agreed to help you escape and wants you to tell Baldgar.","Talk to Acca in the dungeon","Talk to Acca in the dungeons","Talk to Baldgar in the dungeon"}},
[2119]={nameES="Book 4, Chapter 24: A Pinch of Black Powder",objectivesES={"Baldgar is in the dungeons below Isengard.\
\
You have stolen some black powder and should bring it to Baldgar.","Sagrúrz is by the forges in the main cavern beneath Isengard.\
\
Baldgar wants you to do the work Sagrúrz asks of you, but while you are doing that, he also wants you to collect some black powder.","Return to Baldgar with the stolen black powder","Sagrúrz is waiting to speak with you by the forges in the main cavern beneath Isengard.","Put the scattered weapons in the empty barrel","The empty barrel is near the forges in the main cavern beneath Isengard.\
\
Sagrúrz wants you to put the scattered weapons you collected in an empty barrel.","Talk to Sagrúrz at the forge","Book 4, Chapter 24: A Pinch of Black Powder","Weapons are scattered around the floor near the forges. Sagrúrz wants you to pick them up and put them back in an empty barrel. Meanwhile, Baldgar wants you to collect some of the black powder that spews from the works and collects on the floor.","Baldgar has come up with an escape plan, and he wants you to use your relative freedom of movement within Isengard to help him carry it out."}},
[2120]={nameES="Book 4, Chapter 25: Final Preparations",objectivesES={"Thak gave you some trouble when you went to leave the black powder at the war-machine. Now you can either speak to Morflak about Thak, as you threatened, or you can go directly back to Baldgar in the dungeons below Isengard. The door to the depths is north of Orthanc, and Morflak is south-west of the tower.","Baldgar has given you your final instructions for the escape plan: to leave the black powder near one of the great war-machines on the surface, for later ignition.","Morflak stares at you for a long moment.\
\
'It is done. No more words are necessary.'","The largest of the war-machines is being constructed on the surface, within the Ring of Isengard. The door to the surface is in the north wall of the caverns. The war-machines are south-east of the steps of Orthanc.\
\
Baldgar has asked you to leave the black powder that you collected near the largest of the war-machines under construction. You have enough black powder for four small piles.","Find the largest of the war-machines under construction within the Ring","Leave the black powder near the largest of the war-machines under construction","Talk to Baldgar","Leave the black powder near the largest of the war machines under construction. Keep sprinkling the powder until it is gone.","You are near enough the war machine to leave the black powder.","Thak has noticed you lingering near the war-machine!","Thak is near the war-machines on the surface, within the Ring of Isengard.\
\
Thak noticed you lingering near the war-machines and has called you to speak with him.","Book 4, Chapter 25: Final Preparations","You have sprinkled the black powder near the largest of the war-machines under construction.","Baldgar is in the dungeons below Isengard. The entrance to the depths is north of the tower of Orthanc.\
\
You have left the black powder near the largest of the war-machines within the Ring and should speak now with Baldgar in the dungeons.","Morflak stares at you for a long moment before speaking.\
\
'Thak gave you some trouble? Doesn't he know you're one of mine? I will have one of my boys take care of him. No one disrespects Morflak!'","Talk to Baldgar in the dungeon","Talk to Morflak","You sprinkle some of the black powder onto the ground","Talk to Thak"}},
[2121]={nameES="Book 4, Chapter 26: Escape from Isengard",objectivesES={"Baldgar is in the dungeons below Isengard.","Talk to Baldgar and carry out the escape plan","When you awaken, you find that you have been carried to the Gravenwood, but Baldgar is near death.","The time has come to carry out Baldgar's escape plan. If all goes well, you will soon be free of Isengard.","Talk to Baldgar in the Gravenwood","Book 4, Chapter 26: Escape from Isengard"}},
[2122]={nameES="Book 4, Chapter 27: Repaying Treachery",objectivesES={"Baldgar is dead. You should return to Théodred's camp in the Gravenwood to learn what has become of the Grey Company during your captivity.","You have escaped from Isengard with the help of Baldgar, but he did not survive. You should rejoin Théodred at his camp in the Gravenwood to decide what to do next.","Find Théodred at his camp in the Gravenwood and talk to him","Théodred should be at his camp in the Gravenwood.","Book 4, Chapter 27: Repaying Treachery"}},
[2123]={nameES="Book 4, Chapter 28: Survivors",objectivesES={"Théodred wants you to speak to some of the survivors of the Falcon-clan's betrayal of the Grey Company.","Théodred is at his camp in the Gravenwood.","Saeradan, Seren, and Hogawise are at Théodred's camp in the Gravenwood.\
\
Théodred wants you to speak to survivors of the Falcon-clan's betrayal in order to learn what happened while you were imprisoned in Isengard.","Talk to Théodred at the Rohirrim scout-camp","Talk to Saeradan at the Rohirrim scout-camp","Talk to Hogawise at the Rohirrim scout-camp","Talk to Seren at the Rohirrim scout-camp","Book 4, Chapter 28: Survivors"}},
[2124]={nameES="Book 4, Chapter 29: City of Traitors",objectivesES={"You have found Théodred's forward encampment","Travel into Tâl Methedras and find Théodred's forward encampment","From his forward encampment in Tâl Methedras, Théodred makes preparations to launch an attack on Tûr Morva.","Théodred is at the forward encampment in Tâl Methedras.\
\
You have completed the necessary preparations and are now ready to attempt the rescue of the Grey Company from the prison-caves of Tûr Morva.","Théodred has established a small camp within Tâl Methedras from which he and his men will help to save the captured members of the Grey Company.","Théodred is waiting to speak with you at his forward encampment, in Tâl Methedras.","Talk to Théodred at the forward encampment in Tâl Methedras","Théodred's men have formed a camp in sight of the lake in Tâl Methedras. You should go there to begin planning the rescue of the Grey Company.","Book 4, Chapter 29: City of Traitors"}},
[2125]={nameES="Book 4, Chapter 2: Land of the Stag",objectivesES={"Scout ahead and help an inhabitant of Trum Dreng","Book 4, Chapter 2: Land of the Stag","Talk to Braigiar in Lhan Tarren, the village of the Stag-clan","Braigiar will speak with you again just across the border of Enedwaith and Dunland, at Dúvispont, in Trum Dreng.","The plains of Trum Dreng lie to the south.\
\
Braigiar has asked you to scout Trum Dreng, keeping an eye out for its residents.","You have decided to travel with the group heading south into Dunland by way of Trum Dreng, the Land of the Stag.","Braigiar is waiting to speak with you just outside Lhan Tarren, the village of the Stag-clan.\
\
You should speak with Braigiar before proceeding.","Talk to Braigiar once you arrive at Dúvispont, in Dunland"}},
[2126]={nameES="Libro 4, Capítulo 2: El Jinete Perdido",objectivesES={"El cadáver de un caballo negro yace en las ruinas de Minas Agor, situadas entre los estrechos canales del Bosque de los Trolls del Sur.\
\
Debes retirar la brida del cadáver del caballo y llevarla a Elladan.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>La Piedra élfica puede usarse para permitirte acceder a la mejora de inspiración mientras juegas en solitario o en una comunidad pequeña.</rgb>","La fuerza hincha tu pecho. Aquí es un lugar donde puedes obtener inspiración.","Libro 4, Capítulo 2: El Jinete Perdido","Retira la brida del cadáver del caballo negro.","Elladan se encuentra en Thorenhad, ubicado entre las Gargantas del Bruinen, al norte de una guarida de osos.\
\
Elladan se sentirá a la vez complacido y turbado al ver la brida del caballo negro, pues significa que el Jinete desaparecido aún se encuentra en algún lugar dentro del Bosque de los Trolls.","Usa la Piedra élfica para invocar tu inspiración interior.","Encontrarás inspiración en los lugares más oscuros.","Moscas zumban alrededor del cadáver de un caballo negro.","Si no cuentas con una comunidad completa, puedes obtener inspiración.","Brida recogida del corcel negro","Las huellas fueron descubiertas muy al sur del camino, y los hijos de Elrond creen que el Jinete desaparecido podría estar oculto en las ruinas de Minas Agor, situadas en los estrechos canales del Bosque de los Trolls del Sur.\
\
Elladan te ha pedido que sigas al Nazgûl hacia el Bosque de los Trolls del Sur.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>La Piedra élfica puede usarse para permitirte acceder a la mejora de inspiración mientras juegas en solitario o en una comunidad pequeña.</rgb>","Lleva la brida del corcel negro a Elladan.","Elladan y Elrohir han tenido una búsqueda infructuosa del Jinete desaparecido, pero finalmente los hermanos han hallado algunas huellas de su paso.","Encuentra alguna señal del Nazgûl desaparecido."}},
[2127]={nameES="Book 4, Chapter 2: The Valley of Bones",objectivesES={"Talk to Prestadír at Echad Naeglanc in the Bonevales","Prestadír will speak with you again just across the border of Enedwaith and Dunland, in the Bonevales, west of the road.","Talk to Prestadír just inside the entrance of the Bonevales, west of the road from Enedwaith","You have found the entrance to a hidden valley","Prestadír has asked you to scout the Bonevales and learn what threats may lie in wait here and to help Bledhun and his friends.","Help Bledhun and his friends, then meet Prestadír at the hidden valley","You have decided to travel with the group heading south into Dunland by way of the Bonevales.","Prestadír is waiting to speak with you at the camp he established in a hidden valley in the Bonevales.","Book 4, Chapter 2: The Valley of Bones"}},
[2128]={nameES="Book 4, Chapter 2: Too Far From the City",objectivesES={"Talk to Gandalf just inside the entrance to Minas Tirith","Prince Imrahil has dismounted from his steed just inside the gates of Minas Tirith, on the western end of the Pelennor Fields.\
\
You helped save Faramir from death at the hands of the Orcs, but he is grievously wounded. Prince Imrahil of Dol Amroth has borne him back to the city, and wishes to speak with you.","Mount your steed and talk to Derufin outside the Causeway Forts to begin the ride to Minas Tirith","Book 4, Chapter 2: Too Far From the City","Gandalf can be found just within the gates to Minas Tirith.\
\
Faramir has suffered an unnatural wound during the retreat from the Causeway Forts, and Gandalf bears a concerned expression.","The forces of the Enemy have taken the Causeway Forts, and now the expanse of the Pelennor lies between you and the walls of the White City.","Talk to Prince Imrahil just inside the entrance to Minas Tirith","Derufin is outside the Causeway Forts, on the eastern end of the Pelennor Fields.\
\
Duilin and Derufin are ready to climb aboard their steeds and ride to Minas Tirith. They wait only for your word that you are ready to do the same."}},
[2129]={nameES="Book 4, Chapter 30: The Rescue",objectivesES={"Book 4, Chapter 30: The Rescue","Talk to Halbarad at the Rohirrim scout-camp","Théodred is at the forward encampment in Tâl Methedras.\
\
Théodred is waiting to speak with you about beginning the attack on the prison-caves where the Grey Company is being held.","Théodred is satisfied with the steps you have taken to prepare and is now ready to move on the prison-caves to rescue the Grey Company.","Halbarad is at Théodred's camp in the Gravenwood.\
\
You have come alive out of the prison-caves, along with Halbarad and some other surviving members of the Grey Company.","Talk to Théodred and begin the attack on the prison-caves"}},
[2130]={nameES="Book 4, Chapter 3: South-east to Galtrev",objectivesES={}},
[2131]={nameES="Book 4, Chapter 3: South-west to Galtrev",objectivesES={}},
[2132]={nameES="Book 4, Chapter 3: The Seven Gates",objectivesES={"Talk to Doronir at the Gate of Stars to the Fifth Circle","Talk to Thalgam at the Sword-gate to the Second Circle","Talk to Garthor at the Gate of Stones to the Sixth Circle","Talk to Soromar at the Silver Gate to the Third Circle","Book 4, Chapter 3: The Seven Gates","Thalgam guards the Sword-gate to the Second Circle of Minas Tirith.\
\
Mithrandir has given his word that you can be trusted and should be taught the pass-words for each level of the city.","Talk to Mithrandir in the Court of the Fountain, in the Seventh Circle of Minas Tirith","Idhir guards the Lords' Gate to the Fourth Circle of Minas Tirith.\
\
Mithrandir has given his word that you can be trusted and should be taught the pass-words for each level of the city.","Gandalf has arranged for you to be given the pass-words to the gates of the city, so you may travel freely among the various tiers of Minas Tirith.","Talk to Linharn at the Gate of the Citadel to the Seventh Circle","Mithrandir is in the Court of the Fountain on the uppermost level of the city.\
\
You have obtained pass-words for the seven levels of Minas Tirith, and should now talk to Mithrandir in the Seventh Circle.","Soromar guards the Silver Gate to the Third Circle of Minas Tirith.\
\
Mithrandir has given his word that you can be trusted and should be taught the pass-words for each level of the city.","Garthor guards the Gate of Stones to the Sixth Circle of Minas Tirith.\
\
Mithrandir has given his word that you can be trusted and should be taught the pass-words for each level of the city.","Talk to Idhir at the Lords' Gate to the Fourth Circle","Linharn guards the Gate of the Citadel of Minas Tirith.\
\
Mithrandir has given his word that you can be trusted and should be taught the pass-words for each level of the city.","Doronir guards the Gate of Stars to the Fifth Circle of Minas Tirith.\
\
Mithrandir has given his word that you can be trusted and should be taught the pass-words for each level of the city."}},
[2133]={nameES="Libro 4, Capítulo 3: La Sabiduría del Lord Glorfindel.",objectivesES={"Lord Glorfindel se encuentra en Imladris, alto sobre el Bruinen y al este, junto a la cascada fuera de la Última Casa Amigable.\
\
Glorfindel espera hablar contigo a tu regreso del Vado del Bruinen.","Lleva el berilo de Glorfindel a Lord Glorfindel.","Los Nazgûl fueron impedidos de cruzar el Bruinen en este vado.","El Vado del Bruinen está al oeste de Imladris, al pie de las empinadas pendientes.\
\
Lord Glorfindel te ha dado un berilo y te ha pedido que pruebes sus poderes sosteniéndolo en alto en las orillas del Bruinen.","Lord Glorfindel se encuentra en Imladris, al este de Thorenhad, contemplando las cascadas junto a la Última Casa Amigable.\
\
Elladan te ha pedido que consultes con el señor Elfo Glorfindel sobre el Jinete desaparecido.","Elladan se alegró de que hayas encontrado al corcel del Jinete desaparecido, pero no estará satisfecho hasta conocer el destino de su maestro.","Libro 4, Capítulo 3: La Sabiduría del Lord Glorfindel.","Sostenés el berilo de Glorfindel en alto, y este brilla con una luz pálida.","Usa el berilo de Glorfindel en el Vado del Bruinen."}},
[2134]={nameES="Libro 4, Capítulo 4: Recuperando la Pista",objectivesES={"Lleva el berilo de Glorfindel a Elladan","Libro 4, Capítulo 4: Recuperando la Pista","Elladan está en Thorenhad, su campamento entre las Gargantas del Bruinen, al norte de las guaridas de osos.\
\
Lord Glorfindel te ha enviado de regreso a Elladan con un berilo, una piedra élfica que brilla cuando se acerca a lugares donde el gran mal ha dejado su marca.","Lord Glorfindel te dio un berilo que brilla cuando se lleva a lugares donde el gran mal ha dejado su marca."}},
[2135]={nameES="Book 4, Chapter 4: The Lower Village",objectivesES={"The angry Dunlending has been cowed","The village of Galtrev is a village divided. Does it pose a danger to the Grey Company?","Halbarad wants you to talk to the residents of Galtrev in order to learn of the situation in Pren Gwydh.","Catrin has directed you to speak with Dai, Hulun, or Idwal in Galtrev.","Talk to Catrin in Galtrev","She looks you up and down appraisingly.\
\
'You want to know what is happening in these lands? You are far from home... so far from home. In Galtrev you must not offend the wrong people. It is dangerous to make enemies here, yes it is.\
\
'If you seek information, you seek one of these three: Dai, Hulun, or Idwal. They will teach you about these lands.'","Book 4, Chapter 4: The Lower Village","Catrin is in the village of Galtrev.\
\
You have been told to speak with Catrin.","Catrin is in Galtrev.\
\
You should speak with Catrin again.","Find someone in Galtrev who will share information with you","Talk to Dai, Hulun, or Idwal"}},
[2136]={nameES="Book 4, Chapter 4: Tower of Guard",objectivesES={"Talk to Peregrin Took and complete 'Guard of the Citadel'","The Council of Gondor meets in the Dome of the Sun on the Sixth Circle of Minas Tirith. Peregrin Took can be found somewhere in the Citadel. Duilin and Derufin can be found within one of the taverns in the lower circles of the city.\
\
Mithrandir has asked you to provide help to a number of people within the city before the city is besieged.","Prince Imrahil is in the First Circle of Minas Tirith, by the main gate of the city, looking for someone to undertake a dangerous mission.","Talk to Duilin and complete 'In Need of Discipline'","Talk to Imrahil in the First Circle of Minas Tirith, by the main gate to the city","With battle on the horizon, Mithrandir wants you to help the people of Minas Tirith ready themselves for the coming storm.","Book 4, Chapter 4: Tower of Guard","Talk to Othnar and complete 'The Council of Gondor'","Mithrandir is in the Court of the Fountain on the Seventh Circle of Minas Tirith.\
\
You have aided the Council of Gondor, Peregrin Took, and the sons of Lord Duinhir of Blackroot Vale, and should now return to Mithrandir.","Talk to Mithrandir in the Court of the Fountain"}},
[2137]={nameES="Book 4, Chapter 5: Beyond the Rammas",objectivesES={"Ingold is the Captain of the Out-wall, and can be found at the North-gate in the Rammas Echor.\
\
Prince Imrahil has asked you to learn why Ingold has not yet returned to Minas Tirith, and to learn the situation in Talath Anor.","Talk to Barathant in Crithost","Prince Imrahil needs someone to learn what the situation may be north of the city, in Talath Anor.","Talk to Ingold at the North-gate in the Rammas Echor","Book 4, Chapter 5: Beyond the Rammas","If he still lives, Barathant should be somewhere within the town of Crithost, in Talath Anor.\
\
Ingold asked you to find Barathant after you defeated some of the Sûhalar Easterlings.","Warg-riders can be found throughout Talath Anor.\
\
Barathant has asked you to defeat the Warg-riders that have overrun the lands north of the Rammas Echor.","Barathant is in the town of Crithost, in Talath Anor.\
\
You defeated many foes and should now return to Crithost.","Sûhalar Easterlings can be found throughout the plains of Talath Anor, in Old Anórien.\
\
Ingold, Captain of the Out-wall, has asked you to defeat Sûhalar Easterlings throughout Talath Anor."}},
[2138]={nameES="Book 4, Chapter 5: Catrin's Rebellion",objectivesES={"The water here is a suitable location for dumping the axes","Catrin is in the lower village of Galtrev, in Pren Gwydh.\
\
Catrin will be pleased to hear that you have disrupted work at the lumber-camp.","Lumber-piles can be found in the upper village of Galtrev.\
\
Catrin in the lower village of Galtrev has a torch for you to carry to lumber-piles throughout the upper village.","The pond where Catrin wanted you to throw the lumber-axes is east of the lumber-camp.\
\
Catrin asked you to steal lumber-axes from the camp north-east of Galtrev and throw them into the pond east of the camp.","Catrin desires to use you in her efforts to make things difficult for Saruman's servants in Pren Gwydh.","Find the pond in which to throw the lumber axes","Talk to Catrin in Galtrev","Throw the bundle of axes into the pond","The lumber-camp in Pren Gwydh is north-east of Galtrev.\
\
Catrin has asked you to steal axes at the lumber-camp or from other hostile Dunlendings throughout Pren Gwydh, then throw the axes in a pond east of the camp.","The lumber axes fall beneath the surface of the water","Talk to Catrin at Galtrev","Book 4, Chapter 5: Catrin's Rebellion","Catrin is in the lower village of Galtrev.\
\
You have burned wood-piles throughout the upper village and should return now to Catrin."}},
[2139]={nameES="Libro 4, Capítulo 5: Oculto en la Oscuridad",objectivesES={"Encuentra la cámara más profunda de Nurath","Encuentra la cámara más profunda de Thingroth","Elladan está en Thorenhad, su campamento entre las Gargantas del Bruinen, al norte de las guaridas de osos.\
\
Elladan espera saber qué reveló el berilo de Glorfindel: que el Nazgûl desaparecido nunca estuvo en ninguna de las cuevas que buscaste.","Sostienes el berilo de Glorfindel en alto, pero permanece oscuro.","Libro 4, Capítulo 5: Oculto en la Oscuridad","Has llegado a la cámara más profunda de Thingroth.","Elladan te entregó sus notas con las ubicaciones de las cuevas de trolls.\
\
Elladan quiere que busques tres cuevas de trolls con el berilo de Glorfindel.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Usar la Piedra Élfica Brillante te permite acceder al beneficio de inspiración mientras estás solo o en una hermandad más pequeña.</rgb>","Has llegado a la cámara más profunda de Torogrod.","La fuerza crece en tu pecho. Aquí puedes usar la Piedra Élfica Brillante para recurrir a la inspiración.","Usar el berilo de Glorfindel.","Has llegado a la cámara más profunda de Nurath.","Si no estás en una comunidad, puedes usar la Piedra Élfica Brillante para invocar inspiración.","Encuentra la cámara más profunda de Torogrod","Elladan ha determinado que el Jinete desaparecido podría estar escondido en alguna de las muchas cuevas que salpican los riscos de los Bosque de los Trolls y quiere que busques varias de ellas con el berilo de Glorfindel.","Devuelve el berilo de Glorfindel a Elladan."}},
[2140]={nameES="Libro 4, Capítulo 6: El saber de los Onodrim",objectivesES={"Uno de los Onodrim, criatura de días antiguos, fue visto en el valle de los gigantes al sur del Páramo Alto, en lo alto sobre el Bruinen. Según los informes, Barachen lo vio de pie junto a unos árboles imponentes cuando descendía hacia el valle.\
\
Barachen afirmó haber visto a uno de los Onodrim en algún lugar del Bosque de los Trolls, y Elladan cree que es posible que este Onod sepa algo sobre el paradero del Nazgûl desaparecido.","Encuentra al Onod","El Onod te observa con ojos inexpresivos. Su piel, semejante a la corteza, está marcada por la corrupción, y su boca se abre y cierra sin emitir sonido. ¡De pronto, los pozos profundos de sus ojos se agitan con ira!","Libro 4, Capítulo 6: El saber de los Onodrim","Mientras buscabas en las cuevas de los Trollshaws alguna señal del Nazgûl desaparecido, Elladan oyó hablar de uno de los Onodrim en los parajes salvajes que podría conocer el paradero del Jinete.","Barachen se encuentra en su campamento, al sur del Gran Camino del Este que cruza el Bosque de los Trolls del sur. Los exploradores que custodian el camino podrán guiarte hasta él.\
\
Elladan te contó que Barachen informó haber visto a uno de los Onodrim en algún lugar del Bosque de los Trolls y quiere que hables con él al respecto.","Elladan está en Thorenhad, su campamento en las Gargantas del Bruinen, al norte de las cuevas de osos.\
\
Elladan se inquietará al conocer el destino del Onod que Barachen vio en el valle de los gigantes.","Has derrotado al troll silvano"}},
[2141]={nameES="Book 4, Chapter 6: The Net Closes",objectivesES={"Ingold, the Captain of the Out-wall, is at the North-gate of the Rammas Echor.","Brúnion gladly agrees with you, and runs off","Find Cangrail and tell her to return","Talk to Barathant in Crithost","You cannot wait any longer for him to arrive!","Find Brúnion and tell him to return","Retreat to Minas Tirith and talk to Imrahil in the First Circle of the city","Cangrail and Brúnion can be found to the north-west and north-east of Crithost, in Talath Anor.\
\
Barathant asked you to find and recall the scout he sent out from Crithost, and to defeat any enemies you come across in Talath Anor.","Ingold, the Captain of the Out-wall, is at the North-gate of the Rammas Echor.\
\
The scouts in Talath Anor are retreating to the North-gate, and you should do the same. Ingold is waiting for your return.","Barathant never returned to the North-gate, but Ingold cannot wait long for him.","She agrees that it is time to return, and runs off","Book 4, Chapter 6: The Net Closes","Wait for Barathant at the North-gate of the Rammas Echor","Barathant is almost ready to return to the city, but first he wants you to recall the scouts he sent out from Crithost.","Talk to Ingold at the North-gate of the Rammas Echor","Barathant is in the town of Crithost, waiting to hear that his scouts have agreed to return to the North-gate of the Rammas Echor.","Prince Imrahil is in the First Circle of Minas Tirith, waiting for you to return with news of the situation in Talath Anor."}},
[2142]={nameES="Book 4, Chapter 6: The Will to Stand",objectivesES={"Tûr Morva is in Tâl Methedras, to the east of Pren Gwydh.\
\
Catrin has asked you to aid the people of Galtrev and Pren Gwydh as much as you can before moving on to Tâl Methedras.","The guard looks you up and down, suspiciously.\
\
'You say you have helped Catrin in Galtrev? That old woman is always sending us help, but the help is almost never what we need. If you and these Rangers are different, I will bring some of you to see Lheu Brenin. But I hope you do not expect aid from us. The People of the Falcon have their own problems.'","Léolin is suspicious of you, but has agreed to bring you to meet Lheu Brenin.\
\
You have met the guard at the pass into Tâl Methedras, but he is wary of you and the Rangers. He is waiting to travel with you to Tûr Morva.","Book 4, Chapter 6: The Will to Stand","Catrin of the Falcon-clan wants you to help the oppressed people of Galtrev and those who live throughout Pren Gwydh.","Talk to Penrod in Tûr Morva","Talk to Léolin, and he will bring you to Tûr Morva","Aid the people of Pren Gwydh as much as you can before moving on to Tâl Methedras","Penrod is waiting to speak with you in Tûr Morva."}},
[2143]={nameES="Book 4, Chapter 7: Aiding Tûr Morva",objectivesES={"Talk to Lheu Brenin in Tûr Morva","Penrod will be glad to hear that you have aided the people of Tûr Morva with their preparations.","Penrod has told you there is much work to do before the Falcon-clan can have much hope of standing against Saruman.","Talk to Penrod in Tûr Morva","Book 4, Chapter 7: Aiding Tûr  Morva","Each member of the Falcon-clan in Tûr Morva has a task to do to prepare for battle against Saruman. Penrod has asked you to aid them with their tasks.","Lheu Brenin is outside his home, up the hill to the south of Penrod, in Tûr Morva.\
\
Penrod has told you that the Brenin wants to see you concerning some trouble with the captive emissary of Isengard."}},
[2144]={nameES="Book 4, Chapter 7: Ring of Foes",objectivesES={"The enemies of Gondor approach Minas Tirith from the north and from the east, and many folk in the city desire your help before the city is completely surrounded.","Talk to Arodor and complete 'A Long Siege'","Talk to Ormatar in the Citadel atop Minas Tirith","Talk to Imrahil in the First Circle of Minas Tirith, by the main gate to the city","The Council of Gondor meets in the Dome of the Sun on the Sixth Circle of Minas Tirith. Mithrandir can be found at the Court of the Fountain, in the Citadel atop the city. Echadon can be found at the south end of the Second Circle.\
\
Imrahil has asked you to provide help to a number of people within the city before the city is encircled by a ring of foes.","Book 4, Chapter 7: Ring of Foes","Talk to Echadon and complete 'Reserves of Courage'","Prince Imrahil is in the First Circle of Minas Tirith, by the main gate of the city, preparing for battle.","Ormatar is in the Citadel, the highest level of Minas Tirith.\
\
You learned that Ormatar has been seeking you, and you should find out what he wants.","Talk to Mithrandir and complete 'A Matter of Lineage'"}},
[2145]={nameES="Libro 4, Capítulo 7: La Ayuda del Bosque Negro",objectivesES={"Legolas está en una de las habitaciones de huéspedes de la Casa de Elrond.\
\
El Maestro Elrond te ha hablado de un príncipe elfo llamado Legolas, que actualmente se encuentra en Imladris por un tiempo. Proviene del Bosque Negro y puede tener conocimiento sobre la criatura que enfrentaste en las Quebradas de los Trolls.","Habla con Legolas en Rivendel","El Maestro Elrond está en Imladris, muy al este del campamento de Elladan en Thorenhad y por encima del Bruinen.\
\
Elladan te ha pedido que hables con su padre para concertar una audiencia con los Elfos visitantes del Bosque Negro, quienes podrían tener experiencia con criaturas como la que encontraste.","Libro 4, Capítulo 7: La Ayuda del Bosque Negro"}},
[2146]={nameES="Book 4, Chapter 8: The Messenger of Isengard",objectivesES={"Nai has given you permission to enter the cell with Dondhreg to see if you can get any information from the captive emissary.","Talk to Lheu Brenin in Tûr Morva","Talk to Nai at the prison cave","Book 4, Chapter 8: The Messenger of Isengard","Talk to Dondhreg","Lheu Brenin wants you to speak with the emissary of Isengard he is holding captive in the cave behind Tûr Morva.","Nai is guarding the captive emissary of Isengard in the prison-cave, south of Lheu Brenin and in the wall of the cliff to your left.\
\
Lheu Brenin has asked you to press the captive for information. First, you should speak to the guard Nai outside his cell.","You have spoken with Dondhreg, but if there was anything valuable in his words it will be up to Lheu Brenin to discern it."}},
[2147]={nameES="Libro 4, Capítulo 8: El sendero sin marcar",objectivesES={"Libro 4, Capítulo 8: El sendero sin marcar","Legolas está en Rivendel, en una de las estancias de huéspedes de la Casa de Elrond.\
\
El príncipe élfico del Bosque Negro, Legolas, espera ayudarte a rastrear a los trolls silvanos en el Bosque de los Trolls y derrotarlos.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Esta misión está pensada para una comunidad. Si decides emprenderla en solitario recibirás una bonificación de inspiración, pero el desafío será grande.</rgb>","Habla con Legolas en Rivendel y sigue el rastro de los trolls silvanos.","Habla con Legolas en Rivendel","Legolas reconoció a la criatura que describiste como uno de los trolls silvanos y ha accedido a ayudarte a rastrear a los demás.","Legolas está en Rivendel, en una de las estancias de huéspedes de la Casa de Elrond.\
\
El príncipe élfico del Bosque Negro, Legolas, espera hablar contigo sobre lo que ambos visteis en la guarida de los trolls silvanos."}},
[2148]={nameES="Book 4, Chapter 8: What the Steward Saw",objectivesES={"Talk to Mithrandir in besieged Minas Tirith, in the south-eastern area of the Second Circle","Mithrandir is in besieged Minas Tirith, in the south-eastern area of the Second Circle.\
\
<rgb=#00FF00>Minas Tirith is besieged! You may examine the model of the city in the Dome of the Sun to travel between states of the city.</rgb>","Book 4, Chapter 8: What the Steward Saw","Talk to Peregrin Took and travel with him to your audience with Denethor","Peregrin Took is in the Seventh Circle of the city.\
\
You have been summoned before Denethor, the Steward of Gondor. Peregrin Took has been charged with bringing you into Denethor's presence.","As the armies of Mordor begin to encircle the city, the Steward of Gondor summons you before him."}},
[2149]={nameES="Libro 4, Capítulo 9: Apresura su Partida",objectivesES={"Legolas se ha sentido consternado por los acontecimientos en la guarida de los trolls silvanos y cree que Elrond debe ser informado de inmediato.","Libro 4, Capítulo 9: Apresura su Partida","El Maestro Elrond está dentro de La Última Morada.\
\
Legolas te ha pedido que vayas con Elrond de inmediato y le cuentes lo que ocurrió en la guarida de Taushakh, rey de los trolls silvanos."}},
[2150]={nameES="Book 4, Chapter 9: Return to Galtrev",objectivesES={"Catrin is in Galtrev, the Dunlending village in Pren Gwydh, west of Tâl Methedras.\
\
Lheu Brenin has asked you to travel through the lands of Dunland, seeing where the loyalties of the Dunlending clans lie and aiding those of like mind.","Lheu Brenin has given you a task that will help gauge the severity of the threat posed to both the Falcon-clan and the Grey Company.","Book 4, Chapter 9: Return to Galtrev","Talk to Catrin in Galtrev","Talk to Wadu's Ghost in Pren Gwydh"}},
[2151]={nameES="Book 4, Chapter 9: The City Besieged",objectivesES={"Book 4, Chapter 9: The City Besieged","Talk to Lamlor in the besieged Dome of the Sun and complete 'The Withered Tree'","Lamlor can be found in the Dome of the Sun in besieged Minas Tirith. Ingold can be found atop the wall on the north end of the Third Circle in besieged Minas Tirith. Rathon can be found in the Sixth Circle near the street to the Citadel in besieged Minas Tirith.\
\
<rgb=#00FF00>Minas Tirith is besieged! You may examine the model of the city in the Dome of the Sun to travel between states of the city.</rgb>","With Steward Denethor shut in the tower, mourning the final hours of his son Faramir, it is up to Mithrandir and Imrahil to mount the defence of the besieged city.","Prince Imrahil is in besieged Minas Tirith, atop the wall on the south-east end of the Second Circle.\
\
<rgb=#00FF00>Minas Tirith is besieged! You may examine the model of the city in the Dome of the Sun to travel between states of the city.</rgb>","Talk to Prince Imrahil in besieged Minas Tirith, atop the wall on the south-east end of the Second Circle","Talk to Rathon in the besieged city and complete 'Fires in the City'","Talk to Ingold in the besieged city and complete 'Mad With Terror'"}},
[2152]={nameES="Libro 4, Prólogo: Los Problemas de Rivendel",objectivesES={"Elrond espera en la biblioteca, en el piso superior de su casa.\
\
Aragorn te pidió que te presentaras ante Elrond, el maestro de La Última Morada.","Aragorn te ha pedido que hables con Elrond sobre un asunto de suma importancia para Rivendel.","Libro 4, Prólogo: Los Problemas de Rivendel"}},
[2153]={nameES="Libro 5, Capítulo 1: El legado de Azog",objectivesES={"Glúmur se encuentra en la parte superior de las escaleras que dominan la cámara de Nud-melek.\
\
Has derrotado a muchos de los leales sirvientes de Mazog, los Pûlpum, y deberías volver ahora con Glúmur.","Glúmur se encuentra en Nud-melek, con vistas a la fortaleza de Mazog.\
\
Bori te ha pedido que hables con su explorador cerca de Zabadgathol, y que le ayudes a explorar la zona.","Libro 5, Capítulo 1: El legado de Azog","Bori se encuentra en la Cámara de Liderazgo, cerca de la Sala Vigesimoprimera, en Zelem-melek.\
\
Bróin te ha pedido que adviertas a Bori sobre el exceso de confianza que teme que la recuperación de Zigilburk haya despertado en los enanos.","Habla con Glúmur","Localiza y habla con Glúmur en Nud-melek","Bróin teme que recuperar Zigilburk no sea tan beneficioso como parece, y que provoque un exceso de confianza en los enanos.","Zabadgathol, la fortaleza de Mazog, se encuentra en Nud-melek.\
\
Bori te ha pedido que busques Zabadgathol y que derrotes a algunos de los guardias más leales de Mazog, miembros de los Pûlpum."}},
[2154]={nameES="Libro 5, Capítulo 1: Hacia las Montañas Nubladas",objectivesES={"Libro 5, Capítulo 1: Hacia las Montañas Nubladas","Glóin puede encontrarse en el campamento en lo alto del paso que lleva desde Rivendel a las Montañas Nubladas.\
\
Elrond sugirió que buscaras la ayuda de Glóin en la caza del Nazgûl.","Elrond cree que el Nazgûl que ahuyentaste del Bosque de los Trolls ha huido a las Montañas Nubladas. Te ha pedido que continúes la persecución del Nazgûl con la ayuda de Glóin."}},
[2155]={nameES="Book 5, Chapter 1: Separate Ways",objectivesES={"Saeradan is at the camp in the Gravenwood, by the fire.\
\
Halbarad has decided that your path and the Grey Company's must now diverge, and you should say your good-byes to the Rangers.","Radanir nods at you, but keeps his peace.","Talk to Saeradan by the fire at the camp in the Gravenwood","Golodir nods at you, but keeps his peace.","Halbarad is at the camp in the Gravenwood, trying to decide how to safely proceed with the Grey Company's mission and how to help Théodred at the same time.","Book 5, Chapter 1: Separate Ways","Calenglad nods at you, but keeps his peace.","Prestadír nods at you, but keeps his peace.","Corunir nods at you, but keeps his peace."}},
[2156]={nameES="Book 5, Chapter 1: Separate Ways",objectivesES={"Radanir nods at you, but keeps his peace.","Golodir nods at you, but keeps his peace.","Corunir was last seen down the path north-west of the camp in the Gravenwood, by a large boulder.\
\
You have spoken with Saeradan, and he told you to find Corunir and say good-bye.","Book 5, Chapter 1: Separate Ways","Your path now diverges from that of the Grey Company, and Halbarad wants you to make your farewells before you take your leave.","Calenglad nods at you, but keeps his peace.","Prestadír nods at you, but keeps his peace.","Talk to Corunir on the path north-west of the camp in the Gravenwood","Halbarad nods at you, but keeps his peace."}},
[2157]={nameES="Book 5, Chapter 1: Separate Ways",objectivesES={"Radanir nods at you, but keeps his peace.","Talk to Golodir in the shade of a boulder west of Corunir, in the Gravenwood","Book 5, Chapter 1: Separate Ways","Golodir is to the west of Corunir's location near the camp in the Gravenwood.\
\
Corunir wants you to speak with Golodir before you go.","The time has come for your path to diverge from that of the Grey Company, and you should say your farewells to the Rangers.","Calenglad nods at you, but keeps his peace.","Prestadír nods at you, but keeps his peace.","Halbarad nods at you, but keeps his peace."}},
[2158]={nameES="Book 5, Chapter 1: Separate Ways",objectivesES={"Radanir nods at you but keeps his peace.","Calenglad is at the Tree of Tribute, in the Gravenwood.\
\
Golodir has sent you to say your good-byes to Calenglad.","Halbarad nods at you and keeps his peace.","Talk to Calenglad by the Tree of Tribute in the Gravenwood","Book 5, Chapter 1: Separate Ways","Corunir nods at you, but there is nothing left to say and he keeps his peace.","The time has come for your path to diverge from that of the Grey Company, and you should say your farewells.","Prestadír nods at you, but keeps his peace."}},
[2159]={nameES="Book 5, Chapter 1: Separate Ways",objectivesES={"Talk to Radanir on the road east of the Tree of Tribute, in the Gravenwood","The time has come for your path to diverge from that of the Grey Company, and for you to bid the Rangers farewell.","Halbarad nods at you, and keeps his peace.","Book 5, Chapter 1: Separate Ways","Radanir is on the road east of the Tree of Tribute, in the Gravenwood.\
\
Calenglad has told you to say your good-byes to Radanir, or the Rangers would never hear the end of it.","Prestadír nods at you, but keeps his peace.","Golodir nods at you, but there is nothing left to say, and he keeps his peace.","Corunir nods at you, but there is nothing left to say, and he keeps his peace."}},
[2160]={nameES="Book 5, Chapter 1: Separate Ways",objectivesES={"Calenglad nods at you, but there is nothing left to say and he keeps his peace.","The time has come for your path to diverge from that of the Grey Company, and you should bid farewell to the Rangers.","Halbarad nods at you, and keeps his peace.","Talk to Prestadír by the winding road up to the camp in the Gravenwood","Book 5, Chapter 1: Separate Ways","Corunir nods at you, but there is nothing left to say and he keeps his peace.","Golodir nods at you, but there is nothing left to say and he keeps his peace.","Prestadír is to the north-east of Radanir, by the path that winds up to the camp in the Gravenwood.\
\
You should now say your good-byes to Prestadír."}},
[2161]={nameES="Book 5, Chapter 1: Separate Ways",objectivesES={"Radanir nods at you, but there is nothing left to say and he keeps his peace.","Talk to Halbarad in the camp in the Gravenwood","Calenglad nods at you, but there is nothing left to say and he keeps his peace.","Book 5, Chapter 1: Separate Ways","Halbarad is in the camp in the Gravenwood.\
\
You have made your farewells and should return now to Halbarad.","Corunir nods at you, but there is nothing left to be said and he keeps his peace.","Golodir nods at you, but there is nothing left to be said and he keeps his peace.","The time has come for your path to diverge from that of the Grey Company, and you should bid your farewells to the Rangers."}},
[2162]={nameES="Book 5, Chapter 1: The Spread of Rumour",objectivesES={"Enter the City Stables of Minas Tirith, in the First Circle","Book 5, Chapter 1: The Spread of Rumour","The damage is done, but some of the worried men might still be encouraged","Mithrandir is worried about what will befall Minas Tirith if the Rohirrim do not arrive in time, as Denethor foretold, and has asked you to seek for them.","Talk to Derufin on the second level of the City Stables","The stables smell of hay and manure, and men speak in low, worried voices","Worried soldiers can be found throughout the City Stables of Minas Tirith.\
\
Duilin and Derufin have spread the rumour of Gothmog's invulnerability to death among the soldiers in the City Stables. You should do what you can to encourage the worried soldiers there, despite this troubling news.","The City Stables are in the First Circle of Minas Tirith, opposite the main gate of the city.\
\
Mithrandir asked you to go to the City Stables of Minas Tirith and ask Lobordil for a rested steed to bring you past the enemy line, north into Talath Anor.","Lobordil is in the City Stables of Minas Tirith.\
\
Despite the ill-advised rumour-spreading of the brothers of the Blackroot Vale, you still have a task set before you by Mithrandir: you must procure a rested steed from Lobordil in the City Stables, so you can seek the Rohirrim with all haste.","Duilin and Derufin are on the second level of the City Stables of Minas Tirith, up the stairs in the rear.\
\
You spoke what hopeful words you could to the worried soldiers in the City Stables, but it seemed to be of no use.","Talk to Lobordil in the City Stables","Lobordil is in the City Stables of Minas Tirith.\
\
Mithrandir asked you to speak to Lobordil in the City Stables, in order to procure a rested horse to bring you in search of Théoden and his Riders.","Duilin and Derufin must be told not to spread this news any further","Duilin and Derufin are on the second level of the City Stables of Minas Tirith, up the stairs in the rear.\
\
Lobordil learned much from Duilin and Derufin that he should not have, and now should speak to them and learn who they spoke to about Gothmog.","Talk to Duilin on the second level of the City Stables"}},
[2163]={nameES="Book 5, Chapter 2: Grimbold",objectivesES={"Book 5, Chapter 2: Grimbold","This table is used by the Rohirrim to plan their strategy and movements","Find the map table in Grimbold's camp","Talk to Trumbald on the road north of Grimbold's camp","Talk to Théodred in Grimbold's camp","Grimbold's camp is in the Heathfells, south-east of the Gravenwood.\
\
Halbarad wants you to offer your help to Grimbold, Théodred's second in command at the fords of the river Isen.","Travel to Grimbold's camp and speak with Grimbold","Talk to Cynstan on the west bank of the Ford of Isen","Théodred is in Grimbold's camp, overseeing the preparations of his men.\
\
You have familiarized yourself with the situation in the Heathfells and should now find Théodred.","The map table is in the south-east corner of Grimbold's camp. Trumbald is on the road north of the camp. Cynstan is south of the camp, on the western bank of the ford.\
\
Grimbold has asked you to become acquainted with the layout of his camp and to speak with several of the scouts to learn of the situation here.","You have said your farewells to the Grey Company, and it is now time to travel south to Théodred and Grimbold's camp in the Heathfells."}},
[2164]={nameES="Book 5, Chapter 2: Ride Swift and Sure",objectivesES={"You become aware of a strange creature watching you","Lobordil provided you a rested horse to carry you with all haste along the road north of Minas Tirith in search of help.","Cross the bridge into Taur Drúadan, north-west of Hirgon's body","You leap from the back of your borrowed horse at the sight before you","You have found the remains of Hirgon, and his mortally-wounded fellow soldier, north of Minas Tirith, in Talath Anor.","The strange tracks continue to the south-west within the wood.","Study the strange tracks beneath the eaves of the wood","The drumming has become quite loud now, and you feel uneasy, as if you are being watched.","You have never seen tracks such as these before. Some figure walked here on two legs, but the grooves on either side cannot be explained.\
\
As you study the tracks and see they continue to the south-west, you hear the distant sound of drums emanating from deeper in the wood.","If the road through the Beacon-marches is held by the Enemy, you will need to pass through the wood to the south-west to reach Théoden.","You should enter the wood to the south-west if you are to find Théoden","You have found even more strange tracks","You feel as if you are being watched","The strange tracks continue to the south-west within the wood, and the drumming has gotten louder.","You should cross the bridge north-west of the bodies of Hirgon and Andothol, and decide what to do next.","Talk to Andothol where Hirgon lies, in Talath Anor","Travel south-west in search of more tracks","Travel further south-west seeking more of the strange tracks","Strange tracks on the dirt floor of the wood bear further inspection","There are strange tracks in the earth beneath the woods' canopy.","A strange squat creature watches you within the Drúadan Forest.","The tracks continue to the south-west, toward the distant drums","Lobordil has provided you with a rested horse to go in search of help along the northern road.","As you study the strange tracks, you notice that you have gotten closer to the drumming, though it is still distant. The tracks continue to the south-west. What creature has made these markings, and is it responsible for the drumming as well?","Travel north into Talath Anor in search of help","Enter the wood to the south-west, in Taur Drúadan","Talk to the strange creature in the Drúadan Forest","You have found more strange tracks, and they bear further inspection","Andothol speaks the truth. Théoden cannot come by the road","The tracks continue to the south-west","Book 5, Chapter 2: Ride Swift and Sure"}},
[2165]={nameES="Libro 5, Capítulo 2: Trasgos problemáticos",objectivesES={"Glóin está en su campamento al norte de Rivendel.\
\
Al derrotar a Gurzmat, lo encuentras acompañado por enanos Duramano hostiles. Glóin debe ser informado de inmediato sobre este acontecimiento.","Encuentra el campamento de los trasgos","Los trasgos tienen muchos campamentos entre las crestas de Pinnath Fenui, muy al este y al norte del campamento de Glóin.\
\
Glóin te dijo que, si buscas los campamentos de trasgos en las Montañas Nubladas, deberías encontrar a un trasgo llamado Gurzmat. Parece ser su líder, y al derrotarlo deberías sembrar la confusión entre los trasgos y, quizás, encontrar el rastro del Nazgûl.","Los campamentos de los trasgos se extienden a lo largo de las crestas de Pinnath Fenui.","Glóin te dijo que los trasgos parecen muy activos últimamente, y que no le sorprendería que el Nazgûl al que persigues fuese la causa.","Libro 5, Capítulo 2: Trasgos problemáticos","Gurzmat está en algún lugar profundo dentro del campamento de trasgos que se extiende por las crestas de Pinnath Fenui.\
\
Glóin te dijo que, al derrotar al trasgo Gurzmat, sembrarías la confusión entre los trasgos y quizás halles el rastro del Nazgûl que buscas."}},
[2166]={nameES="Book 5, Chapter 3: Older Than the Hills",objectivesES={"Talk to Wêg-pulo-Ghûr in Drû Bhûta","Book 5, Chapter 3: Older Than the Hills","Talk to Khôr-buri-Ghân and tell him about yourself","Khôr-buri-Ghân is in the Drúadan Forest.\
\
He has introduced himself as the son of the chief of the Wild Men, and wants to know what you are seeking and if it will prove harmful to the gorgûn.","You tell him that the Riders of Rohan have set forth from their kingdom to the aid of Gondor, but they will be slowed by the Orcs that have blockaded the road to Minas Tirith. You are unsure if anything can be done to clear the road in time, and tell him so.\
\
'Wild Men may know a way. Not Khôr-buri-Ghân's place to say. Come to Drû Bhûta. Speak to Ghân-buri-Ghân. He will speak for Wild Men.\
\
'Drû Bhûta village to west. Must go north-west through rocks, across water. Then back south. Hidden path. Look for narrow path climbing south-west. Khôr-buri-Ghân see you at front of village.'","Talk to Âm-buri-Sôl in Drû Bhûta","Talk to Khôr-buri-Ghân at the entrance to Drû Bhûta","Khôr-buri-Ghân is in the Drúadan Forest.\
\
He has introduced himself as the son of the chief of the Wild Men, and wants to know who you are and what brings you to his lands.","You introduce yourself and say from where you have come.\
\
'You are friend of Stonehouse-folk? Build walls, long time since they see Wild Men. In danger now.\
\
'You have welcome from Khôr-buri-Ghân, for time. If you prove false you will not live long in forest. You are no friend of gorgûn? Tell Khôr-buri-Ghân now.'","Ghân-buri-Ghân, the leader of the Wild Men, can be found in the village of Drû Bhûta.","You have encountered one of the Wild Men of the Drúadan Forest. Can he or his people be of help to you?","He waits for you to speak again","Khôr-buri-Ghân's fellow Wild Men can be found throughout their village of Drû Bhûta.","Khôr-buri-Ghân is in the Drúadan Forest.\
\
He has introduced himself as the son of the chief of the Wild Men, and wants to know if you are a friend of the gorgûn.","Khôr-buri-Ghân is at the entrance to Drû Bhûta.","Talk to Khôr-buri-Ghân and tell him what you seek","You decide that the word gorgûn can only mean Orc-folk, and tell him that you hate gorgûn and their presence on the road has driven you into the forest.\
\
'Khôr-buri-Ghân knew this! Wild Men hate gorgûn. Kill gorgûn whenever come into wood. What do you seek? If it oppose gorgûn, Khôr-buri-Ghân wants it done, will help.'","Khôr-buri-Ghân is waiting to welcome you to the village of Drû Bhûta.","Talk to Mân-weni-Mhên in Drû Bhûta","Find the entrance to Drû Bhûta, the village of the Wild Men","The entrance to Drû Bhûta is flanked by great Púkel-men","He waits for your answer","Khôr-buri-Ghân gave you directions to Drû Bhûta, the village of the Wild Men. He said: 'Drû Bhûta village to west. Must go north-west through rocks, across water. Then back south. Hidden path. Look for narrow path climbing south-west.'\
\
You hope you can follow that!","Talk to Khôr-buri-Ghân and answer his question","Talk to Ghân-buri-Ghân"}},
[2167]={nameES="Libro 5, Capítulo 3: La Gran Fortaleza",objectivesES={"Lleva los planos de Gabilazan a Glóin","Libro 5, Capítulo 3: La Gran Fortaleza","Lleva los planos de Gabilazan a Glóin.","Recolecta los planos de la piedra angular de Gabilazan","La piedra angular que contiene los planos se halla dentro de la Bóveda de Gabilazan, ubicada en uno de los dos pasos al este del campamento de Glóin. El campamento de Glóin está al norte de Rivendel.\
\
Glóin te dijo que, para aprender cómo acceder a la entrada secreta de la torre interior de Gabilazan, necesitarás tomar los planos de la fortaleza colocados en su piedra angular.","Busca la piedra angular de Gabilazan","Buscando la piedra angular, descubres los planos de Gabilazan.","Planos de Gabilazan recolectados","Glóin te dijo que el Nazgûl al que persigues puede encontrarse en la antigua fortaleza enana de Gabilazan, en compañía de Skorgrím Duramano. Ambos entraron en la casi inexpugnable torre interior de la fortaleza. Glóin cree que la única forma de acceder a la torre interior es aprender la ubicación de su entrada secreta."}},
[2168]={nameES="Book 5, Chapter 3: Training on the Banks",objectivesES={"Book 5, Chapter 3: Training on the Banks","Bring the nets to Rungar","Riders are practicing their net-throwing down the hill to the east of Rungar.\
\
Rungar has asked you to collect some of the thrown nets and bring them back to him.","Rungar is just to the north of Grimbold's camp, seeing to the training of riders under his command.\
\
Athelard has asked you to help Rungar with the training of his riders.","Grimbold is in his camp in the Heathfells.\
\
Théodred has told you to speak with Grimbold if you wish to help the Rohirrim with their plan to take Saruman by surprise.","Rohirrim footmen and archers are training on the eyot in the Ford.\
\
Athelard has asked you to help train the footmen and archers under his command.","Athelard is on the eyot in the middle of the Isen, overseeing the training of his men.\
\
You have practiced sparring with the footmen and archers serving with Athelard and should tell him of your experience.","Athelard is on the eyot in the middle of the river, south-east of Grimbold's camp.\
\
Théodred wants you to help Athelard with training some of the youths who have seen less combat.","Rungar is north of Grimbold's camp.\
\
You have collected some of the nets thrown by the riders and should bring them to Rungar.","You have helped to strengthen the Rohirrim footman","Talk to Théodred in Grimbold's Camp","Talk to Grimbold","Talk to Rungar","Talk to a Rohirrim archer training on the eyot","Talk to a Rohirrim footman training on the eyot","You have helped to strengthen the Rohirrim archer","Talk to Athelard on the eyot in the Isen","The Rohirrim charged with holding the Ford of Isen are training so they will be ready when the need arises to push back Saruman's forces.","Théodred is in Grimbold's camp, south of Rungar.\
\
Rungar has sent you to see Théodred."}},
[2169]={nameES="Book 5, Chapter 4: The Hated Orcs",objectivesES={"Ghân-buri-Ghân is in the village of Drû Bhûta.\
\
You entered Maudhúl Grak near Amon Dîn and recovered the body of Ghân-buri-Ghân's son, slain by Orcs. His other son, Khôr-buri-Ghân, has asked you to return to the Ghân and report your success.","Khôr-buri-Ghân asked you to draw the enemy's attention by entering the Orc-camp, Maudhúl Grak.","Proceed further into Maudhúl Grak and draw the enemy's eye","The wind gently sighs through the branches of the Blood-cloak as you approach","There are many dead Orcs here. Khôr-buri-Ghân has been busy!","Book 5, Chapter 4: The Hated Orcs","You have found more dead Orcs. Khôr-buri-Ghân is further ahead to the north-west","Ghân-buri-Ghân has set before you a task to complete, and if you are successful he has pledged to help the Rohirrim with their passage.","Talk to Khôr-buri-Ghân at the Blood-cloak in Drû Bhûta","Enter Maudhúl Grak and draw the enemy's eye","Talk to Ghân-buri-Ghân in Drû Bhûta","You should return to Drû Bhûta and speak with Ghân-buri-Ghân.","Talk to Khôr-buri-Ghân outside the Orc-camp near Amon Dîn","Khôr-buri-Ghân is in the depths of Maudhúl Grak, waiting to speak with you.","Khôr-buri-Ghân has gone to the Orc-camp on the road north of the Drúadan Forest.\
\
Ghân-buri-Ghân has offered to help the Rohirrim if you will help his youngest son recover the body of his slain eldest.","Return to Drû Bhûta","Talk to Khôr-buri-Ghân in Maudhúl Grak","Khôr-buri-Ghân asked you to draw the enemy's attention by entering the Orc-camp.","Travel to the Blood-cloak in Drû Bhûta, on a rocky cliff on the eastern side of the huge waterfall","The Blood-cloak is to the east of the great waterfall in Drû Bhûta, atop a large rocky cliff. It is the location where the Wild Men perform their funerary rites."}},
[2170]={nameES="Libro 5, Capítulo 4: La Piedra Clave",objectivesES={"Recolecta la Piedra Clave","La bóveda enana que contiene la Piedra Clave se encuentra en el Mirador de Iskeld, cerca de la naciente del Bruinen. Glóin está en su campamento al norte de Rivendel.\
\
Glóin te ha pedido que recuperes una Piedra Clave de una antigua bóveda enana. La Piedra Clave permitirá el acceso a la fortaleza enana ocupada por los Duramano.","Lleva la Piedra Clave a Glóin","Libro 5, Capítulo 4: La Piedra Clave","Glóin descubrió la entrada secreta a la torre interior de Gabilazan, pero el acceso está cerrado y requiere un artefacto de los viejos tiempos.","Piedra Clave recolectada"}},
[2171]={nameES="Book 5, Chapter 4: The Prince of Rohan",objectivesES={"Examine the map table and complete 'Battle of the Ford, Sunset'","You study the maps placed on the table and consider Théodred's plan.\
\
If all goes well, the Prince should have victory by afternoon. If all goes well....\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>This is a Solo quest and cannot be completed with a Fellowship.</rgb>","You study the maps placed on the table and consider Théodred's plan.\
\
When the sun sets on the Twenty-fifth of February, Théodred expects to return to the Ford with newfound confidence in his defences. Perhaps it will be so.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>This is a Solo quest and cannot be completed with a Fellowship.</rgb>","Grimbold is in his camp by the Ford of Isen.\
\
Grimbold is waiting to speak with you following the events of the day.","Talk to Grimbold in his camp in the Heathfells","The map table is in Grimbold's camp.\
\
Study the map table in Grimbold's camp to continue Prince Théodred's retreat.","The map table is in Grimbold's camp.\
\
Study the map table in Grimbold's camp to witness the aftermath of the battle.","The map table is in Grimbold's camp.\
\
Study the map table in Grimbold's camp to begin Prince Théodred's attack.","You study the maps placed on the table and consider Théodred's plan. Once he has come within sight of Isengard, he will order his men to attack the Orcs arrayed outside the walls.\
\
He thinks to arrive outside Isengard by mid-day.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>This is a Solo quest and cannot be completed with a Fellowship.</rgb>","Prince Théodred's plan to strike at Saruman and prevent him from unleashing his armies began on the morning of the Twenty-fifth of February, but much would happen by nightfall.","You study the maps placed on the table and consider Théodred's plan.\
\
This is indeed a daring move, and the Prince expects it to renew Saruman's caution. By nightfall, who knows what the situation may be? It could be that night will bring with it renewed hope for Rohan. There are other possibilities as well, but they are darker and more grim.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>This is a Solo quest and cannot be completed with a Fellowship.</rgb>","Examine the map table and complete 'Battle of the Ford, Afternoon'","Examine the map table and complete 'The Daring Strike, Dawn'","The map table is in Grimbold's camp.\
\
Study the map table in Grimbold's camp to continue Prince Théodred's attack.","Book 5, Chapter 4: The Prince of Rohan","You study the maps placed upon the table and consider Théodred's plan. First, he must determine what defences to leave at the Ford of Isen, then he will ride north to Isengard with a host of riders.\
\
The attack will begin at dawn.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>This is a Solo quest and cannot be completed with a Fellowship.</rgb>","Examine the map table and complete 'The Prince of Rohan, Night'","Examine the map table and complete 'The Daring Strike, Mid-day'"}},
[2172]={nameES="Libro 5, Capítulo 5: El Último Refugio",objectivesES={"Glóin está en su campamento al norte de Rivendel.\
\
El Nazgûl abandonó la fortaleza enana, ordenando a Skorgrím que te matara. Afortunadamente, lograste derrotar a Skorgrím, pero un espíritu malvado emergió de su cadáver y maldijo a los barbiluengos antes de desaparecer. Debes contarle todo lo ocurrido a Glóin.","Libro 5, Capítulo 5: El Último Refugio","Habla con Gimli en Rivendel","Gimli se encuentra en una de las habitaciones de invitados de la Casa de Elrond.\
\
Cuando hayas reunido a tu compañía, busca a Gimli; él te acompañará a la fortaleza enana donde podrían ocultarse el Nazgûl y Skorgrím.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Esta misión está pensada para una comunidad. Si eliges realizarla en solitario, recibirás un bono de inspiración, pero el desafío será considerable.</rgb>","Con la Piedra Clave en mano, ahora puedes entrar en la fortaleza enana de Gabilazan, último refugio de los Duramano, y enfrentar tanto al Nazgûl como a Skorgrím."}},
[2173]={nameES="Book 5, Chapter 5: The Long Road to Battle",objectivesES={"Talk to Thrymm Red-beard in the south-eastern reaches of the encampment in Taur Drúadan","Talk to Harding in the north-eastern reaches of the encampment in Taur Drúadan","Talk to Herubrand in the western reach of the encampment in Taur Drúadan","Harding is in the north-eastern reaches of the Rohirrim encampment in Taur Drúadan.","Talk to Ingbert in the eastern area of the encampment in Taur Drúadan","Talk to Wídfara on the edge of the Rohirrim encampment in Taur Drúadan","Book 5, Chapter 5: The Long Road to Battle","The guard calls out to you to halt, when suddenly his face lights up with recognition","Harding told you to speak to Ingbert at his tents to the west, in the Rohirrim encampment in Taur Drúadan.","Talk to Fastred in the north-eastern reach of the encampment in Taur Drúadan","Talk to Grimbold in the centre of the encampment in Taur Drúadan","Ghân-buri-Ghân and the Wild Men have agreed to help Théoden and his Riders, and will show you the way to their encampment.","Wídfara is at the entrance to the Rohirrim encampment in Taur Drúadan.","The Rohirrim encampment in Taur Drúadan is located west of the hill of Eilenach, along the road.","Find the entrance to the Rohirrim encampment west of Eilenach, along the road","Talk to Elfmar in the eastern reach of the encampment in Taur Drúadan","Wídfara thought you should visit many of the Riders encamped in Taur Drúadan, believing it would lift their spirits.","Thrymm Red-beard and his Éored are on a rise in the south-eastern reaches of the Rohirrim encampment in Taur Drúadan."}},
[2174]={nameES="Libro 5, Capítulo 6: Tras los pasos del mal",objectivesES={"Helegrod se encuentra al norte del campamento de Glóin.\
\
A la entrada de la tesorería de Helegrod encontraste tumularios. Deberías derrotar a uno y registrar sus restos en busca de alguna pista que revele qué los ha traído aquí.","Has recogido el Sello de Drugoth","Explora los bordes de Helegrod","Al enterarse de que el Nazgûl huyó a Helegrod, Glóin te contó parte de la historia de esa antigua fortaleza.","Registra a uno de los tumularios","Helegrod se encuentra al norte del campamento de Glóin. La tesorería exterior está cerca de Nan Gongarag.\
\
Glóin piensa que podrías descubrir cuál es el plan del Nazgûl para Helegrod explorando los bordes de esa sala abandonada en busca de la entrada a la tesorería. Te advirtió que no entres en Helegrod, pues está demasiado bien custodiada por oscuras criaturas.","Lleva el Sello de Drugoth a Glóin","Libro 5, Capítulo 6: Tras los pasos del mal","Has descubierto la Tesorería de Helegrod"}},
[2175]={nameES="Book 5, Chapter 6: What It Means to Fight",objectivesES={"Talk to Horn in the Rohirrim encampment in Taur Drúadan","Talk to Gléowine in the Rohirrim encampment in Taur Drúadan","Dernhelm looks at you warily, but he says nothing.","Horn is in the clearing where his father Ingbert's men are resting before the ride continues.","Horn sighs heavily, sorrow etched deeply upon his face","Elfhelm said someone with something to add to the subject of duty is just to the west, and you should find this person if you can keep the meeting a secret.","You have learned that Horn has joined Théoden's riders for the journey to Gondor.","Elfhelm is not far from his tent in the Rohirrim encampment in Taur Drúadan.\
\
Elfhelm has listened to your conversation with Gléowine, and has something of his own to add.","Elfhelm, standing nearby, catches your eye and your attention","Book 5, Chapter 6: What It Means to Fight","Horn is in the clearing where his father Ingbert's men are resting before the ride continues.\
\
Ingbert claims that his son has finally come to his senses, and challenged you to find out for yourself.","Talk to Elfhelm in the Rohirrim encampment in Taur Drúadan","Find the person of whom Elfhelm cryptically spoke","Gléowine is near Elfhelm's tent in the Rohirrim encampment in Taur Drúadan.\
\
Horn has asked you to speak with Gléowine if you want to hear his side of the argument."}},
[2176]={nameES="Libro 5, Capítulo 7: Noticias Malignas",objectivesES={"Preocupado por los tumularios que descubriste en la entrada del tesoro de Helegrod y el sello que encontraste en uno de los cuerpos, Glóin sugirió que ya es hora de hablar con el Maestro Elrond.","Elrond está en la biblioteca de Imladris.\
\
Glóin te ha pedido que hables con Elrond sobre lo que descubriste fuera del tesoro de Helegrod.","Lleva el Sello de Drugoth al Maestro Elrond","Libro 5, Capítulo 7: Noticias Malignas"}},
[2177]={nameES="Book 5, Chapter 7: Through the Stonewain Vale",objectivesES={"Book 5, Chapter 7: Through the Stonewain Vale","Éomer is at the southern end of the Stonewain Valley.","The Stonewain Valley runs north and south, not far from Drû Bhûta, in Taur Drúadan.","Talk to Éomer at the southern end of Stonewain Valley","Find the clearing where Théoden meets with his advisors","Talk to Ghân-buri-Ghân while he meets with Théoden","Ghân-buri-Ghân is meeting with Théoden and his advisors in Taur Drúadan.","Clear fallen stones in the Stonewain Valley","The entrance to the Stonewain Valley is far south of the Rohirrim encampment, and north-east of Drû Bhûta.","As you approach, you see that Théoden speaks with Ghân-buri-Ghân","Talk to Théoden outside his tent in Taur Drúadan","Clear fallen stones near the northern entrance to Stonewain Valley","Théoden meets with his advisors in a clearing at the base of Eilenach, in Taur Drúadan.","There is trouble on the road ahead. If the Rohirrim are to come to Pelennor in time, they will need another plan.","You clear the path, making it safe for the horses to pass","Talk to Éomer outside Théoden's tent in Taur Drúadan"}},
[2178]={nameES="Libro 5, Capítulo 8: Fuego y Hielo",objectivesES={"Libro 5, Capítulo 8: Fuego y Hielo","Elrond te dijo que después de que el rey enano Durin derrotara al dragón Thorog, el cuerpo del dragón fue dejado a pudrirse en la tesorería vacía de Helegrod. Teme que el hielo y el frío de Orod Lostol hayan preservado el cuerpo hasta tal punto que las artes del Señor Demacrado, Drugoth, podrían infundirle un espíritu maligno y levantarlo como un tumulario.","Helegrod se encuentra al norte de Rivendel y del campamento de Glóin.\
\
Elrond te ha pedido que entres en la tesorería de Helegrod y pongas fin a los planes del Nazgûl. Te advirtió que reunieras aliados.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Esta misión está diseñada para una comunidad. Si decides emprenderla en solitario, recibirás una bonificación de inspiración, pero el desafío será grande.</rgb>","Entra en la tesoro de Helegrod y pon fin a los planes del Nazgûl.","Elrond se encuentra en la biblioteca de Imladris.\
\
En la tesorería, te encontraste con el Nazgûl y lograste derrotarlo. También interrumpiste el ritual que el Señor Demacrado estaba realizando para restaurar al dragón Thorog, aunque parte del proceso se completó y el dragón voló. Elrond debe ser informado de lo ocurrido."}},
[2179]={nameES="Book 5, Chapter 8: The Ride of the Rohirrim",objectivesES={"Talk to Éomer from horseback and join Théoden's Riders","Talk to Théoden on the Field of Onslaught","Théoden's Riders have taken the field!","Éomer is at the southern end of the Stonewain Valley, and he prepares to ride out of the vale and toward the Pelennor's encircling wall.","Book 5, Chapter 8: The Ride of the Rohirrim","The Rohirrim have passed through the Stonewain Valley, and now they prepare for battle."}},
[2180]={nameES="Book 6, Chapter 10: The Falling Shadow",objectivesES={"The corpse of an enormous beast lies broken on the ground here","Edbrit is at Aculf's Camp in the Rushgore.\
\
You have helped deal with some of the newly-aggressive creatures in the Rushgore, and should return now to Edbrit.","Edbrit saw a mysterious shadow fall from the sky far to the south-east, in the Brown Lands.\
\
You have decided to travel to the Brown Lands in search of the mysterious shadow Edbrit saw.","Edbrit saw something fall from the sky, but before he goes with you to investigate it he needs your help in the Rushgore.","Nona is standing by the corpse of the fallen beast in the Brown Lands.\
\
Nona is waiting to speak with you.","Book 6, Chapter 10: The Falling Shadow","Find the location in the Brown Lands where the falling shadow came to earth","Edbrit has asked you to defeat gredbyg, turtles, and avanc that have been stirred up in the Rushgore.\
\
Something has caused the creatures of the Rushgore to become more hostile than usual, and Edbrit wants you to help him deal with them before the two of you go in search of the falling shadow.","Edbrit is standing by the corpse of a mighty beast in the Brown Lands.\
\
You have found the body of a massive beast, and should speak to Edbrit about it."}},
[2181]={nameES="Book 6, Chapter 11: The Vanished Rider",objectivesES={"Complete the deed 'The Vanished Rider' to learn the location of the missing Nazgûl","Someone rode astride the beast that now lies dead in the Brown Lands. But where is this vanished rider?","The great beast that crashed in the Brown Lands is missing its rider, but people throughout the lands bordering the Great River may have seen signs of it. You should seek them out and learn where the rider has gone.","Book 6, Chapter 11: The Vanished Rider","You have scoured the lands near the Great River for some sign of the missing Nazgûl, but have always been half a step behind. You should meet with Nona back by the corpse of the crashed beast as you agreed."}},
[2182]={nameES="Book 6, Chapter 12: Mists of Anduin",objectivesES={"Talk to Galadriel outside the House of Celeborn","Book 6, Chapter 12: Mists of Anduin","You have followed signs left by the rider of the terrible beast that met its end in the Brown Lands, but have not been able to find the rider itself.","Talk to Nona by the Carcass of the Beast and walk with her back to Stangard","Nona is standing by the carcass of the beast in the Brown Lands.\
\
Your search for the missing Nazgûl has proven fruitless, and Nona wants to walk with you back to Stangard where you can find more information.","Galadriel is atop the flet on which is built the House of Celeborn, in Lothlórien.\
\
The night was long, but Galadriel has once again summoned you to speak with her."}},
[2183]={nameES="Book 6, Chapter 1: Bonded By Battle",objectivesES={"Déorwine and Sakalbâr are fighting on the south-eastern stretch of the line on the Field of Onslaught.","Find an Orc that has broken free of the fighting ranks and defeat it","Talk to Fastred near the fighting ranks to the south-east on the Field of Onslaught","You see no sign of Crúmgam, but the dismounted Rohirrim need your help","Gondorian soldiers and Rohirrim riders do battle with the Orcs on the Field of Onslaught. You should slay any of the Orcs that break free of the fighting ranks.","Fastred has asked you to search the battlefield for his hated foe Crúmgam.","Fastred and Gimilkhôr are near the south-eastern stretch of the line on the Field of Onslaught.","Talk to Gimilkhôr near the fighting ranks to the south-east on the Field of Onslaught","Talk to Prince Imrahil on the Field of Onslaught","The Orc falls, but you know that there will be more","Talk to Déorwine at the fighting ranks to the south-east, on the Field of Onslaught","Prince Imrahil has led his swan-knights out of the city, and can be found on the Field of Onslaught.\
\
Théoden marked the emergence of the swan-knights from the city, and wants you to find Prince Imrahil.","Search for Crúmgam on the eastern side of the Field of Onslaught","Book 6, Chapter 1: Bonded By Battle","Théoden is waiting with his banner-bearer, Guthláf, on the Field of Onslaught.","Your words prove fruitful, and he runs in search of another steed","Return to Théoden on the Field of Onslaught","Rohirrim that have been dismounted from their steeds need your help on the eastern side of the Field of Onslaught.","Théoden has led the charge of the Rohirrim into battle before the White City.","Talk to Sakalbâr at the fighting ranks on the south-east side of the Field of Onslaught"}},
[2184]={nameES="Libro 6, Capítulo 1: Tiempos desesperados",objectivesES={"Libro 6, Capítulo 1: Tiempos desesperados","Habla con Haldir en un flet al sureste del río Nimrodel","Has ayudado a los enanos a repeler los primeros ataques de los Orcos, pero Bosi no cree que su pueblo pueda resistir para siempre sin la ayuda de los Elfos de Lórien.","Hay guardianes en los límites de Lórien, al este de Moria. Tales Elfos se encuentran en grandes plataformas, o flets, entre los árboles al sureste del río Nimrodel.\
\
Bosi cree que los enanos no podrán repeler a los Orcos de Mazog por mucho tiempo si realmente cuentan con el apoyo de alguna fuerza de Dol Guldur, y quiere que busques una audiencia con Galadriel de Lórien. Los enanos necesitan aliados si quieren resistir en Khazad-dûm."}},
[2185]={nameES="Libro 6, Capítulo 1: De Golodir y Angmar",objectivesES={"Libro 6, Capítulo 1: De Golodir y Angmar","Esteldín se encuentra en las Quebradas del Norte, al norte y al oeste de Rivendel.\
\
Aragorn te ha pedido viajar a Esteldín en su lugar para hablar con Daervunn, de quien espera pueda esclarecer el preocupante mensaje.","Un halcón adiestrado llegó a Rivendel, portando un mensaje inquietante desde el campamento oculto de los Montaraces en Esteldín para Aragorn, Capitán de los Montaraces."}},
[2186]={nameES="Book 6, Chapter 1: Troubled Dreams",objectivesES={"Find a bedroll in Grimbold's camp and get some rest","A bedroll you can use is located south of Grimbold's position in his camp, by the milestone.\
\
Grimbold wants you to get some rest while you can.","Grimbold is in his camp, north of your bedroll.\
\
You have had a most peculiar dream, if dream it was, and you should tell Grimbold of it.","Book 6, Chapter 1: Troubled Dreams","Your body is exhausted and your mind is ill at ease following the Battle of the Ford.","Talk to Grimbold in his camp and tell him about the strange dream","The bedroll is uncomfortable, and you can feel every jutting stone of the hard ground through it. Even so, you are so exhausted by the events of the day that you fall into a troubled sleep.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>This is a Solo quest and cannot be completed with a Fellowship.</rgb>"}},
[2187]={nameES="Libro 6, Capítulo 2: Contra su señor",objectivesES={"Libro 6, Capítulo 2: Contra su señor","Corunir está en Aughaire, un pueblo de Montañeses en Angmar, en algún lugar al norte de Ram Dúath.\
\
Daervunn te pidió que cruzaras al norte por Ram Dúath y buscaras al Montaraz Corunir, que ahora vive entre los Montañeses de Angmar.","Daervunn te contó cómo llegó un halcón herido, portando un mensaje de Corunir, un Montaraz de la compañía de Golodir, que desafió las órdenes de Aragorn y entró en Angmar, creyendo que una sombra había vuelto a caer sobre Carn Dûm."}},
[2188]={nameES="Book 6, Chapter 2: Death Comes for All",objectivesES={"Talk to Guthláf and bolster his courage","Talk to Guthláf and charge with him into battle once again","Gléowine is at Kings' End, near the corpse of the fell-beast.","Guthláf is on the Field of Onslaught, readying to follow his lord once more into the fray.","Talk to Gléowine at Kings' End","The shadow of death falls upon the Pelennor, and none are safe from its chill grasp.","Book 6, Chapter 2: Death Comes for All","Guthláf is near Théoden, his liege, on the Field of Onslaught.\
\
Théoden has asked you to stay near to his banner-bearer Guthláf and bolster his courage."}},
[2189]={nameES="Book 6, Chapter 2: The Ghost in the Gap",objectivesES={"You have spied another glint of gold to the west of the small pile of gold you discovered.\
\
Someone has been leaving small piles of gold pieces in the Gap of Rohan. Is it Nona?","This member of the Draig-lûth was slain by a sword-stroke. Pieces of gold trail from his clenched fingers, and you pick them up and look at them curiously.\
\
As you straighten up, you see another glint of gold from the west, where two trails meet.","You see another glint of gold from the west, where two trails meet","Wilfrith is in Forthbrond, to the west of Grimbold's Camp.\
\
Grimbold thinks you should travel to Forthbrond and speak with Wilfrith for information about tracking down Wadu's Ghost in the Gap of Rohan.","Defeat Wargs at Âthdâr (3/4)","You look at the slain Draig-lûth warrior and wonder if he was lured to this place by a pile of gold coins like the one you discovered to the west.\
\
You caught a glimpse of another gold glint further to the west of that pile, and wonder if you should investigate it.","You have spied another glint of gold to the west of Âthdâr, where two trails meet.\
\
A member of the Draig-lûth killed by a sword-stroke clutched gold pieces in his hand. What does it mean?","You caught a glimpse of gold from the western side of the Warg-warrens of Âthdâr.\
\
You should investigate the golden glimpse you saw at Âthdâr.","Investigate the glint of gold to the west of Âthdâr","Your suspicion was correct, and Nona stands before you!","Wilfrith heard the sound of swords clashing from the direction of the Warg-warrens of Âthdâr, west of Forthbrond. He wants you to defeat Wargs there while you search for Nona.\
\
Wilfrith thinks you might be able to learn news of Nona by travelling to the Warg-warrens of Âthdâr.","As you examine the pile of gold pieces, you see another glint further to the south-west","Investigate the glint of gold to the south-west","Investigate the glint of gold even further to the west","This member of the Draig-lûth was slain by a sword-stroke. Why did his foe not take the gold clutched in his fingers?\
\
Once again you see another glint of gold from the west, where two trails meet, and wonder if another Draig-lûth warrior lies slain there.","As you defeat another Warg, a glint of gold to the west of the warren catches your eye","Talk to Nona west of Cuvnerth, in the Gap of Rohan","As you examine the pile of gold pieces, you see another glint further to the west","If the dream that troubled your sleep is as it seems, Grimbold is right: you need to take it seriously and act upon its mysterious message.","You have found Nona in the Gap of Rohan, west of Cuvnerth.\
\
You should tell Nona about the troubling dream.","You have spotted another glint of gold to the south-west of the gold coins you discovered, to the west of Cuvnerth.\
\
You are following a trail of gold pieces through the Gap of Rohan. Does this trail near its end?","Investigate the flash of gold on the western side of Âthdâr","Book 6, Chapter 2: The Ghost in the Gap"}},
[2190]={nameES="Book 6, Chapter 3: Daughter of Suvulch",objectivesES={"Nona is at the front gate of the village of Lhanuch, in Enedwaith.\
\
Nona is waiting to speak with you in front of the gate of Lhanuch.","Talk to Nona at the front gate of Lhanuch, in Enedwaith","Meet Nona at the front gate of Lhanuch, in Enedwaith","Book 6, Chapter 3: Daughter of Suvulch","Nona thinks Suvulch may be at the Pool of the King, north-west of Lhanuch.\
\
Nona could not find her father anywhere within Lhanuch, and thinks he might be at the Pool of the King.","Sift through pottery shards along the edges of the Pool of the King","Suvulch is on the shore by the Pool of the King, in Enedwaith, north-west of the village of Lhanuch.\
\
You have found a shining beryl on the shore of the Pool of the King, and should bring it to Suvulch.","The front gate of Lhanuch is in Nan Laeglin, in Enedwaith, north of Dunland.\
\
Nona has agreed to come with you to Lothlórien seeking the meaning behind your dream, but first she wants to stop by the front gate of her home of Lhanuch to bid farewell to her father Suvulch.","Sifting through the shards, you find a small beryl that shines with its own light","Pottery shards can be found along the edges of the Pool of the King.\
\
Suvulch wants you to sift through the pottery shards for something he can give to Nona as a memento.","Bring the shining beryl to Suvulch","Nona searched the village but found no sign of her father","You sift through the small pile of shards, but find nothing of note","Find and talk to Suvulch at the Pool of the King, if he is there","You have found Nona in the Gap of Rohan and she has agreed to come with you to Lothlórien in pursuit of the truth of your troubled dream."}},
[2191]={nameES="Libro 6, Capítulo 3: Secretos de las piedras",objectivesES={"Corunir está en el pueblo de Montañeses de Aughaire.\
\
Con los calcos que Corunir pidió en mano, deberías regresar con el Montaraz y entregarle tu informe.","Corunir te contó cómo Golodir reunió un ejército entre los Montañeses para atacar Carn Dûm. La expedición fracasó y Corunir quedó solo, incapaz de cruzar Rammas Deluon, ahora poseídas de un terrible poder, para conocer el destino de su capitán y compañeros.","Las piedras vigilantes menores están esparcidas por el paisaje del oeste de Angmar, especialmente cerca de los campamentos de Angmarim y Montañeses.\
\
Corunir cree que el secreto de Rammas Deluon puede revelarse investigando una de las piedras vigilantes menores. Te ha indicado que busques una de las piedras menores y hagas un calco de las runas que tiene. Te advirtió que evitaras las piedras vigilantes mortales.","Libro 6, Capítulo 3: Secretos de las piedras","Haz un calco de una piedra vigilante menor","Lleva el calco de la piedra vigilante a Corunir"}},
[2192]={nameES="Book 6, Chapter 3: The Grip of Despair",objectivesES={"The battle rages as deadlier forces from Mordor take the field","Horn is at Kings' End.\
\
You heard a loud commotion and should ask Horn what transpired to cause it.","Talk to Elfhelm south of Kings' End","Talk to Elfhelm near Kings' End","Ingbert is at Kings' End.","Book 6, Chapter 3: The Grip of Despair","Talk to Ingbert at Kings' End","Elfhelm fights in a small knot of soldiers near a fallen Mûmak south of Kings' End.","The resolve of the men of Rohan is sorely tested following the death of Théoden.","A great cry goes up from the direction of Kings' End","There was the sound of sudden commotion from the direction of Kings' End, and you should return there at once","Scout the battlefield south of Kings' End","Talk to Horn at Kings' End","You see Horn standing where Théoden fell. He may know what transpired","Bodies litter the field: Orcs, Haradrim, Rohirrim, and Gondorians","Scout the battlefield north-east of Kings' End","Elfhelm is very near to the corpse of the fell-beast at Kings' End.\
\
Gléowine sent you to find Elfhelm and get him to lead the Rohirrim during this critical moment in the fighting.","Horn's father Ingbert calls you to him","Learn what transpired at Kings' End","The enemy is massing to the south and to the north-east of Kings' End, and Elfhelm wanted you to scout those camps and slay any enemies you find."}},
[2193]={nameES="Libro 6, Capítulo 4: Corazón de piedra",objectivesES={"Las piedras centinela sin vida se encuentran en el oeste de Malenhad, lejos al este de Aughaire.\
\
Corunir te ha pedido que busques uno de los corazones de piedra mencionados en las runas, buscando entre las piedras centinela sin vida.","Examinas la piedra centinela cuidadosamente, pero no ves señales del corazón que Corunir te pidió buscar.","Recogiste un corazón de una piedra centinela sin vida","Lleva el corazón de piedra agrietado a Corunir","Recoge un corazón de una piedra centinela sin vida","Corunir está en el pueblo de los montañeses de Aughaire.\
\
Debes regresar con Corunir y entregarle el corazón de piedra que encontraste.","Examinas la piedra centinela cuidadosamente y descubres, a través de una grieta, una extraña roca oscura. Al recogerla, sientes una breve inquietud, pero desaparece rápidamente.","Libro 6, Capítulo 4: Corazón de piedra","El calco que hiciste mostró runas de naturaleza vil, escritas en la Lengua Negra, en la que Corunir no es experto; sin embargo, pudo distinguir algo sobre el \"corazón\" de la piedra."}},
[2194]={nameES="Book 6, Chapter 4: Swift Hooves",objectivesES={"Travel to Lothlórien and speak with Haldir on his flet outside the borders","Nona has said her farewells to Suvulch, and now it is time for you to ride with all haste to Lothlórien.","Book 6, Chapter 4: Swift Hooves","Haldir is on a flet outside Lothlórien.\
\
You should speak to Haldir to obtain permission to travel with Nona into Lothlórien."}},
[2195]={nameES="Book 6, Chapter 4: The Foe Resurgent",objectivesES={"Study Dúnhere for signs of life at Riders' Stand","Ingbert is at Kings' End, waiting to speak with you and return to battle.","The armies of Mordor fill the field all the way to the river","Éomer is at Riders' Stand.","You examine him closely, but the result is grim. Dúnhere is dead","Éomer has climbed a rocky outcropping on the south-western side of the hillock.","Talk to Ingbert and complete 'Instance: The Foe Resurgent'","Return to Ingbert at Kings' End","Find Gondorian soldiers north of Éomer at Riders' Stand","From here you see that the enemy horde reaches as far as the Rammas","The forces of Mordor fill the plain, and smoke burns on the horizon","Ingbert is at Kings' End.","Talk to Forlong north of Kings' End","Talk to Forlong at Riders' Stand","Book 6, Chapter 4: The Foe Resurgent","Éomer sent you to help Gondorian soldiers atop the hillock at Riders' Stand.","Forlong kneels by the body of his friend Hirluin at Riders' Stand.","With the Witch-king now dead, a new commander has taken control of the enemy forces on the Pelennor Fields.","Forlong and Hirluin are north of Kings' End.","Forlong kneels by the body of Hirluin, slain by the enemy","Talk to Hirluin north of Kings' End","Talk to Éomer at Riders' Stand","Dúnhere was felled by an arrow at Riders' Stand, and Éomer begged you to check for signs of life in his fallen friend.","Éomer and his men have been surrounded on a hillock and cut off from the rest of the defenders.","Talk to Éomer on the south-western outcropping of the hillock","Several approaches climb up the hill at Riders' Stand.\
\
Forlong has asked you to scout the approaches up the hill, even if you think it futile to do so."}},
[2196]={nameES="Book 6, Chapter 5: Old Friends and New Tidings",objectivesES={}},
[2197]={nameES="Book 6, Chapter 5: The Black Ships",objectivesES={"Éomer stands on the rocky outcropping on the south-western corner of the hillock, but his mood is greatly changed.","Éomer asked you to <rgb=#00FF00>look</rgb> into the distance and see what has so disturbed him.","Book 6, Chapter 5: The Black Ships","Éomer is on a rocky outcropping on the south-western side of the hillock at Riders' Stand.","Talk to Éomer on the south-western outcropping of the hillock","<rgb=#00FF00>Look</rgb> into the distance and see what Éomer has seen","Forces of the Enemy approach the hillock as you seek to master your doubt and fear.","Éomer has seen something in the distance that fills him with dread.","Black sails fly on a river of dread"}},
[2198]={nameES="Libro 6, Capítulo 5: El destino del hechicero",objectivesES={"Aunque el corazón de piedra que encontraste estaba agrietado e inútil, aún queda otro camino. Corunir ha sabido de un ritual en la fortaleza de Tór Gailvin, que podría darte un corazón completo si lo interrumpes.","Obtén el corazón de piedra","Libro 6, Capítulo 5: El destino del hechicero","Corazón de piedra obtenido","Lleva el corazón de piedra a Corunir","Tath está en Tór Gailvin, al noreste de Aughaire, al este de Fail-á-Khro.\
\
Corunir te ha enviado a Tór Gailvin para arrebatarle un corazón de piedra a un hechicero de Angmar llamado Tath."}},
[2199]={nameES="Libro 6, Capítulo 6: Desafiando a la piedra",objectivesES={"Libro 6, Capítulo 6: Desafiando a la piedra","Derrota al espíritu de la piedra centinela antigua","Habla con Corunir","Corunir está en el pueblo de los montañeses de Aughaire, al oeste de Bail Róva.\
\
Con el espíritu de la piedra centinela antigua derrotado, deberías regresar con Corunir y darle la noticia de esperanza.","La piedra centinela antigua está cerca del paso oriental de Ram Dúath, cerca de Bail Róva, al este de Aughaire.\
\
Corunir cree que el corazón de piedra puede atraer el espíritu maligno de otra piedra centinela y te ha pedido que pruebes su teoría en una piedra centinela antigua que guarda los pasos de Ram Dúath.","Presenta el corazón de piedra a la piedra centinela antigua","Espíritu de la piedra centinela antigua derrotado","Corunir reaccionó de forma extraña ante la presencia y el contacto del corazón de piedra, apartándose de él aterrorizado. Te dijo que el corazón había sido preparado para recibir un espíritu maligno de una Edad antigua, similar a los que habitan los tumularios al servicio de Angmar."}},
[2200]={nameES="Book 6, Chapter 6: Downriver Dangers",objectivesES={"Has the earth been disturbed here? Does it signify the Fellowship's passage?","You gingerly remove an Orc arrow from the body of the slain scout","Fimloth is at Haldirith in Thinglad.\
\
You have defeated many Orcs and should return to Fimloth at Haldirith in Thinglad.","Haldirith is an Elf-camp located in the northern area of Thinglad.\
\
Alfrohir has brought you from Lothlórien to Thinglad along the Great River, and thinks you should present yourself to Fimloth at Haldirith, in Thinglad.","You see trampled grass underfoot. Did the Fellowship come this way?","You have been following the river south in search of signs of the Fellowship's passage.","The Fellowship passed south along the river, and Fimloth thinks if you seek news of your friends you should follow the river-bank south looking for signs of their passage.","Haldirith in Thinglad serves as an outpost of Lothlórien from which the Elves stand watch for threats from the south.","Orcs can be found in great numbers throughout Thinglad.\
\
Fimloth has asked you to defeat Orcs throughout Thinglad.","Follow the river-bank further south of Haldirith","Fimloth is at Haldirith.\
\
You should return to Fimloth at Haldirith and give her the Orc arrow and news of the slain scout you discovered.","Search south along the river","Book 6, Chapter 6: Downriver Dangers","Follow the river-bank south of Haldirith","Nona is at Haldirith, in Thinglad.\
\
Nona wishes to speak with you.","Bring Orc arrow to Fimloth at Haldirith"}},
[2201]={nameES="Book 6, Chapter 6: The Battle Rages",objectivesES={"Talk to Corunir at the Ruin of Pel Dúven","The Orc snarls a challenge and leaps to his feet!","Corunir is beside himself with anger at the Ruin of Pel Dúven.","You hear a great commotion coming from the north-west","Talk to Radanir on the eastern side of the Ruin of Pel Dúven","Corunir's anger departs, replaced with a haunted visage","Amegil has regained some of his courage, and stands tall","Amegil has cast off his fright, and he speaks now with prideful anger.","Talk to Amegil at the Ruin of Pel Dúven","Book 6, Chapter 6: The Battle Rages","This Orc died of his wounds, as it seemed","Talk to Halbarad at the Ruin of Pel Dúven","Aragorn and the Grey Company have come to the Ruin of Pel Dúven.","Radanir is injured on the eastern side of the Ruin of Pel Dúven.","Use the swift horse by the south-west out-cropping of Riders' Stand to travel to the Ruin of Pel Dúven","This Orc is not feigning death","Halbarad is at the Ruin of Pel Dúven.","Halbarad has told you that some of the bodies littering the Ruin of Pel Dúven are not truly dead, and wants you to examine them for would-be ambushers feigning death.","Examine slain Orcs at the Ruin of Pel Dúven and ensure they are not feigning death","Amegil is frightened, but you would hear what he has said that has so enraged Corunir.","This Orc is truly slain","Corunir is shouting at a frightened Gondorian man, and Halbarad seeks to restrain him","Corunir has become very angry about something, and threatens a Gondorian man at the Ruin of Pel Dúven.\
\
Halbarad has asked you to help him calm down Corunir before the Ranger does something he will regret.","Aragorn and the Grey Company have arrived at the Harlond. Have they come in time to turn the tide of the battle?","The Grey Company has come to Pelennor, and they make safe the Ruin of Pel Dúven","You heard a great commotion coming from the north-west side of the Ruin of Pel Dúven, and should investigate.","The newly-arrived allies that sailed on the Black Ships will disembark and make for the Ruin of Pel Dúven.\
\
Éomer has directed you to use the swift horse at the base of the outcropping on the south-west side of Riders' Stand to ride to meet the new arrivals.","Talk to Aragorn at the Ruin of Pel Dúven","Investigate the commotion on the north-west side of the Ruin of Pel Dúven"}},
[2202]={nameES="Book 6, Chapter 7: A Final Vengeance",objectivesES={"Friends gather to remember Golodir, but there is little time to mourn","Corunir is in the north-west area of the Ruin of Pel Dúven.","Return to the Rangers in the Ruin of Pel Dúven","The Rangers gather in the Ruin of Pel Dúven to mourn Golodir.","Book 6, Chapter 7: A Final Vengeance","Talk to Halbarad in the Ruin of Pel Dúven","Talk to Corunir in the Ruin of Pel Dúven and go in search of Golodir","Corunir fears that the men of Gondor may have worked some tragic mischief upon Golodir.","Talk to Aragorn in the Ruin of Pel Dúven","Talk to Corunir in the Ruin of Pel Dúven"}},
[2203]={nameES="Libro 6, Capítulo 7: Más allá de Rammas Deluon",objectivesES={"Busca sobrevivientes de la banda de Golodir","Rammas Deluon se encuentra muy al este de Aughaire en Malenhad. Corunir sugirió que busques un campamento de enanos al sur, más allá de Rammas Deluon.\
\
Corunir te ordenó pasar por Rammas Deluon, porque ya no tienes causa para temer las mortales piedras. Espera que puedas encontrar un remanente de la fuerza que Golodir condujo a través de las piedras en algún lugar del otro lado.","Tu derrota de la antigua piedra vigilante de Ram Dúath ha demostrado que las piedras pueden ser desafiadas.","Libro 6, Capítulo 7: Más allá de Rammas Deluon"}},
[2204]={nameES="Book 6, Chapter 7: Enemies of Old",objectivesES={"Book 6, Chapter 7: Enemies of Old","Show Nona's sword to Horn in Stangard","Stangard is in Eorlsmead, south of Thinglad.\
\
You have decided to travel with Nona to the Rohirrim village of Stangard, in order to learn what you can of the situation alongside the river and the meaning behind your dream.","Nona's sword is packed within her belongings near the entrance to Stangard.\
\
Nona has given you permission to show her sword to Horn, as long as you let no one touch it.","Horn can be found atop the village of Stangard, in Eorlsmead.\
\
Nona has given you her sword to show to Horn, with the instruction that no one but you is to handle it.","Nona is at the gate of Stangard.\
\
Horn was very interested in Nona's sword, and wants you to return it to her before meeting him outside the town.","Collect Nona's sword from the bag containing her possessions","Nona is outside the gate of Stangard, in Eorlsmead.\
\
Afic refuses to allow Nona to enter Stangard before you show her sword to a man called Horn, near the top of the village.","The Rohirrim village of Stangard sits within Eorlsmead, along the Great River, and that is where your road now leads."}},
[2205]={nameES="Book 6, Chapter 8: On a Field of Red",objectivesES={"Book 6, Chapter 8: On a Field of Red","Talk to Aragorn at the Threshold of the City","Aragorn is at the Threshold of the City.","The sun is high in the sky and Pelennor is red with the blood of the slain, as the forces of Mordor prepare a final attack.","Corunir is in the Ruin of Pel Dúven, waiting to take the field with you in memory of Golodir.","Talk to Corunir in the Ruin of Pel Dúven and take the field"}},
[2206]={nameES="Book 6, Chapter 8: Stone of Friendship",objectivesES={"Hide behind a stone and defeat any foes that approach","Horn is waiting for you by the Cuthstan, among the Wailing Hills, west of Stangard.\
\
You have dealt with an Orc interloper, and should speak now to Horn.","A stone you can hide behind is near the Cuthstan, just to the east of Horn.\
\
Horn hears someone approaching, and he wants you to hide behind a stone to get the drop on the newcomer if it be a foe.","Another stone you can hide behind is near the Cuthstan, east of Horn.\
\
Horn hears someone approaching, and he wants you to hide behind a stone to get the drop on the newcomer if it be a foe.","Horn has asked to meet you by the Cuthstan in the Wailing Hills so he can talk to you about something.","Horn is waiting for you by the Cuthstan in the Wailing Hills, west of Stangard.\
\
The Rohirrim man Horn wants to speak with you at the Cuthstan about something.","Hide behind another stone and defeat any foes that approach","Horn is waiting for you by the Cuthstan, among the Wailing Hills, west of Stangard.\
\
You have dealt with another Orc interloper, and should speak now to Horn.","Book 6, Chapter 8: Stone of Friendship","Horn is waiting for you in the village of Stangard, in Eorlsmead.\
\
You have spoken with Horn at the Cuthstan, and he wants to speak with you some more back in Stangard."}},
[2207]={nameES="Book 6, Chapter 9: Ancient Battlefield",objectivesES={"Bring the battlefield map and the heirloom to Cerdic","Edbrit is in the Rushgore at Aculf's Camp, south-east of Cerdic on the very edge of the swamp.\
\
While you were searching the battlefield of Parth Celebrant, Cerdic received word from Edbrit in the Rushgore about strange happenings.","Book 6, Chapter 9: Ancient Battlefield","Sift through debris beside the bridge to Ost Celebrant","You sift through the debris near the base of the pillar but find nothing of interest","Sift through debris at the arrow-riddled patch of ground","Cerdic has marked three locations in Parth Celebrant on your map: the crumbled base of a pillar, an arrow-riddled patch of ground, and the river-bank by one of the bridges to Ost Celebrant. The first two sites are on the Field of Celebrant directly south of Cerdic, and the third site is to the south-east, alongside the river.\
\
Cerdic and Horn want you to search significant locations from the Battle of the Field of Celebrant.","Sift through debris by the base of the crumbled pillar","Cerdic is at the watch-post on the road into Parth Celebrant.\
\
Horn has given you a map of notable sites at the Battle of the Field of Celebrant to show to Cerdic.","Horn thinks you might find some way to help his people defeat the Khundolar by searching the site of the battle five hundred years ago where their Easterling ancestors were defeated.","Cerdic is at the watch-post on the road as it enters Parth Celebrant from Eorlsmead.\
\
You have found a bronze-worked heirloom at one of the sites of the battle with the Easterlings five hundred years ago, and should show it to Cerdic.","You sift through the debris and find a number of arrowheads, but nothing worth keeping","You find a small bronze-worked heirloom among the debris","Talk to Edbrit at Aculf's Camp in the Rushgore"}},
[2208]={nameES="Book 6, Chapter 9: The City Stands",objectivesES={"Talk to survivors of the battle at the Threshold of the City","Talk to Aragorn at the Threshold of the City","Duinhir is overcome with grief for his sons, and pays no mind to your words of comfort.","Survivors of a long and weary day have come to the Threshold of the City, nursing their wounds and mourning their dead.","Aragorn is at the Threshold of the City.","A long and weary day of fighting has come to an end, but the victory comes at a very high cost.","Book 6, Chapter 9: The City Stands"}},
[2209]={nameES="Libro 6, Prólogo: Volviendo la mirada hacia el Norte",objectivesES={"Aragorn te espera en una de las habitaciones de huéspedes de la Casa de Elrond.\
\
Elrond te advirtió sobre un mal creciente en Angmar y te pidió que hablaras con Aragorn.","La sombra de Angmar, mano de Sauron en el Norte, crece sin cesar, amenazando la paz y la seguridad de Eriador.","Libro 6, Prólogo: Volviendo la mirada hacia el Norte","Habla con Aragorn en Rivendel."}},
[2210]={nameES="Book 7, Chapter 10: To the Wold!",objectivesES={}},
[2211]={nameES="Book 7, Chapter 1: Beginning to Heal",objectivesES={"Aragorn's Pavilion is east of Minas Tirith on the Pelennor Fields, after the battle is concluded.","Find Elfhelm south-west of Aragorn's Pavilion, on the Pelennor Fields","Aragorn's pavilion is east of Minas Tirith on the Pelennor Fields, after the battle is concluded.\
\
<rgb=#00FF00>A horse at the Threshold of the City during the Battle of Pelennor Fields will bring you After the Battle.</rgb>","The Battle of the Pelennor Fields has ended, and the people of Gondor begin the long process of recovering from their losses.","Talk to Prince Imrahil at Aragorn's Pavilion","Aragorn has need of his captains to determine his next course of action","Talk to Gimli at the city gates, west of Aragorn's Pavilion","Legolas and Gimli smile warmly at your approach","Talk to Legolas at the city gates, west of Aragorn's Pavilion","Legolas and Gimli are outside the city gate of Minas Tirith, after the battle.","Talk to Aragorn at his pavilion on the Pelennor Fields","Book 7, Chapter 1: Beginning to Heal","Elfhelm and Daervunn are south-west of Aragorn's Pavilion on the Pelennor Fields.","Talk to Daervunn south-west of Aragorn's Pavilion","Travel to Aragorn's Pavilion east of the city, after the battle of Pelennor Fields","Talk to Elfhelm south-west of Aragorn's Pavilion","Find Legolas and Gimli at the city gates of Minas Tirith, west of Aragorn's Pavilion","Prince Imrahil is at Aragorn's Pavilion, east of Minas Tirith, after the Battle of Pelennor Fields.","Elfhelm and Daervunn are deep in conversation, but they look up as you approach"}},
[2212]={nameES="Libro 7, Capítulo 1: Oculto en la Sombra",objectivesES={"Libro 7, Capítulo 1: Oculto en la Sombra","Lorniel está dentro del edificio en Gath Forthnír.\
\
Areneth te dijo que hablaras con Lorniel, hija de Golodir.","Encuentra a los Montaraces de Gath Forthnír.","Tras descubrir el secreto de las piedras vigilantes de Rammas Deluon, Corunir te envió a las regiones orientales de Angmar, en busca de los Montaraces y Montañeses de Aughaire que habían marchado para derribar el creciente poder de Angmar. Encontraste al Montaraz Braigiar en el puesto enano de Gabilshathûr, en Malenhad.","Gath Forthnír se encuentra en algún lugar muy al norte de Gabilshathûr.\
\
Braigiar te ha enviado a encontrar y prestar ayuda a los supervivientes de la compañía de Golodir en el campamento de Gath Forthnír."}},
[2213]={nameES="Libro 7, Capítulo 1: La colina de Cerin Amroth",objectivesES={"Milwen está junto al arco al oeste de la colina de Cerin Amroth, ubicada en el centro de Lothlórien, lejos al noreste de Talan Haldir y al este de Echad Andestel.\
\
Te han dicho que hables con Milwen en la colina de Cerin Amroth, dentro de los bosques de Lórien.","Habla con Milwen","Libro 7, Capítulo 1: La colina de Cerin Amroth"}},
[2214]={nameES="Book 7, Chapter 1: The Land of the Elf-queen",objectivesES={"Book 7, Chapter 1: The Land of the Elf-queen","Nona observes the mighty mallorn trees, but says nothing","Nona has recovered from her experience in the Rushgore, and is now interested in learning more about the Elf-woods of Lothlórien before you both leave.","Talk to Galadriel in her garden","Talk to Anglamel on the Telain Melthin","Talk to Luidhros on the Telain Galadhrim","Nona is by the ladder down from the flets on which stand the House of Celeborn.\
\
Nona is waiting for you to show her around Caras Galadhon.","Having shown Nona around Caras Galadhon, you should now speak with Galadriel in her garden as she requested.","Talk to Húrien at Celúrlin, the White Fountain of Caras Galadhon","Talk to Nona atop the ladder leading down from the flet near the House of Celeborn","Nona admires the delicate carving of the swan fountain","Nona looks out into the void between flets and says nothing","Now that Galadriel has given permission for Nona to explore Caras Galadhon, you should bring her to see several of its notable locations: Celúrlin, the White Fountain of Caras Galadhon, and several of the flets where much of the work of the Elves is done: the Telain Galadhrim and Telain Melthin."}},
[2215]={nameES="Libro 7, Capítulo 2: Cruzando la Sombra",objectivesES={"Libro 7, Capítulo 2: Cruzando la Sombra","Reúnete con Raghnall al sur de Bail Cátharnakh, al oeste de Gath Forthnír.\
\
Lorniel te dijo que había oído hablar de un Montañés llamado Raghnall, que buscaba abandonar el servicio de Angmar y podría tener información que le permita acceder a Carn Dûm.","Lorniel se encuentra dentro de Gath Forthnír, al este de Bail Cátharnakh.\
\
Te reuniste con Raghnall y él te entregó un pergamino que explica cómo forjar una llave para las puertas de Carn Dûm.","Lleva el pergamino a Lorniel.","Lorniel te dijo que cree que su padre aún vive, prisionero en las mazmorras de Carn Dûm. Espera encontrar una forma de entrar en la terrible ciudad y rescatarlo."}},
[2216]={nameES="Book 7, Chapter 2: The Council of the Captains",objectivesES={"Aragorn is at his pavilion east of Minas Tirith, after the Battle of Pelennor Fields.","Aragorn is at his pavilion, east of Minas Tirith, after the Battle of Pelennor Fields.","Book 7, Chapter 2: The Council of the Captains","Aragorn has called a council of the captains to decide his next course.","Talk to Aragorn at his pavilion and help him determine his course","Talk to Aragorn at his pavilion on the Pelennor Fields"}},
[2217]={nameES="Book 7, Chapter 2: The Point of Decision",objectivesES={"Galadriel has seen disturbing visions in her mirror, and is worried about what it means for your mutual friends.","Peer into the Mirror of Galadriel and experience 'Session: The Point of Decision' or read the shortened account instead","The Fellowship of the Ring comes at last to the most dangerous decision it must make, on which the fate of Middle-earth will be decided. Frodo Baggins walks alone above Parth Galen, wrestling with the difficult choice, but when one of his companions is seized by apparent madness, the Ringbearer is put to his most difficult test so far...","Talk to Galadriel in her garden","Book 7, Chapter 2: The Point of Decision","Galadriel is in her garden in Caras Galadhon.\
\
You have peered into her mirror, and should now speak to Galadriel about what you have seen.","You peer into the waters of Galadriel's mirror, and indistinct images begin to appear of distant friends and worrisome signs...","The Mirror of Galadriel is within her garden, in Caras Galadhon.\
\
Galadriel has asked you to peer into her mirror and see what awaits the Fellowship on their journey south."}},
[2218]={nameES="Libro 7, Capítulo 3: Abriendo el Camino",objectivesES={"Elrond el Medio Elfo está en Rivendel, en el Bosque de los Trolls.\
\
Laerdan, también incapaz de traducir el pergamino, te envió a Rivendel para hablar con Elrond el Medio Elfo.","Lleva el pergamino a Elrond el Medio Elfo.","Laerdan está en Gath Forthnír.\
\
Lorniel te sugirió que buscaras al Elfo llamado Laerdan con la esperanza de descubrir lo que revela el pergamino de Raghnall.","Recuperaste el pergamino de Raghnall, pero estaba escrito en Lengua Negra, la cual Lorniel no puede traducir.","Libro 7, Capítulo 3: Abriendo el Camino"}},
[2219]={nameES="Book 7, Chapter 3: The Great Jest",objectivesES={"Find the herald north-west of the city gate, in the First Circle <rgb=#00FF00>(2012 Soldiers Pledged to Aragorn)</rgb>","Find the herald north of the city gate, in the First Circle <rgb=#00FF00>(1978 Soldiers Pledged to Aragorn)</rgb>","The herald vouches for a number of soldiers to join Aragorn's army","Aragorn has sent you to find heralds on the Pelennor and in the First Circle of Minas Tirith and set them to calling for soldiers willing to join him on the march to Mordor.","Talk to Éomer at Aragorn's Pavilion","Find the herald inside the city gate of Minas Tirith <rgb=#00FF00>(1698 Soldiers Pledged to Aragorn)</rgb>","There is a herald north-west of the city gate of Minas Tirith, in the First Circle.\
\
Aragorn sent you to read his call for more soldiers to heralds who can reach the ears of the men that have now arrived at the city.","Talk to Prince Imrahil at Aragorn's Pavilion","Read aloud Aragorn's call for soldiers <rgb=#00FF00>(2003 Soldiers Pledged to Aragorn)</rgb>","Talk to Aragorn at his pavilion on the Pelennor Fields <rgb=#00FF00>(2021 Soldiers Pledged to Aragorn)</rgb>","Find the herald north-west of Aragorn's Pavilion <rgb=#00FF00>(0 Soldiers Pledged to Aragorn)</rgb>","Book 7, Chapter 3: The Great Jest","Find the herald north-west of the city gate, in the First Circle <rgb=#00FF00>(2007 Soldiers Pledged to Aragorn)</rgb>","Find the herald outside the city gate of Minas Tirith <rgb=#00FF00>(462 Soldiers Pledged to Aragorn)</rgb>","Talk to Elfhelm at Aragorn's Pavilion","Read aloud Aragorn's call for soldiers <rgb=#00FF00>(1802 Soldiers Pledged to Aragorn)</rgb>","There is a herald inside the city gate of Minas Tirith.\
\
Aragorn sent you to read his call for more soldiers to heralds who can reach the ears of the men that have now arrived at the city.","Mithrandir is at Aragorn's Pavilion east of Minas Tirith, after the Battle of Pelennor Fields.","Imrahil, Éomer, and Elfhelm have returned to Aragorn's Pavilion with a count of the soldiers they have attained for Aragorn's march to Mordor.","The herald waits for your message","Find the herald inside the city gate of Minas Tirith <rgb=#00FF00>(1450 Soldiers Pledged to Aragorn)</rgb>","There is a herald north of the city gate of Minas Tirith, in the First Circle.\
\
Aragorn sent you to read his call for more soldiers to heralds who can reach the ears of the men that have now arrived at the city.","Read aloud Aragorn's call for soldiers <rgb=#00FF00>(1203 Soldiers Pledged to Aragorn)</rgb>","Read aloud Aragorn's call for soldiers <rgb=#00FF00>(0 Soldiers Pledged to Aragorn)</rgb>","There is a herald on the Pelennor Fields north-west of Aragorn's Pavilion.\
\
Aragorn sent you to read his call for more soldiers to heralds who can reach the ears of the men that have now arrived at the city.","Aragorn is at his pavilion east of Minas Tirith, after the Battle of Pelennor Fields.","Talk to Mithrandir at Aragorn's Pavilion","Read aloud Aragorn's call for soldiers <rgb=#00FF00>(2021 Soldiers Pledged to Aragorn)</rgb>","There is a herald outside the city gate of Minas Tirith.\
\
Aragorn sent you to read his call for more soldiers to heralds who can reach the ears of the men that have now arrived at the city.","Find the herald outside the city gate of Minas Tirith <rgb=#00FF00>(1003 Soldiers Pledged to Aragorn)</rgb>"}},
[2220]={nameES="Book 7, Chapter 3: The River-walker",objectivesES={"Talk to Faengalph and arrange for a boat and paddles for the journey","Nona is on the flets near the House of Celeborn.\
\
Corudan has sent you to tell Nona you are ready to leave.","Galadriel wants you to journey south along the river Anduin to see what fate has befallen the Fellowship, but for that you will need a guide.","Talk to Nona near the House of Celeborn when you are ready to depart on your southward journey","Corudan is waiting on Telain Neduil for you to return from arranging for a boat and supplies for the journey down the Anduin.","Bordhrist is on Telain Galadhrim, and Faengalph is near the surrounding hedge not far from the entrance to Caras Galadhon, beneath Telain Glorelloth.","Book 7, Chapter 3: The River-walker","Corudan is on Telain Neduil in the eastern side of Caras Galadhon.\
\
Galadriel has sent you to recruit Corudan as a guide along the Anduin as you investigate what has happened to the Fellowship.","Talk to Bordhrist and receive supplies of food for the journey","Return to Corudan on Telain Neduil"}},
[2221]={nameES="Book 7, Chapter 3: The River-walker",objectivesES={"Talk to Faengalph and arrange for a boat and paddles for the journey","Nona is on the flets near the House of Celeborn.\
\
Corudan has sent you to tell Nona you are ready to leave.","Galadriel wants you to journey south along the river Anduin to see what fate has befallen the Fellowship, but for that you will need a guide.","Talk to Nona near the House of Celeborn when you are ready to depart on your southward journey","Corudan is waiting on Telain Neduil for you to return from arranging for a boat and supplies for the journey down the Anduin.","Bordhrist is on Telain Galadhrim, and Faengalph is near the surrounding hedge not far from the entrance to Caras Galadhon, beneath Telain Glorelloth.","Book 7, Chapter 3: The River-walker","Corudan is on Telain Neduil in the eastern side of Caras Galadhon.\
\
Galadriel has sent you to recruit Corudan as a guide along the Anduin as you investigate what has happened to the Fellowship.","Talk to Bordhrist and receive supplies of food for the journey","Return to Corudan on Telain Neduil"}},
[2222]={nameES="Book 7, Chapter 4: A Loud Departure",objectivesES={"Go to the western entrance of Osgiliath","Go to the eastern entrance of Osgiliath","Bandron is at the western entrance to Osgiliath.\
\
You gathered a number of trumpeters to travel with Aragorn's army and announce the coming of King Elessar, and now should speak with some familiar faces at the entrance to Osgiliath.","Talk to Culang on the Pelennor Fields, after the battle","As you approach the east gate, you see Mithrandir astride Shadowfax","Trumpeters can be found on the Pelennor Fields, after the battle.\
\
Mithrandir has asked you to find trumpeters throughout the Pelennor Fields that might be willing to announce the departure of Aragorn's army from Minas Tirith with great noise and tumult.","Aragorn's army is passing through Osgiliath, and Mithrandir intended to meet you at the eastern gate of the city.","Talk to Bandron at the west entrance of Osgiliath","Talk to Ruhír on the Pelennor Fields, after the battle","Talk to Celebrom on the Pelennor Fields, after the battle","Nethadan is at the western entrance to Osgiliath.\
\
You gathered a number of trumpeters to travel with Aragorn's army and announce the coming of King Elessar, and now should speak with some familiar faces at the entrance to Osgiliath.","Book 7, Chapter 4: A Loud Departure","Mithrandir asked you to travel to the western gate of Osgiliath after you gathered four trumpeters.","Some enemies are still hiding in Osgiliath, waiting to jump out and attack the craftsmen responsible for repairing the city and the bridges.\
\
Bandron asked you to defeat some of the enemies lurking in Osgiliath in order to protect his interests.","Talk to Limlaer on the Pelennor Fields, after the battle","Talk to Mithrandir at the eastern entrance of Osgiliath","You see some familiar faces within the west entrance of Osgiliath","Talk to Nethadan at the west entrance of Osgiliath","Mithrandir has given you a surprising directive: one of attention-seeking noise rather than the maintenance of secrecy!","Mithrandir is astride Shadowfax at the east gate of Osgiliath."}},
[2223]={nameES="Book 7, Chapter 4: Along the Shore",objectivesES={"Corudan is at Haldirith, in Thinglad.\
\
You have searched for the Orc that took Corudan's bow, but did not find it.","The first stage of your journey south with Corudan and Nona involves a brief stop in Thinglad to collect Corudan's bow.","Orcs can be found throughout Thinglad, alongside the Great River. Defeat them while Corudan and Nona do the same, and perhaps you will find Corudan's lost bow.","Talk to Corudan in Haldirith","Nona looks at you with disappointment on her face, and you can tell that she has not found Corudan's bow either.","Nona is in Haldirith, in Thinglad.\
\
You should speak to Nona about her experience hunting with Corudan.","Corudan is in Thinglad, in the Great River.\
\
You have come to Thinglad with Nona and Corudan, and should speak to Corudan, who wanted to recover the bow he lent to Fimloth.","Nona looks around Haldirith with interest, but says nothing.","Talk to Nona in Haldirith","Book 7, Chapter 4: Along the Shore"}},
[2224]={nameES="Libro 7, Capítulo 4: Maestría Enana",objectivesES={"Libro 7, Capítulo 4: Maestría Enana","Dwalin está en la Mansión de Thorin, en Ered Luin\
\
Elrond transcribió el pergamino al Oestron, pero te indicó que buscaras la ayuda de Dwalin y los enanos de Ered Luin para forjar la llave de paso a Carn Dûm","Viajaste a Rivendel para buscar la ayuda de Elrond el Medio Elfo en la traducción del pergamino de Raghnall. El Maestro de La Última Morada te dio una bienvenida misteriosa, pero se ofreció a ayudarte.","Lleva el pergamino a Dwalin"}},
[2225]={nameES="Book 7, Chapter 5: A Stop In Stangard",objectivesES={"Talk to Horn in Stangard","Corudan is at Haldirith, in Thinglad.","Collect Horn's harp from the Stangard tavern","Talk to Afic at the gate of Stangard to learn of Horn's whereabouts","Collect Horn's writing supplies from Wada's house","Horn is no longer welcome in Stangard, and has asked you to collect his harp from the Stangard Tavern, and his writing supplies from Wada's house.","Bring his harp and writing supplies to Horn in Stangard","Nona has requested that you stop by the Rohirrim outpost of Stangard so she can thank Horn for speaking on her behalf.","Talk to Corudan at Haldirith","Book 7, Chapter 5: A Stop In Stangard","Collected Horn's writing supplies","Horn is in Stangard, waiting for you to bring him the items for which he asked.","Nona is in Haldirith, in Thinglad.\
\
Horn has decided to travel with you, and now you should go back to Nona so she can be told.","You should speak with Afic, the guard at the gate of Stangard, about meeting with Horn.","Talk to Nona at Haldirith","Corudan looks at you silently, brooding about his lost bow.","Collected Horn's Harp","Horn is atop the hill of Stangard.\
\
You have spoken with Afic, the guard at the gate of Stangard, and he had some inexplicably harsh words concerning Horn."}},
[2226]={nameES="Book 7, Chapter 5: The Garden of Gondor",objectivesES={"Henneth Annûn is located north of the Cross-roads, in North Ithilien.\
\
Aragorn asked you to travel ahead of the host and come to the Ranger hideout at Henneth Annûn.","Aragorn is at the Cross-roads of the King, in Ithilien.","Tell Limlaer to announce the coming of the king","Talk to Golasdín at Henneth Annûn","You realize you are being watched moments before a Ranger emerges from hiding","Talk to Aragorn at the cross-roads","Talk to Peregrin Took east of Osgiliath","Trumpeters can be found at each of the roads that leave the Cross-roads of the King. After they have been told to sound their instruments, Aragorn asked you to defeat foes in North Ithilien and make your way to the Ranger hideout at Henneth Annûn.","Tell Celebrom to announce the coming of the king","Peregrin Took is east of Osgiliath, before the road rises into the hills of Ithilien.\
\
Gandalf told you that Pippin is riding with the Host of the West, and might want to speak to you.","The land of Ithilien was green and beautiful before the armies of Sauron came. Does it retain any of the loveliness it once possessed?","Tell Ruhír to announce the coming of the king","The Cross-roads of the King are east of Osgiliath, in Ithilien.\
\
Aragorn and the Host of the West are marching into Ithilien, and plan to stop at the Cross-roads.","Find the Ranger encampment at Henneth Annûn, in North Ithilien","Tell Culang to announce the coming of the king","Aragorn has called a halt at the Cross-roads of the King","Go to the cross-roads in North Ithilien","Henneth Annûn is located far north of the Cross-roads, in North Ithilien.\
\
Aragorn asked you to move ahead of the host and come to the Ranger camp at Henneth Annûn.","Book 7, Chapter 5: The Garden of Gondor"}},
[2227]={nameES="Libro 7, Capítulo 5: Lo que se Necesita",objectivesES={"Dwalin se puede encontrar en la Mansión de Thorin en Ered Luin.\
\
Litli tomó el mithril de ti y comenzó a calentarlo. Sin embargo, mencionó que dar forma al mithril será un problema, uno que quizás Dwalin pueda resolver.","Litli se puede encontrar junto a la forja cerca del trono dla Mansión de Thorin.\
\
Ahora que has recuperado el mithril y la llave de Éogan, Litli, uno de los herreros de Dwalin, puede comenzar a trabajar en la llave.","Dwalin se puede encontrar en la Mansión de Thorin en Ered Luin.\
\
Dwalin te envió a conseguir una pepita de mithril de la Casa Mathom en la Comarca y una llave para ayudar a hacer un molde de Jon Helecharroyo en Archet.","El Guardián Brombard Colazorro está en la Casa Mathom en Cavada Grande, en la parte occidental de la Comarca. Jon Helecharroyo está en el pueblo de Archet, al noreste de Bree.\
\
Dwalin te informó que necesita una pepita de mithril, que podría estar en posesión de la Casa Mathom en la Comarca, y una llave para hacer un molde, que podría obtenerse de Jon Helecharroyo, el nuevo Capitán de Archet.","Lleva los materiales recolectados a Dwalin","Dwalin, Maestro de la Mansión de Thorin, ha accedido a ayudarte a forjar la llave, pero faltan algunos componentes vitales.","Llevar los materiales recolectados a Litli","Libro 7, Capítulo 5: Lo que se Necesita"}},
[2228]={nameES="Book 7, Chapter 6: A Journey by Boat",objectivesES={}},
[2229]={nameES="Book 7, Chapter 6: The Window on the West",objectivesES={"Explore the main cavern of Henneth Annûn","Aragorn is outside Henneth Annûn, and wishes to speak to you.\
\
You have learned that Orcs and Easterlings aim to ambush the Host of the West as it travels through Cirith Negen, and should report their plan to Aragorn.","The refuge of the Rangers is not luxurious, but it is comfortable enough","The Rangers of Ithilien scout the wood-lands for servants of the Enemy, striking from their hidden camp at Henneth Annûn. In this way, they can help clear the way for the Host of the West as it makes its way toward Mordor.","Orndil thought he saw something to the north-east.\
\
You should investigate further.","The hidden path is narrow and treacherous, and descends into the earth","Orndil nods at you as you catch up with him","Orndil was right: there are signs the enemy seeks to ambush Aragorn at Cirith Negen","From this vantage point you can see the Forbidden Pool and much of the surrounding area","Nearby Rangers scowl angrily and chide you with disapproval and disappointment","Explore the look-out point at the highest point of Henneth Annûn","Talk to Orndil at the look-out spot","Book 7, Chapter 6: The Window on the West","Explore the descending tunnel to Henneth Annûn","Orndil is north-east of Henneth Annûn, and wishes to speak with you.","Find the look-out spot further to the north-east that Orndil mentioned","Golasdín welcomed you to explore the hidden path, the cave hideout, and the look-out at Henneth Annûn. He warned you not to enter the Forbidden Pool.","You spy movement to the north-east, but cannot tell for certain","Talk to Aragorn outside Henneth Annûn","<rgb=#00FF00>Look</rgb> into the distance","The Rangers of Ithilien have a useful scouting location to the north-east of Henneth Annûn.\
\
Aragorn asked you to find Orndil and to scout ahead of the host for dangers posed by lurking enemies.","Talk to Aragorn at Henneth Annûn","Aragorn is outside Henneth Annûn, and wishes to speak to you.","<rgb=#FF0000>Do not enter the Forbidden Pool</rgb>","The Ranger Orndil nods at you as you arrive at his look-out spot","Find the look-out spot north-east of Henneth Annûn that Aragorn mentioned"}},
[2230]={nameES="Libro 7, Capítulo 6: El Martillo de Thrór",objectivesES={"Has recogido el Martillo de Thrór","Libro 7, Capítulo 6: El Martillo de Thrór","Reclama el Martillo de Thrór de la tumba de Skorgrím","Obtuviste la pepita de mithril y la llave arruinada como pidió Dwalin, pero su herrero, Litli, te informó que aún falta algo más para trabajar el mithril.","Litli se encuentra junto a las forjas, cerca del trono de la Mansión de Thorin, en Ered Luin.\
\
Debes llevar el martillo que encontraste a Litli, para que pueda forjar la llave que necesitas.","El Martillo de Thrór se encuentra en la tumba de Skorgrím Duramano. La tumba está al sureste de la Mansión de Thorin.\
\
Dwalin te dijo que necesitaba un martillo que Thrór, abuelo de Thorin y último Rey Bajo la Montaña antes de la llegada de Smaug, llevó consigo al exilio, y que Thráin, su hijo, trajo a las Montañas Azules.","Lleva el Martillo de Thrór a Dwalin","Lleva el Martillo de Thrór a Litli"}},
[2231]={nameES="Book 7, Chapter 7: Shadow of the Argonath",objectivesES={"Book 7, Chapter 7: Shadow of the Argonath","Horn has asked you to speak with Nona and Corudan before gathering sticks to make a campfire.","Bring the fallen sticks to Horn in the shadow of the Argonath","Your boat is beached not far from the Argonath.\
\
Horn has asked you to remove the supplies from the boat.","You have come to the East Wall, where the Argonath towers on either side of the Anduin and the falls of Rauros boom unceasingly.","Talk to Corudan in the shadow of the Argonath","Remove the remaining supplies from your boat near the Argonath","Horn has asked you to speak with Nona and Corudan before gathering sticks to make a camp-fire.","You reach into the boat and remove the remaining supplies for apportioning.","Fallen sticks can be found near the trees not far from the Argonath.\
\
Horn has asked you to collect fallen sticks near the Argonath for preparing a camp-site.","Talk to Nona in the shadow of the Argonath","Horn is by the beach near the Argonath.\
\
You have collected fallen sticks for making a camp-fire, as Horn requested.","Horn speaks quietly, for what he has to say is meant for your ears alone.\
\
'We spoke of a great many things on the boat, and I do not begrudge you for speaking in generalities, but you told me enough to know your errand here is important. Friends of yours came this way, friends bearing a burden of some malice. Whatever they carried, it was sought by Orcs, and perhaps others as well. We need to find what happened to these friends of yours and if their burden has been lost.'\
\
Horn raises his voice to include the Rohirrim man standing nearby.\
\
'This man saw our boat drifting down the river, and hailed me from the shore. His name is Framric, and he has come with a party of Rohirrim from the Wold. I would have us help his people, if they desire our help.\
\
'But first we must prepare our own camp. Speak with Nona and Corudan for their thoughts, and then collect sticks for a fire. I will do the same.'"}},
[2232]={nameES="Book 7, Chapter 7: The Ambush",objectivesES={"Dagoras is in the hidden cave at Henneth Annûn.\
\
Aragorn asked you to speak with Dagoras so he might select Rangers of the Grey Company suitable for the task of ambushing the force that seeks to waylay the Host of the West at Cirith Negen.","Legolas looks at you with a raised eyebrow and a hurt expression","Book 7, Chapter 7: The Ambush","Talk to Legolas in the hidden cave at Henneth Annûn","Hethradir is at the look-out point above the Forbidden Pool, near Henneth Annûn.\
\
Aragorn asked you to speak with Hethradir so he might select Rangers of Ithilien suitable for the task of ambushing the force that seeks to waylay the Host of the West at Cirith Negen.","Talk to Aragorn outside Henneth Annûn","Talk to Legolas and travel to Cirith Negen","Legolas is in the hidden cave at Henneth Annûn.","The Rangers of Ithilien have learned that Orcs and Easterlings seek to surprise the Host of the West on its march, and Aragorn has charged you with defeating the ambush before it can be sprung.","Talk to Dagoras in the hidden cave at Henneth Annûn","Dagoras is in the hidden cave at Henneth Annûn.\
\
You have helped to rout the intended ambush at Cirith Negen, and should now speak with Dagoras.","Legolas is in the hidden cave at Henneth Annûn, ready to leave for Cirith Negen.","Talk to Hethradir by the look-out point over the Forbidden Pool","Aragorn is outside Henneth Annûn.\
\
Dagoras wanted you to raise his concerns with Aragorn concerning his experience in Cirith Negen."}},
[2233]={nameES="Libro 7, Capítulo 7: La Llave Forjada",objectivesES={"Después de recuperar el Martillo de Thrór y los materiales necesarios, el herrero de Dwalin, Litli, forjó para ti una llave de mithril que debería permitirte atravesar las puertas de Carn Dûm.","Libro 7, Capítulo 7: La Llave Forjada","Lorniel espera tu regreso en Gath Forthnír, en el este de Angmar\
\
Deberías llevarle la llave a Lorniel","Entrega la llave de la puerta de Carn Dûm a Lorniel"}},
[2234]={nameES="Book 7, Chapter 8: Reading the Signs",objectivesES={"The Fellowship of the Ring has broken. Is it too late for Boromir of Gondor to make up for the madness that seized him near the high seat of Amon Hen? Desperate to save the hobbits from death, he fights the ferocious Uruks of the White Hand with the last of his strength....","Tracks in the dirt reveal a great number of running feet passed this way!","A discarded pack lies partially buried in the grass of Parth Galen.","Sandy footprints lead down to the water!","You see sandy footprints among the stones of the beach. They are unmistakably those of a hobbit.","Corudan is in the shadow of the Argonath, in the East Wall.\
\
You have learned much about what befell the Fellowship, and should now return to tell the story to Corudan.","Scour the beach near Parth Galen for clues and experience 'Session: Two Hobbits' or read the shortened account instead....","Follow tracks to Dead Orc Glade and experience 'Session: The Horn of Gondor' or read the shortened account instead","Find the lawn of Parth Galen, in the East Wall","Scour the beach near Parth Galen for clues and experience 'Two Hobbits'","Talk to Corudan in the shadow of the Argonath","Book 7, Chapter 8: Reading the Signs","The lawn of Parth Galen is south of the Argonath, on the south-western side of the lake of Nen Hithoel.\
\
Corudan believes you should begin your search for the Fellowship on the lawn of Parth Galen.","You feel the rough leather of the discarded pack between two fingers, and wonder who might have left it here, unattended. Was it left out of need, or out of forgetfulness?","These tracks by the shore are very different than the booted feet that went off to the north of the camp and the discarded pack. You should investigate these sandy footprints eventually, but first you should go where the danger seems to have gone, and follow the other set of tracks that lead away from the discarded pack to the north!","There are enough supplies for a short stay, and you divide them among the rest of your companions.","Sandy footprints on the beach near Parth Galen may give some clue as to what happened to the Fellowship!","Corudan is in the shadow of the Argonath.\
\
You have divided up the supplies you brought from Lothlórien and should now speak with Corudan.","A great battle was fought at Dead Orc Glade... but not everyone came this way. Are there clues on the beach back near Parth Galen?","Examine the discarded pack and experience 'Session: The Breaking of the Fellowship' or read the shortened account at the Parth Galen camp-site instead","Your exploration of the East Wall will need to be comprehensive if you are to learn what happened to the Fellowship here, and if it is still in your power to help them.","A discarded pack in the grass catches your eye","The Fellowship of the Ring has come to the lawn of Parth Galen, but unless its eight surviving members can overcome the evils that threaten to divide them, it will go no further. Even now, the One Ring seeks to ensnare another heart....","A slain Uruk in the southern part of the glade catches your attention","When all else fails, good old-fashioned hobbit-sense must win the day. And so it is that Samwise Gamgee learns of the Ringbearer's plan, and the two set off for Mordor and the Mountain of Fire... alone.","Somewhere within the East Wall, there are more signs of what happened to the Fellowship.","This Uruk bears the mark of the White Hand, and was slain by many desperate cuts of a blade."}},
[2235]={nameES="Book 7, Chapter 8: Resolve",objectivesES={"Rangers of Ithilien hid supply caches east and north of Bâr Tarnaher.\
\
Bregaras asked you to retrieve Ranger supply caches and bring them back to Bâr Tarnaher.","Talk to Bregaras at Bâr Tarnaher","Talk to Gimli at Bâr Tarnaher","Talk to Unréth at Bâr Tarnaher","Gimli is at Bâr Tarnaher, in North Ithilien.","Unréth and Maegur are at Bâr Tarnaher.\
\
Gimli noticed that the soldiers that came with you to Bâr Tarnaher have become increasingly troubled.","Bregaras is at Bâr Tarnaher, north-west of Henneth Annûn in North Ithilien.","Talk to Maegur at Bâr Tarnaher","Book 7, Chapter 8: Resolve","Aragorn is at his camp on the border between Dagorlad and North Ithilien.","Travel to Bâr Tarnaher, north-west of Henneth Annûn","Aragorn is at Henneth Annûn, in North Ithilien.","Deposit the collected supplies near Bregaras at Bâr Tarnaher","Unréth's courage fails, and he looks to you for reassurance","Legolas motions for you to halt, and his eyes search the sky","With the ambush of the Orcs and the Easterlings now foiled, Aragorn sets his sights upon the road ahead.","Talk to Aragorn at his camp on the border of Dagorlad","Legolas is at the ruin of Bâr Tarnaher, in North Ithilien.\
\
You have come to the ruin of Bâr Tarnaher, but Legolas has found something amiss.","Talk to Aragorn at Henneth Annûn","Soldiers of Aragorn's host can be found at Henneth Annûn.\
\
Aragorn asked you to try and bolster the courage of his men.","Bregaras motions to you, desiring to speak","Talk to Legolas at Bâr Tarnaher","Bâr Tarnaher is north-west of Henneth Annûn.\
\
The Rangers of Bâr Tarnaher have launched many attacks upon the Orcs from that ruin, and may know of any dangers to the Host of the West on the road ahead.","Bregaras asked you to leave the supplies you collected at Bâr Tarnaher.","You become aware that Gimli has been trying to capture your attention","Maegur's courage fails, and he looks to you for reassurance"}},
[2236]={nameES="Libro 7, Capítulo 8: Las Puertas de Carn Dûm",objectivesES={"Libro 7, Capítulo 8: Las Puertas de Carn Dûm","Habla con Lorniel","Con la llave de Carn Dûm en mano, ha llegado el momento de alzarnos contra las fuerzas del Falso Rey e intentar rescatar a Golodir.","Golodir está en Gath Forthnír.\
\
Has rescatado a Golodir, pero a un costo terrible. El Falso Rey, Mordirith, apareció y la mató. Lograste debilitar a Mordirith y escapar con Golodir de regreso a Gath Forthnír."}},
[2237]={nameES="Book 7, Chapter 9: By Secret Steps",objectivesES={"Langlas is at Aragorn's camp on the Dagorlad border.\
\
Langlas has called out to you. He has something to say before you leave to scout the plains of Dagorlad.","Aragorn is at his camp on the Dagorlad border.","Talk to Aragorn at his camp on the Dagorlad border","Talk to Faeron at Aragorn's camp on the Dagorlad border","Aragorn has asked you to scout the lands ahead so he will know what awaits the host on its final march to the Black Gate.","Faeron and Mincham can be found at Aragorn's camp on the border of Dagorlad.\
\
Aragorn has asked you to bring several of his Rangers on a mission to scout ahead of the host.","Talk to Langlas at Aragorn's camp on the Dagorlad border","Talk to Mincham at Aragorn's camp on the Dagorlad border","Book 7, Chapter 9: By Secret Steps","Talk to Aragorn and scout the slag-hills of Dagorlad","Aragorn is at his camp on the border of Dagorlad."}},
[2238]={nameES="Book 7, Chapter 9: Three Hunters",objectivesES={"You peer out over the plains, and see a far-off cloud of dust","Mansig's encampment is east of the ridge that forms the border between the East Wall and the Norcrofts.\
\
You should speak with Mansig about acquiring war-steeds that will allow you to follow the Uruks into Rohan.","Travel to the ridge west of Mansig's encampment that forms the border of the East Wall with the Norcrofts","Mansig's encampment is located south-west of the Argonath, on the border of the East Wall and the Norcrofts. A man named Ingild claims to have information of interest to you and your companions.","Talk to Mansig at his encampment","Book 7, Chapter 9: Three Hunters","Your companions stand on the ridge that overlooks the Norcrofts of Rohan, and want to speak with you concerning your next move.","You stand on the ridge that forms the border with the Norcrofts","To the west of Mansig's encampment, a ridge overlooks the Norcrofts of Rohan. Ingild thinks you should <rgb=#FF0000>look</rgb> out over the plains and see if you can see the Uruks that fled East Wall.","Corudan has found some sign of the Fellowship in East Wall as well, and wants you to investigate.","Talk to Ingild at Mansig's encampment, in the East Wall","<rgb=#FF0000>Look</rgb> out over the plains of Rohan"}},
[2239]={nameES="Book 8, Chapter 10: Shield-brothers",objectivesES={}},
[2240]={nameES="Book 8, Chapter 11: Across the Vale",objectivesES={"Horn is at the entrance to Eaworth, in the Entwash Vale.","Eaworth is located in the Entwash Vale, halfway up the Entwash river.\
\
Elfmar has asked you to defeat mounted foes in the Entwash Vale as you travel to Eaworth.","Talk to Horn in Eaworth","Nona, Horn, and Corudan are outside the Mead Hall in Faldham.\
\
Elfmar has asked you to thank your companions from him before you leave for Eaworth.","Talk to Corudan in Faldham","Elfmar has thanked you for training his men, and thinks you should travel north-west to Eaworth for news of the passing Uruks.","Book 8, Chapter 11: Across the Vale","Talk to Nona in Faldham","Nona is silent and, unusually, has nothing to say.","Talk to Horn in Faldham"}},
[2241]={nameES="Book 8, Chapter 12: Homecoming",objectivesES={"You have come to Eaworth, the town where Horn grew up, to see what they have seen of the uruks that crossed Rohan.","Corudan is in Eaworth.\
\
You have spoken with Ingbert and learned that the Uruks passed north of Eaworth, followed by the Third Marshal of the Riddermark.","Talk to Reeve Ingbert in the Mead Hall of Eaworth","Talk to Léowulf and attend the meagre feast","Book 8, Chapter 12: Homecoming","Ingbert's steward Léowulf is in the Mead Hall of Eaworth.\
\
Reeve Ingbert has reluctantly agreed to provide a feast for you and your companions, the very minimum amount of hospitality required by his customs.","Talk to Ingbert in the Mead Hall of Eaworth","Reeve Ingbert is in the Mead Hall of Eaworth.\
\
You have come to Eaworth to learn what its people know of the Uruks you are seeking.","Reeve Ingbert is in the Mead Hall of Eaworth.\
\
You have feasted with Ingbert and now he is waiting to speak with you.","Talk to Corudan in Eaworth"}},
[2242]={nameES="Book 8, Chapter 13: The Ghost Vanishes",objectivesES={"Corudan is in Eaworth.\
\
Horn is convinced that Nona has left your group for some reason, and that she will return.","Find Horn or Nona somewhere in or around Eaworth","Talk to Corudan in Eaworth","Book 8, Chapter 13: The Ghost Vanishes","Horn is looking for Nona in Eaworth.\
\
Corudan thinks you should ask around to see if anyone has seen Nona, and if you cannot find her, you should look for Horn.","No one has seen Nona since the feast at Eaworth. Corudan and Horn are worried."}},
[2243]={nameES="Libro 8, Capítulo 1: Escape de Rushdurinul",objectivesES={"Issuriel se encuentra en el alto flet sobre Cerin Amroth, en Lothlórien.\
\
Issuriel desea escuchar el relato de tu escape de Rushdurinul con el cautivo Mazog, ya que los otros Elfos presentes se mostraron reacios a contarle el resto de la historia.","Issuriel de Lothlórien se encuentra en el alto flet sobre Cerin Amroth.\
\
Haldir te ha hablado de los preparativos que se están haciendo para la partida de la Hueste Dorada hacia el Bosque Negro y desea que hables con Issuriel, una elfa que está siendo considerado para liderar a los Malledhrim. Ella tiene preguntas para hacerte sobre la captura de Mazog.","Mientras Celeborn prepara la Hueste Dorada para avanzar sobre el Bosque Negro en una jugada desesperada para evitar un ataque de Dol Guldur, todavía hay algunos asuntos por resolver.","Libro 8, Capítulo 1: Escape de Rushdurinul","Issuriel se encuentra en el alto flet sobre Cerin Amroth, en Lothlórien.\
\
Has contado el resto del relato de tu escape de Rushdurinul con Mazog, y Issuriel ha escuchado algo que le preocupa.","Habla con Issuriel en Cerin Amroth","Habla con Issuriel y cuéntale la historia de tu escape de Rushdurinul"}},
[2244]={nameES="Book 8, Chapter 1: No Other Way",objectivesES={"Daervunn and Pippin are at the edge of the Camp of the Host, where the northward road leads into Dagorlad.","Aragorn is on the rise in the middle of the Camp of the Host.","Talk to Mithrandir and experience 'Interlude: No Other Way' or read the shortened account instead","Daervunn and Pippin are staring out at the road ahead","Mithrandir is at the Camp of the Host, on the border of Dagorlad.","The Host of the West has come to the border between Ithilien and Dagorlad. There is now no other way to go but forward to the Black Gate of Mordor.","Mithrandir calls to you with concern in his voice","Find Daervunn at the northern edge of the Camp of the Host","Book 8, Chapter 1: No Other Way","Talk to Aragorn at the Camp of the Host","Daervunn is at the northern edge of the Camp of the Host, where the road leaves the encampment and passes into Dagorlad.\
\
Aragorn has asked you to see if Daervunn has readied the men to march.","The worried thoughts of the Host of the West turn towards Frodo and Sam, who have passed beyond even Gandalf's sight. He knows only that the hobbits make for the dangerous pass of Cirith Ungol, their guide the creature Gollum, spared years ago by the mercy of Bilbo. Their guide possesses knowledge of this hidden way into Mordor, but another secret he keeps to himself: the identity of the terrible guardian that lurks within the tunnel through which they must pass...","Mithrandir is at the Camp of the Host on the border of Dagorlad.\
\
Something has worried Mithrandir and he wishes to speak to you about it.","Aragorn is on the rise in the middle of the Camp of the Host.\
\
Daervunn reported that the men are ready to march.","Talk to Mithrandir at the Camp of the Host","Talk to Pippin Took at the northern edge of the Camp of the Host","Mithrandir is at the Camp of the Host on the border of Dagorlad.\
\
Mithrandir is worried about what might have befallen Frodo and Sam since they parted ways with Faramir in Ithilien.","Talk to Daervunn at the northern edge of the Camp of the Host"}},
[2245]={nameES="Libro 8, Capítulo 1: La Llama Titilante",objectivesES={"Lleva el equipo de Golodir a Laerdan","Libro 8, Capítulo 1: La Llama Titilante","Encuentra a Prakhum, emisario de la Ciudad de los Trasgos, y recupera la espada de Golodir de él","Encuentra a Laugi Lenguadorada, emisario de los Duramano, y recupera el escudo de Golodir de él","El equipo de Golodir fue entregado a emisarios de los trasgos, enanos y nómadas de Angmar. Estos emisarios pueden encontrarse en las agujas que rodean Barad Gúlaran, al sur de Gath Forthnír.\
\
Como primer paso en su plan para renovar el espíritu de Golodir, Laerdan te ha pedido que recuperes las armas y pertenencias del Montaraz de manos de los emisarios dentro de las torres de Barad Gúlaran.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Esta misión está pensada para una comunidad. Si decides emprenderla en solitario recibirás una bonificación de inspiración, pero el desafío será grande.</rgb>","Encuentra a Karstíona, emisaria de los Trév Duvárdain, y recupera la cota de malla de Golodir de ella","El asalto a Carn Dûm trajo la libertad del Montaraz Golodir, pero resultó inútil, pues Lorniel pereció y Mordirith, el Senescal de Angmar, se replegó en la fortaleza de la ciudad.","Laerdan está en Gath Forthnír.\
\
Golodir, destrozado por la muerte de su hija, te dijo que lo dejaras en paz y que fueras a hablar con el Elfo Laerdan.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Esta misión está pensada para una comunidad. Si decides emprenderla en solitario recibirás una bonificación de inspiración, pero el desafío será grande.</rgb>","Cota de malla de Golodir recuperada","Espada de Golodir recuperada","Escudo de Golodir recuperado"}},
[2246]={nameES="Book 8, Chapter 1: War-steeds from the Wold",objectivesES={"Enstan is by the south-east exit of Harwick, in the Wold.\
\
Your companions have war-steeds of their own and now you have heard that Enstan wants your help with something urgent.","In order to obtain war-steeds for yourself and your companions, you will need to accomplish two things: complete the preparations for and defence of Langhold, and learn about mounted combat in Harwick.\
\
The defence of Langhold involves a chain of ten quests that begins with a quest bestowed by Dala called 'The Wold.' If Dala has no more quests for you, search around Langhold for other quest-givers.\
\
You can learn about mounted combat at the Tourney Field in Harwick.","You and your companions will need war-steeds if you are to travel across the plains of Rohan with any speed.","Learn how to participate in mounted combat at the Tourney Field in Harwick","Your companions have obtained war-steeds of their own, and are waiting to speak with you in Harwick, by the tourney ground near the stables.","Book 8, Chapter 1: War-steeds from the Wold","Complete all quests in Langhold, in the Wold"}},
[2247]={nameES="Book 8, Chapter 2: Last Chances",objectivesES={"Aragorn is on the rise in the middle of the Camp of the Host.","As you approach, Corunir breaks free of his reverie","Lothrandir is south of Aragorn's position on the rise in the Camp of the Host, on the border of Dagorlad.\
\
Aragorn wanted you to express to some of his kinsmen how grateful he is for the sacrifices they have made, and will make, in his service.","As you approach, Lothrandir surfaces from his thoughts of home","The Host of the West prepares to set forth on the last leg of the march to the Black Gate, and Aragorn wants his friends and kin to know that he is grateful for their trust and their service.","Corunir is east of Radanir's position in the Camp of the Host, on the border of Dagorlad.\
\
Aragorn wanted you to express to some of his kinsmen how grateful he is for the sacrifices they have made, and will make, in his service.","Talk to Lothrandir south of the rise in the Camp of the Host","Book 8, Chapter 2: Last Chances","Talk to Radanir to the south-east of Lothrandir's position in the Camp of the Host","Talk to Aragorn at the Camp of the Host","Talk to Calenglad north of Corunir's position in the Camp of the Host","Aragorn surfaces from his thoughts, and turns to face you","Lothrandir is deep in thought, contemplating the home he left behind.","As you approach, Calenglad returns from his thoughts","Radanir is south-east of Lothrandir's position in the Camp of the Host on the border of Dagorlad.\
\
Aragorn wanted you to express to some of his kinsmen how grateful he is for the sacrifices they have made, and will make, in his service.","Aragorn is lost in his thoughts.","Calenglad is lost in his thoughts.","Radanir is lost in his thoughts.","Corunir is lost in his thoughts.","Calenglad is north of Corunir's position in the Camp of the Host, on the border of Dagorlad.\
\
Aragorn wanted you to express to some of his kinsmen how grateful he is for the sacrifices they have made, and will make, in his service.","Talk to Corunir east of Radanir's position in the Camp of the Host","As you approach, Radanir emerges from his thoughts","Talk to Aragorn in the Camp of the Host"}},
[2248]={nameES="Libro 8, Capítulo 2: Reavivar la Llama",objectivesES={"Lleva la espada y el escudo a Daervunn.","Libro 8, Capítulo 2: Reavivar la Llama","Daervunn está en Esteldín.\
\
Debes regresar con Daervunn para recoger la Cota de Malla de Golodir y ver si tiene alguna idea sobre cómo reparar la espada.","Lleva la espada y el escudo a Toram.","Recupera la espada y el escudo de Golodir de Toram en Esteldín.\
\
Daervunn te pidió que llevaras la espada y el escudo de Golodir a Toram, un forjador de armaduras en Esteldín, para que los repare.","Lograste recuperar el equipo de Golodir, pero como te señaló Laerdan, el equipo estaba corroído y deteriorado más allá de su uso.","Lleva el equipo de Golodir a Daervunn.","Daervunn está en Esteldín, en las Quebradas del Norte, muy al sur y al oeste de Angmar.\
\
Laerdan te instruyó para que llevaras el equipo de Golodir al Montaraz Daervunn para que lo repare.","Toram está en Esteldín\
\
Daervunn sintió que podía reparar la Cota de Malla de Golodir, pero la espada y el escudo estaban más allá de su habilidad. Te pidió que hablaras con Toram en Esteldín para que repare esos objetos."}},
[2249]={nameES="Book 8, Chapter 2: Troubles at Floodwend",objectivesES={"Corudan looks at you silently. He raises an eyebrow at you, and there is a strange fire in his eyes.","Book 8, Chapter 2: Troubles at Floodwend","Floodwend is south-east of Harwick, along the road.\
\
You have agreed to ride to the defence of Floodwend.","Harwick has received urgent pleas for help from Floodwend, and cannot spare anyone to ride there but you.","Talk to Corudan by the entrance to Floodwend","Talk to Goldlac at the entrance to Floodwend","Easterlings are crossing into the Wold south of the rapids of Sarn Gebir, and you need to defeat them and gather their scattered belongings.","Bring salvaged belongings to Goldlac at the entrance to Floodwend","Corudan is by the entrance to Floodwend.\
\
Corudan wants to speak with you about the bow that Elfsige took from a dead Orc near Floodwend.","Goldlac is at the entrance to Floodwend, in the Wold.\
\
You have defeated Easterlings and collected their salvaged supplies, and should return now to Goldlac."}},
[2250]={nameES="Book 8, Chapter 3: A Waiting Silence",objectivesES={}},
[2251]={nameES="Libro 8, Capítulo 3: Forjando la Espada",objectivesES={"Recupera la espada de Golodir de Hemeldir","Los Montaraces de Esteldín pudieron reparar el escudo y la cota de malla de Golodir, pero la espada era de arte élfico, más allá de su habilidad.","Elrond está en Rivendel, en el Bosque de los Trolls.\
\
Daervunn te sugirió que llevaras la espada de Golodir a Elrond de Rivendel para que fuera forjada de nuevo.","Lleva el equipo de Golodir a Hemeldir","Elrond está en Rivendel.\
\
Hemeldir te devolvió la espada forjada de Golodir y te dijo que la llevaras con Elrond para su aprobación.","Hemeldir se encuentra cerca de las fraguas de Rivendel.\
\
Elrond te instruyó que llevaras la espada de Golodir a su maestro herrero, Hemeldir, para que la forjara de nuevo.","Lleva la espada de Golodir a Elrond","Lleva el equipo de Golodir a Elrond","Libro 8, Capítulo 3: Forjando la Espada","Hemeldir se encuentra cerca de las fraguas de Rivendel.\
\
Deberías consultar con Hemeldir para saber si ha terminado de forjar la espada de Golodir."}},
[2252]={nameES="Book 8, Chapter 3: Strange Companions",objectivesES={"Corudan is in Floodwend, north of the Mead Hall.","Book 8, Chapter 3: Strange Companions","You explain the terms of Elfsige's wager, and Alwold chuckles.\
\
'I am not surprised. Times have been tough in the Wold of late, with Orcs and Easterlings and worse prowling around the borders. When my men are not fighting for their lives, they're engaging in fruitless wagers. I cannot stop them. As long as they, and you, abide by the agreed-upon terms, I have no complaint. But I do not want any bloodshed! If you go back on your word, you'll have me to deal with!'","Elfsige claimed a high-quality bow from the body of an Orc he slew: Corudan's favourite bow, loaned to Fimloth and lost in Thinglad.","Elfsige is in Floodwend, north of the Mead Hall.\
\
You have heard that Elfsige has a bow that sounds like it belongs to Corudan, and should ask him to return it.","Talk to Elfsige in Floodwend","Talk to Corudan in Floodwend","Talk to Alwold outside Floodwend","Alwold is on the road outside Floodwend.\
\
Elfsige has agreed to race you to Elthengels, with the winner of the race taking all claim to Corudan's bow. His commander, Alwold, will start the race."}},
[2253]={nameES="Libro 8, Capítulo 4: Un Faro de Esperanza",objectivesES={"Lleva el equipo de Golodir a Laerdan","Libro 8, Capítulo 4: Un Faro de Esperanza","Elrond renombró la espada de Golodir como Dúnachar, Vengadora del Oeste, y profetizó que algún día vengaría la muerte de Lorniel, hija de Golodir.","Lleva el equipo de Golodir","Golodir está en Gath Forthnír, en las regiones orientales de Himbar.\
\
Laerdan te indicó que devolvieras el equipo de Golodir.","Laerdan está en Gath Forthnír, en las regiones orientales de Himbar.\
\
Elrond te entregó la espada Dúnachar y te dijo que la llevaras, junto con el resto del equipo de Golodir, a Laerdan."}},
[2254]={nameES="Book 8, Chapter 4: A Wager in the Wold",objectivesES={"You ask the guard if Elfsige has arrived yet, and he shakes his head in confusion.\
\
'No, but his horse arrived shortly before you did... and without him! Something must have happened to him. You have to retrace your steps, and look for him! He must be somewhere between Elthengels and Floodwend. Look among the trees to the south of the road between here and Floodwend. You could have passed him without seeing him!'","Time before Elfsige arrives at Elthengels:","Talk to Thurhun at the entrance to Elthengels","You have arrived at Elthengels before Elfsige!","Elfsige has returned to Elthengels, in the Norcrofts.\
\
You should return to Elthengels and speak with Elfsige there.","Talk to Elfsige in Elthengels","The race is on! The first person to reach the town of Elthengels, in the Norcrofts, wins claim to Corudan's bow.","Horn looks at you silently, his expression unreadable.","Elthengels is south-west of Floodwend, and you do not have much time in which to reach it before Elfsige does!","Find Elfsige somewhere between Elthengels and Floodwend","Elfsige may be in trouble among the trees south of the road between Elthengels and Floodwend.\
\
Elfsige never arrived at Elthengels, and now you should see if you can find him. He may be in danger!","Hreohmanu gazes at you balefully. This is Elfsige's horse, but you see no sign of the brash young Rohirrim.","Reach the entrance to Elthengels before Elfsige does","You have arrived at Elthengels, but there is no sign of Elfsige.\
\
You should speak with Thurhun, the guard at the entrance to Elthengels, to see if he has seen Elfsige.","Book 8, Chapter 4: A Wager in the Wold"}},
[2255]={nameES="Book 8, Chapter 4: The Black Gate",objectivesES={"Aragorn and the Host of the West have come to the Black Gate of Mordor, and the time has come to deal with the Dark Lord.","Aragorn is at the base of the slag-hill outside the Black Gate.\
\
Aragorn has asked you to accompany him as he rides to demand the surrender of Sauron, and he wants you to be well-prepared before you go with him.","Book 8, Chapter 4: The Black Gate","Aragorn is atop the eastern slag-hill as the Battle of the Black Gate rages outside Mordor.\
\
The Mouth of Sauron has revealed that Frodo and Sam have been captured in Mordor. The quest of the Ring has failed.","Talk to Aragorn on the eastern slag-hill","Talk to Aragorn at the base of the slag-hill and ride with him to the Black Gate"}},
[2256]={nameES="Libro 8, Capítulo 5: La Caída de Mordirith",objectivesES={"Habla con Golodir","Libro 8, Capítulo 5: La Caída de Mordirith","Habla con Golodir en Gath Forthnír","Golodir está en Gath Forthnír.\
\
Tras derrotar a Mordirith y encontrarte con la misteriosa Sara Roblecorazón, tú y Golodir regresaron a Gath Forthnír. Deberías hablar con Golodir nuevamente.","Las esperanzas de Laerdan de usar la espada y la armadura de Golodir para renovar el espíritu del Montaraz no fueron en vano. La visión del brillante escudo de Gondor y de su ardiente espada, Dúnachar, encendió en Golodir un nuevo fuego... quizá uno peligroso.","Mordirith se encuentra en la sala del trono de Carn Dûm.\
\
Golodir te ha pedido que lo acompañes en su regreso a Carn Dûm para enfrentar a Mordirith, el Falso Rey, Senescal de Angmar.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Esta misión está pensada para una comunidad. Si eliges emprenderla en solitario, recibirás una bonificación de inspiración, pero el desafío será grande.</rgb>"}},
[2257]={nameES="Book 8, Chapter 5: Surrounded",objectivesES={"Talk to Gimli on the north-eastern slope of the eastern slag hill","Lines of archers fire into the enemy ranks from their position on the slag hills. Look for full quivers by the bodies of men who have fallen, and gather them for Legolas.","Aragorn is atop the eastern slag hill.","Fight your way to Prince Imrahil on the south-eastern slope of the western slag hill","Talk to Legolas on the north-eastern slope of the eastern slag hill","Mighty Ologs stride forth, bellowing with rage!","Legolas fights alongside Gimli on the north-eastern side of the eastern slag hill.\
\
You collected a number of full quivers to return to Legolas.","Prince Imrahil is hard-pressed on the slopes of the western slag hill, before the Black Gate.\
\
Aragorn has asked you to fight your way across the battlefield to the western slag hill, where you must come to the aid of Prince Imrahil.","Talk to Daervunn on the eastern edge of the battle","Talk to Lothrandir on the eastern edge of the battle","More foes surge from the line!","Legolas fights alongside Gimli on the north-eastern side of the eastern slag hill.","Talk to Aragorn on top of the eastern slag hill","Bring a new supply of full quivers to Legolas on the north-eastern slope of the eastern slag hill","The western slag hill comes under fierce attack!","You hear the battle-cries of Gimli the Dwarf coming from the north-eastern side of the eastern slag hill.","The Host of the West has been surrounded by the armies of Mordor and must now fight for its survival.","Book 8, Chapter 5: Surrounded","Daervunn fights on the south-eastern edge of the eastern slag hill.","Orcs and Uruks have formed a ring around the slag hills, surrounding the Host of the West. Aragorn has asked you to defeat your foes and aid your friends and allies as best you can.","Lothrandir is shouting words of support and guidance to the men of the line on the eastern side of the battle."}},
[2258]={nameES="Book 8, Chapter 5: Thane Mildrith",objectivesES={"Talk to Ingild on the first floor of the Elthengels tavern","You have bought a round of drinks with Horn's coins and should now distribute them to the patrons of the Elthengels tavern.","Talk to Horn in Elthengels","Book 8, Chapter 5: Thane Mildrith","Thane Mildrith is in the mead hall of Elthengels.\
\
After the Orc attack, Thane Mildrith has asked you to meet with her.","Horn has given you some coins of the Mark with which to buy a round of drinks for the patrons inside the Elthengels tavern. Perhaps they will have some information to tell you about the Uruks.","Talk to Thane Mildrith in the Mead Hall of Elthengels","The group of Uruks you are pursuing passed near to Elthengels, and now you should try and learn what the villagers know of them.","Horn is waiting to speak with you in Elthengels.","A new arrival has come to the Elthengels tavern.","Talk to Ingild and investigate the sound he heard","Buy a round of drinks from Thurnoth in the Elthengels tavern","Ingild is waiting to talk to you on the first floor of the Elthengels tavern."}},
[2259]={nameES="Libro 8, Capítulo 6: Un Ojo Vigilante",objectivesES={"Con la ayuda de Golodir, has debilitado enormemente a Mordirith, el Senescal de Angmar, y vengado la muerte de Lorniel.","Libro 8, Capítulo 6: Un Ojo Vigilante","Aragorn se encuentra en Rivendel, en el Bosque de los Trolls, en una de las habitaciones de huéspedes de la Casa de Elrond.\
\
Golodir te indicó que llevaras la noticia de la caída de Mordirith a su jefe, Aragorn.","Habla con Aragorn en Rivendel."}},
[2260]={nameES="Book 8, Chapter 6: The Drowning Tide",objectivesES={"Bring the sword to Thalanir on the slope of the western slag hill","Thalanir is to the west of Pippin and Beregond's location, on the slope of the western slag hill.\
\
Something has distressed Thalanir, and the soldier of Gondor calls for your help.","You also hear Rohirric words of surprise from the south-west","Éomer has asked you to fight your way back to the eastern slag hill in search of Legolas and Gimli.","Protect Reeve Ingbert while he gets to his feet","Thalanir has gone beyond need of a sword. He is slain","Aragorn is atop the eastern slag hill.","While you distract his foes, Ingbert manages to escape","Talk to Pippin on the southern slope of the western slag hill","Thalanir has lost his sword, and the soldier of Gondor has sent you to find a fallen sword on the battlefield to replace the weapon he lost.\
\
Fallen swords can be found around the base of the western slag hill near the bodies of their former wielders.","You hear Éomer's voice above the din, coming from atop the hill","Aragorn calls to you, but you can barely hear him over the sound of the throng","Legolas is on the south-western slope of the eastern slag hill.","Éomer is south-east of the western slag hill.\
\
Prince Imrahil asked you to lend your aid to Éomer of Rohan.","Pippin and Beregond are halfway up the southern slope of the western slag hill.","The Orcs charge once again up the side of the hill","Reeve Ingbert has been injured, and his foes press the attack!","Thalanir was slain before you could return to him with a weapon, but there is no time to mourn his ill fortune.","Rohirrim soldiers are being overmatched by their foes to the south-west of Éomer's position at the base of the western slag hill.","Talk to Aragorn atop the eastern slag hill","Reeve Ingbert needs time to recover, but he is hard-pressed by his foes!","Calenglad is atop the eastern slag hill.","You found a sword for Thalanir and should bring it to him on the southern slope of the western slag hill.","Orcs surge into the space between the two slag hills, thirsty for blood","Reeve Ingbert is wounded south-east of the base of the western slag hill.","Éomer is on top of the western slag hill.","Come to the aid of the Rohirrim men south-west of Éomer's position","Talk to Éomer atop the western slag hill","The Battle of the Morannon continues unabated as the forces of Mordor press the attack.","Talk to Calenglad atop the eastern slag hill","Talk to Éomer south-east of the western slag hill","Learn what has so distressed Thalanir on the slope of the western slag hill","Not far from Pippin and Beregond's location on the western slag hill, a Gondorian soldier calls desperately for your help.","Book 8, Chapter 6: The Drowning Tide","More foes surge about the base of the hill!","Talk to Beregond on the southern slope of the western slag hill","Talk to Thalanir on the southern slope of the western slag hill","Talk to Legolas on the south-western slope of the eastern slag hill","Legolas has asked you to defeat any enemies you can find as the press of battle surges against the eastern slag hill.","You pick up the sword and hope it will ease Thalanir's mind","Find a fallen sword for Thalanir","To the west, a soldier of Gondor cries for help!"}},
[2261]={nameES="Book 8, Chapter 6: The Victor's Ward",objectivesES={"Cliving is a most impressive sight. Now to find Reeve Athelward","Travel to Cliving in the Norcrofts","Talk to Cuthred in Cliving","Thane Mildrith is suspicious of Reeve Athelward, and wants you to see how he is treating her daughter, newly-taken as his ward.","Talk to Athelward in the Mead Hall of Cliving","Cliving is in the Norcrofts, to the north-west of Elthengels.\
\
Thane Mildrith of Elthengels is suspicious of Reeve Athelward of Cliving, who took her daughter Siflád as his ward, and wants you to ensure that Siflád is being treated well.","Siflád is somewhere in Cliving.\
\
Athelward has given you permission to speak to Siflád, his ward.","Reeve Athelward is in the Mead Hall of Cliving.\
\
Thane Mildrith wants you to ensure that her daughter Siflád is not being mistreated. The first step is to introduce yourself to Athelward.","Book 8, Chapter 6: The Victor's Ward","Cuthred, the captain of the guard, is by a guard tower in Cliving, west of the Mead Hall.\
\
Reeve Athelward wanted you to help the captain of his guard once you had spoken with Siflád."}},
[2262]={nameES="Book 8, Chapter 7: Mordor Triumphant",objectivesES={"Book 8, Chapter 7: Mordor Triumphant","Talk to Aragorn and defy the final enemy assault","Aragorn stands atop the eastern slag hill and prepares to stand against the final enemy attack.","The Host of the West has come to the end of the road as the forces of Mordor prepare their final assault.","Talk to Aragorn atop the eastern slag hill","Aragorn is on the eastern slag hill, looking out toward the Black Gate."}},
[2263]={nameES="Book 8, Chapter 7: Riding the Bounds",objectivesES={"Ride to the final marker, north of the third one","Ride to the final marker, north of the third, outside Cliving in the Norcrofts.","Ride to the third marker, west of the second, outside Cliving in the Norcrofts.","Cuthred is in Cliving, near the entrance to the city.\
\
You have ridden the bounds, and should now speak to Cuthred, Cliving's captain of the guard.","Ride to the third marker, west of the second","Book 8, Chapter 7: Riding the Bounds","Ride to the second marker, south of the first","Cuthred is eager to make use of your mounted skill to defend Cliving from the Orcs marauding the Norcrofts.","Talk to Cuthred in Cliving","The last marker is to the north of this one","Ride to the second marker, south of the first, outside Cliving in the Norcrofts.","You have ridden the bounds and should return to Cuthred","The next marker is to the west","Cuthred has sent you riding the bounds of Cliving: riding east of the city to the first marker, and then turning to your right at each new marker until you have described a great loop around Cliving. He wants you to defeat any mounted enemies you encounter on this circuit as well.","The next marker of your circuit is to the south","Ride to the first marker, east of Cliving"}},
[2264]={nameES="Book 8, Chapter 8: A Second Proposal",objectivesES={"Talk to Horn in the Mead Hall of Cliving","Talk to Thane Mildrith in the Mead Hall of the Elthengels","Talk to Athelward in the Mead Hall of Cliving","Reeve Athelward is in the Mead Hall of Cliving.\
\
Athelward wanted to speak with you and your companions before you depart Cliving.","Nona, Horn, and Corudan are in the Mead Hall of Cliving with Athelward.\
\
You should speak with your companions to determine your next course of action.","Talk to Nona in the Mead Hall of Cliving","Reeve Athelward is in the Mead Hall of Cliving.\
\
You have spoken with your companions and should now tell Athelward your decision.","Book 8, Chapter 8: A Second Proposal","Athelward has requested to see you about something before you leave Cliving.","Thane Mildrith listens to your message from Reeve Athelward with growing horror and disgust.\
\
'You cannot be serious! That scoundrel! That braggart! His inaction doomed my husband Pendrad to death by the Orcs, and he personally gave my son the wound that killed him! He has the gall to ask for my hand not once, but twice! And to use friends to do it!'\
\
Mildrith brings herself under control, and continues in a quiet, deadly voice.\
\
'I sent you to learn if my daughter Siflád was being treated well by the murderer of her father and brother. Is she?'","Thane Mildrith is in the Mead Hall of Elthengels, south-east of Cliving, in the Norcrofts.\
\
Reeve Athelward wants you to bring his proposal of marriage to Thane Mildrith.","Talk to Corudan in the Mead Hall of Cliving"}},
[2265]={nameES="Book 8, Chapter 9: South Across the Plains",objectivesES={"Book 8, Chapter 9: South Across the Plains","Thane Mildrith refuses to either trust or marry Athelward, and wants to ensure that the young Elfmar of Faldham is not relying on Athelward.","Scout the river crossing south-west of Elthengels","Bring the Orc Emblems to Elfmar in the Mead Hall of Faldham","Elfmar is the acting thane of Faldham while his father Elfhelm is away.\
\
Thane Mildrith wants you to tell Elfmar of the dangers that face the Norcrofts.","The road runs west of Elthengels for a good way before turning south. At a certain point the southward road crosses the river before it reaches Faldham.\
\
Thane Mildrith wants you to travel to Faldham and collect emblems from Orcs in the Norcrofts to show to Elfmar.","Scouted the river-crossing"}},
[2266]={nameES="Book 9, Chapter 1: A Knock on the Head",objectivesES={"You dimly remember Elrohir, one of the sons of Elrond. He stands on the north-west side of the slag-hill and wishes to speak with you.","You sustained a blow to the head and remember little of the adventures that brought you to this point, but you are in the middle of a battlefield and must fight to survive!","You have awoken on the field of battle outside the Morannon, the Black Gate of Mordor, but all you remember is a hazy confusion of images. What brought you to this point?","Book 9, Chapter 1: A Knock on the Head","Talk to Mithrandir atop the eastern slag-hill during the Battle of the Morannon","Mithrandir stands atop the eastern slag-hill while the Battle of the Morannon rages all about him.\
\
Elrohir has seen something on the horizon and has asked you to tell Mithrandir about this new threat.","Talk to Elrohir on the north-west side of the slag-hill"}},
[2267]={nameES="Libro 9, Capítulo 1: Roblecorazón al descubierto",objectivesES={"Golodir se encuentra en Gath Forthnír, en Angmar, muy al norte de Rivendel.\
\
Gandalf el Gris te ha ordenado que regreses a Gath Forthnír y ayudes a Golodir a buscar a Sara Roblecorazón y el palantír desaparecido.","Mordirith, el Rey Falso, ha sido derrotado y enviado de regreso a Mordor, sin cuerpo, pero la misteriosa Sara Roblecorazón robó el palantír que Mordirith tenía en su poder. Esto preocupa enormemente a Gandalf el Gris.","Libro 9, Capítulo 1: Roblecorazón al descubierto","Sara Roblecorazón se encuentra en Barad Gúlaran, en Nan Gurth, en Angmar. Barad Gúlaran se encuentra en el centro de una serie de puentes que lo rodean como los radios de una rueda de carro. Sara Roblecorazón fue vista junto a la torre situada en el más sudoriental de estos puentes.\
\
Sara Roblecorazón ha sido encontrada fuera de Barad Gúlaran. Golodir te ha dicho que tengas cuidado."}},
[2268]={nameES="Book 9, Chapter 1: Sauron's Hour",objectivesES={"Mithrandir stands atop the eastern slag-hill while the Battle of the Morannon rages all about him.\
\
Elrohir has seen something on the horizon and has asked you to tell Mithrandir about this new threat.","Foes encircle the Host of the West as the Battle of the Black Gate rages around you.","Elrohir stands on the north-west side of the slag-hill and wishes to speak with you.","The Host of the West fights desperately for its survival as the forces of Mordor close in for the kill, and the Battle of the Morannon nears its end.","Talk to Mithrandir atop the eastern slag-hill during the Battle of the Morannon","Book 9, Chapter 1: Sauron's Hour"}},
[2269]={nameES="Book 9, Chapter 1: Éomer",objectivesES={"Book 9, Chapter 1: Éomer","Éomer, the Third Marshal of the Riddermark and the nephew of King Théoden, has come to Eaworth with news of the Uruks you are pursuing.","Éomer is outside the Mead Hall of Eaworth.\
\
You have spoken with this lieutenant Éothain, and should now speak again with Éomer.","Éothain is outside the Mead Hall of Eaworth, with Éomer.\
\
Éomer has told you to ask any questions you have of his man Éothain.","Éomer is outside the Mead Hall of Eaworth.\
\
Corudan told you that Éomer, the nephew of the King, has returned from his ride north in pursuit of the Uruks.","Talk to Éomer outside the Mead Hall of Eaworth","Talk to Éothain outside the Mead Hall of Eaworth"}},
[2270]={nameES="Libro 9, Capítulo 2: El poder de Roblecorazón",objectivesES={"Sara Roblecorazón te ha pedido que la escoltes hasta el interior de Barad Gúlaran.","Libro 9, Capítulo 2: El poder de Roblecorazón","Golodir está en Gath Forthnír.\
\
Deberías regresar con Golodir y contarle lo sucedido en Barad Gúlaran.","Has encontrado a Sara Roblecorazón en Barad Gúlaran, el antiguo retiro del Rey Brujo de Angmar.","Ayuda a Sara Roblecorazón a llegar al corazón de Barad Gúlaran."}},
[2271]={nameES="Book 9, Chapter 2: The Eagles Are Coming!",objectivesES={"Talk to Mithrandir on the field of Cormallen","Book 9, Chapter 2: The Eagles Are Coming!","Talk to Mithrandir atop the eastern slag-hill and defy the enemy once again","Mithrandir is atop the eastern slag-hill as the Battle of the Morannon rages all around him.\
\
The Eagles have flown to the aid of the Host of the West, but will it be enough to turn the tide of battle?","Gwaihir the Windlord and his subjects have come to the aid of the Host of the West... but will it be enough to turn the tide of battle before the Black Gate?","Mithrandir is on the field of Cormallen, waiting to speak with you."}},
[2272]={nameES="Book 9, Chapter 2: Uglúk's End",objectivesES={"You find a great deal of footprints in the chaos that seem to go nowhere","The ground at Éomer's Vengeance is torn up by a confused muddle of footprints. Can anything be learned from it?","Uglúk is beyond caring, not that he would have cared in life.","Talk to Horn at Éomer's Vengeance","Talk to Corudan at Éomer's Vengeance","Horn is waiting to speak with you at Éomer's Vengeance, north-west of Eaworth.","Éomer's Vengeance can be found to the north-west of Eaworth, just outside the eaves of Fangorn.\
\
Éomer has said you should look for signs of your friends at the site where he encountered and destroyed the Uruks led by Uglúk.","Corudan wishes to speak with you at Éomer's Vengeance.\
\
You have found a number of footprints that seem to go toward the Forest of Fangorn, and should speak to Corudan about it.","Éomer has told you where to go to find the Uruks his men destroyed. It is possible you will find your lost friends at the site.","Uglúk and Éomer fought personally at the end of the battle, but Uglúk did not walk away.","You stare at defeated Uglúk and wonder if Boromir rests comfortably, from wherever it is he watches, now that the leader of the band that set upon him is no more.","You find a great deal of footprints, some of which lead north-west","The reek of the burning rises still from the site where Éomer destroyed the Uruks","You pry your eyes away from Uglúk and resolve to search for sign of the halflings","Examine the remains of Uglúk","Book 9, Chapter 2: Uglúk's End","Uglúk has no opinion about your next move.","Find Éomer's Vengeance, north-west of Eaworth"}},
[2273]={nameES="Libro 9, Capítulo 3: La petición de Golodir",objectivesES={"Puedes encontrar aliados en Ost Guruth, en las Tierras Solitarias, Esteldín, en las Quebradas del Norte, y en lugares familiares para todos los pueblos: Combe para los hobbits, la raza de los Hombres y los Beórnidas, y Gondamon para Enanos y Elfos.\
\
Golodir te ha pedido que regreses a tres lugares donde Sara Roblecorazón fue vista en el pasado y hables con aliados en esos sitios.","Golodir está preocupado por que los Caballeros de Mordirith sean puestos al servicio de Amarthiel.","Golodir está en Gath Forthnír en Angmar.\
\
Deberías regresar con Golodir y decirle que la tarea ha sido completada.","Libro 9, Capítulo 3: La petición de Golodir","Habla con Golodir","Habla con aliados en Combe o Gondamon, en Ost Guruth y en Esteldín"}},
[2274]={nameES="Libro 9, Capítulo 3: Viaje a Combe",objectivesES={"El condestable Sotomonte se encuentra fuera de la Comba y la Cresta, en Combe, al suroeste del campamento del caballero.\
\
Tras haber derrotado al Caballero de Mordirith, regresa con el condestable Sotomonte y hazle saber que la amenaza ha sido eliminada.","El Caballero de Mordirith puede encontrarse cerca de un ídolo maligno en el bosque de Chet, al noreste de Combe.\
\
El condestable Sotomonte te dijo cómo encontrar la amenaza en el bosque de Chet, que podría ser el caballero que buscas.","Libro 9, Capítulo 3: Viaje a Combe","Encuentra al Caballero de Mordirith","El condestable Sotomonte mencionó que hay una nueva amenaza en el bosque de Chet y que quizá sea el caballero que buscas."}},
[2275]={nameES="Libro 9, Capítulo 3: Viaje a Esteldín",objectivesES={"Daervunn te ha advertido de una nueva amenaza al norte, cerca de la entrada a Ram Dúath, y de que quizá sea el Caballero que buscas.","Habla con Daervunn en Esteldín","Libro 9, Capítulo 3: Viaje a Esteldín","El Caballero de Mordirith puede encontrarse cerca de Ost Crithlanc, al noreste de Esteldín.\
\
Daervunn te habló de una nueva amenaza en el norte, que podría ser el Caballero que buscas.","Daervunn se encuentra en Esteldín, al sur de la boca de Ram Dúath.\
\
Tras haber derrotado al Caballero de Mordirith, deberías regresar con Daervunn y hacerle saber tu éxito.","Encuentra al Caballero de Mordirith"}},
[2276]={nameES="Libro 9, Capítulo 3: Viaje a Gondamon",objectivesES={"El Caballero de Mordirith podría encontrarse al norte de Gondamon.\
\
Mathi Manofirme sugirió que la amenaza al norte de Gondamon podría ser el Caballero que buscas.","Mathi Manofirme te ha advertido de una nueva amenaza al norte de Gondamon y de que quizá sea el Caballero que buscas.","Mathi Manofirme se encuentra en Gondamon, al sur del campamento del Caballero.\
\
Tras haber derrotado al Caballero de Mordirith, deberías regresar con Mathi Manofirme y hacerle saber que has tenido éxito.","Libro 9, Capítulo 3: Viaje a Gondamon","Encuentra al Caballero de Mordirith"}},
[2277]={nameES="Libro 9, Capítulo 3: Viaje a las Tierras Solitarias",objectivesES={"Frideric el Anciano se encuentra en Ost Guruth, al norte y al oeste de Harloeg.\
\
Tras haber derrotado al Caballero de Mordirith, deberías regresar con Frideric el Anciano y hacerle saber tu éxito.","Frideric el Anciano te ha advertido de una nueva amenaza en los pantanos del sur y de que quizá sea el Caballero que buscas.","El Caballero de Mordirith puede encontrarse en algún lugar de Harloeg, al sur y al este de Ost Guruth.\
\
Frideric el Anciano sugirió que podrías encontrar al Caballero de Mordirith en el pantano del sur.","Encuentra al Caballero de Mordirith","Libro 9, Capítulo 3: Viaje a las Tierras Solitarias"}},
[2278]={nameES="Book 9, Chapter 3: On the Field of Victory",objectivesES={"Book 9, Chapter 3: On the Field of Victory","Talk to Mithrandir on the field of Cormallen","Sam beckons for you to speak to him instead of Frodo","Talk to Frodo in the bower south-east of the field of Cormallen","Éomer of Rohan and Prince Imrahil of Dol Amroth are on the field of Cormallen.","Talk to Radanir on the field of Cormallen","Peregrin Took and Meriadoc Brandybuck are on the field of Cormallen.","Mithrandir is on the field of Cormallen.","Radanir and Aragorn are on the field of Cormallen.","Talk to Éomer on the field of Cormallen","Frodo is about to speak when Sam interrupts and beckons you to him.","Talk to Peregrin Took in the bower","Samwise Gamgee is in the bower in the south-east of the field of Cormallen.","Talk to Legolas on the field of Cormallen","Frodo Baggins is in the bower on the south-east of the field of Cormallen.","Talk to Meriadoc Brandybuck in the bower","Frodo Baggins is in a bower on the south-eastern side of the field of Cormallen, recovering from his ordeal.","Talk to Frodo Baggins in the bower","The field of Cormallen has become a field of victory, and friends and allies share fellowship and speak of their accomplishments in the overthrow of Sauron.","Talk to Gimli on the field of Cormallen","Talk to Samwise Gamgee in the bower","Talk to Prince Imrahil on the field of Cormallen","Legolas and Gimli are on the field of Cormallen."}},
[2279]={nameES="Book 9, Chapter 3: Orcs Beneath the Eaves",objectivesES={"Talk to Corudan at Éomer's Vengeance","You heard a voice coming from a misty dell south of the Orc camp beneath the eaves of Fangorn, and should investigate.","Talk to the owner of the mysterious voice, south of the Orc camp","You hear a voice coming from a misty hollow south of the Orc camp!","There is a camp of Orcs beneath the Eaves of Fangorn, north of Éomer's Vengeance.\
\
Horn wants you to go to the Orc camp beneath the Eaves of Fangorn and defeat the creatures there. You are also to keep your eyes open for your friends while you do.","Defeat Orcs beneath the Eaves of Fangorn (7/8)","Corudan is at Éomer's Vengeance, south-east of the eaves of Fangorn.\
\
You encountered an Ent called Baldbark, and he sent you out of Fangorn with little ceremony.","Book 9, Chapter 3: Orcs Beneath the Eaves","Tracks led from Éomer's Vengeance into the Forest of Fangorn, and you should do what you can to follow them."}},
[2280]={nameES="Libro 9, Capítulo 4: El rastro de Amarthiel",objectivesES={"Libro 9, Capítulo 4: El rastro de Amarthiel","Laerdan se encuentra al otro lado de la cueva en Gath Forthnír.\
\
Golodir te indicó que hablaras con Laerdan para saber cómo puedes ayudarlo a seguir el rastro de Amarthiel.","Calenglad se encuentra en el campamento de los Montaraces en Tinnudir, en la orilla oriental del Lago Evendim.\
\
Laerdan te indicó que fueras al campamento de los Montaraces en Evendim para hablar con el montaraz Calenglad.","Golodir quedó complacido con tu éxito en el sur, pero sigue preocupado por Amarthiel y por su posesión de un palantír."}},
[2281]={nameES="Book 9, Chapter 4: Frodo Baggins and the Ring of Power",objectivesES={"Frodo is inside the bower that was prepared for him on the field of Cormallen.","Enter his bower in the south-east of the field of Cormallen and find Frodo","Talk to Frodo and experience 'Interlude: The Precious, At Last' or read the shortened account instead","In the depths of the Mountain of Fire, Frodo Baggins at last reaches the Cracks of Doom, the only place where the One Ring can be destroyed. As he stands at the brink, he makes a decision that will determine the fate of the Ruling Ring and the power of Sauron that is bonded within.\
\
But he is not alone...","Talk to Frodo inside the bower","Mithrandir has asked you to speak with Frodo and ease his mind, if you can.","Frodo is inside the bower that was prepared for him in the south-east of the field of Cormallen.","Book 9, Chapter 4: Frodo Baggins and the Ring of Power","Frodo smiles weakly at you as you approach"}},
[2282]={nameES="Book 9, Chapter 4: The Stone of Wyrgende",objectivesES={"Talk to Éomer and ride south to the Stone of Wyrgende","Éomer is standing by the Stone of Wyrgende.\
\
Éomer wishes to speak with you before departing for Snowbourn.","Horn is already back at Eaworth, in the Entwash Vale.\
\
You have been reassured that your friends are safe, and now you should travel back to Eaworth with Horn and Corudan.","Talk to Éomer by the Stone of Wyrgende","Book 9, Chapter 4: The Stone of Wyrgende","Talk to Éomer outside the Mead Hall of Eaworth","Éomer is outside the Mead Hall of Eaworth, in the Entwash Vale.\
\
Éomer is ready to ride south when you are, but he has a number of destinations he wants to visit before turning for Edoras and home.","You have received reassuring words from Baldbark concerning your friends, and can now turn your thoughts fully toward aiding Éomer and Rohan.","Talk to Horn in Eaworth","Éomer is outside the Mead Hall of Eaworth.\
\
Éomer said you were welcome to ride south with his men when he departed Eaworth."}},
[2283]={nameES="Libro 9, Capítulo 5: La esperanza de Amarthiel",objectivesES={"Calenglad se encuentra en el campamento de los Montaraces en Tinnudir, en la orilla oriental del Lago Evendim.\
\
Deberías hablar con Calenglad de nuevo, ahora que has descubierto los planes de Amarthiel.","Libro 9, Capítulo 5: La esperanza de Amarthiel","Descubre los planes de Amarthiel en Annúminas.","Calenglad te ha informado de que recientemente ha aumentado el número de angmarim en las afueras de Annúminas."}},
[2284]={nameES="Book 9, Chapter 5: South to Snowbourn",objectivesES={"Book 9, Chapter 5: South to Snowbourn","Éomer will meet you in Snowbourn outside the Mead Hall.\
\
You should ride south and speak again with Éomer in Snowbourn, in the Sutcrofts.","Meet with Éomer in Snowbourn","The next leg of your journey with Éomer will take you to the town of Snowbourn, in the Sutcrofts."}},
[2285]={nameES="Book 9, Chapter 5: The Next Adventure",objectivesES={"Talk to Mithrandir on the field of Cormallen","Talk to Mithrandir inside the bower that was provided for Frodo on the field of Cormallen","Book 9, Chapter 5: The Next Adventure","Frodo has decided that he is ready to relax from the ordeal of his adventure, but your own adventures continue.","Aragorn is on the field of Cormallen.","Talk to Aragorn on the field of Cormallen","Mithrandir is in the bower that was prepared for Frodo on the field of Cormallen.","Mithrandir is on the field of Cormallen."}},
[2286]={nameES="Book 9, Chapter 6: No Retreat",objectivesES={"Bring Warg-rider and corruptor weapons to Éomer in Snowbourn","Warg-riders on the plains of the Sutcrofts wield fire-pots, and Mordor corruptors wield spears.\
\
Éomer has asked you to collect implements of destruction from Warg-riders and Mordor corruptors in the Sutcrofts. He wants to show them to the Reeve as evidence of what his people will face if they do not retreat across the Entwash.","Éomer is outside the Mead Hall in Snowbourn.\
\
You have collected implements of destruction from Warg-riders in the Sutcrofts, and should bring them to Éomer as he requested.","Éomer is in Snowbourn, north-west of Fastred's house, outside the Mead Hall.\
\
You have heard Grimstan's explanation for Fastred's refusal to comply with Éomer's command, and should report it now to the Third Marshal.","Talk to Éomer in Snowbourn","Talk to Grimstan in Snowbourn","Grimstan is outside Reeve Fastred's home in Snowbourn, south-east of Éomer's location.\
\
Éomer has asked you to inquire of Grimstan why Reeve Fastred has not followed his command for his people to move across the Entwash for safety.","Book 9, Chapter 6: No Retreat","Éomer has come to Snowbourn to see if Reeve Fastred has complied with his command to begin preparations to move his people across the Entwash where they can be better defended."}},
[2287]={nameES="Book 9, Chapter 7: The Coming Tide",objectivesES={"Talk to and train with a member of the Snowbourn militia","Éomer will speak with Reeve Fastred about moving the people of Snowbourn across the Entwash, but he wants you to help train the people in the event Fastred still refuses.","Talk to Horn in Snowbourn","Talk to and train with a Snowbourn veteran","Book 9, Chapter 7: The Coming Tide","You have achieved victory, and the veteran has improved slightly","You have achieved victory, and the villager has improved a great deal!","You have achieved victory, and the member of the militia has improved somewhat!","Talk to Éomer in Snowbourn","Éomer is in Snowbourn, outside the Mead Hall.\
\
The Third Marshal of the Riddermark has returned from meeting with Reeve Fastred... and he does not look happy.","Villagers, militia, and veterans can be found throughout Snowbourn.\
\
Éomer has asked you to train with villagers, militia, and veterans of Snowbourn, in order to prepare them in the event he cannot convince Fastred to move them across the Entwash.","Talk to Corudan in Snowbourn","Talk to and train with a Snowbourn villager","Horn and Corudan are in Snowbourn, by the fountain in the centre of town.\
\
You have trained with some of the people of Snowbourn, as have Horn and Corudan."}},
[2288]={nameES="Book 9, Chapter 8: Night Falls on Meduseld",objectivesES={"Book 9, Chapter 8: Night Falls on Meduseld","Éomer wants to ride to Edoras with you to consult with King Théoden about Fastred's refusal to move his people across the Entwash.","Talk to Horn by the Entwade","Éomer wants to return with all speed to Edoras to report to his uncle, King Théoden.","Horn is at the Entwade crossing, in the Sutcrofts.\
\
The unthinkable has happened: Éomer has been imprisoned at the command of the King and you have been ordered never to cross the Entwash under pain of death.","Talk to Éomer in Snowbourn and ride to Edoras"}},
[2289]={nameES="Book 9, Chapter 9: The Dividing Line",objectivesES={"You have been ordered by Théoden King not to cross the Entwash under pain of death.","Corudan is at the Entwade crossing, in the Sutcrofts.","Hunbald stands at the Entwade crossing, in the Sutcrofts.\
\
King Théoden has ordered you not to cross the Entwash under pain of death.","Talk to Hunbald at the Entwade crossing, in the Sutcrofts","Talk to Horn at the Entwade crossing, in the Sutcrofts","Horn is at the Entwade crossing.\
\
Corudan has told you why he has hope for what tomorrow may bring, and has asked that you share his thoughts with Horn.","Book 9, Chapter 9: The Dividing Line","Talk to Corudan at the Entwade crossing, in the Sutcrofts"}},
[2290]={nameES="Libro 9, Prólogo: Noticias del palantír",objectivesES={"Habla con Gandalf en Rivendel","Libro 9, Prólogo: Noticias del palantír","Gandalf se encuentra en la habitación de Bilbo, en el primer piso de la Última Morada, en Rivendel.\
\
Aragorn te ha enviado a hablar con Gandalf.","Aragorn cree que Gandalf debería ser informado del misterioso robo del palantír por parte de Sara Roblecorazón."}},
[2291]={nameES="Libro 9, Prólogo: La Costa Oscura",objectivesES={"Braiglinn se encuentra en Imlad Lalaith, en las orillas del Anduin, en Lothlórien.\
\
Se te ha dicho que hables con Braiglinn sobre la travesía de la Hueste Dorada hacia la Tierra Media.","Ha llegado el momento de que los Malledhrim, la Hueste Dorada, crucen el río Anduin y ataquen a las fuerzas del Enemigo en Dol Guldur.","Libro 9, Prólogo: La Costa Oscura","Alfirimbes está esperando para hablar contigo en Echad Sirion.\
\
Los Elfos han establecido su punto de apoyo en las oscuras orillas del Bosque Negro y están listos para comenzar su avance en el bosque.","Calengoth se encuentra en los muelles cerca de Imlad Lalaith, en las orillas del Anduin, en Lothlórien. Una vez que hayas hecho la travesía, encontrarás a Fuirgam trabajando para asegurar un punto de apoyo en el Bosque Negro.\
\
Calengoth, el oficial de lanzamiento, está esperando para verte en uno de los barcos que te llevarán a través del Anduin con la primera travesía. Una vez que lo hayas hecho, busca a Fuirgam, el Elfo encargado de asegurar un punto de apoyo para los Elfos.","Sube al barco de Calengoth y ayuda a Fuirgam con sus tareas en los Mirk-eaves","Habla con Braiglinn en Imlad Lalaith","Habla con Alfirimbes en Echad Sirion"}},
[2292]={nameES="Book II, Chapter 1: Wrought in Secret",objectivesES={"Talk to Arwen at Imdolen","The Grey Company has come to Rivendell, and there are only a few things left to be done before they begin their journey south.","The Lady Arwen is at Imdolen, on the slope that overlooks the road into the Misty Mountains, north of Rivendell.\
\
Elrond has asked you to speak with his daughter Arwen before you depart with the Grey Company.","Bring Aragorn's standard to Halbarad in Rivendell","Book II, Chapter 1: Wrought in Secret","Halbarad is by the stables in Rivendell.\
\
Arwen has given you the standard she made for Aragorn and has asked you to bring it to Halbarad in Rivendell before the Grey Company departs."}},
[2293]={nameES="Books for the Bored",objectivesES={"Bashem has asked you to send books to Chakâr at Dâr Tabib.\
\
Dâr Tabib is located in the south-west area of the Tor-gardens.","Books for the Bored","Chakâr has asked you to give the books to listless patients in and around Dâr Tabib.\
\
Dâr Tabib is located in the south-west area of the Tor-gardens.","Talk to Chakâr at Dâr Tabib","After receiving a surplus of book copies, the scholars of the Tor-gardens are looking to give them away.","Completado","You have delivered the last of the books, granting the patients of Dâr Tabib a bit of joy amidst the struggle of healing.","You have delivered the last of the books to the patients of Dâr Tabib."}},
[2294]={nameES="Demanda y Suministro de Botas (Diaria)",objectivesES={"Santmereth se encuentra en el Jardín del Festival de Duillond.\
\
Debes informarle a Santmereth que el envío de botas está nuevamente en camino gracias a tu ayuda al zapatero.","Deluraw se encuentra en Duillond, cerca del área de cocina.\
\
Debes llevarle los suministros para las botas, pues él es el zapatero del Festival.","Informa a Santmereth que el envío de botas está en marcha","Lleva los materiales a Deluraw","El evento de Pisoteo de Musarañas siempre se queda sin sus botas especiales no dañinas para repeler musarañas del Jardín del Festival de Duillond.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro cuando finalice el festival actual.</rgb>","Demanda y Suministro de Botas (Diaria)","Los suministros para las botas de Deluraw pueden encontrarse en Duillond y Celondim. El cordel está en los muelles del puerto de Celondim, las ramas pueden recogerse bajo los árboles en flor de los campos de Duillond, y las plantas de lino crecen a lo largo del camino que une ambas ciudades élficas.\
\
Debes recolectar los ingredientes de Deluraw y llevárselos para asegurar una entrega rápida de botas para pisotear musarañas."}},
[2295]={nameES="Borangos The Horror",objectivesES={"You should talk to Isnír.","Isnír can be found at the Udûn Foothold.\
\
You should speak with Isnír.","Upon receiving the remnants of the ancient ward originally used to keep Borangos at bay, Isnír wishes for you to return to Nargroth in the hopes of learning more about the domain of Great Rogmul.","Talk to Isnír","Borangos The Horror"}},
[2296]={nameES="Elevado por la Primavera",objectivesES={"Uno de los nuevos aprendices de Galathir, Nethlas, ha estado molestando a la gente en el Recinto del Festival con las preguntas de investigación de su maestro.","Ayuda a Haerandel con 'Las Flores de Anarlossë'","Arn Juncoso está en el Recinto del Festival de las Tierras de Bree.","Ayuda a Haerandel con 'Partir en primavera'","Tres herboristas de Gondor están causando cierto alboroto en el Recinto del Festival de las Tierras de Bree, y Arn Juncoso te ha pedido que te asegures de que estén contentos... y en silencio.","Habla con Mílgamel en el Recinto del Festival","Ayuda a Nethlas con 'Un Estudio Natural'","Un grupo de herboristas visitantes de Gondor ha viajado muy lejos en nombre de su maestro, pero su llegada ha causado disturbios en el Recinto del Festival de las Tierras de Bree. ¿Se podrá restaurar el buen ánimo propio de la primavera, o su búsqueda de conocimiento sacará de quicio a todos?\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro cuando finalice el evento asociado.</rgb>","Ayuda a Edlothon con 'La Promesa de los Girasoles'","Haerandel se ha sentido ofendido por algo que dijeron los herboristas de Gondor, y desea corregirlo.","Edlothon no sabe cómo las Anarlossë pudieron haber sobrevivido después de tanto tiempo, pero está dispuesto a convencerse si encuentras pruebas.","Habla con Arn Juncoso en el Recinto del Festival","Elevado por la Primavera","Haerandel no puede creer que la Anarlossë aún pueda crecer en algún lugar de la Comarca, y quiere que encuentres a su hermano para contarle esta posibilidad antes de que zarpe hacia el Oeste."}},
[2297]={nameES="Borrowing Barricades",objectivesES={"Winsig has lamented the lack of supplies since the Orc-invasion of the Sutcrofts and believes that the Orc-fortifications might prove useful to the people of Walstow once they are dismantled.","Orc-barricades can be found in the Orc-camps to the north and south-west of Walstow.\
\
Winsig wants you to destroy the Orc-barricades and collect wood-scraps from the wreckage.","Winsig can be found in the Mead Hall of Walstow.\
\
You should return to Winsig with news of your success.","Talk to Winsig","Borrowing Barricades"}},
[2298]={nameES="Jefa del Pasado: Naruhel",objectivesES={"La Doncella Roja está condenada (o eso parece) por la corrupción que han causado los Hombres en su tierra. Estos hombres se presentan ante ella, dispuestos a sacrificarse por la Doncella Roja, y merecen este destino... pero la nobleza de tu sangre será una recompensa aún mayor para ella. Cuando estos Hombres caigan por voluntad propia ante ella, sabrá la diferencia entre los que fortalecen y los que destruyen.","Los Créoth se sacrificarán a la Doncella Roja para restaurar sus fuerzas y su vínculo con la corrupción del pantano. Estos hombres no merecen más que la muerte, y tu presencia al oponerte a la Doncella Roja podría hacer que una parte de ella se dé cuenta de la insensatez de sus actos. Deberías dejar que los hombres mueran para fortalecer a la Doncella Roja, y luego derrotarla. Quizás así comprenda que la corrupción ha crecido demasiado y que debe regresar al mundo natural del que una vez formó parte.","Ayuda a purificar a la Doncella Roja","Jefa del Pasado: Naruhel"}},
[2299]={nameES="Jefa del Pasado: Naruhel - Tier 2",objectivesES={"<rgb=#66b3ff>Recompensa diaria — Tier 2</rgb>","La Doncella Roja está perdida — o eso parece — ante la corrupción infligida a su tierra por hombres corrompidos. Estos hombres se yerguen ante ella, dispuestos a sacrificarse por la Doncella Roja, y merecen tal destino. Sin embargo, la nobleza de tu sangre será un premio mayor para ella, y cuando estos hombres caigan voluntariamente ante su presencia, verá que son los nobles quienes intentan destruirla, y los innobles quienes desean mantenerla así.","Has regresado a Garth Agarwen para derrotar a Naruhel, la Doncella Roja.","Jefa del Pasado: Naruhel - Tier 2"}},
[2300]={nameES="Jefa del Pasado: Naruhel - Tier 3",objectivesES={"La Doncella Roja está perdida — o eso parece — ante la corrupción infligida a su tierra por hombres corrompidos. Estos hombres se yerguen ante ella, dispuestos a sacrificarse por la Doncella Roja, y merecen tal destino. Sin embargo, la nobleza de tu sangre será un premio mayor para ella, y cuando estos hombres caigan voluntariamente ante su presencia, verá que son los nobles quienes intentan destruirla, y los innobles quienes desean mantenerla así.","Has regresado a Garth Agarwen para derrotar a Naruhel, la Doncella Roja.","<rgb=#66b3ff>Recompensa diaria — Tier 3</rgb>","Jefa del Pasado: Naruhel - Tier 3"}},
[2301]={nameES="Jefa del Pasado: Naruhel - Tier 1",objectivesES={"La Doncella Roja está perdida — o eso parece — ante la corrupción infligida a su tierra por hombres corrompidos. Estos hombres se yerguen ante ella, dispuestos a sacrificarse por la Doncella Roja, y merecen tal destino. Sin embargo, la nobleza de tu sangre será un premio mayor para ella, y cuando estos hombres caigan voluntariamente ante su presencia, verá que son los nobles quienes intentan destruirla, y los innobles quienes desean mantenerla así.","Jefa del Pasado: Naruhel - Tier 1","<rgb=#66b3ff>Recompensa diaria — Tier 1</rgb>","Has regresado a Garth Agarwen para derrotar a Naruhel, la Doncella Roja."}},
[2302]={nameES="Jefe del Pasado: Storvâgûn",objectivesES={"Derrota a Storvâgûn","En lo alto de los riscos sobre Helegrod, el traidor Storvâgûn ha puesto a los gigantes de las Montañas Nubladas al servicio de Angmar a cambio de grandes riquezas.","Has regresado a lo alto de los riscos sobre Helegrod para enfrentarte a Storvâgûn.","Jefe del Pasado: Storvâgûn"}},
[2303]={nameES="Jefe del Pasado: Thrâng",objectivesES={"En lo profundo de la Grieta de Nûrz Ghâshu, Thrâng, el jefe de los Ghâshfra, está listo para enfrentarse a todos los que desafíen su poder.","Jefe del Pasado: Thrâng","Derrota a Thrâng"}},
[2304]={nameES="Bound for Ruin",objectivesES={}},
[2305]={nameES="Prisioneros del tormento",objectivesES={"Escuchas a alguien acercándose","Los prisioneros están retenidos en jaulas por todo Kôth Rau. Deberías liberarlos y derrotar a los soldados Ordâkhai que encuentres.","Has liberado a los prisioneros y derrotado a muchos soldados de Ordâkh, ganándote la atención de un campeón utûgi, Kulgath el Devastador.","Los Temámir de Jiret-menêsh quieren ayudar a las personas que están siendo retenidas prisioneras por los Ordâkhai en Kôth Rau.","Has liberado a los prisioneros y derrotado a muchos soldados de Ordâkh. Deberías regresar a Damudûr, la grieta oscura en la base de la montaña.","Regresa a la entrada de Damudûr al pie de la montaña","Derrota a Kulgath el Devastador","Kulgath el Devastador ha sido derrotado","Prisioneros del tormento"}},
[2306]={nameES="Las Rondas del Frontero",objectivesES={"Habla con el Frontero Boffin.","Las Rondas del Frontero","El Frontero Boffin está muy ocupado con el bullicio de la fiesta en la Feria de los Granjeros.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando finalice el evento con el que está asociada.</rgb>","Los invitados se encuentran por todo el mercado de la Feria de los Granjeros en Delagua durante el festival.\
\
Deberías reprender a los borrachos por su mal comportamiento para mantener la fiesta bajo control.","El Frontero Boffin está en Delagua, en la Comarca.\
\
Habla con el Frontero Boffin y dile que la fiesta está bajo control."}},
[2307]={nameES="Recompensa del Frontero",objectivesES={"Los Fronteros de la Comarca necesitan tu ayuda. Lleva la ficha que has encontrado a los Fronteros en Cavada Grande y ayuda a la Tierra Media a proteger las fronteras de la Comarca.","Los Fronteros de la Comarca necesitan tu ayuda. Lleva las fichas que has encontrado a los Fronteros en Cavada Grande y ayuda a la Tierra Media a proteger las fronteras de la Comarca.","Los Fronteros de la Comarca necesitan tu ayuda. Lleva las fichas que has encontrado a los Fronteros en Cavada Grande y ayuda a la Tierra Media a proteger las fronteras de la Comarca.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro cuando se lance la expansión el Abismo de Helm.</rgb>","Habla con Meg Ganapié en Cavada Grande","Recompensa del Frontero"}},
[2308]={nameES="Bounty of the Beltáni",objectivesES={"Batâla has asked you to deliver meals to the residents of Ahâba.\
\
You should collect the packaged meals. They are in a bag near Batâla's hut.","Bounty of the Beltáni","Collect packaged meals","You have delivered meals to the Beltáni.\
\
You should return to Batâla.","Collected packaged meals","Batâla has asked you to deliver meals to the residents of Ahâba.","You have collected the package of meals to deliver to the residents of Ahâba.\
\
You should deliver the meals to Beltáni shepherds and hunters around the village.","Talk to Batâla"}},
[2309]={nameES="La abundancia del mar",objectivesES={"La abundancia del mar","Lleva los salmones de la bahía helada a Tapio.","Lleva los salmones de la bahía helada a Tapio","Tapio te dijo que pescaras donde el mar burbujea y hierve.","Los Vigilantes del Mar han localizado una gran cantidad de peces en la bahía helada, pero no pueden abandonar su puesto para ir a pescar."}},
[2310]={nameES="Bounty: Agan-khô",objectivesES={}},
[2311]={nameES="Bounty: Akraz the Vile",objectivesES={}},
[2312]={nameES="Recompensa: Akvosh",objectivesES={"El cartel de recompensa dice:\
\
'¿Quién de vosotros quiere caminar por el Bosque Salvaje sin miedo? ¡No es posible cuando una daga oxidada Tarkrîp puede clavarse en vuestra espalda en cualquier momento!\
\
'De entre todos los orcos Tarkrîp, hay uno que acecha en el bosque, matando a cualquiera que se adentre por su cuenta. Se llama Akvosh. Se ofrece una recompensa a quien consiga acabar con ese vil orco.'","Un cartel de recompensa te pide que encuentres a Akvosh, un orco despiadado que se esconde en el Bosque Salvaje.","Invoca y enfréntate a Akvosh","Akvosh derrotado","Akvosh se encuentra en la mina occidental del Bosque Salvaje.\
\
Deberías invocar y enfrentarte a Akvosh.","El orco se enfrenta a ti","Completado","Has derrotado a Akvosh y has ayudado a los Pueblos Libres del Bosque Salvaje.","Recompensa: Akvosh"}},
[2313]={nameES="Bounty: Akílu the Feaster",objectivesES={"You have defeated Akílu the Feaster and cleaned up the Fane of Shahûru.\
\
You should return to Shâpar in Ahâba for your reward.","A bounty has been posted for the slaying of a dangerous vulture near Ahâba.","Bounty: Akílu the Feaster","Talk to Shâpar","Defeat Akílu the Feaster","A bounty is posted on this board. It reads:\
\
'Wanted: A brave soul to venture to the Fane of Shahûru and slay the great vulture known as Akílu the Feaster. She and her spawn are disrupting the natural balance of the area by hoarding more carcasses than they can consume and attacking travellers on the road.\
\
'Whoever slays the Feaster and removes the uneaten carcasses from the Fane of Shahûru will receive a reward from the Beltáni of Ahâba.'","You have accepted a bounty to defeat Akílu the Feaster and clean up the Fane of Shahûru.\
\
You should travel to the Fane of Shahûru, north of Ahâba and complete the bounty.","Defeated Akílu the Feaster"}},
[2314]={nameES="Recompensa: Andy Idden, Amigo de Trasgos",objectivesES={"Andy Idden y su perro-lobo están reuniéndose con los trasgos de Tham Andalath, las ruinas en lo alto de una colina al este de Canadiach, en Parth Aduial, al sur de Ost Forod y al norte del camino.\
\
Has aceptado la comisión para reclamar la recompensa por Andy Idden.","Recompensa: Andy Idden, Amigo de Trasgos","Poppy Silleras está en Ost Forod, el antiguo puesto de vigilancia en las colinas de Tyrn Fornech.\
\
Has derrotado a Andy Idden y ahora debes informar a Poppy Silleras.","El cartel anuncia una recompensa por un hombre llamado Andy Idden, acusándolo de tratar con trasgos y conspirar para asesinar a gente honrada de Ost Forod. Invita a quienes estén interesados a hablar con Poppy Silleras en Ost Forod para conocer los detalles y solicitar la comisión","Poppy Silleras está en Ost Forod, el antiguo puesto de vigilancia en las colinas de Tyrn Fornech.\
\
Un cartel que ofrece una recompensa por la captura o derrota de un saqueador de tumbas llamado Andy Idden llamó tu atención. Si deseas presentarte para esta recompensa, debes hablar con Poppy Silleras.","Basilio Resinas está en Ost Forod, el antiguo puesto de vigilancia en las colinas de Tyrn Fornech.\
\
Has derrotado a Andy Idden y ahora debes informar a Basilio Resinas para recibir tu recompensa.","Se ha ofrecido una recompensa por Andy Idden, un saqueador de tumbas del que se rumorea que tiene tratos con trasgos."}},
[2315]={nameES="Recompensa: Ojos de barghest",objectivesES={"Los barghests pueden encontrarse por todas las Quebradas de los Túmulos del Sur. Sus ojos brillantes pueden entregarse a cambio de una recompensa y materiales de artesanía.","Los barghests pueden encontrarse en las Quebradas de los Túmulos del Sur.\
\
Algunos barghests pueden helar el alma con solo una mirada. Edith Rosadulce, en el Alto del Hombre Muerto, ha ofrecido darte una recompensa por recolectar ojos de barghest tomados de los barghests que habitan en el sur.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Las misiones de recompensa son repetibles, pero tienen un número limitado de completaciones. Esta misión puede completarse tres veces.</rgb>","Recompensa: Ojos de barghest","Entrega los ojos de barghest a Edith Rosadulce"}},
[2316]={nameES="Bounty: Barzglúk",objectivesES={"You have defeated Barzglúk and assisted those who wish to reclaim Gundabad.","Defeated Barzglúk.","Bounty: Barzglúk","A bounty notice asks you to seek out Barzglúk, a terrifying great bat found in Máttugard.","Barzglúk and bats can be found in Máttugard.\
\
You should defeat bats.","Defeat Barzglúk","Defeated Barzglúk","Completado","The bounty notice reads:\
\
'Who among you has not known the fear of a bat's shriek in the darkness? It is a warning to quickly seek the safety of light and fire. But this is Gundabad, where the bats have owned these halls for a very long time! Must we always have to watch our backs?!\
\
'Of all the bats that lurk in these halls, none is more dangerous than the one named Barzglúk. A reward to any who can bring down this great bat, along with others of his cauldron!'"}},
[2317]={nameES="Recompensa: Lo bastante grande para alfombras",objectivesES={"Recompensa: Lo bastante grande para alfombras","Los osos pueden encontrarse por todos los campos del norte de Bree.\
\
Sage Semilleno te pidió que recolectaras pieles de oso de los osos en los campos del norte de Bree y zonas circundantes y se las entregaras. Ha ofrecido pagarte un precio justo por este esfuerzo.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Las misiones de recompensa son repetibles, pero tienen un número limitado de completaciones. Esta misión puede completarse tres veces.</rgb>","Lleva las pieles de oso a Sage Semilleno","Sage Semilleno busca pieles de oso para venderlas a los fabricantes de alfombras de Bree."}},
[2318]={nameES="Recompensa: Bill Traspié, Maestro de Espadas",objectivesES={"Clark Cercapiedra está en Ost Forod, el antiguo puesto de vigilancia en las colinas de Tyrn Fornech.\
\
Un cartel que ofrece una recompensa por la captura o derrota de un saqueador de tumbas llamado Bill Traspié llamó tu atención. Si deseas solicitar esta recompensa, debes hablar con Clark Cercapiedra.","Clark Cercapiedra está en Ost Forod, el antiguo puesto de vigilancia en las colinas de Tyrn Fornech.\
\
Has derrotado a Bill Traspié y ahora debes informar a Clark Cercapiedra.","Basilio Resinas está en Ost Forod, el antiguo puesto de vigilancia en las colinas de Tyrn Fornech.\
\
Has derrotado a Bill Traspié y ahora debes hablar con Basilio Resinas para recibir tu recompensa.","Recompensa: Bill Traspié, Maestro de Espadas","El cartel anuncia una recompensa por un hombre llamado Bill Traspié, descrito como un 'saqueador de tumbas notorio, sumamente hábil con las espadas', e invita a los interesados a buscar a Clark Cercapiedra en Ost Forod para conocer los detalles y postularse para la comisión.","Bill Traspié está en las ruinas de Tham Varan en Parth Aduial, al sur del cruce de Canadiach.\
\
Has aceptado la comisión de la recompensa por Bill Traspié.","Se ha ofrecido una recompensa por Bill Traspié, un saqueador de tumbas notorio conocido por su habilidad con las espadas."}},
[2319]={nameES="Bounty: Biret-kôda",objectivesES={}},
[2320]={nameES="Bounty: Black Númenóreans in Parth Daenath",objectivesES={"Defeated Black Númenórean soldiers.","You have defeated Black Númenórean soldiers and their captains, successfully pushing back their assaults in Parth Daenath. The man who posted the bounty will be pleased that the Great Alliance has been made safer, and if he truly manages to refrain from gambling on the makeup of the enemy forces, his coin-purse should not get much lighter.","A bounty notice asks you to push back the Black Númenórean's advance in Parth Daenath.","Black Númenóreans can be found in Parth Daenath.\
\
You should defeat Black Númenórean soldiers and their captains.","The bounty notice reads:\
\
'After so many years of siege, our forces are spread thin, and every now and again there are fresh assaults at the locations we are weakest! I would wager all of my coin that it's these Black Númenóreans who are responsible. Take up the sword and put a stop to these attacks, because my purse runs low. I need to stop making these wagers!'","Completado","Bounty: Black Númenóreans in Parth Daenath"}},
[2321]={nameES="Bounty: Blackhorn",objectivesES={}},
[2322]={nameES="Bounty: Blood of the Black Serpent",objectivesES={"The Black Serpent rallies the Men of Harad to greater viciousness as the many forces of Sauron move against Minas Tirith. In addition to his sons, the strongest of the Enemy's forces creep onto the field in search of you and your fellows.","Derrota a la Serpiente Negra","As the Battle of the Pelennor Fields intensifies, the Men of Harad rally around their King and fight to hold against the warriors of Gondor and Rohan alike.","Bounty: Blood of the Black Serpent"}},
[2323]={nameES="Bounty: Blood-singer Maurgol",objectivesES={}},
[2324]={nameES="Bounty: Bone Amulets",objectivesES={}},
[2325]={nameES="Bounty: Candúr's Escape",objectivesES={"Find and capture Candúr","Candúr brutally attacked a guard ere he fled, likely through one of the gates of Calembel","See if anyone saw Candúr just west of Calembel","It is likely that Candúr stole a sword and fled north, upstream....","Candúr disappeared over the wall west of this very spot....","Candúr did not come this way","You have defeated Candúr, the dangerous escaped criminal from Lamedon","Candúr almost certainly came this way, and has claimed a life in passing hither. It is likely that he is not far.","Search north upstream for Candúr","Collect your reward from Laindir","Candúr, a dangerous criminal, has escaped the dungeons of Calembel. There are no reports of sightings as of yet, or indications as to which way he ran.\
\
A reward will be offered to anyone who can track and capture this violent man.","Laindir can be found in Calembel.\
\
You should return to Laindir and collect your reward for defeating the deadly and murderous Candúr.","If Candúr came this way, it would seem that he has taken a life. This poor man likely crossed his path, and met a violent end at the hands of the escaped killer.","Bounty: Candúr's Escape","According to townsfolk of Calembel, Candúr escaped to the west of town.\
\
You should seek and recapture Candúr, the man who murdered his own brother.","The dungeon where Candúr was kept can be found in the north-west corner of Calembel.\
\
You should see if there is any evidence in the dungeon as to where Candúr might have gone when he escaped.","Townsfolk who may have seen or heard something of Candúr can be found throughought Calembel.\
\
You should speak with townsfolk to see if you can glean any clues to Candúr's whereabouts.","Candúr crawled over the wall just west of the woman who witnessed his escape.\
\
You should search directly west to see if Candúr left any traces to allow him to be followed.","Search the dungeon for hints of Candúr's intentions","Find a witness in Calembel","A dangerous man by the name of Candúr has escaped his incarceration in the jail of Calembel, and should be caught immediately.","Candúr, now armed, likely fled north upstream.\
\
You should search along the river for signs of Candúr. His trail is not yet cold!"}},
[2326]={nameES="Bounty: Captain Hethulos",objectivesES={}},
[2327]={nameES="Recompensa: Reliquias de Cardolan",objectivesES={"Cualquiera de las criaturas en las Quebradas de los Túmulos del Sur puede llevar abalorios y reliquias del reino de Cardolan.\
\
Edith Rosadulce intercambiará materiales de artesanía por cualquier reliquia de Cardolan que encuentres.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Las misiones de recompensa son repetibles, pero tienen un número limitado de completaciones. Esta misión puede completarse tres veces.</rgb>","Cardolan, antaño el reino dominante en la zona de las Quebradas de los Túmulos del Sur, dejó atrás muchas reliquias. Las criaturas de las Quebradas de los Túmulos del Sur probablemente lleven algunas de estas reliquias si uno las busca.","Recompensa: Reliquias de Cardolan","Lleva las reliquias a Edith Rosadulce"}},
[2328]={nameES="Bounty: Chicken-thief",objectivesES={"Bar Elir, a farmstead, is south-west of Calembel.\
\
You should return the chickens to the farmers at Bar Elir.","The farmer states that she saw a trail of footprints heading west from the coop","Bar Elir, a farmstead, is south-west of Calembel.\
\
You should speak with the farmers at Bar Elir to hear their report of the chicken-thief directly.","You have defeated the chicken-thief","The chicken-thief's hideout is west of Bar Elir, in southern Lamedon.\
\
See what the chicken-thief was cooking while you wait for him to return.","The chicken-thief has gathered chickens west of Bar Elir, in southern Lamedon.\
\
The thief is nowhere to be found, but the chickens should be returned to their coop.","Question witnesses at Bar Elir","Collect your reward from Laindir","Laindir can be found in Calembel in Lamedon.\
\
You should return to Laindir in Calembel and tell him that you found the hideout, and defeated the thief.","Find the chicken-thief's hideout","The chicken-thief is reported to have likely gone west of Bar Elir in southern Lamedon, likely taking cover in the shelter of trees and rocks in the hills.\
\
You should search for the chicken-thief.","You have found the hideout of the chicken-thief!","Catch the chicken-thief","Bounty: Chicken-thief","Numerous farmers have reported chickens going missing, and wish the culprit to be caught.","Numerous farmers in the valley of Lamedon have reported chickens going missing, and have often seen a man creeping through the coops at night. He has evaded capture each time he has plundered a coop. The most recent report is from last night, from Bar Elir (a farmstead to the south-west of Calembel).\
\
A generous reward will be bestowed to anyone who can capture the chicken-thief.","Return the chickens to the farmers at Bar Elir"}},
[2329]={nameES="Bounty: Clearing Ghâs Hejai",objectivesES={"Informed Zûfan of the completed bounty","Inform Zûfan in Jadambor that you have culled the number of cultists","Una recompensa publicada por Bôgalekh para ir a Ghâs Hejai en el norte y reducir el número de Hakâri en la zona.","You accepted a bounty notice asking you to reduce the number of Hakâri in Ghâs Hejai. It can be found to the north of Jadambor.","The bounty notice reads:\
\
We can not let the cultists rebuild their strength here in Dil-irmíz.\
\
Any willing adventurers need only to go north to Ghâs Hejai and defeat any you encounter. If you succeed, return to Zûfan here in Jadambor and he will reward you for your efforts.\
\
They can be dangerous. You may want to bring some companions.","Reach the Hakâri camp to the north of Jadambor","Inform Zûfan in Jadambor that you have culled the number of cultists.","Defeat Hakâri to weaken their grasp on the area","Bounty: Clearing Ghâs Hejai"}},
[2330]={nameES="Bounty: Clearing Jalkhûl",objectivesES={"Defeat spiders to help make the area safer","Informed Zûfan of the completed bounty","You accepted a bounty notice asking you to reduce the number of spiders in Jalkhûl. It can be found to the south-east of Jadambor.","Inform Zûfan in Jadambor that you have culled the number of spiders","Bounty: Clearing Jalkhûl","Se ha publicado una recompensa con la solicitud de ir a Jalkhûl en el sur y reducir el número de arañas en la zona.","Reach Jalkhûl to the south-east of Jadambor","You inform Zûfan about the completed bounty.\
\
'That is the best news I have heard all day. I will let the people here know that the caves to the south will be a bit safer for now. My thanks adventurer.\
\
'Be sure to check the board for more requests, we need all the help we can get down here.'","The bounty notice reads:\
\
We need someone to do something about the spiders that have taken over the southern passage through Dil-irmíz.\
\
They have overrun Jalkhûl and now that area is not open to anyone, guard and smuggler alike. Zûfan here in Jadambor has offered a reward for anyone who can help us thin their numbers.\
\
They can be dangerous. You may want to bring some companions."}},
[2331]={nameES="Bounty: Clearing Rat Nests",objectivesES={"You accepted a bounty notice asking you to clear out rat nests in the area. There is one to the north, one to the east, and one to the south of Jadambor.","Informed Zûfan of the completed bounty","Inform Zûfan in Jadambor that the nests have been destroyed.","Destroyed the southern rat nest","You inform Zûfan about the completed bounty.\
\
'Glad to hear that from you. The people down here will be as relieved as I to hear that we will finally get some relief from those creatures destroying our stores of supplies. For the moment at least.\
\
'Be sure to check the board for more requests, we need all the help we can get down here.'","Destroyed the eastern rat nest","Destroy the northern rat nest in western Dil-irmíz","Destroyed the northern rat nest","The bounty notice reads:\
\
Rats are ruining our food stores. We are in desperate need of someone to stop them.\
\
We have located three nests in the area near Jadambor. One to the north, one to the east, and one to the south. Destroy these nests and report back to Zûfan here in Jadambor for a reward.","Inform Zûfan in Jadambor that the nests have been destroyed","Bounty: Clearing Rat Nests","Se ha publicado una recompensa para limpiar los nidos de ratas de la zona.","Destroy the southern rat nest in western Dil-irmíz","Destroy the eastern rat nest in western Dil-irmíz"}},
[2332]={nameES="Bounty: Corrupted Wood-trolls",objectivesES={}},
[2333]={nameES="Bounty: Corsairs at the Fallen Beacon",objectivesES={}},
[2334]={nameES="Recompensa: Gusanitos crujientes",objectivesES={"Un integrante emprendedor y quizás delirante de los Eglain planea crear platos de comida extraños para ayudar con la escasez que los Eglain enfrentan casi regularmente.","Recompensa: Gusanitos crujientes","Lleva la carne a Glaednoth","Los gusanos se pueden encontrar por todo el pantano de Harloeg. Glaednoth se encuentra en Ost Haer, en el extremo sur de Harloeg.\
\
Glaednoth te ha pedido que recojas carne de los gusanos de Harloeg.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Las misiones de recompensa son misiones repetibles, pero tienen un número limitado de completaciones. Esta misión se puede completar tres veces.</rgb>"}},
[2335]={nameES="Bounty: Crótharc the Unbreakable",objectivesES={}},
[2336]={nameES="Bounty: Darkwaters in Rath Dúath",objectivesES={}},
[2337]={nameES="Bounty: Dokhvor and Húlthak",objectivesES={"You have collected a deer carcass","The eldest of the wolves invading the Blackroot Vale, Dokhvor and Húlthak, threaten the people of Lancrath and have made the pass of Tarlang's Neck unsafe for travellers.","With a mournful and defiant howl, Dokhvor falls defeated","Gúrion can be found in Lancrath in the Blackroot Vale.\
\
You have defeated Dokhvor and Húlthak and taken their pelts. You should deliver the pelts to Gúrion in Lancrath.","Húlthak looses a terrible howl as he falls, and Dokhvor attacks in a vengeful fury!","Deer can be found throughout the Blackroot Vale.\
\
Gúrion of Lancrath has posted a bounty seeking skilled hunters to defeat the wolf elders, Dokhvor and Húlthak, who now dwell in Eryn Asgath. You should collect a deer carcass to use as bait.","Collect a deer carcass","Bounty: Dokhvor and Húlthak","The posted note advertises a bounty on a pair of elder wolves that have taken up in the Blackroot Vale known as Dokhvor and Húlthak, describing them as 'vicious and bloodthirsty pack-leaders and mates, and the foul parentage of many of the most aggressive wolves in the western reaches of Gondor'. It suggests that those who would seek to hunt Dokhvor and Húlthak should collect a carcass from one of the deer in the Blackroot Vale, as the wolves are notoriously reclusive and will only appear to feast upon a fresh kill.\
\
You notice that the note demands the pelts of Dokhvor and Húlthak as proof of their demise, and it invites those who have fulfilled the bounty to speak to Gúrion in the hamlet of Lancrath.","Dokhvor and Húlthak can be found in Eryn Asgath in the Blackroot Vale.\
\
You have obtained a deer carcass from one of the many deer of the Blackroot Vale. You should use it as bait to draw out Dokhvor and Húlthak in Eryn Asgath.","Place the deer carcass in Eryn Asgath to draw out Dokhvor and Húlthak","Deliver Dokhvor and Húlthak's pelts to Gúrion in Lancrath","Drawn forth by the scent of a fresh kill, Húlthak attacks!"}},
[2338]={nameES="Bounty: Drâghru",objectivesES={"You have defeated Drâghru. You should return to Nashôn in Kruha-sûrja to report your success.","A bounty has been offered by Nashôn for the defeat of the bog-lurker called Drâghru.","Bounty: Drâghru","Defeat the bog-lurker Drâghru","Talk to Nashôn","Defeated Drâghru","Drâghru can be found in Ilmabiri; the Wells, west of the guard post Kruha-sûrja.","The bounty notice reads:\
\
Reward offered to any individual that puts down the bog-lurker dubbed 'Drâghru'. This dangerous creature is unusually large and aggressive. It has been determined to be a threat to the people of Umbar Baharbêl that must be dealt with. See Nashôn to collect this bounty."}},
[2339]={nameES="Bounty: Easterlings in Parth Daenath",objectivesES={}},
[2340]={nameES="Bounty: Enudâri",objectivesES={}},
[2341]={nameES="Bounty: Ershubât the Cradle-thief",objectivesES={"You have claimed the head of Ershubât the Cradle-thief.\
\
You should return to Ashâb at the Dawn-warden for your reward.","Collected the head of Ershubât","Collect the head of Ershubât","Bounty: Ershubât the Cradle-thief","A bounty is posted on this board. It reads:\
\
'Wanted: The head of the vile beast known as Ershubât the Cradle-thief. This massive cobra is believed to be responsible for the deaths of many Shagâni babes, killed in their own cribs. Any adventurer who ventures into the hidden oasis Nax Shalâl and slays the snake and his spawn will be rewarded.'","You have accepted a bounty to collect the head of Ershubât the Cradle-thief and slay his spawn.\
\
You should travel to the hidden oasis, Nax Shalâl, and complete the bounty.","A bounty has been posted for the slaying of a dangerous cobra in a hidden oasis.","Talk to Ashâb"}},
[2342]={nameES="Bounty: Fer-nefâsi",objectivesES={"Fer-nefâsi hunts her prey in the Hills of Haramûl, located in north central An Shêru.","You have defeated the roc Fer-nefâsi. You should return to Jiret-menêsh to collect your reward.","Talk to Mísikir in Jiret-menêsh","Defeat Fer-nefâsi","A bounty offered for the defeat of Fer-nefâsi, an especially menacing roc.","Reward!\
\
A reward is offered to whoever defeats the roc known as Fer-nefâsi. This savage creature has been witnessed on several occasions harrying dwarves attempting to travel through the Hills of Haramûl. It is only a matter of time before someone is killed!","Fer-nefâsi defeated","Bounty: Fer-nefâsi"}},
[2343]={nameES="Recompensa: Gethin Ojobuey",objectivesES={"Gethin Ojobuey derrotado","Recompensa: Gethin Ojobuey","Un cartel de recompensa te pide que encuentres a Gethin Ojobuey, un peligroso saqueador de tumbas del Bosque Salvaje.","El saqueador de tumbas se enfrenta a ti","Invoca y enfréntate a Gethin Ojobuey","El cartel de recompensa dice:\
\
'Derribó las viejas ruinas solo porque no encontró las riquezas que buscaba. Gethin Ojobuey, el saqueador de tumbas con fama de ganarse enemigos allá donde va. ¿Cuánto tiempo más podemos permitir que este malvado desalmado deambule por el Bosque Salvaje?\
\
'Ofrezco una recompensa a quien libre a estos bosques de Gethin Ojobuey. ¡No quiero volver a ver nunca más a ese saqueador de tumbas derribando ruinas en el Bosque Salvaje!'","Completado","Has derrotado a Gethin Ojobuey y has ayudado a los Pueblos Libres del Bosque Salvaje.","Gethin Ojobuey se encuentra en la Mina Este del Bosque Salvaje.\
\
Debes invocar a Gethin Ojobuey y enfrentarte a él."}},
[2344]={nameES="Bounty: Goblin at Scraper's Clough",objectivesES={"The bounty notice reads:\
\
'Goblins run rampant in the Floodfells! By decree of Runerik Knotbeard, thane of Limlók, all goblins are to be found and defeated immediately! A particularly troublesome goblin has been recently spotted taking refuge in the cave of Scraper's Clough. A reward to any who can defeat it with haste!'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Warning: This quest has a one hour time limit. The timer will begin upon accepting the quest.</rgb>","Defeated the Bear-cleaver!","Defeated the Bone-chewer!","Defeat all goblins in Scraper's Clough.","You ran out of time...","You should return to Limlók and remove the completed bounty from the bounty board.","Travel to Scraper's Clough.","A bounty notice asks you to seek out a goblin that has been seen lurking around the cavern of Scraper's Clough in the Floodfells.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Warning: This quest has a one hour time limit. The timer will begin upon accepting the quest.</rgb>","Bounty: Goblin at Scraper's Clough","Defeated The Gangly Slicer!","Examine the bounty and defeat goblins in Scraper's Clough","You remove the completed bounty from the Limlók bounty board, feeling a sense of accomplishment in your efforts to protect the Langflood.","Return to Limlók and remove the completed bounty","Defeated the Drudge-stomper!"}},
