\
'Goblins run rampant in the Floodfells! By decree of Runerik Knotbeard, thane of Limlók, all goblins are to be found and defeated immediately! A particularly troublesome goblin has been recently spotted taking refuge in the cave of Tithroz. A reward to any who can defeat it with haste!'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Warning: This quest has a one hour time limit. The timer will begin upon accepting the quest.</rgb>","Defeated The Wound-skewer!","You remove the completed bounty from the Limlók bounty board, feeling a sense of accomplishment in your efforts to protect the Langflood.","Return to Limlók and remove the completed bounty","Defeated The Death-spear!","Bounty: Goblin at Tithroz"}},
[2346]={nameES="Bounty: Goblin at Veithhól",objectivesES={"You ran out of time...","Defeated the Crag-slaver!","A bounty notice asks you to seek out a goblin that has been seen lurking around Veithhól in Misthallow.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Warning: This quest has a one hour time limit. The timer will begin upon accepting the quest.</rgb>","Travel to Veithhól.","You should return to Limlók and remove the completed bounty from the bounty board.","Defeated the Shadow-ripper!","Examine the bounty and defeat goblins at Veithhól","The bounty notice reads:\
\
'Goblins run rampant in Misthallow! By order of Skarding Wargsbane, all goblins in Misthallow are to be found and defeated immediately! A particularly troublesome goblin has been recently spotted taking refuge at Veithhól. A reward to any who can defeat it with haste!'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Warning: This quest has a one hour time limit. The timer will begin upon accepting the quest.</rgb>","Defeat all goblins at Veithhól.","Defeated the Raging Mauler!","Bounty: Goblin at Veithhól","You remove the completed bounty from the Limlók bounty board, feeling a sense of accomplishment in your efforts to protect the Langflood.","Return to Limlók and remove the completed bounty","Defeated The Beast Master!"}},
