\
'Goblins run rampant in the Floodfells! By decree of Runerik Knotbeard, thane of Limlók, all goblins are to be found and defeated immediately! A particularly troublesome goblin has been recently spotted taking refuge in the eaves of the nearby forests. A reward to any who can defeat it with haste!'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Warning: This quest has a one hour time limit. The timer will begin upon accepting the quest.</rgb>","Defeated the Pine-cleaver!","You ran out of time...","Travel to the forest's edge.","You should return to Limlók and remove the completed bounty from the bounty board.","Bounty: Goblin at the Forest's Edge","Defeated the Skull-cooker!","Defeated the Blood-spiller!","Defeat all goblins at the forest's edge.","Defeated the Forest-stalker!","A bounty notice asks you to seek out a goblin that has been seen lurking around the forest's edge in the Floodfells.\
