\
<rgb=#FF0000>Warning: This quest has a one hour time limit. The timer will begin upon accepting the quest.</rgb>","You ran out of time...","Travel to the Cabed Rhimdath.","You should return to Limlók and remove the completed bounty from the bounty board.","Defeated the Earth-splitter!","Defeated The Tracking Dagger!","Defeated The Angry Chaser!","Defeat all goblins in the Cabed Rhimdath.","Examine the bounty and defeat goblins in the Cabed Rhimdath","Bounty: Goblin in the Cabed Rhimdath","You remove the completed bounty from the Limlók bounty board, feeling a sense of accomplishment in your efforts to protect the Langflood.","A bounty notice asks you to seek out a goblin that has been seen lurking around the Cabed Rhimdath in Misthallow.\
