<rgb=#FF0000>Warning: This quest has a one hour time limit. The timer will begin upon accepting the quest.</rgb>","Return to Limlók and remove the completed bounty"}},
[2349]={nameES="Recompensa: Vainas de trasgo",objectivesES={"Recompensa: Vainas de trasgo","Gadaric Mascador ha pedido que se aplique justicia contra los trasgos que ahora infestan Minas Eriol. Son responsables de la muerte de muchos de los suyos, y ha ofrecido recompensas por su destrucción.","Lleva las vainas de trasgo a Gadaric Mascador","Los trasgos pueden encontrarse al noreste, bajo la sombra de la Cima de los Vientos, o en las ruinas de Minas Eriol, al sureste de la Posada Abandonada.\
\
Gadaric Mascador quiere reunir las vainas que llevan los trasgos en las Tierras Solitarias.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Las misiones de recompensa son repetibles, pero tienen un número limitado de completaciones. Esta misión puede completarse tres veces.</rgb>"}},
[2350]={nameES="Recompensa: Tabardos de trasgo",objectivesES={"Recompensa: Tabardos de trasgo","Lleva tabardos de trasgo a Lieva Lirioagrio","Hay trasgos en las ruinas de Minas Eriol, al sureste de la Posada Abandonada, y en los campos de Annunlos.\
\
Para terminar su espantapájaros, Lieva Lirioagrio necesita algunos de los tabardos que usan los trasgos de Annunlos, pero nadie en la Posada Abandonada es lo suficientemente valiente para arriesgarse a recoger la tela para ella. Te ha pedido que recojas los tabardos en su lugar.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Las misiones de recompensa son repetibles, pero tienen un número limitado de completaciones. Esta misión puede completarse tres veces.</rgb>","Los trasgos en las ruinas de Minas Eriol, al sureste de la Posada Abandonada, causan muchos problemas a la gente de la posada. Lieva Lirioagrio está cosiendo un espantapájaros para ahuyentar a los trasgos."}},
[2351]={nameES="Bounty: Gorthorog Triplets",objectivesES={}},
[2352]={nameES="Bounty: Grazadhrú",objectivesES={}},
[2353]={nameES="Bounty: Gristlefell",objectivesES={"You have defeated Gristlefell and assisted the expedition.","Defeat Gristlefell","The bounty notice reads:\
\
'Who among you has not known the fear of a bear's call in the woods? It is a warning to keep away, a distant threat. But it is different here in the Ered Mithrin. Here, the láthbear will give you little notice of its ire; before you know you are hunted, it is upon you, its red eyes full of hate, its sharp teeth slavering!\
\
'Of all the láthbears that prowl these mountains, none is more dangerous than the one named Gristlefell. A reward to any who can bring him down, along with others of his sloth!'","A bounty notice asks you to seek out Gristlefell, a ravenous wild beast in Ered Mithrin.","Gristlefell and Mithrin láthbears can be found in Ered Mithrin.\
\
You should defeat láthbears.","Defeated Gristlefell.","Completado","Defeated Gristlefell","Bounty: Gristlefell"}},
[2354]={nameES="Bounty: Gírkhash",objectivesES={"You have defeated Gírkhash and many of his spawn.\
\
You should return to Shâpar in Ahâba for your reward.","You have accepted a bounty to defeat Gírkhash and other bronze lizards in Idagâl.\
\
You should find and defeat these lizards.","Bounty: Gírkhash","Defeat Gírkhash","Talk to Shâpar","A bounty has been posted for a large frilled lizard that has been antagonizing the Beltáni in Ahâba.","Defeated Gírkhash","A bounty is posted on this board. It reads:\
\
'Wanted: A brave adventurer to find and defeat the giant bronze lizard known as Gírkhash. This lizard and his spawn have been attacking the sheep and ransacking the foodstuff in Ahâba and must be hunted down.'"}},
[2355]={nameES="Bounty: Gúrkug",objectivesES={"Defeated Gúrkug","Defeated Gúrkug.","A bounty notice asks you to seek out Gúrkug, a brutal goblin driver found in Máttugard.","Defeat Gúrkug","Bounty: Gúrkug","Completado","You have defeated Gúrkug and assisted those who wish to reclaim Gundabad.","Gúrkug and goblins can be found in Máttugard.\
\
You should defeat goblins.","The bounty notice reads:\
\
'Who among you has the courage to face Gúrkug? The brutal goblin driver wields his drudges as throwing spears, swarming in on any in his way.\
\
'A reward to any who can defeat Gúrkug and other goblins in Máttugard!'"}},
[2356]={nameES="Bounty: Half-trolls",objectivesES={}},
[2357]={nameES="Bounty: Haradrim",objectivesES={}},
[2358]={nameES="Recompensa: Enrico Riscarpado, Ojo Mortal",objectivesES={"Ballard Wilmer está en Ost Forod, el antiguo puesto de vigilancia en las colinas de Tyrn Fornech.\
\
Un cartel que ofrece una recompensa por la captura o derrota del saqueador de tumbas Enrico Riscarpado llamó tu atención. Si deseas solicitar esta recompensa, debes hablar con Ballard Wilmer.","Se ha ofrecido una recompensa por Enrico Riscarpado, un saqueador de tumbas conocido por su puntería mortal con el arco.","Recompensa: Enrico Riscarpado, Ojo Mortal","Basilio Resinas está en Ost Forod, el antiguo puesto de vigilancia en las colinas de Tyrn Fornech.\
\
Has derrotado a Enrico Riscarpado y ahora debes informar a Basilio Resinas para recibir tu recompensa.","Enrico Riscarpado se encuentra cerca de la puerta hacia Forochel, en Cirith Rhîw, al final del camino del norte a través de Tyrn Fornech.\
\
Has aceptado la comisión de reclamar la recompensa por Enrico Riscarpado, un tirador letal con el arco.","Ballard Wilmer está en Ost Forod, el antiguo puesto de vigilancia en las colinas de Tyrn Fornech.\
\
Has derrotado a Enrico Riscarpado y ahora debes informar a Ballard Wilmer.","El cartel anuncia una recompensa por un hombre llamado Enrico Riscarpado, descrito como 'un saqueador de tumbas dotado de una puntería sorprendente con el arco', e invita a los interesados a buscar a Ballard Wilmer en Ost Forod para conocer los detalles y postularse para la comisión."}},
[2359]={nameES="Bounty: Holkorm",objectivesES={}},
[2360]={nameES="Bounty: Iorwerth",objectivesES={"Iorwerth can be found at the Writhendowns Tomb, guarding the barrow from outside.\
\
You should summon and defeat Iorwerth and collect his crest.","Return to Britric","Collected the crest of Iorwerth","<rgb=#FF0000>Completing Wildermore's Recovery will cancel this quest.</rgb>","Defeat Iorwerth and collect his crest","Bounty: Iorwerth","Iorwerth, the guardian of the Writhendowns Tomb, has woken, and haunts the small island on which the tomb rests.","Britric is in Forlaw.\
\
You have defeated Iorwerth, and should now return to Forlaw to collect your bounty."}},
[2361]={nameES="Bounty: Jûkhtar of the Thousand Children",objectivesES={"Bring Jûkhtar's venom to Nazâkh in Zajâna","The malevolent spider Jûkhtar has been growing her brood and attacking Zajâni citizens near her burrow in Jâr Obadal. You are to defeat her and collect a sample of her venom.","Bring Jûkhtar's venom to Nazâkh in Zajâna to collect your reward.","Bounty: Jûkhtar of the Thousand Children","Defeat Jûkhtar and collect her venom","The bounty notice reads:\
\
On behalf of the Doorwards of Zajâna, hallowed protectors of commerce and the Great Road, you are empowered to seek out and defeat the great spider Jûkhtar. Many innocents have been attacked and poisoned by her and her children. We ask that you collect a sample of her venom, that the scholars of Zajâna may study it and compose a healing salve for those poisoned by bites from her children.\
\
After her defeat, bring a sample of her venom to Zajâna. Present it to Nazâkh, Huntswoman to the Doorwards, outside the council chambers in Zajâna for a proper reward.","The malevolent spider Jûkhtar has been growing her brood and attacking Zajâni citizens near her burrow in Jâr Obadal. You are to defeat her and collect a sample of her venom. Bring it to Nazâkh in Zajâna, that she may give it to those who would prepare a salve to heal citizens poisoned by her children."}},
[2362]={nameES="Bounty: Kasâshu the Grinder",objectivesES={"You have reclaimed someone's severed hand from the dread-tortoise.\
\
You should return to Ashâb at the Dawn-warden for your reward.","A bounty has been posted for the slaying of a massive dread-tortoise.","Defeat Kasâshu the Grinder","Bounty: Kasâshu the Grinder","The only item of note inside the tortoise is a severed hand!","A bounty is posted on this board. It reads:\
\
'Wanted: an adventurer to slay the dread-tortoise known as Kasâshu the Grinder. This massive beast has eaten something of great value to a soldier of Aradûn, and the object must be reclaimed from its innards. The Grinder was last seen among the other dread-tortoises at Karmu Râx. The Servants of Aradûn offer a reward for any who can assist with this task.'","Collect the 'item of great value'","You have accepted a bounty to defeat Kasâshu the Grinder and reclaim something of great value from his belly.\
\
You should travel to Karmu Râx and complete the bounty.","Defeated Kasâshu the Grinder","Talk to Ashâb"}},
[2363]={nameES="Bounty: Kaursu",objectivesES={"Bring Kaursu's vile armour to Numûru in Urmâkh","The bounty notice reads:\
\
On behalf of the Queen of Renewed Hamât, Mizâdi Shâra, you are asked to seek out and defeat the infamous Orc Kaursu. Kaursu has been seen inside Kûr Anzar and is known to be allies with the vile Barkhûshim stationed there. Kaursu has killed more than fifty Hamâti warriors, using their skulls and bones as vile trophies upon his very armour.\
\
The proof of his death shall be his chest-piece and pauldrons, that we may lay our fallen soldiers to rest properly. Bring the vile armour to Numûru, Hand of the Queen in Urmâkh for a proper reward.","Defeat Kaursu and collect his vile armour","Bring Kaursu's vile armour to Numûru in Urmâkh to collect your reward.","Mizâdi Shâra, Queen of Renewed Hamât, has posted a bounty seeking skilled soldiers to defeat the infamous Orc Kaursu, slayer of over fifty Hamâti warriors, and return to her Hand, Numûru, with his armour. He keeps his council with the Barkhûshim in Kûr Anzar.","The infamous Orc Kaursu has killed many Hamâti warriors from his perch in Kûr Anzar. You are to defeat him and return to Numûru with his vile armour.","Bounty: Kaursu"}},
[2364]={nameES="Bounty: Keen-eye",objectivesES={"Keen-eye has been spotted atop a frozen waterfall in the High Knolls, and it is believed that his beak will be a valuable part of a collection of bounties.","Keen-eye can be found in the High Knolls, atop the rocky tunnel and frozen waterfall that cover the southern road in the High Knolls.\
\
You should summon and defeat Keen-eye, and collect his beak.","<rgb=#FF0000>Completing Wildermore's Recovery will cancel this quest.</rgb>","Bounty: Keen-eye","Britric is in Forlaw.\
\
You have collected the beak of Keen-eye, and should now return to Forlaw to collect your bounty.","Collected Keen-eye's beak","Defeat Keen-eye and collect his beak","Bring the beak to Britric"}},
[2365]={nameES="Bounty: Keenclaw",objectivesES={}},
[2366]={nameES="Bounty: Kigrush",objectivesES={"Defeated Kigrush","Return to Neshurga and inform him of Kigrush's defeat","The bounty notice reads:\
\
'A group of brigands has been betraying our agreement here in Urash Dâr and they must be stopped. They are working out of Zikrum-dûl and are led by the a ruthless man named Kigrush.\
\
'Put an end to him and speak to Neshurga in Ub Nishir when you do.'","A bounty notice in Ub Nishir has asked for someone to defeat ruthless leader of a group of brigands in Zikrum-dûl to the east known as Kigrush.","A bounty notice asks you to defeat Kigrush, the leader of a brigand group attacking refugees. He is reported to be found in Zikrum-dûl to the east.","Defeat Kigrush","Bounty: Kigrush","Return to Neshurga in Ub Nishir north of Maurûsh and inform him that you have completed the bounty and defeated Kigrush."}},
[2367]={nameES="Bounty: Korutásh the Cruel",objectivesES={"Bring Korutásh's jewelled dagger to Nazâkh in Zajâna to collect your reward.","Bounty: Korutásh the Cruel","The bounty notice reads:\
\
On behalf of the Doorwards of Zajâna, hallowed protectors of commerce and the Great Road, you are empowered to seek out and defeat the infamous goblin Korutásh the Cruel. Long have his raiding parties harried and attacked the people of Sen Chatâk and travellers along the Great Road. He can be found in the hills of Glúkroz, north-east of Sen Chatâk.\
\
Proof of his demise shall be Korutásh's infamous bejewelled dagger. Present it to Nazâkh, Huntswoman to the Doorwards, outside the council chambers in Zajâna for a proper reward.","The dread goblin Korutásh has slain many innocent people in Sen Chatâk with his raiding parties. You are to defeat him and return to Nazâkh with his bejewelled dagger.","Defeat Korutásh and collect his jewelled dagger","The dread goblin Korutásh has slain many innocent people in Sen Chatâk with his raiding parties. You are to defeat him and return to Nazâkh with his bejewelled dagger. Korutásh can be found north-east of Sen Chatâk, in the hills of Glúkroz.","Bring Korutásh's jewelled dagger to Nazâkh in Zajâna"}},
[2368]={nameES="Bounty: Krah, the Spy-master",objectivesES={"Britric is in Forlaw.\
\
You have collected the knife of the goblin Spy-master Krah, and should now return to Forlaw to collect your bounty.","Defeat Krah and collect his knife","Bring the knife to Britric","<rgb=#FF0000>Completing Wildermore's Recovery will cancel this quest.</rgb>","The Spy-master Krah can be summoned just north of Dunfast in the Whitshaws.\
\
You should summon and defeat Krah, and collect his knife.","Isengard's goblin Spy-master, Krah, has been seen near Dunfast in the Whitshaws, and it is believed that his knife will be a valuable part of a collection of bounties.","Collected Krah's knife","Bounty: Krah, the Spy-master"}},
[2369]={nameES="Bounty: Kurr",objectivesES={"Britric is in Forlaw.\
\
You have collected the tooth of Kurr, and should now return to Forlaw to collect your bounty.","Defeat Kurr and collect his tooth","Bounty: Kurr","Collected Kurr's tooth","<rgb=#FF0000>Completing Wildermore's Recovery will cancel this quest.</rgb>","Kurr has been seen by some tall rocks in the north-east plains of the Whitshaws, and it is believed that his tooth will be a valuable part of a collection of bounties.","Kurr romps in the north-eastern plains of the Whitshaws, hiding among some tall rocks near the fishermens' home.\
\
You should summon and defeat Kurr, and collect his tooth.","Bring Kurr's tooth to Britric"}},
[2370]={nameES="Bounty: Kurthár",objectivesES={"Agátur the Boastful asks you to seek out Kurthár, a terrible cave-beast found in Máttugard.","Bring the claw of Kurthár to Agátur","Collect the claw of Kurthár for Agátur","Defeated Kurthár","Defeat Kurthár","Collected the claw of Kurthár","Agátur can be found at Steepset in Máttugard.\
\
You should bring the claw of Kurthár to Agátur.","Kurthár and cave-beasts can be found in Máttugard.\
\
You should defeat cave-beasts.","Bounty: Kurthár"}},
[2371]={nameES="Bounty: Kurzglok the Many-legged",objectivesES={"Deliver Kurzglok's mandibles to Melril in Sardol","Its many barbed legs stilled at last, Kurzglok bubbles and falls silent","Bounty: Kurzglok the Many-legged","The posted note advertises a bounty on a spider of Blackroot Vale known as Kurzglok, described as 'a terrifying great spider and devourer of its own kind lurking in the caverns of Lhingroth', and it invites any who claim to have slain Kurzglok to speak with Melril in the hamlet of Sardol.\
\
You notice that a hasty addition has been scrawled in different hand-writing at the bottom of the note, demanding that Kurzglok's mandibles be collected as proof of its defeat.","Kurzglok can be found somewhere in the caverns of Lhingorth in the Blackroot Vale.\
\
A bounty posted by Melril of Sardol seeks for a skilled hunter to seek out and defeat the spider, Kurzglok, in the caverns of Lhingroth.","The terrible spider known as Kurzglok poses a grave threat to the hunters of Sardol.","The web springs at your touch and a loud reverberation echoes through Lhingroth!","Find and defeat Kurzglok in Lhingroth","Melril can be found in Sardol in the Blackroot Vale.\
\
You have defeated Kurzglok and taken its mandibles. You should deliver them to Melril in Sardol."}},
[2372]={nameES="Bounty: Langarch",objectivesES={"Defeated Langarch","You ask Derufin about the bounty notice.\
\
'The bounty! I am quite glad you are here! The Rangers asked if Duilin and I could rid them of this nuisance. Apparently this boar's been getting in the way of the Rangers slinking about. Obviously I said yes to appease these hospitable men. The thing is, we're quite busy with hunting bigger game and can't be bothered with this animal. If you take care of this task for me, Duilin and I would be most grateful.'","Derufin can be found in Bâr Húrin.\
\
You should speak with Derufin.","The bounty notice reads:\
\
'A large boar keeps interfering with Ranger activities. Please speak with me for further details. Derufin'","A bounty notice asks you to seek out Derufin who has information about Langarch, a maddened wild beast in Southern Ithilien.","Speak with Derufin","Defeat Langarch","Langarch can be found somewhere in Southern Ithilien.\
\
You should defeat Langarch.","Bounty: Langarch"}},
[2373]={nameES="Bounty: Legwêna",objectivesES={"Legwêna is located in the western side of Ilmabiri; the Wells.","The bounty notice reads:\
\
Wanted: The slaying of the morroval known as Legwêna. Do not attempt unless you are an experienced warrior. She has killed some and injured many. Morutágya wants her head! See Porókho for reward.\
\
Scrawled underneath this in another handwriting is an additional message that reads:\
\
Please do not actually bring us a head. That is gruesome.\
-Eshéra","Defeat the morroval Legwêna","Morutágya Clan has called for the death of the morroval known as Legwêna.","Defeated Legwêna","You have defeated the morroval, Legwêna. You should return to Porókho at his camp in Hêbatokh to claim your reward.","Talk to Porókho","Bounty: Legwêna"}},
[2374]={nameES="Bounty: Luhum-gêna",objectivesES={}},
[2375]={nameES="Bounty: Maeganc",objectivesES={"The bounty notice reads:\
\
'I seek a certain bear as a trophy. Come speak with me for further details. Duilin'","A bounty notice asks you to seek out Duilin who has information about Maeganc, a ravenous wild beast in Southern Ithilien.","Duilin can be found in Bâr Húrin.\
\
You should speak with Duilin.","Defeated Maeganc","Speak with Duilin","Maeganc can be found somewhere in Southern Ithilien.\
\
You should defeat Maeganc.","Defeat Maeganc","Bounty: Maeganc","You ask Duilin about the bounty notice.\
\
'Ah yes the great bear, Maeganc. My brother and I have been very busy. So busy in fact that we've not the time to hunt this exquisite game. The Mûmak calls us as the ultimate hunt. If you hunt this bear for us, I promise you will be handsomely rewarded. The bear's head would look grand in our hall back in the Blackroot Vale!'"}},
[2376]={nameES="Bounty: Mangath",objectivesES={}},
[2377]={nameES="Bounty: Manyêki",objectivesES={"Notice:\
\
A reward is offered for the slaying of Manyêki, a grodbog as ferocious as it is repulsive. Do not be fooled by its size! Manyêki is small but mighty.\
\
This detestable creature can usually be found south of Jiret-menêsh in the Hills of Haramûl.","Talk to Mísikir in Jiret-menêsh","Bounty: Manyêki","Defeat Manyêki","You have defeated the grodbog Manyêki. You should return to Jiret-menêsh to collect your reward.","A reward has been offered for the defeat of a grodbog called Manyêki.","Manyêki can usually be found south of Jiret-menêsh in the Hills of Haramûl. You should go there and defeat it.","Manyêki defeated"}},
[2378]={nameES="Bounty: Marr",objectivesES={"Bring the pauldrons to Britric","Collected Marr's pauldrons","Marr has been seen camping outside of Scylfig, and it is believed that his pauldrons will be a valuable part of a collection of bounties.","Defeat Marr and collect his pauldrons","<rgb=#FF0000>Completing Wildermore's Recovery will cancel this quest.</rgb>","Marr can be found camping on a hilltop south-west of the ruined town of Scylfig.\
\
You should summon and defeat Marr and collect his pauldrons.","Britric is in Forlaw.\
\
You have defeated Marr, and should now return to Forlaw to collect your bounty.","Bounty: Marr"}},
[2379]={nameES="Bounty: Moorstalker",objectivesES={}},
[2380]={nameES="Bounty: Nakhrûd",objectivesES={}},
[2381]={nameES="Bounty: Nâralarg, the Blighted Root",objectivesES={"Bounty: Nâralarg, the Blighted Root","The bounty notice reads:\
\
On behalf of the Doorwards of Zajâna, hallowed protectors of commerce and the Great Road, you are empowered to seek out and defeat the dread restless tree Nâralarg, the Blighted Root. He has been seen harrying the citizens of Sormedân and spreading blight and disease from Adagím into our unblemished farmlands. He can be found in the blighted grove of Shádhag, near Adagím.\
\
Proof of his demise shall be a piece of Nâralarg's blighted root. Present it to Nazâkh, Huntswoman to the Doorwards, outside the council chambers in Zajâna for a proper reward.","You are to defeat Nâralarg, the Blighted Root before he can spread noxious disease throughout Kighân. Return to Nazâkh in Zajâna with a sample of his blighted roots to show proof of his demise. He can be found in the blighted grove of Shádhag, near Adagím.","You are to defeat Nâralarg, the Blighted Root before he can spread noxious disease throughout Kighân. Return to Nazâkh in Zajâna with a sample of his blighted roots to show proof of his demise.","Defeat Nâralarg and collect his blighted root","Bring Nâralarg's root to Nazâkh in Zajâna to collect your reward.","Bring Nâralarg's root to Nazâkh in Zajâna"}},
[2382]={nameES="Bounty: Orcs in Arandor",objectivesES={"You defeated Orc lieutenants and successfully thinned the ranks of the Orc soldiers. The man who posted the bounty must be pleased, but you do wonder how many potential bounty-seekers his notice may have sent into danger.","Orc soldiers can be found in Arandor.\
\
You should defeat Orc soldiers and lieutenants.","The bounty notice reads:\
\
'Pay attention to this notice! Do not assume one of your brethren will heed it! Yes, I am writing this to you! The Orcs' numbers are getting out of control in Arandor, and a group of their lieutenants has been rallying for an assault on our camp. Put an end to it, and you will be handsomely rewarded. Yes, you!'","Bounty: Orcs in Arandor","A bounty asks you to thin the Orc numbers and slay their lieutenants in Arandor.","Completado","Defeated Orc soldiers."}},
[2383]={nameES="Bounty: Orcs in Rath Dúath",objectivesES={}},
[2384]={nameES="Bounty: Proto-beast",objectivesES={}},
[2385]={nameES="Bounty: Proto-crab",objectivesES={}},
[2386]={nameES="Bounty: Proto-crow",objectivesES={}},
[2387]={nameES="Bounty: Proto-huorn",objectivesES={}},
[2388]={nameES="Bounty: Proto-salamander",objectivesES={}},
[2389]={nameES="Bounty: Quelling Bog-lurkers",objectivesES={"You inform Zûfan about the completed bounty.\
\
'That is great to hear. Our scouts will be relieved to hear the news and can worry about looking over their shoulders a little less thanks to you.\
\
'Be sure to check the board for more requests, we need all the help we can get down here.'","Informed Zûfan of the completed bounty","Bounty: Quelling Bog-lurkers","You accepted a bounty notice asking you to reduce the number of bog-lurkers near Jadambor to help make the roads safer.","The bounty notice reads:\
\
Some bog-lurkers have been spotted in the area, and we can not risk our scouts getting preyed upon by these beasts.\
\
We are in need of someone to do something about them. If you do, report back to Zûfan here in Jadambor and you will be rewarded for your efforts.\
\
They can be dangerous. You may want to bring some companions.","Inform Zûfan in Jadambor that you have defeated bog-lurkers in the area","Se ha publicado una recompensa para reducir el número de acechadores de pantano en la zona.","Inform Zûfan in Jadambor that you have defeated bog-lurkers in the area."}},
[2390]={nameES="Bounty: Quelling Shades",objectivesES={"Informed Zûfan of the completed bounty","You inform Zûfan about the completed bounty.\
\
'Good tidings you bring me. The shades are surely not to stop any time soon, but your efforts will give us time to catch our breath.\
\
'Be sure to check the board for more requests. We need all the help we can get down here.'","Se ha publicado una recompensa para reducir el número de sombras en la zona.","Bounty: Quelling Shades","Inform Zûfan in Jadambor that you have defeated shades in the area","The bounty notice reads:\
\
Dil-irmíz has become overrun by shades, and we need help fighting them back.\
\
Any willing adventurers who can help reduce their numbers would be welcomed. If you manage to succeed, report back to Zûfan here in Jadambor and you'll be rewarded for your efforts.\
\
They can be dangerous. You may want to bring some companions.","You accepted a bounty notice asking you to reduce the number shades in the area to prevent Jadambor from being overrun."}},
[2391]={nameES="Bounty: Rakhûl",objectivesES={"The bounty notice reads:\
\
'A dangerous wasp has been roaming the Gorge of Woe to the north-east and must be slain to protect travellers along the road.\
\
'Speak with Neshurga in Ub Nishir should you defeat this beast.'","Return to Neshurga and inform him of Rakhûl's defeat","A bounty notice in Ub Nishir has asked for someone to defeat the wasp Rakhûl in the Gorge of Woe to the north-east.","Bounty: Rakhûl","Defeat Rakhûl","A bounty notice asks you to defeat a deadly wasp called Rakhûl in the Gorge of Woe.","Return to Neshurga in Ub Nishir north of Maurûsh and inform him that you have completed the bounty and defeated Rakhûl.","Defeated Rakhûl"}},
[2392]={nameES="Bounty: Recovery of Riches",objectivesES={"Someone has robbed the vault of Calembel, stealing a great many valuables.","Someone has broken into the vault of Calembel while the majority of the guard force is absent from the city. A great many valuables were stolen, and reports have come in that the Corsairs who roam the outskirts of Lamedon openly carry the stolen goods on their persons.\
\
A reward will go to any warrior who can recover the treasure that was stolen.","Stolen treasure from the vault of Calembel can be found on Corsairs in northern Lamedon.\
\
You should recover stolen treasures from the Corsairs.","Laindir can be found in Calembel in Lamedon.\
\
You should return to Laindir and collect your reward for recovering the stolen goods.","Defeat Rilgell, the vault-robber","Defeated Rilgell","Collect your reward from Laindir","Bounty: Recovery of Riches"}},
[2393]={nameES="Bounty: Refugees",objectivesES={}},
[2394]={nameES="Bounty: Ronkúrz",objectivesES={"A bounty notice asks you to seek out Thurindol who has information about Ronkúrz, an Orc captain from the Morgul-vale.","Defeated Ronkúrz","Thurindol can be found in the keep at Bâr Húrin.\
\
You should speak with Thurindol.","Bounty: Ronkúrz","Speak with Thurindol","Ronkúrz can be found somewhere in Southern Ithilien.\
\
You should defeat Ronkúrz.","You ask Thurindol about the bounty notice.\
\
'I gladly accept your offer to defeat Ronkúrz. He commands one of the forces that stormed Osgiliath. The last update I have on his whereabouts is that he was stationed somewhere in South Ithilien. Good luck.'","Defeat Ronkúrz","The bounty notice reads:\
\
'Rangers, we are in need of one of you to defeat Ronkúrz, a captain in the ranks of the Morgul-host. Speak with Thurindol if you plan to accept this mission.'"}},
[2395]={nameES="Bounty: Ruthless Dead",objectivesES={}},
[2396]={nameES="Bounty: Scouting the Beacons",objectivesES={}},
[2397]={nameES="Bounty: Shahâk, Bloodtooth's Pup",objectivesES={"The bounty notice reads:\
\
On behalf of the Doorwards of Zajâna, hallowed protectors of commerce and the Great Road, you are asked to seek out and defeat the dread jázga Shahâk, pup of Bloodtooth. Long have travellers of the Great Road feared Shahâk and her sharp fangs, as she has slain many. She is said to haunt the lands near Dân Shatagan, north-east of Zajâna.\
\
The proof of her death shall be one of her bloody fangs. Present it to Nazâkh, Huntswoman to the Doorwards, outside the council chambers in Zajâna for a proper reward.","Bounty: Shahâk, Bloodtooth's Pup","Bring Shahâk's fang to Nazâkh in Zajâna to collect your reward.","Bring Shahâk's fang to Nazâkh in Zajâna","Defeat Shahâk and collect her mighty fang","Shahâk, pup of the dread jázga Bloodtooth, has been harassing travellers on the Great Road north of Zajâna. Defeat her and return to Nazâkh in Zajâna with one of her fangs as proof of her demise.","Shahâk, pup of the dread jázga Bloodtooth, has been harassing travellers on the Great Road north of Zajâna. Defeat her and return to Nazâkh in Zajâna with one of her fangs as proof of her demise. She is said to haunt the lands near Dân Shatagan, north-east of Zajâna."}},
[2398]={nameES="Bounty: Shakolam",objectivesES={"Bring the bracer to Britric","Defeat Shakolam and collect his bracer","Bounty: Shakolam","Shakolam can be found on the southern part of the Orc-made road in the Balewood.\
\
You should summon and defeat Shakolam, and collect his bracer.","<rgb=#FF0000>Completing Wildermore's Recovery will cancel this quest.</rgb>","Shakolam has been seen patrolling the Orc-made road through the Balewood, towards the southern edge.","Britric is in Forlaw.\
\
You have collected the bracer of Shakolam, and should now return to Forlaw to collect your bounty.","Collected Shakolam's bracer"}},
[2399]={nameES="Bounty: Shálith",objectivesES={"Bounty: Shálith","You have defeated Shálith and collected a trophy as proof","You defeated Shálith and obtained a trophy as proof. Return to Sálunath in Sul Madásh to collect the bounty.","Return to Sálunath with proof of Shálith's demise","The bounty notice reads:\
\
'A monstrous sicklefly called Shálith has been spotted in Saig Hathíl to the north-west. The scouts in the area have requested help in defeating it.\
\
'Bring proof to Sálunath in Sul Madásh if you complete this request.'","A bounty notice asks you to defeat a monstrous sicklefly called Shálith that has been spotted in Saig Hathíl in Adagím, and collect a trophy as proof.","Defeat Shálith"}},
[2400]={nameES="Recompensa: Pudín de mosca guadaña",objectivesES={"Recompensa: Pudín de mosca guadaña","Las moscas guadaña se pueden encontrar en todo el pantano de Harloeg. Glaednoth se encuentra en Ost Haer, en el extremo sur de Harloeg.\
\
Glaednoth te ha pedido que recojas mollejas de las moscas segadoras de Harloeg.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Las misiones de recompensa son misiones repetibles, pero tienen un número limitado de completaciones. Esta misión se puede completar tres veces.</rgb>","Un miembro emprendedor y quizás delirante de los Eglain planea crear platos de comida extraños para ayudar a solucionar la escasez a la que se enfrentan los Eglain casi con regularidad.","Lleva las vísceras a Glaednoth."}},
[2401]={nameES="Bounty: Skrithras",objectivesES={}},
[2402]={nameES="Recompensa: Puré de champiñones empapado",objectivesES={"Las setas empapadas se pueden encontrar en las ruinas al oeste de Ost Haer. Glaednoth se encuentra en las ruinas de Ost Haer, en la zona sur de Harloeg.\
\
Glaednoth te ha pedido que busques setas empapadas para intentar preparar un plato interesante con ellas.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Las misiones de recompensa son misiones repetibles, pero tienen un número limitado de completaciones. Esta misión se puede completar tres veces.</rgb>","Recompensa: Puré de champiñones empapado","Un miembro emprendedor y quizás delirante de los Eglain planea crear platos de comida extraños para ayudar a solucionar la escasez a la que se enfrentan los Eglain casi con regularidad.","Lleva las setas a Glaednoth"}},
[2403]={nameES="Bounty: Strákhal the Strangler",objectivesES={"Defeat Strákhal the Strangler","You have defeated Strákhal and collected a trophy as proof","Return to Sálunath with proof of Strákhal's demise","You defeated Strákhal the Strangler and obtained a trophy as proof. Return to Sálunath in Sul Madásh to collect the bounty.","The bounty notice reads:\
\
'A vicious and deadly Orc named Strákhal, known as The Strangler to locals, has been spotted in Fushaum Sûlm to the south-west. We can not allow these Orcs to prey on our people.\
\
'Bring proof to Sálunath in Sul Madásh if you complete this request.'","Bounty: Strákhal the Strangler","A bounty notice asks you to defeat a vicious Orc named Strákhal in Fushaum Sûlm in southern Adagím, and collect a trophy as proof."}},
[2404]={nameES="Bounty: Suginzi",objectivesES={"Bring Suginzi's great tusk to Numûru in Urmâkh","The great plague boar Suginzi is spreading disease and mayhem throughout Imhûlar. You are to defeat him and return to Numûru with his great tusk.","Bounty: Suginzi","Mizâdi Shâra, Queen of Renewed Hamât, has posted a bounty seeking skilled hunters to find and defeat the great plague boar, Suginzi. You are to defeat him and return to her Hand, Numûru, with one of his great tusks. He was last seen south-west of Urmâkh, near Shakhdag.","The bounty notice reads:\
\
On behalf of the Queen of Renewed Hamât, Mizâdi Shâra, you are empowered to seek out and defeat the great plague boar Suginzi. Suginzi has spread disease and mayhem throughout Imhûlar, and his reign of fear must end.\
\
The proof of his death shall be one of his great tusks, hewn from his head. Bring the tusk to Numûru, Hand of the Queen in Urmâkh for a fitting reward.","Bring Suginzi's great tusk to Numûru in Urmâkh to collect your reward.","Defeat Suginzi and collect one of his great tusks"}},
[2405]={nameES="Bounty: Sulmus",objectivesES={"Britric is in Forlaw.\
\
You have collected the saddle of Sulmus, and should now return to Forlaw to collect your bounty.","Defeat Sulmus and collect his saddle","Sulmus can be found in the Fallows by taking the road directly south, and then searching for eaten prey south of the first split in the road.\
\
You should summon and defeat Sulmus, and collect his saddle.","<rgb=#FF0000>Completing Wildermore's Recovery will cancel this quest.</rgb>","Sulmus has been seen riding through the Fallows, and it is believed that his saddle will be a valuable part of a collection of bounties.","Collected the saddle of Sulmus","Bounty: Sulmus","Bring the saddle to Britric"}},
[2406]={nameES="Bounty: Sóthadar the Trickster",objectivesES={"Bounty: Sóthadar the Trickster","The bounty notice reads:\
\
'There is a bog-lurker known as Sóthadar who has been known to roam in Lhámuth to the north-west. This beast is especially cunning and has earned the title of the trickster as it hides itself well to attack any travelling through its waters. Slay this beast to make the marsh safer for the scouts.\
\
'Bring proof to Sálunath in Sul Madásh if you complete this request.'","You have defeated Sóthadar and collected a trophy as proof","You defeated Sóthadar the Trickster and obtained a trophy as proof. Return to Sálunath in Sul Madásh to collect the bounty.","Defeat Sóthadar the Trickster","A bounty notice asks you to defeat a cunning bog-lurker known as Sóthadar who roams Lhámuth in Adagím, and collect a trophy as proof.","Return to Sálunath with proof of Sóthadar's demise"}},
[2407]={nameES="Bounty: Tamâhu",objectivesES={"The dread scorpion Tamâhu is harassing citizens and growing her brood west of Urmâkh. You are to defeat her and return to Numûru in Urmâkh with her mighty stinger.","Bring Tamâhu's stinger to Numûru in Urmâkh","Bring Tamâhu's stinger to Numûru in Urmâkh to collect your reward.","Mizâdi Shâra, Queen of Renewed Hamât, has posted a bounty seeking skilled hunters to defeat the dread scorpion Tamâhu and return with her mighty stinger. She has last been seen west of Urmâkh, near Dûlagig.","The bounty notice reads:\
\
On behalf of the Queen of Renewed Hamât, Mizâdi Shâra, brave citizens amongst you are asked to seek out and defeat the dread scorpion Tamâhu. Tamâhu has long plagued the lands west of Urmâkh, endangering all the peoples of Imhûlar. Defeat her before her brood spreads and more harm comes to innocent citizens of Urmâkh.\
\
The proof of your triumph shall be her oversized stinger. Bring the twisted weapon to Numûru, Hand of the Queen in Urmâkh for a proper reward.","Bounty: Tamâhu","Defeat Tamâhu and collect her mighty stinger"}},
[2408]={nameES="Recompensa: Tansy Piesdeliebre",objectivesES={"Tansy Piesdeliebre se encuentra en Guardasur, en el Bosque Salvaje.\
\
Deberías invocar y enfrentarte a Tansy Piesdeliebre.","Recompensa: Tansy Piesdeliebre","El cartel de recompensa dice:\
\
'Ella estaba en lo alto de la colina, y supe que me observaba desde lejos. Tansy Piesdeliebre, la asesina implacable, me vigilaba. Tuve suerte, pues aquel día no era yo su objetivo. ¿Cuánto tiempo más tendremos que vivir con miedo mientras recolectamos los recursos del Bosque Salvaje?\
\
'Ofrezco una recompensa a quien consiga librar a estos bosques de Tansy Piesdeliebre. ¡No quiero volver a ver a esa bandida en las alturas del Bosque Salvaje jamás!'","Completado","Has derrotado a Tansy Piesdeliebre y has ayudado a los Pueblos Libres del Bosque Salvaje.","La bandida se enfrenta a ti","Invoca y enfréntate a Tansy Piesdeliebre","Un cartel de recompensa te pide que encuentres a Tansy Piesdeliebre, una peligrosa bandida del Bosque Salvaje.","Tansy Piesdeliebre derrotada"}},
[2409]={nameES="Bounty: Tarlang's Fang",objectivesES={"Defeat Tarlang's Fang","Calennen can be found in central Alagrant in western Blackroot Vale.\
\
You have found a bounty posted for Tarlang's Fang and should now seek Calennen for more information.","The hunters of Alagrant have posted a bounty in hopes of finally defeating the elusive mountain-lion known as Tarlang's Fang.","Defeated Tarlang's Fang","Calennen can be found in central Alagrant in western Blackroot Vale.\
\
You have slain the fierce mountain-lion known as Tarlang's Fang and should now report your success to Calennen.","Tarlang's Fang can be found somewhere in the hills to the south of the Hill of Erech.\
\
Calennen has given you all the information he has about the whereabouts of the fierce mountain-lion. You should now track and slay Tarlang's Fang.","DNT -- will not be seen","The posted note advertises a bounty on a mountain-lion of Blackroot Vale known as Tarlang's Fang, described as 'a mountain-lion of considerable size and power who has a penchant for playing with his meals,' and invites all interested hunters to seek out Calennen in Alagrant for more information on the beast's whereabouts.","Talk to Calennen","Bounty: Tarlang's Fang"}},
[2410]={nameES="Bounty: Thagára",objectivesES={"You have defeated Thagára and collected a trophy as proof","The bounty notice reads:\
\
'A crocodile called Thagára who roams the Lair of the Shadlúgai to the west has been a threat to travellers for too long. We ask that someone put an end to this terror.\
\
'Bring proof to Sálunath in Sul Madásh if you complete this request.'","Bounty: Thagára","Return to Sálunath with proof of Thagára's demise","You defeated Thagára and obtained a trophy as proof. Return to Sálunath in Sul Madásh to collect the bounty.","Defeat Thagára","A bounty notice asks you to defeat a deadly crocodile named Thagára, who roams the Lair of the Shadlúgai in Adagím, and collect a trophy as proof."}},
[2411]={nameES="Recompensa: Thauk, el Vil Huargo",objectivesES={"Derrota a Thauk en Tûm Fuin","El huargo Thauk está en el campamento de trasgos de Tûm Fuin, al norte de Ost Forod.\
\
Has aceptado la comisión de la recompensa por Thauk.","Habla con Basilio Resinas en Ost Forod","Se ha ofrecido una recompensa por Thauk, un huargo cruel aliado con los trasgos que merodean por Tyrn Fornech.","Rowena Guardacotos está en Ost Forod, el antiguo puesto de vigilancia en las colinas de Tyrn Fornech.\
\
Un cartel que ofrece una recompensa por la captura o derrota de un huargo cruel llamado Thauk llamó tu atención. Si deseas solicitar esta recompensa, debes hablar con Rowena Guardacotos.","El cartel anuncia una recompensa por un huargo cruel llamado Thauk, descrito como una 'criatura sedienta de sangre conocida por estar aliada con los trasgos que acechan Tyrn Fornech', e invita a quienes estén interesados a buscar a Rowena Guardacotos en Ost Forod para conocer los detalles y postularse para la comisión.","Thauk derrotado en Tûm Fuin","Recompensa: Thauk, el Vil Huargo","Habla con Rowena Guardacotos en Ost Forod","Rowena Guardacotos está en Ost Forod, el antiguo puesto de vigilancia en las colinas de Tyrn Fornech.\
\
Has derrotado al huargo Thauk y ahora debes informar a Rowena Guardacotos.","Basilio Resinas está en Ost Forod, el antiguo puesto de vigilancia en las colinas de Tyrn Fornech.\
\
Has derrotado a Thauk y ahora debes informar a Basilio Resinas para recibir tu recompensa."}},
[2412]={nameES="Recompensa: La Cúpula de las Estrellas",objectivesES={"The most powerful of Sauron's forces have seized Osgiliath and must be weakened before they can reach Minas Tirith.","Recompensa: La Cúpula de las Estrellas","Derrota a la Espada Negra de Lebennin"}},
[2413]={nameES="Recompensa: El rizo perfecto",objectivesES={"Los jabalíes pueden encontrarse en los campos más septentrionales de Bree.\
\
Sage Semilleno te pidió que cazaras jabalíes para obtener sus colmillos y se los entregaras en el campamento cerca de los lagos en los campos del norte de Bree.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Las misiones de recompensa son repetibles, pero tienen un número limitado de completaciones. Esta misión puede completarse tres veces.</rgb>","Recompensa: El rizo perfecto","Entrega los colmillos a Sage Semilleno","Sage Semilleno te pidió que recolectaras colmillos perfectos de jabalíes en los campos del norte de Bree para ayudarla con los pedidos que debe cumplir."}},
[2414]={nameES="Bounty: The Quays of the Harlond",objectivesES={"Bounty: The Quays of the Harlond","The most powerful of Sauron's forces must be defeated if Gondor is to win the battle.","Derrota al Despojador Proscrito"}},
[2415]={nameES="Bounty: The Ruined City",objectivesES={}},
[2416]={nameES="Bounty: The Silent Street",objectivesES={"Bounty: The Silent Street","The Gloom of Nurn seeks to claim the crown of the King for Gothmog, who has returned to reclaim the throne of Gondor after his long absence.","Derrota a la Languidez de Nurn"}},
[2417]={nameES="Bounty: The Sunken Labyrinth",objectivesES={}},
[2418]={nameES="Bounty: The White Stag",objectivesES={"You should follow the white stag as it flees in eastern Blackroot Vale.\
\
The white stag has fled from your approach, but if you give chase, it is possible you might still catch it.","Pursue and capture the white stag","The hunters of Alagrant have posted a bounty in hopes of capturing a rare white stag that has appeared in the vale.","Dírion can be found in Alagrant in western Blackroot Vale.\
\
You have found a posted bounty for a white stag in Blackroot Vale, and should now speak to Dírion for more information.","Bounty: The White Stag","The posted note advertises a bounty on a particularly elusive white stag, described as 'a powerful and brilliantly white stag whose speed is unmatched by any in the vale,' and invites all interested hunters to seek out Dírion in Alagrant for more information on the stag's last known whereabouts.","The white stag flees at your approach, but you should pursue it","Talk to Dírion","Search for the white stag in Blackroot Vale","DNT -- will not be seen","Dírion can be found in Alagrant in western Blackroot Vale.\
\
You were unable to capture the stag due to its agility, but should report back to Dírion in Alagrant.","Before you can get any closer, the stag gathers its strength and sprints away","The white stag was last seen somewhere in eastern Blackroot Vale.\
\
Dírion offered you some advice on where to track the white stag, and you should now seek it out."}},
[2419]={nameES="Recompensa: Thunash",objectivesES={"Invoca y enfréntate a Thunash","Recompensa: Thunash","Completado","Un aviso de recompensa pide que busques a Thunash, un cruel semiorco del Bosque Salvaje","El aviso de recompensa dice:\
\
'¿Has oído hablar del emisario de Zarquino, que recorre el Bosque Salvaje como si fuera el dueño del lugar? Me opongo a ello: ¡no si podemos hacer algo al respecto!\
\
'Thunash, el semiorco, cree que el Bosque Salvaje le pertenece para arrasarlo y conquistarlo. Se ofrece una recompensa a quien consiga acabar con este vil semiorco.'","Thunash se encuentra en Cotfast, en el Bosque Salvaje.\
\
Deberías invocar a Thunash y enfrentarte a él.","Has derrotado a Thunash y has ayudado a los Pueblos Libres del Bosque Salvaje.","El semiorco se enfrenta a ti","Has derrotado a Thunash"}},
[2420]={nameES="Bounty: Trolls in Parth Daenath",objectivesES={}},
[2421]={nameES="Bounty: Tukûrga",objectivesES={"Bounty: Tukûrga","A bounty notice asks you to defeat a vicious kergrim known as Tukûrga in Tûkurdul, to the north-west near Ashâgir.","The bounty notice reads:\
\
'Tukûrga is a vicious and dangerous kergrim who can be found in Tûkurdul to the north-west of here. This monster must be stopped.\
\
'Neshurga in Ub Nishir will reward you if you slay Tukûrga.'","A bounty notice in Ub Nishir has asked for someone to defeat the kergrim Tukûrga in Tûkurdul to the north-west, near Ashâgir.","Return to Neshurga and inform him of Tukûrga's defeat","Defeat Tukûrga","Defeated Tukûrga","Return to Neshurga in Ub Nishir north of Maurûsh and inform him that you have completed the bounty and defeated Tukûrga."}},
[2422]={nameES="Recompensa: Caparazones de tortuga",objectivesES={"Recompensa: Caparazones de tortuga","Lleva los caparazones a Walt Rosablanca","Las tortugas pueden encontrarse alrededor de los lagos y otros cuerpos de agua en los campos del norte de Bree.\
\
Walt Rosablanca quiere que recolectes caparazones de tortuga y se los entregues detrás de las piedras, cerca de las cascadas donde la garganta se une a los lagos.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Las misiones de recompensa son repetibles, pero tienen un número limitado de completaciones. Esta misión puede completarse tres veces.</rgb>","Walt Rosablanca está recolectando caparazones de tortuga para entregarlos a los herreros de Bree. Los caparazones pueden usarse como buenos moldes para crear escudos."}},
[2423]={nameES="Bounty: Têzdab the Butcher",objectivesES={"A wanted poster for the defeat of one 'Têzdab the Butcher'.","Wanted: Têzdab 'the Butcher'\
\
For the slaying of innocents in An Shêru. Experienced bounty hunters only!\
Last seen in the vicinity of Khanâg Gur, he is ill-tempered and should be approached with caution.","Defeat Têzdab the Butcher","Têzdab the Butcher defeated","Têzdab the Butcher is reported as having been last seen in the vicinity of Khanâg Gur in An Shêru.","Talk to Halshûm in Khanâg Gur","You have defeated Têzdab the Butcher. You should return to Khanâg Gur to collect your reward.","Bounty: Têzdab the Butcher"}},
[2424]={nameES="Bounty: Uzukar",objectivesES={"A bounty notice asks you to defeat Uzukar, a ferocious jackal that has been spotted roaming near Urgudag to the west.","Defeat Uzukar","Return to Neshurga in Ub Nishir north of Maurûsh and inform him that you have completed the bounty and defeated Uzukar.","Return to Neshurga and inform him of Uzukar's defeat","The bounty notice reads:\
\
'A ferocious jackal called Uzukar has been spotted near Urgudag to the west. Traders in the area are in need of someone to get rid of this beast.\
\
'Inform Neshurga in Ub Nishir if you complete this request.'","Defeated Uzukar","A bounty notice in Ub Nishir has asked for someone to defeat a ferocious jackal known as Uzukar who has been spotted near Urgudag to the west.","Bounty: Uzukar"}},
[2425]={nameES="Bounty: Vîz",objectivesES={"Bring the helm to Britric","Vîz can be found camping near a fang-shaped rock in the Fallows, which can be found by following the road south a ways.\
\
You should summon and defeat Vîz, and collect his helm.","<rgb=#FF0000>Completing Wildermore's Recovery will cancel this quest.</rgb>","Bounty: Vîz","Collected the helm of Vîz","Defeat Vîz and collect his helm","Britric is in Forlaw.\
\
You have collected the helm of Vîz, and should now return to Forlaw to collect your bounty.","Vîz has been seen at a fang-shaped rock in the Fallows, and it is believed that his helm will be a valuable part of a collection of bounties."}},
[2426]={nameES="Bounty: War Dispatches",objectivesES={}},
[2427]={nameES="Bounty: Wargs in Arandor",objectivesES={}},
[2428]={nameES="Bounty: Wargs in Rath Dúath",objectivesES={"You reminded the warg packs that threaten folk travelling through Rath Dúath that theirs is not the only strength in the valley.","The bounty notice reads:\
\
'Where once there was a single large warg pack prowling the forests near Rath Dúath, something has changed, and several wargs have broken off to lead their own, smaller packs. These are unafraid to challenge folk on the road, and they can cover a greater distance than before.\
\
'Hunt these packs and teach them we will not run from them. We will fight!'","Warg packs can be found in Rath Dúath.\
\
You should defeat pack leaders and pack wargs.","Completado","Defeated warg packs.","Bounty: Wargs in Rath Dúath","A bounty notice asks you to hunt wargs across Rath Dúath."}},
[2429]={nameES="Bounty: White Mountain Orcs",objectivesES={}},
[2430]={nameES="Bounty: Wicked Daggers",objectivesES={}},
[2431]={nameES="Recompensa: Calaveras de tumulario",objectivesES={"Lleva las calaveras a Edith Rosadulce","Los tumularios pueden encontrarse por todas las Quebradas de los Túmulos del Sur.\
\
La guía, Edith Rosadulce, valora las calaveras de tumulario y te pagará por ellas. Está acampada en el Alto del Hombre Muerto, donde las Quebradas de los Túmulos del Norte se encuentran con las Quebradas de los Túmulos del Sur.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Las misiones de recompensa son repetibles, pero tienen un número limitado de completaciones. Esta misión puede completarse tres veces.</rgb>","Hay una recompensa por las calaveras de los tumularios que vagan por las Quebradas de los Túmulos del Sur.","Recompensa: Calaveras de tumulario"}},
[2432]={nameES="Bounty: Wights in Emyn Duir",objectivesES={"You have defeated many wights in Emyn Duir, and the one who posted the bounty is certain to be pleased.","Se pueden encontrar espectros en Emyn Duir.\
\
Deberías derrotar a los espectros.","Bounty: Wights in Emyn Duir","A bounty notice has asked you to drive the wights out of Emyn Duir.","You defeated wights.","Completado","The bounty notice reads:\
\
'These lands have no shortage of foul creatures, but if you ask me the wight is the worst, bedraggled and disgusting. They are beasts of horror, and I hesitate to call them something so common as pests, but they harass our gravesites and bother our dead. It turns my stomach to think of them!\
\
'If you wish to earn some coin and have the time to spare, I implore you to hunt as many of the vile creatures as you can. I am sick of the things!'"}},
[2433]={nameES="Bounty: Wraiths in Emyn Duir",objectivesES={}},
[2434]={nameES="Bounty: Yambahul",objectivesES={"The bounty notice reads: \
\
'Rangers, we are in need of one of you to defeat Yambahul, a vile Haradrim chieftain. Speak with Anborn if you plan to accept this mission.'","Speak with Anborn","Defeat Yambahul","Defeated Yambahul","A bounty notice asks you to seek out Anborn who has information about Yambahul, a vile Haradrim chieftain.","Anborn can be found in the keep at Bâr Húrin.\
\
You should speak with Anborn.","You ask Anborn about the bounty notice.\
\
'You wish to help our cause? Very well. I do not speak ill of your abilities as a warrior, but do take note, Yambahul is no ordinary foe. He is a high ranking chieftain and commands vast numbers. It will not be an easy fight.'","Yambahul can be found somewhere in Southern Ithilien.\
\
You should defeat Yambahul.","Bounty: Yambahul"}},
[2435]={nameES="Bounty: Újumai the Earth-stirrer",objectivesES={}},
[2436]={nameES="Bovine Breakout",objectivesES={"Gárnoth's Farm was known for the quality of cattle and meat once produced there, but these days there are not many domesticated cows left in the Fallows. Most of those cows are still on the farm, and should not be left to become food for the Orcs.","The Orcs occupying Gárnoth's Farm have managed to keep many cows corralled. They seem to be using them as a local food source instead of relying on shipments from elsewhere.","Free cows in Gárnoth's Farm (0/9)","The cows are free and those that know the paths will be making their way back to Forlaw. Some may wander the plains and will hopefully join the wild herds in the Fallows.","Gárnoth's Farm has a few cows left behind from when the farm was abandoned. Their masters frequently took them to Forlaw's market and would know the paths to get there. If the cows are freed, they should make their way to the city, or may end up wandering the plains, but that would be better than leaving them to an unpleasant fate.","Completado","The Orcs can no longer rely on the local food source, and will once again have to rely on shipments from elsewhere.","The cows left behind at Gárnoth's Farm are grazing in pens throughout the farm.","Bovine Breakout"}},
[2437]={nameES="Bows and Arrows",objectivesES={}},
[2438]={nameES="Arcos para Umbar (Semanal)",objectivesES={"Completa las cuotas diarias para el Gremio de carpinteros de Umbar.","Completado","Los carpinteros proveen a las masas de Umbar Baharbêl, y tú estás haciendo tu parte para ayudar.","Completa las solicitudes del Gremio de carpinteros de Umbar.\
\
Puedes adquirir estas misiones del líder del Gremio de carpinteros de Umbar en la sala del gremio de artesanos de Umbar Baharbêl.","Has completado muchas peticiones de carpinteros de Umbar.","Arcos para Umbar (Semanal)"}},
[2439]={nameES="Bows of Foul Craft",objectivesES={"A camp-fire near Utlac is just the place to burn the Orc-bows you have taken.\
\
Utlac cannot bear to handle the Orc-bows any longer and has asked you to burn them in a nearby camp-fire.","Talk to Utlac","Orc and Uruk-archers can be found throughout the East Wall.\
\
Utlac has asked you to defeat Orcs or Uruks throughout the East Wall and to take their bows so he can destroy them.","Utlac is at the Rohirrim-encampment, waiting to speak with you.","Bows of Foul Craft","Throw the Orc-bows on the camp-fire near Utlac","Utlac is at the Rohirrim-camp in the East Wall.\
\
You have recovered many crude bows from the Orcs that inhabit the East Wall and should bring them to Utlac so he can destroy them.","Bring Orc-bows to Utlac","Utlac says the greatest danger faced by the Rohirrim who have come to the East Wall is the threat posed by Orc-archers lurking among the trees."}},
[2440]={nameES="Brace Yourselves",objectivesES={}},
[2441]={nameES="Bracing for Battle",objectivesES={"Bring the supplies to Léofhelm","In Fastred's absence, Snowbourn must be provisioned and supplied for the coming war.","Piles of logs can be found near felled trees outside the walls, while spears and leather can be gathered within the city.\
\
Léofhelm has asked you to gather the materials needed to supply Snowbourn.","Bracing for Battle","Léofhelm can be found in the Mead Hall of Snowbourn.\
\
You should return to Léofhelm and let him know that you have done as he asked."}},
[2442]={nameES="Bracing for Defeat",objectivesES={"The ruins of the armoury can be found in south-western Osgiliath.\
\
Meldir has asked you to recover hidden stores of weapons from the ruins of the armoury.","Bracing for Defeat","Deliver the weapons to Meldir","Meldir can be found along the south-western walls of Osgiliath.\
\
You have recovered many weapons, and should now deliver them to Meldir.","Determined to bolster the Rangers' defences, Meldir has travelled to the ancient armoury of Osgiliath to seize what remains before it falls into the hands of the Enemy."}},
[2443]={nameES="Braised Boar Belly",objectivesES={"Cúronel has asked you to bring her boar belly meat from healthy boars and to put down diseased boars at her farm, Munadhor Farm in Pinnath Gelin.","Return to Cúronel","You should return to Cúronel with the boar belly pieces that you gathered.\
\
Cúronel is at Munadhor Farm, in central Pinnath Gelin.","Braised Boar Belly","Boar belly is a fatty cut of meat which, when cured with spices and herbs, is added to many popular dishes in Pinnath Gelin."}},
[2444]={nameES="Branching Out",objectivesES={"Barallas wants you to seek out Mossbeard, far to the south-west of the Orc-roadway, in hopes that all of his kind will be reunited.","Talk to Mossbeard","Mossbeard can be found somewhere past Finglas' Mead far to the south-west of the Stonecliff.\
\
Barallas wants you to search for the last Ent that has not rejoined the others at their hideout.","Branching Out"}},
[2445]={nameES="Bravery Beyond Her Years",objectivesES={"Bravery Beyond Her Years","Ellen Fremedon is concerned by her daughter's jaunts into the nearby woods, fearing Dúnburg's enthusiasm for the blade will lead her to trouble.","Ellen Fremedon can be found outside the Mead Hall at Underharrow.\
\
You have rescued Dúnburg and sent her on her way. You should return to Ellen Fremedon.","Talk to Ellen Fremedon","Defended Dúnburg","Dúnburg can be found to the south of Underharrow amidst the trees.\
\
Ellen Fremedon has asked you to find Dúnburg and send her back to Underharrow.","DNT -- Players will not see","Find Dúnburg south of Underharrow"}},
[2446]={nameES="Lecciones de lucha",objectivesES={"Completa 'Artículos de Durabilidad' para Hunward","Lecciones de lucha","Hunward, en el Muelle de los Comerciantes del Bosque Salvaje, ha accedido a forjarte un excelente equipo digno de un Luchador legendario, si le llevas los materiales que necesita.","Hunward estará encantado de instruirte en los aspectos más refinados de la lucha a puño limpio, pero insiste en que necesitarás un equipo mejor si has de liberar todo tu potencial en el arte de golpear.","Hunward se encuentra en el Muelle de los Comerciantes, en el Bosque Salvaje.","Habla con Hunward en el Muelle de los Comerciantes","Completa 'Implementos de Golpeo' para Hunward"}},
[2447]={nameES="Breach in the Darkness: Kamabhosh",objectivesES={"Kamabhosh and his lieutenants can be found in the Cisterns.\
\
You should find and defeat Kamabhosh and his lieutenants.","Defeat Kamabhosh","Breach in the Darkness: Kamabhosh","Defeated Kamabhosh","A raiding party has invaded the Cisterns and it is up to you to defeat the enemy captain Kamabhosh and his lieutenants."}},
[2448]={nameES="Breach in the Darkness: The Back Door",objectivesES={}},
[2449]={nameES="Breach in the Darkness: The Invaders",objectivesES={"Orcs have invaded the Cisterns and it is up to you to defeat the raiding party.","Breach in the Darkness: The Invaders","Orcs can be found throughout the Cisterns.\
\
You should defeat Orcs in the Cisterns."}},
[2450]={nameES="Breach in the Darkness: The Withered Foe",objectivesES={"Breach in the Darkness: The Withered Foe","The Withered Tree can be found in the Cisterns.\
\
You should try and talk some sense into members of the Withered Tree.","The Withered Tree has taken hold of the Cisterns and it is up to you to try and talk some sense into the Gondorians who have lost their way."}},
[2451]={nameES="Breach in the Darkness: Treachery",objectivesES={"The Withered Tree can be found in the Cisterns.\
\
You should find and destroy documents belonging to the Withered Tree.","The Withered Tree has taken hold of the Cisterns and it is up to you to destroy their lies.","Breach in the Darkness: Treachery"}},
[2452]={nameES="Breaching the Hornburg",objectivesES={"Do not allow the door to the Hornburg to be destroyed","The door to the Hornburg has been destroyed","You have succeeded in defending the door to the Hornburg","A gate-house between the Wall and the Hornburg has been converted into a makeshift ward used to treat wounded soldiers. The final doorway leading to the Hornburg has been sealed, but the enemy seeks to breech the opening while slaughtering the wounded in the gatehouse along the way. This rearmost door must be defended at all costs.","Breaching the Hornburg","The enemy plans to breach the Hornburg through a gate-house being used as a makeshift infirmary for the wounded. The wounded men and the supplies of bandages and medicines are in danger, but the door to the Hornburg must be protected at all costs. The wounded will cry out when they begin to succumb to injuries, but you may instruct them in healing.\
\
Merit Rating\
\
This quest starts with <rgb=#FFFF00>Full</rgb> Merit Rating.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Major Merit Loss:</rgb>\
- Door takes structural damage\
- Wounded Rohirrim is defeated\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Moderate Merit Loss:</rgb>\
- Crate of bandages and supplies destroyed"}},
[2453]={nameES="Breaching the Hornburg",objectivesES={"Do not allow the door to the Hornburg to be destroyed","The door to the Hornburg has been destroyed","The enemy plans to breach the Hornburg through a gate-house being used as a makeshift infirmary for the wounded. The wounded men and the supplies of bandages and medicines are in danger, but the door to the Hornburg must be protected at all costs. Heal the men if you are able, and be warned that the goblins mean to destroy the banners upon the wall during their assault.\
\
Merit Rating\
\
This quest starts with <rgb=#FFFF00>Full</rgb> Merit Rating.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Major Merit Loss:</rgb>\
* Door takes structural damage\
* Wounded Rohirrim is defeated\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Moderate Merit Loss:</rgb>\
* Crate of bandages and healing supplies destroyed","You have succeeded in defending the door to the Hornburg","Breaching the Hornburg","The enemy plans to breach the Hornburg through a gate-house being used as a makeshift infirmary for the wounded. The wounded men and the supplies of bandages and medicines are in danger, but the door to the Hornburg must be protected at all costs."}},
[2454]={nameES="Forzar la Puerta del Nigromante",objectivesES={"<rgb=#00FF00>El Cuarto Patio ha sido reclamado</rgb>","Reclama el Primer Patio","Reclama la Puerta del Nigromante","<rgb=#00FF00>La Puerta del Nigromante ha caído. El corazón de Dol Guldur está abierto para el asalto</rgb>","Reclama el Tercer Patio","Reclama el Segundo Patio","El Primer Patio es el primer paso en el camino para tomar la Puerta del Nigromante.","<rgb=#00FF00>El Segundo Patio ha sido reclamado</rgb>","Reclama el Cuarto Patio","Reclama la Ascensión del Hechicero","Forzar la Puerta del Nigromante","El Segundo Patio proporciona un punto de vista sobre toda la Tierra Media debajo. Es crucial tomarlo para que los refuerzos puedan acercarse con seguridad.","<rgb=#00FF00>La Ascensión del Hechicero ha sido reclamada</rgb>","El patio del Tercer Patio protege las entradas a varias cámaras interiores de la fortaleza, la mayoría de los alojamientos de las legiones enemigas.","<rgb=#00FF00>El Primer Patio ha sido reclamado</rgb>","La Puerta del Nigromante marca la entrada al corazón de las fortificaciones exteriores de Dol Guldur. Para asaltar la fortaleza, la puerta debe caer","El Cuarto Patio es un conjunto aparentemente improvisado de tiendas y escombros, pero varios líderes del Enemigo acampan allí para mantenerse cerca de sus tropas.","<rgb=#00FF00>El Tercer Patio ha sido reclamado</rgb>","La Puerta del Nigromante guarda el corazón de las defensas de Dol Guldur. Debe caer para poder sitiar la verdadera fortaleza.","La Ascensión del Hechicero es la última defensa de la Puerta del Nigromante y está bien fortificada en una pendiente empinada."}},
[2455]={nameES="Asalto a la Puerta del Nigromante: Incursión",objectivesES={"Asalto a la Puerta del Nigromante: Incursión","Completa 'Asalto a la Puerta del Nigromante' con un grupo de incursión","La Puerta del Nigromante marca la entrada al corazón de las fortificaciones exteriores de Dol Guldur. Para asaltar la fortaleza, la puerta debe caer"}},
[2456]={nameES="Rompe las flechas, quema los arcos",objectivesES={"Habla con Maedhril en Sírlond","Al poco tiempo, una columna de humo se eleva hacia el cielo; los arcos orcos ya no existen","Maedhril te pidió que derrotes a los exploradores de Caranost y recuperes sus arcos.","La torre que domina el puente de Caranost tiene una gran hoguera en la que Maedhril quería que quemaras los arcos orcos.","Maedhril está en Sírlond, al este de Caranost propiamente dicho.","Quema los arcos orcos en la hoguera en lo alto de la torre que domina el puente de Caranost","Maedhril tiene un plan para lidiar con los arqueros orcos, y requiere tanto tu ayuda como un fuego muy grande.","Rompe las flechas, quema los arcos"}},
[2457]={nameES="Break the Influence",objectivesES={"Among the buildings in Lhan Gogledh, Trehéarn Brenin has begun to accept offers from unnatural forces in the area.","Break the Influence","You should seek out and destroy any banners that you find in the area."}},
[2458]={nameES="Break the Sentries",objectivesES={"Talk to Lhucu at her hut","Lhucu is at her hut, south of Lhan Gogledh.\
\
You should inform Lhucu that the sentries have been scattered.","Break the Sentries","Among the buildings in Lhan Gogledh, patrolling sentries watch for enemies attempting to enter the encampment.","Lhan Gogledh lies along the path north of Lhucu's hut.\
\
Lhucu has asked you to seek out and defeat the sentries that patrol the outskirts of Lhan Gogledh."}},
[2459]={nameES="Desayuno en las ruinas",objectivesES={"Alfredo Pradoblanco ha desaparecido, pero entre sus cosas encuentras un diario.","Alfredo Pradoblanco ha desaparecido de su puesto de vigilancia en Men Erain, pero el diario que se encuentra entre sus pertenencias podría contener alguna pista sobre su paradero.\
\
Has encontrado el puesto de vigilancia de Alfredo Pradoblanco, pero no hay rastro del propio Pradoblanco. Su diario podría contener alguna pista sobre su destino.","Debido a su disminución numérica, los Montaraces del Norte deben contratar ocasionalmente a hombres de Ost Forod para vigilar sus antiguas tumbas.","Alfredo Pradoblanco se encuentra en Men Erain, al sur de Tinnudir, al otro lado del lago. Siguiendo el camino costero hacia el noreste, hacia Men Erain, el campamento de Pradoblanco se encuentra en la ladera, subiendo unos escalones de piedra tallada.\
\
El montaraz Helechír te ha pedido que le lleves provisiones a un hombre llamado Alfredo Pradoblanco en Men Erain.","Lleva los suministros y el diario de vuelta a Helechír.","Helechír se encuentra en una isla situada al suroeste de Men Erain.\
\
Has encontrado el diario de un montaraz que se encontraba en peregrinación hacia las tierras ancestrales de su familia, cerca de Annúminas. Según su diario, sospechaba que lo estaban siguiendo. Helechír estará muy interesado en saberlo.","Lleva los suministros a Alfredo Pradoblanco","Busca el diario en el campamento de Alfredo Pradoblanco","Desayuno en las ruinas","Diario recuperado en el campo de Alfredo Pradoblanco"}},
[2460]={nameES="Rompiendo alianzas",objectivesES={"Rompiendo alianzas","Entra en la cueva","Has encontrado la cueva","La cueva de la reunión se encuentra en el campamento orco de Cirith Nûr, al noroeste del Viejo Fuerte del Camino Verde.\
\
Andreg te ha encargado que descubras la cueva donde los bandidos y los Orcos preparan sus planes y que mates a sus líderes.","Habla con Andreg en el Viejo Fuerte del Camino Verde","Andreg se encuentra en el Viejo Fuerte del Camino Verde, al sureste de Cirith Nûr.\
\
Informa a Andreg de tu éxito tan pronto como puedas.","Has encontrado la cueva. Ahora solo queda entrar, dispersar a los bandidos y Orcos, y derrotar a sus líderes.","Los Montaraces, que vigilan los movimientos de los enemigos del norte y del sur, están preocupados por la aparición de un enemigo al que han luchado durante mucho tiempo en el norte.","Localiza la cueva"}},
[2461]={nameES="Quebrando su espíritu",objectivesES={"Yûl puede encontrarse en el piso más alto de Hurmulkezer en la zona sureste de las Profundidades Llameantes, al sur del Patio de Durin.\
\
Debes encontrar y derrotar a Yûl.","Has derrotado a Yûl, el líder de las fuerzas Ghâsh-hai en Hurmulkezer.\
\
Aunque aún quedan muchos orcos, fracasarán sin un líder.","Los Ghâsh-hai están liderados por el despiadado comandante orco Yûl, y su derrota supondría un duro golpe para la organización de la principal amenaza enemiga en las Profundidades Llameantes.\
\
Debes buscar a Yûl y derrotarlo; tal golpe quebraría el espíritu de los orcos.","Los Ghâsh-hai están liderados por el despiadado comandante orco Yûl, y su derrota supondría un duro golpe para la organización de la principal amenaza enemiga en las Profundidades Llameantes.","Yûl derotado","Completado","Derrota a Yûl","Quebrando su espíritu"}},
[2462]={nameES="Breaking Up the Gang",objectivesES={"Lake-town Smugglers and knife-throwers can be found inside the Smugglers' hideout in Lake-town.\
\
You should defeat Lake-town Smugglers and knife-throwers.","Breaking Up the Gang","Talk to Dagrun","The Lake-town Smugglers have been disrupting Dale for far too long and need to be pushed out. Defeat any smugglers found within their hideout.","Dagrun can be found in the Council of Wares Headquarters.\
\
You should talk to Dagrun."}},
[2463]={nameES="Breaking the Back of the Boar",objectivesES={"Defeat Pakon, the Maldorr Orc-chieftain","The entrance to the Boar-tribe lair is south of Beaconwatch, not far from the Mering-Stream.\
\
Cúthing wants you to travel to the Boar-tribe lair and defeat the chieftain.","You have arrived at the entrance of the Boar-tribe Orc-lair","Travel to the Boar-tribe Orc-lair","The Boar-tribe chieftain is somewhere within their lair.\
\
If you encounter the chieftain of the Boar-tribe, defeat him.","Breaking the Back of the Boar","Cúthing's plan calls for a single person to sneak into the Boar-tribe Orc-lair and defeat their chieftain.","Cúthing is standing near Meregyth, outside the Mead Hall of Beaconwatch.\
\
You should return to Beaconwatch and tell Cúthing about your victory.","Talk to Cúthing"}},
[2464]={nameES="Breaking the Chains",objectivesES={"The prison fortress of Naerband has been rounding up anyone and everyone in an effort to enforce a twisted law over the lands.","Orodir is located next to Naerband.\
\
You should destroy shackles and defeat foes in Orodir.","You have successfully defeated many foes outside the gates of Naerband and destroyed the shackles used to bind their prisoners.","Defeated foes and destroyed shackles.","Breaking the Chains","Completado"}},
[2465]={nameES="Breaking the Cycle",objectivesES={"Breaking the Cycle","Dolvir has asked you to convince war-weary Corsairs to seek him out for help.\
\
You can find weary Corsairs in Abadec's Watch in the south-west corner of Belfalas.","Talk to Dolvir outside Abadec's Watch","Not all of the Corsairs in Abadec's Watch are willing to continue fighting.","You have successfully convinced many weary Corsairs to leave Abadec's Watch.\
\
Dolvir waits for you amongst the trees to the north of the camp. You should talk to him."}},
[2466]={nameES="Breaking the Front",objectivesES={}},
[2467]={nameES="Rompiendo las Líneas del Frente",objectivesES={"El capataz trasgo Natkam patrulla los campamentos de trasgos en las afueras de la hueste orca en Dol Dínen.\
\
Debes cortar el hilo que mantiene unidos a los trasgos: derrota a Natkam, quien los lidera.","El número de trasgos es grande, y están sujetos a su deber por un capataz despiadado. El vínculo es frágil, fundado en el miedo.\
\
Debes buscar los campamentos de trasgos en las afueras de Dol Dínen y encontrar a este capataz trasgo. Si muere, la voluntad de los trasgos podría quebrarse.","Has derrotado a Natkam, el líder de los trasgos. Sus fuerzas se dispersarán sin su brutal voluntad imponiéndose sobre ellos.","Has derrotado a Natkam","Completado","Una gran hueste de orcos atravesó Ram Dúath, expulsando a los hombres de las Quebradas del Norte de sus granjas. Esteldín, hogar de los pocos Dúnedain que quedan en el norte, se salvó de ser descubierta. Desde allí, los Montaraces comienzan a planear su contraofensiva contra la marea negra de Angmar.","Rompiendo las Líneas del Frente","Derrota a Natkam"}},
[2468]={nameES="Breaking the Ice",objectivesES={"Completed Breaking the Ice","Talk to Gwilum at Barnavon or Melvun at the Barnavon Mine","Assist Bervun at the Barnavon Mine","Assist Cada at the Barnavon Mine","Assist Melvun at the Barnavon Mine","Word has come to Barnavon of troubles at the mine.","The Barnavon Mine lies far to the east of Barnavon-town, beyond the tower of Hen Turrau.\
\
Gwilum has asked you to lend aid to the miners at the Barnavon Mine so that Madin Brenin will not punish the Boar-clan for the disruption of ore production.","Melvun is at the Barnavon Mine, east of Barnavon. Gwilum is at Barnavon, west of the Barnavon Mine.\
\
You should speak with either Melvun or Gwilum regarding your successes at the Barnavon Mine.","Assist Argel at the Barnavon Mine","Breaking the Ice"}},
[2469]={nameES="Breaking the News",objectivesES={"Breaking the News","Faltharan is located at the steps to Tol Ciryarani.\
\
You should speak with Faltharan.","Talk to Faltharan","Faltharan looks to you, and lets loose a relieved sigh.\
\
'Very good. It pains me to know that my father is still missing, but I will try to carry on his legacy as best I can. The bloodline of Sirgon shall endure.\
\
'We have tough days ahead of us, but no matter what, Pelargir will stand as a testament to Gondor's defiance in the face of war.'","DNT Not Used","Now that Faltharan's family is safe from the Corsairs, you have been asked personally to deliver the good news."}},
[2470]={nameES="Breaking the Oath-taker's Horn",objectivesES={"Aid Spakorth in learning the fates of his brethren in the Oath-taker's Horn","Aid Gimli in freeing the Stout-axes who refuse to follow King Greytooth","At the command of King Greytooth, the Stout-axes have taken a new name: the Firehorns. In a mad fervour, they now make ready to set out in search of the lost Dwarf-ring, Manthríf.","Talk to Gimli in the Oath-taker's Horn","Aid Gimli in hindering the Firehorn smiths","Gimli might be found in the heights of the Oath-taker's Horn.\
\
You have done much to hinder the Stout-axes loyal to King Greytooth and aid those who have defied him. You should now seek Gimli in the Oath-taker's Horn.","Gimli and Spakorth can be found along the causeway outside the Oath-taker's Horn in Dor Amarth.\
\
Gimli and Spakorth have asked you to aid them in hindering the Firehorns in their quest to recover the lost Dwarf-ring, Manthríf.","Breaking the Oath-taker's Horn"}},
[2471]={nameES="Breaking the Trap",objectivesES={"Talk to Tordoron to the north of Cirith Negen","The Khundolar have devised a trap for the Host of the West and have laid cruel bear-traps along the road through Cirith Negen.","Bear-traps can be found along the road through Cirith Negen in north-eastern North Ithilien.\
\
Anborn has asked you to investigate reports that the path through Cirith Negen is being readied for a Khundolar ambush. You should disarm traps and defeat any foes you encounter.","Breaking the Trap","Tordoron can be found to the north of Cirith Negen.\
\
You have disarmed the traps and fought off Khundolar trapping the pass of Cirith Negen. You should now seek out Tordoron beyond the pass."}},
[2472]={nameES="Breaking the White Hand",objectivesES={}},
[2473]={nameES="Breath of the Dragon",objectivesES={"Thurbald is hiding to the south of Uvel-cadlus.\
\
You should return to Thurbald with news of your success.","A company of Dragon-clan warriors is encamped at the northern end of the Gravenwood, marching down from Enedwaith.","Crates of black fire can be found within Uvel-cadlus.\
\
Thurbald has asked you to enter Uvel-cadlus and destroy the Draig-lûth's supply of black fire.","Breath of the Dragon","Talk to Thurbald"}},
[2474]={nameES="Tiempo para un respiro",objectivesES={"El refugio enano de Gabilshathûr está en grave peligro. Un ejército de Orcos no está lejos, y grupos de incursión orcos están hostigando el puesto.","Hay Orcos Blogmal y Krahjarn por todo el este de Malenhad, al norte de Gabilshathûr.\
\
Gisur te ha pedido que derrotes a muchos Orcos para intentar dar algo de respiro a los enanos de Gabilshathûr.","El capitán de la guardia Gisur está en Gabilshathûr, al sur de Duvuinen.\
\
Has derrotado a un gran número de Orcos y deberías regresar con Gisur para informarle de tu éxito.","Tiempo para un respiro"}},
