[2479]={nameES="Bree IV",objectivesES={}},
[2480]={nameES="Lanza de Bree — Introducción",objectivesES={"Los carpinteros de Bree se enorgullecen de la calidad de su trabajo","Lleva la lanza de Bree a Marga Maderín","Recoge una lanza de Bree","Lanza de Bree — Introducción","Marga Maderín está en el Pabellón de Caza de Bree, al oeste de la Puerta Sur.\
\
Maggie Maderín te ha pedido que le lleves una lanza de Bree para ayudar a los carpinteros de Bree a armar a los Vigilantes."}},
[2481]={nameES="De Bree a Puente de Caballetes",objectivesES={"De Bree a Puente de Caballetes","La ciudad de Puente de Caballetes está amenazada por el Enemigo y necesita ayuda desde lejos.","Puente de Caballetes se encuentra al norte, a lo largo de la ruta llamada Camino Verde. \
\
Habla con el guardia Otley en Puente de Caballetes y averigua cómo puedes ayudar en la defensa de la ciudad."}},
[2482]={nameES="Breeding Grounds",objectivesES={"Drake eggs litter the landscape of the Withered Heath.","You should destroy any drake eggs that you find on the Withered Heath.","Destroyed many drake eggs.","You have successfully destroyed many drake eggs on the Withered Heath. The Zhélruka will surely be thankful of your efforts.","Completado","Drake eggs litter the landscape of the Withered Heath. Destroying the eggs within these ancient drake breeding grounds should lessen the impact of dragonkind in the Grey Mountains.","Breeding Grounds"}},
[2483]={nameES="Bregmor's Legacy",objectivesES={"Talk to Fotri","Fotri will lead you to the dragon Bregmor's corpse.","You should speak with Fotri, who can be found in Forochel.","Bregmor's Legacy"}},
[2484]={nameES="Brenin of the Draig-lûth",objectivesES={"Defeated Heilun Brenin","Talk to Gronu at his camp","Heilun Brenin and his guards can be found at the centre of Gwâl Draig, east of Gronu's camp.\
\
Gronu asked you to defeat Heilun Brenin and his personal guards.","Defeat Heilun Brenin","Brenin of the Draig-lûth","Gronu's camp lies to the west of Gwâl Draig, beneath Harndirion.\
\
You should seek out the Gronu and inform him that Heilun Brenin and his men have been defeated.","Within Gwâl Draig, there must be a leader driving his people to perform such cruel acts upon the clans of the Algraig."}},
[2485]={nameES="Bridge Guards",objectivesES={}},
[2486]={nameES="Bandidos y semiorcos",objectivesES={"Los Vigilantes Hojafrágil y Robledales se encuentran ocultos al este del extremo norte de las ruinas.\
\
Has llevado justicia a los miserables en las ruinas de la Atalaya Sur y ahora debes regresar con el Vigilante Hojafrágil.","Semiorcos y bandidos pueden encontrarse en las ruinas de Andrath.\
\
El Vigilante Hojafrágil está enfurecido por las acciones de los bandidos y semiorcos que ocupan las ruinas de la Atalaya Sur y quiere que asestes un golpe decisivo contra ellos.","Las preocupaciones del Vigilante Hojafrágil sobre los bandidos en la Atalaya Sur se ven confirmadas por la gran cantidad de enemigos que pululan por las ruinas. Te ha pedido que contraataques, debilitando sus fuerzas y dando a los Vigilantes de Bree una oportunidad justa para proteger el campo.","Bandidos y semiorcos","Habla con el Vigilante Hojafrágil"}},
[2487]={nameES="Brigands at Hata Kebir",objectivesES={}},
[2488]={nameES="Brigands in the Bolt-holes",objectivesES={"Brigands in the Bolt-holes","Brigands are hiding out in the Bolt-holes.","As you approach the Bolt-holes, you recall a conversation you overheard on the road...\
\
--\
\
'Why 'The Bolt-holes?'' This from a younger woman in hand-me-down armour and threadbare boots.\
\
Her travelling companion, whose grey cloak obscured her appearance, worked some jerky in the corner of her mouth before answering. 'If the guard are after you, you bolt into a hole. You know, to hide. So if you commit a crime in Ethring or Barad Rill, 'The Bolt-holes' are where you go when you need to hide.'\
\
'I suppose…'\
\
'You don't like the name?'\
\
'I think it sounds silly. Out east I heard there's a group of bandits making camp in a place called 'Thama Aklam'. That sounds so much more impressive.'\
\
Grey Cloak sighed. 'It only sounds more impressive because the name isn't in Westron. Everyone who knows only one tongue thinks words from other languages to be dramatic and special just because they sound different. 'Thama Aklam' likely means something boring like 'The Big Camp.'\
\
'As if you know more than one language,' Threadbare Boots scoffed.\
\
'I do,' Grey Cloak said. 'For example, Nustatyë ve linquë tauramundo.'\
\
'What does that mean?'\
\
'It means, 'Your beauty outmatches the stars themselves' in Quenya.'\
\
'Oh,' Threadbare Boots said, blushing. 'I think you are beautiful too.'\
\
--\
\
Which is all to say, you may want to defeat some brigands in The Bolt-holes.","You have defeated many brigands in the Bolt-holes, making it safer for all who travel between Dor-en-Ernil and Ringló Vale.","Completado","Discover the Bolt-holes","Brigands are hiding out in the Bolt-holes.\
\
Defeat brigands.","You have defeated many brigands in the Bolt-holes."}},
[2489]={nameES="Brigands in the Wild",objectivesES={"Talk to Reeve Fríthild","Talk to Reeve Fríthild at her camp","Talk to the Reeve of Stoke","Use the camp-fire to summon Reeve Fríthild and her companions","<rgb=#FF0000>Reeve Fríthild has been defeated</rgb>","The Council of Stoke determined that Reeve Fríthild should take to the field and lead her people against their aggressors, but now it must choose what front to focus upon.","Reeve Fríthild is in the Mead Hall of Stoke.\
\
You should bring Captain Grimmar's recommendation to Reeve Fríthild.","<rgb=#FF0000>Reeve Fríthild must survive</rgb>","Brigands in the Wild","Reeve Fríthild is at her encampment to the south of Stoke.\
\
You should speak with Reeve Fríthild regarding the battle.","You have successfully defended Reeve Fríthild","Reeve Fríthild is at her encampment to the south of Stoke, just off the road on the other side of the bridge on the road to Kingstead.\
\
Reeve Fríthild asked you to meet her at her encampment.","DNT -- Player should never see","The Reeve of Stoke is in the Mead Hall.\
\
The Reeve instructed you to meet in Stoke to plan for the next attack."}},
[2490]={nameES="Futuros prometedores, vías oscuras",objectivesES={"Futuros prometedores, vías oscuras","Las vías acaban en un pasadizo sin salida","El túnel se encuentra justo al oeste del campamento de Gufi, y se puede llegar a él siguiendo las vías que conducen directamente hasta allí.\
\
Gufi te ha pedido que explores el túnel hacia el que se adentran las vías.","El pasadizo está intacto, pero notas que en este túnel en concreto se respira un aire de inquietud","Gufi confía en que los enanos podrán recuperar Moria rápidamente. Está deseando explorar posibles yacimientos mineros.","En los túneles de las Vetas del Cuerno de Plata, cerca de los pasadizos sin salida, hay carteles.\
\
Deberías colocar los carteles donde las vías conducen a pasadizos sin salida.","Gufi se encuentra en el campamento central de las Vetas del Cuerno de Plata.\
\
Deberías volver a ver a Gufi con los resultados de tu reconocimiento.","Vuelve con Gufi"}},
[2491]={nameES="Azufre y chispas",objectivesES={"Azufre y chispas","Dado que Lobelia Sacovilla-Bolsón pagó para adquirir los ingredientes para sus fuegos artificiales, Hyacinth Tuk te ha reclutado para que la ayudes a reunirlos.","Hyacinth Tuk está en Alforzaburgo, cerca de los Grandes Smials.\
\
Hyacinth Tuk te envió a Ojo de Aguja para conseguir azufre y limaduras de hierro del comerciante enano Onar. Onar hizo un trato rápido y justo y te ha enviado de vuelta con sus paquetes.","Lobelia Sacovilla-Bolsón está en su casa de Bolsón Cerrado, en Hobbiton.\
\
Con tu ayuda, Hyacinth Tuk ya tiene todo lo que necesita para empezar a preparar los fuegos artificiales de Lobelia Sacovilla-Bolsón. Te ha pedido que vuelvas con Lobelia para informarle de que sus fuegos artificiales estarán listos en tres meses.","Lleva azufre y limaduras de hierro a Hyacinth Tuk","El comerciante enano Onar está en la aldea de Ojo de Aguja, en la esquina noroeste del Pantano de los Juncos.\
\
A Hyacinth solo le falta el azufre y las limaduras de hierro para empezar a preparar los fuegos artificiales de Lobelia Sacovilla-Bolsón. Te ha sugerido que podrías conseguirlos de Onar, un comerciante enano."}},
[2492]={nameES="Bring Down the Siege Ladders",objectivesES={"Do not allow the catapult to be destroyed","The enemy has constructed heavy siege ladders that are able to be attached securely to the wall. Once the ladders are attached, Goblin Bombers and Orc Berserkers will be able to quickly scale the wall and mount a massive assault. Destroying the hooks will be essential to detaching the menacing ladders. The enemy has also sent a group of Trolls to assault the tower from behind, which pose a danger to the catapult, the ammo caches, and the tower guards.\
\
Merit Rating\
\
This quest starts with <rgb=#FFFF00>Full</rgb> Merit Rating.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Major Merit Loss</rgb>\
* An enemy powder keg detonates\
* A catapult guard is defeated\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Minor Merit Loss</rgb>\
* An enemy powder keg is ignited\
* A catapult ammo cache is destroyed\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Minor Merit Gain</rgb>\
* An enemy powder keg is diffused","Saruman's army has constructed a large ladder with the ability to latch itself to the wall, making it difficult to detach. Destroy the hooks on the ladders and render them useless, and defeat the war trolls as they ascend to launch their assault.","Bring Down the Siege Ladders"}},
[2493]={nameES="Bring Them to Rest",objectivesES={"Talk to Lhudd at the Hall of Sanctuary","Present the amulet to the mournful shade","Lhudd is at the Hall of Sanctuary, south-east of the barrows.\
\
You should return to Lhudd and explain the happenings outside of the barrows.","Present the amulet to the sorrowful shade","Bring Them to Rest","The sorrowful and mournful shades can be found to the north-west of the Hall of Sanctuary, near the entrances of several barrows on the ridge above.\
\
Lhudd has asked you to present the shades with the broken amulet that you recovered and observe what unfolds.","Throughout the Lich Bluffs, the despondant shades of ancient Algraig clansmen watch over ancient barrows. Perhaps the amulet that you recovered may begin to unravel the mystery of the Oathbreakers that plague the land."}},
[2494]={nameES="Bring Word",objectivesES={}},
[2495]={nameES="Bringer of Ill News",objectivesES={}},
[2496]={nameES="Bringing Beasts to Bear",objectivesES={"Bringing Beasts to Bear","Place the Thistledown haunches on the flat stone in the Isendeep","The Free People control the mine, there is no reason to bring the beasts to bear.","Free People must not control the Mine","Angmar once again holds the Isendeep Mine and Sergeant-at-Arms Thorfinn believes that the time has come to purge them from the depths to take the mine back for the Free People. He suggests a drastic measure to do so in an effort to defeat the foe.","The haunches are placed, the drakes are sure to come. You should hide.","Search the areas south of Tol Ascarnen or west along the plains, south of Dâr-gazag for the Thistledown Grazers. Collect some of their haunches and bring them to the slab within the depths of the Isendeep.\
\
Sergeant-at-Arms Thorfinn believes that the drakes can be used against the Orcs of Angmar and wishes to use them as a diversion while you attack the Tyrant."}},
[2497]={nameES="Bringing Comfort",objectivesES={}},
[2498]={nameES="Bringing Down the Mountain",objectivesES={"Crashing rocks clog the tunnel","Blow up the south-western tunnel","The tunnel is blocked!","The black powder did a fine job of blocking the south-western tunnel. You should move on to the western tunnel and blow that one up as well.\
\
The western tunnel is in the Krauzhaf cave in Pinnath Gelin.","You have battled your way through Krauzhaf and blown up the three tunnels that the Ronkrúm goblins were using to crawl out of the mountain.\
\
Igerna is waiting to speak with you outside the Krauzhaf cave, in Pinnath Gelin.","With both the western and south-western tunnels blocked, you have but one left.\
\
You should blow up the north-western tunnel in the Krauzhaf cave in Pinnath Gelin.","Bringing Down the Mountain","Crashing rocks choke the tunnel","Speak to Igerna outside the cave","Left unchecked, the Ronkrúm goblin horde will continue to crawl out from the depths of the mountain, onto the rolling green hills of Pinnath Gelin.","Blow up the western tunnel","With a hefty supply of dangerously explosive barrels of black powder, you are ready to seal off some of the goblins' tunnels.\
\
You should start with the south-western tunnel, in the cave in Pinnath Gelin.","Blow up the north-western tunnel","Igerna has asked you to gather barrels of the goblins' black powder.\
\
Barrels can be found in the camp outside, as well as inside, the cave at Krauzhaf, in Pinnath Gelin."}},
[2499]={nameES="Bringing Down the Overseers",objectivesES={}},
[2500]={nameES="Bringing Hope to the Hopeless",objectivesES={"The escaped prisoner is at the Ox-clan merchant camp in Nan Curunír.\
\
Mabon has asked you to take him to meet the prisoner who escaped from Orthanc to learn if he knows whether his father, Andras, yet lives.","You found Mabon, son of the merchant Andras whom you aided in the Starkmoor, with Gwin the hunter in Galtrev.","Bringing Hope to the Hopeless","Talk to Mabon","Talk to Andras","Mabon is at the Ox-clan camp outside of Isengard in Nan Curunír.\
\
You should speak with Mabon at once."}},
[2501]={nameES="Llevando Calor",objectivesES={"Canaddal está apostado al comienzo del sendero que desciende desde el Páramo Alto hacia las Gargantas del Bruinen.\
\
Debes entregarle las pieles de oso que recolectaste.","El explorador elfo Canaddal está encargado de equipar y aprovisionar a un grupo de visitantes que se prepara para partir de Rivendel.","Se pueden encontrar osos a lo largo del Páramo Alto, en el Bosque de los Trolls.\
\
Canaddal te ha pedido que caces osos para obtener sus pieles.","Entrega las pieles de oso a Canaddal","Llevando Calor"}},
[2502]={nameES="Broken Laws",objectivesES={}},
[2503]={nameES="Broken Mirror",objectivesES={"Find the mirror trap lever","You have successfully repaired the broken mirror trap. Every mirror trap in Máttugard is now in working order. Master Smith, Grámi Hornhelm, is sure to be pleased.","The mirror trap is working again!","Parts for the mirror trap can be found scattered throughout Shalakibal.\
\
You should search for parts to fix the broken mirror trap.","Find the small mirror shard","The mirror trap is partially working!","The broken mirror trap can be found at Shalakibal, in eastern Máttugard.\
\
You should attempt to repair the broken mirror trap.","Found the mirror trap lever","Master smith, Grámi Hornhelm, wants all of Máttugard's mirror traps in working order.","Examine the broken mirror trap","Broken Mirror","Found the small mirror shard","Found the mirror trap gear","The broken mirror trap can be found at Shalakibal, in eastern Máttugard.\
\
You should find and assess the broken mirror trap.","The trap seems to be missing four different parts","Repaired the broken mirror trap.","Continue repairing the broken mirror trap","Repair the broken mirror trap","Find the large mirror shard","Find the mirror trap gear","Completado","Found the large mirror shard"}},
[2504]={nameES="Juramentos rotos",objectivesES={"Prestadír está en la Posada Embrujada, al este de Echad Mothelen.\
\
Mothelen te ha sugerido que hables con Prestadír para saber más sobre las sombras de los Troncosombríos.","La aparición de las sombras en Burgûl-stazg perturbó al elfo Mothelen, presagiando un mal mucho mayor.","Habla con Prestadír en la Posada Embrujada","Juramentos rotos"}},
