[2567]={nameES="Burning the Eye",objectivesES={}},
[2568]={nameES="Burning the Lawless",objectivesES={}},
[2569]={nameES="Burning the Supplies",objectivesES={}},
[2570]={nameES="Burrowers in the Barrels",objectivesES={"You hear the calm, familiar slosh of ale within these barrels...","Barrel-racks can be found throughout the Hall Under the Mountain.\
\
Snállar has asked you to knock on various barrels of ale to try to expose the ale-thieves in Erebor.","After discovering several suspiciously empty barrels of ale, Snállar hopes to uncover the source of the theft.","Talk to Snállar","With a sudden crash, an ale-soaked cave-claw breaks out of one of the barrels!","Snállar can be found in the Hall Under the Mountain.\
\
You have driven off several ale-soaked cave-claws in the Hall Under the Mountain and should now return to Snállar.","Burrowers in the Barrels"}},
[2571]={nameES="Los Negocios Antes que la Venganza",objectivesES={"Recoge escamas de los sierpes de grieta","Los Negocios Antes que la Venganza","Las cavernas de los sierpes están al sureste de la morada de Thorgest.\
\
Las escamas de los gusanos de grieta parecen ideales para fabricar armaduras resistentes para los Elfos de Rivendel.","Las escamas de los sierpes de grieta parecen ideales para fabricar armaduras resistentes para los Elfos de Rivendel.","Lleva las escamas de sierpe de grieta a Thorgest"}},
[2572]={nameES="Bustle in the Blue Theatre",objectivesES={"Travel to the Blue Theatre in the Fourth Circle","Bustle in the Blue Theatre","Talk to Fróki in the Blue Theatre","Talk to someone from the Cloudyheads inside the Blue Theatre","Fróki can be found inside the Blue Theatre at the southern end of the Fourth Circle.\
\
Fróki has asked you to help The Cloudyheads prepare for their performance in the Blue Theatre.","Polla Stoutley and the Cloudyheads can be found inside the Blue Theatre to the far right of the entrance in an alcove with a fire-place.\
\
You have helped the Cloudyheads perform inside the Blue Theatre, and should now speak to Polla Stoutley.","You have arrived at the Blue Theatre and should now search for the band within","Members of the Cloudyheads can be found inside the Blue Theatre in the Fourth Circle of Minas Tirith.\
\
You have arrived at the Blue Theatre and should now speak to someone from the Cloudyheads about what is to be done next.","Talk to Polla Stoutley in the Blue Theatre","The Blue Theatre can be found to the south in the Fourth Circle of Minas Tirith.\
\
Polla has asked you to meet her and the rest of the Cloudyheads in the Blue Theatre as they work to prepare their performance.","The Cloudyheads have negotiated a performance in the legendary Blue Theatre of Minas Tirith, but now they must think on how best to utilise the theatre's grand scale."}},
[2573]={nameES="Buttons and Berries",objectivesES={"Buttons and Berries","Maliriel has asked you to help her companions complete preparations for the upcoming banquet.","Talk to Aesbrennil at the Vineyards of Lórien","Mushrooms can be found along the bank of the stream that borders Imlad Lalaith. Berries can be found in the forest north of Imlad Lalaith.\
\
Aesbrennil would like you to gather berries and button-like mushrooms for the meal she is preparing for the evening festivities.","Aesbrennil is at the Vineyards of Lórien, south of Imlad Lalaith.\
\
You should bring the mushrooms and berries back to Aesbrennil."}},
[2574]={nameES="Buzzing Sickle-flies",objectivesES={}},
[2575]={nameES="Buzzing in the Ruins",objectivesES={"Buzzing in the Ruins","Borghild is in western Clovengap.\
\
You should let Borghild know that you have completed the task of defeating the wasps.","The wasp hive can be found in south-western Clovengap.\
\
Borghild has asked you to deal with the wasp infestation in the nearby ruins.","Return to Borghild","Within the crumbling ruins of Clovengap lie pulsing nests, full of wasp larvae."}},
[2576]={nameES="Con Hacha y Fuego",objectivesES={"Walt Rosablanca mencionó que Gil Hojarena había venido del norte y el este, donde el lago se encuentra con el bosque.\
\
Walt Rosablanca cree que vale la pena investigar las afirmaciones de Gil Hojarena de que los árboles caminaban cerca de Nen Harn, si no por otra razón que la tranquilidad de Gil.","Gil Hojarena está en la granja Hengstacer, al oeste del campamento de Walt Rosablanca en Nen Harn y al norte de Bree.\
\
Walt Rosablanca te dijo que llevaras noticias de tu victoria a Gil Hojarena, con la seguridad de que una vez más podrá caminar por los bosques en paz.","Habla con Gil Hojarena en la granja Hengstacer","Encuentra el árbol caminante de Gil Hojarena","Derrotaste a Tarbúrz","Walt Rosablanca está en su campamento en el extremo occidental de Nen Harn.\
\
Tu descubrimiento debe ser explicado a Walt Rosablanca en su campamento, aunque solo sea para advertirle que tales cosas existen aquí en las partes más septentrionales de las Tierras de Bree.","Los bosques de las Tierras de Bree pueden ser oscuros y misteriosos. Algunos lugares son más oscuros que otros....","Con Hacha y Fuego","Habla con Walt Rosablanca en Nen Harn"}},
[2577]={nameES="By Bough and Twig",objectivesES={"Blackthorn has been roused by the discovery that Saruman is behind the corruption of the Black Huorns.","Blackthorn awaits your return in the eaves of Fangorn, bordering the Broadacres.\
\
You should return to Blackthorn and let him know that you have done as he asked.","There are places to summon Huorns throughout the eaves of Fangorn, bordering the Broadacres.\
\
Blackthorn asked you to put the acorns in special places to summon the Huorns.","Huorn acorns can be found throughout the eaves of Fangorn, bordering the Broadacres.\
\
Blackthorn asked you to gather Huorn acorns to summon his Huorns with.","DNT -- Will not be seen","Talk to Blackthorn","By Bough and Twig"}},
[2578]={nameES="By Bough and Twig",objectivesES={"Blackthorn has been roused by the discovery that Saruman is behind the corruption of the Black Huorns.","Blackthorn awaits your return in the eaves of Fangorn, bordering the Broadacres.\
\
You should return to Blackthorn and let him know that you have done as he asked.","There are places to summon Huorns throughout the eaves of Fangorn, bordering the Broadacres.\
\
Blackthorn asked you to put the acorns in special places to summon the Huorns.","Huorn acorns can be found throughout the eaves of Fangorn, bordering the Broadacres.\
\
Blackthorn asked you to gather Huorn acorns to summon his Huorns with.","DNT -- Will not be seen","By Bough and Twig","Talk to Blackthorn"}},
[2579]={nameES="Por pezuña y truco",objectivesES={"Se pueden encontrar jabalíes en los alrededores de la Posada Abandonada y al noreste, en las Colinas de los Vientos.\
\
Arinora te pidió que recogieras patas y huesos de pata de jabalí para un plato que sirve en la Posada Abandonada.","Lleva huesos y patas de jabalí a Arinora","Por pezuña y truco","Algunos huéspedes de la Posada Abandonada han adquirido gusto por los platos de cerdo de Arinora."}},
[2580]={nameES="De una forma u otra",objectivesES={"Lobelia insiste en tener fuegos artificiales para su fiesta de cumpleaños. La única forma posible de conseguirlos a tiempo para su fiesta es recuperar los fuegos artificiales robados a Hyacinth Tuk.","De una forma u otra","El Thain se encuentra en los Grandes Smials de Alforzaburgo, al sur de Hobbiton.\
\
Lobelia Sacovilla-Bolsón te ha enviado a ver a Robin Madriguera para hablar sobre los fuegos artificiales robados a Hyacinth Tuk, pero el Oficial Madriguera te ha dicho que este asunto está fuera de su jurisdicción. Te ha sugerido que hables con el paladín Tuk, Thain de la Comarca.","El Oficial Robin Madriguera se encuentra en La Mata de Hiedra, en el centro de Hobbiton.\
\
Como pasarán tres meses antes de que Hyacinth Tuk pueda tener más fuegos artificiales listos para Lobelia Sacovilla-Bolsón, un mes demasiado tarde para su fiesta, Lobelia te ha encargado que hables con Robin Madriguera para intentar recuperar los fuegos artificiales robados a Hyacinth."}},
[2581]={nameES="By Land and Sea",objectivesES={"The Corsairs of Umbar stalk the roads of the Havens of Belfalas and seek to rob and murder any who cross their paths.","Gilanor can be found in Ost Lontir in central Belfalas.\
\
You have defeated many roaming Corsairs and should report your success to Gilanor.","DNT -- will not be seen","Talk to Gilanor","By Land and Sea","Corsair patrol-leaders can be found along the roadways to the north and north-east of Ost Lontir.\
\
Gilanor has asked you to clear the roadways of Corsair patrols in hopes of protecting the people of Ost Lontir."}},
[2582]={nameES="By Mind and Blade",objectivesES={"By Mind and Blade","The combined forces of the Morgul-host pose a serious threat to Minas Tirith and the fate of Middle-earth.","Haradrim and Easterling forces can be found in eastern Osgiliath.\
\
Damrod has asked you to seek out and defeat Haradrim and Easterling forces in Osgiliath.","Talk to Damrod in the culverts of Osgiliath","Damrod can be found in the culverts of Osgiliath.\
\
You have defeated many of the Haradrim and Easterling forces and should now return to Damrod."}},
[2583]={nameES="Bánbros, Scourge of Óinsbridge",objectivesES={"Defeated Bánbros, Scourge of Óinsbridge","Bánbros, Scourge of Óinsbridge","Bánbros poses a great threat to all that enter Óinsbridge.","Completado","Bánbros, Scourge of Óinsbridge has been defeated and you have significantly weakened the Ungoledain.","You have encountered Bánbros, Scourge of Óinsbridge","Defeat Bánbros, Scourge of Óinsbridge"}},
[2584]={nameES="Bâlak, emisario de la Mano Blanca",objectivesES={"Tras interceptar un mensaje de Saruman de Isengard, debes entrar en Minas Caul y derrotar a su emisario para impedir la alianza entre la Corona de Hierro y la Mano Blanca.","Brúnfair está en Gath Forthnír, al norte de Barad Gúlaran.\
\
Tras derrotar a Bâlak, deberías volver a Gath Forthnír y contarle a Brúnfair que has tenido éxito.","Bâlak derrotado","Bâlak, emisario de la Mano Blanca","Minas Caul es una de las grandes torres de Barad Gúlaran, al sur de Gath Forthnír.\
\
Debes viajar hasta Barad Gúlaran y desafiar a Bâlak, el emisario de la Mano Blanca, en el interior de Minas Caul.","Entra en Minas Caul y derrota a Bâlak."}},
[2585]={nameES="Bâr Nírnaeth, the Houses of Lamentation -- Solo/Duo",objectivesES={"Defeat Manôzagar","Bâr Nírnaeth, the Houses of Lamentation -- Solo/Duo","Defeat Narkhor the Flensed","Deep in the darkness of Thuringwath lies Bâr Nírnaeth, the Houses of Lamentation. There, within that great fane where the Nazgûl once worshipped and made sacrifice to Sauron, one of the Dark Lord's most mysterious servants prepares Dhak Thrakrut, the Rite of Returning.","Find Morloth and interrupt the Rite of Returning","Defeat Agath-kali, the Mistress of Lamentation","Across the broken span, Agath-kali prepares a fell ritual before Morloth","Defeat Manôzagar within Mokh Núlum, the Vault of Anguish.","Tûm Morloth can be found outside Bâr Nírnaeth, the Houses of Lamentation.\
\
Agath-kali has absconded to Tûm Morloth to begin her final preparations for Dhak Thrakrut, the Rite of Returning.","Agath-kali can be found in Tûm Morloth.\
\
You must defeat Agath-kali before she can perform Dhak Thrakrut, the Rite of Returning.","Defeat Agath-kali's guardian, Narkhor the Flensed."}},
[2586]={nameES="Bâr Nírnaeth, the Houses of Lamentation -- Tier 1",objectivesES={"Defeat Manôzagar","Defeat Narkhor the Flensed","Deep in the darkness of Thuringwath lies Bâr Nírnaeth, the Houses of Lamentation. There, within that great fane where the Nazgûl once worshipped and made sacrifice to Sauron, one of the Dark Lord's most mysterious servants prepares Dhak Thrakrut, the Rite of Returning.","Find Morloth and interrupt the Rite of Returning","Defeat Agath-kali, the Mistress of Lamentation","Across the broken span, Agath-kali prepares a fell ritual before Morloth","Bâr Nírnaeth, the Houses of Lamentation -- Tier 1","Defeat Manôzagar within Mokh Núlum, the Vault of Anguish.","Tûm Morloth can be found outside Bâr Nírnaeth, the Houses of Lamentation.\
\
