\
You must defeat Agath-kali before she can perform Dhak Thrakrut, the Rite of Returning.","Defeat Agath-kali's guardian, Narkhor the Flensed."}},
[2587]={nameES="Bâr Nírnaeth, the Houses of Lamentation -- Tier 2",objectivesES={"Defeat Manôzagar","Bâr Nírnaeth, the Houses of Lamentation -- Tier 2","Defeat Narkhor the Flensed","Deep in the darkness of Thuringwath lies Bâr Nírnaeth, the Houses of Lamentation. There, within that great fane where the Nazgûl once worshipped and made sacrifice to Sauron, one of the Dark Lord's most mysterious servants prepares Dhak Thrakrut, the Rite of Returning.","Find Morloth and interrupt the Rite of Returning","Defeat Agath-kali, the Mistress of Lamentation","Across the broken span, Agath-kali prepares a fell ritual before Morloth","Defeat Manôzagar within Mokh Núlum, the Vault of Anguish.","Tûm Morloth can be found outside Bâr Nírnaeth, the Houses of Lamentation.\
\
Agath-kali has absconded to Tûm Morloth to begin her final preparations for Dhak Thrakrut, the Rite of Returning.","Agath-kali can be found in Tûm Morloth.\
\
You must defeat Agath-kali before she can perform Dhak Thrakrut, the Rite of Returning.","Defeat Agath-kali's guardian, Narkhor the Flensed."}},
[2588]={nameES="Bâr Nírnaeth, the Houses of Lamentation -- Tier 3",objectivesES={"Defeat Manôzagar","Defeat Narkhor the Flensed","Deep in the darkness of Thuringwath lies Bâr Nírnaeth, the Houses of Lamentation. There, within that great fane where the Nazgûl once worshipped and made sacrifice to Sauron, one of the Dark Lord's most mysterious servants prepares Dhak Thrakrut, the Rite of Returning.","Find Morloth and interrupt the Rite of Returning","Defeat Agath-kali, the Mistress of Lamentation","Across the broken span, Agath-kali prepares a fell ritual before Morloth","Bâr Nírnaeth, the Houses of Lamentation -- Tier 3","Defeat Manôzagar within Mokh Núlum, the Vault of Anguish.","Tûm Morloth can be found outside Bâr Nírnaeth, the Houses of Lamentation.\
