[2589]={nameES="Bíli is Missing",objectivesES={"You should find Bíli the dwarf and help him get back to the mill.\
\
Armund suggested that Bíli might have been exploring somewhere not far to the east of the old sawmill in the Limlight Gorge.","Rescue Bíli","Talk to Bíli","Bíli, another dwarf-companion of Armund, has gone missing somewhere near the old sawmill in the Limlight Gorge. Armund thinks that he was exploring the south-eastern stretch of the Gorge when he disappeared.","You should speak with Bíli at the Limlight Gorge sawmill.","You freed Bíli!","Bíli is Missing"}},
