[2595]={nameES="Encierro prolongado",objectivesES={"Has regañado apropiadamente a los vecinos de Clotilde.\
\
Deberías hacérselo saber.","Los molestos vecinos de Clotilde se encuentran en varios lugares de Gamwich.\
\
Debes regañarlos por molestarla.","Habla con Lassa en Campotieso","Clotilde te ha pedido que le hagas saber a Lassa que llegará pronto.\
\
Debes volver a Campotieso para hacerle saber las buenas nuevas.","Clotilde se niega a dejar su casa hasta que sus molestos vecinos le den un respiro.","Encierro prolongado","Habla con Clotilde"}},
[2596]={nameES="Cache and Carry: Arrows",objectivesES={"Examine the rune","Find the Rangers' rune hidden on an overlook above the curious ruins north-west of Lhanuch","Search for the cache about sixty paces south of the Rangers' rune at the base of a small cliff.","You have uncovered the Rangers' cache of arrows","Take the arrows to Culang in Nan Laeglin","The cache is somewhere a short distance north-west of Lhanuch where you can see a small set of curious ruins. You should be able to find the Rangers' rune on an overlook above them.\
\
Culang has sent you to find a cache of arrows, which can be found sixty paces south of a Rangers' rune.","Dig here","This is the rune Culang described","Culang is at his camp in Nan Laeglin, south-east of the cache.\
\
You have discovered the Rangers' cache and dug up the arrows hidden there. Now you should return with them to Culang.","Culang has assigned you the task of finding a number of hidden supply caches scattered throughout Nan Laeglin. If you can uncover these caches, the Grey Company will be able to pass through the land swiftly without having to risk bartering with potentially hostile locals.","Cache and Carry: Arrows","The ground here seems to be disturbed....","The cache of arrows is buried about sixty paces directly south of the Rangers' rune, along the base of a small cliff there.\
\
Culang asked you to find a hidden cache of arrows.","There is something carved on the stone here...."}},
[2597]={nameES="Cache and Carry: Bandages",objectivesES={"Examine the rune","There is something carved on the tree here....","Culang has assigned you the task of finding a number of hidden caches of supplies scattered throughout Nan Laeglin. If you can uncover these supplies, the Grey Company will be able to pass through swiftly without as having to resort to bartering with possibly hostile locals or stopping to hunt.","You have uncovered the Rangers' cache of bandages","Cache and Carry: Bandages","Dig here","Find the Rangers' rune hidden on a solitary tree east of Lhanuch","This is the rune Culang described","Bring the bandages to Culang","The cache of bandages he says is hidden east of Lhanuch. The rune-marker should be carved on a solitary tree somewhere directly east of the Lhanuch.\
\
Culang has sent you to retrieve a hidden cache of bandages.","The cache should be buried in a small copse of trees north-east of the Rangers' rune","The ground here seems to be disturbed....","Culang is at his camp in Nan Laeglin, to the south of the cache.\
\
You have discovered the Rangers' cache and dug up the bandages hidden there. Now you should return with them to Culang.","The cache of bandages is buried in a small copse of trees directly north-east of the rune.\
\
Culang asked you to retrieve a hidden cache of bandages."}},
[2598]={nameES="Cache and Carry: Healing Draughts",objectivesES={"Examine the rune","There is something carved on the tree here....","Cache and Carry: Healing Draughts","Culang has assigned you the task of finding a number of hidden caches of supplies scattered throughout Nan Laeglin. If you can uncover these supplies, the Grey Company will be able to pass through swiftly without as having to resort to bartering with possibly hostile locals or stopping to hunt.","Dig here","The cache of healing draughts is hidden well to the south of Lhanuch, on the border of the Lich Bluffs. The Rangers' rune may be found atop a green hill with many trees upon it.\
\
Culang has sent you to retrieve a hidden cache of healing draughts.","This is the rune Culang described","Find the  rune atop a green hill with several trees upon it","Find the Rangers' cache forty paces west of the rune, buried around a boulder among a stand of evergreens","You have uncovered the Rangers' cache of healing draughts","The cache of potions would be buried around the base of a boulder some forty paces west into a stand of evergreens.\
\
Culang asked you to retrieve a hidden cache of healing draughts.","Culang is at his camp in Nan Laeglin, north-east of the cache.\
\
You have discovered the Rangers' cache and dug up the healing draughts hidden there. Now you should return with them to Culang.","The ground here seems to be disturbed....","Bring the healing draughts to Culang"}},
[2599]={nameES="Cache and Carry: Hidden Foodstuffs",objectivesES={"Examine the rune","Find the Rangers' cache of foodstuffs","Braigiar has pointed you to a cache of foodstuffs he says is hidden in the north-western area of Fordirith. He believes it should be buried about twenty paces west from a tree marked with the Ranger's rune.","You have uncovered the Rangers' cache of food","This is the rune Braigiar described","There is something carved on the tree here...","Dig here","The ground here seems to be disturbed...","Take the food to Braigiar","Cache and Carry: Hidden Foodstuffs","Braigiar has assigned you the task of finding a number of hidden caches of supplies scattered throughout northern Enedwaith. If you can uncover these supplies, the Grey Company will be able to pass through swiftly without having to resort to bartering with hostile locals or stopping to hunt.","Braigiar said the cache of foodstuffs would be buried about twenty paces west of the rune-marked tree.","Braigiar is at Echad Dagoras in Fordirith.\
\
You discovered the Rangers' cache and dug up the foodstuffs hidden there. Now you should return with them to Braigiar.","Find the hidden rune"}},
[2600]={nameES="Cache and Carry: Hidden Lore",objectivesES={"Examine the rune","There is something carved on the floor here....","You have uncovered the Rangers' cache of scrolls","This is the rune Amarion described","Dig here","Take the scrolls to Amarion","Find the Rangers' cache of scrolls","Amarion is at Echad Dagoras, north-west of the Black Dens.\
\
You have discovered the Rangers' cache and dug up the scrolls of lore hidden there. Now you should return with them to Amarion.","Amarion has pointed you to a cache of weapon-lore scrolls he says is hidden within the Black Dens, south-east of Echad Dagoras. He believes it should be buried about fifty paces west of the cavern floor marked with the Rangers' rune.","Find the hidden rune","Amarion has told you of a particularly valuable hidden cache secreted within the Black Dens -- unfortunately this was before it was overrun by the deadly Shadow Wolves. If you can recover the Weapon-lore scrolls hidden away within, it would be a considerable boon to the Grey Company.","Amarion said the cache of weapon-lore scrolls would be buried about fifty paces west of the rune-marked cavern.","The ground here seems to be disturbed....","Cache and Carry: Hidden Lore"}},
[2601]={nameES="Cache and Carry: Hidden Medicine",objectivesES={"Examine the rune","Find the Rangers' medicine cache","Braigiar has pointed you to a cache of herbs and poultices he says is hidden in the north-eastern area of Fordirith. He believes it should be buried among a stand of pine trees eighty paces north of a boulder marked with the Rangers' rune.","Cache and Carry: Hidden Medicine","There is something carved on the boulder here...","This is the rune Braigiar described","Braigiar is at Echad Dagoras, south-west of the medicine-cache.\
\
You have discovered the Rangers' cache and dug up the medicines hidden there. Now you should return with them to Braigiar.","Dig here","You have uncovered the Rangers' cache of medicines","The ground here seems to be disturbed...","Braigiar has assigned you the task of finding a number of hidden caches of supplies scattered throughout northern Enedwaith. If you can uncover these supplies, the Grey Company will be able to pass through swiftly without having to resort to bartering with hostile locals or stopping to hunt.","Find the hidden rune","Braigiar said the cache of medicines would be buried among a grove of pine trees roughly eighty paces north of a large rune-marked boulder.","Take the medicines to Braigiar"}},
[2602]={nameES="Cache and Carry: Hidden Weapons",objectivesES={"Examine the rune","Braigiar said the cache of weapons would be buried about sixty paces east of the rune marker, amid a jumble of large boulders.","Some among the northern Rangers have often made the trek through Dunland to Gondor, far to the South. During these prior journeys, they left cleverly hidden caches in case one of their number should be injured or in desperate need of supplies during their journeys. Now with the Grey Company travelling into the south they have decided to collect these caches to ensure they are ready to deal with the dangers ahead.","The ground here seems to be disturbed....","Braigiar is at Echad Dagoras, north of the weapon-cache.\
\
You have discovered the Rangers' cache and dug up the weapons hidden there. You should return with them to Braigiar.","This is the rune Braigiar described","Cache and Carry: Hidden Weapons","Dig here","You have uncovered the Rangers' weapons-cache","Take the weapons to Braigiar","Find the hidden rune","Find the Rangers' weapons-cache","There is something on the ground here....","Braigiar has pointed you to a cache he believes is hidden in the Southern area of Fordirith. First, you should find a marker rune atop a small rounded hill with several trees upon it."}},
[2603]={nameES="Caches Underfoot",objectivesES={"Forced to stay constantly in motion when outside Henneth Annûn by the forces of Mordor, the Rangers of Ithilien have taken to hiding caches of supplies in the lands of North Ithilien.","Deliver the caches to Tordoron","You discover nothing of import beneath the disturbed earth","Buried caches can be found to the north of Henneth Annûn in North Ithilien.\
\
Tordoron has asked you to search the lands to the north of Henneth Annûn for buried caches.","Tordoron can be found in the northern wilds of North Ithilien.\
\
You have recovered several caches from the north lands of Ithilien and should now deliver them to Tordoron.","Caches Underfoot"}},
[2604]={nameES="Caches of Corruption",objectivesES={}},
[2605]={nameES="Caging the Spiders",objectivesES={}},
[2606]={nameES="Cair Andros: Cruel Molvagúr",objectivesES={"Defeat Molvagúr","Molvagúr, with swords drawn, snarls at you","Molvagúr, is on Cair Andros.\
\
You should defeat Molvagúr.","In his last, dying breath, Molvagúr sounds the alarms!","Find Molvagúr","Leading a band of Gondorians, Duinhir, lord of Blackroot Vale, has been tasked with the retaking of Cair Andors.","Cair Andros: Cruel Molvagúr","Talk to Duinhir near Cair Andros","Molvagúr, captain of the Enemy forces at Cair Andros, is somewhere on the island.\
\
You should find Molvagúr.","Duinhir can be found near Cair Andros.\
\
You should speak to Duinhir."}},
[2607]={nameES="Cair Andros: The Captives",objectivesES={"Defeated Maushlak","Defeat Maushlak","Cair Andros: The Captives","Maushlak, an Uruk cook, is holding captives to vie for power at Cair Andros.\
\
You should defeat Maushlak.","Talk to Duinhir near Cair Andros","Captives are being held at Cair Andros.\
\
You should rescue the captives.","Duinhir can be found near Cair Andros.\
\
You should speak to Duinhir.","Leading a band of Gondorians, Duinhir, lord of Blackroot Vale, has been tasked with the retaking of Cair Andros."}},
[2608]={nameES="Cair Andros: The Island Walls",objectivesES={"Cair Andros: The Island Walls","You have defeated many Orc scouts upon the walls of Cair Andros and have weakened the Enemy foothold on the island fortress.","Leading a band of Gondorians, Duinhir, lord of Blackroot Vale, has been tasked with the retaking of Cair Andros.","Defeated Orc scouts.","Defeat Orc scouts on the fortress walls around Cair Andros.","Completado"}},
[2609]={nameES="Cair Andros: The Stronghold",objectivesES={"You have destroyed many weapon-racks in Cair Andros, and have weakened the Enemy foothold on the island fortress.","Weapon-racks can be found around Cair Andros.\
\
You should destroy weapon-racks.","Destroy weapon-racks.","Cair Andros: The Stronghold","Completado","Leading a band of Gondorians, Duinhir, lord of Blackroot Vale, has been tasked with the retaking of Cair Andros."}},
[2610]={nameES="La Vigilia de Calengil",objectivesES={"La Vigilia de Calengil","Calengil se encuentra en el refugio élfico de Duillond, al norte.\
\
Thinglaer te ha pedido que busques a su hermano Calengil y le brindes tu ayuda.","El hermano de Thinglaer, Calengil, también busca restaurar las antiguas ruinas élficas en Ered Luin y requiere tu ayuda."}},
[2611]={nameES="Calenglad permaneció",objectivesES={"Calenglad está en Tinnudir, una isla en la costa este del lago Nenuial, en Evendim, lejos hacia el este del Bosque de los Trolls.\
\
Aragorn te ha dado una carga para que se la lleves a Calenglad y un consejo acerca de la naturaleza del respeto: que no puede ser comprado, sino ganado. Con la ayuda de Calenglad, Aragorn espera que puedas recuperar el Silithar necesario para reforjar Narsil.","Lleva la carta de Aragorn a Calenglad","Calenglad permaneció","Aragorn te ha pedido que informes al Montaraz Calenglad de que Narsil será reforjada."}},
[2612]={nameES="Call of Honour",objectivesES={"Call of Honour","Wynstan witnessed the shades of Oathbreakers assisting the brigand treasure-seekers as they brought relics out of Parth Celebrant and was disheartened that the Oathbreakers remained honourless.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: If you take this quest, you will begin Wynstan's Call of Honour line and will be unable to accept Bagmund's Dishonoured Dead line.</rgb>","Completed Stolen Pride","Talk to the captain of the shades at Atburg in the Rushgore","Complete Stolen Pride and obtain the good will of the shades","Relics can be found at Atburg and upon the brigands therein.\
\
Brúngwath has asked you to complete Aculf's request and collect the stolen relics to show your honour.","Talk to Eowils outside Atburg in the Rushgore","The captain of the shades is somewhere at Atburg, south-east of Aculf's camp in the Rushgore.\
\
Wynstan has asked you to convince the captain of the shades to rejoin the fight against the Enemy and fulfill his oath.","Eowils is outside Atburg in the Rushgore, south-east of Aculf's camp.\
\
Wynstan told you to report your successes to the scout Eowils."}},
[2613]={nameES="Call of the Beacon",objectivesES={"Lady Answith is awed by the view of the Halifirien from Beaconwatch.","You have seen the view of the Halifirien","Talk to Lady Answith","Lady Answith is on a porch above the vendor's area north of the Mead Hall in Beaconwatch.\
\
After witnessing the breathtaking view of the Halifirien, you have an idea of the sense of duty that Cútha has for keeping watch. You should return to Lady Answith and tell her that you have gazed upon the Halifirien from high atop Beaconwatch.","Call of the Beacon","The tower high atop Beaconwatch is where Lady Answith is awed by the view of the Halifirien.\
\
Lady Answith recommended that you view the Halifirien and thus perhaps learn to understand her husband's devotion.","Go up into the tower and witness the view at the Halifirien"}},
[2614]={nameES="Call of the North",objectivesES={}},
[2615]={nameES="Call the Beasts!",objectivesES={}},
[2616]={nameES="Llamado a las armas",objectivesES={"Malthellam can be found outside his home in Morlad.\
\
Gúrion asks that you return to Malthellam in Morlad to warn him of the impending union between the Dead and the invader from Tarlang's Crown.","Talk to Malthellam in Morlad","Malthellam can be found outside his home in Morlad.\
\
You have rallied an archer to the defence of each of Blackroot Vale's villages and should now report back to Malthellam.","Talk to Malthellam","Archers can be found along the borders of Morlad in Blackroot Vale.\
\
Malthellam has asked you to send an archer to each of the villages in Blackroot Vale to aid in their defence.","DNT -- will not be seen","Llamado a las armas","Fearful of the grim alliance between the Dead and the invader from Tarlang's Crown, Gúrion asks you to seek Malthellam's counsel in confronting them."}},
[2617]={nameES="Call to Arms: Azgh-buzru",objectivesES={"Náin the Slakeless can be found at the hidden refuge of Drenghól in the northern reaches of Elderslade during the War of Three Peaks.\
\
Náin the Slakeless has led a company north toward Bagûd-mekhem in attempt to secure a forward encampment outside Mount Gundabad. You should muster at Drenghól and report to Náin the Slakeless.","Talk to Náin the Slakeless at Drenghól","The War of Three Peaks rages at Azgh-buzru where clashes between the forces of Gorgar the Ruthless and the Gabil'akkâ have grown ever more bloody and desperate.","Call to Arms: Azgh-buzru"}},
[2618]={nameES="Call to the Eld",objectivesES={}},
[2619]={nameES="Pidiendo carbón",objectivesES={"Pidiendo carbón","Hart Holeman está en su casa en el centro de Sobrecolina.\
\
Hyacinth Tuk agradeció el salitre que le trajiste, aunque te reprendió por dejar que Cam Barroso te convenciera para cazar lobos para él. Ahora te ha pedido que vayas a ver a Hart Holeman para pedirle el carbón que necesita.","Dado que Lobelia Sacovilla-Bolsón pagó para adquirir los ingredientes de sus fuegos artificiales, Hyacinth Tuk te ha reclutado para ayudarla a reunirlos."}},
[2620]={nameES="Calling for Help",objectivesES={"The incident with the bugan at the Barnavon Mine has left the mine with a shortage of healthy workers.","Talk to Gwilum in Barnavon","Gwilum is at Barnavon-town, far to the west of the Barnavon Mine.\
\
Melvun asked you to go to Gwilum and ask for replacement workers.","Calling for Help"}},
[2621]={nameES="Calling the Children Home",objectivesES={"Find and call Shûbar home for supper","Speak with Entârshul in Urmâkh.","Find and call Zâli home for supper","Calling the Children Home","Find and call Ladûl home for supper","Find and call Ninda home for supper","Speak with Entârshul in Urmâkh","Entârshul has asked you to call the children of Urmâkh home for supper.","Call the children Ninda, Shûbar, Zâli, and Ladûl home to Entârshul in Urmâkh for supper. Entârshul suggests telling them Shangarûd will find them if they are reticent to come home. They can be found inside and just outside the gates of Urmâkh."}},
[2622]={nameES="Los Muertos demasiado agitados",objectivesES={"Habla con Reginald Hozhierba en las Quebradas de los Túmulos","Los Muertos demasiado agitados","Los guías de Bree temen por sus protegidos mientras el terror de las Quebradas de los Túmulos se extiende por el norte. Esta situación inesperada les ha obligado a tomar medidas drásticas.","Los espectros pueden encontrarse por todas las Quebradas de los Túmulos, al este y al norte del campamento de los guías.\
\
Por su propia imprudencia, los guías han quedado atrapados. Mientras están aquí, desean ayudar a los Vigilantes de Bree reduciendo la amenaza que hay en las Quebradas de los Túmulos.","Encontrarás a Reginald Hozhierba en el campamento improvisado entre el Bosque Viejo y el norte de las Quebradas de los Túmulos.\
\
Ahora deberías volver con Reginald Hozhierba y decirle que has empezado a eliminar a los tumularios de las Quebradas de los Túmulos."}},
[2623]={nameES="Acampando en la Grieta",objectivesES={"Svanr está en el lado oeste del abismo, en el Puente de Khazad-dûm en Nud-melek.\
\
Debes decirle a Svanr que has derrotado a varios orcos en el puesto avanzado del borde del abismo.","Acampando en la Grieta","Los orcos del borde del abismo no están en su elemento, pero permanecen para acumular fuerzas para un empuje hacia el Valle del Arroyo Sombrìo.","Los orcos se encuentran en el borde del abismo, a lo largo de la gran grieta en el centro de Nud-melek.\
\
Debes derrotar a los orcos del puesto avanzado del borde del abismo.","Vuelve con Svanr"}},
[2624]={nameES="Camps in the Tower",objectivesES={}},
[2625]={nameES="El retraso de Candac",objectivesES={"Lirio Hojarena, una hobbit adinerada de Bree, colecciona cerámicas recogidas de antiguas ruinas en las Tierras Solitarias. Está esperando su último pedido, que no ha llegado.","El retraso de Candac","Entrega la carta de Lirio a Candac","Candac Bosqueclaro está en la Posada Abandonada, que se encuentra al este de los Pantanos de Moscagua, a lo largo del Gran Camino del Este.\
\
Candac Bosqueclaro suministra a Lily Hojarena cerámicas y otros objetos de las ruinas del reino de Arnor. Lirio te ha dado una carta para Candac y te ha enviado a la Posada Abandonada para entregársela e informarte sobre el retraso."}},
[2626]={nameES="La entrega de Candac",objectivesES={"La entrega de Candac","Entrega la carta de la señora Hojarena a Candac","Entregar los artefactos a Lirio Hojarena.","Carta recibida para Candac","Lirio Hojarena espera la última entrega de Candac al pie de la Colina de Bree, en la ciudad de Bree.","Lirio Hojarena vive en su casa, en la esquina de la carretera de Bree que conduce a la Colina de Bree.\
\
Candac Bosqueclaro, incapaz de pagar a un mensajero adecuado, te ha pedido que realices su última entrega a Lirio Hojarena.","Candac Bosqueclaro está en la Posada Abandonada, situada en El Gran Camino del Este, que atraviesa las Tierras Solitarias.\
\
Candac Bosqueclaro te envió a entregar un paquete de cerámica antigua a Lirio Hojarena, por lo que la señora Hojarena te pagó. Debes regresar con Candac con el pago."}},
[2627]={nameES="La obligación de Candac",objectivesES={"Candac Bosqueclaro está en la Posada Abandonada.\
\
Candac Bosqueclaro te ha pedido que busques fragmentos de cerámica con los que pueda continuar su comercio.","La obligación de Candac","Hay fragmentos de cerámica antigua en el valle que se extiende al pie de las ruinas de Minas Eriol, al sureste de la Posada Abandonada. Candac Bosqueclaro está en la Posada Abandonada.\
\
Candac Bosqueclaro te ha pedido que busques fragmentos de cerámica con los que pueda continuar su comercio.","Lleva fragmentos de cerámica a Candac Bosqueclaro","Candac Bosqueclaro compra cerámicas y otros objetos a los Mascador en la Posada Abandonada. Pero con los trasgos que merodean por las Tierras Solitarias, los Mascador tienen problemas para reunir suficientes piezas."}},
[2628]={nameES="Lienzo del desafío",objectivesES={"Habla con Fredegar en Nobotella","Los admiradores de Fredegar se encuentran en el pueblo de Nobotella.\
\
Debes hablar con los admiradores de Fredegar para entender mejor el punto de vista de este hobbit.","Los rufianes se encuentran en las ruinas de Ost Lagorath al norte y en la Comarca Allende.\
\
Fredegar te ha pedido que derrotes a rufianes en la Comarca Allende.","El joven hobbit habla con la pequeña multitud que se arremolina en torno a él.\
\
'Dicen que los Fronteros protegen las fronteras, ¿por qué? ¡Porque todo lo que está dentro de las frontera es nuestro hogar! Somos hobbits, ¿no es así? ¡Nosotros decidimos dónde están y no están las fronteras!\
\
El joven hobbit centra su atención en ti.\
\
'¡Eh, tú! Parece que aún necesitas que te convenzan. Habla con estos hobbits que hay por aquí. ¡Ellos te dirán que no digo más que la verdad!'","Lienzo del desafío","Fredegar Bolger se encuentra en el pueblo de Nobotella.\
\
Debes hablar con Fredegar Bolger.","Fredegar Bolger ha llegado a la Comarca Allende con planes para mantener seguras la Comarca Aquende y la Comarca Allende.","Fredegar Bolger se encuentra en el pueblo de Nobotella.\
\
Debes llevarle la lista de firmas a Fredegar Bolger.","Hobbits preocupados y descontentos por varias razones se encuentran en los pueblos de la Comarca Allende.\
\
Fredegar te ha pedido que recojas firmas de hobbits preocupados en cada pueblo."}},
[2629]={nameES="Capital Earnings",objectivesES={"Talk to Frithelm in Cliving","Capital Earnings","With Caddabrand's main goal completed, all that is left to be done is to collect each share of the reward.","Cliving, the capital city of the Norcrofts, lies far to the north, beyond the trader's outpost along the road.\
\
Caddabrand has informed you that your share of the bounty may be collected from the warrior Frithelm, in Cliving."}},
[2630]={nameES="Captain of Fangs",objectivesES={"You have defeated the Captain of Fangs","Defeat the Captain of Fangs","Captain of Fangs","Ondor is encamped south of the stockade.\
\
You should return to Ondor and tell him that the Captain of Fangs is no more.","The Captain of Fangs is in the stockade, north of Ondor. It can best be reached through the caves behind the stockade.\
\
Ondor has asked you to defeat the Captain of Fangs, a goblin Warg-rider of fierce renown and the leader of these goblins.","Talk to Ondor in Nan Curunír","Ondor spoke of a goblin-captain which they refer to as the Captain of Fangs... perhaps a Warg-rider or commander of the Warg-forces in Nan Curunír."}},
[2631]={nameES="Captain-Generals' Symbols",objectivesES={"Captain-Generals can only be found at locations where the enemy army holds power.\
\
Chieftain Durulkum directed you to collect Captain-General symbols from enemy leaders and then return to him.","Return to Chieftain Durulkum at Dâr-gazag","Captain-Generals' Symbols","At the head of the enemy forces stand the Captain-Generals. Their symbols garner great favour amongst Angmar's army, and presenting these to Mordirith will undoubtedly earn you favour with Lugbúrz."}},
[2632]={nameES="Capitán: El Camino Más Noble es el Servicio",objectivesES={"Capitán: El Camino Más Noble es el Servicio","Reúnete con Dawn Stockard para recibir más entrenamiento de Capitán.","Como Capitán, ha alcanzado tal renombre que ha recibido un llamado de Dawn Stockard de Archet.\
\
Debe buscar a Dawn Stockard para recibir un entrenamiento adicional en su clase.","Dawn Stockard se encuentra en la ciudad de Archet, al norte de Bree, en las Tierras de Bree.\
\
Se le ha indicado hablar con Dawn Stockard, una gran capitana, para descubrir qué la preocupa.","Tu estandarte lleva la llama de la esperanza a los corazones de la buena gente, y tu nombre es alabado por quienes te siguen en batalla contra los males de la sombra.","Dawn Stockard se encuentra en la ciudad de Archet, al norte de Bree, en las Tierras de Bree.\
\
Se le ha indicado hablar con Dawn Stockard, una gran capitana, para averiguar qué la preocupa."}},
[2633]={nameES="Capitán: El Camino de las Manos Sanadoras",objectivesES={"Garnyd se encuentra en Anazârmekhem, en las Profundidades Llameantes de Moria.\
\
Se te ha ordenado buscar a la capitana Garnyd.","Capitán: El Camino de las Manos Sanadoras","Habla con Garnyd en Anazârmekhem, en las Profundidades Llameantes de Moria","La capitana Garnyd te ha convocado."}},
[2634]={nameES="Capitanes de la Marea Negra",objectivesES={"Capitanes de la Marea Negra","Los capitanes Ongbúrz Thorgal, Shum-batar y Dombrî fueron vistos por última vez entre los guardianes de huargos en el campamento orco de Dol Dínen, al sureste de Esteldín.\
\
Elúr te habló del descubrimiento de tres capitanes de la tribu Ongbúrz que comandan los rangos inferiores de la hueste orca: Thorgal, Shum-batar y Dombrî. Cree que sus muertes causarán confusión entre los rangos inferiores. Te recomienda no intentar esta tarea solo.","Elúr espera noticias de tu éxito en su campamento al sureste de Esteldín.\
\
Elúr te dio los nombres de tres capitanes Blogmal entre los orcos de Dol Dínen, donde patrullan los guardianes de huargos. Cuando estos capitanes sean derrotados, deberías regresar con Elúr.","Una gran hueste de orcos atravesó Ram Dúath, expulsando a los hombres de las Quebradas del Norte de sus granjas. Esteldín, hogar de los pocos Dúnedain que quedan en el norte, se salvó de ser descubierta. Desde allí, los Montaraces comienzan a planear su contraofensiva contra la marea negra de Angmar.","Regresa con Elúr"}},
[2635]={nameES="Captains of the Host",objectivesES={}},
[2636]={nameES="Captive for an Age",objectivesES={}},
[2637]={nameES="Capture an Outpost",objectivesES={}},
[2638]={nameES="Capture an Outpost",objectivesES={}},
[2639]={nameES="Capture the Stores",objectivesES={"Lhucu is at her hut, south of Lhan Gogledh.\
\
You should bring the food-stores to Lhucu so that she may redistribute them to the people of Lhan Bach.","Talk to Lhucu at her hut","The Dievlig have attacked travellers and even the village of Lhan Bach and stolen food and supplies, leaving the villagers with little to sustain themselves.","Capture the Stores","The stolen food can be found at Lhan Gogledh, north of Lhucu's hut.\
\
Lhucu has asked you to recover the stolen food for the people of Lhan Bach."}},
[2640]={nameES="Captured Crayfish",objectivesES={"Tassila can be found at the river docks in Arhaim.\
\
You should bring the trout to Tassila.","Captured Crayfish","Talk to Tassila","Tassila, a fisherman in Arhaim, has asked for your help retrieving crayfish traps from along the river-bank.","Crayfish traps can be found along the Anduin River in Duskenvale.\
\
You should collect the crayfish traps."}},
[2641]={nameES="Captured and Cornered",objectivesES={"You have freed many of the captured Men from the Tower of Cirith Ungol.","Captured and Cornered","Legolas is concerned that recent prisoners taken by Captain Róglarg's garrison are now in even greater danger as Shelob's children flood into Cirith Ungol.","The spiders of Lhingris have slain this prisoner...","Captured Men can be found in the Tower of Cirith Ungol.\
\
Legolas has asked you to rescue the Men taken into the Tower by Captain Róglarg's garrison.","You have freed many of the captured Men from the Tower of Cirith Ungol, but sadly, a few fell to the Orcs and spiders now battling in the Tower.","The freed prisoner makes for the gate of Cirith Ungol!","Completado","You were too late to save this Man..."}},
[2642]={nameES="Captured and Tormented",objectivesES={"Captured soldiers are being held by the Enemy in Parth Daenath.\
\
You should free any captured soldiers that you find.","Habla con Celeborn","Celeborn has learned that a group of soldiers was recently captured by the Enemy.","Celeborn can be found at Echad-in-Edhil.\
\
You should talk to Celeborn.","Captured and Tormented"}},
[2643]={nameES="Captured by Corsairs",objectivesES={}},
[2644]={nameES="Caradhras el Cruel",objectivesES={"El cuerpo del enano está congelado, sus últimos instantes de vida preservados por el frío. Al parecer, Thorlák encontró su fin en el apacible abrazo del sueño.","Habla con Hjór en Echad Dúnann","Caradhras el Cruel","Has descubierto el cadáver de una cabra del Cuerno Rojo sacrificada, lo que Hjór interpretó como una buena señal de que su amigo aún podría vivir, ya que el cadáver había sido desollado con gran maestría.","Thorlák fue a la Puerta del Cuerno Rojo en busca de la Torre de Durin en la parte oriental del paso, en Zirakzigil.\
\
Hjór espera que Thorlák haya encontrado algún refugio en la parte alta de la Puerta del Cuerno Rojo.","Encontraste el cuerpo de Thorlák.","Encuentra a Thorlák","Hjór está en Echad Dúnann, al suroeste de la Puerta del Cuerno Rojo.\
\
Debes volver con Hjór e informarle de la muerte de Thorlák."}},
[2645]={nameES="Caranost, ahora hogar de orcos",objectivesES={"Habla con Sirvellon en Sírlond","Los guerreros de Caranost se pueden encontrar al oeste de Sírlond, por toda la ciudad.","Caranost está llena de orcos, y los Elfos en el campamento de Sirvellon están deseosos de hacer algo al respecto.","Caranost, ahora hogar de orcos","Sirvellon está en su campamento de Sírlond, al este de Caranost propiamente dicha."}},
[2646]={nameES="Tarea de Cardolan: Pelajes ennegrecidos",objectivesES={"Los dúnedain de Cardolan han publicado una tarea para recoger pelajes ennegrecidos.","Tarea de Cardolan: Pelajes ennegrecidos","Se busca: pelajes ennegrecidos de las bestias de Cardolan, en especial los de los huargos. Quienes entreguen estos trofeos recibirán una modesta compensación de los dúnedain de Cardolan.","Entregar los pelajes ennegrecidos en un buzón de recogida","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir pelajes ennegrecidos.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú."}},
[2647]={nameES="Tarea de Cardolan: Hachuelas rotas",objectivesES={"Entregar las hachuelas rotas en un buzón de recogida","Se busca: hachuelas rotas de bandidos y semiorcos en Cardolan. Quienes entreguen estos trofeos recibirán una modesta compensación de los dúnedain de Cardolan.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Tarea de Cardolan: Hachuelas rotas","Los dúnedain de Cardolan han publicado una tarea para recoger hachuelas rotas.","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir hachuelas rotas."}},
[2648]={nameES="Tarea de Cardolan: Lanzas de madera rotas",objectivesES={"Entrega las lanzas de madera rotas en una caja de recolección","Se busca: Lanzas de madera rotas de los trasgos, semiorcos y Orcos que molestan a la gente de Cardolan. Quienes entreguen estos trofeos recibirán una modesta compensación de los Dúnedain de Cardolan.","Los Dúnedain de Cardolan han publicado una tarea para recolectar lanzas de madera rotas.","Tarea de Cardolan: Lanzas de madera rotas","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir lanzas de madera rotas."}},
[2649]={nameES="Tarea de Cardolan: Pieles ásperas",objectivesES={"Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir pieles ásperas.","Los dúnedain de Cardolan han publicado una tarea para recoger pieles ásperas.","Tarea de Cardolan: Pieles ásperas","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Entregar las pieles ásperas en un buzón de recogida","Se busca: pieles ásperas de las bestias de Cardolan. Quienes entreguen estos trofeos recibirán una modesta compensación de los dúnedain de Cardolan."}},
[2650]={nameES="Tarea de Cardolan: Polvo tenue",objectivesES={"Entregar los montones de polvo tenue en un buzón de recogida","Se busca: montones de polvo tenue de los muertos que han regresado para perturbar las tierras de Cardolan. Quienes entreguen estos trofeos recibirán una modesta compensación de los dúnedain de Cardolan.","Tarea de Cardolan: Polvo tenue","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir montones de polvo tenue.","Los dúnedain de Cardolan han publicado una tarea para recoger montones de polvo tenue."}},
[2651]={nameES="Tarea de Cardolan: Orejas oscuras",objectivesES={"Tarea de Cardolan: Orejas oscuras","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir orejas oscuras.","Entregar las orejas oscuras en un buzón de recogida","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Se busca: orejas oscuras de linces, uros y huargos en Cardolan. Quienes entreguen estos trofeos recibirán una modesta compensación de los dúnedain de Cardolan.","Los dúnedain de Cardolan han publicado una tarea para recoger orejas oscuras."}},
[2652]={nameES="Tarea de Cardolan: Esencias brillantes",objectivesES={"Tarea de Cardolan: Esencias brillantes","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir esencias brillantes.","Se busca: esencias brillantes de los muertos que han regresado para perturbar las tierras de Cardolan. Quienes entreguen estos trofeos recibirán una modesta compensación de los dúnedain de Cardolan.","Los dúnedain de Cardolan han publicado una tarea para conseguir esencias brillantes.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Entregar las esencias brillantes en un buzón de recogida"}},
[2653]={nameES="Tarea de Cardolan: Huesos de dedo grandes",objectivesES={"Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir huesos de dedo grandes.","Se busca: huesos de dedo grandes de los tumularios que acechan en Tyrn Gorthad, en Cardolan. Reclámalos de sus miserables manos, estén o no unidas, y ten cuidado con los que se arrastran con los dedos bajo la niebla. Quienes entreguen estos trofeos recibirán una modesta compensación de los dúnedain de Cardolan.","Tarea de Cardolan: Huesos de dedo grandes","Entregar los huesos de dedo grandes en un buzón de recogida","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Los dúnedain de Cardolan han publicado una tarea para recoger huesos de dedo grandes."}},
[2654]={nameES="Tarea de Cardolan: Caparazones resistentes",objectivesES={"Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir caparazones resistentes.","Entregar los caparazones resistentes en un buzón de recogida","Los dúnedain de Cardolan han publicado una tarea para recoger caparazones resistentes.","Tarea de Cardolan: Caparazones resistentes","Se busca: caparazones resistentes de arañas, reptadores y otros insectos repugnantes de Cardolan. Quienes entreguen estos trofeos recibirán una modesta compensación de los dúnedain de Cardolan.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú."}},
[2655]={nameES="Tarea de Cardolan: vainas de espada resistentes",objectivesES={"Tarea de Cardolan: vainas de espada resistentes","Entrega las vainas de espada resistentes en una caja de recolección","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir vainas de espada resistentes.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Los Dúnedain de Cardolan han publicado una tarea para recolectar vainas de espada resistentes.","Se busca: vainas de espada resistentes de bandidos y semiorcos en Cardolan. Además, aquellos que se atrevan a desafiar a Tyrn Gorthad también podrían recuperarlas de los Tumularios. Quienes entreguen estos trofeos recibirán una modesta compensación de los Dúnedain de Cardolan."}},
[2656]={nameES="Bagatela de Cardolan — Introducción",objectivesES={"Bagatela de Cardolan — Introducción","Bagatela de Cardolan recogida","Recoge una bagatela de Cardolan","Los túmulos se encuentran dispersos por las Quebradas de los Túmulos del Norte y del Sur. Anglinn está en el Pabellón de Caza de Bree, al este de las Quebradas.\
\
El Montaraz Anglinn te ha pedido que destierres a los espectros bajo las Quebradas de los Túmulos del Norte y del Sur y le lleves las bagatelas del antiguo Cardolan que puedan portar.","Las Quebradas de los Túmulos fueron en otro tiempo un refugio para los Montaraces de Cardolan. Cayó hace mucho y se volvió un lugar de terror bajo la sombra del Rey Brujo de Angmar.","Lleva la bagatela de Cardolan a Anglinn"}},
[2657]={nameES="Carnicería en los Campos de los Hodges",objectivesES={"Las vallas de toda la Granja de Nathan Hodges han sido destrozadas por los huargos merodeadores.","Has hecho un buen gesto por los Hodges, pues tendrán menos trabajo cuando regresen. Con suerte, pronto volverán a casa y podrán concentrarse en recuperarse.","Has hecho un buen gesto por los Hodges, pues tendrán menos trabajo cuando regresen.","Las vallas de la Granja de Nathan Hodges han sido destrozadas por los huargos en maraña. Debes repararlas por si los Hodges desean regresar algún día.","Completado","Se pueden encontrar piezas de valla rotas en la Granja de Nathan Hodges, en el norte de las Tierras Solitarias, cerca de Annúndir.\
\
Debes reparar las vallas rotas, por si los Hodges desean volver.","Carnicería en los Campos de los Hodges"}},
[2658]={nameES="Semilla de Carnimírië",objectivesES={"Cold Soil can be found in the south-west of Fangorn","Carnimírië's Seed has been fertilized with the rocky soil","Quickbeam believes the seed needs to be covered with rocky soil in order to continue to grow. \
\
Rocky soil can be found along the mountains north-east of Derndingle.","Quickbeam believes the seed needs to be covered with mossy soil in order to continue to grow. \
\
Mossy soil can be found at Wellinghall in Fangorn.","Speak to Quickbeam","Soil rich with bark can be found in the north-east of Fangorn","Mossy soil can be found at Wellinghall","Quickbeam believes the seed needs to be covered with sandy soil in order to continue to grow. \
\
Sandy soil can be found along the river in Fangorn Forest.","Quickbeam has figured out what soil is next needed for the seed.\
\
Quickbeam is ready to speak to you at Derndingle.","Quickbeam wishes to speak with you about the seed you have been growing.\
\
Quickbeam is at Derndingle.","Quickbeam has planted a seed to his fallen friend Carnimírië at the Easeful Mead. He wishes to honour the memory of his friend.","Carnimírië's Seed has been fertilized with the chunky soil","Semilla de Carnimírië","Quickbeam needs to ponder how best to support the seed's growth.\
\
Return to Quickbeam at Derndingle to hear what he has to say.","Fertilize Carnimírië's Seed at the Easeful Mead","Rocky soil can be found in the north-west of Fangorn","Return to Quickbeam","Carnimírië's Seed has been fertilized with the mossy soil","Quickbeam believes the seed needs to be covered with cold soil in order to continue to grow. \
\
Cold soil can be found along the mountains in the south-west of Fangorn.","Quickbeam ponders what to do next. Time passes...","Carnimírië's Seed has been fertilized with the cold soil","Quickbeam believes the seed needs to be covered with chunky soil in order to continue to grow. \
\
Chunky soil can be found in the north-east of Fangorn.","Carnimírië's Seed has been fertilized with the sandy soil"}},
[2659]={nameES="Portadores de enfermedad",objectivesES={"Habla con Sal Henares entre el Bosque Viejo y las Quebradas de los Túmulos","Los gusanos y las ratas pueden encontrarse por todo el norte de las Quebradas de los Túmulos, y estas alimañas son probablemente portadoras de enfermedades. Se te ha pedido que mates a estas criaturas para que los refugiados que se esconden en el campamento entre las Quebradas de los Túmulos y el Bosque Viejo tengan un camino despejado cuando partan.\
\
Sal Henares cree que puedes ayudarla a crear un camino para que la gente de Bree lo siga cuando llegue el momento de moverse. Te pidió que elimines muchas de las alimañas en las Quebradas de los Túmulos.","Los guías de Bree temen por sus protegidos mientras los horrores de las Quebradas de los Túmulos se desatan ahora en el norte. Este giro inesperado los ha obligado a tomar medidas drásticas.","Portadores de enfermedad","Sal Henares descansa con los demás en el campamento improvisado entre las Quebradas de los Túmulos y el Bosque Viejo.\
\
Luchaste y mataste a un buen número de criaturas portadoras de enfermedades que habitan en las Quebradas de los Túmulos. Debes regresar con Sal Henares y darle la noticia."}},
[2660]={nameES="Carrying Words of Warning",objectivesES={"Report to Lúmar in Ost Arndír","Word of the Ronkrúm goblin incursion must be brought to Ost Arndír.","Carrying Words of Warning","Igerna has sent you on to Ost Arndír with her report of the goblin incursion.\
\
You should bring the report to Lúmar and let him know what you and Igerna have been doing."}},
[2661]={nameES="Carving Out A Home",objectivesES={"Ambassador Spakorth wishes to offer the finely-honed skills of Stout-axe rune-carvers to Erebor.","Crude stones can be found along the western slopes of Erebor.\
\
Ambassador Spakorth has asked you to gather crude stones from the slopes of Erebor that they might be carved into rune-stones by the Stout-axes.","As Ambassador Spakorth asked, you delivered many stones of Erebor to the Stout-axe rune-carvers. Through their skill, they will be able to create impressive rune-stones for King Thorin III and Durin's Folk.","Stout-axe rune-carvers can be found in Erebor.\
\
You have gathered many stones from the slopes of Erebor and should now deliver them to the Stout-axe rune-carvers in Erebor.","Carving Out A Home","Completado","You have delivered many crude stones to the Stout-axe rune-carvers."}},
[2662]={nameES="Carving Out Hearts",objectivesES={"The Angmarim within the city of Carn Dûm have a desire for the heartwood cut from the centre of the Leafcull-trees within the Grimwood. He has offered you a reward for collecting the heartwood.","Carving Out Hearts","Grimwood-heartwood can be found on the Leafcull-trees, though you may possibly find it in the fallen logs as well.\
\
Chieftain Torbok directed you to recover and return Grimwood-heartwood to him.","Return to Chieftain Torbok at the Grimwood Lumber-camp"}},
[2663]={nameES="Cask Away",objectivesES={"Cask Away","Ahuz is concerned about the wine casks he was transporting that were lost during a recent storm on the isles.","Ahuz has asked you to retrieve his lost wine casks. His boat ran ashore to the west of Mâr Naphra.","Deliver casks to Ahuz","You have successfully collected all of Ahuz's wine casks. You should return them. Ahuz can be found in Mâr Naphra."}},
[2664]={nameES="Casualty of Gundabad",objectivesES={"Klórgren, the massive network of stone-claw tunnels and burrows, cracks the earth as the passages inside weave and twist through the hills. Within Klórgren, the stone-claws are frenzied and disease-ridden. Dead stone-claws line the tunnels ahead. If the corpses are not removed from Klórgren, it is possible that the rock slides will increase and the stone-claws will become even more frenzied as the disease spreads.","Burn many stone-claw corpses within Klórgren.","You have successfully burned many of the diseased stone-claw corpses found in Klórgren. The dwarves coming to Elderslade will thank you for your efforts. This disease that the stone-claws struggle with is not natural, however. You wonder what else in Elderslade has been affected and defiled by the forces of Gundabad, and to what purpose.","The burrows of Klórgren can be found on the eastern edges of Elderslade.\
\
You should burn the stone-claw corpses within Klórgren.","Casualty of Gundabad","The burrows of Klórgren are the cause of unstable earth in the eastern edges of Elderslade.","Completado","Burn the stone-claw corpses within Klórgren"}},
[2665]={nameES="Cat Conundrum",objectivesES={"Complete Quest: No to Cats","Maghôrdo asked for your opinion on what should be done about Furtherholm's cats. You made a decision and acted accordingly. You should report to Maghôrdo at Furtherholm's harbour, near the waterfall.","Cat Conundrum","Talk to Maghôrdo","Complete Quest: Yes to Cats","Many stray cats have made the Furtherholm harbour their home. What should be done about them?","Maghôrdo is unsure of what to do about the cats. He has asked for your opinion - should they stay or should they go?"}},
[2666]={nameES="Cat Conundrum: No to Cats",objectivesES={"The sleepy cat growls at you and dashes away","Shoo the skinny cat","You have shoo'd away each cat in Furtherholm's harbour. You should report to Maghôrdo at Furtherholm's harbour, near the waterfall.","The slinky cat complains and slinks away","Shoo the smelly cat","Shoo the sleepy cat","Completed Cat Conundrum: No to Cats","Return to Maghôrdo","The skinny cat protests before running away","The sassy cat hisses at you and slowly walks away, tail held high","The smelly cat hisses and scurries off","Cat Conundrum: No to Cats","Shoo the sassy cat","Many stray cats have made the Furtherholm harbour their home, and you think they should go.","The scruffy cat hisses and scampers away","Shoo the slinky cat","Shoo the scruffy cat","Maghôrdo has asked you to visit each cat in Furtherholm's harbour area and shoo them away."}},
[2667]={nameES="Cat Conundrum: Yes to Cats",objectivesES={"You have given each cat in Furtherholm's harbour area a bite to eat. You should report to Maghôrdo at Furtherholm's harbour, near the waterfall.","Feed the skinny cat","Feed the smelly cat","The smelly cat swallows the treat whole and rubs on your leg","The slinky cat takes the treat followed by a quick bath","Cat Conundrum: Yes to Cats","Feed the sassy cat","Feed the slinky cat","Feed the sleepy cat","Completed Cat Conundrum: Yes to Cats","The sassy cat snaps up the treat, hisses, and runs away","Return to Maghôrdo","Maghôrdo has asked you to visit each cat in Furtherholms harbour area and give them a bite to eat.","The sleepy cat purrs as it takes the treat and goes back to sleep","Feed the scruffy cat","The scruffy cat nips your finger as it greedily takes the treat","The skinny cat eyes you suspiciously but purrs as it takes your offering","Many stray cats have made the Furtherholm harbour their home, and you think they should stay."}},
[2668]={nameES="Cat Treats",objectivesES={"The cat does not acknowledge your existence, nor does it acknowledge the presence of the treats you leave for it.\
\
Its lack of external desire suggests an inner peace that some might find enviable.\
\
By not acknowledging you, this cat offers wisdom.\
\
Do with that what you will.","The cat does not growl as you approach, but it does not seem thrilled for you to disturb its busy day of doing nothing.\
\
The treats do little to improve your standing.","A local of Lothgobel wants your help distributing treats to cats.","Give treats to the irate cat","Tell Old Grathir that you have given out the treats as he asked.\
\
Old Grathir can be found near the southern entrance of Lothgobel.","Give treats to the disinterested cat","Cat Treats","Talk to Old Grathir","Give treats to the friendly cat","Give treats to the self-satisfied cat","It is true that all the cats of Lothgobel have helped control the rodent population, but this cat has accomplished the most. It left trophies of its conquests in the shoes of the townsfolk as proof of its prowess, something that was most certainly appreciated by all.\
\
The cat accepts the treats as its due payment.","The cat purrs at your approach and even gets up to rub against your leg. The treats are a welcome surprise and it devours all but one. The last one, it seems, is for you, should you wish to sample one.","Old Grathir has asked you to give treats to the cats around Lothgobel."}},
[2669]={nameES="Grabado en defensas de kalpa-kita",objectivesES={"Grabado en defensas de kalpa-kita","Kimmo se encuentra en Pynti-peldot. Deberías llevarle las defensas de kalpa-kita.","Pynti-peldot es la principal fuente de grabados en defensas de kalpa-kita de todo Forochel. Los Lossoth tallan las grandes defensas durante las largas noches de invierno y luego las venden a la gente del sur.","Los kalpa-kita pueden encontrarse dentro y alrededor de su guarida en Leijona-kotin, así como recorriendo el resto de Itä-ma.\
\
Kimmo te ha pedido que le lleves algunas defensas de los kalpa-kita que recorren Forochel.","Regresa con Kimmo con las defensas de kalpa-kita"}},
[2670]={nameES="Catch of the Day",objectivesES={"Fish can be found in the nets that run along the river-bank of the river Ringló.\
\
You should collect fish from the nets.","It looks as if something has washed up on the river-bank","Speak with Laerind","The body is in the village of Ethring.\
\
You should examine the body.","Examinar el cuerpo","The village of Ethring is located in Ringló Vale.\
\
Investigate what washed up on the river-bank in Ethring.","Laerind is located in the village of Ethring.\
\
You should tell Laerind of what you have seen.","Catch of the Day","Investigate what washed up on the river-bank","It looks like the man died very recently, but you cannot deduce a cause of death","You are certain of Laerind's innocence","Laerind has asked you to assist her in collecting provisions for the people of Ethring.","It appears to be the body of a man"}},
[2671]={nameES="Catch of the Day",objectivesES={}},
[2672]={nameES="Catching Chickens",objectivesES={}},
[2673]={nameES="Catching the Eye of the Beast",objectivesES={"You have put an end to Ezôti's shows and saved the animals","Ezôti is nowhere to be found, but Gûshida and a familiar face from the Shield Isles are here.\
\
Speak to Gûshida and Nekhama in the Upper Ward.","Gûshida and Nekhama stand where you expected to find Ezôti.","Catching the Eye of the Beast","Talk to Nekhama across the way from Gûshida"}},
[2674]={nameES="Caught In the Middle",objectivesES={}},
[2675]={nameES="Caught Off-guard",objectivesES={}},
[2676]={nameES="Atrapado en las telarañas",objectivesES={"Has descubierto un broche de Lórien en las telarañas de las Obras Hidráulicas.","Habla con Geirfast en la Sala Vigesimoprimera","Entre las telarañas de las arañas de cristal encuentras un broche. Presenta una hoja verde con vetas plateadas. El nombre de Geirfast está grabado en la parte posterior. Te parece extraño que un broche de Lothlórien lleve el nombre de un enano.","Geirfast está en la Sala Vigesimoprimera.\
\
El broche de Lórien que encontraste tiene grabado el nombre de Geirfast.","Atrapado en las telarañas"}},
[2677]={nameES="Caught in a Vice",objectivesES={"Grimbold has come up with a plan to deal with two problems at once: a treacherous warrior and an imprisoned Ranger. The man he believes to be a lackey of Isengard volunteered to guard the Ranger and might have his fondness for strong drink exploited.","Release Daervunn when Arbald falls asleep. Be careful not to let him see you","Daervunn the Ranger is detained at the Ford of Isen.\
\
You should wait until Arbald drinks himself into a stupour, then cut the imprisoned Ranger loose, but be careful not to let the guard spot you.","Daervunn the Ranger is detained at the Ford of Isen.\
\
When the current guard leaves, put the ale someplace where Arbald is likely to stumble upon it.","Place the ale in the guard's post when the shift changes","Caught in a Vice"}},
[2678]={nameES="Atrapado en la estela",objectivesES={"Istuienn solicita tu ayuda en un asunto de cierta importancia.","Asikko, cacique de los Suuri-lehmä, se encuentra en el campamento de los Hijos de la Tierra situado a lo largo de las colinas al norte de la entrada este de Esteldín.\
\
Istuienn te pidió un favor; te dio una carta y te envió a buscar a Asikko, el cacique de los Hijos de la Tierra que aún es leal a la defensa de Ram Dúath.","Atrapado en la estela","Istuienn está en Esteldín.\
\
Deberías hablar con Istuienn.","Entrega la carta a Asikko","Habla con Istuienn"}},
[2679]={nameES="Causando estragos en Sharmokal",objectivesES={"Causando estragos en Sharmokal","Debes llevar los pernos de metal a Iago.\
\
Iago Rhudd está en Lintrev.","Las máquinas de asedio de Sharmokal son armas mortíferas con un defecto secreto de diseño.","Lleva los pernos a Iago","Iago Rhudd te ha pedido que quites los pernos de metal de las máquinas de asedio de Sharmoka.\
\
Sharmokal se encuentra en el sur de Ciénaga de los Cisness."}},
[2680]={nameES="Cave Growth",objectivesES={}},
[2681]={nameES="Derrumbe",objectivesES={"Defeat all enemies and protect Gimli","Help the Rohirrim soldiers to defend the barricades and defeat the enemies coming from the cavern before Gimli is forced to cave in the entrance.","The enemy has broken through a hidden passageway behind the central Crystal. Gimli reluctantly begins to start caving in the entrance to the passage. Defeat all enemies before Gimli is forced to complete the cave in.\
\
