[2682]={nameES="Derrumbe",objectivesES={"Defeat Troll","Defeat all enemies and protect Gimli","Help the Rohirrim soldiers to defend the barricades and defeat the enemies coming from the cavern before Gimli is forced to cave in the entrance.","The enemy has broken through a hidden passageway behind the central Crystal. Gimli reluctantly begins to start caving in the entrance to the passage. Defeat all enemies before Gimli is forced to complete the cave in.\
\
