[3369]={nameES="Check the Chickens",objectivesES={"You found an egg!","The chicken gives you a dirty look as you claim her egg for yourself","The chicken has no eggs and wishes you wouldn't put so much pressure on it to lay one","This chicken has two eggs. The guilty look in its eye suggests that one might be stolen","Tell Alagiel that you have checked all the chickens for eggs.","The chicken is busy and has no time to entertain your search for eggs","Talk to Alagiel","Check the Chickens","A frazzled farmer needs help looking after her livestock.","Alagiel has asked you to check the chickens of Lothgobel for eggs."}},
[3370]={nameES="Checking for Frogs",objectivesES={"The frog traps can be found in the marshes of the delta west of Iridír.","Bring the frogs to Zildug in Iridír","You have collected all the frogs from the traps. You should bring them to Zildug in Iridír.","This trap is empty","Zildug has asked you to check his frog traps and bring him what you find.","Checking for Frogs"}},
[3371]={nameES="Checking for Intruders",objectivesES={}},
[3372]={nameES="Checking on the Neighbours",objectivesES={"Talk to Sûlmur","Checking on the Neighbours","Turizi would like you to check on the welfare of Sûlmur at her papyrus farm in Ambarûl, east of Ekagar.","Turizi has asked if you wouldn't mind visiting a neighbouring papyrus farm."}},
[3373]={nameES="Comprobando las fronteras",objectivesES={"Se te ha ordenado buscar hacia el este, a lo largo de la garganta, muy al norte de los campos de Bree, más allá de la Granja Hengstacer, para encontrar a un líder orco y su séquito.\
\
Andreg teme que los orcos se hayan adentrado demasiado en las Tierras de Bree, aunque solo un pequeño número pasó por Puente de Caballetes. Esto le preocupa mucho. Te envió a investigar y a asestar un golpe contra los orcos.","El descubrimiento de orcos en las Tierras de Bree ha preocupado a Andreg, el Montaraz.","Derrota a Gazbúrz","Habla con Andreg en el Viejo Fuerte del Camino Verde","Andreg está en el Viejo Fuerte del Camino Verde.\
\
Debes regresar con Andreg y contarle sobre el campamento orco que descubriste a lo largo de la garganta, en los confines más septentrionales de las Tierras de Bree.","Comprobando las fronteras","Gazbúrz derrotado"}},
[3374]={nameES="Checking the Traps",objectivesES={"Checking the Traps","Haldil, a local at the Cape Docks, enjoys working on the shore and on the water.","La trampa está vacía","Fish traps can be found around the shores of either of the Cape islands.\
\
You should check the traps for fish.","Haldil is down by the Cape Docks.\
\
You should speak to Haldil when you have a moment.","Talk to Haldil"}},
[3375]={nameES="Carrera de Gallina",objectivesES={"Carrera de Gallina","Te han engañado. Parece que esta gallina estaba destinada a ser la cena de las fuerzas de Angmar. Salva tu pellejo y llega a Glân Vraig.","Sobrevive al viaje hasta Glân Vraig.","Llega a las afueras de Glân Vraig"}},
[3376]={nameES="Pollos de vuelta al gallinero",objectivesES={"Colocas al pollo en el suelo y este intenta escapar de nuevo, aunque sin éxito","Recupera el segundo pollo escapado","Habla con Mushêndu fuera del corral de los pollos.","Recupera el primer pollo escapado","Colocas al pollo en el suelo, seguro dentro del corral de Mushêndu, y le das una charla seria sobre quedarse adentro","Recupera el tercer pollo escapado","Habla con Mushêndu","Recupera los pollos escapados de Mushêndu.","Recupera el cuarto pollo escapado","Encuentra al explorador","Encuentra al explorador.","Colocas al pollo en el suelo y le dices que se mantenga alejado de los chacales. Te parpadea","Colocas al pollo en el suelo y este asiente ligeramente en señal de agradecimiento. O quizás vio un gusano en la tierra","Un granjero local fuera de Urmâkh ha pedido ayuda para reunir sus pollos escapados.","Habla con el granjero Mushêndu.","Pollos de vuelta al gallinero","Habla con el granjero Mushêndu","Cierras la puerta detrás de ti. Los pollos intercambian una mirada significativa, quizás planeando su próxima escapada"}},
[3377]={nameES="Jefe de los invasores",objectivesES={"Toca el cuerno de invocación en Barad Morlas y derrota a Horngoth.","El cuerno de invocación se encuentra al pie norte de un puente en Barad Morlas, al suroeste de Echad Eregion.\
\
Lengliel te ha pedido que uses el cuerno de invocación de Barad Morlas para desafiar a Horngoth, el líder de los semiorcos de allí.","Lengliel te pidió que reunieras varios estandartes de la Mano Blanca y se los llevaras. Gracias a ellos, ha podido averiguar la identidad del líder de los semiorcos.","Lengliel está en Echad Eregion, al noreste de Barad Morlas.\
\
Debes regresar con Lengliel y contarle sobre tu victoria en Barad Morlas.","Horngoth derrotado","Jefe de los invasores","Habla con Lengliel en Echad Eregion"}},
[3378]={nameES="Caudillo Gûrsh",objectivesES={"Caudillo Gûrsh","Derrota al caudillo Gûrsh","Has derrotado al caudillo Gûrsh","El caudillo Gûrsh, líder de las fuerzas del norte de Angmar, se encuentra en la Biblioteca de Tham Mírdain, justo al suroeste de Echad Mirobel.\
\
Ornras, de Echad Mirobel, te ha pedido que reúnas a un pequeño grupo de combatientes y derroques al caudillo Gûrsh, con la esperanza de que esto debilite la presencia enemiga del norte sin llamar la atención del sur. Los enemigos han estado rebuscando en la Biblioteca en busca de historia olvidada que pueda ser útil para su causa."}},
[3379]={nameES="Chieftain of the Dead",objectivesES={"Defeated Henmaru","Searching for the source of the madness that has befallen the creatures of the marsh, you tracked the draugar to a cave in the Wódfen.","The draug-chieftain probably dwells somewhere in the depths of their cave.\
\
You should hunt for the draug-chieftain and put an end to its existence.","There are Rohirrim at Eaworth, south of the Wódfen.\
\
You should bring news of your victory against Henmaru to the Rohirrim.","Talk to someone at Eaworth","Searching for the source of the madness that has befallen the creatures of the marsh, you tracked the draugar to a cave in the Wódfen.\
\
You should enter Byrgenstow and defeat the chieftain of the draugar.","Somewhere in the depths of Byrgenstow, the ruler of the draugar dwells","Chieftain of the Dead","Defeat Henmaru"}},
[3380]={nameES="Children of Terror",objectivesES={}},
[3381]={nameES="Children of the Sisters",objectivesES={"Speak to someone in Malbarth about travelling east","DNT -- will not be seen","Children of the Sisters","Erianir of Sarnhad has begged you to travel north to Malbarth before journeying east to Ost Anglebed for fear of the growing Corsair and Haradrim force on the coast.","Malbarth can be found to the north of Sarnhad in western Lebennin.\
\
Erianir has asked you to travel north to Malbarth before journeying east in Lebennin as the Corsair and Haradrim forces have seized much of the eastern lands."}},
[3382]={nameES="Tumularios glaciales",objectivesES={"Tumularios glaciales","Los muertos ancestrales se han alzado en el Gran Túmulo.","Los tumularios glaciales se pueden encontrar en el ala inundada del Gran Túmulo."}},
[3383]={nameES="Frío hasta los Huesos",objectivesES={"Los campamentos gauradan están al sur de la morada de Thorgest.\
\
Thorgest te ha pedido que registres los campamentos de los Gauredain con la esperanza de encontrar algún remedio para el mal que le aflige.","Frío hasta los Huesos","Thorgest parece haber caído gravemente enfermo por las armas envenenadas de los Gauredain.","La morada de Thorgest está al norte de los campamentos gauradan.\
\
Debes llevar a Thorgest las reliquias gauradan que hayas recogido para ver si puede hallar una cura entre ellas."}},
[3384]={nameES="Chipping the Bones",objectivesES={"Gather a sample of dragon horn","Gather a sample of dragon spine","Gather a sample of dragon tooth","Lore-master Rúni is at Zudramdân in Elderslade.\
\
You should bring the dragon samples to Lore-master Rúni.","Return to Rúni","Chipping the Bones","Dragon skeletons can be found in Malkorlash, in northern Elderslade.\
\
Lore-master Rúni has asked you to get samples of dragon bones.","Scattered across Elderslade, the sun-bleached bones of great worms are a harsh reminder of the dragons that once prowled these mountains. What secrets might these skeletons hold?","Gather a sample of dragon claw","Gather a sample of dragon rib"}},
[3385]={nameES="Chittering in the Dark",objectivesES={}},
[3386]={nameES="Chitterings at Rasping-crag",objectivesES={"Serric has asked you to reduce the cave-claw infestation in the nearby mountains.\
\
Cave-claws have been spotted at the foot of the mountainside west of Ost Arndír.","You should let Serric know that you have lessened the number of cave-claws at Rasping-crag.\
\
Serric is in Ost Arndír.","Chitterings at Rasping-crag","Return to Serric","Chittering and feral growls have been heard in a once-quiet forest outside of Ost Arndír."}},
[3387]={nameES="Lianas asfixiantes",objectivesES={}},
[3388]={nameES="Choose Wisely",objectivesES={"The time has come to choose your clan allegiance. All you need do is speak with one of the emissaries and choose to represent them on the field of battle.","Choose a clan and receive their blessing","Having met the emissaries of the clans, you must now make a decision. What clan shall you represent in the conflict of the Ettenmoors?","Choose Wisely"}},
[3389]={nameES="Chopping Wood",objectivesES={}},
[3390]={nameES="Cortar el bosque",objectivesES={"Totâkhri chilla, ¡dejando escapar un agudo grito de batalla!","Totâkhri cae, crujiendo mientras su corteza se parte y se agrieta","Encuentra y derrota a Totâkhri, la Raíz Podrida.","Derrota a los Ucornos en la afectada Arboleda Muerta y quema sus retoños.","La podredumbre de Adagím se está extendiendo. Amenaza con traer la plaga a Kighân. Corta los árboles inquietos y quema la plaga en la Arboleda Muerta.","Encuentra y derrota a Totâkhri, la Raíz Podrida","Cortar el bosque"}},
[3391]={nameES="Tareas terminadas",objectivesES={"Se han terminado todas las tareas para preparar la granja para el mercado.","Tareas terminadas","Albin Cotonorte está en la zona del mercado.\
\
Albin Cotonorte querrá saber que todas las tareas están terminadas y que la granja está lista.","Habla con Albin Cotonorte"}},
[3392]={nameES="Chronicle: At the Stone of Erech",objectivesES={"You think about what you have read and ponder the history of the Oath-breakers as it was told to you by Candaith of the Dúnedain.","You have chosen to read from the Chronicle of Events concerning the history of the Oath-breakers and the Paths of the Dead.","Cierra las Crónicas de los Acontecimientos","Chronicle: At the Stone of Erech","You have chosen to read from the Chronicle of Events concerning the story of the Oath-breakers and the Paths of the Dead.","You turn the pages and come to an account of the Oath-breakers and the Paths of the Dead.","Read from the Chronicle of Events and complete At the Stone of Erech","You have read from the Chronicle of Events of the history of the Oath-breakers and the Paths of the Dead.","You turn the pages and become immersed in the chronicle of 'At the Stone of Erech.'"}},
[3393]={nameES="Crónica: La hija del caos",objectivesES={"Has leído las Crónicas de los Acontecimientos sobre la caída de Narmeleth hace mucho tiempo.","Al pasar las páginas, llegas a un relato sobre la caída de Narmeleth hace mucho tiempo.","Cierra las Crónicas de los Acontecimientos","Has elegido leer las Crónicas de los Acontecimientos sobre la caída de Narmeleth hace mucho tiempo.","Crónica: La hija del caos","Lee las Crónicas de los Acontecimientos y completa La hija del caos","Has elegido leer las Crónicas de los Acontecimientos sobre la caída de Narmeleth.","Piensas en lo que has leído y reflexionas sobre la caída de Narmeleth tal como te la contó ella misma.","Al pasar las páginas, te sumerges en la crónica de 'La hija del caos'."}},
[3394]={nameES="Chronicle: The Breaking of the Fellowship",objectivesES={"Cierra las Crónicas de los Acontecimientos","You turn the pages and come to an account of Boromir of Gondor and the Fellowship of the Ring, on Parth Galen in the East Wall.","Chronicle: The Breaking of the Fellowship","You have chosen to read from the Chronicle of Events concerning Boromir of Gondor and the Fellowship of the Ring.","You have chosen to read from the Chronicle of Events concerning the story of Boromir of Gondor on Parth Galen.","You have read from the Chronicle of Events of the history of Boromir of Gondor and the Fellowship of the Ring on Parth Galen, in the East Wall.","Pasas las páginas y te sumerges en la crónica titulada «La Ruptura de la Comunidad»","You think about what you have read and ponder the history of Boromir of Gondor and the Fellowship of the Ring on Parth Galen.","Lee la Crónica de los Acontecimientos y completa «La Ruptura de la Comunidad»"}},
[3395]={nameES="Crónica: La caída de Moria",objectivesES={"Lee la Crónica de los Acontecimientos y completa La caída de Moria","Crónica: La caída de Moria","Piensas en lo que has leído y lamentas la pérdida de tanta gente en las profundidades de Moria.","Cierra las Crónicas de los Acontecimientos","Has leído en la Crónica de los Acontecimientos la caída de Moria y deberías cerrar el libro.","Pasas las páginas y llegas al relato de la caída de Moria. Es una lectura sombría.","Has decidido leer en la Crónica de los Acontecimientos sobre la caída de Moria.","Pasas las páginas y te sumerges en la crónica de la 'Caída de Moria'."}},
[3396]={nameES="Crónica: El Destino de Laerdan",objectivesES={"Has leído el pasaje de las Crónicas de los Acontecimientos sobre la huida de Laerdan hacia Eregion mientras estaba en posesión de Narchuil.","Lee las Crónicas de los Acontecimientos y completa El Destino de Laerdan.","Has elegido leer un pasaje de las Crónicas de los Acontecimientos sobre la huida de Laerdan hacia Eregion mientras estaba en posesión de Narchuil.","Reflexionas sobre lo que has leído y meditas acerca de los actos de Laerdan en Eregion.","Crónica: El Destino de Laerdan","Cierra las Crónicas de los Acontecimientos","Pasas las páginas y llegas a un relato sobre la huida de Laerdan hacia Eregion mientras estaba en posesión de Narchuil.","Has elegido leer un pasaje de las Crónicas de los Acontecimientos acerca del destino de Laerdan durante su huida a Eregion.","Pasas las páginas y te sumerges en la crónica titulada 'El Destino de Laerdan'."}},
[3397]={nameES="Chronicle: The Horn of Gondor",objectivesES={"You have chosen to read from the Chronicle of Events concerning the story of Boromir's last stand.","You turn the pages and come to an account of the last stand of Boromir of Gondor.","Cierra las Crónicas de los Acontecimientos","Chronicle: The Horn of Gondor","You have read from the Chronicle of Events of the history of the last stand of Boromir of Gondor.","Lee la Crónica de los Acontecimientos y completa «El Cuerno de Gondor»","Pasas las páginas y te sumerges en la crónica titulada 'El Cuerno de Gondor'.","You think about what you have read and ponder the last stand of Boromir of Gondor.","You have chosen to read from the Chronicle of Events concerning the last stand of Boromir of Gondor."}},
[3398]={nameES="Chronicle: The House of Isildur",objectivesES={"You have chosen to read from the Chronicle of Events concerning the story of the heirs of Isildur throughout history.","You have read from the Chronicle of Events of the history of the heirs of Isildur.","Cierra las Crónicas de los Acontecimientos","You think about what you have read and ponder the history of the heirs of Isildur as it was told to you by Candaith of the Dúnedain.","You turn the pages and become immersed in the chronicle of 'The House of Isildur.'","Read from the Chronicle of Events and complete The House of Isildur","You have chosen to read from the Chronicle of Events concerning the history of the heirs of Isildur.","Chronicle: The House of Isildur","You turn the pages and come to an account of the heirs of Isildur throughout history."}},
[3399]={nameES="Chronicle: The Point of Decision",objectivesES={"You have chosen to read from the Chronicle of Events concerning Frodo Baggins and the Fellowship of the Ring.","You turn the pages and become immersed in the chronicle of 'The Point of Decision.'","Chronicle: The Point of Decision","You turn the pages and come to an account of Frodo Baggins and the Fellowship of the Ring, on Parth Galen in the East Wall.","Read from the Chronicle of Events and complete The Point of Decision","Cierra las Crónicas de los Acontecimientos","You have chosen to read from the Chronicle of Events concerning the story of Frodo Baggins and his Fellowship on Parth Galen.","You have read from the Chronicle of Events of the history of Frodo Baggins and the Fellowship of the Ring on Parth Galen, in the East Wall.","You think about what you have read and ponder the history of Frodo Baggins and the Fellowship of the Ring on Parth Galen."}},
[3400]={nameES="Crónica: El Prisionero de Sammath Baul",objectivesES={"Has leído el pasaje de las Crónicas de los Acontecimientos sobre el encarcelamiento de Laerdan en Sammath Baul y ahora deberías cerrar el libro.","Cierra las Crónicas de los Acontecimientos","Pasas las páginas y llegas a un relato sobre el encarcelamiento de Laerdan en la torre de Sammath Baul. Es una lectura lúgubre, pues está tomada del testimonio de sus carceleros.","Has elegido leer un pasaje de las Crónicas de los Acontecimientos sobre el encarcelamiento de Laerdan en Sammath Baul.","Lee las Crónicas de los Acontecimientos y completa El Prisionero de Sammath Baul.","Reflexionas sobre lo que has leído y meditas acerca de las acciones de los servidores de Angmar.","Pasas las páginas y te sumerges en la crónica titulada 'El Prisionero de Sammath Baul'.","Crónica: El Prisionero de Sammath Baul","Has elegido leer un pasaje de las Crónicas de los Acontecimientos acerca del extraño encarcelamiento de Laerdan en Sammath Baul."}},
[3401]={nameES="Chronicle: The Wizard's Vale",objectivesES={"You turn the pages and come to an account of Isengard, the Wizard's Vale.","You think about what you have read and ponder the history of the Wizard's Vale.","Cierra las Crónicas de los Acontecimientos","Chronicle: The Wizard's Vale","Lee la Crónica de los Acontecimientos y completa El Valle del Mago","You have chosen to read from the Chronicle of Events concerning the Wizard's Vale of Isengard.","You have chosen to read from the Chronicle of Events concerning the story of the Wizard's Vale.","Pasas las páginas y te sumerges en la crónica de «El Valle del Mago».","You have read from the Chronicle of Events of some of the history of the Wizard's Vale."}},
[3402]={nameES="Chronicle: Two Hobbits",objectivesES={"Cierra las Crónicas de los Acontecimientos","You turn the pages and become immersed in the chronicle of 'Two Hobbits.'","You think about what you have read and ponder the history of Samwise Gamgee and the Fellowship of the Ring on Parth Galen.","Read from the Chronicle of Events and complete Two Hobbits","You have read from the Chronicle of Events of the history of Samwise Gamgee and the Fellowship of the Ring on Parth Galen, in the East Wall.","You have chosen to read from the Chronicle of Events concerning the story of Samwise Gamgee and the Fellowship on Parth Galen.","Chronicle: Two Hobbits","You turn the pages and come to an account of Samwise Gamgee and the Fellowship of the Ring, on Parth Galen in the East Wall.","You have chosen to read from the Chronicle of Events concerning Samwise Gamgee and the Fellowship of the Ring."}},
[3403]={nameES="Crónica: No podemos salir",objectivesES={"Piensas en lo que has leído y lamentas la muerte de Balin y sus leales compañeros en las oscuras profundidades de Moria.","Has elegido leer de las Crónicas de los Acontecimientos sobre el triste final de la expedición de Balin.","Lee de las Crónicas de los Acontecimientos y completa 'No podemos salir'","Al pasar las páginas, llegas a un relato sobre el triste final de la expedición de Balin. Es una lectura sombría.","Cierra las Crónicas de los Acontecimientos","Crónica: No podemos salir","Al pasar las páginas, te sumerges en la crónica 'No podemos salir'","Has leído de las Crónicas de los Acontecimientos sobre el triste final de la expedición de Balin y deberías cerrar el libro.","Has elegido leer de las Crónicas de los Acontecimientos sobre el triste final de la expedición de Balin a Moria."}},
[3404]={nameES="Chronicling the Blight: Flora",objectivesES={"Chronicling the Blight: Flora","You have gathered samples of the blighted flora outside of Sul Madásh. Return the samples you collected to Serâna.","Serâna has asked for you gather samples of the blighted flora near Sul Madásh so that she can study them and see how the rot affects different plants.","Return the flora samples to Serâna"}},
[3405]={nameES="Chronicling the Blight: Insects",objectivesES={"You gathered insects from the marsh waters outside of Sul Madásh. Return the samples you collected to Serâna.","Chronicling the Blight: Insects","Return the insect samples to Serâna","Serâna has asked for you search the waters near Sul Madásh and gather insects found there so that she can study them for signs of blight."}},
[3406]={nameES="Chronicling the Blight: Sap",objectivesES={"Serâna has asked for your help gathering sap from the trees outside of Sul Madásh so that she can study the blight within them.","Chronicling the Blight: Sap","You found blighted sap within the trees outside of Sul Madásh. Return the samples you collected to Serâna.","Return the sap samples to Serâna"}},
[3407]={nameES="Espuma agitada",objectivesES={"Ansurr se encuentra en Hulwul-nefekh, al noreste de la Gran Rueda.\
\
Ansurr estará encantado de saber que has localizado la rueda de agua y que has eliminado a las criaturas cercanas.","Encuentra la antigua rueda de agua","Habla con Ansurr en Hulwul-nefekh","Las ruedas de agua de Moria fueron una vez fundamentales para alimentar y enfriar los grandes fuegos de las antiguas forjas.","Las ruedas de agua se encuentran en la Gran Rueda, al suroeste de Hulwul-nefekh.\
\
Ansurr te ha pedido que encuentres una gran rueda de agua que ya no funciona, cerca de las Obras Hidráulicas. Una vez que la hayas encontrado, elimina a las criaturas cercanas para asegurarla.","Espuma agitada","Una gran rueda de agua yace quieta en el agua cercana"}},
[3408]={nameES="Circle of Wrath: Culling the Troops",objectivesES={"Return to Thornaran and tell him you successfully defeated Orcs in Minas Morgul.","Two forces of Orcs are fortifying the outer ring of Minas Morgul. Thornaran has asked you to defeat warriors in either camp.","Talk to Thornaran","Two Orc armies inhabit the Circle of Wrath in Minas Morgul.\
\
You should venture forth and defeat Orcs from either army.","Circle of Wrath: Culling the Troops"}},
[3409]={nameES="Circle of Wrath: Gothmog's Captain",objectivesES={"Defeat one of Gothmog's captains in Zhar Dushgoi","Defeated one of Gothmog's captains","Return to Thornaran and inform him that you defeated an Orc captain in Zhar Dushgoi.","Circle of Wrath: Gothmog's Captain","Talk to Thornaran","A powerful host of Orcs makes camp within Zhar Dushgoi.\
\
You should seek out one of the captains in Zhar Dushgoi and defeat him.","Zhar Dushgoi lies east of Barad Angarth in the outer ring of Minas Morgul. Thornaran asked you to seek out and defeat its Orc captains."}},
[3410]={nameES="Circle of Wrath: Scourging the Scouts",objectivesES={}},
[3411]={nameES="Circle of Wrath: Squashing the Sergeants",objectivesES={}},
[3412]={nameES="Circle of Wrath: Ugrukhôr's Captain",objectivesES={}},
[3413]={nameES="Circles of Silence",objectivesES={}},
[3414]={nameES="La mirada del enemigo",objectivesES={"La mirada del enemigo","Candaith te ha explicado que los crebain que sobrevuelan la región del Monte Ventoso no son inocentes aves, sino criaturas maléficas enviadas para espiar estas tierras. Para asegurarte de que no regresen a informar a sus amos de lo que han visto, hay que matarlos y arrancarles los ojos.","Los crebain se pueden encontrar por todas las Colinas de los Vientos. El campamento de Candaith está al pie de la Cima de los Vientos, en las Tierras Solitarias.\
\
Candaith te ha encargado que busques y destruyas a los crebain que se encuentran en las inmediaciones de su campamento. Él cree que están aquí por orden de algún amo invisible y que informarán de todo lo que han visto.","Lleva los ojos de craban a Candaith."}},
[3415]={nameES="Circling The Kill",objectivesES={}},
[3416]={nameES="Circling the Prey",objectivesES={}},
[3417]={nameES="City of the Golden Wood",objectivesES={"Randiron is in Telain Galadhrim, beneath the flet on which the trainers reside, down the western path and along the first right turn.\
\
Trevadiel told you to seek Randiron to learn more of the ways of Caras Galadhon.","Talk to Rainen at Telain Galadhrim","City of the Golden Wood","Talk to Randiron near Telain Galadhrim","Talk to Padril at Telain Galadhrim","Padril can be found at Telain Galadhrim, on the level above Rainen, reached by climbing the ladder.\
\
Rainen has asked you to speak with her friend Padril.","Rainen is at Telain Galadhrim, the flet upon which the trainers reside, up the winding steps from Randiron.\
\
Randiron has told you to speak with his friend Rainen.","Trevadiel has welcomed you to Caras Galadhon and wants you to become familiar with the city."}},
[3418]={nameES="City of the Prince",objectivesES={"City of the Prince","Heartened by your victories in Edhellond, Gilanor seeks your aid in protecting the great city of Dol Amroth.","DNT -- will not be seen","The city of Dol Amroth can be found to the west of Ost Lontir.\
\
Gilanor has asked you to offer your services to the people of Dol Amroth.","Talk to a guard outside the eastern gate of Dol Amroth"}},
[3419]={nameES="Civilian Defence",objectivesES={"A troll has reached the women and children!","The enemy is making a final assault on the raised central area of the Glittering Caves. Protect the civilians that are gathered there and defeat all enemies.\
\
Merit Rating\
\
This quest starts with <rgb=#FFFF00>full</rgb> Merit Rating.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Major Point Loss</rgb>\
- Barricade destroyed\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Moderate Point Loss</rgb>\
- Barricade Guard defeated\
- Orc Defiler heals a Troll\
- Civilian attacked","Do not allow any trolls to reach the women and children","Civilian Defence","Protect the civilians at the central camp and defeat the trolls.","Defeat the trolls"}},
[3420]={nameES="Civilian Defence",objectivesES={}},
[3421]={nameES="Recuperar la joya",objectivesES={"Roibeard se encuentra en los campamentos angmarim cerca del Umbral de Hierro, al noreste de Pynti-peldot.\
\
Esko te ha dicho dónde los Angmarim mantienen la Joya de Hielo. Debes recuperarlo antes de que pueda ser devuelto a las cámaras de Angmar.","Has recuperado la Joya de Hielo","Recuperar la joya","Lleva la Joya de Hielo a Esko en Pynti-peldot","Esko te ha dicho que el Hylje-heimo podría inclinarse a apoyar a los Pueblos Libres del Sur si se recupera la Joya de Hielo.","Recoge la Joya de Hielo"}},
[3422]={nameES="Reclamando el pasado",objectivesES={"Pálmar se encuentra en Anazârmekhem, al noreste de las forjas de Khazad-dûm.\
\
Ayudaste a Raf y a Sigir con sus tareas y ahora debes hablar con Pálmar para ganarte su favor ante Narfi.","Ayuda a Sigir en sus esfuerzos de recuperación","Ayuda a Raf a expulsar a los uruks de las forjas","Reclamando el pasado","Habla con Pálmar en Anazârmekhem","Raf y Sigir están en Anazârmekhem.\
\
Pálmar te pidió que hablaras con Raf y Sigir y que les ayudaras a despejar las forjas de Khazad-dûm.","Las forjas de Khazad-dûm fueron en su día el corazón herrero de Moria. Aquí, los inigualables herreros enanos trabajaban el mithril y forjaban sus mayores maravillas. Desde su caída, las forjas de Khazad-dûm se han visto inundadas por enormes aludes de lava y pobladas por los orcos de Moria y sus trols y trasgos. Aquí, el ejército orco trabaja sin cesar, construyendo armas y máquinas de asedio en preparación para la guerra contra Lothlórien.","Ayuda a Sigir a recuperar las herramientas robadas"}},
[3423]={nameES="Clampjaw's Wrath",objectivesES={}},
[3424]={nameES="Claws In the Clough",objectivesES={}},
[3425]={nameES="Claws for Excitement (Daily)",objectivesES={}},
[3426]={nameES="Claws in the Firien",objectivesES={}},
[3427]={nameES="Claws of Obstruction",objectivesES={"Tunnels in the north-east side of the Pit of Stonejaws contain many cave-claws and deep-claws.","Claws of Obstruction","Gráfar Splitstone needs your help clearing out a den of beasts.","Gráfar Splitstone waits to hear about your efforts against the cave-claws.","Habla con Gráfar Partipiedra"}},
[3428]={nameES="Garras de las profundidades",objectivesES={"Garras de las profundidades","Los Rascabismos pueden encontrarse en la Gran Excavación, especialmente en el camino oriental desde el Mirador de la Gran Excavación.\
\
Deberías derrotar a muchos Rascabismos en la Gran Excavación, pero sería prudente centrar tu atención en la ruta oriental hacia Zelem-melek.","Regresa con Wafri en el Mirador de la Gran Excavación","Los Rascabismos vagan por la Gran Excavación, especialmente cerca del Mirador de la Gran Excavación. Estos monstruosos excavadores hacen que las profundidades sean inestables.","Wafri se encuentra en el campamento del Mirador de la Gran Excavación en la Gran Excavación.\
\
Deberías hablar con Wafri y decirle que has derrotado a muchos Rascabismos en los alrededores."}},
[3429]={nameES="Garras de la Tierra",objectivesES={"Los devastadores con pico de cuchilla se pueden encontrar por todo el Ram Dúath.\
\
Reko te ha pedido que le traigas los picos de los devastadores con pico de cuchilla que desea.","Reko, el cazador de los Hijos de la Tierra, desea los picos de los devastadores con pico de cuchilla, aunque no dirá para qué.","Garras de la Tierra","Lleva los picos de los devastadores con pico de cuchilla a Reko, que te espera en Lehmä-koti."}},
[3430]={nameES="Clean-up Duty",objectivesES={}},
[3431]={nameES="Cleaning House",objectivesES={}},
[3432]={nameES="Cleaning Up Dalugronk",objectivesES={}},
[3433]={nameES="Cleaning Up Shagrat's Garrison",objectivesES={"You have burned many of the dead Orcs from Shagrat's garrison. Perhaps it is best if Captain Róglarg continues to believe that an Elf-warrior slew Shagrat's Orcs, rather than a quarrel over Frodo's mithril-coat.","Slain Orcs from Shagrat's garrison can be found throughout Cirith Ungol.\
\
Disappointed in the actions of his predecessor, Captain Róglarg has asked you to burn any slain Orcs you discover in Cirith Ungol.","You have burned many of the dead Orcs from Shagrat's garrison.","Captain Róglarg is irritated that the dead Orcs of Captain Shagrat's garrison still litter Cirith Ungol.","Completado","Cleaning Up Shagrat's Garrison"}},
[3434]={nameES="Cleaning Up the Halls",objectivesES={"Master smith, Grámi Hornhelm, wants Máttugard cleaned up and looking more a city and less a tomb.","Cleaning Up the Halls","Grámi Hornhelm can be found at Maergrind in Máttugard.\
\
You should talk to Grámi Hornhelm.","Stone trolls can be found west of Maergrind.\
\
You should destroy any of the stone trolls that you find.","Talk to Grámi Hornhelm"}},
[3435]={nameES="Cleaning the Gut",objectivesES={"Find the hidden store-room","You have collected a good amount of spoils. Perhaps this is enough for Mânobaz.\
\
Mânobaz can be found next to the Black Anchor.","Cleaning the Gut","Mânobaz has asked you to steal a portion of spoils that is rightfully his from the The Eastern Stores.\
\
The Eastern Stores can be found on the east side of the Lower Ward in the Cistern.","Talk to Mânobaz","Mânobaz is feeling ostracized by his cohorts even after helping to plunder and raid.","You have found the Eastern Stores. The plunder should be stored within."}},
[3436]={nameES="Cleaning the Streets",objectivesES={}},
[3437]={nameES="Limpia las Ruinas de Sarnúr",objectivesES={"Los trolls de las nieves están entre muchas criaturas malignas que han tomado refugio en las ruinas de la antigua ciudad enana llamada Sarnúr por los Elfos.","Habla con Snár en la Mansión de Thorin","Los trolls de las nieves pueden encontrarse en lo profundo de Sarnúr, al sur de la Mansión de Thorin, accediendo a través de las ruinas de Orodost.\
\
Snár te ha pedido que entres en las antiguas ruinas de Sarnúr y derrotes a varios de los trolls de las nieves reunidos allí.","Limpia las Ruinas de Sarnúr","Snár está en la Mansión de Thorin, al norte de Sarnúr, justo fuera del Cuartel de la Piedra Azul.\
\
Debes regresar con Snár con noticias de tu victoria contra los trolls de las nieves."}},
[3438]={nameES="Cleansed of Fear",objectivesES={"Talk to Tucharn","Glathril can be found in Erynos in eastern Lebennin.\
\
You have examined the fallen Corsairs and should now return to Glathril.","This Corsair's clothing is drenched and his boots overflow with water","This Corsair lies facedown in a puddle","Talk to Glathril","Corsairs can be found along the road outside Erynos.\
\
Tucharn has asked you to look over the fallen Corsairs on the road out of Erynos.","Cleansed of Fear","In the wake of a mysteriously stifled Corsair attack, the people of Erynos have been granted an unexpected peace.","Tucharn can be found in Erynos in eastern Lebennin.\
\
Glathril is unclear how the Corsairs met with such a fate and asks you to speak to Tucharn.","This Corsair's clothing is damp to the touch","This Corsair appears to have drowned, despite being just outside Erynos","Nimithil can be found in Ost Anglebed in north-central Lebennin.\
\
You have found the people of Erynos safe from harm, and should now tell Nimithil of what happened.","Talk to Nimithil in Ost Anglebed"}},
[3439]={nameES="Poción purificadora",objectivesES={"Calengil está en Duillond, al norte de Celondim.\
\
Debes devolver las hierbas que recogiste a Calengil.","Las hierbas se pueden encontrar a lo largo de la ribera del río debajo de Duillond. \
\
Calengil te ha pedido que recuperes las hierbas que necesita para completar la poción purificadora.","Calengil te ha pedido que recojas algunas hierbas para él como parte de una poción que está creando para limpiar una oscura corrupción de las ruinas cerca de Duillond.","Devuelve las hierbas que recogiste a Calengil","Poción purificadora"}},
[3440]={nameES="Cleansing Kêr Bréin",objectivesES={}},
[3441]={nameES="Cleansing by Fire",objectivesES={}},
[3442]={nameES="Cleansing the Cave",objectivesES={}},
[3443]={nameES="Cleansing the Dvergvát",objectivesES={"Cleansing the Dvergvát","The rivers of Elderslade are polluted, fouling the sparkling waters of the Dvergvát.","Piles of Orc-filth can be found along river-beds in Elderslade.\
\
Mother Amma has tasked you with cleansing the rivers that flow into the Dvergvát.","Talk to Mother Amma","Mother Amma is in Annâk-khurfu, in eastern Elderslade.\
\
You should talk to Mother Amma."}},
[3444]={nameES="Cleansing the Hoarwell",objectivesES={"Captain-General Tordúr explained that scouts near Tol Ascarnen have seen a number of Angmar's servants dumping the contents of barrels into the river. Drawing water from the river shows that the river is slowly being poisoned. If this is allowed to continue, then the hobbits at Hoarhallow will certainly perish.","Cleanse the Hoarwell River of the poison introduced by Angmar","The poison of the Angmarim was introduced here","Poison cleansed","The poison was introduced to the Hoarwell at the waterfall overlooking Tol Ascarnen, in the central area of the Ettenmoors, north-west of Glán Vraig.\
\
Captain-General Tordúr asked you to make your way to the top of the waterfall overlooking Tol Ascarnen to assist in cleansing the poison that the goblins of Angmar introduced into the Hoarwell River.","The cleansing agent has been introduced to the Hoarwell","Captain-General Tordúr is at Glân Vraig.\
\
You should return to Captain-General Tordúr with news of your success.","Cleansing the Hoarwell"}},
[3445]={nameES="Cleansing the Mirkwood",objectivesES={"Habla con Radagast","Cleansing the Mirkwood","You should defeat corrupted roots and give water to trees in need throughout Eryn Lasgalen.","You should return to Radagast, who can be found at the tree nursery just outside of Felegoth.","Radagast has grown concerned by the ailing roots of Eryn Lasgalen and hopes to heal the forest of decay and corruption.","You should collect phials of the Elves' healing draught from within Felegoth."}},
[3446]={nameES="Purificando la madera podrida",objectivesES={"Purificando la madera podrida","Tu misión es viajar a Hordírid al noroeste para detener a los peligrosos Ucornos y limpiar los árboles corrompidos en la zona.","Derrota al Ucorno despiadado de Adagím"}},
[3447]={nameES="Purificando las ruinas",objectivesES={"Encuentra la segunda torre de Dol Ringwest","Usa el brebaje cerca de la primera torre","Usa el brebaje cerca de la segunda torre","Purificando las ruinas","Encuentra la primera torre de Dol Ringwest","Calengil ha preparado su brebaje y te ha ofrecido el honor de limpiar Dol Ringwest. El brebaje, con el tiempo, fomentará el crecimiento de grandes vides que envolverán las ruinas, derribándolas y devolviéndolas a la naturaleza prístina.","Regresa a Calengil en Duillond, al este de Dol Ringwest","Usa el brebaje purificador aquí","Brebaje usado","Dol Ringwest está al oeste de Duillond.\
\
Calengil te pidió que vertieras el brebaje purificador en el suelo, en la base de las dos torres que permanecen en pie en las ruinas de Dol Ringwest.","Calengil está en Duillond, al este de Dol Ringwest.\
\
Debes regresar con Calengil e informarle que tu tarea en las ruinas de Dol Ringwest está completa."}},
[3448]={nameES="Cleansing the Wold of Warg-packs",objectivesES={}},
[3449]={nameES="Despejar los túneles",objectivesES={"El derrumbe que Sót te ha pedido despejar se encuentra en la parte oriental de la Gran Excavación, al sur de la puerta que conduce a la Extensión Solitaria.\
\
Sót, el bibliotecario de la expedición del Mirador de la Gran Excavación, te ha pedido que le ayudes despejando de escombros el camino que lleva a la Extensión Solitaria.","Habla con Sót en el campamento del Mirador de la Gran Excavación","Sót se encuentra en el campamento del Mirador de la Gran Excavación, al suroeste de la Extensión Solitaria.\
\
Los escombros del derrumbe han sido despejados. Deberías regresar con Sót e informarle.","Despejar los túneles","Los caminos que parten del Mirador de la Gran Excavación están obstruidos por escombros y derrumbes, lo que dificulta el tránsito."}},
[3450]={nameES="Agua clara",objectivesES={"Agua clara","Lleva el odre de agua a Northrim","Odre de agua lleno","Llena el odre de agua","El Último Puente está en el extremo oriental del Gran Camino del Este.\
\
Northrim te dio un odre vacío y curado y te pidió que recogieras agua del Fontegrís en el lado norte del Último Puente.","Dentro de las ruinas de Dol Vaeg, Northrim reúne los últimos objetos necesarios para la defensa de Stanric. Pronto los Eglain esperan estar preparados para lo peor: una batalla prolongada contra la oscuridad que se cierne.","Llena el odre de agua en El Último Puente","Northrim espera tu regreso con agua limpia en Dol Vaeg, al oeste del Último Puente.\
\
Fuiste hasta la orilla del Fontegrís y recogiste agua de sus riberas. Debes volver de inmediato con Northrim.","El agua aquí parece fresca y limpia"}},
[3451]={nameES="Clear a Path",objectivesES={"Clear a Path","Talk to Dorgam within the Orc encampment","Inform Dorgam that you have defeated some of the forces surrounding his position. He is east of Barad Angarth.","The Orcs that threaten the Rangers can be found to the east of Barad Angarth.\
\
Deplete the Orc forces as you make your way further into the encampment.","Orcs have fortified the outer ring of Minas Morgul, to the east. Thin the ranks of the Orcs in this area, so the Rangers can proceed further into the Dead City."}},
[3452]={nameES="Despeja los Caminos",objectivesES={"Despeja los Caminos","Osos feroces se han vuelto numerosos y audaces al norte de Noglond, a lo largo del camino que atraviesa el Valle de Thráin, haciendo que viajar por el valle sea inseguro.","La Hondonada del Cazador se encuentra al norte de Noglond.\
\
Ketill te ha pedido que caces osos en la Hondonada del Cazador y reduzcas su número.","Ketill está en Noglond, al sur de la Mansión de Thorin.\
\
Debes regresar con Ketill e informarle del resultado de tu patrulla."}},
[3453]={nameES="Despeja el Camino",objectivesES={"Despeja el Camino","El canal cerca de Gondamon está al oeste, más allá de las colinas.\
\
Otkell, el Maestro Constructor de Gondamon, te informó que los trasgos son responsables de la falta de agua fresca. Te pidió que vayas al área al oeste del canal y elimines la amenaza trasga.","Otkell está en Gondamon, al este del canal, más allá de las colinas.\
\
Deberías regresar con Otkell y contarle sobre los trasgos que derrotaste.","El suministro de agua que llega a Gondamon sigue interrumpido, a pesar de tus esfuerzos por despejar el canal."}},
[3454]={nameES="Clear-cutting Orcs",objectivesES={"Elfrith is hiding beyond the bounds of Ak-ghru.\
\
You should return to Elfrith with news of your success.","Orcs serving the White Hand are clear-cutting the forest and shipping the wood off to an unknown location.","Clear-cutting Orcs","Talk to Elfrith","Orcs can be found at Ak-ghru.\
\
Elfrith has asked you to defeat many of the clear-cutting Orcs."}},
[3455]={nameES="Clearing Cirith Ungol",objectivesES={"Clearing Cirith Ungol","Broodling eggs and encroaching webs can be found in Cirith Ungol's courtyard and the tower interior.\
\
You should destroy broodling eggs and encroaching webs.","A note hangs on the board, signed by Atli Spider-bane:\
\
'We cannot allow Cirith Ungol to become infested with spiders now that it is no longer infested with Orcs! I need someone to get in there and clear some of the eggs and webs, quickly!'","Atli Spider-bane has requested an adventurer to enter Cirith Ungol and clear out some of the spider eggs and webs."}},
[3456]={nameES="Clearing Enemies in Malkorlash",objectivesES={}},
[3457]={nameES="Clearing Enemies in Zarkul-sulûn",objectivesES={"Zarkul-sulûn is crawling with enemies who need to be removed.","Clearing Enemies in Zarkul-sulûn","Zarkul-sulûn can be found in southern Elderslade.\
\
You should defeat enemies within the ruins of Zarkul-sulûn.","Gunvald is in Annâk-khurfu in Elderslade.\
\
Return to Gunvald.","Return to Gunvald"}},
[3458]={nameES="Limpiando Mudmul-charâf",objectivesES={"Muchos orcos acechan en Mudmul-charâf, sin otro propósito que poner en peligro a los Pueblos Libres que recorren Khazad-dûm.","Limpiando Mudmul-charâf","Puedes encontrar orcos en Mudmul-charâf, en los pasajes del noroeste de Zelem-melek.\
\
Deberías derrotar a los orcos en Mudmul-charâf.","Has derrotado a varios orcos en su campamento en Mudmul-charâf, haciendo que las salas de Zelem-melek sean más seguras para los viajeros que van y vienen de la Sala Vigesimoprimera.","Completado"}},
[3459]={nameES="Clearing Shataz-kordh",objectivesES={}},
[3460]={nameES="Clearing the Forest River",objectivesES={"Complete: Victims of the Ambushers","Complete: Trouble Comes Down the Mountain","Lorndúr can be found in Loeglond.\
\
You should talk to Lorndúr.","Lorndúr can be found in Loeglond.\
\
You should complete quests for Lorndúr.","Talk to Lorndúr","Lorndúr has told you of several problems plaguing trade on the Forest River. Help the raft-elves so they can return to trade upon the water!","Clearing the Forest River","Complete: Thievery on the River"}},
[3461]={nameES="Clearing the Path",objectivesES={}},
[3462]={nameES="Limpiando el camino",objectivesES={"Parece que la cabra ha dejado un montón de... desechos en un rincón del campamento. Este sería un buen lugar para dejar la... suciedad del camino.","Habla con Ingifast","Los enanos de la Guardia Orca son cada vez menos. Los que llevaban más tiempo allí se han marchado en una expedición en busca de riquezas y aventuras en las Vetas del Cuerno Rojo.","Añadiste a la pila lo que habías recogido...","Limpiando el camino","Habla con Ossur en la Guardia Orca","Una compañía de enanos de la Guardia Orca partió en busca de riquezas y aventuras que les esperaban en las Vetas del Cuerno Rojo. La mayoría de ellos son mineros de vocación, y estaban perdiendo el ánimo por llevar demasiado tiempo encerrados en la Guardia.","Deja los 'desechos' en el montón que hay cerca de la cabra","Regresa con Ingifast","Los enanos del campamento estarán más dispuestos a hablar contigo ahora que te has librado del olor. Pero las primeras impresiones nunca se olvidan, y puede que te recuerden por eso.","Hay que limpiar el camino que va desde la Guardia Orca hasta las Vetas del Cuerno Rojo, ya que la compañía de enanos dejó mucha suciedad a su paso.","Algunos miembros de la compañía de enanos han acampado al pie de las escaleras que llevan al Cuerno Rojo. Han preferido no abandonar a su cabra ni su carro.","Habla con Thithrand en la Guardia Orca","Habla con Isólf en la Guardia Orca"}},
[3463]={nameES="Limpiando el camino",objectivesES={"You have destroyed many Avanc-jaw traps and cleared the road for passing Rohirrim.","Limpiando el camino","Along the road and throughout the surrounding forest west of Middlemead, you have discovered crude traps of Dunlending make. These traps would hamstring even the mightiest of steeds, and could be deadly to any passing warrior of the Rohirrim.\
\
If you were to destroy these traps, the people of Middlemead would be protected from such a fate, and the road to the Stonedeans would once again be safe to travel.","The road is still strewn with traps.","Cruel traps of Dunlending make litter the road west of Middlemead in hopes of crippling the Rohirrim and their steeds alike.","Completado","You have cleared the road of the Dunlendings' cruel traps and opened the way anew between Kingstead and the Stonedeans. The people of Middlemead are thankful for your aid.","Avanc-jaw traps can be found along the road west out of Middlemead in Kingstead.\
\
You have discovered cruel Dunlending traps and should destroy them to protect the warriors and steeds of Middlemead."}},
[3464]={nameES="Despejando la Ruta del Sur",objectivesES={"Derrota a Ulâmul la Garra","Ulâmul la Garra derrotado","Despejando la Ruta del Sur","Tu misión es investigar la zona donde ha habido muchos informes de bandidos y ponerles fin, así como a su líder, Ulâmul la Garra.","Emplazamiento del ataque descubierto"}},
[3465]={nameES="Clearing the Way",objectivesES={"Clearing the Way","Nidgyl is at Bree-town in Bree-land, far to the south of the North Downs.\
\
You should return to Nidgyl and tell him of your assault against the Tarkrîp Orcs.","Tarkrîp Orcs can be found in Nan Wathren, north-east of Trestlebridge in the North Downs, far to the north of Bree.\
\
Nidgyl has asked you to defeat the Tarkrîp Orcs in Nan Wathren.","Nidgyl is concerned with the Tarkrîp-raiders who have been ambushing the Rangers and their convoys of late in Nan Wathren.","Talk to Nidgyl"}},
[3466]={nameES="Clearing the Way",objectivesES={"Talk to Dagoras near the gates of Isengard","Clearing the Way","Dagoras is encamped near the gates of Isengard.\
\
You should return to Dagoras with news of your success.","There are half-orcs along the road to Isengard.\
\
Dagoras has asked you to defeat the half-orcs waiting in ambush for Grimbold's emissary.","Grimbold has sent an emissary Orthanc to demand an explanation from Saruman for his interference in matters between Rohan and Dunland. Unfortunately, there are a number of half-orcs lurking along the road to Isengard, awaiting the chance to waylay such an emissary."}},
[3467]={nameES="Clearing the Way",objectivesES={}},
[3468]={nameES="Clearing the Way",objectivesES={"Captain Hanâbu needs your assistance clearing the path for the incoming army.\
\
You should complete 'Clearing the Way: Assault on Jolakhúro' and 'Clearing the Way: Ordâkhai Obstacles'.","Talk to Captain Hanâbu","You have done much to clear the path to Emax Dûl.\
\
You should talk to Captain Hanâbu outside Jolakhúro.","Clearing the Way","The time has come to put Mizâdi's strategy into action. The first step is to clear the way to Emax Dûl.","Complete 'Clearing the Way: Ordâkhai Obstacles'","Captain Hanâbu has gone ahead to attack the Ordâkhai forward camp, Jolakhúro.\
\
You should meet up with Captain Hanâbu outside Jolakhúro.","Meet Mizâdi at the bridge to Emax Dûl","Complete 'Clearing the Way: Assault on Jolakhúro'","Mizâdi has gone ahead with her Subuzûri to claim the bridge to Emax Dûl.\
\
You should meet Mizâdi just up the road from Jolakhúro.","Talk to Captain Hanâbu outside Jolakhúro"}},
[3469]={nameES="Clearing the Way: Assault on Jolakhúro",objectivesES={"Talk to Captain Hanâbu","Defeat Orihóta Bóro","Defeated Orihóta Bóro","Clearing the Way: Assault on Jolakhúro","The Ordâkhai forward camp needs to be cleared before Mizâdi's forces can move into position outside Emax Dûl.","The Ordâkhai in Jolakhúro have been defeated.\
\
You should return to Captain Hanâbu.","The Ordâkhai camp, Jolakhúro, must be cleared in preparation for the arrival of Mizâdi's allied forces.\
\
You should help the Aradûni soldiers defeat the Ordâkhai and their leader, Orihóta Bóro."}},
[3470]={nameES="Clearing the Way: Ordâkhai Obstacles",objectivesES={}},
[3471]={nameES="Clearing the Yard",objectivesES={"Clearing the Yard","Completado.","Stained merrevail can be found near Seregost.\
\
You should defeat any Stained merrevail you find.","The merrevail guarding the front of Seregost have been vanquished. If these are truly the children of Lhaereth the Stained, you wonder what manner of creature she is and if she has more ghastly children awaiting you inside.","Viznak has mentioned that the area near Seregost is heavily patrolled by Lhaereth's children: the Merrevail. You should defeat any you encounter."}},
[3472]={nameES="Un problema claro",objectivesES={"Los materiales originalmente usados para fabricar las lámparas de los enanos se han agotado hace mucho tiempo. Se deben encontrar más si las salas de Moria han de brillar una vez más.","Habla con Thrand en la Bodega Putrefacta","Las arañas de cristal se encuentran al oeste de la Bodega Putrefacta, cerca del Palacio Perdido.\
\
Thrand quiere reparar algunas de las lámparas de los enanos destrozadas por los trasgos y especula que las patas de araña de cristal serán el mejor reemplazo para los cristales.","Un problema claro","Thrand se encuentra en la Bodega Putrefacta, al este del Palacio Perdido.\
\
Thrand estará encantado de ver el estado de las patas de araña de cristal que has recogido."}},
[3473]={nameES="Cleft In Twain",objectivesES={"Complete 'Borrowing Barricades'","Winsig has directed you to assault the Orc camps to the south-west and west of Walstow.","Complete 'Crippling The Front'","Talk to Winsig","Winsig has expressed concern that the Orc camps near Walstow will soon pose too great a threat along with the Orcs entering through the East Wall. She wishes you to completely dismantle their fortifications so that Walstow can redouble its efforts on a single force.","Cleft In Twain","Complete 'A Controlled Pyre'","Complete 'Circling The Kill'","As you've completely destroyed the Orc fortifications, you should now return to Winsig with news of your victory.\
\
Winsig can be found in the mead-hall of Walstow.","Complete 'A Cut Above'"}},
[3474]={nameES="Climbing a Cliff",objectivesES={}},
[3475]={nameES="Climbing the Ladder",objectivesES={"Sháwat can be found somewhere inside Utterby.\
\
You should challenge and defeat Sháwat.","Bakhíl is defeated!","Challenge and defeat Bakhíl","\\qHelp\\q Yólkhon with 'Loosen their Shackles'","Kunchat is pleased with your prowess in duels.\
\
You should talk to Kunchat.","Bakhíl can be found somewhere inside Utterby.\
\
You should challenge and defeat Bakhíl.","\\qHelp\\q Otkóz with 'Defensive Damage'","Kunchat may let you challenge another Jangovar leader as you earn his favour.\
\
You should complete more quests in Utterby.","\\qHelp\\q Yólkhon with 'Lest They Fall Victim'","Talk to Kunchat","Kunchat is ready to give you the name of another Jangovar to challenge.\
\
You should talk to Kunchat.","Help Tuhâl with 'Feeding the Starved'","\\qHelp\\q Otkóz with 'Destructive Disarmament'","Sháwat is defeated!","Challenge and defeat Jáldor","Jáldor is defeated!","Climbing the Ladder","Challenge and defeat Sháwat","Kunchat has heard of your victory and wishes to speak with you.\
\
You should talk to Kunchat.","Jáldor can be found somewhere inside Utterby.\
\
You should challenge and defeat Jáldor.","Help Tuhâl with 'Bolstering the Feeble'","The Jangovar climb ranks by beating their betters in combat. Perhaps if you are able to defeat some of them yourself, the Jangovar will look upon you favourably."}},
[3476]={nameES="Capa del Jinete Negro",objectivesES={"Odovacar Bolger está en su casa, en lo alto de la colina que está en el centro de Bolgovado.\
\
Odovacar Bolger te envió a buscar señales del Jinete Negro, pero todo lo que has encontrado es una capa negra arruinada. Deberías traer la capa negra a Odovacar.","Trae la capa negra a Odovacar Bolger","Odovacar Bolger te ha enviado a perseguir al supuesto Jinete Negro que ha estado rondando sus pocilgas por la noche.","Busca señales del \\qJinete Negro\\q","Capa del Jinete Negro","El \\qJinete Negro\\q fue visto en los campos de Cam Barroso, al este de Bolgovado.\
\
Odovacar Bolger te dijo que uno de sus vecinos, Cam Barroso, informó que el Jinete Negro estaba en sus tierras, siendo perseguido por lobos. Odovacar te ha pedido que vayas a buscar al \\qJinete\\q sin caballo."}},
[3477]={nameES="Cloben's Eye",objectivesES={"From the innumerable beasts you have defeated in Thrór's Coomb, you have managed to obtain a great trophy: Cloben's eye.","With the defeat of Cloben, the dwarves of Thrór's Coomb will no longer have to quake in fear under the threat of the powerful gwiber.\
\
You should bring Cloben's eye to Frithgeir in Zudrugund.","Talk to Frithgeir in Zudrugund","Frithgeir is at Zudrugund, which lies within Nár's Peak, north of the river.\
\
The eye you recovered will long serve as a symbol of the defeat of the gwiber that menaced Thrór's Coomb.","Cloben's Eye"}},
[3478]={nameES="Cloben's Fang",objectivesES={"Frithgeir is at Zudrugund, which lies within Nár's Peak, north of the river.\
\
The fang you recovered will long serve as a symbol of the defeat of the gwiber that menaced Thrór's Coomb.","From the myriad beasts you have defeated in Thrór's Coomb, you have manage to obtain a great trophy: Cloben's Fang.","With the defeat of Cloben, the dwarves of Thrór's Coomb will no longer have to quake in fear under the threat of the powerful gwiber.\
\
You should bring Cloben's fang to Frithgeir in Zudrugund.","Talk to Frithgeir in Zudrugund","Cloben's Fang"}},
[3479]={nameES="Cierra sus madrigueras",objectivesES={"La población de musarañas cerca de Cavada Grande ha aumentado enormemente recientemente, y Ruby Piedraprima quiere que los Fronteros hagan algo al respecto.","Ruby Piedraprima está en Cavada Grande, en su casa al sureste de la estatua de Marcho y Blanco en el centro del pueblo.\
\
Ruby estará encantada de saber que has cerrado algunas de las madrigueras de musaraña cerca del pueblo.","Cierra sus madrigueras","Hay madrigueras de musarañas al este de Cavada Grande, más allá de los Campos de Cavada.\
\
Ruby Piedraprima está molesta por la destrucción de la vegetación causada por las musarañas y quiere que cierres algunas de sus madrigueras."}},
[3480]={nameES="Closing the Port",objectivesES={}},
[3481]={nameES="Vistiendo a Umbar (Semanal)",objectivesES={"Los sastres abastecen a las masas de Umbar Baharbêl, y tú estás poniendo de tu parte para ayudar.","Vistiendo a Umbar (Semanal)","Completa las cuotas diarias para el Gremio de Sastres de Umbar.","Has completado muchas peticiones de sastre de Umbar.","Completa las peticiones del Gremio de Sastres de Umbar.\
\
Puedes adquirir estas misiones del líder del Gremio de Sastres de Umbar en la sala del gremio de artesanía de Umbar Baharbêl.","Completado"}},
[3482]={nameES="Nubes de corrupción",objectivesES={"Se pueden encontrar ídolos ardientes en Tham Lorn, en los Campos de Fornost del oeste.\
\
Deberías desactivar los ídolos y detener la corrupción en esta parte de Fornost.","Mincham te espera en su campamento.\
\
Has desactivado muchos de los ídolos ardientes en Tham Lorn, y deberías contarle a Mincham lo que has logrado.","Se pueden encontrar extraños ídolos por todo Tham Lorn, que arrojan nubes verdes nocivas en los Campos de Fornost.","Se pueden encontrar extraños ídolos por todo Tham Lorn, que arrojan nubes verdes nocivas en los Campos de Fornost.\
\
Deberías desactivar los ídolos y detener la propagación de la corrupción desde este lugar maligno.","Regresa con Mincham","Desactiva los ídolos ardientes en Tham Lorn","Nubes de corrupción"}},
[3483]={nameES="Clovengap Mist-walkers",objectivesES={"Clovengap mist-stalkers and sabre-tooth cats can be found in the vineyards in eastern Clovengap.\
\
Mother Amma has asked you to look into whether the Angmarim have managed to corrupt the sabre-tooth cats that prowl Maranazhâr.","Clovengap Mist-walkers","This appears to be an account of the sorceress Iuvár's attempts at using the crystals on the sabre-tooth cats of Clovengap.\
\
'We are being sent back to the vineyards with more crystals. Bruidalg insists I keep trying, no matter how many of my underlings the blasted cats devour. He gave me an adjustment to the ritual at least, so perhaps this time we shall have more luck.'\
\
As you flip through the pages, a familiar looking piece of torn paper flutters loose.","Deadly sabre-cats prowl the Maranazhâr vineyards in eastern Clovengap.\
\
Look for more clues as to whether the Angmarim have managed to corrupt the sabre-tooth cats.","The Angmarim experiments were going to take place in the vineyards.\
\
With the Angmarim sorceress Iuvár defeated, you should look for clues about their experiments.","A tumbled waggon!","Talk to Nósni","Mother Amma is in Hagbuth, in south-eastern Clovengap.\
\
You should tell Mother Amma what you found in the vineyards.","Drained crystals, and a dead Angmarim","In the crumbling vineyards of Maranazhâr, you have discovered an Angmarim waggon.\
\
The Angmarim have intentions of creating abominations out of the already fierce sabre-tooth cats! You should defeat the Angmarim!","Busca pistas","Search for signs of corruption","Another journal!","Continue searching for signs of corruption","Beneath the crumbling arches of ancient vineyards prowls a deadly beast. Has the corruption of the sarrowstones spread to this already formidable foe?","Examine the waggon","Return to Mother Amma","The waggon was carrying crystals!","Nósni is located in Hagbuth.\
\
Mother Amma has asked you to speak to Nósni."}},
[3484]={nameES="Clovengap: Terror in the Trees",objectivesES={"Defeat Muzhudh","Precious timber awaits those who brave the hidden dangers of the ethereal crevasse of Clovengap.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Warning: This quest has a one hour time limit. The timer will begin upon accepting the quest.</rgb>","Clovengap: Terror in the Trees","You should return to Zádokh Flint-eye and apprise him of your efforts.","You ran out of time...","Defeated Ilvind","Defeated Muzhudh","Defeat Ilvind or Muzhudh.","Talk to Zádokh Flint-eye","Defeat Ilvind"}},
[3485]={nameES="Clovengap: Valuable Resource",objectivesES={"Precious timber awaits those who brave the hidden dangers of the ethereal crevasse of Clovengap.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Warning: This quest requires Clovengap: Terror in the Trees to be underway. If that quest has been completed or failed, you will be unable to exit and re-enter this instance in order to complete this quest.</rgb>","Clovengap: Valuable Resource","The scout gives you a missive to collect logs.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Warning: This quest requires Clovengap: Terror in the Trees to be underway. If that quest has been completed or failed, you will be unable to exit and re-enter this instance in order to complete this quest.</rgb>","Collect logs."}},
[3486]={nameES="Clovengap: Vicious Claws",objectivesES={"Defeat wargs or drakes.","The scout gives you a missive to defeat wargs or drakes.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Warning: This quest requires Clovengap: Terror in the Trees to be underway. If that quest has been completed or failed, you will be unable to exit and re-enter this instance in order to complete this quest.</rgb>","Precious timber awaits those who brave the hidden dangers of the ethereal crevasse of Clovengap.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Warning: This quest requires Clovengap: Terror in the Trees to be underway. If that quest has been completed or failed, you will be unable to exit and re-enter this instance in order to complete this quest.</rgb>","Clovengap: Vicious Claws"}},
[3487]={nameES="Clutchroot's Glen",objectivesES={}},
[3488]={nameES="Carbón para los hornos",objectivesES={"Las cajas de carbón pueden encontrarse en las forjas de Uzbad-bakân, en Zelem-melek.\
\
Deberías destruir las cajas de carbón para frenar la fabricación de armas y armaduras para los orcos de Moria.","Destruye las cajas de carbón","Has descubierto las forjas de Uzbad-bakân, unas instalaciones formidables para la creación de armas y armaduras. El combustible para los hornos debe ser destruido cuanto antes.","Has destruido el carbón que iba a alimentar las forjas de Uzbad-bakân, frenando así la fabricación de armas y armaduras para los orcos de Moria.","Completado","Carbón para los hornos"}},
[3489]={nameES="Coastal Berries",objectivesES={}},
[3490]={nameES="Manto de Sombras",objectivesES={"Tanto los Huargos funestos como la hierba de túmulo pueden encontrarse en las llanuras orientales de Nan Amlug.\
\
Para fabricar una armadura para los Suuri-lehmä, Mauno te ha pedido que recojas pieles de Huargos funestos y algo de hierba de túmulo.","Lleva los objetos que has reunido a Mauno","Mauno está en el campamento de los Suuri-lehmä.\
\
Has reunido suficientes pieles de huargo y la hierba de túmulo que Mauno necesita para curarlas. Deberías llevárselas lo antes posible.","Los Hijos de la Tierra solían creer que las pieles de los Huargos eran completamente inútiles, pero recientemente han descubierto una forma de curarlas.","Manto de Sombras"}},
[3491]={nameES="Coercive Recruitment",objectivesES={}},
[3492]={nameES="Colbert el Cazatesoros",objectivesES={"Colbert el Cazatesoros","Colbert te ha hablado finalmente de su pasado, y de un campamento de cazadores de tesoros en las proximidades de la vieja ciudad de Fornost.","Habla con Colbert","Encuentra el Campamento de los Cazatesoros","El Campamento de los Cazatesoros se encuentra dentro de las puertas de la ciudad de Fornost, al suroeste de la ciudad propiamente dicha, lejos hacia el norte en los Campos de Fornost.\
\
Debes encontrar el Campamento de los Cazatesoros y encontrarte allí con Colbert.","Colbert está en el Campamento de Cazatesoros al norte de Fornost.\
\
Debes hablar con Colbert."}},
[3493]={nameES="Frío como la muerte",objectivesES={"Invoca y derrota a Delucheleg","Frío como la muerte","Has derrotado a Delucheleg","Arre se encuentra en Kuru-leiri, al sureste de Kibilzahar.\
\
Tras haber derrotado a Delucheleg, el Hombre demacrado responsable de alzar a los espectros, deberías regresar con Arre y contarle tus descubrimientos y combates.","Nicca te ha hablado de los espíritus crueles que vagan por el glaciar y de la criatura que los convoca, sepultándolos en los cuerpos congelados de Hombres para que sirvan como guerreros oscuros.","Kibilzahar se encuentra al noroeste de Kuru-leiri.\
\
Nicca te dijo que un poder maligno ha atrapado espíritus crueles dentro de los cuerpos de los espectros en Kibilzahar. Solo el calor del fuego puede expulsarlos. Te ha pedido que reavives los fuegos antiguos que los enanos usaban antaño para calentar la vieja fortaleza. También te advirtió de un señor maligno que acecha ese lugar y de que te prepares para enfrentarte a él si regresas allí.","Habla con Arre en Kuru-leiri"}},
[3494]={nameES="Cold as Ice",objectivesES={"Cold as Ice","Wintry Weather can be found to the north-east of Winter-home.\
\
Daley Utteridge wants you to help the less fortunate of Winter-home by driving off the harsh cold that accompanied the arrival of frost grims in Frostbluff.","Daley Utteridge is concerned for the well-being of the less fortunate and wants you to drive off the frost grims that have appeared in Frostbluff.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> NOTE: This quest will be removed from your quest log when the current festival ends. </rgb>","Daley Utteridge is in Winter-home.\
\
You should return to Daley Utteridge with news of your success.","Talk to Daley Utteridge"}},
[3495]={nameES="Con Collar",objectivesES={"Lleva el collar de hierro a Ovorlas","Ovorlas está en el campamento élfico en el extremo norte de Nen Hilith.\
\
Debes llevar el collar a Ovorlas y ver si significa algo para él.","Con Collar","Descubriste un tosco collar de hierro en el cuello de un lobo en el valle de Nen Hilith. Es posible que el collar brinde información sobre el problema que ha surgido allí.","Al observar de cerca este tosco collar, puedes ver que no es obra de Elfos ni de enanos.\
\
Quizás Ovorlas pueda obtener alguna información del collar. Debes entregárselo en el campamento élfico en el extremo norte de Nen Hilith."}},
[3496]={nameES="Collared Cats",objectivesES={"Bring the collar you found to Twiga at Etheburg in the Brown Lands","Twiga is at Etheburg in the Brown Lands.\
\
You should bring this collar to Twiga at once.","You found this collar upon one of the wild cats that roam the Brown Lands. Its intricate design is unlike any you have seen before.\
\
Regardless, it is a sign that the cats are not native to the region. Twiga will want to know of this.","You found a collar upon one of the wild cats of the Brown Lands. The intricate designs are not familiar to you.","Collared Cats"}},
[3497]={nameES="Collars of the Accursed",objectivesES={}},
[3498]={nameES="Recolectando Alas de Crébain",objectivesES={"Aves molestas se han convertido en una plaga en los campos de Lintrev.","Regresa con Adan","Adan Rhuvyg te ha pedido que recolectes alas de Crébain en los huertos de Lintrev.\
\
Lintrev está en el Valle de los Fuertes.","Recolectando Alas de Crébain","Deberías llevar las alas de Crébain a Adan Rhuvyg.\
\
Adan está en Lintrev."}},
[3499]={nameES="Investigaciones históricas",objectivesES={"Investigaciones históricas","El Gran Túmulo se encuentra en el corazón de las Quebradas de los Túmulos, más allá de el Alto del Hombre Muerto, en el sur de las Quebradas de los Túmulos.\
\
Tobold cortahoja te ha pedido que vayas a recoger cálices Antiguos del Gran Túmulo, situado en el corazón de las Quebradas de los Túmulos.","Tobold Cortahoja ha oído hablar de antiguas reliquias que los Hombres de Cardolan enterraban con sus muertos en las Quebradas de los Túmulos y que parecían servir para repeler a los tumularios.","Devuelve los cálices antiguos a Tobold Cortahoja"}},
[3500]={nameES="Collecting Necessities",objectivesES={"Kishâtu has asked you to gather various plants nearby in Urash Dâr.","Returned to Kishâtu with the various plants","Kishâtu has asked for your help gathering various plants she needs from the area.","Return to Kishâtu with the plants you have collected for her.","Return to Kishâtu with the plants","Collecting Necessities"}},
[3501]={nameES="Collecting Reeds",objectivesES={"Collecting Reeds","Sûlmur has offered to show you how to make papyrus. First, you must harvest some reeds.","You have collected papyrus reeds. You should return to Sûlmur near the barn at Mehêtur.","Bring the papyrus reeds to Sûlmur","Papyrus reeds can be found in the marsh near Mehêtur in Ambarûl."}},
[3502]={nameES="Collecting Scraps",objectivesES={"You have collected metal shields and defeated sand-sifters. You should return to Western Khanâg to give the shields to Sigênik.","Sigênik, a craftsman in Western Khanâg, has told you his plan to reuse the metal from lost shields in Sûr Zugub. He would also like you to slay sand-sifters while you are there.","Collecting Scraps","Bring the metal shields to Sigênik in Western Khanâg","Sigênik has asked you to travel to Sûr Zugub, south-east of Western Khanâg, and collect any abandoned metal shields you find. He would also like you to slay the resident sand-sifters while you're there."}},
[3503]={nameES="Collecting Tribute",objectivesES={}},
[3504]={nameES="Consiguiendo el cebo",objectivesES={"Carne de alce obtenida","Hal Gamyi se encuentra en el centro de Avenal.\
\
Nibs Redondo te ha pedido que hables con Hal Gamyi sobre los lobos.","Consigue carne de alce","Las ciervas jóvenes se encuentran pastando en la vieja arboleda justo al norte del centro de Avenal.\
\
Hal Gamyi te ha sugerido que caces algunos alces para conseguir cebo para los lobos, y luego vuelvas con él.","Lleva la carne de alce a Hal Gamyi","Consiguiendo el cebo","Tu descubrimiento de los lobos en sus camppos ha preocupado a Nibs Redondo."}},
[3505]={nameES="Combe: Soy un Leñador",objectivesES={"Has dejado caer el tronco","Pasa por los duodécimos marcadores con el tronco","Pasa por los novenos marcadores con el tronco","Has terminado en primer lugar en el evento de leñadores de Combe","Has terminado en segundo lugar en el evento de leñadores de Combe","Lleva el tronco hasta las siguientes marcas rojas.","Lleva el tronco hasta las últimas marcas azules para completar la carrera.","Primero tienes que conseguir un hacha para poder cortar leña y luego curar las pieles. Date prisa.","Pasa por los undécimos marcadores con el tronco","Pasa por los octavos marcadores con el tronco","Has llevado el tronco a través del evento de leñadores","Pasa por los décimos marcadores con el tronco","Vuelve con la jueza para reclamar tu premio","Con las pieles listas, ahora debes dirigirte al banco junto a la casa y probar tres cervezas de tabernas locales.","Pasa por los quintos marcadores con el tronco","No te inscribiste con la jueza antes de que comenzara el evento","La Competencia de Leñadores del bosque de Chet está reclutando; los participantes anteriores fueron retirados","Dirígete a la mesa de competencia bajo el árbol en el centro del campamento y refina madera con el hacha de leñador.","Pasa por los segundos marcadores con el tronco","Pasa por los terceros marcadores con el tronco","Vuelve ante el juez y cuéntale tus esfuerzos en el evento.","Lleva el tronco a través del primer conjunto de marcadores en el aserradero del bosque de Chet.","El campamento maderero de Combe organiza un concurso de fuerza, destreza y resistencia para coronar al ganador de una codiciada competencia de leñadores.","Con esas sabrosas bebidas agitándose en tu estómago, comienza la verdadera prueba. Recoge un tronco.","Con las pieles recogidas, es momento de continuar con el curtido. Ve al muro de piedra al otro lado del campamento y cura pieles en los tensores.","Todos los participantes están presentes y la jueza se prepara para iniciar la competencia. Espera a que dé la señal.","Ahora que ya te has inscrito en el evento, tendrás que esperar en el almacén de madera del Bosque de Chet a que se unan otros competidores.","No dejes caer el tronco","Combe: Soy un Leñador","La Competencia de Leñadores del Bosque de Chet no parece estar reclutando","Espera a que la jueza dé la señal","Entrega la madera refinada a Aldith","Recoge un tronco para cargar durante el evento","Pasa por los séptimos marcadores con el tronco","Pasa por los primeros marcadores con el tronco","<rgb=#FF0000>Fallo: Los saqueadores no pueden ocultarse o serán descalificados</rgb>","Pasa por los sextos marcadores con el tronco","Pasa por los cuartos marcadores con el tronco","Has refinado la madera exitosamente. Ahora recoge pieles de las carcasas de osos detrás de la choza de Bauman.","Recoge un hacha de leñador de la mesa de competencia","La competencia está a punto de comenzar","Inscríbete en la competencia hablando con la jueza","Los montones de madera junto a la choza del viejo Bauman están listos para recolectarse. Toma tu hacha y recoge cinco pilas de madera sin refinar.","Te has inscrito en la competencia de leñadores de Combe","Marcas superadas","Estás cargando un tronco","<rgb=#FF0000>Fallo: No te inscribiste con la jueza</rgb>","Entrega las pieles refinadas y el hacha a Aldith","Espera a que otros se inscriban en la competencia","Lleva el tronco a través de las marcas azules","<rgb=#FF0000>Fallo: Los Beórnidas no pueden cambiar entre forma humana y de oso o serán descalificados</rgb>"}},
[3506]={nameES="Come One, Come All!",objectivesES={"You have placed a number of Ezôti's flyers. That is enough, and you should burn the rest in a fire.","A strange man puts on a 'show' in the Upper Ward of Umbar Baharbêl.","Instead of distributing more flyers for Ezôti, you have decided to burn them in a fire. The open flame on the south-eastern corner of the Grand Market in the Upper Ward should suffice.","Throw the remaining flyers into a fire on the south-eastern corner of the Grand Market","You have no more flyers left to place. Will Ezôti wonder how you accomplished the task so quickly? Probably not.","Does Ezôti need so many flyers posted?","Ezôti has asked you to place flyers advertising his show all around the Upper Ward.\
\
But because Ezôti is terrible, do not do a good job. Place flyers in poorly visible spots around the Upper Ward.","Come One, Come All!","Talk to Ezôti in the Upper Ward","And there they go!","You decide you have posted enough flyers. Might as well burn the rest"}},
[3507]={nameES="Coming Down The Mountain",objectivesES={}},
[3508]={nameES="Coming Down the Mountain",objectivesES={}},
[3509]={nameES="Coming Home",objectivesES={"Deliver the beeswax to Gairil","Set the lantern onto the river","Limael's Vineyard is located to the north-west of Celondim.\
\
You can find beeswax from the hives near the vineyard's entrance.","Gairil is working at the Celondim docks to the south.\
\
You should bring the beeswax to him.","Gairil has given you one of the lanterns he crafted earlier.\
\
You should set the lantern down onto the river.","While creating lanterns for his fellow Elves, Gairil the lantern-maker has run out of candle materials and needs help collecting more.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This quest will be removed from your quest log when the current festival ends.</rgb>","Coming Home"}},
[3510]={nameES="Coming to a Conclusion",objectivesES={"Saeradan is at the Rohirrim scout-camp, south of the road to Tâl Methedras.\
\
Huwela told you of a path she found leading up Methedras and instructed you to bring the information to Saeradan.","Talk to Saeradan at the Rohirrim scout-camp","Talk to Huwela near the road to Tâl Methedras","Coming to a Conclusion","Huwela awaits you near the road to Tâl Methedras, north of the Rohirrim scout-camp.\
\
Léofward told you to meet with the Dunlending scout, Huwela, regarding the Old Woman of the Mountain.","Following the Battle of the Mustering Tree, a scout from the Dunlending Boar-clan resistance sent word to Léofward that she had news regarding the Old Woman of the Mountain."}},
[3511]={nameES="Commander Athdurub",objectivesES={"Commander Athdurub","Athdurub patrols the woods of Gathbúrz.\
\
Rodelleth has asked you to hunt down and defeat the Warg-rider Athdurub, commander of the Wargs of Gathbúrz.","The Wargs of Gathbúrz are led by Athdurub, a Warg-rider with a reputation for cunning and viciousness.","Talk to Rodelleth at Thangúlhad","Rodelleth is at Thangúlhad in Gathbúrz.\
\
You should return to Rodelleth with tidings of Athdurub's defeat.","Defeat Commander Athdurub","Defeated Commander Athdurub"}},
[3512]={nameES="Commander Fikthrug",objectivesES={"The Orc-garrison at Bûrzkala is commanded by a fearsome creature known as Fikthrug.","Defeat Commander Fikthrug","Defeated Commander Fikthrug","Fikthrug is at Bûrzkala, directly north of Thangúlhad.\
\
Rodelleth has asked you to find and defeat the Orc-commander Fikthrug.","Commander Fikthrug","Rodelleth is at Thangúlhad in Gathbúrz, south of Búrzkala.\
\
You should return to Rodelleth with news of your victory.","Talk to Rodelleth in Thangúlhad"}},
[3513]={nameES="Comandante Târsh",objectivesES={"El Comandante Târsh se encuentra en la Escuela de Tham Mírdain, al sureste del refugio élfico de Echad Mirobel. \
\
El Comandante Târsh, un uruk-hai lleno de orgullo, lidera las fuerzas de la Mano Blanca en un intento por obtener información antigua de la Escuela en la que ha establecido su campamento. Gelirwen desea que entres en la Escuela y te enfrentes a este bruto con la ayuda de una pequeña comunidad.'","A juzgar por lo que sabemos de los movimientos de la Mano Blanca en esta zona, he deducido que hay un uruk-hai inteligente al frente de las fuerzas enemigas aquí, en Eregion.\
\
'En estos momentos está dirigiendo la operación de registro de las ruinas de la Escuela de Tham Mírdain, al sureste de Echad Mirobel. Según todos los indicios, es un guerrero temible, y su nombre es el Comandante Târsh. Quiero que entres en la Escuela de Tham Mírdain y te enfrentes a este astuto uruk-hai.\
\
'Se dice que tiene un gran ego y que se cree un guerrero sin igual. Quizá podamos usar esto en su contra. No lleves a más de dos personas contigo a la Escuela, pues no queremos atraer también la atención de nuestros enemigos del norte. Ya tenemos bastante con nuestras maniobras más agresivas contra esos enemigos, y sería realmente grave que unieran sus fuerzas.","Comandante Târsh"}},
[3514]={nameES="Recomendaciones",objectivesES={}},
[3515]={nameES="Recomendaciones",objectivesES={}},
[3516]={nameES="Preocupación por un amigo",objectivesES={"Preocupación por un amigo","La granja de Falco Manoverde está al suroeste de la granja de Gammy Cenagales.\
\
Gammy Cenagales, la chismosa local, te ha pedido que averigües por qué el jardín de Falco está fallando.","El jardín de Falco está fallando por una razón desconocida, causando angustia entre la gente de Entibo.","Habla con Falco Manoverde en su granja","Habla con Gammy Cenagales en su granja","Gammy Cenagales está en su granja, al noreste de la granja de Falco Manoverde.\
\
Falco Manoverde no quiso molestarte con sus problemas y te pidió que le dijeras a Gammy Cenagales que deje de husmear."}},
[3517]={nameES="Preocupación por un amigo",objectivesES={"Frithgeir is in Zudrugund.\
\
You have spoken with Nár, who seems to be fine, as normal as he ever is. You should return to Frithgeir.","Preocupación por un amigo","Concerned by the words of Saruman while you were imprisoned within Isengard, you wanted to check on the well-being of Nár and Frithgeir.","Nár is in the library at Zudrugund.\
\
You have spoken with Frithgeir and confirmed to yourself that Saruman was lying when he spoke of killing these dwarves.","Nár looks at you happily, but says nothing. It is a great relief to know that Saruman's words to you in Orthanc concerning this ancient dwarf were untrue."}},
[3518]={nameES="Concerned by Hobbits",objectivesES={"Maelona is in Tûr Morva.\
\
Maelona will want to speak with you once you have regaled Gwynna and Olwen with tales of your homeland.","Maelona had never seen a hobbit before your arrival in Tûr Morva and wants you to share stories of your homeland with members of the Falcon-clan who are concerned by you.","Gwynna looks at you warily, his face a mask of curiosity and fear.\
\
'You are a... halfling? Why are you... why are you so small?'\
\
He turns a bright shade of red, and you decide to defuse his embarrassment with tales of the Shire.","Talk to Gwynna in Tûr Morva","Talk to Penrod in Tûr Morva","Talk to Olwen in Tûr Morva","Concerned by Hobbits","Gwynna and Olwen can be found in Tûr Morva.\
\
Maelona told you that some of her fellows are distrustful of hobbits, having never seen one before, and you should tell them stories of your homeland.","Talk to Maelona in Tûr Morva","Penrod, the first Brehur of Lheu Brenin, is in Tûr Morva. He has been asking for you.\
\
Maelona told you to speak with Penrod now that you have reassured her friends Gwynna and Olwen.","Olwen looks at you distrustfully.\
\
'How do we know that you are what you say you are? A hobbit? I have not heard of hobbits before. How do we know that you are not in league with Saruman?'\
\
You decide that Olwen might be more accepting if you tell her tales of the Shire."}},
[3519]={nameES="Concerning Dragons",objectivesES={}},
[3520]={nameES="Concerning Spiders",objectivesES={"This den has been abandoned","Search Imnagath","There is still prey caught in the webs of this abandoned den","Thranduil can be found in the halls of Felegoth.\
\
You should return to Thranduil.","The spiders have vanished from all over Mirkwood, and King Thranduil wishes to know why.","Concerning Spiders","Only a few lost broodlings remain here","Known spider dens can be found throughout Eryn Lasgalen.\
\
You should search the woods and remaining spider-dens for spiders.","Search Gwígar","Return to Thranduil","Search Glad Thaw"}},
[3521]={nameES="Conflagración",objectivesES={"Habla con Eywind cerca de la entrada al Paso Alto","Informa a Eywind sobre la destrucción provocada por la poción de Gandalf en el caldero ardiente.","Has encontrado el caldero ardiente","Conflagración","El caldero ardiente está en una alta estructura de madera en Ghâshru, hacia el noreste.\
\
Eywind te dijo que viertas la poción de Gandalf en el caldero que los trasgos usan para producir sus potes ígneos y que lo vuelques para que la mezcla incendie los materiales por todo el campamento.","Lleva la poción de Gandalf al caldero ardiente","Vierte la poción de Gandalf en el caldero ardiente","Eywind y Nogmeldir han ideado un plan para usar la poción de Gandalf y sembrar el caos entre los trasgos."}},
[3522]={nameES="Conflict in Dor-en-Ernil",objectivesES={"Borhador can be found in the village of Ethring.\
\
You should speak with Borhador.","Speak with Borhador","Speak with Laerind","Laerind can be found in the village of Ethring.\
\
You should speak with Laerind.","Now that the enemy forces in Ringló Vale have lost their leader and had their ranks decimated, your focus has been directed to Dor-en-Ernil where corsairs have already come ashore.","Seek out Garvir in Linhir","Conflict in Dor-en-Ernil","Garvir, the leader of the Dor-en-Ernil's Gondorian forces can be found in the city of Linhir.\
\
You should seek out Garvir in Linhir."}},
[3523]={nameES="Confronta al Viejo Tuk",objectivesES={"Nada de lo que has hecho por Adelard Tuk parece haber tenido efecto alguno en el \\qfantasma\\q de su biblioteca.","Ve a ver al fantasma del Viejo Tuk","Confronta al Viejo Tuk","Al acercarte a la estantería, esta empieza a temblar y a sacudirse. ¡Hay algo escondido detrás de la estantería!","Has conseguido ahuyentar a la ardilla de la biblioteca de Adelard.","La presencia del fantasma es más fuerte en el rincón más alejado de la biblioteca de Adelard, cerca de la pequeña estantería.\
\
Después de que todo lo demás fracasara, Adelard Tuk te ha pedido que entres en su biblioteca y vayas a ver al fantasma del Viejo Tuk.","Adelard Tuk está fuera de la biblioteca de los Grandes Smials.\
\
Al ir a ver al \\qfantasma\\q en la biblioteca de Adelard Tuk, has descubierto que no era más que una ardilla escondida detrás de los muebles. Debes decirle a Adelard que ya puede volver a su biblioteca."}},
[3524]={nameES="Enfrentamiento en Cotfast",objectivesES={"Entra en Cotfast","Llama a la puerta donde se esconde Gothtal","Aran Verduno se encuentra cerca de Cotfast, en el Bosque Salvaje.\
\
Deberías hablar con Aran Verduno cerca de Cotfast.","Habla con Aran Verduno","Las obras de reconstrucción de Puente de Caballetes continúan.\
\
Deberías echar un vistazo a la reconstrucción de Puente de Caballetes","Habla con Aran Verduno cerca de Cotfast","El edificio en el que se esconde Gothtal se encuentra en Cotfast.\
\
Deberías llamar a la puerta y enfrentarte a Gothtal.","En Cotfast encontrarás botines orcos y oro para sobornos.\
\
Debes destruir los botines orcos, recoger el oro para sobornos y derrotar a los enemigos en Cotfast.","La alarma del pueblo de Cotfast se encuentra cerca.\
\
Deberías hacer sonar la alarma para llamar la atención de Gothtal.","Haz sonar la alarma del pueblo de Cotfast","Has derrotado a Gothtal","Como era de esperar, nadie abrió la puerta","Cotfast se encuentra en el Bosque Salvaje.\
\
Deberías entrar en Cotfast.","Enfrentamiento en Cotfast","Han dejado algo en la puerta oeste de Puente de Caballetes.\
\
Deberías ir a ver qué pasa allí.","Habla con Aran Verduno en Puente de Caballetes","Suena la alarma y aparece Gothtal","La Hermandad de los Leñadores ha decidido acabar con la amenaza de los orcos en el Bosque Salvaje de una vez por todas.","Aran Verduno se encuentra en Puente de Caballetes.\
\
Deberías hablar con Aran Verduno.","Derrota a Gothtal"}},
[3525]={nameES="Confronting Dravron",objectivesES={"Dervorin is going to confront Dravron over his taxes, or lack thereof.\
\
Talk to him when you're ready to accompany him.","You have returned to Ethring with Dervorin.\
\
Talk to Dervorin.","Talk to Dervorin","It is time to confront Dravron.","Confronting Dravron"}},
[3526]={nameES="Confronting Shakfut",objectivesES={"Drive Shakfut from the area","Shakfut is in command of Ugrukhôr's troops in Zhar Skator, west of Barad Angarth. If he is driven off, the remaining forces might push towards Gothmog's troops.","Confronting Shakfut","Shakfut has fled from the area!","Shakfut is currently leading Ugrukhôr's troops in this area. He has been able to prevent his forces from pushing towards Gothmog's encampment on the western side of the Circle of Wrath.\
\
You should drive off Shakfut and defeat his most loyal warriors.","Talk to Dolenthol","You have driven away Shakfut and his most loyal supporters.\
\
You should return to Dolenthol and inform him of your victory."}},
[3527]={nameES="Confronting the Problem",objectivesES={}},
[3528]={nameES="Conquerers From Isengard",objectivesES={}},
[3529]={nameES="Conquering the Bloody Threshold (Tier 1)",objectivesES={"Conquering the Bloody Threshold (Tier 1)","Defeat the Beasts of Slaughter","The final battle of the War of Three Peaks has begun. Prince Durin Stonehelmson of the Longbeards will lead the great force of united dwarves in an assault on the main gates of Gundabad. But the Orkish chieftain, Gorgar the Ruthless, has one final surprise in store for his enemies.","You have completed the Amdân Dammul, the Bloody Threshold on Tier 1.","Gorgar's trap has been sprung, and you must now fight in his arena or perish.\
\
You should defeat Gorgar's Beasts of Slaughter.","Completed: Conquering the Bloody Threshold (Tier 1)","Defeat Gorgar and Ránulur","You have defeated the beasts, but Gorgar now intends to fight you himself!\
\
You must now face Gorgar the Ruthless and Ránulur, Chieftain of Wargs in the arena!"}},
[3530]={nameES="Conquering the Bloody Threshold (Tier 2)",objectivesES={"You have completed the Amdân Dammul, the Bloody Threshold on Tier 2.","Completed: Conquering the Bloody Threshold (Tier 2)","Defeat the Beasts of Slaughter","The final battle of the War of Three Peaks has begun. Prince Durin Stonehelmson of the Longbeards will lead the great force of united dwarves in an assault on the main gates of Gundabad. But the Orkish chieftain, Gorgar the Ruthless, has one final surprise in store for his enemies.","Conquering the Bloody Threshold (Tier 2)","Gorgar's trap has been sprung, and you must now fight in his arena or perish.\
\
You should defeat Gorgar's Beasts of Slaughter.","Defeat Gorgar and Ránulur","You have defeated the beasts, but Gorgar now intends to fight you himself!\
\
You must now face Gorgar the Ruthless and Ránulur, Chieftain of Wargs in the arena!"}},
[3531]={nameES="Conquering the Bloody Threshold (Tier 3)",objectivesES={"You have completed the Amdân Dammul, the Bloody Threshold on Tier 3.","Defeat the Beasts of Slaughter","The final battle of the War of Three Peaks has begun. Prince Durin Stonehelmson of the Longbeards will lead the great force of united dwarves in an assault on the main gates of Gundabad. But the Orkish chieftain, Gorgar the Ruthless, has one final surprise in store for his enemies.","Gorgar's trap has been sprung, and you must now fight in his arena or perish.\
\
You should defeat Gorgar's Beasts of Slaughter.","Defeat Gorgar and Ránulur","You have defeated the beasts, but Gorgar now intends to fight you himself!\
\
You must now face Gorgar the Ruthless and Ránulur, Chieftain of Wargs in the arena!","Completed: Conquering the Bloody Threshold (Tier 3)","Conquering the Bloody Threshold (Tier 3)"}},
[3532]={nameES="Conquering the Bloody Threshold (Tier 4)",objectivesES={"Conquering the Bloody Threshold (Tier 4)","Defeat the Beasts of Slaughter","You have completed the Amdân Dammul, the Bloody Threshold on Tier 4.","The final battle of the War of Three Peaks has begun. Prince Durin Stonehelmson of the Longbeards will lead the great force of united dwarves in an assault on the main gates of Gundabad. But the Orkish chieftain, Gorgar the Ruthless, has one final surprise in store for his enemies.","Gorgar's trap has been sprung, and you must now fight in his arena or perish.\
\
You should defeat Gorgar's Beasts of Slaughter.","Defeat Gorgar and Ránulur","You have defeated the beasts, but Gorgar now intends to fight you himself!\
\
You must now face Gorgar the Ruthless and Ránulur, Chieftain of Wargs in the arena!","Completed: Conquering the Bloody Threshold (Tier 4)"}},
[3533]={nameES="Conquering the Bloody Threshold (Tier 5)",objectivesES={"Completed: Conquering the Bloody Threshold (Tier 5)","Defeat the Beasts of Slaughter","The final battle of the War of Three Peaks has begun. Prince Durin Stonehelmson of the Longbeards will lead the great force of united dwarves in an assault on the main gates of Gundabad. But the Orkish chieftain, Gorgar the Ruthless, has one final surprise in store for his enemies.","You have completed the Amdân Dammul, the Bloody Threshold on Tier 5.","Conquering the Bloody Threshold (Tier 5)","Gorgar's trap has been sprung, and you must now fight in his arena or perish.\
\
You should defeat Gorgar's Beasts of Slaughter.","Defeat Gorgar and Ránulur","You have defeated the beasts, but Gorgar now intends to fight you himself!\
\
You must now face Gorgar the Ruthless and Ránulur, Chieftain of Wargs in the arena!"}},
[3534]={nameES="Conquering the Ornendil",objectivesES={}},
[3535]={nameES="Conquering the Remmorchant (Tier 1)",objectivesES={"Defeat Rûkhor the Pale Herald","Thossulun the Massive, daughter of Shelob and Queen of all gredbyg, must be defeated to stem the tide of insects harassing your allies.","Defeat Bratha Tasakh, Lady of Many Venoms","Conquering the Remmorchant (Tier 1)","The Ungoladan chieftain, Bratha Tasakh, Lady of Many Venoms, bars your path deeper into the Remmorchant.","Defeat Thossulun the Massive","The last challenge is finally upon you: defeat Shelob herself!","You have completed the Remmorchant on Tier 1.","Completed: Conquering the Remmorchant (Tier 1)","Celeborn leads a company of brave adventurers into the depths of the Remmorchant seeking to bring about the final defeat of his ancient foe. Meanwhile, Rûkhor the Pale Herald is enacting his vile plan to unleash the unending hunger of Shelob the Great upon all of Middle-earth.","Rûkhor the Pale Herald has unveiled his nefarious scheme to you. You must defeat him and his Bloodless captain, Zabothak, to prevent Shelob from being unleashed!","Defeat Shelob"}},
