[3541]={nameES="Consistent Harassment",objectivesES={"Habla con Bahanneth en Talan Fanuidhol","Fanuidhol lies to the north-west of Talan Fanuidhol.\
\
Bahanneth wants you to go into Fanuidhol and defeat some of the smiths there, as well as to destroy the stores of weapons they have forged.","Consistent Harassment","Bahanneth was so pleased with the success of your mission to destroy the Orcs' weapons that he would like you to continue your efforts.","Bahanneth is at Talan Fanuidhol, south-east of Fanuidhol.\
\
You should return to Bahanneth with tidings of your success."}},
[3542]={nameES="Constables and Robbers",objectivesES={"After every attempt to intimidate the treasure-hunters into retreating from the Rushgore failed, Aculf has decided to take more drastic measures.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Note: This quest can only be completed by a Solo player. It cannot be completed as part of a Fellowship.</rgb>","Constables and Robbers","Aculf is at his camp in the Rushgore, north-west of Atburg.\
\
You should speak with Aculf regarding your victory at Atburg.","Aculf is at his camp in the Rushgore, north-west of Atburg.\
\
Aculf has asked you to join him and his companions as they assault Atburg.","Talk to Aculf to join the assault on Atburg","Talk to Aculf at his camp in the Rushgore"}},
[3543]={nameES="Constables and Robbers -- Repeatable",objectivesES={"After every attempt to intimidate the treasure-hunters into retreating from the Rushgore failed, Aculf has decided to take more drastic measures.\
