You have defeated many Haradrim in Thama Aklam, but were unable to find any orders. You should return to Steward Malthellim.","Talk to Steward Malthellim","Growing concerned in the wake of Lornost's fall, Steward Malthellim hopes to defeat the Haradrim forces camped nearby before their numbers become too great.","Thama Aklam can be found to the south-east of Ost Anglebed.\
\
Steward Malthellim has asked you to defeat the Haradrim camped nearby before they grow beyond control.","Constricted Offence","This Haradrim does not appear to have any orders..."}},
[3546]={nameES="Gusano tumulario voraz",objectivesES={"Los gusanos tumularios voraces se pueden encontrar en el ala inundada del Gran Túmulo.","Los muertos ancestrales se han alzado en el Gran Túmulo.","Gusano tumulario voraz"}},
