[3552]={nameES="Fuego controlado",objectivesES={"Los orcos globsnaga infestan las Fundaciones de Piedra.\
\
Valthor te ha pedido que derrotes orcos globsnaga para demostrar tu poder.","Valthor se encuentra en el Refugio Sombrío, en la región norte de las Fundaciones de Piedra.\
\
Deberías regresar junto a Valthor y contarle tus hazañas.","Los orcos infestados de hongos, llamados globsnaga por los orcos de Moria, habitan por todos lados en las Fundaciones de Piedra.","Fuego controlado","Habla con Valthor en el Refugio Sombrío"}},
[3553]={nameES="Convenient Resources -- Repeatable",objectivesES={"Frithstan is concerned with the growing lack of provisions and supplies at Stangard.","Frithstan is at his camp near the Cuthstan.\
\
You should return to Frithstan with news of your success.","Convenient Resources -- Repeatable","Wild goats can be found throughout the Wailing Hills.\
\
Frithstan has asked you to hunt the wild goats of the Wailing Hills for their hides.","Return the hides to Frithstan"}},
[3554]={nameES="Cook: Warming Winter Stew",objectivesES={"<rgb=#FF0000>Completing Wildermore's Recovery will cancel this quest.</rgb>","Hildelith is in Forlaw.\
\
You have made warming winter stew and should now deliver it to Hildelith.","Deliver the warming winter stew to Hildeleth","Cook: Warming Winter Stew","You have been given the recipe for a warming winter stew.\
\
You should make a warming winter stew to feed the refugees for Wildermore.","A skilled cook such as yourself can help the refugees of Wildermore by making warming winter stew for them."}},
[3555]={nameES="Cooking Catastrophe",objectivesES={"Talk to Uzhún","Complete two tasks for Shulgolb at Kafagur.","Complete Quest 'Cooking Catastrophe: Drake Eggs'","Cooking Catastrophe","Shulgolb has given you the ingredients that Uzhún requires.\
\
Uzhún can be found at Kafagur.","Complete Quest 'Cooking Catastrophe: Beetle Larvae'","Talk to Shulgolb at Kafagur","Without the right ingredients, Shulgolb's and Uzhún's cooking plans are in a spot of trouble.","You've helped Shulgolb collect enough ingredients.\
\
You should talk to him at Kafagur."}},
[3556]={nameES="Cooking Catastrophe: Beetle Larvae",objectivesES={"You've collected a good amount of beetle larvae.\
\
