\
Ghax-hophra is located north of Kafagur.","Shulgolb's and Uzhún's dish calls for beetle larvae.","Talk to Shulgolb at Kafagur","Cooking Catastrophe: Beetle Larvae"}},
[3557]={nameES="Cooking Catastrophe: Drake Eggs",objectivesES={"Shulgolb has asked you to collect drake eggs from nests in Jeb Lipha.\
\
