\
You should bring them to Shulgolb at Kafagur."}},
[3558]={nameES="Cooking Catastrophe: The Misplaced Salt",objectivesES={"Cooking Catastrophe: The Misplaced Salt","One final, tiny issue needs to be resolved before Uzhún and Shulgolb can get cooking.","Search provision barrels for Uzhún's salt pouch","Uzhún has asked you to search for their salt pouch.\
\
It must be in one of the provision barrels around Kafagur.","No salt pouch here...","You've found Uzhún's salt pouch.\
\
They wait for you at Kafagur.","Talk to Uzhún","You've found the salt pouch!"}},
[3559]={nameES="Cooking Sauce",objectivesES={}},
[3560]={nameES="A refrescarse",objectivesES={"A estos clientes les vendría bien un poco de agua fría","Parece que a estos clientes les vendría bien que les echaran un poco de agua","A refrescarse","Estos pobres clientes tienen muchísimo calor","Debido al calor extremo durante el festival de verano, se te ha pedido que encuentres una forma creativa de refrescar a los clientes acalorados.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando finalice el evento con el que está asociada.</rgb>","Los clientes acalorados se encuentran por todo Hobbiton.\
\
Usa el agua de manera creativa para refrescar a los clientes acalorados.","Estos clientes parecen acalorados","Una jarra de agua puede encontrarse cerca de Tansy Campotieso en el Árbol de la Fiesta.\
\
Recoge la jarra de agua.","Recoge la jarra de agua fría","Regresa con Tansy Campotieso","Tansy Campotieso se encuentra en el Árbol de la Fiesta en Hobbiton.\
\
Habla con Tansy Campotieso.","Jarra de agua fría recogida"}},
[3561]={nameES="Tonelero y Tonel",objectivesES={"Entrega la madera a Bregedúr en Celondim","Entrega la madera para el tonel a Bregedúr en la terraza de artesanía en Celondim.\
\
Reunir la madera era la mitad del recorrido. Ahora debes entregar el material al artesano que fabricará el tonel para vino élfico.","Tu recolección de madera en el valle de Nen Hilith resultó valiosa para los Elfos. Glavrolnen quiere que lleves la madera al tonelero, Bregedúr, en Celondim.","Tonelero y Tonel"}},
[3562]={nameES="Copper Coins of Gundabad for Motes",objectivesES={"Deliver the Copper Coins of Gundabad to the March on Gundabad Quartermaster","Copper Coins of Gundabad for Motes","The March on Gundabad has a small quantity of Motes available.","Collect 30 Copper Coins of Gundabad to trade with the March on Gundabad Quartermaster.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>This quest can be completed weekly.</rgb>","Talk to the March on Gundabad Quartermaster to trade Copper Coins of Gundabad for Motes.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>This quest can be completed weekly.</rgb>"}},
[3563]={nameES="Cobre del Bosque Salvaje",objectivesES={"Alguien ha puesto una tarea para recolectar mineral de cobre en el Bosque Salvaje.","Encontrarás una caja de almacenamiento en el Embarcadero de los Comerciantes o en Puente de Caballetes.\
\
Debes colocar el mineral de cobre en una caja de almacenamiento.","El aviso del tablón dice:\
\
'Se necesita: mineral de cobre del Bosque Salvaje para la artesanía y el comercio. Se te recompensará por tus esfuerzos.'","Cobre del Bosque Salvaje","En el Bosque Salvaje se puede encontrar mineral de cobre.\
\
Deberías recoger mineral de cobre.","Coloca el mineral de cobre en una caja de almacenamiento"}},
[3564]={nameES="Cords of Love",objectivesES={"Cords of Love","Cut the silk cloth into ribbons at Thorían's workbench in Duillond.\
\
You should cut the silk into pretty ribbons.","Thorían is in central Duillond, near the workbenches.\
\
You should bring the cut ribbons to Thorían.","Collected a bolt of silk","The wedding planner in Duillond needs your helps procuring a shipment of handfasting cords she ordered.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This quest will be removed from your quest log when the current festival ends.</rgb>","Thorían is in central Duillond, near the workbenches.\
\
You should go and ask Thorían for handfasting cords.","The bolt of silk is in a crate at Brethilas' shop in Duillond.\
\
You should get a bolt of silk and bring it to be cut at the tailor's workbench.","Talk to Thorían","Celairel is south of Duillond.\
\
Bring the handfasting cords to Celairel.","Thorían can be found in Duillond.\
\
You have gathered the charms and flowers. Return to Thorían.","Deliver the completed handfasting cords to Celairel","Construct the handfasting cords","Talk to Dringlaer in Duillond","The metalsmith Dringlaer can be found in central Duillond, and the flowers bloom in and around the city.\
\
Thorían asked you to gather flowers and speak to Dringlaer.","Collect a bolt of silk"}},
[3565]={nameES="Corpses of Sorrow",objectivesES={"Wights can be found in the Circle of Sorrow in Minas Morgul.\
\
You should defeat any wights that you find.","Damrod can be found in Barad Orhant in Minas Morgul.\
\
You should talk to Damrod.","Damrod wishes to defeat the many wights that stalk the Circle of Sorrow in Minas Morgul.","Corpses of Sorrow","Talk to Damrod"}},
[3566]={nameES="Bestias corruptas de Nenuial",objectivesES={"La Dama Azul está en Gwindethrond, tras la cascada de Valcorriente en el oeste de Emyn Uial, al suroeste de Tyl Ruinen.\
\
Gwindeth está esperando para escuchar que has propinado un duro golpe a las salamandras de Tyl Ruinen.","Bestias corruptas de Nenuial","Las islas de Tyl Ruinen están en el noreste de Valcorriente, cerca del medio del lago, en Evendim.\
\
Gwindeth te ha pedido que derrotes a las salamandras corruptas que encuentres en Tyl Ruinen.","Gwindeth quiere que pruebes tu valía para recuperar el Silithar luchando contra las salamandras de Tyl Ruinen."}},
[3567]={nameES="Corrupted Candlelight",objectivesES={"Corrupted Candlelight","Lore-master Rúni is in Bazanmanar, in the north-east Clovengap.\
\
You should bring the candle to Rúni.","Return to Rúni","The torn fragments have been pieced together to form a map! But there is yet one more piece to this puzzle....","Recover the candle","Tuzugrák and the hobgolins can be found holed up in Anatrâd.\
\
Lore-master Rúni has asked you to defeat Tuzugrák and his hobgoblin captains, and to bring back the stolen candle.","Defeat Tuzugrák"}},
[3568]={nameES="Corrupted Crystals",objectivesES={"The chest is located near the forge at Annâk-khurfu.\
\
Mother Amma has asked you to place the foul smelling crystals in a chest.","Mother Amma is in the forge at Annâk-khurfu.\
\
You should talk to Mother Amma.","Talk to Gunvald","Gunvald is in Annâk-khurfu.\
\
Mother Amma has asked you to pass a message along to Gunvald.","Mother Amma is in the forge of Annâk-khurfu.\
\
Gunvald has asked you to give his thanks to Mother Amma.","Put the crystals into the chest","Mother Amma is in the forge at Annâk-khurfu, in southern Elderslade.\
\
You should bring the crystals to Mother Amma.","Mother Amma needs more crystals to study.","Howlers' Notch is north-west of Annâk-khurfu.\
\
Mother Amma has asked you to collect more of the fell crystals.","Talk to Mother Amma","Return to Mother Amma","Corrupted Crystals"}},
[3569]={nameES="Sabuesos Corrompidos",objectivesES={"Thoroniel está apostada al sur y al oeste del Gladdalf, en el norte del Bosque de los Trolls.\
\
Debes regresar con Thoroniel y hacerle saber que has cumplido lo que pidió.","Sabuesos Corrompidos","Los acechadores de pantano en el norte del Bosque de los Trolls, antaño rumoreados como los sabuesos guardianes de los legendarios Onodrim, han sido corrompidos por un poder oscuro y ahora trabajan junto a los trolls silvanos y otros siervos del Enemigo.","Habla con Thoroniel","Los acechadores de pantano pueden encontrarse en el Gladdalf, en el norte del Bosque de los Trolls.\
\
Thoroniel te ha pedido a ti y a tus compañeros que acabéis con los acechadores de pantano en el norte del Bosque de los Trolls."}},
[3570]={nameES="Memorias corrompidas",objectivesES={"Agorin reveló que las reliquias de Minas Gîl han sido corrompidas de forma irreversible por los hechiceros de Dol Guldur.","Habla con Agorin en Ost Galadh","Memorias corrompidas","Las reliquias corrompidas se encuentran en Minas Gîl, al este de Ost Galadh.\
\
Agorin te ha pedido que destruyas las reliquias silvanas corrompidas que hay en Minas Gîl.","Agorin se encuentra en Ost Galadh, al oeste de Minas Gîl.\
\
Deberías informar a Agorin de tu éxito."}},
[3571]={nameES="Corrupted Salamanders",objectivesES={}},
[3572]={nameES="Arañas corrompidas",objectivesES={"Las sombras extrañas a las que se refería Knakk se pueden encontrar al este y al sureste de donde acampa, en la pasarela elevada situada en el rincón noreste de las Vetas del Cuerno Rojo.","Regresa con Knakk","Knakk acampa en la pasarela elevada que está en el rincón noreste de las Vetas del Cuerno Rojo.\
\
Estará ansioso por saber qué descubriste mientras explorabas la parte este de las Vetas.","Arañas corrompidas","Hay criaturas de formas extrañas merodeando por el este y el sureste. Knakk juró haber visto una criatura que se parecía un poco a una araña. Pero, como está solo en este lugar tan remoto, trata de pasar desapercibido en la pasarela elevada y no pudo verla bien.","Le dices a Knakk que parece que algún tipo de hongo se está propagando e infectando la zona oriental de las Vetas.\
\
'¿La criatura de forma extraña que vi era una araña infectada? ¡¿Dices que incluso el suelo está infectado en esa zona?! ¿A qué nos enfrentamos?\
\
'Esto es realmente preocupante.'"}},
[3573]={nameES="Corrupting One's Own",objectivesES={"Mother Amma is in Bazanmanar, in north-east Clovengap.\
\
You should bring the new fragment to Mother Amma.","Corrupting One's Own","The Angmarim priest can be found in north-western Clovengap.\
\
You should find and defeat the priest who is working to corrupt the deserting Angmarim.","The Angmarim sorcerers are experimenting on their own people with the corrupted sarrowstone crystals.","Defeat Crágacha","Return to Mother Amma"}},
[3574]={nameES="Corrupting the Deserters",objectivesES={}},
[3575]={nameES="Corruption of Cairns",objectivesES={"The ancient homes of the interred dead have been violated. Cairn-stones that once stood as markers for the honoured dead are now being corrupted towards a dark purpose.","Talk to Mincham in the Lich Bluffs","Mincham's camp is north-east of Trac-plas.\
\
You should return to Mincham and report that you discovered a strange liquid had been poured on the cairn-stones, and that several dark markings were engraved upon them as well.","Corruption of Cairns","The corrupted cairn-stones lie to the north of Trac-plas, south-west of Mincham's camp.\
  \
Mincham asked you to seek out corrupted cairn-stones, examine them, and report back with your findings."}},
[3576]={nameES="Corruption of the Lone-lands",objectivesES={"Ost Guruth lies in the Lone-lands, far to the east of Bree-land, along the Great East Road.\
\
Nidgyl has told you to begin your patrol of the Lone-lands at the stronghold of Ost Guruth.","Ost Haer lies in the Grimfens in the Lone-lands, south of Ost Guruth, far to the east of Bree-land.\
\
Nidgyl has asked you to scout the ruins of Ost Haer.","Scout Nan Dhelu","Dol Vaeg lies in the Lone-lands, far to the east of Bree-land, west of the Last Bridge.\
\
Nidgyl has asked you to climb the spire of Dol Vaeg, a tall hill some ways to the west of the Last Bridge. It offers an excellent view of the surrounding lands.","Scout Dol Vaeg","Nidgyl is concerned with the corruption that seems to flow from the ruins in the eastern reaches of the Lone-lands. Should it continue to expand unchecked, it may soon pose a deadly threat to travellers in the region.","Scouted Dol Vaeg","Scout Ost Guruth","Scouted Nan Dhelu","Scout Ost Haer","Scouted Ost Guruth","Nidgyl is at Bree-town in Bree-land, far to the west of the Lone-lands.\
\
You should report to Nidgyl and tell him what you have found in the eastern Lone-lands.","Talk to Nidgyl","Corruption of the Lone-lands","Nan Dhelu lies in the Lone-lands, far to the east of Bree-land, north-east of Dol Vaeg.\
\
Nidgyl has asked you to scout the ruins of Nan Dhelu.","Scouted Ost Haer"}},
[3577]={nameES="Corrupción de la Naturaleza",objectivesES={"Gwenfor Mellion está preocupada por las tierras salvajes que rodean Glyn Helyg.","Habla con Nuddo Sutchic","Habla con Gwenfor","La sombra se ha revelado.","Una extraña sombra permanece","La presencia de la sombra te amenaza","La corrupción más profunda del bosque ha llegado a afectar incluso a las bestias.\
\
Deberías informar de inmediato a Gwenfor en Glyn Helyg.","Adéntrate más en el bosque","Gwenfor Mellion te dice que las plantas se están marchitando y que una sombra se cierne sobre la naturaleza del bosque al sudeste.\
\
El bosque del que habla se encuentra al sudeste de Glyn Helyg. Puedes seguir el camino que sale de la aldea.","Gwenfor espera tu informe. Gwenfor puede encontrarse en Glyn Helyg.","Derrota a la bestia corrompida","Gwenfor Mellion quiere que te adentres más en el bosque y confirmes sus sospechas.\
\
Continúa más adelante por el sendero hacia el sudeste, cruzando el puente. Una sombra tenue permanece alrededor de las aguas quietas.","Investiga la planta corrompida","Corrupción de la Naturaleza","Nuddo Sutchic puede encontrarse en Lintrev, al norte.\
\
Gwenfor te ha pedido que compartas tus hallazgos con ellos."}},
[3578]={nameES="Corruption's Cost",objectivesES={"Brágha Fellwinder has gone to the tower of Caivád Sâr, in central Elderslade.\
\
You should defeat Brágha Fellwinder before she can pass on the knowledge of the crystals and the corruption her spells bring.","Gunvald is in Annâk-khurfu in Elderslade.\
\
Return to Gunvald.","Talk to Gunvald","The sorceress Brágha Fellwinder has gone to Caivád Sâr, where she intends to teach her fellow Angmarim how to make more of the corrupted Wargs.","Defeat Brágha Fellwinder","Corruption's Cost"}},
[3579]={nameES="Corruption's Source",objectivesES={"Mother Amma is in north-eastern Clovengap.\
\
You should tell Mother Amma that the threat has been defeated.","Return to Mother Amma","Find the source of the corruption","La fuente de la corrupción de los cristales ha sido localizada, ¿pero qué yace bajo el lodo?","Corruption's Source"}},
[3580]={nameES="Corruptive Influence",objectivesES={"The Orc has been defeated","Go to the next location","This specific Orc will trouble Dági no longer.\
\
He waits for you at Ashmargathâl.","Talk to Dági","An Orc has been tampering with the dwarves' water supply and needs to be stopped.","Defeat the Orc responsible","Dági has asked you to go to the next set of collection buckets and stop the Orc.\
\
The buckets are in an area that overlooks the Mirrormere, to the south-west of Ashmargathâl.","An Orc rushes up from behind!","Pretend to collect snow","Corruptive Influence","The Orc has not touched these buckets yet, but is most likely nearby.\
\
You should feign ignorance about the Orc's presence and pretend to collect snow.","These buckets remain undisturbed"}},
[3581]={nameES="Corruptor: A Master's Design",objectivesES={"Make your way to Grothum and speak with Taskmaster Bárzqhosh. Ask him for his design for making your sapling grow.","Speak with Bárzqhosh at Grothum for advice","Deliver aurochs droppings to Cinaid at Gramsfoot","You spoke with Bárzqhosh","Corruptor: A Master's Design","Cinaid wants you to visit a humiliated Uruk in Grothum. His hope is that the Uruk will find a way to help your sapling. Go to him and ask for his guidance.","Bárzqhosh provided a very strange answer. Go to the plains along the Hoardale where the Thistledown Grazers roam and collect their dung. Use it in the soil to grow your sapling."}},
