[3655]={nameES="Crab Grab",objectivesES={"Remhir may have a solution to the fast encroachment of the crabs along Dor-en-Ernil's shores.","Remhir has asked you to set up crab traps along Dor-en-Ernil's shores.","Crab Grab","You have set up plenty of traps along the shores of Dor-en-Ernil. You should tell Remhir.\
\
Remhir can be found in Barad Rill.","Talk to Remhir in Barad Rill"}},
[3656]={nameES="Crabbing at Lithengris",objectivesES={"Avri has asked you to check the crab traps she placed at Lithengris.\
\
Lithengris is located south-east of Sadrech's Camp.","A Corsair rushes towards you!","Bucket of crabs obtained","Check the last crab trap","None of the crab traps held any crabs.\
\
You should check the last crab trap at Lithengris.","You have recovered a bucket full of crabs from the Corsair.\
\
You should give it to Avri at Sadrech's Camp.","Talk to Avri at Sadrech's Camp","With her hands full tending to her mother's injuries, Avri finds herself unable to check on her crab traps.","Crabbing at Lithengris","No crabs here..."}},
[3657]={nameES="Chasquear el látigo",objectivesES={"Vicious Orc-slavers torment the Dunlending and Rohirrim captives in their mines.","Bring the Orc-whips to Ondor in the Orc-mines","Chasquear el látigo","Orc Slavers can be found throughout the Orc-mines.\
\
Ondor asked you to claim the whips from the Orc Slavers.","Ondor the Dwarf is in the Orc-mines.\
\
You should bring the whips you collected to Ondor the Dwarf."}},
