[3708]={nameES="Artesanía: Carpintero Artesano",objectivesES={"Artesanía: Carpintero Artesano","Ejecuta la receta para una lanza de tejo","Has fabricado un arco de tejo","Lleva el arco de tejo a Eón","Lleva la lanza de tejo a Rhona","Habla con Tadhrien en Esteldín","Tadhrien se encuentra en la Sala de Artesanía de Esteldín.\
\
Debes hablar con Tadhrien y contarle que tus entregas fueron exitosas.","Ejecuta la receta para un arco de tejo","Has fabricado una lanza de tejo"}},
[3709]={nameES="Artesanía: Barton Tyne ha perdido su anillo",objectivesES={"Artesanía: Barton Tyne ha perdido su anillo","Barton Tyne ha perdido el anillo de cobre reluciente que le dio su esposa Verity, y está desesperado pensando en lo que ella hará cuando descubra que lo perdió.","Recolecta anillo de cobre reluciente","Lleva un anillo de cobre reluciente a Barton Tyne","Anillo de cobre reluciente recolectado","Barton Tyne está en el camino entre la ciudad de Bree y la Posada Abandonada.\
\
Barton Tyne te dijo que perdió su anillo de bodas y está buscando los servicios de un joyero para hacer un anillo de cobre reluciente que lo reemplace. Su esposa Verity seguro estará furiosa si regresa sin él."}},
[3710]={nameES="Artesanía: Bronce para Bree",objectivesES={"Broquel de bronce recolectado","Recolecta broquel de bronce","Osur Martillofirme está preocupado por lo que considera el triste estado de la armadura que llevan los guardias de Bree y quiere aliviar la situación.","Armadura de bronce recolectada","Osur Martillofirme está en la sala de artesanía cerca de la Fuente del Jabalí en Bree.\
\
Osur Martillofirme está preocupado por la baja calidad de la armadura que llevan los guardias de Bree y quiere que encuentres un herrero dispuesto a fabricar una armadura de bronce y un broquel de bronce que pueda dar a los defensores.","Lleva la armadura de bronce y el broquel de bronce a Osur Martillofirme","Artesanía: Bronce para Bree","Recolecta armadura de bronce"}},
[3711]={nameES="Artesanía: Preparativos para acampar",objectivesES={"Lleva dos kits de fogata de serbal a Crocus Stonybanks","Artesanía: Preparativos para acampar","Crocus Stonybanks está en Sobrecolina.\
\
Crocus te ha pedido que le lleves dos kits de fogata de serbal para poder ir de campamento con sus amigos.","Crocus Stonybanks está tratando de reunir algunos materiales para la fogata para poder ir de campamento con sus amigos."}},
[3712]={nameES="Artesanía: Gemas para Guleneth",objectivesES={"Artesanía: Gemas para Guleneth","Entrega ágatas pulidas a Guleneth","Guleneth está en Celondim, en Ered Luin.\
\
El joyero Guleneth te ha pedido que consigas tres ágatas pulidas que pueda usar para completar algunas de las piezas que le quedaron incompletas.","El joyero Guleneth te ha pedido que le traigas ágatas pulidas que pueda usar en las piezas que fabrica."}},
[3713]={nameES="Fabricación: Geoffrey Fuller odia las astillas",objectivesES={"Fabricación: Geoffrey Fuller odia las astillas","Guantes rellenos recogidos","Lleva los guantes rellenos a Geoffrey Fuller","Geoffrey Fuller tiene un verdadero problema con las astillas que recibe a diario por trabajar en el campamento maderero de Combe.","Geoffrey Fuller está en el pueblo de Combe.\
\
Geoffrey está harto de las astillas que encuentra cada día en su trabajo en el campamento maderero y ha pedido que le lleves unos guantes rellenos. Un sastre debería poder hacer los guantes.","Recoge los guantes rellenos"}},
[3714]={nameES="Artesanía: El conocimiento es la mejor defensa",objectivesES={"Clayton Cole espera mejorar la disciplina de los guardias de Bree bajo su mando estudiando las lecciones del pasado.","Conocimiento menor de armería recolectado","Recolecta conocimiento menor de batalla","Artesanía: El conocimiento es la mejor defensa","Lleva conocimiento menor de batalla y conocimiento menor de armería a Clayton Cole","Recolecta conocimiento menor de armería","Clayton Cole está junto a la puerta de Combe, en el lado este de la ciudad de Bree.\
\
Clayton te ha pedido que encuentres un erudito que pueda proporcionarte conocimiento menor de armería y conocimiento menor de batalla.","Conocimiento menor de batalla recolectado"}},
[3715]={nameES="Artesanía: Laegon practica su oficio",objectivesES={"Laegon está en Celondim, en Ered Luin.\
\
Laegon te ha pedido que le lleves tres varas de arco de serbal que pueda usar para perfeccionar sus técnicas de curvado de arcos.","Lleva varas de arco de serbal a Laegon","El elfo Laegon se ha dedicado a practicar la fabricación de arcos, y con frecuencia necesita materiales.","Artesanía: Laegon practica su oficio"}},
[3716]={nameES="Fabricación: Calzas para Gagi",objectivesES={"Recolectadas calzas de bronce","Gagi Cejanublada se encuentra al oeste del Patio de Frerin.\
\
Gagi Cejanublada te ha pedido que le consigas unas calzas de bronce, porque el par que intentó forjar por sí mismo salió muy mal y de ninguna manera se parece a las calzas que quería hacer.","Gagi Cejanublada intentó hacerse unas calzas de bronce, pero el resultado ha sido descrito como un pequeño desastre.","Recolecta calzas de bronce","Entrega las calzas de bronce a Gagi Cejanublada","Fabricación: Calzas para Gagi"}},
[3717]={nameES="Artesanía: Aprovechando las Tierras Bajas",objectivesES={"Solvi Pergaminero está en Gondamon, en las Tierras Bajas de Ered Luin.\
\
Solvi Pergaminero te pidió que consiguieras a un erudito que preparara algunos conocimientos menores de herrería y algunos conocimientos menores de carpintero para que él los examine.","Conocimientos menores de herrería recopilados","Solvi Pergaminero está convencido de que se podría hacer un mejor uso de los recursos que se encuentran fuera de Gondamon y quiere tu ayuda para obtener información que respalde esta idea.","Artesanía: Aprovechando las Tierras Bajas","Lleva conocimientos menores de carpintero y herrería a Solvi Pergaminero","Recopila conocimientos menores de carpintero","Conocimientos menores de carpintero recogidos","Recopila conocimientos menores de herrería"}},
[3718]={nameES="Artesanía: Casa de los artesanos de Cavada Grande",objectivesES={"Esmeralda Barrenales se encuentra en la Casa de los artesanos de Cavada Grande, al suroeste de la estatua del centro del pueblo, más allá de las caballerizas y a lo largo de la primera curva a la izquierda.\
\
Alf Buenaltura te sugirió hablar con su amiga Esmeralda Barrenales si te interesa seguir una profesión artesanal.","Artesanía: Casa de los artesanos de Cavada Grande"}},
[3719]={nameES="Artesanía: La sastra más joven de Cavada Grande",objectivesES={"Recoge conocimientos menores de sastrería","Lleva conocimientos menores de sastrería a Caléndula Azadoble","Conocimientos menores de sastrería recopilados","Artesanía: La sastra más joven de Cavada Grande","Caléndula Azadoble te ha pedido que le lleves algunos conocimientos menores de sastrería para que pueda aprender el oficio.","Caléndula Azadoble está en Cavada Grande.\
\
Caléndula te pidió que le trajeras algunos conocimientos menores de sastrería para empezar a aprender el oficio, aunque nadie se lo enseñe."}},
[3720]={nameES="Artesanía: Los altos estándares de Fondolodoso",objectivesES={"Entrega tartas de champiñones a Odo Fondolodoso","Artesanía: Los altos estándares de Fondolodoso","Odo Fondolodoso está en Los Ranales.\
\
Odo se niega a comer en El Tronco Flotante mientras duren las reparaciones del techo, pero aún quiere sus habituales tartas de champiñones.","A Odo Fondolodoso le preocupa que el techo de su lugar favorito para comer, El Tronco Flotante, esté actualmente en reparación."}},
[3721]={nameES="Artesanía: Ned en un aprieto",objectivesES={"Masa para tarta recolectada","Artesanía: Ned en un aprieto","Ned Pozuelo está en Cavada Grande.\
\
Ned Pozuelo espera que regreses con una masa para tarta que pueda usar para reemplazar la que se comió (la que ya reemplazaba a otra), antes de que su esposa note que falta.","Recoge una masa para tarta","Entrega la masa para tarta a Ned Pozuelo","Ned Pozuelo se comió la masa para tarta que le trajiste como reemplazo de la anterior que devoró, y ahora está en un verdadero aprieto."}},
[3722]={nameES="Fabricación: El Nuevo Engarce de Nefi",objectivesES={"Recoger un collar de cobre reluciente","Nefi Cortagemas rompió el engarce de un collar que una vez elaboró y desea un reemplazo","Nefi Cortagemas se encuentra a lo largo del camino que conduce a la Mansión de Thorin.\
\
'Nefi Cortagemas te ha pedido que le lleves un collar de cobre reluciente para reemplazar uno que hizo durante su tiempo como joyero.","Llevar collar de cobre reluciente a Nefi Cortagemas","Fabricación: El Nuevo Engarce de Nefi","Has recogido un collar de cobre reluciente"}},
[3723]={nameES="Artesanía: Equipando a los defensores",objectivesES={"Recoge guantes de bronce","Recoge un yelmo de bronce","Efi Forjaplacas está en Gondamon, en las Tierras Bajas de Ered Luin.\
\
Efi Forjaplacas te pidió que le trajeras guantes de bronce y un yelmo de bronce con los que pueda equipar a los defensores de la barricada en Rath Teraig.","Entrega guantes de bronce y un casco de bronce a Efi Forjaplacas","Efi Forjaplacas está ansioso por equipar a los enanos que custodian la barricada de Rath Teraig y te pidió que le ayudes a reunir las piezas de armadura necesarias.","Yelmo de bronce recogido","Artesanía: Equipando a los defensores","Guantes de bronce recogidos"}},
[3724]={nameES="Artesanía: El primer desayuno de Seward Ganapié",objectivesES={"Seward Ganapié quiere ofrecer un desayuno a los guardias de la ciudad de Bree como muestra de su agradecimiento.","Lleva huevos con cebollas y bizcochos duros a Seward Ganapié","Seward Ganapié está afuera de El Poney Pisador, en la ciudad de Bree.\
\
Seward Ganapié prometió a algunos guardias que les prepararía un desayuno de huevos con cebollas y bizcochos duros, pero no encuentra su libro de recetas. Te ha pedido que busques un cocinero dispuesto a preparar la comida y te pagará si se la llevas.","Artesanía: El primer desayuno de Seward Ganapié"}},
[3725]={nameES="Artesanía: El duro trabajo de Ingi Barbahumo",objectivesES={"Lleva cerdo asado y bizcochos duros a Ingi Barbahumo","Artesanía: El duro trabajo de Ingi Barbahumo","Ingi Barbahumo se encuentra en Gondamon, en las Tierras Bajas de Ered Luin.\
\
Tiene hambre y quiere que le lleves dos porciones de cerdo asado y dos bizcochos duros para saciar su apetito.","Ingi Barbahumo ha estado trabajando arduamente fabricando armaduras para los enanos que defienden Gondamon, y ahora está listo para comer."}},
[3726]={nameES="Artesanía: Los alumnos de Rompepiedras",objectivesES={"Artesanía: Los alumnos de Rompepiedras","Gríss Rompepiedras quiere enseñar a algunos de sus alumnos cómo forjar armas de bronce y desea que le lleves algunas piezas.","Gríss Rompepiedras está en la Sala de Forja dentro de la Mansión de Thorin.\
\
Gríss Rompepiedras te pidió que le llevaras dos hojas de bronce y dos empuñaduras de bronce para usarlas como ejemplos con sus alumnos de forja de armas.","Lleva hojas de bronce y empuñaduras de bronce a Gríss Rompepiedras."}},
[3727]={nameES="Fabricación: Fuerte de brazo y agudo de mente",objectivesES={"Fabricación: Fuerte de brazo y agudo de mente","Roderick Carver está junto al Salón de Artesanos en Combe, al sur de Archet. El camino de la izquierda desde el centro de Combe sube la colina pasando el Salón de Artesanos.\
\
Edward Carver quiere que hables con su hermano Roderick sobre aprender una profesión artesanal.","Tras el incendio de Archet, Edward Carver y su hermano Roderick esperan animar a todos los que tienen potencial a dedicarse a profesiones artesanales por el bien de los Pueblos Libres."}},
[3728]={nameES="Artesanía: Estudio de los Navíos Blancos",objectivesES={"Entrega conocimientos menores de carpintero a Raindis","Recopila conocimientos menores de carpintero","Raindis está en Celondim, en Ered Luin.\
\
Raindis te ha pedido que recolectes algunos conocimientos menores de carpintero de un erudito para que pueda ver si es posible mejorar la madera utilizada como vigas en los Navíos Blancos.","Artesanía: Estudio de los Navíos Blancos","Raindis de Celondim te ha pedido que le lleves algunos conocimientos menores de carpintero que pueda aplicar a la preparación de las maderas utilizadas en la construcción de los Navíos Blancos.","Conocimientos menores de carpintero recogidos"}},
[3729]={nameES="Artesanía: Suministros para el campamento maderero.",objectivesES={"El campamento maderero de Combe necesita suministros para que sus trabajadores puedan aumentar la producción de madera utilizable.","Martillo de serbal recolectado","Recolecta martillo de serbal.","Ember Hayes está en el campamento maderero de Combe.\
\
Ember dijo que te pagaría por un martillo de serbal y tres empuñaduras de serbal, si pudieras llevárselos. Un carpintero debería poder fabricar estos objetos.","Lleva un martillo de serbal y tres empuñaduras de serbal a Ember Hayes.","Artesanía: Suministros para el campamento maderero."}},
[3730]={nameES="Artesanía: El gran robo de la masa para tarta",objectivesES={"Masa para tarta recolectada","Artesanía: El gran robo de la masa para tarta","Recoge una masa para tarta","Ned Pozuelo se comió la masa para tarta que su esposa tenía pensado rellenar para hacer una deliciosa tarta, y ahora necesita con urgencia un reemplazo.","Ned Pozuelo está en Cavada Grande.\
\
Ned Pozuelo está esperando que regreses con una masa para tarta que pueda usar para reemplazar la que se comió, antes de que su esposa descubra que falta.","Entrega la masa para tarta a Ned Pozuelo"}},
[3731]={nameES="Artesanía: La Galería de los Artesanos",objectivesES={"Bogi Excavadorprofundo te ha pedido que hables con su amigo Egil Barbavieja en la Mansión de Thorin sobre cómo contribuir al estado de la artesanía en las Montañas Azules.","Egil Barbavieja se encuentra en la Galería de los Artesanos, dentro de la Mansión de Thorin, al este de la cámara de entrada.\
\
Bogi Excavadorprofundo te sugirió que hablaras con su amigo Egil Barbavieja, que ha estado recibiendo a artesanos novatos en las Montañas Azules durante más de un siglo.","Artesanía: La Galería de los Artesanos"}},
[3732]={nameES="Artesanía: Metales Mínimos",objectivesES={"El hierro negro forjado en las Profundidades Llameantes de Moria suele contener leves trazas de 'plata auténtica'. Aunque el preciado metal no puede recuperarse, este extraño aleaje posee usos valiosos para quienes dominan el saber y la artesanía.","Artesanía: Metales Mínimos","Los lingotes de hierro y las escamas de sierpe bruñidas pueden obtenerse de los orcos y de las sierpes que habitan en las Profundidades Llameantes.\
\
Myndil te ha pedido que le recolectes hierro negro y escamas de sierpe bruñidas.","YOU SHOULD NOT SEE THIS","Habla con Myndil en Anazârmekhem","Myndil se encuentra en Anazârmekhem, en las Profundidades Llameantes de Moria.\
\
Debes llevarle a Myndil el hierro y las escamas que has recolectado."}},
[3733]={nameES="Artesanía: Verity Tyne ha perdido su anillo",objectivesES={"Verity Tyne ha perdido el anillo de cobre reluciente que le dio su esposo Barton, y está muy preocupada de que él lo descubra.","Lleva el anillo de cobre reluciente a Verity Tyne","Verity Tyne está en la Sala de Artesanía en Bree.\
\
Verity Tyne te ha pedido que encuentres un joyero dispuesto a hacerle un anillo de cobre reluciente para reemplazar el anillo de bodas que perdió.","Artesanía: Verity Tyne ha perdido su anillo","Recolecta anillo de cobre reluciente","Anillo de cobre reluciente recolectado"}},
[3734]={nameES="Fabricación: Armas para Leighton Howard",objectivesES={"Hacha de bronce recogida","Leighton Howard está en el pueblo de Combe, en las Tierras de Bree.\
\
Leighton te ha pedido que consigas un hacha de bronce y dos hojas de bronce para él, porque los armeros locales cobran demasiado y las necesita para proteger a su familia.","Leighton Howard te ha pedido que consigas algunas armas de bronce para defender a su familia.","Recoge hacha de bronce","Fabricación: Armas para Leighton Howard","Lleva un hacha de bronce y dos hojas de bronce a Leighton Howard"}},
[3735]={nameES="Crafts of Old",objectivesES={}},
[3736]={nameES="El desafío de Crannog",objectivesES={"Tareas de Torquil completadas","Tareas de Osbail completadas","Te enviaron a Crannog, el jefe de Aughaire, para perseguir un Fém para los Trév Gállorg.","Torquil, Raith y Osbail están cerca del trono de Crannog, el jefe de Aughaire.\
\
Crannog te ha encargado enfrentar los peligros de los que te hablarán Torquil, Raith y Osbail. Una vez que lo hayas hecho, espera que vuelvas a verlo.","El desafío de Crannog","Crannog se encuentra en su asiento de gobierno en Aughaire, al oeste de la isla central.\
\
Has ayudado a algunos de los Trév Gállorg con los peligros que enfrenta el asentamiento y ahora deberías informar a Crannog de tus éxitos.","Tareas de Raith completadas","Completa las tareas de Osbail","Completa las tareas de Raith","Completa las tareas de Torquil"}},
[3737]={nameES="El quinto desafío de Crannog",objectivesES={"Has vencido a Nekhtan en combate","Desafía a Nekhtan","A instancias de Crannog, combatiste y venciste a tres de los guerreros más poderosos de Aughaire para ganarte el derecho a representar a los Trév Gállorg en el Clúcath, pero aún queda una prueba más.","Nekhtan va a entrenarse junto a un gran árbol al este de Aughaire. Crannog te dijo que salieras del asentamiento por el norte, y luego giraras al este y siguieras la línea de las colinas hasta ver el árbol en una hondonada al norte.\
\
Crannog te contó la historia de Nekhtan, el mayor guerrero de los Trév Gállorg, cuyo padre fue asesinado en el último Clúcath, donde los Trév Duvárdain escucharon a sus amos Angmarim y violaron las reglas del rito. Tu tarea es vencerle para ganarte el derecho a representar a los Trév Gállorg en el Clúcath.","Crannog está en su trono, al oeste de la isla central del asentamiento de Aughaire.\
\
Has vencido a Nekhtan y deberías llevar la noticia de tu éxito a Crannog.","El quinto desafío de Crannog"}},
[3738]={nameES="El cuarto desafío de Crannog",objectivesES={"Raith está cerca del trono de Crannog, al oeste de la isla central de Aughaire. Feradakh está en el Búth Luikh, al sureste del trono de Crannog. Fonghala está en el Búth Sánkhas, al sureste del mercado de Aughaire. Moridac está en los corrales de uros de Aughaire, al noreste del trono de Crannog.\
\
En un esfuerzo por ver si eres lo suficientemente fuerte para representar a los Trév Gállorg en el próximo Clúcath, Crannog te ha encomendado luchar contra varios de los guerreros más poderosos de Aughaire. Raith puede hablarte de cada uno de ellos.","El cuarto desafío de Crannog","Derrota a Fonghala","El Fém que Crannog te concedió era iniciar el Rito del Clúcath, una antigua ceremonia de juicio de los Montañeros. Por ahora, sin embargo, tiene otras tareas para ti.","Has vencido a Fonghala en combate","Derrota a Feradakh","Has vencido a Moridac en combate","Derrota a Moridac","Has vencido a Feradakh en combate","Crannog está en su trono, al oeste de la isla central de Aughaire.\
\
Has vencido a los tres guerreros que Crannog te puso delante y deberías informarle ahora de tus victorias."}},
[3739]={nameES="El segundo desafío de Crannog",objectivesES={"Tareas de Rona completadas","Completa las tareas de Camran","Has completado el primer desafío de Crannog para demostrar tu valía ante los Trév Gállorg de Aughaire, pero él aún no confía en ti.","Completa las tareas de Rona","El segundo desafío de Crannog","Crannog se encuentra en su asiento de gobierno en Aughaire, al oeste de la isla central.\
\
Has realizado las tareas que te dieron Lakhina, Camran y Rona y ahora deberías regresar a Crannog.","Tareas de Camran completadas","Lakhina, Camran y Rona se encuentran en la isla central de Aughaire, al este del asiento de gobierno de Crannog.\
\
Crannog quiere que hables con Lakhina, Camran y Rona de Aughaire y realices las tareas que te pidan.","Tareas de Lakhina completadas","Completa las tareas de Lakhina"}},
[3740]={nameES="El tercer desafío de Crannog",objectivesES={"El tercer desafío de Crannog","Tus logros en nombre de los Trév Gállorg te han ganado el reconocimiento y la confianza de Crannog, su jefe.","El Cairn del Honor está al noreste de Fail-á-Khro, muy al norte de Aughaire. La cima de la colina en la que descansa el Cairn del Honor está marcada por una fila de antorchas.\
\
Raith te ha dicho que debes recoger la Piedra del Clúcath y llevársela a Crannog.","Lleva la Piedra del Clúcath a Crannog","Raith está junto al trono de Crannog, en Aughaire, al oeste de la isla central del asentamiento.\
\
Crannog te ha concedido tu Fém —iniciar el rito del Clúcath— y te ha dicho que hables con Raith para saber qué implica esto.","Crannog está en su trono, al oeste de la isla central de Aughaire.\
\
Has tomado la Piedra del Clúcath del Cairn del Honor y deberías llevársela ahora a Crannog."}},
[3741]={nameES="Aterrizaje forzoso",objectivesES={"Lleva las cometas estrelladas a Lila Cordelero","Las cometas estrelladas se pueden encontrar por todo Hobbiton.\
\
Deberías recoger las cometas estrelladas para que otros visitantes del festival puedan disfrutarlas.","Muchos cometas han caído por todo Hobbiton y deben ser recogidos.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando termine el evento con el que está asociada.</rgb>","Lila Cordelero se encuentra cerca del árbol de la fiesta en Hobbiton.\
\
Deberías llevarle las cometas estrelladas.","Aterrizaje forzoso"}},
[3742]={nameES="Derrumbe",objectivesES={"Hamall está en Jazârgund, al oeste de Fehem-dûm y Hadâd-dûm.\
\
Hamall debería saber que ninguna de las columnas de vino abajo y que la cueva está intacta.","Habla con Hamall en Jazârgund","Las columnas ruinosas pueden encontrarse en los campamentos orcos de Fehem-dûm y Hadâd-dûm, al este de Jazârgund.\
\
Hamall ha detectado varias columnas ruinosas cerca de los campamentos orcos. Te ha asegurado de que si se dañan lo suficiente, todo se derrumbará y destruirá los campamentos.","Las columnas se mantienen firmes","Hamall ha detectado varias columnas ruinosas en las cuevas de los alrededores de los campamentos de trasgos y orcos. Si son dañadas, la cueva debería derrumbarse sobre las fuerzas enemigas.","Derrumbe"}},
[3743]={nameES="Recogida de cajas",objectivesES={"Recogida de cajas","Habla con Cad Gamoespino.","Cad Gamoespino está en Puente de Caballetes.\
\
Deberías hablar con Cad Gamoespino.","Los constantes ataques han dejado Puente de Caballetes en mal estado, y la Hermandad de los Leñadores está haciendo todo lo posible por reconstruir el pueblo.","Lleva las cajas vacías al almacén de Puente de Caballetes","En Puente de Caballetes hay cajas vacías por todas partes.\
\
Deberías recoger todas las cajas vacías.","El almacén se encuentra en Puente de Caballetes.\
\
Debes llevar las cajas vacías al almacén de Puente de Caballetes."}},
[3744]={nameES="Cajas y barriles",objectivesES={"Habla con Leighton Kipps en Rantost","Cajas y barriles","La isla de Rantost es donde los saqueadores de tumbas han establecido su campamento central. Allí se guarda gran parte de la historia.","Leighton Kipps está acampado en el extremo sureste de Rantost.\
\
Leighton Kipps quiere saber cuántas cajas y barriles hay para transmitirles la información a los montaraces.","Hay cajas y barriles repartidos por todo Rantost.\
\
Leighton Kipps te ha pedido que cuentes las cajas y barriles que hay en Rantost."}},
[3745]={nameES="Crawlers in Arnach",objectivesES={"Talk to Arlach","Arlach has expressed an increased frequency of attacks on Arnach from a spider's nest across the river.","You found the spider's nest in Lhingar and have defeated many spiders, including their queen. You should tell Arlach the news.\
\
Arlach is in Arnach.","Arlach has asked you to investigate Lhingar across the river to the north-west.","Lhingar queen defeated","Defeat Lhingar queen","Crawlers in Arnach"}},
[3746]={nameES="Crawlers of the Crags",objectivesES={}},
[3747]={nameES="Brazos reptantes",objectivesES={"Pueden encontrarse brazos reptantes en el Laberinto del Gran Túmulo.","Los muertos ancestrales se han alzado en el Gran Túmulo.","Brazos reptantes"}},
[3748]={nameES="Crawling in the Darkness",objectivesES={}},
[3749]={nameES="Creatures of the Mire",objectivesES={"Legolas can be found in the Camp of the Host, on the northern edge of North Ithilien.\
\
You should talk to Legolas and tell how you have cleansed many blighted creatures from the borders of the Dead Marshes.","Return to Legolas","Creatures from the Dead Marshes have ventured into the muddy border of the Noman-lands.\
\
You should destroy any of these creatures you find while scouting in the Noman-lands.","Destroy creatures from the Dead Marshes while scouting in the Noman-lands.","The Dead Marshes lie just beyond the Noman-lands, a cursed place where the fallen of a great battle still rest. The vile creatures who reside there seem to be overstepping their bounds and venture into the muddy border of the Noman-lands.  You should thin their numbers so they cannot spread any further.","Creatures of the Mire"}},
[3750]={nameES="Credits and Debits",objectivesES={}},
[3751]={nameES="Creeping Decay",objectivesES={"At their Master's bidding, defilers of Mordor have come down from the Ephel Dúath and have begun to corrupt the lands of North Ithilien.","Creeping Decay","Thurindol can be found at Aelin Veren.\
\
You have defeated the defilers and thrown down the Dúath-spires. You should return to Thurindol with news of your success.","Talk to Thurindol at Aelin Veren","Defilers and Dúath-spires can be found along the edges of the Mountains of Shadow in south-eastern North Ithilien.\
\
Thurindol has asked you to defeat the defilers invading North Ithilien and destroy the black stone spires to which they are drawn."}},
[3752]={nameES="Emblemas del Valor — Introducción",objectivesES={"El Concilio del Norte necesita insignias para otorgárselas a los héroes de la guerra contra Angmar.","Hróar está en Gath Forthnír, en Angmar.\
\
Hróar te ha pedido que forjes algunas Emblemas del Valor y se las lleves.","Emblemas del Valor — Introducción","Entrega tus Emblemas del Valor a Hróar en Gath Forthnír"}},
[3753]={nameES="Emblemas de Vigilancia — Introducción",objectivesES={"Hróar está en Gath Forthnír, en Angmar.\
\
Hróar te ha pedido que forjes algunos Emblemas de Vigilancia y se los lleves.","Entrega tus Emblemas de Vigilancia a Hróar en Gath Forthnír","Emblemas de Vigilancia — Introducción","El Concilio del Norte necesita un medio para identificar a sus guerreros en el campo de batalla."}},
[3754]={nameES="Los gritos de la hueste",objectivesES={"Los gritos de la hueste","Himbar está plagado por las merrevail y sus parientes, los murciélagos. Estas criaturas atacan sin piedad a los Montaraces de Gath Forthnír.","Thoriel te espera en Gath Forthnír, el campamento de Montarances oculto al este de Himbar.\
\
Has derrotado a Iarvael y ahora debes volver a ver Thoriel con las noticias de tu victoria.","Los merrevail cazan por todo Himbar, las tierras al oeste de Gath Forthnír.\
\
Thoriel te ha pedido que elimines a su teniente, Iarvael, en las cuevas donde habitan."}},
[3755]={nameES="Crime and Consequences",objectivesES={}},
[3756]={nameES="Crime at the Farmlands",objectivesES={"A farm near Langhold has been robbed, and the brigands are too many and too near for your liking.","Crime at the Farmlands","The farmer is at his farm between Langhold and the brigands' encampment.\
\
You should return the stolen goods to the farmer, who is much poorer after the robbery by brigands.","Collect stolen goods from brigands","Cattle and other stolen goods can be found in the brigand encampment in the northern Wold.\
\
You should free the cattle and collect the stolen goods from the brigands.","Bring the stolen goods back to their rightful owner"}},
[3757]={nameES="Crippling The Front",objectivesES={}},
[3758]={nameES="Crippling the Enemy",objectivesES={"Talk to Girhâzi","Eshadûr, a former fishing village, has become an Ordâkhai encampment. It is on the south side of the Ikorbân River, across from Iridír.","You have completed your mission in Eshadûr and should return to Dalagín in Iridír.","Dalagín, the Dumûri captain, has asked you to enter Eshadûr and destroy their boats, defeat Ordâkhai soldiers, and scout a few locations.","Scout the western store-house","Enter the village of Eshadûr","The Ordâkhai are well supplied","Scout the eastern officers' tent","You have entered Eshadûr","Crippling the Enemy","Are those waggons loaded with explosives?","The Ordâkhai are not lacking for leadership","Scout the southern stables","Talk to Dalagín in Iridír","You have completed your mission there and reported back to Dalagín, the Dumûri captain, in Iridír. She has asked you to go to Girhâzi and tell her of the waggons laden with black powder.","Dalagín, the Dumûri captain, has asked you to enter Eshadûr and disrupt the Ordâkhai operations there."}},
[3759]={nameES="Crippling the Hand",objectivesES={}},
[3760]={nameES="Croar",objectivesES={"Hay sapos infestando las vías fluviales de Tâl Bruinen, en el Bosque de los Trolls.\
\
Mientras estés en Tâl Bruinen, deberías purgar las vías fluviales de los sapos repugnantes.","Sapos repugnantes infestan las vías fluviales de Tâl Bruinen.","Croar"}},
[3761]={nameES="Crocodile Hunting (Daily)",objectivesES={}},
[3762]={nameES="Crocodile Skin",objectivesES={}},
[3763]={nameES="Crossbow Bolts in the Bolt-holes",objectivesES={}},
[3764]={nameES="Cruzando por caminos traicioneros",objectivesES={"Un buen lugar para descansar probablemente se encuentra cerca de Sudulthurkh, el cruce norte de Nud-melek. Puedes invocar a Svanr usando el cuerno que te dio.\
\
Debes dirigirte hacia el este a través de Nud-melek, pasando al norte del gran abismo.","Este es un buen lugar para descansar","Cruzando por caminos traicioneros","Llamaste a Svanr a tu lado","Encuentra un buen lugar para descansar (usa el cuerno para llamar a Svanr a tu lado)","El cuerno de invocación se encuentra cerca del puente de Khazad-dûm, detrás de Svanr en Nud-melek.\
\
Debes invocar a Svanr a tu lado cuando estés listo para partir.","Svanr se encuentra en el cruce de Sudulthurkh, en el noreste de Nud-melek.\
\
Debes hablar con Svanr.","Svanr desea viajar hacia el este a través de Nud-melek una vez más.","Habla con Svanr en Sudulthurkh"}},
[3765]={nameES="Crossing the Threshold",objectivesES={"You have arrived in Aerthir and should seek the strange man","Crossing the Threshold","Aerthir can be found far to the south of Ost Anglebed in Lebennin.\
\
Nimithil has asked you to aid the people of Aerthir and seek out a strange man taking refuge in the settlement.","The strange man can be found somewhere in Aerthir.\
\
You have arrived in Aerthir and should now seek the strange man that dwells there.","Talk to the strange man in Aerthir","Travel south to Aerthir","Troubling rumours have come from Aerthir in the south, the settlement nearest where the Corsairs and Haradrim have made landfall."}},
[3766]={nameES="Crown of Antlers",objectivesES={"There are Rangers at Echad Idhrenfair to the north-east of the stag-corpse.\
\
You should bring the rack of antlers you harvested to one of the Rangers of the Grey Company.","You carefully harvest the antlers from this corpse. The extraordinarily large rack of antlers is without blemish and perfectly symmetrical.\
\
Such a specimen might be of interest to the Rangers of the Grey Company.","Talk to a Ranger at Echad Idhrenfair","Crown of Antlers","You found the corpse of one of the mysterious white stags of Enedwaith and harvested its strange antlers."}},
[3767]={nameES="Crown of Hamât - Fog and Rumours",objectivesES={"Speak with Surâsh in southern Imhûlar","Scout the area south-east near Zahûmakh for signs of the scouts","Examine the second scout","This scout met a violent end; his armour gouged in deep, curved cuts","Mizâdi requests your aid in investigating a strange and disturbing report she has received from her scouts in the south of Imhûlar.","Find the second clue as to the scouts' death","Examine the strange banner near the scouts.","Bring the clues and banner to Mizâdi in Urmâkh","This scout fought valiantly, but his wounds are numerous, his chest punctured with arrow heads","Crown of Hamât - Fog and Rumours","A discarded sword, in the style of the Subuzûri guard","A pile of armour, burned and discarded","Examine the third scout","Examine the first scout","A scroll detailing movements of a group of Ordâkhai under a new banner, a silver lion","Find a third clue as to the scouts' death","A perplexing banner with a silver lion's head, similar in image to Mizâdi's standard","Collect the strange banner","Examine the strange banner nearby","Bring the clues and banner to Mizâdi in Urmâkh.","Speak with Surâsh at the site of the missing scouts. The site can be found south-east of Urmâkh, near Zahûmakh.","Examine the scouts for clues of the cause of their untimely end.","Scout the area around Zahûmakh to the south-east where the scouts were last seen.","Examine the area around the scouts for more clues as to their demise, and their assailants.","You see the scouts, their bodies beginning to bloat in the marsh","This scout did not see her death coming; the back of her neck is caked in dried blood","Find the first clue as to the scouts' death","Speak with Surâsh in southern Imhûlar.","Collect the strange banner."}},
[3768]={nameES="La corona del Coloso",objectivesES={"Deberías <rgb=#FF0000>mirar</rgb> alrededor","<rgb=#FF0000>Mira</rgb> alrededor","La cuerda para escalar el Coloso está cerca.\
\
Sube a la cima del Coloso y <rgb=#FF0000>mira</rgb> alrededor.","Con las cuerdas colocadas en su lugar, ahora puedes subir hasta lo más alto del Coloso y contemplar todo Evendim.","Sardan está en la base del Coloso.\
\
Sardan estará interesado en escuchar lo que has visto.","La corona del Coloso","Escala al pico del Coloso","Habla con Sardan, cerca del Coloso","La vista es fantástica, pero puedes ver que todavía hay mucho por hacer"}},
[3769]={nameES="Crude Trappings",objectivesES={}},
[3770]={nameES="Cruel Barb",objectivesES={}},
[3771]={nameES="Cruel Blades",objectivesES={"Isengard wood-cutters can be found in south-west Balewood near Finglas' Mead.\
\
Mossbeard has asked that you break the cruel axes of the Orcs in the Balewood to prevent further harm from coming to the trees and his kind.","Cruel Blades","Talk to Mossbeard","Mossbeard can be found following you, or if you have become separated, he can be called with your whistle.\
\
You have defeated many Orcs and destroyed their vile tools. You should now speak to Mossbeard and see if he has more tasks for you.","Mossbeard wants you to defeat the Orcs that are encroaching on Finglas' Mead."}},
[3772]={nameES="Cruel Trapping",objectivesES={}},
[3773]={nameES="Trampas crueles",objectivesES={"Andreg is taking you to meet with Saeradan at the Rohirrim scout-camp; however, he needs help with his own mission first.","Andreg has asked you to help him find and disable Orc-traps throughout the <rgb=#FFFF00>South Gravenwood</rgb>.","Talk to Andreg","Trampas crueles","You should speak with Andreg regarding the traps you disabled."}},
[3774]={nameES="Armas crueles de Moria",objectivesES={"Armas crueles de Moria","Maethoron sabe que los orcos de Moria son más numerosos que las armas que portan y quiere que robes algunas de esas armas de los campamentos orcos en Nanduhirion.","Los orcos han establecido tres campamentos a lo largo del camino que atraviesa Nanduhirion, al noroeste de Talan Haldir. Se pueden encontrar armeros en estos campamentos.\
\
Maethoron te ha pedido que robes armas orcas de los campamentos de los orcos en Nanduhirion.","Lleva las armas orcas a Maethoron"}},
[3775]={nameES="Crumble the Support",objectivesES={"Defeated Gogulch","Defeat Brathach","Defeat Glewlûd","The giant-thanes may be found among the ruins on the southern edge of Thrór's Coomb.\
\
Frithgeir has asked you to seek out and defeat each of Gunnberg's thanes.","Dwelling in the ruins throughout Thrór's Coomb, four thanes rule over the other giants in the area. These foul creatures spread fear and destruction against those that would stand against them.","Crumble the Support","Frithgeir is at Zudrugund, north of the giant-ruins.\
\
You should bring news of your victory to Frithgeir.","Talk to Frithgeir at Zudrugund","Defeated Tuisog","Defeated Brathach","Defeated Glewlûd","Defeat Gogulch","Defeat Tuisog"}},
[3776]={nameES="Crumbling Ramparts",objectivesES={"Gelvira can be found in Díngarth.\
\
You should talk to Gelvira.","Díngarth's crumbling ramparts are in need of repair.","Crumbling Ramparts","Gelvira, daughter of Huneric Hundred-slayer, has been tasked with fortifying Díngarth.","Talk to Gelvira"}},
[3777]={nameES="Crush the Defences",objectivesES={"Garrun is at his camp, north-west of Cuvnerth.\
\
You should bring word to Garrun that the Dunlendings have been driven out of the village.","Cuvnerth lies to the south-east of Garrun's camp.\
\
Garrun has asked you to enter Cuvnerth and drive the Dunlendings from the village.","Talk to Garrun in the Isendale","Crush the Defences","An advance force from the Wulf's Cleft army has occupied the village of Cuvnerth."}},
[3778]={nameES="Crushing Force",objectivesES={"Defeat Folkár","Rodelleth is at Thangúlhad in Gathbúrz.\
\
You should return to Rodelleth with news of your victory.","Defeated Trínash","Crushing Force","Folkár, Durflágit, and Trínash may be found somewhere in Gathbúrz.\
\
Rodelleth has asked you and your allies to defeat three deadly Olog-hai champions.","Defeated Durflágit","Defeat Trínash","Defeated Folkár","Speak with Rodelleth in Thangúlhad","Defeat Durflágit","Dol Guldur has released three Olog-hai champions into Gathbúrz. These monsters will prove a terrible obstacle to the Malledhrim."}},
[3779]={nameES="Aplastando la resistencia",objectivesES={"Derrota a Talûntûm en Burgûl-stazg","Talûntûm derrotado","Habla con Dagorchiel en Echad Mothelen","Aplastando la resistencia","Dagorchiel está en Echad Mothelen, al sureste de Burgûl-stazg.\
\
Deberías volver a ver a Dagorchiel con las noticias de tu victoria.","Talûntûm se encuentra en el baluarte en la parte trasera de Burgûl-stazg, al noroeste de Echad Mothelen.\
\
Dagorchiel te ha pedido que derrotes a Talûntûm, el capitán de Burgûl-stazg.","Mientras buscabas información sobre el mal que provocó que muchos trasgos desertaran de Burgûl-stazg, averiguaste que las fuerzas del enemigo esetán comandadas por un uruk llamado Talûntûm."}},
[3780]={nameES="Crushing the Free Peoples -- Angmar",objectivesES={"Los trolls de Angmar tienen un único objetivo: destruir a los enemigos de Angmar.","Habla con el capataz Sharkûlob en Pie de Gram","Taskmaster Sharkûlob is at Gramsfoot in the Ettenmoors.\
\
The trolls from Angmar, in an effort to speed the victory of Angmar's army, are willing to return Angmar to fight the Free Peoples in exchange for your services in the North. You should speak with Taskmaster Sharkûlob.","Crushing the Free Peoples -- Angmar","Taskmaster Sharkûlob is at Gramsfoot in the Ettenmoors.\
\
You took the place of a troll while it wrought destruction against the forces of the Free Peoples in Angmar. You should speak with Taskmaster Sharkûlob."}},
[3781]={nameES="Aplastando a los Pueblos Libres -- Eregion",objectivesES={"El capataz Sharkûlob se encuentra en Pie de Gram, en las Landas de Etten.\
\
Ocupaste el lugar de un troll en Angmar mientras este causaba estragos entre las fuerzas de los Pueblos Libres en Eregion. Deberías hablar con el capataz Sharkûlob.","El capataz Sharkûlob se encuentra en Pie de Gram, en las Landas de Etten.\
\
Los trolls de Angmar, en un intento por acelerar la victoria del ejército de Angmar, están dispuestos a ir a Eregion para luchar contra los Pueblos Libres a cambio de tus servicios en el Norte. Deberías hablar con el capataz Sharkûlob.","Aplastando a los Pueblos Libres -- Eregion","Los trolls de Angmar tienen un único objetivo: destruir a los enemigos de Angmar.","Habla con el capataz Sharkûlob en Pie de Gram"}},
[3782]={nameES="Crushing the Free Peoples -- Forochel",objectivesES={"Crushing the Free Peoples -- Forochel","Taskmaster Sharkûlob is at Gramsfoot in the Ettenmoors.\
\
The trolls from Angmar, in an effort to speed the victory of Angmar's army, are willing to go to Forochel to fight the Free Peoples in exchange for your services in the North. You should speak with Taskmaster Sharkûlob.","Los trolls de Angmar tienen un único objetivo: destruir a los enemigos de Angmar.","Habla con el capataz Sharkûlob en Pie de Gram","Taskmaster Sharkûlob is at Gramsfoot in the Ettenmoors.\
\
You took the place of a troll in Angmar while it wrought destruction against the forces of the Free Peoples in Forochel. You should speak with Taskmaster Sharkûlob."}},
[3783]={nameES="Crushing the Palace",objectivesES={}},
[3784]={nameES="Crystal Containment",objectivesES={"You found a crystal apparently left behind by one of the Angmarim, possessed of a foreboding aura. As you pick it up to examine it more closely, you think you can hear a tapping sound emanating from inside, and a quiet whispering. It seems likely the Angmarim priests use these crystals to hold fell spirits before they find suitable corpses for creating wights.\
\
If you destroy these crystals, the fell spirit might be more easily banished.","Crystal Containment","Talk to Molkha in the valley","A fell spirit has been released from the crystal!","Destroy glowing crystals to release fell spirits","You have defeated many fell spirits in Mullach Cagar, preventing them from being used to make wights.\
\
You should report to Molkha in the valley.","You have discovered fell spirits contained in Angmarim crystals in Mullach Cagar.","Glowing crystals can be found in Mullach Cagar.\
\
You should destroy these crystals and defeat the released fell spirits."}},
[3785]={nameES="Crystal Torches",objectivesES={}},
[3786]={nameES="Crystal-encrusted Wargs",objectivesES={"Mother Amma suspects the corruption uncovered in Elderslade has spread to Clovengap.","Crystal-encrusted Wargs can be found in south-western Clovengap.\
\
Mother Amma has asked for you to defeat crystal-encrusted Wargs and to bring her crystal samples.","Mother Amma is in Stókkset, in Clovengap.\
\
You should bring the crystal sarrowstone sample to Mother Amma.","Return to Mother Amma","Crystal-encrusted Wargs"}},
[3787]={nameES="Culling Oxen",objectivesES={"You have been tasked to hunt dun cows for food.\
\
Oxen can be found on a hill called Glaerendalf, to the west.","Bring the meat to Branach at the farm of Cornworth","Locrin's brother Branach will be pleased to receive the meat you collected. He waits for you at the farm of Cornworth.","Culling Oxen","A herd of oxen grazes upon the green hills of Pinnath Gelin."}},
[3788]={nameES="Culling the Blighted",objectivesES={}},
[3789]={nameES="Culling the Crocodiles",objectivesES={}},
[3790]={nameES="Culling the Darkness",objectivesES={"Trac-plas lies south and west of Mincham's camp.\
\
There are older, more powerful wights haunting the barrows of Trac-plas among their younger brethren. Mincham has asked you to seek out these creatures and defeat them.","Culling the Darkness","Mincham's is located north and west of Trac-plas.\
\
You should return to Mincham and let him know that you have dispatched several of the grim Ashenwight-captains.","Among the newly-risen wights, several older, more powerful creatures have been sighted. Perhaps defeating these creatures may shed light upon the emerging threat.","Talk to Mincham in the Lich Bluffs"}},
[3791]={nameES="Acabar con la llama",objectivesES={"Acabar con la llama","Habla con Lúgethir en Tyl Ruinen","Las salamandras se pueden encontrar por todo Tyl Ruinen.\
\
Lúgethir te ha pedido que derrotes a varias salamandras en los alrededores de Tyl Ruinen, con la esperanza de contener su número.","La isla de Tyl Ruinen ha sido invadida por salamandras.","Lúgethir se encuentra en el campamento de Humphrey Rebuscón en Tyl Ruinen.\
\
A Lúgethir le alegrará saber que se ha reducido el número de salamandras."}},
[3792]={nameES="Culling the Grim",objectivesES={"Tarshiah laments about the growing population of kergrim threatening the coast off Bakhjâd.","Culling the Grim","Talk to Tarshiah","Tarshiah has asked you to help cull the population of kergrim on the coast west of Mâr Naphra.","Now that the task is complete you should report back to Tarshiah."}},
[3793]={nameES="Culling the Hunters",objectivesES={}},
[3794]={nameES="Culling the Pack",objectivesES={"The Wargs of Azanulbizar must have their ranks thinned before the major battle takes place.","Culling the Pack","Defeat Khakrank","Defeated Khakrank","Valdi can be found in Amdân.\
\
You should talk to Valdi.","Defeat Naurnash","Return to Valdi","Defeated Naurnash","Wargs can be found at Gadh Ujáf and Zagâf Muzug.\
\
Valdi has asked you to defeat Wargs and their sires."}},
[3795]={nameES="Reduciendo la Presa",objectivesES={"Reduciendo la Presa","Hay ciervos que habitan en las Gargantas del Bruinen, en el Bosque de los Trolls.\
\
Los lobos que causan problemas en las Gargantas del Bruinen podrían verse disuadidos si se reduce el número de ciervos, dejándolos con poca presa.","Los lobos podrían sentirse atraídos a las Gargantas del Bruinen por la presencia de los ciervos que allí habitan."}},
[3796]={nameES="Culling the Tide of Easterlings",objectivesES={}},
[3797]={nameES="Culling the Tide of Orcs",objectivesES={}},
[3798]={nameES="Culling the Tide of Trolls",objectivesES={}},
[3799]={nameES="Culling the Tide of Uruk-hai",objectivesES={}},
[3800]={nameES="Cultivating a Cure",objectivesES={"Talk to Thorlind","Thorlind can be found north of the path in Eryn Lasgalen.\
\
You should talk to Thorlind.","Cultivating a Cure","Thorlind believes the poison you found poses a grave threat and has asked you to gather ingredients for an antidote. Find the Celeblam plants nearby.","Celeblam flowers can be found nearby, in Eryn Lasgalen.\
\
You should collect Celeblam."}},
[3801]={nameES="Cultivando el Bosque Salvaje",objectivesES={"Puedes encontrar lugares para plantar árboles y marcar los tejos salvajes en el sur del Bosque Salvaje.\
\
Mantoespino te ha pedido que marques los tejos salvajes para talarlos y que plantes las semillas de un tipo de árbol menos agresivo.","Mantoespino busca tu ayuda para cultivar los árboles del Bosque Salvaje.","Habla con Mantoespino","Mantoespino está en el sur del Bosque Salvaje.\
\
Deberías hablar con Mantoespino.","Cultivando el Bosque Salvaje"}},
[3802]={nameES="Cultivation: A Bit of Earth",objectivesES={"Cultivation: A Bit of Earth","Faranil asked that you make your way to the north-west to seek out cave-claws that move the earth with their mandibles. She believes that you can collect earth from within their maws that will be better for your sapling.","Concerned that the sapling is not drawing enough from the soil, Faranil asked you to make your way into the Ettenmoors to find soil that has been macerated by the cave-claws."}},
[3803]={nameES="Cultivation: A Matter of Assistance",objectivesES={}},
[3804]={nameES="Cultivation: A Matter of Expertise",objectivesES={}},
[3805]={nameES="Cultivation: A Touch of Gold",objectivesES={"Speak with Golloval in the shadow of the Isendeep Mine","Deliver the bauble to Golloval","Golloval needs a glass bauble to capture a ray of the sun. He tasked you with trying to collect one from the goblins in Grothum, the Warg dens in the west, or the amongst the spiders in the craggy stones - far to the west.","Deliver the bauble to Faranil at Glân Vraig","Collect a glass bauble from goblins, wargs, or spiders","Collected a glass bauble for Golloval","You spoke with Golloval","Head toward the Isendeep mine, and in the shadow of the entrance find the Eagle Golloval. Ask the eagle if he might know how to enhance the mood of the sapling kept at Glân Vraig.","You received the infused bauble from Golloval and were advised to return the bauble to the cultivator at Glan Vraig.","Golloval gave you a sun-kissed bauble","Faranil believes that the sapling is in need of a direct source of sunlight. She believes that Golloval, the eagle that watches the Ettenmoors can assist.","Cultivation: A Touch of Gold","Golloval flies into the sky and returns to drop the bauble in your hand"}},
[3806]={nameES="Cultivation: Fertile Ground",objectivesES={}},
[3807]={nameES="Cultivation: Further Understanding - Part I",objectivesES={"Elrond listens to your tale intently. Then he looks about him and when he speaks, it is as if he conjures the very trees that surround Rivendell.\
\
'Your tale, friend, is one of interest and wonder. A sapling that stirs at your passage is a thing of which I have not heard since the Great Forest covered nearly all of Middle-earth. It is a rare thing these days. This portent and your involvement in it, must have greater meaning than any have yet discovered.'\
\
Elrond pauses and then shakes his head.\
\
'Yet, friend, there is nothing more I can offer you or the patron who assists you in the Ettenmoors.'\
\
Sensing your disappointment, he continues.\
\
'Do not despair.\
\
'This is a good omen. Perhaps the land is healing, though the battle still persists. Go with that knowledge, and the hope that the tomorrow you make for the sapling you have found will be one of bright light.'","Cultivation: Further Understanding - Part I","Speak with Elrond at the Last Homely House","Elrond could no more explain your discovery of the sapling than could Faranil. He insisted that you continue your efforts. He believes that you may be working toward healing the Ettenmoors in some fashion.","Faranil directed you to tell the tale of how you discovered and claimed the sapling to Elrond at the Last Homely House in Rivendell. She hopes that the Lord of Rivendell may know something of the sapling you found.","Faranil admits that all her tireless work and study has given her little insight into the true nature of the sapling you discovered. She believes that it is time to seek aid outside of the Ettenmoors.","Return to Faranil at Glân Vraig with your news"}},
[3808]={nameES="Cultivation: Further Understanding - Part II",objectivesES={"Speak with Radagast at Ost Guruth","Radagast suggested that you are helping to grow a noble creatures by your efforts and advised that you should continue on the path that you are set upon.","Faranil, seeking more information on the sapling that you are raising, directed you to Ost Guruth, an outpost in the Lone-lands, where Radagast the Brown has been seen. She bid you visit him and share your tale of discovering and nurturing the sapling.","Cultivation: Further Understanding - Part II","Faranil wants to unlock the mysteries of the sapling and believes that there might be one in the Lone-lands who knows something. His name is Radagast, and as a guardian of nature this does seem to be something of which he might know a thing or two."}},
[3809]={nameES="Cultivation: Further Understanding - Part III",objectivesES={"Nurture your sapling at Old Man Willow","Speak with Tom Bombadil at his home in the Old Forest","Faranil carefully packed the young sapling into a pot and gave it to you with instructions to take the sapling into the Old Forest to speak with the River-maiden Goldberry.","Speak with Goldberry at her spring in the Old Forest","Your sapling looks refreshed","Having done all you were told it is now time to return the sapling to Faranil in the Ettenmoors as Tom suggested.","Faranil believes that something has changed with the sapling and it is time to look for another piece of guidance. She bids you visit the Old Forest and speak to the River-maid who dwells there. Her name is Goldberry.","Cultivation: Further Understanding - Part III","Tom hinted that you need bring the sapling to visit Old Man Willow, as something there will help the sapling grow into what it is meant to be.","Goldberry directed your to meet with her again at Tom Bombadil's house deep within the Old Forest."}},
[3810]={nameES="Cultivation: Further Understanding - Part IV",objectivesES={"Travel to Evendim and seek out Quickbough","You spoke with Quickbough and it seems the Ent is given a new hope with your sapling. Return to the Ettenmoors and Faranil to tell them what occurred.","Faranil has pieced together enough understanding to send you to a friend who she believes will see the sapling in a completely different light and understanding.","Faranil believes that it is time to speak with the Ent, Quickbough, about the sapling you have found. Though she knows the risk is that she will give the Ent false hope with this discovery.","Cultivation: Further Understanding - Part IV","Quickbough stares, for what seems like several minutes, at the sapling. Suddenly, the sapling wiggles and Quickbough's eyes go wide.\
\
'Hroom, throom, shoom.\
\
'Not an Enting, no.\
\
'Still... we will weep for the loss we suffer.\
\
'But this... hroom...\
\
'This little one... is... hope for a future...\
\
'And you... throom... thrumm... humm...\
\
'Have... made this... possible...'\
\
You are not sure, but it appears that Quickbough's eye well with tears.\
\
'Thank you... little one.\
\
'Thrumm....'"}},
[3811]={nameES="Cultivation: Matter of Study",objectivesES={"You spoke with Ned Claybrick","Talk to your sapling","Though you heard nothing when listening to the sapling, it did seem that something stirred in the little plant. Let Faranil know.","Cultivation: Matter of Study","After studying your sapling for some time, Faranil seeks the aid of the Hobbits of Hoarhallow for more insight into how to care for the sapling.","Speak with Faranil at Glân Vraig","You hear nothing, but the sapling stirred when you leaned in","Make your way to Hoarhallow and ask Ned Claybrick if he ever thinks that plants he tends seem inquisitive.","Ask Ned Claybrick at Hoarhallow if his plants are inquisitive","You spoke to your sapling","Listen to your sapling","Ned suggested that he speaks to his plants but he has never listened to them. Maybe there is something to what he said. Return to Glân Vraig and give it a try.","You talked to the sapling, but nothing seemed to change. Perhaps you should try listening."}},
[3812]={nameES="Cultivation: Matter of Wonder",objectivesES={"Cultivation: Matter of Wonder","Make your way to Hoarhallow and speak with Marigold Winterdown","Journey to Hoarhallow and ask Marigold Winterdown if she knows of a way to brighten a flower or plant even further.","Marigold Wintersdown told you she dances with her plants","Marigold told you to dance with plants and they will dance with you. Return to Glân Vraig and dance with your sapling.","Faranil believes that your sapling is especially happy today. She asked that you visit Marigold Winterdown at Horahallow for more insight."}},
[3813]={nameES="Cultivation: Selfish Request - Cragstone Spiders",objectivesES={}},
[3814]={nameES="Cultivation: Selfish Request - Darktide Wolves",objectivesES={}},
[3815]={nameES="Cultivation: Soil is Out of Balance",objectivesES={}},
[3816]={nameES="Cultivation: Strong Roots from Good Water",objectivesES={}},
[3817]={nameES="Cultivation: The Enemy Would Trample",objectivesES={}},
[3818]={nameES="Cultivation: The Problem with Bok",objectivesES={}},
[3819]={nameES="Cultivation: The Sapling Stirs - Weekly",objectivesES={"Faranil asked that you return to them each day to see what new effort might strengthen your sapling. She is located in Glân Vraig, the foothold of the Free People in the Ettenmoors.","Cultivation: The Sapling Stirs - Weekly","Faranil believes that the sapling is stirring from all of your efforts. Continue your efforts over the course of several days to see what bounty may come."}},
[3820]={nameES="Cultivador de corrupción",objectivesES={"Es probable que el cultivador de los hongos se encuentre cerca del centro de la zona recientemente corrompida.\
\
La corrupción se ha extendido con rapidez desde las Fundaciones de Piedra, y parece que algo la está fomentando y dirigiendo.","El cultivador de los hongos es un terror procedente de lo más profundo de las Fundaciones de Piedra.\
\
La corrupción se ha extendido rápidamente desde las Fundaciones de Piedra, y cuenta con la ayuda y la guía de uno de los sinnombre. Este agente de la corrupción debe de haber sido enviado aquí por algo mucho más siniestro...","Derrota al Retorcido","Regresa con Knakk","Cultivador de corrupción","Knakk acampa en la pasarela elevada que está en el rincón noreste de las Vetas del Cuerno Rojo.\
\
Estará ansioso por saber si su suposición era correcta y si has encontrado y derrotado al cultivador de hongos.","Averigua qué está cultivando los hongos","La infestación en las Vetas del Cuerno Rojo oriental parece estar dirigida y fomentada por algo siniestro. ¿Cómo ha podido propagarse tan rápidamente desde las Fundaciones de Piedra?"}},
[3821]={nameES="Cunning Eyes",objectivesES={"Goblins can be found near the cave in western Nan Curunír.\
\
Ondor has asked you to thin the number of Goblins around the caves before venturing within.","The caves along western Nan Curunír are guarded by vicious goblins.\
\
As long as their watch is maintained, it will be difficult to approach the caverns unseen, so Ondor has asked you to thin their ranks.","Ondor is near the caves in western Nan Curunír.\
\
You should return to Ondor with news of your success.","Cunning Eyes","Talk to Ondor in Nan Curunír"}},
[3822]={nameES="Curing the Ills of the Taurogrim",objectivesES={"Curing the Ills of the Taurogrim","Talk to Thranduil","Celeblam flowers can be found in Eryn Lasgalen.\
\
Thranduil has asked you to gather Celeblam for the Elves of Eryn Lasgalen so that Thorlind can craft more of his healing draught.","The Taurogrim bear a potent, but curable poison. Without a steady supply of Celeblam, their corruption will spread too quickly to contain.","Thranduil can be found in Felegoth.\
\
You should talk to Thranduil."}},
[3823]={nameES="Curing the Leather",objectivesES={"There are hides stretched between poles near Rhus in Tûr Morva.\
\
Rhus wants you to beat the stretched hides in order to smooth them out for use in armour-making.","You skin the ox and now have a suitably tough ox-skin","Rhus is on the eastern shore of the lake in Tâl Methedras, by his tanning tools in Tûr Morva.","Rhus has been given the task of tanning leather to be used in the preparation of armour for the Falcon-clan and will appreciate your help.","Recover a suitably tough skin from a slain Tâl Methedras ox","Curing the Leather","Taf is at the leather-working pavillion, north of Rhus's home and on the shore of the lake in Tâl Methedras.\
\
Rhus has given you treated ox-skins to bring to Taf.","Buckets of sudsy water are set out near Rhus in Tûr Morva.\
\
Rhus has asked you to help clean the leather strips he is soaking in the sudsy buckets.","Rhus is by his tools in Tûr Morva.\
\
You have helped Rhus considerably, and he wishes to speak with you.","Bring treated ox-skins to Taf on the shore of the lake","Rhus is by his tanning tools in Tûr Morva.\
\
You have cleaned several of the strips of leather that Rhus has been soaking and should now speak with the tanner about what he needs next.","Bring the tough ox-skin to Rhus","Talk to Rhus in Tûr Morva","Tâl Methedras Oxen can be found on the far side of the lake, across from Tûr Morva."}},
[3824]={nameES="Curiosity Dawns",objectivesES={"Return to Ashlimb to tell him of the hobbits' fate <rgb=#FF00FF>you may use the horse near Gandalf for swifter travel</rgb>","You have discovered another Ent, this one barely different from a tree.\
\
He stands still as stone, but regards you with his deep, slow eyes.","Ask Gandalf about the horse that stands near him","The Ent does not speak, but its eyes gleam with a sharp green spark as you relay Gandalf's tale.\
\
You did not succeed in waking Ashlimb from his sleepy state, but from his keen gaze, you sense that you have appeased his restless curiosity.","Search the surrounding woods for another sleeping Ent","You have done what you could for Ashlimb; it is now time to seek another sleeping Ent","Gandalf is atop Treebeard's Hill, alongside a horse you have never seen before.\
\
Gandalf has one more thing to say to you.","Ashlimb is at the eastern edge of Fangorn's eaves, waiting to hear of the hobbits' fate.\
\
You should return to Ashlimb and convey Gandalf's tale of their meeting with Treebeard.","Gandalf would like you to bring news of the hobbits back to Ashlimb, who first put you on their trail.","Ents can be found throughout Fangorn. You should search north-east of Ashlimb for other Ents you can help, as Gandalf bid.","Gandalf found this horse lost in the wood, but it is willing to bear you to Ashlimb more swiftly than you could go on foot","Curiosity Dawns"}},
[3825]={nameES="Curious Captives",objectivesES={"Curious Captives","Ukhrash-traps can be found at Lochan Dúv in Gloomingtarn.\
\
Hersegg has asked you to free ukhrâsh from traps at Lochan Dúv in the hope that releasing them will hinder the plans of the Iron Crown in Gloomingtarn.","Hersegg can be found in Gloomingtarn.\
\
You have freed many ukhrâsh from traps at Lochan Dúv and sent the Iron Crown into disarray. You should talk to Hersegg.\
\
<#FF0000>NOTE: If you become separated from Hersegg, use her horn to call her to your side.</rgb>","After discovering that the Iron Crown have begun to capture and tame ukhrâsh, Hersegg has devised a plan to set the would-be pets of the Angmarim against them.","Talk to Hersegg"}},
[3826]={nameES="Curious Errands",objectivesES={"Confront the Uruk War-leader","Search the fields east of Middlemead for Déorwald's apprentice","Déorwald grows concerned for his apprentice who has not returned after a rushed journey to Pendlac's Farm.","Defeated the Uruk War-leader","Aside a blood-soaked Uruk, you discover Déorwald's apprentice and slain horses of pale coat","Déorwald's apprentice can be found on the fields of Kingstead to the east of Middlemead and Folcbur's homestead.\
\
Déorwald believes his apprentice to be journeying to Pendlac's Farm on an unknown errand. You should find and speak to his apprentice.","Déorwald can be found at the traders' pavillion in central Middlemead.\
\
You have found Déorwald's apprentice slain by a vicious Uruk who spoke of mysterious things. You should return to Déorwald with this ill news.","Talk to Déorwald","Curious Errands","The Uruk War-leader can be found on the fields to the east of Middlemead.\
\
You have discovered the remains of Déorwald's apprentice, his horses, and his presumed murderer. You should confront and defeat the Uruk-hai responsible."}},
[3827]={nameES="¡Malditos sean sus inmundos pies!",objectivesES={"Dindirith te ha pedido que elimines la suciedad de los orcos del Nimrodel, el rápido arroyo situado fuera de las fronteras de Lórien.","Las riberas ensuciadas del Nimrodel se encuentran al norte y al sur de Echad Andestel, a lo largo de las orillas del arroyo.\
\
Dindirith te ha pedido que limpies las riberas del Nimrodel, ensuciadas por el paso de los orcos.","Lleva la inmundicia orca a Dindirith","Dindirith se encuentra en Echad Andestel, al oeste de las riberas del Nimrodel y de la frontera de Lórien.\
\
Has recogido la suciedad orca de las riberas del Nimrodel y ahora debes regresar con Dindirith, tal como te pidió."}},
[3828]={nameES="La maldición de los túmulos",objectivesES={"Deberías decirle a Arnail que has devuelto los artefactos robados a las tumbas.\
\
Arnail está en el camino cerca de la granja Scurlo, en las Quebradas del Sur.","Vuelve con Arnail","Un ladrón de tumbas angustiado necesita ayuda para levantar una maldición potencialmente mortal.","Arnail te ha pedido que devuelvas los objetos robados a las tumbas de Haudh Nirui.\
\
Haudh Nirui está en las Quebradas del Sur, en el noreste de Cardolan.","La maldición de los túmulos"}},
[3829]={nameES="Cut the Supplies",objectivesES={"Talk to Eirien in Mithechad","Garmadh-maudhûl can be found to the north-east of Mithechad by following a trail that traverses up the mountain.\
\
Eirien has asked you to destroy the ore-carts which the Orcs at Garmadh-maudhûl are using to resupply Dol Guldur.","Eirien is at Mithechad, south-west of Garmadh-maudhûl.\
\
You should return to Eirien and let her know that the ore-carts have been destroyed.","Cut the Supplies","The Orc-encampment of Garmadh-maudhûl boasts a mine which produces ore for the use of the armies of Dol Guldur."}},
[3830]={nameES="Cuts of Fish",objectivesES={"Cuts of Fish","<rgb=#FF0000>Completing Aiding the Eastemnet will cancel this quest</rgb>","Héalac is at Snowbourn.\
\
Héalac will be pleased to get all of the cuts of fish you were able to catch.","Bring the cuts of fish to Héalac","The people of Rohan are being starved out by the destruction of their farms and crops. A large quantity of fish would help ease the shortage.","Fish can be caught in the lake and river just east of Snowbourn.\
\
Héalac asked you to go fishing and bring him several dozen cuts of fish."}},
[3831]={nameES="Cutting Back",objectivesES={"Prepared rations can be found inside the kitchen of Snowbourn.\
\
You should collect rations for the people of Snowbourn.","Ganburh slinks away, obviously embarrassed","Elfswith looks upset, but does not press the issue","Talk to Dudweld","Dudweld sighs heavily and wanders off","The food-cart is near the kitchen of Snowbourn.\
\
As food is scarce, Fastred wants you to make sure that people wait and do not swarm the food-stores. Perhaps a stern <rgb=#FF00FF>ahem</rgb> will do.","Talk to Gísling","Talk to Elfswith","Fastred wants you to distribute rations to the people of Snowbourn along with his guards.","Gísling can be found in central Snowbourn.\
\
You should speak with Gísling and let him know you distributed the food as Fastred ordered.","Talk to Ganburh","Shoo Ganburh away from the food-stores with a stern <rgb=#FF00FF>ahem</rgb>","Shoo Dudweld away from the food-stores with a stern <rgb=#FF00FF>ahem</rgb>","Cutting Back","Dudweld, Ganburh, and Elfswith can be found throughout Snowbourn.\
\
You should distribute the food to Dudweld, Ganburh, and Elfswith.","Shoo Elfswith away from the food-stores with a stern <rgb=#FF00FF>ahem</rgb>"}},
[3832]={nameES="Cortando Cuerdas",objectivesES={"Encuentra a Vífill","Cortando Cuerdas","Grímkell está en Noglond, al este de la arboleda.\
\
Vífill te dice que informes a Grímkell sobre la presencia de trasgos en la arboleda.","Vífill está en algún lugar de la arboleda, por el camino al oeste de Noglond.\
\
Grímkell te ha pedido que salgas a buscar a Vífill.","Grímkell, el comandante en Noglond, envió a uno de sus guardias, Vífill, a cortar leña y está preocupado porque Vífill no ha regresado."}},
[3833]={nameES="Cutting Down the Orcs",objectivesES={}},
[3834]={nameES="Cortando la Mano",objectivesES={"Cortando la Mano","Ivar dejó un capitán al mando de los tumularios, más poderoso que los protectores.","Reykur probablemente se encuentre en las cámaras más alejadas de las ruinas donde acampan los tumularios.\
\
Eriac te ha pedido que mates al hombre demacrado Reykur, el capitán de Ivar entre los tumularios. Debido a tu victoria sobre otros tumularios, Eriac cree que Reykur puede estar esperándote.","Derrota a Reykur","Habla con Eriac en el campamento de Eglain, en Agamaur","Eriac te espera en el campamento de Eglain, en el extremo sur de Agamaur.\
\
Has matado a Reykur, sumiendo al resto del ejército de tumularios en la confusión. A Eriac le interesará saber que has tenido éxito.","Reykur derrotado"}},
[3835]={nameES="Cutting off the Orders",objectivesES={"Melethon is at the Causeway Forts.\
\
You should speak to Melethon.","Morgul Captains and War-leaders can be found in enemy strongholds in Osgiliath.\
\
You should defeat Morgul Captains and War-leaders.","Cutting off the Orders","Speak with Melethon","Melethon has ordered you to defeat Captains and War-leaders of the enemy forces to cause disorder among their ranks."}},
[3836]={nameES="Cutting the Chaff",objectivesES={}},
[3837]={nameES="Cutting to the Core",objectivesES={"Sâd Doldúr lies to the south of Barad Angol, down the mountainside.\
\
Himeinior has asked you to collect some water samples and pieces of fallen blighted wood from the area around Sâd Doldúr.","Cutting to the Core","Habla con Himeinior","The forest in the Ashenslades appears to have been corrupted by a strange malady that has spread across the area.","Heiminior is at the camp near Barad Angol, up the mountain pass north of Sâd Doldúr.\
\
You should return the branches and samples of water to Himeinior."}},
[3838]={nameES="Daffodil ha desaparecido",objectivesES={"La Loma del Troll está en el Pantano de los Juncos, al sureste de Ojo de Aguja.\
\
Filibert sospecha que Olwir llevó a Daffodil a algún lugar del Pantano de los Juncos. Te sugirió que empieces a buscar en la Loma del Troll.","Lleva la campana de la vaca a Filibert Bolger","Esta pobre vaca parece que fue atacada y parcialmente devorada por una bestia grande. Alrededor de su cuello encuentras una campana de bronce.","Examina la vaca","Campana de la vaca recogida","Filibert Bolger se encuentra en Ojo de Aguja, al norte de la Loma del Troll.\
\
Al examinar la vaca muerta en la cima de la Loma del Troll, encontraste una campana. Quizá Filibert Bolger pueda decir, por la campana, si la vaca que encontraste era su Daffodil.","Mientras buscabas en la Loma del Troll por encargo de Filibert Bolger, encontraste el cadáver de una vaca. Un examen más detallado debería revelar si es la vaca de Filibert, Daffodil.","Recoge la campana de la vaca","Daffodil ha desaparecido","Filibert Bolger te dijo que su vaca, Daffodil, ha desaparecido y sospecha que un enano llamado Olwir la robó.","Busca a Daffodil"}},
[3839]={nameES="Dagor's Folly",objectivesES={"Stones for a cairn can be found around the clearing where Dagor died, south-east of Arnach.\
\
You found Dagor's lifeless corpse. It is clear that he died a soldier's death. You should give him and his men a heroes' rite and build a cairn where they fell.","Baranor stands within the keep in Arnach.\
\
You found the lifeless corpses of Dagor and his men. It is clear that he died a soldier's death. You should return to Baranor and tell him of how you built a cairn and mourned his loss.","You observe a solemn silence in honour of the fallen","A tear falls from Baranor's eye.\
\
'Poor lads! In truth, it might have gone just this way, had Dagor gone off with Forlong and the others. \
\
'He died running into battle, and not from it. I see now a kind of naive folly mixed with those brave passions I so admired in Dagor, but I think I shall remember him for that bravery and his soldierly bearing. In my heart, he died a soldier's death.'","Talk to Baranor","Stones for a cairn can be found around the clearing where Dagor and his men died, due east of Arnach.\
\
You found Dagor's lifeless corpse. It is clear that he died a soldier's death. You should give him and his men a heroes' rite and build a cairn where they fell.","Search for Dagor","Mourn Dagor's corpse","Build a cairn","Dagor and his newly-built cairn lie in a clearing south-east of Arnach.\
\
You found Dagor's lifeless corpse. It is clear that he died a soldier's death. You should give him and his men a heroes' rite and mourn their passing.","Dagor's Folly","Just as the Haradrim assault on Arnach broke and fell back, Dagor and some of his men ran madly off into the darkness. The time has come to go in search of them.","Dagor ran south-eastward out of Arnach.\
\
Baranor has asked you to venture out and find Dagor and the men who followed him.","Here lies Dagor. It seems he died in combat in this clearing.","Built a cairn"}},
[3840]={nameES="Dagor: A Blow to the Head",objectivesES={"Dagor: A Blow to the Head","Dagor can be found in Arnach, near the keep.\
\
You should return to Dagor and tell him how you have bested a number of their leaders.","Dagor has a bold strategem for throwing the Haradrim invaders into disarray.","Haradrim Captains can be found, especially in their camps, east and south of Arnach.\
\
You should defeat captains of the Haradrim to compromise their leadership and organization.","Talk to Dagor"}},
[3841]={nameES="Dagor: A Cut From Behind",objectivesES={"Dagor has an ingenious scheme to bring the Haradrim to their knees by destroying their supply piles and their boats.","Dagor can be found in Arnach, near the keep.\
\
You should return to Dagor and tell him how you destroyed the enemy's boats and supplies.","Dagor: A Cut From Behind","The Haradrim boats and supply caches are near the mouth of the River Erui in Lossarnach.\
\
Now that you have discovered the landing area, you should burn their boats and destroy their supply piles.","Locate the Haradrim boats","The Haradrim boats and supply caches are near the mouth of the River Erui in Lossarnach.\
\
First, you should locate the area where the boats and the caches were seen.","Talk to Dagor"}},
[3842]={nameES="Dagor: A Strike at the Hands",objectivesES={"Dagor: A Strike at the Hands","Dagor can be found in Arnach, near the keep.\
\
You should return to Dagor and tell him of the blow you have struck to the foe.","Talk to Dagor","Dagor has a daring plan to diminish the attacking power of the Haradrim invaders.","Haradrim invaders can be found east and south of Arnach.\
\
You should defeat a number of Haradrim Devoted while they are scattered, so there are fewer to attack in force."}},
[3843]={nameES="Dahâl Huliz, The Arena -- Solo/Duo",objectivesES={"Ezaphir calls forth the third challenge!","Talk to Ezaphir and defeat the first challenge","Ezaphir calls for the first challenge!","Ezaphir informs you that you are about to face your greatest challenge in the arena: Rothog the Storm himself.","You are victorious, and Ezaphir returns to the fighting sands","Ezaphir will issue your first challenge when you are ready to compete.","You have defeated Rothog the Storm, and the spoils of victory are yours!","Ezaphir congratulates you on your victory, but there are more difficult challenges to come.","The gladiatorial pits of Umbar Baharbêl serve several important purposes: entertaining the masses, keeping their attention focused, and meting justice upon those who break the laws of the city.\
\
Upon taking control of Umbar, the Kindred of the Coins altered the traditional rules of the arena. Most battles are no longer to the death, and the memory of such capital punishment has remained in the cruel past. Combat has become a sport for the masses, and any who dare can enter the fighting pits and attempt to enhance their glory. Gladiators bound to the arena serve their sentences by entering battle and fighting to the end.","Ezaphir congratulates you on your success, but he warns you the following challenges may not be so easy.","Ezaphir calls forth your final challenge: Rothog the Storm!","Talk to Ezaphir and defeat the second challenge","Talk to Rothog the Storm in the Arena","Talk to Ezaphir and defeat the fourth challenge","Rothog awaits you in the Arena.","Ezaphir calls forth the second challenge!","Defeated the First Challenge!","Defeated the Third Challenge!","Ezaphir will call forth one of the more stalwart gladiators to test your mettle in glorious combat.","Talk to Ezaphir and defeat the third challenge","Talk to Ezaphir and defeat Rothog the Storm","Ezaphir calls forth the fourth challenge!","Defeated the Second Challenge!","Dahâl Huliz, The Arena -- Solo/Duo"}},
[3844]={nameES="Dahâl Huliz, The Arena -- Tier 1",objectivesES={"Ezaphir calls forth the third challenge!","Talk to Ezaphir and defeat the first challenge","Ezaphir calls for the first challenge!","Ezaphir informs you that you are about to face your greatest challenge in the arena: Rothog the Storm himself.","You are victorious, and Ezaphir returns to the fighting sands","Ezaphir will issue your first challenge when you are ready to compete.","You have defeated Rothog the Storm, and the spoils of victory are yours!","Dahâl Huliz, The Arena -- Tier 1","Ezaphir congratulates you on your victory, but there are more difficult challenges to come.","The gladiatorial pits of Umbar Baharbêl serve several important purposes: entertaining the masses, keeping their attention focused, and meting justice upon those who break the laws of the city.\
\
Upon taking control of Umbar, the Kindred of the Coins altered the traditional rules of the arena. Most battles are no longer to the death, and the memory of such capital punishment has remained in the cruel past. Combat has become a sport for the masses, and any who dare can enter the fighting pits and attempt to enhance their glory. Gladiators bound to the arena serve their sentences by entering battle and fighting to the end.","Ezaphir congratulates you on your success, but he warns you the following challenges may not be so easy.","Ezaphir calls forth your final challenge: Rothog the Storm!","Talk to Ezaphir and defeat the second challenge","Talk to Rothog the Storm in the Arena","Talk to Ezaphir and defeat the fourth challenge","Rothog awaits you in the Arena.","Ezaphir calls forth the second challenge!","Defeated the First Challenge!","Defeated the Third Challenge!","Ezaphir will call forth one of the more stalwart gladiators to test your mettle in glorious combat.","Talk to Ezaphir and defeat the third challenge","Talk to Ezaphir and defeat Rothog the Storm","Ezaphir calls forth the fourth challenge!","Defeated the Second Challenge!"}},
[3845]={nameES="Dahâl Huliz, The Arena -- Tier 2",objectivesES={"Ezaphir calls forth the third challenge!","Talk to Ezaphir and defeat the first challenge","Ezaphir calls for the first challenge!","Ezaphir informs you that you are about to face your greatest challenge in the arena: Rothog the Storm himself.","You are victorious, and Ezaphir returns to the fighting sands","Ezaphir will issue your first challenge when you are ready to compete.","You have defeated Rothog the Storm, and the spoils of victory are yours!","Dahâl Huliz, The Arena -- Tier 2","Ezaphir congratulates you on your victory, but there are more difficult challenges to come.","The gladiatorial pits of Umbar Baharbêl serve several important purposes: entertaining the masses, keeping their attention focused, and meting justice upon those who break the laws of the city.\
