[3855]={nameES="Daily Request: A Casual Study",objectivesES={"Tancram is in the Hall of the King.","Daily Request: A Casual Study","You mark the spread of the disease in the bog-lurker","<rgb=#00FF00>Look</rgb> at an Infectious Plague-rat in Agarnaith","You mark the spread of the disease in the plague-rat","<rgb=#00FF00>Look</rgb> at an Agarnaith Gore-crow","Bring your report on the spread of the disease to Tancram in the Hall of the King","You mark the spread of the disease in the plague-fly","Tancram has asked you to perform a casual study of some of the creatures that crawl or fly in plague-ridden Agarnaith.","<rgb=#00FF00>Look</rgb> at a Bloody Bog-lurker in Agarnaith","You mark the spread of the disease in the gore-crow","Tancram has asked you to defeat boars and wolves in plague-ridden Agarnaith, and to <rgb=#00FF00>look</rgb> at several other creatures in order to gauge the spread of the disease.","<rgb=#00FF00>Look</rgb> at a Bloody Plague-fly in Agarnaith"}},
[3856]={nameES="Daily Request: A Package from Home",objectivesES={"Talk to Vórthi in the Hall Under the Mountain","Góthur is by a lake of fire to the south-west of Mordath, the great pit over which Barad-dûr once towered.","Daily Request: A Package from Home","Vórthi asked you to defeat foes in Dor Amarth before delivering the package to Góthur.","Vórthi has given you a package to deliver to an adventurer in Dor Amarth.","Deliver the package from Vétha to Góthur","Vórthi is in the Hall Under the Mountain, in Erebor."}},
[3857]={nameES="Daily Request: An Errand for Aster",objectivesES={"Aster Hayward wants to provide meals for some of the freed Nurnhoth and has asked you to collect some of the foodstuffs she thinks they would enjoy.","Food jars can be found at Rhûd Vorn, an Easterling camp on the eastern side of Udûn.","Bring the food jars to Aster Hayward in Tham Periain","Daily Request: An Errand for Aster","Aster Hayward is in Tham Periain."}},
[3858]={nameES="Daily Request: An Errand for Frodo",objectivesES={}},
[3859]={nameES="Daily Request: An Errand for Merry",objectivesES={"Bring the items you collected to Aster Hayward in Tham Periain","Aster Hayward conveyed a request to you from Meriadoc Brandybuck, who desires to continue his research into plants and vegetation, particularly for use in his pipe.","Aster Hayward is in Tham Periain.","Daily Request: An Errand for Merry","In the swamps of Agarnaith, travelling seeds can be found from nerbyg and plague-flies, and entangled weeds can be found from bog-lurkers."}},
[3860]={nameES="Daily Request: An Errand for Pippin",objectivesES={}},
[3861]={nameES="Daily Request: An Errand for Sam",objectivesES={"Aster Hayward conveyed a request to you from Samwise Gamgee: to defeat spiders in Lhingris.","Spiders can be found in great numbers throughout Lhingris.","Daily Request: An Errand for Sam","Talk to Aster Hayward in Tham Periain","Aster Hayward is in Tham Periain."}},
[3862]={nameES="Daily Request: Arming Our Warriors",objectivesES={"The Sons of Stone are located on the road near Rath Cail in Lhingris.","You remove a bundle of equipment from the waggon","The Crow-feeders are located on the road south of Rath Cail in Lhingris.","Find the Crow-feeders and supply the dwarves with fresh equipment","Find the Sons of Stone and supply the dwarves with fresh equipment","Vórthi has asked for your help rearming a number of dwarves adventuring in Lhingris.","Bring the remaining equipment to Unvíth just north of the Crow-feeders","Unload the cart on the road in the north-east of Lhingris, near the entrance to Dor Amarth","Vágrek is with his cart in the north-east of Lhingris, near the road into Dor Amarth.","The Crow-feeders have been resupplied with new equipment","The Sons of Stone have been resupplied with new equipment","Daily Request: Arming Our Warriors","Unvíth is just north of the Crow-feeders."}},
[3863]={nameES="Daily Request: Choosing Doom",objectivesES={"Glórellas is in the Court of Celeborn.","Daily Request: Choosing Doom","Glórellas has asked you to defeat some of the foes that stalk Dor Amarth, but she left the choice of which foes to face up to you.","Glórellas asked you to defeat foes in Dor Amarth, choosing between rock-worms, dire-horns, and a number of other creatures, in order to aid the Elves that fight in that land.","Talk to Glórellas in the Court of Celeborn"}},
[3864]={nameES="Daily Request: Food, Water, and Words",objectivesES={}},
[3865]={nameES="Daily Request: Forget Not These Others",objectivesES={}},
[3866]={nameES="Daily Request: Hot Work, And Lots Of It!",objectivesES={"The keg is greatly appreciated!","Vórthi has heard tales of the great lake of fire in Talath Úrui, the Ghâshghurm, and wants you to bring some means of refreshment to the dwarves that must adventure by its banks.","Set up a keg for parched dwarves north of the road between Naerband and the Ghâshghurm","Talk to Vórthi in the Hall Under the Mountain","Set up a keg for parched dwarves east of Thorzhaf, in Talath Úrui","There is a good spot for a keg north of the road in Talath Úrui, between Naerband and the Ghâshghurm.","There is a good spot for a keg north-east of Thorzhaf, in Talath Úrui.","Vórthi is in the Hall Under the Mountain.","Set up a keg for parched dwarves north-east of Thorzhaf, in Talath Úrui","There is a good spot for a keg east of Thorzhaf, in Talath Úrui.","Daily Request: Hot Work, And Lots Of It!"}},
[3867]={nameES="Daily Request: News From Lhingris",objectivesES={}},
[3868]={nameES="Daily Request: Notice of the King",objectivesES={"Tancram has asked you to raise banners of the King in the vale of Udûn.","This banner will serve as a reminder that a king rules in Gondor","Tancram is in the Hall of the King.","Tancram gave you a number of banners to raise over Dor Amarth.","Daily Request: Notice of the King","Talk to Tancram in the Hall of the King"}},
[3869]={nameES="Daily Request: Pick Your Poison",objectivesES={"Vórthi has asked for your help combatting threats in Agarnaith, but he is not particular about how exactly you accomplish it.","Daily Request: Pick Your Poison","Vórthi is in the Hall Under the Mountain.","Vórthi asked you to choose foes to defeat in Agarnaith, and no matter what you choose to face, you will be making the swamp more safe.","Talk to Vórthi in the Hall Under the Mountain"}},
[3870]={nameES="Daily Request: Report from Talath Úrui",objectivesES={"Glórellas asked you to defeat enemies in Talath Úrui before finding Candithil and obtaining his report.","Talk to Glórellas in the Court of Celeborn","Glórellas has asked you to find Candithil in Talath Úrui and obtain his report.","Talk to Candithil by the cross-roads south-east of Orodruin, in Talath Úrui","Candithil is near the cross-roads south-east of Orodruin, in Talath Úrui.","Daily Request: Report from Talath Úrui","Glórellas is in the Court of Celeborn."}},
[3871]={nameES="Daily Request: Scorching Selection",objectivesES={"Tancram has asked you to defeat some of the dragon-kind that stalk Talath Úrui.","Daily Request: Scorching Selection","Tancram is in the Hall of the King.","Salamanders, rock-worms, and fire-drakes can be found throughout Talath Úrui.","Talk to Tancram in the Hall of the King"}},
[3872]={nameES="Daily Request: Still Defiant",objectivesES={"Tancram asked you to defeat enemies within the fortress of Durthang, in Udûn.","Hang the repaired Thandrim shield on the wall outside the entrance to Durthang, in Udûn","Retrieve the shield of the Thandrim from the wall where you placed it","Tancram has given you a shield of the Thandrim, now repaired, and has asked you to defeat the evil ones who hold Durthang.","Tancram gave you a shield to hang on a wall outside the entrance to Durthang, so you may fight in memory of the fallen Thandrim.","Daily Request: Still Defiant","Tancram is in the Hall of the King.","The shield was untouched by enemies. Perhaps they fear it","You placed a repaired shield of the Thandrim on a wall outside the entrance to Durthang, in Udûn, and should now retrieve it.","Bring the repaired Thandrim shield to Tancram in the Hall of the King"}},
[3873]={nameES="Daily Request: Swamp Full of Danger",objectivesES={"Daily Request: Swamp Full of Danger","Glórellas is in the Court of Celeborn.","Glórellas has asked you to defeat foes in Agarnaith in order to aid adventurers in that plague-ridden reach of Gorgoroth.","Talk to Glórellas in the Court of Celeborn","Glórellas asked you to defeat beasts and Orc-kind in Agarnaith."}},
[3874]={nameES="Daily Request: The Cart at the Parade Grounds",objectivesES={"Vórthi has devised a means of taking Orc-blades and Orc-shields and converting them to use by the dwarves, and needs your help to supply the raw materials.","Daily Request: The Cart at the Parade Grounds","Vórthi asked you to search the Orc camps on the valley floor in Udûn for discarded blades and shields that can be turned into dwarf-weapons.","Load the weapons and shields into Vágrek's cart near the Udûn Foothold","Vágrek is by his cart near the Udûn Foothold.","Vórthi is in the Hall Under the Mountain, waiting to hear your report.","You add your supply of equipment to Vágrek's cart","Talk to Vórthi in the Hall Under the Mountain"}},
