[3881]={nameES="Diario: Ayudando a una cosecha suave",objectivesES={"The Kintai's duty to ensure Nisigím thrives is ceaseless. Though Sívigush threatens to corrupt the last vestiges of purity in the land, they shall endure. To assist them deliver Kinta harvesting tools to Sul Madásh.\
\
Deliver Kinta harvesting tools to Aralath at Sul Madásh.","The Kintai's duty to ensure Nisigím thrives is ceaseless. Though Sívigush threatens to corrupt the last vestiges of purity in the land, they shall endure. To assist them deliver Kinta harvesting tools to Sul Madásh.\
\
