[3882]={nameES="Daily: An Even Stickier Harvest",objectivesES={"Deliver the harvested honey to Lejâni at Zajâna","Kighân's recovery requires not only the sword, but also the plowshare. Assist the people by attending to more mundane efforts across the land.\
