Harvest honeycombs at Medân Makhai.","Daily: An Even Stickier Harvest","Kighân's recovery requires not only the sword, but also the plowshare. Assist the people by attending to more mundane efforts across the land.\
\
Deliver harvested honeycombs from Medân Makhai to Lejâl in Zajâna."}},
