[3892]={nameES="Daily: Defeat Hâzlur",objectivesES={"Daily: Defeat Hâzlur","Defeat the powerful bog-lurker known as Hâzlur wandering Dil-irmíz.","Defeat the bog-lurker Hâzlur","Bôgalekh has asked you to defeat Hâzlur, a powerful bog-lurker spotted in the area.","Return to Bôgalekh in Jadambor in Dil-irmíz to inform them of Hâzlur's defeat.","Informed Bôgalekh of Hâzlur's defeat","Hâzlur defeated","Return to Bôgalekh to inform them of Hâzlur's defeat"}},
[3893]={nameES="Daily: Defeat Râmakhir",objectivesES={"Return to Bôgalekh to inform them of Râmakhir's defeat","Bôgalekh has asked you to defeat Râmakhir, a powerful shade spotted in the area.","Informed Bôgalekh of Râmakhir's defeat","Râmakhir defeated","Daily: Defeat Râmakhir","Defeat the shade Râmakhir","Return to Bôgalekh in Jadambor in the flooded undercity to inform them of Râmakhir's defeat.","Defeat the powerful shade known as Râmakhir to the west of Jadambor."}},
[3894]={nameES="Daily: Essence for Elixirs",objectivesES={"Bring the shade essence to Kavíra in Jadambor in western Dil-irmíz.","Essence from defeated shades has many uses. Bring some to Kavíra, the healer in Jadambor, to help resupply their stores.","You found shade essence","Bring the shade essence to Kavíra in Jadambor","Daily: Essence for Elixirs","You found shade essence.","You have gathered shade essence from the shades in the area. Kavíra, the healer in Jadambor would have use of these.","Shades can be found to the west of Jadambor.\
\
Collect their essence and bring it to Kavíra in Jadambor.","There are many shades throughout western Dil-irmíz. Kavíra, the healer in Jadambor, would surely be grateful if you restocked their supply of shade essence."}},
