[3899]={nameES="Daily: Keeping Up Inspections",objectivesES={"Examine the mine at Gebarakór","Examine the mine at Lâkindar","Nothing has visibly changed at the mine","Lâkindar remains haunted by shades and wights","Though the mines have been inspected, the dwarves of Jiret-menêsh still wish to ensure that no ill-activity has returned to the places where they may yet go. Return to the four mines and inspect them.","The open pit-mine is still in use by the Ordâkhai","Examine the mine at Erakúndo","Daily: Keeping Up Inspections","Adazâr remains sealed and populated by kergrim","Examine the mine at the Arch of Adazâr"}},
