[3901]={nameES="Daily: Keeping the Whispers Silent",objectivesES={"Tu canción ha disipado la corrupción","Find the whispering crypt to the south","Find the whispering crypt further to the east","Find the whisper crypt to the east","Los lamentos de agonía te aprietan el pecho de ansiedad","The forsaken land of An Shêru wakens, but the hold of evil upon the land remains. Assist the people of An Shêru and all of Mûr Ghala will benefit.\
\
Silence the whispers in the crypts.","El aullido siniestro te da escalofríos","Sing a song of Light to counter the Darkness","Enter the Crypts of Gadim-ûn","Los susurros inquietantes llenan tu corazón de temor","Daily: Keeping the Whispers Silent","Find the whispering crypt to the west","Sing a song of Light to again counter the Darkness","Los susurros fantasmales te revuelven el estómago"}},
[3902]={nameES="Daily: Lay Them to Rest",objectivesES={"Fell magic has long plagued the lands of Kighân. With the restoration at hand, the people desire to rid the fell things that disturb their dead. Help them pay respects and purge the Restless Dead.\
\
Defeat the Dead near Jag Golód.","Fell magic has long plagued the lands of Kighân. With the restoration at hand, the people desire to rid the fell things that disturb their dead. Help them pay respects and purge the Restless Dead.\
\
Defeat the Dead at Jag Golód.","Daily: Lay Them to Rest"}},
