[3906]={nameES="Daily: More Nakhód Júra",objectivesES={"Kighân's recovery requires not only the sword, but also the plowshare. Assist the people by attending to more mundane efforts across the land.\
\
Collect ingredients for nakhód júra to deliver to Aphadar at his farm, or craft nakhód júra for delivery to the Steward of Mûr Ghala, Lejâl, at Zajâna.","Deliver nakhód júra to Lejâl, at Zajâna","Kighân's recovery requires not only the sword, but also the plowshare. Assist the people by attending to more mundane efforts across the land. Deliver crafted nakhód júra to the Steward of Mûr Ghala, Lejâl, at Zajâna.","Daily: More Nakhód Júra","Kighân's recovery requires not only the sword, but also the plowshare. Assist the people by attending to more mundane efforts across the land.\
\
Craft nakhód júra for delivery to the Steward of Mûr Ghala, Lejâl, at Zajâna."}},
