[3921]={nameES="Daily: The Keys to Our Past",objectivesES={"The scholars of Zajâna seek to recover all remnants of their history taken by the invaders who oppressed them. They ask for assistance in making delicate tinctures and sturdy keys to recover their lost knowledge.\
\
Create and deliver Zajâni-made keys to Lejâl at Zajâna.","Daily: The Keys to Our Past","Deliver Zajâni-made keys to Lejâl at Zajâna"}},
