[3924]={nameES="Bailes con los Enanos",objectivesES={"Bailes con los Enanos","Sigue los pasos del maestro del baile antes de que se agote el tiempo","El maestro de baile está en la taberna de Mansión de Thorin.\
\
Tras haber completado los pasos de baile necesarios, habla con el maestro de baile para aprender el baile de los Enanos.","Espera a que comience la celebración del baile de los Enanos","No abandones la zona de baile","El maestro de baile está en la taberna del Salón de Thorin.\
\
Espera a que comience la celebración del baile de los Enanos y sigue las instrucciones del maestro de baile.","Tómate un breve descanso","Sigue los pasos indicados por el maestro de baile.","Paso realizado","El baile de los Enanos ha comenzado"}},
[3925]={nameES="Bailes con los Elfos",objectivesES={"La maestra de baile está en Duillond, cerca de los establos.\
\
Tras haber completado los pasos de baile necesarios, habla con la maestra de baile para aprender el baile de los Elfos.","Espera a que comience la celebración del baile de los Elfos","Sigue los pasos indicados por la maestra de baile.","No abandones la zona de baile","La maestra de baile está en Duillond, cerca de los establos.\
\
Espera a que comience la celebración del baile de los Elfos y sigue las instrucciones de la maestra de baile.","Tómate un breve descanso","Sigue los pasos de la maestra de baile antes de que se agote el tiempo","Bailes con los Elfos","El baile de los Elfos ha comenzado","Paso realizado"}},
[3926]={nameES="Bailes con los Hobbits",objectivesES={"Sigue los pasos del maestro del baile antes de que se agote el tiempo","No abandones la zona de baile","Bailes con los Hobbits","Espera a que comience la celebración del baile de los hobbits","Tómate un breve descanso","El maestro de baile está bajo el Árbol de la Fiesta en la Comarca.\
\
Espera a que comience la celebración del baile de los hobbits y sigue las instrucciones del maestro de baile.","El baile de los hobbits ha comenzado","Sigue los pasos indicados por el maestro de baile.","Paso realizado","El maestro de baile está bajo el Árbol de la Fiesta en la Comarca.\
\
Tras haber completado los pasos de baile necesarios, habla con el maestro de baile para aprender el baile de los hobbits."}},
[3927]={nameES="Bailes con los Hombres",objectivesES={"Bailes con los Hombres","La maestra de baile está en el centro del recinto del festival de Bree.\
\
Espera a que comience la celebración del baile de los Hombres y sigue las instrucciones de la maestra de baile.","Sigue los pasos indicados por la maestra de baile.","No abandones la zona de baile","Espera a que comience la celebración del baile de los Hombres","Sigue los pasos de la maestra del baile antes de que se agote el tiempo","Tómate un breve descanso","El baile de los Hombres ha comenzado","La maestra de baile está en el centro del recinto del festival de Bree.\
\
Tras haber completado los pasos de baile necesarios, habla con la maestra de baile para aprender el baile de los Hombres.","Paso realizado"}},
[3928]={nameES="Peligro entre las dunas",objectivesES={"Herthdúr tuvo un desafortunado encuentro con los rondadores de arenas que merodean entre las dunas de Barandalf y desea poner fin a la amenaza que suponen para los viajeros.","Herthdúr está en el campamento de los montaraces junto al Coloso, al noroeste de Barandalf.\
\
Has acabado con algunos de los rondadores de arenas que merodean entre las dunas de Barandalf y deberías informar de tu éxito a Herthdúr.","Se pueden encontrar rondadores de arenas por todo Barandalf, pero especialmente en Lithost, al sureste del Coloso, al otro lado del río respecto a las ruinas de Barad Tharsír.\
\
Herthdúr te ha pedido que derrotes a algunos de los rondadores de arenas que hacen que viajar por Barandalf sea peligroso para él y su inventario de mercancías.","Peligro entre las dunas","Habla con Herthdúr en el campamento del Coloso"}},
[3929]={nameES="Peligro en Khadar-zarâm",objectivesES={"Los enemigos se encuentran en los niveles más altos de Khadar-zarâm en Nud-melek.\
\
Debes derrotar a los enemigos que esperan en la escalera para emboscar a los viajeros inocentes.","Svanr se encuentra al pie de la gran escalera en el oeste de Nud-melek.\
\
Debes regresar con Svanr y decirle que has eliminado a muchos enemigos en Khadar-zarâm.","Peligro en Khadar-zarâm","Vuelve con Svanr","Svanr casi fue asesinado por una lanza que le lanzaron mientras bajaba por Khadar-zarâm, la gran escalera de Nud-melek. ¡Eso solo puede significar una cosa: trasgos arriba!"}},
[3930]={nameES="Danger in Silence",objectivesES={"Danger in Silence","Talk to Inguc","Talk to Anrad","Talk to Thane Edric","Talk to Ordgar","Ordgar can be found near the gates into Entwade.\
\
Thane Edric has asked that you speak to his guards inside and near the river Entwash to learn of any news of the Enemy's whereabouts in Kingstead.","Thane Edric can be found near the waggons outside the Mead Hall of Entwade.\
\
You have spoken to Edric's men and learned much of the threats facing Kingstead. You should now return to Thane Edric.","Thane Edric and Léoflad struggle to ensure the safety of their people as the forces of the Enemy draw ever closer.","Anrad can be found slightly to the north outside the gates of Entwade.\
\
You have spoken to Inguc of more threats in Kingstead. You should speak to Anrad before returning to Thane Edric.","DNT -- Players will not see","Inguc can be found slightly to the south-east outside the gates of Entwade.\
\
You have spoken to Ordgar. You should continue to speak to Thane Edric's guards in hopes of discovering why the attacks have ceased in the past week."}},
[3931]={nameES="Danger in the Hills",objectivesES={"The footprints head west","Danger in the Hills","The fifth footprint lies to the south-west of the fourth.\
\
You should continue tracking the beast to its lair.","The footprints head to the south-west","The footprints lead into a cave to the north-west","The fourth footprint lies to the west of the third, south and west of Echad Idhrenfair.\
\
You should continue tracking the beast to its lair.","Find the third footprint","Return to the site of the first footprint","Find the fourth footprint","Find the second footprint","Enter the Grey King's lair and defeat the creature","The footprints continue west","Himeinior is at Echad Idhrenfair, north-east of the Grey King's lair.\
\
You have defeated the creature known as the Grey King and should return to Himeinior with news of your victory.","The footprints continue off to the south","The creature's lair lies to the north-west of the fifth footprint, south-west of Echad Idhrenfair.\
\
Himeinior bade you defeat the unknown creature.","The Ranger Himeinior was disturbed by the crushed boulder and skeleton you discovered while patrolling the Gloomglens.","The third footprint lies to the west of the second, south and west of Echad Idhrenfair.\
\
You should continue tracking the beast to its lair.","The footprint you found lies to the west of Echad Idhrenfair.\
\
Himeinior has asked you to return to the site of the footprint you found and track the beast to its lair.","The second footprint lies to the south of the first, which was to the west of Echad Idhrenfair.\
\
You should continue to track the beast to its lair.","Find the fifth footprint","Talk to Himeinior at Echad Idhrenfair"}},
[3932]={nameES="Danger in the Marshes",objectivesES={"Explore to the north-west of Artamir's camp","Artamir has asked you to investigate a number of different locations in the Dead Marshes, seeking some clue to the Orkish presence here. He asked you to seek out notable spots to the north, north-west, and west, and said he would do the same.","The sound of insects is overwhelming at this nest, and you do not want to tarry","Talk to Artamir at his camp in the Dead Marshes","Below the water's surface, the drowned wood seems to beckon with watery tendrils","This rocky crag rises out of the swamp, and you feel exposed against the sky","Explore to the north of Artamir's camp","You have learned that the Orcs were sent into the Dead Marshes for some purpose. Did Frodo come this way, and does the Dark Master of the Orcs know of his passage?","You have found some interesting spots within the Dead Marshes, but few clues to the Orkish presence here. You should return now to Artamir's camp. Perhaps he found something of note.","Find the entrance to the Orc camp","You have found the entrance to the Orc camp, as Artamir requested","Explore to the west of Artamir's camp","Danger in the Marshes"}},
[3933]={nameES="Jabalíes Peligrosos",objectivesES={"El condestable Tanglerush está preocupado por el aumento del número de animales salvajes que se ven cerca de las fronteras de Entibo.","El condestable Tanglerush está en la plaza del pueblo de Entibo.\
\
El condestable Tanglerush estará complacido de saber que has reducido la población de jabalíes cerca de Entibo.","Jabalíes Peligrosos","Los jabalíes se pueden encontrar cerca de la casa del condestable Bolger, al sureste de Entibo, al sur de la granja de la Viuda Froghorn.\
\
El condestable Tanglerush quiere que reduzcas la población de jabalíes cerca de Entibo antes de que uno de los hobbits sea atacado."}},
[3934]={nameES="Dangerous Dens",objectivesES={"Talk to Thorlind","Taurog-dens can be found in Tholkát, in northern Eryn Lasgalen.\
\
You should destroy Taurog-dens in Tholkát.","Thorlind can be found near Tholkát.\
\
You should talk to Thorlind.","The Taurogrim have taken over an area of Eryn Lasgalen called Tholkát. Thorlind has asked you to cleanse this area of their evil, including their accursed dens.","Dangerous Dens"}},
[3935]={nameES="Dangerous Dwarf-eaters",objectivesES={"Kyrstig has asked you to stop the kergrim from consuming the dwarf-corpses in the Akhaldarâg tombs.","Kyrstig is scouting near Akhaldarâg.","Kergrim can be found throughout the Pit of Stonejaws.","Talk to Kyrstig near Akhaldarâg","Dangerous Dwarf-eaters"}},
[3936]={nameES="Empresa Peligrosa",objectivesES={"Un carro yace destrozado en el camino, y hay señales de que fue atacado","Empresa Peligrosa","Tim Rastrojal condujo su carro al sur de Echad Candelleth, siguiendo la carretera hacia Acebeda, que cruza un pequeño vado al este de la cabaña de Garbert y asciende hacia la Cordillera de Acebeda.\
\
Tongannel te ha pedido que sigas el camino hacia el sur y busques cualquier señal de Tim Rastrojal para calmar sus temores por su seguridad.","La caja está rota y vacía, pero el cartel dice 'Propiedad de T. Rastrojal'","Busca cualquier rastro de Tim Rastrojal en el camino a Acebeda","Tongannel ha tenido un mal presentimiento durante los últimos días y teme que no augure nada bueno para el viajero de Bree con quien entabló amistad."}},
[3937]={nameES="Dangerous Game: Aurochs",objectivesES={"Dangerous Game: Aurochs","Defeat Thrumtróth the Thunderer","Talk to Rékar","Rékar the Huntsman has challenged you to bring down some well-known beasts in the Dale-lands.","Rékar the Huntsman can be found in Dale.\
\
You should talk to Rékar.","Thrumtróth the Thunderer and other aurochs can be found in the wilderness of the Dale-lands.\
\
You should hunt aurochs and Thrumtróth the Thunderer.","Defeated Thrumtróth the Thunderer"}},
[3938]={nameES="Dangerous Game: Avanc",objectivesES={"Talk to Rékar","Northern river-avanc and Fenskin can be found in the Marshes in the Dale-lands.\
\
You should hunt northern river-avanc and Fenskin.","Rékar the Huntsman can be found in Dale.\
\
You should talk to Rékar.","Defeated Fenskin","Dangerous Game: Avanc","Rékar the Huntsman has challenged you to bring down some well-known beasts in the Dale-lands.","Defeat Fenskin"}},
[3939]={nameES="Dangerous Game: Lynx",objectivesES={"Talk to Rékar","Rékar the Huntsman can be found in Dale.\
\
You should talk to Rékar.","Mountain lynxes and Snowfell can be found on the slopes of Erebor.\
\
You should hunt mountain lynxes and Snowfell.","Defeated Snowfell","Dangerous Game: Lynx","Defeat Snowfell","Rékar the Huntsman has challenged you to bring down some well-known beasts in the Dale-lands."}},
[3940]={nameES="Dangerous Game: Moose",objectivesES={"Dangerous Game: Moose","Talk to Rékar","Rékar the Huntsman can be found in Dale.\
\
You should talk to Rékar.","Dale-lands Moose and Oakthorn can be found in the wilderness near Dale.\
\
You should hunt Dale-lands Moose and Oakthorn.","Defeat Oakthorn","Defeated Oakthorn","Rékar the Huntsman has challenged you to bring down some well-known beasts in the Dale-lands."}},
[3941]={nameES="Dangerous Pages",objectivesES={"Find a man dressed in yellow in the Court of Larinâsta","Read the note in the mysterious book on the table","Dangerous Pages","Tarsâri have appeared! Fight or flee from them!","Read the note in the mysterious book in the Kalmakhíla.","Locate the red book 'A History of Zajâna' in the south wing of the Kalmakhíla in Zajâna.","Find a man dressed in yellow in the Court of Larinâsta in Zajâna.","You have heard the Kalmakhíla is a vast repository of knowledge. Perhaps there are books on the Tarsâri here?","Locate the red book 'A History of Zajâna'","Flee from the Tarsâri and return to Rayíka just outside the Kalmakhíla.","The note reads: You wish to learn more about the Tarsâri? Find me in yellow in Larinâsta","Flee from the Tarsâri and return to Rayíka!"}},
[3942]={nameES="Dangerous Quarry",objectivesES={"Frithgeir is at Zudrugund, north of the gwiber-nests.\
\
You should return to Frithgeir and let him know that you have been able to defeat a number of gwiber in Thrór's Coomb.","Several clutches of gwiber have begun to build nests in the valley of Thrór's Coomb below Zudrugund, endangering the people of Enedwaith.","Talk to Frithgeir at Zudrugund","Dangerous Quarry","Gwiber-nests can be found in the eastern reaches of Thrór's Coomb, south of Zudrugund.\
\
Frithgeir has asked you to defeat any gwiber that you encounter near their nests."}},
[3943]={nameES="Darfi Has Wandered Off",objectivesES={"Darfi, yet another companion of Armund, has disappeared somewhere to the north-west of the old sawmill in the Limlight Gorge. Armund asked him to scout the dense stands of trees near the base of the ridge there, but he still has not come back.","You freed Darfi!","Rescue Darfi","Talk to Darfi","Darfi Has Wandered Off","You should find Darfi the dwarf and help him get back to the mill.\
\
Armund said he was headed north-west of the sawmill to size up some lumber-stands for cutting.","You should speak with Darfi at the Limlight Gorge sawmill."}},
[3944]={nameES="Dargnákh Unleashed -- Tier 1",objectivesES={"Use the ballistae to goad Dargnákh into a rampage","You drove Dargnákh from the outbuildings!","Defeat Dargnákh","Use the torches to set the Orc's powder alight and drive Dargnákh from the outbuildings","Use the ballistae to goad Dargnákh into a rampage.","Use food to lure Dargnákh to escape and continue his rampage.","You defeated Huva!","You have come upon the cage of Dargnákh, the troll captured by the servants of the White Hand. Perhaps this may be used to your advantage as you seek to disrupt Saruman's war-efforts.","Drive Dargnákh from the outbuildings by setting him aflame with the torches on the walls.","Defeat Huva","Defeat Dargnákh the troll before he escapes into the wild.","Use food to lure Dargnákh to escape and continue his rampage","Dargnákh has escaped to continue his rampage!","Defeat Huva, an acolyte of Saruman.","Dargnákh Unleashed -- Tier 1","Dargnákh has been driven to rampage!","Defeated Dargnákh"}},
[3945]={nameES="Dargnákh Unleashed -- Tier 2",objectivesES={}},
[3946]={nameES="Dargnákh's Rage",objectivesES={"Andras asked you to enter the Ring of Isengard and sow confusion among the enemy by enraging the troll Dargnákh into rampaging.","Drive Dargnákh onward to his death... and the deaths of Saruman's lackeys.","Drive Dargnákh into a rampage","Dargnákh has fallen","Dargnákh's Rage"}},
[3947]={nameES="Internándose en Hondonada del Terrón",objectivesES={"Nuddo debe oír sobre la creciente infestación. Nuddo Sutchic está esperando en Lintrev.","Nuddo ha sido testigo de la presencia de la sombra en los alrededores.","Has derrotado a la reina araña corrompida.","Internándose en Hondonada del Terrón","Has derrotado a la reina araña corrompida.\
\
Debes contarle a Nuddo en Lintrev las buenas noticias.","Habla con Nuddo Sutchic","Nuddo te dice que las arañas han comenzado a atacar desde que la sombra atravesó la tierra. Hondonada del Terrón se encuentra al suroeste. Puedes tomar el camino que sale hacia el sur desde Lintrev y cruzar el puente.\
\
Viaja a Hondonada del Terrón y contiene la infestación de arañas.","Habla con Nuddo","Derrota a la reina araña corrompida.","Nuddo Sutchic te ha encargado encontrar y derrotar a la reina araña corrompida.\
\
Regresa a Hondonada del Terrón hacia el suroeste y encuentra a la reina."}},
[3948]={nameES="Dark Clouds on Bundushâthur",objectivesES={"Hoping to put an end to Azog's plots at the warding-spire of Atrad-zarakh, Dwarves of the Kámbrada, Zhélruka, and Abnúzhu have made for the slopes of Bundushâthur.","You raise a banner of the Haban'akkâ of Thráin in defiance of Azog!","Scout Târ-kútoz","King Shâlim Nightcloak, King Usk, and King Vélat can be found at Ashmargathâl.\
\
You have arrived at Ashmargathâl. You should speak to the Kings of the Kámbrada, Zhélruka, and Abnúzhu leading the assault on Atrad-zarakh.","You have done much to aid the dwarves of the Kámbrada, Zhélruka, and Abnúzhu at Atrad-zarakh.","Dwarves of the Kámbrada, Zhélruka, and Abnúzhu can be found at Ashmargathâl, far to the north of Amdân on the slopes of Bundushâthur.\
\
Dáin has asked you to travel to Ashmargathâl and aid the Dwarves of the Haban'akkâ.","Dark Clouds on Bundushâthur","Talk to King Shâlim Nightcloak","Talk to King Usk","You have done much to hinder Azog's forces at Târ-kútoz and Atrad-zarakh.\
\
You should raise a banner of the Haban'akkâ of Thráin at Atrad-zarakh.","Târ-kútoz can be found to the west of Ashmargathâl.\
\
The Kings of the Kámbrada, Zhélruka, and Abnúzhu have asked you to scout Târ-kútoz and defeat Azog's forces at Atrad-zarakh.","Goblins and bats can be found at Târ-kútoz and within the warding-spire of Atrad-zarakh. Trophy-bones can be collected from Orcs and some goblins.\
\
You should aid the Kámbrada, Zhélruka, and Abnúzhu by defeating the goblins and bats dwelling at Târ-kútoz. You should also collect trophy-bones for the Haban'akkâ.","Bats swirl around the Orcs and goblins encamped at the warding-spire of Atrad-zarakh","Completado","Although the battle on Bundushâthur is not yet ended, your efforts have done much to aid the Dwarves of the Kámbrada, Zhélruka, and Abnúzhu.","Raise a banner of the Haban'akkâ of Thráin at Atrad-zarakh","Talk to King Vélat","Travel to Ashmargathâl","The Dwarves of the Kámbrada, Zhélruka, and Abnúzhu have claimed Ashmargathâl!"}},
[3949]={nameES="Dark Crystals",objectivesES={}},
[3950]={nameES="Dark Deeds in Sammath Gûl",objectivesES={"Dark Deeds in Sammath Gûl","Laegalar has asked you to collect Blades of Necromancy from the Black Númenóreans that inhabit Sammath Gûl.","Sammath Gûl is in Dol Guldur.\
\
Laegalar has asked you to recover many Blades of Necromancy from the Black Númenóreans who roam Sammath Gûl."}},
[3951]={nameES="Profanadores Sombrios",objectivesES={"El Descenso Profundo de Moria se encuentra al norte y noroeste del Tesoro Olvidado.\
\
Has encontrado y eliminado a un buen número de los profanadores oscuros que merodeaban por el interior del Tesoro Olvidado.","Habla con Falgir en el Descenso Profundo","Se han descubierto cristales en Moria que portan las marcas del Tesoro Olvidado, una cámara sellada que oculta una considerable cantidad de riquezas. Este hallazgo ha despertado el interés de algunos enanos, que ahora desean descubrir la cámara y salvar su contenido de los orcos saqueadores.","Profanadores Sombrios","Los profanadores oscuros se pueden encontrar dentro del Tesoro Olvidado, al sur y sureste del Descenso Profundo.\
\
Falgir te pidió que encontraras y cazases a los profanadores oscuros que vigilan a los nuevos habitantes del Tesoro Olvidado."}},
[3952]={nameES="Excavaciones Tenebrosas - Envueltas en tinieblas",objectivesES={"En las Excavaciones Tenebrosas, las profundidades más olvidadas de Khazad-dûm, los Sin Nombre dominan las sombras amargas. Al igual que otras criaturas que se ocultan en la Fosa Negra que es Moria, los Sin Nombre temen la luz, pero no dejan pasar ninguna oportunidad de propagar corrupción y desaliento. Estos terribles enemigos deben ser erradicados de las Excavaciones Tenebrosas antes de que logren extenderse a otras zonas de las minas.","No seas derrotado","La región de las Excavaciones Tenebrosas se extiende muy al sureste de la Sala Vigesimoprimera.\
\
El enano Sigurd te ha desafiado a internarte en las Excavaciones Tenebrosas y derrotar al Gurvand sin la ayuda de runas, deseando que demuestres tu valía como el gran guerrero que se rumorea que eres.","Gurvand derrotado","Excavaciones Tenebrosas - Envueltas en tinieblas","Regresa con Sigurd a la Sala Vigesimoprimera","Derrota al Gurvand sin utilizar las piedras rúnicas","Sigurd se encuentra en la Sala Vigesimoprimera, al noroeste de la Gran Excavación donde merodean los Sin Nombre.\
\
Sigurd querrá saber si estuviste a la altura del desafío que te propuso: acabar con el Gurvand sin utilizar las runas."}},
[3953]={nameES="Excavaciones Tenebrosas - No hables mal",objectivesES={"Lengua del Gurvand obtenida","El Gurvand se encuentra en las Excavaciones Tenebrosas, muy al sureste del puesto de Eilíefr en la Sala Vigesimoprimera.\
\
El enano Eilíefr te ha desafiado a internarte en las Excavaciones Tenebrosas y derrotar a la antigua criatura sin nombre conocida como el Gurvand, trayendo de vuelta su lengua como trofeo cuando hayas terminado.","Recoge la lengua del Gurvand","Muestra la lengua del Gurvand a Eilíefr en la Sala Vigesimoprimera","En las Excavaciones Tenebrosas, las profundidades más olvidadas de Khazad-dûm, los Sin Nombre gobiernan sobre las sombras amargas. Como otras criaturas que se esconden en la Fosa Negra que es Moria, los Sin Nombre temen la luz, pero no dejarán escapar ninguna oportunidad de propagar corrupción y desesperación. Estos terribles enemigos deben ser erradicados de las Excavaciones Tenebrosas antes de que consigan abrirse paso hacia otras zonas de las minas.","Excavaciones Tenebrosas - No hables mal"}},
[3954]={nameES="Excavaciones Tenebrosas - Iluminar la Oscuridad",objectivesES={"Regresa con Geirr en la Sala Vigesimoprimera","En las Excavaciones Tenebrosas, las profundidades más olvidadas de Khazad-dûm, los Sin Nombre gobiernan sobre las sombras amargas. Como otras criaturas que se esconden en la Fosa Negra que es Moria, los Sin Nombre temen la luz, pero no dejarán escapar ninguna oportunidad de propagar corrupción y desesperación. Estos terribles enemigos deben ser erradicados de las Excavaciones Tenebrosas antes de que consigan abrirse paso hacia otras zonas de las minas.","Excavaciones Tenebrosas - Iluminar la Oscuridad","Las Excavaciones Tenebrosas están muy al sureste de la Sala Vigesimoprimera.\
\
El enano Geirr te ha retado a adentrarte en las Excavaciones Tenebrosas y derrotar a muchos de los enemigos sin nombre que allí habitan.","El enano Geirr se encuentra en la Sala Vigesimoprimera, al noroeste de la Gran Excavación, donde merodean los Sin Nombre.\
\
Geirr querrá saber si has sido lo bastante valiente como para adentrarte en las Excavaciones Tenebrosas y pelear contra los Sin Nombre."}},
[3955]={nameES="Presagios Oscuros",objectivesES={"Es un tiempo de malos presagios. Los Heraldos de los Muertos han surgido de las sombras para amenazar a los pueblos de la Tierra Media, pero ¿qué mal los ha llamado?\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión será eliminada de tu registro cuando finalice el evento asociado.</rgb>","Nedda Hojapino se encuentra en los campamentos de Escaramuzas de Bree, Ost Galadh y la Sala Vigesimoprimera.\
\
Los Heraldos de los Muertos han aparecido en escaramuzas por toda la Tierra Media. Deberías buscar a Nedda Hojapino para saber más acerca de estos misteriosos enemigos.","Habla con Nedda Hojapino en Bree, Ost Galadh o en la Sala Vigesimoprimera","Te has encontrado con una criatura de mal agüero, distinta a cualquiera de los lugartenientes del Enemigo a los que te hayas enfrentado antes. ¿Qué presagia su presencia para los pueblos de la Tierra Media?","Presagios Oscuros"}},
[3956]={nameES="Dark Hearts and Shadowed Minds",objectivesES={"Rescued first kidnapped resident","Rescued fourth kidnapped resident","Rescue second kidnapped resident","Dark Hearts and Shadowed Minds","Mizâdi has asked for your aid in freeing kidnapped Urmâkhi residents in Kûr Anzar.","Rescued third kidnapped resident","Rescued second kidnapped resident","Rescue third kidnapped resident","Rescue first kidnapped resident","Return to Numûru in Urmâkh","Return to Numûru in Urmâkh with your report.","Numûru has tasked you with freeing kidnapped Urmâkhi residents in Kûr Anzar and defeating any All-seeing who stand between you and them. Kûr Anzar is located due east of Urmâkh.","Rescue fourth kidnapped resident"}},
[3957]={nameES="Cazadores Oscuros",objectivesES={"Cazadores Oscuros","La cueva de Bûrzum Pushdug está al norte de Tór Gailvin, en el lado oeste de la colina donde se construyó esa fortaleza. Tór Gailvin está al noreste de Aughaire.\
\
Finnán te pidió que derrotaras a los orcos de Bûrzum Pushdug para enviar un mensaje de reproche a los Trév Duvárdain.","Finnán está en la isla central del asentamiento de Aughaire.\
\
Has derrotado a muchos orcos en Bûrzum Pushdug y ahora deberías llevar la noticia de tu victoria a Finnán."}},
[3958]={nameES="Dark Idols",objectivesES={"The slopes of Gathbúrz are dotted with horrific idols of the Dark Lord Sauron. These must all be destroyed if the Elves are to reclaim the forest of Mirkwood from the clutches of the Enemy.","Talk to Handelen at Thangúlhad","Handelen is at Thangúlhad in Gathbúrz.\
\
Having destroyed many of the idols of the Necromancer, you should return to Handelen.","Idols of the Necromancer may be found across the landscape of Gathbúrz.\
\
Handelen has tasked you with destroying the dark idols of Sauron that stand as a symbol of his power of Southern Mirkwood.","Dark Idols"}},
[3959]={nameES="El poder oscuro se alza",objectivesES={"El poder oscuro se alza","Derrota a Raulik","Raulik derrotado","Has derrotado a Raulik y detenido la propagación de la influencia de Sauron en esta zona concreta de Moria.","Desde los confines de Skrithûrz-ulíma, oyes a un ruidoso orco llamado Raulik. Sus palabras llegan directamente desde Mordor, y exhorta a los orcos de Moria a unirse a Sauron y servir al Ojo.","Derrota a Raulik, el siervo de Mordor","Completado","Raulik se encuentra en las afueras de Skrithûrz-ulíma, un campamento de orcos de Moria al noroeste de la Guardia Orca.\
\
Un orco de Mordor se ha disfrazado de orco de Moria y está animando a los orcos de Moria a unirse al Gran Ojo."}},
[3960]={nameES="Jinetes Oscuros",objectivesES={"Capitán Ongbúrz derrotado en Morfil","Derrota al capitán Ongbúrz en Morfil","Jinetes Oscuros","Los hermanos de Torquil fueron asesinados por orcos, y él busca aliados para vengarse de ellos.","La cueva Morfil está en Fasach-larran, al este de Aughaire.\
\
Torquil te ha pedido que vayas a Morfil y derrotes a los orcos que mataron a sus hermanos.","Torquil está en Aughaire, cerca del asiento de Crannog, al oeste de la isla central del asentamiento.\
\
Has matado a muchos orcos en Morfil y ahora deberías regresar con Torquil en Aughaire."}},
[3961]={nameES="Dark Relics",objectivesES={"Found the accursed staff","Find the accursed dagger","YOU SHOULDNT SEE THIS","Dark Relics","Found the accursed dagger","Find the accursed staff","Ianudirel can be found just south of the bridge at Krul Lugu.\
\
You should return the accursed relics you have gathered to Ianudirel.","The dagger and cup are held in the ruins of Sâd Morangol. The staff may be carried by one of the sorcerers of Sâd Morangol.\
\
Ianudirel has asked you to collect three relics -- a dagger, a cup, and a staff -- from the sorcerers of Sâd Mornagol.","Find the accursed cup","Found the accursed cup","Ianudirel has discovered the location of a number of evil relics being wielded by the sorcerers in Taur Morvith to summon fell spirits.","Bring the relics to Ianudirel"}},
[3962]={nameES="Dark Spirits of the Windfells",objectivesES={"Gwyllion's Gate lies to the south of Gavar Cadlus.\
\
Rhiain has asked you to seek evidence of the Cuthraul's presence and to banish the spirit if you may.","You feel an unnatural chill in the air","You found the evidence Rhiain requires","Talk to Rhiain at Gavar Cadlus","Rhiain is at Gavar Cadlus, north from Gwyllion's Gate.\
\
You should return to Rhiain with tidings of your success.","Cuthraul have appeared at Gwyllion's Gate, to the south of Gavar Cadlus.\
\
Rhiain sked you to banish the Cuthraul if you can.","The Uch-lûth received the gift of the Grey Company, but still do not trust you fully.","Dark Spirits of the Windfells","Seek evidence of the Cuthraul at Gwyllion's Gate"}},
[3963]={nameES="Dark Spirits of the Windfells -- Repeatable",objectivesES={"Cuthraul haunt the lands around Gavar Cadlus.\
\
Iuan has asked you to banish the Cuthraul from the land.","Dark Spirits of the Windfells -- Repeatable","Iuan is at Gavar Cadlus in the Windfells of Enedwaith.\
\
You should return to Iuan with tidings of your victory against the Cuthraul.","Talk to Iuan at Gavar Cadlus","The Uch-lûth were impressed by your victory against the Cuthraul at Gwyllion's Gate and seek your aid once more."}},
[3964]={nameES="Estandartes Oscuros",objectivesES={"Camran se encuentra en la isla central de Aughaire, al este del asiento de gobierno de Crannog.\
\
Has destruido los estandartes que volaban sobre Tor Gailvin y deberías volver ahora a Camran.","Estandartes Oscuros","Camran de Aughaire te ha preparado una tarea por la que sabrá si tienes la confianza de Crannog.","La fortaleza de Tor Gailvin se encuentra al noreste de Aughaire.\
\
Camran te ha pedido que vuelvas a Tor Gailvin y destruyas los estandartes que vuelan sobre la fortaleza.","Habla con Camran"}},
[3965]={nameES="Dark Talisman",objectivesES={}},
[3966]={nameES="Venganza oscura",objectivesES={"Los orcos Nûlthauk y Ranghâsh están en la ciudad de Dûn Covád, lejos al norte de Aughaire, entre las colinas occidentales.\
\
Eilig te ha pedido que derrotes a uno de los dos orcos que mataron a su hermana y así vengar su memoria.","Eilig, un guerrero de los Trév Gállorg, busca sembrar el caos entre los orcos que han tomado la ciudad de Dûn Covád y vengar a su hermana también.","Eilig está en el Búth Luikh de Aughaire.\
\
Deberías regresar con Eilig y contarle tu viaje a Dûn Covád.","Venganza oscura"}},
[3967]={nameES="Victoria Oscura",objectivesES={"Habla con Simbi en la Sala Vigesimoprimera","Victoria Oscura","Simbi está de guardia en la Sala Vigesimoprimera, al sur de Jazârgund. \
\
Simbi ha enviado un mensaje a Oxi, pidiendo hablar contigo en la Sala Vigesimoprimera.","Oxi cree que tus esfuerzos han mejorado enormemente la situación en el Camino de Durin desde tu llegada. Cree que la victoria está asegurada para los enanos en Jazârgund, pero que otros lugares en Moria pueden necesitar tu ayuda."}},
[3968]={nameES="Aguas Oscuras y Poco Profundas",objectivesES={"Encuentra el segundo cadáver de trasgo","Gyrgir está en la Bodega Putrefacta, en el noreste de las Obras Hidráulicas.\
\
Gyrgir estará encantado de escuchar que las sanguijuelas ya no representarán un problema para los enanos.","Las sanguijuelas se amontonan alrededor de los cadáveres de trasgos justo al oeste de la Bodega Putrefacta.\
\
Gyrgir quiere que encuentres los cadáveres de los que se han estado alimentando las sanguijuelas y esparzas toxina de tritón alrededor de ellos para matar a las sanguijuelas.","Usa la toxina de tritón","Ves algunas sanguijuelas arrastrándose en el agua","Toxina de tritón utilizada","Encuentra el primer cadáver de trasgo","Encuentra el tercer cadáver de trasgo","Encuentra el cuarto cadáver de trasgo","Habla con Gyrgir en la Bodega Putrefacta","Aguas Oscuras y Poco Profundas","Las sanguijuelas que infestan las Obras Hidráulicas se han salido de control y están impidiendo que los enanos exploren más allá."}},
[3969]={nameES="Oscurecido por el moho",objectivesES={"Espejo limpiado con el ácido","Habla con Thrand en Hulwul-nefekh","Thrand está en Hulwul-nefekh en el centro de las Obras Hidráulicas.","El espejo cubierto de hongo se encuentra justo afuera de la Cámara de la Memoria, al sureste de Hulwul-nefekh.\
\
Thrand cree que el ácido que Ansurr fabricó debería destruir el hongo que cubre el espejo.","Encuentra el espejo cubierto de hongo","Oscurecido por el moho","Limpia el espejo con el ácido","Antiguos espejos reflejaban la luz a lo largo de los túneles de Moria. Uno de ellos, que se encuentra en las Obras Hidráulicas, está completamente cubierto por una gruesa capa de hongo."}},
[3970]={nameES="La más oscura de las aguas",objectivesES={"Los aguaoscuras están en los estanques y jardines de Glinghant, más allá de la plaza de Clorhir.\
\
Debes entrar en Glinghant y derrota a los aguaoscuras que han profanado su belleza.","Glinghant fue una vez el lugar más bello de todo Annúminas... algo nada fácil dado el esplendor de la antigua ciudad en su apogeo. Las descripciones de los estanques y jardines de Glinghant tienen un lugar especial en los corazones de mi gente. Incluso después de tantos años de deterioro, podía contemplarse el recuerdo de su belleza.\
\
La llegada de Amarthiel y sus legiones a Annúminas es de por sí motivo de tristeza, pero de todo el daño que han causado a la ciudad, el ocupamiento y profanación de Glinghant es lo que más me enfurece. Aunque el resto de Annúminas cayese, los expulsaría de este lugar y restauraría su esplendor de antaño. No muchos de mis hermanos comparten esta opinción, pero tal es mi horror por la profanación de Glinghant.\
\
Amarthiel tiene muchos siervos, pero a Glinghant ha enviado a los aguaoscuras: espíritus malvados de corrupción. Si te aventurases más allá de las puertas a las terrazas de Glinghant, te agradecería enormemente que los eliminases.","La más oscura de las aguas"}},
[3971]={nameES="Darkness No More",objectivesES={"Herehasen is at Tordag's camp in the Broadacres, south of Fangorn.\
\
You should return to Herehasen and let him know that the Black Huorns will not threaten the Men of Rohan, and Blackthorn the Ent has pledged his allegiance to them.","Blackthorn has been roused to wrath by the treachery of Saruman.","DNT -- Will not be seen","Darkness No More","Talk to Herehasen at Tordag's camp"}},
[3972]={nameES="Darkness No More",objectivesES={"The Ent Blackthorn was roused to anger by your reckless slaughter of his Huorns.","Herehasen is at Tordag's camp in the Broadacres, south of the eaves of Fangorn.\
\
Blackthorn sent you back to Herehasen with his refusal to help the Rohirrim.","Your carelessness in slaying the Huorns who serve Blackthorn has likely cost the Rohirrim a powerful ally. You should speak with Blackthorn and try to convince him to help.","Darkness No More","Blackthorn has chosen to ignore the needs of the Rohirrim, but at least you can assure Herehasen that the shadows of Fangorn will not harm his people.\
\
You should speak with Blackthorn before returning to Herehasen.","Talk to Blackthorn","Your carelessness in slaying the Huorns has likely cost a powerful ally. You should speak with Blackthorn and try to convince him to help.","Talk to Herehasen at Tordag's camp"}},
[3973]={nameES="Darkness No More",objectivesES={"Herehasen is at Tordag's camp in the Broadacres, south of Fangorn.\
\
You should return to Herehasen and let him know that the Black Huorns will not threaten the Men of Rohan, and Blackthorn the Ent has pledged his allegiance to them.","Blackthorn has been roused to wrath by the treachery of Saruman.","DNT -- Will not be seen","Darkness No More","Talk to Herehasen at Tordag's camp"}},
[3974]={nameES="Darkness Revealed",objectivesES={"Below Drug Haniad, within an abandoned crypt, resides the source of the darkness creeping into the Lich Bluffs.","Mincham's camp lies in a small grove of trees, north of Drug Haniad.\
\
You should return to Mincham and inform him that the ritual has been stopped and that a greater force is behind the raising of the wights in the Lich Bluffs.","Talk to Mincham in the Lich Bluffs","Talk to Mincham  in the Lich Bluffs","Mincham is at his camp in the Lich Bluffs.\
\
You should speak with Mincham when you are prepared, and he will lead you to the entrance of Lhe Colvern.","Darkness Revealed"}},
[3975]={nameES="Darkness in the Ruins",objectivesES={"You have successfully braved the Bones of Barad-dûr and defeated many Black Númenóreans there.","A wealth of lore awaits those who brave the Bones of Barad-dûr.","Darkness in the Ruins","Complete Barad-dûr: Ruins of Darkness","An urgent notice is pinned to the board:\
\
'Black Númenóreans have been spotted in Barad-dûr. A brave adventurer is needed to defeat foes within the ruins. Seek out Candúr in Udûn to learn more.'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Warning: This quest requires Barad-dûr: Realm of the Black Word to be underway. If that quest has been completed or failed, you will be unable to exit and re-enter this instance in order to complete this quest.</rgb>","Candúr can be found in Udûn.\
\
You should talk to Candúr.","Completed Barad-dûr: Ruins of Darkness.","Completado"}},
[3976]={nameES="Darkness over Ethring",objectivesES={"Borhador can be found in The Crossing-hall.\
\
You should speak with Borhador.","Speak with Borhador","Darkness over Ethring","Candúr, the town guard, asks you speak with Borhador of the situation in the Vale.","Borhador carries the heavy burden of uncertainty for his Vale."}},
[3977]={nameES="Daughter Like Father",objectivesES={"Edwulf can be found at the Rohirrim training grounds, east of Cliving. The camp is a converted farmstead, hidden in a vale of trees north of the road.\
\
Reeve Athelward has asked you to speak with Edwulf, the man in charge of instructing his daughter, Ides, in the martial arts.","Talk to Edwulf at the Rohirrim training grounds","Daughter Like Father","Athelward's beloved daughter, Ides, has aspirations of becoming a brave warrior, much like her father. Athelward wishes for Ides to be happy and has agreed to provide her with suitable training."}},
[3978]={nameES="Days Long Past",objectivesES={"Days Long Past","Talk to Barallas to hear more of his tale","Barallas is at Stonecliff with Tithenolf in northern Balewood.\
\
Barallas wishes to tell you more of the Ents of the Balewood. You should speak with him to learn more of his tale.","Talk to Barallas","The Ent, Barallas, wishes to share his memories of the Balewood before Núrzum's assault shattered the forest.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This instance quest is meant to be run Solo and cannot be run in a group.</rgb>","Barallas is at Stonecliff with Tithenolf in northern Balewood.\
\
Barallas has finished his tale. You should now speak with him and discover if more can be done to aid the Ents."}},
[3979]={nameES="Dead In His Tracks",objectivesES={"The avanc can be found under Rook to the west of Snowbourn.","This avanc is clearly dead, but its rider has no idea","The avanc lays motionless on the ground","As Rook's avanc is his steed of sorts, whistling might be a good way to call him.\
\
The avanc can be found under Rook to the west of Snowbourn.","Whistling didn't prove helpful, so perhaps a more direct approach would work.\
\
The avanc can be found under Rook to the west of Snowbourn.","Poke at the avanc","Attempt to speak to the avanc","Rook can be found to the west of Snowbourn.","Dead In His Tracks","The avanc lays still","Rook is getting extremely frustrated that his avanc will not rise and continue on their journey.","Whistle and try to grab the avanc's attention","Talk to Rook"}},
[3980]={nameES="Dead Pool - Fire-stoker",objectivesES={}},
[3981]={nameES="Dead Pool - Forge-master",objectivesES={}},
[3982]={nameES="Dead Pool - Generalist",objectivesES={}},
[3983]={nameES="Dead Pool - Master of Workers",objectivesES={}},
[3984]={nameES="Dead Pool - Safety Foreman",objectivesES={}},
[3985]={nameES="La resurrección de los muertos",objectivesES={"Con la terrible presencia de los tumularios, los montañeses de Rhudaur y la amenaza de las aguas oscuras, el enemigo se ha vuelto demasiado poderoso como para que el pequeño campamento de Eglan pueda contenerlo.","Ve a ver a Eriac el Fuerte al campamento de Eglain, en Agamaur.","Hay tumularios por todo Agamaur.\
\
Eriac te ha pedido que le ayudes a matar tumularios en Agamaur. Los Eglain no son lo suficientemente numerosos como para luchar solos contra estas temibles criaturas.","Eriac el Fuerte se encuentra en el campamento de Eglain, en Agamaur.\
\
Has eliminado a un gran número de tumularios en el Pantano Rojo. Ahora es el momento de volver a ver a Eriac el Fuerte para informarle.","La resurrección de los muertos"}},
[3986]={nameES="Las Aguasombrías",objectivesES={"Las Aguasombrías","Las Aguasombrías se encuentran en el extremo este de Agamaur.\
\
Eriac te ha pedido que ayudes a los suyos a repeler a estas entidades formadas a partir de las aguas de Agamaur. Como prueba de tus esfuerzos, quiere que le traigas las antiguas piezas del Rhudaur y del Arthedain que quedan atrapadas en las Aguasombrías cuando estas surgen de los pantanos.","Con la terrible presencia de los tumularios, los montañeses de Rhudaur y la amenaza de las Aguasombrías, el enemigo se ha vuelto demasiado grande para que el pequeño campamento de Eglain pueda contenerlo.","Devuelve las piezas a Eriac"}},
[3987]={nameES="Caída mortal",objectivesES={"Habla con Thettmár en el Descenso Profundo","Usa el pasadizo secreto cerca de Stíling","Vuelve con Stíling (puedes usar el pasadizo secreto)","Thettmárr se encuentra en el campamento de Descenso Profundo, al norte de Gamil Filik.\
\
Deberías volver con Thettmárr y contarle lo que has visto en el campamento de los trasgos.","La trampa de caída mortal se encuentra cerca del campamento de los trasgos en Gamil Filik, al sureste del campamento de Descenso Profundo.\
\
Stíling te ha pedido que encuentres la trampa de caída mortal y la actives, para luego atraer a Pukhlor hacia su muerte bajo las rocas.'","Arma la trampa y atrae a Pukhlor hacia ella","Caída mortal","Stíling señaló una antigua trampa de caída en las minas, construida por los enanos de Moria hacía mucho tiempo, y sugirió que podrían aprovecharla en beneficio de los enanos.","Stíling está en su puesto, a las afueras de Gamil Filik.\
\
Deberías volver con Stíling y contarle que Pukhlor ha sido derrotado.","El pasadizo secreto está justo al lado de Stíling, en la sala cercana a Gamil Filik.\
\
Debes entrar en el pasadizo secreto para colarte por detrás del campamento de los trasgos."}},
[3988]={nameES="Deadly Delta Avanc",objectivesES={}},
[3989]={nameES="Deadly Rain in Cloudyhead Pass",objectivesES={}},
[3990]={nameES="Deadly Stillness",objectivesES={"Talk to Legolas in Rath Cail","Legolas can be found atop a small ridge overlooking Rath Cail.\
\
You have travelled into Rath Cail with Legolas and should now speak to him.","Deadly Stillness","Legolas fears that remaining still in Lhingris portends an ill fate, and so he hopes to move deeper into Rath Cail to continue his search for Ungwetári."}},
[3991]={nameES="Deadly Torrents",objectivesES={"Darkwater drawn from the river Blackroot by Azruthor threatens people throughout the vale and could soon wash over all of Gondor.","Deadly Torrents","Talk to Melril","Darkwater can be found in and along the river Blackroot in Tarlang's Crown\
\
Melril has asked you to quiet the waters of the Blackroot which have been roused by Azruthor in Tarlang's Crown.","DNT -- will not be seen","Melril can be found at the northern end of Tarlang's Crown in Blackroot Vale.\
\
You have quelled the darkwater and returned it to the river Blackroot. You should now speak to Melril."}},
[3992]={nameES="Deadly or Dead",objectivesES={"The Orc falls defeated!","Deadly or Dead","You signal the Orc that you are prepared.","At Captain Róglarg's urging, Shíkurz has assembled his warriors to be tested against your skill in combat.","Captain Róglarg's warriors can be found in the courtyard of Cirith Ungol.\
\
Shíkurz has asked you to test the warriors in Captain Róglarg's garrison. You are to challenge them and fight to the death.","Talk to Shíkurz in the courtyard of Cirith Ungol","Shíkurz can be found in the courtyard of Cirith Ungol.\
\
You have defeated many of Captain Róglarg's Orcs and should now return to Shíkurz."}},
[3993]={nameES="Dealing in Stealing",objectivesES={}},
[3994]={nameES="Tratando con Cuencasangre",objectivesES={"Completa la misión 'Asegurando el Agua'","Tratando con Cuencasangre","Completa la misión 'Botánica Mórbida'","Completa la misión 'Pelea en la Cuencasangre'","Habla con Deryn","Marget, Deryn y Murig pueden encontrarse cerca de la guarida de Huargos conocida como Cuencasangre.\
\
Ayuda a cada uno de los alumnos con su tarea.","Has ayudado a cada uno de los exploradores guerreros en entrenamiento y debes regresar a su campamento.\
\
Habla con Deryn","Deryn te hace señas para que hables con él","Eluna quiere presentarte a sus pupilos."}},
[3995]={nameES="Dealing with Itho",objectivesES={"Talk to Anath","Anath has asked you to meet Nekhama in Halrax.","While you were searching for Berkha, Itho arrived to try stealing one of Raghda-gûn's eggs for himself.\
\
Speak to Raghda-gûn's friends to discover the story of what transpired.","Talk to Nekhama in Halrax","The woman stands outside the pub looking impatient. She spots you, thrusts a letter into your hands, and returns inside. She does not invite you to follow her.\
\
The letter is written in shockingly beautiful handwriting:\
\
The would-be child thief has been dealt with. Before his demise, he mentioned the name of someone in Umbar who seeks rare 'animals' to own. If you find yourself in the city of Umbar, seek out Tatháta. She could be an ally in your hunt for this scoundrel.","Itho has arrived at Raghda-gûn's nest to take an egg for himself.","Dealing with Itho"}},
[3996]={nameES="Death From Above",objectivesES={}},
[3997]={nameES="Death From Below",objectivesES={"Talk to Vatnar to enter the cellars","Death From Below","Vatnar has detected a band of goblin-sappers digging a tunnel below the cellars of Thangúlhad. He and his brother Thyrnir intend to invade the goblin-tunnel and collapse it before they can undermine the tower's foundation.\
\
<rgb=#00ff00>WARNING: Death From Below is a high difficulty solo challenge quest. Beware, all who enter therein.</rgb>","Vatnar is at Thangúlhad in Gathbúrz.\
\
With the aid of Vatnar and Thyrnir, you have defeated the goblin-sappers and saved Thangúlhad. You should speak again with Vatnar.","Talk to Vatnar at Thangúlhad","Vatnar is at Thangúlhad in Gathbúrz.\
\
You should speak with Vatnar when your are ready to travel with him and Thyrnir to prevent the goblin-sappers from destroying Thangúlhad."}},
