[4056]={nameES="Muerte a los invasores",objectivesES={"Raskwith se encuentra en Mekhem-bizru, al noroeste de los campamentos orcos.\
\
Raskwith estará feliz de saber que los estandartes han sido plantados en los campamentos orcos.","Estandarte plantado en Athmadhul","Planta el estandarte en Uruk-gashan","Planta el estandarte en Athmadhul","Con sus comunicaciones cortadas, los orcos en el Valle del Arroyo Sombrío son ahora vulnerables. Los enanos desean demostrarles cuán indefensos son realmente.","Habla con Raskwith en Mekhem-bizru","Estandarte plantado en Uruk-gashan","Los campamentos orcos de Uruk-gashan, Drû-garmadh y Athmadhul se encuentran al sureste de Mekhem-bizru.\
\
Raskwith te ha pedido que vayas a los tres campamentos orcos del Valle del Arroyo Sombrío y plantes estandartes de enanos en cada uno, para mostrar a los orcos que el valle nunca les pertenecerá.","Muerte a los invasores","Estandarte plantado en Drû-garmadh","Planta el estandarte en Drû-garmadh"}},
[4057]={nameES="Muerte a las doncellas",objectivesES={"Habla con Oxi en Jazârgund","El paso a Zirakzigil se encuentra al oeste a través de los jardines, luego al norte.\
\
Folkath te ha instruido para que impidas que la expedición de Bogrian traiga de vuelta cualquier trofeo potencialmente valioso o peligroso de los restos del Balrog.","Usa el cuerno en el estandarte de Bogrian para invocarla y derrotarla","Oxi está en Jazârgund, al sur y al este de la entrada a Zirakzigil.\
\
Oxi espera tu regreso y confía en tu éxito.","Muerte a las doncellas","La bandera de Bogrian se encuentra entre el destacamento de merrevail en Zirakzigil.\
\
Se puede llamar a Bogrian fuera de su escondite usando las trompetas en su bandera para invocarla.","Bogrian ha huido a Zirakzigil con un destacamento de sus guardias personales para buscar la entrada a las Salas de los Espejos de Lumul-nar.","Has usado el cuerno para invocar a Bogrian, la reina de los merrevail","Bogrian ha caído ante ti"}},
[4058]={nameES="Death to the Reaper",objectivesES={"Wadel is encamped outside the walls of Thornhope.\
\
You should return to Wadel with news of your victory over Matumkâr.","Defeat Matumkâr","Defeated Matumkâr","Matumkâr will likely be found near Wadel's home in Thornhope.\
\
Wadel has asked you to kill Matumkâr, the Orc who led the band that murdererd his family.","Death to the Reaper","Wadel, the grieving father you rescued from the ruins of Thornhope, desires nothing but revenge against the monsters who murdered his family.","Talk to Wadel outside Thornhope"}},
[4059]={nameES="Death's Breath",objectivesES={"Death's Breath","Noxious cauldrons can be found across Azgh-buzru, especially among siege installations.\
\
Dréri has asked you to destroy noxious cauldrons at Azgh-buzru.","Talk to Dréri at Drenghól","Much to the horror of the Gabil'akkâ, Gorgar the Ruthless has discovered a means to spread strange, noxious fumes upon the war-fell of Azgh-buzru.","Dréri can be found at Drenghól in the War of Three Peaks.\
\
You have destroyed many noxious cauldrons at Azgh-buzru and impaired Gorgar's usage of this vile weaponry. You should report to Dréri at Drenghól."}},
[4060]={nameES="Debts Repaid",objectivesES={"After being ambushed by familiar warriors along their journey home, the Variags of Khand have found a new enemy in their old allies: the Khundolar.","A pair of Khundolar rush forth from the bush!","Jarl Gurthilm and his company can be found to the west of Henneth Annûn in North Ithilien.\
\
You have routed the Khundolar ambushers and uncovered their grisly handiwork. You should return to Jarl Gurthilm.","Search to the north of Jarl Gurthilm's company","Whether by beast or Man, this doe has been viciously mauled...","Search to the west of Jarl Gurthilm's company","Jarl Gurthilm and his company can be found to the west of Henneth Annûn in North Ithilien.\
\
Jarl Gurthilm has asked you to search the lands surrounding his company in hopes of routing more attacks by the Khundolar.","Debts Repaid","Talk to Jarl Gurthilm","This Variag lies slain and a blade of Easterling make protrudes from his chest...","Search to the east of Jarl Gurthilm's company"}},
[4061]={nameES="Debts and Axes",objectivesES={"Debts and Axes","The Rohirrim messenger Cadthorn and his companions were set upon by goblins as they were returning to Forthbrond with important messages from Edoras.","Ardwyn is at Forthbrond, south and east of the goblin-cave.\
\
Cadthorn asked you to bring the effects of the fallen Rohirrim to Ardwyn.","Talk to Ardwyn at Forthbrond","The cave mouth where the goblins may be found lies to the north of Cadthorn's position, along the ridge.\
\
Cadthorn has asked you to hunt down the goblins that attacked his party, drive them off, and recover his companions' stolen belongings."}},
[4062]={nameES="Deceptive Challenger",objectivesES={}},
[4063]={nameES="Deceptive Invitations",objectivesES={"Deceptive Invitations","Return to the sneaky hobbit at the Party Tree","The sneaky hobbit can be found near the Party Tree in the Shire.\
\
You should let the sneaky hobbit know that you have delivered all of the invitations.","Troublesome hobbits can be found around the Shire.\
\
A sneaky hobbit has asked you to deliver deceptive invitations to her troublesome neighbours.","A sneaky hobbit is looking for help delivering wedding invitations.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This quest will be removed from your quest log when the current festival ends.</rgb>"}},
[4064]={nameES="Decimate the Encampment",objectivesES={}},
[4065]={nameES="El desciframiento de la Lengua Negra",objectivesES={"Daervunn espera tu regreso en Esteldín.\
\
Mincham te devolvió las órdenes y te envió de vuelta con Daervunn junto con su informe.","Lleva el informe de Mincham a Daervunn","Pide a Mincham que traduzca las órdenes de los uruks","Una gran hueste de orcos atravesó Ram Dúath, expulsando a los hombres de las Quebradas del Norte de sus granjas. Esteldín, hogar de los pocos Dúnedain que quedan en el norte, se salvó de ser descubierta. Desde allí, los Montaraces comienzan a planear su contraofensiva contra la marea negra de Angmar.","Mincham tiene un pequeño campamento con vista al Camino Verde, justo al sur de los Campos de Fornost.\
\
Daervunn te devolvió las órdenes y te envió a hablar con Mincham, quien domina la Lengua Negra de Mordor, en su campamento junto a los Campos de Fornost en el oeste. Espera que Mincham pueda traducir las órdenes.","El desciframiento de la Lengua Negra"}},
[4066]={nameES="Descifrando el pergamino",objectivesES={"Un pergamino antiguo contiene lo que parece ser información vital que Rhiangar quiere. La habilidad de descifrar sus contenidos no está a su alcance, sin embargo.","Descifrando el pergamino","Melynis te ha sugerido que hables con Gerwyn mientras ella descifra el pergamino.\
\
Gerwyn se encuentra en la caravana en el norte de Cardolan.","Dale el pergamino a Melynis","Rhiangar te ha pedido que le lleves el pergamino a Melynis Bragreg.\
\
Melynis está en la caravana al sur de Andrath, en el norte de Cardolan.","Llévale el pergamino a Melynis"}},
[4067]={nameES="Deeds and Words",objectivesES={}},
[4068]={nameES="Secretos Profundos del Arte Rúnico",objectivesES={"Completa Tallando una Nueva Piedra","Habla con Elrond en Rivendel","Dardúr te ha enviado con Elrond el Medio Elfo, uno de los Sabios, para aprender los secretos profundos del arte rúnico.","Completa Una Prenda Digna","Dardúr está en Gondamon en Ered Luin.","Secretos Profundos del Arte Rúnico","La casa de Elrond se encuentra en el valle de Rivendel, en el Bosque de los Trolls.\
\
Dardúr te ha pedido que busques la guía de Elrond el Medio Elfo para que puedas aprender de él."}},
[4069]={nameES="Venganza Profunda",objectivesES={"Venganza Profunda","Eilig ha regresado a Aughaire.\
\
Nûlthauk está muerto, así que deberías volver con Eilig para contarle lo que has hecho.","Eilig y sus hermanos Machar y Torquil buscan venganza contra los orcos saqueadores que mataron a los suyos.","La cueva de los orcos está al norte de Aughaire, justo al este de Dûn Covád.\
\
Eilig te ha pedido que mates al cacique Ongburz, Nûlthauk, quien lideró a los orcos que mataron a los suyos."}},
[4070]={nameES="Deep-barrow: Bones of Sacrifice",objectivesES={}},
[4071]={nameES="Deep-barrow: Runes of Corruption",objectivesES={}},
[4072]={nameES="Deeper in the Well",objectivesES={"This stone seems to be the right size and shape","Acquire a large, smooth stone of the right size from outside Mushêndu's farm. Mushêndu's farm is located just outside Urmâkh to the north-west.","Remove the small stones clogging the drain-ways of the well.","Examine the well for signs of disrepair.","Use smooth stone on stuck rock inside Urmâkh well","Examine the well for signs of disrepair","Speak with Mushêndu in Urmâkh.","Deeper in the Well","Speak with Mushêndu in Urmâkh","Use the smooth stone to bash the stuck rock inside Urmâkh well back down.","Mushêndu, a local farmer, has asked for your help repairing the local well. He believes there may be something trapped inside it.","Speak to Mushêndu in Urmâkh about what to do next.","Ask Mushêndu in Urmâkh what you should do","Inexplicably this somehow worked - the well is running again","Examine the well once more","As you get closer to the well you see small stones trapped in the drain-ways","Find a large, smooth stone outside Mushêndu's farm","There is a large rock trapped further into the well","Examine the well once more."}},
[4073]={nameES="Las profundidades más hondas",objectivesES={"Sin que los enanos lo sepan, los Ghâsh-hai han enviado refuerzos para reforzar los campamentos orcos. Esperemos que no sea demasiado tarde para advertir a los enanos.","Las profundidades más hondas","Dirígete hacia Ânghumu-ru","Ânghumu-ru se encuentra al suroeste de Anazârmekhem.\
\
Deberías dirigirte hacia Ânghumu-ru y buscar allí a Feggi.","Feggi y sus enanos probablemente se encuentren en el oeste de Ânghumu-ru.\
\
Deberías buscar a Feggi y a sus enanos.","Busca a Feggi en Ânghumu-ru","Has encontrado Ânghumu-ru; ¡esperemos que el puesto avanzado de Feggi esté cerca!"}},
[4074]={nameES="Defacing the Town",objectivesES={"Speak with Hazâl near the dock in Halrax","You confronted the Corsair vandal, and after issuing a threat and attacking you, he ran when it was clear you would defeat him. Return to Hazâl and inform him that the vandal should no longer be a problem.","Defacing the Town","Find the Corsair vandal and ask him to stop","Hazâl asked that you search the south-eastern dock of Halrax for the vandal responsible for defacing the walls throughout the town.","You defeated Shamgar, and he ran from the town","Find the defaced walls throughout Halrax and clean them to restore their beauty.","Having cleaned the graffiti from the walls in town, you should return to Hazâl near her home by the docks in Halrax.","Speak with Hazâl near the docks in Halrax","Hazâl, appalled at the treatment of the buildings within the town, enlists your aid to remedy the situation."}},
[4075]={nameES="Defeat Darúk",objectivesES={"Defeat Darúk","Talk to Harchador at Mithechad","Destroyed Darúk's battle-standard","Destroy Darúk's battle-standard","Defeated Darúk","Darúk is at Ânghum-maudhûl to the east of Mithechad.\
\
Harchador has asked you to defeat Darúk and destroy his standard.","At the centre of Ânghum-maudhûl, the long-lived Darúk watches over his forces. This evil creature has served for many long years in the armies of Dol Guldur.","Harchador is at Mithechad, west of Ânghum-maudhûl.\
\
You should return to Harchador with news of your victory against Darúk."}},
[4076]={nameES="Derrota de los Señores de la Guerra -- Eregion",objectivesES={"La invasión de hoy ha terminado","Derrota de los Señores de la Guerra -- Eregion","Completa tu masacre antes de que termine la invasión de hoy","Se te ha ordenado derrotar a los Señores de la Guerra en Eregion.","Las fuerzas de la Corona de Hierro están invadiendo las tierras de los Pueblos Libres."}},
[4077]={nameES="Derrota a los Horrores de la Caverna",objectivesES={"Derrota a Gâdhûp o Brúllug en Sarnúr","Snár está en la Mansión de Thorin, al norte de Sarnúr, justo fuera del Cuartel de la Piedra Azul.\
\
Debes regresar con Snár y contarle tu victoria sobre los terrores de Sarnúr.","Gâdhûp y Brúllug pueden encontrarse en Sarnúr, al sur de la Mansión de Thorin, accediendo a través de las ruinas de Orodost.\
\
Snár te ha pedido que derrotes a Gâdhûp, el troll de las nieves, o a Brúllug, el dragonzuelo.","Habla con Snár en la Mansión de Thorin","Derrota a los Horrores de la Caverna","Muchas cosas malignas además de los Duramano habitan en lo profundo de Sarnúr... muchas de las cuales infunden terror incluso en el corazón de otros seres malvados.","Brúllug derrotado","Gâdhûp derrotado"}},
[4078]={nameES="Derrota el Calor",objectivesES={"Habla con Tansy Campotieso","Tansy Campotieso se encuentra en el Árbol de la Fiesta en la Comarca.\
\
Regresa con Tansy Campotieso.","Las olas de calor se encuentran cerca del Árbol de la Fiesta en la Comarca.\
\
Derrota las olas de calor.","Numerosos visitantes del Festival de Verano están sufriendo el intenso calor veraniego.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando finalice el evento con el que está asociada.</rgb>","Derrota el Calor"}},
[4079]={nameES="Derrota a los tenientes",objectivesES={"Derrota a los tenientes","Habla con Vagun en Anazârmekhem","Fil Gashan es el cuartel y punto de concentración de la invasión orca de Lothlórien. Oculto en lo más profundo de un paisaje ígneo y con una entrada adyacente a las Forjas de Khazad-dûm, los orcos se entrenan aquí bajo la atenta vigilancia del general Talug.","Fil Gashan se encuentra al suroeste de Anazârmekhem.\
\
Vagun cree que los orcos de Fil Gashan deben ser expulsados, y que al derrotar a los tenientes y tomar su equipo, podrías engañar a los demás orcos.","Vagun se encuentra en Anazârmekhem, al noreste de Fil Gashan.\
\
Has luchado a través de Fil Gashan y derrotado a los tenientes como se te pidió. Ahora deberías regresar a Vagun con tu informe."}},
[4080]={nameES="Defence at the Carrock",objectivesES={"Habla con Grimbeorn","Grimbeorn can be found at the Beorninghús in the Beorning-lands.\
\
You should talk to Grimbeorn.","The Carrock is under attack!","Gwaihir the Wind-lord can be found at the Eyrie.\
\
You should talk to Gwaihir.","Defence at the Carrock","Talk to Gwaihir the Wind-lord"}},
[4081]={nameES="Defence of Harwick: Rain of Arrows",objectivesES={"Approach an Easterling","The archers can hit your target","<rgb=#FF0000>Completing Aiding the Eastemnet will cancel this quest</rgb>","The archers of Harwick can focus their fire if you present them with a target.","Direct archers with your flag while defending Harwick.\
\
Wulfin has given you a flag you can use to direct the archers defending Harwick.","Wulfin is in Harwick.","Defence of Harwick: Rain of Arrows","Talk to Wulfin"}},
[4082]={nameES="Defence of Harwick: The Assault",objectivesES={"Easterlings have come across the river and are marching on Harwick.","<rgb=#FF0000>Completing Aiding the Eastemnet will cancel this quest</rgb>","The Easterlings are attacking Harwick.\
\
Wulfin has alerted you to the fact that Easterlings are about to descend upon Harwick.","Defence of Harwick: The Assault","Wulfin can be found in Harwick.\
\
Wulfin will be pleased to hear Harwick is secure.","Talk to Wulfin"}},
[4083]={nameES="Defence of Hoarhallow",objectivesES={}},
[4084]={nameES="Defence of Lugazag",objectivesES={}},
[4085]={nameES="Defence of Scylfig",objectivesES={"Thrymm has returned, and the time of the attack is nigh. Scylfig must brace itself for an assault by the White Hand Orcs.","Cyneberg is in the icy ruins of Scylfig.\
\
You should comfort Cyneberg after her great loss.","Thane Cynegar is in the Mead Hall of Scylfig.\
\
You should go to the Thane and tell him that the time for battle draws near.","Try to comfort Cyneberg","Speak with Thane Cynegar","Defence of Scylfig"}},
[4086]={nameES="Defensa del Poney Pisador",objectivesES={"Rechaza el primer asalto","El Segundo vigía Heathstraw está deseando comentar contigo el plan para proteger el Poney Pisador en los momentos previos al asalto.","<rgb=#FF0000>El fuego dentro del Poney Pisador lo ha consumido.</rgb>","<rgb=#00FF00>El segundo asalto ha sido rechazado. Tienes unos breves momentos para descansar</rgb>","<rgb=#00FF00>Goilag ha sido derrotado. Bree está a salvo</rgb>","Heathstraw debe sobrevivir a la batalla","El primer asalto ha sido rechazado, pero el enemigo no está vencido. Hay que mantener las defensas.","Rechaza el segundo asalto","<rgb=#FF0000>Heathstraw ha caído.</rgb>","Derrota a Goilag","El primer asalto ha comenzado. El Poney Pisador y quienes están dentro deben ser protegidos a toda costa.","El Poney Pisador debe sobrevivir a la batalla","Las fuerzas enemigas parecen débiles y agotadas. Sus números disminuyen.","Las mujeres y los niños de Bree se han atrincherado dentro de la posada del Poney Pisador. Los bandidos y maleantes que tomaron el pueblo quieren castigar a quienes se oponen a ellos.","Para que Bree sea de nuevo una ciudad libre, Goilag, el líder de los bandidos, debe ser derrotado.","<rgb=#00FF00>El tercer asalto ha sido rechazado. Goilag entra ahora en escena</rgb>","Rechaza el tercer asalto","<rgb=#00FF00>El primer asalto ha sido rechazado. Tienes unos momentos para descansar</rgb>","Defensa del Poney Pisador","Habla con el vigía adjunto Heathstraw"}},
[4087]={nameES="La Defensa del Poney Pisador - Incursión",objectivesES={"La Defensa del Poney Pisador - Incursión","Completa 'La Defensa del Poney Pisador' con un grupo de incursión","Las mujeres y los niños de Bree se han atrincherado dentro de la posada del Poney Pisador. Los bandidos y maleantes que tomaron el pueblo quieren castigar a quienes se oponen a ellos."}},
[4088]={nameES="Defence of Tirith Rhaw",objectivesES={}},
[4089]={nameES="Defence of Tol Ascarnen",objectivesES={"Stand with Lieutenant Solvi at Tol Ascarnen and defeat the enemy there.\
\
Lieutenant Solvi wants to prepare for battle and hold this all-important location out of the hands of the Enemy. If you succeed, speak with Solvi or if he or Tol Ascarnen falls into enemy hands, report to Captain-General Tordúr at Glân Vraig.","South of the falls of the Hoarwell River there stands a keep upon an island. This keep, once a seat of Rhudaur's strength within the Ettenmoors, long ago fell to ruin, but the vantage afforded at the top of the towers makes the location a strategic point within the Ettenmoors. It is for this reason that Lieutenant Solvi believes Angmar's army will strike at the location in an attempt to claim it for their own.","Report to Lieutenant Solvi at Tol Ascarnen if he stands and you control the location. If he has fallen or the enemy claimed the keep, return to Glân Vraig and speak with Captain-General Tordúr.\
\
The battle at Tol Ascarnen earned you victory over your foes.","Defence of Tol Ascarnen"}},
[4090]={nameES="Defence of Walstow: Eye of the Storm",objectivesES={"Waldeg is at Snowbourn.\
\
Waldeg will be pleased to hear that Walstow has been defended.","Walstow has been surrounded on all sides by an army of Orcs and trolls.","Talk to Waldeg","Defence of Walstow: Eye of the Storm","<rgb=#FF0000>Completing Aiding the Eastemnet will cancel this quest</rgb>","Orcs and trolls are attacking Walstow.\
\
Waldeg asked you to join in the defence of Walstow, protecting it from an army of Orcs and trolls."}},
[4091]={nameES="Defence of Walstow: Triage",objectivesES={"Defence of Walstow: Triage","Waldeg is at Snowbourn.\
\
Waldeg will be pleased to hear that you were able to treat the wounds of several injured Rohirrim.","Talk to Waldeg","Approach an injured soldier","<rgb=#FF0000>Completing Aiding the Eastemnet will cancel this quest</rgb>","Many Rohirrim have been injured defending Walstow from the Enemy.","Use your kit to start treating the soldier","Injured Rohirrim can be found in Walstow.\
\
Waldeg asked you to triage and treat the Rohirrim who have been injured defending Walstow.","Determine how to treat the soldier and do so"}},
[4092]={nameES="Defensa del Pozo Anciano",objectivesES={"Defiende a Arvunath de los Orcos que atacan","Tu misión es viajar al Pozo Anciano y ayudar a la erudita de Sul Madásh, Arvunath, mientras investiga las ruinas.","Defensa del Pozo Anciano","Habla con Arvunath","No escuchas a más Orcos acercándose. Arvunath puede continuar su investigación con seguridad","Escuchas a más Orcos acercándose"}},
[4093]={nameES="Defence of the Isendeep",objectivesES={"Mines provide the ore that is needed to build weapons and armour for the war. The Isendeep long ago stopped being a mine capable of great production, but there are still veins of ore within the stone there and this makes the location desirable to both the forces of Angmar and the Free Peoples.","Lieutenant Otur is within the Isendeep Mine.\
\
Lieutenant Otur asked for your assistance to help defend the Isendeep Mine against the forces of Angmar. If you succeed, speak with Otur or if he or the Isendeep falls into enemy hands, report to Captain-General Tordúr at Glân Vraig.","Lieutenant Otur is within the Isendeep Mine. If Otur has fallen or the Isendeep Mine is in the hands of the enemy, you can speak with Captain-General Tordúr at Glân Vraig in his stead.\
\
Through a hard fought battle, you defeated great number of the enemy within the Isendeep mine.","Defence of the Isendeep"}},
[4094]={nameES="Defence of the Lumber-camp",objectivesES={"Defence of the Lumber-camp","Once a harvesting location for the Hobbits of Hoarhallow, the Grimwood Lumber-camp now offers equipment for refining and preparing the wood needed to build palisades throughout the Ettenmoors. Lieutenant Swithulf knows that retribution will come in the form of an assault from Gramsfoot.","First Marshal Núrdram is at the Grimwood Lumber-camp. If Núrdram fell in battle or the Lumber-camp has fallen to the enemy, make your way to Glân Vraig and speak with Captain-General Tordúr.\
\
Though it was a hard-fought battle, you made your stand and have earned your reward.","Stay within the area of the Grimwood Lumber-camp and defeat the enemy out of Angmar.\
\
First Marshal Núrdam believes that the Free Peoples can achieve victory with your assistance at the Grimwood Lumber-camp and has asked that you stay and fight to defeat the foe when they come. If Ambeng or Lugazag falls, report to Captain-General Tordúr at Glân Vraig."}},
[4095]={nameES="Defence: Build a Gate at Lugazag",objectivesES={}},
[4096]={nameES="Defence: Build a Gate at Lugazag",objectivesES={"Orders are to collect items from around the Ettenmoors so that a gate can be constructed to keep the Free People out of Lugazag. Best get to it.","Materials delivered","Entrega los materiales a Dumûl en Lugazag","Defence: Build a Gate at Lugazag","Head out into the Ettenmoors and collect the materials needed to construct the gate that will seal the front of Lugazag tower."}},
[4097]={nameES="Defence: Build a Gate at Tiríth Rhaw",objectivesES={"Materials delivered","Entrega los materiales a Gaath en Tírith Rhaw","You are ordered to acquire materials needed to build a gate that will defend the exterior of Tiriíth Rhaw.","Defence: Build a Gate at Tiríth Rhaw","Make your way into the wilds of the Ettenmoors and collect the materials needed to construct the external gate."}},
[4098]={nameES="Defence: Exterior Gate Lugazag",objectivesES={"Regresa con Oswythe en Lugazag","Now that you have control of the tower of Lugazag, you must build a door to defend the exterior of the tower.","Defence: Exterior Gate Lugazag","Collect materials to build a gate to seal off the entrance of Lugazag. All the materials needed can be found in the wilds of the Ettenmoors."}},
[4099]={nameES="Defence: Exterior Gate Tiríth Rhaw",objectivesES={"Regresa con Haliggyr en Tírith Rhaw","Defence: Exterior Gate Tiríth Rhaw","Now that you have control of the tower of Tiríth Rhaw, you must build a door to defend the exterior of the tower.","Collect materials to build a gate to seal off the entrance of Tiríth Rhaw. All the materials needed can be found in the wilds of the Ettenmoors."}},
[4100]={nameES="Defence: Gate Atop Tiríth Rhaw",objectivesES={"It has been strongly recommended that you acquire materials needed to build a gate that will defend the interior of Tiriíth Rhaw.","Deliver the materials to Gozad at Tiríth Rhaw","Defence: Gate Atop Tiríth Rhaw","Make your way into the wilds of the Ettenmoors and collect the materials needed to construct the internal gate."}},
[4101]={nameES="Defence: Interior Door Lugazag",objectivesES={}},
[4102]={nameES="Defence: Interior Gate Tírith Rhaw",objectivesES={}},
[4103]={nameES="Defensa: Reforzar la Puerta en Lugazag",objectivesES={"Se te envía de nuevo a las tierras salvajes de las Landas de Etten para recolectar el material necesario para reforzar la puerta en Lugazag.","Adéntrate en las Landas de Etten y recolecta los materiales necesarios para reforzar la puerta en Lugazag.","Recolecta astillas de Grimwood","Entrega los materiales a Dumûl en Lugazag","Astillas de Grimwood recolectadas","Defensa: Reforzar la Puerta en Lugazag"}},
[4104]={nameES="Defensa: Reforzar la Puerta en Tírith Rhaw",objectivesES={"Se te envía de nuevo a las tierras salvajes de las Landas de Etten para recolectar el material necesario para reforzar la puerta en Tirith Rhaw.","Adéntrate en las Landas de Etten y recolecta los materiales necesarios para reforzar la puerta en Tírith Rhaw.","Entrega los materiales a Gaath en Tírith Rhaw","Recolecta astillas de Grimwood","Astillas de Grimwood recolectadas","Defensa: Reforzar la Puerta en Tírith Rhaw"}},
[4105]={nameES="Defensa: Reforzar la Puerta de Lugazag",objectivesES={"Regresa con Oswythe en Lugazag","Defensa: Reforzar la Puerta de Lugazag","Con Lugazag capturado y la puerta construida, se te pide que enfoques tu atención en mejorar la puerta para una defensa mayor.","Ayuda a reforzar aún más la fortaleza en Lugazag recolectando materiales para reforzar la puerta. Encontrarás todo lo que necesitas en las Landas de Etten."}},
[4106]={nameES="Defensa: Reforzar la Puerta de Tírith Rhaw",objectivesES={"Con Tírith Rhaw capturado y la puerta construida, se te pide que enfoques tu atención en mejorar la puerta para una defensa mayor.","Regresa con Haliggyr en Tírith Rhaw","Defensa: Reforzar la Puerta de Tírith Rhaw","Astilla de Grimwood recolectada","Recolecta astillas de Grimwood","Ayuda a reforzar aún más la fortaleza en Tírith Rhaw recolectando materiales para reforzar la puerta. Encontrarás todo lo que necesitas en las Landas de Etten."}},
[4107]={nameES="Defences for War",objectivesES={"Defences for War","Talk to Sigvith","Damaged barricades can be found throughout Zarkul-sulûn.\
\
Sigvith has asked you to repair barricades damaged in the siege of Zarkul-sulûn.","Sigvith can be found at Zarkul-sulûn.\
\
You have repaired many of the damaged barricades at Zarkul-sulûn. You should report back to Sigvith.","After winning a foothold at Zarkul-sulûn, the dwarves of the Gabil'akkâ must maintain a defence lest it fall back into the hands of the Orcs of Gundabad."}},
[4108]={nameES="Defend Us",objectivesES={}},
[4109]={nameES="Defend the Belegiant Bridge",objectivesES={"Melethon is at the Causeway Forts.\
\
You should speak to Melethon.","Stand your ground soldier","Melethon has tasked you with defending the Belegiant Bridge from enemy who is trying to retake it.","Speak with Melethon","Keep your post and defend the centre of the bridge","No seas derrotado","You have successfully defended the Belegiant Bridge","Defend the centre of the Belegiant Bridge","You have left the bridge unguarded","Defend the Belegiant Bridge","The Belegiant Bridge is located in centre of Osgiliath over the Anduin River.\
\
You should defend the centre of the Belegiant Bridge.","The Belegiant Bridge is located in the centre of Osgiliath over the Anduin River.\
\
You should keep your post and defend the centre of the Belegiant Bridge.","Do not leave the centre of the bridge"}},
[4110]={nameES="Defend the Eastern Guardpost",objectivesES={"Talk to Guard Cai at the eastern guardpost","Defend the Eastern Guardpost","Move the rocks to enlist the aid of the Old Tree","Boulders can be found near the roots of the Tree.\
\
Guard Cai has asked you to move the boulders near the crebain so the Tree can help you defeat them.","Guard Cai is at the eastern guardpost of the Pristine Glade.\
\
The craban-spies are redoubling their efforts. You should speak with Guard Cai again and find out what can be done to stop them.","You have arrived at the eastern guardpost in time to defend it from attack."}},
[4111]={nameES="Defend the Ornendil Bridge",objectivesES={"Stand your ground soldier","You have successfully defended the Ornendil Bridge","Keep your post and defend the centre of the bridge","No seas derrotado","Defend the centre of the Ornendil Bridge","You have left the bridge unguarded","Edenos has tasked you with defending the Ornendil Bridge from enemy who is trying to retake it.","Defend the Ornendil Bridge","Do not leave the centre of the bridge","The Ornendil Bridge is located in Northern Osgiliath over the Anduin River.\
\
You should defend the centre of the Ornendil Bridge.","Speak with Edenos","Edenos is at the Palace of Eldacar.\
\
You should speak to Edenos.","The Ornendil Bridge is located in Northern Osgiliath over the Anduin River.\
\
You should keep your post and defend the centre of the Ornendil Bridge."}},
[4112]={nameES="Defiende el río",objectivesES={"Defiende el río","Los Orcos avanzan hacia el sur por un afluente al sur de Maurûsh a lo largo del río. Tienen la intención de envenenarlo, y debes detenerlos.","Tu misión es viajar al río cerca de Maurûsh y detener a los Orcos allí antes de que envenenen el afluente."}},
[4113]={nameES="Defend the Southern Guardpost",objectivesES={"Guard Edrud is at the southern guardpost of the Pristine Glade.\
\
The half-orcs are redoubling their efforts. You should speak with Guard Edrud again and find out what can be done to stop them.","Defend the Southern Guardpost","You have done all you can to stop the attack","Talk to Guard Edrud at the southern guardpost","Half-orcs are attacking the southern guardpost from the west.\
\
Guard Edrud has asked you to defend the southern guardpost with his guards.","Defend the southern guardpost from half-orcs","You have arrived at the southern guardpost in time to defend it from attack."}},
[4114]={nameES="Defend the Western Guardpost",objectivesES={"Do not let a torch-bearer reach the Tree","Guard Ambras is at the western guardpost of the Pristine Glade.\
\
Guard Ambras has asked you to stop all the torch-bearers from reaching the Tree.","You have done all you can to stop the Uruk-hai","You arrived at the western guardpost in time to defend it from attack.","Defend the western guardpost from the Uruk-hai","A torch-bearer has reached the Tree","Talk to Guard Ambras at the western guardpost","Defend the Western Guardpost","Guard Ambras is at the western guardpost of the Pristine Glade.\
\
The Uruk-hai are re-doubling their efforts. You should speak with Guard Ambras again and find out what can be done to stop them."}},
[4115]={nameES="Defender of the Vale",objectivesES={"Find and speak with Arvaethor","Arvaethor can be found near a pillaged lumber camp south-east of the village of Ethring.\
\
You should find and speak with Arvaethor.","Defender of the Vale","Candúr, the town guard, asks you to find and aid Borhador's son, Arvaethor, who alone protects the Vale."}},
[4116]={nameES="Defensores de la Tierra Negra",objectivesES={"Defensores de la Tierra Negra","Entrega un barril de armaduras al capitán Uruk de la guarnición.","Estás destinado a servir mediante el trabajo al Señor Oscuro.","Entrega un barril de lanzas al capitán Uruk de la guarnición","Entrega un barril de espadas al capitán Uruk de la guarnición","El capitán Uruk de la guarnición puede encontrarse en las mazmorras de Barad-dûr.","Las armas y armaduras forjadas por los Hachetón abastecen a las guarniciones que vigilan la Tierra Negra de Mordor."}},
[4117]={nameES="Defenders of the Fortress",objectivesES={"You have found the first general, Coldbear","Drugoth the Death-monger has relocated from the Misty Mountains and made his new home in the largest glacier in the Icebay of Forochel.  Now, his mad, rambling mind is planning an attack on Annúminas to the south.\
\
Drugoth has fled to the summit of Sâri-surma. Confront him, and put an end to his malicious plans.","Defeat the first general, Coldbear","You have defeated Osan","Drugoth the Death-monger has relocated from the Misty Mountains and made his new home in the largest glacier in the Icebay of Forochel.  Now, his mad, rambling mind is planning an attack on Annúminas to the south. You must stop this attack before it happens by killing Drugoth and both of his generals.","You must stop the attack on Annúminas before it happens by killing Drugoth and both of his generals.\
\
You have discovered the first general, Coldbear. The creature must be defeated if you are to ascend the path to Drugoth.","You have defeated Coldbear, the first general","Defeat Drugoth the Death-monger","Locate the first general of Sâri-surma","Drugoth has gathered his lieutenants and generals to the fortress on Sâri-surma. You must kill his generals so that they may not send evil spreading across the south.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>This quest will be cancelled if you leave Sâri-surma before completing it.</rgb>","Coldbear has been defeated, but the second general still awaits battle within the fortress. You will likely encounter the final general on your way to Drugoth.","You must stop the attack on Annúminas before it happens by killing Drugoth and both of his generals.\
\
You have discovered the second general, Osan. The giant and his minions will attempt to block your path, preventing you from confronting Drugoth.","You have found the second general, Osan","Defeat the second general, Osan","Locate the second general of Sâri-surma","Defenders of the Fortress","You have defeated Drugoth the Death-monger"}},
[4118]={nameES="Defending Crithost",objectivesES={}},
[4119]={nameES="Defending Mûr Ghala (Weekly)",objectivesES={}},
[4120]={nameES="Defending Sul Madásh",objectivesES={}},
[4121]={nameES="Defending That Which is Not Theirs",objectivesES={}},
[4122]={nameES="Defendiendo la catapulta",objectivesES={"Defendiendo la catapulta","Habla con Cudhaer cerca del Coloso","Cudhaer está en el risco que domina el Coloso desde el sur.\
\
Cudhaer estará complacido de escuchar que los exploradores han sido dispersados y su posición es segura.","Cudhaer está ocupado reparando la catapulta, un proceso delicado y que requiere tiempo.","Los exploradores se encuentran en las arboledas al suroeste y sureste del risco sobre el Coloso.\
\
Cudhaer te ha pedido que termines con varios exploradores mientras repara la catapulta.","Sardan está en el Coloso, al norte del risco de la catapulta.\
\
Sardan querrá saber que la catapulta está reparada y lista para disparar."}},
[4123]={nameES="Defending the Farmstead",objectivesES={"Talk to Randgar","Secure the farm gate","The farm gate has been secured","Randgar has refused to leave his home, at the risk of being killed by Orcs or Uruks. His home is under continuous assault, but he perseveres for the chance to be with the woman he loves.","Defending the Farmstead","Randgar lives on a small farm, south and east of Cliving, along the road.\
\
Randgar awaits outside his home for news that the constant Orc-menace has been put to an end.","Randgar's farm is south and east of Cliving, along the road. The gate is just outside the small home.\
\
Randgar has asked you to secure the gates to his farmstead, but to be wary of assaults from Orcs."}},
[4124]={nameES="Defending the Floodfells",objectivesES={}},
[4125]={nameES="Defendiendo el rebaño",objectivesES={"Defendiendo el rebaño","Tus ataques a los orcos en los campos de Gatson han provocado la ira de sus compañeros. Gatson espera un ataque en cualquier momento.","Gatson está en su granja, al norte de los campos donde pasta su rebaño.\
\
Tú y Alwin lograron detener el ataque de los orcos al rebaño de Gatson. Deberías regresar a la granja y contárselo a Gatson.","Alwin, el hombre de Gatson, está con el rebaño al sur de la granja.\
\
Gatson te ha pedido que ayudes a su trabajador Alwin a defender el rebaño de los orcos merodeadores. Asegúrate de que ni Alwin ni el rebaño sufran daño.","Los orcos han sido expulsados","Habla con Alwin, el trabajador de la granja de Gatson"}},
[4126]={nameES="Defending the Shielded Citadel",objectivesES={"The stairs are under attack!","Imrêkh-guthlu must be defended!","Lóssi can be found at Imrêkh-guthlu in Máttugard.\
\
You should talk to Lóssi.","Imrêkh-guthlu can be found in the southern reaches of Máttugard, near Deepscrave.\
\
You should travel to Imrêkh-guthlu.","Defending the Shielded Citadel","The bridge is under attack!","Travel to Imrêkh-guthlu","Talk to Hetbrúda at Imrêkh-guthlu","Talk to Lóssi","Hetbrúda can be found at Imrêkh-guthlu in Máttugard.\
\
You should talk to Hetbrúda.","The dwarf-outpost of Imrêkh-guthlu borders the heavily-fortified Orc stronghold of Deepscrave in Gundabad.","Imrêkh-guthlu can be found in the southern reaches of Máttugard, near Deepscrave.\
\
You should defend Imrêkh-guthlu.","Hetbrúda has spoken to the dwarves at Imrêkh-guthlu and now wishes to speak with you"}},
[4127]={nameES="Defending the Southern Rammas",objectivesES={}},
[4128]={nameES="Defending the Umbar-môkh (Weekly)",objectivesES={}},
[4129]={nameES="Defensive Damage",objectivesES={}},
[4130]={nameES="Defiled Supplies",objectivesES={}},
[4131]={nameES="Defilers in the Water",objectivesES={"Defilers in the Water","Orc Defilers have begun calling forth the turbulent spirits of those unfortunate enough to have perished within the Deep at battles long past. If they are allowed to continue their summons, the Rohirrim in the water mill may find themselves besieged by a rather unexpected adversary.\
\
Merit Rating\
\
This quest starts with <rgb=#FFFF00>Full</rgb> Merit Rating\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Major Merit Loss:</rgb>\
* Summoned darkwater spirit escapes the pond\
* Darkwater spirit enters the water-mill\
\
<rgb=#00FF00>Minor Merit Gain:</rgb>\
* Darkwater escaped from the pond is defeated","White Hand defilers have gathered around the pond in the Deeping Coomb and are attempting to call forth disturbed spirits to assail the Rohirrim. Defeating the defilers will end the foul ritual, but the spirits will need to be dealt with once they have been called forth."}},
[4132]={nameES="Definir lo Desconocido",objectivesES={"Has recogido una muestra de cristal","Has recogido una muestra fúngica","Lleva los materiales a Hethuwen en el Refugio Sombrío","Has recogido un saco de veneno de grodbog","Recoge un saco de veneno","Los orcos infectados pueden encontrarse al sur del Refugio Sombrío. Los fragmentos de cristal pueden hallarse en la Fosa Colmilluda, en la Camino de Durin, al noreste. Los gredbyg venenosos pueden encontrarse en las Vetas del Cuerno Rojo, al oeste del Refugio Sombrío.\
\
Hethuwen te ha pedido que le lleves una muestra fúngica de los orcos en las Fundaciones de Piedra, un cristal de la Fosa Colmilluda y un saco de veneno de uno de los gredbyg de los Filones del Cuerno Rojo.","Has recogido un saco de veneno","Recoge una muestra de cristal","El Refugio Sombrío se encuentra en las Fundaciones de Piedra, en el sudeste de Moria.\
\
Debes regresar con las muestras reunidas y entregárselas a Hethuwen en el Refugio Sombrío.","Recoge un saco de veneno de grodbog","Definir lo Desconocido","Recoge una muestra fúngica","Hethuwen carece de los componentes que necesita para estudiar a fondo el contenido del extraño envío que recibió de Hasta."}},
[4133]={nameES="Defusing Destruction",objectivesES={}},
[4134]={nameES="Defusing the Situation",objectivesES={}},
[4135]={nameES="Desafiando toda descripción",objectivesES={"Bingo está en el exterior de la casa de Tom Bombadil, en el Bosque Viejo.\
\
Has intentado averiguar más sobre Tom Bombadil, pero al misterioso individuo no parece gustarle dar explicaciones.","Tom Bombadil está en su casa al este del Viejo Hombre Suace.\
\
Has bailado con el Viejo Hombre Sauce, como Tom pidió.","Desafiando toda descripción","Baya de Oro puede haberte dado la respuesta que Bingo estaba buscando, y deberías ahora volver con el hobbit para ver si está de acuerdo.","Los ojos de Tom brillan y su voz es risueña","Habla con Baya de Oro en la casa de Tom Bombadil o junto a su manantial","Bailes, y por un momento sientes una sensación de bienvenida. Luego se va.","Bingo te entrega las páginas de su manuscrito","Te invade una sensación de incomodidad. ¿Tom realmente quiere que bailes aquí?","Te colocaste en la cascada como Tom sugirió, y ahora deberías darte cuenta de qué se supone que tendrías que haber aprendido de la experiencia.","Tom toma el manuscrito y pasa sus manos por las páginas.\
\
'¡Qué maravilla! Estas hojas, todas cubiertas de palabras, escritas con cuidado. Puedo sentir las letras bajo mis dedos, ¡la tinta seca y los pensamientos guardados! Esa no es la forma de hacer las cosas de Tom, pero hay alegría en recordar. Estas páginas son como una canción cantada por la mañana pero llevada por el viento hasta la tarde, cuando podría ser escuchada de nuevo.\
\
'Me encanta la sensación de estas páginas y sus pequeñas palabras. Déjame sentarme con ellas un rato, y tú habla con la hija del río. Baya de Oro ha regresado de su manantial, ¡y es más hermosa y encantadora que cuando se fue!'","Colócate en la espuma de la cascada al sur de la casa de Tom","Encuentra el Viejo Hombre Sauce, al oeste de la casa de Tom Bombadil","Habla con Tom Bombadil","Habla con Bingo fuera de la casa de Tom Bombadil","Bingo te ha pedido que le enseñes su manuscrito a Tom Bombadil en un esfuerzo para hacer que el misterioso individuo se sincere sobre su historia y origen.","Habla con Tom Bombadil, y pregúntale sobre él mismo","Tom Bombadil te ha pedido que permanezcas bajo la espuma de la cascada al sur de su casa si quieres saber sobre él.","Bingo no está seguro sobre cómo describir a Tom Bombadil en su diario de viaje, y te ha pedido que vayas directamente a hacerle algunas preguntas.","El Viejo Hombre Sauce está hacia el oeste siguiendo el Tornasauce, al oeste de la casa de Tom Bombadil.\
\
Tom Bombadil te ha pedido que bailes con el Viejo Hombre Sauce si quieres saber lo que es preocuparse por las mismas cosas que Tom.","Lleva el manuscrito de Bingo a Tom Bombadil para que lo revise","Los ojos de Tom brillan, pero claramente ya no quiere responder más preguntas","Bingo se enfrenta ahora al primer desafío real de su viaje: ¡encontrar una descripción para Tom Bombadil para su diario de aventuras!","Baya de Oro ha regresado de su manantial. Durante el día se la puede encontrar en el interior de la casa de Tom Bombadil, y de noche le gusta pasear por los alrededores.\
\
Tom te ha dicho que deberías hablar con Baya de Oro mientras examina el manuscrito de Bingo."}},
[4136]={nameES="Dehêbix Speaks For The Community",objectivesES={}},
[4137]={nameES="Respuesta retrasada",objectivesES={"Bueno... ¿a la tercera va la vencida?","La amiga de Lassa, Clotilde, no se ha presentado para su té semanal.","A primera vista, Clotilde no parece estar en casa.\
\
Intenta llamar a la puerta.","Espera a que Clotilde abra la puerta","Encuentra la casa de Clotilde en Gamwich","Es posible que Clotilde no te haya oído llamar.\
\
Inténtalo de nuevo.","Respuesta retrasada","Desde el interior de la casa, alguien grita: '¡Vete!'","Llama a la puerta de Clotilde","Sin respuesta...","Debes encontrar la casa de Clotilde en Gamwich.\
\
Está frente a la posada de la Aljaba Repleta.","Deberías esperar a ver Clotilde abre la puerta.","Hay alguien en casa... seguramente Clotilde.\
\
Intenta hablar con ella a través de la puerta.","La casa está completamente en silencio...","Todavía no hay respuesta...","Habla con Clotilde"}},
[4138]={nameES="Delayed Supplies",objectivesES={"Delayed Supplies","Brifard is concerned that the servant he was escorting has not returned yet.","Brifard is at his camp to the north-east.\
\
Having found the remains of the servant, you should return to Brifard.","Brifard mentioned that the servant was gathering reeds along the shore of the Great River to the north-east.\
\
Brifard wants you to investigate the river's edge and find out what is taking the servant so long.","Talk to Brifard","Search for the missing Rohirrim servant","You have found what remains of the servant"}},
[4139]={nameES="Delayed and Deserted",objectivesES={"Talk to Glassiel","Delayed and Deserted","Talk to Irodon","Talk to Gorhir","Irodon, Gorhir, and various supplies can be found within Halach in south-eastern Upper Lebennin.\
\
Glassiel has asked for your aid in helping the folk of Halach rebuild after the latest Haradrim assault.","Determined to endure the assaults of the Haradrim, the folk of Halach seek your aid in rebuilding and pushing back the Enemy.","Glassiel can be found in the centre of the ruins of Halach in south-eastern Upper Lebennin.\
\
You have aided in gathering and unpacking the goods of the remaining folk of Halach, and should now return to Glassiel."}},
[4140]={nameES="Retrasar la ayuda",objectivesES={"Un mensajero de Barad Morlas ha llegado hasta los semiorcos en Târ Stazg, advirtiéndoles de la presencia de los elfos en Eregion.","Habla con Palanaer en Echad Dúnnan","Palanaer se encuentra en Echad Dúnann, al suroeste de Târ Stazg.\
\
Deberías regresar con Palanaer y contarle sobre la derrota de los semiorcos.","Târ Stazg se encuentra al noreste de Echad Dúnann, en las montañas, antes de la Puerta del Cuerno Rojo.\
\
Palanaer te ha pedido que viajes a Târ Stazg y derrotes a los semiorcos antes de que puedan reforzar Barad Morlas.","Retrasar la ayuda"}},
[4141]={nameES="Delaying the Inevitable",objectivesES={}},
[4142]={nameES="Delaying the Siege",objectivesES={"Ingold has seen the erection of siege machines by Sauron's forces. He hopes that by sabotaging this equipment it will delay the enemy as they prepare for war.","Speak with Ingold","Siege equipment can be found in the northern section of Pelennor Fields.\
\
You should sabotage siege equipment.","Ingold can be found at the North-gate of the Rammas.\
\
You should speak with Ingold.","Delaying the Siege"}},
[4143]={nameES="Delicious Crawler Meat",objectivesES={}},
[4144]={nameES="Delivering Justice",objectivesES={"Talk to Andur","Tibira has asked you to deal with the bandits that have placed a barricade along the road west of Western Khanâg. One of the bandits surrendered and has agreed to meet you outside of Western Khanâg, near the southern gate.","Tibira has asked you to deal with the bandits that have placed a barricade along the road west of Western Khanâg. One of the bandits is surrendering. You should talk to him.","Tibira told you of bandits robbing travellers on the road and asked for your help.","These must be the bandits of which Tibira spoke","Meet Andur near the gate to Western Khanâg","Delivering Justice","Talk to the Khûdi bandit","Tibira has asked you to deal with the bandits that have placed a barricade along the road west of Western Khanâg.","Locate the bandits hindering travellers","Tibira has asked you to deal with the bandits that have placed a barricade along the road west of Western Khanâg. One of the bandits surrendered and has agreed to meet you outside of Western Khanâg, near the southern gate. You should talk to him.","Tibira has asked you to deal with the bandits that have placed a barricade along the road west of Western Khanâg. One of the bandits surrendered and has entered Western Khanâg, promising to do only honest work. You should return to Tibira and talk to her.","Talk to Tibira"}},
[4145]={nameES="Delivering New Orders",objectivesES={"As you hand over the orders, the guard opens the note and begins to read.\
\
'What's this business? They don't think we can handle things around here, and now they're sending more guards to the docks?'","As you hand over the orders, the guard opens the note and begins to read.\
\
'All right, I understand.'","As you hand over the orders, the guard opens the note and begins to read.\
\
'Looks like we will have to get these ships ready for a lot of folk. The harbour-master isn't going to be too pleased about this!'","Lorvegil is located in the market east of Tol Ciryarani.\
\
You should speak with Lorvegil.","Talk to Lorvegil","In his preparation to help evacuate the city, Lorvegil has asked you to deliver new orders to the nearby troops stationed in Pelargir.","DNT - Not Used","Delivering New Orders","As you hand over the orders, the guard opens the note and begins to read.\
\
'Uh, won't this leave certain areas of the city a little vulnerable? I know the Corsairs are gone, but there's still plenty of threats from within the city.'","As you hand over the orders, the guard opens the note and begins to read.\
\
'Thank goodness. I'll be happy to leave this area. If you listen you can hear those crooks and thieves from the across the bridge, plotting and yelling. They're looking forward to taking over more of the city.'","The guards can be found in the areas surrounding the market and shipyard.\
\
You should deliver new orders to the guards.","As you hand over the orders, the guard opens the note and begins to read.\
\
'Well, all right then. It sounds like those men at the docks could use a hand or two, anyway.'","As you hand over the orders, the guard opens the note and begins to read.\
\
'This has me a little worried. Why would they pull people away from one of the only places where there is still a threat to watch over? Oh well, I suppose that our leaders know best.'","As you hand over the orders, the guard opens the note and begins to read.\
\
'Finally, I get something to do! There's nothing here but ruined streets. Why do they have us guarding it, anyway?'"}},
[4146]={nameES="Delivering Vengeance",objectivesES={"You should defeat jackals in Khûd Zagin in an effort to prevent further tragedies, such as the one Shalâra has suffered.","Delivering Vengeance","Talk to Shalâra in Western Khanâg","You have defeated jackals in Khûd Zagin in an effort to prevent further tragedies, such as the one Shalâra has suffered. You should return to Shalâra in Western Khanâg.","Shalâra has told you that jackals killed her baby. Following a short discussion, you have offered to cull the jackal population to a more reasonable number."}},
[4147]={nameES="Delivering War Orders",objectivesES={"Náin the Slakeless, Lord of the Iron Hills, has taken charge of Zarkul-sulûn with hopes of steering the dwarves to victory.","Delivering War Orders","Zhélruka Soldiers can be found at Zarkul-sulûn.\
\
You should deliver Náin the Slakeless's war orders to the Zhélruka Soldiers."}},
[4148]={nameES="Entrega de tartas",objectivesES={"Entrega de tartas","Las mesas para las tartas están en el mercado agrícola de la Granja de Cotonorte.\
\
Las tartas están calientes y huelen deliciosamente. Deben ser entregadas en las mesas del recinto del mercado.","Pon las tartas en las mesas","Habla con Albin Cotonorte","Albin Cotonorte está en el mercado agrícola de la Granja de Cotonorte.\
\
Albin Cotonorte querrá saber que las tartas están listas para el mercado.","Las tartas están recién horneadas y listas para ser entregadas."}},
[4149]={nameES="Delivery to Melgobas",objectivesES={"Harthel in Melgobas awaits his family's return.","Delivery to Melgobas","Talk to Harthel","You've fed every stray cat you could find in Melgobas.\
\
You should talk to Harthel.","Talk to Harthel at Melgobas","Sadrech has asked you to bring the ox parts to her husband, Harthel, in Melgobas.\
\
Melgobas can be found west of her camp.","Harthel has given you a bucket of offal to feed to the stray cats around Melgobas."}},
[4150]={nameES="Entrega para Meregrot Nortuk",objectivesES={"Recoge la cesta de picnic","Lleva la cesta a Meregrot","Coloca la cesta de picnic en la manta","Meregrot está sentada cerca del río, al sureste de Quiebra Larga.\
\
Meregrot Nortuk te ha pedido que coloques la cesta de picnic en la manta junto a ella.","Agobiada por sus deberes, Rosalinda Nortuk no puede llevar el almuerzo a su anciana madre, Meregrot.","La cesta de picnic está junto a Rosalinda Nortuk en Quiebra Larga.\
\
Rosalinda te ha pedido que le lleves una cesta de picnic a su madre Meregrot.","Entrega para Meregrot Nortuk","Meregrot está sentada junto al río, al sureste de Quiebra Larga.\
\
Rosalinda te ha pedido que lleves una cesta de comida a su madre, Meregrot.","Meregrot sonríe cuando colocas la cesta"}},
[4151]={nameES="Delivery to Ost Lontir",objectivesES={"Delivery to Ost Lontir","Talk to Gilanor in Ost Lontir","Gilanor can be found in Ost Lontir, to the west of Tadrent.\
\
You should deliver these supplies to him.","Bruidis has asked you to deliver supplies to the people of Ost Lontir."}},
[4152]={nameES="Deluches",objectivesES={"Deluches se ha escapado","Deluches","Gautar está de vuelta en Valleoscuro, al norte y un poco al este del santuario de Deluches.\
\
No pudiste derrotar al terrible capitán de los espíritus, Deluches, por lo que los espíritus crueles no pudieron ser desterrados. Debes regresar a Gautar y informarle de estos acontecimientos.","El santuario de los espíritus crueles se encuentra en un islote, en un pequeño estanque en la parte sur de Imlad Balchorth, al sur y un poco al oeste de Valleoscuro.\
\
Gautar te ha pedido que vayas al santuario de los espíritus crueles en Imlad Balchorth. El santuario se puede reconocer como una gran punta de hierro, una característica común de las obras de los Angmarim que podría hacer que el santuario sea difícil de encontrar.","Gautar examinó los símbolos que recuperaste de los espíritus crueles y descubrió que llevaban signos de Angmar, algo que podría estar vinculando a los espíritus al mundo mortal. También había un nombre escrito en ellos: Deluches.","Invoca y derrota a los espíritus en el santuario del sur"}},
[4153]={nameES="Deluros de Rivendel",objectivesES={"Deluros de Rivendel","Lleva fragmentos de reliquia a Deluros","El erudito Deluros está en la biblioteca de la Casa de Elrond en Rivendel.\
\
Glorenglir te ha pedido que lleves a Deluros los fragmentos de reliquia que recuperaste de los acechadores de nieve de las Montañas Nubladas, con la esperanza de que él reconozca que está lista para avanzar como erudita.","Glorenglir creía que los acechadores de nieve podían usarse para desenterrar fragmentos de historia de las nieves de las Montañas Nubladas, y has demostrado que tenía razón."}},
[4154]={nameES="Profundiza Más (Semanal)",objectivesES={"Al internarse profundamente en el mundo, se ha convocado a valientes aventureros para rechazar la oscuridad en toda la Tierra Media.","Profundiza Más (Semanal)","Has completado muchas excavaciones por toda la Tierra Media y has logrado rechazar la oscuridad que avanzaba.","Completado","Completa 15 excavaciones en cualquier dificultad."}},
[4155]={nameES="Profundiza al Máximo (Semanal)",objectivesES={"Has completado muchas excavaciones difíciles por toda la Tierra Media y has logrado rechazar la oscuridad que avanza.","Al adentrarse en los rincones más oscuros del mundo, se ha convocado a valientes aventureros para rechazar la oscuridad en toda la Tierra Media.","Profundiza al Máximo (Semanal)","Completado"}},
[4156]={nameES="Profundiza en la Oscuridad (Semanal)",objectivesES={"Has completado muchas excavaciones difíciles por toda la Tierra Media y has logrado rechazar la oscuridad que avanza.","Profundiza en la Oscuridad (Semanal)","Al internarse profundamente en el mundo, se ha convocado a valientes aventureros para rechazar la oscuridad en toda la Tierra Media.","Completa 10 excavaciones de alto nivel en la Tierra Media (nivel 6 y superior).","Completado"}},
[4157]={nameES="Delvings Allowance",objectivesES={}},
[4158]={nameES="La Flecha Extraviada de Delyth",objectivesES={"Deberías llevar la flecha limpia a Delyth\
\
Delyth está en Clegur","La flecha está cubierta de baba viscosa, pero por lo demás está intacta","Lograste recuperar la flecha de Delyth, pero está bastante estropeada. Te ha pedido que la enjuagues en el río cercano\
\
El río se encuentra junto a Clegur","Busca la flecha perdida","Una flecha extraviada fue a parar a un avanc furioso.","Aquí hay huellas en el barro","La Flecha Extraviada de Delyth","Algún gran reptil hizo estas huellas","Delyth Saethur te ha pedido que recuperes su flecha perdida\
\
La flecha se perdió en Clegur","Sigue el rastro","La flecha se ve, y se siente, mucho mejor","Lleva la flecha limpia a Delyth","Deberías llevar la flecha a Delyth Saethur.\
\
Delyth está en Clegur.","Enjuaga la flecha","Dale la flecha a Delyth","Mientras buscabas la flecha perdida de Delyth Saethur, te encontraste con grandes huellas reptilianas. Deberías seguir las huellas y enfrentar a la criatura que robó la flecha."}},
[4159]={nameES="Demand Absent Supply",objectivesES={}},
[4160]={nameES="Demanding Supply",objectivesES={"You have recovered many of the crops pillaged by the Uruks near Entwade. With these renewed supplies, Entwade will have the rations necessary to hold through the impending assault.","Uruks of the White Hand encroach ever closer on the settlements of Kingstead, aiming to starve or slay any in their path.","You have recovered many crates of Kingstead crops and should now prepare to return them to Entwade.","Completado","You must gather more crates of crops before returning to Entwade.","Amid the wreckage along the road to Middlemead, you have discovered a crate of crops from Kingstead that withstood the Uruk assault. If more crates remain intact, such supplies would be of great value to the warriors of Entwade in their preparation for the coming assault.","Demanding Supply","Crates of Kingstead crops can be found along the road to Middlemead in eastern Kingstead.\
\
You have discovered a crate of crops that has survived the Uruk onslaught. You should recover as many as you can to aid the forces at Entwade."}},
[4161]={nameES="Demon-spawn",objectivesES={"Demon-spawn","Talk to Amal at the Woodman camp in the Rushgore","Amal is at the Woodman camp in the Rushgore, south-east of the avanc breeding grounds.\
\
You should return to Amal with news of your success.","Avanc-nests can be found at their breeding grounds, north-west of the Woodman camp in the Rushgore.\
\
Amal has asked you to destroy the avanc-nests in hopes of driving the creatures from the shores of the Limlight.","The avanc-nests along the Limlight have become a danger to those travelling south from Mirkwood."}},
[4162]={nameES="Demons of the Rushgore",objectivesES={}},
[4163]={nameES="Guarida de Pughlak",objectivesES={"Completed 'Den of Pughlak'","Complete 'Den of Pughlak' on any difficulty.\
\
Use the Instance Finder to enter the Den of Pughlak.","Influenced goblins can be found in northern Gloomingtarn.\
\
You should defeat influenced goblins.","This cavern appears to go very deep underground","Further explore where the influenced goblins are camped","A group of goblins in Gloomingtarn has been seen acting in a very peculiar way.","Orti can be found at Watchers' Roost in the Gloomingtarn.\
\
You should return to Watchers' Roost and talk to Orti.","Talk to Orti","Complete 'Den of Pughlak' on any difficulty","The entrance to the Den of Pughlak can be found in the Gloomingtarn.\
\
You should further explore where the influenced goblins are camped.","Guarida de Pughlak"}},
[4164]={nameES="Den of Pughlak -- Solo",objectivesES={}},
[4165]={nameES="Den of Pughlak -- Tier 1",objectivesES={}},
[4166]={nameES="Den of Pughlak -- Tier 2",objectivesES={}},
[4167]={nameES="Den of Pughlak -- Tier 3",objectivesES={}},
[4168]={nameES="Guarida de lobos",objectivesES={"Guarida de lobos","Los leñadores de Combe que se adentran en el bosque de Chet en busca de madera de calidad buscan protección contra la fauna local.","El leñador Taylor Green espera en el campamento maderero al suroeste, al norte de la caseta de vigilancia.\
\
Como pidió Taylor Green, has infundido el miedo a los hombres en los lobos del bosque de Chet. Se alegrará de saber de tu éxito.","La guarida de lobos está en la pared del acantilado al noreste del campamento maderero.\
\
El leñador Taylor Green está preocupado porque los lobos que merodean por los bosques al noreste pueden ser una amenaza para los leñadores y te ha pedido que reduzcas su número."}},
[4169]={nameES="Denizens of Ost Dunhoth",objectivesES={"Ost Dunhoth is the fortress of Gortheron the Doom-caller.","Denizens of Ost Dunhoth","Return to the Rangers of Thrór's Coomb","The Rangers in Thrór's Coomb will be pleased to hear you have culled some of Gortheron's forces.","Ost Dunhoth is in southern Enedwaith.\
\
You have been asked to venture to Ost Dunhoth and defeat many of its denizens."}},
[4170]={nameES="Dens of the Taurogrim",objectivesES={"Talk to Thranduil","Dens of the Taurogrim","Taurog-dens can be found in Tholkát in northern Eryn Lasgalen.\
\
You should destroy Taurog-dens in Tholkát.","Despite the efforts of the Elves, the Taurogrim have returned to Tholkát in Eryn Lasgalen.","Thranduil can be found in Felegoth.\
\
You should talk to Thranduil."}},
[4171]={nameES="Rechaza su veneno",objectivesES={"Encuentra y derrota a Goródha","Goródha se ha mostrado en Dul Râkh. ¡Encuéntrala y derrótala!","Tu misión es viajar a Dul Râkh y evitar que los sectarios anâkhi produzcan más de sus mortales venenos. Si puedes, mata también a su apotecaria principal Goródha.","Has encontrado a Goródha. ¡Derrota a Goródha!","Los enemigos de Urush Dâr usan las glándulas venenosas de los usan-kûni en sus hojas. Debemos hacer todo lo posible para reducir esta práctica.","Goródha se ha mostrado. ¡Debes derrotarla para detener la producción de veneno de los Anâkhi!","Rechaza su veneno","Goródha derrotada"}},
[4172]={nameES="Cristales agotados",objectivesES={"Cristales agotados","Se han descubierto cristales en Moria que portan las marcas del Tesoro Olvidado, una cámara sellada que oculta una considerable cantidad de riquezas. Este hallazgo ha despertado el interés de algunos enanos, que ahora desean descubrir la cámara y salvar su contenido de los orcos saqueadores.","El Tesoro Olvidado se encuentra al sur y sureste del Descenso Profundo.\
\
Garthar te pidió que buscaras en el Tesoro Olvidado cualquier señal de los cristales agotados. Si los encuentras, te pidió que se los devolvieras.","Lleva los cristales a Garthar en el Descenso Profundo"}},
[4173]={nameES="Depleted Stores",objectivesES={}},
[4174]={nameES="Derufin's Task",objectivesES={"This must be the southern wooded area described by Derufin","Set traps in the northern forest area described by Derufin","This must be the eastern wooded area described by Derufin","Derufin's Task","The locations Derufin pointed to on his map can be found near Bâr Húrin.\
\
You should place traps in the wooded locations near Bâr Húrin that Derufin outlined on his map.","Set traps in the southern forest area described by Derufin","Talk to Derufin","Derufin is located in Bâr Húrin.\
\
You should talk to Derufin.","This must be the northern wooded area described by Derufin","Derufin has asked you to relieve his burden of hunting equipment and set some traps in Southern Ithilien for him and his brother.","Set traps in the eastern forest area described by Derufin"}},
[4175]={nameES="Desecration in the Tombs",objectivesES={"Desecration in the Tombs","Return to the merchant Muntâkh in Mekab-kuphâr","The merchant Muntâkh has asked you to undo the desecration of tombs by grave robbers in Sektakhâb.","The merchant Muntâkh has asked you to undo the desecration of tombs by grave robbers in Sektakhâb, so that the dead may find some peace.","Return to the merchant Muntâkh in Mekab-kuphâr, the Temámir outpost in the southern Khabârkhad."}},
[4176]={nameES="Desertores",objectivesES={"Desertores","Habla con Mothelen en Echad Mothelen","Los desertores trasgos se encuentran en los Troncosombríos, entre Echad Mothelen y Burgûl-stazg, al noroeste.\
\
Mothelen te ha pedido que des caza a algunos desertores trasgos y descubras qué les tiene aterrorizados.","Mothelen está en Echad Mothelen en el oeste de los Troncosombríos, al sureste de Burgûl-stazg.\
\
Deberías volver a ver a Mothelen con la información que has reunido.","Los elfos de la Hueste Dorada han descubierto un segundo campamento enemigo en el límite oeste de los Troncosombríos, pero algo parece ir mal."}},
[4177]={nameES="Escolta designada: Una perturbación en Bolgovado",objectivesES={"Acompaña al hobbit borracho fuera de este lugar público","Dod Retumbo es la vergüenza de Bolgovado. ¡Incluso los cerdos se comportan mejor!\
\
Deberías acompañar al hobbit borracho a un lugar apartado donde no moleste a la gente de bien del pueblo.","Escolta designada: Una perturbación en Bolgovado","Esta no es su casa, pero al menos podrá dormir la mona sin ponerse más en ridículo.","Un miembro de la Liga de las Posadas parece haber ido a parar mientras estaba borracho en una pocilga de Bolgovado, donde todo el mundo puede verlo. ¡Qué vergüenza!","Dod Retumbo es la vergüenza de Bolgovado. ¡Incluso los cerdos se comportan mejor!\
\
Debes acompañar al hobbit borracho a un lugar apartado donde no moleste a la gente de bien del pueblo.","No has conseguido supervisar apropiadamente a Dod"}},
[4178]={nameES="Designated Escort: A Disturbance in Celondim",objectivesES={"Acompaña al enano borracho fuera de este lugar público","Páll, un desconocido llegado del refugio de caza de Thrási, es la vergüenza de Celodim.\
\
Deberías acompañar al enano borracho a un lugar apartado para que no moleste a los Elfos de bien de la villa.","Designated Escort: A Disturbance in Celondim","Un miembro de la Asociación de la Cerveza parece haber terminado borracho en Celdomin, donde todos los Elfos pueden verlo. ¡Qué vergüenza!","Ahora Páll puede dormir la mona sin avergonzar a sus vecinos","Has dejado que Páll se ponga en ridículo"}},
[4179]={nameES="Designated Escort: A Disturbance in Duillond",objectivesES={"Acompaña al enano borracho fuera de este lugar público","Has dejado que Agmund se ponga en ridículo","Agmund es la vergüenza de Celodim.\
\
Deberías acompañar al enano borracho a un lugar apartado para que no moleste a los Elfos de bien del pueblo.","Ahora Agmund puede dormir la mona sin avergonzar a sus vecinos","Designated Escort: A Disturbance in Duillond","Un miembro de la Asociación de la Cerveza parece haber terminado borracho en Duillond, donde todos los Elfos pueden verlo. ¡Qué vergüenza!"}},
[4180]={nameES="Designated Escort: A Disturbance in Needlehole",objectivesES={"Acompaña al enano borracho fuera de este lugar público","Un miembro de la Asociación de la Cerveza parece haber terminado borracho en Ojo de Aguja, donde todo el mundo puede verlo. ¡Qué vergüenza!","Nói es la vergüenza de Ojo de Aguja.\
\
Deberías acompañar al enano borracho a un lugar apartado para que no moleste a la gente de bien del pueblo.","Ahora Nói puede dormir la mona sin avergonzar a sus vecinos","Has dejado que Nói se ponga en ridículo","Designated Escort: A Disturbance in Needlehole"}},
[4181]={nameES="Escolta designada: Una perturbación en Cepeda",objectivesES={"Un miembro de la Liga de las Posadas parece haber ido a parar mientras estaba borracho a Cepeda, donde hasta cierto punto no desentona, pero a decir verdad se ha pasado de la raya.","Robin Nogales es la vergüenza de Cepeda, y eso es decir mucho. Ningún hobbit de Cepeda tendría tan poco aguante con la cerveza.\
\
Deberías acompañar al hobbit borracho a un lugar apartado para que no haga el ridículo delante de los demás clientes.","Has dejado que Robin Nogales se ponga en ridículo","Acompaña a Robin Nogales fuera de este lugar público","Esta no es su casa, pero ahora Robin Nogales puede dormir la mona sin ponerse en ridículo","Escolta designada: Una perturbación en Cepeda"}},
[4182]={nameES="Escolta designada: Una perturbación en Casa del Bosque",objectivesES={"Has dejado que Amaranta Valeoro se ponga en ridículo","Acompaña a la hobbit borracha fuera de este lugar público","Amaranta Valeoro es la vergüenza del Cruce.\
\
Deberías acompañar a la hobbit borracha a un lugar apartado donde no moleste a la gente de bien del pueblo.","Amaranta no se ha ido tan lejos como pretendías, pero al menos está fuera de la vista","Escolta designada: Una perturbación en Casa del Bosque","Una miembro de la Liga de las Posadas parece haber ido a parar mientras estaba borracha al decente pueblo de Casa del Bosque, donde todo el mundo puede verla. ¡Qué vergüenza!"}},
[4183]={nameES="Designs for the Siege",objectivesES={}},
[4184]={nameES="Desire Above Strength",objectivesES={"Desire Above Strength","Ides can be found at the mill, north of the Rohirrim training grounds, at the northern edge of the Norcrofts.\
\
Ides wishes to speak with you regarding the events at the training grounds.","Ides wishes to speak with you about her future as a shield-maiden and living up to her father's legacy.","Talk to Ides","Ides can be found at the mill, north of the Rohirrim training grounds, at the northern edge of the Norcrofts.\
\
Ides has important matters on her mind that she wishes to discuss with you.","Allow Ides to discuss her ambitions with you"}},
[4185]={nameES="Desolation on the Coast",objectivesES={"This man either resisted or was deemed too weak by the Corsair slavers...","After seeing smoke rise against the darkened skies, Baraniel has asked you to seek out survivors of the recent raid on Ethillorn.","Search the ruins of Ethillorn for survivors","The man flinches at your approach, clearly caught off-guard.\
\
'You surprised me, stranger... I thought they were coming to strike me down at last. I tried to fight back when they sacked the town, but they merely wounded me before they were called away. A dreadful man in red passed through Ethillorn and took the Corsairs with him. The Corsairs returned in a time, but they have not yet thought to seek me out.\
\
'The others though... I do not know what has become of them. I fear many of my people have been taken as slaves, but I swear I have heard the sounds of death rise in this gloom.\
\
'Seek them out, my friend, I beg you.'","Search deeper in Ethillorn for any sign of survivors","Enslaved Gondorians can likely be found near the Corsair ships moored at Ethillorn.\
\
You have found one survivor in Ethillorn and he has begged your aid in freeing his folk from the Corsairs.","Talk to Baraniel in Sarnhad","DNT -- will not be seen","Desolation on the Coast","Ethillorn can be found to the south-west of Sarnhad in Lower Lebennin.\
\
Baraniel has asked you to search the sacked town of Ethillorn for any sign of survivors.","Ethillorn can be found to the south-west of Sarnhad in Lower Lebennin.\
\
You have searched near the entrance of Ethillorn, but have not yet found any survivors. You should now search deeper in Ethillorn.","Baraniel can be found in Sarnhad in western Lower Lebennin.\
\
You have freed all the enslaved Gondorians you could, but not all were so fortunate. You should return to Baraniel in Sarnhad.","You have freed an inhabitant of Ethillorn from the Corsairs","You do not yet see any survivors..."}},
[4186]={nameES="Despair in the Streets",objectivesES={}},
[4187]={nameES="Despair in the Streets",objectivesES={}},
[4188]={nameES="Desperate Battle: Glorfindel of Imladris",objectivesES={}},
[4189]={nameES="Desperate Battle: Khôltekh of the Shoreward Stone",objectivesES={}},
[4190]={nameES="Desperate Battle: Legolas and Gimli of the North",objectivesES={"You must defend the north-west waterfall and not leave it until enough time has passed!","Gimli fights to the south-east during the Dagor Carlanthir.","You have to defend this location long enough to secure it from your enemies!","Talk to Legolas during the Dagor Carlanthir","Gimli asked you to stand your ground at the waterfall to his south-east.","You must defend the waterfall to the south-east of Gimli, and not leave it until enough time has passed!","You left the location undefended, and have failed!","Hurry to defend the waterfall to Gimli's south-east","Talk to Gimli during the Dagor Carlanthir","Defend the south-eastern waterfall until time is up","Legolas and Gimli seek to patch holes in the defensive line during the Dagor Carlanthir.","You have secured the south-eastern waterfall!","Hurry to defend the waterfall north-west of Legolas","Legolas asked you to stand your ground before the waterfall to the north-west.","<rgb=#FF0000>Do not leave the south-eastern waterfall or you will fail the quest!</rgb>","Defend the north-west waterfall until time is up","Legolas fights during the Dagor Carlanthir.","Desperate Battle: Legolas and Gimli of the North","<rgb=#FF0000>Do not leave the north-west waterfall or you will fail the quest!</rgb>","You have secured the north-west waterfall!"}},
[4191]={nameES="Desperate Battle: Rahâzi of Ambarûl",objectivesES={}},
[4192]={nameES="Desperate Battle: Rothog of Dahâl Huliz",objectivesES={}},
[4193]={nameES="Desperate Battle: Sirgon of Lebennin",objectivesES={}},
[4194]={nameES="Desperate Harvest",objectivesES={}},
[4195]={nameES="Desperate Refuge",objectivesES={"TBD has told you to seek out a small Rohirrim outpost to the south-west of High Knolls, near the southern border of Balewood.","Search for the Rohirrim outpost outside southern Balewood","Talk to TBD Scout A","You hear a faint rustling from the hill above, perhaps there is a route upward nearby","Having found the camp, you should now speak to the captain of the Rohirrim stationed here and discover if he knows anything of the whereabouts of the refugees of Byre Tor.","Desperate Refuge","Fearing the worst for the other refugees of Byre Tor, TBD wishes you to travel to a Rohirrim outpost at the southern border of Balewood in hopes of finding those that fled into the dark, frozen forest."}},
[4196]={nameES="Situación desesperada",objectivesES={"Los nerbygs y las babosas se pueden encontrar en Duvuinen, al norte de Gabilshathûr.\
\
Kol te ha pedido que recolectes patas de norbog y lenguas de babosa para ayudar a complementar las provisiones en Gabilshathûr.","Kol, un residente de Gabilshathûr, te habló de su necesidad desesperada de comida.","Situación desesperada","Lleva los ingredientes a Kol"}},
[4197]={nameES="Campamento a la desesperada",objectivesES={"Encuentra el zurrón de Rúdhan","Onora espera junto al río a que regreses con los suministros que has recolectado.","Este debe de ser el zurrón de Rúdhan","Campamento a la desesperada","Onora te ha encargado recoger algo de leña y el zurrón de su marido, en algún lugar entre los árboles cercanos.","Llévale la leña y el zurrón a Onora, junto al río","Un par de refugiados parecen necesitar algunos suministros."}},
[4198]={nameES="Despicable!",objectivesES={"After listening to the details of this \\qDead Pool\\q you decided to speak with Othax and give him your honest opinion of this practice.","You admonish Othax for unconscionable behaviour","You have shown how angry this practice makes you","Despicable!","Show your anger to Othax (<rgb=#FF0000>/angry</rgb>)","Tell Othax of the immorality of this practice (<rgb=#FF0000>/talk</rgb>)","You made your displeasure with this practice known to Othax and he seems to still want to say something to you. Speak with Marjadi at the commons in Rakhatâb.","Othax was unapologetic and defensive about his decision to continue running the game. He suggested that you speak with another worker in the rest area to get her opinion. Make your way to her and let her know of your disapproval of this practice.","You expressed that this practice is immoral","Admonish Othax for this unwholesome practice (<rgb=#FF0000>/no</rgb>)","Othax does not seem to think that there is anything wrong with taking advantage of those who suffer grievous injuries while working at Rkhatâb. You are going to give him your honest opinion of this practice.","Speak with Marjadi at the commons in Rakhatâb","Speak with Othax"}},
[4199]={nameES="Destino: Angmar",objectivesES={"Destino: Angmar","Un Montaraz oculto en el norte entre un grupo de Montañeses que se han librado del yugo de Angmar necesita ayuda más allá del Ram Dúath.","Habla con Corunir en Aughaire","Has llegado a Aughaire","En el norte, a través del Ram Dúath, hay un campamento de Montañeses que han estado libres de la influencia de Angmar durante años. El Montaraz Corunir está en Aughaire, la aldea en el borde norte del Ram Dúath, aguardando tu ayuda.","Aughaire es un campamento de Montañeses, al norte, a través del Ram Dúath, dentro de Angmar.\
\
El Montaraz Corunir y sus aliados Montañeses requieren ayuda para resistir a los opresivos Angmarim.","Viaja a Aughaire en Angmar"}},
[4200]={nameES="Destino: Las Tierras de Bree",objectivesES={"Destino: Las Tierras de Bree","Tu experiencia ha crecido, y es hora de avanzar en tu entrenamiento.","Habla con el segundo vigilante Heathstraw en Bree","Viaja a Bree","Has llegado a Bree","Es tiempo de viajar a Bree","Estás bien encaminado a convertirte en un Héroe de la Tierra Media. Es hora de dirigirse a Bree.","El Segundo vigilante Heathstraw te espera cerca de la Fuente del Jabalí en Bree.\
\
Debes hablar con el Segundo vigilante Heathstraw para aprender más sobre Bree."}},
[4201]={nameES="Destino: Esteldín",objectivesES={"Viaja a Esteldín","Habla con Daervunn en Esteldín","En los tramos orientales de las Quebradas del Norte, ocultos entre las colinas, yacen los últimos vestigios de un pueblo noble, los Dúnedain del Norte.","Daervunn, un capitán de los Montaraces del Norte, te espera en Esteldín, su refugio oculto en las Quebradas del Norte.\
\
La gente de Aragorn hijo de Arathorn requiere tu ayuda.","Esteldín yace en el seno de las colinas en la zona oriental de las Quebradas del Norte llamada la Cuestadereyes. Debes buscar allí al Montaraz llamado Daervunn.","Esteldín yace en el seno de las colinas en la zona oriental de las Quebradas del Norte llamada la Cuestadereyes. Debes buscar allí a un Montaraz llamado Daervunn.","Destino: Esteldín","Has llegado a Esteldín"}},
[4202]={nameES="Destino: Evendim",objectivesES={"Ha llegado la noticia para que almas valientes se dirijan a la aldea de Avenal, al norte de Tejonera, en la frontera de Evendim.","Hal Gamyi, primo del estimado Samsagaz Gamyi, necesita ayuda en la aldea de Avenal en la Comarca, lindando con la región del Lago Evendim.","Has llegado a Evendim","Habla con Hal Gamyi en Avenal","Viaja a Evendim","Avenal está al norte de Tejonera en la Comarca. Necesitarás seguir el camino a través de los Campos Verdes para llegar a la aldea y buscar a Hal Gamyi.\
\
Hal Gamyi puede encontrarse cerca del centro de Avenal.","Destino: Evendim"}},
[4203]={nameES="Destino: Forochel",objectivesES={"Destino: Forochel","Taur Orthon está al norte de Ost Forod en Evendim, en la tierra helada de Forochel. Mainio aguarda ayuda fuera del campamento.\
\
Debes encontrar a Mainio y ofrecerle tu ayuda.","Has recibido una solicitud de ayuda en la tierra nevada de Forochel.","Mainio, un Hombre del norte, ha enviado mensajes hacia el sur con comerciantes —contra los deseos de sus mayores— diciendo que su gente necesita ayuda.\
\
El rumor de estos mensajes ha llegado a ti, y deberías buscar a Mainio en Forochel, fuera del campamento Lossoth de Kauppa-köti, en el lugar conocido como Taur Orthon.","Has llegado a Forochel","Viaja a Forochel","Habla con Mainio en Taur Orthon en Forochel"}},
[4204]={nameES="Destino: Tierras Solitarias",objectivesES={"Estás bien encaminado a convertirte en un Héroe de la Tierra Media. Es hora de dirigirse a las Tierras Solitarias.","Habla con alguien en la Posada Abandonada","Destino: Tierras Solitarias","Has llegado a la Posada Abandonada en las Tierras Solitarias","Pocos Hombres viven en las Tierras Solitarias, pero esos pocos habitan en una posada en el camino hacia el este, rumbo al Bosque de los Trolls.","Viaja a las Tierras Solitarias","La Posada Abandonada se encuentra a lo largo del Gran Camino del Este que sale por la Puerta Sur de Bree. Si viajas durante un buen trecho, encontrarás la posada al norte del camino.\
\
Debes encontrar la Posada Abandonada y hablar con los parroquianos allí."}},
[4205]={nameES="Destino: Montañas Nubladas",objectivesES={"El campamento de Glóin está al oeste del camino que sube hacia el norte saliendo de Rivendel. Búscalo y habla con él.","Glóin, uno de los compañeros del gran Thorin Escudo de Roble, requiere ayuda en su campamento al norte de Rivendel en las Montañas Nubladas.","El enano Glóin se dirigió al norte hacia las Montañas Nubladas para buscar viejos recuerdos y encontrar algo de entretenimiento. Su campamento puede encontrarse al oeste del sendero que conduce al norte desde Rivendel.\
\
Glóin y sus compañeros necesitan ayuda.","Habla con Glóin en su campamento en las Montañas Nubladas","Viaja a las Montañas Nubladas","Destino: Montañas Nubladas","Has llegado a las Montañas Nubladas"}},
[4206]={nameES="Destino: Quebradas del Norte",objectivesES={"Puente de Caballetes se encuentra al norte de Bree a lo largo del Camino Verde. Debes dirigirte allí y hablar con la gente que hace de esta acosada aldea su hogar.","Has llegado a las Quebradas del Norte","Viaja a Puente de Caballetes en las Quebradas del Norte","Habla con Marla Shelton en Puente de Caballetes","La aldea de Puente de Caballetes está en un estado terrible. Están asediados por orcos en sus fronteras norte y sur y están enviando llamados generales a cualquiera que crean capaz de ayudarlos.","Destino: Quebradas del Norte","La gente de Puente de Caballetes necesita ayuda, al norte de las Tierras de Bree a lo largo del Camino Verde."}},
[4207]={nameES="Destino: Bosque de los Trolls Meriodional",objectivesES={"Destino: Bosque de los Trolls Meriodional","Habla con Candelleth en Echad Candelleth en Tal Bruinen","La elfa Candelleth puede encontrarse en una ruina que lleva su nombre. La ruina se alza sobre un acantilado con vista al Bruinen, al sur, más allá de las Gargantas del Bruinen. Ella requiere ayuda de cualquiera que responda al llamado.","Has llegado al Bosque de los Trolls Meridional","Candelleth, una elfa que vive en la parte meridional del Bosque de los Trolls, necesita ayuda.","Viaja al Bosque de los Trolls Meridional","Echad Candelleth, en Tâl Bruinen, se asienta en lo alto de un acantilado con vista al gran río. Debes buscar a Candelleth allí y brindarle la ayuda que puedas."}},
[4208]={nameES="Destino: Bosque de los Trolls",objectivesES={"Los elfos de Rivendel tienen exploradores acampados cerca del Último Puente entre las Tierras Solitarias y el Bosque de los Trolls.\
\
Debes ofrecerles tu ayuda.","Destino: Bosque de los Trolls","Habla con un elfo explorador en el Bosque de los Trolls","Los elfos de Rivendel vigilan el Último Puente desde las Tierras Solitarias hacia el Bosque de los Trolls.","Has llegado al Bosque de los Trolls","Es probable que los exploradores de Rivendel estén acampados cerca del Último Puente entre las Tierras Solitarias y el Bosque de los Trolls.\
\
Debes ofrecerles tu ayuda.","Viaja al Bosque de los Trolls"}},
[4209]={nameES="Destroy the Southern Flag",objectivesES={"Return to Soldier Paashum at the encampment west of Tol Ascarnen","Destroy the Southern Flag","Paashum is at the encampment on the western bank of the Hoarwell River, west of Tol Ascarnen.\
\
You carefully sneaked to the flag calling the Free Peoples to the defence of the southern bridge and destroyed it. This set-back will surely give your forces a chance to defeat the enemy within Tol Ascarnen.","Flags call the enemy to Tol Ascarnen facing south on the Hoardale island. Cross the river and destroy the flag located north of the southern bridge.\
\
Paashum has tasked you with a mission to destroy the flag which calls the enemy defenders to the southern bridge over the Hoardale River.","Angmar suffers in misery as the Free Peoples hold Tol Ascarnen."}},
[4210]={nameES="Destroy the Western Flag",objectivesES={"Return to Soldier Paashum at the encampment west of Tol Ascarnen","Destroy the Western Flag","Paashum is at the encampment on the western bank of the Hoarwell River, west of Tol Ascarnen.\
\
You carefully sneaked to the flag calling the Free Peoples to the defence of the western bridge and destroyed it. This set-back will surely give your forces a chance to defeat the enemy within Tol Ascarnen.","Cross the bridge to the north-east of the camp and destroy the flag against the crumbling walls near the western shore of the Hoardale island.\
\
Paashum has tasked you with a mission to destroy the flag which calls the enemy defenders to the western bridge over the Hoardale River.","Angmar suffers in misery as the Free Peoples hold Tol Ascarnen."}},
[4211]={nameES="Destruyendo a los espectros",objectivesES={"Los espectros se encuentran en Imlad Balchorth, al oeste de Myrkworth.\
\
Sigar te ha pedido que destruyas a los espectros de Imlad Balchorth. Puedes encontrarlos vagando por el extremo este de Imlad Balchorth.","Sigar está en Myrkworth, al este de Imlad Balchorth.\
\
Tras destruir a muchos espectros como te pidió, vuelve a ver a Sigar en Myrkworth y cuéntale que la tarea está hecha.","Sigar te ha pedido que mates tantos espectros como puedas en Imlad Balchorth con la esperanza de reducir su número y detener las incursiones nocturnas.","Destruyendo a los espectros"}},
[4212]={nameES="Destroying Blades",objectivesES={}},
[4213]={nameES="Destruyendo sus recursos",objectivesES={"Los armeros y cajas de suministros se encuentran en Ashúrz Maufulug, al sur y un poco hacia el oeste de Echad Glamodúd.\
\
Glamodúd te ha pedido que debilites más a los orcos de Ashúrz Maufulug destruyendo sus armas y suministros.","Habla con Glamodúd en Echad Glamodúd","Glamodúd está en Echad Glamodúd, al sur y un poco al este de Ashúrz Maufulug.\
\
Deberías volver a Ashúrz Maufulug con las noticias de tu éxito.","Destruyendo sus recursos","Has eliminado gran parte de la amenaza de las trampas y arqueros que hacían que atacar Ashúrz Maufulug una empresa particularmente arriesgada, pero todavía hay mucho por hacer."}},
[4214]={nameES="Destroying the Barricades",objectivesES={"Destroying the Barricades","You have destroyed many barricades in Abadec's Watch.\
\
Dolvir waits for you amongst the trees to the north of the camp. You should talk to him.","The barricades in Abadec's Watch have granted the Corsairs a sense of security.","Talk to Dolvir outside Abadec's Watch","Dolvir has asked you to destroy barricades at Abadec's Watch.\
\
Abadec's Watch is located in the south-west corner of Belfalas."}},
[4215]={nameES="Destroying the Defences",objectivesES={"Melethon is at the Causeway Forts.\
\
You should speak to Melethon.","Enemy barricades can be found on the Eastern side of Osgiliath.\
\
You should destroy enemy barricades.","Speak with Melethon","Destroying the Defences","Melethon has tasked you with destroying the enemy barricades scattered around Eastern Osgiliath to help push the enemy forces out of the city."}},
[4216]={nameES="Destrucción del criadero",objectivesES={"Se pueden encontrar nidos de dragonzuelo en el valle occidental de Ram Dúath, al norte de Esteldín.\
\
Debes destruir los nidos de los dragonzuelos que habitan el valle occidental de Ram Dúath antes de que puedan multiplicarse.","Destrucción del criadero","No solo hay sierpes en el valle occidental de Ram Dúath, sino también dragonzuelos. Los dragonzuelos alados, más inteligentes que sus congéneres menores, representan una amenaza mayor para Esteldín y las Quebradas del Norte.","Encontraste varios nidos de dragonzuelo en el oeste de Ram Dúath y los destruiste, pero había muchas sierpes en la zona y los nidos estaban bien defendidos.","Completado"}},
[4217]={nameES="Destruyendo las operaciones",objectivesES={"Los orcos del Cuerno Rojo están ocupados extrayendo minerales y han hecho cribas para separar el mineral de la tierra. Destruir las cribas que hay esparcidas por las Vetas del Cuerno Rojo servirá para frenar las operaciones mineras de los orcos.","Es posible que los orcos consigan reparar las cribas con el tiempo, pero esperemos que tengan otras cosas de las que ocuparse antes de que tengan ocasión de hacer las reparaciones. Este es el primer paso para frenar las operaciones mineras de los orcos en el Cuerno Rojo.","Los orcos utilizan las cribas que se encuentran en la base de las vías elevadas a lo largo de las Vetas del Cuerno Rojo, al sureste de la Guardia Orca.","Completado","Las cribas que utilizan tanto los orcos de Moria como los de la Mano Blanca para filtrar el mineral extraído no deben dejarse en buen estado. Destruirlas ayudará a frenar la producción de armas y armaduras de los orcos.","Destruyendo las operaciones"}},
[4218]={nameES="Destroying the Watch",objectivesES={}},
[4219]={nameES="Destruyendo sus medios",objectivesES={"Destruyendo sus medios","Habla con Inufileg en Gwingris","Los dunlendinos están asolando Glâd Ereg, talando árboles para abastecer de madera a los lacayos de Saruman.","El campamento maderero de los dunlendinos está al sureste de Gwingris. Inufileg está en Gwingris, al oeste y al norte del campamento maderero de los dunlendinos.\
\
Inufileg te ha pedido que detengas la tala de árboles de los dunlendinos quitándoles sus hachas."}},
[4220]={nameES="Destructive Disarmament",objectivesES={}},
[4221]={nameES="Determinando su fuerza",objectivesES={"Habla con Bahanneth en Talan Fanuidhol","Bahanneth está en Talan Fanuidhol, al suroeste de Talan Gwilith.\
\
Deberías regresar a Bahanneth y informarle de tus hallazgos.","Ayuda a Raingon","Has ayudado a Maenhador","Maenhador está en Talan Fanuidhol. Raingon está en Talan Gwilith, al noreste de Talan Fanuidhol.\
\
Bahanneth te ha pedido que ayudes a Maenhador y a Raingon con sus tareas de exploración.","Los orcos de Moria han salido a Fanuidhol, reuniéndose para un asalto sobre el Bosque de Oro.","Has ayudado a Raingon","Ayuda a Maenhador","Determinando su fuerza"}},
[4222]={nameES="Determinando su fuerza -- Campamentos del norte",objectivesES={"Explora Bidroi Maudhul","Explora Nardur-stazg","Explora Prakûth-fulug","Raingon está en Talan Gwilith, al sureste de Fanuidhol.\
\
Debes regresar a Raingon con tu informe.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Nota: Mientras la Defensa de Fanuidhol esté activa, Raingon no estará disponible para completar la misión o para comentarios. Tendrás que esperar a que la Defensa de Fanuidhol termine para completar esta misión.</rgb>","Habla con Raingon en Talan Gwilith","Drûmaudhul, Prakûth-fulug, Bidroi Maudhul y Nardur-stazg se encuentran todos al noroeste de Talan Gwilith.\
\
Raingon te ha pedido que explores cuatro campamentos de Orcos en Fanuidhol para determinar su fuerza: Drûmaudhul, Prakûth-fulug, Bidroi Maudhul y Nardur-stazg.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Nota: Mientras la Defensa de Fanuidhol esté activa, Raingon no estará disponible para completar la misión o para comentarios. Tendrás que esperar a que la Defensa de Fanuidhol termine para completar esta misión.</rgb>","Has explorado Drûmaudhul","Has explorado Prakûth-fulug","Determinando su fuerza -- Campamentos del norte","Explora Drûmaudhul","Los Orcos de Moria han salido a Fanuidhol, reuniéndose para un asalto sobre el Bosque de Oro.","Has explorado Bidroi Maudhul","Has explorado Nardur-stazg"}},
[4223]={nameES="Determinando su fuerza -- Campamentos del sur",objectivesES={"Has explorado Golugrak","Todos los campamentos de los Orcos se encuentran al norte de Talan Fanuidhol. Bolg Maufulug se encuentra más al oeste. Golugrak está al noroeste de Talan Fanuidhol. Gazpush está al norte de Golugrak. Mokûrz Gundul está al este de Gazpush.\
\
Maenhador te ha pedido que patrulles cuatro campamentos de Orcos en Fanuidhol para determinar su fuerza: Bolg Maufulug, Golugrak, Gazpush y Mokûrz Gundul.","Has explorado Gazpush","Has explorado Mokûrz Gundul","Explora Bolg Maufulug","Los Orcos de Moria han salido a Fanuidhol, reuniéndose para un asalto sobre el Bosque de Oro.","Explora Golugrak","Habla con Maenhador en Talan Fanuidhol","Determinando su fuerza -- Campamentos del sur","Explora Gazpush","Has explorado Bolg Maufulug","Maenhador está en Talan Fanuidhol, al sur de Fanuidhol.\
\
Debes regresar a Maenhador con tu informe.","Explora Mokûrz Gundul"}},
[4224]={nameES="Devastation in the North",objectivesES={"The Mead Hall is locked for good. There is no more Thane in Langhold.","Scout the north gate of Langhold","Cíllan is in the stables of Harwick, tending to her late husband's war-steed.\
\
You should speak with Cíllan in Harwick.","The view into the town from the north gate is grim...","Scout the Mead Hall","Devastation in the North","You narrowly escaped the battle in Langhold, but you grieve for those who died defending their keep.","Scout the town's centre","Tell Cíllan about her husband's final stand","You do not see or hear any signs of people in the centre of town","What remains of Langhold is not far, just a little ways south along the road in the northern Wold.\
\
You should return to Langhold and have a look around at the town that was so recently thriving -- namely the north gate, the centre of town, and the Mead Hall.","The guard directs you to the stables, where Cíllan tends to the war-steed of her late husband","Search for Cíllan in Harwick","Langhold is empty, a ruin of what it once was.\
\
You should seek Cíllan and the other refugees of Langhold. They headed towards Harwick, and you should ensure that they arrived safely, and bring the grievous news to the family of the Thane."}},
[4225]={nameES="Devilry in the Woods",objectivesES={}},
[4226]={nameES="Devoted of the Heirs",objectivesES={"Talk to the captured Corsair captain","Talk to the captured Haradrim warrior","Talk to the captured Corsair archer","Devoted of the Heirs","Tell Steward Malthellim of the prisoners' warnings","Steward Malthellim can be found in the Lord's Hall in Ost Anglebed.\
\
You have spoken to the prisoners and should now tell Steward Malthellim of what you have learned.","Talk to Nimithil","Fearing a foolish alliance between the people of Lebennin and the Heirs of Castamir, Nimithil of Pelargir hopes to expose the treachery in Ost Anglebed.","Nimithil can be found in the lowest section of Ost Anglebed with her guards.\
\
You have spoken to the prisoners in Ost Anglebed and relayed your findings to Malthellim. You should now return to Nimithil.","The Corsair archer merely glares at you, and then spits at your feet.","The jail of Ost Anglebed can be found to the south-east of the entrance to the Lord's Hall.\
\
Nimithil has asked you to speak to prisoners in an attempt to uncover the source of the treachery in Ost Anglebed."}},
[4227]={nameES="Devoured From Within",objectivesES={}},
[4228]={nameES="La caza del Diamante",objectivesES={"La caza del Diamante","Pregunta dónde se encuentra Adamanda","Rosalinda Nortuk, Alguacil de la Comarca Allende, tiene mucho trabajo y pocas manos que la ayuden. Su hija Adamanda tendría que estar asistiéndola, pero no aparece. Quizá la gente del pueblo tenga alguna pista sobre dónde podría encontrarse la hobbit errante.","Enuenta a Adamanda Nortuk","Los hobbits que podrían saber dónde está Adamanda se encuentran en Nobotella y Quiebra Larga.\
\
Pregunta si alguien sabe dónde está Adamanda Nortuk.","Adamanda Nortuk se encuentra en la Comarca Allende.\
\
Busca a Adamanda Nortuk.","Adamanda arruga la carta"}},
[4229]={nameES="El Gran Plan de Diamante",objectivesES={"Lleva la madera a Anson","Puede encontrarse lino creciendo en las granjas al norte de Campotieso.\
\
Anson Cordelero te ha pedido que recojas lino.","Vuelve con Adamanda","Lleva el lino a Anson","Recoge la cuerda","Has encontrado un trozo de madera apropiado","Anson Cordelero se encuentra en Campotieso.\
\
Adamanda Nortuk te ha pedido que le pidas algo de cuerda a Anson Cordelero.","Anson Cordelero se encuentra en Campotieso.\
\
Debes llevar el lino a Anson Cordelero.","Recoge un trozo apropiado de madera","Este árbol es viejo y quebradizo","Anson Cordelero se encuentra en Campotieso.\
\
Lleva el trozo de madera a Anson.","Con sus obligaciones para la tarde canceladas, Adamanda Nortuk está libre para centrarse en comenzar con su Gran Plan.","La cuerda está junto a Anson en Campotieso.\
\
Recoge la cuerda.","El Gran Plan de Diamante","Adamanda está cerca de Nobotella.\
\
Lleva la cuerda a Adamanda.","La leña caída se puede encontrar en los bosques cerca de Campotieso.\
\
Anson Cordelero te ha pedido que consiguas un trozo de leña caída apropiado.","Habla con Anson Cordelero"}},
[4230]={nameES="Diamantes en bruto (Diario)",objectivesES={"Entrega la caja de joyas al líder del Gremio de Joyeros de Umbar.","Diamantes en bruto (Diario)","Entrega una caja de joyas al líder del Gremio de Joyeros de Umbar","Caja de joyas creada para el Gremio de Joyeros de Umbar","El gremio de joyeros de Umbar Baharbêl crea materiales y objetos vendidos y usados por muchos en la ciudad. Estás haciendo tu parte para mantener las existencias llenas.","La receta necesaria para completar esta misión está disponible para su compra. <rgb=#00f000>Compra la receta de la misión al líder del gremio.</rgb>\
\
Crea una caja de joyas para Umbar Baharbêl.","Crea una caja de joyas para el Gremio de Joyeros de Umbar"}},
[4231]={nameES="Diamantes en bruto (Diario)",objectivesES={"Entrega la caja de joyas al líder del Gremio de Joyeros de Umbar.","Diamantes en bruto (Diario)","Entrega una caja de joyas al líder del Gremio de Joyeros de Umbar","Caja de joyas creada para el Gremio de Joyeros de Umbar","El gremio de joyeros de Umbar Baharbêl crea materiales y objetos vendidos y usados por muchos en la ciudad. Estás haciendo tu parte para mantener las existencias llenas.","La receta necesaria para completar esta misión está disponible para su compra. <rgb=#00f000>Compra la receta de la misión al líder del gremio.</rgb>\
\
Crea una caja de joyas para Umbar Baharbêl.","Crea una caja de joyas para el Gremio de Joyeros de Umbar"}},
[4232]={nameES="Did Not!",objectivesES={}},
[4233]={nameES="Did Too!",objectivesES={}},
[4234]={nameES="Dificultad 0: Normal",objectivesES={"Dificultad 0: Normal","Completar esta misión reducirá la dificultad a niveles normales.","Completar esta misión te devolverá a la dificultad normal e impedirá permanentemente completar cualquier hazaña basada en la dificultad.","Habla con el viajero curtido","El camino que tienes por delante se ha vuelto más fácil..."}},
[4235]={nameES="Dificultad 1: Aventurero",objectivesES={"Completar esta misión aumentará la amenaza que suponen los monstruos que encuentres durante tu viaje por la Tierra Media, y te otorgará una pequeña bonificación a la experiencia obtenida en combate.","Dificultad 1: Aventurero","El camino que tienes por delante se ha vuelto más peligroso...","Habla con el viajero curtido","Completar esta misión cambiará tu nivel de dificultad actual."}},
[4236]={nameES="Dificultad 2: Atrevido",objectivesES={"Completar esta misión aumentará la amenaza que suponen los monstruos que encuentres durante tu viaje por la Tierra Media, y te otorgará una pequeña bonificación a la experiencia obtenida en combate.","El camino que tienes por delante se ha vuelto más peligroso...","Habla con el viajero curtido","Completar esta misión cambiará tu nivel de dificultad actual.","Dificultad 2: Atrevido"}},
[4237]={nameES="Dificultad 3: Sin miedo",objectivesES={"Completar esta misión aumentará la amenaza que suponen los monstruos que encuentres durante tu viaje por la Tierra Media, y te otorgará una pequeña bonificación a la experiencia obtenida en combate.","El camino que tienes por delante se ha vuelto más peligroso...","Habla con el viajero curtido","Completar esta misión cambiará tu nivel de dificultad actual.","Dificultad 3: Sin miedo"}},
