[4244]={nameES="Dig Deep",objectivesES={}},
[4245]={nameES="Digging Deeper",objectivesES={"Upon defeating Uflúk, you found a report among his belongings.\
\
Discussing this report with Aighrig may reveal something.","Talk to Aighrig","Deliver the report to Rékkur","Rékkur awaits your return at Annâk-khurfu, to the east of Zarkul-sulûn.\
\
Aighrig has asked you to bring the report to him.","With few clues as to what Gáfin discovered before he died, hunting down the Orc commander Uflúk for information may be the next best option.","Use war horn and defeat Uflúk","A report lies crumpled among Uflúk's belongings","The Orc camp Zarkul-sulûn is located west of Annâk-khurfu.\
\
Aighrig believes that Uflúk can be lured out if you find a war horn to use in the camp.","Show Aighrig the report","Use the whistle to summon Aighrig to your side","Rékkur has suggested bringing Aighrig with you to the Orc camp.\
\
Aighrig stands before the stairs to Annâk-khurfu.","Digging Deeper"}},
[4246]={nameES="Digging In",objectivesES={"Céolflad is in the refugees' cave in northern Byre Tor.\
\
You should bring the firewood to Céolflad.","Bring the firewood to Céolflad","Céolflad, a healer, has vowed to ensure that Ránmald can deliver her child amongst friends and helpers. She has asked that plenty of firewood be collected to get the women ready for digging into their new temporary home.","Firewood can be found around clusters of trees in the northern High Knolls.\
\
You should collect firewood so that the women can comfortably settle into their new temporary home.","Digging In"}},
[4247]={nameES="Digging Up Knowledge",objectivesES={"Return to the Pohâni Têredal in the Kalmakhíla in Zajâna","Digging Up Knowledge","Return to the Pohâni Têredal in the Kalmakhíla in Zajâna.","The Pohâni Têredal has knowledge of the Pale Blight, but needs your help completing some of his tasks whilst he conducts research for you.","Create raised beds for the flowers in the flower bed within the Kalmakhíla in Zajâna.","Retrieve the flowers from outside Zajâna that the Pohâni Têredal mentioned.","Return to the Pohâni Têredal in the Kalmakhíla and report on your success.","Gather water from the bucket near the planted flowers","Water the planted flowers in the flower bed within the Kalmakhíla in Zajâna.","Return to the Pohâni Têredal in the Kalmakhíla","Gather water from the bucket near the planted flowers in the Kalmakhíla in Zajâna.","Plant the harvested flowers in the holes you've dug within the Kalmakhíla in Zajâna."}},
[4248]={nameES="Cavando al Oeste",objectivesES={"Los orcos están cavando en Hielo Caído, al noroeste de Mekhem-bizru.\
\
Raskwith te pidió que detuvieras a los orcos que están intentando cavar a través de la avalancha en Hielo Caído.","Habla con Raskwith en Mekhem-bizru","Cavando al Oeste","Raskwith se encuentra en Mekhem-bizru, al sureste de Hielo Caído.\
\
Raskwith estará encantado de saber que los esfuerzos de los orcos han sido interrumpidos.","Los orcos de Moria están intentando cavar a través de la avalancha que bloquea la Puerta del Cuerno Rojo y acceder a Eregion."}},
[4249]={nameES="Excavando en busca de reliquias",objectivesES={"Los extraños montículos de tierra se encuentran al norte del campamento de Mincham, en los Campos de Fornost.\
\
Debes excavar en las extrañas pilas de tierra.","La excavación fue una tarea peligrosa en tierra agitada y corrompida, pero has descubierto algunos objetos de valor. Tus esfuerzos te han traído riqueza.","Excava en los montículos","Has encontrado algunas extrañas reliquias en tu exploración de los Campos de Fornost","Completado","Excavando en busca de reliquias","Como Colbert el Loco indicó, has encontrado unos extraños montículos de tierra durante tu exploración de los Campos de Fornost.\
\
Debes excavar y buscar si hay algo que valga la pena encontrar enterrado en este extraño terreno."}},
[4250]={nameES="Excavando en la tierra",objectivesES={"Encuentra el túmulo de Taradan","Encuentra el túmulo de Orron","Lleva los fragmentos de saber a Tobold Cortahoja","Excavando en la tierra","Los estudios que Tobold Cortahoja realizó en la biblioteca de Bree le dieron a entender algunos de los secretos que guardan las Quebradas de los Túmulos. Su preocupación crece con cada nuevo descubrimiento dentro de los túmulos.","Los túmulos de Taradan, Orron y Ringdor se encuentran en el norte de las Quebradas de los Túmulos.\
\
Tobold Cortahoja te ha dicho que excaves en la entrada de los túmulos de Taradan, Orron y Ringdor. Para ayudarte en la excavación, te ha dado una pequeña piqueta. Esta herramienta te ayudará a evitar dañar los fragmentos de saber que puedas descubrir.","Tobold Cortahoja te espera entre las Quebradas de los Túmulos y el Bosque Viejo.\
\
Tu excavación en los túmulos de Taradan, Orron y Ringdor ha descubierto tres fragmentos de saber, escritos en trozos de pergamino. Deberías llevar estos fragmentos a Tobold Cortahoja.","Encuentra el túmulo de Ringdor"}},
[4251]={nameES="Diminishing the Enemy",objectivesES={"Ningêna has asked you to go to Khetsok, the Ordâkhai camp on the south side of the Wrackwade in Ambarûl, and defeat some of the soldiers there.","Talk to Ningêna","The Ordâkhai maintain an encampment on the south side of the Wrackwade, from which they launch attacks at the Dumûri of Sûru.","Diminishing the Enemy","You have defeated Ordâkhai soldiers at Khetsok, the Ordâkhai camp on the south side of the Wrackwade. You should return to Ningêna at Sûru."}},
[4252]={nameES="Dimming the Lights",objectivesES={"Elhudan may be found within the Slade of Shadows, south of Andreg's position.\
\
Andreg has instructed you to defeat elhudan at the Slade of Shadows.","Dimming the Lights","The Slade of Shadows appears to be a focal point for the evil that is growing within the Gravenwood."}},
[4253]={nameES="Dimming the Summit",objectivesES={}},
[4254]={nameES="Dinner at the Manor",objectivesES={"Dagrun can be found in the Master's manor.\
\
You should talk to Dagrun.","Talk to Orgrand","Now that the Lake-town Smugglers are no longer a threat, it is time to consider the empty position of Master. Join Dagrun as she prepares for an important dinner.","Frekur, Orgrand, Rikolf, Maeriel, and Hoskuld can be found in Lake-town.\
\
You should talk to Frekur, Orgrand, Rikolf, Maeriel, and Hoskuld.","Complete: The Deadly Dinner","Talk to Frekur","Habla con Maeriel","Talk to Dagrun","Talk to Rikolf","Talk to Hoskuld","Dinner at the Manor","Dagrun is waiting for you near the Master's manor.\
\
You should talk to Dagrun."}},
[4255]={nameES="Dinodas en apuros",objectivesES={"Dinodas en apuros","Prisca tiene una pregunta para ti. Está dentro del nº 8 de la calle Aguamiel, esperando que empiece la fiesta de inauguración.","Dile a los hobbits entrometidos que no molesten a Dinodas (2/3)","Habla con Dinodas Boffin en la calle Aguamiel","Dinodas está siendo molestado por hobbits entrometidos de la Comarca Allende.","Habla con Prisca Boffin dentro del nº 8 de la calle Aguamiel","Asegúrate que los hobbits","Habla con Angélica Boffin dentro del nº 8 de la calle Aguamiel","Angélica te ha pedido que salgas y averigües si sus hermanos planean volver a su fiesta.","Hobbits entrometidos reprendidos (1/3)","Hobbits entrometidos reprendidos (3/3)","Dinodas podría haber cometido un error, y necesita tu ayuda para arreglarlo.","Dile a los hobbits entrometidos que no molesten a Dinodas (0/3)","Hobbits entrometidos reprendidos (2/3)","Habla con Esmeralda Boffin dentro del nº 8 de Honeymead Lane","Habla con Griffo Boffin dentro del nº 8 de la calle Aguamiel","Los hobbits entrometidos se marchan... de momento.","Los hobbits entrometidos se marchan indignados... pero volverán","Dinodas está agradecido de que hayas conseguido que los hobbits entrometidos le dejen en paz.","Dile a los hobbits entrometidos que no molesten a Dinodas (1/3)","Habla con Caléndula Boffin dentro del nº 8 de la calle Aguamiel","Abres la boca para sugerir que Caléndula deje la fiesta para ir en busca de aventuras, pero antes de que puedas decir nada, te interrupe.\
'Creo que podría haber trasgos por aquí,' dice, y asientes con la cabeza.\
\
'Alguien debería hacer algo...' dice, con la mirada ya fija en la puerta.","Griffo, Esmeralda y Caléndula han entrado en el nº 8 de la calle Aguamiel.\
\
Dinodas, desesperado por la proecupación, te ha encargadao que disperses a sus hermanos para retrasar la apertura del regalo de inaguración de la casa de Angélica.","Sal fuera y comprueba si los hermanos de Angélica planean volver"}},
[4256]={nameES="Diplomacy In the Giant's Den",objectivesES={}},
[4257]={nameES="Dire Threat",objectivesES={"Travelled to the Folde Farm","Talk to Witgil","The Folde Farm can be found just north of Aldburg.\
\
Thane Arcil has asked you to travel to the Folde Farm and warn them of the potential of Orc-attacks.","Talk to Arcil","Arcil and Éothain could not reach an agreement as to which Orc-tribe posed the greatest threat and left the decision in your hands.","Travel to the Folde Farm","Witgil is somewhere at the Folde Farm.\
\
Now that you have arrived at the Folde Farm, you should seek out and speak with Witgil.","Dire Threat","Arcil is in the Mead Hall of Aldburg to the south of Folde Farm.\
\
You have alerted the people at the Folde Farm about the Orc-threat and should now return to Arcil."}},
[4258]={nameES="Dire Threat",objectivesES={"Travelled to the Folde Farm","Talk to Witgil","Arcil and Éothain could not reach an agreement as to which Orc-tribe posed the greatest threat and left the decision in your hands.","Travel to the Folde Farm","Witgil is somewhere at the Folde Farm.\
\
Now that you have arrived at the Folde Farm, you should seek out and speak with Witgil.","The Folde Farm can be found just north of Aldburg.\
\
Éothain has asked you to travel to the Folde Farm and warn them of the potential of Orc-attacks.","Dire Threat","Éothain is near the entrance of Aldburg to the south of Folde Farm.\
\
You have alerted the people at the Folde Farm about the Orc-threat and should now return to Éothain.","Talk to Éothain"}},
[4259]={nameES="Dire Warnings",objectivesES={"Word has arrived from Garrun that Rohirrim scouts have discovered that the caverns beneath the Isendale are much more extensive than previously thought.","Dire Warnings","Ardwyn is at Forthbrond, far to the north of Innoth's camp.\
\
Innoth instructed you to bring news of the Orc-caverns to Ardwyn.","Talk to Ardwyn at Forthbrond"}},
[4260]={nameES="Direnfirel: Dangers Lurking in the Shade",objectivesES={}},
[4261]={nameES="Direnfirel: Guide of the Wooded River-bank",objectivesES={"Defeated the leader of the enemies within Direnfirel","Defeat the leader of the enemies within Direnfirel","Quickbeam has asked you to destroy the leader of the enemy force.","Talk to Quickbeam","You gather your things and prepare to travel to Direnfirel.","Direnfirel: Guide of the Wooded River-bank","You should return to Quickbeam and inform him of your success.\
\
Quickbeam can be found at Derndingle.","Along the banks of the Swiftwater is the small lumber-milling settlement of Direnfirel, near Middlemead. Since the evacuation of Edoras not many were left to defend the settlement and it has fallen to the enemy."}},
[4262]={nameES="Direnfirel: Lost in the Woods",objectivesES={}},
[4263]={nameES="Trabajo sucio: Matanza de orcos",objectivesES={"Andreg se encuentra en el Viejo Fuerte del Camino Verde, al sur de Cirith Nûr.\
\
El campamento orco estaba repleto de poderosos orcos, y en el centro del campamento había una cueva excavada en el acantilado. Debes regresar con Andreg con tu informe.","Trabajo sucio: Matanza de orcos","Encontrarás orcos acampados en Cirith Nûr, en el lado oeste del Camino Verde, al norte del Viejo Fuerte del Camino Verde.\
\
Andreg te pidió que intentaras desbaratar a los orcos en su campamento en Cirith Nûr.","Habla con Andreg en el Viejo Fuerte del Camino Verde","Los Montaraces, que vigilan los movimientos de los enemigos del norte y del sur, están preocupados por la aparición de un enemigo al que han luchado durante mucho tiempo en el norte."}},
[4264]={nameES="Desactivando alarmas",objectivesES={"Habla con Vagun en Anazârmekhem","Desactivando alarmas","Fil Gashan es el cuartel y punto de concentración de la invasión orca de Lothlórien. Oculto en lo más profundo de un paisaje ígneo y con una entrada adyacente a las Forjas de Khazad-dûm, los orcos se entrenan aquí bajo la atenta vigilancia del general Talug.","Fil Gashan se encuentra al suroeste de Anazârmekhem.\
\
Vagun te indicó que intentaras desactivar las enormes campanas de alarma que los orcos han colocado en todo Fil Gashan. Mencionó que las centinelas son buenos para detectar a cualquiera que no sea de su especie.","Vagun se encuentra en Anazârmekhem, al noreste de Fil Gashan.\
\
Intentaste desactivar varias de las alarmas. Aunque no siempre tuviste éxito, como Vagun había advertido, el intento es más importante que el éxito."}},
[4265]={nameES="Disagreeable Beasts",objectivesES={"Rádek can be found near the gates of Mount Gundabad.\
\
You have freed several frost-tusks from their hitching posts at Hanksar-mokh and Kulûg-mokh. You should return to Rádek.","Disagreeable Beasts","Frost-tusks can be found hitched to posts in Hanksar-mokh and Kulûg-mokh.\
\
Rádek has asked you to free frost-tusks from their hitching posts in an attempt to sow discord at Hanksar-mokh and Kulûg-mokh.","Gorgar the Ruthless keeps many curious beasts in his thrall. Among them, the frost-tusks possess size and might beyond that of any mere Orc, but they are reluctant to be stabled.","Talk to Rádek"}},
[4266]={nameES="Disappearing Goods",objectivesES={"Found pieces of burned notes","Disappearing Goods","Return to Bâzadur","Found signs of crates that were removed","Bâzadur has asked you to look for additional clues around the hideout in Ashâgir.","Return to Bâzadur with the information you have gathered from your investigation in Ashâgir.","Return to Bâzadur and inform him of what you found while searching the supplies.","Search for a hideout near Ningûdu","Bâzadur suggests you investigate a hideout they know of down near Ningûdu, as there may be more clues to the whereabouts of the supplies there.","Look for clues at the nearby shelters","Look for clues at the nearby rubble","Recover the stolen supplies at the hideout in Ningûdu, near Ashâgir.","Look for clues near the supply cart","Found scraps of cloth used to cover the supplies","Return to Bâzadur in Ashâgir","Return the recovered supplies to Bâzadur in the hideout in the Ashâgir camp.","Investigate the corpse found at the hideout in Ningûdu, near Ashâgir, for the missing supplies.","Found the hideout near Ningûdu","Bâzadur has asked for your help investigating the stolen supplies in Ashâgir. He has suggested inspecting the supplies themselves first to see if you can find out anything.","Investigate the corpse","Returned the recovered supplies to Bâzadur","Identified the thief","Bâzadur needs your help discovering the cause of the supplies going missing from their camp in Ashâgir, and wants you to investigate."}},
[4267]={nameES="La desaprobación de Myrtle Cenagales",objectivesES={"Recoge la tetera en el interior del agujero hobbit de Bingo","Merrimac acepta alegramente la tetera","El alcalde Pieblanco está fuera del Agujero Municipal, al sur del agujero hobbit de Bingo, en Cavada Grande.\
\
Myrtle Cenagales no aprueba la aventura de Bingo, y ha presentado una petición para que lo encierren en las CeldasAgujeros. Te ha pedido que vayas a ver si el alcalde ya se ha pronunciado al respecto.","La desaprobación de Myrtle Cenagales","Myrtle resopla con orgullo, segura de que su petición tendrá éxito","Recoge el cubo en el interior del agujero hobbit de Bingo","Merrimac Belinfante vive en el mismo barrio que Bingo en Cavada Grande.\
\
Bingo le pidió prestada una tetera a Merrimac Belinfante y quiere que se la devuelvas antes de emprender su viaje.","Myrtle Cenagales está al este del agujero hobbit de Bingo, en Cavada Grande.\
\
Has devuelto el cubo que Bingo le había pedido prestado a su vecina Myrtle, y ahora ella desea hablar contigo.","Myrtle Cenagales está fuera de su agujero hobbit, en Cavada Grande.\
\
Le has entregado las flores a Myrtle como Bingo te lo había pedido, y no sabe cómo reaccionar.","Las flores brotan a menudo cerca de la estatua de Marcho y Blanco, en el centro de Cavada Grande.\
\
Bingo te ha pedido que recojas algunas de las flores que crecen cerca de la estatua de Marcho y Blanco y se las des a Myrtle Cenagales para darle las gracias por ser tan buena vecina.","Habla con Myrtle Cenagales","Muestra la petición de Myrtle a Bingo en el interior de su agujero hobbit, en Cavada Grande","Habla con Bingo en el interior de su agujero hobbit, en Cavada Grande","Recoge flores cerca de la estatua de Marcho y Blanco, en Cavada Grande","Myrtle acepta el cubo con una mirada de desaprobación","Poppy acepta el ovillo de cordel con una sonrisa confusa","El alcalde te entrega la petición de Myrtle, que tiene un buen número de firmas","Myrtle Cenagales vive en lo alto de una pequeña colina al este del agujero hobbit de Bingo, en Cavada Grande.\
\
Bingo le pidió prestado un cubo a Myrtle, y quiere que se lo devuelvas antes de emprender su viaje.","Bingo está confiado en que está preparado para su viaje, pero ahora necesita preparar sus cosas para el viaje.","Habla con el Alcalde Will Pieblanco fuera del Agujero Municipal, en Cavada Grande","Habla con Myrtle Cenagales fuera de su agujero hobbit en Cavada Grande","Recoge el ovillo de cordel en el interior del agujero hobbit de Bingo","El alcalde Will Pieblanco te ha dado la petición de Myrtle para que se la entregues a Bingo para que sepa lo que le espera (¡y que Myrtle podría intentar encerrarlo ella misma!)","Poppy Ciñatiesa vive justo enfrente del agujero hobbit de Bingo en Cavada Grande.\
\
Bingo le pidió prestado un ovillo de cordel a Poppy Ciñatiesa y quiere que se lo devuelvas antes de emprender su viaje.","Bingo está en el interior de su agujero hobbit en el pueblo de Cavada Grande, al norte del Agujero Municipal.\
\
Bingo tiene que preparar la mochila para su viaje, y te ha pedido que le ayudes con los últimos preparativos.","Myrtle acepta las flores con una mezcla de confusión y vergüenza","Bingo está en el interior de su casa en Cavada Grande, justo al norte del Agujero Municipal.\
\
Has hecho lo que Bingo te pidió y le has dado flores a Myrtle Cenagales para agradecerle sus buenos deseos.","Dejas a Myrtle con sus pensamientos... y sus firmas"}},
[4268]={nameES="Disarm and Rearm",objectivesES={"Bundles of swords and armour pieces can be found in Tingobel in north-eastern Blackroot Vale.\
\
Thenidiel has asked you to seek out any remaining weapons and armour pieces in Tingobel in hopes that her people can aid in the defence of Lancrath.","Displaced from her home, Thenidiel of Tingobel hopes to ensure that the Rashat-hai cannot sack any other settlements in Blackroot Vale.","Deliver the swords and armour pieces to Thenidiel","DNT -- will not be seen","Thenidiel can be found in Lancrath in south-eastern Blackroot Vale.\
\
You have recovered as many weapons and armour pieces as you were able to carry, and should now deliver them to Thenidiel.","Disarm and Rearm"}},
[4269]={nameES="Disarming the Enemy",objectivesES={"You have not recovered enough swords from the Dunlendings.","Stolen swords can be found in the hands of the nearby Dunlendings.\
\
You have come across a wrecked cart that has been partially looted by the nearby Dunlendings. You should defeat them and recover the swords.","Hidden under the cover of trees, Dunlendings have ambushed a cart on the road to the Stonedeans and stolen numerous arms.","You have recovered many stolen swords from the nearby Dunlendings.","You have recovered many swords from the Dunlendings, depriving the enemies of Rohan the chance to exploit stolen arms against the Rohirrim in battle.","Collect stolen swords","While investigating a wrecked cart on the road to the Stonedeans, you have discovered a barrel emptied of swords. You surmise that the nearby Dunlendings have armed themselves with the stolen weapons. In the interests of Middlemead and Kingstead, you should defeat the Dunlendings and reclaim the stolen arms.","Completado","Dunlendings invading from the west have ransacked a passing cart and stolen numerous blades from Béored's shipment. You should reclaim them.","Disarming the Enemy"}},
[4270]={nameES="Disarming the Foe",objectivesES={"Habla con Bahanneth en Talan Fanuidhol","Disarming the Foe","Fanuidhol lies to the north-west of Talan Fanuidhol.\
\
Bahanneth wants you to enter Fanuidhol and kill several of the smiths there, as well as to destroy some of the stores of weapons they have forged. The weapons can be found stored towards the back of the camp, further to the north-west.","Bahanneth is concerned about the siege-parts you stole from the Orcs. Even without them, they will be able to construct primitive weapons to conduct a siege.","Bahanneth is at Talan Fanuidhol, south-east of Fanuidhol.\
\
You should return to Bahanneth with news of your victory."}},
[4271]={nameES="Disarming the Uruks",objectivesES={"Uruk weapons can be found in Kala-gijak.\
\
You should destroy Uruk weapons.","Faeron can be found outside Kala-gijak.\
\
You should talk to Faeron.","Faeron has suggested that while storming Kala-gijak, you should destroy any Uruk weapons you find. This will prevent them from mounting a defence.","Talk to Faeron","Disarming the Uruks"}},
[4272]={nameES="Desarmando el valle",objectivesES={"Desarmando el valle","Los misteriosos Angmarim están fuera de la cueva de los trolls en la parte sur de Taur Gonwaith, al sur de Lin Giliath.\
\
Baranwen te pidió que recolectaras cofres de armas de los Angmarim y se los llevaras para destruir esas viles armas.","Baranwen está en Lin Giliath, al noroeste de Taur Gonwaith.\
\
Baranwen espera tu regreso con las armas de los orcos, que destruirá.","Hombres del norte de Angmar han vagado hasta Taur Gonwaith.","Lleva los cofres de armas de los Angmarim a Baranwen"}},
[4273]={nameES="Discontented Dale-folk",objectivesES={}},
[4274]={nameES="Discord in the Woodland Realm",objectivesES={"Lorndúr can be found in Loeglond.\
\
You should talk to Lorndúr.","Discord in the Woodland Realm","Talk to Lorndúr","Due to recent events, King Thranduil Swiftstream has decided to close the Woodland Realm to outsiders. This has caused some friction among his people, especially the Raft-elves. Thranduil would like you to report to Loeglond to see what can be done to ease these tensions.","Loeglond can be found between Eryn Lasgalen and the Dale-lands.\
\
You should travel to Loeglond.","Travel to Loeglond","Leave Felegoth","Galion calls you over as you pass","Thranduil has asked you to head to Loeglond.\
\
You should leave Felegoth.","Talk to Galion","Galion wishes to speak with you inside Felegoth.\
\
You should talk to Galion.","Many raft-elves sit idly by, morose at their lack of work"}},
[4275]={nameES="Descubre los Salones de la Noche",objectivesES={"By completing this quest, you will be marked as completing Discover the Halls of Night","Grants completion of deed: Discover the Halls of Night","Descubre los Salones de la Noche","Habla con Javatar para completar Descubre los Salones de la Noche"}},
