[4302]={nameES="Enfermedad entre los jabalíes",objectivesES={"El condestable Cardoso se encuentra cerca de las ruinas de la Posada del Tejón Loco en Archet.\
\
Querrá saber de tu éxito.","Enfermedad entre los jabalíes","Jabalíes enfermos merodean por las tierras al sur y al este de la puerta de Archet.\
\
El condestable Cardoso cree que la mejor forma de acabar con la enfermedad que afecta a los jabalíes locales es eliminar a los ya infectados.","El condestable Cardoso está preocupado por la enfermedad que se está propagando entre los jabalíes tras la destrucción sufrida en Archet. Los jabalíes deben ser eliminados antes de que infecten a otros animales y acaben con la ya escasa comida en Archet."}},
[4303]={nameES="Diseased Prey",objectivesES={"Diseased Prey","Return to Elder Ilaya in Khûtra.","Return to Elder Ilaya in Khûtra","Khûtra Elder Ilaya has asked for your help in healing some of the afflicted wild goats surrounding Khûtra. The goats can be found in the hills north of Khûtra.","Khûtra Elder Ilaya has asked for your help in healing some of the afflicted animals surrounding Khûtra."}},
[4304]={nameES="Dishonoured Dead",objectivesES={"Bagmund is appalled by the presence of the Oathbreakers at Atburg. Despite their noble heritage as Men of Gondor, he despises them for the betrayal they performed in ages past and for the dishonourable deeds they commit on behalf of the brigands.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: If you take this quest, you will begin Bagmund's Dishonoured Dead line and will be unable to accept Wynstan's Call of Honour line.</rgb>","Eowils is outside Atburg in the Rushgore, south-east of Aculf's camp.\
\
Bagmund asked you to report your successes to the scout Eowils.","Talk to Eowils outside Atburg in the Rushgore","Dishonoured Dead","Shades can be found at Atburg, south-east of Aculf's camp in the Rushgore.\
\
Bagmund has asked you to banish the shades from Atburg and the Rushgore."}},
[4305]={nameES="Dishonoured Dead",objectivesES={}},
[4306]={nameES="Dislodged",objectivesES={"Cyneswith lies to the east, behind the large Springview Estate.\
\
You have removed many of the Orcs from the homes and farmsteads to the west. This act should restore some hope in Cyneswith.","Dislodged","The farmsteads lie at the western edge of the Norcrofts.\
\
Cyneswith has asked you to defeat many of the scavengers and defilers that have invaded and dislodged the farmers from their homes.","The homes and farms of the people of Norcrofts have fallen to the savage pillagers and defilers of the White Hand force. With neither Reeve Athelward or King Théoden willing to send men to oppose them, there is little hope of reclaiming the homes without outside intervention.","Return to Cyneswith"}},
[4307]={nameES="Disloyal to the Crown",objectivesES={"Múta can be found in Tûr Ágal, the tower in the centre of Caivád Sâr.\
\
You have learned what you could from the tortured Angmarim. You should report back to Múta.","After the Dourhands and their mysterious lord arrived at Caivád Sâr, some servants of the Iron Crown were subjected to new agonies in Tûr Ágal, while others were banished from Elderslade.","Talk to Múta","Disloyal to the Crown","Tortured Angmarim can be found in Tûr Ágal, the tower in the centre of Caivád Sâr.\
\
Múta has asked you to question the Angmarim that have been tortured by the Dourhands and their kin."}},
[4308]={nameES="Dismantling Makham Mijann",objectivesES={"The structures at the former Corsair camp contain plenty of useful materials.","Bruidis has asked you to collect wood and cloth from wood piles and banners in Makham Mijann.\
\
Makham Mijann lies north of Tadrent.","You have collected a suitable amount of wood and cloth.\
\
You should give these materials to Bruidis in Tadrent.","Dismantling Makham Mijann","Talk to Bruidis in Tadrent"}},
[4309]={nameES="Dismantling Their Efforts",objectivesES={}},
[4310]={nameES="Disorder",objectivesES={}},
[4311]={nameES="Disorder of The Eye",objectivesES={"Legolas can be found near Aiglos in Dor Amarth.\
\
You should speak with Legolas.","There seems to be a large group of Black Númenóreans gathered around the spear","Confront the wounded devoted","Return to the spot where Aiglos lies","More devoted have arrived and should be defeated","Aiglos can be found in Dor Amarth.\
\
You should travel back to Aiglos to assess the situation.","Hithgol asks for you and Legolas to assess if Aiglos is at all retrievable in its current location.","You see a wounded devoted of the Order of the Eye and should confront him","Disorder of The Eye","A wounded devoted can be found near Aiglos.\
\
You should confront the wounded devoted from the Order of the Eye.","Those devoted to the Order of the Eye can be found around Aiglos.\
\
You should defeat them if you stand any chance of retrieving the spear.","Those devoted to the Order of the Eye can be found around Aiglos.\
\
You should defeat them to stand any chance of retrieving the spear.","Confront a devoted","Habla con Legolas."}},
[4312]={nameES="Desorientación",objectivesES={"Habla con Birdie Espinajo","Birdie Espinajo se encuentra fuera del Laberinto de Setos.\
\
Debes hablar con Birdie Espinajo y contarle tu éxito al probar las cervezas siniestras del laberinto.","Desorientación","Jarras de cerveza siniestra han sido dejadas en el Laberinto de Setos para confundir los sentidos de quienes lo recorren.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro cuando finalice el festival actual. </rgb>","Se te ha acabado el tiempo","Las cervezas siniestras pueden encontrarse por todo el Laberinto de Setos, esperando a ser bebidas.\
\
Debes probarlas....... ¡pero ten cuidado! Te desorientarán durante tu recorrido."}},
[4313]={nameES="Acaba con los Trolls de las Nieves",objectivesES={"Los trolls de las nieves están entre los terribles enemigos que han tomado refugio en la antigua ciudad enana de Sarnúr.","Snár está en la Mansión de Thorin, al norte de Orodost, justo fuera del Cuartel de la Piedra Azul.\
\
Debes regresar con Snár con noticias de tu éxito contra los trolls de las nieves.","Habla con Snár en la Mansión de Thorin","Acaba con los Trolls de las Nieves","Los trolls de las nieves pueden encontrarse en lo profundo de Sarnúr, al sur de la Mansión de Thorin, a través de las ruinas de Orodost.\
\
Snár te ha pedido que derrotes a los trolls de las nieves que habitan las antiguas ruinas enanas."}},
[4314]={nameES="Dispatching a Nuisance",objectivesES={}},
[4315]={nameES="Dispersando la Nube",objectivesES={"Los murciélagos han descendido desde las Montañas Nubladas hacia el Bosque de los Trolls, espías del Enemigo que buscan el valle oculto de Imladris.","Hay murciélagos en el sur del Bosque de los Trolls.\
\
Mientras estés en el sur del Bosque de los Trolls, deberías acabar con el espionaje de los murciélagos del Enemigo en la región.","Dispersando la Nube"}},
[4316]={nameES="Disquiet in the Halls",objectivesES={"Talk to King Thorin III","Listen to King Thorin III speak of Nori","As you approach the throne of King Thorin III, you notice a number of restless dwarves gathered before it...","King Thorin III can be found before his throne in the Hall Under the Mountain.\
\
You encountered a messenger of Erebor who urged you to speak to the King under the Mountain at once.","Disquiet in the Halls","King Thorin III has asked you to listen to him speak on matters concerning Nori, the Keeper of the Coffers.","King Thorin III can be found before his throne in the Hall Under the Mountain.\
\
You have arrived at Erebor and found a number of dwarves pacing restlessly before the King under the Mountain. You should speak to King Thorin III at once.","Listen to King Thorin III speak of Karazgar","Dori can be found in the Hall under the Mountain.\
\
King Thorin III has asked you to deliver the missive Nori left behind before he departed Erebor to Dori in the Hall under the Mountain.","Listen to King Thorin III speak of Vethúg Wintermind","King Thorin III can be found before his throne in the Hall Under the Mountain.\
\
You have heard the grievances of the dwarves of Erebor, and you should now return to King Thorin III.","King Thorin III can be found before his throne in the Hall Under the Mountain.\
\
You have learned of the matters troubling King Thorin III and should now heed the will of the King under the Mountain.","Restless dwarves can be found before the throne of the King under the Mountain.\
\
King Thorin III Stonehelm has grown weary of rising tensions among the Dwarves of Erebor, and has asked you to listen to the grievances of his people that he might better understand them.","King Thorin III has asked you to listen to him speak on matters concerning Karazgar and Vethúg Wintermind.","Deliver Nori's missive to Dori in the Hall Under the Mountain","In the weeks following the defeat of Vethúg Wintermind, tensions have risen between the Dwarves of Erebor and the King under the Mountain as the Zhélruka of the East now make for the Steel Keep, Thikil-gundu."}},
[4317]={nameES="Disquieting Dreams",objectivesES={"Lady Terenis grows troubled by increasingly dark dreams of her brother and her estranged sister.","Talk to Baranor in Arnach","Disquieting Dreams","Baranor can be found in Arnach, which can be reached by travelling east across the Erui at the Crossings or by use of the bridge near the beacon Minlos.\
\
Lady Terenis has asked you to travel east to Arnach and aid the guards there in keeping the people of Lossarnach from harm."}},
[4318]={nameES="Disrupting Bel Tâkhmar",objectivesES={}},
[4319]={nameES="Control perturbado",objectivesES={"<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Usa la habilidad 'Libera la mente' en los sirvientes poseídos para avanzar en la misión.</rgb>","Habla con Sorkamâl la Tolerante","Busca y derrota a los Orcos antiguos cerca de la entrada.","Derrota a Daithúch el Bebedor de Heridas y sus secuaces para escapar.","Derrota a Daithúch el Bebedor de Heridas y sus secuaces","Sorkamâl la Tolerante ha descubierto una forma de liberar sus mentes y sacarlos. Usa su pergamino para liberar sus mentes y recoger los suministros necesarios para el esfuerzo de guerra de Mizâdi.\
\
Habla con Sorkamâl para que te dé el pergamino.","Derrota a los refuerzos de los Orcos antiguos cerca de la entrada","Daithúch el Bebedor de Heridas y sus secuaces eliminados","Busca a los sirvientes poseídos. Libéralos del control y reúne suministros adicionales por toda el área para el esfuerzo de guerra.","Los civiles dentro de los Aposentos de los Sirvientes de Emax Dûl están bajo el control de los Thardúth. Sorkamâl la Tolerante ha descubierto una forma de liberar sus mentes y sacarlos. Usa su pergamino para liberar sus mentes y recoger los suministros necesarios para el esfuerzo de guerra de Mizâdi.","A medida que los Orcos antiguos caen, Daithúch el Bebedor de Heridas emerge","Control perturbado"}},
[4320]={nameES="Disrupting the Flow",objectivesES={}},
[4321]={nameES="Disrupting the Muster",objectivesES={"Disrupting the Muster","Talk to Perindúr at Mithechad","Perindúr is at Mithechad, west of Ânug-stazg.\
\
You should tell Perindúr of your victory over the Enemy forces at Ânug-stazg.","Ânug-stazg is host to a muster of the Orcs in the Ashenslades. From here, they plan to lay waste to the Malledhrim encampment at Mithechad.","Defeat Fotak","Defeated Fotak","Fotak and his minions may be found at Ânug-stazg, due east of Mithechad.\
\
Perindúr has asked you to defeat the Orc Fotak and his warriors."}},
[4322]={nameES="Disrupting the Ritual",objectivesES={"Faerchiril is at Barad Angol, north and up the hill from Sâd Doldúr.\
\
You should speak with Faerchiril and let her know that Lidognir has been stopped and that his men have been defeated.","Talk to Faerchiril at Barad Angol","Disrupting the Ritual","Among the ruins of Sâd Doldúr, a foul sorceror is performing a ritual to further spread the blight past the reaches of the Ashenslades.","Defeat Lidognir","Defeated Lidognir","The ruins of Sâd Doldúr lie south and down the mountain pass from Barad Angol.\
\
Faerchiril has asked you to travel to Sâd Doldúr, climb to the upper reaches of the ruins, and defeat Lidognir and his men."}},
[4323]={nameES="Disruption at Barad Nemorn",objectivesES={}},
[4324]={nameES="Disruption at Harlanc",objectivesES={}},
[4325]={nameES="Disruption at Lân Mefam",objectivesES={}},
[4326]={nameES="Disruption of Crebain",objectivesES={"Faniel is concerned that the crebain are disrupting the workers of Parth Rest.","Disruption of Crebain","Faniel has asked you to defeat crebain around Parth Rest.","You have done what you can to quell the encroaching crebain. You should report your success to Faniel.\
\
Faniel can be found in Parth Rest.","Talk to Faniel in Parth Rest"}},
[4327]={nameES="Disensión en las filas",objectivesES={"Los enanos creen que pueden engañar a los Ghâsh-hai para que se alíen con las fuerzas de Mordor convenciéndolos de que Sauron es consciente de su traición.","Habla con Gúthi en el Cruce de las Cenizas","Puedes encontrar los altares Ghâsh-hai en las estructuras similares a puentes que rodean el Cruce de las Cenizas.\
\
Gúthi cree que los Ghâsh-hai pueden ser convencidos para unirse a las fuerzas de Mordor. Quiere que coloques varias piedras marcadas con el Gran Ojo en los altares cercanos al Cruce de las Cenizas.","Gúthi se encuentra en el Cruce de las Cenizas, en la parte suroeste de las Profundidades Llameantes.","Disensión en las filas"}},
[4328]={nameES="Peligros distantes",objectivesES={"Ponto Corneta de Tejonera está preocupado por la aparición de trasgos en la Comarca y quiere proteger sus derechos de pastoreo en los Campos Verdes.","Peligros distantes","Se pueden encontrar trasgos armados con lanzas en el norte de los Campos Verdes.\
\
Ponto Corneta teme que pueda ser atacado a distancia por trasgos con lanzas, si los rumores resultan ser ciertos, y te ha pedido que elimines esa amenaza.","Ponto Corneta está en Tejonera, cerca del centro del pueblo.\
\
Los rumores sobre trasgos en los Campos Verdes tenían a Ponto Corneta preocupado por su seguridad y la de sus ovejas. Te había pedido que te aseguraras de que no hubiera trasgos armados con lanzas en los campos. Encontraste muchos, pero lograste despacharlos sin demasiados problemas. Deberías decirle a Ponto que debería ser seguro para él regresar a los Campos Verdes, aunque puede que se requiera tacto para evitar entrar en pánico a los habitantes de la Comarca."}},
[4329]={nameES="Relaciones distantes",objectivesES={"Habla con Leithólf","Forochel se encuentra al norte de Evendim pasado Cirith Rhiw, al norte de Tyrn Fornech. Deberías comenzar tu búsqueda en el pueblo de Kauppa-kohta.","Relaciones distantes","Glóin busca noticias de uno de sus primos lejanos que se encuentra comerciando en la tierra de Forochel."}},
[4330]={nameES="Aversión por las verduras",objectivesES={"El joven Barhador dejó claro que preferiría comer pescado en lugar de verduras y te preguntó si podías pescar algo para que todos disfrutarais en la comida.","Este parece el lugar de pesca recomendado por Barhador","Vuelve con Barhador con los peces","Vuelve con Barhador a su campamento en el Ángulo del Mitheithel con los tres peces frescos que has pescado.","Pesca tres peces en el lugar de pesca recomendado por Barhador en el Ángulo del Mitheithel.","Encuentra el lugar de pesca que describió Barhador","Pesca tres peces en el arroyo justo al sur de donde Barhador ha acampado en el Ángulo del Mitheithel.","Aversión por las verduras"}},
[4331]={nameES="Disturbances in Thinglad",objectivesES={"Evidence of trespassers can likely be found at the water's edge in the northern part of the road in Thinglad, near where the sentinel Noriel is guarding the road.\
\
You should search for evidence of trespassers while Noriel stands guard.","Noriel guards the forest edge along the border of Lothlórien.\
\
You should bring the horseshoe to Noriel.","Noriel has asked you to search the woods nearby for signs of trespassers.\
\
You should search the forest floor for anything out of the ordinary.","Search nearby for a sign of trespassers","Disturbances in Thinglad","Bring the horseshoe to Noriel","Tell Noriel of the nets you found","You find a shoe thrown from a horse","Noriel, sentinel of Thinglad, stands on the road near the edge of Lothlórien.\
\
You should tell Noriel of the nets you found.","Noriel is a sentinel of Thinglad, the southernmost reach of Lothlórien. She believes that trespassers have appeared on their lands of late and wishes for you to investigate."}},
[4332]={nameES="Disturbed Forces",objectivesES={}},
[4333]={nameES="Restos perturbados",objectivesES={"Las tumbas perturbadas se pueden encontrar en las profundidades del ala inundada del Gran Túmulo.","Los muertos ancestrales se han alzado en el Gran Túmulo.","Restos perturbados"}},
[4334]={nameES="Noticias inquietantes",objectivesES={"Habla con Lengliel en Echad Eregion","Noticias inquietantes","Lengliel se encuentra en Echad Eregion, al sureste de Gwingris.\
\
Calelloth te ha pedido que le entregues una carta a Lengliel sobre los semiorcos y las sierpes.","Calelloth cree que las noticias sobre los asuntos de los semiorcos con las sierpes de Eregion deben difundirse por todos los campamentos élficos."}},
[4335]={nameES="Divided by War",objectivesES={"Search for Jajax's brother","Jajax's brother can be found somewhere in Hata Kebir.\
\
Jajax has begged your aid in finding his brother who he believes is among the forces at Hata Kebir.","Jajax is desperate to find his brother in Hata Kebir and hopes to free him from the misguided rule of the Heirs of Castamir.","Divided by War"}},
[4336]={nameES="Dividing the Bridge",objectivesES={}},
[4337]={nameES="¿Tienen buen sabor los avanc?",objectivesES={"Culhuc siente curiosidad por saber si los avanc serían una buena fuente de alimento.","Hay una zona de anidación de avanc en el Aguaestancada, al oeste de Lhan Garan, llamada Colmillar.\
\
Mata avancs cerca de Colmillar.","Culhuc está atendiendo el horno comunitario en Lhan Garan.\
\
Habla con Culhuc.","Habla con Culhuc"}},
[4338]={nameES="Hazme un sabor",objectivesES={"Hazme un sabor","Henepa Nudotorcido se encuentra atendiendo el bar en El Recodo del Codo en el pueblo de Campotieso.\
\
Vuelve con Henepa Nudotorcido.","La hierba lobera puede encontrarse en el borde del bosque al norte de Campotieso.\
\
Recoge hierba lobera.","Habla con Henepa Nudotorcido","Henepa Nudotorcido necesita ayuda con un dilema culinario."}},
[4339]={nameES="Do Right By the Child",objectivesES={"Talk to Shikavi","Shikavi is concerned that her child is romanticizing the life of a Corsair and may travel down a path she cannot follow.","Defeat Kina's guards","Talk to Kina in the Gut","Shikavi has asked you to try and reach Kina and help him see the realities of pirate life.","Do Right By the Child","You handled Kina's supposed friends, but they ran away in the process. You should tell Shikavi.","Kina has run away disinterested in what you have to say leaving you to deal with his friends."}},
[4340]={nameES="Do Right By the Family",objectivesES={"Confront Hûmaraz","Talk to Shikavi","Shikavi is convinced that Kina is in far deeper than she could ever fear.","Do Right By the Family","You have slain Hûmaraz, but Kina ran away again, his feelings hurt by what once was his idol. You should check in with Shikavi.\
\
Shikavi can be found outside of the Black Anchor Tavern.","Shikavi has asked you to appeal to the authority of the captain of the crew of which Kina pretends to be a member.\
\
Captain Hûmaraz can be found on the south-east end of Lower Ward."}},
[4341]={nameES="¿Conoces a... Candaith?",objectivesES={"Candaith se encuentra en su campamento, en el lado occidental de la Cima de los Vientos.\
\
Los cazadores no conocen el nombre de Candaith, pero han visto indicios de un campamento en la base occidental de la Cima de los Vientos.","Cazadores en el Paso de Moscagua podrían conocer al montaraz Candaith... sin duda vale la pena intentar ver si conocen al montaraz que vigilaba las Tierras Solitarias.","Habla con Candaith en su campamento"}},
[4342]={nameES="Does Anyone Yet Live",objectivesES={"Enemy flags can be found outside of the homes in Byre Tor.\
\
You should destroy enemy flags and search the homes for survivors of the White Hand assault.","Investigate the fourth home","Investigate the fifth home","Investigate the third home","This home has been thoroughly ravaged by Orcs","This home has been wrecked by Orcs, and no survivors remain within","Investigate the first home","Enemy flags can be found outside of the homes in Byre Tor.\
\
You should destroy Enemy flags and search the homes for survivors of the White Hand assault.","Completado","This home is empty and cold","This home is empty","Orcs have planted their flags before the doors of Byre Tor homes as a trophy of their thorough efforts at pillaging, but perhaps some people have survived....","This home has been destroyed","Investigate the second home","Tear down enemy flags and investigate homes","You have investigated many homes in Byre Tor, but they are all empty.\
\
It would appear that there are no survivors.","Does Anyone Yet Live","You have torn down the Enemy flags planted at the doors of the destroyed homes in Byre Tor.","Orcs have planted their flags before the doors of Byre Tor homes as a trophy of their thorough efforts at pillaging."}},
[4343]={nameES="Dogs of Evil",objectivesES={"Cúfaron is at Hestil's camp on Parth Galen.\
\
You have defeated many swert-hounds and should now return to Cúfaron as he asked.","Dogs of Evil","Swert-hounds can be found throughout the East Wall.\
\
Cúfaron has asked you to hunt some of the swert-hounds that haunt the East Wall.","Cúfaron regaled you with tales of his exploits, but he said he has never seen Swert-hounds like the ones that prowl the East Wall.","Talk to Cúfaron"}},
[4344]={nameES="Dogs of War",objectivesES={"The Orcs of Taur Morvith have unleashed packs of Wargs to harry intruders who would dare approach through the forests to the north.","Dogs of War","YOU SHOULDNT SEE THIS","Iavassúl is at Iavassúl's Watch in Taur Morvith.\
\
You should return the war-collars to Iavassúl.","Wargs can be found roaming throughout Taur Morvith.\
\
Iavassúl has asked you to hunt down the Wargs roaming Taur Morvith and collect their war-collars as trophies.","Bring the collars to Iavassúl at Iavassúl's Watch"}},
