[4349]={nameES="Dol Amroth - Joining the City Guard",objectivesES={"Complete Hashadîr - Trapping the Beach","Speak to Beriaudur to learn more about the city guard","Beriaudur is in Dol Amroth.\
\
Beriaudur will be pleased to hear you are now acquaintance with the Dol Amroth - Library.","Complete Hashadîr - Captains of the Crew","Dol Amroth - Joining the City Guard","Beriaudur has much to tell you about the city guard of Dol Amroth.","Speak to Beriaudur","Use the Library Tokens to earn Acquaintance with the Library","Complete Hashadîr - Slavers of Men","The guard has long been responsible for watching over Dol Amroth and ensuring the safety of its townsfolk.","You must be acquaintance with the Dol Amroth - Library to be allowed to guard over it as part of the Dol Amroth town watch.","To prove yourself able to watch over the library, you must first accomplish a series of tasks.\
\
Tolrían will be able to inform you of the necessary tasks.","Complete Hashadîr - A Place to Lie at Night"}},
