[4372]={nameES="Dolmund Has Vanished",objectivesES={"You should speak with Dolmund at the Limlight Gorge sawmill.","Dolmund Has Vanished","You freed Dolmund!","You should find Armund's brother Dolmund and help him get back to the mill.\
\
Armund said that Dolmund headed west to clear debris from upriver to keep it from fouling the sawmill's wheel.","Rescue Dolmund","Dolmund, Armund's brother, headed west from the sawmill to examine the falls and cut away any debris that might foul the sawmill's wheel, but he has not come back.","Talk to Dolmund"}},
[4373]={nameES="La perdición de Caras Gelebren",objectivesES={"<rgb=#FF0000>No permitas que Faeldor sea derrotado</rgb>","<rgb=#FF0000>Los guerreros Mírdain de la puerta norte han sido derrotados</rgb>","Resiste el cuarto asalto","Después de destruir la parte inferior de la ciudad, el Enemigo ha lanzado un nuevo asalto sobre Caras Gelebren.\
\
Debes resistir el primer asalto y permitir a Celebrimbor que prepare las últimas defensas de la Casa de los Mírdain.","Resiste el último asalto","Faeldor se encuentra en la puerta norte de Caras Gelebren.\
\
Has resistido el tercer asalto contra Caras Gelebren, pero las fuerzas del Enemigo os superan ampliamente en número. Debes hablar con Faeldor.","El campeón del Enemigo ha sido derrotado, pero la batalla no ha terminado.\
\
Ve a hablar con Celebrimbor.","El segundo asalto ha sido rechazado, pero las fuerzas del Enemigo continúan su avance sobre Caras Gelebren.\
\
Debes resistir el tercer asalto.","Has rechazado el asalto final contra Caras Gelebren, pero el enemigo ha enviado a uno de sus campeones para asegurarse de sellar el destino de Caras Gelebren.\
\
Debes derrotar al campeón del Enemigo.","<rgb=#00FF00>Has defendido Caras Gelebren contra el primer asalto</rgb>","La perdición de Caras Gelebren","<rgb=#00FF00>¡Un cuerno resuena mientras el enemigo renueva el asalto contra Caras Gelebren!</rgb>","El Enemigo ha cruzado la puerta sur de Caras Gelebren.\
\
Debes resistir el cuarto asalto y ayudar a Celebrimbor en la defensa de la Casa de los Mírdain.","<rgb=#FF0000>No permitas que Celebrimbor sea derrotado</rgb>","Resiste el tercer asalto","<rgb=#00FF00>Has defendido Caras Gelebren contra el último asalto</rgb>","<rgb=#FF0000>No permitas que los guerreros Mírdain de la puerta sur sean derrotados</rgb>","<rgb=#00FF00>Has defendido Caras Gelebren contra el segundo asalto</rgb>","El Enemigo ha tomado las puertas de Caras Gelebren.\
\
Debes resistir el último asalto y ayudar a Celebrimbor a defender la Casa de los Mírdain.","Habla con Celebrimbor","<rgb=#00FF00>Has defendido Caras Gelebren contra el tercer asalto</rgb>","<rgb=#FF0000>¡Celebrimbor ha caído!</rgb>","Derrota al campeón del Enemigo","<rgb=#FF0000>¡Faeldor ha caído!</rgb>","Resiste el segundo asalto","Resiste el primer asalto","<rgb=#FF0000>Los guerreros Mírdain de la puerta sur han sido derrotados</rgb>","El primer asalto ha sido rechazado, pero las fuerzas del Enemigo continúan su avance sobre Caras Gelebren.\
\
Debes resistir el segundo asalto.","Caras Gelebren, el bastión plateado, fue una vez la capital de Tham Mírdain y la joya de Eregion. Por desgracia, la ruina cayó sobre ella cuando Sauron, buscando hacerse con los Anillos de Poder, reunió sus vastos ejércitos y destruyó toda Eregion.","Las fuerzas del Enemigo han invadido la ciudad, y aunque hayas triunfado contra uno de los campeones del Enemigo, Caras Gelebren está perdida.\
\
Debes aguantar junto a Celebrimbor contra el Enemigo.","Defiende Caras Gelebren del Enemigo","<rgb=#00FF00>¡El campeón del Enemigo ha sido derrotado!</rgb>","Celebrimbor está liderando la defensa de Caras Gelebren contra los ejércitos del Enemigo.\
\
Debes hablar con Celebrimbor.","Celebrimbor se encuentra en la Casa de los Mírdain en la parte más oriental de Caras Gelebren.\
\
Faeldor te ha pedido que le digas a Celebrimbor que las fuerzas del Enemigo pronto penetrarán a través de las puertas interiores de Caras Gelebren. Debes hablar con Celebrimbor.","<rgb=#FF0000>No permitas que los guerreros Mírdain de la puerta norte sean derrotados</rgb>","<rgb=#00FF00>Has defendido Caras Gelebren contra el cuarto asalto</rgb>","Habla con Faeldor"}},
[4374]={nameES="La perdición de Caras Gelebren -- Incursión",objectivesES={"Caras Gelebren, el bastión plateado, fue una vez la capital de Tham Mírdaim y la joya de Eregion. Determinado a poseer los Anillos de Poder, Sauron declaró la guerra a los Elfos y condujo a sus vastos ejércitos a Eregion para arrasar Caras Gelebren.","Completa 'La perdición de Caras Gelebren' en un grupo de incursión","Caras Gelebren, el bastión plateado, fue una vez la capital de Tham Mírdaim y la joya de Eregion. Determinado a poseer los Anillos de Poder, Sauron declaró la guerra a los Elfos y condujo a sus vastos ejércitos a Eregion para arrasar Caras Gelebren.\
\
¡Ayuda a Lord Celebrimbor y a los Elfos de Eregion a resistir contra las fuerzas de Sauron!","La perdición de Caras Gelebren -- Incursión"}},
[4375]={nameES="Doomed Invocation",objectivesES={"After informing Hênok of what you discovered you have been asked to return to Ghâs Hejai in Dil-irmíz.","Informed Bôgalekh of your victory in Ghâs Hejai","Return to Bôgalekh in Jadambor in Dil-irmíz and inform them of your triumph over the Hakâri.","Defeat Khadimâl and stop the Hakâri ritual","Khadimâl must be stopped before they complete their ritual within Ghâs Hejai in Dil-irmíz.","Doomed Invocation","Hênok has asked you to defeat Khadimâl and stop the ritual in Ghâs Hejai.","Defeated Khadimâl and stopped the Hakâri ritual","Discovered the ritual location in Ghâs Hejai","Return to Bôgalekh in Jadambor","Discover the ritual location in Ghâs Hejai"}},
[4376]={nameES="Double the Damage",objectivesES={}},
[4377]={nameES="Enanos hoscos",objectivesES={"Enanos hoscos","En Annunlos yace una ruina, abandonada desde hace mucho por los Eglain. Despojada y con sólo las profundidades sin explorar, los Eglain dejaron lo que había bajo la ruina, como es su costumbre. Sin embargo, la ruina ahora vuelve a rebosar de vida, pues enanos, presumiblemente aliados con Orcos, registran las profundidades en busca de tesoros.","Entrega la bandera a Refr Mercurio","Bandera de los enanos recogida","Recoge una bandera de los enanos","Las ruinas de Thandobel se encuentran al sur de Refr Mercurio, en Annunlos.\
\
Refr Mercurio expresó su deseo de saber qué clase de enanos se dignarían a trabajar junto a los Orcos y te ha pedido que vayas a las ruinas de Thandobel y captures una de sus banderas."}},
[4378]={nameES="Caras duras",objectivesES={"Teodoro Tojo está en las ruinas de Gwingris, en Eregion.\
\
Spalvi te ha dado la Piedra de Roth para que se la des a Teodoro Tojo, ya que él no debe ya lealtad a los Duramano y no quiere conservar su tesoro.","Dale la Piedra de Roth a Haley Pradodulce en Gwingris","La Cordillera de Acebeda está al sureste de Gwingris.\
\
Spalvi te ha pedido que viajes con él hasta la Cordillera de Acebeda , desde donde tendréis una buena vista de las tierras de alrededor y deberíais ser capaz de ver a cualquier Duramano que se aproxime a vuestra posición.","Habla con Spalvi en la Cordillera de Acebeda, al sureste de Gwingris","Explora el camino que va hacia el norte de Eregion al Bosque de los Trolls, y mantente alerta de cualquier cosa sospechosa","Spalvi está esperando para hablar contigo antes de viajar al Paso del Cuerno Rojo en busca de entradas de cuevas que pudieran acercaros a Bingo.","Dale la Piedra de Roth a Teodoro Tojo en Gwingris","Spalvi te ha pedido que te quedes cerca de él y <rgb=#FF0000>mires</rgb> a la distancia desde la Cordillera de Acebeda para ver si detectas a alguno de los Duramano que os persiguen.","Spalvi está en las ruinas de Gwingris, en el noroeste de Eregion.\
\
Has encontrado un hacha clavada en un árbol no muy lejos de Gwingris, y deberías llevársela a Spalvi.","Lleva el hacha amenazadora a Spalvi en Gwingris, en Eregion","Miras a lo lejos pero no ves ninguna señal de Duramanos persiguiéndote","Spalvi está en las ruinas de Gwingris, en Eregion.","Spalvi se ha ido poniendo cada vez más nervioso por algo, lo que no parece algo normal en él. ¿Qué le preocupa?","Haley Pradodulce está en las ruinas de Gwingris, en Eregion.\
\
Convencido de que era falso y sin valor, Teodoro no quiso quedarse con la Piedra de Roth. Quizás Haley Pradodulce opine de forma diferente.","Habla con Spalvi en la Cordillera de Acebeda y asciende las montañas para buscar a Bingo","Sacas el hacha del árbol, y reflexionas sobre su significado","Spalvi está nervioso por algo, y quería que echaras un vistazo al camino que tomasteis desde el Bosque de los Trolls a Eregion en busca de algo sospechoso. El camino deja Gwingris al sureste antes de girar al norte y continuar hacia el Bosque de los Trolls.","Quédate cerca de Spalvi en la Cordillera de Acebeda","<rgb=#FF0000>Mira</rgb> al horizonte desde la cima de la Cordillera de Acebeda","Spalvi te entrega la Piedra de Roth con una sonrisa torcida","Retira el hacha del árbol","Habla con Spalvi en Gwingris, en Eregion","Caras duras","Ves un hacha clavada en un árbol, junto al camino","Un hacha está clavada en un árbol junto al camino que lleva desde Eregion al Bosque de los Trolls."}},
[4379]={nameES="Blasones Duramano — Introducción",objectivesES={"La entrada a Sarnúr está al sur de la Mansión de Thorin y al oeste de Noglond, en las ruinas de Orodost.\
\
Tórth te ha pedido que entres en la fortaleza de los Duramano en Sarnúr y acabes con las criaturas que habitan allí, reclamando los blasones duramano como prueba de tu valor.","Los descendientes de Skorgrím Duramano han sido desde siempre una espina para el linaje de Durin, los Barbiluengos. Aunque ahora son parias, continúan siendo una amenaza para los Pueblos Libres de Ered Luin.","Blasones Duramano — Introducción","Lleva los blasones duramano a Tórth"}},
[4380]={nameES="Dourhands in a Bind",objectivesES={"Dourhands in a Bind","Captured Dourhands can be found at Sadauk-kala in western Máttugard.\
\
You should free the captured Dourhands.","Stolen supplies can be found at Sadauk-kala in Máttugard.\
\
You should recover the stolen supplies.","Talk to one of the freed Dourhands","The freed Dourhands can be found near Steepset in Máttugard.\
\
You should talk to one of the freed Dourhands.","Free the captured Dourhands","The freed Dourhands can be found near Steepset in Máttugard.\
\
You should bring the supplies to one of the freed Dourhands.","You find a few of greedy Dourhands who have been captured by the hobgoblin forces here in Sadauk-kala. It is only a matter of time before the hobgoblins obtain useful information from the Dourhands, and they would certainly use what they learn against those who seek to reclaim the Mountain-hold. You decide to rescue the Dourhands.","Bring the supplies to one of the freed Dourhands","A small group of greedy Dourhands has been captured by the hobgoblin forces in Máttugard."}},
[4381]={nameES="Apagando el incendio de la granja",objectivesES={"Busca una cubeta vacía","Debes decirle a Erina que has apagado muchos de los incendios en la granja Hove.\
\
Erina está en la granja Sculoc, al norte de Cardolan.","Ahora que tienes un cubo de agua, puedes apagar las llamas que devoran la granja de la familia Hove.\
\
La granja se encuentra en el norte de Cardolan.","Vuelve a Erina","Erina te ha pedido que apagues los incendios en la granja de la familia Hove. Debes buscar una cubeta en la granja Scurloc con el que llenar de agua para apagar las llamas.\
\
La granja Scurloc se encuentra en el norte de Cardolan.","Llena la cubeta en la granja de los Hove","Has encontrado una cubeta vacía, pero ahora tienes que llenarla de agua.\
\
Deberías encontrar el estanque en la granja de la familia Hove, al norte de Cardolan.","El agua se derrama por los lados de la cubeta","Apagando el incendio de la granja"}},
[4382]={nameES="Down By The Docks",objectivesES={"Talk to Sigeric","This scout was forcibly drowned by the Orcs - a cruel end...","Find the second Rohirrim scout","Down By The Docks","Find the third Rohirrim scout","Sigeric, the man you rescued from the sacked farmstead, has asked that you look for three Men that left the morning of the attack to go fishing. They have not returned and Sigeric fears the worst.","Sigeric, the survivor of Garsfeld, can be found in northern Snowbourn.","Sigeric wants you to look for three men dispatched to deal with the Orc situation outside the fishing village to the south-east.\
\
He also wants you to slay the Orcs that have sacked the town.","This scout was clearly slain by the nearby Orcs","Find the first Rohirrim scout"}},
[4383]={nameES="Down From the Emyn-nu-Fuin",objectivesES={"You have defeated many Orcs in Eryn Lasgalen and have assisted the Elves in their efforts to restore the forest.","Orcs who escaped the Battle Under the Trees now hide in the vicinity of the Emyn-nu-Fuin.","Defeated many Orc-kind in Eryn Lasgalen.","Completado","Down From the Emyn-nu-Fuin","Orcs can be found scattered throughout Eryn Lasgalen.\
\
King Thranduil has bade you defeat any Orc-kind you come across."}},
[4384]={nameES="Down From the Tower",objectivesES={"Murig can be found at the watch-tower in Trum Dreng.\
\
You should bang on the door to see if Murig will be foolish enough to come down from his eyrie.","Murig has been driven off once again","Bang on the door to the watch-tower to summon Murig","Down From the Tower","Elain can be found on the hill that leads to the watch-tower, defending against approaching Dragon-clansmen in the plains.\
\
You should return to Elain and tell her that the watch-tower has been reclaimed for the Stag-clan.","Return to Elain on the path to the watch-tower","Murig has settled at the watch-tower of Trum Dreng. If this waypoint is to be secured, he must be called down and defeated so that the Stag-clan can reclaim it."}},
[4385]={nameES="Down Payment",objectivesES={"Return to Cíllan at the refugee camp","Cíllan hopes to make a payment on the manor to secure a place to live for her people with the savings you recovered from Langhold.","Bring Cíllan's first payment to Frithbéorth","Down Payment","Frithbéorth reluctantly hands over the keys to his family's large manor.","Cíllan awaits you at the refugees' camp outside of Harwick.\
\
You should hasten to Cíllan to hand her the keys and tell her of the deal with Frithbéorth... and it would be wise to mention the rats as well.","Speak to Frithbéorth to enter the manor","Frithbéorth is in Harwick, waiting patiently for a delivery of three-hundred gold to secure the purchase of his family's large manor.\
\
You should bring Cíllan's down payment to Frithbéorth and see if he will accept it."}},
[4386]={nameES="Desde las montañas",objectivesES={"Se pueden encontrar orcos a lo largo de todo el camino que atraviesa Nanduhirion, el Valle del Arroyo Sombrío, al noroeste de Talan Haldir.\
\
Hadroneth te ha pedido que reduzcas el número de orcos que han salido del interior de las montañas.","Hadroneth está preocupado por la gran cantidad de orcos que han salido de las puertas de Moria hacia el Valle del Arroyo Sombrío, y quiere que reduzcas su número.","Desde las montañas","Hadroneth se encuentra en Talan Haldir, a orillas del Nimrodel.\
\
El elfo Hadroneth está esperando que le informes de tu éxito en la eliminación de los orcos que han salido de las Puertas de Moria hacia Nanduhirion."}},
[4387]={nameES="¿Bajado de las Montañas?",objectivesES={"Lleva el broche a Ringhul en el Páramo Alto","Arifael vive en las laderas de Amon Nendir, al sur del Páramo Alto, en el borde oriental del Bosque de los Trolls.\
\
A Elrohir le preocupan las huellas de gigante que viste en Tâl Bruinen y quiere que preguntes a Arifael si ha oído hablar de gigantes que vaguen tan al sur.","Has descubierto una serie de huellas de gigante en Tâl Bruinen y un broche perteneciente a Ringhul, montaraz del Páramo Alto.","Habla con Arifael","Ringhul está en su puesto en el Páramo Alto, al norte y al este de Tâl Bruinen.\
\
Candelleth te dijo que el broche que encontraste pertenece a un antiguo explorador suyo llamado Ringhul, que ahora está destinado en el Páramo Alto, y sugirió que se lo lleves y le preguntes acerca del gigante."}},
[4388]={nameES="Colina abajo",objectivesES={"Habla con Andreg en el Fuerte del Camino Verde","Colina abajo","Oddvarr finalmente recordó que pidió ayuda antes de tu llegada.","Andreg está en el Viejo Fuerte del Camino Verde, al oeste de Hengstacer.\
\
Oddvarr te pidió que le dijeras al Montaraz Andreg que agradece la ayuda de los Montaraces y que los orcos han bajado desde los tramos orientales de las Quebradas del Norte."}},
[4389]={nameES="Down with His Ship",objectivesES={}},
[4390]={nameES="Abajo, Abajo a la Ciudad de los Trasgos",objectivesES={"Glóin está acampado fuera de la entrada a la Ciudad de los Trasgos.\
\
Nogmeldir te ha pedido que encuentres a Glóin y le pidas ayuda para hallar a Glorwen.","Tras derrotar al líder de la manada de huargos, Colmillo Negro, y descubrir el posible paradero de la cazadora élfica desaparecida, Glorwen, ahora afrontas la sombría tarea de adentrarte en las profundidades de la Ciudad de los Trasgos para rescatarla.","Abajo, Abajo a la Ciudad de los Trasgos","Glorwen está prisionera en la Ciudad de los Trasgos.\
\
Nogmeldir te ha pedido que encuentres y rescates a la exploradora Glorwen."}},
[4391]={nameES="Pagos iniciales",objectivesES={"Pagos iniciales","Habla con Adso Henoloma","Dirígete a la Vieja Granja Dulcésped, al noreste del campamento de Adso, y ayuda a Adso a ahuyentar a los bandidos de su campamento.\
\
Adso no encuentra otra forma de expulsar a los bandidos que no implique violencia. Te envió a luchar y derrotar bandidos cerca de la Vieja Granja Dulcésped.","Adso Henoloma te ha pedido ayuda en una acción seria contra los bandidos que lo extorsionan y amenazan a él y a sus trabajadores.","Adso Henoloma espera tu regreso en su campamento, al suroeste de la Vieja Granja Dulcésped, junto al Gran Camino del Este.\
\
Debes regresar con Adso Henoloma con noticias de tu éxito."}},
[4392]={nameES="Dragoncillos de la Vieja Ciudad del Cuerno de Plata",objectivesES={"Informa a Öndótt de que la población de dragoncillos ha disminuido","Los siniestros dragoncillos de las Vetas del Cuerno de Plata han acabado con varios enanos que transportaban suministros entre los campamentos enanos de las Vetas del Cuerno de Plata y las Obras Hidráulicas.","Dragoncillos de la Vieja Ciudad del Cuerno de Plata","Öndótt se encuentra en lo alto de la escalera de la Vieja Ciudad del Cuerno de Plata.\
\
Deberías volver con Öndótt.","En la Vieja Ciudad del Cuerno de Plata, situada al sur de las Vetas del Cuerno de Plata, se pueden encontrar dragoncillos enfermos.\
\
Deberías acabar con muchos de los dragoncillos enfermos."}},
[4393]={nameES="Dragons with White Hands",objectivesES={"Guto can be found at his small camp-site in the southern fields of Trum Dreng.\
\
You should return to Guto with the White Hand symbols you collected.","Dragon-clansmen in the White Hand encampment show signs of belonging to Isengard instead of acting upon their own motives.\
\
You should collect evidence of the White Hand from the Dragon-clan warriors of the encampment.","Return to Guto at his encampment","The Dragon-clan must be taught a lesson if they are to attack their fellow Men at the bidding of Isengard.","Dragons with White Hands"}},
[4394]={nameES="Draigoch's Lair -- Discovery",objectivesES={}},
[4395]={nameES="Drakes On the Cliffs",objectivesES={}},
[4396]={nameES="Drakes of the Ghâshghurm",objectivesES={}},
[4397]={nameES="Drakes' Cradle",objectivesES={}},
[4398]={nameES="Pociones para todos (Diario)",objectivesES={"Fabrica una caja de pociones para el Gremio de Eruditos de Umbar.","La receta necesaria para completar esta misión está disponible para su compra. <rgb=#00f000>Compra la receta de la misión al líder del gremio.</rgb>\
\
Prepara una caja de pociones para Umbar Baharbêl.","Pociones para todos (Diario)","El gremio de eruditos de Umbar Baharbêl suministra pociones para los curanderos. Te pidieron que ayudes a satisfacer la demanda.","Caja de pociones fabricada para el Gremio de Eruditos de Umbar.","Proporciona la caja de pociones al líder del Gremio de Eruditos de Umbar.","Entrega una caja de pociones al líder del Gremio de Eruditos de Umbar."}},
[4399]={nameES="Pociones para todos (Diario)",objectivesES={"Fabrica una caja de pociones para el Gremio de Eruditos de Umbar.","La receta necesaria para completar esta misión está disponible para su compra. <rgb=#00f000>Compra la receta de la misión al líder del gremio.</rgb>\
\
Prepara una caja de pociones para Umbar Baharbêl.","Pociones para todos (Diario)","El gremio de eruditos de Umbar Baharbêl suministra pociones para los curanderos. Te pidieron que ayudes a satisfacer la demanda.","Caja de pociones fabricada para el Gremio de Eruditos de Umbar.","Proporciona la caja de pociones al líder del Gremio de Eruditos de Umbar.","Entrega una caja de pociones al líder del Gremio de Eruditos de Umbar."}},
[4400]={nameES="Pociones para Umbar (Semanal)",objectivesES={"Completa las solicitudes del Gremio de Eruditos de Umbar.\
\
Puedes adquirir estas misiones del líder del Gremio de Eruditos de Umbar en la sala del gremio de artesanos de Umbar Baharbêl.","Completaste muchas solicitudes de eruditos de Umbar.","Completado","Pociones para Umbar (Semanal)","Los eruditos proveen a las masas de Umbar Baharbêl, y tú estás haciendo tu parte para ayudar.","Completa las cuotas diarias para el Gremio de Eruditos de Umbar."}},
[4401]={nameES="Draughts for the Dwarves",objectivesES={}},
[4402]={nameES="Draurákh, the Wolf Den",objectivesES={"Talk to Náth at Fellgát","Náth has asked you to find the wolf den called Draurákh west of Fellgát and defeat the wolves within.\
\
You should defeat wolves in Draurákh, including the pack leader, Snárfrek.","You have cleared the wolf pack from Draurákh.\
\
You should talk to Náth in Fellgát.","Defeat Snárfrek","Náth has asked you to clear a den of wolves west of Fellgát.","Draurákh, the Wolf Den","Defeated Snárfrek"}},
[4403]={nameES="Dravron's Secrets",objectivesES={"Talk to Dervorin","Dervorin would like you to see if anyone in Ethring has any information regarding Dravron.\
\
Talk to the citizens of Ethring.","Talk to the tax collector","Dervorin hopes the people of Ethring may offer insight into Dravron's operation.","Dravron's Secrets","Talk to the lumber camp labourer","The man's face turns grim when you mention Dravron.\
\
'That man is an absolute good for nothing! All me and the fellas want to do is good, honest work, but the boss has us sitting on our rear ends most days.'","You have asked around about Dravron and should report back to Dervorin with your findings.\
\
Talk to Dervorin in Ethring."}},
[4404]={nameES="Drawing Maps",objectivesES={"Aerin has asked you to hide a false map somewhere in Hata Kebir, east of Aerthir.\
\
Find a place to hide the map.","Drawing Maps","You have found a good place to hide the false map","Talk to Aerin","You have successfully hidden the map, and should inform Aerin.\
\
Talk to Aerin in Aerthir.","Reluctantly, Aerin tears her gaze from her book and smiles at you.\
\
'Did you do it? Did you hide the map? Oh how delightful! I'm not entirely sure what the purpose of the original map is, but I can tell you that the map that I made points to nothing but sewer entrances! I hope they have fun rooting around in the muck.\
\
'Now, if you'll excuse me, I'd like to see how this duel ends.'\
\
She returns to her reading, quickly forgetting you're there.","Aerin wishes to mislead some bandits in nearby Hata Kebir.","Find a good place to hide the false map"}},
[4405]={nameES="Atrayendo al enemigo",objectivesES={"Has preparado el campamento falso","Atrayendo al enemigo","Habla con Limlaer","Establece el campamento falso y derrota a Râkhuga.","Derrotó a Râkhuga el Rastreador.","Limlaer está al sureste de Echad Dúnann, a lo largo del camino de Nan Sirannon.\
\
Deberías regresar a Limlaer con noticias sobre tu éxito.","Limlaer ha solicitado tu ayuda para tender pistas falsas y atraer al Enemigo hacia el sur.","El emplazamiento del campamento falso se encuentra al suroeste de Limlaer, entre Porth Cadlus y Goeolhad, en una cuenca rodeada de rocas.\
\
Limlaer te ha encomendado la tarea de tender una trampa a los exploradores del Enemigo."}},
[4406]={nameES="Atrayendo a la manada",objectivesES={"El Viejo Artemisa está en el campamento al este de Minas Eriol.\
\
Después de sacar a la manada de Zarpasombra a campo abierto, derrotaste al líder huargo. El Viejo Artemisa querrá saber de tu victoria.","Atrayendo a la manada","Invocaste y derrotaste a Zarpasombra","Habla con el Viejo Artemisa","Mientras cazabas los huargos de Nain Enidh, Artemisa preparó una comida especial para su líder. Todo lo que queda para facilitar el paso por el Gran Camino del Este es sacar a este líder de su escondite y llevarlo a la batalla.","Invoca y derrota a Zarpasombra","La mesa de piedra donde debes verter el potaje de Artemisa está al final de un sendero hacia el sur, cerca de un poste de señales en el camino que atraviesa Nain Enidh.\
\
El Viejo Artemisa te pidió que llevaras el potaje especial que preparó a una piedra antigua cerca de la guarida de los huargos. El hedor debería atraer a su líder."}},
[4407]={nameES="Drawn to Death",objectivesES={}},
[4408]={nameES="Drawn to War",objectivesES={"Faltharan can be found overlooking the eastern gate of Pelargir.\
\
Angbor has grown concerned by the behaviour of Faltharan, the son of the Lord of Pelargir, and wishes for you to speak to him.","<rgb=#FF00FF>Calm</rgb> Faltharan and ask of his troubles","Faltharan, lord regent of Pelargir, seeks to uncover the fate of his father before all hope is lost.","Talk to Faltharan","Faltharan can be found overlooking the eastern gate of Pelargir.\
\
You have found Faltharan and should now try to calm him before he rushes out into combat.","Faltharan can be found overlooking the eastern gate of Pelargir.\
\
You have listened to Faltharan's troubles, and should now assure him of your intent to help him.","Faltharan appears lost in thought as you approach, and his gaze is fixed on the eastern gate of Pelargir.\
\
'I know you have come to dissuade me, friend, but I cannot be turned from my task.\
\
'So much has happened in so swift a time... it has been but a few days since Pelargir was reclaimed, but still many more troubles weigh on me...'","Talk to Faltharan, Son of Sirgon","Drawn to War"}},
[4409]={nameES="Drawn to the Marshes",objectivesES={"<rgb=#FF00FF>Poke</rgb> the Ranger and attempt to wake him from the trance","The remaining Rangers in Anborn's company fled northward from the battle plain after the Wainriders ambushed them, but may now have become enthralled by the glimmering lights that dance about the Dead Marshes.","Faramir can be found at the foot of Dol Acharn in Dagorlad.\
\
You have freed the remaining Rangers from their trances and sent them back to Haerondir. You should now speak to Faramir near Dol Acharn.","The remaining Rangers can be found somewhere in the southern reaches of the Dead Marshes in northern Dagorlad.\
\
Faramir has informed you that the rest of the Rangers fled northward into the dangerous shallows of the Dead Marshes. You should seek them out at once.","Talk to Faramir at the foot of Dol Acharn","You have found a Ranger staring blankly into the waters of the Dead Marshes...","Drawn to the Marshes","The Ranger wakes from the trance!"}},
[4410]={nameES="Atraído por el agua",objectivesES={"Gyrgir cree que el hongo preferiría vivir en el agua que en los orcos. Quiere estudiar más a fondo la infección.","Atraído por el agua","Gyrgir te espera en Hulwul-nefekh, al oeste de la Cámara de las Aguas Oscuras.\
\
Has matado a varios orcos globsnaga y has recogido suficientes esporas de hongo para que los enanos puedan investigarlas. Regresa a ver a Gyrgir en Hulwul-nefekh y entrégale las esporas.","Regresa a Gyrgir con las esporas","Los orcos globsnaga se pueden encontrar en las orillas cerca de la Cámara de las Aguas Oscuras, al sur de la Bodega Putrefacta.\
\
Gyrgir quiere que recojas esporas de hongo de varios orcos globsnaga. Cree que con ellas podrá aprender cosas importantes para crear un antídoto."}},
[4411]={nameES="Atraído por el agua",objectivesES={"As Quickbeam's Huorn marches about above the Entwash's banks, you notice it begin to swat its branches at the nearby wood-flies, narrowly missing your head in the process. In the absence of the Ents and most other Huorns, it is clear that these disease-laden flies have grown unchecked and wild.\
\
You should aid the Huorn in culling their numbers.","Atraído por el agua","Wood-flies can be found throughout Fangorn Forest to the west of Derndingle.\
\
The Huorn seeks your aid in thinning the number of wood-flies in Fangorn Forest. You should defeat them.","Talk to Quickbeam's Huorn","You have slain many wood-flies and reduced the threat they posed to the Entwash and nearby trees.","Quickbeam's Huorn seems pleased that you have made an effort to rid the forest of disease-laden wood-flies. You slew many of their number, and judging by numerous crushed wings stuck to the Huorn's branches, so did it.","DNT -- Players will not see","In the absence of the Ents, wood-flies have spread out of control and threaten to overwhelm the forest."}},
[4412]={nameES="Dread Shells from Loeg Thangalf",objectivesES={"Maelvír has asked you to bring back shells from the dread-turtles inhabiting a nearby island.\
\
You can hunt dread-turtles on the island of Loeg Thangalf, in Pinnath Gelin.","With multiple dread-turtle shells in hand, you should return to Maelvír.\
\
Maelvír is at Mereham, in central Pinnath Gelin.","Return to Maelvír","Dread Shells from Loeg Thangalf","The island of Loeg Thangalf has become home to ferocious dread-turtles, whose shells may well serve to provide protection and armour for the Knights of the Green Hills."}},
[4413]={nameES="Terror en la ciudad caída",objectivesES={"Se pueden encontrar tres piedras centinelas menores en algún lugar de la ciudad de Dún Covád, al norte de Aughaire, en las colinas occidentales de Fasach-falroid.\
\
Sorkha quiere que encuentres las ubicaciones de estas tres piedras centinelas menores dentro de Dún Covád.","Sorkha, de los Trév Gállorg, está preocupado por las piedras centinelas menores que se han erigido en la ciudad de Dún Covád.","Sorkha está en el Búth Luikh de Aughaire.\
\
Has localizado tres piedras centinelas menores dentro de la ciudad de Dún Covád y ahora debes regresar a Sorkha con el conocimiento de sus ubicaciones.","Terror en la ciudad caída"}},
[4414]={nameES="Dreams of Fire and Giants",objectivesES={"Talk to Béortnoth outside of Thornhope","You found Thane Béortnoth, the last known survivor of the Orcs' assault on Thornhope, wandering half mad with injury and grief.","Thornhope lies just down the road from Béortnoth's camp.\
\
Thane Béortnoth has asked you to search Thornhope for other survivors.","You found nothing here","Thane Béortnoth is encamped outside of Thornhope.\
\
You should return to Béortnoth with news of your findings.","Dreams of Fire and Giants"}},
[4415]={nameES="Dredging a Path for Aragorn",objectivesES={}},
[4416]={nameES="Dredging up the Past",objectivesES={"It would seem to be a hobbit-hole, but there is little comfort to be found here","The warrens of Tûn Melen can be found to the south of Tûn Melen in the south-western Gladden Fields.\
\
You have searched the ruined excavation site at Tûn Melen, but you found no sign of Sharkey or his men. You should continue your search to the south and find the warrens of Tûn Melen.","The warrens of Tûn Melen can be found to the south of Tûn Melen in the south-western Gladden Fields.\
\
You have found the warrens of Tûn Melen. You should investigate them, but proceed carefully, as Sharkey and his men are likely gathered inside.","Investigate Tûn Melen","Find the warrens of Tûn Melen","Talk to the imprisoned Woodman in the warrens of Tûn Melen","A faint voice cries out from a small alcove in the warrens of Tûn Melen","Investigate the warrens of Tûn Melen","The imprisoned Woodman can be found in a small alcove to the right of the entrance to the warrens of Tûn Melen.\
\
After entering the warrens of Tûn Melen, you heard a faint cry from a Woodman in a cage. You should speak to the imprisoned Woodman and learn what has happened in the warrens of Tûn Melen.","A hastily-repaired dredging machine has been used to burrow into the hillside","Amidst the sunken dredging machines at Tûn Melen, you notice a number of crumbling foundations","Find and explore the ruined excavation site at Tûn Melen","The ruined excavation site at Tûn Melen can be found somewhere among the ruined dredging machines in the northern reaches of Tûn Melen.\
\
Sharkey's orders told of a ruined excavation site in the northern reaches of Tûn Melen. You should find it and explore it.","Dredging up the Past","The orders make note of Woodmen helping Sharkey search a place called Tûn Melen","After searching the belongings of Sharkey's lieutenant, you discover orders sealed by a small waxen 'S'. If these are orders from Sharkey, you should examine them at once.\
\
You should unseal the orders and learn what Sharkey's plans are for the Gladden Fields.","With knowledge gained from the Woodmen, Sharkey has expanded his search to curious, old tunnels beneath the Gladden Fields.","Sharkey's orders can be found in your inventory.\
\
You have discovered orders from Sharkey after defeating Sharkey's lieutenant at Sharkey's Slough.","Read 'Sharkey's Orders'","Tûn Melen can be found in the south-western reaches of the Gladden Fields.\
\
You have found orders from Sharkey detailing excavations at a place called Tûn Melen. According to the orders, it seems to be located to the south-west of Sharkey's Slough.","Rotting furniture and cracked plates litter the room, but you find no sign of Sharkey's Men"}},
[4417]={nameES="Dress-up",objectivesES={}},
[4418]={nameES="Dressage",objectivesES={"Wait for the next move","Dressage is the art of rider and horse becoming one and going through a series of choreographed manoeuvres.","The dressage rider is in a field behind the fountain in Cliving.\
\
Gladsnel has challenged you to perform a course of dressage practice.","Wait for the next round of dressage to begin","Talk to Gladsnel","Gladsnel is at Cliving.\
\
Gladsnel will be surprised to hear that you passed the dressage practice.","The dressage has begun","Perform the matching move in time","<rgb=#FF0000>Completing Aiding the Eastemnet will cancel this quest</rgb>","Prepare for the next move","Dressage"}},
[4419]={nameES="Drive Them Off",objectivesES={"Talk to Perindúr at Mithechad","Drive Them Off","Wargs can be found throughout the Ashenslades, but many are gathered to the south of Mithechad, near Naur-hoit.\
  \
Perindúr has asked you to hunt down and defeat the Wargs of the Ashenslades.","Across the Ashenslades, there are small packs of Wargs that harass Malledhrim patrols through the area.","Perindúr is at Mithechad, north of Naur-hoit.\
\
You should return to Perindúr and tell him of your success in the hunt."}},
[4420]={nameES="Drive Them Out",objectivesES={}},
[4421]={nameES="¡Expúlsalos!",objectivesES={"Derrota a la Gran Matriarca de la Nieve","La Gran Matriarca de la Nieve puede encontrarse en la tundra occidental.\
\
Derrotarla asustará a la manada de yetis y hará que se vuelvan contra los Gauredain.","Las Bestias de la Nieve han sido expulsadas del puesto avanzado de los Lossoth en la Tundra Occidental, pero regresarán a menos que su matriarca sea derrotada.","Has derrotado a la Gran Matriarca de la Nieve"}},
[4422]={nameES="Expulsando a las bestias",objectivesES={"Derrota al coloso Colmillo Rojo","Coloso Colmillo Rojo derrotado","El coloso Colmillo Rojo puede encontrarse entre las colinas rocosas y oscuras situadas muy al suroeste de Kauppa-kohta.\
\
Valtteri te ha pedido que rastrees y derrotes al coloso Colmillo Rojo, usando un símbolo lossoth en llamas para asustar a la bestia.","Tu éxito contra los huargos de Forochel te ha granjeado el respeto de los cazadores lossoth. Valtteri solicita tu ayuda una vez más.","Habla con Valtteri","Expulsando a las bestias","Valtteri se encuentra en la parte norte de Kauppa-kohta.\
\
Deberías regresar con Valtteri y comunicarle tu victoria sobre el coloso Colmillo Rojo."}},
[4423]={nameES="Ahogamiento en los muelles",objectivesES={"Ahogamiento en los muelles","Orchalwë se alegrará de oír que los prisioneros han sido salvados.","Los prisioneros están siendo ahogados por los torturadores Angmarim en los muelles del puerto de Annúminas, en el nivel más inferior de la ciudad, cerca del agua.","Orchalwë te ha hablado de una cruel práctica de los Angmarim que han ocupado las ruinas de Annúminas: ahogar a sus prisioneros en los muelles del puerto de Annúminas.","Habla con Orchalwë"}},
[4424]={nameES="Ahogando el pasado",objectivesES={"Talk to Doron","Doron has commanded you to cast the treasures which once cursed his men into the Limlight River, directly to the south of Ost Celebrant. These treasures are strewn about the southern part of Ost Celebrant.","Doron is at your side in Ost Celebrant. If he has wandered from your sight, he can be summoned with your horn.","The treasures are strewn about the southern side of Ost Celebrant on the shore near the Limlight River.","Ahogando el pasado"}},
[4425]={nameES="Guardianes del Tambor",objectivesES={"Derrota a Kaushar","Guardianes del Tambor","Kaushar derrotado","La Ciudad de los Trasgos está al noreste del campamento de Glóin.\
\
Vighar te ha pedido que encuentres el camino dentro de la fortaleza hasta la zona donde los trolls tamborileros están vigilados por los azotadores. Mata a varios de estos trasgos y a su líder, Kaushar.","Vighar Trotasendas está en el campamento de Glóin, justo fuera de la Ciudad de los Trasgos.\
\
Kaushar y los azotadores usaron a sus trolls contra ti, pero lograste derrotarlos. Ahora debes regresar con Vighar y entregarle tu informe.","Habla con Vighar en el campamento de Glóin, fuera de la Ciudad de los Trasgos","Las notas que descubriste hablaban de trolls mantenidos en las partes más profundas de la Ciudad de los Trasgos, golpeando tambores para agitar a los trasgos y prepararlos para la batalla. Glóin ha encargado a Vighar organizar partidas para entrar en las zonas de los tambores y matar a los trolls y al líder de los azotadores, con el fin de reducir la amenaza que representan para las gentes al oeste y al este de las Montañas Nubladas."}},
[4426]={nameES="Tambores en lo profundo",objectivesES={"Oghûk quiere vengarse de Kaushar, el trasgo que lo encerró por causar problemas con los tambores de los trolls en las profundidades de la Ciudad de los Trasgos.","Vuelve con Oghûk a su celda en la prisión de la Ciudad de los Trasgos","Los trolls tamborileros se encuentran en las profundidades de la Ciudad de los Trasgos.\
\
Oghûk quiere vengarse de Kaushar, un trasgo que repara los tambores de los trolls en las profundidades de la Ciudad de los Trasgos. Lo culpa por haberlo hecho encarcelar y quiere que sufra. Es una tarea desagradable, pero Oghûk no te ayudará si no lo ayudas tú primero.","Oghûk está en su celda en la prisión de la Ciudad de los Trasgos.\
\
Los trolls tamborileros estaban en una zona profunda de la Ciudad de los Trasgos. Vigilados por capataces trasgos, encontraste a los trolls y los derrotaste tal como Oghûk pidió.","Tambores en lo profundo"}},
[4427]={nameES="Tambores de guerra",objectivesES={"Habla con Fostólf en la Cámara de la Encrucijada","Tambores de guerra","Fostólf está en la Cámara de la Encrucijada, al sur de la Sala de la Escalera Alta.\
\
Todos los tambores trsagos han sido silenciados.Fostólf debería poder descansar por fin.","Los trasgos que hacen sonar los tambores están acampados en la Sala de la Escalera Alta, al norte de la Cámara de la Encrucijada.\
\
Fostólf te ha pedido que destruyas los tambores trasgos para que él y sus compañeros puedan conseguir dormir.","Los enanos de la Cámara de la Encrucijada han podido dormir poco desde que llegaron. Los trasgos de los alrededores han estado haciendo sonar sus tambores sin decanso, provocando ecos retumbantes por todo el Camino de Durin."}},
[4428]={nameES="Tambores de guerra",objectivesES={"Morgul-troll drummers have arrived on the field to inspire their vile allies to attack Minas Tirith with a renewed ferocity. They must be defeated with haste to stem the tide of frenzied Morgul-orcs.\
\
This quest starts with <rgb=#FFFF00>empty</rgb> Merit Rating.\
\
<rgb=#00FF00>Merit Gain:</rgb>\
* Defeat the Morgul-troll drummers\
* Do not allow more than two waves of frenzied Morgul-orcs to attack the wall","Tambores de guerra","Morgul-troll drummers have arrived on the field. Defeat them quickly to stem the tide of frenzied Morgul-orcs."}},
[4429]={nameES="Tambores de guerra",objectivesES={"Tambores de guerra","Morgul-troll drummers have arrived on the field. Defeat them quickly to stem the tide of frenzied Morgul-orcs.","Morgul-troll drummers have arrived on the field to inspire their vile allies to attack Minas Tirith with a renewed ferocity. They must be defeated with haste to stem the tide of frenzied Morgul-orcs.\
\
This quest starts with <rgb=#FFFF00>empty</rgb> Merit Rating.\
\
<rgb=#00FF00>Merit Gain:</rgb>\
* Defeat the Morgul-troll drummers\
* Do not allow more than two waves of frenzied Morgul-orcs to attack the wall"}},
[4430]={nameES="Secando la hierba para pipa",objectivesES={"Secando la hierba para pipa","Florencia Gamyi está en la Granja de Cotonorte.\
\
Florencia Gamyi querrá saber que la hierba para pipa se ha colocado en los secaderos.","Habla con Florencia Gamyi","La hierba para pipa es algo que los hobbits se toman muy en serio. Un mercado nunca recibiría visitas a menos que tuviera un suministro y variedad adecuados.","Los secaderos están al noreste de Florencia Gamyi en la Granja de Cotonorte.\
\
La hierba para pipa clasificada debe colocarse en los secaderos."}},
[4431]={nameES="Drúkala: Fire in the Deeps",objectivesES={}},
[4432]={nameES="Drúkala: The Mark of the Enemy",objectivesES={}},
[4433]={nameES="Drúkala: Trespassers in Gloomingtarn",objectivesES={"Long forbidden to pass beyond Zâram-mekhem, the Orcs' bargain with the Iron Crown has allowed them to settle within the hallowed caverns of Gloomingtarn.","Orcs and goblins can be found at Drúkala in Gloomingtarn.\
\
After gaining entry to Gloomingtarn through the aid of the Iron Crown, the Orcs of Gundabad have made camp at Drúkala. You should defeat Orcs and goblins at Drúkala.","After passing beyond Zâram-mekhem, the tarn-gate, you have discovered an encampment of Orcs and goblins in Gloomingtarn. Sacred not only to the Longbeards, but to all dwarves, the hallowed cavern of Gloomingtarn has long been forbidden to the Orcs—and it must remain so!\
\
You should defeat Orcs and goblins at Drúkala.","You have done much to hinder the Orcs in their attempts to settle within Gloomingtarn. With their numbers scattered back into Deepscrave and other hidden depths of Mount Gundabad, it is likely the Orcs will not soon return to Gloomingtarn.","You have defeated many Orcs and goblins at Drúkala.","Defeat Orcs and goblins at Drúkala","Completado","Drúkala: Trespassers in Gloomingtarn"}},
[4434]={nameES="Dubious Fish",objectivesES={"Anírwen has asked you to inspect crates of fish on the docks of the bay.\
\
The docks are in the Dol Amroth bay.","Anírwen is concerned about the quality of the fish that is being sent up to the king's hall.","You should let Anírwen know that you examined many crates of fish.\
\
Anírwen is at her shop in Dol Amroth.","Dubious Fish","Return to Anírwen"}},
[4435]={nameES="Ducks and Drakes",objectivesES={}},
[4436]={nameES="Duilin's Task",objectivesES={"Duilin, and avid hunter, has wagered a bet that you cannot bag as many game as he can!","Speak to Duilin","Duilin is located in Bâr Húrin.\
\
You should talk to Duilin.","Beasts can be found throughout Southern Ithilien.\
\
You should defeat beasts in Southern Ithilien.","Duilin's Task"}},
[4437]={nameES="Duindir: Haradrim",objectivesES={}},
[4438]={nameES="Duindir: Supplies",objectivesES={}},
[4439]={nameES="Las hojas sin filo también cortan",objectivesES={"Lleva las espadas ornamentales a los Montaraces en Tinnudir.","Los Montaraces están en Tinnudir, al suroeste de Tham Andalath.\
\
Uno de los Montaraces querrá examinar las espadas ceremoniales que has encontrado.","Esta arma está desafilada, pero no gastada. Parece antigua, pero ceremonial. Quizás deberías recoger algunas más y llevárselas a los Montaraces en Tinnudir.","Tham Andalath es la propiedad más alejada de Tinnudir. Lo que en su día fue una de las casas más opulentas de todo Evendim, ahora está profanada por los trasgos.","Las hojas sin filo también cortan","Tham Andalath se encuentra al noreste de Tinnudir y al este de Tham Ornen.\
\
Has encontrado un arma ceremonial en Tham Andalath y crees que deberías reunir más para llevárselas a los Montaraces de Tinnudir."}},
[4440]={nameES="Dulled by Wear and Tear",objectivesES={"As the men valiantly defend Brockbridge, they occasionally discard ineffective weapons and grab a new one to keep fighting. These dull blades now litter the ground throughout the town.","Discarded dull blades can be found throughout Brockbridge.\
\
Mula has asked you to sharpen the dulled blades that the defenders of Brockbridge have discarded.","Dulled by Wear and Tear","Herefara is on the northern side of Brockbridge.\
\
Mula had instructed you to return to Herefara when you were finished.","Talk to Herefara"}},
[4441]={nameES="Embotando las armas de guerra",objectivesES={"Investiga la parte trasera del campamento","Los Orcos han establecido un campamento cerca del Tramo de Nâmbadir. Tu tarea es sabotear sus armas y derrotar a cualquiera que se interponga en tu camino.","Destruye los estantes de armas de orcos y derrota a los Orcos en Tharháth, cerca del Tramo de Nâmbadir.","Embotando las armas de guerra","Derrota al Devastador Utûgi","Algo grande ruge de ira al ser perturbado","Investiga el ruido que proviene de la parte trasera del campamento.","Derrota al Devastador Utûgi."}},
[4442]={nameES="Dun Ox Hunt",objectivesES={"Fresh injuries hinder Sadrech from hunting oxen for the people of Melgobas.","Talk to Sadrech at her camp","Sadrech has asked you to hunt oxen in Anfalas for parts.\
\
The Dun Ox herd north of her camp is also a good source of oxen.","You have obtained enough ox parts.\
\
You should return to Sadrech at her camp.","Dun Ox Hunt"}},
[4443]={nameES="Dun Shûma, The King's Fortress -- Solo/Duo",objectivesES={"Defeated Zidunâm, the Serpent Reborn","Defeated Ushdâla, Lady of the Pride","Defeat Zidunâm, the Spirit-caller in Dun Shûma, The King's Fortress.","Defeat Ushdâla, Lady of the Pride","Defeat Weaponmaster Mâkhragab","Defeat Weaponmaster Mâkhragab and Ushdâla, Lady of the Pride in Dun Shûma, The King's Fortress.","Dun Shûma, The King's Fortress -- Solo/Duo","The hostile forces of Ekhamât have claimed Dun Shûma, the hidden fortress of Menûn Shûma III. The ancient ruin is said to hold many historical treasures of the kingdoms of Shagâna. Though Bârshud has retreated, his Umûni still stand opposed to Mizâdi's quest to claim the Crown of Hamât.","Defeated Weaponmaster Mâkhragab","Defeat Zidunâm, the Spirit-caller"}},
[4444]={nameES="Dun Shûma, The King's Fortress -- Tier 1",objectivesES={"Defeated Zidunâm, the Serpent Reborn","Defeated Ushdâla, Lady of the Pride","Defeat Zidunâm, the Spirit-caller in Dun Shûma, The King's Fortress.","Defeat Ushdâla, Lady of the Pride","Defeat Weaponmaster Mâkhragab","Dun Shûma, The King's Fortress -- Tier 1","Defeat Weaponmaster Mâkhragab and Ushdâla, Lady of the Pride in Dun Shûma, The King's Fortress.","The hostile forces of Ekhamât have claimed Dun Shûma, the hidden fortress of Menûn Shûma III. The ancient ruin is said to hold many historical treasures of the kingdoms of Shagâna. Though Bârshud has retreated, his Umûni still stand opposed to Mizâdi's quest to claim the Crown of Hamât.","Defeated Weaponmaster Mâkhragab","Defeat Zidunâm, the Spirit-caller"}},
[4445]={nameES="Dun Shûma, The King's Fortress -- Tier 2",objectivesES={"Defeated Zidunâm, the Serpent Reborn","Defeated Ushdâla, Lady of the Pride","Defeat Zidunâm, the Spirit-caller in Dun Shûma, The King's Fortress.","Defeat Ushdâla, Lady of the Pride","Defeat Weaponmaster Mâkhragab","Defeat Weaponmaster Mâkhragab and Ushdâla, Lady of the Pride in Dun Shûma, The King's Fortress.","Dun Shûma, The King's Fortress -- Tier 2","The hostile forces of Ekhamât have claimed Dun Shûma, the hidden fortress of Menûn Shûma III. The ancient ruin is said to hold many historical treasures of the kingdoms of Shagâna. Though Bârshud has retreated, his Umûni still stand opposed to Mizâdi's quest to claim the Crown of Hamât.","Defeated Weaponmaster Mâkhragab","Defeat Zidunâm, the Spirit-caller"}},
[4446]={nameES="Dun Shûma, The King's Fortress -- Tier 3",objectivesES={"Defeated Zidunâm, the Serpent Reborn","Defeated Ushdâla, Lady of the Pride","Defeat Zidunâm, the Spirit-caller in Dun Shûma, The King's Fortress.","Defeat Ushdâla, Lady of the Pride","Defeat Weaponmaster Mâkhragab","Defeat Weaponmaster Mâkhragab and Ushdâla, Lady of the Pride in Dun Shûma, The King's Fortress.","The hostile forces of Ekhamât have claimed Dun Shûma, the hidden fortress of Menûn Shûma III. The ancient ruin is said to hold many historical treasures of the kingdoms of Shagâna. Though Bârshud has retreated, his Umûni still stand opposed to Mizâdi's quest to claim the Crown of Hamât.","Defeated Weaponmaster Mâkhragab","Defeat Zidunâm, the Spirit-caller","Dun Shûma, The King's Fortress -- Tier 3"}},
[4447]={nameES="Dungeons of Naerband -- Tier 1",objectivesES={"Defeat Thraknûl and put an end to his wicked ways.","Gumog has been defeated!","Defeat Thraknûl","Urudanî, the mysterious flame-wraith under the command of Borangos the Horror, has been seen many times, entering and exiting the prison fortress of Naerband. Her work with Thraknûl, Sauron's former the chief torturer, lies within the dungeons of the Direhold -- The results of their work more would surely aid the great Rogmul.","Defeat Gumog","Thraknûl has been defeated!","Dungeons of Naerband -- Tier 1"}},
[4448]={nameES="Dungeons of Naerband -- Tier 2",objectivesES={"Defeat Thraknûl and put an end to his wicked ways.","Gumog has been defeated!","Defeat Thraknûl","Dungeons of Naerband -- Tier 2","Urudanî, the mysterious flame-wraith under the command of Borangos the Horror, has been seen many times, entering and exiting the prison fortress of Naerband. Her work with Thraknûl, Sauron's former the chief torturer, lies within the dungeons of the Direhold -- The results of their work more would surely aid the great Rogmul.","Defeat Gumog","Thraknûl has been defeated!"}},
