[4461]={nameES="El campeón de las Tierras Brunas",objectivesES={"El campeón de las Tierras Brunas","Las órdenes decían así:\
\
'Recorred las tierras de Eregion. No dejéis piedra sin remover. Acudid con vuestro campeón, Llygad, la Espada de los Dunlendinos, a la Escuela de Tham Mírdain y prestad ayuda a mis uruk-hai; allí debéis obtener todo el conocimiento que podáis y traérmelo'.\
\
Y así termina la misiva, breve pero inequívocamente clara. Si aún queda algún conocimiento que extraer de la sabiduría de Tham Mirdain, se debe informar a los Elfos de Echad Mirobel.'","Echad Mirobel se encuentra en los confines suroccidentales de Eregion.\
\
Has encontrado unas extrañas órdenes relacionadas con el saqueo de la Escuela de Tham Mirdain, así como a un campeón de los dunlendinos que liderará este asalto contra la cámara del saber de los Elfos. Deberías llevar este mensaje a Echad Mirobel, donde es de esperar que alguien sepa qué significan.","Habla con Gelirwen en Echad Mirobel"}},
[4462]={nameES="Dunlending Patrols",objectivesES={"Dunlending patrols roam the road running south-west along the banks of the Isen.","Dunlending Patrols","Grimbold is at the Ford of Isen.\
\
You should inform Grimbold that the Dunlending patrols have been eliminated.","Talk to Grimbold at the Ford of Isen","Dunlending outriders are patrolling the road along the Isen, south-west of the Rohirrim encampment.\
\
Grimbold has asked you to eliminate some of the Dunlending patrols in order to give the Rohirrim room to manoeuvre unseen."}},
[4463]={nameES="Dunlending Versus Dunbog",objectivesES={"While fighting in the Dunbog, you discovered a man sitting under a tree. smiling and surrounded by Avanc-corpses.","Gwin can be found under the tree outside Lhan Rhos.\
\
Edhow asked you to tell Gwin that he will not provide him another sword.","Talk to Edhow in Lhan Rhos","Dunlending Versus Dunbog","Edhow is in Lhan Rhos, at the centre of the Dunbog.\
\
Gwin the Avanc-hunter has asked you to return to Lhan Rhos and fetch him a new sword from Edhow.","Talk to Gwin in the Dunbog"}},
[4464]={nameES="Durin's Bane and the Unslain",objectivesES={"Dáin has asked you to go to the East Gate of Moria and feel the presence of the Balrog within.","Dáin has begun to tell the story of Nafni the Unslain.\
\
You should talk to Dáin to hear his story.","Dáin continues the story of Nafni, now near its ending.\
\
'And so Khazad-dûm was abandoned. Thráin I became king, barely older than I am now, and eventually he led our people to Erebor. Nafni earned his title \\qThe Unslain\\q for surviving his second encounter with the Balrog, and he would become a wise advisor and trusted friend to King Thráin. He was a great and noble dwarf of Durin's Folk.'\
\
Dáin is pleased with his own recounting of the tale, but as his thoughts return to your present situation his face hardens and his eyes burn with anger.\
\
'Though Azog is dead and his Orc-army routed, a greater foe prevents us from reclaiming our lost kingdom. Though all the dwarf clans answer our call to battle, it will not be enough. No power among the mortal races will ever be enough....\
\
'Hermáth, I wish to be alone with my thoughts for now. Thank you for checking in on me.'","Complete 'The Fall of Khazad-dûm'","You have felt the same dread that Dáin did. Moria is not safe to enter!","Complete 'The Fall of Khazad-dûm' on any difficulty.\
\
Use the Instance Finder to enter this instance.","You should return to Dáin and inform him that you did indeed feel the presence of the Balrog inside the gates of Moria.","Dáin has a tale to tell about the Balrog he witnessed inside the gates of Moria; Durin's Bane.","Dáin has just about finished his story.\
\
You should talk to Dáin to hear the ending.","Durin's Bane and the Unslain","<rgb=#FF0000>Sit</rgb> and listen to Dáin's story","Talk to Dáin","Sit before Dáin and listen to the story of Nafni the Unslain.","Complete 'Discovery: The Fall of Khazad-dûm'","Dáin begins to tell the tale of The Fall of Khazad-dûm","Still shaken by the sight of the creature beyond the gates, Dáin squints at you as you approach.\
\
'Have you come to check on me, Hermáth? Hmph!'\
\
He grumbles but spares you an uncertain smile.\
\
'I always thought myself fearless. I have gone toe-to-toe with Orcs and trolls many times my size with nothing but the fire in my heart. But THAT foe... Durin's Bane! Standing in sight of just one such evil has shaken me to my core. Imagine an army of those fiends!\
\
'You do not think me a coward, do you? I know you for a fierce warrior, Hermáth. I would have you go to the East Gate and feel the monster's presence for yourself! Then, at least, I will know I am not alone in my fear.'"}},
[4465]={nameES="El Día de Durin en Erebor",objectivesES={"En la entrada secreta de Erebor, a la hora exacta del Día de Durin, se ha colocado una losa de piedra aparentemente común donde hace mucho tiempo se abrió una puerta. Un zorzal se posa sobre una piedra, como si estuviera esperando.","Examina la piedra","Has leído las runas inscritas en la piedra junto a la vieja puerta lateral de Erebor.","El Día de Durin en Erebor","El sol está a punto de brillar sobre una piedra forjada por enanos, que se encuentra frente a la antigua puerta secreta en el lado del Monte Erebor.\
\
Deberías acercarte y ver qué sucede con la piedra cuando el sol moribundo ilumina su cara."}},
[4466]={nameES="Durin's Folk: Gathering Gems",objectivesES={}},
[4467]={nameES="Durthang: Army of the Pit",objectivesES={"Durthang: Army of the Pit","Defeat Uruks.","Talk to Candúr","Talk to Candúr.","Defeat Uruks","Many foes await those who dare enter the fortress of Durthang, home to the Captain of the Pit.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Warning: This quest requires Durthang: The Dark Spire to be underway. If that quest has been completed or failed, you will be unable to exit and re-enter this instance in order to complete this quest.</rgb>"}},
[4468]={nameES="Durthang: Lowering The Guards",objectivesES={"Defeat Orc Guards throughout Durthang in Udûn.","Durthang: Lowering The Guards","Defeated many Orc Guards.","The guards standing watch and patrolling the fastness of Durthang are its first line of defence. Things would surely bode better for the forces of Gondor if that line were lowered.","Things will surely go better for the forces of Gondor now that the number of guards in Durthang has been lowered.","Completado","The guards standing watch and patrolling the fastness of Durthang are its first line of defence."}},
[4469]={nameES="Durthang: Order of the Pit",objectivesES={"Bring the orders to Candúr.","Collect orders.","Durthang: Order of the Pit","Recoge las órdenes","Many foes await those who dare enter the fortress of Durthang, home to the Captain of the Pit.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Warning: This quest requires Durthang: The Dark Spire to be underway. If that quest has been completed or failed, you will be unable to exit and re-enter this instance in order to complete this quest.</rgb>","Bring the orders to Candúr"}},
[4470]={nameES="Durthang: Prized Possessions",objectivesES={}},
[4471]={nameES="Durthang: Sorcerers' Baubles",objectivesES={}},
[4472]={nameES="Durthang: Talons and Venom",objectivesES={"The Uruks and Sorcerers within the fastness of Durthang are like sharp talons and fell venom of Ugrukhôr's might. They instill fear and obedience, the one by force, the other by subtler means.","Defeated many enforcers and sorcerers.","The Uruks and Sorcerers within the fastness of Durthang are like sharp talons and fell venom of Ugrukhôr's might.","Defeat Uruk Enforcers and Black Númenórean Sorcerers in Durthang, in Udûn.","Durthang: Talons and Venom","Ugrukhôr now has fewer sharp talons and venomous fangs to exert his might, thanks to you.","Completado"}},
[4473]={nameES="Durthang: The Dark Spire",objectivesES={"Many foes await those who dare enter the fortress of Durthang, home to the Captain of the Pit.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Warning: This quest has a one hour time limit. The timer will begin upon accepting the quest.</rgb>","You ran out of time...","Durthang: The Dark Spire","Talk to Candúr","Defeat Azgazôr","You should return to Candúr and apprise him of your efforts.","Defeated Azgazôr","Defeat Azgazôr."}},
[4474]={nameES="Durthang: The Lieutenants of Ugrokhor",objectivesES={}},
[4475]={nameES="La Preocupación de Dwalin",objectivesES={"Busca a Glóin en su campamento en las estribaciones occidentales de las Montañas Nubladas, al norte de Rivendel, muy al este de Ered Luin.\
\
Dwalin quiere que lleves una advertencia a su amigo Glóin en las Montañas Nubladas. Cree que el aumento de la actividad de los trasgos podría no limitarse a los trasgos de Ered Luin.","La Preocupación de Dwalin","Habla con Glóin en su campamento en las Montañas Nubladas","Dwalin está preocupado por rumores que ha oído sobre agitaciones en las Montañas Nubladas."}},
[4476]={nameES="Las penurias de Dwaling",objectivesES={"Recoge la bolsa con las herramientas de soplado de vidrio","Lleva la bolsa con las herramientas de soplado de vidrio a Hob Cimacolina","La bolsa con las herramientas de soplado de vidrio se encuentra en el umbral de un agujero hobbit en el lado norte de Dwaling.\
\
Hob Cimacolina te ha pedido que recojas una bolsa con herramientas de soplado de vidrio para él.","Hob Cimacolina está en su casa en el Prado del Toro Bramador en Dwaling, al sur de los Pantanos Arenosos.\
\
Debes regresar con Hob Cimacolina con la bolsa de herramientas de soplado de vidrio.","Las penurias de Dwaling","Has recogido la bolsa con las herramientas de soplado de vidrio","Las herramientas para soplar vidrio son únicas y requieren mucho mantenimiento. Un hobbit que vivía en Dwaling solía repararlas."}},
[4477]={nameES="Enano, interrumpido",objectivesES={"Enano, interrumpido","Habla con Logi en la entrada de Iorvinas","Angar Tripahierro derrotado","El líder de los Duramano debe estar en Iorvinas.\
\
Logi te ha pedido que derrotes al líder de los Duramano, que está intentando crear una alianza con los orcos.","Unos enanos que partieron a una expedición hacia el este se detuvieron para investigar unas ruinas, ya que sospechan que los Duramano y los Orcos han hecho un pacto.","Derrota a Angar Tripahierro","Logi se encuentra a la entrada de las ruinas de Iorvinas.\
\
No te ha costado mucho derrotar al jefe de los Duramano. Ahora ya no deberían suponer ningún problema."}},
[4478]={nameES="Dwarf-beards",objectivesES={}},
[4479]={nameES="¡La cena de los enanos!",objectivesES={"Has liberado a los enanos que iban a convertirse en la comida de los orcos en Uzbad-bakân.","Has descubierto que varios enanos habían sido capturados por los orcos y entregados a las cocinas de Uzbad-bakân... ¡para convertirse en la cena!","Tras entrar en las cocinas de Uzbad-bakân, te encuentras con algunos prisioneros enanos. Han sido capturados por los orcos y arrstrados hasta aquí... ¡para convertirse en su cena!\
\
Deberías liberar a los prisioneros enanos de Uzbad-bakân antes de que sean devorados por los orcos.","Libera a los enanos prisioneros en las cocinas de Uzbad-bakân","Completado","Los enanos prisioneros se encuentran en la zona de la cocina de Uzbad-bakân, en el sur de Zelem-melek.\
\
Deberías liberar a los prisioneros enanos antes de que los orcos los cocinen para la cena."}},
