[4493]={nameES="Tarea de los Enanos de Erebor: Cimitarras oxidadas",objectivesES={"Entrega las cimitarras oxidadas en una caja de recolección","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir cimitarras oxidadas.","Tarea de los Enanos de Erebor: Cimitarras oxidadas","Alguien ha publicado una tarea para recoger Cimitarras oxidadas. Se pueden entregar a cambio de una recompensa.","Se busca: Cimitarras oxidadas de los Strongholds of the North.","Se busca: Cimitarras oxidadas de los Strongholds of the North. Recógelas para ganar una recompensa adecuada para los coleccionistas.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú."}},
[4494]={nameES="Enanos con armas de orcos",objectivesES={"Lleva las armas de los orcos a Logi, en Iorvinas.","Unos enanos que partieron en expedición hacia el este se detuvieron para investigar unas ruinas, ya que sospechan que los Duramano y los Orcos han hecho un pacto.","Enanos con armas de orcos","Los orcos y los Duramano se encuentran en los alrededores de Iorvinas, y Logi está en allí.\
\
Cuando descubrió que los orcos y los Duramano vivían muy cerca unos de otros, Logi comenzó a temer una alianza. Te ha pedido que busques pruebas de ello."}},
[4495]={nameES="Dwelling in the Hills",objectivesES={"Dwelling in the Hills","Speak to the occupants of the dwelling","The ramshackle dwelling sits in the hills of eastern Rath Dúath.\
\
You should speak to the occupants of the dwelling.","Complete: Rot for the Fire","The child's lost toy must be somewhere nearby.\
\
You should search for the child's toy.","Find the child's toy","You have overcome the deception of the spirits housed within the forgotten watching-stone. Their purpose remains unknown to you, but you feel certain you must not underestimate the malice of this place.","Complete: Questionable Meal","Talk to the strange child","The toy crumbles to dust in your hand. Within lies a medallion of Sauron","A strange family lives in a ramshackle dwelling upon the slopes of the Morgul Vale.","Defeated the watching stone's grip on your mind.","The child looks around slowly before clearing his throat, as if he has uttered not a word in years.\
\
'My doll. I must have my doll returned. It is all I have. Where could it be? Find it, please.'","Return to the ramshackle dwelling","To your surprise, you spy a small cabin precariously resting in the hills of the Morgul Vale. It looks as if the cabin is occupied by a family, but is that not strange? Men have not lived in the Morgul Vale for many years. Perhaps it is worth investigating this ramshackle cabin and those who dwell there.","The ramshackle dwelling sits in the hills of northern Rath Dúath.\
\
You should speak to the occupants of the broken-down house.","Your vision now clear, you see it was no dwelling at all!","The child says nothing.","The ramshackle dwelling sits in the hills of northern Rath Dúath.\
\
You should speak to the occupants of the dwelling.","Completado","The ramshackle dwelling sits in the hills of northern Rath Dúath.\
\
You should return to the broken-down dwelling to further your investigations."}},
[4496]={nameES="Dwergfant: A Rock and a Hard Place",objectivesES={"Dwergfant: A Rock and a Hard Place","Aldbéort is awaiting you at Cliving.\
\
Aldbéort will be pleased to hear that the Dwergfant is fully functional again.","<rgb=#FF0000>Completing Aiding the Eastemnet will cancel this quest</rgb>","The impaired mechanisms can be found within the Dwergfant.\
\
Aldbéort has asked you to venture to the Dwergfant and repair the mechanisms within.","Talk to Aldbéort","If the mechanisms within the Dwergfant do not work, the Limlight will be ruined."}},
[4497]={nameES="Dwergfant: Foul Waters",objectivesES={"Avanc and toads can be found at Dwergfant.\
\
Aldbéort has asked you to venture to the Dwergfant and defeat the avanc and toads found within.","Dwergfant: Foul Waters","Avanc and toads are polluting the Dwergfant.","Aldbéort is at Cliving.\
\
Aldbéort will be pleased to hear the avanc and toad population in the Dwergfant has been thinned.","<rgb=#FF0000>Completing Aiding the Eastemnet will cancel this quest</rgb>","Talk to Aldbéort"}},
