[4505]={nameES="Dâr Narbugud: A Plague Restrained",objectivesES={"In order to keep the pestilence from creeping to the fair lands beyond the walls of Moria, the Elves of Lothlórien believe the fungus-infested Orcs must be stopped ere they emerge from Moria.","The new Globsnaga Orcs can be found throughout Dâr Narbugud, in the southern-most reaches of the Foundations of Stone in Moria.\
\
Donfuin has asked you to slaughter the weaker, newly-altered Orcs to prevent their use as carriers of the fungus they are now infested with.","Donfuin stands outside of Dâr Narbugud in Moria.\
\
You should speak with Donfuin and inform him of your success against the weak Glabsnaga Orcs in Dâr Narbugud.","Talk to Donfuin","Dâr Narbugud: A Plague Restrained"}},
[4506]={nameES="Dâr Narbugud: Bastions of Doom",objectivesES={"Defeated Rung","The Elves believe that trolls give a great advantage to the enemy in battle, due to their massive strength and hardiness. The troll-leaders in Dâr Narbugud must be eliminated in order to weaken the enemy's forces.","The trolls you seek can be found in Dâr Narbugud, near the Dark Delvings at the southernmost tip of the Foundations of Stone.\
\
Donfuin has asked you to defeat the trolls' leaders, which should disorganize the trolls and deflate their usefulness in battle.","Talk to Donfuin","Defeat Blagh","Dâr Narbugud: Bastions of Doom","Defeat Rung","Defeated Blagh","Donfuin stands just outside of Dâr Narbugud.\
\
You should speak with Donfuin and inform him of your victory over the troll-leaders."}},
[4507]={nameES="Dâr Narbugud: Champions of Virulence",objectivesES={"Defeat Îstum","Defeated Zholuga","Dâr Narbugud: Champions of Virulence","Defeat Zholuga","Defeated Îstum","Defeat Flâgît","Defeated Flâgît","The great leaders of the Globsnaga in Dâr Narbugud are essential to the strength and strategy of the enemy. They must be destroyed before they can lead their Globsnaga-hosts to war against the dwarves and Elves of the neighbouring lands.","Talk to Donfuin","Donfuin is outside of Dâr Narbugud in Moria.\
\
You should speak with Donfuin and tell him of your success against the leaders of the plague-bearing Orcs.","The leaders of the Globsnaga can be found in Dâr Narbugud, in the southern-most reaches of the Foundations of Stone.\
\
You should defeat each leader of the Globsnaga to sever the head of the force that rallies in in Dâr Narbugud."}},
[4508]={nameES="Dâr Narbugud: Noxious Vapours",objectivesES={"The greater fumaroles can be found in Dâr Narbugud, at the southern tip of the Foundations of Stone.\
\
Donfuin has asked you to destroy the fumaroles that belch their noxious fumes into the poisoned chambers of Dâr Narbugud.","Dâr Narbugud: Noxious Vapours","The great fumaroles of Dâr Narbugud fill the chambers of corruption with a noxious gas, creating the perfect atmosphere for the breeding of noxious spores.","Donfuin can be found outside of Dâr Narbugud in Moria.\
\
You should go to Donfuin and inform him of your success in destroying the belching fumaroles of Dâr Narbugud.","Talk to Donfuin"}},
[4509]={nameES="Dâr Narbugud: Purifying the Fungal Contagions",objectivesES={"Celeborn has devised a means to ensure the Globsnaga fungus never survives once the legions of the infested are destroyed.","Filth washed away","Purify the liquid in Zholuga's plague-chamber","Donfuin is outside of Dâr Narbugud in Moria.\
\
You should return to Donfuin and inform him of your success in purifying the most corrupted places in Moria.","Purify the liquid in Îstum's plague-chamber","Talk to Donfuin","The chambers of rancour can be found in Dâr Narbugud, in the southern-most reaches of Moria's Foundations of Stone.\
\
You should use the contents of the phial to cleanse the rancourous chambers of transformation within Dâr Narbugud.","This is an ideal place to use Galadriel's draught","Purify the liquid in Flâgît's plague-chamber","Dâr Narbugud: Purifying the Fungal Contagions"}},
[4510]={nameES="Dâr Narbugud: The Bewildering Inscription",objectivesES={"One of the Nameless creatures that prowled the twisted passages of Dâr Narbugud was found carrying a strange sword-hilt, bearing an inscription in unmistakeable Sindarin letters. While this haft is now fell and cold to the touch, its history might be of interest to one who remembers its making.","The hilt is ice-cold and gives off a fell glow, and it is blackened with the remnants of its Nameless bearer. You would cast it aside without further thought, for it is a sickening relic, but something catches your eye: Elven-script. The letters inscribed upon the hilt are clear, unfaded Sindarin. \
\
This artifact may have a colourful history. How did it come to live in the hands of this hideous creature? You should bring the hilt to one who may recognize it.","Bring the hilt to Celeborn at Caras Galadhon","Find someone who may recognize the hilt","Celeborn can be found in Lothlórien's main city, Caras Galadhon.\
\
You should show the corrupted hilt you have found to Celeborn, whose wisdom and long memory may dispel the mystery surrounding this artifact.","Dâr Narbugud: The Bewildering Inscription","Celeborn believes that the sword hilt will be recognizeable to someone who lives in Lothlórien. He surmises, based on the words on the handle, that the warrior of old was a loyal protector of the Golden Wood.\
\
You should seek someone who may recognize the befouled relic."}},
[4511]={nameES="Dâr Narbugud: The Deep Places of the World",objectivesES={"Defeated the Mistress of Pestilence","Dâr Narbugud: The Deep Places of the World","Talk to Donfuin","Donfuin is outside of Dâr Narbugud in Moria.\
\
You should tell Celeborn of your very great deed in defeating the Mistress of Pestilence in Moria.","Defeat the Mistress of Pestilence","The source of the pestilence in Moria is near the Dark Delvings at the southernmost tip of the Foundations of Stone, in a foul place called Dâr Narbugud.\
\
Donfuin wishes you and your allies to defeat the Nameless sources of the sickness spewing from Dâr Narbugud, thus removing the threat of the fungal plague's spread.","Defeated the Blind One","Defeat the Blind One","Celeborn of Lothlórien believes that the restoration of the natural world is key in the battle against the powers of evil in Middle-earth."}},
[4512]={nameES="Dâr Narbugud: The Heart of the Scourge",objectivesES={"Dâr Narbugud: The Heart of the Scourge","Celeborn is in Caras Galadhon, at the heart of Lothlórien.\
\
You should speak with Celeborn at the behest of Baranglim to gain his counsel about the final and most important task to be achieved in Moria.","Talk to Celeborn at Caras Galadhon","Dâr Narbugud is in the Foundations of Stone in Moria, to the south-east near the Dark Delvings.\
\
Celeborn has given you a phial of Elven light to bring to the heart of plague, sickness, and corruption within Moria.","This would be an ideal place to use Celeborn's light","Celeborn, Lord of Lothlórien, is gravely concerned by the final and most perilous threat in Moria: the plague of fungus threatening to spread with the infected Orcs as they rally to defend their caverns against the dwarves and Elves.","Celeborn stands at the heart of Lothlórien, in the hidden city of Caras Galadhon.\
\
You should speak with Celeborn and share the tale of your great success in Dâr Narbugud, dealing a heavy blow to the creatures who would cover the world in sickness.","Collected the phial of light","Use the phial of light","The light seems to make this place less fell to look upon"}},
[4513]={nameES="Dígelon: A Light in the Darkness",objectivesES={}},
[4514]={nameES="Dígelon: Feasting on Fungus",objectivesES={}},
[4515]={nameES="Dúgar, el alce negro",objectivesES={"Derrota a Dúgar, el alce negro","Por el Bosque Salvaje vaga un alce con un pelaje negro como el azabache.","Dúgar, el alce negro, se encuentra en la parte sur del Bosque Salvaje.\
\
Linnet te ha pedido que derrotes al alce negro, Dúgar.","Dúgar, el alce negro","Has derrotado a Dúgar, el alce negro","Linnet se encuentra en la zona centro-sur del Bosque Salvaje.\
\
Deberías volver con Linnet Encinarroja.","Habla con Linnet"}},
[4516]={nameES="Una cuestión de confianza",objectivesES={"Las ruinas de Ost Guruth se encuentran cerca del Gran Camino del Este, donde Nain Enidh se une a Talath Gaun.\
\
Hunulf Mascador, convencido de que podrías ser de gran ayuda para su pueblo, te ha pedido que vayas a la ciudad de los Eglain, Ost Guruth, y hables con Frideric el Anciano.","Una cuestión de confianza","Hunulf y Gadaric Mascador coinciden en que tus esfuerzos han ayudado a su pueblo y creen que deberías reunirte con su líder.","Habla con Frideric el Anciano en Ost Guruth"}},
[4517]={nameES="Earning Respect",objectivesES={"Accept Damkalb's challenge","Jajax is in the tavern of Lothgobel.\
\
You should speak with Jajax.","Jajax strikes you as someone who might be prevailed upon to listen to reason, despite his aggressive words upon your meeting. You tell him that you mean him no harm, and wish to speak civilly.\
\
'Civil, eh? You have killed many of my men to come here. But I suppose I have done the same to the people you look on as your kin.\
\
'I will consider negotiations with you, but you must earn my respect, and that of my men, otherwise they will not look kindly upon your coming and going where you please. Speak with Damkalb, at that table yonder.'","Damkalb has challenged you to drink the strong liquors of the Corsairs, which can be found in the tavern of Lothgobel.\
\
You should drink the liquors of the Corsairs in the time allotted.","Earning Respect","Jajax has demanded that you earn his respect before any attempt at negotiation is made.","Speak with Jajax","Damkalb has challenged you to best his drinking time","Damkalb is in the tavern in Lothgobel.\
\
You should speak with Damkalb.","Accept Damkalb's drinking challenge"}},
[4518]={nameES="Earning Trust",objectivesES={"The newly arrived horse in Combe may be found in his new stall.\
\
The horse is strange to Combe and is still uneasy in his new environment. <rgb=#FF0000>Pat</rgb> the horse to comfort him.","<rgb=#FF0000>Pat</rgb> the horse to comfort him in his new stall","Talk to the stable-helper","Fill the water-bucket","Ensure the food-trough has grain","Earning Trust","The stable-helper wants you to assist the new horse in settling into its new stall in the Combe horse stables.","Inspect the horse's bedding","The stable-helper is near the stables of Combe.","The horse looks more comfortable and shows signs of trusting you...","The new horse in the Combe stables needs some help settling into his new stall."}},
[4519]={nameES="Easing Tensions",objectivesES={"Maendal can be found at Aelin Veren, in central North Ithilien.\
\
You have done what you could to calm the Rangers of Ithilien at Aelin Veren and should now speak to Maendal.","Rangers of Ithilien can be found at Aelin Veren, in central North Ithilien.\
\
Maendal has asked you to calm his fellow Rangers in the wake of the Haradrim attacker's ill-fated assault.","Despite the reckless actions of a prisoner, the long hatred between the peoples of Gondor and Harad cannot be eased by further bloodshed.","Talk to Maendal","Easing Tensions"}},
