\
Look out at Ringlo Vale."}},
[4613]={nameES="Eithel Gwaur, the Filth-well -- Solo",objectivesES={"Defeated Balchneth","The Filth-well of Eithel Gwaur is the source of the corruption that has long tainted the flowing waters of the Ithilduin, giving to them a new name: Morgulduin, River of Sorcery.","Find Rauniel's chamber.","Defeat Balchneth, the gate-keeper","Defeated Gwaurodel","Eithel Gwaur, the Filth-well -- Solo","Find Rauniel's chamber","Defeat Gwaurodel.","Defeat Balchneth, the gate-keeper.","Defeat Gwaurodel"}},
