[4621]={nameES="Ekhamât Triumphant",objectivesES={"Return to Mizâdi on the battlefield outside Nisigurûm in southern Imhûlar.","Ekhamât Triumphant","Defeat Ekhamâti forces around you and tend to the wounded Subuzûri in Nisigurûm.","Speak with Mizâdi on the battlefield outside Nisigurûm","You must help turn the tide of battle and finish this fight, as there is a much greater fight happening west of Imhûlar."}},
[4622]={nameES="Elda Steps Aside",objectivesES={"Bring the letter to Herubrand","Wid Isernore is filled with ore-bearing stone.\
\
The overseer asked that you gather ore for him.","Elda Steps Aside","Talk to the mine overseer","Herubrand is in the cellar of the farm-house.\
\
You should bring the letter to Herubrand.","Though Elda was an advisor to Reeve Heremond for some time, he never saw eye to eye with Herubrand. This detachment led him to seek another who shared his vision for the future of Woodhurst.","Gifemund is in the ore refinery building within Woodhurst, near the centre of the city.\
\
Herubrand told you to insinuate yourself into the good graces of Gifemund in order to learn what he has planned.","The mine overseer is at Wid Isernore.\
\
The ore you gathered should be returned to the mine overseer.","The overseer is at Wid Isernore, just outside of Woodhurst.\
\
Gifemund told you to speak with the overseer of his mine and learn how you might help there.","Talk to Gifemund"}},
[4623]={nameES="Ancianas en las sombras",objectivesES={"Ancianas en las sombras","Derrota a la tejedora de telarañas","Desde mucho antes de que los orcos y los muertos se arrastraran hacia las Tierras Solitarias, los Eglain han tenido que lidiar con la amenaza de las arañas que habitan en las ruinas a lo largo del solitario tramo de Eriador. Ahora, a medida que las arañas son expulsadas de las profundidades de sus hogares en ruinas, se acercan cada vez más a Ost Guruth y amenazan a la gente que vive allí.","Hiladora de telarañas derrotada","Derrota a la hiladora de telarañas","Habla con Tortwil en Ost Guruth","Tejedora de telarañas derrotada","Las ancianas de la prole de arañas se encuentran en Amon Ros, al oeste de Ost Guruth.\
\
Tortwil te pidió un favor: que fueras a Amon Ros y mataras a las ancianas de la prole de arañas.","Trampera de telarañas derrotada","Derrota a la trampera de telarañas","Tortwil espera tu regreso en Ost Guruth, al este de Amon Ros.\
\
Tortwil se alegrará de saber de tu victoria contra las ancianas arañas de Amon Ros."}},
