[4684]={nameES="Tarea de los Elfos de Rivendel: Ramas poderosas",objectivesES={"Tarea de los Elfos de Rivendel: Ramas poderosas","Maedlathron espera el regreso de una colección de ramas poderosas en el campamento de los elfos en Gwingris.","Has aceptado la tarea de entregar ramas poderosas de las retorcidas criaturas de la naturaleza cercanas y de los alrededores del campamento de los elfos de Gwingris al elfo Maedlathron.","Se busca: Ramas poderosas de las retorcidas criaturas de la naturaleza que rodean el puesto de avanzada de Gwingris.","Se busca: Ramas poderosas de las retorcidas criaturas de la naturaleza que rodean el puesto de avanzada de Gwingris. Puedes devolver los artículos a Maedlathron en Gwingris en Eregion para obtener una recompensa.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Entrega las ramas poderosas a Maedlathron en Gwingris dentro de Eregion"}},
[4685]={nameES="Tarea de los Elfos de Rivendel: Huesos de dedos estriados",objectivesES={"Has aceptado la tarea de recoger huesos de dedos estriados de los Muertos en las áreas que rodean Thorenhad. Los objetos deben ser entregados en la caja de recolección en el puesto de avanzada.","Se busca: Huesos de dedos estriados de los Muertos que rodean Thorenhad. Todos los artículos deben ser entregados en la caja de recolección en el puesto de avanzada en el Bosque de los Trolls.","Los Elfos de Thorenhad te agradecen tus esfuerzos.","Entrega los huesos de los dedos estriados a la caja de recolección en Thorenhad en el Bosque de los Trolls","Se busca: Huesos de dedos estriados de los Muertos que rodean Thorenhad.","No has recuperado suficientes huesos de dedos estriados para los Elfos de Thorenhad.","Tarea de los Elfos de Rivendel: Huesos de dedos estriados","Los Elfos de Thorenhad desean que se les entregue un cargamento de huesos de dedos estriados."}},
[4686]={nameES="Tarea de los Elfos de Rivendel: Corazón de madera con cicatrices",objectivesES={"Thaliollang en la ruina de los Elfos de Meluinen en Lin Giliath requiere la devolución del corazón de madera con cicatrices.","Se necesita: Corazón de madera con cicatrices recogido de los acechadores de pantano que se encuentran en Meluinen. Entregue los artículos a Thaliollang en Lin Giliath.","Tienes la tarea de recoger el corazón de madera con cicatrices de los acechadores de pantano de Meluinen y entregárselo a Thaliollang. Thaliollang se encuentra en Lin Giliath, las ruinas de los Elfos de Meluinen.","Se necesita: Corazón de madera con cicatrices recogido de los acechadores de pantano que se encuentran en Meluinen.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Entregar el corazón de madera con cicatrices a Thaliollang en Lin Giliath","Tarea de los Elfos de Rivendel: Corazón de madera con cicatrices"}},
[4687]={nameES="Tarea de los Elfos de Rivendel: Garras afiladas",objectivesES={"Entregar las garras afiladas a Thaliollang en Lin Giliath","Tienes la tarea de recoger garras afiladas de los enormes sapos que plagan Meluinen y entregárselas a Thaliollang. Thaliollang se encuentra en Lin Giliath, las ruinas de los Elfos de Meluinen.","Thaliollang en la ruina de los Elfos de Meluinen en Lin Giliath requiere la devolución de garras afiladas.","Se necesita: Garras afiladas de los enormes sapos que plagan Meluinen.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Se necesita: Garras afiladas de los enormes sapos que plagan Meluinen. Entregue los artículos a Thaliollang en Lin Giliath.","Tarea de los Elfos de Rivendel: Garras afiladas"}},
[4688]={nameES="Tarea de los Elfos de Rivendel: Suciedad sedosa",objectivesES={"Has aceptado la tarea de recoger suciedad sedosa de las arañas en las áreas que rodean Thorenhad. Los artículos deben ser entregados en una caja de recolección. Hay una caja de recolección en Thorenhad en el Bosque de los Trolls.","Los Elfos de Thorenhad te agradecen tus esfuerzos.","Se busca: Suciedad sedosa de las arañas que rodean Thorenhad. Los artículos deben ser entregados en una caja de recolección. Hay una caja de recolección en Thorenhad en el Bosque de los Trolls.","Los Elfos de Thorenhad desean que se les entregue un cargamento de suciedad sedosa.","Se busca: Suciedad sedosa de las arañas que rodean Thorenhad.","Entregar la suciedad sedosa a la caja de recolección","Tarea de los Elfos de Rivendel: Suciedad sedosa","No has recuperado suficiente suciedad sedosa para los Elfos en Thorenhad."}},
[4689]={nameES="Tarea de los Elfos de Rivendel: Suciedad sedosa",objectivesES={"Has aceptado la tarea de recoger suciedad sedosa de los insectos que rodean Echad Candelleth. Debes entregar los artículos a Bainthir en el campamento o en una caja de recolección.","Se busca: Una colección de suciedad sedosa de los insectos que rodean Echad Candelleth. Todos los artículos deben ser entregados a Bainthir en las ruinas.","Entregar la suciedad sedosa a Bainthir en Echad Candelleth en el Bosque de los Trolls","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Tarea de los Elfos de Rivendel: Suciedad sedosa","Bainthir, un Elfo en el campamento de Echad Candelleth, está esperando una entrega de suciedad sedosa."}},
[4690]={nameES="Tarea de los Elfos de Rivendel: Escamas lisas",objectivesES={"Entregar las escamas lisas a Bainthir en Echad Candelleth en el Bosque de los Trolls","Se busca: Una colección de escamas lisas de los sierpes que rodean Echad Candelleth.","Bainthir, un Elfo en el campamento de Echad Candelleth, está esperando una entrega de escamas lisas.","Has aceptado la tarea de recoger escamas lisas de los sierpes que rodean Echad Candelleth. Debes entregar los artículos a Bainthir en el campamento.","Se busca: Una colección de escamas lisas de los sierpes que rodean Echad Candelleth. Todos los artículos deben ser entregados a Bainthir en el campamento.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Tarea de los Elfos de Rivendel: Escamas lisas"}},
[4691]={nameES="Tarea de los Elfos de Rivendel: Alas lisas",objectivesES={"Has aceptado la tarea de recoger alas lisas de los pájaros en las áreas que rodean Thorenhad. Los artículos deben ser entregados en la caja de recolección en el puesto de avanzada.","Se busca: Alas lisas de los pájaros que rodean Thorenhad.","Se busca: Alas lisas de los pájaros que rodean Thorenhad. Todos los artículos deben ser entregados en la caja de recolección en el puesto de avanzada en el Bosque de los Trolls.","Los Elfos de Thorenhad desean que se les entregue un cargamento de alas lisas.","No has recuperado suficientes alas lisas para los Elfos en Thorenhad.","Entregar las alas lisas a la caja de recolección en Thorenhad en el Bosque de los Trolls","Tarea de los Elfos de Rivendel: Alas lisas","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú."}},
[4692]={nameES="Tarea de los Elfos de Rivendel: Caparazones resistentes",objectivesES={"Thaliollang en la ruina de los Elfos de Meluinen en Lin Giliath requiere la devolución de caparazones resistentes.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Se necesita: Caparazones resistentes de los insectos y acechadores de pantano de Meluinen.","Se necesita: Caparazones resistentes de los insectos y acechadores de pantano de Meluinen. Entregue los artículos a Thaliollang en Lin Giliath.","Entregar los caparazones resistentes a Thaliollang en Lin Giliath","Tarea de los Elfos de Rivendel: Caparazones resistentes","Tienes la tarea de recoger caparazones resistentes de los acechadores de pantano e insectos que se encuentran en Meluinen y entregárselos a Thaliollang. Thaliollang se encuentra en Lin Giliath, las ruinas de los Elfos de Meluinen."}},
[4693]={nameES="Tarea de los Elfos de Rivendel: Vainas de espada resistentes",objectivesES={"Entregar las vainas de espada resistentes a Thaliollang en Lin Giliath","Tarea de los Elfos de Rivendel: Vainas de espada resistentes","Se necesita: Vainas de espada resistentes de los orcos que plagan Meluinen.","Se necesita: Vainas de espada resistentes de los orcos que plagan Meluinen. Entregue los artículos a Thaliollang en Lin Giliath.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Thaliollang en la ruina de los Elfos de Meluinen en Lin Giliath requiere la devolución de vainas de espada resistentes.","Tienes la tarea de recoger vainas de espada resistentes de los orcos que plagan Meluinen y entregárselas a Thaliollang. Thaliollang se encuentra en Lin Giliath, las ruinas de los Elfos de Meluinen."}},
[4694]={nameES="Tarea de los Elfos de Rivendel: Picos muy afilados",objectivesES={"Has aceptado la tarea de recoger picos muy afilados de los pájaros en las áreas que rodean Thorenhad. Los artículos deben ser entregados en la caja de recolección en el puesto de avanzada.","Se busca: Picos muy afilados de los pájaros que rodean Thorenhad. Todos los artículos deben ser entregados en la caja de recolección en el puesto de avanzada en el Bosque de los Trolls.","No has recuperado suficientes picos muy afilados para los Elfos en Thorenhad.","Se busca: Picos muy afilados de los pájaros que rodean Thorenhad.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Los Elfos de Thorenhad desean que se les entregue un cargamento de picos muy afilados.","Entregar los picos muy afilados a la caja de recolección en Thorenhad en el Bosque de los Trolls","Tarea de los Elfos de Rivendel: Picos muy afilados"}},
[4695]={nameES="Embedded in the Battlefield",objectivesES={"Desperate to keep the Gabil'akkâ from drawing any nearer to Mount Gundabad, the Orcs have brought many siege engines onto the battlefield.","Talk to Reithvald Red-ember","Orkish ballistae, catapults, and trebuchets can be found on the battlefield around Zudramdân in the War of Three Peaks.\
\
Reithvald Red-ember has tasked you with destroying the siege engines used by the Orcs of Gundabad.","Reithvald Red-ember can be found at Ifbar-athrâkh.\
\
You have destroyed many Orkish siege engines. You should report your success to Reithvald Red-ember.","Embedded in the Battlefield"}},
[4696]={nameES="Embers of Battle",objectivesES={"Talk to Darfin","Fires can be found throughout Zarkul-sulûn.\
\
Darfin has asked you to douse lingering fires throughout Zarkul-sulûn.","Embers of Battle","Darfin can be found at Zarkul-sulûn.\
\
You have doused many lingering fires at Zarkul-sulûn. You should report to Darfin.","Although the Gabil'akkâ were able to win a foothold at Zarkul-sulûn, lingering fires from the battle endanger the dwarves and their supplies at Zarkul-sulûn."}},
[4697]={nameES="Emerald Firefly Lanterns",objectivesES={}},
[4698]={nameES="Emergency Rations",objectivesES={}},
[4699]={nameES="Emisarios de la Mano Blanca",objectivesES={"Los uruks de la Mano Blanca pueden encontrarse entre los trasgos y orcos que habitan en el Camino de Durin. Uno fue visto en Ninknakh Faltor, al norte de la Cámara de la Encrucijada. Otro en Gloku-ru, al noreste. El último fue avistado en el camino de Jazârgund hacia el Cruce de Durin, al noreste.\
\
Kalman te ha pedido que derrotes a los emisarios de la Mano Blanca.","Emisario derrotado en Gloku-ru","Emisario derrotado en el Cruce de Durin","Habla con Kalman en la entrada a Zirakzigil","Los exploradores enanos han avistado a un puñado de uruks de la Mano Blanca que han entrado de alguna forma en Moria, por caminos desconocidos. Parecen estar intentando aliarse con las tribus de trasgos del Camino de Durin.","Derrota al emisario en el Cruce de Durin","Derrota al emisario en Gloku-ru","Emisarios de la Mano Blanca","Derrota el emisario en Ninknakh Faltor","Derrota al emisario en Ninknakh Faltor","Kalman está en la Puerta de las Nubes, en el Camino de Durin.\
\
Deberías informar a Kalman de que los emisarios de la Mano Blanca que se encontraban en el Camino de Durin han sido derrotados."}},
[4700]={nameES="Emissaries to Jiret-menêsh",objectivesES={"Shenzâmin raises his hand in greeting","The ruler of Jiret-menêsh is inside the fortress.","Shenzâmin is in the fortress of Jiret-menêsh.","Châmelek Gêta, the ruler of Jiret-menêsh, asked you to help her people deal with the creatures at either the gredbyg camp to the west or the worm camp to the east.","A Temámir dwarf with thunder in his eyes shouts at you to watch yourself","Talk to Shenzâmin at Khanâg Valoyar","Find Châmelek Gêta, the ruler of Jiret-menêsh, inside the fortress","Habâti glowers at you.","The entrance to Jiret-menêsh is along the road north of Khanâg Valoyar.","Shenzâmin is at the cross-road south of Jiret-menêsh.","Talk to Dejemûl at the cross-road south of Jiret-menêsh","Shenzâmin and Kishâtal agreed to meet you at the cross-roads south of Jiret-menêsh.","Châmelek Gêta, the ruler of Jiret-menêsh, is inside the fortress.","Talk to Shenzâmin in the fortress of Jiret-menêsh","Shenzâmin is at Khanâg Valoyar, bristling with anger at your treatment by the Temámir Habâti.","Talk to Kishâtal at the cross-road south of Jiret-menêsh","Find the entrance to Jiret-menêsh far north of Khanâg Valoyar","Dejemûl is at the cross-road south of Jiret-menêsh.","Meet up with Shenzâmin and Kishâtal at the cross-road south of Jiret-menêsh","Talk to Shenzâmin at the cross-road south of Jiret-menêsh","Shenzâmin is in the fortress of Jiret-menêsh, near Châmelek Gêta.","Châmelek Gêta, the ruler of Jiret-menêsh, listens as you introduce yourself and the Hamâti soldiers Kishâtal and Shenzâmin. You go on to relay your treatment at Khanâg Valoyar, and the dwarf-leader frowns.\
\
'This dwarf Habâti is not immediately known to me, but I have been most busy with affairs within Jiret-menêsh itself. The operation of distant outposts on the surface I leave to others.\
\
'I will hear the words of Renewed Hamât, but it is customary for such dignitaries to lend some assistance when they arrive, as a showing of good faith. Two such problems currently trouble my people: an infestation of gredbyg and a host of worms. Does Hamât intend to help us with these matters?'","You have found the grand entrance to Jiret-menêsh","Talk to Habâti at Khanâg Valoyar","Shenzâmin stands here.","Châmelek Gêta, the ruler of Jiret-menêsh, is at her throne within the fortress.","Mizâdi entrusted her soldiers Shenzâmin and Kishâtal to meet with the Temámir of Jiret-menêsh, and they will not let her down.","Emissaries to Jiret-menêsh","Châmelek Gêta smiles magnanimously at you.\
\
'Very good, very good! I have been informed of your work on behalf of the Temámir of Jiret-menêsh, and will now listen to the words of the emissaries of Shâra Mizâdi of Renewed Hamât.'","Shenzâmin suggested that you first visit Khanâg Valoyar before you go to Jiret-menêsh.","The Temámir dwarf Habâti at Khanâg Valoyar has accosted you with shouted insults.","Talk to Châmelek Gêta, the ruler of Jiret-menêsh","Kishâtal at the cross-road south of Jiret-menêsh has listened to the merchant's words and wants to speak to you.","Visit Khanâg Valoyar before you go to Jiret-menêsh","If fortune is with you, the ruler of Jiret-menêsh will be more polite than Habâti"}},
[4701]={nameES="Emissary of Flame",objectivesES={"Defeated the Rogmul Emissary","Defeat the Rogmul Emissary","Ingold has asked you to defeat the Rogmul Emissary visiting Fushaum Tûm and to defeat those who may be persuaded by the Nameless creature.","A notice is pinned to the board, signed by Ingold:\
\
'An emissary from Nargroth has been spotted in Fushaum Tûm. A brave adventurer is needed to defeat the Rogmul emissary and those of Fushaum Tûm.'","Emissary of Flame","Ingold, a soldier of Gondor, has scouted Dor Amarth and is concerned with the growing numbers of foes gathering at the encampment of Fushaum Tûm."}},
[4702]={nameES="Emisario de la Ciudad de los Trasgos",objectivesES={"Entra en Minas Maur y derrota al emisario de la Ciudad de los Trasgos","Minas Maur es una de las grandes torres de Barad Gularan, al sur de Gath Forthnir.\
\
Debes viajar a Barad Gularan y derrotar al emisario de la Ciudad de los Trasgos dentro de Minas Maur. Brúnfair te sugirió que llevaras aliados contigo.","La Ciudad de los Trasgos ha enviado un emisario a Minas Maur para negociar con Angmar.","Gath Forthnir está al norte de Barad Gularan.\
\
Habiendo derrotado a Prakhum, regresa a Gath Forthnir y avisa a Brúnfair sobre lo que has hecho.","Emisario de la Ciudad de los Trasgos"}},
[4703]={nameES="Emisario de los Duramano",objectivesES={"Brúnfair está en Gath Forthnir, al norte de Barad Gularan.\
\
Habiendo derrotado a Laugi Lenguadorada, debes regresar a Brúnfair y contarle sobre tu éxito.","Habiendo descubierto un juramento de los Duramano, debes entrar en Minas Angos y derrotar a su emisario para detener una alianza entre ellos y la Corona de Hierro.","Entra en Minas Angos y derrota al emisario de los Duramano.","Emisario de los Duramano","Minas Angos es una torre en Barad Gularan, al sur de Gath Forthnir.\
\
Debes viajar a Barad Gularan y derrotar a Laugi Lenguadorada , el emisario de los Duramano, dentro de Minas Angos. Brúnfair te sugirió que llevaras aliados."}},
[4704]={nameES="Emissary of the Stout-axes",objectivesES={"Emissary of the Stout-axes","Gimli can be found at his camp-site within Dor Amarth.\
\
Spakorth has told the tale of his people's enslavement by a Black Númenórean and how the House that belonged to his ancestors was slowly brought to ruin by Sauron. You should speak to Gimli about what is to be done.","Talk to Spakorth at Blozronk","Talk to Gimli at Blozronk","Gimli can be found at the ruins of Díngarth in Dor Amarth.\
\
Spakorth of the Stout-axes has offered to treat with Gimli at Blozronk. You should return to Gimli and Legolas.","Talk to Gimli at the ruins of Díngarth","Spakorth can be found at Blozronk in Dor Amarth.\
\
Gimli and Legolas have discussed their concerns, but Gimli appears eager to help the Dwarves of Lûghash despite Legolas's reticence. You should now speak to Spakorth and learn how best to aid his folk.","After encountering the Stout-axe Dwarves of Mordor, Legolas and Gimli hope to establish peace with this long-lost House."}},
[4705]={nameES="Emisario de los Trev Duvárdain",objectivesES={"Emisario de los Trev Duvárdain","Minas Agar se encuentra en el lado occidental de Barad Gularan, al sur de Gath Forthnir.\
\
Debes viajar a Barad Gularan y derrotar a Karstíona, el emisario de los Trev Duvárdain, dentro de Minas Agar.","Brúnfair está en Gath Forthnir, al norte de Barad Gularan.\
\
Habiendo derrotado a Karstíona, debes regresar a Brúnfair y contarle sobre tu éxito.","Los Trev Duvardain han enviado un emisario a Minas Agar para negociar con los sirvientes de la Corona de Hierro.","Entra en Minas Agar y derrota a Karstíona"}},
[4706]={nameES="Emisario de la Mano Blanca",objectivesES={"Habiendo interceptado una promesa de Saruman de Isengard, debes entrar en Minas Caul y derrotar a su emisario para detener una alianza entre la Corona de Hierro y la Mano Blanca.","Bâlak derrotado","Brúnfair está en Gath Forthnir, al norte de Barad Gularan.\
\
Habiendo derrotado a Bâlak, debes regresar a Gath Forthnir y decirle a Brúnfair que has cumplido la tarea.","Entra en Minas Caul y derrota a Bâlak.","Minas Caul es una de las grandes torres de Barad Gularan, al sur de Gath Forthnir.\
\
Debes viajar a Barad Gularan y desafiar a Bâlak, el emisario de la Mano Blanca, dentro de Minas Caul.","Emisario de la Mano Blanca"}},
[4707]={nameES="Vacío",objectivesES={"The occupants of this shelter left no trace of their whereabouts","The quiet here is oppressive, as if not a breath stirs for leagues","Cyneberg is at Dunfast.\
\
You should tell Cyneberg what you found.","This home is colder and draughtier than the others...","The village of Dunfast is in the centre of the Whitshaws.\
\
You should examine Dunfast for clues as to why it is empty.","Apparently a violent scuffle broke out in this home","A mess was left here, as if belongings were hastily gathered","Vacío","This barn is empty; even the horses are gone","Return to Cyneberg","You and Cyneberg have come to the village of Dunfast, but it is empty....","Explore Dunfast","It is clear that supplies were gathered before this shelter was abandoned","The lock has been broken right off this door, as if entry was forced","This satchel has been abandoned in the middle of the floor"}},
[4708]={nameES="Empty Chairs",objectivesES={"Empty chairs can be found in the rear of the Mead Hall of Middlemead.\
\
You have gathered the keepsakes of Thane Mágla's councilmen. You should continue to place them at Mágla's side.","Thane Mágla can be found in the Mead Hall of Middlemead.","Empty chairs can be found in the rear of the Mead Hall of Middlemead.\
\
You have gathered the keepsakes of Thane Mágla's councilmen. You should now return them to Mágla's side.","Empty Chairs","Placed the sword","Thane Mágla's home can be found directly to the south-east of the Mead Hall in Middlemead.\
\
Thane Mágla has asked that you gather keepsakes from his bedside and return them to him, so his council might gather once last time.","Talk to Thane Mágla","Place the horseshoe at Mágla's side","Placed the horn","Place the horn at Mágla's side","Placed the shield","Heartbroken to learn the last of his council was slain, Thane Mágla wishes to sit amongst his men once more before the war's end.","Place the shield at Mágla's side","Place the sword at Mágla's side","Placed the horseshoe"}},
[4709]={nameES="Empty Keg Emergency",objectivesES={}},
[4710]={nameES="Despensa vacía",objectivesES={"El pescado que Nôra necesita puede encontrarse en la bahía de hielo al oeste del campamento de Olavi.\
\
Olavi te ha pedido que recojas una de sus cañas de pescar y consigas el pescado que Nôra necesita.","La despensa comunal de Sûri-kylä está agotándose, debido a los difíciles tiempos que corren en Forochel.","Despensa vacía","Nôra está en Sûri-kylä.\
\
Has conseguido el pescado donde Olavi te dijo que fueras. Ahora debes llevárselo a Nôra, que se encuentra en Sûri-kylä.","Lleva el pescado a Nôra","Encontrarás a Olavi al este y ligeramente al sur de Sûri-kylä en su campamento de pesca junto al camino de Itä-mâ.\
\
Nôra te ha pedido que le digas a Olavi que le lleve tantos cubos de pescado seco como pueda.","Habla con Olavi"}},
[4711]={nameES="Emyn Ernil Cave - Captain Without a Ship",objectivesES={}},
[4712]={nameES="Emyn Ernil Cave - Mining with Oars",objectivesES={}},
[4713]={nameES="Emyn Ernil Cave - Shaky Scaffolds",objectivesES={"Speak to Lhossil","Lhossil can be found in Dol Amroth.\
\
Lhossil will be pleased to hear the scaffold has been shored up.","The scaffolding holding up the ceiling of the large cave in Emyn Ernil is old and rotting.","Emyn Ernil Cave - Shaky Scaffolds","Rotting scaffolding may be found in the large cave beneath Emyn Ernil.\
\
Lhossil asked you to venture beneath Emyn Ernil and repair some of the scaffold within that is rotting away."}},
[4714]={nameES="Emyn Ernil Cave - Shattered Crystals",objectivesES={}},
[4715]={nameES="Emyn Ernil Tunnels - Claws of the Deep",objectivesES={"Deep-claws are digging in the tunnels beneath Emyn Ernil.\
\
Gelloth asked you to defeat the deep-claws that are threatening to collapse the tunnels beneath Emyn Ernil.","Gelloth can be found in Dol Amroth.\
\
Gelloth will be very pleased to hear the tunnels are safe from collapse.","Emyn Ernil Tunnels - Claws of the Deep","Speak to Gelloth","The Corsair intrusion has awoken the deep-claws beneath Emyn Ernil, threatening the stability of the tunnels."}},
[4716]={nameES="Emyn Ernil Tunnels - Corsair Surveyors",objectivesES={}},
[4717]={nameES="Emyn Ernil Tunnels - Forgotten Ore",objectivesES={}},
[4718]={nameES="Emyn Ernil Tunnels - Twists and Turns",objectivesES={"Emyn Ernil Tunnels - Twists and Turns","The tunnels beneath Emyn Ernil are a maze of twists and turns.","Speak to Gelloth","Posts can be found in the tunnels beneath Emyn Ernil.\
\
Gelloth asked you to venture beneath Emyn Ernil and mark the posts throughout the tunnels to aid in navigation.","Gelloth can be found in Dol Amroth.\
\
Gelloth will be pleased to hear the posts have been marked."}},
[4719]={nameES="Plagas de Emyn Naer",objectivesES={"Habla con Tinúriel en Echad Dúnann","Plagas de Emyn Naer","Una plaga de gusanos ha sido motivo de preocupación para los Elfos de Echad Dúnann.","Tinúriel está en Echad Dúnann, al noreste de Emyn Naer.\
\
Debes regresar de inmediato a Tinúriel e informarle de tu éxito.","Los gusanos pueden encontrarse en Emyn Naer, al suroeste de Echad Dúnann.\
\
Tinúriel te ha pedido que elimines a los corruptos gusanos de Emyn Naer."}},
[4720]={nameES="Enclaves in the Depths",objectivesES={}},
[4721]={nameES="Encroaching Avanc",objectivesES={}},
[4722]={nameES="Encroaching Ice",objectivesES={}},
[4723]={nameES="La amenaza de los kalpa-kita",objectivesES={"Habla con Âtos","Los kalpa-kita pueden encontrarse por toda la tundra de Itä-mâ.\
\
Âtos te ha pedido que ayudes a purgar Itä-mâ de la plaga de los kalpa-kita.","Âtos se encuentra en Pynti-leiri.\
\
Ahora que has derrotado a muchos kalpa-kita, deberías regresar con Âtos.","Los kalpa-kita han ido adentrándose poco a poco en territorio lossoth y ahora empiezan a lanzar pequeñas incursiones contra los puestos avanzados de los Lossoth prácticamente cada noche.","La amenaza de los kalpa-kita"}},
[4724]={nameES="Encroaching Spiders",objectivesES={"You have defeated many Spiders in Western Osgiliath.","Encroaching Spiders","Completado","Edenos has tasked you with defeating encroaching spiders from the Morgul Vale that have recently crossed the river.","You have defeated many Spiders thus making the Western side of the city a safer place to defend against the enemy.","Spiders can be found on the Western side of Osgiliath.\
\
You should defeat the encroaching Spiders."}},
[4725]={nameES="Encroaching on Esgaroth",objectivesES={"Esgaroth-of-old can be found east of Loeglond, on the Long Lake.\
\
You should travel to Esgaroth-of-old.","Talk to Mervárth","One last thing must be done to make the trading routes safe. Esgaroth-of-old, the ruins of the previous Lake-town, must be cleared of brigands.","Encroaching on Esgaroth","Travel to Esgaroth-of-old","Mervárth is standing guard outside Esgaroth-of-old.\
\
You should talk to Mervárth.","A man standing nearby whistles at you and beckons you over"}},
[4726]={nameES="Encroaching on the Sisters' Lands",objectivesES={"Melawen can be found in Malbarth in north-western Lebennin.\
\
You have defeated many Corsair scouts and should now return to Melawen.","Talk to Melawen","A scouting force of Corsairs has been lurking nearby the small settlement of Malbarth and seeks to pillage and overpower the few people that dwell there.","Corsair scouts can be found on the outskirts of Malbarth in north-western Lebennin.\
\
Melawen has asked you to search for and defeat any Corsair scouts encroaching on Malbarth.","Encroaching on the Sisters' Lands","DNT -- will not be seen"}},
[4727]={nameES="Termina con la amenaza de Dolvaethor",objectivesES={"Dolvaethor está en el interior de Haudh Valandil en la isla donde se encuentra Ost Elendil, más llá del puente de Ariant, en Annúminas.\
\
Glangilith te ha pedido que derrotes a Dolvaethor y pongas fin a sus malvados planes en Haudh Valandil.","Termina con la amenaza de Dolvaethor","Devuelve la paz a los restos de Valandil","Valandil está de nuevo en paz."}},
[4728]={nameES="End of Immortality",objectivesES={}},
[4729]={nameES="End of the Wintersebb",objectivesES={"Far to the north, where the Isendeep Mine runs beneath the shadow of the Mountains of Angmar, a brood of Drakes threatens the workers within the mine.","Return to Lieutenant Swithulf at the Grimwood Lumber Camp","Lieutenant Swithulf awaits your return at the Grimwood Lumber-yard.\
\
Climbing high into the foothills of the Mountains of Angmar in Arador's end, you faced down many foes from the Wintersebb-brood and emerged to collect your reward.","End of the Wintersebb","Wintersebb-drakes can be found north in the area of Arador's End.\
\
Lieutenant Swithulf directed you to make your way north with others in search of a way to destroy the Wintersebb-drakes."}},
[4730]={nameES="Fin de la pesadilla",objectivesES={"Éa está en Tármunn Súrsa, cerca de Carn Dûm.\
\
Has devuelto a Dírdrë con los Montaraces. Deberías hablar con Éa, su madre, de inmediato.","Has encontrado a Dírdrë, hija de Éa, viva y a salvo.","Escolta a Dírdrë a un lugar seguro","Éa está en Tármunn Súrsa, cerca de Carn Dûm.\
\
Dírdrë te ha pedido ayuda para regresar con su madre, Éa.","Has escoltado a Dírdrë a un lugar seguro","Fin de la pesadilla"}},
[4731]={nameES="El fin del terror",objectivesES={"El fin del terror","Has derrotado a muchos orcos en Urugarth, pero tu tarea aún no está completa. El líder uruk sigue en pie.","Donaith está en Gath Forthnír, al este de Urugarth.\
\
Deberías regresar a Gath Forthnír y contarle a Donaith la buena noticia de tu victoria.","El líder del ejército orco reside en las profundidades de Urugarth, al oeste de Gath Forthnír.\
\
Donaith te habló de un poderoso general uruk que debe ser derrotado."}},
[4732]={nameES="Acabando con el anciano",objectivesES={"Las sierpes que infestan las ruinas de Fornost están liderados por un anciano al que los orcos llaman Gajarpan. Hay que destruir a Gajarpan si queremos expulsar a las sierpes de Fornost.","Erl Pescador está en el campamento de los cazatesoros de las ruinas de Fornost.\
\
Deberías hablar con Erl Pescador.","Derrota a Gajarpan","Acabando con el anciano","Vuelve junto a Erl Pescador","Has derrotado a Gajarpan","Puedes encontrar a Gajarpan muy al norte del campamento de los cazatesoros.\
\
Erl Pescador te ha pedido que mates a Gajarpan, el más viejo y terrible de las sierpes.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Se recomienda una compañía pequeña.</rgb>"}},
[4733]={nameES="Ending the Nightmare",objectivesES={"There is great rumour about the Abominations stealing children, and they also have been attacking Lhan Rhos.","Talk to Blaire at the Boar-clan encampment","Talk to Blaire when you are ready to leave for Lhan Colvarn","Blaire is at the Boar-clan encampment, south of Lhan Colvarn.\
\
Blaire has asked you to accompany him to Lhan Colvarn for a night raid.","Blaire is at the Boar-clan encampment, south of Lhan Colvarn.\
\
You should talk to Blaire now that you have ended the Abomination threat.","Ending the Nightmare"}},
[4734]={nameES="Enduring The War",objectivesES={"Wounded soldiers can be found in Díngarth.\
\
You should tend to the wounded soldiers.","Enduring The War","Círdan can be found in Díngarth.\
\
You should talk to Círdan.","Talk to Círdan","Salves can be found in Díngarth.\
\
You should gather salves for wounded soldiers.","Círdan has seen many injured over the years. Currently, many of those wounded remain untreated."}},
[4735]={nameES="Enedwaith - Grey Company I",objectivesES={}},
[4736]={nameES="Enedwaith - Grey Company II",objectivesES={}},
[4737]={nameES="Enedwaith - Grey Company III",objectivesES={}},
[4738]={nameES="Enedwaith - Grey Company IV",objectivesES={}},
[4739]={nameES="Enedwaith Algraig Tokens of the Wild Allowance",objectivesES={}},
[4740]={nameES="Enemies Abound",objectivesES={"You delivered the signet of Torsbury to Thane Tordag as Fríthild required, but you have found the people of Torsbury already routed from their town.","Enemies Abound","Servants of the White Hand can be found at Torsbury and in the fields south of Torsbury.\
\
Torferth asked you to ride to Torsbury and the field to the south of the village and learn what kinds of forces are arrayed against his father's garrison.","DNT -- Will not be seen","Torferth is at Tordag's encampment, north of the road between Torsbury and Stoke.\
\
You should return to Torferth with your report.","Torferth is at Tordag's encampment north of the road between Torsbury and Stoke.\
\
Tordag told you to lend your aid to his son, Torferth.","Talk to Torferth in Tordag's encampment","Talk to Torferth at Tordag's encampment"}},
[4741]={nameES="Enemies Beneath the Mountain",objectivesES={}},
[4742]={nameES="Enemies Beneath the Towers",objectivesES={}},
[4743]={nameES="Enemigos para siempre",objectivesES={"Los trasgos han infestado Gazatmur en números alarmantes y representan una gran amenaza para el campamento del Mirador de la Gran Excavación.","Wigfast está en su escondite cerca de Gazatmur, el campamento de trasgos del este de la Gran Excavación.\
\
Debes regresar con Wigfast ahora que has reducido el número de trasgos.","Enemigos para siempre","Los trasgos se encuentran en Gazatmur, una gran zona al este de la Gran Excavación.\
\
Debes derrotar a muchos trasgos en Gazatmur para reducir su número.","Regresa con Wigfast en su escondite"}},
[4744]={nameES="Enemies Within the Ruins",objectivesES={"Search the Palace of Eldacar","Search the House of Healing","Searched the Dome of Stars","Search interiors within after-battle Osgiliath for enemies and hidden supplies.","Talk to Mablung","Mablung has asked you to search Osgiliath's ruined buildings for enemies and hidden supplies.","Search the Dome of Stars","You should talk to Mablung, who can be found at the Ranger encampment in after-battle Osgiliath.","Searched the Palace of Eldacar","Enemies Within the Ruins","Searched the House of Healing"}},
[4745]={nameES="Enemies at Bagûd-mekhem",objectivesES={}},
[4746]={nameES="Enemies at the War-fell",objectivesES={"You have defeated a vast number of the forces of Gundabad at Azgh-buzru.","Overrun with the forces of Gorgar the Ruthless, the War of Three Peaks rages at Azgh-buzru.\
\
If the Gabil'akkâ hope to continue their march on Mount Gundabad, their enemies at the war-fell must be defeated to the last.","Overrun with the forces of Gorgar the Ruthless, Azgh-buzru has become the site of many skirmishes in the War of Three Peaks.","Enemies at the War-fell","Gorgar's forces can be found throughout Azgh-buzru.\
\
You have encountered a vast number of Gorgar's forces at Azgh-buzru, the war-fell. You should defeat them and aid the march on Gundabad.","Completado","You have defeated a vast number of the forces of Gundabad at Azgh-buzru and granted a brief advantage to the dwarves of the Gabil'akkâ."}},
[4747]={nameES="Enemies in Seregost",objectivesES={}},
[4748]={nameES="Enemies in the Firien Wood",objectivesES={}},
[4749]={nameES="Enemies in the Mouths of Entwash",objectivesES={"You should defeat the Orcs and Variags you find in the Mouths of Entwash.","Enemies in the Mouths of Entwash","Forces of the enemy now creep through the Mouths of Entwash and should be rooted out.","Root out forces of the enemy that have taken to the Mouths of Entwash."}},
[4750]={nameES="Enemies of Elves and Men",objectivesES={}},
[4751]={nameES="Enemigos de Lothlórien",objectivesES={"Narfi se encuentra en la Sala Vigesimoprimera, al noreste de la Guardia Orca y de Anazârmekhem.\
\
Tras muchas incursiones difíciles en el corazón mismo de las fortalezas orcas de Moria, has logrado victorias decisivas y frustrado los intentos de las criaturas de asestar un golpe devastador contra los elfos de Lothlórien.","Completa las tareas de Pálmar en las forjas de Khazad-dûm","Habla con Narfi en la Sala Vigesimoprimera","Los orcos se reúnen bajo diversos estandartes, pero acuden a una sola causa. Esto resulta inquietante para los enanos, y la intención de la hueste de guerra de Moria impulsa incluso a los más firmes del Pueblo de Durin a actuar contra los orcos en las salas que han ocupado durante tantos años.","Completa las tareas de Avar en la Gran Escalera","Enemigos de Lothlórien","Los hermanos de Narfi pueden encontrarse en la Guardia Orca y en Anazârmekhem, al suroeste de la Sala Vigesimoprimera, donde Narfi ocupa su puesto.\
\
Narfi te ha pedido que visites a sus hermanos Avar, Pálmar y Teitur en la Guardia Orca y en Anazârmekhem, y averigües qué ayuda necesitan.","Completa las tareas de Teitur en Fil Gashan"}},
[4752]={nameES="Enemies of our Enemy",objectivesES={"Sergeant-at-Arms Thorfinn has an idea that could give the Free Peoples the ability to drive the forces of Angmar from the Isendeep, but the plan is not without grave danger.","Thistledown grazers are found on the southern side of the Hoarwell River or on the plains of the Steps of Gram. The grazing land near the Hoarwell is south and west from the dwarf camp and the grazing land in the Steps of Gram is to the south and east.\
\
Sergeant-at-Arms Thorfinn believes that with some clever tactics, the Free Peoples may use the drakes against Angmar's host and sweep through the mines behind them to recover the position.","Deliver the haunches to Sergeant-at-Arms Thorfinn at the camp west of the Isendeep","Place the haunches on the flat stone near the War-tyrant","The flat stone is very near where the War-tyrant commands his forces within the Isendeep Mine.\
\
Sergeant-at-Arms Thorfinn wants to drive the forces of Angmar from the Isendeep. He believes with some clever placement, the Free Peoples may use the drakes against Angmar's host and sweep through the mines behind them to recover the position.","The meat has been placed","Enemies of our Enemy"}},
[4753]={nameES="Enemigos del Cruce de Caminos",objectivesES={"Vuelve con Svanr en Sudulthurkh","Enemigos del Cruce de Caminos","Svanr se encuentra en un rincón del camino justo al este de Sudulthurkh.\
\
Debes hablar con Svanr.","Tú y Svanr vieron a un gran número de orcos empujando carros en Sudulthurkh, claramente transportando suministros de guerra hacia el este.","Los orcos se encuentran empujando carros en el cruce de Sudulthurkh en Nud-melek, al norte del gran abismo.\
\
Debes derrotar a los orcos belicosos de Moria antes de que puedan causar estragos en el Valle."}},
[4754]={nameES="Enemigos del Descenso Profundo",objectivesES={"Stíling está explorando las afueras de Gamil Filik, en las Vetas del  Cuerno de Plata, al sur y luego ligeramente al este del Descenso Profundo.\
\
Deberías hablar con Stíling y ofrecerle tus servicios para hacer frente a la amenaza de los trasgos","Enemigos del Descenso Profundo","Encuentra a Stíling en Gamil Filik","Thettmár te ha pedido que busques a Stíling, que se ha ido a explorar las vías del este."}},
[4755]={nameES="Enemigos de los Eglain",objectivesES={"El supervisor de los Duramano puede encontrarse en las ruinas de Mithrenost, al sur de Refr Mercurio.\
\
Refr Mercurio te ha pedido que localices y derrotes al supervisor de los Duramano en Mithrenost, con la esperanza de que sus seguidores se aparten de sus malos caminos. Te pidió que le lleves pruebas de la derrota del supervisor.","Medallón del supervisor de los Duramano recuperado","Entrega el medallón del supervisor de los Duramano a Refr Mercurio","Recupera el medallón del supervisor de los Duramano","Enemigos de los Eglain","En Annunlos hay una ruina, abandonada desde hace mucho por los Eglain. Los Eglain se llevaron todo lo que pudieron sin explorar las tumbas bajo la ruina, como es su costumbre. Sin embargo, la ruina vuelve a rebosar de vida, ya que enanos, aliados con orcos, la registran en busca de tesoros en sus profundidades."}},
[4756]={nameES="Enemigos de la Segunda Sala",objectivesES={"Muchos enemigos merodean por la Segunda Sala de Nud-melek.\
\
Debes derrotar a las fuerzas del mal que rondan esta sala.","Enemigos de la Segunda Sala","Enemigos y criaturas viles se encuentran en la Segunda Sala de Nud-melek.\
\
Debes derrotar a los enemigos en la Segunda Sala.","Completado","Muchos enemigos merodean por la Segunda Sala de Nud-melek.","Has derrotado a varios enemigos en la Segunda Sala de Nud-melek."}},
[4757]={nameES="Enemies on the Threshold",objectivesES={"In the ruins beside the gates of Mount Gundabad, the forces of Gorgar the Ruthless have built twin encampments known as Hanksar-mokh, the sword-home, and Kulûg-mokh, the spear-home. From these encampments, countless Orcs keep watch on Elderslade, where they remain ever-prepared to slay any who would dare to approach the domain of Gorgar the Ruthless.\
\
You should defeat many of the forces of Gorgar at Hanksar-mokh and Kulûg-mokh.","Enemies on the Threshold","Gorgar the Ruthless has rallied his forces to Hanksar-mokh and Kulûg-mokh, twin encampments built beside the very gates of Mount Gundabad.","You have defeated a significant number of Gorgar's forces at Hanksar-mokh and Kulûg-mokh and done much to clear the path to the gates of Mount Gundabad for the Gabil'akkâ.","Completado","The forces of Gorgar the Ruthless can be found in Hanksar-mokh and Kulûg-mokh, Orc-encampments that straddle the gates of Mount Gundabad.\
\
Countless numbers of Orcs, trolls, and goblins loyal to Gorgar the Ruthless inhabit Hanksar-mokh and Kulûg-mokh. You should defeat as many as you can to aid the Gabil'akkâ in reclaiming Mount Gundabad.","You have defeated a significant number of Gorgar's forces at Hanksar-mokh and Kulûg-mokh."}},
[4758]={nameES="Enemigo tras enemigo",objectivesES={"Enemigo tras enemigo","Lleva la carne a Merruth","Los jabalíes que habitan en el este de Cardolan portan una enfermedad mortal.","Merruth te ha pedido que caces jabalíes enfermos en el este de Cardolan y que coloques su carne en el camino a los cubiles de huargos cercanos.","Deberías llevarle la carne de jabalí enfermo a Merruth.\
\
Merruth está en el este de Cardolan."}},
[4759]={nameES="El enemigo a las puertas",objectivesES={"Habla con Glamodúd en Echad Glamodúd","Habla con Aemeldir en Echad Sirion","The presence of goblin-spies in the Mirk-eaves also infers the presence of an enemy encampment somewhere in the vicinity.","Glamodúd is at Echad Glamodúd, south-east from Echad Sirion, at the southern foot of Amon Angened. Aemeldir is at Echad Sirion.\
\
Farasgon has asked you to speak with Glamodúd regarding the Orc-camp to the south and Aemeldir regarding Dúrburz-stazg, the encampment to the north.","El enemigo a las puertas"}},
[4760]={nameES="Enemy \\qIntelligence\\q",objectivesES={"Stazg Vozag, the main out-camp in the Pit of Stonejaws, receives messages from hobgoblins elsewhere in Gundabad.","\\qDwarves have breached gates of Gundabad. Máttugard under siege.\\q","Talk to Klúso near Stazg Vozag","Scraps of paper inside the out-camp might hold information intended for the hobgoblin leadership... but they might be intercepted by a daring adventurer.","\\qThing-fold wards remain intact. Do not attempt to enter!\\q","Collect the first hobgoblin report","Collect the second hobgoblin report","Collect the fourth hobgoblin report","Klúso is scouting near Stazg Vozag.","\\qGloomingtarn wards being attacked. Orcs maybe free to enter.\\q","Collect the fifth hobgoblin report","Enemy \\qIntelligence\\q","\\qMorale low among Orc soldiers. Gorgar is failing.\\q","\\qAngmarim continuing experiments in Clovengap. Keeping watch.\\q","Collect the third hobgoblin report"}},
[4761]={nameES="Enemy at the Armoury",objectivesES={}},
[4762]={nameES="Enemy at the Eastern Wharf",objectivesES={"Melethon is at the Causeway Forts.\
\
You should speak to Melethon.","Speak with Melethon","The Eastern Wharf is located on the Eastern side of Osgiliath.\
\
You should fight and slaughter foes around the Eastern Wharf.","Melethon has ordered you to fight and slaughter foes around the Eastern Wharf in the goal to retake Osgiliath.","Enemy at the Eastern Wharf"}},
[4763]={nameES="Debilitando al enemigo",objectivesES={"Lieva Lirioagrio espera tu regreso en la Posada Abandonada, al suroeste de la Ladera de los Vientos.\
\
Añadiste el brebaje de Lieva a los barriles de comida en los campamentos de trasgos al noreste de la Posada Abandonada. Lieva querrá saber de tu éxito.","Habrá barriles de comida sin comer en los campamentos de trasgos de la Ladera de los Vientos, al noreste de la Posada Abandonada y al suroeste de la Cima de los Vientos.\
\
Lieva Lirioagrio te ha pedido que lleves un brebaje especial que preparó a los campamentos de trasgos del noreste e introducirlo en su suministro de comida. Se supone que el brebaje tiene propiedades que, según Lieva, animarán a los trasgos a abandonar las Tierras Solitarias.","Debilitando al enemigo","Lieva Lirioagrio tiene una gran aversión por los trasgos que han llegado recientemente a las Tierras Solitarias y busca ahuyentarlos.","Habla con Lieva Lirioagrio en la Posada Abandonada"}},
[4764]={nameES="Engaging the Enemy",objectivesES={"Engaging the Enemy","Habla con Aemeldir en Echad Sirion","Durbúrz-stazg lies to the north of Echad Sirion.\
\
Aemeldir has asked you to defeat servants of the Enemy at Durbúrz-stazg. You will need to enter the encampment through the eastern gate.","The Elves of the Golden Host seek a way to cripple the Orcs of Durbúrz-stazg.","Echad Sirion lies to the south of Durbúrz-stazg.\
\
You should return to Aemeldir with news of your success."}},
[4765]={nameES="Engines of Destruction",objectivesES={"Talk to Órug at Drenghól","Órug can be found at Drenghól in the War of Three Peaks.\
\
You have destroyed many trebuchets and ballistae at Azgh-buzru. You should report to Órug at Drenghól.","Orkish trebuchets and ballistae can be found at Azgh-buzru.\
\
Órug has asked you to destroy trebuchets and ballistae at Azgh-buzru.","Gorgar's forces have erected terrible siege-engines to halt the advance of the Gabil'akkâ at Azgh-buzru.","Engines of Destruction"}},
[4766]={nameES="Enhancement Runes for Host of the West Silver Pieces (Daily)",objectivesES={"The Host of the West Quartermaster asked you to bring them fifty Host of the West Silver Pieces.","Enhancement Runes for Host of the West Silver Pieces (Daily)","Deliver 50 Host of the West Silver Pieces to the Host of the West Quartermaster","The Host of the West has many fine wares for those who would aid them."}},
[4767]={nameES="Enhancement Runes for Host of the West Silver Pieces (Weekly)",objectivesES={"Enhancement Runes for Host of the West Silver Pieces (Weekly)","The Host of the West Quartermaster asked you to bring them one-hundred Host of the West Silver Pieces.","Deliver 100 Host of the West Silver Pieces to the Host of the West Quartermaster","The Host of the West has many fine wares for those who would aid them."}},
[4768]={nameES="Enlightenment of the Suspicious Mind",objectivesES={"Irsinith, inspired by your story, will commune with the Mother Tree. While she does, she asks that you visit her father and mother at Sul Madásh.","Viznak wants you to bring the tale and news of the king's story to Irsinith, the Warden of the Mother Tree in Adagím.","Viznak is curious and precocious, a frightening combination. He directs you to seek Irsinith's counsel at the Mother Tree.","Present your story to Ildimár at Sul Madásh","Irsinith, inspired by your story, will commune with the Mother Tree. You have spoken with Irsinith's father. He asked that you speak with her mother before returning to Irsinith at the Mother Tree.","Speak with Irsinith at the Mother Tree","Irsinith bids you seek counsel from her parents in Sul Madásh","Enlightenment of the Suspicious Mind","You learned some more about the blight from Ildimár and Dáthlil, return to Irsinith at the Mother Tree in Adagím and see what she learned from her communion with the ancient tree.","Return to Irsinith at the Mother Tree and see what she learned","Dáthlil responds and bids you return to Irsinith","Irsinith listens to the tale of the King's Folly with great interest. As you explain the variance in maps from the Temámír and Men, she nods in assent. When you finish, she pauses and looks to the Mother Tree.\
\
'The Temámír map speaks true. In elder days, we held pacts with the dwarves; the defence of Nisigím was a charge borne by all. There were peaks even they dared not climb.\
\
'The Kinta stood firm in that age, though it lies beyond my remembering. My father and mother may recall what I cannot.\
\
'Take your tale to them at Sul Madásh. I shall seek Amûma's counsel—if her grief permits, she may yet speak.'","You shared your story with Ildimár","After your explanation and description of the enemies setting upon you on the return to him, Viznak looks off into the distance before speaking.\
\
'Morvul, troll, Orcs, all pawns for Blight Lady. Not spiders, though. Not that I ever see. My bodyguards are smart to send you. We should tell the sad Elf-lady about Blight Lady. Her name is Irsinith. She is a very sad Elf-lady. This news will not cheer her up, but maybe give her a new purpose. You go and talk to her and see if she can teach you more.'","Hear Dáthlil's response to your story","Ildimár and Dáthlil listen to the retelling of the King's Folly, and all you have learned since. They share a glance, and Ildimár speaks.\
\
'Men tell this story in a manner different from what we recall. Ages have passed, the king's bones have long been dust, but a persistent memory endures.\
\
'Bitter woe came to Nisigím, and many reaches of the great wood went unwatched after. Our people fought not only the cruelty of Men, but also the endless creep of Sívigush, the blight that rises now to consume all. In truth, we have always striven against Sívigush. It is as old as the stars.'"}},
[4769]={nameES="¡Basta de problemas!",objectivesES={"Derrota al supervisor baltmau","Tu misión es viajar a Mokh Grazádh al oeste y reducir el número de orcos en el campamento antes de que continúen atacando Laivárth. Si puedes, destruye también cualquier suministro que encuentres.","Supervisor baltmau derrotado"}},
[4770]={nameES="Entangled Elves",objectivesES={"A number of Ivorel's scouts have not returned from their mission in the Scuttledells. Miluimil saw some of them entrapped by the spiders to the north.","Habla con Miluimil en el campamento de Ivorel","Entangled Elves","The ensnared Elves may be found in the nests of the spiders to the north of Ivorel's camp.\
\
Miluimil has asked you to set forth to free his ensnared companions.","Miluimil is at Ivorel's camp, south of the spider-nests.\
\
You should speak with Miluimil and tell him that the scouts have been freed."}},
[4771]={nameES="Entra en el Ángulo",objectivesES={"Encuentra el camino a Eitheldir","El camino a Eitheldir se halla en el norte del Ángulo.\
\
Deberías buscar el camino que lleva a Eitheldir.","Busca a Merileg","Durante milenios, el Ángulo fue escenario de innumerables y devastadoras batallas, lo que le valió el nombre de Haudh Erthaid, la Tumba de los Reinos. Convertido de nuevo en un paraje natural, ofrece refugio a quienes no desean ser encontrados. Resguardado por dos ríos difíciles de vadear, el Ángulo es el hogar de montaraces, elfos y refugiados por igual. Pero una reciente incursión de orcos, forajidos y otros siervos del Enemigo ha devuelto la guerra a las colinas y las riberas del Ángulo.","Merileg se encuentra cerca de las ruinas de Eitheldir, en el norte del Ángulo.\
\
Elladan te ha pedido que le entregues una carta de presentación.","Entra en el Ángulo"}},
[4772]={nameES="Entran los Orientales",objectivesES={"Este guerrero sostiene un pergamino sellado con cera azul","Bingo está en el patio superior de Stangard.\
\
Tú y tus aliados han defendido Stangard con éxito del ataque oriental.","Lleva las órdenes secretas a Bingo en Etheburg, en el borde de las Tierras Pardas","Derrota orientales en las Tierras Pardas (11/12)","Habla con Bingo en la puerta este de Stangard y prepárate para la ofensiva oriental","Habla con Bingo dentro de Stangard","El puesto avanzado de Etheburg está en el borde de las Tierras Pardas, más allá del Juncal.\
\
Bingo ha decidido tomar cartas en el asunto y quiere investigar las Tierras Pardas.","Se pueden encontrar orientales por todas las Tierras Pardas, y Bingo te ha pedido que luches contra ellos para ayudar a los hombres de Stangard.","Bingo quiere ayudar a los hombres de Stangard, aunque se negaron a escuchar su advertencia de que un ejército se reúne justo ante sus puertas.","Entran los Orientales","Langhár está en el patio superior de Stangard.\
\
Tú y tus aliados habéis defendido Stangard con éxito del ataque oriental.","Habla con Langhár dentro de Stangard","Sabert está en la puerta este del puesto avanzado de Stangard.\
\
Has encontrado órdenes preocupantes dirigidas a los Orientales, y Bingo quiere que se las muestres a Sabert en Stangard.","Bingo está en el puesto avanzado de Etheburg, en el borde de las Tierras Pardas.\
\
Has encontrado un pergamino que aparentemente contiene órdenes secretas para los Orientales describiendo un ataque encubierto a un puesto que parece ser Stangard.","Sabert está en la puerta este del puesto avanzado de Stangard.\
\
Sabert ha cambiado de opinión ahora que le has mostrado pruebas del plan de los Orientales, y quiere que lo ayudes con las defensas de Stangard.","Lleva las órdenes secretas a Sabert en la puerta este de Stangard","Habla con Bingo en el puesto avanzado de Etheburg, en el borde de las Tierras Pardas"}},
[4773]={nameES="Enter the Remmorchant",objectivesES={"Defeated Gragarag of the Queensbrood","Defeat Gamnagol of the Queensbrood","Defeated Rûkhor the Pale Herald","Mablung is awaiting your return in Echad Taerdim, the Ranger camp in Cirith Ungol.\
\
You should report to Mablung when you are able.","The time has come to enter the Remmorchant.\
\
You should enter the Remmorchant with a raid group ready via the Instance Finder panel.","Enter the Remmorchant","Talk to Mablung","Word has reached you that Celeborn and the Rangers of Ithilien are prepared to enter the Remmorchant. They have called for your aid. You should return to Echad Taerdim in Cirith Ungol and report to Mablung.","Talk to Celeborn inside Torech Ungol","Bratha Tasakh and her Ungoledain have been defeated.\
\
You should press further into the Remmorchant.","Shelob has been defeated at last.\
\
You should talk to Celeborn.","Defeated Thossulun the Massive","Rûkhor the Pale Herald has unveiled his nefarious plot!\
\
You should defeat Rûkhor the Pale Herald before he succeeds in his plan!","The chieftain of the Ungoledain blocks your path deeper into the Remmorchant.\
\
You should defeat Bratha Tasakh, Lady of Many Venoms.","Defeated Gamnagol of the Queensbrood","Defeat Bratha Tasakh, Lady of Many Venoms","Defeat Guruthang of the Queensbrood","The mighty children of Shelob block your path forward.\
\
You should defeat the Queensbrood and Thossulun the Massive.","Defeated Bratha Tasakh, Lady of Many Venoms","Proceed deeper into the Remmorchant","Defeat Gragarag of the Queensbrood","Defeat Shelob","Defeat Rûkhor the Pale Herald","Celeborn and the Rangers have set up a small staging camp inside Torech Ungol.\
\
You should find the camp and report to Celeborn.","Celeborn and the Rangers of Ithilien are prepared to enter the depths of the Remmorchant, and have called for your aid. The time has come to once again face Shelob.","Defeated Guruthang of the Queensbrood","Habla con Celeborn","Defeat Thossulun the Massive","Thossulun and the Queensbrood have fallen, finally stemming the tide of spiders and gredbyg.\
\
You should press further into the Remmorchant.","Reach Level 130","The time has come to face Shelob within the Remmorchant.\
\
You should defeat Shelob."}},
[4774]={nameES="Entering Khanâg Gur",objectivesES={}},
[4775]={nameES="Enterrado en Haudh Eärendur",objectivesES={"Enterrado en Haudh Eärendur","Nimbellas se encuentra en el campamento de los Montaraces, en el Camino de los Reyes.\
\
Nimbellas estará deseando examinar los grabados que has recogido.","Habla con Nimbellas en el Camino de los Reyes","En Haudh Eärendur descansa el último Rey del Norte que logró mantener unida la Casa de Elendil.","Haudh Eärendur se encuentra en el Camino de los Reyes, al oeste del campamento de los Montaraces.\
\
Nimbellas te ha pedido que copies los grabados de las tumbas de Haudh Eärendur."}},
[4776]={nameES="Entradas de Barad Tharsír",objectivesES={"Entradas de Barad Tharsír","Las profundas rodadas en el suelo y los pequeños trozos de madera identifican esta sala como el viejo almacén","Un leve marcado de espadas y arcos rodea la entrada. Esto debió ser la armería","Descubre la segunda entrada","Habla con Daerol en el Coloso","Barad Tharsír fue una vez un importante puerto de mercancías que comunicaba Evendim con el sur por el Baranduin.","Una gran cantidad de fragmento de cerámica identifica esta sala como el comedor","Descubre la quinta entrada","Daerol está en el Coloso, al noroeste de Barad Tharsír.\
\
Daerol estará muy interesado en oír lo que has averiguado sobre las puertas de Barad Tharsír.","El punto más alto de las ruinas. Los restos dispersos de armamento dejan claro que esto eran los barracones","Barad Tharsír está al sureste del Coloso en la orilla este del río Brandivino.\
\
Daerol te ha pedido que explores las ruinas de Barad Tharsír y le informes de lo que encuentres.","Esta entrada no se identificó, o el tiempo ha borrado cualquier inscripción","Descubre la tercera entrada","Descubre la primera entrada","Descubre la cuarta entrada"}},
[4777]={nameES="Tarea de los Ents del Bosque de Fangorn: Membrana nociva",objectivesES={"Los Ents del Bosque de Fangorn tienen la tarea de recoger trofeos al derrotar a sus enemigos en Oestemnet. Estos pueden ser entregados a cambio de una recompensa.","Tarea de los Ents del Bosque de Fangorn: Membrana nociva","Entrega las membranas nocivas en una caja de recolección","Se busca: Membrana nociva del oeste de Rohan. Recógela para ganar una recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista en El Valle Emboscado.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir trofeos de la batalla.","Se busca: Membrana nociva de Oestemnet."}},
