[4847]={nameES="Huida de La Hendidura del Ocaso",objectivesES={"Clark Cercapiedra está en Ost Forod, el antiguo puesto de vigilancia en las colinas de Tyrn Fornech, al sur de La Hendidura del Ocaso.\
\
Has recuperado la mochila de reliquias robadas y deberías devolvérsela a Clark Cercapiedra.","La mochila de cerámica robada está en algún lugar de La Hendidura del Ocaso, al suroeste de Tûm Fuin, infestado de trasgos. Tûm Fuin está al norte de Ost Forod.","Clark Cercapiedra se encontró con una banda de saqueadores de tumbas en La Hendidura del Ocaso, y cree que podrían haber ocultado allí una mochila de reliquias robadas.","Huida de La Hendidura del Ocaso","Llévale la mochila de reliquias a Clark Cercapiedra"}},
[4848]={nameES="Escapa del palacio",objectivesES={"Encuentra al último noble de Zajâni prisionero","Nirjara deja escapar un último suspiro y se desploma en el suelo, derrotada","Escapa del palacio","Derrota a Nirjara Boro en el Salón de Lajor.","Libera al último noble de Zajâni prisionero en el Salón de Lajor.","Derrota a los guardias ordâkhai y libera a los nobles de Zajâni prisioneros en el Salón de Lajor.","Derrota a Nirjara Boro en el Salón de Lajor","Libera al último noble de Zajâni prisionero","Encuentra al último noble de Zajâni prisionero en el Salón de Lajor.","Varios nobles de Zajâni han sido secuestrados por el Consejo de las Joyas. Aunque se pague su rescate, los Ordâkhai los matarán de todos modos. Ve al Salón de Lajor y rescátalos."}},
[4849]={nameES="Espying the Vale",objectivesES={"Ingbert has instructed you to lend his son Ingmar your full support as he makes preparations for the attack on Maustazg.","Ingmar has asked you to ride a patrol through the Entwash Vale.\
\
You should patrol the first point for signs of the Enemy.","Ingmar has asked you to ride a patrol through the Entwash Vale.\
\
You should patrol the third point for signs of the Enemy.","Espying the Vale","Ingmar has asked you to ride a patrol through the Entwash Vale.\
\
You should patrol the final point for signs of the Enemy.","Patrol the third point","Patrolled the fourth point","Patrolled the third point","Ingmar has asked you to ride a patrol through the Entwash Vale.\
\
You should patrol the second point for signs of the Enemy.","Patrol the second point","Patrol the fourth point","Patrol the first point","Patrolled the first point","Patrolled the final point","Patrol the final point","Ingmar is in the Mead Hall of Eaworth, in the Entwash Vale.\
\
You should return to Ingmar with news of your success.","Talk to Ingmar in the Mead Hall of Eaworth","Patrolled the second point","Ingmar has asked you to ride a patrol through the Entwash Vale.\
\
You should patrol the fourth point for signs of the Enemy."}},
[4850]={nameES="Espying the Vale",objectivesES={"Góda has instructed you to make a patrol of the Entwash Vale to determine the strength of the Enemy.\
\
You should patrol the first point.","Espying the Vale","Patrol the third point","Góda has instructed you to make a patrol of the Entwash Vale to determine the strength of the Enemy.\
\
You should patrol the fourth point.","Patrolled the fourth point","Patrolled the third point","Lady Góda is in the Mead Hall of Eaworth, in the Entwash Vale.\
\
You should return to Lady Góda with news of your success.","Góda has instructed you to make a patrol of the Entwash Vale to determine the strength of the Enemy.\
