[4919]={nameES="Tarea de expedición: Vaina de espada enana",objectivesES={"Alguien ha publicado una tarea para recoger vainas de espada enanas. Se pueden entregar a cambio de una recompensa.","Se busca: Vainas de espada enanas de las Moradas de los Enanos. Recógelas para ganar una recompensa adecuada para los coleccionistas.","Tarea de expedición: Vaina de espada enana","Se busca: Vainas de espada enanas de las Moradas de los Enanos.","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir vainas de espada enanas.","Entrega las vainas de espada enanas en una caja de recolección","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú."}},
[4920]={nameES="Tarea de expedición: Cola de roca",objectivesES={"Alguien ha publicado una tarea para recoger colas de roca. Se pueden entregar a cambio de una recompensa.","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir colas de roca.","Se busca: Colas de roca de las Moradas de los Enanos.","Se busca: Colas de roca de las Moradas de los Enanos. Recógelas para ganar una recompensa adecuada para los coleccionistas.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Tarea de expedición: Cola de roca","Entrega las colas de roca en una caja de recolección"}},
[4921]={nameES="Tarea de expedición: Piel erosionada por la piedra",objectivesES={"Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir pieles erosionadas por la piedra.","Se busca: Pieles erosionadas por la piedra de las Moradas de los Enanos.","Entrega las pieles erosionadas por la piedra en una caja de recolección","Alguien ha publicado una tarea para recoger pieles erosionadas por la piedra. Se pueden entregar a cambio de una recompensa.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Se busca: Pieles erosionadas por la piedra de las Moradas de los Enanos. Recógelas para ganar una recompensa adecuada para los coleccionistas.","Tarea de expedición: Piel erosionada por la piedra"}},
[4922]={nameES="Tarea de expedición: Garra marchita",objectivesES={"Tarea de expedición: Garra marchita","Alguien ha publicado una tarea para recoger garras marchitas. Se pueden entregar a cambio de una recompensa.","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir garras marchitas.","Entrega las garras marchitas en una caja de recolección","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Se busca: Garras marchitas de las Moradas de los Enanos. Recógelas para ganar una recompensa adecuada para los coleccionistas.","Se busca: Garras marchitas de las Moradas de los Enanos."}},
[4923]={nameES="Tarea de expedición: Oreja marchita",objectivesES={"Se busca: Orejas marchitas de las Moradas de los Enanos.","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir orejas marchitas.","Entrega las orejas marchitas en una caja de recolección","Alguien ha publicado una tarea para recoger orejas marchitas. Se pueden entregar a cambio de una recompensa.","Se busca: Orejas marchitas de las Moradas de los Enanos. Recógelas para ganar una recompensa adecuada para los coleccionistas.","Tarea de expedición: Oreja marchita","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú."}},
[4924]={nameES="Expedition to the East Wall",objectivesES={"Mansig wants you to defeat some of the Orcs and Uruks that ambushed his men in the East Wall.","Orcs and Uruks can be found throughout the East Wall.\
\
Mansig has asked you to defeat Orcs and Uruks throughout the East Wall.","Talk to Mansig","Expedition to the East Wall","Mansig is at his camp in the East Wall.\
\
You have defeated many of the foes that attacked Mansig's party of Rohirrim and should now return to tell him of your success."}},
[4925]={nameES="Expedition: A Daring Rescue",objectivesES={"Expedition: A Daring Rescue","Rescue a captured soldier","Talk to Agorin at Echad Sirion","You have rescued one of the captured soldiers","Agorin is at Echad Sirion, on the eastern bank of the Anduin.\
\
You should return to Agorin with news of your success.","A few Elves who were among the first to cross the Anduin to make way for the main landing were captured by Orcs. If they are not rescued before the Malledhrim make their final assault upon Amon Angened, the prisoners will likely be killed.","Elvish prisoners are being held in the Orc-fortress upon Amon Angened, south-east of Echad Sirion.\
\
Agorin has asked you to mount the rescue of Elvish prisoners from their Orc-captors."}},
[4926]={nameES="Expedition: Bridging the Gap",objectivesES={"This bridge has already been destroyed","The two bridges lie to the south of Echad Sirion, along a small tributary to the Anduin.\
\
Ivorel has asked you to take the two bridges allowing access to the Mirk-eaves from the south.","Talk to Ivorel at Echad Sirion","Expedition: Bridging the Gap","Ivorel is at Echad Sirion, on the eastern banks of the Anduin.\
\
You should inform Ivorel that both bridges were already destroyed.","Capture the western bridge","Two bridges ford the stream south of Echad Sirion. By means of these bridges, Orc-reinforcements may flank the Malledhrim.","Capture the eastern bridge"}},
[4927]={nameES="Expedición: Peligro bajo la superficie",objectivesES={"Expedición: Peligro bajo la superficie","Solo puede completarse antes de que la Expedición entre en Moria.","Los lagartos de las cavernas pueden encontrarse por toda la cueva conocida como la Gruta de las Aguas Negras; su entrada está en la colina a lo largo de la pendiente que sube a la Puerta de Acebeda.\
\
Valgút te ha pedido que derrotes a varios lagartos de las cavernas que habitan dentro de la Gruta de las Aguas Negras y amenazan la seguridad de la expedición.","Valgút te ha advertido que los lagartos de las cavernas han hecho su hogar dentro de la Gruta de las Aguas Negras, y quiere que derrotes a algunos de ellos si piensas entrar en la cueva.","Valgút se encuentra fuera de la entrada de la Gruta de las Aguas Negras, en la pendiente que sube a la Puerta de Acebeda.\
\
Has derrotado a muchos de los peligrosos lagartos de las cavernas dentro de la Gruta de las Aguas Negras, y ahora deberías regresar con Valgút."}},
[4928]={nameES="Expedition: Disrupting Communication",objectivesES={"Ivorel is at Echad Sirion, on the eastern banks of the Anduin.\
\
You should return to Ivorel with news of your success.","Talk to Ivorel at Echad Sirion","Goblin-runners can be found throughout the Mirk-eaves.\
\
Ivorel has asked you to intercept and defeat the goblin-runners that carry messages from camp to camp in the Mirk-eaves.","Communication between the Orc-fortifications scattered across the Mirk-eaves are handled by goblin-runners who rush messages from one to another. The defeat of these runners not only would cut the encampments off from each other, but may result in the interception of important information about the Enemy's movements.","Expedition: Disrupting Communication"}},
[4929]={nameES="Expedición: Los cuatro enanos",objectivesES={"Brogur envió a cuatro enanos a explorar la cueva conocida como la Gruta de las Aguas Negras, pero aún no han regresado con él. Está ansioso por conocer su destino.","Solo puede completarse antes de que la Expedición entre en Moria.","Has encontrado el cuerpo de Ogur. Está muerto.","Brogur se encuentra fuera de la cueva conocida como la Gruta de las Aguas Negras, en la pendiente, al oeste.\
\
Has encontrado a los cuatro enanos que Brogur envió a la Gruta de las Aguas Negras, y deberías informarle de su destino.","Has encontrado el cuerpo de Sulki. Está muerto.","Expedición: Los cuatro enanos","Los cuatro enanos se encuentran en algún lugar dentro de la Gruta de las Aguas Negras, la cueva que se encuentra en la pendiente al este de Brogur.\
\
Brogur quiere saber qué pasó con los cuatro enanos que envió a investigar la Gruta de las Aguas Negras, y te ha encargado de encontrarlos."}},
[4930]={nameES="Expedition: Lost in the Fray",objectivesES={"Talk to Agorin at Echad Sirion","Rescue exhausted soldier","Rescue wounded soldier","Rescued wounded soldier","Expedition: Lost in the Fray","Rescue desperate soldier","Agorin is at Echad Sirion on the eastern banks of the Anduin.\
\
You should return to Agorin and let her know that you have found and aided the missing soldiers.","Rescued desperate soldier","A handful of Elves have become separated from the main host during the battle to take the Mirk-Eaves.","The Elf-soldiers may be found among the trees of the Mirk-eaves.\
\
Agorin has asked you to aid the missing Elves should you find them amongst the forests of the Mirk-eaves.","Rescued exhausted soldier"}},
[4931]={nameES="Expedición: Órdenes para los semiorcos",objectivesES={"El enano Símbi te ha pedido que entres en la cueva de Filgogân y obtengas toda la información posible sobre el campamento de los semiorcos.","Deja la información sobre los semiorcos a Símbi","Solo puede completarse antes de que la Expedición entre en Moria.","Expedición: Órdenes para los semiorcos","La información sobre los semiorcos puede encontrarse en sus fuegos de campamento dentro de la cueva de Filgogân, al suroeste del campamento de Bósi, al otro lado del Sirannon seco.\
\
Símbi te ha pedido que obtengas información de cada uno de los fuegos de campamento de los semiorcos dentro de la cueva de Filgogân.","Símbi se encuentra a las afueras de la cueva de Filgogân, al suroeste del campamento de Bósi, al otro lado del Sirannon seco.\
\
Has recopilado una gran cantidad de información sobre los semiorcos en la cueva de Filgogân, que deberías llevar a Símbi."}},
[4932]={nameES="Expedition: Seeing to the Fallen",objectivesES={"The wounded Elves are at Echad Sirion, on the eastern banks of the Anduin.\
\
Now that you have collected enough bandages, you should see to the treatment of the Elf-soldiers who were seriously wounded during the first wave of the assault upon Mirkwood.","This crate is full of military supplies","Expedition: Seeing to the Fallen","The Elf grimaces silently as you try to staunch the bleeding of a severe stomach wound.\
\
After you do the best you can, you move on, unsure whether he will live through the night.","YOU SHOULD NOT SEE THIS","In battles of such a scale as the Mirkwood landing, severe wounds and even death are an inevitable consequence, even among such fine warriors as the Mallhedrim.","Agorin is at Echad Sirion, on the eastern banks of the Anduin","This soldier is having serious trouble breathing and cannot speak. You realize that the left side of his chest has been nearly crushed by some massive blow.\
\
You bandage some of his lesser wounds in an effort to comfort him, but he is clearly dying and beyond aid.","The supplies are at Echad Sirion, on the eastern banks of the Anduin.\
\
Agorin has tasked you with finding clean bandages that have been misplaced among the rest of the military supplies that were hastily brought across the Anduin.","Talk to Agorin at Echad Sirion"}},
[4933]={nameES="Expedición: El punto común",objectivesES={"Solo puede completarse antes de que la Expedición entre en Moria.","Expedición: El punto común","Los semiorcos que se encuentran dentro de la cueva de Filgogân, al suroeste del campamento de Bósi y al otro lado del Sirannon seco, seguramente llevan alguna prueba de su lealtad hacia el maestro de Graug.\
\
Símbi te ha pedido que averigües el punto común que une a estos semiorcos, y que le traigas pruebas de ello.","Símbi quiere saber quién ha enviado a los semiorcos a Filgogân, donde su presencia amenaza la expedición de enanos que ha venido a Acebeda.","Lleva las piedras pintadas a Símbi","Símbi se encuentra fuera de la entrada de la cueva de Filgogân, al suroeste del campamento de Bósi, al otro lado del Sirannon seco.\
\
Has recuperado piedras, pintadas de forma tosca con el emblema de una mano, de muchos de los semiorcos dentro de Filgogân, y ahora deberías llevarlas a Símbi."}},
[4934]={nameES="Expedición: En lo alto de la cascada",objectivesES={"Throttólf se encuentra en la caverna llamada Gruta de las Aguas Negras, cerca de la entrada, por un pasaje desde la base de la cascada.\
\
Encontraste la caja fuerte en lo alto de la cascada, pero cualquier tesoro que pudiera haber contenido se ha convertido en polvo hace mucho tiempo. Deberías regresar con estas noticias a Throttólf.","Solo puede completarse antes de que la Expedición entre en Moria.","Throttólf quiere que encuentres el punto más alto de la cascada dentro de la Gruta de las Aguas Negras, y veas si puedes recuperar el tesoro mencionado por Ógur.","El tesoro del que habló Ógur podría estar en lo alto de la cascada, en las profundidades de la caverna conocida como la Gruta de las Aguas Negras.\
\
Throttólf te ha pedido que encuentres los pasajes que conducen al punto más alto de la cascada para que puedas investigar la posibilidad de que se pueda encontrar algún tesoro allí.","La caja fuerte no contiene más que polvo.","Encuentra la caja fuerte en lo alto de la cascada","Expedición: En lo alto de la cascada"}},
[4935]={nameES="Expedición: Un asunto desagradable",objectivesES={"Pilas de huesos pueden encontrarse por toda la caverna de Filgogân, y la dentadura de oro de Lofrík podría estar entre ellos.\
\
Trausti te ha pedido que busques en los montones de huesos dentro de la caverna la dentadura de oro característica de su amigo Lofrík.","Solo puede completarse antes de que la Expedición entre en Moria.","Trausti está preocupado de que su amigo Lofrík pueda haber sido asesinado por los semiorcos, y quiere que busques su dentadura de oro característica.","Has encontrado una dentadura de oro astillada entre los huesos","Trausti se encuentra en algún lugar dentro de la caverna de Filgogân.\
\
Has encontrado la dentadura de oro característica de Lofrík, y deberías regresar con las tristes noticias de la muerte de su amigo a Trausti.","Expedición: Un asunto desagradable","Busca entre los montones de huesos en Filgogân la dentadura de oro de Lofrík","Has fallado en encontrar la dentadura de oro que buscas","Lleva la dentadura de oro astillada a Trausti"}},
[4936]={nameES="Expedición: No son bienvenidos en Acebeda",objectivesES={"Sandar se encuentra con Bósi en el pequeño campamento de enanos, al noreste de la cueva de Filgogân.\
\
Has diezmado las filas de los semiorcos en la cueva de Filgogân y derrotado a su líder Graug. Ahora solo te queda volver a ver a Sandar.","Expedición: No son bienvenidos en Acebeda","El enano Sandar te ha pedido que ayudes a la expedición derrotando a los semiorcos, que han establecido su campamento dentro de la cueva de Filgogân.","Solo puede completarse antes de que la Expedición entre en Moria.","La caverna de Filgogân se encuentra al suroeste de Sandar, al otro lado del lecho seco del Sirannon, en la esquina suroeste de las colinas circundantes.\
\
Sandar te ha pedido que derrotes a los semiorcos que han acampado dentro de Filgogân, así como a su líder Graug."}},
[4937]={nameES="Exploiting the Enemy",objectivesES={}},
[4938]={nameES="Explore Ghâr Mejet",objectivesES={"Explored the south-eastern chamber","Explored the main chamber","Talk to Yâshri outside of Ghâr Mejet","Ghâr Mejet is a vile place within the underground. Explore its chambers and report on your findings.","Explore the north-eastern chamber","Explored the south-western chamber","Explored the north-western chamber","Explore the south-western chamber","Inform Yâshri of your findings.","Explore the main chamber","Ghâr Mejet is a vile place within the underground. Explore its chambers and report your findings to Yâshri.","Explore the north-western chamber","Explore the south-eastern chamber","The main chamber of Ghâr Mejet is the vilest place in the area. Explore its chambers and report on your findings.","Explore Ghâr Mejet","Explored the north-eastern chamber"}},
[4939]={nameES="Exploring Brúvraum",objectivesES={}},
[4940]={nameES="Exploring Ronglagam",objectivesES={"Varthmath seeks to learn more about the frenzied stone-claws in Máttugard.","Exploring Ronglagam","Talk to Varthmath at Zidir-nesad","Ronglagam can be found south-east of Zidir-nesad in Máttugard.\
\
You should travel to Ronglagam.","Varthmath can be found at Zidir-nesad, The Steepset, in Máttugard.\
\
You should talk to Varthmath at Zidir-nesad.","Varthmath inspects the samples of the stone-claw burrows.\
\
'Hmm, nothing seems tainted or poisoned here. You would not know that from the way these stone-claws are acting, though!'","Ronglagam can be found south-east of Zidir-nesad in Máttugard.\
\
You should defeat stone-claws and collect samples at Ronglagam.","Travel to Ronglagam","Bring the samples to Varthmath near Ronglagam","The burrows are crawling with stone-claws","Varthmath can be found near Ronglagam in Máttugard.\
\
You should bring the samples to Varthmath."}},
[4941]={nameES="Explorando Uzbad-bakân",objectivesES={"Has descubierto los cubiles orcos de Uzbad-bakân","Explorando Uzbad-bakân","Explora la armería de Uzbad-bakân","Uzbad-bakân se encuentra al sur del Salón del Agua que fluye.\
\
Deberías dirigirte al sur a través de Zelem-melek y explorar Uzbad-bakân, la fortaleza de los orcos en Zelem-melek.","Has descubierto las cocinas de Uzbad-bakân","Uzbad-bakân es un vasto campamento lleno de orcos. Deberías explorar todos sus rincones.","Explora las cocinas de Uzbad-bakân","Búi te ha encomendado que explores la vasta ciudad orca de Uzbad-bakân.","Explora las moradas de los orcos de Uzbad-bakân","Has descubierto la forja de Uzbad-bakân","El capataz Mögr se encuentra en la Sala Vigesimoprimera.\
\
Has explorado el enorme campamento orco de Uzbad-bakân, encontrándolo fuerte y bien protegido. Deberías compartir eesta información con Mögr cuanto antes.","Explora la forja de Uzbad-bakân","Háblable al capataz Mögr de la presencia de muchos orcos en Zelem-melek","Has descubierto la armería de Uzbad-bakân"}},
[4942]={nameES="Exploring Vâr Nuchur",objectivesES={}},
[4943]={nameES="Exploring is Thirsty Work",objectivesES={}},
[4944]={nameES="Exploring the Ancient Tomb",objectivesES={"The ancient tomb lies to the south of Elthengels, hidden in a remote corner of the Norcrofts by a waterfall.\
\
The ancient tomb awaits your exploration.","Explore the depths of the ancient tomb","You have explored the depths of the ancient tomb","A tomb of the Men of Gondor from the Second Age has been revealed in a secluded area of the Norcrofts. It is unknown what treasures -- or dangers -- may lie within.\
\
The greatest discoveries are often hidden at the bottom of such ancient tombs, waiting for some adventurers to come and seek them out.","A tomb of the Men of Gondor from the Second Age has been discovered in a secluded area of the Norcrofts. It is unknown what treasures -- or dangers -- may lie within.","Explore the ancient tomb","Exploring the Ancient Tomb"}},
[4945]={nameES="Explorando los Vastos Salones",objectivesES={"Dirígete hacia el este y comienza tu exploración de Zelem-melek","Completado","Mögr te ha pedido que continúes tu exploración de Zelem-melek para tener una comprensión más detallada de este peligroso sector de Moria, comenzando con los Vastos Salones.","Los Vastos Salones están en el fondo del Gran Salón de Durin.\
\
Deberías comenzar tu exploración de Zelem-melek en los Vastos Salones.","Los grandes pasadizos de Zelem-melek se encuentran dirigiéndose hacia el este por la sala inferior.\
\
Deberías dirigirte hacia el este, donde colocaste los estandartes.","Has llegado a una encrucijada en Zelem-melek. ¡Tu exploración de esta enorme, sinuosa y sobrecogedora área dará lugar a muchas aventuras!","Explorando los Vastos Salones","Has comenzado tu exploración de Zelem-melek."}},
[4946]={nameES="Explosive Nest Removal",objectivesES={"Molkha has given you a satchel of explosive containers to quickly destroy the many cliff-top drake nests.\
\
You should destroy drake nests in Flogalith with Molkha's bombs. The sloping path to Flogalith is to the north-west of Molkha's position.","You have destroyed many drake nests in Flogalith.\
\
You should return to Molkha on the frozen lake south-west of Fellgát.","Talk to Molkha in the valley","Explosive Nest Removal","Molkha has a plan to quickly clear out many of the drake nests in Flogalith."}},
[4947]={nameES="Explosive Repercussions",objectivesES={"Elder Jurmêna has tasked you with destroying the goblin weapons of war by using their own explosives against them.","Set alight black powder near catapults within Glúkroz.","Return to Elder Jangâli in Sen Chatâk","Return to Elder Jangâli in Sen Chatâk.","Pick up barrels of black powder and destroy goblin catapults in Glúkroz. Glúkroz can be found north-east of Sen Chatâk.","Explosive Repercussions"}},
[4948]={nameES="Extending a Helping Hand",objectivesES={"You have delivered the supplies at the specified location.\
\
Shúkurz also asked you to whistle after dropping off the supplies.","Extending a Helping Hand","Talk to Shúkurz","Shúkurz has asked you to take fresh supplies to a supply drop.\
\
You should take some supplies from the supply area of Aslíf.","With Shúkurz's help, Náin may yet be found.","Supplies retrieved","<rgb=#00ff00>Whistle</rgb> at the supply drop","Retrieve supplies in Aslíf","You should talk to Shúkurz and see if he will agree to Múta's plan.","Deliver supplies","For a moment, you feel someone watching... then the sensation disappears","You have delivered the supplies and done everything Shúkurz asked of you.\
\
You should return to Aslíf on the upper tier and talk to him if he's returned.","Talk to Shúkurz in Aslíf","You have retrieved fresh supplies to deliver.\
\
You should find the drop point in front of some gates at the top level of the 'Abad-nuhbu, to the east."}},
[4949]={nameES="Exterminio de Gorogrod -- Diaria",objectivesES={"Exterminio de Gorogrod -- Diaria","Exterminio de Gorogrod"}},
[4950]={nameES="Extinguishing Fear",objectivesES={}},
[4951]={nameES="Extracting Information",objectivesES={"Sigeric is in the prison of Snowbourn.\
\
Gísling wants you to interrogate Sigeric and see if he is willing to part with any information about who sent him to undermine Snowbourn.","Talk to Sigeric","Sigeric was revealed to be the traitor in the midst of the Men of Snowbourn.","Sigeric can be found inside the prison of Snowbourn.\
\
You should talk to Sigeric.","Talk to Fastred","Fastred can be found in the Mead Hall of Snowbourn.\
\
Sigeric has proven to be a brutal traitor of Rohan, and Gísling wishes for you to tell Fastred of Sigeric's threats against the Sutcrofts.","Sigeric can be found inside the prison of Snowbourn.\
\
Sigeric refuses to cooperate with the people of Snowbourn and has now mocked your attempts to break his will. Perhaps you should take a more threatening approach.","<rgb=#FF00FF>Stare</rgb> Sigeric down and see if he talks","Sigeric does not seem willing to talk","Talk to Gísling","Extracting Information","<rgb=#FF00FF>Shake your fist</rgb> at Sigeric","Sigeric is in the prison of Snowbourn.\
\
Perhaps if you <rgb=#FF00FF>stare</rgb> Sigeric down, he will break.","Sigeric smirks slightly, but remains silent","Gísling can be found in central Snowbourn.\
\
You should report Sigeric's refusal to cooperate to Gísling."}},
[4952]={nameES="Eye and Hand Coordination",objectivesES={}},
[4953]={nameES="Ojo de la tormenta",objectivesES={"Ojo de la tormenta","Echad Garthadir, el campamento de los Montaraces en Annúminas, sufre constantes ataques.","Echad Garthadir se encuentra a cierta distancia del Camino de los Reyes, dentro de Annúminas.\
\
Los Montaraces te han enviado a prestar ayuda a Echad Garthadir.","Habla con Adadhrond en Echad Garthadir"}},
[4954]={nameES="Eyes For Isamó",objectivesES={"Eyes For Isamó","Isamó arrives at the gate, grateful for your help","A path out of Starkhaven climbs to the north-west. Isamó asked that you clear the way to that gate for her.","Climb north-west to the gate out of Starkhaven","Isamó flees Starkhaven for an uncertain future","Isamó has arrived at one of the paths that leads out of Starkhaven.","She wipes her eyes.\
\
'There is a sloping path that leads to a gate in the south-west reaches of Starkhaven. The gate is usually closed, but Engéru arranged that it would be left open for us on this day.\
\
'Go ahead of me, to this south-western gate, and clear the way of enemies. If you will be my eyes, I will do the best I can to carry out my husband's wishes, though it pains me.'","The sloping path climbs north-west to a gate that is usually closed","Talk to Isamó by the gate","You have agreed to help Isamó and Engéru escape from Starkhaven before the Song sails to war.","Isamó has resolved to be courageous, but her eyes are still full of tears.\
\
'Go ahead of me, to this south-western gate, and clear the way of enemies. If you will be my eyes, I will do the best I can to carry out my husband's wishes, though it pains me.'","The sloping path that leads out of Starkhaven is to the south. You should travel ahead of Isamó and ensure the way is clear for her to follow.","Travel ahead of Isamó to the sloping path that leads out of Starkhaven","Isamó stares at the open gate as if part of her wished it remained closed.\
\
'My feet are heavy, stranger, but for Engéru I will let them carry me from Starkhaven. I thank you for showing me the way safely here, and I have only one thing more to ask of you.\
\
'Think not ill of me or of my husband. Each of us were born into our families' work, and the construction of the fleet was all we ever knew. Of course ships are made for war! But when such a fleet sits idle for so many years, is it so strange to believe it might always remain unused? So it was for our families, and for Engéru, and for myself.\
\
'Farewell, stranger. If you might somehow prevail against the Song, know that Engéru and Isamó celebrate with you.'"}},
[4955]={nameES="Eyes On Ost Rimmon",objectivesES={}},
[4956]={nameES="Eyes Out of the Sky",objectivesES={"The crebain and traps can be found to the south-west of Garsfeld.\
\
Gísil wants you to defeat the crebain that have flocked around Garsfeld and bait traps outside the town to ensnare the foul birds.","Gísil can be found in the Mead Hall of Garsfeld.\
\
You should return to Gísil and let him know that you have done as he directed.","Eyes Out of the Sky","Gísil has noticed that, despite your efforts, crebain continue to harry the crofters.","Talk to Gísil at the Mead Hall of Garsfeld"}},
[4957]={nameES="Eyes and Ears of Madh-fushaum",objectivesES={"The eyes and ears of Madh-fushaum, the Uruk-hai sentry in the watch-towers around the outer wall are entrusted with the safety of the entire army.","Defeat Uruk-hai sentries (0/6)","Eyes and Ears of Madh-fushaum","The wall outside of Madh-fushaum has enemies that never sleep, and are the eyes and ears of the army within. Any solid network of sentries has multiple layers, and the watch-towers along the wall make-up a strong inner layer.","The eyes and ears of Madh-fushaum, the Uruk-hai sentry in the watchtowers around the outer wall are entrusted with the safety of the entire army.","The Uruk-hai sentries were battle-hardened warriors and a crucial aspect of the White Hand army. Removing them struck a blow to the safety and coordination of the forces within Madh-fushaum.","An army of this size needs a strong network of sentries to ensure communication throughout the soldiers and can respond to incoming threats.","Their army is now blind to incoming threats, but more importantly are even less aware of your passing.","Completado"}},
[4958]={nameES="Eyes in the Dark",objectivesES={"You have found the source of the spiders in Cirith Ungol: the Under-gate.","The Under-gate has been ripped open, exposing the tower to the tunnels of Torech Ungol!","The source of the spiders can be found somewhere within the Tower of Cirith Ungol.\
\
Legolas has asked you to find the source of Shelob's brood in the Tower of Cirith Ungol.","Eyes in the Dark","As countless spiders of Shelob's brood pour forth from the Tower of Cirith Ungol, Legolas hopes to uncover their source and prevent more from swarming into the fortress.","Completado","You have discovered the Under-gate ripped open in the depths of the Tower of Cirith Ungol. The tunnels of Torech Ungol now lead directly into the tower!\
\
You should bring word to Legolas in the turret of the Tower of Cirith Ungol as soon as you are able.","Find the source of Shelob's brood in the Tower of Cirith Ungol"}},
[4959]={nameES="Eyes in the Demon-pit",objectivesES={"Return to Neshurga in Ub Nishir with the information you've gathered on Utug-bûr.","Arrived at the Utug-bûr scouting location","Return to Neshurga in Ub Nishir","Scout Utug-bûr from the location that Neshurga described.","Neshurga has asked you to go investigate Utug-bûr because he needs more information on what they are up against in Urash Dâr.","Scout out Utug-bûr to gather information","Reach the Utug-bûr scouting location that Neshurga described.","Reach the Utug-bûr scouting location","Scouted Utug-bûr","Eyes in the Demon-pit"}},
[4960]={nameES="Eyes in the Field",objectivesES={"Egbalth can be found near one of the burned houses at Bosa's Farm in northern Kingstead.\
\
You have spotted a fallen soldier of Middlemead. You should investigate if this is the man Mágla meant for you to meet.","Thane Mágla is concerned that an agent of Wormtongue lurks within Middlemead, and hopes for you to work alongside his trusted councilman to expose the traitor.","Bosa's Farm can be found to the east of Middlemead in northern Kingstead.\
\
Thane Mágla has asked you to seek out Egbalth in hopes of aiding him in exposing the agent of Wormtongue in Middlemead.","You have encountered a slain Rohirrim.","Bosa's Farm can be found in northern Kingstead.\
\
You have arrived at Bosa's Farm to find it overrun by the White Hand. You should search the farm for any signs of life.","Travel to Bosa's Farm","Examine Egbalth","Eyes in the Field","You spot a Rohirrim warrior fallen amidst the wreckage","Bosa's Farm has been overrun by the White Hand","Search for any sign of Egbalth","Egbalth's lifeless body is slumped against the side of a burned home, and brutal wounds are visible through punctures in his armour.\
\
Whether his horn was sounded or not, it is clear that aid did not arrive in time."}},
[4961]={nameES="Eyes in the Forest",objectivesES={"Scout the path to the Rohirrim scout-camp","Scouted the path to the Rohirrim scout-camp","Andreg is preparing to part company with you. You should speak with him to find out where to go from here.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Completing this quest will make it impossible to acquire new discoverables from Andreg and will fail the Tracking an Old Goat deed and any unresolved discoverables.</rgb>","Talk to Andreg","The Rangers Saeradan, Amlan, and Andreg have tracked Gwyllion, the Old Woman of the Mountain, from the Windfells in Enedwaith to the Gravenwood of Dunland.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Completing this quest will make it impossible to acquire new discoverables from Andreg and will fail the Tracking an Old Goat deed and any unresolved discoverables.</rgb>","Andreg has asked you to help him scout the Gravenwood -- specifically the path to the Rohirrim scout-camp -- for signs of Gwyllion's passage.","Eyes in the Forest"}},
[4962]={nameES="Eyes in the Forest",objectivesES={"Andreg is preparing to part company with you. You should speak with him to find out where to go from here.","Scout the path through the <rgb=#FFFF00>South Gravenwood</rgb> to the Rohirrim scout-camp and deal with the many threats that face the Rohirrim and Grey Company","Andreg has asked you to help him scout the <rgb=#FFFF00>South Gravenwood</rgb> -- specifically the path to the Rohirrim scout-camp -- for signs of Gwyllion's passage.","Talk to Andreg","Scouted the path through the <rgb=#FFFF00>South Gravenwood</rgb>","The Rangers Saeradan, Amlan, and Andreg have tracked Gwyllion, the Old Woman of the Mountain, from the Windfells in Enedwaith to the Gravenwood of Dunland.","Eyes in the Forest"}},
[4963]={nameES="Eyes in the Marshes",objectivesES={}},
[4964]={nameES="Los ojos de Dol Guldur",objectivesES={"Faroniel está en Echad Sirion, en los Lindes Oscuros.\
\
Deberías volver a ver a Faroniel con las noticias de tu éxito.","Habla con Faroniel en Echad Sirion","Los ojos de Dol Guldur","Los elfos de la Hueste Dorada han establecido un campamento en las costas de los Lindes Oscuros y buscan protegerlo contra los espías del Enemigo.","Se pueden encontrar crebain y huargos por todos los Lindes Oscuros.\
\
Faroniel te ha pedido que ciegues a los ojos de Dol Guldur derrotando a muchos de los crebain y huargos que rondan por los Lindes Oscuros."}},
[4965]={nameES="Eyes of Mordor",objectivesES={}},
[4966]={nameES="Ojos de Entibo",objectivesES={"El jardín de Falco está fallando por una razón desconocida, causando angustia entre la gente de Entibo.","Habla con Gammy Cenagales en su granja","Habla con los habitantes de Entibo","Gammy Cenagales está en la segunda granja al norte del camino cerca de las granjas de Entibo.\
\
El conocimiento que obtuviste de la gente de Entibo será de gran interés para Gammy Cenagales, la chismosa del pueblo.","Ojos de Entibo","La gente de Entibo se puede encontrar cuidando y vigilando sus granjas o en el centro de Entibo.\
\
Gammy Cenagales ha recomendado que hables con algunos de los habitantes de Entibo para saber qué pasó con el jardín de Falco."}},
[4967]={nameES="Ojos del Enemigo",objectivesES={"Los hendrevail pueden encontrarse en las Gargantas del Bruinen, en el Bosque de los Trolls.\
\
Mientras estés en las Gargantas del Bruinen, deberías encargarte de los hendrevail que han comenzado a aparecer allí.","Ojos del Enemigo","Los hendrevail, a menudo usados como espías por el Enemigo, han empezado a aparecer en las Gargantas del Bruinen."}},
[4968]={nameES="Eyes of the Riders",objectivesES={}},
[4969]={nameES="Eyes on the Enemy",objectivesES={"As you got closer to some of the prisoners, a shiny glint of something metal on the ground caught your eye. You should pick it up.","Eyes on the Enemy","You tell Nabatínu about the prisoners and show him the shiny button you found in the gravel.\
\
'This is a curious find,' he says, looking closely at the button. 'I have not seen its like before, but I will ask the others.\
\
'As for the prisoners, these Orcs; Utûgi, you called them? They have been patrolling the roads and attacking caravans, just as your friend Khagâmi experienced. They kill many, but they also take many prisoners. This must be where they bring them, but to what end, I do not know. I do not see them being turned into Jatsakóri, so it must be for some other evil purpose.'","You see something glinting on the ground","Talk to Nabatínu at Gadim-ûn","Investigate the prisoners","Rhadrog has asked you to scout Kôth Rau, the Ordâkhai stronghold in south-central An Shêru.","You have done what you can for the moment at Kôth Rau. You should return to Gadim-ûn and discuss what you found with Nabatínu.","You should talk to Rhadrog about Nabatínu's theory that defeating Ombátha may allow the enthralled Jatsakóri to break free.","Go to the Ordâkhai stronghold of Kôth Rau","You found a decorative brass button","Kôth Rau still flies the banners of Sauron","You have come to Kôth Rau to scout out the situation at the Ordâkhai stronghold and found them flying the banners of Sauron, called Barkhûsh in this part of the world.","Talk to Rhadrog","As you destroyed banners of Barkhûsh at Kôth Rau, you noticed that they are holding prisoners here. You should assess the situation with the prisoners.","Nabatínu worries that the only way to free the rest of the enthralled Jatsakóri may be to defeat Ombátha, which he fears may not be possible.","Pick up the shiny object"}},
[4970]={nameES="Eyes to the West",objectivesES={"There is no sign of the Ungoledain here. Continue to head west towards Rushgate","Habla con Radagast","The defeated Ungoledain have retreated and are thought to be heading to Rushgate. Follow their tracks and look around to see where they are regrouping.","Continue to head west and scout for Ungoladan activity.","Radagast can be found in the north of the Thornholt woods.\
\
Return to Radagast and let him know what you've seen here in Rushgate.","Look to the west for Ungoladan activity","Eyes to the West","Look towards the west for any Ungoladan activity.","Enter Rushgate and scout for Ungoladan activity.","It is clear the Ungoledain were here and must have crossed the bridge.","There is no sign of the Ungoledain here. Continue to head into Rushgate","This location provides a good vantage point to the west"}},
[4971]={nameES="Eyes upon the Enemy",objectivesES={"Scouted Gorthbar","Scouted Minas Caul","Scouted Bail Dílas","Bail Dilas lies in Angmar, far to the north and east of Esteldín.\
\
Handarod has asked you to scout the encampment of Bail Dílas and see what forces are arrayed near the gates of Carn Dûm.","Gorthbar lies in Angmar, far to the north and east of Esteldín.\
\
Handarod has asked you to scout the graveyard of Gorthbar and see what dread rites the Enemy is performing in that horrid place.","Handarod is concerned with the Council of the North's efforts to track the movements of the forces of Angmar within their deepest strongholds.","Scout Bail Dílas","Minas Caul is in Angmar, far to the north and east of Esteldín.\
\
Handarod has asked you to scout the tower of Minas Caul and see what forces of the Enemy inhabit the Witch King's domain there.","Talk to Handarod","Eyes upon the Enemy","Scout Minas Caul","Scout Gorthbar","Handarod is at Esteldín in the North Downs, far to the west and south of Angmar.\
\
You should report to Handarod and tell him what you have seen in the heart of Angmar."}},
[4972]={nameES="Eyesores Drifted Ashore",objectivesES={"Eyesores Drifted Ashore","Maghôrdo has asked you to clean up any flotsam you find on the island's southern beaches so that visitors will not be reminded of the peril of travelling here.","Talk to Maghôrdo","You have cleaned up the flotsam from shipwrecks along the island's southern beaches. You should report to Maghôrdo at Furtherholm's harbour, near the waterfall.","Due to the difficulty of navigating the turbulent waters of the Shield Isles, it is common for flotsam from shipwrecks to wash up on Furtherholm's southern shores."}},
[4973]={nameES="Ezôti's Menagerie",objectivesES={"You know that Ezôti's 'show' is no longer happening, and his animals have been freed","Ezôti's Menagerie","A man named Ezôti has assembled a fearsome collection of animals for his menagerie in the Upper Ward, and it is the talk of many folk in the Sail-haven.","Ezôti can be found by Bith Gabâr in the Upper Ward.","Talk to Ezôti by Bith Gabâr in the Upper Ward"}},
[4974]={nameES="Face the Cold",objectivesES={"Face the Cold","Defeat frost grims around Lake Isingmere","The frost grims along the edge of Lake Isingmere have been thinned drastically and shouldn't pose much of a threat for a while.","Deadly frost grims are appearing on the edge of Lake Isingmere and need to be defeated before their numbers grow.","If not thinned drastically, the frost grims around Lake Isingmere will eventually pose a grave threat.","The recent bout of cold weather has caused deadly frost grims to appear where the coast meets Lake Isingmere.","Completado"}},
[4975]={nameES="Facing Fears",objectivesES={}},
[4976]={nameES="Haciendo frente a tus miedos",objectivesES={"Has destruido al hechicero Pesadilla en los Salones de la Noche.","Derrota a Pesadilla.","Haciendo frente a tus miedos","Has vencido al espíritu cruel Pánico en los Salones de la Noche.","Derrota a Pesadilla","Derrota a Pánico","Has vencido al espíritu cruel Terror en los Salones de la Noche.","Derrota a Terror y Pánico.","Derrota a Terror"}},
[4977]={nameES="Facts and Fictions",objectivesES={"Question One:\
Belondor, Kinsman of the Fleet-fast, is married to an Umbari woman named Khâsha.","Question Two:\
Azagath Sea-shadow has been known to walk through the markets of Umbar Baharbêl.","Question Five:\
The name of this land comes from the word Umbru-mâra, which means 'Fruitful Land.'","<rgb=#FFFF00>'The Sea-stone Mutiny, during which the Heirs of Castamir were overthrown, began in the Upper Ward of the city.'</rgb>\
\
If the statement is <rgb=#00FF00>True</rgb>, stand under the green canopy\
If the statement is <rgb=#FF0000>False</rgb>, stand under the red canopy","Tafikh has challenged you to a game of Facts and Fictions, believing that you do not know enough about the people of Umbar Baharbêl and the Kindred of the Coins.","Tafikh is waiting to ask you her third question.","Wrong answer! The game is over","Tafikh is waiting to ask you her fourth question.","<rgb=#FFFF00>'Belondor, Kinsman of the Fleet-fast, is married to an Umbari woman named Khâsha.'</rgb>\
\
If the statement is <rgb=#00FF00>True</rgb>, stand under the green canopy\
If the statement is <rgb=#FF0000>False</rgb>, stand under the red canopy","<rgb=#FFFF00>'The Church of the All-Seeing prized the sea-opal Abâshal, and used it to decorate its places of worship.'</rgb>\
\
If the statement is <rgb=#00FF00>True</rgb>, stand under the green canopy\
If the statement is <rgb=#FF0000>False</rgb>, stand under the red canopy","You are correct, and advance to the next round!","Talk to Tafikh","Tafikh is waiting to ask you her fifth question.","Tafikh is amazed that you answered all of her questions correctly.","<rgb=#FFFF00>'Azagath Sea-shadow has been known to walk through the markets of Umbar Baharbêl.'</rgb>\
\
If the statement is <rgb=#00FF00>True</rgb>, stand under the green canopy\
If the statement is <rgb=#FF0000>False</rgb>, stand under the red canopy","Tafikh is waiting to ask you her second question.","Question Four:\
The Sea-stone Mutiny, during which the Heirs of Castamir were overthrown, began in the Upper Ward of the city.","Question Three:\
The Church of the All-Seeing prized the sea-opal Abâshal, and used it to decorate its places of worship.","Facts and Fictions","<rgb=#FFFF00>'The name of this land comes from the word Umbru-mâra, which means 'Fruitful Land.''</rgb>\
\
If the statement is <rgb=#00FF00>True</rgb>, stand under the green canopy\
If the statement is <rgb=#FF0000>False</rgb>, stand under the red canopy","Tafikh is waiting to ask you her first question."}},
[4978]={nameES="Faded Fears",objectivesES={"Travel to Annâk-khurfu in Elderslade","Faded Fears","Talk to Léothred at Annâk-khurfu","Léothred, the Rohirric scholar, and his new friend Fróthi have been thrust ever closer towards the dangers of war in their quest to learn the truth about Fram and Scatha.","Léothred can be found at Annâk-khurfu.\
\
You should talk to Léothred at Annâk-khurfu.","Annâk-khurfu can be found in Elderslade.\
\
You should travel to Annâk-khurfu.","Gundabad forces can be found throughout Elderslade.\
\
You should defeat Gundabad forces in Elderslade."}},
[4979]={nameES="Fading, Not Faded",objectivesES={}},
[4980]={nameES="Faeron, maestro del sigilo",objectivesES={"Faeron aún no te ha visto. ¡Es tu oportunidad para sorprenderlo!","Recupera el tercer alijo de los montaraces en la isla del riachuelo que hay al noreste.","Mantente alerta por si aparece Faeron ¡y píllalo en plena faena!","Habla con Faeron junto al alijo de los montaraces","El segundo alijo de los montaraces está situado justo al norte, cruzando el río, oculto en una zanja cerca del borde del acantilado occidental.","Faeron aguarda junto al segundo alijo, muy satisfecho de sí mismo.","Atrapa a Faeron","El primer alijo de los montaraces está situado al noreste de Tornhad, más allá de un estanque de aguas tranquilas, oculto entre las rocas al oeste de la base de una ruidosa cascada.","El montaraz Mithrendan ha regresado a Tornhad.","A Faeron se le ha encargado recuperar varios alijos de los montaraces como preparación para la próxima misión de los Dúnedain, pero él se empeña en convertirlo en un juego.","Recupera el alijo de montaraz","Mithrendan espera el contenido del alijo de vuelta en Tornhad.","El tercer alijo de los montaraces está situado en una pequeña isla en mitad del riachuelo.","Faeron podría acercarse en cualquier momento, pero si consigues pillarlo in fraganti, ganarás el concurso.","Llega al alijo de los montaraces antes que Faeron","Faeron, maestro del sigilo","Sorprende a Faeron","Faeron aguarda junto al primer alijo de los montaraces con aire triunfante.","Faeron aguarda junto al alijo abierto con cara de satisfacción.","Lleva el contenido del alijo de los montaraces a Mithrendan en Tornhad","El tercer alijo de los montaraces está situado en una isla en el riachuelo, a poca distancia hacia el noreste.","Pero si este no es Faeron, ¿dónde estará el sigiloso montaraz?"}},
[4981]={nameES="Fail-á-Khro Recuperado",objectivesES={"Cána está en Fail-á-Khro, al norte de Aughaire.\
\
Los Trév Gállorg han retomado Fail-á-Khro y ahora buscan tu ayuda para mantenerlo.","Fail-á-Khro Recuperado","Has sobrevivido al Clúcath, y Fail-á-Khro ha sido recuperado por los Trév Gállorg."}},
[4982]={nameES="Failure Erased?",objectivesES={"Valukhâri is dismissive that the tale is nothing more than a child's fable spun for a new crowd and age. Something does not sit right with you. Take the map to your allies Rhadrog and Faeron, recently arrived here in Zajâna and gather their opinions.","Rhadrog asks you to speak with Faeron","Faeron agrees and suggests you ask Rhadrog what next to do","Ask Rhadrog how to proceed at the south-west gate in Zajâna","Failure Erased?","Faeron and Rhadrog agree there is a reason to investigate further. Faeron suggested you ask Rhadrog how to proceed.","The difference in the maps provided by the scholars of Zajâna and the Temámir are pronounced. The Doorward leader believes that the map provided by Bêtam may be a fraud, or errant. You should consult with your allies from the north, Rhadrog and Faeron.","Rhadrog believes the tale may have merit and wants you to share the story and map with Faeron at the fountain square in Zajâna.","Speak with Rhadrog near the south-west gate in Zajâna","Share the story with Faeron at the fountain square Zajâna"}},
[4983]={nameES="Failure to Communicate",objectivesES={"Daervunn the Ranger was detained by the Rohirrim at the Ford of Isen when he attempted to warn them of Saruman's treachery. It appears that some faction within the Golden Halls of Edoras has a grudge against the Dúnedain and has ensured that their passage through the region will not be easy.","Failure to Communicate","Grimbold has outlined his suspicions about Isengard's involvement in the orders he has received. You must find some way to free the Ranger without Grimbold's direct involvement.","Talk to Grimbold at the Ford of Isen","Grimbold is at the Ford of Isen.\
\
Daervunn has asked you to speak with Grimbold on his behalf."}},
[4984]={nameES="Débil pero feroz",objectivesES={"Darri está en la Sala Vigésimoprimera.\
\
Vuelve con él y cuéntale qué pasó al girar el espejo.","El tercer espejo está en la Sala Vigésimoprimera de Zelem-melek.\
\
Debes ajustar su ángulo para alinearlo con los demás.","Gira el tercer espejo para que coincida con los demás","Vuelve con Darri","Débil pero feroz","Darri quiere que compruebes si su teoría es correcta. Para ello, debes volver al tercer espejo y cambiar su ángulo para que coincida con los demás."}},
[4985]={nameES="Comercio con Bree",objectivesES={"Hay lobos en Paso de Moscagua, en la esquina noreste de los Pantanos de Moscagua, al este de Bree.\
\
Los lobos del Paso de Moscagua han estado causando problemas a un amigo del Jefe de Vigilancia Grimbriar. Grimbriar te ha pedido que reduzcas la manada como favor mientras él reúne provisiones para Anlaf.","Comercio con Bree","El Jefe de Vigilancia Grimbriar se encuentra en una cabaña del Camino Verde, al norte de Bree.\
\
Anlaf te ha pedido que vayas a contarle al Jefe de Vigilancia Grimbriar su problema de suministros con la esperanza de que pueda ayudarle a conseguir las provisiones que necesita.","Grimbriar te espera en una cabaña del Camino Verde, al norte de Bree.\
\
El Jefe de Vigilancia Grimbriar querrá saber si has tenido éxito contra los lobos del Paso de Moscagua.","Anlaf el Despojado teme que las incursiones de los Trasgos pongan fin a su negocio. Necesita provisiones rápidamente o podría verse obligado a cerrar la Posada Abandonada."}},
[4986]={nameES="Faithful of the Sisters",objectivesES={"Baskets, flowers, and cloth can be found in Erynos in eastern Lebennin.\
\
Glathril has asked you to gather materials so that she might craft tribute baskets for the Sisters of Lebennin.","Place a tribute basket in the Serni","Deliver the materials to Glathril in Erynos","Talk to Glathril in Erynos","This is a good spot to place the basket","Bring a tribute basket to the Sirith","After finding their belief in the Sisters of Lebennin renewed, the people of Erynos wish to pay tribute to the Sisters of the Gilrain, Serni, and Sirith.","Bring a tribute basket to the Serni","Place a tribute basket in the Sirith","A basket can be delivered into the waters of the Gilrain to the west of Malbarth, near a waterfall along the Serni east of Ost Anglebed, and into the Sirith to the south-east of Erynos.\
\
Glathril has crafted the baskets and has asked you to deliver them into the rivers of Lebennin.","Glathril can be found in Erynos in eastern Lebennin.\
\
You have gathered all the materials that Glathril requested, and you should now return them to her.","Faithful of the Sisters","Place a tribute basket in the Gilrain","Bring a tribute basket to the Gilrain","Glathril can be found in Erynos in eastern Lebennin.\
\
You have delivered the tribute baskets into the Gilrain, Serni, and Sirith, and should now return to Glathril."}},
[4987]={nameES="El jardín de Falco",objectivesES={"La casa del Condestable Bolger está ubicada al sureste de la granja de Falco Manoverde.\
\
Confrontado con la verdad, Falco Manoverde confesó que había hecho un trato turbio con los rufianes. Te ha pedido que hables con el Condestable Bolger y lo adviertas de que los bandidos vienen a quemar el pueblo.","El jardín de Falco","La granja de Falco Manoverde está al suroeste de la granja de Gammy Cenagales.\
\
Gammy Cenagales ha sugerido que hables con Falco Manoverde nuevamente y le cuentes sobre los misteriosos intrusos que fueron vistos cerca de su jardín.","La granja de Falco Manoverde está al noroeste de la casa del Condestable Bolger.\
\
Tú y el Condestable Bolger han derrotado a los bandidos Montebruno que planeaban quemar el pueblo de Entibo. Falco se alegrará de que hayas tenido éxito.","Habla con el Condestable Bolger en su granja","El jardín de Falco está fallando por una razón desconocida, causando angustia entre la gente de Entibo.","Habla con Falco Manoverde en su granja","Has expulsado con éxito a los bandidos."}},
[4988]={nameES="¡El Festival de Otoño está aquí!",objectivesES={"Hueles a hojas quemadas y manzanas de caramelo, ¡el Festival de Otoño ha llegado!","Viaja al Árbol de la Fiesta para participar en el Festival de Otoño","El Festival de Otoño reparte travesuras ingeniosas y sabrosos manjares por toda la Tierra Media. Únete a la fiesta empezando por la Comarca, donde el señor Bilbo Bolsón ha dejado una última sorpresa para sus vecinos.\
\
¡Feliz otoño!","El Festival de Otoño reparte travesuras ingeniosas y sabrosos manjares por toda la Tierra Media. Únete a la fiesta empezando por la Comarca, donde el señor Bilbo Bolsón ha dejado una última sorpresa para sus vecinos.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro cuando finalice el festival actual.</rgb>","Viaja al Árbol de la Fiesta","El Festival de Otoño reparte travesuras ingeniosas y sabrosos manjares por toda la Tierra Media. Únete a la fiesta empezando por la Comarca, donde el señor Bilbo Bolsón ha dejado una última sorpresa para sus vecinos.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Tras aceptar esta misión, puedes completarla para conseguir un mapa al Árbol de la Fiesta en la Comarca, donde podrás participar en el Festival.</rgb>"}},
[4989]={nameES="La Caída de los Hijos de la Tierra",objectivesES={"La Caída de los Hijos de la Tierra","Los Hijos de la Tierra de la facción Rauta-lehmä están acampados al este de Esteldín, en Nan Amlug.\
\
Deberías mostrarles a los traidores Rauta-lehmä que han elegido el bando equivocado en la guerra que se avecina.","Has derrotado a los Hijos de la Tierra de los Rauta-lehmä en la sección oriental de Nan Amlug.","Durante muchas eras, los Hijos de la Tierra protegieron el paso por Ram Dúath contra Angmar, pero desde la traición de la tribu Suuri-lehmä por parte del Primer Cazador Jarkko y sus seguidores, los Hijos de la Tierra han quedado atrapados en las Quebradas del Norte.\
\
Debes derrotar a los Rauta-lehmä, como se hacen llamar los traidores. Demuéstrales que su traición es conocida y no será tolerada.","Durante muchas eras, los Hijos de la Tierra protegieron el paso por Ram Dúath contra Angmar, pero desde la traición de la tribu Suuri-lehmä por parte del Primer Cazador Jarkko y sus seguidores, los Hijos de la Tierra han quedado atrapados en las Quebradas del Norte.","Has derrotado a un buen número de Rauta-lehmä en el este de Nan Amlug.","Completado"}},
[4990]={nameES="Fall of the Queen",objectivesES={"Return to Sênjar in Sormedân and tell him the new queen has been defeated.","The queen flashes her mandibles and roars in rage","Find and defeat the aggressive queen bee","Fall of the Queen","Return to Sênjar in Sormedân","You have defeated the new queen bee","Find and defeat the aggressive queen bee in Medân Makhai.","Sênjar has asked you to slay the new queen of the bees of Medân Makhai. Before you can face the queen, you must defeat the bee guardians defending the queen. Medân Makhai can be found north-west of Sormedân.","Sênjar has told you the bees of Medân Makhai have grown more aggressive since a new queen took over the hive and drove off the old queen. Sênjar has requested your aid in defeating the new queen."}},
[4991]={nameES="Manzanas caídas",objectivesES={"Lleva las manzanas a El Tío Gamyi","Manzanas caídas","El Tío Gamyi fue despedido de sus labores como jardinero de Bolsón Cerrado por los Sacovilla-Bolsón. Antes de su despido, estaba recogiendo manzanas del huerto pero no pudo terminar.","El Tío Gamyi está fuera de su casa en Bolsón de Tirada, al pie de la Colina en Hobbiton.\
\
Debes llevarle a El Tío Gamyi las manzanas que lograste salvar de los montones de manzanas."}},
[4992]={nameES="Fallen By the Wayside",objectivesES={}},
[4993]={nameES="El roble caído",objectivesES={"Hojasombría se encuentra en el noroeste de Agamaur.\
\
Radagast el Pardo te ha encomendado la tarea de destruir las criaturas corrompidas de Agamaur para intentar limpiar el mal del señor demacrado Ivar del pantano. Mientras no estabas, se enteró de que un gran ucorno había sido corrompido y que era la fuerza que agitaba a los otros ucornos. Te ha pedido que destruyas a Hojasombría.","De alguna manera, la propia esencia del Pantano Rojo ha sido corrompida. Radagast el Pardo, un mago que ha llegado a Agamaur, busca descubrir la causa.","Radagast se encuentra en el campamento de los Eglain, en el sur de Agamaur, cerca de la entrada.\
\
Radagast te envió a destruir al gran ucorno Hojasombría para intentar limpiar el mal de Ivar de Agamaur. La tarea está cumplida, es hora de regresar junto a Radagast con la trágica noticia de tu éxito.","El roble caído"}},
[4994]={nameES="Fallen Ranger",objectivesES={"Braigiar's body is in the centre of the village of Tûr Morva, where he fell during his escape with Radanir.\
\
Radanir has asked you to recover Braigiar's body from the centre of Tûr Morva.","Find Braigiar's body, and Théodred will carry it back to the encampment","You stare at Braigiar's fallen form and wonder how many other friends must die within the walls of Tûr Morva.","Talk to Radanir at the forward encampment in Tâl Methedras","Braigiar was slain when he and Radanir tried to escape from Tûr Morva. Radanir was wounded and wants you to retrieve the body of his friend.","Radanir is at the forward encampment in Tâl Methedras.\
\
Radanir will be pleased to know that you have recovered Braigiar's body.","Fallen Ranger"}},
[4995]={nameES="Fallen Soldiers",objectivesES={"Talk to Thranduil","Thranduil can be found at Echad-in-Edhil.\
\
You should talk to Thranduil.","Soldiers who fell in battle have been brought back as horrifying wights to fight against their fellows.","Elf-wights and fallen soldier wights can be found in Parth Daenath.\
\
You should lay to rest your slain fellows.","Fallen Soldiers"}},
[4996]={nameES="Fallen Stones and Forgotten Tales",objectivesES={"Fallen Stones and Forgotten Tales","Erymeldir claims to know little of the ancient Elvish ruins within the Limlight Gorge, saying that they were abandoned even before he was born\
\
He suggested that you may want to ask Ordhrien about them as she is a good bit older than he.","Talk to Ordhrien","You discovered a number of unimagineably old ruins within the Limlight Gorge. They appear to be Elvish, but it is impossible to say what age they may have hailed from."}},
[4997]={nameES="Fallen Supplies",objectivesES={"Fallen Supplies","Dargumë can be found at Asbaj-khîrfin.\
\
You should bring the supplies to Dargumë.","Bring the supplies to Dargumë","An accident involving a supply cart has left the dwarves' supplies strewn about Máttugard.","Supplies can be found in northern Máttugard.\
\
You should recover supplies.","These supplies were ruined during the fall"}},
[4998]={nameES="Árboles Caídos",objectivesES={"Árboles Caídos","Los Ucornos del norte del Bosque de los Trolls han sido corrompidos por algún poder oscuro y han comenzado a colaborar con los trolls silvanos y otros siervos del Enemigo.","Thoroniel está apostada al sur y al oeste del Gladdalf, en el norte del Bosque de los Trolls.\
\
Debes regresar con Thoroniel y comunicarle que has cumplido su petición.","Habla con Thoroniel","Los Ucornos pueden encontrarse en el Gladdalf, en el norte del Bosque de los Trolls.\
\
Thoroniel te ha pedido a ti y a tus compañeros que acabéis con los Ucornos del norte del Bosque de los Trolls."}},
[4999]={nameES="Fallen to Madness",objectivesES={"Maddened marsh-lurkers can be found at Gilvamyr and Gladden Falls in the Gladden Fields. A few may also be found wandering the Gladden Fields.\
\
You have encountered a number of maddened marsh-lurkers stalking the Gladden Fields. You must defeat them.","It is unfortunate that they could not be healed of the malady that overtook them, but you have prevented the maddened marsh-lurkers from doing more harm to the other inhabitants of the Gladden Fields.","Fallen to Madness","You have defeated many maddened marsh-lurkers in the Gladden Fields.","Some of the marsh-lurkers in the Gladden Fields have succumbed to a sudden, mysterious madness. To Radagast's dismay, the creatures seemingly cannot be turned from whatever corruption has taken hold of them.\
\
You should defeat them before they bring more harm to the other inhabitants of the Gladden Fields.","A sudden, mysterious madness has overtaken some of the creatures that dwell in the Gladden Fields.","Completado"}},
[5000]={nameES="Caídos ante los Huargos",objectivesES={"Habla con Orthonn","Orthonn teme que un viajero que pasó junto a él haya sido atacado por los huargos durante el asalto a las tierras de cultivo.","Orthonn está en Ost Lagoros, en el borde oriental de Annúndir.\
\
Debes hablar con Orthonn.","Caídos ante los Huargos","Una gran manada de huargos se ha asentado en el norte de Annúndir, y los huesos de sus víctimas cubren los túmulos funerarios del norte.\
\
Orthonn teme que un pequeño viajero no haya llegado sano y salvo a Amon Raith, y te ha pedido que busques en Haudh Eglain cualquier señal de problemas."}},
[5001]={nameES="Estandartes perdidos",objectivesES={"Lleva el estandarte al heraldo de Reginald Guardián","Cuéntale a Reginald Guardián dónde se encuentra su heraldo extraviado","Se te ha pedido que encuentres al heraldo de Reginald Guardián, pero al encontrarle, te ha revelado que perdió el preciado estandarte familiar de su capitán.","El estandarte de Reginald Guardián se ha perdido en uno de los campamentos de los Angmarim de la cornisa de hielo, al sureste de Sûri-kylä.\
\
El heraldo de Reginald te ha pedido que recuperes el estandarte de su capitán, que perdió durante el ataque de los Angmarim.","Reginald Guardián se encuentra en Sûri-kylä, al noroeste de la cornisa de hielo.\
\
El heraldo de Reginald Guardián te ha pedido que le digas a su capitán que está a salvo y dónde puede encontrarle.","Recupera el estandarte","Estandarte recuperado","Estandartes perdidos"}},
[5002]={nameES="Fallows: Driving Back the Enemy",objectivesES={"Fallows: Driving Back the Enemy","Núrzum is dead, but the enemy still roams free throughout much of Wildermore.","<rgb=#FF0000>Completing Wildermore's Recovery will cancel this quest.</rgb>","Ealswith is in Forlaw.\
\
You should return to Ealswith.","The forces of Isengard can be found in the Fallows.\
\
You should ride to the Fallows and defeat the enemies of Wildermore.","Regresa con Ealswith"}},
[5003]={nameES="Fallows: The Farmers' Loss",objectivesES={"Collect the sacks of supplies","Ealswith is in Forlaw.\
\
You should return to Ealswith.","<rgb=#FF0000>Completing Wildermore's Recovery will cancel this quest.</rgb>","The hoe, sickle, and sacks of supplies can be found at the farmsteads in the southern Fallows.\
\
You should ride to the Fallows and gather the requested supplies.","Collected the sacks of supplies","The farmers of the Fallows have oft requested the recovery of their valuable tools and supplies, left at the farms when all were abandoned.","Regresa con Ealswith","Collected the sickle","Collect the hoe","Fallows: The Farmers' Loss","Has recuperado la azada","Collect the sickle"}},
[5004]={nameES="Órdenes falsas",objectivesES={"Órdenes falsas","Drostan, ahora despojado de su nombre y llamado Soltakh entre los Trév Gállorg, está ansioso por redimirse.","Se pueden encontrar cofres por toda la ciudad de Dûn Covad, en las colinas occidentales al norte de Fail-á-Khro.\
\
Soltakh te ha pedido que deslices órdenes falsas en los cofres utilizados por la cadena de mando angmarim para la comunicación de tareas.","Soltakh se encuentra en Fail-á-Khro, al sur de Dûn Covad y al norte de Aughaire.\
\
Después de deslizar las órdenes falsas en los cofres de los Angmarim, deberías regresar a Soltakh en Fail-á-Khro.","Habla con Soltakh"}},
[5005]={nameES="Falsas protecciones",objectivesES={"Erchiel está lista para avanzar con las etapas finales del plan que Lithuifin la ayudó a elaborar.","Erchiel te ha pedido modificar una serie de marcadores gauradan para convertirlos en Protecciones de Perdición y evitar que los Gauredain crucen hacia las Agujas de la Linde.\
\
Los marcadores se encuentran a lo largo del río, al norte de las Agujas de la Linde.","Debes regresar y contarle a Erchiel que has terminado de colocar las protecciones.\
\
Erchiel está en las Agujas de la Linde, al sur del río.","Habla con Erchiel","Falsas protecciones"}},
[5006]={nameES="Entrega de Falster",objectivesES={"Entrega de Falster","Entrega el saco de objetos a Ollie Arbustorojo.","Ollie Arbustorojo está esperando en la tienda de armas y armaduras al este del Ayuntamiento de Bree.\
\
Falster colocó las reliquias que reuniste en un saco y te pidió que lo entregaras a Ollie Arbustorojo.","Entrega la bolsa de monedas a Falster el Zorro.","Falster el Zorro está en La Posada Abandonada, en las Tierras Solitarias, al este de Bree.\
\
Ollie Arbustorojo te dio un pago escaso y expresó su descontento antes de enviarte de regreso con Falster el Zorro en La Posada Abandonada.","Falster quedó satisfecho con tu ayuda y ahora quiere que los objetos que reuniste sean entregados a Ollie Arbustorojo."}},
[5007]={nameES="Encargo de Falster",objectivesES={"Las monedas y reliquias pueden encontrarse entre los escombros de Arnor en el valle bajo Minas Eriol, al sureste de la Posada Abandonada. También hay lobos merodeando por el valle.\
\
Falster el Zorro, un comerciante que trabaja para un hombre llamado Ollie Arbustorojo, te ha pedido que recojas algunas monedas antiguas y reliquias para él. Falster quiere que caces lobos en la zona para obtener dientes que puedan compensar el retraso en su entrega a Ollie Arbustorojo.","Entrega las curiosidades a Falster el Zorro.","Encargo de Falster","Falster el Zorro, un residente de la Posada Abandonada, necesita ayuda para adquirir ciertas curiosidades para Ollie Arbustorojo, de Bree."}},
[5008]={nameES="Faltharan's Charge",objectivesES={"People can be found inside Glaniath in Upper Lebennin.\
\
You have arrived at Glaniath, but have not yet seen Faltharan. You should ask an inhabitant of Glaniath if they have seen him.","Ask someone in Glaniath if Faltharan has arrived","Faltharan readies himself for the journey into Upper Lebennin where he hopes to uncover his father's fate.","Travel to Glaniath in Upper Lebennin","Faltharan's Charge","You have arrived at Glaniath, but Faltharan is nowhere to be found","The gate into Upper Lebennin can be found in north-eastern Pelargir.\
\
Faltharan has asked you to travel into Upper Lebennin and aid him in seeking his lost father. You should travel to the eastern gate.","Glaniath can be found along the road outside the eastern gate of Pelargir.\
\
Faltharan has bidden you to meet him at Glaniath, a small farming village in Upper Lebennin. He hopes to begin his search in the surrounding area.","The road into Upper Lebennin lies ahead...","Travel to the eastern gate of Pelargir"}},
[5009]={nameES="Faltharan's Confrontation",objectivesES={"Faltharan can be found at the steps to Tol Ciryarani.\
\
You should speak with Faltharan.","Talk to Faltharan","DNT - Not Used","Speak with Faltharan","Faltharan's Confrontation","Join Faltharan as he confronts Lorvegil","Spoke with Faltharan","You have discovered the location of the traitor Lorvegil, and must help Faltharan bring him to justice."}},
[5010]={nameES="Historia Familiar",objectivesES={"Regresa a Declan con noticias de su abuelo","Un bardo, Declan te ha pedido que investigues los Salones de la Noche y regreses con cualquier pista sobre la desaparición de su abuelo.","Descubre lo que le sucedió a Durell","Los Salones de la Noche se encuentran entre las colinas al este de Aughaire, más allá de la puerta norte.\
\
Descubre lo que le sucedió a Durell en los Salones de la Noche.","Has descubierto que Sombra es el abuelo de Declan, su espíritu atrapado durante siglos en los Salones de la Noche.","Historia Familiar"}},
[5011]={nameES="Historia Familiar",objectivesES={"Found the site of Alferth's death","The memorial dedicated to Gárwig's grandson Wilsig can be found in the southern Writhendowns.\
\
You should light the memorial flame for Wilsig to ease the grief of his grandfather.","The memorial dedicated to Gárwig's grandson Cuthard can be found in the southern Writhendowns.\
\
You should light the memorial flame for Cuthard to ease the grief of his grandfather.","Lit the memorial flame for Wilsig","Assure Gárwig that his grandsons have been honoured","Find the memorial dedicated to Wilsig","Gárwig is in the Mead Hall Lornsettle in Forlaw.\
\
You should return to Gárwig, and offer him the comfort that the flames burn bright in memory of his fallen grandsons.","Lit the memorial flame for Cuthard","Light the memorial flame for Gárwig's grandson, Cuthard","Gárwig has lost many sons and grandsons of late, both at Scylfig and earlier, when the snows first started to fall. He would like you to tend to the memorials placed at the sites where his grandsons fell.","Found the site of Cuthard's death","Found the site of Wilsig's death","Historia Familiar","The memorial dedicated to Gárwig's grandson Alferth can be found in the southern Writhendowns.\
\
You should light the memorial flame for Alferth to ease the grief of his grandfather.","Light the memorial flame for Gárwig's fallen grandson, Alferth","Light the memorial flame for Gárwig's grandson, Wilsig","Find the memorial dedicated to Cuthard","Lit the memorial flame for Alferth","Find the memorial dedicated to Alferth"}},
[5012]={nameES="Problemas de familia",objectivesES={"Deberías llevar la milenrama, la corteza de sauce y las setas a Cedrach.\
\
Cedrach está en el Bosque Viejo.","Cedrach Amon te ha pedido que consigas corteza de sauce, milenrama y setas de sombrero resbaladizo mientras busca el arcón en su cabaña.\
\
Deberías buscar estos objetos en el Bosque Viejo.","Vuelve con Cedrach","Problemas de familia","Ahora que le has dado los peces a Henbran, quiere hablar contigo sobre Luilloth. Los recuerdos, sin embargo, desaparecen con el tiempo. Y ha pasado mucho tiempo para Henbran.","Encuentra a Cedrach la Cruel","Henbran Amon te ha sugerido que recuperes el grimorio de la familia Amon de su hermana, Cedrach la Cruel.\
\
Cedrach vive en el Bosque Viejo, en Cardolan."}},
[5013]={nameES="Family Secrets",objectivesES={"Family Secrets","Search the ruins of the Mâkhda Khorbo for a heavy, ornate necklace that the Yâshalam family lost. The ruins of the Mâkhda Khorbo can be found in the hills east of Khûtra.  Then bring it back to the Yâshalam Family Emissary, Miritah.","Find the Yâshalam family necklace","Return the family necklace to Miritah in Khûtra","The Yâshalam family's emissary, Miritah, has asked you to retrieve a family heirloom, a necklace, from the ruins of the Mâkhda Khorbo."}},
[5014]={nameES="Tesoros familiares",objectivesES={"Los bandidos pueden encontrarse en un gran campamento en las Ruinas del Árbol Amarillo, al sur de Entibo; pero puede que otros en el bosque de Chet también lleven objetos robados.\
\
Ya sea por benevolencia o por interés personal, Zancafirme te ha pedido que recolectes los objetos familiares robados de los bandidos y se los entregues en la Puerta de Combe de Bree.","Tesoros familiares","Lleva los objetos familiares a Bruner Zancafirme","Bruner Zancafirme, un caballero de mala reputación procedente de Bree, ha decidido hacer una buena obra por los refugiados de los ataques del Montebruno."}},
[5015]={nameES="Fanatical Followers",objectivesES={}},
[5016]={nameES="Fancy Feasts",objectivesES={"Fancy Feasts","Talk to Séarl in the north-east Dunbog","Séarl has been tasked with gathering food for the Avanc-lûth. He personally does not have a taste for toad-legs, but that is what has been demanded by the Elders.","Toads are all around the camp-fire where Séarl is encamped in the Dunbog.\
\
Séarl has asked you to fetch toad-legs for him."}},
[5017]={nameES="Fane of the Dead",objectivesES={}},
[5018]={nameES="Fangorn - Ents of Fangorn Forest I",objectivesES={}},
[5019]={nameES="Fangorn - Ents of Fangorn II",objectivesES={}},
[5020]={nameES="Fangorn - Ents of Fangorn III",objectivesES={}},
[5021]={nameES="Fangorn - Ents of Fangorn IV",objectivesES={}},
[5022]={nameES="Fangorn Upturned",objectivesES={"Search Wellinghall for signs of upheaval","<rgb=#FF00FF>Look around</rgb> from the centre of Derndingle","Search the Easeful Mead for signs of upheaval","DNT -- Will not be seen","Since the Ents marched to war, the forest has been left upturned and angered. Quickbeam seeks knowledge of what has happened to Fangorn Forest before moving to act.","Search Derndingle for signs of upheaval","Talk to Quickbeam","Quickbeam can be found in Derndingle in south-eastern Fangorn Forest.\
\
You have searched all of the locations to which Quickbeam directed you, and should now return to him with what you have learned.","The mead is fraught with brambles and you can faintly hear nearby chittering","Wellinghall can be found far to the north-west of Derndingle, the Easeful Mead to the north, and Derndingle in south-eastern Fangorn Forest.\
\
Quickbeam has asked you to scout Wellinghall, the Easeful Mead, and Derndingle for signs that the forest has grown wild and angry.","Fangorn Upturned","Wellinghall appears calm, but the growls of wood-trolls can be heard to the north-east","You see nothing strange around Derndingle"}},
[5023]={nameES="Fangorn's Edge -- Tier 1",objectivesES={}},
[5024]={nameES="Fangorn's Edge -- Tier 2",objectivesES={"Fangorn's Edge -- Tier 2","Save Fangorn by destroying Saruman's forces","Work your way up the side of the hill and to the edge of the Fangorn. Defeat all the enemy forces that stand in your way. Protect the Ents!","Saruman has reinforced the edge of Fangorn with some of his toughest forces. You and your fellows must stop the lumber-camp from destroying Fangorn and the Ents that protect it.","You have saved Fangorn"}},
[5025]={nameES="Fangs Bared",objectivesES={"Habla con Fuirgam en Ost Galadh","One of Fuirgam's trackers has been ambushed and slain by wolves in the forests of Emyn Lûm.","Defeated Sharpfang","Defeat Sharpfang","Sharpfang may be found at Hrigg Vidukuni, west of the Wild Ruins, south-west of Ost Galadh.\
\
Fuirgam has asked you to travel to Hrigg Vidukuni and search the area for the Emyn Lûm pack-leader, Sharpfang, and defeat him.","Fangs Bared","Fuirgam at Ost Galadh is at Ost Galadh, north of the Wild Ruins, north-east of Hrigg Vidukuni.\
\
You should return to Fuirgam with news of your success."}},
[5026]={nameES="Fangs Bared",objectivesES={"You approach Daugha-tûm. He remains silent, but his gaze is fixed upon you.\
\
You ask him several carefully-worded questions about his company's intent and the whereabouts of his kin in North Ithilien.\
\
You offer him a moment to respond.","Daugha-tûm does not respond to your questions.\
\
His face is twisted in a mix of anger and disappointment, and it would seem that the decision to surrender was not his to make. However, he makes no attempt to free himself from his bonds and appears to have come to terms with his captain's choice.\
\
Yet, before you can turn back to Maendal, you hear the cracking of a nearby twig and the shifting of stone within the old baths...","Question Daugha-tûm","Daugha-tûm can be found in Aelin Veren, in central North Ithilien.\
\
Maendal has asked you to question the Haradrim prisoners, beginning with the warrior Daugha-tûm.","Talk to Maendal","Fangs Bared","Maendal can be found at Aelin Veren.\
\
You and the Rangers were forced to slay a rebelling Haradrim prisoner. You should talk to Maendal about what is to be done.","Daugha-tûm, a proud warrior of Harad, is the first to be questioned by you and the Rangers of Ithilien in hope of discovering why the Haradrim chose to surrender."}},
[5027]={nameES="Fangs a Million",objectivesES={}},
[5028]={nameES="Fangs for Arrows",objectivesES={}},
[5029]={nameES="Fangs from the East",objectivesES={"Fangs from the East","Bring the wild cat fangs to Twiga at Etheburg in the Brown Lands","Twiga is at Etheburg in the Brown Lands, north-west of Lashkarg.\
\
You should bring the fangs you collected to Twiga as a token of your valour.","Unnerved by the knowledge that the wild cats were trained to attack the Rohirrim, Twiga seeks to remove or lessen that threat.","Wild cats can be found throughout the Brown Lands and at the Khundolar encampment of Lashkarg, south-east of Etheburg.\
\
Twiga has asked you to hunt the wild cats of the Brown Lands and bring him their fangs as a testament of your valour."}},
[5030]={nameES="Fangs in the Snow",objectivesES={}},
[5031]={nameES="Fangs of War",objectivesES={}},
[5032]={nameES="Fangs of the Mist-walkers",objectivesES={"Nósni is in Hagbuth in north-east Clovengap.\
\
Bring the furs and fangs to Nósni.","Beneath the crumbling arches of ancient vineyards prowls a deadly beast. Has the crystal corruption altered this already formidable foe?","Return to Nósni","Clovengap mist-stalkers and sabre-tooth cats can be found in the vineyards.\
\
Nósni has asked you to bring back furs from Clovengap mist-stalkers and fangs from the deadly sabre-tooth cats of Clovengap.","Fangs of the Mist-walkers"}},
[5033]={nameES="Fangs of the Wulf",objectivesES={"Bedwur is in Avardin in the central Starkmoor.\
\
Bedwur will be pleased to hear you have secured a large profit for him from the forces at Wulf's Cleft.","Eva is in Avardin, in the central Starkmoor.\
\
Eva may have knowledge of where the boy has gone.","The great Dunlending camp of Wulf's Cleft lies to the south of Avardin and the Starkmoor.","The Auctioneer's treachery of Isengard finally caught up with him. There is no sign of the merchant's son","Talk to Eva in Avardin","Fangs of the Wulf","Talk to Bedwur in Avardin","Bedwur is in Avardin in the central Starkmoor.\
\
Bedwur has asked you to travel to an overlook of Wulf's Cleft and destroy whoever comes to find you.","Talk to Bedwur to raid the outpost outside the Wulf's Cleft encampment"}},
[5034]={nameES="Avivando las llamas",objectivesES={}},
[5035]={nameES="Avivando las llamas",objectivesES={}},
[5036]={nameES="Fanuidhol Skirmish",objectivesES={"You failed to report back in to Raingon!","Raingon is at Talan Gwilith.\
\
You should speak with Raingon to prepare the defences for battle.","Fanuidhol Skirmish","The Orcs in Fanuidhol have been launching frequent small-scale attacks against the borders of Lórien to test and weaken the resolve of the defenders before they launch a major assault.","Raingon is at Talan Gwilith.\
\
With the assault turned aside, you should speak with Raingon.","Habla con Raingon en Talan Gwilith","Raingon has asked you to defeat the attackers out of Fanuidhol at both Talan Gwilith and Talan Fanuidhol, while protecting the Elven soldiers."}},
[5037]={nameES="Far From Home",objectivesES={"The Master of Horses cares for a swift horse in the Cave of the Avorrim.\
\
Dorthaneth wants to fulfill the wishes of Lady Galadriel, and has asked you to borrow a fast horse from the Master of Horses and carry out an important errand in the Dead Marshes.","Far From Home","Talk to the Master of Horses in the Cave of the Avorrim","A long journey of many miles finally concludes: you have come to the Dead Marshes","Talk to Artamir at his camp in the Dead Marshes","Borrow the swift horse from the Master of Horses and ride to the Dead Marshes","Dorthaneth has received word from the Lady of Lórien concerning an enterprising Gondorian in the Dead Marshes, and wants you to ensure he causes no trouble.","The Master of Horses is in the Cave of the Avorrim.\
\
Dorthaneth has asked you to speak to the Master of Horses, who cares for the swiftest Avorrim horses.","Artamir, son of Ilcamir, has come to the Dead Marshes on an errand, but Galadriel of Lórien fears his presence there may draw unwanted attention to those lands."}},
[5038]={nameES="Far From Shore",objectivesES={"Far From Shore","Melawen can be found in Malbarth in western Lebennin.\
\
Barchir has asked you to speak with the people of Malbarth before you depart for the east.","Talk to Melawen","Talk to Arvaeth","DNT -- will not be seen","Arvaeth can be found to the north-west of Malbarth in western Lebennin.\
\
Barchir has asked you to speak with the people of Malbarth before you depart for the east.","Lendithil can be found in Malbarth in western Lebennin.\
\
Barchir has asked you to speak with the people of Malbarth before you depart for the east.","Sheltered from the conflict growing on the coastline, the people of Malbarth look to their ancient beliefs for answers in these dark times.","Talk to Lendithil"}},
[5039]={nameES="Faramir's Ruse",objectivesES={"The Wainrider chieftain fades into shadow, but immediately reappears atop Dol Acharn!","Talk to Chieftain Zhan Ashû at Dol Acharn","Faramir can be found due west of Dol Acharn in Dagorlad.\
\
You have told the Wainrider chieftain of the Bloodletter's heritage and of the banner he bears, but his people still remained hostile despite their apparent gratitude. You should return to Faramir.","Confront and defeat the Wainrider chieftain at Dol Acharn","Faramir's Ruse","Talk to Faramir near Dol Acharn","Chieftain Zhan Ashû can be found atop Dol Acharn in eastern Dagorlad.\
\
You have bested the chieftain in combat and he now wishes to speak to you. You should attempt to convince him of the Bloodletter's danger to his people.","Faramir, son of Ondoher has devised a ruse to confound the Wainriders into both ending the treachery of the Bloodletter at Ondoher's Folly and ignoring the advance of the Host of the West.","A chill washes over you as the Wainrider chieftain appears!","The Wainrider chieftain can be found somewhere within Dol Acharn. Disturbing an object of his people might rouse him to step forth from the shadows.\
\
Faramir has asked you to draw forth and defeat the Wainrider chieftain in the hope you might gain an audience with him."}},
[5040]={nameES="Farewell Lyndelby",objectivesES={}},
[5041]={nameES="Farewell to Berkha",objectivesES={"Raghda-gûn has realized she may not be best suited to care for little Berkha.","Talk to Berkha","Farewell to Berkha","The little duck waddles away from Raghda-gûn, but he doesn't make it more than a few feet before he looks back at the one who took him in.\
\
'Quack!'\
\
The single word could not hope to capture the depth of his gratitude or his love, but it will have to do.","Raghda-gûn has realized she may not be best suited to care for little Berkha, and has arranged for you to take him with you.\
\
Speak to Berkha at Raghda-gûn's nest, Aklâradum, atop a cliff south of Halrax."}},
[5042]={nameES="Adiós a Lhan Garan",objectivesES={"Eluna te ha pedido que te despidas de sus estudiantes antes de marcharte.\
\
Habla con Murig, Deryn y Marget.","Habla con Eluna","Habla con Murig","Eluna te ha pedido que hables con la gente de Lhan Garan.","Murig sonríe cálidamente mientras te acercas.\
\
'No tenías obligación para con nosotros y aun así te has puesto en peligro una vez tras otra. Gracias.\
\
'Los otros y yo mantendremos Lhan Garan a salvo. Aquí estará siempre que quieras venir a visitarnos.","Adiós a Lhan Garan","Eluna está esperándote.\
\
Habla con Eluna.","Habla con Deryn","Marget tiene su atención en Ardhun. Solo cuando te acercas parece recordar el mundo que le rodea.\
\
'Dime, viajero, viste cómo luchó, ¿verdad? ¿Cómo crees que me iría a mí contra ella?'\
\
Marget te sonríe, y hay un atisbo de peligro y malicia en sus ojos.\
\
'Tan bien como me iría contra ti, supongo.\
\
'He oído que pronto nos dejarás. Espero que el resto de tus aventuras sean al menos la mitad de emocionantes que la que compartimos.\
\
'Ven a visitarnos de nuevo. Y trae pan. De alguna manera, el de Deryn sabe a medicina.'"}},
[5043]={nameES="Farewell to Pelargir",objectivesES={"Join Faltharan as he says his good-byes","Faltharan can be found at the steps to Tol Ciryarani.\
\
You should speak with Faltharan.","Farewell to Pelargir","Faltharan has asked you to accompany him as his family departs for more safe lands.","Talk to Faltharan","DNT - Not Used","Faltharan can be found at the steps to Tol Ciryarani.\
\
Speak with Faltharan to head to the shipyard."}},
[5044]={nameES="Farm-fields of Woodhurst",objectivesES={"Speak with Gifemund","Return to Herubrand in his hideout within the farmhouse cellar and tell him of Gifemund's promise to keep the fields watched.","Speak with Gifemund about the security concerns in the city. He has taken over the protection for Woodhurst, and it is clear that things have not gotten better.","Farm-fields of Woodhurst","Herubrand should be told of the farmers being murdered so close to where he is hiding.","The fields are disturbed by someone who has no regard for the crops. This was clearly not the farmer's doing. It does not bode well for the missing farmers.","Calin is on the first floor of the farmhouse, and is looking into arranging a search party for the missing farmers.","Speak with Herubrand","Investigate the farm-fields","Herubrand has been staying in the cellar of the farmers' house, but Calin and Herubrand have not seen them in over a day and begin to worry about them.","Speak with Calin","Return to Herubrand","You found a place where it seems people broke into the city and disturbed the field...","The farmers have gone missing, and are suspected to be out in the fields somewhere."}},
[5045]={nameES="Las herramientas del granjero Hove",objectivesES={"Expulsado de su tierra y herido por trasgos descontrolados, Cendrew Hove busca la forma de compensar a sus anfitriones.","Vuelve con Cendrew","Cendrew Hove te ha pedido que recuperes sus herramientas de carpintero de su granja.\
\
La granja de la familia Hove está en Cardolan.","Busca las herramientas de carpintero","Las herramientas del granjero Hove","Has encontrado la caja de herramientas del granjero, pero estaba vacía. Sospechas que los trasgos que han tomado la granja se han llevado las herramientas. Debes acabar con trasgos en la granja Hove y recuperar las herramientas robadas.\
\
La granja Hove se encuentra en el centro de Cardolan, hacia el norte.","Deberías llevar las herramientas de carpintero a Cendrew Hove.\
\
Cendrew está en la granja Scurloc, en el noreste de Cardolan."}},
[5046]={nameES="Mercado de Granjeros",objectivesES={"Recolecta productos de Asphodel Froghorn","La granja de la Viuda Froghorn está al este de Entibo.\
\
Asphodel Froghorn está esperando el pago que recibiste de Himloc Grouse por la venta de sus vegetales.","Himloc Grouse normalmente se encuentra en la plaza del pueblo de Entibo, al oeste de la granja de la Viuda Froghorn.\
\
Asphodel parece pensar bien de ti y te ha pedido que vendas algunos de sus productos a Himloc Grouse, el comerciante.","Mercado de Granjeros","Lleva la cesta de vegetales a Himloc Grouse","La granja de la Viuda Froghorn está en el camino al oeste y al sur de la granja de Eldo Swatmidge.\
\
Eldo Swatmidge te pidió que recolectaras los productos que Asphodel Froghorn piensa vender.","Lleva el pago de Himloc a Asphodel Froghorn","Productos recolectados de Asphodel Froghorn","Eldo Swatmidge es un granjero exitoso, pero está solo. Ha buscado tu ayuda para cortejar a su vecina, la Viuda Froghorn."}},
[5047]={nameES="El mercado agrícola está abierto",objectivesES={"Habla con Hob Cimacolina en Dwaling","Hob Cimacolina está en Dwaling, al noreste de Avenal.\
\
Albin Cotonorte te ha pedido que te aventures en Dwaling y les avises de que el mercado agrícola abrirá antes este año.","Los hobbits que viven en Dwaling estarán impacientes por saber que el mercado agrícola de Cotonorte está abierto.","El mercado agrícola está abierto"}},
[5048]={nameES="Farmer: Hardy Bulbs",objectivesES={"The recipe for hardy bulbs (both field and crop) has been given to you by Hildelith.\
\
You should farm hardy bulbs for the folk of Wildermore.","Deliver the hardy bulbs to Hildelith","<rgb=#FF0000>Completing Wildermore's Recovery will cancel this quest.</rgb>","Farmer: Hardy Bulbs","Hildelith is in Forlaw.\
\
You have crafted Hardy Bulbs and should now deliver them to Hildelith.","A skilled farmer such as yourself can help the refugees of Wildermore by cultivating hardy bulbs for them."}},
[5049]={nameES="Boletos de la Feria Agrícola",objectivesES={"Puedes encontrar a la Pregonera del Festival en el centro de Delagua durante el festival de la Feria Agrícola.\
\
¡Habla con ella para reclamar tus boletos del festival gratuitos!","Boletos de la Feria Agrícola","Reclama tus boletos de la Feria Agrícola"}},
[5050]={nameES="Feria de los Granjeros: La Cacería de Hongos de Maggot",objectivesES={"Feria de los Granjeros: La Cacería de Hongos de Maggot","Espera a que comience la partida","Recoge más hongos","Habla con Osbert Barroso para recibir las fichas por haber ganado la cacería de hongos.","Quedan diez segundos en la cacería de hongos","La cacería de hongos de Maggot ha comenzado","Habla con Osbert Barroso","Saliste del campo de maíz de Maggot...","Evita a los perros de Maggot","No comiste suficientes hongos. Inténtalo de nuevo","Los hobbits jóvenes de la Comarca mantienen desde hace mucho tiempo la tradición de colarse en los campos del granjero Maggot para robar los hongos suculentos que crecen a la sombra de las hileras de maíz. Al granjero Maggot no le hacen ninguna gracia estos intrusos, y cada año, cuando llega la época de la cosecha, suelta a sus tres perros, Colmillo, Garra y Lobo, por los campos para ahuyentar a los hobbits indeseables. Este año, un pequeño grupo de hobbits audaces ha convertido estas incursiones en un 'evento' no oficial de la Feria de los Granjeros, formando grupos para intentar robar los hongos silvestres.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando finalice el evento con el que está asociada.</rgb>","Recoge al menos cinco hongos.","Uno de los perros de Maggot te ha visto","Has conseguido devorar cinco de los hongos de Maggot... ¡Sigue comiendo tantos como puedas antes de que termine el juego!"}},
[5051]={nameES="Feria de los Granjeros: La carrera de los huevos de Sandson",objectivesES={"Habla con Wymarc Cavada para recibir las fichas por haber ganado la carrera de los huevos.","Has salido del gallinero de Sandson","Espera a que comience la partida","La carrera de los huevos de Sandson comenzará en breve. Tu objetivo es recoger al menos cinco huevos blancos, pero puedes ganar fichas adicionales recogiendo más huevos... ¡y especialmente si consigues los raros huevos de colores!\
\
Espera en el gallinero hasta que Wymarc Cavada declare el inicio del juego.","La carrera de los huevos de Sandson ha comenzado","Has conseguido reunir cinco huevos blancos. Recoge todos los que puedas antes de que termine el juego.\
\
Intenta coger cualquier huevo festivo que veas.","Recoge más huevos","Feria de los Granjeros: La carrera de los huevos de Sandson","Wymarc Cavada supervisa la carrera anual de los huevos, en la que hobbits y visitantes, jóvenes y mayores por igual, corretean tras las gallinas del granjero Sandson con la esperanza de recoger los huevos puestos en medio del pánico. Parece que el pienso especial de Sandson contenía ingredientes poco habituales este año, ya que algunos de los huevos que ponen sus gallinas presentan colores realmente extraños. Aun así, puede que los coleccionistas de huevos les encuentren algún valor.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando finalice el evento al que está asociada. </rgb>","No has recogido suficientes huevos. Inténtalo de nuevo","Recoge cinco huevos blancos tan rápido como puedas.","Habla con Wymarc Cavada"}},
[5052]={nameES="La ruina del granjero",objectivesES={"Las langostas son la ruina del sustento de los cultivadores de avena de Avenal","La ruina del granjero","Has encontrado algo fuera de lugar en las tierras de Nibs Redondo","Nibs redondo está en su granja, al este de Avenal.\
\
Debes volver con Nibs Redondo y hablarle del cadáver de alce y el lobo que te atacó.","Las tierras de Nibs Redondo están al este y noreste de su granja.\
\
Nibs Redondo ha aceptado tu oferta de ayuda y te ha indicado dónde se encuentran sus tierras.","Encuentra algo fuera de lugar en las tierras de Nibs Redondo"}},
[5053]={nameES="Farmhouse of the Entwash Vale: Crops",objectivesES={}},
[5054]={nameES="Farmhouse of the Entwash Vale: Enhancements",objectivesES={}},
[5055]={nameES="Farmhouse of the Entwash Vale: Inhabitants",objectivesES={}},
[5056]={nameES="Farmhouse of the Entwash Vale: Rebuild",objectivesES={}},
[5057]={nameES="Farmhouse of the Sutcrofts: Crops",objectivesES={}},
[5058]={nameES="Farmhouse of the Sutcrofts: Enhancements",objectivesES={}},
[5059]={nameES="Farmhouse of the Sutcrofts: Inhabitants",objectivesES={}},
[5060]={nameES="Farmhouse of the Sutcrofts: Rebuild",objectivesES={}},
[5061]={nameES="Farmhouse of the Sutcrofts: Superior Farmland",objectivesES={}},
[5062]={nameES="Farmhouse of the Sutcrofts: Superior Oven",objectivesES={}},
[5063]={nameES="Farms of the Fallows",objectivesES={"There are muffled calls for help from nearby. Search for those around the farm needing your help","You found and rescued Torwulf","The farms in the Fallows were abandoned when Núrzum attacked Forlaw, and it was deemed unsafe to be outside the city walls. Thrymm's Farm is the meeting place for anyone in the outlying farms who are escaping to the safety of Forlaw.","There are a few survivors calling for help around Thrymm's Farm. These calls seem to be coming from around the outer edges of the farm.","Find Oter in the centre of Thrymm's Farm","Farms of the Fallows","The rescued farmers ran off toward the barn in the centre of the farm. Find and talk to Oter, who seems to be the senior among these farmers.","You found and rescued Siric","Find Thrymm's Farm near Forlaw","Thrymm's Farm is south-east of Forlaw. The road outside the east gate has a fork, and the southern path runs straight through this farm.","You found and rescued Oter"}},
[5064]={nameES="Robo a la moda",objectivesES={"Los Crebain han estado robando cascos y sombreros a los buenos ciudadanos de Urmâkh. Un explorador local los ha rastreado hasta Ghât Okho. Debes recuperar los tocados de estos descarados ladrones alados.","Recupera los tocados en Ghât Okho y derrota a los crebain.","Robo a la moda"}},
[5065]={nameES="Fasten A Waggon",objectivesES={"You have found a suitable spare wheel for Natholan's waggon. Return it to Natholan just outside of Echad Lendir.\
\
Echad Lendir can be found to the east along the road to Barad Faen.","Natholan is not confident his waggon will make the rest of the journey.","You have found a suitable spare waggon wheel","Fasten A Waggon","Talk to Natholan at Echad Lendir","Find a spare waggon wheel in Lond Cirion","Natholan has asked you to find a spare wheel in Lond Cirion.\
\
Lond Cirion can be found to the west."}},
[5066]={nameES="Faster Than a Flash",objectivesES={"Grimwald only smiles smugly at you. You find that you don't like this little boy very much. His breathing is not even laboured!\
\
'One more race? Back to the front gate. I am sure you'll win this time, since you already know the way!'","Grimwald is outside the Mead Hall of Grimslade.\
\
You should speak with Grimwald.","Race Grimwald to the stable in the north-west of town","The end of your race with Grimwald is at the Mead Hall in Grimslade.\
\
You should race Grimwald to the Mead Hall.","Faster Than a Flash","The end of your race with Grimwald is at the front gate of Grimslade.\
\
You should race Grimwald to the front gate.","Race to the north-west stable!","Speak with Grimwald to begin the race","Race Grimwald to the front gate","Run to the front gate! Grimwald thinks he can beat you.","Speak with Grimwald at the Mead Hall","Grimwald has beaten you soundly....","Race to the Mead Hall!","Make it to the front gate before Grimwald","Grimwald is outside of Grimslade's Mead Hall.\
\
You should speak with Grimwald.","Twins! You've been tricked....","Grimwald, son of Grimbold, has challenged you to a race. Outrunning such a small fellow should not be difficult.","The end of your race with Grimwald is at the stable in the south-west of town.\
\
You should race Grimwald to the stable.","Race Grimwald to the Mead Hall","Race to the front gate!"}},
[5067]={nameES="Faster Than a Flash",objectivesES={"Grimwald has done the impossible and beaten you!","Grimwald, son of Grimbold, has challenged you to a race. Outrunning such a small fellow should not be difficult.","The end of your race with Grimwald is at the front gate of Grimslade.\
\
You should race Grimwald to the front gate.","Make it to the front gate before Grimwald","Speak with Grimwald to begin the race","Grimwald is outside of Grimslade's Mead Hall.\
\
You should speak with Grimwald.","Run to the front gate! Grimwald thinks he can beat you.","Faster Than a Flash"}},
[5068]={nameES="Faster Than a Flash II",objectivesES={"Grimwald, son of Grimbold, has challenged you to a race. Outrunning such a small fellow should not be difficult.","Grimwald has beaten you again....","The end of your race with Grimwald is at the stable in the south-west of town.\
\
You should race Grimwald to the stable.","Race Grimwald to the stable in the south-west of town","Faster Than a Flash II"}},
[5069]={nameES="Faster Than a Flash III",objectivesES={"Grimwald has beaten you soundly....","Grimwald, son of Grimbold, has challenged you to a race. Outrunning such a small fellow should not be difficult.","Grimwald only smiles smugly at you. You find that you don't like this little boy very much. His breathing is not even laboured!\
\
'One more race? Back to the front gate. I am sure you'll win this time, since you already know the way!'","Faster Than a Flash III","Race Grimwald to the Mead Hall","The end of your race with Grimwald is at the Mead Hall in Grimslade.\
\
You should race Grimwald to the Mead Hall."}},
[5070]={nameES="Faster Than a Flash IV",objectivesES={"Grimwald, son of Grimbold, has challenged you to a race. Outrunning such a small fellow should not be difficult.","Twins! You've been tricked....","The end of your race with Grimwald is at the front gate of Grimslade.\
\
You should race Grimwald to the front gate.","Grimwald only smiles smugly at you. You find that you don't like this little boy very much. His breathing is not even laboured!\
\
'One more race? Back to the front gate. I am sure you'll win this time, since you already know the way!'","Race Grimwald to the front gate","Grimwald is outside the Mead Hall of Grimslade.\
\
You should speak with Grimwald.","Faster Than a Flash IV","Speak with Grimwald at the Mead Hall"}},
[5071]={nameES="Alcalde Gordo",objectivesES={"Habla con el alcalde Pieblanco","En la zona de la Feria de los Granjeros hay objetos que podrían aliviar las molestias del alcalde.\
\
Deberías recoger un objeto que ayude a calmar lo que necesita el alcalde.","El alcalde Pieblanco se encuentra en la Feria de los Granjeros, en Delagua.\
\
Debes hablar con el alcalde Pieblanco.","Se dice que Will Pieblanco, alcalde de Cavada Grande, es el hobbit más gordo de la Cuaderna del Oeste (y quizá de más allá).\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando finalice el evento al que está asociada. </rgb>","Alcalde Gordo"}},
[5072]={nameES="Fate Unknown -- Baingaleth",objectivesES={"Baingaleth was taken to the Dungeons of Dol Guldurm.","Found and rescued Baingaleth","Find and rescue Baingaleth","Baingaleth has disappeared. She was supposed to meet Carethalph secretly under the shadow of the Hanging Tree but she never showed up. All that he found was a crudely-written note from the Orcs of Dol Guldur.","Fate Unknown -- Baingaleth"}},
[5073]={nameES="Fate Unknown -- Borihon",objectivesES={"Borihon has gone missing.  The elves of Emyn Lum are worried that one of their strongest captains is missing. They have tasked you to search within the Dungeons of Dol Guldur for him.  Please be careful with him.  He may have been injured during the fight.","Borihon is in the Dungeons of Dol Guldur.","Fate Unknown -- Borihon","Found and rescued Borihon","Find and rescue Borihon"}},
[5074]={nameES="Fate Unknown -- Bregrochon",objectivesES={"Fate Unknown -- Bregrochon","Bregrochon is in the Dungeons of Dol Guldur.","Found and rescued Bregrochon","Bregrochon is gone. Naerdolen lost track of him somewhere in the northern caves when they were attacked by Black Númenóreans. He fears that his long-time friend has been taken to the dungeons of Dol Guldur.","Find and rescue Bregrochon"}},
[5075]={nameES="Fate Unknown -- Faelwen",objectivesES={"Found and rescued Faelwen","Find and rescue Faelwen","Fate Unknown -- Faelwen","Faelwen is at the Dungeons of Dol Guldur.","Atharnúrel has asked you to find her friend Faelwen. They were revelling in Imlad Lalaith and wandered across the river, seeking to bring mirth to the eaves of Mirkwood. Sadly, a group of uruks came and took her friend, and she fears to return to Imlad Lalaith without her."}},
[5076]={nameES="Fate Unknown -- Faenthír",objectivesES={}},
[5077]={nameES="Fate Unknown -- Glamrennel",objectivesES={"Glamrennel is in the Dungeons of Dol Guldur.","Find and rescue Glamrennel","Agorgened has lost his sweetheart to an ambush by the Orcs of Dol Guldur at the top of a large waterfall.","Found and rescued Glamrennel","Fate Unknown -- Glamrennel"}},
[5078]={nameES="Fate Unknown -- Hethulír",objectivesES={"Fate Unknown -- Hethulír","Hethulír is in the Dungeons of Dol Guldur.","Find and rescue Hethulír","Laegalar has lost his brother, Hethulír, in the woods of Mirkwood.  They were out searching for rare herbs when they were ambushed by sorcerers.  He has come to the Mourning Well in hopes that someone hears his cries for his lost brother.","Found and rescued Hethulír"}},
[5079]={nameES="Fate Unknown -- Maediel",objectivesES={"Maediel is in the Dungeons of Dol Guldur.","Find and rescue Maediel","Fate Unknown -- Maediel","Maediel has gone missing. Her daughter, Dolhendeth, is worried because lately she has decided to go for long walks in dangerous areas. She is worried that Maediel has been captured and has asked you to bring her back to her.","Found and rescued Maediel"}},
[5080]={nameES="Fate Unknown -- Thimuil",objectivesES={"Fate Unknown -- Thimuil","Find and rescue Thimuil","Found and rescued Thimuil","Thimuil is in the Dungeons of Dol Guldur.","Uiloriel sits in the Haunted Inn trying impossibly to drown her sorrows. Her bethrothed has gone missing. Thimuil went to fetch her more lembas from Lothlórien and never returned."}},
[5081]={nameES="El destino del Jinete Negro",objectivesES={"Odovacar Bolger te ha prestado los servicios de su sabuesa, Verónica, para rastrear al misterioso \\qJinete Negro\\q. Te dijo que siguieras a Verónica dondequiera que fuera, y ella encontraría al intruso.","Odovacar Bolger está seguro de que el misterio del intruso de negro pronto se resolverá.","El destino del Jinete Negro","Verónica olfatea la capa, huele el aire por un momento y luego ladra emocionada.","Muestra la capa negra a Greta Albo","Odovacar Bolger está en su casa en el centro de Bolgovado, al norte de sus pocilgas.\
\
Deberías regresar con Odovacar Bolger y contarle lo que has aprendido sobre el \\qJinete Negro\\q.","Greta Albo está en Bolgovado.\
\
Verónica te ha llevado hasta Greta Albo. ¿Podría ser ella el misterioso \\qJinete Negro\\q?","Verónica corre de vuelta con Odovacar","Fogo Albo se encuentra en la Perca Dorada en Cepeda, al sureste de Bolgovado.\
\
La sabuesa de Odovacar Bolger, Verónica, te llevó hasta Greta Albo, quien te dijo que hizo la capa para su sobrino, Fogo. Fogo Albo es muy probablemente el \\qJinete Negro\\q. Deberías buscarlo.","No más \\qcabalgatas\\q nocturnas para mí... ¡demasiados lobos por ahí!","Sigue a Verónica hasta el \\qJinete Negro\\q"}},
[5082]={nameES="Fate of the Mother Tree",objectivesES={}},
[5083]={nameES="Fate of the Moulder-wood, Part 1",objectivesES={"Learn about Adagím from Tálbiral","Fate of the Moulder-wood, Part 1","Speak with Tálbiral to learn about the the Pale Blight's impact on Adagím and how the Kintai are trying to fight it.","Speak with Tálbiral"}},
[5084]={nameES="Fate of the Moulder-wood, Part 10",objectivesES={"Dáthlil has received a scout's report that they have had strange sightings to the south and they believe they have located the source of the Pale Blight.","Fate of the Moulder-wood, Part 10","Speak with Dáthlil","Speak with Dáthlil to learn more about the scout's report","You have defeated the morroval that attacked you near the ruins of Nagakhêdi and is believe to be the source of the Pale Blight. Speak with Dáthlil about your success."}},
[5085]={nameES="Fate of the Moulder-wood, Part 2",objectivesES={"Tálbiral has asked for your help with checking trees within Laivárth for signs of rot so that they can be cleansed.","You found trees that have been infected by the Pale Blight within Laivárth. Return to Tálbiral so he knows to cleanse them from the grove.","Fate of the Moulder-wood, Part 2","Speak with Tálbiral"}},
[5086]={nameES="Fate of the Moulder-wood, Part 3",objectivesES={"Return to Tálbiral","Reach blight area","Tálbiral has asked that you check the area surrounding Laivárth and gather samples of the blight for him to inspect.","Tálbiral has asked that you check the area surrounding Laivárth and inspect blighted areas to learn more about it.","You have inspected the blight surrounding Laivárth. Return to Tálbiral with the information you gathered.","Fate of the Moulder-wood, Part 3"}},
[5087]={nameES="Fate of the Moulder-wood, Part 4",objectivesES={"You found Irsinith at the Hill of the Mother. Speak with her about the Pale Blight and how Laivárth is being consumed by it.","Find Irsinith at the Hill of the Mother","Speak to Irsinith at the Hill of the Mother","Tálbiral has asked you to find and speak with Irsinith at the Hill of the Mother. She will want to know about how the Pale Blight is consuming Laivárth.","Fate of the Moulder-wood, Part 4","You see someone mourning near the tree"}},
[5088]={nameES="Fate of the Moulder-wood, Part 5",objectivesES={"You have gathered sap from Amûma. Return to Irsinith with it so that she can show you the signs of the Pale Blight.","Fate of the Moulder-wood, Part 5","Irsinith has asked you to gather sap from the trunk of the mother tree and return it to her so that she can show you how the Pale Blight is rotting within.","Bring the sap from the mother tree to Irsinith"}},
[5089]={nameES="Fate of the Moulder-wood, Part 6",objectivesES={"Speak with Dáthlil","You found the chieftains of Sul Madásh. Speak with Dáthlil and bring her the news of the Pale Blight from her daughter, Irsinith.","Fate of the Moulder-wood, Part 6","You found the chieftains of Sul Madásh. Dáthlil has asked you to speak with her husband Ildimár and learn more about the settlement.","You see the chieftains of Sul Madásh engaged in a discussion","Speak with Ildimár","Find the chieftains in Sul Madásh","Irsinith has asked you to travel to Sul Madásh and speak with the chieftains there. They will want to know of the Pale Blight's effect on Amûma and Laivárth."}},
[5090]={nameES="Fate of the Moulder-wood, Part 7",objectivesES={"<rgb=#00FF00>Look</rgb> out over the lands of Adagím","Ildimár has asked that you look out over the lands of Adagím from where they stand so you can see how bad the Pale Blight has ravaged the land.","The lands outside of Sul Madásh appear endless and covered in fungal rot","Ildimár has told you that Rangers from the north arrived in Sul Madásh to fight back the Pale Blight and could likely use your help.","Fate of the Moulder-wood, Part 7","You have seen just how far the Pale Blight has spread through Adagím and how so little of it remains unspoiled. You should speak with Ildimár now that you know more of what they are up against.","Speak with Ildimár","Speak with Faeron"}},
[5091]={nameES="Fate of the Moulder-wood, Part 8",objectivesES={"Fate of the Moulder-wood, Part 8","Speak with Viznak about the serum","Return to Viznak with the serum ingredients","Faeron has asked you to help the Rangers to craft a serum against the Pale Blight by assisting Viznak in concocting it.","You have gathered the requested ingredients for the potion. Return to Viznak in Sul Madásh so he can begin crafting the concoction.","Viznak informed you about the plan for the Pale Blight potion and asked that you gather the needed ingredients from near Sul Madásh."}},
[5092]={nameES="Fate of the Moulder-wood, Part 9",objectivesES={}},
[5093]={nameES="Fate of the North",objectivesES={}},
[5094]={nameES="Father of Our Lament",objectivesES={"Talk to Lhudd at the Hall of Sanctuary","Talk to Cadelhin at Crug Cadelhin","Cadelhin is at Crug Cadelhin in the Lich Bluffs.\
\
You should talk to Cadelhin when you are ready to travel into Crug Fernvael to confront Cadelhin's father.","Deep within the forgotten barrows of the Lich Bluffs lies Crug Fernvael, the tomb of Cadelhin's father. His defeat might lead to his people's freedom from an ancient curse.","Father of Our Lament","Lhudd is at the Hall of Sanctuary in the Lich Bluffs.\
\
Following Fernvael's defeat, many shades have been released from their ancient curse. You should return to Lhudd with the news."}},
[5095]={nameES="Father, Husband, Son",objectivesES={"Collect Ránmald's pendant","Céolstan, son of Aldstan, husband of Ránmald, and father of an unborn child, has been slain by Orcs, sacrificing himself so that the women of Byre Tor could escape.","Céolstan can be found between Byre Tor and the refugees' cave.\
\
You should lay Céolstan to rest.","You ask the wife of Aldstan's son if she wishes to lay a tribute at Céolstan's grave.\
\
Ránmald closes her eyes sadly, and for a few moments seems unable to speak. At last she gives a quiet answer.\
\
'This pendant. He gave it to me, and I have treasured it always. If it is buried with him, it will be a part of me that lies with him....'","The man strains as he looks at you, clearly in pain from his wound.\
\
'It is too late to save me, stranger, but... I am glad you have come. You can help us.\
\
'But first, there is something I would have you do. I cannot... do it myself, and I cannot send Ránmald in her condition. My son lies behind us, dead in the snow, where he fought off Orcs so that these women could steal away.\
\
'Will you lay him to rest? My sword is just here... I will not need it anymore. Lay --lay it with him.'","Ránmald wishes to place a cherished pendant upon her husband's grave","You have buried Céolstan","Ránmald can be found in the refugees' cave in the northern High Knolls.\
\
You should ask Ránmald if there is anything she wishes to bury with her husband.","Aldstan can be found in the refugees' cave in the northern High Knolls.","Father, Husband, Son","Return to Aldstan","Lay Céolstan to rest","Collected Ránmald's pendant","Ránmald's pendant can be found in the refugees' cave in the High Knolls.\
\
You should collect Ránmald's pendant.","Céolstan can be found between Byre Tor and the refugees' cave.\
\
You should find Céolstan, and lay him to rest.","Here lies brave Céolstan, who sacrificed himself so that the survivors could escape","Here lies Céolstan, son, husband, and father of Byre Tor survivors.\
\
It is clear from the carnage strewn about him that he was brave and strong. Not many men could have felled so many hale Orcs.\
\
He sacrificed himself so that the women of Byre Tor could escape.","Pick up Aldstan's sword","Ask Ránmald for a tribute to lay at her husband's grave","Collected Aldstan's sword","Find Céolstan's body near Byre Tor","Aldstan's sword sits beside him at the refugees' cave in the High Knolls, north of Byre Tor.\
\
You should collect Aldstan's sword to bury it with his son."}},
[5096]={nameES="Fathomwell Fishing",objectivesES={"Tarax is across the Fathomwell from Hûmaz.","Talk to Tarax on the other side of the Fathomwell","Talk to Hûmaz on the other side of the Fathomwell","Fathomwell Fishing","Hûmaz is across the Fathomwell from Tarax.","The Fathomwell cisterns provide water for the rest of the city, but that is no reason for local fishermen to avoid plumbing its depths for their dinners.","You are reasonably certain that is not the case, but you might talk to Tarax again"}},
[5097]={nameES="Fauna Investigation",objectivesES={"Defeated swarming plague-flies","Defeated Agarnaith gore-crow","After completing your survey of the area, you conclude that the animals of Agarnaith are quite dangerous. They all seem to be infected with some sort of disease, driving them into a ravenous frenzy. You will include this note in your scouting report.","Defeat infectious plague-rat","Completado.","Completado","Defeat plagued dire-wolf","Fauna Investigation","Derrota un cuervo sangriento de Agarnaith","Defeat diseased swamp-boar","Defeated plagued dire-wolf","Defeated infectious plague-rat","Since Agarnaith is primarily marshland, it has the potential to contain many dangerous animals. You should investigate before proceeding deeper.","Animals can be found in southern Agarnaith.\
\
You should defeat one of each different animal you find.","Defeated diseased swamp-boar","Defeat swarming plague-flies"}},
[5098]={nameES="Fear Without Name",objectivesES={}},
[5099]={nameES="Miedo al Colapso",objectivesES={"Los rascacuevas se encuentran a lo largo de la ladera al oeste de Edhelion, dispersos cerca de la entrada y dentro del Abismo de Plata.\
\
Orodlin te pidió que derrotaras rascacuevas en toda la Puerta de Thorin y entregaras el mensaje a Bogi en el Patio de Frerin.","Habla con Bogi en el Patio de Frerin","Miedo al Colapso","La piedra bajo la Puerta de Thorin está llena de madrigueras de rascacuevas. Si el daño continúa, toda el área podría debilitarse lo suficiente como para colapsar.","Bogi se encuentra en el centro de la Puerta de Thorin, en el Patio de Frerin, al oeste de Edhelion, en el centro del valle."}},
[5100]={nameES="Miedo a la muerte",objectivesES={"Examine a fallen Corsair","The Corsairs' hideout can be found in north-central Dor-en-Ernil along the mountainside.\
\
You have encountered two Corsairs fleeing south-east of Dol Brannor. You should search the nearby mountainside for their hideout.","Slain Corsairs litter the ground nearby","Miedo a la muerte","Search the cave for more Corsairs","Search for the cave the Corsairs mentioned as they fled","You have found a cave tucked into the hillside and should explore it further","Corsairs flee nearby, paying you little attention as they pass...","Corsairs have fled into the hills of Dor-en-Ernil, hinting that their forces may be beginning to regroup further from Linhir.","This fallen Corsair curiously bears no wounds. Stranger still, a mixture of surprise and fear are readily apparent in his face, hinting that he and his men were taken unawares by some unknown foe.","Search for the Corsair hideout to the north-west","DNT -- will not be seen","The slain Corsair can be found on the ground of the Corsair cave in north-central Dor-en-Ernil.\
\
You have found naught but slain Corsairs in the cave and should examine their bodies to determine what has occurred.","The Corsairs' hideout can be found somewhere to the north-west of Hata Khezrat along the mountainside.\
\
Gorroch has asked you to track the Corsairs into the hills in hopes of disrupting them.","The Corsairs' hideout can be found in northern central Dor-en-Ernil.\
\
You have found the Corsairs' cave and should now search it for any sign of Corsairs."}},
[5101]={nameES="Fear of Famine",objectivesES={}},
[5102]={nameES="Fearsome Felines",objectivesES={"Bring the pelts to Turizi","Servals and caracals can be found prowling about the rice fields of Ekagar in Ambarûl. You should defeat some and bring their pelts to Turizi.","Fearsome Felines","You have defeated servals and caracals prowling about the rice fields of Ekagar. You should bring their pelts to Turizi behind the farmhouse.","Turizi has asked you to slay some of the wild cats worrying his mother."}},
[5103]={nameES="Preparación de festín - Pasteles de Nueve Estrellas",objectivesES={"Habla con el líder del Gremio de Cocineros en Minas Morgul","Habla con Aesseledh","Preparación de festín - Pasteles de Nueve Estrellas","Las recetas de artesanía que debes crear se pueden encontrar en tu panel de artesanía.\
\
Hornea quince porciones de Pastel de Nueve Estrellas."}},
[5104]={nameES="Preparación de festín - Pan de viaje relleno",objectivesES={"El líder del Gremio de Cocineros te ha pedido que hornees pan de viaje con varios rellenos. ¿Cuál es tu favorito?","Habla con el líder del Gremio de Cocineros en Minas Morgul","Las recetas de artesanía que debes crear se pueden encontrar en tu panel de artesanía.\
\
Hornea tres tipos diferentes de pan de viaje, cinco piezas de cada uno.","Preparación de festín - Pan de viaje relleno","Habla con Aesseledh"}},
[5105]={nameES="Preparación de festín - Verduras",objectivesES={"Habla con el líder del Gremio de Cocineros en Minas Morgul","Al líder del Gremio de Cocineros le gustaría ver cómo prepararías verduras mixtas.","Preparación de festín - Verduras","Las recetas de artesanía que debes crear se pueden encontrar en tu panel de artesanía.\
\
Cocina veinticinco porciones de verduras a medio cocer.","Habla con Aesseledh"}},
[5106]={nameES="Preparación de festín - Masa de pan de viaje",objectivesES={"Preparación de festín - Masa de pan de viaje","Habla con el líder del Gremio de Cocineros en Minas Morgul","Las recetas de artesanía que debes crear se pueden encontrar en tu panel de artesanía.\
\
Prepara veinticinco porciones de masa de pan de viaje.","Al líder del Gremio de Cocineros le gustaría que intentaras preparar masa de pan de viaje usando una receta antigua.","Habla con Aesseledh"}},
[5107]={nameES="Banquete del Bosque Salvaje",objectivesES={"Habla con Minda Matosos","Los ingredientes para el banquete se pueden encontrar en el Bosque Salvaje.\
\
Minda Matosos necesita ayuda para reunir los ingredientes para un gran banquete.","Delicias del Bosque Salvaje completada","Banquete del Bosque Salvaje","Minda se encuentra en un campamento en el sur del Bosque Salvaje.\
\
Deberías hablar con Minda Matosos.","Ya han encontrado el poni y el carro de Minda Matosos, pero ella todavía tiene una tarea que cumplir: reunir los ingredientes para el banquete de su señora."}},
[5108]={nameES="Feasting on the Forest",objectivesES={"Gredbyg devour and rot trees from below, striking fear into your Huorn companion and threatening Fangorn Forest.","Talk to Quickbeam's Huorn","As you wander Fangorn Forest, the Huorn travelling with you suddenly seems disturbed. It swiftly strikes a nearby stump with one of its roots causing numerous gredbyg to pour forth. It quickly crushes all of their number, but still appears upset.\
\
You should search rotting stumps for more gredbyg and slay them before they can spread rot deeper into Fangorn.","Gredbyg can be found under rotting stumps throughout southern Fangorn.\
\
The Huorn has expressed naught but contempt for the gredbyg chewing upon the trees of Fangorn. You should defeat them.","DNT -- Players will not see","Feasting on the Forest","You have defeated many gredbyg and stopped them from causing more damage to Fangorn.","The Huorn's anger seems to have subsided, and the gredbyg are no longer able to devour Fangorn from below, at least for the moment."}},
[5109]={nameES="Feather Fetch",objectivesES={"Return to Paguri with the pristine feathers","Feather Fetch","Returned to Paguri with the pristine feathers","Paguri in Ub Nashir has asked you to gather feathers from nearby birds so that she can replenish her stock of arrows.","Bring the pristine feathers back to Paguri in Ub Nishir.","Paguri in Ub Nishir has asked you to gather feathers from birds in Urash Dâr so that she can replenish her stock of arrows."}},
[5110]={nameES="Feather for His Cap",objectivesES={}},
[5111]={nameES="Enemigos emplumados",objectivesES={"Hannar está en Othrikar.\
\
Lograste encontrar al Montaraz que Hannar te pidió buscar, y él te sugirió que buscaras el lugar de anidación de los hendrevail. Debes regresar con Hannar con esta información.","Habla con Hannar en Othrikar","Habla con Orthonn en Ost Lagoros","Enemigos emplumados","A pesar de tus esfuerzos, la amenaza de los hendrevail sigue siendo una plaga en las colinas alrededor de Othrikar.","Orthonn está recogiendo hierbas en Dehesa del rey, probablemente en su campamento en las Ruinas De ost lagoros al noroeste de la Granja de gatson, algo al sur y Oeste de othrikar.\
\
Hannar explicó que su gente no sabía lo suficiente sobre los hendrevail como para saber cómo enfrentarse a ellos, ya que cazarlos no Parecía funcionar. te pidió que hablaras con un Cazador llamado orthonn, que podría tener información sobre estas aves."}},
[5112]={nameES="Feathers for Friendship",objectivesES={"Pristine feathers might be found in the nests of the crebain at Pluvun Gwern, north-east of Echad Saeradan.\
\
Amlan has asked you to collect pristine feathers to trade to the Algraig of Enedwaith.","The Rangers of the Grey Company seek to acquire the good will of the Uch-lûth, the Dunlending clan inhabiting Enedwaith.","Feathers for Friendship","Saeradan is at Echad Saeradan in the Windfells of Enedwaith, south-west of Pluvun Gwern.\
\
Amlan told you to take the craban-feathers to Saeradan to be prepared for delivery to the Algraig.","Bring the craban-feathers to Saeradan at Echad Saeradan"}},
[5113]={nameES="Feathers of the Flock",objectivesES={"The hill of Cracabor is the highest point in the Wold, and is located just north of the Twickenburg.\
\
You should climb Cracabor and collect feathers from the evil flock that has landed there.","Bring the feathers to Sergeant Tidlac","The hill of Cracabor is covered in spying crebain that intimidate the surrounding lands with their sinister gazes.","Feathers of the Flock","Kill a spying craban","Sergeant Tidlac is keeping watch on the road from the fort of Twickenburg, between Harwick and Floodwend.\
\
You should bring the feathers to Sergeant Tidlac."}},
[5114]={nameES="Plumas del Bosque Salvaje",objectivesES={"Alguien ha puesto una tarea para recoger plumas en el Bosque Salvaje.","Encontrarás una caja de almacenamiento en el Embarcadero de los Comerciantes o en Puente de Caballetes.\
\
Debes guardar las plumas en una caja de almacenamiento.","Plumas del Bosque Salvaje","Coloca las plumas en la caja de almacenamiento","En el Bosque Salvaje se pueden encontrar plumas en los pájaros.\
\
Deberías recoger plumas.","El anuncio del tablón dice:\
\
'Se necesita: plumas del Bosque Salvaje para obras y reparaciones. Se recompensará su esfuerzo.'"}},
