[5219]={nameES="Feed for the Horses",objectivesES={"Feed for the Horses","Éogar is found by the stables of the horse-farm.","Return to Éogar with the grain","There are many bags and sacks of grain spread around the main buildings of Hengstacer Farm.","Éogar can always use more help on his farm, and today he needs help feeding the horses.","The grain was mouldy and unfit for horses.","Se te ha acabado el tiempo"}},
[5220]={nameES="Feeding A Village",objectivesES={"Umaris has asked for your help feeding the village using the large, fierce crabs south of Khûtra. Perhaps Elder Roshat will see your value once you've helped the village.","Return with crab meat to Umaris","Large crabs can be found to the south-east of Khûtra. Go there and return with crab meat to feed the hungry villagers.","Feeding A Village"}},
[5221]={nameES="Feeding Boars",objectivesES={}},
[5222]={nameES="Frenesí Alimenticio",objectivesES={"Es extraño que los rascacuevas hayan salido en masa de sus cuevas hacia la luz del sol. Quizás algo los ha impulsado a un frenesí alimenticio.","Frenesí Alimenticio","Reduce el número de rascacuevas en el Bosque de los Trolls Sur, ya que son una amenaza para todos en su estado actual de frenesí.","Has matado a muchos rascacuevas en el Bosque de los Trolls Sur y has vuelto a hacer seguro el camino para los viajeros.","DNT -- Will not be seen","Derrota rascacuevas en el Bosque de los Trolls Sur","Completado","Has derrotado a muchos rascacuevas en el Bosque de los Trolls Sur","Los rascacuevas se encuentran por todo el Bosque de los Trolls Sur, pero especialmente en Ost Dúrgonn, al norte del camino y del campamento de Barachen.\
\
Reduce el número de rascacuevas en el Bosque de los Trolls Sur, ya que son una amenaza para todos en su estado actual de frenesí."}},
[5223]={nameES="Feeding Garsfeld",objectivesES={"Aid Bernwyn","Gísil wants you to aid the people of Garsfeld with various tasks that he believes will help restabilise the town.\
\
Agelric and Bernwyn can be found in the centre of Garsfeld, while Gísling can be found inside the mead-hall of Garsfeld.","Aid Agelric","Talk to Gísil","Gísil can be found inside the mead-hall of Garsfeld.","Gísil has expressed concern for the folk of Garsfeld. He and his men have kept the invaders at bay, but the crofters are too afraid to return to their work. Gísil hopes you can help the people of Garsfeld by aiding them with various tasks.","Aid Gísling","Feeding Garsfeld"}},
[5224]={nameES="Feeding a Small Army",objectivesES={"Bring the meat back to Ningêna at Sûru","Feeding a Small Army","Ningêna would like more meat added to their stockpile at Sûru.","You have hunted fen-wallowers and collected their meat. You should bring it to Ningêna in Sûru.","Shegdush, located east of Sûru, has a sizable wild boar population. You should go there and hunt fen-wallowers for Ningêna."}},
[5225]={nameES="Feeding the Company",objectivesES={"Andreg is at Echad Saeradan in the Windfells of Enedwaith.\
\
You should bring the meat you collected to Andreg.","Dun oxen can be found throughout the Windfells.\
\
Andreg has asked you to hunt the dun oxen of the Windfells for meat. He warned you not to harm the domesticated oxen of the Uch-lûth.","Feeding the Company","The Rangers of the Grey Company are running short of provisions and seek ways to supplement their remaining supplies.","Bring ox-meat to Andreg at Echad Saeradan"}},
[5226]={nameES="Feeding the Company -- Repeatable",objectivesES={"Andreg is at Echad Saeradan in the Windfells of Enedwaith.\
\
You should bring the ox-meat you collected to Andreg.","The Rangers of the Grey Company are running short of provisions and seek ways to supplement their remaining supplies.","Dun oxen can be found throughout the Windfells.\
\
Andreg has asked you to once more hunt the dun oxen of the Windfells, but warned you not to harm the herds of the Uch-lûth.","Feeding the Company -- Repeatable","Bring ox-meat to Andreg at Echad Saeradan"}},
[5227]={nameES="Alimentar a las vacas",objectivesES={"Gerardo Hoyondo está en los corrales de la Granja de Cotonorte.\
\
Gerardo Hoyondo se alegrará de saber que se han llenado los pesebres.","Una de las atracciones principales del mercado agrícola de Cotonorte es su zona para acariciar animales.","Alimentar a las vacas","Las musarañas y los sacos de pienso se encuentran cerca de Gerardo Hoyondo en la Granja de Cotonorte.\
\
Gerardo Hoyondo te ha pedido que recojas los sacos de pienso y ahuyentes a las musarañas que los están robando.","Los pesebres están en los corrales de la Granja de Cotonorte.\
\
Hay que echar el pienso en los pesebres para las vacas.","Habla con Gerardo Hoyondo"}},
[5228]={nameES="Feeding the Forge",objectivesES={}},
[5229]={nameES="Feeding the Front Line",objectivesES={"Sighild holds out a honey cake.\
\
'Oh, this isn't for you. I apologize if you thought I was giving this honey cake to you, I am just proud of this batch, is all. This is a special, and exceptionally hearty recipe that would keep a fighting dwarf full for a day! Hmm, are you venturing out into battle yourself? Would you take these honey cakes with you and deliver them to the hungry dwarves on the front lines? I would be most thankful!'","You have successfully delivered many of Sighild's honey cakes to hungry dwarves on the front lines of the battlefield. Those brave fighting dwarves will not forget all that you have done to assist in the war effort.","Delivered many honey cakes to hungry dwarves.","Completado","Hungry dwarves can be found on the front lines of the battlefield.\
\
You should deliver honey cakes to hungry dwarves.","Feeding the Front Line","The Beorning Sighild has prepared a batch of war-time honey cakes to feed those on the front line."}},
[5230]={nameES="Alimentando a los necesitados",objectivesES={"Puedes encontrar alces por toda la región de Länsi-mâ.\
\
Ríki te ha pedido que ayudes a reabastecer los almacenes de Zigilgund con carne de alce.","Alimentando a los necesitados","Ríki está preocupado por las escasas provisiones para sus mineros hambrientos.","Lleva los cuartos traseros de alce a Ríki en Zigilgund"}},
[5231]={nameES="Abasteciendo el Puesto",objectivesES={"Los osos pueden encontrarse en las tierras salvajes alrededor de Gondamon, especialmente hacia el norte.\
\
Gafí te ha pedido que consigas carne de oso para ayudar a llenar las reservas de Gondamon para los meses venideros.","Abasteciendo el Puesto","Gafí, el proveedor de Gondamon, te ha pedido ayuda para reunir provisiones para el invierno.","Lleva la carne de oso a Gafí en Gondamon."}},
[5232]={nameES="Feeding the Pigs",objectivesES={"Talk to Mileth","You have fed all the pigs you could find around Glaniath.\
\
You should talk to Mileth.","Mileth has asked you to help her feed the pigs wandering around Glaniath.","It's meal time for the pigs of Glaniath.","Feeding the Pigs"}},
[5233]={nameES="Feeding the Sail-haven",objectivesES={"The Sail-haven of Umbar Baharbêl is filled with skilled shipmen who toil to better the Free City in the aftermath of the Sea-stone Mutiny.","Talk to Zemirah at the Sailors' Guild-hall","Feeding the Sail-haven","Hungry shipmen can be found throughout the Sail-haven, especially on its piers and near its canals.\
\
Zemirah has asked you to deliver meals to hungry shipmen in the Sail-haven.","Zemirah can be found at the Sailors' Guild-hall in the Sail-haven of Umbar Baharbêl.\
\
You have delivered meals to many of the shipmen labouring in the Sail-haven. You should return to Zemirah."}},
[5234]={nameES="Feeding the Starved",objectivesES={}},
[5235]={nameES="Feeding the War Effort",objectivesES={"Harvest oranges and defeat zizani at Burukíri.","Speak with Zilêndu, a farmer in Ambarûl. Zilêndu can be found at Burukíri, an orchard north of Iridír.","Give the harvested grain and oranges to Zilêndu, the Ambarûli farmer.","Harvest grain in the northern field near the orchard in Ambarûl.","Speak with Mizâdi in Iridír","Speak with Zilêndu at Burukíri","Mizâdi has asked you to assist the local Ambarûli in procuring supplies to feed the soldiers gathered in Iridír.","Speak with Mizâdi in Iridír.","Give the harvested oranges to Zilêndu, the Ambarûli farmer","Feeding the War Effort"}},
[5236]={nameES="Fell Experiments",objectivesES={"Fell Experiments","Search the testing camp","An Angmarim tent!","Search for more clues","Find Mother Amma in Hagbuth","You found a journal!","You found a torn fragment of paper","Busca pistas","Someone has been experimenting on the Wargs of Clovengap and creating even more dangerous abominations.","Mother Amma is in Hagbuth, in south-eastern Clovengap.\
\
You found a fragment of torn paper and a journal detailing sarrowstones experiments. You should bring the journal and paper fragment to Mother Amma.","The Angmarim camp is in south-west Clovengap.\
\
You have discovered an Angmarim camp where a sorceress is conducting experiments on the local Wargs.","Search for the testing site","Warg dens can be found in western Clovengap.\
\
Mother Amma has asked for you search for clues around the Warg dens.","More cages and Angmarim!","A cage! You must be close!","Defeat the Angmarim sorceress","Clues can be found in the upper tiers of south-west Clovengap.\
\
You should continue to look for clues as to how the crystal-encrusted Wargs are being created."}},
[5237]={nameES="Fell Servants",objectivesES={}},
[5238]={nameES="Espíritus caídos",objectivesES={"Habla con Hartrim","Espíritus caídos","Las mismas aguas de Agamaur se han levantado para proteger a Ivar y a la Doncella Roja, animadas por los espíritus caídos de Morgoth que han regresado del más allá.","Las Aguasombrías se encuentran en la zona de Garth Agarwen. \
\
Hartrim te ha pedido que le ayudes a apaciguar al espíritu de Agamaur, Dannasen, destruyendo los espíritus caídos que corrompen las tierras de Garth Agarwen.","Hartrim se encuentra en la entrada de la zona de Agamaur llamada Garth Agarwen.\
\
Los aguasoscuras tienen el poder de infundir miedo incluso en los espectros malditos de Arthedain, impidiéndoles avanzar hacia Garth Agarwen y cumplir su maldición. A petición de Hartrim, fuiste a destruirlas y tuviste cierto éxito. Deberías volver con Hartrim para informarle de tu victoria."}},
[5239]={nameES="Invocaciones infames",objectivesES={"Reúne piedras rúnicas de los invocadores kergrim dentro de las Tumbas de Khâb Ishil.","Derrota a Zâkrat el Susurrador","Zâkrat el Susurrador, líder de los kergrim, ataca a aquellos que han frustrado sus planes.","Derrota a los espíritus crueles que han sido invocados en las Tumbas de Khâb Ishil.","Cuando el último espíritu cruel cae, Zâkrat el Susurrador entra en las Tumbas de Khâb Ishil y te desafía","Derrota a los espíritus crueles que se acercan","Invocaciones infames","Los kergrim no solo profanan las tumbas de Khâb Ishil, sino que también las utilizan para invocar espíritus crueles al mundo.\
\
Encuentra una forma de interrumpir el ritual y acabar con esta amenaza.","Zâkrat el Susurrador derrotado","Disipa los escudos de sombra que protegen los altares de ritual con las piedras rúnicas que has reunido dentro de las Tumbas de Khâb Ishil."}},
[5240]={nameES="Fell the Banners",objectivesES={"Talk to Lhucu at her hut","Lhucu is at her hut, north of Lhan Bach.\
\
You should return to Lhucu and let her know that the standards have been destroyed.","Trehéarn Brenin's banners fly in Lhan Bach, south of Lhucu's hut.\
\
Lhucu has asked you to tear down her father's standards that now hang throughout the village of Lhan Bach.","Heartened by the potential allegiance of the elders of Lhan Bach, Lhucu proposes a plan to liberate the village.","Fell the Banners"}},
[5241]={nameES="Fell the Fallen",objectivesES={"Fell the Fallen","Sâd Doldúr lies to the south of Barad Angol.\
\
Himeinior has asked you to find and dispatch several fell spirits near Sâd Doldúr and collect tokens of their allegiance.","Among the ruins on the eastern border of the Ashenslades, fell spirits from beyond the Void have risen and wander the area.","Habla con Himeinior","Himeinior is at Barad Angol, north and up the mountain from Sâd Doldúr.\
\
You should return to Himeinior with the tokens you collected from the fell spirits of Sâd Doldúr."}},
[5242]={nameES="Fell to Despair",objectivesES={}},
[5243]={nameES="Talando árboles",objectivesES={"Mattie Bosquerudo y Noll Tobbit deben encontrarse en algún lugar del Camino Verde al norte de Puente de Caballetes.\
\
Elsie te ha dicho que no ha tenido noticias ni de su marido Mattie o de Noll Tobbit, su hermano, desde que se marcharon y te ha pedido que los busques.","Elsie Bosquerudo te ha dicho que su marido, Mattie, y su hermano, Noll, dejaron Puente de Caballetes para ir en busca de árboles que talar para las barricadas.","Talando árboles"}},
[5244]={nameES="Fence Repair",objectivesES={"You should tell Miruhir that you have finished repairing the fence.\
\
Miruhir can be found in Iáphel.","Miruhir has asked you to repair fences around a section of vineyard in Iáphel.\
\
The broken fences can be found on the western hill of Iáphel.","Talk to Miruhir","Fence Repair","There are broken sections of fence in Iáphel that need mending."}},
[5245]={nameES="Feral Shadow",objectivesES={"The Fang of Shadows stalks the area outside the Black Dens, south-east of Echad Dagoras.\
\
Amarion has asked you to hunt the Fang of Shadows, leader of the Shadow-wolves in the Black Dens.","Among the fell spirits which have taken form as Shadow-wolves, there is one that is more dangerous than all the rest.","Defeat the Fang of Shadows","You have defeated the Fang of Shadows","Amarion is at Echad Dagoras, north-west of the Black Dens.\
\
You should speak with Amarion and let him know that you have defeated the Fang of Shadows, but that the power of the Black Dens seems unbroken.","Talk to Amarion at Echad Dagoras","Feral Shadow"}},
[5246]={nameES="Ferndúr el Virulento",objectivesES={"Habla con Throst","Ferndúr el Virulento","Has encontrado la guarida de Ferndúr","Throst cree que el hechicero Ferndúr se preocupa por los espíritus malignos que habitan la zona no muy lejos del Caldero de la Muerte.","Throst está de vuelta en Gath Forthnir, al este de la guarida de Ferndúr.\
\
Con Ferndúr muerto, debes regresar a Throst para contarle la historia de tus hazañas.","Haz salir y derrota a Ferndúr","Hay espíritus malignos en una zona en ruinas no muy lejos del Caldero de la Muerte, en la isla central de Imlad Balchorth.\
\
Ferndúr debe ser destruido para dispersar la amenaza maligna en esta tierra maldita."}},
[5247]={nameES="Festival - Chicken Chasing League of Eriador",objectivesES={}},
[5248]={nameES="Festival - The Ale Association",objectivesES={}},
[5249]={nameES="Festival - The Inn League",objectivesES={}},
[5250]={nameES="Boleto del festival",objectivesES={"Habla con Gredlan Artemisa.","Habla con Gredlan Artemisa","Una vez al día, Gredlan Artemisa puede darte un boleto del festival.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro cuando finalice el festival actual.</rgb>","Boleto del festival"}},
[5251]={nameES="Festival Token Allowance",objectivesES={}},
[5252]={nameES="Pocos se atreven",objectivesES={"Gailthin se encuentra en la ciudad enana de Gondamon, en las tierras bajas de Ered Luin.\
\
Golhador te ha pedido que muestres los anillos de defensa al emisario Gailthin.","Gailthin la Elfa fue emisaria ante los gigantes en tiempos más felices, y es una de las pocas personas que podría entender el significado de los anillos de defensa que has recuperado.","Pocos se atreven","Lleva los anillos de defensa a Gailthin"}},
[5253]={nameES="Field of Thieves",objectivesES={}},
[5254]={nameES="Fields Aflame",objectivesES={"Tolwin can be found in the hall of Crithost.\
\
You should speak with Tolwin.","Tolwin has asked you to mitigate the damage done to crops north of Cirthost by putting out fires in the fields, then collect any supplies that haven't been burned by the enemy.","Supplies can be found around the farm houses in Parth Lisc.\
\
Now that the fires are dealt with, you should recover any supplies from the farm.","Bring the supplies for Tolwin","You've gathered water to put out the fires!","Fields Aflame","Fires can be found in the fields near Parth Lisc.\
\
You should put out fires in the fields."}},
[5255]={nameES="Fields of Danger",objectivesES={"Talk to Sûlmur","Sûlmur has offered you a reward for defeating crocodiles and zizani, what the locals call Neekers, in the papyrus fields at Mehêtur in Ambarûl.","You have defeated crocodiles and zizani in the papyrus fields. You should return to Sûlmur north-east of the fields.","Fields of Danger","Sûlmur has trouble with aggressive crocodiles and Neekers lurking among the papyrus reeds."}},
[5256]={nameES="Fields of Uncertainty",objectivesES={"Fields of Uncertainty","Return to Osin in Faldham","Farmers can be found all around the Mead Hall of Faldham, at their individual farmsteads.\
\
Osin has asked you to seek the various farmers around Faldham and to lend them what aid you can.","Osin has concerned himself with the unreadiness of the crofters around Faldham for the impending siege. He prepares his body for battle, while his mind lingers on the affairs of the crofters.","Osin prepares outside the Mead Hall at the centre of Faldham.\
\
The farmer's troubles have been put to rest, and Osin may now focus on his own problems."}},
[5257]={nameES="Fiendish Foes",objectivesES={"Fiendish Foes","Ingi is at Ost Ringdyr, south of Grothum.\
\
With the goblins dispatched, the time has come to return to Ingi.","Lieutenant Ingi explained that the Snowreap goblins are the same who inhabit Goblin-town and the bulk of the Misty Mountains. He knows that they are an ally to Angmar and wants to see their numbers culled.","There are Snowreap-guards and sappers at Grothum, north of Ost Ringdyr.\
\
Lieutenant Ingi wishes to cull the Snowreap goblins from the Ettenmoors and weaken the forces which Angmar can bring to bear against the Free Peoples."}},
[5258]={nameES="Fierce Resistance",objectivesES={}},
[5259]={nameES="Fight For Zajâna, Part 1",objectivesES={}},
[5260]={nameES="Fight For Zajâna, Part 2",objectivesES={}},
[5261]={nameES="Fight For Zajâna, Part 3",objectivesES={}},
[5262]={nameES="Fight For Zajâna, Part 4",objectivesES={}},
[5263]={nameES="Fight For Zajâna, Part 5",objectivesES={}},
[5264]={nameES="Fight For Zajâna, Part 6",objectivesES={}},
[5265]={nameES="Fight For Zajâna, Part 7",objectivesES={}},
[5266]={nameES="Fight For Zajâna, Part 8",objectivesES={}},
[5267]={nameES="Fight for the Grey",objectivesES={"Complete each of the Grey Mountain instances, on any difficulty level, weekly. The scaling instance cluster can be found in the Instance Join panel.","Fight for the Grey","Complete scaling instances in the Grey Mountains.","Complete the Caverns of Thrumfall Instance","Complete the Thikil-gundu Instance","Completa la instancia El Brilloprofundo","Join forces in the struggle to hold the Grey Mountains."}},
[5268]={nameES="Luchar o Huir — Repetible",objectivesES={"Permanece con el caballo y usa la emote correcta","Cuéntale a Éogar lo sucedido","El caballo se encuentra afuera, en los Campos de Caballos.","Los caballos pueden ser entrenados y responden a distintos tonos de voz o señales.","Luchar o Huir — Repetible"}},
[5269]={nameES="Fightin' Freebooters",objectivesES={"The second freebooter you spoke to isn't interested in fighting. Talk to Anyâmat about what to do next.\
\
Anyâmat may be summoned by using Anyâmat's whistle from your inventory. Anyâmat may only be summoned while in and around Zamarzîr.","Make friends (2/4)","The third freebooter gave you and Anyâmat some grilled fish. Talk to Anyâmat about what to do next.\
\
Anyâmat may be summoned by using Anyâmat's whistle from your inventory. Anyâmat may only be summoned while in and around Zamarzîr.","Challenge freebooters (0/8)","Anyâmat rushes to your side","The second freebooter you spoke to wasn't interested in fighting. Anyâmat has decided to change strategies and wants to make friends with these freebooters instead.\
\
Freebooters may be found on a tiny island north-west of Halrax.","Anyâmat wants to make friends with all four freebooters on this little island.\
\
Freebooters may be found on a tiny island north-west of Halrax.","The first freebooter you spoke to wasn't interested in fighting. Talk to Anyâmat about what to do next.\
\
Anyâmat may be summoned by using Anyâmat's whistle from your inventory. Anyâmat may only be summoned while in and around Zamarzir.","Make friends (4/4)\
Talk to Anyâmat","Make friends (3/4)\
Talk to Anyâmat","Defeat freebooters (0/8)","Anyâmat has made unexpected friends with the freebooters she was intending to instigate! Talk to Anyâmat about what to do next.\
\
Anyâmat may be summoned by using Anyâmat's whistle from your inventory. Anyâmat may only be summoned while in and around Zamarzîr.","Fightin' Freebooters","Make friends (3/4)","Anyâmat speaks through a mouthful of grilled fish.\
\
'I should go around talking to strangers more often! Instead of fighting you they give you free tea and fish and sing with you. I really like these folks. Come, let's meet the last of their company.'","The first freebooter you spoke to isn't interested in fighting. Try challenging one of her friends.\
\
Freebooters may be found on a tiny island north-west of Halrax.","Anyâmat thinks it would be a great idea to pick fights with random freebooters so that she might experience the rough and tumble life of a sailor.\
\
Willing freebooters may be found on a tiny island north-west of Halrax.","Anyâmat harbours aspirations of being a great shanty-man.","Talk to Anyâmat"}},
[5270]={nameES="Luchando contra la Opresión",objectivesES={"Habla con Corunir en Aughaire","Una carta de un Montaraz oculto en el norte, entre un grupo de montañeses que han rechazado el yugo de Angmar, indica que necesitan ayuda más allá del Ram Dúath.","Aughaire es un campamento de montañeses, al norte a través del Ram Dúath.\
\
La carta de Corunir solicita ayuda para los guerreros que resisten contra los opresores Angmarim.","Luchando contra la Opresión"}},
[5271]={nameES="Fighting Back Against Angmar",objectivesES={}},
[5272]={nameES="Luchando contra el limo con limo",objectivesES={"Un poderoso lagarto ha estado matando mensajeros enanos. Gyrgir desea que atraigas al lagarto y lo elimines.","Derrota a Crestapiedra","Habla con Gyrgir en Hulwul-nefekh","Luchando contra el limo con limo","La comida del lagarto se encuentra en el Abismo Hundido, al oeste de Hulwul-nefekh.\
\
Gyrgir dice que un poderoso lagarto, Crestapiedra, a menudo se alimenta de cadáveres de grodbogs. Ha elaborado un poderoso veneno para espolvorear sobre la comida. Una vez que Crestapiedra lo coma, Gyrgir cree que tendrás una oportunidad de derrotarlo.","Gyrgir se encuentra en Hulwul-nefekh, al este del Abismo Hundido.\
\
Gyrgir estará encantado de saber que su veneno funcionó y que Crestapiedra no devorará más enanos.","Derrotaste a Crestapiedra","Envenena la comida"}},
[5273]={nameES="Luchando en las calles",objectivesES={"Ringlor y el resto de los Dúnedain están luchando una batalla perdida contra los Angmarim que han tomado Annúminas.","Luchando en las calles","Los Angmarim pueden encontrarse por todas partes en las calles de Annúminas, en la orilla suroeste del lago Nenuial.\
\
Ringlor espera que prestando tu ayuda en el combate, puedas ayudar a darle la vuelta a la batalla por Annúminas.","Ringlor está en el campamento de Montaraces en la isla de Tinnudir, en Evendim.\
\
El Montaraz Ringlor te ha pedido que te unas a la batalla contra los Angmarim en la ciudad de Annúminas, y tomes parte en la refriega. Ahora deberías volver con la noticia de tus victorias."}},
[5274]={nameES="Combatiendo a la Camada",objectivesES={"Thoroniel se encuentra en el Bosque de los Trolls Norte, justo al sur de los Valles Trenzados, en la esquina noroeste.\
\
Thoroniel espera saber que has derrotado a las arañas que merodean por los Valles Trenzados.","Combatiendo a la Camada","Thoroniel ha estado vigilando la actividad de las arañas en el Bosque de los Trolls Norte y se ha alarmado por el reciente aumento en su número.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Esta misión está pensada para una comunidad completa.</rgb>","Las arañas han hecho su hogar en los Valles Trenzados del Bosque de los Trolls Norte, al norte del campamento de Thoroniel.\
\
Thoroniel te ha pedido que derrotes a las arañas en los Valles Trenzados, y te recomienda llevar aliados.","Habla con Thoroniel"}},
[5275]={nameES="Luchando contra el hongo",objectivesES={"Ansurr se encuentra en Hulwul-nefekh, en el centro de las Obras Hidráulicas.\
\
Regresa con él para informarle que has ayudado a sus compañeros con sus ideas.","Ayuda a Gyrgir","Los enanos de Hulwul-nefekh tienen muchas ideas y teorías sobre cómo eliminar el hongo.","Habla con Ansurr en Hulwul-nefekh","Ayuda a Ansurr","Luchando contra el hongo","Ansurr y los otros enanos se encuentran en Hulwul-nefekh, en el centro de las Obras Hidráulicas.\
\
Ansurr te ha pedido que ayudes a los otros enanos con sus ideas para combatir el crecimiento malvado.","Ayuda a Thrand"}},
[5276]={nameES="Fil Gashan: el anillo del general",objectivesES={"El general Talug puede encontrarse en Fil Gashan, muy al suroeste de la Sala Vigesimoprimera.\
\
El enano Eilíefr te ha pedido que derrotes al general Talug para demostrar tu valía y que regreses con su anillo cuando lo hayas conseguido.","Devuelve el anillo a Eilíefr en la Sala Vigesimoprimera","Fil Gashan sirve como cuartel y campo de entrenamiento de los orcos de Moria. Tras esos muros, un temible general ha estado preparando a sus tropas para un asalto contra los elfos de Lothlórien, al este de Khazad-dûm. Los enanos de Brogur y Bósi, que desean recuperar Moria, pretenden impedirlo a cualquier precio, pues anhelan que elfos y enanos restauren sus antiguas alianzas en beneficio de ambos pueblos.","Fil Gashan: el anillo del general"}},
[5277]={nameES="Fil Gashan - Debilitar a las fuerzas enemigas",objectivesES={"Regresa con Geirr en la Sala Vigesimoprimera","Fil Gashan sirve como cuartel y campo de entrenamiento de los orcos de Moria. Tras esos muros, un temible general ha estado preparando a sus tropas para un asalto contra los elfos de Lothlórien, al este de Khazad-dûm. Los enanos de Brogur y Bósi, que desean recuperar Moria, pretenden impedirlo a cualquier precio, pues anhelan que elfos y enanos restauren sus antiguas alianzas en beneficio de ambos pueblos.","Fil Gashan - Debilitar a las fuerzas enemigas","El enano Geirr se encuentra al suroeste de la Sala Vigesimoprimera.\
\
El enano Geirr te ha retado a adentrarte en Fil Gashan y derrotar a muchos de los orcos que allí habitan.","El enano Geirr se encuentra en la Sala Vigesimoprimera, al noreste de Fil Gashan.\
\
Geirr querrá saber si has sido lo bastante valiente como para adentrarte en Fil Gashan y pelear contra los orcos."}},
[5278]={nameES="Fil Gashan - Asalto Sigiloso",objectivesES={"Sigurd espera noticias de tu incursión en la Sala Vigesimoprimera, al noreste de Fil Gashan.\
\
El general Talug ha sucumbido ante ti y has logrado pasar entre los centinelas uruk casi sin que te descubriesen. Sigurd querrá saber si has cumplido todas las condiciones de su difícil desafío.","Fil Gashan - Asalto Sigiloso","Fil Gashan está muy al suroeste de la Sala Vigesimoprimera, y el general Talug se encuentra en las profundidades de aquel sitio.\
\
Sigurd te ha retado a que utilices el sigilo y el ingenio para vencer al general Talug, el líder de una gran horda de orcos, sin matar a demasiados de sus centinelas.","General Talug derrotado","Fil Gashan sirve como cuartel y campo de entrenamiento de los orcos de Moria. Tras esos muros, un temible general ha estado preparando a sus tropas para un asalto contra los elfos de Lothlórien, al este de Khazad-dûm. Los enanos de Brogur y Bósi, que desean recuperar Moria, pretenden impedirlo a cualquier precio, pues anhelan que elfos y enanos restauren sus antiguas alianzas en beneficio de ambos pueblos.","Regresa con Sigurd en la Sala Vigesimoprimera","Derrota al general Talug"}},
[5279]={nameES="Filled to the Brim",objectivesES={"Deliver the mugs to Barliman Butterbur at the entrance to the inn.","Barliman Butterbur, proprietor of the Prancing Pony, has found himself pleasantly overwhelmed during Bree's celebration of Midsummer.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This quest will be removed from your quest log when the current festival ends.</rgb>","Drunken revellers and forsaken mugs can be found throughout the Prancing Pony in Bree.\
\
Barliman has asked you to coax drunken revellers off the tables before they can kick more of his crockery into the corners of the Prancing Pony. He has also asked you to gather any mugs abandoned by drunken revellers in unusual spots in the inn.","Filled to the Brim","Deliver the mugs to Barliman Butterbur"}},
[5280]={nameES="Filling Forlong's Shoes",objectivesES={"Baranor can be found at the keep in Arnach.\
\
You have helped Dagor and Indir work against the invading Haradrim, as Baranor asked. Now you should return to Baranor in Arnach.","Filling Forlong's Shoes","Baranor's two captains are busy guarding the town and keeping watch on the Haradrim who have snuck into Lossarnach.","Dagor and Indir can be found at the keep in Arnach.\
\
Baranor has asked you to help his two captains, Dagor and Indir, protect the town from the Haradrim.","Talk to Baranor","Help Dagor and Indir"}},
[5281]={nameES="Filling The Field",objectivesES={"Build one of Virgil's snowmen","In the field outside of Winter-home, select the style of snowman you'd like to build.","Talk to Virgil Greenfield","Filling The Field","Virgil Greenfield needs help filling out the snowman field outside of Winter-home. He has directed you to try your hand at crafting one of his snowmen.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> NOTE: This quest will be removed from your quest log when the current festival ends. </rgb>"}},
[5282]={nameES="Filth and Corruption",objectivesES={"Dudsig is near the stables in Oserley, west of the marshes.\
\
You should return to Dudsig with news of your success.","Filth and Corruption","Defeat Eldnoth","DNT -- Will not be seen","Defeated Eldnoth","The brigand leader may be found in the marshes east of Oserley.\
\
Dudsig has asked you to find and defeat the leader of the brigands who assaulted Lúfa.","You reported the success of your duty at Ordlac's house and delivered the dagger you found to Dudsig.","Talk to Dudsig in Oserley"}},
[5283]={nameES="Filth and Riches",objectivesES={}},
[5284]={nameES="Filth-well: Lost Relics",objectivesES={}},
[5285]={nameES="Filth-well: Remnants of Rauniel",objectivesES={}},
[5286]={nameES="Filth-well: Restoring the Morgulduin",objectivesES={"You have successfully brought these pure waters to the source of the Morgulduin in hopes of beginning the process of purifying the tainted river. You have done a great service to all those working to reclaim Minas Ithil from the remnants of Sauron's forces.","The waters of the Morgulduin are deadly at its source.\
\
You should attempt to purify the deadly waters of the Morgulduin River.","Filth-well: Restoring the Morgulduin","There is much for the White Company to accomplish in reclaiming Minas Ithil from the remnants of Sauron's forces.","Completado"}},
[5287]={nameES="Filthy Thieves",objectivesES={"Sewer rats can be found throughout Ilmabiri, but may be more plentiful in Gedma-ghâr, on the eastern edge.","You have slain many Ilmabiri rats. Return to Gajóta to let him know.","Gajóta, the cook at Hêbatokh, the Morutágya clan hideout, has asked you to do something about the rats that keep getting into their food stores.","Filthy Thieves","Talk to Gajóta"}},
[5288]={nameES="Final Notice",objectivesES={"Aculf wants to make it clear that the brigands are not welcome in the territory of the Riddermark, although he is willing to entertain a peaceful resolution.","Talk to Ulferth at Atburg in the Rushgore","Eowils is outside Atburg in the Rushgore, south-east of Aculf's camp.\
\
Aculf instructed you to bring Ulferth's answer to the scout Eowils.","Talk to Eowils outside Atburg in the Rushgore","Final Notice","Ulferth can be found at the edge of Atburg, south-east of Aculf's camp in the Rushgore.\
\
Aculf asked you to deliver his ultimatum to Ulferth, captain of the treasure-seekers in the Rushgore."}},
[5289]={nameES="Final Rest",objectivesES={"Wights can be found among the cairns east along the road above the Bone Quarry.\
\
Naeglanc has asked you to banish any wights you might find around the cairns in the eastern valley.","Mair can be found in the eastern valley above the Bone Quarry.\
\
Naeglanc asked you to speak with Mair.","Naeglanc and his allies continue to battle the evil wights and spirits which have arisen within the Bonevales.","Final Rest","Talk to Mair among the cairns"}},
[5290]={nameES="Final Stand",objectivesES={"Final Stand","Gárwig, Thrymm and Cyneberg have gathered in the Mead Hall in Forlaw to prepare for the final stand against Núrzum.\
\
Speak with Thrymm and let him know you are ready to end Núrzum's path of destruction once and for all.","Speak with Thrymm","Thrymm has returned to the Forlaw Mead Hall.\
\
You should speak with him after the great victory.","With Thrymm's return, the time to strike Núrzum is now.","Speak with Thrymm in the Forlaw Mead Hall"}},
[5291]={nameES="Encuentra a Malin",objectivesES={"Tu búsqueda de los hijos desaparecidos de Addie encontró los restos de Amlach Trigal, que sostenía el diario de su hermano. Las últimas entradas crípticas parecen revelar que Amlach oyó voces siniestras provenientes de las regiones del sur de las Quebradas de los Túmulos","El diario que encontraste parece indicar que Malin fue llevado al sur de las Quebradas de los Túmulos, a un túmulo que da al pantano maligno.\
\
Addie Trigal te ha pedido que busques a su otro hijo, Malin","Habla con Addie Trigal en el Alto del Hombre Muerto","Malin ha sido derrotado","Busca a Malin","Encuentra a Malin","Al comenzar a examinar a Malin, de pronto el cuerpo se agita...","Addie Trigal espera tu regreso en la relativa seguridad que ofrecen sus guías en el Alto del Hombre Muerto.\
\
En tu búsqueda por las Quebradas de los Túmulos, encontraste a los dos hijos de Addie, Amlach y Malin, pero demasiado tarde para ayudar a cualquiera de los dos. Las criaturas viles de las Quebradas de los Túmulos los habían matado a ambos y tomaron los restos de Malin para sus propios fines. Debes regresar con Addie Trigal y contarle lo que ha sucedido con su hijo."}},
[5292]={nameES="Finding Balance",objectivesES={"You have bid Agalûnu farewell and she asked you to tell her sister Kalkhadra in Iridír that she is all right.","Shanthar has thanked you for all that you have done. He asked you to visit Agalûnu once more to check on her and tell her he will visit soon.","You have done what you can to help restore balance to Arwáth, for both the forest and the people who will now share the burden of caring for it.","Finding Balance","Talk to Agalûnu","Return to Kalkhadra in Iridír"}},
[5293]={nameES="Finding Baradûm",objectivesES={"Check the body to determine if it is Baradûm","Return to Galêris with the news of Baradûm's death.","Return to Galêris with the news of Baradûm's death","You see a body nearby. You should check if it is Baradûm","Finding Baradûm","Search for Baradûm in Jâr Obadal.","Search for clues to Baradûm's whereabouts. Galêris mentioned he was last seen patrolling near the caves of Jâr Obadal. Jâr Obadal can be found south-east of Ingar-garâsh.","Galêris, one of Mizâdi's Subuzûri in Ingar-garâsh, has asked you to rescue her husband Baradûm. Baradûm was last seen patrolling near the cave of Jâr Obadal, home of ravenous spiders.","Search for Baradûm in Jâr Obadal","Check the body to determine if it is Baradûm."}},
[5294]={nameES="Finding Berkha",objectivesES={"Talk to Berkha","The duckling tilts his head at you, as if quietly asking 'Why were you swimming around in that lake?'\
\
When you reach down to pick him up, he happily leaps into your arms.\
\
He's had his fun. It's time to return to Raghda-gûn.","Berkha announced his presence at the shore of Irkhadâr.\
\
Speak to Berkha.","As you approach, Berkha cradled safely in your arms, you see that Raghda-gûn has more guests. One of them, a familiar greasy looking man, lies dazed on the ground, his vacant eyes fixed on the sky above. The other two you may have seen in passing on the streets of Halrax.\
\
'Berkha!' Raghda-gûn shouts as you approach. 'What have I told you about going off on your own?'\
\
Berkha quacks and nips at your sleeve.\
\
'We will speak later, young man.'\
\
Raghda-gûn fixes her clever eyes on you.\
\
'You have my thanks. Now, I believe you know this gentleman taking up space on the ground?'","Finding Berkha","Talk to Raghda-gûn","Find Berkha","Raghda-gûn asked you to find Berkha in Irkhadâr, the caldera lake in Zamarzîr.\
\
Irkhadâr is north of Aklâradum.","You find a few duck feathers. Perhaps Berkha has been nearby","You have found little Berkha and should take him back to Aklâradum.\
\
Aklâradum is on a cliff to the south of Irkhadâr.","Sadly, there is no sign of Berkha","You hear a loud quacking from the lakeside shore.","There is no sign of Berkha here","The little bird, Berkha, has gone missing! His mother, Raghda-gûn, has bid you find him."}},
[5295]={nameES="Finding Blue",objectivesES={"Dírion's dog, Draug, is disheartened after losing his favourite toy, a doll called 'Blue', somewhere in the woods around Alagrant.","Search the traps in the woods around Alagrant for 'Blue'","Finding Blue","Draug can be found in Alagrant, in the Blackroot Vale.\
\
You have found 'Blue' in one of the traps outside Alagrant. You should return 'Blue' to Draug in Alagrant.","Draug howls in excitement and practically snatches 'Blue' from your hand!","The sprung trap can be found outside Alagrant, in the Blackroot Vale.\
\
You have found a small blue object caught in one the traps. You should free 'Blue' from the trap.","Deliver 'Blue' to Draug in Alagrant","Free 'Blue' from the sprung trap","Talk to Dírion","Dírion can be found in Alagrant, in the Blackroot Vale.\
\
You have returned 'Blue' to Draug and he appears pleased. You should talk to Dírion.","A small, colourful object caught in a nearby trap catches your eye. It's 'Blue'!","Traps can be found outside the hamlet of Alagrant, in the Blackroot Vale.\
\
Dírion has asked you to search the traps outside Alagrant for any sign of 'Blue', a beloved toy of his dog, Draug. You should search the traps in the woods around Alagrant.","This trap is empty, and you see no sign of 'Blue'..."}},
[5296]={nameES="En busca de un postre fresco",objectivesES={"En busca de un postre fresco","Recoge bayas ácidas que crecen al oeste de donde Barhador ha acampado en el Ángulo del Mitheithel.","Vuelve con Barhador a su campamento en el Ángulo del Mitheithel con las bayas que has recogido.","Entre otras muchas cosas, Barhador te ha pedido que recojas algunas bayas ácidas mientras estás fuera buscando otras cosas para comer.","Vuelve con Barhador con las bayas ácidas"}},
[5297]={nameES="Finding Healing",objectivesES={"Apply the poultice","Finding Healing","You have collected herbs to make a healing poultice for Agalûnu. You should mash them with the mortar and pestle near Agalûnu's tent.","Talk to Agalûnu","You have made a healing poultice. You should go to Agalûnu and apply it to her wound.","Mix the herbs with a mortar and pestle","Talk to Shanthar","Agalûnu has asked you to collect healing herbs for a poultice. They can be found across the stream to the south-east.","Agalûnu must rest to allow her wound to heal. In the meantime, she asked you to return to Shanthar and reassure him that she intends to keep her promise to help him care for the forest. Shanthar is at his abode in Arwáth.","Agalûnu's wound has re-opened and she worries about a possible infection.","You have made a healing poultice and applied it to Agalûnu's wound. You should talk to her and see how she is doing."}},
[5298]={nameES="Finding Meneldor",objectivesES={"Meneldor has failed to return to the agreed-upon meeting location. Landroval grows concerned for his friend's safety, as the spider-hole to the west remains the most likely unsearched location.","Talk to Landroval","Finding Meneldor","You have found the cave-entrance","Locate the entrance of the spider-cave","Venom-bite spider-cave lies west of Landroval's hidden clearing.\
\
Landroval has asked you to search inside the spider-lair for his missing friend, Meneldor.","Venom-bite spider-cave lies west of Landroval's hidden clearing.\
\
Landroval has requested that you discover the entrance to the spider-lair he viewed to the west.","Landroval can be found at the clearing of trees in the north-east section of the Wailing Hills.\
\
Landroval awaits your return and will be eager to see his friend Meneldor as well.","Enter the cave and search for Meneldor"}},
[5299]={nameES="Encontrando la razón",objectivesES={"La entrada a la cueva que los cazadores bloquearon está en las ruinas al este de Archet.\
\
Atli te dijo que envió a su primo Bali a revisar las cuevas, pero aún no ha regresado. Si lo encuentras, puede que tenga la respuesta a lo que ha perturbado a las arañas.","Llevar el diario y las páginas del diario a Atli Matarañas","Buscar a Bali","Habla con Atli Matarañas en Archet","Las páginas faltantes del diario de Bali deben estar en algún lugar dentro de las cuevas. Es posible que las arañas hayan tomado las páginas y las hayan envuelto en sus capullos.\
\
Has encontrado el cadáver de Bali y su diario, pero faltan varias páginas. Debes encontrar las páginas antes de regresar con Atli.","Registras el cadáver de Bali y encuentras un diario con varias páginas faltantes. El texto del diario dice:\
\
'No lo creería, pero las arañas han despejado la entrada de la cueva. He entrado en la cueva y las arañas reaccionaron instantáneamente, como si fueran atraídas por mí. No sé por qué. Pasé el día buscando cuidadosamente solo cerca de la entrada y encontré varios cadáveres envueltos en capullos. ¡Estas arañas parecen envolver todo en sus capullos! Escribiré más mañana cuando me adentre más en la cueva.'\
\
Quizá lo mejor sea entrar en la cueva para ver si puedes encontrar el resto de las páginas del diario antes de regresar con Atli.","Atli Matarañas se encuentra justo al norte de Cal Sprigley.\
\
Cal Sprigley sugirió que hables con Atli Matarañas sobre las arañas en su granja y cómo deshacerse de ellas.","Encontrando la razón","Atli Matarañas se puede encontrar en el extremo norte de Archet.\
\
Atli Matarañas querrá saber qué descubriste entre las páginas del diario de Bali.","La granja de Cal Sprigley ha sido invadida por arañas sin razón aparente, dejando a Cal y Holly sin hogar en Archet."}},
[5300]={nameES="Finding Rest",objectivesES={"Wights have begun to rise up from the cairns of the Bonevales, presenting a threat to all who dwell in Dunland.","Ilar is at his camp, north and east of the Bone Quarry.\
\
You should seek out Ilar and let him know that the cairns have been sealed.","Talk to Ilar at his camp in the Bonevales","The Bone Quarry lies to the east of Echad Naeglanc.\
\
Naeglanc has asked you to close several cairn-openings within the Bone Quarry.","Finding Rest"}},
[5301]={nameES="Finding a Breach in the Darkness",objectivesES={"Complete Quest: Breach in the Darkness: Treachery","Finding a Breach in the Darkness","Rathon can be found at the northern end of the Fourth Circle of Minas Tirith.\
\
You should speak with Rathon and assist him with protecting the Cisterns.","Speak with Rathon","Complete Quest: Breach in the Darkness: The Back Door","Complete Quest: Breach in the Darkness: The Withered Foe","The Withered Tree has taken hold of the Cisterns and let a raiding party of Orcs into the city. It is up to you to regain control of the Cisterns.","Complete Quest: Breach in the Darkness: Kamabhosh","Complete Quest: Breach in the Darkness: The Invaders","Rathon can be found at the northern end of the Fourth Circle of Minas Tirith.\
\
You should speak with Rathon."}},
[5302]={nameES="Finding an Old Fiend",objectivesES={"Elain awaits you in Lhan Tarren.\
\
You should speak with Elain and inform her that you slew her old enemy.","Defeated Red-eye","Finding an Old Fiend","Elain, the huntress you rescued not long ago, wishes to finish the hunt she began on the day she was captured.","Talk to Elain at Lhan Tarren","Red-eye was said to be at a den to the south-west.\
\
Elain has asked you to hunt down Red-eye in her stead while she prepares for the evening's rites.","Defeat Red-eye"}},
[5303]={nameES="Finding the Flock",objectivesES={"Several sheep have wandered off and become lost in and near Ahâba.\
\
You should find and <rgb=#00FFFF>whistle</rgb> at the lost sheep to send them home.","Finding the Flock","Collect hay bale","Collected hay bale","Shepherd Nahíd in Ahâba needs help finding his lost sheep.","You have found all of Nahíd's lost sheep.\
\
You should return to Nahíd.","Talk to Nahíd","Nahíd has requested help gathering his sheep.\
\
You should start by collecting the nearby hay bale."}},
[5304]={nameES="Finding the Lost",objectivesES={}},
[5305]={nameES="La búsqueda del nido",objectivesES={"Encuentra el nido de las arañas","Has localizado el origen de las arañas del Bosque del Fardo","La búsqueda del nido","Robin Madriguera se encuentra en la Posada La Mata de Hiedra, en el centro de Hobbiton.\
\
Otho piensa que los Oficiales deberían estar al tanto del peligro que pueden representar las arañas y te ha pedido que hables con Robin Madriguera, el Oficial de Hobbiton.","Robin Madriguera se encuentra en la Posada La Mata de Hiedra, en el centro de Hobbiton.\
\
El Oficial Madriguera te envió a ocuparte de la amenaza que representan las arañas en el Bosque del Fardo y a descubrir la ubicación de su nido. Deberías volver a hablar con Robin Madriguera para contarle que has tenido éxito.","Puede que haya arañas en el Bosque del Fardo, al norte y noroeste de Sobrecolina.\
\
Otho Anchocinto te envió a hablar con Robin Madriguera sobre las arañas, pero el Oficial de Hobbiton ya había recibido informes sobre las criaturas del Bosque del Fardo. El Oficial Madriguera te ha pedido que mates tantas arañas como puedas, pero también que encuentres su nido.","Otho está preocupado porque las arañas que infestaban su carreta parecen haberse escapado. Podrían representar un peligro en otra parte de la Comarca."}},
[5306]={nameES="Finding the Path",objectivesES={"After finding the Silent One's home of sorts, the Orc was forced to flee deeper into Lhingris. You and Legolas must now pursue the elusive Orc if you hope to claim his armour.","The trails of blood begin at the Silent Haunt and lead deeper into Lhingris.\
\
Legolas has spotted two trails of blood leading from the Silent Haunt. It seems the Silent One is trying to lose you in the shadows of Lhingris.","Follow the trail of the Silent One's blood deeper into Lhingris","The trail of blood leads deeper into Lhingris!","Finding the Path","Talk to Legolas near Dath Nethryn","Legolas can be found above the swamp of Dath Nethryn in Lhingris.\
\
The trails of blood have led both you and Legolas to the swamp of Dath Nethryn. The Silent One now hides within, hoping to tend his wounds and escape your pursuit.","You have found Legolas at the end of the other trail of blood!"}},
[5307]={nameES="Finding the Range",objectivesES={}},
[5308]={nameES="Finding the Remedy",objectivesES={"Return to Penda with the pouches of remedy","This scribbled note contains a set of orders to the Mor-hai Orcs, signed by one named Dushatár. It seems that the Mor-hai have often been careless when creating and handling their poisons. The orders demand that pouches of herbal remedy be carried in order to help cure their mistakes.\
\
It would certainly be helpful to collect some of these remedy pouches and to bring them to Frithstan's camp.","Penda may be found back at the camp, along the road north of the Cuthstan.\
\
Frithstan and his men should be able to make good use of the remedy you have collected from the Mor-hai.","Finding the Remedy","A set of orders has been posted, instructing the Mor-hai to carry pouches of remedy in order to safe-guard against their own poisons.","Mor-hai Orcs can be found within their cave in the western section of the Wailing Hills.\
\
Securing remedy from defeated Orcs will likely prove to be a worthwhile endeavour for the Men of Stangard."}},
[5309]={nameES="Finding the Remedy -- Repeatable",objectivesES={}},
[5310]={nameES="Finding the Saboteurs",objectivesES={"Saboteurs are hiding in the cisterns.\
\
You should defeat the saboteurs.","Speak with Rathon","Finding the Saboteurs","Rathon can be found outside the cistern entrance on the Fourth Circle of Minas Tirith.\
\
You should speak with Rathon.","Rathon has been tasked with maintaining many of the cisterns in Minas Tirith by himself and could use some assistance in tracking down those who sabotaged the main cistern valve."}},
[5311]={nameES="Finding the Way-finder",objectivesES={"Return to Nella","Search for the missing way-stone","You should bring the way-stone back to Nella.\
\
Nella is in Dol Amroth outside of the Swan-knight's Keep.","Finding the Way-finder","You found Nella's way-stone!","Nella has asked you to you look for her missing way-stone.\
\
The way-stone went missing in Hashadir.","Somewhere in the ruins of Hashadir lies a precious heirloom."}},
[5312]={nameES="Fingers of the White Hand",objectivesES={}},
[5313]={nameES="Finish the Abominations",objectivesES={}},
[5314]={nameES="Finishing the Task",objectivesES={"Athelbald will not go back to the farm until his task is complete. You will need to finish it to ensure that he returns safely to the Folde Farm.","Finishing the Task","Talk to Athelbald","Athelbald is at the Folde Farm.\
\
You should bring the boar-meat that you collected to Athelbald.","Gather the meat from four boars.\
\
Boars wander the hills east of the Folde Farm."}},
[5315]={nameES="El medallón de Finna",objectivesES={"El medallón de Finna","Habla con Róarr en la Guardia Orca","Un enano llamado Nykr se dio la vuelta durante una ruta porque se le había caído un bonito medallón-rompecabezas, y esto le costó la vida. Su amigo Gufi, consternado por esta decisión sin sentido, quiere saber porqué mereció la pena morir por este objeto.","Hay muchos enanos en la Guardia Orca.\
\
A Róarr le sorprendió la muerte de Nykr. Aunque no sabía por qué su amigo valoraba tanto ese medallón fabricado a mano, te ha sugerido que preguntes a los otros enanos en la Guardia Orca.","Encuentra a un enano en la Guardia Orca que sepa por qué Nykr murió por su medallón","Róarr está en la Guardia Orca.\
\
Róarr querrá saber el significado del medallón, para poder informar de ello a Gufi."}},
[5316]={nameES="El medallón de Finna",objectivesES={"El medallón de Finna","Habla con Róarr en la Guardia Orca","Un enano llamado Nykr se dio la vuelta durante una ruta porque se le había caído un bonito medallón con un rompecabezas, y esto le costó la vida. Su amigo Gufi, consternado por esta decisión sin sentido, quiere saber porqué mereció la pena morir por este objeto.","Hay muchos enanos en la Guardia Orca.\
\
A Róarr le sorprendió la muerte de Nykr. Aunque no sabía por qué su amigo valoraba tanto ese medallón fabricado a mano, te ha sugerido que preguntes a los otros enanos en la Guardia Orca.","Encuentra a un enano en la Guardia Orca que sepa por qué Nykr murió por su medallón","Róarr está en la Guardia Orca.\
\
Róarr querrá saber el significado del medallón, para poder informar de ello a Gufi."}},
[5317]={nameES="Finnvarth Is Lost",objectivesES={"You freed Finnvarth!","You should find Finnvarth the dwarf and help him get back to the mill.\
\
Armund suggested that he should have been exploring somewhere not far to the east of the old sawmill in the Limlight Gorge.","Finnvarth, companion of Armund, is lost somewhere near the old sawmill in the Limlight Gorge. Armund claimed that he was searching for likely stands of lumber that could be cut once the dwarves get the mill working again, but he has not turned up for several hours.","You should speak with Finnvarth at the Limlight Gorge sawmill.","Talk to Finnvarth","Finnvarth Is Lost","Rescue Finnvarth"}},
[5318]={nameES="Fire Beneath the Shadow",objectivesES={"Talk to Mithrandir","You should talk to Angbor, who can be found at the Cross-roads.","Meet with Mithrandir","Talk to Angbor","Angbor has spoken to Aragorn and Mithrandir about an important matter concerning the Morgul Vale.","You should talk to Mithrandir at the road that leads to the Morgul Vale, near to the after-battle Cross-roads.","Fire Beneath the Shadow"}},
[5319]={nameES="Fire Glands",objectivesES={}},
[5320]={nameES="Fuego y agua",objectivesES={"Los angmarim están usando barcos para transportar a sus tropas por las ruinas y Evendim.","Orchalwë querrá saber que los barcos han sido quemados.","Habla con Orchalwë","Fuego y agua","Orchalwë quiere que quemes los barcos en el muelle."}},
[5321]={nameES="Fuego y agua",objectivesES={}},
[5322]={nameES="Fire in Dâr Matum",objectivesES={}},
[5323]={nameES="Fuego en el cielo",objectivesES={"Las dos grandes tiendas de campaña proporcionan suministros a las fuerzas de la puerta este.","Los angmarim guardan sus provisiones y suministros en grandes tiendas de campaña.","Fuego en el cielo","Orchalwë se alegrará al saber que las tiendas están en llamas.","Habla con Orchalwë"}},
[5324]={nameES="Fire-starter",objectivesES={"Fire-starter","Salamanders are found just north of Harwick in the swamps along the road outside of the city.\
\
You should collect glands from salamanders to help the refugees keep their fires lit for protection against the dark and cold.","Cadda is at the refugee camp outside of Harwick, waiting to grow tall so that he may be a great warrior of Rohan.\
\
You should bring the salamander glands to Cadda, but naturally keeping it a great secret, for the child wishes to take all the credit. How can you refuse?","The refugees of Langhold have built a makeshift camp outside the gate of Harwick.","Bring Cadda the salamander glands (but do keep it a secret)"}},
[5325]={nameES="Fires and Shadowfells",objectivesES={}},
[5326]={nameES="Fires in the City",objectivesES={"Talk to Duinhir in the Second Circle of the besieged city","A burning stone landed in the Second Circle. Rathon wanted you to find a water bucket and use that to extinguish the stone.\
\
<rgb=#00FF00>Minas Tirith is besieged! You may examine the model of the city in the Dome of the Sun to travel between states of the city.</rgb>","You extinguished the burning stone!","A burning stone landed in the Fourth Circle. Rathon wanted you to find a water bucket and use that to extinguish the stone.\
\
<rgb=#00FF00>Minas Tirith is besieged! You may examine the model of the city in the Dome of the Sun to travel between states of the city.</rgb>","Forlong and Golasgil are in the Fourth Circle of the besieged city, and have sought to get your attention.\
\
<rgb=#00FF00>Minas Tirith is besieged! You may examine the model of the city in the Dome of the Sun to travel between states of the city.</rgb>","Rathon, the Warden of the Wells, has his hands full trying to keep the fires in Minas Tirith from spreading out of control.","Talk to Forlong in the Fourth Circle of the besieged city","Duinhir and his sons are in the Second Circle of the besieged city, and have sought to get your attention.\
\
<rgb=#00FF00>Minas Tirith is besieged! You may examine the model of the city in the Dome of the Sun to travel between states of the city.</rgb>","Talk to Golasgil in the Fourth Circle of the besieged city","Pick up a water bucket in the besieged city","A burning stone landed in the Third Circle. Rathon wanted you to find a water bucket and use that to extinguish the stone.\
\
<rgb=#00FF00>Minas Tirith is besieged! You may examine the model of the city in the Dome of the Sun to travel between states of the city.</rgb>","A burning stone landed in the Sixth Circle. Rathon wanted you to pick up a water bucket and use that to extinguish the stone.\
\
<rgb=#00FF00>Minas Tirith is besieged! You may examine the model of the city in the Dome of the Sun to travel between states of the city.</rgb>","A burning stone landed in the Fifth Circle. Rathon wanted you to find a water bucket and use that to extinguish the stone.\
\
<rgb=#00FF00>Minas Tirith is besieged! You may examine the model of the city in the Dome of the Sun to travel between states of the city.</rgb>","Fires in the City","You extinguish the stone, and Forlong calls out to you happily"}},
[5327]={nameES="Fires of Isengard",objectivesES={}},
[5328]={nameES="Fires of Nargroth",objectivesES={}},
[5329]={nameES="Fires of the Ghâshghurm",objectivesES={}},
[5330]={nameES="Leña para las noches frías",objectivesES={"Regresa con Orthonn","Leña para las noches frías","Leña y madera de deriva pueden encontrarse cerca de Ost Lagoros.\
\
Debes recoger leña y madera de deriva para ayudar a Orthonn a mantener su fuego bien encendido.","Orthonn está en su campamento, en el extremo sureste de Annúndir.\
\
Debes llevar la leña a Orthonn.","Orthonn te ha pedido que recojas leña para alimentar su fogata."}},
[5331]={nameES="Exploración de fuegos artificiales",objectivesES={"Este parece ser el lugar para lanzar fuegos artificiales azules","Este parece ser el lugar para lanzar fuegos artificiales verdes","Lanza fuegos artificiales naranja en la Cima de los Vientos en las Tierras Solitarias","Gandalf se encuentra en el escenario de Methel, al norte de Delagua en la Comarca, durante los espectáculos de fuegos artificiales.\
\
Deberías volver a ver a Gandalf y compartir con él tus experiencias con los fuegos artificiales.","Gandalf el Gris te ha pedido que visites varios lugares de la Tierra Media y uses colores específicos de fuegos artificiales en cada punto de referencia.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Los fuegos artificiales pueden comprarse a los vendedores del festival o ganarse como recompensas del festival.</rgb>\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando termine el festival actual. </rgb>","Lanza fuegos artificiales violetas en la casa de Tom Bombadil en el Bosque Viejo","Los fuegos artificiales azules parecen serenos por encima del bullicio y el clamor de Bree","Los ricos fuegos artificiales violetas contrastan con los simples y apartados alrededores de la casa de Tom Bombadil","Los fuegos artificiales amarillos tienen un carácter festivo, realzado por el alegre aspecto del Árbol de la Fiesta","Lanza fuegos artificiales verdes en la entrada de la Última Morada","Este parece ser el lugar para lanzar fuegos artificiales violetas","Los fuegos artificiales verdes complementan bien la naturaleza armoniosa de los Elfos","Este parece ser el lugar para lanzar fuegos artificiales naranja","Gandalf te ha pedido que viajes a cada uno de estos lugares y lances los fuegos artificiales apropiados: \
\
Lanza fuegos artificiales azules en el espectáculo de fuegos artificiales de Bree, cerca de la Puerta Norte.\
\
Lanza fuegos artificiales rojos en el Patio de Frérin, fuera de la Mansión de Thorin.\
\
Lanza fuegos artificiales verdes en la Última Morada en Rivendel.\
\
Lanza fuegos artificiales amarillos en el Árbol de la Fiesta de Hobbiton en la Comarca.\
\
Lanza fuegos artificiales naranja en la Cima de los Vientos en las Tierras Solitarias.\
\
Lanza fuegos artificiales violetas fuera del hogar de Tom Bombadil en el Bosque Viejo.","Exploración de fuegos artificiales","Lanza fuegos artificiales rojos en el Patio de Frérin en Ered Luin","Lanza fuegos artificiales azules en el espectáculo de fuegos artificiales de Bree","Los fuegos artificiales naranja emiten un cálido resplandor que ilumina la Cima de los Vientos","Lanza fuegos artificiales amarillos en el Árbol de la Fiesta de la Comarca","Lanza fuegos artificiales verdes en la entrada de la Última Morada en Rivendel","Este parece ser el lugar para lanzar fuegos artificiales rojos","Regresa a ver a Gandalf en el espectáculo de fuegos artificiales del escenario de Methel","Este parece ser el lugar para lanzar fuegos artificiales amarillos","Los fuegos artificiales rojos realzan la valentía presente en las estructuras hechas por los enanos"}},
[5332]={nameES="Fuegos artificiales para el festival",objectivesES={"Fuegos artificiales para el festival","Habla con Robert Verdelinde","Robert Verdelinde está a cargo de los fuegos artificiales de los Días de Verano.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando finalice el festival actual.</rgb>","Los vendedores de fuegos artificiales pueden encontrarse en Duillond, la Mansión de Thorin, el Árbol de la Fiesta y los terrenos del Festival de Bree. Robert Verdelinde te espera en los terrenos del Festival de Bree.\
\
Robert Verdelinde te ha pedido que reúnas los cuatro fuegos artificiales especiales de los vendedores de los Días de Verano. El tiempo apremia."}},
[5333]={nameES="Fuegos artificiales en Bree",objectivesES={"La zona de fuegos artificiales se encuentra cerca de la puerta norte de Bree.\
\
Debes lanzar los fuegos artificiales correctos según indique el coordinador.","Fuegos artificiales en Bree","Winston Perales ha organizado un espectáculo de fuegos artificiales para la gente de Bree.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando termine el festival actual. </rgb>","No lances el fuego artificial incorrecto","Winston Perales está en la zona de fuegos artificiales cerca de la puerta norte de Bree.\
\
Debes hablar con Winston Perales sobre tu desempeño en el espectáculo de fuegos artificiales.","El espectáculo de fuegos artificiales ha terminado, vuelve a intentarlo la próxima noche","Lanzaste el fuego artificial incorrecto"}},
[5334]={nameES="Fuegos artificiales en la Comarca",objectivesES={"El escenario de Methel de Delagua se usa para representar obras de teatro, pero también para lanzar fuegos artificiales durante celebraciones especiales.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando termine el festival actual. </rgb>","No se lanzaron suficientes fuegos artificiales para impresionar al público","Fuegos artificiales en la Comarca","Milo Tejonera está en el escenario de Methel, al norte de Delagua, en la Comarca.\
\
Deberías hablar con Milo Tejonera sobre tu participación en el espectáculo de fuegos artificiales de la Comarca.","Lanza fuegos artificiales para impresionar al público","Habla con Milo Tejonera en el escenario de Methel","Se han colocado lanzadores de fuegos artificiales en el escenario de Methel, al norte de Delagua en la Comarca.\
\
Espera a que el presentador declare el inicio del evento y luego lanza tantos fuegos artificiales como puedas.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Se necesita más de uno o dos participantes para lanzar suficientes fuegos artificiales y divertir al público.</rgb>","Los lanzadores de fuegos artificiales están en el escenario de Methel, al norte de Delagua, en la Comarca.\
\
Usa los lanzadores de fuegos artificiales para ofrecer un maravilloso espectáculo al público. La mejor forma de entretener al público es trabajar en equipo y lanzar tantos fuegos artificiales como sea posible.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Se necesita más de uno o dos participantes para lanzar suficientes fuegos artificiales y divertir al público.</rgb>","Espera a que el presentador declare el inicio del espectáculo"}},
[5335]={nameES="Reliquias de la Primera Edad — Introducción",objectivesES={"Reliquia de la Primera Edad recogida","Recoge una reliquia de la Primera Edad","Lleva la reliquia de la Primera Edad a Ásgeir","Los descendientes de Skorgrím Duramano han sido desde siempre una espina para el linaje de Durin, los Barbiluengos. Aunque ahora son parias, continúan siendo una amenaza para los Pueblos Libres de Ered Luin.","Reliquias de la Primera Edad — Introducción","Sarnúr se encuentra al sur de la Mansión de Thorin y al oeste de Noglond, en las ruinas de Orodost.\
\
Ásgeir te ha pedido que entres en la fortaleza de los Duramano en Sarnúr y derrotes a las criaturas que moran allí, reclamando reliquias de la Primera Edad para los enanos de la Mansión de Thorin."}},
[5336]={nameES="First Marshals' Marks",objectivesES={}},
[5337]={nameES="First Round Is On You",objectivesES={"Talk to Ibzan at the Black Anchor","Ibzan is concerned for The Black Anchor. The Corsairs have made it difficult for the tavern to entertain guests and also turn any profit.","You have taken back as many casks as you can from the Corsairs of the Gut.","Ibzan has asked you to take back casks of mead stolen from Corsairs in the Gut.","First Round Is On You"}},
[5338]={nameES="First of the Heirs",objectivesES={"Talk to Harnion","Elaglar can be found in the Court of the Fount in Dol Amroth.\
\
You should speak to Elaglar about your first victory against the Heirs of Castamir.","First of the Heirs","Harnion can be found along the road into Tarlang's Crown from Belfalas.\
\
Harnion has asked you to weaken the forces of Tarlang's Crown before confronting Azruthor. You should now speak to Harnion.","Talk to Elaglar in Dol Amroth","The forces in Tarlang's Crown have been severely weakened!","DNT -- will not be seen","After weakening the forces in Tarlang's Crown, the time has come to confront Azruthor and put an end to the Scourge's plans for the Anfalas.","Aid Harnion in weakening the forces in Tarlang's Crown","You should continue to weaken the forces of Tarlang's Crown.\
\
Harnion has asked you to weaken the forces of Tarlang's Crown before confronting Azruthor. \
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Completing the deed Quests of Tarlang's Crown will advance this quest.</rgb>"}},
[5339]={nameES="¡Primero, el desayuno!",objectivesES={"Habla con Adolinda en la Posada Embrujada","Bingo está dentro de la Posada Embrujada, en los Troncosombríos del Bosque Negro.\
\
Prestadír afirma no haber oído nunca de ninguna Montaraz llamada Aduiallin.","A Bingo le han dado un libro de recetas, y quiere preparar un delicioso plato siguiendo lo que aparece en sus páginas.","Habla con Prestadír en la Posada Embrujada","Bingo está en la Posada Embrujada, situada en los Troncosombríos del Bosque Negro.\
\
Has descubierto que Adolinda no es en absoluto una Montaraz, sino una habitante de Audaghaim que permanece bajo una antigua maldición.","Bingo ha intentado traducir los lugares mencionados en el libro de recetas donde podrías encontrar los ingredientes para el desayuno:\
\
Las patatas pantanosas se encuentran junto a charcas fétidas en el centro del Bosque Ahogado.\
Los arbustos de salvia crecen en las Ruinas Salvajes, al sur de Ost Galadh, en Emyn Lûm.\
Los cuervos del Bosque Negro pueden encontrarse alrededor de Emyn Lûm, y las arañas pueden hallarse en las Hondonadas Enmarañadas.\
Las ramitas de menta crecen alrededor de la torre de Minas Gîl, al este de Ost Galadh.","Prestadír está dentro de la Posada Embrujada, situada en los Troncosombríos del Bosque Negro.\
\
Bingo te ha pedido que averigües si alguno de los otros Montaraces sabe adónde ha ido Aduiallin.","Bingo está dentro de la Posada Embrujada, en los Troncosombríos del Bosque Negro.\
\
Has recogido los ingredientes que Bingo necesita para preparar el desayuno que quiere, y deberías llevárselos.","Habla con Bingo en la Posada Embrujada","Lleva los ingredientes del desayuno a Bingo en la Posada Embrujada","Adolinda está en un rincón sombrío de la Posada Embrujada."}},
[5340]={nameES="Fish Delivery",objectivesES={"Bring the fish to Anírwen","Today's catch of fresh fish can be found along the piers where the boats are parked in the wharf of Dol Amroth.\
\
You should pick up the fresh fish from the wharf, and bring it to Anírwen.","Fish Delivery","Anírwen has asked you to collect the catch from today and bring it to the fish market.","Anírwen is at the market near the docks of Dol Amroth, on the eastern side of the city.\
\
You should bring the fresh catch to Anírwen."}},
[5341]={nameES="Peces del Bosque Salvaje",objectivesES={"En los estanques del Bosque Salvaje se pueden encontrar piscardos salvajes.\
\
Deberías pescar piscardos salvajes.","Encontrarás una caja de almacenamiento en el Embarcadero de los Comerciantes o en Puente de Caballetes.\
\
Debes colocar","Peces del Bosque Salvaje","Alguien ha publicado una tarea para pescar piscardos en el Bosque Salvaje.","El aviso del tablón dice:\
\
'Se necesita: piscardos del Bosque Salvaje para comida y comercio. Se recompensará tu esfuerzo.'","Coloca los piscardos salvajes en una caja de almacenamiento"}},
[5342]={nameES="Cuentos de Pescador",objectivesES={"Habla con Nokki","Refkell está increíblemente orgulloso de su última captura y desea presumir ante su amigo.","Cuentos de Pescador","Noglond está al sur de la Mansión de Thorin, al sureste del Valle de Thráin, siguiendo el camino hacia las Tierras Bajas.\
\
Refkell te ha pedido que visites a Nokki y le cuentes acerca de su última captura."}},
[5343]={nameES="El enemigo del pescador",objectivesES={"El enemigo del pescador","El cubo está lleno hasta el borde con pescado.","Los Angmarim han ahuyentado a los osos polares hacia las zonas de pesca de los Lossoth.","Los cubos de pescado de Olavi se encuentran al suroeste de su campamento, a lo largo de la Bahía de Hielo.\
\
Por temor a los osos, Olavi te ha pedido que recuperes sus cubos de pescado de las zonas de pesca.","Lleva los cubos de pescado a Olavi","Olavi está en su campamento de pesca, al este de Sûri-kylä junto al camino a Jä-rannit.\
\
Deberías llevarle los cubos de pescado que has recuperado a Olavi."}},
[5344]={nameES="El mejor amigo del pescador",objectivesES={"Hay Angmarim en la orilla de la bahía de hielo, al suroeste del campamento de Olavi.\
\
Olavi te ha pedido que recuperes su caña de pescar de manos de los Angmarim.","Olavi está en su campamento junto al camino, en Jä-rannit.\
\
Has recuperado la caña de pescar de Olavi y deberías devolvérsela cuanto antes.","Recupera la caña de pescar de Olavi","Caña de pescar de Olavi recuperada","El mejor amigo del pescador","En su huida apresurada de los Angmarim, Olavi perdió su caña de pescar.","Lleva la caña de pescar a Olavi"}},
[5345]={nameES="Fishing For Fixes",objectivesES={"Gwían leans over to inspect your work","You have finished repairing all of Gwían's fishing nets.\
\
You should talk to her in Melgobas.","Talk to Gwían","Gwían wishes to talk to you.\
\
She can be found in Melgobas.","Gwían crosses her arms and raises an eyebrow","Repair the large fishing net","What's a few broken fishing nets to a seasoned adventurer?","Repair the small fishing net","Gwían wishes to talk to you again. Perhaps she'll let you repair the larger net now...?\
\
She can be found in Melgobas.","Gwían has finally allowed you to repair the large fishing net.\
\
You can find it in Melgobas.","Gwían has asked you to repair a small fishing net in Melgobas.","Gwían coughs politely, catching your attention","Gwían has asked you to repair another small fishing net in Melgobas.","Gwían leaves you momentarily to examine the net with a keen eye. Your work must have passed some unspoken test, because she soon returns to you with a slight smile. 'Well then, I suppose you are ready for the large net. Repairing it will take more time, but that won't be a problem for you, will it?'","Gwían smiles, nodding to herself in approval","Fishing For Fixes","Repair the other small fishing net","You seem to have missed a tear on the corner of the small fishing net.\
\
You can repair it in Melgobas.","Repair the small fishing net... again"}},
[5346]={nameES="Fishing for Advice",objectivesES={"Catch a fish near the waterfall above the harbour","The pier on the west side of the harbour looks great for fishing. Time to cast a line!","Fish from the pier in the harbour","Find a place to fish in the harbour","Find a place to fish at the west side of the harbour","There are many great fishing spots all over the island. You should bring your catch to Merkhâma and tell her.","The sandbar on the north side of the island has great potential for a fishing spot. You should scout the location.","Find a place to fish from the sandbar in the north","A waterfall flows from above into the harbour. Could there be fish up there?","Fish off the pier in the west side of the harbour","Find a place to fish near the waterfall above the harbour","Perhaps you could fish near the bridge in the harbour.","The sandbar on the north side of the island looks like a great fishing spot. You should catch fish there.","Visitors often ask Merkhâma where the best places to fish are, but she doesn't know. She has asked you to test various fishing spots around Furtherholm and then share your opinions with her.","Catch a fish from the sandbar in the north","The pier near the bridge in the harbour looks good. You should fish here.","Fishing for Advice","Maybe you should try fishing from the pier on the west side of the harbour.","Bring the fish back to Merkhâma","It looks like there are indeed fish near the waterfall above the harbour. You should catch one.","Este parece un buen lugar"}},
[5347]={nameES="Fishing on the Wharf",objectivesES={"Anírwen has invited you to do some fishing off the wharf of Dol Amroth.","Show the fish to Anírwen","An ideal fishing spot can be found on the low dock where the rowboats are tied up, south-east of Anírwen.\
\
You should fish on the low dock.","Anírwen is at the market near the docks of Dol Amroth, on the eastern side of the city.\
\
You should bring the fresh catch to Anírwen.","Fishing on the Wharf","This is a good place for fishing"}},
[5348]={nameES="Fishing the Day Away",objectivesES={}},
[5349]={nameES="Fishy Work",objectivesES={"Talk to Rindur","Rindur has given you an empty bucket to fill with fish.\
\
You can fill it up from the full fish crate in Melgobas.","Take fish from the full fish crate","You have set all the fish out to dry on drying racks.\
\
You should let Rindur in Melgobas know.","Fishy Work","You have filled your bucket with fish.\
\
You should set the fish out to dry on drying racks around Melgobas.","Rindur's fishing haul must be dried out to prepare for preservation."}},
[5350]={nameES="Algo huele a pescado. Demasiado a pescado.",objectivesES={"Los peces simples pueden capturarse en el estanque de Delagua. Tienes buenas probabilidades de atrapar peces simples en cada intento.\
\
¡Atrapa todos los peces simples que puedas! Pero hagas lo que hagas, no atrapes el pez malo...","Flobert Redondo se encuentra en el estanque de pesca de Delagua.\
\
Deberías regresar junto a Flobert Redondo de inmediato.","Los peces difíciles pueden capturarse en el estanque de Delagua. Tienes probabilidades moderadas de atrapar peces difíciles en cada intento.\
\
¡Atrapa todos los peces difíciles que puedas! Pero hagas lo que hagas, no atrapes el pez malo...","Algo huele a pescado. Demasiado a pescado.","Muestra a Flobert Redondo la increíble suerte que has tenido","Los peces posibles pueden capturarse en el estanque de Delagua. Tienes probabilidades razonables de atrapar peces posibles en cada intento.\
\
¡Atrapa todos los peces posibles que puedas! Pero hagas lo que hagas, no atrapes el pez malo...","Los peces fáciles pueden capturarse en el estanque de Delagua. Tienes muchas probabilidades de atrapar peces fáciles en cada intento.\
\
¡Atrapa todos los peces fáciles que puedas! Pero hagas lo que hagas, no atrapes el pez malo...","Ha llegado el momento de pescar y reunir toda la suerte que tengas. Podrás conservar todas las ganancias… hasta que falles, claro.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: El resultado de esta misión se basa en la suerte y no se ve afectado por la habilidad de pesca.</rgb>\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando finalice el evento al que está asociada.</rgb>","Los peces improbables pueden capturarse en el estanque de Delagua. Tus probabilidades de atraparlos todos son, bueno... improbables.\
\
¡Atrapa todos los peces improbables que puedas! Pero hagas lo que hagas, no atrapes el pez malo..."}},
[5351]={nameES="Five Against the Wold",objectivesES={}},
[5352]={nameES="Reparando la desgracia de Falco",objectivesES={"Jasper Fondolodoso está en el campamento de bandidos en Ost Baranor, al sur de las granjas de Entibo.\
\
Falco Manoverde te ha pedido que pongas fin al bandido Montebruno, Jasper Fondolodoso. Sugirió que lleves amigos.","Falco confesó que originalmente fue presionado por un hombre llamado Jasper Fondolodoso. Fondolodoso es un poderoso bandido que se encuentra en las ruinas del Árbol Amarillo, al sur, más allá de las granjas de Entibo.","Derrota a Jasper Fondolodoso","Jasper Fondolodoso derrotado","Falco Manoverde está en su granja en Entibo, al norte de Ost Baranor.\
\
Debes regresar con Falco Manoverde con la noticia de tu victoria sobre Jasper Fondolodoso.","Reparando la desgracia de Falco","Habla con Falco Manoverde en su granja"}},
[5353]={nameES="Arreglando la rueda que chirría",objectivesES={"Has llamado a Reinn a tu lado","Habla con Reinn (usa el cuerno para invocarlo)","Mögr se ha cansado de las constantes quejas de Reinn sobre el trabajo por hacer en la Sala Vigesimoprimera, y le invita a continuar con la expedición.","Habla con Reinn sobre su partida","Reinn ha visto una hoguera en el nivel inferior de la Gran Sala de Durin","La Gran Sala de Durin se encuentra al sur de la Sala Vigesimoprimera, tomando a la derecha desde el arco sur.\
\
Mögr te ha pedido que explores la sala situada al sur de la Sala Vigesimoprimera.","Explora hacia el sudeste en la Gran Sala de Durin","Reinn quiere hablar contigo","La Gran Sala de Durin se encuentra al sur de la Sala Vigesimoprimera en Zelem-melek.\
\
Deberías explorar la Gran Sala de Durin en Zelem-melek con Reinn, avanzando hacia el sudeste.","Encuentra al dueño de la hoguera","Arreglando la rueda que chirría","El cuerno de invocación se encuentra en la Sala Vigesimoprimera, junto a Mögr.\
\
Deberías usar el cuerno para llamar a Reinn a tu lado cuando estés listo para partir.","Reinn se encuentra en la Sala Vigesimoprimera.\
\
Deberías hablar con Reinn.","Has visto la luz de una hoguera en los niveles inferiores de la Gran Sala de Durin.\
\
Deberías encontrar la hoguera y a quien la atiende.","Puedes llamar a Reinn a tu lado usando el cuerno que te dio.\
\
Deberías hablar con Reinn.","Explora la sala al sur de la Sala Vigesimoprimera","Reinn quiere explorar hacia el sudeste","Has llegado a la Gran Sala de Durin"}},
[5354]={nameES="Flagon Morale",objectivesES={"Bring the ale-casks to the quartermaster at the Ford of Isen","The Rohirrim quartermaster is at the Ford of Isen.\
\
You should return the ale-casks that you recovered to the quartermaster at Grimbold's encampment.","Talk to the Rohirrim quartermaster","Flagon Morale","Grimbold has suggested that one of his less-well-loved guards is a minor noble and political schemer who happens to be overly fond of drink. This guard may be the weak link to allowing Daervunn to escape.","The quartermaster can be found in the Rohirrim camp at the Ford of Isen.\
\
Grimbold subtly inferred a plan to allow Daervunn to escape, but you will have to obtain some of the strong ale favoured by the Men of Rohan.","The Dunlendings have a camp not too far from the Ford of Isen, where the stolen ale is being kept.\
\
You will need to fight your way into the Dunlending camp and retrieve the stolen casks if you want to enact Grimbold's plan to secretly release Daervunn."}},
[5355]={nameES="Flags of The Free Peoples",objectivesES={}},
[5356]={nameES="Llama y sombra",objectivesES={"Geirfast ha identificado la pequeña cueva descrita en el mapa y enviará allí la antorcha maravillosa que has ensamblado mientras buscas uno o dos aliados.","Habla con Geirfast en la Sala Vigesimoprimera","Geirfast se encuentra en la Sala Vigesimoprimera.\
\
Deberías volver a hablar con Geirfast cuando estés listo para viajar a la extraña cueva.","Geirfast se encuentra en la Sala Vigesimoprimera.\
\
Deberías regresar con Geirfast y hablarle del extraño mapa que viste proyectado en la pared a la luz de la antorcha.","Llama y sombra"}},
[5357]={nameES="Flame in the Mountain",objectivesES={}},
[5358]={nameES="Flames at the Gate",objectivesES={"One of Saruman's perilous war machines, capable of spewing forth waves of fire, has been moved to the centre gate of Helm's Dike. If the device continues with its foul diffusion, the gate will surely bend beneath the immense heat and the first defence against the approaching army will be breached. Protect the archers upon the dike and supply their buckets with arrows so that they may defeat the foul construct.\
\
Merit Rating\
\
This quest starts with <rgb=#FFFF00>Full</rgb> Merit Rating.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Major Merit Loss</rgb>\
* Gate is dealt heavy structural damage\
* Gate is destroyed\
* Rohirrim Archer defeated\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Moderate Merit Loss</rgb>\
* Rohirrim Worker defeated","Defeat the war machine assaulting the main gate","<rgb=#FF0000>Do not allow the gate to be destroyed</rgb>","The war machine has been destroyed","The gate along the road must not fall to the flames of Saruman's twisted machine. The gates must be defended until the deadly construct can be disabled and destroyed.","Flames at the Gate"}},
[5359]={nameES="Flames at the Gate",objectivesES={"<rgb=#FF0000>Do not allow the gate to be destroyed</rgb>","Saruman's perilous war-machines, capable of spewing forth waves of fire, are approaching Helm's Dike. The largest is approaching the gate, which will surely bend beneath the immense heat and the first defence against the approaching army will be breached. Also, two smaller machines are approaching the defenders to either side of the gate and must be dealt with as well.\
\
Aid the archers upon the dike as they take aim at the war machine below.\
\
Merit Rating\
\
This quest starts with <rgb=#FFFF00>Full</rgb> Merit Rating.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Major Merit Loss</rgb>\
* Gate is dealt heavy structural damage\
* Gate is destroyed\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Moderate Merit Loss</rgb>\
* Archer attacking the war machine is defeated","The gate has been destroyed","The gate along the road must not fall to the flames of Saruman's twisted machines. The gates must be defended until the deadly constructs can be disabled and destroyed. Protect the archers upon the dike and supply them with arrows so that they may defeat the foul constructs.","Flames at the Gate"}},
[5360]={nameES="Flames in the Dark",objectivesES={"Deliver the wood to Arvellon in Glaniath","Haradrim and chopped wood can be found among the trees to the south of Glaniath in Upper Lebennin.\
\
Arvellon has asked you to recover wood and defeat any Haradrim scouts that have passed into Upper Lebennin.","Arvellon can be found in Glaniath to the north-east of Pelargir.\
\
You have defeated many scouts and recovered a substantial amount of wood. You should now return to Arvellon.","As the darkness in the sky intensifies, keeping the fires lit and the Enemy at bay has become an even greater challenge.","Flames in the Dark"}},
[5361]={nameES="Flames of War",objectivesES={}},
[5362]={nameES="Flames of the South-beacon",objectivesES={"Concerned that the war will soon consume all of Lebennin, Barchir bids you seek out the Steward of Ost Anglebed and aid in repelling the invaders near Pelargir.","Flames of the South-beacon","The Steward can likely be found in his hall in Ost Anglebed.\
\
Barchir has asked you to travel east to Ost Anglebed and aid the men there in holding against the Enemy's forces.","Talk to the Steward in Ost Anglebed"}},
[5363]={nameES="Fuegos artificiales en peligro",objectivesES={"Fuegos artificiales en peligro","El campamento de bandidos está en La Hondonada Angosta, las alturas en el suroeste de Marjala, no muy lejos de Casa del Bosque. Puedes entrar en el campamento cruzando un vado cerca del borde de una cascada.\
\
El Oficial Robin Madriguera te envió a ver a Paladin Tuk, el Thain de la Comarca, para hablarle de los fuegos artificiales robados a Hyacinth. El Thain sugirió que podrían haber sido robados por una banda de maleantes acampados en Marjala y te pidió que destruyeras esos fuegos artificiales.","Paladin Tuk está seguro de que una banda de bandidos robó los fuegos artificiales de Hyacinth y planea usarlos para fines dañinos.","Destruye los fuegos artificiales robados","Los fuegos artificiales han sido destruidos","El Thain está en los Grandes Smials de Alforzaburgo.\
\
El Thain, Paladin Tuk, te envió a destruir los fuegos artificiales robados a Hyacinth Tuk en un campamento de bandidos. Con la victoria en la mano, deberías volver a ver al Thain de inmediato."}},
[5364]={nameES="Del Lino a la Fibra",objectivesES={"Tanathron, el tejedor, está en Duillond cerca de los hornos.\
\
Debes llevarle las plantas de lino a Tanathron para reforzar su menguante provisión.","Lleva las plantas de lino a Tanathron y recoge las fibras","El lino crece entre las hierbas a lo largo del camino que conduce de Duillond hacia Celondim.\
\
Debes recoger tallos de lino para que la precaria reserva de Tanathron pueda mantenerse perfectamente equilibrada.","Deluraw está cerca de los hornos en Duillond.\
\
Debes llevarle las fibras de lino a Deluraw, pues al parecer son muy difíciles de conseguir.","Del Lino a la Fibra","El zapatero de Duillond está teniendo dificultades para obtener suministros de lino del acaparador tejedor.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro cuando finalice el festival actual.</rgb>","Lleva las fibras de lino a Deluraw","Tanathron está en Duillond, cerca de los hornos y del zapatero.\
\
Debes hablar con Tanathron acerca de conseguir fibra de lino para elaborar las botas usadas en el pisoteo de musarañas.","Habla con Tanathron"}},
[5365]={nameES="Flay the Free Peoples",objectivesES={}},
[5366]={nameES="Huidos hacia el sur",objectivesES={"Huidos hacia el sur","Busca en el Alto del Hombre Muerto a los otros guías","Los guías de Bree esperan que sus aliados y más gente que pagó por investigar las Quebradas de los Túmulos hayan sobrevivido y llegado a un lugar seguro en las Quebradas del Sur.","El Alto del Hombre Muerto se encuentra entre las Quebradas de los Túmulos del Norte y las Quebradas de los Túmulos del Sur.\
\
Sal Henares te pidió que buscaras en el Alto del Hombre Muerto a los otros guías de Bree."}},
[5367]={nameES="Desafío del corredor de los flets: Bregradel",objectivesES={"Desafío del corredor de los flets: Bregradel","Estás buscando al corredor de los flets en Telain Glorelloth.","Habla con el corredor de los flets en Telain Glorelloth","Bregradel te ha desafiado a demostrar tu familiaridad con Caras Galadhon en una carrera entre los árboles.","El corredor de los flets en Telain Glorelloth está esperando para hablar contigo.","Has llegado al corredor de los flets a tiempo","Completa el desafío a tiempo","Encuentra al corredor de los flets en Telain Glorelloth"}},
[5368]={nameES="Desafío del corredor de los flets: Lagordal",objectivesES={"Encuentra al corredor de los flets en el gran alto flet perteneciente a Telain Neduil","Estás buscando al corredor de los flets en un gran alto flet de Telain Neduil.","Desafío del corredor de los flets: Lagordal","Habla con el corredor de los flets en Telain Neduil","El corredor de los flets en Telain Neduil está esperando para hablar contigo.","Has llegado al corredor de los flets a tiempo","Lagordal te ha desafiado a demostrar tu familiaridad con Caras Galadhon en una carrera entre los árboles."}},
[5369]={nameES="Desafío del corredor de los flets: Leginiel",objectivesES={"Desafío del corredor de los flets: Leginiel","Encuentra al corredor de los flets cerca del maestro de establos","Leginiel te ha desafiado a demostrar tu familiaridad con Caras Galadhon en una carrera entre los árboles.","Habla con el corredor de los flets cerca del maestro de establos","El corredor de los flets cerca del maestro de establos está esperando para hablar contigo.","El corredor de los flets que estás buscando está cerca del maestro de establos de Caras Galadhon.","Has llegado al corredor de los flets a tiempo"}},
[5370]={nameES="Desafío del corredor de los flets: Lintwen",objectivesES={"Habla con el corredor de los flets fuera de la Casa de Celeborn","Estás buscando al corredor de los flets fuera de la Casa de Celeborn.","El corredor de los flets fuera de la Casa de Celeborn está esperando para hablar contigo.","Desafío del corredor de los flets: Lintwen","Encuentra al corredor de los flets fuera de la Casa de Celeborn","Lintwen te ha desafiado a demostrar tu familiaridad con Caras Galadhon en una carrera entre los árboles.","Has llegado al corredor de los flets a tiempo"}},
[5371]={nameES="Moscas en el pantano",objectivesES={"Tu misión es viajar a Saig Hathíl y reducir el número de moscas guadaña que se han vuelto peligrosas y agresivas.","Matriarca de la colmena enojada eliminada","Moscas en el pantano","Derrota a la matriarca de la colmena enojada"}},
[5372]={nameES="Flight From Vatug-ronk",objectivesES={"Shúkurz has agreed to help the Gabil'akkâ.","Flight From Vatug-ronk","Shúkurz will meet you by the southern entrance of Vatug-ronk.\
\
Vatug-ronk is located on the lowest level of Deepscrave, to the west of Aslíf.","You have freed the Orcs.\
\
Shúkurz is waiting for you by the southern entrance to Vatug-ronk.","Talk to Shúkurz near Vatug-ronk","Shúkurz has asked you to free a few imprisoned Orcs.\
\
Their cages can be found around Vatug-ronk."}},
[5373]={nameES="Flight from Justice",objectivesES={"Handarod is at Esteldín in the North Downs, far to the east of Evendim.\
\
You should return to Handarod and tell him of Jabe Grimshaw's defeat.","Defeated Jabe Grimshaw","Defeat Jabe Grimshaw","The Rangers believe Jabe Grimshaw can be found in the ruins of Barad Rath in Evendim, far to the west of Esteldín.\
\
Handarod has asked you to seek out the brigand Jabe Grimshaw and defeat him.","Talk to Handarod","The Rangers of Esteldín are hunting a fugitive by the name of Jabe Grimshaw, who slew one of their comrades during his escape.","Flight from Justice"}},
[5374]={nameES="Flight to Grúmachath",objectivesES={"Múta can be found at Grúmachath.\
\
You have found Múta speaking to the Zhélruka in charge of Grúmachath. You should talk to Múta.","Amidst the battered stones of an old Angmarim settlement, the Zhélruka have made camp","Múta can be found at Grúmachath.\
\
After arriving at Grúmachath, Múta ran off toward the centre of the encampment. You should join Múta by the camp-fire at Grúmachath.","Talk to Múta","Múta runs off toward the centre of Grúmachath","Talk to Mézto at Grúmachath","Múta appears to be speaking with the Zhélruka in charge of Grúmachath","Mézto can be found at Grúmachath.\
\
You have found Múta speaking to the Zhélruka in charge of Grúmachath, Mézto. You should talk to Mézto.","Múta can be found at your side.\
\
You have arrived at Grúmachath. You should talk to Múta.\
\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: If you become separated from Múta, use the horn she gave you to summon her to your side.</rgb>","Múta rushes to your side!","Flight to Grúmachath","After escaping her imprisonment at Mur Shatraug, the Witch-gate, Múta intends to join the Zhélruka expedition at Grúmachath.","Talk to Múta at Grúmachath","Grúmachath can be found to the north-east of the Mur Shatraug, the Witch-gate.\
\
After escaping with your aid, Múta intends to join the Zhélruka expedition at Grúmachath. You should travel to Grúmachath with Múta.\
\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: If you become separated from Múta, use the horn she gave you to summon her to your side.</rgb>","Travel to Grúmachath with Múta","Join Múta by the camp-fire at the centre of Grúmachath"}},
[5375]={nameES="Huida a la Montaña Solitaria -- Nivel 1",objectivesES={"Defiende el claro del asalto de los Orientales","Los Orientales han sido expulsados. El claro está asegurado. La gente de Valle llegará a la Montaña Solitaria.","Derrota a los Orientales en el claro","Huida a la Montaña Solitaria -- Nivel 1","La gente de Valle está intentando huir a la seguridad de la Montaña Solitaria. El ejército de los Orientales no está muy lejos..."}},
[5376]={nameES="Huida a la Montaña Solitaria -- Nivel 2",objectivesES={"Defiende el claro del asalto de los Orientales","Los Orientales han sido expulsados. El claro está asegurado. La gente de Valle llegará a la Montaña Solitaria.","Derrota a los Orientales en el claro","Huida a la Montaña Solitaria -- Nivel 2","La gente de Valle está intentando huir a la seguridad de la Montaña Solitaria. El ejército de los Orientales no está muy lejos..."}},
