[5652]={nameES="Fushaum Bal North: Shatúrro the Spear",objectivesES={"Fushaum Bal North: Shatúrro the Spear","Talk to Khirgi","The encampment of Fushaum Bal is a lawless home to evil men once under the command of Sauron.","Khirgi can be found at Fushaum Bal North.\
\
You should talk to Khirgi.","Shatúrro can be found in Fushaum Bal South.\
\
You should defeat Shatúrro.","Defeat Shatúrro, the Spear","Defeated Shatúrro"}},
[5653]={nameES="Fushaum Bal North: Shatúrro's Hired Hands",objectivesES={"Fushaum Bal North: Shatúrro's Hired Hands","Talk to Khirgi","The encampment of Fushaum Bal is a lawless home to evil men once under the command of Sauron.","Khirgi can be found at Fushaum Bal North.\
\
You should talk to Khirgi.","Shatúrro's hunters can be found in Fushaum Bal South.\
\
You should defeat any hunters under the command of Shatúrro."}},
