[5657]={nameES="Fushaum Bal South: Attacking the Unwelcome",objectivesES={}},
[5658]={nameES="Fushaum Bal South: Dealing in Stealing",objectivesES={"<rgb=#FF0000>Don't let the Fushaum Guards spot you</rgb>","Now that the road to Nurn is blocked, our food supply is running low.\
\
'Khirgi has sent men to hunt sûlokil, but has plenty of meats. Steal some of his provisions for us.'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Note: This quest is only available while the quest, The Fushaum Resolution, is underway.</rgb>","Food can be found in Fushaum Bal North.\
\
You should steal food from Fushaum Bal North while avoiding the guards.","Thâng can be found at Fushaum Bal South.\
\
You should talk to Thâng.","Talk to Thâng","Fushaum Bal South: Dealing in Stealing","The encampment of Fushaum Bal is a lawless home to evil men once under the command of Sauron.","A guard spotted you sneaking around!"}},
[5659]={nameES="Fushaum Bal South: Destroying the Watch",objectivesES={}},
[5660]={nameES="Fushaum Bal South: Khirgi's Bridge Guards",objectivesES={}},
[5661]={nameES="Fushaum Bal South: Khirgi's Elite",objectivesES={}},
[5662]={nameES="Fushaum Bal South: Khirgi's Scouts",objectivesES={"Mâlatuk can be found at Fushaum Bal.\
\
You should talk to Mâlatuk.","The encampment of Fushaum Bal is a lawless home to evil men once under the command of Sauron.","Fushaum Bal South: Khirgi's Scouts","Talk to Mâlatuk","Khirgi's Scouts can be found around Fushaum Bal.\
\
You should defeat any men scouting around Fushaum Bal."}},
[5663]={nameES="Fushaum Bal South: The Bandit's Stash",objectivesES={}},
[5664]={nameES="Fushaum Bal South: Turning Sides",objectivesES={}},
[5665]={nameES="Fûshath la Bestia",objectivesES={"Los señores de Carn Dûm enviaron a tres de sus sirvientes para mantener a la gente de Donnvail bajo control. Si el poderoso Gorthorog conocido como Fûshath la Bestia es derrotado, el dominio de la sombra sobre la ciudad podría debilitarse.","Fûshath la Bestia suele encontrarse en el barrio al este de los aliados de Una.\
\
Enan te ha encargado derrotar a Fûshath la Bestia, el poderoso ejecutor Gorthorog.","Enan está junto a los aliados de Una, en la ciudad de Donnvail, al oeste del barrio donde antes se encontraba Fûshath la Bestia.\
\
Debes regresar con Enan para contarle tu victoria.","Fûshath la Bestia"}},
[5666]={nameES="Gaerdring y Gaerthel",objectivesES={"Gaerdring y Gaerthel","Los muertos ancestrales se han alzado en el Gran Túmulo.","Derrota a Gaerthel","Gaerdring y Gaerthel, hermanos guerreros de la antigüedad, se han alzado en las profundidades del Laberinto del Gran Túmulo.","Gaerdring derrotado","Gaerthel derrotado","Derrota a Gaerdring"}},
[5667]={nameES="La Furia de Gaeruan",objectivesES={"El Guardia Ansurr te habló de su plan para dirigir la furia de la madre tortuga, Gaeruan, contra los trolls y orcos de Grishbalt. Su ataque debería sembrar confusión entre esas criaturas y facilitar la infiltración en las cavernas.","El Guardia Ansurr se encuentra en el asentamiento enano de Gabilshathûr, al suroeste de Grishbalt.\
\
El plan del Guardia Ansurr funcionó perfectamente. La madre tortuga fue atraída hacia las cavernas, y su furia sembró el caos en el campamento.","Dejaste el huevo de tortuga","El nido de Gaeruan se encuentra en el centro del lago Duvuinen, al norte de Gabilshathûr. Las cavernas de Grishbalt están al noreste del nido de Gaeruan.\
\
Toma uno de los huevos del nido de Gaeruan y colócalo cerca de la hoguera central en las cavernas de Grishbalt.","Encuentra el nido de Gaeruan en Duvuinen","La Furia de Gaeruan"}},
[5668]={nameES="Gain and Glory: Assist the Rich",objectivesES={"You have defended yourself against the workers' anger, and taken the stolen records back from Gareth Rust","See if Daley Utteridge will tell you anything useful","Apparently, Gareth Rust is in possession of records of the mayor's incriminating transactions....","Sometimes you must put yourself before others, even when those others have great need. The reward is often worth it!\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> NOTE: This quest will be removed from your quest log when the current festival ends. </rgb>","You talk conversationally with Daley Utteridge, but he does not say anything helpful","Daley Utteridge is in the workers' area of Winter-home.\
\
You should speak with Daley Utteridge and see if he will share the information that the mayor seeks.","The mayor wants you to betray the workers...and the price is right!","<rgb=#FF0000>Talk</rgb> to Daley Utteridge -- maybe he will talk back","The mayor is in the centre of town among the festival patrons.\
\
You should tell Mayor Goodnough what Daley Utteridge told you concerning Gareth Rust and the record of unsavoury transactions that now lies in his hands.","Find out what the mayor wants from you","Gareth Rust does not trust you now","Tell Mayor Goodnough everything you learned from Daley Utteridge","Use the summoning horn to call the mayor and protect him from the workers' wrath","Daley Utteridge is in the workers' area of Winter-home.\
\
You should try to persuade Daley Utteridge to tell you more so that the mayor will have the information he seeks.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>To perform an emote, select your target and type the required emote in your chat window. (Example: \\q/cheer\\q)</rgb>","The mayor wishes for you to meet the two workers in the woods south-east of town.\
\
When you are ready, you should go to the woods and summon the mayor and the workers using the town's Summoning Horn.","Mayor Goodnough is in Winter-home in Frostbluff, awaiting news of your success in the Festival Square.\
\
You should speak with the mayor now that you have helped to save his reputation and return the stolen records to him.","Daley Utteridge appreciates your sympathy and opens up","Convince Gareth Rust to confide in you","<rgb=#FF0000>Sigh</rgb> your sympathy at Daley Utteridge","Gareth Rust is in the workers' area in Winter-home, toiling unhappily with his fellow workers.\
\
You should try to get some dirt on Gareth Rust, as his negativity makes him a candidate for being let go.","Try to convince Daley Utteridge to confide in you (outsider though you are)","Offer comfort and <rgb=#FF0000>pat</rgb> Daley Utteridge on the head","The mayor stands in the centre of Winter-home, overseeing the events of the Yule Festival.\
\
You should speak with the mayor and find out what he wants from you, though it sounds like he has a sleazy scheme brewing.","Return the records of corruption to Mayor Goodnough to receive your reward","Daley Utteridge appreciates the comfort, but he does not wish to share his woes","Daley Utteridge stands near Gareth Rust in the workers' area.\
\
You should see if Daley Utteridge will trust you enough to speak of the workers' unhappiness to an outsider.","Gain and Glory: Assist the Rich","Daley Utteridge is reluctant to tell you anything incriminating, but he might be persuadable....","Daley Utteridge is in the workers' area of Winter-home.\
\
You should try to persuade Daley Utteridge to tell you more so that the mayor will have the information he seeks.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>To perform an emote, select your target and type the required emote in your chat window. (Example: '/cheer')</rgb>"}},
[5669]={nameES="Tarea de los Galadhrim: Porra de metal rota",objectivesES={"Alguien ha publicado una tarea para que se le entreguen porras de metal rotas. Se pueden entregar a cambio de una recompensa.","Se busca: Porras de metal rotas tomadas de los enemigos derrotados de los Galadhrim.","Tarea de los Galadhrim: Porra de metal rota","Has entregado un número loable de porras de metal rotas.","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir porras de metal rotas.","Entrega las porras de metal rotas en una caja de recolección"}},
[5670]={nameES="Tarea de Galadhrim: Oreja preciosa",objectivesES={"Has entregado una valiosa colección de orejas preciosas.","Entrega las orejas preciosas en una caja de recolección","Se busca: Orejas preciosas de bestias enemigas encontradas en Lothlórien y el Valle del Arroyo Sombrío.","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir orejas preciosas.","Alguien ha publicado una tarea para que le entreguen orejas preciosas. Se pueden entregar a cambio de una recompensa.","Tarea de Galadhrim: Oreja preciosa"}},
[5671]={nameES="Tarea de Galadhrim: Piel preciosa",objectivesES={"Tarea de Galadhrim: Piel preciosa","Entrega las pieles preciosas en una caja de recolección","Alguien ha publicado una tarea para que le entreguen pieles preciosas. Se pueden entregar a cambio de una recompensa.","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir pieles preciosas.","Has entregado una valiosa colección de pieles preciosas.","Se busca: Piel preciosa de bestias enemigas encontradas en Lothlórien y el Valle del Arroyo Sombrío."}},
[5672]={nameES="Tarea de Galadhrim: Magnífica vaina de espada",objectivesES={"Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir magníficas vainas de espada.","Se busca: Magníficas vainas de espada tomadas de los enemigos derrotados de los Galadhrim.","Alguien ha publicado una tarea para entregar magníficas vainas de espada. Se pueden entregar a cambio de una recompensa.","Entrega las magníficas vainas de espada en una caja de recolección","Has entregado un número respetable de magníficas vainas de espada.","Tarea de Galadhrim: Magnífica vaina de espada"}},
[5673]={nameES="Tarea de Galadhrim: Piel desagradable",objectivesES={"Entrega las pieles desagradables a una caja de recolección","Se busca: Piel desagradable de bestias enemigas encontradas en Lothlórien y el Valle del Arroyo Sombrío.","Alguien ha publicado una tarea para que le entreguen piel desagradable. Se pueden entregar a cambio de una recompensa.","Has entregado un montón de pieles desagradables.","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir pieles desagradables.","Tarea de Galadhrim: Piel desagradable"}},
[5674]={nameES="Galtrev's Unwelcome Neighbours",objectivesES={"Dragon-clan invaders roam the western reaches of Pren Gwydh freely after having settled there.\
\
You should protect the weakened peoples of Pren Gwydh by defeating the cruel folk of the Dragon-clan.","Talk to Tomos","Upon learning of Galtrev's current weakness, the Dragon-clan has settled nearby to prey on the people of Pren Gwydh.","Galtrev's Unwelcome Neighbours","Tomos is near the Dragon-clan's new settlement in the western reaches of Pren Gwydh.\
\
You should return to Tomos and tell him of your success against the Dragon-clan."}},
[5675]={nameES="Galtrev: The Capital Settlement",objectivesES={"Flint Ironheart, the Overseer at the fourth workstation, seems to be at the root of the delay in the day's productivity.\
\
You should speak with Flint Ironheart and find out if there is anything you can do to help.","Speak with the first White Hand Overseer","Speak with the third Overseer","Evidently, the fourth station is very behind with its shipment, blocking the progress of the third","Speak to the second Overseer","You have ventured into Galtrev, the capital settlement of Dunland in Pren Gwydh. It would appear that the White Hand currently governs this expansive village.","The White Hand Overseers can be found in the lower areas of Galtrev, guarding their four respective posts.\
\
You should speak with White Hand Overseer at the west gate to see if he needs your help.","Galtrev: The Capital Settlement","Find out why Flint Ironheart is blocking the entire day's work","The second Overseer is held up by the third Overseer's tardiness","The Overseer is held up by the second supply line Overseer"}},
[5676]={nameES="Gammy Cenagales",objectivesES={"Gammy Cenagales","Gammy Cenagales vive en la segunda granja al norte del camino hacia el este desde el centro de Entibo.\
\
El alguacil Hierbaroja sugirió que hables con Gammy Cenagales si deseas saber más sobre lo que está ocurriendo en Entibo.","El vigilante Hierbaroja mencionó que una de las hobbits más ancianas, Gammy Cenagales, siempre le habla sobre lo que ocurre en las granjas de Entibo al este del centro del pueblo. Puede que sepa una o dos cosas que necesitan hacerse cerca de las granjas."}},
[5677]={nameES="Caza mayor de Gamwich",objectivesES={"Ocaso derrotado","Caza mayor de Gamwich","Derrota a Filocortante","Escurridiza derrotada","Gytha Sacamontes se encuentra en el pueblo de Gamwich.\
\
Habla con Gytha Sacamontes en Gamwich.","Derrota a Morrofino","Filocortante derrotado","Derrota a Ocaso","Colmilloamarillo derrotada","Hay presas de caza por toda la Comarca Allende.\
\
Da caza a las criaturas de la Comarca Allende para Gytha Sacamontes y demuéstrale tu valía.","Derrota a Colmilloamarillo","Morrofino derrotado","Derrota a Escurridiza","Habla con Gytha Sacamontes en Gamwich","Se pueden encontrar criaturas raras y temibles por toda la Comarca Allende.\
\
Debes dar caza a estas criaturas para Gytha Sacamontes y probarle tu valía."}},
[5678]={nameES="La Receta Secreta de Gandalf",objectivesES={"Gandalf está en la habitación de Bilbo, en la planta baja de la Última Morada, en Rivendel.\
\
Nogmeldir te ha pedido que viajes a Rivendel, al oeste de las Montañas Nubladas, y traigas una poción especial de Gandalf el Gris.","Habla con Gandalf en Rivendel","Lleva la poción de Gandalf a Nogmeldir","La Receta Secreta de Gandalf","Nogmeldir está en Vindurhal, en el Paso Alto del norte.\
\
Gandalf el Gris te ha dado una poción especial que preparó, y debes llevarla a Nogmeldir.","Nogmeldir recordó una poción especial que Gandalf el Gris mencionó usar en sus fuegos artificiales para aumentar su poder."}},
[5679]={nameES="Gaol-break",objectivesES={"You have succeeded in causing a riot in Esh Mêkag and freeing many thralls.\
\
You should talk to Ebuzâm.","Gaol-break","Ebuzâm is ready to go back into Esh Mêkag to rescue as many thralls as he can.\
\
You should speak with Ebuzâm and complete 'Instance: Gaol-break'.","Talk to Ebuzâm","Ebuzâm will not give up until he frees everyone he can from Esh Mêkag.","Complete 'Instance: Gaol-break'"}},
[5680]={nameES="Garden of Lumber",objectivesES={}},
[5681]={nameES="Jardinería para la abuelita",objectivesES={"Habla con \\qNana\\q Morna Valeoro","Ayuda a \\qNana\\q Morna Valeoro a cuidar el jardín.","Jardinería para la abuelita","\\qNana\\q Morna Valeoro se encuentra en los altos de Campotieso, en la parte sur del pueblo.\
\
Habla con Morna.","A \\qNana\\q Morna Valeoro le vendría bien ayuda en el jardín."}},
[5682]={nameES="Garlic Scapes are a Fair Exchange for Wine",objectivesES={"Derva has garlic scapes for Miruhir.","Derva has asked you to deliver garlic scapes to her friend Miruhir.\
\
You can find Miruhir in Iáphel.","Talk to Miruhir","Garlic Scapes are a Fair Exchange for Wine"}},
[5683]={nameES="Puertas al pasado",objectivesES={"Haudh Elendil sigue siendo impresionante en su majestuosidad. Ha resistido el paso del tiempo mejor que la mayoría","Explora Haudh Tarcil","El Camino de los Reyes está repleto de tumbas y criptas que albergan los restos de los antiguos reyes y gobernantes de la antigua ciudad de Annúminas.","Explora Haudh Eldacar","Desde el interior se oyen órdenes secas y cortantes. Los Angmarim están aquí y buscan algo en el interior","Explora Haudh Elendil","Haudh Tarondor se yergue firme y en silencio. Nada ha perturbado esta tumba desde hace muchos años","Las puertas de Haudh Elendur están selladas y llevan mucho tiempo sin abrirse","Habla con Maladan en el Camino de los Reyes","Se oyen voces que provienen de detrás de la puerta de Haudh Eldacar","Explora Haudh Eärendur","Maladan se encuentra en el campamento de los Montaraces, en el Camino de los Reyes.\
\
Maladan querrá saber en qué estado se encuentran las tumbas y las criptas del Camino de los Reyes.","Haudh Valandur está siendo poco a poco devorada por el lago. La puerta parece haber sido abierta hace poco.","Explora Haudh Valandur","Las criptas y las tumbas se alinean a lo largo del camino que va desde el campamento de los Montaraces en el Camino de los Reyes hacia el oeste, hasta la ciudad de Annúminas.\
\
Maladan te ha pedido que explores las entradas de varias tumbas y criptas situadas en el Camino de los Reyes.","Puertas al pasado","Explora Haudh Tarondor","Explora Haudh Arantar","Explora Haudh Elendur","Haudh Tarcil ya no es lo que era. El paso del tiempo y el lago le han arrebatado su antiguo esplendor.","Haudh Eärendur parece estar en buen estado. Sin embargo, se pueden ver huellas de carros que bajan por el camino."}},
[5684]={nameES="Gath Daeroval, the Shadow-roost -- Solo",objectivesES={"Defeat Khatlob the Brood-mother","Defeat Khatlob the Brood-mother.","Cannoth hands you several phials of soothful vapour","Cannoth has a plan.","Talk to Cannoth further up the path.","Gath Daeroval, the Shadow-roost -- Solo","Reach the outcropping above and destroy the fell beast eggs before they hatch.","Defeated Khatlob the Brood-mother","Defeat Khúrthak the Rent.","Talk to Cannoth further up the path","Defeated Khúrthak the Rent","The Shadow-roost of Gath Daeroval is home to Khatlob, the Brood-mother of the winged beasts ridden by the Nazgûl. She and her vile egg-clutch must be destroyed or there will never be an end to the terror of the fell beasts.","Defeat Khúrthak the Rent","Talk to Cannoth"}},
[5685]={nameES="Gath Daeroval, the Shadow-roost -- Tier 1",objectivesES={"Defeat Khatlob the Brood-mother","Defeat Khatlob the Brood-mother.","Cannoth hands you several phials of soothful vapour","Cannoth has a plan.","Talk to Cannoth further up the path.","Reach the outcropping above and destroy the fell beast eggs before they hatch.","Defeated Khatlob the Brood-mother","Defeat Khúrthak the Rent.","Talk to Cannoth further up the path","Defeated Khúrthak the Rent","The Shadow-roost of Gath Daeroval is home to Khatlob, the Brood-mother of the winged beasts ridden by the Nazgûl. She and her vile egg-clutch must be destroyed or there will never be an end to the terror of the fell beasts.","Gath Daeroval, the Shadow-roost -- Tier 1","Defeat Khúrthak the Rent","Talk to Cannoth"}},
[5686]={nameES="Gath Daeroval, the Shadow-roost -- Tier 2",objectivesES={"Defeat Khatlob the Brood-mother","Defeat Khatlob the Brood-mother.","Cannoth hands you several phials of soothful vapour","Cannoth has a plan.","Talk to Cannoth further up the path.","Gath Daeroval, the Shadow-roost -- Tier 2","Reach the outcropping above and destroy the fell beast eggs before they hatch.","Defeated Khatlob the Brood-mother","Defeat Khúrthak the Rent.","Talk to Cannoth further up the path","Defeated Khúrthak the Rent","The Shadow-roost of Gath Daeroval is home to Khatlob, the Brood-mother of the winged beasts ridden by the Nazgûl. She and her vile egg-clutch must be destroyed or there will never be an end to the terror of the fell beasts.","Defeat Khúrthak the Rent","Talk to Cannoth"}},
[5687]={nameES="Gath Daeroval, the Shadow-roost -- Tier 3",objectivesES={"Defeat Khatlob the Brood-mother","Defeat Khatlob the Brood-mother.","Cannoth hands you several phials of soothful vapour","Cannoth has a plan.","Talk to Cannoth further up the path.","Reach the outcropping above and destroy the fell beast eggs before they hatch.","Defeated Khatlob the Brood-mother","Defeat Khúrthak the Rent.","Talk to Cannoth further up the path","Defeated Khúrthak the Rent","The Shadow-roost of Gath Daeroval is home to Khatlob, the Brood-mother of the winged beasts ridden by the Nazgûl. She and her vile egg-clutch must be destroyed or there will never be an end to the terror of the fell beasts.","Defeat Khúrthak the Rent","Talk to Cannoth","Gath Daeroval, the Shadow-roost -- Tier 3"}},
[5688]={nameES="Gatherers in a Foreign Land",objectivesES={}},
[5689]={nameES="Reuniendo Pergaminos Antiguos",objectivesES={"Reuniendo Pergaminos Antiguos","Fragmentos de pergamino desvaído pueden encontrarse en Sarnúr, al sur de la Mansión de Thorin, accediendo a través de las ruinas de Orodost.\
\
Rútur te ha pedido recuperar cualquier fragmento de pergamino desvaído que puedas encontrar en Sarnúr.","Hay rumores de que antiguos pergaminos permanecen en Sarnúr desde los días anteriores a que las grandes ciudades de los Duramano fueran destruidas por el gran cataclismo que desgarró Ered Luin.","Habla con Rútur en la Mansión de Thorin","Rútur está en la Mansión de Thorin, al norte de Sarnúr, justo fuera del Cuartel de la Piedra Azul.\
\
Ahora que posees los fragmentos de pergamino desvaído que Rútur te pidió reunir, debes regresárselos para que pueda descifrarlos."}},
[5690]={nameES="Reuniendo textos antiguos",objectivesES={"Habla con Broderic Saucedales en Bree","Reuniendo textos antiguos","Haudh Methernil, el Túmulo de Ringdor, el Túmulo de Taradan y Haudh Taenthod están dispersos por el Norte de las Quebradas de los túmulos.\
\
Broderic Saucedales te pidió que recuperaras textos antiguos en Haudh Methernil, el Túmulo de Ringdor, el Túmulo de Taradan y Haudh Taenthod. Usando el carbón y el papel que te he proporcionado, toma calcos de los pilares que están dispersos.","En lo profundo de Haudh Methernil, el Túmulo de Ringdor, el Túmulo de Taradan y Haudh Taenthod en las Quebradas de los Túmulos, se rumorea que hay pilares con texto antiguo grabado en ellos. Este texto puede contar historias antiguas de los héroes de nuestro pasado.","Broderic Saucedales se encuentra cerca del Pabellón de Caza, al final del Callejón Embrujado en Bree.\
\
Debes regresar con Broderic Saucedales con el texto que encontraste."}},
[5691]={nameES="Haciendo mantequilla",objectivesES={"Haciendo mantequilla","Las vacas están en una granja al este.","Rosa Tejonera está en la parte sur de la Granja de Cotonorte.\
\
Rosa Tejonera querrá la mantequilla para poder terminar las tartas.","Llévale la mantequilla a Rosa Tejonera","La mantequera está cerca de las vacas en la Granja de Cotonorte.\
\
El siguiente paso para hacer mantequilla es batir la leche.","La mantequilla es el último ingrediente para las tartas. Con ella, se puede empezar a hornear."}},
[5692]={nameES="Gathering Donations",objectivesES={}},
[5693]={nameES="Recolectando huevos",objectivesES={"Se pueden encontrar huevos cerca de las gallinas en la Granja de Cotonorte.\
\
Rosa Tejonera te ha pedido que recojas varios huevos para ayudar con la elaboración de tartas.","Recolectando huevos","Se necesita un baño de claras de huevo para cubrir la parte superior de la masa de las tartas.","Rosa Tejonera está en la Granja de Cotonorte.\
\
Rosa Tejonera querrá empezar a trabajar con los huevos.","Llévale los huevos a Rosa Tejonera"}},
[5694]={nameES="Recolectando harina",objectivesES={"Lleva los tallos de trigo a Edulfo Tunelero","El primer paso para hacer una tarta es conseguir harina para la masa.","Edulfo Tunelero está en el molino de la Granja de Cotonorte.\
\
Deberías volver con Edulfo Tunelero.","Rosa Tejonera está en la Granja de Cotonorte.\
\
Rosa Tejonera se alegrará de ver la harina que has ayudado a hacer.","Habla con Edulfo Tunelero en la Granja de Cotonorte","Se puede encontrar trigo en los campos de la Granja de Cotonorte.\
\
Rosa Tejonera te ha pedido que recojas un poco de trigo para hacer harina para las masas de las tartas.","Recolectando harina","Lleva la harina a Rosa Tejonera","Edulfo Tunelero está en el molino de la Granja de Cotonorte.\
\
Edulfo Tunelero te ayudará a moler el trigo para hacer harina.","Se pueden encontrar ratas alrededor del molino de la Granja de Cotonorte.\
\
Edulfo Tunelero te ha pedido que ahuyentes a algunas ratas mientras muele el trigo para hacer harina."}},
[5695]={nameES="Gathering Friends",objectivesES={"Talk to the dwarf","As you gathered kalorkhûn meat for the people of Gadim-ûn, you heard the sound of combat coming from somewhere nearby. You should find from where the sound is originating.","Return to Gadim-ûn","Find Abníshu, the kalorkhûn roost","You have gathered kalorkhûn meat for the Jatsakóri, and returned to Gadim-ûn. You should talk to Nabatínu and give him the meat.","The Rangers plan to relocate to Gadim-ûn so they can help the Jatsakóri. You should talk to Khagâmi at the Rangers' camp to see if she would like to go to Gadim-ûn also.","You found the kalorkhûn roost","Talk to Khagâmi","You have found a dwarf at Abníshu, also fighting the kalorkhûn. You should talk to him.","You have gathered kalorkhûn meat for the people of Gadim-ûn, and met a dwarf, Mêshaget, along the way. You should return to Gadim-ûn in north-eastern An Shêru with the meat.","Talk to Rhadrog","Gathering Friends","You find a dwarf fighting a kalorkhûn","You have found Abníshu, the kalorkhûn roost Rhadrog told you about. You should defeat some kalorkhûn to collect their meat to bring with you to Gadim-ûn.","Find where the sounds of combat originate","Khagâmi wants to accompany you to Gadim-ûn. You should talk to Rhadrog at his camp about your next steps.","Faeron and Rhadrog both agree that they should help the Jatsakóri.","In an effort not to put a strain on their resources, Rhadrog has asked you to go to Abníshu, a kalorkhûn roost to the west and collect some meat to bring with you to Gadim-ûn.","Bring the kalorkhûn meat to Nabatínu"}},
[5696]={nameES="Recuperando las telarañas sombrías",objectivesES={"Hafren te ha pedido que recojas telarañas sombrías en Nettinglade.\
\
Las telarañas sombrías se pueden encontrar en el Claro de Redes, en el Bosque Viejo.","Vuelve con Hafren","Hafren se ríe mientras te cuesta pasarle la telaraña pegajosa","Los hilos plateados de la telaraña sombría de las arañas del Bosque Viejo pueden salvar vidas, pero también ponerlas en peligro.","Recuperando las telarañas sombrías","Debes llevar las telarañas sombrías que has recogido a Hafren.\
\
Hafren se encuentra en la caravana de Gerwyn, en el norte de Cardolan."}},
[5697]={nameES="Recolección de calabazas",objectivesES={"Recolección de calabazas","El laberinto de trigo de Wistmead se encuentra en el espacio del Festival de la Cosecha de Wistmead.\
\
Deberías llevar las calabazas a Ermentrude Henoloma en la entrada del laberinto de trigo.","Ermentrude Henoloma, la maestra del laberinto de Wistmead, te ha pedido que recojas algunas de las asombrosas calabazas decorativas que crecen dentro de las paredes de trigo.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando termine el evento con el que está asociada.</rgb>","El laberinto de trigo de Wistmead se encuentra en el espacio del Festival de la Cosecha de Wistmead.\
\
Ermentrude Henoloma te ha pedido que recojas calabazas decorativas.","Lleva las calabazas a Ermentrude Henoloma"}},
[5698]={nameES="Recolectando musgo sepulcral",objectivesES={"Haudh Iarchith, Gwantham, Goetham y Haudh Nogbenn están ubicados en las Quebradas de los Túmulos del sur.\
\
Agatha Valleverde te pidió que recolectaras un raro musgo sepulcral que puede encontrarse en varias criaturas que habitan Haudh Iarchith.","Lleva el musgo sepulcral a Agatha Valleverde en Bree","Agatha Valleverde te habló de un musgo sepulcral con propiedades medicinales que solo puede encontrarse en los túmulos de Haudh Iarchith, Gwantham, Goetham y Haudh Nogbenn en las Quebradas de los Túmulos del sur.","Agatha Valleverde se encuentra al final del Callejón Embrujado, cerca del Pabellón de Caza, en Bree.\
\
Debes llevar el musgo sepulcral a Agatha Valleverde.","Recolectando musgo sepulcral"}},
[5699]={nameES="Gathering Guests (Daily)",objectivesES={"Khâtaphos needs more people willing to travel Middle-earth to spread the word about Furtherholm and attract more guests.","Talk to Khâtaphos in Furtherholm","Complete any Gathering Guests quest","At Khâtaphos' request, you have gone to a location on his list and successfully promoted Furtherholm. You should return to him inside The Cracked Flagon to claim your reward.","Captain Khâtaphos has made a list of places he would like someone to visit and promote Furtherholm. You should pick a location to go to.","Gathering Guests (Daily)"}},
