[5924]={nameES="Greeting Vilihad Túcca",objectivesES={}},
[5925]={nameES="Grey Mountain Way-food",objectivesES={"Grey Mountain Way-food","Bring the nuts and berries to Rúzat at Dôm Goru","Nuts and berries can be found in eastern Ered Mithrin near Erebor.\
\
You should collect pine nuts and wild berries.","You should bring the nuts and berries to Rúzat at Dôm Goru in Ered Mithrin.","Help Rúzat gather way-food to be eaten on the trail."}},
[5926]={nameES="Grey Mountains Instance Deeds!",objectivesES={}},
[5927]={nameES="Greylin's Bounty",objectivesES={"One of the Want-kin, Gaustaf, has found joy in panning the Greylin for gem-stones and other interesting baubles.","Greylin's Bounty","Gaustaf can be found at Khadâsh-gâra in Elderslade.\
\
You have found a few small gem-stones and interesting pebbles from panning the Greylin. You should return to Gaustaf.","You have found a suitable location to pan the Greylin!","Deliver the gem-stones and pebbles to Gaustaf","The Greylin runs south out of Ered Mithrin to the east of Khadâsh-gâra.\
\
Gaustaf has asked you to pan the Greylin in several locations and bring him what you find. You should pan the Greylin."}},
[5928]={nameES="Un frío atroz",objectivesES={"Un frío atroz","Habla con Pasi","Los Lossoth culpan al duro invierno de la invasión de los Angmarim y te han pedido tu ayuda para expulsarlos.","Las tiendas de los Angmarim están en el campamento al sureste de Sûri-kylä, cerca del paso hacia Forodwaith.\
\
Pasi te ha pedido que vuelvas a los campamentos Angmarim y quemes sus tiendas con la yesca que te ha proporcionado.","Pasi está en Sûri-kylä, al noroeste del campamento Agmarim.\
\
Deberías llevar las noticias de tu éxito a Pasi."}},
[5929]={nameES="Grim Standards",objectivesES={}},
[5930]={nameES="Seres de las tumbas siniestros",objectivesES={"Los muertos antiguos se han alzado en el Gran Túmulo.","Los seres de las tumbas siniestros se encuentran en el laberinto del Gran Túmulo.","Seres de las tumbas siniestros"}},
[5931]={nameES="Reclamación de Corteza sombría",objectivesES={"Regresa junto a Radagast con las semillas de Corteza sombría","Reclamación de Corteza sombría","Radagast el Pardo te habló un poco de la tierra que se ha convertido en el Pantano Rojo y de la caída de la Doncella Roja. También habló de Corteza de roble, un gran árbol que una vez creció allí, ahora llamado Corteza sombría.","Corteza sombría se encuentra en Garth Agarwen, al norte de Agamaur, en las Tierras Solitarias. Radagast está en Barad Dhorn, en el campamento Eglain.\
\
Radagast te ha pedido que le lleves bellotas de las ramas de Corteza sombría, para plantarlas en el Bosque Viejo y reclamar una pequeña parte del dominio de su pariente."}},
[5932]={nameES="El desafío de Grimbeorn",objectivesES={"Tu hermano Sterkist se encuentra en la Torre del Encuentro, en Rivendel.","Completa 'Artículos de resiliencia'","Completa 'Implementos de ferocidad'","El desafío de Grimbeorn","Habla con Sterkist en Rivendel","Tu hermano Sterkist ha llegado a Rivendel y ha traído un desafío para ti de parte de Grimbeorn.","Habla con Grimbeorn en Vindurhal, en las Montañas Nubladas","Grimbeorn ha llegado al Paso Alto, en las Montañas Nubladas. Se encuentra en el campamento llamado Vindurhal, en el estrecho espacio entre la Fuente Oriental del Bruinen y el Paso Alto Norte.\
\
Sterkist te ha contado que Grimbeorn planeaba viajar al Paso Alto si completabas las tareas que te había encomendado."}},
[5933]={nameES="Grimbold's Doting Mother",objectivesES={"Elgyth calls out as you examine the letter:\
\
'Ahhh...that is the last letter I have received from my dear son. He wrote about the Prince, poor Théodred, how he died in his arms. He wrote that Elfhelm was fighting against him in trying to hold the Fords.\
\
'My poor son...he was struggling a great deal.'","Grimbold's Doting Mother","Elgyth calls out as you examine a small figurine:\
\
'A gift to my son from Erkenbrand! He gave it to my son to remind him of his father's honour as he died to defend the Westfold. Grimbold has cherished this statuette and its giver ever since.\
\
'That great lord is like a father to Grimbold. They are both of them great – sacrificing everything for the Riddermark. Defending her lands and her king. They love Rohan more than anyone. How it must pain them to see her at war!'","Elgyth, the mother of Grimbold, has a house filled with loving memories of her mighty son.","Elgyth's belongings can be found in her home, and among them may be a letter telling of Grimbold's news from the Fords of Isen.\
\
You should search Elgyth's home for the latest news of Grimbold.","You take your leave of kindly Elgyth, saying that you have trespassed on her hospitality long enough, and that other pressing matters are at hand.\
\
'Of course, of course -- you travelling warriors, I know your like! Always more to do.\
\
'It was kind of you to stop and talk to an old woman. I hope you find Grimbold and Erkenbrand in time!'","Elgyth's voice calls out as you examine an old warhorn.\
\
'When he was a boy, he hid his father's warhorn to try to stop him from going off to battle – but of course my good husband knew he had it, and let him have it as a keepsake.\
\
'His father did not come back, and my dear boy thought that death took his father because he had not his horn to sound the alarm. It took a long while to soothe his fears. My Grimbold feels much.'","Elgyth calls out when you examine a lady's needlework.\
\
'Hildith made that for him when they were first betrothed, and he cherished it always.\
\
'He loves that wife of his, even if her words cut him like a whip. They had a terrible fight when he left for war. All of Grimslade could hear.'","Elgyth is in her home in Grimslade, in the south-eastern Westfold.\
\
You should take your leave of Elgyth.","Take your leave of Elgyth"}},
[5934]={nameES="Letales macabros",objectivesES={"Has extinguido las brillantes llamas errantes de los sombríos ardientes que merodean por las Profundidades Llameantes. Los enanos descansarán más tranquilos sabiendo que su número se ha reducido.","Letales macabros","Los sombríos ardientes se pueden encontrar por todas las Profundidades Llameantes.\
\
Deberías extinguir a los sombríos ardientes, ya que los enanos no les tienen aprecio.","Los sombríos ardientes no son más que un obstáculo para los esfuerzos de los enanos, y sus llamas deben ser extinguidas. Su intenso brillo anaranjado debería convertirlos en objetivos fáciles.","Completado"}},
[5935]={nameES="Grimslade Will Burn",objectivesES={}},
[5936]={nameES="Grimwood Reinforcements",objectivesES={"Deliver the message without defeat","Travel east and south from the Grimwood Lumber Camp to inform Captain-General Tordúr that the Grimwood Lumber Camp belongs to the Free People.\
\
You have been tasked with informing the Captain-General that the battle at the Grimwood is won.","The Grimwood Lumber-yard once again falls to the control of the Free Peoples.","Another informed the Captain-General, support arrives at the Grimwood soon.","Talk to Tordúr at Glân Vraig","Grimwood Reinforcements","You were defeated and failed to deliver the message","Angmar must not control the Lumber Camp","Support must not be present at the Grimwood","Angmar has taken the Lumber Camp"}},
[5937]={nameES="Grinding Bones in the Grimwood",objectivesES={"Chieftain Torbok prepares the defence of the Grimwood Lumber-yard against the Free Peoples.","Fight Angmar's foes within the bounds of the Grimwood Lumber-camp.\
\
You were instructed to stand this ground and fight for the glory of Angmar in defence of the Grimwood Lumber-camp.","If Torbok is defeated or the lumber camp has fallen to the Free Peoples, return to Gramsfoot and face the wrath of War-tyrant Akúlhun.\
\
You should return to Chieftain Torbok at the Grimwood Lumber Camp to gloat of your victories against the Free Peoples.","Grinding Bones in the Grimwood"}},
[5938]={nameES="Gristlebite, Scourge of Lhingris",objectivesES={}},
[5939]={nameES="El pedido de Grobo",objectivesES={"El pedido de Grobo","Sig Mandrake está complacido con la ayuda que le has brindado y quiere que recojas las tortugas que Benegar Vallelargo está guardando en la casa de su tío.","Grobo Hierbaperro está en su madriguera hobbit, junto al cobertizo lleno de tortugas, en el lado este de Entibo.\
\
Has reunido a las tortugas que atormentaban a Grobo Hierbaperro y ahora debes hablar con él, ahora que están nuevamente aseguradas dentro de la bolsa para cargarlas.","Habla con Grobo Hierbaperro","Recoge la bolsa para cargar tortugas en el cobertizo de Grobo Hierbaperro","La bolsa para cargar tortugas está en algún lugar dentro del cobertizo de Grobo Hierbaperro, una madriguera adjunta a su casa.\
\
Grobo Hierbaperro está aterrorizado de las tortugas y quiere que vuelvas a meter en la bolsa a las que quedaron sueltas en su cobertizo.","Las tortugas pueden encontrarse por todo el cobertizo de Grobo Hierbaperro.\
\
Grobo Hierbaperro está aterrorizado de las tortugas y quiere que recojas a todas las criaturas que escaparon de la bolsa mal atada que su sobrino dejó en su cobertizo.","Muéstrale la bolsa para cargar tortugas a Grobo Hierbaperro en su madriguera hobbit","Grobo Hierbaperro tiene una madriguera hobbit en Entibo.\
\
El sobrino de Grobo Hierbaperro está guardando una bolsa de tortugas en el cobertizo de su tío, y debes preguntarle a Grobo Hierbaperro si puedes recogerlas."}},
[5940]={nameES="Infestación de gredbyg",objectivesES={"El Agujero Chirriante localizado y marcado en tu mapa","Regresa con Kúli","Infestación de gredbyg","La Fosa de las Garras, el Agujero Chirriante y la Gran Colmena cuentan con yacimientos sin explotar que parecen atraer a los gredbyg.\
\
Los gredbyg se han multiplicado sin control en el sur de las Vetas del Cuerno Rojo. Su colmena es enorme y se construyó sobre numerosos yacimientos de mineral sin explotar. ¡Es probable que ese túnel sea el mejor lugar para la extracción de mithril en todo Moria!","La Gran Colmena localizada y marcada en tu mapa","Fosa de las Garras localizada y marcada en tu mapa","Kúli y Auti acampan en el límite norte de la enorme colmena de gredbyg.\
\
A Kúli le interesa localizar buenos lugares para la extracción de minerales dentro de la colmena. Espera que algún día la colmena de gredbyg ya no sea tan peligrosa y que sea posible extraer minerales en esos lugares.","Dos miembros de la compañía de enanos de la Guardia Orca partieron hacia la caverna meridional de las Vetas del Cuerno Rojo. No esperaban que esta caverna albergara una colmena de gredbyg tan impresionante e imponente que podría resultar más peligrosa que las operaciones mineras de los orcos."}},
[5941]={nameES="Nodrizas grodbog",objectivesES={"Nodrizas grodbog","Auti está en Guardia Orca, al noroeste de Nud-heden.\
\
Auti se alegrará de oír que los gredbyg han sido derrotados y ya no están cuidando a sus crías.","Los gredbyg se encuentran en Nud-heden, en el Agujero Chirriante, al sureste de Guardia Orca.\
\
Auti quiere quemates a los gredbyg que están cuidando de las crías.","Habla con Auti en Guardia Orca","Auti ha recibido informes que tras las puertas los gredbyg estaban guardando, estaban criando a sus pequeños."}},
[5942]={nameES="Nodrizas grodbog",objectivesES={"Nodrizas grodbog","Los gredbyg se encuentran en Nud-heden, dentro de la colmena, al sur del campamento de Kúli y Auti.\
\
Derrota a los gredbyg en Nud-heden.","Los gredbyg han convertido Nud-heden en una extensión de su colmena. Este sitio fue una vez un antiguo hogar de los enanos... y debería volver a serlo. Ve allí y mata a todos los gredbyg que encuentres.","Regresa con Auti","La antigua guarnición de Nud-heden está infestada de gredbyg. La colmena se extiende incluso hasta esta antigua morada, que es legendaria entre los enanos.","Auti acampa junto con Kúli, justo al norte de la colmena de gredbyg.\
\
Auti se alegrará de saber que los gredbyg han sido derrotados y que Nud-heden está un paso más cerca de volver a ser el hogar de los enanos."}},
[5943]={nameES="Grooming the Horses",objectivesES={}},
[5944]={nameES="Growing Concerns",objectivesES={"Growing Concerns","Return to Sílivat and inform him that you have cleansed the monstrous fungi found in Sul Madásh.","Return to Sílivat","Sílivat has given you enchanted water that he hopes will cleanse the fungi growing on the eastern edges of Sul Madásh and prevent them from spreading the blight deeper into the settlement."}},
[5945]={nameES="Corrupción creciente",objectivesES={"El límite oriental de las Vetas del Cuerno Rojo está infestado por un hongo que crece de forma agresiva.","Regresa con Knakk","Corrupción creciente","El crecimiento rápido en las Vetas del Cuerno Rojo orientales amenaza con cubrir toda la zona con lo que parece una capa de liquen e infestar todo lo que vive allí.","Knakk acampa en la pasarela elevada que está en el rincón noreste de las Vetas del Cuerno Rojo."}},
[5946]={nameES="Growing Pains",objectivesES={"Return to Lebadar","Lebadar, an elderly gardener in Minas Tirith, is having difficulty tending to his gardens during the festival.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This quest will be removed from your quest log when the current festival ends.</rgb>","Lebadar waits for you on the Second Circle, at the base of the entrance to the Third.\
\
You should assure him that the garden has been tended.","The garden lies on the Third Circle of Minas Tirith, to the north-west of the entryway between the Second and Third Circles. The statue of Steward Egalmoth keeps watch over the garden.\
\
Lebadar has asked you to pull out the weeds and water the bushes there.","Growing Pains"}},
[5947]={nameES="Growth in Darkness",objectivesES={"As you wander through the middle of Fangorn Forest, you notice Quickbeam's Huorn picking up small objects from the ground nearby and stowing them on itself.\
\
Upon closer inspection, you notice it has been gathering seed-pods from the forest floor, especially those that have fallen into the shadows.\
\
You are not quite certain why Quickbeam's Huorn is collecting them, but you decide to aid in gathering seed-pods.","Growth in Darkness","Seed-pods can be found throughout central Fangorn Forest.\
\
Quickbeam's Huorn has begun stowing away seed-pods to plant as you travel. You should aid in collecting them.","You pause to present the seed-pods to Quickbeam's Huorn. Unaware of any other means to deliver the seeds to your large companion, you tuck them into a notch in its trunk.\
\
The Huorn shudders, hurling a seed-pod down to the nearby earth and then gently pats it into the soil.\
\
Taking this as a sign that the Huorn will disperse the seed-pods itself, you decide to press on.","Quickbeam's Huorn can be found at your side or can be called with your whistle.\
\
You have gathered many seed-pods from the forest floor and should now give them to Quickbeam's Huorn.","In the wake of death and decay permeating Fangorn Forest, Quickbeam's Huorn has taken up the task of dispersing fallen seeds.","Give the seed-pods to Quickbeam's Huorn","DNT -- Players will not see"}},
[5948]={nameES="Ganado a regañadientes",objectivesES={"Gánate la confianza de Lauri","La desconfianza de los Lossoth hacia ti se interpone en cualquier intento de seguir explorando Forochel. Impresionar a Ora, una de las jefas de los Lossoth, puede ser la única manera de continuar tus esfuerzos en la región.","Kaj, el hijo de Ora, puede encontrarse cerca de ella, en la cabaña principal. Lauri, el mejor explorador de Ora, se encuentra cerca de la puerta sur de Pynti-peldot. Niko, el Maestro de la Caza de Ora, puede encontrarse en su campamento, siguiendo el camino hacia el suroeste.\
\
Ora te dijo que debías ganarte su confianza ayudando a otros Lossoth de su tribu y te sugirió que empezaras por su hijo Kaj, el explorador Lauri y Niko, su Maestro de la Caza.","Ora se encuentra en Pynti-peldot.\
\
Una vez ganada la confianza de tres Lossoth, deberías regresar de inmediato con Ora.","Gánate la confianza de Kaj","Gánate la confianza de Niko","Habla con la jefa Ora","Ganado a regañadientes"}},
[5949]={nameES="Gruesome Remains",objectivesES={"Húrin leads the grim task of collecting the remains of comrades catapulted into Minas Tirith by the Enemy.","Gruesome Remains","Picked up an unfilled barrel","You should use the unfilled barrel to collect any scattered remains that you can find on the outer walls of Minas Tirith.","You should pick up an unfilled barrel so that you can collect any scattered remains found on the outer walls in Minas Tirith.","Húrin can be found outside the front gates of Minas Tirith.\
\
You should deliver the filled barrel to Húrin.","Deliver the filled barrel to Húrin","Pick up an unfilled barrel"}},
[5950]={nameES="Grugáth Unleashed",objectivesES={}},
[5951]={nameES="Grumbling and Rumbling",objectivesES={}},
[5952]={nameES="Grumbling at the Fountain",objectivesES={"You have ushered away a number of dissenters in the Court of the Fount, restoring order to the bustling square.","Dissenters of Lothíriel's rule can be found in the Court of the Fount.\
\
You should disperse the dissenters.","Grumbling at the Fountain","Completado","The Swan-knight Beriadir has asked you to break up groups of dissenters from the Court of the Fount, for they are disturbing the peace in that fine square."}},
[5953]={nameES="Grár's Seal",objectivesES={"Habla con Náin","Mazalu Ugshar, The Scholar's Abode can be found in Erebor.\
\
You should seek out Mazalu Ugshar.","Seek the entrance of the Howling Pit","Find Grár's Key","Travel to Erebor","Grár's Seal","The key is not here","The entrance to the Howling Pit can be found beyond the last mithril door, deep within Járnfast.\
\
You should seek the entrance of the Howling Pit.","The entrance to the Howling Pit can be found beyond the last mithril door, deep within Járnfast.\
\
You should examine the entrance of the Howling Pit.","Erebor can be found in the north of the Dale-lands.\
\
You should travel to Erebor.","Bring Grár's Key to Náin","Náin can be found next to the Howling Pit.\
\
You should talk to Náin.","Examine the entrance of the Howling Pit","You found Grár's Key!","Glóthin can be found in Erebor.\
\
You should talk to Glóthin.","Mazalu Ugshar can be found in Erebor.\
\
You should search The Scholar's Abode for Grár's Key.","Seek out Mazalu Ugshar","The mithril plate over the pit has a small hole in it!","The last mithril seal guarding the Howling Pit remains intact. It can only be opened safely with that of a special key, kept safe within the walls of Erebor.","Náin said the key could be found in Mazalu Ugshar, The Scholar's Abode","Náin can be found in Járnfast.\
\
You should return to Náin.","Glóthin allows you full access to Mazalu Ugshar","Beyond lies the final barrier between Járnfast and the Howling Pit","The nearby guard wants to have a word with you","Talk to Glóthin"}},
[5954]={nameES="Guard of the Citadel",objectivesES={"Talk to Peregrin Took once more, despite his reluctance","The Thirsty Seer is in the Fifth Circle of Minas Tirith. The picnic lunch that Pippin ordered should be ready for you to pick up and carry to the Watch-point at the end of the pier on the top of the city.","You are sharing a delicious picnic with Pippin at the Watch-point atop the city. He has reluctantly begun to tell you what brought him to Minas Tirith with Gandalf, but he could use some coaxing.","Your picnic at the Watch-point is done, and now it is time to clean it up.","Peregrin Took may be a Guard of the Citadel, but he is still a hobbit and enjoys good food and good company above all else.","Eat and drink some of the picnic food","You clean up the picnic and put everything away","You are sharing a delicious picnic with Pippin at the Watch-point atop the city.","Clean up the picnic at the Watch-point","Pippin eats in silence","The brew is most refreshing","Talk to Peregrin Took at his post in the Citadel","Pippin stands and gazes off into the distance","You set out the picnic lunch, and everything looks delicious","Talk to Peregrin Took at the Watch-point at the end of the pier","Pippin is focused on his food, and does not seem eager to talk.","It tastes delicious!","It tastes very good, but you are becoming worried about Pippin","The food tastes fine enough","You sip the brew, and it refreshes you","It tastes very good!","Pippin is waiting for you at the Watch-point on the end of the pier at the top of Minas Tirith.","Pippin has returned to his post in the Citadel, the Seventh Circle of the city.","You are sharing a delicious picnic with Pippin at the Watch-point atop the city. The hobbit became very evasive when recounting the reason for his journey to Minas Tirith with Gandalf.","Guard of the Citadel","Pick up the picnic lunch from The Thirsty Seer in the south-west section of the Fifth Circle"}},
[5955]={nameES="Guardián: La hazaña más valiente es la desinteresada.",objectivesES={"Reúnete con Wáli para recibir más entrenamiento de Guardián.","Como Guardián, has alcanzado tal renombre que has recibido una convocatoria de Wáli de Gondamon, en Ered Luin.\
\
Deberías buscar a Wáli para recibir más entrenamiento en tu clase.","Guardián: La hazaña más valiente es la desinteresada.","El enano Wáli está en el puesto de avanzada de Noglond, al sur de la Mansión de Thorin y al oeste de la ciudad enana de Gondamon, en Ered Luin.\
\
Se te ha dicho que hables con Wáli, un guardián valiente que podría tener algunas palabras para ti."}},
[5956]={nameES="Guardián: El Camino del Defensor de los Pueblos Libres",objectivesES={"Habla con Dithrik en las Fundaciones de Piedra","Guardián: El Camino del Defensor de los Pueblos Libres"}},
[5957]={nameES="Guardians of Dol Amroth",objectivesES={}},
[5958]={nameES="Guardianes del claro",objectivesES={"El primer pedestal está al este de Lin Giliath, y los otros dos al sur de él, en una gran recodo del pantano.\
\
Meldichen te ha dado varias runas para colocarlas en los pedestales de piedra en Meluinen, lo que espera que llame a los guardianes del claro a la defensa.","Los guardianes del pantano no parecen interesados en la runa","Medlichen está en Lin Giliath.\
\
Medlichen espera noticias de que has colocado exitosamente los canel en los pedestales de piedra de Meluinen.","A Meldichen le preocupa que los trolls de las rocas vuelvan cuando sepan que los Elfos han vuelto a Lin Giliath y cree que debería reforzar las defensas.","Guardianes del claro"}},
[5959]={nameES="Guardians of the Nest",objectivesES={}},
[5960]={nameES="Guarding the Crossing",objectivesES={"Corsairs and their grappling hooks can be found atop the overlook in Linhir.\
\
You have discovered Corsairs that scaled the walls of Linhir and should defeat them before throwing down their hooks.","Erchar can be found in Linhir in eastern Dor-en-Ernil.\
\
You have completed your patrol and routed a small band of Corsairs that attempted to infiltrate the city. You should now return to Erchar.","Patrol the overlook in southern Linhir","Patrol Linhir's gates to Lebennin","Corsairs have climbed into Linhir!","Talk to Erchar in Linhir","Guarding the Crossing","Linhir's gates to Dor-en-Ernil can be found in the north-western part of the city and Linhir's gates to Lebennin can be found to the south-west.\
\
Erchar has asked you to patrol the gates of Linhir for any sign of the Enemy.","Patrol Linhir's gates to Dor-en-Ernil","The Corsairs and Haradrim have not renewed their attacks from within Dor-en-Ernil","The Corsairs have not renewed their attacks from Lebennin","Concerned that the Corsairs will continue to assault Linhir, Erchar has asked you to patrol the crossing.","The overlook can be found in the southernmost part of Linhir.\
\
You should patrol the overlook and ensure that the Corsairs at Ethillorn are not rallying a new assault."}},
[5961]={nameES="Guarding the Ocean",objectivesES={}},
[5962]={nameES="Guarding the Vale",objectivesES={"Guarding the Vale","Spiders and Orcs are on the verge of discovering the hidden vale which is to be the mustering location for the Eagles, Landroval and Meneldor.","Spiders and Orcs wander among the trees just west of the hidden clearing where Landroval waits.\
\
Landroval has asked you to defeat the nearby Orcs and Spiders to allow his meeting location to remain hidden from enemy eyes.","Return to the eagle Landroval in his clearing","Landroval can be found at the clearing of trees in the north-east section of the Wailing Hills.\
\
Landroval awaits your return at the hidden clearing."}},
[5963]={nameES="Guarding the Watch-tower",objectivesES={}},
[5964]={nameES="Guarding the Watch-towers",objectivesES={"The watch-towers west of the gate are besieged by enemies crossing the trench to scale the dike. The scouts above the watch-towers are in grave danger. Should the towers become razed by the enemy, a great asset in defending the dike will be lost.\
\
Merit Rating\
\
This quest starts with <rgb=#FFFF00>Partial</rgb> Merit Rating.\
\
<rgb=#00FF00>Minor Point Gain</rgb>\
* Every scout remaining in the watch-tower upon defeating each wave\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Major Point Loss</rgb>\
* A watch-tower becomes structurally damaged\
* A Rohirrim scout becomes defeated","Guarding the Watch-towers","The watch-towers upon Helm's Dike grant a favourable position for the Rohirrim. Scouts will mark the numbers of the coming force and fire their arrows upon them as they approach. The enemy will make every effort to take away the advantage the towers provide, you must protect the towers and the archers who fight to defend them."}},
[5965]={nameES="Tarea de los guardias: Garras de púas",objectivesES={"Los enanos de la expedición minera han solicitado una colección de garras de púas.","Esta caja de recolección es revisada diariamente por los enanos. Tu colección seguramente llegará a la parte solicitante.","Se busca: Garras de púas","Tarea de los guardias: Garras de púas","Se busca: Garras de púas\
\
Los enanos de la expedición minera han solicitado una colección de garras de púas.","Las cajas de recolección para esta tarea se pueden encontrar en los principales centros de Moria.\
