[6087]={nameES="Hashadîr - Slavers of Men",objectivesES={}},
[6088]={nameES="Hashadîr - Trapping the Beach",objectivesES={"The beach is at Hashadîr, to the south of Dol Amroth.\
\
Tolían asked you to place several traps along the beach to damage the corsair boats.","Hashadîr - Trapping the Beach","Traps need to be placed along the beach near Hashadîr. These will damage any small boats they bring ashore.","Tolrían can be found in Dol Amroth.\
\
Tolrían will be pleased to the beach has been trapped.","Speak to Tolrían"}},
[6089]={nameES="Hashadîr - Trapping the Beach",objectivesES={"Traps need to be placed along the beach near Hashadîr. These will damage any small boats they bring ashore.","Hashadîr - Trapping the Beach","The beach is at Hashadîr, to the south of Dol Amroth.\
\
Tolrían asked you to place several traps along the beach to damage the Corsair boats.","Tolrían can be found in Dol Amroth.\
\
Tolrían will be pleased to the beach has been trapped.","Speak to Tolrían"}},
[6090]={nameES="El odio al oso y al hombre",objectivesES={"El odio al oso y al hombre","Habla con Langhár en Ost Guruth","Langhár se encuentra en Ost Guruth, la fortaleza en ruinas de las Tierras Solitarias.\
\
Has derrotado a Ofolmóth y puesto fin al peligro que representaba para los Pueblos Libres de Eriador, aunque no sin consecuencias.","Tu hermana Langhár ha sido enviada a Ost Guruth, en las Tierras Solitarias, para dar caza a uno de la estirpe de Beorn que se ha vuelto hacia el mal.","Langhár se encuentra en Ost Guruth, la fortaleza en ruinas de las Tierras Solitarias.\
\
Langhár te ha pedido que la ayudes a enfrentarse a Ofolmóth, un Beórnida que se ha vuelto hacia el mal.","Habla con Langhár y viaja con ella para enfrentarte a Ofolmóth"}},
[6091]={nameES="Callejón embrujado",objectivesES={"Encontraste un anillo","Investiga un fantasma en Bree","Las ruinas de las que habló el alcalde están en un callejón no muy lejos de la Puerta Sur, a la derecha.\
\
El alcalde Tenderlarch te ha pedido que investigues los rumores sobre un callejón embrujado y que tranquilices a los agentes de la ley de Bree. Te ha pedido que visites el callejón por la noche, ya que es el único momento en que se ha informado del fantasma.","Cuando le ofreces el anillo al espectro, el espíritu te mira con una nueva luz en sus ojos translúcidos. '¡El anillo... el anillo!\
\
'¡Ah! ¡Por fin! Me has aliviado de una pequeña carga de mi lista de deudas impagas y juramentos incumplidos. Con la devolución de este anillo, siento como si las nieblas se despejaran ante mis ojos...\
\
'Espera un momento, y te explicaré mi presencia aquí.'","El callejón del espectro está cerca de la Puerta Sur, en unas viejas ruinas.\
\
Deberías llevar el anillo que encontraste al espectro y ver si eso lo apacigua. Es probable que el espectro solo aparezca en el callejón por la noche.","Devuelve el anillo al espectro.","Encuentra el anillo perdido","El alcalde de Bree ha recibido informes de un fantasma en un callejón, pero ninguno de los agentes de la ley quiere investigar el rumor.","El espectro parece incapaz de verte. Canta en un monótono tono apagado: 'Ay... perdido para siempre... nunca será devuelto...\
\
'El anillo... devuelve el anillo... bajo la puerta de la barraca...\
\
'La piedra negra... escondida por la piedra negra...'","El anillo está escondido en la puerta de una barraca, pero no hay barracas en Bree. Sin embargo, el espectro también mencionó una piedra negra.\
\
Quizás si localizas este anillo perdido del que habló el espectro, pueda descansar.","Callejón embrujado"}},
[6092]={nameES="Bosque embrujado",objectivesES={"Regresa con Toly Tejonera junto a la Puerta que limita con el Bosque Viejo y Los Gamos.\
\
El árbol muerto ha sido derribado, y aunque todavía hay un gran mal agitando el bosque, las fronteras de Los Gamos deberían ver cierto alivio. Debes volver con la noticia a Gillemin Brandigamo.","Habla con Toly Tejonera","Descubre la fuente de los problemas del bosque","El nido de arañas se encuentra cerca del Claro del Sauce, al sur del antiguo campamento de Gillemin. Busca allí señales del árbol enojado.\
\
Gillemin te dijo que la fuente del malestar del bosque probablemente se encontraba dentro del hueco de las arañas más allá del río Tornasauce hacia el sur, dentro del Bosque Viejo.","Bosque embrujado","Gillemin Brandigamo cree que el gran árbol que encontró está en el centro de la agitación del Bosque Viejo."}},
[6093]={nameES="Tierras embrujadas",objectivesES={"Glamír está cerca de las Aguas Lúgubres, al oeste de Emyn Hoedh y al noreste de Gondamon.\
\
Deberías hablar con Glamír y averiguar si ha encontrado una forma de derrotar a los seres de los montículos de una vez por todas.","Glamír ha encontrado la fuente de la corrupción de Haudh Lin: un montículo de seres malignos.","Estos seres habitan los montículos de Emyn Hoedh, al este de las Aguas Lúgubres.\
\
Glamír te ha pedido que luches contra los seres de los montículos de Haudh Lin mientras él busca una forma de librar la tierra de su presencia.","Tierras embrujadas"}},
[6094]={nameES="Haunting the Dead",objectivesES={"The screams of Rohirrim pierce the air as you press onward","You have found a passage into the heart of the White Mountains","Find the leader of the Rashat-hai","Patrol Gurz-shâpol","The lair of the Rashat-hai can be found atop Dunharrow along the White Mountains.\
\
Ellen Fremedon has asked that you find and explore the lair of the Orcs that terrorize the people of Underharrow.","Gurz-shâpol can be found atop the northern border of Dunharrow within the White Mountains.\
\
You have discovered the Orcs and heard Rohirrim nearby. You should continue exploring the cave.","Gurz-shâpol can be found atop the northern border of Dunharrow within the White Mountains.\
\
You have encountered the Orcs, but you know there is more to be found in the depths of this cave.","Crude banners wave in the dank air of Gurz-shâpol","Ellen Fremedon grows concerned by the Orc presence in the Harrowdale as her people make ready to travel to Dunharrow.","Patrol deeper into Gurz-shâpol","You see one of the Orcs keeping watch in the distance","Gurz-shâpol can be found atop the northern border of Dunharrow within the White Mountains.\
\
You have found the Orc-cave, and should now explore it.","Ellen Fremedon can be found outside the Mead Hall of Underharrow.\
\
You have purged the cave of the Rashat-hai and saved the people of Rohan from their vile plans. You should return to Ellen with these tidings.","Haunting the Dead","Complete Quest: Master of the Dead-Folk","Find the Orc-cave in the White Mountains","Gurz-shâpol can be found atop the northern border of Dunharrow within the White Mountains.\
\
You have encountered many Orcs, captive Rohirrim, and even athelas, but you have yet to find the Rashat-hai leader. You should continue your search.","You spot an extremely pale Orc in the depths of the cave","While exploring, you spot athelas growing on the cave floor","Gurz-shâpol can be found atop the northern border of Dunharrow within the White Mountains.\
\
You have made it deep into the Orc cave, but have seen no sign of the Orc-leader. You should continue your search.","Talk to Ellen Fremedon","The leader of the Rashat-hai can be found in the deepest reaches of Gurz-shâpol.\
\
You have found the Orc-leader and should now defeat him for the good of the people of Underharrow."}},
[6095]={nameES="Haunting the Vale",objectivesES={"While exploring the Hill of Erech after nightfall, you have discovered numerous Dead wandering around the Stone. Judging by their actions, these Dead are ruthless and despise your presence in the vale.\
\
You should defeat them in the hopes they will return to the Paths of the Dead and trouble the people of Blackroot Vale no more.","You have defeated many of the Dead on the Hill of Erech. While they will return in time, the people of Blackroot Vale shall enjoy a brief respite from the unsettling presence of the Dead.","The Dead can be found around the Stone of Erech at night.\
\
You have encountered numerous Dead around the Stone of Erech and should defeat them in the hope they return to the Paths of the Dead.","Haunting the Vale","DNT -- will not be seen","You have laid many of the Dead to rest, albeit temporarily.","Night has fallen, and the Dead now wander the Hill of Erech","Completado","The presence of the Dead in the vale threatens all, but perhaps if laid to rest once more, they shall return to the Paths of the Dead.","Defeat the Dead at the Stone of Erech"}},
[6096]={nameES="Havoc and Hounds",objectivesES={}},
[6097]={nameES="Caos en Eshadûr",objectivesES={"Busca en Eshadûr la pólvora negra explosiva y destruye cualquier contenedor de esta sustancia que encuentres.","Los Dumûri han aprendido que los Ordâkhai en Eshadûr han reabastecido su suministro de pólvora negra.","Caos en Eshadûr"}},
[6098]={nameES="Hay is for Horses",objectivesES={"The stables of Avardin have been in turmoil as of late. Lack of money, supplies, and storms have all contributed to the stables being shuttered.","Bring the hay to Levelha in Avardin","Hay can be found to the east of Avardin.\
\
Levelha has asked you to collect hay for the horses.","Levelha is in Avardin, in the central Starkmoor.\
\
Levelha will be pleased to see you have brought the hay back.","Hay is for Horses"}},
[6099]={nameES="Haycliff: Frog-slime",objectivesES={"Haycliff: Frog-slime","<rgb=#FF0000>Completing Aiding the Eastemnet will cancel this quest</rgb>","Dernstan is at Eaworth.\
\
Dernstan will be happy to start scraping the slime off of the frogs you gathered.","Talk to Dernstan","The frogs of the Haycliff have a slime covering their bodies that is a natural antiseptic.","Frogs can be found within the Haycliff.\
\
Dernstad asked you to venture within the Haycliff and return with several frogs."}},
[6100]={nameES="Haycliff: Terrors of the Forest",objectivesES={"Wood-trolls can be found at the Haycliff.\
\
Dernstan has asked to venture within the Haycliff and defeat the Wood-trolls found there.","The Wood-trolls within the Haycliff guard it fiercely, preventing access and travel to all.","Dernstan is at Eaworth.\
\
Dernstan will be pleased to hear you have defeated many Wood-trolls within the Haycliff.","Haycliff: Terrors of the Forest","<rgb=#FF0000>Completing Aiding the Eastemnet will cancel this quest</rgb>","Talk to Dernstan"}},
[6101]={nameES="He Says Shield Shells",objectivesES={"Talk to Luarch at the hunters' camp","Turtle-shells are used for many purposes in Lhan Rhos.","He Says Shield Shells","Turtles can be found throughout the southern Dunbog.\
\
Luarch has asked you to hunt turtles in the area and collect their shells."}},
[6102]={nameES="Aquel que lidera",objectivesES={"Con Nadelek derrotado, deberías volver a ver a Vämmä en Sûri-kylä y hablarle sobre tu victoria.","Nadelek derrotado","Vämmä teme que un nuevo jefe der guerra pueda haberse alzado entre los Gauredain para llevarlos a la batalla en gran número.","Derrota a Nadelek","Nadelek mora en algún lugar del interior de Barad Gaurhoth.\
\
Vämmä te ha pedido que busques al jefe de guerra Gauradan, Nadelek, y le derrotes.","Aquel que lidera"}},
[6103]={nameES="Head of the Fallen Beast",objectivesES={"Habla con Éomer","Head of the Fallen Beast","You should talk to Éomer, who can be found at Aragorn's pavilion on the after-battle Pelennor.","Éomer, King of Rohan, has decided to investigate the slain fell-beast of the Witch-king."}},
[6104]={nameES="Head of the Herd",objectivesES={"Líshu returns to Nahíd's side","Talk to Líshu","You let Líshu know she has done a good job, and offer a pat on the head.\
\
'Rowf!'\
\
She offers a single bark and a wagging tail in return.","Nahíd's sheep have returned, but need to be herded into their pen.\
\
You should <rgb=#00FFFF>whistle</rgb> at Líshu to let her know it is time to work.","Shepherd Nahíd's sheep have returned, but they now need to herded back into their pen.","The sheep have all been returned to their pen.\
\
You should let Líshu know she has done a good job!\
\
If Líshu is missing, you can use Líshu's Horn, on the fence near Nahíd, to recall her.","Líshu is ready to herd the sheep into their pen.\
\
You should <rgb=#00FFFF>point</rgb> at the sheep near the pen to instruct Líshu to herd them.\
\
If Líshu is missing, you can use Líshu's Horn, on the fence near Nahíd, to recall her.","Head of the Herd","Talk to Nahíd","Líshu snaps to your side, ready to work!","Líshu's job is finished.\
\
You should talk to Nahíd.","<rgb=#00FFFF>Whistle</rgb> at Líshu"}},
[6105]={nameES="Head to Haerondir",objectivesES={}},
[6106]={nameES="Heading Off the Stampede",objectivesES={}},
[6107]={nameES="Rumbo al Oeste",objectivesES={"Habla con Aradia fuera del Gran Túmulo","Othrongroth, el Gran Túmulo, se encuentra cuesta arriba desde el pequeño campamento en el sur de las Quebradas de los Túmulos. Los espíritus malignos pueden encontrarse dentro de Othrongroth, tras una puerta marcada con una calavera.\
\
Como último favor antes de abandonar la Tierra Media, Aradia y sus compañeros desean ayudar a purificar la Sombra de Angmar de las Quebradas de los Túmulos. Ella te ha pedido que entres en Othrongroth y enfrentes a los espíritus malignos que allí habitan.","Rumbo al Oeste","Tres Elfos que viajaban hacia los Puertos Grises llegaron a las Quebradas de los Túmulos tras percibir una gran corrupción que emanaba del Gran Túmulo. Su estancia en las tierras de Bree no terminará hasta que ayuden a purificar la tierra de una antigua corrupción antes de partir hacia el Oeste.","Aradia está acampada fuera del Gran Túmulo.\
\
Deberías regresar con Aradia para informarle de tu éxito contra los espíritus malignos del Gran Túmulo."}},
[6108]={nameES="Healing Khûtra, Part 1",objectivesES={"Heshra has asked you to procure large quantities of ingredients he needs from Ziriha, the merchant. She can be found near the fishing pier.","Talk to Ziriha, the merchant","Return to Heshra, the herbalist","Healing Khûtra, Part 1","Return to Heshra the herbalist in the Elder Hall.","Give dried ingredients to Heshra, the herbalist","Administer salve to afflicted Khûtra villagers. They can be found on the rocks just outside of Khûtra, to the east.","Give dried ingredients to Heshra in the Elder Hall.","Heshra has asked you to bring him large quantities of the ingredients he needs for the improved healing salve."}},
[6109]={nameES="Healing Khûtra, Part 2",objectivesES={"Return to Elder Ilaya outside the Elder Hall.","Healing Khûtra, Part 2","Speak with Elder Ilaya","Administered salve to glum diseased pig","Administered salve to boisterous diseased pig","Elder Ilaya has asked that you administer the improved salve to the afflicted goats and pigs in Khûtra. The goats can be found outside the Elder Hall.","Administered salve to scheming diseased pig","Administered salve to happy diseased pig","Administered salve to sullen diseased pig","Administer salve to scheming diseased pig","Administer salve to sullen diseased pig","Administer salve to glum diseased pig","Speak to Elder Ilaya about administering the improved salve to the livestock in Khûtra.","Administer salve to boisterous diseased pig","Administer salve to despondent diseased pig","Administered salve to despondent diseased pig","You should administer the salve to diseased pigs in Khûtra. They can be found in a pen outside the Elder Hall.","Administer salve to happy diseased pig"}},
[6110]={nameES="Healing Khûtra, Part 3",objectivesES={"Speak with Umaris, the fisher. She can be found by the fishing pier.","Return to Umaris by the fishing pier.","Speak with Umaris, the fisher","Umaris has asked you to distribute the salve to the five best fishing spots in Khûtra. These fishing spots start on the fishing pier and then move west along the shore.","Return to Umaris","Umaris has asked you to distribute the salve to the best fishing spots in Khûtra.","Healing Khûtra, Part 3"}},
[6111]={nameES="Reservas de remedios",objectivesES={"Hodric Ciñatiesa vive en el lado del bosque de Casa Brandi en Los Gamos.\
\
El hobbit Hodric Ciñatiesa suministra a Zancafirme el ungüento curativo que este vende a Cartwell el Sanguijuela.","Bruner Zancafirme hace negocios en la Puerta de Combe en Bree.\
\
Hodric, no del todo contento, te entregó la caja que Bruner pidió. Debes llevársela a Zancafirme de inmediato.","Consigue una caja de ungüento aceitoso de Hodric Ciñatiesa","Lleva la caja de ungüento a Bruner Zancafirme","Reservas de remedios","Cartwell el Sanguijuela ha pedido algunos suministros a Bruner Zancafirme, quien a su vez se ha quedado sin existencias."}},
[6112]={nameES="Healing the Haban'akkâ",objectivesES={"Talk to Thorin at Amdân","Healing the Haban'akkâ","Thorin can be found at Amdân.\
\
You have delivered the antidote to the poisoned warriors at Amdân. You should return to Thorin.","Poisoned warriors can be found at Amdân.\
\
Thorin has tasked you with administering an antidote to the poisoned warriors resting at Amdân.","After Edash discovered a cure for the Orkish poisons used by Azog and his clan, the Dwarves of the Haban'akkâ have gained renewed hope for victory at Azanulbizar."}},
[6113]={nameES="Healing the Hurt",objectivesES={}},
[6114]={nameES="Healing the Lost",objectivesES={"Desperate to maintain their foothold within Osgiliath, Golthor and the Rangers ask your aid in recovering long-hidden stores of valuable goods.","Healing the Lost","Deliver the recovered goods to Golthor","Food-stores and athelas can be found within the Houses of Healing in eastern Osgiliath.\
\
Golthor has asked you to recover hidden stores of food and athelas that were stowed away by the Rangers for times of war.","Golthor can be found outside the Houses of Healing in eastern Osgiliath.\
\
You have recovered many food-stores and bundles of athelas and should now deliver them to Golthor."}},
[6115]={nameES="Heaps of the Stuff",objectivesES={}},
[6116]={nameES="Heart of Glass",objectivesES={"Defeat Glérgangol in Glittengrof","Heart of Glass","Talk to Vithin in Glittengrof","Vithin can be found in Glittengrof in Gloomingtarn.\
\
You have defeated Glérgangol and done much to hinder the glass-spiders invading Glittengrof. You should return to Vithin.","Glérgangol can be found in Glittengrof in Gloomingtarn.\
\
Vithin has asked you to seek out the elusive Glérgangol and put an end to her before her brood overwhelms Gloomingtarn and the rest of Mount Gundabad.","Glérgangol's carapace shatters as she falls defeated!","Sheltering in the webs of a massive brood-mother known as Glérgangol, glass-spiders now dwell within the ancient crystal-lodes of Glittengrof."}},
[6117]={nameES="Corazón de las Aguas",objectivesES={"Al buscar el origen de las aguas envenenadas, encontraste un extraño garfio óseo y se lo mostraste a Fimreg.","Corazón de las Aguas","Rhúnelleth está en Tármunn Súrsa, al este de Carn Dûm.\
\
Viajaste profundamente dentro de Carn Dûm y mataste a la temida bestia conocida como Helchgam.","Derrota a Helchgam","Tármunn Súrsa está al noroeste de Gath Forthnír, más allá de las Puertas de Carn Dûm.\
\
Fimreg te ha pedido que hables con Rhúnelleth en Tármunn Súrsa.","Helchgam acecha en las aguas de Carn Dûm, más allá de las puertas al oeste de Himbar.\
\
Rhúnelleth reveló que la fuente del veneno es una criatura de muchos brazos a la que llamó Helchgam.","Helchgam derrotado"}},
[6118]={nameES="Heart or Gold",objectivesES={"Randgar's spear seems to have been left on the ground","Examine the discarded cloak","Bring Randgar's cloak to Inhild in Cliving","Heart or Gold","Randgar has devised a plan to win the admiration of Inhild's callous father in the hopes that the young couple might someday be together in happiness.","Examine the discarded spear","Defeat the Uruk-hai Looter and collect his stolen valuables","Randgar is nowhere to be seen. Signs of struggle are visible here","Randgar's cloak has been torn and is stained with blood","The Uruk-hai looter has been seen by Randgar travelling between many of the deserted homes south of Randgar's farm.\
\
Randgar has guessed that the Uruk-hai looter may be carrying enough valuables to impress Inhild's father, if Randgar were to possess them, and wishes you to obtain them.","You have defeated the looter, but he carried no such stolen valuables","Randgar lives on a small farm, south and east of Cliving, along the road.\
\
The Uruk-hai looter bore none of the valuables that Randgar had hoped for, and a new course of action must be taken. You should return to Randgar and let him know.","Return to Randgar at the farmstead","Inhild resides at an estate, just east of the central fountain in Cliving, with her father.\
\
With Randgar missing and a disturbed scene found at his home, Inhild should be informed of the events that have transpired.","Randgar lives on a small farm, south and east of Cliving, along the road.\
\
Randgar is not to be seen. Several things at the farm seem amiss and worth inspecting."}},
[6119]={nameES="Hearts of Shadow",objectivesES={}},
[6120]={nameES="Heath of Cold",objectivesES={"You should defeat any fierce cold-drakes and grims that you find while exploring the Withered Heath.","Fierce cold-drakes and frost grims roam in numbers upon the Withered Heath and must be defeated.","You should defeat any drakes that you find while exploring the Withered Heath.","You have successfully defeated many of the cold-drakes and frost grims that roam the Withered Heath. The Zhélruka will surely be thankful of your efforts.","Fierce cold-drakes and frost grims roam in numbers upon the Withered Heath and must be defeated if the Grey Mountains are to ever be safe.","Completado","Heath of Cold","Defeated fierce cold-drakes and frost grims.","Defeat fierce cold-drakes and frost grims"}},
[6121]={nameES="Heavy Lifting",objectivesES={"Your Uruk-hai overseer has more work for you to do in the caverns beneath Isengard.","Sagrúrz is in the centre of the main cavern beneath Isengard.\
\
Your Uruk-hai overseer has another task for you, this one near the great forges in the centre of the caverns.","Kenned's barrel of weapons is right next to him.\
\
Kenned cannot carry the barrel of weapons Sagrúrz has charged him to carry, so you are going to carry it for him.","You set down the barrel of armour with a heavy thud","Sagrúrz is waiting in the centre of the main cavern beneath Isengard.","Heavy Lifting","Pick up a barrel of armour","Talk to Sagrúrz in Isengard","You set down the barrel of weapons with a heavy thud and a sigh of relief","Pick up Kenned's barrel of weapons","Sagrúrz wants you to carry heavy barrels of armour and weapons up the slope to the north and to leave them on the wooden platform directly above Fâsh with the others.","The prisoner Kenned is exhausted and cannot carry the barrel Sagrúrz wants him to.","Sagrúrz is in the centre of the main cavern beneath Isengard.","Pick up a barrel of weapons","Talk to Kenned in Isengard","You set down Kenned's barrel of weapons with a heavy thud"}},
[6122]={nameES="Heeding the Call",objectivesES={"Habla con Radagast","Heeding the Call","Radagast can be found in Blómgard.\
\
You should talk to Radagast.","Radagast can be found in Rhosgobel.\
\
You should talk to Radagast.","Radagast is concerned that the Ungoledain may have come to Laerlad because they are searching for Rhosgobel.","Talk to Radagast at Rhosgobel"}},
[6123]={nameES="Heft and Haft",objectivesES={}},
[6124]={nameES="Heirs To Naught",objectivesES={"Although most were slain or routed during the Sea-stone Mutiny, several crews of Corsairs still loyal to the Heirs of Castamir have found unlikely refuge in Umbar Baharbêl.","Heirsworn Corsairs can be found around their ships at the northern and southern piers of the Sail-haven, as well as at the southern ship-yard of the Sail-haven.\
\
Eshmun has asked you to defeat Heirsworn Corsairs in the Sail-haven.","Talk to Eshmun at the Harbour-warden's Tower","Eshmun, Captain of the Haven, can be found at the Harbour-warden's Tower in the Sail-haven of Umbar Baharbêl.\
\
You have defeated many of the Heirsworn Corsairs troubling the people of the Sail-haven. You should return to Eshmun.","Heirs To Naught"}},
[6125]={nameES="Heirs and Successors",objectivesES={"Akálam's tale continues.\
\
'And so, he came to Umbar like a spectre in the night. It was said that his blade was wreathed in flame, for the ships of the Sail-haven were set alight in his wake, and the harbour burned as if the water itself had turned to blackest pitch.\
\
'Many were those who fell before him and his fleet, but none fought as bravely as my father, Akurga. He was Captain of the Haven on that dark night, and it fell to him to repel these interlopers lest all of Umbar be overthrown. Alas, before my own eyes, the villain slew my father at the doors of the Harbour-master's Tower. I was only a boy then, and rushing out from the doors, I stepped over my father to take up his spear. It seemed then that our enemy hesitated, and in that moment, I drove the spear into him with all of my might. Fleeing into the flames, he withdrew with his fleet, and he was never seen again.\
\
'And surely I dealt him a mortal blow, for had I not truly killed him, would not he have returned to avenge himself upon us?'","Meet Eshmun at the Bloody Eagle","Eshmun can be found in the Bloody Eagle, a tavern located to the east of the Harbour-warden's Tower in the Sail-haven of Umbar Baharbêl.\
\
After having an uncomfortable talk with Khôltekh the Cunning, you decide you should return to Eshmun in the Bloody Eagle.","As Akálam's story continues, you suspect you know the man he describes","Heirs and Successors","Despite its age, there appears to be dried blood on the tip of Akurga's spear","Satisfied that the Heirsworn have been routed from the Sail-haven, at least for the moment, Eshmun has invited you to accompany him to the Bloody Eagle to celebrate this victory and toast to brighter days ahead.","As Akálam's tale concludes, you turn your attention back to him","Examine Akurga's spear in the Bloody Eagle","Akálam is telling his tale of the bane of Umbar in the Bloody Eagle.\
\
After speaking with Akálam, you believe you know the identity of the bane of Umbar. You should continue to listen to his tale.","Akálam can be found behind the bar in the rear of the Bloody Eagle.\
\
Akálam has nearly concluded his tale of the bane of Umbar. You should talk to Akálam.","Khôltekh the Cunning can be found in the Bloody Eagle, in the Sail-haven.\
\
After listening to Akálam's tale, you heard a chuckle at the end of the bar in the Bloody Eagle, and it appears that Khôltekh the Cunning, one of the Kindred of the Coins, was amused by some aspect of Akálam's tale.","You find Eshmun standing near the rear of the tavern, already holding a drink","Eshmun can be found in the Bloody Eagle, a tavern located to the east of the Harbour-warden's Tower in the Sail-haven of Umbar Baharbêl.\
\
You have found Eshmun in the Bloody Eagle. You should talk to Eshmun.","Akurga's spear can be found behind the bar in the rear of the Bloody Eagle.\
\
Eshmun has asked you to examine Akurga's spear in the Bloody Eagle.","Talk to Akálam in the Bloody Eagle","Akálam can be found behind the bar in the rear of the Bloody Eagle.\
\
After inspecting Akurga's spear, you have caught the attention of the tavern keep of the Bloody Eagle, Akálam. You should talk to Akálam.","Talk to Khôltekh the Cunning in the Bloody Eagle","The Bloody Eagle is a tavern located to the east of the Harbour-warden's Tower in the Sail-haven of Umbar Baharbêl.\
\
Eshmun has asked you to meet him at the Bloody Eagle to celebrate your victory over the Heirsworn in the Sail-haven. You should meet Eshmun at the Bloody Eagle.","Listen to Akálam's tale of the bane of Umbar","A wry chuckle echoes from the end of the bar","Talk to Eshmun in the Bloody Eagle"}},
[6126]={nameES="Helchon, recién juramentado",objectivesES={"Helchon, recién juramentado","Helchon se encuentra entre los más jóvenes de los Dúnedain que han jurado lealtad a Aragorn, y está ansioso por demostrar su valía.","Helchon grita en señal de triunfo y promete reunirse contigo fuera de Tornhad","Una vez completada su patrulla, Helchon te espera fuera de Tornhad.","Habla con Helchon en Tornhad","Habla con Helchon fuera de las ruinas de Thelgarth, en lo alto de Tornhad","El deber de Helchon para hoy es patrullar cerca de las ruinas de Thelgarth, al sur y en lo alto de Tornhad. Ha acordado reunirse contigo allí."}},
[6127]={nameES="Helegrod Drake - Raid",objectivesES={}},
[6128]={nameES="Helegrod Drugoth - Raid",objectivesES={}},
[6129]={nameES="Helegrod Giant - Raid",objectivesES={}},
[6130]={nameES="Helegrod Spider - Raid",objectivesES={}},
[6131]={nameES="Brazo de Helgi Cazatrasgos",objectivesES={"La estatua de Helgi Cazatrasgos no estaría completa sin un brazo para sostener una gran hacha.\
\
Los trasgos del Camino de Durin destruyeron la estatua, y sus partes se pueden encontrar dispersas por toda la Moria. Un enano llamado Uxi se esfuerza por reconstruir esta estatua.","Arnod está en Tharâkh Bazân, al oeste de Sulnul-dûm.\
\
Arnod se alegrará de saber que encontraste la pieza de la estatua.","Encontraste el brazo de la estatua","La estatua de Helgi Cazatrasgos no estaría completa sin un brazo para sostener una gran hacha.","Encuentra el brazo de la estatua","Brazo de Helgi Cazatrasgos","El brazo de la estatua se encuentra en Sulnul-dûm, al este de Tharâkh Bazân.\
\
Debes recoger el brazo de la estatua de Helgi Cazatrasgos.","Habla con Arnod en Tharâkh Bazân"}},
[6132]={nameES="Yelmo de Helgi Cazatrasgos",objectivesES={"Simbi se encuentra en la Sala Vigesimoprimera.\
\
Has encontrado una pieza de la estatua destrozada de Helgi Cazatrasgos y deberías llevársela a un enano que la entregará a Uxi.","Has encontrado una pieza faltante de la estatua de Helgi Cazatrasgos: la parte superior de su cabeza.","Yelmo de Helgi Cazatrasgos","Has descubierto la parte superior de la cabeza de la estatua de Helgi Cazatrasgos.","Lleva la pieza de la estatua a Simbi en la Sala Vigesimoprimera"}},
[6133]={nameES="El hombro de Helgi Cazatrasgos",objectivesES={"Encuentra la pieza de la estatua","Encontraste el hombro de la estatua y parte de una cabeza","El hombro de la estatua de Helgi Cazatrasgos está en Hurmulkezer, un campamento Ghâsh-hai al sur de Anazârmekhem en las Profundidades Llameantes.\
\
Deberías recuperar la pieza de la estatua para la colección de Uxi.","Markthor se encuentra en el Cruce de las Cenizas, al oeste de Hurmulkezer.\
\
Markthor querrá saber que el hombro de la estatua está a salvo, para poder enviarlo a Uxi para su reensamblaje.","Has descubierto el hombro de la estatua de Helgi Cazatrasgos en Hurmulkezer, en las Profundidades Llameantes.\
\
Los trasgos del Camino de Durin destruyeron la estatua, y sus piezas se encuentran dispersas por toda Moria. Un enano llamado Uxi trata de reconstruirla.","Habla con Markthor en el Cruce de las Cenizas","El hombro de Helgi Cazatrasgos","Has descubierto el hombro de la estatua de Helgi Cazatrasgos en Hurmulkezer, en las Profundidades Llameantes."}},
[6134]={nameES="Hombro y brazo de Helgi Cazatrasgos",objectivesES={"Has descubierto la parte del hombro y el brazo de la estatua de Helgi Cazatrasgos de la Cámara de la Encrucijada.","Hombro y brazo de Helgi Cazatrasgos","El trozo de estatua se encuentra en el centro de las Vetas del Cuerno Rojo.\
\
Deberías llevar el trozo de estatua a alguien en las Vetas del Cuerno Rojo.","Has descubierto la parte del hombro y el brazo de la estatua de Helgi Cazatrasgos de la Cámara de la Encrucijada.\
\
Los trasgos del Camino de Durin destruyeron la estatua y sus partes pueden ser encontradas repartidas por todo Moria. Un enano llamado Uxi se ha propuesto restaurar la estatua.","Has recuperado el trozo de estatua","Lleva el trozo de estatua a Knakk","Knakk se encuentra en un campamento oculto, en una pasarela elevada de la esquina noreste de las Vetas del Cuerno Rojo.\
\
Deberías llevar el trozo de estatua a Knakk, quien puede enviársela a Uxi para que la restaure a la Cámara de la Encrucijada.","Has recuperado el hombro y el brazo de la estatua de Helgi Cazatrasgos"}},
[6135]={nameES="Empalizada de Helm",objectivesES={"The defenders of the Hornburg are busy preparing for the onslaught that will soon begin. Those left at the Dike must buy them as much time as possible.","Helm's Dike forms the first barrier of defence for Rohan's final stand. Saruman's army marches, angry and ready for war.\
\
Merit Rating\
\
This quest starts with <rgb=#FFFF00>Full</rgb> Merit Rating.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Major Merit Loss:</rgb>\
- Soldier defeated\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Moderate Merit Loss:</rgb>\
- Commander defeated\
- Banner burned","Empalizada de Helm","Gamling must survive","Speak to Gamling when you are ready to begin","Defend the Dike and buy the primary defence time"}},
[6136]={nameES="Empalizada de Helm - Comunidad",objectivesES={"Helm's Dike forms the first barrier of defence for Rohan's final stand. Saruman's army marches, angry and ready for war.\
\
Merit Rating\
\
This quest starts with <rgb=#FFFF00>Full</rgb> Merit Rating.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Major Merit Loss:</rgb>\
- Soldier defeated\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Moderate Merit Loss:</rgb>\
- Commander defeated\
- Banner burned","Gamling must survive the battle","Empalizada de Helm - Comunidad","Protect the Dike"}},
[6137]={nameES="Helm's Gate: Dwarf-expertise",objectivesES={"Cuéntale a Gimli tus observaciones sobre las fortificaciones en la Puerta de Helm","Fortifications can be found around the gate at Helm's Dike.\
\
You should examine the various fortifications of the Rohirrim.","Examine the gate","The gate is well-kept and hardy, but could easily be crushed by enemy siege-craft","Gimli is interested in the stability of the fortifications at Helm's Gate, and wishes to hear your opinion.","Gimli stands at Helm's Gate in the southern Westfold.\
\
You should speak with Gimli.","Helm's Gate: Dwarf-expertise"}},
[6138]={nameES="Puerta de Helm: El ojo periscopio de un arquero",objectivesES={"This is a good place to look","<rgb=#FF0000>Look</rgb> northward","Speak with Legolas about what you saw","Legolas stands with the King's host at Helm's Gate.\
\
You should return and speak with Legolas.","Barrels of arrows can be found lining the wall at Helm's Gate.\
\
You should count the barrels to see if the archers at Helm's Dike have enough arrows to defend Helm's Deep.","Legolas stands at Helm's Gate.\
\
You should return and speak with Legolas.","Return to Legolas","Puerta de Helm: El ojo periscopio de un arquero","You see a creeping darkness, and smoke of the burning waste left by the marching enemy. The destruction is vast indeed.","Count barrels of arrows stored at Helm's Gate","Legolas has seen the approach of the great host of Isengard, and wishes for you to look to the defences of the men stationed at the gate to Helm's Deep.","Legolas stands at Helm's Dike, his gaze cast northward.\
\
You should <rgb=#FF0000>look</rgb> to the north to get a look at the troubled plains."}},
[6139]={nameES="Puerta de Helm: Demasiado joven, demasiado viejo",objectivesES={"You bow to honour this brave soldier, and as you do so, a tear comes unbidden to his smiling eyes","Your calm words to the boy have helped his trembling to stop","Puerta de Helm: Demasiado joven, demasiado viejo","You surrender to this fearsome soldier, and he smiles brightly at you","Aragorn has asked you to rally the despondent-looking men left by Erkenbrand to defend Helm's Gate on the eve of war.","Return to Aragorn","Men can be found along Helm's Dike, manning the gate to Helm's Deep.\
\
Aragorn has asked you to cheer up the men.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This quest requires emotes. You must select your target and type the correct \\q/emote\\q into the chat box.</rgb>","The old man smiles and nods at your fair song, his heart gladdened","Aragorn can be found at Helm's Gate in the southern Westfold.\
\
You should speak with Aragorn."}},
[6140]={nameES="Tarea de los Helmingas: Orejas recortadas",objectivesES={"Se busca: Orejas recortadas de Oestemnet. Recógelas para ganar una recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista en el oeste de Rohan.","Entrega las orejas recortadas en una caja de recolección","Se busca: Orejas recortadas de Oestemnet.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Tarea de los Helmingas: Orejas recortadas","Alguien ha publicado una tarea para recoger trofeos de batalla. Se pueden entregar a cambio de una recompensa.","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir trofeos de la batalla."}},
[6141]={nameES="Tarea de los Helmingas: Alas recortadas",objectivesES={"Tarea de los Helmingas: Alas recortadas","Entrega las alas recortadas en una caja de recolección","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Se busca: Alas recortadas de Oestemnet.","Se busca: Alas recortadas de Oestemnet. Recógelas para ganar una recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista en el oeste de Rohan.","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir trofeos de la batalla.","Alguien ha publicado una tarea para recoger trofeos de batalla. Se pueden entregar a cambio de una recompensa."}},
[6142]={nameES="Tarea de los Helmingas: Pieles dañadas",objectivesES={"Se busca: Pieles dañadas de Oestemnet. Recógelas para ganar una recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista en el oeste de Rohan.","Se busca: Pieles dañadas de Oestemnet.","Tarea de los Helmingas: Pieles dañadas","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir trofeos de la batalla.","Alguien ha publicado una tarea para recoger trofeos de batalla. Se pueden entregar a cambio de una recompensa.","Entrega las pieles dañadas en una caja de recolección"}},
[6143]={nameES="Tarea de los Helmingas: Vainas de espada picadas",objectivesES={"Tarea de los Helmingas: Vainas de espada picadas","Se busca: Vainas de espada picadas de Oestemnet.","Entrega las vainas de espada picadas en una caja de recolección","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir trofeos de la batalla.","Alguien ha publicado una tarea para recoger trofeos de batalla. Se pueden entregar a cambio de una recompensa.","Se busca: Vainas de espada picadas de Oestemnet. Recógelas para ganar una recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista en el oeste de Rohan."}},
[6144]={nameES="Tarea de los Helmingas: Hachas destrozadas",objectivesES={"Entrega las hachas destrozadas en una caja de recolección","Se busca: Hachas destrozadas de Oestemnet. Recógelas para ganar una recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista en el oeste de Rohan.","Tarea de los Helmingas: Hachas destrozadas","Se busca: Hachas destrozadas de Oestemnet.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir trofeos de la batalla.","Alguien ha publicado una tarea para recoger trofeos de batalla. Se pueden entregar a cambio de una recompensa."}},
[6145]={nameES="Tarea de los Helmingas: Pieles rasgadas",objectivesES={"Entrega las pieles rasgadas en una caja de recolección","Tarea de los Helmingas: Pieles rasgadas","Se busca: Pieles rasgadas de Oestemnet.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir trofeos de la batalla.","Alguien ha publicado una tarea para recoger trofeos de batalla. Se pueden entregar a cambio de una recompensa.","Se busca: Pieles rasgadas de Oestemnet. Recógelas para ganar una recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista en el oeste de Rohan."}},
[6146]={nameES="Ayuda desde el sur",objectivesES={"Exploradores de Esteldín han intentado romper las líneas y llegar a Gath Forthnír. Hasta ahora, ninguno ha tenido éxito.","Muiladan espera en el valle al sur.\
\
Areneth te pidió que escoltaras a Muiladan, un explorador de Esteldín, hasta el campamento de los Montaraces en Gath Forthnír.","Encuentra a Muiladan","Ayuda desde el sur","Has escoltado a Muiladan a un lugar seguro.","Areneth está en Gath Forthnír, al norte.\
\
Muiladan sobrevivió al viaje hacia el norte y podrá guiar a sus compañeros hasta el campamento oculto."}},
[6147]={nameES="Helping Halach's Labourers",objectivesES={"You have finished delivering water-skins to thirsty labourers in Halach.\
\
You should talk to Gorhir at the pier.","Gorhir looks out for his fellow labourers.","Helping Halach's Labourers","There are thirsty labourers working in Halach.\
\
Gorhir has asked you to bring water-skins to them.","Talk to Gorhir"}},
[6148]={nameES="Echando una pata",objectivesES={"Atiende al conejo herido","Atiende al pájaro herido","Alimenta a la cabra hambrienta","Echando una pata","Alimenta al poney hambriento","Aunque la gallina agradece tus atenciones, ¡tiene mucha hambre!","Hay animales hambrientos y necesitados en el pueblo de Quiebra Larga.\
\
Cuida de los animales hambrientos y necesitados en Quiebra Larga.","Reconforta al pobre cerdito con una <rgb=#FF0000>palmadita</rgb>","Aunque el poney agradece tus atenciones, ¡tiene mucha hambre!","Prunella Valeoro se encuentra en el pueblo de Quiebra Larga.\
\
Habla con Prunella Valeoro.","Rana herida atendida","Alimenta a las gallinas hambrientas","Los animales heridos se encuentran en el pueblo de Quiebra Larga.\
\
Debes cuidar a los ainmales heridos en Quiebra Larga.","Pájaro herido atendido","Aunque la cabra agradece tus atenciones, ¡tiene mucha hambre!","Reconforta al pobre perrito con una <rgb=#FF0000>palmadita</rgb>","Alimenta al gato hambriento","Reconforta a la pobre vaquita con una <rgb=#FF0000>palmadita</rgb>","Atiende a la rana herida","Atiende a la tortuga herida","Aunque el gato agradece tus atenciones, ¡tiene mucha hambre!","Conejo herido atendido","Habla con Prunella Valeoro"}},
[6149]={nameES="Helping the Hurt",objectivesES={"Melvun is at the Barnavon Mine.\
\
You should speak with Melvun again to see if he has finished the salve.","Talk to Melvun at the mine","Melvun is at the Barnavon Mine.\
\
You should speak with Melvun and let him know that you have completed his task.'","The Barnavon Mine has been infested by bugan who are terrorizing the miners. Many of the workers have been injured or slain, while the rest have been driven out of the mine.","Helping the Hurt","Red clover can be found in the hills near the mine, particularly at Hen Turrau.\
\
Melvun has asked you to collect red clover which he can use to make medicines for the injured miners.","The wounded miners can be found in the camp outside the Barnavon Mine.\
\
Melvun asked you to take the salve and bandages to the wounded miners and bind their wounds.","Melvun is at the Barnavon Mine.\
\
You should bring the red clover you collected to Melvun.","Bring the red clover to Melvun at the mine"}},
[6150]={nameES="Helping the Innocent",objectivesES={"Completado.","Poisoned animals can be found north of the path in Eryn Lasgalen.\
\
You should cure poisoned animals.","Helping the Innocent","Completado","The animals of the forest have fallen victim to a vile poison. Thorlind has asked you to use the antidote you made to cure the poor creatures.","Thorlind's cure has proven effective and cured many sickened animals in Eryn Lasgalen. Whatever caused this poisoning is still out there, lurking. You should be careful, lest the same fate befalls you."}},
[6151]={nameES="Helping with the Harvest",objectivesES={"You have been asked to collect stalks of rice that are ready to harvest from the eastern fields at Ekagar.","Urama, tired from a life of manual labour, has asked for your help on her rice farm.","You have collected stalks of rice that were ready to harvest from the fields to the east. You should bring them to Urama by the trellis.","Helping with the Harvest","Bring rice stalks to Urama"}},
[6152]={nameES="Risco de Helva: Buena caza",objectivesES={"Caza animales salvajes en el Risco de Helva","En el Risco de Helva, en el Bosque Salvaje, hay bestias.\
\
Deberías cazar animales salvajes en el Risco de Helva.","Risco de Helva: Buena caza","La colina del Risco de Helva es un buen lugar para cazar animales salvajes en el Bosque Salvaje. Si cazas aquí, te ganarás el respeto de los Pueblos Libres que también cazan en la naturaleza.","La colina del Risco de Helva es un buen lugar para cazar animales salvajes en el Bosque Salvaje."}},
[6153]={nameES="Hen Hunter",objectivesES={}},
[6154]={nameES="Granja Hengstacer",objectivesES={"Un enano visitante en la Granja Hengstacer fue atacado por algunos orcos.","Granja Hengstacer","Habla con Éogar en la Granja Hengstacer","La Granja Hengstacer se encuentra al noreste de la cabaña de Saeradan, por el camino hacia el este desde el Viejo Fuerte del Camino Verde.\
\
Saeradan te envió a la Granja Hengstacer para investigar rumores sobre orcos.","Cam Manzaneda está en la Granja Hengstacer.\
\
Éogar te dijo que hablaras con Cam Manzaneda, su peón.","Habla con Cam Manzaneda en la Granja Hengstacer"}},
[6155]={nameES="Granja Hengstacer",objectivesES={"Recibiste una carta del dueño de la Granja Hengstacer, un establo que provee bestias de carga para las Tierras de Bree. El dueño te invitó a su granja para posiblemente adquirir una bestia de carga que puedas llamar tuya.","Granja Hengstacer","Habla con Éogar en la Granja Hengstacer","Direcciones a la Granja Hengstacer:\
\
Desde la Puerta Oeste de Bree, viaja hacia el norte por el Camino Verde hasta pasar la Granja de Espinar a tu izquierda y un viejo fuerte en ruinas a tu derecha. Hay un sendero estrecho, marcado por las huellas de los caballos y ponis de Hengstacer, que sube la colina junto a esas ruinas. Sigue ese sendero hacia el este y el norte, y encontrarás el camino a la Granja Hengstacer.","Debes dirigirte a la Granja Hengstacer y hablar con el dueño, Éogar.\
\
Desde la Puerta Oeste de Bree, viaja hacia el norte por el Camino Verde hasta pasar la Granja de Espinar a tu izquierda y un viejo fuerte en ruinas a tu derecha. Hay un sendero estrecho, marcado por las huellas de los caballos y ponis de Hengstacer, que sube la colina junto a esas ruinas. Sigue ese sendero hacia el este y el norte, y encontrarás el camino a la Granja Hengstacer."}},
[6156]={nameES="Hens in a Dire Situation",objectivesES={}},
[6157]={nameES="Her Ladyship's Lair",objectivesES={"As webs begin to fill the Tower of Cirith Ungol, it has become clear that Shelob now desires to expand her lair into the Tower.","Although spiders still flood into Cirith Ungol, you have burned many of their webs and prevented them from gaining a greater foothold in the Tower of Cirith Ungol.","You have burned many webs in Cirith Ungol.","Her Ladyship's Lair","Completado","Webs can be found throughout Cirith Ungol.\
\
Legolas has asked you to burn webs to prevent the spiders from gaining a foothold in Cirith Ungol."}},
[6158]={nameES="Heraldo de guerra",objectivesES={"Nûst derrotado","Alrekur se encuentra en Mekhem-bizru, al noroeste de Drû-garmadh.\
\
Alrekur estará encantado de saber que Nûst ha sido derrotado.","Habla con Alrekur en Mekhem-bizru","Nûst se encuentra en Drû-garmadh, al sureste.\
\
Alrekur cree que si Nûst, el líder de Drû-garmadh, es derrotado, el campamento ya no representará una amenaza.","Los enanos creen que si derrotan al líder de Drû-garmadh, la amenaza también será eliminada.","Heraldo de guerra","Derrota a Nûst"}},
[6159]={nameES="Herald of the Rohirrim",objectivesES={"The Ford of Isen demarks the eastern boundary of Dunland. The Rohirrim have established an encampment on the western side of the ford, where Grimbold of the Grimslade can be found commanding their local forces.\
\
Bring the horn to Grimbold and tell him of the herald's fate.","The herald lies dead at last from a mortal arrow-wound, and you rise from your death vigil.\
\
Gripping his horn you determine to deliver it to Grimbold at the Ford of Isen and tell him of the herald's fate.","Check on the Rohirrim herald","The herald has fallen","Defend the herald of the Rohirrim","Herald of the Rohirrim","You found a message upon the Dunlending Hound-master regarding a Rohirrim herald who has been sent to speak with a clan-leader among the Dunlendings. The herald is to be ambushed and slain before he reaches his destination.","The herald is supposed to be travelling towards Dol Baran from an encampment at the Ford of Isen.\
\
You should find and defend the herald of the Rohirrim.","The body of the fallen Rohirrim herald lies before you.\
\
You should collect the fallen herald's horn and return it to Grimbold.","The message you found upon the Hound-master speaks of a Rohirrim herald who is travelling to parley with a Dunlending brenin. The Hound-master has been instructed to waylay and kill the herald before he arrives at the meeting.\
\
While the Hound-master has been defeated, it appears that his allies have already departed to hunt down the herald. You should find the meeting place and rescue the herald before the trap is sprung.","Talk to Grimbold at the Ford of Isen"}},
[6160]={nameES="Heraldry of Durin IV",objectivesES={}},
[6161]={nameES="Heraldry of the Elves",objectivesES={"You should raise heraldry of Gil-galad, Eryn Galen, and Lothlórien in Parth Daenath to intimidate the Enemy and boost the spirits of the soldiers.","Celeborn can be found in Echad-in-Edhil.\
\
You should talk to Celeborn.","Habla con Celeborn","Heraldry of the Elves","Celeborn seeks to raise the heraldry of the Elves throughout Parth Daenath."}},
[6162]={nameES="Heraldry of the High King",objectivesES={}},
[6163]={nameES="Heraldry of the Ruthless",objectivesES={"Banners of Gorgar can be found at Bagûd-mekhem.\
\
You have discovered bloody banners flown by the Orcs loyal to Gorgar the Ruthless at Bagûd-mekhem. You should destroy them.","Within Bagûd-mekhem, you have discovered the Orcs of Gundabad loyal to Gorgar the Ruthless flying terrible heraldry in defiance of the dwarves of the Gabil'akkâ.\
\
Depicting a bloodied dwarf-helm pierced by a spear, these banners draw your mind to past battles against Bolg's other son, Mazog, and his loyal Pûlpum. Could those loyal to the sons of Bolg rally beneath the same banners?\
\
You should destroy these banners and work to diminish the legacy of Bolg in the North.","You have destroyed many banners of Gorgar at Bagûd-mekhem. Although this act alone does not turn the tide of the war, it has put a new fear in the hearts of the Orcs of Gundabad.","You have destroyed many banners of Gorgar at Bagûd-mekhem.","Heraldry of the Ruthless","Within Bagûd-mekhem, the Orcs of Gundabad loyal to Gorgar the Ruthless fly terrible banners in defiance of the dwarves of the Gabil'akkâ.","Completado"}},
[6164]={nameES="Heraldry of the Thíuda",objectivesES={}},
[6165]={nameES="Heraldos de la corrupción",objectivesES={"Sigdan está en la Cámara de la Encrucijada, al norte del Mirador de la Gran Excavación.\
\
Rambi te ha dicho que hables con su amigo Sigdan sobre la armadura que has encontrado.","Habla con Sigdan en la Cámara de la Encrucijada","Heraldos de la corrupción","Has encontrado una pieza de armadura. Cuando la has recogido, unos murciélagos te han atacado.","Rambi está en la Cámara de la Encrucijada, en el Camino de Durin.\
\
Sigdan ha compartido contigo su evaluación de las marcas en la armadura que has encontrado.","Habla con Rambi en la Cámara de la Encrucijada"}},
[6166]={nameES="Heralds of a New Age",objectivesES={"Talk to Erna and warn her of Karazgar's interest in the Herald of Winter","Talk to the rumour-mongering Lake-man","Erna can be found in Dale.\
\
The Lake-man was slain along the roadway by one of Karazgar's agents in the Dale-lands. It seems Karazgar has a peculiar interest in the Herald of Winter. You should return to Erna and tell her what has occurred.","A gruff voice rises behind you...","Talk to Kynlig in Dale","Erna can be found in Dale.\
\
You learned that the Lake-man misunderstood Kynlig's tale and that the Herald of Winter is little more than a legend to the Dwarves of Erebor. You should return to Erna and tell her what you have learned.","Troubled Dale-folk can be found throughout Dale.\
\
Erna has asked you to speak to a number of troubled Dale-folk and learn if there is any truth to the rumours that have been spreading in Dale.","Fearful rumours have begun to spread throughout the Dale-lands regarding a mysterious figure known only as the Herald of Winter.","A Lake-man speaks loudly and gestures wildly at a crowd of Dale-folk...","Find the Lake-man along the road to Lake-town and deliver him to the Queen Regent","The Lake-man can likely be found along the roadway to Lake-town.\
\
Erna has asked that you seek the Lake-man on the roadway to Lake-town and deliver him to her in Dale.","Heralds of a New Age","Kynlig can be found fishing in Dale.\
\
The rumour-monger claims the story was told to him by a dwarf named Kynlig in Dale. You should find and speak to Kynlig.","Talk to Erna","The rumour-mongering Lake-man can be found in Dale.\
\
You have found the rumour-monger telling wild tales to a crowd of nearby Dale-folk. You should speak to him and urge him to stop spreading dangerous rumours.","Deliver Erna's missive to King Thorin III in Erebor","Find the rumour-monger in Dale","King Thorin III can be found in Erebor.\
\
Erna has written a missive to King Thorin III and has asked you to deliver it to him in the halls of Erebor.","The rumour-monger can be found somewhere in Dale.\
\
You have listened to the tales of several troubled Dale-folk, and it seems that a Lake-man has come to Dale telling wild stories of the Herald of Winter. You should seek the rumour-monger in Dale.","The Weeping Warrior's servant falls defeated..."}},
[6167]={nameES="Hierbas y remedios",objectivesES={"Te has encontrado con una serie de hierbas interesantes en tus viajes. Estas deben ser recogidas mientras atraviesas las tierras y llevadas al Montaraz Orthonn.","Lleva las hierbas a Orthonn","La vinca se puede encontrar entre afloramientos rocosos en la cima de las colinas de Nan Amlug, cerca de Othrikar. La reina de los prados se encuentra en raíces de árboles orientadas al sur en el campamento de arañas al sur de Esteldín. La petasita crece junto al agua en los pantanos cerca del refugio élfico de Lin Giliath en Meluinen.\
\
Deberías recoger hierbas para Orthonn.","Orthonn está en Dehesa del rey, al norte de la Granja de gatson.\
\
Deberías llevar las hierbas que Recogiste A Orthonn.","Hierbas y remedios"}},
[6168]={nameES="Hierbas del Bosque Salvaje",objectivesES={"El aviso del tablón dice:\
\
'Se necesita: hierbas del Bosque Salvaje para comidas y trueque. Se te recompensará por tu esfuerzo.'","Coloca las hierbas silvestres en una caja de almacenamiento","Encontrarás una caja de almacenamiento en el Embarcadero de los Comerciantes o en Puente de Caballetes.\
\
Debes guardar las hierbas silvestres en una caja de almacenamiento.","Alguien ha puesto una tarea para recolectar hierbas en el Bosque Salvaje.","Hierbas del Bosque Salvaje","En el extremo sur del Bosque Salvaje se pueden encontrar hierbas silvestres.\
\
Deberías recolectar hierbas silvestres."}},
[6169]={nameES="Domando Gatos",objectivesES={"Óláfr está en Noglond, en el Valle de Thráin, al sur por el camino desde las Piedras del Mirlo.\
\
Óláfr debería alegrarse al saber de tu éxito.","Domando Gatos","Habla con Óláfr en Noglond","Los linces pueden encontrarse por todo el Valle de Thráin, pero Óláfr sugirió dirigirse al norte, hacia las Piedras del Mirlo.\
\
Óláfr te ha pedido que asegures la seguridad del camino que atraviesa el Valle de Thráin cazando a los linces que habitan allí.","Óláfr necesita ayuda para encargarse de los linces en el Valle de Thráin."}},
[6170]={nameES="Herding to the Lone-lands",objectivesES={}},
[6171]={nameES="Herding to the North Downs",objectivesES={}},
[6172]={nameES="Herding to the Trollshaws",objectivesES={}},
[6173]={nameES="Herefara's Patrol",objectivesES={"Herefara decides a patrol is needed to secure the Rohirrim's encampment. He has asked you to accompany him on the patrol.","Talk to Herefara to dismiss him","Patrol Eilenach","Herefara's Patrol","Patrol the river crossing to the Beacon Hills","Use the whistle to summon your new friend if you become separated","Patrol Nardol","Herefara can be found in the War-stead of the Helmingas.\
\
You should speak with Herefara.","You should patrol Taur Drúadan with Herefara by your side.","All is quiet atop Eilenach","Patrol Eilenach's beacon","Patrol Nardol's look-out","All seems quiet on Nardol","Speak with Herefara.","The Orcs upon Eilenach seem to be concerned with something in the forest","All seems quiet to the west","Herefara has asked you to patrol Taur Drúadan with him","Speak with Herefara","Some spying Orcs hide out on Nardol's point!"}},
[6174]={nameES="Herencia restaurada",objectivesES={"El cráneo del Gran Uro está en las tierras de los Rauta-lehmä, al este, cruzando Nan Amlug.\
\
Para demostrar su buena intención a los Hijos de la Tierra, Ragnarr Cuernoso te ha pedido que recuperes el cráneo robado del Gran Uro de los Rauta-lehmä.","Cuando el Primer Cazador Jarkko traicionó a los Suuri-lehmä, se fue con el tótem del cazador de la tribu; el cráneo del Gran Uro, el homónimo de los Suuri-lehmä. Trajiste un cráneo tótem a Ragnarr, pero parece que no es suficiente.","Devuelves el cráneo del Gran Uro","Ragnarr Cuernoso está en el campamento de los Suuri-lehmä, al oeste del campamento de los Rauta-lehmä.\
\
Debes devolver el cráneo del Gran Uro a Ragnarr Cuernoso.","Herencia restaurada","Recoge el cráneo del Gran Uro"}},
[6175]={nameES="Herencia de Gilmar",objectivesES={"Busca el heredero de Bardulf Gilmar","Habla con Orthonn en Ost Lagoros","En la cara de este marcador hay una inscripción desgastada: 'Esta tierra es concedida a Bardulf Gilmar y su linaje, ahora y siempre, en reconocimiento a sus valientes hazañas. Eärnur, hijo de Eärnil, Príncipe de Gondor, T.A. 1975.'\
\
La tierra circundante está estéril y abandonada. Si es que los herederos de Gilmar aún viven, puede que no sean conscientes de su legado.","Habla con Gilmar en la granja de Gatson","Herencia de Gilmar","Habla con Istuienn en Esteldín","Gilmar está en la granja de Gatson.\
\
Istuienn, quien cuida los archivos de los Montaraces, te proporcionó un extracto de unas crónicas antiguas que explican cómo el antepasado de Gilmar salvó la vida de Eärnur, un antiguo Príncipe de Gondor, y recibió tierras en perpetuidad por su valor.","Orthonn está en las ruinas de Ost Lagoros, al noroeste de la granja de Gatson.\
\
Has encontrado una piedra que otorga tierras al antepasado del trabajador de Gatson, Gilmar. Gilmar te ha pedido que preguntes al Montaraz Orthonn sobre su antepasado.","Istuienn está en Esteldín, al este de la granja de Gatson.\
\
Has encontrado una piedra que otorga tierras al antepasado del trabajador de Gatson, Gilmar. Gilmar te envió a hablar con el Montaraz Orthonn, pero Orthonn no pudo ayudarte. Sin embargo, te sugirió que buscaras a Istuienn, la archivista de Esteldín.","Descubriste un marcador de piedra en medio de una tierra estéril, pero fértil. El marcador declaraba que la tierra circundante era propiedad de Bardulf Gilmar y sus herederos. Si es que aún viven tales herederos, es poco probable que sepan de su legado.","Lleva el extracto a Gilmar en la granja de Gatson","Puede que aún se encuentre un heredero de Bardulf Gilmar en algún lugar de las Quebradas del Norte."}},
