[6229]={nameES="Héroe / Heroína de la Comunidad Perdida",objectivesES={"Habla con Reginald Guardián","Reginald Guardián se encuentra en Sûri-kylä, en Forochel.\
\
Se te ha indicado que busques al capitán de la Comunidad Perdida, Reginald Guardián.","Has ayudado a todos los miembros de la Comunidad Perdida en todas sus diversas necesidades."}},
[6230]={nameES="Tarea de los Héroes de Limclaro: Corazón de madera nudoso",objectivesES={"Entrega el corazón de madera nudoso en cualquier tablón de tareas del Gran Río","Has aceptado la tarea de adquirir corazón de madera nudoso.","Has entregado el corazón de madera nudoso por una modesta recompensa en el tablón de tareas local.","Se busca: Corazón de madera nudoso de los Ucornos en la región del Gran Río. Recógelos y entrégalos en un tablón de tareas en el Gran Río para ganar el favor de los Héroes de la Garganta del Limclaro.","Se busca: Corazón de madera nudoso de los Ucornos en la región del Gran Río.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Tarea de los Héroes de Limclaro: Corazón de madera nudoso","Aún no has recolectado suficiente corazón de madera nudoso para completar tu tarea.","Alguien ha publicado una tarea para recolectar corazón de madera nudoso de los Ucornos. Se pueden entregar en cualquier tablón de tareas en el Gran Río."}},
[6231]={nameES="Tarea de los Héroes de Limclaro: Ramas gruesas",objectivesES={"Entrega las ramas gruesas en cualquier tablón de tareas del Gran Río","Has entregado las ramas gruesas por una modesta recompensa en el tablón de tareas local.","Se busca: Ramas gruesas de los Ucornos en la región del Gran Río. Recógelas y entrégalas en un tablón de tareas en el Gran Río para ganar el favor de los Héroes de la Garganta del Limclaro.","Alguien ha publicado una tarea para recolectar ramas gruesas de los Ucornos. Se pueden entregar en cualquier tablón de tareas en el Gran Río.","Has aceptado la tarea de adquirir ramas gruesas.","Tarea de los Héroes de Limclaro: Ramas gruesas","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Aún no has recolectado suficientes ramas gruesas para completar tu tarea.","Se busca: Ramas gruesas de los Ucornos en la región del Gran Río."}},
[6232]={nameES="Heroicidad (Opcional)",objectivesES={"Pinzalarga derrotada","Valthor se encuentra en el Refugio Sombrío, en las Fundaciones de Piedra, al oeste de Skûmfil.\
\
Regresa con Valthor con noticias sobre tu victoria.","Derrota a Pinzalarga","Heroicidad (Opcional)","Pinzalarga se encuentra en Skûmfil, al este del Refugio Sombrío en las Fundaciones de Piedra.\
\
Valthor te ha pedido que comples la Senda del Campeón Marcial matando al grodbog Pinzalarga.","Los gredbyg de Skûmfil son una horrible especie de carroñeros, y entre ellos se encuentran unos terribles insectos de clase guerrera.","Habla con Valthor en el Refugio Sombrío"}},
[6233]={nameES="Hestil's Suggestion",objectivesES={"You look around at Langhold, and wonder when you will next see Hestil and her friends","You look around at Elthengels, and wonder when you will next see Hestil and her friends","If you are done with the East Wall and have not yet visited the Wold, travel to Langhold, in the Wold","Hestil has told you of two possible places you could go once you have completed your adventures in the East Wall: north to Langhold, in the Wold, if you have not already gone there, or north-west to Elthengels, in the Norcrofts.","You have aided Hestil and her friends with their troubles, and now she has some advice for you.","If you are done with the East Wall and have already visited the Wold, travel to Elthengels, in the Norcrofts","Hestil's Suggestion"}},
[6234]={nameES="Hewing Fell Wings",objectivesES={"Fernachar has asked you to defeat many merrevail in pursuit of the Malledhrim scouts who have been waylaid at Dannenglor.","Merrevail can be found in the Elf-ruins of Dannenglor, north of the Haunted Inn in the Dourstocks.\
\
You should fight the merrevail in pursuit of the Malledhrim Elves who were most likely waylaid at the gates of Dannenglor.","Hewing Fell Wings","Talk to Fernachar at the Haunted Inn","Fernachar awaits you anxiously at the Haunted Inn in the Dourstocks, south of Dannenglor.\
\
You should return swiftly to Fernachar and inform him of your relative success against the merrevail of Dannenglor."}},
[6235]={nameES="Tallando una nueva piedra",objectivesES={"Runas del archivero Ánraig recogidas","Dardúr te ayudará a tallar una piedra rúnica de gran maestría.","Gruglok se encuentra en Urugarth, en Angmar. Azgoth y Mormoz pueden encontrarse en Carn Dûm, también en Angmar.\
\
Dardúr necesita ahora el Sello de Guerra de Gruglok y una Runa de Dominio Alado.","Sello de Guerra recogido","Tallando una nueva piedra","Recolecta las runas del archivero Ánraig","Runa de Dominio Alado recogida","Los norboglir pueden encontrarse en Malenhad, en Angmar. Los huargos pueden encontrarse en Angmar, las Montañas Nubladas y Forochel.\
\
Dardúr necesita ahora cuernos de niquebrique y garras recurvadas de huargo.","Recolecta una Runa de Dominio Alado","Lleva los objetos recolectados a Dardúr en Gondamon, en Ered Luin","Las piedras pueden encontrarse entre los trasgos de Ciudad de los Trasgos. La inscripción rúnica la porta Ánraig, al este de Gwaelband en las ruinas de Annúminas.\
\
Dardúr desea que le traigas piedras de las raíces de las Montañas Nubladas y una inscripción rúnica en posesión de un archivero angmarim llamado Ánraig.","Recoge un Sello de Guerra"}},
[6236]={nameES="Talando el Bosque",objectivesES={"Erchiel está en las Agujas Altas, en la orilla noroeste del lago Evendim.\
\
Debes regresar a las Agujas Altas y contarle a Erchiel tu batalla contra Podredumbre del Corazón.","Ramalarga cree que algún poder maligno podría estar torciendo el bosque hacia fines oscuros, quizás los trolls silvanos que han empezado a aparecer en Evendim. Enfurecido, el Ent está listo para actuar.","Putrecorazones stá en la Arboleda Retorcida, que se encuentra al suroeste de las Agujas Altas.\
\
Además de expulsar a los trolls de madera de su arboleda, Erchiel también te pidió que encontraras y derrotaras a su líder, Putrecorazones, con la esperanza de que el resto huya.","La Arboleda Retorcida está al suroeste de las Agujas Altas.\
\
Enfurecido por la destrucción injustificada infligida a su arboleda, Ramalarga te ha pedido que derrotes a los trolls silvanos que infestan la Arboleda Retorcida.","Putrecorazones ha huido","Talando el Bosque","Encuentra y derrota a Putrecorazones"}},
[6237]={nameES="Hidden Amongst the Ruin",objectivesES={"As the Orcs became more active after the fall of Sauron, they took to making camp in the ruins of Barad-dûr.","Hidden Amongst the Ruin","Defeated many Orcs in Dor Amarth.","You notice the Orcs around Dor Amarth are quick to attack. They seem unorganized amongst the shattered ruins of Barad-dûr. You are unsure what plans they have, if any. However, something should be done to thin their numbers.","You have defeated many Orcs in Dor Amarth on your conquests through Gorgoroth.","Completado","Orcs can be found around Dor Amarth.\
\
You should defeat as many Orcs as possible."}},
[6238]={nameES="Hidden Dangers",objectivesES={"Hidden Dangers","Mablung can be found at the Camp of the Host, on the northern edge of North Ithilien.\
\
You should return to Mablung and tell him that many of the Orkish traps were destroyed.","Venture into the Noman-lands with Faroth, find hidden Orkish traps, and destroy them. They can be found in the many ruins throughout the Noman-lands.\
\
Faroth must be present to find the hidden Orkish traps. If you lose track of him, use the hound-calling whistle to summon him back.","Return to Mablung","Mablung has asked you to venture into the Noman-lands ruins with Faroth and search for hidden Orkish traps."}},
[6239]={nameES="Gemas ocultas",objectivesES={"Lleva el tesoro de gemas a Bothwar","Bothwar te ha indicado la ubicación de una reserva de gemas que no pudo recuperar antes de ser asignado a su deber actual en Gabilshathûr.","Tesoro de gemas recolectado","Recoge el tesoro de gemas","Gemas ocultas","El tesoro de gemas se encuentra cerca de los nidos de rascacuevas en Dolroth, en el sur de Gorothlad, al norte y al este de Gabilshathûr.\
\
El enano minero Bothwar te ha pedido que recuperes un tesoro de gemas para él."}},
[6240]={nameES="Tesoro oculto",objectivesES={"Tesoro oculto","Los Tarkrîp están justo al norte de Tór Gailvin -- busca la cueva que llaman Burzum Pushdug.\
\
Machar te ha pedido que recojas oro de la cueva de los orcos que mataron a sus parientes.","Machar y sus hermanos Torquil y Eilig buscan venganza contra los orcos saqueadores que mataron a sus parientes.","Lleva el polvo de oro a Machar"}},
[6241]={nameES="Hidden Lieutenants",objectivesES={}},
[6242]={nameES="Hidden Parcels",objectivesES={"Hidden Parcels","Bring the hidden parcels to Nakûr","Hidden parcels can be found alongside the southern waterway that runs through the Lower Ward.","Nakûr is located on the western side of the Lower Ward, near the southern waterway.","Nakûr is concerned about the parcels he has seen Corsairs hiding around the waterways of the Lower Ward, and wants you to investigate them."}},
[6243]={nameES="Cuarteles escondidos",objectivesES={"Se ha encontrado la antigua guarnición, pero ha pasado mucho tiempo desde que los enanos pusieron un pie en ella.\
\
A Kúli le encantará descubrir que la guarnición existe de verdad y no es solo una leyenda. Querrá saber hasta qué punto se ha vuelto peligroso ese lugar legendario y en qué estado se encuentra.","Cuarteles escondidos","Encontraste la antigua guarnición de mineros, Nud-heden","Regresa con Kúli","El campamento de Kúli y Auti se encuentra cerca de la colmena de gredbyg, y se arrepienten de haberse instalado en un lugar tan peligroso.","Revisaste el cuartel principal de Nud-heden","Encuentra la antigua guarnición de mineros, Nud-heden","Revisaste el antiguo comedor de Nud-heden","La antigua guarnición de mineros se encuentra en algún lugar dentro de la colmena de gredbyg, al sur del campamento de Kúli y Auti.\
\
Kúli cree que la guarnición de mineros se encuentra en las Vetas del Cuerno Rojo, según un antiguo texto enano que leyó en el medallón. Auti y Kúli vinieron a esta caverna en busca de mithril, ¡pero en su lugar se encuentran buscando una leyenda!","Revisaste la sala de entrada de Nud-heden","Kúli acampa junto con Auti, justo al norte de la colmena de gredbyg.\
\
Kúli se alegrará de saber que la antigua guarnición existe tal y como sospechaba. Sin embargo, puede que no sea la solución segura que él esperaba que fuera."}},
[6244]={nameES="Hidden Under Mist and Talon",objectivesES={"You find no enemy presence here","Egraedir can be found in Misthallow.\
\
You should return to Egraedir with the stones you have collected.","Talk to Fanglind at Thokvist","Small stones can be found in Misthallow.\
\
You should gather the stones for Egraedir.","Egraedir can be found in Misthallow.\
\
You should greet Egraedir.","Fanglind can be found at Thokvist.\
\
You should talk to Fanglind.","Return to Egraedir","Locations to scout can be found nearby Thokvist in Misthallow.\
\
You should scout Misthallow for Skarding.","Skarding can be found at Thokvist.\
\
You should talk to Skarding.","Egraedir can be found in Misthallow.\
\
You should talk to Egraedir.","The Eagle is gone","The Eagle stares at you inquisitively","Scout the first location for Skarding","You see another Eagle!","Greet the eagle with a <rgb=#FF0000>bow</rgb>","A thick layer of mist shrouds much of the valley of Misthallow, making winged surveillance nearly impossible.","Talk to Skarding Wargsbane at Thokvist","Hidden Under Mist and Talon","Trolls were here, but quite some time ago","Scout the third location for Skarding","Scout the second location for Skarding","Talk to Egraedir"}},
[6245]={nameES="Ocultos por piel y nieve",objectivesES={"Hay osos por todas las Montañas Nubladas: cerca de la Fuente del Bruinen, por los Riscos Altos, al norte del campamento de Glóin y junto de los Salones de los Gigantes.\
\
Malthenor te ha pedido que derrotes a osos en las montañas para reducir la amenaza que suponen para los potenciales viajeros.","Malthenor está en el campamento de Glóin.\
\
Malthenor estará complacido de oír que has derrotado a muchos osos en las montañas.","Malthenor está preocupado por los osos que rondan las montañas y quiere que luches contra ellos.","Ocultos por piel y nieve"}},
[6246]={nameES="Oculto a plena vista",objectivesES={"Sigeric staggers away from you, clearly defeated","Talk to Sigeric","Sigeric has told you that the trail of the man he spotted begins outside the south gate of Snowbourn.","Search the nearby crofts for the spy","There is no sign of any trail, but perhaps it lies ahead","The crofts can be found just off the road far to the south-east of Snowbourn.\
\
Having found a banner of the White Hand, you should investigate the nearby crofts and homes for any sign of a spy.","Talk to Fastred","Investigate the barn","You have found a banner of the White Hand and footprints leading towards the nearby crofts","Fastred can be found inside the Mead Hall of Snowbourn.\
\
You have bested Sigeric, the man you rescued from Orcs near Garsfeld, and now the Rohirrim have him in their control. Fastred must be told of Sigeric's treachery.","Continue along the road to the south of Snowbourn","You have found Sigeric outside the barn, and he looks quite pleased to see you.\
\
You should speak to him and discover why he sent you on this hunt.","Sigeric believes he has discovered a spy near Snowbourn. He has found a crude trail along the road south of Snowbourn and wishes you to follow it.","The trail can be found along the road south and east of Snowbourn.\
\
The trail has been cold so far, but in the interest of Snowbourn, you should keep searching.","Oculto a plena vista","The barn can be found among the croftlands to the south-east of Snowbourn.\
\
Following the trail from Snowbourn, you have found yourself outside a barn.","Follow the road south of Snowbourn","As you approach the barn, Sigeric appears","You have found no sign of the spy, but you hear rumblings from the barn to the north"}},
[6247]={nameES="Hide and Secrets",objectivesES={"Time to find Anoch!","A lonely boy in Melgobas wants to play a game.","Count to ten","Find and <rgb=#00ff00>poke</rgb> Anoch","Talk to Anoch","Anoch has asked you to play a game with him. He'll hide, and you'll have to find him.\
\
To start, you should approach the well across from the stables in north-east Melgobas.","Approach the well across from the Melgobas stables","You should give Anoch ten seconds to hide.","You've found Anoch!\
\
You should talk to him.","Hide and Secrets","You should find Anoch hiding somewhere in Melgobas."}},
[6248]={nameES="Hide and Seek",objectivesES={"The brigand hideaway is located somewhere in the Brown Lands.\
\
Céola has asked you to scout the third patrol point for the location of the brigand hideaway.","Céola is at Etheburg, south of Helstor, in the Brown Lands.\
\
You should return to Céola with news of your success.","The brigand hideaway is located somewhere in the Brown Lands.\
\
Céola has asked you to scout the second patrol point for the location of the brigand hideaway.","Scout the fourth patrol point","Hide and Seek","Scout the first patrol point","You have discovered Helstor, the brigand hideaway","In the distance, you see a large Easterling encampment","The brigand hideaway is located somewhere in the Brown Lands.\
\
Céola has asked you to scout the first patrol point for the location of the brigand hideaway.","Scout the third patrol point","Céola is concerned that the brigand threat in the Brown Lands will make it impossible to even attempt to hinder the Khundolar.","Scout the second patrol point","Talk to Céola at Etheburg in the Brown Lands","You have found nothing here","The brigand hideaway is located somewhere in the Brown Lands.\
\
Céola has asked you to scout the fourth patrol point for the location of the brigand hideaway.","In the distance, you see a lone tree standing...or is it a tree?"}},
[6249]={nameES="Escondite por Allende",objectivesES={"Ve al cenador","Gildor podría saber dónde está el último niño escondido","Debes encontrar a los niños hobbit que se esconden por Campotieso.\
\
Gildor te ha asegurado que no neceitas aventurarte más allá de los muros de Campotieso.","Escondite por Allende","Es solo una partida al escondite. ¿Qué podría salir mal?","Gildor te ha invitado a jugar al escondite.\
\
Ve al cenador de Campotieso para comenzar la partida.","Busca y <rgb=#00ff00>pica</rgb> a los niños escondidos (5/6)","Has encontrado a todos los que se habían escondido. ¿Dónde puede estar el último niño?","Cuenta hacia atrás desde diez","Gildor está descansando en Campotieso cerca del cenador.\
\
Él podría saber dónde está el último niño escondido.","Habla con Gildor"}},
[6250]={nameES="Juego del escondite",objectivesES={"Rollo Gamonuevo ha sido invitado a jugar al escondite con sus amigos Daisy y Polo Tejonera, pero sus lugares de escondite poco imaginativos le han hecho perder el interés en el juego.","Encuentra a Polo Tejonera","Juego del escondite","Polo Tejonera se esconde detrás de la estatua de madera tallada de Marcho y Blanco en el centro de Cavada Grande. Su hermana Daisy se esconde al sureste de la talla, en los arbustos a la derecha de la casa de Peony Cavada.\
\
Rollo Gamonuevo está jugando al escondite con sus amigos, pero siempre se esconden en los mismos lugares y está cansado de fingir sorpresa cada vez que los encuentra.","Rollo Gamonuevo se encuentra al norte de la estatua tallada de Marcho y Blanco en el centro de Cavada Grande, dentro del círculo de setos que rodean el Agujero Municipal.\
\
Rollo está esperando a que le digas que encontraste a Polo y a Daisy Tejonera.","Encuentra a Daisy Tejonera"}},
[6251]={nameES="Pieles para mantas",objectivesES={"Nan Orngon está al sureste de Ost Forod.\
\
Rowena Guardacotos te ha pedido que te aventures en Nan Orngon y traigas varias pieles de oso para convertirlas en mantas.","Las pieles de oso sirven para hacer mantas de invierno cálidas, evitando que el viento te hiele los huesos.","Llévale pieles de oso a Rowena Guardacotos en Ost Forod","Ost Forod está al oeste de Nan Orngon.\
\
Rowena Guardacotos querrá empezar a convertir las pieles en mantas.","Pieles para mantas"}},
[6252]={nameES="Pieles para Etta",objectivesES={"Regresa con Etta Tejobaya","Las numerosas charcas de la Pradera de Juncos son el hogar de peligrosos avanc, cuyas gruesas pieles producen un cuero excelente.","Pieles para Etta","Deberías llevar las pieles de avanc a Etta Tejobaya.\
\
Etta está en el Campamento de Siempreviva, al norte de Tharbad.","Etta Tejobaya te ha pedido que le traigas pieles de los avanc que habitan en las charcas al norte de Tharbad."}},
[6253]={nameES="Pieles del Bosque Salvaje",objectivesES={"Coloca las pieles en una caja de almacenamiento","Pieles del Bosque Salvaje","lguien ha puesto una tarea para conseguir pieles en el Bosque Salvaje.","En el Bosque Salvaje se pueden encontrar pieles de algunas piezas de caza mayor.\
\
Deberías recoger las pieles.","Encontrarás una caja de almacenamiento en el Embarcadero de los Comerciantes o en Puente de Caballetes.\
\
Debes colocar las pieles en una caja de almacenamiento.","El aviso del tablón dice:\
\
'Se necesitan: pieles del Bosque Salvaje para artesanía y comercio. Se te recompensará por tu esfuerzo.'"}},
[6254]={nameES="Ocultando su paso",objectivesES={"Recupera la flecha usada","Recupera el pañuelo","Examinando la madera carbonizada que le has traído, Ruidhriel ha descubierto que una grna batalla tuvo lugar en la Colina Quemada.","Ocultando su paso","Pañuelo recuperado","Los retos de la batalla están esparcidos por la Colina Quemada, al oeste donde se encuentra Ruidhriel.\
\
Ruidhriel te ha pedido que encuentres cualquier resto de la batalla que tuvo lugar en la Colina Quemada y los ocultes.","Recupera la extraña rama","Habla con Ruidhriel","Extraña rama recuperada","Flecha usada recuperada"}},
[6255]={nameES="Ocultos bajo el suelo",objectivesES={"Lithost está al sur del Coloso, en la ribera oeste del Baranduin.\
\
Herthdúr te ha pedido que vayas a Lithost, le des la vuelta a algunas rocas y derrotes a los gusanos que encuentres.","Has encontrado a un gusano bajo la roca","Herthdúr está en el campamento del Coloso, al norte de Lithost.\
\
Herthdúr estará satisfecho al saber que la población de gusanos ha sido reducida.","A los gusanos les gusta enterrarse bajo las rocas.","Habla con Herthdúr en el campamento del Coloso","Ocultos bajo el suelo"}},
[6256]={nameES="Hiding in the Wilds",objectivesES={"Barallas has sent you deep into the Balewood in search of his lost fellows. He hopes to reunite with the other Ents that survived Nurzum's assault.","Strongroot has agreed to journey to Barallas's side","Aid Nindorn with 'A Lost Friend'","Strongroot agrees to return to Barallas and the others","Barallas wants you seek out other Ents that fled into the darkness of the Balewood and send them to rally at his side.","Aid Strongroot with 'In Núrzum's Wake'","Nindorn has agreed to travel to Barallas's side","Nindorn begins his journey back to Barallas and the others","Talk to Barallas","Barallas can be found at Stonecliff in northern Balewood.\
\
You have rallied the other Ents and should return to Barallas.","Hiding in the Wilds","Talk to Strongroot","Talk to Nindorn"}},
[6257]={nameES="Escondiendo la prueba",objectivesES={"Estás esperando que la vecina de Angélica en el nº 9 de la calle Aguamiel abra la puerta.","Dale unas palmaditas a Tom Melaza","Dale unas palmaditas a Madre Espigada","Todo el mundo se despide, y Camelia dice que se reunirá contigo fuera","Deberías ir dentro del nº 9 de la calle Aguamiel y ver qué puede hacerse con el cuadro incorrecto de la fiesta de inauguración.","Magetha Cavada no discutirá ningún asunto personal hasta que los villanos de cada lugar indicado por los Fronteros de la Comarca de Allende hayan sido neutralizados.","Habla con Camelia Boffin dentro del nº 9 de la calle Aguamiel","Camelia Boffin está dentro del nº 9 de la calle Aguamiel.","Según los rumores que has descubierto, el propietario del nº 9 de la calle Aguamiel es una hobbit llamada Magetha Cavada, y sale de Quiebra Larga cada mañana.","Habla con Magetha Cavada en Quiebra Larga","Camelia dice que hablará con Magetha mientras conoces a los animales","Los hobbits entrometidos te miran intensamente. ¡Este no es un lugar apropiado!","Camelia está esperando fuera del nº 9 de la calle Aguamiel para que le cuentes cómo ha ido.","Ahora que se ha visto involucrada inevitablemente en la conspiración de su hermano, Camelia Boffin necesita tu ayuda para esconder la prueba de que el regalo de inauguración p","Hay potenciales escondites para la prueba por todo Nobotella.","Dale unas palmaditas a Avellana","Entra en el nº 9 de la calle Aguamiel y averigua cómo esconder la prueba del error de Dinodas","Espera que el propietario del nº 9 de la calle Aguamiel responda","Camelia piensa que podríais ser capacecs de esconder la prueba del error de Dinodas dándole el cuadro a la vecina de Angélica.","Habla con Magetha Cavada dentro del nº 9 de la calle Aguamiel","Magetha Cavada está en su casa, en el nº 9 de la calle Aguamiel.","El hobbit entrometido te mira, curioso. ¡Este no es un buen lugar!","Dale unas palmaditas a Trufa","Esta debe ser Magetha Cavada","Habla con Magetha Cavada dentro de su casa","No hay respuesta... pero escuchas crujidos extraños detrás de la puerta","Camelia ha dicho que se reunirá contigo fuera del nº 9 de la calle Aguamiel.","Magetha Cavada te ha pedido que cuides de sus animales para tranquilizarlos por tener extraños en su casa.","Habla con Camelia Boffin fuera del nº 9 de la calle Aguamiel","Escondiendo la prueba","Dale unas palmaditas a Refunfuño","Encuentra a Magetha Cavada en Quiebra Larga","El hobbit entrometido te escudriña, sospechoso. ¡Este no es un lugar adecuado!","Camelia Boffin está fuera del nº 8 de la calle Aguamiel.","Habla con Camelia Boffin fuera del nº 8 de la calle Aguamiel","Camelia piensa que podrías esconder la prueba del error de Dinodas dándole el cuadro a la vecina de Angélica.","Los hobbits entrometidos de Nobotella podrían decirte algo útil sobre el propietario del nº 9 de la calle Aguamiel.","Camelia está esperando que vuelvas a Nobotella con buenas noticias.","Dale unas palmaditas a Guruñidus Tuk","Toca el timbre del nº 9 de la calle Aguamiel"}},
[6258]={nameES="Hiding the Masterworks",objectivesES={}},
[6259]={nameES="Altas Cumbres: Una ruta ocupada",objectivesES={"<rgb=#FF0000>Completing Wildermore's Recovery will cancel this quest.</rgb>","Strong White Hand Orcs have been spotted on the road in the High Knolls, making travel in Wildermore treacherous for ordinary folk.","Altas Cumbres: Una ruta ocupada","Return to Dudoc in Forlaw","The northern road in the High Knolls can be reached by speaking with Dudoc to travel there.\
\
You should travel to the High Knolls and reclaim the northern road from the Orc invaders.","Dudoc is in Forlaw.\
\
You should speak with Dudoc."}},
[6260]={nameES="Altas Cumbres: Repeler al enemigo",objectivesES={"Altas Cumbres: Repeler al enemigo","Núrzum is dead, but the enemy still roams free throughout much of Wildermore.","Ealswith is in Forlaw.\
\
You should return to Ealswith.","<rgb=#FF0000>Completing Wildermore's Recovery will cancel this quest.</rgb>","The forces of Isengard can be found in the High Knolls.\
\
You should ride to the High Knolls and defeat the enemies of Wildermore.","Regresa con Ealswith"}},
[6261]={nameES="Altas Cumbres: Temblores en los torrentes",objectivesES={"The towering stone crests of the High Knolls have shown signs of being less stable since Núrzum's encounter with Wildermore.","The southern road of the High Knolls is the most commonly used for travel.\
\
You should investigate the tall peaks of stone along the road to see if the road is stable enough for travellers.","Núrzum's passage seems to have harmed the stability of the road here","Ealswith is in Forlaw.\
\
You should return to Ealswith.","<rgb=#FF0000>Completing Wildermore's Recovery will cancel this quest.</rgb>","Regresa con Ealswith","Altas Cumbres: Temblores en los torrentes"}},
[6262]={nameES="En lo Alto de las Montañas",objectivesES={"El campamento de Glóin está al oeste del camino que asciende hacia el norte, saliendo de Rivendel. Búscalo allí y habla con él.\
\
Glóin envió una solicitud pidiendo que lo visites en su campamento en las Montañas Nubladas.","Glóin envió una carta solicitando tu presencia en su campamento al norte de Rivendel, en las Montañas Nubladas.","Habla con Glóin en su campamento en las Montañas Nubladas","En lo Alto de las Montañas"}},
[6263]={nameES="Highway Robbery",objectivesES={"Talk to Lúfred","Orcs have attacked many traders on the road in Duskenvale and stolen their supplies. The trader Lúfred has asked you to retrieve the wares.","Orcs have stolen many traders' wares by ambushing them on the road to Arhaim.\
\
You should collect the stolen supplies from the Orc camp Brafulug.","Highway Robbery","You have retrieved the stolen supplies from the Orc camp.\
\
You should return to Lúfred at the Beorning watchpost to inform him."}},
[6264]={nameES="Hildegard and the Fate of Woodhurst",objectivesES={"The grim words Hildegard shared with you are invaluable, and you should inform Herubrand","Hildegard and the Fate of Woodhurst","Gifemund awaits your return in the ore refinery near the centre of Woodhurst.\
\
Herubrand bade you return to Gifemund with Hildegard's words.","Talk to Herubrand","Herubrand is in the cellar of the farmhouse.\
\
You should tell Herubrand of your meeting with Hildegard on behalf of Gifemund.","The wealthy merchant Gifemund is in a strong position to make a move for the throne of Woodhurst, but is uncertain of the situation and seeks perspective from an unusual source.","Hildegard the soothsayer resides in a cave on the cliff overlooking Woodhurst.\
\
Gifemund asked you to speak with Hildegard the Soothsayer on his behalf.","Talk to Gifemund","Talk to the soothsayer"}},
[6265]={nameES="Hildith's Council",objectivesES={"Hildith is in the Mead Hall of Grimslade.\
\
You should speak with Hildith.","Hildith's Council","Hildith has opened her doors to you at last and summoned you to sit in on a council meeting.","Participate in Hildith's Council","Dunward is outside of the Mead Hall in Grimslade.\
\
You should speak with Dunward.","Speak with Dunward outside the Mead Hall"}},
[6266]={nameES="Amenaza de las Colinas",objectivesES={"Habla con Dwalin en el Patio de Frerin","Dwalin puede encontrarse en el Patio de Frerin, al noreste del campamento de trasgos.\
\
Debes regresar con Dwalin con noticias de tu éxito.","<rgb=#00e4ff>¡Esta misión ha sido restaurada para los Servidores Legendarios!</rgb>\
\
'Si bien este asunto de Duramano y trasgos confabulados no puede ignorarse, debemos centrar nuestra atención en asuntos más apremiantes.\
\
'Hacia el sudoeste hay un campamento de trasgos en las laderas sobre el Patio de Frerin. Ve allí y encárgate de todos ellos.\
\
'Mientras tanto, voy a investigar este asunto de los Duramano más a fondo.'","Amenaza de las Colinas","Los trasgos pueden encontrarse al sudoeste del Patio de Frerin, en las laderas de las montañas.\
\
Dwalin te ha pedido que te encargues de los trasgos acampados cerca de la Mansión de Thorin.","Los Duramano han sido descuidados en su guardia y han permitido que los trasgos merodeen por las laderas de Ered Luin.","Habla con Dwalin"}},
[6267]={nameES="Montañeses del Norte",objectivesES={"Montañeses de Angmar siguieron al ejército orco a través de Ram Dúath hasta las Quebradas del Norte y establecieron un campamento cerca de la entrada del paso. Estos montañeses mantienen abierto el paso desde Angmar.","Los montañeses están acampados cerca de la entrada este de Ram Dúath, al noreste de Esteldín.\
\
Debes recoger broches de los montañeses para que se pueda determinar la composición de sus fuerzas.","Melthindir está fuera de Esteldín, mirando hacia el este de Nan Amlug.\
\
Debes regresar con Melthindir y entregarle los broches que recogiste.","Regresa con Melthindir","Montañeses del Norte"}},
[6268]={nameES="Hills in the Mist",objectivesES={"Light the fire on the hilltop","Wood can be found in Misthallow.\
\
You should gather wood from Misthallow.","Find a suitable hill to scout Lumrog","The second hill you found is in Misthallow.\
\
You should light the fire on the hill.","<rgb=#FF0000>Look</rgb> out towards the encampment of Lumrog","Hills in the Mist","You do not have a good view of Lumrog... but you do have a plan!","The hill Skarding speaks of can be found near Thokvist in Misthallow.\
\
You should scout the situation at Lumrog from atop a nearby hill.","Egraedir is blocking the view!","The encampment is very well-guarded","Skarding can be found at Thokvist.\
\
You should talk to Skarding.","You explain to Egraedir that a fire has been lit on one of the nearby hills.\
\
'Yes, I see it. It was most likely set by those vile trolls. I do not like the way they cut down and burn the forest! By the time you get there, worthless and slow, the entire hilltop will be scorched from base to crest! I shall put it out.'","Egraedir can be found in Misthallow.\
\
You should talk to Egraedir about the fire.","Find another hill nearby","Build a fire on the hilltop","Talk to Egraedir about the fire","The thick layer of mist shrouds much of the valley of Misthallow, leaving you to patrol the valley floor if you wish to learn what moves there.","Skarding can be found at Thokvist.\
\
You should report back to Skarding.","Talk to Skarding Wargsbane at Thokvist","There must be another nearby hill in Misthallow.\
\
You should find another nearby hill.","The second hill you found is in Misthallow.\
\
You should build a fire on the hill.","The hill with a good view of Lumrog can be found in Misthallow.\
\
You should scout Lumrog from afar."}},
[6269]={nameES="Frustra los planes de los orcos",objectivesES={"Maethoron se encuentra en Talan Haldir, cerca de las orillas del Nimrodel, al sureste de Nanduhirion.\
\
Has derrotado a muchos de los emboscadores orcos que dificultaban el viaje por el camino a través de Nanduhirion, y ahora deberías informar a Maethoron de tu éxito.","Frustra los planes de los orcos","Se pueden encontrar emboscadores orcos a lo largo del camino que atraviesa Nanduhirion, al noroeste de Talan Haldir.\
\
Maethoron te ha pedido que acabes con los emboscadores en Nanduhirion para que el camino sea seguro.","Maethoron está preocupado por el creciente número de emboscadores orcos en el camino que atraviesa Nanduhirion hacia Lothlórien.","Habla con Maethoron"}},
[6270]={nameES="Hindering Côs Braen",objectivesES={}},
[6271]={nameES="Hindering the Horde",objectivesES={"You should cull the drake-horde by destroying their eggs","Hindering the Horde","The drakes of Wyrmdelf have laid an enormous number of eggs, creating a threat that the Rohirrim might not be able to overcome.","Destroy drake-eggs","Drake-eggs can be found in nests throughout the Wyrmdelf.\
\
You should destroy any drake-eggs you find in the Wyrmdelf.","The drakes of Wyrmdelf have laid an enormous number of eggs, creating a threat that the Rohirrim might not be able to overcome.\
\
You should destroy as many of the eggs as possible."}},
[6272]={nameES="Anzuelo a sueldo",objectivesES={"Lleva la caña cebada a Petunia Corneta","La señorita Corneta está horrorizada por el acto bárbaro de la pesca, así que parece que debes seguir echándole una mano","Dile a Petunia Corneta que el cebo está listo","El cubo de cebo está justo donde lo dejaste, al norte del lugar de pesca.\
\
Deberías cebar la línea de pesca para Petunia Corneta.","Excava en la tierra húmeda para buscar gusanos","Al parecer, la señorita Corneta no tiene ninguna intención de cebar la línea de pesca ella misma…","Anzuelo a sueldo","Tu bondad natural te impulsó a ayudar a una joven hobbit en apuros; quizá te lo pienses dos veces antes de volver a hacerlo.\
\
Petunia Corneta se encuentra en el lugar de pesca de Delagua. Deberías volver a hablar con Petunia Corneta y, con suerte, esta vez te liberará de tu acuerdo con ella.","Convence a Petunia Corneta de que te deje terminar de ayudarla por hoy","La tierra húmeda, el caldo de cultivo perfecto para los gusanos, se encuentra justo al norte de la zona de pesca, cruzando el pequeño puente.\
\
Deberías desenterrar gusanos en la tierra húmeda y colocarlos en el cubo de cebo cercano.","Quizá deberías pensártelo dos veces antes de volver a aceptar ayudar a Petunia Corneta, porque parece que nunca te dejará marcharte","Muestra el pez que atrapaste a Petunia Corneta","Engancha el cebo para Petunia Corneta","Se pueden atrapar peces en el estanque de Delagua.\
\
Debes usar tus conocimientos de pesca para atrapar un pez en el lugar de pesca para la cena de Petunia Corneta.","Has enganchado un gusano","Petunia Corneta ha sido desafiada a atrapar peces para la cena de su familia, pero no se siente preparada para muchas de las tareas poco refinadas que implica conseguir la comida.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando finalice el festival actual.</rgb>","Petunia Corneta se encuentra cerca del lugar de pesca de Delagua.\
\
Deberías llevarle el pez que has atrapado a Petunia Corneta, pues seguro que quedará satisfecha tras todo el esfuerzo que has hecho por ella.","Lleva el pez a Hal Corneta en Hobbiton","Hal Corneta se encuentra en el centro de Hobbiton, el pueblo situado al oeste y un poco al norte de Delagua.\
\
Deberías llevar el pez que has atrapado al hermano de Petunia Corneta, Hal Corneta.","Petunia Corneta está acurrucada cerca del lugar de pesca en la Comarca.\
\
Deberías hablar con Petunia Corneta y decirle que el cebo está listo.","Es probable que Petunia Corneta siga acurrucada en el lugar de pesca de Delagua.\
\
Deberías llevarle la línea de pesca con el cebo a Petunia Corneta."}},
[6273]={nameES="Hired Ruffians?",objectivesES={}},
[6274]={nameES="History Etched in Stone",objectivesES={}},
[6275]={nameES="History of Darkness",objectivesES={}},
[6276]={nameES="Mente de colmena",objectivesES={"Habla con Moggi en el Refugio Sombrío","Moggi se encuentra en el Refugio Sombrío, al noroeste de Skûmfil.\
\
Has encontrado y matado al grodbog guerrero Uammaethor y a sus defensores en el lugar lleno de cadáveres llamado Skûmfil.","Derrota a Nestaduan","Mente de colmena","Skûmfil se encuentra al sureste del Refugio Sombrío.\
\
Moggi te ha enviado a Skûmfil para acabar con los gredbyg guerreros que allí habitan y que tienen cierta independencia respecto a la reina Brúmbereth. El jefe de estos es Uammaethor.","Derrotaste a Ulugon","Derrotaste a Grog","Derrotaste a Grothulun","Derrota a Uammaethor","Skûmfil no es más que un vertedero, un lugar donde se arrojan a los orcos muertos de Moria cuando empiezan a apestar. Es allí donde dos enemigos se han reunido, cada uno con la intención de usar los cadáveres para sus propios fines. Los kergrim y otros carroñeros los utilizan como fuente de alimento, y los insectos, como lugar para poner sus huevos y engendrar futuras generaciones.","Derrotaste a Nestaduan","Derrotaste a Uammaethor","Derrota a Grog","Derrota a Ulugon","Derrota a Grothulun"}},
[6277]={nameES="Hládek the Hoary, Scourge of Thikil-gundu",objectivesES={"Hládek the Hoary poses a grave threat to all that seek the knowledge buried within Thikil-gundu.","Hládek the Hoary, Scourge of Thikil-gundu","Defeat Hládek the Hoary, Scourge of Thikil-gundu","Defeated Hládek the Hoary, Scourge of Thikil-gundu","Completado","Hládek the Hoary, Scourge of Thikil-gundu has been defeated. You have removed a significant threat.","You have encountered Hládek the Hoary, Scourge of Thikil-gundu"}},
[6278]={nameES="Hoarded Goods",objectivesES={"Bring the supplies to Bregdal","Bregdal has asked you to gather any supplies you might find in Dâr Mauzur.","A notice is pinned to the board, signed by Bredgal:\
\
'Many supplies have been seen in the encampment of Dâr Mauzur, in Talath Úrui. A brave adventurer is needed to infiltrate the encampment and recover some of these supplies.'","Bregdal, a soldier of Gondor, has scouted Talath Úrui and found a fortified enemy encampment within the sprawling wreckage of Dâr Mauzur.","Bregdal can be found on the border of Talath Úrui and Dor Amarth.\
\
You should bring the supplies to Bregdal.","Hoarded Goods"}},
[6279]={nameES="Hoarhallow's Dwindling Food",objectivesES={"Emissary Pip Diggins of Hoarhallow told you a tale of woe concerning the destruction wrought on his village by the Snowreap-goblins far to the north-east of Hoarhallow.","Deliver the food-sacks to Emissary Pip Diggins at Ost Ringdyr","The goblin-village of Grothum lies far to the north-east of Hoarhallow.\
\
Emissary Pip Diggins asked you to recover food stolen from Hoarhallow. He directed you to search among the goblin village at Grothum or on the persons of the enemy.","Hoarhallow's Dwindling Food"}},
[6280]={nameES="Hobbits of the Company: Gathering Rations",objectivesES={}},
[6281]={nameES="Dificulta el liderazgo",objectivesES={"Dificulta el liderazgo","Con los rangos de los orcos invasores reducidos, ahora es el momento de atacar a su liderazgo, obstaculizando su comunicación y sumiendo sus fuerzas en el caos.","Raskwith se encuentra en Mekhem-bizru, al noroeste de los campamentos orcos.\
\
Raskwith estará encantado de saber que los emisarios orcos de Moria han sido derrotados.","Habla con Raskwith en Mekhem-bizru","Derrota al emisario orco en Athmadhul","Emisario orco derrotado en Uruk-gashan","Emisario orco derrotado en Drû-garmadh","Emisario orco derrotado en Athmadhul","Derrota al emisario orco en Drû-garmadh","Los emisarios orcos de Moria se encuentran en Uruk-gashan, Drû-garmadh y Athmadhul.\
\
Raskwith te ha pedido que vayas a los tres campamentos orcos del Valle del Arroyo Sombrío y derrotes a los tres emisarios orcos de Moria.","Derrota al emisario orco en Uruk-gashan"}},
[6282]={nameES="Hobbling Homeward",objectivesES={"Hobbling Homeward","Malhar has stopped for a rest at a point in the Mouths of Entwash. Talk to him and see if you can be of any help.","Scouted to the west","Return to Malhar where he waits at a point in the Mouths of Entwash and let him know that the path ahead is clear.","Defend yourself","Bring the filled water-skin to Malhar, where he waits at a point in the Mouths of Entwash.","Give Malhar the water-skin","Scout ahead to the west","This water looks fresh and clear","Scout ahead to the south-west","Malhar has stopped on his path in the Mouths of Entwash. Talk to him to hear what he has to say.","You have led Malhar safely out of the Mouths of Entwash. Go with him to Glánhar in the centre of Ost Rimmon.","Armed men jump out at you","Malhar has stopped and seems to be listening hard for some sound","Malhar is stopped short by a dry coughing fit","Scouted to the south-west","Talk to Malhar when you are ready to begin the journey out of the Mouths of Entwash.","The Beacon Hills comes into view","This water is muddy and unsuitable for drinking","Find water","Investigate the sounds","Accompany Malhar on the path out of the Mouths of Entwash.","The noises Malhar heard ahead of him in the Mouths of Entwash turned out to be a Variag ambush!","Malhar is ready to travel back to Ost Rimmon.","Find fresh water near Malhar, at a point in the Mouths of Entwash, and fill his empty water-skin.","Return to Malhar where he waits at a point in the Mouths of Entwash and describe what you saw scouting ahead.","Malhar comes to a halt and looks around, hesitating","Investigate the noises Malhar thinks he heard, just south of the point he stopped in the Mouths of Entwash.","Malhar stopped again, just as the Beacon Hills came into full view. Talk to him to hear what he has to say.","Scouted to the south","Filled the water-skin","Fill the water-skin","Malhar has asked you to scout ahead, south and west of the point where he has stopped in the Mouths of Entwash.","Return to Malhar","Scout ahead to the south","Return to Glánhar","Variag defeated","Go with Malhar","You relay all that you encountered.\
\
'I see, then. No path is safe, I think, but I judge our best course is to head due south. Yes, I think so.'","Talk to Malhar"}},
[6283]={nameES="Caballito de madera",objectivesES={"Caballito de madera","Ride through the sixth gate.","The hobby-horse is near Harwick's Mead Hall.\
\
To run the race, you must first have a hobby-horse.","Garbrand is outside the Mead Hall of Harwick.","The first gate is ahead.","Do not let time expire","The children run races on hobby-horses.","Ride through the fourth gate.","<rgb=#FF0000>Completing Aiding the Eastemnet will cancel this quest</rgb>","Ride through the tenth gate.","Ride through the fifth gate.","Ride through the third gate.","Reach the second gate.","Ride through the twelfth gate.","Ride through the ninth gate.","Ride through the eighth gate.","Ride through the seventh gate.","Return to Garbrand","Ride through the eleventh gate."}},
[6284]={nameES="La receta del hobotrasgo",objectivesES={"La receta del hobotrasgo","Bob Hojasverdes cree haber descubierto los planes de los trasgos.","Bob Hojasverdes está en Dwaling, al norte de la Cresta de la Hoja Sombría.\
\
Deberías volver a ver a Bob Hojasverdes con las noticias de tu éxito.","Receta de los hobotrasgos recogida","Llévale la receta de los hobotrasgos a Bob Hojasverdes","Recoge la receta de los hobotrasgos","El campamento de los trasgos está en la Cresta de la Hoja Sombría, al sur de Dwaling.\
\
Bob Hojasverdes quiere que quemes las ollas que usan los trasgos para cocinar las arañas, así como que recuperes la receta de su brea."}},
[6285]={nameES="Hobgoblins at the Highest House",objectivesES={"Hobgoblins at the Highest House","The Battle of Uzdarulzahar is underway!\
\
You should defeat hobgoblins in Uzdarulzahar.","The battle proceeds!","Completado","You have defeated many hobgoblins in Uzdarulzahar, turning the tide of battle in favour of the Gabil'akkâ!","The Battle of Uzdarulzahar has begun, and the hobgoblin forces must be defeated."}},
[6286]={nameES="¡Llegaron las Hobbitravesuras!",objectivesES={"Las Hobbitravesuras son un pasatiempo muy apreciado por los hobbits de la Comarca. Han traído este juego tan singular al campo de festivales al norte de Bree. ¿Qué podría salir mal al darle palos a una docena de aventureros y poner una gallina en el medio?"}},
[6287]={nameES="Hold On",objectivesES={}},
[6288]={nameES="Hold the Mine",objectivesES={}},
[6289]={nameES="Holding Back the Tide",objectivesES={"Speak to Thane Elfmar at the Mead Hall of Faldham","The Uruk-hai riders are east of Acdreda's position.\
\
Acdreda requires aid in defending the eastern farms from the enemy riders.","Acdreda defends the area directly east of Sahard's farmstead.\
\
Norbald has spotted a band of Uruk riders moving towards Acdreda's position.","Acdreda defends outside the eastern edge of Sahard's farm.\
\
Acdreda awaits to hear of your confrontation with the Uruk-hai riders.","Time has expired","Do not allow time to expire","Speak to Acdreda east of Sahard's farm","Norbald has been able to hold and secure the perimeter at his location, but another band of enemy riders heads east towards Acdreda.","Holding Back the Tide","Speak to Acdreda east of Sahard's farmstead","Elfmar musters the other riders at the Mead Hall of Faldham.\
\
Acdreda hopes that Elfmar has rallied the remaining men for the main assault against Faldham."}},
[6290]={nameES="Holdouts Amongst the Rubble",objectivesES={"Defeat enemies hiding in Osgiliath.","Talk to Mablung","You should talk to Mablung, who can be found at the Ranger encampment in after-battle Osgiliath.","Holdouts Amongst the Rubble","Mablung has asked you to defeat  enemies still lurking in Osgiliath."}},
[6291]={nameES="Té de hojas de acebo",objectivesES={"Té de hojas de acebo","Los acebos se pueden encontrar por todo Glâd Ereg. Celebrandir está acampado en Gwingris, en el norte de Glâd Ereg.\
\
Debes recoger más hojas de acebo y llevárselas al Elfo Celebrandir.","Lleva las hojas de acebo a Celebrandir en Gwingris","Aunque las bayas de acebo se consideran generalmente venenosas, las hojas de acebo se utilizan a menudo para preparar té.","Esta rama está cubierta de hojas de acebo aromáticas. Has oído que los Elfos pueden preparar excelentes tés con las hojas de muchos árboles diferentes. Tal vez uno de los Elfos en Gwingris pueda preparar algo con estas hojas de acebo si reúnes más"}},
[6292]={nameES="Home Awaits",objectivesES={"Home Awaits","Refugees from Lothgobel can be found around Calembel.\
\
You should tell the refugees that it is safe for them to return, for the Corsairs have pulled out.","Return to Laindir","Laindir is in Calembel.\
\
You should return to Laindir to tell him the refugees have been informed of the good news.","The refugees of Lothgobel are in Calembel, and should return to their home now that it is safe from the Corsairs."}},
[6293]={nameES="Home Is Where You Hang Your Helmet",objectivesES={"Find Bezab's lost helmet somewhere in the water channel that runs through Furukzahar","Talk to Bezab south of the entrance to the throne in Furukzahar","Examine Bezab's lost helmet in the cave-claw nest by the water channel that runs through Furukzahar","Bezab misplaced his helmet, and he fears it might have fallen into the river that runs through Furukzahar.","Home Is Where You Hang Your Helmet","An egg rests inside Bezab's lost helmet, and you decide not to disturb it","Bezab is south of the entrance to the throne in Furukzahar, waiting to hear if you found his lost helmet.","You have found Bezab's lost helmet in the middle of a cave-claw nest","You found Bezab's lost helmet beside the water channel that runs through Furukzahar, but it seems a cave-claw found it first.","Bezab dropped his favourite helmet over the railing in Furukzahar and it fell into the water channel that runs through the fortress."}},
[6294]={nameES="Home from the War",objectivesES={"Home from the War","Urama has suggested you introduce yourself to her son, Turizi.","Talk to Turizi","Turizi has been troubled since returning home from the war in the north. You should talk to him behind the house at Ekagar."}},
[6295]={nameES="Nostalgia y Malestar",objectivesES={"Bingo está en la esquina noreste de Maur Tulhau, sufriendo de un estómago revuelto.\
\
Lili Gardhur te dio algo de té medicinal para llevárselo a Bingo.","Habla con Lili Gardhur en Maur Tulhau","Se pueden encontrar plantas de té fuera de Maur Tulhau, en los Valles Sombríos.\
\
Lili Gardhur te dio un cuchillo y te envió a buscar plantas de té adecuadas fuera de Maur Tulhau.","Habla con Bingo en Maur Tulhau","Bingo ha comido demasiado durante el Festín de Bienvenida y te pidió que busques a un sanador en Maur Tulhau que pueda tener un remedio para él.","Recoge el té caliente del hito en Maur Tulhau","Lili te entrega una taza caliente de té medicinal para Bingo","Bingo ha terminado el té medicinal, y ahora deberías ver si se siente mejor.","Habla con Haley Pradodulce en Maur Tulhau","Bingo y sus acompañantes están en la esquina noreste de Maur Tulhau.","Corta brotes de té de las plantas en los Valles Sombríos","Lili Gardhur está en la plaza central de Maur Tulhau, en los Valles Sombríos.","Una olla de té caliente está hirviendo sobre el hito en el centro de Maur Tulhau.\
\
Lili Gardhur cree que el otro té que llevaste a Bingo se enfrió demasiado para ser eficaz y quiere que le lleves otra olla con mayor rapidez.","Bingo está en la esquina noreste de Maur Tulhau, sorbiendo el té que le llevaste.","Iola Isbrun está en la esquina noreste de Maur Tulhau.","Habla con Lili Gardhur, la sanadora de Maur Tulhau","Lleva el té medicinal a Bingo en la esquina noreste de Maur Tulhau","Habla con Iola Isbrun en Maur Tulhau","La gente de este pueblo ha sido muy amable, pero su Festín de Bienvenida no ha sido nada amable con Bingo.\
\
'Haley me dijo que no era necesario probar todos los platos que me pusieran delante, ¡y ese consejo me vino muy bien! ¿Te imaginas qué habría pasado si no me hubiera deshecho de la Piedra de Roth? Algún cruel accidente culinario, ¡seguro!'","Lili Gardhur está en la plaza central de Maur Tulhau.\
\
El té medicinal de Lili no pareció ayudar al estado de Bingo, y él te pidió que averigües si ella tiene algún otro remedio que pueda funcionar.","Lleva los brotes de té a Lili Gardhur en Maur Tulhau","Habla con Teodoro Tojo en Maur Tulhau","Bingo está en la esquina noreste de Maur Tulhau.","Bingo quizá haya disfrutado un poco demasiado del Festín de Bienvenida de Maur Tulhau y ahora se siente muy mal.","Bingo toma el té caliente y lo sorbe con cuidado","Un olor penetrante llena el aire cuando cortas la parte superior de la planta","Nostalgia y Malestar","Lili te entrega un pequeño cuchillo y te maravilla lo afilado de su filo"}},
[6296]={nameES="Homestead Defence",objectivesES={"Aid Mabon in searching the homestead","Mabon is just east of the Homestead in the northern Starkmoor.\
\
Mabon will want to speak with you about the raid.","Mabon is just east of the homestead in the northern Starkmoor.\
\
Mabon needs your help to drive the raiders out of his father's homestead and protect the valuables within.","Homestead Defence","Talk to Mabon at Andras' homestead","Andras is not the only one who wishes to obtain valuables from his homestead."}},
[6297]={nameES="Residencias de Eriador",objectivesES={"Residencias de Eriador","Habla con uno de los vendedores de casas de Eriador","Habla con uno de los vendedores de casas que se pueden encontrar en Eriador.\
\
Podrás encontrar a estos vendedores de casas:\
- Al otro lado del río desde Duillond\
- Al otro lado del río, al oeste de la Puerta de Thorin\
- Al sur de Cavada Grande\
- Al sureste de Entibo","Con los rumores de guerra, el enemigo que avanza y expulsa a los habitantes de las zonas rurales de Eriador, y los nuevos conflictos que atraen colonos desde las tierras del sur, pequeñas comunidades están surgiendo en el Norte. Un agente que encontraste te ha sugerido aprovechar la oportunidad para comprar tu propia casa hablando con uno de los vendedores que se encuentran cerca de las principales comunidades de todo Eriador."}},
[6298]={nameES="Residencias de Gondor",objectivesES={"Puedes tomar el caballo que está junto al vendedor de casas en Dol Amroth, Pelargir o Minas Tirith.\
\
Deberías ir y dar una vuelta por la zona residencial del cabo de Belfalas y sus alrededores.","Residencias de Gondor","Al amable anciano le encantaría mostrarte los alrededores del cabo de Belfalas","Te encuentras en el Camino del Cabo, que lleva al faro","Habla con Falastír","Falastír se encuentra en el faro del cabo de Belfalas.\
\
El vendedor de casas te ha recomendado que hables con Falastír, el viejo farero.","Debido a la amenaza que se cierne sobre algunas zonas de Belfalas, muchos nobles han abandonado sus hogares buscando la seguridad de la ciudad, dejando gran parte de las áreas costeras tranquilas y desocupadas. Un administrador de residencias te ha sugerido que aproveches la oportunidad para comprar tu propia casa en Gondor.","Visita el cabo de Belfalas"}},
[6299]={nameES="Residencias de Rohan",objectivesES={"Rohan necesita granjeros y colonos. El agente inmobiliario de Rohan te ha sugerido que aproveches la oportunidad de comprar tu propia casa en Rohan.","Las residencias dominan Edoras","Este pequeño pueblo es animado","Visita las residencias de la Tierra del Rey de Rohan","Puedes encontrar a Burginda en Edoras o en las residencias de la Tierra del Rey. Seleflad se encuentra en Edoras o en las residencias del Folde este.\
\
Deberías hablar con Burginda o con Seleflad.","Residencias de Rohan","Visita una de las casas del barrio de la Tierra del Rey","Visita una de las salas de banquetes de las residencias de la Tierra del Rey","Visita una de las casas de las residencias del Folde este","Visita el centro de las residencias de la Tierra del Rey","Este pequeño pueblo es bastante rústico","Esta casa es muy impresionante","Visita una de las salas de banquetes de las residencias del Folde este","Visita las residencias del Folde este de Rohan","Esta sala de banquetes es muy impresionante","Habla con Burginda","Las casas están dispuestas en círculo alrededor de la sala de banquetes","Visita el centro de las residencias del Folde este","Las residencias de la Tierra del Rey y del Folde este se encuentran en Rohan.\
\
Deberías visitar y explorar las residencias de la Tierra del Rey y del Folde este.","Habla con Seleflad"}},
[6300]={nameES="Homesteads of the Eastfold",objectivesES={"Seleflad can be found at Edoras or the Eastfold Homesteads.\
\
You should talk to Seleflad.","Homesteads of the Eastfold","Habla con Seleflad","The rural foothills of Rohan are in need of pioneers and tree-friends. Seleflad has suggested you might take the opportunity to purchase your own home in Rohan."}},
[6301]={nameES="Osos mieleros",objectivesES={"El granjero Polo Ganapié ha tenido problemas con osos que saquean sus colmenas y matan a sus abejas.","El granjero Ganapié cerró sus colmenas para proteger a sus abejas de los osos mieleros, pero no pueden mantenerse cerradas o las abejas también sufrirán. Te ha pedido que ahuyentes a cualquier oso atraído por la miel.","Osos mieleros","Protege a Polo y ahuyenta a todos los osos","Ahora que has ahuyentado a los osos, habla de nuevo con Polo Ganapié para recibir tu recompensa.","Los osos han sido ahuyentados"}},
[6302]={nameES="Pollo Asado con Miel — Introducción",objectivesES={"Baldwin Colazorro está en la Casa de los Mathoms, en Cavada Grande, en la Comarca.\
\
Baldwin te ha pedido que le lleves un pollo asado con miel para los cocineros de la Sociedad de los Mathoms.","Pollo asado con miel recogido","Lleva el pollo asado con miel a Baldwin Colazorro","Baldwin Colazorro te dijo que un pollo asado con miel es siempre el centro de la cena de la Sociedad de los Mathoms, pero el Maestro Cocinero ha estado demasiado ocupado para preparar uno.","Pollo Asado con Miel — Introducción","Recoge un pollo asado con miel"}},
[6303]={nameES="Honour Enough",objectivesES={}},
[6304]={nameES="Honour and Treachery",objectivesES={"Talk to Fastred at Kings' End","Talk to Fastred","Talk to Burnoth at Minas Tirith","The paths of the Riders Three and Reeve Fastred align as they move against Crúmgam and his traitorous agent.","Honour and Treachery","Battle on the Pelennor Fields until the day is won","Fastred can be found at Kings' End.\
\
Burnoth has asked you to speak to Fastred about Crúmgam.","The Riders Three can be found at the Threshold of the City.\
\
The battle is won. You should now speak to the Riders Three, and learn of what they faced after your paths diverged.","Fastred can be found at Kings' End.\
\
Fastred has asked you to accompany him and the Riders Three into battle against Crúmgam. You should speak to him when you are prepared.","Talk to Hutha at Minas Tirith","Talk to Ulf at Minas Tirith","There are many things to be done before the day is won on the Pelennor Fields.\
\
Note: You must complete Book 6, Chapter 8 of Volume IV to advance this objective."}},
[6305]={nameES="Honour and Vengeance",objectivesES={"You have arrived at Hata Kebir and Jajax rushes to your side","Fearing his people will become slaves to Mordor at the war's end, Jajax weighs his decision to strike against the Heirs of Castamir.","Aid Jajax in weakening the leaders of Hata Kebir","Meet Jajax at Hata Kebir","Aid Jajax in searching Hata Kebir","Erchar can be found in Linhir along the Gilrain in western Lebennin.\
\
Jajax has decided to remain with his brother until you are able to rally the forces of Erchar and Herion against the Heirs of Castamir. You should return to Linhir.","Jajax can be found at your side or can be called with your horn.\
\
You have listened to Daxamat's retelling and should now speak to Jajax.","Listen to the tale of Daxamat's journey with Balakhôr the Scourge","Honour and Vengeance","Hata Kebir can be found due east of Aerthir in south-eastern Lebennin.\
\
Jajax has asked you to aid him in fighting against the Heirs of Castamir at Hata Kebir.","Daxamat can be found in the northernmost area of Hata Kebir in south-eastern Lebennin.\
\
You should listen to Daxamat as he recounts the story of his journey to Lebennin alongside the Scourge.","Jajax can be found at your side or called with your horn.\
\
You should aid Jajax in his search of Hata Kebir.","Talk to Erchar in Linhir","Aid Jajax in stealing his fellow Corsairs' pillage","Jajax rushes to your side!","Aid Jajax in crippling the forces of Hata Kebir","Talk to Jajax","Hata Kebir can be found in south-eastern Lebennin.\
\
Jajax has asked your aid in weakening the forces of the Heirs of Castamir in Hata Kebir."}},
[6306]={nameES="Caza honorable",objectivesES={"Caza honorable","Vuelve con Linnet","Linnet se encuentra en la zona centro-sur del Bosque Salvaje.\
\
Deberías volver con Linnet.","Ahora que vuelve a ser posible viajar al Bosque Salvaje, los cazadores han acudido en busca de bestias legendarias.","En la zona central del Bosque Salvaje se pueden encontrar trampas envenenadas.\
\
Linnet te ha pedido que destruyas todas las trampas envenenadas con las que te encuentres."}},
[6307]={nameES="Honouring Healers",objectivesES={}},
[6308]={nameES="Honouring the Burned",objectivesES={}},
[6309]={nameES="Honrar a los muertos",objectivesES={"Los angmarim han estado saqueando las tumbas de Annúminas.","Orchalwë querrá quedarse con las cajas fuertes hasta que pueda devolverlas a Tinnudir.","Lleva las cajas fuertes a Orchalwë","Hay cajas fuertes llenas de reliquias fuera de las puertas de las tumbas de Annúminas en Tyl Annûn.","Honrar a los muertos"}},
[6310]={nameES="Honrar a los muertos",objectivesES={}},
[6311]={nameES="Honrando a los caídos",objectivesES={"Shatogtar derrotado","Lleva las estatuas a Ladenthir en Echad Eregion","Hay estatuas conmemorativas repartidas por todo Barad Morlas, al suroeste de Echad Eregion.\
\
Ladenthir te ha pedido que conserves la memoria de los Elfos de Eregion recuperando las estatuas conmemorativas colocadas en Barad Morlas por los Elfos de Rivendel antes de que los semiorcos puedan saquearlas. También te ha pedido que derrotes a Shatogtar, uno de los Uruk-hai.","Ladenthir está en Echad Eregion, al noreste de Barad Morlas.\
\
Deberías volver a ver a Ladenthir con las noticias de tu éxito.","Después de la destrucción de Eregion a menos de Sauron, los elfos de Rivendel regresaron al lugar y colocaron estatuas en lugares donde sus valientes guerreros cayeron en combate.","Derrota a Shatogtar","Honrando a los caídos"}},
[6312]={nameES="Honrando a los caídos",objectivesES={"Se plantó una bandera para honrar a los enanos","Regresa con Ráthulf","Ráthulf llora por los enanos que perdieron la vida a manos del Guardián del Agua.","Ráthulf está en el Umbral de Durin en Moria.\
\
Debes regresar con Ráthulf y contarle sobre tu servicio a los enanos caídos.","Honrando a los caídos","Planta una bandera en la tumba de los enanos caídos","Fuera de la Puerta de Acebeda se encuentra un pequeño cementerio donde yacen los enanos caídos.\
\
Debes plantar una bandera en el cementerio justo afuera de la Puerta de Acebeda."}},
[6313]={nameES="Honouring the Gilrain",objectivesES={"Baskets and cloth can be found in Malbarth, and reeds can be found along the banks of the Gilrain.\
\
Arvaeth has asked for your help in crafting the traditional tribute baskets woven by the people of Lebennin.","Deliver the baskets and materials to Arvaeth","Honouring the Gilrain","The folk of Malbarth pay tribute to the river Gilrain for the bounty it has granted the people of Lebennin and to honour the fabled Sisters of their land.","Arvaeth can be found on the banks of the Gilrain, to the north-west of Malbarth.\
\
You have gathered all of the materials Arvaeth asked for and should now return to him with them."}},
[6314]={nameES="Anzuelo, Sedal y Plomada",objectivesES={"Garbert está en su cabaña en Tâl Bruinen, al sur y oeste de Rivendel.\
\
Haldúr te ha pedido que visites a Garbert y le compres suministros de pesca debido a sus heridas.","Habla con Garbert","Haldúr te ha informado de que Garbert atraviesa dificultades y podría necesitar algo de negocio.","Anzuelo, Sedal y Plomada"}},
[6315]={nameES="Hope For Brighter Days",objectivesES={}},
[6316]={nameES="Hope For Walstow",objectivesES={"Adalgifu looks painfully uncomfortable with what just occurred, but she at least seems to be distracted from the threats facing Walstow","Talk to Adalgifu","Hubyrt appears markedly unimpressed by this display, but cracks a slight smile","Comfort Adalgifu with a <rgb=#FF00FF>hug</rgb>, <rgb=#FF00FF>calm</rgb>ing words, a mighty <rgb=#FF00FF>flex</rgb>, or a <rgb=#FF00FF>story</rgb>","The crofters and guard-captain are in Walstow centre.\
\
Winsig is worried that her crofters are losing hope and wants you to speak with them about their concerns. After that, she would like to hear a report.","The Rohirrim guard-captain, Egelferth, is stationed at the north end of Walstow.\
\
Winsig is worried that her crofters are losing hope and wants you to speak with them about their concerns. After that, she would like to hear a report.","Hubyrt appears excited to hear a tale of your adventures thus far","Adalgifu appears greatly distracted as you tell the tale of your journey to Rohan","Adalgifu is in Walstow.\
\
You should try to comfort her with a <rgb=#FF00FF>hug</rgb>, some <rgb=#FF00FF>calm</rgb>ing words, a mighty <rgb=#FF00FF>flex</rgb>, or an enthralling <rgb=#FF00FF>story</rgb>.","Talk to Hubyrt","Egelferth nods slightly and returns to his post","Adalgifu stifles a chuckle as you pose, but her smile is unmistakable","Talk to Winsig","Hubyrt takes a deep breath and appears more relaxed","The crofters and guards of Walstow are beginning to lose hope in the face of the dangers which plague them.","Hope For Walstow","Comfort Hubyrt with a <rgb=#FF00FF>hug</rgb>, <rgb=#FF00FF>calm</rgb>ing words, a mighty <rgb=#FF00FF>flex</rgb>, or a <rgb=#FF00FF>story</rgb>","<rgb=#FF00FF>Salute</rgb> Egelferth before returning to Winsig","Adalgifu is standing in central Walstow.\
\
Winsig is worried that her crofters are losing hope and wants you to speak with them about their concerns. After that, she would like to hear a report.","Talk to Egelferth","Winsig can be found in the Mead Hall of Walstow.","Hubyrt appears comforted and smiles genuinely","The guard-captain is in Walstow.\
\
You should give the guard-captain a <rgb=#FF00FF>salute</rgb>.","Hubyrt is standing in Walstow.\
\
You should try to comfort him with a <rgb=#FF00FF>hug</rgb>, some <rgb=#FF00FF>calm</rgb>ing words, a mighty <rgb=#FF00FF>flex</rgb>, or an enthralling <rgb=#FF00FF>story</rgb>.","Adalgifu lets out a sigh, but appears to be soothed by your words"}},
[6317]={nameES="La esperanza del este",objectivesES={"La esperanza del este","Habla con Borgar en Jazârgund","Los calderos están hacia el este, en Jundul-dûm.\
\
Borgar te ha pedido que enciendas varios calderos que hay por el camino que va hacia el este desde Jazârgund.","Borgar está en Jazârgund, al oeste de Jundul-dûm.\
\
Borgar estará encantado de oír que los refuerzos que pidió podrán ahora encontrar el camino.","Borgar ha sido informado de que más enanos están siendo preparados para reforzar el campamento de Jazârgund."}},
[6318]={nameES="Hope Rekindled",objectivesES={"Hope Rekindled","Talk to Lhucu at her hut","Naeglanc is at Echad Naeglanc, west of the cairns where Mair is posted.\
\
Mair has asked you to speak with Naeglanc regarding the remnants of the vessel you recovered.","Talk to Naeglanc at Echad Naeglanc","Lhucu's hut sits upon a ridge west of Echad Naeglanc, between Lhan Gogledh and Lhan Bach.\
\
Naeglanc suggested that you speak with Lhucu, daughter of Trehéarn Brenin, regarding the urn.","You brought the remnants of an ancient, rune-engraved vessel to Mair among the cairns."}},
[6319]={nameES="Hope for Thornhope?",objectivesES={"Thane Wulfrad is at Thornhope, north-west of Eaworth, in the Entwash Vale.\
\
Reeve Ingbert asked you to go to Thane Wulfrad and learn the circumstances of Thornhope that prevented them from sending aid to Eaworth.","Word had been sent to Thornhope, the northern city of the Entwash Vale, requesting aid against the Orcs' siege, but Ingbert has heard no word from Thane Wulfrad.","Talk to Thane Wulfrad at Thornhope","The man before you seems disoriented and more than half mad. His garments are torn and bloody, testament to the battle which occurred at the city of Thornhope.\
\
'What? Who?'","Hope for Thornhope?"}},
[6320]={nameES="Hope for the Harvest",objectivesES={"Bring the crops you salvaged to Gifemund","The villagers fear that all the crops they harvested have been spoiled by the frost.","This crop has been ruined by the frost","Hope for the Harvest","Harvested crops can be found throughout Dunfast near many of the buildings.\
\
You should check the crops for spoilage, and gather any that are still safe to eat.","This crop is still good to eat","Gifemund can be found at the refugees' encampment south-west of Dunfast.\
\
You should bring the crops you rescued to Gifemund."}},
[6321]={nameES="Hope from Thornhope",objectivesES={}},
[6322]={nameES="Horn of Rockwithers",objectivesES={"Rockwithers can be found among the Thistledown Grazers, south across the Hoarwell River.\
\
Angmar's forces at Tol Ascarnen are building a horn with which to call reinforcements to the fight when the Free Peoples return to assault the area. Kaasak has tasked you with retrieving the horn of the great aurochs, Rockwithers.","Collected Rockwithers' horn","Collect Rockwithers' horn","Talk to Soldier Kaasak at Tol Ascarnen","Tol Ascarnen has fallen to the combined might of Angmar's army, but their forces are meagre, and they must fortify quickly, else the Free Peoples will regain a foothold here.","Horn of Rockwithers"}},
[6323]={nameES="Horns Aplenty",objectivesES={}},
[6324]={nameES="Horns for Battle",objectivesES={"Collect metal fastenings from Rymenhild","Craft battle-horns for the guards of Eaworth","Offram stands guard outside the Vendor Hall in Eaworth.\
\
You should let Offram know that you have delivered the battle-horns to the guards of Eaworth.","Talk to Offram outside the Vendor Hall in Eaworth","The guards can be found throughout the city of Eaworth in the Entwash Vale.\
\
Offram asked you to deliver the battle-horns you crafted to the guards of Eaworth.","Collected metal fastenings from Rymenhild","Horns for Battle","The Quartermaster's workbench is outside the Mead Hall of Eaworth.\
\
Offram asked you to take the materials you collect to the Quartermaster's workbench and craft battle-horns for the guards of Eaworth.","Offram has provided the ivory you need. Rymenhild can be found in the northern part of Eaworth. Leather can be found near the Vendor Hall in Eaworth.\
\
Offram wants you to collect the ivory, fastenings, and leather needed to craft battle-horns for the guards of Eaworth.","Offram is decidedly pleased with your hunting prowess and your offering of meat, hides, and ivory. He has more tasks for you."}},
[6325]={nameES="Horse-bedding",objectivesES={"The horse-bedding can be found inside the horse's stall.","This bedding looks like it's been here forever, probably from the previous tenant in this stall. It's awfully dirty and should certainly be replaced at once. Collect some freshly-cut hay stacks to replace this bedding.","The horse-bedding has been replaced.","Horse-bedding","The Stable-helper wants you to help the newly-arrived horse to settle into his new stall at the Combe stables.","The hay-piles can be found around the stables and up the road towards Bree-town and Staddle.","Replace the horse's bedding"}},
[6326]={nameES="Horses Gone Astray",objectivesES={}},
[6327]={nameES="Caballos en Alquiler",objectivesES={"Habla con Oddvarr","Cam Manzaneda trabaja en una granja de caballos llamada Hengstacer, en los campos de Bree. Fue abordado por un enano que quería alquilar algunos caballos para una expedición.","El viejo enano fue visto por última vez caminando hacia las antiguas ruinas al sureste.\
\
Cam te pidió que revisaras cómo está un viejo enano que quería explorar las ruinas cerca de Hengstacer.","Caballos en Alquiler"}},
[6328]={nameES="Hospitality in a Strange Land",objectivesES={"It would seem that the leaders of Stangard are at odds","Stanric, the leader of Stangard, can be found in the Mead Hall.\
\
You should seek hospitality in Stangard from Stanric.","Ask Cynred if he will give you rations for your stay in Stangard","Stanric's train of thought was interrupted by another standing nearby","Sithric stands at the head of the Mead Hall in Stangard.\
\
You should speak with Sithric.","Stangard is the chief settlement of Rohan in the Great River area. It is an expansive city with many homes, stables, guard-houses, and watch-towers.","Talk to Stanric, the captain at Stangard","Hospitality in a Strange Land","See what Sithric has to say","Cynred seems unable to say whether food can be shared with you","Cynred, the keeper of the food and keys, is near the lock-houses of Stangard in Eorlsmead.\
\
You should speak with Cynred at Sabert's recommendation that laws of hospitality be honoured.","The Mead Hall is the large structure at the top of Stangard's hill.\
\
You should seek entrance to the Mead Hall by speaking with Gadda, the guard.","Talk to Gadda, Lieutenant of Stangard, to gain entrance to the Mead Hall"}},
[6329]={nameES="Tarea de la Hueste del Oeste: Masa burbujeante",objectivesES={"Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir masa burbujeante.","Alguien ha publicado una tarea para recoger masa burbujeante. Se pueden entregar a cambio de una recompensa.","Se busca: Masa burbujeante de la región de Ithilien del Norte.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Se busca: Masa burbujeante de la región de Ithilien del Norte. Recógelas para ganar una recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista en Ithilien del Norte.","Tarea de la Hueste del Oeste: Masa burbujeante","Entrega la masa burbujeante en una caja de recolección"}},
[6330]={nameES="Tarea de la Hueste del Oeste: Oreja quemada",objectivesES={"Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir orejas quemadas.","Tarea de la Hueste del Oeste: Oreja quemada","Entrega las orejas quemadas en una caja de recolección","Se busca: Orejas quemadas de la región de Ithilien del Norte. Recógelas para ganar una recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista en Ithilien del Norte.","Alguien ha publicado una tarea para recoger orejas quemadas. Se pueden entregar a cambio de una recompensa.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Se busca: Orejas quemadas de la región de Ithilien del Norte."}},
[6331]={nameES="Tarea de la Hueste del Oeste: Piel mohosa",objectivesES={"Alguien ha publicado una tarea para recoger pieles de moho. Se pueden entregar a cambio de una recompensa.","Se busca: Pieles mohosas de la región de Ithilien del Norte. Recógelas para ganar una recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista en Ithilien del Norte.","Tarea de la Hueste del Oeste: Piel mohosa","Se busca: Pieles mohosas de la región de Ithilien del Norte.","Entrega las pieles mohosas en una caja de recolección","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir pieles mohosas.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú."}},
[6332]={nameES="Tarea de la Hueste del Oeste: Caparazones prismáticos",objectivesES={"Tarea de la Hueste del Oeste: Caparazones prismáticos","Se busca: Caparazones prismáticos de la región de Ithilien del Norte. Recógelos para ganar una recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista en Ithilien del Norte.","Alguien ha publicado una tarea para recoger caparazones prismáticos. Se pueden entregar a cambio de una recompensa.","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir caparazones prismáticos.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Se busca: Caparazones prismáticos de la región de Ithilien del Norte.","Entrega los caparazones prismáticos en una caja de recolección"}},
[6333]={nameES="Tarea de la Hueste del Oeste: Suciedad maloliente",objectivesES={"Tarea de la Hueste del Oeste: Suciedad maloliente","Alguien ha publicado una tarea para recoger suciedad maloliente. Se puede entregar a cambio de una recompensa.","Entrega la suciedad maloliente en una caja de recolección","Se busca: Suciedad maloliente de la región de Ithilien del Norte.","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir suciedad maloliente.","Se busca: Suciedad maloliente de la región de Ithilien del Norte. Recógela para ganar una recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista en Ithilien del Norte.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú."}},
[6334]={nameES="Tarea de la Hueste del Oeste: Piel gastada",objectivesES={"Tarea de la Hueste del Oeste: Piel gastada","Alguien ha publicado una tarea para recoger pieles gastadas. Se pueden entregar a cambio de una recompensa.","Entrega la piel gastada en una caja de recolección","Se busca: Piel gastada de la región de Ithilien del Norte.","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir piel gastada.","Se busca: Piel gastada de la región de Ithilien del Norte. Recógelas para ganar una recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista en Ithilien del Norte.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú."}},
[6335]={nameES="Hostages and Heroes",objectivesES={}},
[6336]={nameES="Hounds in the Woods",objectivesES={"Find Skádda","Talk to Ainhard","Hounds in the Woods","Skádda runs home","The forester Ainhard's hounds ran into the woods and became lost when the goblins passed through. He has asked for your help tracking them down.","Grymil takes his time walking home","Find Grymil","Find Hrában","Hrában runs home","The forester Ainhard lives south of Vegbár.\
\
You should talk to Ainhard.","Ainhard's three hounds, Hrában, Skádda, and Grymil, can be found somewhere in the forest near his home.\
\
You should find Hrában, Skádda, and Grymil and send them home."}},
