[6359]={nameES="Households of the Kingstead",objectivesES={"The majestic plains of Rohan are in need of farmers and horse-friends. Burginda has suggested you might take the opportunity to purchase your own home in Rohan.","Burginda can be found at Edoras or the Kingstead neighbourhoods.\
\
You should talk to Burginda.","Habla con Burginda","Households of the Kingstead"}},
[6360]={nameES="Housekeeping",objectivesES={"Darôma has offered to pay you to make the beds and clean the floors in the guest rooms of The Cracked Flagon.","Darôma's helpers are not being very helpful and there are chores to be done.","You have made the beds and scrubbed the floors of the guest rooms of The Cracked Flagon. You should return to Darôma inside the inn to collect your reward.","Housekeeping","Talk to Darôma"}},
