[6535]={nameES="Ill-advised Infusions",objectivesES={"Galathir is giving patients Draught of Everworth, which Aragorn believes may be harmful.","Aragorn has asked you to remove any of Galathir's Draught of Everworth infusions that have been left near patients in the House of Rest and the House of Remedies in the Houses of Healing.","Ill-advised Infusions","Aragorn can be found in the High Hall of the Houses of Healing, on the Sixth Circle of Minas Tirith.\
\
You should bring the harmful Draughts of Everworth to Aragorn, as he asked.","Bring Aragorn the Draughts of Everworth"}},
[6536]={nameES="Ill-fated Deception",objectivesES={"Gondren can be found in central Tarlang's Crown.\
\
Harnion has asked you to rescue Gondren from the forces in Tarlang's Crown.","Ill-fated Deception","Harnion fears for the life of his friend, Gondren, who disguised himself in an attempt to discover more of the Heirs of Castamir and their vile plans.","Talk to Gondren in Tarlang's Crown","DNT"}},
[6537]={nameES="Ill-gotten Goods",objectivesES={"Innoth is at his camp, to the west and south of the Dunlending supply-line.\
\
You should return to Innoth with the supplies that you recovered from the Dunlendings.","Ill-gotten Goods","The supplies that were being ferried beneath the Isendale to Cuvnerth are now being brought to several outposts, including Brôntrig. Stop any Dunlendings from ferrying supplies.","Talk to Innoth near the Isen","The Dunlending transporting the supplies can be found along the hill east of Innoth's camp, reached by travelling the switchback to the north.\
\
Innoth has asked you to stop the Dunlendings from delivering their Orc-provided supplies to their various outposts."}},
[6538]={nameES="Ill-meaning Glances",objectivesES={"Much to Grámi Hornhelm's dismay, a newly-arrived company of Zhélruka has taken an uncomfortable interest in the works of Hammerstead.","Ill-meaning Glances","Talk to Grámi Hornhelm","Leering Zhélruka can be found throughout Hammerstead.\
\
Concerned that ill-meaning glances shall soon turn to theft, Grámi Hornhelm has asked you to politely urge the visiting Zhélruka to depart Hammerstead.","Grámi Hornhelm can be found at Hammerstead.\
\
Although not all of them took your words to heart, you have urged many of the visiting Zhélruka to depart Hammerstead. You should now speak to Grámi Hornhelm."}},
[6539]={nameES="Illumination",objectivesES={"You have hung up the banners.\
\
You should talk to Rimâti.","Despite those who would try to destroy it, Umbar's past survives.","Talk to Rimâti at the Shrine to He-Who-Sees-All","Rimâti has invited you to join her at the Shrine to He-Who-Sees-All.\
\
You can find the shrine at the southern end of the Tor-gardens.","Talk to Rimâti","Rimâti has given you dyed banners to hang up at the Shrine to He-Who-Sees-All.","Illumination"}},
