[6541]={nameES="Imlad Morgul: La Reclamación",objectivesES={"Complete quests of Imlad Morgul: The Reclamation.","The White Company must face many challenges in reclaiming Minas Ithil from the grasp of darkness.","Complete quests of Imlad Morgul: The Reclamation, weekly.","Imlad Morgul: La Reclamación"}},
