\
Has recolectado el último conjunto de componentes que Fenton Marshley te pidió.","Lleva el último conjunto de componentes a Fenton Marshley","Fenton Marshley está en el Refugio de Cazadores, al este de Archet y al norte de Bree, en las Tierras de Bree.\
\
Has recolectado el primer conjunto de componentes que Fenton Marshley te pidió.","Los Hombres de Angmar pueden encontrarse en Fasach-falroid y cerca de Malenhad, en Angmar. Zarpahelada puede hallarse en las Montañas Nubladas, donde habitan los gigantes.\
\
Fenton Marshley te pidió que le trajeras una de las garras afiladas de Zarpahelada y los bastones corroídos de la Corona de Hierro, llevados por los malvados Hombres de Angmar.","Has recolectado la garra afilada de Zarpahelada","Lleva el segundo conjunto de componentes a Fenton Marshley","Instrumentos de la Caza","Lleva el primer conjunto de componentes a Fenton Marshley","Recolecta la garra afilada de Zarpahelada","Fenton Marshley ha aceptado ayudarte a forjar un arma digna de tu gran habilidad como cazador. La historia de esta arma será una de peligro y maldad, pero de estas dificultades surgirá la fuerza.","Las sierpes pueden encontrarse en Forochel y Angmar. Las tortugas temibles habitan en Malenhad, en Angmar. Los muertos vivientes rondan Imlad Balchorth, en Angmar.\
\
Fenton te pidió que le trajeras ojos de sierpe nublados, picos venenosos de tortuga temible y uñas pútridas.","Recolecta Medallón de Paso","Los uruks custodian la ciudad de Carn Dûm, en Angmar, mientras que el vil Helchgam habita en sus profundidades.\
\
Fenton te pidió que le trajeras un Medallón de Paso y la baba pútrida de Helchgam.","Recolecta baba pútrida de Helchgam"}},
[6559]={nameES="Utensilios de la noche",objectivesES={"El cuidador de huargos Athpukh se puede encontrar en Urugarth en Angmar. La reina morroval Azgoth se puede encontrar en Carn Dûm en Angmar.\
\
Sterling Ganapié te pidió que le trajeras un símbolo de cuidador de huargos y una garra cruel de Azgoth.","Recoge la garra partida de Narglup","Las sanguijuelas de azufre se pueden encontrar por las regiones orientales de Malenhad en Angmar. Narglup se puede encontrar cerca de Tór Gailvin en las regiones occidentales de Angmar.\
\
Sterling Ganapié te pidió que regresaras con colmillos de sanguijuela de azufre huecos y la garra partida del Huargo Narglup.","Lleva el último grupo de componentes a Sterling Ganapié","Has recogido el símbolo del cuidador de huargos","Has recogido una garra cruel de Azgoth","Lleva el segundo grupo de componentes a Sterling Ganapié","Has recogido la garra partida de Narglup","Lleva el primer grupo de componentes a Sterling Ganapié","Utensilios de la noche","Sterling Ganapié está en Los Gamos, al oeste de Bree y al este del río Brandivino.\
\
Sterling Ganapié está esperando a que regreses con el último grupo de componentes.","Recoge la garra cruel de Azgoth","Sterling Ganapié está en Los Gamos, al oeste de Bree y al este del río Brandivino.\
\
Sterling Ganapié está esperando a que regreses con el primer grupo de componentes.","Sterling Ganapié ha accedido a ayudarte a fabricar un arma que complemente tu gran habilidad como saqueador.","Las sierpes con los ojos que nos interesan habitan en lugares como Forochel, las Montañas Nubladas y Eregion. Las tortugas temibles habitan en Malenhad, en las regiones orientales de Angmar.\
\
Sterling Ganapié te pidió que le trajeras ojos de sierpes odiosas y picos venenosos de tortuga temible.","Sterling Ganapié está en Los Gamos, al oeste de Bree y al este del río Brandivino.\
\
Sterling Ganapié está esperando a que regreses con el segundo grupo de componentes.","Recoge el símbolo del cuidador de huargos"}},
[6560]={nameES="Conocimiento impuro",objectivesES={"Dirígete bajo el puente del Cruce de las Cenizas","Has defendido a Regin","Has llegado bajo el puente del Cruce de las Cenizas","Habla con Regin bajo el puente sur a la salida del Cruce de las Cenizas","Conocimiento impuro","Gúthi está en el Cruce de las Cenizas, en la parte occidental de las Profundidades Llameantes.\
\
Deberías regresar con Gúthi.","Nuevas informaciones han salido a la luz: los orcos buscan una forja en particular, la antigua forja de Hurmulkezer. La han estado usando para forjar armaduras llameantes y también planean crear una nueva arma mortal...","Habla con Gúthi en el Cruce de las Cenizas","Regin se encuentra en la esquina suroeste de las Profundidades Llameantes, en la zona inferior al sur del Cruce de las Cenizas.\
\
Deberías ir a hablar con Regin bajando por las escaleras desde el Cruce de las Cenizas.","Regin se encuentra en la esquina suroeste de las Profundidades Llameantes, en la zona inferior al sur del Cruce de las Cenizas.\
\
Deberías encontrarlo y hablar con él."}},
[6561]={nameES="Aguas impuras",objectivesES={"Has encontrado el estanque en la segunda terraza","Encuentra el estanque de la tercera terraza","Aguas impuras","La entrada a Glinghant se encuentra en la plaza de Clorhir, en Annúminas. Glinghant se compone de varias terrazas, y en cada terraza hay un estanque.\
\
Debes verter agua del vial de agua limpia que te han proporcionado en cada uno de los estanques de las terrazas de Glinghant.","Has encontrado el estanque en la tercera terraza","Encuentra el estanque de la segunda terraza"}},
[6562]={nameES="Celebrando el Solsticio de Verano",objectivesES={"Faeleth se encuentra en Minas Tirith (Solsticio de Verano).\
\
Faeleth te da las gracias por participar en la celebración del Solsticio de Verano.","Habla con Faeleth en Minas Tirith (Solsticio de Verano)","Habla con el capitán Khâtaphos en Isla Remota, en las Islas Escudo","Las celebraciones del solsticio de verano tienen lugar en Minas Tirith (Solsticio de Verano), así como en la Mansión de Thorin, Duillond, Bree, el Árbol de la Fiesta en la Comarca e Isla Remota en las Islas Escudo.\
\
A medida que se acerca el día del solsticio de verano, los pueblos de la Tierra Media se reúnen para celebrar el gran Festival del Solsticio. ¡Disfruta del baile, la alegría y el amor con tu familia y amigos!","Celebrando el Solsticio de Verano","A medida que se acerca el día del solsticio de verano, los pueblos de la Tierra Media se reúnen para celebrar el gran Festival del Solsticio. ¡Disfruta del baile, la alegría y el amor con tu familia y amigos!"}},
[6563]={nameES="In Days of Youth",objectivesES={"The Middle Stores are in south part of the Third Circle.\
\
They have some Old Calembel deep at the back of the Middle Stores. You should gather some for Forlong's table.","Find a hat","The Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle.\
\
Listen to Forlong continue his tale.","In Days of Youth","Listen to Hirluin","Forlong claims the mark can be found in the Third Circle, just north of the Pier.\
\
Look for a mark on the column where the old Master of the Burg swung at Forlong's head. Forlong claims it can still be seen but Hirluin disbelieves him.","Look for the mark on the column","Bring the cheese to Neldir","The Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle.\
\
Forlong, Hirluin, and Neldir have tasted the Old Calembel. See how they liked it.","Listen to Neldir","Go up to the Fourth Circle and see if anyone knows what became of the minstrel Authlin.","The Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle.\
\
Hear what Hirluin has to say.","The three friends raise their glasses and drink","Ask for Old Calembel in the Middle Stores","The Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle.\
\
Return to the Merry Swan and tell Forlong the bottle has been placed at Authlin's favourite stone.","Search for these things in the Third Circle of Minas Tirith.\
\
Look for a hat, some bread, some flowers, and a small rug to help prove Neldir's point.","Found some flowers","The Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle.\
\
Hear to what Neldir has to say.","Find some flowers","Return with the wine","Return to Neldir","Place the bottle at Authlin's stone","Find a small rug","Raise a glass","The Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle.\
\
Bring the cheese back to the Merry Swan.","The Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle.\
\
Lord Forlong has recalled an old wine they used to drink, named Beren's Blood, and has asked you to bring him some.","The Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle.\
\
Find some of the Old Calembel cheese that Forlong and his friends used to eat with their favourite wine. Start by asking Imadan, the barkeep of the Merry Swan.","The Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle.\
\
Try to carry the pile of things across the room.","Return to Forlong","The Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle.\
\
You have learned what became of Authlin, Master Minstrel. Now you should return to Forlong and company in the Merry Swan.","Return to Hirluin","Talk to Neldir","The Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle.\
\
Imadan has some of the Beren's Blood wine Forlong wants. You should gather some yourself from the storage area.","Talk to Hirluin","Forlong and his friends are in the Merry Swan, in the Third Circle of Minas Tirith.\
\
Drink with Forlong and company.","Found some bread","Ask Imadan for Old Calembel","The Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle.\
\
Return to the Merry Swan and tell Hirluin the mark can, in fact, be seen.","The Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle.\
\
Bring the wine back over to Forlong's table.","The things tumble from your hands!","The Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle.\
\
Listen to Forlong's reply.","The three solemnly partake of bread and cheese","Hirluin catches your arm as you come up.\
\
'Give that wine here, friend. Should you place it before Forlong, we others might never have a taste.'\
\
This is met with hearty laughter, not least by Forlong himself.\
\
'Here friends - a glass for you Neldir, a glass for me, yes, and one for you, Forlong, old friend. To our days of youth!'","You place the bottle reverently at the stone's base","Found a hat","Carry the pile of things","The Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle.\
\
Hear what Forlong has to say.","Found a small rug","The Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle.\
\
Bring the things you have gathered back to Neldir, in the Merry Swan.","Here was Authlin's favourite place to sing","Find some bread","Listen to Forlong","Authlin's favourite spot was across from the Artists' Fellow-hall in the Fourth Circle.\
\
Place the empty bottle of Beren's Blood at Authlin's favourite spot, to commemorate the old minstrel.","Ask Imadan for Beren's Blood wine","Return to Authlin's favourite spot","Lord Forlong sits in the Merry Swan Tavern, drinking with his old friends Lord Hirluin and one Neldir of Minas Tirith, making the most of the calm before the storm.","You can clearly make out the mark Forlong spoke of","The Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle.\
\
Hear what Neldir has to say.","The Middle Stores are in south part of the Third Circle.\
\
Imadan has no Old Calembel cheese, but thinks the back reaches of the Middle Stores might have some.","The Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle.\
\
Listen to Neldir's interjection.","Neldir combines the items into a rough pile","Talk to Forlong"}},
[6564]={nameES="In Death's Shadow",objectivesES={"Collect athelas in Gurz-shâpol","You have discovered patches of athelas growing in Gurz-shâpol and should recover it for the good of the Rohirrim.","You have gathered much athelas from Gurz-shâpol, and stowed it away for the coming journey to Dunharrow. The warriors of Rohan will benefit greatly from your bravery as the darkest days of war draw ever nearer.","Athelas can be found throughout Gurz-shâpol.\
\
You have discovered athelas growing in the dark of Gurz-shâpol that has gone unnoticed by the Orcs. You should gather it for the warriors of Rohan.","You have gathered much athelas for the warriors of Rohan, and should now store it for the coming journey to Dunharrow.","You have not gathered enough athelas for the Rohirrim and should continue to search for more.","Completado","Amid the dim glow of Gurz-shâpol, you have discovered blooms of athelas bursting from the earth near the Orcs' filth and destruction. The healing plant has gone unnoticed by the untrained eyes of the Orcs, but through your dealings with the Rangers, you are well-acquainted with its appearance. You should gather as much as possible before returning to the Rohirrim for they will have great use of it in the coming days of the war.","Blooming in the darkness of Gurz-shâpol, patches of athelas grow unnoticed by the Orcs of the White Mountains.","In Death's Shadow"}},
[6565]={nameES="In Defence of Eaworth",objectivesES={"Ingbert is in the Mead Hall of Eaworth.\
\
You should speak with Ingbert regarding the battle at Maustazg.","Talk to Ingbert","Ingbert stands near Góda in the Mead Hall of Eaworth.\
\
Góda, disgusted with you, suggested that if you wish to redeem yourself for your errors in judgement, you should speak with Ingbert.","Ingbert is in the Mead Hall of Eaworth.\
\
Speak with Ingbert when you are ready to ride to Maustazg.","You have won victory at Maustazg","Talk to Ingbert in the Mead Hall of Eaworth","The preparations for the defence of Eaworth have been completed, but all is not well....\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This instance can only be completed Solo.</rgb>","Talk to Ingbert to ride to Ingmar's aid","In Defence of Eaworth"}},
[6566]={nameES="In Defence of Eaworth",objectivesES={"You have attained glory against the Orcs","Talk to Ingbert in the Mead Hall of Eaworth","Talk to Ingbert to accompany Ingmar to Maustazg","Preparations for the assault on Maustazg are now complete, which Ingmar has decided to lead himself, against his father's wishes.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This instance can only be completed Solo.</rgb>","Reeve Ingbert is in the Mead Hall of Eaworth.\
\
You should speak with Ingbert if you are ready to join Ingmar for the assault on Maustazg.","Ingbert is in the Mead Hall of Eaworth.\
\
You should speak with Ingbert regarding the assault on Maustazg.","In Defence of Eaworth"}},
[6567]={nameES="En Defensa del Bosque",objectivesES={"En Defensa del Bosque","Las moscas guadaña pueden encontrarse en los bosques al oeste y suroeste de Celondim.\
\
Laenin, el Guardián del Claro, te informó que está reclutando a quienes deseen ayudar a salvar la naturaleza circundante de una infestación de moscas guadaña.","Ovorlas está en el campamento élfico en Nen Hilith, al suroeste de Celondim.\
\
Has derrotado muchas moscas guadaña, como pidió Laenin, y ahora deberías buscar a Ovorlas.","Laenin, el Guardián del Claro, planea dejar la Tierra Media, pero desea ver preservada la santidad y la belleza de los bosques que rodean Celondim. Acontecimientos recientes han llevado a un gran número de insectos viles a internarse en el bosque, y Laenin teme que los árboles puedan enfermar como resultado.","Habla con Ovorlas en Nen Hilith"}},
[6568]={nameES="In Ethring's Defence",objectivesES={"Defend the north-west entrance leading to Calembel","Candúr can be found patrolling the village of Ethring.\
\
You should speak with Candúr.","Defend the west entrance leading to Eilendoth","Ethring west entrance","Defend the south entrance leading to Dor-en-Ernil","You have defended the north-east entrance of Ethring","Ethring north-east entrance","Arvaethor has asked you to accompany him back to Ethring and help strengthen their defences.","Speak with Candúr","Ethring north-west entrance","You have defended the north-west entrance of Ethring","Ethring south entrance","In Ethring's Defence","Speak with Arvaethor","Defend the four entrances of Ethring.","Speak with Arvaethor.","Defend the north-east entrance near the lumber mill","You have defended the south entrance of Ethring","Speak with Laerind","The entrances of Ethring need defending!","Laerind can be found in the village of Ethring.\
\
You should speak with Laerind.","You have defended the west entrance of Ethring","You hear a call to arms from Candúr"}},
[6569]={nameES="En el corazón del peligro (opcional)",objectivesES={"Garnyd se encuentra en Anazârmekhem, al norte de Fil-gashan.\
\
Deberías regresar con Garnyd para informarle de tu victoria.","Orcos derrotados en Fil-gashan","Fil-gashan se halla en los confines suroccidentales de las Profundidades Llameantes.\
\
Garnyd te ha indicado que uses el cuerno de guerra de Nanlug para desafiar a los orcos en Fil-gashan.","En el corazón del peligro (opcional)","Desafía a los orcos dentro de Fil-gashan, cerca de su estandarte de batalla","El sonido del cuerno de guerra de Nanulg sería una afrenta tal para los orcos de Fil-gashan que no se atreverían a ignorar su llamada.","Habla con Garnyd en Anazârmekhem"}},
[6570]={nameES="En su memoria",objectivesES={"Kúli quiere que la muerte de Nykr sea anunciada y celebrada a la verdadera manera de los enanos.","En su memoria","Deberías visitar, sin un orden particular: el Refugio Sombrío, Jazârgund, el Descenso Profundo, Anazârmekhem, el Mirador de la Gran Excavación, la Cámara de la Encrucijada, la Guardia Orca, la Sala Vigesimoprimera, el Umbral de Durin y la Bodega Putrefacta.\
\
Kúlli quiere que hablas con los amigos de Nykr el Portador del Medallón en cada uno de los puestos avanzados enanos de Moria, para llevarles la noticia de su muerte y brindar en su memoria con cada uno de ellos.","Habla con Kúli en el Agujero Chirriante","Kúli se encuentral al norte del Agujero Chirriante, en las Vetas del Cuerno Rojo.\
\
Tras localizar a todos los amigos de Nykr el Portador de Medallón por todo Moria, deberías volver a ver a Kúli, su pariente."}},
[6571]={nameES="En su memoria",objectivesES={"Brinda en memoria de Kafli en Anazârmekhem","Encuentra la jarra que hay en la Cámara de la Encrucijada y bebe de ella.\
\
Kúli quiere que hables con los amigos de Kafli en cada uno de los puestos avanzados que hay por todo Moria, para informarles de su muerte y brindar con ellos en su memoria.","Habla con Kúli, que acampa cerca de la colmena de gredbyg","Encuentra la jarra que hay en el Refugio Sombrío y bebe de ella.\
\
Kúli quiere que hables con los amigos de Kafli en cada uno de los puestos avanzados que hay por todo Moria, para informarles de su muerte y brindar con ellos en su memoria.","Kúli se encuentra al norte de la colmena de gredbyg, en las Vetas del Cuerno Rojo.\
\
Tras haber empinado el codo con los amigos de Kafli por todo Moria, deberías volver con Kúli, su pariente.","Brinda en memoria de Kafli en la Sala Vigesimoprimera","Brinda en memoria de Kafli en el Mirador de la Gran Excavación","Brinda en memoria de Kafli en el Refugio Sombrío","En su memoria","Brinda en memoria de Kafli en la Bodega Putrefacta","Encuentra la jarra que hay en el Mirador de la Gran Excavación y bebe de ella.\
\
Kúli quiere que hables con los amigos de Kafli en cada uno de los puestos avanzados que hay por todo Moria, para informarles de su muerte y brindar con ellos en su memoria.","Encuentra la jarra que hay en la Bodega Putrefacta y bebe de ella.\
\
Kúli quiere que hables con los amigos de Kafli en cada uno de los puestos avanzados que hay por todo Moria, para informarles de su muerte y brindar con ellos en su memoria.","Encuentra la jarra que hay en el Descenso Profundo y bebe de ella.\
\
Kúli quiere que hables con los amigos de Kafli en cada uno de los puestos avanzados que hay por todo Moria, para informarles de su muerte y brindar con ellos en su memoria.","Encuentra la jarra que hay en la Sala Vigesimoprimera y bebe de ella.\
\
Kúli quiere que hables con los amigos de Kafli en cada uno de los puestos avanzados que hay por todo Moria, para informarles de su muerte y brindar con ellos en su memoria.","Kúli quiere que la muerte de Kafli se dé a conocer y se celebre a la auténtica manera enana.","Encuentra la jarra que hay en Anazârmekhem y bebe de ella.\
\
Kúli quiere que hables con los amigos de Kafli en cada uno de los puestos avanzados que hay por todo Moria, para informarles de su muerte y brindar con ellos en su memoria.","Brinda en memoria de Kafli en el campamento de Kúli","Brinda en memoria de Kafli en el Descenso Profundo","Brinda en memoria de Kafli en la Cámara de la Encrucijada","Encuentra la jarra que hay en el campamento de Kúli y bebe de ella.\
\
Kúli quiere que hables con los amigos de Kafli en cada uno de los puestos avanzados que hay por todo Moria, para informarles de su muerte y brindar con ellos en su memoria."}},
[6572]={nameES="En honor del amor pospuesto",objectivesES={"Tuilinn te ha invitado a meditar solemnemente en Cerin Amroth.","Te encuentras en el lugar donde Elessar y Undómiel se juraron fidelidad","En honor del amor pospuesto","El lugar del que habló Tuilinn se encuentra en el lado sur de Cerin Amroth.\
\
Tuilinn quiere que vayas al punto de la colina de Cerin Amroth donde Aragorn y Arwen se juraron fidelidad y <rgb=#FF0000>medites</rgb> en honor de su amor, tal como ella hace.","<rgb=#FF0000>Medita</rgb> en Cerin Amroth","Habla con Tuilinn en Cerin Amroth","Tuilinn se encuentra en lo alto del flet en Cerin Amroth.\
\
Deberías decirle a Tuilinn que has hecho lo que te indicó."}},
[6573]={nameES="Con Esperanza de Paz",objectivesES={"Habla con Eluna","Eluna desea que actúes como su escolta para una reunión crucial.","Has regresado a Lhan Garan con Eluna y los demás.\
\
Habla con Eluna","Con Esperanza de Paz"}},
[6574]={nameES="En Memoria de los Perdidos",objectivesES={"En Memoria de los Perdidos","Lleva la flecha de la venganza a Núrelleth","Cúbenn ha fabricado una flecha en memoria del esposo de Núrelleth, Faengris, asesinado por los Orcos.","Núrelleth se encuentra en Telain Glorelloth, donde los flets se extienden sobre la cerca que rodea Caras Galadhon.\
\
Cúbenn te ha dado la flecha que fabricó en memoria del esposo asesinado de Núrelleth, Faengris."}},
[6575]={nameES="In Need of Discipline",objectivesES={"Lord Duinhir of the Blackroot Vale went to the Mûmak and Keep Tavern in the Second Circle of Minas Tirith to reprimand his sons.","Retrieve arrows from the makeshift Mûmak","Talk to Duinhir atop the wall in the Second Circle","Duinhir stares at the makeshift Mûmak, seeming to see it for the first time","In Need of Discipline","Derufin is inside the Mûmak and Keep Tavern in the Second Circle of the city.","Talk to Lord Duinhir once again, in the Mûmak and Keep Tavern","Duilin and Derufin have been firing arrows at the makeshift Mûmak in the Mûmak and Keep Tavern, in the Second Circle of the city.\
\
Duilin has asked you to recover the arrows he has already fired at the Mûmak, and give them to Derufin for his turn.","You have arrived to find Lord Duinhir mid-shout.\
\
'...and as my sons, you are responsible for upholding my good name! If you do not do as I command, folk will look at your example and say, \\qDuinhir cannot even control his own sons! What sort of a man is that?\\q And furthermore... furthermore!'\
\
Duinhir splutters into silence.","Duilin is in the Mûmak and Keep Tavern in the Second Circle of Minas Tirith.","Talk to Duilin in the Mûmak and Keep Tavern","Bring the Blackroot equipment to Lord Duinhir in the Mûmak and Keep Tavern","Duilin and Derufin left Minas Tirith without their father's permission, and now that they have returned they want to make amends.","Duinhir is somewhere within the city of Minas Tirith.\
\
Derufin asked you to find his father Duinhir and put in a good word for he and his brother's forbidden adventure in Ithilien.","Bring the Blackroot arrows to Derufin inside the Mûmak and Keep Tavern","Lord Duinhir asked you to help his men gather up the equipment he had been inspecting."}},
[6576]={nameES="In Need of Pelts",objectivesES={"Gather jackal pelts for Munsubur from the nearby jackal dens of Urgudag or Khazâda.","Return to Munsubur with the pelts","Bring the jackal pelts back to Munsubur in Ub Nishir near Maurûsh.","Munsubur has asked you to help him to gather pelts from jackals in Urash Dâr.","In Need of Pelts"}},
[6577]={nameES="En necesidad de rescate",objectivesES={"En necesidad de rescate","Liberen a los prisioneros detenidos en Eshadûr y sáquenlos de Dokhára, el torturador ordâkhai.","Has rescatado a los prisioneros detenidos en Eshadûr. Ahora debes enfrentarte a Dokhára, el torturador ordâkhai.","Derrota a Dokhára en el camino hacia la Entrada","Dokhára, el torturador ordâkhai, retiene a varias personas de Ambarûl prisioneras en Eshadûr."}},
[6578]={nameES="In Need of Tending",objectivesES={"Quickbeam can be found in Derndingle in south-eastern Fangorn Forest.\
\
You have delivered the lost Huorns to safety at Quickbeam's side in Derndingle. You should speak to Quickbeam.","Young Huorns have become lost in Fangorn Forest and must be tended by Quickbeam if they are to survive.","Bring the lost Huorns to Derndingle","Derndingle can be found in south-eastern Fangorn Forest.\
\
You have gathered as many young Huorns as you could find, and should now return to Derndingle.","Talk to Quickbeam","In Need of Tending","Lost Huorns can be found throughout southern Fangorn Forest.\
\
Quickbeam's Huorn wants you to help search for young Huorns in Fangorn Forest.","You have encountered a young Huorn, and your companion swiftly shuffles to its side, as if to defend it. You cannot quite tell, but Quickbeam's Huorn appears upset that it has been left to fend for itself in this empty, dangerous forest.\
\
You should continue your search for other lost Huorns and then bring them to safety in Derndingle.","DNT -- Players will not see"}},
[6579]={nameES="In Núrzum's Wake",objectivesES={"A crevasse can be found on the south-western side of the Orc-roadway through the Balewood.\
\
Strongroot wants you to search for more evidence of Núrzum's assault in the Balewood, so the Ents may better understand the foe they face.","Núrzum's destruction can be found off the sides of the Orc-roadway through northern Balewood.\
\
Strongroot wants you to search for more evidence of Núrzum's assault in the Balewood so that the Ents may better understand the foe they face.","Examine the nearby crevasse in the Balewood","The Orc-roadway can be found to the south and west of Strongroot in northern Balewood.\
\
Strongroot has sent you to explore further down the Orc-roadway in hopes of finding evidence of Núrzum's destruction, so that he and the Ents might better understand their foe.","You have encountered a shard of ice upon which Núrzum has impaled several wood-trolls","Talk to Strongroot","Strongroot wants you to explore around the Orc-roadway and discover evidence of Núrzum's corruption of the Balewood.","Search for a boulder thrown by Núrzum","You have discovered a jagged crack in the Balewood's earth, surely caused by Núrzum's stomping","Search for more signs of Núrzum's destruction in the Balewood","You have found an icy boulder that has impacted the ground deeply... such strength goes beyond even that of a giant","Strongroot can be found in northern Balewood.\
\
You have discovered much of Núrzum's destruction and should now return to Strongroot to discuss what you have found.","In Núrzum's Wake"}},
[6580]={nameES="En problemas",objectivesES={"Flík está en el campamento de los trasgos donde lo encontraste.\
\
Deberías llevar a Flík a un lugar seguro.","En problemas","Has encontrado a un enano de las Vetas del Cuerno de Plata retenido como prisionero en un campamento de trasgos.","Styrr se encuentra en el campamento de Descenso Profundo.\
\
Deberías volver inmediatamente con Styrr e informarle de que han encontrado y rescatado a Flík.","Informa a Styrr de que Flík ha sido rescatado","Dile a Flík que ya estáis listos para salir","Flík está a salvo"}},
[6581]={nameES="En persecución",objectivesES={"Esta hacha es de fabricación enana y parece haber sido abandonada recientemente. Quizá uno de los expedicionarios enanos haya tenido problemas en el camino.\
\
Deberías buscar por los alrededores al dueño de esta hacha.","Túbi Puñogrueso se encuentra en lo alto de las escaleras del Umbral de Durin.\
\
Kambi te habló de los desvaríos del jefe trasgo acerca de su tribu y la voz que teme. Te pidió que informaras a Túbi Puñogrueso lo antes posible.","En persecución","Habla con Túbi Puñogrueso","El dueño del hacha probablemente se encuentre en algún punto de los túneles cercanos al Umbral de Durin, hacia el oeste de la Gran Excavación.\
\
Deberías buscar al propietario del hacha.","Encuentra al dueño del hacha abandonada","Has encontrado un hacha enana abandonada en el camino y ahora estás buscando al enano que la empuñaba."}},
[6582]={nameES="In Pursuit of Orcs",objectivesES={"Return to Uda at her camp and let her know you have reduced the number of Orcs in the area.","Return to Uda at her camp near Utug-bûr","Uda has asked you to slay Orcs in Urash Dâr to help her thin their numbers.","In Pursuit of Orcs","Uda is unhappy with the number of Orcs in the area and has asked that you help her to reduce it."}},
[6583]={nameES="In Search of Quellwort",objectivesES={"In Search of Quellwort","The three plants can be found in central Clovengap.\
\
Golodhrim has asked you to collect samples of three plants.","Clovengap plants with special properties are written of in ancient tales.","Return to Golodhril","Golodhril is located in Bazanmanar.\
\
You should bring the flowers you collected to Golodhril."}},
[6584]={nameES="In Search of Truth",objectivesES={"Thandor, the Gondorian Captain, can be located in the market east of Tol Ciryarani.\
\
You should speak with Thandor.","The eastern river-gate can be found on the east side of the city.\
\
You should investigate the river-gate.","Spoke with Thandor","In Search of Truth","Take the note","Took the note","DNT - Not Used","A stray note on the ground catches your attention","Speak with Thandor","Investigate the area near the river-gate","The stray note can be found near the eastern river-gate of Pelargir.\
\
You should bring the note to Thandor.","Suspicious of recent events, Thandor has asked you to inspect the eastern river-gate for any clues about what caused Pelargir to fall.","Talk to Thandor","Thandor carefully reads the note.\
\
'These orders bear the seal of Sirgon? This cannot be. It would mean that the lordship itself is responsible for the fall of the city! I know Faltharan too well to think that he would have a hand in this, but I'm almost too afraid to ask.\
\
'Those men who tried to attack you are part of a larger group. They've made the east-garth their own personal haven. Why they would want these orders has me concerned.'"}},
[6585]={nameES="In Search of a Cure",objectivesES={}},
[6586]={nameES="In Search of the Culprit",objectivesES={"In Search of the Culprit","Look for the person responsible","Agalûnu was stuck by an arrow, shot by an unseen foe in Arwáth.","Agalûnu has asked you to help her by finding who is responsible for wounding her. You should explore Arwáth in northern Ambarûl and seek out the culprit.","Talk to the strange Elf","You spot a strange Elf","While searching Arwáth for who might have struck Agalûnu with an arrow, you spotted a strange Elf.  You should talk to him."}},
[6587]={nameES="In Search of the Lost Lord",objectivesES={"Search Sirthanc for the source of the moans","Haradrim have overrun the road leading up to the beacon!","Faltharan can be found at Sirthanc in north-western Upper Lebennin.\
\
You have spoken to Lord Sirgon and should now speak to Faltharan.","Faltharan can be found just inside the western entrance to Glaniath in Upper Lebennin.\
\
Arvellon has heard of Faltharan's arrival in Glaniath. You should now reunite with him and aid in his search.","Talk to Lord Sirgon","Haradrim guards can be found along the pathway leading to the beacon Sirthanc in north-western Upper Lebennin.\
\
You have discovered Haradrim near the base of the beacon-hill, and should defeat them.","Follow the road north towards the beacon Sirthanc","Sirthanc can be found to the north-west of Glaniath in Upper Lebennin.\
\
Faltharan has asked you to accompany him to the beacon Sirthanc where he believes his father may have been taken.","Talk to Faltharan","As the Haradrim slaver falls defeated, you can hear the laboured breaths of a man nearby...","Sirthanc can be found in north-western Upper Lebennin.\
\
You have defeated the leader of the Haradrim and should now search the beacon for Lord Sirgon.","Too weakened to support himself, Lord Sirgon falls to the ground","Faltharan can be found at your side or can be called with your horn while you are in Upper Lebennin.\
\
You have freed Lord Sirgon from his bonds and should speak to Faltharan about what is to be done next.","Free Lord Sirgon from his bonds","After reuniting with Faltharan, the time has come to seek Lord Sirgon in Upper Lebennin.","Call forth and defeat the leader of the Haradrim","Talk to Faltharan at Sirthanc","You have discovered Lord Sirgon of Pelargir, bound and barely standing","The binding pole can be found on Sirthanc in north-western Upper Lebennin.\
\
You have discovered Lord Sirgon bound to a pole on Sirthanc, and should now free him.","In Search of the Lost Lord","Lord Sirgon can be found at Sirthanc in north-western Upper Lebennin.\
\
Faltharan has asked you to speak to his father while he examines the Lord's injuries.","A watch-horn can be found somewhere near the beacon Sirthanc.\
\
You have defeated many of the Haradrim and should now confront their leader.","Talk to Faltharan in Glaniath"}},
[6588]={nameES="In Search of the Spider-queen",objectivesES={"Travel into Lhingris and join Legolas in his search for Ungwetári","In Search of the Spider-queen","Legolas has ventured into Lhingris after becoming suspicious that an old foe of his father, Thranduil, still dwells in the Ephel Dúath.","Legolas can be found somewhere near the road leading to Durthang in Lhingris.\
\
Legolas has asked you to join him in his search for an old foe known to his father as the spider-queen, Ungwetári.","You have found Legolas amid a ruined encampment...","Talk to Legolas in the ruined encampment","Legolas is standing in the remains of small encampment beside the road to Durthang in Lhingris.\
\
You have found Legolas in a ruined Orkish encampment and should now speak to him."}},
[6589]={nameES="In Service of the Heirs",objectivesES={"Fell spirit tormentors can be found inhabiting fell-trolls in Tarlang's Crown.\
\
You have discovered foul fell spirits inhabiting trolls in Tarlang's Crown and should defeat them before they can be used against Gondor.","A fell spirit leaps from the troll's remains","Fell trolls can be found throughout Tarlang's Crown, especially along the main pathway.\
\
Gondren has asked you to defeat fell trolls and quell the fell spirits he believes is inhabiting their bodies.","Talk to Gondren","Inhabited by foul fell spirits, hulking fell trolls now lurk Tarlang's Crown and are among Azruthor's most powerful allies.","DNT -- will not be seen","In Service of the Heirs","Defeat a fell troll in Tarlang's Crown","Gondren can be found near the main encampment in Tarlang's Crown.\
\
You have quelled several fell spirits and trolls, severely weakening Azruthor's forces in Tarlang's Crown."}},
[6590]={nameES="In Service to Reeve Athelward",objectivesES={"Talk to Reeve Athelward at the Mead Hall of Cliving","Reeve Athelward has heard of your endeavours to help Walnoth investigate the crimes in Cliving.","In Service to Reeve Athelward","Reeve Athelward resides at the Mead Hall at the north-east end of Cliving.\
\
Reeve Athelward has summoned you before him to discuss matters that concern him and his people."}},
[6591]={nameES="In Short Supply",objectivesES={}},
[6592]={nameES="In Sickness and in Plague",objectivesES={"Rats and clouds of swamp gas can be found to the north of Lhan Rhos.\
\
Elder Kedivor has asked you to reduce the number of diseased rats and clouds of swamp-gas.","In Sickness and in Plague","Anurin is at the northern lines of the Avanc-lûth.\
\
You should report to Anurin now that you have disposed of the rats and scattered the swamp-gas.","Talk to Anurin in the Dunbog","Elder Kedivor is worried about the sickness and disease that are spreading from the camp in the north."}},
[6593]={nameES="A la Vista de la Escalera Amarga",objectivesES={"Los enanos Sigrun y Greip fueron enviados al norte del campamento de Glóin en el nacimiento oeste del Bruinen para explorar Helegrod y se supone que han establecido un pequeño campamento en los árboles a la vista de la Escalera Amarga.\
\
Glóin te ha enviado a hablar con los exploradores que ha enviado para vigilar la Escalera Amarga que sube a las puertas de Helegrod, lejos al norte de su campamento en la Fuente occidental del Bruinen.","Completa Viejas Amistades","Completa El Lamento del Cazador de sierpes","Encuentra la entrada a Helegrod","La antigua fortaleza se alza ante ti. Será mejor buscar compañeros antes de aventurarte más adelante.","Helegrod está al noreste de Sigrun y el campamento de Greip.\
\
Es la hora de que veas esta antigua fortaleza con tus propios ojos.","Completa La Magnitud de la Amenaza","Glóin te contó solo una pequeña parte de la historia de Helegrod y te pidió que hablases con los exploradores que envió para vigilar la Escalera Amarga en busca de signos de la amenaza creciente tras los muros de Helegrod.'","Completa Enemigos Antiguos de Matarañas","Los enanos Sigrun y Greip deben consultar y enviar información a varios de sus amigos antes de aventurarse nuevamente en Helegrod.","A la Vista de la Escalera Amarga"}},
[6594]={nameES="In Their Absence, Chapter 1",objectivesES={"In Their Absence, Chapter 1","Fenric Banks is in Oatbarton, the hobbit-town in the southern reaches of Evendim. It is one of the most northerly villages of the Shire.\
\
Barliman Butterbur has asked you to investigate the worries of the hobbit Fenric Banks, in Oatbarton.","Talk to Fenric Banks in Oatbarton","Shadows are lengthening throughout Eriador now that many of the Rangers have left for the south-lands, and trouble is brewing in their absence.","Talk to Bounder Boffin inside Northcotton Farm","The Northcotton Farm is located west of Oatbarton's town centre and up the steep hill.\
\
Fenric Banks has told you of the hobbit disappearances and wants you to gather a couple friends and investigate the Northcotton Farm, where one of the hobbits was last seen."}},
[6595]={nameES="In Their Absence, Chapter 10",objectivesES={"Drugoth the Deathmonger has been commanded to raise an army of wights on Sâri-surma, in Forochel.\
\
Elrond has translated the broken tablet he found within the Lost Temple and now knows the location of another Gaunt-lord.","You are not alone. A Lossoth hunter watches you closely","Talk to Pirita in the fortress on Sâri-surma","Pirita of the Lossoth is inside the fortress on Sâri-surma.\
\
Pirita wishes to speak with you.","Travel to Sâri-surma and make your way through the fortress","In Their Absence, Chapter 10","Elrond's examination of the tablet he found in the Lost Temple has revealed the objective of another of the Gaunt-lords."}},
[6596]={nameES="In Their Absence, Chapter 11",objectivesES={"In Their Absence, Chapter 11","Talk to Yrjänä in Sâri-surma","Yrjänä is somewhere within the fortress on Sâri-surma.\
\
Pirita has asked you to find the Lossoth chieftain, Yrjänä, within the depths of the fortress.","In the depths of the fortress on Sâri-surma, the Lossoth are trying to end the threat of Drugoth the Death-monger."}},
[6597]={nameES="In Their Absence, Chapter 12",objectivesES={"In the depths of the fortress on Sâri-surma, Drugoth the Death-monger threatens the safety of Forochel and the lands beyond.","Defeat Drugoth the Death-monger in the fortress on Sâri-surma","Drugoth the Death-monger waits in the depths of his fortress on Sâri-surma.\
\
Yrjänä has told you that Drugoth acts impulsively, more like an animal than a thinking being.","Defeated Drugoth the Death-monger","Habla con Yrjänä","Yrjänä wants to speak with you now that you have defeated Drugoth in the fortress on Sâri-surma.","In Their Absence, Chapter 12"}},
[6598]={nameES="In Their Absence, Chapter 13",objectivesES={"Find Gortheron's lair in the south-western reaches of the Lich Bluffs, in Enedwaith","Yrjänä picked up a tablet that seems to contain directions to the stronghold of Gortheron the Doom-caller, leader of the Gaunt-lords.","In Their Absence, Chapter 13","The stronghold of Gortheron the Doom-caller is located in Enedwaith, in the south-western reaches of the Lich Bluffs.\
\
Yrjänä found a tablet in the depths of the fortress on Sâri-surma that reveals the location of the leader of the Gaunt-lords."}},
[6599]={nameES="In Their Absence, Chapter 14",objectivesES={"Túgonn is in the entrance of Ost Dunhoth.\
\
You have conquered two wings of Ost Dunhoth and should return now to Túgonn.","Talk to Túgonn","In Their Absence, Chapter 14","Ost Dunhoth has two wings that must be explored before the central area can be unsealed.","Survive the spread of plague and poison in the west wing","The Ranger Túgonn has told you that the door into the central area of Ost Dunhoth is locked and can only be opened by exploring the side wings.","Survive the wages of war and conquer your fear in the east wing"}},
[6600]={nameES="In Their Absence, Chapter 15",objectivesES={}},
[6601]={nameES="In Their Absence, Chapter 2",objectivesES={"Bounder Boffin's assistant Tulip is somewhere further inside the Northcotton Farm, and it could be the missing hobbits are as well.\
\
Bounder Boffin has asked you to search for the missing hobbits inside the Northcotton Farm.","In Their Absence, Chapter 2","Bounder Boffin is concerned about the disappearances happening in and around the Northcotton Farm and wants you to investigate.","Tulip Grubb is somewhere within the Northcotton Farm.\
\
You have rescued the missing hobbits and should now find Bounder Boffin's assistant, Tulip Grubb, who came into the farm to investigate the disappearances.","Talk to Tulip Grubb within the Northcotton Farm"}},
[6602]={nameES="In Their Absence, Chapter 3",objectivesES={"Defeat Thadúr the Ravager on the Northcotton Farm","In Their Absence, Chapter 3","Thadúr el Devastador derrotado","Tulip Grubb told you about an evil-looking creature named Thadúr at the end of the path through the doors behind Tulip. He seems to be the creature responsible for the deadly Darkthorn poison.\
\
You and your allies need to defeat Thadúr before he can bring any more trouble to the Shire.","You have rescued some of the hobbitnapped hobbits from the Northcotton Farm, and now Tulip Grubb believes she knows what caused the disappearances.","Talk to Bounder Boffin on the Northcotton Farm","Bounder Boffin is inside the Northcotton Farm.\
\
You have defeated Thadúr the Ravager, and Bounder Boffin is eager to speak with you about your victory on the Northcotton Farm."}},
[6603]={nameES="In Their Absence, Chapter 4",objectivesES={"In Their Absence, Chapter 4","Stoneheight is located on the North Downs, north-east of Amon Raith. The town of Stoneheight is located atop a sloping rise north of a deserted farm-house.\
\
Ronald Dwale has teased apart the meaning of Thadúr's final words and has told you that Tirith dan Forduath was the ancient name for a place now called Stoneheight, on the North Downs.","Talk to Benedric Jacklin in the town of Stoneheight","Talk to Ronald Dwale about Thadúr's final words","Ronald Dwale lives north-east of Oatbarton, just outside the village of Dwaling.\
\
Bounder Boffin has sent you to speak with Ronald Dwale about Thadúr's final words. If anyone knows what Tirith dan Forduath is, he will.","Before his defeat, Thadúr the Ravager spoke some mysterious words. You must get to the bottom of them before great evil comes to pass."}},
[6604]={nameES="In Their Absence, Chapter 5",objectivesES={"You have come to the town of Stoneheight, but it seems to have been recently attacked.","In Their Absence, Chapter 5","Benedric Jacklin has asked you to search further within Stoneheight for survivors of the attack.\
\
The town of Stoneheight was attacked by a merciless figure who moved with a single-minded purpose, and now you must search for survivors.","You catch a glimpse of movement out of the corner of your eye.","Talk to Seward Pearse before he succumbs to his injuries","Search Stoneheight for survivors of the attack","You have found a survivor of the attack on Stoneheight, but his wounds seem very severe."}},
[6605]={nameES="In Their Absence, Chapter 6",objectivesES={"Seward Pearse's home is further within the town of Stoneheight, and he wants you to see if the helm is still there.\
\
Ivar the Blood-hand stalked through the town of Stoneheight, and Seward Pearse believes he came looking for the helm Seward purchased from a merchant.","Defeated Dale Truitt","The helm is gone. Ivar found what he was seeking","While in the wreckage of the town of Stoneheight, you saw in-fighting between two of the enemies left by Ivar to finish the job.\
\
Dale Truitt slew Búbhosh-grat and now must be defeated if the people of Stoneheight are to rebuild.","Benedric Jacklin wishes to speak with you about what happened to the town of Stoneheight.","In Their Absence, Chapter 6","Search further within Stoneheight for sign of the helm","Defeat Dale Truitt in Stoneheight","Talk to Benedric Jacklin in Stoneheight","The attack on Stoneheight must be avenged, and quickly: allies of the terrible figure that led the attack still remain within its walls."}},
[6606]={nameES="In Their Absence, Chapter 7",objectivesES={"Bring the broken tablet to Elrond in Rivendell","Elrond Half-elven is in his library in Rivendell.\
\
You have been given a mysterious tablet that was found in the town of Stoneheight. The tablet is covered in mysterious runes; perhaps Elrond can read them.","In Their Absence, Chapter 7","The Elf-scout Ithriel is scouting the Lost Temple, located at Ost Chall in the northern reaches of Nan Tornaeth.\
\
Elrond has read the runes on the tablet found in Stoneheight, and a mention of the Lost Temple has drawn his notice.","Benedric Jacklin found a tablet with curious markings on it in the wreckage of Stoneheight.","Find Ithriel at the Lost Temple"}},
[6607]={nameES="In Their Absence, Chapter 8",objectivesES={"The mercenary Scristan is seriously injured just within the entrance to the crypts of the Lost Temple.\
\
You have found an injured mercenary, but he makes no hostile sign.","Cross the temple-grounds and enter the crypts","The crypts of the Lost Temple are beyond the grounds of the temple.\
\
Ithriel has asked you to fight the mercenary band hired by Ferndúr as you make your way across the temple-grounds.","In Their Absence, Chapter 8","Ithriel has told you that the Gaunt-lord Ferndúr the Virulent has come to the Lost Temple for some unknown purpose.","Talk to Scristan","An injured mercenary nods weakly at you, but makes no sign to attack"}},
[6608]={nameES="In Their Absence, Chapter 9",objectivesES={"The mercenary Scristan has been left for dead by his former allies, but he wants you to avenge himself upon his employer, the Gaunt-lord Ferndúr.","Elrond wishes to speak with you about your defeat of Ferndúr the Virulent.\
\
You have defeated the Gaunt-lord Ferndúr in the depths of the Lost Temple, and now Elrond wishes to speak with you.","Ferndúr the Virulent is further within the crypts of the Lost Temple.\
\
The mercenary Scristan believes that the Gaunt-lord intended to throw away the lives of the mercenary band he hired, and Scristan wants him to pay for it.","In Their Absence, Chapter 9","Defeat Ferndúr the Virulent within the Lost Temple","Talk to Elrond in the depths of the Lost Temple","Defeated Ferndúr the Virulent"}},
[6609]={nameES="In Too Deep",objectivesES={"Thane Edric can be found in the Mead Hall of Entwade in eastern Kingstead.\
\
You have aided Thane Edric's men greatly in preparing the town and eliminating the Enemy's nearest forces.","Thane Edric's men can be found inside Entwade, as well as along the road west to Middlemead and among the fields outside southern Entwade.\
\
Thane Edric has asked that you aid his men in identifying and minimizing the threats that lurk outside Entwade, as well as helping the men of the settlement bolster its defences before the White Hand returns to siege the town.","Talk to Thane Edric","Thane Edric and his men struggle to make ready for the coming siege of Entwade amid the numerous threats already surrounding the town.","In Too Deep","DNT -- Players will not see"}},
[6610]={nameES="In a Spot of Trouble",objectivesES={"In a Spot of Trouble","Marigold Winterdown is at the hobbit-village of Hoarhallow, found on the western edge of the Grimwood Forest in Hithlad. The village is found on the shores of the Hoarwell River.\
\
Alf is free, but before he left you, he asked that you inform Marigold Winterdown that he would be returning to work at the bakery in Hoarhallow shortly.","Alf Earthenway is at Grothum.\
\
Alf Earthenway asked you to help him escape from the goblins.","Alf is free","Talk to Alf","Alf Earthenway was out for a leisurely stroll when goblins found him and dragged him to the north. He has spent the time since his capture cooking for the goblins as they think he makes the tastiest food. It was the only thing that he could do to prevent the goblins from eating him."}},
[6611]={nameES="In the Clutches of Despair",objectivesES={"Cyneberg painstakingly buried the townsfolk and decorated their graves","Tell Cyneberg what you saw","You gently tell Cyneberg that you saw the brave, heroic work she did when she came to this town, and the view of her fallen home. She looks at you with tear-filled eyes.\
\
'I did what I could for them, but I was too late. Luckily the Orcs were not many, and they were scattered. But my heart broke when I saw Scylfig down below....'","Cyneberg has moved mountains in Grimnesberg as her grief caught up with her at last.","Scylfig, Cyneberg's own ice-encased home from the Writhendowns, can be seen from this peak...","Cyneberg can be found in the centre of Grimnesberg.\
\
You should speak with Cyneberg.","In the Clutches of Despair","Cyneberg did a great deal of work in Grimnesberg as her grief overwhelmed her.\
\
You should have a look around and see where Cyneberg's mind was while she captured this town."}},
[6612]={nameES="En las grietas sombrías",objectivesES={"En las grietas sombrías","El jefe Tuokki te ha pedido que busques a uno de los Hijos de la Tierra, un explorador que fue enviado al siguiente valle para espiar a un grupo de mujeres-murciélago que habían hecho su guardia en algún lugar de las grietas ocultas de Ram Dúath. El Jefe te ha informado de que un explorador tenía un campamento escondido en lo alto de la pared del valle hacia el este."}},
[6613]={nameES="In the Halls of Thikil-gundu",objectivesES={"Talk to Dori and Nori in the Keep of Tharrazhâr","Dori and Nori can be found in the Keep of Tharrazhâr.\
\
You have repelled Karazgar and rescued Nori from the depths of Thikil-gundu, but many mysteries linger about the fate of the Steel Keep. You should talk to Dori and Nori.","Fearing that Nori has met with a terrible end at the hands of Karazgar or the mysterious dwarf-wights within Thikil-gundu, Dori and Company must muster the courage to enter the Steel Keep.","In the Halls of Thikil-gundu","Dori can be found atop Stánbalk, the Stone Wall.\
\
You have found evidence that Nori has gone into Thikil-gundu, and Dori now seeks to find his brother before Karazgar or the mysterious dwarf-wights can bring any harm to him.\
\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: You must complete the instance 'Thikil-gundu' on its solo difficulty to advance this quest.</rgb>","Talk to Dori and travel into Thikil-gundu"}},
[6614]={nameES="In the Halls of Thikil-gundu",objectivesES={"DNT - Company and Nori","Talk to Dori in Afhân-binnîn","Defeat Athramóth","Find the northern hall that leads into Afhân-binnîn from Kall-khebâb","Appearing to anticipate your arrival, Karazgar stands beneath a great crack in the Wrathhorn!","In the Halls of Thikil-gundu","To your horror, a great cold-drake rests among her brood at Thikil-nesad!","Karazgar can be found in the western reaches of Zashar-tûmun.\
\
You have found Karazgar, the Weeping Warrior, and you should now attempt to defeat him.","After sealing the western passage into Thikil-nesad, Nori suddenly notices Dori and Company!","The old forges of Thikil-gundu are rife with Orcs!","You feel a cold wind blowing from the rimed ruin-dwellings of Thikil-gundu...","Talk to Dori at the ruined hall to Afhân-binnîn in Kall-khebâb","The hoarding-vault of Immêsh-khalt can be found in the centre of Durûz-mazal, the Chamber of Faces.\
\
Dori has directed you and the rest of the company to search the hoarding-vault of Immêsh-khalt for signs of Nori.","Athramóth and her brood can be found in Thikil-nesad.\
\
You have discovered a great cold-drake resting among her brood. You should defeat Athramóth and make safe the old throne of the Steel Keep.","Recover the crown of Dáin","Slain long ago by Vethúg Wintermind, Frór, son of Dáin I, has been raised from death...","Find and confront Karazgar in Zashar-tûmun","Frór the Lost can be found in the heights of Afhân-binnîn.\
\
You have discovered the remains of Frór, son of Dáin I, brought to life by a fell spirit in Afhân-binnîn. You should defeat him and let him at last be laid to rest.","Find a way into the smithies of Kall-khebâb","Defeat Karkasht Crow-feeder and the Orcs of Gundabad in Kall-khebâb","Dori can be found in Thikil-gundu.\
\
You have reunited with Nori. You should now speak to Dori and learn what is to be done.","Talk to Nori at Thikil-nesad","Find a way through Amrâg-zahar to Zashar-tûmun","Search for Nori at Thikil-nesad, the Steel Seat","Defeat Karazgar, the Weeping Warrior","Nori can be found at Thikil-nesad.\
\
Nori has fled into Thikil-nesad and unwittingly reunited with Dori. You should talk to Nori.","Zashar-tûmun, the ruin-dwellings of Thikil-gundu, can be found to the west of the feast-house of Amrâg-zahar.\
\
Nori has warned you that Karazgar now prepares a great force of dragon-kind in Zashar-tûmun. You should find a way to Zashar-tûmun and confront Karazgar.","Defeat Frór the Lost and banish the fell spirit inhabiting his remains","The smithies of Kall-khebâb can be found in the eastern halls of Thikil-gundu.\
\
Determined to delve deeper into Thikil-gundu, Dori has asked you to find the smithies of Kall-khebâb so that you might gain passage into the other halls of the Steel Keep.","Search for Nori in Afhân-binnîn","Set in gold and adorned with precious mithril, the crown of Dáin has not faded in beauty...","Find a way to Afhân-binnîn through the feast-house of Amrâg-zahar","Amid the ruined remains of Amrâg-zahar, a passage leading into Afhân-binnîn lies open...","Athramóth falls defeated, but you hear a great commotion in the distance!","The remains of Frór, son of Dáin I, fall lifeless to the ground...","Nori might be found somewhere within Afhân-binnîn. Afhân-binnîn can be found through Amrâg-zahar.\
\
You have discovered a passage into Afhân-binnîn, and you should now search for Nori within the lore-troves of Thikil-gundu.","Thikil-nesad, the Steel Seat, can be found deep within Thikil-gundu.\
\
Fearing that Nori has been discovered by the inhabitants of the Steel Keep, Dori now hopes to find him before the old throne of Thikil-gundu.","A hall to Afhân-binnîn can be found at the northern end of the smithies of Kall-khebâb.\
\
With the smithies clear of foes, you should now search the smithies for a way into the lore-trove of Afhân-binnîn.","Fearing that Nori has met with a terrible end at the hands of Karazgar or the mysterious dwarf-wights within Thikil-gundu, Dori and Company must muster the courage to enter the Steel Keep.","Talk to Dori","Dori can be found in Thikil-gundu. If you have become separated, you may call him and the rest of the company by using your horn.\
\
You have repelled Karazgar and rescued Nori from the depths of Thikil-gundu. You should now speak to Dori.","Karazgar can be found somewhere within Zashar-tûmun.\
\
Nori has warned you that Karazgar now prepares a great force of dragon-kind in Zashar-tûmun. You should find and confront Karazgar.","Dori can be found in Thikil-gundu.\
\
You have defeated the fell spirit inhabiting the remains of Frór and recovered the long-lost crown of Dáin. You should offer the crown to Dori and learn what is to be done.","Search the hoarding-vault of Immêsh-khalt","An enormous hoard of gold lies encased in ice beneath your feet...","Talk to Dori in Thikil-gundu","Dori can be found in Thikil-gundu. If you have become separated, you may call him and the rest of the company by using your horn.\
\
You have come to Thikil-gundu in search of Nori. You should now speak to Dori in Thikil-gundu.","The hall into Afhân-binnîn is sealed by rubble and debris...","Karkasht Crow-feeder can be found in the smithies of Kall-khebâb.\
\
You have discovered a massive hobgoblin leading the Orcs in the smithies of Kall-khebâb. You must defeat him if you are to continue deeper into Thikil-gundu.","The feast-house of Amrâg-zahar can be found through the northernmost doors of Durûz-mazal, the Chamber of Faces.\
\
With the heat of the smithies now spreading through Thikil-gundu, Dori hopes to find another way to reach Afhân-binnîn and continue the search for Nori.","Karkasht Crow-feeder falls defeated, and the heat of the smithies begins to spread through Thikil-gundu...","Deliver the crown of Dáin to Dori in Thikil-gundu"}},
[6615]={nameES="In the Halls of Thikil-gundu",objectivesES={"DNT - Company and Nori","Talk to Dori in Afhân-binnîn","Defeat Athramóth","Find the northern hall that leads into Afhân-binnîn from Kall-khebâb","Appearing to anticipate your arrival, Karazgar stands beneath a great crack in the Wrathhorn!","In the Halls of Thikil-gundu","To your horror, a great cold-drake rests among her brood at Thikil-nesad!","Karazgar can be found in the western reaches of Zashar-tûmun.\
\
You have found Karazgar, the Weeping Warrior, and you should now attempt to defeat him.","After sealing the western passage into Thikil-nesad, Nori suddenly notices Dori and Company!","The old forges of Thikil-gundu are rife with Orcs!","You feel a cold wind blowing from the rimed ruin-dwellings of Thikil-gundu...","Talk to Dori at the ruined hall to Afhân-binnîn in Kall-khebâb","The hoarding-vault of Immêsh-khalt can be found in the centre of Durûz-mazal, the Chamber of Faces.\
\
Dori has directed you and the rest of the company to search the hoarding-vault of Immêsh-khalt for signs of Nori.","Athramóth and her brood can be found in Thikil-nesad.\
\
You have discovered a great cold-drake resting among her brood. You should defeat Athramóth and make safe the old throne of the Steel Keep.","Recover the crown of Dáin","Slain long ago by Vethúg Wintermind, Frór, son of Dáin I, has been raised from death...","Find and confront Karazgar in Zashar-tûmun","Frór the Lost can be found in the heights of Afhân-binnîn.\
\
You have discovered the remains of Frór, son of Dáin I, brought to life by a fell spirit in Afhân-binnîn. You should defeat him and let him at last be laid to rest.","Find a way into the smithies of Kall-khebâb","Defeat Karkasht Crow-feeder and the Orcs of Gundabad in Kall-khebâb","Dori can be found in Thikil-gundu.\
\
You have reunited with Nori. You should now speak to Dori and learn what is to be done.","Talk to Nori at Thikil-nesad","Find a way through Amrâg-zahar to Zashar-tûmun","Search for Nori at Thikil-nesad, the Steel Seat","Defeat Karazgar, the Weeping Warrior","Nori can be found at Thikil-nesad.\
\
Nori has fled into Thikil-nesad and unwittingly reunited with Dori. You should talk to Nori.","Defeat Frór the Lost and banish the fell spirit inhabiting his remains","Zashar-tûmun, the ruin-dwellings of Thikil-gundu, can be found to the west of the feast-house of Amrâg-zahar.\
\
Nori has warned you that Karazgar now prepares a great force of dragon-kind in Zashar-tûmun. You should find a way to Zashar-tûmun and confront Karazgar.","The smithies of Kall-khebâb can be found in the eastern halls of Thikil-gundu.\
\
Determined to delve deeper into Thikil-gundu, Dori has asked you to find the smithies of Kall-khebâb so that you might gain passage into the other halls of the Steel Keep.","Search for Nori in Afhân-binnîn","Set in gold and adorned with precious mithril, the crown of Dáin has not faded in beauty...","Find a way to Afhân-binnîn through the feast-house of Amrâg-zahar","Amid the ruined remains of Amrâg-zahar, a passage leading into Afhân-binnîn lies open...","Athramóth falls defeated, but you hear a great commotion in the distance!","The remains of Frór, son of Dáin I, fall lifeless to the ground...","Nori might be found somewhere within Afhân-binnîn. Afhân-binnîn can be found through Amrâg-zahar.\
\
You have discovered a passage into Afhân-binnîn, and you should now search for Nori within the lore-troves of Thikil-gundu.","Thikil-nesad, the Steel Seat, can be found deep within Thikil-gundu.\
\
