[6616]={nameES="In the King's Wake",objectivesES={"Amid growing dangers in Kingstead, Thane Edric and Léoflad struggle to prepare their people to journey to the Eastfold.","Thane Edric and his wife, Léoflad, can be found outside the Mead Hall of Entwade.\
\
Thane Edric has asked you to aid Léoflad and his people as they make ready to travel. You should speak to Edric and Léoflad.","Talk to Thane Edric","DNT -- Will not be seen","In the King's Wake","Thane Edric can be found outside the Mead Hall of Entwade near the waggons.\
\
You have aided the people of Entwade greatly, and should now speak to Thane Edric of what is to be done next."}},
[6617]={nameES="In the Name of Azog",objectivesES={}},
[6618]={nameES="A la sombra de gigantes",objectivesES={"Entrega las lianas resistentes a Buckley Sheppard","Las raíces pueden encontrarse por todo el Bosque Viejo, en los tramos orientales al norte y al sur del campamento de Adso. Buckley Sheppard está en el campamento de Adso, junto al Gran Camino del Este.\
\
Buckley Sheppard te ha ofrecido pagarte por encontrar lianas resistentes de las raíces en el Bosque Viejo. Las lianas se usarán para fabricar ataduras resistentes en lugar de clavos.","A la sombra de gigantes","Buckley Sheppard cree que las raíces de los árboles en el Bosque Viejo son lo bastante fuertes como para atar grandes secciones de madera."}},
[6619]={nameES="In the Shadow of the Emyn-nu-Fuin",objectivesES={"You have defeated many Orcs in Eryn Lasgalen and have assisted the Elves in their efforts to restore the forest.","Defeated many Orc-kind in Eryn Lasgalen.","The Orcs who escaped the Battle Under the Trees now hide in the vicinity of the Emyn-nu-Fuin.","Completado","In the Shadow of the Emyn-nu-Fuin","Orcs can be found scattered throughout Eryn Lasgalen.\
\
King Thranduil has bade you defeat any Orc-kind you come across."}},
[6620]={nameES="In the Shadow of the Mountain",objectivesES={"Andreg is near the Slade of Shadows, south of the Rohirrim scout-camp.\
\
Andreg has asked you to help him face the evils at the Slade of Shadows.","Complete Baa, Baa, Black Sheep","Complete Spirits of Dunland","Complete Dimming the Lights","The Rangers Saeradan, Amlan, and Andreg have tracked Gwyllion, the Old Woman of the Mountain, from the Windfells in Enedwaith to the Gravenwood of Dunland.","Andreg is near the Slade of Shadows, south of the Rohirrim scout-camp.\
\
You should return to Andreg with news of your successes.","Talk to Andreg near the Slade of Shadows","Complete Mystery of the Trees","In the Shadow of the Mountain"}},
[6621]={nameES="In the Shadow of the Stone",objectivesES={"A camp of Rohirrim located north of the Cuthstan has missed delivering a report to the soldiers of Stangard. Byrnstan wishes to check on the camp's leader and ensure that all is well.","The camp appears deserted, except for one man","Penda may be found in the Rohirrim-camp along the road north of the Cuthstan, to the west of Stangard.\
\
Penda seems to be the only man left at Frithstan's camp.","In the Shadow of the Stone","Visit the Rohirrim-camp along the northern base of the Cuthstan","The Rohirrim-camp may be found along the road north of the Cuthstan, to the west of Stangard.\
\
Byrnstan has asked you to visit Frithstan and ask about the delay in his report to Stangard.","Talk to Penda about Frithstan's location"}},
[6622]={nameES="In the Shadows of Black Sails",objectivesES={"Complete 'The Scourge's Captains'","Eshmun, Captain of the Haven, can be found at the Harbour-warden's Tower in the Sail-haven of Umbar Baharbêl.\
\
You have done much to rout the remnants of the Heirs of Castamir in the Sail-haven. You should talk to Eshmun.","In the Shadows of Black Sails","Complete 'Stealing From Their Own'","In the wake of a brazen murder committed by the Heirsworn, Eshmun, the Captain of the Haven, intends to deliver swift and terrible retribution upon those still loyal to the Heirs of Castamir in Umbar Baharbêl.","Eshmun, Captain of the Haven, can be found at the Harbour-warden's Tower in the Sail-haven of Umbar Baharbêl.\
\
Eshmun, Captain of the Haven, has asked for your aid in ridding Umbar Baharbêl of those still loyal to Balakhôr the Scourge and the Heirs of Castamir.","Talk to Eshmun at the Harbour-warden's Tower","Complete 'Heirs To Naught'"}},
[6623]={nameES="En el espíritu de Yule",objectivesES={"Habla con Mara Arenales","Mara Arenales está emocionada de dar la bienvenida a los visitantes a Rivegel y los anima a participar en todas las actividades del festival.","En el espíritu de Yule","Mara Arenales desea agradecerte por tu participación en el Festival de Yule hoy."}},
[6624]={nameES="En el espíritu de Yule",objectivesES={"Habla con Mara Arenales","Mara Arenales está emocionada de dar la bienvenida a los visitantes a Barranca Escarchada y los anima a participar en todo tipo de actividades durante el festival.'","En el espíritu de Yule","Mara Arenales desea agradecerte por tu participación en el Festival de Yule hoy."}},
[6625]={nameES="In the Wake of the Golden Host",objectivesES={"You found nothing of note here","The road to the Gostannon lies to the north of Amon Angened, leading eastwards. The first patrol point lies to the north-west of Amon Angened, upon the road.\
\
Dannaswen has asked you to patrol the road to the Gostannon in order to determine the strength of the Enemy there.","Dannaswen is at the Elf-waypost atop Amon Angened, south of the Gostannon.\
\
You should report back to Dannaswen at once.","You have found nothing of note here","In the Wake of the Golden Host","You have discovered an enemy patrol","You have found the enemy encampment at the Gostannon","Patrol the road to the Gostannon","The road to the Gostannon lies to the north of Amon Angeled, leading eastwards.\
\
Dannaswen has asked you to patrol the road to the Gostannon in order to determine the strength of the Enemy there.","The Elves of the Golden Host are concerned with the continued presence of Orcs in the Mirk-eaves and in procuring supplies for the Malledhrim in the east.","Talk to Dannaswen atop Amon Angened"}},
[6626]={nameES="In the Way of Dwarves",objectivesES={"Dôm Goru can be found somewhere to the north-west of Furuk-mekhem, the Southgate.\
\
After learning that the Zhélruka have a small encampment named Dôm Goru in the eastern hills of the Ered Mithrin, Dori has asked you to ride ahead of the Company and learn if they know anything of Nori's expedition.","Bags of gold coins can be purchased at a Vault-keeper.\
\
In exchange for information, Zádokh Flint-eye has asked you to give him ten gold coins.","In the Way of Dwarves","You discover a small deposit of black rock...","Collect a fragment of dragon-stone","You discover a small encampment of Zhélruka just off the road into the Ered Mithrin...","Find a deposit of dragon-stone in the Bitter Scar","Find Dôm Goru","Zádokh Flint-eye can be found at Dôm Goru.\
\
You have collected a small fragment of dragon-stone as Zádokh Flint-eye asked, and you should now deliver it to him at Dôm Goru and learn what else he knows of recent happenings in the Grey Mountains.","Learn if the Zhélruka at Dôm Goru encountered Nori's expedition","Deliver the bag of gold coins to Zádokh Flint-eye at Dôm Goru","Talk to Zádokh Flint-eye at Dôm Goru","You place a share of your gold into a small pouch and it jingles softly...","Desperate to learn more of Nori's passage into the Ered Mithrin, Dori hopes to parley with the Zhélruka that have come seeking their ancestral home of Dómekh.","Deliver the fragment of dragon-stone to Zádokh Flint-eye at Dôm Goru","Dragon-stone could once be found in the depths of the Ered Mithrin and near to the lairs of dragons, but it might also be found among the Bitter Scar.\
\
Zádokh Flint-eye has asked you to find a deposit of dragon-stone in the Bitter Scar and bring a fragment of it to him.","Dori can be found at Dôm Goru.\
\
After returning to Zádokh Flint-eye with the dragon-stone you discovered, he informed you that Dori and Company have come to Dôm Goru. You should speak to Dori and tell him what you have learned.","A small deposit of dragon-stone can be found in the southernmost reaches of the Bitter Scar.\
\
You have discovered a deposit of dragon-stone and should now mine it for Zádokh Flint-eye.","Talk to Dori at Dôm Goru","Obtain a bag of gold coins","The dragon-stone appears to be a sort of hardened, shimmering coal...","Zádokh Flint-eye can be found at Dôm Goru in the Ered Mithrin.\
\
You have defeated many drakes and worms as Zádokh Flint-eye asked and should now return to him.","Zádokh Flint-eye can be found at Dôm Goru in the Ered Mithrin.\
\
You have collected ten gold coins for Zádokh Flint-eye as he asked and should now speak to him.","Dôm Goru can be found to the north-west of Furuk-mekhem, the Southgate in the Ered Mithrin.\
\
You have arrived at Dôm Goru and should now speak to the Zhélruka at the encampment and learn if they encountered Nori's expedition.","Drakes and worms can be found throughout the Ered Mithrin.\
\
In exchange for information, Zádokh Flint-eye has asked you to defeat many of the drakes and worms of the Ered Mithrin."}},
[6627]={nameES="In the Wind",objectivesES={"Múta can be found at Mur Shatraug, the Witch-gate.\
\
After being discovered by Dourhands at the Witch-gate, Múta was captured and the rest of her scouts were scattered. You should find Múta.","Múta's weapons can be found at Mur Shatraug, the Witch-gate.\
\
Múta has asked you to return her weapons to her before attempting an escape. You should collect Múta's weapons.","Originally intending to join the Zhélruka expedition in Câr Bronach, Múta and her scouts quickly became separated after being ambushed by Dourhands at Mur Shatraug, the Witch-gate.","Dourhands can be found at Mur Shatraug, the Witch-gate.\
\
In preparation for her escape, Múta has asked you to collect orders from the Dourhands at the Witch-gate. You should defeat the Dourhands and collect their orders.","Múta can be found at Mur Shatraug, the Witch-gate.\
\
You have recovered Múta's weapons. You should deliver them to Múta.","You discover Múta locked in a cage within the Dourhands' encampment at the Witch-gate","Deliver the orders to Múta at Mur Shatraug, the Witch-gate","Talk to Múta at Mur Shatraug, the Witch-gate","Deliver the weapons to Múta at Mur Shatraug, the Witch-gate","Múta can be found at Mur Shatraug, the Witch-gate.\
\
You have collected orders from the Dourhands at Mur Shatraug, the Witch-gate. You should deliver them to Múta.","Múta's dagger is stained black, perhaps from a crude dye or Orkish blood","Múta can be found at Mur Shatraug, the Witch-gate.\
\
Múta has been captured and imprisoned by the Dourhands at Mur Shatraug, the Witch-gate. You should talk to Múta.","Múta's axe is of a simple design, but it has clearly seen much use","Find Múta at Mur Shatraug, the Witch-gate","In the Wind"}},
[6628]={nameES="Incienso para los atormentados",objectivesES={"Nan Mabli te ha pedido que quemes incienso en las los túmulos en las Quebradas del Sur.\
\
Los túmulos se encuentran en Gond Orchal, en las Quebradas del Sur.","Vuelve con Nan Mabli","Deberías informar a Nan Mabli de que has quemado incienso en los túmulos.\
\\Nan Mabli está en las Quebradas del Sur.","Incienso para los atormentados","Algo ha removido los huesos de los muertos en los túmulos de las Quebradas del Sur."}},
[6629]={nameES="Inconvenient Orcs",objectivesES={"You have defeated the Orcs in the hills of Duskenvale.\
\
You should return to Lúfred at the Beorning Watchpost to inform him.","Talk to Lúfred","Orcs have been troubling the road between the Gladden Fields and Duskenvale, preventing trade and travel. The trader Lúfred has asked you to take care of the issue.","Lúfred has asked you to stop the Orc activity in Duskenvale so trade can resume.\
\
You should find the Orc camp in the hills in Duskenvale.","This appears to be the source of the Orc ambushers","Defeated Captain Ugúrz","Find the Orc camp of Brafulug","Inconvenient Orcs","You have discovered a camp of Orcs in northern Duskenvale.\
\
You should defeat the Orcs and their leader in Brafulug.","Defeat Captain Ugúrz"}},
[6630]={nameES="Incubación en las Profundidades Llameantes",objectivesES={"Al entrar en las Profundidades Llameantes desde las Vetas del Cuerno Rojo, escuchaste un ruido que provenía de la esquina de la derecha.","Los gredbyg solían estar confinados en los límites de esta caverna, pero la colmena ha crecido enormemente hasta alcanzar el impresionante tamaño que ves hoy en día. Debe de haber una fuente de calor cerca que ayude a los gredbyg a desarrollar sus larvas y capullos tan rápido.","Encuentra la fuente de calor que sustenta a la colmena de gredbyg","Incubación en las Profundidades Llameantes","Has encontrado la fuente de calor que sustenta a la colmena de gredbyg y, por desgracia, no hay nada que se pueda hacer para detenerla. La colmena se ha construido en el lugar perfecto de Moria para aprovechar el calor natural que generan las minas.","El calor proviene de los charcos de aceite hirviendo y de los pozos de lava de las Profundidades Llameantes. No hay nada que se pueda hacer para impedir que sustente a la colonia de gredbyg a incubar sus larvas...\
\
Pero parece que hay un enano herido escondido entre las rocas. Deberías ver si necesita ayuda.","Comprueba el ruido que hay a la vuelta de la esquina a la derecha","Buscas la fuente de calor que ayuda a la colmena de gredbyg a incubar sus larvas tan rápidamente. Es probable que se encuentre en el extremo más alejado de la colmena."}},
[6631]={nameES="Indescifrable",objectivesES={"Glóin examinó el conjunto de órdenes recuperadas de los uruks en la Ciudad de los Trasgos y descubrió que también estaban escritas en la Lengua Negra.","Indescifrable","Elrond está en la Última Morada en Rivendel, al suroeste del campamento de Glóin.\
\
Glóin se dio cuenta de que otro conjunto de órdenes escritas en Lengua Negra tardaría demasiado en traducirse y te envió a Rivendel para hablar directamente con Elrond.","Muestra las órdenes a Elrond en Rivendel","Glóin está en su campamento, justo fuera de la Ciudad de los Trasgos, al noreste de Rivendel.\
\
Elrond Medio-Elfo hizo anotaciones en las órdenes y te advirtió de que los trasgos tenían un nuevo líder, un Gran Trasgo que desafiaba la intromisión de los uruks en la Ciudad de los Trasgos. Te envió de vuelta con Glóin junto con las órdenes traducidas.","Entrega las órdenes a Glóin en su campamento en las Montañas Nubladas","Elrond te ha devuelto las órdenes"}},
[6632]={nameES="Indir: Close Their Eyes",objectivesES={"Much of Lossarnach's farmland is burned and the first planting has been missed. Indir fears that if the Haradrim discover Arnach's grain supplies, no victory will forestall thin crops and starvation in seasons to come.","Lossarnach's seed stores can be found in the farms north-east of Arnach.\
\
You should travel to the remaining farms to the north-east and do what you can to hide and protect the seed stores there.","Indir: Close Their Eyes","Indir can be found in Arnach, near the keep.\
\
You should return to Indir and tell him that the remaining seed stores have been safely hidden from the foe.","Talk to Indir"}},
[6633]={nameES="Indir: Cover Their Ears",objectivesES={"War-horns can be found in the Haradrim camps south and east of Arnach.\
\
Indir's men have seen great warhorns in the Haradrim camps. He believes that if you sabotaged the horns, any assault on Arnach would be disorganized.","Indir: Cover Their Ears","Indir seeks to further disorganize the Haradrim by sabotaging their war-horns.","Indir can be found in Arnach, near the keep.\
\
Indir believes that if you sabotaged the Haradrim's war-horns, any assault on Arnach would be disorganized. You should return to him and tell him this has been done.","Talk to Indir"}},
[6634]={nameES="Indir: Seal Their Lips",objectivesES={}},
[6635]={nameES="Muestras de kergrim infectadas",objectivesES={"Lleva las muestras a Glorelloth en el Refugio Sombrío.","Muestras de kergrim infectadas","Skûmfil no es más que un vertedero, un lugar donde se arrojan a los orcos muertos de Moria cuando empiezan a apestar. Es allí donde dos enemigos se han reunido, cada uno con la intención de usar los cadáveres para sus propios fines. Los kergrim y otros carroñeros los utilizan como fuente de alimento, y los insectos, como lugar para poner sus huevos y engendrar futuras generaciones.","Skûmfil se encuentra al sureste del Refugio Sombrío.\
\
Glorelloth quiere asegurarse de que los kergrim no son los responsables de la enfermedad que afecta a los orcos de la oscuridad sombría, por lo que te ha enviado a recoger muestras de la piel de los kergrim."}},
[6636]={nameES="Orcos infectados",objectivesES={}},
[6637]={nameES="Muestras infectadas",objectivesES={"Devuelve las muestras a Pentlenn en el Refugio Sombrío","Muestras infectadas","La Sala Decimosexta es una zona infestada de orcos, muchos de los cuales padecen una terrible enfermedad que provoca crecimientos similares a hongos en sus cuerpos.\
\
Mallas, un elfo aliado de los enanos, cree que hay algo oculto bajo la Sala Decimosexta y desea descubrir el verdadero propósito y el origen de la plaga."}},
[6638]={nameES="Infected Troll",objectivesES={}},
[6639]={nameES="Chirridos infernales",objectivesES={"Kúli se encuentra en un campamento lejos hacia el sureste de Guardia Orca, en un pasadizo cavernoso entre las Vetas del Cuerno Rojo y las Profundidades Llameantes.\
\
Kúli se alegrará de saber que los chirridos de los gredbyg han sido acallados.","Los gredbyg pueden encontrarse al suroeste de Guardia Orca.\
\
Kúli te ha pedido que derrotes a los gredbyg que están volviéndolo loco con sus incesantes chirridos.","Los gredbyg del exterior del campamento de Guardia Orca sisean y chasquean durante la noche, impidiendo que los enanos duerman.","Habla con Kúli","Chirridos infernales"}},
[6640]={nameES="Chirridos infernales",objectivesES={"El zumbido de miles de gredbyg es suficiente para volver loco a cualquiera. Ese chirrido incesante parece no tener fin. Hay que silenciar todo ese ruido. Los gredbyg más grandes, los guerreros, son los responsables de los chillidos más fuertes.","La imponente colmena de gredbyg ocupa todo el pasillo cavernoso que une las Vetas del Cuerno Rojo y las Profundidades Llameantes.\
\
El zumbido sigue siendo insoportablemente fuerte en toda la colmena, pero se nota mucho más silencioso en otras partes de Moria.","Los gredbyg de la colmena, situada en el túnel sur de las Vetas del Cuerno Rojo, chirrían y chillan. El alboroto que hacen se oye a kilómetros de distancia, y es sorprendente que Moria no retumbe con todo ese ruido.","Los gredbyg guerreros se encuentran por toda la colmena, que ocupa el pasillo cavernoso entre las Vetas del Cuerno Rojo y las Profundidades Llameantes.\
\
El zumbido de miles de gredbyg se oye en casi todo Moria, pero es tan constante que la mayoría ni se da cuenta.","Completado","La colmena de gredbyg está más silenciosa, por ahora, y el zumbido que queda es casi... tolerable.","Chirridos infernales"}},
[6641]={nameES="Infernal Stores",objectivesES={"Thyrnir noticed that the Orcs of Gathbúrz have left their fire-oil supplies haphazardly piled about in the chaos of the Elven assault.","Talk to Thyrnir at Thangúlhad","Thyrnir at Thangúlhad in Gathbúrz.\
\
You should report your success to Thyrnir.","YOU SHOULD NOT SEE THIS","Infernal Stores","Fire-pots and supply crates can be found in the Orc-forts throughout northern Gathbúrz.\
\
Thyrnir has asked you to destroy the goblins' stockpiles of fire-oil by igniting them with the goblins' own fire-pots."}},
[6642]={nameES="Infestation",objectivesES={"Tyki quiere que mates algunos de los orcos infectados de hongos que ha visto por la zona.","Los orcos de la tribu de los Globsnaga se encuentran en Dalgum-ru, al sur del Refugio de las Sombras.\
\
Tyki quiere que mates a los orcos de la tribu de los Globsnaga que hay por la zona.","Tyki se encuentra en el Refugio Sombrío, al norte de Dalgum-ru.\
\
Debes regresar a Tyki y informarle que Dalgum-ru está efectivamente infestada de orcos, y que has matado a muchos.","Habla con Tyki en el Refugio Sombrío","Infestation"}},
[6643]={nameES="Infestation at Gnasher's Delf",objectivesES={}},
[6644]={nameES="Infiltrating Er Shamol",objectivesES={"Tuhâl has fashioned you a disguise!\
\
You should talk to Tuhâl.","Now that you have a disguise, you need to infiltrate Er Shamol.\
\
You should travel to Utterby with Tuhâl.","Find and free Tuhâl's family","Tuhâl is waiting to speak to Lord Náin on behalf of his people.\
\
Speak with Tuhâl to enter the instance 'Lord of Iron'.","Speak with Tuhâl and enter Instance: The Lord of Iron","Talk to Tuhâl","Kunchat, who oversees the Jangovar's forces, would like to speak with you.\
\
You should talk to Kunchat.","Many Easterlings are occupying this Dalish village, now called Er Shamol","Kunchat, who oversees the Jangovar's operations, will put you to work.\
\
You should talk to Kunchat.","Tuhâl's family is somewhere in Utterby.\
\
You should find and free Tuhâl's family.","Tuhâl has convinced Lord Náin to give him time to evacuate the innocent Easterlings from Utterby.\
\
You should talk to Tuhâl.","Talk to Kunchat","Tuhâl's family will escape Utterby when they are able","Tuhâl is ready to infiltrate Er Shamol.\
\
You should talk to Tuhâl.","You put on the Easterling clothing with Tuhâl's help","Undermine the Jangovar by completing quests in Utterby","The Dalish village of Utterby is currently under control of the Easterlings, who call it Er Shamol. Soon, the dwarves will be pushed to reclaim this territory for their allies.","Utterby is currently occupied by Jangovar forces.\
\
You should complete quests in Utterby to undermine the Jangovar.","Tuhâl's family will escape Er Shamol when they are able","Travel to Utterby","Infiltrating Er Shamol"}},
[6645]={nameES="Infiltrating Thorzhaf",objectivesES={"Párgrub can be found near Thorzhaf.\
\
You should talk to Párgrub and compete in the pit-fighting tournament.","Compete in the pit-fighting tournament","A notice is pinned to the board:\
\
'A brave warrior is needed to infiltrate the pit-fighting tournament located at Thorzhaf, in Talath Úrui.'","A new pit-fighting tournament has begun and you have been asked to participate.","Infiltrating Thorzhaf"}},
[6646]={nameES="Informa a Esteldín",objectivesES={"Informa a Esteldín","Has ayudado a Aglardir a reabastecer Lin Giliath, pero sus preocupaciones aún no se han disipado. La misión original de la compañía de Gildor Inglorion sigue sin cumplirse.","Esteldín está al noreste de Lin Giliath, oculta en las montañas orientales entre la Dehesa del Rey y Nan Amlug.\
\
Aglardir te ha enviado con Dagoras, el capitán de la guardia de Esteldín, para informarle del paso de los Nazgûl."}},
[6647]={nameES="Informar a Grimbriar",objectivesES={"Habla con el Vigilante Jefe Grimbriar","El Vigilante Jefe Grimbriar se encuentra en su puesto fuera de Bree.\
\
Los Vigilantes Hojafrágil y Robledales creen que no se puede contener la marea a punto de estrellarse contra los muros de Andrath. Te han pedido que convenzas al Vigilante Jefe Grimbriar de que debe buscar la ayuda de los Montaraces del Norte.","Informar a Grimbriar","Andrath ha sido invadida y los Vigilantes enviados para evaluar la amenaza creen que no puede recuperarse, a pesar de tus esfuerzos más recientes. De mala gana, has sido enviado de vuelta con el Vigilante Jefe Grimbriar con estas sombrías noticias."}},
[6648]={nameES="Informing the Kin",objectivesES={"Deliver the letter to Porókho","Deliver Belondor's letter to the Morutágya clan, informing them of the demise of their leader, Tumúldo Fierce-water.","Belondor has asked you to deliver a letter to Morutágya, the clan of smugglers that Tumúldo Fierce-water was the leader of, informing them of his death. Morutágya maintains a hideout in the southern part of Ilmabiri, beneath the Sail-haven of Umbar Baharbêl.","Informing the Kin"}},
[6649]={nameES="Informing the Masses",objectivesES={}},
[6650]={nameES="Infusion from the North: A Different Bread",objectivesES={}},
[6651]={nameES="Infusion from the North: A Worker's Honesty",objectivesES={"Deliver Keteph's new recipe to Tankho","Deliver Keteph's new recipe to Karishah in Rakhatâb","Deliver Keteph's new recipe to Beliash in Rakhatâb","Karishah did not enjoy the new recipe","Karishah tears the bready creation in half and takes a large bite.\
\
'This bread is awful! It is bland. No spice, no taste. This is terrible.'\
\
He spits the mouthful on the ground.\
\
'I would not pay for this. Nor would I put in my body for free.'","Keteph wants discerning and brutally honest feedback from the workers of Rakhatâb. He asks that you deliver these free meals to the worker leaders there.","Beliash did not like the new recipe","Hûzo looks at you and cautiously accepts the sack.\
\
'I am wary of those bearing free gifts. Alas, I am hungry, as are many in Rakhatâb. I will indulge you.'\
\
He takes a bite of Keteph's new dish.\
\
'Dry. Drier and drabber than a day along the shore with no water. I will eat it begrudgingly because the crab is delicious.'","Tankho did not like the new recipe","Beliash opens the sack and looks the bready gift over.\
\
'Smells good.'\
\
He takes a bite.\
\
'Oh.'\
\
His face contorts.\
\
'This bread is the worst thing I have ever tasted. It mars the delicious crab and saffron in the dish. This is, perhaps, the worst thing I have eaten in a moon.'","Infusion from the North: A Worker's Honesty","Keteph listens to you explain the harsh reactions of the workers in Rakhatâb. He then nods his head.\
\
'I thought the same when I took a bite after you left. How you northerners use this bread as a means of sustenance is a wonder. It has no taste. Still, I think that I can make a marriage of northern heartiness and the delicacies of Umbar work well together.'","Taphis did not enjoy the meal","Hûzo was not impressed with the recipe","Deliver Keteph's new recipe to Taphis","Keteph desires to hear fair criticism of his new dish. He enlists you to deliver sacks containing his new dish to the expedition leaders outside of Umbar to get their discerning opinions.","You gathered the responses and critiques from the worker leaders in Rakhatâb. Return this information to Keteph at the Swain's Guild-hall in Umbar Baharbêl.","Deliver Keteph's new recipe to Hûzo"}},
[6652]={nameES="Infusion from the North: Better Taste",objectivesES={}},
[6653]={nameES="Infusion from the North: It Needs Colour",objectivesES={}},
[6654]={nameES="Infusion from the North: The Latest Masterpiece",objectivesES={}},
[6655]={nameES="Infusion from the North: The Proper Outer Layer",objectivesES={"Acquire five loaves of barley bread from cooks through trade or auction and return them to Keteph at the Swain's Guild-hall in Umbar Baharbêl. Apprentice cooks can bake barley bread.","Acquire five loaves of barley bread from cooks through trade or auction and return them to Keteph at the Swain's Guild-hall in Umbar Baharbêl. Apprentice cooks can bake <rgb=#00FF00>Barley Bread</rgb>.","Keteph asks for your assistance in creating a dish that satisfies the desires of the Epicurean elite in Umbar. He desires a sturdy bread to support his latest creation.","Return the loaves of <rgb=#00FF00>Barley Bread</rgb> to Keteph at the Swain's Guild-hall","Infusion from the North: The Proper Outer Layer"}},
[6656]={nameES="Infusion from the North: The Right Tool",objectivesES={"Collected Keteph's family cruet","Collect Keteph's family cruet","Deliver the cruet to Keteph at the Swain's Guild-hall","Collect Keteph's family cruet from Phâredar in Jax Phanâl","Return to Jax Phânal and speak with Phâredar to retrieve Keteph's family cruet.","Infusion from the North: The Right Tool","You recovered Keteph's family cruet from the goblins. Return the cruet to him at Swain's Guild-hall in Umbar Baharbêl.","Keteph asked you to further assist him in crafting a special new dish. He needs you to return to Jax Phanâl to retrieve his cruet.","Phâredar told you that Keteph's family cruet was stolen in a raid by goblins. She suggested that you go to the encampment in the south-east to acquire the cruet from the goblins."}},
[6657]={nameES="Inhild's Wish",objectivesES={}},
