\
Dirígete a la posada El Arado y las Estrellas en Tejonera y habla con el miembro de la Liga de las Posadas que se encuentra allí.","Cervezas bebidas (4/6)"}},
[6672]={nameES="La Posada Abandonada: Acaba con el origen de los ruidos",objectivesES={"Localiza y destruye la fuente de los ruidos","La Posada Abandonada: Acaba con el origen de los ruidos","Los ruidos de los que se queja la gente no son causados por el viento, sino por algo mucho peor. Si quiere acabar con esos ruidos de una vez por todas, debe encontrar su origen y, si es necesario, destruirlo.","Espíritu del collar destruido","Destruye el origen de los ruidos"}},
[6673]={nameES="La Posada Abandonada: Acertijos en la oscuridad",objectivesES={"Habla con Umín","Te encuentras dentro de La Posada Abandonada a medianoche. El posadero te ha pedido que investigues el origen de los ruidos que provienen del sótano.","Los clientes ya han empezado a quejarse de los ruidos que se oyen en el sótano. Explora la zona y trata de descubrir el origen de los ruidos.","Explora las profundidades bajo La Posada Abandonada.","La estantería se abre deslizándose para revelar una escalera que desciende hacia la oscuridad.","Has encontrado a un hombre sospechoso leyendo un libro y mirando la puerta decorada con una runa brillante frente a él. ¿Quién es este hombre y qué hace aquí? Será mejor que se lo preguntes.","Habla con el hombre sospechoso","Derrota a Umín","Has descubierto lo que parece ser una cripta. Quizás Umin pueda desvelar este misterio.","La trampa giratoria ha arrancado el collar del cuello de Umín, y ahora yace brillando en el suelo. El propio Umín yace desplomado en el suelo. ¿Por qué te ha atacado?\
\
Habla con él y déjale que te lo explique...","Continúa explorando las cavernas.","Has liberado a Umín del poder del collar","Umín, el hombre que conociste en las cuevas, ha aceptado ayudarte en tu investigación. Debes aprovechar sus conocimientos para explorar las cuevas más a fondo.","Has descubierto la cripta del capitán Rabghul.","Investiga el origen de los ruidos","Los clientes han empezado a quejarse de ruidos en el sótano. Investiga la zona y descubre el origen de los ruidos.","Es Umin. Vivo y en forma... quizá demasiado. Parece que ha adquirido una fuerza casi sobrenatural durante su ausencia. Lleva un collar rojo brillante alrededor del cuello. También está enfadado contigo... Tendrás que derrotarlo si quieres sobrevivir.","Lleva a Umín a la cripta","Un hombre de aspecto sospechoso se encuentra frente a ti.","Sigue adelante a través de las cavernas","La Posada Abandonada: Acertijos en la oscuridad"}},
[6674]={nameES="La Posada Abandonada: Acertijos en la oscuridad (Nivel 2)",objectivesES={"Habla con Umín","Explora las profundidades bajo La Posada Abandonada","Te encuentras dentro de La Posada Abandonada a medianoche. El posadero te ha pedido que investigues el origen de los ruidos que provienen del sótano.","No era Umín quien intentaba matarte. Era el espíritu que habitaba en el collar. Lo controlaba, haciéndole cumplir sus órdenes. Debes destruir al espíritu, no sea que escape de ese lugar y cause estragos en la Tierra Media.","La estantería se abre deslizándose para revelar una escalera que desciende hacia la oscuridad.","Continúa explorando las cavernas","Has encontrado a un hombre sospechoso leyendo un libro y mirando la puerta decorada con una runa brillante frente a él. ¿Quién es este hombre y qué hace aquí? Será mejor que se lo preguntes.","Habla con el hombre sospechoso","Derrota a Umín","Has descubierto lo que parece ser una cripta. Quizás Umin pueda desvelar este misterio.","La trampa giratoria ha arrancado el collar del cuello de Umín, y ahora yace brillando en el suelo. El propio Umín yace desplomado en el suelo. ¿Por qué te ha atacado?\
\
Habla con él y déjale que te lo explique...","La Posada Abandonada: Acertijos en la oscuridad (Nivel 2)","Se acabó. El espíritu ha sido derrotado. Habla con Umín y explícale tu victoria.","Has liberado a Umin del poder del collar","Un hombre de aspecto sospechoso se encuentra frente a una puerta brillante marcada con runas.","Investiga el origen de los ruidos","Los clientes han empezado a quejarse de ruidos en el sótano. Investiga la zona y descubre el origen de los ruidos.","Es Umin. Vivo y en forma... quizá demasiado. Parece que ha adquirido una fuerza casi sobrenatural durante su ausencia. Lleva un collar rojo brillante alrededor del cuello. También está enfadado contigo... Tendrás que derrotarlo si quieres sobrevivir.","La estantería ocultaba un pasadizo secreto que conducía bajo la posada. Deberías registrar esa cueva e intentar encontrar el origen de esos ruidos.","Lleva a Umín a la cripta","Has descubierto la cripta del capitán Rabghul","Destruye el espíritu del collar","Sigue adelante a través de las cavernas","Umin, el hombre que conociste en las cuevas, ha aceptado ayudarte en tu investigación. Debes aprovechar sus conocimientos para explorar las cuevas más a fondo.","Abandona el barco"}},
[6675]={nameES="La Posada Abandonada: Golpe de medianoche",objectivesES={"La Posada Abandonada: Golpe de medianoche","Habla con Anlaf sobre la cerveza gratis","Necesitarás estar lleno de cerveza si quieres pasar el rato.","Los clientes de La Posada Abandonada se han quejado de unos terribles ruidos que provienen del suelo y las paredes del sótano. El propietario de la posada te ha pedido que esperes hasta medianoche, cuando suelen comenzar las quejas por los ruidos."}},
[6676]={nameES="Innocence in Peril",objectivesES={"Ivorel, the leader of a scout expedition into the Scuttledells, is concerned about the fate of Hal Tiller, an adventuresome young hobbit who asked to be allowed to aid the Elves on their expedition into Mirkwood. Ivorel fears that the inexperienced hobbit may have been slain by the horrors lurking in the clefts of the Scuttledells.","Search the southern Scuttledells for signs of Hal Tiller.\
\
Ivorel suggested a few places where he might most likely be found as part of the mission he was assigned, but she believes that he is most likely dead.","You can find no sign of Hal Tiller","Search east of the Pool of Tranquility","Search the paths north of the Pool of Tranquility","Innocence in Peril","Search the barrows north of the Pool of Tranquility","There is no sign that Hal Tiller was ever here","You found a torn and bloodied hobbit-pack","Habla con Ivorel en su campamento","Ivorel is at her camp in the Scuttledells.\
\
You should return to Ivorel and show her the pack you found."}},
[6677]={nameES="Amenaza Insecto",objectivesES={"Se pueden encontrar por toda la ciénaga de Meluinen, al sur de Lin Giliath.\
\
Debes reducir la amenaza de las moscas-guadaña de Meluinen, que han sido agitadas por los Trolls de Piedra.","Amenaza Insecto","Las moscas-guadaña en las ciénagas de Meluinen han sido perturbadas por la reciente agresión de los Trolls de Piedra.","Las moscas-guadaña en las ciénagas de Meluinen han sido perturbadas por la reciente agresión de los Trolls de Piedra, creando una amenaza para los Elfos de Lin Giliath.\
\
Debes derrotar moscas-guadaña en Meluinen.","Completado","Has derrotado varias moscas-guadaña enfurecidas en Meluinen, lo que debería dar a los Elfos de Lin Giliath un pequeño respiro frente a estas criaturas hostiles en el claro."}},
[6678]={nameES="Insectos entre los moribundos",objectivesES={"Encontraste esta quitina y muchas otras cosas en los insectos que habitan en Skûmfil. Deberías llevársela a alguien que pueda saber más sobre los insectos.","Recogiste este trozo de quitina de Brumbereth, la reina de los gredbyg de Skûmfil.","Entrega la quitina a Mallas en el Refugio Sombrío","Mallas se encuentra en el Refugio Sombrío.\
\
Llévale la quitina a Mallas. Quizás él pueda darte alguna explicación sobre por qué hay insectos cerca de los orcos infectados.","Insectos entre los moribundos"}},
[6679]={nameES="Inside Ezôti's Den",objectivesES={"The boar's worried eyes are fixed on the baby bear","Ezôti has revealed where he keeps his captive animals. Share this information with Gûshida.\
\
Gûshida is in the Upper Ward of Umbar Baharbêl.","Ezôti smiles at you for a little too long, an already uncomfortable pause becoming longer and more awkward with each passing second. Finally he says 'I think I can trust you with a most important task. I have many animals in my care.'\
\
He leans closer to you. His breath smells of good fish and bad milk.\
\
'...Or should I say \\qour\\q care? That is right! I am entrusting you with the care of my animals. Go to where I house my precious friends in the Upper Quarter. Feed and water them.'","Ezôti's captive animals are in poor condition. Gûshida has asked you to help check on them.\
\
Ezôti's hiding place is inside the Upper Ward of Umbar Baharbêl.","Talk to Gûshida across the way from Ezôti","Check on the boar","The goat leans into your touch. You sense it has been a long time since it has been treated with compassion","Inside Ezôti's Den","The creature's breathing is laboured","Check on the cave-claw","Meet with Gûshida inside Ezôti's Flat","The bear issues a plaintive cry, causing your companion to wince","Gûshida told you to meet her at Ezôti's hiding place.\
\
Ezôti's hiding place is inside an unassuming flat in the Upper Ward of Umbar Baharbêl, to the north-east.","Talk to Gûshida inside Ezôti's Flat","You have inspected the animals and should report back to Gûshida.\
\
Gûshida can be found in Ezôti's hiding place in the Upper Ward of Umbar Baharbêl.","The air is thick with an amalgam of stenches. Gûshida pinches her nose with a thick cloth.\
\
'Quickly! Help me check on them!'","Check on the bear","A strange man puts on a 'show' in the Upper Ward of Umbar Baharbêl.","Check on the goat","You share the animals' location with Gûshida.\
\
'Good work! I will tell my associates we are on our way to rescue the animals. I will meet you inside Ezôti's Flat in the Upper Ward, north-east of here.'"}},
[6680]={nameES="Insight into Action",objectivesES={"The Kintai of Sul Madásh welcome the assistance of you and the others against their ancient enemy, Sívigush. Irsinith directs you to enlist Viznak's further assistance.","Insight into Action","Collect a peculiar-looking mushroom from south-east Adagím","Deliver the peculiar mushroom to Viznak at Sul Madásh","Speak with Viznak at the Sul Madásh in Adagím","Viznak directs you to scour the area in the south-east section of Adagím in search for something out of the ordinary. He believes that you will find a fungal growth very different from the others near the location not on the maps.","You discovered a mushroom at the foot of the mountains in south-eastern Adagím. The mushroom was certainly different and out of place from the rest. Return the mushroom to Viznak at the Mother's Hill.","Collected a peculiar-looking mushroom","Irsinith enlists you to gain Viznak's aid in learning more about the missing section of the map. Return to him at Sul Madásh."}},
[6681]={nameES="Inspect the Ship-yard",objectivesES={"Anvils stand unused at the south-east forges. Are the crews already armed?","Explore south-east frame construction","The ship-yard at Starkhaven sprawls along the shore at Sûg Nidar, birth-place of a mighty fleet.","Explore eastern central scaffolding","Standing by a banner on the north-western side of Starkhaven, you reflect upon the construction of such a fleet as the Song. It must have required a tremendous effort from thousands of workers for many years, and such work is revealed by the sprawling vastness of the ship-yard.\
\
You decide to explore Starkhaven and see what you can learn of the construction effort.","Explore the south-east forges","The keep at Starkhaven is the heart of Ordâkhai power in Sûg Nidar","Explore the central keep of Starkhaven","You have explored the inner workings of the ship-yard at Starkhaven, and learned much of how such a mighty fleet could be constructed.","A great wooden scaffolding towers above the western side of the central ship-yard","The shell of a ship waits to be completed among its finished brethren","The frame of a ship waits to be finished on the north-western side of the ship-yard","Explore western timber assembly","Inspect the Ship-yard","Standing by a banner on the north-western side of Starkhaven, you decide to explore the ship-yard and learn what you can of its workings.","Your exploration of the ship-yard at Starkhaven has revealed something troubling: despite the hive of activity it must have been over the years, construction has now slowed tremendously. Many ships remain unfinished, and skeletal hulls stand where they were begun.\
\
The Song of Waves and Wind has no need of further ships. The fleet is large enough already, and the threat it poses is very real. You and your friends must do something, or all of coastal Middle-earth is in danger.","Explore eastern timber assembly","Wooden scaffolding claws the sky on the eastern side of the central ship-yard","Piles of timber stand idle on the eastern side of the ship-yard","Explore north-west frame construction","Examine the banner at the ship-yard of Starkhaven","Stacked lumber and timbers wait here for delivery to ships on the west side","The ship-yard at Sûg Nidar has constructed dozens of ships, with even more still in progress. You should explore the vast ship-yard at Starkhaven.","Completado","Explore western central scaffolding"}},
[6682]={nameES="Inspecting the Goods",objectivesES={"A merchant has hurt his back and wants you to inspect them in his stead by smacking the bags.\
\
His bags of rice can be found arrayed beyond the Wharf-gate just inside the Sail-haven.","Pick up the bag of bad rice","You hear good sound quality and feel the firmness of the bag","Smack the bags of rice (3/5)","Smack the bags of rice (4/5)","You have delivered the bag of bad rice","Uh oh! That neither sounded nor felt right","You have inspected all the rice and should report back to the injured merchant.\
\
The injured merchant is outside the Monger's Guild-hall in the Upper Ward of Umbar Baharbêl.","Smack the bags of rice (2/5)","Smack the bags of rice (1/5)","You have found a bag of rice that does not pass muster. Pick it up and drop it next to the injured merchant.\
\
The injured merchant can be found outside the Monger's Guild-hall in the Upper Ward.","A quality bag of rice if ever you smacked one","Inspecting the Goods","Sounds good!","Talk to the injured merchant outside the Monger's Guild-hall","A merchant needs help evaluating the quality of his goods.","Smack the bags of rice (0/5)","No problems here, just delicious rice"}},
[6683]={nameES="Inspiration for a Love Poem",objectivesES={"Took down notes in Rhovendol's journal -- but the stone detail of a nearby building catches your eye","Bring your notes to Rhovendol","The great fountain of Dol Amroth is in the Court of the Fount.\
\
You should <rgb=#FF0000>meditate</rgb> at the fountain, and think of how it reminds you of Barían.","Rhovendol is in the Scholar's Quarter in Dol Amroth.\
\
You should return to Rhovendol.","Perhaps it was because Barían stood amongst the stone-masons, but the fair stonework reminds you of her style of beauty","Rhovendol mentioned that Barían could often be found in the Mason's Quarter in Dol Amroth.\
\
You should see if you can catch a glimpse of Barían before you run off to take notes on things that resemble her.","Examine the blue canopy for resemblance to Barían","Write about the fair stonework's resemblance to Barían","Write about how the stream of water is strong and bold","This is a good place to meditate","The building whose stone detail caught your eye is south-east of the fountain in the Court of the Fount -- the one with the golden statue atop it.\
\
You should <rgb=#FF0000>look</rgb> at the detail on this fine building.","Your journal is in your inventory.\
\
You should use the journal to write down your observations.","Inspiration for a Love Poem","<rgb=#FF0000>Meditate</rgb> at the fountain","This is a good place to look","Rhovendol, a poet of Dol Amroth, has asked you to take notes for him so that he may compose a poem to his love, Barían.","Blue canopies can be found in the Court of the Fount.\
\
You should examine the canopies for resemblance to Barían.","The colour is little like Barían's hardy presence, but the fabric's strength against the breeze impresses you","Took down notes in Rhovendol's journal","Barían stares boldly and expectantly at the master stone-mason, standing out amongst the workmen","Write about the fabric's strength against the wind","Try to catch a glimpse of Barían","<rgb=#FF0000>Look</rgb> at the stonework detail on the fine building"}},
[6684]={nameES="Inspire Hope",objectivesES={"Lhucu is at her hut, north of Lhan Bach.\
\
You should return to Lhucu with the answers from Nia and Parru.","Talk to Parru at Lhan Bach","Talk to Nia at Lhan Bach","Talk to Lhucu at her hut in the Bonevales","Nia and Parru are elders of Lhan Bach, found along the path south of Lhucu's hut.\
\
Lhucu asked you to speak with Nia and Parru and convince them to turn away from the service of Trehéarn Brenin.","Lhucu confirmed Naeglanc's suspicions regarding the urn-shards you discovered.","Inspire Hope"}},
[6685]={nameES="Animar al cartero Raropié",objectivesES={"El cartero Raropié está en los Ranales, al este de Delagua.\
\
El cartero Coto está preocupado por su amigo Raropié y quiere que le lleves noticias de tus esfuerzos por revitalizar el Servicio de Correo Postal Rápido con la esperanza de que eso le levante el ánimo.","Animar al cartero Raropié","El cartero Coto está encantado de que estés ayudando al Servicio de Correo Postal Rápido a recuperar su reputación de rapidez en la entrega del correo y quiere que lleves noticias de tus esfuerzos al cartero Raropié de los Ranales, que ha estado bastante decaído últimamente."}},
[6686]={nameES="Instancia: Un mal cumpleaños",objectivesES={"Instancia: Un mal cumpleaños","The sons of Isildur are at Díngarth, waiting for you to sit by their camp-fire.","Listen to the conversation of the sons of Isildur","Meldaran is at Díngarth.","Talk to Vëamacil","Talk to Meldaran","Tárandil is at Díngarth.","<rgb=#00FF00>Sit</rgb> by the fire","Vëamacil is at Díngarth.","Vëamacil and his brothers are at Díngarth.","The sons of Isildur are at Díngarth.","The sons of Isildur are spending a final night by the fire before the day dawns upon the Bright Company's desperate mission to rob Sauron of his domination over the Ghâzab Bôron.","Talk to Tárandil"}},
[6687]={nameES="Instancia: Una tradición Beorninghús",objectivesES={"Instancia: Una tradición Beorninghús","You collect some fruit for the table from Violet","<rgb=#FF0000>Sit</rgb> down for a meal.","You collect some bread for the table from Lady","This is a good place to <rgb=#FF0000>sit</rgb> down","How kind of Clover! You should give this dinnerware to Rose","<rgb=#FF0000>Sit</rgb> down for a meal","Star is helping to set the table","Habla con Grimbeorn.","Help set the table.","You place the fruit on the table","Enjoy a meal.","How kind of Honey-bun! You should give this dinnerware to Star","You collect some honey for the table from Cream","Rose is helping to set the table","Talk to Gírta","Now that the guests have arrived, dinner can begin","How kind of Leaf! You should give this dinnerware to Sprout","Talk to Gírta.","Enjoy a meal","Sprout is helping to set the table","You collect some nuts for the table from Lily","You place the honey on the table","Grimbeorn invites many family members and guests to a feast.","Habla con Grimbeorn","Help set the table","How kind of Honey-pie! You should give this dinnerware to Bud","You place the bread on the table","Enjoy a moment's rest","You place the nuts on the table","Bud is helping to set the table","Enjoy a moment's rest."}},
[6688]={nameES="Instancia: Una cuchilla de llamas y furia, parte 2",objectivesES={"Speak with Mizâdi in the tower","Okhíso and Mizâdi draw their swords","Instancia: Una cuchilla de llamas y furia, parte 2","Listen to Mizâdi and Okhíso","Finish your ascent and enter the tower room to confront Okhiso.","Speak with Mizâdi to continue your ascent through the tower","Defeat Okhíso and his guards","Assist Mizâdi with her confrontation with Okhíso","Speak with Mizâdi in the tower.","Listen to Okhíso's dying words.","Go with Mizâdi up the tower stairs to confront Okhíso.","Mizâdi stops to allow you to rest","Defeat Okhíso's guards and archers.","Mizâdi stops to regroup with you","You must quickly ascend the tower of Kûr Anzar. Okhíso must not escape what justice demands.","Listen to Okhíso's dying words","Listen to Mizâdi and Okhíso.","Alert Mizâdi you are prepared to continue","Tell Mizâdi you are prepared to move forward","Mizâdi arrives at the throne ready to treat with Okhíso"}},
[6689]={nameES="Instancia: Una cuchilla de llamas y furia, parte 3",objectivesES={"Meet Mizâdi back at the tower of Kûr Anzar.","Instancia: Una cuchilla de llamas y furia, parte 3","Put out straw fires and rescue trapped citizens in Kûr Anzar.","Meet Mizâdi back at the tower of Kûr Anzar","Okhíso, seeking to divert your attention, has set Kûr Anzar aflame. That was not enough to stay Mizâdi's blade but now the city needs to be saved. You must put out the fires and rescue trapped citizens in Kûr Anzar."}},
[6690]={nameES="Instancia: Un mosaico roto",objectivesES={"Habla con Fastrith Halcomida en Zul-mazal","Bored by the discussion, Imák has called for you to speak with him. He believes danger is near.","Talk to Imák in Zul-mazal","Listen to the dwarves discuss the broken mosaic in Zul-mazal","Remain alert for any further threats to the dwarves","Fastrith and the other dwarves stand in Zul-mazal, discussing the broken mosaic on the wall.","Bori and the other dwarves prepare to defend Zul-mazal from the hobgoblin hunting-pack.","Imák calls for you from the other side of the chamber","You and the dwarves have defended Zul-mazal from the hobgoblin hunting-party.","A hobgoblin prey-catcher has found the entrance to Zul-mazal, and before he was slain he alerted his band to your position. You and the dwarves must ready your defence!","Return to Zul-mazal with Imák and ready the defence","Bori has suggested that you bring Fastrith to inspect the broken mosaic in Zul-mazal in order to see if her master Stáli the Hewer would be interested in it.","Imák has been defeated!","Instancia: Un mosaico roto","Talk to Bori in Zul-mazal","Fastrith has come to Zul-mazal."}},
[6691]={nameES="Instancia: El encargo de un saqueador",objectivesES={"Palma Rizopardo te ha convencido de recuperar la espada Medhrod, robada por medio-orcos en Naerost, en las Tierras Solitarias.","Palma Rizopardo está esperando para hablar contigo en las colinas fuera de Naerost.\
\
De alguna manera, Palma te ha convencido de infiltrarte en las ruinas de Naerost para recuperar la espada Medhrod.","Palma Rizopardo está en la ladera, fuera de las ruinas de Naerost.\
\
Palma espera con entusiasmo tu regreso con Medhrod.","La espada Medhrod está en algún lugar dentro de las ruinas de Naerost.\
\
Los medio-orcos que la robaron seguramente la tienen bien vigilada dentro de las ruinas.","Recuperar Medhrod","Instancia: El encargo de un saqueador"}},
[6692]={nameES="Instancia: Un enredo en la calle Aguamiel",objectivesES={"Habla con Prisca Boffin","Instancia: Un enredo en la calle Aguamiel","Escapa del nº 8 de la calle Aguamiel","Espera que Prisca vuelva al salón","<rgb=#00FF00>Anima</rgb> para evitar que Angélica encuentre a Dinodas","Angélica tiene algo más que decirte.","Habla con Angélica Boffin","Prisca quiere hablar contigo.","Con el regalo seguro en tus manos, debes escapar del nº 8 de la calle Aguamiel","Angélica quiere hablar contigo.","Esconde el regalo en algún sitio... ¡y rápido!","Dinodas cree que el regalo está guardado en la habitación de atrás, al final de la Sala de Entrada.","Para prevenir una situación embarazosa, Dinodas te ha encargado que lleves a cabo un plan mediante el cual espera recuperar el regalo de inauguración antes de que su hermana Angélica lo abra.","Debes esperar hasta que sea seguro moverse sin ser visto.","<rgb=#00FF00>Desmáyate</rgb> o <rgb=#00FF00>túmbate</rgb> para esconderte de la vista","Alguien se está acercando a tu habitación. ¡Será mejor que te escondas detrás de la mesa!","Angélica te está buscando.","Escucha lo que Angélica tiene que decir","Una fechoría bien ejecutada... más o menos.","Encuentra el regalo envuelto en el almacén oeste"}},
[6693]={nameES="Instancia: El estandarte de un capitán",objectivesES={"Jarl Brazodecobre te espera fuera de Ost Galumar.\
\
Jarl Brazodecobre desea hablar contigo.","El estandarte ahora se muestra con orgullo","Tres postes de estandarte están colocados en los muros de Ost Galumar.\
\
Jarl Brazodecobre te ha pedido izar tres de los estandartes de los Pueblos Libres sobre Ost Galumar.","Jarl Brazodecobre se encuentra fuera de Ost Galumar.\
\
Jarl Brazodecobre espera hablar contigo sobre tu tarea exitosa.","Habla con Jarl Brazodecobre","Instancia: El estandarte de un capitán","Has viajado a Ost Galumar con Jarl Brazodecobre para izar los estandartes de los Pueblos Libres sobre las ruinas ocupadas por los Duramano."}},
[6694]={nameES="Instancia: Un público cautivo",objectivesES={"Applaud Khûldim Umûn for his decision","Talk to Girhâzi","Listen to the conversation","Show Khûldim Umûn that you are powerful","<rgb=#00FF00>Wave</rgb> at Khûldim Umûn","Instancia: Un público cautivo","Greet Khûldim Umûn","Girhâzi has an idea for how to get Khûldim Umûn to divulge the location of the lost archive, and she needs your help.","Listen to Khûldim Umûn","<rgb=#00FF00>Challenge</rgb> Khûldim Umûn to trial by combat","Girhâzi has a plan to get Khûldim Umûn to divulge the location of Dubarâkh, and has asked you to go along with whatever she is saying.","<rgb=#00FF00>Pose</rgb> for Khûldim Umûn","<rgb=#00FF00>Clap</rgb> for Khûldim Umûn's decision","Show Khûldim Umûn how courageous you are","Girhâzi signals that she wants to talk to you, but makes no effort to keep her words unheard by Khûldim Umûn.\
\
'I was planning on ransoming him and sending him back to his family once we learned where the archive is, but if he is not going to tell us, what do you think of giving the people of Ambarûl what they want? Public executions are so distasteful though. We could even make it a fair fight, you against him. It would end the same.'","Girhâzi has a plan to get Khûldim Umûn to divulge the location of Dubarâkh. You should talk to her.","Challenge Khûldim Umûn to single combat","<rgb=#00FF00>Flex</rgb> at Khûldim Umûn"}},
[6695]={nameES="Instancia: El Valor de un Campeón",objectivesES={"Instancia: El Valor de un Campeón","Mosal-ruk se planta desafiante ante ti.\
\
Has luchado en lo profundo de Ost Cyrn junto a Slade Ransford, y ha llegado el momento de enfrentar a Mosal-ruk, el líder de la partida de guerra que ocupa las ruinas.","Slade Ransford está en Ost Cyrn, en las Tierras Solitarias.\
\
Slade está descansando rápidamente en lo alto de uno de los edificios en ruinas de Ost Cyrn, y espera hablar contigo sobre avanzar más en las ruinas en busca de Mosal-ruk.","Slade Ransford está en Ost Cyrn, en las Tierras Solitarias.\
\
Slade espera hablar contigo sobre luchar en lo profundo de Ost Cyrn en busca de Mosal-ruk, el vil orco que lidera esta partida de guerra.","Has venido a Ost Cyrn con Slade Ransford para expulsar a los orcos que se han instalado en las ruinas.","Habla con Slade Ransford","Desafía a Mosal-ruk","Slade Ransford está triunfante en Ost Cyrn.\
\
Juntos, tú y Slade recorristeis las ruinas de Ost Cyrn y pusisteis fin a Mosal-ruk y su vil partida de guerra."}},
[6696]={nameES="Instance: A Changing Wind",objectivesES={}},
[6697]={nameES="Instancia: Un capítulo sobre elfos",objectivesES={"Viaja a Lothlórien con Haldir y Bingo","Habla con Bingo en el camino","Habla con Bingo dentro de Caras Galadhon","Has venido con Bingo a través del Valle del Arroyo Sombrío y te has encontrado con un pequeño grupo de elfos enviados desde Lothlórien para recibiros.","Haldir ha pedido que tú y Bingo lo acompañéis a Lothlórien.","Haldir y varios Elfos han llegado en un momento oportuno, y parece que estaban esperándoos.","Tú, Bingo y Willem Bigotes habéis salido de la vasta oscuridad de Moria y ahora os acercáis al Bosque de Oro.","Tú y Bingo os habéis encontrado con Celeborn y Galadriel, y están muy interesados en oír hablar de vuestros viajes.","Instancia: Un capítulo sobre elfos","Habla con Galadriel","Bingo está dentro de Caras Galadhon, esperando hablar contigo.","Has defendido a Bingo de un ataque de un grupo de orcos, y ahora el hobbit está listo para continuar su tranquilo paseo por el Valle del Arroyo Sombrío.","El Señor y la Dama de Lórien esperan hablar contigo en Caras Galadhon.","Habla con Haldir en el camino","Habla con Bingo en el camino a través del Valle del Arroyo Sombrío","Habla con Bingo en Caras Galadhon","Habla con Celeborn","Escucha las palabras de Celeborn y Galadriel","Tú y Bingo habéis sido escoltados hasta Lothlórien, y ahora el hobbit está muy emocionado por aprender todo lo que pueda sobre los Elfos.","Has avanzado con Bingo un buen trecho dentro del Valle del Arroyo Sombrío, y un sendero conduce hacia el este en dirección al Bosque de Oro."}},
[6698]={nameES="Instancia: Una reunión clandestina",objectivesES={"Talk to Kyrstig","Instancia: Una reunión clandestina","Listen to the conversation","Scout Kyrstig has an important report to share: a secret meeting between Loknashra and the leader of the Cult of Drugoth hints at their true motives in the region....","Kyrstig is describing what she saw transpire between the Angmarim cultist and Loknashra.\
\
You should listen to the conversation.","Kyrstig is ready to describe what she saw earlier.\
\
You should talk to Kyrstig."}},
[6699]={nameES="Instancia: Un Golpe Imponente",objectivesES={"Leave Borhador and face whatever is pounding upon the walls of the Crossing-hall.","The sound gets louder, rattling the doors","Instancia: Un Golpe Imponente","Borhador heard sounds coming from outside the hall.\
\
You should speak with Borhador.","Let the events transpire.","Speak with Borhador","Borhador stands outside the Crossing-hall.\
\
You should speak with Borhador.","Let the events transpire","Borhador hears a loud noise outside and want you to investigate as he fears the a cave troll has come for him.","Leave Borhador and face whatever is pounding upon the walls of the Crossing-hall","The townspeople of Ethring band together to overthrow a rampaging cave troll"}},
[6700]={nameES="Instancia: Un enemigo acorralado",objectivesES={"Habla con Miluimil para salir de las oscuras cavernas.","Derrota a los orcos que persiguen a Gollum","Habla con Miluimil","El explorador elfo Miluimil ha recibido el encargo de capturar a la criatura llamada Gollum para impedir que caiga en manos de los orcos.","Instancia: Un enemigo acorralado","Habla con Miluimil y adéntrate en las cavernas para impedir que los orcos que persiguen a Gollum lo capturen.","Gollum ha escapado"}},
[6701]={nameES="Instancia: Una Cabaña en el Bosque",objectivesES={"Radagast te ha pedido que hables con Saeradan afuera","Instancia: Una Cabaña en el Bosque","Frente a ti se sienta Radagast el Pardo, un Mago del orden de Gandalf. Busca tu ayuda en la Guerra del Anillo.\
\
Debes hablar con Radagast y ver cómo puedes ayudar.\
\
<rgb=#00ff00>Haz clic derecho en los personajes para interactuar</rgb>.","Habla con Radagast el Pardo"}},
[6702]={nameES="Instancia: Una grieta en la Corona de Hierro",objectivesES={"Bandrauth Adder-fang can be found in the upper chamber of Tûr Ágal, the tower in the centre of Caivád Sâr.\
\
Bandrauth Adder-fang intends to slay you to atone for his failures in Elderslade. You should defend yourself and defeat Bandrauth Adder-fang.","Brathar Crack-helm is departing the upper chamber of Tûr Ágal, the tower in the centre of Caivád Sâr.\
\
You should remain alert while Brathar and his Dourhands depart.","Talk to Múta","With the defeat of Bandrauth Adder-fang and the Dourhands, a sudden silence falls in Tûr Ágal","As the last of the other Angmarim leave the chamber, Bandrauth Adder-fang smirks at you","Brathar, the Dourhands, and the servants of the Iron Crown can be found in the upper chamber of Tûr Ágal, the tower in the centre of Caivád Sâr.\
\
You have found Brathar, the Dourhands, and the servants of the Iron Crown gathered in Tûr Ágal. You should observe this meeting and try to remain unseen.","Follow Múta and fight your way through Tûr Ágal","<rgb=#FF0000>Múta has been defeated!</rgb>","After reaching the door to the upper chamber, Múta pauses and beckons you over","Instancia: Una grieta en la Corona de Hierro","Observe Brathar's departure from Tûr Ágal","Talk to Bandrauth Adder-fang","Múta can be found in Tûr Ágal, the tower in the centre of Caivád Sâr.\
\
Múta is ready to search for Brathar in Tûr Ágal. You should speak to her when you are prepared.","Talk to Brathar Crack-helm","Brathar, the Dourhands, and servants of the Iron Crown have gathered in Tûr Ágal!","It seems your presence did not go unnoticed by Brathar","Múta can be found in the upper chamber of Tûr Ágal, the tower in the centre of Caivád Sâr.\
\
You have found Brathar, the Dourhands, and the servants of the Iron Crown gathered in Tûr Ágal. You should talk to Múta.","Bandrauth Adder-fang can be found in the upper chamber of Tûr Ágal, the tower in the centre of Caivád Sâr.\
\
Sensing that Bandrauth Adder-fang may fail in his task yet again, the Dourhands have entered the fight to ensure that you do not leave Tûr Ágal.","Observe the meeting between Brathar and the Iron Crown","Defeat Bandrauth Adder-fang","Múta can be found in Tûr Ágal, the tower in the centre of Caivád Sâr.\
\
Múta has paused beside a door in the heights of Tûr Ágal. You should talk to Múta.","Brathar Crack-helm can be found in the upper chamber of Tûr Ágal, the tower in the centre of Caivád Sâr.\
\
You have been discovered by Brathar Crack-helm. You should approach Brathar and talk to him.","Word has spread that a mysterious enemy has arrived at Caivád Sâr, threatening to turn the tide of the War of Three Peaks.","Múta can be found in Tûr Ágal, the tower in the centre of Caivád Sâr.\
\
You should follow Múta into the heights of Tûr Ágal.","Múta can be found in the upper chamber of Tûr Ágal, the tower in the centre of Caivád Sâr.\
\
With Múta's aid, you have overcome Bandrauth Adder-fang and the Dourhands at Tûr Ágal. You should talk to Múta.","Defeat Bandrauth Adder-fang and the Dourhands","Bandrauth Adder-fang can be found in the upper chamber of Tûr Ágal, the tower in the centre of Caivád Sâr.\
\
You have been offered to Bandrauth Adder-fang that he might atone for his failure. You should talk to Bandrauth Adder-fang."}},
[6703]={nameES="Instancia: Un Desvío Peligroso",objectivesES={"Instancia: Un Desvío Peligroso","Habla con Spalvi en la pendiente por encima de Helegrod","Un grupo de Duramanos ha llegado a Helegrod, y su líder desea hablar contigo.","Bingo está dispuesto a ayudar a su nuevo amigo Spalvi a recuperar el tesoro robado por los nómadas Corcur y llevarlo a la fortaleza enana de Helegrod.","Bingo espera fuera de la gran puerta de Helegrod, esperando para hablar contigo.","Bingo está poco a poco subiendo las escaleras a la puerta de Helegrod, y deberías seguirle.","Habla con Bingo en lo alto de las escaleras","Bingo está en la pendiente nevada que lleva hasta la fortaleza enana de Helegrod.","Spalvi está en la pendiente nevada por encima de Helegrod.","Spalvi ha llegado a lo alto de los escalones, frente a la gran puerta de Helegrod.","Sobrevive al enfrentamiento con los Duramano","Bingo está siendo retenido por los Duramano a cambio de vuestro buen comportamiento.","Habla con el líder del grupo de los Duramano","Habla con Spalvi en lo alto de las escaleras","Sube las escaleras hacia Helegrod con Bingo","Spalvi te ha revelado que es un Duramano, y ahora estás en una situación complicada.","Dirígete a las escaleras que conducen a la puerta de Helegrod","La gran puerta de Helegrod se alza ante ti","Habla con Spalvi","Has derrotado un puñado de nómadas Corcur, pero Spalvi te ha dicho que entre ellos no reconoce a ninguno de los que le emboscaron.","Habla con Bingo","Habla con Bingo en la pendiente que conduce a Helegrod","Bingo sonríe de oreja a oreja, y te preguntas si hay algo que pueda disgustarle","Un campamento nómada de los Corcur se interpone entre vosotros y las enormes puertas de Helegrod.\
\
Spalvi y Bingo se reunirán contigo una vez llegues a la escalera principal."}},
[6704]={nameES="Instancia: Un camino peligroso",objectivesES={"Runald and his familly have prepared their waggon, said their farewells, and are ready to begin their dangerous journey south to Edoras.","The waggon has been destroyed!","Escort the waggon along the road","Do not allow Runald's waggon to be destroyed","Instancia: Un camino peligroso","Runald and his family have arrived safely at the trader's outpost along the road.\
\
Runald wishes to thank you for aiding his departure.","Talk to Runald","The waggon has arrived safely at the trader's outpost","Runald and his family await you at the southern entrance to the village of Elthengels."}},
[6705]={nameES="Instance: A Daring Escape",objectivesES={"Stanric wants you to rally the men of Stangard while he makes his way to the Mead Hall","Help Stanric out of his cell","Defend Stanric and defeat Sithric.","Stanric is alive, defying the lies of Sithric. It is clear that Stanric must be freed at once, so that justice may be done for this betrayal.","Instance: A Daring Escape","Stanric is in the lock-house of Stangard.","Athulf is in the tavern of Stangard with some equally suspicious men.","Stanric is now in the Mead Hall of Stangard.","Stanric is in the prison of Stangard.","Listen to Stanric's plan","Free Stanric from his bonds","Stanric is in the Mead Hall.","Stanric is in the lock-house.","Tell Athulf of Sithric's deception","Talk to Stanric","Rally the men in the inn","Help Stanric take down Sithric once and for all","The inn in Stangard is full of suspicious Rohirrim.","Stanric is free -- and now Sithric must pay for his crimes"}},
[6706]={nameES="Instancia: Un regalo oscuro",objectivesES={"Defeat the Barkhûshim!","You hear a cry behind you, and a voice calls out in challenge","Go with Razâl up the tower stairs to find Numûru and defeat All-seeing cultists.","Speak with Numûru in the Angar Aragín","Defeat Karâshna Zíri.","Find the other prisoners.","Speak with Razâl inside the Angar Aragín.","Free Numûru from his bonds.","<rgb=#ff0000>Razâl must not falter</rgb>","Speak with Razâl inside the Angar Aragín","Ascend the stairs and defeat the Barkhûshim guarding the other prisoners.","Free the third prisoner","Go with Razâl up the tower stairs to find Numûru","Find the other prisoners","You must move quickly into Angar Aragín to save Numûru!","Defeat Karâshna Zíri","Free Numûru from his bonds","Speak with Razâl","Speak with Razâl in the Angar Aragín.","Instancia: Un regalo oscuro","Free the prisoners.","Speak with Numûru in the Angar Aragín.","Free the second prisoner","Free the first prisoner","Razâl has faltered!"}},
[6707]={nameES="Instancia: Un Pacto Oscuro",objectivesES={"Azruthor and the Dead rush from the vale!","Gúrion is standing near the base of the Hill of Erech.\
\
You have arrived at the Hill of Erech and should now speak to Gúrion.","Gúrion is climbing the Hill of Erech.\
\
You should follow Gúrion toward the summit of the Hill of Erech.","Nerzus is standing at the Stone of Erech.\
\
You have followed Gúrion to the Hill's peak, and should now attempt to convince Nerzus and the Ruthless Dead of the invader's deception.","Steward Malthellam seeks to expose and oust the strange invader from Tarlang's Crown before he can rally the Dead to his cause.","DNT -- will not be seen","Gúrion is climbing the Hill of Erech.\
\
You have defeated the Dead again, but should now sprint to the Hill's peak in hopes of avoiding continued attacks by the Dead.","Talk to Nerzus","Follow Gúrion up the Hill of Erech","Talk to Gúrion","Gúrion is hiding near the peak of the Hill of Erech.\
\
You have reached a point close to the summit, and should now speak to Gúrion.","Observe the meeting of the Dead and Azruthor","Gúrion is at the peak of the Hill of Erech.\
\
You have defeated Nerzus once more, but many of the Dead have rallied to Azruthor's side in Tarlang's Crown.","Azruthor and Nerzus are at the Stone of Erech.\
\
You should watch the meeting between the invader and the Dead.","Follow Gúrion to the Hill's peak","Follow Gúrion further up the Hill of Erech","Defeat Nerzus","Gúrion is climbing the Hill of Erech.\
\
You have defeated the Dead that attacked you, and should continue up the hill.","<rgb=#FF0000>Gúrion has fallen!</rgb>","Instancia: Un Pacto Oscuro","<rgb=#FF0000>Gúrion must not be defeated</rgb>","Nerzus is at the Stone of Erech.\
\
You should defeat him before warning the people of Blackroot Vale of Azruthor's summoning of the Dead to Tarlang's Crown."}},
[6708]={nameES="Instancia: Una Defensa en la Oscuridad",objectivesES={"Habla con Andyri","Un Elfo ha caído en batalla. Has fallado como Vigilante.","Andyri está en la cueva de los trolls de piedra.\
\
Has protegido a los Elfos de Andyri mientras se recuperaban y ahora debes hablar con ella.","No permitas que ningún Elfo muera","Debes impedir que los Elfos sean derrotados mientras descansan tras sus batallas.","Defiende a los Elfos hasta que recuperen sus fuerzas","Has llegado a las cuevas de los trolls de piedra, cerca de Lin Giliath, para defender a los Elfos de Andyri mientras se recuperan de su dura batalla.","Instancia: Una Defensa en la Oscuridad","Andyri está esperando para hablar contigo dentro de las cuevas de los trolls de piedra."}},
[6709]={nameES="Instance: A Disturbance at the Gate",objectivesES={"Assist Gárwig in Forlaw","Speak with Gárwig at the gate.","Speak with Gárwig","Help Gárwig","Gárwig is in the Mead Hall of Forlaw.\
\
You should speak with Gárwig.","Gárwig is pale and breathless, his eyes wide in his shock at the cruel death of his remaining sons.\
\
'Why did it not take me instead? What does the creature want with us?\
\
'How can it be stopped?'","A disturbance at the west gate has come to the attention of the Reeve.","Assist Gárwig in Forlaw.","Follow Gárwig and speak with him","Instance: A Disturbance at the Gate"}},
[6710]={nameES="Instancia: Un Reflejo Vacilante",objectivesES={"Galadriel has stepped up to her Mirror and looks ready to gaze into it.","Hear what the Mirror shows","You have found a grave-faced Galadriel in her garden, by her Mirror, awaiting you.","Habla con Galadriel","You should approach Galadriel.","Galadriel seems to have seen all that she will see in the Mirror, tonight, and is ready to talk with you.","Galadriel is gazing into her Mirror. Stand by her and she will relate all that she sees.","Instancia: Un Reflejo Vacilante","Approach Galadriel"}},
[6711]={nameES="Instancia: Un Consejo Final",objectivesES={"Asiste al Concilio final","Habla con Glorfindel","Glorfindel te ha convocado a un último Concilio, que decidirá el destino de Narmeleth.'","Instancia: Un Consejo Final","Asistir al Concilio final.","Hablar con Glorfindel para volver a Rivendel."}},
[6712]={nameES="Instancia: Un ajuste de cuentas final",objectivesES={"After a moment, the eyes of all of the dwarves turn to Dáin","The Dwarves of the Haban'akkâ can be found at Durin's Stone.\
\
After Dáin revealed that he encountered Durin's Bane, the Dwarves of the Haban'akkâ have grown uneasy. You should calm them down.","As dawn breaks, you discover a great gathering of survivors at Durin's Stone","Thorin can be found at Durin's Stone.\
\
You have paid your respects to the other dwarf-kings. You should talk to Thorin at the central pyre at Durin's Stone.","Thorin can be found at Durin's Stone.\
\
After finding King Thráin lost in thought beside Kheled-zâram, he told you to return to Thorin and let his son know that he would soon return. You should talk to Thorin.","It appears Nár has quietly followed you to the gates of Khazad-dûm","As the dwarves again fall silent, King Thráin turns to Thorin","At first, King Thráin says nothing.\
\
After a moment, he straightens his beard and turns to the other survivors.","It appears King Thráin has returned to the pyres at last","Pay your respects to King Onúr and the Landorrim","Dáin can be found at Durin's Stone.\
\
After the lighting of the final pyres, the Sixth War of the Dwarves and Orcs has come to an end. You should talk to Dáin.","Talk to Thorin","The Kings of the Seven Houses have gathered at Durin's Stone.\
\
On the morn after the Battle of Azanulbizar, the Kings of the Seven Houses have again gathered to council. You should listen to the council of the Kings of the Seven Houses.","Nár can be found at the gates of Khazad-dûm.","Urge the Dwarves of the Haban'akkâ to remain <rgb=#FF00FF>calm</rgb>","Talk to Dáin","Talk to King Thráin","As smoke rises into the night sky above the dale, Dáin looks to you","<rgb=#FF00FF>Listen</rgb> to the council of the Kings of the Seven Houses","Surviving Dwarves of the Haban'akkâ have gathered at Durin's Stone.\
\
After a night of fitful rest, you have awoken to find the Dwarves of the Haban'akkâ gathered at Durin's Stone. You should join the gathering of survivors there.","King Thráin might be found by the banks of Kheled-zâram.\
\
After preparing the final pyres at Azanulbizar, Thorin has asked you to find King Thráin.","Rest at Durin's Stone","King Thráin can be found at the gates of Khazad-dûm.\
\
After Azog's defeat and the routing of the Orcs at Azanulbizar, King Thráin has returned to the gates of Khazad-dûm. You should talk to King Thráin.","Dáin can be found in the First Hall of Khazad-dûm.\
\
Dáin is recounting his tale of entering the First Hall of Khazad-dûm. You should talk to Dáin.","Wait for King Thráin","Pay your respects to King Drógar and the Narfanghoth","As King Thráin prepares to order the lighting of the pyres, he calls to you","King Thráin and Thorin can be found at Durin's Stone.\
\
King Thráin has asked Thorin what he believes should be done at Azanulbizar. You should listen to King Thráin and Thorin.","The pyres can be found at Durin's Stone.\
\
King Thráin has asked you to join him in lighting the final pyres at Durin's Stone.","The pyres can be found at Durin's Stone.","King Thráin can be found by the banks of Kheled-zâram near Durin's Stone.\
\
You have found King Thráin at the banks of Kheled-zâram. Speak with him.","Witness as Nár inspects the head of Azog","Follow King Thráin","The Battle of Azanulbizar has ended, but at unimaginable cost.","King Thráin can be found at Durin's Stone.\
\
You should talk to King Thráin.","King Thráin gazes into Kheled-zâram...","Pay your respects to King Ugún and the Kámbrada","Dáin can be found at Durin's Stone.\
\
Dáin has been forced to rebuke King Thráin with a tale of the aftermath of Azog's slaying. You should listen to Dáin.","Pay your respects to King Vékun and the Zhélruka","Without another word, Nár leaves","Listen to the council of the Kings of the Seven Houses","Pay your respects to King Shâlim and the Abnúzhu","As murmurs among the survivors fall silent, King Thráin begins to speak","King Thráin can be found at Durin's Stone.\
\
King Thráin has returned to Durin's Stone. You should wait for King Thráin to give the order to light the final pyres.","King Thráin can be found at Durin's Stone.\
\
After Thorin gave his counsel, King Thráin and the other Kings of the Seven Houses have agreed to the war's ending. You should talk to King Thráin.","The Kings of the Landorrim, Narfanghoth, Temámir, Kámbrada, Zhélruka, and Abnúzhu can be found at Durin's Stone.\
\
Before the final pyres are lit at Durin's Stone, Dáin has suggested that you pay your respects to the Kings of the Seven Houses. Afterward, Dáin has asked you to talk to Thorin.","Listen to Dáin's tale","As the other Kings of the Seven Houses nod in agreement, King Thráin falls silent","You should rest with King Thráin and the surviving Dwarves of the Haban'akkâ at Durin's Stone.","King Thráin can be found at the gates of Khazad-dûm.\
\
With the head of Azog prepared, King Thráin intends to send a warning to the Orcs of Moria. You should talk to King Thráin.","Nár says nothing.\
\
His face is stern, but it does little to mask the tears dried upon his cheeks.","Witness the lighting of the pyres at Durin's Stone","Among the survivors, you discover the Kings of the Seven Houses gathered in council","Nár can be found at the gates of Khazad-dûm.\
\
After King Thráin set Azog's head upon a stake, Nár has arrived at the gates of Khazad-dûm. You should talk to Nár.","Instancia: Un ajuste de cuentas final","Talk to Nár","Join the gathering of survivors at Durin's Stone","King Thráin can be found at the gates of Khazad-dûm.\
\
After witnessing Nár return the coin-purse to Azog, King Thráin has beckoned you over. You should talk to King Thráin.","Listen to King Thráin and Thorin","Aid King Thráin and light the pyres at Durin's Stone","King Thráin can be found at the gates of Khazad-dûm.","Dáin can be found at Durin's Stone.\
\
After the felling of trees and the raising of great pyres at Azanulbizar, the time has come to burn the fallen Kings and their guards at Durin's Stone.","King Thráin has set the Dwarves of the Haban'akkâ on a grim task. You should aid the Haban'akkâ.","Dáin can be found at Durin's Stone.\
\
After the other lords and Kings of the Seven Houses have expressed apprehension about continuing the war, King Thráin and the other dwarves have looked to Dáin. You should speak with him now.","Dáin and Thorin stand beside a newly-set stake at the gates of Khazad-dûm","Aid the Haban'akkâ","Witness as King Thráin places Azog's head upon a stake at Khazad-dûm","As Dain finishes his tale, King Thráin sighs and murmurs rise among the survivors","Find King Thráin at Kheled-zâram","Pay your respects to King Jegín and the Temámir","Listen to Dáin","Dáin is recounting the tale of what he saw in the First Hall of Khazad-dûm."}},
[6713]={nameES="Instancia: Una venganza final",objectivesES={"Golodir felled the mighty Thrúgrath, but his body is broken and he will not survive.","Golodir has gone ahead. Can you find him before it is too late?","Habla con Corunir","Find Golodir","Despite his broken body, Golodir smiles at you","Corunir mourns the loss of his friend on the Pelennor.","Corunir hopes that you will be able to find Golodir before he comes to harm.","You have come with Corunir to an outpost on the Pelennor where the fighting has been thick.","<rgb=#FF0000>Corunir must not be defeated</rgb>","Instancia: Una venganza final","Habla con Golodir"}},
[6714]={nameES="Instancia: Un Vuelo de Dragonzuelos",objectivesES={"Debes ahuyentar a la bandada de dragonzuelos que han descendido sobre las ruinas élficas de Pembar desde la cima de Zirakzigil. Si lo consigues, los elfos te permitirán usar la antigua forja de las ruinas y así potenciar el granate imbuido que llevas contigo.","Derrotado Dragonzuelo alado recién nacido","Derrotada Rimlúg la Madre Alada","Derrota a Rimlúg la Madre Alada","Derrotado Dragonzuelo alado joven","Instancia: Un Vuelo de Dragonzuelos","La enfurecida Madre Alada ha descendido al patio en el centro de las ruinas. Enfréntate a ella y derrótala para expulsar a los dragonzuelos de las ruinas para siempre.","Usa el yunque antiguo","Habla con Perimbant para volver a Echad Dúnann.","Caza a los dragonzuelos más jóvenes evitando a sus hermanos mayores.","Usa la antigua forja para potenciar tu granate imbuido.","Habla con Perimbant"}},
[6715]={nameES="Instancia: Una queja formal",objectivesES={"Instancia: Una queja formal","Hob Cimacolina ha usado su llave de repuesto para dejarte entrar en el gran agujero de Dwaling. Te ha pedido que entregues la queja formal redactada por Ronald Dwalkien a los rufianes, usando la fuerza si es necesario.","La queja ha sido resuelta","Hob Cimacolina te ha pedido que te enfrentes a Will Tuffin, el líder de la gente grande en Dwaling, con su carta.","Entrega la queja formal"}},
[6716]={nameES="Instance: A Game of Brigand-bashing",objectivesES={}},
[6717]={nameES="Instancia: Un regalo para el futuro",objectivesES={"Defeat the roc huntress","You have joined Gôbezhir to present the axe he made to Mêshaget. You should talk to Gôbezhir.","The roc huntress is defeated","Watch Gôbezhir present the weapon to Mêshaget","As you watched Gôbezhir give the weapon to Mêshaget, your company was attacked by a roc huntress. You should defeat the roc attacking you.","You have joined Gôbezhir to present the axe he made to Mêshaget. You watch Gôbezhir give the weapon to its recipient.","You're under attack!","Gôbezhir Firmhand, master smith of Jiret-menêsh, has decided to give his life's masterwork as a gift to Mêshaget.","Instancia: Un regalo para el futuro","As you watched Gôbezhir give the weapon to Mêshaget, your company was attacked by a roc huntress. Together, you and Mêshaget defeated the aggressive avian. You should talk to Mêshaget.","Talk to Mêshaget","Talk to Gôbezhir"}},
[6718]={nameES="Instancia: Un regalo para el norte",objectivesES={"Has viajado con Ulfar hasta las afueras del campamento de los enanos en el Pantano de los Juncos. Allí esperas poner fin al plan del enano Olwir de capturar un troll de piedra y dárselo como regalo al enano Skorgrím en el norte.","Ulfar te ha dicho que continúes, más adentro en el campamento de los enanos, sin él, y que mates al troll de piedra si encuentras uno.\
\
Ulfar fue herido en la lucha y no pudo seguir contigo. Sin embargo, te dijo que el troll de piedra debe ser eliminado y que estés atento a Olwir, ya que seguramente intentará impedir que mates a la bestia.","Habla con Ulfar","Habla con Ulfar y luego defiéndelo mientras se adentra más en el campamento de los enanos.","Ulfar ha sido herido en la batalla. Habla con él para ver qué quiere que hagas.","Con el troll de piedra y Olwir muertos, regresa con el herido Ulfar y cuéntale lo que ha pasado.","Instancia: Un regalo para el norte","Mata al troll de piedra"}},
[6719]={nameES="Instancia: Un atisbo de luz diurna",objectivesES={"Give the bottle of Khôrob for Gúrumkir","Let Mizâdi know you have helped the wounded.","You've found an unattended, mostly full bottle of Khôrob","Listen to Mizâdi and Amalíbi's conversation","Speak with several of the wounded soldiers in Amalíbi's camp and ask if they require aid.","Comfort Jínsa in Amalíbi's encampment","Speak with Mizâdi in Amalíbi's camp","Instancia: Un atisbo de luz diurna","Gather fresh bandages for Zagêli","Help Amalíbi's wounded with their various needs.","Give the fresh bandages to Zagêli","Enter Amalíbi's encampment near Iridír","This crate is filled with fresh cloth, wraps, and bandages","Listen to Jínsa's story","A small moment of peace has given Mizâdi time to speak with Amalíbi, to see the consequences of her decisions.","Speak with Jínsa in Amalíbi's camp","Let Mizâdi know you have helped the wounded","Speak with Zagêli in Amalíbi's camp","Listen to Mizâdi and Amalíbi's conversation.","Give the fresh bandages to Zagêli and the Khôrob to Gúrumkir in Amalíbi's camp.","Enter Amalíbi's encampment near Iridír.","Speak with Mizâdi in Amalíbi's camp.","Comfort Jínsa in Amalíbi's encampment.","Ask to hear Jínsa's story","Find a bottle of Khôrob for Gúrumkir","Speak with Gúrumkir in Amalíbi's camp"}},
[6720]={nameES="Instancia: Un poder mayor",objectivesES={"Remain on guard during the confrontation with Azagath","Talk to Khôltekh","Khôltekh glances at you briefly but says nothing. All of his attention is fastened upon Azagath.","Servants of the Thardúth await you at Utug-bûr.","Mithrandir and your companions prepare to confront the Thardúth.","Talk to Rothog","Azagath Sea-shadow has suggested that his former allies among the Kindred of the Coins join his new cause.","Your companions stand opposed to Azagath Sea-shadow and the Thardúth he now serves.","The time has come for you and your companions to confront the Thardúth at Utug-bûr.","Confront Azagath in front of Utug-bûr","Talk to Mithrandir in front of the waterfall","Instancia: Un poder mayor"}},
[6721]={nameES="Instancia: El deber del guardián",objectivesES={"Instancia: El deber del guardián","Severin Rodador está junto al Puente de Caballetes.\
\
Severin Rodador está esperando asignarte tu posición en la defensa del pueblo.","Has defendido Puente de Caballetes de los orcos saqueadores.","Severin Rodador ha solicitado tu ayuda en la defensa de Puente de Caballetes. El pueblo está muy presionado por los orcos, y se necesitan guardianes para evitar que crucen hacia las Tierras de Bree.","Habla con los defensores de Puente de Caballetes.","Hilton Harper está fuera de Puente de Caballetes.\
\
Hilton Harper está esperando hablar contigo sobre tu defensa del pueblo.","Severin Rodador te dijo que varios hombres han venido a ayudar en la defensa de Puente de Caballetes.\
\
Antes de partir para ayudar a un grupo de granjeros atrapados en las Quebradas del Norte, Severin Rodador te encargó mantener alejados del puente a cualquier orco saqueador. Deberías hablar con los hombres cercanos para asignarles sus posiciones.","Hilton Harper está frente al Puente de Caballetes.\
\
Hilton Harper está esperando hablar contigo sobre la organización de la defensa de Puente de Caballetes.","Habla con Hilton Harper"}},
[6722]={nameES="Instancia: Una Comida Ganada con Esfuerzo",objectivesES={"Gather dishes from the hutch","Fuirion's blood begins to form a pool on the floor, and it is clear that he has sustained a deep slash-wound in his belly","Fuirion is at Gladion's doorstep.\
\
You should examine Fuirion.","Examine Fuirion","Find out what the commotion is all about","The table is in Gladion and Limril's home.\
\
You should gather dishes from the hutch, and set the table.","Limril is in her home in Dínadab in northern Lamedon.\
\
You should see what else Limril needs.","You should set the table for Limril","Instancia: Una Comida Ganada con Esfuerzo","Offer to help Limril with dinner while she waits for Fuirion to arrive","Limril is in her home in Dínadab in northern Lamedon.\
\
You should offer to help Limril with dinner while she waits for Fuirion.","The peace is broken by the sound of the door banging open","The hutch is in the corner.\
\
You should gather dishes from the hutch, and set the table.","Gladion kneels at the door with his brother in his arms.\
\
You should ask Gladion what happened to his brother Fuirion.","Talk to Limril","You should help by setting the table","While waiting for Fuirion to arrive, Limril has asked you to help with dinner."}},
[6723]={nameES="Instancia: Una casa forjada de nuevo",objectivesES={"Talk to King Greytooth","Tell King Greytooth the <rgb=#FF00FF>story</rgb> of the Ring-bearer's quest","King Greytooth is standing in Lûghash. You should tell him of your many tales of valour, especially those you shared with Gimli.","Follow Gimli and join King Greytooth among the Stout-axes of Lûghash","King Greytooth is eager to hear tales of valour from you and Gimli. You should not keep him waiting.","Instancia: Una casa forjada de nuevo","Tell King Greytooth the <rgb=#FF00FF>story</rgb> of the battles of the Hornburg and of the Pelennor Fields","Gimli is addressing King Greytooth in Lûghash. You should listen to his tale.","You have come to Zôreth's chamber with King Greytooth and the Stout-axes. You should now speak to him and confront the Mistress of Lûghash.","King Greytooth is standing in Zôreth's chamber in Lûghash.\
\
Despite freeing his people from the Mistress of Lûghash, King Greytooth appears more troubled than ever. You should speak to him.","Spakorth has noticed a peculiar key upon a necklace worn by King Greytooth. King Greytooth is willing to speak of it, but wishes to do so privately.","As he stands above Spakorth, a grim fury washes across King Váskmun's face","Defeat the fell spirit that was inhabiting Spakorth","Zôreth is standing in her chamber. You should join King Greytooth and the Stout-axes in confronting her and putting an end to her treachery.","With a fateful swing of Dolgráth the Battle-hungry, King Váskmun Greytooth slays Zôreth...","Sversting, the master-smith of Lûghash, has crafted a keen axe for King Greytooth and now wishes to present it to him.","King Greytooth is standing above the defeated Spakorth. You should speak to him and learn what is to be done.","Listen to Gimli tell the tale of Smaug and the Battle of Five Armies","Spakorth attempted to steal the key from King Greytooth, and after being thwarted, a fell spirit has risen from him. Spakorth lies wounded, but the fell spirit appears unharmed.","Confront Zôreth","Overjoyed by the return of their King, Váskmun Greytooth, the Stout-axes of Lûghash have asked you and Gimli to share your tales of valour among the Free Peoples that they might learn more of the world beyond Mordor.","Follow King Greytooth and learn of his secret","Witness Sversting present his tribute to King Greytooth","Habla con Gimli","Gimli is standing in Lûghash.\
\
King Greytooth has asked you and Gimli to share your tales of valour with him and his folk that he might learn of the path that led you to Mordor.","Tell King Greytooth the <rgb=#FF00FF>story</rgb> of Skorgrím and of the lost Dwarf-kingdom of Khazad-dûm"}},
[6724]={nameES="Instancia: Encargo de Cazadora",objectivesES={"Gytha Lainey está en el camino fuera de Sobrecolina.\
\
Has venido a Sobrecolina con Gytha Lainey para proteger a su gente del peligro que los amenaza. Gytha está esperando para hablar contigo sobre cómo proceder.","Gytha Lainey está en Sobrecolina.\
\
Has derrotado con éxito a la partida de caza de Huargos que se adentró en el Bosque del Fardo y ahora deberías hablar de tu victoria con Gytha Lainey.","Has viajado con Gytha Lainey a la aldea de Sobrecolina, en la Comarca, para defender a su gente de los estragos de un grupo de Huargos que merodea desde el norte.","Gytha Lainey está en la aldea de Sobrecolina.\
\
Ahora que has advertido a los habitantes de Sobrecolina que entren en sus casas, tú y Gytha deben detener a los Huargos invasores.","Los habitantes de Sobrecolina siguen con sus quehaceres, ajenos al peligro que acecha en algún lugar al norte de su aldea.\
\
Gytha te ha dicho que adviertas a los habitantes de Sobrecolina que permanezcan dentro de sus casas hasta que el peligro haya pasado.","Habla con Gytha Lainey","Habla con los habitantes de Sobrecolina","Instancia: Encargo de Cazadora"}},
[6725]={nameES="Instancia: Un viaje hacia el peligro",objectivesES={"If the driver moves away, it should be safe to depart the waggon.","Rahâzi is hidden inside the waggon.","You hear the crunching of footsteps beside the waggon","Talk to Rahâzi inside the waggon","<rgb=#00FF00>Listen</rgb> for anyone who might approach","Stand near the back of the waggon","You should stand near the back of the waggon and <rgb=#00FF00>listen</rgb> for anyone to approach too near.","The driver has returned to the side of the waggon","Instancia: Un viaje hacia el peligro","Wait for the driver to leave before departing the waggon","Do not move, and make no noise!","It will be some time before the waggon arrives. Now you can only wait.","Pass the time while the waggon rumbles to its destination","Together, you and Rahâzi have snuck aboard a waggon carrying supplies and must remain hidden from the Temámir who drives it.","Try not to move or make any noise"}},
[6726]={nameES="Instancia: Un viaje en barco",objectivesES={"Listen to Horn tell his story of King Fengel.","Corudan is waiting to speak with you beside the river where you have stopped for the night.","Horn is sitting by the fire.","Corudan is sitting by the camp-fire.","Talk to Horn by the camp-fire","Instancia: Un viaje en barco","Horn and Nona are sitting on opposite sides of the camp-fire by the Anduin.","Nona is sitting by the camp-fire, waiting to tell her story.","You have travelled by boat down the Anduin in the company of Nona, Horn, and Corudan, but must camp for the night before you proceed further.","Nona is telling a story by the camp-fire.","Talk to Corudan and decide upon a tale to share","Talk to Corudan","Talk to Nona by the camp-fire","Listen to Nona's story","Talk to Corudan by the camp-fire","Listen to Horn's story","Corudan is by the camp-fire, waiting to speak with you.","Horn is waiting to finish the story of King Fengel and Wyrgende the crone."}},
[6727]={nameES="Instancia: Un Entierro Justo",objectivesES={"Speak with Herion","<rgb=#FF0000>Kneel</rgb> before the brave warriors to pay your respects","You kneel in silence at the loss of this brave Gondorian warrior","Erchar is saddened by his decisions","Erchar is at the battleground.\
\
You should speak with Erchar.","Instancia: Un Entierro Justo","Listen to the conversation between Erchar and Herion.","<rgb=#FF0000>Kneel</rgb> before this brave warrior and pay your respects","Erchar and Herion return to the site of the battle that drove them apart and pay their respects before the returning journey to Linhir.","Herion is at the battleground.\
\
You should speak with Herion.","<rgb=#FF0000>Kneel</rgb> before the brave warrior to pay your respects","The bodies of Gondorian warriors slain by the Corsair forces can be found at the battleground.\
\
You should cover the bodies with soil and pay your respects.","Herion grows restless and wants to return to Linhir","Speak with Erchar","Erchar and Herion meet at the battleground.\
\
You should speak to Erchar.","Erchar and Herion meet at the battleground.\
\
You should listen to the conversation between Erchar and Herion."}},
[6728]={nameES="Instancia: Un rey debe ver su reino",objectivesES={"Talk to King Elessar in the Tower of Ecthelion","Glindor has brought you to the Tower of Ecthelion, where King Elessar and Queen Arwen await you.","King Elessar and his advisors discuss his plan to tour the kingdom and heal the hurts caused by the war.","Instancia: Un rey debe ver su reino","King Elessar is ready to speak with you about his plans.","Talk to Thalhír in the Tower of Ecthelion","Listen to the discussion of the Heirs of Castamir","Talk to Glindor in the Tower of Ecthelion","Thalhír, the Warden of Laws, is in the Tower of Ecthelion and has been called to answer whether the Heirs of Castamir remain a threat to the peace of Gondor.","Talk to Queen Arwen in the Tower of Ecthelion","Listen to the discussion of King Elessar's plans","Queen Arwen is in the Tower of Ecthelion and wishes to speak with you about a special task.","King Elessar has summoned you to the Tower of Ecthelion in Minas Tirith, where he wishes to discuss his plans with you.","King Elessar is in the Tower of Ecthelion, waiting to hear if you will agree to this new plan."}},
[6729]={nameES="Instancia: Una Vida Pende de un Hilo",objectivesES={"Defend yourself against the attacking Corsairs.","Gladion is at the Corsair encampment in northern Lamedon.\
\
You should speak with Gladion.","Gladion's anguish is severe. It is best that you return to Dínadab....","Speak with Gladion","Instancia: Una Vida Pende de un Hilo","Fuirion's life hangs on a thread, and Hebil, a cruel Corsair captain, stands in the way of his rescue.","Defend yourself against the attacking Corsairs","Speak with Hebil","Hebil stands over Fuirion in the middle of the corsairs' encampment.\
\
You should speak with Hebil.","Fuirion has collapsed!","Hebil stands over Fuirion in the middle of the corsairs' encampment.","Try to reason with Hebil"}},
[6730]={nameES="Instancia: Una apelación lógica",objectivesES={"Wait until Sithric is gone, then speak with Stanric","Now that you have assessed the hardships of Stangard, it is time to make an appeal to the leaders for change.","Sithric is in the Mead Hall at Stangard.","Watch the discussion in the Mead Hall.","See what Gadda plans to do","Sithric has warned you to keep out of Stangard's affairs","Instancia: Una apelación lógica","Gadda stands with you in the Mead Hall of Stangard.\
\
You should speak with Gadda.","Watch the discussion","Stanric is in the Mead Hall at Stangard.","Address your observations to Stanric when he is ready to hear you","Sithric is in the Mead Hall of Stangard.","Observe the leaders' discussion","You should observe the discussion between the leaders of Stangard.","Talk to Sithric","Talk to Stanric","Stanric is in the Mead Hall.\
\
You should speak with Stanric about what you saw in Stangard.","Sithric is out of earshot -- you should speak with Stanric again"}},
[6731]={nameES="Instancia: Muy Lejos de Gondor",objectivesES={"Habla con Boromir y escucha lo que tiene que decir sobre el viaje","Habla con Boromir y escucha lo que tiene que decir sobre su viaje","Instancia: Muy Lejos de Gondor","Habla con Boromir y escucha lo que tiene que decir sobre la misión","Considera a Háma, Portero de Théoden","Denethor, el Senescal de Gondor, lucha con muchas dificultades.","Escucha el relato de Boromir sobre su viaje","Escucha el relato de Boromir","Habla con Boromir y escucha lo que tiene que decir sobre el resto del viaje","Considera a Éomer, Mariscal de la Marca","En junio, Boromir y su hermano Faramir fueron convocados por su padre, el Senescal de Gondor, a la Torre Blanca.","Considera a Gríma Lengua de Serpiente","Alguien inesperado dejó su hogar para hablar con Boromir cerca del Paso de Rohan.","Habla con Boromir y escucha lo que tiene que decir sobre Rohan","Aunque se le negó una audiencia con Théoden, Boromir habló con varios miembros de su corte.","Considera a Éowyn, Dama de Rohan","Considera a Théodred, heredero de Théoden","Boromir continúa el relato de su viaje.","Boromir ha aceptado contarte el relato de su viaje desde Gondor.","Habla con Boromir y escucha lo que tiene que decir sobre Gondor"}},
[6732]={nameES="Instancia: La Voluntad de un Sabio",objectivesES={"Instancia: La Voluntad de un Sabio","Observa a Isferon abrir las cajas y descubrir sus secretos.","Isferon está de pie dentro de la cueva.\
\
Isferon está abriendo las cajas que le dejó Berenin.","Isferon está de pie dentro de la cueva.\
\
Isferon ha abierto las tres cajas que le dejó su amigo Berenin cuando zarpó hacia el Oeste.","Has llegado a la cueva donde Isferon ha estado guardando las cajas que le dejó Berenin.","Isferon está de pie dentro de la cueva.\
\
Isferon está esperando para hablar contigo antes de abrir las tres cajas y descubrir qué secretos le dejó su amigo Berenin cuando zarpó hacia el Oeste."}},
[6733]={nameES="Instancia: Cuestión de linaje",objectivesES={"You study some of the scrolls in this pile, but it avails you little","Mithrandir is in the Old Archives.","None of these books mention Eärnur's name, as far as you can tell","Mithrandir is in the Old Archives, and he bears a worried expression.","You study many of the rolled scrolls, but find nothing relevant","You have found a book detailing the lineage of the Kings and the Stewards of Gondor, and should show it to Mithrandir.","You have come with Mithrandir to the Old Archives of Minas Tirith, in order to help the Wizard piece together something that has troubled him.","You have found a scroll bearing Eärnur's name in many locations, and should show it to Mithrandir.","The books are falling apart, and you handle them gingerly but find little of note","You unroll a number of the old scrolls, but nothing catches your eye","Talk to Mithrandir in the Old Archives","You find a dusty tome containing records of the Kings and Stewards","This pile of scrolls does not contain the information you seek","You pull many of the books at random, but do not find anything useful","Listen to Mithrandir in the Old Archives","Mithrandir has asked you to search one of the chambers in the Old Archives for mention of Eärnur, the last King of Gondor.","Mithrandir is inside the Old Archives.","Mithrandir is in the Old Archives of Minas Tirith.","Show the book you found to Mithrandir in the Old Archives","Search the Old Archives for mention of Eärnur","Instancia: Cuestión de linaje","You find a yellowed scroll that bears Eärnur's name many times throughout","Mithrandir has asked you to search another of the chambers in the Old Archives for mention of Eärnur, the last King of Gondor.","Show the Eärnur scroll to Mithrandir in the Old Archives","The pages of these books are very faded, and tell you nothing of interest"}},
[6734]={nameES="Instancia: Una comida en Cormallen",objectivesES={"Listen to Frodo's answer to the complaint.","Approach the table","Habla con Merry","You should approach the table, where the four hobbits have already begun.","Habla con Frodo","Habla con Sam","Eat or drink","Habla con Pippin","Pippin wishes to speak to you.","You should join in the meal and partake of the food and drink laid out on the table.","You should help yourself to some more food and drink while the four friends talk.","You should hear what Sam says for himself.","You should hear what Pippin says to Frodo.","You have gone down with Pippin and Merry to Cormallen, to share a meal with Sam and Frodo, who have been spending their days there.","Instancia: Una comida en Cormallen","Enjoy the hobbits' company","Hear Merry's reply to Frodo."}},
[6735]={nameES="Instancia: Una reparación",objectivesES={"Sigileth wipes the tears from her eyes.\
\
'I have said my part. I believe Silirtas heard my words... but I cannot know for certain.'","<rgb=#00FF00>Hail</rgb> the spirit, if spirit it be","Learn the severity of Corudan's injuries","The wound Nakási gave to my brother was deep; it worsened with travel, soaking through our makeshift bandages.","Hear what Cúridwan had to say of the unnatural chill","Listen to Sigileth's account","Ask Sigileth what she believes happened","Follow Sigileth's account of her return from the Fearwater","Hear what Cúridwan had to say about Corudan's injuries","Sigileth wishes to tell you about her return from the Fearwater with her brother and Cúridwan.","Hear what Corudan had to say","Hear what Sigileth believed of the spirit","<rgb=#00FF00>Shiver</rgb> at the thought of the unnatural cold","Hear the remainder of Sigileth's account","Sigileth describes her return from the Fearwater with her brother and Cúridwan.","Instancia: Una reparación"}},
[6736]={nameES="Instancia: Un mensaje en Mithril",objectivesES={"Talk to Prince Ingór","Habla con Stóthkell","Instancia: Un mensaje en Mithril","Hear Thettmárr's dying words","Talk to Imák","Thettmárr has suffered grievous injury at the hands of the attacking Orcs, and will not long survive.","It is too late. Stóthkell is dead.","On your return to Máttugard with Imák and Venko, you discover that the dwarves at Maergrind are under attack by the forces of Gorgar!","Venko and Imák are ready to join the fight!","Imák knows there is no time to spend on grief.","Talk to Venko","Mantente en guardia","Gorgar has emerged from the ranks of the Orcs to challenge the dwarves for control of Gundabad!","Prince Ingór requests your help in the middle of the battle.","Stóthkell has been grievously wounded by the mithril hammer wielded by Gorgar the Ruthless, and will not long survive."}},
[6737]={nameES="Instancia: La esperanza de un juglar",objectivesES={"Leigh Putnam está dentro de la cueva de los refugiados.\
\
Has ayudado en la defensa de los refugiados, y ahora Leigh desea hablar contigo.","Habla con Severin Rodador","Habla con Leigh Putnam","Has viajado a una cueva cercana con Leigh Putnam para ayudar a levantar el ánimo de los refugiados que buscan refugio allí y convencerlos de que Puente de Caballete sería un lugar más seguro para esconderse.","Severin Rodador ha llegado a la cueva con malas noticias.\
\
Has intentado convencer a los refugiados de que vayan a la relativa seguridad de Puente de Caballete, pero se negaron.","Los refugiados se esconden en el fondo de la cueva.\
\
Leigh Putnam te ha pedido que intentes levantar el ánimo de los refugiados que se esconden en la cueva y que los convenzas de ir a Puente de Caballete.","Instancia: La esperanza de un juglar","Leigh Putnam está justo dentro de la entrada de la cueva.\
\
Has viajado con Leigh a la cueva donde los refugiados buscan refugio de los ataques de Orcos.","Habla con los refugiados escondidos en la cueva"}},
[6738]={nameES="Instancia: Una Necesidad de Palabras",objectivesES={"Aragorn stands atop the wall, ready to speak to the worried defenders.","Help Aragorn to bolster the spirits of the defenders on the wall","Aragorn is atop the Deeping Wall, and wishes to speak with you.","The Men of Rohan stand ready to defend the Deeping Wall, but Aragorn fears the vast extent of Saruman's forces will cause them to despair.","Instancia: Una Necesidad de Palabras","Thurketel stands atop the wall. Did Aragorn's words help him recover his hope?","Talk to Aragorn atop the wall","Worried defenders can be found atop the wall, and Aragorn has asked you to send them to him for encouraging words.","Talk to Thurketel atop the wall","The men of Rohan need inspiring words if they are to stand against Saruman's forces."}},
[6739]={nameES="Instance: A New Post",objectivesES={}},
[6740]={nameES="Instancia: Una noche de historias de fantasmas",objectivesES={"Busca otro Boffin para que cuente una historia de miedo","Elige a uno de los Boffins para que cuente una historia de miedo","Bingo y su ribera de primos se han reunido a la orilla de los Campos Verdes para compartir historias espeluznantes y celebrar el espíritu del Festival de la Cosecha.","Instancia: Una noche de historias de fantasmas","Mantente alerta para encontrar una cura a las malditas botas","Escucha las historias espeluznantes con los Boffin","Los numerosos primos de Bingo tienen historias a hacer miedo para compartir, y es tu turno de elegir quién va a contar la siguiente.","Bingo está de pie cerca de la hoguera, al borde de los Campos Verdes, con sus muchos primos.","Los muchos primos de Bingo quieren contar historias a hacer miedo, y es a ti a quien le toca elegir quién empezará.","Bingo tiene una historia espeluznante que contar.","Ayuda a Esmeralda a quitarse los zapatos malditos","Bingo se encuentra cerca de la hoguera, a la orilla de los Campos Verdes.","Habla con Bingo junto a la hoguera","Escucha las historias a hacer miedo con los Boffin","Habla con Bingo para escuchar su historia espeluznante","Las llamas danzantes de la hoguera iluminan los rostros de los Boffin, y un silencio siniestro se apodera del lugar."}},
[6741]={nameES="Instancia: Una separación",objectivesES={"Habla con Ravaedron frente a la Cabaña del Helechal","Acompaña a Ravaedron mientras se despide","Habla con Maddoc Astaciervo dentro de la Cabaña del Helechal","Maddoc Astaciervo te ha dado la bienvenida a la Cabaña del Helechal.","Glenys Astaciervo te ha dado la bienvenida a su hogar.","Visita a los Astaciervo mientras Ravaedron se despide","Ravaedron se encuentra frente a la Cabaña del Helechal, el hogar de sus amigos los Astaciervo.","Instancia: Una separación","Ravaedron te ha pedido que lo acompañes a despedirse de sus amigos, los Astaciervo, antes de abandonar la Tierra Media para siempre.","Habla con Maddoc Astaciervo","Habla con Glenys Astaciervo dentro de la Cabaña del Helechal","Quédate junto a Ravaedron y ofrécele el consuelo que necesita mientras se despide.","El ambiente se ha enfriado dentro de la Cabaña del Helechal.\
\
Maddoc Astaciervo te hace un gesto para que hables con él."}},
[6742]={nameES="Instancia: Un asunto personal",objectivesES={"Nabatínu has asked you for the personal favour of checking on the welfare of his wife, Kugâna, a Jatsakóri still under the thrall of the Bokhóri sorceresses.","Another group is arriving at Gebarakór. You should move closer to hear what they are saying.","You spot her, alive, but not well","This is close enough","Instancia: Un asunto personal","You have travelled with Faeron to Gebarakór, the Ordâkhai open-pit mine. You should talk to Faeron.","<rgb=#FF0000>Look</rgb> for Kugâna among the workers","Observe the conversation","Move closer to the Ordâkhai","Talk to Faeron","Another group has arrived at Gebarakór. You should listen in on what they are saying.","You witnessed the arrival of Ombátha, the leader of the Bokhóri, sorcerers with the ability to ensnare Men's will. You should <rgb=#FF0000>look</rgb> for Kugâna, Nabatínu's wife, among the assembled workers."}},
[6743]={nameES="Instancia: Un lugar para los hobbits",objectivesES={"Enjoy the meal","These rooms would make handsome quarters for a Hobbit, if restored","Join Merry and Pippin in enjoying the makeshift meal.","Instancia: Un lugar para los hobbits","Help Pippin and Merry gather the things needed for a makeshift meal.","Habla con Merry","Habla con Gandalf","You should bring the things you collected to the table.","Habla con Pippin","Explore the kitchens","Explore the side quarters","Little remains of ovens or cookery, but the kitchens must have been fine and well-provisioned, once","Pippin and Merry have come running back with their own findings.","There are spaces that might have been dining areas and studies off here... is that an overgrown garden beyond?","Explore Bâr Thorenion with Merry and Pippin.","Gandalf has invited everyone to step in and see Bâr Thorenion. You should talk to Merry and Pippin and hear what they think of it all.","Talk to Pippin in the central courtyard, now that you have all explored Bâr Thorenion.","After the question of whether they should go into Mordor, Gandalf announced he had something - or rather some-place - to show Pippin and Merry.","Little but the kitchens lead off of this way","Explore the north passage","Explore the central courtyard","Gandalf has led you to Bâr Thorenion in North Ithilien, cut into a high place above Cormallen. \
\
You should talk to Gandalf to hear more about Bâr Thorenion.","Explore the southern passage","The central pool must have been lovely when it was clean and clear","Lay the things about the table"}},
[6744]={nameES="Instance: A Prisoner to Stangard",objectivesES={"Sithric stands beside Stanric in the Stangard Mead Hall.\
\
Sithric wishes to discuss the capture of the Uruk and respond to Stanric's judgement.","Talk to Gadda about the Uruk's fate","Talk to Stanric about the Uruk's fate","Stanric stands at the head of the Stangard mead hall.\
\
Stanric wishes to discuss the capture of Dargum, and decide an appropriate course of action.","Talk to Sithric about the Uruk's fate","Talk to Odda","Dargum has been bound and brought before the leaders of Stangard. They will decide his fate and what should be done about this new-found threat.","Stanric and Sithric are preparing to discuss the matters at hand","Gadda stands before Stanric and Sithric in the Mead Hall.\
\
Gadda wishes to discuss the result of Stanric and Sithric's council.","Odda is waiting to speak with you inside the Stangard Mead Hall.","Instance: A Prisoner to Stangard"}},
[6745]={nameES="Instancia: Una promesa cumplida",objectivesES={"Make your way through the tunnel to the Skarháld throne room","Karazgar has cut a swath of destruction through the Dwarves of Skarháld, but you may still have a chance to stop him.","Gandalf awaits the mask of Karazgar.","Karazgar has come to Skarháld in fulfilment of his second promise.","A pitched battle was fought in the throne room only recently","Pick up the mask of Karazgar","Kámat breathes his last","Karazgar has escaped, but he left his mask behind.","The Dwarves of Skarháld are in danger! You must hurry through the escape tunnel carved behind the fortress if you are to reach them before it is too late!","Karazgar has left the keep. If you hurry you might still be able to save some of the Dwarves of Skarháld.","Stand with Gandalf in defence of the Dwarves of Skarháld","Bring the mask of Karazgar to Gandalf","Instancia: Una promesa cumplida","Find and confront Karazgar","Talk to Kámat in the throne room","The tunnel behind Skarháld has been cleared by an unknown interloper. Can it be that Karazgar has come to fulfil his promise?","The mask is cold to the touch","Kámat has been seriously wounded and is near death.","Hurry to the exit of the keep and you may still save some lives"}},
[6746]={nameES="Instancia: Una promesa cumplida",objectivesES={"Join Raphûz by the fire","Tell Raphûz you do not think him a fool with <rgb=#00FF00>no</rgb>","Over tea and a smoke, Raphûz tells you why he joined the Tale-wardens and recalls the story of his family.","<rgb=#00FF00>Bow</rgb> to Raphûz and take your leave","Instancia: Una promesa cumplida","Conclude your discussion with Raphûz","<rgb=#00FF00>Cough</rgb> at Raphûz, alerting him to your difficulty with his device","Raphûz offers a seat by the fire.","<rgb=#00FF00>Smoke</rgb> with Raphûz","<rgb=#00FF00>Sit</rgb> with Raphûz by the fire","You used Raphûz's hookah, but the experience is different than smoking with your pipe.","Join Raphûz by the fire.","Raphûz suggested you share his tobacco.","Raphûz smiled as you approached and asked you to join him","Smoke with Raphûz's device","Continue conversing with Raphûz.","You continue listening to Raphûz's story. You should share a smoke with him using your pipe.","The evening grows long. Perhaps it is time to retire."}},
[6747]={nameES="Instancia: Una comida tranquila",objectivesES={"Overcome with emotion, Limril has become upset and Gladion is concerned for her.","Instancia: Una comida tranquila","Gather dishes from the hutch","Help Limril by setting the table","Limril is in her home in Dínadab in northern Lamedon.\
\
You should offer to help Limril with dinner while she waits for Gladion.","You have helped prepare for dinner, and should now wait for the meal to begin.","Talk to Gladion","Limril is in her home in Dínadab in northern Lamedon.\
\
You should see what else Limril needs.","You should set the table for Limril","The peace is broken by the sound of the door opening","Offer to help Limril with dinner","Limril has asked you to help with dinner.","The hutch is in the corner.\
\
Gather dishes from the hutch, and set the table.","The table is in Gladion and Limril's home.\
\
Gather dishes from the hutch, and set the table.","Wait for the meal to begin","Talk to Limril"}},
[6748]={nameES="Instancia: Una solicitud razonable",objectivesES={"Wynmar followed you to Haldirith and seeks a final word with Noriel.\
\
You should escort Wynmar to Haldirith.","Wynmar has followed you to Haldirith and stands beside you now.\
\
You should talk to Wynmar.","Tell the Elves why you have brought a trespasser to the Elf-keep","Ninil is outside of Haldirith, waiting to speak with you.","Noriel is at Haldirith.","Tell Ninil why Wynmar begged to come","Wynmar has begged you to let him see Noriel one last time to make a gift of flowers.","Observe the meeting of Wynmar and Noriel","Noriel sighs and shakes her head slightly","Instancia: Una solicitud razonable","You tell Ninil that Wynmar wishes more than anything to speak with Noriel before leading his people from Thinglad for good.","Escort Wynmar to Haldirith","Talk to Noriel","Show Wynmar the ruins of Haldirith on the path ahead","Noriel and Wynmar are at Haldirith.","Wynmar cannot believe his eyes at the sight of Haldirith, home of the Elven sentinels of Thinglad"}},
[6749]={nameES="Instancia: Una reliquia en Lumul-nar",objectivesES={"Una ola de temor te recorre mientras la reliquia es destruida, y luego desaparece.","Bróin cree que Gorothúl entregó una reliquia maligna a los merrevail que infestan los Espejos de Lumul-nar.","Derrota a Ergoth, el oscuro Morraval que fue atraído por el Regalo de Gorothúl.","Bróin cree que una de las reliquias que Gorothúl dejó en Moria fue dada a los merrevail que infestan las Salas de los Espejos de Lumul-nar y quiere que la destruyas.","Destruye el Regalo de Gorothúl en Lumul-nar","Instancia: Una reliquia en Lumul-nar","Derrota a Ergoth","Ergoth derrotado"}},
[6750]={nameES="Instancia: Un joven líder reacio",objectivesES={"Agelwyn, the young wife of Thane Gladsúnu of Marton, is reluctant to lead her people in her husband's absence.","Agelwyn can be found in the refugees' hiding spot north of Marton.\
\
You should help Agelwyn to put aside her anxiety and begin to lead her people.","Agelwyn is distraught under the pressure of responsibility that has settled on her shoulders","Instancia: Un joven líder reacio","Speak with Agelwyn","Listen to Agelwyn","Agelwyn's memory unfolds....","If Agelwyn wishes to heed her husband's advice and make for Helm's Deep, now is the time.","Talk to Agelwyn"}},
[6751]={nameES="Instancia: Una solicitud",objectivesES={"Ask Karazgar the questions you wish","Instancia: Una solicitud","Karazgar, the Weeping Warrior, has declared a truce and desires to speak with you.","Karazgar has fled from the new arrivals on the road.","Karazgar has confronted you at the Old Ford, but for the moment he has declared a truce. He wishes only to speak with you.\
\
He has given you the chance to ask the questions you wish.","Approach Karazgar and hear what he has to say","Listen to what Karazgar has to say","Give Karazgar your response to his request","Elrond and much of his household have made the passage of the mountains.","Remain alert for the reaction of Karazgar, and stay on your guard.","Karazgar has confronted you at the Old Ford, but for the moment he has declared a truce. He wishes only to speak with you.\
\
He waits for you to respond.","Wait for the newcomers to arrive","Karazgar has confronted you at the Old Ford, but for the moment he has declared a truce. He wishes only to speak with you.","Karazgar has made his request of you: he wants you to give him the Black Book of Mordor.","Mantente en guardia","Talk to Elrond on the road near the Old Ford","Give your response to Karazgar"}},
[6752]={nameES="Instance: Una noche apacible",objectivesES={"Bingo ya debe haber elegido un buen lugar para que hagas una hoguera.","Instance: Una noche apacible","Habla con Bingo junto a la hoguera","Habéis dejado el camino y ahora Bingo quiere acampar para pasar la noche.","Las horas de la nochen han pasado... con muchos incidentes... y Bingo por fin se levanta.","Habla con Bingo","Bingo se ha dormido, pero alguien tiene que quedarse despierto y alerta por si surge algún peligro. ¡Y ese alguien eres tú!","Bingo te ha pedido que busques yesca adecuada para hacer una hoguera.","Bingo está sentado junto al fuego que habéis encendido en el Bosque de los Trolls, listo para irse a dormir.","Bingo está listo para descansar por hoy, y quiere acampar justo a la entrada del Bosque de los Trolls.","Haz una hoguera en el lugar que ha elegido Bingo","Monta guardia en el campamento mientras Bingo duerme"}},
[6753]={nameES="Instancia: Un Reencuentro Agridulce",objectivesES={"Llega Ardhun","<rgb=#FF0000>No te acerques demasiado a la conversación entre Eluna y Ardhun</rgb>","Espera a que Ardhun llegue","Más guerreros Draig-lûth aparecen con fuerza","Defiende a Eluna","<rgb=#FF0000>¡Eluna ha sido derrotada!</rgb>","Partes junto a Eluna y sus estudiantes hacia una negociación de alto riesgo.","Habla con Eluna","Espera a que Ardhun llegue.","Habla con Eluna antes que cominencen las negociaciones.","La lucha ha terminado.\
\
Reagrúpate con los demás.","Eluna ha sobrevivido al intento contra su vida, en gran parte gracias a tu valentía.\
\
Deberías hablar con Eluna.","Deberías defender a Eluna","Permanece alerta.","Reagrúpate con Eluna y sus estudiantes","Escucha la conversación entre Eluna y Ardhun.","Instancia: Un Reencuentro Agridulce","Permanece en guardia mientras llegan más Draig-lûth"}},
[6754]={nameES="Instancia: Un camino a través de la oscuridad",objectivesES={"Habla con el Frontero Boffin.","Después de demostrar tu habilidad, háblale al Frontero Boffin para saber a dónde desea llevarte.","En la puerta de la Granja de Odo, habla con el Frontero Boffin.","<rgb=#00FF00>¡Has entrenado bien y has impresionado al Frontero Boffin!</rgb>","Libera a los otros hobbits.","Sigue al Frontero Boffin.","Toma las armas del bolso del Frontero Boffin <rgb=#00FF00>(Haz clic derecho sobre el bolso)</rgb>","Escapa del campamento Montebruno con Trancos.","El Frontero Boffin ha mencionado que necesitas un arma antes de adentrarte más en la granja. Te ha llevado a un bolso con un par de armas.","Después de demostrar tu habilidad, habla con el Frontero Boffin para saber a dónde desea llevarte.","Mientras el Frontero Boffin intenta cortar las telarañas, defiéndelo de las arañas que seguramente intentarán detenerlo.\
\
Al avanzar por la granja del viejo Odo, encontraste tu camino bloqueado por telarañas.","Mientras entrenas para convertirte en Vigilante, tu instructor, el Frontero Boffin, ha conocido a tres hobbits viajeros en el camino. Los tres hobbits están viajando a Bree, pero se han detenido para tomar un refrigerio.","Deberías informarle al Frontero Boffin que el camino hacia la siguiente puerta ya está despejado.\
\
El Vigilante Boffin te pidió que despejaras el camino hacia la siguiente puerta mientras él vigilaba por si regresaba el Jinete Negro.","Despiertas dentro del campamento Montebruno.","Tras ahuyentar al Nazgûl, habla con Mundo Sacovilla-Bolsón.","Un Jinete Negro ha asustado al Frontero Boffin fuera del camino. ¡Síguelo!","El Frontero Boffin cree que lo mejor es esconderse hasta que el Jinete Negro pase, y piensa que el granero de hojas del viejo Odo podría ser un buen lugar para ocultarse.","Los hobbits parecen estar pasándola muy bien. Los tres viajeros se dirigen a Bree, lo cual es algo inusual para un hobbit, pero pronto la charla sobre hongos te distrae de esa preocupación.","<rgb=#00FF00>¡Has escapado con la ayuda de Trancos!</rgb>","Libérate de los Montebruno de Archet.","Sigue al Frontero Boffin en busca de un lugar seguro.\
\
El Vigilante Boffin encontró la llave de la casa del viejo Odo, pero en su apuro por abrir la puerta, la rompió dentro de la cerradura.","Habla con el Frontero Boffin <rgb=#00FF00>(Camina hacia adelante presionando W)</rgb>","Siéntate y escucha a los hobbits.","Al regresar de tu encargo, ves que el Frontero Boffin ha invitado a tres hobbits a compartir su fuego. Los hobbits están viajando a Bree, lo cual ya es curioso por sí mismo.","La Reina Araña ha despertado. Libera al Frontero Boffin y a los otros hobbits de la malvada criatura.","Habla con Trancos","El Frontero Boffin te ha pedido que entrenes con él para asegurarse de que puedes emprender tus viajes.","Con el camino despejado, sigue al Frontero Boffin mientras abre la puerta.","Habla con el hobbit prisionero, Mundo, e intenta ayudarlo a salir de allí.","Instancia: Un camino a través de la oscuridad"}},
[6755]={nameES="Instancia: Un camino a través de la oscuridad",objectivesES={"Has demostrado que puedes luchar; ahora es más seguro continuar con la patrulla.","Habla con el Frontero Boffin.","Sigue a Trancos mientras te ayuda a escapar","Durante un paseo nocturno, te encuentras con el Frontero Boffin en un camino especialmente oscuro de la Comarca.","El Frontero Boffin te espera en el sendero.\
\
Debes hablar con el Frontero Boffin antes de continuar tu huida a través de la granja.","Has salido a dar un paseo y parece que hay alguien más en el camino.","Sigue al Frontero Boffin.","El Frontero Boffin necesitará protección de las arañas mientras corta sus resistentes telarañas.\
\
Debes derrotar a las arañas y proteger al Frontero Boffin mientras intenta llevarte a un lugar seguro.","Te encuentras en una celda de prisión, rodeado por los bandidos que te secuestraron a ti y a tus compañeros hobbits.","Instancia: Un camino a través de la oscuridad","El saco está cerca del Frontero Boffin en el camino.\
\
Debes mirar dentro del saco para ver si contiene algo que pueda serte útil en una noche oscura como esta.","Las arañas están en la Granja de Hojas de Odo.\
\
El Frontero Boffin teme a las arañas y desea que despejes el camino antes de aventurarse adelante.","Hay un arma en el saco. Ahora debes saquearla y equiparla antes de intentar luchar.","Habla con el Frontero Boffin para comenzar el combate de práctica <rgb=#00FF00>(Haz clic derecho sobre el arma en tu inventario para equiparla.)</rgb>","Has despertado dentro de una prisión, rodeado de bandidos.","Amdir ha ayudado a rescatar a tus amigos de los crueles bandidos.\
\
Ahora debes reunirte con el compañero de Trancos, un Montaraz llamado Amdir","Debes hablar con el hobbit que te llama.","Avanza por el camino <rgb=#00FF00>(Muévete hacia delante presionando W)</rgb>","Trancos ahora se arrodilla junto a su amigo gravemente herido, Amdir.\
\
Debes hablar con Trancos, pues él sabrá mejor qué hacer a continuación.","Intenta salir de tu celda","La puerta que te saca de la prisión está al final del pasillo, saliendo de tu celda.\
\
Debes seguir a Trancos fuera de la puerta de la prisión.","El Frontero Boffin quiere ver si eres capaz de empuñar una hoja para defenderte.\
\
Debes practicar un duelo de entrenamiento con el Frontero Boffin para que ambos se sientan más confiados en el oscuro camino.","Sigue a Trancos","El Frontero Boffin está intentando llegar a un lugar seguro a través de la Granja de Hojas de Odo.\
\
Debes seguir al Frontero Boffin hasta un camino más seguro, que los conducirá a ambos a una aldea cercana.","Arañas amenazantes bloquean tu camino.","Debes hablar con tu rescatador de aspecto severo","El Jinete Negro se ha ido, pero el compañero Montaraz de Trancos está gravemente herido","Un Hombre misterioso y curtido por el clima te espera en la prisión de los bandidos.\
\
Debes hablar con tu rescatador para que pueda guiarte fuera del peligro.","Abandona la prisión <rgb=#00FF00>(Haz clic derecho sobre las puertas para abrirlas. Camina hacia las puertas abiertas para ser transportado a tu destino.)</rgb>","El Frontero Boffin desea patrullar el camino, pues tiene una inquietante sensación sobre esta noche.\
\
Debes patrullar el camino junto al Frontero Boffin.","Has salido a dar un paseo, pero parece que hay alguien en el camino delante (algo poco común en estos parajes tranquilos.)\
\
Debes hablar con el individuo que está en el camino frente a ti. <rgb=#00ff00>Haz clic derecho sobre los personajes para interactuar</rgb>.","El Frontero Boffin te espera en el sendero.\
\
Debes seguir al Frontero Boffin para escapar de la amenaza en el camino.","Habla con el sujeto del camino <rgb=#00FF00>(Haz clic derecho sobre el hobbit para interactuar)</rgb>","Habla con Trancos","Las arañas están en la Granja de Hojas de Odo.\
\
El Frontero Boffin teme a las arañas y desea que despejes el camino antes de aventurarse más adelante.","Has salido a dar un paseo, pero parece que hay alguien en el camino delante (algo poco común en estos parajes tranquilos.)\
\
Debes hablar con el individuo que está en el camino frente a ti.","Derrota arañas (0/2) <rgb=#00FF00>(Haz clic derecho sobre una araña para seleccionarla en combate. Haz clic izquierdo en los Íconos de habilidades en la parte inferior de la pantalla para usarlas.)</rgb>","Examina el saco al costado del camino <rgb=#00FF00>(Haz clic derecho sobre el saco para recoger lo que hay dentro)</rgb>","Te has encontrado con un Frontero sobresaltado en el camino del País de las Colinas Verdes.\
\
Debes hablar con el Frontero Boffin para escuchar lo que tiene que decir."}},
[6756]={nameES="Instancia: Un Final Despiadado",objectivesES={"Drugât and Nerzus can be found in the innermost chamber of Nimrond.\
\
Defeat Drugât and Nerzus, leaders of the ruthless dead and Orkish forces.","You should speak with Arvaethor.","Arvaethor asks for you to follow him to the very heart of the caverns, deep inside the mountain.","Drugât has been defeated","Delve to the deepest chamber of the caverns of Nimrond","Arvaethor has fallen in battle!","<rgb=#FF0000>Arvaethor must survive</rgb>","Speak with Arvaethor","Speak with Arvaethor.","Delve to the deepest chamber of the caverns of Nimrond.","The Hall of Nimrond stands before you, crawling with the Dead","Destroy the dark stones to gain entrance to the inner hall of Nimrond.","Defeat Drugât and Nerzus","Instancia: Un Final Despiadado"}},
[6757]={nameES="Instancia: Una cámara secreta",objectivesES={"Are you... imagining this?","Talk to Frethi","Instancia: Una cámara secreta","Frethi is ready to begin exploring the chamber.\
\
You should talk to Frethi.","You have found an ancient chamber deep beneath Moria. What secrets lie within?","Look around with Frethi","You ask if Frethi saw the strange figure.\
\
'No, I saw nothing. Are you feeling all right, friend?'"}},
[6758]={nameES="Instancia: Un Club Secreto",objectivesES={"Instancia: Un Club Secreto","Has venido a Dwaling con Ponto Avena para ocuparte de los bandidos que han tomado el pueblo.","La porra que buscas está en el suelo junto a los bandidos dormidos cerca de la casa de Perlina Gamyi en Dwaling.\
\
Ponto espera que recuperes la porra de entre los bandidos dormidos en Dwaling.","Encuentra la porra","Evita ser detectado por los rufianes","Ponto Avena está de pie en el camino que baja hacia Dwaling.\
\
Ponto espera hablar contigo sobre tu próxima \\qrecuperación\\q.","Robas silenciosamente la porra del bandido dormido","Ponto Avena está en la ladera del borde norte de Dwaling.\
\
Ponto espera oír cómo te fue en la recuperación de la porra."}},
[6759]={nameES="Instancia: Una reunión secreta",objectivesES={"Grímyr is waiting to speak with you.","A dwarf named Grímyr has asked to speak with you privately about some urgent matter.","Defend yourself","Grímyr has suddenly attacked you!\
\
You should defend yourself!","Grímyr has asked that you follow him to a more discreet location.","Instancia: Una reunión secreta","Talk to Grímyr","Follow Grímyr","Grímyr suddenly attacks!"}},
[6760]={nameES="Instancia: Una miniaventura compartida",objectivesES={"Glorfindel is in Sul Madásh.","Cúridwan is in Sul Madásh.","Cúridwan has returned from her wandering in the blighted forest and Inkanûsh is eager to speak with her in Sul Madásh.","Inkanûsh and Cúridwan are in Sul Madásh.","Listen to Glorfindel","Listen to the conversation between Inkanûsh and Cúridwan","Check Baharúd for signs of life","Inkanûsh is in Sul Madásh.","Talk to Cúridwan in Sul Madásh","Alas, Baharúd is slain","Talk to Inkanûsh in Sul Madásh","Talk to Glorfindel in Sul Madásh","Instancia: Una miniaventura compartida","The Utûgi have been driven away, but they leave sorrow in their wake."}},
[6761]={nameES="Instancia: Una presencia silenciosa",objectivesES={"Imák and Venko wait for you on the hill upon which the Drearspire stands.","Eavesdrop on the discussion between the cultists in the Drearspire","Loud mechanisms operate noisily inside Tûr Fúar, but the halls are empty","Talk to Imák outside the Drearspire","Venko stands before a side entrance to the Drearspire, considering its suitability for your purpose.","Follow Imák and Venko toward the Drearspire","Enter the Drearspire with Imák and Venko","You have entered the Drearspire with Imák and Venko and should search the tower for answers.","You have entered the Drearspire with Imák and Venko, and now you have the opportunity to eavesdrop on some of the Angmarim who remain in the tower. Perhaps you will learn what these evil folk seek to accomplish within Câr Bronach, and elsewhere.\
\
You must not be seen by the Angmarim cultists.","Inside the Drearspire, Venko has called for you to halt.","Talk to Imák inside the Drearspire","Explore the Drearspire with Imák and Venko","Instancia: Una presencia silenciosa","<rgb=#FF0000>Avoid being seen by the Angmarim cultists</rgb>","Talk to Venko inside the Drearspire","Imák and Venko hope your presence in the Drearspire will go unnoticed as you investigate the Angmarim interest in the tower.","You have entered the Drearspire with Imák and Venko, in search of answers: what villainy have the Angmarim conducted within Câr Bronach?","Talk to Venko beside the side entrance to Drearspire","You have come with Imák and Venko to Tûr Fúar, the Drearspire, to learn if an Angmarim ritual is behind the curious happenings within Câr Bronach."}},
[6762]={nameES="Instancia: Una canción para la compañía",objectivesES={"Leland Sotomonte está dentro de la cueva, escondite de los bandidos que le robaron el almuerzo.\
\
Leland Sotomonte espera para hablar contigo.","Habla con Leland Sotomonte","Instancia: Una canción para la compañía","Protege a Leland Sotomonte","Leland Sotomonte busca recuperar algo que le fue robado por los bandidos.\
\
Leland Sotomonte te ha pedido que lo ayudes.","Leland Sotomonte ha encontrado el escondite de los bandidos que le robaron algo valioso."}},
[6763]={nameES="Instancia: Una Lanza en la Marca del Sur",objectivesES={"Habla con Toby Thorndyke","Andrew Roblebosque está detrás de la línea de Vigilantes al sur de Bree.\
\
El ataque ha sido repelido con éxito, y ahora deberías hablar con el Vigilante Roblebosque.","Toby Thorndyke está en tu lugar dentro de la línea de Vigilantes que defienden Bree del ataque desde el sur.","Te has alejado de tu posición, y la defensa ha sufrido por ello","El ataque ha sido repelido","Instancia: Una Lanza en la Marca del Sur","Habla con Andrew Roblebosque","Has aceptado unirte a la línea de Vigilantes defendiendo el acceso a Bree contra una banda de bandidos que se aproxima desde el sur.","Andrew Roblebosque está detrás de la línea de Vigilantes al sur de Bree.\
\
El Vigilante Roblebosque está esperando hablar contigo.","No abandones tu puesto en la línea"}},
[6764]={nameES="Instancia: Una tormenta al atardecer",objectivesES={"Defeat the Captain of the Third Ward","Fight through the fourth ward of Lashkarg and defeat the commander of the Khundolar.","Fight through the second ward of Lashkarg and defeat its captain.","Defeated the Captain of the Third Ward","Instancia: Una tormenta al atardecer","Defeated the Captain of the Second Ward","Defeat the Captain of the First Ward","You prepare to assault the Khundolar war-camp of Lashkarg in hopes of driving them back from Rohirrim territory.","Fight your way through the first ward of Lashkarg and defeat its captain.","Fight through the third ward of Lashkarg and defeat its captain.","Defeat the Captain of the Second Ward","Defeat the Commander of the Khundolar","Defeated the Captain of the First Ward","Defeated the Commander of the Khundolar"}},
[6765]={nameES="Instancia: Un robo de libertad",objectivesES={"Answer Glúrkub's question: can the goblin trust Prince Durin?","Listen to Glúrkub","Glúrkub stands in the hiding spot near the path to the mountain's summit.","Watch Glúrkub carry out the plan","Talk to Glúrkub in the Welkin-lofts","Glúrkub stands in the hiding spot in the Welkin-lofts.","Instancia: Un robo de libertad","Talk to Prince Durin","You have come with Glúrkub to the Welkin-lofts to steal the mithril hammer wielded by Gorgar the Ruthless, and perhaps earn the goblin captive his freedom.","You have safely escorted Glúrkub past the dwarf-lines and out of Gundabad.","Return to Prince Durin with Glúrkub and the mithril hammer","Answer Glúrkub's question: what password should he use to call you from hiding if he gets into trouble?","Talk to Glúrkub","Glúrkub is in the hiding spot in the Welkin-lofts.","<rgb=#FF0000>Do not leave the hiding spot too early!</rgb>","You were seen too early, and the plan has failed!","You and Glúrkub successfully carried out the plan to steal the mithril hammer and should now return to Prince Durin.","Talk to Glúrkub outside Gundabad","Listen to Glúrkub explain the plan","Glúrkub has asked you if he can trust Prince Durin, and if you think the prince will let him go.","Escort Glúrkub from Gundabad","Glúrkub has delivered the mithril hammer to Prince Durin, as he promised. The goblin now waits to speak with you.","Talk to Glúrkub in the hiding spot","<rgb=#FF0000>Do not leave the hiding spot until Glúrkub shouts the password!</rgb>","Glúrkub has gone to execute his part of the plan: stealing the mithril hammer from the guards Gorgar left behind. You should remain in the hiding spot and not emerge unless Glúrkub gets into trouble and shouts the password.","Glúrkub stands among the trees not far from the hiding place you scouted.","Listen to Glúrkub and wait for Gorgar to climb to the peak","Glúrkub has asked you what password he should use to call you forth from hiding if he gets into trouble.","Glúrkub has seized the mithril hammer and raced back to the hiding spot, where he waits to speak with you.","Prince Durin has commanded that Glúrkub be given safe passage away from Gundabad, and asked you to escort the goblin from Elderslade.","Glúrkub has delivered the mithril hammer to Prince Durin, as he promised to do. How will the prince now respond?"}},
[6766]={nameES="Instancia: Un ladrón en la noche",objectivesES={"Atherol Tuk está agachado en la cerca al borde de la propiedad de Maggot, junto al camino.\
\
Atherol espera hablar contigo sobre el plan para evitar que los bandidos roben los hongos de Maggot.","Algunos bandidos han venido a Bamfurlargo y pueden estar escondidos en cualquier parte de la granja.\
\
Atherol Tuk espera que elimines a los bandidos que planean robar los hongos de Maggot... ¡y quiere que tú también robes algunos!","Tú y Atherol Tuk habéis venido a Bamfurlargo para evitar que los bandidos Montebruno se lleven los deliciosos hongos de Maggot.","Atherol Tuk está esperando junto a la cerca, al lado del camino, fuera de Bamfurlargo.\
\
Atherol Tuk espera saber que te has deshecho de los bandidos que planeaban robar los hongos de Maggot.","Instancia: Un ladrón en la noche"}},
[6767]={nameES="Instancia: Sed de sangre",objectivesES={"Defeat Zakrif, the troll-commander of the Orc-company.","Instancia: Sed de sangre","Hutha has perished","Talk to Reeve Fastred","Listen to the discussion between the Riders Four and Reeve Fastred.","Listen to the discussion between the Riders Four and Reeve Fastred","You have accompanied the Riders Four to the camp of Reeve Fastred in the Sutcrofts in the hope of discussing the Khundolar invasion with him.","Talk to Burnoth.","Léofdag has perished","Defeat Zakrif","Fastred has perished","Ulf has perished","Burnoth has perished","Talk to Burnoth","Defeat the Orcs attacking Fastred's camp","Defeat the Orcs attacking Fastred's camp.","Defeated Zakrif","Fastred and the Riders Four must survive","Talk to Fastred."}},
[6768]={nameES="Instance: A Timely Rescue",objectivesES={"You have driven off the Shadow-wolves","Speak with Amarion and return to Echad Dagoras in Fordirith.","Help Amarion escape from the Black Dens.","Talk to Amarion","Instance: A Timely Rescue","Amarion left camp to search the Black Dens, where he believed he might find some way to destroy the Shadow-wolves -- but he has been gone too long. Braigiar has asked you to search for him among the Dens in the hope that he might be found unharmed."}},
[6769]={nameES="Instancia: Un rastro de venganza",objectivesES={"You appear to have come upon a trail of vengeance, left by a mysterious warrior whose deeds strongly resemble Thrymm's....","Listen to Cyneberg","Listen to Thrymm and Cyneberg","Cyneberg se encuentra en el norte de las Altas Cumbres.\
\
Deberías seguir a Cyneberg.","A look of relief passes over Thrymm's face","Reassure Thrymm that Cyneberg is all right","Instancia: Un rastro de venganza","You should listen to Thrymm and Cyneberg.","Follow Cyneberg","See if Cyneberg is feeling better","Thrymm is in the northern High Knolls.\
\
You should speak with Thrymm.","Thrymm and Cyneberg are in Thrymm's cave in the northern High Knolls.","Talk to Cyneberg"}},
[6770]={nameES="Instancia: Una Trampa para la Criatura",objectivesES={"La criatura sigilosa está escapando por Tâl Bruinen, y debes seguirla si puedes.","Coloca el pescado bajo la ventana","Instancia: Una Trampa para la Criatura","Habla con Garbert","Tú y Garbert están listos para poner en marcha el plan del pescador para atrapar a la criatura sigilosa que ronda Tâl Bruinen.","Adwold logró alcanzarte a pesar de sufrir una herida en la pierna durante la persecución.\
\
Está esperando saber el resultado.","Adwold está escondido detrás del refugio improvisado que Garbert construyó cerca de su cabaña.\
\
¿Qué fue ese sonido? Adwold está seguro de haber oído algo. ¿Será la criatura?","La criatura sigilosa ha regresado a la cabaña de Garbert, y tú y Adwold están listos para activar la trampa.\
\
Adwold te indicó esperar su señal antes de saltar sobre la criatura para intentar capturarla.","Udulug derrotado","Habla con Adwold","Garbert ya ha preparado parte del plan, pero aún necesita tu ayuda.","Persigue a la criatura sigilosa por Tâl Bruinen","Atrapá a la criatura cuando Adwold dé la señal","Adwold está esperando que coloques el pescado bajo la ventana.\
\
Adwold te mostró el lugar perfecto para dejar el cebo: bajo la ventana grande en el costado de la cabaña de Garbert.","Derrota a Udulug","Adwold está listo para aguardar escondido a que aparezca la criatura.\
\
Debes prepararte para activar la trampa.","Has perdido a la criatura, pero encontraste a un orco que parece haber sido encargado de seguirle el rastro: se trata de Udulug, de quien la criatura habló.\
\
Udulug debe ser derrotado."}},
[6771]={nameES="Instancia: Un Camino Problemático",objectivesES={"Anborn recalls bringing Gollum forth to be questioned by Faramir shortly after his capture, and his fears for the journey of the Halflings and the gangrel-creature.","Anborn can be found in Henneth Annûn.\
\
Anborn is telling you what he recalls of the night he brought the gangrel-creature to be questioned.","Listen to Anborn's tale","Instancia: Un Camino Problemático"}},
[6772]={nameES="Instancia: Un informe preocupante",objectivesES={"Talk to Molkha","Molkha is ready to describe what she saw earlier.\
\
You should talk to Molkha.","Listen to the conversation","Instancia: Un informe preocupante","Molkha is describing what she saw transpire between the drakes, hobgoblins, and Angmarim.\
\
You should listen to the conversation.","Molkha has a troubling report to share: the Frost-bound Hobgoblins, the Angmarim, and the Drakes of the Frost-horde are negotiating alliances and using fallen dwarves as bargaining chips."}},
[6773]={nameES="Instancia: Un verdadero amigo del pueblo de Durin",objectivesES={"Talk to Hrostyr","King Thorin III has called for the folk of the Lonely Mountain to assemble and hear his words.","Hrostyr stands before the throne of King Thorin III.","Instancia: Un verdadero amigo del pueblo de Durin","Listen to the words of Thorin III, King Under the Mountain","Thorin III, King Under the Mountain, addresses the folk of the Lonely Mountain."}},
[6774]={nameES="Instancia: Un verdadero amigo de Gondor",objectivesES={"Listen further to the words of King Elessar in the Court of the Fountain","King Elessar is in the Court of the Fountain, atop the city.","Instancia: Un verdadero amigo de Gondor","Talk to Malthengil in the Court of the Fountain","King Elessar has invited the folk of the city to a ceremony in the Court of the Fountain.","Listen to the words of King Elessar in the Court of the Fountain","Malthengil, the guard of King Elessar, is in the Court of the Fountain.","Mithrandir is in the Court of the Fountain, high atop the city.","Talk to Mithrandir in the Court of the Fountain"}},
[6775]={nameES="Instancia: Un corazón vengativo",objectivesES={"Ugrukhôr is ready to face you in single combat.","Ugrukhôr does not have the capacity for mercy. He toys with you and with the lives of your friends. He must pay for his cruelty.","Ugrukhôr, the Captain of the Pit, has captured the Ranger Annoth. He comes now to Barad Cúron to challenge Gothmog for supremacy of Imlad Morgul.","The Ranger Culang is in the throne room inside Barad Cúron.","Lûrkh has been swiftly defeated! Now you can descend the tower","Gothmog has been defeated, but he is not the only Master of Mordor who has come to Barad Cúron.","Instancia: Un corazón vengativo","Lûrkh has given all his attention to the Oath-stone in the centre of the chamber. Now is your chance to overpower him!","Lûrkh is focused on the Oath-stone. Now is your chance to overpower him!","The time has come to face Ugrukhôr, the Captain of the Pit, and avenge the lives he has taken.","Defeat Lûrkh, and do it quickly","Talk to Ugrukhôr","Wait for Culang's signal to attack","Permanece alerta","Descend Barad Cúron and return to the throne room without alerting Ugrukhôr to your presence","Talk to Lûrkh","Defeat Ugrukhôr, the Captain of the Pit","Ugrukhôr does not have the capacity for mercy. He toys with you and with the lives of your friends.","With the advantage of surprise on your side, you should descend the tower of Barad Cúron and return to the throne room.","Clear the room atop Barad Cúron of merrevail","Culang has noticed your return, and now you must wait for his signal to attack. Do not let Ugrukhôr see you before that time!","Talk to Culang inside the throne room of Barad Cúron","Culang catches your eye. Be ready for his signal!","Ugrukhôr has asked you a question.","Ugrukhôr has commanded one of his guards, an Orc named Lûrkh, to take you on a search of the tower for Karazgar.","Lûrkh wants you to clear the room of merrevail while he studies the Oath-stone, pondering if some valuable piece of it might be chipped away and kept as treasure."}},
[6776]={nameES="Instancia: Un Golpe Venenoso",objectivesES={"Search for Vaskorn","The Ungoledain have begun to retreat, but left behind a vicious spider shade to fight you.","Defeat the spider shade","Threkmóth and his folk have taken the poison-protecting potion in preparation for the assault on the Ungoledain... and possible rescue of Vaskorn.","Instancia: Un Golpe Venenoso","Protect Vaskorn from Ungoledain attackers","Vaskorn appears to be unconscious, but alive.","The Ungoledain appear to be ready for an attack. Fight them off as you continue to search for Vaskorn."}},
[6777]={nameES="Instancia: Una inaguración muy Boffin",objectivesES={"Todos los hijos Boffin han vuelto a Nobotella y ahora la fiesta de inauguración de la casa de Angélica puede comenzar sin más retrasos.","Comprueba que los Boffin estén en el almacén","Justo cuando terminas de decirle a Angélica (algo sorprendida) que sus hermanos están todos todavía aquí en vez de a saber dónde, alguien llama a la puerta.\
\
'Creía que me habías dicho que estábamos todos aquí, ¿no?' te pregunta la muchacha hobbit.","Angélica no cabe en sí de gozo.","Comprueba que los Boffin estén en el salón","Angélica está esperando tu informe en su nueva casa.","Comprueba que los Boffin estén en la cocina","Angélica está en su nueva casa: el nº 8 de la calle Aguamiel, Nobotella.","Berilac ha encontrado un lugar para su siesta","Sobrevive a la fiesta de inauguración de la casa sin pasar vergüenza","Los co-conspiradores Camelia y Dinodas están aquí, por supuesto","Habla con Prisca","Un visitante ha llegado al nº 8 de la calle Aguamiel durante la fiesta de inauguración de la casa de Angélica.","Habla con Angélica","Angélica piensa que deberías comprobar que sus hermanos están todos todavía aquí, y que ninguno ha desaparecido de nuevo.","Caléndula y Griffo están en el salón","Fosco y Esmeralda están en el salón","Instancia: Una inaguración muy Boffin","Habla con Bingo","Prisca está contenta de que todo haya salido bien.","Bingo está en el pasillo de la nueva casa de Angélica, con una sonrisa de felicidad."}},
[6778]={nameES="Instancia: Una luna creciente",objectivesES={"Follow Dolenthol","After the wards surrounding Barad Cúron were destroyed, the fell magic sealing Uialrond, the Dome of Evening has been undone.","Instancia: Una luna creciente","Find a good spot to look down at the council table of Uialrond","This table is covered in a thick layer of dust, but conceals no secrets","You find nothing of note buried within this old dust and debris","Examine the source of the curious glimmer","You should search Uialrond and try to discern why it was sealed.","Search for anything that might explain why Uialrond was sealed","You should witness the vision of Galadriel.","A small lamp-fragment of Lórien glimmers in the darkness and you feel a sudden presence","A curious glimmer catches your eye!","Talk to Faramir","This shelf holds many dusty books of Gondorian make","You should follow Dolenthol into Uialrond, the Dome of Evening.","Bear witness to the echo of Galadriel","You think you spy something in the centre of the council table below","<rgb=#FF00FF>Look</rgb> down at the council table of Uialrond","Only the plated gold on this chair is tarnished","Uialrond appears to be curiously untouched by the evil in Minas Morgul","The echo of Galadriel fades back into the darkness of Uialrond","Dolenthol is standing inside Uialrond, the Dome of Evening.\
\
You should talk to Dolenthol.","You have a clear view from here","You should find a good spot to look down at the council table of Uialrond.","You should examine the source of the curious glimmer.","You have witnessed the hopeful words of Galadriel, and Dolenthol has revealed himself to be the Lady Éowyn before Prince Faramir in Uialrond.\
\
You should talk to Faramir.","Talk to Dolenthol"}},
[6779]={nameES="Instancia: Una boda en el Solsticio de Verano",objectivesES={"The time has come for King Elessar and Arwen Undómiel to exchange their vows, in view of the assembled masses.","Mithrandir has called for a moment of silence to remember those who did not live to see this day.","Mithrandir's fireworks are as impressive as ever, and the celebration will continue long into the night.","Some honoured guests have asked to speak some words at the ceremony.","Instancia: Una boda en el Solsticio de Verano","Midsummer's Day has arrived, and with it the Great Wedding of King Elessar and Arwen Undómiel.","The procession is underway, and King Aragorn Elessar II is waiting for you to walk down the aisle to him, where he has a few words for you.","Listen to Mithrandir's additional words of remembrance","Your place, from where you will have a fine view of the ceremony, is next to Meriadoc Brandybuck on the southern side of the aisle.","<rgb=#00FF00>Mourn</rgb> to remember those who did not live to see this day","You take your place next to Merry and the procession continues","<rgb=#00FF00>Cheer</rgb> for Sam","Mithrandir's fireworks signal an end to the ceremony, but only the start of the celebration","Listen to the speeches by honoured guests","The speeches concluded, Mithrandir continues the wedding ceremony.","The processional continues while the Elves take their places atop the prow.","Mithrandir wishes to speak some additional words of remembrance.","Witness the marriage of King Elessar and Arwen Undómiel","Wait for the Elves to take their places as the processional continues","Watch as Mithrandir continues the ceremony","Sam has finished reciting his poem, and the assembled crowd cheers for the embarrassed hobbit.","Listen to Mithrandir's words of welcome","Walk down the aisle and speak to Aragorn","Stand next to Merry on the southern side of the aisle","Mithrandir has some words of welcome for the folk assembled atop the pier."}},
[6780]={nameES="Instance: Acolyte of the Necromancer",objectivesES={"Hear the stranger speak","Defend yourself.","Talk to Oroniel","Someone - or something - has come to dwell in Caras Tilion.","Oroniel is able to walk again and calls for a retreat","Defeat Agânuzir.","Defend yourself!","Defeat Agânuzir","Oroniel is able to defend herself, though she cannot move","Talk to Oroniel.","Silence descends upon the hilltop as a figure steps out from behind the ruins","Hear what the stranger has to say.","Instance: Acolyte of the Necromancer"}},
[6781]={nameES="Instancia: A través del Ikorbân",objectivesES={}},
[6782]={nameES="Instancia: Aldburg se reúne",objectivesES={"Talk to Arcil","Arcil, Éothain, and others have gathered to discuss the next course of action for Aldburg.\
\
You should speak with Arcil.","Instancia: Aldburg se reúne","A small assembly from Aldburg have gathered to discuss how to handle the Orc problems that have plagued the Eastfold of late.","Both Arcil and Éothain stated their case about which Orc-tribe poses the greatest threat.\
\
You speak with Arcil once again.","The people of Aldburg have come together to decide how best to deal with the two Orc-tribes that have been causing trouble of late.\
\
You should observe the discussion.","Observa la discusión"}},
[6783]={nameES="Instancia: Todo está en calma",objectivesES={"The sons of Isildur weigh what should be done with Urudanî Stonemaiden. She has been defeated, but while she lives she remains a threat to the Great Alliance.","Vëamacil and Ornaher are outside the walls of Amon Fuin.","Vëamacil and Ornaher, two of the sons of Isildur, are eager to conduct a dangerous rescue mission into the enemy-held fortress of Amon Fuin.","Defeat the guards that defend Urudanî Stonemaiden","Magoldir wants you to advise Vëamacil and Ornaher to abandon their mission to Amon Fuin.","You and the sons of Isildur have encountered Magoldir the Elf outside Amon Fuin.","Instancia: Todo está en calma","Urudanî's cultists have been defeated, and her contingent of Orcs has abandoned her, but she still intends to stand and fight.","Talk to Vëamacil","Talk to Vëamacil and Ornaher and convince them not to proceed into Amon Fuin","The sons of Isildur have charged forward into Amon Fuin, dismissing the warnings of Magoldir.","Talk to Urudanî Stonemaiden in Amon Fuin","Urudanî Stonemaiden commands the Mordorrim cultists within Amon Fuin.","Stand alongside Magoldir and the sons of Isildur in Amon Fuin","You failed to protect your allies!","<rgb=#FF0000>All of your allies must survive</rgb>","Talk to Magoldir outside Amon Fuin"}},
[6784]={nameES="Instancia: Todo lo que queda",objectivesES={"Talk to Randgar","Inhild has travelled to Randgar's farm, in order to say a final farewell to the man she loved so dearly.","Inhild begins to call out for Randgar","Randgar has returned and is awaiting outside his farm.\
\
Randgar has appeared, alive and well, and would like to explain things to you.","Talk to Inhild","Inhild can be found along the road to Randgar's farm.\
\
Inhild wishes to speak with you about Randgar.","Inhild can be found near Randgar's farm.\
\
Inhild wishes to discuss one final matter with you.","Instancia: Todo lo que queda"}},
[6785]={nameES="Instancia: Aliados Inesperados",objectivesES={"Aragorn has slowed beyond the Fords. He wishes to speak with you.","Éomer has heard a horseman approaching, and wants to speak with you.","Habla con Calenglad","Habla con Aragorn","Habla con Halbarad","Talk to Théoden on the road through the mysterious wood","Talk to Legolas on the road through the mysterious wood","Habla con Golodir","Halbarad and the Grey Company have accomplished their mission, and Halbarad wants to speak with you.","Instancia: Aliados Inesperados","Aragorn is speaking with Halbarad past the Fords of Isen.","The Fords of Isen are a sad reminder of the good folk who fell in defence of Rohan","Journey with the company beyond the Fords of Isen","Talk to Éomer on the road","Many of your friends among the Grey Company wish to speak with you before continuing on.","Gandalf is on the road, waiting to proceed.","Talk to Aragorn beyond the Fords of Isen","The company continues toward Isengard.","Talk to Radanir","Habla con Corunir","Théoden is on the road through the mysterious wood. He has never seen Ents before, and the sight has filled him with wonder.","Talk to Gandalf on the road through the mysterious wood","Legolas has dismounted and is staring into the trees.","Talk to Aragorn on the road through the mysterious wood","Aragorn has turned back to hear your opinion of the mysterious wood through which the company now travels.","Gandalf has unsettled business with Saruman, and the company rides with him to Isengard."}},
[6786]={nameES="Instancia: La esperanza de Amarthiel",objectivesES={"Encuentra a Amarthiel y descubre sus planes.","Debes derrotar al Númenóreano Negro.","Instancia: La esperanza de Amarthiel","Calenglad te ha pedido que encuentres a Amarthiel y descubras sus planes. Te ha enviado a Annúminas con cinco Montaraces para ayudar a rechazar a los angmarim.","Encuentra y detén a Amarthiel.","Habla con el montaraz protector que está frente a ti.","Habla con el montaraz protector antes de buscar a Amarthiel."}},
[6787]={nameES="Instancia: Emboscada en Echad Taerdim",objectivesES={"Rûkhor and his forces depart","The uruks have fallen back, but a strange man has appeared above the camp.\
\
You should listen to Rûkhor.","The camp is under attack!","Travel to Echad Taerdim with Legolas and Atli","Talk to Mablung","The attack has been repelled.\
\
You should talk to Mablung.","Listen to Rûkhor","The uruks fall back!","Strange uruks are attacking the Ranger camp.\
\
Defend the camp!","Habla con Legolas.","Legolas would like to return to Echad Taerdim.\
\
You should travel with Legolas and Atli to the Ranger camp.","Defend the camp","Instancia: Emboscada en Echad Taerdim","Legolas would like to return to Echad Taerdim.\
\
You should talk to Legolas.","You return to Mablung's camp with Legolas and Atli, but something is wrong."}},
[6788]={nameES="Instancia: Emboscada en las alturas",objectivesES={"Instancia: Emboscada en las alturas","You should talk to Nabatínu when you are ready to begin the assault.","Talk to Nabatínu","Talk to Rhadrog","You have collected the supply crates. You should talk to Rhadrog about what to do next.","Nabatínu has given orders to everyone in your company. You should collect the supply crates.","Rhadrog, Faeron, and Nabatínu have devised a plan to acquire supplies needed by the Jatsakóri by attacking an Ordâkhai supply caravan.","<rgb=#FF0000>Nabatínu must survive</rgb>","Your company has defeated the Ordâkhai defending the supply caravan. You should talk to Nabatínu about what to do next."}},
[6789]={nameES="Instancia: Entre enemigos",objectivesES={"Listen to Balakhâd's account","Listen to Balakhâd's account of his encounter with Azagath and Nakási within Nirgambâr.","Talk to Balakhâd","Instancia: Entre enemigos","Balakhâd has agreed to tell you what befell him after he fled from Jirush and hid within the tombs of Nirgambâr.","Balakhâd has more to tell you."}},
[6790]={nameES="Instancia: Una audiencia con los Cuan-lûth",objectivesES={"Enfréntate a la espía en el exterior","Habla con Cariad","Observa el interrogatorio de Igrain","Igrain ha ofrecido dejarte marchar para poder espiar libremente a los refugiados Cuan-lûth.\
\
Deberías esperar y no ceder.","Igrain se ha rendido.\
\
Deberías observar su interrogatorio.","Deberías hablar con Cariad sobre la opinión que tiene Erlys de los montaraces.","Derrota a Igrain","Han visto a una espía de Saruman fuera de la cueva.\
\
Erlys te ha ordenado que te enfrentes a la espía y la derrotes.","Cariad desea hablar de unos asuntos con Erlys.","Cariad te ha llevado a conocer al resto de su pueblo, los Cuan-lûth de las Tierras Brunas.","Instancia: Una audiencia con los Cuan-lûth","Deberías hablar con Cariad antes de acercarte a Erlys.","Derrotar a Igrain puede ayudar a que los Cuan-lûth confíen más en ti.","Espera y mantén tu posición","Observa la discusión"}},
[6791]={nameES="Instancia: Una audiencia con los porteros",objectivesES={"Speak with Mizâdi inside the Shorakhúna.","Listen to the conversation between Mizâdi and the Doorwards.","The Doorwards have requested Mizâdi's presence in Zajâna. Go with Shâra Mizâdi to show the Doorwards she mean them no harm, and rally their support in her hunt for Bârshud.","Instancia: Una audiencia con los porteros","Listen to the conversation between the Doorwards and Mizâdi.","Join Mizâdi and Numûru outside the council chambers","Listen to the conversation between Mizâdi and the Doorwards","Place the sword on the table in front of Sarâgh, Master of Spears","Speak with Numûru inside the Shorakhúna.","Speak with Mizâdi inside the Shorakhúna","Enter the council chamber with Mizâdi within the Shorakhúna.","Speak with Numûru inside the Shorakhúna","Listen to the conversation between the Doorwards and Mizâdi","Join Mizâdi and Numûru outside the council chambers.","Place the sword on the table in front of Sarâgh, Master of Spears.","Pick up the sword from the table in the Shorakhúna","Enter the council chamber with Mizâdi within the Shorakhúna","Pick up the sword from the table in the Shorakhúna."}},
[6792]={nameES="Instancia: Una audiencia con la tormenta",objectivesES={"Speak to Rothog regarding Zarzíra Dawn-star's petition","Members of the Kindred of the Coins take petitions from nobles throughout Umbar. Rothog has summoned you to his chambers to hear one specific complaint.","Speak to Zarzíra and witness the proceedings","Rothog has summoned you to his chambers to hear a specific complaint from one of his nobles regarding one of the gladiators.","Instancia: Una audiencia con la tormenta","Speak to Rothog the Storm","Talk to Rothog","Approach Zarzíra Dawn-star to begin her petition.","Rothog requests that you call forth the petitioner"}},
[6793]={nameES="Instancia: Un eco en las montañas",objectivesES={"Durin stares into the sheet of ice at Winterstith, muttering quietly.","You have managed to break Durin's reverie at the Anvil of Winterstith, but he still speaks slowly, as if waking from a deep sleep.","Durin stares deeply into the ice, muttering quietly","Mírkuz has listened to the words of Durin with growing displeasure and worry, and now he wishes to voice his concerns to you.","Carefully approach Durin","Listen to Heilar's account","Listen to the questions of the Longbeards","Talk to Mírkuz","Listen to Durin as he addresses the great force of Longbeards","Gently break Durin's reverie, if you can","Glóin stands among the warriors of the Longbeard army before the Anvil of Winterstith.","Habla con Glóin","Instancia: Un eco en las montañas","Glóin is worried for the prince of the Longbeards, and has asked you to slowly approach Durin and learn why he came to Winterstith.","The Zhélruka Mírkuz followed on the heels of the Longbeard army during its march from Skarháld, and now he has interrupted Durin's speech.","Habla con Durin","Durin was last seen travelling north-east with a single companion. Do they journey to the Anvil of Winterstith? And for what purpose?","Glóin and the warriors of the Longbeard army marvel at Durin's secret departure from Skarháld.","Newly-resolved, Durin addresses the Longbeard army before the Anvil of Winterstith.","Durin has managed to shake free of his reverie, seeing for the first time the Longbeard army from the Lonely Mountain."}},
[6794]={nameES="Instancia: Un eco de días pasados",objectivesES={"The lever squeals with disuse, then slides into place","You have travelled deep into the mine beneath Zudrugund with Nár, Elladan, and Nona. Elladan has had a curious feeling that you have been watched for some time now.","Nár seems to be more aware of his surroundings, thanks to the brew supplied by Frithgeir, and may now tell you what he said to Wadu.","Frithgeir has prepared the brew for Nár, and you should now see if it has the promised effect.","Nona has asked you to get to the bottom of the mystery concerning her brother Wadu and the dwarves of Zudrugund.","Nár looks around in an interested fashion, but you cannot tell if he even sees you at the moment.","Nona listens impatiently as you explain what the situation in Zudrugund seems to be.\
\
'I want answers for myself. My brother was changed after he came here, and this Nár knows why. He will tell me why, or it will go badly for him!'","You have pulled the lever to open the gate and should now rejoin your friends below.","Nár has offered to take you to the mines below Zudrugund, where he last remembers seeing Wadu. Perhaps the mystery of what happened to Nona's brother here remains below.","Find and use the lever that unlocks the gate","Nona has learned the truth: that her brother Wadu found his courage far below Zudrugund and defeated a mighty gwiber in the depths.","Talk to Frithgeir","Habla con Elladan.","Frithgeir is working to prepare the brew for Nár so you may speak to him without difficulty.","Nona has demanded an explanation from you.","Elladan is thinking, pondering what to do next, now that you are deep beneath Zudrugund and Nár is passing out of awareness again.","Your friends are missing. Have they already gone on past the gate that blocked passage deeper into the mine?","Your friends are deep within the mine, seeking the truth of what befell Wadu in the depths when he came here with Nár.","Learn what Nona wants from the dwarves","Nona has burst into the dwarf-hall, intending to confront the dwarves about the fate of her brother Wadu.","A locked gate blocks further progress into the mine, and Elladan has asked you to find the lever that should open it.","Halbarad wishes to speak with you while Frithgeir prepares the brew for Nár.","Nona wears a puzzled expression. She seems dissatisfied with the journey and wishes to speak with you.","Follow Elladan to Nár and listen to the dwarf's tale","Frithgeir is preparing the brew for Nár and has recommended that while you wait you speak with the members of the Grey Company who have come to Zudrugund.","Elladan is waiting to speak with you about Nár's mysterious and sudden change.","Listen to the exchange between Nona and Nár","Nár shakes his head, breathing deeply of the steam billowing out of the mug.\
\
'Wadu...I know that name. We went to the father-lode, where rang the sound of hundreds of dwarf-hammers, far below Zudrugund.\
\
'It is curious. I remember walking with Wadu among the great turning water-wheels of the Old Father, but I have not seen him since. He is not still down there, is he?'\
\
You tell Nár that Wadu has been slain, and his beard creases into a frown.\
\
'Ah, that is a shame. He was most brave. Wasn't he? I can take you to the mine, if you'd like.'","Instancia: Un eco de días pasados","The gate stands open, but your friends are gone. Are they below?","Rejoin Elladan, Nona, and Nár below"}},
[6795]={nameES="Instancia: Un Ojo en la Tormenta",objectivesES={"Deberías recoger las piedras rúnicas ahora que han sido alcanzadas por los rayos","Instancia: Un Ojo en la Tormenta","Habla con Techeryn","En la cima de Amon Sûl pueden encontrarse tres piedras planas.\
\
Techeryn te ha pedido colocar tres piedras rúnicas sobre las piedras planas de la cima y esperar a que cada una sea alcanzada por un rayo.","Has venido con Techeryn a Amon Sûl, donde una tremenda tormenta envuelve la cima, para desentrañar parte del misterio que rodea a las runas y su conexión con el mundo natural.","Techeryn está en el sendero que asciende hacia la cima de Amon Sûl.\
\
Techeryn está esperando para hablar contigo.","La piedra aún humea tras el impacto del rayo, pero la runa permanece como la única marca","Techeryn ha llegado a la cima de Amon Sûl y está esperando para hablar contigo.","Lleva las piedras rúnicas a Techeryn","Techeryn te ha asegurado que la foudre golpeará las tres piedras rúnicas que colocaste en la cima de Amon Sûl, y no debes regresar con ella hasta que eso ocurra.","Espera a que los rayos golpeen las tres piedras rúnicas","Los rayos han alcanzado cada una de las tres piedras rúnicas que colocaste en la cima; ahora deberías recogerlas todas de nuevo."}},
[6796]={nameES="Instance: An Incident in the Camps",objectivesES={}},
[6797]={nameES="Instancia: Un presagio del este",objectivesES={"Talk to Doron","Defeat Maraz","You have uncovered a room decorated with strange banners and trinkets that fill you with dread. While you do not see the Easterling, you believe him to be nearby.","The Easterling, Maraz, has revealed that he drove the brigands into serving his brotherhood, and that he and his people seek to crush Rohan beginning with Parth Celebrant. He must be defeated before his plans can come to fruition.","Suddenly, a voice rises through the air behind you","Doron hopes to find the Easterling invader among the crumbling tunnels of Ost Celebrant. Explore the ruins and try to uncover his whereabouts.","Search the ruins for the Easterling","Instancia: Un presagio del este","Doron can be called to your side with the horn you carry.","Explore the ruins under Ost Celebrant","You notice strange banners adorning this hall, but there is no sign of the Easterling","With Doron's guidance, you have discovered a passageway under Ost Celebrant. Doron bids you to enter and confront the Easterling invader."}},
[6798]={nameES="Instancia: Una convocatoria inesperada",objectivesES={"Dís seems unusually wary of speaking in your presence, but gestures for you to approach...","King Thorin III is speaking with Arcah, Daughter of Croär, chief of the ravens of Ravenhill.","Talk to King Thorin III","King Thorin III is at Ravenhill.\
\
You have spoken to Arcah and told her much of your adventures, and you should now speak to King Thorin III.","As the North awaits the coming of Vethúg Wintermind, King Thorin III has received an urgent and unexpected summons from Ravenhill.","Talk to Dís at Ravenhill","Dís can be found in the chambers of Ravenhill.\
\
You have come to Ravenhill seeking to answer an urgent summons. You should talk to Dís.","King Thorin III is at Ravenhill.\
\
Hoping to answer an urgent summons, King Thorin III has travelled to Ravenhill. You should follow him.","Arcah, Daughter of Croär, is at Ravenhill.\
\
After speaking with the King under the Mountain, Arcah desires to learn more of you.","Talk to Arcah, Daughter of Croär","Instancia: Una convocatoria inesperada","Listen to King Thorin III and Arcah","Follow King Thorin III into Ravenhill","Arcah hops in your direction and looks at you curiously...","King Thorin III is at Ravenhill.\
\
You have come to Ravenhill with King Thorin III and should now seek an audience with Dís."}},
[6799]={nameES="Instancia: Antigua guarida",objectivesES={"Fonn ha aprendido que se han visto gorthorogs viajando hacia Ologfil en Malenhad. Ha enviado a un explorador para investigar, pero el explorador no ha regresado.","Con la muerte de Ulkrank, deberías poder liberar a Bethad de su prisión y escapar de la oscura guarida de Ologfil.","Bethad ha sido encarcelado por el líder de guerra gorthorog, Ulkrank, quien debe ser asesinado para poder liberar al explorador de forma segura.","Libera a Bethad de su encarcelamiento","El montañés Bethad debe estar en algún lugar de esta cueva fétida, aunque si es posible que esté vivo o no es una incógnita.","Has liberado a Bethad.","Has descubierto la prisión de Bethad.","Encuentra a Bethad en Ologfil","Has derrotado a Ulkrank.","Instancia: Antigua guarida","Derrota a Ulkrank"}},
[6800]={nameES="Instancia: Angmar Renacido",objectivesES={"Escucha mientras Crannog se dirige a los Trév Gállorg y a los Trév Duvárdain","Crannog se encuentra en Fail-á-Khro.\
\
La negociación ha concluido. Debes hablar con Crannog.","Mientras algunos de los Trév Duvárdain se adelantan para hablar, la negociación comienza en serio","Instancia: Angmar Renacido","Al concluir la negociación, Crannog te hace señas para que hables con él","Asiste a la negociación en Fail-á-Khro","Crannog se encuentra en Fail-á-Khro.\
\
Has seguido a Crannog y a los Trév Gállorg hasta Fail-á-Khro para negociar con los Trév Duvárdain. Debes hablar con Crannog.","Los Trév Gállorg se han reunido en Fail-á-Khro para negociar con los Trév Duvárdain.\
\
Debes presenciar la negociación entre los Trév Gállorg y los Trév Duvárdain.","Los Trév Gállorg se han reunido en Fail-á-Khro para negociar con los Trév Duvárdain.\
\
Debes escuchar mientras Crannog se dirige a los Trév Gállorg y a los Trév Duvárdain.","Con el fragmento de Tauressar destruido, los siervos del juramento liberados y los últimos vestigios de la Corona de Hierro llevados a la ruina, un nuevo día incierto, pero esperanzador, amanece en Angmar.","Habla con Crannog"}},
[6801]={nameES="Instance: As Near as May Be",objectivesES={"Habla con Candaith","Talk to the exhausted Ranger","Halbarad is waiting to speak with you outside the ring-forges.","Treasure-coffers from Minas Elendúr can be found in the corner of the ruins.\
\
Fúsi Gem-cutter has asked you to bring him more gold from the coffers you retrieved from Minas Elendúr.","Instance: As Near as May Be","Fúsi receives the gold with an appraising look","Golodir has remained at the entrance courtyard of the ring-forges in order to delay the attacking uruks. He needs your help.","Fúsi Gem-cutter has emerged from the ring-forges with a request for you.","The uruks have been defeated","Habla con Halbarad","Investigate the distant shout","What danger has come to the ring-forges, and what does it signify for the Grey Company?","Habla con Elrohir","An exhausted Ranger stands before you, his breath ragged and uneven","Habla con Golodir","The uruks have been defeated and the plans of the Grey Company remain intact.","Talk to Fúsi Gem-cutter","Halbarad's plan is set into motion: for Fúni Gem-cutter to fashion imitations of Aragorn's ring of Barahir, based on Candaith's description.","Candaith has asked to speak with you, if you have a moment to spare.","A distant shout has broken the stillness. What has happened?","Elrohir is waiting for you in the courtyard north of Candaith and Halbarad.","Pick up a treasure-coffer from the corner of the room where they are stored"}},
[6802]={nameES="Instance: Ashâmi's Challenge",objectivesES={"Speak with Ashâmi to continue the hunt for Kanagir","Speak with Ashâmi","You survived the attack by Kanagir","She scans the woods and speaks softly.\
\
'I kissed him. It was spontaneous, something I never expected do.\
\
'I have not often allowed anyone to get close to me.\
\
'My mother's disposition, love of life, and attitude of defiance in the face of great oppression shaped me. I am who am I because of her. Her marriage to my father was arranged. I never understood how she came to care for him.\
\
'But, Raphûz,-'\
\
She stops, alerted to a sound.\
\
'What was that?'","Ashâmi appears a bit shaken as she looks over the woods. You, too, have an uneasy feeling in these woods.","There has been no sign of the serval Numûru described to Ashâmi. The woods are eerily still and quiet.","In order to prove their mettle Raphûz and Ashâmi were tasked by Numûru to prove their abilities while confronting their fears. Ashâmi must face a fearsome serval in Imhûlar.","Speak with Ashâmi to begin the hunt","Speak with Ashâmi about how to proceed","Ashâmi slows to a stop peering through the woods","Ashâmi looks eager to speak after surviving the ambush","Instance: Ashâmi's Challenge","Ashâmi stopped her search and looked back into the woods. Something still feels off.","There is still no sign of Kanagir","Kanagir proved a true hunter. You and Ashâmi survived and should discuss a return to Urmâkh.","Ashâmi looks shaken, but resolute. The serval pack attacked without warning. The serval Kanagir, as described, was not among them. You feel like you are being stalked."}},
[6803]={nameES="Instance: Assault on Bardh-dorám",objectivesES={"Instance: Assault on Bardh-dorám","You should speak with Reeve Fríthild before starting your attack.","Defeat the gate-guard and its minions.","Talk to Reeve Fríthild","Escape from Bardh-dorám through the postern gate.","Defeat Mabaj and his minions","Defeated Mabaj and his minions","Defeat the gate-guard and its minions","You have accompanied Reeve Fríthild, Thane Ordlac, and Dudsig to the enemy encampment of Bardh-dorám.","Escape from Bardh-dorám through the postern gate","<rgb=#FF0000>Reeve Fríthild has been defeated</rgb>","Defeat Mabaj and his minions.","<rgb=#FF0000>Reeve Fríthild must survive</rgb>","Defeat Ushatar and his minions.","Defeated Ushatar and his minions","Defeat Ushatar and his minions","Defeat Illska and his minions.","Defeat Illska and his minions","Defeated Illska and his minions","Defeated the gate-guard and its minions"}},
[6804]={nameES="Instancia: Asalto a Pasohendido",objectivesES={"You and the dwarves have followed the trail of the Angmarim into Clovengap, where you hope you will find some sign of the Black Stone Anvil's passage.","Talk to Bósi near the entrance to Clovengap","Talk to Bori by the warg corpse in Clovengap","Listen to the dwarves discuss the situation in Clovengap","The dwarves have discovered the corpse of an Angmarim cultist not far from the first body you encountered in Clovengap.","You have fended off the wargs... for now.","Bori and the other dwarves gather around the warg corpse you found near the entrance to Clovengap.","The dwarves have discovered the corpse of a warg among the mist-laden grasses of Clovengap.","Bósi stands by the entrance to Clovengap.","The dwarves discuss the violence that has been done here in Clovengap; what does it mean for the safety of your travelling party?","This corpse has been torn by the sharp claws of wargs","Examine the warg corpse","Instancia: Asalto a Pasohendido","The corpse of this warg is marked by fire, and smells of sorcery","There are wolf-voices on the wind, and it seems the dwarves do not have long to prepare before the wargs attack!","Talk to Bósi in Clovengap","Examine the corpse of the Angmarim cultist","Remain alert for the return of the wargs"}},
[6805]={nameES="Instancia: Asalto a Rath Teraig",objectivesES={"Habla con Avorthal","Avorthal busca a Skorgrim Duramano en el valle de Rath Teraig, infestado de trasgos.\
\
Avorthal ha prometido la fuerza de su brazo a tu causa y busca vengarse de Skorgrim por el daño que ha causado a los pueblos de Ered Luin.","Skorgrim Duramano ha escapado. Avorthal te espera para hablar sobre el curso que debes tomar a continuación.","Instancia: Asalto a Rath Teraig","Avorthal busca a Skorgrim Duramano en el valle de Rath Teraig, infestado de trasgos.\
\
Un ataque sorpresa de los trasgos ha diezmado las filas de los Pueblos Libres en Rath Teraig, y ahora Avorthal lidera un contraataque contra los trasgos que acechan en las alturas.","Avorthal busca a Skorgrim Duramano en el valle de Rath Teraig, infestado de trasgos.\
\
Avorthal ha jurado rescatar a Sara Roblecorazón, que está cautiva de los trasgos en Rath Teraig, y dejar de preocuparse por el destino de su padre hasta que ella esté libre.","Los enanos y los Elfos de Ered Luin han comenzado su asalto contra el ejército trasgo en el desfiladero de Rath Teraig, y Langlas te ha enviado tras las líneas enemigas para reunirte con Avorthal."}},
[6806]={nameES="Instance: Assembly of the Avanc-lûth",objectivesES={}},
[6807]={nameES="Instancia: En una encrucijada",objectivesES={"Escucha a escondidas a Lagordal y a la espía","Espera a que Erlys interrogue a Lagordal","Todavía queda la cuestión del destino de Lagordal.","<rgb=#FF0000>¡Igrain ha sido derrotada!</rgb>","Instancia: En una encrucijada","Habla con la montaraz","Te has alejado demasiado de Erlys e Igrain","Deberías hablar con Erlys antes de acercarte a Tornhad.","La espía se ha percatado de tu presencia.\
\
Deberías enfrentarte a ella y a Lagordal junto con tus aliados.","Deberías esperar nuevas órdenes de Erlys.","Espera nuevas órdenes de Erlys","La espía ha sido derrotada, pero Lagordal sobrevive.","El enfrentamiento ha terminado de forma violenta.\
\
Deberías defender a Erlys e Igrain.","Habla con Erlys","Sigue a Erlys","Libera a Cariad de sus ataduras","Defiende a Erlys e Igrain","Erlys te ha ordenado que liberes a Cariad.","Espera la sentencia de Lagordal","Enfréntate a Lagordal y a la espía","Una montaraz ha exigido saber el motivo de la presencia de los dunlendinos aquí.\
\
Deberías contarle lo que ha pasado.","Has ayudado a liberar a Cariad y a poner fin a las intrigas de Lagordal.\
\
Deberías hablar con Erlys.","<rgb=#FF0000>¡Erlys ha sido derrotada!</rgb>","Deberías seguir a Erlys.","<rgb=#FF0000>No te alejes demasiado de Erlys e Igrain</rgb>"}},
[6808]={nameES="Instancia: En la Piedra de Erech",objectivesES={"Talk to Britou","Examine the disturbing idol erected by the Orcs in Garth Lotheg","Talk to Isildur","Instancia: En la Piedra de Erech","You are Iarvund, a soldier of the young Kingdom of Gondor, come to the Hill of Erech with your friend Urcheneb to serve your master Isildur.","Wait for the Men of the Mountain to arrive","Isildur is in the centre of Garth Lotheg, waiting to speak with you about the disturbing idol of Sauron the Orcs erected there.","The Orcs have erected a disturbing idol in the centre of Garth Lotheg.","Isildur is standing by the Stone of Erech, waiting to speak with you.","Talk to Dorwë","The Men of the Mountain have arrived. Will they now swear the oath of allegiance to Isildur?","Talk to King Rioc","Support Isildur as he curses the Men of the Mountain for their refusal","Candaith is telling you the tale of the Oath-breakers and the Paths of the Dead.","Many years passed, and a shadow fell upon the Kingdom of Gondor.","Candaith is continuing the story of Isildur and the oath of the Men of the Mountain.","King Rioc and the Men of the Mountain have come to Erech, summoned by Isildur to fulfill their oath.","It is as Isildur feared. Garth Lotheg has been besieged by Orcs, and its defenders slain.","Talk to Urcheneb","The Men of the Mountain have arrived, but they refuse to honour the terms of their oath.","Urcheneb and Isildur are on the summit of Erech.","Talk to Bodúan","Isildur has asked you to look for the Men of the Mountain to arrive from the north slope of the hill of Erech.\
\
Isildur and his trusted soldiers have come to Erech and now wait for the arrival of the Men of the Mountain.","Witness the meeting between Isildur and the Men of the Mountain","Isildur is at the summit by the Stone of Erech, waiting for the Men of the Mountain to arrive and fulfill their oath.","Isildur is at the summit of Erech.","Listen to Candaith continue the telling of the tale","Listen to Candaith's story continue","The King of the Mountain has sworn to fight against Sauron should he return to Middle-earth, and in return, his people will have the aid of Gondor.","Isildur has returned to the Stone of Erech to summon the Men of the Mountain to fulfill their oath, but they have not yet arrived."}},
[6809]={nameES="Instancia: En la Cima de la Isla",objectivesES={"Instancia: En la Cima de la Isla","Balakhâd has expressed a desire to speak with you instead of fighting.","Sigileth has tracked Balakhâd and Nakási to the island of Kasukhín, in the middle of the Fearwater.","Sigileth is eager to end the threat posed by Balakhâd and Nakási.","Corudan has been grievously injured by Nakási's deadly blade.","Talk to Sigileth on the island of Kasukhín","Stand your ground against Balakhâd","Examine Corudan's wound","Balakhâd has attempted to convince you of the rightness of his position.","Nakási has discovered your attempt to destroy the Song of Waves and Wind!","Defeat Balakhâd on the island of Kasukhín","Delay Nakási long enough for Cúridwan to finish her mission","Talk to Balakhâd on the island of Kasukhín","Words will not appease Balakhâd. Only combat will suffice!","Nakási and Balakhâd escape to the surviving ships of the fleet!"}},
[6810]={nameES="Instancia: Ataque a Zudrugund",objectivesES={"Núrzumgrat has left a mighty troll to defend the span below Zudrugund. It must be defeated if you are to reach the top.","You have repelled the attack","You have defeated the Defender of the Span","Fight your way further up the path and talk to Candaith","Now that the Defender of the Span is defeated, you can approach Zudrugund, where the leader of the uruks confronts the dwarves.","Instancia: Ataque a Zudrugund","Talk to Nár outside Zudrugund","Defeat the Defender of the Span","Candaith is further up the path to Zudrugund.","Talk to Radanir on the path up to Zudrugund","If Ergothorn can be trusted, a warband of uruks marches on Zudrugund from the south, with orders involving Nár that could endanger the errand of the Grey Company.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>This quest is meant for a fellowship. If you choose to undertake this quest solo, you will receive an Inspired Greatness bonus, but the challenge will be great.</rgb>","Nár is outside Zudrugund, and you should speak to him now that the uruks are defeated.","You have come with Radanir to Zudrugund in pursuit of the uruk-band.","Fight your way up the path to Zudrugund and talk to Calenglad"}},
[6811]={nameES="Instancia: Despierto por fin",objectivesES={"The Ent stares down at the bird's lifeless body. A strange expression plays across his eyes.\
\
'I see....'","You have found Oldheart's little bird-friend...dead, suffocated by the pollutants of the Orcs and Uruks crossing Fangorn from Isengard to Rohan.","You have picked up Oldheart's fallen friend","Bring the bird to Oldheart","Oldheart stops at the edge of the polluted pond","You should follow Oldheart.","Instancia: Despierto por fin","Oldheart is in Fangorn.","Oldheart is at the pond's edge in Fangorn.","Oldheart stops at the edge of the pond and turns around expectantly","Oldheart speaks, his voice slow from disuse, but the tone of sadness is unmistakeable","Speak with Oldheart, for the other Ents approach","Tell Oldheart of the little bird's fate","The dead bird can be found in the middle of the murky, foul pond.","Talk to Oldheart","Oldheart stands at the edge of his meadow in Fangorn.\
\
You should speak with Oldheart.","You awakened the Ents of Fangorn's eaves","You are tempted to lie to Oldheart to spare the Ent his feelings, but it will not do. Those keen eyes will see through it at once.\
\
You gently relay your tale to Oldheart, of the Orcs of Saruman, the sullied water, and the little victim -- a bird that did nothing but pass unwitting through the cloud of death that creeps upon all the lands of Middle-earth.","The Ent rumbles softly as he searches for a voice that has not oft been used for many years.\
\
'Hrum. Where is my little friend? Please bring him to me.'","Follow Oldheart","You should talk to Oldheart.","Pick up the little bird","The Ents are awake...."}},
[6812]={nameES="Instancia: El Despertar",objectivesES={"Hermáth Stormhammer can be found at Abkân'aban, the Stone of Wakening.\
\
You have fought your way to the White Stone Forge, but Allaban the Collector and his forces will soon arrive at Abkân'aban. You should talk to Hermáth Stormhammer.","Spall and Thrástan can be found at Abkân'aban, the Stone of Wakening.\
\
Despite all peril, Spall and Thrástan have accompanied you to Abkân'aban to confront the Iron Crown. You should talk to Spall and Thrástan.","Allaban the Collector and the Iron Crown can be found at Abkân'aban, the Stone of Wakening.\
\
Allaban the Collector and the Iron Crown have arrived at Abkân'aban. You should confront them and prevent them from laying claim to the White Stone Forge.","As the last of the Angmarim of the Iron Crown falls defeated, Hermáth calls you over","Hermáth Stormhammer can be found at Abkân'aban, the Stone of Wakening.\
\
You have accompanied Hermáth Stormhammer and his warriors to confront the Iron Crown at Abkân'aban. You should talk to Hermáth Stormhammer.","Talk to Spall","Thrástan can be found at Abkân'aban, the Stone of Wakening.\
\
After escorting Thrástan to the White Stone Forge, it has sprung to life. You should talk to Thrástan.","Thrástan can be found at Abkân'aban, the Stone of Wakening.\
\
Thrástan has thanked you for your aid and asked you to bear witness to his \\qawakening\\q. You should honour Thrástan's wishes.","As Tamindur descends, you see Allaban and the Iron Crown preparing to attack!","Without hesitation, the Forge-servant strides forth","Hermáth Stormhammer can be found at Abkân'aban, the Stone of Wakening.\
\
The Forge-servant has used his ancient power to defeat Allaban the Collector and the Iron Crown at Abkân'aban. You should talk to Hermáth Stormhammer.","Witness the wrath of the Forge-servant","Hermáth Stormhammer can be found at Abkân'aban, the Stone of Wakening.\
\
You have spoken to Spall and Thrástan and they intend to do what they can to repel the Iron Crown. You should talk to Hermáth Stormhammer.","The Iron Crown can be found at Abkân'aban.\
\
You should follow Hermáth Stormhammer and do what you can to repel the Iron Crown from the Stone of Wakening.","Witness Thrástan's awakening","Talk to the Forge-servant","The Forge-servant can be found at Abkân'aban, the Stone of Wakening.\
\
The Forge-servant is confronting Allaban the Collector and the Iron Crown. You should bear witness to the Forge-servant's wrath.","Confront Allaban the Collector and the Iron Crown","All that remains where Allaban the Collector once stood is a pillar of basalt!","At Abkân'aban, the Stone of Wakening, the Angmarim of the Iron Crown seek to master the white forge of Durin the Deathless, forever defiling the hallowed caverns of Gloomingtarn.","As if in answer, the ancient forge springs to life at your approach!","Instancia: El Despertar","The Forge-servant can be found at Abkân'aban, the Stone of Wakening.\
\
By some ancient magic, Thrástan has been returned to his true form: the Forge-servant. You should talk to the Forge-servant.","The White Stone Forge can be found atop Abkân'aban, the Stone of Wakening.\
\
With sudden clarity, Thrástan wishes to return to the White Stone Forge. You should escort Thrástan to the White Stone Forge.","Talk to Thrástan","Fight through the Iron Crown to the White Stone Forge atop Abkân'aban","Escort Thrástan to the White Stone Forge","As the flames fade around you, an imposing figure appears where Thrástan stood","Talk to Hermáth Stormhammer","Thrástan can be found at Abkân'aban, the Stone of Wakening.\
\
Although Allaban the Collector and the forces of the Iron Crown will soon arrive, Hermáth Stormhammer has asked you to escort Thrástan to the White Stone Forge. You should talk to Thrástan."}},
[6813]={nameES="Instancia: Azagath Perseguido",objectivesES={"Nauriel has not forgotten the injuries done to her family by the Kindred of the Coins, and she wants to pursue Azagath and his fleeing allies as they attempt to escape the Citadel of Winds.","Follow Azagath's trail through the door and outside the Citadel of Winds","Nauriel is within the great hall of the Citadel of Winds, ready to pursue Azagath and his allies.","Azagath and his allies fled outside the Citadel of Winds by making use of the door at the bottom of the stairs.","Talk to Nauriel outside the Citadel of Winds","Ushu wants to speak to you in the Citadel of Winds.","Follow Nauriel to the docks outside the Citadel of Winds","Follow Ushu and Enât","Azagath and his allies have escaped from the island on which stands the Citadel of Winds.","Nauriel is waiting to speak with you within the Citadel of Winds.","Talk to the observant dock-worker outside the Citadel of Winds","Nauriel has come with you outside the Citadel of Winds in pursuit of Azagath.","Nauriel desires to chase after Azagath and his allies as they flee deeper into the Citadel of Winds.","Talk to Ushu in the Citadel of Winds","Talk to Nauriel in the Citadel of Winds","Instancia: Azagath Perseguido","Ushu has agreed to show you and Nauriel the passage through which Azagath and his allies fled.","The nearby dock-worker may know where Azagath and his allies fled."}},
[6814]={nameES="Instancia: Balakhôr el Azote",objectivesES={"Balakhôr has offered you a drink from his collection of wines.","Talk to Lothíriel and prepare to depart for the Night-jewel","Instancia: Balakhôr el Azote","Lothíriel is in the Great Hall of Dol Amroth.\
\
Balakhôr has sent a summons to Lothíriel to treat with him on his flagship, the Night-jewel.","Talk to Lothíriel","Balakhôr stands on the deck of the Night-jewel, waiting to hear why Lothíriel did not answer his summons.","Dorthaneth has come to the Great Hall of Dol Amroth to advise her friend Lothíriel.","Talk to Dorthaneth","Lothíriel is in the Great Hall of Dol Amroth. She has asked for your advice concerning Balakhôr's proposal that she treat with him on the deck of his flagship.","Accept or refuse Balakhôr's offer","Step off the side of the Night-jewel","Umer, the Corsair emissary, has rowed you to the Night-jewel and is now ready to bring you to Balakhôr.","Dorthaneth is in the Great Hall of Dol Amroth. She has asked if you are willing to go to the Night-jewel in Lothíriel's stead.","The corsair rowed you to the Night-jewel in awkward and unpleasant silence","Balakhôr has done enough talking. Now it is time for you to make your own demands of the Corsair leader.","Talk to Balakhôr","Balakhôr has summoned Lothíriel to treat with him on his flagship, the Night-jewel.","The wine is among the best you have ever tasted","Balakhôr's eyes flash angrily at your refusal","Balakhôr is on the deck of the Night-jewel, and has more to say to you.","Make your own demands of Balakhôr","Balakhôr has refused your demands, and instead has made you an offer: to step off the side of the Night-jewel and swim to shore.","You are walking with Balakhôr on the deck of the Night-jewel, remaining alert for any sign of treachery.","Give Lothíriel your advice on her course of action","You have come to the Night-jewel to treat with Balakhôr about the war.","Lothíriel is in the Great Hall of Dol Amroth.\
\
You have agreed to meet with Balakhôr on his flagship, the Night-jewel, in Lothíriel's stead.","Talk to Umer on the deck of the Night-jewel","Go to the Night-jewel and meet with Balakhôr"}},
[6815]={nameES="Instancia: La perdición del Rey Elfo",objectivesES={"King Thranduil is at Torech Emel.\
\
After threatening King Thranduil, the bloated and sickly Iphantemel welcomed her own end. You should talk to King Thranduil.","Talk to King Thranduil","Despite uncovering evidence that the Weeping Warrior still lurks within Eryn Lasgalen, King Thranduil has turned his attention to his hated foe of old: Iphantemel.","<rgb=#FF0000>King Thranduil has been defeated!</rgb>","King Thranduil is standing in the webbed hollow in Torech Emel.\
\
You have repelled an attack by the children of Iphantemel, but it seems the Old Mother may have called off her children.","Confront Iphantemel","King Thranduil is at Torech Emel.\
\
You have come to a webbed hollow in Torech Emel and learned that Iphantemel dwells in the nearby cavern. You should talk to King Thranduil.","Instancia: La perdición del Rey Elfo","You are being attacked by Iphantemel's spiders in Torech Emel.","King Thranduil's scout is speaking to him.","<rgb=#FF0000>King Thranduil must not be defeated</rgb>","Iphantemel's massive form falls lifeless to the ground...","Repel the spider ambush in Torech Emel","King Thranduil beckons you over...","King Thranduil is standing in Torech Emel.\
\
You have come to Torech Emel to confront and defeat the Great Spider, Iphantemel. You should talk to King Thranduil.","Follow King Thranduil into Torech Emel","One of King Thranduil's scouts stands watch at the edge of a thickly-webbed hollow...","Iphantemel can be found in a small cavern in Torech Emel.\
\
Iphantemel has called off her children and awaits King Thranduil.","Listen to King Thranduil and his scout","King Thranduil is at Torech Emel.\
\
King Thranduil intends to confront the Old Mother, but he is unnerved by the lack of spiders at Torech Emel. You should follow him and remain on guard."}},
[6816]={nameES="Instancia: Barad Tironn",objectivesES={"Encuentra a Laerdan","Entra en Barad Tironn y habla con Forchon.","Has descubierto que Laerdan no fue asesinado y que fue retenido en Barad Tironn para ser interrogado.","Éin derrotado","Instancia: Barad Tironn","Entra en Barad Tironn y encuentra a Laerdan.","Espera a Forchon","Espera a Forchon en Barad Tironn"}},
[6817]={nameES="Instancia: Irrumpiendo en los cuarteles",objectivesES={}},
[6818]={nameES="Instancia: Batalla por los Confines Superiores",objectivesES={"Defeat the remaining hobgoblins.","Defeat the remaining hobgoblins","Talk to Gazathrug.","Find a good location to spy on the Orcs.","Find a good location to spy on the Orcs","Listen to the Orc factions","A group of Orcs led by Gazathrug has converged with a group of hobgoblins","Defeat Gazathrug.","Talk to Hetbrúda","Gazathrug picks himself up, sword in hand, to die in battle","A large group of Orcs gathers close to here!","Talk to Gazathrug","Instancia: Batalla por los Confines Superiores","Gazathrug, still breathing, beckons you closer","Gazathrug falls in combat","Now is the time to take on the last few remaining hobgoblins!","Defeat Gazathrug","Talk to Hetbrúda.","Listen to the Orc factions.","Gazathrug's fear of losing the Upper Reaches of Máttugard are quite warranted."}},
[6819]={nameES="Instancia: Batalla por Hamât, Parte 2",objectivesES={"Take the hilltop from Ekhamâti forces.","Speak with Mizâdi on the hilltop outside of Dun Shûma","Take the hilltop from Ekhamâti forces","Defend the hilltop from Ekhamâti forces until reinforcements arrive!","Defend the hilltop from Ekhamâti forces until reinforcements arrive","Defeat Ekhamati forces and destroy Ekhamâti tar pots as you move toward the hilltop.","Set up camp on the hilltop outside of Khud Zagin.","Mizâdi has faltered!","Set up barricades around the hilltop encampment.","Speak with Mizâdi on the battlefield outside Dun Shûma","Speak with Mizâdi on the battlefield outside Dun Shûma.","Mizâdi has tracked Bârshud to the fortress of Dun Shûma in Khûd Zagin. The time has come to meet Bârshud in pitched battle and defeat him for good.","<rgb=#ff0000>Mizâdi must not falter</rgb>","Speak with Mizâdi in Khûd Zagin on the hilltop outside of Dun Shûma.","Instancia: Batalla por Hamât, Parte 2"}},
[6820]={nameES="Instancia: Batalla por Hamât, Parte 3",objectivesES={"Push into Dun Shûma and end the threat of Bârshud!","Speak with Mizâdi in Dun Shûma.","Defeat the Ekhamâti forces!","Defeat the Mûmak!","Enter the inner courtyard of Dun Shûma","Instancia: Batalla por Hamât, Parte 3","Make your way toward the inner courtyard of Dun Shûma with Mizâdi","Make your way down the hilltop and toward the inner courtyard of Dun Shûma with Mizâdi.","Listen to Mizâdi and Bârshud II.","Defeat the Mûmak","Make your way toward the inner courtyard of Dun Shûma with Mizâdi.","Mizâdi has faltered!","Defeat Ekhamâti forces and treat the wounded Subuzûri at Dun Shûma.","Enter the inner courtyard of Dun Shûma.","Speak with Mizâdi in Dun Shûma","Defeat the Ekhamâti forces","<rgb=#ff0000>Mizâdi must not falter</rgb>","Listen to Mizâdi and Bârshud II"}},
[6821]={nameES="Instancia: La Batalla por Maurûsh",objectivesES={"You have arrived at the entrance into Maurûsh. Speak with Galâmka when you are ready to continue the fight.","An Orc ambush. Defeat them!","Enter the passage from Ub Nishir","Reconvene with Galamka at the top of the stairs in the stronghold of Maurûsh to bring the fight to the leader of the Orcs here.","Escape Maurûsh back to the mountain passage","You have made it to Râkdakul, the Utûgi who is leading the Orcs here in Maurûsh. He must be stopped so the stronghold can be reclaimed.","Defeat the Orcs guarding the stairs","You enter the passage from Ub Nishir, the battle for Maurûsh has begun!","Instancia: La Batalla por Maurûsh","More Orcs are coming. Defend yourself!","Speak with Galâmka","The stairs are cleared. Reconvene with Galâmka","Proceed out of the passage and into the stronghold of Maurûsh to continue the battle.","You escaped from Maurûsh and the Orcs","Follow Galâmka through the passage to reach Maurûsh.","Fight with Galâmka to retake the stronghold of Maurûsh from the Orcs.","Continue following Galâmka through the passage to get to the stronghold of Maurûsh.","Follow Galâmka through the passage","Defeat the Orcs","Galâmka takes a moment to catch his breath.\
\
'I did not expect the Orcs to have overrun this passage. No matter, we must press on.\
\
'This is the entrance into Maurûsh. Here is where we will take our stand. Are you ready, friend?'","Orcs have ambushed you inside the passage to Maurûsh. Defeat them!","Galâmka has fallen! The battle for Maurûsh has been lost!","More Orcs have spotted you and want to prevent you from reaching Maurûsh. Defeat them and continue the fight.","The fight in Maurûsh continues. You must push your way up the stairs to bring the battle to the leader of the Orcs.","Enter into the passage from Ub Nishir to begin the attack on the Orcs in Maurûsh.","Exit the passage into the stronghold of Maurûsh","Escape back to the mountain passage!","Reconvene with Galamka at the top of the stairs","Râkdakul and the Orcs proved too powerful. Escape Maurûsh back into the mountain passage!","Continue through the passage","Defeat Râkdakul and reclaim Maurûsh","You have defeated the Orc ambush. Follow Galâmka as he leads you through the passage to Maurûsh."}},
[6822]={nameES="Instancia: Ante las Puertas de Durin",objectivesES={"Wárr está supervisando los trabajos en la Puerta de Acebeda, al este del pequeño puesto avanzado y alrededor del lago.\
\
Mientras Bósi ayuda con los preparativos en el pequeño puesto avanzado, quiere que lleves los picos reparados a Wárr en la Puerta de Acebeda.","Enanos que arrojan piedras al agua se pueden encontrar a lo largo de las orillas del lago.\
\
Brogur tiene un mal presentimiento sobre el lago frente a la Puerta de Acebeda y te ha pedido que hagas que los enanos dejen de perturbar el agua.","Espera a que lleguen más enanos.","El pequeño puesto avanzado se encuentra al otro lado del lago, donde defendiste a Bósi de los lobos de sombra que atacaban.\
\
Los enanos están intentando luchar contra la misteriosa criatura que ahora acecha fuera de los Muros de Moria. Bósi te ha ordenado que te apresures al pequeño puesto avanzado para buscar ayuda para los enanos desesperados.","Brogur está frente a la Puerta de Acebeda.\
\
Brogur está esperando para hablar contigo sobre cómo ayudar a la expedición en la Puerta de Acebeda.","Bósi está fuera de la Puerta de Acebeda.\
\
Bósi ha llegado y te espera para hablar contigo.","La caja se encuentra al sur de Wárr y junto a Brogur, frente a la Puerta de Acebeda.\
\
Wárr te ha pedido que dejes los picos reparados en una caja para su uso futuro.","Habla con Brogur.","El pequeño puesto avanzado que está a lo largo del camino que serpentea hasta el lago tranquilo frente a la Puerta de Acebeda está siendo atacado.\
\
Bósi y los enanos necesitan tu ayuda para defender el puesto avanzado de los lobos de las sombras.","Bósi está en el pequeño puesto avanzado donde luchaste contra los lobos de sombra, al otro lado del lago amenazante.\
\
Los enanos están en plena retirada ante la misteriosa criatura en el lago, y deberías hablar con Bósi antes de que la expedición se convierta en una derrota.","Algunas piedras grandes han bloqueado las Puertas de Durin, que se encuentran en los Muros de Moria, a orillas del Lago Negro.\
\
Bósi cree que sería un honor para ti ayudar a despejar algunos de los escombros de la Puerta de Acebeda.","Habla con Bósi","Lleva los picos reparados a Wárr","Mantente en guardia","Regresa al pequeño puesto avanzado y busca ayuda","Los trabajadores de la expedición de Bósi y Brogur casi han desenterrado los escombros que bloquean la Puerta de Acebeda, y ha llegado el momento de entrar en Khazad-dûm.","Brogur está fuera de la Puerta de Acebeda.\
\
Has logrado que los enanos dejen de perturbar las aguas del lago frente a la Puerta de Acebeda, y ahora deberías regresar con Brogur.","Instancia: Ante las Puertas de Durin","Los enanos están reunidos al borde del lago, fuera de la Puerta de Acebeda.\
\
La Puerta de Acebeda está casi abierta y los enanos se preparan para entrar en las minas.","Bósi está de pie en la pendiente que serpentea más allá del pequeño puesto avanzado enano, con vista al lago tranquilo.\
\
Has venido con Bósi por el camino sinuoso que conduce a la Puerta de Acebeda, y él está esperando para hablar contigo.","Habla con Bósi.","Coloca los picos reparados en la caja"}},
[6823]={nameES="Instance: Behind Bars",objectivesES={"Instance: Behind Bars","Find the key to Dagoras' cell in the jailor's quarters.","Braigiar believes that his captain, Dagoras, has been captured by the Dunlending deserters after going to negotiate an agreement with them. He has asked you to try to find and rescue Dagoras from Lhe Lhechu.","Find the key to Dagoras' cell","You have rescued Dagoras","Release Dagoras from his cell","Dagoras has made it to the cave exit","Speak with Dagoras and find a way to release him from his cell.","You have found the key","Help Dagoras escape","Talk to Dagoras","Release Dagoras from his cell.","Speak with Dagoras again.","Escape from Lhe Lhechu with Dagoras."}},
[6824]={nameES="Instancia: Bajo el Agujalúgubre",objectivesES={"La historia de Finrúth continúa en las profundidades de Tûr Fúar...","Finrúth está preparada para contar la historia de su tiempo con la Corona de Hierro en el Monte Gundabad.\
\
Debes hablar con Finrúth.","Habla con Finrúth","Escucha la historia de Finrúth","Después de la caída de Mordirith y el abandono de Carn Dûm, los miembros de las tribus Trév Duvárdain se dividieron cada vez más, lo que llevó a muchos a abandonar la Corona de Hierro. Sin embargo, muchos todavía permanecieron entre los Trév Duvárdain y, ya sea por ignorancia o por ceguera voluntaria ante la verdadera maldad de la Corona de Hierro, la siguieron hasta el Monte Gundabad.","Instancia: Bajo el Agujalúgubre","Finrúth está relatando la historia de su tiempo con la Corona de Hierro en el Monte Gundabad.","La historia de Finrúth continúa en Agal Dûn...","Finrúth está lista para continuar el relato de su tiempo entre la Corona de Hierro en el Monte Gundabad.\
\
Debes hablar con Finrúth."}},
[6825]={nameES="Instancia: Bajo los Campos Verdes",objectivesES={"Has encontrado al Frontero Piedraprima","Habla con Halros","Encuentra al Frontero Piedraprima","El Frontero Piedraprima se ha herido en las cuevas situadas bajo los Campos Verdes.\
\
Has encontrado al Frontero Piedraprima, pero los trasgos lo han herido.","Instancia: Bajo los Campos Verdes","Halros ha encontrado al fin un camino que lleva a la \\qsala del trono\\q de Lubach y te espera para hablar de tu victoria.","La red de cuevas bajo los Campos Verdes parece ser extensa y se ha convertido en el hogar de una peligrosa tribu de trasgos.","El Frontero Piedraprima se encuentra en algún lugar de las cuevas de los trasgos y puede estar en peligro.\
\
Halros te ha enviado a buscar al Frontero Piedraprima bajo los Campos Verdes para salvarlo.","Habla con el Frontero Piedraprima"}},
[6826]={nameES="Instancia: Más allá de la memoria viva",objectivesES={"The dream feels so real to you.","Maintain focus as your dream continues","Enter the tower room in your dream","Your dreaming mind conjures unusual images before you, with familiar voices emerging from unexpected places.","Balakhôr the Scourge glares at you from across the chamber","A feeling of disorientation clouds your mind: this is not the grove of Arwáth","Witness the strange images conjured by your dreaming mind","Listen to unfamiliar voices conjured by your dreaming mind","Even seen through the haze of unreality conjured by your dreaming mind, you can see lines of care and worry on the Wizard's face. Some great effort has left its mark upon him, and his exhaustion is apparent in every movement.","You suffer a feeling of unreality as Corudan's voice emerges from the body of the scorpion.\
\
'She cautioned us that the creatures possess great reserves of patience,' he says.\
\
'They might lie in wait for hours, hidden from careless observation, and strike without any warning.'","Talk to Corudan in your dream","Though he has been dead for months, the image of Balakhôr the Scourge glowers at you from the other side of the tower room.","Balakhôr appears as you remember him.\
\
Months ago, before the end of the War of the Ring, the leader of the Heirs of Castamir stood on the deck of the Night-jewel, defying Aragorn and the Army of the Dead in what proved to be his final moments.","Mithrandir stands within Thuringwath, Valley of the Secret Shadow","Examine the image of Balakhôr the Scourge conjured by your dreaming mind","Familiar images and voices emerge from your dreaming mind.","Despite the comfortable accommodations given to you by Girhâzi, your sleep has been disturbed by strange dreams.","In your dream the Wizard Mithrandir stands before an unpleasant statue in the Valley of the Secret Shadow.","You are gripped with a sense of unreality as an unfamiliar land coalesces before your sleeping eyes.","The tower room in the Citadel of Winds swims from the recesses of your sleeping mind.","Talk to Mithrandir in your dream","An image from the darkest corner of the Morgul Vale swims from the recesses of your mind.","You expected your dreaming mind to bring you a vision of the grove of Arwáth, but it is not so. It seems the course of your dream is not so easily-controlled.","The unnatural flames barring the way into the tower room high within the Citadel of Winds have disappeared, granting you passage.","The hallway outside the tower room in the Citadel of Winds swims from the recesses of your sleeping mind.","Somehow, your unconscious mind knows this wraith to be the Nazgûl known in the annals of Gondor as the Grim Southron... but he and the others of his kind perished with Sauron.\
\
Is this a vision of the distant past, when the Nazgûl still lived?","Examine the image of Mithrandir conjured by your dreaming mind","Examine the image of the Grim Southron conjured by your dreaming mind","Thuringwath swims hazily before your dreaming eyes.","Instancia: Más allá de la memoria viva","Listen to familiar voices conjured by your dreaming mind","Examine the scorpion conjured by your dreaming mind","Unfamiliar images and voices emerge from your dreaming mind, of events you never could have seen."}},
[6827]={nameES="Instancia: La carga de Bingo",objectivesES={"Willem está al sur del puente, en el reino de Rohan.","Bingo ha decidido cruzar el reino de Rohan a pie para evitar tener que montar un caballo.","Habla con Willem al otro lado del puente","Bingo está listo para cruzar al reino de Rohan.","Habla con Bingo junto al puente hacia Rohan","Willem te mira con indiferencia, como diciendo: '¿Qué te tomó tanto tiempo?'\
\
De pronto, sus orejas se mueven y tú también oyes voces guturales. ¡Orcos se acercan desde el sur!","Habla con Egwylf","Habla con Bingo","Has conocido a una mujer llamada Egwylf justo dentro de los límites de Rohan, y está muy interesada en las aventuras de tu pequeño grupo.","Escucha lo que Egwylf tiene que decir sobre Rohan","Bingo está al sur del puente, en el reino de Rohan.","Una mujer de Rohan ha llegado galopando por el camino, impresionada por tu victoria sobre la partida de saqueo orca.","Instancia: La carga de Bingo"}},
[6828]={nameES="Instancia: Montebruno Debilitados",objectivesES={"El bandido moribundo reveló que los Montebruno estaban siendo pagados tanto por alguien del sur como por agentes de Angmar. Cuando intentó reformar la banda sin lealtad a ninguno de los dos, el Enano Pálido lo abatió. Deberías hablar con el Condestable Sotomonte sobre esto.","Habla con el Condestable Sotomonte","Habla con el bandido","En una de las cámaras más profundas del escondite de los Montebruno, encontraste al misterioso Enano amenazando a un bandido. El Enano hirió gravemente al bandido, luego huyó, ordenando a sus enanos que te atacaran.\
\
Condestable Sotomonte te ha pedido que hables con el bandido herido.","Instancia: Montebruno Debilitados","El Condestable Sotomonte viajó contigo hasta el escondite en una cueva de William Zorrillero, el antiguo líder de los Montebruno en la zona de Combe. Zorrillero está muerto, al igual que muchos otros bandidos, pero debes estar seguro de que no han empezado a reunir sus fuerzas de nuevo.","Has protegido al Condestable Sotomonte","Has viajado con el Condestable Sotomonte de Combe a la cueva que los Montebruno utilizaron una vez como escondite."}},
[6829]={nameES="Instancia: La sangre fluye como el vino",objectivesES={"Instancia: La sangre fluye como el vino","TBD"}},
[6830]={nameES="Instancia: La sangre fluye como el vino, parte 2",objectivesES={"TBD","Instancia: La sangre fluye como el vino, parte 2"}},
[6831]={nameES="Instancia: La sangre fluye como el vino, parte 3",objectivesES={"Instancia: La sangre fluye como el vino, parte 3","TBD"}},
[6832]={nameES="Instancia: La sangre fluye como el vino, parte 4",objectivesES={"Instancia: La sangre fluye como el vino, parte 4","TBD"}},
[6833]={nameES="Instancia: La sangre fluye como el vino, parte 5",objectivesES={"TBD","Instancia: La sangre fluye como el vino, parte 5"}},
[6834]={nameES="Instancia: Sangre por Sangre",objectivesES={"Talk to Herion","Erchar can be found in Linhir.\
\
Erchar is fighting against the invaders in Linhir. You should aid him.","Garvir can be found on the ledge above the Gilrain.\
\
You have found Garvir and should aid him before defeating the invaders.","<rgb=#FF0000>Herion must not be defeated</rgb>","Listen to the captain's report","Defend Linhir with Erchar","Aid Erchar in searching for Herion in Linhir","Defeat the Haradrim war-master and his men","Erchar can be found in Linhir.\
\
Erchar is searching for Herion in Linhir. You should follow him.","The Corsairs and Haradrim make ready once more for battle at Linhir as the Heirs of Castamir seek to avenge their fallen.","The Haradrim war-master can be found near the ledge overlooking the Gilrain.\
\
Garvir has been killed by one of the Heirs of Castamir, who called his forces away. You should defeat the remaining men.","Instancia: Sangre por Sangre","DNT","Aid Garvir and defeat the invaders from Lebennin","You have prevailed, but at great cost...","Fight through Linhir with Erchar and Herion to aid Garvir","<rgb=#FF0000>Herion has been defeated!</rgb>","Erchar can be found in Linhir.\
\
You have broken the first assault and should now speak to Erchar.","Erchar can be found in central Linhir.\
\
You have defeated the invaders and beaten back the attack, but at great cost. You should speak to Erchar.","Erchar and Herion can be found in central Linhir.\
\
Erchar and Herion are fighting their way through Linhir to reach Garvir.","<rgb=#FF0000>Erchar has been defeated!</rgb>","<rgb=#FF0000>Erchar must not be defeated</rgb>","Erchar can be found in Linhir.\
\
The Corsairs and Haradrim are attacking Linhir. You should speak to Erchar and defend the city.","The captain can be found in Linhir.\
\
Erchar is speaking with one of his captains. You should listen to the captain's report.","Herion can be found in central Linhir, overlooking the Gilrain.\
\
You have found Herion amidst the battle and should now speak to him.","Talk to Erchar"}},
[6835]={nameES="Instancia: Lazos de Roble y Hierro",objectivesES={"Thromur and Shálun can be found at Amdân.\
\
Shálun has told his tale of the defeat of Urro at Mount Gundabad, but Thromur has suddenly interjected. You should listen to Thromur and Shálun.","Sputtering with rage, Urro falls defeated and succumbs to Thorin's blows with the oaken shield!","Fight through the forest and search for Frerin","Thromur can be found at Amdân.\
\
You have accompanied Thromur to confront Shálun. You should talk to Thromur.","After a tense moment, Shálun lets out a sorrowful sigh","Felled by Orkish arrows, Fundin seemingly met his end defending the vanguard's retreat","You discover Fundin slain in the woods beside Kheled-zâram","Follow Shálun and deliver Urro's hand to Frerin","Follow Thorin and aid Shálun in defeating Urro One-hand","After a long moment, Shálun produces Urro's hand from a small bag on his belt","Investigate the source of the glint","Follow Thromur and confront Shálun","Shálun points toward where he caught sight of the glint","Instancia: Lazos de Roble y Hierro","Thromur can be found at Amdân.\
\
You should offer your reassurance to Thromur by agreeing about the symbolic importance of Urro's hand to Frerin and Durin's Folk.","Follow Shálun and aid Thorin","Thorin can be found at Durin's Stone.\
\
You should follow Thorin and aid Shálun in defeating Urro One-hand.","Shálun can be found at Durin's Stone.\
\
You should follow Shálun and aid Thorin.","Talk to Shálun","Urro turns to challenge Thorin!","Thromur can be found at Amdân.\
\
You should follow Thromur and confront Shálun.","Defeat Urro One-hand","Shálun can be found at Azanulbizar.\
\
You have arrived to discover King Thráin's vanguard beset by Orcs. You should talk to Shálun.","As you approach, Shálun raises a single eyebrow appraisingly","Thromur can be found at Amdân.\
\
Shálun insists that he played a vital role in Frerin's defeat of Urro at Mount Gundabad. You should talk to Thromur.","<rgb=#FF00FF>Agree</rgb> with Thromur and try to convince Shálun to relinquish Urro's hand","Shálun can be found at Amdân.\
\
Shálun insists that he played a vital role in Frerin's defeat of Urro at Mount Gundabad. You should talk to Shálun.","Thorin can be found at Durin's Stone.\
\
You have aided Thorin in defeating Urro One-hand. You should talk to Thorin quickly before tending to Shálun.","Pausing to look around for a moment, Thromur beckons you over","Examine the corpse of Fundin","You should search for what remains of King Thráin's vanguard.","Thromur can be found in the woods to the north-west of Durin's Stone.\
\
After pondering what to do next, Thromur has beckoned you over. You should talk to Thromur.","Stunned at Shálun's assertion, Thromur looks to you","Listen to Thromur and Shálun","Thorin can be found at Durin's Stone.\
\
Thorin has been wounded by Urro One-hand and lays injured. You should talk to Thorin and aid him if you might.","Talk to Thorin","Despite his injuries, Thorin has risen and hewn an oak branch from a nearby tree","Agree with Thromur and try to convince Shálun to relinquish Urro's hand","Talk to Thromur","Shálun can be found at Amdân.\
\
To your surprise, Shálun has produced Urro's hand. You should talk to Shálun.","Shálun can be found at Durin's Stone.\
\
You have arrived to find King Thráin's vanguard in dire need of aid. The King is wounded and Frerin was slain by Urro One-hand.","Follow Thromur and find what remains of King Thráin's vanguard","After finding the corpse of Fundin, Thromur and Shálun are discussing what is to be done.","The glint can be found in the woods to the north-west of Durin's Stone.\
\
Shálun noticed a glint in the dark of the woods of Azanulbizar. You should investigate its source.","Thromur looks to you for reassurance","Shálun can be found at Durin's Stone.\
\
Shálun aided Thorin, but was dealt a fatal blow by Urro One-hand. You should talk to Shálun.","Shálun can be found at Amdân.\
\
You should try to convince Shálun of the symbolic importance of Urro's hand to Frerin and Durin's Folk.","Thromur and Shálun have arrived at the woods to the north-west of Durin's Stone to aid the vanguard, but they are in retreat! You should fight through the forest and aid the vanguard as you continue the search for Frerin.","After King Thráin and his vanguard set out to assault the gates of Khazad-dûm, a sudden revelation threatens to raise tensions between the Longbeards and the Zhélruka at Amdân.","Shálun can be found at Amdân.\
\
You should travel with Shálun to deliver Urro's hand to Frerin.","Urro One-hand can be found at Durin's Stone.\
\
Urro has mortally wounded Shálun. You should aid Thorin in defeating Urro One-hand."}},
[6836]={nameES="Instancia: Borangos el Horror",objectivesES={"Make your way towards Borangos' inner sanctum in Nargroth.","Find a suitable place to hide","Stay hidden and let events transpire.","With the knowledge you now hold, you must speak to Isnír at once!","Borangos approaches!","Upon receiving the remnants of the ancient ward originally used to keep Borangos at bay, Isnír wishes for you to return to Nargroth in the hopes of learning more about the domain of Great Rogmul.","Find a suitable place to hide.","Borangos will not notice you here","Make your way towards Borangos' inner sanctum in Nargroth","Instancia: Borangos el Horror","<rgb=#FF0000>Do not leave your hiding place!</rgb>","Stay hidden and let events transpire"}},
[6837]={nameES="Instancia: Abriéndose paso",objectivesES={"Talk to Bósi, former leader of the Iron Garrison","Rúvaran's forces have been routed, and now Durin is eager to return to the work of breaking through the ice before Gundabad.","Durin, Prince of the Longbeards, and Ingór, Prince of the Zhélruka, have commanded their forces to break through the ice that blocks passage into Gundabad.","Talk to Durin on the landing outside Gundabad","Durin is eager to pass beyond the ice and into Gundabad.","Talk to Prince Ingór at the ice outside Gundabad","Talk to Durin inside Gundabad","Talk to Durin outside the gates of Gundabad","Talk to Venko of the Zhélruka","Prince Ingór desires to wield a sword, not a pick-axe, in service of the effort to gain entrance to Gundabad.","Durin stands on the landing before the gates of Gundabad, eager to pass into the Mountain-home.","Follow Durin","The gates of Gundabad lie before you, atop the stairs.","Climb the stairs and pass through the gates into Gundabad","At long last, Durin has entered the Mountain-home.","Habla con Durin","Talk to Stóthkell, forge-master of the Iron Garrison","<rgb=#FF0000>Durin and Ingór must not be defeated!</rgb>","Durin wishes to observe the progress made by the dwarves of the Gabil'akkâ outside the gates of Gundabad.","Dwarves of the Gabil'akkâ work to break through the ice that blocks passage into Gundabad.","Talk to Imák the Stout-axe","Instancia: Abriéndose paso","Durin has fallen!"}},
[6838]={nameES="Instancia: Rompiendo el Lomo del Jabalí",objectivesES={"Defeat Pakon, the Maldorr Orc-chieftain","The Boar-tribe chieftain is somewhere within their lair.\
\
If you encounter the chieftain of the Boar-tribe, defeat him.","Instancia: Rompiendo el Lomo del Jabalí","Cúthing's plan calls for a single person to sneak into the Boar-tribe Orc-lair and defeat their chieftain.","Defeated Pakon, the Maldorr Orc-chieftain"}},
[6839]={nameES="Instancia: El legado de Bregmor",objectivesES={"Examine the corpse of Bregmor","Experience the vision","Another vision presents itself","Experience the vision.","Examine the rust spot.","Examine the corpse of Bregmor.","Fotri will lead you to the dragon Bregmor's corpse.","The strange vision disperses","There can be no doubt: some of the dragon's bones are not here","Examine the rust spot","Instancia: El legado de Bregmor"}},
[6840]={nameES="Instancia: La alianza rota",objectivesES={"Instancia: La alianza rota","Derrota a los bandidos y Orcos en la cueva.","Has encontrado la cueva. Ahora solo queda entrar, dispersar a los bandidos y Orcos, y derrotar a sus líderes."}},
[6841]={nameES="Instancia: Ajetreo en el Teatro Azul",objectivesES={"Habla con Robbo Moliespalda","Stand at the front of the stage in the Blue Theatre","This does not appear to be the outfit Robbo described...","Deliver the outfit to Polla Stoutley","<rgb=#FF0000>Dance</rgb> for the audience","Watch the Cloudyheads perform in the Blue Theatre","You have found the outfit and should now show it to Polla!","The Cloudyheads have negotiated a performance in the legendary Blue Theatre of Minas Tirith, but now they must think on how best to utilise the theatre's grand scale.","Talk to Polla Stoutley","The Cloudyheads are on stage in the Blue Theatre.\
\
The Cloudyheads are performing, so you should enjoy the show!","Search for the ornate outfit that Robbo described","The stage can be reached by passing through the short halls behind the stage in the Blue Theatre.\
\
Polla has asked you to stall for time as the Cloudyheads finish preparing for their performance. You should try the things she suggested to keep the audience entertained.","Polla Stoutley can be found behind the stage inside the Blue Theatre.\
\
You have tried to keep the audience entertained with varying degrees of success and should now return to Polla.","The audience seems enthralled by your tale!","Robbo Gristback can be found behind the stage in the Blue Theatre.\
\
You have arrived at the Blue Theatre and should now help the Cloudyheads prepare for their performance.","Various outfits can be found in the halls behind the stage inside the Blue Theatre.\
\
Robbo mentioned seeing an outfit in the halls behind the stage. You should search for the most ornate one you can find.","You have reached the front of the stage and should now entertain the audience!","Tell a <rgb=#FF0000>story</rgb> to the audience","Polla Stoutley can be found on the stage in the Blue Theatre.\
\
You have watched the Cloudyheads' performance and should now congratulate Polla and the others.","The audience seems to be tiring of your act...","The audience applauds softly...","Perform a <rgb=#FF0000>handstand</rgb> for the audience","Polla Stoutley can be found behind the stage in the Blue Theatre.\
\
You have found the outfit Robbo described and should now bring it to Polla.","Instancia: Ajetreo en el Teatro Azul"}},
[6842]={nameES="Instancia: Por pasos secretos",objectivesES={"Make your way to the upper levels of Narchost.\
<rgb=#FF0000>Do not be seen by any of your foes!</rgb>","The Rangers move quickly, eager to be done with this evil place","Eager to learn the Enemy's secrets to help Aragorn and the Host of the West, Faeron wants to enter Narchost.","Talk to Faeron inside Narchost","Faeron has returned from scouting the ridge.","Talk to Mincham on the rocky slope","Talk to Mincham inside Narchost","Sounds below you in the tower signal the return of the Orcs","The smell of the burning herbs is most foul","Eavesdrop on the conversation without being seen","An acrid stench fills the air, offending your senses","You have crossed the noxious plains of Dagorlad with the Rangers Faeron and Mincham, scouting the lands through which Aragorn's host must pass.","You have entered Narchost and do not have long before the Orc patrol returns.","Follow Faeron to Narchost","The entrance to Narchost is temporarily unguarded.","You have overheard a conversation between Khôgath the Render and his minion Fulak, but it is not safe to linger within Narchost.","Talk to Faeron on the rocky slope","Mincham is ahead of you on the rocky slope.","The herbs burn with a terrible smell","Enter Narchost and remain alert","Instancia: Por pasos secretos"}},
[6843]={nameES="Instancia: Llamando a Cúridwan",objectivesES={"Glorfindel has spotted enemies ahead.","Inkanûsh and Glorfindel have come to speak with Cúridwan, but as the sun sets upon Imhûlar they are not the only visitors to Kûgrun.","Instancia: Llamando a Cúridwan","You hear someone moving around behind the house!","Listen to the conversation between the Wizard, the Elf, and the hermit in Kûgrun.","Pass through the vines and enter Kûgrun","Talk to Glorfindel on the slope that rises to Kûgrun","Learn from Usakâr what has happened to Cúridwan","The disturbed vines reveal that some of the Orcs have already entered Kûgrun.","Someone hid from the Orcs behind Cúridwan's dwelling.","Inkanûsh stands outside the entrance to Cúridwan's home of Kûgrun.","Usakâr the Hermit may know what happened to Cúridwan.","Orcs and jackals have come to threaten Cúridwan, and must be cleared from Kûgrun.","Listen to the conversation in Kûgrun","Talk to the one who hid from the Orcs behind Cúridwan's dwelling","Talk to Inkanûsh outside the entrance to Cúridwan's home of Kûgrun","Talk to Usakâr the Hermit in Kûgrun","Orcs and jackals have come to threaten Cúridwan, and must be cleared from Kûgrun!","Inkanûsh and Glorfindel have come to Kûgrun in search of Cúridwan.","Defeat all the Orcs and jackals threatening Kûgrun"}},
[6844]={nameES="Instancia: Cese a la resistencia",objectivesES={"Dolpan ha sido derrotado","Gúthi ha pedido que se inutilice la antigua forja de Hurmulkezer para que los orcos no puedan seguir utilizándola contra los enanos de las Profundidades Llameantes.","La antigua forja en lo alto de Hurmulkezer ha sido tomada por los orcos.","Dolpan estaba a punto de forjar un arma en la antigua forja cuando esta quedó inutilizada. Debe ser derrotado.","Derrota a Dolpan","Instancia: Cese a la resistencia","Inutiliza la forja"}},
[6845]={nameES="Instance: Celebration of Victory",objectivesES={"Observe the feast in the Mead Hall of Stoke.","You should speak with Reeve Fríthild.","Thane Ordlac is kneeling beside Reeve Fríthild.\
\
You should bring the water to Thane Ordlac.","Talk to Reeve Fríthild","You should speak with Thane Ordlac.","Collected mug of water","Reeve Fríthild has collapsed","Talk to Thane Ordlac","A mug of water sits on one of the tables below the dais.\
\
Thane Ordlac instructed you to fetch a cup of water.","Collect mug of water","Instance: Celebration of Victory","Observe the festivities in the Mead Hall of Stoke","You have joined Reeve Fríthild and her guests in the Mead Hall of Stoke for a feast celebrating the victory at Bardh-dorám.","Bring the water to Thane Ordlac"}},
[6846]={nameES="Instance: Challenge at the Gate",objectivesES={"One of the Nine known to mortals as The Gloom of Nurn has emerged to answer your challenge at the gates of Dol Guldur. You and your allies must gather all of your strength if you have any hope of defeating him and his forces.","Instance: Challenge at the Gate","Defeat the Gloom of Nurn and his forces before the gates of Dol Guldur.","Defeated the Gloom of Nurn","Derrota a la Languidez de Nurn","Are you prepared to leave the field of battle?","Return to the Stone of Challenge"}},
[6847]={nameES="Instance: Clear the Path",objectivesES={"Defeated the wight-captain","Defeat the wight-captain","Naeglanc has sent you to uncover what is happening in Plas-maru.","Defeat the wights that have arisen within the great cairn of Plas-maru.","Instance: Clear the Path"}},
[6848]={nameES="Instancia: Cerrando el libro",objectivesES={"The Weeping Warrior has arrived at last","Wait by the flat stone for Karazgar to arrive and claim his prize","Instancia: Cerrando el libro","Karazgar has come to meet with you at the Old Ford.","Answer Karazgar","You have decided to deliver the Black Book of Mordor to Karazgar, as he requested.","Place the Black Book of Mordor on the flat stone","Karazgar has agreed to your conditions, and waits for you to set the Black Book on the flat stone.","Give Karazgar your conditions","Karazgar has taken the Black Book of Mordor.","You have chosen to deliver the Black Book of Mordor to Karazgar, and should wait by the flat stone in the Old Ford until he arrives to claim his prize.","Karazgar waits to hear your conditions.","Talk to Karazgar at the Old Ford","Mantente en guardia","Karazgar has asked you a question, and awaits your response."}},
[6849]={nameES="Instancia: Órdenes del Rey",objectivesES={"Talk to Gléowine outside Meduseld","Instancia: Órdenes del Rey","Talk to Gríma outside Meduseld","Gandalf is outside Meduseld, speaking words of wisdom to Théoden.","Talk to Gandalf outside Meduseld","Horn is outside Meduseld, waiting to speak with you.","Gríma has been brought out of Meduseld and awaits the King's judgement.","Stand with Théoden and hear the commands of the king","Gríma has asked to be named steward of Meduseld in Théoden's absence.","Gríma hisses at you, his eyes narrowed unpleasantly.\
\
'Do not disturb my lord more than you have already! He is weary, and needs his rest. Only when you and your irksome friends leave his lands will he be once again at peace.'","Gríma's eyes dart back and forth from face to face, sizing up the assemblage.\
\
'My lord, can you not see what this Wizard and his ragged band seek to achieve? They do not care for your health or for your safety, and seek to lead you into danger. Your death would grieve them little, but there are those close to you who would mourn even the smallest hurt to your person.\
\
'Listen to Gríma, and come back inside. Abandon the madness these cruel ones have instilled in your mind. Let me send them away. Speak not of war! That is a young man's endeavor, and you have ruled the Mark for many seasons. Will you not listen to your faithful Gríma? Send me not away!'","Talk to Aragorn outside Meduseld","Gléowine is outside Meduseld, worrying.","Théoden has emerged from the Golden Hall to look out over his kingdom, and to issue the commands necessary for its survival.","Talk to Éomer outside Meduseld","Aragorn is outside Meduseld, waiting to speak with you.","Talk to Horn outside Meduseld","Théoden stands atop the steps outside Meduseld, gazing out upon his lands."}},
[6850]={nameES="Instancia: Enfrentando a Dravron",objectivesES={"Defeat Dravron and his brigands.","Talk to Dervorin","You set out with Dervorin to confront Dravron.","Approach Dravron","Instancia: Enfrentando a Dravron","Regroup with Dervorin and the workers","Listen to Dervorin and Dravron's conversation.","Listen to Dervorin and Dravron","Dravron attacks!","La lucha ha terminado.\
\
Reagrúpate con los demás.","Talk to Dervorin before the negotiation begins.","<rgb=#FF0000>Dervorin has been defeated!</rgb>","Dervorin sighs.\
\
'I have a long day ahead of me.'","Approach Dravron."}},
[6851]={nameES="Instancia: Policías y ladrones",objectivesES={}},
[6852]={nameES="Instancia: Locura devoradora",objectivesES={"Defeated Head Servant Sintáhi","Thothril the Entangler has begun to take over the minds of the servants in the palace.\
\
You should talk to Razâl.","You have arrived inside the servant's living quarters of the palace.\
\
You should investigate the area.","You have arrived inside the servant's living quarters of the palace.\
\
You should talk to Razâl.","Instancia: Locura devoradora","As the palace of Emax Dûl succumbs to the control of Thothril the Entangler, many civilians have become trapped. It is our duty to free them before they are driven to madness.","You have defeated Thothril's illusions and saved who you can.\
\
You should talk to Razâl.","All that is left to do is to defeat the head servant before she can convert others to Thothril's cause.\
\
You should defeat Head Servant Sintáhi.","Investigate the servants' quarters","Talk to Razâl","Defeat Head Servant Sintáhi","Thothril the Entangler has begun to take over the minds of the servants in the palace.\
\
You should defeat the maddening illusions to save those whose minds are still intact."}},
[6853]={nameES="Instancia: La fuente de la corrupción",objectivesES={"La cascada está en el este de Clovengap.\
\
Rúni el Sabio cree que hay una cueva oculta tras la cascada cercana. Debes encontrar la cueva.","The source of the corruption is deep in the Min Návaid cave in Clovengap.\
\
You should uncover the source of the corrupted sarrowstones and put an end for good to the terrible experiments of Bruidalg the Bloodletter.","Instancia: La fuente de la corrupción","Investigate the dragon bones","Talk to Rúni","Find the secret tunnel","The secret tunnel is within the crystal cave, Min Návaid.\
\
The journal spoke of a secret tunnel whose entrance can be revealed by the light of the candle. With the Angmarim High Priest defeated, you should look for the secret tunnel.","Lore-master Rúni is in the crystal cave.\
\
You should tell Lore-master Rúni that the deed is done.","Defeated Praushod the Foetid","There is a cave behind the waterfall!","Praushod the Foetid lies deeper within Min Návaid.\
\
You should summon Praushod the Foetid by striking the corrupted crystals.","The dragon bones are in Min Návaid.\
\
Lore-master Rúni has asked you to investigate the cave for dragon bones.","Lore-master Rúni waits for you by the falls in western Clovengap.\
\
You should talk to Rúni.","Defeat Bruidalg the Bloodletter","The tunnel is revealed!","Deep in the ground, in crystal-laden, foetid pools, an ancient evil spreads corruption.","Defeated Bruidalg the Bloodletter","Find the crystal cave","Summon Praushod the Foetid"}},
[6854]={nameES="Instancia: Concilio de los Siete",objectivesES={"Dáin can be found at Amdân.\
\
After listening to Thráin's council with the Kings of the Seven Houses, Dáin has beckoned you. You should talk to Dáin.","<rgb=#FF00FF>Cheer</rgb> for Thráin","As you take your place beside Dáin, Thráin begins to speak","Such a rousing speech is worthy of a cheer!","Dáin can be found at Amdân.\
\
You should talk to Dáin.","Listen as Thrain addresses the Kings of the Seven Houses at Amdân","Dáin can be found at Amdân.\
\
You should accompany Dáin and join the gathering at Amdân.","Instancia: Concilio de los Siete","As Thráin and the others prepare to take rest, Dáin beckons you over","As the cheers fall quiet, Thráin begins the ordering of the Haban’akkâ","After coming to Azanulbizar at long last, King Thráin has called the Kings of the Seven Houses to council at Amdân.","Thrain is addressing the Kings of the Seven Houses at Amdân.","Talk to Dáin","Follow Dáin and join the gathering at Amdân","Thráin can be found at Amdân.\
\
You should cheer for Thráin."}},
[6855]={nameES="Instance: Darkness Revealed",objectivesES={}},
[6856]={nameES="Instancia: Hija de la Lucha",objectivesES={"Protege a Laerdan","Has fallado en proteger a Laerdan","Instancia: Hija de la Lucha","Protege a Narmeleth","Has fallado en proteger a Narmeleth","Sigue a Narmeleth","Narmeleth te ha pedido que la acompañes, ya que tiene a alguien muy especial para que conozcas.","Escucha la historia de Narmeleth sobre cómo se convirtió en Amarthiel, campeona de Angmar."}},
[6857]={nameES="Instancia: La llegada del alba",objectivesES={"Habla con Elrond","Baradal needs to talk to you.\
\
You should talk to Baradal.","Talk to Baradal","Listen to the conversation","Ránulur has come to finish what he started.\
\
You should defeat Ránulur!","Despite our efforts, evil still lingers in the world. It has crawled into dark corners and deep places to hide from the light. I will not allow it to threaten one of our own. It will not hide from me anymore.","Elrond would like to speak with you about what has transpired.\
\
You should talk to Elrond.","Galadriel and Arwen are conversing.\
\
You should listen to the conversation.","Defeat Ránulur","Instancia: La llegada del alba"}},
[6858]={nameES="Instancia: Días pasados",objectivesES={"Listen to Barallas' tale at Enting Hollow","Instancia: Días pasados","Barallas wishes to tell you of times before the siege of Fangorn Forest and the scattering of the Ents.","Barallas' tale comes to a close","Barallas is recounting his tale of the Ents at the Enting Hollow in the Balewood.\
\
Barallas and the other Ents of the Balewood once stood united at the Enting Hollow before Núrzum came to Fangorn.","Talk to Barallas","Barallas is standing at the Enting Hollow in the Balewood.\
\
Barallas has finished his tale of the Ents. You should speak with him before setting off.","Barallas is standing at the Enting Hollow in eastern Balewood.\
\
Barallas has chosen to tell you of times long past in Fangorn Forest, when the Ents still stood united."}},
[6859]={nameES="Instancia: La muerte llega para todos",objectivesES={"Pick up the fallen banner where it fell from Guthláf's hand","Give the banner to Éomer, as Théoden requested","Théoden nods at you weakly, desiring to speak","Death has come to the Pelennor, and even kings cannot stand against it forever.","Théoden has asked you to give the banner to Éomer.","Permanece alerta","Talk to Théoden","Guthláf is on the fields of the Pelennor, ready to ride as his king commands.","Guard Théoden during his last moments","Éomer silently takes the banner from you and lifts it to the sky.","The Riders of Rohan have joined the battle, but on the fields of the Pelennor, great deeds go hand in hand with death.","Talk to Guthláf on the field of battle","Instancia: La muerte llega para todos","Théoden has come to the end of his road, but he has a final request of you.","Remain on guard as Éomer remembers the fallen.","The battle rages before the White City.","Théoden requested that you pick up the banner of Rohan where it fell, and give it to Éomer.","Ride with Guthláf and stand with the king"}},
[6860]={nameES="Instance: Death From Below",objectivesES={"Instance: Death From Below","Speak with Vatnar and begin your counterattack against the goblin-sappers!","Vatnar has detected a band of goblin-sappers digging a tunnel below the cellars of Thangúlhad. He and his brother Thyrnir intend to invade the goblin-tunnel and collapse it before they can undermine the tower's foundation.\
\
<rgb=#00ff00>WARNING: Death From Below is a high difficulty solo challenge quest. Beware, all who enter therein.</rgb>","Talk to Vatnar to return to the surface.","Talk to Vatnar"}},
[6861]={nameES="Instance: Deep in the Darkening Wood",objectivesES={"Sterkist is under attack!\
\
You should defeat Borzagor the Grisly!","Instance: Deep in the Darkening Wood","Deep within Mirkwood, an ancient enemy has returned. A Beorning trader is lost within a maze of trees and thorns, predators closing in around him. Find a way through, and save him before it is too late.","With Sterkist recovered, it is time to escape.\
\
You should talk to Thorlind.","Borzagor the Grisly is defeated","Habla con Langhár","Langhár went this way","Langhár becomes a bear and follows the scent!","Langhár collapses!","Sterkist is somewhere within these woods.\
\
You should follow Langhár and find Sterkist.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Langhár must survive!</rgb>","Talk to Thorlind","You have arrived at the edge of a section of deep woods.\
\
You should talk to Langhár.","Find Sterkist","Defeat Borzagor the Grisly","Sterkist is in danger!","Langhár must survive!"}},
[6862]={nameES="Instancia: Más adentro",objectivesES={"You should talk to Pippin and find out what he thinks he has seen.","With that, the half-orc expires","Instancia: Más adentro","Habla con Merry","You should begin searching the area for signs of the three half-orcs.","Confront the half-orcs","Habla con Pippin","Talk to the dying half-orc","The half-orc who was struck by the troll has some life yet in him. You should speak to him now and see what you can learn.","Defeated enraged troll","Begin searching","Stop to get your bearings","Defeat the enraged troll","Merry has brought your expedition to a stop. You should hear what he has to say.","You should follow the footprints that Pippin discovered and see where they lead.","An enraged troll has stumbled into the confrontation, knocking down one of the half-orcs and sending the other two fleeing. You must defend yourself against the troll!","You should resume searching the area for signs of the three half-orcs.","You should talk to Pippin and Merry.","You have found the three half-orcs again!","You have returned with Merry and Pippin to Mordor, with the sole intent of finding the three suspicious half-orcs. The Ranger Golodhon has pointed you on the way to where he believes they ought to be.","Continue searching","Follow the footprints","You have found the three half-orcs again. Join Merry and Pippin and try to get some answers out of them.","The prints lead ever onward and upward","You should continue searching the area for signs of the three half-orcs."}},
[6863]={nameES="Instancia: Defensa en la Carroca",objectivesES={"Find Varthmath","Defeat Ormoth, the drake assault leader.","Protect the Carrock and defeat the attacking drakes.","The leader of the drake assault has arrived!","The Carrock is under attack!","Ormoth has fallen!","Talk to Anórohir","Find Varthmath.","Protect the Carrock and defeat the attacking drakes","Instancia: Defensa en la Carroca","Talk to Anórohir."}},
[6864]={nameES="Instancia: Defensa de Scylfig",objectivesES={"Speak with Thrymm in the centre of Scylfig","Speak with Grimgar in the centre of Scylfig","Speak with Thrymm in front of the Mead Hall","Follow Thrymm to the northern stables to fend off the White Hand attackers.","Help Thrymm fend off the White Hand attackers along the path leading to the Mead Hall.","A giant has breached the gate to Scylfig and is charging forth into the centre of town.","Follow Thrymm to the Mead Hall","Speak with Cyneberg","The giant, Núrzum has breached the gate and is now heading towards the Mead Hall. It needs to be defended at all costs.","Stand beside Thrymm and guard the Mead Hall","The southern stables have been secured, but the giant Núrzum has breached the gate. Speak with Thrymm to find out what to do next.","Garsig and Cynegar are now trying to head Núrzum off at the road before he gets to the Mead Hall.","The White Hand have already penetrated the perimeter of Scylfig and are attacking. Speak with Thrymm to find out the plan to defend Scylfig.","Follow Thrymm to the northern stables","Go to the Mead Hall and stand guard","The strange giant felled Grimgar and Humbald in a single blow","Cynegar and Garsig were the latest to perish at the hands of Núrzum.","The northern stables have been secured. Speak with Thrymm to find out where to head next.","The giant, Núrzum, has hurled a gravely-wounded Thrymm far into the desolate lands of Wildermore, smothering hope and Scylfig beneath a harsh winter","More White Hand attackers rush forth to oppose you!","The giant, Núrzum charges forth towards the Mead Hall and is met there by Thrymm Red-beard. Observe the battle between the two warriors and ensure that no one gets into the Mead Hall.","Help Thrymm fend off the White Hand attackers!","Follow Thrymm to the centre of town","Speak with Thrymm","Follow Thrymm to the centre of Scylfig to defend against the White Hand attackers.","After defeating Thrymm, Núrzum turns and departs Scylfig. The women and children inside the Mead Hall appear to be safe.","Stand with Cyneberg and observe the battle between Thrymm and Núrzum","Gárwig's grandson, Grimgar, has been holding his own along with his brother, Humbald in the centre of town. Speak with him.","Núrzum's might easily overcomes Garsig and Cynegar","Speak with Thrymm at the northern stables","Fend off the White Hand attackers near the northern stables.","Instancia: Defensa de Scylfig","The attack the people of Scylfig feared is now upon the town. Villagers throughout Scylfig need protection from the White Hand, but ultimately, the Mead Hall must not be breached. Therein are the women and children of the town.","Grimgar and Humbald met an unfortunate fate while dealing with Núrzum. Speak with Thrymm to find out the next course of action.","Speak with Thrymm on the road leading up to the Mead Hall","Follow Thrymm up towards the Mead Hall to make sure nothing gets past.","Grimgar and his brother, Humbald have kept this area of Scylfig well-defended","Assist Thrymm in defeating any remaining Orcs in the centre of Scylfig"}},
[6865]={nameES="Instance: Desire Above Strength",objectivesES={"Ides can be found at the mill, north of the training grounds.\
\
Ides wishes to discuss her thoughts with you.","Talk to Ides about Edwulf","Ides can be found along the road, west of the training grounds.\
\
Ides has spotted an Uruk, and will need your help to defeat it.","The Uruk-hai have been routed","The grunts of Uruks can be heard coming from the training grounds","Do not allow Ides to become defeated","Talk to Ides","Ides can be found along the road, west of the training grounds.\
\
After defeating the Uruk-hai invaders, Ides awaits your return.","Ides can be found at the mill, north of the training grounds.\
\
Ides seems to have heard a noise and wishes to inquire about it.","Defeat the Uruk-hai warrior","Uruks have assaulted the Rohirrim training grounds.\
\
Ides has asked you to help deal with the attacking Uruk-hai.","Ides has asked you to walk with her and to listen as she expresses her thoughts.","Ides has been defeated","Talk to Ides along the roadway","Return to Ides along the road","Instance: Desire Above Strength","The sounds of combat can be heard to the south","Ides can be found at the forked path along the road, west of the training grounds.\
\
Ides has found Edwulf, injured in battle, and would like to discuss what should be done."}},
[6866]={nameES="Instancia: Cavar profundo",objectivesES={"Rescue the miners trapped by the collapsed shafts throughout the mine.","You have reached the mine exit in time!","Escape before the mine collapses","Hûzo asked that you enter the mine to free the workers trapped within.","Instancia: Cavar profundo","Your rescued the miners, but the mine is shaking violently. Make your way out of the mine.","La mina se derrumbó","Rescued a miner at Jid Phêsi"}},
[6867]={nameES="Instancia: Descubriendo al Descendiente",objectivesES={"Approach and listen to Shadowfax and his companion","Shadowfax awaits you on the border of the eastern fields of Rohan.","For centuries the Mearas have freely roamed the plains of Rohan, bowing only before the kings and princes of the Rohirrim.","Instancia: Descubriendo al Descendiente","Shadowfax is waiting for you here in the fields of Rohan. Shadowfax has led his companion here to wait for you, though the companion is not yet aware of why he came to this place."}},
[6868]={nameES="Instancia: Caras Hurañas",objectivesES={"Spalvi está en lo alto del Paso del Cuerno Rojo, en medio de una terrible ventisca.","Escuchas voces traídas con el viento una vez más","Spalvi te ha pedido que te adentres en la ventisca y <rgb=#FF0000>mires</rgb> o <rgb=#FF0000>eches un vistazo</rgb> alrededor en busca de entradas a cuevas.","Spalvi y tú habéis subido a lo alto del Paso del Cuerno Rojo buscando algún acceso al interior de la montaña.","Sobrevive al enfrentamiento con el grupo de asalto Duramano","Spalvi y tú habéis sobrevivido al ataque de un grupo de asaltantes Duramano.","Habla con Spalvi en la ventisca","Has subido a las montañas con Spalvi en busca de alguna cueva.","<rgb=#FF0000>Mira</rgb> o echa un <rgb=#FF0000>vistazo</rgb> en busca de entradas a cuevas en medio de la fuerte ventisca","Spalvi y tú habéis subido a lo alto del Paso del Cuerno Rojo buscando alguna forma de llegar a Bingo, pero ha aparecido un nuevo peligro: ¡un grupo de asalto de los Duramano!","Thóvarg no va a retirarse, y Spalvi está deseando pelear.","La cara de Willem es inescrutable, pero crees que está bastante satisfecho consigo mismo.","No encuentras cuevas, pero escuchas voces traídas por el viento","Instancia: Caras Hurañas"}},
[6869]={nameES="Instancia: Pago inicial",objectivesES={"Frithbéorth neglected to mention the rat infestation in the manor that he just sold to Cíllan for a hefty sum.\
\
You should defeat the rats that reside in the manor.","Instancia: Pago inicial","Cíllan just arrived in the new manor you just purchased for her in Harwick.\
\
You should hasten to Cíllan to hand her the keys and tell her of the deal with Frithbéorth...and it would be wise to mention the rats as well.","Return to Cíllan at the door of her new manor","The house in harwick you purchased for Cíllan has unwanted occupants...","Investigate the old manor to ensure that the refugees may move in","The old home of Frithbald, father to Frithbéorth, is located in the north-east corner of Harwick.\
\
You should investigate the house before the refugees begin to move in.","You hand Cíllan the keys to the manor","The old manor is infested with rats"}},
[6870]={nameES="Instancia: Mazmorras de Dol Guldur",objectivesES={"Bori ha sido escoltado a un lugar seguro","Encuentra a Bori y habla con él","Has entrado en las mazmorras de Dol Guldur en busca del prisionero Bori con un pequeño grupo de Elfos.","Ningloril ha tenido problemas en la antesala de las mazmorras.\
\
Habla con Ningloril cuando haya sido liberada de la celda.","Bori está siendo retenido en algún lugar del Ala Este de las mazmorras.\
\
Encuentra a Bori en el Ala Este de las mazmorras y libéralo.","Ningloril se encuentra en la antesala de las mazmorras de Dol Guldur.\
\
Los Elfos han tomado las mazmorras por asalto, y Ningloril te espera para hablar contigo en la antesala principal.","Habla con Bori","Habla con Ningloril","Bori se encuentra en una celda en el Ala Este de las mazmorras de Dol Guldur.\
\
Bori espera que dejes barriles de belladona en el pasillo para noquear a cualquier guardia que llegue, luego que lo escoltes fuera de las mazmorras.","Instancia: Mazmorras de Dol Guldur"}},
[6871]={nameES="Instance: Dúnedain Past and Present",objectivesES={"Talk to Lothrandir","The Angmarim have launched an ambush!\
\
You should defeat the Angmarim attackers!","Listen to the conversation","You have arrived at the shipwreck of the Thoroval.\
\
You should talk to Lothrandir.","Instance: Dúnedain Past and Present","Lothrandir, a Ranger of the North, has joined you in your quest to find a lost Arnorian treasure in Forochel. Your only hope of finding it may lie with the shade of Arvedui, last King of Arthedain.","Defeated the Angmarim","Defeat the Angmarim","Lothrandir is speaking with Arvedui at the shipwreck of the Thoroval.\
\
You should listen to the conversation."}},
[6872]={nameES="Instancia: Eaworth bajo asedio",objectivesES={"<rgb=#FF0000>Ulf has perished</rgb>","<rgb=#FF0000>Léofdag has perished</rgb>","<rgb=#FF0000>Burnoth has perished</rgb>","Defend Eaworth and spring the trap","You have defeated the Orc-assault","Reeve Ingbert is outside the Mead Hall of Eaworth.\
\
You should speak with Reeve Ingbert.","Hear Léofdag's tale.","Hear Burnoth's tale.","Talk to Ulf the Reaver in the southern end of Eaworth.","Talk to Léofdag","Speak with Ulf the Reaver.","Talk to Ulf the Reaver","Talk to Burnoth.","Hear Ulf's tale.","Hear Ulf's tale","<rgb=#FF0000>Ingbert has perished</rgb>","Talk to Burnoth","Talk to Reeve Ingbert","The trap has been set, soon to be sprung against the Orcs besieging Eaworth.","Hear Léofdag's tale","Hear Burnoth's tale","<rgb=#FF0000>Hutha has perished</rgb>","<rgb=#FF0000>Ingbert and the Riders Four must survive</rgb>","Instancia: Eaworth bajo asedio","Speak with Léofdag near the southern gate of Eaworth.","Defend Eaworth and spring the trap.","Speak with Léofdag."}},
[6873]={nameES="Instancia: Ecos de Los Muertos",objectivesES={"Instancia: Ecos de Los Muertos","Habla con Candaith","You have not ventured far along the Forsaken Road and have already encountered one of the Oath-breakers cursed by Isildur.","Radanir stands within the Forsaken Road, wishing to speak with you about the grim place.","Run back through the Forsaken Road and talk to Radanir to escape!","Maonir has given in, at last, and seems to wish to speak with you.","Habla con Halbarad","Find and talk to Britou","Halbarad has confronted Maonir along the Forsaken Road.","You are betrayed! You must escape the Forsaken Road","Maonir told you that Britou wants to speak with you, and that you could find him by keeping the chasm on your right.","Candaith is in the depths of the Forsaken Road, confronting the Oath-breaker Britou.","You have come to walk the Forsaken Road beneath the Lich Bluffs, where it is said a number of Oath-breakers from the time of Isildur still dwell, suffering from their curse.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>This quest is meant for a fellowship. If you choose to undertake this quest solo, you will receive an Inspired Greatness bonus, but the challenge will be great.</rgb>","Talk to Maonir","Talk to Radanir","You have been betrayed. You must escape from the Forsaken Road."}},
[6874]={nameES="Instancia: Emisario de la Ciudad de los Trasgos",objectivesES={"Prakhum derrotado","Has entrado en Minas Maur en busca de Prakhum, el emisario de la Ciudad de los Trasgos.","Instancia: Emisario de la Ciudad de los Trasgos","Debes derrotar a Prakhum, el emisario de la Ciudad de los Trasgos, para recuperar parte del equipamiento de Golodir.","Derrota a Prakhum"}},
[6875]={nameES="Instancia: Emisario de los Duramano",objectivesES={"Derrota a Laugi Lenguadorada","Laugi Lenguadorada derrotado","Instancia: Emisario de los Duramano","Debes derrotar a Laugi Lenguadorada, el emisario de los Duramano de las Montañas Azules, para recuperar parte del equipamiento de Golodir.","Has entrado en Minas Angos en busca de Laugi Lenguadorada, el emisario de los Duramano."}},
[6876]={nameES="Instancia: Emisario de los Trév Duvárdain",objectivesES={"Instancia: Emisario de los Trév Duvárdain","Debes derrotar a Karstíona, la emisaria de los Trév Duvárdain del oeste de Angmar, para recuperar parte del equipamiento de Golodir.","Karstíona derrotada","Has entrado en Minas Agar en busca de Karstíona, la emisaria de los Trév Duvárdain.","Derrota a Karstíona"}},
[6877]={nameES="Instancia: Emisario de la Mano Blanca",objectivesES={"Instancia: Emisario de la Mano Blanca","Bâlak derrotado","Has entrado en Minas Caul en busca de Bâlak, el emisario de la Mano Blanca.","Debes derrotar a Bâlak.","Derrota a Bâlak"}},
[6878]={nameES="Instance: Ending the Nightmare",objectivesES={"Speak with Blaire before continuing.","End the nightmare of the Abominations","You have saved the Abominations, ending the nightmare","You have stepped inside Knotfist's hut","Blaire has been defeated!","You have accompanied Blaire to Lhan Colvarn to put and end to the Abomination threat and their leader, Knotfist.","Instance: Ending the Nightmare","The time to end the nightmare of the Abominations has come. Finish what has been started.","Talk to Blaire","You have killed Knotfist, ending the nightmare","Enter Knotfist's hut","Enter Knotfist's hut."}},
[6879]={nameES="Instancia: Entran los Orientales",objectivesES={"Bingo está justo dentro de la entrada del puesto avanzado de Stangard.","Tú y Bingo han descubierto un plan oriental para atacar el puesto avanzado de Stangard.","Sabert ha quedado mudo por la aparición de Landroval, pero necesitas que esté listo para la batalla: ¡los orientales han comenzado su ataque sobre Stangard!","Habla con Bingo y averigua de qué tareas se encargará","Langhár está justo dentro de la entrada de Stangard.","Habla con Bingo en Stangard","Bingo ha regresado de sus encargos y está listo para participar en la batalla... ¡que ya ha concluido!","Instancia: Entran los Orientales","Habla con Sabert en Stangard","Investiga el alboroto al suroeste","Sabert está en la entrada de Stangard, listo para prepararse para el ataque oriental.","Habla con Langhár y averigua de qué tareas se encargará","Habla con Sabert en la entrada de Stangard","Ha habido un fuerte alboroto hacia el suroeste. ¿Ha comenzado el ataque oriental?"}},
[6880]={nameES="Instancia: Escape de Naerband",objectivesES={"Follow Akhrûn and escape Naerband","Defend yourself!","You notice a loose brick","Confront Thraknûl.","Escape the cell","Deja que acontecimientos sigan su curso.","Talk to Akhrûn","Thraknûl and Urudanî have returned to Naerband and there is little hope that you will be able to escape the prison fortress alive.","Instancia: Escape de Naerband","That almost worked! One more try should do it!","Confront Thraknûl","Deja que acontecimientos sigan su curso","Behind the loose brick you find an old scrap of metal","You hear the lock unlatch!","Akhrûn can be found in her cell, in the south-western end of Naerband.\
\
You should free Akhrûn.","Talk to Akhrûn.","Follow Akhrûn and escape Naerband.","Escape the cell using the what information you remember from Akhrûn's own daring escape.","Enemies guard the stairs ahead.\
\
You must approach them and prepare to defend yourself!","Free Akhrûn"}},
[6881]={nameES="Instancia: Escape de Isengard",objectivesES={"Baldgar has been defeated!","You are hiding with Baldgar, still awaiting Acca's signal.","Acca has been defeated!","Wait with Baldgar for Acca's signal: an enormous blast of flame and smoke","It is time to carry out Baldgar's plan to escape from Isengard.","Acca is ready to speak with you.","Baldgar wants to speak with you before you leave the dungeons.","Run up the slope to the entrance to the dungeons with Acca and Baldgar","Talk to Baldgar","Morflak has killed Acca, and now Baldgar wants you to keep Morflak busy so that he can light the black powder.","You need to walk slowly through the large, open room with Baldgar and Acca so as not to attract undue attention.","Talk to Morflak and keep him busy","Walk slowly through the large room with Baldgar and Acca so as not to attract attention","One of the Dunlending prisoners has tried to attract your attention.","Baldgar is in his cell. He wants to speak with you one last time before you begin.","Talk to Acca","You defeat the Uruk-hai key-master and retrieve his keys!","You, Baldgar, and Acca will go before the rest of the prisoners, running up the slope to the entrance to the dungeons.","Acca has volunteered to light the black powder to provide you with the distraction which you need to escape.","You have made it to the surface of Isengard. You are almost there!","Return to Baldgar","Instancia: Escape de Isengard","Find the Uruk-hai key-master","Acca has gone to light the black powder, and you should hide with Baldgar until you see the signal: a giant plume of smoke and flame!","Talk to the Dunlending prisoner","The key-master is somewhere in the dungeons. Baldgar wants you to take him by surprise, and told you to climb the slope, turning right into the other wing of the dungeons when you have the opportunity.","Talk to Baldgar just inside the entrance to the dungeons","You have recovered the keys from the Uruk-hai key-master.","You have freed Baldgar and Acca from their cells, and now Baldgar wants to speak with you."}},
[6882]={nameES="Instancia: Escapar de Rushdurinul",objectivesES={"Protege a Bróin de los orcos que atacan","Habla con Bróin","Los Elfos y los enanos están discutiendo el destino de Mazog.","A petición de Issuriel, relatas la historia de tu escape de Rushdurinul con Mazog a cuestas.","Bróin está en las profundidades de Rushdurinul, esperando escuchar lo que tienes que decir sobre el destino de Mazog.","Has obligado a Mazog a someterse","A pesar de su intento de escapar, has logrado que Mazog se someta. Ahora deberías hablar con Bróin.","Bróin está esperando para hablar contigo en Rushdurinul.","Da tu opinión a Bróin sobre su decisión respecto al destino de Mazog","Has llegado a la entrada de Zurr-thurkh y ahora debes asegurarte de que las palabras de Mazog no sean más que fanfarronadas antes de irte.","Escucha la discusión sobre el destino de Mazog","Bróin te ha explicado cómo modificar el rol de apoyo de tus aliados, utilizando la bandera que ha colocado, y está esperando a que lo hagas.","Los Elfos y los enanos dentro de Rushdurinul están considerando las diversas implicaciones de lo que debe hacerse con Mazog.","Mazog está en Rushdurinul. Debes atarlo con las cadenas que Bróin te ha dado.","Bróin está en Rushdurinul, esperando para hablar contigo ahora que Mazog está encadenado.","Habla con Mazog","Instancia: Escapar de Rushdurinul","Usa el estandarte para cambiar el rol de apoyo de tus aliados","Esclaviza a Mazog","La fuga de Rushdurinul ha comenzado -- ¡debes defender a Bróin del ataque de los Orcos!","Bróin está esperando para hablar contigo en las profundidades de Rushdurinul."}},
[6883]={nameES="Instancia: La huida de Eskil",objectivesES={"You and Trausti have discovered where Eskil Bloodthumb is held captive within Vatug-ronk.","Talk to Trausti in Vatug-ronk","Talk to Eskil beside the cage","Instancia: La huida de Eskil","Trausti wants to search Vatug-ronk for Eskil Bloodthumb.","Talk to Trausti by the camp-fire","Trausti has come with you to search Vatug-ronk for Eskil Bloodthumb and his stolen axe.","Talk to the weary Orc by the camp-fire and learn what befell the camp","Something passed through the encampment of Vatug-ronk and slew the Orcs within. Those who remain are too weary or injured to offer much resistance.","Trausti has vowed to rescue Eskil Bloodthumb from imprisonment in the depths of Vatug-ronk... and to find his stolen axe as well, if such a thing might be arranged.","Talk to Trausti outside Vatug-ronk","You have defeated the reinforcements Gorgar sent to Vatug-ronk to deal with the hobgoblins. You should speak with Eskil to ensure he is safe and will recover from his ordeal."}},
[6884]={nameES="Instancia: Incluso en la Oscuridad",objectivesES={"Umer has come out onto the deck of the Night-jewel, ready to face you at last.","Aragorn is on the docks of Pelargir, waiting to storm the Night-jewel in search of Balakhôr.","Instancia: Incluso en la Oscuridad","Talk to Aragorn on the docks of Pelargir","Legolas, Aragorn, and Gimli have fought through the city to the docks.\
\
Legolas is waiting to speak with you concerning the number of allies you might have ready at hand.","Talk to Gimli at Aragorn's camp","The Corsair attack on Pelargir has been turned back, in large part, but Balakhôr himself must still be defeated if their threat is to be ended.","Talk to Aragorn at his camp","Talk to Aragorn on the deck of the Night-jewel","Aragorn has returned to the deck of the Night-jewel, unable to find Balakhôr below-decks.","Legolas has asked if you plan to take on Balakhôr by yourself or if you have a Fellowship near at hand.","Talk to Legolas on the docks","Talk to Legolas and declare your intentions","The Corsairs have been defeated and Pelargir retaken. One task remains.\
\
Gimli wishes to speak with you about the next step Aragorn plans to take.","The Corsairs have enslaved the people of Gondor as they moved up the coast toward Pelargir. Now it is time to free these slaves from the benches to which they are chained.","The Dead Men have departed, and now Aragorn wishes to speak with you.","Balakhôr has been defeated, and now Aragorn wishes to speak with you on the deck of the Night-jewel.","Stay on guard while Aragorn speaks to the King of the Dead","Talk to Aragorn on the Night-jewel","Aragorn speaks now to the Dead Men of Dunharrow, who have fulfilled their oath to fight against Sauron's forces.","Talk to Umer on the deck of the Night-jewel"}},
[6885]={nameES="Instancia: Ojos de Edoras",objectivesES={"Céolflad saw a suspicious figure in Edoras, and now you should ask her questions to learn what you can of his appearance.","Éowyn is on the steps outside Meduseld.","Elfburg's recollection of the man she saw is very similar to that of Céolflad","Nona has been confronted by a number of children in Edoras, and she does not seem happy about it.","Talk to Éowyn outside Céolflad's house","Corudan is in the market in Edoras, amused by the recent turn of events concerning Nona and the Rohirrim children.","Elfburg is in Edoras, north of Céolflad's home. She too has seen a suspicious figure in Edoras, and Éowyn would like you to ask her questions as well.","Horn is waiting to speak with you on the road through the market, in Edoras.","Talk to Horn in Edoras","Talk to Éowyn on the steps outside Meduseld","Find Elfburg and question her about the suspicious man she saw in Edoras","You have returned to Edoras with Horn, and Nona has set foot within the city for the first time.","Ask Céolflad questions about the suspicious man she saw in Edoras","Talk to Céolflad in Edoras, north-east of the Meduseld steps","Céolflad is north-east of the Meduseld steps, outside her home.\
\
Éowyn has asked you to speak to Céolflad and obtain a description of the suspicious figure that interfered with her duty to empty the city.","Talk to Nona in Edoras","Instancia: Ojos de Edoras","Éowyn has hurried up to you near Céolflad with news.","Horn has come to your position near Elfburg, and you should tell him what you have learned.","Talk to Corudan in Edoras"}},
[6886]={nameES="Instancia: Enfrentando miedos",objectivesES={"Lady Tóla asked you to speak with her husband's grandmother, Lady Góda, and obtain her assistance in convincing Reeve Ingbert to deny Lord Ingmar's wishes.","You tell the Reeve that you must know more of the situation before you can provide him with adequate advice","Talk to Lord Ingmar","Speak with Lady Góda.","Watch the discourse between Reeve Ingbert, Lady Góda, and Lord Ingmar.","You agree that there is wisdom in taking the Enemy unaware","Instancia: Enfrentando miedos","Speak with Lord Ingmar.","You admit that it is a difficult decision. King Théoden's edict is, in truth, law","Speak with Reeve Ingbert.","Talk to Lady Góda"}},
[6887]={nameES="Instancia: Enfrentando su miedo",objectivesES={}},
[6888]={nameES="Instancia: La Confrontación de Faltharan",objectivesES={"Faltharan can be located at the stairs near the east gate.\
\
You should speak with Faltharan.","DNT - Not Used","Confront Lorvegil","You have discovered the location of the traitor Lorvegil, and must help Faltharan bring him to justice.","Instancia: La Confrontación de Faltharan","Faltharan can be found to the west of the eastern gate.\
\
You should speak with Faltharan.","Aid Faltharan as he confronts Lorvegil","Talk to Faltharan","<rgb=#FF0000>Faltharan has fallen!</rgb>","Aided Faltharan","Confronted Lorvegil","<rgb=#FF0000>Faltharan must not be defeated</rgb>","Faltharan can be located at the stairs near the east gate.\
\
You should aid Faltharan as he attempts to confront Lorvegil.","Lorvegil can be found to the west of the eastern gate.\
\
Speak with Lorvegil in order to confront him about his crimes.","Talked to Faltharan"}},
[6889]={nameES="Instancia: Colmillos del Wulf",objectivesES={}},
[6890]={nameES="Instancia: Despedida de Evendim",objectivesES={"Wait until Calenglad is satisfied that he can join the Grey Company","The robbers have put their gathered plunder into a strongbox located within the crypt.","Habla con Calenglad","You have defeated the tomb-robbers and should now examine their plunder","Talk to Calenglad at Tinnudir","Calenglad is speaking with Gwindeth, the Blue Lady of Nenuial.","Calenglad is standing in front of a tomb-entrance in the Flooded Ward.","Instancia: Despedida de Evendim","Calenglad is inside the crypt in the Flooded Ward, waiting to speak with you.","Inside the chest you see many relics stolen from Annúminas","Gwindeth favours you with a distant smile, brought on by some fond memory","Calenglad is in the Flooded Ward of Annúminas.","You have come with Calenglad to the Flooded Ward to clear it of robbers so that his heart may rest easy as he travels with the Grey Company.","Investigate the tomb-robbers' plunder"}},
[6891]={nameES="Instancia: Adiós a Pelargir",objectivesES={"Instancia: Adiós a Pelargir","Faltharan has asked you to accompany him as his family departs for more safe lands.","Talk to Faltharan","Observed the farewell","DNT - Not Used","Faltharan is located at the shipyard.\
\
You should accompany Faltharan as he says his good-byes.","Faltharan is located at the shipyard.\
\
You should speak with Faltharan.","Observe the farewell"}},
[6892]={nameES="Instance: Fate of the Mother Tree",objectivesES={"Speak with Irsinith","Listen to Irsinith","Irsinith wishes to tell you more about Amûma and her duty as her warden.","Instance: Fate of the Mother Tree"}},
[6893]={nameES="Instancia: El destino del Bosque muerto, parte 10",objectivesES={"The tracks continue here. Long toes with claw marks are visible in the rotten dirt","These tracks are fresh. The source of this blight must be nearby","You have defeated the morroval that you encountered at the ruins of Nagakhêdi. Return to Sul Madásh with the scout to report to Dáthlil.","Scouts in Sul Madásh believe they have discovered the source of the Pale Blight with an unknown enemy being spotted near the ruins of Nagakhêdi to the south. Follow the tracks the scouts discovered to the east of the camp.","There are more tracks continuing east. Faded talon-marks are visible in the earth","Speak with the scout and return to Sul Madásh","Instancia: El destino del Bosque muerto, parte 10","Follow the tracks to the source of the Pale Blight","Kill the morroval","The tracks led you to the ruins of Nagakhêdi and a morroval has appeared to stop you. Defeat her!","Scouts in Sul Madásh believe they have discovered the source of the Pale Blight with an unknown enemy being spotted near the ruins of Nagakhêdi to the south.","The tracks are much newer and lead south towards the ruins","You found faint tracks that you can't identify. They continue to the east"}},
[6894]={nameES="Instancia: El destino del Bosque muerto, parte 9",objectivesES={"You drink the serum. It leaves an earthy and burning taste in your mouth.","Eat the <rgb=#FF0000>red</rgb> mushroom","Eat the <rgb=#00FF00>green</rgb> mushroom","You drank the serum, now it is time to eat the blighted mushrooms and see what happens!","Eat the <rgb=#0000FF>blue</rgb> mushroom","Despite the foul taste, your body feels more resilient","It is suspiciously chewy, but you feel more focused","It tastes worse than the last and almost makes you sick","<rgb=#00FF00>Drink</rgb> the Pale Blight serum","It burns more than the others, but you somehow feel invigorated","Speak with Viznak","Instancia: El destino del Bosque muerto, parte 9","You drank the serum and ate the mushrooms. Speak with Viznak again to see what is next.","Eat the <rgb=#FFFF00>yellow</rgb> mushroom","Test the Pale Blight serum that the Viznak and the Rangers made to ensure it protects the imbiber from the rot."}},
[6895]={nameES="Instancia: El destino del Norte",objectivesES={"Grimbeorn seeks word of the situation in the Wells of Langflood.","Náth has fallen!","Talk to Rúzat.","<rgb=#FF0000>Rúzat must survive</rgb>","Journey to Ered Mithrin with the dwarves","Defeat the ambushers.","<rgb=#FF0000>Agátur must survive</rgb>","Talk to Rúzat","Defeat the ambushers","Agátur has fallen!","Journey to Ered Mithrin with the dwarves.","Instancia: El destino del Norte","Rúzat has fallen!","<rgb=#FF0000>Náth must survive</rgb>"}},
[6896]={nameES="Instancia: El destino de la Doncella de Piedra",objectivesES={"Instancia: El destino de la Doncella de Piedra","The Orc you see now is different than those that served Urudanî, but you have seen his kind before: he is one of the Ghâsh-hai.","Examine the Black Númenórean shown to you by Zaghárog","Examine the image shown to you by Zaghárog","She is a woman of Númenor, possessed of a cold beauty. The images that float before your eyes are hazy and indistinct, but even so her beauty is tainted by the cruel expression she wears and the malice in her eyes.\
\
'Urudanî,' whispers Zaghárog. 'Gúrzyul.'","You feel a presence behind you","Hazy images swirl before your eyes of the delving of the Caverns of Fire, long ago.","Examine the Ghâsh-hai shown to you by Zaghárog","Zaghárog persists in showing you images of the past.","Zaghárog presents you with images from the delving of a fortress in the depths of the Caverns of Fire, long ago.","Witness the images shown to you by Zaghárog","It seems Sauron dispatched the Nazgûl to investigate","You have paid the price he demanded. Will Zaghárog consent to share knowledge of the Gúrzyul?","The Orc that appears before you now is different than those that served Urudanî, but you have seen his kind before: he is one of the Ghâsh-hai. What has Borangos done to the Orcs of this place?","The woman is composed entirely of fire, a being of burning flames. She stares past you, sightlessly, and you hear the voice of Zaghárog in your mind.\
\
'But the Stonemaiden returned... changed...'\
\
The images become faint; Zaghárog will soon release his hold on you, and you must be content with what he has shown to you.","Examine the creature shown to you by Zaghárog","In appearance the creature seems similar to the Regmyl you have encountered, but its terrible majesty is an order of magnitude greater than those others. Even in the hazy dreamscape conjured by Zaghárog, this Great Rogmul is a terrifying presence.\
\
'Borangos,' Zaghárog whispers in your mind. 'Borangos the Horror.'"}},
[6897]={nameES="Instance: Father of Our Lament",objectivesES={}},
[6898]={nameES="Instancia: Lucha por Zajâna, Parte 1",objectivesES={}},
[6899]={nameES="Instancia: Lucha por Zajâna, Parte 2",objectivesES={}},
[6900]={nameES="Instancia: Lucha por Zajâna, Parte 4",objectivesES={}},
[6901]={nameES="Instancia: Lucha por Zajâna, Parte 5",objectivesES={}},
