[6903]={nameES="Instancia: Lucha por Zajâna, Parte 8",objectivesES={}},
[6904]={nameES="Instancia: Última batalla",objectivesES={"The giant Núrzum is heading to Forlaw in an attempt to extinguish the last bastion of hope for the people of Wildermore. Run towards Núrzum until you're close enough for him to hear the sound of the Winter's Horn.","The frost grims have been defeated. Sound the Winter's Horn","Núrzum has been defeated","Sound the Winter's Horn to damage Núrzum.","Get close enough for Núrzum to hear the Winter's Horn","The frost grims have been defeated. Quickly sound the Winter's Horn","Infuriated by the sound of the Winter's Horn, the giant Núrzum turns his attention to you","Clear the area of all threats before using the Winter's Horn again.","Núrzum is making his way towards Forlaw. He must be stopped before he is able to complete his path of destruction.","The Stone of Thangorodrim has been separated from Núrzum, creating a flash freeze encapsulating him in a tomb of ice","You are within range. Now blow the Winter's Horn to get Núrzum's attention","Núrzum has been weakened. It should take one more sounding of the horn to finish him off.","Defeat frost grims","Instancia: Última batalla","Thrymm, Cyneberg, and Gárwig are prepared to defeat Núrzum. Speak with Thrymm along the ice bridge.","Sound the Winter's Horn to defeat Núrzum","Sound the Winter's Horn to further damage Núrzum.","Blow the Winter's Horn to get Núrzum's attention","The Huorn fused with Núrzum appears to be retracting, weakening his physical form and causing him to break apart","Speak with Thrymm","You are close enough to Núrzum for him to hear the sound of the Winter's Horn. Blow the horn to get the giant's attention.","Núrzum is infuriated by the sound of the Winter's Horn. He appears to be weakening each time it sounds","The Winter's Horn caused massive damage to Núrzum, but he struggles through the pain. Make sure that Gárwig remains protected.","Núrzum has been defeated. The people of Wildermore will be terrorized no longer. Speak with Thrymm.","Sound the Winter's Horn","The frost grims have been defeated. Sound the Winter's Horn one last time to defeat Núrzum!","Protect Gárwig"}},
[6905]={nameES="Instancia: Encontrando a Meneldor",objectivesES={"Meneldor has escaped the webbing and wishes to depart from the cave at once.","Landroval has directed you to the entrance of a large hill-cave, which is home to a dangerous breed of spiders. If Meneldor has entered this cave, he may be in great peril.","Talk to Meneldor and release him from the webbing","Landroval has asked you to search for signs of Meneldor in the cave and to lend him aid if you happen upon him.","Meneldor has warned you of the presence of a dangerous creature in the cave. This threat must be dealt with quickly before attempting to free the Great Eagle.","Talk to the Great Eagle, Meneldor","Defeat the spider, Meneghen","Instancia: Encontrando a Meneldor","Meneldor remains entagled in the spider's webbing. He may safely break free now that the spider-queen has been defeated","Talk to Meneldor to leave the spider-cave","Meneghen has been defeated and Meneldor is now safe","You hear a large creature moving among the webs"}},
[6906]={nameES="Instancia: Fuego bajo la Sombra",objectivesES={"Talk to Mithrandir","Habla con Aragorn","Talk to Mithrandir.","Talk to Mithrandir at the overlook.","Instancia: Fuego bajo la Sombra","Angbor has spoken to Aragorn and Mithrandir about an important matter concerning the Morgul Vale.","Let Mithrandir execute his plan","Let Mithrandir execute his plan.","Set fire to the noisome flowers.","Talk to Aragorn."}},
[6907]={nameES="Instancia: Fuego y Hielo",objectivesES={"Busca los obeliscos y abre el camino hacia el centro de la tesorería.\
\
El examen del obelisco hallado en la entrada de la tesorería reveló que la única forma de acceder al centro es invocar el nombre de Elbereth en los obeliscos dispersos por toda la tesorería.","Instancia: Fuego y Hielo","Busca al Nazgûl y pon fin a sus planes.\
\
Ahora que has invocado el nombre de Elbereth en tres de los obeliscos de la tesorería, el camino hacia el centro está abierto.","Examina el obelisco","Por petición del Maestro Elrond de Imladris, has entrado en la tesorería abandonada de Helegrod para poner fin al plan del Nazgûl de restaurar al dragón Thorog.","Busca al Nazgûl y pon fin a sus planes.","Examina el obelisco\
\
Has encontrado un obelisco que brillaba tenuemente.","Una placa en el lateral de este obelisco está escrita en varias lenguas. Dice:\
\
'Yo, Durin, señor de Khazad-dûm, he excavado esta cámara con la ayuda de los Gwaith-i-Mírdain. Para proteger las grandes riquezas halladas aquí, se erigieron obeliscos forjados con las artes de los Elfos como símbolo de amistad.\
\
Sólo aquellos que invoquen el nombre de la Encendedora de Estrellas podrán pasar. Tres veces tres son los obeliscos, y tres veces debes hablar.'","Detén los planes del Nazgûl"}},
[6908]={nameES="Instancia: Primer Verso, Último Verso",objectivesES={"Tu esposo Tumúldo se reúne con los demás miembros de la Hermandad de la Moneda dentro de la Ciudadela de los Vientos.","Nakási Segadora de Olas navega por las aguas de la memoria, desconocida para todos salvo para ella.","Los demás miembros de la Hermandad se retiran de la reunión, pero tú y Tumúldo se quedan.","Tu miedo, tu ira y tu soledad se disuelven en la oscuridad.","Whatever Nakási may have experienced during her final moments, you hope she is now at peace.","Tatháta stands upon the deck of Tumuldo-râba, Nakási's flagship.","Azagath desea hablar contigo y con Tumúldo sobre un asunto secreto.","Uno de los guardias dentro de la Ciudadela de los Vientos intenta impedir tu paso a la sala donde se reúne la Hermandad de la Moneda.","Quédate junto a Tumúldo mientras la Hermandad de la Moneda debate tu presencia","Tumúldo siempre fue tu roca firme, incluso cuando los días eran aterradores y las noches largas y terribles.","Había algo que querías decirle a tu esposo, pero ahora no puedes recordar qué era.","Talk to Tatháta on the deck of Tumuldo-râba","Instancia: Primer Verso, Último Verso","La Hermandad de la Moneda debate tu presencia en la Ciudadela de los Vientos.","Tu miedo, tu ira y tu soledad finalmente han desaparecido.","Habla con el guardia dentro de la Ciudadela de los Vientos","Entra en la sala donde tu esposo Tumúldo se reúne con los demás miembros de la Hermandad","<rgb=#00FF00>Reflexiona</rgb> sobre esta pregunta: ¿cumplió la Hermandad de la Moneda con sus intenciones?","Permanece con Tumúldo tanto tiempo como puedas","Habla con Azagath sobre un asunto secreto","Toma su mano y enfrenta lo que venga","Nakási Wave-reaper is gone","Debes <rgb=#00FF00>reflexionar</rgb> sobre esta pregunta: ¿cumplió la Hermandad de la Moneda con su propósito?","Quédate con Tumúldo mientras el resto de la Hermandad se retira"}},
[6909]={nameES="Instancia: El Primero de los Herederos",objectivesES={"Azruthor merely glares at you - his eyes betraying a seething rage.\
\
All is silent for a moment, but then he begins to speak.","Seek Azruthor in the camp at Tarlang's Crown","Defeat Azruthor","DNT -- will not be seen","Azruthor can be found in the main tent of the camp at Tarlang's Crown.\
\
Harnion has asked you to confront and defeat Azruthor in Tarlang's Crown.","Worn down by your assault, the Corsairs have left one of their horses unattended. It is now time to return to Dol Amroth with news of your victory.","Azruthor can be found just outside the main tent of the camp at Tarlang's Crown.\
\
You should defeat Azruthor and his allies for the good of Gondor.","After weakening the forces in Tarlang's Crown, the time has come to confront Azruthor and put an end to the Scourge's plans for the Anfalas.","Confront Azruthor","Instancia: El Primero de los Herederos","Azruthor can be found just outside the main tent of the camp at Tarlang's Crown.\
\
You have discovered Azruthor's whereabouts and should now confront him."}},
[6910]={nameES="Instancia: Cinco contra el Páramo",objectivesES={"Instancia: Cinco contra el Páramo","<rgb=#FF0000>Ulf has been defeated</rgb>","<rgb=#FF0000>HUtha has been defeated</rgb>","Defeat the Khundolar riders.","<rgb=#FF0000>Léofdag has been defeated</rgb>","<rgb=#FF0000>Burnoth has been defeated</rgb>","<rgb=#FF0000>All of the Riders Four must survive</rgb>","Talk to Burnoth and return to Harwick.","Speak with Burnoth.","Defeated the Khundolar riders","Talk to Burnoth","Defeat the Khundolar riders","You have accompanied the Riders Four to an encampment of Easterlings, where Burnoth hopes to prove to Aldor Harding that Men make their own fates."}},
[6911]={nameES="Instancia: Llama y Sombra",objectivesES={"Lleva la antorcha hasta donde deba colocarse, más adentro en la pequeña cueva.","Geirfast recomienda llevar uno o dos aliados para encender y colocar la antorcha.\
\
Dejó la antorcha justo en la entrada de la cueva descrita en el extraño mapa, que contiene instrucciones esotéricas para su encendido.","La extraña luz de la antorcha ha proyectado un mapa sobre la pared","Recoge la antorcha","Instancia: Llama y Sombra"}},
[6912]={nameES="Instancia: Huida de Khazad-dûm",objectivesES={"Brogur fell behind during the retreat, and Bósi asked you to find his cousin.","You have entered Khazad-dûm from the East-gate, and the situation appears worse than you feared.","Talk to Solsi inside the First Hall","Find Brogur in the First Hall","Bósi and Brogur have not yet made it back to the East-gate. Solsi asked you to find them, if they still live.","Instancia: Huida de Khazad-dûm","Talk to Bósi in the First Hall","Brogur is on the western side of the First Hall.","Find Bósi and Brogur and escape from Khazad-dûm","You have found Brogur, but he is dead","Bósi has finally made it to the First Hall!","Bósi is in the First Hall, near the East-gate of Khazad-dûm.","If the rumours are true, the Iron Garrison is in danger and their foothold in Khazad-dûm is threatened.","You have found Brogur, but there is no sign of Bósi","Bósi has made it to the First Hall.","Talk to Brogur in the First Hall"}},
[6913]={nameES="Instance: Flight of the Golden Queen",objectivesES={"Jaith has entered Dâr Laja with information about what transpires in the city.","The catacombs of Umbar-môkh may allow you to flee the uprising and escape to safety!","Talk to Gadâr within Dâr Laja","Guard-captain Gadâr stands prepared to defend you within Dâr Laja.","The fate of some members of the Kindred of the Coins remain a mystery, and for now can only be guessed at by wondering minds.","Follow Khôltekh through Umbar-môkh to safety","Your guards have left Dâr Laja to prevent the uprising from entering the Meeting-hall and doing you some harm. You should return to the main hall and stay away from the entrance!","Temámir soldiers bar your passage.","Walk to the northern waggons or defy Khôltekh by standing your ground","Talk to Jaith inside Dâr Laja","Khôltekh motions for you to speak to him.","Instance: Flight of the Golden Queen","Khôltekh had better have an explanation for this insult!","Khôltekh nods in the direction of the waggons to the north.","Return to the safety of the main hall of Dâr Laja","Follow Gadâr and remain under his protection","Temámir soldiers bar your passage","Khôltekh has led you into Umbar-môkh, through which you must find safety!","Gadâr has sworn to protect you. You should stay close to him.","Talk to the Temámir guardsman barring your passage","Talk to Khôltekh and demand an explanation","Talk to Khôltekh in the main hall of Dâr Laja","You demand to know the meaning of this insult","Flee through Umbar-môkh to safety!","Khôltekh hopes to lead you through Umbar-môkh to safety!","Talk to Khôltekh in Umbar-môkh","Khôltekh beckons you to the safety of the main hall"}},
[6914]={nameES="Instance: Floodwend Besieged",objectivesES={"Objective 2: Ride out and trample the unmounted forces.","Speak with Elfhelm again.","You have defeated the remaining forces. Ride on! <rgb=#00FF00>Objective Completed (4/6)</rgb>","You have defeated the Uruks at the gate.  Ride on! <rgb=#00FF00>Objective Completed (2/6)</rgb>","Continue through the valley. You must chase down the Nazgul rider.","Objective 6: Speak with Elfhelm","The town of Floodwend has been besieged. You must do everything in your power to drive back the evil forces of Isengard and Mordor and save the town from imminent doom!","Objective 1: Speak to Elfhelm","Objective 3: Defeat the enemies on the road","Objective 4: Defeat the remaining enemies on the road","Instance: Floodwend Besieged","Time is up! Please try again later.","Objective 5: Defeat the Nazgûl","Floodwend is saved! <rgb=#00FF00>Objective Completed (5/6)</rgb>","Congratulations! You are the hero of Rohan! <rgb=#00FF00>Objective Completed (6/6)</rgb>","Elfhelm has asked you to ride and push back the enemy forces.  The horses are dead, reinforcements are ariving late, and only you can stop the threat.","At the end of the valley, waits the Nazgul rider.  Defeat him and reclaim Floodwend for Rohan!","Follow Elfhelm to the town gates. <rgb=#00FF00>Objective Completed (1/6)</rgb>","Speak with Elfhelm before you. He will lead the way to the gates of Floodwend!","You have defeated some ambushers. Ride on! <rgb=#00FF00>Objective Completed (3/6)</rgb>"}},
[6915]={nameES="Instance: Floodwend Besieged",objectivesES={"Speak with Radwig","Listen to Radwig","Floodwend's peril has come to a boil. The Orcs and Easterlings have advanced on Floodwend, lead by the Nazgûl: the Grim Southron.","You let Radwig die!","The Mead Hall is safe at last","You let Etta die!","The town of Floodwend is besieged by the forces of Jóshkhin Orda, led by the Grim Southron who re-grouped the routed army.\
\
You must protect the Mead Hall, and the young Thane of Floodwend!","The Mead Hall of Floodwend has been defended, and Radwig is excited to congratulate you, and thank you for your help.","Radwig is in the Mead Hall of Floodwend.","The sounds of battle grow louder. The forces of Mordor are not far!","Radwig shows great courage for one so young. You must ready yourself for an attack on the Mead Hall.","Speak with the young Thane","Instance: Floodwend Besieged","<rgb=#FF0000>Radwig cannot be defeated</rgb>","Protect the Mead Hall from the forces of Mordor","<rgb=#FF0000>Etta cannot be defeated</rgb>","Radwig is in the Mead Hall of Floodwend, awaiting the approach of the forces of Mordor, let by the Grim Southron."}},
[6916]={nameES="Instancia: Flores para Eshtali",objectivesES={"Listen to Mizâdi","Speak with Mizâdi by Eshtali's tomb","Instancia: Flores para Eshtali","Offer comfort to Mizâdi.","Join Mizâdi at Eshtali's tomb.","Eshtali lies in the tombs of Esh-kimâkhi. In the fight to liberate Kûr Anzar, there was scarcely enough time to think, let alone mourn the dead. Now that the immediate threat is over, we mourn our fallen and remind ourselves why they still take such firm residence in our hearts.","Join Mizâdi at Eshtali's tomb","Offer comfort to Mizâdi","Place the flowers on Eshtali's tomb.","Listen to Mizâdi.","Speak with Mizâdi by Eshtali's tomb."}},
[6917]={nameES="Instancia: Bosque por los árboles",objectivesES={"Wait for the Ents to arrive outside Drû Vádokan","Nindorn has fallen!","The glow of flames can be seen as an Uruk rushes forth in the distance","With Voskor's death, a sense of peace has returned to Balewood","Talk to Barallas","Barallas and the other Ents are outside Drû Vádokan.\
\
The Ents are ready to assault Drû Vádokan. You should speak to Barallas and begin the assault.","As Tithenolf slowly strides forth, it is clear the last Ent has arrived","Voskor can be found inside Drû Vádokan.\
\
Barallas and the Ents have discovered a vile Uruk leading the Orc forces in Balewood, but he appears to be wounded.","Fight your way through Drû Vádokan","Strongroot has fallen!","Voskor is standing in the middle of Drû Vádokan.\
\
You should approach Voskor and confront him with the Ents of Balewood.","Barallas and the Ents are attacking Drû Vádokan.\
\
You should follow them into battle to ensure their success.","Barallas is standing outside Drû Vádokan.\
\
Barallas and the others have travelled to Drû Vádokan and now stand ready to raze what remains of the Orc forces in Balewood. You should speak to him while you wait for the others to arrive.","Barallas has fallen!","<rgb=#FF0000>Barallas and the Ents must survive</rgb>","Instancia: Bosque por los árboles","Barallas is outside Drû Vádokan.\
\
You should wait for the other Ents to arrive before beginning the assault.","Follow Barallas and the Ents to the gate","Barallas and the Ents have decided to assault Drû Vádokan and put an end to the White Hand presence in Fangorn Forest.","Mossbeard has fallen!","Defeat Voskor","Approach Voskor","Tithenolf has fallen!","Barallas and the Ents are marching to assault Drû Vádokan.\
\
You should follow Barallas and the other Ents as they march to the gate of Drû Vádokan."}},
[6918]={nameES="Instancia: Prólogo: Muchos retornos infelices",objectivesES={}},
[6919]={nameES="Instancia: Adelante los Toringas",objectivesES={}},
[6920]={nameES="Instancia: La locura de Fram",objectivesES={"Léothred and Fróthi have finally uncovered the truth of how Fram died and who killed him.","Talk to Fróthi","Talk to Léothred","Listen to Fróthi and Léothred's tale.","Instancia: La locura de Fram","Listen to Fróthi and Léothred's tale","Talk to Léothred.","Talk to Fróthi."}},
[6921]={nameES="Instancia: Liberado de la carga",objectivesES={"Listen to the words of Bozhéna","Listen to the words of Bozhéna in the Halls of Memory","Listen to the words of Vóin, as remembered by Bozhéna","Bozhéna will pick up the tale on the slopes of Mordor, as depicted by the Halls of Memory.","Bozhéna has made her own contributions to the Halls of Memory.","It was Vóin's wife Bozhéna who completed the Black Book of Mordor, hiding her contributions among the illustrations in the margins towards the end of the tome.","Delve deeper into the Halls of Memory","Talk to Bozhéna on the slopes of Mordor, as depicted by the Halls of Memory","Listen to the words of Bozhéna on the slopes of Mordor, as depicted by the Halls of Memory","Instancia: Liberado de la carga","As the end of his years approached, Vóin took one last journey to the Grey Mountains.","Hear the conclusion of Bozhéna's account, secretly recorded in the Black Book","Hear the words of Vóin, as recorded by Bozhéna"}},
[6922]={nameES="Instancia: La carga de Frodo",objectivesES={"Frodo está en los senderos fuera de La Última Morada, tomando el aire nocturno.\
\
Gandalf el Gris te pidió que caminaras con Frodo Bolsón y evaluaras su estado de ánimo.","Frodo está en una bifurcación de caminos no muy lejos de La Última Morada.\
\
Tu paseo con Frodo parece haber aliviado algunas de sus preocupaciones.","Gandalf el Gris te ha pedido que hables con Frodo Bolsón sobre sus preocupaciones.","Instancia: La carga de Frodo","Camina con Frodo","Frodo está fuera de La Última Morada, tomando el aire nocturno.\
\
Gandalf el Gris te pidió que caminaras con Frodo Bolsón y evaluaras su estado de ánimo.","Habla con Frodo"}},
[6923]={nameES="Instance: Funeral for a Friend",objectivesES={"Defend the Hornburg against the White Hand","You have defeated the first wave","The forces of the White Hand are attacking the Hornburg. Aid the Rohirrim against their enemy.","You have joined with Burnoth in remembering Léofdag's valour at the Battle of the Hornburg.","You have defeated the third wave, but Léefdag has fallen....","You should speak with Burnoth at once.","Instance: Funeral for a Friend","Talk to Burnoth","You have defeated the second wave","The armies of the White Hand are attacking the Hornburg. You should speak at once with Burnoth."}},
[6924]={nameES="Instancia: El Sueño de Galadriel",objectivesES={"Estás atrapado en un sueño.","Estás atrapado en un sueño peculiar.","Instancia: El Sueño de Galadriel","Estás teniendo un sueño muy peculiar."}},
[6925]={nameES="Instancia: Fuga de la cárcel",objectivesES={"Ratúlko the Bloody has discovered your true identity!\
\
You should fight for your life!","Talk to Ebuzâm","You have found Ratúlko the Bloody and his 'important guest'","Enter the execution chamber","You have cleared the torture chamber.\
\
You should continue to the next cell block.","Ratúlko has noticed you!","You have found several prisoners being tortured in the torture chamber.\
\
You should defeat the torturers and arm any imprisoned thralls you find.","You have collected enough weapons to arm the prisoners and stage a riot.\
\
You should free and arm any imprisoned thralls you find.","Ratúlko the Bloody is busy having a conversation with Góramul Sai.\
\
You should quietly free and arm the prisoners in the execution chamber while they are talking.","You have travelled to the prison of Esh Mêkag with Ebuzâm.\
\
You should talk to Ebuzâm.","You hear prisoners screaming","Enter the torture chamber","Instancia: Fuga de la cárcel","Talk to the Ordâkhai guard","You have cleared the torture chamber, but have yet to find Ratúlko the Bloody.\
\
You should continue forward and arm any imprisoned thralls you find.","You have made it past the first gate.\
\
You should discreetly collect any Ordâkhai weapons you find.","Eavesdrop on the conversation","The prisoners erupt in cheers! They have pushed back the Ordâkhai!","You explain to the guard that you have captured Ebuzâm and are taking him to Ratúlko the Bloody personally. He smirks.\
\
'Good! This one has been a thorn in our side for quite some time. Did you really think you could get away, Ebuzâm? I hope the warden finally puts you in the dirt where you belong.'","Ebuzâm wants to enter the torture chamber to free anyone inside.\
\
You should enter the torture chamber.","Talk to Ratúlko the Bloody","Survive Ratúlko's attack","Enter the next cell block","The door deeper into the prison is locked and guarded.\
\
You should talk to the Ordâkhai guard and convince him to let you pass.","Esh Mêkag, the Silent Mouth, grinds Men to dust year after year. Now, when we few have finally found the strength to escape, they threaten to execute the rest. This will not stand... not while I draw breath!","There is one chamber left.\
\
You should enter the execution chamber.","Ratúlko the Bloody is having a conversation with Góramul Sai.\
\
You should listen to their conversation. What they say might be valuable information to Mizâdi's cause.","Ratúlko the Bloody has noticed you.\
\
You should talk to Ratúlko the Bloody and try to convince him you are just a guard."}},
[6926]={nameES="Instancia: Claro de los Tres Alegres",objectivesES={"Defeat the Dheghûn in the glade.","Defeat the Dheghûn","A strange howling sound emanates from the Púkel-men statues","Let Rhûd-pulo-Drât perform his ritual.","Ghân-buri-Ghân believes Rhûd-pulo-Drât may need the newly constructed ward more than the entire village of Drû Bhûta to protect the Drúadan Wood.","Follow Rhûd-pulo-Drât","This hidden glade must be a very sacred place to the Woses. Rhûd-pulo-Drât seems nervous","Let Rhûd-pulo-Drât perform his ritual","You should speak with Rhûd-pulo-Drât.","Instancia: Claro de los Tres Alegres","Follow Rhûd-pulo-Drât to Luk Khakát.","The last of the Dheghûn falls and calm is restored to the glade","Speak with Rhûd-pulo-Drât"}},
[6927]={nameES="Instance: Glinting in Forgotten Pools",objectivesES={"Fish up a glinting Relic of Inner Fire","Elhudan circle the pools in this area of the Dunbog, casting their fell light upon your wary faces.\
\
You should defeat all of the elhudan in this area.","The turtles roam the pool that Franis led you to.\
\
You should defeat the turtles that romp in this area so that you may fish in peace when all is done.","Slugs slither around the pools to which Franis has led you.\
\
You should defeat all of the slugs of this area before you attempt to fish here.","Defeat each of the turtles","Defeat all of the elhudan around this pool","Follow Franis to the turtle-guarded pools","Fish up a muddy Seal of Patience","You have collected a muddy Seal of Patience","Collected a glinting Relic of Inner Fire","Collected a dripping Relic of Cunning","The avanc have been slain; it is now safe to fish","A muddy Seal of Patience can likely be found in the nearby pools.\
\
You should use your fishing skill to try to snag a relic.","Collected a worn Relic of Time","Fish up a soggy Relic of Strength","The bog-lurkers have been cleared away, and you may now fish in peace","Talk to Franis","You have defeated the slugs; you may now fish in peace","The turtles are gone, and it is now safe to fish","Defeat all of the slugs","Franis is waiting for you to speak with him again.\
\
You should talk to Franis; his knowledge of the Dunbog has steered you successfully to the most promising pools.","A soggy Relic of Strength can likely be found in the nearby pools.\
\
You should use your fishing skill to try to snag a relic.","Avanc circle the pools in which a soggy Relic of Strength might be found.\
\
You should defeat the avanc so that you can fish in peace in the pools.","Franis is waiting for you to speak with him again.\
\
You should talk to Franis; his knowledge of the Dunbog will steer you to the most promising pools.","A dripping Relic of Cunning can likely be found in the nearby pools.\
\
You should use your fishing skill to try to snag a relic.","Many valuable relics of old were lost in a battle that took place long ago in the Dunbog. It is often said that night-time fishing excursions will produce ancient and wonderful gems that enhance powerful items.","Fish up a worn Relic of Time","Instance: Glinting in Forgotten Pools","Franis has led you to a pool that is surrounded by menacing bog-lurkers.\
\
You should defeat all of the bog-lurkers so that you may fish in peace.","Defeat all of the bog-lurkers in this area","Fish up a dripping Relic of Cunning","Collected a soggy Relic of Strength","Talk to Franis to continue through the bog","Defeat the avanc at the first pool","Franis is waiting for you in the Dunbog.\
\
You should speak with Franis.","A glinting Relic of Inner Fire can likely be found in the nearby pools.\
\
You should use your fishing skill to try to snag a relic.","A worn Relic of Time can likely be found in the nearby pools.\
\
You should use your fishing skill to try to snag a relic."}},
[6928]={nameES="Instancia: Mosquitos en su red",objectivesES={"Find a path through the Tower of Cirith Ungol","You are searching for a path to the tower-gate with Legolas. Remain on guard.","Shelob's children flee back beyond the Under-gate toward the tunnels of Torech Ungol!","You have come to the Under-gate, and a path out of the tower lies open before it!","Talk to Legolas in the Tower of Cirith Ungol","Legolas is standing near the shattered remains of the Under-gate.\
\
Saernaston appears to have been devoured by Shelob herself. Belzagar has fled the tower, and now you and Legolas should as well.","You have come to the Under-gate and should now guard Belzagar's escape from Cirith Ungol.","Stand against Shelob's children at the Under-gate","Instancia: Mosquitos en su red","Defeat Saernaston","You suddenly notice green eyes leering at you in the shadows above!","Legolas is standing in the Tower of Cirith Ungol.\
\
You and Legolas plan to distract the spiders of Shelob's brood at the Under-gate to allow Belzagar to send word to Ugrukhôr and Rûkhor the Pale Herald. You should speak to Legolas when you are prepared.","You have been cornered in the depths of Cirith Ungol by the ancient spider, Saernaston. You must defeat him if you hope to escape!","In an attempt to warn the Gúrzyul of Shelob's growing wrath and secure Cirith Ungol, Legolas has decided to allow an emissary of Rûkhor the Pale Herald the opportunity to escape by distracting Shelob's brood at the Under-gate.","Pursue Shelob's children into Torech Ungol","Talk to Legolas at the Under-gate","Shelob's children have fled back beyond the Under-gate toward the tunnels of Torech Ungol. You should pursue them and prevent more from entering the Tower of Cirith Ungol.","You hear the cracking of Saernaston's carapace and terrible screeches echoing from the tunnels of Torech Ungol!"}},
[6929]={nameES="Instancia: Gondor y Umbar",objectivesES={"Sirgon waits below the stairs that climb to the Hungry Deep Tavern.","Stand by Sirgon while he meets with Belondor","Belondor's wife Mêshka has arrived at the Hungry Deep Tavern, and she is not pleased to see that Sirgon has violated her ban upon returning to the Upper Ward.","Climb up to the Hungry Deep Tavern with Sirgon","Talk to Mêshka at the Hungry Deep Tavern","Talk to Rothog at the Hungry Deep Tavern","Talk to Sirgon below the Hungry Deep Tavern","Belondor has suggested that Sirgon meet with him at the Hungry Deep Tavern, but it will be best if you and your crew attend the meeting as well... for the safety of all involved.","Remain alert to see what Rothog will do","Instancia: Gondor y Umbar","Talk to Sirgon at the Hungry Deep Tavern","Belondor wishes to speak with you at the Hungry Deep Tavern.","Rothog the Storm has questions for Belondor.","Sirgon is compelled to speak on behalf of King Elessar.","Talk to Belondor at the Hungry Deep Tavern","Belondor wants to speak with you about the events that transpired beneath the Mâkhda Khorbo.","Rothog the Storm has something to say to you.","You have agreed to stand by Sirgon with much of your crew while he meets with Belondor."}},
[6930]={nameES="Instancia: La Codicia de Gormr",objectivesES={"Por petición de Dwalin, has entrado en la Mansión de Thorin para confrontar a Gormr por su participación en el robo de Hen-heledh.","Dwalin informa a Mathi Manofirme, quien acaba de entrar, que tú le contarás la historia de tu batalla contra Marrec.","Con Marrec muerto y Hen-heledh a salvo, deberías atender a Dwalin.","Confronta a Marrec.","Has encontrado a Gormr.","Mientras hablabas con Mathi, la dama Arwen entró y comenzó a atender las heridas de Dwalin. Deberías hablar con ella para saber cómo está.","Instancia: La Codicia de Gormr","En lugar de confrontar a Gormr, lo encontraste rodeado de trasgos. Con la distracción que provocaste, logró escapar, pero Marrec envió trasgos a atacarte. Debes defenderte.","Has derrotado a los trasgos, pero Dwalin ha caído. Deberías atenderlo.","Marrec ha derribado a Dwalin, dejándote solo para evitar su huida.","Has acompañado a Dwalin a la sala del trono de la Mansión de Thorin. Deberías hablar con él antes de confrontar a Gormr.","Has encontrado a Gormr, mortalmente herido por Marrec. Deberías hablar con él mientras aún vive.","Marrec ha robado el Espejo de Visión a Gormr. No debe escapar de la Mansión de Thorin con Hen-heledh.","Dwalin te ordena seguir a Marrec y detenerlo antes de que robe Hen-heledh a Gormr.","Sigue a Marrec."}},
[6931]={nameES="Instancia: Gothmog Aparece",objectivesES={"Can it be? How did Golodir come to Osgiliath before you, and what evil befell him here?","Talk to Derufin by the mighty ram Grond","You have found the broken body of the Ranger Golodir","Derufin has asked you to travel north through Osgiliath while he searches to the east for his brother Duilin and for Grond.","A flash of colour to the north-east! Can it be?","A feeling of dread falls upon you, and hazy images swim before your eyes","You have made your way with Derufin into enemy-occupied Osgiliath in search of the mighty ram Grond.","The enemy has brought a great weapon to Osgiliath, and you have volunteered to damage or destroy the mighty ram Grond before it can be used against Minas Tirith.","Talk to Derufin and ask him about the dreadful, ghostly images","Travel north through Osgiliath in search of Grond","Your heart is gripped by a sudden chill","You are drawn to the north-east... is that where Grond may be found?","Give your last respects to Golodir","Talk to Derufin within Osgiliath","Instancia: Gothmog Aparece","A terrifying foe has come to Osgiliath.","Your eyes must be playing tricks on you","Derufin and Duilin have caught up with you and marvel at the sheer size of the mighty ram Grond.","You have found Grond, and the mighty ram is undefended. Now is the time for you to damage its great wheels.","Derufin is within the city of Osgiliath, helping you search for Grond, the mighty weapon of the enemy.\
\
You experienced an overpowering feeling of dread within the city of Osgiliath, and felt the presence of ghostly images, but Derufin does not seem to have noticed any of the strange occurrences.","Talk to Duilin by the mighty ram Grond","You have found Grond, great weapon of the Enemy","Stand with Duilin and Derufin within Osgiliath","Find Grond somewhere within Osgiliath","As you approach the fallen Ranger, your mind rebels at the thought that Golodir might have somehow gotten ahead of you and come to Osgiliath against Aragorn's command. How could he have come more swiftly than the Corsair ships, more swiftly than your own tread?\
\
The merest flickering doubt is enough to dispel your wondering mind, and you see now that the body lying on the cold stones of war-torn Osgiliath is not that of Golodir after all, but another soldier fallen in the defence.","Derufin is within Osgiliath, and has expressed concern over the increasingly potent visions you have experienced within the city."}},
[6932]={nameES="Instancia: La ira de Gothmog",objectivesES={"Gothmog has not yet exhausted his powers. With his illusions defeated he redoubles his attack!","Go with the disguised Ayorzén to Barad Cúron, pretending to be his prisoner","Survive the further assaults of Gothmog","Culang has succumbed to his wounds!","The watchful presence that guards the entrance to Barad Cúron has given you leave to enter the tower.","Draw upon the memory of Isildur for inspiration","Both weakened and enraged by your defiance, Gothmog presses the attack!","Ayorzén has disguised himself as Karazgar, the Weeping Warrior, and plans to bring you inside Barad Cúron as his prisoner.","Draw upon the memory of Elendil for inspiration","Gothmog stumbles in pain, cursing his mortality","Draw upon the memory of Narmeleth for inspiration","Culang believes you should use Gothmog's own weapons against him, reminding the wraith of those heroes who stood against darkness despite the evils arrayed against them. It is Culang's hope that the light of their inspiration will serve to weaken the wraith, sapping him of his strength.","Defeat Gothmog","Enter Barad Cúron and confront Gothmog","Talk to Ayorzén outside Barad Cúron","Draw upon the memory of Anárion for inspiration","Defeat the illusions of Mordirith","Inside Barad Cúron, the Tower of the Crescent Moon, the villain Gothmog awaits.","<rgb=#FF0000>Culang must survive</rgb>","Instancia: La ira de Gothmog","Ayorzén has disguised himself as Karazgar, the Weeping Warrior, and now he attempts to bring you and the Ranger Culang into Barad Cúron as his prisoners.","Draw upon the memory of Golodir for inspiration","Inside Barad Cúron, the wraith Gothmog attempts to demoralize you with painful memories of the past."}},
[6933]={nameES="Instancia: Saluda al cielo",objectivesES={"Habla con un enano al borde del Lago Espejo","Sigue a Svanr hasta el Valle del Arroyo Sombrío","Svanr se encuentra en la Primera Sala de Nud-melek.","Vuelve con Svanr","El enano te invita a contemplar Kheled-zâram","Instancia: Saluda al cielo","Habla con Svanr","Habla con alguien en Mekhem-bizru","Svanr se encuentra fuera de Moria, en el Valle del Arroyo Sombrío.\
\
Debes hablar con Svanr.","Mekhem-bizru se encuentra al final del camino que parte de la Puerta Este de Moria.","Las aguas de Kheled-zâram parecen frescas y claras, las estrellas brillando sobre la superficie como joyas relucientes.","Este es un buen punto de vista","<rgb=#FF0000>Mira</rgb> el Lago Espejo desde Mekhem-bizru","El Lago Espejo, también llamado Kheled-zâram, es el lago que se encuentra junto a Mekhem-bizru en el Valle del Arroyo Sombrío.\
\
Debes <rgb=#FF0000>mirar</rgb> el Lago Espejo desde Mekhem-bizru.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión requiere emotes.</rgb>","Es hora de dejar Moria por fin y disfrutar del aire fresco nuevamente.","Svanr se encuentra en el Valle del Arroyo Sombrío.\
\
Debes hablar con Svanr.","Kheled-zâram es el gran lago que se encuentra en el Valle del Arroyo Sombrío.\
\
Debes hablar con un enano que contemple Kheled-zâram."}},
[6934]={nameES="Instancia: Agravios",objectivesES={"Instancia: Agravios","Accompany Authi as he presents his case before King Thorin","Talk to Authi","Talk to Hrostyr, King Thorin's personal guard","King Thorin has chosen to hear Authi Gem-cutter's grievance, but he will not do so at his throne.","Listen to the judgement of King Thorin","King Thorin has chosen to go among his people for the hearing of Authi's complaint.","Authi has heard the king's judgement and now wishes to speak with you.","Talk to King Thorin","Authi Gem-cutter has asked for your help with bringing his grievance against Khîl Tale-spinner before the king.","Listen to Khîl's response before the king"}},
[6935]={nameES="Instancia: Bosque Oscuro arderá",objectivesES={"An unwelcome smell fills the air....","Hildith has chosen to free the prisoner in hope that he will stop the attack","Hildith has asked you to watch and wait....","Elfhelm is with Hildith at the gate of Grimslade.","Talk to Hildith","Instancia: Bosque Oscuro arderá","Hildith is in the jail of Grimslade.","Speak with Hildith once more","Hildith is in the jail of Grimslade.\
\
You should speak with Hildith.","Hildith is at the front gate of Grimslade.","Hildith has gone to the front gate of Grimslade.\
\
You should speak with Hildith.","Grimslade must be saved from the Half-orcs bringing fire.","Speak with Elfhelm","The half-orc who was moments ago a prisoner of Grimslade now stands before the gates of town.","Assist Hildith at the front gate","Grimslade is being attacked! Defend the city gate....","Stand your ground to defend Grimslade","Speak with Hildith","Defend Grimslade","Wait alongside Hildith and the guards of Grimslade","Speak with the prisoner","Follow Hildith","Listen to Hildith's decision","The half-orc who was moments ago a prisoner of Grimslade now stands before the gates of town.\
\
You should speak with the prisoner."}},
[6936]={nameES="Instance: Guiding the Misguided",objectivesES={}},
[6937]={nameES="Instancia: Medias verdades",objectivesES={"Has recuperado una mitad de Narchuil y debes asistir al consejo convocado por Elrond para discutir el destino del anillo y analizar las acciones de Laerdan.","Instancia: Medias verdades","Asiste al Consejo de Narchuil","Asiste al Consejo de Narchuil."}},
[6938]={nameES="Instancia: Medianos y Olifantes",objectivesES={}},
[6939]={nameES="Instancia: Medianos y Olifantes",objectivesES={}},
[6940]={nameES="Instancia: Hamât Renovado",objectivesES={"Listen to Mizâdi speak to the other leaders","Continue listening to the conversation between Mizâdi and the other leaders","Give Mizâdi's gift to Rahâzi","Bow out of respect to Mizâdi","Speak with Mizâdi at Dun Shûma.","Bow out of respect to Mizâdi.","Mizâdi, Girhâzi, Rahâzi, Amalíbi, and Numûru have gathered outside Dun Shûma to discuss their victory and what is next for Shagâna.","Cheer with Mizâdi","Instancia: Hamât Renovado","Listen to the conversation between the leaders","Continue listening to the conversation between Mizâdi and the other leaders.","Listen to the conversation between Mizâdi and the other leaders.","Speak with Mizâdi at Dun Shûma","Give Mizâdi's gift to Amalíbi","Finish listening to the conversation between Mizâdi and the other leaders.","Listen to the conversation between Mizâdi and the other leaders","Give Mizâdi's gift to Girhâzi","Cheer with Mizâdi!","Continue listening to the conversation","Give gifts to each of the leaders.","Gather pile of gifts Mizâdi brought.","Finish listening to the conversation between Mizâdi and the other leaders","Give Mizâdi's gift to Numûru"}},
[6941]={nameES="Instancia: Negociaciones difíciles",objectivesES={"Talk to Éowyn outside Meduseld","Thane Edric can be found outside Meduseld in Edoras.\
\
Thane Edric has argued with Éowyn and has now drawn his blade against her. You must defeat him.","Instancia: Negociaciones difíciles","DNT -- Players will not see","Listen to Edric and Éowyn's conversation","The glow of torches in the distance signals Éowyn's arrival","Éowyn can be found outside Meduseld in Edoras.\
\
You have defeated Edric, subduing him before his madness could inflict any harm on Éowyn. You should now speak to Éowyn.","Thane Edric can be found on the stairs to Meduseld in Edoras.\
\
You have arrived in Edoras and should now follow Edric as he seeks Éowyn.","Thane Edric is standing outside the doors to Meduseld.\
\
Thane Edric is clearly overcome by his recent loss. You should speak to him.","Following the tragic deaths of his wife and people, Thane Edric journeys to Edoras to confront Éowyn.","Thane Edric is outside Meduseld.\
\
Éowyn has arrived in response to Edric's shouts. You should wait until Edric demands your account of the events on the road to Aldburg.","Wait with Thane Edric","Knowing he is beaten, Edric yields and tears stream down his face","Edric's face betrays a seething rage","Follow Thane Edric to Meduseld","Talk to Thane Edric","Thane Edric is outside Meduseld in Edoras.\
\
Edric seeks an audience with Éowyn. You should wait at his side.","DNT -- Player will not see","Thane Edric can be found outside Meduseld in Edoras.\
\
You have ridden to Edoras with Thane Edric in search of Éowyn. You should follow Edric.","Defeat Thane Edric"}},
[6942]={nameES="Instancia: El odio al oso y al Hombre",objectivesES={"Ofolmóth te ha revelado sus intenciones. No acatará las leyes de los Hombres.\
\
Langhár desea hablar contigo antes de que comience el combate.","Habla con Langhár en las ruinas","Has encontrado a Ofolmóth, y se pregunta si has venido a unirte a él.","Habla con Ofolmóth","Has llegado con Langhár a las Ciénagas del Sur en busca de Ofolmóth. Ella espera hablar contigo antes de continuar hacia las ruinas donde se vio por última vez a tu pariente.","Sobrevive a tu encuentro con Ofolmóth","Instancia: El odio al oso y al Hombre","Has encontrado a Ofolmóth, pero ya no es de tu sangre. Ahora es tu enemigo.","Habla con Langhár en las Ciénagas del Sur","Langhár ha sido herida de gravedad, pero sigue con vida.","Ofolmóth ha herido gravemente a Langhár y debe ser derrotado.","Has llegado con tu hermana Langhár a las Ciénagas del Sur de las Tierras Solitarias en una misión triste: poner fin a los males cometidos por tu pariente Ofolmóth.","Derrota a Ofolmóth por sus crímenes contra la gente inocente"}},
[6943]={nameES="Instancia: Cabeza de la Bestia Caída",objectivesES={"Burn the carcass of the fell-beast","Wrap the head of the fell-beast in the heavy cloth given to you by Mithrandir.","Talk to Éomer on the Pelennor.","Talk to Mithrandir near the corpse of the fell-beast.","Mithrandir greets the scholars of the Houses of Lore","The corpse burns with eerie flames","Mithrandir takes the wrapped fell-beast head from you","Mithrandir gives you a heavy cloth in which to wrap the head of the fell-beast","Talk to Éomer by the burning carcass of the fell-beast","Now that you have wrapped the head of the foul steed in heavy cloth, Mithrandir asked that you burn the corpse of the fell-beast.","Stand by as Mithrandir speaks with the scholars of the Houses of Lore.","Mithrandir has taken an interest in the slain fell-beast that once served as the steed of the Witch-king of Angmar, Lord of the Nazgûl.","Remain alert while Mithrandir speaks with the scholars at the Houses of Lore","Talk to Mithrandir in the Houses of Lore.","Wrap the fell-beast head in the cloth","Talk to Mithrandir in the Houses of Lore","Travel to the Houses of Lore with Mithrandir","Instancia: Cabeza de la Bestia Caída","Talk to Mithrandir by the carcass of the fell-beast","Travel to the Houses of Lore with Mithrandir and deliver the head of the fell-beast to the scholars there.","Talk to Mithrandir by the burning carcass of the fell-beast"}},
[6944]={nameES="Instancia: Atendiendo a la llamada",objectivesES={"More Ungoledain are approaching!","Defeat Ungoledain at Rhosgobel","Defend Rhosgobel from the Ungoledain.","Deja que acontecimientos sigan su curso.","Instancia: Atendiendo a la llamada","Defeat Mengris Tásakh.","Defeat Ungoledain at Rhosgobel.","Talk to Radagast outside his cottage.","Listen to Radagast","Radagast is concerned that the Ungoledain may have come to Laerlad because they are searching for Rhosgobel.","The Ungoledain retreat","Defend Rhosgobel from the Ungoledain","Deja que acontecimientos sigan su curso","Defeat Mengris Tásakh","Talk to Radagast outside his cottage"}},
[6945]={nameES="Instancia: Reliquia de Cardolan",objectivesES={"Your head is pounding.","You have encountered a daring hobbit lass while searching for a way to cleanse the corruption from the sceptre that came out of Mordor.","Examine the tomb in Haudh Nogbenn","There is a hobbit girl in Haudh Nogbenn! What is she doing here?","Instancia: Reliquia de Cardolan","You found a fallen shield outside Haudh Nogbenn. Has someone been taken inside the barrow, and now needs your help?","Marigold Boffin is in Haudh Nogbenn.","Listen to the words of the slain prince","Talk to the owner of the shield and protect them from harm","Talk to Marigold Boffin","Has someone fallen into danger in Haudh Nogbenn?","Search for someone in danger inside Haudh Nogbenn","There is a tomb in Haudh Nogbenn. Is this the final resting place of the sceptre's owner?","It's Marigold Boffin!"}},
[6946]={nameES="Instancia: Reliquia de Khazad-dûm",objectivesES={"Dwarves died here, but there is no sign of Orc-kind in these rooms","Greith is in the central chamber, just east of the geode.","Talk to Greith in the central chamber, just north of the geode","Greith has asked you to search the room to the east of the Chamber of Machurful.","The Key of the Forgotten has been cleansed of Mordor's corruption!","<rgb=#FF0000>Greith must not be defeated</rgb>","Greith has asked you to search the room to the north of the Chamber of Machurful.","Greith is in the central chamber, by the tremendous geode.","Defeat Grotcleaver","Greith survived the battle with Grotcleaver, and wishes to speak with you.","Grotcleaver falls, last resident of Machurful","Talk to Greith","You have unlocked a door in Khazad-dûm that has remained sealed for more than a thousand years.","Search the northern chamber","Search the southern chamber and return to Greith","Talk to Greith in the central chamber","Grotcleaver, a tremendous deep-claw, has made its home in the Chamber of Machurful.","Greith has been defeated!","Search the rooms to the east","Greith is in the central chamber, just north of the geode.","Talk to Greith in the central chamber, just east of the geode","Greith has asked you to search the room to the south of the Chamber of Machurful.","Instancia: Reliquia de Khazad-dûm","Bodies lie in the northern chamber, but the shelves are undisturbed"}},
[6947]={nameES="Instancia: Reliquia de Osgiliath",objectivesES={"Listen to the words of Nathlad","Nathlad has ended his patrol and now stands before you, deep in thought.","Nathlad has brought you down to the bridges that now cross the Anduin, above which stands the city of Osgiliath.","Talk to Nathlad by the bridges that cross the River Anduin","Nathlad has agreed to tell you what he knows about the rigging-hook you recovered from Mordor, but he wants you to help him with his work along the river.","Talk to Nathlad","Instancia: Reliquia de Osgiliath","Nathlad has come to a conclusion."}},
[6948]={nameES="Instancia: Reliquia de Rhudaur",objectivesES={"Instancia: Reliquia de Rhudaur","The coffer contains only dust. What a waste!","You have entered the Rhudauran Lost Temple in an attempt to cleanse the evil from the corrupted cup that came to you out of Mordor.","Fithákh falls. She will not see the Corcur rise, after all","The cultist has mistaken you for a friend","An enterprising soul has already looted this coffin","Talk to Fithákh in the inner chamber","Fithákh asked you to set the cup on the tomb in the middle of the inner chamber, saying that it will serve as an altar for a sacrifice.","You feel light-headed. Suddenly, a cool breeze rushes through the chamber!","You hastily leave the Lost Temple. Fithákh is not your concern","Set the corrupted cup on the central tomb","Explore the Lost Temple and find a way into the innermost chamber","There must be some way to get into the innermost chamber of the Lost Temple, where Elrond believes the corrupted cup might be redeemed.","Either leave the inner chamber or put an end to Fithákh's villainy","Sadly, the brazier contains nothing of value","Fithákh, a cultist of the Corcur, has gained entrance to the innermost chamber of the Lost Temple. She seems to be expecting someone.","You have done what you set out to do, and now you can either leave the chamber with haste or put an end to Fithákh's villainy."}},
[6949]={nameES="Instancia: Reliquia de los Hijos de la tierra",objectivesES={"Talk to Rattleleaf and get him back on track","Rhothlas has begun to tell you the tale of what he saw by the still pool.","Rattleleaf has agreed to tell you the story of what he saw by the pool beneath Kar Lak. Will hearing his tale help you to cleanse the Earth-kin pouch of its corruption?","Rattleleaf is by the still pool beneath Kar Lak, waiting to tell you his tale.","Listen to Rattleleaf's tale","Rattleleaf is by the pool beneath Kar Lak.","Instancia: Reliquia de los Hijos de la tierra","Rattleleaf seems to have distracted himself, and needs reminding of the story he was going to tell.","Talk to Rattleleaf and hear his tale","Talk to Rattleleaf","Rattleleaf has told you the story of Trotsiv, unhappy though it was."}},
[6950]={nameES="Instancia: Reliquia de los Eglain",objectivesES={"Darothild's shade stands before you at the Spring of the Red-maid, where she lost her final battle.\
\
Walgar has asked you to show the corrupted sculpture to Darothild's shade.","You know beyond any doubt: this is the shade of Darothild, who fell at the Spring of the Red-maid.","Walgar is at the Spring of the Red-maid.","Darothild's shade stands before you at the Spring of the Red-maid, where she lost her final battle.","You have survived the onslaught of enemies at the Spring of the Red-maid, but now a mysterious figure has revealed herself.","Talk to Walgar at the Spring of the Red-maid","Talk to Darothild's shade","Aric the Stone-speaker told you that the carving seems to be of Darothild, a champion who defied the Red-maid long ago, and was lost.","Defend Walgar from the Woman at the Spring","Show the corrupted sculpture to Darothild's shade","Instancia: Reliquia de los Eglain","Ease Darothild's pain","There can be no doubt. This is the shade of Darothild","You have come with some Eglain warriors to the Spring of the Red-maid. Here it may be that you can remove the corruption that encircles the carving of Darothild."}},
[6951]={nameES="Instancia: Reliquia del Gran Rey",objectivesES={"Talk to Techeron at the Bridge of Ariant","Talk to Techeron","The Ranger Techeron is near the Bridge of Ariant.","Instancia: Reliquia del Gran Rey","The Badge of Ariant has been cleansed of Mordor's corruption!","The Ranger Techeron is at the Bridge of Ariant, in Annúminas.","You have come with Techeron to the Bridge of Ariant with the hope that the corrupted badge might be cleansed of its evil."}},
[6952]={nameES="Instancia: Reliquia de lo Ordinario",objectivesES={"Habla con Umín","Umín stands outside the docked ship, waiting to speak with you.","Umín has collected the necklace from where it lay, and he wishes to speak with you about it.","Habla con Mal Juntahierbas","Investigate the forsaken ship","Others have come to the lost ship for some unknown purpose, and you should learn what they intend.","Umín's words have had an effect on Mal Stackwort, but whether they will last remains to be seen.","Mal Stackwort has no idea of the meaning behind Umín's words, and has asked you to explain them.","Mal Stackwort, former minion of Bill Ferny, leads a crew of cutthroats intending to free the forsaken ship from its trapped berth.","Instancia: Reliquia de lo Ordinario","Umín has returned with you to the forsaken ship where the Spirit of the Necklace was defeated, hoping to aid you in cleansing the corruption from the necklace you found in Mordor, and perhaps to find some measure of peace for himself.","Mantente en guardia","Defeat Mal Stackwort's crew of cutthroats"}},
[6953]={nameES="Instancia: Reliquia de la Marca de los Jinetes",objectivesES={"The Orcs that captured Eldmath belong to the Boar-tribe and are led by Tharbag.","Remain alert and look for an opportunity to free Eldmath","Instancia: Reliquia de la Marca de los Jinetes","Eldmath was taken eastward to Gris-shâtroful","Talk to Tharbag","Talk to Eldmath","Tharbag's Orcs have captured Eldmath, and you really should free him... he was holding onto the corrupted tusk-shard when he was taken!","Sneak into Gris-shâtroful from the back","Skámash has been left in charge of dealing with you. This will likely prove to be a mistake!","Tharbag has foolishly left a single Orc to deal with you","The Vengeance of Folca has been cleansed of Mordor's corruption!","Talk to Skámash","Eldmath has run into some trouble while out in the field, and now he has been captured by Orcs. Even worse, he was holding onto the corrupted tusk-shard when he was taken!","Gris-shâtroful is to the east, and you might be able to drop down from above and surprise the Orcs that captured Eldmath.","Eldmath is in Gris-shâtroful, waiting to speak with you.","You have found Eldmath, but the Orcs were alerted to your presence.","Survive the encounter with Tharbag"}},
[6954]={nameES="Instancia: Reliquia de los Hombres de las Nieves",objectivesES={"Lothrandir is in the village of Sûri-kylä.","Pinja has been defeated!","Talk to Pinja in front of her home","You never met Oiva, but this does appear to be a warrior of the Lossoth. As you study the still form, you feel a sharp pain behind your eyes and a throbbing in your head.","A Lossoth warrior claims that Pinja's dead husband Oiva has returned to life. How can this be?","The widow Pinja is outside her home, in Sûri-kylä.","The Brooch of Bone has been cleansed of Mordor's corruption!","Remain alert for any further treachery by Hamaito","Lothrandir has been defeated","Something is afoot in the the village of the Lossoth, and Lothrandir fears that the corruption that infuses the brooch may have done some harm to the widow to whom he returned it.","Habla con Pinja","Find Pinja and learn what has happened","Hamaito has been defeated, and the corruption of Oiva's bone brooch has been cleansed.","Lothrandir is in Sûri-kylä.","Talk to Lothrandir in Sûri-kylä","Pinja told you that whatever has taken her husband Oiva's shape is currently unconscious behind her home.","Instancia: Reliquia de los Hombres de las Nieves","A spirit has masqueraded as Pinja's slain husband for its own cruel jest, but you have now revealed it.","Defeat Hamaito","Hamaito has revealed himself and seeks to avenge the spoiling of his jest.","Examine the unconscious body behind Pinja's home","The cold air shimmers as if beheld through a haze of heat","A Lossoth warrior has news of Pinja's whereabouts in Sûri-kylä.","Talk to the Lossoth warrior in Sûri-kylä"}},
[6955]={nameES="Instancia: Reliquia de las Tribus",objectivesES={"Raiglud is telling you a tale from her childhood.","Raiglud is ready to continue her tale.","Talk to Raiglud and listen to the rest of her story","Raiglud has told you she needs to rest a moment, for the telling of this tale is taking a lot out of her.","Raiglud has a story to tell, and perhaps hearing it will help you to cleanse the needle of the corruption that surrounds it.","Raiglud, the oldest woman in Lhanuch, has begun to tell you a tale from her childhood.","Consider Raiglud's description of Maushkán","Maushkán has already slain many members of Raiglud's tribe this day, but he is eager to kill even more. You can almost see the rage and hatred in his eyes, and smell his foul stench. He leads a raiding party of Orcs, and they follow him out of fear and a desire for treasure.","Listen to Raiglud's story","Raiglud has told her story.","It is hard to believe that Raiglud could ever have been young, but you know that it must have been true, as it is for all people. You can almost see her, hidden by a mound of grass and hay, as her fear of Maushkán and his band wars with her anger at what they have done to her people.","Consider Raiglud's description of Deilur","Consider Raiglud's description of herself as a child","Talk to Raiglud","You can almost see Deilur standing defiantly before the Orc raiding party, surrounded by the bodies of her friends and her family among the Uch-lûth. She has little chance of surviving this encounter, but Raiglud's description of her is so vivid that she seems almost to be standing before you, hale and hearty.\
\
She has nothing that might be called a weapon, but she does grip a needle of bone in one hidden fist.","Instancia: Reliquia de las Tribus","The Needle of Many Leagues has been cleansed of Mordor's corruption!"}},
[6956]={nameES="Instancia: Reliquia de los Hombres Salvajes",objectivesES={"Instancia: Reliquia de los Hombres Salvajes","Khôr-buri-Ghân is inside the cave that was his brother's favourite place.","Descend to the lower chamber of the cave and confront the Orc","An Orc has found Bhai-buri-Ghân's cave.","Confront Turkalb","You have come with Khôr-buri-Ghân to the cave that was his brother Bhai-buri-Ghân's favourite place.","Khôr-buri-Ghân is in his brother's favourite cave.","Help protect Khôr-buri-Ghân","Talk to Khôr-buri-Ghân inside the cave","The Memento of Bhai-buri-Ghân has been cleansed of Mordor's corruption!","Khôr-buri-Ghân motions for you to descend and confront the Orc, and he will follow","The Orc Turkalb has found Bhai-buri-Ghân's favourite cave."}},
[6957]={nameES="Instancia: Alto Asiento de los Enanos",objectivesES={"Talk to Durin atop the stairs near the Steepset","Talk to Durin in the court below the Steepset","The stairs leading to the Steepset have been made safe","Durin stands with his personal guard Hrostyr not far from the Steepset, and he waits to speak with you.","Clear the stairs leading to the Steepset of foes","Hear the words of Durin before the Steepset","Instancia: Alto Asiento de los Enanos","Durin stands by the Steepset, mourning for what has been lost.","Durin stands before the Steepset, the High Seat of the Lord of Gundabad.","Durin desires to see with his own eyes the Steepset, the High Seat of the Lord of Gundabad.","Talk to Durin by the Steepset","Durin asked you to clear the stairs leading to the Steepset of foes. Once you have accomplished this, he will rejoin you at the top of the stairs.","Now that you have cleared the stairs of his foes, Durin can climb to the Steepset.\
\
He waits to speak with you at the top of the stairs."}},
[6958]={nameES="Instancia: El Consejo de Hildith",objectivesES={"Hildith's council is in the Mead Hall of Grimslade.","Hildith is in the Mead Hall of Grimslade.","Hildith is in Grimslade's Mead Hall.","Hildith is in the Grimslade Mead Hall.","Listen to the council","Hildith gives you a look as hard as stone as you depart","Hildith has offended everyone with her harsh words...","Bow to Hildith and take your leave","Speak with Hildith","Walk to the door","Ask Hildith why she was so harsh to Dunward","Utterly alone in the Thane's seat, Hildith's angry demeanor has dissolved into one of deep sadness now that she thinks no one is near.","You feel compelled to take one last look at Hildith","Instancia: El Consejo de Hildith","Hildith decides to sit and hear council from you and from Dunward.","Éomer's tale is done. You should now return your thoughts to the men gathered at Helm's Gate, waiting for Gandalf and hoping that Erkenbrand will return soon.","You should head towards the door of the Mead Hall.","Look back at Hildith from across the Mead Hall"}},
[6959]={nameES="Instancia: Asalto a la colina",objectivesES={"Habla con Fuirgam y comienza el asalto a la fortaleza orca.","Fuirgam debe sobrevivir","Instancia: Asalto a la colina","Habla con Fuirgam para poner fin a la batalla y reclamar la fortaleza para los Malledhrim.","Habla con Fuirgam","Fuirgam está preparado para lanzar su asalto a la fortaleza orca que domina los Lindes Oscuros. Te ha pedido que te unas a sus fuerzas para el ataque, que, si tiene éxito, debería romper la columna vertebral de las fuerzas orcas que defienden el bosque, permitiendo a los Malledhrim avanzar hacia la torre de Dol Guldur.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Completar esta misión pondrá fin al asalto a los Lindes Oscuros. \
\
Cualquier misión que no hayas completado en esta área será cancelada y ya no estará accesible después.</rgb>"}},
[6960]={nameES="Instancia: El hijo de su padre",objectivesES={"Instancia: El hijo de su padre","Talk to Gurnákh","Once again, the shade of Tárandil falls silent","Vágari the Wanderer desires to speak to you of his past misdeeds.","The shade that came to be called Vágari the Wanderer desires to confess to you the misdeeds of his past.","Hear the words of Isildur as recounted by Vágari","Listen to Vágari's account","The shade of Tárandil says nothing.","Talk to Vágari the Wanderer"}},
[6961]={nameES="Instancia: Regreso a casa",objectivesES={"Talk to Horn outside the Mead Hall in Eaworth","Listen to the conversation around the table in the Mead Hall of Eaworth","Talk to Reeve Ingbert in the Mead Hall of Eaworth","Talk to Corudan at the table in the Mead Hall of Eaworth","You have attended a feast at Horn's home of Eaworth. The food was good, but your reception by Horn's father Ingbert was frosty.","Talk to Nona in the Mead Hall of Eaworth","Horn is outside the Mead Hall, in Eaworth.","Horn is outside the Mead Hall of Eaworth.","Instancia: Regreso a casa","Ingbert, Ingyth, and Nona have gotten up from the table and are each in the Mead Hall of Eaworth. You should speak with each of them.","Horn interrupts before you can speak to Ingyth","Corudan's seat is just to your right, at the table in the Mead Hall of Eaworth.","Talk to Ingyth in the Mead Hall of Eaworth","Talk to Horn inside the Mead Hall of Eaworth","The feast is over, but the conversation continues.","Talk to Reeve Ingbert at the table in the Mead Hall of Eaworth","Reeve Ingbert is at the table in the Mead Hall of Eaworth.","Horn is in the Mead Hall of Eaworth.","Talk to Ingyth at the table in the Mead Hall of Eaworth","Ingyth is at the table just to the right of her father, Ingbert, in the Mead Hall of Eaworth."}},
[6962]={nameES="Instance: Homestead Defence",objectivesES={}},
[6963]={nameES="Instancia: Honor y traición",objectivesES={"Follow Fastred as he seeks Crúmgam","Burnoth is standing on the field near Kings' End.\
\
You have arrived at the last location where Fastred sighted Crúmgam, and should now talk to Burnoth.","Instancia: Honor y traición","Crúmgam's flames are upon one of the charred fields outside Kings' End.\
\
Vile flames have sprung to life and must now be quenched.","The ambushing foes can be found just ahead.\
\
You have begun your search for Crúmgam, but foes now harry your advance. You must defeat them!","Confront Crúmgam","Burnoth is standing near the pyre outside Kings' End.\
\
You have defeated the traitor, Brodwulf, and should now speak to Burnoth.","Fastred and the Riders Three are searching the fields outside Kings' End.\
\
You have survived an ambush and should now resume your search for Crúmgam.","Talk to Burnoth","Search the charred fields for signs of Crúmgam","Defeat the ambushing foes","Fastred is running through the charred fields outside Kings' End.\
\
You have witnessed Crúmgam's sorcery and should now search the nearby area for Crúmgam.","Defeat Brodwulf and avenge Léofdag","The paths of the Riders Three and Reeve Fastred align as they move against Crúmgam and his traitorous agent.","Defeat the seeking flames","Brodwulf is standing near the pyre outside Kings' End.\
\
Crúmgam has fled, leaving the traitor to his fate. You should defeat Brodwulf and avenge Léofdag.","Crúmgam is standing before the pyre outside Kings' End.\
\
You have found Crúmgam and beside him stands a man bearing the armour of the King's knights - a traitor deep within the heart of Rohan."}},
[6964]={nameES="Instancia: Comienzos Humildes",objectivesES={"El hombre está vestido de manera extraña, pero parece amistoso, y cualquier enemigo de los trasgos o de los orcos es amigo de los Holbytlan.","Protege a tus amigos y familia de los trasgos","Rebusca en el saco del trasgo para conseguir un arma y equípala, y luego habla con Fanglind","Habla con Odger Túcca más adelante por el sendero hacia el sureste","El Águila Fanglind ha protegido durante mucho tiempo a los Holbytlan de cualquiera que encuentre su valle oculto, y hoy no ha sido diferente.","Habla con tu amigo Valaric Túcca entre los pacíficos hogares de los Holbytlan","Habla con Meneldir y completa la misión 'Un Mundo Más Grande'","Habla con la Abuela Madelgard Túcca","Has visto a Odger Túcca más abajo por el sendero hacia el sureste, y deberías contarle tus planes.","Le dices a Oggy que la extrañarás","Habla con Ogiva Túcca cuesta abajo","Le prometes a Erma que volverás, algún día.","Habla con la Abuela Maddy","La Abuela Maddy te ha pedido que <rgb=#00FF00>saludes</rgb> a tus amigos y familia, y luego comiences tu gran aventura.","Reúnete con Heldric Túcca fuera de su hogar en Lyndelby cuando el sol se levante en el día que has decidido partir.","Tu buen amigo Valaric Túcca apenas puede creer que hayas tomado la decisión de marcharte.","Habla con Fanglind, uno de los Grandes Águilas que protegen a tu gente","Tu aventura comienza, y juras hacer lo que pidió la Abuela Maddy: ayudar a cualquiera que necesite ayuda.","Habla con Erma Túcca cerca de la base de la colina","El mejor amigo de Odger Túcca, su rana Croaker, ha desaparecido.","Vilíhad nunca ha tenido demasiada imaginación.","Habla con Vilihad en el sendero hacia el sur","Instancia: Comienzos Humildes","Reúnete con Heldric Túcca cuando salga el sol","La Abuela Maddy te pidió que te despidieras de algunos de los madrugadores de Lyndelby.","Encontraste a Croaker... ¡pero también encontraste una tropa de trasgos husmeando!","El mejor amigo de Odger Túcca, su rana Croaker, ha desaparecido, pero oíste su croar cerca de las rocas al suroeste.","Fanglind te ha recomendado que busques en el saco que dejaron los trasgos y equipes una de las armas que encuentres dentro. Después, quiere hablar contigo un poco más.","Oyes el croar preocupado de Croaker proveniente del suroeste","<rgb=#00FF00>Saluda</rgb> a tus amigos y familia, los buenos Holbytlan de Lyndelby, y comienza tu gran aventura","Le dices a Fanglind que tu corazón te llama a partir, y él agita sus plumas.","La Abuela Madelgard Túcca está esperando hablar contigo mientras el sol se eleva sobre un hermoso día en la aldea oculta de Lyndelby.","Tu viaje exige que ayudes a la gente que lo necesite","Espera a que Croaker revele a dónde ha ido","Busca a Croaker cerca de las rocas al suroeste","La Abuela Maddy te mira con tristeza, pero también con esperanza en sus ojos."}},
[6965]={nameES="Instancia: Cazador cazado",objectivesES={"Talk to Shaidal","The sounds of footsteps fill the halls, you are ambushed by attackers.","Rothog has asked that you travel into the gladiator's residences and question Shaidal regarding the petition.","With the ambush survived, Shaidal calls you over","Instancia: Cazador cazado","Speak to Shaidal about the attack and what he will need of you.","Within the halls of Dahâl Huliz, the gladiators make their home. Rothog has asked that you question Shaidal.","Speak to Shaidal about the attack","Defeat ambushers"}},
[6966]={nameES="Instance: Imminent Collapse",objectivesES={"Ondor has collapsed the cave-entrance","You have come upon a cave-entrance in the northern Heathfells, on the border of Nan Curunir, where you have encountered a rather unusual dwarf. Without heed to his own safety, he has set about collapsing the cave-entrance, which he claims leads to a warren of Orcs below.","Instance: Imminent Collapse","Ondor is at the Orc-cave.\
\
You should speak with Ondor the Dwarf once more.","Defend Ondor as he works to collapse the cave-entrance.","Talk to Ondor","Talk to Ondor at the Orc-cave"}},
[6967]={nameES="Instancia: En un Valle del Norte",objectivesES={"Camina junto a Boromir y cuéntale lo sucedido desde que os separasteis.","Habla con Boromir","Instancia: En un Valle del Norte","Bregoleth te dijo que un amigo te espera más adelante, por el sendero que desciende hacia Rivendel.","Encuentra al amigo del que habló Bregoleth más adelante en el sendero","Al parecer, el propio viaje de Boromir llegó a buen puerto, y el soldado de Gondor se alegra de verte.","Le contaste a Boromir parte de lo que te ocurrió junto a Meneldir después de que los tres se separaron, y el soldado de Gondor ha pasado gran parte del trayecto en silencio.","Habla con Galasebdir en el camino a través de las Tierras Solitarias.","Elrond, el señor de la casa, desea escuchar tu historia.","Habla con Bregoleth","Galasebdir, un montaraz conocido tuyo, te ha alcanzado en el camino a través de las Tierras Solitarias.","Elrond de Rivendel debe ser advertido de la sombra que se alza en Angmar.","Habla con Boromir junto a La Última Morada.","Semiorcos acosan a los viajeros en el camino a través de las Tierras Solitarias.\
\
Candaith tenía razón: el camino a Rivendel es peligroso.","Boromir desea saber qué ocurrió después de que los tres tomaron caminos distintos.","Habla con Gandalf el Gris fuera de La Última Morada.","Habla con Elrond fuera de La Última Morada.","Habla con Galasebdir en el camino a través del Bosque de los Trolls","Gandalf el Gris te ha saludado fuera de La Última Morada y desea hablar contigo.","Habla con Galasebdir en el camino a través del Páramo Alto","En la entrada de Rivendel, el guerrero elfo Bregoleth se alegra al verte.","Habla con Galasebdir en el camino a través del Bosque de los Trolls.","Has viajado con Galasebdir hacia los bosques del Bosque de los Trolls.","Boromir de Gondor levanta la vista hacia ti, con una sonrisa satisfecha en el rostro.","Has ascendido por el Páramo Alto junto a Galasebdir y ahora estás cerca del valle oculto de Rivendel."}},
[6968]={nameES="Instancia: En defensa de Eaworth",objectivesES={"<rgb=#FF0000>Lord Ingmar perished</rgb>","Listen to the conversation","You have broken through the mounted defences of Maustazg","Listen to what Hoital has to say.","Confront Hoital, leader of the Orcs at Maustazg.","You have broken through to the central camp of Maustazg","Fight your way to the centre of Maustazg.","Lord Ingmar has launched an assault upon the Orcs at Maustazg.","Ingmar lies wounded in the central camp of Maustazg.\
\
You should speak with Ingmar and leave Maustazg behind.","You lift Ingmar and carry him away.","Fight your way through the mounted defences of Maustazg.","Defeat Hoital.","Fight through the mounted defences of Maustazg","Talk to Ingmar","Fight your way to the centre of Maustazg","Confront Hoital","<rgb=#FF0000>Lord Ingmar must survive</rgb>","Defeat Hoital and his minions","Defeated Hoital","Speak with Lord Ingmar.","Instancia: En defensa de Eaworth"}},
[6969]={nameES="Instancia: Necesitado de Ánimos",objectivesES={"Éowyn has agreed to bring you along","Éowyn is in Edoras.\
\
You should speak with Éowyn.","Instancia: Necesitado de Ánimos","Éowyn is in Edoras.\
\
You should follow Éowyn.","Fight alongside Éowyn","Éowyn has fallen","Éowyn is in Edoras.\
\
You should listen to Éowyn.","Éowyn's eyes are far away as you look at her, a bitterness upon her fair features that is sad to look upon.\
\
You gently speak her name, and she looks at you once more, her reverie broken.","Éowyn is ready to face the foe that threatens Edoras.","Listen to Éowyn","Fight alongside Éowyn.","Follow Éowyn","Éowyn looks at you once more, startled","Speak with Éowyn","Speak with Éowyn.","You have defeated the warband that threatened the refugees of Edoras!","Rouse Éowyn from her unhappy reverie","Join Éowyn in battle","Éowyn is in need of cheering up, though she hides her dire mood well for the sake of her people."}},
[6970]={nameES="Instancia: En recuerdo",objectivesES={"Mêshka has commissioned a mural in memory of the fallen crew of the Rebuke. Everyone is present, and the memorial is almost ready to begin. You should talk to Mêshka.","You see a painting of Belondor valiantly attempting to defend his doomed crew from Azagath","Talk to Mêshka","Mêshka has commissioned a mural in memory of the fallen crew of the Rebuke. The families of the deceased mariners have tried to absolve Belondor of his feelings of guilt. Belondor wants to talk to you.","Talk to Belondor","Attend the memorial","Admire the mural","Mêshka has commissioned a mural in memory of the fallen crew of the Rebuke. Everyone is present, and the memorial is ready to begin. You should take a moment to look at the mural.","Mêshka has commissioned a mural in memory of the fallen crew of the Rebuke. Everyone is present, and the memorial is ready to begin.","Mêshka has commissioned a mural in memory of the fallen crew of the Rebuke. Everyone is present, and the memorial is beginning.","Instancia: En recuerdo"}},
[6971]={nameES="Instancia: En el Palacio del Cisne",objectivesES={"Roamingstar has appeared in the Palace of the Swan.","King Elessar and Queen Arwen wait to discuss important matters with Imrahil, Prince of Dol Amroth.","Dorthaneth stands in the Palace of the Swan.","Queen Arwen has indicated a place on the floor where she wants you to set down the bowl of water.","Wait until Queen Arwen explains her peculiar words and deeds.","Listen to the words of Dorthaneth","Talk to King Elessar in the Palace of the Swan","Set the bowl of water down on the floor where Queen Arwen indicated","Queen Arwen has asked to speak with you.","Talk to Roamingstar in the Palace of the Swan","Talk to Rossaran in the Palace of the Swan","You have come to the Palace of the Swan, where Imrahil, Prince of Dol Amroth, considers how to deal with the threats that still endanger Gondor in the aftermath of the War of the Ring.","Wait for your audience with the Prince of Dol Amroth","Wait for Queen Arwen to explain herself","Talk to Queen Arwen in the Palace of the Swan","Instancia: En el Palacio del Cisne","Talk to Dorthaneth in the Palace of the Swan","King Elessar waits patiently for his audience with Prince Imrahil to begin.","The Swan-knight Rossaran has brought you before the Prince of Dol Amroth, as King Elessar desired."}},
[6972]={nameES="Instancia: En presencia de Saruman",objectivesES={"You have not seen this Angmarim woman since you left the north-lands. When last you saw her, she had been cast out by her clan for dishonouring them. Her name was taken from her, and she became known as Gun Ain: without name.\
\
She survived in the wastes of Forochel by stealing food from the Lossoth hunters once their prey was felled. Lothrandir gave her a bag of food to last until she could rebuild the wreckage of her life.\
\
What is she doing here?","Listen to Saruman within Orthanc","You have been called to Orthanc to appear before the Wizard Saruman.","Explore the tower of Orthanc","Talk to Saruman in the tower of Orthanc","Instancia: En presencia de Saruman","The power of Saruman's voice is seductive, his words convincing. You find yourself nodding in agreement.\
\
You must <rgb=#FF0000>resist</rgb>. You must not succumb.","Talk to Fâsh inside Orthanc","<rgb=#FF0000>Resist</rgb> the power of Saruman's voice (use <rgb=#FF0000>/resist</rgb>)","You have been summoned inside Orthanc to present yourself to Saruman and have been ordered not to stray from the path.","Saruman has brought you to a library within his tower of Orthanc.","You have not seen the Angmarim once known as Avair since you were in Forochel. Her name was taken from her, and now she serves Saruman as Gun Ain, 'Without Name.'","Fâsh has brought you inside Orthanc and is waiting to speak with you.","Talk to Gun Ain"}},
[6973]={nameES="Instancia: Una estrella cae en las tinieblas",objectivesES={"No has encontrado a Thelaron ni al Gwatharan, pero un elfo familiar se alza ante ti...","Los barriles de polvora negra pueden encontrarse al este del destacamento avanzado en el Dagorlad.\
\
Slégar el Artero te ha pedido encontrar lo que queda de la polvora negra del Enemigo y prenderle fuego. Espera que eso proporcione una distracción para que la Alianza avance hacia la Puerta Negra.","El príncipe Amroth está entre la compañía de Harthalín.\
\
Has llegado y encuentras a Harthalín y su compañía atendiendo las heridas del príncipe Amroth. Amroth afirma haber visto a uno de los Gwetherain pasar con un elfo sobre su corcel.","Las Lanzas de Lindon han resistido a las fuerzas de Sauron, pero luchan una batalla desesperada","Habla con el Alto Rey Gil-galad en el destacamento avanzado","Harthalín puede encontrarse junto a tu lecho en Tham Send, en La Última Morada.\
\
Has despertado de tu encuentro con el Rey Brujo dentro del refugio de Imladris. Harthalín ahora está sentada a tu lado. Debes intentar hablar con ella.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Selecciona a Harthalín y escribe '/murmurar' para avanzar la misión.</rgb>","Enfrenta a los Gwetherain","Debes permanecer junto al Alto Rey y los demás comandantes de la Alianza.\
\
Los Gwetherain se aproximan al cuartel trasero de la Alianza.","Dernaith y Megoril pueden encontrarse en el destacamento avanzado en Dagorlad.\
\
Has encontrado a dos de las Lanzas de Lindon, pero no has encontrado a Thelaron. Debes hablar con Dernaith y Megoril.","El campamento de los Hombres del Este se encuentra muy al este del destacamento avanzado.\
\
Harthalín te ha llevado al extremo más lejano del campamento de los Hombres del Este, y ahora debes buscar cualquier señal de Thelaron o del Rey Brujo.","El destacamento avanzado se encuentra al otro lado de las zanjas en llamas del Enemigo, al sur del cuartel trasero.\
\
El Alto Rey te ha pedido que explores el destacamento avanzado y transmitas un mensaje a sus allegados: las Lanzas de Lindon.","Habla con Elrond, recoge tus pertenencias y parte de viaje con sus hijos","Has sufrido enormemente a causa de la herida que te infligió el Rey Brujo. Debes seguir descansando hasta sanar por completo.","Debes buscar cualquier señal del paso del Gwatharan y seguir su camino.\
\
Has proporcionado la distracción que la Alianza necesitaba. Ahora debes buscar a Thelaron y seguir la senda del Gwatharan que lo llevó.","Harthalín puede encontrarse con su compañía más allá de las zanjas orientales en el Dagorlad.\
\
Has sabido que el propio Rey Brujo tomó a Thelaron, y ahora debes hablar con Harthalín y planear un rescate.","<rgb=#FF00FF>Murmura</rgb> a Harthalín e intenta moverte\
<rgb=#FF0000>(Selecciona a Harthalín y escribe /murmurar)</rgb>","El Alto Rey Gil-galad y Elendil el Alto están hablando a la Alianza.","Hithgol puede encontrarse en una de las camas de Tham Send en La Última Morada.\
\
Hithgol, el guerrero y herborista que una vez ayudó al príncipe Amroth, recibió un golpe del Señor Oscuro. Debes saber cuál es su condición y ver si pronto sanará también.","Pezuñas familiares conducen más profundo en el campamento oriental...","Rescata al príncipe Thranduil al oeste del destacamento avanzado","Harthalín se prepara para rechazar a los Hombres del Este. ¡Debes seguir adelante!","Elrond puede encontrarse en el valle cubierto de telarañas al oeste del destacamento avanzado.\
\
Tú, Elrond y Glorfindel habéis rechazado a los terribles engendros de Ungwetári que amenazaban tanto al Jinete Maldito como a Thranduil. Ahora debes hablar con Elrond.","Habla con Slégar el Artero","Averigua el estado de Hithgol en Tham Send","Conoce el destino de Thelaron por boca del príncipe Amroth","Elrond el Medio Elfo puede encontrarse dentro de Tham Send en La Última Morada.\
\
Elrond te habla de la gran batalla contra Sauron y del destino de tus allegados.","Escucha al Alto Rey Gil-galad y a Elendil el Alto","Se pueden encontrar soldados heridos al oeste del destacamento avanzado en el Dagorlad.\
\
Dernaith y Megoril te han alertado del reciente paso de uno de los Gwetherain, el Jinete Maldito, que dispersó sus fuerzas y dejó a muchos heridos en la llanura de batalla.","DNT","Camina con Elrond","Encuentra y sigue el camino del Gwatharan","Conoce el destino de las Lanzas de Lindon y su cuartel","Las inconfundibles huellas del corcel del Gwatharan conducen hacia el noreste.","Elrond Medio Elfo se encuentra en algún lugar dentro de Tham Send en La Última Morada.\
\
Has despertado de tu largo letargo y ahora debes buscar a Elrond.","Descansa hasta que tu herida sane","Habla con Elrond","El Alto Rey Gil-galad puede encontrarse en el destacamento avanzado en el Dagorlad.\
\
Has llegado para encontrar a la Alianza reunida en el destacamento avanzado. Ahora debes hablar con el Alto Rey Gil-galad como él solicitó.","El Alto Rey Gil-galad y los comandantes de la Alianza están de pie al frente del cuartel trasero.\
\
Harthalín te ha pedido que te unas a ella en el discurso del Alto Rey a la Alianza en vísperas de una gran batalla.","Debes hablar con Harthalín.\
\
Tú y tu compañera, Harthalín, habéis marchado en la Última Alianza durante años bajo el mando del Alto Rey Gil-galad.","La Alianza ha llegado al destacamento avanzado en Dagorlad.\
\
Elrond el Medio Elfo ha traído noticias del avance de la Alianza, y el Alto Rey Gil-galad ha solicitado tu presencia en el destacamento avanzado.","Elrond el Medio Elfo puede encontrarse dentro de Tham Send en La Última Morada.\
\
Has encontrado a Elrond y ahora debes hablar con él.","El corcel del Rey Brujo se agita salvajemente a tu llegada — ¡él y Thelaron deben de estar cerca!","A pesar de parecer curado por fuera, Hithgol parece estar en un sueño profundo e inquieto","Es el año 3434 de la Segunda Edad, y Sauron ha regresado. Tú y tu compañera, Harthalín, os habéis unido a los Elfos y Hombres de la Última Alianza en la llanura de la batalla para desafiar al Señor Oscuro de Mordor.","Encuentra a Elrond en La Última Morada","Habla con Harthalín","Slégar el Artero puede encontrarse en el destacamento avanzado en Dagorlad.\
\
El Alto Rey Gil-galad te ha enviado en una misión doble: proporcionar una distracción para la Alianza y rescatar a la Lanza de Lindon, Thelaron. Antes de partir, debes hablar con Slégar el Artero del Pueblo de Durin.","Harthalín puede encontrarse con su compañía más allá de las zanjas orientales en el Dagorlad.\
\
Has encontrado a Harthalín y su compañía mientras buscabas a Thelaron. Debes hablar con ella para ver si alguno en su compañía puede ayudarte.","Busca en el campamento cualquier señal de Thelaron o del Rey Brujo","Entrega el mensaje del Alto Rey a las Lanzas de Lindon","Instancia: Una estrella cae en las tinieblas","Reúnete con la Alianza en el destacamento avanzado","Elrond te ha dado permiso para viajar a Celondim en preparación para zarpar hacia los Puertos de Mithlond, pero necesitarás provisiones para tu viaje.","El príncipe Thranduil puede encontrarse muy al oeste del destacamento avanzado, en un valle cubierto de telarañas.\
\
Uno de los Gwetherain, el Jinete Maldito, ha desviado al príncipe Thranduil a un valle cercano donde ahora está atrapado. Debes ayudar a Thranduil a rechazar al Jinete Maldito.","El Alto Rey Gil-galad está de pie fuera del cuartel trasero en el Dagorlad.\
\
Has resistido ante los Gwetherain, y el Alto Rey ahora desea hablar contigo.","Habla con el Alto Rey Gil-galad","Asiste al discurso del Alto Rey ante la Alianza","El Rey Brujo puede encontrarse en lo alto del mirador más allá del campamento de los Hombres del Este.\
\
Has seguido al corcel del Rey Brujo hasta el extremo del campamento de los Hombres del Este y ahora debes subir las largas escaleras hasta el mirador. Debes enfrentar al Rey Brujo y rescatar a Thelaron.","Enfrenta al Rey Brujo y rescata a Thelaron"}},
[6974]={nameES="Instancia: En la Ciudadela",objectivesES={"The other water-bearers stand to the south-east of the fountain inside the Citadel of Winds.","Talk to Jajax's captive","Instancia: En la Ciudadela","The Kindred of the Coins has obtained a new, more valuable hostage: you!","Survive the attention of the Kindred of the Coins in the Citadel of Winds","The bubbling fountain in the Citadel of Winds heralds the arrival of an unexpected presence.","Pick up the bowl of sea-water on the bridge to the Citadel of Winds","The Kindred of the Coins escape into the Citadel's depths, leaving their captive behind","Eavesdrop upon the confrontation of the Kindred of the Coins with Jajax and his captive","Jajax has revealed your identity to the Kindred of the Coins!","Talk to Water-bearer Ushu south-east of the fountain","Several members of the Kindred of the Coins guard their captive inside the Citadel of Winds.","The jar falls to the floor and shatters, water soaking into the carpet","Witness the confrontation","Jajax's captive is in the Citadel of Winds.","You pour the sea-water into the fountain, and should now take up your place alongside the other water-bearers","You should pick up the bowl of sea-water and carry it across the bridge to the island, bringing it past the defences and up the hill into the Citadel of Winds. Do not drop the bowl or spill any of the water!","At the suggestion of Hármelak, the Golden Queen, you have uncovered a means of gaining access to the Citadel of Winds, where Azagath Sea-shadow must be holding Thorongil captive.","Azagath has noticed you within the Citadel of Winds.","Talk to Azagath Sea-shadow in the Citadel of Winds","Several members of the Kindred of the Coins meet with Jajax inside the Citadel of Winds.","Jajax is in the Citadel of Winds.","Eavesdrop upon the conversation of the Kindred of the Coins inside the Citadel of Winds","Talk to Jajax in the Citadel of Winds"}},
[6975]={nameES="Instancia: En el abismo",objectivesES={"Instancia: En el abismo","Gimli can be found in the Chamber of the Watchers in Barad-dûr.\
\
You have repelled the attacks of a glamour, one of the remnants of the Dark Lord himself, which warned of an insidious trap laid for the Firehorns and King Váskmun Greytooth. You should now speak to Gimli.","Confront the glamour in the Chamber of the Watchers","Gimli can be found in the depths of Barad-dûr.\
\
You are searching the depths of Barad-dûr for King Váskmun Greytooth and the Firehorns. You should follow Gimli and keep a keen eye on the shadowed tunnels of the Dark Tower.","The caverns suddenly grow wider, and you come to a room dwarfed by statues of Sauron and his servants...","Search the depths of Barad-dûr for King Váskmun Greytooth and the Firehorns","Talk to Gimli in the Chamber of the Watchers","Gimli is standing in the Chamber of the Watchers in the depths of Barad-dûr.\
\
You and Gimli have found a grisly trail of slain followers of the Order of the Eye leading to the Chamber of the Watchers. A statue of Sauron looms ahead and its gaze is fixed upon you. You should speak to Gimli.","The glamour, one of the malevolent remnants of the Dark Lord, fades into the shadows...","Habla con Gimli","Deep in the depths of Barad-dûr, there lies a passage into the Mordath, the Black Pits of Mordor, through which Váskmun Greytooth intends to lead the Firehorns in his quest to reclaim the Dwarf-ring, Manthríf.","Gimli can be found on the precipice within the abyss of Mordath.\
\
You descended into the abyss of Mordath and have come to a ledge within depths of Barad-dûr. You should speak to Gimli and begin your search for King Váskmun Greytooth and the Firehorns.","The glamour can be found in the Chamber of the Watchers in Barad-dûr.\
\
A glamour has risen from the statue of Sauron in the Chamber of the Watchers. You and Gimli must stand fast!"}},
[6976]={nameES="Instancia: En el Círculo de la Desesperación",objectivesES={"The tower is secure!","Secure the tower","Secure the tower.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>It is recommended to have the quest The Circle of Madness underway.</rgb>","The tower of Barad Arthir, otherwise known as the Lofty Watch-fort, must be captured in order to enter the Circle of Despair and reclaim Minas Morgul.","A foothold has been established in the tower","Talk to one of the Rangers.","Talk to one of the Rangers","Instancia: En el Círculo de la Desesperación"}},
[6977]={nameES="Instancia: En el Círculo de la Locura",objectivesES={"Instancia: En el Círculo de la Locura","The tower is secure!","Secure the tower","Secure the tower.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>It is recommended to have the quest The Circle of Sorrow underway.</rgb>","A foothold has been established in the tower","The tower of Barad Elenath, otherwise known as the Star-gazers' Spire, must be captured in order to enter the Circle of Madness and reclaim Minas Morgul.","Talk to one of the Rangers.","Talk to one of the Rangers"}},
[6978]={nameES="Instancia: En el Círculo de la Pena",objectivesES={"The tower is secure!","Secure the tower","Barad Orhant, otherwise known as the Tower of the Treegarth, must be captured in order to enter the Circle of Sorrow and reclaim Minas Morgul.","A foothold has been established in the tower","Secure the tower.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>It is recommended to have the quest The Circle of Wrath underway.</rgb>","Instancia: En el Círculo de la Pena","Talk to one of the Rangers.","Talk to one of the Rangers"}},
[6979]={nameES="Instancia: En el Círculo de la Ira",objectivesES={"The tower of Barad Angarth, otherwise known as the Gate-wardens' Keep, must be claimed in order to enter the Circle of Wrath and reclaim Minas Morgul.","The tower is secure!","Secure the tower","Secure the tower.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>It is recommended to have the quest Into the Dead City underway.</rgb>","A foothold has been established in the tower","Talk to one of the Rangers.","Talk to one of the Rangers","Instancia: En el Círculo de la Ira"}},
[6980]={nameES="Instancia: Hacia la Casa de la Represión",objectivesES={"You helped Mêshaget and defeated the dwarf-wight he was fighting. You should talk to him.","Mêshaget is being attacked by a dwarf-wight! You should help him defeat his foe.","Search the tomb with Mêshaget","Talk to Mêshaget","Save Mêshaget","You have the journal!","You have the journal of Semayâti the Unyielding, the famous engineer from Lâkindar of old. You should talk to Mêshaget.","Help Mêshaget search the tomb for the journal of Semayâti the Unyielding.","You have found the journal of Semayâti the Unyielding, the famous engineer from Lâkindar of old. You should take the journal out of her stone resting place.","You have what you came for and should now leave the Quelling-house.","Open the tomb of Semayâti the Unyielding","Escape the Quelling-house with Mêshaget","Instancia: Hacia la Casa de la Represión","Take the journal","As you approached what you thought was the entrance to the tomb of Semayâti the Unyielding, you heard a frightened scream from inside. It must be Mêshaget! You should enter the tomb and help him.","This prominent stone grave must belong to Semayâti the Unyielding. You should open it and see what awaits inside."}},
[6981]={nameES="Instancia: Hacia el Abismo de Plata",objectivesES={"Has entrenado con Gimli. Ahora debes adentrarte en la mina...","Hay algo extraño en este lugar...","Deberías hablar con los mineros para evacuarlos","Un saco lleno de equipo yace cerca de la entrada a la Mina del Abismo de Plata.\
\
Deberías saquear el saco para equiparte con lo que necesitarás para la jornada.","Has recogido un arma, pero algo no está bien...","Acércate al anciano que está cerca <rgb=#00FF00>(Avanza presionando W)</rgb>","Habla con Gandalf","Deberías caminar junto a Gandalf","Habla con el mago <rgb=#00FF00>(Haz clic derecho sobre Gandalf para interactuar)</rgb>","Gandalf el Gris, un mago que acompaña a la Compañía de Thorin, salvó a Gimli del troll.","El nuevo túnel excavado por Tvistur se abre ante ti.\
\
Deberías adentrarte en el túnel para intentar interceptar al troll mientras persigue a Gimli.","Sigue al capataz Otur para conseguir ayuda para Gimli.\
\
Mientras intentabas llamar a Tvistur para la ceremonia de Thorin, él rompió una pared y liberó a un troll. El troll lo mató, y luego fue tras Gimli. Deberías seguir a Otur y ver cómo puedes ayudar a Gimli.","Este enano está perfectamente conservado, y yace entre las ruinas de una antigua estructura élfica...","Busca a Gimli","Entrena con Gimli para practicar tus habilidades en combate <rgb=#00FF00>(Asegúrate de equipar tu arma)</rgb>","Un anciano encorvado se encuentra frente a ti mientras te diriges a la Mina del Abismo de Plata.\
\
Deberías acercarte a él.","Thorin parte, dejando su mansión al cuidado de Gormr Forjadura","Habla con Gimli para saber qué hacer","Examina el cadáver en las ruinas élficas","Camina junto a Gandalf mientras desea tenerte cerca.","Deberías acompañar a Gandalf, pues es un consejero respetado de Thorin.","Camina junto a Gandalf y escúchalo un momento <rgb=#00FF00>(Avanza presionando W; gira con A y D)</rgb>","Has llegado hasta Gimli. ¡Ayúdalo, si puedes!","Ábrete paso hacia el interior del Abismo de Plata para ayudar a Gimli.\
\
Mientras seguías a Otur, descubrió que la puerta que llevaba al puente había sido dañada por los ataques del troll. Te pidió que fueras a ayudar a Gimli mientras él iba a buscar más ayuda.","El Hombre de gris es Gandalf, consejero de tu señor Thorin Escudo de Roble","Gimli quiere que demuestres tu fuerza antes de permitirte seguirlo a la mina para rescatar a los trabajadores. Nunca se sabe qué males pueden surgir cuando las montañas tiemblan.","Parece que has descubierto unas ruinas antiguas, aparentemente de estructuras élficas. Un cuerpo yace entre ellas.","Gormr no está de humor para entretenerte, joven. Deberías recoger tu equipo y ponerte a trabajar","El mago Gandalf el Gris, consejero de Thorin Escudo de Roble, desea hablar contigo. Como Thorin es el señor de estos salones, crees que lo mejor es escuchar.","<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Los archivos que necesitas para continuar tus aventuras en la Tierra Media deberían terminar de descargarse en breve. ¡Gracias por tu paciencia!</rgb>","Recoge tu equipo del saco junto a la puerta <rgb=#00FF00>(Haz clic derecho sobre los objetos brillantes para recogerlos)</rgb>","Habla con Gormr, el nuevo Senescal de la Mansión de Thorin","Gormr Forjadura ha sido nombrado Senescal de la Mansión de Thorin mientras Thorin está ausente. Ahora que Thorin y Gandalf han partido, deberías hablar con Gormr para escuchar sus instrucciones.","Sigue a Gandalf y escucha sus reflexiones","La entrada a la Mina del Abismo de Plata se alza ante ti.\
\
Gimli quiere encontrarse contigo dentro de la mina inestable, donde lo ayudarás a evacuar a los mineros. Deberías entrar por la puerta.","Pregunta a Gimli qué hacer a continuación","Sigue el túnel que abrió Tvistur para intentar alcanzar a Gimli","Un saco lleno de equipo yace cerca de la entrada a la Mina del Abismo de Plata. Deberías saquear el saco para equiparte con lo que necesitarás para la jornada.","Los mineros están repartidos por toda la mina, trabajando arduamente.\
\
Un temblor de tierra ha inquietado a Gormr, el nuevo líder. Él y Gimli quieren despejar esta mina para que nadie salga herido.","Recoge tu equipo del saco junto a la puerta de la mina","Convence a los mineros de que se retiren","Tienes trabajo que hacer, pero Gandalf aún tiene más que decir","Prepárate para demostrar tu valentía ante Gimli","Habla con el Capataz Otur","Tras recoger tu arma, un gran temblor sacudió la montaña sobre ti. Gimli, hijo de Glóin, y Gormr se sobresaltaron.","Instancia: Hacia el Abismo de Plata"}},
[6982]={nameES="Instancia: Invitación a una Bebida",objectivesES={"Dunlending ruffians heard the sound of commotion and entered the tavern to aid Arnwi.","Join Calin and Arnwi at the table nearby","Observe the discussion between Arnwi and Calin","Calin arrived shortly before you did and joined Arnwi who was waiting at a table nearby.","Calin is nervous about an unusual invitation for a drink with Arnwi, who has been out of touch for some time. Calin may be overly cautious, but a lot has happened lately to put him on edge.","Survive the Dunlending ambush","Instancia: Invitación a una Bebida","You should return to Herubrand with Calin's body, and inform him of what happened here","After the battle Calin is laying very still where he fell. Arnwi caught him off guard with a strong blow that would have killed most men.","Arnwi and Calin have much to catch up on. It is unclear what Arnwi has been up to as he has not been seen by Calin or Herubrand for some time.","Completado","Calin received a serious blow to the head and passed away during your fight with the Dunlendings","See to Calin's injuries"}},
[6983]={nameES="Instance: Isle of Storms -- Solo/Duo",objectivesES={"Defeat the great beast guarding the entrance to the caves of the Isle of Storms.","Someone - or more likely something - has slain most the pirates who once frequented these caves and driven away any survivors. If you want to reach the Roc's aerie above, you're going to have to make your way past it....","Defeat Urâbaz the Mighty","Defeat Raghârik","You have defeated Krizhmûl!","A great winged terror known to the people of Umbar as a Roc has been seen attacking ships sailing off the Cape of Umbar, swamping them with the winds from its vast wings and plucking the hapless crew out of the water. The lords of Umbar have requested that you find the nesting place of this monstrous bird and drive it from the Shield Isles. The Roc is believed to be roosting upon a deserted isle in the far reaches of the archipelago, once a haunt for pirates and brigands. Rumours say that they were driven out by strange and monstrous creatures, far greater in size than any beast should be....","The tunnels here howl with winds that blow down from the peak, making your progress treacherous - but it seems to be the only path leading to the Roc's aerie above.","Instance: Isle of Storms -- Solo/Duo","You have defeated Raghârik!","Defeat Krizhmûl","You have defeated Urâbaz the Mighty!"}},
[6984]={nameES="Instance: Isle of Storms -- Tier 1",objectivesES={"Defeat the great beast guarding the entrance to the caves of the Isle of Storms.","Someone - or more likely something - has slain most the pirates who once frequented these caves and driven away any survivors. If you want to reach the Roc's aerie above, you're going to have to make your way past it....","Defeat Urâbaz the Mighty","Defeat Raghârik","You have defeated Krizhmûl!","A great winged terror known to the people of Umbar as a Roc has been seen attacking ships sailing off the Cape of Umbar, swamping them with the winds from its vast wings and plucking the hapless crew out of the water. The lords of Umbar have requested that you find the nesting place of this monstrous bird and drive it from the Shield Isles. The Roc is believed to be roosting upon a deserted isle in the far reaches of the archipelago, once a haunt for pirates and brigands. Rumours say that they were driven out by strange and monstrous creatures, far greater in size than any beast should be....","Instance: Isle of Storms -- Tier 1","The tunnels here howl with winds that blow down from the peak, making your progress treacherous - but it seems to be the only path leading to the Roc's aerie above.","You have defeated Raghârik!","Defeat Krizhmûl","You have defeated Urâbaz the Mighty!"}},
