[6989]={nameES="Instance: Isolation Amongst Survivors",objectivesES={"You should speak with Céolflad.","Talk to Edhild again.","Ránmald is clearly isolated from the other women, a dangerous problem for a pregnant woman who must survive a harsh winter","Listen to Frithwyn.","Talk to Edhild at Céolstan's grave.","The women of Byre Tor can be found at Aldstan's grave.\
\
You should speak with the women.","See if Edhild needs comfort","You should speak with Edhild at Aldstan's grave.","You ask Céolflad of what squabbles she speaks. What is the women's problem with Ránmald?\
\
'It is no longer my concern. Now leave me be, meddler. Ye have struck me hard with grief, bringing me here to see my dear Thane in the ground.\
\
'I'll be kind to the girl from now on. For him.'","Ask Edhild why the women do not like Ránmald","Talk to Frithwyn at Céolstan's grave.","Talk to Céolflad.","Meet the women of Byre Tor at Aldstan's grave","Instance: Isolation Amongst Survivors","Listen to Céolflad's speech","Edhild will not explain, despite the Thane's dying wish that Ránmald should be accepted","You should express your frustration and <rgb=#FF0000>roar</rgb> at the women.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This objective requires an emote.</rgb>","<rgb=#FF0000>Roar</rgb> at the unkind women","You should speak with Ránmald.","Talk to Céolflad","Talk to Ránmald","Céolflad is indignant towards you for associating with Ránmald","Frithwyn resents that Ránmald is an outsider","Ask Frithwyn why she does not like Ránmald","You should speak with Edhild.","You should speak with Frithwyn.","The women are unconcerned by your frustration","Ask Ránmald if she will excuse you while you talk to the others","Talk to Frithwyn at Céolstan's grave","Listen to Frithwyn","Talk to Edhild at Céolstan's grave","Ránmald feels isolated from the other women, and you do not wish to leave her alone with them in her vulnerable condition.","Listen to Céolflad's speech.","Speak with Edhild","Ask Céolflad why she is cold to Ránmald"}},
[6990]={nameES="Instancia: Fuga de la prisión",objectivesES={"Sal de tu celda y acércate a tu rescatador <rgb=#00FF00>(Usa W para avanzar)</rgb>","Derrota al captor de Mundo","Despiertas en un calabozo de un campamento de bandidos. Un hombre de aspecto sombrío -- un Montaraz, Trancos -- está delante de ti. Mientras te pones de pie con dificultad, su voz urgente llega a tus oídos.","Amdir se encuentra justo más allá de la puerta principal.\
\
El Montaraz Amdir fue derribado por el Jinete Negro antes de que Trancos pudiera ahuyentarlo. Deberías preguntarle a Trancos qué hacer, porque la situación es ahora muy grave.","Trancos ha vencido a los guardias bandidos, pero te advierte de que hay más enemigos por delante.\
\
El Montaraz quiere que practiques el combate luchando con él para asegurarse de que eres capaz de defenderte durante la fuga.","Trancos espera cerca a la puerta principal.\
\
Amdir está gravemente herido. Trancos sabrá mejor qué hacer para ayudar a su amigo.","Sigue a Trancos al exterior","Encuentra a Trancos y Amdir","Habla con Mundo Sacovilla-Bolsón","<rgb=#00FF00>Has demostrado adecuadamente tu destreza en el combate</rgb>","Celandine Brandigamo está retenida en el campamento de bandidos.\
\
Trancos quiere que rescates a los hobbits, empezando por Celandine, mientras él va en busca de señales de Mordor (que se encuentra sorprendentemente cerca). Tendrás que derrotar a todos los bandidos que encuentres mientras buscas a los hobbits.","Mundo Sacovilla-Bolsón está retenido en la zona de la prisión, más allá de la puerta de la jaula donde estaba Celandine.\
\
La distracción de Celandine fue un éxito. Solo queda un bandido para vigilar a Mundo. Deberías deshacerte de él rápidamente.","Instancia: Fuga de la prisión","<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Los archivos que necesitas para continuar tus aventuras en la Tierra Media deberían terminar de descargarse en breve. ¡Gracias por tu paciencia!</rgb>","Un bolso está en el suelo, cerca de tu rescatador.\
\
Trancos te ha dicho que busques armas en el bolso y recojas su contenido, porque necesitarás defenderte durante esta atrevida fuga.","Ahora que has practicado el combate, habla con Trancos para saber qué hacer a continuación.","Celandine está retenida en una jaula, junto a la pared del recinto.\
\
Has vencido a los captores de Celandine, pero no has encontrado a Mundo Sacovilla-Bolsón. Celandine puede que sepa dónde está retenido Mundo.","Ahora que has salido de la prisión, habla con Trancos para saber cuál es el siguiente paso.","Has derrotado al captor de Mundo","Habla con Trancos <rgb=#00FF00>(Haz clic derecho en Trancos para hablar)</rgb>","Trancos ha salido de la prisión y ha entrado en el patio. Te está esperando allí.","Habla con Trancos","Trancos y Amdir os esperan a ti y a los hobbits en la puerta principal.\
\
Has liberado a ambos hobbits que habían desaparecido, pero aún no has escapado del campamento.","Mundo está atado a un poste en el patio.\
\
A pesar de la derrota de su captor, Mundo Sacovilla-Bolsón parece estar especialmente disgustado. Deberías animarle a que se una a ti.","Busca armas en la mochila <rgb=#00FF00>(Haz clic derecho en la mochila para abrirla)</rgb>","Mientras viajabas por el bosque de Chet, unos bandidos te asaltaron y te hicieron prisionero. Ahora te encuentras en una celda, buscando la manera de escapar."}},
[6991]={nameES="Instancia: Juicios del Rey",objectivesES={"Beregond is in the hall, and has not heard that it is his time for judgement.","King Elessar must weigh the issues facing Gondor and make his pronouncements.","Wait until the king calls for your report","Instancia: Juicios del Rey","Talk to Malthengil","Find Beregond in the Hall of the King and tell him it is his time for judgement","There are many issues facing Gondor which require the pronouncements of King Elessar.","Malthengil has asked you to deliver your report of Mordor to King Elessar, but first there are some matters on which the king must rule."}},
[6992]={nameES="Instancia: Guardián de los Muertos",objectivesES={"Keep close to Dolenthol and remain alert","Defeat Thargaun and the Morroval.","Talk to Dolenthol.","Instancia: Guardián de los Muertos","Defeat the Morroval","Keep close to Dolenthol and remain alert.","<rgb=#FF0000>Dolenthol must survive</rgb>","Defeat Thargaun","Dolenthol needs your help to find and confront the vile wraith who commands the Dead in Minas Morgul.","Now is the time to attack!","Talk to Dolenthol","Defeated Thargaun!","<rgb=#FF0000>Dolenthol has fallen in battle!</rgb>"}},
[6993]={nameES="Instancia: Espíritus afines",objectivesES={"You have infiltrated a meeting of supporters of the Heirs of Castamir, and should learn what you can of their operation and their plans to undermine the rule of King Elessar.","Instancia: Espíritus afines","Observe the meeting of the Castamir supporters","Maethon is within one of the abandoned homes of Linhir now used by supporters of the Heirs of Castamir.","Nakási Wave-reaper desires vengeance upon the Heirs of Castamir, and has challenged you to stand with her against them.","A supporter of Castamir stands inside an abandoned home and bars your passage.","Tumúldo Fierce-water lies dying, attacked by the supporters of Castamir.","Maethon is in the cellar of an abandoned home in Linhir.","Talk to Nakási","Hear what transpired","Maethon excitedly waves you over","Tumúldo Fierce-water is on the very precipice of death.","Observe the meeting of the Castamir supporters and the emissaries from Umbar","Maethon asked you to introduce yourself to some of the supporters of Castamir in the cellar of the abandoned home.","Examine Tumúldo Fierce-water","Find Maethon somewhere within the abandoned homes of Linhir","Tumúldo Fierce-water, emissary from Umbar, is interested to speak with you.","Maethon is somewhere within the abandoned homes taken over by supporters of the Heirs of Castamir.","Talk to the Castamir supporter inside the abandoned home","Hear the final words of Tumúldo Fierce-water","Tumúldo Fierce-water lies on the cold stone floor in a pool of his own blood, a Gondorian blade buried in his back. His wife Nakási kneels by him, her eyes burning with fury and with unshed tears.","Tumúldo Fierce-water has been grievously wounded, a deadly blade buried in his back.","Talk to Maethon","Supporters of the Heirs of Castamir secretly meet in a cellar in Linhir.","Talk to Tumúldo Fierce-water","Follow Maethon upstairs and learn what has happened","Tumúldo stirs. He is alive, but has only moments","Something has happened upstairs!"}},
[6994]={nameES="Instancia: La Carga de la Dama Éowyn",objectivesES={"Éowyn stands in Meduseld as she presides over Edoras in King Théoden's absence.\
\
You should speak with Éowyn.","Listen to Éowyn","Instancia: La Carga de la Dama Éowyn","Witwyn, Éowyn's serving-woman, can be found in Meduseld.\
\
Witwyn wishes to speak with you.","A shadow seems to fall upon the lady's bright features, and she looks troubled....","Éowyn stands in Meduseld as she presides over Edoras in King Théoden's absence.\
\
You should listen to Éowyn.","Speak with Witwyn, the serving-woman","Éowyn leaves in haste, her face a mask fair and cold....","Speak with Éowyn","Éowyn sits proudly in Meduseld, hearing the concerns of her people before their departure to Dunharrow."}},
[6995]={nameES="Instancia: La huida de Laerdan",objectivesES={"Laerdan está siendo retenido prisionero en Sammath Baul.","Encuentra a Laerdan","Morven derrotado","Laerdan está casi inconsciente y herido. Debe ser llevado a Rivendel con Elrond, pues dudas que pueda sobrevivir sin su ayuda.","Entra en Sammath Baul y encuentra a Laerdan.","Instancia: La huida de Laerdan"}},
[6996]={nameES="Instancia: Guarida de la Bestia",objectivesES={"Cruel Dancer engages Tatháta the Beast in conversation aboard the second ship moored within the hidden harbour.","Cruel Dancer has chased after Tatháta the Beast, but your priority must be to rescue Corudan.","Someone emerges from below deck: the ship's captain","Wait for the ship's captain to arrive","Corsairs loyal to the Kindred of the Coins have learned of your presence in the hidden harbour!","Instancia: Guarida de la Bestia","Witness the confrontation between Cruel Dancer and Tatháta the Beast","Talk to Tatháta the Beast aboard her ship","Having found no one within the first ship, Cruel Dancer believes the hostages you seek may be aboard the second ship moored within the hidden harbour.","You have boarded the first ship and should wait for Cruel Dancer to join you.","Tatháta the Beast stands upon the deck of her ship.","Board the nearest ship to the west in the hidden harbour","You have found Corudan aboard the second ship, and he is still alive!","Cruel Dancer has returned from her search of the first ship's interior.","The deck of the ship is free of enemies","Cruel Dancer arrives aboard the second ship","Defeat Tatháta and her crew","Talk to Cruel Dancer in the hidden harbour","Cruel Dancer stands aboard the deck of one of the ships moored within the hidden harbour.","You have found the hidden harbour used by two members of the Kindred of the Coins, and hope to rescue the hostages contained within.","Wait for the captain of the ship to arrive.","Corudan is a captive aboard the second ship, but he is still alive.","The conversation has become a violent conflict!","Talk to Corudan aboard the second ship moored within the hidden harbour","Wait for Cruel Dancer to join you aboard the ship","Talk to Cruel Dancer aboard the ship","The nearest of the ships you should investigate is to the west.","Talk to Cruel Dancer aboard the first ship in the hidden harbour","Defeat the Corsair defenders aboard the ship while Cruel Dancer searches below deck","Follow the walkways to the second ship moored within the hidden harbour","Cruel Dancer emerges from below deck","Cruel Dancer has come with you to the hidden harbour."}},
[6997]={nameES="Instancia: Últimos deseos del Señor de Playa Larga",objectivesES={"King Elessar has called for the final testament of Golasgil, Lord of Anfalas, to be read aloud and his wishes carried out.","King Elessar is in the study of Lond Cirion.","Caebar is in the study of Lond Cirion, seeking to prove that Golasgil's testament was truly written by the Lord of Anfalas before his death in battle.","Listen to the reading of Golasgil's final wishes","Caebar is in the study of Lond Cirion, where Golasgil's testament will be read.","The study of Lond Cirion may contain samples of Lord Golasgil's writing that can be used to prove he wrote the testament, and its provenance made secure.","Talk to King Elessar","You and Caebar have proven that both the testament and Golasgil's notes on the currents were written by the same person, and now the Lord of Anfalas's last wishes can be read aloud and carried out.","A paper used as a bookmark has the notation 'Remember to buy fish,' but is unsigned","Examine the papers that contain Golasgil's final wishes","Instancia: Últimos deseos del Señor de Playa Larga","The seal on these papers has indeed been broken, which is unusual for such a document","This parchment contains notes on the migratory patterns of sea-birds, but it is unsigned","Pages with the heading 'Notes on the Currents' is signed by Golasgil and contains musings on the subject","Search the chamber for papers written in Golasgil's hand","Give Golasgil's notes on the currents to Caebar","Stand ready in the event you will be of some use","This page lists coins earned and spent, but could have been written by anyone","King Elessar has suggested that his scribe Caebar may be able to ascertain the provenance of the handwriting contained in Golasgil's purported testament.","Lady Marra has produced her husband's final wishes and set them on the table.","King Elessar has commanded that Lord Golasgil's testament be read aloud and his wishes carried out.","Talk to Caebar in Lond Cirion"}},
[6998]={nameES="Instancia: Dando Descanso a los Muertos Malvados",objectivesES={"Derrota a Ferndúr el Virulento y a sus hombres demacrados","<rgb=#FF0000>Glorfindel no debe ser derrotado</rgb>","Habla con Glorfindel","Ábrete paso hasta el altar junto a Glorfindel","Instancia: Dando Descanso a los Muertos Malvados","DNT -- Will not be seen","Ferndúr el Virulento se encuentra en la cima del altar en Ost Brandras.\
\
Ya te has enfrentado a Ferndúr y ahora debes derrotarlo.","Debes hablar con Glorfindel antes de enfrentarte al enemigo.\
\
Glorfindel está afuera de Ost Brandras y espera tu ayuda para confrontar a Ferndúr el Virulento.","<rgb=#FF0000>¡Glorfindel ha caído!</rgb>","Acércate a los hombres demacrados en lo alto del altar","Has acompañado al señor Glorfindel a Ost Brandras para enfrentar al Señor Demacrado, Ferndúr el Virulento.","Glorfindel está al pie del altar en Ost Brandras.\
\
Te has abierto paso entre numerosos espíritus malignos y ahora debes enfrentar a Ferndúr cuando estés preparado.","Sigue a Glorfindel dentro de Ost Brandras","Glorfindel está en Ost Brandras.\
\
Debes seguir a Glorfindel dentro de las ruinas y enfrentar a Ferndúr el Virulento.","Los hombres demacrados se encuentran en la cima del altar en Ost Brandras.\
\
Has llegado a la base del altar y ahora debes enfrentarte a los hombres demacrados."}},
[6999]={nameES="Instancia: Líder del Bosque Putrefacto",objectivesES={"Logon derrotado","Zagâfum derrotado","Instancia: Líder del Bosque Putrefacto","Desciende al escondite de los trolls silvanos y derrota a su líder.","Derrota a Zagâfum","Derrota a Logon","Encuentra al líder de los trolls silvanos","Derrota a Zagâfum y Logon.","Has entrado en el escondite de los trolls silvanos. Siguiendo las instrucciones de Lithuilas, debes encontrar al líder de los trolls silvanos y derrotarlo.","Líder de los trolls silvanos encontrado"}},
[7000]={nameES="Instancia: Legado de Conflicto",objectivesES={"Nimithil is standing in the rear of the Hall of Ost Anglebed.\
\
Nimithil is concerned that the arguing in the hall will soon turn to violence and asks for your support in calming the crowd.","Instancia: Legado de Conflicto","Talk to Nimithil","Observe the meeting between Nimithil and Malthellim","Defeat Yamanim, Hosdam, and Khutâ","Subdue Steward Malthellim","Nimithil can be found somewhere in the Hall of Ost Anglebed.\
\
You have travelled to the hall with Nimithil, but became separated amid a large crowd of belligerent people. You should reunite with Nimithil.","Listen to Nimithil speak to the crowd of Gondorians","Nimithil and Malthellim are speaking near the fire-pit in the centre of the Hall of Ost Anglebed.\
\
Nimithil is sharing what you have learned in Lornost and Ost Anglebed with Malthellim. You should listen as they speak.","Nimithil is standing in the rear of the Hall of Ost Anglebed.\
\
You have found Nimithil, but the Steward has not yet returned to the Hall. You should ask Nimithil what is to be done.","Search for Nimithil among the crowd","Nimithil can be found in the rear of the Hall of Ost Anglebed.\
\
You have subdued Steward Malthellim with the aid of Nimithil's guards, and should now speak to Nimithil.","Steward Malthellim can be found in the Hall of Ost Anglebed.\
\
Malthellim has drawn his weapon in desperation, and must now be subdued if the people of Ost Anglebed are to remain safe.","Concerned by the growing influence of the Heirs of Castamir in Lebennin, Nimithil hopes to warn Steward Malthellim of treachery within Ost Anglebed and prevent her people from splintering.","Malthellim looks appalled and swiftly draws his weapon!","Yamanim, Hosdam, and Khutâ are moving against the dissenters within the Hall of Ost Anglebed.\
\
Malthellim has aligned himself with the Heirs of Castamir and has now allowed the Corsair and Haradrim men in Ost Anglebed to execute dissenting folk.","The doors to the hall are thrust open and rattle loudly against the walls"}},
[7001]={nameES="Instancia: ¡Tomemos el Hornburg!",objectivesES={"Try to survive!","This way is not safe!","You must try to escape!\
\
Run south, towards Helm's Deep.","Try to escape towards the north-west","Something has unnerved the other Orcs....","You must try to escape!\
\
Run north...into the strange trees.","Talk to your neighbour again","Watch and wait","The boss wants you to get back in line","This way has been taken by the cursed Men!","Now you must flee! These strange trees will provide cover.","Try to escape south","Escape through the forest!","But where did these trees come from? This forest was not here before...was it?","Find a spot to rest, and rest briefly at the edge of the trees","You must seize the Hornburg and drive out the Men!","You must try to escape!\
\
Run north-west, towards the Fords of Isen.","The Uruk-commander stands near the ugly gate up ahead.\
\
You should ask the boss when the battle will be over, for you grow bored without a drop of blood to stain your sword.","Get back in line and talk to your neighbour","You must try to escape!\
\
Run east, along the dike.","Ask the boss when the battle will be done","Your place in line is back a ways, near some other Orcs.\
\
You should speak with your neighbour.","Your place in line is back a ways, near some other Orcs.\
\
You should watch and wait.","Try to escape towards the east","Your place in line is back a ways, near some other Orcs.\
\
You should get back in line.","Instancia: ¡Tomemos el Hornburg!","Run north!","A blasted Elf has blocked the way","Find a resting spot at the edge of the trees."}},
[7002]={nameES="Instance: Lhaid Ogo",objectivesES={"The muddy depths of Lhaid Ogo are home to many decaying horrors, and a Dunlending messenger may be lost within.","Talk to Anirin in Lhaid Ogo","Somewhere inside Lhaid Ogo, a messenger from Dunland may be in trouble.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>This quest is meant for a fellowship. If you choose to undertake this quest solo, you will receive an Inspired Greatness bonus, but the challenge will be great.</rgb>","You have found Anirin in the depths of Lhaid Ogo and should speak with him.","Search Lhaid Ogo for the lost Dunlending messenger","Instance: Lhaid Ogo"}},
[7003]={nameES="Instancia: Liberando Woodhurst",objectivesES={"Instancia: Liberando Woodhurst","Now that Thurferth has left, Gifemund and Calin have engaged in a quieter discussion.","Speak to Calin before joining the confrontation. \
\
It appears Gifemund and Thurferth are in an argument that could get violent near the empty throne.","Observe Calin and Gifemund's discussion","There is a heated discussion between Gifemund and Thurferth in front of the empty throne in the mead hall.","Gifemund has made his move, and demanded Guard Captain Thurferth step down due to his failing to keep the city safe. They now try to settle their differences in front of the empty throne they have both sought.","Speak with Calin","Speak to Calin near the throne at the back of the mead hall.","Observa la discusión"}},
[7004]={nameES="Instancia: Luces en la Tierra",objectivesES={"Talk to Céola","The Khundolar prepare to lay siege to Etheburg, and you have chosen to defend the way-post.","Defeat all of the attacking Khundolar.","Céola is at Etheburg in the Brown Lands.\
\
You should speak with Céola regarding the battle at Etheburg.","<rgb=#FF0000>Céola must not be defeated</rgb>","Céola is at Etheburg in the Brown Lands.\
\
You should speak at once with Céola to learn his plan.","Instancia: Luces en la Tierra","Talk to Céola at Etheburg in the Brown Lands","Defeated all of the attacking Khundolar","<rgb=#FF0000>Céola was defeated</rgb>","Defeat all of the attacking Khundolar"}},
[7005]={nameES="Instancia: Limlók bajo ataque",objectivesES={"Return to Glóin in the village square and protect him from the Orcs","Meet with Runerik, the village chieftain of Limlók","Talk to Venko at Limlók","Find Imák and protect him from the Orcs","Venko wishes to speak with the village chieftain of Limlók to learn what befell the raiding-party from Gundabad.","The posts of the encircling wall are lower here","The wooden palisade appears sturdy enough at this location","Examine the eastern fence of Limlók","Shorter posts were used for the encircling wall behind the barn","Find Venko and protect him from the Orcs","The raiding-party has attacked the village of Limlók from multiple directions at the same time!","Runerik Knotbeard stands outside his home in Limlók.","Follow Runerik Knotbeard","Examine the north-western fence of Limlók","The cliffs beyond the palisade here should serve as adequate defence","Examine the south-eastern fence of Limlók","Instancia: Limlók bajo ataque","The raiding-party that threatened the safety of Limlók has been defeated, thanks to your efforts and those of your companions, as well as those of the people who dwell there. One Orc remains alive, but he will soon die of his wounds.","The raiding-party from Gundabad had designs upon the peaceful Beorning village of Limlók... but where has it gone?","Listen to Glóin's words","Examine the north-eastern fence of Limlók","Venko is ready to speak with the Beorning chieftain at the village of Limlók and learn if he has seen the missing raiding-party from Gundabad.","You hear a waterfall beyond the wall here: a natural defence?","Talk to Natsatúg before he dies of his wounds","Talk to Runerik Knotbeard outside his house in Limlók","Runerik believes his town has nothing to fear from the missing raiding-party, but your companions want to check Limlók's exterior fences just to make sure.","Examine the south-western fence of Limlók","Limlók is under attack!","Runerik does not believe his village is any more susceptible to danger than is usual for his people."}},
[7006]={nameES="Instancia: Recuerdos lejanos",objectivesES={"Instancia: Recuerdos lejanos","Sigue a Prestadír por el agujero del muro","Habla con Prestadír","Prestadír te ha pedido que lo sigas afuera.","Prestadír se encuentra sobre las turbulentas aguas del Fontegrís, justo fuera de los muros de Eitheldir.","Habla con Prestadír a las afueras de Eitheldir","Prestadír se encuentra a las afueras de las ruinas de Eitheldir.","Prestadír se encuentra en las ruinas de Eitheldir.","Habla con Prestadír fuera de los muros de Eitheldir","Has venido con Prestadír para patrullar por las ruinas de Eitheldir y saber qué quiere decirte."}},
[7007]={nameES="Instancia: Sombras perdidas",objectivesES={"The shadowy beast's power fades as it sinks back to whence it came!","Destroy the source of the Dheghûn","Destroy the source of the Dheghûn.","Instancia: Sombras perdidas","You should speak with Rhûd-pulo-Drât.","Find the source of the Dheghûn","At the end of the cavern, a large organic bulb pulses","Your tampering has only released an unknown horror upon Gondor!","Defeat Gúthrakh the Ravenous","Rhûd-pulo-Drât is in need of a warrior to brave the depths of Nardol's ancient mine and destroy the source of the Dheghûn beneath the mountain.","Defeat the Dheghûn and find out where they are coming from within the Nardol mines.","Speak with Rhûd-pulo-Drât"}},
[7008]={nameES="Instancia: Perdido en Fangorn",objectivesES={"The old Ent Baillas is in Fangorn.","Talk to Baillas","The rustling sound came from the east of Baillas.","You are once again observing the memory of an Ent. Someone or something approaches from the opposite direction.","Baillas's memory has ended; you must clear your head and return to reality.","Instancia: Perdido en Fangorn","Search east of Baillas for the source of the sound","The Ent was apparently concerned about the passage of an injured-looking Rohirrim man.\
\
You feel concerned for him as well, for you know these folk to be generally good sorts. Surely he will need assistance if he is to survive in this particularly wild forest.","A rustling sound indicates the approach of some noisy creature","Baillas wishes to impart a memory upon you.","A Rohirrim has limped into the woods, speaking bitterly as he walked"}},
[7009]={nameES="Instancia: Lothrandir",objectivesES={"Listen to Halbarad determine what must be done","Golodir has found his way to the large chamber, and his anger is evident.","You see no recognition in Lothrandir's eyes. He shakes and convulses before you, a pitiable figure that bears little resemblance to the strong-willed man you remember. Of all Saruman's crimes, this may be the one that strikes nearest to your heart.\
\
He seems to be trying to speak, but his words are muffled and his voice weak.","The woman named Mercy has told you where you might find Lothrandir: in the southernmost passage of the building in which you find yourself. You must search the building for him, and quickly!","Talk to Lothrandir in his cell","Gun Ain has given voice to something remarkable. Can it be true? Does Lothrandir still live?","Halbarad has found a large room, its floor covered with dirty water, and has called for you to join him.","Instancia: Lothrandir","Halbarad has determined what should be done.","Far below, in a large room, Halbarad beckons you onward","Halbarad has reunited with his lost kinsman.","The Grey Company has separated into groups in order to search more of Isengard for their captive kinsman.","Search the flooded pits for some sign of the captive Lothrandir","For the first time, Gun Ain's eyes are alight with a fierce and sudden joy. She exults in her words, and radiates a restless energy.\
\
'You spoke of the strength of Lothrandir's will, and you were not wrong. Saruman tried to exert control over his mind, tried with every ounce of his power, but still your friend resisted. The Wizard wove convincing illusions and portraits of despair, but still Lothrandir fought. Many and powerful were the tricks he employed to break your friend's mind, but each one failed. Lothrandir remained strong, and the Wizard could find no means of bending him to his will.\
\
'In the end, Saruman had to abandon the effort. He took another prisoner from his cell, a Falcon Clan warrior named Kenned who had proved unable to work in the Pits, and dressed him in Lothrandir's garb. That is the poor creature you see before you; he has at last earned his freedom.'","Talk to Lothrandir in the large chamber","Talk to Halbarad in the large chamber","The Rangers have lost a kinsman and a friend, and are sharing a moment of grief before they must return to Aragorn with the sad news.","Allow the Rangers time to mourn","You have agreed to search for Lothrandir in some more of the buildings in the wall of Isengard.","Talk to Halbarad outside Lothrandir's cell","Squinting in the half-light, a pile of rags reveals itself to be a weary prisoner","Talk to Golodir in the large chamber","Lothrandir stands before you, a shadow of his former self.","Lothrandir is in a cell unlocked by Gun Ain's key, off the southernmost passage.","Talk to Gun Ain in the large chamber","Find Lothrandir in a cell off the southernmost passage of the building"}},
[7010]={nameES="Instancia: Lothrandir de los Yermos Helados",objectivesES={"A young girl crouches by a ragged camp-site. Can this be the screaming shadow?","Talk to the mysterious girl","Find the screaming shadow within the massive cavern","Lothrandir must not be defeated","Lothrandir has been defeated","Lothrandir has chosen to spare the life of Gun Ain and is waiting to speak to you.","You have found a mysterious girl crouched by a ragged camp-fire in the depths of Kolo-hampât and must now defend yourself from her.","You have found a mysterious girl crouched by a ragged camp-fire in the depths of Kolo-hampât.","Instancia: Lothrandir de los Yermos Helados","Defend yourself from Gun Ain","Gun Ain falls to the icy ground, exhausted and defeated","The girl stares at you fiercely, her eyes wild with anger and fear. She shivers in the cold, and her face is thin and drawn. There is a feral air about her, and she seems tense, poised to strike.","Learn the history of this mysterious girl","Lothrandir has gone his own way to search the depths of Kolo-hampât, and now you must seek out the mysterious 'screaming shadow' yourself.","Talk to Lothrandir","Lothrandir is in Kolo-hampât, seeking the 'screaming shadow' that has interfered with the Lossoth hunters.","Lothrandir is in Kolo-hampât, waiting to speak with you.","You have entered the massive cavern of Kolo-hampât with the Ranger Lothrandir in search of the 'screaming shadow' that has interfered with the Lossoth hunters."}},
[7011]={nameES="Instance: Maladies for Remedies",objectivesES={"Khâshap is cornered!","Khâshap has left his champion Utho to deal with you.","Defeat Khâshap","The pursuit of Khâshap has led you to a dead end. He has no choice but to take a stand.","Khâshap has fled into the bustling Streets of Râhal Bakh where he has the protection of his cohorts.","A gate blocks your way!","Khâshap continues his escape to another gate. But it seems he is out of options.","Continue the pursuit","Talk to Hadorion","Instance: Maladies for Remedies","Defeat Utho the Grasper","Khâshap has fled deeper into the Streets of Râhal Bakh. Catch up to him before it is too late.","Khâshap at long last has been stopped. The engine of the apothecaries will no longer reach his masters, and the crisis averted.\
\
You should speak to Hadorion.","The way is open! Continue your pursuit!","Pursue Khâshap"}},
[7012]={nameES="Instancia: Hombre y Monstruo",objectivesES={}},
[7013]={nameES="Instancia: Marca de la Mano Blanca",objectivesES={"Regresa con el Uruk cautivo y mantente alerta","Habla con el Uruk cautivo","Drusi Begwyl vigila a su cautivo y quiere preguntarte algo.","<rgb=#FF0000>Tanto Meneldir como Flam Helur deben sobrevivir</rgb>","Habla con Drusi Begwyl","Flam Helur ha aceptado llevarte a ti y a Meneldir hasta el Uruk que él y su compañera capturaron.","Escucha las últimas palabras de Ushdul","Habla con el moribundo Ushdul","Instancia: Marca de la Mano Blanca","Has impedido que los Uruks rescaten a Ushdul.","Habla con Flam Helur","Permanece alerta y descubre qué trajo a Ushdul y a los Uruks a la Ciénaga de los Cisnes","El cautivo de Drusi te mira con desprecio.","Meneldir está listo para luchar contra cualquier nuevo peligro que se acerque.","Ushdul está muriendo, atravesado por flechas disparadas por quienes se suponía que venían a rescatarlo.","El Uruk herido se mueve","Ushdul yace moribundo. Ha exigido que escuches sus últimas palabras.","Meneldir y los Fuertes buscan descubrir qué ha traído a Ushdul y a los otros Uruks a la Ciénaga de los Cisnes.","Flam Helur, uno de los cazadores Fuertes de Clegur, ha aceptado llevarte al Uruk que él y su compañera Drusi capturaron.","Habla con Meneldir"}},
[7014]={nameES="Instancia: Mazog",objectivesES={"Golpea la puerta de la fortaleza","La puerta de la fortaleza de Zabadgathol se encuentra justo delante de ti.\
\
Bori quiere que golpees la puerta de la fortaleza para invocar a Mazog.","Bori espera una respuesta a su desafío.\
\
Ve a hablar con él y defiéndelo si es necesario.","Habla con Sweina","Bori se encuentra cerca de una de las entradas de Zabadgathol.\
\
Bori te espera para que lo acompañes a Zabadgathol.","Bori ha sido congelado por alguna maldad, y se te libera para llevar las malas noticias a los enanos.","Habla con Bori","Sweina ha llegado a las afueras.\
\
Deberías hablar con Sweina sobre el giro de los acontecimientos.","Instancia: Mazog","Bori está seguro de que con el poder del hacha de mithril Zigilburk, junto con tu ayuda, puede derrotar a Mazog y evitar la guerra.","Tu golpe resuena en toda la caverna, pero no hay respuesta.","Sobrevive a tu encuentro con Gorothúl y haz lo que te diga"}},
[7015]={nameES="Instancia: Mazog en la telaraña",objectivesES={"Instancia: Mazog en la telaraña","Usa el estandarte de los Malledhrim para dar órdenes de apoyo a Achardor","La Guardia Oculta ha comenzado el peligroso viaje a través de las Hondonadas Enmarañadas a lo largo de Râd Iorist.","Issuriel ha sido gravemente herida y se está desmayando justo al borde de la conciencia. Sus párpados tiemblan débilmente, pero no parece reconocerte.","Achardor está vigilando a lo largo de Râd Iorist, el peligroso camino hacia Dol Guldur que ha sido elegido por la Guardia Oculta.","Ha llegado el momento de llevar a Mazog más lejos por Râd Iorist, aunque los bosques estén infestados de arañas.","Habla con Sigileth","Issuriel tiene un mal presentimiento sobre algo y quiere hablar contigo mientras su nerviosismo aumenta.","La Guardia Oculta lucha por su supervivencia contra las arañas de las Hondonadas Enmarañadas incluso mientras uno de sus miembros y su prisionero sucumben al veneno del maestro de las arañas.","Habla con Achardor","El camino de la Guardia Oculta a lo largo de Râd Iorist ha terminado en desastre: Issuriel y Mazog han sido envenenados, y ahora el éxito de la misión está en peligro.","Asegura las cadenas de Mazog","Defiende a Issuriel","Revisa a Issuriel herida","Issuriel se encuentra en algún lugar a lo largo de Râd Iorist, al noreste de Achardor y Cúcheron. Las arañas de las Hondonadas Enmarañadas han tejido telarañas detrás de ella, y deben ser cortadas si los Elfos quieren unirse a ella con el prisionero.","La posición de Achardor a lo largo de Râd Iorist ha sido atacada por las arañas de las Hondonadas Enmarañadas. ¡Debes defender a Mazog de su ataque!","Habla con Issuriel","Achardor ha llegado a la posición de Issuriel a lo largo de Râd Iorist, con Mazog a su lado.","Habla con Issuriel más allá de las telarañas, al noreste","El camino que Cúcheron exploró no es seguro, y ahora el Elfo debe ser defendido de las arañas que lo persiguen. Asegúrate de que Mazog no sea asesinado.","Has resistido otro ataque de las arañas de las Hondonadas Enmarañadas y ahora deberías hablar con Achardor","Defiende a Mazog","Achardor necesita tu ayuda para liberarse de las telarañas y seguir a Issuriel y Mazog en lo profundo del bosque de las Hondonadas Enmarañadas.","Retiras las telarañas pegajosas y adherentes de los eslabones de las cadenas de Mazog, y el orco te mira impasible.","Defiende a Achardor y a la Guardia Oculta","Cúcheron ha sido salvado, gracias a tus esfuerzos y a los de Achardor, y Mazog sigue siendo prisionero de la Guardia Oculta.","Ayuda a Achardor a liberarse de las telarañas que lo atan","Habla con Cúcheron","Achardor te espera para que le des una orden de apoyo utilizando su estandarte de los Malledhrim.","La posición de Sigileth en Râd Iorist está siendo atacada por las arañas de las Hondonadas Enmarañadas. Debes defender a Sigileth y a Mazog.","Has resistido un primer ataque de las arañas a lo largo de Râd Iorist y ahora deberías hablar con Sigileth.","Sigileth te espera para hablar contigo a lo largo de Râd Iorist, en las Hondonadas Enmarañadas.","La posición de Issuriel en Râd Iorist ha sido atacada por las arañas de las Hondonadas Enmarañadas. Debe ser defendida.","Issuriel ha sido gravemente herida por las arañas de las Hondonadas Enmarañadas y yace desmayada bajo la luz de la luna llena. Mazog también ha sufrido una herida y parece estar en el mismo estado."}},
[7016]={nameES="Instancia: Conoce a Harding",objectivesES={"Harding and Captain Agelmund are meeting on the Officers balcony of the Meadhall.","Harding and Captain Agelmund are discussing the recent attacks by the Easterlings, and what else has set in motion around Harwick.","Listen to Harding","Speak with Agelmund, Captain of the Wold","Observe the meeting of Harding and his Captain","In the meadhall of Harwick, a meeting is taking place between Harding and his Captain, Agelmund. The Easterlings are advancing into the Wold, and the Rohirrim are hard pressed to keep their defences secure.","Harding and Captain Agelmund are meeting on the Officers' balcony of the Mead Hall.","Instancia: Conoce a Harding"}},
[7017]={nameES="Instancia: Conociendo al intendente",objectivesES={"Shúkurz is trying to feign a believable fight.\
\
You should play along, but stay close to Brukshar while fighting.","You should continue following Shúkurz.","Shúkurz might have seen what you saw. It wouldn't hurt to ask him.","You tell Shúkurz of the shadows you saw.\
\
'But -- but if anyone had been in that tunnel, we would've seen them.\
\
'...now I'LL be jumping at shadows! All right, just keep your head down -- we'll be in and out fast.'","The Orcs are eager for a fight.\
\
You should try to communicate with Shúkurz... somehow.","Shúkurz waits for you a little ways into the tunnel.","Shúkurz has brought you deep into Vatug-ronk, with the hope of learning Dhúrstrok's location.","You and Shúkurz have managed to obtain Dhúrstrok's location, all while escaping with your lives. But you've been noticing strange things....\
\
You should talk to Shúkurz.","Talk to Shúkurz","Fight Shúkurz","Instancia: Conociendo al intendente","You should follow Shúkurz deeper into the tunnel.","<rgb=#FF0000>Do not stray too far from Brukshar</rgb>","Follow Shúkurz","Shúkurz adopts a shaky fighting stance. His eyes dart towards your weapons, but he gives a subtle nod.","You have strayed too far from Brukshar","Brukshar has called off the fight.\
\
You should continue following Shúkurz."}},
[7018]={nameES="Instancia: Recuerdos de Mithrandir",objectivesES={"Habla con Bróin","Instancia: Recuerdos de Mithrandir","Has encontrado una caverna bajo Dol Guldur y debes despejarla de enemigos si va a ser utilizada por la Hueste Dorada.","Limpia Thurimen, la caverna bajo los cimientos de Dol Guldur, de enemigos","Has encontrado una caverna excavada profundamente bajo la fortaleza de Dol Guldur. ¿Podría ser este el mismo pasaje que Gandalf utilizó para infiltrarse en la fortaleza del Nigromante hace mucho tiempo?","Avanza más en Thurimen, despejándola de enemigos","Bróin y Sigileth han llegado a Thurimen y están asombrados de ver lo bien que se adapta a sus propósitos.","Has despejado gran parte de Thurimen de amenazas y deberías continuar hacia adelante y hacia arriba."}},
[7019]={nameES="Instancia: Recuerdos de Máttugard",objectivesES={"Although over two hundred years have passed since the Haban'akkâ of Thráin set siege to Máttugard during the Sixth War of the Dwarves and Orcs, memories of that fateful battle have never left the mind of Hermáth Stormhammer.","King Thráin can be found at Zidir-nesad, the Steepset.\
\
The Haban'akkâ of Thráin is attempting to wrest control of Máttugard from the Orcs of Mount Gundabad. You should talk to King Thráin and aid the Haban'akkâ!","Instancia: Recuerdos de Máttugard"}},
[7020]={nameES="Instancia: Recuerdos de la Última Alianza",objectivesES={"Listen to Elladan's tale of the Battle of Dagorlad","Listen as Elrohir concludes the tale of the Battle of Dagorlad","Elrohir is describing the courage of Gil-galad and Elendil in the face of the Ringwraiths.","Instancia: Recuerdos de la Última Alianza","Elrohir is nearing the end of his tale. You should continue to follow along.","Elrohir and Elladan are telling you the tale of the Last Alliance's victory at the Battle of Dagorlad. You should follow along and listen as Elrohir begins the tale.","Listen to Elrohir's tale of the Last Alliance","As the Second Age approached its end, Elrond stood with the Last Alliance against the forces of Sauron and won a decisive victory that led to the Dark Lord's defeat.","The Last Alliance gathered at a great bulwark in Dagorlad and prepared to strike against the armies of Mordor.","Elrohir is describing a great battle between the Ringwraiths and the commanders of the Last Alliance.","Elrohir and Elladan are telling you the tale of the Last Alliance's victory at the Battle of Dagorlad. You should follow along and listen as Elladan continues the tale.","Listen to Elrohir's tale of the Battle of Dagorlad","Follow the Last Alliance across the flaming trench toward Mordor","Elladan is describing the trials of the Last Alliance as they drew closer to the Black Gate.","Elrohir has finished his tale of the Battle of Dagorlad.","Follow Gil-galad and Elendil into battle against the Ringwraiths","Listen to Elrohir's final remarks","Follow the Last Alliance into battle against the armies of Mordor"}},
[7021]={nameES="Instancia: Mensajes de Lórien",objectivesES={"Master Elrond is waiting to speak with you in the Library of his house.","Arwen is outside the library in the House of Elrond and wishes to speak with you.","Instancia: Mensajes de Lórien","Pethelen is in the main hall of the House of Elrond.\
\
You have entered the House of Elrond with Pethelen, and he is waiting to speak with you.","Talk to Pethelen","Enter the Hall of Fire","Habla con Elrohir","Lord Elrond has asked to meet you in the library of his house to further discuss the charge: to gather the Dúnedain that they may ride to the aid of Aragorn in Rohan.","Talk to Master Elrond","Master Elrond is waiting inside the library of his house to speak with you.","The Lady Arwen catches your eye and smiles a greeting","Enter the Library in the House of Elrond","Talk to Lord Elrond","Elrohir is in the library of his father's house.","Master Elrond is in the Hall of Fire inside his house in Rivendell, waiting to speak with you.","Lord Elrond is waiting to speak with you in the library of his house.","Walk to the Library in the House of Elrond","Talk to Lady Arwen","Master Elrond is waiting for you in the Hall of Fire, inside the Last Homely House.","You have come to Imladris in response to an urgent summons from Master Elrond.","Master Elrond is in the library of his house."}},
[7022]={nameES="Instancia: Incursión de medianoche",objectivesES={"Debes debilitar la respuesta del campamento a tu ataque emboscando y eliminando a varios de sus guardias veteranos antes de que comience la fase principal del asalto.","Toma una tea de la hoguera","Usa la antigua forja para potenciar tu adamantita infundida.","Coge antorchas de la hoguera en el centro del campamento dunlendino y prende fuego a tantas tiendas como sea posible para crear pánico y desorden.","Instancia: Incursión de medianoche","Habla con Perimbant","Usa el yunque antiguo","Has creado una adamantita potenciada","Capitán dunlendino derrotado","Debes encontrar y derrotar al capitán dunlendino antes de que pueda reunir a sus tropas para repeler tu asalto.","Derrota al capitán dunlendino","Habla con Perimbant para volver a Echad Dúnann.","Sin que lo sepan los dunlendinos de Eregion, su campamento más grande se ha construido sobre una antigua forja de elfos donde una vez se forjaron algunas de las mejores armas de principios de la Tercera Edad. Para poder acceder a esta forja, Perimbant ha ideado un audaz plan para asaltar el campamento a través del río a la luz de la luna, entrando a hurtadillas para vencer a los guardias y prender fuego a gran parte del campamento, dispersando a los desprevenidos defensores en el caos de la batalla y las llamas."}},
[7023]={nameES="Instancia: Medianoche en el Bosque Ahogado",objectivesES={"Has advertido a Achardor del intento de escape de Mazog, y ahora el Orco puede ser recapturado.","Habla con Bróin","Con el corazón encogido, notas el cuerpo de un Elfo junto al estanque estancado","Bróin está en la Bodega Desolada, esperando para hablar contigo.","Examinar el cuerpo","Issuriel te espera para hablar contigo a lo largo del camino de Râd Cened.","Cúcheron ha explorado la siguiente etapa de tu viaje a través del Bosque Ahogado con Mazog.","Cúcheron te ha pedido que despejes el túnel al noreste de su posición de peligro mientras él vigila a Mazog y luego regreses con él.","La posición de Cúcheron a lo largo del camino de la Guardia Oculta a través del Bosque Ahogado ha sido atacada. Debes defender a Mazog de estos enemigos.","Usa el estandarte de la Hueste Dorada para dar órdenes de apoyo a Sigileth","Issuriel te ha pedido que asegures las cadenas de Mazog y que lo escoltes a través de los pantanos del Bosque Ahogado hasta Cúcheron, que espera un poco más adelante.","Habla con Achardor en la bodega de la Posada Embrujada","Tras la muerte de Raddir, la Guardia Oculta ha avanzado cojeando hasta la bodega de una posada entre los Troncosombríos, allí para decidir qué se puede hacer.","Habla con Sigileth","Cúcheron está esperando para preguntarte algo, ahora que los ataques han cesado por el momento.","No has logrado llegar a Achardor antes que Mazog","Habla con Achardor","Asegura las cadenas de Mazog","Sigileth ha explorado la siguiente etapa de tu viaje a través del Bosque Ahogado con Mazog.","Despeja el túnel de peligros para que Mazog pueda ser escoltado de manera segura a través de él","Issuriel te espera para hablar contigo en el camino de Râd Cened.\
\
Has recorrido parte del camino elegido por Raddir a través del Bosque Ahogado y ahora debes seguir el camino de Râd Cened con Mazog.","Lo impensable ha ocurrido: Raddir ha sido asesinado en el Bosque Ahogado.","Cúcheron te ha pedido que uses su estandarte de la Hueste Dorada para dar órdenes que le permitan apoyarte en la batalla.","Instancia: Medianoche en el Bosque Ahogado","La posición de Sigileth a lo largo del camino de la Guardia Oculta a través del Bosque Ahogado ha sido atacada. Debes defender a Mazog de estos enemigos.","Habla con Issuriel","Revisas las cadenas de Mazog y siguen seguras. Te mira evaluándote, lo cual es de alguna manera más desconcertante que su habitual mueca.","Sigileth te ha pedido que uses su estandarte de la Hueste Dorada para dar órdenes que ella pueda apoyarte en la batalla.","Usa el estandarte de la Hueste Dorada para dar órdenes de apoyo a Issuriel","Defiende a Mazog","Mazog tiene una mirada siniestra en sus ojos. Asegúrate de que sus cadenas permanezcan seguras.","Habla con Cúcheron","Cúcheron está fuera del túnel, vigilando a Mazog y esperando tu regreso.","Es hora de llevar a Mazog más lejos por Râd Cened, la ruta que Raddir ha seleccionado para llevar a la Guardia Oculta a través del peligroso Bosque Ahogado.","Has logrado ponerte delante de Mazog y puedes impedir su escape","La Guardia Oculta comienza el peligroso cruce del Bosque Ahogado con Mazog.","Te aseguras de que las cadenas de Mazog permanezcan seguras. Una vez más, el Orco te recompensa solo con una mirada evaluadora.","Te aseguras de que las cadenas de Mazog estén seguras. El Orco te mira con desprecio, y sus ojos brillan de odio.","Llamas su nombre e intentas obtener una respuesta del Elfo, pero ya es demasiado tarde: Raddir está muerto.\
\
No hay señales de lucha ni marcas de heridas que puedas ver, pero a pesar de ese enigma, una cosa está clara: la Guardia Oculta ha perdido a uno de los suyos.","Sigileth te está esperando para hablar contigo, ahora que los ataques han cesado por el momento.","Sigileth te ha pedido que asegures las cadenas de Mazog y lo escoltes a través de los pantanos del Bosque Ahogado hasta Raddir, que espera más adelante.","Issuriel te ha pedido que uses su estandarte de la Hueste Dorada para dar órdenes que le permitan apoyarte en la batalla contra cualquier amenaza.","Llega a Achardor antes que Mazog","Usa el estandarte de la Hueste Dorada para dar órdenes de apoyo a Cúcheron","Regresa a Cúcheron"}},
[7024]={nameES="Instancia: Amigo desaparecido",objectivesES={}},
[7025]={nameES="Instance: Missing Persons",objectivesES={}},
[7026]={nameES="Instancia: Desaparecido en las Ciénagas",objectivesES={}},
[7027]={nameES="Instancia: Identidad equivocada",objectivesES={"La lluvia y el viento se han vuelto muy intensos, y Bingo quiere encontrar un lugar resguardado donde quedarse.","El Nazgûl ha huido.","Un Nazgûl ha descendido sobre las llanuras de Rohan, ¡y Bingo está en peligro!","Egwylf cree que podrías ahuyentar al Nazgûl si logras prender fuego a la hierba.","Recoge la antorcha del suelo donde ha caído","Habla con Egwylf","Mientras viajas por las llanuras de Rohan con Bingo, Egwylf y Willem Bigote, una fuerte tormenta ha estorbado vuestro avance.","Busca un lugar donde refugiarte de la tormenta","El Nazgûl sisea con furia. ¡No quiere acercarse a las llamas!","Protege a Egwylf y Willem del Nazgûl","Protege a Bingo del Nazgûl","Habla con Bingo antes de que la tormenta empeore","Instancia: Identidad equivocada"}},
[7028]={nameES="Instancia: Nieblas del Anduin",objectivesES={"Talk to Horn in Stangard","Nona is standing on a small rise amidst rocks in the Rushgore.\
\
Some terrible presence has come near to you in the Rushgore.","Horn is waiting to speak to you about the price for healing Nona.","Galadriel has come to speak with you about Nona.","The Nazgûl stands atop the hill. You need to find a means of driving it off!","Travel to Lothlórien to seek the aid of Galadriel","Survive your encounter with great evil in the Rushgore","Talk to Nona atop the rocky rise in the Rushgore","Find Nona! She is in grave danger!","Horn is standing uncomfortably in Lothlórien, waiting to speak with you.","Bring Nona to Stangard for the healing she needs","An evil presence has come to the Rushgore, and you are in great danger!","An Easterling has attempted to escape, and you need to defeat him before he alerts his fellows.","You are returning with Nona to Stangard, in order to regroup and plan your next move.","Suddenly, a woman's scream pierces the stillness! Nona is in trouble!","Horn is waiting for your answer in Stangard.","You hastily grab the fallen torch, burning your hand!","Nona is somewhere in the Rushgore, and it sounds like she's in trouble!","Talk to Horn in Lothlórien","Nona is struggling to speak.","Survive the Easterling ambush and prevent any of them from alerting their fellows","There are Easterlings in the mists of the Rushgore, and something worse beside!","You are making your way through the Rushgore with Nona.","Instancia: Nieblas del Anduin","Talk to Nona in the Rushgore","You have brought Nona to Stangard, but do not know if the Rohirrim will be able to save her life.","Talk to Nona where she lies in Stangard","Talk to the Khundolar Captain","You have come to seek the aid of Galadriel. Will she give it?","Talk to Galadriel in Lothlórien","You are walking through the Rushgore with Nona when she stops and wants to talk to you about something.","Walk with Nona through the Rushgore"}},
[7029]={nameES="Instancia: La Caída de Mordirith",objectivesES={"Instancia: La Caída de Mordirith","Con la luz de Dúnachar, Golodir ha derrotado a Mordirith, aunque el villano escapó antes de poder ser vencido por completo. Deberías hablar con Golodir para ver qué desea que hagas.","Ayuda a Golodir mientras te adentras más en el Castillo del Rey Brujo.","Has viajado muy adentro de Carn Dûm junto a Golodir, hasta la propia fortaleza del Rey Brujo. Aquí Golodir espera enfrentarse a Mordirith y destruir la Corona de Hierro para siempre.","Deberías hablar con Golodir de inmediato.","Habla con Golodir"}},
[7030]={nameES="Instancia: Mordor Triunfante",objectivesES={"Talk to Golasgil between the slag hills","Find Pippin atop the western slag hill","Golasgil has been thrown to the ground by a great Olog, and now the beast seeks to finish what it began.","You have heard Pippin's voice from above the din of battle. He needs your help!","Golasgil has been mortally wounded.","Talk to Beregond atop the western slag hill","Beregond is atop the western slag hill, calling for help.","Talk to Golasgil where he lies","Pippin does not move","The armies of Mordor converge on the slag hills as Aragorn and the Host of the West prepare for the final assault.","Aragorn is atop the eastern slag hill, ready to engage once more with the enemies that approach.","Stand your ground and defend Aragorn","Talk to Aragorn atop the eastern slag hill","Help soldiers caught between the slag hills","Instancia: Mordor Triunfante","The battle rages all around you, and Beregond intends to rally the forces to keep fighting until the end.","Pippin lies beneath a great Olog atop the western slag hill.","Golasgil of Anfalas has been caught between the slag hills and needs your help.","You have found Beregond, but Pippin does not stand with him","Defeat the Olog that crushed Golasgil","You hear a scream from above. That was Pippin's voice!","Check on Pippin where he lies","Aragorn has asked you to make your way to the western slag hill and to help soldiers caught in the middle of the fighting.","Find Calenglad where he fell on the battlefield","The eastern slag hill has come under heavy attack, and Aragorn calls his kinsmen to him for the final defence.","Great shouting and clamour rises from the west","Aragorn has asked you to find Calenglad where he fell, if you can, and ease his pain."}},
[7031]={nameES="Instancia: Mordrambor",objectivesES={"Calenglad está dentro de la fortaleza de Tinnudir.\
\
Mordrambor ha escapado, dejando tras de sí muertos y moribundos.","Encuentra a Tadan","Calenglad está dentro de la fortaleza de Tinnudir.\
\
Tú y Calenglad habéis entrado en la fortaleza de Tinnudir para enfrentar a Mordrambor, el Númenóreano Negro encarcelado.","Calenglad está dentro de la fortaleza de Tinnudir.\
\
Has entrado en la fortaleza de Tinnudir para enfrentar a Mordrambor, el Númenóreano Negro encarcelado.","Tadan está en la habitación en lo alto de las escaleras, donde Mordrambor estaba encerrado.\
\
El Númenóreano Negro ha escapado de su prisión, y no hay rastro de su carcelero.","Enfrenta a Mordrambor con Calenglad","Instancia: Mordrambor","Calenglad ha decidido enfrentar a Mordrambor y averiguar si sabe algo sobre Narchuil."}},
[7032]={nameES="Instancia: Musgovilla, la Aldea Fronteriza",objectivesES={"Espera a que Skardí Doblafilos deje tu equipo sobre el mostrador y luego tómalo.","El guardia en la puerta de Musgovilla te saluda con una sonrisa amistosa, haciéndote señas para que te acerques.\
\
<rgb=#00FF00>(Avanza presionando W, y haz clic derecho sobre Bevan para hablar con él)</rgb>","Musgovilla está bajo ataque, y Meneldir necesita tu ayuda para salvar la aldea.","Habla con Meneldir y completa la misión 'Un Mundo Más Grande'","Has encontrado a uno de los villanos responsables del ataque a la aldea de Musgovilla. ¿Qué ha traído a trasgos como este a la Ciénaga de los Cisnes?","Has derrotado al trasgo, pero no pudo haber provocado todos estos incendios él solo. Sin duda tiene aliados cerca.","El repique de las campanas indica que el peligro ha llegado a Musgovilla","Bevan en la puerta te recomendó que te presentaras a Geralt, uno de los habitantes de Musgovilla.\
\
<rgb=#00FF00>(Avanza con W, gira izquierda y derecha con A y D, retrocede con S)</rgb>","Habla con Geralt junto a la fuente en la plaza del pueblo\
\
<rgb=#00FF00>(Puedes avanzar presionando W y girar hacia la izquierda o derecha con A y D)</rgb>","Meneldir ha salido apresurado de la herrería, y debes seguirlo\
\
El repique de las campanas indica que algún problema ha llegado a Musgovilla","Skardí Doblafilos te ha pedido que dejes tu equipo sobre el mostrador, y él lo arreglará gratis... esta vez.\
\
<rgb=#00FF00>(Haz clic derecho en el punto brillante para dejar tu equipo sobre el mostrador)</rgb>","Toma tu equipo del mostrador y habla con Skardí Doblafilos\
\
<rgb=#00FF00>(Haz clic derecho en el saco para abrirlo y ver su contenido. Haz clic derecho en los objetos dentro para recogerlos y ponerlos en tu inventario. Pulsa “I” para ver tu Inventario)</rgb>","Derrota a Madthrug","Quédate junto a Meneldir y permanece alerta","Espera a que Skardí Doblafilos deje tu equipo sobre el mostrador y entonces recógelo.","Habla con Eleri","Equipa tus armas y habla con Meneldir dentro de la herrería\
\
<rgb=#00FF00>(Cuando consigas nuevas armas y armaduras, presiona 'I' para ver tu Inventario. Desde ahí, puedes equiparlos haciendo clic con el botón derecho en sus Íconos o arrastrándolos al panel de personajes, al que puedes acceder presionando 'C')</rgb>","Habla con Meneldir en la plaza de Musgovilla","Skardí Doblafilos está dentro de la herrería de Musgovilla, al sureste de la fuente.\
\
<rgb=#00FF00>(Entra en la herrería haciendo clic derecho en la puerta para abrirla, luego presiona W para entrar)</rgb>","Habla con Skardí Doblafilos dentro de la herrería de Musgovilla","El hombre dentro de la herrería de Musgovilla, Meneldir, te ha llamado para hablarle\
\
<rgb=#00FF00>(Cuando consigas nuevas armas y armaduras, presiona 'I' para ver tu Inventario. Desde ahí, puedes equiparlos haciendo clic con el botón derecho en sus Íconos o arrastrándolos al panel de personajes, al que puedes acceder presionando 'C')</rgb>","Espera a que Skardí Doblafilos repare tu equipo y lo deje en el mostrador","Eleri ha llamado a todos en Musgovilla para ayudar a defender la aldea del ataque del grupo trasgo","Habla con Bevan en la puerta de Musgovilla\
\
<rgb=#00FF00>(Avanza presionando W y haz clic derecho en Bevan para hablar con él)</rgb>","Espera a que Skardí Doblafilos repare tu equipo y lo coloque sobre el mostrador","Habla con Wenna","Meneldir tiene una petición para ti.","Prepárate para defender a los aldeanos de Madthrug, líder de la partida de asalto","Has ayudado a salvar Musgovilla de los estragos de los Uruks... pero ¿por qué vinieron al pueblo en primer lugar?","Has encontrado al aparente líder de la partida de asalto, y no es un trasgo... es uno de los Uruk-hai de combate.\
\
Madthrug lidera la partida de asalto contra Musgovilla, amenazando a los pacíficos habitantes del pueblo.","Instancia: Musgovilla, la Aldea Fronteriza","La madre de Tegwyn, Wenna, está agradecida por tu ayuda salvando a su hijo de los Uruks.","Trasgo asaltante derrotado","Escucha a Meneldir y a Skardí discutir los acontecimientos","Skardí Doblafilos está dentro de la herrería de Musgovilla, al sur de la puerta.","Asegúrate de que Tegwyn esté a salvo","Derrota al trasgo asaltante\
\
<rgb=#00FF00>(Haz clic derecho en el trasgo asaltante para entrar en combate)</rgb>","Deja tu equipo sobre el mostrador\
\
<rgb=#00FF00>(Haz clic derecho en el punto brillante para dejar tu equipo sobre el mostrador)</rgb>","Skardí Doblafilos está muy interesado en ver a alguien como tú en la pacífica aldea de Musgovilla.\
\
<rgb=#00FF00>(Mantén presionado el botón derecho del ratón para girar tu cámara y mantener a la gente importante a la vista)</rgb>","Skardí Doblafilos ha reparado tu equipo y te invita a recogerlo del mostrador. Espera con entusiasmo tu opinión sobre su trabajo.\
\
<rgb=#00FF00>(Haz clic derecho en el zurrón brillante para abrirlo y ver su contenido. Haz clic derecho en los objetos que hay dentro del saco para ponerlos en tu inventario. Pulsa 'I' para ver tu Inventario)</rgb>","Entra en la herrería de Musgovilla al sureste de la fuente.\
\
<rgb=#00FF00>(Haz clic derecho en la puerta para abrirla y luego avanza con W para entrar)</rgb>","Sigue a Meneldir afuera para descubrir qué peligro ha llegado a Musgovilla","Espera a que Skardí Doblafilos vaya detrás del mostrador\
\
<rgb=#00FF00>(Mantener presionado el botón derecho del ratón te permite girar la cámara y mantener a la vista a la gente de interés)</rgb>","Habla con Meneldir","La promesa de aventura y una inclinación por viajar te han traído a Musgovilla, un pequeño asentamiento en la frontera de la Ciénaga de los Cisnes y el Antiguo Cardolan. ¿Qué te espera ahora?","Meneldir está junto a la puerta de Musgovilla, reflexionando sobre los sucesos de los últimos minutos.","El hombre apoyado en la pared de la tienda llama tu atención"}},
[7033]={nameES="Instancia: De luto por los muertos",objectivesES={"Enter the Tower of Ecthelion with Éomer","Light the pyre","There is little time to mourn those lost at Pelennor, but Aragorn knows that some time must be spared to remember the fallen.","Pick up the stone for Snowmane's cairn.","Place the stone on the cairn that marks Snowmane's grave.","Speak with Éomer on the Pelennor.","<rgb=#FF0000>Mourn</rgb> for Théoden King","Habla con Éomer","Speak with Éomer inside the Tower of Ecthelion.","Use the torch to light the pyre.","Éomer motions that he wishes to speak to you","Pick up the torch for lighting the pyre.","Enter the Tower of Ecthelion.","Pay your respects to Théoden King.","Listen to Éomer speak.","Walk with Éomer to Théoden's bedside","Place the stone on the cairn for Snowmane","The night is lit by the fire of the burning pyre","Listen to Éomer as he speaks the names of the fallen.","The torch burns brightly in the night","Remain alert while Éomer speaks","Listen to the record of the fallen","Recoge la antorcha","Walk with Éomer to pay respects to Théoden.","Speak with Éomer at the Tower of Ecthelion.","You are overcome by the loss of many great warriors.","Instancia: De luto por los muertos","Pick up the stone for Snowmane's cairn","<rgb=#FF0000>Mourn</rgb> the loss of your fellow warriors"}},
[7034]={nameES="Instancia: Boca de Gondor",objectivesES={"Yadêphal is in Barad-dûr, where Sauron reigned.","Talk to Yadêphal in Barad-dûr","Dulgabêth is in Barad-dûr, and demands to know why you have come to treat with him instead of Aragorn.","You know that Aragorn will never accept this offer","Aragorn will never accept this offer, but you should tell Dulgabêth of your intention to bring it before the king.","Aragorn bestowed upon you the authority to speak on his behalf, and you have gone with Yadêphal to hear what his master, once the Mouth of Sauron, has to say to Gondor.","Aragorn has given you authority to treat with Dulgabêth on his behalf.","Tell Dulgabêth your name and your title","Aragorn has given you authority to hear what Dulgabêth has to say.","Tell Dulgabêth you will bring his offer before the king","Listen to Dulgabêth's offer in Barad-dûr","Instancia: Boca de Gondor","Follow Yadêphal to Dulgabêth in Barad-dûr"}},
[7035]={nameES="Instancia: La advertencia de Munfaeril",objectivesES={"Defeat Madin Brenin and his guards.","Instancia: La advertencia de Munfaeril","Munfaeril has asked you to take a warning to Madin, Brenin of Barnavon.","Defeated Madin Brenin and his guards","Deliver Munfaeril's warning to Madin Brenin","Defeat Madin Brenin and his guards","Deliver Munfaeril's warning to Madin Brenin in Barnavon."}},
[7036]={nameES="Instance: Mysteries To Unravel",objectivesES={"Approach Lúkhag","Aighrig seems intent on confronting the Angmarim at the tower's entrance.\
\
She has asked you not to attack them unless it's in self-defence.","Lúkhag has led you to Dûn Traikh, presumably where she last saw Aighrig.","Instance: Mysteries To Unravel","Defend Lúkhag","Lúkhag appears to know where she's going, but will need you to defend her.","Defend Aighrig","Talk to Aighrig","The conversation between Latharn and Aighrig has not ended peacefully.","Latharn has been defeated.\
\
You should check on Aighrig.","Lúkhag is waiting for you on the road leading to Dûn Traikh.","<rgb=#FF0000>Aighrig has been defeated!</rgb>","Aighrig has stopped in front of the tower and has something to say.","<rgb=#FF0000>Lúkhag has been defeated!</rgb>","Aighrig is determined to find Latharn.","Observe the confrontation","Lúkhag has led you to Aighrig, who has come to Dûn Traikh alone.","Seeing that you've caught up, Lúkhag continues flying towards Dûn Traikh."}},
[7037]={nameES="Instancia: Nakási Segadora de Olas y los herederos de Castamir",objectivesES={"Remain alert for any Heirsworn treachery","Confront Aphadaer and Balakhâd","Together, you and Tatháta the Beast have determined to defeat the leadership of the Song of Waves and Wind and prevent the fleet from being used further against Gondor or anywhere else.","Defeat Nakási Wave-reaper","Prepare for battle and talk to Nakási Wave-reaper","Remain on your guard against those who command the Song of Waves and Wind.","Aphadaer claims he has taken the life of King Elessar. Tell him <rgb=#00FF00>no</rgb>, for the King will survive his wound.","Nakási Wave-reaper has accomplished her mission, and she stares at you with contentment.","Remain on your guard as you confront the leadership of the Song","Prepare for battle and speak to Aphadaer","The battle is over.","Talk to Tatháta on the dock","Tatháta is beside the Heirsworn ship Phazanêg.","Remain alert for any treachery on the part of the Heirsworn.","Tell them <rgb=#00FF00>no</rgb>, the King will live","Aphadaer has sought the protection of Balakhâd for the death of King Elessar.","Instancia: Nakási Segadora de Olas y los herederos de Castamir","Aphadaer has decided to prove his loyalty to Balakhâd and the Heirs of Castamir by facing you in battle."}},
[7038]={nameES="Instancia: Sacrificios necesarios",objectivesES={"You are suddenly ensnared in thick webbing!","Talk to Legolas at Torech Ungol","Captain Róglarg yells out to you and beckons you over!","Captain Róglarg is standing before the sealed entrance to Torech Ungol.\
\
You have cleared the debris as Captain Róglarg ordered. Aside from the tremors of shifting rocks in the depths of Torech Ungol, seemingly no progress has been made in unsealing Torch Ungol.","Instancia: Sacrificios necesarios","Captain Róglarg can be found at Torech Ungol.\
\
You and Captain Róglarg have led a company of Orcs to Torech Ungol to be sacrificed to Shelob.","Signal '<rgb=#FF00FF>no</rgb>' to Captain Róglarg","Debris can be found outside the mouth of Torech Ungol.\
\
Captain Róglarg has ordered you to clear debris from the main tunnel of Torech Ungol in an attempt to appease Shelob.","You have come to Torech Ungol with Captain Róglarg and should now lead the sacrifices to the mouth of Torech Ungol.","Signal Captain Róglarg","Captain Róglarg grumbles to himself.\
\
'I've been over here keeping eyes on the lot of them, and now I count only six! Where did two of them get off to?\
\
'Maybe they jumped into the tunnels. A lot of good that'll do them... she'll get them either way!\
\
'Have you seen anything, Silent One? Your neck still works, doesn't it?'","Legolas can be found near the entrance of Torech Ungol.\
\
Legolas has freed you from the webs that ensnared you. You should speak to Legolas and flee Torech Ungol!","Legolas swiftly cuts you loose, but the webbing pulls the Silent One's armour from you!","Desperate to be rid of the relentless attacks by creatures of Her Ladyship's lesser broods, Captain Róglarg of Cirith Ungol prepares to sacrifice a company of Orcs to Shelob at her lair, Torech Ungol.","Signal Captain Róglarg at Torech Ungol","Webs have shot forth from the hidden caves and tunnels of Torech Ungol, dragging many Orcs in your company to their dooms. You should flee Torech Ungol with Captain Róglarg.","Flee Torech Ungol with Captain Róglarg!","Escape with Captain Róglarg","Captain Róglarg is standing before the sealed entrance to Torech Ungol.\
\
You have brought the sacrifices to the mouth of Torech Ungol, but it is blocked by stone and debris. You should get Captain Róglarg's attention and see if he knows what to do.","Keep watch on the Orcs and await Her Ladyship's arrival","Return to Captain Róglarg","Captain Róglarg is keeping watch at Torech Ungol.\
\
Captain Róglarg has asked you if you know where the two missing Orcs in the company have gone. You should tell him no, even if you know better.","You are trapped in the thick webs of Her Ladyship! You must struggle free!","Captain Róglarg is keeping watch at Torech Ungol.\
\
Captain Róglarg has called you over. You should see what he wants.","\\qEscort\\q the sacrifices to Torech Ungol with Captain Róglarg","You break stone after stone, but Torech Ungol remains sealed!","You should await Her Ladyship's arrival at Torech Ungol until Captain Róglarg signals otherwise.","Try to free yourself from the webs!","Captain Róglarg has fled to the entrance of Torech Ungol.\
\
You have escaped the webs of Shelob and her children with Captain Róglarg. You should escape and return to Cirith Ungol."}},
[7039]={nameES="Instancia: Negociaciones",objectivesES={"Negotiate with Jajax","Hebil has come to ask for Jajax's help.","You have asked Jajax to pull his men out of Lothgobel","Jajax is in the tavern of Lothgobel.\
\
You should speak with Jajax.","Instancia: Negociaciones","Speak with Jajax to tell him you agree","Jajax has agreed to speak with you about the fate of Lothgobel.","You tell Jajax that his offer is more than fair.\
\
'Aye, that it is. And we do not play fair. See how the men grumble and stir already? It seems that some of them do not like my speech....'","You hear the tavern door slam open...","Watch the confrontation between Jajax and Hebil","This seems like one of those situations you should get out of... quickly."}},
[7040]={nameES="Instancia: Los vecinos se encuentran",objectivesES={"Orcs are attacking Thinglad!\
\
You should defeat many Orcs.","Defeat attackers","You should speak with Noriel at once.","Wynmar appears to be rather smitten with Noriel","Noriel has asked Wynmar to lead his people from Thinglad, and he has given his word","Listen to Noriel and Wynmar","You should talk to Noriel.","Observe the dialogue between Noriel and Wynmar.","Instancia: Los vecinos se encuentran","The Elves of Thinglad are unveiled to their Stangard neighbours at last.","Talk to Noriel","Thank Wynmar for his intervention","You should talk to Wynmar."}},
[7041]={nameES="Instancia: Nestinanessornë",objectivesES={"Leafshade has agreed to tell you the story of how he met Nestinanessornë, and what happened afterward.","Talk to Nestinanessornë","Nakási Wave-reaper and her Corsairs have come to Leafshade's grove.","Nestinanessornë lies upon the stone table in Leafshade's grove.","Leafshade and Nestinanessornë discuss the Elf's need to leave the Ent's grove.","Listen to the conversation of Leafshade and Nestinanessornë","Nestinanessornë has collapsed in Leafshade's grove, seeking to go to the aid of his friends.","Talk to Nakási Wave-reaper","Observe the confrontation between Nakási Wave-reaper and Leafshade","Leafshade and Nestinanessornë discuss what befell the Elf, and how he came to be in the Ent's care.","Talk to Leafshade","Instancia: Nestinanessornë","Leafshade remembers his conversations with Nestinanessornë.","Nakási Wave-reaper poses a threat to Leafshade and to Nestinanessornë.","Leafshade is ready to conclude his tale."}},
[7042]={nameES="Instancia: Nueva Diablura",objectivesES={"Magor te ha ayudado a despejar el camino hacia un oscuro y profundo antro. Sintiéndose en peligro, se ha ido a buscar ayuda, dejándote a ti la tarea de descubrir la nueva amenaza. Busca el mal que se encuentra delante de ti y destrúyelo.","Al entrar en Azanarukâr, te encuentras con los batallones de las tropas de élite de Mazog. Los Elfos te han pedido que elimines la amenaza que representa Mazog en Azanarukâr derrotando a sus líderes.","Has matado a dos grandes Rogmul que afirmaban guardar Azanarukâr desde hace mucho tiempo. Escuchas horribles rugidos delante de ti y solo puedes imaginar el peligro que se esconde detrás de la siguiente curva.","Instancia: Nueva Diablura","Los Elfos de Lothlórien te han enviado al corazón de Azanarukâr para descubrir qué le ha pasado a Magor y qué es lo que realmente sucede en estas profundidades inexploradas.","Has derrotado a los líderes de los Orcos de Moria que Mazog envió a Azanarukâr y has encontrado a Magor, el Elfo perdido. Ahora, Magor quiere que le ayudes a derrotar a las criaturas sin nombre que habitan en las profundidades de Azanarukâr. Necesitará ayuda para acabar con esta plaga.","Habla con Magor, el Elfo prisionero"}},
[7043]={nameES="Instancia: La Noche Cae sobre el Vado de Sarn",objectivesES={"Habla con Halbarad y escucha su relato","Halbarad teje un relato de temor.","Halbarad ha accedido a contarte la noche en que el Vado de Sarn fue atacado.","Instancia: La Noche Cae sobre el Vado de Sarn","Escucha el relato de Halbarad"}},
[7044]={nameES="Instancia: La noche cae sobre Meduseld",objectivesES={"Talk to Éomer in Edoras","Listen as Éomer speaks with Théoden","Éomer is ready to confront Théoden and his advisor Gríma Wormtongue.","Talk to Háma inside Meduseld","Talk to Corudan in front of Meduseld","Gríma studies you with piercing eyes, and you feel distinctly uncomfortable. How much knowledge of your imprisonment in Isengard did Saruman share with his nefarious agent?\
\
You learned in the caverns below Isengard that Gríma is a pawn of Saruman... but does Gríma know that you know it?","Talk to Háma","Talk to Éomer in front of Meduseld","You have come with Éomer to Edoras to speak with his uncle Théoden, the King of Rohan.","Háma is before the gates of Meduseld, waiting to take your weapons.","Éomer is standing on the approach to Meduseld, the Golden Hall, and wishes to speak with you.","Talk to Horn in front of Meduseld","Talk to Gríma","It is not yet time for your audience with Théoden. You will be called before him when he is ready for you.","Háma, el portero de Théoden, está ante las puertas de Meduseld y debe aprobar tu entrada antes de que puedas ver al Rey.","Wait for your audience with Théoden","Witness the will of Théoden","Talk to Háma in front of Meduseld","You stand before the seat of Théoden, King of Rohan, but it is his advisor Gríma that will decide your fate.","Instancia: La noche cae sobre Meduseld","You have come into Meduseld with Háma, seeking an audience with Théoden.","Gríma has called you forth to speak to him.","You have come before the seat of Théoden, King of Rohan.","Talk to Éomer in Meduseld","Your companions are outside Meduseld and have been asked to leave their weapons with Háma."}},
[7045]={nameES="Instancia: Ninguno salvo uno",objectivesES={"El bosque invade la parte trasera de la granja","Has llegado con Dinodas Boffin a los bosques brumosos que bordean Wistmead en busca del espíritu que perturba la Comarca.","Dinodas se encuentra dentro de la vieja granja de los Cleary.","Tú y Dinodas habéis encontrado una granja en ruinas en medio del bosque brumoso. ¿Serán estos los Acres siniestros de los que habló el espectro?","Dirígete a la sala principal de la granja","Dinodas está mirando la puerta del sótano en el lado oeste de la granja.","La puerta del sótano parece no estar cerrada con llave","Inspecciona la fachada de la granja","Inspecciona la parte trasera de la granja","Nadie descansa ahora en este porche lateral, si es que alguien lo hizo alguna vez","La Ira Furtiva se desata dentro de la vieja granja de los Cleary.","Instancia: Ninguno salvo uno","La puerta del lado oeste de la granja no está cerrada con llave y te llevará a ti y a Dinodas al sótano bajo la granja.","Hay algo muy peculiar en estas escaleras...","Habla con Dinodas junto a la puerta del sótano","Inspecciona el lado oeste de la granja","Has llegado con Dinodas a la granja embrujada de los Acres siniestros, y los dos debéis abriros camino por el sótano para descubrir sus secretos.","Abre la puerta del lado oeste de la granja y entra al sótano","Hay algo peculiar en estas escaleras","Bingo y sus primos han llegado a la sala principal de la vieja granja de los Cleary, dispuestos a mantenerse a tu lado contra el espíritu misterioso... ¿pero será suficiente para oponerse a la malicia de ese ser maléfico?","Habla con Dinodas entre los árboles brumosos","Bingo se encuentra dentro de la vieja granja de los Cleary.","Si el fantasma de Halson Cleary es realmente el responsable de las apariciones de Wistmead y la Maldición de los Acres siniestros, Bingo está seguro de que tú y su primo Dinodas podréis llegar al fondo del asunto.","Abre paso por la granja embrujada junto a Dinodas","Por fin has llegado a la sala principal de la granja embrujada.","Bingo te ha dado las únicas armas que podrían dañar a la Ira Furtiva: las cartas que Ivy Redsmith escribió a Halson Cleary hace tanto tiempo.","Ayuda a Dinodas a resistir el miedo que amenaza con abrumarlo","Permanece junto a Bingo mientras confronta al espíritu misterioso","Has llegado a la sala principal de la vieja granja de los Cleary con Dinodas Boffin, y no debes ceder al miedo que amenaza con abrumar al joven hobbit.","La puerta está cerrada con llave y atrancada, y no puede abrirse desde este lado","Habla con Dinodas dentro de la vieja granja de los Cleary","Habla con Bingo en la granja embrujada","Inspecciona el lado este de la granja","Habla con Bingo dentro de la vieja granja de los Cleary","Enfrenta a la Ira Furtiva junto a Bingo y los demás Boffins"}},
[7046]={nameES="Instancia: Nada por nada",objectivesES={"<rgb=#FF0000>Do not be seen!</rgb>","<rgb=#FF0000>You were seen by Dolguzigir!</rgb>","Lhaereth has entered and is speaking to one who can only be the keeper of the Halls of Black Lore.\
\
You should listen to their conversation.","You have entered the Halls of Black Lore to uncover what Lhaereth seeks, but danger is near.","You have safely made it outside","You have entered the Halls of Black Lore.\
\
You should speak to Faeron.","Someone, or something, has created a diversion for you!\
\
You should escape the Halls of Black Lore!","Escape the Halls","You should follow Faeron and keep to the shadows.","Listen to the conversation","Instancia: Nada por nada","Talk to Faeron","Lhaereth bursts into the Halls!","You hear a sudden crash and a yelp!","<rgb=#FF0000>You were seen by Lhaereth!</rgb>","Follow Faeron"}},
[7047]={nameES="Instancia: El cuento de Nár",objectivesES={"Hersegg can be found at Azanulbizar.\
\
You should talk to Hersegg.","Hersegg can be found at Azanulbizar.\
\
You should listen to Hersegg as she recounts Nár's tale.","Hersegg has asked you to learn the fate of Thrór.\
\
You should listen to Hersegg as she recounts Nár's tale.","Follow along with Hersegg as she recounts Nár's tale","Instancia: El cuento de Nár","Hoping to aid King Thorin in guiding the Prince to victory, Hersegg, grand-daughter of Hermáth Stormhammer, has offered to tell you the tragic tale of Nár.","Talk to Hersegg","Learn the fate of Thrór and the name of his murderer"}},
[7048]={nameES="Instancia: Núrzum",objectivesES={"Talk to Horn in Byre Tor","Stay close to Horn and survive your encounter with Núrzum","You have come with Horn to the eastern gate of Byre Tor, and the cold winds begin to rise.","You have escaped the centre of Byre Tor, but Nona is still in danger! Horn is at a loss, and does not know what he can do to help her.","Nona is in danger, but you can do nothing without putting the rest of you at risk! You must stay close to Horn and Corudan!","Corudan became separated from Nona when Orcs attacked, and now she is by herself somewhere in Byre Tor, with Núrzum stalking through the streets.","Núrzum has returned to Byre Tor! Stay close to Horn, and out of the sight of the giant!","Horn has retreated to the stables of Byre Tor, while Núrzum continues his destructive march through the city.","Nona has given Núrzum the slip, much to your relief and that of your companions... especially Horn.","Horn is by the side of a building in Byre Tor. He is desperate to think of some way to keep Núrzum from finding Nona.","Horn is hiding behind a barricade in Byre Tor, as Núrzum encroaches upon his position.","Horn is by the stables in Byre Tor, trying to come up with a way to keep Núrzum from finding Nona.","You and Horn have found Corudan in Byre Tor, but the Elf and the Dunlending were separated by attacking Orcs and now Nona is missing.","You have been spotted by Núrzum!","Talk to Corudan in Byre Tor","You have come with Horn, Corudan, and Nona to the city of Byre Tor.","Reassure Horn that all will be well","Stay close to Horn! Núrzum is moving through the streets of Byre Tor and you must not lose track of your companion!","You have come to Byre Tor with your companions to see what you can learn of Núrzum's seeming interest in the city.","Instancia: Núrzum","Talk to Nona in Byre Tor"}},
[7049]={nameES="Instancia: La ira de Núrzum",objectivesES={"Instancia: La ira de Núrzum","The Ents of the Balewood wish to impart their knowledge of Núrzum's assault into Wildermore upon you.","Leave Drû Vádokan and travel to the forest's edge","Talk to the strange tree, Duskleaf","The destruction that followed Duskleaf's defeat is known well to Ents and Men alike","The lands of Men lay to the east beyond the forest's edge.\
\
You have defeated the Ent, Duskleaf. You should now continue eastward and fulfil the bargain that you made with Saruman.","The forest's edge can be found outside the eastern gate of Drû Vádokan in north-western Balewood.\
\
You are standing inside Drû Vádokan, the White Hand's base in the Balewood. You must travel to the forest's edge and wreak havoc upon the Men of Wildermore.","You hear the familiar creaking of branches as more trees rise against you in the distance","Journey into Wildermore and defeat any that stand in your way","The forest's edge lies to the south-east in Whitshaws.\
\
The trees of the Balewood are enraged at your presence in the woods. You must defeat them if you are to seek your revenge on the Men of Wildermore.","Journey deeper into the forest","You have found your path blocked by a strange tree that looks as if it wishes to speak with you","You discover your path blocked by what appear to be angry trees. Clear them and continue your journey to the east!","Duskleaf is standing in northern Balewood.\
\
You have found your path blocked by a strange tree that is looking at you with a mix of anger and confusion. You should speak with this tree before continuing eastward.","The forest's edge lies to the south-east in Whitshaws.\
\
You have found yourself beset on all sides by denizens of the forest. You should continue travelling to the east, but be sure to defeat any that stand in your way."}},
[7050]={nameES="Instancia: El poder de Roblecorazón",objectivesES={"Instancia: El poder de Roblecorazón","Habla con Sara Roblecorazón","Sigue a Sara Roblecorazón más adentro de Barad Gúlaran.","Sigue a Sara Roblecorazón hasta el corazón de Barad Gúlaran.","Sara Roblecorazón te ha pedido que hables con ella y quiere que la sigas mientras te cuenta su historia."}},
[7051]={nameES="Instance: Odd Benefactors",objectivesES={}},
[7052]={nameES="Instance: Of Axe and Fire",objectivesES={}},
[7053]={nameES="Instancia: De sueños y deseos",objectivesES={"Tárasánë is in the Pristine Glade.\
\
You and Tárasánë appear to be in the Pristine Glade. You should speak to her and learn how this has come to be.","Instancia: De sueños y deseos","You have beheld a vision of Vethúg Wintermind, the cold-drake of the Ered Mithrin!","Visions of the Green Lady can be found within your dream of the Pristine Glade.\
\
The Green Lady has asked you to seek out the visions that have crept into your dream of the Pristine Glade.","You have beheld a vision of Karazgar, the Weeping Warrior!","You have beheld a vision of the Herald of Winter, Hrímil Frost-heart!","The Green Lady once dwelled in the heights of the Emyn-nu-Fuin, but that was long before the darkening of Mirkwood.","Talk to Tárasánë, the Green Lady","Tárasánë is in the Pristine Glade.\
\
Tárasánë stands before the Great Tree of the Pristine Glade. You have witnessed the three visions she bestowed upon you, and you should now speak to her once more."}},
[7054]={nameES="Instancia: Viejos amigos y nuevas noticias",objectivesES={"Gandalf is in Galadriel's garden, waiting to speak with you.","Haldir is in the woods of Lothlórien.","Talk to Galadriel and describe to her your dream","Talk to Haldir within Lothlórien","Galadriel is in her garden, waiting to speak with you.","Against all your hopes, Gandalf has returned!","Galadriel is waiting to speak with you in her gardens.","You have come to Lothlórien with Nona to learn the meaning behind your curious dreams.","Nona is in the gardens of Galadriel, and wants to speak with you.","Instancia: Viejos amigos y nuevas noticias","Talk to Nona in Galadriel's garden","Talk once more to Gandalf","Haldir is in the woods of Lothlórien, waiting to speak with you."}},
[7055]={nameES="Instancia: Sobre estas piedras",objectivesES={"Gísling has fallen!","Crúmgam stands outside the Mead Hall of Snowbourn. Fastred's vigour is renewed after the safety of his son was assured. Crúmgam must be defeated to return peace to Snowbourn.","Gísil has fallen!","Fastred is standing outside the Mead Hall of Snowbourn.\
\
Fastred has emerged from the Mead Hall. You should speak to him at once.","Defend Gísling","Gísil is in northern Snowbourn, and has asked you to follow him to the Mead Hall in hopes of meeting with Fastred.","Talk to Fastred","Gísling can be found in south-eastern Snowbourn.\
\
Winsig asks that you find and aid Gísling and the people of Snowbourn while she seeks out Fastred.","Talk to Winsig","Gísling asks that you seek his father, Gísil as soon as you are able","As the last Orc is felled, Gísling implores you to seek his father near the north gate","Winsig has gone to find Fastred. You should aid the people of Snowbourn in repelling the Orc assault.","Gísil is said to be near the north gate of Snowbourn.\
\
Gísling has moved to aid the people of Snowbourn and asks that you seek the aid of his father and Fastred.","Confront Crúmgam","Gísil is standing at the north gate of Snowbourn.\
\
Gísil and his men were struck by a vicious assult of Orcs. Gísil is wounded, but seeks to locate Fastred.","Winsig has fallen!","Gísil sets off towards the Mead Hall","Fastred now seeks to exact his revenge on his son's abductor.","Fight your way to the north gate of Snowbourn","Find and talk to Gísling","Defeat Crúmgam","Fastred is standing in central Snowbourn.\
\
Crúmgam has been defeated and the Orc force is broken. Fastred, his Thanes, and his people are safe for the moment.","Fastred has fallen!","Defend Winsig as she enters Snowbourn","Gísling can be found in eastern Snowbourn. He is overwhelmed defending the city from the siege and requires your aid.","Fight your way to the Mead Hall of Snowbourn","Instancia: Sobre estas piedras","Having defeated the Orcs and providing Winsig safe passage, you should seek out Gísling","As Fastred speaks the sky darkens, and a wave of dread passes over you","Crúmgam produces a shredded piece of Folcred's clothing and Fastred is overcome","Winsig is standing outside the east gate of Snowbourn.\
\
Winsig has ridden with you to Snowbourn in hopes of fending off an Orc assault on the town. It seems you are already too late!","The Orcs defeated, Gísil stands wounded among his fallen men","Talk to Gísil","Winsig seeks your aid in fighting to repel the vicious assault of Crúmgam on Snowbourn.","As you approach the Mead Hall, Fastred emerges, his face contorted in rage","<rgb=#FF0000>Fastred, Gísil, Gísling, and Winsig must survive</rgb>","Defeat Crúmgam's forces","As the sky darkens, a familiar figure appears in Snowbourn. You should confront this man, and put and end to his villainy."}},
[7056]={nameES="Instancia: En un campo de rojo",objectivesES={"Stand against the forces of evil","Defeat Crúmgam and his allies","Habla con Calenglad","Talk to Horn and fight alongside him","Habla con Aragorn","Crúmgam has been defeated!","Crúmgam has been defeated, but not without sacrifice.","Stand with Aragorn as he confronts Gothmog","You break free of Crúmgam's evil!","Instancia: En un campo de rojo","Gothmog has fled the battlefield, leaving Aragorn and the Grey Company to mourn the slain he leaves behind.","The forces of Mordor prepare for a final attack on the fields of the Pelennor.","You have found Aragorn and the Grey Company on the battlefield as they prepare to confront Gothmog.","You have become held by a powerful and evil force, unable to move!","Talk to Horn on the battlefield","You have fought alongside Horn, but the horrors of battle are taxing his courage.","Crúmgam must pay for his crimes against the Free Peoples of Middle-earth.","You have found Horn in the midst of battle, but the bloodshed is taking its toll on him."}},
[7057]={nameES="Instancia: Queda una esperanza",objectivesES={"Viaja con Narmeleth para derrotar a Mordirith.","Habla con Narmeleth.\
\
Con las últimas fuerzas, Narmeleth clavó la espada rota en el pecho de Mordirith. Su cuerpo deformado yace cerca del cuerpo colapsado de Narmeleth.","Instancia: Queda una esperanza","Protege a Narmeleth","Has fallado en proteger a Narmeleth","Viaja con Narmeleth para derrotar a Mordirith y Mordrambor.","Sigue a Narmeleth","Su vida se ha gastado derrotando a Mordirith, el cuerpo sin vida de Narmeleth yace ante ti. Su rostro, una vez marcado por la culpa y la tristeza, ahora está en paz.\
\
Deberías regresar a Gath Forthnír para contarles todo lo que ha sucedido.'","Habla con Narmeleth","Derrota a Mordrambor","La última esperanza para derrotar a Mordirith, el Falso Rey de Angmar, es un asalto final contra él en su fortaleza de Gador Gularan."}},
[7058]={nameES="Instancia: Solo medio recordado",objectivesES={"You have earned the trust of Gultháva, the Maiden of the Gladden, and she has brought you into Kidzul-kâlah with the hope that you will be a comfort to her friend.","Instancia: Solo medio recordado","Visitors unlooked-for have come to Kidzul-kâlah!","Gultháva has released the enchantment that sealed the chamber in which her friend resides, deep within Kidzul-kâlah.","Talk to Gultháva in her secret grotto","A sensation of peaceful slumber fills the grotto","Gultháva's friend has been revealed to be the shade of Isildur, long kept imprisoned in a secret grotto behind Kidzul-kâlah.","Lead Gandalf and the Elves to Gultháva's friend","Gandalf, Elrond, and Glorfindel have entered Kidzul-kâlah and wants you to lead them to Gultháva's friend.","Talk to Gultháva, the Maiden of the Gladden","Smooth paths of crushed stones climb to a rocky platform in the centre of the odd chamber.","Talk to Elrond in the torrential passage","A piercing scream shattered the stillness! Has something happened to Gultháva?","The shade is reminiscent of Vágari, but possesses none of the Wanderer's dread","Gandalf the Wizard and the Elf-lords Elrond and Glorfindel have come to the flooded passages of Kidzul-kâlah.","The Maiden of the Gladden is inside Kidzul-kâlah.","Climb one of the paths up to the centre of the grotto","Make your way through the torrential passage to the chamber where Gultháva keeps her friend","Hurry back down the torrential passage and find Gultháva","Talk to Gultháva's friend","Remain alert in the secret grotto","In appearance, Gultháva's friend puts you in mind of Vágari the Wanderer, but whereas that shade filled you with a sense of dread, this one does not.","Talk to the shade of Isildur in Gultháva's secret grotto","Gultháva mourns the disappearance of her friend, the shade she held captive for so long."}},
[7059]={nameES="'Instancia: Othrongroth",objectivesES={"Habla con el señor de los túmulos","La entrada a Othrongroth está cerca, al oeste.\
\
Tom Bombadil te llevó a salvo a la entrada de Othrongroth, el Gran Túmulo, en las Quebradas de los Túmulos. Tu búsqueda del Rey Brujo te llevará al interior del túmulo.","El Rey Brujo y el enano Skorgrím han entrado en Othrongroth. Deberías seguirlos al interior del túmulo y buscarlos allí.","Ve a la entrada del Gran Túmulo, Othrongroth","Tom Bombadil te ha traído al túmulo llamado Othrongroth. Un sirviente del Nazgûl, Andraste, dijo que el Señor de los Nazgûl se encontraría aquí.","Gracias a la llegada de Tom Bombadil, el señor de los túmulos ha sido derrotado. Tom espera para hablar contigo.","Sigue al Rey Brujo","Tu camino a través del Gran Túmulo te llevó al Jinete Negro, quien notó tu presencia y llamó a los Muertos para atacarte. ¡Derrota a estas criaturas y continúa a través de Othrongroth!","Tu persecución del Rey Brujo te ha conducido a una habitación con un tumulario sentado en un gran trono. La criatura te dio la bienvenida y dijo que si querías una audiencia, podías acercarte.","Persigue al Rey Brujo"}},
[7060]={nameES="Instancia: Supera al viento, supera a las olas",objectivesES={"Much depends upon your haste! You must reach Umbar Baharbêl!","Race westward along the road to Umbar Baharbêl","Khashig has called for you to stop and explain your haste.","Race to Umbar Baharbêl before it is too late!","The cannons fall silent behind you as you outpace your enemies... but Umbar remains far distant","Khashig leaps from his guard-post and calls for you to stop","Instancia: Supera al viento, supera a las olas","Warn Khashig of the approaching danger"}},
[7061]={nameES="Instancia: Pintando el cuadro",objectivesES={"Move through the twisting passage and Gandalf will tell you what he knows of Magoldir","Gandalf stands within the Halls of Memory woven by the words of Vóin the Zhélruka, long ago.","Instancia: Pintando el cuadro","Gandalf's study of the Black Book of Mordor has raised as many questions as it has answered.","Gandalf informed you, regretfully, that this branch of his study has come to naught. Instead, the Wizard desires for you to return to the entrance of the Halls of Memory, there to follow a different avenue of inquiry.","Gandalf has found the place he sought in the Black Book, and is ready to speak to you of Vóin's journey in Mordor.","Listen to Gandalf's thoughts concerning Vóin's encounter with Magoldir","Vóin adventured in the Grey Mountains in search of lost Thafar-gathol","Gandalf has found the place he sought in the Black Book, and is ready to speak to you of Vóin's journey in the Grey Mountains.","Vóin wrote of a journey he took in search of Thafar-gathol in the company of King Thráin I, who led the Longbeards prior to the founding of Erebor beneath the Lonely Mountain. Further information about this journey lies ahead, beyond the unformed passage that joins the several Halls of Memory.","Gandalf desires to speak to you concerning what he has learned from his study of the Black Book of Mordor.","The fog dissipates, revealing further avenues of knowledge","Gandalf has told you that the name Magoldir does not appear only within the pages of the Black Book of Mordor, and he desires to tell you what else he knows of the Elf.","Listen to Gandalf's description of Vóin's account","Many questions remain","Talk to Gandalf in the Grey Mountains, as depicted by the Halls of Memory","Gandalf has told you that despite failing to find Thafar-gathol, Vóin found something of interest in the Grey Mountains, and he has asked you to consider what it might have been.","Gandalf speaks to you of the Halls of Memory, a representation of the contents of the Black Book of Mordor given shape by his words and those of the dwarf Vóin.","Listen to the musings of Gandalf","Consider the obscured figures in Mordor, as depicted by the Halls of Memory","Consider the obscured figures in the Grey Mountains, as depicted by the Halls of Memory","Something befell Vóin among the rocky crags of Mordor, but his account remains vague, the details obscured.\
\
Gandalf has asked you to consider the cryptic figures he has found in Vóin's account of his journey in Mordor.","Move through the twisting passage until you reach another of the Halls of Memory","Return to the entrance of the Halls of Memory, there to pursue a different avenue of inquiry","Gandalf waits at the entrance to the Halls of Memory, prepared to follow a different avenue of inquiry.","While adventuring in the Grey Mountains, Vóin encountered an Elf named Magoldir, who claimed to oppose evil in all of its forms. According to the Wizard, the name \\qMagoldir\\q occurs frequently among the pages of the Black Book of Mordor.","Talk to Gandalf in Mordor, as depicted by the Halls of Memory","Talk to Gandalf in the Halls of Memory","Vóin wrote of a journey he took to a \\qcold, hard land,\\q where great evil dwelt. Further information about this journey lies ahead, beyond the unformed passage that joins the several Halls of Memory.","It was to Mordor that Vóin ventured... but when did he go, and why?","Gandalf is speaking to you of Vóin's journey in Mordor, where he apparently obtained the Black Book, but the Wizard remains confused about a number of obscured events in the Zhélruka's account."}},
[7062]={nameES="Instance: Passage into Dunland",objectivesES={}},
[7063]={nameES="Instance: Passage of the Marshes",objectivesES={"Frodo has slowed his pace. The Dead Marshes are taking their toll on him.","Continue the passage of the marshes","Gollum has bounded back to you. Your master is right: the creature has not guided you wrong... yet.\
\
You still do not trust him.","Talk to Gollum, if he can bring himself to speak","Frodo looks very tired. The journey through the swamp is taking its toll.","Gollum is terrified, and is in no shape to go on. The frightening encounter with the terrible shadow has shaken him tremendously.","This will be a good place to sit next to Frodo and keep watch","Remain awake and alert, Sam!","A terrible shadow approaches from high above the Dead Marshes!","You do not like what you overheard Gollum muttering to himself, if you did not imagine it.","How has Frodo fared?","A cold chill runs down your spine!","Make your way, carefully, through the swamp <rgb=#00FF00>(press 'Insert' to toggle your more careful walk)</rgb>","Instance: Passage of the Marshes","Hide!","You and Frodo inch closer and closer to Mordor, but you do not trust the guide that has brought you into the Dead Marshes: the creature Gollum.","Comfort Frodo and decide what to do","You have to go on, even if the Dead Marshes seem to go on forever.","Talk to Gollum, and let him know how things stand","Try and stay awake, Sam!","Talk to Mister Frodo in the Dead Marshes","Frodo blinks at you for a moment and slowly rouses from his slumber.\
\
'I suppose it is time to set out again? I am ready to be out of this wretched swamp, and the only way for it is to get moving again, I suppose. I am very tired, Sam.'","Sit next to Frodo and stay alert for any dangers while he rests","Talk to Gollum and keep a watchful eye on the wretch","Talk to Frodo and make sure he is feeling all right","The journey through the swamp has proven to be very difficult, with no end in sight.","Gollum has bounded ahead through the swamps, showing you and Frodo the way.","Frodo has wandered off by himself! You have to find him!","Talk to Mister Frodo","Stay close to Gollum, and make sure he does not try anything","You hate to do it, but it is time to wake Frodo and set out once again.","Talk to Frodo and make sure he is all right","Find out what Gollum is up to, the villain!","Frodo has decided to catch some sleep, and wants you to sit next to him.","You sit next to Frodo and resolve to stay awake and alert","You are sure Gollum will try something at some point during the passage of the marshes. Stay close to him and make sure the wretch has no opportunity to cause trouble!"}},
[7064]={nameES="Instancia: Peregrinación a Sundergrót",objectivesES={"Talk to Durin by the overlook in the ruins atop High Sundergrót","Wait with your companions while they discuss your find and the history of High Sundergrót","Hill-beasts and bats haunt the upper reaches of the ruins perched atop High Sundergrót.\
\
You should clear the path of these dangers to make the way safe for Durin and your companions.","Instancia: Peregrinación a Sundergrót","Your companions have rested from their climb and now look around the snowy heights of High Sundergrót.","Prince Durin has come to High Sundergrót and waits to speak with you.","The forlorn wind whistles among the crags, but nothing else moves","Examine the broken dwarf-blade lying near the overlook on the upper level","Talk to Durin at High Sundergrót","Search the drift of snow to the north, where a glint of metal has caught your eye","Continue north-east and climb the fallen pillar lying over the stairs to reach the upper level of the ruins in High Sundergrót","Listen to the words of Durin by the overlook in High Sundergrót","Durin and your companions have safely arrived on the upper level of the ruins perched atop High Sundergrót.","You hear growling sounds and fluttering wings in the upper reaches of the ruins","Accompany Durin on the northward road to war","The climb to High Sundergrót has left Glóin quite exhausted, and he wishes to speak with you before you proceed.","Continue climbing northward among the crags of High Sundergrót","Long ago and high above Sundergrót, the Greymaul Rebellion came to an end. It is now a place of great import for Durin's Folk, and Longbeards have been known to visit the high crags for contemplation and reflection.","Durin has asked you to continue your climb to the upper levels of High Sundergrót, among the ruins to the north-east. A sloping pillar lies across the broken stairs that will help you gain access to the upper levels.","A broken dwarf-blade catches your eye by the overlook on the upper level of the ruins perched atop High Sundergrót.","Clear beasts and bats from the ruins in the upper reaches of High Sundergrót","Glóin suggested that you continue your northward climb among the crags of High Sundergrót.","Durin is ready to turn once more for the north, and to war.","The drift covers an ancient helmet of dwarf-make, shattered long ago","This blade is of such ancient make that it must have been broken long ago","Talk to Glóin among the crags of High Sundergrót"}},
[7065]={nameES="Instancia: Luchador de foso",objectivesES={"Defeat the third opponent","Enter the combat area","Defeat the first opponent.","Enter the combat area.","You forfeit the challenge!","Defeat the second opponent","A new pit-fighting tournament has begun and you have been asked to participate.","Defeat the first opponent","Defeat the third opponent.","Instancia: Luchador de foso","Opponent defeated!","<rgb=#FF0000>Do not leave the combat area!</rgb>","Defeat the second opponent."}},
[7066]={nameES="Instancia: Planes de la Hueste Dorada",objectivesES={"Habla con Raddir","Habla con Bróin","Braiglinn te ha traído para conocer a algunos de los Elfos con los que lucharás durante el viaje de la Hueste Dorada a través del Bosque Negro: Raddir, Sigileth y Achardor.","La Guardia Oculta, el grupo de Elfos encargado de llevar a Mazog en secreto a Dol Guldur, se está preparando para cruzar el Anduin, después de lo cual se encontrarán con los enanos que transportan al líder de los Orcos.","Habla con Sigileth","Los Elfos y los enanos están discutiendo los planes relacionados con Mazog.","Habla con Achardor","Braiglinn te espera para hablar contigo en Imlad Lalaith.","Escucha la discusión sobre el plan relacionado con Mazog","Bróin ha pedido hablar contigo.","Habla con Issuriel","Has cruzado el río con la compañía de Elfos encargados de llevar a Mazog a Dol Guldur, y Raddir ahora te espera para hablar contigo.","Cairches te espera para transportarte a través del Anduin con la compañía de Elfos encargados de llevar a Mazog a Dol Guldur.","Habla con Cúcheron","Habla con Braiglinn","Braiglinn te espera para llevarte a conocer a más de los Elfos que componen la Guardia Oculta.","Braiglinn te ha traído para conocer a dos Elfos más con los que lucharás durante el viaje a Dol Guldur: Cúcheron e Issuriel.","Instancia: Planes de la Hueste Dorada","Habla con Cairches"}},
[7067]={nameES="Instancia: Prisionera de los Pueblos Libres",objectivesES={"Algunos Angmarim han regresado a los alrededores de Delossad para registrar las ruinas.\
\
Muildir te ha informado de los Angmarim que merodean afuera y quiere que los derrotes antes de entrar.","Examina los objetos inusuales dentro de Delossad","Muildir se oculta cerca de la entrada de Delossad.\
\
Has derrotado a los Angmarim que volvieron a Delossad y ahora deberías regresar con él.","Te has encontrado con Mordrambor en las profundidades de Delossad, y te ha encerrado en una de las celdas donde Amarthiel fue prisionera.\
\
Muildir ha venido en tu ayuda y te liberará de la celda.","Muildir se oculta cerca de la entrada de Delossad.\
\
Está esperando hablar contigo antes de que investigues las ruinas de Delossad.","Habla con Muildir","Instancia: Prisionera de los Pueblos Libres","El interior de Delossad, conocido como Sithad en días olvidados, es oscuro y lúgubre. Sus muros han visto gran dolor, y un aire pesado lo envuelve todo.\
\
Estás buscando en la penumbra de Delossad pistas sobre el misterio del anillo de Amarthiel, Narchuil.","Has viajado con Muildir a las ruinas de Delossad para buscar respuestas sobre el pasado de Narchuil."}},
[7068]={nameES="Instancia: Probando su valentía",objectivesES={}},
[7069]={nameES="Instancia: Persiguiendo a Bârshud, Parte 1",objectivesES={}},
[7070]={nameES="Instancia: Persiguiendo a Bârshud, Parte 2",objectivesES={"Speak with Mizâdi once more inside the tent.","Listen to the conversation between Mizâdi, Numûru, and Khónyo Bóro.","Place the bowl of food in front of Khónyo Bóro.","Speak with Mizâdi once more inside the tent","Speak with Mizâdi inside Mizâdi's tent","Speak with Numûru inside Mizâdi's tent.","Speak with Mizâdi inside the tent","Place the bowl of food in front of Khónyo Bóro","Listen to the conversation between Mizâdi, Numûru, and Khónyo Bóro","Speak with Khónyo Bóro inside Mizâdi's tent in Ingar-garâsh","Shâra Mizâdi has requested your presence in the interrogation of Khónyo Bóro in her tent in Ingar-garâsh.","Speak with Numûru inside Mizâdi's tent","Pick up the bowl of food from the table inside Mizâdi's tent","Speak with Mizâdi inside the tent.","Speak with Mizâdi inside Mizâdi's tent.","Instancia: Persiguiendo a Bârshud, Parte 2","Speak with Khónyo Bóro inside Mizâdi's tent in Ingar-garâsh.","Grab the bowl of food from the table inside Mizâdi's tent."}},
[7071]={nameES="Instancia: Reina de Reinas",objectivesES={"Instancia: Reina de Reinas","Defeat the Queen of Queens and her brood","Defeat all insects at the nest to draw forth the queen.","You have disturbed the insect-nest, producing unexpected results.","You prod at the nest, but nothing happens.","Defeated the Queen of Queens and her brood"}},
[7072]={nameES="Instancia: Furia del Erui",objectivesES={"Roamingstar is at the Crossings of the Erui.\
\
You have defeated the armoured wights and Roamingstar has arrived, filling you with hope. You should listen as she confronts her Sister.","Defeat the summoned armoured wights","Listen to the Lone Lady","More armoured wights rise from the shallows of the Erui!","The Sisters of Lebennin seek to calm their Sister's fury before it consumes both the Enemy and the people of Gondor alike.","The Armour of the Usurper falls broken into the shallows of the Erui!","The Five Sisters are gathered at the Crossings of Erui.\
\
You have defeated the Lone Lady and broken her madness. You should watch as her Sisters speak to her.","Instancia: Furia del Erui","As the armoured wights sink back into the Erui, Roamingstar appears!","The Lone Lady is at the Crossings of Erui.\
\
You have defeated many of the Lone Lady's armoured wights and should now listen as she speaks.","The Lone Lady can be found at the Crossings of Erui.\
\
You have arrived at the Crossings of Erui and should now try to speak to the Lone Lady.","Defeat the Lone Lady's risen armoured wights","The Lone Lady's armoured wights can be found at the Crossings of Erui.\
\
The Lone Lady has withdrawn in her anger and has summoned more armoured wights to drive you from the Erui. You must stand fast!","Observe the meeting of the Five Sisters","Defeat the Armour of the Usurper","The Armour of the Usurper is at the Crossings of Erui.\
\
The Lone Lady has taken control of Castamir's long-lost armour and now wields it in her final assault against your and her Sisters. You must defeat the Lone Lady.","The Lone Lady's armoured wights can be found at the Crossings of Erui.\
\
The Lone Lady has summoned wights of the Kin-strife to push you from her waters. You must defeat them!","Talk to the Lone Lady","Castamir's armour comes to life!","The last of the risen armoured wights sinks back into the Erui...","Listen as Roamingstar confronts the Lone Lady","The Lone Lady is at the Crossings of Erui.\
\
You have calmed the anger of the Lone Lady and should now speak to her."}},
[7073]={nameES="Instancia: Incursores en Tûm Rost",objectivesES={"King Elessar has brought his soldiers to bear against the Corsair raiders that threaten Iáphel.","A young boy emerges from the hiding-place: Orgolas of Anfalas!","Talk to Orgolas","A Corsair leaps from his hiding-place and attacks!","Talk to Rossaran among the northern buildings of Iáphel","Talk to King Elessar by the shore","Talk to King Elessar outside Iáphel","Talk to Gimli in the main square of Iáphel","Gimli remained in the main square of Iáphel to root Corsair raiders from out of hiding.","Search for Corsairs hiding behind the northern buildings of Iáphel.","Instancia: Incursores en Tûm Rost","You defeated another of the hiding Corsairs","Search along the shoreline for any sign of hidden Corsairs","You should listen to Orgolas's story.","Rossaran is waiting to hear your report among the northern buildings of Iáphel.","What has brought Orgolas to this place? He was supposed to remain in Ost Arndír!","Gwindir, the vintner of Iáphel, sits in a widening red pool and stares at you with glassy eyes, his clothes red-stained. You ask if he is injured, and he shakes his head.\
\
'This is not blood,' he says. 'It is worse! My finest bottles were smashed beyond repair and their contents drained! I pray the King still has the bottles we gifted to him. They are irreplaceable now.'\
\
Gwindir falls silent.","King Elessar has asked you to search along the shoreline for sign of Corsairs that did not take to their boats.","Talk to the Swan-knight Rossaran in Iáphel","Corsairs have raided the grassy hills and fields of Tûm Rost, threatening the village and vineyards of Iáphel with destruction.","This potential hiding-place is free of hidden Corsairs","King Elessar wears a thoughtful expression as he waits for you to speak to him.","Listen to Orgolas explain what befell Thorongil","King Elessar has asked you to go with the Swan-knight Rossaran to drive the Corsairs from northern Iáphel.","You and Gimli have caught up with King Elessar by the shore, down the hill from Iáphel.","Talk to Orgolas outside his hiding-place"}},
[7074]={nameES="Instance: Raphûz's Challenge",objectivesES={}},
[7075]={nameES="Instancia: Represalia Rápida",objectivesES={}},
[7076]={nameES="Instancia: Reino de la Vieja Madre",objectivesES={"Help construct a barricade.","The spiders have left to regroup","Help construct the final barricades.","Defend the workers from the spiders.","Talk to Oroniel","All is still quiet below","Thranduil has a plan to besiege Iphantemel's den in Torech Emel.","Defend the workers from the attacking spiders.","The movement in the gorge below has quieted","The barricade is constructed","Help construct another barricade.","Help construct a barricade","Talk to Thranduil","Instancia: Reino de la Vieja Madre","Defend the workers from the spiders","Defeat the attacking spiders","Spiders approach!","You should talk to Oroniel.","Talk to Thranduil.","Help construct another barricade","More spiders approach!"}},
[7077]={nameES="Instancia: El Paso Rojo",objectivesES={"Sigue a Radagast más adentro de Agamaur","Dannasen se encuentra en el campamento de los Eglain, al sur del trono de Neven, el comandante de las sombras.\
\
Antes de ser convocado por Ivar para contener a las sombras, Neven era un tumulario. Ahora que lo has derrotado, Dannasen puede que esté dispuesto a ayudarte.","Instancia: El Paso Rojo","Has viajado con Radagast hasta el pantano corrupto de Agamaur. Ayúdalo a llegar al campamento de los Eglain, al oeste.","Habla con Elsa para saber más sobre sus batallas en Agamaur.\
\
Gracias a Dannasen y sus hombres, el camino hacia el oeste en dirección a Agamaur se ha abierto, y has podido alcanzar a Elsa y Eriac.","Sigue a Radagast mientras se adentra en Agamaur.\
\
Dannasen, como animado por un nuevo aliento, ha llamado a sus hombres a luchar para abrir el camino hacia el oeste. Quizás ahora puedas alcanzar a Elsa y Eriac.","Habla con Dannasen","Habla con Radagast","El trono de Neven se encuentra más al norte, en las ruinas.\
\
Neven tiene cierta influencia sobre el capitán de las sombras, Dannasen. Quizás si hablas con él encuentres una forma de cambiar las órdenes de Dannasen.","Las ruinas del antiguo reino de Rhudaur, deformadas por el tiempo y el contacto con un mal oscuro, se extienden ante ti. Junto a Radagast el Pardo, debes encontrar a Elsa y Eriac y ayudarlos contra el Señor Demacrado, Ivar Manosangrienta, y sus sirvientes no muertos.","El líder de las sombras reside en el campamento aparentemente abandonado de los Eglain.\
\
La derrota de Raizamarga ha abierto el camino a las ruinas del oeste, donde viven las sombras de las que Radagast te habló. Deberías hablar con Dannasen, su líder, para obtener su ayuda.","La puerta de Garth Agarwen se encuentra al norte.\
\
Elsa te ha enviado a buscar a Ivar en Garth Agarwen para poner fin a su existencia.","Habla con Radagast para ver si quiere que hagas algo más.\
\
Radagast ha expulsado al Señor Demacrado Ivar de Agamaur y ha detenido sus horribles planes... por ahora."}},
[7078]={nameES="Instancia: Recordando a Thrymm",objectivesES={"Repe el asalto final","Speak with Edsig","Instancia: Recordando a Thrymm","The enemy attack has been broken, and Forlaw remains unscathed. However, that this many Orcs are marching on the roads of Wildermore is troubling.","The Orc army is approaching, and are coming up the road!","<rgb=#FF0000>Edsig was Defeated!</rgb>","<rgb=#FF0000>Gárferth is defeated!</rgb>","Edsig and Gárferth are prepared to defend the city of Forlaw, or die trying. They are encouraged by Thrymm's arrival, knowing that he could probably single-handedly defeat the attacking Orcs.","The Orcs marching on Forlaw are almost defeated, but the worst is yet to come. They are spurred on by two lumbering and brutal war-trolls.","The Orcs have arrived with a rather large raiding party. This attacking force is quite possibly the largest to ever march on the city of Forlaw.","<rgb=#FF0000>Edsig and Gárferth must stay alive</rgb>","Cyneberg tells you of the first attack on Forlaw by the White Hand. Not long ago, while Cyneberg was in Scylfig and before Thrymm left to join her, Thrymm and the twin sons of Gárwig courageously defended Forlaw from a large Orc attack.","Return to Edsig"}},
[7079]={nameES="Instancia: Recuerdo",objectivesES={"Coloca la piedra superior en el túmulo de Carchammadel","Coloca la piedra superior en el túmulo de Tadan","Has venido con Calenglad a Barad Rath para recordar a los Montaraces caídos durante la fuga de Mordrambor de Tinnudir.","Los Dúnedain esperan que coloques la piedra superior en el túmulo de Tadan.","Los Dúnedain esperan que coloques la piedra superior en el túmulo de Carchammadel.","Los Dúnedain han venido a Barad Rath para llorar la pérdida de algunos de sus miembros.","Instancia: Recuerdo","Coloca la piedra superior en el túmulo de Colhamnir","Calenglad está en la ladera cerca de Barad Rath.\
\
Los Dúnedain han venido a Barad Rath para recordar a sus caídos, y Calenglad espera caminar contigo hasta el lugar.","Los Dúnedain esperan que coloques la piedra superior en el túmulo de Colhamnir.","Escucha a Calenglad","Habla con Calenglad","Observa la construcción del túmulo","Toma tu lugar junto a Cuguminuial","Ala-Veloz trae un mensaje temido, aunque esperado: las tropas de Amarthiel han comenzado a cruzar la Puerta de Evendim en busca de Narchuil."}},
[7080]={nameES="Instance: Rescate a la luz de la luna",objectivesES={"Hablar con Avorthal","Instance: Rescate a la luz de la luna","Svanr, el ex-maestro del puerto de Kheledûl, te ha traído por un camino oculto hasta las puertas de la ciudad. Ahora depende de ti <rgb=#FF0000>colarte en Kheledûl y liberar a Avorthal</rgb>.","Has defendido a Avorthal con éxito","Avorthal está en la cubierta de la \\qPiedra de Ira,\\q todavía atracada en Kheledûl.\
\
El Capitán de la \\qPiedra de Ira\\q ha sido derrotado. Deberías hablar con Avorthal y hacer tu escape.","Encontrar a Avorthal","Avorthal está retenido en la \\qPiedra de Ira,\\q el barco atracado en la ciudad portuaria de Kheledûl.\
\
Si no lo liberas esta noche, la \\qPiedra de Ira\\q llevará a Avorthal lejos del rescate y condenará a Ered Luin a la guerra entre enanos y elfos."}},
[7081]={nameES="Instance: Respite in Shonith",objectivesES={}},
[7082]={nameES="Instance: Recupera la Cima de los Vientos",objectivesES={"Has derrotado a Muz, el cuidador de huargos","Habla con Candaith","En algún lugar por encima de ti, Candaith te espera para hablar contigo de nuevo.\
\
Has vencido a dos de los líderes de la tropa de guerra orca.","La expedición de los Uruk-haï yace en ruinas. Has ganado la batalla. Deberías hablar con Candaith.","Habla con Candaith en la cumbre de la Cima de los Vientos","Derrota a los sirvientes de Rigûl","Busca a los enemigos Bûb-hosh y Muz","Candaith desea hablar contigo","El Montaraz Candaith ha solicitado tu ayuda para eliminar la amenaza de los orcos de las Colinas de los Vientos. Candaith cree que la presencia de orcos del Sur en la cumbre de la Cima de los Vientos es un presagio de una invasión de Eriador.","Encuentra y derrota al líder Uruk-hai","Una pequeña tropa de Trasgos te ha recibido al pie de la Cima de los Vientos. Candaith te ha enviado por el camino de la izquierda, mientras él despeja el camino de la derecha, reuniéndose una vez más en la cima de la Cima de los Vientos.","Candaith te envió por una de las ramas del camino que sube a la Cima de los Vientos, mientras él tomaba la otra, en busca de los líderes de la tropa de guerra orca.","Instance: Recupera la Cima de los Vientos","Has derrotado a Olog-snaga","Derrota a Rigûl","Has encontrado al líder de la expedición de Saruman, el Uruk Rigûl. Debes vencer a Rigûl y a sus sirvientes para romper su voluntad y expulsarlos de las Colinas de los Vientos.","Has derrotado a Bûb-hosh","Has llegado al pie de la Cima de los Vientos y has descubierto que orcos del Sur han llegado a la cima. Candaith espera tu ayuda para expulsar a la tropa de guerra de las ruinas de Amon Sûl.","You have defeated Rigûl"}},
[7083]={nameES="Instance: Recupera la Cima de los Vientos",objectivesES={"Habla con Candaith","Habla con Candaith en la cima de la Cima de los Vientos","En algún lugar por encima de ti, Candaith te espera para hablar contigo de nuevo.\
\
Has vencido a dos de los líderes de la tropa de guerra orca.","La expedición de los Uruk-haï yace en ruinas. Has ganado la batalla. Deberías hablar con Candaith.","Busca a los enemigos Bûb-hosh y Muz","Derrota a los sirvientes de Rigûl","Candaith desea hablar contigo","Muz, el Guardián de Huargos, derrotado","Bûb-hosh derrotado","Rigûl derrotado","Derrota a Bûb-hosh","El Montaraz Candaith ha solicitado tu ayuda para eliminar la amenaza de los orcos de las Colinas de los Vientos. Candaith cree que la presencia de orcos del Sur en la cumbre de la Cima de los Vientos es un presagio de una invasión de Eriador.","Encuentra y derrota al líder Uruk-hai","Una pequeña tropa de Trasgos te ha recibido al pie de la Cima de los Vientos. Candaith te ha enviado por el camino de la izquierda, mientras él despeja el camino de la derecha, reuniéndose una vez más en la cima de la Cima de los Vientos.","Candaith te envió por una de las ramas del camino que sube a la Cima de los Vientos, mientras él tomaba la otra, en busca de los líderes de la tropa de guerra orca.","Instance: Recupera la Cima de los Vientos","Derrota a Rigûl","Has encontrado al líder de la expedición de Saruman, el Uruk Rigûl. Debes vencer a Rigûl y a sus sirvientes para romper su voluntad y expulsarlos de las Colinas de los Vientos.","Olog-snaga derrotado","Has llegado al pie de la Cima de los Vientos y has descubierto que orcos del Sur han llegado a la cima. Candaith espera tu ayuda para expulsar a la tropa de guerra de las ruinas de Amon Sûl.","Derrota a Muz, el Guardián de Huargos"}},
[7084]={nameES="Instancia: Volver a Ashâgir",objectivesES={"Corudan needs your help if he is to reach the chamber deep within Ashâgir where the last stockpile of Hungry Fire was hidden.","Rothog has fallen, and you have failed!","Talk to Corudan inside Ashâgir","Talk to Rothog inside Ashâgir","Corudan has devised a desperate plan, and he needs your help and the assistance of Rothog the Storm to carry it out.","Instancia: Volver a Ashâgir","Deep within Ashâgir, Rothog is ready to do his part."}},
[7085]={nameES="Instancia: Volver a Azanarukâr",objectivesES={"Una ola de temor te recorre mientras la reliquia es destruida, luego desaparece.","Has venido a Azanarukâr con Magor en busca de un artefacto dejado por Gorothúl en las profundidades.","Gwathnor derrotado","<rgb=#FF0000> No permitas que Gwathnor o sus aliados se acerquen a la salida </rgb>","Has encontrado la reliquia dentro de Azanarukâr, y deberías destruirla para evitar que se desarrollen más de los planes de Gorothúl.","Magor ha sido derrotado","Habla con Magor","Defiende a Magor","Derrota a Gwathnor","Instancia: Volver a Azanarukâr","<rgb=#FF0000> Una fuerza oscura ha escapado de la caverna </rgb>","Gwathnor ha despertado y debe ser derrotado para evitar que su poder crezca. \
\
<rgb=#FF0000>No permitas que Gwathnor ni ninguno de sus esbirros se acerquen a la puerta.</rgb>","Destruye la baliza de Gorothúl","Magor espera hablar contigo en las profundidades de Azanarukâr después de tu derrota de Gwathnor y las formas de Grawulun.","En las profundidades de Azanarukâr, Magor desea luchar a tu lado en busca del artefacto que cree que Gorothúl dejó allí."}},
[7086]={nameES="Instancia: Volver al Barrio Real",objectivesES={"You have collected as many tomes as you can carry.\
\
You should talk to Sorkamâl.","You see the bottom section of a broken statue near the royal bed","Defeat Dúrkhamos the Far-reaching","The statue you assembled exudes a fell aura.\
\
You should destroy the assembled Thardúth statue.","The stone is unnaturally cold to the touch","Defeated Dúrkhamos the Far-reaching","Destroy the Thardúth statue","You have collected the pieces of the artifact.\
\
You should assemble the artifact by placing the pieces on the bottom section.","Sorkamâl is curious to learn more about the broken artifact.\
\
You should collect the remaining artifact pieces.","You have found a strange broken statue near the Sai's bed.\
\
You should investigate the artifact piece.","Sorkamâl would like to check one more location before you leave.\
\
You should investigate the Sai's bed-chamber.","You have arrived in the royal living quarters.\
\
You should talk to Sorkamâl.","Sorkamâl fears valuable tomes may be destroyed in the fighting in Emax Dûl.\
\
You should collect historical tomes in the royal living quarters.","Talk to Sorkamâl","Destroyed the Thardúth statue","The completed artifact unleashes dark magic all around it!","Instancia: Volver al Barrio Real","The palace of Emax Dûl has fallen under the control of one of the Thardúth of Damudûr, Thothril the Entangler. Many important records and tomes are still stored in this historic Nêshakari fortress. We must recover them, before they are destroyed in the fighting!","Assemble the artifact","Investigate the artifact piece","An Ordâkhai sorcerer has appeared and threatens you!\
\
You should defeat Dúrkhamos the Far-reaching.","Investigate the Sai's bed-chamber"}},
[7087]={nameES="Instancia: La venganza del Gran Trasgo",objectivesES={"Talk to Skalla","The Great Goblin's forces are approaching, and will soon clash with those of the hobgoblin warlord.","Battle has been joined!","The battle has been won!\
\
You should talk to Langhár.","The Great Goblin's forces are approaching.\
\
You should talk to Skalla.","Witness the battle","Instancia: La venganza del Gran Trasgo","The Great Goblin's forces are approaching. The Warlord's host lies in wait. Battle will soon erupt. All we can do now is watch, and hope they fall upon each other's spears.","Habla con Langhár"}},
[7088]={nameES="Instance: Revolt in the Deeps",objectivesES={}},
[7089]={nameES="Instance: Ride Against the Goblins",objectivesES={"<rgb=#FF0000>Fríthild must survive</rgb>","Defeated the Warg-riders","<rgb=#FF0000>Fríthild was defeated</rgb>","Reeve Fríthild has chosen to take to the field against the Warg-riders at Baldmund's recommendation.","You should speak with Reeve Fríthild.","Defeat the Warg-riders","Defeat the Warg-riders terrorizing the eastern fields of the Broadacres.","Talk to Reeve Fríthild","Instance: Ride Against the Goblins","DNT -- Players will not see"}},
[7090]={nameES="Instancia: Reparando los males de Trum Dreng",objectivesES={"Guto has stormed off, and he and the Elder are at odds... but the Elder has seen the threat behind the words of Saruman","Talk to Elder Riagán","Follow Guto","The Elder looks like he wishes to speak with you.\
\
You should talk to Elder Riagán.","Instancia: Reparando los males de Trum Dreng","Guto is at his encampment.\
\
You should speak with Guto.","Notify Elder Riagán that Guto brings a guest","Make sure that the servant of Isengard keeps to his peaceful intentions","Guto and the servant of Isengard are just behind you.\
\
You should observe the meeting with the Elder and make sure that nothing goes awry.","Hear Guto's proposition","The Elder is in Lhan Tarren.\
\
You should notify Elder Riagán that Guto is arriving soon with the half-orc guest from Isengard.","Someone approaches...","You and Guto have discovered that the White Hand is behind the recent aggression by the Dragon-clan.","The Elder notes your mistrust of the soldiers of Isengard"}},
[7091]={nameES="Instance: Rise and Fall",objectivesES={"Clear the path of wights","Leave Lhan Gogledh as the Huntsman commanded.","Clear a path through the wights for Lhucu.","The path is now clear","You have accompanied Lhucu to the village of Lhan Gogledh to confront her father, Trehéarn Brenin.","Talk to Lhucu","Defeat Mostun","Talk to Lhucu.","Let Lhucu know that the path has been cleared below.","Banish the fell spirit Mostun from the mortal world.","Speak with Lhucu.","Defeated Trehéarn Brenin","Confront and defeat Trehéarn Brenin.","Instance: Rise and Fall","Withdraw through the main gate","Defeat Trehéarn Brenin","Defeated Mostun"}},
[7092]={nameES="Instance: Rise of the Fallen Son",objectivesES={"Cadelhin's tale has finished","Seek out the tomb of Cadelhin within the barrow and place the amulet thereon.","Talk to Cadelhin","Place the amulet on Cadelhin's tomb","You have defended Cadelhin","Protect Cadelhin from the shades that seek to do him harm.","Listen to Cadelhin's tale.","Instance:  Rise of the Fallen Son","Lhudd has asked you to explore the ancient barrow in an attempt to discover more about the shades that dwell still in the Lich Bluffs. He believes that the shade of Cadelhin may know how to break the curse that binds them.","Listen to Cadelhin's tale"}},
[7093]={nameES="Instance: Rohirrim Herald",objectivesES={"Defend the herald of the Rohirrim from his ambushers.","Hold out until reinforcements arrive.","The herald has fallen silent, his breath coming in a few last ragged gasps as his life fades.","Blow the Horn of the Rohirrim","Defeat the Dunlending attackers","Instance: Rohirrim Herald","Talk to the Rohirrim herald","The Rohirrim have come to your aid","With the battle over, the herald you strove to protect lies dying. You speak to him, hoping to bring his final words to his allies at the Ford of Isen.","Overwhelming numbers of wild men are approaching. Summon the Rohirrim to your aid.","Having quickly moved to rescue a herald of the Rohirrim from a Dunlending ambush, you have arrived only in time to desperately fend off the attackers.","You blow the Horn of the Rohirrim"}},
[7094]={nameES="Instancia: Raíz y podredumbre",objectivesES={"Marigold ha sugerido espiar a las criaturas arboréas.\
\
Si una de ellas se marcha, quizá sea posible detener juntas a las otras dos.","En busca de las extrañas criaturas arboréas que vio, Marigold te ha llevado a lo más profundo del Bosque Viejo.","Marigold ha desafiado a las criaturas arboréas.","Debes proteger a Marigold mientras te guía a través del bosque.","Espía a las criaturas arboréas","Habla con Marigold","Las criaturas arboréas han sido derrotadas.","Defiende a Marigold","Instancia: Raíz y podredumbre","Marigold ha encontrado a las criaturas arboréas.\
\
Deberías hablar con ella y elaborar un plan.","Marigold está esperando a que la alcances antes de internarse más en el Bosque Viejo.","<rgb=#FF0000>¡Marigold ha sido derrotada!</rgb>"}},
[7095]={nameES="Instancia: La furia de Rothog",objectivesES={"Rothog has summoned you to his chambers as he confronts Zarzíra Dawn-star about her misdeeds.","Talk to Rothog the Storm","Instancia: La furia de Rothog","Speak to Rothog","Defeat Zarzíra and her men","Rothog has summoned you to his chambers to confront Zarzíra Dawn-star about her misdeeds.","Defeat Zarzíra and her men as they attack you in the audience chamber.","Speak to Rothog the Storm about Zarzíra's treachery.","With Zarzíra vanquished, Rothog beckons to you"}},
[7096]={nameES="Instance: Rout the Supply Chain",objectivesES={}},
[7097]={nameES="Instancia: Ruinas de los Ancestros",objectivesES={"Talk to Gori on the bridge","Talk to Gori","Talk to Gori by the plaque","Gori has paused to speak with you before the next set of stairs.","Gori Stonesetter needs protection so that he might see for himself the ruins of the ancient buildings and bridges his ancestors helped build.","Gori continues his way through the ruins, too distracted to notice any imminent danger.","Gori is catching his breath after the battle and motions you over to talk with him.","Instancia: Ruinas de los Ancestros","Gori waits for you by the side of the River Kibil-nâla."}},
[7098]={nameES="Instancia: Corriendo hacia la nada",objectivesES={"Attempt to stand against Voskor and his force","The Orc roadway can be found to the west of the cave Húna discovered.\
\
Húna has reunited with Bebbe, but during their conversation the frantic screams of one of their fellows nearby has filled them with grave concern.","The Orc roadway stretches through much of Balewood.\
\
Sensing that the refugees may be nearby, you decide to search the barren roadway for any sign of Byre Tor refugees before more Orcs return.","Leodwald can be found laying on the roadway in Balewood.\
\
You should speak to Leodwald about his condition before confronting the Uruk captain a second time.","Húna has been slain!","A frantic yell coming from the Orc roadway pierces the air","A surly Uruk captain standing over a wounded refugee sees you approach","The cave can be found to the east of the Orc roadway.\
\
The Uruk captain has been brutally defeated by a raging Huorn. You should flee for safety while the Huorn pursues the wounded Uruk into the woods.","Search the roadway for sign of Byre Tor refugees","Húna is on the roadway in Balewood.\
\
The snarls of Orcs in the distance have cut short Húna's heroics, and you should speak to him to discern what action is to be taken.","You summon the courage to stand as the vicious Huorn beats back the Uruk captain","You are frozen in fear as the ground trembles - you must wait to see what unfolds.","The snarls of Orcs can be heard faintly in the distance...","The man's attackers can be found on the roadway.\
\
You have discovered a man of Byre Tor fleeing from vicious wood-trolls of Balewood.","Húna can be found outside the cave to the east of the roadway in Balewood.\
\
You have escaped certain defeat from a powerful Uruk captain and a vicious Huorn, and should now seek shelter with the other refugees in the nearby cave.","Húna can be found along the Orc roadway in Balewood.\
\
Having saved the man from certain doom, you should now speak to him to learn of his plight and the fates of the other refugees.","Talk to Húna","Húna is travelling along the Orc roadway in Balewood.\
\
You should aid Húna in seeking out his fellows in Balewood.","Léodwald has been slain!","The ground trembles as Voskor begins to speak","In the dark of Balewood, you have discovered a snow-covered pack, a sign that the refugees of Byre Tor may yet live.","Instancia: Corriendo hacia la nada","Follow Húna and Bebbe to the Orc roadway","Follow Húna deeper into Balewood","Approach the Uruk captain, Voskor","You have escaped Rottenheart and the Orcs!","The Orc attackers can be found on the roadway in Balewood.\
\
In response to your defiance, the Uruk captain has set his Orcs upon you. They must be defeated if the refugees are to escape the forest alive.","A muffled yell pierces the snowfall as a refugee runs into view","<rgb=#FF0000>The refugees of Byre Tor must survive</rgb>","Talk to Leodwald and confront Voskor","Húna is running north-east of the roadway in Balewood.\
\
Húna believes that his fellows might be found off the side of the road in Balewood. You should continue to follow and protect him.","Bébba has been slain!","The Uruk smirks before gesturing to you, Bébba, and Húna","The Uruk captain can be found along the roadway in Balewood.\
\
Húna's fellow, Leodwald, has been wounded and captured by a vile Uruk captain of Isengard. You should confront the Uruk before any more harm can come to the Rohirrim.","Talk to Húna and flee into the cave","Flee to the cave with the Byre Tor refugees"}},
[7099]={nameES="Instancia: Corriendo salvajemente",objectivesES={"Your joyous bellow echoes through the valley!","Deja que acontecimientos sigan su curso.","Talk to Runerik.","Approach the gathering in the woods.","<rgb=#FF0000>Roar</rgb> to the wilds!","Instancia: Corriendo salvajemente","Run wild!","Approach the gathering in the woods","A celebration is in order after the fall of Lumrog and Gúrbarash's cowardly flight.","Deja que acontecimientos sigan su curso","Talk to Runerik"}},
[7100]={nameES="Instancia: Saboteando a Kûr Anzar",objectivesES={"Move further into Kûr Anzar","Move to meet Numûru and Razâl outside the Angar Aragín, the tower of Kûr Anzar at the top of the city.","Speak with Numûru","Instancia: Saboteando a Kûr Anzar","Move closer to speak with Numûru and Razâl.","Listen to Numûru","Listen to Numûru and Razâl's conversation","Move further into Kûr Anzar.","Set fire to the barricades near the tower","Speak with Razâl outside Kûr Anzar.","Meet Numûru and Razâl outside the tower of Kûr Anzar","Sabotage the Barkhûshim forces in Kûr Anzar by taking grain sacks, destroying weapon stands and defeating Barkhûshim sentries.","Assist Razâl and Numûru on a mission into Kûr Anzar to weaken the Barkhûshim.","Speak with Numûru outside Kûr Anzar.","Listen to Numûru near Angar Aragín.","Listen to Numûru and Razâl's conversation.","Move closer to speak with Numûru and Razâl","Speak with Razâl","Set fire to the barricades near the tower.","Speak with Razâl near Angar Aragín, the tower of Kûr Anzar."}},
[7101]={nameES="Instance: Say the Words",objectivesES={"The second stone is yours!","Unlock the door","The time has come to speak the password to the Emissary.","The Emissary roars with delight!","The door is open!\
\
You should retrieve the second stone!","Speak the Words","The Emissary has asked you to speak the pass code in \\qthe King's chosen language\\q.\
\
You should speak the words to the Emissary.","Take the second stone","Talk to the Emissary","You have the key!\
\
You should unlock the door and retrieve the second stone!","Instance: Say the Words","You should talk to the Emissary in the Mountains of Shadow Chamber."}},
[7102]={nameES="Instancia: Cicatrices de batalla",objectivesES={"Shards of ice litter the ground, betraying a final, futile struggle by Vethúg Wintermind...","Talk to Dori in the Bitter Scar","Dori can be found in the Bitter Scar.\
\
You have discovered concerning evidence that Karazgar may have slain or taken Vethúg Wintermind from the Bitter Scar. You should leave at once with Dori and Company.","After learning that Vethúg Wintermind fell upon the foothills of Winterstith, Dori and Company have decided to seek the fallen cold-drake and discover some final proof of his demise.","Examine the signs of battle in the Bitter Scar","Dori, Glóin, and Bofur stand huddled near the end of the Bitter Scar...","Dori can be found in the Bitter Scar.\
\
You have travelled to the end of the Bitter Scar and rejoined Dori and Company, but there is no sign of the remains of Vethúg Wintermind.","Signs of battle can be found at the end of the Bitter Scar.\
\
You have come upon the aftermath of a struggle between Vethúg Wintermind and an unknown foe. You should examine the signs of battle to determine what has happened.","Ingór crosses his arms and waits for Dori's response...","Dori can be found in the Bitter Scar.\
\
You have discovered that a great struggle occurred between Karazgar and Vethúg Wintermind, and it seems Karazgar was the victor. You should speak to Dori at once.","Witness the meeting of the companies of Dori and Ingór","Dori can be found in the Bitter Scar.\
\
Ingór has revealed himself to be a Prince of the Zhélruka, and he has offered Dori and Company safe passage to Skarháld. You should speak to Dori and see if he wishes to accept.","Only Karazgar, the Weeping Warrior, could have left this behind...","Instancia: Cicatrices de batalla","Ingór, son of Vékun, has come to the Bitter Scar with a company of his own and appears eager to speak to Dori and Company.\
\
You should remain on guard and defend Dori and Company if the need arises.","Náth can be found at the Bitter Scar.\
\
You have travelled to the end of the Bitter Scar with Dori and Company, you now prepare to search for the remains of Vethúg Wintermind. You should speak to Náth.","A company of Zhélruka blocks the way!","Dori, Bofur, and Glóin have ventured into the Bitter Scar.\
\
You should follow Dori, Bofur, and Glóin into the Bitter Scar.","You are able to free a bloodied, black arrow from the frozen earth...","Talk to Dori","Deliver the black arrow to Dori","Find Dori, Glóin, and Bofur in the Bitter Scar","Talk to Náth","Leave the Bitter Scar with Dori and Company"}},
[7103]={nameES="Instancia: Scatha despierta",objectivesES={}},
[7104]={nameES="Instancia: El Legado de Scatha",objectivesES={"Talk to Fróthi.","The lore-master Fróthi wishes to examine what remains of the dragon-tooth necklace.","The vision fades and you realize your finger has come away from the dragon tooth","Experience the vision","Instancia: El Legado de Scatha","Talk to Fróthi","A vision comes over you, unbidden","Experience the vision.","Examine Scatha's tooth","Examine Scatha's tooth with Fróthi."}},
[7105]={nameES="Instancia: Amigos dispersos",objectivesES={"The hobbits are upon Treebeard's Hill.","Gandalf is at Treebeard's Hill in Fangorn.","The hobbits appear to have made a new friend","Observe the fate of the two hobbits","Gandalf believes you have the power to stir the sleeping shepherds of Fangorn","Gandalf wishes to speak with you atop Treebeard's Hill.","Habla con Gandalf","Listen to Gandalf","Instancia: Amigos dispersos","Gandalf is on Treebeard's Hill.","Gandalf wishes to speak with you."}},
[7106]={nameES="Instancia: Esquemas y desventuras",objectivesES={}},
[7107]={nameES="Instancia: Vástago del Invierno",objectivesES={"Defend Erebor from Vethúg Wintermind and his brood","King Thorin III Stonehelm can be found before the gates of Erebor.\
\
Vethúg Wintermind makes for Erebor, and King Thorin III Stonehelm has readied an army of dwarves and Elves to oppose him. You should speak to King Thorin when you are prepared to defend Erebor.","Struggle against the cold!","Defeat Vethúg Wintermind","Vethúg Wintermind has descended from the sky.\
\
Vethúg Wintermind is attacking Erebor. You should attempt to defeat him.","<rgb=#FF0000>King Thorin III Stonehelm must not be defeated</rgb>","Talk to King Thorin III Stonehelm","After spending countless years within Thikil-gundu, Vethúg Wintermind comes to wreak vengeance upon Durin's Folk.","Vethúg breathes frost upon you, and ice begins to encase you!","With a crash, Vethúg Wintermind lands before the gates of Erebor!","Follow King Thorin III Stonehelm","You should follow King Thorin III Stonehelm and remain alert at the gates of Erebor.","The cold has taken you.","King Thorin III Stonehelm can be found before the gates of Erebor.\
\
You were incapacitated during the battle against Vethúg Wintermind, but have awoken to find King Thorin III Stonehelm standing triumphantly above you.","King Thorin III pauses and beckons for you to come closer","<rgb=#FF0000>The King under the Mountain has been defeated!</rgb>","King Thorin III Stonehelm is making ready to defend Erebor.\
\
King Thorin III Stonehelm has spoken to the forces arrayed in defence of Erebor. You should now speak to King Thorin III Stonehelm.","Instancia: Vástago del Invierno","By some miracle you have survived, but what has happened?","Vethúg Wintermind's brood has descended upon Erebor.\
\
Vethúg Wintermind has come to Erebor. You should aid the dwarves of Erebor in defending against the attacks of Vethúg's brood."}},
[7108]={nameES="Instance: Searching for Hope",objectivesES={"Talk to Girhâzi","Instance: Searching for Hope","Khûldim Umûn has led you into a salt mine where he claims the Dubarâkh is hidden. You should follow Girhâzi and Khûldim.","Accompany Girhâzi and Khûldim","Listen to the conversation","Khûldim Umûn has informed Girhâzi that the Dubarâkh is inside an abandoned salt mine. You have been invited to join them as they search the caves for the lost library of Ambarûli culture and history.","Girhâzi must survive","Khûldim Umûn has led you into a salt mine where he claims the Dubarâkh is hidden. You should talk to Girhâzi."}},
[7109]={nameES="Instancia: Buscando en las profundidades",objectivesES={"Within Mâkhda Khorbo, Belondor has noticed that the gate previously blocking access to the stairs is now open. You should go up the stairs.","You have searched Mâkhda Khorbo and found the remains of a map, torn in half. You should talk to Belondor.","Talk to Belondor","You have failed to protect Belondor","At the end of a hallway in Mâkhda Khorbo you and Belondor have found a tapestry on the wall that is a map. You should examine the map.","This large map is an old and tattered tapestry. The right half of it has been cut and torn from what remains; and recently, by the looks of it. The lettering on it is written in a language with which you are unfamiliar.","You have arrived at the Iron Stairwell in Mâkhda Khorbo, where you and Belondor faced each other as enemies, and where his crew was slain by Azagath's dark magic. You should talk to Belondor.","Examine the map","You are in an area of Mâkhda Khorbo that Belondor says he saw Azagath and Nakási enter. You should search the area for signs of why they may have come here.","Belondor must survive","Belondor stops for a moment and looks around. He mutters something to himself, and you can see on his face that something just occurred to him.","Ascend the Iron Stairwell","You have followed Belondor into an upstairs area. You should talk to Belondor.","Instancia: Buscando en las profundidades","Belondor has asked you to accompany him as he returns to Mâkhda Khorbo in search of clues that may explain why Azagath and Nakási went there, as well as where they are going.","You spot something at the end of this hall","You have found a map","Examine the item","As you enter this upstairs area, you discover that it is infested with bats. You should defeat bats.","You and Belondor have spotted something at the end of this hallway. You should investigate what it is.","Continue searching the area","You have arrived at the Iron Stairway in Mâkhda Khorbo, where you and Belondor faced each other as enemies, and where his crew was slain by Azagath's dark magic. You should talk to Belondor."}},
[7110]={nameES="Instancia: Caminos Secretos",objectivesES={"Gimli is not sure what to make of Lheu Brenin.","Gimli must not be defeated","The child of the Westfold has tried to get your attention.","Lheu Brenin has been defeated, and the people who shelter in the Glittering Caves are now safe from the Falcon Clan.","Survive the assault of the Falcon Clan warriors","Defeat Lheu Brenin","Lheu Brenin is ready to fight, and has no fear of you or Gimli.","Talk to the Rohirrim child","Lheu Brenin, leader of the Falcon Clan, has finally paid for his crimes","Learn what evil has entered the Glittering Caves","Lheu Brenin has vast reserves of strength, and wishes to see you dead. You have to weaken him through battle!","Instancia: Caminos Secretos","Talk to Lheu Brenin","Lheu Brenin has come to the end of his strength, and has paid for his crimes.","Some villainy has come to the Glittering Caves of Aglarond.","Lheu Brenin and other members of the Falcon Clan have come to the Glittering Caves.","Gimli has fallen!","You have encountered a small child in the Glittering Caves.","Talk to Gimli in the Glittering Caves","The small girl waves off your inquiry, dismissing your questions with a toss of her hair.\
\
'There is no time to talk! My mother is with the other folk of Westfold, hiding in the cave, but I heard something back here and came to see what it was. Do you know what I found?'\
\
She looks around quickly, and then says in a hushed whisper, 'Villains! Villains from Dunland!'","Weaken Lheu Brenin","Lheu Brenin has commanded his warriors to kill everyone in the Glittering Caves.","Gimli is in the Glittering Caves, ready to proceed further into Aglarond.","The child of the Westfold has excitedly asked for you to speak to her.","You have come with Gimli deeper into the Glittering Caves to make certain the folk who shelter here will be safe.","Talk to the child of the Westfold","Habla con Gimli"}},
[7111]={nameES="Instance: Sever the Supply Lines",objectivesES={}},
[7112]={nameES="Instancia: Sombras en Jirush",objectivesES={"Talk to Rahâzi","You have come with Rahâzi, Corudan, and Sigileth to the fortress above Jirush with the hope that you will be able to find Balakhâd and free him from Ordâkhai captivity.","You escape from the fortress and look for your companions","Leave the fortress by the main gate before you are discovered by the Ordâkhai","Listen to what Tatháta has to say","Tatháta watches you carefully","Your part of the plan requires you to sneak inside the fortress turn to the right to search for the prisoner.","Sneak into the fortress and search the right side of the Ordâkhai camp","Remain on your guard and listen to the newcomer","A number of Ordâkhai soldiers have already been slain. What transpired here?","Tatháta has offered to answer a single question of yours.","Tatháta has answered your question, and the sound of distant shouting has brought your conversation with her to a close.","Ask Tatháta a single question","The time has come for you to leave the fortress before you are discovered by the Ordâkhai.","Instancia: Sombras en Jirush","Tatháta has agreed to answer a single question of yours.","Tatháta has come to the fortress above Jirush.","Talk to Tatháta","Rahâzi wants to go over the plan before you infiltrate the fortress above Jirush.","Distant shouting disturbs the fortress. Rahâzi's task is accomplished"}},
[7113]={nameES="Instancia: Cantares en la Tormenta",objectivesES={"Escucha a Cebadilla Mantecona","Rojo de vergüenza, ¡Bill Helechal abandona el Poney Pisador!","Habla con Cebadilla Mantecona","Cebadilla Mantecona te ha pedido que interpretes cantares marineros por todo el Poney Pisador.","Bill Helechal está en el Poney Pisador.","Instancia: Cantares en la Tormenta","Cebadilla Mantecona se encuentra en el Poney Pisador.","Enfrenta a Bill Helechal","<rgb=#FF0000>No pierdas la compostura</rgb>","Cebadilla Mantecona necesita un Marinero experimentado para mantener los ánimos altos —y a los clientes sentados— en el Poney Pisador mientras una tormenta azota Bree.","Cebadilla Mantecona confronta a Bill Helechal y Harry Goatleaf."}},
[7114]={nameES="Instancia: La noche de Zarquino",objectivesES={"Talk to Sharkey","Talk to Tautila","Confront Sharkey","Sharkey is in the warrens of Tûn Melen.\
\
Sharkey has revealed himself. You should confront Sharkey.","Sharkey is in the warrens of Tûn Melen.\
\
After you defeated his guards, Sharkey has surrendered to you and Tautila. You should talk to Sharkey.","Tautila can be found deep within the warrens of Tûn Melen.\
\
You have found and freed Tautila, but he is unable to walk. You should talk to Tautila and try to help him to his feet.","Instancia: La noche de Zarquino","Contrary to Radagast's belief, Sharkey seems to be a pale half-orc. His hair is matted with some sort of white clay, but darker patches are still visible around it. You would never describe a half-orc as handsome, but it seems that Sharkey has taken a great deal of care in crafting his appearance. His brow is furrowed in frustration as he looks you up and down.\
\
'Not one of them could stop you?'\
\
Sharkey glares at you. Behind his stern gaze, you detect a hint of shock.","Tautila can be found somewhere in the warrens of Tûn Melen.\
\
Sharkey has taken Tautila and plans to hang him as punishment. You should try to rescue Tautila from Sharkey.","Tautila is alive, but bound and badly beaten","Tautila is not in his cage, but Vulfila appears to have been waiting for you","Seemingly unable to stand on his own, Tautila collapses","Free Tautila","Tautila can be found in the warrens of Tûn Melen.\
\
You have returned after nightfall as Tautila asked. You should speak to Tautila.","Tautila can be found in the warrens of Tûn Melen.\
\
You have defeated Garmog. After he surrendered and bartered the true identity of Sharkey for his life, Garmog fled the warrens of Tûn Melen. You should talk to Tautila.","Talk to Vulfila","Tautila can be found deep within the warrens of Tûn Melen.\
\
You have found Tautila. You should loosen his restraints and free him.","Find and rescue Tautila from Sharkey","Sharkey, the vicious leader of a band of half-orcs and ruffians, has big plans for the Gladden Fields.","Vulfila can be found in the warrens of Tûn Melen.\
\
Tautila has been taken from his cage and Vulfila appears to have been waiting for you to return. You should confront Vulfila."}},
[7115]={nameES="Instancia: Raíces destrozadas",objectivesES={"Brúndoron lays slain as the Orcs serving Lomor prepare to return his hewn trunk to Isengard","Mossbeard is standing outside the future location of the White Hand encampment in the Balewood.\
\
Mossbeard is prepared to tell you a portion of what the trees have told him of Núrzum's origins before returning to Barallas and the others.","Listen as Mossbeard tells the tale of Brúndoron's fall","Talk to Mossbeard","Instancia: Raíces destrozadas","Mossbeard has chosen to tell you of Brúndoron, an elder Huorn of the Balewood slain before Núrzum came into power.","Mossbeard is standing in the future location of the White Hand encampment in the Balewood.\
\
Mossbeard's story has come to a close. You should speak to him before continuing your journey to Barallas and the others.","Mossbeard's story is still unfolding.\
\
Mossbeard is sharing his memories as learned from the trees of the Balewood. You should listen as he tells you more of this story."}},
[7116]={nameES="Instancia: La que camina en la oscuridad",objectivesES={"Talk to Felgúr","You are trapped in webs!","Enter Torech Ungol","Felgúr smells someone coming.\
\
You should talk to Felgúr.","Listen to the conversation","Felgúr ran into Torech Ungol, followed by Rûkhor and the Ungoledain.\
\
You should enter Torech Ungol.","Find Felgúr","Run!","The Pale Herald is coming.\
\
You should listen to the conversation.","Instancia: La que camina en la oscuridad","Escape Torech Ungol","The time has come to enter Torech Ungol and discover if Ungwetári yet lives.","Break free of the webs!","Felgúr ran into Torech Ungol, followed by Rûkhor and the Ungoledain.\
\
You should find Felgúr.","You have escaped Shelob.\
\
You should talk to Legolas.","Felgúr was just devoured by Shelob. She is coming for you.\
\
Run!","Shelob is coming!\
\
You need to escape from the webs!","You have escaped Shelob","Habla con Legolas."}},
[7117]={nameES="Instancia: Hermanos de escudo",objectivesES={"This man has the rank of Rinc.\
\
His mood is one of eagerness.\
\
He was born in Faldham and his loyalty has always been to Elfhelm and his heirs.","Elfmar's men are in the field outside the Mead Hall of Faldham.\
\
Elfmar has asked you to train with his men so they will have some additional battle experience.","Talk to Elfmar to begin training with him","This man has the rank of Guma.\
\
His mood is one of understated confidence.\
\
He was born in Minas Tirith but is of Rohirric descent, and came to Faldham many years ago. He has already distinguished himself in battle with the Orcs.","This man has the rank of Ceorl.\
\
His mood is one of trepidation.\
\
He was born in Garsfeld, but now lives in Faldham and his loyalty is to Elfmar while Elfhelm is away.","Train with Elfmar's men in the field outside the Faldham Mead Hall","Trained a man of Rinc rank","Elfmar is in the field outside the Mead Hall of Faldham.","Elfmar wants to have another bout with you.","Nona and Horn are in the field outside the Faldham Mead Hall.","This man has the rank of Rinc.\
\
His mood is one of confidence.\
\
He was born in Harwick and came to Faldham with his family very recently. He practices daily so he may better protect them.","This man has the rank of Ceorl.\
\
His mood is one of extreme confidence, but you can tell it is misplaced. He is certain to yield at the first chance of injury.\
\
He lives in Snowbourn and came to Faldham to serve Elfhelm, but he arrived after Elfhelm rode to the Fords and now seeks to impress Elfmar.","Elfmar has asked for your aid in training his men, and also for a chance to discuss the situation in Rohan.","Trained a man of Guma rank","Talk to Elfmar","This man has the rank of Rinc.\
\
His mood is one of weariness.\
\
He was born in Langhold and has seen much of war. He came to Faldham because this is where his steed finally succumbed to exhaustion. He offered his sword to Elfmar as a means of regaining his honour.","Instancia: Hermanos de escudo","This man has the rank of Ceorl.\
\
His mood is one of slight trepidation.\
\
He was born in Faldham, and he works daily on his combat skill but to little result. He hopes his training with you will help.","Talk to Corudan","This man has the rank of Guma.\
\
His mood is one of eagerness.\
\
He was born in Faldham and is a frequent companion of Elfmar and Éomer.","Talk to Nona","Trained a man of Ceorl rank","Nona looks for someone with whom to spar","Horn goes off to find someone with whom to spar","This man has the rank of Ceorl.\
\
His mood is one of quiet confidence, and you cannot tell his level of skill from his countenance.\
\
He was born in Edoras and came to Faldham at a young age.","Corudan wishes to train with you as well.","Elfmar wishes to train with you.","Talk to Horn","Elfmar is standing outside his Mead Hall, and he wishes to speak with you about the possibility of training his men."}},
[7118]={nameES="Instance: Shield-maiden of Rohan",objectivesES={"Watch the funeral proceedings","Fríthild lies upon the table before the fireplace.\
\
Thane Ordlac asked you to retrieve Fríthild's sword and place it upon her in state.","Watch the funeral proceedings.","Thane Ordlac stands before the table where Reeve Fríthild lies.\
\
Thane Ordlac wishes for you to speak with him again.","Fríthild's shield is on the table near the door.\
\
Thane Ordlac asked you to retrieve Fríthild's shield and place it upon her in state.","Collected Reeve Fríthild's sword","Placed Reeve Fríthild's sword upon her in state","Fríthild lies upon the table before the fireplace.\
\
Thane Ordlac asked you to retrieve Fríthild's shield and place it upon her in state.","Talk to Fríthbert","Fríthild's sword is on the table near the door.\
\
Thane Ordlac asked you to retrieve Fríthild's sword and place it upon her in state.","Talk to Dudsig","Collected Reeve Fríthild's shield","Place Reeve Fríthild's sword upon her in state","Place Fríthild's shield upon her in state","Dudsig is near the door to Reeve Fríthild's house.\
\
Dudsig wishes to speak with you.","Thane Ordlac stands before the table where Reeve Fríthild lies.\
\
You should speak with Thane Ordlac before the funeral begins.","Placed Fríthild's shield upon her in state","Talk to Thane Ordlac","Collect Reeve Fríthild's shield","Talk to Edhild","Instance: Shield-maiden of Rohan","You have come to Reeve Fríthild's house to honour her before her children.","Collect Reeve Fríthild's sword","Young Reeve Fríthbert and his sister Edhild appear distraught at Thane Ordlac's pronouncement. You should speak with them."}},
[7119]={nameES="Instancia: Corto de estatura, grande en hazañas",objectivesES={"Talk to Maedal outside the Uruk camp","Drafli Broadshield has recovered his confidence and needs to speak to you.","Maedal is outside the Uruk camp on Amon Hen, waiting to speak with you for your part of the plan to rescue Drafli Broadshield from captivity.","Listen to the situation within the Uruk camp","Instancia: Corto de estatura, grande en hazañas","Talk to Isteron atop Amon Hen","Enter the camp and defeat the Uruk guarding Drafli's cage","Talk to Hestil outside the Uruk camp","You have been spotted, and the rescue mission has ended in failure!","Ramdir is near the summit of Amon Hen, and you should speak to him.","Talk to Ramdir atop Amon Hen","Talk to Drafli Broadshield","The Uruk camp has mostly emptied in pursuit of Isteron! You need to go and rescue Drafli Broadshield while the others see to Isteron's well-being.","Avoid being seen!","Isteron is in trouble near the top of Amon Hen.","You need to observe what's going on inside the Uruk camp on Amon Hen. Be careful not to be seen!","Survive your encounter with the Grim Southron","Defeated Drafli's guard","Drafli Broadshield is inside his cage in the Uruk camp on Amon Hen. You need to speak to him to get him out of his depression.","Hestil's group of adventurers-for-hire is in danger near the summit of Amon Hen.","It is time for Hestil's group of adventurers-for-hire to rescue their guardian from his captivity, and you have agreed to help with the task.","Hestil is outside the Uruk encampment on Amon Hen, waiting to speak with you before setting the plan into motion."}},
[7120]={nameES="Instance: Shot in the Dark",objectivesES={}},
[7121]={nameES="Instancia: No muestres miedo",objectivesES={}},
[7122]={nameES="Instancia: Asedio intensificado",objectivesES={"The enemy will assault both of the barricaded entrances into Brockbridge. Herefara has asked you to use your war-steed and help the defenders that are more overwhelmed.","The city of Brockbridge faces its greatest challenge yet as an army marches on the stalemate siege in an attempt to punch through their stalwart defences.","Instancia: Asedio intensificado","Defend Brockbridge","<rgb=#FF0000>Herefara has been defeated</rgb>","<rgb=#FF0000>Herefara cannot be defeated</rgb>","Herefara would like to thank you for your assistance in keeping the enemy at bay and ensuring not too many men were lost in the battle.","The enemy is preparing to assault Brockbridge with renewed vigour, and the few defenders remaining will be hard-pressed to keep the city secure.","Talk to Herefara"}},
[7123]={nameES="Instancia: Sigileth en la oscuridad",objectivesES={"Hármelak waits for tidings of the army that approaches the city, and your brother Jajax is not about to give her this news. It falls to you to do this, Daxamat.","Talk to your brother Jajax in Dâr Laja and tell him what you saw","Your quick action has unearthed Sigileth from the rubble that might have proved her tomb!","Talk to Sigileth among the rubble beside the collapsed entrance to Utug-bûr","You have only moments before the entrance to Utug-bûr collapses. If you are to escape with Sigileth, you will have to act quickly.","Heed the words of Corudan","Corudan knows the need for haste if you are to rescue Sigileth.","Days later, anxious eyes turn to the east and consider the army of soldiers approaching Umbar Baharbêl.","Talk to Hármelak inside Dâr Laja and tell her what you saw","Several days ago, in the aftermath of the Dagor Carlanthir.","You can go no further without risking entombment with the Thardúth... but perhaps Sigileth will hear your voice if you call for her down the hallway!","<rgb=#FF0000>You have to reach the exit before the entrance collapses!</rgb>","Break the rubble beside the collapsed entrance to Utug-bûr","Break more of the rubble beside the collapsed entrance to Utug-bûr","Choose your words with care and call for Sigileth to return to you","Instancia: Sigileth en la oscuridad","You are out of time! You must escape from Utug-bûr!","Days earlier, in the aftermath of the Dagor Carlanthir","Days pass, and a ruler in Umbar Baharbêl anxiously awaits news","Escape from Utug-bûr!","Talk to Corudan inside Utug-bûr","You cannot have imagined it! You know someone lives beneath the rubble!","You can go no further inside Utug-bûr or you will be trapped forever with the Thardúth.","She lives! Can it be possible?","Jajax waits in Dâr Laja to hear news of what his brother Daxamat learned of the approaching army."}},
[7124]={nameES="Instancia: Nada o húndete",objectivesES={"Habla con Bingo en las orillas del Brandivino","Nada al otro lado del río","Habla con Bingo, pero que no te gotee encima","Dar ejemplo quizás pueda ayudar. Si cruzas el río nadando, puede que Bingo encuentre la manera de hacer lo mismo.","Bingo está listo para aprender a nadar, y necesita tu consejo.","Deberías regresar con Bingo y ver si tu demostración le ha ayudado a ganar algo de confianza.","Te duelen los músculos, pero has hecho una buena demostración","Instancia: Nada o húndete","Como preparación para su viaje, has acompañado a Bingo a la orilla del Brandivino para ayudarle mientras aprende a nadar.","Bingo ha chapoteado un poco en el agua. Es posible que haya nadado un poco, pero es difícil decirlo a ciencia cierta.","Vuelve con Bingo y comprueba si tu demostración ha sido de ayuda","Habla con Bingo en la orilla del Brandivino"}},
[7125]={nameES="Instancia: Hermana del Gilrain",objectivesES={"The Ruthless Dead appear once more, angered by your presence!","The river Gilrain flows south to the mere from Roamingstar's glade.\
\
You have defeated the Ruthless Dead once more and should now meet Roamingstar at the edge of the mere.","DNT -- will not be seen","Instancia: Hermana del Gilrain","As the last of the Dead vanish, you continue your pursuit of Roamingstar","Confront Nerzus and the Ruthless Dead","Follow the river south towards the mere","Defeat the Ruthless Dead before they can cross the Gilrain","The river Gilrain flows south from Roamingstar's glade.\
\
You have defeated the Ruthless Dead you encountered along the river's edge and should now continue south.","Nerzus of the Ruthless Dead suddenly appears before you!","The Ruthless Dead are attacking from the western banks of the Gilrain.\
\
You have encountered the Ruthless Dead along the Gilrain and should prevent them from crossing.","As thanks for your aid and to protect the lands of Gondor, Roamingstar seeks to prevent the Ruthless Dead from crossing into Lebennin.","The Ruthless Dead are attacking from the western banks of the Gilrain.\
\
The Ruthless Dead have renewed their attack, and must be defeated before they can cross the Gilrain unhindered.","Talk to Roamingstar","Granted a respite, you must now reach Roamingstar","The river Gilrain flows south from Roamingstar's glade.\
\
Roamingstar has asked you to follow the Gilrain south to the mere and prevent the Dead from crossing it.","Roamingstar's power has banished Nerzus and sent the Ruthless Dead fleeing back to their dark home","A watery image of Roamingstar dashes through the shallows of the Gilrain...","Nerzus and the Ruthless Host can be found on the western banks of the mere.\
\
You have encountered Nerzus and his grim host as they ready to cross into Lebennin.","Roamingstar can be found at the edge of the mere along the Gilrain in eastern Dor-en-Ernil.\
\
You have defeated the Ruthless Dead and driven them far from Dor-en-Ernil. You should now speak to Roamingstar.","Follow the Gilrain further south","Defeat the Ruthless Dead trying to cross the Gilrain","Roamingstar is standing on a small shoal along the Gilrain.\
\
You have agreed to aid Roamingstar in banishing the Ruthless Dead and should now speak to her.","Follow the Gilrain to the edge of the mere"}},
[7126]={nameES="Instancia: Piel de Bregmor",objectivesES={"Instancia: Piel de Bregmor","Encuentra la guarida del dragón Bregmor.","Ythel derrotado","Yrjänä te dijo dónde encontrar la guarida del dragón Bregmor, aunque no sabía si el dragón seguía con vida.","Derrota a Ythel","Localiza y detén a los angmarim antes de que obtengan la piel de Bregmor","Derrota al líder de las fuerzas angmarim."}},
[7127]={nameES="Instancia: Tumba de Skorgrím",objectivesES={"Tras huir de los salones, habla con Dwalin una vez más.","Los enanos Duramano esperan devolver la vida a su líder muerto hace mucho tiempo, Skorgrím. Junto a Dwalin, has viajado a la tumba excavada por los Duramano para Skorgrím con el fin de poner fin a sus planes.","Has fallado en defender a Dwalin","Continúa defendiendo a Dwalin mientras te acercas a tu objetivo: el lugar donde se realiza el ritual para restaurar a Skorgrím.","Instancia: Tumba de Skorgrím","Acompaña y defiende a Dwalin mientras avanzas hacia la tumba de Skorgrím.","Sigue a Dwalin para ver si puedes detener la resurrección.","Habla con Dwalin"}},
[7128]={nameES="Instance: Something Foul",objectivesES={"Enter Plas-maru and seek out the main chamber","Instance: Something Foul","Drive back the fell spirit from Lhucu.","Entered Plas-maru","Talk to Lhucu","Defeat Mostun","Naeglanc has sent you to uncover what is happening in the depths of Plas-maru.","Travel deep into Plas-maru and locate the levers that control the gate to the main chamber.","Speak with Lhucu and escape Plas-maru.","Defeat the chieftain and his fell spirit companion","Seek out the main chamber of Plas-maru.","Enter the main chamber of Plas-maru and uncover the secret of the cairn.","Discover what is causing the wights to stir within the Bonevales","You have defeated Mostun, now free Lhucu"}},
[7129]={nameES="Instancia: Algo ha despertado",objectivesES={"Examine Sigileth","The Orcs remaining in Maurûsh seemingly abandoned much of their equipment at one of their camp-fires.","Silirtas also stands frozen in place. What has happened to them... or to you?","A feeling of exhaustion overwhelms you","Sigileth and Silirtas stand unmoving in Maurûsh. What has happened to them... or to you?","Sigileth stares at you with concern.","Mithrandir has come to Maurûsh... but for what purpose has the Wizard travelled so far south?","Instancia: Algo ha despertado","Wait for answers","Examine the imposing creature worshipped by the Orcs","Something stirs within the old keep of Maurûsh, but it is not the presence of the Ordâkhai that threatens Urash Dâr from behind its walls.","Silirtas and Sigileth have come with you to investigate Maurûsh.","Search deeper within Maurûsh for some way to free your friends","Sigileth stands unmoving, as if she were frozen in place","Examine the abandoned possessions at the camp-fire","Talk to Sigileth within Maurûsh","A great weight lifts from your eyelids","Some great evil pursues you! You have to escape from Maurûsh!","Flee down the slope to the south to escape from Maurûsh!","An unusual creature, larger than the other Orcs you have seen, stands deep within Maurûsh. Or is this creature a product of the enchantment in which you have been snared?","Examine Silirtas","Sigileth has fallen, and you have failed!","A great weight lifts from your eyelids.","Talk to Silirtas outside Maurûsh","Some evil located deeper within Maurûsh may hold the key to freeing Sigileth and Silirtas from the ensnaring enchantment.","Talk to Mithrandir in Maurûsh"}},
[7130]={nameES="Instancia: Hijos de Raíz Negra",objectivesES={"You have made your way through the wilds of Ithilien in search of Mûmakil, and now the brothers Duilin and Derufin have once more crossed paths in their respective hunts.","Instancia: Hijos de Raíz Negra","Survive the encounter, and ensure that Duilin and Derufin live to tell the tale","You have encountered two Mûmakil in the wilds of Ithilien, but Duilin and Derufin have lost the element of surprise and now the three of you must escape from the trumpeting beasts.","Choose to accompany Derufin","Duilin and Derufin are waiting for you to choose which of the brothers you wish to accompany on the hunt for a Mûmak.","You have left Bâr Húrin with Duilin and Derufin to hunt one of the mighty Mûmakil.","Choose to accompany one of the brothers and follow him in search of prey\
<rgb=#FF0000>If you are in a Fellowship, every character must choose the same brother to follow, or the instance will fail.</rgb>","Duilin and Derufin have agreed to help you with your own mission if you will help them with theirs: hunting the mighty Mûmakil the Haradrim have brought to Gondor.","Talk to Derufin on the path","Talk to Duilin on the path","Meet up with the other hunter","Choose to accompany Duilin"}},
[7131]={nameES="Instancia: Hijos de la Hoja y la Piedra",objectivesES={"Habla con el guardián Galadhrim.","Los Galadhrim están esperando a escuchar qué tienes que decir sobre la solicitud de Bósi.","Habla con el arquero Galadhrim.","Has decidido caminar por los bosques de Lothlórien con Legolas y Gimli en busca de patrullas de orcos.","Bósi está en la frontera de Lothlórien, intentando conseguir una audiencia con Celeborn.","Bósi está teniendo una audiencia con Celeborn de Lórien sobre el envío de Elfos para asistir a los enanos en Khazad-dûm.","Legolas y Gimli están de pie en uno de los caminos que atraviesan los bosques de Lothlórien.\
\
Legolas espera viajar contigo a través de los bosques de Lothlórien.","Instancia: Hijos de la Hoja y la Piedra","Vigila la audiencia de Bósi con Celeborn.","Sigue a Legolas y Gimli hasta la orilla del bosque.","Se te ha dicho que sigas a Legolas y Gimli hasta la orilla del bosque para encontrarte con un enano que ha preguntado por ti.","Galadriel espera para hablar contigo tras la audiencia con Bósi.","Mientras estaba vendado, Bósi ha sido llevado a Caras Galadhon dentro de Lothlórien para su audiencia con Celeborn.","Habla con Legolas.","Habla con Bósi.","Has venido con Legolas y Gimli cerca de la frontera del bosque, y has sido saludado por uno de los Galadhrim."}},
[7132]={nameES="Instancia: Hijos del Usurpador",objectivesES={"As you approach the tent, a wave of dread passes over you...","DNT -- will not be seen","Erchar and Herion can be found within Hata Kebir.\
\
Garvir's brothers are battling their way deeper into Hata Kebir. You should aid them.","Erchar and Herion can be found within Hata Kebir.\
\
You have begun to assault Hata Kebir with Garvir's brothers and should follow them into battle.","Fight your way into Hata Kebir with Erchar and Herion","Instancia: Hijos del Usurpador","Talk to Jajax in Hata Kebir","Azgarzôr's tent is in the heart of Hata Kebir.\
\
Jajax has joined with you and Garvir's brothers to confront Azgarzôr. You should battle your way to his tent.","Horses can be found just inside the western entrance to Hata Kebir.\
\
Erchar has asked you to free the horses and spook them, so that they might cause further commotion within Hata Kebir.","Fight your way to Azgarzôr's tent","Erchar is standing outside Hata Kebir.\
\
You have arrived at Hata Kebir and should now speak to Erchar before beginning your assault.","After defeating the Haradrim and stable-hands, the horses stand undefended","Erchar is standing in Hata Kebir.\
\
You have defeated Azgarzôr and avenged Garvir. You should speak to Erchar before leaving the camp.","Seeking to put an end to the reign of the Heirs of Castamir, Jajax prepares himself for an uneasy and hopefully brief alliance with Garvir's brothers.","Fight your way further into Hata Kebir","Azgarzôr is in Hata Kebir.\
\
You have found Azgarzôr, and must now defeat him.","Jajax is standing outside the inner camp-sites of Hata Kebir.\
\
You have battled your way deep into Hata Kebir and have discovered Jajax amid the largely-emptied tents nearby. You should speak to him.","You notice a familiar face in the distance...","Confront and defeat Azgarzôr","Azgarzôr is slain!","Talk to Erchar"}},
[7133]={nameES="Instancia: Entrenamiento en Minas Tirith",objectivesES={"Talk to Harnion about sparring with the soldiers.","Talk to Harnion","Go to the centre of the sparring area.","Spar with the soldiers","Spar with the soldiers until you've faced them all.","Go to the centre of the sparring area","Return to Harnion","Harnion, the Master-at-Arms of the Training Ground, has asked for your aid in helping the soldiers with their sparring skills.","<rgb=#FF0000>You must not be defeated by the soldiers</rgb>","Instancia: Entrenamiento en Minas Tirith","Talk to Harnion about the sparring match.","You have been bested by the soldiers!"}},
[7134]={nameES="Instancia: Espectro del Miedo Gris",objectivesES={"Instancia: Espectro del Miedo Gris","Busca a Meneldir y Gorwen en las catacumbas bajo Dol Ernil","Habla con Halbarad en Dol Ernil","Sobrevive a tu encuentro con el Miedo Gris","Habla con Gorwen en las catacumbas bajo Dol Ernil","Halbarad se encuentra en la sala del trono de Dol Ernil, buscando alguna pista sobre el paradero de Gorwen y Meneldir.","Escucha las últimas palabras de Meneldir","Busca pistas en la sala del trono de Dol Ernil","Halbarad busca alguna pista sobre la desaparición de Meneldir y Gorwen.","Llega a las catacumbas bajo Dol Ernil","Habla con Halbarad en la sala del trono de Dol Ernil","Un mal terrible acecha en las catacumbas bajo Dol Ernil.","Meneldir se escabulle. Ya no está.","Usa la trampilla en la esquina de la sala del trono para descender a las catacumbas","Debes buscar a Meneldir y Gorwen en las catacumbas... solo.","La trampilla en un rincón de la sala del trono conduce a unas catacumbas bajo la fortaleza.","La trampilla conduce a catacumbas bajo la fortaleza.","Meneldir ha sufrido una herida grave. Le queda poco tiempo.","Meneldir y Gorwen han desaparecido del campamento exterior de Dol Ernil. ¿Se toparon con el Miedo Gris?","Algo anda mal en las catacumbas bajo Dol Ernil, y más de una vida está en peligro.","Las huellas se han vuelto aún más confusas en la sala del trono de Dol Ernil.","Has encontrado a Gorwen. ¡Está viva!"}},
[7135]={nameES="Instancia: Ejecutando el Gran Plan",objectivesES={"Espera a que el lince sea capturado.","Habla con Diamante","Coloca el pastel","Habla con Adamanda","Espera que la trampa se despliegue","Tras descubrir que el lince era una madre reciente, Adamanda ha liberado a la criatura.\
\\Debes hablar con Adamanda.","Coloca la trampa","Arrodíllate detrás del arbusto con Diamante","Instancia: Ejecutando el Gran Plan","El pastel está en un lugar irresistible","El sendero está en la Comarca Allende.\
\
Adamanda Nortuk te ha pedido que coloques una trampa a lo largo del sendero que usa frecuentemente el lince.","Adamanda te espera fuera de Nobotella.\
\
Habla con Adamanda Nortuk."}},
[7136]={nameES="Instancia: Hacer saltar la trampa",objectivesES={"El Montaraz Tadan y sus compañeros Dúnedain se ocultan en el extremo de la calzada hacia Haudh Elendil, aguardando en emboscada a que Mordrambor aparezca.\
\
Tadan necesita que atraigas a Mordrambor hacia la emboscada de los Dúnedain al final de la calzada.","Instancia: Hacer saltar la trampa","Se te ha pedido que lleves a Mordrambor de regreso al extremo de la calzada con los Montaraces.","Tadan y sus compañeros Montaraces han ideado un plan para capturar a Mordrambor, uno de los lugartenientes Númenóreanos Negros de Amarthiel, mientras viaja desde Haudh Elendil con una escolta inusualmente reducida.","Habla con Tadan","El Montaraz Tadan está al final de la calzada, frente a Haudh Elendil.\
\
Tadan te espera para hablar contigo tras la captura de Mordrambor.","Enfréntate a Mordrambor en el extremo más alejado de la calzada"}},
[7137]={nameES="Instance: Stanric's Stand",objectivesES={"Sithric is enraged at Stanric's new defiance, but Stanric is determined to be strong","Gadda is outside of the Mead Hall at Stangard.","Talk to Stanric.","Talk to Stanric inside his house","Gadda points you to Stanric's house for a discussion away from unfriendly eyes and ears","Gadda, Stanric, and Sithric are outside of the Mead Hall.","Stanric is in his household near the Mead Hall.","Talk to Gadda","Sithric has at last caught wind of your deeds on behalf of Stangard, and for some reason he is displeased....","Observe the confrontation between Sithric and Stanric","You tell Stanric about the good you were able to do with little effort, free of the restrictions of politics","Stanric seems determined to make a change","Tell Stanric of your methods and hear his thoughts","Stanric is inside of his house in Stangard, near the Mead Hall.","Follow Stanric outside","Talk to Stanric","Instance: Stanric's Stand","Gadda is outside of Stanric's house.","Stanric has gone outside.\
\
You should follow him."}},
[7138]={nameES="Instance: Starlight and Shadows",objectivesES={}},
[7139]={nameES="Instancia: Pacificando el Vado",objectivesES={"<rgb=#FF0000>Éowyn must not be defeated</rgb>","Nâdar can be found at the western edge of Entwade.\
\
You have encountered the leader of the White Hand forces in Entwade. You should defeat him.","Ordgar has been defeated!","The gate of Entwade remains strong as the Orc force dwindles","Síric is in northern Entwade.\
\
You have discovered Síric and his men amidst slain White Hand forces. You should speak to Síric.","Inguc has been defeated!","Talk to Síric","Follow Éowyn to the western flank","DNT -- Players will not see","<rgb=#FF0000>The Men of Entwade must not be defeated</rgb>","Magenred has been defeated!","Síric can be found in northern Entwade with Womar and Gifel.\
\
You should seek out Síric and aid him.","Talk to Anrad","Éowyn and the others can be found to the west.\
\
Éowyn is running toward the western flank of Entwade. You should follow her.","Agelman has been defeated!","Thane Edric's men can be found to the east of the Mead Hall of Entwade.\
\
You should aid Agelman and Éowyn in combat.","Éowyn has been defeated!","Aid Agelman and Éowyn in defending Entwade","Anrad has been defeated!","Anrad can be found at the gate of Entwade near the Sutcrofts.\
\
You have defended the southern flank of Entwade and should now secure the gate.","Follow Éowyn","Defeat Nâdar","Defeat Orcs attacking the palisades of Entwade","Éowyn is standing outside the Mead Hall of Entwade.\
\
You should speak to Lady Éowyn and drive the White Hand from Entwade.","Talk to Éowyn","Mordor Orcs can be found outside the gates of Entwade, hacking at the nearby fences.\
\
Anrad has asked that you slip past the Orcs at the gate and engage Orcs attacking the walls of Entwade.","Find Síric","Síric has been defeated!","Instancia: Pacificando el Vado","Éowyn can be found inside Entwade in eastern Kingstead.\
\
You have repelled the White Hand and brought some measure of peace to the Wade. You should now speak to Éowyn.","Éowyn can be found near the Mead Hall of Entwade.\
\
You should follow Éowyn.","Kenbert has been defeated!","Gifel has been defeated!","Slain Orcs and Uruks litter the ground at Síric's feet","Hoping to cut down the White Hand invaders once and for all, Éowyn rides to Entwade with vengeance in her heart."}},
[7140]={nameES="Instancia: Extraños transeúntes",objectivesES={}},
[7141]={nameES="Instancia: Juramentos prestados",objectivesES={"Captain Garmund can be found just ahead of you, at the northern edge of the farmland.\
\
Garmund has asked you to help him repel many of the White Hand trespassers across the farmland.","You have helped drive the White Hand forces away","Instancia: Juramentos prestados","Captain Garmund has organized an unexpected counter-attack against the Orcs who have sacked the farmlands outside of Cliving in the hopes of driving back some of the White Hand forces.","Talk to Garmund"}},
[7142]={nameES="Instancia: Juramento de Secreto",objectivesES={"Angbor can be found inside the Great Hall of Tumladen.\
\
You have arrived in the Great Hall and should now speak to Angbor.","Lady Terenis and Angbor can be found in the Great Hall of Tumladen.\
\
Lord Angbor is now speaking with Lady Terenis about the battle at Pelargir. You should listen to their conversation.","Talk to Angbor","At the request of Aragorn, Lord Angbor has come to Tumladen to privately deliver a message of victory to Lady Terenis.","Follow Lord Angbor and Lady Terenis to the fireplace","Instancia: Juramento de Secreto","Lady Terenis and Angbor can be found in the Great Hall of Tumladen.\
\
You have arrived in the Great Hall with Angbor, and should now approach Lady Terenis.","Listen as Lord Angbor and Lady Terenis speak","Lady Terenis can be found in the rear of the Great Hall of Tumladen.\
\
Lord Angbor has returned to the fields of Lebennin with his host, and has left you to aid Lady Terenis.","Approach Lady Terenis with Angbor","Talk to Lady Terenis","Lady Terenis and Angbor can be found in the Great Hall of Tumladen.\
\
You should follow Lady Terenis and Angbor to the fireplace in the rear of the Great Hall."}},
[7143]={nameES="Instancia: Tomando un descanso",objectivesES={"Help Khagâmi","Investigate the sound you heard to the east","Khagâmi is tired from her travels west through An Shêru, and is ready to settle in for the night. Together, you have set up a camp-fire and made yourselves as comfortable as you are able to while on the road.","Instancia: Tomando un descanso","While you and Khagâmi were talking at the camp-fire, you both heard a suspicious sound from the east. You should investigate what it was.","While you and Khagâmi were talking at the camp-fire, you both fell under attack! You should help Khagâmi.","You received some unexpected help while defending your camp. You should talk to Faeron.","Khagâmi is tired from her travels west through An Shêru, and is ready to settle in for the night. By joining her at her camp-fire, you may learn something of her journey.","Talk to Faeron","Talk to Khagâmi","While you and Khagâmi were talking at the camp-fire, you both fell under attack! You should defeat the bandits.","Khagâmi is being attacked!"}},
[7144]={nameES="Instancia: Tomar postura",objectivesES={}},
[7145]={nameES="Instancia: Cuentos de la Compañía Brillante",objectivesES={"Habla con Glorfindel","Lendelen is at Echad-in-Edhil.","The High Elves of the Bright Company undertake the most dangerous missions required by the Great Alliance.","Habla con Gandalf","Talk to Lendelen","Listen to the concerns of Gandalf","Glorfindel is at Echad-in-Edhil.","Talk to the shade of Isildur","The shade of Isildur has been interrupted by Gandalf, and he is not happy about it.","Gandalf has interrupted the shade of Isildur's story-telling, bringing you back to the present situation on Tol Send.","Listen to the tale told by the shade of Isildur","Talk to Magoldir","Gandalf has interrupted the telling of Isildur's tale with a number of questions.","The shade of Isildur is on Tol Send.","Gandalf is on Tol Send.","Magoldir is at Echad-in-Edhil.","Instancia: Cuentos de la Compañía Brillante"}},
[7146]={nameES="Instancia: Thane Mildrith",objectivesES={}},
[7147]={nameES="Instancia: Las aventuras de Jajax y Daxamat",objectivesES={"Jajax has returned to you at great speed. You are not the only sibling to have gotten into trouble!","Khôltekh has asked you for your name.","Wait for Jajax to return... and cause no trouble","Jajax has agreed to recount to you what happened to him and his brother Daxamat when the two of them sailed from Gondor to Umbar after the conclusion of the war.","Itûr has asked you to discreetly escape from Khôltekh through the northern exit of the courtyard.","Jajax has decided to look for information about what has happened in Umbar.","Jajax has arrived at a run!","Talk to Khôltekh in the courtyard of the Teeming Net Tavern","Escape through the northern exit of the courtyard","Talk to Itûr... quietly","You have returned to Umbar with your brother Jajax.","Talk to Jajax in the Sail-haven of Umbar Baharbêl","Your friend Itûr has recognized you and called you over to him.","Jajax stands in the courtyard of the Teeming Net Tavern.","Follow Jajax","Talk to Itûr in the courtyard of the Teeming Net Tavern","Talk to Jajax outside the courtyard of the Teeming Net Tavern","Jajax told you the city is not safe for the two of you, and you have to hurry back to your ship and escape!","Remain in the courtyard as your brother Jajax requested, and cause as little trouble as possible.","Instancia: Las aventuras de Jajax y Daxamat","Follow Jajax back to the ship... and quickly!","Your brother Jajax has asked you to follow him through the city.","Talk to Jajax in the courtyard of the Teeming Net Tavern","Itûr has quietly caught your attention.","Wait in the courtyard for Jajax to return"}},
[7148]={nameES="Instancia: La emboscada",objectivesES={"Instancia: La emboscada","Talk to Dagoras north of Cirith Negen","Gimli is standing off the road north of Cirith Negen, waiting to attack the enemy ambushers.","You and the Rangers have turned the tables on the ambushers at Cirith Negen.","<rgb=#FF0000>Do not get too close to Cirith Negen before the Rangers are in position</rgb>","You have been spotted by the ambushers, and ruined the plan!","Survive combat until the Rangers can attack!","You have met up with Dagoras in the woods north of Cirith Negen.","Talk to Gimli north of Cirith Negen","Attack the Orc leader at Cirith Negen to signal the other Rangers","Your attack on the Orc leader at Cirith Negen will be the signal for Dagoras and the other Rangers to begin the full assault.","You need to survive until the Rangers can finish their attack!","You have come with Legolas, Gimli, and a number of Rangers to the northern side of Cirith Negen in order to disrupt the Orc and Easterling ambush.","The tables have been turned!","<rgb=#FF0000>Gimli must not be defeated!</rgb>","The Rangers have launched their attack!"}},
[7149]={nameES="Instancia: El ataque de los aprendices",objectivesES={"Kyrstig has pointed out the first tomb on the left in Akhaldarâg as yours.\
\
You should enter the tomb.","Clear the tomb of Angmarim","Enter the dwarf-tomb","Talk to Kyrstig","The dwarf-tomb contains Angmarim possessed of evil intent.","The tomb has been cleared!","Confront Loknashra","Instancia: El ataque de los aprendices","Kyrstig waits to speak with you.","<rgb=#FF0000>The Scout Trio must survive!</rgb>","Scout-master Ausma has charged you and her three apprentices with dismantling the Angmarim forces in the Pit of Stonejaws.","It is time to confront Loknashra!","Kyrstig needs your help.","You should defeat the dwarf-wights in the tomb.","Defeat the Dwarf-wights"}},
[7150]={nameES="Instancia: El Asalto a Archet",objectivesES={"Estás de pie fuera de la brecha en la muralla este de Archet, al oeste del Refugio del Cazador.\
\
Debes evitar que los Montebruno capturen Archet.","Derrota a los Montebruno y a su líder","Habla con Jon Helecharroyo","Ned Pruner está gravemente herido y requiere asistencia.","Archet está bajo ataque. Jon Helecharroyo y los otros cazadores han decidido entrar al pueblo por la Puerta Este. Debes avanzar y conocer el destino de Mundo, Celandine, Amdir y el Capitán Helecharroyo.","<rgb=#FF0000>Jon Helecharroyo ha caído</rgb>","<rgb=#00FF00>Has llegado a tiempo al Capitán Helecharroyo</rgb>","<rgb=#00FF00>Has limpiado el área de los artesanos de enemigos</rgb>","Encuentra una manera de llegar al centro de Archet y encontrar a Amdir.\
\
Después de que derrotaste a los prisioneros, Ned Pruner te dijo que los bandidos Montebruno habían intentado invadir Archet por fin, y que Amdir ayudó a defender la posada. Amdir se puede encontrar en algún lugar adelante; deberías ayudarlo en la defensa de la Posada del Tejón Loco.\
\
Después de que Ned murió, su pobre esposa Peg vino a atender su cuerpo.","<rgb=#00FF00>Has derrotado a Calder Cob</rgb>","<rgb=#00FF00>Has limpiado la plaza del mercado de enemigos</rgb>","Con Archet a salvo, deberías hablar con Jon Helecharroyo.","<rgb=#00FF00>Has limpiado el patio de la cárcel de enemigos</rgb>","Protege a Jon Helecharroyo","La plaza del mercado de Archet está bloqueada, y Jon Helecharroyo teme que llegues demasiado tarde. Quiere seguir adelante.","Habla con Ned Pruner","Protege Archet derrotando la invasión de los Montebruno.\
\
Amdir fue incapacitado por la herida morgul que sufrió del Nazgûl, y ahora depende de ti salvar Archet de los Montebruno.","Instancia: El Asalto a Archet","Llegaste demasiado tarde para salvar el área de los artesanos, pero puede que no sea demasiado tarde para salvar todo Archet."}},
[7151]={nameES="Instancia: La Subasta",objectivesES={"Talk to Bedwur","Merchants of the Ox-clan gather frequently for auctions, where large amounts of goods -- and money -- trade hands.","Observe the auction","Many merchants have gathered here tonight.","Instancia: La Subasta"}},
[7152]={nameES="Instancia: El banquete y la brecha",objectivesES={"Defeat the goblins","Take part in the Finder's Gathering with Bergil and the other children.","Join the children at the table for the Finder's Gathering.","Join the Finder's Gathering","Search for Glatham","The children's Gathering takes place in a back room of the Old Guest-house. Gifts, brought by all, are piled high on the table for all to enjoy.","By dispatching  the goblins near Glatham and the strange woman, you have caught the attention of the goblin captain.","You have come with Gelwen and Bergil to the cisterns. See if Gelwen can retrace her steps and to find her brother Glatham.","Talk to Gelwen","Gelwen has stumbled into the room, troubled and out of breath. Talk to her to find out what has happened.","Gelwen stands with Bergil, Glatham, and the mysterious woman near where the goblins came in.\
\
You have defeated the goblins who made a breach into this part of the cisterns and for the moment, it is safe. You should see what Gelwen has to say.","Take part in the Gathering","Defeat the goblin captain","You have found Glatham, surrounded by goblins! More goblins come in through a breach in the wall.","You have come with Gelwen and Bergil to the cisterns. Go with them and find Glatham.","Instancia: El banquete y la brecha"}},
[7153]={nameES="Instancia: La Batalla ante el Rammas Deluon",objectivesES={"Instancia: La Batalla ante el Rammas Deluon","Derrota rápidamente a las hechiceras","Faelbenn ha sido derrotado","Recibe tus órdenes de Faelbenn.","Habla con Faelbenn","Previene que los baluartes caigan","Un baluarte ha caído","Tiempo expirado","El Montaraz Faelbenn te ha pedido que le ayudes a derrotar a los refuerzos de Angmar que están cruzando el Rammas Deluon.","Derrota a las hechiceras de Angmar y evita que los refuerzos crucen el Rammas Deluon.","Defiende a Faelbenn"}},
[7154]={nameES="Instance: The Battle Under the Trees",objectivesES={"You are a Lothlórien sentry, keeping watch over the Golden Wood. You should join your fellow sentry up ahead.","Follow the archers to the north-east, up the hill","Orc invaders have appeared in Lothlórien! Help defend the Golden Wood.","King Thranduil asked you to follow the archers to the north-east, up the hill.","Join your fellow archer to the east, and keep watch over Lothlórien","Instance: The Battle Under the Trees","Galadriel has used her powers to defeat the last of this Orc assault. Now she wishes to talk to you.","You have arrived in Mirkwood. You have crossed paths with Lord Thranduil himself, and should talk with him.","You have come to a hilltop in Mirkwood held by Elves and embattled on all sides.","You have arrived in Mirkwood and come to the edge of the fighting.","Talk to Thranduil on the hilltop","Defend Lothlórien from Orcs and trolls","To the east, you see King Thranduil ride up on his mighty steed","Push onward to the east and defeat the Orc-invaders","Defeat Orc-invaders in Mirkwood by the lamp-posts in the wood","Defeat every attacking enemy on the hilltop. This is the last stand!","Habla con Galadriel","You have crossed paths with Lord Thranduil once again in Mirkwood.","<rgb=#FF0000>Thranduil has been defeated</rgb>","Orc invaders have appeared in Lothlórien! Push onward to where the fighting appears worst.","Orc invaders have appeared in Lothlórien and now Lady Galadriel has taken to the field. Fight by her side and guard her at all costs.","Head east and protect Galadriel while she readies her defences","Thranduil relata las pruebas que el Bosque Negro y Lothlórien soportaron mientras Gondor marchaba y luchaba a las puertas de Mordor.","Head east and talk to King Thranduil"}},
[7155]={nameES="Instancia: La Batalla por Aughaire",objectivesES={"Defiende Aughaire de los asaltos de Angmar.","Firingal ha sido derrotado","Instancia: La Batalla por Aughaire","Defiende a Firingal","Defiende todos los baluartes de Aughaire","Aughaire ha sido defendida","Has acompañado al montaraz Firingal a Aughaire para defender el pueblo contra los asaltos de la horda de Mordirith.","Uno de los baluartes de Aughaire ha caído","Habla con Firingal","Deberías informar a Firingal.","Defiende Aughaire","Habla con Firingal sobre la defensa de Aughaire."}},
[7156]={nameES="Instance: The Battle of Dol Baran",objectivesES={}},
[7157]={nameES="Instancia: La Batalla de Lórien",objectivesES={"Belvagor ha sido derrotado","Un paso ha sido sobrepasado","Belvagor y sus dos amigos esperan órdenes en la ladera que asciende hacia Fanuidhol.\
\
Belvagor y sus dos amigos esperan que les indiques qué pasos deben defender. Para ello, primero debes viajar al Paso Norte, Paso Oeste y Paso Este y observar la composición de los defensores en cada uno; entonces podrás tomar una decisión informada.","Defiende todos los pasos de los orcos","Has destruido cuatro ídolos del Enemigo y ahora deberías regresar para hablar con Belvagor en el paso que le indicaste que defendiera.","Defiende a Belvagor","Belvagor se encuentra en la base de la ladera que asciende hacia Fanuidhol.\
\
El elfo Belvagor está esperando hablar contigo sobre su plan para repeler el ataque de los orcos.","No repeliste a los orcos a tiempo","Instancia: La Batalla de Lórien","Los orcos de Moria han comenzado su asalto a Lothlórien, y depende de ti, tus aliados y un pequeño grupo de elfos repelerlos.","Habla con Belvagor","El tiempo es esencial"}},
[7158]={nameES="Instancia: La Batalla de Rhunendin",objectivesES={"Defiende los baluartes de los Pueblos Libres","Habla con Tordoron","Deberías hablar con Tordoron sobre tu victoria.","Defiende a Tordoron","Reclama rápidamente todos los campamentos","Instancia: La Batalla de Rhunendin","El montaraz Tordoron ha pedido tu ayuda para asaltar las fuerzas de Angmar en Rhunendin.","Hable con Tordoron para recibir sus órdenes de marcha."}},
[7159]={nameES="Instancia: La batalla del Camino Profundo",objectivesES={"Una barricada ha sido superada","Evita que una barricada sea superada","Evita que Brogur sea derrotado","El líder del asalto contra el Camino Profundo ha entrado en batalla. Elimina a este Orco para reclamar la victoria.","Deberías hablar con Brogur para ver de qué ayuda podrías ser en la próxima batalla.","Has viajado al Camino Profundo para ayudar a defenderlo. Sigue las órdenes de Brogur para ayudar a los Enanos de Moria a resistir.","Derrotados Horngoth y sus secuaces","Brogur ha sido derrotado","Derrota a Horngoth y sus secuaces","Ayuda a defender el Camino Profundo contra el asalto de Mazog.","Habla con Brogur","Defiende el Camino Profundo","Instancia: La batalla del Camino Profundo","Con Horngoth derrotado, la batalla del Camino Profundo ha sido ganada. Habla con Brogur para ver qué más quiere que hagas."}},
[7160]={nameES="Instance: The Battle of the Ford, Afternoon",objectivesES={"The men are disorganized and in chaos, and Grimbold wants to gather them together for one last stand.","Instance: The Battle of the Ford, Afternoon","You have come down the road in retreat with Grimbold, and he has put up his hand to stop you.","Fight off the attacking forces in order to buy Théodred precious time to retreat","Théodred's host has been driven back from the gates of Isengard in disarray, and pockets of Rohirrim are fighting for their lives as they retreat.","You have retreated further down the road and are once more embroiled in the fighting. You must buy Théodred as much time as you can!","A rider has brought disturbing news: a second force of uruks has left Isengard in secret and has driven the defending force at the Ford of Isen back into Rohan.","Grimbold has fought off his opponent and wants to speak with you while he catches his breath.","Talk to Grimbold"}},
[7161]={nameES="Instance: The Battle of the Ford, Sunset",objectivesES={"You have returned with as much haste as you can to the Ford of Isen and must now try to save Prince Théodred from the forces of Saruman.","Confront Morflak","Morflak's attention is drawn to the eastern bank of the Ford, but before you can take advantage of his inattention, you are yourself rooted to the spot with wonder.\
\
A line of riders has come from Rohan, and the courage of the uruks melts away as the Rohirrim prepare to charge.","In the eastern distance, you hear a horn blowing from far away","Talk to Morflak","Grimbold needs you to fight alongside him to where Théodred is suffering the fierce attacks of Saruman's forces.","Instance: The Battle of the Ford, Sunset","You have come to the eyot in the middle of the river Isen and have found the uruk Morflak gloating over Théodred's fallen form.","Talk to Grimbold","Prince Théodred is in trouble on the eyot in the middle of the Isen! You need to fight alongside Grimbold to come to the aid of the Prince!","Talk to Grimbold on the bank of the Isen"}},
[7162]={nameES="Instancia: La Batalla de la Sala Vigesimoprimera",objectivesES={"Una barricada ha sido superada","Ayuda a mantener la Sala Vigesimoprimera contra el asalto de Mazog.","Repliégate y defiende la Cámara de Mazarbul","Repliégate y defiende las barricadas de la sala","Una vez más, los zapadores trasgos han destruido las barreras en las barricadas. Wíli ha ordenado una retirada a la Cámara de Mazarbul.","Defiende la Sala Vigesimoprimera","Cámara de Mazarbul defendida","Habla con Wíli","Defiende a Wíli","Has viajado hasta la Vigésimo Primera Sala para participar en su defensa.¡Sigue las instrucciones de Wíli y ayuda a los enanos de Moria!","Los zapadores trasgos han destruido las barreras en las barricadas de la Sala Vigesimoprimera. Wíli ha ordenado una retirada a la sala que da a la Cámara de Mazarbul.","Instancia: La Batalla de la Sala Vigesimoprimera","Evita que una barricada sea superada","Habla con Wíli para ver qué ayuda puedes prestar en su defensa.","Con los orcos expulsados, habla con Wíli para ver si hay algo más que quiera que hagas.","Wíli ha sido derrotado"}},
[7163]={nameES="Instancia: La batalla de la Vía de los Herreros",objectivesES={"Defiende a Stóthkell","La Vía de los Herreros ha sido defendida","Stóthkell ha sido derrotado","Habla con Stóthkell","Habla con Stóthkell para ver qué ayuda puedes prestar en la defensa.","Sigue a Stóthkell para descubrir qué es lo que hace temblar la Vía de los Herreros.","Una forja ha caído","Sigue a Stóthkell","Ayuda a defender la Vía de los Herreros contra el asalto de Mazog.","Instancia: La batalla de la Vía de los Herreros","Has viajado a la Vía de los Herreros para ayudar en su defensa. Sigue las indicaciones de Stóthkell y ayuda a los Enanos de Moria a resistir el ataque.","Defiende la Vía de los Herreros","Evita que una forja caiga","Con los orcos expulsados, habla con Stóthkell para ver si hay algo más que quiera que hagas."}},
[7164]={nameES="Instancia: La Bestia de Abajo",objectivesES={"Talk to Cruel Dancer and hear her last request","Galatâni lies dying in the moonlight.","Stand your ground!","Exhausted by her tale and the loss of so much blood, Galatâni falls silent","Galatâni remained silent during the journey, preserving her strength","Corudan stands in the forgotten passage within Kamrabezûr.","Galatâni asked that you bring her outside into the sunlight before she dies.","Follow Corudan and Sigileth down the forgotten passage","Instancia: La Bestia de Abajo","Talk to Corudan in the forgotten passage within Kamrabezûr","The rampaging beast escapes into greater Kamrabezûr and is gone","Corudan stands in a forgotten passage within Kamrabezûr.","Listen to what befell Cruel Dancer when she caught up to Tatháta in the forgotten passage within Kamrabezûr.","Cruel Dancer lies dying in the forgotten passage within Kamrabezûr.","You have accompanied Corudan and Sigileth into a forgotten passage in the depths of Kamrabezûr, the vaults beneath Umbar Baharbêl, in search of Tatháta.","Bring Galatâni into the sunlight before she dies","Talk to Galatâni in the moonlight","A dying Umbari woman lies in a pool of her own blood","Talk to Corudan in the forgotten passage","Galatâni has one more thing to say to you.","Hear what Galatâni has left to say","The passage shakes as a mighty beast charges toward you and your friends down the forgotten passage!","Despite the appearance of the rampaging beast, Corudan and Sigileth have not abandoned their purpose to investigate the forgotten passage within Kamrabezûr.","Talk to Sigileth in the forgotten passage","Galatâni does not have much time to live.","Stand with Galatâni and observe her final moments","Sigileth waits for you and Corudan in the forgotten passage.","Listen to Cruel Dancer's story","Judging from the quantity of blood spilled on the floor of this chamber, the Umbari woman does not have long to live.","Talk to the dying Umbari woman"}},
[7165]={nameES="Instancia: La Puerta Negra",objectivesES={"Instancia: La Puerta Negra","Collect the short-sword","The Mouth of Sauron has presented tokens for the perusal of the company.","Collect the mithril-shirt","Stand with the Host of the West in defiance of Mordor","Collect the Elf-cloak","You have taken the items that belonged to Frodo and Sam, and Gandalf has defied the Mouth of Sauron.","The Mouth of Sauron mocks the Host of the West, and prepares the terms of Aragorn's surrender. Remain alert.","Aragorn is at the Morannon, the Black Gate of Mordor, and prepares to challenge Sauron.","Mithrandir asked you to retrieve the items presented by the Mouth of Sauron.","Stand with Aragorn as he defies the Mouth of Sauron","The Mouth of Sauron smiles with cruelty and avarice","Mithrandir has asked for you to speak with him while he considers Sauron's terms.","On the very doorstep of Mordor, Aragorn commands Sauron to come forth and surrender.","Talk to Pippin and keep him quiet","Aragorn has decided to call for the surrender of Sauron, and wishes for you to stand with him.","Listen to the demands of the Mouth of Sauron","Talk to Aragorn outside the Black Gate","Mithrandir has asked you to make Pippin hold his tongue lest he endanger the negotiations with the Mouth of Sauron.","Talk to Mithrandir","Stand with Aragorn as he defies the Dark Lord Sauron"}},
[7166]={nameES="Instancia: La Espada que Fue Quebrada",objectivesES={"Instancia: La Espada que Fue Quebrada","En las fraguas de Rivendel, los herreros élficos de Elrond trabajan arduamente rehaciendo la espada de los reyes.\
\
Los herreros élficos han comenzado la labor de reforjar a Narsil.","Aragorn está en las fraguas de Rivendel.\
\
Aragorn desea hablar contigo.","Aragorn está esperando para hablar contigo justo afuera de las fraguas de Rivendel.\
\
Los herreros élficos están reforjando a Narsil, la espada que fue quebrada.","Sé testigo de la reforja de Narsil","Los herreros élficos de Elrond han comenzado a reforjar a Narsil, la espada que fue quebrada, reliquia de los herederos de Elendil."}},
[7167]={nameES="Instancia: El florecimiento",objectivesES={"You have come outside with your companions to see what has happened.","Watch the mighty force leaving Balewood","Relax around the fire with your companions","Nona has leapt to her feet, and wants to see what you think of the rumbling sound.","Talk to Nona inside the cave","You have earned a moment's rest with your friends while you wait to see if Leaflock will come through with the aid Corudan thinks you have earned.","Your companions are transfixed by the sight. Only Corudan can manage the words to describe it.","Instancia: El florecimiento","Talk to Corudan on the slope outside the cave","A mighty force of Huorns are leaving the Balewood. They can have only one destination: Núrzum!","Join Nona outside the cave","<rgb=#FF0000>Sit</rgb> by the fire with your companions","Your companions are sitting around the fire in Nona's cave, and you should do the same. Simply <rgb=#FF0000>sit</rgb> by the fire and relax while you can.","You suddenly hear a low rumbling from outside the cave!","Your companions are relaxing around the fire in Nona's cave, having earned a small, and overdue, respite."}},
[7168]={nameES="Instancia: Las Flores de Anarlossë",objectivesES={"Habla con Mílgamel","Haerandel desea hablarte de días muy lejanos, cuando él y su hermano Edlothon caminaban entre los Anarlossë que florecían en las tierras de los Hombres.","Nethlas da más crédito a las palabras de su maestro que a las de Haerandel, y no tiene reparo en decirlo.","Haerandel desea hablarte de la flor legendaria Anarlossë, desaparecida desde hace mucho de la Tierra Media.","Escucha el relato de Haerandel sobre la legendaria Anarlossë","Haerandel te ha hablado de la Anarlossë, la flor legendaria.","Instancia: Las Flores de Anarlossë","Mílgamel tiene algunas preguntas sobre el relato de Haerandel.","Habla con Nethlas","Habla con Haerandel"}},
[7169]={nameES="Instancia: El cazarrecompensas",objectivesES={"Basil y tú habéis sobrevivido a la traición de Sprunt","Bsilio Resinas está en el Círculo de Duelo de Ost Forod.\
\
Basilio Resinas y tú habéis superado con éxito la traición de Cuthbert Sprunt. Deberías hablar con Basilio de inmediato.","Habla con Basil Resinas","Cuthbert Sprtun ha ofrecido una recompensa por tu cabeza y has decidido desafiarlo a un combate singular para que la retire.","Instancia: El cazarrecompensas","Basilio Resinas ha ido contigo al Círculo de Duelo en Ost Forod.\
\
Basilio Resinas te espera para hablar contigo dentro del Círculo de Duelo.","Te enfrentas en combate singular con Cuthbert Sprunt en el Círculo de Duelo.\
\
Basilio Resinas supervisa el combate para asegurarse de que Cuthbert no haga trampas.","Derrota a Cuthbert Sprunt","Cuthbert Sprunt ha revelado sus verdaderas intenciones y ha llamado a sus secuaces para que le ayuden.\
\
Basilio Resinas ha salido en tu defensa, y con su ayuda, debes derrotar al enemigo."}},
[7170]={nameES="Instancia: El Arco está Tensado",objectivesES={"Glorfindel waits for you to approach the council.","Glorfindel is come to the Council of War in the Court of Lothlórien. You, too, are expected to join them.","Hear what Galadriel has to say of the prophecy.","Approach the Council","Habla con Glorfindel","Instancia: El Arco está Tensado","You and Glorfindel have joined the Council of War. Talk to him to hear of the text he recovered.","Habla con Galadriel","It is time to approach the Council of War.","Galadriel will now address the Council of War.","Hear Galadriel's pronouncement"}},
[7171]={nameES="Instancia: La Ruptura de la Comunidad",objectivesES={"Your companions do not understand. You have to find Frodo and make him understand that the Ring must go to Minas Tirith.","Frodo is gone, and the anger has lifted from your senses much as a cloud moves on from covering the sun. You should return now to Aragorn and the rest of your party. Perhaps Frodo has returned to them and will forgive you your outburst.","Frodo is gone. You should return to the camp-site and see if he will forgive your outburst","Frodo will doom us all! You have to take the Ring from him before he ransoms Middle-earth to Sauron!","Talk to Frodo and tell him of Minas Tirith's great need","The Elf, Legolas, is by the camp-fire.","Talk to Frodo and ask to borrow the Ring so you can save Gondor","Search the hollow log for the sneaking hobbit!","He is not here! Where is the Ring?","The sneak must be hiding somewhere around here! Search the places he might be hiding, and seize the Ring!","Habla con Aragorn","Talk to Aragorn by the camp-fire","Seize the Ring from Frodo!","He is a fool! He will doom us all! He will give the Ring to Sauron!","Frodo has wandered partially up Amon Hen. He needs to be told of your city's great need for the Ring.","No! The fool! He has doomed us all!","Instancia: La Ruptura de la Comunidad","The Elf is a valuable companion, but his arrows are nothing compared to the power of the Ring!","Aragorn does not understand. My city needs the Ring to survive!","Show yourself, villain! Where is the Ring?","He is not listening! Elves and Wizards have already filled his head with nonsense!","A pox on all hobbits! Where is the cowardly creature?","Aragorn is by the camp-fire on Parth Galen.","Frodo is nowhere to be seen","Search the leaf pile for the sneaking hobbit!","Frodo has wandered partially up Amon Hen. He needs to be told of your city's great need for the Ring. Perhaps he will lend it to you? You can use the Ring to save Minas Tirith, and all of Gondor!","You have found Frodo, but he has not seen you yet.","Frodo has asked for an hour in which to decide the course of the Fellowship, but you are worried he will not choose to bring the Ring to Minas Tirith.","Frodo has not yet made his decision! Perhaps he can be convinced!","Talk to the Elf, Legolas, by the camp-fire","Find Frodo and convince him to bring the Ring to Minas Tirith. He wandered somewhere to the north-west.","Search through the bush for the sneaking hobbit!","Talk to Frodo and see if he has yet decided what to do","Aragorn wants to know where you have been."}},
[7172]={nameES="Instance: The Broadacres Betrayed",objectivesES={"<rgb=FF0000>Torferth was defeated</rgb>","Thane Torferth of Torsbury has brought his men to Stoke, where he prepares to march upon the Mead Hall and confront the traitor Ordlac.","<rgb=#FF0000>Torferth must not be defeated</rgb>","Arrived at the Mead Hall of Stoke","Defeat Ordlac and protect the children","Instance: The Broadacres Betrayed","Dudsig and his guards are blocking the way to Ordlac and the children. Defeat them and confront Ordlac.","Talk to Thane Torferth","Thane Torferth stands on the road to Stoke.\
\
You should speak with Thane Torferth before the attack.","<rgb=#FF0000>Torferth was defeated</rgb>","The Mead Hall of Stoke is at the end of the road.\
\
Torferth is making for the Mead Hall of Stoke, where he intends to confront Ordlac.","Ordlac is near the end of the Mead Hall, threatening Reeve Fríthild's children.\
\
Aid Torferth against Ordlac and protect the children.","Defeated Ordlac","Defeat Dudsig and his guards","Thane Torferth is in the Mead Hall of Stoke.\
\
You should speak with Thane Torferth at once.","Defeated Dudsig and his guards","Fight through Ordlac's forces to the Mead Hall of Stoke"}},
[7173]={nameES="Instancia: La jaula y los cautivos",objectivesES={"Your captor stands outside the cage for some purpose of her own.","Jajax sleeps on, oblivious to everything.","Talk to the mysterious girl","You never saw her face before now, but it was in Umbar-môkh that you spoke to Tephísa. She is one of the Terâsi, the forgotten children who make their way through hidden paths beneath the city. It must have been the Temámir Birûk who gave her this message to bring to you and Jajax.\
\
Tephísa studies your face closely.\
\
'I watched the flames destroy my home once, stranger. They were orange and red then, the embers lit by servants of Barkhûsh, but a fire is a fire. Those ships will set ablaze the homes of Gondor, but they will return, and when they return the conflagration will spread to the homes of Umbar.\
\
'I can help you escape, but I have a price.'","You tell Jajax that Hármelak is lying.\
\
'Aye,' he agrees. 'She lied before, and she lies again.'","A girl watches you from outside the cage","<rgb=#00FF00>Beckon</rgb> the girl to speak","Give Tephísa your answer","It is difficult to measure the passing of time in the cage.","Tephísa waits for your response.","Listen to the words of your visitor","The girl eyes you warily.","See what Jajax thinks","Listen to the words of your captor","Wait for the girl to speak","Perhaps if you <rgb=#00FF00>beckon</rgb> the girl she will speak to you.","You have given your answer, and must now wait to see her response.","Talk to your captor through the bars of your cage","Desperate for tidings from above, captives wrestle with their helplessness in the face of the evil that threatens Umbar and Gondor.","Wait to see what she will do","Instancia: La jaula y los cautivos","Talk to Jajax","Pass the time in your cage","There is nothing more you can do but wait.","Jajax rests on a cot by the entrance of the cage."}},
[7174]={nameES="Instancia: El Cautivo",objectivesES={"Talk to Morflak in Isengard","Talk to Iwan at the gate into Isengard","Talk to Léolin in the prison-caves","Betrayal... you were attacked by two members of the Falcon-clan, but Lothrandir was able to turn the tables on them. You should speak with him now.","Talk to Lothrandir in the prison-caves","Instancia: El Cautivo","Talk to Nai in the prison-caves","You have been brought to Isengard by waggon along a bumpy road.","You have met Lothrandir in the prison-caves, coming back from an errand in the depths.","You have come with Lheu Brenin to speak with the captive emissary from Isengard one more time before he dies and hopefully learn something of use to the Falcon-clan and the Grey Company.","Nai is guarding the cell where Dondhreg is being held captive in the prison-caves.","Lothrandir has been badly beaten by your captors and is finding it difficult to go on.","Survive the waggon ride along a bumpy road","Follow Lothrandir into Isengard","An Uruk-hai named Morflak has made you pull up short before the tower of Orthanc.","Talk to Lothrandir at the gates of Isengard","Iwan is ready to bring you into Isengard.","You have been captured and brought to Isengard, home of the traitor Saruman","Lheu Brenin has come with you into the prison-caves behind Tûr Morva to speak with the captive emissary.","Léolin is waiting to speak with you in the prison-caves.","Lothrandir is running into the heart of Isengard by his own power. It is a small gesture, but it is something, and gives you a glimmer of hope.","Lheu Brenin has blocked your passage with a group of armed warriors. He wishes to speak with you.","Talk to Lheu Brenin in the prison-caves"}},
[7175]={nameES="Instancia: La caravana a Río Nevado",objectivesES={"Gísling can be found along the road to Snowbourn.","Gísling was defeated!","<rgb=#FF0000>The crofters must survive</rgb>","Gísling is walking with the crofters along the road south to Snowbourn.\
\
Gísling hopes you can aid him in escorting the crofters of Garsfeld to Snowbourn. However, he fears that Orcs lurk just beyond his sight and threaten to harm his people.","<rgb=#FF0000>Gísling must not be defeated</rgb>","Escort the crofters of Garsfeld to safety","Talk to Gísling","Instancia: La caravana a Río Nevado","Gísling is standing with the crofters at The Raided Crofts.\
\
Having made it this far, Gísling has asked for your aid in escorting the crofters of Garsfeld to Snowbourn.","The crofters have reached Snowbourn safely","At the order of Gísil, you are to aid to the crofters of Garsfeld as they travel south to seek safer shelter within the walls of Snowbourn.","A crofter has fallen!"}},
[7176]={nameES="Instancia: Las elecciones del Maestro Samsagaz",objectivesES={"Following Snaga's muffled shouts, you discover a ladder leading upward!","Shagrat chases a small Orc from the turret!","The gate of Cirith Ungol can be found at the easternmost point of Cirith Ungol.","Draw the phial of Galadriel and hold it aloft!","Search for Mr. Frodo in the Tower of Cirith Ungol","<rgb=#FF0000>No! The quest cannot end this way!</rgb>","Use your hobbit-sense","Confront Shagrat","After disguising themselves in Orkish armour and cloaks now kept by the Silent One, Samwise Gamgee and Frodo Baggins passed through Lhingris in their quest to reach Mount Doom.","Mr. Frodo must be in the turret of the Tower of Cirith Ungol, and it sounds like he's in danger!","Talk to Mr. Frodo and escape the Tower of Cirith Ungol","Instancia: Las elecciones del Maestro Samsagaz","Shagrat stands alone. It's now or never!","Upon seeing you, the Orc recoils and flees up the stairs of the Tower!","<rgb=#FF0000>Claim the One Ring!</rgb>","Spring past the Silent Watchers into Cirith Ungol!","You hear angry Orc-voices approaching from the turret! Hide!","Ascend the Tower of Cirith Ungol","Rescue Mr. Frodo from the Tower of Cirith Ungol","Wait for the right moment","An Orc has fled from you. You should continue higher into the Tower of Cirith Ungol in search of Mr. Frodo.","Harden your will and charge at the gate of Cirith Ungol!","You hear Orkish voices, and the familiar voice of Shagrat. Quickly, hide!","Mr. Frodo must be in the turret of the Tower of Cirith Ungol. Keep climbing!","The Silent Watchers let out a shrill cry, and far above you, a bell rings in answer!","Pass through the gate of Cirith Ungol","Shagrat has chased the Orc, Snaga, onto the parapet of Cirith Ungol. You should remain hidden until the right moment.","The Ring has tempted you with visions of yourself as Samwise the Strong. Use your hobbit-sense, Sam!","Hide behind slain Orcs and wreckage!","The phial of Galadriel! Its light might overcome whatever force bars your path!","An unseen force seems to block your passage into Cirith Ungol.","As soon as you approach him, Shagrat darts past you and flees down the stairs of the Tower!","Something too strong for your will to overcome bars the way!","Mr. Frodo can be found somewhere in the Tower of Cirith Ungol.","Find the topmost chamber of Cirith Ungol","You've rescued Mr. Frodo!","You cannot pass! What else can you do in this moment of great need?","The Ring has begun to tempt you! You must resist and rescue Mr. Frodo.","See what could be if you were only to claim the Ring!","You feel the Ring begin to gnaw at your will and reason!","Shagrat is blocking your path into the heights of Cirith Ungol. It's now or never, Sam!","The Silent Watchers quail and their will is broken for a moment!","Now's your chance! Mr. Frodo needs your help!"}},
[7177]={nameES="Instancia: La Cámara de Enfriamiento",objectivesES={"Slagvi está a tu lado en la cámara de enfriamiento.\
\
Deberías hablar con Slagvi.","Slagvi quiere que el líder de los trasgos que ha tomado la cámara de enfriamiento sea encontrado y derrotado.","Habla con Slagvi","Slagvi se ha unido a ti en la cámara de enfriamiento","Repara el engranaje oxidado","Repara la rueda atascada","Slagvi ha sido invocado","El jefe ha caído y los trasgos restantes huyen aterrados. La cámara de enfriamiento es segura por ahora.","Engranaje oxidado reparado","Un cuerno de invocación se encuentra en la parte frontal de la cámara de enfriamiento.\
\
El cuerno de invocación puede usarse para llamar a Slagvi a tu lado.","Habla con Slagvi. Puedes invocarlo si os separáis.","Rueda atascada reparada","Slagvi invocado","La cámara de enfriamiento ha sido reparada","Instancia: La Cámara de Enfriamiento","Repara la palanca atascada","Los elementos que hay que reparar se encuentran al fondo de la cámara de enfriamiento.","Encuentra y derrota al jefe de Moria","Sal de la cámara de enfriamiento","Palanca atascada reparada","Es hora de salir de la cámara de enfriamiento.","Slagvi está listo para comenzar la investigación de la cámara de enfriamiento","Usa el cuerno de invocación para llamar a Slagvi","Slagvi desea investigar el fallo de los sistemas de agua en la Gran Excavación y cree que el origen del problema está en la propia cámara de enfriamiento.","(Puedes usar el cuerno de invocación en cualquier momento para llamar a Slagvi a tu lado)","Slagvi ha sido llamado"}},
[7178]={nameES="Instancia: El costo de la lealtad",objectivesES={"Talk to Doron","As Doron speaks, the din of a large force rises in the distance","Follow Doron outside Ost Celebrant","Doron is stationed outside of Ost Celebrant. You should follow him as he tells his tale.","Doron is inside Ost Celebrant with his men. You should listen as he continues his tale.","Having heard the roar of an approaching force, Doron and his men have decided to cross the bridge of Ost Celebrant and confront the invaders.","Having survived an Easterling assault, Doron is entering Ost Celebrant, where he hopes to reunite with the rest of his men.","Follow Doron into Ost Celebrant","<rgb=#FF0000>Doron must not be defeated</rgb>","Doron is stationed outside of Ost Celebrant, after having patrolled the road down to the Limlight with his men.","Follow Doron through his memory","Doron, leader of the Oathbreakers in Parth Celebrant, has decided to tell you how he and his men came to be cursed. As he speaks, you find yourself drawn into a daydream, experiencing the tale alongside Doron and his men.","Instancia: El costo de la lealtad","Doron is standing on the edge of the bridge into Ost Celebrant."}},
[7179]={nameES="Instance: The Council of Brehur",objectivesES={}},
[7180]={nameES="Instance: The Council of Herubrand",objectivesES={"Instance: The Council of Herubrand","Observe the council meeting","Herubrand's council is meeting in the cellar of the farmhouse, and Herubrand has invited you to join them.","Talk to Herubrand","You have joined Herubrand as he meets with his council to discuss what should be done in the aftermath of the attack on the Mead Hall of Woodhurst."}},
[7181]={nameES="Instancia: El Concilio de los Reyes",objectivesES={"With the triumphant Rhúnhoth horde of the Ghâzab Bôron on its way, the lords of the Great Alliance have called a council to determine what can be done to stave off defeat.","Tárandil is outside the pavilion where the council of the kings will take place.","Vëamacil is in the tent where the council of kings is underway.","Talk to Tárandil","The council of the kings will soon begin, and the sons of Isildur are hopeful that their presence and yours will go unremarked.","Talk to Vëamacil","Lendelen of the Bright Company has proposed a dangerous plan by which Sauron's hold over the Ghâzab Bôron might be broken.","High King Gil-galad has reservations about your attendance and that of Isildur's sons.","Wait for the council of the kings to begin","High King Gil-galad has called into question your presence, and that of the sons of Isildur, at the council of kings.","The council of kings is underway.","Observe the council of the kings","Instancia: El Concilio de los Reyes","Talk to High King Elendil","The council of the kings continues, but not all in attendance are satisfied with its pronouncements.","High King Elendil is inside the pavilion for the council of kings.","Habla con el Alto Rey Gil-galad"}},
[7182]={nameES="Instancia: El Consejo de Stoke",objectivesES={"Instancia: El Consejo de Stoke","Talk to Reeve Fríthild","Speak with Reeve Fríthild.","Reeve Fríthild's sword, shield, and mail are on the table below the dais.\
\
Reeve Fríthild asked you to collect her arms and armour.","Observe the Council of Stoke","Bring the sword, shield, and mail to Reeve Fríthild.","Collected Fríthild's mail","Collect Fríthild's shield","Reeve Fríthild has summoned together the Council of Stoke in order to come to a consensus regarding what action to take against the forces of the White Hand in the Broadacres.","Collected Fríthild's sword","Observe the Council of Stoke.","Bring the sword, shield, and mail to Reeve Fríthild","Collected Fríthild's shield","DNT -- Will not be seen","Collect Fríthild's mail","Collect Fríthild's sword"}},
[7183]={nameES="Instancia: El Consejo de los Capitanes",objectivesES={"Instancia: El Consejo de los Capitanes","Mithrandir is holding council inside Aragorn's pavilion on the Pelennor.","Aragorn has called for a council of the captains at his pavilion in order to decide what must be done.","Observe the council of the captains","Aragorn is inside his pavilion with many of the captains who fought at Pelennor.","Talk to Mithrandir inside the pavilion","Prince Imrahil is holding council inside Aragorn's pavilion on the Pelennor.","Aragorn and the captains of the armies are meeting to decide their next course.","Talk to Aragorn inside the pavilion","Talk to Imrahil in the pavilion"}},
[7184]={nameES="Instancia: La cruel historia de Durthang",objectivesES={"Talk to Annoth during his recounting of the tale","It is important to Annoth that you hear the tale of the Thandrim.","Annoth desires to tell you the tale of his ancestors, the Thandrim, who kept watch on Mordor from fortresses within the Black Land for more than a thousand years.","Listen to Annoth's account of the Thandrim","Instancia: La cruel historia de Durthang"}},
[7185]={nameES="Instancia: El Valle Maldito",objectivesES={"Listen to Malthellam and Rosfin","Listen to Malthellam","Talk to Rosfin","Malthellam is near his fireplace in his home.\
\
Malthellam and Rosfin spoke at length on the history of the vale, and Malthellam now desires to hear the rest of your tale.","Malthellam and Rosfin are speaking in Malthellam's home.\
\
You have informed them that the Dead continue to haunt the vale.","Malthellam can be found beside the fireplace in his home.\
\
You have come to tell Malthellam and Rosfin of what you have learned of the Dead and Tarlang's Crown. You should speak to Malthellam.","Rosfin can be found beside the fireplace in Malthellam's home.\
\
You have come to tell Malthellam and Rosfin of what you have learned of the Dead and Tarlang's Crown. You should speak to Rosfin while you wait for Malthellam.","Malthellam and Rosfin are speaking in Malthellam's home.\
\
You have told them of all that you experiencing in Alagrant and Sardol, and now Malthellam and Rosfin are discussing what is to be done.","Talk to Malthellam","Instancia: El Valle Maldito","DNT -- will not be seen","Malthellam can be found beside the fireplace in his home.\
\
You have finished discussing matters with Rosfin and Malthellam and should speak to Malthellam once more before readying yourself to journey into the vale once more.","Recount your <rgb=#FF00FF>story</rgb> to Malthellam and Rosfin","After aiding the villages of Alagrant and Sardol, you have uncovered dangerous, new threats to Blackroot Vale that you must reveal to Malthellam and Rosfin."}},
[7186]={nameES="Instancia: El Ataque Audaz, Amanecer",objectivesES={"Talk to Cynstan on the east bank of the Isen","Théodred is on the eyot in the middle of the river Isen. Cynstan has asked you to tell him that the Ford will be in Cadda's capable hands while the Prince rides to Isengard.","Cadda is on the east bank of the Ford, and he wants to speak with you.","Travel up the road to Isengard","The scout has returned from Isengard and brings word to Théodred that the number of Orcs and half-orcs outside the walls is not to be feared.\
\
Théodred wants to discuss this report with you.","Mount your steed and talk to Grimbold when you are ready to ride","You have come part of the way up the road to Isengard, and now Théodred is waiting for the return of his scout. You should speak with the Prince.","Théodred is waiting to speak with you on the eyot in the middle of the Isen.\
\
It is dawn and nearly time to begin the daring strike on Isengard. Théodred is waiting to speak with you before his host rides north.","You have travelled up the road towards Isengard with the host, and Grimbold wants to speak with you.","Talk to Théodred on the eyot in the Isen","Talk to Cadda on the east bank of the river Isen","Théodred has given Cynstan a message to deliver and is waiting to speak with you again.","Talk to Grimbold on the road to Isengard","Talk to Cynstan on the eyot in the Isen","Cynstan is on the eyot in the middle of the river Isen.","The sun rose on the Twenty-fifth of February, and Théodred and Grimbold made final preparations for a daring strike on the forces of Isengard.","Cynstan is on the east bank of the river Isen and wants to talk to you.","Talk to Cynstan in the middle of the Ford","Théodred has asked you to mount your steed and talk to Grimbold when you are ready to ride to Isengard.","Cynstan is in the middle of the Ford. He is concerned about something and wants to speak with you.","Talk to Théodred on the road to Isengard","Instancia: El Ataque Audaz, Amanecer","You have travelled up the road towards Isengard with the host.","Cross the Ford of Isen once more and speak with Théodred on the eyot"}},
[7187]={nameES="Instancia: El Ataque Audaz, Mediodía",objectivesES={"Before the gates of Isengard, the Rohirrim led by Théodred have come under attack by an overwhelming force of Saruman's uruks.\
\
You need to speak with Grimbold amid the chaos of battle!","Talk to Grimbold at the head of the host","The riders have netted some of the attacking uruks, and Grimbold has charged you with defeating them in order to buy time for the retreat.","Prince Théodred has asked you and Grimbold to cut through the brush on the eastern side of the road to attack the half-orc flank.","Prince Théodred and his host have come to the gates of Isengard, and it is now time for his daring strike to begin.","Instancia: El Ataque Audaz, Mediodía","Talk to Rungar","Théodred is waiting to address his assembled men, and you should speak with him.","Talk to Grimbold before the gates of Isengard","Rungar has arrived on the flank of the main host, and you should speak with him.","Talk to Théodred"}},
[7188]={nameES="Instancia: La hora más oscura",objectivesES={"Denethor has emerged from the tower, ready to die for his city and his people.","Talk to Imrahil","Your mind is filled with terrible visions, but the voice of the Steward cuts through the frightening images.","Talk to Denethor amid the terrible visions","Your mind is full of hazy, troubled images","Escape from the enemy and find Peregrin Took","Imrahil has slain many Orcs, and has called to you for news of the gate.","The Witch-king is victorious!","You have been captured by the Enemy!","Talk to Mithrandir before the broken gate","Shake off your reverie, and talk to Denethor","Witness the confrontation between Mithrandir and the Witch-king of Angmar","Denethor is standing before you, his face an earnest mask of despair and hopelessness.","Talk to Denethor before he succumbs to his wounds","Wait for a chance to turn the tables on your captors","Talk to Gothmog atop the city","Fight alongside Denethor atop the city","Denethor has been wounded.","You have hurried down to the ruin of the gates with Mithrandir. Only he can stand against the Witch-king.","Instancia: La hora más oscura","Peregrin Took is in grave danger!","Gondor's darkest hour has come. The forces of Mordor have broken the gates of Minas Tirith, and the Witch-king of Angmar has brought his master's evil to bear upon the defenders of the White City.","You must find Peregrin Took and protect him from the forces of the Enemy!","A shrill voice pierces the thin air above the city","Mithrandir stands alone before the Witch-king, blocking his passage into the city.","Gothmog stands before you at the top of the city, secure in victory.","Remain alert for any chance to help Peregrin or Denethor!"}},
[7189]={nameES="Instancia: El día que llegó el gigante",objectivesES={"Instancia: El día que llegó el gigante","Something evil bears down on Dunfast.\
\
You should ensure that everyone has evacuated their homes.","You have gathered some meagre belongings, but you feel a great urge to keep moving","Ludeca is in Dunfast.\
\
You should speak with Ludeca.","Convince Forthere to evacuate","You find that you have not the will to go further. You are too afraid, brave though you are....","You have entered your own home","A terrible rumbling shakes the earth","Ask Ludeca about the snow","Forthere's house is on the outskirts of Dunfast.\
\
You should break into Forthere's house.","Talk to Ludeca","The rumbling came from north-west of town.\
\
You should search for the source of the rumbling.","The unearthly chill in Iothete's home reminds you that Iothete rarely comes here anymore. You hope that he is safe.","Léofburg reluctantly agrees to meet outside of Dunfast","You have come outside of your home in town to find the snow worse than any weather you have seen in this part of Rohan.","Break the lock to Forthere's home","Forthere is in his home in Dunfast.\
\
You should convince Forthere to evacuate immediately.","Ludeca is terrified of the sudden change of weather in Dunfast, as terrified as you are yourself","Listen to your neighbours","Search near the windmill for the source of the rumbling","You fear for your elderly neighbour, but an uncertain fate in the frozen wild is better than certain death in Dunfast","Get everyone out! Something evil bears down on Dunfast.","Forthere's home is locked, as always. It is best to come back when all else is done.","The rumbling sounded like it came from near the windmill","Forthere, beaten, was carried out and evacuated with the others....","Tell Ludeca of the terrible force north-west of Dunfast"}},
[7190]={nameES="Instancia: El entretenimiento del día",objectivesES={"Instancia: El entretenimiento del día","Watch the performance","Ulishár eagerly waits for the play to begin in the city of Zajâna.","Something has captured Inkanûsh's attention.","Talk to Inkanûsh in the audience","You and your companions have joined the audience to watch a theatrical entertainment performed by Têrkar's Travellers, a troupe to which Ulishár is indebted.","While the performance continues, you should remain a model audience member.","Ulishár enjoyed the performance, but his expression is one of worry.","Talk to Ulishár in the audience"}},
[7191]={nameES="Instancia: La Cena Mortal",objectivesES={"You hear a loud crash upstairs!","A loud crash came from upstairs.\
\
You should find the source of the crash.","Dagrun has been named Master!\
\
You should talk to Dagrun.","Instancia: La Cena Mortal","Hoskuld ran into the kitchen, seeming unwell.\
\
You should talk to Dagrun.","The dinner guests are conversing.\
\
You should listen to the conversation.","Listen to the conversation","You must accuse someone of murder!\
\
Choose wisely!","The dinner guests have all split up.\
\
You should talk to Dagrun.","Háta is dead!\
\
You should talk to Dagrun!","Maeriel has left the room, angered at the other guests' behaviour.\
\
You should go check on Maeriel.","A grand dinner is being hosted by the Elders of Lake-town, but the shadow of the late Master's murder still hangs over the manor. Something wicked is about to unfold.","Accuse someone of murder!","Maeriel lies slumped on the floor. She has been stabbed through the back with a carving knife!","Háta did not return with the others.\
\
You should find Háta.","Find the source of the crash","Frekur did not commit the murders!","Maeriel is dead!\
\
You should talk to Dagrun!","Hoskuld lies on the floor, unmoving, his face a deep maroon colour. You lean in closer and realize he is not breathing!","Find Háta","Thewár looks to have several broken bones from the fall, but the back of his head is bloody, as if struck by a heavy object. He is dead!","Háta is dead!","Check on Hoskuld","Orgrand seems disoriented and barely notices you approach.\
\
'What... what happened? I think someone struck me... Sútvif?'","Check on Thewár","Talk to Captain Álarr","Thewár has suddenly fallen down the stairs!\
\
You should check on Thewár!","Talk to Rikolf the Elder","Háta lies on the floor. You see red marks around her neck. She has been strangled!","Dagrun has been waiting for you.\
\
You should talk to Dagrun.","Hoskuld ran into the kitchen, seemingly unwell.\
\
You should check on Hoskuld.","Orgrand did not commit the murders!","Talk to Dagrun","Dagrun did not commit the murders!","Captain Álarr has arrived downstairs.\
\
You should talk to Álarr.","You accuse Rikolf of murder!","Maeriel is dead!","Rikolf the Elder wants to speak with you.\
\
You should talk to Rikolf the Elder.","Hoskuld is dead!","Hoskuld is dead!\
\
You should talk to Dagrun!","Thewár is dead!","Check on Maeriel","Thewár is dead!\
\
You should talk to Dagrun!"}},
[7192]={nameES="Instancia: La muerte de Scatha",objectivesES={"Approach the vision of Karazgar and Fram","<rgb=#FF0000>Karazgar must survive this tale</rgb>","For Léothred and Fróthi, the truth of how Fram slayed Scatha is finally revealed.","Experience the vision","Experience the vision.","You can hear Karazgar's thoughts.\
\
'Seek your fame and riches, petty Fram. You are now a servant of Karazgar, whether you know it or not.'","Instancia: La muerte de Scatha","<rgb=#FF0000>Fram must survive this tale</rgb>","Approach the vision of Karazgar and Fram."}},
[7193]={nameES="Instancia: La Defensa de Arnach",objectivesES={"<rgb=#FF0000>Indir has been defeated!</rgb>","Baranor stands on the bridge before Arnach's keep.\
\
The Haradrim assault has be deflected. Baranor waits to talk with you.","<rgb=#FF0000>Dagor must not be defeated</rgb>","Talk to Baranor","Defend Arnach","<rgb=#FF0000>Dagor has been defeated!</rgb>","Baranor stands on the bridge before Arnach's keep.\
\
Defend the keep with Baranor and his men.","Instancia: La Defensa de Arnach","<rgb=#FF0000>Baranor has been defeated!</rgb>","Baranor stands on the bridge before Arnach's keep.\
\
The Haradrim are likely to attack soon. Talk to Baranor now.","<rgb=#FF0000>Indir must not be defeated</rgb>","<rgb=#FF0000>Baranor must not be defeated</rgb>","Baranor and his men brace themselves against the oncoming Haradrim assault."}},
[7194]={nameES="Instancia: La defensa de Faldham",objectivesES={"Nothwulf can be found to the south-west, along the road near the southern farms.\
\
Elfmar has asked you to aid Nothwulf defend the southern perimeter.","Nothwulf can be found to the south-west, along the road near the southern farms.\
\
Nothwulf will need your aid to defend the southern perimeter.","Botglim has been defeated","Elfmar and members of the Elfward await at the opening to the mead hall of Faldham.\
\
Elfmar and the Elfward must be notified that you have defeated the commanders of the attacking army.","Speak to Nothwulf along the road to the south-west","Osin has approached Nothwulf from the west","Nothwulf is prepared to defend the southern border","Speak to Thane Elfmar at the mead hall gates","Defeat Urbhár, the Orc commander","Defend Faldham with the help of Thane Elfmar","Ride with Osin to defend the south-west edge of Faldham","Langfrith defends the gate to the mead hall of Faldham.\
\
Langfrith has been guarding the mead hall entrance, and Osin believes that he may need your assistance.","The enemy forces have been routed","Elfmar has asked you to aid Nothwulf to the south-west","Elfmar remains ready, just north of the road fork at the north edge of Faldham.\
\
The defence against the White Hand forces has begun, and Thane Elfmar seems both confident and prepared.","Urbhár has been defeated","Defeat Botglim, the Uruk commander","Ride with Nothwulf to defend the southern perimeter","Thane Elfmar has gathered the Elfward and prepared for a strike against the village of Faldham. The Rohirrim intend to defend against the waves of Orcs and Uruks without the aid of Athelward or Théoden's riders.","Speak with Nothwulf about the defences","Langfrith believes the invading commanders can be found north of the mead hall","Urbhár and Botglim can be found north of the mead hall.\
\
Langfrith believes that defeating the commanders of the invaders, Urbhár and Botglim, may disrupt the ongoing assault.","Elfmar remains ready, just north of the road fork at the north edge of Faldham.\
\
Thane Elfmar wishes to speak with you about the defences of Faldham.","Speak to Langfrith guarding the mead hall gates","Nothwulf has asked you to aid Osin defend to the west","Speak to Thane Elfmar","Nothwulf awaits at the southern edge of Faldham.\
\
Nothwulf wishes to speak about the ongoing defence of the town.","Instancia: La defensa de Faldham"}},
[7195]={nameES="Instancia: La defensa de Galtrev",objectivesES={"The servants of Isengard want revenge for the uprising of the people of Galtrev.","The Gathering Hall cannot be saved","Defeat the Uruk-hai master and his forces","Galtrev is safe for now","Defend Galtrev from the White Hand forces.","Do not allow the Gathering Hall to burn","The White Hand is attacking","Bron is in Galtrev.","Instancia: La defensa de Galtrev","Talk to Bron","You should talk to Bron."}},
[7196]={nameES="Instancia: La defensa de Puente de Caballetes",objectivesES={"Has defendido Puente de Caballetes","Habla con Halbarad","Has viajado con Halbarad a Puente de Caballetes para ayudar en su defensa contra los orcos de la tribu Ongbúrz.","Halbarad se encuentra en Puente de Caballetes, cerca de Nellie Bosquejo.\
\
Junto a Halbarad y el pueblo de Trestlebridge, has defendido la ciudad contra los orcos Ongbúrz.","Ayuda a Halbarad en la defensa de Puente de Caballetes.","Instancia: La defensa de Puente de Caballetes"}},
[7197]={nameES="Instancia: La defensa de Puente de Caballetes",objectivesES={"Has defendido Puente de Caballetes","Habla con Halbarad","Has viajado con Halbarad a Puente de Caballetes para ayudar en su defensa contra los orcos de la tribu Ongbúrz.","Halbarad se encuentra en Puente de Caballetes, cerca de Nellie Bosquejo.\
\
Junto a Halbarad y el pueblo de Trestlebridge, has defendido la ciudad contra los orcos Ongbúrz.","Ayuda a Halbarad en la defensa de Puente de Caballetes.","Instancia: La defensa de Puente de Caballetes"}},
[7198]={nameES="Instancia: El desastre",objectivesES={"Instancia: El desastre","Vágari believed Isildur attempted to swim across the river in order to escape.","Find some sign that Isildur made for the river-bank","Hear the words of Vëamacil as remembered by Vágari","Talk to Vágari the Wanderer","Talk to Tárandil","Vágari the Wanderer desires to speak to you of his past misdeeds.","Vágari believed Isildur ran for the river-bank, and he desperately searched for some sign of the king's escape.","Swim across the river to find Isildur","The shade that came to be called Vágari the Wanderer desires to confess to you the misdeeds of his past.","Hear the words of Meldaran as remembered by Vágari","Listen to Vágari's account"}},
[7199]={nameES="Instancia: Las lealtades divididas de Glúrkub el Trasgo",objectivesES={"Survive the reemergence of Hrímil Frost-heart","Instancia: Las lealtades divididas de Glúrkub el Trasgo","Acquiring the mithril hammer for Gorgar was only the beginning.","Carry out Gorgar's plan","Gorgar has chosen you for some unknown purpose.","The War of Three Peaks is underway!","You have run with Muzmák from the War of Three Peaks... but how far will be enough?","Command Ránulur to fight on behalf of Gorgar","Glúrkub tiene una historia que contar... pero ¿cuánto de ella se puede creer?","Continue working for Gorgar","Hrímil Frost-heart has emerged from her icy prison behind the Anvil of Winterstith!","Muzmák stands in silence upon the snowfield.","Talk to Muzmák in Durshulot","Gorgar has need of a goblin to acquire a valuable treasure for him.","Continue your flight from the war","Muzmák gave you the names of three similar-minded residents of Durshulot who might help you escape from the growing conflict beneath Gundabad.","An unexpected visitor has interrupted your plans.","You ran far from the battle-lines, eventually finding yourself on distant snowfields.","Collect the mithril treasure sought by Gorgar","Muzmák is waiting to speak with you.","Talk to Zogmauk","Talk to Muzmák during the War of Three Peaks","Gorgar believes there is a mithril treasure in the room on this side of the rock-fall.","Talk to Shulgolb","You served Gorgar faithfully and well.","Carry out the wishes of Gorgar the Ruthless","Talk to Lumbag","Talk to Muzmák as he catches his breath","Gorgar the Ruthless has sent you to command the loyalty of Ránulur, Chieftain of Wargs.","Remain alert during Gorgar's inspection","Talk to Gorgar the Ruthless","Talk to Muzmák"}},
[7200]={nameES="Instancia: El Destino del Norte",objectivesES={"Debes encontrar las Forjas de los Anillos de Tham Mírdain.","Aunque gravemente herido, Laerdan aún respira débilmente.","Sigue a Amarthiel y a Mordrambor","Amarthiel no te presta atención alguna, consumida por completo por su aflicción. Aunque ha sufrido terriblemente a manos de sus antiguos aliados, todavía puede representar una amenaza para el Norte. Debes llevarla como prisionera de los Pueblos Libres y dejarla a su merced.","Un Laerdan gravemente herido yace al pie del puente","Has llegado cerca de las ruinas de Tham Mírdain, las Forjas de los Anillos de Eregion, donde Amarthiel pretende reforjar a Narchuil. Debes encontrar la manera de poner fin a su plan.","Strok derrotado","Entra en Tham Mírdain","Has encontrado a Laerdan en la entrada de Tham Mírdain, gravemente herido. Deberías averiguar a través de él qué ocurrió.","Encuentra las Forjas de los Anillos de Tham Mírdain","Debes encontrar a Amarthiel antes de que pueda reforjar a Narchuil.","Has descubierto las Forjas de los Anillos de Tham Mírdain","Has entrado en Tham Mírdain","Instancia: El Destino del Norte","Derrota al guardián de la puerta, Strok","Amarthiel fue interrumpida por la llegada del Númenóreano Negro Mordrambor. Deberías seguirlos para descubrir qué nuevo mal ha surgido.","Laerdan te indicó que encontraras y derrotaras al Gorthorog Strok, quien posee las llaves de Tham Mírdain.","Debes enfrentarte a Amarthiel en las Forjas de los Anillos de Tham Mírdain.","Enfréntate a Amarthiel","Deberías usar las llaves recuperadas de Strok para ingresar en Tham Mírdain.","Encuentra a Amarthiel en algún lugar dentro de Tham Mírdain"}},
[7201]={nameES="Instancia: Los Huesos del Dragón",objectivesES={"Fasti is speaking with the owner of the tavern in order to arrange a table for you.","Talk to Ránnvig in the Dragonbone Inn","Talk to Kólfith in the Dragonbone Inn","Follow Fasti to your table","Wait inside the Dragonbone Inn for Kólfith to arrive","Return to your table by the fire","Authi Gem-cutter is in the Dragonbone Inn, and he wishes to speak to you.","This patron of the Dragonbone Inn has had more than his share and pays you no mind.","Survive the confrontation in the Dragonbone Inn","Talk to Fasti inside the Dragonbone Inn","You have some time to wait before Kólfith arrives","The dwarf ignores you. He seems content to sit and take in the scenery, keeping to himself.","You should return to your table in the Dragonbone Inn.","Fasti told you to wait for Kólfith to arrive.","A man of Lake-town has offered you information on Karazgar, the Weeping Warrior, and agreed to meet you inside the Dragonbone Inn.","A dwarf has come to your table in the Dragonbone Inn.","Authi Gem-cutter has been defeated!","Talk to Authi Gem-cutter in the Dragonbone Inn","This man of Lake-town spends most of his days in the Dragonbone Inn, deep in his cups. He has no information for you, or if he does he is in no condition to share it with you.","Fasti is inside the Dragonbone Inn, waiting to show you to a table where you can wait for Kólfith.","Instancia: Los Huesos del Dragón","Kólfith has come to the Dragonbone Inn, seeking to punish you for asking about Karazgar.","Kólfith has come to the Dragonbone Inn, but his friendly demeanor has fallen away and he seems eager for a fight.","<rgb=#FF0000>Authi Gem-cutter must not be defeated</rgb>","Remain alert for signs of trouble","Ránnvig, the proprietor of the Dragonbone Inn, has some words for you."}},
[7202]={nameES="Instancia: El Enano Soñador",objectivesES={"Witness the visions granted by Mótsog","Durin stands in the forgotten chamber deep beneath Gundabad, boiling with rage.","The dwarf claiming to be Mótsog has promised to show Durin forgotten sights.","The dwarf claiming to be Mótsog says he can show Durin what he has forgotten.","A strange sorcery envelopes the forgotten chamber deep below Gundabad. What secrets lie within?","Witness the visions granted by the stranger","Durin has asked you to remain alert for any sign of danger.","Talk to Mótsog","Mótsog has promised to show Durin forgotten sights.","Instancia: El Enano Soñador","Mantente en guardia","Talk to Durin in the forgotten chamber","It cannot be denied that Mótsog possesses a curious power. How can he reveal these visions to you?","Talk to the strange dwarf"}},
[7203]={nameES="Instancia: La Tesorería Ahogada",objectivesES={"Entra en Ghân-gharâf a través del pasaje despejado","A través de pasajes secretos llenos de agua, el Guardián del Agua ha regresado a Ghân-gharâf para descubrir algo inesperado: aventureros que desean desafiarlo.","Habla con Bróin","Bori ha despejado un camino hacia Ghân-gharâf y ahora deberías adentrarte por él.","Instancia: La Tesorería Ahogada","Bróin está débil, pero quizás puedas rescatarlo de las profundidades inundadas antes de que el Guardián regrese furioso.","Habla con Bori","Los túneles inundados que conectan Gundlajân y Ghân-gharâf están bloqueados por antiguos mecanismos de fabricación enana, y también están infestados de todo tipo de criaturas horribles. Ambos problemas deberán ser resueltos.","Has acompañado a Bori a los pasajes inundados bajo las Obras Hidráulicas, donde él cree que aún podría encontrarse Zigilburk.","Enfréntate al Guardián del Agua","Bori está justo dentro de la puerta que da acceso a Gundlajân.\
\
Bori te espera para explicarte su plan.","Despeja un camino a través de los túneles inundados para llegar a Ghân-gharâf","Has descubierto a Bróin en las ruinas inundadas de Ghân-gharâf. A pesar de su lucha contra el Guardián del Agua frente a las Puertas de Durin, sigue vivo."}},
[7204]={nameES="Instancia: ¡Vienen las águilas!",objectivesES={"Find Frodo on the slopes of Orodruin","You have found Frodo and Sam on the slope of Mount Doom, but you do not have long before the slope will be engulfed in flame!","You have obtained the Phial of Galadriel","Mithrandir is on the slag-hill before the Black Gate.","Remain on your guard!","Aragorn is on the slag-hill as the Battle of the Morannon rages all around him.","You found Frodo and Sam... they are alive!","You must stand on the edge of the outcropping if Gwaihir and his kin are to see you!","Instancia: ¡Vienen las águilas!","Talk to Samwise Gamgee on Orodruin","Talk to Aragorn on the slag hill","The Eagles have come to the aid of the Host of the West, and the tide of battle has turned!","Talk to Mithrandir on the slag hill","Landroval has set you down upon the slope of Mount Doom while the Eagles circle the Mountain and seek for Frodo on the far side.","Talk to Mithrandir on the slag-hill","Walk to the edge of the outcropping... there is little time to spare!"}},
[7205]={nameES="Instancia: La Casa Mayor",objectivesES={"Hersegg can be found at Mîn Lorg.\
\
After encountering a large company of Angmarim during your attempted escape, you have found the way out of Mîn Lorg blocked. You should talk to Hersegg.","Hersegg can be found at Mîn Lorg.\
\
You have come to the entryway of an ancient dwelling at Mîn Lorg. You should talk to Hersegg.","Thrástan can be found at Mîn Lorg.\
\
After rescuing Thrástan from the Iron Crown at Mîn Lorg, the old dwarf seems to be struggling to speak. You should talk to Thrástan.","The Iron Crown has sent a company of Angmarim to block your escape!","Within the deepest reaches of Gloomingtarn, the Angmarim of the Iron Crown have unwittingly discovered a long-forgotten passage rumoured to conceal the greatest secret of Gloomingtarn.","<rgb=#FF0000>Do not allow Hersegg to be defeated</rgb>","Instancia: La Casa Mayor","<rgb=#FF0000>Hersegg has been defeated!</rgb>","Hersegg pauses, studying the structure around you","Rescue the dwarf captured by the Iron Crown","Fight through Mîn Lorg with Hersegg","Hersegg can be found at Mîn Lorg.\
\
After helping Thrástan to his feet, you grow concerned that the Angmarim will soon return to Mîn Lorg. You should talk to Hersegg.","Hersegg can be found at Mîn Lorg.\
\
You have found an old dwarf captured by the Iron Crown at Mîn Lorg. You should rescue the dwarf.","Escape Mîn Lorg with Hersegg and Thrástan","Hermáth Stormhammer can be found at Mîn Lorg.\
\
To your surprise, Hermáth Stormhammer and his warriors arrived to rescue you from the Angmarim of the Iron Crown. You should talk to Hermáth Stormhammer.","As the last of the Angmarim falls defeated, Hermáth Stormhammer calls you over","Hersegg and Thrástan can be found at Mîn Lorg.\
\
You should attempt to overcome the Angmarim of the Iron Crown barring your escape from Mîn Lorg.","Talk to Hersegg","As the Angmarim fall defeated, the old dwarf looks to you","Hersegg can be found at Mîn Lorg.\
\
You have entered Mîn Lorg to confront the Iron Crown with Hersegg. You should talk to Hersegg.","After spying something in the distance, Hersegg quietly calls you over","Hersegg can be found at Mîn Lorg.","Talk to Thrástan","Hersegg can be found at Mîn Lorg.\
\
Hersegg has spied something in the distance at Mîn Lorg. You should talk to Hersegg.","Defend Thrástan from the Iron Crown","Hersegg and Thrástan can be found at Mîn Lorg.","Talk to Hermáth Stormhammer"}},
[7206]={nameES="Instancia: El Pasaje Vacío",objectivesES={"<rgb=#FF0000>Saluda</rgb> o <rgb=#FF0000>felicita</rgb> o <rgb=#FF0000>honra</rgb> la memoria de Ongli","Has protegido a Bósi de los trasgos","Viaja con Bósi al Corazón de Fuego","Bósi está en el Corazón de Fuego, contemplando las majestuosas forjas ocultas.","Tú y Bósi han llegado a un pasillo descuidado en las Profundidades Occidentales, con la esperanza de encontrar una entrada a Nâr-khelab, el Corazón de Fuego.","Busca en las forjas de la derecha","La suposición de Bósi era correcta, y has encontrado la ubicación del Corazón de Fuego.","Busca en las forjas del centro","No hay señales de Zigilburk cerca de estas forjas","Busca en las forjas de la izquierda","Bósi te ha pedido que investigues el Corazón de Fuego, buscando a Zigilburk, el hacha de mithril.","Bósi está en el pasillo donde cree que se puede encontrar la entrada al Corazón de Fuego.\
\
Bósi te está esperando para hablar sobre cómo buscar la entrada.","Bósi está en el pasillo donde cree que se puede encontrar la entrada al Corazón de Fuego.","Bósi cree que saludando o felicitando la memoria del enano que construyó el Corazón de Fuego, podrás acceder a él.","Instancia: El Pasaje Vacío","Habla con Bósi."}},
[7207]={nameES="Instancia: El intercambio",objectivesES={"El Guardián de la puerta te ha llamado a pasar por la puerta de Dol Guldur para discutir el intercambio de Mazog por los enanos prisioneros.","Habla con Bróin","El intercambio ha sido un fracaso, y debes escapar... si puedes!","Ha llegado el momento de realizar el intercambio de Mazog por los enanos prisioneros. Muchos destinos pueden decidirse por el resultado de esta negociación...","Sigileth te ignora, su rostro es una máscara de ira y dolor. Decides dejarla en paz.","Sobrevive y escapa, si puedes","Bróin está apoyado en un bastón, esperando para hablar contigo.","Achardor se encuentra en la cima de la colina que lo separa de Bróin.","Achardor está esperando para hablar contigo sobre el próximo intercambio de Mazog por los enanos prisioneros.","Habla con Sigileth","Permanece junto a la Guardia Oculta mientras el guardián de la puerta considera la oferta","Habla con Achardor","Achardor ha pedido hablar contigo antes de que continúes hacia la puerta.","La Guardia Oculta está lista en las puertas de Dol Guldur, esperando el regreso del Guardián de la puerta.","Bróin ha regresado, pero ¿con qué propósito dejó Gadorgar sin previo aviso?","Achardor está tratando de decidir qué se puede hacer.","Viaja con la Guardia Oculta hasta las puertas de Dol Guldur","Los Elfos de la Guardia Oculta tienen una decisión que tomar: esperar a que Bróin regrese o llevar a Mazog a las puertas de Dol Guldur sin él.","Instancia: El intercambio","Espera a que la Guardia Oculta decida qué se puede hacer","La Guardia Oculta se ha retirado de las puertas de Dol Guldur para reagruparse en Ost Galadh, su misión ha fracasado.","Sigue a la Guardia Oculta más allá de la puerta","Los Elfos de la Guardia Oculta lidian con la frustración y las palabras maliciosas de Mazog mientras deciden qué hacer.","Achardor está preocupado por los términos del acuerdo tal como los presentó Gorothúl.","Continúa las negociaciones","Habla con Cúcheron","El guardián de las puertas de Dol Guldur está considerando la oferta.","Bróin se encuentra abajo de la colina que lo separa de Achardor y el resto de la Guardia Oculta.","La Guardia Oculta ha llegado a las puertas de Dol Guldur con el prisionero Mazog.","Gorothúl ha usado sus poderes para congelarte en el lugar, como lo hizo antes de Zabadgathol.","Habla con Gorothúl","Gorothúl ha salido de la fortaleza para negociar el intercambio de Mazog por los enanos prisioneros."}},
[7208]={nameES="Instancia: El Ojo de Angmar",objectivesES={"Entra en Barad Tironn y busca la Piedra Vidente","La Piedra Vidente está sobre su pedestal en lo profundo de Barad Tironn.\
\
Laerdan ha dado la señal: alguien del grupo debe tomar la Piedra Vidente y llevarla a Calenglad en la entrada de Barad Tironn. ¡Rápido!","Calenglad se encuentra en la entrada de Barad Tironn.\
\
Debes proteger a quien transporte la Piedra Vidente y asegurarte de que llegue a manos de Calenglad en la entrada de Barad Tironn. ¡Rápido!","Has entregado la Piedra Vidente a Calenglad","La Piedra Vidente se encuentra en algún lugar dentro de Barad Tironn.\
\
Debes encontrar la Piedra Vidente y robarla antes de que Amarthiel pueda usarla para descubrir la ubicación de Narchuil.","Entrega la Piedra Vidente a Calenglad en la entrada de Barad Tironn","Amarthiel y la Piedra Vidente están dentro de Barad Tironn.\
\
Laerdan se ha enfrentado a Amarthiel y ahora aguardas su señal para tomar la Piedra Vidente y sacarla de Barad Tironn.","Sobrevive al encuentro con Amarthiel","Instancia: El Ojo de Angmar","Alguien debe tomar la Piedra Vidente","Laerdan escuchó de manera imprudente las palabras de Mordrambor y se internó solo en Barad Tironn para desafiar a Amarthiel. Calenglad te ha pedido que le robes la Piedra Vidente y ayudes a Laerdan si es posible."}},
[7209]={nameES="Instancia: El desvanecimiento de los bosques",objectivesES={"You have led Agalûnu to Shanthar's abode in the wooded grove of Arwáth. Agalûnu wants to talk to you.","You have led Agalûnu to Shanthar's abode in the wooded grove of Arwáth. You should stop and appreciate the beauty of the grove with Agalûnu.","Shanthar gazes at the woman, his expression unreadable.\
\
'You know not of which you speak, child. I have sworn an oath to steward these grounds and protect them with my life. Why I have done so is none of your concern. What I do not understand is why Men insist on destroying everything beautiful in Middle-earth.\
\
'Trees provide shade, they disrupt harsh winds, they protect the soil from the river. They provide homes to birds, squirrels and insects. They provide food for all. Long ago, this entire valley was a forest, dense with trees exactly like these. Then Men came and 'put them to use' as you would do. They are already in use, only you do not see it.'","Talk to Agalûnu","Instancia: El desvanecimiento de los bosques","Outraged that a Kinta Elf shot her with an arrow in an attempt to get her to leave Arwáth, Agalûnu has asked you to escort her into the grove to confront Shanthar.","Listen to the conversation","Talk to Shanthar","The secluded grove is peaceful and majestic","You have led Agalûnu to Shanthar's abode in the wooded grove of Arwáth. You should listen to their conversation.","You have led Agalûnu to Shanthar's abode in the wooded grove of Arwáth. You should talk to Agalûnu.","You have led Agalûnu to Shanthar's abode in the wooded grove of Arwáth. Shanthar has something to say to Agalûnu.","<rgb=#00FF00>Look</rgb> at the beauty of Arwáth"}},
[7210]={nameES="Instancia: La Caída de Moria",objectivesES={"Habla con Náin","Durin VI se encuentra junto a la comitiva en las profundas cavernas bajo Khazad-dûm.\
\
Durin espera hablar contigo.","Náin se encuentra con lo que queda de la comitiva en las profundas cavernas de Khazad-dûm.\
\
Durin ha caído ante la terrible criatura que dormía bajo Khadaz-dûm, y ahora Náin es el soberano del reino de los enanos.","Durin VI, Señor de Moria, se encuentra en el estrado al norte del gran salón del trono.\
\
Está esperando para hablar contigo sobre cierto asunto antes de que llegue la comitiva de elfos de Lórien.","Corría el año 1980 de la Tercera Edad. Eres Nafni, un fiel sirviente de Durin VI, señor de Khazad-dûm, y no tienes la menor idea de lo que les deparará a tus hermanos enanos en esta fatídica noche.","Durin VI se encuentra junto a la comitiva en las profundas cavernas bajo Khazad-dûm\
\
Durin está esperando a que limpies la caverna de rascacuevas y rascabismos.","Sverri se encuentra en la enterada principal del salón del trono, al sur del gran estrado de Durin.\
\
Durin te ha pedido que hables con él y aguardéis a la comitiva de elfos de Lórien.","Durin VI se encuentra en el estrado, al norte del salón del trono.\
\
Náin te ha pedido que le comuniques a su padre que la hueste de elfos de Lothlórien ya ha llegado.","Un gran terror dormido bajo Khazad-dûm durante una larga edad.","Sverri se encuentra ante las puertas, frente al gran trono de Durin.\
\
El portero del salón del trono está esperando para hablar contigo sobre cierto asunto.","Durin VI y su comitiva se dirigen a los yacimientos de mithril, en las profundas cavernas bajo Khazad-dûm.","Instancia: La Caída de Moria","Ayuda a romper el muro agrietado","Melkólf Tallapiedras se encuentra en el lado oeste del salón del trono de Durin.\
\
Este te ha pedido que le encargues una estatua de su hijo Náin.","Desde su estrado, al norte del trono.\
\
Durin ansía deslumbrar a los elfos de Lothlórien con la magnificencia de las minas de mithril.","Durin VI se encuentra junto al estrado del gran salón del trono.\
\
Regresa con él e infórmale de que Melkólf Tallapiedras ha aceptado esculpir una gran estatua para su hijo Náin.","Sigue a Durin VI y a su compañía","Durin VI se encuentra junto a la comitiva en las profundas cavernas bajo Khazad-dûm\
\
Durin está esperando a que le ayudes a atravesar el muro agrietado bajo Khazad-dûm.","Habla con Sverri","Habla con Melkólf Tallapiedra","Sobrevive!","Durin VI se dirige a los elfos de Lothlórien.","Habla con Náin, señor de Moria","Espera a que Durin VI termine de dirigirse a los Elfos","Habla con Durin VI","Náin se encuentra ante las puertas del salón del trono de Durin junto a la comitiva de elfos de Lórien\
\
Náin espera hablar contigo."}},
[7211]={nameES="Instancia: El Premio Fatal",objectivesES={"Instancia: El Premio Fatal","Wait with Captain Lachír for his men to return.","You have found Captain Lachír. He, in turn, has found ingots of metal he believes are imbued with great power, and ordered his men to gather all they could find.","Wait with Captain Lachír","Defend yourselves from Captain Lachír's men","Defend yourselves once more","There is a pause in the onslaught. Captain Lachír wishes to speak.","Help clean off the encrusted object in front of Captain Lachír.","Something has come over Captain Lachír's men and they are attacking without regard.","When you meet Lachír's eyes in the light, there is a wildness behind a mask of bravery. It is fear.\
\
'Have all my men turned on me? Can I have pushed them too far in search of something powerful, something truly magnificent? Can sullen resentment - or greed, greed and jealousy have driven them to such ends?\
\
'But what am I saying? Did you see their faces? It was madness, madness and not mutiny written there, plain as day.'\
\
The captain falls silent abruptly, brooding.","Talk to Captain Lachír while you wait for his men to return.","Talk to Captain Lachír","With an anguished cry, the captain runs off and is lost to the deepening shadows","Clean off the artifact","More of Captain Lachír's men are attacking."}},
[7212]={nameES="Instancia: El Destino de Laerdan",objectivesES={"Laerdan ha sido engañado. Debe defenderse del ataque de Amarthiel, la Campeona de Angmar...","Encuentra a Narmeleth","Instancia: El Destino de Laerdan","Sobrevive al ataque de Amarthiel","Elrond está preocupado por el destino de Laerdan en Tham Mírdain...","Laerdan sigue buscando incluso ahora a su amada hija Narmeleth, con la esperanza de llevarle los fragmentos de Narchuil y devolverle la cordura."}},
[7213]={nameES="Instancia: El destino del Ectheldur",objectivesES={"Derrota a Naegir y a los buscadores de restos","Tarneth se está preparando para regresar a Tinnudir.","Naegir te ha tendido una emboscada en el islote del Lago Evendim.","Sigue a Tarneth","Los restos se encuentran en el extremo sur del islote en el Lago Evendim.","Habla con Tarneth","Tarneth ha viajado a un islote en el Lago Evendim.","Examina los restos en el pequeño islote del Lago Evendim","<rgb=#ff00ff>Mira alrededor</rgb> a los restos en el pequeño islote del Lago Evendim","Tarneth ha viajado a un islote en el Lago Evendim. Debes seguirla y explorar el islote.","Enfrenta a Naegir","Parece poco probable que estos restos sean del Ectheldur, así que quizá el mapa de Naegir estaba equivocado.","Presencia el encuentro de Tarneth con la Dama Azul","Los Montaraces del Norte en Evendim han buscado durante mucho tiempo los restos del Ectheldur, el antiguo navío insignia de Annúminas, pero sus esfuerzos no han pasado desapercibidos por un grupo de saqueadores de tumbas del sur.","Instancia: El destino del Ectheldur","Una brisa fresca recorre el islote mientras Naegir y los demás caen derrotados","La Dama Azul se desvanece en las aguas del Lago Evendim","Este es un buen lugar para <rgb=#ff00ff>mirar</rgb> los restos","Gwindeth, la Dama Azul, ha aparecido en las aguas del Lago Evendim."}},
[7214]={nameES="Instancia: El Padre de los Sutcrofts",objectivesES={"Fastred is standing outside Dagred's Grave.\
\
Having defeated the Orcs brought to his father's grave by Crúmgam, you should return to Snowbourn with Fastred.","As the last Orc falls to the ground, a moment of peace returns to Dagred's grave","Talk to Fastred","Fastred wants to speak to you of his father, Dagred, the past Reeve of the Sutcrofts.","A chill fills the air as a Man in the garb of Mordor approaches...","Crúmgam stands at the eastern side of Dagred's Grave.\
\
The darkening of the sky has heralded the arrival of a fierce Man of Mordor, Crúmgam. You and Fastred should confront this Man.","Walk with Fastred","<rgb=#FF0000>Fastred must not be defeated</rgb>","Instancia: El Padre de los Sutcrofts","Confront Crúmgam","Fastred is standing just outside his father's gravesite with Framferth.\
\
Fastred wishes to speak to you about his people and his father's legacy.","Fastred is walking through his father's gravesite."}},
[7215]={nameES="Instancia: El banquete del ciervo corredor",objectivesES={"Observe the ritual as it unfolds","The Feast of the Running Stag has been disrupted by the ill omen...","Join the Stag-clansmen and observe the rites","The crow's wing appears twisted, as if someone attempted to break it cruelly. The message it bore is still attached to its leg.\
\
You recognize at once that this was the crow you sent to the southern farm. Something very unfriendly intercepted this poor bird.\
\
It is clear that the farmer's family never received this summons.","Bring the Elder what he asks for when he is finished speaking","You have brought the Elder the final piece of the ritual set","This looks like a good place to sit and watch","The Elder smiles at you as you place the crown at his feet","Talk to Elain","Instancia: El banquete del ciervo corredor","The Feast of the Running Stag has begun.","The Feast of the Running Stag is about to begin.","You should perform the <rgb=#FF0000>/sit</rgb> emote near the bonfire to observe the festival.","You have placed the horse-tail at the Elder's feet","The Elder's ritual crown can be found at the doorway from which he entered.\
\
You should collect the crown and carry it carefully to the Elder.","The Elder has called an early end to the Feast of the Running Stag this year, due to likely danger in the south where some of his people live.","The crow was intercepted before it could reach the farm in the south","You should observe the Feast of the Running Stag.","The Feast of the Running Stag continues.","Observe the Feast of the Running Stag","Observe the rites","You have arrived at Lhan Tarren as the Feast of the Running Stag began and have been invited to join the Stag-clan for the evening.","The Elder has asked you to fetch the crown","The Elder's ritual horse-tail can be found at the doorway from which he entered.\
\
You should collect the horse-tail and carry it carefully to the Elder when he is done speaking.","The Elder's ritual spear can be found at the doorway from which he entered.\
\
You should collect the spear and carry it carefully to the Elder when he is done speaking.","Listen to the Elder","Bring the Elder what he asks for","Elain is at the Feast of the Running Stag.\
\
You should speak with Elain about the injured crow and the missing southern family."}},
[7216]={nameES="Instancia: La Comunidad Parte",objectivesES={"Elrond se encuentra frente a su casa, observando cómo la Compañía se marcha.\
\
La Compañía ahora se dirige hacia lo salvaje en una misión secreta sobre la cual descansan las esperanzas de todos los Pueblos Libres.","Gandalf se encuentra frente a la Casa de Elrond, preparándose para partir con la Compañía.\
\
Los habitantes de la casa de Elrond se han reunido para despedirse de la Compañía mientras se preparan para partir.","Boromir se encuentra orgullosamente frente a la Casa de Elrond, preparándose para partir con la Compañía.\
\
Los habitantes de la casa de Elrond se han reunido para despedirse de la Compañía mientras se preparan para partir.","Ha llegado el momento de despedirse de la Compañía, que parte para su misión secreta.","Instancia: La Comunidad Parte","Los miembros de la Compañía se encuentran frente a la Casa de Elrond, preparándose para partir.\
\
Los habitantes de la casa de Elrond se han reunido para despedirse de la Compañía mientras se preparan para partir.","Frodo está en el frente de la Casa de Elrond, preparándose para partir con la Compañía.\
\
Los habitantes de la casa de Elrond se han reunido para despedirse de la Compañía mientras se preparan para partir."}},
[7217]={nameES="Instancia: El Violín y el Tambor",objectivesES={"After an argument with her daughter, Ellen shifts her focus back to her people","Lady Fremedon of Underharrow finds herself at odds with Éowyn as she makes ready for the impending migration to Dunharrow.","Ellen Fremedon can be found outside the Mead Hall of Underharrow.\
\
You have arrived in Underharrow and should acquaint yourself with Ellen Fremedon and her family.","DNT -- Players will not see","Ellen Fremedon can be found around Underharrow.\
\
You have asked to speak more with Ellen Fremedon, and she is now telling you of the burdens that fall on Underharrow.","Ellen Fremedon can be found near the river Snowbourn in Underharrow.\
\
You have finished speaking to Ellen Fremedon and met her daughter. You should now aid her in helping the people of Rohan.","Talk to Ellen Fremedon","Instancia: El Violín y el Tambor","Walk with Ellen Fremedon"}},
[7218]={nameES="Instancia: El Primer Asalto",objectivesES={"The Mead Hall lies in north-east Walstow.\
\
Winsig has called for aid from her men, and they now endeavour to put out the fires now that the Orc force is broken.","Defend the second stable of Walstow","Winsig is standing outside the Mead Hall of Walstow.\
\
The Orc force has been repelled, and Winsig and her people are free, at least for the moment, from the danger that consumed their home.","<rgb=#FF0000>Winsig must not be defeated</rgb>","The first stable lies just to the west of the Mead Hall of Walstow.\
\
Winsig hopes to keep the Orcs from slaying the steeds of her people.","Follow Winsig into Walstow","Walstow is under siege by Orcs of the East Wall who have finally brought their plans to fruition. Winsig and her folk require aid or another settlement of the Sutcrofts will fall to the same grim fate as Hytbold.","Having witnessed the slaying of many steeds, Winsig sets off to the other stable of Walstow","Gadhumúrz stands just beyond the bridge of Walstow.\
\
Winsig must reunite with her men, but a menacing Orc blocks your path.","Derrota a Gadhumúrz","Talk to Winsig","The nearby stables burst into flames!","Winsig stands just outside Walstow.\
\
The town is under siege by the Orcs of the East Wall. You should speak to Winsig and begin your assault.","Winsig is in Walstow.\
\
Nearby homes have been set ablaze by Orcs, and Winsig hopes to keep her town from ruin.","As you cross the bridge, a large, vicious Orc blocks the way","As you approach the stable, a group of Orcs ambushes you","Instancia: El Primer Asalto","With the Orcs defeated, Winsig moves to rally the riders","The second stable lies to the south of the Mead Hall of Walstow.\
\
Winsig requires your aid in defending the stable from the vicious assault of the Orcs.","The bridge of Walstow passes through the middle of the town.\
\
While you defeated the Orcs at the second stable, the rest of the town has burst into flame. Winsig desires to reunite with her men and put out the fires.","Winsig has been defeated!","Follow Winsig to the Mead Hall","As the last of the Orcs falls, you notice black clouds of smoke rise through the air near the mead hall","Cross the bridge with Winsig","Defend the first stable of Walstow","Follow Winsig to the second stable","The second stable lies to the south of the Mead Hall of Walstow.\
\
In the wake of seeing so many steeds slain, Winsig hopes to protect any that remain alive."}},
[7219]={nameES="Instancia: La Primera Hoja",objectivesES={"The fearsome Sûhalar, Korpûrta, must face the consequences of his actions for the slaughter of Gilgír and Tolwin's older brothers.","<rgb=#FF0000>Tolwin must survive</rgb>","Cross the bridge to Cair Andros and find The First Blade.","Instancia: La Primera Hoja","Speak with Dúneth","Tolwin has fallen in battle!","Defeat The First Blade.","Find The First Blade","Korpûrta looks amused at your presence","You have slain the fearsome First Blade of the Sûhalar","Defeat Korpûrta","Stay close to Tolwin and Dúneth and defeat enemies at Jal Kepir.","<rgb=#FF0000>Dúneth must survive</rgb>","You should speak with Dúneth.","Dúneth has fallen in battle!"}},
[7220]={nameES="Instancia: La primera promesa",objectivesES={"Durin fights against the onslaught of dragon-kind at the upper courtyard of the fortress and needs your help.","Durin has seen that the dwarves operating the siege defences are in need of help, and asked you to attend to them.","Bótuz Frostblood fights among his people in an upper courtyard of the fortress, but the drakes and other dragon-kind do not relent.","Catch up to Durin at the bottom of the stairs","Talk to Durin in the courtyard at Skarháld","Fight alongside Durin at Skarháld","The fortress of Skarháld is under attack! Durin raced ahead and already engages in battle at the bottom of the stairs.","Instancia: La primera promesa","Durin is in the courtyard of Skarháld. Most of the dragon-kind army has retreated.","Climb the central platform and assist the dwarves operating the siege defences","At Karazgar's signal the dragon-kind retreat, their victory assured and unnecessary to prove","The siege defences are being overrun!","Talk to Durin in the upper courtyard of the fortress","Before the dwarves at Skarháld have had the chance to properly prepare, Karazgar launches the first of his promised attacks upon the fortress.","The drakes and other dragon-kind have begun to overwhelm Skarháld. Durin calls for you to help him turn the tide."}},
[7221]={nameES="Instancia: El Enemigo Resurgente",objectivesES={"Talk to Imrahil","You find your path blocked by a terrible wraith!","Stand back as Duilin and Derufin clear a path","Reach the Hillock with Imrahil and Ingbert","Battle across the Pelennor Fields","You have discovered Duilin and Derufin scouting a path through the nearby battlefield","The Hillock lies to the south-east of Minas Tirith.\
\
Ingbert has decided that the best course is to reach the Hillock and make a stand against the Enemy's reinforcements there. You should follow him.","Duilin and Derufin are scouting ahead and attempting to slay the Mûmakil.\
\
You should stand back and allow them to weaken the beasts before proceeding.","The Orc encampment is ahead.\
\
Duilin and Derufin have been slain by the Haradrim and their Mûmakil. You should flee into the nearby Orc encampment.","The wraith vanishes, leaving behind only a pile of robes...","You spot Prince Imrahil and his Swan-knights battling against the Haradrim","Orolang is standing at the cross-roads to the north of the Hillock.\
\
You have found your path blocked by a dreadful wraith and must defeat him if you are to reach the Hillock.","Talk to Ingbert","Aid Imrahil and his Swan-knights","The Haradrim have momentarily stopped their attacks, allowing you a chance to reach the Hillock","Instancia: El Enemigo Resurgente","With the Witch-king now dead, a new commander has taken control of the enemy forces on the Pelennor Fields.","The brothers of Blackroot are slain and the Mûmakil are maddened! Flee!","Ingbert is on the Pelennor Fields just ahead of you.\
\
You have begun your foray from King's End to discover the Enemy's new commander and should now talk to Ingbert.","Reach the Hillock with Ingbert","Imrahil and his Swan-knights can be found to the north of the Hillock on the Pelennor Fields.\
\
Imrahil is under attack! You and Ingbert should come to his aid.","Ingbert is battling on the Pelennor Fields.\
\
Ingbert has asked you to join him in searching for the Enemy's new commander.","Defeat Orolang","The Mûmakil have not pursued you, but you have been spotted by Orcs!","Imrahil is at the cross-roads to the north of the Hillock.\
\
You should speak to him about what is to be done.","The Hillock is due south of your position.\
\
Ingbert and Imrahil have begun their journey to the Hillock. You should accompany them.","Flee to safety in the Orc encampment!"}},
[7222]={nameES="Instancia: El Estanque Prohibido",objectivesES={"Faramir, Anborn, and Frodo came to the overlook of Henneth Annûn.\
\
You should listen to Anborn's tale.","Instancia: El Estanque Prohibido","Listen to Anborn's tale","Anborn recalls the tense exchange when the gangrel-creature came unbidden to the Forbidden Pool beneath Henneth Annûn.","With Frodo's aid, Anborn hopes to capture Gollum at the Forbidden Pool.\
\
You should listen to Anborn's tale.","Anborn and Frodo travelled down to the Forbidden Pool.\
\
You should listen to Anborn's tale."}},
[7223]={nameES="Instancia: Los Vados han caído",objectivesES={"Follow the other soldiers in retreat","Grimbold stands at Prince Théodred's grave at the Fords of Isen.","Grimbold's voice is low when next he speaks....","The men have retreated backwards into the Westfold, and you should follow.","Tell Grimbold that it is over","You return to the fords from pursuing a band of Uruks to no avail, and find a scene of utter chaos and despair....","You should look back to see if Grimbold is following","This man draws no breath....","Grimbold is at the Fords.","Fight your way to Grimbold at the Ford.","Tell Grimbold <rgb=#FF0000>no</rgb>","Erkenbrand cannot help now, for the Uruks have come between you","<rgb=#FF0000>Beckon</rgb> to Grimbold","Grimbold stands at Prince Théodred's grave at the Fords of Isen.\
\
You should tell Grimbold no.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This quest requires emotes. Select your target and perform the desired emote.</rgb>","Find Grimbold amongst the chaos","Grimbold stands dumbfounded at Théodred's grave, unmoving....","Leave with the soldiers while there is still time. Grimbold will follow if he is wise....","See what the soldiers choose to do","An injured soldier lies ahead at the river's edge.\
\
You should run to the injured man's side.","This soldier is unwilling to lay down his life for a lost cause","Fallen men are scattered upon the ground at the Fords of Isen.\
\
You should search the men on the ground.","Ask the dying soldier what happened while you were gone","It is clear that the battle has taken a dire turn. There is no hope....","Ask the soldiers what they wish to do","Instancia: Los Vados han caído","Grimbold is still standing at Théodred's grave.\
\
You should <rgb=#FF0000>beckon</rgb> to Grimbold.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: You should select your target to perform this emote.</rgb>","Search for Grimbold among the chaos at the ford.","Elfhelm, one of the leaders fighting alongside Erkenbrand at the Fords of Isen, wishes to fall back at once.","The soldiers have gathered around Grimbold and yourself.\
\
You should ask the soldiers what they think.","Approach the ford"}},
[7224]={nameES="Instancia: Las forjas de Isengard",objectivesES={"Saruman is attempting to forge legendary weapons of his own to get the upper hand in his war against the Horse-lords of Rohan.","Defeated the Master of the Forge","Instancia: Las forjas de Isengard","Enemies in the employ of Saruman can be found throughout the Forges of Isengard.","Defeat the Master of the Forge"}},
[7225]={nameES="Instancia: Los Señores Olvidados",objectivesES={"Defeated Gámgrish","Within the Dead City of Minas Morgul, a locked chamber of the Witch-king has opened.","Read the notes on the altar","Defeated Bortharak","The chambers along the room's walls begin to shift","You inspect the book. It seems to be a journal, written in Black Speech. Each page lists the names of the four gaunt-men you have bested, as well as various indecipherable notes. The first four pages also reference Ivar, Thadúr, Ferndúr, and Drugoth, four of the gaunt-lords. There is a fifth and final page of writing that lists the name, Gortheron. No notes have been taken on this page. You believe the Witch-king may have been attempting to create a new set of gaunt-lords to command and locked it away here. Luckily his work seems to have gone unfinished. It is good that you were able to defeat these gaunt-men before the notes were discovered by one of Sauron's former servants.","Defeated Manargoth","Defeat Gámgrish","Defeat Manargoth","Read the notes on the altar.","Defeat the gaunt-men.","Defeat Úghurn","Defeat Bortharak","Defeated Úghurn","Instancia: Los Señores Olvidados","Enter further into Roz Dagalur, the Fiend-house"}},
[7226]={nameES="Instancia: El funeral en Forlaw",objectivesES={"Place the final stone on Cynegar's grave","Listen to Gárwig speak about Gársig","Listen to Gárwig speak of Edsig and Gárferth","Pick up the stone for Gársig's grave","Place the final stone on Thrymm's grave","Join Gárwig near the grandson's graves","Join the others at Cynegar's grave","Pick up the stone for Cynegar's grave","Leave the funeral with Cyneberg","Listen to Gárwig speak about Cynegar","Speak with Cyneberg","Instancia: El funeral en Forlaw","Place the final stone on Gársig's grave","Walk with Cyneberg to the funeral","Every living member of Gárwig's family has come to the graveyard today to pay their respects and say good-bye to those they loved.","You picked up the stone.","Many were lost in the battle at Scylfig, but none were more important to the people of Wildermore than their hero Thrymm Red-beard. A funeral is being planned by Gárwig and Cyneberg so that the people of Forlaw can pay their respects and say good-bye to those who lost their lives.","Join Gárwig near the twins' graves","Join and watch those gathered for Gársig","The final stone has been placed on Thrymm's grave.","Listen to Gárwig speak of Humbald and Grimgar","The final stone has been placed on Gársig's grave.","The final stone has been placed on Cynegar's grave.","Join and watch those gathered for Thrymm","Pick up the stone for Thrymm's grave","Listen to Gárwig speak about Thrymm","Listen to Gárwig speak"}},
[7227]={nameES="Instancia: La Resolución Fushaum",objectivesES={"Defeat the leaders of Fushaum Bal","Talk to Mâlatuk.","Meet with the divided leaders of Fushaum Bal","Meet with the divided leaders of Fushaum Bal.","Defend yourself.","<rgb=#FF0000>Beckon</rgb> the leaders of Fushaum Bal to come forward","Defeat the leaders of Fushaim Bal.","Defend yourself!","Instancia: La Resolución Fushaum","The camp of Fushaum Bal is a lawless home to evil men once under the command of Sauron.","Defeated Thâng","Talk to Mâlatuk","Beckon the leaders of Fushaum Bal to come forward.","Defeated Khirgi"}},
[7228]={nameES="Instancia: Las Puertas de Carn Dûm",objectivesES={"Habla con Golodir","Golodir espera para hablar contigo.\
\
Has encontrado a Golodir y ahuyentado a Mordirith, pero a un costo terrible.","Instancia: Las Puertas de Carn Dûm","Protege a Lorniel mientras busca a Golodir, su padre.","Usa la palanca al otro lado de la puerta.\
\
Al adentrarte más en Rhunendin, encontraste una puerta que la llave de Carn Dûm no pudo abrir. Debes dirigirte hacia la palanca y abrir la puerta para Lorniel.","Has viajado a Rhunendin con Lorniel. Usando la llave que ayudaste a forjar, va a buscar a su padre.","Habla con Lorniel","Tras encontrar a Golodir, Lorniel fue asesinada. Ahora el Falso Rey se alza ante ti, lejos de su fuente de poder. Ha llegado la hora de derrotar a Mordirith.","Derrota a Mordirith, el Falso Rey.","Golodir habla entre sollozos ahogados: ¡No, no... Lorniel!\
\
'Tenía razón... Mordirith tenía razón. Solo estaba jugando conmigo... contigo. Podría haberte derrotado hoy si realmente lo hubiera querido.\
\
'Todo ese tiempo mirando a través del palantír pensé que vería la victoria... que Lorniel y tú... que ustedes me liberarían, que provocarían la caída de Angmar. Todo se ha desvanecido... todo está perdido...'","Derrotaste a Mordirith, el Falso Rey.","Abre la puerta para Lorniel"}},
[7229]={nameES="Instance: The Gates of Isengard",objectivesES={}},
[7230]={nameES="Instancia: El Fantasma Regresa",objectivesES={"Nona is prepared to become Wadu's Ghost and slay her former lover... but you cannot stand idly by.","Reminisce about your adventures","Stand beside the fire with your friends","It is a reunion of friends and adventurers near the summit of Lhanuch, but not everyone is welcome.","Enter Lhanuch and climb the hill","Suvulch stands partway up the hill in Lhanuch.","... and promptly fell down on his rump when the shrew within leapt out of its hiding-place","Corudan has asked to go with you to visit an old friend.","Instancia: El Fantasma Regresa","You prevented Nona from becoming Wadu's Ghost... but it was a close thing.","Corudan encouraged you to climb the hill into Lhanuch and ensure that your group will be welcome.","Find Nona up the hill near the summit of Lhanuch","<rgb=#00FF00>Sit</rgb> by the fire and reminisce about your adventures","Talk to Suvulch in Lhanuch","Nona smiles as you approach","Talk to Nona by the fire near the summit of Lhanuch","After a lengthy journey, Corudan and your other companions stand outside the village of Lhanuch.","Nona has called for you and the others to <rgb=#00FF00>sit</rgb> and reminisce about your adventures.","Talk to Nona and keep her from once again becoming Wadu's Ghost","Talk to Corudan outside Lhanuch","You and your friends sit by the fire and reminisce about your shared adventures.","Suvulch told you Nona is further up the hill within Lhanuch, and will be delighted to see you.","Suvulch nods in greeting","Nona sits by the fire near the summit of Lhanuch."}},
[7231]={nameES="Instancia: El Fantasma Regresa",objectivesES={"Examine the gift you and Corudan worked with Caebar to prepare","It is a reunion of friends and adventurers near the summit of Lhanuch.","Reminisce about your adventures","Stand beside the fire with your friends","Enter Lhanuch and climb the hill","Suvulch stands partway up the hill in Lhanuch.","Nona is grateful for the gift you and Corudan worked with Caebar to prepare.","Corudan has asked to go with you to visit an old friend.","Instancia: El Fantasma Regresa","Corudan encouraged you to climb the hill into Lhanuch and ensure that your group will be welcome.","Find Nona up the hill near the summit of Lhanuch","<rgb=#00FF00>Sit</rgb> by the fire and reminisce about your adventures","Talk to Suvulch in Lhanuch","Nona smiles as you approach","Talk to Nona by the fire near the summit of Lhanuch","Nona has called for you and the others to <rgb=#00FF00>sit</rgb> and reminisce about your adventures.","Talk to Corudan outside Lhanuch","You and your friends sit by the fire and reminisce about your shared adventures.","Suvulch told you Nona is further up the hill within Lhanuch, and will be delighted to see you.","Suvulch nods in greeting","Nona has set down the gift you and Corudan worked with Caebar to prepare.","Nona sits by the fire near the summit of Lhanuch.","After a lengthy journey, Corudan and Caebar stand outside the village of Lhanuch."}},
[7232]={nameES="Instancia: La Forja de los Espectros",objectivesES={"Debes destruir a los espíritus caídos que moran en esta cámara, así como a su maestro, si quieres alcanzar la forja y completar la cualidad que buscas.","Instancia: La Forja de los Espectros","Debes destruir a los armeros malditos y a su maestro espectral para disipar el mal que han urdido en esta forja ancestral.","Has creado un zafiro potenciado","Usa la antigua forja para potenciar tu zafiro infundido.","Maestro de la forja de Cargûl derrotado","Usa el yunque antiguo","Derrota al Maestro de la forja de Cargûl"}},
[7233]={nameES="Instancia: La guarida del gigante",objectivesES={"Habla con Hórin","Find the ice-giant chieftain","Hórin is waiting to proceed inside Thyrstáth.\
\
You should talk to Hórin.","You should walk through Thyrstáth with Hórin until you find the ice-giant chieftain.","You are held in place by a dark force!","Hórin believes the best course of action is to enter Thyrstáth on a diplomatic mission. Your aim is to prevent the ice-giants from falling under the sway of Hrímil and her Frost-horde.","Listen to the conversation","You are bound in place by a dark force!","Instancia: La guarida del gigante","Hórin is standing outside the throne-room in Thyrstáth.\
\
You should talk to Hórin.","Hórin is negotiating with the ice-giant chieftain.\
\
You should listen to the conversation."}},
[7234]={nameES="Instancia: El Regalo de Hojasverdes",objectivesES={"While waiting for Grimbeorn's answer, Legolas recalls a recent story told to him by King Thranduil.","<rgb=#FF0000>Listen</rgb> to Legolas","Let Legolas tell his story.","<rgb=#FF0000>Listen</rgb> to Legolas.","Let Legolas tell his story","Instancia: El Regalo de Hojasverdes"}},
[7235]={nameES="Instancia: El Dador de Dones",objectivesES={"Bregoleth teje un relato de Caras Gelebren en la Segunda Edad de la Tierra Media.","Deja atrás a Bregoleth para escuchar el final de su relato, que se encuentra más adelante dentro de la Montaña de Fuego","Escucha mientras Bregoleth teje su relato","Bregoleth ha aceptado hablarte de los años que vivió en Eregion, y del Enemigo que vino a amenazar a su pueblo y a toda la Tierra Media.","Habla con Bregoleth en su memoria de Caras Gelebren","Sigue a Bregoleth y escucha mientras teje su relato","Bregoleth teje un relato de Caras Gelebren tal como era durante los años que vivió allí en la Segunda Edad de la Tierra Media.","Bregoleth habla de un lugar que nunca ha visto, un lugar de mal indescriptible: el interior de Orodruin, la Montaña de Fuego en la Tierra Negra de Mordor.","Habla con Bregoleth en un lugar de mal indescriptible","Instancia: El Dador de Dones"}},
[7236]={nameES="Instancia: La Gloria de la Compañía Brillante",objectivesES={"Follow the Bright Company into the upper chambers of the tower","You have come face to face with Sauron in an upper chamber of Barad-dûr, and must distract the Dark Lord from his real danger.","Follow Glorfindel and escape from the tower!","The veil of the Valar abates!","Stand with Glorfindel and Lendelen","Lendelen and Glorfindel have rejoined you atop the stair, and now their mission, and yours, must be completed.","<rgb=#FF0000>If you do not escape in time you will fail the quest.</rgb>","Talk to Glorfindel on Tol Send","Talk to Glorfindel in Barad-dûr","Glorfindel relates to you the last glorious mission of the Bright Company, but he seems to harbour some hesitation, reluctant to share the tale with you.","Talk to Glorfindel in the tunnel of Halroth","Talk to Sauron","Glorfindel has halted, waiting for Lendelen.","Glorfindel stands on Tol Send, ready to conclude his tale.","Lendelen wants you to climb the spiral stair to the upper floors of the tower, where other Elves of the Bright Company will join you.","Now that you have passed beyond the wall of Barad-dûr with the Bright Company, Lendelen wishes to speak to you.","Follow Glorfindel and Lendelen to the chamber of the Vandassar, and stand with them","Talk to Gandalf on Tol Send","Lendelen has successfully broken Sauron's hold upon the Vandassar, and now you must escape from the tower!","Instancia: La Gloria de la Compañía Brillante","<rgb=#FF0000>All of your allies must survive</rgb>","Glorfindel is in the tunnel of Halroth, prepared to fight through the dark passage to Barad-dûr itself.","Gandalf stands on Tol Send, the events of the past newly-awakened in him.","Death has come to the Bright Company, and you have failed!","The Bright Company stands against the Nazgûl in a high chamber of Barad-dûr, but the mission of Glorfindel and Lendelen remains higher still.","Climb the spiral stair and speak with an Elf of the Bright Company outside the upper chambers","Talk to Lendelen inside Barad-dûr","You failed to escape, and Sauron's victory was complete","Listen to the words of Glorfindel","Glorfindel has concluded his tale of the last glorious mission of the Bright Company, in which Sauron's control over the Vandassar was broken.","The mission of the Bright Company all comes down to this moment, high in the chamber of the Vandassar."}},
[7237]={nameES="Instancia: El Gran Trasgo en el Exilio",objectivesES={"Investigate the cave","Enter the cave behind the village","You should return to Langhár with this information","This spot is close enough to signal Langhár","Instancia: El Gran Trasgo en el Exilio","Get into position next to the village gate","<rgb=#FF00FF>Wave</rgb> at Langhár when in position","Langhár is ready to explain her plan to enter the goblin hideout.\
\
You should talk to Langhár.","Habla con Langhár","You have learned much about the Great Goblin's situation.\
\
You should return to Langhár and tell her this new information.","You should investigate the cave to find evidence of why the goblins are here and how many they number.","Langhár has asked you to get closer to the cave entrance before she alerts the goblins.\
\
You should get into position, and then <rgb=#FF00FF>wave</rgb> at Langhár to give the signal.","Return to Langhár","You have found the Great Goblin and his host","You have found the Great Goblin and a large number of goblins loyal to him.\
\
You should listen to him speak to his followers to see what you can learn.","A horde of goblins has departed Goblin-town, wreaking chaos in their path. We have followed, and come to their new hiding place. Now, we have them cornered. It is time we found out exactly what is going on here.","Langhár has drawn the attention of the goblins in Waldfast.\
\
You should sneak behind them and find the cave she mentioned.","Eavesdrop upon the Great Goblin"}},
[7238]={nameES="Instancia: El Gran Salón de Durin",objectivesES={"Habla con Dómárr","Instancia: El Gran Salón de Durin","Dómárr ha descubierto algunos asuntos desagradables en el Gran Salón de Durin, y cree que puede aportar pruebas de que Zelem-melek es extramadamente vulnerable.","Dómárr y Reinn se encuentran en el Gran Salón de Durin.","Escucha la discusión de los enanos","Dómárr se encuentra en el Gran Salón de Durin.\
\
Deberías hablar con Dómárr.","Escucha a Reinn y a Dómárr"}},
[7239]={nameES="Instancia: El Gran Triunfo de Mordor y Ordâkh",objectivesES={"Wait for your cue to arrive, and then run up the stairs on the right side","The play is almost over, and you should join the other performers on the stage.","Now is your chance! Slip inside the hallway while the audience is distracted.","Talk to Ulishár in the back-stage chambers","Ulishár has found an unsent letter in the Lord's Study.","Ulishár has joined you in the hallway west of the stage, in the belly of Emax Dûl.","Ulishár stands with you in the back-stage chambers of the performance hall in Emax Dûl.","Satagêra has told you to wait for your moment to run onto the stage.","Talk to Ulishár in the hallway west of the stage","Take your <rgb=#00FF00>bow</rgb>","Join the other performers on the stage as the play comes to an end","Wait for your next cue","Slip inside the west hallway while the audience is distracted","You should join Têrkar's Travellers on-stage for your bow","You have infiltrated the city of Emax Dûl in the guise of a performer with Têrkar's Travellers.","Listen to Ulishár read the unsent letter he has found","Talk to Satagêra by the rear entrance to the stage","Take your <rgb=#00FF00>bow</rgb> with the other performers.","Run up the stairs and deliver your line","The papers in the Lord's Study may provide the information you seek. Search them and learn what you can!","<rgb=#00FF00>Faint</rgb> at the sight of the impressive Mûmak","<rgb=#00FF00>Faint</rgb> at the sight of the impressive Mûmak.","Your big moment has arrived! Run up the stairs on the right side of the stage and stand by the door to the west hallway.","Join the other performers on the stage","Satagêra stands by the doorway leading to the stage.","Read the papers in the Lord's Study","Read more of the papers in the Lord's Study","Return to the rooms backstage and wait for the rest of Têrkar's Travellers","You learned what you came for, and should now return to the rooms backstage to wait for the rest of Têrkar's Travellers.","Instancia: El Gran Triunfo de Mordor y Ordâkh","Talk to Ulishár in the Lord's Study","Ulishár wishes to speak with you in the Lord's Study.","Now you must wait for your second cue. Once Mashkânu says 'Well?' you must faint... but not before!"}},
[7240]={nameES="Instance: The Grey King",objectivesES={}},
[7241]={nameES="Instancia: La Rebelión de los Mazo Gris",objectivesES={"Mótsog weaves to you the tale of his treachery's foundation.","Habla con Durin","Durin has challenged Mótsog to deny his treachery, but the mysterious dwarf insists he will not.","Mótsog has agreed to speak of the treachery for which he is remembered.","Durin cannot understand why his namesake would have trusted Mótsog with the lordship of Gundabad.","Instancia: La Rebelión de los Mazo Gris","Talk to Mótsog","Listen to the tale of Mótsog"}},
[7242]={nameES="Instancia: La Mano de Angmar",objectivesES={"Yrjänä y los Ancianos de los Lossoth deben reunirse con el emisario de Angmar.","Instancia: La Mano de Angmar","Yrjänä te dijo que los Angmarim también han llegado a Sûri-kylä, liderados por un Númenóreano Negro.","Acompaña a Yrjänä para encontrarte con el emisario de Angmar."}},
[7243]={nameES="Instance: The Hands of a Healer",objectivesES={"Faramir has recovered, and now Aragorn goes to see if Éowyn's condition has improved.","Instance: The Hands of a Healer","Habla con Aragorn","Walk to Merry's bedside","Aragorn has gone to Merry's bedside to see if his work has aided the hobbit's recovery.","Follow Aragorn to Éowyn's bedside","Aragorn is by Faramir's bedside in the Houses of Healing.","Capítulo 5: La reunión de la Compañía Gris","Aragorn is by Merry's bedside in the Houses of Healing.","Remain alert in the event you are needed","Aragorn's skill at healing will be put to the test in the Houses of Healing.","Merry is still in bed, but he seems to be recovering.","Aragorn is by Éowyn's bedside in the Houses of Healing."}},
[7244]={nameES="Instancia: La aparición de Wistmead",objectivesES={"Sigue al jefe de correos Ganapié hasta el sótano de la Oficina del Servicio Postal Rápido","Doblas la última de las cartas y la devuelves a su sobre","Montones de cartas olvidadas dirigidas a Halson Cleary se encuentran en el sótano de la Oficina del Servicio Postal Rápido.","Lee una de las cartas olvidadas","Habla con el jefe de correos Ganapié en el sótano de la Oficina del Servicio Postal Rápido","El jefe de correos Ganapié podría tener una pista para que sigas sobre los misteriosos eventos que involucran a Wistmead.","Estudia las cartas en busca de alguna pista sobre el misterio de Wistmead","Estudia las cartas para encontrar alguna pista sobre el misterio de Wistmead","El jefe de correos Ganapié ha regresado al sótano de la Oficina del Servicio Postal Rápido y está esperando escuchar lo que has aprendido.","Habla con el jefe de correos Ganapié en la Oficina del Servicio Postal Rápido","Estudia las cartas para encontrar alguna pista sobre la aparición de Wistmead","Montones de cartas olvidadas dirigidas a Halson Cleary se pueden encontrar en el sótano de la Oficina de Correos Rápida.","Instancia: La aparición de Wistmead","Se pueden encontrar montones de cartas olvidadas dirigidas a Halson Cleary en el sótano de la Oficina del Servicio Postal Rápido.","El jefe de correos Ganapié se ha ofrecido a mostrarte las viejas cartas dirigidas a Halson Cleary, que se han mantenido en el sótano de la Oficina del Servicio Postal Rápido durante todo el tiempo que él recuerda."}},
[7245]={nameES="Instancia: La Heráldica de Lindon",objectivesES={"Tu búsqueda del origen de la risa extraña te llevó hasta un demacrado. Esta vil criatura debe ser derrotada.","Has descubierto la fuente de la extraña risa","Busca el origen de la extraña risa","Busca el peto de Laerdan","Derrota a Goeolgúr","Instancia: La Heráldica de Lindon","Goeolgúr derrotado","Busca en Dolendath alguna pista sobre el peto de Laerdan.","Una voz extraña te llamó hacia adelante. Descubre su origen.","A lo lejos se oye el sonido de risas","Golodir te dijo que el peto de Laerdan podría encontrarse en Dolendath, el lugar donde su ejército se refugió por primera vez tras cruzar Rammas Deluon."}},
[7246]={nameES="Instancia: La Cámara Oculta",objectivesES={"This small stack of crates contains broken pieces of wood and metal, and nothing of use","Talk to Khîl in his father's house","Khîl is standing in front of the secret door, but it remains closed.","You inspect the desk Khîl moved away from the wall and note the scrapes on the floor caused by the movement. The drawer contains nothing of interest, and although you search beneath and behind the heavy stone of the desk, you find no apparatus that might connect it to the secret door.\
\
The desk does not appear to be involved with opening the door, and served only to keep its location a secret from idle eyes.","You reach under the corner of the table and disturb an insect that flies away, buzzing angrily. You doubt the insect knows anything about the secret door so you let it escape.","The secret to opening this door must be somewhere within the house","The grain in these sacks has long since rotted. The sacks themselves hide nothing of note","Stretching further you find a hidden lever, which you pull. There is a snap elsewhere in the house!","You are disappointed to see that the hidden door remains closed","It is impossible to tell exactly when this illustration might have been painted. An armoured dwarf commands his warriors to assault a forest encampment of Orcs against a backdrop of flames. Is this a painting of Mirkwood, or other woods entirely?\
\
You feel around the edges of the frame and behind the painting for a hidden lever or other device, but find nothing.","Khîl has discovered the word that opens the secret door: Vóin, the name of his great-great-great-grandfather.","The stone bench is heavy, but you study it closely and find nothing unusual","Khîl has discovered the word that opens the secret door: Vóin, the name of his great-great-great-grandfather. Now he wishes to explore the chamber.","Khîl stands by the secret door, studying the runes that appeared on its face.","Listen to Khîl's explanation","You stretch your arm beneath the mattress and find nothing unusual within reach","Thinking the ore-filled barrow might contain a hidden lever or other mechanism, you search it closely but find nothing out of the ordinary. It rolls on its front wheel and is not rooted to the floor as you might have expected.\
\
At last you dig around in the contents of the barrow, but your search reveals nothing suspicious.","Khîl has brought you to his father's house. He is consumed with worry about something he discovered there.","You cannot move the heavy stone of the bed by yourself, but you inspect its sides and back for hidden sigils or devices and find none. Reaching under the mattress, you disturb only dust and long-dead insects.","Behind these crates you find that a young Khîl scratched his name in the wall, but nothing useful","The chest is locked and you can find no way to open it","Explore the hidden chamber with Khîl","Search the house of Khîl's father for some means of opening the secret door","Khîl has asked you to search his father's house for some means of opening the secret door he discovered.","Khîl is inside the hidden chamber in his father's house.","Instancia: La Cámara Oculta","Talk to Khîl outside the secret door","Return to Khîl","Help Khîl discover the words that will open the door","You search among the crates, but find nothing of note","These crates contain assorted home goods, and you find nothing suspicious among them","Khîl is standing in front of the secret door, trying to learn the words that will open it.","You reach under this corner of the table and find it covered in a film of ancient dust. The dirt smears and you wipe it off on your clothes.","This bed is too heavy to move. You search all around its sides and back but find only cobwebs and dust, and nothing suspicious.","This chest used to be locked, but now it stands open and reveals its contents: glittering gold and shining gemstones. The riches are impressive, but you are not here for the fortunes of Khîl's forebears. Instead you reach into the treasure and feel around the edges until you find a small recess on the inside of the chest. You press the indentation and hear Khîl give a whoop of triumph from the other room.","You reach under the corner of the table and find only dust. Even so, it does not dissuade you from your search and you only relent when you are certain this corner of the table holds no secrets.","Khîl has found something in his father's house that fills him with worry, and he has asked for your help to investigate it.","This table bears the scuff-marks of heavy use but nothing of use to you now","The metal-banded chest contains only rags and moth-eaten clothes","This chest contains old clothes that likely once belonged to Khîl's mother","Talk to Khîl inside the hidden chamber","You reach under this corner of the table and feel a series of small scratches that merit closer inspection. You study the scratches and discover a crude picture of what seems to be a bed, with a line emanating from its very centre.","Talk to Khîl by the secret door"}},
[7247]={nameES="Instancia: El escondite",objectivesES={"Habla con Toradan","Instancia: El escondite","Zorrillero reside en algún lugar dentro del escondite.\
\
Has engañado para entrar en el escondite de los Montebruno. Ahora debes encontrar a Zorrillero y hablar con él para conocer el paradero de Amdir.","Amdir yace en las mazmorras al final del escondite de los Montebruno.\
\
Zorrillero te dijo que Amdir estaba encerrado y que lo que le estaba pasando parecía antinatural. Deberías encontrar a Amdir rápidamente.","Habla con el guardia de los Montebruno. Si tu engaño tiene éxito, debería darte acceso al escondite.\
\
Toradan te envió al escondite de Zorrillero para rescatar a Amdir y poner fin a las travesuras de los Montebruno.","Busca a Amdir","Habla con el guardia de los Montebruno","Ayuda a Toradan","Has escoltado a Sara Roblecorazón de manera segura","Toradan tose sangre. 'Amdir está... más allá de la salvación ahora. Debes advertir... a mis parientes....'\
\
'Mundol está en la Cueva de Reunión de los Montaraces. Él... ayúdalo....\
\
'Ve a Sotomonte... pregúntale si... si Tanglerush entregó mi mensaje....'","Una anciana en la parte trasera de la celda que albergaba a Amdir te llamó para pedir ayuda. Deberías ayudarla a escapar.\
\
Sea lo que sea lo que le está pasando a Amdir, lo ha vuelto completamente loco, y es mucho más poderoso de lo que parecía al principio. Su grito ensordecedor te aturdió momentáneamente y abrió la puerta de su celda.","Habla con William Zorrillero","Habla con Sara Roblecorazón","Intenta ayudar a Toradan a derrotar a Amdir.\
\
Al acercarte a la entrada del escondite de los Montebruno, te encontraste con Toradan y Amdir.","Después de ayudar a Sara Roblecorazón a salir del escondite de los Montebruno, Toradan entró y vio en qué se había convertido Amdir. Al ver que su pariente estaba demasiado lejos para ayudarlo, Toradan intentó matarlo, pero en su lugar fue derribado.\
\
Deberías hablar con Toradan antes de que muera.","Toradan habló sobre Amdir tratando de matar a los otros Montaraces y te pidió que hablaras con el Condestable Sotomonte sobre un mensaje que envió a alguien llamado Tanglerush.\
\
Sin embargo, antes de salir del escondite, deberías hablar nuevamente con Sara Roblecorazón para ver si necesita más ayuda.","El guardia de los Montebruno te mira desde debajo de una ceja fruncida. Escupe al suelo y estudia tu rostro durante unos segundos antes de darte una sonrisa irónica y siniestra.","Habla con la vieja prisionera","Habla con Amdir","Has descubierto a Amdir y has encontrado que se ha transformado parcialmente en un espectro. Dejó de delirar al verte, así que tal vez todavía haya algo de esperanza para él.","Toradan te envió al escondite de Zorrillero para rescatar a Amdir y poner fin a las travesuras de los Montebruno."}},
[7248]={nameES="Instancia: El Cuerno de Gondor",objectivesES={"Instancia: El Cuerno de Gondor","Aragorn has given you an important charge, perhaps the most important charge you have been given on this entire journey: keep the hobbits safe!","Blow the Horn of Gondor to summon aid!","The number of the Uruks is overwhelming! You need aid! Blow the Horn of Gondor!","Come to the aid of the hobbits!","Meriadoc and Peregrin need your help. They are not safe of the Uruks yet!","You have to protect the hobbits, at any cost!","The hobbits need your help, Boromir!","You have done what you could, Boromir.","This fallen Uruk is barely alive, but the mark of the White Hand on his armour is unmistakeable.\
\
'Seize... the halfling...' he moans, his wounds bubbling painfully.\
\
These Uruks are here for Frodo! You have to stop them!","Defeat the Uruk that threatens the hobbits!","The hobbits Meriadoc and Peregrin are in danger! You have to come to their aid!","An Uruk threatens the hobbits!","The Uruks are closing in...","You need aid! You must blow the Horn of Gondor!","Talk to Meriadoc","Defend the hobbits","Examine the dying Uruk in the middle of the glade","Talk to Peregrin"}},
[7249]={nameES="Instancia: La Casa de Isildur",objectivesES={"En el año 1975 de la Tercera Edad, un grupo de Dúnedain liderado por los hermanos Laegened y Haerdor viajó hacia el norte, a Forochel, para recuperar las reliquias dejadas atrás durante la huida del naufragio de Fornost.\
\
Haerdor ha explorado los alrededores y desea hablar contigo.","Aragorn y Túgonn se han encontrado con un anciano en el camino a través del Valle del Arroyo Sombrío.","Hasikkä, el caudillo de los Lossoth, desea hablar contigo.","Escucha el intercambio entre Aragorn y el anciano","Los trolls de las colinas han sido derrotados, pero es demasiado tarde para Arador, Capitán de los Dúnedain.","Habla con Haerdor al pie de la colina, al oeste","Haerdor desea hablar contigo.","Es el año 1965 de la Tercera Edad, y el viaje de Laegened y Haerdor los ha llevado a las orillas de la Bahía de Hielo en busca de su rey.\
\
Haerdor ha llegado a la Bahía de Hielo, contemplando la nave destrozada enviada a rescatar a Arvedui, y desea hablar contigo.","Habla con Hasikkä","Instancia: La Casa de Isildur","Habla con Glangon","Habla con Aragorn","Es el año 2956 de la Tercera Edad, y Aragorn, hijo de Arathorn, se dispone a iniciar los grandes viajes mediante los cuales conocerá el mundo. Está esperando hablar contigo, pues desea despedirse antes de partir hacia las tierras del sur.","Candaith ha decidido contarte algunos acontecimientos clave de la historia de los Dúnedain.","Aragorn desea hablar contigo.","Haerdor espera escuchar que los sierpes invernales han sido despejados del paso.","Es el año 2930 de la Tercera Edad, y Arador, el Capitán  de los Dúnedain, no ha regresado de la Cima de los Trolls, a donde se aventuró para velar por la seguridad de su pueblo. Glangon teme lo peor.\
\
Glangon espera hablar contigo al pie de la Cima de los Trolls.","Es el año 2956 de la Tercera Edad, y Aragorn, hijo de Arathorn, se prepara para comenzar los grandes viajes con los que conocerá el mundo. Pero primero debe despedirse de los amigos de su infancia.","Habla con Haerdor","Habla con Gandalf el Gris","Es el año 1965 de la Tercera Edad, y el viaje de Laegened y Haerdor los ha llevado a las orillas de la Bahía de Hielo en busca de su rey.\
\
Haerdor desea hablar contigo en las orillas de la Bahía de Hielo.","Escucha la narración de Candaith","Los trolls de las colinas de las Landas de Etten capturaron a Arador, el Capitán de los Dúnedain, y deben ser derrotados si ha de ser rescatado.","Derrota a los trolls de las colinas que capturaron a Arador","Gandalf el Gris desea hablar contigo.","Es el año 2930 de la Tercera Edad, y Arador, el Capitán  de los Dúnedain, no ha regresado de la Cima de los Trolls, a donde se aventuró para velar por la seguridad de su pueblo. Glangon teme lo peor.","Hay sierpes en la ladera al este de Haerdor.\
\
Tu hermano Haerdor te ha pedido que uses tus habilidades de sigilo para despejar el camino de gusanos."}},
[7250]={nameES="Instancia: El Camino del Cazador",objectivesES={"Instancia: El Camino del Cazador","Colmilloamarillo está en algún lugar del Bosque Viejo.\
\
Gytha Lainey te ha encomendado la tarea de derrotar a Colmilloamarillo, una loba mortal que acecha en el Bosque Viejo. Te advirtió que Colmilloamarillo es astuta, y deberás idear alguna forma de hacerla salir de su escondite.","Gytha Lainey te espera en algún lugar del Bosque Viejo.\
\
Gytha se alegrará —y se sorprenderá— al saber que has derrotado a Colmilloamarillo."}},
[7251]={nameES="Instancia: El festín desafortunado",objectivesES={"Léothred, the Rohirric scholar, wishes to learn more of the political tensions that arose during Fram's reign over the Ai-thúda.","Talk to Léothred","Listen to Léothred's tale","Instancia: El festín desafortunado","Talk to Léothred.","Listen to Léothred's tale."}},
[7252]={nameES="Instancia: La Sorpresa de los Infiltradores",objectivesES={"Habla con Sig Mandrake","Garrett el Retorcido está en el Escondite de los Infiltradores.\
\
Debes ver si puedes detener la sorpresa que traman los infiltradores.","Habla con Artie Raíz","Habla con Culver el Ingenioso","Culver el Ingenioso está dentro del Escondite de los Infiltradores.\
\
Debes ver si puedes detener la sorpresa que traman los infiltradores.","Sig Mandrake está en el Escondite de los Infiltradores.","Encuentra y habla con Garrett el Retorcido","Has llegado al escondite de los infiltradores en Bree, y debes ver si puedes detener la sorpresa que han planeado.","Habla con Artie Root","Instancia: La Sorpresa de los Infiltradores","Encuentra y habla con Culver el Ingenioso","Artie Raíz está en el Escondite de los Infiltradores.","Culver el Ingenioso está en el Escondite de los Infiltradores."}},
[7253]={nameES="Instancia: El Círculo Íntimo",objectivesES={"Scout-master Ausma intends to find a way deep into Shakhajât in order to learn more about Warlord Dushtalbúk and his advisors.","Talk to Scoutmaster Ausma","Talk to Scout-master Ausma","Enter Shakhajât","Ausma is pleased with your progress so far.","Listen to the conversation","Instancia: El Círculo Íntimo","<rgb=#FF0000>Do not allow the hobgoblins to see you!</rgb>","You should eavesdrop and see what can be learned.","You should follow Ausma.","You have found another way into Shakhajât","Ausma is continuing to explore, and will need your help.","Follow Scout-master Ausma"}},
[7254]={nameES="Instancia: La cámara más profunda",objectivesES={"Examina el arma detenidamente","Busca la cámara más profunda","Busca la cámara más profunda de la sala secreta; seguir las pistas puede ayudarte a encontrarla más rápido.","Frente a esta magnífica hacha está grabada la palabra MATADRAGONES","Has descubierto la cámara más profunda","Por fin has conseguido llegar a la misteriosa cámara a la que te conducían las enrevesadas instrucciones del mapa que encontraste.","Investiga el arma sobre el pedestal en la cámara más profunda.","Instancia: La cámara más profunda"}},
[7255]={nameES="Instancia: La piedra de Ithil",objectivesES={"Ingold is concerned that in defeat, Dulgabêth and his followers may direct their wrath upon Gondorians in Mordor.","Listen to the conversation","<rgb=#FF0000>Listen</rgb> to the conversation","<rgb=#FF0000>Do not leave your hiding place!</rgb>","Follow Ingold","Talk to Ingold.","Deja que acontecimientos sigan su curso.","This is a good place to listen","Deja que acontecimientos sigan su curso","Talk to Ingold","Instancia: La piedra de Ithil","Defeat Dulgabêth's servants.","You see something glinting from atop a rock spire","Get closer so that you may overhear the conversation","Defeated Krassa-phûrsa","Confront Dulgabêth's servants and retrieve the Ithil-stone.","Defeat Dulgabêth's servants","Follow Ingold.","Get closer so that you may overhear the conversation.","Listen to the conversation.","Confront Dulgabêth's servants and retrieve the Ithil-stone","Defeated Glúrugoth"}},
[7256]={nameES="Instancia: El viaje al Abismo de Helm",objectivesES={"Agelwyn and her party are by the river-bank in the southern Westfold.\
\
You should speak with Agelwyn.","Follow Agelwyn","The first people you met in the Westfold have been murdered by the White Hand... innocent people.","<rgb=#FF0000>Mourn</rgb> the slaughtered innocents","Agelwyn needs your aid in escorting her people to Helm's Deep across the dangerous plains of the Westfold.","You should speak with Agelwyn.","Listen to Agelwyn","Agelwyn is undeterred by the rebellion of half of her followers","Agelwyn can be found in the refugees' hiding spot north of Marton.\
\
You should help Agelwyn lead her people to Helm's Deep.","Follow Agelwyn and keep her people safe.","Agelwyn's speech did not go as well as she hoped, but several people are still willing to follow her","Keep the people of Marton safe","Agelwyn is heartened by the good fortune encountered on the journey","Agelwyn has died","Elstan has died","Speak with Agelwyn","Agelwyn and her party are travelling along the river-bank towards Helm's Deep.\
\
You should keep the people of Marton safe as they travel.","You should <rgb=#FF0000>mourn</rgb> the refugees.","Talk to Agelwyn","You recognize this person -- you saw these refugees on the road when you first entered the Westfold.\
\
These poor folk never made it to Helm's Deep, for the plains were crawling with deadly servants of the enemy.","Instancia: El viaje al Abismo de Helm"}},
[7257]={nameES="Instancia: El Rey Cabalga hacia el Poniente",objectivesES={"Gléowine is somewhere outside Edoras.\
\
Théoden has asked for you to bring Gléowine before him.","Talk to Aragorn outside Edoras","Listen to Théoden issue commands before the host","Instancia: El Rey Cabalga hacia el Poniente","Théoden is outside Edoras, ready to ride to war.","Théoden is outside Edoras, among the host that plans to ride to Isengard.","Talk to Gimli outside Edoras","Talk to Théoden outside Edoras","Aragorn, Legolas, and Gimli are by the side of the river outside Edoras, waiting for the host to depart.","Théoden has called Gléowine before him.","Éomer is outside Edoras, with the great host that has assembled to ride with Théoden.","Talk to Éomer outside Edoras","Théoden wishes to speak with you before the host departs.","Find and talk to Gléowine outside Edoras","Talk to Théoden before the host","Théoden has mustered a great host, more than a thousand spears, to ride to Isengard and bring war upon the Wizard Saruman.","Talk to Legolas outside Edoras","Talk to Théoden among the host"}},
[7258]={nameES="Instancia: El Rey Bajo la Montaña",objectivesES={"Defeat Dómor","Instancia: El Rey Bajo la Montaña","Remain on your guard and protect the king from danger","Hrostyr, the personal guard of King Thorin, will bring you to see him.","Wait with Bósi for your audience with King Thorin","Evil has come to the Lonely Mountain, and the dwarves fight to defend their home.","Talk to Hrostyr","You have come with Bósi for an audience with King Thorin III.","King Thorin has commanded you to keep Dómor from escaping.","You are waiting for an audience with King Thorin.","Remain on your guard for further danger","A sensation of great evil emanates from the fallen helm!","Knock the helm from Dómor's hand before he gives it to Thorin","Something is not right! You have to stop Thorin from wearing that helm!","Something is not right. You are overcome with an evil sensation!"}},
[7259]={nameES="Instancia: El Rey y el Senescal",objectivesES={"Gondor has a king again!","Talk to Imrahil before the gate of Minas Tirith","Witness events as they transpire before the city","The Host of the West has come to the gate of Minas Tirith, and Faramir, Steward of Gondor, greets Aragorn outside the city.","After so long, Gondor at last has a king again.","Instancia: El Rey y el Senescal","Prince Imrahil told you to find a good place to stand among the townsfolk on the right side as you approach the city.","Find a good place to stand among the townsfolk on the right","You have come with the Host of the West to the gates of the White City, where the future rule of Gondor will be determined.","<rgb=#FF0000>Cheer</rgb> for the king and for Gondor","Ioreth nods at you conspiratorially as you approach","Prince Imrahil of Dol Amroth is before the gate of the White City, waiting to speak with you."}},
[7260]={nameES="Instancia: El Campeón de la Dama",objectivesES={"Instancia: El Campeón de la Dama","Defend Lúfa against the White Hand's hirelings.","Talk to Lúfa in Ordlac's house","Lúfa is at Ordlac's house in Oserley.\
\
Speak with Lúfa and make sure that she is unharmed.","Lúfa has retired for the evening, leaving you to stand guard against the anticipated attempt upon her life.","Check the corpse of the brigand leader for evidence","Defend Lúfa against the White Hand's hirelings","Defended Lúfa against the White Hand's hirelings","Secure the windows and door","Check the corpse of the brigand leader for evidence.","Check the windows and doors to make sure they are secured.","You have found a dagger, covered with a slimy black substance","The windows and door are securely locked"}},
[7261]={nameES="Instancia: La última gran fortaleza",objectivesES={"Ceorl had much to say of the the events at the Fords of Isen.\
\
You should listen to Ceorl's address to the company.","Listen to Ceorl and the King","After a lengthy discussion about the crisis in the Westfold, Éomer recounts a troubling encounter upon the road that changed the king's course.","Éomer's memory of the man's troubling words continues....\
\
'At night fresh forces of the enemy came over the river against our encampment. All Isengard must be empty now, and Saruman has armed the hill-men and herd-folk of Dunland, and these he also loosed on us.\
\
'We were overpowered. The shield-wall is broken. Erkenbrand has drawn off those men he could gather, but the rest are scattered. We know nothing of Erkenbrand, or Grimbold, or Elfhelm!'","Listen to Ceorl's address to the company","Éomer's tale is done. You should now return your thoughts to the men gathered at Helm's Gate, waiting for Gandalf and hoping that Erkenbrand will return soon.","Instancia: La última gran fortaleza","Observe Théoden's encounter upon the road","Hear what Céorl has to say","Éomer's tale now draws to a close. That was the last anyone saw of Gandalf, or heard of Erkenbrand.","Éomer's memory describes Théoden's encounter with a man the company met on the road....","Théoden and his company are at the head of the line of horsemen in the Westfold.\
\
You should observe this memory of Éomer's by approaching Théoden."}},
[7262]={nameES="Instancia: El Último Mazo Gris",objectivesES={"Derrota a Gorgar el Despiadado","Stand with Mótsog","You have been tasked with escorting Mótsog to the peak above Gundabad, where the last of the Greymauls will confront Hrímil Frost-heart.","As the sun sets behind distant hills, Mótsog's time on this world draws near its end.\
\
The dragon still lives.","Instancia: El Último Mazo Gris","Talk to Mótsog beneath the peak","Defeat Ailgar and Rúvaran","Confront Hrímil Frost-heart","A great cheer sounds from far below!","Gorgar has succumbed to the voice of the dragon. He must be defeated if Mótsog is to face Hrímil Frost-heart.","Two leaders of the Angmarim have blocked your way up the slope to Hrímil Frost-heart, and they must be defeated if Mótsog is to reach the dragon.","Talk to Mótsog","Mótsog has fallen, and you have failed!","Prince Durin has asked you to accompany Mótsog to the peak, where the last of the Greymauls will confront Hrímil Frost-heart.","Talk to Mótsog on the slope"}},
[7263]={nameES="Instancia: El Último Refugio",objectivesES={"Instancia: El Último Refugio","Con tu ayuda, Glóin pudo obtener la Piedra Clave de la entrada secreta que lleva al torreón interior de la fortaleza enano ubicada en el paso de Gabilazan. Junto a su hijo, Gimli, te ha pedido que entres en esta fortaleza y pongas fin al Nazgûl y a Skorgrím.","Habla con Gimli para comenzar tu incursión en la fortaleza enana.\
\
La fortaleza enana en el paso de Gabilazan podría ser tanto el último escondite de los Duramano liderados por Skorgrím como del Nazgûl al que has perseguido a través del Bosque de los Trolls y hasta las Montañas Nubladas.","Habla con Gimli para continuar tu incursión en la fortaleza enana.\
\
La fortaleza enana en el paso de Gabilazan podría ser tanto el último escondite de los Duramano liderados por Skorgrím como del Nazgûl al que has perseguido a través del Bosque de los Trolls y hasta las Montañas Nubladas.","Gimli está de pie en el patio de la fortaleza de Gabilazan.\
\
Has derrotado con éxito a Skorgrím Duramano, pero el significado de su muerte aún es incierto.","Enfrenta al Nazgûl y a Skorgrím","Has avanzado hasta lo profundo de la fortaleza enana. Está casi a punto el momento de enfrentar al Nazgûl y a Skorgrím. Habla con Gimli para comenzar la batalla final.\
\
La fortaleza enana en el paso de Gabilazan podría ser tanto el último escondite de los Duramano liderados por Skorgrím como del Nazgûl al que has perseguido a través del Bosque de los Trolls y hasta las Montañas Nubladas.","Habla con Gimli","Skorgrim fue derrotado"}},
[7264]={nameES="Instancia: La amistad duradera",objectivesES={"Habla con Ravaedron frente a la Cabaña del Helechal","Himeinior ha accedido a ayudar a Ravaedron con su último plan, y está esperando para hablar contigo.","Ravaedron ha terminado lo que fuera que estuviese haciendo y ya está listo para agradecerte tu ayuda.","Te ha tocado la poco envidiable tarea de soportar el disgusto de los Astaciervo con Ravaedron.","Has venido con Ravaedron a la Cabaña del Helechal.","Ravaedron te ha pedido que llames a la puerta de la Cabaña del Helechal.","Habla con Ravaedron","A Ravaedron se le ha ocurrido otro plan con el que espera arreglar las cosas con los Astaciervo.","Llama a la puerta de la Cabaña del Helechal","Habla con Himeinior","Instancia: La amistad duradera","Ravaedron os ha pedido a los Astaciervo y a ti que lo sigáis a un lado de la Cabaña del Helechal.","Soporta la tormenta de indignación de los Astaciervo con Ravaedron","Sigue a Ravaedron"}},
[7265]={nameES="Instancia: La balada de la tierra seca",objectivesES={"Mizâdi is ready to meet with her allies and plan her strategy for Idagâl.\
\
You should speak to Mizâdi to begin the meeting.","Listen to the conversation","Our pursuit of Bârshud has led us to Idagâl, a scorched land of scavengers and cruelty. Here we will stand defiant and push the empire of Ordâkh out of the region for good. But first, we need allies.","Talk to Mizâdi","Instancia: La balada de la tierra seca","Mizâdi is speaking with her advisors about the situation in Idagâl.\
\
You should listen to the conversation."}},
[7266]={nameES="Instancia: El Legado de Durin",objectivesES={"Listen to Durin conclude the tale","Habla con Durin","The curtain of memory has pulled back, revealing to Durin the lives he lived and the places he saw. He knows now what before he did not.","Durin has the knowledge now to finish the tale of Mótsog.","Durin has more to say of the Sunder-battle's aftermath.","Instancia: El Legado de Durin","Durin wishes to conclude the tale.","Durin has agreed to conclude the tale of Mótsog, for it is not that dwarf's tale alone, but Durin's as well."}},
[7267]={nameES="Instancia: El Legado del Pueblo de Durin",objectivesES={"Find Spakorth, Dréri, and Náth and invite them to the Feast of Durin's Folk","Witness the arrival of King Thorin's final guest","King Thorin III beckons you to his side...","Talk to King Thorin III","King Thorin III has planned a great celebration for the Dwarves of Durin's Folk.","Spakorth can be found among the revellers in the Hall Under the Mountain.\
\
You have found Spakorth, Dréri, and Náth and should now request that they join King Thorin at his table.","Attend the Feast of Durin's Folk with King Thorin","Find Gimli, Dori, and Nori and send them to the Feast of Durin's Folk","King Thorin's speech is interrupted by frantic shouting echoing through the Hall Under the Mountain!","Your seat can be found next to Dwalin at the leftmost end of the table.\
\
King Thorin has offered you a seat at his table, and you should now inspect it as King Thorin asked.","Amid the din of the Feast of Durin's Folk, Gimli is speaking to Dori and Nori in hushed tones...","Instancia: El Legado del Pueblo de Durin","Gimli, Dori, and Nori can be found somewhere in the Hall Under the Mountain.\
\
Glóin has asked that you find Gimli, Dori, and Nori and send them to join the Feast of Durin's Folk at King Thorin's table.","You have summoned the Stout-axes to the Feast of Durin's Folk, and you should now return to your seat at King Thorin's table.","Glóin can be found at King Thorin's table in the Hall Under the Mountain.\
\
You have returned to King Thorin's table, but just as you were about to take your seat, Glóin tried to get your attention. You should speak to him.","Inspect the seat King Thorin has chosen for you","King Thorin III is standing beside his table in the Hall Under the Mountain.\
\
All of King Thorin's guests have arrived, and now the feast can begin. You should talk to King Thorin.","Nár shuffles up the stairs to greet King Thorin III...","Listen to King Thorin III","King Thorin III was hoping that one more dwarf would attend the Feast of Durin's Folk, but he is uncertain when or if he will arrive.\
\
You should wait with King Thorin III.","The Stout-axes can be found somewhere among the celebrations in the Hall Under the Mountain.\
\
King Thorin III has asked you to find Spakorth, Dréri, and Náth in Erebor and offer them an invitation to join the King Under the Mountain at his table.","Gimli, Dori, and Nori can be found on the upper level of the Hall Under the Mountain.\
\
You have found Gimli, Dori, and Nori and should now urge them to attend the Feast of Durin's Folk at King Thorin's table.","Return to your seat at the Feast of Durin's Folk","King Thorin gestures to the end of the table...","King Thorin III is giving a speech to the Dwarves of Durin's Folk in attendance.\
\
You should listen to King Thorin III.","This stone-wrought chair bears few marks of age, and appears surprisingly comfortable...","Spakorth, Dréri, and Náth appear to have joined Durin's Folk in the celebration!","King Thorin III can be found at his table in the Hall Under the Mountain.\
\
You have found all the missing dwarves and should now return to King Thorin III and attend the Feast of Durin's Folk.","Invite Spakorth, Dréri, and Náth to the Feast of Durin's Folk","Habla con Glóin","King Thorin's feasting table can be found on the landing before his throne in the Hall Under the Mountain.\
\
You should attend the Feast of Durin's Folk with King Thorin.","King Thorin is standing beside his table in the Hall Under the Mountain.\
\
You have inspected the chair King Thorin chose for you, and you should now speak to King Thorin.","Await the arrival of King Thorin's final guest","Disappointed that his guest must not be coming, King Thorin shuffles impatiently and begins to speak...","Listen to King Thorin III and Nár","Glóin tries to get your attention!","King Thorin III is standing before his throne in the Hall Under the Mountain.\
\
At King Thorin's request, you have come to attend a great feast and celebration in Erebor.","Frantic shouting has interrupted King Thorin's speech to the Dwarves of Durin's Folk.\
\
You should remain alert and witness the arrival of whoever has been shouting.","Habla con Gimli","King Thorin III is speaking to the Dwarves of Durin's Folk and welcoming Nár back to Erebor.\
\
You should listen to King Thorin III and Nár."}},
[7268]={nameES="Instancia: La Leyenda de Folca",objectivesES={"Verify the Boar of Everholt has succumbed to its wounds","The strong musk of boar wafts in from the north","The Boar of Everholt is nearby.\
\
The Boar's trail leads to the north, towards the sound of running water.","The fabled Boar of Everholt has finally been defeated.\
\
During the battle, you suffered severe wounds and now fight to retain consciousness.","The Boar of Everholt has sustained grave injuries and is heading towards the stream.\
\
Follow the Boar of Everholt to ensure that you have finally defeated the great beast.","Do not succumb to the wounds suffered during the battle","Defeat the Boar of Everholt","The Boar of Everholt is near.\
\
You should slay the great beast.","The Boar of Everholt has sustained grave injuries","Follow the trail of the Boar of Everholt to the north","Follow the scent of the Boar of Everholt.","The musky scent of the Boar draws nearer","The fabled Boar of Everholt collapses as pain overcomes you from a vicious wound suffered during battle","The Boar of Everholt is drinking from the stream. You should attack while it is unaware","Meregyth begins to regale you with the tale of King Folca the Hunter and the Boar of Everholt.","Instancia: La Leyenda de Folca","Continue to follow the trail of the Boar of Everholt to the north","The Boar of Everholt is very close.\
\
You should approach the great creature quietly.","Find the trail of the Boar of Everholt"}},
[7269]={nameES="Instancia: La lección de las llamas",objectivesES={"Talk to Rothog beside the burning wreck of the Orc-ship Grishúlvosh","You have come with Jajax, Rothog, and Belondor to destroy the Narghâk weapons used by the Song.","Stand by Jajax and decide your next course","Talk to Jajax on the Kosagháti","You have successfully disabled the Narghâk weapons aboard the Ordâkhai ship Kosagháti.","Talk to Jajax on the dock","Instancia: La lección de las llamas","Together with Belondor and Rothog, you and Jajax are determined to destroy the Narghâk weapons on two of the ships of the Song.","Rothog grieves beside his fallen comrade.","Something has happened to the Orc-ship Grishúlvosh. Jajax demands your attention.","If you tamper with the Narghâk weapons aboard the Ordâkhai ship Kosagháti, you should be able to prevent their further use."}},
[7270]={nameES="Instancia: La Biblioteca de Acero",objectivesES={"Oshadhúr derrotado","Usa la antigua forja para potenciar tu adamantita infundida.","La Biblioteca de Acero está siendo atacada por una banda de Orcos de Fuego de las profundidades de Moria. Están intentando invocar suficientes espíritus de fuego para romper las protecciones que protegen la biblioteca y convertirla en un infierno. Debes proteger la biblioteca y derrotar a los Orcos si deseas hacer uso de la antigua forja que hay dentro para completar tu calidad.","Has creado una adamantita potenciada","Usa el yunque antiguo","Derrota a Oshadhúr","Debes derrotar a los invocadores de orcos de fuego para evitar que invoquen suficientes espíritus para destruir la biblioteca. Si se reúnen demasiados espíritus dentro de la biblioteca, será consumida en un infierno y se perderá. Una vez que te hayas encargado de los invocadores, deberás enfrentarte al líder de los orcos...","Instancia: La Biblioteca de Acero"}},
[7271]={nameES="Instancia: El Enano Solitario",objectivesES={"The Jangovar are conversing.\
\
You should listen to the conversation.","Habla con Náin","Náin would like to speak with you.\
\
You should talk to Náin.","The Jangovar leaders are defeated!","Listen to the conversation","Talk to Tuhâl","Náin the Slakeless has engaged the Jangovar in battle!\
\
You should defeat the Jangovar!","Escape Utterby with Náin and Tuhâl","Tuhâl is nervously waiting to speak to the Jangovar leaders.\
\
You should talk to Tuhâl.","Náin has attacked the Jangovar!","Defeat the Jangovar","You have escaped the chaos in Utterby","Instancia: El Enano Solitario","The dwarves have attacked Utterby!\
\
You should follow Náin and escape!","You have secured an audience with the Jangovar leaders, but time runs short. Lord Náin's attack comes soon."}},
[7272]={nameES="Instancia: El Señor de Gundabad",objectivesES={"You have crossed the lake with Bori, and now he waits to speak with you before you climb to the threshold of Gundabad to meet up with Durin's fighting force.","Enter Gorgar's arena and join Durin and his allies","Prince Durin and his allies stand bravely in the arena of Gorgar the Ruthless on the very threshold of Gundabad.","Instancia: El Señor de Gundabad","The gate to the threshold of Gundabad lies ahead of you, where Gorgar has devised an arena to challenge Prince Durin and his allies.\
\
Bori needs your help to push open the gate that lies between you and Durin's fighting force.","Bori is eager to follow Durin to the threshold of Gundabad, where he hopes to observe the prince's defeat of Gorgar the Ruthless and acquisition of the title 'Lord of Gundabad.'","Remain on your guard!","Talk to Bori on the path leading to the threshold of Gundabad","Push open the gate to Gorgar's arena"}},
[7273]={nameES="Instancia: El Señor de Hierro",objectivesES={"Habla con Náin","Tuhâl is speaking to Lord Náin.\
\
You should listen to the conversation.","The time has come for Tuhâl of Chayasír to stand before Lord Náin and speak for the Easterling refugees.","Listen to the conversation","Talk to Tuhâl","You have been tasked with infiltrating Utterby!\
\
You should talk to Náin.","Instancia: El Señor de Hierro"}},
[7274]={nameES="Instancia: El Señor de Moria",objectivesES={"Habla con Náin","Defeat Azog","Azog's bodyguards can be found outside the East-gate of Khazad-dûm.\
\
After slaying Náin, Azog has set his bodyguards upon the Iron-folk. You should defeat Azog's bodyguards.","Azog can be found outside the East-gate of Khazad-dûm.\
\
In answer to Náin's taunts, Azog has come out of the shadows of Khazad-dûm. You should confront Azog with Náin and the Iron-folk.","Wait for Dáin","Dáin can be found outside the East-gate of Khazad-dûm.\
\
After entering Khazad-dûm, Dáin has returned deeply troubled. You should talk to Dáin.","Defeat Azog's bodyguards","Náin can be found outside the gates of Khazad-dûm at Muru Azog.\
\
Náin Orcsfoe has driven off the coward Bolg, leaving Azog to face the Haban’akkâ. You should talk to Náin.","Náin and Azog can be found outside the East-gate of Khazad-dûm.\
\
Azog has answered Náin's challenge. You should witness the battle between Náin and Azog.","Dáin has walked into Khazad-dûm.\
\
You should await Dáin's return.","Azog rushes forth!","Dáin can be found outside the East-gate of Khazad-dûm.\
\
Dáin has slain Azog. You should talk to Dáin.","Witness as Náin confronts Bolg outside Khazad-dûm","Follow Dáin and join in the assault on the gates of Khazad-dûm","Instancia: El Señor de Moria","Dáin disappears into the shadows","Witness Náin as he battles against Azog","Atop the stairs, you find Náin Orcsfoe and his warriors prepared to confront Bolg","Azog can be found outside the East-gate of Khazad-dûm.\
\
After slaying Náin, Azog hopes to escape the wrath of the Iron-folk. You should aid Dáin and defeat Azog.","Dáin can be found just outside Muru Azog at Azanulbizar.\
\
After overcoming Azog's forces at Durin's Stone, Náin Orcsfoe and the Iron-folk have begun their assault on the gates of Khazad-dûm. You should talk to Dáin.","As the last of Azog's bodyguards falls dead, Dáin rushes forth","Too fearful to answer Náin's challenge, Bolg flees back into Khazad-dûm!","With a sickening crack, Náin's neck snaps beneath Azog's blow and Azog roars triumphantly","Talk to Dáin","Dáin can be found at the East-gate of Khazad-dûm.\
\
After slaying Azog, Dáin has chosen to enter Khazad-dûm. You should watch as Dáin enters Khazad-dûm.","Witness as Dáin enters Khazad-dûm","As you approach Dáin, he appears to hardly notice you.\
\
After a moment, he opens his mouth as if to say something, but remains silent.","Confront Azog","Dáin can be found at Muru Azog.\
\
You have joined in the assault on the gates of Khazad-dûm. You should follow Dáin and aid the soldiers of the Haban’akkâ.","Náin Orcsfoe and the Iron-folk have broken through Azog's defences at Muru Azog.\
\
You should aid Náin and the Iron-folk as they approach the gates of Khazad-dûm.","Without another word, Dáin turns and walks toward the threshold into Khazad-dûm","Dáin stands over Azog's broken body, and with a swift slice, he beheads the Orc","After the horn-call of Grór sounded, Náin and the Dwarves of the Iron Hills charged forth to challenge Azog and put an end to the battle.","Dáin remains silent.","Dáin runs out of the shadows of Khazad-dûm, his face grey with unknowable fear"}},
[7275]={nameES="Instance: The Lost Temple",objectivesES={"Ferndúr the Virulent has nearly completed his deadly experiments beneath the lost Rhudauran temple.\
\
He and his servants must be defeated before his plans come to fruition!","You have discovered Ferndúr the Virulent, in the  central chamber, in the depths of the lost Rhudauran temple.\
\
He and his servants must be defeated before his plans come to fruition!","Search the temple for Ferndúr's location","The gate to Ferndúr's chamber has been opened","Defeat the Gaunt-lord Ferndúr in the Lost Temple discovered within the Trollshaws before he completes his plan to unleash a deadly plague upon the North!","Instance: The Lost Temple","Derrota a Ferndúr el Virulento"}},
[7276]={nameES="Instancia: El Taller Perdido",objectivesES={"Buscas entre la pila de papeles, pero no encuentras nada útil.","Has entrado en un pasaje que conduce al antiguo taller de Melkólf Tallapiedra para buscar cualquier mención de Zurr-thurkh, el 'camino secreto' que pudo haber construido como túnel de escape desde la sala del trono de Durin.","Busca entre los papeles esparcidos alguna mención de Zurr-thurkh","Páginas del taller de Melkólf Tallapiedra están esparcidas por todo el pasaje, y deberías buscarlas en busca de cualquier mención de Zurr-thurkh, el 'camino secreto' que podría conducir a la sala del trono de Durin.","Instancia: El Taller Perdido","La palabra 'Zurr-thurkh' llama tu atención. ¡Has encontrado lo que buscabas!"}},
[7277]={nameES="Instancia: La locura en sus ojos",objectivesES={"In desperation you call her name, but Silirtas remains frozen, unaware of the evil that threatens her.","Awaken Silirtas from the enchantment that keeps her from moving","A sense of exhaustion has overcome you once again, as happened earlier when you journeyed within Maurûsh.","Prevent Azagath from inflicting great harm upon Silirtas","Place Narghâk to the left side of the entrance to Utug-bûr (1/3)","Stand your ground","Instancia: La locura en sus ojos","Check on the group placing the Narghâk on the other side","You and Sigileth have volunteered to place the Narghâk on the left side of the entrance to Utug-bûr.","Place Narghâk to the left side of the entrance to Utug-bûr (0/3)","You need to seal the entrance to Utug-bûr before the Thardúth emerge and levy their full power against you.","Listen to the threatening voice within your mind","At the urging of his Thardúth masters, Azagath intends to do great harm to your friends.","The Thardúth turn their attention elsewhere in the battle. The sorcerous exhaustion that troubled you has been lifted.","The ethereal voice speaks threatening words from within the confines of your mind.","Talk to Silirtas outside Utug-bûr","Place Narghâk to the left side of the entrance to Utug-bûr (2/3)","Grieving that the Thardúth had their origins as ancient Kintai, Silirtas greatly desires to do her part in sealing them away.","Frozen, unmoving figures stand near at hand","Silirtas is in grave danger! She must awaken at once!"}},
[7278]={nameES="Instancia: La Locura de Vanyalos",objectivesES={"Fight the Orc captain among the reeds by the River Anduin.\
\
Just as Lady Vanyalos fainted, the Orc captain, Tenakrul, came upon you.","Lady Vanyalos stands between two trees, off the northward road.\
\
You have found Lady Vanyalos. You should approach her and see if she can be persuaded to return to Imloth Melui.","Protect Lady Vanyalos","Talk to Lady Vanyalos","Lady Vanyalos stands among the reeds by the River Anduin.\
\
Having come to her senses at last, the Lady Vanyalos looks ready to talk to you.","Defeated Tenakrul","Instancia: La Locura de Vanyalos","Lady Vanyalos left Imloth Melui unescorted and unguarded. Merenir, fearing for her safety and state of mind, sent you after her. You have found Lady Vanyalos just off the northward road.","Defeat Tenakrul","You hear an Orkish shout, followed by footfall. You are discovered!","<rgb=#FF0000>Lady Vanyalos has been defeated!</rgb>","Lady Vanyalos is wandering on the greensward by the River Anduin.\
\
You should protect the Lady Vanyalos and see if you can get her to come to her senses.","Approach Lady Vanyalos","<rgb=#FF0000>Lady Vanyalos must not be defeated</rgb>"}},
[7279]={nameES="Instancia: La Matrona y el Maestro",objectivesES={"La caza de Tasgall los ha llevado a las laderas de Nád Nathair.","El plan de Tasgall está listo, y ustedes dos deben intentar acabar con la amenaza de Bangrath y Murragrath.","Habla con Tasgall","Instancia: La Matrona y el Maestro"}},
[7280]={nameES="Instancia: El significado de la alianza",objectivesES={"The overseer does not seem very forgiving","The half-orc to whom you spoke seems unreasonably angry.\
\
You should defend yourself and the townsfolk from the wrath of the servants of Isengard.","Tomos is searching for his wife, Mari.\
\
You should follow Tomos through Galtrev.","Try to appease the White Hand overseer","Mari is in Galtrev.\
\
You should speak with Mari.","Tomos stands nearby.\
\
You should speak with Tomos.","Defeat the servants of the White Hand.","A White Hand overseer has been defeated; this act of defiance will surely enrage the servants of Isengard","Talk to Mari","Instancia: El significado de la alianza","Help defend the people of Galtrev","Tomos has died","Tomos must not fall","An angry White Hand overseer has appeared to make Tomos answer for his crime of missing the day's work.\
\
You should speak with the overseer to try to appease him.","Follow Tomos","An angry White Hand overseer approaches...","Talk to Tomos","Tomos is searching for his wife, Mari.\
\
You should follow Tomos to Mari's side.","The people of Galtrev wish to free themselves from the unfairly one-sided alliance with Isengard's White Hand presence.","Help the people of Galtrev"}},
[7281]={nameES="Instancia: La pelea en la plaza",objectivesES={"Derwent no entiende por qué crees que Altapiedra tiene fama de ser peligrosa.","Ha ocurrido algo que no sucedía desde hace ocho días:\
\
¡Los orcos han llegado al pueblo de Altapiedra!","Derwent Correhuela está asustado, pero por lo demás ileso.","Derwent Correhuela ha hecho un descubrimiento desagradable, aunque no especialmente sorprendente.","Habla con Derwent Correhuela en Altapiedra","Habla con Derwent Correhuela","Instancia: La pelea en la plaza","Derwent Correhuela dejó atrás un pueblo peligroso, solo para encontrar otro.","Reúnete con algunos de los vecinos de Derwent en Altapiedra","Derwent está encantado de mostrarte su nuevo hogar, el pueblo de Altapiedra.","Protege a Derwent y a sus vecinos de los orcos"}},
[7282]={nameES="Instancia: El Espejo de Galadriel",objectivesES={"Galadriel te espera en el centro del jardín.\
\
Galadriel te ha hecho llamar a su jardín de Lothlórien, porque desea hablar contigo.","Escucha las palabras de Galadriel sobre tu destino","Gwaihir, el Señor de los Vientos, ha venido a descansar en el jardín de Galadriel.\
\
Galadriel te ha pedido que vayas a hablar con Gwaihir sobre el destino de Gandalf el Gris.","Galadriel te espera en el centro del jardín.\
\
Has visto cosas extrañas en el Espejo de Galadriel, incluyendo imágenes confusas de Gandalf y una terrible criatura: un Balrog, el Daño de Durin.","Habla con Gwaihir","Habla con Galadriel","El Espejo de Galadriel se encuentra en el centro del jardín.\
\
Galadriel te ha invitado a mirar en su Espejo y a preguntarle lo que quieres ver.","Instancia: El Espejo de Galadriel","La Dama Galadriel desea hablar contigo en su jardín, en Lothlórien.","Galadriel te espera en el centro del jardín.\
\
La Dama Galadriel ha visto más que el destino de Mithrandir en su Espejo; también ha visto algunos indicios de tu propio destino.","Mira en el Espejo de Galadriel"}},
[7283]={nameES="Instancia: Los Desaparecidos",objectivesES={"You have found a chamber of cages, and some old friends","Survive the return of the Orcs to Burg-shápol","Corudan is in the depths of Burg-shápol.","You have found Burg-shápol, a cave in the Everholt where the missing craftsmen may be found.","Instancia: Los Desaparecidos","You have found Nona and Corudan in the depths of Burg-shápol.","Talk to Horn in Burg-shápol","Horn is inside Burg-shápol, the cave in the Everholt where the missing craftsmen might be found.","Talk to Nona in Burg-shápol","Many Orcs have returned to Burg-shápol, and you must defeat them!","This chamber contains more dead Orcs, but no sign of the missing craftsmen","You hear raised voices from further ahead, but cannot make out any of the words","Horn has stayed behind to delay the approach of the following Orcs, while you search the tunnels of Burg-shápol for the missing craftsmen.","Talk to Corudan in Burg-shápol","Horn is in the tunnels of Burg-shápol.","Search the tunnels of Burg-shápol for the missing craftsmen"}},
[7284]={nameES="Instancia: Los esclavos del mithril",objectivesES={"Utiliza la antigua forja y los fragmentos de mineral de mithril que has recogido para potenciar tu granate imbuido.","Debes encontrar suficientes fragmentos de mineral de mithril para poder aprovechar la forja de fundición y obtener la calidad que buscas. Con suerte, los trasgos esclavizados habrán logrado recolectar suficiente mineral para satisfacer tus necesidades... ahora es poco probable que se desprendan de él por las buenas.","Capataz de la mina derrotado","Has creado un granate potenciado","Derrota al capataz de la mina","Instancia: Los esclavos del mithril","Te han hablado de una mina de mithril agotada hace mucho tiempo en cuyo interior se encuentra una antigua forja de fundición. Allí dentro deberías ser capaz de sentar las bases de la calidad que buscas. Sin embargo, una despiadada banda de orcos ha esclavizado a sus propios hermanos trasgos para rebañar los últimos residuos de la mina, lo que dificultará enormemente tu acceso a la forja.","Usa el yunque antiguo"}},
[7285]={nameES="Instancia: La Luna sobre Ambarûl",objectivesES={"Talk to Rothog the Storm","Instancia: La Luna sobre Ambarûl","Talk to Rahâzi","The Dumûri warriors Rahâzi and Surdûsha have suggested that you return with them to Iridír where you can speak of your shared triumph over the Ordâkhai remnant.","Khôltekh has some words for you before you continue on to Iridír.","Stand your ground against Tatháta and protect the Dumûri warriors.","Rothog and Khôltekh have arrived in Ambarûl, and they seek to gain permission from its people to carry out the mission they share with you.","The remainder of your travelling company has arrived","Khôltekh coughs, drawing your attention from Rothog's lion","Death comes even for a Dumûri warrior. You have failed!","Rothog the Storm has arrived, and his arrival may have saved you and the Dumûri warriors from Tatháta's wrath.","Rahâzi waits to speak with you before she departs.","Talk to Khôltekh","Observe the meeting of Khôltekh and Rahâzi","Stand your ground against Tatháta and protect the Dumûri warriors","Khôltekh has arrived in Ambarûl.","Rahâzi and Surdûsha have triumphed over the Ordâkhai, but now a new threat emerges.","Part of the way back to Iridír, Rahâzi has called for a halt."}},
[7286]={nameES="Instancia: Los Marginados de Morroval",objectivesES={"Derrotada la señora de los morroval","Debes derrotar a los ladrones de morroval y recuperar las herramientas que han tomado de la forja. También debes evitar que los carroñeros que huyen escapen de la forja, para que no se lleven demasiadas piezas importantes de equipo.","Has viajado a una antigua forja donde una vez se fabricaron algunas de las mejores armas de Moria, pero una banda de merrevail expulsados de sus propias cavernas ha comenzado a saquearla y a llevarse las herramientas y los materiales que hay dentro. Debes derrotar a los merrevail y recuperar las herramientas robadas antes de que dejen la forja al descubierto si deseas poder potenciar la gema que llevas.","Derrota a la señora de los morroval","Has creado un zafiro potenciado","Un carroñero morroval intenta escapar","Usa la antigua forja para potenciar tu zafiro infundido.","Instancia: Los Marginados de Morroval","Usa el yunque antiguo"}},
[7287]={nameES="Instancia: El Reclutamiento",objectivesES={"Tell Grimbold the <rgb=#FF0000>story</rgb> of Elfhelm's regret","You must convince Grimbold that he is wrong....","The troll Bosnauk is at the Fords of Isen.\
\
You should defeat Bosnauk with Grimbold, if you can.","You must convince Grimbold to rally his spirits and help to defend the King at Helm's Deep.","Habla con Gandalf","Grimbold sits stubbornly, his eyes fixed upon the ground","Grimbold sits at Théodred's grave at the Fords of Isen.\
\
You should talk to Grimbold -- tell him the <rgb=#FF0000>story</rgb> of Hildith's regret.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>You must select your target and perform the emote.</rgb>","Tell Grimbold the <rgb=#FF0000>story</rgb> of Hildith's regret","Speak with Grimbold","Grimbold is at Théodred's grave at the Fords of Isen.\
\
You should speak with Grimbold.","Grimbold sits at Théodred's grave at the Fords of Isen.\
\
You should talk to Grimbold -- tell him the <rgb=#FF0000>story</rgb> of the king's recovery.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>You must select your target and perform the emote.</rgb>","Try to defeat Bosnauk with Grimbold","The shadow of despair is lifted from Grimbold's brow","Bosnauk is defeated!","Grimbold sits at Théodred's grave at the Fords of Isen.\
\
You should speak with Grimbold.","Observe the meeting at the fords","Help Grimbold fight!","Grimbold is unmoved by your account","Grimbold is at the Fords of Isen.\
\
You should speak with Grimbold.","Grimbold sits at Théodred's grave at the Fords of Isen.\
\
You should talk to Grimbold -- tell him the <rgb=#FF0000>story</rgb> of Elfhelm's regret.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>You must select your target and perform the emote.</rgb>","Listen to Grimbold","Tell Grimbold the <rgb=#FF0000>story</rgb> of the king","Gandalf is at the Fords of Isen.\
\
You should speak with Gandalf.","Instancia: El Reclutamiento"}},
[7288]={nameES="Instancia: El Ladrón Misterioso",objectivesES={"Return to the trap.","Talk to Sírithon","Instancia: El Ladrón Misterioso","Check on the trap.","Nothing is missing","Investigate the noises","Having found convincing proof, Sírithon devises a plan to catch the Loeglond thief.","Check on the trap","Investigate the noises.","There seems to be noises coming from the other side of Loeglond!","Return to the trap","The supplies are gone!","Patrol Loeglond.","Talk to Sírithon.","The noises seem to have been a decoy!"}},
[7289]={nameES="Instancia: El Misterio de Zul-mazal",objectivesES={"Witness the completion of the mosaic... again","Observe the restoration of the mosaic","Stáli and Fastrith have finished assembling the mosaic.","Talk to Stáli the Hewer","Fastrith is eager to carry out her idea.","Stáli and Fastrith have once again finished assembling the mosaic.","Durin stands in the chamber of Zul-mazal, ready to learn whatever secrets may remain between its walls.","Remain vigilant while the dwarves consider the chamber","Talk to Fastrith","Instancia: El Misterio de Zul-mazal","Witness the completion of the mosaic","Bósi and Durin have heard the sounds of approaching enemies.","Bósi, former leader of the Iron Garrison, has warned you that more hobgoblins approach.","Fastrith has had an idea.","Observe the completed mosaic","You and the dwarves have uncovered the secret of Zul-mazal, and now Durin must decide what should be done.","The dwarves believe they have uncovered the key to the mystery of Zul-mazal.","Stáli the Hewer believes his time has come at last.","Durin has come to the chamber of Zul-mazal with the intention of laying bare its mysteries.","Habla con Durin","Durin and the dwarves examine the chamber for clues.","Habla con Bósi."}},
[7290]={nameES="Instance: The Narrow Way",objectivesES={"Instance: The Narrow Way","Talk to Ianudirel","Speak with Ianudirel and fight your way across the bridge to Krul Lugu.","Ianudirel has made it across","The Elf-scout Ianudirel has been trapped across the river from Krul Lugu. She must return to the near side, but expects to be ambushed when she attempts to cross the bridge.","Talk to Ianudirel to return to Iavassúl."}},
[7291]={nameES="Instancia: El siguiente movimiento",objectivesES={"Listen to the Kindred discuss the disappearance of Balakhâd","Within a tower room inside the Citadel of Winds, the Kindred of the Coins discuss the days to come.","Talk to Sirgon in the tower room","The Kindred of the Coins discuss the mission to pursue Azagath and Nakási.","Instancia: El siguiente movimiento","Talk to Hármelak inside the tower room","Listen to the Kindred discuss the adventure to come","The Kindred of the Coins discuss the recent past with you and Sirgon in a tower room in the Citadel of Winds.","Talk to Sirgon inside the Citadel of Winds","Hármelak and other leaders of the Kindred of the Coins await you in a tower room inside the Citadel of Winds.","Talk to Belondor inside the tower room","Hármelak wishes to discuss with you the road ahead.","Sirgon has volunteered for the dangerous mission to pursue Azagath and Nakási into the wild lands of the east and south.","Hármelak wishes to address you before you depart.","Attend your meeting with the Kindred of the Coins","You and Sirgon have been escorted to an upper level of the Citadel of Winds.","The Kindred of the Coins discuss the disappearance of Balakhâd with you and Sirgon in a tower room in the Citadel of Winds.","You have come with Sirgon of Lebennin to an upper level of the Citadel of Winds to meet with the Kindred of the Coins.","Talk to Hármelak in the tower room","Belondor wishes to tell you what the Kindred knows concerning Balakhâd's escape from the Citadel of Winds."}},
[7292]={nameES="Instance: The Old Woman of the Mountain",objectivesES={"Defeat Gwyllion and her lieutenants","Speak with Saeradan to return to Echad Saeradan.","Saeradan must survive","Instance: The Old Woman of the Mountain","Accompany Saeradan to confront Gwyllion","Seek out Gwyllion at her hut beyond Gwyllion's Gate.","Habla con Saeradan","Speak with Saeradan at Gwyllion's Gate.","Saeradan has charged you with confronting Gwyllion, the Old Woman of the Mountain, and driving her forth from the Windfells of Enedwaith.","Gwyllion has retreated","Saeradan has been defeated"}},
[7293]={nameES="Instancia: El ataque de los orcos",objectivesES={"Ask Noriel if Wynmar will live","Rothulf and Wynmar are at their camp in Thinglad.","Talk to Rothulf","Instancia: El ataque de los orcos","Wynmar is at his camp.","Noriel and Wynmar are speaking quietly between themselves.","The Orcs have begun their attack on the Rohirrim's vulnerable encampment in Thinglad.","See if Wynmar and Noriel need your help","Orcs are attacking! You must defeat them.","Rothulf is at the camp.","Wynmar, Rothulf, and the other Rohirrim hunters now brace themselves against an onslaught.","Noriel is tending to Wynmar's wounds.","Defeat the attacking Orcs","Help Rothulf rouse Wynmar from his woe","Too many have died...","Noriel has slain the attacker, but Wynmar lies wounded","Talk to Wynmar","See if Wynmar is ready to fight"}},
[7294]={nameES="Instancia: El marginado",objectivesES={"What is going on?","You found two ruffians beating Sâdikiz as he lay on the floor. You should stop them and defeat the ruffians.","Derrota a los rufianes","Talk to Sâdikiz","TBD","Sâdikiz the Sky-hungry can be found at Khanâg Gur, and is said to be often found at the tavern there. You should go into the tavern to find him.","Is there a fight in the tavern? You should get closer to see what is going on.","Instancia: El marginado","The ruffians have fled","You have defeated the ruffians who were beating Sâdikiz as he lay helpless on the floor. You should talk to the relieved dwarf."}},
[7295]={nameES="Instancia: El dolor del arrepentimiento",objectivesES={"Léofmar has finished the tale of how he was afraid when the armies of Orcs began to march across the field -- how he sounded his horn to alert Garsfeld, then fled in fear of wielding a sword against so many cruel foes.","Instancia: El dolor del arrepentimiento","Léofmar is relaying the tale of his cowardice, for which he believes a curse is his punishment.","Léofmar is ready to reveal his tale of guilt and cowardice.","Léofmar cowers against the side of a building while the town flies into a panic at the prospect of battle.\
\
His eyes are wild with the madness of a sudden fear. You look upon a man who is ready to flee.","Léofmar's tale is ended, but to you, it is not a curse-worthy one. He is only a green young man with a farmer's blood in his veins, not a soldier's. He curses himself for running, but there is nothing evil laid upon him but his own regret.","Something terrible stirs in the fields below...","Listen to Léofmar's narration","Follow Léofmar's narration","Léofmar describes a watch-tower in the settlement of Garsfeld in the Sutcrofts, and his reluctant post there.\
\
Watch-tower duty is generally a slow business without much incident, but on this day, the unimaginable happens....","Observe Léofmar's behaviour.","Léofmar has escaped from a certain battle and pauses outside of Garsfeld's north-west gate"}},
[7296]={nameES="Instancia: El Heraldo Pálido",objectivesES={"Talk to Felgúr","Instancia: El Heraldo Pálido","Listen to Felgúr's story","Felgúr has a tale to tell about a dark man who came to lead his people astray."}},
[7297]={nameES="Instancia: El Sendero de Aearil",objectivesES={"Proteje a Saija","Busca a Narchuil","Habla con Saija","Saija ha prometido guiarte en tu búsqueda de Narchuil.","Saija ha muerto","Instancia: El Sendero de Aearil","Habla con Saija dentro de Halla-kolo.","Busca a Narchuil en Halla-kolo."}},
[7298]={nameES="Instancia: La receta perfecta",objectivesES={"Habla con Bert Bartolín fuera del agujero hobbit de Bingo","Instancia: La receta perfecta","Ha llegado el día de la fiesta de Bingo... ¿vendrán los invitados?","Habla con el recién llegado","Caléndula y Spalvi escuchan embelesados las aventuras de Haley","Recibe a las nuevas llegadas","Bingo está recordando aventuras con Egwylf y Langhár","Teodoro y Bert intentan superar las historias del otro, ¡pero los hobbits solo quieren comer!","Entra en la casa de Bingo para la fiesta","La familia de Willem recibe mucha atención por parte de los jóvenes hobbits","Bert Bartolín ha llegado fuera del agujero hobbit de Bingo, ¡y está listo para comenzar el banquete!","Myrtle Cenagales encabeza un pequeño grupo de vecinos de Bingo en el sendero fuera de su agujero hobbit.","Recibe a los vecinos de Bingo fuera de su agujero hobbit","Donnamira Tuk examina el manuscrito de Bingo para ver si sería adecuado para su biblioteca","Bingo está cerca de la cocina de su agujero hobbit. Ahora que ya has conversado con algunos invitados, deberías ver cómo está disfrutando tu anfitrión de su fiesta.","Los vecinos de Bingo y los visitantes de Maur Tulhau intentan encontrar puntos en común","Habla con Myrtle en el sendero fuera del agujero hobbit de Bingo","Myrtle Cenagales está fuera del agujero hobbit de Bingo. ¿Viene también a la fiesta?","La casa de Bingo está llena de muchos de los amigos que hizo durante su viaje, y deberías socializar con los invitados antes de que suene la campana para la cena.","Habla con Bingo en su casa","Siguen llegando invitados a la fiesta de Bingo, pero no hay garantía de que todos se lleven bien.","Siguen llegando más invitados a la fiesta de Bingo, y deberías recibirlos para que se sientan bienvenidos.","Recibe a los invitados de la fiesta de Bingo a medida que llegan","La expresión recelosa de Myrtle sería más adecuada para una batalla que para una fiesta"}},
[7299]={nameES="Instancia: El pacto peligroso",objectivesES={"You can hear the thoughts of Karazgar.\
\
'Oh the pieces, they fall right into place. I have Fram right where I want him.'","Experience the vision","Experience the vision.","Approach the vision of Fram","For Léothred and Fróthi, the truth of how Fram slayed Scatha begins to take form.","Instancia: El pacto peligroso","Approach the vision of Fram."}},
[7300]={nameES="Instancia: El cuadro pintado",objectivesES={"Examine the indistinct figures","Gandalf flips through the pages of the Black Book","Vóin writes of his adventures in the Grey Mountains, where he encountered Magoldir the Elf and the two became fast friends.","Listen to the words of Gandalf concerning his discoveries","Gandalf is in the Grey Mountains as they are depicted by the Halls of Memory.","Two thousand years following his survival of the Siege of Barad-dûr, Magoldir adventured in the Grey Mountains... but he did not travel alone.","Gandalf speaks to you of the discoveries he made while studying the Black Book.","Move through the twisting passage until you reach the Grey Mountains, as depicted by the Halls of Memory","Talk to Gandalf in the Grey Mountains, as depicted by the Halls of Memory","Habla con Gandalf","Gandalf has made a worrisome discovery while continuing his study of the Black Book of Mordor.","Examine the indistinct figure that remains","Instancia: El cuadro pintado"}},
[7301]={nameES="Instancia: El luchador de foso -- Día uno",objectivesES={"Enter the combat area","Now that you have been entered in the pit-fighting tournament, you should show these Orcs what is what.","Defeat the first opponent","<rgb=#FF0000>Do not leave the combat area!</rgb>","The first opponent enters the arena!","Defeat the second opponent.","Defeat the first opponent.","Enter the combat area.","Defeat the third opponent.","You have defeated Dhárpush the Foul!","Hear Gumog's words.","You have defeated Búkra the Scratcher!","Talk to Párgrub","Defeat the third opponent","Instancia: El luchador de foso -- Día uno","The Uruk, Gumog, starts to bellow to the crowd","You forfeit the challenge!","Defeat the second opponent","Talk to Párgrub.","You have defeated Gúgru the Gangly!","Hear Gumog's words"}},
[7302]={nameES="Instancia: El luchador de foso -- Día tres",objectivesES={"Enter the combat area","Now that you have been entered in the pit-fighting tournament, you should show these Orcs what is what.","Defeat the first opponent","You have defeated Mozrúf Blade-storm!","<rgb=#FF0000>Do not leave the combat area!</rgb>","Defeat the second opponent.","Defeat the first opponent.","Enter the combat area.","Instancia: El luchador de foso -- Día tres","You have defeated Núghorg the Scar-webbed","Defeat the third opponent.","Hear Gumog's words.","Defeat the previous tournament's victor","You have defeated Gorzum the Finisher!","Fight off the hoards of Orcs!","Defeat the previous tournament's victor.","Talk to Párgrub","The previous tournament's victor enters the arena!","Defeat the third opponent","Fend off the hordes of Orcs!","You forfeit the challenge!","Defeat the second opponent","Talk to Párgrub.","You have defeated Úrzot the Ravenous!","Gumog bellows to the crowd","Hear Gumog's words"}},
[7303]={nameES="Instancia: El luchador de foso -- Día dos",objectivesES={"Enter the combat area","Now that you have been entered in the pit-fighting tournament, you should show these Orcs what is what.","Defeat the first opponent","<rgb=#FF0000>Do not leave the combat area!</rgb>","Defeat the second opponent.","Defeat the first opponent.","Enter the combat area.","Defeat the third opponent.","You have defeated Ghárnakh Steelfist!","You have defeated Khûr the Ripper Twin!","You have defeated Maushak the Marrow-drinker!","Instancia: El luchador de foso -- Día dos","Talk to Párgrub","Defeat the third opponent","The Uruk, Gumog, starts to bellow to the crowd","You forfeit the challenge!","Defeat the second opponent","You have defeated Karg the Ripper Twin!","Talk to Párgrub."}},
[7304]={nameES="Instancia: El plan de ataque",objectivesES={"The leaders of the rebellion have gathered in Ahâba to plan their attack.\
\
You should listen to the conversation.","Defeat the attacking Ordâkhai","Instancia: El plan de ataque","Ahâba is under attack!","Listen to the conversation","Travelling in these lands, I have made bonds with many whose stories are like mine. The tyranny and depravity of Ordâkh has armed us with a common resentment. As rebellion gathers at my back and allies join my table, we plan to besiege Emax Dûl.","The Ordâkhai retreat!","Talk to Mizâdi","The leaders of the rebellion have gathered in Ahâba.\
\
You should talk to Mizâdi to begin the meeting.","Someone approaches in the darkness.\
\
You should listen to the conversation.","Ahâba is under attack!\
\
You should defeat the attacking Ordâkhai!"}},
[7305]={nameES="Instancia: El punto de decisión",objectivesES={"In desperation, you slip the Ring on your finger!","Consider the thoughts of Galadriel","You have managed to remove the Ring, narrowly avoiding the wrath of Sauron.\
\
Gandalf is brought once again to mind, and as you stand among the ruins atop Amon Hen you ponder your course.","You manage to remove the Ring. Now you know what you must do.","Walk north-west of Parth Galen so you may be alone with your thoughts","Sauron has sensed the Ring! Even now he looks for you!","Thoughts of Bilbo have risen unbidden in your mind as you try to decide what to do.","The terror of your recent experience is still with you, but you conjure the kindly face of Gandalf from your memories to try and fight back the dread. You can almost hear his voice, as clearly as when he spoke to you thusly in the library at Rivendell.\
\
'There are a great many dangers facing Middle-earth, Frodo, and your Ring is responsible, even indirectly, for all of them. The Orcs of the Misty Mountains stir, and Lórien is threatened with fire. The horsemen of Rohan fight back the wolves of Isengard. Corsairs put to sea from Harad and endless armies march from the east. The Mountain of Fire is aflame, and the Dark Lord's forces are in motion.\
\
'There are men who stand against him, men like Boromir, son of the Steward of Gondor and your companion. He and the men like him will fight, for as long as they are able, but when all is finished it seems to me they will be simply men, and for how long can men stand against such evil?\
\
'No, Frodo, I fear that when all is reckoned, it will come down to one hobbit, after all, and the strength he himself can bring to bear. Perhaps that is always the way it was meant to be.'","Walk further west so you may be alone in your thoughts","Sauron can sense the presence of the Ring! He searches for you!","The words of Gandalf are foremost in your thoughts.","You feel a presence behind you","Consider thoughts of Gandalf in the ruins atop Amon Hen","Talk to Boromir on Amon Hen","Aragorn and the rest of the Fellowship are camped on Parth Galen, in the East Wall.\
\
The time has come to decide which of the Company will go with Boromir to Minas Tirith, and which will go to Mordor, if any do.","A madness has taken Boromir!","A madness has taken Boromir! With the Ring on he cannot find you to harm you! Climb to the summit of Amon Hen to escape!","You have asked to be alone with your thoughts while you decide what must be done.\
\
Perhaps a short walk will help, as long as you do not stray out of call of the Fellowship.","The words of Galadriel are foremost in your thoughts.","Boromir has followed you part of the way up Amon Hen, and is waiting to speak to you.","Climb the stairs to the south-east so you may be alone in your thoughts","Instancia: El punto de decisión","Consider thoughts of Bilbo","Thoughts of Galadriel have risen unbidden in your mind as you try to decide what to do.","Consider the thoughts of Gandalf","Talk to Aragorn on Parth Galen","Thoughts of Elrond have risen unbidden in your mind as you try to decide what to do.","Thoughts of Galadriel rise unbidden in your mind","Consider the thoughts of Elrond","Thoughts of Gandalf have risen unbidden in your mind as you try to decide what to do.","Thoughts of Elrond rise unbidden in your mind","The Fellowship of the Ring has come at last to the ultimate decision: the East road or the West?","The words of Elrond are foremost in your thoughts.","Thoughts of Gandalf rise unbidden in your mind"}},
[7306]={nameES="Instancia: El poder de los juramentos",objectivesES={"You must be close now!\
\
You should help Arvedui reveal the hidden door!\
\
Say the password 'Dolen uin Belegoth' aloud to reveal the door.","Arvedui and Lothrandir are having a conversation outside Sûri-kylä.\
\
You should talk to Lothrandir when they are finished.","Talk to Lothrandir","Arvedui and Lothrandir are talking.\
\
You should listen to the conversation.","Speak to Arvedui to travel to Jä-reitti","Frost grims block your path deeper into the ice caves.\
\
You should defeat the frost grims.","Instancia: El poder de los juramentos","Defeated the frost grims","With the key of Agoroth in hand, the time has come to find the door to the hidden fortress, deep within the caves of ice.","Listen to the conversation","Say the password to reveal the door","Arvedui is ready to show you the way to Agoroth.\
\
Talk to Arvedui to travel to Jä-reitti.","The door to Agoroth has been revealed!","Arvedui and Lothrandir are conversing outside Sûri-kylä.\
\
You should listen to the conversation.","Derrota a los macabras de escarcha"}},
[7307]={nameES="Instancia: El Príncipe de Rohan, Noche",objectivesES={"Grimbold is on the eyot in the middle of the Isen, with Théodred.","Théodred does not have much time left. He wants to speak to you.","Instancia: El Príncipe de Rohan, Noche","Prince Théodred is dead. Grimbold wants to speak with you.","Elfhelm wishes to speak with you now that the battle has been won.","Talk to Elfhelm","The unthinkable has happened: Théodred, the Prince of Rohan, has sustained a mortal wound and lies dying at the Ford of Isen.","Talk to Grimbold","Talk to Théodred"}},
[7308]={nameES="Instancia: El Prisionero de Sammath Baul",objectivesES={"Laerdan se encuentra en estado de sometimiento en la cámara del piso superior de Sammath Baul.\
\
Morven te ordenó que lo regreses a su celda.","Un estruendo ensordecedor retumba por la sala","Amarthiel está interrogando al elfo Laerdan en el piso superior de Sammath Baul.\
\
Se te ha concedido el gran honor de presenciar el interrogatorio de Amarthiel al elfo Laerdan.","Morven se encuentra en la cámara del piso superior de Sammath Baul.\
\
Amarthiel ha terminado su interrogatorio y ahora Morven desea hablar contigo.","Morven se encuentra en el piso superior de la torre.\
\
Has despertado a todos los guardias dormidos y ahora deberías regresar junto a Morven.","Se pueden encontrar sanguijuelas de sangre por toda la torre de Sammath Baul.\
\
Morven te pidió que erradicaras las sanguijuelas que infestan la torre como preparación para la visita de Amarthiel.","Laerdan se encuentra en estado de sometimiento en la cámara del piso superior de Sammath Baul.\
\
Sammath Baul está siendo atacada por aliados de Laerdan, y Morven moviliza sus fuerzas para defender la torre.","El elfo Laerdan ha sido aprisionado en Sammath Baul, donde permanece bajo la atenta vigilancia de la torturadora Morven y de sus sangradores angmarim.","Devuelve a Laerdan a su celda","Los orcos Tarkrîp y Lozudurkh el Gorthorog se encuentran dormidos por toda Sammath Baul.\
\
Morven te envió a despertar a Lozudurkh y a todos los Tarkrîp dormidos en la torre.","Espera a que Amarthiel termine su interrogatorio","Instancia: El Prisionero de Sammath Baul","Morven se encuentra en la cámara del piso superior de Sammath Baul.\
\
Has eliminado por ahora las sanguijuelas de Sammath Baul y deberías informar a Morven en el piso superior.","Morven se encuentra en la cámara del piso superior de Sammath Baul.\
\
Morven te espera para darte tus instrucciones."}},
[7309]={nameES="Instancia: La Partida de Saqueo",objectivesES={"<rgb=#FF0000>Huneric must survive</rgb>","Defeat the raiding party.","Instancia: La Partida de Saqueo","Huneric, Lord of the Thíuda, has noticed forces gathering at Mokh Darga and wishes to halt a raid before it begins.","Talk to Huneric","The raiding party has been defeated and no longer poses a threat to Adambel","<rgb=#FF0000>Huneric has fallen in battle!</rgb>","Talk to Huneric.","Defeat the raiding party"}},
[7310]={nameES="Instancia: El alcance de la justicia",objectivesES={"Confront Athálrik","Instancia: El alcance de la justicia","Pursue Athálrik.","An anguished cry rises suddenly up ahead, followed by a laugh, then a growl","Defeat Athálrik.","You find the memory-cloth clutched in his hands.","A man who must be Athálrik stands, holding something up before him","Pursue Athálrik","You have found Athálrik. Now confront him.","TBD","Find Athálrik","Follow the sounds eastward.","It is serene here among the pines, the wind brushing thoughtfully through the grass","You have tracked Athálrik to his retreat in the highlands west of Lake-town.","Athálrik falls, a look of malice, fervour, and disbelief twisting his face","You should look for Athálrik, eastward from Víthog.","Search Athálrik","You should search Athálrik for the Chayasír's memory-cloth.","Defeat Athálrik"}},
[7311]={nameES="Instancia: La Reclamación de Talath Anor",objectivesES={"Some of the enemies flee on horse","The last few Haradrim have escaped to Cair Andros","Talk to Elfhelm at the river crossing in Talath Anor.","Instancia: La Reclamación de Talath Anor","Defeat enemies alongside Elfhelm","Enter the destroyed farm","With renewed spirit, Éomer, king of Rohan, has decided to send Elfhelm to lead an attack against a band of Haradrim who has fled into Talath Anor.","Enter the destroyed farm.","Defeat enemies at the farm alongside Elfhelm and his men.","Talk to Elfhelm","Pursue the Haradrim.","Pursue the Haradrim","Elfhelm has fallen in battle!","<rgb=#FF0000>Elfhelm must survive</rgb>"}},
[7312]={nameES="Instancia: El cielo rojo se oscurece",objectivesES={"Listen to Rhadrog's story","Instancia: El cielo rojo se oscurece","Rhadrog is telling you the tale of why he left Agarnaith with Faeron.\
\
You should talk to Rhadrog to begin.","Rhadrog is telling you the tale of why he left Agarnaith with Faeron.\
\
You should listen to Rhadrog's story.","Talk to Rhadrog","Rhadrog has a tale to tell about his departure from Agarnaith."}},
[7313]={nameES="Instancia: El Reeve del Valle del Entaguas",objectivesES={"Instancia: El Reeve del Valle del Entaguas","Speak with Burnoth.","Watch the discourse between Burnoth and Ingbert","Watch the discourse between Burnoth and Reeve Ingbert.","Talk to Burnoth","You have accompanied Burnoth as he comes before Ingbert, Reeve of the Entwash Vale."}},
[7314]={nameES="Instancia: El Refugio de Edhelion",objectivesES={"Ahora que has llegado al patio de Edhelion, sigue a Dorongúr Espinablanca hacia él.","Instancia: El Refugio de Edhelion","Habla con tu maestro, Talagan Lenguadeplata","Elrond el Medio Elfo necesita hablar contigo","Talagan Lenguadeplata te ha dicho que desea que te dirijas al patio de Edhelion y ayudes a defenderlo de nuevos ataques.","Habla con Talagan Lenguadeplata afuera de la biblioteca","Encuentra al Maestro Talagan afuera","Habla con Elrond <rgb=#00FF00>(Haz clic derecho sobre Elrond para interactuar)</rgb>","<rgb=#00ff00>Has vencido a Talagan</rgb>","Tu amado maestro, Talagan Lenguadeplata, se ha sacrificado para asegurarse de que los artefactos de Edhelion no cayeran en manos de Skorgrím.\
\
Ahora debes hablar con Elrond sobre todo lo que ha sucedido.","Un gran estruendo ha sacudido la biblioteca. Habla con Elrond para saber qué debes hacer.","Sigue a Elrond y a Dorongúr Espinablanca","La alforja está en el suelo cerca de Elrond.\
\
Deberías revisar la alforja en busca de armas que puedas usar para protegerte mejor, pues una guerra se libra afuera.\
\
<rgb=#00FF00>(Haz clic derecho sobre los objetos brillantes para interactuar con ellos. Para recoger el contenido de la alforja, haz clic en el botón marcado como 'Recoger todo', y los objetos aparecerán en tu inventario.)</rgb>","Sigue a Elrond y a Dorongúr Espinablanca hasta la entrada de las salas de Edhelion.\
\
Poco después de que entraste al patio de Edhelion, los Duramano derribaron la puerta. Skorgrím y un grupo de enanos corrieron hacia la entrada de las salas de Edhelion.","Elrond el Medio Elfo te llama para que vayas a hablar con él, pues una guerra se libra afuera.\
\
Habla con Elrond. <rgb=#00ff00>Haz clic derecho sobre los personajes para interactuar</rgb>","Mientras visitabas Edhelion con tu maestro, un Elfo llamado Talagan, el refugio montañoso fue atacado repentinamente por un enano violento y sediento de sangre llamado Skorgrím, rey de la familia Duramano.","Abre la alforja <rgb=#00FF00>(Haz clic derecho sobre la alforja para recoger lo que hay dentro)</rgb>","<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Los archivos que necesitas para continuar tus aventuras en la Tierra Media deberían terminar de descargarse en breve. ¡Gracias por tu paciencia!</rgb>","Habla con Elrond","Sigue a Dorongúr Espinablanca","Hay un arma en la alforja. Deberías recogerla y equiparla antes de intentar luchar.","Sigue a Edhelben","Lucha hasta llegar al patio de Edhelion.","Habla con Dorongúr","Acércate a Elrond <rgb=#00FF00>(Avanza presionando W)</rgb>","Ahora que has adquirido nuevas armas, deberías equiparlas.\
\
<rgb=#00FF00>ABRIR TU INVENTARIO: Presiona 'i' para abrir tu inventario y ver el arma, o haz clic izquierdo en los íconos de bolsa en la parte inferior de tu pantalla.\
\
<rgb=#00FF00>EQUIPAR TU ARMA: Haz clic derecho sobre el arma en tu inventario para equiparla. Esto reemplazará el arma endeble que tienes equipada actualmente.</rgb>\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>CONSEJO: Deberías equipar tu mejor arma antes de intentar entrar en combate.</rgb>","Sigue a Edhelben mientras te guía hacia el patio de Edhelion.\
\
Tu maestro Talagan Lenguadeplata te ha dicho que quiere que vayas al patio de Edhelion y ayudes a defenderlo de nuevos ataques.","Habla con Dorongúr Espinablanca."}},
[7315]={nameES="Instancia: El Rescate",objectivesES={"Find Hogawise within the prison-caves","Herestan and Hogawise are ready to fight the defenders at two rooms of cells within the prison-caves.","Halbarad and the sons of Elrond are further within the prison-caves.","You have freed a room of captives","Habla con Halbarad","Talk to Lheu Brenin","Lheu Brenin guards a bridge that leads deeper into the caves, but you cannot pass. Archers of the Falcon-clan make crossing impossible.","Théodred and some of his loyal men have come with you to the prison-caves behind Tûr Morva to try and rescue the Grey Company.","Return to Théodred in the prison-caves","Talk to Théodred within the prison-caves","Find Herestan within the prison-caves","Théodred is in one of the tunnels of the prison-caves you passed through to reach the prisoners.","Théodred is within one of the rooms of cells within the prison-caves.","Théodred is a short way ahead in the prison-caves.","Halbarad needs to speak with you.","Talk to Théodred in the prison-caves","Find Halbarad and the sons of Elrond, deeper within the prison-caves","Instancia: El Rescate"}},
[7316]={nameES="Instancia: La reconquista de Cair Andros",objectivesES={"Defeat Sárgrish","<rgb=#FF0000>Tolwin must survive</rgb>","Defeat Thaukbag","Talk to Duinhir","Defeat Ursajun","Talk to Dúneth","Defeat the four lieutenants of Cair Andros as you fight along side Tolwin, Dúneth, and Duinhir.","Walk together to the prow of Cair Andros.","Tolwin has fallen in battle!","Defend your ground in hope that additional support arrives to aid in the fight.","Defeated Hurshála","With the Enemy alerted, the Faint-hearted are left with no choice but to retake the island with haste.","Talk to Tolwin","Instancia: La reconquista de Cair Andros","Defend your ground","Fight through Cair Andros with Duinhir and his men.","<rgb=#FF0000>Duinhir must survive</rgb>","Dúneth has fallen in battle!","Defeated Sárgrish","Duinhir has fallen in battle!","Walk together to the prow of Cair Andros","Fight through Cair Andros with Duinhir and his men","Defeated Ursajun","<rgb=#FF0000>Dúneth must survive</rgb>","Talk to Duinhir.","Talk to Tolwin and Dúneth.","Defeated Thaukbag","Defeat Hurshála"}},
[7317]={nameES="Instance: The Return",objectivesES={"Weaken the Balrog Thaurlach to allow Glorfindel to defeat it","Habla con Glorfindel","Derrota al troll","Search the Rift of Nûrz Ghâshu for clues of Glorfindel's whereabouts.","Continue to look for clues of Glorfindel's whereabouts.","Continue following Glathlírel to seek clues of Glorfindel's whereabouts","Find a way past the locked gate.","Examine the clue","You have found a clue and should examine it.","With the guidance of Glathlírel, search for Glorfindel in the Rift of Nûrz Ghâshu.","Follow Glathlírel to search for clues of Glorfindel's whereabouts","Glathlírel is ready to explore the Rift of Nûrz Ghâshu once again, in search of Glorfindel.","Find a way past the locked gate","Defeated the troll","Fend off the attacking Pale-folk Defenders.","Follow the clue to Glorfindel.","Weaken the Balrog Thaurlach so Glorfindel can finish it once and for all.","Hear what Glorfindel has to say.","Follow the clue to Glorfindel","Thaurlach has been defeated!","Talk to Glathlírel","Defeat the Darklings.","Stand by Glorfindel's side","Defeat the troll.","Stand by Glorfindel's side.","Instance: The Return","You should talk to Glorfindel, now that Thaurlach is defeated."}},
[7318]={nameES="Instancia: Las Riquezas de Rhûn",objectivesES={"Zarhal Kôz can be found somewhere within Uya Hujûm.\
\
You have arrived in Uya Hujûm and should now battle through the encampment until you find Zarhal Kôz.","Zarhal Kôz can be found deep within Uya Hujûm.\
\
Zarhal Kôz has called forth his men and now attacks. You should defeat him.","Jarl Gurthilm and his company have travelled to the stronghold of Uya Hujûm to deal their vengeance upon Zarhal Kôz and the Khundolar.","Zarhal Kôz's men leap forth from the tent!","A great tent stands before you... and you can hear hasty chatter within!","Talk to Jarl Gurthilm","Instancia: Las Riquezas de Rhûn","Defeat Zarhal Kôz and his men","Zarhal Kôz can be found deep within Uya Hujûm.\
\
You have discovered Zarhal Kôz's whereabouts and should now confront him with the Variags.","Jarl Gurthilm is standing with his men in Uya Hujûm.\
\
You have come with the Variags to Uya Hujûm and should now speak to Jarl Gurthilm.","Confront Zarhal Kôz","Fight your way through Uya Hujûm and find Zarhal Kôz","Zarhal Kôz lies slain amidst his wealth of gold and treasures!"}},
[7319]={nameES="Instancia: La cabalgata de los Rohirrim",objectivesES={"The battle is joined!","Mount your steed and talk to Éomer","Ride for battle!","Listen to Théoden address the Rohirrim","Éomer is ready to join the line of horsemen, and he wants you to follow him.","Théoden, King of Rohan, prepares to address his people.","Instancia: La cabalgata de los Rohirrim","Join Éomer in the line","The Rohirrim have passed through the gap in the Rammas, and prepare to ride for the besieged city.","The Rohirrim have formed a line just south of the Rammas, preparing to ride for the city."}},
[7320]={nameES="Instance: The Rider's Retreat",objectivesES={"You have defeated the Nazgul. The battle is won for now.","Chase the Nazgul","TBD - Talk to Rohirrim Captain","Speak to the TBD Rohirrim Rider","TBD: OMG it's coming right for us!","Ride with the Rohirrim!","TBD","TBD Chase the Nazgul","Kill the Nazgul","Instance: The Rider's Retreat","TBD - Kill the Nazgul","TBD - Talk to Rohiriim Dude again","The Rohirrim Captain has fallen!","Don't let Rohirrim Captain die!"}},
[7321]={nameES="Instance: The Riders Four",objectivesES={"Burnoth invited you to speak with him and his companions to learn more about the Riders Four and their mission in the Eastemnet.","Léofdag eyes you warily.\
\
'Few care to know my tale, for it is one of shame. But if know it you must....'","Ulf stares at you darkly, as though uncertain whether to speak or fight.\
\
'My past is my own, stranger, but for Burnoth's sake, I will speak a little of it....'","Talk to Burnoth, son of Baldeg","Talk to Ulf the Reaver","Burnoth is at the refugee camp outside Harwick.\
\
You should return to Burnoth and let him know that you have spoken with his companions.","Talk to Léofdag, son of Winedag","Talk to Hutha, son of Hengest","Burnoth is near the camp-fire of the Riders Four in the refugee camp outside Harwick.\
\
You should speak with Burnoth to learn his story.","Talk to Burnoth","Instance: The Riders Four","The young archer eyes you a little suspiciously.\
\
'You wish to speak with me? Ah, Burnoth sent you. So be it....'"}},
[7322]={nameES="Instancia: El rito deshecho",objectivesES={"Con el regreso de la Corona de Hierro y sus leales entre los Trév Duvárdain, ahora divididos, a Carn Dûm, se rompió una paz frágil y los antiguos enemigos de los Trév Gállorg buscaron un nuevo dominio sobre Angmar.","Nekhtan ha ofrecido relatar la historia del rito de Clúcath.\
\
Debes hablar con Nekhtan.","Escucha el relato de Nekhtan sobre el rito del Clucath","Instancia: El rito deshecho","Nekhtan ha concluido la historia del rito de Clúcath.\
\
Debes hablar con Nekhtan.","Habla con Nekhtan","Nekhtan está relatando los eventos del rito del Clucath entre los Trév Gállorg y los Trév Duvárdain."}},
[7323]={nameES="Instancia: El Rito de Clúcath",objectivesES={"Crannog está esperando para caminar contigo al sitio donde se realizará el Clúcath.","Derrota a los guerreros de los Trév Duvárdain","Observa cómo se desarrolla el Clúcath","Has salido victorioso en el rito de Clúcath","Instancia: El Rito de Clúcath","Habla con Crannog","El Clúcath está a punto de comenzar: Crannog de los Trév Gállorg y Domongart de los Trév Duvárdain están cara a cara.","Crannog está en Fail-á-Khro, esperando para felicitarte por tu victoria.\
\
Has salido victorioso en Clúcath y ahora deberías hablar con Crannog.","Has venido a Fail-á-Khro para participar en el rito ceremonial de Clúcath en nombre de los Trév Gállorg."}},
[7324]={nameES="Instancia: La Puerta del Río",objectivesES={"You and Jajax have done what you could. Now it must be up to others.","At a gesture from the Golden Queen, the guards encircle you","You and Jajax stand alone against the guardsmen in Dâr Laja.","Convince Hármelak that the river gate must be closed","Talk to Khôltekh in Dâr Laja","Instancia: La Puerta del Río","Khôltekh has stepped through the line of Temámir archers to address you.","Assure Hármelak that <rgb=#00FF00>yes</rgb>, you have seen it","Talk to Hármelak in Dâr Laja","Only the Kindred of the Coins can command the river gate be closed. You and Jajax must convince Hármelak to issue the order.","Hármelak stands upon the dais in Dâr Laja.","Hármelak stares at you in disbelief, waiting for you to answer her question with a <rgb=#00FF00>yes</rgb>.","Jajax has come with you to Dâr Laja to warn the Kindred of the Coins about the approaching danger.","Temámir archers hold you at bay. You can fight no longer","The haste of your errand permits no delay: the Kindred of the Coins must be warned of the approaching danger!","Talk to Jajax in Dâr Laja"}},
[7325]={nameES="Instance: The Road to Adagím",objectivesES={}},
[7326]={nameES="Instancia: El Camino a Dunharrow",objectivesES={"Éowyn is standing outside Dimholt at Dunharrow.\
\
You should talk to Éowyn.","<rgb=#FF0000>Éowyn must not be defeated</rgb>","The Orc stands waiting outside the Dark Door","DNT -- Players will not see","Defeat Ur","Éowyn can be found on the Firienfeld at Dunharrow.\
\
You have arrived at Dunharrow, and now Éowyn wishes to speak with you.","The pale figure has fled deeper into the Dimholt.\
\
You should pursue it.","Éowyn, Mágla, and Ellen Fremedon have made their preparations, and now, they stand ready to guard the people of Kingstead as they travel to Dunharrow.","Éowyn has been defeated!","Instancia: El Camino a Dunharrow","Explore Dimholt with Éowyn","Talk to Éowyn at Dunharrow","Frantic screams echo from the Paths of the Dead","Éowyn is walking near the edge of Dimholt at Dunharrow.\
\
You should walk with Éowyn.","Éowyn can be found outside the Dark Door in the Dimholt.\
\
You have defeated the Orc-leader and brought peace to the people of Kingstead.","Talk to Éowyn","Ur can be found outside the Dark Door.\
\
You have cornered the Orc and should now defeat it.","Walk with Éowyn","Pursue the pale figure through the Dimholt","A pale figure stands in the distance...","Éowyn is inside the Dimholt.\
\
You should explore the Dimholt and discover what lurks nearby."}},
[7327]={nameES="Instance: The Roots of Fangorn",objectivesES={"Instance: The Roots of Fangorn","The venomous brood of Gurthúl has burrowed its way beneath the Roots of Fangorn - they must be destroyed before they can poison the forest above!","Defeat Frûshkul the Orc captain","A band of Moria Orcs have been ruthlessly enslaved by the spider queen Gurthúl and made to dig a secret tunnel into the natural caverns beneath the Limlight Falls at the edge of Fangorn.\
\
They are led by a powerful Orc named Frûshkul, who has been left to guard the passages as Gurthúl takes her brood ahead to corrupt and poison Fangorn's deepest roots.","Defeat the spider-queen Gurthúl","Defeat Gurthúl and her venomous brood beneath the Roots of Fangorn in Great River before they corrupt and sicken the forest above!","You have defeated Frûshkul the Orc captain!","You have defeated Gurthúl!"}},
[7328]={nameES="Instancia: Las Runas de la Malicia",objectivesES={"Defeated the frenzied grodbog","A ritual obelisk of the Iron Crown has been constructed in the caverns!","Explore the cave and learn of what stirs the beasts in Máttugard.","Defeat the frenzied beasts guarding the ritual obelisk.","Something stirs the creatures of Máttugard from within the caverns, deep under the Mighty Court.","The ritual obelisk has been destroyed!","Defeated the frenzied deep-claw","Talk to Varthmath","Defeat the frenzied grodbog","Destroy the ritual obelisk.","Talk to Varthmath.","Destroy the ritual obelisk","Search the cave for what stirs the beasts in Máttugard","Instancia: Las Runas de la Malicia","Defeat the frenzied deep-claw"}},
[7329]={nameES="Instancia: Los Muertos Despiadados",objectivesES={"Waldere is in the tunnel before you, injured and exhausted.","Talk to Waldere and declare your intentions","Talk to Elfdag in the Paths of the Dead","Waldere told you that his men were slain outside of a passage in the south-west of a cavernous chamber, and thinks you should search that tunnel for Elfdag.","A great city of the Dead stands beneath the mountains.\
\
You have found Elfdag in the Paths of the Dead, and now must fight to free him from the Dead.","Elfdag is in the empty streets of the city of the Dead beneath the mountains.","You have found Elfdag! He cowers in the court ahead, frightened by the Dead","You have proven your persistence to the Dead, and they retreat warily","Talk to Waldere","Search the south-west tunnel in the Paths of the Dead for Elfdag","Instancia: Los Muertos Despiadados","Waldere has asked if you plan to venture deeper into the Paths of the Dead by yourself or if you have a Fellowship near at hand.","Fight off the Dead Men and rescue Elfdag","You have come to the Paths of the Dead in search of Elfhelm's grandson Elfdag, who may have ventured beneath the mountain."}},
[7330]={nameES="Instancia: El ritual secreto",objectivesES={"Habla con Hórin","The Angmarim are attempting a ritual that will empower Loknashra!\
\
You should defeat the cultists performing the ritual!","Defeat the approaching fell spirits","The Angmarim are attempting a ritual that will empower Loknashra!\
\
You should defeat the approaching fell spirits!","Hórin is ready to stop the ritual taking place in Bagud-dum.\
\
You should talk to Hórin.","Do not allow the ritual to succeed","Ugarad the Harbinger intends to perform a secret ritual to impart the strength of the Gauntlord Drugoth to Loknashra of the Frost-bound. You and Hórin must stop this ritual before it is too late!","Instancia: El ritual secreto","Defeat the Angmarim cultists"}},
[7331]={nameES="Instancia: El camino secreto",objectivesES={"Orvar te ha dicho que busques a Bori, el cautivo, en el gran campamento orco de la sala del trono.","Habla con Bróin","Con la aparición repentina de Bróin y los Elfos de Buzun-ghâr, Mazog ha sido derrotado.","Protege a Orvar mientras enfrenta a Mazog","Debes despejar el camino para que Orvar te siga cuando esté listo.","No hay señales de Bori entre los orcos.","Has venido con Orvar a Rushdurinul, la sala del trono donde Mazog tiene su guarida, y ahora enfrentarás al líder orco.","Busca a Bori en el campamento orco","Sin señales de Bori en el campamento orco dentro de Rushdurinul, Orvar ha decidido enfrentar a Mazog directamente.","Has venido con Orvar Martillo de Campana a Zurr-thurkh, el 'camino secreto' que fue construido como pasaje de escape desde la sala del trono de Durin, y lo usarás para acceder a la fortaleza de Mazog.","Habla con Orvar en Rushdurinul","Nadie ha recorrido el 'camino secreto' desde antes de la Caída de Moria, pero ahora tú y Orvar Martillo de Campana lo usarán para llegar detrás de los muros de la fortaleza de Mazog, Zabadgathol.","Habla con Corunothiel","Habla con Orvar en Zurr-thurkh","Habla con Orvar","Despeja el camino para Orvar","Instancia: El camino secreto","Orvar está esperando fuera del camino secreto, en Rushdurinul."}},
[7332]={nameES="Instancia: La Sombra Secreta",objectivesES={"Mithrandir pauses before the looming shadows","Allow Mithrandir to banish the shadows in Falch Gurth","You and Mithrandir are walking through Falch Gurth.","Allow Mithrandir to banish the shadows of Thuringwath","With a sudden flash of light from Mithrandir's staff, the shadows give way","Follow Mithrandir","You should talk to Mithrandir.","Mithrandir's light pierces the shadows, revealing a blanket of darkness upon Thuringwath","You are following Mithrandir.","Thuringwath, the Valley of Secret Shadow, has remained hidden among the slopes of Ephel Dúath since the Second Age of the world.","As the pass widens into Thuringwath, great shadows loom before you","Mithrandir falls silent.","Mithrandir can be found in Falch Gurth.","Instancia: La Sombra Secreta","Again, the shadows give way to Mithrandir's light","Talk to Mithrandir","Dark shadows again loom in your path","You should follow Mithrandir."}},
[7333]={nameES="Instancia: El Secreto de Stormwall",objectivesES={"Talk to the dwarf","Deep within Stormwall lies a fiery secret, slumbering in the shadows.","Defend yourself against the dragon-kind.","Instancia: El Secreto de Stormwall","Defend yourself against the dragon-kind!","You should speak with the dwarf."}},
[7334]={nameES="Instancia: Los secretos de Sundergrót",objectivesES={"Náth has fallen!","<rgb=#FF0000>Rúzat must survive</rgb>","Deja que acontecimientos sigan su curso.","Approach the dwarves","<rgb=#FF0000>Agátur must survive</rgb>","Defeat Rákhrum and his forces.","Approach the dwarves.","The goblins of Sundergrót have set up a secret meeting within the old dwarf ruins.","Agátur has fallen!","Defeat Rákhrum and his forces","Rúzat has fallen!","Instancia: Los secretos de Sundergrót","Deja que acontecimientos sigan su curso","<rgb=#FF0000>Náth must survive</rgb>"}},
[7335]={nameES="Instancia: El Cazador de Sombras",objectivesES={"The time has come to enter the dwarf ruin, Shathur-munzu. The woodmen warned us of 'monsters' and 'The Shadow Hunter', but I remain unconvinced. Whatever lies inside, we are capable of defeating it.","You wake up in a cage inside what must be Shathur-munzu","You find yourself inside a cage in Shathur-munzu.\
\
You should wake up.","Knock out the Orc jailor","Talk to Baradal","Baradal is standing by outside Shathur-munzu.\
\
You should talk to Baradal.","Instancia: El Cazador de Sombras","An Orc has approached your cage, taunting you.\
\
You should knock out the Orc.","The Orc jailor crumples to the ground. The key to your cage is in reach!","You should be able to reach the key and free yourself from this cage.","Defeat the attacker"}},
[7336]={nameES="Instance: The Shadow in Morthond",objectivesES={"Rovalang has been defeated, and you have failed!","Climb the slope and stop the Nazgûl from learning of Aragorn's passage. Rovalang must not be defeated.","The Nazgûl has not yet learned of Aragorn's passage. Hope remains, for now!","Time until Nazgûl encounters Drugât:","You must find the Nazgûl and prevent it from learning of Aragorn's passage.","Rovalang is waiting to speak with you.","Defeat the Nazgûl before Drugât emerges from the Paths of the Dead. Rovalang must not be defeated.","You and Rovalang have gone to the foot of the White Mountains in search of the creature he saw.","Talk to Rovalang and declare your intentions","You have struck the Nazgûl a grievous blow: you have kept from it dangerous knowledge","Instance: The Shadow in Morthond","Time until the Nazgûl learns of Aragorn's passage:","If the Nazgûl is able to learn of Aragorn's passage, the Ranger's advantage will be lost. You must defeat the Nazgûl before he can meet with Drugât!","Drugât emerges from the Paths of the Dead, and your mission has failed!","You have come to the foothills of the White Mountains in the company of Rovalang, searching for the terrible beast he saw flying above the Blackroot Vale.","Talk to Rovalang","Rovalang has asked if you and he are on your own, or if you have a Fellowship near at hand."}},
[7337]={nameES="Instancia: La Sombra de Mordor",objectivesES={"Recoge un arma abandonada para defenderte","Habla con Dwalin","Con un grito desafiante, Vaski atrae la atención de Ushgrat. ¡Corre mientras puedas!","Divisas a un uruk encorvado sobre un Hachetón herido, bloqueando la salida","Defiende a Lethi de la criatura pálida","Habla con Nagli en la Mansión de Thorin","Ashaug puede encontrarse cerca de Hakal-kúnug, la Escalera Retorcida dentro de Barad-dûr.\
\
Ashaug ha recibido una herida grave en la lucha dentro de Barad-dûr, pero sus heridas parecen venir de una fuente inusual. Deberías hablar con Ashaug.","Rethvárd se encuentra en la Puerta Oxidada en Ered Luin.\
\
Nagli te ha llevado ante Rethvárd, un guardia Duramano, con la esperanza de que pueda concederte una audiencia con Gormr Forjadura, el Senescal de la Mansión de Thorin. Debes hablar con Rethvárd.","<rgb=#FF0000>¡No escapaste a tiempo!</rgb>","Lethi ha avanzado hacia los pasillos sombríos de Barad-dûr\
\
Debes seguir a Lethi y continuar hacia las puertas de Barad-dûr.","Disfrázate como un capitán orco","Medio oculto tras un brasero, Lethi observa a lo lejos","Cuando Lethi se acerca a la criatura pálida, ¡esta salta de pronto y ataca!","Lethi se encuentra en Barad-dûr.\
\
Has descubierto al uruk Ushgrat custodiando las puertas de Barad-dûr. Peor aún, parece haber sometido a Vaski. Debes hablar con Lethi.","El capitán orco muerto se encuentra justo delante de Lethi en Barad-dûr\
\
Tras divisar a un capitán orco muerto, Lethi te ha pedido que te disfraces con su armadura para engañar a los habitantes de Mordor. Debes disfrazarte.","Algunos de los Duramano han elegido seguir a Skorgrím, pero parece que algunos aún podrían ser persuadidos.","Después de frustrar la huida de Vaski, Ushgrat vigila ante las puertas de Barad-dûr.\
\
Deberías confrontar a Ushgrat y abrirte paso luchando para salir de Barad-dûr.","Sigue a Lethi","Mientras te ajustas el yelmo mal encajado, Lethi te llama","Advierte a Rethvárd que no siga a Skorgrím","Instancia: La Sombra de Mordor","Habla con Ashaug","Skorgrím, y muchos de los Duramano que lo siguen ahora, marchan desde la Puerta Oxidada.\
\
Debes mantenerte alerta.","Lethi se encuentra en Barad-dûr.\
\
Después de repeler a la criatura pálida que lo atacó, Lethi está trastornado. Debes hablar con Lethi antes de continuar hacia las puertas de Barad-dûr.","Mientras Dwalin mira hacia la Mansión de Thorin, se acaricia la barba con inquietud","La criatura pálida escupe y maldice mientras huye","Lethi se encuentra en Barad-dûr.\
\
Te has disfrazado como un capitán orco, lo cual podría ayudarte a escapar de la Tierra de Mordor. Debes hablar con Lethi.","Nagli te ha hablado de un enano llamado Dwalin, quien lideró la reciente expedición Barbiluenga a la Mansión de Thorin\
\
Con la esperanza de conocer la verdad de las afirmaciones de Skorgrím y buscar refugio, Nagli te ha pedido que viajes con él a la Mansión de Thorin.","Habla con Lethi","Manchado con sangre negra, Ashaug yace moribundo entre varios orcos y Hachetones caídos","Lethi puede encontrarse cerca de Hakal-kúnug, la Escalera Retorcida dentro de Barad-dûr.\
\
Deberías seguir a Lethi y encontrar el camino hacia las puertas de Barad-dûr.","Nagli se encuentra en la Puerta Oxidada en Ered Luin.\
\
Nagli te ha sugerido que pidas refugio entre los Duramano en Ered Luin. Sin autoridad para decidirlo, Nagli te ha pedido que hables con Rethvárd para que él pueda llevarte ante el Senescal de la Mansión de Thorin.","Escapa de Barad-dûr y encuentra una salida de Mordor","Hasta aquí hemos llegado. Será mejor no dejarnos ver","El camino hacia las puertas de Barad-dûr está justo delante de ti.\
\
Lethi te ha pedido que mires más allá de la esquina y veas si la salida de Barad-dûr está despejada.","Dwalin puede encontrarse en algún lugar dentro de la Mansión de Thorin.\
\
Tras entrar en la Mansión de Thorin, los barbiluengos han vigilado de cerca a Nagli. Debes encontrar y hablar con Dwalin.","Enfrenta al Uruk","Sigue a Nagli","A medida que la sombra de Mordor se alarga sobre la Tierra Media, el Enemigo ordena la liberación de un prisionero misterioso, provocando intrigas y revueltas en Barad-dûr.","<rgb=#FF0000>¡Debes escapar antes de que Ushgrat domine a Lethi y Vaski!</rgb>","Lethi y Vaski han atraído la atención de Ushgrat lejos de ti.\
\
¡Debes escapar de Barad-dûr antes de que sea demasiado tarde!","Armas abandonadas pueden encontrarse cerca de los orcos muertos en Hakal-kúnug, la Escalera Retorcida dentro de Barad-dûr.\
\
Deberías encontrar un arma adecuada para defenderte antes de avanzar más en Barad-dûr.","La criatura pálida se encuentra en Barad-dûr.\
\
A pesar de parecer muerta, la criatura pálida se ha puesto de pie y ha atacado a Lethi. Debes defenderlo y ahuyentar a la criatura.","Habla con Nagli","Nagli puede encontrarse en la Puerta Oxidada en Ered Luin.\
\
Todos los Duramano excepto Nagli han partido con Skorgrím. Deberías hablar con Nagli.","Nagli puede encontrarse en la Puerta Oxidada en Ered Luin.\
\
Después de que contaste a los Duramano tu escape de Mordor, un enano llamado Nagli ha pedido hablar contigo. Deberías hablar con Nagli.","Lethi se encuentra en Barad-dûr.\
\
Lethi avanza hacia las puertas de Barad-dûr. Debes seguirlo.","Lethi se encuentra en Barad-dûr.\
\
Lethi está de pie junto a un brasero en Barad-dûr. Debes hablar con Lethi.","Se puede encontrar a Lethi cerca de Hakal-kúnug, la Escalera Retorcida, dentro de Barad-dûr.\
\
Debes hablar con Lethi","Habla con Rethvárd","Permanece alerta","Lethi se encuentra en Barad-dûr.\
\
Has tomado un arma. Debes hablar con Lethi y seguirlo hacia las puertas de Barad-dûr.","Rethvárd puede encontrarse en la Puerta Oxidada en Ered Luin.\
\
Ninguno de los otros Duramano que advertiste pudo ser disuadido de seguir a Skorgrím. Deberías advertir a Rethvárd.","Asómate por la esquina y <rgb=#FF00FF>mira</rgb> si las puertas de Barad-dûr están sin guardia","Habla con Skorgrím","Encuentra a Dwalin, el líder de la expedición Barbiluenga, en la Mansión de Thorin","Skorgrím te fulmina con la mirada. Sus ojos destellan con un brillo antinatural\
\
'Estás lejos de casa, ¿no es así?'","Skorgrím Duramano se encuentra en la Puerta Oxidada en Ered Luin.\
\
Seguido por un número considerable de Duramano, y un Hombre de aspecto mortecino, Skorgrím ha pedido hablar contigo. Debes hablar con Skorgrím.","Dwalin puede encontrarse en la Mansión de Thorin.\
\
Has encontrado a Dwalin en lo profundo de la Mansión de Thorin. Debes hablar con él en nombre de Nagli y pedir refugio en la Mansión de Thorin.","Los Duramano pueden encontrarse en la Puerta Oxidada en Ered Luin.\
\
Skorgrím Duramano afirma haber sido resucitado por un Hombre de aspecto mortecino llamado Ivar Manosangrienta, y ha convocado a todos los Duramano leales al servicio de Angmar. Sin embargo, algunos han dudado en responder a su llamado. Deberías advertirles que no sigan a Skorgrím."}},
[7338]={nameES="Instancia: El entrenamiento de la doncella escudera",objectivesES={"Ides has ventured with you into the woods.\
\
Ides wishes to speak with you about the Uruk-hai.","Defeat the Uruk-hai scouts","Instancia: El entrenamiento de la doncella escudera","Ides has ventured into the wooded area adjacent to the training grounds, to test her skill against the wild bears. She is eager to prove herself in battle.","<rgb=#FF0000>Do not allow Ides to be defeated</rgb>","The Uruk-hai scouts have invaded the woods by the training grounds.\
\
Uruks have begun to attack Ides while searching for the location of the training grounds.","Ides can be found waiting along the road.\
\
Ides wishes to speak with you about hunting the wild bears.","Talk to Ides","You have successfully hunted bears with Ides","Ides has ventured with you into the woods.\
\
Ides wishes to speak with you about the hunt."}},
[7339]={nameES="Instancia: La Hoz, el Loto y el León",objectivesES={"Instancia: La Hoz, el Loto y el León","Spread the map out on the table.","You have brought the leaders of Ambarûl, Khûd Zagin, and Imhûlar together in Iridír. Mizâdi has much to do before Girhâzi and Amalíbi trust her or her leadership.","Speak with Mizâdi in the war room.","Gather the map from near the Subuzûri","Listen to the conversation","Join Mizâdi around the war table","Speak with Mizâdi in the hall","Speak with Mizâdi","Speak with Mizâdi in the hall.","Spread the map out on the table","Listen to the conversation.","Join Mizâdi around the war table.","Gather the map from near the Subuzûri."}},
[7340]={nameES="Instancia: El Asedio de Barad Morlas",objectivesES={"Los Elfos han lanzado un ataque para recuperar Barad Morlas de los dunlendinos que han invadido Eregion. Aunque el ataque inicial tuvo éxito, una fuerza mayor de dunlendinos cayó sobre los Elfos mientras atendían a sus heridos. Ahora, atrapados entre las ruinas y sometidos a los asaltos constantes de las máquinas de guerra, los Elfos necesitan desesperadamente ayuda.","Un defensor Elfo ha caído","Aunque los Elfos son guerreros hábiles capaces de repeler sin dificultad los asaltos de los dunlendinos, las máquinas de asedio en el campo los tienen inmovilizados y están mermando su número. Debes salir al campo, encontrar las máquinas de asedio y derrotar a sus equipos, otorgando un respiro a los defensores élficos.","Tras derrotar a los dunlendinos y dispersar a sus fuerzas, ahora puedes usar la antigua forja para potenciar tu zafiro infundido con las bendiciones de los Elfos.","Con sus máquinas de asedio fuera de combate y su ataque debilitándose, el comandante dunlendino dirige un asalto final contra el puente. Debe ser detenido.","Derrota al comandante dunlendino","Usa el yunque antiguo","Habla con Perimbant para volver a Echad Dúnann.","El comandante dunlendino ha sido derrotado","Instancia: El Asedio de Barad Morlas","Habla con Perimbant","Equipo de arma de asedio derrotado"}},
[7341]={nameES="Instance: The Siege of Emax Dûl",objectivesES={"You hear the clamour of fighting echoing all around you","You and Razâl must find a way into the gate-house to open the gates of Emax Dûl.\
\
You should explore the caves with Razâl and find the entrance to the gate-house.","Razâl is standing by to begin the infiltration plan.\
\
You should talk to Razâl when you are ready to begin.","Exit the gate-house","This is surely the gate-house","You have successfully taken control of the gate-house.\
\
You should find and use the lever for the main gate.","Find Mizâdi","Instance: The Siege of Emax Dûl","Defeat Góramul Sai","Talk to Razâl","Razâl is with you and ready to begin.\
\
You should enter the secret cave system.","Mizâdi's forces have begun the invasion of the city.\
\
You should exit the gate-house to the streets of Emax Dûl.","Emax Dûl, the ancient Nêshakari stronghold overlooking Idagâl, has long been known to be an impenetrable fortress. Many invasions have failed at its gates. The prince of Ordâkh and his forces are counting on this to protect themselves from the growing rebellion just outside their walls, but unknown to them, the fortress has a weakness.","Góramul Sai has retreated into the palace","Mizâdi has cornered Góramul Sai at the steps to the palace.\
\
You should help your allies defeat Góramul Sai.","Defeated the guards in the gate-house","You have found the gate-house.\
\
You should defeat the guards in the gate-house before they can signal the alarm.","Defeat the guards in the gate-house","Find the entrance to the gate-house","Mizâdi's forces are fighting for control of Emax Dûl.\
\
You should find Mizâdi somewhere up ahead.","Enter the secret cave system","Use the gate lever"}},
[7342]={nameES="Instancia: La Herencia del Cambiapieles",objectivesES={"Ha llegado el momento de despedirte de tus hermanos antes de salir hacia el mundo más amplio.","El Mago Radagast ha venido al refugio de Grimbeorn, y tu mente corre intentando averiguar la razón. Tu hermano Sterkist quiere tu ayuda para descubrir qué ha traído al Mago desde su hogar en el Bosque Negro.","Instancia: La Herencia del Cambiapieles","Parece que Radagast ya sabía del movimiento de los trasgos, y que su visita a Grimbeorn está relacionada de algún modo con los crecientes problemas del mundo.","Habla con Sterkist y convéncelo de que no permanezca como un oso malhumorado","Langhár te sonríe, pero antes de hablar con tu hermana deberías terminar tu primera tarea: derrotar a las moscas guadaña que zumban cerca.","Habla con Sterkist frente al refugio de Grimbeorn","Grimbeorn ha tomado su decisión: te enviará en el encargo de Radagast, para llevar una advertencia sobre la oscuridad creciente que amenaza la Tierra Media.","Te has preparado para el viaje, y ahora ha llegado el momento de dejar la tierra de tu hogar en busca del Montaraz Aragorn.","Habla con Radagast y Grimbeorn, llena las alforjas del caballo y parte de viaje","Has vivido en los valles protegidos del Río Anduin toda tu vida, pero ahora las tierras salvajes te llaman, y la aventura se abre ante ti.","Encuentra a la vaca lechera que anda vagando y convéncela de regresar a su corral.","Varthmath quizá sepa qué trajo a Radagast fuera del Bosque Negro, y deberías encontrarlo en el corral de animales al oeste del refugio. Tu primo es un hombre de pocas palabras, pero sus oídos atentos no se pierden nada.","Una de las vacas lecheras ha salido del corral, y Varthmath quiere que la encuentres y la envíes de vuelta antes de que salga del recinto de Grimbeorn.","Habla con Sterkist afuera del refugio de Grimbeorn","Sterkist gruñe en el lenguaje de los osos, pero tus palabras están llenas de afecto. Él se eriza, y finalmente cede.","Ofolmóth quiere que pongas a prueba tu temple contra las moscas guadaña alrededor de la cerca. Si rodeas la cerca hacia el oeste y el sur, encontrarás suficientes molestias para obtener una buena práctica.","Corre al refugio de Grimbeorn para advertirle de los trasgos","Ofolmóth está rodeado por los cuerpos de trasgos","Habla con Ofolmóth y descubre qué quiere de ti.","Habla con Langhár","Habla con Radagast","Tu hermana Langhár suele pasear por los campos de trébol, vigilando cualquier amenaza que se acerque demasiado al hogar de Grimbeorn. Ella te llamó después de que derrotaras a muchas moscas guadaña, y puede encontrarse al suroeste.","Te acercas a la vaca lechera y ella brama nerviosamente. Algo la ha alterado. ¿Qué podría ser?\
\
Cuando eras joven desarrollaste la habilidad de comprender muchos de los lenguajes animales, un don de tu ancestro Beorn. Ahora recurres a esa facilidad natural para hablarle suavemente a la vaca lechera.\
\
Al poco tiempo recupera la calma y comienza a volver lentamente a su corral.","Escucha las noticias de Radagast sobre el mundo más amplio","Los trasgos han convergido en el corral de Grimbeorn, y deberías llevarle noticia de su ataque.","Los trasgos han llegado a los valles del Anduin, y deberías volver al refugio de Grimbeorn y advertir a tu familia del peligro.","Radagast tiene un encargo urgente para ti, y te llevará lejos de las tierras familiares de tu hogar.","Habla con Langhár en los campos fuera del corral de Grimbeorn, al suroeste.","Necesitarás algunos suministros si quieres tener éxito en tu viaje.","Tú y tu hermano Sterkist han pasado muchas tardes mirando las aguas quietas del estanque junto al refugio de Grimbeorn una vez terminado el trabajo.\
\
Sterkist está filosófico esta tarde en particular y desea continuar vuestra conversación.","Habla con Grimbeorn","Los trasgos han llegado a los valles del Anduin, y deberías llevar noticia de su presencia a Grimbeorn en su refugio.","Date prisa y vuelve a la entrada del refugio de Grimbeorn","Habla con Varthmath en el corral al oeste del refugio de Grimbeorn","Ofolmóth ha pronunciado tu nombre. Está de pie justo más allá de la puerta del corral de Grimbeorn.","Habla con Sterkist junto al estanque de Grimbeorn"}},
[7343]={nameES="Instancia: El olor de la revuelta",objectivesES={"Derrota a los rufianes.","Derrota a los rufianes","Deja que los acontecimientos sigan su curso.","Lanza bombas fétidas a los Fronteros de Lotho.","Instancia: El olor de la revuelta","Deja que los acontecimientos sigan su curso","Los planes de Lotho de cambiar las fronteras de la Comarca Allende deben ser detenidos.","Con los rufianes derrotados, es hora de centrar tu atención en Lotho","Habla con Fredegar"}},
[7344]={nameES="Instancia: El Arrebatador",objectivesES={"Atta is telling you his tale of Úbil the Snatcher.\
\
You should talk to Atta.","Instancia: El Arrebatador","Atta has offered to tell you his tale of Úbil the Snatcher.\
\
You should talk to Atta.","Atta is telling you his tale of Úbil the Snatcher.\
\
You should talk to Atta before allowing him to continue his tale.","When Atta was a boy, the creature known as the Snatcher returned to the Vales of Anduin and once again sought to prey on the weak and helpless.","Listen to Atta and follow along with his tale","Talk to Atta","Atta falls silent.","Atta is telling you his tale of Úbil the Snatcher.\
\
You should listen to Atta as he tells his tale."}},
[7345]={nameES="Instancia: Las nieves vuelven",objectivesES={"Jump off the edge of Byre Tor's cliff.","Núrzum has arrived; run! Run the other way!","Run north","Jump off the cliff, quickly!","Two more uruks stand in the road in north-west Byre Tor.","Defeat the Uruk scout","Run north, to the edge of Byre Tor.","Núrzum is close behind!\
\
You should run in the opposite direction.","You do not remember any more -- only staggering blindly away, far away from Byre Tor","Enemies are behind you!","A cold wind blows from the north-west of town.\
\
You should speak to the Uruk in the north-west of Byre Tor.","Jump off the cliff","Instancia: Las nieves vuelven","Run east!","Talk to the Uruk standing in the road","Uruks approach...","Two more Uruks appear to block the path...","Run east, away from Núrzum's forces!","Uruks approach from behind!\
\
You should defeat the attacking Uruks.","Try to escape Byre Tor by heading north-west","Run away from Núrzum!\
\
You should approach the glowing path markers.","Run away from Núrzum, east!","The snows and the enemies have come to Byre Tor once more.","Run along the road, away from Núrzum"}},
[7346]={nameES="Instancia: La canción de la dulce Lara",objectivesES={"Linadar is by the camp-fire near where the waggons have stopped for the night.","Talk to Linadar by the camp-fire","A brief respite on the way to Minas Tirith will be welcomed by all.","Talk to Rathnor by the waggons","Listen to the conversation by the camp-fire and remain alert","Talk to Ayorzén south-west of the waggons","Rathnor has stopped the waggons on the road to Minas Tirith, and will wait for the onset of morning before he drives them the rest of the way to the White City.","Talk to Mithrandir south-east of the camp-fire","Talk to Ayorzén by the camp-fire before the situation worsens","Talk to Mithrandir south-east of the waggons","Mithrandir is near the fire where the waggons have stopped for the night.","Talk to Linadar west of the waggons","Tensions run high by the side of the road where the waggons to Minas Tirith have stopped for the night, and you should try and defuse the situation, if you can.","Ayorzén is looking at the sunset not far from where the waggons have stopped for the night.","Instancia: La canción de la dulce Lara","The men have called for you to <rgb=#00FF00>sit</rgb> by the fire with them.","Tensions run high by the side of the road where the waggons to Minas Tirith have stopped for the night.","<rgb=#00FF00>Sit</rgb> by the camp-fire near the waggons","The waggons have stopped for the night, and the folk that travel with you prepare to rest."}},
[7347]={nameES="Instancia: Los Hijos de Isildur",objectivesES={"Talk to the Gondorian soldier","Tárandil is at Díngarth.","The sons of Isildur are sharing a meal and conversation around a camp-fire at the encampment of Díngarth.","Talk to Tárandil","Vëamacil and Ornaher are at Díngarth, relating stories told by their eldest brother Meldaran, who remained at the Black Gate.","A soldier of Gondor has asked the sons of Isildur for tidings of the Ghâzab Bôron.","Talk to Vëamacil","Listen to the sons of Isildur discuss the Ghâzab Bôron, the Storm of Wrath","Vëamacil is at Díngarth.","Tárandil has returned with the wine, but he is displeased to be the subject of his foster-brothers' gibes.","Ornaher is at Díngarth.","The sons of Isildur wait for you to sit by their camp-fire and share a meal.","Instancia: Los Hijos de Isildur","Talk to Ornaher","A Gondorian soldier has interrupted the merry-making to ask a concerning question of the sons of Isildur.","Listen to the sons of Isildur discuss the war's progress","Listen to the conversation of the sons of Isildur","<rgb=#00FF00>Sit</rgb> by the fire","Vëamacil has suggested that you take a meal with his brothers before the sons of Isildur conduct their inspection of Díngarth's defences."}},
[7348]={nameES="Instancia: El Adivino",objectivesES={"You give Hildegard your name and she nods.\
\
'It is a pleasure to meet you, friend of Herubrand. Many are the roads you have walked to get here, and many more you will walk before you are at last given rest.'","Hildegard stands, unblinking, but does not appear to see you or Nona any longer.","Hildegard stands, unblinking, but does not appear to see you any longer","Hildegard stares sightlessly forward.","Hildegard looks at you curiously. Her face is a quiet mask, and you cannot tell what hides behind her calm expression.","Talk to Herubrand inside Orlag Den","Listen to Horn's confrontation with Hildegard in Orlag Den.","Horn has made his disbelief of Hildegard most plain.","The soothsayer Hildegard stands upright, staring forward sightlessly. She still breathes, but she no longer appears to see either you or Nona.","Listen to the words of Hildegard","Answer Hildegard's questions, and hear what she has to say","Talk to Horn in Orlag Den","Hildegard is inside the cave of Orlag Den, where she makes her home.","Hildegard has asked you what adventuring discipline you follow.","Instancia: El Adivino","Nona is in Orlag Den, the cave of the soothsayer Hildegard.","Herubrand has brought you to Orlag Den, the cave of the soothsayer Hildegard.","Talk to Nona in Orlag Den","Talk to Hildegard in Orlag Den","Hildegard has asked to speak with Nona.","Horn is in Orlag Den, the cave of the soothsayer Hildegard.","Listen to Horn and Hildegard's confrontation","Herubrand is inside Orlag Den, the cave of the soothsayer Hildegard."}},
[7349]={nameES="Instancia: El Espectro y la Sombra, Parte 3",objectivesES={"Khaljûn asks you to accompany him further into the Blade-horn to further investigate the wailing spirit and his brother's journal.","Investigate the strange crack left by the wailing spirit within the Blade-horn.","Attempt to calm the mysterious spirit within the Blade-horn.","The spirit turns and flees like the wind, moving through a seemingly solid wall","Investigate the strange mechanism in the torch near the wall of the Blade-horn.","Defeat the attacking spirits!","Investigate the strange mechanism near the wall of the Blade-horn","Attempt to calm the mysterious spirit","Defeat the mysterious spirit within the Blade-horn","Defeat the mysterious spirit within the Blade-horn.","Spirits descend to attack you!","Instancia: El Espectro y la Sombra, Parte 3","You see a similar mechanism to the first wall in Blade-horn. Another secret passage?","Press further into the Blade-horn, behind the broken wall.","A secret door shudders and opens, leading to a deeper part of the Blade-horn","Press further into the Blade-horn","Investigate the strange wall within the Blade-horn"}},
[7350]={nameES="Instancia: El Espectro y la Sombra, Parte 4",objectivesES={"Get close to the first secret door inside the Blade-horn","Defeat Valrazâr in the crypt","Listen to the conversation","Defeat Valrazâr in the crypt.","You must press even further into Bâdrasag, the Blade-horn, to uncover its closely kept secrets.","Listen to Khaljûn in the crypt of the Blade-horn.","Listen to the conversation between Khaljûn and Valrazâr.","Listen to Khaljûn in the crypt of the Blade-horn","Join Khaljûn at the tomb at the end of the corridor.","Listen to the conversation between Khaljûn and the mysterious man.","The wall pushes back and lifts, revealing another corridor and an even deeper area","Listen to the conversation between Khaljûn and Valrazâr","Examine the suspicious wall the spirit went through in the Blade-horn.","Join Khaljûn at the tomb at the end of the corridor","Examine the suspicious wall the spirit went through in the Blade-horn","Instancia: El Espectro y la Sombra, Parte 4","Defeat the angry spirits within the passage!","The door opens, seemingly without activation or interference","Get close to the first secret door inside the Blade-horn."}},
[7351]={nameES="Instancia: El lenguaje de los animales",objectivesES={"Le hablas al ciervo con palabras tranquilizadoras en la lengua de los animales, palabras que Grimbeorn y otros de los tuyos te enseñaron en tu juventud. El pánico del ciervo se atenúa poco a poco, aunque sus orejas aún se agitan ante cualquier sonido.\
\
La actitud de la criatura asustada te indica que Clothar tiene razón en preocuparse: un gran depredador anda cerca.","Has encontrado al oso que amenazó y aterrorizó a Clothar.\
\
Parecía que casi lograbas calmar al gran oso con tus palabras, pero la criatura logró sacudirse tu influencia.","Clothar Hojarena se encuentra en el Bosque Viejo y apenas puede creer lo que ven sus ojos y oyen sus oídos.","Vuelves a tender la mano hacia el oso, recurriendo a tu afinidad natural con las criaturas. Un gruñido bajo confirma tu sospecha: algo ha infundido en el oso un miedo grande y terrible, poniendo en marcha este ataque frenético.\
\
'Amigo', le hablas con tono tranquilizador, y el oso te dice su nombre.\
\
De pronto, un fuerte estremecimiento sacude el cuerpo de la criatura, ¡y vuelve a atacar!","Clothar se sobresaltó por la aparición repentina de un animal, pero solo era un ciervo nervioso, no el oso gigante que esperaba ver.\
\
Deberías hablarle en la lengua de los animales y averiguar si ha visto al oso enloquecido.","El miedo ha desaparecido y ahora ves algo distinto en los ojos de Zarzagruño: respeto y admiración. Has salvado al oso de sí mismo.","El miedo ha desaparecido de los ojos de Zarzagruño y ha sido reemplazado por otras emociones: respeto y admiración.\
\
Tus palabras apaciguadoras y la firmeza de tu determinación han devuelto a Zarzagruño la razón. En la lengua de su especie, te cuenta sobre un espectro aterrador que rondaba las llanuras donde yacen los túmulos de Hombres muertos hace mucho tiempo. El rostro de ese terrible rey despertó en Zarzagruño un miedo primigenio, y no pudo sacudirse la locura que se apoderó de él.\
\
Con un resoplido agradecido, Zarzagruño se da la vuelta y se interna de nuevo entre los árboles.","Ves algo en el ojo de la criatura que te hace dudar","Derrota al gran oso","Clothar Hojarena te ha llevado al Bosque Viejo en busca del oso gigante que tanto lo aterrorizó.","Te encontraste con un ciervo nervioso en el Bosque Viejo y supiste que hay un depredador cerca. ¿Podría ser el oso gigante con el que se topó Clothar Hojarena?","Has aprendido el nombre del gran oso, Zarzagruño, y que algún mal ha infundido en la criatura un miedo grande y terrible, llevándola a un estado de frenesí.","Habla con Clothar en el Bosque Viejo","Enfréntate al gran oso, pero no lo mates","Instancia: El lenguaje de los animales","Habla con la criatura recién llegada en la lengua de los animales","Salva a Zarzagruño","Ahora estás seguro: el miedo se refleja en los ojos del oso","Habla con Zarzagruño en la lengua de su especie","Tu ancestro Beorn tenía un vínculo especial con las criaturas que vivían cerca de su morada, y tú también has heredado parte de esa cualidad.\
\
Intentas recurrir a ese aspecto de tu naturaleza para calmar a la poderosa bestia que tienes delante. ¿Qué ha llevado a esta criatura a semejante furia?\
\
Parece que tus palabras surten efecto, pero de repente la criatura sacude su enorme cabeza y redobla su ataque.","Clothar Hojarena se encuentra en el Bosque Viejo y no está nada contento con ello.","Has visto miedo en los ojos del gran oso y ahora estás seguro: algo contrario a su naturaleza ha empujado a esta criatura a atacar.","Habla con el gran oso en la lengua de su especie","El oso es enorme y parece dominado por la furia, pero aun así ves algo en su mirada que te hace dudar."}},
[7352]={nameES="Instancia: El nido de arañas",objectivesES={"Madre de la prole de cristal derrotada","Instancia: El nido de arañas","Una cría voraz ha salido del nido...","Usa la forja antigua para potenciar tu adamantita infusa.","Derrota a la madre de la prole de cristal","Debes rescatar a los enanos envueltos en capullos dentro de la antigua armería antes de que sean devorados por las crías voraces del nido.","Usa el yunque antiguo","Has creado una adamantita potenciada","Se te ha pedido que rescates a la expedición de enanos que ha sido capturada dentro de la antigua armería antes de que sean devorados por las viles arañas que han tejido un gran nido en su interior. Si tienes éxito, tienes la bendición del Pueblo de Durin para hacer uso del yunque que hay allí para potenciar la adamantita infusa que llevas."}},
[7353]={nameES="Instancia: El Favor de las Estrellas",objectivesES={"Mira desde el lado de babor del Saervig y busca la Corona de Durin","Byrski Proadura ha navegado el Saervig hasta el Lago Espejo.\
\
Has buscado la Corona de Durin en varios lugares, pero tu búsqueda no ha tenido éxito. Debes hablar con Byrski Proadura.","Has sido envuelto en una luz blanca y brillante, y aunque no puedes identificar su origen, su calidez eleva tu espíritu.","El destello que Byrski vio puede encontrarse en el lado de estribor del Saervig, más cerca de la proa.\
\
Byrski Proadura te ha pedido buscar el destello que vio en el Lago Espejo y decirle si también crees que es la Corona de Durin.","Babor se encuentra en el lado izquierdo de un barco cuando se mira hacia la proa.\
\
Byrski Proadura te ha pedido mirar hacia el lado de babor del Saervig y buscar la Corona de Durin.","La proa se encuentra en la parte frontal del Saervig.\
\
Byrski Proadura te ha pedido mirar desde la proa del Saervig y buscar la Corona de Durin.","Instancia: El Favor de las Estrellas","Ves muchas estrellas en el Lago Espejo, pero no la Corona de Durin","Habla con Byrski Proadura","Byrski Proadura ha navegado el Saervig hasta el Lago Espejo.","Mira desde la proa del Saervig y busca la Corona de Durin","Cuando la luz se desvanece, ¡parece que Byrski ha estado tratando de llamar tu atención!","La popa se encuentra en la parte trasera del Saervig.\
\
Byrski Proadura te ha pedido mirar desde la popa del Saervig y buscar la Corona de Durin.","Estribor se encuentra en el lado derecho de un barco cuando se mira hacia la proa.\
\
Byrski Proadura te ha pedido mirar hacia el lado de estribor del Saervig y buscar la Corona de Durin.","Busca el destello en el Lago Espejo","Mira desde la popa del Saervig y busca la Corona de Durin","Byrski Proadura ha navegado el Saervig hasta el Lago Espejo.\
\
Has sido envuelto en una curiosa luz, pero Byrski parece preocupado. Debes hablar con Byrski Proadura.","Mira desde el lado de estribor del Saervig y busca la Corona de Durin","Byrski Proadura se ha ofrecido a buscar la Corona de Durin en el Lago Espejo, con la esperanza de que anuncie un final auspicioso para la reclamación de Khazad-dûm por parte de la Guarnición de Hierro."}},
[7354]={nameES="Instance: The Stone Returned",objectivesES={"Frethi's panicked words shake you to your core. A haze you did not realize was present suddenly lifts from your mind. A powerful feeling of dread washes over you.\
\
'What are you doing? You cannot release the Nameless! Durin the Deathless himself sealed it away!'\
\
He notices your confused expression and takes a step back to explain.\
\
'Listen, I translated the rest of the runes, and they are a dire warning! They say that returning the stones will release a being known as the Shadowed King!'\
\
Suddenly the ground beneath you begins to shake.\
\
'It has begun! Look out!'","<rgb=#8A2BE2>Kill Frethi</rgb>","Place the Secret Stone on its pedestal","Witness the release of the Shadowed King","The time has finally come.\
\
You must place the Secret Stone on the fifth pedestal.","Frethi is clearly injured from the Shadowed King's attack.\
\
'You must… return to King Thorin! Please! He must know of what happened here, and the Shadowed King's threats! I will recover, just go!'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>You will swiftly travel to Erebor!</rgb>","Something is wrong. What just happened?\
\
You should talk to Frethi.","Instance: The Stone Returned","The time has come to reunite the five stones. Their purpose will finally be revealed!","He has been released!\
\
Witness his might!"}},
[7355]={nameES="Instancia: La Piedra de Wyrgende",objectivesES={"Instancia: La Piedra de Wyrgende","Talk to Éomer by the Stone of Wyrgende","Orcs are attacking the area near Wyrgende's Stone!","Horn and Corudan are at Wyrgende's Stone.","You have come to the Stone of Wyrgende with Éomer, the nephew of King Théoden.","Éomer has come to the Stone of Wyrgende, but you have not entirely divined his purpose for doing so.\
\
You should speak to Éomer to learn why he has come to this grim place before continuing on to Snowbourn.","Éomer is at the Stone of Wyrgende.","Talk to Horn at the Stone of Wyrgende","Talk to Corudan at the Stone of Wyrgende","Talk to Éomer at the Stone of Wyrgende"}},
[7356]={nameES="Instance: The Storm Abated",objectivesES={"Instance: The Storm Abated","Fight off the ambush awaiting you in Rothog's chambers.","Speak to Shaidal about his task.","Speak to Rothog the Storm and watch his reaction","Speak to Shaidal about his task","With the ambush survived, Rothog enters into the room","Armed with proof of Shaidal's innocence, you approach Rothog the Storm with your findings.","Defeat ambushers"}},
[7357]={nameES="Instancia: La historia de una piedra extraña",objectivesES={"Talk to Iothete","Iothete is in his hut in the Whitshaws.\
\
You should speak with Iothete.","Listen to Iothete","An old man stands ahead","Instancia: La historia de una piedra extraña","Iothete's voice paints a picture in your mind of his walk on the fateful day a year or so ago.\
\
The woods of the Whitshaws feel very different than the bare white tines protruding from the snow today.","Follow Iothete","Iothete remembers sitting for a long while with the old wanderer","Listen to Iothete's memory","Iothete is in the woods in the northern Whitshaws.\
\
You should speak with Iothete.","Listen to Iothete's tale","You should follow Iothete's memory into his home in Dunfast.","Iothete remembers being entranced by the old traveller at once","Iothete remembers walking in the green woods of the Whitshaws","The fragment of stone you recovered from Iothete's home has a story behind it, and you are ready to hear it.","Iothete is in the woods of the Whitshaws.\
\
You should speak with Iothete and listen to his memory of a fateful day.","Iothete concludes his tale:\
\
'The memory is strange, foggy, unsettling. I do not feel like I was there -- merely looking on from a distance while I spoke too much of things that do not concern strangers.\
\
'I told my neighbours, but they dismissed me as being mad. The stone terrified me. It made me cold.\
\
'So I left.\
\
'Now it is cold everywhere, and it is my fault.'"}},
[7358]={nameES="Instancia: La batalla de la Separación",objectivesES={"Mótsog continues his tale of the Sunder-battle.","Climb the stairs to Biriz-zahar","Talk to Mótsog atop Biriz-zahar","Mótsog's tale is nearly complete.","Follow Ragna the Fierce through the burning city","Talk to Mótsog and hear his tale","The words of Mótsog have painted the picture of a dwarf woman who will stop at nothing to rescue her husband and king. You can almost see her striding through the burning streets of Biriz-zahar, calling for Durin to answer her, as Mótsog's voice fades. The heat of the flames feels so real.","Mótsog has brought his tale near to its conclusion.","Instancia: La batalla de la Separación","Ragna the Fierce renewed her attempt to rescue her husband and king.","The army led by Ragna the Fierce climbed the unguarded stairs to the high places of Biriz-zahar.","Hear the tale of Mótsog","Mótsog speaks of Sauron's betrayal of the Greymauls, and of Ragna's race through the blood-drenched city of Biriz-zahar."}},
[7359]={nameES="Instancia: La Espada y la Doncella de Piedra",objectivesES={"Move through the twisting passage to another of the Halls of Memory","Talk to Gandalf in the Grey Mountains as depicted by the Halls of Memory","Approach the band of adventurers in the tavern depicted by the Halls of Memory","Talk to Gandalf in the Minas Anor tavern depicted by the Halls of Memory","Talk to Gandalf in Durthang as depicted by the Halls of Memory","Vóin and his companions met at a tavern in Minas Anor one night, and planned a dangerous excursion.","Further information about Vóin's journey to Gondor as one of Eärnur's boon companions lies beyond the Grey Mountains, in the Halls of Memory.","Listen to the conclusion of Eärnur's doomed adventure within Durthang","Gandalf is in Durthang, as depicted by the Halls of Memory.","Gandalf's study of the Black Book has revealed an excursion by Eärnur and his companions to recapture the fortress of Durthang, in Gorgoroth.","Listen to the account of Vóin and his friends at the tavern depicted by the Halls of Memory","Return to the Grey Mountains, as depicted by the Halls of Memory","Gandalf has continued his study of the Black Book of Mordor.","Gandalf speaks to you of the discoveries he made while studying the Black Book.","Move through the twisting passage until you reach another of the Halls of Memory","Listen to the account of Eärnur's doomed adventure within Durthang","Gandalf wishes to resume the tale of Vóin in the Grey Mountains as they are depicted by the Halls of Memory.","Gandalf is in the Grey Mountains, as depicted by the Halls of Memory.","Talk to Gandalf in the Halls of Memory","Instancia: La Espada y la Doncella de Piedra","Gandalf is in the tavern depicted by the Halls of Memory."}},
[7360]={nameES="Instancia: La historia de Tolwin",objectivesES={"Let the events transpire.","You should run after Tolwin so that you may speak with him.","There is a bear trap on the slain body.\
\
You should examine the bear trap.","There are footprints around the slain body.\
\
You should examine foot prints.","You see another Sûhalar and by the looks of him, slain not long ago","Investigate the slain Sûhalar","Examine the foot prints","These fresh foot prints are very small. Too small for a man.","Tolwin looks glum as he starts to tell his tale","Nearby is another slain body.\
\
You should investigate the slain Sûhalar.","The slain body of a Sûhalar leads you on the trail of a mysterious Sûhalar slayer.","This trap looks new and was recently constructed","Instancia: La historia de Tolwin","The Sûhalar slayer must be nearby.\
\
You should search nearby for more signs of conflict.","Let the events transpire","You noticed the Sûhalar was caught in a bear trap","You should speak with Tolwin.","Examine the bear trap","Run after Tolwin so that you may speak with him","Let Tolwin tell his story.","Search nearby for another sign of this Sûhalar slayer","Let Tolwin tell his story","Speak with Tolwin"}},
[7361]={nameES="Instancia: La doma de los Mearas",objectivesES={"Talk to Léothred","Léothred, the Rohirric scholar, seeks to learn more of his people history in Misthallow.","Listen to Léothred's tale","Talk to Léothred.","Listen to Léothred's tale.","Instancia: La doma de los Mearas"}},
[7362]={nameES="Instancia: Los lazos que unen",objectivesES={"Instancia: Los lazos que unen","Habla con Pinja","Impide que los hermanos de Pinja interrumpan el ritual","Pinja tiene tres hermanos. Asegúrate de que no interrumpan el ritual de Kaj.","Habla con Kaj.","Doma al mamut","El mamut ha sido domado","Habla con Manu","Impide que los hermanos de Pinja interrumpan a Kaj","Doma al mamut y protege a Pinja","La valentía de Kaj parece haber impresionado a Pinja","Calma al mamut y evita que se desboque","Manu reclama tu atención.","Kaj quiere que lo protejas mientras invoca un ritual lossoth ya en desuso.","Manu ha regresado arrastrando a un mamut salvaje.\
\
Deberías ayudar a calmar a la bestia."}},
[7363]={nameES="Instancia: El punto de inflexión",objectivesES={"Klúso is ready to describe what he saw earlier.\
\
You should talk to Klúso.","Follow Klúso","Talk to Klúso","Klúso is describing what he saw transpire between the hobgoblins and ice-giants.\
\
You should follow the hobgoblins to listen to the conversation.","Klúso begins to conclude his story...","Listen to the conversation","Klúso is describing what he saw transpire between the hobgoblins and ice-giants.\
\
You should listen to the conversation.","Klúso is concluding his story.\
\
You should return to him.","Klúso is describing what he saw transpire between the hobgoblins and ice-giants.\
\
You should follow Klúso.","Return to Klúso","Instancia: El punto de inflexión","Scout Klúso has an interesting report to share: relations between the Orcs and hobgoblins may have finally reached a tipping point....","Follow the hobgoblins to listen to the conversation"}},
[7364]={nameES="Instancia: La tumba de Elendil",objectivesES={"Encuentra el Silithar","Has viajado hasta la Tumba de Elendil en busca del Silithar necesario para reforjar Narsil.","El Silithar está en algún lugar de las cavernas bajo la tumba de Elendil.\
\
No has encontrado el Silithar en la última cámara de la tumba de Elendil... debe haber sido arrastrado a otro lugar cuando las aguas se retiraron.","Instancia: La tumba de Elendil","Gwindeth ha venido a la tumba de Elendil, y está esperando para hablar contigo en su cámara más profunda.\
\
Te has encargado de Idella Abrecriptas, pero no hay signos del Silithar.","Idella Abrecriptas está en algún lugar de las profundidades de la tumba de Elendil.\
\
Calenglad tenía razón... La banda de saqueadores de tumbas de Idella Abrecriptas ha aprovechado la ventaja de las recién retiradas aguas para sondear las profundidades de la tumba en busca de tesoros. Debe ser detenida.","Gwindeth está ahora en la cueva bajo la tumba de Elendil.\
\
Has recuperado el Silithar, y Gwindeth espera para hablar contigo."}},
[7365]={nameES="Instance: The Trail Ends",objectivesES={"Recover a crude key from the guards","Release the first captive.","Discover and open a locked cell with the crude key that you recovered.","The Houndmaster Laodegan has heard that an outsider has attacked the dungeon and is guarding the entrance.","Within the depths of this cavern, several of the Uch-lûth clansmen and women have been locked away in cages awaiting a grisly fate.","Release the first captive","Unlock the cell door for a prisoner","Unlocked the cell door for the last prisoner","Defeat Laodegan near the entrance","Seek out guards within the cavern and recover a crude key from them.","Free the second captive","Release the last captive.","Recovered a crude key","Defeated Laodegan near the entrance","Freed the second captive","Release the last captive","Recovered a crude key from the guards","Released the first captive","Instance:  The Trail Ends","Unlock the cell door for the last prisoner","Thank you for dispatching these filthy creatures. I was taken several weeks ago, and I thought that I would never escape. Thank you and may the blessing of the Uch-gwirod be with you.'","Release the second captive.","Released the last captive","Unlocked the cell door for a prisoner"}},
[7366]={nameES="Instancia: La Sala de Entrenamiento",objectivesES={"Utiliza la forja ancestral para potenciar tu granate infundido","Instancia: La Sala de Entrenamiento","Una disciplinada hueste de orcos de Moria se ha asentado en una de las antiguas salas de armería y la está utilizando como sala de entrenamiento en preparación para su próxima ofensiva contra los enanos. Si quieres llegar a la vieja forja de armas que alberga dicha sala y potenciar el granate infundido que llevas contigo, tendrás que abrirte paso a la fuerza entre los orcos.","Debes derrotar a los reclutas orcos antes de que estén listos para lanzar su ofensiva contra los enanos, y abatir al uruk que supervisa su entrenamiento.","Usa el yunque antiguo","Derrota al maestro de batalla uruk"}},
[7367]={nameES="Instancia: El tesoro de Rohan",objectivesES={"Defend the herd from attacking Orcs.","<rgb=#FF0000>Shadowfax has been defeated</rgb>","<rgb=#FF0000>Arod has been defeated</rgb>","Confront Shadowfax","Shadowfax is at the centre of the wild herd.\
\
You should confront Shadowfax.","<rgb=#FF0000>A black horse has been stolen</rgb>","<rgb=#FF0000>Hasufel must survive</rgb>","You have defended the herd from the attacking Orcs","<rgb=#FF0000>Hasufel has been defeated</rgb>","<rgb=#FF0000>Shadowfax must survive</rgb>","Instancia: El tesoro de Rohan","Shadowfax and his companions rear and gallop off in the direction of Éomer's Vengeance... where you must now return.","You have journeyed to the horse-herd the mysterious old man directed you.","<rgb=#FF0000>Arod must survive</rgb>","The Lord of the Mearas whinnies and shakes his mane as you approach. When he calms, he looks upon you with regal approval.","<rgb=#FF0000>At least one black horse must remain</rgb>","Defend the herd from attacking Orcs"}},
[7368]={nameES="Instancia: La prueba de la locura",objectivesES={"For those reclaiming Minas Ithil from the grasp of darkness, a trial of madness has begun.","Overcome the Trial of Madness.","Overcome the Trial of Madness","Find the artifact","Destroy the Orb of Madness","You have survived the Trial of Madness and successfully destroyed the artifact!","Find the artifact.","Instancia: La prueba de la locura","A strange haze clouds your vision!","Destroy the Orb of Madness."}},
[7369]={nameES="Instancia: La prueba de la ira",objectivesES={"Now to destroy the artifact","Overcome the Trial of Wrath","Defeat the Ghâsh-hai.","Overcome the Trial of Wrath.","Destroy of the Orb of Wrath","For those reclaiming Minas Ithil from the grasp of darkness, a trial of wrath has begun.","Instancia: La prueba de la ira","A strange haze clouds your vision!","Defeat the Ghâsh-hai","Destroy the Orb of Wrath.","You have survived the Trial of Wrath and successfully destroyed the artifact!"}},
[7370]={nameES="Instancia: La verdad del asunto",objectivesES={"Watch events unfold","Náin wishes to speak with you.","Habla con Náin","You should continue observing the interrogation.","You should defeat the hobgoblin raiders.","Return to Shúkurz and listen to his story","Féli is waiting for you before he starts the interrogation.","Defeat the hobgoblin raiders","The time has come to interrogate the Orc prisoner.","You should talk to the Orc captain.","Talk to Féli","Talk to Shúkurz","You should follow Féli to the interrogation and see what happens.","Instancia: La verdad del asunto","There are empty weapon barrels and Orc soldiers waiting on orders throughout the camp.\
\
You should fill the barrels and deliver orders.","Listen to the interrogation","You should watch the events before you unfold.","Talk to the Orc captain","You should continue interrogating Shúkurz.","You should return to Shúkurz and continue listening to his story."}},
[7371]={nameES="Instancia: El Corazón Retorcido",objectivesES={"Ramalarga se ha unido a ti en la batalla para destruir tanto a Putrecorazones como al ucorno conocido como el Corazón Retorcido.","Habla con Ramalarga","Debes hablar con Ramalarga y ayudarlo contra el Corazón Retorcido.","La Arboleda Retorcida ha sido purificada","Debes hablar con Ramalarga.","Instancia: El Corazón Retorcido"}},
[7372]={nameES="Instancia: El sendero sin marcas",objectivesES={"Legolas está esperando para hablar contigo\
\
Tú y Legolas del Bosque Negro habéis seguido las huellas de los trolls silvanos a través de la naturaleza salvaje del Bosque de los Trolls.","Legolas es amenazado por trolls silvanos que atacan en el Gladdalf.\
\
Tú y Legolas del Bosque Negro habéis seguido las huellas de los trolls silvanos a través de la naturaleza salvaje del Bosque de los Trolls.","Legolas es amenazado por hordas de arrastreros corrompidos en el Gladdalf.\
\
Tú y Legolas del Bosque Negro habéis seguido las huellas de los trolls silvanos a través de la naturaleza salvaje del Bosque de los Trolls.","Legolas ha guiado el camino hacia lo profundo del Gladdalf, un rincón remoto del Bosque de los Trolls, siguiendo el rastro de los trolls silvanos.","Habla con Legolas.","Legolas sigue un rastro misterioso hacia el Gladdalf.\
\
Tú y Legolas del Bosque Negro habéis seguido las huellas de los trolls silvanos a través de la naturaleza salvaje del Bosque de los Trolls.","Ayuda a Legolas.","Instancia: El sendero sin marcas","Legolas ha seguido un rastro misterioso hasta un montículo de tierra rodeado de agua en el centro del Gladdalf.\
\
Tú y Legolas el Elfo habéis seguido las huellas de los trolls silvanos a través de la naturaleza salvaje del Bosque de los Trolls."}},
[7373]={nameES="Instancia: Las tierras salvajes indómitas",objectivesES={"Khilbakh has been defeated!","Talk to Vaskorn","Vaskorn has fallen!","<rgb=#FF0000>Vaskorn must survive</rgb>","Runerik Knotbeard fears an assault upon Limlók may be imminent.","Talk to Vaskorn.","Find and defeat Khilbakh","Instancia: Las tierras salvajes indómitas","Find and defeat Khilbakh and the Warg raiding party.","You have defeated the raiding party!","Defeat the raiding party"}},
[7374]={nameES="Instancia: Comienza el levantamiento",objectivesES={"You found a ring containing keys to the cages in the Fleetfast gaol!","Belondor and Rothog have come to free you from the Fleetfast gaol.","Talk to Rothog in the ship Sotóka","Talk to Jajax in the ship Sotóka","There is a commotion outside the cage in the Fleetfast gaol.","Talk to Tatháta in her ship Sotóka","Talk to Tatháta in the Fleetfast gaol","Tatháta stands by the hatch leading to Umbar-môkh.","Make your way to the hidden harbour","Talk to Belondor in the Fleetfast gaol","Your foes now defeated, the way to the hidden harbour is open to you.","After travelling for a short distance, you hear the sound of foes ahead of you","You and Jajax have escaped from the gaol, but there are foes between you and the hidden harbour.","Pursue the Song to Gondor","Board Tatháta's ship and go belowdecks","Descend into Umbar-môkh","Permanece alerta","Tatháta eyes you carefully","Jajax is in the Fleetfast gaol.","Jajax is in one of the cages of the Fleetfast gaol.","Tatháta's ship Sotóka is moored in the hidden harbour","Tatháta and Jajax stand by the hatch leading to Umbar-môkh","Belondor stands by the hatch leading to Umbar-môkh.","The path of your escape leads into Umbar-môkh.","Your pursuit of the Song begins.","Search the bodies of the slain guards for the keys to the gaol","Make your way downstairs to the hatch leading to Umbar-môkh","This guard does not have the keys to the gaol","Jajax has suggested that you search the bodies of the slain guards to see if either of them have the keys to the gaol.","Instancia: Comienza el levantamiento","Tidings from the city outside are cut off from the prisoners in the Fleetfast gaol. What is happening in Umbar Baharbêl?","Talk to Jajax","Jajax sputters with flustered surprise","Talk to Belondor in the ship Sotóka","Your allies stand ready to pursue the Song.","Talk to Jajax in Umbar-môkh","Belondor and Rothog entered the gaol from a hatch downstairs that leads to Umbar-môkh. Now you should find your way downstairs to escape!","You should board Tatháta's ship so you may pursue the Song."}},
[7375]={nameES="Instancia: La Voz del Dragón",objectivesES={"Instancia: La Voz del Dragón","Habla con Durin","Stand with the dwarves","The Dwarrowmoot has begun.","Hrímil has escaped on powerful wings, making for the high peak, but her terror is plain to see.","Observe the Dwarrowmoot","The Dwarrowmoot has been interrupted by the dragon!","Remain on your guard!","The Dwarrowmoot came to a sudden end, but Durin has made a decision: it is time to face the dragon and reclaim the Mountain-home!","Prince Durin stands at the Thing-fold to begin the Dwarrowmoot for which he has called.","Durin has called for Dwarrowmoot, a gathering of the dwarves that will decide what can be done to wrest Gundabad from the claws of Hrímil Frost-heart.","Their laughter is disturbed by the sound of a rushing wind!"}},
[7376]={nameES="Instancia: La Noche de la Espera",objectivesES={"Escucha la conversación de tus compañeros y permanece alerta.","Habla con Boromir","Habla con Aberthol en la sala principal","Los residentes de Herne están de bastante buen ánimo considerando los peligros que podrían amenazar su pueblo.","Habla con Meneldir en la Posada de la Encrucijada","<rgb=#FF0000>Meneldir, Egfrith y Boromir deben sobrevivir</rgb>","Instancia: La Noche de la Espera","Habla con Boromir junto a las ventanas","Habla con Maddoc en el mostrador","Habla con Meneldir fuera de la Posada de la Encrucijada","Boromir muestra una expresión preocupada.","Escucha la conversación de tus compañeros","Meneldir te ha invitado a <rgb=#00FF00>sentarte</rgb> en su mesa.","Boromir está junto a una de las ventanas. ¿Ha visto algo afuera?","Una sensación de temor se ha asentado sobre la Posada de la Encrucijada. ¿Qué ha ocurrido afuera?","<rgb=#00FF00>Siéntate</rgb> en la mesa de Meneldir","La gente de Herne se refugia en la Posada de la Encrucijada por la noche, temerosa de que cualquier mal que pasó por Herne pueda regresar.","Regresa a tu mesa","Meneldir quiere hablar contigo en la Posada de la Encrucijada mientras esperáis que pasen las horas.","Habla con Bledri arriba","Meneldir te ha pedido que hables con algunos de los habitantes que se reúnen en la Posada de la Encrucijada y que los tranquilices diciéndoles que estarán a salvo.","Habla con Aldyth arriba","Sal fuera de la Posada de la Encrucijada e investiga","Tus compañeros están listos para defender a la gente de Herne."}},
[7377]={nameES="Instancia: La confesión del errante",objectivesES={"Vágari the Wanderer desires to speak to you of his past misdeeds.","The shade that came to be called Vágari the Wanderer desires to confess to you the misdeeds of his past.","The shade of Tárandil says nothing, dwelling upon his old sorrows.","Talk to Rioc","Listen to the shade's account","Instancia: La confesión del errante","Listen to Vágari's account","The shade of Tárandil falls silent, overcome with ancient grief","Talk to Vágari the Wanderer"}},
[7378]={nameES="Instancia: Los Want-kin",objectivesES={"The Want-kin begin their supper, and you should too!","This will do...","Sit on the log beside Nagli at the camp-fire at Khadâsh-gâra","Tell Nagli and the Want-kin the <rgb=#00ff00>story</rgb> of your adventures before coming to Elderslade","Nagli set your supper beside you at Khadâsh-gâra.\
\
The Want-kin have begun their meal. You should share a supper with them.","Sigue a Nagli","Neither Longbeards, Zhélruka, nor Stout-axes, a company of clanless dwarves known only as the Want-kin have made camp in Elderslade.","Beside the fire, plates of food have been prepared","Stórath scoffs and wanders off to his bedroll","The Want-kin listen closely to your tales of adventure","Share a hearty supper with the Want-kin at Khadâsh-gâra","A suitable log for sitting can be found beside Nagli at Khadâsh-gâra.\
\
Nagli has asked you to join him and the other Want-kin at the camp-fire at Khadâsh-gâra.","Instancia: Los Want-kin","Nagli can be found at Khadâsh-gâra.\
\
You have brought more firewood to the fire at Khadâsh-gâra as Nagli asked. You should talk to Nagli.","Listen to Nagli and the Want-kin","Nagli can be found at Khadâsh-gâra.\
\
Nagli has asked to hear more tales of your adventures before coming to Elderslade. You should tell Nagli and the Want-kin of your adventures in Middle-earth.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: You will need to select Nagli before emoting to advance this quest.</rgb>","Nagli can be found at Khadâsh-gâra.\
\
You should follow Nagli.","Nagli can be found at Khadâsh-gâra.\
\
Nagli has asked to speak with you. You should talk to Nagli.","Nagli can be found at Khadâsh-gâra.\
\
You should talk to Nagli.","Listen to Nagli and Stórath","Firewood can be found at Khadâsh-gâra.\
\
Nagli has asked you to fetch some firewood to stoke the fire at Khadâsh-gâra. You should collect the firewood.","Nagli and Stórath are talking about the tales you told.","The Want-kin are preparing to have supper.","It is hard to imagine a finer meal prepared in the wilds of Elderslade","Habla con Nagli","As the wood crackles, the fire's warmth can be felt throughout Khadâsh-gâra","Collect firewood to stoke the fire at Khadâsh-gâra","Nagli can be found at Khadâsh-gâra.\
\
After Stórath expressed his displeasure in hosting you, Nagli and the other Want-kin defended your presence at Khadâsh-gâra. You should talk to Nagli.","Nagli sits down beside the fire and gestures to a log","<rgb=#00ff00>Sit</rgb> on the log beside Nagli at the camp-fire at Khadâsh-gâra"}},
[7379]={nameES="Instancia: La Guerra de las Tres Cumbres",objectivesES={"Durin has commanded that the assault on Gundabad begin by seizing a foothold further ahead in the foothills of Elderslade: the ruin of Zarkul-sulûn will become the base of operations for the Gabil'akkâ!","Zarkul-sulûn has been occupied, a new foothold for the Gabil'akkâ!","Talk to Durin during the assault on Zarkul-sulûn","Prince Durin has commanded that the Gabil'akkâ seize the ruin of Zarkul-sulûn from the Orcs.","Instancia: La Guerra de las Tres Cumbres"}},
[7380]={nameES="Instancia: La táctica del señor de la guerra",objectivesES={"You see Gorgar standing alone at the edge of the cliff","You have tracked the hobgoblins to the end of the road.\
\
You should follow Hórin and find the hobgoblins.","The hobgoblins will soon be upon you!\
\
You should blow the horn to summon your forces!","Listen to the conversation","You are clear of the hobgoblins! Blow the horn to summon your forces!","Blow the horn to summon your forces!","The hobgoblins are just ahead!","You have reached the end of the Father's Path, and Warlord Dushtalbúk must be ahead. His reason for marching to the mountain's peak is about to be revealed....","The hobgoblins will soon be upon you!\
\
You should wait for your forces to arrive!","Instancia: La táctica del señor de la guerra","Hórin is standing by with the dwarf forces.\
\
You should talk to Hórin.","The Gabil'akkâ has arrived!","Find the hobgoblins","Habla con Hórin","You have found Gorgar at the end of the road. He must be the hobgoblins' reason for coming here!\
\
You should watch and listen as events unfold!","The Voice of the Dragon is wearing off! You can move again!","Return to the Gate of Uzdarulzahar","Wait for your forces to arrive","Follow Hórin to the hiding spot","The hobgoblins will soon be upon you!\
\
You should return to the Gate of Uzdarulzahar and summon your forces!"}},
[7381]={nameES="Instancia: El guerrero encontrado",objectivesES={"Remain alert for any treachery by Karazgar","Bótuz Frostblood and his Zhélruka have crossed Óinsbridge in search of Karazgar.","Habla con Bótuz Sangrehielo","Bótuz Frostblood has some words for you now that Karazgar has departed.","Karazgar has asked to speak with you.","Instancia: El guerrero encontrado","Search for Karazgar with Bótuz and his warriors","Bótuz Frostblood and his warriors have left Skarháld in search of Karazgar, the Weeping Warrior.","Talk to Karazgar, but remain alert for treachery"}},
[7382]={nameES="Instancia: El Guerrero rehecho",objectivesES={"Habla con Aragorn","Aragorn has agreed to tell you what he knows of King Eärnur's last days.","Aragorn has agreed to tell you the tale of Eärnur's last days, known only to the wise and to those of Isildur's line.","Instancia: El Guerrero rehecho","Listen to the words of Aragorn","Aragorn has agreed to tell you what he knows of Eärnur's last days.","Listen to the words of Aragorn concerning Eärnur"}},
[7383]={nameES="Instancia: El Guardián del Agua",objectivesES={"Brogur ha venido a la orilla del Lago Negro, a pesar de los deseos de su primo.","Bósi se encuentra en la pendiente que conduce al lago frente a las Puertas de Durin.\
\
Bósi te espera para desearte suerte contra el Guardián del Agua. Está seguro de que el mordisco de tu arma prevalecerá.","Bosi y Brogur se encuentran en la orilla del lago.\
\
El Guardián del Agua ha sido ahuyentado, y ahora deberías hablar con Bosi y Brogur.","Brogur ha sido derrotado.","El mordisco de tu arma tendrá que prevalecer contra la gruesa carne de los muchos tentáculos del Guardián.","Instancia: El Guardián del Agua","Protege a Brogur del Guardián del Agua","Habla con el explorador de Bósi.","Habla con Brogur.","El Guardián del Agua se esconde bajo la superficie del lago, pero sus tentáculos salen para atacarte.\
\
Debes derrotar los tentáculos del Guardián y ahuyentarlo de la entrada a Moria.","Brogur ha desafiado al Guardián del Agua, decidido a vengar la muerte de su hijo.","Ahuyenta al Guardián del Agua","Habla con Bósi."}},
[7384]={nameES="Instancia: El banquete de bodas",objectivesES={"A great commotion draws your attention to the west side of the feast-hall","Instancia: El banquete de bodas","Talk to the wine steward downstairs","Prince Imrahil told you a wine steward working at the wedding-feast wanted you to meet with him downstairs.","Merethien, the Master Foodmonger of Minas Tirith, has some questions for Merry and Pippin concerning what qualifies as a 'banquet' at their home, the distant Shire. Furthermore, she is pleased to have an excuse to leave Ioreth's chatter and Galathir's lecture behind her.","Samwise Gamgee is at the head table in Merethrond.","The Grey Company has gathered to celebrate the wedding of their chieftain, and to honour the great deeds done on his behalf.","The wine steward is being regaled with tales of Thrymm's heroics, and he wishes to speak with you.","Listen (again) to Thrymm's tale of his exploits","A loud disturbance has caused a commotion on the western side of the feast-hall.","Pippin wants to return to his own table for a bit, and wishes for you and Merry to follow him.","Go outside and confront the 'rough sorts' described by the wine steward","Follow Pippin back to his table","Prince Imrahil was given a message for you.","The wine steward gave you some fine bottles of Gondor's finest to use as a peace offering with the 'rough sorts' gathering outside.\
\
You have been tasked with leaving Merethrond by the front doors and confronting the group of rough sorts the wine steward described.","Talk to King Elessar","Talk to Prince Imrahil","Talk to Prince Faramir of Ithilien","Talk to Culang","Talk to Beregond","Talk to the wine steward","Talk to King Elessar upstairs, on the western side of the feast-hall","Merethien wants to know if Merry and Pippin are satisfied that the wedding-feast she has helped to prepare can compare with the banquets they described in the Shire.","Talk to Samwise Gamgee","The wedding-feast continues into the night and you should speak with King Elessar before the festivities conclude.","The ceremony may be over, but the festivities continue! The great wedding-feast will last well into the night, with the noise of celebration continuing nearly until dawn.","Talk to Thrymm Red-beard","Thrymm Red-beard has obtained a captive audience, and is regaling them with tales of his adventures.","He hands you a number of wine bottles to use as a peace offering","King Elessar wishes to speak with you.","Investigate the disturbance on the western side of the feast-hall","Talk to Merethien","Talk to Radanir","You should return to the wedding-feast, which will likely soon be winding down.","Listen to the words of the Grey Company","Capítulo 5: La reunión de la Compañía Gris","Beregond and his family sit at Pippin's table with a number of Gondorian nobles.","Go back inside Merethrond and rejoin the wedding-feast","Prince Faramir of Ithilien is at the head table in Merethrond."}},
[7385]={nameES="Instancia: El Guerrero Lloroso",objectivesES={"Beckon Bryn to you.","Follow Bryn to meet his friend","Listen to the Weeping Warrior.","<rgb=#FF0000>Beckon</rgb> Bryn to you","Follow Bryn and meet his friend.","The Weeping Warrior looks coldly at you","Listen to Bryn's exchange with Akshir","Erna is worried about her son Bryn who has become more and more distant and aggravated.","The Weeping Warrior escapes","Talk to Bryn.","Before you stands Akshir, the Jangovar leader","Try to speak with Bryn.","Listen to the Weeping Warrior","Talk to Bryn","Listen to Bryn's exchange with Akshir.","Instancia: El Guerrero Lloroso"}},
[7386]={nameES="Instancia: La Mano Blanca en la Oscuridad",objectivesES={"Bori está esperando a que hagas <rgb=#FF0000>saludos</rgb> para saber que entiendes la señal.","Bori está esperando bajo las vías del carro minero para hablar contigo sobre la fuerza principal de los orcos.","Llega debajo de las vías sin ser visto","Ha llegado el momento de abandonar todo sigilo; tú y Bori están lo suficientemente adentrados en el campamento como para que el líder de los orcos de la Mano Blanca esté sin la protección de sus guardianes.","Espera a que llegue Bori","Habla con Bori","<rgb=#FF0000>Saluda</rgb> a Bori para que te siga cuando no haya moros en la costa","Espera a que los orcos abandonen Stazgnâkh","Bori te ha pedido que lo sigas a Stazgnâkh.","Llega al lado del edificio sin ser visto","<rgb=#FF0000>Saluda</rgb> para que Bori te siga cuando no haya moros en la costa","La plataforma hacia la que debes correr está justo delante de la posición de Bori, construida sobre un hueco en la pared de roca. Asegúrate de mantenerte alejado de los orcos que patrullan, o tu misión terminará en fracaso.","Instancia: La Mano Blanca en la Oscuridad","Bori está esperando para hablar contigo sobre su plan.","Bori está mirando hacia la oscuridad que rodea Stazgnâkh y espera para hablar contigo.","<rgb=#FF0000>Saluda</rgb> a Bori para que te siga cuando la costa esté despejada","El edificio al que debes correr se encuentra justo delante de la posición de Bori, construido en el costado de la pared de roca. Asegúrate de mantenerte alejado de los orcos en patrulla, o tu misión terminará en fracaso.","Párate cerca de Bori","Llega al andamio sin ser visto","Llega debajo de la plataforma sin ser visto","Las vías del carro minero a las que debes correr se encuentran justo delante de la posición de Bori, construidas sobre un hueco en la pared de roca. Asegúrate de mantenerte alejado de los orcos en patrulla, o tu misión terminará en fracaso.","Sigue a Bori","El andamio hacia el que debes correr está justo delante de la posición de Bori; él quiere que lo esperes en su sombra. Asegúrate de mantenerte alejado de los orcos que patrullan, o tu misión terminará en fracaso.","Has llegado a Stazgnâkh con Bori para ejecutar su audaz plan: infiltrarte furtivamente en la parte trasera del campamento y matar al líder de los orcos de la Mano Blanca.","El plan de Bori está en pleno efecto; ahora depende de los valientes esfuerzos de Wíli y Stilling atraer a la fuerza principal de los orcos fuera del campamento.","Bori se está adentrando más en Stazgnâkh.","Ashpar ha sido derrotado.","<rgb=#FF0000>Saluda</rgb> a Bori para demostrar la señal"}},
[7387]={nameES="Instance: The Wild Hunt -- Arassiel's Spirit",objectivesES={"Protect the Spirit of Wisdom","The stag-spirit has been defeated","You have chosen a deadly spirit","Accept the stag-spirit's challenge","The spirit of Wisdom has been defeated","Speak with the Stag-spirit","You have discovered the spirit of Wisdom","After speaking with the Stag-spirit, you must drink from the strange pool to escape from this eerie realm of spirits.","Accept the stag-spirit's challenge of wisdom.","Instance: The Wild Hunt -- Arassiel's Spirit","Five spirits stand before you. One is the spirit of Wisdom, the other four are spirits of Anger, Greed, Vengeance, and Fear. You must find the spirit of Wisdom among them -- but decide carefully for your choice is perilous.\
\
The stag-spirit told you this:\
\
Firstly, you must know that Fear can be found directly to the right of Vengeance. Secondly, you must know that Anger is directly left of Greed. Lastly, the spirit of Wisdom cannot be found next to Greed, Anger, or Vengeance. Choose wisely.","You stand before an ancient spirit imbued with great wisdom. You must pass through its trial if you wish to gain the Huntsman's favour.","Protect the stag-spirit","You have completed the test of Wisdom","Talk to the stag-spirit","Speak with the stag-spirit and confront its challenge.","As you lean down and drink from the pool, strange visions dance before your eyes, and the odd mist that had fallen upon the forest begins to lift.","Identify the spirit of Wisdom"}},
[7388]={nameES="Instance: The Wild Hunt -- Gwenaewen's Spirit",objectivesES={"You have reached the third lith","You have reached the first lith","Gwenaewen has bidden you challenge an ancient spirit of winds in the Wild Hunt that the Huntsman has set before you.","You have reached the second lith","Challenge Gwenaewen's spirit","Approach the falcon-spirit and prove your quickness in following it.","Follow the spirit to the second lith","After speaking with the Falcon-spirit, you must drink from the strange pool to escape from this eerie realm of spirits.","You must follow Gwenaewen's spirit!","You have reached the mystic pool!","Follow the spirit to the third lith","As you lean down and drink from the pool, strange visions dance before your eyes, and the odd mist that had fallen upon the forest begins to lift.","Follow the spirit to the mystic pool","Speak with the Ancient Spirit","Instance: The Wild Hunt -- Gwenaewen's Spirit","Follow the spirit to the fourth lith","Follow the spirit to the first lith","You have reached the fourth lith"}},
[7389]={nameES="Instance: The Wild Hunt -- Lavaneth's Spirit",objectivesES={"Instance: The Wild Hunt -- Lavaneth's Spirit","Challenge the boar-spirit","The boar glowers at you, temperamentally pawing at the ground as you approach. Its white tusks are long and deadly, glimmering in the starlight.","As you lean down and drink from the pool, strange visions dance before your eyes, and the odd mist that had fallen upon the forest begins to lift.","Speak with the Boar-spirit","You have defeated the boar-spirit","After speaking with the Boar-spirit, you must drink from the strange pool to escape from this eerie realm of spirits.","Lavaneth has bidden you challenge an ancient spirit of strength in the Wild Hunt that the Huntsman has set before you.","Approach the ancient spirit and prove your strength in challenge against it."}},
[7390]={nameES="Instance: The Wild Hunt -- Munfaeril's Spirit",objectivesES={"Speak with the Ox-spirit","The ox-spirit has set before you a challenge of endurance. You must both survive against the waves of crushing despair before you.","As you lean down and drink from the pool, strange visions dance before your eyes, and the odd mist that had fallen upon the forest begins to lift.","Munfaeril has bidden you challenge an ancient spirit as a test of endurance in the Wild Hunt that the Huntsman has set before you.","Challenge the ox-spirit","Having faced your challenge and emerged unbowed, you may now return to the waking world through the waters of the pool.","The ox-spirit has perservered","Instance: The Wild Hunt -- Munfaeril's Spirit"}},
[7391]={nameES="Instancia: La voluntad de resistir",objectivesES={"Talk to Penrod","You have come into Tûr Morva to meet with Lheu Brenin, leader of the Falcon-clan.","Lheu Brenin is waiting to speak with you.","Follow Léolin through Tûr Morva","Meet with Lheu Brenin, leader of the Falcon-clan","Talk to Léolin","Mair is not pleased at whoever threw the rock at Saeradan.","Habla con Halbarad","Talk to Lheu Brenin","Saeradan has been hit by a stone thrown by a Dunlending. You should check to make sure that he is all right.","Instancia: La voluntad de resistir","Follow Léolin into Tûr Morva","Halbarad is on the path leading up to Tûr Morva.","Léolin is leading you up the hill to meet with Lheu Brenin in Tûr Morva.","Habla con Saeradan","Lheu Brenin's first Brehur, Penrod, is ready to speak with you.","Léolin is on the path leading up to Tûr Morva.","Halbarad is waiting to speak with you.","Léolin is leading you through Tûr Morva to meet with Lheu Brenin, the leader of the Falcon-clan.","Talk to Mair","The Grey Company has come to Tûr Morva, in Tâl Methedras, to meet with Lheu Brenin, the leader of the Falcon-clan."}},
[7392]={nameES="Instancia: El Mago y el Rey",objectivesES={"Mithrandir is by the young sapling atop Mindolluin.","King Elessar is by the young sapling atop Mindolluin.","Talk to King Elessar on the slope of Mindolluin","Find the sapling amid the snows atop Mindolluin","You have come with King Elessar and Mithrandir to a secret path high above Minas Tirith, on the slopes of Mount Mindolluin.","You have come with King Elessar and Mithrandir to a secret path high above Minas Tirith.","Instancia: El Mago y el Rey","A sapling grows by the snow line high atop Mount Mindolluin.","Remain alert for any sign of danger","At the very edge of the snow grows a young sapling","Talk to King Elessar on Mindolluin","Talk to Mithrandir on Mindolluin","You have come with Mithrandir and Elessar to a secret path high above the city."}},
[7393]={nameES="Instancia: El Valle del Mago",objectivesES={"You are Gríma Wormtongue, advisor and servant to Saruman the White. He has been visited by Radagast the Brown, and you and Acca are waiting to hear if your master has any commands for you.","Acca wants to speak with you on the pinnacle of Orthanc.","Saruman is in the gardens of Isengard and wants to speak with you.","Saruman listens as you breathlessly recount Acca's recent delivery of a loaf of bread to Gandalf, and their ensuing conversation. His face is a thundercloud.\
\
'Why did you allow Acca to do this? Dog! What would you have done if he allowed Gandalf to come down? What would have been your answer if my worthless steward had freed him?'\
\
Saruman masters his anger, but his tone is no less stern.\
\
'From this point onward, none will climb the steps to the pinnacle save myself. I will have Acca thrown in the dungeons, where he will have time enough to consider this betrayal. He will have not even a crust to chew upon; let him eat slop instead.\
\
'You will perform Acca's duties in his stead, until I have others for you. And I will, Gríma. Soon you will return to your homeland. But not yet.'","Talk to Acca on the pinnacle of Orthanc","Talk to Saruman in the gardens of Isengard","Acca has come to the pinnacle of Orthanc with a basket of bread for Gandalf. You should talk to him.","Listen to Acca's story continue","Saruman is on the steps of Orthanc.","Talk to Acca in the gardens of Isengard","Acca is telling you the story of his downfall as the steward of Saruman's household.","Acca is near the steps of Orthanc, listening to the conversation of Gandalf and Saruman. You should speak with him.","Talk to Acca outside Orthanc","Listen to Acca's story continue.","See to Gandalf's horse while Acca escorts the Wizard to Saruman","Listen to Acca continue his story.","You have overheard Saruman speaking of some troubling things, but Acca can make no sense of them.","Talk to Saruman on the steps of Orthanc","Talk to Acca near the gates of Isengard","Instancia: El Valle del Mago","Acca is waiting to speak with you.","You are to take care of Gandalf's horse while Acca brings the Wizard to speak with Saruman.","Gandalf's horse is tired from its long journey and will benefit from a stay in the stables with food and water.","Acca's story continues.","Listen to Acca continue his tale","Find Saruman within Orthanc and tell him of Acca's sympathies","You must find Saruman within Orthanc and tell him of Acca's sympathies."}},
[7394]={nameES="Instancia: El Mago, la Reina y los Hermanos",objectivesES={"Attend the meeting of the Kindred of the Coins and Shâra Mizâdi of Renewed Hamât","An Umbari guardsman has asked you to speak on behalf of Inkanûsh.","Talk to Hármelak at the gate","Investigate the commotion at the gate with Inkanûsh","It has not taken long for Mithrandir, now using the name Inkanûsh, to involve himself in the affairs of Umbar and Shagâna.","Enter the Citadel of the Winds as a guest of the Kindred","Talk to Shâra Mizâdi in the Citadel of Winds","Observe the confrontation at the gate and be ready to intervene if it comes to violence","Mizâdi calls for you to speak with her","The others have already gone ahead, but Rahâzi has lingered","Rahâzi has stayed behind to speak with you in the Citadel of Winds.","You have helped to ease some of the tension between the two groups at the gate, but you should remain on guard just in case.","Hármelak motions for you to come speak with her","Hármelak has indicated that she wants to speak with you before you leave.","A commotion at the nearby gate has drawn your attention.","Hármelak has come to the gate, and she has questions for you.","The guardsmen at the gate have stopped a group of warriors from entering the city.","Talk to the Umbari guardsman","Talk to Hármelak in the Citadel of Winds","Stand ready to prevent the outbreak of violence","Shâra Mizâdi desires to speak with you before the attendees disperse.","The Kindred of the Coins meets with Shâra Mizâdi of Renewed Hamât to discuss the relationship between their two powers and the days to come.","Talk to Rahâzi in the Citadel of Winds","You and Inkanûsh have been invited to attend the meeting of the Kindred of the Coins with Shâra Mizâdi within the Citadel of Winds.","Instancia: El Mago, la Reina y los Hermanos"}},
[7395]={nameES="Instancia: La Palabra de un Sanador",objectivesES={"Habla con Huldar","Huldar está en las minas de Othrikar.\
\
Has repelido el ataque a Othrikar, y ahora debes hablar con Huldar.","Instancia: La Palabra de un Sanador","Huldar está en el centro de Othrikar.\
\
El enano Huldar está esperando para hablar contigo.","El ataque de los Duramano ha sido repelido","Apoya a los centinelas de Othrikar en la posición de Huldar","El ataque de los Duramano es inminente, y Huldar te ha pedido ayudar en la defensa de Othrikar.","Huldar ha sido herido en batalla, y ahora las centinelas de Othrikar en las minas están sin su Maestro Rúnico. Debes reemplazar a Huldar antes de que sea demasiado tarde.","Apoya a los centinelas de Othrikar contra los Duramano","Los Duramano planean atacar Othrikar, y se te ha encomendado mantener a los defensores enanos luchando el mayor tiempo posible."}},
[7396]={nameES="Instancia: Las preocupaciones del Señor Celeborn",objectivesES={"Haldir espera hablar contigo sobre las preocupaciones del Señor Celeborn.","Celeborn te ha llamado a una audiencia en Caras Galadhon.","Escucha lo que Celeborn tiene que decirte","Instancia: Las preocupaciones del Señor Celeborn","Habla con Haldir"}},
[7397]={nameES="Instancia: Cavaron Demasiado Rápido",objectivesES={"Instancia: Cavaron Demasiado Rápido","Independientemente de lo que Balin haya logrado aquí, este lugar ya no es seguro para ningún minero","Gufi cree que estás exagerando los peligros con los que te topaste durante tu misión de exploración, y te ha pedido que explores un posible yacimiento minero de la época de Balin.","Has encontrado los picos de los mineros de Balin, y nada más que peligros.","Un silencio sepulcral envuelve la mina, solo interrumpido por los sonidos extraños de los Gredbyg. Averigua todo lo que puedas sobre la expedición minera de Balin."}},
[7398]={nameES="Instancia: El Azote de los Ladrones",objectivesES={"Los saqueadores de tumbas han sido derrotados","Instancia: El Azote de los Ladrones","Los Montaraces han venido a Rantost para expulsar a los saqueadores de tumbas y recuperar las reliquias robadas.","Habla con Eliot Bencroft","Los Montaraces han tomado posiciones en tres campamentos en la isla de Rantost.\
\
Defiende a los Montaraces de los ataques de los saqueadores de tumbas y sus aliados."}},
[7399]={nameES="Instancia: El Legado de Thorog",objectivesES={"Sigrun knows of Thorog and will lead the way to examine the dragon's corpse.","Experience the vision","Examine the corpse of Thorog.","Experience the vision.","Instancia: El Legado de Thorog","Examine the rust spot.","Examine the corpse of Thorog","The strange vision disperses","Another vision comes over you","Examine the rust spot","It is unmistakable: some of Thorog's bones are missing"}},
[7400]={nameES="Instance: Those Who Are Dead",objectivesES={"Learn if Dûgden knows what has caused this disturbance","The heavy weight of the silence before the coming of the Heir has been lifted. Now the darkness is busy with the sighing whispers of the Dead. Tenval's gaze is piercing and eager.\
\
'What moved the Heir of Isildur to come beneath the Mountain, Lûtkal...? Has he forgiven us our treason...? I will follow him to Erech, and whither then...? I cannot see it, but I care not....'","One of the living Men is the Heir of Isildur, and he has called your kind to the Stone of Erech. This has caused a split among your people: Tenval and Drugât argue the merits of following the Heir or ignoring his summons.","Dûgden has chosen to follow Drugât, and Sauron","You knew Dûgden long ago, before the two of you succumbed to weakness and fell beneath the heavy weight of the Curse of Isildur. His presence is cold, but he burns with a fierce agony.\
\
'What has brought the heir of hated Isildur to this place, Lûtkal...? Untold years we have suffered the Curse of his cruel ancestor... has it not been enough...?'\
\
Dûgden's resolve is sudden and frightening.\
\
'I will cast my lot in with Sauron, as we did before...! Drugât speaks the truth: only Sauron will reward us for our service. Only he can banish the chains of our curse! I will follow our true master!'","Witness the actions of your potential allies","Tenval has felt a curious disturbance and wishes to speak with you.","Dûgden is beneath the Mountain, in the Paths of the Dead. He shares your curse, and your feeling that something has changed.","Learn if Tenval shares your uneasy disquiet","Talk to Dûgden and learn his intention","You have made your decision, and must now deal with the consequences.","The heavy silence beneath the Mountain remains unbroken, a held breath beneath the still waters of Time, an expectant hush. Dûgden feels it too.\
\
'I swore I would never forget this presence,' he breathes without air or voice, giving thought to the idea that has come to all who now walk the undying paths beneath the Mountain.\
\
'Isildur the Hated has come again, to deepen the burden of his curse.'","Tenval and Dûgden were your closest friends when you walked the earth as a living man, in the days before the Curse. Now they must decide where their course lies, as must you.","Instance: Those Who Are Dead","Listen to the arguments of Tenval and Drugât","Only the Oath-breakers of old know what befell Aragorn and his friends within the Paths of the Dead.","Tenval and Dûgden were your closest friends when you walked the earth as a living man, in the days before the Curse. They have decided where their paths lead, and now you must do the same.","Years have no meaning beneath the Mountain for the likes of you, but even so, you hold the memory of a time when the passage of day and night mattered. A new feeling has crept into your being, but you cannot place it. Tenval senses it too.\
\
'Something feels different in the dark, Lûtkal,' he murmurs, and you know it is true.","Talk to Tenval and learn his intention","A number of living Men have entered the paths beneath the Mountain, intruding upon your demesnes.","Watch the living interlopers pass, and learn their intentions","Your lot has been cast, your path decided","Tenval has chosen to follow the Heir of Isildur","Make your choice: follow either Aragorn or Drugât"}},
[7401]={nameES="Instancia: Aquellos que vinieron antes",objectivesES={"Un extraño recuerdo se despliega...","Esta cabra te llevará de regreso a la Primera Sala en Nud-melek.","Regresa a la cabra para volver","No puedes dejar de pensar en el Puente de Khazad-dûm...","El puente de Khazad-dûm se encuentra al este de Nud-melek.\
\
Debes caminar hasta el puente de Khazad-dûm.","Una escena se desarrolla ante ti en el Puente de Khazad-dûm.\
\
Debes observar la escena de lo que ocurrió en el puente.","Has explorado el Puente de Khazad-dûm antes de abandonar Moria y has presenciado un recuerdo de Gandalf enfrentándose a un enemigo terrible...","Camina hasta el Puente de Khazad-dûm","Instancia: Aquellos que vinieron antes","Un enigma de un recuerdo se desplegó ante tus ojos, mientras Gandalf enfrentaba a la criatura más temible que hayas visto jamás","La cabra que trajiste aquí está un poco más atrás, al este del puente.\
\
Debes regresar a la cabra para volver a la Primera Sala.","Observa lo que ocurrió en el puente"}},
[7402]={nameES="Instancia: La Amenaza de un Buen Golpe",objectivesES={"Habla con Dewernt Correhuela","Has ayudado a Derwent Correhuela a enfrentarse a las exigencias de Bill Helechal.","Quédate junto a Derwent Correhuela y luce amenazante","Instancia: La Amenaza de un Buen Golpe","Habla con Derwent Correhuela","Derrota a los matones de Bill Helechal","Bajo la cobertura de la oscuridad has venido con Derwent Correhuela al lugar de reunión en el sur de Bree."}},
[7403]={nameES="Instancia: A través del bloqueo",objectivesES={"Examina el cofre del tesoro que William quiere darle a Bingo","Bingo está en el bloqueo del norte de Enedwaith.","Uno de los antiguos bandidos te hace señas para que hables con él.","Habla con Bingo en el camino a través de Enedwaith","El pequeño cofre contiene muchas monedas de oro","Habla con William en el bloqueo","Habla con Bingo en la barrera","Bingo está en el camino a través de Enedwaith, preparándose para enfrentarse al bloqueo orco.","Deja que Bingo diga lo suyo, pero permanece alerta","Haley está en la carretera norte a través de Enedwaith y quiere decirte algo antes que sigas tu ruta.","El líder de los bandidos te hace señas para que te acerques.","El largo camino hacia el norte ha sido bloqueado por gente poco recomendable, pero Bingo deberá pasar de algún modo si quiere llegar al final de su viaje.","Habla con Graham el Cruel, el líder de los bandidos","Habla con Haley en el camino a través de Enedwaith","<rgb=#FF0000>¡Bingo no debe ser derrotado!</rgb>","Bingo tiene algo que decirles a los bandidos.","Bingo tose y avanza a zancadas","Elimina a todos los bandidos","Los bandidos no te dejarán pasar y deben ser eliminados.","William te dijo que parte del botín fue dejado atrás por los orcos y quiere que Bingo lo tenga.","Instancia: A través del bloqueo"}},
[7404]={nameES="Instancia: La granja de Thrymm",objectivesES={"The farmers are gathering near the barn, and are concerned that Ragnold may not be safe. He was on the far side of the farm when the western side was attacked.","Instancia: La granja de Thrymm","Talk to Oter","<rgb=#FF0000>You let Ragnold die!</rgb>","Defend Thrymm's Farm from the final assault","Follow Oter to the centre of Thrymm's Farm","The Warg-riders at Edsig's Farm were disrupted by your efforts, and their organized raids on the farms should stop. The farmers should finally be able to repair Thrymm's Farm and begin work on the fields.","Oter and the others have been cornered near the barn. The enemy is burning the farm to the ground. The chances of the farmers escaping and making a run for Forlaw are slim.","<rgb=#FF0000>You let Oter die!</rgb>","Observe what Laudh has to say","<rgb=#FF0000>Do not let any farmers die</rgb>","The farmers were prepared to begin working the fields, but the enemy has begun a surprise attack on Thrymm's Farm!","<rgb=#FF0000>You let Torwulf die!</rgb>","Follow Oter to the western fields","Laudh is capturing the farmers and leaving you at Thrymm's Farm, to either die there or to inform Forlaw of what happened. He is convinced Núrzum will kill you eventually.","The rebuilding of Thrymm's Farm is underway. Oter has brought tools to the fields, and would like your help preparing the fields to produce crops for Forlaw.","The enemy is attacking from the south and are trying to trap you and the farmers on Thrymm's Farm while they burn it down.","Laudh has sent the captain of this band of Warg-riders to attack you and the farmers. He seems intent on capturing the farmers for some nefarious purpose.","<rgb=#FF0000>You let Siric die!</rgb>"}},
[7405]={nameES="Instancia: El Martillo de Thrór",objectivesES={"Derrota a Faerdami, un espíritu maligno que ha tomado posesión del martillo de Thrór.","Siguiendo las indicaciones de Dwalin, has viajado al sepulcro abandonado de Skorgrím Duramano para buscar el martillo de forja de mithril de Thrór, el abuelo de Thorin.","Instancia: El Martillo de Thrór","Busca el martillo de Thrór","Registra la tumba de Skorgrím para encontrar el martillo de Thrór."}},
[7406]={nameES="Instancia: Théoden, hijo de Thengel",objectivesES={"Talk to Horn and approach the king","Horn is inside Meduseld, waiting to approach the king.","Instancia: Théoden, hijo de Thengel","Talk to Gandalf in Meduseld","Witness the confrontation of Gandalf and Théoden, and allow harm to come to none","Inside Meduseld, Gandalf has revealed his nature and his good intentions to Théoden King. What will the king make of the tidings he brings?","Gandalf is in Meduseld and has attempted to lift the veil from Théoden's eyes as it concerns the plight of his people.","A hush hangs over the hall","You have returned to Meduseld against the wishes of Théoden, and now must see if he is receptive to the warning you bring.","Inside Meduseld, Gandalf appeals to Théoden. Will the king heed the warning he brings?"}},
[7407]={nameES="Instancia: En ayuda de Ausma",objectivesES={"Ausma is frozen in a block of ice!","Find Ausma","Help Ausma while the Trio fights the hobgoblins!","Talk to Kyrstig","You have to escape!","The plan to rescue Ausma begins with Kyrstig.","Instancia: En ayuda de Ausma","Escape with Ausma","The scouts Kyrstig, Molkha, and Klúso have stormed the hobgoblin fortress Shakhajât to rescue their master, Ausma. But it is unclear if they are too late, or if their help is needed at all.","You need to find Ausma.","Stand by with the Scout Trio"}},
[7408]={nameES="Instancia: Evitar una guerra",objectivesES={"Langlas requiere tu asistencia para encontrar y liberar a Avorthal. Debes cuidar las espaldas del otro, no sea que fallen.","Habla con Langlas","Has viajado con Langlas hasta el campamento de los Duramano en un esfuerzo por rescatar al príncipe elfo Avorthal.","Instancia: Evitar una guerra"}},
[7409]={nameES="Instancia: A la ayuda de un Montaraz",objectivesES={"Derrota a Amdir","Habla con Reniolind","Derrota a Amdir.\
\
Amdir se escondía en lo más profundo de las ruinas y abatió a Reniolind antes de centrar su atención en ti.","Reniolind se encuentra en el Fuerte de Aguas Pantanosas, al oeste de la Cueva de la Reunión.\
\
En su último suspiro, Mundol el Montaraz te suplicó que salvaras a Reniolind, otro de su gente, de la furia asesina de Amdir.","Al entrar en la Cueva de la Reunión, descubriste que era demasiado tarde para ayudar a Mundol el Montaraz. Amdir ya lo había herido de muerte. Mundol te pidió que llevaras un aviso a Reniolind, un joven erudito Montaraz que está estudiando las ruinas del viejo Fuerte de Aguas Pantanosas.","Instancia: A la ayuda de un Montaraz","Reniolind yace moribundo en el suelo de las cuevas.\
\
Reniolind te ha mostrado un pasaje secreto bajo los Pantanos de Moscagua, en las cuevas que se encuentran bajo las ruinas. Al final, encontraste a Amdir esperándote. Amdir hirió mortalmente a Reniolind antes de huir. El Montaraz moribundo desea hablar contigo.","Amdir invocó a una reina araña gigante antes de huir. Mata a la araña y habla con el Montaraz moribundo."}},
[7410]={nameES="Instancia: Juntos ahora",objectivesES={"Ashâmi is too injured to continue. You have failed","Instancia: Juntos ahora","You, Raphûz, and Ashâmi are distracting the enemy forces from a main assault on Kûr Anzar.","The words from the cultist linger in the air","Your assault was successful, but the madness of the cultists weighs on Ashâmi and Raphûz. You should make haste and return to Urmâkh.","Speak with Raphûz to begin the assault","Speak with Ashâmi to return to Urmâkh"}},
[7411]={nameES="Instancia: Demasiado lejos de la ciudad",objectivesES={"Gandalf has commanded you to ride for the city of Minas Tirith, while he follows with Prince Imrahil and the wounded Faramir.","Ride for the gates of Minas Tirith","Instancia: Demasiado lejos de la ciudad","Talk to Faramir on the Pelennor Fields","Faramir has fallen from his horse! He seems to have suffered a terrible injury.","A dart flies right by your head, missing by inches, and then another!","Talk to Gandalf on the Pelennor","You have come to Minas Tirith in time!","Faramir, Captain of Gondor, is beset on all sides by the forces of the enemy! You must help him reach Minas Tirith!","Gandalf has crossed the field in the company of Prince Imrahil and his swan-knights, and he motions for you to speak with him.","Ride across the Pelennor toward Minas Tirith","You can hear the sound of fighting ahead of you, in the middle of the Pelennor. Someone needs your help!","Stand beside Faramir, and defend him from his foes","You have found Faramir, but the young captain is hard-pressed on all sides!","The time has come for you to ride to Minas Tirith, but the enemy will be close on your heels."}},
[7412]={nameES="Instancia: Intercambiando Destinos",objectivesES={"Flee Middlemead with Thane Mágla","You have discovered steeds left unharmed","A din rising outside the Mead Hall signals the arrival of the White Hand","Approach Thane Mágla in the Mead Hall","Travel out of the Mead Hall with Mágla","Listen to Mágla","Defeat Hildulf","DNT -- Players will not see","Mágla can be found at the table.\
\
Mágla sees no hope for Rohan. You should tell him of your journeys in the Eastemnet.","Thane Mágla can be found in the Mead Hall of Middlemead.\
\
You should listen to Thane Mágla.","Mágla can be found in the Mead Hall.\
\
You should travel outside to confront the White Hand with Mágla.","Mágla is in Middlemead.\
\
You should aid Mágla in escaping Middlemead.","Mágla can be found at the table.\
\
Mágla sees no hope for Rohan. You should disagree with him.","Thane Mágla has been defeated!","Mágla is in Middlemead.\
\
You should fight through Middlemead with Mágla.","Mágla is at the table in the Mead Hall of Middlemead.\
\
You should wait with Mágla as he decides what action to take.","After sending his people to safety, Thane Mágla remains behind to defend Middlemead from the White Hand.","Listen to Thane Mágla","Thane Mágla is sitting at his table.\
\
Mágla has asked you to speak with him.","Talk to Thane Mágla","Instancia: Intercambiando Destinos","Mágla must be convinced to stand with his people","Tell Mágla a <rgb=#FF00FF>story</rgb> of your adventures in the Eastemnet","Tell Mágla <rgb=#FF00FF>no</rgb>","<rgb=#FF00FF>Challenge</rgb> Mágla to lead once more","Thane Mágla can be found outside the Mead Hall of Middlemead.\
\
You have escaped the White Hand forces and made your way to the horses. You should speak to Thane Mágla and flee!","Horses can be found to the south-east of the traders' pavillion.\
\
You should now escape Middlemead.","Share mead with Mágla","Hildulf can be found at the traders' pavillion in Middlemead.\
\
You have encountered Hildulf and Uruks, and should now defeat them.","<rgb=#FF0000>Thane Mágla must not be defeated</rgb>","Fight through Middlemead with Thane Mágla","The mead can be found on the table.\
\
Mágla has asked you to share a drink with him.","Mágla can be found at the table.\
\
Mágla is beginning to believe that hope remains. You should challenge him."}},
[7413]={nameES="Instancia: Viajeros en Ithilien",objectivesES={}},
[7414]={nameES="Instancia: Tesoro perdido, tesoro encontrado",objectivesES={"Bingo ha entrado en la guarida del poderoso Draigoch para rescatar a Teodoro Tojo... ¡si no es ya demasiado tarde!","Corre hacia la cuerda y escapa de la guarida de Draigoch","Has encontrado a Teodoro Tojo en las profundidades de la guarida de Draigoch.","Hasta ahora, la suerte te ha acompañado. El dragón está dormido","Habla con Teodoro Tojo en la guarida de Draigoch","<rgb=#FF0000>Escapa antes de que la guarida se llene de fuego</rgb>","Habla con Bingo en la guarida de Draigoch","Instancia: Tesoro perdido, tesoro encontrado","Bingo está en la entrada de la guarida de Draigoch y espera rescatar a Teodoro Tojo antes de que sea demasiado tarde.","Desciende por la cuerda para llegar al fondo de la guarida de Draigoch","Escabúllete junto al dragón dormido con Bingo","Haley Pradodulce desenrolla su cuerda y la ata firmemente a un saliente rocoso","<rgb=#FF0000>Bingo no debe ser derrotado</rgb>","Habla con Haley en la guarida de Draigoch","Habla con Teodoro Tojo fuera de la guarida de Draigoch","Teodoro Tojo está en el fondo de la guarida de Draigoch y debes descender para alcanzarlo.","Habla con Bingo en el fondo de la guarida de Draigoch","Bingo está en el fondo de la guarida de Draigoch y quiere hablar contigo de algo urgente.","Abandona la guarida con Teodoro Tojo, Haley Pradodulce y Bingo","Haley Pradodulce te ha seguido hasta un saliente con vista al dragón dormido."}},
[7415]={nameES="Instancia: Tratando con sinvergüenzas",objectivesES={"Return to Akhiz","Talk to Lacheg","Placed the ransom in the chest","It is time to meet with Jarl Akhiz and free Glánhar's sons.","Now that you have seen Lacheg and Togbor, return to Jarl Akhiz for the ransom payment and choose which of the brothers to heed.","Create a distraction","Talk to Togbor","Show Jarl Akhiz that you have brought the ransom.","It is time to leave the cellar in Bâr Nadhron.","Leave the cellar!","Go down into the cellar","You see Akhiz and some of his men up ahead, waiting for you.","Show Akhiz the ransom","Go down into the cellar in Bâr Nadhron and find Akhiz.","Place the ransom in the chest","Now that you have seen Lacheg and Togbor, return to Jarl Akhiz to complete the ransom.","Go past the opened gate and see that the hostages are all right.","Instancia: Tratando con sinvergüenzas","The brazier post falls over with a crash!"}},
[7416]={nameES="Instancia: Temblores bajo Barad-dûr",objectivesES={"Tras un momento de silencio tenso, los tres notáis que los temblores han cesado","<rgb=#FF00FF>Acuéstate</rgb> en tu litera e intenta descansar","Núluzagar puede encontrarse en las mazmorras de Barad-dûr.\
\
Tu breve descanso fue interrumpido por la dura voz del sectario Núluzagar. Debes escuchar a Núluzagar antes de que su paciencia se agote.","Lethi y Vaski pueden encontrarse en las mazmorras de Barad-dûr.\
\
Ansioso por compartir rumores mientras la Orden del Ojo está ausente, Vaski desea contarte lo que ha escuchado.","Lethi puede encontrarse en las mazmorras de Barad-dûr.\
\
Te has despertado de un breve descanso y encuentras a los otros Hachetones en tu celda también despiertos.","Estás intentando descansar.","Escucha a Vaski y Lethi","Vaski puede encontrarse en las mazmorras de Barad-dûr.\
\
Vaski ha oído varios rumores inquietantes en la Torre Oscura y desea compartirlos contigo.","Intenta descansar","Tras un día de arduo trabajo en Barad-dûr, regresas a las mazmorras para un breve respiro. Sin embargo, una repentina serie de temblores te ha sacado del descanso.","Núluzagar te mira impasible.","Recoge tu plato","Habla con Vaski","Tu litera se encuentra en las mazmorras de Barad-dûr.\
\
Tras un tenso intercambio entre Lethi y Vaski, Lethi ha sugerido que todos intentéis descansar en vuestras literas antes del amanecer.","Tus raciones están sobre un pedazo de escombro cerca de tu litera en las mazmorras de Barad-dûr.\
\
Despertado por temblores y con pocas probabilidades de encontrar más descanso, Lethi ha sugerido que termines tus raciones antes de que los sectarios de la Orden del Ojo regresen a las mazmorras.","Termina tus raciones","Terminas tus raciones a regañadientes","Instancia: Temblores bajo Barad-dûr","Vaski puede encontrarse en las mazmorras de Barad-dûr.\
\
Después de dejar tu plato, Vaski te ha llamado. Deberías hablar con Vaski.","Los platos repiquetean al temblar de nuevo Barad-dûr","Dile a Vaski <rgb=#FF00FF>no</rgb> y pídele que comparta lo que oyó","Lethi puede encontrarse en las mazmorras de Barad-dûr.\
\
Frustrado con la imprudencia de Vaski, Lethi ha puesto fin a la conversación.","Habla con Lethi","Habla con Núluzagar","Tu plato vacío de raciones está cerca de tu litera en las mazmorras de Barad-dûr.\
\
Deberías añadirlo a la pila de platos junto a la puerta de tu celda.","Justo cuando empiezas a dormirte, una voz familiar te increpa"}},
[7417]={nameES="Instancia: Tribunal de Sombras",objectivesES={"Speak with Andreg at the Slade of Shadows.","Stop the elhudan from entering the cauldron","Collect the Token of the Ox from the second altar","Andreg has a plan to draw forth and ensnare Gwyllion and her allies at the Slade of Shadows.","Andreg must not be defeated","Andreg is lying among the shards of the Dutegelh.\
\
You should see if there is anything you can do to help Andreg.","Defeat the Tribunal of Shadows.","Stop the elhudan and defeat the Tribunal of Shadows","Collect the Token of the Goat from the first altar","Defeated the Tribunal of Shadows","Follow Andreg to the Slade of Shadows.","Instancia: Tribunal de Sombras","Andreg is hiding near the Slade of Shadows.\
\
You should return to Andreg at once.","Talk to Andreg","Collect the Token of the Stag from the third altar","Wait with Andreg to see what happens","Place the Token of the Goat on the first altar","Place the Token of the Ox on the second altar","You should speak with Andreg to learn his plan.","Place the Token of the Stag on the third altar","Andreg has been defeated","Andreg is lying mortally wounded among the shards of the Dutegelh at the heart of the Slade of Shadows.\
\
You should bring the tokens of the gurach to Andreg at once.","The three altars can be found between the trees at the heart of the Slade of Shadows.\
\
Andreg instructed you to place the tokens of the gurach on the altars within the Slade of Shadows.","Wait with Andreg to see what happens.","The tokens of the gurach are upon the altars at the heart of the Slade of Shadows.\
\
Andreg instructed you to collect the tokens of the gurach and return to him."}},
[7418]={nameES="Instancia: Sueños Turbulentos",objectivesES={"You are held in the grip of a dream","Your mind is disturbed by troubling dreams.","Your sleep is troubled by dreams of ill omen. Do they hold any significance, or are they just dreams?","You are held in the grip of a dream. Talk to Golodir on the shore of Lake Evendim","You are held in the grip of a dream. Talk to Candaith.","Your mind is disturbed by troubling dreams.\
\
Candaith is waiting for you by the entrance to Grimbold's camp.","Your mind is disturbed by troubling dreams.\
\
Morflak looms large in your memory, casting his shadow over all things.","Estás atrapado en un sueño.","Listen to Peregrin Took on the banks of the Anduin","You are held in the grip of a dream. Listen to Frodo Baggins on the banks of the Anduin","Your mind is disturbed by troubling dreams.\
\
Lothrandir stands before you on the shore of Lake Evendim.","You are held in the grip of a dream.\
\
Candaith stands before you once more, looking puzzled about something.","Lothrandir stands before you, struggling against his bonds, but his eyes show no sign of despair. Defiance shines from those wells of blue, and his mouth is a resolute line.","You are held in the grip of a dream.\
\
Familiar faces have emerged from the fog of sleep.","You are held in the grip of a dream. Listen to Aragorn on the banks of the Anduin","Instancia: Sueños Turbulentos","You know Théodred did not die at this place, but the sight of the fallen Prince still fills you with regret and with worry for the future of his kingdom.\
\
The dream holds you in its grip, and refuses to let you go.","Your mind is disturbed by troubling dreams.\
\
You have encountered Candaith, and even though you know you are asleep, it is still painful to see him.","You are held in the grip of a dream. Search the camp for survivors","Your mind is disturbed by troubling dreams.\
\
No living person seems to be left in Grimbold's camp.","You are held in the grip of a dream. Talk to Candaith on the shore of Lake Evendim","Listen to Legolas on the banks of the Anduin","You are held in the grip of a dream. Walk with Candaith and see what he shows you","Your mind is disturbed by troubling dreams.\
\
Candaith is waiting for you on the shore of Lake Evendim.","You are held in the grip of a dream. Talk to Candaith before he goes","You are held in the grip of a dream. Listen to Boromir on the banks of Anduin","Calenglad stares out at the lake, his eyes glassy. He takes no notice of you.","Golodir stands before you, tall and proud, but his eyes burn with fire and his lip is twisted into a sneer.","Boromir stands apart from the rest of the group, staring across the water to the far bank, but every now and then his eyes drift in the direction of the hobbits.","Nothing moves within Grimbold's camp","You are held in the grip of a dream. Listen to Samwise Gamgee on the banks of the Anduin","You are held in the grip of a dream. Talk to Morflak and resist your fear","Your mind is disturbed by troubling dreams.\
\
Golodir stands before you on the shore of Lake Evendim.","Your mind is disturbed by troubling dreams.\
\
Calenglad stands before you on the shore of Lake Evendim.","You are held in the grip of a dream.\
\
A giant sword rises from the misty swamp before you.","You are held in the grip of a dream. Talk to Candaith at the gate before he goes","Listen to Gimli on the banks of the Anduin","You are held in the grip of a dream. Listen to Merry Brandybuck on the banks of the Anduin","You are held in the grip of a dream. Examine the enormous sword that rises from the swamp before you","You are held in the grip of a dream. Talk to Calenglad on the shore of Lake Evendim","As you stare at Nona's lifeless body lying among the mist and the reeds, you feel the waking world beginning to rip away the veil of sleep from your eyes..."}},
[7419]={nameES="Instancia: Amistad problemática",objectivesES={"Talk to Getfleda and let her know what her friends had to say.","Hear Brunstan's side of the story","Instancia: Amistad problemática","Talk to Getfleda.","Talk to the children observing the fight between Brunstan and Sperling","Talk to Getfleda","This child confessed to misplacing Sperling's toy sword","Hear Sperling's side of the story","Talk to Brunstan and Sperling.","You have accompanied Getfleda, a girl of Eaworth, to help break up a fight between two of her friends, Brunstan and Sperling.","Talk to the children observing the fight between Brunstan and Sperling and learn if any of them saw what happened."}},
[7420]={nameES="Instance: Tusks of the Boar",objectivesES={"Destroying the siege-engine has caused the camp to catch fire","Destroy the next siege-engine further in the camp","Flee on Elder Déin's horse","Instance: Tusks of the Boar","Speak with Elder Déin again.","Talk to Elder Déin","Tecwin kneels before you. Speak with him to discuss his plans.","Defeat the Dunlending siege-captain quickly.","Destroy any siege-engines that you come across in the camp.","Sounds of a massive battle reach your ears","The fire in the camp is spreading all around you","Defeat Dunlending siege-captain","Talk to Tecwin","Choose 4 soldiers to assist you","Talk to Elder Déin quickly","Wait for the Dunlendings to move out","Flee upon Elder Déin's horse before the chance to survive is no more!","Destroy the first siege-engine","You have made it out of Wulf's Cleft alive","Speak with Elder Déin in the centre of the conflagration.","Elder Dein has been defeated!","The Boar-clan is assaulting Wulf's Cleft in an effort to hinder the army there.","The fire is raging everywhere now","Don't let Elder Dein be defeated","Elder Déin has asked you to choose four of his finest soldiers to join you in your attempt to destroy the siege engines of the Dunlending army.","Destroy the next set of siege-engines","Choose four warriors to assist you","Speak with Gwin at the front lines. The Boar-clan will move out and attack the main camp, while you destroy as much of the camp as possible.","Speak with Elder Déin as he addresses the warriors.","Talk to Gwin","Destroy the final siege-engines"}},
[7421]={nameES="Instancia: Dos Hobbits",objectivesES={"Instancia: Dos Hobbits","Merry is sitting by the camp-fire at Parth Galen.\
\
You should talk to Merry to see if he is as concerned as you are.","Talk to Pippin by the camp-fire","Talk to Aragorn by the camp-fire","Pippin is at the camp-fire on Parth Galen.\
\
You're worried, and should talk to your friends. Pippin is young and might need a friendly word.","Frodo has already taken one of the boats! You have to swim as best you can out into the lake to reach him before he gets too far away!","Use your hobbit-sense to learn where Frodo has gone","Talk to Merry by the camp-fire","Frodo may be in danger! Stay with Aragorn!","Frodo may be in danger! You have to stay with Aragorn!","Boromir has returned to the camp-fire on Parth Galen.","One of the boats is missing! Frodo has already taken it!","Aragorn is standing by the camp-fire on Parth Galen.","Frodo must be on this boat!","Swim out into Nen Hithoel and find Frodo's boat!","Talk to Frodo on the boat","Talk to Boromir by the camp-fire","Get back to the boats, Sam!","You need to use your plain old hobbit-sense to figure out what has happened to Frodo!","You're in quite a pickle, Samwise Gamgee. You know what Frodo thinks he has to do, but you want to ensure that he doesn't go off without you.","Frodo needs to get back to the boats if he plans to leave for Mordor alone, and that means you need to get back to the boats if you are to catch him!"}},
[7422]={nameES="Instancia: Ira desenfrenada",objectivesES={"Fight alongside Béortnoth and Wadel on the fourth leg of the assault.","<rgb=#FF0000>Béortnoth must survive the assault</rgb>","Fight alongside Béortnoth and Wadel on the third leg of the assault.","<rgb=#FF0000>Béortnoth has been defeated</rgb>","Béortnoth wishes to speak with you.","Fight alongside Béortnoth and Wadel on the fourth leg of the assault","<rgb=#FF0000>Wadel must survive the assault</rgb>","Fight alongside Béortnoth and Wadel on the first leg of the attack","<rgb=#00FF00>You have earned another respite</rgb>","You have accompanied Thane Béortnoth and Wadel of Thornhope into the ruins of their village to wreak vengeance upon the Orcs there.","<rgb=#00FF00>You have a moment to rest</rgb>","Speak with Béortnoth.","Talk to Béortnoth","Fight alongside Béortnoth and Wadel on the second leg of the assault","<rgb=#00FF00>You may take a moment to rest</rgb>","Instancia: Ira desenfrenada","Fight alongside Béortnoth and Wadel on the first leg of the attack.","Fight alongside Béortnoth and Wadel on the third leg of the assault","<rgb=#FF0000>There are too many enemies to push out of Thornhope</rgb>","Fight alongside Béortnoth and Wadel on the second leg of the assault.","<rgb=#FF0000>Wadel has been defeated</rgb>"}},
[7423]={nameES="Instancia: Bajo la Montaña Blanca",objectivesES={"Speak with Arvaethor at the head of the cave.","Use the whistle to summon your new friend if you become separated","Arvaethor is out of breath but wishes to speak with you","Defeat the Orc chieftain.","Push the Orkish forces further into the mountain","Stay in the cave and learn of what is happening","Escape the Dead and return to where you entered the cave","Speak to Arvaethor","Instancia: Bajo la Montaña Blanca","Arvaethor asks for you to accompany him into a cavern under the White Mountains and drive the Orkish forces back.","A foreboding chill permeates the air of the cave","Defeat the Orc chieftain","Quickly, escape with your life!","You and Arvaethor enter the cave.\
\
You should speak to Arvaethor.","Escape the Dead and return to where you entered the cave.","The Orc chieftain guards the entrance to an ancient hall","Dead seep into the room.\
\
You should stay in the cave and learn of what is happening.","Speak with Arvaethor","Push the Orkish forces further into the mountain."}},
[7424]={nameES="Instance: Undermining Ushkútoz",objectivesES={"The central chamber can be found deep within Ushkútoz.\
\
You have found no sign of Kraznákh, but the central chamber of Ushkútoz is filled with Orcs. You should defeat them before continuing your search for Kraznákh.","As Kraznákh taunts you, you discover the trench-tunnel has been collapsed behind you!","Agnar Brokentooth can be found in Ushkútoz.\
\
Agnar Brokentooth has led you to Ushkútoz to aid in sabotaging the Orcs' trench-tunnel and the defeat of Kraznákh, a lieutenant of Gorgar the Ruthless.","As the last Orc falls defeated, Agnar beckons you over","Clear the central chamber of Ushkútoz","Talk to Agnar Brokentooth","Defeat Kraznákh's Orcs and survive the ambush","As the last of Kraznákh's Orcs falls defeated, the lieutenant of Gorgar attacks!","Kraznákh can be found in Ushkútoz.\
\
You have been trapped in the central chamber of Ushkútoz by Lieutenant Kraznákh and his Orcs. You should confront Kraznákh.","Determined to break a bloody stalemate, Agnar Brokentooth has devised a plan to infiltrate the Orkish trench-tunnel of Ushkútoz.","Confront Kraznákh","Agnar Brokentooth can be found in Ushkútoz.\
\
With the sudden aid of Lági Helmbiter and Reithvald Red-ember, you and Agnar Brokentooth have defeated Lieutenant Kraznákh. You should talk to Agnar Brokentooth.","Fight through Ushkútoz and find Kraznákh","Agnar Brokentooth can be found in Ushkútoz.\
\
You have defeated the Orcs in the central chamber of Ushkútoz, but you have found no sign of Kraznákh. You should talk to Agnar.","With a sputtering cry, Kraznákh falls defeated!","Agnar Brokentooth is leading the attack on Ushkútoz.\
\
You should follow Agnar Brokentooth and defeat the Orcs inhabiting Ushkútoz as you search for Kraznákh.","Kraznákh's Orcs can be found in Ushkútoz.\
\
After trapping you in the central chamber of Ushkútoz, Kraznákh has set his Orcs upon you. You must defeat them.","Lieutenant Kraznákh eyes you with disdain.","You do not see Kraznákh, but the central chamber of Ushkútoz is teeming with Orcs","Defeat Lieutenant Kraznákh","Agnar Brokentooth can be found in Ushkútoz.\
\
Agnar fears Kraznákh has lured you into an ambush. You should remain alert.","Kraznákh can be found in Ushkútoz.\
\
After you and Agnar defeated his retinue, Kraznákh has entered the fray in a fury. You must defeat Lieutenant Kraznákh.","Remain alert!","Instance: Undermining Ushkútoz"}},
[7425]={nameES="Instance: Unfinished Business",objectivesES={"Talk to Mekhnet","Defend Mekhnet","You should defend Mekhnet as you both face Thraunákh.","<rgb=#FF0000>Mekhnet has been defeated!</rgb>","Instance: Unfinished Business","Thraunákh has been defeated.","Before delving deeper into Atrad-zarakh, you should talk to Mekhnet.","You have found Thraunákh, though Mekhnet wishes to speak with you before facing him.","With Atrad-zarakh finally breached, it is up to you and Mekhnet to stop Thraunákh and his sapper-bombs.","You should help defend Mekhnet."}},
[7426]={nameES="Instancia: Unión del Mal",objectivesES={"Present yourself to the Knight of Dulgabêth at Amon Thaur","You have obtained the disguise of a Nurnhoth slave, and now seek to infiltrate the meeting of the Masters of Mordor at Amon Thaur.","Lhaereth barely looks at you as she takes the pouch from your hands.\
\
'Stay here, slave. I may have further use for you,' she says, an unmistakable air of menace in her voice.","Lhaereth has commanded you to remain where you are.","You collected the fallen pouch, and now Lhaereth wants you to bring it to her.","Other slaves have already arrived. You should climb the stairs at Amon Thaur and join them.","Lhaereth has summoned one of the Nurnhoth slaves.","You have infiltrated the meeting of the Masters of Mordor at Amon Thaur, on the slopes of Mount Doom.","Talk to the Nurnhoth slave","Instancia: Unión del Mal","The slave dropped a pouch when he died, and now Laereth calls for you to bring it to her.","You have come in disguise to the base of Amon Thaur. Will Dulgabêth's knights permit you to gain access to the meeting?","Escape down the stairs without being discovered","Join the Nurnhoth slaves to the south-east, among the pillars of Amon Thaur","From this landing, you can see other slaves by the pillars to the south-east","The slave collapses, and as he falls a pouch drops from his hand","Pick up the fallen pouch where it lies","<rgb=#FF0000>Avoid getting too near to Urudanî, or she will see through your disguise</rgb>","Yadêphal looks at you with disinterest, but there is no recognition in his eye. The clothes you wear blind Dulgabêth's emissary to your identity. He does not know you.\
\
'Move along, slave!' he barks at you.","Dulgabêth and his knights have been betrayed. You should escape down the stairs and away from Amon Thaur before it is too late for you to get away!","Urudanî has seen through your disguise!","Bring the fallen pouch to Lhaereth the Stained","You can see other slaves to the south-east of the landing, among the pillars of Amon Thaur. You should join them in order to avoid arousing the suspicion of the enemy.","You have learned much, but now you should escape down the stairs before you are discovered!","Observe the meeting of the Masters, and remain beneath their notice","Climb the stairs at Amon Thaur and look for other Nurnhoth slaves"}},
[7427]={nameES="Instancia: Desbloqueando la historia",objectivesES={"Talk to Girhâzi","Talk to Amâsu","Amâsu and Girhâzi have followed you into the salt mine tunnels once more. You should join them at the odd wall.","Amâsu and Girhâzi have followed you into the salt mine tunnels once more. Amâsu wants to talk to you.","Join Amâsu and Girhâzi at the wall","Amâsu and Girhâzi have followed you into the salt mine tunnels once more. Girhâzi wants to talk to you.","Amâsu and Girhâzi have followed you into the salt mine tunnels once more. After leading them to the odd wall you found, they were able to open the secret door, discovering the Dubarâkh. Girhâzi wants to talk to you.","From here the odd wall is to the north","Intrigued by your discovery of a curious wall inside another salt mine tunnel, Amâsu has asked you to escort her there to see it for herself. Girhâzi, who would not want to be left out, is accompanying you.","Amâsu and Girhâzi have followed you into the salt mine tunnels once more. You should talk to Amâsu.","Observe Girhâzi and Amâsu","Amâsu and Girhâzi have followed you into the salt mine tunnels once more. With Girhâzi's help, you have thwarted an attack by giant scorpions. Amâsu would like to talk to you.","Girhâzi must survive","<rgb=#00FF00>Think</rgb> about which way to go from the first crossway","Lead Amâsu and Girhâzi to the odd wall","Amâsu and Girhâzi have followed you into the salt mine tunnels once more, and have led them to the odd wall you found. You should listen to their conversation.","<rgb=#00FF00>Think</rgb> about which way to go from the second crossway","Instancia: Desbloqueando la historia","Amâsu and Girhâzi have followed you into the salt mine tunnels once more. You should lead them to the odd wall you found.","East seems to be the best way to go"}},
[7428]={nameES="Instancia: Invierno antinatural",objectivesES={"Gléowine is outside the village, waiting to speak with you.","Horn is ready to seize the mysterious watcher in Dunfast.","Horn could use your help to stand up and salvage as much of his dignity as possible.","Talk to Corudan in Dunfast","Corudan senses that you are being watched.","You still sense a watchful presence in Dunfast, and should find who or what it is that watches.","Nona stares at you with haunted eyes, a look of surprise on her face","Horn believes he has found Corudan's mysterious watcher, and is ready to seize the opportunity to reveal it!","Instancia: Invierno antinatural","You sense someone staring at the four of you","Horn is down-hearted following your encounter with Nona in the empty village of Dunfast.","Talk to Gléowine outside Dunfast","Horn, Corudan, and Gléowine are exploring Dunfast, and you should do the same.","Be ready for anything! Horn is prepared to seize the mysterious watcher in Dunfast","You are investigating what has happened to Dunfast, the village where Gléowine was born.","Listen to what befell Nona after she left your fellowship in the Entwash Vale","Talk to Gléowine in Dunfast","Explore Dunfast with Horn, Corudan, and Gléowine","Talk to Horn in Dunfast","Nona has returned, but she does not seem happy to see you. What will this mean for Horn?","Help Horn brush himself off and salvage his dignity"}},
[7429]={nameES="Instancia: Desenredar el hilo",objectivesES={"Instancia: Desenredar el hilo","Trancos te ha pedido que le ayudes a acabar de una vez por todas con el alboroto asesino de Amdir.","Ayuda a Torthann a entrar en el campamento de Montebruno","Descubre la causa del miedo de los bandidos","Torthann percibió la fuente del miedo de los bandidos en la esquina sur del campamento. Debería investigar.","Torthann te llama.","Habla con Torthann","Torthann no está convencido de que el mal finalice con el tumulario y cree que Amdir está en algún lugar cercano. Tal vez haya algo más en el campamento.","Trancos y sus parientes, Torthann y Lenglinn, te han conducido a las afueras del campamento de los bandidos. Trancos te hace señas."}},
[7430]={nameES="Instancia: Venganza de los Caídos",objectivesES={"Attempt to free yourself from Burudagath the Bloodletter","Faramir can be found at Ondoher's Folly.\
\
Burudagath has been defeated and Faramir has reappeared within the Fane of Screaming at Ondoher's Folly.","Defeat every Orc at Ondoher's Folly","Faramir is just outside Ondoher's Folly in Dagorlad.\
\
You should speak to Faramir when you are ready to assault Ondoher's Folly and confront the Bloodletter.","Listen to Burudagath","Burudagath has survived his encounter with the Wainriders, but appears to be severely wounded.","Burudagath rises from the ground!","Burudagath the Bloodletter is outside the Fane of Screaming at Ondoher's Folly.\
\
You have defeated every Orc in Ondoher's Folly and should now confront Burudagath.","Slain by their own master, the last Orcs fall...","Darkness creeps into your vision and you fall to the ground...","As Burudagath succumbs to his visions of the dead, you are able to break free!","In a desperate bid to free the Wastes of two threats to the Host of the West, Faramir, son of Ondoher has set a plan in motion to stop Burudagath the Bloodletter by setting the Wainriders against him.","Remain on guard as Zhan Ashû speaks","Zhan Ashû is addressing you before the Wainriders return to Dol Acharn.","Orcs can be found throughout Ondoher's Folly.\
\
Faramir has asked you to aid him in defeating the Orcs of Ondoher's Folly so the Wainriders remain deceived upon their arrival.","Instancia: Venganza de los Caídos","Confront Burudagath the Bloodletter","The Wainriders have come to Ondoher's Folly and are now confronting Burudagath the Bloodletter.","Talk to Faramir inside the Fane of Screaming at Ondoher's Folly","Speared by Zhan Ashû, Burudagath falls to the ground defeated!","Talk to Faramir at Ondoher's Folly","You are trapped in the Fane of Screaming at Ondoher's Folly.","At the last moment, a familiar chill rushes into the fane as the Wainriders appear!","Observe the confrontation between Zhan Ashû and Burudagath"}},
[7431]={nameES="Instancia: Lenguas viles",objectivesES={"Nobor can be found in the back of the Old Archives, on the left side of the second floor.\
\
Nobor has revealed his intent. You must convince him to abandon his plans against the Steward!","The rogmul writhes and disappears in the darkness of the Old Archives...","The area Gúldil mentioned can be found in the back of the Old Archives on the second floor.\
\
Gúldil has asked you to search the second floor of the Old Archives.","Confront Nobor","Hoping to confront the thief before the words on the stolen scroll can be spoken, Maenir directs you to the Old Archives.","Examine Nobor","Nobor can be found in the back of the Old Archives, on the left side of the second floor.\
\
Nobor was slain by the summoning of the rogmul. You should examine his body before leaving the Old Archives.","Nobor's body lies motionless on the floor of the Old Archives - his face frozen in horror. His body bears no wounds, but all life is gone from him.\
\
The scroll's origin may or may not have been unknown to Nobor, but it is clear that the power it contained was beyond his imagining and control.\
\
Mithrandir's warning was not misplaced - he must be told of what has occurred.","It has been a day filled with ill omens. Nobor's was a cruel fate - even for one of the Withered Tree.","Gúldil can be found in the Old Archives.\
\
Gúldil has offered to help you confront the thief in the Old Archives. You should speak to him.","You warn Nobor that he does not understand that the scroll is a tool of the Enemy.\
\
'The words of yet another dog, happy to feast on scraps at the feet of the Steward! The Enemy shall claim all soon enough - better we position ourselves to be spared his full wrath. \
\
'The Steward is powerless, and his mind betrays him! If he would treat his own son so shamefully, then how lowly are we to him?\
\
'No, I cannot surrender now. The Steward must be slain!'","Instancia: Lenguas viles","Listen to the scroll-thief","Defeat Vadokhar","Vadokhar can be found in the back of the Old Archives, on the left side of the second floor.\
\
Vadokhar has appeared in the Old Archives. You should defeat the rogmul before it can cause any more harm.","Search the Old Archives for the scroll-thief","The scroll-thief can be found in the back of the Old Archives, on the left side of the second floor.\
\
You have found the man you presume to be the scroll-thief and should now confront him.","You have found a man surrounded by scrolls and barricaded into a corner of the archives","Talk to Gúldil"}},
[7432]={nameES="Instancia: Viznak vive",objectivesES={"Return to Faeron","Instancia: Viznak vive","<rgb=#FF0000>Faeron has fallen!</rgb>","The merrevail retreat!","Listen to the conversation","<rgb=#FF0000>Faeron and Rhadrog must survive!</rgb>","Dolenthol has just learned that Viznak is actually a goblin.\
\
You should listen to the conversation.","<rgb=#FF0000>Rhadrog has fallen!</rgb>","You are under attack!\
\
Defeat the merrevail attackers!","With Rhadrog and Dolenthol in tow, you should return to Faeron and see how you can help.","Faeron and Viznak are about to be overrun by merrevail and need your help!","Defeat the merrevail","Viznak has regained consciousness and is speaking with the Rangers.\
\
You should listen to the conversation."}},
[7433]={nameES="Instancia: Voz en el Viento",objectivesES={"Defeat the Alad of Er-atûr","Speak with Raphûz","Ashâmi, begrudgingly, accepts your assistance","You and Raphûz discovered Ashâmai amongst a section of dead trees in the grove. She does not look happy to see you. Approach her and allow Raphûz to explain why you are here.","Cautiously approach Ashâmi","Allow Ashâmi and Raphûz to finish their discussion","Raphûz is too injured to continue, you have failed","Raphûz is preparing for battle through the grove to find Ashâmi.","You have defeated the Alad of Er-atûr","Ashâmi begins to make her way toward Shonith","You approached Ashâmi in the ruined grove. Allow Raphûz and her to speak.","Assist Ashâmi and Raphûz to defeat the Alad","Ashâmi begins the grisly business of collecting a trophy from the Alad. Raphûz shifts nervously.","Ashâmi is concerned you and Raphûz are over-matched in the fallen grove. She warns that the Alad is a powerful creature and suggests you may not survive this attack.","Raphûz asked you to accompany him to find Ashâmi. He wanted to apologize to the woman and to help her.","Speak with Raphûz to begin the search for Ashâmi","You found Ashâmi","Raphûz follows Ashâmi","Ashâmi scowls.","Instancia: Voz en el Viento","As Ashâmi begins to walk away, Raphûz looks at you excitedly and smiles. You should speak with him.","Ashâmi finishes her task and she and Raphûz move to speak to one another. Allow them to have their conversation.","Wait for Raphûz and Ashâmi to finish speaking"}},
[7434]={nameES="Instancia: Viaje del Cazador de Olas",objectivesES={"Talk to Sirgon on the deck of the Wave-hunter","Go back up on deck","Talk to Sigileth on the deck of the Wave-hunter","Gwallang the Limlinn hops excitedly up and down, occasionally cracking the shell of a snail he has caught on the railing of the Wave-hunter. He seems very happy to be sailing with Sirgon again.","Caebar has suggested you go above and take in the fresh air.","Talk to Daxamat and learn about Umbar","Legolas calls for your help.","Waterlogged but alive, you have found where the Wave-hunter ran aground on the Shield Isles.","Caebar stands on the deck of the Wave-hunter, already concerned about something.","<rgb=#00FF00>Beckon</rgb> for Daxamat to come down","Sigileth stands on the deck of the Wave-hunter.","When you have learned enough, find Caebar below decks","Talk to Caebar on the deck of the Wave-hunter","Listen to the concerns of your crew","Spirits are light as the Wave-hunter begins its voyage to Umbar.","Sirgon calls for you as the storm rages outside and the Wave-hunter is tossed on wild seas.","As he said he would, Caebar prefers to remain below decks.","Caebar is worried that Daxamat will fall, and he has asked you to <rgb=#00FF00>beckon</rgb> the Corsair to come down.","Talk to Legolas on the deck of the Wave-hunter","Sirgon stands on the deck of the Wave-hunter as its voyage begins.","Find the Wave-hunter","Thrown from the ship during the storm, you have washed ashore and must now return to the Wave-hunter.","Talk to Sirgon inside the Wave-hunter","Wait with your crew","Some members of your crew are talking and enjoying the breeze off the sea","Instancia: Viaje del Cazador de Olas","The storm rages!","Talk to Caebar below decks in the Wave-hunter","Sirgon recommended that you speak with the crew-members you recruited for the voyage as the Wave-hunter sails to Umbar.","Talk to your crew and make your way to Caebar below decks","Now that your preparations have been made, it is time for the voyage of the Wave-hunter and the completion of your secret mission.","Go up on deck and weather the storm","Meet with Sirgon","Caebar is below decks, waiting to hear how the crew is enjoying the voyage.","Some members of your crew discuss the situation that awaits them in Umbar.","Daxamat has agreed to tell you what he can about the City of the Corsairs."}},
[7435]={nameES="Instancia: El cuento de Vóin",objectivesES={"Hidden within the secret runes, Vóin speaks of his journey to Mordor.","Talk to Gandalf on the slopes of Mordor, as depicted by the Halls of Memory","The hidden runes left by Vóin in the Black Book of Mordor describe a difficult choice made within the dungeons of Minas Morgul.","Listen to Vóin's tale as recorded in the secret runes","Vóin recorded the words of Eärnur in hidden runes within the Black Book of Mordor.","Delve deeper into the Halls of Memory","Gandalf is in the Halls of Memory, ready to read the secret writing of Vóin's tale.","Vóin joined a group of wicked dwarves bound for service in Minas Morgul.","Instancia: El cuento de Vóin","Listen to Eärnur's plan as recorded by Vóin in the secret runes","Hidden within the secret runes, Vóin speaks of the dungeons of Minas Morgul.","Gandalf has finished reading the hidden runes Vóin left within the Black Book of Mordor.","Hear the words of Eärnur","Gandalf believes he can reveal the rest of Vóin's tale using the shard of glass you discovered in the locked box inside Khîl's home.","Talk to Gandalf in the Halls of Memory","The hidden runes left by Vóin in the Black Book of Mordor describe the time he spent within Minas Morgul, seeking to free Eärnur.","Vóin writes of his difficult choice in the dungeons of Minas Morgul, and his words return to the slopes of Mordor."}},
[7436]={nameES="Instancia: La guerra llega a Rohan",objectivesES={"Instancia: La guerra llega a Rohan","You should find Utred's war-steed by following Cíllan and her children.","Invading brigands are at the north gate of Langhold.\
\
You should hurry to the north gate and fight back the brigands.","The sounds of battle ring in the north of town...","Hear Thane Utred's decision on the fate of Langhold","Ready Utred's war-steed for carrying the Thane's family to safety","The Thane convinces his children to go willingly with Cíllan","The Thane has fallen, and madness comes over all","Run after Dala to escape","Thane Utred needs a moment alone to collect his thoughts","You should watch the evacuating women and children, and ensure that they get a safe start on the road.","Thane Utred refuses to abandon his city","Hurry to meet the invaders in battle","Langhold is on the brink of a worrisome attack by unified forces of vengeful brigands and blood-thirsty Easterlings, backed by Mordor.","Follow Dala","The war-steed is prepared for the evacuation","Leave the Mead Hall and search for Cíllan outside","In the chaos of Langhold's fall, Dala calls your name.","Help fight for Langhold","Find Dala in the chaos and follow him","See if Utred is all right","Talk to Cíllan outside the Mead Hall","Thane Utred of Langhold has a decision to make.\
\
You should speak with the Thane of Langhold.","Talk to Cíllan","Thane Utred is in the Mead Hall of Langhold.\
\
You should listen to the Thane's conversation with his family, and then follow them outside when they are finished speaking.","Observe the Thane's conversation with his family","Observe the battle for Langhold.","The magnificent horse looks ready to bear the Thane's family to the end of the world and back. It must have sensed its master's need, for it is prepared to carry its precious riders to safety at once.","Make sure the innocent denizens of Langhold get a safe start to Harwick","Cíllan is on the steps of the Mead Hall.\
\
You should speak with Cíllan.","The battle is near!","The evacuees are safe; you should run to the defence of Langhold","Follow Dala."}},
[7437]={nameES="Instancia: Jinetes cautelosos",objectivesES={}},
[7438]={nameES="Instancia: Ruedas de agua de Nalâ-dûm",objectivesES={"Una ola de temor te recorre mientras la reliquia es destruida, y luego desaparece.","Destruye la reliquia de Gorothúl en Nalâ-dûm","Bróin cree que una de las reliquias que Gorothúl dejó en Moria fue dada a los merrevail que infestan las Salas de los Espejos de Lumul-nar y quiere que la destruyas.","Derrota a Caerlûg, la criatura inmunda que ha tomado residencia en las profundidades de las Ruedas de Agua de Nalâ-dûm.","Instancia: Ruedas de agua de Nalâ-dûm","Caerlûg derrotado","Derrota a Caerlûg","Bósi informa que una reliquia de Gorothúl yace entre las Ruedas de Agua de Nalâ-dûm y requerirá un uso cuidadoso de los mecanismos para alcanzarla y destruirla."}},
[7439]={nameES="Instancia: No podemos salir",objectivesES={"Habla con Olgir","Derrota a Mazog","El Libro de Mazarbul está sobre la tumba que se erigió para Balin en el centro de la cámara.\
\
Thíli te ha pedido que termines de escribir el relato de los enanos en el Libro de Mazarbul.","Resiste a Mazog hasta el final","Mazog, un joven orco descendiente de Azog el trasgo, ha liderado el asalto contra los enanos y debe ser derrotado.","Frár está en el pasaje al este del Puente de Khazad-dûm.\
\
Tu resistencia contra los orcos te ha llevado a ti y a Frár al pasaje al este del puente.","Espera a que Frár decida qué hacer","Sigue a Thíli hasta la Cámara de Mazarbul","Termina de escribir el Libro de Mazarbul","Frár está en el pasaje al este del Puente de Khazad-dûm.\
\
Un gran mal ha llegado a Khazad-dûm, y su sombra ha llenado a Frár de temor. Está esperando para hablar contigo.","Habla con Lóni","Instancia: No podemos salir","Frár, Lóni y Náli han decidido hacer una última resistencia contra los orcos. Tú, Ori, estarás con ellos.","Thíli está en la sala Vigesimoprimera.\
\
Tú y Thíli han escapado de los orcos que se estaban reuniendo en el Puente de Khazad-dûm, pero se están cerrando alrededor de ustedes.","El asalto final contra los enanos ha comenzado.","Sobrevive al asalto de los orcos","Habla con Thíli","Habla con Náli","Siguiendo tu sugerencia, los enanos se están retirando a la Cámara de Mazarbul, que puede ser más fácilmente defendida contra la horda que se aproxima.","Thíli está en el lado occidental del Puente de Khazad-dûm.\
\
Frár ha decidido enfrentar su destino, ralentizando el avance de los males que aún esperan a los enanos para que puedas escapar a la sala Vigesimoprimera con Thíli.","Uno de los exploradores que enviaste hace días ha regresado a la sala Vigesimoprimera.","Los orcos son demasiados, y las fuerzas de Mazog se acercan para dar el golpe fatal.","Frár está esperando en el lado occidental del Puente de Khazad-dûm.\
\
¡Frár necesita desesperadamente tu ayuda si los orcos deben ser rechazados!","Thíli está en la Cámara de Mazarbul, esperando para hablar contigo mientras el resto de los enanos preparan las defensas.","Habla con Frár","Thíli está en la sala Vigesimoprimera.\
\
Te quedan pocos enanos y todo parece perdido. Thíli está esperando para hablar contigo sobre la situación.","Lóni y Náli están en el lado este del Puente de Khazad-dûm.\
\
Has luchado hasta llegar a los enanos al otro lado del puente y deberías hablar con ellos sobre la situación crítica.","El año es 2994 de la Tercera Edad, y la expedición de Balin en Moria está llegando a su destino sombrío. Eres Ori, uno de los enanos encargados de defender Moria tras la muerte de Balin.","Habla con Frár y escapa"}},
[7440]={nameES="Instancia: Riqueza de los Muertos",objectivesES={"After fighting through the dead, you and Raphûz see the treasure he seeks. A small cadre of guards stands between you and Raphûz's goal.","In the shadow of an ancient tomb, Raphûz awaits your counsel.","Raphûz wishes to claim a treasure from a wealthy tomb in Nirgambâr. You agreed to assist him as he searches this place of the dead.","Raphûz eyes the chest and beckons you closer","Raphûz looks concerned, you should speak with him","Raphûz confirms his resolve and continues forward","Tell Raphûz you are ready to claim the chest","Speak with Raphûz","Raphûz awaits your counsel and assistance to begin","You ventured deeper into the ruins of Nirgambâr. Raphûz's resolve is holding, but he looks nervous.","You fought your way through the Dead at Nirgambâr to obtain a chest containing riches for Raphûz. Raphûz stands near the prize and looks pleased.","Raphûz paused his advance and looks in need of reassurance","Instancia: Riqueza de los Muertos"}},
[7441]={nameES="Instancia: Las armas del Enemigo",objectivesES={"Has encontrado a Narucham, y parece que lleva muerto un buen tiempo. Debes darle un entierro digno y luego regresar con Gwathryn.","Instancia: Las armas del Enemigo","Encuentra el anillo Narchuil","Goeolgon derrotado","El Enemigo está estudiando el anillo Narchuil en Barad Dúrgul.","Entra en Barad Dúrgul y recupera el anillo Narchuil."}},
[7442]={nameES="Instancia: Bienvenido a Harwick",objectivesES={"This is a good place to sit","Speak with Harding","After helping out the people in and around Harwick, word has gotten back to Harding of your goodness, and he has called a council to hear of your deeds.","<rgb=#FF0000>Sit</rgb> at Harding's right hand","Speak with Harding, Reeve of the Wold","Harding gestures for you to sit at his right hand","Tell Harding you are ready to begin","Instancia: Bienvenido a Harwick","Harding holds his council in the upper level of the Mead Hall in Harwick.\
\
You should <rgb=#FF0000>sit</rgb> in the chair to Harding's right.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>This quest requires that you perform an emote while in the appropriate place.</rgb>","Harding holds his council in the upper level of the Mead Hall in Harwick.","Observe Harding's council"}},
[7443]={nameES="Instancia: Lo que se dijo y lo que se reveló",objectivesES={"Do not hand them all the gold, dwarf, for it is not yours","Talk to Gradrágh","Defeat Grúshat the Thrasher","A covert meeting between the forge-workers and the Easterling contingent might just yield a way out of Udûn.","Indeed, all your lives are forfeit for treachery against Ugrukhôr, Captain of the Pit","A louder, more dismayed murmur rises from among the forge-workers","Instancia: Lo que se dijo y lo que se reveló","See who approaches","What menacing voice spoke those words? See who approaches.","Talk to Kurtil","The enforcer and Rogmul are defeated, but the parley is lost beyond hope.","The meeting is underway. The forge-workers are presenting their case.","Take down the meeting flag","It seems that Kurtil wants to whisper something to you.","The meeting is underway. Can Gradrágh salvage the situation?","Defeated the Rogmul Rúthragon","The meeting is beginning.","The meeting is underway. The two sides do not yet see eye to eye.","Defeated Grúshat the Thrasher","Gradrágh asked you to pull down the meeting flag, as it is no longer needed and only draws attention to the covert gathering.","Watch and listen","All hope is lost","Gradrágh has beckoned you over.","Defeat the Rogmul Rúthragon","A murmur issues from the gathered crowd","Gradrágh beckons you over","Things are not going well. Kurtil has motioned you over."}},
[7444]={nameES="Instancia: Lo que vio el Senescal",objectivesES={"The images fade, becoming more and more difficult to see clearly.","Steward Denethor has summoned you to an audience in the Tower of Ecthelion.","Denethor has instructed you to look into the depths of the palantír.","Talk to Denethor","Follow Denethor","You are standing by the palantír in Denethor's secret chamber, trying to shake the troubling images from your mind. Even so, they linger still.","Talk to Denethor in the Tower Hall","Instancia: Lo que vio el Senescal","Slowly, your mind clears, and you shake the visions from your sight","Hazy images swirl before your eyes!","Denethor has brought you to a secret chamber high in the Tower of Ecthelion.","Peregrin Took has led you into the Tower of Ecthelion for your audience with Steward Denethor.","You recognize the captive immediately. It is Frodo","Hazy images swirl before your eyes.","Examine the captive hobbit","Talk to Peregrin Took in the Tower Hall","Denethor has brought you to a secret chamber high in the Tower of Ecthelion","The hazy images become more indistinct!","Look into the depths of the palantír","Talk to Denethor in his secret chamber","Denethor wishes to show you something, and has invited you to a secret chamber in the Tower of Ecthelion.","Steward Denethor is in the Tower Hall, waiting to speak with you."}},
[7445]={nameES="Instancia: Susurros de los largos años",objectivesES={"You have descended a secret stairway into a hidden wing of the dungeons of Dol Guldur, where intense shadow covers its lost chambers.","Sigileth of the Hidden Guard lives still!","Examine objects within the Room of Voices","Witness the shadowy impressions evil has left upon this chamber","An old companion steps into the room","A powerful presence has left its mark upon this chamber, and fell voices whisper of the past.","Your reverie is broken by the sound of footsteps in the west passage!","Cautiously investigate the western passage","Shadowy impressions from the past unfold before your sight","Someone is approaching from the western passage!","You thought her dead, but somehow Sigileth of the Hidden Guard is still alive!","Instancia: Susurros de los largos años","Intense shadow blankets the area. What evils might this forgotten chamber have held before the fall of Sauron?","Cross the bridge and explore the room beyond","There may be more to discover within this Room of Voices.","Talk to Sigileth in the Room of Voices"}},
[7446]={nameES="Instancia: Susurros en los Fosos",objectivesES={"Sigileth is standing at the edge of the Room of Voices in Gostador.\
\
You have witnessed many events of Karazgar's past, but did not find Karazgar in Gostador. After waiting for a time, Sigileth has come to find you.","Witness the shadowy impressions evil has left upon this chamber","A powerful presence has left its mark upon this chamber, and fell voices whisper of the past.","Karazgar may be found somewhere within the ruins of Gostador.\
\
You have returned to Dol Dhannen in search of Karazgar and have descended into Gostador. You should search for Karazgar.","Instancia: Susurros en los Fosos","As you approach the throne of the Necromancer, a vision comes over you...","Shadowy impressions from the past unfold before your sight","Examine objects within the Room of Voices in Gostador","As the shadowy impressions fade, you hear a familiar voice calling out for you...","Although Galadriel remains doubtful that Karazgar has returned to the ruins of Dol Guldur, she has mustered a company to aid you in your search for the Weeping Warrior in the depths of Dol Dhannen.","There may be more left to discover within the Room of Voices.","Talk to Sigileth in the Room of Voices","Search for signs of Karazgar in Gostador"}},
[7447]={nameES="Instancia: Susurros de la Forja",objectivesES={"When the guard starts walking again, distract him by waving <rgb=#00FF00>/bye</rgb>","You distracted the guard and Ayaluk escaped","The guard returned to his post and Ayaluk was caught","Distract the guard with a <rgb=#00FF00>/hail</rgb>","Keep the guard distracted for one full minute","Distract the guard by clearing your throat <rgb=#00FF00>/ahem</rgb>","You distracted the guard well enough for Ayaluk to search and escape. Return to his hiding spot near the building east of Ulanor's office.","Speak with Ayaluk at a building near Ulanor's chambers","Ayaluk asked you to distract the guard while he sneaks into Ulanor's office to find proof of her wrongdoing.","Instancia: Susurros de la Forja","Meet Ayaluk at the edge of the building near the overseer's chambers.","You agreed to assist Ayaluk in obtaining proof of the overseer's wrongdoing in Rakhatâb.","Speak with Ayaluk near his original hiding spot"}},
[7448]={nameES="Instance: Who Is Our Ally?",objectivesES={}},
[7449]={nameES="Instancia: Madera, Lago, Montaña y Piedra",objectivesES={"You have come with Thorin's Company, his sister Dís, and Gandalf the Wizard to ensure the Arkenstone still remains entombed with Thorin Oakenshield within Mazal Akrâz, the Chamber of Glory.","Instancia: Madera, Lago, Montaña y Piedra","Dís stands by the tomb of her brother and her sons, in Mazal Akrâz, the Chamber of Glory.","Remain alert while Gandalf and the dwarves open the tomb","Gandalf is waiting to speak with you at the top of Mazal Akrâz, the Chamber of Glory.","Gandalf agreed to meet you by the tomb of Thorin Oakenshield, at the bottom of Mazal Akrâz, the Chamber of Glory.","Talk to Gandalf in Mazal Akrâz","Gandalf is by the tomb of Thorin Oakenshield, in Mazal Akrâz.","Talk to Dís in Mazal Akrâz","Talk to Gandalf at the top of Mazal Akrâz","Listen to the words of Gandalf","Relieved that the Arkenstone remains with Thorin, Gandalf wishes to say a few words to you and to the dwarves.","The dwarves of Thorin's Company, his sister Dís, and Gandalf have come to Mazal Akrâz to see if the Arkenstone remains within.","Listen to Gandalf's lecture on the evolution of words","Descend the steps in Mazal Akrâz and make your way to the tomb of Thorin Oakenshield"}},
[7450]={nameES="Instancia: Woodhurst ha Caído",objectivesES={"<rgb=#FF0000>Herubrand has been defeated</rgb>","Speak with Gifemund ahead of you.\
\
The time has come to re-capture the fountain area, but you will need Gifemund's aid.","<rgb=#FF0000>Herubrand must survive</rgb>","Speak with Gifemund","Herubrand is near the throne in the mead hall.\
\
Herubrand would like to thank you for your part in aiding their victory.","<rgb=#FF0000>Manna must survive</rgb>","<rgb=#FF0000>Gifemund must survive</rgb>","<rgb=#FF0000>Nothmar must survive</rgb>","Defeat Thurferth and the enemy at the throne","The White Hand have conquered Woodhurst and are now openly marching in the streets. You must aid Herubrand, Gifemund, and Nothmar in reclaiming the city.","Herubrand is standing outside the mead hall door.\
\
Herubrand wishes to speak with you after defeating Arnwi.","<rgb=#FF0000>Gifemund has been defeated</rgb>","Instancia: Woodhurst ha Caído","<rgb=#FF0000>Manna has been defeated</rgb>","Make your way to the throne","Herubrand has arrived at the fountain.\
\
Herubrand wishes to speak with you about the plan to retake the mead hall.","Thurferth, a White Hand Emissary and a Dunlending named Cadwalader are standing in front of the throne.\
\
Those who organized the fall of Woodhurst now boldly claim ownership of the city.","Capture the fountain area","Herubrand waits to speak with you before approaching those waiting for you at the throne of the mead hall.","Speak with Herubrand","<rgb=#FF0000>Nothmar has been defeated</rgb>","Herubrand is within the door of the mead hall.\
\
Herubrand wishes to give directions on how the group will approach the coming battle.","Enter the mead hall with the others.\
\
The battle for Woodhurst has progressed into the mead hall.","<rgb=#FF0000>Scurfa has been defeated</rgb>","You defeated the enemy around the fountain, and can hear Herubrand and Nothmar approaching...","Defeat the enemy outside the mead hall","Defeat the enemy who hold the fountain area in Woodhurst.","The enemy has heavily guarded the pathway up to the mead hall, and appear to be guarding the front door.","<rgb=#FF0000>Scurfa must survive</rgb>","Follow the others into the mead hall","Defeat the enemy throughout the mead hall and make your way to the throne.","Herubrand signals to Nothmar and Gifemund to attack"}},
[7451]={nameES="Instancia: El mundo atrás y el hogar adelante",objectivesES={"Take your place","Instancia: El mundo atrás y el hogar adelante","Pippin and Merry have gathered 'the fellowship and everyone else who really mattered' in Bâr Thorenion for a meal and good cheer.","Take your place among the guests."}},
[7452]={nameES="Instancia: La ira del Reeve",objectivesES={"Athelward can be found along the road south of Cliving.\
\
Athelward wishes to discuss the results of your encounter with the Orcs and Uruks.","Accompany Reeve Athelward on the field of battle.","You have completed patrolling the southern road","Talk to Reeve Athelward","Talk to Athelward","Reeve Athelward is not content with simply giving orders. He wishes to lead by example. He has taken to the fields alongside you, in order to witness your prowess in battle firsthand.","Instancia: La ira del Reeve"}},
[7453]={nameES="Instancia: El regreso de Zigilburk",objectivesES={"Ghân-gharâf se encuentra muy por debajo de las Profundidades Inundadas, más allá de una serie de cavernas parcialmente inundadas.\
\
Bróin desea que seas testigo del regreso de Zigilburk a Ghân-gharâf. En tu camino, hablarás con muchos de los enanos de la Guarnición de Hierro que has ayudado durante tus viajes por Moria.","Habla con Ráthwald","Habla con Rink","Habla con Bróin","Habla con Wafi","Habla con Bori","Habla con Stóthkell","Estás presente para presenciar el sellado de Zigilburk.","Presencia el sellado de Ghân-gharâf","Habla con Sigdan","Instancia: El regreso de Zigilburk","Habla con Sweina","Habla con Hundi","Bróin te ha dicho que le digas a Bori que Zigilburk ha sido dejado con Óin en la cámara inundada.","Habla con Stilling","Habla con Brogur.","Ghân-gharâf se encuentra muy por debajo de las Profundidades Inundadas, más allá de una serie de cavernas parcialmente inundadas.\
\
Bróin desea que seas testigo del regreso de Zigilburk a Ghân-gharâf. En tu camino, hablarás con muchos de los Enanos de la Guarnición de Hierro a los que has ayudado durante tus viajes por Moria.","Habla con Tulk","Habla con Wárr","Habla con Slóthi","Habla con Orvar","Habla con Thálfi","Bróin ha decidido que Zigilburk no puede permanecer con los Enanos de la Guarnición de Hierro y ha llamado a su gente a Ghân-gharâf para devolver el hacha al lugar de donde proviene.","Habla con Bósi.","Ghân-gharâf se encuentra muy por debajo de las Profundidades Inundadas, más allá de una serie de cavernas parcialmente inundadas.\
\
Bróin desea que presencies el regreso de Zigilburk a Ghân-gharâf. En tu camino, hablarás con muchos de los enanos de la Guarnición de Hierro que has ayudado durante tus viajes dentro de Moria."}},
[7454]={nameES="Instrucciones en el mapa",objectivesES={"El mineral de narfulz se puede encontrar en el lado oeste del Puente de Khazad-dûm, al sureste de la Sala Vigesimoprimera.\
\
El siguiente paso en las instrucciones del mapa para construir la antorcha implica el procesamiento del mineral de narfulz, un metal conocido por prenderse fuego cuando se muele en polvo.","Geirfast se encuentra en la Sala Vigesimoprimera, al noroeste del Puente de Khazad-dûm.\
\
Geirfast querrá comenzar a procesar el mineral de narfulz en polvo para la antorcha.","Instrucciones en el mapa","Este mapa es antiguo, desgastado y ha sido manipulado en numerosas ocasiones. Representa una cámara oculta y contiene instrucciones complicadas para la fabricación de una antorcha muy especial.","Geirfast se encuentra en la Sala Vigesimoprimera, al noroeste de Khadar-zarâm.\
\
Geirfast estará ansioso por comenzar a convertir el ícor en una pasta para la antorcha.","Has encontrado un mapa antiguo entre los restos del Campamento de Balin. Contiene instrucciones para fabricar una antorcha muy extraña y especial.","Habla con los enanos de la Sala Vigesimoprimera sobre el mapa","Lleva la antorcha endeble a Geirfast en la Sala Vigesimoprimera","El ícor se puede encontrar en los gusanos de las profundidades entre Khadar-zarâm y el Puente de Khazad-dûm, al sureste de la Sala Vigesimoprimera.\
\
Para continuar con el siguiente paso de la fabricación de la antorcha, Geirfast te ha dicho que necesita ícor de los gusanos de las profundidades de Nud-melek.","Puedes encontrar enanos en la Sala Vigesimoprimera, al oeste del Campamento de Balin.\
\
Quizás desees consultar con los enanos de la Sala Vigesimoprimera sobre el mapa que encontraste. Tal vez uno de ellos pueda ayudarte a descifrarlo.","Has recogido una antorcha endeble de Páshnar","Lleva el mineral de narfulz a Geirfast en la Sala Vigesimoprimera","Lleva el ícor de los gusanos de las profundidades a Geirfast en la Sala Vigesimoprimera","Recoge una antorcha endeble de Páshnar","Geirfast se encuentra en la Sala Vigesimoprimera, al oeste de Khadar-zarâm.\
\
Geirfast podrá ayudarte a aprender qué hacer a continuación para revelar el tesoro del mapa.","Páshnar se encuentra al norte de Khadar-zarâm, al este de la Sala Vigesimoprimera.\
\
Geirfast cree que podrías obtener una antorcha de Páshnar, un goblin jinete de huargo. Esta antorcha te permitirá comenzar a seguir las instrucciones encontradas en el antiguo mapa."}},
[7455]={nameES="Instrumentos del enemigo",objectivesES={"Instrumentos del enemigo","Los orcos que empuñan lanzas pueden encontrarse en Skrithûrz-ulíma, al noroeste de la Guardia Orca.\
\
Los orcos están utilizando lanzas robadas de los antiguos arsenales de armas de Moria.","Moria está llena de antiguas reservas de armas de los antepasados de los enanos. La mayoría de las mejores piezas desaparecieron hace tiempo, pero los orcos de Skrithûrz-ulíma han encontrado un gran suministro de lanzas.\
\
Las lanzas son armas peligrosas en manos de un oponente experimentado.","Los orcos de Moria llevan mucho tiempo saqueando los arsenales de antiguas armas enanas almacenadas en las viejas salas, pero las lanzas que utilizan ahora son especialmente crueles y mortales.","Completado","Se reconoce la obra de un verdadero artesano cuando resiste el paso del tiempo.\
\
Has recuperado valiosas armas de manos equivocadas y probablemente has salvado la vida de muchos enanos inocentes que habrían sufrido el filo de esas lanzas.","Has recuperado muchas lanzas antiguas de los orcos de Skrithûrz-ulíma.","Recoge lanzas de los orcos en Skrithûrz-ulíma"}},
[7456]={nameES="Intercept the Courier",objectivesES={}},
[7457]={nameES="Intercept the Messenger",objectivesES={"Defeat the Kala-gijak messenger","Collect orders from Seregost","Faeron has spotted an important-looking Uruk travelling between Kala-gijak and Seregost. You should intercept whatever information this messenger carries.","Faeron can be found outside the mountain pass in Agarnaith.\
\
You should talk to Faeron.","Collected orders from Seregost","Talk to Faeron","Intercept the Messenger","The Kala-gijak messenger can be found travelling on the path east of Kala-gijak.\
\
You should defeat him and intercept any orders he carries.","Defeated the Kala-gijak messenger"}},
[7458]={nameES="Interlopers from the North",objectivesES={}},
[7459]={nameES="Interludio: Un sueño de frío y silencio",objectivesES={"Frodo is gone, like all the rest. All of your friends have gone away","Frodo stares at you silently. It has been so long since you have seen him.\
\
You beg him to speak, but you find that you no longer remember the sound of his voice.","There's no sign of Pippin, but you have found... Sam Gamgee?","Save Éowyn","You remember these Orcs. But where is Pip?","Run with the Orcs","Loneliness grips your heart","Nothing moves in the camp of Rohan","Sam looks at you sadly, and then he too is gone","Find a living man among the Rohirrim","Look for Pippin to the south-east, among the barrows","Is that Pippin? You see someone back to the west, among the barrows!","You are surprised to see Sam here among the barrows, and you tell him so. He frowns, and his face is full of sorrow.\
\
'Have you seen Frodo?' he asks. 'I cannot find him anywhere! He was here, and now he is gone!'\
\
You tell him that Pippin has gone away, but you will look for both of them. They cannot be gone forever, can they?","Pippin was here, but now he is gone. Look for him to the south-east, somewhere among the barrows.","Is that Pippin? What is he doing in the Barrow-downs?","This man sleeps the unending sleep of death, and gains no rest from it. His sightless eyes stare at you accusingly.","Éowyn does not respond.\
\
You cannot tell if the warrior lives. Would remaining behind have been a crueler fate?","Talk to Pippin among the barrows","Do any of the Rohirrim still live?","Éowyn is in danger! She needs help!","The man stares past you with sightless eyes. He died on the Pelennor, and will never return home to his family.","Death hangs above all.","Pippin seems as if he wants to say more, but then he is gone","Merry's body is held in the grip of the Black Shadow, but his dreaming mind works to free him of the malady's nightmare.","Talk to Sam among the barrows","What is Sam Gamgee doing here in among the barrows? Where is Frodo?","Your friends have all gone.","Talk to Éowyn","Talk to Dernhelm","Interludio: Un sueño de frío y silencio","Isengard?","Death hangs above all","Find your friend to the north, among the barrows","Who has come to this camp among all the dead?","Talk to Uglúk","You remember these Orcs... but where is Pippin?","Find Pippin","Dernhelm does not respond.\
\
You cannot tell if the warrior lives, if ever he did."}},
[7460]={nameES="Interludio: Un sueño de frío y silencio",objectivesES={"Examine Merry and complete 'Interlude: A Dream of Cold and Silence'","The battle may be over, but many of those wounded during the fighting still fight for their lives.","Interludio: Un sueño de frío y silencio","Pippin is inside the High Hall of the Houses of Healing, located on the Sixth Circle of Minas Tirith.","Merry suffers from a malady the Gondorians call the Black Shadow. He is on a bed in the High Hall of the Houses of Healing, still caught in the throes of a terrible dream from which he cannot wake.","Pippin is inside the High Hall of the Houses of Healing, on the Sixth Circle of Minas Tirith.","Talk to Pippin in the High Hall of the Houses of Healing","Merry has grown very pale, and cannot wake. The Black Shadow comes from the Nazgûl, and he was very near indeed to their leader. Will it now cost him his life?"}},
[7461]={nameES="Interludio: Un regreso secreto",objectivesES={"Examine Merry in the Houses of Healing","Examine Faramir in the Houses of Healing","Éowyn is held in the grip of a troubled sleep, but a grey shadow has crept over her features and she is very pale. You have heard whispers of the Black Shadow that comes from the Nazgûl, and it seems to have settled very heavily upon her.\
\
Her shield-arm is broken, but the healers have tended to it with all their skill, and it seems to your eyes that it will heal in time. The state of her sword-arm is more troubling, for it seems that there is no life in it, though the bones are not broken.","Ioreth has never heard of athelas. Could it be she would know it by another name?","Talk to Mithrandir in the Houses of Healing","Mithrandir has come down out of the city to speak with you.","Enter the Houses of Healing with Imrahil and Mithrandir","You ask Ioreth if there might be some athelas to be had in the storerooms.\
\
'We have healing herbs of many varieties, but of course never as many as we might wish, especially not with so many needing our help! It has been some time since a carrier from Lossarnach has come, and our stock of cemenduril liquor is very low. But I am afraid I do not know of any herb by the name of athelas. I can ask the herb-master. He knows the old names.'","You arrive in the Sixth Circle without incident","Examine Éowyn in the Houses of Healing","Ioreth has never heard of athelas. Perhaps she knows it by another name?","Talk to Mithrandir outside the city","Aragorn did not make it to the Houses of Healing in time","You have entered the Houses of Healing at the behest of Mithrandir.","Sneak through the city to the Houses of Healing","Interludio: Un regreso secreto","You greet Mithrandir warmly and ask him how the folk of the city fare in the aftermath of the battle.\
\
'The uninjured are slowly waking from the horrors of the siege, and before long they will return to their daily lives. But many soldiers and townsfolk lie in the Houses of Healing, suffering from the wounds of battle and the greater hurts inflicted by the Nazgûl. Some of the healers remark that if there were a king in Gondor, as of old, these wounds might be healed through his skill.'\
\
You tell Mithrandir that you did not wish to upset the delicate situation in Minas Tirith by entering the city without the invitation of its Steward.\
\
'If you do not go to the Houses of Healing, there might be no Steward by nightfall that could offer you such an invitation, Aragorn! Faramir needs your healing-arts, as do many others. You might save them still if you enter the city in disguise. Avoid Knowing Scholars who might see you for who you are, and the political situation should be unharmed. I cannot command you to do this, but I do request it as your friend, and as a friend of Gondor.'","You tell Ioreth that some folk also know athelas by another name: kingsfoil.\
\
'Kingsfoil? Say you so? My sisters claimed it to be naught but a weed! Now that you mention it, I have noticed that it does give off a sweet smell when its flowers are disturbed. It is somehow a wholesome smell, if you understand what I mean. I did wonder why any king would wish such a plant to be named so, and not one more brightly-coloured or eye-catching.'","Ask Ioreth for kingsfoil","Talk to Imrahil outside the Houses of Healing","Pass through the gates and make your way up through Minas Tirith to the Houses of Healing without being seen by Knowing Scholars who might see through your disguise.","Ioreth might know where you can find some athelas.","You were seen by a Knowing Scholar, upsetting the delicate political situation!","Prince Imrahil of Dol Amroth is outside the Houses of Healing.","Ask Ioreth for athelas","You have made it through the city without being identified","You study Faramir's face closely, and note that he is covered in sweat. His forehead glistens, and he burns feverishly. He breathes shallowly, and the rise and fall of his chest is very difficult to detect without close scrutiny.\
\
The son of Denethor seems close to death. If nothing changes, and soon, he will join his father by nightfall.","Mithrandir is in the Houses of Healing.","Athelas might help to heal them, but is there any to be had?","The words of Ioreth compelled Mithrandir to seek for one who might be able to heal those suffering from the Black Shadow.","Éowyn is lying in a bed two rooms to the north of Faramir's room in the Houses of Healing.","Merry is in the north-western room of the Houses of Healing.","Merry suffers troubled dreams. Like Éowyn, he pierced the Lord of the Nazgûl with his weapon and the encounter worked a grievous harm upon him. A grey pall has settled upon his face, and the Black Shadow stifles his breath.","Faramir lies in a bed against the right wall. He does not look well","Avoid Knowing Scholars","You decide to make your way up through the city in secret","Faramir is in the south-eastern sick-room of the Houses of Healing."}},
[7462]={nameES="Interludio: Un regreso secreto",objectivesES={"Talk to Gandalf and complete 'Interlude: A Secret Return'","Ioreth is inside the High Hall of the Houses of Healing, located on the Sixth Circle of Minas Tirith.","Interludio: Un regreso secreto","Talk to Gandalf in the High Hall of the Houses of Healing","Talk to Ioreth in the High Hall of the Houses of Healing","The Houses of Healing are full, and the healers are having a difficult time seeing to the needs of the wounded.","Gandalf is inside the High Hall of the Houses of Healing, located on the Sixth Circle of Minas Tirith."}},
[7463]={nameES="Interlude: Blood of Azog",objectivesES={"Aid Prince Durin with 'Blood of Azog: Fathers and Sons'","Interlude: Blood of Azog","Hermáth Stormhammer can be found at Vosh Torú, in the Dwelling-halls of Erebor.","Glóin can be found in the war-room at Annâk-khurfu in Elderslade.","King Thorin can be found in the Hall Under the Mountain at Erebor.","Prince Durin can be found in the war-room at Annâk-khurfu in Elderslade.","Hersegg can be found in Akrâz-zahar at Erebor.","After the escape of Gorgar, son of Bolg, and the sealing of the gates of Mount Gundabad by Hrímil Frost-heart, Prince Durin faces his first true test. As Durin weighs whether it will be vengeance or wisdom that guides his hand, Lord Glóin's thoughts turn to conflicts of old. All too familiar with the triumphs and sorrows of Durin's Folk, Glóin hopes that a lesson in history might temper Prince Durin's desire to bring the War of Three Peaks to an end at all cost.","Aid Hersegg with 'Blood of Azog: The Sixth War'","Aid Hermáth Stormhammer with 'Blood of Azog: At Seventh Light'","Aid King Thorin with 'Blood of Azog: Muster to the Mountain-home'","Aid King Thorin with 'Blood of Azog: Brethren of Past and Present'","Aid Glóin with 'Blood of Azog: A Lesson Hard-learned'","Durin can be found in the war-room at Annâk-khurfu.\
\
After speaking with Hermáth Stormhammer, Durin has decided that the Gabil'akkâ will march on Mount Gundabad in seven days. You should talk to Durin.","Aid King Thorin with 'Blood of Azog: Will of the Stormhammer'","Talk to Durin at Annâk-khurfu"}},
[7464]={nameES="Interludio: El llamado de Calenglad",objectivesES={"Helchon is somewhere in the Hall of the Huntsman.","Talk to Helchon","You speak, slowly and haltingly at first, but gradually with greater confidence and urgency. You tell the mighty figure of the Huntsman of your concern that the Falcon Clan has wrought some great evil in the caves of Tâl Methedras, and that the shaking in the earth may spell the doom of your friends.\
\
The Huntsman is silent for a long while before speaking.","Follow the stag deeper into the forest","A majestic stag has appeared in the forest of the Mournshaws.","You and Helchon have come to the Mournshaws in search of answers, but the journey is wearing on the young Ranger.","Helchon is exhausted. The frequent attacks by corrupted creatures have drained his desire to proceed.","You have travelled to the Mournshaws following the rumour of a great spirit that might know what shakes the earth in Dunland.","Talk to Helchon in the Hall of the Huntsman","Talk to the mighty figure of the Huntsman","The Huntsman awaits your request, Calenglad.","Slowly approach the majestic stag","The majestic stag is leading you deeper into the forest.","Interludio: El llamado de Calenglad"}},
[7465]={nameES="Interludio: La Guardia de Halros",objectivesES={"Prestadír has woken you for your turn at watch.","Habla con Halbarad","Halbarad is waiting to speak with you following the attack by the Falcon Clan.","Wake up your brethren before the Falcon Clan attacks!","Habla con Prestadír","Interludio: La Guardia de Halros","Did you see something move in the darkness?","Investigate your uneasy feeling","Talk to Halbarad and prepare for the Falcon Clan attack","It is now your turn to keep watch while the rest of the Grey Company sleeps. You will waken Halbarad at the dawn.","Halbarad has instructions for you, and you should receive them quickly! The Falcon Clan attack is imminent!","You need to wake up your comrades before the attack!","That was a Falcon Clan scout! The camp is about to be attacked!","Prestadír has woken you for your turn at the watch. You have five hours to spend until the dawn.","Stand watch until dawn"}},
[7466]={nameES="Interludio: La Guardia de Halros",objectivesES={"Habla con el Frontero Primstone","Bounder Primstone is in the Greenfields, waiting for you to walk with him to Oatbarton.","Bounder Primstone is outside Oatbarton.","Talk to Bill Ferny outside Oatbarton","Interludio: La Guardia de Halros","You have agreed to walk with Bounder Primstone on his rounds to Oatbarton today.","Bill Ferny is on the outskirts of Oatbarton, and if you know him, the Man is up to no good.","It is getting late, and you are not yet at Oatbarton. Bounder Primstone wants to take a short rest.","You have arrived at the outskirts of Oatbarton with Bounder Primstone.","Talk to Bounder Primstone outside Oatbarton","Talk to Bounder Primstone in the Greenfields","You have walked with Bounder Primstone about halfway to Oatbarton, but you have heard the sound of wolves on the wind."}},
[7467]={nameES="Interludio: Última Marcha de los Ents",objectivesES={"The Ents have smashed open the gate to Isengard, and now you should proceed into the ring.","Interludio: Última Marcha de los Ents","Saruman's servant has gone to join his master in the tower.","Saruman's servant has gone to join his master in the tower","Talk to Quickbeam in front of the gate to Isengard","Pass through the ruined gate of Isengard and defeat Saruman's forces","The Ents have diverted the river and flooded the Ring of Isengard. Their purpose: to wash it clean of Saruman's filth.","Quickbeam must not be defeated","You have come to the ring of Isengard with as many of the Ents that responded to your call. The time has come to remind Saruman of what he has forgotten!","Talk to Quickbeam outside the ring of Isengard","Survey your handiwork and greet the newcomer","The Ents have been driven mad by the fires of Saruman! His evil must be washed away!","The Ents have torn down the gate that gives entrance to the Ring of Isengard.","Saruman has fought back with flame and smoke!","The Ents have come to Isengard to remind Saruman of the danger he has risked with his plans.","Quickbeam has fallen!"}},
[7468]={nameES="Interludio: Última Marcha de los Ents",objectivesES={"Treebeard is near the base of Orthanc, and has agreed to finish the story begun by Merry.","Treebeard is by the base of Orthanc.","Treebeard has agreed to finish the story begun by Merry, telling you of the last march of the Ents.","Talk to Treebeard and listen to his tale","Interludio: Última Marcha de los Ents","Talk to Treebeard by the base of Orthanc"}},
[7469]={nameES="Interludio: Muchas preocupaciones",objectivesES={"Elrohir is waiting to speak with you on the road up the hill in Tûr Morva.","Radanir is among the buildings atop the hill in Tûr Morva.\
\
Radanir has returned from his expedition in the mountains.","Talk to Elrohir on the road through Tûr Morva","Talk to Calenglad by the entrance to the ruins atop the hill","Await the gathering of the Dúnedain atop the hill in Tûr Morva","Interludio: Muchas preocupaciones","Talk to Golodir up the hill in Tûr Morva","Talk to Radanir in Tûr Morva, south of Calenglad","Saeradan is north-east of Elrohir, in Tûr Morva. Golodir is up the hill in Tûr Morva. Calenglad is by the entrance to the ruins.\
\
Elrohir is pleased that you have decided to leave Tâl Methedras at last and thinks the others will be similarly pleased.","The Rangers have gathered atop the hill in Tûr Morva.\
\
You have helped Radanir fight off a small group of the Falcon Clan, and should now give the Grey Company some of the direction they seek by speaking with Prestadír.","The time has come to decide what each member of the Grey Company should do in the coming days.","Talk to Saeradan in Tûr Morva","Talk to Prestadír atop the hill in Tûr Morva","Halbarad has led the Grey Company through many dangers already on its journey to aid Aragorn, but many treacherous miles still lie ahead."}},
[7470]={nameES="Interludio: Ningún otro camino",objectivesES={"That should be enough. Yes, precious, time to slip away...","Sméagol is back, the coward","Climb the final stair with the hobbitses","We have to find Her, and tell her what we have brought with us!","Sneak to the east, towards the tower, precious","She will help us get the Precious, yes she will, gollum, gollum!","The nice Master and the other hobbit need to rest.","Wait until the hobbitses are deep in conversation","The nice master is near the top of the Winding Stair, looking out upon the dead city below.","You have business ahead. Leave the hobbitses behind and go to the east, beneath the tower.","Talk to Sméagol and tell him this will retrieve the Precious","Leave us alone, Sméagol! This is the only way, gollum!","The nice master has asked you to <rgb=#00FF00>lie down</rgb>, at least for a little while.","Sleep, precious... yes, for a little while","Find Her, precious, and tell Her what we have brought!","Talk to nice Master","We have to tell Her what we have brought. She will be so pleased, gollum, gollum!","Wait for the hobbitses to become absorbed in their conversation.","She won't want the Precious, though, no indeed, gollum!","Enter the tunnel, gollum, gollum!","Interludio: Ningún otro camino","Weak! Do not listen to him, gollum, gollum!","Sméagol is back, and he wants to keep us from the Precious! Only we know what we must do, gollum!","What do you want, precious? Leave me alone!","There is one more stair to climb before the hobbitses can put the Winding Stair behind them.\
\
And then?","Once we have the Precious, we will be the Master!","The tunnel lies ahead. You need to go there, precious, and make certain all is ready!","Talk to Sméagol outside the tunnel","Sméagol is here. What does he want? Why is he in my way, gollum, gollum?","You have led the good master and his protector into the mountains, as you were asked. The Straight Stair and the Winding Stair are behind, and the Tunnel lies ahead.","Sneak east to the tunnel, precious","Talk to Sméagol, precious","Sneak to the east, towards the tunnel, gollum","<rgb=#00FF00>Lie down</rgb> and get some sleep, as the nice Master requested","Now what was the right way, gollum, gollum?","Sméagol is back. He doesn't have the nerve to get the Precious!"}},
[7471]={nameES="Interludio: Un viaje más",objectivesES={"Britou stands before you, a figure of malice that has caused you grief in the recent past. You cannot forgive him, but he appears to offer you no immediate threat.","Talk to Britou","Candaith was dear to you, and you still keenly feel the pain of his loss. He often came to visit your cabin on the Bree-fields, and many were the nights the two of you spent in quiet conversation about the events of the day. The conversations became more serious and more grim as the shadows deepened in Middle-earth, but your favourites will always be those that were full of smiles and laughter.\
\
'We came back for you, my brother. We should not have left you here for even one day. Forgive me, Candaith.'\
\
Your words hang in the still air.","Shades of the oath-breakers you encountered on the Forsaken Road have appeared all around you! What evil do they pose to you now?","You gaze upon the fallen form of Hodhon, and think of the delight upon his face each time he recovered a curious artifact from the ruins of Annúminas. Many were the nights you spent warming yourself by the fire while Calenglad explained to Hodhon the historical significance of the artifact he had found, and the memory brings a smile to your face even now.\
\
This grim road should not be his tomb. You and Radanir will see to it that he rests at last along the shores of Nenuial that he so loved.","The oathbreakers fade from your sight, returning to the Mountain from which they fled.","Talk to Radanir along the Forsaken Road, where Candaith fell","Radanir has sensed something is wrong, and he is standing by the stopped waggon.","You and Radanir have arranged the use of a waggon to bring your fallen brothers back to their homes in the north.","Linnor lived in service to the Grey Company and fell upon the Forsaken Road","You should find the bodies of your fallen friends and pay your respects, and Radanir will begin carrying them out of the Forsaken Road.","You have honoured your kinsmen, and should now speak with Radanir along the Forsaken Road.","Allow the oathbreakers to pass","Calithil lived in service to the Grey Company and fell upon the Forsaken Road","Talk to Radanir along the Forsaken Road","Candaith lived in service to the Grey Company and fell upon the Forsaken Road","Linnor was well-known to you, for he lived on the Bree-fields and often visited your cabin to share a meal and the news. He was generally well-regarded by Man and Bree-hobbit alike, and it was Linnor who helped Burle Pierson construct the frame for his farm-house south of Bree-town.\
\
Linnor did not range as far afield as many of your kin, and his decision to join the Grey Company was not an easy one. You hope he knows, somehow, that his service was not for nothing. You and Radanir will make sure he is laid to rest among the comfortable hills of his home.","Survive your second encounter with the oath-breakers","Radanir has had an idea, and wants to tell it to you.","Talk to Radanir","Interludio: Un viaje más","Hodhon lived in service to the Grey Company and fell upon the Forsaken Road","Radanir is beneath the earth along the Forsaken Road.","Calithil kept to himself, and in that way he was much like Aragorn your chieftain. He strode often in the Trollshaws 'neath the moon, and it was he who introduced Radanir to Elweleth at Thorenhad. He used to jest that he did it only to make things difficult for Radanir.\
\
He will rest more easily beneath the trees, perhaps a stone's throw from the sound of Loudwater.","Himeldir lived in service to the Grey Company and fell upon the Forsaken Road","You gaze upon Himeldir's face with deep sorrow, for you remember how much he argued against coming to the Forsaken Road. He believed the words of Ergothorn should not be trusted, and thought seeking beneath the earth for the honourless ones to be a foolish journey.\
\
He spoke of it to you in private, and shared his concerns with Candaith, but in the end he agreed to walk the Forsaken Road. From that point onward you heard no complaint from him, and he descended bravely.\
\
'I am sorry, Himeldir,' you whisper to his fallen form. 'Be at peace, my kinsman. We will not leave you here.'","Talk to Radanir by the stopped waggon"}},
[7472]={nameES="Interludio: Pasaje de las Ciénagas",objectivesES={"Now that Artamir has agreed to leave the Dead Marshes, you wonder if Frodo passed this way after all.","Interludio: Pasaje de las Ciénagas","You stare at the supplies Artamir brought to the Dead Marshes and wonder if Frodo took this treacherous route after all.","Artamir brought many supplies with him to the Dead Marshes. If Frodo did pass this way, he would not have had as many. What hardships might he have faced on this road?","You shake your head to dismiss the troubling thoughts of the hardships Frodo might have faced if his road truly did lead into the Dead Marshes. You are not even certain he came this way, but if he did, at least he likely had the companionship of a good friend to keep him going. The two of them would do their best to remain hidden from the eyes of any enemies, and with luck they may remain undetected.\
\
There is nothing you can do now for Frodo and Sam, but by convincing Artamir to leave the Dead Marshes you will at least keep the Gondorian man from attracting attention to these lands. May it be enough.","Examine Artamir's supplies and contemplate 'The Passage of the Marshes'","Examine the supplies Artamir brought to the Dead Marshes, and break from your reverie concerning Frodo","Your mind wanders as you contemplate the many supplies Artamir brought to the Dead Marshes. If Frodo did pass this way, what hardships might he have faced in these treacherous lands?","Artamir has agreed to leave the Dead Marshes, but as you stare at the Gondorian man's supplies, you wonder if Frodo ever did pass this way. If he did, he was much less-equipped than Artamir. Your mind wanders as you contemplate his hardships."}},
[7473]={nameES="Interludio: Foso del Halcón",objectivesES={"Talk to Corunir outside the prison-caves... again","You have dropped into the pit at the bottom of the prison-caves, where members of the Falcon Clan who displeased Lheu Brenin have been abandoned.","The entrance to the prison-caves of Tûr Morva is to the north-east.","Drop into the pit at the bottom of the prison-caves","You have survived your encounter with the Beast in the Pit, and should see how Corunir is doing.","For the first time in a long time, your vengeance is forgotten","Corunir is waiting before the entrance to the prison-caves. He must know your mind.","Golodir can no longer resist the lure of vengeance, and has decided to return to the prison-caves of Tûr Morva in search of Lheu Brenin, chieftain of the Falcon Clan.","Talk to Wenda","Return to the entrance of the prison-caves","Talk to Corunir inside the prison-caves","Wenda is frightened, but it has been a long time since you were adept with comforting words.","Corunir refuses to let you enter the prison-caves in search of Lheu Brenin.","Corunir is waiting by the entrance to the prison-caves","Something lives in the bottom of the pit where Lheu Brenin throws his captives.","Interludio: Foso del Halcón","Maelona has requested your help deep within the prison-caves.","A terrible smell of rot fills the pit","You try to ease Wenda's fears with comforting words, but it has been a long time since such words came easy to you, and your face reddens with each stumbling syllable.\
\
'You are kind... Ranger.... Thank you...'\
\
Wenda tests her leg, and winces gingerly.\
\
'My arms... are fine. But I will need... some help with the rope...'\
\
While Corunir and Maelona arrange for getting everyone out of the pit, you listen as Wenda haltingly tells you how she learned the craft of tree-climbing when she was young.\
\
'My father will be shamed in the world of spirits if I fall from the rope... and I will blame you, Ranger!'\
\
You swear that she will not fall, and that her father will be proud of her ascent... but if she does fall, she should make sure to fall on Corunir, who is relatively plump, for a Ranger.\
\
She laughs at that, and you laugh with her.","Lheu Brenin has left Dunland and passed into Rohan with those loyal to him, but before he left he cast dissenting members of the Falcon Clan into the Pit of the Falcon at the bottom of the prison-caves.","Talk to Maelona in the prison-caves","Talk to Corunir outside the prison-caves","Corunir has decided to accompany you into the prison-caves in search of Lheu Brenin.","Defeat the Beast in the Pit","Talk to Corunir in the pit"}},
[7474]={nameES="Interlude: Shades in the Swamp",objectivesES={"Talk to Gandalf inside the Beorninghús","Help Gandalf with 'Shades in the Swamp: The Wanderer Sought'","Talk to Grimbeorn at the Beorninghús","Help Grimbeorn with 'Shades in the Swamp: Ghostly Figures'","Talk to the Shade of Isildur","Help Gultháva with 'Shades in the Swamp: The Maiden of Gladden'","Gandalf is inside the Beorninghús.","Help Gultháva with 'Shades in the Swamp: Only Half-Remembered'","Gultháva, the Maid of the Gladden, is by the rocky path that leads into the Gladdenmere.","Gultháva, the Maid of the Gladden, is by the ruins of Kidzul-kâlah along the path that runs through Gladdenmere.","Grimbeorn is outside the Beorninghús.","Eurik's son Badwila is in the north-western reaches of the Gladden Fields.","Interlude: Shades in the Swamp","The shade of Isildur waits on Tol Send, lost within his memories.","Darkness has fallen upon the Gladden Fields, disturbing the sleep of the shades that have long haunted the area. Gandalf has given you two purposes: to investigate the cause of this disorder, and to preserve the safety of the Woodmen who live nearby.","Help Badwila with 'Shades in the Swamp: Vagári the Wanderer'"}},
[7475]={nameES="Interludio: Fuerza de voluntad",objectivesES={"Tip over the slop bucket","Survive the consequences of your defiance","Gun Ain has come to the kitchens underneath Isengard to bring you before Saruman.","Talk to Gun Ain in the kitchens below Isengard","Tip over the other slop bucket","Lothrandir of the Dúnedain still stands strong in the dungeons beneath Isengard, resisting the torments of his captors.","Keep Saruman from dominating your mind","Barkh is not pleased with you","You have showed your defiance yet again, and the Uruks are not pleased!","Barkh wants you to scoop some slop, but you have a better idea","You have come with Gun Ain to the tower of Orthanc, there to speak with Saruman.","Barkh is not pleased with your defiance.","Interludio: Fuerza de voluntad","Barkh wants you to serve some slop to the hungry uruks, but you have a better idea.","Barkh has asked you one more time to comply with his orders.","Talk to Barkh and receive your orders","Talk to Gun Ain atop Orthanc","You have been told to report to Barkh in the kitchens for the day's orders.","You have been brought before the Wizard Saruman."}},
[7476]={nameES="Interludio: El Portero",objectivesES={"Day has dawned, and with it comes new hope for Rohan.\
\
Gléowine has offered to tell you the tale of Háma's heroic last stand before the gates of the Hornburg.","Interludio: El Portero","Talk to Gléowine on the field of victory","Day has dawned, and with it comes new hope for Rohan.\
\
Théoden is on the field of victory, before the walls at Helm's Deep.","Day has dawned, and with it comes new hope for Rohan.\
\
You have heard his tale of Háma, and should speak now to Gléowine.","Gléowine is preparing a song mourning Háma, the doorward of Théoden, who fell before the Hornburg.","Talk to Gléowine on the field of victory, and complete 'Interlude: The Doorward'","Talk to Théoden on the field of victory"}},
[7477]={nameES="Interludio: El Portero",objectivesES={"Survive against the Orcs that threaten the Hornburg","In the moments before dawn, Háma performed his greatest service for Rohan and his king.","Draw upon reserves of strength by focusing on the House of Eorl","Live as long as you are able, for Théoden and for Rohan","Háma has only one door to guard, the door that safe-guards his king.","Háma stands in the gate-house. He has only one door to guard, the door that safe-guards his king.","Háma must draw upon thoughts of the House of Eorl if he is to persevere.","Stand against the Orcs that threaten the Hornburg","Interludio: El Portero","Position yourself before the door and let no enemies pass","Triumph against the Orcs that threaten the Hornburg","Draw upon reserves of strength by focusing on the glory of Rohan","Háma must draw upon thoughts of Rohan if he is to persevere.","Háma must draw upon thoughts of his father Léoferth if he is to persevere.","Draw upon reserves of strength by thinking of your father Léoferth"}},
[7478]={nameES="Interlude: The Ghost Returns",objectivesES={"Talk to Corudan at the Harbour Warden's tower","Interlude: The Ghost Returns","Corudan has returned after months away, and he desires to catch up with lost friends.","Talk to Corudan and go with him on one more journey","Corudan is by the Harbour Warden's tower."}},
[7479]={nameES="Interlude: The Ghost Returns",objectivesES={"Talk to Corudan at the Harbour Warden's tower","Interlude: The Ghost Returns","Corudan has returned after months away, and he desires to catch up with lost friends.","Corudan is by the Harbour Warden's tower.","Talk to Corudan and go with him to see a lost friend"}},
[7480]={nameES="Interludio: La Asamblea",objectivesES={"Pippin looks at you amiably, but says nothing.","Merry's stomach grumbles, and he smiles at you apologetically","Merry is outside the gate of Isengard.","Talk to Merry outside the gate of Isengard","Merry is outside the gate of Isengard.\
\
Merry has agreed to tell you the story of how he and Pippin met Treebeard the Ent.","Talk to Merry and hear the story of how he met Treebeard","Pippin smokes contentedly, and says nothing.","Merry has agreed to tell you the story of how he and Pippin met Treebeard.","Interludio: La Asamblea"}},
[7481]={nameES="Interludio: La Asamblea",objectivesES={"Talk to Pippin on the way to Derndingle","Talk to Pippin and tell him your house is near","Wait for your new hobbit-friends to finish drinking the Ent-draught","You should pick up two bowls for your hobbit friends and one for yourself.","One of your new hobbit friends, Pippin, wants to speak with you.","You have called a moot of your people to decide what is to be done concerning Saruman.","Merry wishes to speak with you about something.","Baldbark needs to be convinced.","Talk to Merry in Wellinghall","Interludio: La Asamblea","One of the curious creatures wishes to speak with you. How peculiar.","Show your new hobbit friends the way to your home","You have decided to show the hobbits to your home.","You greet Beechbone, a handsome Ent. His path has crossed with yours several times recently, and the memory of those pleasant conversations is still somewhat fresh. After a polite amount of time, your words turn to the matter of Saruman.\
\
'You speak of our neighbour as if he is an enemy, and indeed, he does not seem to be the friend he was once. Fumes rise from his home and the smell gives my nose offence, but that is not a crime. Orcs, too, could come from any number of holes. What evidence marks Saruman as their master?'\
\
Beechbone politely declines to discuss the matter with you further, but he agrees to listen to the debate and may in time come around to your point of view.","Pick up the container of Ent-draught","Merry has agreed to fill you in on how he and Pippin met the Ent named Treebeard, and what happened afterwards.","You should tell the hobbits that Quickbeam will go with them while the moot continues.","Talk to one of the curious creatures","Follow the hobbits to Derndingle","Pick up three bowls with which to serve your friends and yourself","The other hobbit wishes to speak with you.","Convince Quickbeam that something must be done","You have decided to show these curious little creatures, these hobbits, to your home.","Viaja al Valle Emboscado con los hobbits","Your hobbit friends could use a sip of Ent-draught. You should bring them the bowls you picked up.","Convince Beechbone that something must be done","Learn the nature of the curious little creatures","Beechbone needs to be convinced.","The hobbits seem to be enjoying the Ent-draught.","Bring your new hobbit friends to Wellinghall","Many of your people have come to Derndingle to discuss the matter of Saruman.","You have heard the sound of two curious creatures speaking to one another, and should investigate.","You exchange pleasantries with Quickbeam, one of the younger Ents. His home is not far from Derndingle, and sometimes you have seen him walking in the sunlight among the trees. Before much time has passed, the conversation turns to Saruman. Quickbeam seems to have some idea of the Wizard's crimes already.\
\
'Saruman has much for which to answer. He is a tree-killer, and we have been quiet neighbours for too long already. You find me over-hasty, I know, but in this there seems to be little need for discussion, Fangorn. I have quite made up my mind.'\
\
You tell Quickbeam of the two young hobbits you met, and ask if he will watch them while you speak to the rest of the Ents at the moot. He readily agrees.","You have brought the hobbits to Derndingle, where the Ents will discuss the matter of Saruman. You should tell the young one what to expect.","Quickbeam needs to be convinced.","Your new hobbit friends may enjoy a sip of Ent-draught.","Capítulo 5: La reunión de la Compañía Gris","Talk to the other hobbit","The creatures seem to offer no threat, but you have not seen their like before.","Convince Baldbark that something must be done","Bring the bowls of Ent-draught to your new hobbit friends"}},
[7482]={nameES="Interludio: El buey y el dragón",objectivesES={"Talk to Glynn Brenin atop the village","The worm hisses at its trapped victims, and lumbers in for its meal. You have to get its attention!\
\
'Over here, worm! Over here! Let me get a look at that ugly visage of yours, and see if I can work any improvements!'\
\
As the worm closes for battle, you wonder if you could have fashioned a better battle-cry.","This worm has not noticed your approach, and though it pains you to attack unaccompanied by a shout borne of your sharp wit, you do so anyway. There will be time enough, and worms enough in Lhanuch, for you to think of something clever in the meantime.","Anirin can be found down the hill in Lhanuch.\
\
Anirin, the messenger of the Falcon Clan who has been recovering in Lhanuch from a leg injury, should be told what has happened in Tûr Morva.","You have travelled with Saeradan into Enedwaith and have stopped for the night at Lhanuch on your way north with the waggon containing your fallen comrades.","Talk to Anirin down the hill in Lhanuch","Interludio: El buey y el dragón","Glynn Brenin's open face grows cloudy and troubled as you speak of the Grey Company's betrayal by Lheu Brenin and the Falcon Clan.\
\
'Alas for your fallen, and for the hopes of my people, Radanir. If Lheu Brenin has succumbed to the whispered promises of Saruman, how can we hope to persevere 'gainst him?'\
\
Glynn Brenin snorts. 'Lheu was not as strong as I believed, Radanir. That must now be the truth. His weakness, buried deeply, has emerged and betrayed us all.'","Talk to Anirin","Glynn Brenin can be found near the top of the village, in front of his dwelling.","Talk to Suvulch at the west-gate of Lhanuch","Talk to Saeradan outside the gates of Lhanuch","The Dragon Clan has released worms throughout Lhanuch, and Glynn Brenin wants you to defeat them!","Saeradan is outside the gates of Lhanuch.\
\
Now that the Dragon Clan has been driven away from Lhanuch, you should speak with Saeradan.","Glynn Brenin is near the top of Lhanuch, fighting off warriors of the Dragon Clan.","The worm snaps its fangs together as it menaces its prey.\
\
'Oh, what is that horrible stench? Is that you, worm? It is! It is a wonder you creatures are even able to breed!'","Talk to Glynn Brenin at the top of the village","Suvulch of the Uch-lûth is by the gate, confronting a large and hostile force of Dunlendings.","The Dragon Clan has offered Anirin a chance to share in the treasure taken from Lhanuch. Talk to him at the West gate of the village.","Saeradan is standing outside the gates of Lhanuch and wishes to speak with you."}},
[7483]={nameES="Interludio: El Precioso, al fin",objectivesES={"No, Precious! Don't leave me!","The Precious is ours! <rgb=#FF0000>Dance</rgb>, Precious, <rgb=#FF0000>dance</rgb>!","Kill the fat hobbit!","Interludio: El Precioso, al fin","Frodo has agreed to tell you the truth of the events within Mount Doom.","Get the Ring!","The Ring is gone","Find the hobbitses!"}},
[7484]={nameES="Interludio: Aquellos que Están Muertos",objectivesES={"Interludio: Aquellos que Están Muertos","Rovalang beheld a frightening meeting atop the Hill of Erech, and does not know what it signifies, but you know part of its significance, at the least: Aragorn spoke with the oath-breakers in the dead of night.","Rovalang stands on the slope of the Hill of Erech.\
\
Rovalang wishes to learn more of the meeting between the Dead and Aragorn, if you are willing to speak to him.","Rovalang is on the slope of the Hill of Erech.","Talk to Rovalang and experience 'Interlude: Those Who Are Dead'","Talk to Rovalang"}},
[7485]={nameES="Interrogating the Suspects",objectivesES={"Each of the suspects may be found within the city of Cliving: Swithorne at the Rohirrim tents by the Mead Hall, Eldora at her home by the west gate, and Wigfugol at his estate in the north-west part of the city.\
\
Walnoth would like you to interrogate the people he believes to be the main suspects in the crimes that have occurred.","Wigfugol has established that he had no possible access to the kitchen","Talk to Eldora at her home near the west entrance to Cliving","Walnoth believes that he has narrowed the list of suspects down to three individuals. The soldier Swithorne, the cook's assistant Eldora, and an elderly man -- Wigfugol -- all must be interrogated.","Return to Walnoth and discuss each suspect's testimony","Eldora has established that she had no motive to harm either victim","Talk to Wigfugol at his estate in the north-west part of Cliving","Walnoth may be found near the fountain at the centre of Cliving.\
\
Walnoth awaits the results of your interrogations.","Swithorne has established that his witness should absolve him of the crimes","Talk to Swithorne at his tent near the Mead Hall","Interrogating the Suspects"}},
[7486]={nameES="Hacia Bree",objectivesES={"Lolo Wendingway mencionó que Bree está lleno de rumores sobre sombras que crecen y refugiados que llegan del sur. Te dijo que buscaras al segundo vigilante Heathstraw si querías continuar ayudando en las Tierras de Bree.","El segundo vigilante Heathstraw se encuentra cerca de la Fuente del Jabalí en el centro de la Plaza del Mercado en Bree.\
\
Lolo Wendingway mencionó que el segundo vigilante Heathstraw podría tener información sobre personas que necesitan cosas hechas en Bree.","Hacia Bree"}},
[7487]={nameES="Into Enemy Territory",objectivesES={"Return to Shukûri in the Gorge of Woe to inform her you have reduced the number of Orcs in the camps near Utug-bûr.","Into Enemy Territory","Return to Shukûri","Shukûri has asked that you go to Sar-kidul and Ab-dâna to the north near Utug-bûr to see what you find and defeat any Orcs you encounter there.","Shukûri in the Gorge of Woe has asked you to scout out the camps to the north near Utug-bûr and defeat any Orcs you find there."}},
[7488]={nameES="Into Falch Gurth",objectivesES={"Find the source of the voices in Falch Gurth","Taurdir can be found at Torgris.\
\
You have discovered a small encampment of Rangers within a cleft of Falch Gurth. You should talk to Taurdir.","Talk to Taurdir","Search for Nidhlas and his men in Falch Gurth","Falch Gurth can be found to the south of Taen Orwath.\
\
You have entered Falch Gurth in search of Nidhlas and his men. You should continue searching for signs of them.","Shadows loom ahead of you, but you hear hushed voices up the path to the east","A small company of Rangers entered Falch Gurth in an attempt to explore Thuringwath, the Valley of Secret Shadow.","The source of the voices seems to be coming from a raised cleft within Falch Gurth.\
\
While exploring Falch Gurth, you overheard hushed voices from the east. You should investigate the source of the voices.","Falch Gurth can be found to the south of Taen Orwath.\
\
Cuilion has asked you to enter Falch Gurth and learn what has become of Nidhlas and his men.","A foreboding pass has been carved through the black slopes of Ephel Dúath","Find the entrance of Falch Gurth","It seems a few Rangers have made camp in a small cleft within Falch Gurth","Into Falch Gurth"}},
[7489]={nameES="Into Fangorn",objectivesES={}},
[7490]={nameES="Into Harm's Way",objectivesES={"Cerdic has asked that you speak to his men to learn more of the Balewood before venturing into the forest.","Talk to Athelman","You hear the snarls of Wargs in the distance. Look to the road!","Stand at the nearby bunker and watch the road","Talk to Frethi","Into Harm's Way","Cerdic is concerned with the increased patrols of Orcs through the part of Fangorn known as the Balewood.","The bunker can be found in Cerdic's camp overlooking the roadway to the east.\
\
You have spoken to Cerdic's men. You should now take up a post at the nearby bunker and watch the road for signs of Warg-riders.","The Orc raiding party has passed along the road.\
\
You should speak to Cerdic before venturing into the Balewood.","Talk to Cerdic"}},
[7491]={nameES="Into Naerband",objectivesES={"Naerband is located in Talath Úrui.\
\
You should search Naerband for information about Thraknûl.","Into Naerband","Complete The Key to Chaos","Find the lever that opens the torture chamber","Retrieve the guard's key","It sounds like Akhrûn has been recaptured!","Naerband is located in Talath Úrui.\
\
You should retrieve the key from the corpse of the guard.","With Akhrûn returning to Nurn, you decide to infiltrate Naerband to learn more of the terrible Thraknûl.","Naerband is located in Talath Úrui.\
\
You should retrieve and read the guard's register.","The register contains text about the coming and goings of prisoners, jailers, and torturers","Retrieve and read the guard's register","Search Naerband for information about Thraknûl","You hear a noise echoing through the prison halls","<rgb=#FF0000>Listen</rgb> more closely to the noise","Naerband is located in Talath Úrui.\
\
You should enter Naerband.","Naerband is located in Talath Úrui.\
\
You should find the lever that opens the torture chamber.","Listen","It looks as if the former guard had been recently tortured","Naerband is located in Talath Úrui.\
\
You should listen more closely.","The guard abandoned the post.\
\
You should search Naerband's dungeons for the guard.","You hear the door to the torture chamber unlock","Naerband is located in Talath Úrui.\
\
You should listen.","Complete Servants of Urudanî","Akhrûn is in Naerband.\
\
You should find and speak with Akhrûn quickly.","Enter Naerband","You find some sort of register inside a locked guard room","The smell of burnt flesh permeates the air around you","Now you should be able to find out what is in the guard's register","Find Akhrûn","Naerband is located in Talath Úrui.\
\
Now with the knowledge you have acquired through the guard's register, you should complete additional tasks within Naerband.","Complete The Madness of Thraknûl","Search Naerband for the guard"}},
[7492]={nameES="Into Naerost",objectivesES={"Naerost lies to the east of Weathertop in the Lone-lands, far to the east of Bree.\
\
Nidgyl has asked you to assault the ruins of Naerost and defeat the villianous half-orc Hontimûrz. He suggested that you take allies with you.","Derrota a Hontimûrz","Nidgyl is in Bree-town in Bree-land, far to the west of Naerost.\
\
You should return to Nidgyl and tell him of Hontimûrz' defeat.","Into Naerost","Nidgyl in Bree-town told you of a ruthless band of half-orcs that has inhabited the ruins of Naerost in the Lone-lands.","Talk to Nidgyl","Hontimûrz ha sido derrotado"}},
[7493]={nameES="Into Osgiliath",objectivesES={}},
[7494]={nameES="Entra en Sant Lhoer, los Jardines Emponzoñados",objectivesES={"Oganuin ha sido derrotada","Derrota a Cráthair","Sant Lhoer, conocido como los Jardines Emponzoñados de Carn Dûm, es un lugar húmedo repleto de plantas, árboles y flores mortales, como pocas o ninguna se han visto antes en la Tierra Media. Más allá de las aguas fétidas de color verde berilo que fluyen por Sant Lhoer, se alzan inmensas estructuras de cristal, incluyendo Bâr Heledh, la Casa de Cristal. Es aquí donde la hechicera Oganuin practica su arte, experimentando con criaturas, plantas y personas por igual. ¿Con qué fin y para qué propósito? Solo se pueden suponer los más oscuros designios.","Mientras explorabas Sant Lhoer, has encontrado un pabellón de cristal. Deberías buscar dentro por señales de Málruv.","Encontraste una llave de hierro","Entra en Sant Lhoer y busca alguna señal de Málruv","Has descubierto una llave de hierro en el cuerpo de Cráthair. Dolág piensa que podría abrir una puerta que vio en el extremo norte de los Jardines Emponzoñados.\
\
Deberías buscar y abrir la puerta del norte.","Busca la puerta norte","Dolág te ha encontrado dentro de la puerta de los Jardines Emponzoñados y te está esperando para continuar. Deberías buscar a su hermano desaparecido.","Has encontrado a Málruv y lo has rescatado de las maquinaciones de la maga angmarim, Oganuin. Deberías hablar con Málruv.","Espera a Dolág y luego habla con ella","Dejas los Jardines Emponzoñados atrás y te diriges hacia enormes estructuras de hierro y vidrio. Deberías continuar buscando a Málruv.","Encontraste una enorme casa de cristal","Dentro de Sant Lhoer has encontrado a un mago angmarim, Cráthair, y su compañero, el Jorthkyn Tarkka-oka. El último es como nada que hayas visto antes. ¡Esto debe ser uno de los horribles experimentos de Oganuin! Deberías derrotar a ambos.","Habla con Dolág","Continúa buscando a Málruv","Derrota a la Alta Cultivadora Oganuin","Has descubierto enormes invernaderos de vidrio y hierro dentro de Sant Lhoer. Espera a que Dolág te alcance y luego habla con ella.","El gran Jorthkyn se estrella en el suelo","Habla con Dolág dentro de Sant Lhoer, los Jardines Emponzoñados","Después de derrotar a la hechicera Oganuin, rescataste a Málruv y te ocupaste de su bienestar. Su preocupada hermana ahora está esperando para hablar contigo.\
\
Deberías hablar con Dolág","Rhúnelleth te ha sugerido que hables con Dolág, cuyo hermano desapareció mientras exploraba los Jardines Emponzoñados de Carn Dûm.\
\
Dolág está en Bail Avarc, cerca de Carn Dûm.","Entra en Sant Lhoer, los Jardines Emponzoñados","Habla con Málruv","Te paras ante Bâr Heledh, la Casa de Vidrio de Carn Dûm. Dentro de sus muros de metal y vidrio, la hechicera Oganuin practica sus artes oscuras, creando abominaciones y retorciendo seres vivos hacia fines inhumanos. Debes derrotarla y buscar señales de Málruv.","Determinada a rescatar a su hermano desaparecido, Dolág te ha pedido que la encuentres en la entrada de Sant Lhoer, los Jardines Emponzoñados.\
\
Los Jardines Emponzoñados están ubicados en Carn Dûm.","Has descubierto a Cráthair y Tarkka-oka","Dolág te espera para hablar contigo en Bail Avarc, cerca de Carn Dûm.","La llave se desliza en la cerradura y la puerta se abre","Dentro de un pabellón de hierro y vidrio en Sant Lhoer, Tarkka-oka y su guardián Cráthair te tendieron una emboscada. Tras derrotarlos, encontraste una llave de hierro.\
\
Dolág se ha unido a ti en el pabellón y está esperando para hablar contigo.","Busca en el pabellón","Habla con Dolág en Bail Avarc","Derrota a Tarkka-oka","Encontraste un pabellón de cristal"}},
[7495]={nameES="Into the Abyss",objectivesES={"Into the Abyss","You have come to the abyss of Mordath...","Travel to the mouth of the abyss of Mordath in Dor Amarth","Talk to Spakorth at the ruins of Díngarth","Gimli is standing near the mouth of the abyss of Mordath.\
\
You have learned that King Greytooth and the Firehorns have descended into the Abyss of Mordath. You should speak to Gimli and pursue them.","The abyss of Mordath can be found to the south-east of the Oath-taker's Horn in Dor Amarth.\
\
Spakorth has asked you to patrol the mouth of the abyss amidst the ruins of Barad-dûr, and search for any sign of King Váskmun Greytooth and the Firehorns.","Deep in the depths of Barad-dûr, there lies a passage into the Mordath, the Black Pits of Mordor, through which Váskmun Greytooth intends to lead the Firehorns in his quest to reclaim the Dwarf-ring, Manthríf.","Gimli is standing near the mouth of the abyss of Mordath.\
\
You searched the mouth of the abyss, finding no sign of King Váskmun Greytooth or the Firehorns, but Gimli has now arrived at the Mordath. You should speak to him, and learn what he and Spakorth discovered.","Talk to Gimli at the abyss of Mordath","You find no evidence that the Firehorns travelled this way, but you suddenly hear a familiar voice nearby...","Gimli can be found at the ruins of Díngarth.\
\
You have returned to the ruins of Díngarth from the dungeons of Barad-dûr after learning that King Váskmun Greytooth and the Firehorns have descended into the Mordath. Spakorth and his folk are free at long last, but the fate of Firehorns is still unwritten. You should speak to Gimli.","<RGB=#FF00FF>Look</rgb> for any sign of the Firehorns at the abyss of Mordath","Spakorth can be found at the ruins of Díngarth in Dor Amarth.\
\
You and Gimli have escaped the ruins of Barad-dûr after confronting a glamour, and have returned to the ruins of Díngarth to tell Spakorth of what you discovered. You should speak to Spakorth.","Talk to Gimli at the ruins of Díngarth"}},
[7496]={nameES="Hacia los Bails",objectivesES={"Ídolo de Bail Grundail destruido","Ídolo de Bail Cátharnakh destruido","Hacia los Bails","Areneth está en Gath Forthnír, al oeste de Himbar.\
\
Tras destruir los ídolos de Himbar, debes volver a Gath Forthnír y contarle a Areneth lo que has conseguido.","Ídolo de Bail Dílas destruido","Destruye el ídolo de Bail Cátharnakh","Destruye el ídolo de Bail Dílas","Destruye el ídolo de Bail Grundail","Los ídolosde los Angmarim se encuentran en los tres bails al sur de Himbar, al oeste de Gath Forthnír.\
\
Areneth te ha pedido que te dirijas a los tres Bails al sur de Himbar. En el centro de cada uno de ellos hay un ídolo que debe ser destruido para impedir que los Angmarim ataquen de nuevo.","Los Angmarim, siervos del Señor Oscuro, amenazan a los Montaraces de Gath Forthnír.\
\
A los Montaraces les gustaría que los rechazaras de una vez por todas destruyendo los ídolos en el centro de cada Bail."}},
[7497]={nameES="Into the Bleak Forest",objectivesES={}},
[7498]={nameES="Dentro de la Cueva",objectivesES={"Debes explorar el interior de la cueva y averiguar cuántos trolls hay.","La entrada a la cueva de los trolls está al noreste del campamento de Arrod.\
\
Deberías explorar el interior de la cueva, ya que hay pocos trolls afuera durante la luz del día.","Dentro de la Cueva","La entrada a la cueva de los trolls está al noreste del campamento de Arrod.\
\
Deberías explorar el interior de la cueva, ya que no parece haber muchos trolls afuera.","Arrod está en su campamento sobre el acantilado al suroeste de la cueva de los trolls.\
\
Debes regresar con Arrod y contarle lo que descubriste en la cueva.","Has derrotado al hendroval, pero viste pocos trolls; quizá estén refugiados en lo profundo de su cueva.","Estos trolls de caverna son mucho más resistentes que los trolls de piedra que encontraste en otras partes del Bosque de los Trolls.","Explora el interior de la cueva de los trolls","Habla con Arrod"}},
[7499]={nameES="Into the Dead City",objectivesES={"There appears to be no visible means of entering this tower","The Rangers of Ithilien have decided that now is the time to enter Minas Morgul and begin to cleanse the Dead City, if such a thing might be possible.","Talk to Damrod in Barad Angarth","Talk to Damrod","Complete 'Instance: Into the Circle of Wrath'","Enter Barad Angarth, the Gate-wardens' Keep","Minas Morgul nestles among the mountains in Imlad Morgul.\
\
You should patrol the outer wall of the Dead City.","This narrow path leaves you too open for an ambush","A small hatchway juts from the base of this tower","The wall here is smooth and impossible to climb","Damrod can be found at Barad Angarth.\
\
You should talk to Damrod.","The entrance to Barad Angarth can be found at the base of the outer wall of Minas Morgul.\
\
You should enter the tower of Barad Angarth.","The main entrance to Minas Morgul is too heavily guarded for a direct assault","Into the Dead City","Damrod can be found at Echad Uial.\
\
You should talk to Damrod.","The walls here appear too steep for you to scale"}},
[7500]={nameES="Into the Dragon's Maw",objectivesES={"A company of Dragon-clan warriors is encamped at the northern end of the Gravenwood, marching down from Enedwaith.","Into the Dragon's Maw","One of the Dunlending captains might carry the orders Thurbald seeks.\
\
Thurbald has asked you to find a copy of the Draig-lûth's orders.","Thurbald is hiding to the south of Uvel-cadlus.\
\
You should bring the orders you found to Thurbald at once.","Órdenes recogidas","Recoge las órdenes","Bring the orders to Thurbald"}},
[7501]={nameES="Into the Dusk",objectivesES={"The horse was spooked by your approach and ran deeper into the forest.\
\
You should find the missing horse again.","Baradal is slightly shaken by the sudden death of the horse.\
\
'We are not alone out here! There are deep claw marks in its hide! Be on guard! The poor horse. He loyally followed his master into danger and met an undeserved fate.\
\
'Wait... look at these tracks! I believe the demons feared by the Woodmen are simply wargs. We are more than capable of handling this threat. We should proceed to Shathur-munzu at once.'","Baradal is standing by in Arhaim.\
\
When you are ready to head into the wilds, you should speak to Baradal.","Shathur-munzu is somewhere west of Arhaim.\
\
You should start by following the path west from the village.","You have found a cart sitting by itself in the road","This must be all that remains of the man you sought","Into the Dusk","Baradal believes the owner of the cart may still be alive somewhere in the forest west of Arhaim.\
\
You should search for the cart's owner.","Follow the path west from Arhaim","The horse has been killed!","Find the cart's owner","Armed with the information you need, Baradal wishes to head into the wilds in search of the dwarf ruin Shathur-munzu.","Baradal can be called to your side with Baradal's summoning horn.\
\
You should talk to Baradal about what just occurred.","The dead cart owner's horse may still be alive somewhere in the forest of Duskenvale.\
\
You should find the missing horse.","Find Shathur-munzu","Talk to Baradal","You have found a cart sitting by itself in the road.\
\
You should talk to Baradal about this.","Baradal can be called to your side with Baradal's summoning horn.\
\
You should talk to Baradal.","Shathur-munzu can be found west of Arhaim, in the wilds of Duskenvale.\
\
You should find Shathur-munzu.","Find the missing horse","The horse is startled and runs deeper into the forest","Baradal pauses, alarmed by something ahead"}},
[7502]={nameES="En la Fosa Colmilluda",objectivesES={"Has recogido el saco de provisiones","Habla con Folkath en la Fosa Colmilluda","En la Fosa Colmilluda","El saco de provisiones de Oxi se encuentra en el suelo junto a él, en Jazârgund.\
\
Oxi te ha pedido que lleves un saco de provisiones importantes al puesto avanzado de enanos en la Fosa Colmilluda.","Folkath espera las provisiones en el campamento de la Fosa Colmilluda, al final del camino al este de Jazârgund.\
\
Oxi te ha pedido que lleves las provisiones importantes que ha recogido a Folkath en la Fosa Colmilluda.","Oxi te ha pedido que ayudes a un grupo de enanos que intentan obstaculizar a los morrovals en la Fosa Colmilluda, en el lado este del Camino de Durin."}},
[7503]={nameES="Into the Fold",objectivesES={"With the Haradrim assault coming any moment, Indir is worried that some of the townsfolk are still outside the bailey walls.","Some people remain outside the keep, in the town of Arnach.\
\
You should gather the townsfolk outside the bailey walls and send them into the keep for their safety.","Into the Fold","Indir can be found within the walls of Arnach's keep.\
\
All the townsfolk of Arnach should now be gathered within the keep. You should return to Indir to tell him this has been done.","Talk to Indir"}},
[7504]={nameES="Hacia la Contienda",objectivesES={"Across the field of battle, the burning ruins of Zudramdân loom...","Find Agnar Brokentooth at Ifbar-athrâkh","Agnar Brokentooth can be found at Ifbar-athrâkh.\
\
You have found Agnar Brokentooth in Ifbar-athrâkh. You should deliver Glóin's orders to Agnar Brokentooth at once.","As the War of Three Peaks overtakes Elderslade, Glóin has need of hale warriors to see the battle to its end.","Advance to the forward trenches","Agnar stands among several dwarves deep within Ifbar-athrâkh","Órug, Zhúdo, and Gárjan can be found in the trenches or on the battlefield in the War of Three Peaks.\
\
Glóin has sent you on a mission to join the forces of the Gabil'akkâ on the battlefield and receive reports from Órug, Zhúdo, and Gárjan before delivering his orders to Agnar Brokentooth at Ifbar-athrâkh.","Talk to Gárjan","Known as Ifbar-athrâkh, the Gabil'akkâ have erected a defensive trench within the stones of Elderslade","Talk to Órug","Hacia la Contienda","Deliver Glóin's order to Agnar Brokentooth at Ifbar-athrâkh","The forward trenches can be found to the south of the ruins of Zudramdân in the War of Three Peaks.\
\
You have received reports from Órug, Zhúdo, and Gárjan. You should continue on to the forward trenches and deliver Glóin's orders to Agnar Brokentooth in Ifbar-athrâkh.","Talk to Zhúdo","Ifbar-athrâkh can be found beneath the hillside to the south-east of the forward trenches.\
\
You have arrived at the forward trenches and should now seek out Agnar Brokentooth in Ifbar-athrâkh."}},
[7505]={nameES="Into the Furrows",objectivesES={"Speak with Galâmka","Into the Furrows","Told Galâmka <rgb=#00FF00>no</rgb>","Galâmka has information on the current state of Urash Dâr.","Tell Galâmka <rgb=#00FF00>no</rgb>, that you are not frightened and that you wish to help the people of Urash Dâr.","Speak with Galâmka now that he knows you are not too scared to help.","Tell Galâmka <rgb=#00FF00>no</rgb>"}},
[7506]={nameES="Into the Gladdenmere",objectivesES={"Talk to Radagast in the Gladden Fields","Varthmath and Gandalf can be found at the Beorninghús.\
\
You should talk to Varthmath and Gandalf.","Radagast can be found on the northern edge of the Gladden Fields.\
\
You should talk to Radagast in the Gladden Fields.","Travel to the Gladden Fields with Gandalf to meet with Radagast","Talk to Gandalf in the Gladden Fields","Radagast has travelled to the Woodmen village of Hultvís and seeks your assistance with strange shadows that have appeared along the River Gladden. Many Woodmen have noticed an eerie gloom near the entrance to the Gladdenmere. They came to Radagast seeking answers, and you should speak with him in Hultvís as soon as you are able.","Gandalf can be found on the northern edge of the Gladden Fields.\
\
You should talk to Gandalf in the Gladden Fields.","Varthmath can be found at the old dock in the south-east side of the Gladdenmere.\
\
You should talk to Varthmath in the Gladdenmere.","Radagast has travelled to the Woodmen village of Hultvís, seeking your assistance with strange shadows lurking in the Gladden Fields.","Radagast can be found on the northern edge of the Gladden Fields.\
\
You should travel to the Gladden Fields to meet with Radagast and Gandalf.","Radagast can be found at Hultvís.\
\
You should talk to Radagast.","Into the Gladdenmere","Talk to Radagast at Hultvís","Talk to Gandalf inside Grimbeorn's lodge","The two wizards embrace and are soon deep in conversation","Talk to Varthmath at the Beorninghús","Talk to Varthmath in the Gladdenmere"}},
[7507]={nameES="Into the Grimwood",objectivesES={}},
[7508]={nameES="Into the Hiddenhoard (Tier 1)",objectivesES={}},
[7509]={nameES="Into the Hiddenhoard (Tier 2)",objectivesES={}},
[7510]={nameES="Into the Hiddenhoard (Tier 3)",objectivesES={}},
[7511]={nameES="Into the Hiddenhoard (Tier 4)",objectivesES={}},
[7512]={nameES="Into the Hiddenhoard (Tier 5)",objectivesES={}},
[7513]={nameES="Hacia el Paso Alto",objectivesES={"Habla con Eywind en el Paso Alto","Hacia el Paso Alto","Vighar Trotasendas te habló de un grupo de tres exploradores enviados desde Rivendel que pasaron por su campamento hace unas semanas para explorar las tierras orientales de las Montañas Nubladas, a medida que ascienden hacia el Paso Alto. Estos tres —los elfos Nogmeldir y Glorwen y el enano Eywind— tienen la misión de determinar la fuerza de la Ciudad de los Trasgos, donde se rumorea que un nuevo Gran Trasgo ha tomado el trono y podría estar preparándose para la guerra contra los asentamientos a ambos lados de las Montañas Nubladas.","Encuentra a Eywind y a sus compañeros en el Paso Alto, a través del paso que se extiende más allá de Pinnath Fenui y atraviesa Cirith Daur hacia el este."}},
[7514]={nameES="Into the Ironfold",objectivesES={"Investigated the Dwarves of Járnfast","You should meet Spall the Lore-master in the Ironfold, which lies down the road that leads from the south-eastern gates of Dale.","Thorin stands before his throne in the court of Erebor.\
\
You should hear King Thorin's Stonehelm reply.","Talk to Spall","Investigated Utterby","Into the Ironfold","Investigate the Dwarves of Járnfast","You should talk to Spall the Lore-master.","Spall can be found before Thorin's throne in the court of Erebor.\
\
You should hear Spall's reply to King Thorin Stonehelm.","Talk to Lord Náin again","Investigate Skald's Drop","You should talk to Lord Náin again, at his seat in Járnfast in the Iron Hills.","Skald's Drop lies along the southern edge of the Ironfold, Utterby right in the middle, and Járnfast at its eastern edge.\
\
You should investigate the rumours about the Iron Hills near the stair at Skald's Drop, in the Dalish town of Utterby, and at the keep of Járnfast where Lord Náin dwells.\
\
If you get separated from Spall, use the horn to call him back.","Talk to King Thorin","Meet Spall in the Ironfold","King Thorin has charged Spall with visiting the Iron Hills to determine whether any of the rumours in his court are the least bit true.","Investigate Járnfast's foundations","Investigate Utterby","Skald's Drop investigated","Use this to call Spall back to you","Spall returns to your side, looking somewhat disoriented"}},
[7515]={nameES="Into the Ironfold: Dwarves of Járnfast",objectivesES={"Now that you have talked to many dwarves in Járnfast, you should talk once more to Spall.","Into the Ironfold: Dwarves of Járnfast","The Dwarves of Járnfast will be able to confirm or deny the remaining rumours about the Iron Hills.","You should talk to the Dwarves of Járnfast, including Lord Náin.","Talk to Spall"}},
[7516]={nameES="Into the Ironfold: Foundations of Járnfast",objectivesES={"You should talk to Spall about the foundations of Járnfast.","Now that you have inspected a great number of the cracks apparent in Járnfast's stonework, you should talk to Spall.","Investigate the rumours about the structural integrity of Járnfast.","Into the Ironfold: Foundations of Járnfast","You should examine cracks in the stonework of Járnfast, both inside and out.","Talk to Spall","Investigate the foundations of Járnfast"}},
[7517]={nameES="Into the Ironfold: Skald's Drop",objectivesES={"Into the Ironfold: Skald's Drop","You should return the axe to the strange dwarves at their camp-site near Skald's Drop. You should also ask them why the axe was tied to an ox.","You should view the Stair in the cliff's edge, at Skald's Drop in the Ironfold.","Talk to Okuz","Talk to Spall","Find the axe","The possessions are scattered near to Skald's Drop in the Ironfold.\
\
You should help the strange dwarves gather their scattered possessions, including small sacks, big parcels, and water-skins.","You should talk to Spall about the rumours regarding Skald's Drop.","You should talk to Spall, now that you have seen the Stair at Skald's Drop.","Bring the axe to Okuz and Túmo","Strange-looking dwarves stand around the camp-fire.","You should talk to Spall and hear his thoughts on what you have found in the Ironfold.","You should hear what Spall has to say in response to Okuz's claims.","Return to Okuz and Túmo","Okuz and Túmo stand by their camp-fire, near Skald's Drop in the Ironfold.\
\
Hear Okuz's answer to Spall's charge.","You should talk to the strange dwarves you found at a camp-fire near to Skald's Drop in the Ironfold.","Found an... ox?","Investigate Skald's Drop","Find the Stair","You should bring the belongings you gathered to Okuz and Túmo at their camp, near Skald's Drop.","You should look for a camp-fire inland near Skald's Drop, and see if there are any of the rumoured travellers there.","Investigate the rumours about Skald's Drop and the Stair with Spall.","Found the Stair","You should search for Okuz and Túmo's axe, which they say 'ran' off away from their camp near Skald's Drop, toward the river.","Investigate the small camp","Talk to the strange dwarves"}},
[7518]={nameES="Into the Ironfold: Utterby",objectivesES={"Find signs of what happened","Investigate the rumours about the Dalish town of Utterby.","You should scout Utterby with Spall, making sure to get a view of the south and east gates, and looking out for signs of who controls the town now and how that came to pass.","Now that you have scouted the perimeter of Utterby, you should talk to Spall.","Investigate Utterby","Learn who controls Utterby now","View Utterby's east gate","View Utterby's south gate","Talk to Spall","Into the Ironfold: Utterby","You should talk to Spall about investigating the rumours regarding Utterby."}},
[7519]={nameES="Into the Jaws",objectivesES={"You have entered Esh Mêkag via the escapees' secret route.\
\
You should talk to Ishûri in Esh Mêkag.\
\
If you need to re-enter Esh Mêkag, talk to Ishûri in Dur Nâgu.","Find Ebuzâm","Free Shakûl","You must help some prisoners escape Esh Mêkag before Ebuzâm will leave.\
\
You should rescue Ebuzâm's children, Enûtu and Shakûl, as well as the Aradûni soldiers and the kidnapped Beltáni.\
\
If you need to re-enter Esh Mêkag, talk to Ishûri in Dur Nâgu.","You have successfully rescued many prisoners from Esh Mêkag.\
\
You should report your success to Arâniz in Dur Nâgu.","Talk to Ishûri","You cut Ebuzâm free","Use the tunnel to return to Dur Nâgu","Enûtu is free!","Talk to Arâniz","Free the kidnapped Beltáni","Ishûri has agreed to show you the secret way into Esh Mêkag.\
\
You should talk to Ishûri when you are ready to enter Esh Mêkag.","The kidnapped Beltáni are free!","You should find Ebuzâm somewhere in the Esh Mêkag pit-mine.\
\
If you need to re-enter Esh Mêkag, talk to Ishûri in Dur Nâgu.","Shakûl is free!","Free the captive Aradûni","You have rescued who you can.\
\
You should return to Dur Nâgu using the secret tunnel.","Free Enûtu","The captive Aradûni are free!","Arâniz believes you will need the escaped thralls' help to get into Esh Mêkag.\
\
You should talk to Ishûri and mention the name 'Ebuzâm'.","You ask Ishûri if she will show you the secret way into Esh Mêkag to rescue those inside. She recoils in horror.\
\
'You want to go INSIDE? No! No, you must not! Only a few of us have ever made it out alive... and those left behind are punished! They will torture you to death if they catch you! I can't in good conscience let you go in there!'\
\
You say you can rescue Ebuzâm if she shows you the way inside. She seems shocked that you know the name.\
\
'Ebuzâm? I... we owe him our lives. If you say you will free him, I must trust that you will.'","Arâniz believes the only way to rescue the captured soldiers is to convince the escaped thralls to help you infiltrate Esh Mêkag.","Into the Jaws","Talk to Ishûri to enter Esh Mêkag"}},
[7520]={nameES="Hacia la Larga Oscuridad",objectivesES={"Spalvi está en el Mirador de la Gran Excavación, en Moria.","Habla con Spalvi en el Mirador de la Gran Excavación","Decides mantener los ojos bien abiertos por si ves a Bingo mientras ayudas a Ketill","Spalvi ha accedido a reunirse contigo en la entrada al reino de los enanos de Moria, una vez que la Guarnición de Hierro haya abierto las Puertas de Durin, en la Puerta de Acebeda.","Decides regresar con Spalvi en el Mirador de la Gran Excavación y ver qué ha averiguado","Completa 'Volumen II, Libro 1: Los Muros de Moria' hablando con Ráthwald, cerca de Echad Dúnann y completando su cadena de misiones","Spalvi Corazonrecio está en el Umbral de Durin, justo en la entrada occidental a Moria.\
\
Spalvi ha decidido que seguir a la Guarnición de Hierro dentro de Moria es tu mejor esperanza de encontrar a Bingo Boffin.","Ketill el Cartógrafo se encuentra en la cornisa más alta, en medio de la biblioteca de Katûb-zahar, al noreste del Mirador de la Gran Excavación","Spalvi Corazonrecio ha decidido que no hay otra manera, y si deseas encontrar a Bingo de nuevo, tendrás que seguir a la Guarnición de Hierro dentro de Moria.","Hacia la Larga Oscuridad","Habla con Ketill el Cartógrafo en lo alto de Katûb-zahar","Ketill el Cartógrafo está en el Mirador de la Gran Excavación, situado en Moria.\
\
Spalvi ha oído que un enano de la Guarnición de Hierro llamado Ketill está haciendo mapas de Khazad-dûm y podría ayudarte a encontrar a Bingo.","Habla con Spalvi en el Umbral de Durin, en la Gran Excavación de Moria","Derrota enemigos en Katûb-zahar hasta que Ketill termine de trabajar en su mapa","Ketill el Cartógrafo se encuentra encaramado en un muro en lo alto de Gazatmur, al este del Mirador de la Gran Excavación.","Ketill el Cartógrafo te ha pedido que combatas enemigos en Katûb-zahar, al noreste del Mirador de la Gran Excavación, hasta que haya terminado su trabajo.","Ketill el Cartógrafo te ha pedido que derrotes enemigos en Gazatmur, al este del Mirador de la Gran Excavación, hasta que termine su trabajo.","Habla con Ketill el Cartógrafo en lo alto de Gazatmur, al este del Mirador de la Gran Excavación","Derrota enemigos en Gazatmur hasta que Ketill termine de trabajar en su mapa.","Habla con Ketill el Cartógrafo en el Mirador de la Gran Excavación"}},
[7521]={nameES="Into the Marsh",objectivesES={"Thane Sparhafoc is in the Mead Hall, in the eastern part of Fenmarch.\
\
Guthláf asked you to inform his father, Thane Sparhafoc, about the troubles at the lumber-yard.","Talk to Thane Sparhafoc","Into the Marsh","Travel to Fenmarch","Thane Sparhafoc is at Fenmarch, east of the lumber-yard.\
\
Guthláf stayed behind to assist in the cleaning efforts at the lumber yard, but asked to have a message relayed to his father, Thane Sparhafoc.","The lumber-yard has been saved, but the Orc-problem remains a growing concern."}},
[7522]={nameES="Into the Mâkhda Khorbo -- Tier 1",objectivesES={}},
[7523]={nameES="Into the Mâkhda Khorbo -- Tier 2",objectivesES={}},
[7524]={nameES="Into the Mâkhda Khorbo -- Tier 3",objectivesES={}},
[7525]={nameES="Into the Mâkhda Khorbo -- Tier 4",objectivesES={}},
[7526]={nameES="Into the Mâkhda Khorbo -- Tier 5",objectivesES={}},
[7527]={nameES="Into the Pit of Abomination",objectivesES={}},
[7528]={nameES="Into the Quelling-house",objectivesES={"Meet Mêshaget at the entrance to Lâkindar","Complete Instance: Into the Quelling-house","Châmelek Gêta is at once furious with you both but also awestruck at having the journal of Semayâti the Unyielding handed to her. She demands Mêshaget explain what this is about. You should talk to Mêshaget.","Mêshaget promised to explain what is going on when you meet at the top of the great staircase at Lâkindar's entrance. Lâkindar is located far to the south of Jiret-menêsh in An Shêru.","Talk to Mêshaget","Following a confrontation with Sâdikiz the Sky-hungry and his Ordâkhai allies, you have helped an injured Mêshaget return to Jiret-menêsh where you were both immediately brought before an angry Châmelek Gêta.","Find the entrance to the tomb of Semayâti the Unyielding","Talk to Mêshaget outside of Lâkindar","Unsurprisingly, the Dead here are not at rest","Mêshaget has pleaded his case with Châmelek Gêta as well as he could, asking only that she take the time to review the journal and consider the option of making alliances and fortifying the city. You should talk to Châmelek Gêta to hear her response.","You have cleared a path in the Quelling-house and have yet to see Mêshaget. You should search for the tomb of Semayâti the Unyielding.","You have travelled to Lâkindar and found Mêshaget waiting for you. You should talk to him.","Into the Quelling-house","Mêshaget wants to ensure neither of you were followed here. You should enter the Quelling-house and assess the situation.","Disturbed by something in Sâdikiz's letter, Mêshaget has decided that he must enter Lâkindar, the Quelling-house, and he has asked you to accompany him.","As you approached what you thought was the entrance to the tomb of Semayâti the Unyielding, you heard a frightened scream from inside. It must be Mêshaget! You should enter the tomb and help him.","Enter the Quelling-house","The dead have awoken and are roaming the halls of Lâkindar. You should defeat some of the wights to clear the way for Mêshaget.","This looks like the tomb entrance","Talk to Châmelek Gêta","Châmelek Gêta agreed to examine the plans in the journal and discuss the situation with Mêshaget after she has done so. You should talk to Mêshaget inside the Gêta's hall.","Instance: Into the Quelling-house completed"}},
[7529]={nameES="En el Ram Dúath",objectivesES={"Arohir ha oído que los buenos hijos de la tierra de Ram Dúath están acosados por enemigos de Angmar, y te ha enviado a investigar.","En el Ram Dúath","El señor de los hijos de la tierra está en su aldea en el lado oeste de Ram Dúath.\
\
Arohir te ha enviado con los hijos de la tierra de Ram Dúath para ofrecer ayuda contra las fuerzas de Angmar que los acosan."}},
[7530]={nameES="Al interior de la Falla",objectivesES={"Glorfindel está cerca del Bruinen en Rivendel.\
\
Faimir sugiere que hables con Glorfindel y descubras qué es lo que le preocupa.","Glorfindel está preocupado por los eventos recientes y el recuerdo de un mal mayor en Angmar.","Iorelen se encuentra en el campamento de Iorelen, lejos al noreste en Angmar.\
\
Glorfindel te pidió que buscaras a Iorelen y averiguar si todavía vive.","Al interior de la Falla"}},
[7531]={nameES="Hacia la oscuridad salvaje",objectivesES={"Habla con Gelirwen en el Refugio Sombrío","Gelirwen se encuentra en el Refugio Sombrío.\
\
Has completado todas las tareas que te encargaron Moggi, Ymar, Glorelloth y Pentlenn, y debes volver con Gelirwen para darle la noticia.","Recupera las runas de las Excavaciones Tenebrosas para Pentlenn","Descubre el secreto de las Excavaciones Tenebrosas para Glorelloth","Ayuda a Moggi a eliminar a las criaturas terribles que habitan en la oscuridad de las Excavaciones Tenebrosas","Ayuda a Ymar a expulsar a los gusanos luminiscentes de las Excavaciones Tenebrosas","En las profundidades más oscuras de Moria, hay un lugar donde la única luz que brillaba provenía de las lámparas de enanos y hongos luminiscentes. Ahora estos túneles son más tenues que nunca y hogar de criaturas que existen solo en pesadillas. Sin embargo, ahí están, y los agentes de Veúlfur enviados al Refugio Sombrío encuentran poco consuelo al saber que hay algo en las Excavaciones Tenebrosas que ordena a los orcos a envenenarse de una manera que los entrega a una voluntad superior.","Completa la misión que te han encargado Ymar, Moggi, Pentlenn y Glorelloth en los alrededores de las Excavaciones Tenebrosas y luego regresa con Gelirwen.\
\
Gelirwen desea saber qué secretos pueden ofrecer las salas más oscuras de Moria a la expedición al Refugio Sombrío.","Hacia la oscuridad salvaje"}},
[7532]={nameES="Into the Spider's Den",objectivesES={"Talk to Felgúr","Celeborn can be found outside Torech Ungol.\
\
You should talk to Celeborn.","Celeborn and Legolas are outside Torech Ungol, at the top of the Winding Stair.\
\
You should talk to Celeborn and Legolas.","The time has come to enter Torech Ungol, confront Rûkhor the Pale Herald, and discover if Shelob yet lives.","Help Celeborn with 'Caging the Spiders'","Talk to Mablung","Celeborn has asked you to swiftly return to the rangers in Echad Taerdrim.\
\
You should return to the rangers and talk to Mablung.\
\
Speak to Legolas to return there quickly.","Into the Spider's Den","Celeborn has asked for your help containing the spiders in Torech Ungol.\
\
You should help Celeborn with 'Re-forming the Snare' and 'Caging the Spiders'.","Help Celeborn with 'Re-forming the Snare'","Felgúr has continued ahead to Torech Ungol, and is waiting at the top of the Winding Stair.\
\
You should climb the Winding Stair and find Felgúr.","Complete 'Instance: She Who Walks in the Darkness'","Felgúr has tracked his people to the top of the Winding Stair.\
\
You should talk to Felgúr, and be ready for a fight.","Habla con Celeborn","Habla con Legolas."}},
[7533]={nameES="En el Bosque Salvaje",objectivesES={"El árbol furioso se encuentra en el camino del norte del Bosque Salvaje.\
\
Habla con el árbol furioso.","Con la esperanza de reunir provisiones para reparar su pueblo devastado, los habitantes de Puente de Caballetes han abierto las puertas del Bosque Salvaje. Sin embargo, el bosque es peligroso y el camino está bloqueado.","En el Bosque Salvaje","Habla con el árbol furioso"}},
[7534]={nameES="En el bosque",objectivesES={"Walt Rosablanca está acampado en las ruinas en el extremo occidental del lago conocido como Nen Harn.\
\
Gil Hojarena te pidió que hablaras con Walt Rosablanca sobre la extraña cosa que vio al norte del bosque de Chet.","En el bosque","Los bosques de las Tierras de Bree pueden ser oscuros y misteriosos. Algunos lugares son más oscuros que otros....","Habla con Walt Rosablanca en Nen Harn"}},
[7535]={nameES="En el bosque",objectivesES={"Looks like Corsairs got to the workers first","Haelam is short-handed and could use some help tracking down his workers up in the woods.","The workers can be found in the forest south of Tadrent, in the foothills of the Emyn Ernil, above the beacon Nendath.\
\
You should find the workers there and help them finish their task.","Bring the wood back to Haelam in Tadrent","Examine one of the bodies","The workbench is located near Haelam in Tadrent.\
\
Use the workbench to build crates for Haelam.","Haelam is located in the village of Tadrent.\
\
Speak with Haelam.","Search for the missing workers","The workers' camp-site can be found in the forest south of Tadrent, in the foothills of the Emyn Ernil, above the beacon Nendath.\
\
You should examine a body and collect wood for Haelam.","Haelam is located in the village of Tadrent.\
\
Bring the wood back to Haelam in the village of Tadrent.","This is indeed one of Haelam's workers","Speak with Haelam","En el bosque"}},
[7536]={nameES="Intrepid Hope",objectivesES={"You have found Shúkurz and Phocas outside Kafagur, near the northern side.\
\
You should talk to Phocas.","The trail continues north out of Kafagur","Follow the trail of footprints out of Kafagur","Shúkurz has abandoned all caution to try and reason with a strange Man.","Shúkurz has left behind a trail of footprints leading out of the northern side of Kafagur.\
\
You should follow it.","Talk to Shúkurz","Intrepid Hope","Talk to Phocas","Shúkurz has asked you to talk to him back in Kafagur.","You have found Shúkurz and Phocas outside Kafagur, near the northern side.\
\
You should talk to Shúkurz.","Upon noticing you, Phocas looks down in shame","Talk to Shúkurz in Kafagur"}},
[7537]={nameES="Introducción: La Carga de un Capitán",objectivesES={"Usa <rgb=#00ff00>Golpe devastador</rgb> sobre el muñeco de entrenamiento cercano. \
\
PISTA:\
\
Los Capitanes dependen de su <rgb=#00ff00>Grito de Batalla</rgb> para entrar en un <rgb=#ffff00>Estado de Preparación para la Batalla</rgb>. Mientras estén en este estado, los Capitanes pueden usar habilidades especiales como <rgb=#00ff00>Golpe devastador</rgb>, un ataque efectivo que inflige gran daño. Ataca al <rgb=#ff0000>Muñeco de Entrenamiento</rgb> con tu <rgb=#00FF00>Grito de Batalla</rgb> para ponerte en <rgb=#ffff00>Estado de Preparación para la Batalla</rgb> y luego ataca al muñeco con tu <rgb=#00ff00>Golpe devastador</rgb>.","El Instructor de Capitanes se encuentra en los campos de entrenamiento de Archet, muy cerca de la puerta.\
\
Ahora que has usado con éxito tu habilidad recién aprendida, deberías regresar con tu instructor y contarle tu éxito.","Has usado con éxito Golpe Devastador","Usa tu <rgb=#00ff00>Grito de Batalla</rgb> sobre el muñeco de entrenamiento y luego golpéalo con tu habilidad <rgb=#00ff00>Golpe devastador</rgb>","Habla con el Instructor de Capitanes en Archet","Introducción: La Carga de un Capitán"}},
[7538]={nameES="Introducción: El Barrido de Escudo del Guardián",objectivesES={"Habla con el entrenador de Guardián en Edhelion","Golpea el muñeco de entrenamiento con Barrido de Escudo","Has golpeado el muñeco de entrenamiento con Barrido de Escudo","Habla de nuevo con el entrenador y aprende la habilidad <rgb=#00ff00>Barrido de Escudo</rgb>. Usa tu nueva habilidad en el muñeco de entrenamiento cercano.\
\
<rgb=#00ff00>NOTA: Usa el entrenador y selecciona Entrenar habilidades de Guardián para abrir el panel de selección de habilidades. Haz clic izquierdo en una habilidad para resaltarla y luego haz clic en el botón Entrenar en la parte inferior del panel de selección de habilidades, o haz doble clic en la habilidad, y comprarás la habilidad con éxito.</rgb>\
\
CONSEJO:\
\
Los Guardianes dependen de <rgb=#ffff00>Habilidades Reactivas</rgb> para causar daño y generar <rgb=#ff0000>Amenaza</rgb> contra sus enemigos. <rgb=#00ff00>Barrido de Escudo</rgb> requiere que el Guardián <rgb=#ffff00>Bloquee</rgb> un ataque enemigo antes de poder usar la habilidad. Dirígete a los <rgb=#ff0000>Muñecos de Entrenamiento</rgb> al norte del entrenador y atácalos hasta que bloquees uno de sus ataques. Si tienes problemas para bloquear, prueba usar <rgb=#00ff00>Resguardo del guardián</rgb> para aumentar tus posibilidades de bloquear ataques enemigos. Una vez que hayas bloqueado un ataque podrás usar tu habilidad <rgb=#00ff00>Barrido de Escudo</rgb>. Golpea el <rgb=#ff0000>Muñeco de Objetivo</rgb> con <rgb=#00ff00>Barrido de Escudo</rgb>.","Introducción: El Barrido de Escudo del Guardián","Ahora que has usado con éxito tu nueva habilidad, regresa con tu entrenador y cuéntale tu éxito.","Habla con Dorongúr Espinablanca en Edhelion."}},
[7539]={nameES="Introducción: El Barrido de Escudo del Guardián",objectivesES={"Tu entrenador quiere que uses tus nuevas habilidades para demostrar que puedes enfrentarte a los muchos peligros que existen en el mundo.","Golpea el muñeco de entrenamiento con Barrido de Escudo","Habla con el mentor de guardianes en el Patio de Frerin","Has golpeado el muñeco de entrenamiento con Barrido de Escudo","Introducción: El Barrido de Escudo del Guardián","El entrenador de guardianes está en el Patio de Frerin.\
\
Ahora que has usado con éxito tu habilidad recién aprendida, deberías regresar con tu entrenador y contarle tu éxito.","Deberías hablar con el entrenador de nuevo y aprender la habilidad <rgb=#00ff00>Golpe de escudo</rgb>. Usa tu nueva habilidad en el maniquí de entrenamiento cercano.\
\
<rgb=#00ff00>NOTA: Usa al entrenador y selecciona 'Entrenar habilidades de Guardián' para abrir el panel de selección de habilidades. Haz clic izquierdo en una habilidad para resaltarla y luego haz clic izquierdo en el botón 'Entrenar' en la parte inferior del panel de selección de habilidades -- o haz doble clic en la habilidad -- y comprarás la habilidad con éxito.</rgb>\
\
PISTA:\
\
Los guardianes dependen de las <rgb=#ffff00>Habilidades Reactivas</rgb> para infligir daño y generar <rgb=#ff0000>Amenaza</rgb> contra sus enemigos. <rgb=#00ff00>Golpe de escudo</rgb> requiere que el guardián <rgb=#ffff00>Bloquee</rgb> un ataque enemigo entrante antes de poder usar la habilidad. Dirígete a los <rgb=#ff0000>Maniquíes de Entrenamiento</rgb> al norte del entrenador y atácales hasta que bloquees con éxito uno de sus ataques. Si tienes problemas para lograr un bloqueo, intenta usar <rgb=#00ff00>Resguardo del guardián</rgb> para aumentar tus posibilidades de bloquear ataques enemigos. Una vez que hayas bloqueado un ataque podrás usar tu habilidad <rgb=#00ff00>Golpe de escudo</rgb>. Golpea el <rgb=#ff0000>Maniquí de Objetivo</rgb> con <rgb=#00ff00>Golpe de escudo</rgb>."}},
[7540]={nameES="Introducción: El Disparo perforante del Cazador",objectivesES={"Introducción: El Disparo perforante del Cazador","Golpea el muñeco de entrenamiento con Disparo perforante","Ahora que has usado con éxito tu nueva habilidad, regresa con tu entrenador y cuéntale tu éxito.","Has golpeado el muñeco de entrenamiento con Disparo perforante","Habla con el entrenador de cazadores en Edhelion","Habla de nuevo con el entrenador y aprende la habilidad <rgb=#00ff00>Disparo perforante</rgb>. Usa tu nueva habilidad en el muñeco de entrenamiento cercano.\
\
<rgb=#00ff00>NOTA: Usa el entrenador y selecciona Entrenar habilidades de cazador para abrir el panel de selección de habilidades. Haz clic izquierdo en una habilidad para resaltarla y luego haz clic en el botón Entrenar en la parte inferior del panel de selección de habilidades, o haz doble clic en la habilidad, y comprarás la habilidad con éxito.</rgb>\
\
CONSEJO:\
\
(Los cazadores necesitan <rgb=#ffff00>Concentración</rgb> para usar algunos de sus disparos especiales, y <rgb=#00ff00>Disparo perforante</rgb> es una de esas habilidades. Usa tu habilidad <rgb=#00ff00>Disparo Rápido</rgb> hasta tener <rgb=#ffff00>3 puntos de Concentración</rgb>, luego usa <rgb=#00ff00>Disparo perforante</rgb>.","Habla con Dorongúr Espinablanca en Edhelion."}},
[7541]={nameES="Introducción: El Disparo perforante del Cazador",objectivesES={"Habla con el entrenador de cazadores en el Patio de Frerin","Debes hablar nuevamente con el entrenador y aprender la habilidad <rgb=#00ff00>Disparo perforante</rgb>. Usa tu nueva habilidad en el muñeco de entrenamiento cercano.\
\
<rgb=#00ff00>NOTA: Usa al entrenador y selecciona Entrenar habilidades de Cazador para abrir el panel de selección de habilidades. Haz clic izquierdo en una habilidad para resaltarla y luego haz clic izquierdo en el botón Entrenar en la parte inferior del panel — o haz doble clic en la habilidad — y la aprenderás correctamente.\
\
PISTA:\
\
Los Cazadores necesitan <rgb=#ffff00>Concentración</rgb> para usar algunos de sus disparos especiales, y <rgb=#00ff00>Disparo perforante</rgb> es una de esas habilidades. Usa tu habilidad <rgb=#00ff00>Disparo Rápido</rgb> hasta que tengas <rgb=#ffff00>3 puntos de Concentración</rgb>, y luego usa <rgb=#00ff00>Disparo perforante</rgb>.","Introducción: El Disparo perforante del Cazador","Golpea el muñeco de entrenamiento con Disparo perforante","Has golpeado el muñeco de entrenamiento con Disparo perforante","El entrenador de cazadores está en el Patio de Frerin.\
\
Ahora que has usado con éxito tu nueva habilidad, regresa con tu entrenador y cuéntale tu éxito."}},
[7542]={nameES="Introducción: El Compañero del Sabio",objectivesES={"Introducción: El Compañero del Sabio","Has dañado el muñeco de entrenamiento con Brasas ardientes.","Golpea el muñeco de entrenamiento con Brasas ardientes.","Debes hablar de nuevo con el entrenador y aprender la habilidad <rgb=#00ff00>Brasas ardientes</rgb>. Usa tu nueva habilidad en el muñeco de entrenamiento cercano.\
\
<rgb=#00ff00>NOTA: Usa el entrenador y selecciona Entrenar habilidades de Sabio para abrir el panel de selección de habilidades. Haz clic izquierdo en una habilidad para resaltarla y luego haz clic en el botón Entrenar en la parte inferior del panel de selección de habilidades, o haz doble clic en la habilidad, y comprarás la habilidad con éxito.</rgb>","Habla con el entrenador de Sabios en Edhelion","Ahora que has usado con éxito tu nueva habilidad, regresa con tu entrenador y cuéntale tu éxito.","Habla con Dorongúr Espinablanca en Edhelion."}},
[7543]={nameES="Introducción: El Compañero del Sabio",objectivesES={"Golpea el maniquí de entrenamiento con Brasas ardientes","Habla con el entrenador de la clase Sabio en Archet","Usa la habilidad <rgb=#00ff00>Brasas ardientes</rgb> en el muñeco de entrenamiento cercano.","Introducción: El Compañero del Sabio","Has golpeado el maniquí de entrenamiento con Brasas ardientes.","El entrenador de la clase Sabio está en Archet, al oeste del campo de entrenamiento.\
\
Ahora que has usado con éxito tu habilidad recién aprendida, deberías regresar con tu entrenador y contarle tu éxito."}},
[7544]={nameES="Intro: La balada de la rapidez del juglar",objectivesES={"Debes hablar de nuevo con el entrenador y aprender la habilidad <rgb=#00ff00>Balada Mayor</rgb>. Usa tu nueva habilidad en el muñeco de entrenamiento cercano.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Usa al entrenador y selecciona 'Entrenar habilidades de juglar' para abrir el panel de selección de habilidades. Haz clic izquierdo en una habilidad para resaltarla y luego haz clic izquierdo en el botón Entrenar en la parte inferior del panel -- o haz doble clic en la habilidad -- y así comprarás la habilidad.</rgb>\
\
PISTA:\
\
Los juglares usan <rgb=#ffff00>Baladas</rgb> para atacar a sus enemigos y potenciarse a sí mismos. Estas habilidades funcionan mediante un sistema rotatorio que permite al juglar tener tres mejoras especiales activas al mismo tiempo. Tras aplicarse la tercera mejora, la siguiente <rgb=#ffff00>Balada</rgb> que se reproduzca sobrescribirá a la primera, luego a la segunda, y así sucesivamente.","El mentor de juglares está en el Patio de Frerin.\
\
Ahora que has usado con éxito tu habilidad recién aprendida, deberías regresar con tu mentor y contarle tu éxito.","Habla con el Entrenador de Juglares en el Patio de Frerin","Usa la habilidad Balada de la Rapidez en el maniquí de entrenamiento","Has golpeado el muñeco de entrenamiento con la habilidad Balada de la rapidez","Intro: La balada de la rapidez del juglar"}},
[7545]={nameES="Introducción: Las Baladas del Juglar",objectivesES={"Habla con el entrenador de Juglar en Edhelion","Introducción: Las Baladas del Juglar","Ahora que has usado con éxito tu nueva habilidad, regresa con tu entrenador y cuéntale tu éxito.","Usa la habilidad Balada Mayor en el muñeco de entrenamiento","Habla de nuevo con el entrenador y aprende la habilidad <rgb=#00ff00>Balada Mayor</rgb>. Usa tu nueva habilidad en el muñeco de entrenamiento cercano.\
\
CONSEJO:\
\
Los juglares usan <rgb=#ffff00>Baladas</rgb> para atacar a sus enemigos y fortalecerse. Estas habilidades funcionan en un sistema rotativo que permite al juglar tener tres mejoras especiales a la vez. Tras aplicar la tercera mejora, la siguiente <rgb=#ffff00>Balada</rgb> reemplazará la primera, luego la segunda y así sucesivamente.","Has usado la habilidad Balada Mayor en el muñeco de entrenamiento","Habla con Dorongúr Espinablanca en Edhelion."}},
[7546]={nameES="Intro: Una plaga en la Puerta de Thorin",objectivesES={"Dwalin espera noticias en el Patio de Frerin, al este del río donde examinaste el suelo.\
\
Deberías hablar con Dwalin en el Patio de Frerin y hacerle saber que el propio río parece estar envenenado por una putrefacción enfermiza.","Informa a Dwalin sobre el origen de la enfermedad de los enanos","Intro: Una plaga en la Puerta de Thorin","Dwalin, un fiel amigo del difunto Thorin Escudo de Roble, ha venido a afirmar una vez más el reinado de Thorin, pero muchos de los enanos de su grupo se han enfermado.","El suelo tiene un olor y una textura repugnantes en este lugar","Los enanos del grupo de Dwalin pasaron por los campos al oeste del Patio de Frerin cuando llegaron.\
\
Debes comenzar tu búsqueda siguiendo el camino hacia el oeste para ver si hay alguna evidencia del origen de la plaga que aflige a los enanos."}},
[7547]={nameES="Intro: Una petición de ayuda",objectivesES={"Lleva la carta de advertencia de Sprigley a Helecharroyo","Regresa a ver a Cal Sprigley y anúnciale la mala noticia","Ve a Combe para pedir ayuda contra la amenaza de Montebruno","Cal Sprigley está en su granja, en el extremo sur de Archet.\
\
Debes regresar con Cal e informarle que el camino hacia Combe está bloqueado en la puerta, y Archet quedará por su cuenta.","Cal Sprigley te ha pedido que reúnas la ayuda que puedas de la ciudad cercana de Combe.","Intro: Una petición de ayuda","Mientras Helecharroyo lee la carta de Cal Sprigley, su rostro queda en blanco. La lee por segunda vez y sólo entonces te mira.\
\
'He sido un tonto. ¡Oh, qué he hecho?'","El capitán Helecharroyo está dentro de las murallas de la ciudad de Archet.\
\
Debes regresar con Helecharroyo con la carta de Cal Sprigley como prueba de las intenciones de los Montebruno. Debe ser informado de que la parte sur de Archet está llena de señales de un ataque inminente.","La puerta de Combe no está lejos al oeste de la granja de Sprigley, a lo largo del camino que va al sur desde la ciudad de Archet.\
\
Debes pedir asistencia en Combe, pues allí tienen muchos soldados bien equipados debido a su proximidad al peligroso bosque de Chet."}},
[7548]={nameES="Intro: Una fuente pútrida",objectivesES={"Habla con Elrohir, el hermano de Elladan","Elrohir de Rivendel, el otro hijo de Elrond, se encuentra fuera de la entrada de una cueva en el sendero de la montaña.\
\
Deberías hablar con Elrohir sobre tu misión para Dwalin y Elladan.","Explora el flanco de la montaña para descubrir la fuente del veneno","Intro: Una fuente pútrida","Un elfo se encuentra en la cima del sendero de la montaña y se parece mucho a Elladan","Agua pútrida brota de la fuente de las Montañas Azules, por encima de la Mansión de Thorin, envenenando a todas las criaturas que tengan la mala suerte de beberla.","El sendero de la montaña está al noroeste del Patio de Frerin en Ered Luin.\
\
Debes subir el sendero de la montaña y encontrar la fuente de las aguas infectadas y repeler a cualquier guardia de la corrupción en el camino."}},
[7549]={nameES="Introducción: Las Palabras atronadoras del Maestro rúnico",objectivesES={"Has usado la habilidad Palabras atronadoras en el muñeco de entrenamiento","Ahora que has usado con éxito tu nueva habilidad, regresa con tu entrenador y cuéntale tu éxito.","Introducción: Las Palabras atronadoras del Maestro rúnico","Habla de nuevo con el entrenador y aprende la habilidad <rgb=#FF0000>Palabras atronadoras</rgb>. Usa tu nueva habilidad en el muñeco de entrenamiento cercano.\
\
<rgb=#00ff00>NOTA: Usa el entrenador y selecciona Entrenar habilidades de Maestro rúnico para abrir el panel de selección de habilidades. Haz clic izquierdo en una habilidad para resaltarla y luego haz clic en el botón Entrenar en la parte inferior del panel de selección de habilidades, o haz doble clic en la habilidad, y comprarás la habilidad con éxito.</rgb>\
\
CONSEJO:\
\
Los Maestros rúnicos requieren <rgb=#ff0000>Afinidad de Combate</rgb> para usar habilidades ofensivas y <rgb=#00ff00>Afinidad de Curación</rgb> para lanzar hechizos de curación. La <rgb=#ffff00>Afinidad</rgb> se <rgb=#ff0000>incrementa</rgb> o <rgb=#00ff00>reduce</rgb> usando habilidades similares. Las habilidades ofensivas suelen tener fondo <rgb=#ff0000>rojo</rgb> y las de curación fondo <rgb=#00ff00>verde</rgb>. Usa tus habilidades ofensivas para subir tu <rgb=#ff0000>Afinidad de Combate</rgb> a tres y luego usa <rgb=#FF0000>Palabras atronadoras</rgb>.","Usa la habilidad <rgb=#FF0000>Palabras atronadoras</rgb> en el muñeco de entrenamiento","Habla con el entrenador de Maestro rúnico en Edhelion","Habla con Dorongúr Espinablanca en Edhelion."}},
[7550]={nameES="Introducción: Las Palabras atronadoras del Maestro rúnico",objectivesES={"Habla con el instructor de maestros rúnicos en el Patio de Frerin","El entrenador de maestros rúnicos está en el Patio de Frerin.\
\
Ahora que has usado con éxito tu habilidad recién aprendida, regresa con tu entrenador y cuéntale tu éxito.","Has golpeado al muñeco de entrenamiento con la habilidad Palabras Electrizantes","Debes hablar con el entrenador de nuevo y aprender la habilidad <rgb=#FF0000>Palabras Electrizantes</rgb>. Usa tu nueva habilidad en el muñeco de entrenamiento cercano. \
\
<rgb=#00ff00>NOTA: Usa al entrenador y selecciona Entrenar habilidades de maestro rúnico para abrir el panel de selección de habilidades. Haz clic izquierdo en una habilidad para resaltarla y luego haz clic izquierdo en el botón Entrenar en la parte inferior del panel de selección de habilidades -- o haz doble clic en la habilidad -- y así conseguirás comprar la habilidad.</rgb>\
\
CONSEJO:\
\
Los maestros rúnicos requieren <rgb=#ff0000>Afinación de Combate</rgb> para usar habilidades ofensivas, y <rgb=#00ff00>Afinación de Curación</rgb> para lanzar hechizos de sanación.  <rgb=#ffff00>Afinación</rgb> se <rgb=#ff0000>aumenta</rgb> o <rgb=#00ff00>disminuye</rgb> mediante el uso de habilidades similares.  Las habilidades ofensivas típicamente tienen fondos <rgb=#ff0000>rojos</rgb>, y las de sanación suelen tener fondos <rgb=#00ff00>verdes</rgb>. Usa tus habilidades ofensivas para elevar tu <rgb=#ff0000>Afinación de Combate</rgb> a tres y luego usa tu habilidad <rgb=#00ff00>Palabras Electrizantes</rgb>.","Introducción: Las Palabras atronadoras del Maestro rúnico","Usa la habilidad <rgb=#FF0000>Palabras atronadoras</rgb> en el muñeco de entrenamiento"}},
[7551]={nameES="Intro: Una tenue esperanza",objectivesES={"Los planes de Montebruno que recogiste revelan que los bandidos, guiados por las fuerzas malignas de Angmar, planean atacar aprovechando la oscuridad cerca del Viejo Sendero del Este, que está infestado de arañas.","Este explorador bandido encontró su fin en el callejón sin salida del Viejo Sendero del Este","El Viejo Sendero del Este atraviesa la gran colina al oeste del Refugio del Cazador.\
\
Debes explorar el Viejo Sendero del Este para ver cómo puede usarse para obtener ventaja sobre los Montebruno cuando ataquen.","Jon Helecharroyo está en el Refugio del Cazador, en la esquina noreste de Archet.\
\
Debes contarle a Jon Helecharroyo sobre el callejón sin salida y el explorador de los Montebruno masacrado al final del Viejo Sendero del Este.","Regresa con la esperanzadora noticia a Jon Helecharroyo","Atli Matarañas está afuera del Refugio del Cazador.\
\
Debes hablar con Atli Matarañas y aprender lo que puedas sobre el Viejo Sendero del Este.","El Sendero del Este está lleno de peligros, pero en esos peligros yace la esperanza.","Habla con Atli Matarañas sobre el Viejo Sendero del Este","Intro: Una tenue esperanza","Comprueba si el muro sigue intacto"}},
[7552]={nameES="Intro: Escudo poderoso",objectivesES={"Has golpeado el maniquí de entrenamiento con 'Barrido de escudo'","Golpea el maniquí de entrenamiento con 'Barrido de escudo'","Usa tu habilidad <rgb=#00ff00>Barrido de escudo</rgb> en el maniquí de entrenamiento cercano.\
\
PISTA:\
\
Los guardianes dependen de las <rgb=#ffff00>habilidades reactivas</rgb> para infligir daño y generar <rgb=#ff0000>Amenaza</rgb> contra sus enemigos.  <rgb=#00ff00>Barrido de escudo</rgb> requiere que el guardián <rgb=#ffff00>bloquee</rgb> un ataque enemigo entrante antes de poder usar la habilidad.  Dirígete a los <rgb=#ff0000>maniquíes de entrenamiento</rgb> al norte y ataca uno hasta que logres bloquear uno de sus ataques.  Si tienes problemas para bloquear, prueba usar <rgb=#00ff00>Resguardo del guardián</rgb> para aumentar tus probabilidades de bloquear los ataques enemigos.  Una vez que hayas bloqueado un ataque, podrás usar tu habilidad <rgb=#00ff00>Barrido de escudo</rgb>.  Golpea el <rgb=#ff0000>maniquí de entrenamiento</rgb> con <rgb=#00ff00>Barrido de escudo</rgb>.","Habla con la entrenadora de guardianes en Archet","La entrenadora de guardianes está en el campo de entrenamiento de Archet.\
\
Ahora que has usado con éxito tu habilidad recién aprendida, deberías regresar con tu entrenadora y contarle tu éxito.","Intro: Escudo poderoso"}},
[7553]={nameES="Intro: Una voz poderosa",objectivesES={"Usa Balada Mayor mientras estés en combate con el muñeco de entrenamiento","Has usado Balada mayor mientras estabas en combate con el maniquí de entrenamiento","Habla con el entrenador de juglares en Archet","PISTA:\
\
Los juglares usan <rgb=#ffff00>Baladas</rgb> para atacar a sus enemigos, sanar ligeramente a sus compañeros y potenciarse a sí mismos. Estas habilidades funcionan con un sistema de rotación que permite al juglar tener tres mejoras especiales sobre sí en todo momento. Después de aplicarse la tercera mejora, la siguiente <rgb=#ffff00>Balada</rgb> que se reproduzca sobrescribirá la primera, luego la segunda, y así sucesivamente.","El entrenador de juglares está en Archet, al oeste del terreno de entrenamiento.\
\
Ahora que has usado con éxito tu habilidad recién aprendida, deberías volver con tu entrenador y contarle tu éxito.","Intro: Una voz poderosa"}},
[7554]={nameES="Introducción: El Golpe Hábil del Vigilante",objectivesES={"Usa la habilidad Golpe Hábil en un muñeco de entrenamiento","Habla con el entrenador de Vigilante en Edhelion","Introducción: El Golpe Hábil del Vigilante","Habla de nuevo con el entrenador y aprende la habilidad <rgb=#00ff00>Golpe Hábil</rgb>. Usa tu nueva habilidad en el muñeco de entrenamiento cercano.\
\
<rgb=#00ff00>NOTA: Usa el entrenador y selecciona Entrenar habilidades de Vigilante para abrir el panel de selección de habilidades. Haz clic izquierdo en una habilidad para resaltarla y luego haz clic en el botón Entrenar en la parte inferior del panel de selección de habilidades, o haz doble clic en la habilidad, y comprarás la habilidad con éxito.</rgb>\
\
CONSEJO:\
\
Los Vigilantes usan combinaciones de sus habilidades básicas como <rgb=#00ff00>Estocada Rápida</rgb> y <rgb=#00ff00>Embestida  con escudo</rgb> para crear ataques <rgb=#ffff00>Gambito</rgb> más poderosos. Para usar tu habilidad <rgb=#00ff00>Golpe Hábil</rgb>, ataca un <rgb=#ff0000>Muñeco de Entrenamiento</rgb> dos veces con <rgb=#00ff00>Estocada Rápida</rgb>. Esto hará que tu habilidad <rgb=#00ff00>Gambito Predeterminado</rgb> cambie a <rgb=#00ff00>Golpe Hábil</rgb>. Usa <rgb=#00ff00>Golpe Hábil</rgb> para golpear el <rgb=#ff0000>Muñeco de Entrenamiento</rgb>.","Has usado la habilidad Golpe Hábil en el muñeco de entrenamiento","Ahora que has usado con éxito tu nueva habilidad, regresa con tu entrenador y cuéntale tu éxito.","Habla con Dorongúr Espinablanca en Edhelion."}},
[7555]={nameES="Intro: Allegiance and Blessing",objectivesES={"Spoke with the Tarkrîp emissary","Spoke with the Shelob's Brood emissary","Malavin instructed you to speak to each of the emissaries representing the clans of Carn Dûm and beyond. They have blessings that they will seek to bestow upon you, provided you will serve in their name.","Spoke with the Scara-pack emissary","Spoke with the White Hand emissary","Speak with the emissaries","The War-tyrant seems displeased that emissaries from Carn Dûm arrived and made their way into the war tent. His demeanor is more grim than usual, and he has instructed you to make your way to the Angmarim sorceress who now resides in the tent within the confines of Gramsfoot.","Spoke with the Blogmal emissary","Spoke with the Ongbúrz emissary","You have spoken with Malavin","War-tyrant Akúlhun directed you to the war tent to speak with an Angmarim sorceress there named Malavin. Apparently she is here to assist, inspect, or guide the war effort. Whatever her purpose, it does not sit well with the War-tyrant.","Spoke with the Krahjarn emissary","Intro: Allegiance and Blessing","Having spoken to all the emissaries it is time to return to Malavin for further instruction."}},
[7556]={nameES="Introducción: El pedido de Amdir",objectivesES={"Después de rescatarte de los bandidos de los Montebruno y de un misterioso Jinete Negro, el Montaraz Amdir te llevó al pueblo de Archet, en el bosque de Chet, al este de Bree. La ciudad, bajo amenaza de ataque, se prepara para defenderse de los Montebruno.","Introducción: El pedido de Amdir","Amdir puede encontrarse descansando en el suelo cerca del centro de Archet, afuera de la Posada del Tejón Loco.\
\
El Montaraz Amdir ha hecho saber que desea hablar contigo."}},
[7557]={nameES="Introducción: Un Mal Presentimiento",objectivesES={"Habla con Dwalin y cuéntale sobre los planes de Gormr para el ritual.","Introducción: Un Mal Presentimiento","Las palabras y sugerencias de Gormr no te han traído más que inquietud, y hay una tensión en el aire. Es hora de buscar a Dwalin y ver si los Elfos y los barbiluengos pueden unirse en sus propósitos.","Dwalin se encuentra en el Patio de Frerin, en el mismo centro de la zona de la Puerta de Thorin.\
\
Ahora sería un buen momento para consultar con Dwalin sobre el extraño comportamiento de Gormr y sus siniestros indicios."}},
[7558]={nameES="Intro: Estanque Contaminado",objectivesES={"Habla con Dorollas en Edhelion","Dorollas está al oeste de la poza en Edhelion, cerca de Elladan.\
\
Deberías volver con Dorollas y decirle que has purgado con éxito las viles babosas de la poza.","Intro: Estanque Contaminado","Desde el abandono de Edhelion, terribles criaturas de naturaleza antinatural han encontrado su camino dentro de los muros. En un estanque de aguas tibias ha establecido su morada una criatura inmunda, y los Elfos, empeñados en restaurar el refugio de Edhelion, piden tu ayuda para eliminar esas vilezas del estanque.","Babosas infestan una poza dentro de las murallas de Edhelion, al este de Dorollas.\
\
Dorollas te ha encargado limpiar las babosas de Edhelion para que pueda comenzar la restauración en lo que alguna vez fue el hermoso refugio de los Elfos."}},
[7559]={nameES="Introducción: El Capitán Helecharroyo",objectivesES={"Jon Helecharroyo, hijo del capitán que organizó la guarnición de Archet, temía la presencia de un traidor entre las filas. El montaraz Amdir confirmó las sospechas de Jon en el campamento de los Montebruno.","El Capitán Helecharroyo dirige la guarnición desde la Posada del Tejón Loco, al sur de Amdir.\
\
Amdir teme que el Capitán Helecharroyo no escuche sus noticias sobre el traidor Calder Cob, pero espera que si la noticia viene de ti, sí lo haga.","Amdir descansa junto al edificio al norte de la Posada del Tejón Loco.\
\
El Capitán Helecharroyo no quiso escuchar lo que tenías que decir sobre Calder Cob. En cambio, te dijo que le digas a Amdir que se mantenga al margen de los problemas de Archet, y te sugirió que ayudes a las granjas locales a defenderse de los lobos.","Introducción: El Capitán Helecharroyo"}},
[7560]={nameES="Introducción: El Capitán Helecharroyo",objectivesES={"El condestable Cardoso cree que Archet está fuera de peligro","Kate Henseed cree que Archet está fuera de peligro","Trancos está en la localidad de Archet, esperando noticias.\
\
Debes hablar con Trancos y contarle la locura del capitán Helecharroyo.","Los habitantes de Archet están reunidos por la ciudad; la presencia de Montaraces visitantes atrajo su atención.\
\
Debes hablar con los habitantes para ver si alguno más está de tu lado y no del de Helecharroyo.","Peg Pruner cree que Archet está fuera de peligro","Dile a Trancos que la gente de Archet no te cree","Habla con el condestable Cardoso para ver si cree tu advertencia","Habla con Peg Pruner para ver si cree tu advertencia","Habla con el capitán Helecharroyo en Archet","Introducción: El Capitán Helecharroyo","El capitán Helecharroyo no cree que los Montebruno sean una amenaza","El capitán Helecharroyo está en la localidad de Archet, cerca de la Posada del Tejón Loco.\
\
Debes hablar con el capitán Helecharroyo en nombre de Trancos e intentar convencerlo de que haga caso de la amenaza de los bandidos Montebruno.","Trancos descansará tranquilo si Archet se entera de la amenaza inminente de los Montebruno, pero el líder de la guarnición de la ciudad, el capitán Helecharroyo, desconfía de los montaraces de aspecto peligroso. Simplemente no hará caso a la advertencia de Trancos.","Habla con Kate Henseed para ver si cree tu advertencia"}},
[7561]={nameES="Introducción: Desarmando a la Competencia",objectivesES={"Habla con el Instructor de Saqueadores en Archet","Golpea al muñeco de entrenamiento con Golpe Sorpresivo","Introducción: Desarmando a la Competencia","El Instructor de Saqueadores se encuentra en Archet, al oeste del campo de entrenamiento.\
\
Ahora que has usado con éxito tu Golpe Sorpresivo, debes regresar con tu instructor y contarle tu éxito.","Has golpeado al muñeco de entrenamiento con Golpe Sorpresivo","Usa tu habilidad <rgb=#00ff00>Golpe sorpresivo</rgb> contra el muñeco de entrenamiento cercano.\
\
<rgb=#00ff00>PISTA:\
\
Los Saqueadores se benefician enormemente de <rgb=#ffff00>Golpes Críticos</rgb> y <rgb=#f fff00>Golpes Devastadores</rgb>. Realizar estos ataques les permitirá usar habilidades especiales como <rgb=#00ff00>Golpe de Doble Filo</rgb>. Además, muchas habilidades de Saqueador se benefician de estar en <rgb=#ffff00>Sigilo</rgb>.\
\
Intenta atacar un <rgb=#ff0000>muñeco de entrenamiento</rgb> desde <rgb=#ffff00>Sigilo</rgb> con <rgb=#ffff00>Golpe sorpresivo</rgb> para infligir aún más daño."}},
[7562]={nameES="Intro: Perros de la Muerte",objectivesES={"Los perros que habitan los túmulos llamados \\qbarghests\\q se han apoderado de las tierras de la Puerta de Thorin, lo que implica la presencia de mucha muerte cerca....","Habla con Unnarr en el Patio de Frerin","Intro: Perros de la Muerte","Unnarr está en el Patio de Frerin, de pie entre los demás miembros del grupo de Dwalin.\
\
Deberías hablar con Unnarr y contarle que lograste ahuyentar a los perversos sabuesos tumularios en la Puerta de Thorin.","Los barghests se pueden encontrar en las llanuras nevadas cubiertas de hollín alrededor del Patio de Frerin.\
\
Debes derrotar a los barghests, porque son una señal de una muerte antinatural en este valle que una vez fue sano y hermoso."}},
[7563]={nameES="Introducción: El sueño de Elrond",objectivesES={"Busca la sabiduría de Merethen sobre el acertijo del sueño de Elrond.","Busca la sabiduría de Dorollas sobre el acertijo del sueño de Elrond.","Merethen observa que la nieve en el valle de abajo está negra por el hollín, y que probablemente sea la \\qnieve negra\\q del sueño de Elrond.","Introducción: El sueño de Elrond","Los Elfos de la Compañía de Elrond pueden encontrarse alrededor de la Atalaya de Edhelion.\
\
Debes buscar a los Elfos que tengan ideas sobre dónde comenzar a investigar el sueño.","os Elfos de la Compañía de Elrond pueden encontrarse alrededor de la Atalaya de Edhelion.\
\
Debes buscar a los Elfos que tengan ideas sobre dónde comenzar a investigar el sueño.","Elladan, uno de los hijos de Elrond, ha venido a Edhelion para investigar un sueño inquietante que perturbó a su padre.","Elladan espera en el camino hacia Edhelion.\
\
Debes hablar con Elladan sobre lo que aprendiste de Merethen y Dorollas.","Habla con Elladan.","Dorollas cree que Skorgrím es el Rey Duro del sueño de Elrond."}},
[7564]={nameES="Introducción: La misión de Elrond",objectivesES={"Elladan, hijo de Elrond el Medio Elfo, se encuentra no muy lejos de Nos Grimsong.\
\
Deberías hablar con Elladan para saber en qué misión los Elfos de Rivendel han viajado tan lejos hacia las Ered Luin.","Habla con Elladan, hijo de Elrond","Un grupo de barbiluengos y un grupo de Elfos han regresado a la Mansión de Thorin tras una larga ausencia de ambos. Nos Grimsong, de los enanos, ha venido a ofrecer su ayuda a los Elfos y a descubrir por qué han regresado en este momento.","Los Elfos han viajado a Edhelion para investigar la terrible premonición de Elrond...","Introducción: La misión de Elrond"}},
[7565]={nameES="Introducción: La Premonición de Elrond",objectivesES={"Introducción: La Premonición de Elrond","Dorongúr Espinablanca está al pie de los escalones dentro de las ruinas de Edhelion, más allá de la puerta.\
\
Dorongúr Espinablanca desea hablar contigo sobre un asunto de gran importancia.","Tras siglos de ausencia, regresas al refugio de Edhelion, junto con los hijos de Elrond y Dorongúr Espinablanca.","Habla con Dorongúr Espinablanca en Edhelion."}},
[7566]={nameES="Introducción: Trasgos merodeadores",objectivesES={"Los trasgos merodeadores se encuentran al suroeste del Patio de Frerin, ocultos en las colinas de la región.\
\
Dwalin te ha pedido que mates a un trasgo y lo revises. Si encuentras algo interesante, llévaselo a Dwalin de inmediato.","<rgb=#00e4ff>¡Esta misión ha sido restaurada para los Servidores Legendarios!</rgb>\
\
'Los Elfos me hablaron de trasgos excavando en el Abismo de Plata, y entre los guardias de la mina y ese hombre de túnica roja... bueno, me ha hecho pensar. ¿Están los Duramano involucrados? El cosquilleo en mis bigotes dice que sí, pero necesito pruebas sólidas antes de lanzar acusaciones.\
\
'Lo primero que debemos averiguar es si los Duramano están usando trasgos como aliados. Mata a uno de los trasgos merodeadores al oeste de aquí y revisa su cuerpo en busca de pruebas de la implicación de los Duramano.\
\
'Los trasgos merodeadores se encuentran en las colinas al suroeste del Patio de Frerin.'","Hace mucho tiempo, Skorgrím, señor de los Duramano, se alió con trasgos y trolls. Dwalin cree que los Duramano están volviendo a sus antiguas costumbres.","Revisa a un trasgo merodeador","Espada enana recogida","Lleva la espada enana a Dwalin","Introducción: Trasgos merodeadores"}},
[7567]={nameES="Introducción: Trasgos en los riscos",objectivesES={"Los Elfos le dijeron a Dwalin que Elrohir, hijo de Elrond, entró en los Túneles de Piedramusgo cerca de la Mansión de Thorin para descubrir más sobre los planes de los Duramano.","Introducción: Trasgos en los riscos","Lleva la carta a Dwalin.","Dwalin se encuentra en el Patio de Frerin, al sureste de los Túneles de Piedramusgo.\
\
Elrohir te dio una carta para llevar a Dwalin.","Elrohir puede estar en algún lugar de los Túneles de Piedramusgo. La entrada a los túneles está al final del Camino de la Cabeza de Hacha, al noroeste del Patio de Frerin.\
\
Elrohir, hijo de Elrond, entró en los Túneles de Piedramusgo para buscar respuestas al misterio de por qué los Duramano se han aliado con los trasgos. Dwalin te pidió que te reunieras con Elrohir para ver qué ha descubierto."}},
[7568]={nameES="Introducción: Los Actos de Gormr",objectivesES={"Dwalin se encuentra en el Patio de Frerin, la plaza central de la Puerta de Thorin.\
\
Olin reveló que Gormr Duramano está aliado con trasgos y puede haber tenido que ver con su envenenamiento.","Olin se sintió mucho mejor tras tomar un remedio hecho con hongos élficos. Libre de dolor, Olin te habló de Gormr Forjadura, el enano que lidera a los Duramano.","Introducción: Los Actos de Gormr"}},
[7569]={nameES="Introducción: Gormr, Senescal de la Mansión",objectivesES={"Dile a Gormr Forjadura, Senescal de la Mansión de Thorin","Gormr custodia la puerta de la tumba en el Berghold, al sur del área de la Puerta de Thorin.\
\
Debes hablar con Gormr y averiguar todo lo que puedas sobre sus iniciativas como Senescal de la Mansión de Thorin y por qué el cuerpo de Skorgrím ha sido trasladado.","Introducción: Gormr, Senescal de la Mansión","El rastro de flores que crece cerca del cadáver de Skorgrím te ha conducido a Gormr, el Senescal de la Mansión de Thorin."}},
[7570]={nameES="Introducción: Guardianes del Abismo de Plata",objectivesES={"Los Guardianes del Abismo de Plata son un grupo de enanos encargados por Thorin de asegurar que el Abismo de Plata permanezca intacta.","Olin puede encontrarse al oeste del Patio de Frerin.\
\
Bolli te pidió que encontraras a Olin, uno de los Guardianes del Abismo de Plata, y que averiguaras lo que sabe sobre la situación en la Mansión de Thorin.","Introducción: Guardianes del Abismo de Plata","Habla con Olin"}},
[7571]={nameES="Introducción: Perfeccionando tus habilidades",objectivesES={"Habla con Trancos en Archet","Introducción: Perfeccionando tus habilidades","Trancos sugirió que entrenaras más antes de acudir en defensa de Archet"}},
[7572]={nameES="Introducción: Perfeccionando tus habilidades",objectivesES={"Los entrenadores de clase pueden encontrarse en los principales centros del mundo, pero el más cercano está en la Atalaya de Edhelion, no lejos de Elladan.\
\
Debes hablar con tu entrenador para ver si tiene algo que enseñarte.","Introducción: Perfeccionando tus habilidades","Habla con Elladan."}},
[7573]={nameES="Intro: Interrogatorio",objectivesES={"Intro: Interrogatorio","Según las pruebas que recopilaste, el capitán Helecharroyo ha ordenado la captura de Calder Cobb.\
\
El capitán Helecharroyo quiere que te dirijas a las cárceles y obtengas toda la información que puedas de Calder Cobb.","Debe completarse antes de la \\qIntroducción.\\q","Ned Pruner se encuentra en las cárceles al este de la ubicación del capitán Helecharroyo.","Habla con Ned Pruner"}},
[7574]={nameES="Intro: En la Sombra",objectivesES={"Jon Helecharroyo está reuniendo fuerzas en el Refugio del Cazador, en la esquina noreste de Archet.\
\
Debes regresar con Jon Helecharroyo, entregándole los planes de los Montebruno que has recogido.","Una carta dentro de la bolsa dice que los bandidos Montebruno piensan atacar esta noche con la ayuda de Angmar","Intro: En la Sombra","El Nido de los Montebruno se encuentra al sur del Pabellón de Caza.\
\
Debes derrotar a los bandidos para reducir sus filas y reunir información sobre sus planes exactos para la incursión en Archet.","Jon Helecharroyo te ha enviado al Nido de los Montebruno, el corazón de la amenaza sobre Archet, con la esperanza de que puedas descubrir su plan de ataque.","Reúne información sobre la incursión prevista de los Montebruno","Lleva los planos de Montebruno a Jon Helecharroyo"}},
[7575]={nameES="Introducción: Manteniendo el Equilibrio",objectivesES={"Usa tu habilidad <rgb=#00ff00>Estocada</rgb> en el muñeco de entrenamiento cercano.","Habla con Barton Halifax, el Instructor de Marineros en Archet","Introducción: Manteniendo el Equilibrio","Barton Halifax, el Instructor de Marineros, está en Archet, al oeste del campo de entrenamiento.\
\
Ahora que has usado tu habilidad con éxito, deberías regresar con tu instructor y contarle de tu éxito."}},
[7576]={nameES="Intro: Medicina de los Elfos",objectivesES={"Entrega las hierbas curativas a Elrohir","Elrohir está fuera de los Túneles de Piedramusgo, custodiando la entrada contra los sanguinarios Duramano.\
\
Deberías llevar las hierbas a Elrohir y contarle lo que presenciaste dentro de las cuevas.","El espíritu cruel se ha disipado, pero el temor provocado por sus palabras persiste...","Explora la cueva para intentar descubrir qué podría estar causando el azote en Ered Luin","Intro: Medicina de los Elfos","Es posible que se encuentren hierbas curativas dentro de la cueva detrás de Elrohir.\
\
Deberías explorar la cueva en busca de las hierbas que ayudan a purgar los venenos de los Túneles de Piedramusgo.","Una horrible sensación se apodera de ti: ¡algo se acerca!","Seguramente hay una razón por la que los Muertos han invadido estas tierras, y esta cueva parece ser la fuente.\
\
Debes explorar la cueva en busca del origen de los problemas en la Puerta de Thorin.","Elrohir te ha pedido que busques una hierba en las cuevas de los Túneles de Piedramusgo, pues cree que la montaña intentará, a su manera, purgarse de los venenos que la invaden."}},
[7577]={nameES="Introducción: Meditando sobre el Pasado",objectivesES={"Los Elfos más ancianos y sabios pasan su tiempo contemplando el pasado en busca de extraer sabiduría de él.","Introducción: Meditando sobre el Pasado"}},
[7578]={nameES="Intro: Plaga entre los árboles",objectivesES={"Los insectos pueden encontrarse en el bosquecillo de árboles al norte de Dorongúr Espinablanca, cerca de la puerta dorada.\
\
Dorongúr Espinablanca te encargó ayudar a recuperar el refugio de Edhelion eliminando los insectos que han hecho de los árboles cercanos su hogar.","Intro: Plaga entre los árboles","Dorongúr Espinablanca se encuentra al sur de los árboles.\
\
Con los insectos derrotados, le has demostrado tu valía a Dorongúr Espinablanca. Deberías volver a verlo y contarle tu victoria.","Habla con Dorongúr Espinablanca en Edhelion."}},
[7579]={nameES="Introducción: Interroga al prisionero",objectivesES={"Los arbustos de arándanos crecen cerca del Refugio de Montebruno, al sureste de Archet.\
\
Ned Pruner te ha pedido que recojas suficientes arándanos para hornear los pasteles que Calder Cob pidió.","Debe completarse antes de la \\qIntroducción.\\q","Lleva las bayas a Ned Pruner","Introducción: Interroga al prisionero","El traidor, Calder Cob, se niega a hablar con el crédulo carcelero, Ned Pruner, hasta que tenga unos pasteles de arándanos.","Ned Pruner está en la cárcel de Archet.\
\
Recogiste los arándanos que Ned Pruner pidió. Deberías regresar con las bayas y dárselas a Ned."}},
[7580]={nameES="Introducción: Remedio de los antiguos reyes",objectivesES={"El montaraz Amdir te dijo que le pidió a Celandine Brandigamo que recogiera una hierba llamada \\qathelas\\q para preparar un remedio para su herida, por si la hoja estaba envenenada.","Las hojas de reyes crecen al sur de Archet, cerca de unas ruinas antiguas llamadas el Capricho de Bronwe.\
\
Celandine Brandigamo, demasiado asustada para salir de las puertas de Archet, te ha pedido que recojas hojas de athelas para ella, para poder preparar el remedio que Amdir le pidió.","Lleva las hojas de reyes a Celandine Brandigamo","Debe completarse antes de la \\qIntroducción.\\q","Introducción: Remedio de los antiguos reyes","Celandine Brandigamo se encuentra con Amdir fuera de la Posada del Tejón Loco en Archet.\
\
Has recogido suficientes hojas para el remedio de Amdir. Deberías regresar con ellas a Celandine Brandigamo."}},
[7581]={nameES="Introducción: Remedio de los antiguos reyes",objectivesES={"Regresa con Trancos con las hojas de reyes y tu extraña historia","Trancos, preocupado por su amigo herido, te ha pedido que busques una hierba llamada \\qHojas de reyes\\q, que él cree que podrá mitigar el veneno del malvado cuchillo que hirió a Amdir.","El Capitán Helecharroyo está cerca de la Posada del Tejón Loco en la aldea de Archet.\
\
Debes preguntarle si conoce plantas de hojas de reyes por aquí cerca y también si le gustaría que le ofrecieras ayuda para ganarte sus favores.","Completa una misión para Calder Cob, el soldado de mayor confianza de Helecharroyo","Calder Cob está en una granja fuera de Archet, en el camino hacia el Capricho de Bronwe si tomas la ruta al sur desde la ciudad. Las hojas de reyes puede encontrarse en el Capricho de Bronwe.\
\
Debes hablar con Calder Cob y ver cómo puedes ayudarlo frente a la amenaza de lobos que atacan antes de dirigirte a las ruinas para recoger las hojas de reyes.","Pide instrucciones al Capitán Helecharroyo y comienza a intentar ganarte sus favores","Trancos está en la ciudad de Archet, esperando tu regreso con las hojas y noticias sobre tus esfuerzos por lograr que Helecharroyo confíe en ti.\
\
Debes llevarle a Trancos las hojas de reyes e informarle sobre el comportamiento traicionero de Calder Cob.","Introducción: Remedio de los antiguos reyes"}},
[7582]={nameES="Introducción: Regreso desde la Montaña Solitaria",objectivesES={"Nos Grimsong se encuentra en la esquina noroeste del Patio de Frerin.\
\
Bolli te pidió que prestaras tu ayuda a Nos Grimsong.","Tras muchos años de ausencia, un grupo de barbiluengos ha regresado a las Montañas Azules y a la Mansión de Thorin.","Habla con Nos Grimsong en el Patio de Frerin","Introducción: Regreso desde la Montaña Solitaria"}},
[7583]={nameES="Introducción: En defensa de Archet",objectivesES={"Introducción: En defensa de Archet","Dirk Ladrillodo defiende una granja al sur y oeste, fuera de la puerta principal de Archet.\
\
Amdir te dijo que hablaras con Dirk Ladrillodo y le ofrecieras tu ayuda, tal como originalmente te lo indicó el Capitán Helecharroyo.","Habla con Dirk Ladrillodo","Los lobos pueden encontrarse al este y sur de la granja y en el Capricho de Bronwe.\
\
Dirk Ladrillodo está encargado de proteger el corral de ovejas fuera de Archet y se alegra de recibir ayuda del Capitán Helecharroyo.","Dirk Ladrillodo se encuentra en el corral de ovejas, al sur y oeste de Archet.\
\
Deberías regresar con Dirk Ladrillodo para informarle de tu éxito.","Amdir te ha pedido que ayudes en la defensa de Archet colaborando con el Capitán Helecharroyo."}},
[7584]={nameES="Introducción: Afila tus habilidades",objectivesES={"Nos Grimsong recomendó que afiles tus habilidades un poco antes de enfrentarte a cualquiera de las amenazas que abundan en Ered Luin.","Bolli se encuentra en los escalones del norte, en el centro del Patio de Frerin.\
\
Deberías regresar con Bolli y ver qué más tiene preparado para ti.","Introducción: Afila tus habilidades","Habla con Bolli en el Patio de Frerin"}},
[7585]={nameES="Introducción: Santuario al Rey Caído",objectivesES={"Gormr, Senescal de la Mansión de Thorin y líder de los Duramano que la habitan ahora, no te permitirá el acceso a la Tumba de Skorgrím. Sin embargo, sí te ha dado permiso para visitar el santuario.","Gormr te espera en el Berghold en la Puerta de Thorin.\
\
Deberías regresar con Gormr después de haber completado la tarea que te dio.","Habla con Gormr Forjadura en el Berghold","Introducción: Santuario al Rey Caído","El Santuario de Skorgrím está en la Fosa Barrigapétrea.\
\
Deberías visitar el santuario para ver de qué se trata todo este alboroto en torno a Skorgrím.","Una estatua amenazante ha sido erigida a semejanza del rey ancestral de los Duramano.","Visita el Santuario de Skorgrím en la Fosa Barrigapétrea","Los murciélagos pueden encontrarse en la caverna de la Fosa Barrigapétrea, a la cual se puede entrar desde el patio cercano al Berghold o desde lo alto de la Cumbre Invernal.\
\
Debes derrotar murciélagos en la Fosa Barrigapétrea para asegurar que el Santuario de Skorgrím permanezca limpio."}},
[7586]={nameES="Introducción: El asedio al sur",objectivesES={"Habla con Cal Sprigley para evaluar la amenaza de los Montebruno en el sur","Cal Sprigley se encuentra en su granja en la parte más al sur de Archet.\
\
Deberías hablar con Cal Sprigley para evaluar la realidad de la amenaza de los Montebruno.","Introducción: El asedio al sur","El Capitán Helecharroyo, preocupado por la mención de Otto el bandido sobre un ataque de los Montebruno desde el sur de Archet, te ha pedido que viajes a la granja de Cal Sprigley para encontrar pruebas de las intenciones de los bandidos."}},
[7587]={nameES="Intro: Señales y Presagios",objectivesES={"Usa el colchón en el Refugio del Cazador para descansar","Tuviste un sueño muy curioso y deberías compartirlo con el cazador en el Refugio del Cazador.","Un cazador en el Refugio del Cazador te ha ofrecido un colchón que puedes usar para descansar.","Cuéntale al cazador sobre tu curioso sueño","Has tenido un día largo, y un cazador en el Refugio del Cazador piensa que deberías descansar.","Intro: Señales y Presagios"}},
[7588]={nameES="Intro: Señales y Presagios",objectivesES={"Usa el saco de dormir para descansar","Tuviste un sueño muy curioso y deberías contárselo al minero que te recomendó descansar.","Has tenido un día largo, y un minero te sugiere que descanses.","Un minero te ha ofrecido un saco de dormir que puedes usar para descansar.","Intro: Señales y Presagios","Cuéntale al minero sobre tu curioso sueño"}},
[7589]={nameES="Introducción: La Tumba de Skorgrím",objectivesES={"Habla a Eilian","<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Los archivos que necesitas para continuar tus aventuras en la Tierra Media deberían terminar de descargarse en breve. ¡Gracias por tu paciencia!</rgb>","Introducción: La Tumba de Skorgrím","Dwalin te ha pedido que viajes con él y te unas a los hijos de Elrond en la Tumba de Skorgrím. El mal despertado por los Duramano debe ser sofocado antes de que ocurra la atroz resurrección de Skorgrím.","Dwalin te pidió que viajaras con él a la tumba de Skorgrím y pusieras fin a los locos planes de los Duramano.\
\
Deberías hablar con él nuevamente cuando puedas partir.","Habla con Dwalin","Habla con Skogi"}},
[7590]={nameES="Introducción: La carga de Trancos",objectivesES={"Amdir te asegura que está bien, pero está pálido como la muerte y tiembla de frío","Ve por ti mismo cómo está Amdir","Descubre por qué Trancos está preocupado","Amdir, muy pálido y herido, está sentado en Archet cerca de la Posada del Tejón Loco.\
\
Deberías ir a ver a Amdir, pues fue apuñalado anoche mientras ayudaba a rescatarte a ti y a los dos hobbits de los Montebruno.","Trancos está arrodillado junto a su amigo Amdir, cerca de la Posada del Tejón Loco en el pueblo de Archet.\
\
Deberías hablar con Trancos, pues Amdir insinuó que la necesidad de Trancos es más urgente.","Introducción: La carga de Trancos"}},
[7591]={nameES="Introducción: El hijo del Capitán",objectivesES={"El Capitán Helecharroyo está distanciado de su hijo Jon desde que discutieron sobre la lealtad de Calder Cob. El Capitán confiaba en Cob, mientras que Jon sospechaba de él. Las órdenes que encontraste demostraron que Jon tenía razón.","Introducción: El hijo del Capitán","Jon Helecharroyo se encuentra en el Refugio del Cazador, que está sobre el camino al este de Archet.\
\
El Capitán Helecharroyo, inseguro de en quién confiar, te ha pedido que hables con su hijo Jon y ganes su ayuda. Te prometió una generosa recompensa si lo logras."}},
[7592]={nameES="Intro: El cazador exiliado",objectivesES={"Debes apelar a Jon Helecharroyo en contra de los deseos de su padre","Jon Helecharroyo, el hijo exiliado del Capitán, se encuentra en el Refugio del Cazador al noreste de Archet.\
\
Debes solicitar a Jon Helecharroyo y a sus cazadores que acudan en ayuda de la ciudad asediada.","Trancos no ha dejado aún Archet, pero está ansioso por marcharse para poder cumplir con su verdadera misión.\
\
Trancos es un sabio montaraz que ha visto cómo se han producido muchas cosas malas; deberías preguntarle qué hacer.","El capitán Helecharroyo, en su lealtad hacia Calder Cob, permitió que su propio hijo se distanciara de él después de que su hijo y Calder Cob tuvieran un enfrentamiento. El capitán tomó partido por Calder Cob, y su hijo no ha puesto un pie en Archet desde entonces.","Helecharroyo está desesperado; deberías preguntarle a Trancos qué hacer","Intro: El cazador exiliado","Pregunta al cazador exiliado si puede ayudar a Archet"}},
[7593]={nameES="Intro: Las huellas de sangre",objectivesES={"Intro: Las huellas de sangre","Las \\qhuellas enrojecidas\\q comienzan en la Mina del Abismo de Plata. Elladan sospecha que conducen hasta donde yace Skorgrím.\
\
Debes seguir las flores rojas hasta su final, examinando cada una en busca de señales, porque crecen donde el cadáver de Skorgrím corrompió la tierra al ser trasladado sobre ella.","Habla con el enano barbiluengo que está espiando cerca","La pista de \\qhuellas rojas como la sangre\\q comienza en este punto","Explora la puerta en el patio de la Mina del Abismo de Plata","Las flores rojas han crecido alrededor de la tumba derruida de Skorgrím y alrededor del lugar donde cayó. Elladan cree que las flores podrían ser lo que Elrond vio como huellas rojo sangre en su sueño y que lo llevarán al cuerpo de Skorgrím.","La pista de flores te ha llevado a una fortaleza enana oscura","Las \\qhuellas enrojecidas\\q comienzan en la Mina del Abismo de Plata y se extienden a lo largo del camino. Elladan sospecha que conducen hasta donde yace Skorgrím.\
\
Debes seguir las flores rojas hasta su final, examinando cada una en busca de señales, pues crecen donde el cadáver de Skorgrím corrompió la tierra al ser trasladado sobre ella.","Un fuerte de aspecto poco amigable se alza ahora ante ti.\
\
Deberías explorar el fuerte, pues la pista indica que el cuerpo de Skorgrím podría haber sido trasladado aquí.","Sigue la pista de flores rojas por el camino","Has encontrado otra flor a lo largo del sendero"}},
[7594]={nameES="Introducción: Las Salas de Edhelion",objectivesES={"Elladan te espera al oeste del estanque.\
\
Tu búsqueda reveló que muchos de los trasgos llevaban picos forjados por enanos. Elladan estará muy interesado en tu hallazgo.","Lleva los picos enanos a Elladan","Los cadáveres de los trasgos abatidos yacen al este de Elladan, rodeando el estanque.\
\
Elladan mató a varios trasgos y quiere que revises los cuerpos en busca de pistas, mientras él permanece en su puesto.","Elladan entró en Edhelion y encontró a trasgos excavando en los muros. Mató a muchas de esas criaturas viles y ahuyentó al resto junto con sus secuaces boggart.","Introducción: Las Salas de Edhelion"}},
[7595]={nameES="Introducción: El interrogatorio",objectivesES={"Después de que Calder Cob intentó que los Montebruno te emboscaran, Trancos quiere demostrar sin lugar a dudas que es un enemigo de Archet.","Interroga a Otto el bandido sobre sus vínculos con los Montebruno","Habla con el Capitán Helecharroyo","Otto el bandido está detenido en los cepos del patio de la cárcel de Archet, al otro lado del camino de Trancos y Amdir.\
\
Deberías interrogar a Otto directamente sobre la traición de Calder Cob y los Montebruno; el Capitán Helecharroyo no está listo para ser convencido solo con tus palabras.","El Capitán Helecharroyo está en el pueblo de Archet.\
\
Deberías contarle rápidamente al Capitán Helecharroyo lo que Otto te ha dicho a ti y a su carcelero, Ned Pruner.","Otto sabe que Calder Cob está involucrado con los Montebruno","Introducción: El interrogatorio","Habla con el carcelero sobre las palabras inquietantes de Otto","El carcelero de Archet, un hombre llamado Ned Pruner, está cerca de Otto con cautela.\
\
Deberías hablar con Ned Pruner, quizá Otto se haya sincerado con su captor.","Ned Pruner está de acuerdo en que Archet está en peligro"}},
[7596]={nameES="Introducción: Los barbiluengos",objectivesES={"Entrega los picos enanos a Dwalin en el Patio de Frerin","Se descubrieron trasgos dentro de Edhelion, y Elladan luchó contra muchos de ellos. Está preocupado por lo que descubriste al revisar los cuerpos: cada uno de los trasgos muertos llevaba picos forjados por enanos.","Introducción: Los barbiluengos","Dwalin se encuentra en el Patio de Frerin, al oeste del Abismo de Plata. Boggarts se alinean en el camino de salida de Edhelion.\
\
Elladan te ha indicado que lleves los picos enanos a Dwalin y le cuentes sobre los trasgos en la mina Plataprofunda. También te sugirió que elimines algunos boggarts y averigües si ellos también llevan los picos."}},
[7597]={nameES="Introducción: Las Piedras Rituales",objectivesES={"Lleva las piedras rituales a Bjarni","Las piedras rituales pueden encontrarse dentro y alrededor de la Fosa Barrigapétrea, al este del Berghold en la Puerta de Thorin.\
\
Debes recolectar piedras negras para el ritual conmemorativo que están preparando los Duramano.","Bjarni está en el Berghold, en el área sur de la Puerta de Thorin.\
\
Debes hablar con Bjarni y entregarle las piedras negras que has recolectado.","Introducción: Las Piedras Rituales","Se te ha pedido recolectar piedras negras para un ritual que Gormr ha planeado en conmemoración de Skorgrím, rey de los Duramano en la antigüedad, antes de su caída en la oscuridad."}},
[7598]={nameES="Intro: Los espías",objectivesES={"Los Montebruno han enviado espías para evaluar la situación en Archet, lo cual se ha convertido en motivo de preocupación para Dirk Ladrillodo.","Los espías de los Montebruno pueden encontrarse al sureste de la granja de ovejas, entre la granja y el Capricho de Bronwe.\
\
Dirk Ladrillodo quiere descubrir lo que los espías de los Montebruno han averiguado. Te ha pedido que enfrentes a uno de los espías y recuperes cualquier orden o mensaje que pueda llevar.","Intro: Los espías","Derrota a un espía de Montebruno y regístralo","Órdenes de los Montebruno recogidas","Dirk Ladrillodo se encuentra en la granja de ovejas al suroeste de Archet.\
\
Dirk Ladrillodo estará ansioso por leer las órdenes que encontraste en el espía de Montebruno. Debes llevárselas lo antes posible.","Entrega las órdenes de los Montebruno al capitán Helecharroyo","Lleva las órdenes de los Montebruno a Dirk Ladrillodo","El capitán Helecharroyo se encuentra dentro de la Posada del Tejón Loco, al norte de la puerta de Archet.\
\
Dirk Ladrillodo te envió con el capitán Helecharroyo con las órdenes que encontraste en los espías de Montebruno."}},
[7599]={nameES="Introducción: La tormenta se avecina",objectivesES={"Jon Helecharroyo está en la Cabaña de Caza, al este de Archet.\
\
Jon Helecharroyo está esperando que te unas a su compañía.","<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Los archivos que necesitas para continuar tus aventuras en la Tierra Media deberían terminar de descargarse en breve. ¡Gracias por tu paciencia!</rgb>","Habla con Jon Helecharroyo","Habla con Mundo Sacovilla-Bolsón","Introducción: La tormenta se avecina","Tus esfuerzos para preparar Archet para el inminente ataque de los Montebruno han dado sus frutos. Ahora las preparaciones están completas, y ha llegado el momento de luchar."}},
[7600]={nameES="Introducción: La emoción de la batalla",objectivesES={"Introducción: La emoción de la batalla","Habla con Dorongúr Espinablanca en Edhelion","Habla nuevamente con el entrenador y aprende la habilidad <rgb=#00ff00>Golpes Feroces</rgb>. Usa tu nueva habilidad en el muñeco de entrenamiento cercano.\
\
<rgb=#00ff00>NOTA: Usa al entrenador y selecciona Entrenar Habilidades de Campeón para abrir el panel de selección de habilidades. Haz clic izquierdo en una habilidad para resaltarla y luego haz clic izquierdo en el botón Entrenar al final del panel de selección, o haz doble clic en la habilidad, y habrás comprado la habilidad con éxito.\
\
PISTA:\
\\Los campeones dependen de <rgb=#ffff00>Fervor</rgb> para activar algunas de sus habilidades, como <rgb=#00ff00>Golpes Feroces</rgb>. Usa tus habilidades <rgb=#00ff00>Golpe Veloz</rgb> y <rgb=#00ff00>Ataque salvaje</rgb> para generar <rgb=#ffff00>2 de Fervor</rgb> y luego golpea al <rgb=#ff0000>Muñeco de Entrenamiento</rgb> con tu habilidad <rgb=#ffff00>Golpes Feroces</rgb>.","Dorongúr Espinablanca se encuentra en Edhelion.\
\
Debes dirigirte a Dorongúr Espinablanca y decirle que has terminado tu meditación y que te has preparado para la batalla.","Has golpeado al muñeco de entrenamiento con Golpes Feroces","Ahora que has usado con éxito la habilidad que acabas de aprender, regresa con tu entrenador y cuéntale sobre tu éxito.","Habla con el Entrenador de Campeones","Golpea el muñeco de entrenamiento con Golpes Feroces"}},
[7601]={nameES="Introducción: La emoción de la batalla",objectivesES={"Introducción: La emoción de la batalla","Habla con el Entrenador de Campeones en el Patio de Frerin","Has golpeado al muñeco de entrenamiento con Golpes Feroces","El Entrenador de Campeones se encuentra en el Patio de Frerin.\
\
Ahora que has usado con éxito tu nueva habilidad, regresa con tu instructor y cuéntale tu éxito.","Debes hablar nuevamente con el instructor y aprender la habilidad<rgb=#00ff00>Golpes Feroces</rgb>. Usa tu nueva habilidad en el muñeco de entrenamiento cercano.\
\
<rgb=#00ff00>NOTA: Usa al entrenador y selecciona Entrenar Habilidades de Campeón para abrir el panel de selección de habilidades. Haz clic izquierdo en una habilidad para resaltarla y luego haz clic izquierdo en el botón Entrenar al final del panel de selección, o haz doble clic en la habilidad, y habrás comprado la habilidad con éxito.\
\
PISTA:\
\\Los campeones dependen de <rgb=#ffff00>Fervor</rgb> para activar algunas de sus habilidades, como <rgb=#00ff00>Golpes Feroces</rgb>. Usa tus habilidades <rgb=#00ff00>Golpe veloz</rgb> y <rgb=#00ff00>Ataque salvaje</rgb> para generar <rgb=#ffff00>2 de Fervor</rgb> y luego golpea al <rgb=#ff0000>Muñeco de Entrenamiento</rgb> con tu habilidad <rgb=#ffff00>Golpes Feroces</rgb>.","Golpea el muñeco de entrenamiento con Golpes Feroces"}},
[7602]={nameES="Introducción: La emoción de la lucha",objectivesES={"Has golpeado al muñeco de entrenamiento con Golpes Feroces","Golpea al muñeco de entrenamiento con Golpes Feroces","El Entrenador de Campeones se encuentra en Archet, al oeste del campo de entrenamiento.\
\
Ahora que has usado exitosamente tu nueva habilidad, deberías regresar con tu entrenador y contarle tu éxito.","Usa tu habilidad<rgb=#00ff00>Golpes Feroces</rgb> en el muñeco de entrenamiento cercano.'\
\
PISTA:\
\
Los Campeones dependen de <rgb=#ffff00>Fervor</rgb> para activar algunas de sus habilidades como <rgb=#00ff00>Golpes Salvajes</rgb>. Usa tus habilidades <rgb=#00ff00>Golpe veloz</rgb> y <rgb=#00ff00>Muro de Espadas</rgb> para generar <rgb=#ffff00>2 de Fervor</rgb> y luego golpea el <rgb=#ff0000>muñeco de práctica</rgb> con tu habilidad <rgb=#ffff00>Golpes Feroces</rgb>.","Habla con el Entrenador de Campeones en Archet","Introducción: La emoción de la lucha"}},
[7603]={nameES="Introducción: La Emoción de la Lucha",objectivesES={"Otto Beecher, el Entrenador de Luchadores, se encuentra en Archet, al oeste de los campos de entrenamiento.\
\
Ahora que has usado exitosamente tu nueva habilidad, deberías regresar con tu entrenador y contarle tu éxito.","Introducción: La Emoción de la Lucha","Habla con Otto Beecher, el Entrenador de Luchadores en Archet","Usa tu nueva habilidad <rgb=#00ff00>Golpe Descendente</rgb> en el Muñeco de Entrenamiento cercano\
\
Los Luchadores dependen del <rgb=#ffff00>Valor</rgb> para activar algunas de sus habilidades, como <rgb=#00ff00>Golpe Descendente</rgb>. Usa tu <rgb=#00ff00>Golpe Bajo</rgb> o <rgb=#00ff00>Gancho Diestro</rgb> para acumular <rgb=#ffff00>3 de Valor</rgb> y luego golpea al <rgb=#ff0000>Maniquí de Entrenamiento</rgb> con tu habilidad <rgb=#ffff00>Golpe Descendente</rgb>."}},
[7604]={nameES="Intro: Los lobos de las ruinas",objectivesES={"Has ayudado a derrotar al amo de los lobos Montebruno.","Hay una extraña bandera en la cima de las escaleras.","Calder Cob se encuentra en la granja un poco más abajo en el camino desde Archet.\
\
Antes de volver con Trancos, deberías preguntarle por qué intentó que te tendieran una emboscada los Montebruno.","Has derrotado al amo de los lobos Montebruno.","Busca en la cima del Capricho de Bronwe el origen de los lobos","Pregunta a Calder Cob por qué intentó tenderte una emboscada","Intro: Los lobos de las ruinas","Has encontrado una extraña bandera en la cima de las ruinas del Capricho de Bronwe.\
\
Deberías examinar esta bandera más de cerca....","Trancos quisiera que ganes el favor del Capitán Helecharroyo si puedes, así que terminas ofreciendo tu ayuda a un soldado leal llamado Calder Cob.","Los lobos se pueden encontrar cerca de Archet y parecen concentrarse alrededor del Capricho de Bronwe.\
\
Calder Cob, un soldado de confianza del capitán Helecharroyo, te ha pedido que investigues el problema de lobos de Archet.","Usa el Estandarte de Montebruno para convocar al culpable <rgb=#ffff00>(No abandones la plataforma)</rgb>"}},
[7605]={nameES="Intro: De muslo a cuello",objectivesES={"El entrenador de vigilantes está en Archet, en el campo de entrenamiento.\
\
Ahora que has usado con éxito Ataque defensivo, deberías volver con tu entrenador e informarle de tu éxito.","Habla con el entrenador de vigilantes en Archet","Golpea el maniquí de entrenamiento con Ataque defensivo","Intro: De muslo a cuello","Has golpeado el maniquí de entrenamiento con Ataque defensivo","Usa <rgb=#00ff00>Ataque defensivo</rgb> en el maniquí de entrenamiento cercano. \
\
\
PISTA:\
\
Los vigilantes usan combinaciones de sus habilidades básicas, como <rgb=#00ff00>Estocada rápida</rgb> y <rgb=#00ff00>Golpe de escudo</rgb>, para crear ataques <rgb=#ffff00>Gambito</rgb> más poderosos. Para usar tu habilidad <rgb=#00ff00>Ataque defensivo</rgb>, ataca un <rgb=#ff0000>maniquí de entrenamiento</rgb> con tu habilidad <rgb=#00ff00>Golpe de escudo</rgb> dos veces. Esto debería hacer que tu habilidad <rgb=#00ff00>Gambito predeterminado</rgb> cambie por tu habilidad <rgb=#00ff00>Ataque defensivo</rgb>. Usa tu habilidad <rgb=#00ff00>Ataque defensivo</rgb> para golpear un <rgb=#ff0000>maniquí de entrenamiento</rgb>."}},
[7606]={nameES="Intro: Evitar la fatalidad inminente",objectivesES={"Habla con Dwalin en el Patio de Frerin","Administra la poción de Elrohir a Olin","Los efectos curativos se notan de inmediato","Administrar la poción de Elrohir a Mathi Manofirme","Antes de que Dwalin y los barbiluengos puedan esperar unirse a los Elfos para impedir que Gormr permita que los espíritus caídos corrompan Ered Luin para siempre, los enanos envenenados deben ser curados de su terrible enfermedad.","Dwalin está en el Patio de Frerin, en la Puerta de Thorin.\
\
Deberías hablar con Dwalin sobre cómo proceder ahora que sus enanos han recibido un remedio.","Decir a Dwalin que ahora hay esperanza para los enanos de su grupo","Administra la poción de Elrohir a Selur","Administra la poción de Elrohir a Bogi","Intro: Evitar la fatalidad inminente","Los enanos enfermos están en el Patio de Frerin, acurrucados en el suelo y muriéndose por el manantial venenoso del que bebieron.\
\
Deberías administrar la pócima de Elrohir a los enanos enfermos.","Dwalin está junto a sus enanos enfermos en el Patio de Frerin, debajo de los túneles de Piedramusgo.\
\
Deberías llevar el remedio de Elrohir a Dwalin y contarle las graves advertencias sobre el espíritu maligno que encontraste en la cueva.","Debes dar el remedio al pueblo de Dwalin"}},
[7607]={nameES="Intro: El lugar donde cayó Skorgrím",objectivesES={"Las ruinas de Edhelion están al noreste, a lo largo del camino desde donde se encuentra Elladan.\
\
Debes entrar en las ruinas de Edhelion y buscar el lugar donde cayó Skorgrím.","Habla con Dorongúr sobre sus recuerdos de la muerte de Skorgrím","Dorniel resultó gravemente herida cuando Edhelion fue atacado, y muchos otros murieron","Si Skorgrím es realmente la fuente de la inquietante premonición de Elrond, debería examinarse el lugar de sus últimos actos.","Naithriel recuerda que Skorgrím, el señor de los enanos, buscó la inmortalidad, pero murió en su lugar","Habla con Dorniel sobre sus recuerdos de Edhelion","Habla con Naithriel sobre sus recuerdos de Edhelion","Intro: El lugar donde cayó Skorgrím","Una extraña flor roja crece en el lugar donde Skorgrím y Talagan perecieron juntos"}},
[7608]={nameES="Intro: Dónde duerme Skorgrím",objectivesES={"Elladan te espera en la Guardia de Edhelion.\
\
Debes volver con Elladan con la flor que recogiste en el sitio de la tumba de Skorgrím.","Lleva la odiosa flor roja a Elladan","Encuentra el lugar donde se encontró el cuerpo de Skorgrím","El lugar donde se descubrió el cuerpo de Skorgrím en las profundidades de la mina, donde los rayos del sol alcanzan las viejas bodegas en ruinas de Edhelion.\
\
Deberías buscar de nuevo el cuerpo de Skorgrím para asegurarte de que no camine como en el sueño de Elrond.","La flor tiene un aspecto venenoso y mortal....","La Mina del Abismo de Plata está al oeste de las ruinas de Edhelion, al pie del sendero de escalones que baja por la montaña.\
\
Deberías seguir las escaleras hacia abajo y entrar en la Mina del Abismo de Plata para buscar de nuevo el cuerpo de Skorgrím.","Intro: Dónde duerme Skorgrím","Has encontrado el sitio del cuerpo de Skorgrím, pero... el cuerpo no aparece por ningún lado. En su lugar hay flores rojas funestas.\
\
Deberías recoger una de esas flores rojas funestas para llevarla a Elladan.","Recoge una de las extrañas flores rojas","El cuerpo de Skorgrím fue visto por última vez hace varios años por mineros enanos en la Mina del Abismo de Plata, donde se encontraron por primera vez las bodegas en ruinas de Edhelion desde su caída.","El cuerpo de Skorgrím ha desaparecido, pero la misma flor extraña que se encontró en Edhelion crece en el lugar de su antigua tumba"}},
[7609]={nameES="Introducción a la cocina",objectivesES={"Abre la <rgb=#FF00FF00>caja</rgb> que te dio el Cocinero Novato para recoger la cebada de primavera, el huevo y el agua","Deberías hablar con el cocinero novato para aprender más sobre la cocina y encaminarte hacia una buena alimentación.","Has preparado una bizcocho duro","El cocinero novato te proporcionó una <rgb=#FF00FF00>caja</rgb> llena de ingredientes que puedes usar para preparar la receta de bizcochos duros. Abre la <rgb=#FF00FF00>caja</rgb> para obtener los ingredientes.\
\
<rgb=#FF00FF00>Los ingredientes para cocineros normalmente se compran a vendedores o se intercambian con jugadores de la profesión de agricultura. También puedes encontrar ingredientes en la Sala de Subastas.</rgb>","Ahora tienes todos los ingredientes para hacer un bizcocho duro","La receta está completa. <rgb=#FF00FF00>¡No comas ni vendas el bizcocho duro!</rgb> Es hora de mostrar tu trabajo al Cocinero Novato.","Usando los ingredientes que obtuviste, cocina una <rgb=#FF00FF00>bizcocho duro</rgb>","Introducción a la cocina","Has preparado una taza de harina de cebada de primavera","Lleva el <rgb=#FF00FF00>bizcocho duro</rgb> al Cocinero Novato","Has recibido una caja de ingredientes","Usando los ingredientes que recibiste, prepara una <rgb=#FF00FF00>taza de harina de cebada de primavera</rgb>","El cocinero novato te proporcionó los ingredientes necesarios para crear bizcochos duros. Sin embargo, primero debes preparar uno de los ingredientes más importantes: una <rgb=#FF00FF00>taza de harina de cebada de primavera</rgb>.","Habla con el Cocinero Novato cerca del horno en la zona de artesanía"}},
[7610]={nameES="Introducción a la cocina",objectivesES={"Abre la <rgb=#FF00FF00>caja</rgb> que te dio el Cocinero Novato para recoger la cebada de primavera, el huevo y el agua","El cocinero novato te proporcionó una <rgb=#FF00FF00>caja</rgb> llena de ingredientes que puedes usar para preparar la receta de bizcochos duros. Abre la <rgb=#FF00FF00>caja</rgb> para obtener los ingredientes.\
\
<rgb=#FF00FF00>Los ingredientes para cocineros normalmente se compran a vendedores o se intercambian con jugadores de la profesión de agricultura. También puedes encontrar ingredientes en la Sala de Subastas.</rgb>","Ahora tienes todos los ingredientes para hacer un bizcocho duro","Habla con el Cocinero Novato en Lhan Garan para aprender más sobre cocina.","La receta está completa. <rgb=#FF00FF00>¡No comas ni vendas el bizcocho duro!</rgb> Es hora de mostrar tu trabajo al Cocinero Novato.","Con los ingredientes que recibiste, prepara una <rgb=#FF00FF00>taza de harina de cebada de primavera</rgb> mediante el <rgb=#FF00FF00>panel de artesanía</rgb>","Has preparado un bizcocho duro","Introducción a la cocina","El Cocinero Novato frota algo de harina entre sus dedos.\
\
'¡Buen trabajo! Tienes talento para esto. Ahora usa esta harina para preparar el <rgb=#FF00FF00>bizcocho duro</rgb>.'\
\
<rgb=#FF00FF00>Para abrir tu panel de artesanía puedes usar la tecla 'T' o hacer clic en el botón de artesanía (que parece un martillo y un yunque) en la esquina inferior izquierda de tu interfaz.\
\
Selecciona la pestaña de Cocina en la interfaz de artesanía y busca la receta adecuada.\
\
Recuerda: para ejecutar una receta debes estar cerca de la instalación apropiada. La Cocina requiere un horno o una fogata.</rgb>","Has preparado una taza de harina de cebada de primavera","Lleva el <rgb=#FF00FF00>bizcocho duro</rgb> al Cocinero Novato","Has recibido una caja de ingredientes","El Cocinero Novato te proporcionó los ingredientes necesarios para preparar bizcochos duros. Sin embargo, primero debes preparar uno de los ingredientes más importantes: una <rgb=#FF00FF00>taza de harina de cebada de primavera</rgb>.\
\
<rgb=#FF00FF00>Para abrir tu panel de artesanía puedes usar la tecla 'T' o hacer clic en el botón de artesanía (que parece un martillo y un yunque) en la esquina inferior izquierda de tu interfaz.\
\
Selecciona la pestaña de Cocina en la interfaz de artesanía y busca la receta correspondiente.\
\
Recuerda: para ejecutar una receta debes estar cerca de la instalación adecuada. La Cocina requiere un horno o una fogata.</rgb>","Con los ingredientes que has obtenido, cocina un <rgb=#FF00FF00>bizcocho duro</rgb> en un <rgb=#FF00FF00>horno</rgb>","La taza de harina de cebada de primavera está lista, y ahora puedes preparar el <rgb=#FF00FF00>bizcocho duro</rgb>, como indicó el Cocinero Novato.\
\
<rgb=#FF00FF00>Para abrir tu panel de artesanía puedes usar la tecla 'T' o hacer clic en el botón de artesanía (que parece un martillo y un yunque) en la esquina inferior izquierda de tu interfaz.\
\
Selecciona la pestaña de Cocina en la interfaz de artesanía y busca la receta adecuada.\
\
Recuerda: para ejecutar una receta debes estar cerca de la instalación adecuada. La Cocina requiere un horno o una fogata.</rgb>","Habla con el Cocinero Novato cerca del horno en la zona de artesanía"}},
[7611]={nameES="Introducción a la artesania",objectivesES={"Completado 'Introducción a la joyería'","Completado 'Introducción a la minería'","Completado 'Introducción al oficio leñador'","Completado 'Introducción a la carpintería'","Completado 'Introducción a la fabricación de armas'","Completa tres de las siguientes misiones:\
'Introducción a la cocina'\
'Introducción a la agricultura'\
'Introducción al oficio leñador'\
'Introducción a la joyería'\
'Introducción a la herrería'\
'Introducción a la minería'\
'Introducción a la erudición'\
'Introducción a la sastrería'\
'Introducción a la fabricación de armas'\
'Introducción a la carpintería'","Completado 'Introducción a la agricultura'","Completado 'Introducción a la sastrería'","Introducción a la artesania","Completado 'Introducción a la herrería'","Completado 'Introducción a la erudición'","Completado 'Introducción a la cocina'","Elige una vocación con la Maestra de Aprendices para desbloquear las misiones introductorias de artesanía. Completa tres misiones introductorias de artesanía"}},
[7612]={nameES="Introducción a la Agricultura",objectivesES={"El Aprendiz de granja te proporcionó los ingredientes necesarios para crear una cebolla amarilla. Sin embargo, primero debes sembrar tu <rgb=#FF00FF00>campo de cebollas amarillas</rgb>.","Recolecta la <rgb=#FF00FF00>buena cosecha de cebollas amarillas</rgb>","La receta está completa. <rgb=#FF00FF00>¡No comas ni vendas la cebolla amarilla!</rgb> Es hora de mostrar tu trabajo a tu mentor, el Aprendiz de granja.","El Aprendiz de granja te proporcionó los ingredientes necesarios para crear una cebolla amarilla. Ahora debes cosechar tu <rgb=#FF00FF00>campo de cebollas amarillas</rgb> y obtener una <rgb=#FF00FF00>buena cosecha de cebollas amarillas</rgb>. Para encontrar el campo, activa la habilidad <rgb=#FF00FF00>Rastrear cultivos</rgb>.","El ayudante de granja novato te proporcionó una <rgb=#FF00FF00>caja</rgb> llena de ingredientes que puedes usar para cultivar la cebolla amarilla. Abre la <rgb=#FF00FF00>caja</rgb> para obtener los ingredientes.\
\
<rgb=#FF00FF00>Los ingredientes para los granjeros normalmente se compran a los vendedores o se descubren mientras trabajas en el campo. También puedes encontrar ingredientes en la Casa de Subastas.</rgb>","Has recogido una cebolla amarilla","Habla con el jornalero agrícola novato cerca de las tierras de cultivo en el área de artesanía","Deberías hablar con el ayudante de granja novato para aprender más sobre el oficio de granjero y encaminarte hacia una buena alimentación.","Ahora tienes todos los ingredientes para cultivar una cebolla amarilla","Has activado Detección de cultivos","Activa la habilidad <rgb=#FF00FF00>Detección de cultivos</rgb>","Lleva la <rgb=#FF00FF00>cebolla amarilla</rgb> al ayudante de granja novato","Introducción a la Agricultura","Abre la <rgb=#FF00FF00>caja</rgb> que te entregó el Aprendiz de Granja para recoger la semilla de cultivo para aprendiz, el balde de agua y un puñado de fertilizante","La agricultura es una profesión especialmente importante, ya que los granjeros proveen al mundo de alimentos, y como cualquier hobbit puede atestiguar, la comida es una de las mercancías más preciadas que existen.\
\
<rgb=#FF00FF00>¡Cuidado! Necesitarás completar las recetas correctas y entregar los objetos indicados en esta misión. \
\
Deberás realizar las recetas de campo de cebollas amarillas y la receta de la cebolla amarilla y entregar la cebolla amarilla. Si no lo haces, tendrás que obtener nuevos materiales crudos o reiniciar la misión tras un retraso de 24 horas.</rgb>","Usando los ingredientes que recibiste, siembra un <rgb=#FF00FF00>campo de cebollas amarillas</rgb>","Se te han proporcionado ingredientes","Usando los ingredientes que tienes, elige una <rgb=#FF00FF00>cebolla amarilla</rgb> en el banco de trabajo","Has plantado un campo de cebollas amarillas","Has obtenido una <rgb=#FF00FF00>buena cosecha de cebollas amarillas</rgb>"}},
[7613]={nameES="Introducción a la Agricultura",objectivesES={"Recolecta la <rgb=#FF00FF00>buena cosecha de cebollas amarillas</rgb>","La receta está completa. <rgb=#FF00FF00>¡No cocines ni vendas la cebolla amarilla!</rgb> Es hora de mostrar tu trabajo a tu mentor, el ayudante de granja novato.","El ayudante de granja novato te proporcionó una <rgb=#FF00FF00>caja</rgb> llena de ingredientes que puedes usar para cultivar la cebolla amarilla. Abre la <rgb=#FF00FF00>caja</rgb> para obtener los ingredientes.\
\
<rgb=#FF00FF00>Los ingredientes para los granjeros normalmente se compran a los vendedores o se descubren mientras trabajas en el campo. También puedes encontrar ingredientes en la Casa de Subastas.</rgb>","Has recogido una cebolla amarilla","Habla con el jornalero agrícola novato cerca de las tierras de cultivo en el área de artesanía","Con los ingredientes que recibiste, planta un <rgb=#FF00FF00>campo de cebollas amarillas</rgb> en el <rgb=#FF00FF00>terreno de cultivo</rgb>","Deberías hablar con el ayudante de granja novato para aprender más sobre el oficio de granjero y encaminarte hacia una buena alimentación.","El ayudante de granja novato te proporcionó los ingredientes necesarios para cultivar cebollas amarillas. Ahora debes cosechar tu <rgb=#FF00FF00>campo de cebollas amarillas</rgb> y obtener una <rgb=#FF00FF00>buena cosecha de cebollas amarillas</rgb>. Para encontrar el campo, activa la habilidad <rgb=#FF00FF00>Detección de cultivos</rgb>.","Ahora tienes todos los ingredientes para cultivar una cebolla amarilla","Con los ingredientes que tienes, recoge una <rgb=#FF00FF00>cebolla amarilla</rgb> en el <rgb=#FF00FF00>banco de trabajo</rgb>","Has activado Detección de cultivos","Activa la habilidad <rgb=#FF00FF00>Detección de cultivos</rgb>","El ayudante de granja novato te proporcionó los ingredientes necesarios para crear un campo de cebollas amarillas. Sin embargo, primero debes plantar tu <rgb=#FF00FF00>campo de cebollas amarillas</rgb>.\
\
<rgb=#FF00FF00>Para abrir tu panel de artesanía, puedes usar la tecla 'T' o hacer clic sobre el botón de artesanía (tiene el Ícono de un martillo y un yunque) en la parte inferior izquierda de tu interfaz.\
\
Selecciona la pestaña de Agricultura en la interfaz de artesanía y busca la receta correspondiente.\
\
Recuerda: para ejecutar una receta debes estar cerca de la instalación adecuada. La Agricultura requiere un terreno de cultivo.</rgb>","Lleva la <rgb=#FF00FF00>cebolla amarilla</rgb> al ayudante de granja novato","Introducción a la Agricultura","La Agricultura produce algunos bienes terminados, pero gran parte de su rendimiento consiste en cultivos, flores y otros ingredientes que Cocineros y Eruditos necesitan para ejercer sus propios oficios.\
\
<rgb=#FF00FF00>¡Ten cuidado! Debes completar las recetas correctas y entregar los objetos solicitados en esta misión.\
\
Deberás ejecutar las recetas del campo de cebollas amarillas y de la cebolla amarilla, y entregar la cebolla amarilla. Si no lo haces, deberás obtener nuevos materiales o reiniciar la misión tras una espera de 24 horas.</rgb>","Abre la <rgb=#FF00FF00>caja</rgb> que te entregó el Aprendiz de Granja para recoger la semilla de cultivo para aprendiz, el balde de agua y un puñado de fertilizante","Has cosechado tu campo y ahora puedes recoger la <rgb=#FF00FF00>cebolla amarilla</rgb>, como indicó el ayudante de granja novato. Dirígete a un <rgb=#FF00FF00>banco de trabajo</rgb> cercano para revisar tu cosecha.","Se te han proporcionado ingredientes","Has plantado un campo de cebollas amarillas","Has obtenido una <rgb=#FF00FF00>buena cosecha de cebollas amarillas</rgb>"}},
[7614]={nameES="Introducción al oficio leñador",objectivesES={"Las recetas están completas. <rgb=#FF00FF00>¡No vendas el cuero ligero cepillado ni la tabla fina de serbal!</rgb> Es hora de mostrar tu trabajo a tu mentor, el Proveedor.","Abre la <rgb=#FF00FF00>caja</rgb> entregada por el proveedor para recoger las dos pieles ligeras, dos troncos de serbal y un trozo de cera","Deberías hablar con el Proveedor para aprender más sobre el oficio de leñador.","Habla con el proveedor en el área de artesanía","Usa los ingredientes que recibiste para fabricar una <rgb=#FF00FF00>tabla fina de serbal</rgb>","Has fabricado un trozo de cuero ligero cepillado","Has fabricado una tabla fina de serbal","El Proveedor te proporcionó los ingredientes necesarios para crear una pieza de <rgb=#FF00FF00>cuero ligero cepillado</rgb> y una <rgb=#FF00FF00>tabla fina de serbal</rgb>.","Usando los ingredientes que recibiste, fabrica una pieza de <rgb=#FF00FF00>cuero ligero cepillado</rgb>","Ahora tienes todos los ingredientes para fabricar un cuero ligero cepillado y una tabla fina de serbal","Entrega el <rgb=#FF00FF00>cuero ligero cepillado y la tabla fina de serbal</rgb> al proveedor","El Proveedor te proporcionó una <rgb=#FF00FF00>caja</rgb> llena de ingredientes que puedes usar para ejecutar las recetas de leñador. Abre la <rgb=#FF00FF00>caja</rgb> para obtener los ingredientes.\
\
<rgb=#FF00FF00>Los ingredientes para leñadores se encuentran entre las ramas caídas o en las muchas bestias que merodean en la naturaleza, y algunos se compran a proveedores. También puedes encontrar ingredientes en la Sala de Subastas.</rgb>","Introducción al oficio leñador","Se te han proporcionado ingredientes","Los leñadores recolectan la madera de las ramas caídas. También son expertos en el tratamiento de la madera para su uso; pero su saber no termina ahí, pues también curten las pieles de las bestias que se encuentran en la naturaleza. Estas habilidades aprendidas proporcionan a carpinteros y sastres los materiales necesarios para ejercer sus oficios. Esta profesión de recolección es muy demandada y con frecuencia rentable en la Tierra Media.\
\
<rgb=#FF00FF00>¡Cuidado! Deberás completar las recetas correctas y entregar los objetos indicados en esta misión. \
\
Deberás ejecutar las recetas de serbal tratado y de cuero ligero, y entregar las finas tablas de serbal y el cuero ligero cepillado. Si no lo haces, tendrás que obtener nuevas materias primas o reiniciar la misión después de un retraso de 24 horas.</rgb>"}},
[7615]={nameES="Introducción al oficio de leñador",objectivesES={"Las recetas están completas. <rgb=#FF00FF00>¡No vendas el cuero ligero cepillado ni la tabla fina de serbal!</rgb> Es hora de mostrar tu trabajo a tu mentor, el Proveedor.","La Proveedora Principal te proporcionó una <rgb=#FF00FF00>caja</rgb> llena de ingredientes que puedes usar para ejecutar las recetas del oficio de Leñador. Abre la <rgb=#FF00FF00>caja</rgb> para obtener los ingredientes.\
\
<rgb=#FF00FF00>Los ingredientes para Leñadores se encuentran entre ramas caídas, obtenidos de bestias salvajes, o comprados a proveedores. También puedes encontrar ingredientes en la Casa de Subastas.</rgb>","Deberías hablar con la Proveedora Principal para aprender más sobre el oficio de Leñador.","Abre la <rgb=#FF00FF00>caja</rgb> que te entregó la Proveedora Principal para recoger las dos pieles ligeras, los dos troncos de serbal y el trozo de cera","La Proveedora Principal te proporcionó los ingredientes necesarios para crear una <rgb=#FF00FF00>pieza de cuero ligero cepillado</rgb> y una <rgb=#FF00FF00>tabla fina de serbal</rgb>.\
\
<rgb=#FF00FF00>Para abrir tu panel de artesanía puedes usar la tecla 'T' o hacer clic en el botón de artesanía en la parte inferior izquierda de tu interfaz.\
\
Selecciona la pestaña de Leñador en la IU de artesanía y busca la receta adecuada.\
\
Recuerda: para ejecutar una receta debes estar junto a la instalación adecuada. El oficio de Leñador requiere un banco de trabajo.</rgb>","Has fabricado un trozo de cuero ligero cepillado","Has fabricado una tabla fina de serbal","Introducción al oficio de leñador","Ahora tienes todos los ingredientes para fabricar un cuero ligero cepillado y una tabla fina de serbal","Entrega el <rgb=#FF00FF00>cuero ligero cepillado y la tabla fina de serbal</rgb> al proveedor","Habla con la Proveedora Principal en la zona de artesanía","Con los ingredientes recibidos, fabrica una <rgb=#FF00FF00>pieza de cuero ligero cepillado</rgb> en un <rgb=#FF00FF00>banco de trabajo</rgb>","Los Leñadores recolectan madera de ramas caídas y también curan pieles de las bestias salvajes. Estas habilidades proporcionan a carpinteros y sastres los materiales necesarios para ejercer sus oficios. Es una profesión muy necesaria y rentable en la Tierra Media.\
\
<rgb=#FF00FF00>¡Ten cuidado! Debes completar las recetas correctas y entregar los objetos indicados en esta misión.\
\
Deberás elaborar las recetas de madera de serbal tratada y cuero ligero, y entregar las tablas finas de serbal y el cuero ligero cepillado. Si fallas, deberás obtener nuevos materiales o reiniciar la misión tras 24 horas.</rgb>","Con los ingredientes recibidos, fabrica una <rgb=#FF00FF00>tabla fina de serbal</rgb> en un <rgb=#FF00FF00>banco de trabajo</rgb>","Se te han proporcionado ingredientes"}},
[7616]={nameES="Introducción a la joyería",objectivesES={"Lleva el <rgb=#FF00FF00>anillo de cobre</rgb> al joyero novato","Abre la <rgb=#FF00FF00>caja</rgb> que te dio el joyero novato para recoger los lingotes de cobre","Los joyeros crean adornos que pueden ser imbuidos con cierta cantidad de poder. Son miembros bienvenidos de los Gremios de Artesanía.\
\
<rgb=#FF00FF00>¡Cuidado! Necesitarás completar las recetas correctas y entregar los objetos requeridos indicados en esta misión.\
\
Deberás ejecutar la receta del anillo de cobre y entregar el anillo de cobre. Si no lo haces, tendrás que obtener nuevas materias primas o reiniciar la misión después de un retraso de 24 horas.</rgb>","El aprendiz de joyero te proporcionó los ingredientes necesarios para crear un <rgb=#FF00FF00>anillo de cobre</rgb>. Acércate al banco de trabajo y prepara el <rgb=#FF00FF00>anillo de cobre</rgb>.","Introducción a la joyería","Ahora tienes todos los ingredientes para fabricar un anillo de cobre","Usando el ingrediente que recibiste, fabrica un <rgb=#FF00FF00>anillo de cobre</rgb>","La receta está completa. <rgb=#FF00FF00>¡No vendas el anillo de cobre!</rgb> Es hora de mostrar tu trabajo a tu mentor, el aprendiz de joyero.","Has fabricado un anillo de cobre","El aprendiz de joyero te proporcionó una <rgb=#FF00FF00>caja</rgb> llena de ingredientes que puedes usar para realizar la receta del anillo de cobre. Abre la <rgb=#FF00FF00>caja</rgb> para obtener los ingredientes.\
\
<rgb=#FF00FF00>Los ingredientes para joyeros normalmente se compran a vendedores o se intercambian con jugadores con la profesión de minero. También puedes encontrar ingredientes en la Sala de Subastas.</rgb>","Deberías hablar con el joyero novato para aprender más sobre la fabricación de joyas.","Habla con el joyero novato cerca del banco de trabajo en la zona de artesanía","Se te han proporcionado ingredientes"}},
[7617]={nameES="Introducción a la joyería",objectivesES={"Con el ingrediente que recibiste, fabrica un <rgb=#FF00FF00>anillo de cobre</rgb> en un <rgb=#FF00FF00>banco de trabajo</rgb>","El aprendiz de joyero te proporcionó los ingredientes necesarios para crear un anillo de cobre. Acércate al banco de trabajo y prepara el <rgb=#FF00FF00>anillo de cobre</rgb>.\
\
<rgb=#FF00FF00>Para abrir tu panel de artesanía, puedes usar la tecla 'T' o hacer clic en el botón de artesanía (que parece un martillo y un yunque) en la parte inferior izquierda de tu interfaz.\
\
Selecciona la pestaña Joyero en la interfaz de artesanía y busca la receta adecuada.\
\
Recuerda: para ejecutar una receta debes estar cerca de la instalación apropiada. La joyería requiere un banco de trabajo.</rgb>","Lleva el <rgb=#FF00FF00>anillo de cobre</rgb> al joyero novato","Los Joyeros crean adornos que pueden estar imbuidos de cierto poder. Las joyas de calidad son necesarias para aventureros de todo tipo.\
\
<rgb=#FF00FF00>¡Ten cuidado! Debes completar las recetas correctas y entregar los objetos solicitados en esta misión.\
\
Deberás ejecutar la receta del anillo de cobre y entregar el anillo de cobre. Si fallas, deberás conseguir nuevos materiales o reiniciar la misión después de un retraso de 24 horas.</rgb>","Abre la <rgb=#FF00FF00>caja</rgb> que te dio el joyero novato para recoger los lingotes de cobre","Introducción a la joyería","Ahora tienes todos los ingredientes para fabricar un anillo de cobre","La receta está completa. <rgb=#FF00FF00>¡No vendas el anillo de cobre!</rgb> Es hora de mostrar tu trabajo a tu mentor, el aprendiz de joyero.","Has fabricado un anillo de cobre","El aprendiz de joyero te proporcionó una <rgb=#FF00FF00>caja</rgb> llena de ingredientes que puedes usar para realizar la receta del anillo de cobre. Abre la <rgb=#FF00FF00>caja</rgb> para obtener los ingredientes.\
\
<rgb=#FF00FF00>Los ingredientes para joyeros normalmente se compran a vendedores o se intercambian con jugadores con la profesión de minero. También puedes encontrar ingredientes en la Sala de Subastas.</rgb>","Deberías hablar con el joyero novato para aprender más sobre la fabricación de joyas.","Habla con el joyero novato cerca del banco de trabajo en la zona de artesanía","Se te han proporcionado ingredientes"}},
[7618]={nameES="Introducción a la herrería",objectivesES={"Entrega el <rgb=#FF00FF00>yelmo de bronce</rgb> al aprendiz de herrero.","Habla con el herrero novato junto a la forja en la zona de artesanía","Crea el <rgb=#FF00FF00>yelmo de bronce</rgb>, según las indicaciones del Aprendiz de herrero.","Ahora tienes todos los ingredientes para fabricar un yelmo de bronce","Deberías hablar con el aprendiz de herrero para aprender más sobre la herrería.","El aprendiz de herrero te proporcionó una <rgb=#FF00FF00>caja</rgb> llena de ingredientes que puedes usar para ejecutar la receta del yelmo de bronce. Abre la <rgb=#FF00FF00>caja</rgb> para obtener los ingredientes.\
\
<rgb=#FF00FF00>Los ingredientes para herreros normalmente se compran a vendedores o se intercambian con jugadores con la profesión de minero. También puedes encontrar ingredientes en la Sala de Subastas.</rgb>","Introducción a la herrería","La receta está completa. <rgb=#FF00FF00>¡No vendas el yelmo de bronce!</rgb> Es hora de mostrar tu trabajo a tu mentor, el Aprendiz de herrero.","Usando los ingredientes que tienes, forja un <rgb=#FF00FF00>yelmo de bronce</rgb>","Abre la <rgb=#FF00FF00>caja</rgb> que te dio el herrero novato para recoger los dos lingotes de bronce","Los herreros proporcionan armaduras y herramientas a los pueblos de la Tierra Media. Convertirse en herrero puede ser difícil, pero los objetos que suministran son una necesidad en todas partes.\
\
<rgb=#FF00FF00>¡Cuidado! Necesitarás completar las recetas correctas y entregar los objetos indicados en esta misión. \
\
Deberás elaborar la receta del yelmo de bronce y entregar el casco de bronce. Si no lo haces, tendrás que obtener nuevos materiales o reiniciar la misión tras un retraso de 24 horas.</rgb>","Has fabricado un yelmo de bronce","Se te han proporcionado ingredientes"}},
[7619]={nameES="Introducción a la herrería",objectivesES={"Entrega el <rgb=#FF00FF00>yelmo de bronce</rgb> al aprendiz de herrero.","Habla con el herrero novato junto a la forja en la zona de artesanía","Ahora tienes todos los ingredientes para fabricar un yelmo de bronce","Deberías hablar con el aprendiz de herrero para aprender más sobre la herrería.","Crea el <rgb=#FF00FF00>yelmo de bronce</rgb>, según las instrucciones del Aprendiz de herrero.\
