[7693]={nameES="Ivar Manosangrienta",objectivesES={"Ivar Manosangrienta","Radagast conoce el antiguo mal del Señor demacrado Ivar, apodado Manosangrienta, que está levantando un ejército de tumularios en Agamaur.","Entrega el yelmo de Ivar a Radagast, en el campamento de los Eglain","Ivar puede encontrarse en Garth Agarwen, en Agamaur, dentro de las Tierras Solitarias.\
\
Radagast no puede interferir directamente en la guerra buscando y destruyendo a Ivar Manosangrienta. Te ha pedido que vayas en su lugar y que le traigas el yelmo de Ivar como prueba de tu victoria."}},
[7694]={nameES="Ivory Spears",objectivesES={}},
[7695]={nameES="Iáphel Errands",objectivesES={"Complete 'The Crows of Iáphel'","Iáphel Errands","Talk to Miruhir","Miruhir has many tasks that need doing in and around his vineyard.","Complete 'Vineyard Pests'","Miruhir has asked you to help with many tasks around the vineyard.\
\
Complete quests in and around Iáphel.","Complete 'A Delivery for the Cooper'","Complete 'Fence Repair'","You have completed all the tasks that Miruhir gave you.\
\
Speak with him in Iáphel.","You have completed all the tasks that Miruhir has set before you. He looks so happy he could hug you. He doesn't because you are sweaty, he is sweaty, and despite his gratitude he doesn't know you that well.\
\
'What a gift you have for odd jobs! Could I convince you to stay on? Even for another day or so? Ah, you have other places to be. I understand.'\
\
He tries not to look too disappointed but he is a forthright man who wears his heart upon his sleeve."}},
[7696]={nameES="Iáphel's Wine Delivery Service",objectivesES={"Miruhir wishes to send some wine to his friend, Derva.","Miruhir has asked you to deliver wine to his friend, Derva, at the farm to the north.\
\
Deliver wine to Derva.","Talk to Derva","Iáphel's Wine Delivery Service"}},
[7697]={nameES="Jackal Begone",objectivesES={"Jackals can be found to the TBD of TBD.\
\
TBD Dog Lover, a concerned citizen in Jirush, has asked you to thin the number of jackals around TBD.","TBD Dog Lover can be found to the TBD of Jirush.\
\
Return to TBD Dog Lover.","Jackal Begone","Return to TBD Dog Lover","TBD Dog Lover, a concerned citizen of TBD, is worried about the jackal attacks assaulting travellers to Jirush. She especially seems concerned about her own faithful hound's safety."}},
[7698]={nameES="Jajax's Revenge",objectivesES={"Mourn Jajax's fallen allies","Speak with Jajax","Say farewell to Jajax","Summon and defeat Hebil","Jajax's Revenge","You have mourned Jajax's fallen allies","You have defeated Hebil, avenging the murdered Corsairs loyal to Jajax","The site of the massacre is south-west of Calembel.\
\
You should <rgb=#FF0000>mourn</rgb> Jajax's men at the site of the massacre.","Hebil's banner is at the massacre site in southern Lamedon.\
\
You should use the battle-horn on the banner to call Hebil to battle.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: Use the whistle to summon Jajax if you become separated.</rgb>","Jajax stands at the site of the Corsairs' massacre, in southern Lamedon.\
\
You should say farewell to Jajax.","Hebil has punished Jajax for allying himself with you in the most horrible way Jajax could ever imagine.","Jajax is at the site of Hebil's massacre.\
\
You should speak with Jajax.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: Use the whistle to summon Jajax if you become separated.</rgb>"}},
[7699]={nameES="Jal Vârsha: Axes of the Sûhalar",objectivesES={}},
[7700]={nameES="Jal Vârsha: Taking the North Wall",objectivesES={}},
[7701]={nameES="Jal Vârsha: The Guarded Ranks",objectivesES={}},
[7702]={nameES="Jal Vârsha: Turning the Tides",objectivesES={}},
[7703]={nameES="Jangovar Marauders",objectivesES={}},
[7704]={nameES="Jealous Neighbours",objectivesES={"Andûmu is worried that the jázgai that prowl near their camp at night will soon try to rob them of their food stores. You defeated some of them to thin their numbers and renew their fear of people. You should return to Andûmu in Gadim-ûn.","Talk to Andûmu","Andûmu is worried that the jázgai that prowl near their camp at night will soon try to rob them of their food stores. He has asked you to go to their den atop a hill south of Gadim-ûn called Spoiler's Crag and renew their fear of people.","Jealous Neighbours","A pack of jázgai have been less afraid of the people at Gadim-ûn of late, and have come close to venturing into the camp."}},
[7705]={nameES="Jeweller: Jewelled Coin",objectivesES={"<rgb=#FF0000>Completing Wildermore's Recovery will cancel this quest.</rgb>","A skilled jeweller such as yourself can help the refugees of Wildermore by crafting a jewelled coin for them.","Hildelith is in Forlaw.\
\
You have crafted a jewelled coin, and should now deliver it to Hildelith.","Jeweller: Jewelled Coin","Hildelith has given you a recipe for a jewelled coin.\
\
You should craft a jewelled coin for the impoverished refugees at Forlaw.","Deliver the jewelled coin to Hildelith"}},
[7706]={nameES="Joyas de Evendim",objectivesES={"Joyas de Evendim","Los gusanos se pueden encontrar en el Barandalf, al sur del Coloso.\
\
Herthdúr te ha pedido que busques piezas de joyería en los gusanos del Barandalf.","Cavando en las dunas, los gusanos podrían haber devorado otras piezas de joyería antigua.","Lleva las joyas a Herthdúr","Herthdúr está en el Coloso, al norte del Barandalf.\
\
Herthdúr estará ansioso por ver las antiguas joyas que has recuperado de las arenas."}},
[7707]={nameES="Joyas reptantes",objectivesES={"Encuntra a un montaraz en el campamento del Coloso para hablarle sobre el anillo que has encontrado","Joyas reptantes","Has encontrado un antiguo y opaco anillo entre los restos de un gusano. Un Montaraz del campamento del Coloso podría estar interesado en verlo.","El campamento del Coloso está al norte del Barandalf.\
\
Uno de los Montaraces del campamento del Coloso podría estar interesado en ver el anillo que has encontrado.","El anillo es opaco, y el diseño parece antiguo. No puedes discernir nada más sobre él. Deberías mostrárselo a uno de los Montaraces del campamento del Coloso."}},
[7708]={nameES="Únete a los Fronteros",objectivesES={"Únete a los Fronteros","El Segundo Oficial Bonce se puede encontrar fuera del Agujero Municipal en Cavada Grande. El Agujero Municipal está en un recinto amurallado en el lado norte de la ciudad.\
\
Deberías hablar con el Segundo Oficial de la Guardia de la Comarca, Bodo Bonce, en Cavada Grande, si deseas unirte a los Fronteros.","Para que puedas ayudar a los Hobbits de la Comarca, necesitarás unirte a los Fronteros de la Guardia."}},
[7709]={nameES="Joining the Battle",objectivesES={"The Barnavon Mine has been infested by bugan, who have driven forth the Boar-clan miners.","Bugan can be found within the Barnavon Mine.\
\
Argel has asked you to enter the Barnavon Mine and defeat many of the bugan which drove them out.","Joining the Battle","Talk to Argel at the mine","Defeated bugan chieftain","Defeat bugan chieftain","Argel is at the camp outside the Barnavon Mine.\
\
You should return to Argel with news of your deeds."}},
[7710]={nameES="Joining the Hunt",objectivesES={}},
[7711]={nameES="Joining the Hunt",objectivesES={"Skarding Wargsbane can be found on the battlefield.\
\
You should talk to Skarding Wargsbane.","The ground shakes as the beast approaches!","Azhatarg has been defeated!","Search Howlers' Notch for Azhatar","Examine where the trail of destruction ends","Examine the destruction","Defeat Azhatarg","Howlers' Notch can be found in Elderslade.\
\
You should search Howlers' Notch with Skarding by your side.","Skarding Wargsbane can be found at Shakal-atrâd.\
\
You should talk to Skarding Wargsbane.","Examine the trail of destruction","Talk to Skarding Wargsbane.","No sign of Azhatar here, but it looks like there was recent conflict","Talk to Skarding Wargsbane at Shakal-atrâd","This is very much broken","This Orc was mauled by a great force","This has been recently broken","Talk to Skarding Wargsbane","Skarding Wargsbane, the great Beorning hunter, tracks a deadly beast upon the battlefield.","Joining the Hunt","This dwarf was mauled, just as the Orc you saw","Use the whistle to summon Skarding if you become separated","Examine the dead dwarf","Howlers' Notch can be found in Elderslade.\
\
Follow the travel of destruction from Howlers' Notch.","Continue following the trail"}},
[7712]={nameES="Journey to Jiret-menêsh",objectivesES={"As you began to speak with the guard, Mêshaget and Khagâmi arrived behind you. You should talk to Mêshaget.","Ir a Jiret-menêsh","Journey to Jiret-menêsh","Talk to the guard","A guard is asking you to stop","Jiret-menêsh is located in north-western An Shêru, atop a mountain peak.","As you approached the entrance to Jiret-menêsh, a guard asked you to stop. You should talk to her.","Talk to Mêshaget","Mêshaget has invited you to visit his home, Jiret-menêsh."}},
[7713]={nameES="Joyous Jam",objectivesES={"Bring the jam to Gírta","Now is the time to <rgb=#00FF00>dance</rgb> and crush the grapes","Joyous Jam","Tienes una tanda de uvas recién pisadas listas para convertirse en mermelada","The grape tub can be found at the Beorninghús.\
\
You should place the grapes that you have collected into the tub.","The grape tub can be found at the Beorninghús.\
\
You should stomp on the grapes.","The wash bucket can be found at the Beorninghús.\
\
You should wash your feet before stomping on grapes.","Now it is time to crush the grapes!","The grape tub can be found at the Beorninghús.\
\
You should remove the crushed grapes from the tub.","The next step: give the honey jar a shake or two","Add the crushed grapes to a half-empty honey jar","Crush the grapes by doing a <rgb=#00FF00>dance</rgb> on them","Gírta can be found at the Beorninghús.\
\
You should bring the jam to Gírta.","Place the grapes into the tub at the Beorninghús","Your stamping feet crush the grapes most effectively","A honey jar can be found at the Beorninghús.\
\
You should add the crushed grapes to the jar.","You should shake the jar.","The vineyard can be found west of the Beorninghús.\
\
You should gather some grapes for making jam.","Gírta asked you to make jam from scratch: a difficult task, but one which the Beorning matriarch believes you can accomplish. Perhaps it would be best to begin by picking grapes in the orchard.","Perfectly shaken!","Recoge las uvas pisadas de la tinaja","Métete en la tinaja","For those visiting the Beorninghús, it is important to help in the daily work of Beornings.","Wash your feet in the wash bucket","Perhaps a good wash would do before the grapes are crushed","Give the jar a good <rgb=#00FF00>shake</rgb>"}},
[7714]={nameES="Judgement Clouded By Grief",objectivesES={"Gárferth and Edsig are in the Mead Hall at Forlaw.\
\
You should speak with Gárferth and Edsig.","Gárwig is in the Mead Hall of Forlaw.\
\
You should speak with Gárwig.","Cyneberg recommends caution after seeing what Núrzum was capable of","Speak with Edsig","Judgement Clouded By Grief","Gárferth is bent on revenge","Edsig wishes to avenge his fallen brothers and nephews","Speak with Gárwig","Hear Edsig's thoughts","Gárferth, Edsig, and Cyneberg are in the Mead Hall at Forlaw.\
\
You should speak with Gárferth, Edsig, and Cyneberg to hear what they think should be done about Núrzum.","Gárwig wishes to act to protect his realm, but he knows that his judgement is deeply clouded by the grief of his loss.","Hear Cyneberg's thoughts","Hear Gárferth's thoughts","Talk to Gárferth"}},
[7715]={nameES="¿Solo suciedad y baratijas?",objectivesES={"Caron está al oeste de Tharbad, en la orilla del río.","Has recogido una vieja insignia de Tharbad... ¡esto no es basura después de todo!","Los orcos que merodean por la ciudad inundada de Tharbad podrían haber encontrado objetos de valor.","Caron ha dejado volar su imaginación, y se pregunta si los orcos podrían haber recogido algo de valor entre las ruinas de la ciudad inundada.","Derrota orcos en Tharbad y recupera objetos de valor (5/6)","Lleva la vieja insignia a Caron al oeste de Tharbad"}},
[7716]={nameES="Just Walked Away",objectivesES={}},
[7717]={nameES="Just a Warm-up",objectivesES={"You have defeated many hobgoblins in the Pit of Stonejaws.\
\
You should talk to Scout-master Ausma at Bárgstad.","Just a Warm-up","Scout-master Ausma has asked you to deal with any hobgoblins that cross your path while you complete your initial reconnaissance.","Talk to Scout-master Ausma at Bárgstad","Scout-master Ausma has asked you to defeat any hobgoblins you come across while looking for Shakhajât.\
\
You should defeat hobgoblins in the Pit of Stonejaws."}},
[7718]={nameES="Justice Served",objectivesES={"Gísling can be found in eastern Snowbourn to the north of the east gate.\
\
You should speak with Gísling now that he has been freed from his imprisonment.","Meet Fastred in the prison of Snowbourn","Justice Served","Gísling's cell is inside the prison of Snowbourn.\
\
You should open Gísling's cell and return to him his freedom now that Sigeric has been exposed as a traitor.","Talk to Fastred in the prison of Snowbourn","Fastred has told you to meet him in the prison of Snowbourn, located near the Mead Hall.\
\
You should speak with Fastred, as he instructed.","Talk to Gísling in Snowbourn","The Rohirrim of Snowbourn have captured Sigeric from the croft where you defeated him.","Gísling looks as if he wishes to say something to Fastred, but he remains silent","Release Gísling from his cell","Fastred is in the prison of Snowbourn, located near the Mead Hall.\
\
Fastred wants you to meet with him so that he can right his recent wrongs."}},
[7719]={nameES="La Cerveza Especial de Jónar",objectivesES={"La Cerveza Especial de Jónar","Jónar, un enano siniestro de la Mansión de Thorin, te ha enviado a una búsqueda para recolectar los ingredientes de su bebida especial.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando finalice el festival actual.</rgb>","Jónar se encuentra en el sótano de la Mansión de Thorin.\
\
Deberías llevarle a Jónar todos los ingredientes repugnantes que recolectaste durante tu aventura.","Huevo crudo podrido recolectado","Los ingredientes de Jónar pueden encontrarse en los siguientes lugares: el gas de pantano se encuentra en el Pantano de los Juncos. El huevo crudo puede encontrarse en la granja de Arenilla. La baba de babosa viscosa puede encontrarse a lo largo de la orilla del río, cerca de Celondim.\
\
Deberías recolectar gas de pantano, un huevo crudo y baba de babosa para la cerveza especial de Jónar.","Lleva los ingredientes repugnantes a Jónar","Recolecta un huevo crudo podrido en la granja de Arenilla"}},
[7720]={nameES="La Entrega Especial de Jónar",objectivesES={"Lleva la bebida especial de Jónar al Árbol de la Fiesta","Este sería un buen lugar para destapar la bebida especial de Jónar","La Entrega Especial de Jónar","El Árbol de la Fiesta se encuentra en Hobbiton, en la Comarca.\
\
Deberías activar el horrible brebaje de Jónar alrededor de la concentración de asistentes al festival de la Comarca para arruinarles el día.","Jónar se encuentra en el sótano de la Mansión de Thorin.\
\
Deberías regresar junto a Jónar y contarle todo lo ocurrido.","Regresa con Jónar en la Mansión de Thorin","Jónar desea que lleves su horrible brebaje a una zona poblada de La Comarca, donde arruinará el día de cualquiera que se encuentre cerca.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando finalice el festival actual.</rgb>","Has desatado un hedor terrible","Los vapores del brebaje vil provocaron una explosión","Usa la bebida especial de Jónar en quienes asisten al festival de la Comarca","El Árbol de la Fiesta se encuentra en la Comarca, en el pueblo de Hobbiton.\
\
Deberías llevar la bebida especial de Jónar al Árbol de la Fiesta, donde sin duda arruinará el día de muchos hobbits que se han reunido allí."}},
[7721]={nameES="Kafagur's Fallen",objectivesES={}},
[7722]={nameES="Kalabrazân, Scourge of the Dale-lands",objectivesES={}},
[7723]={nameES="Kang-kethek the Sorcerer",objectivesES={"Defeat the sorcerer Kang-kethek quickly","Kang-kethek the Sorcerer","<rgb=#FF0000>You have left Kang-kethek unchallenged for too long.</rgb>","<rgb=#FF0000>Defeat Kang-kethek before he vanishes</rgb>","The fell Haradrim Sorcerer Kang-kethek has come into the area. Defeat him before he turns the tide of the combat.\
\
This quest starts with <rgb=#FFFF00>empty</rgb> Merit Rating.\
\
<rgb=#00FF00>Merit Gain:</rgb>\
* Defeat Kang-kethek\
* Defeat Kang-kethek quickly","Defeat Kang-kethek quickly, before you and your allies succumb to his sorcery."}},
[7724]={nameES="Kang-kethek the Sorcerer",objectivesES={"Defeat the sorcerer Kang-kethek quickly","Kang-kethek the Sorcerer","<rgb=#FF0000>You have left Kang-kethek unchallenged for too long.</rgb>","<rgb=#FF0000>Defeat Kang-kethek before he vanishes</rgb>","The fell Haradrim Sorcerer Kang-kethek has come into the area. Defeat him before he turns the tide of the combat.\
\
This quest starts with <rgb=#FFFF00>empty</rgb> Merit Rating.\
\
<rgb=#00FF00>Merit Gain:</rgb>\
* Defeat Kang-kethek\
* Defeat Kang-kethek quickly","Defeat Kang-kethek quickly, before you and your allies succumb to his sorcery."}},
[7725]={nameES="Karazgar's Gambit",objectivesES={"After confronting the Weeping Warrior at Caras Tilion, Thranduil returned to Felegoth with no memory of his encounter with Karazgar.","As you step into the pool of water, a towering figure appears before you...","Search Caras Tilion for signs of the Weeping Warrior","Caras Tilion can be found to the south of Felegoth in Eryn Lasgalen.\
\
Unable to remember anything after encountering Karazgar, Thranduil has asked you to seek the Weeping Warrior in Caras Tilion.","As Thranduil feared, the battle consumed Elves and Men alike, but Karazgar fled deeper into Caras Tilion...","Follow the trail of rust deeper into Caras Tilion","Karazgar's Gambit","The trail of rust leads deeper into Caras Tilion.\
\
You should follow the trail of rust into Caras Tilion and attempt to learn what has transpired.","The trail of rust leads deeper into Caras Tilion.\
\
You have found what remains of Thranduil's company and Karazgar's agents in Caras Tilion, but it appears Karazgar escaped this encounter. You should search for him deeper in Caras Tilion.","Talk to the Green Lady","The Green Lady is standing in the centre of Caras Tilion.\
\
You have followed Karazgar's trail to a rust-laden pool in Caras Tilion. The Green Lady that Thranduil described has revealed herself to you. You should attempt to speak to her and learn what has transpired.","The trail of rust leads deeper into Caras Tilion...","You notice a trail of scattered rust leading deeper into Caras Tilion..."}},
[7726]={nameES="Karstíona, emisaria de los Trév Duvárdain",objectivesES={"Minas Agar se alza en el lado oeste de Barad Gúlaran, al sur de Gath Forthnír.\
\
Debes viajar a Barad Gúlaran y derrotar a Karstíona, la emisaria de los Trév Duvárdain, en el interior de Minas Agar.","Los Trév Duvárdain han enviado a un emisario a Agar para tratar con los lacayos de la Corona de Hierro.","Karstíona, emisaria de los Trév Duvárdain","Brúnfair está en Gath Forthnír, al norte de Barad Gúlaran.\
\
Tras derrotar a Karstíona, debes volver a ver a Brúnfair y decirle que has tenido éxito.","Entra en Minas Agar y derrota a Karstíona"}},
[7727]={nameES="Oculto del Enemigo",objectivesES={"Consigue el mapa con la ruta a Esteldín","Oculto del Enemigo","No encuentras ningún mapa en este Montaraz.","El Montaraz caído que llevaba el mapa con la ruta a Esteldín está en el algún lugar de los estanques y jardines de Glinghant, más allá de la plaza de Clorhir, en Annúminas.\
\
Harthadril te ha pedido que saques el mapa con la ruta a Esteldín de Glinghant.","Mapa con la ruta a Estledín recuperado"}},
[7728]={nameES="Keep Slaughtering the Free Peoples",objectivesES={"Taskmaster Sharkúlob is at Gramsfoot in the Ettenmoors.\
\
You took the place of a troll in Angmar while it wrought destruction against the forces of the Free Peoples in the Ettenmoors. You should speak with Taskmaster Sharkûlob.","Talk to Taskmaster Sharkúlob at Gramsfoot and complete a patrol through the Ettenmoors as a Troll (Cost: 500 Commendations)","Taskmaster Sharkúlob is at Gramsfoot in the Ettenmoors.\
\
The trolls from Angmar, in an effort to speed the victory of Angmar's army, are willing to come to the Ettenmoors to fight the Free Peoples in exchange for your services in the North. You should speak with Taskmaster Sharkûlob.","Los trolls de Angmar tienen un único objetivo: destruir a los enemigos de Angmar.","Keep Slaughtering the Free Peoples","Talk to Taskmaster Sharkúlob at Gramsfoot"}},
[7729]={nameES="Keeper of the Dead",objectivesES={}},
[7730]={nameES="Guardianes y Cautivos",objectivesES={"Entrega las llaves a Oghûk en su celda dentro de la prisión de la Ciudad de los Trasgos","Guardianes y Cautivos","El trasgo Oghûk quiere que lo ayudes a escapar de su celda.","Los carceleros trasgos se encuentran en las mazmorras de la Ciudad de los Trasgos.\
\
Oghûk cree que los carceleros de la prisión de la Ciudad de los Trasgos tienen las llaves de su celda. Quiere que mates a los carceleros y encuentres las llaves. Solo te ayudará después de que lo liberes."}},
[7731]={nameES="Guardianes de los Muertos",objectivesES={"Durante el rescate de Malloval, descubriste que los Corcur están aliados con los tumularios, pero no aprendiste nada más.","Emblema de demacrado recogido","Este emblema lleva marcas que pertenecen a un demacrado llamado Gúrdring. Esa vil criatura debe ser encontrada y destruida.","Los hombres de las colinas de Rhudaur pueden encontrarse por todas las ruinas de Nan Tornaeth, especialmente al otro lado del puente de Thoriant.\
\
Los hombres de las colinas de Rhudaur tienen alguna conexión vil con los tumularios que merodean por las ruinas de Nan Tornaeth, y deberías buscar entre ellos algún símbolo que revele a su amo común.","Los hombres de las colinas de Rhudaur podrían tener algún símbolo que revele a su amo común","Recoge un símbolo de los hombres de las colinas de Rhudaur","Has encontrado el emblema del demacrado Gúrdring y deberías buscar a esa criatura maligna antes de que su poder se vuelva demasiado grande.","Guardianes de los Muertos"}},
[7732]={nameES="Keepers of the Ered Lithui",objectivesES={}},
[7733]={nameES="Keepers of the Sacred Tarn",objectivesES={"After discovering that a number of the crystal-lamps along the banks of Durthuzâram have been befouled by slime and muck, Hermáth Stormhammer has resolved to see them restored to their former glory.","Befouled crystal-lamps can be found along the banks of Durthuzâram.\
\
After lending you his handkerchief, Hermáth Stormhammer has asked you to polish the befouled crystal-lamps along the banks of Durthuzâram.","Keepers of the Sacred Tarn","Talk to Hermáth Stormhammer"}},
[7734]={nameES="Guardianes del bosque",objectivesES={"Habla con Lithuilas en Gwingris","Guardianes del bosque","Los trolls silvanos se encuentran cerca de Sâd Thareg, al sur de Gwingris.\
\
Lithuilas te ha pedido que derrotes a los trolls silvanos de Glâd Ereg y averigües su propósito allí. Te ha sugerido que lleves uno o dos aliados contigo.","Lithuilas ha averiguado que hay un grupo de trolls silvanos en Glâd Ereg y cree que son los responsables de provocar al bosque.","Lithuilas está en Gwingris, al norte de Sâd Thareg.\
\
Deberías volver a ver a Lithuilas con las noticias de tu éxito."}},
[7735]={nameES="Keeping Back the Cold",objectivesES={}},
[7736]={nameES="Keeping Them On Guard",objectivesES={"You have done your duty to Captain Róglarg and patrolled the Under-gate, but it seems your threats were likely not fully understood by the Under-gate wardens.\
\
It seems that the children of Shelob have begun to amass on the other side of the Under-gate.","Keeping Them On Guard","<rgb=#FF00FF>Shake your fist</rgb> at the Under-gate wardens","Patrol the Under-gate in the Tower of Cirith Ungol","The Under-gate can be found in the rear of the Tower of Cirith Ungol.\
\
Captain Róglarg has asked you to patrol the Under-gate and threaten the Uruk guards if they have been remiss in their duties.","Captain Róglarg is concerned that the Uruks guards of the Under-gate have shirking their duties.","The Under-gate wardens stand before the Under-gate in the Tower of Cirith Ungol.\
\
You have heard strange sounds on the other side of the Under-gate and should now threaten the Under-gate wardens as Captain Róglarg commanded.","You have done your duty to Captain Róglarg and patrolled the Under-gate.","Completado","You hear faint, but frantic scraping and screeching on the other side of the Under-gate..."}},
[7737]={nameES="Keeping Them at Bay",objectivesES={"Keeping Them at Bay","You should gather your allies and defeat the monstrous trolls that inhabit the Limlight Gorge to prevent them from mustering numbers that might threaten Stangard.","Captain Agelbrit is at the Limlight Gorge guard-post.\
\
You should return to Captain Agelbrit with news of your success.","Captain Agelbrit fears that the trolls of the Limight Gorge may gather their strength to attack Stangard.","Talk to Captain Agelbrit"}},
[7738]={nameES="Keeping Up Appearances",objectivesES={"Rhadrog has asked you to use the Haerondir Horn in certain places around Haerondir, and to use it to scare nearby curious Orcs.","Keeping Up Appearances","Rhadrog can be found in Haerondir.\
\
You should speak with Rhadrog.","Curious Orcs can be found outside of Haerondir.\
\
Use the Haerondir Horn to spook curious Orcs who have wandered too close to Haerondir.","The spooked Orc runs away!","Use the Haerondir Horn at horn-blowing spots in Haerondir.","Speak with Rhadrog"}},
[7739]={nameES="Keeping the Fires Lit",objectivesES={}},
[7740]={nameES="Keeping the Flame Lit",objectivesES={"Baráil in Sâr Marsag has asked you to travel west to Hadrudád and collect suitable firewood to keep their flame lit as well as defeat any of the monstrous huorns you encounter.","Baráil in Sâr Marsag has asked you to travel to Hadrudád and collect suitable firewood to keep their flame lit as well as defeat any of the monstrous huorns you encounter.","Keeping the Flame Lit","Return to Baráil with the firewood","Return to Baráil in Sâr Marsag with the firewood you have collected to keep the flame lit."}},
[7741]={nameES="Mantener puros a los Norsu",objectivesES={"Mantener puros a los Norsu","Regresa junto a Mika en Norsu-hauta y cuéntale tu éxito.","Mika reconoce las marcas del colmillo como hechicería angmarim trazada por la mano de un Gauradan. Quiere que encuentres y derrotes al vidente gauradan que se atreve a intentar corromper a uno de los mamuts de los Lossoth.","Busca por los alrededores de Norsu-hauta al vidente gauradan que está intentando ensorcelar a un mamut.","Derrota a un vidente gauradan que está intentando ensorcelar a un mamut","Has derrotado al vidente gauradan"}},
[7742]={nameES="Keeping the Orphans Busy",objectivesES={"Fence posts can be found scattered around the western side of Forlaw.","Ansith is inside Gárferth's house, near the centre of Forlaw. Ansith and Ebba are preparing dinner after the long day.","Cuthmar can be found on the western side of Forlaw busy with his chores.","Speak to Ansith","Speak to Cuthmar","The two orphans of Gárwig's kin, sired by Cuthbald and Merwyn, are now cared for by Ebba. After the recent events and the funeral, they need not dwell on such times as the adults will, and are being kept busy with chores.","Return the fence posts to Cuthmar","Keeping the Orphans Busy","Snow piles on the western side of Forlaw are building up. \
\
Most of the residents cannot remember the snow in Forlaw ever being quite this bad."}},
[7743]={nameES="Keeping the Roads Safe",objectivesES={"Talk to Hállkell","Keeping the Roads Safe","The ambushed caravan can be found along the western end of the main road in Eryn Lasgalen.\
\
You should investigate the caravan.","It is doubtful they saw the ambush coming","Hállkell is visibly shaken","Still no signs of trouble","Nothing to report here","The road continues to the west, towards the Vales of Anduin.\
\
Continue to patrol the main road to the west for Orcs.","A caravan ahead has met with conflict","Continue to patrol the road through Eryn Lasgalen for Orcs","Hállkell can be found along the western end of the main road in Eryn Lasgalen.\
\
You should talk to the merchant again.","The main road through Eryn Lasgalen can be found south of Felegoth.\
\
You should patrol the road for Orcs.","Patrol the main road through Eryn Lasgalen for Orcs","The dead Elves bear blackened puncture wounds","Having concluded the spiders have left Mirkwood, Thranduil focuses on keeping the roads safe in hope that trade can resume.","The road continues east and west.\
\
Continue patrolling for Orcs along the main road to the west.","The Beorning merchant can be found along the western end of the main road in Eryn Lasgalen.\
\
You should talk to the merchant and find out what happened to the caravan.","Are those... spider-webs?"}},
[7744]={nameES="Carrera de saltos de barril: La credulidad de Kolmar",objectivesES={"Carrera de saltos de barril: La credulidad de Kolmar","Habla con Arnar","Observa la carrera para ver si Kolmar resulta vencedor","Kolmar ha perdido la carrera","Has abandonado la zona de la carrera","Arnar se encuentra en la zona de la carrera de barriles durante el Festival de Verano.\
\
Deberías hablar con Arnar y recoger la abundante recompensa que tiene para ofrecerte por tu excelente suerte.","La carrera de saltos de barril comenzará pronto en este mismo circuito.\
\
Has predicho que Kolmar ganará la carrera, y ahora deberías observar si tu predicción se cumple.","No abandones la zona de la carrera","Tienes un interés personal en el éxito de Kolmar mientras participa en la carrera de saltos de barril del Festival de Verano."}},
[7745]={nameES="Carrera de saltos de barril: Corre, Lar",objectivesES={"Lar ha perdido la carrera","Observa la carrera para ver si Lar resulta victorioso","Habla con Arnar","La carrera de saltos de barril comenzará pronto en este mismo circuito.\
\
Crees que Lar ganará la carrera y deberías observar si esto se cumple.","Has abandonado la zona de la carrera","No abandones la zona de la carrera","Arnar se encuentra en la zona de la carrera de barriles durante el Festival de Verano.\
\
Deberías hablar con Arnar y recoger la generosa recompensa que tiene para ofrecerte por tu excelente suerte.","Tienes un interés personal en el éxito de Lar mientras participa en la carrera de saltos de barril del Festival de Verano.","Carrera de saltos de barril: Corre, Lar"}},
[7746]={nameES="Carrera de saltos de barril: ¡A la carrera!",objectivesES={"Carrera de saltos de barril: ¡A la carrera!","Habla con Jorfi","Jorfi ofrece un par de entradas gratuitas para la Carrera de saltos de barril del Festival de Verano.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando finalice el festival actual. </rgb>","Habla con Jorfi para recibir dos entradas gratuitas para las carreras de saltos de barril."}},
[7747]={nameES="Carrera de salto de barriles: Ottó el extraordinario",objectivesES={"Ottó ha perdido la carrera","Habla con Arnar","Tienes un interés personal en el éxito de Ottó mientras participa en la carrera de salto de barriles del Festival de Verano.","Observa la carrera para ver si Ottó resulta victorioso","Has abandonado la zona de la carrera","Arnar se encuentra en la zona de la carrera de barriles durante el Festival de Verano.\
\
Deberías hablar con Arnar y recoger la generosa recompensa que tiene para ofrecerte por tu excelente suerte.","No abandones la zona de la carrera","Carrera de salto de barriles: Ottó el extraordinario","La carrera de salto de barriles comenzará pronto en este mismo circuito.\
\
Has predicho que Ottó ganará la carrera, y deberías observar si tu predicción se cumple."}},
[7748]={nameES="Carrera de saltos de barril: El paso veloz de Signar",objectivesES={"Habla con Arnar","Carrera de saltos de barril: El paso veloz de Signar","Has abandonado la zona de la carrera","Observa la carrera para ver si Signar resulta victorioso","La carrera de saltos de barril comenzará pronto en esta misma pista.\
\
Has predicho que Signar ganará la carrera, y deberías observar si esta predicción se cumple.","Tienes un interés personal en el éxito de Signar mientras participa en la carrera de saltos de barril del Festival de Verano.","Arnar se encuentra en la zona de la carrera de barriles durante el Festival de Verano.\
\
Deberías hablar con Arnar y recoger la generosa recompensa que tiene para ofrecerte por tu excelente suerte.","No abandones la zona de la carrera","Signar ha perdido la carrera"}},
[7749]={nameES="Kept By The Dead",objectivesES={}},
[7750]={nameES="Kergrim Corrupters",objectivesES={}},
[7751]={nameES="Kergrim de Haudh Valandur",objectivesES={"Maladan se encuentra en el campamento de los Montaraces, en el Camino de los Reyes.\
\
A Maladan le alegrará saber que has sobrevivido a la batalla de Haudh Valandur.","Habla con Maladan en el Camino de los Reyes","Haudh Valandur se ha convertido en el hogar de un grupo de kergrim, unas criaturas repugnantes de origen desconocido.","Kergrim de Haudh Valandur","Haudh Valandur se encuentra en el Camino de los Reyes, al oeste del campamento de los Montaraces.\
\
Maladan te ha pedido que vayas a Haudh Valandur y derrotes a los kergrim que hay allí."}},
[7752]={nameES="Kergrim en la carretera",objectivesES={"Has encontrado las provisiones saqueadas, pero llegaste demasiado tarde para salvar al conductor","Tu misión es viajar a Tûkurdul para recuperar las provisiones que fueron saqueadas y salvar al conductor si puedes. Por supuesto, debes matar a cualquier kergrim que veas en la zona para asegurarte de que no vuelvan a atacar.","Kergrim en el extremo noroeste de Tûkurdul, cerca de Ashâgir, saqueó un cargamento del oeste. Se llevaron al conductor y el contenido de su carga. Salva al conductor y recupera sus provisiones.","Kergrim en la carretera"}},
[7753]={nameES="Los líderes kergrim",objectivesES={"Buenamordida y Viejo Roedor están en Skûmfil, al sureste del Refugio Sombrío.\
\
Odmar quiere que acabes con los líderes kergrim que trajeron a las criaturas devoradoras de cadáveres a Skûmfil a través de los túneles de Moria.","Los líderes kergrim","Derrota a Buenamordida","Habla con Odmar en el Refugio Sombrío","Derrota a Viejo Roedor","Skûmfil no es más que un vertedero, un lugar donde se arrojan a los orcos muertos de Moria cuando empiezan a apestar. Es allí donde dos enemigos se han reunido, cada uno con la intención de usar los cadáveres para sus propios fines. Los kergrim y otros carroñeros los utilizan como fuente de alimento, y los insectos, como lugar para poner sus huevos y engendrar futuras generaciones.","Odmar se encuentra en el Refugio Sombrío, al noroeste de Skûmfil.\
\
Encontraste a los dos kergrim, uno antiguo y el otro un invocador, y los mataste. Odmar, que está en el Refugio Sombrío, se alegrará de saber que ya está hecho.","Buenamordida derrotado","Viejo Roedor derrotado"}},
[7754]={nameES="Keteph's Communication",objectivesES={}},
[7755]={nameES="Las llaves de las criptas",objectivesES={"Las llaves de las criptas","Maladan se encuentra en el campamento de Montaraces, en el Camino de los Reyes.\
\
Maladan querrá examinar las llaves que has recogido.","Los habitantes del Camino de los Reyes poseen antiguas llaves que pueden abrir algunas de las criptas y tumbas que hay en su interior.","Llévale las llaves a Maladan"}},
[7756]={nameES="Khirgi's Elite",objectivesES={}},
[7757]={nameES="Khirgi's Scouts",objectivesES={}},
[7758]={nameES="Khlârum the Sneak",objectivesES={"Handarod is at Esteldín in the North Downs, far to the west and north of the Misty Mountains.\
\
You should return to Handarod and tell him of Khlârum's defeat.","Talk to Handarod","Defeat Khlârum","Khlârum the Sneak","A particularly vicious and dangerous goblin has been spotted in the camps outside of Goblin-town. He is said to be hunting down warriors who dare travel too close to their stronghold.","Khlârum lurks near the camp of Akûltot in the eastern Misty Mountains, far to the south and east of the North Downs.\
\
Handarod has asked you to aid the Elves of Rivendell by defeating the goblin Khlârum.","Defeated Khlârum"}},
[7759]={nameES="Khorroz: Beasts at Bay",objectivesES={"Khorroz, once the home to the largest bat population in Gundabad, has now been overtaken by deadly cave-beasts.","Khorroz can be found in Máttugard.\
\
You should light fires to scare off some of the cave-beasts at Khorroz.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Note: Torches can be dropped by right clicking the induction bar.</rgb>","Set fire to a large pile at Khorroz","Light fires to scare off cave-beasts at Khorroz","Burned piles of refuse to scare off cave-beasts at Khorroz.","Khorroz: Beasts at Bay","Pick up a torch to burn other piles of refuse","Khorroz can be found in Máttugard.\
\
You should light fires to scare off some of the cave-beasts at Khorroz.","Completado","This pile of refuse was quite flammable!","You have lit many piles aflame at Khorroz and frightened off many cave-beasts in return. Your efforts here are sure to make Máttugard a safer dwelling for those seeking to reclaim Gundabad.","Khorroz, once the home to the largest bat population in Gundabad, has now been overtaken by deadly cave-beasts. The beasts thrive in the darkness. Perhaps there is a way to drive some of the beasts out of Khorroz?"}},
[7760]={nameES="Khorroz: Missing Trinkets",objectivesES={"Khorroz, once the home to the largest bat population in Gundabad, has now been overtaken by deadly cave-beasts.","Khorroz, once the home to the largest bat population in Gundabad, has now been overtaken by deadly cave-beasts. The dwarf-made cavern is littered with bones and old trinkets. These trinkets must have been collected by the cave-beasts as they hunt in Gundabad. Reuniting these trinkets with their rightful owners would certainly be a boon to the spirits of those seeking to reclaim Gundabad.","A supply chest can be found at any dwarf outpost in Máttugard.\
\
You should place the dwarf trinkets in a supply chest.","Khorroz: Missing Trinkets","Khorroz can be found in Máttugard.\
\
You should collect dwarf trinkets at Khorroz.","Place the dwarf trinkets in a supply chest"}},
[7761]={nameES="Khâshap's Assembly",objectivesES={"Confront Khâshap","Attend Khâshap's assembly","Khâshap plans to confront the rumours head on by appearing before the Gut. Hadorion believes we should spring the trap now.","Khâshap has fled into the back streets of the Gut. Hadorion believes this is the final chance. Khâshap is cornered.","Khâshap has fled into the back alleys!","Khâshap's Assembly","A group of Corsairs has gathered","Khâshap has gathered his Corsairs and makes his escape into the back alleys of the Lower Ward. He must be stopped here before he delivers the phials of Ifrinn to his master.","It is finally time to confront Khâshap.","Talk to Hadorion"}},
[7762]={nameES="Khûd Zagin To Imhûlar",objectivesES={}},
[7763]={nameES="Patea a los rascacuevas",objectivesES={"Esta caja contiene botas resistentes de varios tamaños, perfectas para patear rascacuevas. Maginard te sugirió que tomaras un par para ti.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Debes colocar las botas como una habilidad. Para hacerlo, arrastra el objeto 'Botas Pateagarras' desde tu inventario a tu barra de habilidades. Luego, usa la habilidad en los Rascacuevas Ladrones para avanzar en la misión.</rgb>","Patea a los rascacuevas","Maginard quiere que des patadas a los rascacuevas que encuentres dentro del túnel al sureste del centro del pueblo de Entibo. Usa tus Botas Pateagarras para mandar volar a las bestias.","Maginard quiere que des patadas a los rascacuevas ladrones que encuentres dentro del túnel bajo el pueblo de Entibo. Para hacerlo de forma segura, debes tener un par de botas resistentes para patear. Maginard te habló de una caja cercana que contiene esas botas en el centro del pueblo de Entibo.","Consigue un par de Botas Pateagarras de la caja","Maginard Zorronillo sabe que hay rascacuevas causando problemas en Entibo y tiene algunas ideas sobre cómo lidiar con ellos."}},
[7764]={nameES="Kicking a Stone",objectivesES={"Gozug can be found deep within the troll-infested Stone-hole, north of Gnarlstump's camp.\
\
Gnarlstump has asked you to defeat Gozug, chieftain of the wild trolls of the Brown Lands.","Defeated Gozug","Gnarlstump is at his camp, south of the Stone-hole.\
\
You should return to Gnarlstump with news of your victory.","Defeat Gozug","Kicking a Stone","Gnarlstump is angered by the presence of trolls in the Brown Lands, especially the desolation of the Entwives' gardens, and wishes them removed.","Talk to Gnarlstump in the Brown Lands"}},
[7765]={nameES="Kidzul-kâlah: Battles Past",objectivesES={"Kidzul-kâlah: Battles Past","Hithril of the Elves of Lórien is concerned about the shadowy waters that surround the sunken ruins of Kidzul-kâlah.","Weapons taken from the Gladden Fields into Kidzul-kâlah should be destroyed before they can be used for some foul purpose."}},
[7766]={nameES="Kidzul-kâlah: Bonds of the Drowned",objectivesES={}},
[7767]={nameES="Kidzul-kâlah: Dark Waters",objectivesES={"Kidzul-kâlah: Dark Waters","Darkwaters menace the drowned ruins of Kidzul-kâlah, and must be defeated.","Hithril, of the Elves of Lórien, is concerned about the shadowy waters that surround the sunken ruins of Kidzul-kâlah."}},
[7768]={nameES="Kidzul-kâlah: The Fallen",objectivesES={}},
[7769]={nameES="Mátenlo con fuego",objectivesES={"Encuentra y derrota a Tamâhu, el escorpión temible.","Derrota a Tamâhu, el escorpión temible","Encuentra al escorpión temible Tamâhu","Los escorpiones cerca de Dûlagig han estado expandiendo su alcance y se están volviendo más agresivos en sus ataques. Reduce su número antes de que se conviertan en una amenaza aún mayor para Urmâkh.","Derrota a los escorpiones y destruye sus nidos para reducir su número.","Tamâhu chasquea sus pinzas en señal de advertencia al acercarte","Mátenlo con fuego"}},
[7770]={nameES="Kill Ten Rats",objectivesES={}},
[7771]={nameES="Mátalo con fuego",objectivesES={"Las estructuras fúngicas se encuentran en y alrededor de Dalgum-ru, al sur del Refugio Sombrío.\
\
Tyki quiere que quemes algunas de las extrañas estructuras fúngicas cerca del campamento de los Orcos.","Tyki ha estado observando de cerca a los orcos de la tribu de los Globsnaga para ver si su intento de cura con agua fresca funcionó. Ha determinado que no, y la amenaza orca debe ser erradicada de Khazad-dûm...con fuego.","Mátalo con fuego","Habla con Tyki en el Refugio Sombrío","Tyki se encuentra en el Refugio Sombrío, al norte de Dalgum-ru.\
\
Debes regresar a Tyki para informarle de lo inflamables que resultaron ser esas estructuras fúngicas."}},
[7772]={nameES="Kill the Messenger",objectivesES={"Talk to Eirien at Mithechad","Sealed orders may be found on the Orcs at Gâthlata, east of Mithechad, north of Ânghum-maudhûl.\
\
Eirien has asked you to collect sealed orders from the Orcs of Gâthlata.","Eirien is at Mithechad, west of Gâthlata.\
\
You should bring the sealed orders you discovered to Eirien at once.","The small Orc-camp of Gâthlata sits below Ânghum-maudhûl and serves as a crossroad for the Orcs mustering in the Ashenslades.","Kill the Messenger"}},
[7773]={nameES="Matando al lobo",objectivesES={"Derrota a Âthruk en Maudhul-ulur","Matando al lobo","Goldínwen está en Echad Glamodúd, al norte de Maudhul-ulur.\
\
Deberías volver a ver a Goldínwen con la noticia de tu victoria.","Âthruk se encuentra en Maudhul-ulur, al sur de Echad Glamodúd.\
\
Goldínwen te ha pedido que derrotes a Âthruk, el capataz de Maudhul-ulur.","Habla con Goldílwen en Echad Glamodúd","Âthruk derrotado","Los huargos organizados de Maudhul-ulur siguen siendo una gran amenaza para los Elfos de los Malledhrim."}},
[7774]={nameES="Kindling Crates",objectivesES={}},
[7775]={nameES="Kindling to Wildfire",objectivesES={"With the Taurogrim defeated and their twisted forms burned, the familiar crackling of firewood echoes through Tríubad. Although you suspect that the Taurogrim will soon return, you have done well to aid the Woodmen.","Kindling to Wildfire","Completado","Driven from Tríubad by the Taurogrim, the Woodmen hope to repel the wood-demons from their remaining settlements in Woodsedge.","Taurogrim can be found throughout Tríubad in Woodsedge.\
\
Believing it might cleanse the Vales of Anduin of their evil, Clothar has asked you to burn the remains of fallen Taurogrim at Tríubad.","You have burned the remains of many of the Taurogrim at Tríubad."}},
[7776]={nameES="Kindly Advice",objectivesES={"Defeated Saruman's minion","Talk to the old man again...","Break the old man's spell! Say <rgb=#FF0000>no</rgb> to him, if you can","The old man in rags is near the White Hand Encampment in north-east Fangorn.\
\
The old man in rags wishes to speak with you again.","An old, bent man has appeared in the forest near the White Hand encampment.","Defeat the warrior summoned by Saruman","Talk to Wisewood","Kindly Advice","Talk to the old man again","Something does not seem right. This sounds like wisdom, but your logic struggles against your heart, for the man's words seem wrong...","Such wisdom cannot be naysaid","The old man in rags is near the White Hand encampment in north-east Fangorn.\
\
You should say <rgb=#FF0000>no</rgb> to the old man and break the strange spell he has over you.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>You must select the intended target and perform an emote to advance this quest.</rgb>","The old man in rags is near the White Hand encampment in north-east Fangorn.\
\
You should <rgb=#FF0000>agree</rgb> with the old man, since what he says is so reasonable.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>You must select the intended target and perform an emote to advance this quest.</rgb>","All that this man says seems reasonable and just","The old man in rags is near the White Hand encampment in north-east Fangorn.\
\
The old man in rags wishes to speak with you again.","<rgb=#FF0000>Agree</rgb> with the old man","Wisewood is at his place near the White Hand encampment in north-eastern Fangorn.\
\
You should speak with Wisewood.","The old man vows that you will die for defying him","Talk to the old man again, now that the veil is lifted","The old man in rags is near the White Hand encampment in north-east Fangorn.\
\
You should speak with the old man in rags once more.","You have naysaid the old man, who is likely Saruman posing as Gandalf. The spell is broken!"}},
[7777]={nameES="Kindness Counts",objectivesES={"Kindness Counts","Impressed by the kindness you have shown her people, Lady Tóla, new wife of Lord Ingmar, requests your presence.","Lady Tóla awaits you within her house in the northern part of Eaworth.\
\
You should enter Lord Ingmar's house and speak with Lady Tóla.","Talk to Tóla at Ingmar's house in Eaworth","Darmod stands guard outside Lord Ingmar's house in the northern part of Eaworth.\
\
Botulf instructed you to speak with Darmod, Lord Ingmar's doorwarden, to gain access to Lady Tóla.","Talk to Darmod outside Ingmar's house in Eaworth"}},
[7778]={nameES="Kindred of Hamât Renewed",objectivesES={"Mizâdi knows your strength and honour and looks to your assistance again as she takes her battle directly to the Ordâkhai.","Reach Kindred standing with the Hamât Renewed","Speak to Lumgâna at Mizâdi's encampment","As Hamât rises anew, you have proven an invaluable ally. Mizâdi and her agents look to you for further assistance. You should return to Mizâdi's encampment and treat with Lumgâna.","Kindred of Hamât Renewed","Your renown grows among the Hamât Renewed. Return now to the Quartermaster—they have readied a boon in thanks for your labours."}},
[7779]={nameES="Kindred of Sul Madásh",objectivesES={}},
[7780]={nameES="Kindred of the Adúrhid",objectivesES={}},
