[7783]={nameES="Kindred of the Temámir of Jiret-menêsh",objectivesES={}},
[7784]={nameES="Kindred to the City of Zajâna",objectivesES={"Across Kighân, your efforts increase your standing among the people. In the halls of Zajâna, your name and deeds grow with import.","Kindred to the City of Zajâna","Across Kighân, your efforts increase your standing among the people.","You remain true to your word, aiding the City of Zajâna earnestly. You should return to the city to speak with the quartermaster to be recognized for your efforts.","Reach Kindred standing with The City of Zajâna","Speak with Alahamâr at Zajâna"}},
[7785]={nameES="Rey de la colina",objectivesES={"You have defended the Malledhrim war-banner with honour","Defend the banner of the Malledhrim","You were unable to defend the Malledhrim war-banner","The guard-towers are in Krul Lugu below Iavassúl's Watch.","You have placed the Malledhrim war-banner atop one of the guard-towers","You have abandoned the Malledhrim war-banner to the Enemy","Rey de la colina","Iavassúl is at Iavassúl's Watch, above Krul Lugu.\
\
You should speak with Iavassúl regarding your efforts in the Orc-camps.","Talk to Iavassúl at Iavassúl's Watch","The guard-towers are in Krul Lugu below Iavassúl's Watch.\
\
Iavassúl has asked you to claim one of the two guard-towers in Taur Morvith with a banner of the Malledhrim, then hold it against the Orcs for a time.","The Orcs of Taur Morvith are in disarray. Iavassúl now has a plan to keep them that way.","Place the Malledhrim war-banner"}},
