[7796]={nameES="Kings of Wood and Stone",objectivesES={"You pick up a small, unadorned pouch...","Deliver the token of peace to King Thranduil in Felegoth","King Thranduil can be found in Felegoth.\
\
You have been tasked with delivering King Thorin's token of peace to King Thranduil.","Scouts can be found throughout Felegoth.\
\
King Thranduil has asked you to send scouts into Eryn Lasgalen to seek the Weeping Warrior. You should sent the scouts out as soon as you are able.","Talk to King Thranduil","The token of peace can be found on King Thorin III's throne.\
\
King Thorin has asked you to collect and deliver a token of peace to King Thranduil.","Retrieve the token of peace from King Thorin's throne","Hoping to warn King Thranduil of the Weeping Warrior's presence in Eryn Lasgalen, King Thorin III seeks to renew his father's friendship with the Elvenking.","King Thranduil can be found in Felegoth.\
\
You have sent many of King Thranduil's scouts into Eryn Lasgalen in search of the Weeping Warrior. You should return to King Thranduil.","Kings of Wood and Stone"}},
[7797]={nameES="Kingsfoil: Between the Cracks",objectivesES={"Search Minas Tirith for any kingsfoil growing wild.","Kingsfoil: Between the Cracks","Bring the kingsfoil you have found back to Bergil, outside of the Houses of Healing on the Sixth Circle of Minas Tirith.","Aragorn has tasked Bergil with finding enough athelas, also known as kingsfoil, to treat every soldier afflicted with the Black Shadow.","Bring the kingsfoil to Bergil"}},
[7798]={nameES="Kingsfoil: Cut and Dried",objectivesES={"Bring the dried kingsfoil you have found back to Bergil, outside of the Houses of Healing on the Sixth Circle of Minas Tirith.","Kingsfoil: Cut and Dried","Bring the kingsfoil to Bergil","Ask people in Minas Tirith for any dried kingsfoil leaves they may have.","Aragorn has tasked Bergil with finding enough athelas, also known as kingsfoil, to treat every soldier afflicted with the Black Shadow."}},
[7799]={nameES="Rompecabezas",objectivesES={"Roba una piedra de la suerte","Rompecabezas","Amon Môth se encuentra al oeste y al sur de las Agujas de la Linde, y el túmulo que mencionó Erchiel está en algún lugar del borde norte de su campamento.\
\
Erchiel te ha pedido demostrar tu astucia robándole una piedra de la suerte a uno de los gigantes de Amon Môth.","Erchiel se encuentra en las Agujas de la Linde, al noreste de Amon Môth, cerca de la orilla del lago Evendim.\
\
Debes llevarle la piedra de la suerte.","Roba una piedra de la suerte a los gigantes de Amon Môth","Lleva la piedra de la suerte a Erchiel en las Agujas de la Linde","Robaste una piedra de la suerte","La elfa Erchiel está preocupada por los gigantes que han estado arruinando el bosque."}},
