[7839]={nameES="Lang Rhuven: The Escape",objectivesES={"The horses are now free and safe from the Easterlings","A horse has been defeated!","Return to Candúr","Find the horses","Horses can be found in Lang Rhuven on the border of Dagorlad.\
\
You should free the horses in Lang Rhuven.","The horses look reluctant but willing to follow you.","Lang Rhuven: The Escape","Candúr has been monitoring the Enemy in Lang Rhuven and believes that now is the time to attack the camp.","The horses flee back into the encampment","Do not let every horse be defeated","You can tell by the scars, these horses have not been treated well.","Free the horses in Lang Rhuven","Freed the horses in Lang Rhuven.","You should return to Candúr, who can be found at a small Ranger outpost hidden in the Slag-hills.","You must lead the horses through the encampment"}},
[7840]={nameES="Lang Rhuven: The Guards",objectivesES={"You have defeated many of the tower-guards within the enemy encampment of Lang Rhuven. With their guard towers unmanned, you should be able to strike your foes again with ease.","Defeated many Khundolar tower-guards at Lang Rhuven.","Candúr has been monitoring the Enemy in Lang Rhuven and believes that now is the time to attack the camp.","Completado","Tower-guards can be found in Lang Rhuven on the border of Dagorlad.\
\
You should defeat tower-guards found in Lang Rhuven.","Lang Rhuven: The Guards"}},
[7841]={nameES="Lang Rhuven: The Siege",objectivesES={"Candúr has been monitoring the Enemy in Lang Rhuven and believes that now is the time to attack the camp.","Easterling supply tents and trebuchets can be found in Lang Rhuven on the border of Dagorlad.\
\
You should destroy supply tents and trebuchets found in Lang Rhuven.","Completado","Lang Rhuven: The Siege","You have caused a considerable amount of damage to the enemy structures at Lang Rhuven. The Easterling forces will certainly have a difficult time rebuilding after that incursion.","Caused much damage to the enemies at Lang Rhuven."}},
[7842]={nameES="Lang Rhuven: The War-leaders",objectivesES={"Lang Rhuven: The War-leaders","Defeated Khatikhôl","Return to Candúr","Candúr has learned of the two leaders who control all forces in Lang Rhuven.","Defeat Khatikhôl","Khatikhôl and Dashat Khôz can be found in Lang Rhuven on the border of Dagorlad.\
\
You should defeat Khatikhôl and Dashat Khôz.","Defeat Dashat Khôz","Defeated Dashat Khôz","You should return to Candúr, who can be found at a small Ranger outpost hidden in the Slag-hills."}},
[7843]={nameES="Lang Rhuven: The War-party",objectivesES={"Return to Candúr","A war-party will be entering Lang Rhuven from the eastern end of the encampment.\
\
You should defeat the war-party before they get to the camp.","Defeat the war-party entering Lang Rhuven","Do not let the war-party into Lang Rhuven","A war-party approaches Lang Rhuven from the east to reinforce the Easterlings there.","The war-party has been defeated!","You have let the war-party into Lang Rhuven!","Lang Rhuven: The War-party","<rgb=#FF0000>Do not leave the eastern end of Lang Rhuven unguarded</rgb>","Stand your ground and defeat the war-party","You should return to Candúr, who can be found at a small Ranger outpost hidden in the Slag-hills."}},
[7844]={nameES="Langraf: Defilers of the Dead",objectivesES={"Langraf has fallen into disrepair and gredbyg have filled the tombs.","Talk to Waldeg","Gredbyg and rats can be found at Langraf.\
\
Waldeg has asked you to venture within Langraf and clean out the gredbyg and rats found within.","<rgb=#FF0000>Completing Aiding the Eastemnet will cancel this quest</rgb>","Waldeg is at Snowbourn.\
\
Waldeg will be pleased to hear you have helped to clean the gredbyg and rats out of Langraf.","Langraf: Defilers of the Dead"}},
[7845]={nameES="Langraf: Honouring the Ancients",objectivesES={"Pay your respects at the second tomb","Pay your respects at the third tomb","Many noble warriors are buried within the halls of Langraf.","Talk to Waldeg","<rgb=#FF0000>Completing Aiding the Eastemnet will cancel this quest</rgb>","Langraf: Honouring the Ancients","You have paid your respects","Waldeg is at Snowbourn.\
\
Waldeg will be pleased to hear that you honoured his ancestors and remembered their sacrifice.","The tombs can be found within Langraf.\
\
Waldeg has asked you to venture into Langraf, find the tombs of his ancestors, and honour them by kneeling before them.","Pay your respects at the first tomb"}},
[7846]={nameES="Lanterns Aglow",objectivesES={"Lanterns Aglow","There are lanterns along the path between Imlad Lalaith and Caras Galadhon. Wait for night fall, and then light them to help lead revellers to the feast.\
\
As part of the preparations for the evening feast, Galhíril would like you to light the lanterns that will lead the evening revellers to the banquet.","Maliriel has asked you to help her companions finish the prepartions for the upcoming banquet.","Talk to Galhíril at Imlad Lalaith","Galhíril is at Imlad Lalaith.\
\
You should return to Galhíril with your report."}},
[7847]={nameES="Deber de Despensa",objectivesES={"Deber de Despensa","Los platos no parecen estar más limpios que cuando los recogiste, pero tendrá que servir","Dentro de las mazmorras de Barad-dûr, una despensa repugnante alimenta a los numerosos siervos del Señor Oscuro.","Colocas los platos limpios sobre una mesa cercana","Los platos limpios pueden encontrarse en la Despensa Repugnante, en las mazmorras de Barad-dûr.","Inspecciona los platos limpios","Estás destinado a servir mediante el trabajo al Señor Oscuro.","Los platos sucios pueden encontrarse por las mazmorras de Barad-dûr.","Se puede encontrar una tina de lavado en la Despensa Repugnante, en las mazmorras de Barad-dûr.","Limpia los platos en la tina de lavado de la Despensa Repugnante"}},
[7848]={nameES="Lashing the Walls",objectivesES={}},
[7849]={nameES="Lassemista's Seed",objectivesES={"Quickbeam has thought of how he next wishes to honour Lassemista's memory.\
\
Quickbeam is ready to speak to you at Derndingle.","Lassemista enjoyed long talks with Treebeard. Quickbeam believes saying good-bye to Wellinghall will honour his memory.\
\
Wellinghall can be found in west Fangorn.","Quickbeam has remembered how he next wishes to honour Lassemista's memory.\
\
Quickbeam is ready to speak to you at Derndingle.","Say <rgb=#FF0000>bye</rgb> to Wellinghall","One of Lassemista's favourite places was a great tree. Quickbeam believes bowing before it will honour his memory.\
\
The tree can be found in the north-east of Fangorn.","Speak to Quickbeam","<rgb=#FF0000>Bow</rgb> before the ancient tree","Quickbeam has planted a seed to his fallen friend Lassemista at Isengard. He wishes to honour the memory of his friend.","Quickbeam will wish to speak to you about Lassemista.\
\
Quickbeam is at Derndingle.","<rgb=#FF0000>Look around</rgb> at the small island","Lassemista's Seed is at Isengard","Lassemista's Seed","<rgb=#FF0000>Bow</rgb> before the tree to honour Lassemista","Quickbeam and Lassemista used to watch the river from a small island. Quickbeam asked you to go there and have a look around.\
\
The island is in the river in the centre of Fangorn.","Find the ancient tree","Quickbeam needs to ponder what else would honour Lassemista's memory.\
\
Return to Quickbeam at Derndingle to hear what he has to say.","Shed a <rgb=#FF0000>tear</rgb> at Lassemista's Seed","Return to Quickbeam","Find the small island","Return to Quickbeam to hear what he has to say","Quickbeam ponders what to do next. Time passes...","Quickbeam wishes to honour Lassemista by showing he misses him with a single tear.\
\
Lassemista's seed has been planted at Isengard.","Find Wellinghall"}},
[7850]={nameES="Last Chance Escape",objectivesES={"Balidan has asked you to collect some spare parts for his escape. The parts can be found within Mâr Naphra's off-limits storage.","You have successfully collected everything Balidan needs to make his escape. Deliver them to the meeting point.\
\
Balidan is waiting on the coast south-west of Mâr Naphra.","Meet with Balidan","Balidan expresses that he severely misjudged the life of a pirate. He desires your help in planning an escape.","Last Chance Escape"}},
[7851]={nameES="Últimas voluntades",objectivesES={"Los restos de los amigos de Delun han sido hallados.\
\
Deberías volver con ella en las afueras de Gond Orchal.","Delun te ha pedido que encuentres lo que queda de sus amigos y quemes sus cuerpos. Están en algún lugar al noroeste de la ubicación de Delun.\
\
Deberías empezar por Einion.","Encuentra y quema el cuerpo de Einion","Habla con Muna","Delun te ha pedido que encuentres lo que queda de sus amigos y quemes sus cuerpos. Están en algún lugar al noroeste de la ubicación de Delun.\
\
Melwyn es la última persona que tienes que encontrar.","Encuentra y quema el cuerpo de Melwyn","El espíritu se desvanece en la nada, abandonando su cólera","La mujer ensangrentada te mira en shock. Se encoge y se prepara para huir antes de darse cuenta de algo.\
\
'Tú... no eres un tumulario. ¿Has venido a rescatarnos? Por favor, encuentra a mis amigos. Mataron a Muna primero, y luego nos llevaron al resto al interior de los túmulos. Conseguí salir, pero... Einion, Curig, Melwyn... Están en alguna parte más al noroeste.\
\
'Por favor, si encuentras... lo que queda de ellos, quémalos. Mis heridas pueden esperar.'","Una brisa solemne silba por los túmulos","Puede que sea demasiado tarde para rescatar a la gente que está dentro de Gond Orchal, pero pueden ser salvados en la muerte.","La atmósfera angustiante se disipa inmediatamente","Delun te ha pedido que encuentres lo que queda de sus amigos y quemes sus cuerpos. Están en algún lugar al noroeste de la ubicación de Delun.\
\
Ahora debes buscar a Curig.","Encuentra y quema el cuerpo de Curig","Vuelve con Delun fuera de Gond Orchal","Una persona extraña mira en silencio el cuerpo inerte de Delun","Últimas voluntades","Has vuelto demasiado tarde.\
\
La extraña tiene algo que decirte."}},
[7852]={nameES="Last-minute Arrows",objectivesES={}},
[7853]={nameES="Last-minute Gathering",objectivesES={}},
[7854]={nameES="Last-minute Hunting",objectivesES={}},
[7855]={nameES="Laudh, Lieutenant of Núrzum",objectivesES={"Defeat Laudh","Laudh, Lieutenant of Núrzum, is no longer coordinating the Orcs in Gárnoth's Farm, and they are bound to drift into chaos soon.","Laudh, Lieutenant of Núrzum","Laudh stands watch over Gárnoth's Farm from his make-shift command post on the southern side of the farm.","Laudh has been defeated","Núrzum left his lieutenant, Laudh, in charge of conquering the Fallows and destroying the infrastructure supporting Forlaw. He is a very capable Uruk-hai, and is as brutal a fighter as he is a cunning tactician.","Defeating the Lieutenant of Núrzum has left the Orc forces in the Fallows disconnected from the army spread out through Wildermore. With the line of communication broken, the people of Forlaw may rout the remaining Orcs, and reclaim what has been lost on the plains of the Fallows.","Laudh, Lieutenant of Núrzum, stands watch over Gárnoth's Farm from his make-shift command post on the southern side of the farm.","Completado","The Lieutenant of Núrzum oversees the White Hand forces in the Fallows. He oversaw the capture of both Edsig's and Gárnoth's Farms and has converted them for the Orcs' purposes. His death will cripple the coordination of White Hand efforts in the Fallows."}},
[7856]={nameES="Laugi Lenguadorada, emisario de los Duramano",objectivesES={"Minas Angos es una torre de Barad Gúlaran, al sur de Gath Forthnír.\
\
Debes viajar a Barad Gúlaran y derrotar a Laugi Lenguadorada, el emisario de los Duramano, dentro de Minas Angos. Brúnfair te ha recomendado que lleves aliados contigo.","Tras descubrir la voluntad de los Duramano de forjar una alianza, debes entrar en Minas Angos y derrotar a su emisario para impedir que combinen fuerzas con la Corona de Hierro.","Brúnfair está en Gath Forthnír, al norte de Barad Gúlaran.\
\
Tras derrotar a Laugi Lenguadorada, deberías volver a ver a Brúnfair y hablarle de tu victoria.","Laugi Lenguadorada, emisario de los Duramano","Entra en Minas Angos y derrota al emisario de los Duramano."}},
[7857]={nameES="Anarquía entre los trasgos",objectivesES={"Acaba con Gathrok","Desde que la expedición de enanos entró en Moria, ha habido demasiados encuentros con trasgos.","Stíling se esconde a las afueras de Gamil Filik, en las VEtas del Cuerno de Plata.\
\
Deberías volver a ver a Stíling y decirle que has conseguido derrotar a Gathrok.","Habla con Stíling","Gathrok ha sido derrotado","Anarquía entre los trasgos","Gathrok y sus trasgos se encuentran en Gamil Filik, al sureste del Descenso Profundo.\
\
Stíling te ha pedido que derrotes a Gathrok, un jefe trasgo, y que debilites sus fuerzas."}},
[7858]={nameES="Lay of the Land",objectivesES={"Habla con Aemeldir en Echad Sirion","Scout the eastern gate of Durbúrz-stazg","The Elves of the Golden Host seek a way to cripple the Orcs of Durbúrz-stazg.","Lay of the Land","Durbúrz-stazg lies to the north of Echad Sirion.\
\
Aemeldir has asked you to scout the gates of Durbúrz-stazg to determine which is the least guarded.","Scout the southern gate of Durbúrz-stazg","Aemeldir is at Echad Sirion, south of Durbúrz-stazg.\
\
You should return to Aemeldir with the results of your patrol.","This gate is only lightly guarded","This gate is heavily guarded"}},
[7859]={nameES="Layers Between",objectivesES={}},
[7860]={nameES="Dando Descanso a los Muertos Malvados",objectivesES={"Habla con Glorfindel","Habla con Elrond","Glorfindel está afuera de la Última Morada, en Rivendel, cerca de la cascada.\
\
Debes hablar con él acerca del enfrentamiento con Ferndúr el Virulento.","Dando Descanso a los Muertos Malvados","Has ayudado a Glorfindel a derrotar a Ferndúr y a sus esbirros","Elrond está en su biblioteca en el piso superior de la Última Morada, en Rivendel.\
\
Glorfindel te pidió regresar con Elrond y darle un informe sobre el enfrentamiento con Ferndúr.","Glorfindel está afuera de la Última Morada, en Rivendel, cerca de la cascada.\
\
Debes hablar con Glorfindel cuando puedas marchar contra Ferndúr y sus esbirros.","Glorfindel está afuera de la Última Morada, en Rivendel, cerca de la cascada.\
\
Elrond te pidió hablar con Glorfindel y obtener su ayuda contra Ferndúr el Virulento.","Elrond cree que podría haber uno de los temidos Señores Demacrados detrás de los males del Bosque de los Trolls.","Habla con Glorfindel para marchar contra Ferndúr y sus esbirros"}},
[7861]={nameES="Líder de la madera malvada",objectivesES={"Derrota a Zagâfum","Habla con Lithuilas en Gwingris","Lithuilas está en Gwingris, al norte de Sâd Thareg.\
\
Deberíamos volver a ver a Lithuilas con las noticias de tu victoria.","Zagâfum, el líder de los trolls silvanos, se encuentra en la cueva de Sâd Thareg, al sur de Gwingris.\
\
Lithuilas te ha pedido que derrotes a Zagâfum.","El líder de los trolls silvanos ha sido descubierto en Glâd Ereg. Esta podría ser una oportunidad para terminar con su amenaza en el bosque de acebos de una vez por todas.","Líder de la madera malvada"}},
[7862]={nameES="Leader of the Nink-hai",objectivesES={"Use the horn to draw Dargum's attention and defeat Grazadh","The Nink-hai threat looms ever present. Langfrith believes that the only solution will be to defeat the Nink-hai's commander.","The Nink-hai leader can be found at the end of the mountain pass in the mountains.\
\
Langfrith has asked you to infiltrate the Orc camp and defeat the leader of the tribe.","You have defeated Grazadh, but Dargum has escaped","Leader of the Nink-hai","Explore the Nink-hai camp along the mountain path east of Faldham.\
\
Langfrith has asked you to infiltrate the Orc camp and discover the leader of the tribe.","Enter the Nink-hai camp and locate their leader","Langfrith awaits outside the mead hall of Faldham.\
\
Langfrith will want to hear of the events that transpired with the Nink-hai leader.","You have discovered the location of Dargum, the Nink-hai leader","Return to Langfrith and inform him of Dargum's escape","The horn has drawn Dargum's attention"}},
[7863]={nameES="Leader of the Rat-folk",objectivesES={}},
[7864]={nameES="Leader of the Siege",objectivesES={}},
[7865]={nameES="Leaders from Moria",objectivesES={"Find and defeat an Under-wall Captain in the Under-wall","Talk to Isteron","Leaders of the Moria Orcs can be found in the northernmost and southernmost side passages in the Under-wall.\
\
Isteron wants you to send a message to the Moria Orcs by challenging one of their leaders in battle.","Isteron is by the northernmost exit from the Under-wall.\
\
You have defeated a Moria Orc-leader and should return to tell Isteron of your success.","Leaders from Moria","You have defeated the Under-wall Captain","Isteron wants you to defeat one of the leaders from Moria that leads the Orcs in the Under-wall."}},
[7866]={nameES="Líderes de las Profundidades",objectivesES={"Encuentra y derrota a Farmak el Mejor Corredor","Líderes de las Profundidades","Los líderes trasgos Zagh, Dâgal y Farmak moran dentro de la Ciudad de los Trasgos. La Ciudad de los Trasgos se encuentra al noreste del campamento de Glóin.\
\
Vighar Trotasendas te ha encomendado dar caza y derrotar a varios líderes en las profundidades de la Ciudad de los Trasgos.","Encuentra y derrota a Dâgal el Vigía","Habla con Vighar Trotasendas en el campamento de Glóin, fuera de la Ciudad de los Trasgos","Farmak el Mejor Corredor derrotado","Dâgal el Vigía derrotado","Zagh, Maestro de la Guardia, derrotado","Encuentra y derrota a Zagh, Maestro de la Guardia","Glóin recibió información desde Rivendel de que hay varios líderes en las profundidades de la Ciudad de los Trasgos. Vighar Trotasendas, por orden de Glóin, ofrece recompensas por dar caza a estos líderes dentro de la Ciudad de los Trasgos.","Vighar Trotasendas está en el campamento de Glóin, en las Montañas Nubladas, justo fuera de la Ciudad de los Trasgos.\
\
Encontraste a los líderes trasgos por toda la Ciudad de los Trasgos. Dâgal vigilaba a los orcos de Angmar, Zagh recorría los túneles gritando órdenes a los guardias, y Farmak corría por los pasadizos buscando intrusos. Ahora que han sido derrotados, debes regresar con Vighar."}},
[7867]={nameES="Leaders of the Frost-bound",objectivesES={}},
[7868]={nameES="Leaders of the Goblins",objectivesES={}},
[7869]={nameES="Líderes de las huestes",objectivesES={"Guardianes, clamamaldiciones y orcos fúngicos explosivos pueden encontrarse en la Sala Decimosexta, al noreste del Refugio Sombrío.\
\
Odmar te envió a encontrar y destruir a los orcos que cree que lideran esta incursión enfermiza en la Sala Decimosexta.","Regresa con Odmar en el Refugio Sombrío","La Sala Decimosexta es una zona infestada de orcos, muchos de los cuales padecen una terrible enfermedad que provoca crecimientos similares a hongos en sus cuerpos.\
\
Mallas, un elfo aliado de los enanos, cree que hay algo oculto bajo la Sala Decimosexta y desea descubrir el verdadero propósito y el origen de la plaga.","Líderes de las huestes","Odmar se encuentra en el Refugio Sombrío, al suroeste de la Sala Decimosexta.\
\
Has combatido valerosamente contra los orcos infectados de la Sala Decimosexta y has derrotado a muchos guardianes, clamamaldiciones y orcos portadores de terribles hongos. Ahora deberías informar a Odmar de que has cumplido sus órdenes."}},
[7870]={nameES="Leaders of the Nink-hai",objectivesES={"Odda can be found near the road south of the Cuthstan.\
\
You have disrupted the Nink-hai chain of command, and Odda is awaiting your return.","Talk to Odda at his tent near the road","The Nink-hai Orc-tribe can be found south-west of Odda's tent.\
\
Odda has asked you to remove the chieftains who are atop the tribe's chain of command.","Leaders of the Nink-hai","Odda has observed the movements of the Nink-hai Orc-tribe. The tribe has a number of dangerous chieftains that are at the head of the chain of command."}},
[7871]={nameES="Leading Floodwend's Demise",objectivesES={"The Warleader of Nîn-stazg can be found deep within the Orc encampment of Nîn-stazg, south-east of Floodwend.\
\
You should defeat the Warleader of Nîn-stazg.","Leading Floodwend's Demise","Etta, mother of Thane Radwig, is in the Mead Hall of Floodwend.\
\
You should speak with Etta.","Defeat Nîn-stazg's Warleader from Mordor","Nîn-stazg's war-leader poses a dire threat to the city of Floodwend and its young Thane.","Return to Radwig in Floodwend","Speak with Etta","Thane Radwig is in the Mead Hall of Floodwend.\
\
You should tell Thane Radwig that the Warleader has been slain, which should bring some peace of mind to the young Thane."}},
[7872]={nameES="Leading Through Fear",objectivesES={"Find and defeat Lanferth","Leading Through Fear","Talk to Idmar","Defeated Lanferth","Idmar is at his camp along the road in central Parth Celebrant.\
\
You should return to Idmar at once with news of your victory.","The brigands are led by a man named Lanferth, and Idmar believes eliminating him may put an end to their invasion.","Lanferth's tent is located deep within Hordfierd.\
\
Idmar has asked you to defeat Lanferth, leader of the brigands."}},
[7873]={nameES="Leading the Advance",objectivesES={}},
[7874]={nameES="Hojas en Casa del Bosque",objectivesES={"Rollo Boffin está en Casa del Bosque, al este de Alforzaburgo, en el camino de Cepeda.\
\
Dado que Longo Madriguerales no pudo ayudarte a descubrir la ubicación de Gerebert, Esilia te pidió que hablaras con Rollo Boffin. Dado que Rollo supervisa gran parte de la hierba para pipa que pasa por Casa del Bosque, y Gerebert se escondió en un carro que transportaba hojas hacia el este, puede que sepa algo sobre Gerebert.","Longo Madriguerales no pudo ayudarte a descubrir qué ha sido de Gerebert Tuk, pero Esilia pensó en alguien más con quien podrías hablar.","Hojas en Casa del Bosque"}},
[7875]={nameES="Aprendiendo a Pescar en Lhan Garan",objectivesES={"Madog te ha pedido demostrar tus habilidades para pescar.","Habla con Madog","Madog te pidió atrapar un pez mientras estás de pie cerca del Maestro de Pasatiempos en Lhan Garan.\
\
Atrapa un pez.","Ponte de pie cerca del Maestro de Pasatiempos en Lhan Garan y atrapa un pez.","Aprendiendo a Pescar en Lhan Garan"}},
[7876]={nameES="Alas curtidas de los dragonzuelos",objectivesES={"Alas curtidas de los dragonzuelos","Las alas de los dragonzuelos son resistentes y curtidas; con la preparación adecuada pueden dar lugar a una armadura robusta.","Recolecta pieles de dragonzuelo","Las alas de los dragonzuelos son resistentes y curtidas; con la preparación adecuada pueden dar lugar a una armadura robusta.\
\
Deberías recolectar alas de dragonzuelo en el paso de Ram Dúath.","Lleva los cueros a Melthindir","Melthindir está en Esteldín, vigilando fuera de la entrada este.\
\
Deberías llevar el cuero que recogiste a Melthindir.","Se pueden encontrar dragonzuelos en el valle occidental de Ram Dúath, al norte de Esteldín.\
\
Deberías recolectar alas de dragonzuelo en el paso de Ram Dúath."}},
[7877]={nameES="Leave No One Behind",objectivesES={"You have escaped from the Halls of Black Lore, but without Faeron. You must find him and discover if it was indeed Viznak you heard inside.","Leave No One Behind","Talk to Faeron","Éowyn quickly gathers bandages, splints, and disinfectant","Viznak and Faeron need your help!\
\
You should talk to Rhadrog to begin 'Instance: Viznak Lives'.","You inform Rhadrog that Dolenthol will suffice as a medic and ask if he is ready to depart.\
\
'You told him? But, but... can we trust him with Viznak's secret?'\
\
You nod and assure Rhadrog that Dolenthol is trustworthy.\
\
'Good enough. We must leave at once!'","Talk to Rhadrog to begin 'Instance: Viznak Lives'","Talk to Viznak","Faeron has rescued Viznak, but the merrevail are in quick pursuit.\
\
You should return to the Barad Elenath and inform Rhadrog!","Faeron has returned to Barad Elenath, the Stargazers' Spire.\
\
You should talk to Faeron.","Faeron has rescued Viznak, but the merrevail are hot on their heels!\
\
You should inform Dolenthol!","You quickly tell Rhadrog that Faeron is nearby with a gravely-wounded Viznak.\
\
'They're alive! We must go at once, but I admit I know only the basics of field medicine. We need a proper medic!'","Faeron did not return to the Stargazers' Spire with the others, so he must still be somewhere in the Circle of Madness.\
\
You should find Faeron!","Talk to Rhadrog","Dolenthol is ready to help Faeron and Viznak.\
\
You should let Rhadrog know you are ready to go.","Viznak has survived the attack, and is now resting outside Barad Elenath.\
\
You should talk to Viznak.","Find Faeron","Talk to Dolenthol"}},
[7878]={nameES="Partir no es fácil",objectivesES={"Bingo te sonríe con una expresión de disculpa","Encuentra a Bingo en las afueras de Bolgovado y entrégale su otra bolsa","Encuentra a Bingo en Delagua y entrégale su bastón","Bingo te ha dicho que continuaría hacia Delagua mientras tú recuperabas su bastón.","Bingo te ha dicho que olvidó su otra bolsa y te ha pedido que regreses a su agujero hobbit para recuperarla.","Bingo ha decidido que la primera parada de su viaje será el cruce de caminos del Cruce, al este de Cavada Grande.","El cenagoso Pantano de la Rana se encuentra al este y al norte de Delagua.\
\
Bingo te ha sugerido que tomes un desvío por el Pantano de la Rana para evitar a los hobbits entrometidos que lo persiguen.","Has recuperado el bastón de Bingo, y ahora deberías llevárselo a Delagua","Viaja hasta el Cruce y habla con Bingo","Bingo dejó su bastón apoyado contra el muro exterior de su agujero hobbit, y te ha pedido que vuelvas a buscarlo.","Has recuperado la otra bolsa de Bingo, y ahora deberías llevársela a Bolgovado","Vuelve al agujero hobbit de Bingo y recupera su bastón","Vuelve al agujero hobbit de Bingo y recupera su otra bolsa","Bingo tiene miedo de las ranas y los sapos, y te ha pedido que derrotes a suficientes sapos de las colinas salvajes que plagan el Pantano de la Rana para que pueda regresar al camino.","La última vez que viste a Bingo, estaba paralizado por el miedo en la parte más occidental del Pantano de la Rana.","Bingo está listo para emprender finalmente su viaje, y quiere que lo acompañes.","Bingo te ha dicho que se reuniría contigo en las afueras de Bolgovado una vez que recuperaras la otra bolsa que accidentalmente se dejó en casa.","Partir no es fácil","Habla con Bingo en el Pantano de la Rana"}},
[7879]={nameES="Saliendo de la Tierra Media",objectivesES={"Bregar está en Duillond, al norte de Celondim.\
\
Toronn te ha pedido que intentes convencer a Bregar de que lo acompañe al Oeste.","Saliendo de la Tierra Media","Toronn quiere dejar la Tierra Media y viajar al Oeste, a las Tierras Imperecederas, pero no se irá mientras su hermano, Bregar, se niegue a partir."}},
[7880]={nameES="Leaving a Lasting Mark",objectivesES={}},
[7881]={nameES="Abandonar las profundidades",objectivesES={"El enano Svanr se encuentra en la escalera occidental de Nud-melek, sobre Khadar-zarâm.\
\
Deberías hablar con Svanr.","Habla con Svanr en Nud-melek","Abandonar las profundidades"}},
[7882]={nameES="Saliendo de las minas",objectivesES={"Saliendo de las minas","Dile a Svanr lo que encontraste","Las orcas parecen haber estado arrastrando carros de suministros a sus campamentos; parece que podrían estar reuniendo provisiones para una ofensiva importante.","Svanr se encuentra cerca de Sudulthurkh, en el norte de Nud-melek.\
\
Debes decirle a Svanr que has destruido varios carros de los goblins en Nud-melek, dificultando su salida de las minas.","Los carros de la mina se encuentran en Nud-melek, en el cruce norte de Sudulthurkh.\
\
Las fuerzas de Mazog están arrastrando carros de mina llenos de suministros a través de Nud-melek."}},
[7883]={nameES="Leech Hunt",objectivesES={"Voracious leeches can be found in the waters of Dath Nethryn.\
\
You should defeat voracious leeches.","The Conquest of Gorgoroth has encountered a particularly dangerous species of leeches and requests an adventurer's aid.","Leech Hunt","A bounty notice is pinned to the board, stamped with the royal seal of Gondor:\
\
'An extremely dangerous species of leech has been discovered in the swamps of Dath Nethryn. The Conquest of Gorgoroth requests an adventurer to travel to Lhingris and exterminate them. They are known to lurk beneath the water's surface and will attack if the water is disturbed.'"}},
[7884]={nameES="Left for Dread",objectivesES={"Find the missing sword","Found the missing sword","Téothic is in Aldburg, to the west of the hills.\
\
You found Téothic's heirloom sword and should return it to him at once.","Téothic hired a villager to kill a boar for him and gave the villager a family sword to do so. When the villager arrived at the location, he was overcome with dread, dropped the sword, and fled.","Left for Dread","Téothic's sword may be found in the hills east of Aldburg.\
\
Téothic has asked you to recover his sword, an old family heirloom, which was dropped by the hunter that he hired.","Talk to Téothic"}},
[7885]={nameES="Left in Our Care",objectivesES={"DNT - Players will not see","Thane Edric and his men have turned their attention to protecting Entwade now that the people have fled to safety in Aldburg.","Left in Our Care","Talk to Gifel","Gifel can be found inside the Mead Hall of Entwade at one of the tables.\
\
You have finished boarding up the homes of Entwade, and should now return to Gifel.","Planks can be found outside several homes in Entwade.\
\
Gifel has asked that you take some of the pressure off of Edric's men by boarding up some of the houses."}},
[7886]={nameES="Legacy in the Mist",objectivesES={"Talk to Léothred in Framsburg","Talk to Léothred at Hlithseld","Léothred can be found in Framsburg.\
\
You should talk to Léothred in Framsburg.","Talk to Léothred elsewhere in Framsburg","Framsburg can be found in the north of Misthallow.\
\
You should explore Framsburg.","Explore Framsburg","Legacy in the Mist","Hlithseld is located in the north of Misthallow.\
\
You should talk to Léothred at Hlithseld.","Establish an encampment in Misthallow near Framsburg","Travel to Hlithseld to rest","Hlithseld is located in the north of Misthallow.\
\
You should establish the camp of Hlithseld with Léothred.","This rocky promontory is blanketed with old ruins","Hlithseld is located in the north of Misthallow.\
\
You should travel to Hlithseld and rest.","Framsburg can be found in Misthallow.\
\
You should learn the history of the Rohirrim with Léothred.","Léothred, the Rohirric scholar, seeks to travel to the great fortress that his people built in Misthallow.","Learn the history of the Rohirrim with Léothred","Hlithseld has been established!"}},
[7887]={nameES="Legacy of Strife",objectivesES={"Legacy of Strife","Talk to Nimithil","Concerned by the growing influence of the Heirs of Castamir in Lebennin, Nimithil hopes to warn Steward Malthellim of treachery within Ost Anglebed and prevent her people from splintering.","Nimithil can be found in Ost Anglebed in north-central Lebennin.\
\
Nimithil has asked you to accompany her in speaking to the Steward of Ost Anglebed of her worries about the Heirs of Castamir and their influence on her people.","Nimithil can be found in Ost Anglebed in north-central Lebennin.\
\
You have survived Malthellim's betrayal and should now speak to Nimithil about what is to be done next."}},
