[7961]={nameES="Desafío legendario del Centinela",objectivesES={"No ganaste la batalla en treinta minutos","Rilhathel está decidida a cantar canciones sobre tus esfuerzos en defensa de Lórien y te ha planteado un desafío verdaderamente legendario, además de simplemente rechazar a los orcos.","Rilhathel te ha pedido no solo ganar la batalla por Lórien, sino también derrotar a Narshpug y a Grakâmâb antes de que abandonen el campo de batalla, evitar que Belvagor sufra heridas graves y hacerlo todo en treinta minutos.","Grakâmâb derrotado","Habla con Rilhathel en Caras Galadhon","Debes completar el desafío más legendario de Rilhathel durante la Batalla de Lórien","Belvagor ha resultado herido","Gana la batalla en treinta minutos","Desafío legendario del Centinela","Rilhathel te ha pedido no solo ganar la batalla por Lórien, sino también derrotar a Narshpug y a Grakâmâb antes de que abandonen el campo de batalla, evitar que Belvagor sufra cualquier herida y hacerlo todo en treinta minutos.","Evita que Belvagor sufra heridas graves","Derrota a Narshpug","Narshpug derrotado","Derrota a Grakâmâb","Rilhathel se encuentra en Caras Galadhon esperando saber si has completado su desafío legendario con éxito.","Completa con éxito la Batalla de Lórien"}},
[7962]={nameES="Ocio Perdido en Radlaw",objectivesES={"Ocio Perdido en Radlaw","Has encontrado el tomo perdido de Rhawn Torlan.\
\
Deberías llevárselo de vuelta a Rhawn Torlan en Clegur.","Rhawn necesita ayuda para encontrar su tomo perdido. Debería estar en Radlaw, en un lugar con vista al Aguaestancada.","Has encontrado el libro de Rhawn","Rhawn Torlan ha perdido su lugar favorito para contemplar el Aguaestancada.","Encuentra el libro de Rhawn","Habla con Rhawn Torlan"}},
[7963]={nameES="Lembas para las Puertas",objectivesES={"El lembas es el legendario pan de viaje de Lórien, y un alimento básico para aquellos que realizan largas guardias.","Lleva el paquete de lembas a Losdirith","Lembas para las Puertas","Basdan está en Telain Bangad en Caras Galadhon.\
\
Has entregado los paquetes de lembas a los guardias y ahora deberías regresar a Basdan.","Lleva el paquete de lembas a Minathlang","Losdirith se encuentra en la entrada del jardín de la Dama Galadriel. Minathlang se encuentra en la entrada de la ciudad.\
\
Basdan te ha dado paquetes de lembas para que los lleves a los guardias en las diversas puertas de la ciudad.","Habla con Basdan en Telain Bangad"}},
[7964]={nameES="Lest They Fall Victim",objectivesES={}},
[7965]={nameES="Para que no olvidemos",objectivesES={"Conmovido por los relatos de la batalla perdida de los enanos, Arnod desea ahora honrar la memoria de los enanos caídos.","Hay tres lugares en Tharâkh Bazân donde Arnod desea que cuentes la <rgb=#FF0000>historia</rgb> de las batallas: una estatua al norte, una fuente al sur y una estatua central.\
\
Arnod quiere que honres a los enanos caídos de Moria contando la historia de la antigua batalla perdida en los monumentos que los enanos construyeron en Tharâkh Bazân.","Has honrado a los caídos con la historia de su antigua batalla","Arnod está en el extremo este de Tharâkh Bazân.\
\
Arnod querrá saber que has honrado a los antiguos contando la historia de su derrota.","Para que no olvidemos","De pie frente a la estatua del norte","De pie frente a la fuente del sur","Cuenta la historia de la antigua batalla","Habla con Arnod en Tharâkh Bazân","De pie frente a la estatua central"}},
[7966]={nameES="Let Them Fight",objectivesES={"Completed 'The Harrowing of Morgul'","Complete 'The Harrowing of Morgul' on any difficulty","Complete 'The Harrowing of Morgul' on any difficulty.\
\
Use the Instance Finder to enter this instance.","Let Them Fight","With the defeat of both Shaktur and Dargásh in Zhar Dushgoi, the Rangers are able to reach deeper into Minas Morgul.\
\
You should speak to Damrod and inform him of your victory.","Talk to Damrod","Damrod has asked that you enter the fray between Gothmog and Ugrukhôr's forces and defeat each army's captain."}},
[7967]={nameES="Let Them Hear Your Roar",objectivesES={"<rgb=#FF00FF>Roar</rgb> at a cowardly goblin at Gudule's Home","Langhár can be summoned to your side with Langhár's summoning horn.\
\
You should talk to Langhár.\
\
If Langhár is no longer with you, she may be outside Waldfast or in Vegbár.","Cowardly goblins are lurking in the forest near the homes of Woodmen. They wait patiently for their chance to break in and steal whatever they can.","<rgb=#FF00FF>Roar</rgb> at a cowardly goblin at Hodver's Home","Let Them Hear Your Roar","<rgb=#FF00FF>Roar</rgb> at a cowardly goblin at Evrul's Home","The goblin flees in fear!","Cowardly goblins can be found in the forest near the Woodmen homes.\
\
Find them and <rgb=#FF00FF>roar</rgb> at them!","Habla con Langhár"}},
[7968]={nameES="Let Them Hunger",objectivesES={"The goblins of Dol Guldur feed their Warg companions foul meats to make them stronger and more vicious.","Talk to Maerwen at Helethir","Complete Maerwen's task","The Wargs and the foul meats they are fed with can be found at Draugdegil, north-east of Helethir.\
\
Maerwen has asked you to defeat the Wargs of Draugdegil, after tricking them into eating all of the goblins' foul meats.","Completed Maerwen's task","Let Them Hunger","Maerwen is at Helethir, south-west of Dol Guldur.\
\
You should return to Maerwen for your reward."}},
[7969]={nameES="Let There Be Light",objectivesES={}},
[7970]={nameES="Let Us Follow Them",objectivesES={"Track the half-orc emissary to make sure he is not causing trouble","The emissary of Isengard has left you with an uneasy feeling. You should track him and see if the White Hand encampment shows any signs of rallying for retribution at the Stag-clan's refusal to join them.","The half-orc emissary retreated southwards towards the White Hand encampment, probably following the road.\
\
You should follow the emissary and make sure that he does not plan to attack Lhan Tarren after being insulted by Riagán.","Hurry back! Lhan Tarren may have been attacked already, while you searched for the wrong foe....","It can only be hoped that Guto and Elain are safe at least, since they were not there during the attack.\
\
You should seek them in Lhan Tarren and try to help recover from the attack by the White Hand.","Speak with Guto","Guto is in Lhan Tarren.\
\
You should speak with Guto.","Let Us Follow Them"}},
[7971]={nameES="Let's Go Fly a Kite",objectivesES={"Many people should see you from here!","Talk to Tâlugar","Fly a kite near the southern cove","Fly a kite atop the eastern bridge","Fly a kite on the southern beach","Per Tâlugar's request, you have flown a kite in the more populated areas of the island so that people can see your kite and be inspired to buy one of their own. You should return to Tâlugar on the south side of Furtherholm's harbour to collect your reward.","Tâlugar has come to Furtherholm from Umbar Baharbêl to sell kites to the visitors.","Let's Go Fly a Kite","Tâlugar has asked you to fly a kite in the more populated areas of the island so that people can see your kite and be inspired to buy one of their own.","Fly a kite on the sand in front of the inn","Fly a kite at the west end of the harbour","People here don't seem to notice your kite","Was that kite-envy you just saw?","Do the people here appreciate your kite?","People here seem impressed with your kite!"}},
[7972]={nameES="¡Tomemos la Cuernavilla!",objectivesES={"Théoden is in the Great Hall of the Hornburg.\
\
You should witness the end of the siege on Helm's Deep.","You have been given a map to guide you to Théoden's side.\
\
You should read the map and go to Théoden at once.","Habla con Théoden","Théoden is in the Great Hall of the Hornburg.\
\
You should speak with Théoden.","Use the map to rally to Théoden's summons","Witness the last stand.","Witness the last stand of the Rohirrim","You have received a summons to participate in the last stand of the Rohirrim at Helm's Deep.\
\
Many have survived the long night, and it is time to ride out and throw down the enemies that now fill the vale."}},
[7973]={nameES="Lethal Larvae",objectivesES={}},
[7974]={nameES="Letter From Léothred",objectivesES={"Léothred can be found at Hlithseld.\
\
You should talk to Léothred at Hlithseld.","A letter has arrived from Léothred, the Rohirric historian.","Talk to Léothred at Hlithseld","Letter From Léothred"}},
[7975]={nameES="Letters of the Enemy",objectivesES={"Collecting orders from fallen corsairs may give more insight as to what the corsair captain of Makham Mijann is planning.","Bruidis can be found in the village of Tadrent.\
\
You should bring the corsair orders to Bruidis so that she can look through the information you've gathered.","Corsair orders can be found on the bodies of corsair footmen throughout Belfalas.\
\
Collecting orders from fallen corsairs may give more insight as to what Captain Tabadam of Makham Mijann is planning.","Letters of the Enemy","Collecting orders from fallen corsairs may give more insight as to what the corsair captain of Makham Mijann is planning.\
\
The first corsair order reads as followed:\
\
'You are ordered to ambush passing carts for supplies. Bring the supplies to the river for shipment downstream. Do not, I repeat do not enter Tadrent. A confrontation would cost us more time than we can afford. We will put Tadrent to the sword once this business is done.'\
\
Captain Tabadam","Collect corsair orders","Bring the corsair orders to Bruidis in Tadrent","Collected corsair orders"}},
[7976]={nameES="Letting the Light In",objectivesES={"Find the last sleeping Ent","You come to an Ent standing at the edge of a fair meadow, soaking up the sunlight that flows off the ridge.","Greenroot is awake now! At last, one Ent in Fangorn has felt some change.","Letting the Light In","Talk to Greenroot","Trees with dense foliage are no longer held in place by the shadows, and can be encouraged to let the light in for the first time in a long age.","Trees that block the light can be found throughout the Black Heart of Fangorn.\
\
Trees with dense foliage are no longer held in place by the shadows, and can be encouraged to let the light in for the first time in a long age.","The shadows have long kept the foliage so hatefully dense that it blocked all light into the Black Heart. It is time to push back the leaves to let the light shine in once more. There is hope for this place yet!","Greenroot has appeared behind you while you let the light in.\
\
You should speak with Greenroot.","Clear foliage to allow light in","You should press further into Fangorn, towards the sunlight you see in the distance to the south-west of this grove."}},
