[8039]={nameES="Lhudblath, el huargo plateado",objectivesES={"Lhudblath, el huargo plateado","Has derrotado a Lhudblath, el huargo plateado","Derrota a Lhudblath, el huargo plateado","Lhudblath, el huargo plateado, se encuentra en la parte oriental del Bosque Salvaje.\
\
Linnet te ha pedido que derrotes al huargo plateado, Lhudblath.","Linnet se encuentra en la zona centro-sur del Bosque Salvaje.\
\
Deberías volver con Linnet Encinarroja.","Los huargos merodean por el Bosque Salvaje, pero ninguno es tan feroz ni tan letal como Lhudblath, el huargo plateado.","Habla con Linnet"}},
[8040]={nameES="Liberating Woodhurst",objectivesES={"Gifemund has come forward and is demanding that Guard-captain Thurferth step down due to his inability to protect Woodhurst. They now seek to settle their differences before the empty seat of the Thane.","Speak with Herubrand","Talk to Calin","Speak with Herubrand in the basement of the farm-house in Woodhurst.","Liberating Woodhurst","You should speak with Calin when you are ready to go to the Mead Hall."}},
[8041]={nameES="Liberation from Dûn Traikh",objectivesES={}},
[8042]={nameES="Lugartenientes de la corrupción",objectivesES={"Lugartenientes de la corrupción","Las arañas y los orcos ahora infectados parecen seguir a un nuevo amo una vez que adoptan sus formas mutadas. El caos puede dar miedo, pero cuando uno ve orden donde esperaba encontrar caos, puede resultar aún más aterrador.","Knakk está acampado en la pasarela elevada en la esquina noreste de las Vetas del Cuerno Rojo.","Has descubierto qué controla a las arañas infectadas y lo has derrotado.","Encuentra al líder entre los orcos infectados","Regresa con Knakk","Has descubierto qué controla a los orcos infectados y lo has derrotado.","Encuentra al líder entre las arañas infectadas","El líder de los orcos infectados debería encontrarse entre sus sirvientes al sureste del campamento de Knakk, al igual que la reina, que acecha entre su prole al este."}},
[8043]={nameES="Lieutenants of the Herald",objectivesES={"Defeated Draulush the Bloody","Defeated Narnagír the White-arrow","Legolas has identified the leaders of the Bloodless in Kaslokroz.\
\
You should defeat Draulush, Mangath, and Narnagír.","Lieutenants of the Herald","Defeated Mangath the Impervious","Defeat Draulush the Bloody","Defeat Narnagír the White-arrow","Defeat Mangath the Impervious","Legolas has identified the leaders of the Bloodless Uruks in Kaslokroz and would like your help eliminating them."}},
[8044]={nameES="Lieutenants' Seals",objectivesES={}},
[8045]={nameES="Life After Death",objectivesES={"Bring ninglyr to Gaerfalas atop Amon Angened","Gaerfalas is at the way-post atop Amon Angened, east of Fállug.\
\
You should bring the flowers you collected to Gaerfalas.","Ninglyr may be found around the ruins of Fállug, west of Amon Angened.\
\
Gaerfalas has asked you to gather ninglor flowers for use in preparing medicines.","The Elves at the way-post atop Amon Angened provide supplies and provisions for the main force of the Malledhrim in the east.","Life After Death"}},
[8046]={nameES="Life After Rhûn",objectivesES={}},
[8047]={nameES="Life Along The Morthond",objectivesES={"A few fish were caught in this net!","Fishing nets can be found along the River Morthond near Sardol in the Blackroot Vale.\
\
Gordir has asked you to search for fish in the nearby fishing nets and bring any fish you find to him. You should search the nets.","Deliver the fish to Gordir in Sardol","Gordir can be found along the River Morthond in Sardol.\
\
You have searched the nets as Gordir asked and found a few fish caught in them. You should deliver the fish to Gordir.","Gordir can be found along the River Morthond in Sardol.\
\
You have fished with Gordir and caught three pike out of the River Morthond. You should talk to Gordir.","Life Along The Morthond","Many fish dwell in the waters of the River Morthond and provide a rich bounty for the fishermen of the Blackroot Vale.","Esta red está vacía","Talk to Gordir","Gordir can be found on a pier along the River Morthond in Sardol.\
\
You have delivered the fish caught in the nets to Gordir, and he has asked you to fish with him for a time. You should fish with Gordir."}},
[8048]={nameES="Cuando la muerte da vida",objectivesES={"Habla con Mallas en el Refugio Sombrío","Ayuda a Lar a eliminar a los gredbyg de Skûmfil","Skûmfil no es más que un vertedero, un lugar donde se arrojan a los orcos muertos de Moria cuando empiezan a apestar. Es allí donde dos enemigos se han reunido, cada uno con la intención de usar los cadáveres para sus propios fines. Los kergrim y otros carroñeros los utilizan como fuente de alimento, y los insectos, como lugar para poner sus huevos y engendrar futuras generaciones.","Recoge muestras de los gredbyg en Skûmfil para Pentlenn","Ayuda a Moggi a eliminar a los gredbyg de Skûmfil","Cuando la muerte da vida","Mallas se encuentra en el Refugio Sombrío.\
\
Has completado todas las tareas que te encargaron Lar, Moggi y Pentlenn. Vuelve con Mallas e infórmale de que has cumplido con tu misión.","Lar, Moggi y Pentlenn se encuentran en el Refugio Sombrío.\
\
Mallas te ha dicho que le hablará bien de ti a Veúlfur en la Sala Vigesimoprimera después de que hayas ayudado a sus agentes en el Refugio Sombrío."}},
[8049]={nameES="Life Springs Anew",objectivesES={"Deliver the seeds to Ereblen in Henneth Annûn","Ereblen can be found in Henneth Annûn.\
\
You have gathered many seeds and should now deliver them to Ereblen.","Even with near-constant incursions from Mordor and the Wastes, Ithilien has proven resilient to the Enemy's attacks and continues to bloom with new life.","Seeds of oxlip, horsetail, and vetchling can be found on the Field of Cormallen to the west of Henneth Annûn.\
\
Ereblen has asked you to gather more seeds from the Field of Cormallen and return to him with as many as you are able to bear.","Life Springs Anew"}},
[8050]={nameES="Life in Darkness",objectivesES={"Life in Darkness","Mossbeard can be found at your side or if you have become separated, you can use your whistle to call him.\
\
You have uncovered many plants that were freezing beneath snowdrifts in south-west Balewood. You should now talk to Mossbeard and see what more can be done.","Talk to Mossbeard","Mossbeard fears that the winter will claim much of the life in the Balewood and wishes for you to uncover the plants that have become buried in snow.","Snowdrifts can be found throughout south-west Balewood.\
\
Mossbeard wants you to uncover plants that might be freezing beneath snowdrifts in the Balewood and expose them to whatever light remains in the darkened forest."}},
[8051]={nameES="Life in Eryn Lasgalen",objectivesES={"Habla con Radagast","Life in Eryn Lasgalen","Hoping to heal Eryn Lasgalen, Radagast has been cultivating saplings.","Fertile soil and dead trees can both be found throughout Eryn Lasgalen.\
\
You should clear away the dead trees and plant the saplings in fertile soil around the forest.","You should return to Radagast, who can be found at the tree nursery just outside of Felegoth.","Saplings can be found just south of Felegoth.\
\
You should gather saplings that are to be planted around the forest."}},
[8052]={nameES="La vida en el otro lado",objectivesES={"La vida en el otro lado","Mizâdi has agreed to hear Kotráka Saiya's story.\
\
You should talk to Kotráka Saiya and complete the Session.","You have heard Kotráka Saiya's story.\
\
You should talk to Kotráka Saiya.","You have heard Kotráka Saiya's story.\
\
You should talk to Mizâdi to hear what she thinks.","Kotráka Saiya has come to seek an alliance with Mizâdi. Will the princess' words be enough to convince her?","Complete 'Session: Life on the Other Side'","Talk to Kotráka Saiya","Talk to Mizâdi"}},
[8053]={nameES="Lifting the Ballast",objectivesES={"Talk to Jidâlo outside the Broken Pillar Tavern in the Lower Ward","Shajât's former captain, Jidâlo, is outside the Broken Pillar Tavern in the Lower Ward.","The Ballast's former ship-mates can be found in the vicinity of the Broken Pillar Tavern, in the Lower Ward.","Shajât goes inside the Guild Hall, and you wonder if caravans have ballast","Bring the coins raised by his ship-mates to Shajât outside the Lower Ward","Shajât is outside the Lower Ward, in the Sail-haven.","Lifting the Ballast","Shajât lost the coins given to him by his ship-mates to ruffians in the Gut, and if you don't recover them for him no one will.","Return his coins to Shajât outside the Swain's Guild Hall","Talk to Shajât outside the Swain's Guild Hall","Shajât stands outside the Guild Hall, but he still looks despondent","Shajât stands outside the Swain's Guild Hall in the Lower Ward.","Find the Swain's Guild Hall in the Lower Ward","Excited to begin his new life, Shajât agreed to meet you outside the Swain's Guild Hall in the Lower Ward.","Is it possible for one man to be so... unfortunate?","Shajât has a sad story to tell, and he has asked you to help him with his myriad woes."}},
[8054]={nameES="Levantando el yugo",objectivesES={"Éa está en Tármunn Súrsa, al este de Carn Dûm.\
\
Los esclavos de Carn Dûm han sido liberados y ahora pueden regresar a sus hogares, pero no pudiste encontrar al esposo de Éa, Erscin. Deberías regresar con Éa para informarle.","Carn Dûm se encuentra al oeste de Tármunn Súrsa.\
\
El esposo de Éa, Erscin, y sus compañeros guerreros fueron capturados por orcos y llevados a Carn Dûm. Ella te ha pedido que entres en Carn Dûm y rescates a Erscin.","Levantando el yugo","Carn Dûm es el corazón maligno de Angmar, una ciudad terrible protegida por puertas y hordas de orcos guerreros."}},
[8055]={nameES="Light of the Lost",objectivesES={}},
[8056]={nameES="Luz del alba naciente (opcional)",objectivesES={"Ruingal ha sido derrotado","Entra en las Forjas de Khazad-dûm, invoca al espectro ígneo Ruingal y acaba con él.","Habla con Winiel en la Bodega Putrefacta","Usa el tomo para invocar a Ruingal","Con la ayuda del libro que obtuviste del sapo Granrugido, Winiel ha logrado descifrar los fragmentos de saber que le llevaste. Gracias a tu ayuda, ha obtenido información acerca de un espectro ígneo que acecha en las Minas de Moria.","Winiel se encuentra en la Bodega Putrefacta, en las Obras Hidráulicas, al noreste de las Forjas de Khazad-dûm.\
\
Deberías regresar con Winiel para informarle de tu victoria.","Derrota a Ruingal","Luz del alba naciente (opcional)"}},
[8057]={nameES="El faro del Baranduin",objectivesES={"Habla con Gaelnarthan en el campamento del Coloso","Las ruinas del faro están al sureste del Coloso.\
\
nGaelnarthan te ha pedido que te aventures en el faro y derrotes a la criatura que encuentres en su interior.","Derrota a la criatura bajo el faro","Gaelnarthan está en el campamento del Coloso.\
\
Gaelnarthan estará complacido de oír que el kergrim que les hostigaba ha sido derrotado.","El faro del Baranduin","Con la llave del sótano del faro, puedes atacar a la criatura que ahora llama hogar a este lugar.'"}},
[8058]={nameES="Lighting and Fences: Rebuild I",objectivesES={}},
[8059]={nameES="Lighting and Fences: Rebuild II",objectivesES={}},
[8060]={nameES="Lighting and Fences: Rebuild III",objectivesES={}},
