[8067]={nameES="Encendiendo el pozo",objectivesES={"Las lámparas se encuentran en el largo y sinuoso descenso hacia el pozo situado en el centro de las Vetas del Cuerno de Plata.\
\
Debes bajar por el camino y encender las lámparas a medida que avanzas.","Thalfar quiere que se enciendan las lámparas de la mina profunda, lo que debería ayudar a ahuyentar a los enemigos que se han instalado allí y hacer que la expedición minera sea más segura para los enanos.","halfar se encuentra en el campamento minero central de las Vetas del Cuerno de Plata.\
\
Deberías volver a ver a Thalfar e informarle de que las lámparas están encendidas de nuevo","Encendiendo el pozo","Habla con Thalfar"}},
[8068]={nameES="Iluminando el camino",objectivesES={"Habla con Slagvi en el Mirador de la Gran Excavación","Los caminos hacia y desde el Mirador de la Gran Excavación son oscuros, pero ajustar un antiguo espejo reflector de luz ha ayudado a iluminar el camino.","Ajustar este espejo ha permitido que los caminos del Mirador de la Gran Excavación estén mucho mejor iluminados que antes. Esto evitará probablemente que muchos caigan o tomen un camino equivocado.","Slagvi se encuentra en el campamento del Mirador de la Gran Excavación, en la Gran Excavación de Moria.\
\
Deberías hablar con Slagvi sobre el espejo que ajustaste.","Iluminando el camino"}},
[8069]={nameES="Iluminando el camino",objectivesES={"Hurmulkezer se encuentra justo al sur del Patio de Durin, en la zona sureste de las Profundidades Llameantes.\
\
Deberías encender piras en Hurmulkezer.","Las piras de Hurmulkezer están encendidas, advirtiendo a los enanos de que los enemigos controlan actualmente esta fortaleza, y que entrar sin saberlo sería mortal.","Completado","Iluminando el camino","Todos los orcos son criaturas perezosas, y las piras de Hurmulkezer permanecen apagadas por falta de mantenimiento. Encenderlas servirá como advertencia a los enanos de que en estos salones habitan enemigos."}},
[8070]={nameES="Lightning in a Bottle",objectivesES={}},
[8071]={nameES="Lights Upon the Linduin",objectivesES={"Defeated many Linduin fire-flies in Laerlad.","You have defeated many Linduin fire-flies in Laerlad, allowing the Woodmen to travel without constant threat. They will be grateful for your efforts.","Linduin fire-flies can be found in Laerlad.\
\
You should defeat Linduin fire-flies.","Something has agitated the fire-flies of Laerlad, causing them to attack without warning. If Laerlad is to be made safe for the Woodmen of Blómgard, these creatures must be defeated.","Completado","Frenzied fire-flies attack those who wander through Laerlad.","Lights Upon the Linduin"}},
[8072]={nameES="Luces para el mercado",objectivesES={"Milo Surcolargo está en la Granja de Cotonorte.\
\
Milo Surcolargo se alegrará de saber que las lámparas arderán durante toda la noche.","Se pueden encontrar lámparas apagadas en los senderos de la Granja de Cotonorte.\
\
Milo Surcolargo te ha pedido que le ayudes a iluminar la zona encendiendo las lámparas del mercado agrícola de la Granja de Cotonorte.","Los senderos de la Granja de Cotonorte están iluminados por lámparas que con el tiempo se apagan y hay que reemplazarlas.","Habla con Milo Surcolargo","Luces para el mercado"}},
[8073]={nameES="Luces en la oscuridad",objectivesES={"Los limrafn acechan en Haudh Valandil, la tumba en la isla más allá del puente de Ariant, en Annúminas.\
\
Debes derrotar a los limrafn que acechan en las profundidades de Haudh Valandil.","Ost Elendil, el gran palacio de los reyes de antaño, está en la isla más allá del puente de Ariant. En su base está la entrada a Haudh Valandil, la tumba de Valandil, hijo de Isildur. Temo que la tumba, tras largo tiempo sin profanar, se haya convertido en el hogar de grandes males: tanto de Angmar como de otros orígenes.","Luces en la oscuridad"}},
[8074]={nameES="Lights in the Land",objectivesES={"Lights in the Land","Céola is at Etheburg in the Brown Lands.\
\
Céola has asked you to help the Rohirrim border-guard defend against the Khundolar's retaliation.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This instance quest is meant to be run Solo, but can be run with a Duo as well.</rgb>","Talk to Céola when you are ready to defend Etheburg","Enraged by your attack upon Lashkarg and the death of their chieftain, the Khundolar stage an assault upon Etheburg.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This instance quest is meant to be run Solo, but can be run with a Duo as well.</rgb>","Talk to Céola at Etheburg in the Brown Lands","Céola is at Etheburg in the Brown Lands.\
\
You should speak with Céola regarding the victory at Etheburg."}},
[8075]={nameES="Lights in the Land -- Repeatable",objectivesES={"Céola is at Etheburg in the Brown Lands.\
\
Céola has asked you to help the Rohirrim border-guard defend against the Khundolar's retaliation.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This instance quest is meant to be run Solo, but can be run with a Duo as well.</rgb>","Talk to Céola when you are ready to defend Etheburg","Enraged by your attack upon Lashkarg and the death of their chieftain, the Khundolar stage an assault upon Etheburg.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This instance quest is meant to be run Solo, but can be run with a Duo as well.</rgb>","Lights in the Land -- Repeatable","Talk to Céola at Etheburg in the Brown Lands","Céola is at Etheburg in the Brown Lands.\
\
You should speak with Céola regarding the victory at Etheburg."}},
[8076]={nameES="Like Smoke in the Night",objectivesES={"Ordâkhai soldiers can be found throughout TBD Khud Zagin.\
\
TBD has asked you to defeat several wandering patrols of Ordâkhai soldiers through TBD various parts of Khud Zagin.","TBD, a rebel in opposition to the Ordâkhai, is growing concerned about the number of Ordâkhai patrols near Ghalburu. You have offered to clear a few of their number.","Like Smoke in the Night","TBD Rebel Sharpshooter can be found in Ghalburu.\
\
Return to TBD Rebel Sharpshooter,","Return to TBD Rebel Sharpshooter"}},
[8077]={nameES="Like Water for Meat",objectivesES={}},
[8078]={nameES="Like Water for the Drowned",objectivesES={"Bring peace by force to the restless Curthádi spirits at Róthirin.","Report back to Artar Ildarthos at Vartúlin that you've brought peace to many Curthádi at Róthirin.","Ildarthos, Artar of the remaining Adúrhid warriors in Vartúlin, has asked for your help in bringing peace to the many wrathful Curthádi at Róthirin.","Report back to Artar Ildarthos at Vartúlin","Like Water for the Drowned"}},
[8079]={nameES="Lilies for Lily",objectivesES={"The pond that contains the water-lilies is just to the west of the Mead Hall.\
\
Selethryth asked you to gather water-lilies to feed her goat.","Selethryth is north-west of the Mead Hall of Fenmarch.\
\
You have gathered a number of water-lilies and should bring them back to Selethryth so that she may feed her hungry goat.","Selethryth's goat, Lily, will only eat water-lilies, and Selethryth has no more.","Lilies for Lily","Talk to Selethryth"}},
[8080]={nameES="Lirios en el Valle",objectivesES={"Un lirio perfecto crece en algún lugar a lo largo del Bruinen, al este del puesto de Arrod.\
\
Arrod te ha pedido que le traigas un lirio perfecto de belleza exquisita. Ningún otro tipo servirá.","Has encontrado un lirio perfecto","Arrod quedó complacido con la pluma que le trajiste, y se ha inspirado en ella para confeccionar un collar para Narlinn.","Encuentra el lirio perfecto","Arrod vigila el camino que atraviesa las Gargantas del Bruinen desde su puesto, cerca de unas ruinas en lo alto de una colina, al oeste del Bruinen.\
\
Arrod se alegrará al ver que has encontrado un lirio de belleza exquisita.","Lirios en el Valle","Lleva el lirio perfecto de regreso a Arrod"}},
[8081]={nameES="Lilies of the Vale",objectivesES={"Haldis wishes for you to decorate the inside of Grimbeorn's lodge.\
\
You should decorate the inside of the lodge with the lilies you collected.","Lilies of the Vale","Pond lilies can be found in ponds throughout the Beorning-lands.\
\
You should collect pond lilies for Haldis.","Haldis has seen the pond lilies in full bloom and wishes to bring joy to the Beorninghús.","Talk to Haldis","Haldis can be found at the Beorninghús.\
\
You should inform Haldis that the decorations are complete."}},
[8082]={nameES="El secreto de Lily",objectivesES={"Gammy Cenagales está segura de que Falco Manoverde se ha metido en algún tipo de problema del que no puede salir, y el mensaje críptico que recibiste de Lirio no ayuda a tranquilizarla.","Habla con Lirio Sotomonte en su casa","Habla con Gammy Cenagales en su granja.","lleva los lirios rojos a Lirio Sotomonte en su granja.","Entrega los lirios rojos a Lirio Sotomonte","Lirio Sotomonte se encuentra fuera de su casa al este de la casa de Gammy Cenagales, al pie de la colina, al norte del camino.\
\
Gammy Cenagales cree que con la persuasión adecuada, Lirio contará todo lo que sabe sobre la difícil situación de Falco.","Lirio Sotomonte se encuentra fuera de su casa, al este de la granja de Gammy Cenagales.\
\
Lirio Sotomonte dijo que no podía decir específicamente cuál era el problema de Falco Manoverde, pero que podía mostrártelo si mirabas las cosas correctas. Como pista, te envió a recolectar lirios rojos. Al encontrar los lirios, también notaste el gran campamento de bandidos en Ost Baranor.","El secreto de Lily","Gammy Cenagales está en su granja, al oeste de la casa de Lirio Sotomonte.\
\
Lirio te dijo — sin decirte — que la Gente Grande acampada en las ruinas del sur del bosque de Chet es la razón por la que la granja de Falco Manoverde está sufriendo. Deberías contarle a Gammy Cenagales lo que sabes.","Los lirios rojos se pueden encontrar en la zona boscosa al sur del Árbol Amarillo, bien al sur de la casa de Lirio Sotomonte.\
\
Lirio Sotomonte dijo que no podía decir específicamente cuál era el problema de Falco Manoverde, pero que podía mostrártelo si mirabas las cosas correctas. Como pista, te envió a recolectar lirios rojos."}},
[8083]={nameES="Lily-Picking",objectivesES={"Talk to Bruidis in Tadrent","Bruidis has asked you to help her collect lilies from the marsh north of Tadrent.","Lily-Picking","You have collected plenty of lilies.\
\
You should bring them to Bruidis in Tadrent.","Bruidis wishes to surprise her husband with a gift."}},
[8084]={nameES="Lingering Blight",objectivesES={}},
[8085]={nameES="Link in the Chain",objectivesES={"Wights have arisen in the Bonevales, presenting a terrible threat to all who dwell in Dunland.","Link in the Chain","Ilar is at his camp, west of Plas-maru.\
\
You should bring the chain-links that you recovered to Ilar.","Talk to Ilar at his camp in the Bonevales","Chain-links may be found on wights outside Plas-maru, east of Ilar's camp.\
\
Ilar has asked you to recover chain-links from fallen wights."}},
[8086]={nameES="Liquid Courage",objectivesES={"Liquid Courage","Return to Lieutenant Solvi at Tol Ascarnen","Captain-General Mákan does his best to assist the morale of the troops stationed at Tol Ascarnen. The relentless battle takes its toll on a being over time, and ale is the best way to keep the Free Peoples prepared.","You may be able to find some in Hoarhallow itself, but it will likely be costly. You may even find the draughts stored at Grothum and Dâr-gazag.\
\
Lieutenant Solvi asked you to find and recover draughts of Hoarhallow-ale."}},
[8087]={nameES="Listening to the Pulse",objectivesES={"Hathalon's mood is grim","Talk to Hathalon, Master-at-arms, in the north of Imloth Melui","Merenir's mood is hopeful","Talk to Brunil in the Hall of the Gentle Hand, on the western side of Imloth Melui","Hathalon trains new recruits in the northern part of Imloth Melui. Merenir oversees the flow of refugees by the fountain in the middle of town. Master Healer Brunil treats the injured within the Hall of the Gentle Hand, on the western side of Imloth Melui.\
\
Lady Vanyalos has asked you to talk to the people she trusts in Imloth Melui and determine their moods.","Lady Vanyalos is in her hall on the north-eastern rise in Imloth Melui.\
\
You should return to Lady Vanyalos and report what you have heard from her three trusted advisors.","Talk to Lady Vanyalos in her hall on the north-east rise of Imloth Melui","Talk to Merenir, Captain of the Guard, in the centre of Imloth Melui","Lady Vanyalos wishes to know the current mood and thoughts of the people of Imloth Melui.","Listening to the Pulse","Brunil's mood is dour"}},
[8088]={nameES="Escuchando a la madera (Diario)",objectivesES={"El gremio de carpinteros de Umbar Baharbêl suministra muchos artículos hermosos a los ciudadanos de la ciudad. Estás ayudando a que sus servicios de artesanía crezcan.","Fabrica una caja de arcos para el Gremio de carpinteros de Umbar.","Has creado una caja de arcos para el Gremio de carpinteros de Umbar.","Proporciona la caja de arcos al líder del Gremio de carpinteros de Umbar.","Entrega una caja de arcos al líder del Gremio de carpinteros de Umbar.","Escuchando a la madera (Diario)","La receta necesaria para completar esta misión está disponible para su compra. <rgb=#00f000>Compra la receta de la misión al líder del gremio.</rgb>\
\
Empaqueta una caja de arcos para Umbar Baharbêl."}},
[8089]={nameES="Escuchando a la madera (Diario)",objectivesES={"El gremio de carpinteros de Umbar Baharbêl suministra muchos artículos hermosos a los ciudadanos de la ciudad. Estás ayudando a que sus servicios de artesanía crezcan.","Fabrica una caja de arcos para el Gremio de carpinteros de Umbar.","Has creado una caja de arcos para el Gremio de carpinteros de Umbar.","Proporciona la caja de arcos al líder del Gremio de carpinteros de Umbar.","Entrega una caja de arcos al líder del Gremio de carpinteros de Umbar.","Escuchando a la madera (Diario)","La receta necesaria para completar esta misión está disponible para su compra. <rgb=#00f000>Compra la receta de la misión al líder del gremio.</rgb>\
\
Empaqueta una caja de arcos para Umbar Baharbêl."}},
[8090]={nameES="Letanía de desafío",objectivesES={"Antes de continuar tu aprendizaje, Dithrik desea ver cómo te desempeñas en un duelo contra el enano Brestir.","Letanía de desafío","Regresa con Dithrik en las Fundaciones de Piedra","Desafía a Brestir a un duelo en el Puente de Khazad-dûm","Brestir derrotado"}},
[8091]={nameES="Lithengris Mystery",objectivesES={}},
[8092]={nameES="Little Comfort",objectivesES={"Bote, Léofrun's doll, is somewhere within the ruins of Thornhope.\
\
Léofrun has asked you to find her doll Bote.","Collected Léofrun's doll","Bring the doll to Léofrun outside Thornhope","Little Comfort","Léofrun is encamped outside the walls of Thornhope.\
\
You should return the frightened little girl's doll to its owner.","After you rescued the frightened child, Léofrun, from the ruins of Thornhope, she took refuge with Thane Béortnoth.","Collect Léofrun's doll"}},
[8093]={nameES="Little Folk Harvesters",objectivesES={"The Lumber Yard has fallen into enemy hands.","Tortmund has arrived safely","Little Folk Harvesters","Tortmund Cliffside is at the tower on the eastern border of Hoarhallow, just over the bridge.\
\
Sergeant-at-Arms Aeglas has asked you to see the safe arrival of the hobbits from Hoarhallow. The hobbits will be assisting the Free Peoples in acquiring enough materials to create bulwarks throughout the Ettenmoors.","As the battle for the Ettenmoors rages on, the host of the Free Peoples is beginning to realize that they must think about reinforcing their positions throughout the land.","Escort Tortmund Cliffside to the Grimwood Lumber camp"}},
[8094]={nameES="Pequeña revolución",objectivesES={"Estandarte de Mordor colocado en el trono de Zâhof","Zâhof derrotado","El líder uruk de la Mano Blanca ha establecido su campamento en el Camino de Durin y está haciendo que varias tribus de trasgos y orcos se alíen bajo su mando.","Coloca el estandarte de Mordor en el trono de Zâhof","El trono de Zâhof está en Fehem-dûm, al este de Jazârgund.\
\
Ión desea causar discordia entre los orcos de Moria y Mordor. Te ha dado un estandarte para que lo coloques en el trono del uruk de la Mano Blanca.","Derrota a Zâhof","Ion está en Jazârgund, al oeste de Fehem-dûm.\
\
Ión se alegrará de oír que Zâhof está muerto y que el estandarte de Mordor ha sido colocado en su trono.","Zâhof se encuentra en Fehem-dûm, al este de Jazârgund.\
\
Zâhof es el líder de los uruks de la Mano Blanca en Moria. Si cae, los planes de Saruman caerán con él.","Pequeña revolución","Habla con Ión en Jazârgund"}},
[8095]={nameES="Little Spirits",objectivesES={"Amarêkh, one of the Temámir guards stationed in Mekab-kuphâr, has asked you to leave offerings of food for the \\qlittle spirits\\q throughout Khabârkhad. \
\
The first location is west of Mekab-kuphâr, near Sektakhâb, where the Dead walk.","Return to the Temámir Guard Amarêkh in Mekab-kuphâr in southern Khabârkhad.","Amarêkh, one of the Temámir guards stationed in Mekab-kuphâr, has asked you to leave offerings of food for the \\qlittle spirits\\q throughout Khabârkhad.","Return to the Temámir Guard Amarêkh in Mekab-kuphâr","The third location is north-west of Mekab-kuphâr, near Lôkhalel, where tomb robbers keep their council.","The second location is north of Mekab-kuphâr, near Nishabêt, home of monstrous spiders.","Little Spirits"}},
[8096]={nameES="Pequeñas maravillas",objectivesES={"You discovered an object which by all appearances belongs to a child, though it does not seem to be Dunlending in nature.","Talk to a Ranger at Echad Idhrenfair","This appears to belong to a child, though it does not seem to be of the Dunlendings. Perhaps one of the Rangers of the Grey Company may be able to unravel the mystery.","Pequeñas maravillas","There are Rangers at Echad Idhrenfair in the Gloomglens.\
\
You should bring the object you found to the Rangers of the Grey Company. Perhaps they will be able to unravel the mystery."}},
