[8193]={nameES="Lost Lore of Gorgoroth: Udûn",objectivesES={"Collect Page 16","Collect Page 2","Collect Page 13","You have gathered the pages, but the binding is still missing, and the author still unknown. You recall Narthavron at the Udûn Foothold mentioned fighting in the War of the Last Alliance; perhaps he knows more about these pages.","Collect Page 1","Soot-smudged pages can be found scattered around Udûn.\
\
You should collect the pages to complete the story.","Soot-smudged pages can be found scattered around Udûn. Perhaps you can complete the story if you find them all.","Collect Page 15","Collect Page 7","Collect Page 8","Collect Page 5","Collect Page 6","Collect Page 14","Collect Page 10","Completado.","Collect Page 11","You've found the page of a journal, written in an Elvish script, and ripped from its binding. It has small, sooty handprints on it. Perhaps you can find other pages around Udûn and complete the story.","Collect Page 3","Collect Page 4","Lost Lore of Gorgoroth: Udûn","Narthavron can be found at the Udûn Foothold.\
\
You should talk to Narthavron.","Collect Page 9","Completado","Collect Page 12","Talk to Narthavron"}},
[8194]={nameES="Lost Lore of the Dwarf-holds: Ered Mithrin",objectivesES={}},
[8195]={nameES="Lost Lore of the Dwarf-holds: Ironfold",objectivesES={"Collect page 3","Collect page 5","Lost Lore of the Dwarf-holds: Ironfold","Rusted pages can be found scattered around the Ironfold.\
\
You should collect the pages to complete the story.","Collect page 6","Collect page 9","Collect page 8","Completado.","Collect page 4","The story is complete. From the poem, you have learned the tale of the Longbeards coming to the Ironfold, the destruction of Járnfast, the reconstruction, and the existence of a Nameless horde beneath the hold. You wonder if the recent eruption of Orodruin has affected the mithril seal holding back the evil in the Howling Pit....","Collect page 2","You've found a torn page of a tome, rust-coloured from the iron in the soil of the Ironfold. Perhaps you can find other pages around the Ironfold and complete the story.","Completado","Collect page 7","Collect page 1","Collect page 10","Pages of a tome can be found scattered around the Ironfold. Perhaps you can complete the story if you find them all."}},
[8196]={nameES="Lost Lore of the Dwarf-holds: Smaug",objectivesES={}},
[8197]={nameES="Lost Lore of the Dwarf-holds: Thikil-gundu",objectivesES={"You have gathered all the pages of the lost lore of Thikil-gundu, the Steel Keep.","Find the twelfth page","Find the sixth page","Found the eleventh page","Found the first page","Found the fourth page","Find the tenth page","Found the twelfth page","Found the tenth page","Found the fourteenth page","Built by the dwarves and stolen by dragons, Thikil-gundu, the Steel Keep, has borne witness to a tragic and terrible history.","Find the thirteenth page","Found the thirteenth page","Find the first page","Find the eighth page","Find the ninth page","Find the fourteenth page","Found the third page","You have found a curious page of rust-stained writing. Perhaps you can find other pages among the Dwarf-holds of the Ered Mithrin to learn more of the lost lore of Thikil-gundu, the Steel Keep.","Rust-stained writing can be found in Thikil-gundu and among the Ered Mithrin.\
\
You should find more rust-stained pages to learn more of the lost lore of Thikil-gundu, the Steel Keep.","Find the third page","Find the eleventh page","Find the second page","Found the seventh page","Found the fifth page","You have gathered a number of pages of rust-stained writing among the Dwarf-holds of the Ered Mithrin, and you have learned more of the history of Thikil-gundu, the Steel Keep, through the writing of Karazgar, the Weeping Warrior.","Lost Lore of the Dwarf-holds: Thikil-gundu","Find the fifth page","Found the eighth page","Found the second page","Find the seventh page","Find the fourth page","Found the ninth page","Completado","Found the sixth page"}},
[8198]={nameES="Lost Lore of the Great Alliance",objectivesES={"Collect Page 16","Collect Page 17","Talk to Elendil","Collect Page 26","Continue adventuring in Mordor Besieged","Stark-white pages can be found scattered throughout Mordor Besieged.\
\
You should collect the pages to complete the story.","Pages of a journal can be found scattered across Mordor Besieged. Perhaps you can complete it if you find them all.","Collect Page 20","Collect Page 2","Collect Page 22","Lost Lore of the Great Alliance","Collect Page 13","Collect Page 19","Collect Page 24","Collect Page 21","Collect Page 1","Collect Page 15","Collect Page 7","Collect Page 8","Collect Page 5","Collect Page 25","Collect Page 27","Collect Page 14","Collect Page 10","Collect Page 6","Completado.","Collect Page 11","Collect Page 3","You have found lost pages of a journal authored by Elendil.\
\
You should continue adventuring in Mordor Besieged.","Collect Page 18","Collect Page 4","High King Elendil can be found in Adambel.\
\
If he is missing, he will return after the Council of the Kings.","You have found the page of a journal, stark-white in contrast to the battle-scarred plain of Gorgoroth. Perhaps you can find other pages in Mordor Besieged and complete the story.","Collect Page 9","The story is complete. You believe this is an account of Gil-galad's shattering of the Morannon written by High King Elendil himself. Perhaps if you bring it to him, he will be able to comment further.","Completado","Collect Page 12","Collect Page 23"}},
[8199]={nameES="Lost Lore of the Morgul Vale: Cirith Ungol",objectivesES={"Collect Page 16","Collect Page 17","Collect Page 2","Continue Adventuring in Cirith Ungol","Collect Page 13","Collect Page 19","Ancient pages can be found scattered throughout Cirith Ungol.\
\
You should collect the pages to complete the story.","Collect Page 1","Collect Page 15","The story is complete. This letter was clearly written for Galadriel by her husband Celeborn, but you are unsure quite how old it is. Perhaps if you bring it to Celeborn, he will be able to answer your questions.","Collect Page 7","Collect Page 8","You show Celeborn the ancient pages you found in Cirith Ungol. He looks amused.\
\
'Thousands of years later, a letter sent but never delivered re-appears. Just as the subject of the letter has re-appeared herself. I wrote this in the early days of the Second Age. Thangorodrim had fallen. I, with the aid of the Bright Company, hunted down Morgoth's living servants, of which the spawn of Ungoliant were counted. My request for aid did eventually reach Galadriel, through other means, and the star-glasses received. Ungwetári was bound by the Gilgelair for only a few hundred years, before Sauron came to Mordor and freed her.\
\
'When I return to Lórien, I will deliver this letter to Galadriel. I believe she will be pleased to finally receive it.'","Collect Page 5","Collect Page 6","Collect Page 14","Collect Page 10","Completado.","Collect Page 11","Pages of a letter can be found scattered across Cirith Ungol. Perhaps you can complete it if you find them all.","Collect Page 3","Celeborn can be found outside Torech Ungol, at the top of the Winding Stair.\
\
You should talk to Celeborn.","Collect Page 18","Collect Page 4","You have found what appears to be a page of a letter. It seems quite ancient, written in an elvish script with a deft hand on paper that should have long ago decomposed. Perhaps you can find other pages in Cirith Ungol and complete the story.","Legolas still needs your help in Cirith Ungol searching for Shelob.\
\
You should continue adventuring in Cirith Ungol.","Habla con Celeborn","Collect Page 9","Completado","Collect Page 12","Lost Lore of the Morgul Vale: Cirith Ungol"}},
