[8205]={nameES="Lost Lore of the Vales: Old Mad Ubb",objectivesES={"Collect Page 6","Collect Page 10","Collect Page 4","Lost Lore of the Vales: Old Mad Ubb","Completado.","You have found a verse of what appears to be a Woodfolk song, perhaps written down by a scholar passing through the Vales. You might be able to complete the song if you find all of the missing verses.","Collect Page 1","Collect Page 3","Collect Page 9","After a fair amount of searching, you have completed the song. This seems to be a song the Woodfolk sing to their children to warn them away from the marshes. The song itself is quite old, and has been passed down verbally for many generations. Could it be that Old Mad Ubb was based on a real person, perhaps 'Úbil the Snatcher,' a figure of whom the Woodfolk still speak? The unpleasantness of which Old Mad Ubb is accused in the doggerel strikes you as familiar, somehow.","Completado","Birch-bark pages can be found scattered throughout the Vales of Anduin.\
\
You should collect the pages to complete the song.","Collect Page 2","Collect Page 7","Collect Page 8","Verses of a song can be found scattered around the Vales of Anduin. Perhaps you can complete it if you find them all.","Collect Page 5"}},
[8206]={nameES="Lost Lore of the Vales: Tauralindalë",objectivesES={}},
[8207]={nameES="Lost Miner -- Inir",objectivesES={"Inir awaits rescue in the Barnavon Mine.\
\
You should escort Inir to the mine entrance.","Cada is outside the Barnavon Mine.\
\
You should return to Cada with news of Inir's rescue.","Talk to Inir","The miner Inir was wounded during the attempt to flee the Barnavon Mine, but managed to hide from the bugan.","Lost Miner -- Inir","Escorted Inir to safety","Talk to Cada at the mine"}},
[8208]={nameES="Lost Miner -- Siam",objectivesES={"The miner Siam was wounded during the attempt to flee the Barnavon Mine, but managed to hide from the bugan.","Talk to Siam","Lost Miner -- Siam","Siam is awaiting rescue in the Barnavon Mine.\
\
You should escort Siam to the mine entrance.","Escorted Siam to safety","Talk to Cada at the mine","Cada is outside the Barnavon Mine.\
\
You should return to Cada and let him know that Siam is safe."}},
[8209]={nameES="Lost Miner -- Wilim",objectivesES={"Escorted Wilim to safety","The miner Wilim was wounded during the attempt to flee the mine, but managed to hide from the bugan.","Talk to Wilim","Talk to Cada at the mine","Wilim awaits rescue in the Barnavon Mine.\
\
You should escort Wilim to the mine entrance.","Cada is outside the Barnavon Mine.\
\
You should return to Cada and let him know that you escorted Wilim to freedom.","Lost Miner -- Wilim"}},
[8210]={nameES="Lost Miner I, Part 2",objectivesES={"The miner Wilim has been rescued from the clutches of the bugan in the Barnavon Mine.","Lost Miner I, Part 2","Talk to Gwilum in Barnavon","Gwilum is outside the gate to Barnavon-town, far to the west of the Barnavon Mine.\
\
Cada asked you to bring the good news of Wilim's survival to Gwilum."}},
[8211]={nameES="Lost Miner II, Part 2",objectivesES={"Talk to Gwilum in Barnavon","Lost Miner II, Part 2","Gwilum is outside the gate to Barnavon-town, far to the west of the Barnavon Mine.\
\
Cada has asked you to bring the good tidings of Siam's survival to Gwilum.","The miner Siam has been rescued from the clutches of the bugan in the Barnavon Mine."}},
[8212]={nameES="Lost Miner III, Part 2",objectivesES={"Gwilum is outside the gate to Barnavon-town, far to the west of the Barnavon Mine.\
\
Cada asked you to take the good tidings of Inir's survival to Gwilum.","The miner Inir has been rescued from the clutches of the bugan in the Barnavon Mine.","Talk to Gwilum in Barnavon","Lost Miner III, Part 2"}},
[8213]={nameES="He perdido mis canicas",objectivesES={"Lleva las canicas a Warstang","He perdido mis canicas","Puede que encuentres a las bestias que se comieron las canicas de Warstang repartidas por toda Länsi-mâ.\
\
Encuentra las canicas perdidas de Warstang en los vientres de las bestias que las devoraron y devuélveselas en el puesto avanzado enano de Zigilgund.","Warstang, un saqueador que reside actualmente en Zigilgund, ha perdido sus canicas. Al parecer se dispersaron y fueron devoradas por diversas bestias, y quiere tu ayuda para recuperarlas."}},
[8214]={nameES="Lost No More",objectivesES={"Find Corsair captives at the wreck of the Kêl Tezhor","You have found a Corsair captive at the wreck of the Kêl Tezhor.\
\
You should talk to him.","Hedra has asked you to free Corsair captives at the wreck of the Kêl Tezhor, if there are any.\
\
You should first find them.","Talk to Udnerth outside of the wreck of the Kêl Tezhor","Relinquishing her father's knife to you, Hedra instead hopes you can use it to free the Corsairs' captives.","Talk to the Corsair captive","You have found the last surviving Corsair captive at the wreck of the Kêl Tezhor.\
\
You should free Udnerth from his bindings.","Lost No More","Free Udnerth from his bindings","The captive squints at you","You've done what you set out to do.\
\
You should talk to Udnerth outside of the wreck of the Kêl Tezhor."}},
[8215]={nameES="Lost Shadows",objectivesES={}},
[8216]={nameES="Provisiones perdidas",objectivesES={"Unos enanos que escoltaban un carro de provisiones desde el Umbral de Durin fueron emboscados justo al oeste de Manarbul. El carro fue destruido y las cajas de provisiones robadas.","Lleva las cajas de provisiones a Gansi","Provisiones perdidas","Los trasgos ladrones fueron vistos por última vez huyendo hacia el norte por el camino que lleva a Mudmulzarâk.\
\
Gansi te ha pedido que recuperes las cajas de provisiones robadas por los trasgos.","Gansi está en la Cámara de la Encrucijada, al sur de Mudmulzarâk.\
\
Has recuperado las cajas de provisiones robadas por los trasgos y deberías llevárselas a Gansi sin demora."}},
[8217]={nameES="Lost Trade-goods",objectivesES={"The bandits attacked the waggon along the Road of Riches to the east of Iridír. You should defeat the bandits in that area and recover the lost trade-goods.","Dashên has had a shipment of trade-goods stolen by bandits. He has asked for your help in getting them back.","Lost Trade-goods","Return to Dashên with the recovered trade-goods","You have defeated the bandits and recovered the stolen trade-goods. You should return to Iridír and speak to Dashên."}},
[8218]={nameES="Objetos perdidos",objectivesES={"Habla con Reginard fuera de Lhúngobel","Reginard te está esperando en el exterior de Lhúngobel.\
\
Vuelve con él con su mochila y lo que queda de sus pertenencias.","Reginard te ha invitado a que te encuentres con él de vuelta en su campamento.\
\
Su campamento se encuentra en la ciénaga al sur de Lhúngobel.","Libera a Reginard de sus ataduras.","Objetos perdidos","Encuentra la mochila de Reginard","Libera a Reginard de sus ataduras","A Reginard se le cae el alma a los pies al sopesar la mochila en sus manos.\
\
'Supongo que a los trasgos no les gustaban mucho mis cosas. Solo quedan unos cuantos frascos de especias...\
\
'Esper. ¿Dó... dónde está mi trébol de la suerte? ¡No puedo volver sin él! Ese trébol fue un regalo de... de...'\
\
Respira honda y temblorosamente varias veces para calmarse.\
\
'No hay mucho que se pueda hacer, ¿no? No podemos peinar todo este lugar en busca de un simple trébol. Esto... ¡solo será un contratiempo menor en mi aventura! Sí, eso es.\
\
'¿Por qué no preparo algo de vuelta en el campamento? ¡Es lo justo después de todo lo que has hecho! Me encontraré allí contigo... necesito dar un paseo a solas.'","Habla con Reginard","Has encontrado a Reginard de vuelta en su campamento.\
\
Habla con él.","La mochila parece desafortunadamente ligera","Reginard te ha pedido que recuperes su mochila, que debe estar en algún lugar de Lhúngobel.","Has encontrado la mochila de Reginard con la mayoría de su contenido arruinado.\
\
Devuélvele la mochila.","Encuentras a Reginard mirando cabizbajo a la hoguera apagada","Has encontrado a Reginard. Ahora falta encontrar sus pertenencias.","Vuelve con Reginard al campamento en la ciénaga","Recupera la mochila de Reginard","La comida y hierba para pipa de Reginard ha sido esparcida por el suelo y arruinada"}},
[8219]={nameES="Lost by the Falls",objectivesES={"Search for Edâkhi near the Falls of Ilûritu","Return to Kiga in Ub Nishir","Speak with Edâkhi","Return to Kiga in Ub Nishir to the north of Maurûsh and let her know about Edâkhi.","Kiga has asked you to search for the leader of her group, Edâkhi, near the Falls of Ilûritu.","Kiga has asked that you find her expedition leader, Edâkhi, near the Falls of Ilûritu because she has yet to return to Ub Nishir.","Lost by the Falls","Speak to Edâkhi and tell her that Kiga is worried about her.","Found expedition camp"}},
[8220]={nameES="Lost in Battle",objectivesES={}},
[8221]={nameES="Perdido en Caranost",objectivesES={"Busca señales de Mellanion","Dale el caballito de juguete a Mellanion","La manta que has encontrado es sin duda de tejido élfico. ¿Podría haber pertenecido al niño elfo desaparecido? Deberías seguir buscando señales de Mellanion en Caranost, en el centro de Cardolan.","Vuelve a Sírlond","Con los orcos distraídos, ¡Mellanion pudo escapar! Deberías comprobar que ha regresado a Sírlond.\
\
Sírlond se encuentra en el centro de Cardolan.","Sigue buscando señales de Mellanion.","Sigue buscando señales de Mellanion","El propio hijo perdido de la mujer que llora puede ser la clave para liberarla del dolor que la está llevando a la locura.","Grethron quiere que le devuelvas el caballito de juguete a Mellanion.\
\
Mellanion está en Sírlond, gracias a ti.","Enciende la caja de polvora negra","Perdido en Caranost","Mellanion logró esconderse de sus captores, pero necesita ayuda para escapar. Quiere que enciendas la caja de polvora negra que vio en la torre sobre las escaleras.\
\
La torre está en Caranost.","El caballito de juguete parece que ha sido mordido, ¡pero esperemos que su dueño no lo haya sido! Sigue buscando señales de Mellanion en Caranost, en el centro de Cardolan.","Grethron cree que el hijo de Annaethel aún puede estar vivo. Deberías buscar señales de Mellanion en Caranost, en el centro de Cardolan."}},
[8222]={nameES="Lost in Fangorn",objectivesES={"The Ent Baillas can be found towards the central southern edge of Fangorn Forest.\
\
You should speak with Baillas.","The Ent you encountered has a memory he wishes to impart upon you, for he is too sleepy to pursue his own interests.","The Ent looks at you knowingly. It is clear that he is curious about what may have happened to this injured man.","Talk to Baillas once more","You have the sensation of recalling a memory that is not your own....","Lost in Fangorn","Observe Baillas's memory","The Ent Baillas can be found towards the central southern edge of Fangorn Forest.\
\
You should speak with Baillas to learn the memory upon which he dwells.","This Ent is not dissimilar from Ashlimb. It is apparent in his eyes that he mulls upon some memory with interest, but has grown too sleepy to do anything but mull."}},
[8223]={nameES="Una cuestión de traducción",objectivesES={"Candaith no puede descifrar las inscripciones que encontraste entre los orcos de las Tierras Solitarias, pero conoce a un Montaraz que podría hacerlo.","Saeradan está en el campamento de Montaraces situado a lo largo del Camino Verde, al norte de Bree y al este del camino, cerca del Taller de Espinar.\
\
Candaith te entregó las órdenes que habías recuperado y te pidió que se las llevaras a Saeradan el Montaraz.","El Montaraz Candaith está en su campamento, al pie de la Cima de los Vientos.\
\
Saeradan te ha revelado que orcos que se hacen llamar Uruk-hai han venido al norte para espiar la región y descubrir por qué sus primos del norte se dirigen hacia el sur. Te ha pedido que regreses rápidamente con Candaith para advertirle del peligro.","Lleva las órdenes de los orcos a Candaith","Lleva las órdenes de los orcos a Saeradan","Una cuestión de traducción"}},
[8224]={nameES="Lost in Lhingris",objectivesES={"Nurnhoth can be found in Dath Nethryn.\
\
A Nurnhoth has asked you to find his companions, who have become lost and endangered in the swamps of Dath Nethryn.","After escaping their servitude in Dor Amarth and Talath Úrui, several Nurnhoth have become lost and endangered in the swamps of Dath Nethryn.","You have aided many of the Nurnhoth lost and endangered in the shallows of Dath Nethryn, and you have helped them escape both the oppressive might of Sauron's servants and the terrible creatures of Lhingris.","You have aided many of the Nurnhoth lost and endangered in the shallows of Dath Nethryn.","Completado","Lost in Lhingris"}},
[8225]={nameES="Lost in Love",objectivesES={"Randgar lives on a small farm, south and east of Cliving, along the road.\
\
Inhild has asked you to go to the farmer Randgar and convince him to flee for her sake.","Talk to Randgar at his farm","Inhild is worried about a young farmer named Randgar, whom she cares deeply for. Randgar has decided to risk his life outside of Cliving, rather than abandon the woman he loves.","Lost in Love"}},
[8226]={nameES="Lost in Passing",objectivesES={"Faramir, son of Ondoher can be found at the foot of Dol Acharn.\
\
You have discovered Faramir, son of Ondoher while searching for the remaining Rangers. You should speak to him.","After sending a company of Rangers to seek you on the battle plain, Anborn now hopes to see them safely return to Haerondir at your side.","You have discovered the spirit of Faramir floating near the foot of Dol Acharn!","Talk to Faramir at the foot of Dol Acharn","Search for the remaining Rangers near Dol Acharn","Dol Acharn can be found due east of Ondoher's Folly and the battle plain in Dagorlad.\
\
You have found six dead Rangers, but still seek the remaining four. You should search the foot of Dol Acharn for any survivors.","This Ranger lies slain, but is marked with no wounds...","Lost in Passing","The Rangers can be found somewhere to the north-east of Haerondir on the battle plain between Ondoher's Folly and Dol Acharn.\
\
Anborn has asked you to seek the lost company of Rangers that left Haerondir in search of you and Anborn. You should search for them in Dagorlad."}},
[8227]={nameES="Perdidos en sus redes",objectivesES={"Perdidos en sus redes","Hunulf Mascador te ha hablado de los diversos tesoros perdidos en las telarañas, bajo Minas Eriol.","Las arañas han establecido su hogar debajo de las ruinas de Minas Eriol, al oeste del campamento de Hunulf. Allí se han perdido muchos objetos valiosos que necesitan los Eglain.\
\
Hunulf te ha pedido que vayas al peligroso valle situado bajo Minas Eriol, una fortaleza en ruinas infestada de trasgos. Te ha dicho que las arañas se han apoderado de muchos tesoros que los Eglain quieren recuperar.","Habla con Hunulf Mascador"}},
[8228]={nameES="Lost in Transit",objectivesES={"Felgar has asked you to deliver some missives to scouts.\
\
Two scouts are on the level below Felgar's location: one on a bridge to the east, the other to the west. The third scout is waiting two levels below Felgar's location, in Aslíf.","An injured Felgar needs you to send missives to a couple of other scouts.","Completado","Lost in Transit","You have completed Felgar's request. The scouts have received their missives, and Felgar will be back on her feet soon enough.","You have completed Felgar's request."}},
[8229]={nameES="Lost in the Confusion",objectivesES={"Talk to Celebros","Clearing away the debris reveals an ash-stained lockbox","Search the area near the reflecting pool","The capture site can be found to the north-east of Celebros.\
\
You should search the capture site for signs of the missing heirloom.","DNT - Not Used","A metallic shimmer underneath the debris catches your attention...","Collect the lost heirloom","Lost in the Confusion","Collected the lost heirloom","Celebros, the wife of Lord Sirgon, lost a family heirloom during her capture. She has asked for your help in finding it.","Examine the shimmering debris","Celebros is located in the market east of Tol Ciryarani.\
\
You should speak with Celebros.","The shimmering debris is located near the reflecting pool of the capture site.\
\
You should examine the shimmering debris.","The heirloom box is located near the reflecting pool of the capture site.\
\
You should take the heirloom box."}},
[8230]={nameES="Lost in the Lodes",objectivesES={"Talk to Lokur","Lokur can be found in Ormgren.\
\
You have freed many of the ensnared Longbeard miners in Ormgren. You should return to Lokur.","After encountering a number of aggressive and unsettled glow-worms in Ormgren, several Longbeard miners have been ensnared by viscous glowing slime.","Lost in the Lodes","Ensnared Longbeard miners can be found in Ormgren in Gloomingtarn.\
\
Lokur has informed you that several Longbeard miners exploring Ormgren have been ensnared by unsettled glow-worms. You should help free the ensnared miners."}},
[8231]={nameES="Lost in the Mail",objectivesES={}},
[8232]={nameES="Lost in the Shallow",objectivesES={}},
[8233]={nameES="Lost in the Swamp",objectivesES={"Defeated many lost spirits.","Completado","You have defeated many lost spirits along the river Gladden, making the Vales of Anduin safer.","A strange darkness has come to the Vales of Anduin. Lost spirits move along the river Gladden. These fell beings should be defeated if the Vales are to remain safe.","Lost spirits can be found along the river Gladden.\
\
You should defeat lost spirits.","Lost in the Swamp","Lost spirits move along the river Gladden."}},
[8234]={nameES="Lost in the Wood",objectivesES={"Ghân-buri-Ghân can be found in Drû Bhûta.\
\
You should speak with Ghân-buri-Ghân.","You find Rhûd-pulo-Drât, unharmed, but he runs off before you get a chance to speak with him","The tracks meander slowly, moving deeper into the woods","Search for the missing Wose","There is an ancient darkness emanating from this mysterious foe","Arriving at the last known location of the Wose, Rhûd-pulo-Drât, you spot footprints","Defeat the unknown creature","Ghân-buri-Ghân, chieftain of the Drúedain, asks of you to find Rhûd-pulo-Drât, a Wose who has recently gone missing.","You describe to Ghân-buri-Ghân the strange creature that frightened Rhûd-pulo-Drât and attacked you.\
\
'You describe Dheghûn. They not from Drúadan Forest. Recently come here from unknown around same time Wood-troll turn to shadow. Dheghûn now threat too when they attack you and Rhûd-pulo-Drât. Must keep balance, yet so many pushing rocks.'","Defeat the strange creatures that scared off the Wose you found.","Speak with Ghân-buri-Ghân","The last place the missing Wose was seen was in the Drúadan Forest.\
\
You should search for the missing Wose.","Lost in the Wood","You should follow the footprints and continue searching for the missing Wose."}},
[8235]={nameES="Lost, But Loyal",objectivesES={}},
[8236]={nameES="Lost, But Not Forgotten",objectivesES={"Forced into the sewers of Osgiliath after a staggering defeat by the Morgul-host, Mablung and the Rangers of Ithilien struggle to survive beneath a stronghold of the Enemy.","Mablung's Rangers can be found throughout Osgiliath.\
\
Mablung has asked you to seek the Rangers he sent to scout the surface of Osgiliath and order them to return to his post.","Lost, But Not Forgotten","Mablung can be found in the culverts of Osgiliath.\
\
You have found several of Mablung's Rangers and should now return to him in the culverts.","Talk to Mablung in the sewers of Osgiliath","The Ranger noticeably flinches and readies his weapon as you approach.\
\
'I feared my position was discovered... I am sorry, stranger. Mablung has sent you?\
\
'I shall return to the tunnels with haste, but I cannot abandon my post until my friend returns and we have saved more of our old records.'"}},
[8237]={nameES="Lothgobel Salvage Wood",objectivesES={"Talk to Aradax","You have retrieved some salvage wood from around Lothgobel and should return it to Aradax in Lothgobel.\
\
Talk to Aradax in Lothgobel.","A Corsair has asked you to retrieve scrap wood from around town.","Lothgobel Salvage Wood","Aradax has asked you to collect scrap wood from around Tathrendalf."}},
[8238]={nameES="Lothgobel and Reports of Corsairs",objectivesES={"Find and confront Jajax","The smell of smoke on the air does not bode well","Lothgobel is in central Lamedon.\
\
You should investigate Lothgobel for signs of Corsair intrusion.","You have seen a great deal of evidence showing that the enemies here are uniformly loyal to a Corsair named Jajax.\
\
You should seek out this captain and confront him about his ransacking of Lothgobel.","The Watchman can be found in Dínadab in northern Lamedon.\
\
You should speak with the Watchman about what should be done next against the Corsair threat.","Investigate the streets of Lothgobel for signs of Corsair intrusion","Lothgobel and Reports of Corsairs","Homes can be found in Lothgobel in central Lamedon.\
\
You should search homes for signs of Gondorians or the invading Corsairs.","Speak with the Watchman of Dínadab","You should investigate the rumours of Corsairs in Lothgobel, to the south","You heard rumours that Corsairs were seen moving into Lothgobel in central Lamedon."}},
[8239]={nameES="Lothgobel's Wild Boar Problem",objectivesES={"Lothgobel's Wild Boar Problem","Alagiel has asked you to defeat vicious boars near Lothgobel.","Talk to Alagiel","Tell Alagiel that you have culled some boars.","A farmer asks you to help protect Lothgobel by fighting off wild boars."}},
[8240]={nameES="Lothlórien - Galadhrim I",objectivesES={}},
[8241]={nameES="Lothlórien - Galadhrim II",objectivesES={}},
[8242]={nameES="Lothlórien - Galadhrim III",objectivesES={}},
[8243]={nameES="Lothlórien - Galadhrim IV",objectivesES={}},
[8244]={nameES="Lothlórien Allowance",objectivesES={}},
[8245]={nameES="Preparativos de Lothlórien I",objectivesES={"Lleva los planes de batalla a Sileffind","Preparativos de Lothlórien I","Sileffind se encuentra en Caras Galadhon. Los orcos y trasgos en las afueras de Lothlórien y por toda Moria pueden llevar planes de batalla que ayuden a los elfos a prepararse para el ataque.\
\
Sileffind te ha pedido que derrotes a orcos y trasgos y recojas de ellos los planes de batalla.","Sileffind cree que los orcos de Moria están planeando un ataque contra Lothlórien y quiere que busques sus planes de batalla."}},
[8246]={nameES="Preparativos de Lothlórien II",objectivesES={"Donndageth se encuentra en Caras Galadhon.\
\
Has derrotado a numerosos orcos y trasgos en las peligrosas mazmorras de Moria y deberías regresar con Donndageth con noticias de tus victorias.","Los orcos y trasgos más poderosos pueden encontrarse en las numerosas y peligrosas mazmorras de Moria: las Forjas de Khazad-Dûm, el Tesoro Olvidado, la Gran Escalera y la Sala Decimosexta.\
\
Donndageth te ha pedido que derrotes orcos y trasgos en las peligrosas mazmorras de Moria para limitar las fuerzas que podrían atacar Lothlórien.","Preparativos de Lothlórien II","Donndageth te ha pedido que derrotes orcos en las numerosas mazmorras de Moria para reducir las fuerzas disponibles para su inminente ataque contra Lothlórien.","Habla con Donndageth en Caras Galadhon"}},
[8247]={nameES="Preparativos de Lothlórien III",objectivesES={"Un ataque contra Lothlórien por parte de los orcos de Moria está sin duda por venir, y Mithenn quiere asegurarse de que los puestos avanzados en la frontera expuesta de Fanuidhol estén abastecidos.","Habla con Faelleron en Talan Fanuidhol","Faelleron se encuentra en la base de Talan Fanuidhol.\
\
Has entregado una caja de suministros a Talan Fanuidhol y ahora deberías hablar con Faelleron.","Mithenn, dentro de Caras Galadhon, quiere que lleves los suministros que dejó fuera de las puertas de la ciudad hasta la base de Talan Fanuidhol.\
\
Mithenn quiere asegurarse de que las talan en las afueras del expuesto Fanuidhol estén bien abastecidas para el ataque de los orcos.","Preparativos de Lothlórien III","Has entregado los suministros a Talan Fanuidhol","Recoge suministros fuera de la entrada de Caras Galadhon"}},
[8248]={nameES="Preparativos en Lothlórien IV",objectivesES={"Habla con Sileffind en la entrada de Caras Galadhon","Una pila de cajas se encuentra junto a Aesgyl en Telain Galadhrim. Sileffind está en la entrada de Caras Galadhon.\
\
Se te ha pedido que lleves una caja a Sileffind en la entrada de Caras Galadhon.","Sileffind está en la entrada de Caras Galadhon.\
\
Has entregado una caja a Sileffind y ahora deberías hablar con él.","Aesgyl ha preparado algunos suministros para ayudar en la defensa de Lothlórien contra los Orcos de Moria.","Recoge una caja de la pila cerca de Aesgyl","Preparativos en Lothlórien IV"}},
[8249]={nameES="Love Is In the Air",objectivesES={"Colladan is located in the Houses of Lore in Minas Tirith.\
\
Bring the wayward verses to Colladan.","Wayward verses can be found around the Houses of Lore in Minas Tirith.\
\
You should collect wayward verses for the hopeful poet.","A romance stricken young man needs help impressing his poetry-loving lady friend.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This quest will be removed from your quest log when the current festival ends.</rgb>","Love Is In the Air","Bring the wayward verses to Colladan"}},
[8250]={nameES="El amor es Como una Flor",objectivesES={"Recoge una violeta","Recoge una prímula","Lleva las flores a Avery Manzanagria","Has recogido una prímula","Las caléndulas pueden encontrarse cerca del círculo de piedra fuera de Cavada Grande, las violetas más allá de la Puerta Oeste de Bree, y las prímulas en el círculo de piedra sobre Celondim.\
\
Al darse cuenta de que no puede reunir el valor para hablar cara a cara con la dama de sus afectos, Avery Manzanagria te ha pedido ayuda para recolectar una combinación de flores de todos los rincones de Eriador.","Has recogido una caléndula","Has recogido una violeta","El amor es Como una Flor","Recoge una caléndula","El enamorado Avery Manzanagria ha caído rendido por una mujer a la que ha estado admirando desde lejos por Bree.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro cuando finalice el festival actual. </rgb>"}},
[8251]={nameES="Reservas de comida bajas",objectivesES={"Reservas de comida bajas","Los jabalíes han tomado las ruinas de Minas Vrûn, al este de Amon Raith.\
\
Amarion te ha pedido que caces los jabalíes de Minas Vrûn para que pueda alimentar a los granjeros que se han refugiado en Amon Raith.","Llevar carne dura de jabalí a Amarion","El montaraz Amarion está en Amon Raith, al oeste de Annúndir y al este del Camino Verde.\
\
Amarion espera que regreses con la carne de jabalí con la que espera alimentar a los granjeros bajo su cuidado.","El montaraz Amarion estaba acampado en Amon Raith, vigilando las tierras circundantes. No estaba preparado para cuidar de los granjeros que huían de la invasión de Angmar en Annúndir."}},
[8252]={nameES="Low Hanging Fruit",objectivesES={"You collected the perfectly good oranges you found lying on the ground. You should return to Meliri at Burukíri in Ambarûl.","Low Hanging Fruit","Meliri wants you to collect any perfectly good oranges you find lying on the ground. They are found in the orange groves of Burukíri in Ambarûl.","Bring the oranges to Meliri","Meliri insists that no food should go to waste and has asked you to pick up any perfectly good oranges off of the ground before they can go bad."}},
[8253]={nameES="Prueba de lealtad",objectivesES={"Te has ganado la confianza de Naethmunn","Gánate la confianza de Forchon","Prueba de lealtad","Te has ganado la confianza de Astiul","Te has ganado la confianza de Forchon","Los montaraces Astiul, Forchon y Naethmunn están en el campamento de la isla de Tinnudir, en Evendim.\
\
Calenglad te ha pedido que ofrezcas tu ayuda a tres de sus hermanos. Cuando estén convencidos de que tu corazón es puro y no planeas saquear las tumbas de los Dúnedain, considerará de nuevo tu proposición.","Gánate la confianza de Astiul","Gánate la confianza de Naethmunn","Calenglad te ha pedido que ayudes a sus compañeros montaraces en Tinnudir. Una vez que estén satisfechos con la ayuda que prestes, considerará de nuevo tu propuesta.","Calenglad está en el campamento de montaraces de la isla de Tinnudir, en Evendim.\
\
Has convencido a sus hermanos de que tu corazón es puro y debes volver con Calenglad para pedirle de nuevo su ayuda para conseguir el Silithar para Aragorn."}},
[8254]={nameES="Luck of the White Stag",objectivesES={}},
[8255]={nameES="Piedra de la suerte",objectivesES={"Everard te espera en su casa en el centro de Sobrecolina.\
\
Everard Holebourne estará encantado de recuperar su piedra de la suerte.","Recoge la piedra de la suerte","Busca la piedra de la suerte en la carcasa del ciervo","Lleva la piedra de la suerte a Everard Holebourne","La guarida del oso está al norte de Sobrecolina, en las laderas sobre las Piedras de Tronco.\
\
Everard Holebourne te ha pedido que recuperes su piedra de la suerte de la carcasa del ciervo que mató, la cual fue arrastrada a una guarida de osos.","Has recogido la piedra de la suerte","Piedra de la suerte","Everard Holebourne perdió su venado y su piedra favorita por culpa de un oso merodeador."}},
[8256]={nameES="Afortunada la flecha que mata dos veces",objectivesES={"Los cadáveres de orcos se encuentran esparcidos por las fronteras norte y sur de Lórien, al este de Echad Andestel.\
\
Celegúien te ha pedido que busques los cuerpos de orcos abatidos por flechas en las afueras de Lórien y te ha advertido que no te acerques demasiado a la frontera. Quiere que recuperes las flechas para que puedan volver a usarse contra los orcos.","Afortunada la flecha que mata dos veces","Celegúien te ha pedido que recuperes flechas de los arqueros Galadhrim que ya han sido usadas para abatir orcos en las afueras del Bosque de Oro.","Lleva las flechas élficas a Celegúien","Celegúien se encuentra en Echad Andestel, el campamento en las riberas del Nimrodel, al oeste de la frontera de Lórien.\
\
Has recuperado flechas de los orcos abatidos a lo largo de la frontera de Lórien y ahora deberías llevárselas a Celegúien."}},
[8257]={nameES="Lugazag Reinforcements",objectivesES={"Glân Vraig lay far to east and south of Lugazag.\
\
After taking Lugazag away from the Enemy, the army of the Free Peoples have sent you to Glân Vraig to request reinforcements for the tower.","Deliver the message without defeat","Your mission has failed","Lugazag is now under the control of the Free Peoples. In order to keep the tower under the ownership of the Free People reinforcements must be called to defend its walls.","Another has informed the Captain-General, support arrives shortly","Talk to Tordúr at Glân Vraig","Lugazag is fallen to the Army of Angmar","Support must not be present at Lugazag","Lugazag Reinforcements","Angmar's Army must not control Lugazag"}},
[8258]={nameES="Luilloth, la princesa regente de Cardolan",objectivesES={"La placa dice: 'Luilloth, princesa, madre, esposa, campeona.' Detrás de la placa encuentras un pergamino","Habla con Rhiangar para escuchar su historia de Luilloth","Rhiangar Nevit te ha pedido que encuentres una estatua de Luilloth en Dol Ernil y que busques pistas en su base.\
\
La estatua de Luilloth está en Dol Ernil.","Hace miles de años, una princesa dio descanso a los muertos y salvó el reino. Sin embargo, perdió todo al hacerlo.","Lleva el pergamino a Rhiangar","Luilloth, la princesa regente de Cardolan","Rhiangar sonríe al verte.","Encuentra a Rhiangar Nevit cerca de Dol Ernil","Rhiangar Nevit te ha pedido que vayas a su encuentro cerca de Dol Ernil.\
\
Dorn Ernil está en el noroeste de Cardolan.","Busca la estatua de Luilloth","Rhiangar Nevit te ha pedido que escuches su historia de Luilloth.\
\
Rhiangar se encuentra en la Posada de la Encrucijada, la posada de Herne."}},
[8259]={nameES="Luistin — Introducción",objectivesES={"Luistin lossoth recogido","Recoge un luistin lossoth","Juha te explicó cómo los Lossoth pueden correr sobre el hielo a gran velocidad gracias a los huesos que atan a sus zapatos.","Juha está en Sûri-kylä y en Pynti-peldot, en Forochel.\
\
Juha te ha pedido que estés atento por si encuentras algún luistin que los Lossoth hayan perdido durante sus travesías por las tierras heladas y que se lo lleves.","Lleva el luistin a Juha","Luistin — Introducción"}},
[8260]={nameES="Lumber Disarray",objectivesES={"Camaen is disturbed by all the lumber scattered around Parth Rest due to fauna disturbing the workers.","You have collected as much lumber as you can and returned it all to its proper place. You should report your success to Camaen.\
\
Camaen can be found in Parth Rest.","The lumber has been stacked","Talk to Camaen in Parth Rest","The lumber should be placed in its proper place by Camean in Parth Rest.","Camaen has asked you to collect the scattered lumber around Parth Rest.","Place the lumber in its proper place","Lumber Disarray"}},
[8261]={nameES="Lumber from Ethring",objectivesES={"Talk to Dervorin in Ethring","Herion has asked you to investigate the missing lumber supplies from Ethring.\
\
Ethring can be found in Ringlo Vale to the north.","Talk to Raithir in Ethring","Raithir has told you that Dervorin should be able to help as Lord of the Vale.\
\
Dervorin can be found in Ethring.","Lumber from Ethring","Herion is worried that the lumber supply from Ethring in Ringlo Vale has been disturbed."}},
[8262]={nameES="Madera del Bosque Salvaje",objectivesES={"Coloca los trozos de madera en una caja de almacenamiento","Madera del Bosque Salvaje","Encontrarás una caja de almacenamiento en el Embarcadero de los Comerciantes o en Puente de Caballetes.\
\
Debes guardar los trozos de madera en una caja de almacenamiento.","El anuncio del tablón dice:\
\
'Se necesita: madera del Bosque Salvaje para obras y reparaciones. Se recompensará su esfuerzo.'","Alguien ha puesto una tarea para recoger madera en el Bosque Salvaje.","En el Bosque Salvaje hay árboles de los que se puede obtener madera.\
\
Deberías recoger los trozos de madera."}},
[8263]={nameES="Sustancia luminosa",objectivesES={"El pozo minero cerca de Sori está repleto de gusanos luminiscentes, cuyas entrañas se pueden utilizar para fabricar una especie de antorchas.","Lleva la sustancia luminosa a Sori","Sustancia luminosa","Sori se encuentra en el pasadizo sur de las Vetas del Cuerno de Plata.\
\
Deberías volver a ver a Sori con la sustancia luminosa que has recogido de los gusanos luminiscentes."}},
[8264]={nameES="Luz venenosa",objectivesES={"Rocheledh is at Estolad Mernael in the Drownholt.\
\
You should bring the stingers you collected to Rocheledh so that he may craft a useful antidote from their luminous venom.","Rocheledh is concerned that many sources of poison are potential threats to those who assist the Golden Host on their venture through Mirkwood. He wishes to craft an antidote to have on hand against the firefly poison.","Lleva los aguijones luminosos a Rocheledh en Estolad Mernael","Luz venenosa","Fireflies can be found throughout the Drownholt in Mirkwood.\
\
Rocheledh has asked you to collect the venomous stingers of fireflies so that he may craft an antidote against the poison. He fears for safety of the Elf-friends who travel with the Malledhrim."}},
[8265]={nameES="Lumrog Lackeys",objectivesES={"Defeat Orcs or hobgoblins in Lumrog","Completado.","Within the encampment of Lumrog, Orcs and hobgoblins serve foul hill-trolls that make this place home. If these creatures are dispatched, the trolls will find it difficult to maintain their presence in Misthallow.","Without their lackeys, the hill-trolls will find it difficult to maintain their presence in Misthallow. Lumrog has been made safer, if not completely safe, by your efforts.","The encampment of Lumrog echoes not only with the heavy footfalls of hill-trolls, but also with the shrieks and cries of their servants and allies. If these Orcs and hobgoblins are slain, the trolls will find it difficult to maintain their presence in Misthallow.","Completado","Lumrog Lackeys"}},
[8266]={nameES="Lumrog Stompers",objectivesES={"Lumrog Stompers","Hill-trolls have settled in the Misthallow, and the sound of their heavy footsteps shakes the rocks around their encampment. These creatures pose a danger to any who draw too near to Lumrog and should be defeated.","The sound of heavy footsteps shakes the rocks around an encampment of Lumrog. Hill-trolls have settled here and they pose a danger to those in the area.","Completado.","Lumrog has long been a home to a group of hill-trolls in Misthallow. The sound of their heavy footsteps shakes the rocks around their encampment striking fear into the hearts of the nearby residents.","Defeat hill-trolls in Lumrog","Completado","The sound of the trolls stomping around Lumrog has quieted some, thanks to your efforts. Lumrog will never truly be safe, but you have lessened the danger these massive creatures pose for the residents of Misthallow, and that is a good deed."}},
[8267]={nameES="Lumul-nar: Smothering the Sun",objectivesES={"Lumul-nar, the Hall of Mirrors, can be found in Zirakzigil, to the north of the Chamber of the Cross-roads.\
\
Frár has asked you to clear the Lumul-nar of bats and merrevail to make the place more suitable for the dwarves to take over.","Based on the sounds and odours wafting from near the entrance to Lumul-nar, Frár believes that the Hall of Mirrors is infested with bats... or worse. He does not think that the mirrors can be restored when their home is teeming with so many vile winged creatures.","Frár is in the Chamber of the Cross-roads, to the south of Lumul-nar.\
\
You should speak with Frár of your defeat of the many bat-creatures in the Hall of Mirrors.","Lumul-nar: Smothering the Sun","Habla con Frár"}},
[8268]={nameES="Lumul-nar: The Bane of Illumination",objectivesES={"Lumul-nar: The Bane of Illumination","Defeat the evil presence in the Hall of Mirrors","The Hall of Mirrors can be found in Zirakzigil, to the north of the Chamber of the Cross-roads.\
\
Frár has asked you to defeat the menace that holds the Hall of Mirrors in its clutches. You should bring a friend or two on this dangerous venture.","Frár is in the Chamber of the Cross-roads, to the south of Lumul-nar.\
\
You should speak with Frár and inform him of your success against Ergoth in the Hall of Mirrors.","Frár of the Chamber of the Cross-roads explored near the entrance to Lumul-nar, the Hall of Mirrors, and recalls that a great feeling of menace turned him from his path.","Habla con Frár","Ergoth has been defeated"}},
[8269]={nameES="Lumul-nar: The Lesser Rings",objectivesES={}},
[8270]={nameES="Almuerzo para las Vigilantes",objectivesES={"Almuerzo para las Vigilantes","Entrega comida y bebida a Lhian y Cledd.","Entrega comida y bebida a Eryl.","Debes informar a Rhedyn que completaste tus entregas.\
\
Habla con Rhedyn.","Rhedyn te pide llevar un pequeño refrigerio a cada guardia de torre a lo largo del muro.","Gwion da un largo trago de la cantimplora antes de hablar.\
\
'Empaqué cerdo salado para comer. Olvidé traer algo para beber, y no sería apropiado que dejara mi puesto para buscar algo. Gracias por el agua, y dale mis gracias también a la panadera.'","Entrega comida y bebida a Gwion.","Entrega comida y bebida a Deris","Habla con Rhedyn","Entrega comida a los guardias en las torres a lo largo del muro defensivo de Musgovilla."}},
[8271]={nameES="Lurkers Large and Small",objectivesES={}},
[8272]={nameES="Lurkers in the Marsh",objectivesES={"Bog-lurkers have been creeping into Makham Mijann.","Makham Mijann has been overrun by bog-lurkers!","You should clear some bog-lurkers out of Makham Mijann to make their numbers more manageable.\
\
Makham Mijann is located to the north of Tadrent.","It seems that once dismantling efforts in Makham Mijann ground to a halt, bog-lurkers began creeping in.\
\
You should clear some out of the area to make their numbers more manageable.","You have defeated many bog-lurkers at Makham Mijann. When the residents of Tadrent return to dismantle the rest of the camp, they should have no problem with the bog-lurkers.","You have defeated many bog-lurkers at Makham Mijann.","Lurkers in the Marsh","Completado","Defeat bog-lurkers at Makham Mijann"}},
[8273]={nameES="Lurking Hunger",objectivesES={"Bloody bog-lurkers can be found in the red waters of Agarnaith.\
\
You should defeat bloody bog-lurkers.","Lurking Hunger","Viznak can be found in his hideout.\
\
You should talk to Viznak.","Agarnaith's bog lurkers are even more dangerous than the normal variety, lurking under the water, waiting to drown their victims. Viznak has asked you to destroy any you find.","Talk to Viznak"}},
[8274]={nameES="Lurking Jaws",objectivesES={}},
[8275]={nameES="Lurking Looters",objectivesES={"Goblin looters can be found stealthily skulking near Ainhard's homestead.\
\
You should defeat goblin looters.","Goblins are still lurking in the forest near Ainhard's home, waiting for an opportunity to steal from him.","Lurking Looters","Langhár can be summoned to your side with Langhár's summoning horn.\
\
You should talk to Langhár.","Habla con Langhár"}},
[8276]={nameES="Lurking in the Bogs",objectivesES={"Lurking in the Bogs","Erothai has asked you to clean up the bogs to the north so that Mâr Naphra maintains such a high status as an establishment.","Talk to Erothai","Erothai is concerned that the bog-lurkers are becoming more aggressive, heightening the threat of attacks on Mâr Naphra.","You've done all you can to clear the bogs. You should talk to Erothai and give your full report.\
\
Erothai can be found in Mâr Naphra."}},
[8277]={nameES="Lurking in the Flames",objectivesES={"Worms and salamanders can be found in Talath Úrui, mainly near the Ghâshghurm.\
\
You should defeat any worms and salamanders that you encounter.","Worms and salamanders thrive in the embrace of the Ghâshghurm.","Lurking in the Flames","The safety of Talath Úrui is hampered by the many worms and salamanders encroaching the land thanks to Ghâshghurm. You should lower their numbers and thus their hold upon the realm.","Completado","Talath Úrui is safer to cross now that you have defeated a great number of worms and salamanders.","Defeated many worms and salamanders in Talath Úrui."}},
[8278]={nameES="Acechando en las sombras",objectivesES={"Nökkvi se encuentra en el Refugio Sombrío, en las Fundaciones de Piedra.\
\
Debes regresar a Nökkvi y asegurarle que has derrotado a las bestias sinnombre.","Los Sinnombre se pueden encontrar en todas las Fundaciones de Piedra, especialmente a lo largo del borde oriental del lago.\
\
Nökkvi desea que te deshagas de los horrores sin nombre que lo han estado aterrorizando","Habla con Nökkvi en el Refugio Sombrío","Acechando en las sombras","Nökkvi teme a las extrañas y sinnombre horrores que ha visto en las Fundaciones de Piedra."}},
[8279]={nameES="Esperando en la oscuridad",objectivesES={"Esperando en la oscuridad","Los orcos pueden encontrarse en la Cámara de las Aguas Oscuras al sur de la Bodega Putrefacta.\
\
Sylfa te ha pedido que lances un ataque preventivo contra los orcos mientras sus compañeros avanzan hacia el oeste.","Ansurr se encuentra en Hulwul-nefekh, al oeste de la Cámara de las Aguas Oscuras.\
\
Observaste que los orcos que derrotaste eran diferentes a los que habías visto en toda Moria, con extraños crecimientos cubriéndolos. Ansurr debería estar al tanto de esto.","Los orcos no han atacado el puesto de los enanos en la Bodega Putrefacta durante varios días. Sylfa teme que estén preparando un asalto mayor y quiere que presiones el ataque mientras la mayoría de los enanos de la Bodega Putrefacta avanzan hacia el oeste a un nuevo puesto avanzado.","Habla con Ansurr en Hulwul-nefekh"}},
[8280]={nameES="Capa de Piel de Lince",objectivesES={"En el Páramo Alto propinaste un golpe rápido y mortal a un lince de hermosa piel. La bestia se abalanzó sobre ti y, tras derrotarla, reclamaste un digno trofeo con la esperanza de encontrar un sastre élfico que pudiera usar la piel para confeccionar una capa elegante.","Los Elfos habitan en el valle oculto de Rivendel, en los límites orientales del Bosque de los Trolls.\
\
Atacado por el Lince del Páramo Alto, venciste a la bestia y descubriste que tus golpes no dejaron marca alguna en su piel. Tras retirar la piel con destreza, deberías buscar a un armero élfico que pudiera convertirla en una capa magnífica.","Capa de Piel de Lince","Lleva la piel de lince a un armero élfico para que confeccione una capa","Aunque es hermosa, hay poco que puedas hacer con esta piel de lince. Si encontraras a un sastre élfico hábil, quizá podrías convencerlo de trabajar la piel y convertirla en una capa elegante."}},
[8281]={nameES="Lân Mefam: Half-troll Axes",objectivesES={}},
[8282]={nameES="Lân Mefam: Haradrim Tents",objectivesES={}},
[8283]={nameES="Lân Mefam: Marksmen",objectivesES={}},
[8284]={nameES="Lân Mefam: Mûmakil Feed",objectivesES={}},
[8285]={nameES="Léofdag's Return",objectivesES={"You have restored honour to Léofdag's name","Léofdag's wife, Fleda, is in Aldburg.\
\
Burnoth asked you to return Léofdag's body to his wife, Fleda, and tell the people of Aldburg of his valour and honour in the Battle of the Hornburg.","Fleda is in Aldburg.\
\
Now that the memorial for Léofdag has ended, you should speak with Fleda.","Speak with Burnoth to return Léofdag's body to Fleda in Aldburg","Talk to Fleda","Léofdag's Return","Léofdag perished at the Battle of the Hornburg, vindicating himself from the accusations against his honour."}},
[8286]={nameES="Los compañeros de Líkmund",objectivesES={"Has ayudado a Fostólf","Ayuda a Fostólf","Ayuda a Rink","Los enanos de la Cámara de la Encrucijada necesitan ayuda para establecerse allí.","Los compañeros de Líkmund","Fostólf, Rink y Gansi están en la Cámara de la Encrucijada.\
\
Líkmund te ha sugerido que hables con Fostólf, Rink y Gansi, y averigües qué tareas podrían tener para ti.","Has ayudado a Gansi","Has ayudado a Rink","Habla con Líkmund en la Cámara de la Encrucijada","Ayuda a Gansi","Líkmund está en la Cámara de la Encrucijada.\
\\Deberías volver a ver a Líkmund y hablarle sobre tus esfuerzos ayudando a Fostólf, Rink y Gansi."}},
[8287]={nameES="Lúbtul, Scourge of Thikil-gundu",objectivesES={"Defeat Lúbtul, Scourge of Thikil-gundu","You have encountered Lúbtul","Defeated Lúbtul, Scourge of Thikil-gundu","Lúbtul, Scourge of Thikil-gundu","Completado","Lúbtul, Scourge of Thikil-gundu has been defeated. You have removed a significant threat.","Lúbtul poses a grave threat to all that seek the knowledge buried within Thikil-gundu."}},
[8288]={nameES="La locura de Machan",objectivesES={"Dile a Murdaigán que Machan está a salvo.","La locura de Machan","Ayuda a Machan a salir de la guarida de los sierpes de fuego.","Machan buscó tonta y solitariamente cazar sierpes de fuego y terminó atrapado y herido.","Habla con Machan cuando puedas ayudarlo","Has salvado a Machan"}},
[8289]={nameES="Machines of War",objectivesES={"Siege machines can be found at Nîn-stazg to the south-east of Floodwend.\
\
You should destroy siege-weapons that you find in the woods.","Talk to Radwig at Nîn-stazg","Find out why Etta suddenly protests","The young Thane Radwig is in the Mead Hall of Floodwend.\
\
You should speak with Radwig.","Thane Radwig is on a hill overlooking Nîn-stazg.\
\
You should speak with Thane Radwig.","Radwig wishes to meet you outside of Nîn-stazg, an Orc-encampment in the south-east of the Wold.\
\
You should search for Radwig near Nîn-stazg, for he wishes to help you drive out the Orcs there.","Machines of War","Return to Radwig outside of Nîn-stazg","Hear Radwig's reply","Etta, mother of Thane Radwig, is in the Mead Hall of Floodwend.\
\
You should speak with Etta.","Machines of war are being constructed at Nîn-stazg, and their purpose is to lay Floodwend to ruin. Radwig wishes to go fight the forces of Mordor himself, but his mother is not thrilled with this idea.","You encourage the youth Radwig to remain safe with his guards, for these Mordor Orcs are fierce, and his people need him"}},
[8290]={nameES="Mad With Terror",objectivesES={"Men cast aside their weapons and shields when they fled in terror from their posts along the wall at the north end of the Third Circle.\
\
Ingold has asked you to retrieve the weapons and shields the men dropped when they fled.\
\
<rgb=#00FF00>Minas Tirith is besieged! You may examine the model of the city in the Dome of the Sun to travel between states of the city.</rgb>","Ingold is the besieged city, atop the wall at the north end of the Third Circle.\
\
You have retrieved weapons and shields cast aside by men when they fled, and should return now to Ingold.\
\
<rgb=#00FF00>Minas Tirith is besieged! You may examine the model of the city in the Dome of the Sun to travel between states of the city.</rgb>","Ingold is in the besieged city, atop the wall at the north end of the Third Circle.\
\
You have convinced some of the fleeing men to return to their posts, despite their terror.\
\
<rgb=#00FF00>Minas Tirith is besieged! You may examine the model of the city in the Dome of the Sun to travel between states of the city.</rgb>","Frightened soldiers can be found in the besieged city, at the north end of the Third Circle.\
\
Ingold has asked you to convince the men that ran from their posts to return.\
\
<rgb=#00FF00>Minas Tirith is besieged! You may examine the model of the city in the Dome of the Sun to travel between states of the city.</rgb>","You have found Ingold engaged in the defence of the city, and he struggles against the pall of terror that has fallen upon Minas Tirith.","Mad With Terror","Talk to Ingold in the besieged city, atop the wall at the north end of the Third Circle"}},
[8291]={nameES="Made to Suffer",objectivesES={"Talk to Halhir","Imprisoned Rangers can be found in and around Meneldil's Square in western Osgiliath.\
\
Halhir has asked you to free imprisoned Rangers of Ithilien before they are executed in Meneldil's Square.","While scouting the western side of Osgiliath, Halhir learned of the horrible fate that awaits all who are captured by the Morgul-host.","Halhir can be found due east of the Palace of Eldacar in western Osgiliath.\
\
You have rescued many imprisoned Rangers and should now return to Halhir.","Made to Suffer"}},
[8292]={nameES="Madness Ensues",objectivesES={}},
[8293]={nameES="Madness Under The Mountain",objectivesES={"Search for the source of the spiders' madness in Lhingroth","The cave of Lhingroth can be found in the hills to the east of Sardol.\
\
Amathon has asked you to brave the depths of Lhingroth in hopes of finding what has roused the spiders.","Amathon can be found in Sardol, to the west of Lhingroth.\
\
You have been confronted by an oath-breaker of the Ruthless Dead who warned of their intent to break their curse without fulfilling it.","A grim altar reminiscent of the Paths of the Dead stands before you...","A queer chill seems to be emanating from this path...","Examine the skeleton beneath the altar in Lhingroth","Madness Under The Mountain","DNT -- will not be seen","As you examine the bones, a ghastly oath-breaker rises forth to attack!","The spiders of Blackroot Vale have grown far more violent and bold in recent days, and Amathon of Sardol hopes to discover what caused this furor.","Talk to Amathon","A suspiciously preserved skeleton can be found in the depths of Lhingroth.\
\
You have found a strange altar, and what appear to be preserved bones. You should examine them before returning to Amathon.","You have slain the oath-breaker, but must bring these ill tidings to Amathon","Search for the source of the chill in Lhingroth","The chill seems to be emanating from the path to the right in Lhingroth.\
\
You feel a peculiar chill inside Lhingroth and should investigate further."}},
[8294]={nameES="Maedol N'i-Mâr Dhín",objectivesES={"La entrada a las quebradas residenciales de Imladris se encuentra al sur de las caballerizas de Rivendel. Hirthamel te ha sugerido explorar las colinas y hondonadas, y quizás considerar vivir allí tú mismo.","Observas colinas onduladas cubiertas de densas hojas otoñales","Visita la plaza del vallón","Visita una gran villa","Maedol N'i-Mâr Dhín","Una propiedad hermosa, lista para ser decorada con cuidado y dedicación","Visita una cabaña sencilla","Visita la entrada del barrio","Encuentra una buena vista del valle","Una vista sobrecogedora, enmarcada por los picos de las Montañas Nubladas","regresa con Hirthamel","Debes regresar con Hirthamel para contarle lo que has visto","Sin duda una morada con amplio espacio tanto para hermandad como familia","Puede verse la alegre actividad mientras los Elfos de Rivendel trabajan y comercian con gozo","Una pequeña pero cómoda cabaña se encuentra aquí, con vistas sobre el valle","Una brillante puerta dorada marca la entrada al valle superior","Visita una villa","Encaramados en lo alto de las colinas que dominan Imladris, los Elfos de Rivendel dan la bienvenida a todos los que buscan hogar y fuego, entre las hojas encendidas y las aguas murmurantes del Bosque de los Trolls.","Encuentra una vista del Bosque de los Trolls"}},
[8295]={nameES="Magic of the Pale Herald",objectivesES={"You have found a strange orb filled with what you believe is blood in Kaslokroz. It gives you an uneasy feeling; perhaps it is used by The Pale Herald for his dark sorceries. You decide that destroying it, and others like it, is probably in your best interests.","Habla con Legolas.","Blood orbs can be found in Kaslokroz, an Uruk-hai camp.\
\
You should destroy the blood orbs.","You have destroyed the blood orbs in Rûkhor's camp.\
\
You should report your success to Legolas near Kaslokroz.","Magic of the Pale Herald","Strange orbs filled with blood and sorcery dot Kaslokroz, a camp of the Uruk-hai."}},
[8296]={nameES="Make Safe the Gorge",objectivesES={"Return to Shukûri","Shukûri has asked you to thin the numbers of wasps and sandstorms within the Gorge of Woe.","Make Safe the Gorge","Return to Shukûri in the Gorge of Woe and let her know that you have thinned the number of enemies in the area.","Shukûri in the Gorge of Woe has asked you to help her with thinning the number of wasps and sandstorms in the area."}},
[8297]={nameES="Make Them Hunger",objectivesES={}},
[8298]={nameES="Make Use of Nature's Gift",objectivesES={"Narthrien suggests you collect driftwood that is dry enough to be salvageable.","Talk to Narthrien in Parth Rest","You have collected a healthy amount of driftwood that could be of use as lumber in Parth Rest. You should bring it back to Narthrien.\
\
Narthrien can be found in Parth Rest.","Make Use of Nature's Gift","Narthrien may have a solution to Parth Rest's supply chain issue."}},
[8299]={nameES="Making An Example",objectivesES={"Fastred will be pleased to hear that you have added to the collection of Orc heads outside Snowbourn. \
\
Fastred can be found inside the mead-hall in Snowbourn.","Fastred wants you to gather Orc heads to add to the grim display outside Snowbourn. \
\
Orcs can be found throughout the Sutcrofts.","Fastred's hatred for the Orcs has shaped Snowbourn as of late. He has asked that you collect Orc heads to decorate the pikes outside the city as he returns to the mead-hall.","Making An Example","Talk to Fastred in Snowbourn's mead-hall"}},
[8300]={nameES="Making Meat-pies",objectivesES={"Take meat, flour, and vegetables to Ordbéorth's oven and bake meat-pies","Talk to Offram outside the Vendor Hall in Eaworth","Offram stands guard outside the Vendor Hall in Eaworth.\
\
You should return to Offram and let him know that you have delivered the meat-pies.","Making Meat-pies","Pleased with your hunting prowess and offering of aurochs-meat, hides, and ivory, Offram has recruited you to perform more tasks.","Sacks of flour and vegetables can be found within the Eaworth Vendor Hall.\
\
Offram wants you to collect sacks of flour and vegetables to finish making meat-pies for the inhabitants of Eaworth.","Ordbéorth's oven can be found behind his house in the northern part of Eaworth.\
\
Offram wants you to take the meat, flour, and vegetables to Ordbéorth's oven and bake meat-pies for the inhabitants of Eaworth.","People in need of provisions can be found throughout Eaworth.\
\
Offram wants you to take the meat-pies you baked to people in need of provisions for the siege."}},
[8301]={nameES="Making Mischief",objectivesES={"Find a good place to set off the fireworks","Many wealthy patrons have been distracted by your mischief!\
\
You should pick the pockets of the wealthy patrons for coins to give to the poor.","You have set off some distracting fireworks","Making Mischief","You will earn the respect of Gareth Rust if you manage to make trouble at the Festival.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> NOTE: This quest will be removed from your quest log when the current festival ends. </rgb>","Gareth Rust is in the workers' area in Winter-home.\
\
You should return to Gareth Rust and find out if he saw your excellent firework display.","The fireworks are stored at the top of the stairs overlooking the Festival Square.\
\
You should set off the fireworks to distract the wealthy patrons of the Festival.","Return to Gareth Rust with the pilfered coins"}},
[8302]={nameES="Making Papyrus",objectivesES={"Talk to Sûlmur","Use the workbench to press the woven reeds under a weight","Sûlmur has offered to walk you through making papyrus.","Papyrus reeds peeled and cut into strips","Papyrus strips woven together","You have completed all the steps of making papyrus. You should talk to Sûlmur.","Use the workbench to weave the strips together","You have a pile of papyrus reeds. Take them to the workbench, remove the green skin, and cut them into strips.","Collect reeds from the pile across the yard at Mehêtur, and bring them to the workbench.","You have peeled the papyrus and cut the inside of the reeds into thin strips. Now you should weave them together at the workbench.","Woven reeds pressed under weight","Use the workbench to prepare the reeds","Pick up a pile of papyrus reeds","You have woven the papyrus strips together. The next step is to press them under a heavy weight.","Making Papyrus"}},
[8303]={nameES="Making Ready to Flee",objectivesES={"The refugees' horses can be found at the head of their camp, north of Marton.\
\
You should saddle the horses to ready them for the dangerous journey to Helm's Deep.","Agelwyn is in the refugees' small camp in the ravine north of Marton.\
\
You should speak with Agelwyn.","Agelwyn has asked you to ready the horses for travel, and to gather the weapons and shields for delivery to Helm's Deep.","Speak with Agelwyn","Making Ready to Flee","Shields, spears, and saddles can be found throughout the refugees' small camp north of Marton.\
\
You should collect spears, shields, and saddles for the journey, and ready the horses."}},
[8304]={nameES="Making Warriors",objectivesES={"The sparring area is high up in Imloth Melui, west of Lady Vanyalos' quarters.\
\
Fresh recruits are ready to spar with you in an effort to improve their skills.","Hathalon can be found at the sparring area high up in Imloth Melui, west of the Hall of Lady Vanyalos.\
\
You helped Hathalon train some of the new recruits, and should see what he thought of your lessons.","Talk to Hathalon on the height, north-west of the Hall of Lady Vanyalos","Talk to one more young recruit at the sparring area in Imloth Melui","Making Warriors","Captain Merenir feels that if you sparred with some of his guards, it would raise their spirits and improve their form.","Hathalon can be found at the sparring area high up in Imloth Melui, north-west of the Hall of Lady Vanyalos.\
\
Captain Merenir has asked you to help Hathalon train some of the new recruits.","Talk to another young recruit at the sparring area in Imloth Melui","Talk to a young recruit at the sparring area in Imloth Melui"}},
[8305]={nameES="Making a Point",objectivesES={"Talk to Rhosun Turio at Maur Tulhau","Rhosun Turio is an artist in Maur Tulhau who works with stag-ivory scrimshaw.","White stags can be found throughout the Gloomglens in Enedwaith.\
\
Rhosun Turio has asked you to collect stag-antlers for her to continue her scrimshaw.","Rhosun Turio can be found in Maur Tulhau in the Gloomglens of Enedwaith.\
\
You should bring the stag-antlers you collected back to Rhosun Turio.","Making a Point"}},
[8306]={nameES="Making a Trade",objectivesES={"Talk to Dashên","Bring the provisions to Tibira in Western Khanâg","You have traded Tibira's copper ingot to Dashên at Iridír in Ambarûl for fresh produce. You should return to Tibira at Western Khanâg in Khûd Zagin with the crate.","Bring the ingot to Dashên in Iridír","Tibira has asked you to take her copper ingot to Dashên at Iridír in Ambarûl and trade it for fresh produce.","Making a Trade","Dashên takes the copper ingot and hands you a crate loaded with a generous variety of fruits, vegetables, nuts, and a jar of honey.\
\
'There we are. Give Tibira my thanks for her business.'","Tibira has asked you to take her copper ingot to Dashên at Iridír in Ambarûl and trade it for fresh produce. You should talk to Dashên.","Tibira has need of someone to travel to Ambarûl and make a trade for her."}},
[8307]={nameES="Haciendo las rondas",objectivesES={"El granjero Arenilla está en su granja, al oeste de El Cruce.\
\
Lograste recoger suficientes huevos sin que el gallo te viera. Deberías llevarlos de vuelta al granjero Arenilla.","Llevar los huevos al granjero Arenilla","Los nidos de gallinas están alrededor del patio del granjero Arenilla.\
\
El granjero Arenilla te ha pedido que recojas algunos huevos de los nidos de sus gallinas, pero te advirtió que te mantuvieras alejado del gallo. Si te ve mientras recoges los huevos, llamará y molestará a las demás gallinas. Además, ¡seguro que dejarás caer los huevos que has recogido!","El granjero Arenilla se ha lastimado la pierna y no puede atender a sus gallinas ni a sus nidos.","El gallo te ha visto. Has fallado","No encuentras huevos en el nido","Haciendo las rondas","Evitar el gallo"}},
[8308]={nameES="Making the Rounds At Tadrent",objectivesES={"You defeated the deadly stray warg, ensuring it cannot endanger Tadrent","Making the Rounds At Tadrent","Osbenn, an exhausted guard at Tadrent, has asked you to make his rounds for him.","Examine the Corsair corpse and remain alert","Leave Tadrent by the northern entrance and circle around the town to the left","With a ferocious growl, a deadly warg leaps to attack!","Continue circling the town of Tadrent for Guard Osbenn","You have have begun making Osbenn's rounds for him, and should continue to circle the town of Tadrent on his behalf.","Guard Osbenn is in the centre of Tadrent, in King's Gondor.","Osbenn asked you to leave Tadrent by the northern entrance and circle the town to the left.","This location marks the start of Osbenn's rounds; or it would, if he were making them","While making his rounds for Guard Osbenn, you have found the corpse of a Corsair.","This is the halfway point of Osbenn's rounds, which he is not making","Talk to Guard Osbenn in Tadrent, King's Gondor","If Osbenn were here, he would see the Corsair corpse in the grass. Instead... you do","You have reached the halfway point of Osbenn's rounds, and should continue to circle the town of Tadrent on his behalf."}},
[8309]={nameES="Retoños de malbrethil",objectivesES={"La salud de un tipo particular de abedul, llamado malbrethil por los elfos, parece afectar en gran medida a la salud general del bosque. Mallendathor está preocupado por su disminución y su estado y quiere que investigues la causa.","Las ramas de este retoño están caídas y su corteza parece frágil","Se pueden encontrar retoños de malbrethil en Taur Hith, al noreste de Cerin Amroth.\
\
Mallendathor quiere que encuentres y examines algunos retoños de malbrethil.","Mallendathor se encuentra cerca de Cerin Amroth, al suroeste de Taur Hith.\
\
Deberías contarle a Mallendathor lo que has visto sobre los retoños de malbrethil.","Habla con Mallendathor en Cerin Amroth","Retoños de malbrethil"}},
[8310]={nameES="Tarea de Malledhrim: Polvo precioso",objectivesES={"Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir polvo precioso.","Se busca: Polvo precioso tomado de los enemigos derrotados de los Malledhrim.","Tarea de Malledhrim: Polvo precioso","Alguien ha publicado una tarea para entregar montones de polvo precioso. Se pueden entregar a cambio de una recompensa.","Entrega el polvo precioso en una caja de recolección","Has entregado una cantidad respetable de polvo precioso."}},
[8311]={nameES="Tarea de Malledhrim: Caparazón afilado",objectivesES={"Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir caparazones afilados.","Se busca: Caparazones afilados tomados de los enemigos derrotados de los Malledhrim.","Alguien ha publicado una tarea para entregar caparazones afilados. Se pueden entregar a cambio de una recompensa.","Tarea de Malledhrim: Caparazón afilado","Has entregado una cantidad respetable de caparazones afilados.","Entrega los caparazones afilados en una caja de recolección"}},
[8312]={nameES="Tarea de Malledhrim: Esencia vil",objectivesES={"Entrega las esencias viles en una caja de recolección","Tarea de Malledhrim: Esencia vil","Alguien ha publicado una tarea para entregar esencias viles. Se pueden entregar a cambio de una recompensa.","Se busca: Esencias viles tomadas de los enemigos derrotados de los Malledhrim.","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir esencias viles.","Has entregado una cantidad respetable de esencias viles."}},
[8313]={nameES="Tarea de Malledhrim: Suciedad vil",objectivesES={"Entrega la suciedad vil en una caja de recolección","Se busca: Suciedad vil tomada de los enemigos derrotados de los Malledhrim.","Has entregado una cantidad respetable de suciedad vil.","Alguien ha publicado una tarea para entregar suciedad vil. Se puede entregar a cambio de una recompensa.","Tarea de Malledhrim: Suciedad vil","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir suciedad vil."}},
[8314]={nameES="Tarea de Malledhrim: Hueso de dedo vil",objectivesES={"Has entregado un número respetable de viles huesos de los dedos.","Tarea de Malledhrim: Hueso de dedo vil","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir viles huesos de los dedos.","Se busca: Huesos de dedos viles tomados de los enemigos derrotados de los Malledhrim.","Entrega los huesos de dedos viles en una caja de recolección","Alguien ha publicado una tarea para entregar viles huesos de los dedos. Se pueden entregar a cambio de una recompensa."}},
[8315]={nameES="Mam Murgwid's Devoted",objectivesES={"Legolas has asked you to defeat Ungoladan devoted in Cadar Skûs.","Legolas has asked you to defeat any Ungoledain priestesses you find in Cadar Skûs, as they are the ones who claim leadership of the clan.","Habla con Legolas.","Mam Murgwid's Devoted","You have defeated the highest ranking Ungoledain at Cadar Skûs.\
\
You should talk to Legolas."}},
[8316]={nameES="Man and Monster",objectivesES={"Mossbeard has communed with the trees and fallen of the Balewood and now wishes to tell all that he has learned of Núrzum's coming.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This instance quest is meant to be run Solo and cannot be run in a group.</rgb>","Man and Monster","Mossbeard can be found at Stonecliff in the Balewood.\
\
Mossbeard is prepared to tell you and the Ents of the rest of what he has learned from the trees of the forest. You should listen to his tale when you are ready.","Talk to Mossbeard","Mossbeard can be found at Stonecliff in the Balewood.\
\
Mossbeard's tale of Saruman and Núrzum has concluded. You should now speak with him of what can be done to stop the forces at work in the Balewood."}},
[8317]={nameES="Los Asesinos de Hombres",objectivesES={"Orcos que portan la bandera de Angmar se han derramado en las Tierras Solitarias desde el norte y han ocupado Ost Cyrn, unas ruinas situadas al suroeste de Ost Guruth.","Los Asesinos de Hombres","Grimdeal espera noticias de tu éxito en Ost Guruth, al noreste de Ost Cyrn.\
\
Deberías volver a ver a Grimdeal para contarle tu victoria.","Los orcos se encuentran en las ruinas de Ost Cyrn, al suroeste de Ost Guruth.\
\
Grimdeal te ha pedido que ayudes a defender a los Eglain atacando a los orcos de Ost Cyrn."}},
[8318]={nameES="Managing the Menace",objectivesES={}},
[8319]={nameES="Mandan, el Maestro de Hierbas",objectivesES={"El montaraz Mithrendan está en Tornhad.","El montaraz Mandan te ha pedido ayuda para recoger varios de los objetos por los que abandonó Tornhad: gel luminiscente de las moscas de luz del Ángulo, sombreros de seta húmedos y juncos afilados de la orilla del río cercana.","Encuentra a Mandan junto a uno de los ríos al noreste de Tornhad","Mandan, el Maestro de Hierbas","Mandan busca hierbas útiles para elaborar ungüentos y cataplasmas","Habla con Mandan","Mandan está en la isla en medio de un río al noreste de Tornhad, esperando a que vuelvas con los objetos que te pidió.","Has encontrado a Mandan en una isla en mitad de un río al noreste de Tornhad, y el maestro de hierbas de los Dúnedain no parece correr más peligro de lo habitual.","Lleva los objetos que has recogido a Mandan","Mandan suele recorrer todo el Ángulo, pero Mithrendan cree que deberías buscar al Maestro de Hierbas en algún lugar junto a un río al noreste de Tornhad.","Al montaraz Mithrendan no le preocupa la ausencia de Mandan más de lo habitual... pero, aun así, sigue algo inquieto.","Habla con Mithrendan en Tornhad"}},
[8320]={nameES="Atendiendo el Mercado",objectivesES={"Muchos de los vendedores aún no han regresado de su descanso, y el mercado está abarrotado de clientes impacientes que esperan sus productos.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando finalice el evento con el que está asociada.</rgb>","Atendiendo el Mercado","Ayuda a tantos clientes como puedas durante tu turno","Los clientes del Mercado de los Granjeros se están amontonando en el puesto.\
\
Deberías ayudar a preparar tantos pedidos como puedas antes de que termine tu turno.","Tu turno ha terminado"}},
[8321]={nameES="¡Muchas felicidades!",objectivesES={"Milo Corneta, irritado por la idea de Lobelia de recibir regalos de cumpleaños en vez de entregarlos, ha estado criando un sapo particularmente vil y gordo para dárselo como regalo.","Con suficientes sapos eliminados, Lobelia la Sapa debería aparecer en algún lugar del Pantano de la Rana, al norte de El Tronco Flotante.\
\
Milo Corneta te ha pedido que sometas al sapo salvaje que ha llamado Lobelia.","Milo Corneta está esperando junto a El Tronco Flotante en los Ranales.\
\
Debes informar a Milo de tu éxito al capturar a Lobelia la Sapa.","Enfréntate a Lobelia la Sapa","Lobelia la Sapa ha regresado asustada a su jaula","Lobelia la Sapa se esconde entre los sapos de las colinas en el Pantano de la Rana, el pantano justo al norte de los Ranales.\
\
Milo Corneta te ha pedido que elimines suficientes sapos en el Pantano de la Rana para que salga Lobelia la Sapa."}},
[8322]={nameES="Many Preparations",objectivesES={"Talk to King Thorin III","Collect the Master's curfew notices","Talk to Queen Regent Erna and aid the people of Dale","King Thranduil can be found in Felegoth.\
\
You have aided the people of Lake-town in preparing, and you should now travel to Felegoth and aid King Thranduil and the Elves of Eryn Lasgalen in preparing for the coming of Vethúg Wintermind.","You pick up a thick stack of sternly-worded notices written by Dagrun herself!","Dale-folk can be found throughout Dale.\
\
Erna has not ordered her people to Erebor, but she will allow them to depart for safety if they wish it. You should urge the people of Dale to seek shelter in Erebor.","Erna can be found within the Great-keep in Dale.\
\
King Thorin III has asked you to speak to the other leaders of the North and aid them in hastening their preparations for the coming of Vethúg Wintermind.","Quivers of arrows can be found near the dungeons of Felegoth, crates of provisions can be found in the wine cellar, and straw can be found near the trapdoors of Felegoth.\
\
King Thranduil has asked you to help ease the burden of travel to Erebor by packing several barrels with supplies to be shipped to Loeglond for the coming battle at Erebor.","With the knowledge that Vethúg Wintermind will soon come to Erebor, the peoples of the North hasten to prepare for the battle ahead.","Barrels can be found nearby the trapdoors of Felegoth.\
\
You have gathered many supplies and straw and should now use what you have gathered to pack barrels for the Elves of Felegoth.","Many Preparations","Talk to Master Dagrun and aid the people of Lake-town","Dagrun can be found within the Master's Manor in Lake-town.\
\
After aiding the people of Dale, you should continue on to Lake-town and aid the Lake-men as best you can.","The pile of curfew notices can be found behind Dagrun in the Master's Manor in Lake-town.\
\
Dagrun has asked you to post curfew notices throughout Lake-town, and has offered a number of water-skins to the dwarves of Erebor. You should pick up the notices before leaving the Master's Manor.","Notices can be posted throughout Lake-town. Water-skins can be found around Lake-town.\
\
Dagrun has asked you to post curfew notices, and in return, she has offered a number of water-skins to aid the dwarves of Erebor.","King Thorin III can be found before his throne in the Hall Under the Mountain.\
\
You have aided all the peoples of the North and should now return to King Thorin III at Erebor.","Talk to King Thranduil and aid the Elves of Felegoth"}},
[8323]={nameES="Muchos cadáveres inquietantes",objectivesES={"Notas el hedor de la muerte en Baiúrz-mur. Hay tantos orcos muertos como vivos aquí.","Los profanadores y sus maestros han usado a los orcos inferiores como catadores de los venenos fabricados en Baiúrz-mur.\
\
El veneno de los profanadores ha sido fabricado con cuidado para terminar con cualquier criatura viva, incluso los resistentes orcos. Es otra muestra de su crueldad que probaran el veneno en los de su propia especie.","Muchos cadáveres inquietantes","Los cadáveres de los orcos se encuentran por todo Baiúrz-mur.\
\
Deberías buscar en los cadáveres de los orcos pistas de lo que ha podido causar su muerte.","Encuentras una botella vacía con un leve olor a veneno. Este orco era un catador de la inmunda ponzoña.","Completado","Los profanadores y sus maestros han usado a los orcos inferiores como catadores de los venenos fabricados en Baiúrz-mur.\
\
El veneno de los profanadores ha sido fabricado con cuidado para terminar con cualquier criatura viva, incluso los resistentes orcos.","Notas el hedor de la muerte en Baiúrz-mur. Hay tantos orcos muertos como vivos aquí.\
\
Deberías investigar los cadáveres para ver qué ha causado tal número de muertes. Puede que haya una correlación con la fabricación de veneno por los profanadores y la muerte de los orcos inferiores."}},
[8324]={nameES="Map the Gap",objectivesES={}},
[8325]={nameES="Map to the Treasure",objectivesES={}},
[8326]={nameES="Mapping Northern Clovengap",objectivesES={"Hrímil's passage has frozen the fields","Hobgoblins have overtaken Anatrâd!","Search for the fields of Frósthel","Return to Gerja","Hrímil's passage has silenced the fall's roar","The passing of Hrímil has greatly altered the landscape of Clovengap. Are there still signs of the fields and fortresses beneath the ice?","A piece of ancient, curved glass glints from the rubble","Search for the Amgaruslun Falls","Mapping Northern Clovengap","The new locations are in northern Clovengap.\
\
You should search for the Amgaruslun Falls, the ruins of Anatrâd, the look-out, and Frósthel.","Gerja Defthand is in Bazanmanar, in north-east Clovengap.\
\
You should let Gerja Defthand know what you found.","Search for the look-out","Search for Anatrâd"}},
[8327]={nameES="Cartografiando el Camino Tortuoso",objectivesES={"Has dibujado la Sala Vigesimoprimera en el pergamino","Thálfi está al oeste en la Cámara de la Encrucijada.\
\
Thálfi está esperando que regreses con el mapa que has dibujado del Camino Tortuoso.","Dirígete a la segunda sección del Camino Tortuoso y dibuja en el pergamino","Cartografiando el Camino Tortuoso","Dirígete a la cuarta sección del Camino Tortuoso y dibuja en el pergamino","Has dibujado esta parte del Camino Tortuoso en el pergamino","Has encontrado una buena sección para dibujar en el pergamino","Dirígete a la tercera sección del Camino Tortuoso y dibuja en el pergamino","Dirígete a la primera sección del Camino Tortuoso y dibuja en el pergamino","Habla con Thálfi en la Cámara de la Encrucijada","Entra en la Sala Vigesimoprimera y dibújala en el pergamino para completar el mapa","Has encontrado un buen lugar para dibujar en el pergamino","Dirígete a la última sección del Camino Tortuoso y dibuja en el pergamino","El Camino Tortuoso se encuentra al este y conecta la Cámara de la Encrucijada con la Sala Vigesimoprimera.\
\
Thálfi te ha pedido que cartografíes el Camino Tortuoso y la Sala Vigesimoprimera al este de la Cámara de la Encrucijada.","Thálfi necesita a alguien para mapear el Camino Tortuoso, el camino entre la Cámara de la Encrucijada y la Sala Vigesimoprimera."}},
[8328]={nameES="Marauders in the Dale-lands",objectivesES={"You have defeated many Jangovar marauders.","You have defeated many Jangovar marauders encroaching on the Dale-lands. Your efforts will ensure the safety of all those within Dale's walls.","Jangovar marauders encroach upon the city of Dale and should be dealt with swiftly.","Marauders in the Dale-lands","Jangovar marauders can be found in the wilds near the city of Dale in the Dale-lands.\
\
Erna has asked you to defeat any Jangovar marauders you come across.","Completado"}},
[8329]={nameES="Marauders of Nan Laeglin",objectivesES={"Talk to Siorus Brehur at the Brenin's Hall","Marauders of Nan Laeglin","Siorus Brehur is at the Brenin's Hall in the village of Lhanuch.\
\
You should return to Siorus Brehur with news of your victory.","Wargs and half-orcs from Isengard can be found throughout Nan Laeglin, especially where they have raided Uch-lûth farmsteads.\
\
Siorus Brehur has asked you to defend his people against the marauding Wargs and half-orcs in the region of Nan Laeglin.","Half-orcs and Wargs out of Isengard raid the lands around Nan Laeglin to force the people to bow to Saruman's demands."}},
[8330]={nameES="Marauders of the Lone-lands",objectivesES={"Nidgyl is concerned with the half-orcs who have been spotted marauding through the Nain Enidh region of the Lone-lands, making travel into the east nearly impossible.","Half-orcs can be found throughout the Nain Enidh region of the Lone-lands, far to the east of Bree.\
\
Nidgyl has asked you to defeat the half-orcs marauding in the Lone-lands.","Nidgyl is at Bree-town in Bree-land, far to the west of Nain Enidh.\
\
You should return to Nidgyl of Bree-town and tell him of your battles against the half-orcs of Nain Enidh.","Marauders of the Lone-lands","Talk to Nidgyl"}},
[8331]={nameES="March on Gundabad: Additional Steps (Daily)",objectivesES={"The Gabil'akkâ, the Unified Army of Dwarves, has need of your assistance in securing a foothold outside of Gundabad.","March on Gundabad: Additional Steps (Daily)","Talk to Hlóthi","Completed 'March on Gundabad: Healing Hands'","Locate Hlóthi and inform him of your progress.","Complete 'March on Gundabad: Torching the Trenches'","Complete 'March on Gundabad: Resupplying the Forces'","Complete 'March on Gundabad: Pilfering Orkish Orders'","Completed 'March on Gundabad: Raising Morale'","Completed 'March on Gundabad: Siege Upon Siege Engines'","Complete 'March on Gundabad: Securing the Slade'","Completed 'March on Gundabad: Torching the Trenches'","Complete 'March on Gundabad: Siege Upon Siege Engines'","Hlóthi has requested your aid in completing several tasks outside of Gundabad for the Gabil'akkâ, the Unified Army of Dwarves.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: In order to advance this quest, you must complete any four of the required quests.</rgb>","Complete 'March on Gundabad: Raising Morale'","Completed 'March on Gundabad: Securing the Slade'","Completed 'March on Gundabad: Pilfering Orkish Orders'","Completed 'March on Gundabad: Resupplying the Forces'","Complete 'March on Gundabad: Healing Hands'"}},
[8332]={nameES="March on Gundabad: Assisting the War Effort (Daily)",objectivesES={"Spoke to Hlóthi","Your assistance in completing several sorties for the Gabil'akkâ has been greatly noticed.","The Gabil'akkâ, the Unified Army of Dwarves, has need of your assistance in the ongoing war effort.","March on Gundabad: Assisting the War Effort (Daily)","Speak to Hlóthi","Hlóthi has asked for your assistance in the war effort. The Gabil'akkâ, the Unified Army of Dwarves, has requested that you assist the war effort."}},
[8333]={nameES="March on Gundabad: Healing Hands",objectivesES={"Talk to Hlóthi","March on Gundabad: Healing Hands","Numerous wounded soldiers have been stranded on the battlefield, unable to receive aid.","You can find injured soldiers scattered across enemy territory, beyond the dwarves' trenches at Ifbar-athrâkh. More soldiers have been stranded in Azgh-buzru, but Hlóthi has suggested bringing allies if you go there.\
\
You should tend to these soldiers' wounds so that they may return to safety.","The soldiers you tended to will seek treatment from the healers.\
\
Hlóthi in Annâk-khurfu will want to know that you've honoured his request."}},
[8334]={nameES="March on Gundabad: Missions for the Cause",objectivesES={"Speak to Elóf","March on Gundabad: Missions for the Cause","Seek out and complete several missions to assist the Gabil'akkâ.","Seek out and speak to Elóf regarding your completion of several missions.","The Gabil'akkâ, the Unified Army of Dwarves, has requested your assistance in completing a series of missions on their behalf."}},
[8335]={nameES="March on Gundabad: Pilfering Orkish Orders",objectivesES={}},
[8336]={nameES="March on Gundabad: Raising Morale",objectivesES={"March on Gundabad: Raising Morale","The dwarf-trenches have been dug along the main road towards Gundabad.\
\
Hlóthi has asked that you sing to disheartened soldiers in the trenches, so that you may bolster their spirits.","Talk to Hlóthi","War affects not just the body, but also the mind. The horrors of the War of Three Peaks have caused some Gabil'akkâ soldiers to lose hope.","You have sung songs for several disheartened soldiers and bolstered their spirits.\
\
Hlóthi in Zarkul-sulûn is waiting for you to report back."}},
[8337]={nameES="March on Gundabad: Resupplying the Forces",objectivesES={}},
[8338]={nameES="March on Gundabad: Securing the Slade",objectivesES={"Hlóthi is in Annak-khurfu in southern Elderslade.\
\
Return to Hlóthi.","Foes can be found throughout the War of Three Peaks.\
\
Hlóthi has asked you to defeat foes in the War of Three Peaks.","March on Gundabad: Securing the Slade","Foes in the War of Three Peaks must be defeated to help the Gabil'akkâ press forward to Gundabad.","Speak to Hlóthi"}},
[8339]={nameES="March on Gundabad: Shakalush, the Stair Battle (Daily)",objectivesES={"Hlóthi has requested your aid in securing Bagûd-mekhem, the Gate of Wind, for the Gabil'akkâ, the Unified Army of Dwarves.","Speak to Hlóthi","Locate Hlóthi and inform him of your progress.","Complete 'Shakalush, the Stair Battle'","The Gabil'akkâ, the Unified Army of Dwarves, has asked for your assistance in routing the forces outside Bagûd-mekhem, the Gate of Wind.","March on Gundabad: Shakalush, the Stair Battle (Daily)"}},
[8340]={nameES="March on Gundabad: Siege Upon Siege Engines",objectivesES={"Siege engines can be found throughout the War of Three Peaks.\
\
Hlóthi has tasked you with destroying enemy siege engines.","Return to Hlóthi","Hlóthi is in Zarkul-sulûn, in southern Elderslade.\
\
Return to Hlóthi.","Enemy siege engines throughout the War of Three Peaks must be destroyed.","March on Gundabad: Siege Upon Siege Engines"}},
[8341]={nameES="March on Gundabad: Torching the Trenches",objectivesES={}},
[8342]={nameES="Caléndula",objectivesES={"El río Tornasauce atraviesa el centro del Bosque Viejo, y podría ser un buen punto de referencia para usar en tu búsqueda de Caléndula Boffin.","Habla con Caléndula en el exterior de la casa de Tom Bombadil","Habla con Bingo en las orillas del Tornasauce, en el Bosque Viejo","Caléndula Boffin está en el exterior de la casa de Tom Bombadil en el Bosque Viejo, al noreste del río Tornasauce.","Busca en las orillas del Tornasauce, en el Bosque Viejo, a Caléndula Boffin","Has llegado a la casa de Tom Bombadil","Pregunta a uno de los Boffins sobre Caléndula","Una extraña criatura del bosque con botas amarillas invitó a Caléndula a su casa al noreste. Deberías acompañarla y asegurarte de que es seguro.","Caléndula está emocionada por hablar contigo sobre la aventura de Bingo.\
\
Bingo y tú habéis encontrado a Caléndula Boffin en el Bosque Viejo, en la orilla del Tornasauce.","Habla con Caléndula en las orillas del Tornasauce, en el Bosque Viejo","Habla con Bingo en el exterior de la casa de Tom Bombadil","Caléndula","Caléndula Boffin podría estar perdida en algún lugar del Bosque Viejo, y Angélica Boffin te ha hablado de los murciélagos, raíces y lobos que podrían estar amenazando a su hermana en el bosque.","Uno de los Boffins en el exterior de la casa de Prisca podría saber dónde ha ido Caléndula.\
\
Has devuelto a la mayoría de los hijos de Prisca Boffin a su casa, pero Caléndula Boffin todavía está por ahí fuera, en algún lugar.","Bingo está en el exterior de la casa de Tom Bombadil en el Bosque Viejo, al noreste del río Tornasauce.","A pesar de tus esfuerzos, parece que una de las hijas de Prisca Boffin, Caléndula, se te pasó por alto y todavía está lejos de casa.","Bingo y tú habéis encontrado a Caléndula Boffin en el Bosque Viejo, en la orilla del Tornasauce.","Encuentra la casa de la extraña criatura con botas amarillas, en el Bosque Viejo"}},
[8343]={nameES="Marinero: El mayor viaje es la maestría",objectivesES={"Aelindil se encuentra en Tornhad, en el Ángulo del Mitheithel.\
\
Has recibido una carta de Aelindil, un Marinero de los Dúnedain, que desea hablar contigo.","Marinero: El mayor viaje es la maestría","Lleva la carta a Aelindil en Tornhad","Has demostrado tu valía entre la innumerable cantidad de Marineros y Corsarios que surcan las aguas de la Tierra Media, pero ahora emprendes un nuevo rumbo: poner a prueba tu habilidad y dominar el propio Mar, si puedes."}},
[8344]={nameES="Mark of the Falcon",objectivesES={"Taf is at the leather-working pavillion in Tûr Morva.\
\
You have collected the lake-side plants Taf asked you to gather and should bring them to him.","Taf is responsible for crafting much of the armour the Falcon-clan will wear into battle and could use your help.","Return the excess dye to Taf","You collect the crushed plant dye from the grinding stone","Bring lake-side plants to Taf","Lake-side plants with red flowers can be found growing alongside the shore of the lake in Tâl Methedras, but only where the dirt comes right down to the water.\
\
Taf has asked you to collect lake-side plants with red leaves that he can grind up for dye.","Bring the crushed dye to Taf","Taf is at the leather-working pavillion in Tûr Morva.\
\
You have ground up some dye on his grinding stone and should show the product of your labour to Taf.","Partially-completed leather armour is on the table near Taf in the leather-working pavillion of Tûr Morva.\
\
Taf has asked you to use the dye you prepared to put the mark of the Falcon on some of the partially-completed leather armour he has set out on a table.","Taf is at the leather-working pavillion in Tûr Morva.\
\
You have drawn the mark of the Falcon on some of the partially-completed armour and should return the excess dye to Taf.","Draw the mark of the Falcon clan on the partially-completed armour","There is a grinding stone at the leather-working pavillion near Taf, in Tûr Morva.\
\
Taf has asked you to grind up the plants you gathered on his grinding stone, in order to make the colouring for the dye he needs.","You draw a passable Falcon's claw on the armour","Grind up some dye using Taf's grinding stone","Mark of the Falcon"}},
[8345]={nameES="Marcado para la Muerte",objectivesES={"In the wake of a sudden and brutal assault, Thane Mágla's trusted warrior lies slain by Uruks of the White Hand.","Talk to Thane Mágla","Defeated Curr","Egbalth's horn can be found outside one of the burned homes at Bosa's Farm.\
\
The leader of the White Hand forces at Bosa's Farm has not made himself known. You should sound Egbalth's horn to lure the Uruk leader to your position.","Marcado para la Muerte","Thane Mágla can be found inside the Mead Hall of Middlemead.\
\
You have dispatched the Uruk leader, Curr, who spoke of something deeply unsettling before being defeated. You should return to Thane Mágla with this information.","A large Uruk strides forth from the smoking remains of a crofter's home","Lure and defeat Curr","As you look over Egbalth, you notice his horn lying amidst the nearby wreckage. While he likely sounded it to call for aid, only Uruks stood ready to answer. \
\
You have not been able to identify the leader of these Uruk forces thus far, but you suspect that sounding the horn once again might draw what remains of their force.\
\
You decide to learn what you can of the White Hand's purpose at Bosa's Farm before returning to Thane Mágla."}},
[8346]={nameES="Marked for Export",objectivesES={"Talk to Mervárth","Mervárth can be found outside Esgaroth-of-old.\
\
You should talk to Mervárth.","Marked crates can be found inside Esgaroth-of-old.\
\
You should collect marked crates.","Marked for Export","The smugglers in Esgaroth-of-old have been mixing in marked crates with shipments headed down the Lake. Mervárth has asked you to collect them as evidence of their foul deeds."}},
[8347]={nameES="Marked for Later",objectivesES={"The walls in TBD Location need to be marked for repair, to the TBD direction.\
\
TBD Carpenter has asked for your help again, this time in marking the damaged parts of the battlements so he can repair them later.","TBD Mark weak points in the walls","Return to TBD Carpenter","Marked for Later","TBD Carpenter can be found in TBD.\
\
You have left marks on the most decrepit parts of Jirush's battlements for the TBD Carpenter to repair later. Return to him with updates so he can begin his work soon."}},
[8348]={nameES="Market Rates",objectivesES={"Go to the hillside outside the Khab Kitâx outside Zajâna where the orange trees grow and gather seven oranges for Merbâna.","Return to Khâbakh in the Kalmakhíla in Zajâna with the book he requested. The Kalmakhíla can be found near the Shorakhúna in central Zajâna.","Haggle with Merbâna in the Court of Larinâsta","Haggle with Merbâna in the Court of Larinâsta in Zajâna about how many oranges she needs in exchange for the book Khâbakh requested.","Finish haggling with Merbâna in the Court of Larinâsta in Zajâna about how many oranges she needs in exchange for Khâbakh's book.","Finish haggling with Merbâna in the Court of Larinâsta","Market Rates","Speak with Merbâna in the Court of Larinâsta in Zajâna about buying the book Khâbakh requested. The Court of Larinâsta is located due east of the Kalmakhíla, whilst still in Zajâna.","Continue haggling with Merbâna in the Court of Larinâsta in Zajâna about how many oranges she needs in exchange for Khâbakh's book.","In order to get the book Khâbakh needs, you will need to haggle with the local book-seller in the Court of Larinâsta.","Return to Khâbakh in the Kalmakhíla with the book","Return to Merbâna in Larinâsta in Zajâna with the oranges","Return to Merbâna in the Court of Larinâsta in Zajâna with the harvested oranges.","Continue haggling with Merbâna in the Court of Larinâsta","Speak with Merbâna in the Court of Larinâsta"}},
[8349]={nameES="Marks of a Conspiracy",objectivesES={"Dori can be found before the throne of King Thorin III in the Hall under the Mountain.\
\
King Thorin III has granted Dori leave to pursue Nori into the Ered Mithrin, but Dori must now meet his terms. You should speak to Dori.","Unlock the door to Nori's home and begin your search with Dori","Talk to Dori before the throne of King Thorin III","Talk to King Thorin III","Talk to Dori in the Hall Under the Mountain","Dori can be found inside Nori's home in Tumnu-dûm, the Dwelling-halls of Erebor.\
\
You have examined many notes in Nori's home and they bear marks of a conspiracy to defy the King under the Mountain and seek the hoards of Thikil-gundu. You should inform Dori.","The earth shakes as a deep-claw bursts forth!","Nori's home can be found in Tumnu-dûm, the Dwelling-halls of Erebor.\
\
You have arrived at Nori's home in Tumnu-dûm and should now use the spare key to gain entry.","Meet Dori at Nori's home in Tumnu-dûm, the Dwelling-halls","Thikil-gundu was lost, Nori thought, but it was not the way of dragons to abandon their hoards...","Nori's home can be found in Tumnu-dûm, the Dwelling-halls of Erebor.\
\
After learning that Nori left behind a spare key, Dori has asked you to meet him at Nori's home in Erebor.","After clearing the dust away, Nori drew forth his armour of old. The time had come!","King Thorin III can be found before his throne in the Hall under the Mountain.\
\
Dori has begged King Thorin III to grant him leave to pursue his brother into the Ered Mithrin. You should now speak to King Thorin III.","After countless hours of study, Nori learned that the hoarding-vault laid 'beneath the eyes of the Seven'...","Talk to Débel in the New-lodes of Narathâk","Débel can be found among the New-lodes of Narathâk.\
\
You have defeated many of the encroaching deep-claws in the New-lodes of Narathâk and should now return to Débel.","Notes can be found throughout Nori's home in Tumnu-dûm, the Dwelling-halls of Erebor.\
\
After noticing a number of scattered notes, Dori has asked you to begin your search of his brother's home by examining what Nori left behind.","Dori seems fixated upon the King under the Mountain and barely seems to notice your approach.\
\
'King Thorin III Stonehelm, King under the Mountain, I beg leave to travel into the Ered Mithrin. You have forbidden Durin's Folk to return to the Steel Keep, Thikil-gundu, but that is not my purpose. I go in search of my brother, Nori!\
\
'I am a loyal dwarf of Erebor. I have fought and bled in its defence... from the Easterlings... from Bolg! All I ask is the chance to save Nori from his folly!\
\
'Will you grant me leave, King under the Mountain?'","After Vethúg's defeat at the gates of Erebor, Nori enlisted his kinsfolk to follow him to Thikil-gundu...","Dori can be found among the upper levels of the Hall under the Mountain.\
\
You have obtained a spare key to Nori's home in Erebor, and you should now return to Dori and tell him what you have learned.","Dori can be found inside Nori's home in Tumnu-dûm, the Dwelling-halls of Erebor.\
\
You have gained entry to Nori's home and should now speak to Dori.","Dori can be found before the throne of King Thorin III in the Hall under the Mountain.\
\
Dori intends to beg King Thorin III to allow him to seek his brother, Nori, in the Ered Mithrin. You should meet Dori before the throne of King Thorin III.","Talk to Dori in Nori's home","Talk to the dwarf in the New-lodes of Narathâk","Talk to Dori","After Nori secretly departed Erebor for the Ered Mithrin, Dori hopes to learn why his brother deceived both him and the King under the Mountain.","You spot a dwarf matching Dori's description...","Deep-claws have burrowed into the New-lodes of Narathâk.\
\
In exchange for aiding him in repelling the deep-claws of Erebor, Débel has offered to share what he knows of Nori's secret expedition to Thikil-gundu.","Dori shifts uncomfortably outside Nori's home...","Thikil-gundu had once possessed great wealth, Nori thought, and now it sat unguarded and unclaimed...","The strange dwarf can be found among the New-lodes of Narathâk.\
\
You have found a dwarf matching Dori's description and should now speak to him.","Dori looks around the empty home of his brother...","Marks of a Conspiracy","Find a dwarf matching Dori's description in the New-lodes of Narathâk","The New-lodes of Narathâk can be found in the entry hall of Erebor.\
\
Believing him to be in league with Nori, Dori has asked you to find a dwarf of uncommon lineage in the New-lodes of Narathâk."}},
[8350]={nameES="Marooned",objectivesES={}},
[8351]={nameES="Marsh Spirits",objectivesES={"Some disturbance has wakened many of the dead within the marshes. These spirits will work no good in the world while they prowl.\
\
You should defeat a number of fell spirits in the Dead Marshes.","Marsh Spirits","You have defeated a number of spirits in the Dead Marshes.","Some spirits, roused by intruders, prowl the Marshes restlessly.","Completado","Some disturbance has wakened many of the dead spirits within the marshes. They should really be returned to rest.\
\
Defeat a good number of fell spirits in the Dead Marshes."}},
[8352]={nameES="Marsh-reeds",objectivesES={"Bring the marsh reeds to Céolstan at the Harwick Stables","Marsh reeds tend to grow along the edges of standing water, and prefer the rich soil near bogs.\
\
You should collect marsh reeds, the favourite food of Harwick's horses.","Marsh-reeds","Great steeds are the pride of Harwick, and these horses feed on only the finest of hay, grasses, and reeds.","The guard of the stables waits for you to return."}},
[8353]={nameES="Marton Farmlands: Fires in the Fields",objectivesES={}},
[8354]={nameES="Marton Farmlands: The Enemy Patrol",objectivesES={}},
[8355]={nameES="Marton Farmlands: Unsightly Haystacks",objectivesES={}},
[8356]={nameES="Marton: Fallen to Orcs",objectivesES={"You have defeated a number of the Orkish invaders of Marton, but their numbers seem endless. This town is no longer safe, but you hope that you have avenged the farmers who were forced from their homes.","Orcs can be found in the Westfold town of Marton.\
\
You should defeat Orcs in Marton.","The Westfold town of Marton is now utterly occupied by violent Orc-invaders that streamed down from Isengard through the undefended gap.","Marton: Fallen to Orcs","Completado","It is clear that the town of Marton has fallen to Orcs of late."}},
[8357]={nameES="Marton: Favoured Steeds",objectivesES={}},
[8358]={nameES="Marton: Hindered Escape",objectivesES={"It is possible that some people did not escape Marton after the recent Orc assault, and might need rescue.\
\
You should search for hidden places where townsfolk might be trapped.","Townsfolk can perhaps be found in hidden spots throughout Marton in the northern Westfold.\
\
You should search the town for any hiding or trapped survivors.","It is possible that some people did not escape Marton after the recent Orc assault, and might need rescue.","Marton: Hindered Escape","You have rescued some straggling townsfolk. If anything good can be said of the state of Marton, it is that the townspeople seem to have escaped with their lives.\
\
This is more than can be said of other towns you've encountered.","Completado","Search Marton for survivors"}},
[8359]={nameES="Marton: Remnants of a Massacre",objectivesES={"Rípmaush has staked the heads of many Rohirrim victims in Marton's Mead Hall, defiling the corpses and the seat of the Thane.\
\
Such desecrations should not be allowed to stand and rot. You should burn the hideous stakes to undo the hideous work of Rípmaush.","Severed heads can be found in the Mead Hall of Marton.\
\
You should burn the severed heads on stakes.","Rípmaush has staked the heads of many Rohirrim victims in Marton's Mead Hall, defiling the corpses and the seat of the Thane.","Marton: Remnants of a Massacre","You have burned the desecrated heads on stakes in Marton's Mead Hall.\
\
Such a wrong cannot be righted, but destroying the Orc's hideous work is better than letting it stand.","Completado","You have burned the desecrated heads on stakes in Marton's Mead Hall."}},
[8360]={nameES="Marzlok, Scourge of Glimmerdeep",objectivesES={"Marzlok, Scourge of Glimmerdeep has been defeated. You have removed a significant threat.","Defeat Marzlok, Scourge of Glimmerdeep","Marzlok, Scourge of Glimmerdeep","Defeated Marzlok, Scourge of Glimmerdeep","Completado","You have encountered Marzlok, Scourge of Glimmerdeep","Marzlok poses a great threat to all that attempt to remove resources while under his watch in Glimmerdeep."}},
[8361]={nameES="Mash",objectivesES={}},
[8362]={nameES="Máscaras de fauces abiertas",objectivesES={"Máscaras burdas han sido colgadas en Mudmul-charâf como burla a las estatuas de los enanos, mostrando sus horribles bocas en una cruel risa orca.","Destruye las máscaras burdas","Completado","Máscaras de fauces abiertas","Las máscaras burdas talladas y colgadas por el enemigo pueden encontrarse en Mudmul-charâf, en las salas del noroeste de Zelem-melek.\
\
Deberías destruir las máscaras burdas, pues se burlan de las magníficas estatuas hechas por los enanos de antaño.","Has destruido las máscaras crueles que los orcos y trasgos colgaron en Mudmul-charâf."}},
[8363]={nameES="Master of Barad Gúlaran",objectivesES={"Gath Forthnír is north-west from Barad Gúlaran.\
\
You entered Barad Gúlaran and after some time found and defeated the Castellan within his chambers. You should now return to Gath Forthnír, the hidden refuge in the north-east area of Angmar, and inform Uidon that you have defeated Castellan Wisdán.","Long ago, a servant pledged himself to the Witch-king's cause. His service lasts to this day, and his dark embrace on Barad Gúlaran brings terror into the hearts of those fighting to unseat Shadow in the North.","Barad Gúlaran rises out of the centre of Nan Gurth, south and east of Gath Forthnír.\
\
Uidon directed you to enter Barad Gúlaran in search of Castellan Wisdán. You are to slay him and return to Uidon for your reward.","Master of Barad Gúlaran"}},
[8364]={nameES="Señor de las llamas",objectivesES={"Señor de las llamas","Derrota a Gothghaash el Invocallamas","Ossur se encuentra en la Guardia Orca, al suroeste de la Gran Escalera.\
\
Debes regresar con Ossur, en la Guardia Orca, y contarle tu victoria sobre Gothghaash.","Habla con Ossur en la Guardia Orca","En lo más profundo de las salas de Moria, las llamas brotan de charcos aceitosos. Aquí es donde los Ghâsh-hai tienen su hogar. Una de sus facciones está aliada con Mazog, el señor de Moria, y ha acudido a la Gran Escalera para pagar tributo a su líder.","Gothghaash puede encontrarse en la Gran Escalera, al noreste de la Guardia Orca.\
\
Ossur te habló de Gothghaash, el líder de los orcos de fuego, y te indicó que lo encontraras y lo derrotaras.","Gothghaash el Invocallamas derrotado"}},
[8365]={nameES="Maestro de Maethad",objectivesES={"Derrota a Khurrákh","Maethad está al norte y al este de Gabilshathûr.\
\
Hwati te ha indicado que entres al centro de Maethad y uses el Ushum-ghâsh para hacer que Khurrákh se presente.","Hwati está de regreso en Gabilshathûr, al oeste y al sur de Maethad.\
\
Tras haber derrotado a Khurrákh, deberías regresar con Hwati y contarle la historia de tus hazañas.","Habla a Hwati","Khurrákh derrotado","Hwati te ha dicho que ahora que tienes la maza de Ronkûrz, puedes hacer que Khurrákh, el Maestro de Maethad, se presente y desafiarlo.","Maestro de Maethad","Haz que Khurrákh se presente y derrótalo"}},
[8366]={nameES="Maestro de la Marea Negra",objectivesES={"Recoge la armadura del general uruk","Derrota a Zaukîl y recoge su armadura","Armadura del general uruk recogida","Maestro de la Marea Negra","El general uruk Zaukîl se encuentra en la cima de una colina, en el corazón del campamento orco de Dol Dínen, al sureste de Esteldín.\
\
Debes derrotar a Zaukîl, el general uruk de Dol Dínen, y traer su armadura como prueba de tu hazaña.","Lleva la armadura a Elúr","El general uruk Zaukîl se encuentra en la cima de una colina, en el corazón del campamento orco en Dol Dínen, al sureste de Esteldín."}},
[8367]={nameES="El amo de la oscuridad",objectivesES={"Glorelloth se encuentra en el Refugio Sombrío, al noroeste de las Excavaciones Tenebrosas.\
\
Tras atravesar las Excavaciones Tenebrosas, encontraste allí el origen del mal: una criatura ancestral llamada Gurvand. Luego de una dura pelea, acabaste con la criatura, y ahora debes regresar con Glorelloth en el Refugio Sombrío.","Habla con Glorelloth en el Refugio Sombrío","Las Excavaciones Tenebrosas se encuentran muy al sureste del Refugio Sombrío.\
\
Glorelloth te advirtió que en las Excavaciones Tenebrosas existe un mal que no teme a la luz. Te aconsejó que anduvieras con cuidado en aquel lugar, situado muy al sureste del Refugio Sombrío.","En las profundidades más oscuras de Moria, hay un lugar donde la única luz que brillaba provenía de las lámparas de enanos y hongos luminiscentes. Ahora estos túneles son más tenues que nunca y hogar de criaturas que existen solo en pesadillas. Sin embargo, ahí están, y los agentes de Veúlfur enviados al Refugio Sombrío encuentran poco consuelo al saber que hay algo en las Excavaciones Tenebrosas que ordena a los orcos a envenenarse de una manera que los entrega a una voluntad superior.","El amo de la oscuridad","Derrota el Mal en las Excavaciones Tenebrosas","Has derrotado al Gurvand"}},
[8368]={nameES="Master of the Dead-Folk",objectivesES={"A brutal Orc-leader commands the Rashat-hai in Gurz-shâpol, sending out raiding parties to steal away the people and goods of Rohan.","Deep in Gurz-shâpol, you have encountered the mighty Orc-leader, Gûjah. It is unknowable how many have fallen to his blade or to his ilk, but he must be defeated if the people of Rohan are to reach Dunharrow in safety.","Defeat Gûjah","You have encountered a large, brutish Orc deep in Gurz-shâpol.","Gûjah can be found in the deepest reaches of Gurz-shâpol atop his throne.\
\
You have encountered a large, brutish Orc that must surely be the leader of the Rashat-hai. You should defeat him.","You have triumphed over Gûjah, defeating the Orc-leader and sending his forces into disarray.","The Orcs of the White Mountains rallied behind Gûjah, and through your efforts, his vile leadership has been put to an end. The people of Underharrow and Kingstead shall rest more soundly with such a brutal creature defeated.","You have not yet slain the leader of the Orc forces.","Master of the Dead-Folk","Completado","Defeated Gûjah"}},
[8369]={nameES="Master of the Fane",objectivesES={}},
[8370]={nameES="El maestro del látigo",objectivesES={"Lleva las espadas a Grimdeal, en Ost Guruth","El líder de los orcos y sus armas pueden encontrarse en algún lugar dentro de las ruinas de Ost Cyrn, al suroeste de Ost Guruth.\
\
Grimdeal cree que si logras matar al líder de los orcos y robar sus armas, podrían colapsar sobre sí mismos y las Tierras Solitarias se librarían de su amenaza.","Orcos que portan la bandera de Angmar se han derramado en las Tierras Solitarias desde el norte y han ocupado Ost Cyrn, unas ruinas situadas al suroeste de Ost Guruth.","Grimdeal espera tu regreso en Ost Guruth, al noreste de Ost Cyrn.\
\
Deberías volver a ver a Grimdeal sin demora para llevarle las espadas de orco que has recogido como prueba de tu victoria.","El maestro del látigo"}},
[8371]={nameES="Señor de los Alzados",objectivesES={"Habla con Calenthon","Deberías buscar al demacrado Gúrdring antes de que su poder se vuelva demasiado grande","Calenthon está en Nan Tornaeth, muy al oeste de Ost Brandras.\
\
A Calenthon le alegrará saber que has matado al demacrado Gúrdring.","Gúrdring derrotado","Has encontrado un emblema como el que solo has visto una vez... en Agamaur, en el Señor Demacrado Ivar.","El demacrado Gúrdring probablemente esté acampado en las zonas más profundas de las ruinas de Nan Tornaeth.\
\
Has encontrado el emblema del demacrado Gúrdring y deberías buscar a esa criatura maligna antes de que su poder se vuelva demasiado grande.","Derrota a Gúrdring","Señor de los Alzados"}},
[8372]={nameES="Mastering the Forges",objectivesES={"The Firehorns loyal to King Greytooth must be deprived of their forges if his quest to seize the dwarf-rings is to be brought to an end.","You have destroyed many of the forges, tools, and weapons vital to King Greytooth and the Firehorns' quest to seek the dwarf-rings.\
\
It is possible the Firehorns still possess a great deal of armour and weapons in their stores, but for the moment, you have stopped them from forging new equipment.\
\
Gimli and Spakorth will be pleased.","Firehorn smiths and their equipment can be found around the forges in the depths of the Oath-taker's Horn.\
\
Gimli has asked you to hinder the Firehorns' efforts to amass armour and weapons for the quest to seek the dwarf-rings.","Completado","You have done much to hinder King Greytooth and the Firehorns in their efforts to prepare for the search for the dwarf-rings.","Mastering the Forges"}},
[8373]={nameES="Mastering the Wilds",objectivesES={"Talk to Mablung","Mablung can be found in Henneth Annûn.\
\
You have heard the reports of his Rangers and should now deliver them to Mablung.","Henneth Annûn can be found in north-central North Ithilien.\
\
Mablung has asked you to hear the reports of recently-returned Rangers to help guide his plans to defend Ithilien.","The Rangers know much of the lands and history of Ithilien and have dedicated themselves to its protection even in times of war.","Mastering the Wilds"}},
[8374]={nameES="Maestros de la guerra",objectivesES={"Habla con Dagfari en Mekhem-bizru","Dagfari se encuentra en Mekhem-bizru, al noroeste de Drû-garmadh.\
\
Dagfari querrá saber sobre la derrota de los maestros de asedio.","Maestros de la guerra","Ahora que no hay más materiales de construcción, los enanos quieren eliminar a los orcos que operan las máquinas de asedio.","Los maestros de asedio de Moria se encuentran en Drû-garmadh, al sureste de Mekhem-bizru.\
\
Dagfari quiere eliminar a los maestros de asedio de Moria que operan las grandes máquinas de asedio."}},
[8375]={nameES="Maestros del Asedio Negro",objectivesES={"Derrota trolls en Dol Dínen","Una gran hueste de orcos se derramó por el Ram Dúath, expulsando a los hombres de las Quebradas del Norte de sus granjas, trayendo consigo poderosos trolls Ongbúrz.","Los trolls se pueden encontrar más allá de las trincheras de Dol Dínen, al sureste de Esteldín, bajo la cubierta del humo.\
\
Debes derrotar a los trolls Ongbúrz de Dol Dínen.","Maestros del Asedio Negro","Completado","Una gran hueste de orcos se derramó por el Ram Dúath, expulsando a los hombres de las Quebradas del Norte de sus granjas, trayendo consigo poderosos trolls Ongbúrz.\
\
Debes derrotar trolls Ongbúrz en Dol Dínen.","Has derrotado a un gran número de trolls en Dol Dínen."}},
[8376]={nameES="Maestros de los Muertos",objectivesES={"Has derrotado a Mordeloth","Ivorel se encuentra en su campamento en las Hondonadas Enmarañadas.\
\
Deberías informar a Ivorel de la destrucción de los maestros demacrados.","Has derrotado a Thorún","Tres hombres demacrados, llamados maestros demacrados, han estado creando un ejército de espectros para usarlo contra los Malledhrim.","Maestros de los Muertos","Los maestros demacrados pueden encontrarse en las regiones orientales de las Hondonadas Enmarañadas.\
\
Ivorel te ha encargado destruir a los tres maestros demacrados que están levantando a los Muertos de sus túmulos.","Has derrotado a Brungúr","Derrota a Mordeloth","Derrota a Brungúr","Habla con Ivorel en su campamento","Derrota a Thorún"}},
[8377]={nameES="Masters of the Ford",objectivesES={}},
[8378]={nameES="Materiales para Nuestras Armas",objectivesES={"Habla con Nos Grimsong","Nos Grimsong está en el Patio de Frerin, al oeste del Abismo de Plata.\
\
Debes regresar con Nos Grimsong por tu recompensa.","Materiales para Nuestras Armas","Ahora que te has ocupado de la fauna local, Nos Grimsong te ha pedido que ayudes a reponer suministros para el Patio de Frerin.","Los minerales pueden encontrarse en el Abismo de Plata, al este del lago congelado al este del Patio de Frerin.\
\
Nos Grimsong te ha pedido que reúnas minerales para él.","Habla con Nos Grimsong en el Patio de Frerin"}},
[8379]={nameES="Tarea de la Sociedad Mathom: Garras torcidas",objectivesES={"Tarea de la Sociedad Mathom: Garras torcidas","Entregar las garras torcidas a Hal Corneta en Hobbiton","Se busca: Garras torcidas de los sapos que rodean los Ranales en la Comarca.","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir garras torcidas para los fronteros de la Comarca. Han encargado a Hal Corneta que recoja los artículos cerca de los establos en Hobbiton.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Hal Corneta quiere garras torcidas. Hal se puede encontrar cerca del establo en el centro de Hobbiton.","Se busca: Garras torcidas de los sapos que rodean los Ranales en la Comarca. Los Fronteros buscan pruebas de quienes les ayudan a mantener segura la Comarca. Entregue los artículos a Hal Corneta en el centro de Hobbiton."}},
[8380]={nameES="Tarea de la Sociedad Mathom: Dagas rotas",objectivesES={"Se busca: Dagas rotas de los trasgos en las afueras de la Comarca.","Hal Corneta quiere dagas rotas. Hal se puede encontrar cerca del establo en el centro de Hobbiton.","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir dagas rotas para los Fronteros de la Comarca. Han encargado a Hal Corneta que recoja los artículos cerca de los establos en Hobbiton.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Se busca: Dagas rotas de los trasgos en las afueras de la Comarca. Los Fronteros buscan pruebas de quienes les ayudan a mantener segura la Comarca. Entregue los artículos a Hal Corneta en el centro de Hobbiton.","Tarea de la Sociedad Mathom: Dagas rotas","Entregar las dagas rotas a Hal Corneta en Hobbiton"}},
[8381]={nameES="Tarea de la Sociedad Mathom: Arcos cortos rotos",objectivesES={"Tarea de la Sociedad Mathom: Arcos cortos rotos","Entregar los arcos cortos rotos a Ponto Avena en Avenal","La gente del pueblo de Avenal espera la entrega de arcos cortos rotos a Ponto Avena en el centro del pueblo.","Se te ha encomendado la tarea de recolectar y entregar arcos cortos rotos de los trasgos que rodean Avenal. Debes entregar los artículos a Ponto Avena en el centro del pueblo de Avenal.","Se busca: Arcos cortos rotos de los trasgos que rodean Avenal.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Se busca: Arcos cortos rotos de los trasgos que rodean Avenal. Puede hacer la entrega a Ponto Avena en el centro de Avenal."}},
[8382]={nameES="Tarea de la Sociedad Mathom: Arcos cortos rotos",objectivesES={"Tarea de la Sociedad Mathom: Arcos cortos rotos","Se busca: Arcos cortos rotos de los bandidos al norte de Avenal. Puede hacer la entrega a Ponto Avena en el centro de Avenal.","Se busca: Arcos cortos rotos de los bandidos al norte de Avenal.","Se te ha encomendado la tarea de recolectar y entregar arcos cortos rotos de los bandidos al norte de Avenal. Debes entregar los artículos a Ponto Avena en el centro del pueblo de Avenal.","Entregar los arcos cortos rotos a Ponto Avena en Avenal","La gente del pueblo de Avenal espera la entrega de arcos cortos rotos a Ponto Avena en el centro del pueblo.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú."}},
[8383]={nameES="Tarea de la Sociedad Mathom: Vainas de espada rotas",objectivesES={"Se busca: Vainas de espada rotas de los bandidos en las afueras de la Comarca. Los Fronteros buscan pruebas de quienes les ayudan a mantener segura la Comarca. Entregue los artículos a Hal Corneta en el centro de Hobbiton.","Entregar las vainas de espada rotas a Hal Corneta en Hobbiton","Tarea de la Sociedad Mathom: Vainas de espada rotas","Se busca: Vainas de espada rotas de los bandidos en las afueras de la Comarca.","Hal Corneta quiere vainas de espada rotas. Hal se puede encontrar cerca del establo en el centro de Hobbiton.","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir vainas de espada rotas para los Fronteros de la Comarca. Han encargado a Hal Corneta que recoja los artículos cerca de los establos en Hobbiton.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú."}},
[8384]={nameES="Tarea de la Sociedad Mathom: Orejas sucias",objectivesES={"Se busca: Orejas sucias de las bestias que se encuentran en la Comarca. Los Fronteros están buscando pruebas de aquellos que los están ayudando a mantener segura la Comarca. Entregue los artículos a Hal Corneta en el centro de Hobbiton.","Hal Corneta quiere orejas sucias. Se puede encontrar a Hal cerca del establo en el centro de Hobbiton.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Tarea de la Sociedad Mathom: Orejas sucias","Se busca: Orejas sucias de las bestias que se encuentran en la Comarca. Los Fronteros están buscando pruebas de aquellos que los están ayudando a mantener segura la Comarca.","Has aceptado una tarea para conseguir orejas sucias para los fronteros de la Comarca. Han encargado a Hal Corneta que recoja los artículos cerca de los establos en Hobbiton.","Entregar las orejas sucias a Hal Corneta en Hobbiton"}},
[8385]={nameES="Tarea de la Sociedad Mathom: Suciedad sucia",objectivesES={"Se busca: Suciedad sucia de insectos y arañas que infestan la Comarca. Los Fronteros buscan pruebas de quienes les ayudan a mantener segura la Comarca. Entregue la suciedad a Hal Corneta en el centro de Hobbiton.","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir suciedad sucia para los Fronteros de la Comarca. Han encargado a Hal Corneta que recoja los artículos cerca de los establos en Hobbiton.","Tarea de la Sociedad Mathom: Suciedad sucia","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Entregar la suciedad sucia a Hal Corneta en Hobbiton","Hal Corneta quiere suciedad sucia. Hal se puede encontrar cerca del establo en el centro de Hobbiton.","Se busca: Suciedad sucia de insectos y arañas que infestan la Comarca."}},
[8386]={nameES="Tarea de la Sociedad Mathom: Alas sucias",objectivesES={"Entregar las alas sucias a Hal Corneta en Hobbiton","Se busca: Alas sucias de los murciélagos en la Comarca del norte.","Tarea de la Sociedad Mathom: Alas sucias","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir alas sucias para los Fronteros de la Comarca. Han encargado a Hal Corneta que recoja los artículos cerca de los establos en Hobbiton.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Hal Corneta quiere alas sucias. Hal se puede encontrar cerca del establo en el centro de Hobbiton.","Se busca: Alas sucias de los murciélagos en la Comarca del norte. Los Fronteros buscan pruebas de quienes les ayudan a mantener segura la Comarca. Entregue los artículos a Hal Corneta en el centro de Hobbiton."}},
[8387]={nameES="Tarea de la Sociedad Mathom: Caparazones pesados",objectivesES={"Se busca: Caparazones pesados de los insectos y arañas al norte de Avenal.","Se te ha encomendado la tarea de recoger y entregar caparazones pesados de los insectos y arañas al norte de Avenal. Debes entregar los artículos a Ponto Avena en el centro del pueblo de Avenal.","Entrega los caparazones pesados a Ponto Avena en Avenal","Tarea de la Sociedad Mathom: Caparazones pesados","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","La gente del pueblo de Avenal espera la entrega de caparazones pesados a Ponto Avena en el centro del pueblo.","Se busca: Caparazones pesados de los insectos y arañas al norte de Avenal. Puedes hacer la entrega a Ponto Avena en el centro de Avenal."}},
[8388]={nameES="Tarea de la Sociedad Mathom: Caparazones pesados",objectivesES={"Entregar los caparazones pesados a Ponto Avena en Avenal","Se busca: Caparazones pesados de los insectos y arañas que rodean Avenal. Puede hacer la entrega a Ponto Avena en el centro de Avenal.","Se busca: Caparazones pesados de los insectos y arañas que rodean Avenal.","Se te ha encomendado la tarea de recolectar y entregar caparazones pesados de los insectos y arañas que rodean Avenal. Debes entregar los artículos a Ponto Avena en el centro del pueblo de Avenal.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","La gente del pueblo de Avenal espera la entrega de caparazones pesados a Ponto Avena en el centro del pueblo.","Tarea de la Sociedad Mathom: Caparazones pesados"}},
[8389]={nameES="Tarea de la Sociedad Mathom: Vainas de espada pesadas",objectivesES={"Se te ha encomendado la tarea de recolectar y entregar vainas de espada pesadas de los trasgos que rodean Avenal. Debes entregar los artículos a Ponto Avena en el centro del pueblo de Avenal.","Entregar las vainas de espada pesadas a Ponto Avena en Avenal","Se busca: Vainas de espada pesadas de los trasgos que rodean Avenal.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Tarea de la Sociedad Mathom: Vainas de espada pesadas","La gente del pueblo de Avenal espera la entrega de vainas de espada pesadas a Ponto Avena en el centro del pueblo.","Se busca: Vainas de espada pesadas de los trasgos que rodean Avenal. Puede hacer la entrega a Ponto Avena en el centro de Avenal."}},
