[8545]={nameES="Tarea de Minas Tirith: Pieles rasgadas",objectivesES={"Tarea de Minas Tirith: Pieles rasgadas","Entrega las pieles rasgadas en una caja de recolección","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir pieles rasgadas.","Se busca: Pieles rasgadas de la región de Anórien Ancestral.","Alguien ha publicado una tarea para recoger pieles rasgadas. Se pueden entregar a cambio de una recompensa.","Se busca: Pieles rasgadas de la región de Anórien Ancestral. Recógelas para ganar una recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista en Anórien Ancestral.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú."}},
[8546]={nameES="Mine Inspections",objectivesES={"Find the mine at the Arch of Adazâr","This is an open pit-mine still in use by the Ordâkhai","Men have mined in An Shêru for hundreds of years, but the Din of Stone was powerful and likely collapsed the mines not of dwarf-design.","Find the mine at Lâkindar","Adazâr is sealed shut and overrun with kergrim","Lâkindar is in good condition but is haunted by shades and wights","This mine is called 'The Spent-lodes' and is possibly collapsed","Find the mine at Erakúndo","Talk to Kufâro in Jiret-menêsh","Find the mine at Gebarakór","Kufâro has asked you to visit the locations of other mines in An Shêru and assess their condition. Erakúndo and Gebarakór are near each other in southern An Shêru. Adazâr is in the far western part of the region, and Lâkindar is in the south-west corner.","You have visited the locations of other mines in An Shêru and assessed their condition. You should return to Kufâro in Jiret-menêsh.","Mine Inspections"}},
[8547]={nameES="Tarea de los mineros: Garras de púas",objectivesES={"Los enanos de la expedición minera han solicitado una colección de garras de púas.","Tarea de los mineros: Garras de púas","Esta caja de recolección es revisada diariamente por los enanos. Tu colección seguramente llegará a la parte solicitante.","Se busca: Garras de púas","Se busca: Garras de púas\
