[9142]={nameES="Moria Elf-stone Allowance",objectivesES={}},
[9143]={nameES="Moria Platinum Token Allowance",objectivesES={}},
[9144]={nameES="Mornaur: Aganbâr the Cruel",objectivesES={}},
[9145]={nameES="Mornaur: Forgeworkers",objectivesES={}},
[9146]={nameES="Mornaur: Fruits of the Forge",objectivesES={}},
[9147]={nameES="Motes, Embers, and Figments Allowance",objectivesES={}},
[9148]={nameES="La madre de las bestias",objectivesES={"Keli está en Zigilgund, al oeste de la cueva de los peikko.\
\
Deberías volver a ver a Keli para hablarle de tu victoria sobre la gran matrona de las nieves.","Gran matrona de las nieves derrotada","Keli ha averiguado porqué las bestias de las nieves han estado tan agresivas últimamente y quiere que mates a su matrona.","La madre de las bestias","La gran matrona de las nieves se encuentra en la cueva al este en lo alto de la colina desde Zigilgund.\
\
Keli te ha pedido que liberes Forochel de la gran matrona de las nieves que ha estado agitando a los peikko.","Derrota a la gran matrona de las nieves","Vuelve a ver a Keli en Zigilgund"}},
[9149]={nameES="Mother of the Pack",objectivesES={}},
[9150]={nameES="Madre del Valle",objectivesES={"Una matriarca dragonzuela reside en el valle occidental de Ram Dúath. El paso no estará seguro hasta que sea abatida.","Madre del Valle","Has derrotado a la matriarca dragonzuela en el valle de las sierpes, y los cañones del norte de Ram Dúath son ahora más seguros gracias a ello.","La matriarca dragonzuela reside en el paso occidental de Ram Dúath, al noreste de Esteldín.\
\
Debes matar a la matriarca dragonzuela de Ram Dúath. Mientras viva, solo engendrará más sierpes que cubrirán la tierra de inmundicia.","Derrota a la matriarca dragonzuela","Completado","Una matriarca dragonzuela ha establecido su guarida en el valle al norte de Nan Amlug. Incluso aquí, sientes su furia sobre cualquiera que ose poner un pie en su dominio.\
\
Debes derrotar a la matriarca que ha llenado el valle con su prole."}},
[9151]={nameES="Mountain Hides",objectivesES={"Mountain Hides","Hórin can be found in Skarháld.\
\
You should return to Hórin with the hides.","Hórin, a Zhélruka Dwarf, says his people do not have clothing warm enough to go up into the mountains.","Deer can be found in Ered Mithrin.\
\
You should collect hides from harts and hinds around Ered Mithrin.","Bring the hides to Hórin"}},
[9152]={nameES="Asaltantes de la montaña",objectivesES={"Ringhul está en su puesto en el Páramo Alto, al norte y oeste de Amon Nendir.\
\
Arifael te pidió que regresaras con Ringhul y le informaras que sus parientes lejanos han comenzado a bajar de las montañas con la intención de hacer la guerra en el Bosque de los Trolls.","Asaltantes de la montaña","Habla con Ringhul","Derrota al gigante aplastacabezas","Arifael está en su morada cerca de Amon Nendir, no lejos de la Laguna de Piedra.\
\
Deberías regresar con Arifael y contarle tus logros.","Gigantes hostiles pueden encontrarse en la Laguna de Piedra, cerca de la morada de Arifael.\
\
Arifael te ha pedido que vayas a la Laguna de Piedra para derrotar a los gigantes hostiles y a su líder.","Habla con Arifael","Gigante aplastacabezas derrotado","Los gigantes hostiles en la Laguna de Piedra han violado un antiguo tratado al bajar de las montañas y entrar en el Bosque de los Trolls."}},
[9153]={nameES="Mounted Combat - War-steed Mount XP",objectivesES={}},
[9154]={nameES="Mounted Combat Training",objectivesES={}},
[9155]={nameES="Mounted Combat Tutorial (repeatable)",objectivesES={}},
[9156]={nameES="Mounting a Rescue",objectivesES={"You found a set of keys!","Return to Rhadrog outside Kôth Rau","You have gotten the keys from the Utûgi gaolers that will open the cages. You should free the prisoners from their captivity.","Mounting a Rescue","You explain the situation to Rhadrog, and he nods.\
\
'We cannot in good conscience leave those people there. I would also like to know why Utûgi are capturing people and bringing them to the Ordâkhai. We must free the captives and see if they know what the Ordâkhai are planning.\
\
'I will go with you. Meet me outside Kôth Rau, and we will make a plan from there.'","Meet with Rhadrog outside Kôth Rau","Khagâmi recognizes the brass button as one belonging to Tâklu, who was one of her travelling companions when her caravan was attacked. She begs you to rescue the prisoners, hoping that Tâklu is among them. You should talk to Rhadrog in Gadim-ûn for his opinion.","You asked Tâklu what the enemy was doing with the prisoners at Kôth Rau and did not learn much. They were subjected to torture, and the most unfortunate were the people who were sent to Ombátha. You should tell Rhadrog what you learned.","Talk to Tâklu","You have freed many prisoners from their cages at Kôth Rau and returned to Gadim-ûn. You should talk to Tâklu, an acquaintance of Khagâmi that you recently rescued.","Talk to Khagâmi","You have freed many prisoners from their cages at Kôth Rau. You should return to Rhadrog outside of the Ordâkhai stronghold.","Talk to Rhadrog","Defeat Utûgi gaolers to find the keys","Talk to Khagâmi in Gadim-ûn","While you were scouting an area of Kôth Rau where prisoners are being held, you spotted and picked up a decorative brass button.","You have freed many prisoners from their cages at Kôth Rau and returned to Gadim-ûn. You should talk to Khagâmi, who had asked you to rescue them.","Rhadrog speculates that the Utûgi gaolers have the keys to the cages. You should defeat Utûgi gaolers until you find the keys.","Rhadrog agrees that the prisoners at Kôth Rau should be freed, and also hopes to learn why they are keeping prisoners at all. You should meet Rhadrog outside of Kôth Rau in south-central An Shêru, where you will come up with a plan.","Nabatínu has suggested asking Khagâmi at Gadim-ûn about the brass button you found at Kôth Rau."}},
[9157]={nameES="Mounts for Mordor",objectivesES={}},
[9158]={nameES="Mourning Felled Friends",objectivesES={}},
[9159]={nameES="Mourning Mithrandir",objectivesES={"Losdirith watches the gate to the garden of Lady Galadriel, south along the path from the pavilion where Demlindeth sings songs of mourning.\
\
Demlindeth has asked you to speak words of comfort to Losdirith, who has been acting strangely in the wake of Mithrandir's passing.","Losdirith is outside the entrance to Galadriel's Garden.\
\
Losdirith will want to hear what you saw when you looked through the canopy of leaves at Telain Neduil, even if it is not what he hoped.","You peer into the distance, but Losdirith's dream remains just that: a dream","Travel to Telain Neduil and find the flet where the canopy of leaves intrudes on the platform","Talk to Losdirith at the gate of Galadriel's Garden","Talk to Losdirith at the gate to Galadriel's Garden","<rgb=#FF0000>Look</rgb> for Mithrandir beneath the overhanging canopy","Telain Neduil consists of a series of flets north-west of Galadriel's Garden in Caras Galadhon, and the leaves grow over the edge of one of its flets.\
\
Losdirith wants you to stand at the place he saw in his dream, within the canopy of leaves that cover part of a flet in Telain Neduil, and to <rgb=#FF0000>look</rgb> for Gandalf.","This place within the canopy matches Losdirith's description","Gandalf the Grey fell in Moria, and his loss has been felt by many of the Elves he once knew.","Mourning Mithrandir"}},
[9160]={nameES="Luto por los muertos",objectivesES={"La condestable Wren se encuentra en la casa de guardia en la colina al este de Combe.\
\
Gail quiere encontrar a los bandidos que robaron la caña de pescar favorita de su difunto padre y recuperarla. Te ha enviado a pedir información a la condestable Wren sobre los bandidos y dónde podrían haber llevado sus pertenencias robadas.","El padre de Gail Varaguarda pereció en las llamas de la Posada del Tejón Loco, y muchos de sus bienes fueron robados por los bandidos Montebruno.","Luto por los muertos","Recoge la caña de pescar","Recogida la caña de pescar","Lleva la caña de pescar a Gail Varaguarda","El campamento principal de los Montebruno está en el bosque de Chet, al norte de la casa de guardia.\
\
La condestable Wren sugirió que el bandido que robó la caña de pescar del difunto padre de Gail Varaguarda podría estar cerca del abrevadero bajo el campamento principal de los Montebruno."}},
[9161]={nameES="Luto por los muertos",objectivesES={"Luto por los muertos","Habla con Aragorn","Aragorn has decreed that everyone shall break for the remainder of the day and mourn those lives lost in the battle of the Pelennor Fields.","You should talk to Aragorn, who can be found at his pavilion on the after-battle Pelennor."}},
[9162]={nameES="Mouth of Shadow",objectivesES={}},
[9163]={nameES="Moving Moss",objectivesES={"Blighted Marsh-lurkers can be found throughout the marshlands for the Wastes.\
\
Collect Tangled Moss for Arodor.","Deliver the Tangled Moss to Arodor","Moving Moss","Even in the harsh terrain of the Noman-lands, life, though it hardy and few, still flourishes.","Arodor can be found at the Camp of the Host.\
\
You have gathered the moss and should now deliver them to Arodor."}},
[9164]={nameES="Mover montañas",objectivesES={"Los gertheryg se encuentran en Urugarth, al oeste de Tármunn Súrsa.\
\
Táni te pidió que busques a los trolls y a su líder y los derrotes a todos.","Los gertheryg, los terribles parientes de los trolls de Angmar, representan una de las mayores amenazas para los Pueblos Libres.","Táni está en Tármunn Súrsa, al este de Urugarth.\
\
Con los trolls y su líder derrotados, es hora de regresar con Táni.","Mover montañas"}},
[9165]={nameES="Moving Stones",objectivesES={"Gnarlstump can be found near the desolation of the Entwives' gardens in the Brown Lands.\
\
You should return to Gnarlstump with news of your victory against the wild trolls of the Brown Lands.","Moving Stones","Trolls can be found throughout the Brown Lands, in the desolation of the Entwives' gardens, and the Stone-hole, north of Gnarlstump's camp.\
\
Gnarlstump has asked you to defeat trolls in the Brown Lands.","Gnarlstump is angered by the presence of trolls in the desolation of the Entwives' gardens and the Brown Lands.","Talk to Gnarlstump in the Brown Lands"}},
[9166]={nameES="Moving Them Off",objectivesES={"Guard Kember is near the gate of Winter-home.\
\
You should return to Guard Kember and tell him that the beggars have been successfully moved away from the eyes of the town.","Tell Ted Ives to move off","Regina Judson looks very sorrowful as she dashes away","Hungry beggars can often get too close to the Festival area in Winter-home, which is a strict violation of the Mayor's rules to keep the Yule Celebration pleasant for all.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> NOTE: This quest will be removed from your quest log when the current festival ends. </rgb>","Barrett Nowell reluctantly moves along, unsure of where to go","Bill Hyde's face is reddened by the cold, but he walks away from the fire sadly","Tell Jack Judson to move off","Moving Them Off","Tell Barrett Nowell to move off","Return to Guard Kember","The beggars can be found in the streets throughout town, and since the Mayor finds them unsightly, Guard Kember has asked you to make them leave.\
\
You should remove beggars from the streets about town so that the Festival patrons won't be upset by them.","Jack Judson hurries away, looking most appalled","Tell Bill Hyde to move off","Tell Regina Judson to move off","Ted Ives gives you a disappointed look, but moves along"}},
[9167]={nameES="Movimiento invisible",objectivesES={"Los linces se pueden encontrar merodeando en la Alta Acebeda, al noreste de Echad Eregion.\
\
Lengliel te ha pedido que recojas pieles de lince para ella, para poder confeccionar capas para los exploradores.","Los Elfos de Eregion utilizan pelajes de lince para confeccionar sus capas.","Movimiento invisible","Habla con Lengliel en Echad Eregion"}},
[9168]={nameES="Moving in Shadow",objectivesES={"Deliver the supply crates to Melril in Tarlang's Crown","Moving in Shadow","Corsair cutthroats can be found lurking in and around the Corsair encampment in Tarlang's Crown.\
\
Melril has asked you to defeat Corsairs before they can sneak into Blackroot Vale and recover more crates stolen from Sardol.","DNT -- will not be seen","Melril can be found at the northern end of Tarlang's Crown in Blackroot Vale.\
\
You defeated many of the Corsair cutthroats and recovered several supply crates. You should deliver this news and the crates to Melril.","Hoping to put an end to the raids into Blackroot Vale, Melril seeks to hunt sneaking Corsairs and recover what they have stolen."}},
[9169]={nameES="Encuentra al señor Henoloma...",objectivesES={"Adso Henoloma se encuentra en su campamento, aproximadamente a mitad de camino entre Bree y el Portal del Este, hacia el este por el Gran Camino del Este.\
\
Trumric Agripalma te envió a reunirte con Adso Henoloma.","Trumric Agripalma te ha dado indicaciones para que vayas a conocer personalmente a Adso Henoloma. Considera que es lo justo por todo el trabajo que has realizado.","Encuentra al señor Henoloma...","Habla con Adso Henoloma en su campamento"}},
[9170]={nameES="Much Needed Provisions",objectivesES={}},
[9171]={nameES="Much-needed Supplies",objectivesES={"South of Harndirion, there is a small series of ponds which are the prime watering holes of the deer which inhabit Thrór's Coomb.","Much-needed Supplies","Talk to Gronu at his camp","Placed venison on Gronu's cart","Gronu is at his camp to the south of the cart.\
\
You should return to Gronu and let him know that the cart has been filled.","The cart lies to the north of Gronu, on the southern shore of the river.\
\
Gronu asked you to bring the venison which you collected and place it on the cart his party left behind.","Deer can be found among a series of ponds, south of Harndirion and Gronu's camp.\
\
Gronu has asked you to hunt the deer that water nearby to help provision his village.","Place venison on Gronu's cart"}},
[9172]={nameES="Mucking Around",objectivesES={"Piles of muck can be found within the cisterns.\
\
You should remove piles of muck from the cisterns.","Mucking Around","Rathon can be found outside the cistern entrance on the Fourth Circle of Minas Tirith.\
\
You should speak with Rathon.","Speak with Rathon","Rathon has been tasked with maintaining many of the cisterns in Minas Tirith by himself and has come to find piles of muck spreading through the cisterns."}},
[9173]={nameES="Embarrar a los cerdos",objectivesES={"Una de las atracciones principales del mercado agrícola de Cotonorte es su zona para acariciar animales.","Gerardo Hoyondo está en los corrales de la Granja de Cotonorte.\
\
Gerardo Hoyondo se alegrará de saber que los cerdos ya tienen su barro.","Embarrar a los cerdos","El cubo se puede encontrar en el estanque cercano.\
\
Gerardo Hoyondo te ha pedido que embarres a los cerdos.","Habla con Gerardo Hoyondo"}},
[9174]={nameES="Muiráthakh, el Juez Silencioso",objectivesES={"Muiráthakh, el Juez Silencioso, mantiene su corte en el corazón de la ciudad de Donnvail, a través del arco al este de Una y sus aliados.\
\
Raghnaid te ha encargado a ti y a tus aliados poner fin al reinado de Muiráthakh.","Muiráthakh derrotado","Raghnaid te ha encargado poner fin al reinado de Muiráthakh, el Juez Silencioso, que tiene a Donnvail bajo su control con un puño de hierro.","Muiráthakh, el Juez Silencioso","Raghnaid se encuentra en la ciudad de Donnvail, al noreste de Fail-á-Khro.\
\
Has derrotado a Muiráthakh. Regresa con Raghnaid para contarle tu triunfo.","Derrota a Muiráthakh"}},
[9175]={nameES="Munfaeril's Warning",objectivesES={"Placed Munfaeril's sigil on the shrine","Let Munfaeril know when you are ready to depart for Barnavon. <rgb=#FF0000>You may summon her through the shrine if necessary</rgb>","Munfaeril is at her shrine, north of Barnavon.\
\
You should speak with Munfaeril when you are ready to depart for Barnavon.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>This instance is intended to be run solo, but can be run duo as well.</rgb>","You have found a placard upon Munfaeril's shrine that describes the ritual of the Dunlending Derudh to call upon the ox-spirit Munfaeril for aid.","Talk to Munfaeril at her shrine","Collect Munfaeril's sigil","Warg-riders and Ox-clan warriors wander the landscape of Carreglyn.\
\
Perhaps one of the Warg-riders or Ox-clan warriors came upon the shrine and stole Munfaeril's sigil.","This placard describes the ritual used by the Derudh of Dunland to call upon the ox-spirit Munfaeril, which they call the Uch-gwirod, for aid. The troubles in Barnavon may be cause enough to attempt such a feat.\
\
The placard demands the use of a sigil, which you do not possess. Perhaps one of the foes wandering Carreglyn may have one in its possession....","You have spoken with Munfaeril about Madin Brenin","Talk to Munfaeril through her shrine","Munfaeril is at her shrine, north of Barnavon.\
\
You should return to Munfaeril and tell her of the events at Barnavon.","Collected Munfaeril's sigil","Munfaeril's shrine lies to the north of Barnavon.\
\
You should place Munfaeril's sigil upon her shrine and perform the ritual to call upon her aid.","Place Munfaeril's sigil on the shrine","Munfaeril is at her shrine, north of Barnavon.\
\
You should speak with Munfaeril through the shrine regarding the evils committed by the brenin of Barnavon.","Munfaeril's Warning"}},
[9176]={nameES="Mur Shatraug: Dour Hands, Iron Crowns",objectivesES={}},
[9177]={nameES="Mur Shatraug: Supplies for the Gabil'akkâ",objectivesES={}},
[9178]={nameES="Mur Shatraug: Watchers at the Witch-gate",objectivesES={}},
[9179]={nameES="Asesinato en las ruinas",objectivesES={"Helechír se encuentra en una pequeña isla cerca de Men Erain.\
\
Ayudaste a Glirion a luchar contra una banda de saqueadores de tumbas y deberías llevar la noticia de tu éxito a Helechír.","Los saqueadores de tumbas han sido derrotados","Las antiguas ruinas de Evendim y quienes las custodian están en peligro por culpa de los saqueadores de tumbas.","Glirion ha establecido su campamento en unas ruinas situadas en lo alto de las colinas de Men Erain, con vistas al lago.\
\
Helechír te ha enviado a ayudar a Glirion, un montaraz que ayuda a vigilar las ruinas de Dúnadan, cerca de Annúminas. Te ha advertido que los caminos que atraviesan las tierras altas se han perdido en su mayor parte con el paso del tiempo y que no será fácil subir a las alturas.","Asesinato en las ruinas","Habla con Glirion"}},
[9180]={nameES="Murder on the Wing",objectivesES={"Fuirgam is at Ost Galadh, north of the Wild Ruins.\
\
You should tell Fuirgam that the crebain in the Wild Ruins have been dealt with.","Murder on the Wing","The Wild Ruins lie to the south of Ost Galadh.\
\
Fuirgam has asked you to thin the flocks of crebain that inhabit the Wild Ruins.","Fuirgam believes that the Enemy will use the crebain of Mirkwood as spies against the Malledhrim.","Talk to Fuirgam in Ost Galadh"}},
[9181]={nameES="Recolección de hongos",objectivesES={"Los hongos se pueden encontrar alrededor del borde del agua al oeste de la Bodega Putrefacta.\
\
Thrand piensa que destruir los hongos ralentizará la propagación del hongo entre la población de Orcos.","Thrand se encuentra en Hulwul-nefekh, en el centro de las Obras Hidráulicas.\
\
Regresa con él para decirle que has destruido muchos hongos.","Regresa con Thrand en Hulwul-nefekh","Recolección de hongos","Thrand cree que el hongo se forma en los hongos que crecen en el lago. En su opinión, los Orcos deben haber comido los hongos, y eso es lo que causó que se infectaran."}},
[9182]={nameES="Un hongo para Rivendel",objectivesES={"Habla con Galasebdir","Un hongo para Rivendel","Los libros encontrados en la biblioteca de Rivendel indican que una variedad particularmente mortal de hongo crece dentro de la Grieta de Nûrz Ghâshu. Este hongo podría ser utilizado por el Enemigo para crear un arma terrible.","Los curtamusgans se pueden encontrar dentro de la Grieta de Nûrz Ghâshu.\
\
Galasebdir te ha pedido que le lleves un Curtamusgan, para que los eruditos de Rivendel puedan estudiarlo y preparar una defensa contra su veneno en caso de que Angmar lo utilice como arma.","Galasebdir se encuentra en el campamento de Iorelen.\
\
Has encontrado un Curtamusgan y deberías llevárselo a Galasebdir de inmediato."}},
[9183]={nameES="Mushrooms in the Marsh",objectivesES={"<rgb=#FF0000>Look around</rgb> for any more mushrooms.","Your eye catches a big orange mushroom in the marsh. Haelam might enjoy selling this specimen","Mushrooms in the Marsh","Collect the big orange mushroom","Some rowdy Corsairs start to cross the swamp and it seems they're up to no good","Haelam is in the village of Tadrent.\
\
Return to Haelam with the mushrooms.","The marsh is just north-east of Tadrent.\
\
Haelam has tasked you with collecting mushrooms from the marsh.","Now that Haelam is confident the roads will soon be safe for travel, he wants you to go into the swamp and collect some mushrooms for an order that he has neglected to fill.","The big orange mushroom is located in the marsh.\
\
Collect the big orange mushroom and be on your guard.","<rgb=#FF0000>Look around</rgb> for any more mushrooms","Return to Haelam with the mushrooms"}},
[9184]={nameES="Reflexiones y enseñanzas",objectivesES={"Reflexiones y enseñanzas","La Escuela de Tham Mírdain se encuentra al este, subiendo una pequeña cuesta desde la ladera norte de Echad Mirobel.\
\
El mal amenaza con apoderarse del conocimiento perdido de Eregion, y te corresponde a ti recuperarlo antes de que se pierda para siempre. Faellien te ha pedido que le lleves a Echad Mirobel cualquier fragmento de conocimiento que encuentres.'"}},
[9185]={nameES="Imprescindibles...",objectivesES={"Busca mercancías de caravanas robadas dentro de las murallas de la Atalaya Sur y en manos de los enemigos que han hecho de las ruinas su guarida. Devuelve todo lo que encuentres al Vigilante Robledales, al este de la entrada norte de las ruinas.\
\
No todas las caravanas pueden permitirse atravesar las puertas, y aquellas que no pueden pierden sus bienes a manos de los bandidos, haciendo que sufran todas las Tierras de Bree.","Imprescindibles...","Entrega las mercancías al Vigilante Robledales.","Los bienes y monedas que suelen llegar desde las tierras del sur son la savia vital de Bree. Sin estos materiales, gran parte de las Tierras de Bree sufrirá. El Vigilante Robledales te pidió que recuperaras algunos de los bienes que los bandidos arrebataron a las caravanas que no pudieron pagar el precio para pasar."}},
[9186]={nameES="Mutineers and Ruffians All!",objectivesES={"Many of the ruffians in the Fleet-fast conducted a mutiny against Kenza and she wants you to deal with them.","Mutineers and Ruffians All!","Kenza is by the stairs leading to the upper level in the Fleet-fast.","Kenza wants you to deal with the mutineers that cost her the command of her ship.","Talk to Kenza in the Fleet-fast"}},
[9187]={nameES="Mutual Enemies",objectivesES={}},
[9188]={nameES="Silenciando a la manada",objectivesES={"Derrota a Faucenegra en la Colina de los Aullidos","Faucenegra derrotado","Habla con Lavanferon en Echad Mothelen","Black wolves can be found throughout the Dourstocks. Blackmaw can be found at the Packhowler's Hill, some distance to the south-east from Echad Mothelen.\
\
Lavanferon has asked you to defeat many wolves and their pack-leader, Blackmaw.","Lavanferon is at Echad Mothelen, some distance north-west from the Packhowler's Hill.\
\
You should return to Lavanferon with news of your success.","Muchas oscuras y malvadas criaturas habitan en las profundidades al sur del Bosque Negro. Entre ellas están los lobos negros.","Silenciando a la manada"}},
[9189]={nameES="Llamado de mi hermano",objectivesES={"Uno de los hermanos de Saeradan pidió recientemente ayuda contra un enemigo que los Montaraces del Norte conocen muy bien.","Habla con Andreg en el Fuerte del Camino Verde","Llamado de mi hermano","Andreg espera en su puesto en el Fuerte del Camino Verde, al norte por el Camino Verde desde la cabaña de Saeradan.\
\
Saeradan te envió para ayudar a Andreg, uno de sus hermanos."}},
[9190]={nameES="Mi hermano Hunulf",objectivesES={"Mi hermano Hunulf","Gadaric, convencido de la validez de tus esfuerzos, cree que podrías ayudar a su hermano Hunulf.","Hunulf Mascador se encuentra en el campamento situado en el extremo este de Minas Eriol.\
\
Gadaric Mascador te ha pedido que vayas a ver a su hermano Hunulf.","Habla con Hunulf Mascador"}},
[9191]={nameES="Mi asistente",objectivesES={"El condestable Bram Hojafresno, satisfecho con tu ayuda, tiene otra tarea para ti.","Habla con el asistente Osmann","Mi asistente","El asistente Osmann se encuentra en el campamento situado al este de Minas Eriol.\
\
El condestable Bram Hojafresno te ha pedido que ayudes a su asistente. Este debería tener varias tareas que proponerte."}},
[9192]={nameES="Mis Amigos Enanos",objectivesES={"Bilbo Bolsón ha terminado su libro y desea asegurarse de que sus recuerdos sobre los lugares y sucesos importantes sean correctos.","Has hablado con Dwalin","Bilbo Bolsón está en Rivendel, en el Bosque de los Trolls, al sur del campamento de Glóin y muy al este del Salón de Thorin.\
\
Dwalin y Glóin compartieron contigo historias de su aventura en la Ciudad de los Trasgos. Ahora debes volver con Bilbo.","Habla con Bilbo Bolsón en Rivendel","Mis Amigos Enanos","Dwalin está en la Mansión de Thorin, muy al oeste, más allá de la Comarca. Glóin está en su campamento al norte de Rivendel.\
\
Bilbo Bolsón quiere saber si sus amigos enanos Dwalin y Glóin conservan recuerdos que puedan ser buenas adiciones para su libro.","Habla con Glóin en las Montañas Nubladas","Has hablado con Glóin","Habla con Dwalin"}},
[9193]={nameES="El almuerzo de mi nieto",objectivesES={"Cesta de almuerzo recogida","El almuerzo de mi nieto","Cuando su nieto Wilcome era pequeño, la abuela Tunelero siempre le preparaba su almuerzo. Ahora que se ha mudado a Scary, donde supervisa la cantera, ya no tiene la oportunidad. Sin embargo, echaba tanto de menos prepararlo que hoy le ha preparado un almuerzo muy especial, pero no puede caminar hasta Scary para llevárselo. Te ha pedido que se lo lleves.","Recoge la cesta de almuerzo","Lleva la cesta de almuerzo a Wilcome Tunelero","Wilcome Tunelero es el supervisor de la cantera de Scary, al noreste.\
\\La abuela Tunelero te ha pedido que lleves el almuerzo que ha preparado a su nieto Wilcome, en Scary."}},
[9194]={nameES="La esperanza de mi corazón",objectivesES={"La pulsera que encontraste pertenecía a una chica de los Montaraces llamada Dírdrë. Su madre se pregunta si aún podría estar viva.","La esperanza de mi corazón","Puede que Dírdrë se encuentre en Nan Gurth, al sureste de Carn Dûm.\
\
La hija de Éa fue arrebatada hace muchos años. Podría ser que Dírdrë aún viva.","Encuentra a Dírdrë","Dírdrë encontrada"}},
[9195]={nameES="My Missing Woodworker Tools",objectivesES={"Retrieved Aradax's woodworking tools","Aradax has asked you to retrieve his woodworking tools from Tathrendalf to the north-east.","His fingers grace over the woodworking tools as if they were precious jewellery or fine cloth.\
\
'Thanks for bringing these back to me. I would have gone myself, but I am not ready for the conversations that await me back there.'","My Missing Woodworker Tools","Talk to Aradax","A Corsair has asked you to retrieve some woodworking tools from his former comrades at Tathrendalf.","You have retrieved Aradax's woodworking tools from Tathrendalf.\
\
Talk to Aradax in Lothgobel.","Retrieve Aradax's woodworking tools"}},
[9196]={nameES="My Own Fate",objectivesES={"Ashâmi accepted Raphûz's apology and seems genuinely concerned about him. She asked you to speak with him while she prepares a message for her father.","Talk to Ashâmi in Shonith","Raphûz said Igbâl cited portents in the sky and on the earth that reinforced the story you shared. He wants you to return to Shonith to tell Ashâmi what occurred.","Raphûz suggests an alternate plan and wants you to share it with Ashâmi. He asked you to speak to her at the oasis Shonith.","Speak with Raphûz at the oasis Shonith","Raphûz wants to speak with you","You arrived at Igbâl's home after Raphûz delivered the news of Ashâmi and provided the \\qproof\\q of the Alad's death. The mood is somber. Galamê stands ready to speak with you.","Speak with the translator, Galamê, at Igbâl's home in Jirush","My Own Fate","Raphûz suggested you return to Shonith and speak with Ashâmi","Make your way to Igbâl's home in Jirush","Galamê explained that Igbâl believes his daughter is dead and that you and Raphûz avenged her death by slaughtering the Alad. The ruse was successful. Raphûz waits for you to speak with him at Igbâl's home.","Speak with Raphûz at Igbâl's home in Jirush","Speak with Ashâmi at the oasis of Shonith","Raphûz plans to deliver the Aladi head to Igbâl at the merchant's home in Jirush. He asked you to meet him there to bear witness and to support the ruse he and Ashâmi concocted.","Ashâmi desires to rid herself of her father and Raphûz wants to help her achieve her independence as a way to prove to her that his missteps were only due to his not understanding the culture.","Ashâmi asked that you speak with Raphûz at Shonith","You arrived at Igbâl's home; Galamê wishes to speak with you","Ashâmi realized what Raphûz delivering the message to her father would mean. She accepted the offer. You should return to Raphûz at the oasis Shonith and inform him."}},
[9197]={nameES="La espada de mi hermana",objectivesES={"Déornyd se encuentra en Pynti-peldot, al norte de los cañones de hielo.\
\
Has encontrado a Gránung y ahora deberías devolvérsela a Déornyd en Pynti-peldot.","Déornyd ha perdido su arma más preciada, una espada que perteneció a su hermana, una campeona de gran renombre entre los Eglain.","Recupera a Gránung","Gránung recuperada","La espada de mi hermana","Devuelve a Gránung a Déornyd","Déornyd cree que la espada de su hermana aún se encuentra en los cañones de hielo o en sus alrededores, al sur de Pynti-peldot.\
\
Déornyd te ha pedido que encuentres la espada de su hermana y se la devuelvas."}},
[9198]={nameES="Mysteries To Unravel",objectivesES={"Approach Lúkhag","Lúkhag chirps in affirmation before leading you away from Annâk-khurfu.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>WARNING: This is a solo instance and cannot be completed in a fellowship.</rgb>","Talk to Rékkur","A frantic Lúkhag has returned without Aighrig.","You should inform Rékkur of what you've learned about Gáfin's discovery.","Lúkhag hangs from a tree in front of Annâk-khurfu.\
\
You should go to her and see where she'll lead you.","Mysteries To Unravel"}},
[9199]={nameES="Mysteries of the Ghâshghurm",objectivesES={}},
[9200]={nameES="Mysterious Happenings",objectivesES={"Examined remains","Talk to Caron in the Bonevales","Mysterious Happenings","Examine remains","Caron awaits you to the north-west of the area you searched.\
\
You should seek out Caron, as Bledhun instructed, and discuss what you have found.","Recently, there have been rumours of strange occurrences in the Bonevales, which have brought Bledhun into the ancient burial grounds.","Signs of the strange happenings might be found in the Bonevales, west of Bledhun.\
\
Bledhun has asked you to seek out and discover any signs of the strange happenings in the Bonevales."}},
[9201]={nameES="Mysterious Ore",objectivesES={}},
[9202]={nameES="Mysterious Relic in Enedwaith",objectivesES={"Talk to Brungos","Mysterious Relic in Enedwaith","A strange relic has appeared in Thrór's Coomb, and the creatures of the area hesitate to stray too near it.","On the slope stands an evil-looking relic. As you examine the relic, you are suddenly held in the grasp of complicated sensations: feelings of sickness, anger, and fear rush through you, and just as it seems it must be too much, they pass. You are left feeling weak and weary, and the relic keeps its secrets to itself.","The Ranger Brungos has discovered an unsettling relic in Thrór's Coomb."}},
[9203]={nameES="Reliquia misteriosa en Forochel",objectivesES={"Una reliquia misteriosa se encuentra ante la puerta sellada hacia Angmar. ¿Qué secreto esconde?","Habla con Noora","Los Lossoth estudian la misteriosa reliquia que han encontrado dentro de las murallas del Umbral de Hierro.","Reliquia misteriosa en Forochel","En la sombra del muro hay una reliquia de aspecto maligno. La miras fijamente, y a medida que lo haces comienzas a sentir una creciente sensación de miedo. La sensación se vuelve más fuerte, y a medida que tu terror crece, también lo hace tu deseo de correr lo más lejos posible de la reliquia. Tan repentinamente como llegó el sentimiento, desaparece, pero aún así la reliquia no revela ningún secreto."}},
[9204]={nameES="La misteriosa reliquia de las Quebradas del Norte",objectivesES={"Ted Farmer está fuera de la cabaña en la que estaba viviendo con su hermano Burt, con la vista fija en la espeluznante reliquia que alguien ha colocado allí mientras la cabaña ardía.","Hay una reliquia de aspecto maligno ante la cabaña quemada. Mirarla fijamente hace que te hierva la sangre, aunque no logras identificar la razón. Sacudes la cabeza, y la sensación se disipa.","Habla con Ted Farmer","La misteriosa reliquia de las Quebradas del Norte","Una misteriosa reliquia ha aparecido fuera de la granja abandonada de Puntadepico en las Quebradas del Norte."}},
[9205]={nameES="Reliquia Misteriosa en la Comarca",objectivesES={"Reliquia Misteriosa en la Comarca","En el centro del campo se alza una reliquia de aspecto maligno, claramente no hecha por hobbits. Observas la reliquia con cautela, pero no revela ninguno de sus secretos. Te sientes vagamente enfermo; un aura malsana parece emanar de la reliquia.","Habla con Bungo Cavada","Bungo Cavada no puede creer la aterradora reliquia que apareció en su campo de hierba para pipa en Avenal.","Una reliquia misteriosa ha aparecido en medio del cultivo de hierba para pipa de Bungo Cavada, arruinando toda la cosecha."}},
[9206]={nameES="Relicario Misterioso en el Bosque de los Trolls",objectivesES={"En las profundidades de las cuevas de Laenan, una misteriosa reliquia se alza de forma ominosa ante una puerta sellada.","Habla con Elrond","La puerta en las profundidades de las cuevas de Laenan ocupa tus pensamientos.","Elrond está en su biblioteca en la Última Morada, en Rivendel.\
\
Has encontrado una misteriosa reliquia frente a la puerta sellada en las profundidades de las cuevas de Laenan y deberías informarle al respecto.","Relicario Misterioso en el Bosque de los Trolls","La puerta parece estar trabada desde el otro lado. Debes informar a Elrond.","Examina la puerta sellada en las profundidades de las cuevas de Laenan","Una ominosa reliquia se alza frente a la puerta. La observas con cautela, pero mantiene sus secretos ocultos. De pronto te sientes débil, abrumado por un mareo y una intensa sensación de náusea. Sacudes la cabeza y la sensación pasa, pero tus pensamientos quedan atrapados en la puerta ante la cual ha sido colocada la reliquia."}},
[9207]={nameES="Mysterious Residue",objectivesES={}},
[9208]={nameES="Mystery of Ilûritu",objectivesES={"Edâkhi has asked you to help her investigate the Falls of Ilûritu for signs of Enârshan, the river-maiden.","Look for clues to Enârshan's whereabouts near the waterfall for Edâkhi.","Return to Edâkhi with what you learned","Edâkhi has asked you to look for clues to Enârshan's whereabouts near along the river.","Look for additional clues to Enârshan's whereabouts along the river for Edâkhi.","Return to Edâkhi and tell her about what you have learned about the river-maiden, Enârshan.","Mystery of Ilûritu"}},
[9209]={nameES="Mystery of the Trees",objectivesES={"The cauldron and altars which Andreg mentioned can be found between the great trees at the heart of the Slade of Shadows.\
\
Andreg has instructed you to try and examine the altars and cauldron within the Slade of Shadows to learn what purpose they serve.","Examine the second altar","Examine the third altar","The top of this altar bears the mark of the Druggavar","Examine the first altar","The cauldron appears to be empty, but it is extremely chill to the touch and smells of death","Mystery of the Trees","The top of this altar bears the mark of the stag","Examine the cauldron","The Slade of Shadows appears to be a focal point for the evil that is growing within the Gravenwood.","The top of this altar bears the mark of the ox"}},
[9210]={nameES="Múl Kholuim, el Guardián de los Libros.",objectivesES={"Descubre la biblioteca de Múl Kholuim.","Has encontrado el campamento de Múl Kholuim dentro de una ruina en las colinas altas al sur del gran lago en Imlad Balchorth.\
\
Birgir te ha pedido que derrotes a Múl Kholuim. También te advirtió que reunieras aliados.","Birgir está en Myrkworth, al noreste del campamento de Múl Kholuim.\
\
Habiendo derrotado a Múl Kholuim, deberías regresar con Birgir.","Múl Kholuim tiene su campamento dentro de una ruina en unas colinas altas al sur del gran lago en Imlad Balchorth, al oeste de Myrkworth. Birgir te ha pedido que encuentres el campamento del Guardián de los Libros Angmarim.","Birgir estaba complacido con la disrupción que ya causaste entre las filas de los Angmarim, pero siente que no fue del todo suficiente.","Múl Kholuim, el Guardián de los Libros.","Descubriste la biblioteca de Múl Kholuim"}},
[9211]={nameES="Mûmak of the Harlond",objectivesES={"Pick up the crate","You should let Dingási know that Lokhûr is happily munching away at the carrots and other vegetables you brought from the provisioner.\
\
Dingási is in the Harlond.","Mûmak of the Harlond","Dingási has asked you to bring a crate of carrots from the Harlond's provisioner and bring it back to the mûmak.\
\
The crate is next to the provisioner, in the Harlond, and the mûmak is north of the Harlond's walls.","Rescued from the Battle at the Pelennor Field, a great mûmak works alongside the Temámir Dwarves to repair the harbour.","The great mûmak trumpets with pleasure as you arrive with her snack","Return to Dingási"}},
[9212]={nameES="Tarea Hamâti de Mûr Ghala: Garras osificadas",objectivesES={"Entrega las garras osificadas en una caja de recolección","Se busca: garras osificadas de Mûr Ghala.","Se busca: garras osificadas de Mûr Ghala. Reúnelas para ganar una recompensa adecuada para los coleccionistas.","Tarea Hamâti de Mûr Ghala: Garras osificadas","Hamât Renovado ha publicado una tarea para recolectar garras osificadas. Estas pueden ser entregadas a cambio de una recompensa.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir garras osificadas para Hamât Renovado."}},
[9213]={nameES="Tarea Hamâti de Mûr Ghala: Orejas llenas de arena",objectivesES={"Hamât Renovado ha publicado una tarea para recolectar orejas llenas de arena. Estas pueden ser entregadas a cambio de una recompensa.","Se busca: orejas llenas de arena de Mûr Ghala.","Tarea Hamâti de Mûr Ghala: Orejas llenas de arena","Se busca: orejas llenas de arena de Mûr Ghala. Reúnelas para ganar una recompensa adecuada para los coleccionistas.","Entrega las orejas llenas de arena en una caja de recolección","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir orejas llenas de arena para Hamât Renovado."}},
[9214]={nameES="Tarea de Mûr Ghala Hamâti: Sustancia pegajosa arenosa",objectivesES={"Se busca: sustancia pegajosa arenosa de Mûr Ghala.","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir sustancia pegajosa arenosa para los Hamât Renovados.","Los Hamât Renovados han publicado una tarea para recolectar sustancia pegajosa arenosa. Esta puede ser entregada a cambio de una recompensa.","Entrega los montones de sustancia pegajosa arenosa en una caja de recolección","Se busca: sustancia pegajosa arenosa de Mûr Ghala. Reúnelas para ganar una recompensa adecuada para los coleccionistas.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Tarea de Mûr Ghala Hamâti: Sustancia pegajosa arenosa"}},
[9215]={nameES="Tarea de Mûr Ghala Hamâti: Hachas cocidas al sol",objectivesES={"Tarea de Mûr Ghala Hamâti: Hachas cocidas al sol","Los Hamât Renovados han publicado una tarea para recolectar hachas cocidas al sol. Estas pueden ser entregadas a cambio de una recompensa.","Entrega las hachas cocidas al sol en una caja de recolección","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir hachas cocidas al sol para los Hamât Renovados.","Se busca: hachas cocidas al sol de Mûr Ghala.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Se busca: hachas cocidas al sol de Mûr Ghala. Reúnelas para ganar una recompensa adecuada para los coleccionistas."}},
[9216]={nameES="Tarea Hamâti de Mûr Ghala: Pieles secadas al sol",objectivesES={"Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir pieles secadas al sol para Hamât Renovado.","Entrega las pieles secadas al sol en una caja de recolección","Hamât Renovado ha publicado una tarea para recolectar pieles secadas al sol. Estas pueden ser entregadas a cambio de una recompensa.","Tarea Hamâti de Mûr Ghala: Pieles secadas al sol","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Se busca: pieles secadas al sol de Mûr Ghala. Reúnelas para ganar una recompensa adecuada para los coleccionistas.","Se busca: pieles secadas al sol de Mûr Ghala."}},
[9217]={nameES="Tarea de Mûr Ghala Hamâti: Vainas de espada quemadas por el sol",objectivesES={"Entrega las vainas de espada quemadas por el sol en una caja de recolección","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir vainas de espada quemadas por el sol para los Hamât Renovados.","Los Hamât Renovados han publicado una tarea para recolectar vainas de espada quemadas por el sol. Estas pueden ser entregadas a cambio de una recompensa.","Se busca: vainas de espada quemadas por el sol de Mûr Ghala. Reúnelas para ganar una recompensa adecuada para los coleccionistas.","Se busca: vainas de espada quemadas por el sol de Mûr Ghala.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Tarea de Mûr Ghala Hamâti: Vainas de espada quemadas por el sol"}},
[9218]={nameES="Tarea Kintai de Mûr Ghala: Garras osificadas",objectivesES={"Entrega las garras osificadas en una caja de recolección","Se busca: garras osificadas de Mûr Ghala.","Se busca: garras osificadas de Mûr Ghala. Reúnelas para ganar una recompensa adecuada para los coleccionistas.","Los Kintai de Sul Madásh han publicado una tarea para recolectar garras osificadas. Estas pueden ser entregadas a cambio de una recompensa.","Tarea Kintai de Mûr Ghala: Garras osificadas","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir garras osificadas para los Kintai de Sul Madásh."}},
[9219]={nameES="Tarea Kintai de Mûr Ghala: Orejas llenas de arena",objectivesES={"Se busca: orejas llenas de arena de Mûr Ghala.","Tarea Kintai de Mûr Ghala: Orejas llenas de arena","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir orejas llenas de arena para los Kintai de Sul Madásh.","Se busca: orejas llenas de arena de Mûr Ghala. Reúnelas para ganar una recompensa adecuada para los coleccionistas.","Entrega las orejas llenas de arena en una caja de recolección","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Los Kintai de Sul Madásh han publicado una tarea para recolectar orejas llenas de arena. Estas pueden ser entregadas a cambio de una recompensa."}},
[9220]={nameES="Tarea Kintai de Mûr Ghala: Sustancia pegajosa arenosa",objectivesES={"Se busca: sustancia pegajosa arenosa de Mûr Ghala.","Los Kintai de Sul Madásh han publicado una tarea para recolectar sustancia pegajosa arenosa. Esto se puede entregar a cambio de una recompensa.","Tarea Kintai de Mûr Ghala: Sustancia pegajosa arenosa","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir sustancia pegajosa arenosa para los Kintai de Sul Madásh.","Entrega los montones de sustancia pegajosa arenosa en una caja de recolección","Se busca: sustancia pegajosa arenosa de Mûr Ghala. Reúnelas para ganar una recompensa adecuada para los coleccionistas.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú."}},
[9221]={nameES="Tarea Kintai de Mûr Ghala: Hachas cocidas al sol",objectivesES={"Tarea Kintai de Mûr Ghala: Hachas cocidas al sol","Los Kintai de Sul Madásh han publicado una tarea para recolectar hachas cocidas al sol. Estas pueden ser entregadas a cambio de una recompensa.","Entrega las hachas cocidas al sol en una caja de recolección","Se busca: hachas cocidas al sol de Mûr Ghala.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir hachas cocidas al sol para los Kintai de Sul Madásh.","Se busca: hachas cocidas al sol de Mûr Ghala. Reúnelas para ganar una recompensa adecuada para los coleccionistas."}},
[9222]={nameES="Tarea Kintai de Mûr Ghala: Pieles secadas al sol",objectivesES={"Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir pieles secadas al sol para los Kintai de Sul Madásh.","Entrega las pieles secadas al sol en una caja de recolección","Los Kintai de Sul Madásh han publicado una tarea para recolectar pieles secadas al sol. Estas pueden ser entregadas a cambio de una recompensa.","Tarea Kintai de Mûr Ghala: Pieles secadas al sol","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Se busca: pieles secadas al sol de Mûr Ghala. Reúnelas para ganar una recompensa adecuada para los coleccionistas.","Se busca: pieles secadas al sol de Mûr Ghala."}},
[9223]={nameES="Tarea Kintai de Mûr Ghala: Vainas de espada quemadas por el sol",objectivesES={"Entrega las vainas de espada quemadas por el sol en una caja de recolección","Los Kintai de Sul Madásh han publicado una tarea para recolectar vainas de espada quemadas por el sol. Estas pueden ser entregadas a cambio de una recompensa.","Se busca: vainas de espada quemadas por el sol de Mûr Ghala. Reúnelas para ganar una recompensa adecuada para los coleccionistas.","Se busca: vainas de espada quemadas por el sol de Mûr Ghala.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Tarea Kintai de Mûr Ghala: Vainas de espada quemadas por el sol","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir vainas de espada quemadas por el sol para los Kintai de Sul Madásh."}},
[9224]={nameES="Tarea Temámir de Mûr Ghala : Garras Osificadas",objectivesES={"Entrega las garras osificadas en una caja de recolección","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir garras osificadas para los Temámir de Jiret-menêsh.","Se busca: garras osificadas de Mûr Ghala.","Se busca: garras osificadas de Mûr Ghala. Reúnelas para ganar una recompensa adecuada para los coleccionistas.","Tarea Temámir de Mûr Ghala : Garras Osificadas","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Los Temámir de Jiret-menêsh han publicado una tarea para recolectar garras osificadas. Estas pueden ser entregadas a cambio de una recompensa."}},
[9225]={nameES="Tarea Temámir de Mûr Ghala : Orejas llenas de arena",objectivesES={"Se busca: orejas llenas de arena de Mûr Ghala.","Se busca: orejas llenas de arena de Mûr Ghala. Reúnelas para ganar una recompensa adecuada para los coleccionistas.","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir orejas llenas de arena para los Temámir de Jiret-menêsh.","Entrega las orejas llenas de arena en una caja de recolección","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Los Temámir de Jiret-menêsh han publicado una tarea para recolectar orejas llenas de arena. Estas pueden ser entregadas a cambio de una recompensa.","Tarea Temámir de Mûr Ghala : Orejas llenas de arena"}},
[9226]={nameES="Tarea Temámir de Mûr Ghala : Sustancia pegajosa arenosa",objectivesES={"Se busca: sustancia pegajosa arenosa de Mûr Ghala.","Entrega los montones de sustancia pegajosa arenosa en una caja de recolección","Se busca: sustancia pegajosa arenosa de Mûr Ghala. Reúnelas para ganar una recompensa adecuada para los coleccionistas.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Tarea Temámir de Mûr Ghala : Sustancia pegajosa arenosa","Los Temámir de Jiret-menêsh han publicado una tarea para recolectar sustancia pegajosa arenosa. Esta puede ser entregada a cambio de una recompensa.","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir sustancia pegajosa arenosa para los Temámir de Jiret-menêsh."}},
[9227]={nameES="Tarea Temámir de Mûr Ghala: Hachas cocidas al sol",objectivesES={"Tarea Temámir de Mûr Ghala: Hachas cocidas al sol","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir hachas cocidas al sol para los Temámir de Jiret-menêsh.","Entrega las hachas cocidas al sol en una caja de recolección","Se busca: hachas cocidas al sol de Mûr Ghala.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Los Temámir de Jiret-menêsh han publicado una tarea para recolectar hachas cocidas al sol. Estas pueden ser entregadas a cambio de una recompensa.","Se busca: hachas cocidas al sol de Mûr Ghala. Reúnelas para ganar una recompensa adecuada para los coleccionistas."}},
[9228]={nameES="Tarea Temámir de Mûr Ghala: Pieles secadas al sol",objectivesES={"Los Temámir de Jiret-menêsh han publicado una tarea para recolectar pieles secadas al sol. Estas pueden ser entregadas a cambio de una recompensa.","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir pieles secadas al sol para los Temámir de Jiret-menêsh.","Entrega las pieles secadas al sol en una caja de recolección","Tarea Temámir de Mûr Ghala: Pieles secadas al sol","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Se busca: pieles secadas al sol de Mûr Ghala. Reúnelas para ganar una recompensa adecuada para los coleccionistas.","Se busca: pieles secadas al sol de Mûr Ghala."}},
[9229]={nameES="Tarea Temámir de Mûr Ghala: Vainas de espada quemadas por el sol",objectivesES={"Entrega las vainas de espada quemadas por el sol en una caja de recolección","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir vainas de espada quemadas por el sol para los Temámir de Jiret-menêsh.","Se busca: vainas de espada quemadas por el sol de Mûr Ghala. Reúnelas para ganar una recompensa adecuada para los coleccionistas.","Tarea Temámir de Mûr Ghala: Vainas de espada quemadas por el sol","Se busca: vainas de espada quemadas por el sol de Mûr Ghala.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Los Temámir de Jiret-menêsh han publicado una tarea para recolectar vainas de espada quemadas por el sol. Estas pueden ser entregadas a cambio de una recompensa."}},
[9230]={nameES="Tarea de Mûr Ghala Zajâna: Garras osificadas",objectivesES={"Entrega las garras osificadas en una caja de recolección","Se busca: garras osificadas de Mûr Ghala.","Tarea de Mûr Ghala Zajâna: Garras osificadas","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir garras osificadas para la ciudad de Zajâna.","Se busca: garras osificadas de Mûr Ghala. Reúnelas para ganar una recompensa adecuada para los coleccionistas.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","La ciudad de Zajâna ha publicado una tarea para recolectar garras osificadas. Estas pueden ser entregadas a cambio de una recompensa."}},
[9231]={nameES="Tarea de Mûr Ghala Zajâna: Orejas llenas de arena",objectivesES={"Se busca: orejas llenas de arena de Mûr Ghala.","La ciudad de Zajâna ha publicado una tarea para recolectar orejas llenas de arena. Estas pueden ser entregadas a cambio de una recompensa.","Tarea de Mûr Ghala Zajâna: Orejas llenas de arena","Se busca: orejas llenas de arena de Mûr Ghala. Reúnelas para ganar una recompensa adecuada para los coleccionistas.","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir orejas llenas de arena para la ciudad de Zajâna.","Entrega las orejas llenas de arena en una caja de recolección","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú."}},
[9232]={nameES="Tarea de Mûr Ghala Zajâna: Sustancia pegajosa arenosa",objectivesES={"Se busca: sustancia pegajosa arenosa de Mûr Ghala.","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir sustancia pegajosa arenosa para la ciudad de Zajâna.","Entrega los montones de sustancia pegajosa arenosa en una caja de recolección","Se busca: sustancia pegajosa arenosa de Mûr Ghala. Reúnelas para ganar una recompensa adecuada para los coleccionistas.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Tarea de Mûr Ghala Zajâna: Sustancia pegajosa arenosa","La ciudad de Zajâna ha publicado una tarea para recolectar sustancia pegajosa arenosa. Esto se puede entregar a cambio de una recompensa."}},
[9233]={nameES="Tarea de Mûr Ghala Zajâna: Hachas cocidas al sol",objectivesES={"Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir hachas cocidas al sol para la ciudad de Zajâna.","La ciudad de Zajâna ha publicado una tarea para recolectar hachas cocidas al sol. Estas pueden ser entregadas a cambio de una recompensa.","Entrega las hachas cocidas al sol en una caja de recolección","Tarea de Mûr Ghala Zajâna: Hachas cocidas al sol","Se busca: hachas cocidas al sol de Mûr Ghala.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Se busca: hachas cocidas al sol de Mûr Ghala. Reúnelas para ganar una recompensa adecuada para los coleccionistas."}},
[9234]={nameES="Tarea de Mûr Ghala Zajâna: Pieles secadas al sol",objectivesES={"Tarea de Mûr Ghala Zajâna: Pieles secadas al sol","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir pieles secadas al sol para la ciudad de Zajâna.","La ciudad de Zajâna ha publicado una tarea para recolectar pieles secadas al sol. Estas pueden ser entregadas a cambio de una recompensa.","Entrega las pieles secadas al sol en una caja de recolección","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Se busca: pieles secadas al sol de Mûr Ghala. Reúnelas para ganar una recompensa adecuada para los coleccionistas.","Se busca: pieles secadas al sol de Mûr Ghala."}},
[9235]={nameES="Tarea de Mûr Ghala Zajâna: Vainas de espada quemadas por el sol",objectivesES={"Entrega las vainas de espada quemadas por el sol en una caja de recolección","Se busca: vainas de espada quemadas por el sol de Mûr Ghala. Reúnelas para ganar una recompensa adecuada para los coleccionistas.","Se busca: vainas de espada quemadas por el sol de Mûr Ghala.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir vainas de espada quemadas por el sol para la ciudad de Zajâna.","La ciudad de Zajâna ha publicado una tarea para recolectar vainas de espada quemadas por el sol. Estas pueden ser entregadas a cambio de una recompensa.","Tarea de Mûr Ghala Zajâna: Vainas de espada quemadas por el sol"}},
[9236]={nameES="NUEVO vector del libro 6 de Crannog",objectivesES={"NUEVO vector del libro 6 de Crannog"}},
[9237]={nameES="Naethír el glacial",objectivesES={"Derrota a Naethír","Has derrotado a uno de los líderes de las fuerzas del mal en los Campos de Fornost.","Has expulsado a Naethír","Naethír el glacial","Sientes un frío terrible, y te das cuenta de que hay una gran y antigua presencia cerca.\
\
Has encontrado a Naethír, una presencia aterradora en los Campos de Fornost. Este ser fantasmagórico ha ganado poder al arrebatar la vida a las tierras que le rodean.","Naethír se encuentra en el centro de los Campos de Fornost, al norte del camino que conduce al oeste hacia Evendim.\
\
Debes derrotar a Naethír, ya que este ser ha arrebatado toda calidez a los Campos de Fornost.","Completado","Te has topado con Naethír, una presencia aterradora en los Campos de Fornost...","Has derrotado a uno de los líderes de las fuerzas del mal en los Campos de Fornost, Naethír, quien drena el calor de los Hombres."}},
[9238]={nameES="Nalâ-dûm: An Abundance of Grime",objectivesES={}},
[9239]={nameES="Nalâ-dûm: Hard-plated Armour",objectivesES={}},
[9240]={nameES="Nalâ-dûm: Menace of Nalâ-dûm",objectivesES={"Defeated the Caerog","Dór is at the Chamber of the Cross-roads in Moria, above Nalâ-dûm in Durin's Way.\
\
You should return to Dór and tell him of the Caerog you bested, thus removing the menace of the Water-wheels.","Nalâ-dûm: Menace of Nalâ-dûm","Talk to Dór at the Chamber of the Cross-roads","Dór of the Chamber of the Cross-roads explored near the entrance to Nalâ-dûm where the Water-wheels once turned, and he recalls that a great feeling of menace turned him from his path.","Nalâ-dûm, where the Water-wheels lie still, is far below of the Chamber of the Cross-roads in the Water-works of Moria.\
\
Dór has asked you to travel to Nalâ-dûm and defeat the menace that lurks deep inside that forsaken hall. He warned you to take a friend or two with you.","Defeat the menace in Nalâ-dûm"}},
[9241]={nameES="Nameless Horror",objectivesES={"A freshly-slain Orc has been laid on an offering table in the Wracking-hall","Enter the Wracking-hall","The Wracking-hall can be found in the eastern reaches of the Circle of Death.\
\
Maendal has asked you to search the Wracking-hall for signs of a terrible nameless creature and defeat it.","Nameless creatures wander across terrible heaps of misshapen corpses and filth in the Wracking-hall","Find the entrance to the Wracking-hall","Search for the Gnawing One in the Wracking-hall","Nameless Horror","Maendal has tracked the nameless creatures in service to the cultists of Minas Morgul to an old feast-hall of Minas Ithil, now known as the Wracking-hall.","The Wracking-hall can be found in the eastern reaches of the Circle of Death.\
\
Maendal has asked you to find the greatest of the nameless creatures in the Wracking-hall and defeat it.","As you examine the sacrificed Orc, a terrible, shrieking roar echoes through the Wracking-hall","Examine the sacrificed Orc","The Wracking-hall can be found in the eastern reaches of the Circle of Death.\
\
You have discovered the Wracking-hall and should now enter it.","Maendal can be found outside Uialrond in the Circle of Death.\
\
You have defeated the Gnawing One and prevented more nameless creatures from gnawing into the foundations of Minas Morgul. You should return to Maendal.","The Wracking-hall can be found in the eastern reaches of the Circle of Death.\
\
You have discovered a freshly-slain Orc on an offering table within the Wracking-hall. You should examine it and see if it was meant to appease the Gnawing One.","The Gnawing One falls broken to the ground","Talk to Maendal at Uialrond","The old feast-hall stands before you, and you hear strange sounds echoing from within"}},
[9242]={nameES="Nannies in the Nest",objectivesES={"Nannies in the Nest","Molkha is scouting outside Borkordh.","Hobgoblin nest-tenders can be found in the drake-nest of Borkordh in the south-east side of the Pit of Stonejaws.","Molkha has spotted several hobgoblins inside Borkordh, tending the drake nests.","Talk to Molkha outside Borkordh"}},
[9243]={nameES="Nargroth Devoted",objectivesES={"Defeat Regmyl and destroy shrines to Borangos","The Regmyl in Nargroth serve Borangos the Horror. Their presence shows the power that Borangos holds over the caverns of fire. You should defeat any Regmyl you come across and destroy the shrines they worship.","You have successfully defeated many Regmyl and destroyed shrines to Borangos within the fire caverns of Nargroth. Your efforts should slowly weaken the hold that Borangos has over Talath Úrui.","Nargroth is located in Talath Úrui.\
\
You should defeat Regmyl and destroy shrines to Borangos.","Defeated many Regmyl and destroyed shrines to Borangos.","Completado","Nargroth, the caverns of fire, is home to many creatures of flame.","Nargroth Devoted"}},
[9244]={nameES="Nasty Stings",objectivesES={"Swarming plague-flies and their nests can be found in the wilds of Agarnaith.\
\
You should destroy swarming plague-flies and plague-fly nests.","Plagued ash-claws and their dens can be found in the wilds of Agarnaith.\
\
You should destroy plagued ash-claws and ash-claw dens.","Talk to Viznak","Plague-ridden nerbyg and their nests can be found in the wilds of Agarnaith.\
\
You should destroy plague-ridden nerbyg and norbog nests.","Living in a swamp can't be easy, even for a goblin. Viznak has asked you to deal with some local insect nests to make his life a little more bearable.","Nasty Stings","Viznak can be found in his hideout.\
\
You should talk to Viznak."}},
[9245]={nameES="La granja de Nathan Hodges",objectivesES={"Dile a Nathan Hodges que la granja ha sido limpiada de huargos","Nathan Hodges está en Amon Raith.\
\
Deberías decirle a Nathan Hodges que su granja ahora está a salvo de los huargos.","La granja de Nathan Hodges se encuentra al este, por el camino desde Amon Raith en las Quebradas del Norte.\
\
Deberías ir a la granja de Nathan Hodges y asegurarte de que esté libre de huargos.","Nathan Hodges y su esposa fueron expulsados de su granja por un ataque de huargos. Te han pedido que verifiques si es seguro para ellos regresar.","La granja de Nathan Hodges"}},
[9246]={nameES="Natsulm el Asaltante Nocturno",objectivesES={"Natsulm el Asaltante Nocturno","Natsulm el Asaltante Nocturno se encuentra en el Bosque Salvaje.\
\
Deberías encontrar a Natsulm el Asaltante Nocturno.","El temible huargo llamado Natsulm el Asaltante Nocturno acecha a quienes se aventuran demasiado lejos en el Bosque Salvaje.","El temible huargo llamado Natsulm el Asaltante Nocturno acecha a quienes se aventuran demasiado lejos en el Bosque Salvaje. Derrotar a esta temible bestia ayudará a devolver la seguridad al Bosque Salvaje.","Encuentra a Natsulm el Asaltante Nocturno","Natsulm el Asaltante Nocturno se encuentra en el Bosque Salvaje.\
\
Deberías derrotar a Natsulm el Asaltante Nocturno.","Derrota a Natsulm el Asaltante Nocturno"}},
[9247]={nameES="Natural Defence",objectivesES={"Shimmering river-toads can be found along the shores of various streams and ponds in North Ithilien, especially to the north-east of Henneth Annûn.\
\
Rhadrog has asked you to defeat toads in North Ithilien and harvest their slime for use by the Rangers.","Rhadrog can be found in Henneth Annûn.\
\
You have carefully gathered a great deal of toad-slime and should now return to Rhadrog.","Talk to Rhadrog","Rhadrog can be found in Henneth Annûn.\
\
You have coated many arrow-heads in toad-slime and should now report back to Rhadrog.","Desperate to hold their last refuge, the Rangers of Ithilien devise a plan to use the natural defences of Ithilien's wildlife against the Enemy.","Workbenches can be found within the deepest caverns of Henneth Annûn.\
\
You have gathered phials of toad-slime and should now use it to coat arrow-heads for the Rangers of Ithilien.","Natural Defence"}},
[9248]={nameES="Luz natural",objectivesES={"Luz natural","YOU SHOULDNT SEE THIS","Habla con Lomdognir en Ost Galadh","Lomdognir se encuentra en Ost Galadh.\
\
Regresa con Lomdognir con las glándulas de luciérnaga que has recogido.","Las luciérnagas se encuentran por todo Emyn Lûm.\
\
Lomdognir te ha pedido que busques a las luciérnagas en Emyn Lûm e intentes recolectar un puñado de sus glándulas, que producen un resplandor capaz de iluminar incluso a través de la niebla que envuelve el Bosque Negro.","Lomdognir se pregunta si las glándulas luminosas de las luciérnagas de la zona podrían servir como una fuente de luz más fiable en las neblinas antinaturales que rodean el Bosque Negro."}},
[9249]={nameES="Una presa natural",objectivesES={"Los caracales en Tir Katar han estado cazando a los viajeros de la zona. Expúlsalos del área e intenta encontrar supervivientes.","Una presa natural","Encuentra y derrota a la matriarca de los caracales de Khûdi, Amangísu, en Tir Katar.","Derrota a Amangísu","Tu misión es viajar a Tir Katar para neutralizar los caracales que se han estado atacando a los viajeros cercanos y ayudar a cualquier sobreviviente que puedas encontrar."}},
[9250]={nameES="Natural Refreshment",objectivesES={"The avanc has been drenched, but shows no sign of movement","Rook wants you to attempt to wake his avanc so he can continue his journey to the East. \
\
He mentioned seeing a bucket along the edge of the Entwash.","Natural Refreshment","Rook is frustrated that his steed will not budge from this spot. He believes the avanc to be thirsty, so he wishes for you to fetch some water from the nearby Entwash.","Rook can be found to the west of Snowbourn.","Find a bucket and attempt to wake Rook's avanc","Talk to Rook"}},
[9251]={nameES="Nature's Own",objectivesES={}},
[9252]={nameES="Near Death",objectivesES={"Talk to Baillas","Baillas is standing near Léofmar in Fangorn.","Léofmar says no more. The poisonous berries seem to be taking their toll on the poor man.\
\
You have tried everything you can think of, but there is naught to do but stay with this poor man while he dies...\
\
...but your train of thought is interrupted by a sudden noise behind you.","Baillas has come to Léofmar's side after all. The Ent stands before the Rohirrim in the centre of Fangorn's eaves.\
\
You should speak with Baillas.","Baillas sleeps again already","You give Baillas a heartfelt verbal thanks for this miraculous gesture of kindness that saved a man's life.\
\
Baillas says nothing and appears to be more asleep than ever. You were so sure that you had done Gandalf's bidding and awakened an Ent, but Baillas does not seem to have found any further reason to be awake, now that he has saved the day....","Give the Kingsfoil to Léofmar to restore his health","Near Death","The kind Ent watches, waiting patiently for you to give the generous gift of kingsfoil to the sick man.","Léofmar says no more. The poisonous berries begin to take their toll.","You have tried everything in your power to help Léofmar, but it took the Ent Baillas's slow awakening to save the dying man.","Thank Baillas for his kind deed","Léofmar is near Baillas.\
\
You should give the kingsfoil leaves to Léofmar to restore him to health.","Baillas has wakened after all! He bears a gift of kingsfoil to give to the poisoned man","It is Baillas! The Ent has roused himself and is here at the dying man's side after all. And just in time, for in the long, twig-like fingers of his hand is a small sprig of fresh picked kingsfoil.\
\
This herb will save Léofmar's life. You cannot help but marvel at the Ent's kindly curiosity towards the once-doomed Rohirrim Man."}},
[9253]={nameES="Near and Dear",objectivesES={"Forlong and his friends are in the Merry Swan, in the Third Circle of Minas Tirith.\
\
Raise a final glass and drink with Forlong and company.","Find Forlong's locket","The Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle.\
\
You should return to Forlong with word of what you have seen.","The Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle.\
\
Bring the Sûhalar beards back to Forlong, in the Merry Swan.","The Sûhalar can be found among the enemy's forces, especially north of the Rammas Echor in Talath Anor.\
\
Defeat and gather the beards of some Sûhalar, so that Forlong and company can judge if they are more like dwarves or Men.","Húrin stands by the City Gates, which are at the centre of the First Circle of Minas Tirith.\
\
Forlong has asked you to ask Húrin, Warden of the Keys, about the state of preparation and if they can do anything to help.","Ask after Laranís in the Sixth Circle","The Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle.\
\
Hear what Neldir has to say.","This is a good place to view the enemies upon the Pelennor","The Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle.\
\
Return to Forlong with his locket.","Listen to Hirluin","The enemy is making many preparations upon the Pelennor fields, but shows no clear sign of marshalling an attack","The Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle.\
\
Hear what Forlong, Hirluin, and Neldir think of the Sûhalar beards you brought to them.","The Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle.\
\
Hear whether Forlong, Hirluin, and Neldir think the Sûhalar are kin of Dwarves or the Men of Lossarnach.","Raise a glass","Found Forlong's locket","The Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle.\
\
Hear Hirluin's reply.","The Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle.\
\
You should return to Forlong with Húrin's report.","<rgb=#FF0000>Look</rgb> upon the enemy forces from the wall","Lord Forlong sits in the Merry Swan, drinking with his old friends Lord Hirluin and one Neldir of Minas Tirith. The conversation turns to matters close at hand and dear to heart.","The Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle.\
\
Hear what Forlong has to say.","Listen to Neldir","Go up to the Sixth Circle and inquire after Hirluin's old flame, Laranís, among the magistrates and councilors near the Dome of the Sun.","Forlong and his friends are in the Merry Swan, in the Third Circle of Minas Tirith.\
\
Make peace and drink with Forlong and company.","The Third Circle wall can be accessed via staircase, near to the Merry Swan.\
\
Lord Forlong has asked you to go up upon the walls in the Third Circle and <rgb=#FF0000>look</rgb> upon the enemy forces.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This objective requires emotes.</rgb>","The Southern Great Guest-house is in the Seventh Circle.\
\
Bring Forlong the locket of his wife and daughters. It is in his quarters in the Southern Great Guest-house.","Near and Dear","Return to Forlong","The Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle.\
\
Hear what Hirluin has to say.","Listen to Forlong","The Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle.\
\
Return to Forlong with what you have learned of Laranís.","Talk to Húrin, Warden of the Keys","Talk to Forlong","Find a look-out spot on the wall"}},
[9254]={nameES="Cerca de los Límites de la Comarca",objectivesES={"Habla con Hal Gamyi en Avenal","Un hobbit escribió un mensaje que llegó hasta ti. En él, pedía que almas valientes fueran al pueblo de Avenal, al norte de Tejonera y lindando con Evendim.","Avenal está al norte de Tejonera en la Comarca. Necesitarás seguir el camino a través de los Campos Verdes para llegar a la aldea y buscar a Hal Gamyi.\
\
Hal Gamyi puede encontrarse cerca del centro de Avenal.","Cerca de los Límites de la Comarca"}},
[9255]={nameES="Necessary Sacrifices",objectivesES={"Captain Róglarg can be found in the courtyard of Cirith Ungol.\
\
You have gathered several sacrifices and now Captain Róglarg is prepared to bring them to Torech Ungol. You should get Captain Róglarg's attention and signal that you are ready to depart.","Talk to Legolas outside Cirith Ungol","Necessary Sacrifices","Desperate to be rid of the relentless attacks by creatures of Her Ladyship's lesser broods, Captain Róglarg of Cirith Ungol prepares to sacrifice a company of Orcs to Shelob at her lair, Torech Ungol.","Signal Captain Róglarg","Legolas can be found along the road outside of Cirith Ungol.\
\
You have narrowly escaped the wrath of Shelob and her children. You should now speak to Legolas."}},
[9256]={nameES="Need for Greed",objectivesES={}},
[9257]={nameES="Necesidad de una barrica",objectivesES={"Encontrarás a Brethilwen al norte y al oeste, en las afueras del Viñedo de Limael. Dirígete por el camino que sale de Celondim hacia el noroeste y sigue el pequeño sendero junto al río hacia el oeste para encontrarla.\
\
Bregedúr, el tonelero local de Celondim, te pidió que entregaras un tonel para almacenar vino a su amiga Brethilwen en el Viñedo de Limael.","Entrega el tonel de vino a Brethilwen fuera del Viñedo de Limael","DNT - NEVER SHOULD BE SEEN","Necesidad de una barrica","Bregedúr, en la Plaza del Artesano de Celondim, te pidió que entregaras un tonel destinado a almacenar vino a su amiga Brethilwen en el Viñedo de Limael."}},
[9258]={nameES="Needed Warmth",objectivesES={"Dréri has asked you to look around the nearby area for firewood.\
\
You should collect fallen branches near Fellgát.","Talk to Dréri","Now that you have some firewood, you should build camp-fires in Fellgát.","The camp-fires in Fellgát have been assembled, but now they need to be set alight.","Dréri has asked you to set up camp-fires in Fellgát to keep the cold away.","The camp-fires have been lit, protecting Fellgát from the chill of the mountains.\
\
You should talk to Dréri.","Needed Warmth"}},
[9259]={nameES="La vigilancia de Ojo de Aguja",objectivesES={"La vigilancia de Ojo de Aguja","El Frontero Redondo se encuentra de servicio cerca del camino que conduce a Ojo de Aguja, al norte de Cavada Grande, al noroeste de Hobbiton.\
\
El Oficial Madriguera te ha pedido que viajes a Ojo de Aguja y ofrezcas tus servicios al Frontero Redondo.","El Oficial Madriguera cree que deberías conocer a los otros Oficiales y Fronteros."}},
[9260]={nameES="Needles and Haystacks",objectivesES={"You have stumbled into the affairs of Little Pip and Vexed Meldis. Does one of Tadrent's haystacks hold a valuable treasure?","Little Pip stands by the haystack in question at the northern entrance of Tadrent, in King's Gondor.","Talk to Little Pip by the haystack in question","There is no needle in that haystack after all.","Wait...","There's nothing hidden in that haystack after all","Search the haystack in question until you find something... or look for another solution","Needles and Haystacks","Little Pip has been put to work searching a particular haystack in King's Gondor... for something.","You search through the haystack in question... but find nothing"}},
[9261]={nameES="Needles for the Orcs",objectivesES={"Intact Orkish arrows can be found scattered in the ground at Zarkul-sulûn.\
\
Hoping to arm Zhélruka archers, Rádek has asked you to collect intact Orkish arrows from the ground at Zarkul-sulûn.","Zhélruka archers can be found at Zarkul-sulûn.\
\
You have collected the Orkish arrows and should now deliver them to Zhélruka archers at Zarkul-sulûn.","After discovering a number of intact Orkish arrows left behind at Zarkul-sulûn, Rádek has devised a plan to 'return' them to the Orcs of Gundabad.","Rádek can be found at Zarkul-sulûn.\
\
You have armed the Zhélruka archers and should now report back to Rádek.","Needles for the Orcs","Talk to Rádek"}},
[9262]={nameES="Needs Fulfilled",objectivesES={"You have given meat you bought from Zidek to the hungry stray and can see that he is a gentle and intelligent dog. You should give him some pats.","You can see that the expression in Zidek's eyes has softened since he watched you interact with the hungry stray dog.\
\
'You know, now that I think about it, it is possible I can spare some meat for the beast. If he works for it, that is. It seems that Ubdun could use a companion and protector while herding the goats, and this fellow looks like he needs a companion in addition to something to eat.\
\
'Here, take that steak on the table and see if the dog will follow you to Ubdun.'","Zidek said he would feed the dog if he serves as the protector and companion of Ubdun the goatherd. He has pointed to a large, juicy steak on the table, and asked you to take it and see if the dog will follow you to Ubdun.","Needs Fulfilled","The dog has followed you, or rather the steak, to Ubdun's location, near Jirush. You should talk to Ubdun.","Talk to Ubdun","A hungry dog whines and begs at Zidek's butcher shop.","The dog followed you!","Zidek is trying to send the hungry dog away. You should talk to Zidek.","You hold the meat out to the dog, and he takes it from you, careful not to bite your hand. He wags his tail and continues to lick your hand long after the food is gone.","The dog is whining, staring at the meat Zidek has for sale.\
\
'Off with you, you pest!'\
\
Zidek looks about, presumably for something to throw at the dog.","Carry the steak to Ubdun outside Jirush","Zidek tried sending the hungry dog away, but you took pity upon the animal and bought some meat for the dog. You should give it to him.","Talk to Zidek","You have given meat you bought from Zidek to the hungry stray and can see that he is a gentle and intelligent dog. Afterward, you gave the good dog some pats that did not go unappreciated. You should talk to Zidek.","Give food to the hungry dog","Give the dog a <rgb=#00FF00>pat</rgb>."}},
[9263]={nameES="Needs of the People",objectivesES={"Speak with Entârshul","Speak with Mushêndu, a farmer in Urmâkh","Return to Mizâdi in Urmâkh now that you have heard the needs of the people of Urmâkh.","Mizâdi has asked that you speak with residents of Urmâkh to help with their daily needs.","Speak with Girnada, Quartermaster of Urmâkh","Speak with Mizâdi in Urmâkh","Needs of the People","Speak with Nukûsh, Blacksmith of Urmâkh","Mizâdi has asked that you speak with residents of Urmâkh to help with their needs. Specifically, she's asked you speak with Girnada, Mushêndu, Entârshul and Nukûsh in Urmâkh."}},
[9264]={nameES="Rompeniquebriques",objectivesES={"El Vigilante Robledales se alegrará de saber que la cantidad de niquebriques cerca de su campamento, en el extremo oriental del borde norte de la Atalaya Sur, ha disminuido.\
\
El Vigilante Robledales ha solicitado tu ayuda para eliminar a las criaturas y así poder encontrar un descanso reparador.","El pantano al norte y al este de la posición del Vigilante, fuera de la Atalaya Sur, es el hogar de ruidosos niquebriques.\
\
El Vigilante Robledales ha solicitado tu ayuda para eliminar a las criaturas y así poder encontrar un descanso reparador.","Rompeniquebriques","Regresa con el Vigilante Robledales","El Vigilante Robledales te ha pedido un favor personal mientras estabas en la zona de la Atalaya Sur."}},
[9265]={nameES="El amigo de los Niquebriques",objectivesES={"El amigo de los Niquebriques","Roderick, el amigo de los Niquebriques está preocupado por Sniken, su mascota niquebrique, y te ha pedido ayuda para animarlo.","Lleva las alas de mosca guadaña a Roderick, el Amigo de los Niquebriques","Las grandes moscas guadaña se encuentran principalmente en el sur del Pantano de Moscagua. Roderick, amigo de Niquebriques está acampado en lo alto de un acantilado cerca de las Ruinas del Agujero de Trasgos, en la parte sureste del Pantano de Moscagua.\
\
Roderick, el amigo de los Niquebriques te pidió que recolectaras alas de las moscas guadaña que se encuentran en el Pantano de Moscagua para alimentar a su mascota niquebrique, Sniken."}},
[9266]={nameES="Niquebriques en los Pantanos",objectivesES={"Niquebriques en los Pantanos","Habla con Edda Ramaje","Aunque siempre está atento a los trasgos, la vigilante Junquero cree que las criaturas de los Pantanos de Moscagua, al este de Entibo, no son menos peligrosas para el pueblo.","Edda Ramaje se encuentra en los Pantanos de Moscagua, al sureste de las ruinas.\
\
La vigilante Junquero te pidió que contactaras a los vigilantes apostados en los pantanos después de que lograste reducir el número de Niquebriques.","Los Pantanos de Moscagua se encuentran al este de Entibo, más allá de la granja de Swatmidge.\
\
La vigilante Junquero teme que la creciente población de Niquebriques en el norte de los pantanos sea una amenaza para Entibo que los vigilantes están pasando por alto debido a los problemas con los trasgos."}},
[9267]={nameES="Negotiations",objectivesES={"Jajax is in the tavern of Lothgobel.\
\
You should speak with Jajax.","Make your way to Calembel and speak with someone there","Try to negotiate with Jajax","Jajax has agreed to enter into negotiations with you about the fate of Lothgobel.","Negotiations","Calembel, the main city of Lamedon, can be found south of Lothgobel.\
\
You should leave the Corsairs to their business and make your way to Calembel."}},
[9268]={nameES="Neighbourly Pies",objectivesES={}},
[9269]={nameES="Neighbours Meet",objectivesES={"Neighbours Meet","The missing hunter has been found dead, and his companions should be alerted to this unhappy turn of events.","Wynmar stands at the site of the Orc-siege in Thinglad.\
\
You should speak with Wynmar.","The enemies who slew this fellow may yet be near.\
\
You cannot help but wonder what Noriel would wish you to do. Will driving out the unwelcome Rohirrim still be the first priority when a true enemy is surely so near?","The hunter lies dead on a hilltop in Thinglad, a forest guarded closely by the Elves of Lórien.\
\
You should search the dead hunter once more to make an argument for chasing the true enemy out of Thinglad.","The arrows that pierced this man's body so many times are crude, likely Orkish in make. The Orcs that loosed these cannot be far.\
\
There is only one choice in this matter: driving out these foes is the more pressing task. Noriel should abandon her wish to send the Rohirrim away.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This is intended to be a single-player encounter, but up to two players may enter at a time. It is recommended that guests do not join if they have not reached this part of the story.</rgb>","Talk to Wynmar","Make a case to chase out the true enemy, not the Rohirrim"}},
[9270]={nameES="Nunca Aventures con el Estómago Vacío",objectivesES={"Samsagaz Gamyi sabe una que otra cosa sobre las aventuras. Con gusto te ayudará en tus propias y alegres andanzas y se asegurará de que seas capaz de alimentarte durante el camino.","Samsagaz Gamyi, además de ser un gran aventurero por derecho propio, desea ayudarte en tus propias aventuras. Háblale y te recompensará con un obsequio, como haría cualquier buen hobbit.","Ve lo que Sam tiene para ti","Nunca Aventures con el Estómago Vacío"}},
[9271]={nameES="Nunca Lejos de Casa",objectivesES={"Wesley Saltabosques se encuentra en el lugar de trabajo de Espinar en las Tierras de Bree, muy al este de Ered Luin.\
\
Wesley Saltabosques te ha dicho que nunca podrá viajar a Celondim en Ered Luin para encontrar la \\qAñada de Limael\\q que necesita para completar el desafío de la Liga de las Posadas. Te pidió que le consiguieras un poco de vino.","Lleva la Añada de Limael a Wesley Saltabosques en el lugar de trabajo de Espinar.","Nunca Lejos de Casa","Recoge Añada de Limael en Celondim.","Has recogido Añada de Limael","Se te ha encargado completar una entrega a un miembro de la Liga de las Posadas que se ha quedado varado lejos del festival esta temporada.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu bitácora de misiones cuando termine el festival actual. </rgb>","La Añada de Limael se puede comprar en Celondim en Ered Luin.\
\
Debes recoger la Añada de Limael de un viticultor de Celondim."}},
[9272]={nameES="Nunca Lejos de Casa",objectivesES={"Nunca Lejos de Casa","El Vino de Isengard, señuelo para la Cosecha de Limael, puede obtenerse en el Poney Pisador, en Bree.\
\
Deberías dirigirte al Poney Pisador y conseguir algo de Vino de Isengard de manos de Cebadilla Mantecona, que luego entregarás a Wesley Saltabosques haciéndolo pasar por la Cosecha de Limael.","Has recogido la falsa Cosecha de Limael","Recoge la falsa Cosecha de Limael en el Poney Pisador","Wesley Saltabosques se encuentra en la Obra de Espinar, en Bree.\
\
Deberías llevarle el Vino de Isengard, hábilmente disfrazado como Cosecha de Limael. Necesita ese vino para completar el Desafío de la Liga de las Posadas.","Lleva la falsa Cosecha de Limael a Wesley Saltabosques"}},
[9273]={nameES="Nunca es Solo una cosa",objectivesES={"Habla con Rothavron en el Vado de Sarn","Rothavron está preocupado por algo más que el paso de los terribles Jinetes.","Rothavron está en el Vado de Sarn.","Los bandidos se han estado reuniendo al sur, en Gaervarad en Páramo Rojizo, y Rothavron no quiere que los villanos queden sin oposición.","Nunca es Solo una cosa"}},
[9274]={nameES="Never Reported Back",objectivesES={"Find Herestan","Find Déormund","Never Reported Back","Hogawise is at the forward encampment in Tâl Methedras.","Hogawise is worried about two of his kinsmen, who have not reported back to the camp since they went scouting the lake's edge.","Talk to Hogawise at the forward encampment in Tâl Methedras","Two of Théodred's men went to scout the lake's edge: Déormund to the north-west and Herestan to the north. They have not returned, and Hogawise wants you to find them."}},
[9275]={nameES="Guiso de la familia Nevit",objectivesES={"Rhiangar Nevit quiere recuperar el favor de su padre, el alcalde de Herne. Para ello, necesita ayuda para conseguir los ingredientes de su comida favorita.","Vuelve con Rhiangar","Consigue una hogaza de pan","Consigue una botella del mejor vino de la Posada de la Encrucijada","Rhiangar Nevit te ha pedido que consigas los suministros para el guiso favorito de su familia. Las cabras de pelaje rojizo pueden encontrarse al oeste de Herne, y el resto de ingredientes pueden obtenerse de los aldeanos, muchos de los cuales están en la Posada de la Encrucijada, la posada de Herne.\
\
Deberías conseguir los ingredientes para Rhiangar.","Rhiangar está en la casa del alcalde, en Herne.\
\
Deberías llevarle a Rhiangar los ingredientes de la cena.","Consigue las especias del guiso de Tangwen","Consigue patatas","Guiso de la familia Nevit","Tangwen te da un saquito de especias"}},
[9276]={nameES="New Arrival in Combe",objectivesES={}},
[9277]={nameES="Nuevo Crecimiento",objectivesES={"Nuevo Crecimiento","Informa a alguien en el campamento del Mirador de la Gran Excavación sobre el hongo","Informa a Thórhall sobre el hongo que viste","Thórhall está preocupado por el extraño hongo","Qué hongo tan extraño....\
\
Podría ser prudente informar a los enanos que una flora extraña parece estar extendiéndose en Moria. Hay algo en el aspecto de ese hongo y en el área circundante que resulta inquietante.","El campamento del Mirador de la Gran Excavación es el centro principal de los enanos en la Gran Excavación.\
\
Debes llevar noticias del extraño hongo que encontraste a alguien en el Mirador de la Gran Excavación.","Thórhall está en el pequeño campamento de enanos en Lamab-dûm.\
\
Debes informar a Thórhall sobre el extraño hongo que encontraste en el Palacio de Náin.","Has descubierto un crecimiento extraño, diferente a cualquier otro que hayas visto en el Palacio de Náin."}},
[9278]={nameES="Nuevas pieles para curtir",objectivesES={"Derrota al cocodrilo masivo","Cocodrilo masivo derrotado","Nuevas pieles para curtir","Tu misión es viajar al oeste de Sul Madásh hasta la Guarida de los Shadlúgai y recolectar pieles de cocodrilo."}},
[9279]={nameES="New Hires",objectivesES={}},
[9280]={nameES="Un nuevo hogar para las reliquias de antaño",objectivesES={"La entrada a la tumba está en la isla más allá del puente de Ariant, en el nivel superior de la ciudad.\
\
Glangilith te ha pedido que recuperes reliquias de valor incalculable de Haudh Valandil antes de que los Angmarim las destruyan.","Un nuevo hogar para las reliquias de antaño"}},
[9281]={nameES="New Labourers of Mate Isernore",objectivesES={}},
[9282]={nameES="New Life",objectivesES={"New Life","The soil of North Ithilien is rich, even in times of war. The Rangers of Ithilien hope that simple efforts will aid in preserving the land in years to come.","Ereblen can be found to the west of Henneth Annûn.\
\
You have planted many seeds and should now return to Ereblen.","Talk to Ereblen","Fertile soil can be found in the lowlands of North Ithilien to the west and south of Henneth Annûn.\
\
You have gathered many seeds and should now plant them throughout North Ithilien.","Seeds can be found on the Field of Cormallen and in the surrounding woods.\
\
Ereblen has asked you to gather many seeds from the Field of Cormallen and then plant them in the lowlands of North Ithilien."}},
[9283]={nameES="New Orders",objectivesES={}},
[9284]={nameES="New Quest",objectivesES={}},
[9285]={nameES="New Thievery",objectivesES={"Lorndúr can be found in Loeglond.\
\
You should talk to Lorndúr.","Talk to Lorndúr","River nets can be found along the Forest River between Loeglond and Felegoth.\
\
An enemy of the North has been using river nets to steal shipments from Felegoth to Loeglond beneath the notice of the Elves. You should destroy the river nets before more shipments are stolen.","New Thievery","Despite efforts to repel the Orcs and prevent the theft of Felegoth's goods, more shipments continue to be stolen from the Forest River between Felegoth and Loeglond."}},
[9286]={nameES="Nuevos problemas en el Bosque Viejo",objectivesES={"El campamento de Gillemin Brandigamo está a cierta distancia al sureste en el Bosque Viejo, más allá de la Colina del viejo Muddyfoot.\
\
Toly Tejonera te pidió que buscaras el consejo de un viejo guardabosques llamado Gillemin Brandigamo.","Nuevos problemas en el Bosque Viejo","Habla con Gillemin Brandigamo en el Bosque Viejo","Toly Tejonera está preocupado porque todo lo que le trajiste estaba echado a perder. Eso, junto con la agitación de las criaturas del bosque, lo tiene inquieto."}},
[9287]={nameES="Newfound Freedom",objectivesES={}},
[9288]={nameES="News From Ethring",objectivesES={"<rgb=#FF0000>Look</rgb> towards Mount Mindolluin","Dervorin can be found upon the wall near the Wainrider's Head on the Second Circle of Minas Tirith.\
\
You should speak with Dervorin.","You meet Dervorin and tell him of news from his home, Ethring.","Dervorin gazes at Mount Mindolluin","Dervorin will meet you upon the wall near the Wainrider's Head on the Second Circle of Minas Tirith.\
\
You should climb up on top the wall of the Second Circle to meet with Dervorin.","Dervorin can be found upon the wall near the Wainrider's Head on the Second Circle of Minas Tirith.\
\
You should look towards Mount Mindolluin with Dervorin.","Speak with Dervorin","News From Ethring","The mountain range stands tall and majestic over Old Anórien","Speak with Dervorin upon the wall of the Second Circle","Dervorin seeks to make his family proud"}},
[9289]={nameES="News From Tadrent",objectivesES={"You meet Rossaran and tell him of news from his home, Tadrent.","Look at the fire","News From Tadrent","Speak with Rossaran","The brazier sits next to Rossaran.\
\
You should look at the flames.","Rossaran longs to return to Belfalas after the war is over","The flame burns bright with the hope of Gondor","Rossaran can be found in the Court of Tarondor on the First Circle of Minas Tirith.\
\
You should speak with Rossaran."}},
[9290]={nameES="News of the Host",objectivesES={"News of the Host","Talk to Angbor","Morgul lurkers can be found in the wooded land south of the after-battle Cross-roads.\
\
You should proclaim the King's return to any Morgul Orcs lurking nearby.","With the Host of the West on the march, Angbor has been given orders to proclaim the King's return.","You should talk to Angbor, who can be found at the after-battle Cross-roads."}},
[9291]={nameES="News the Reeve Must Hear",objectivesES={}},
[9292]={nameES="El pariente cercano",objectivesES={"El pariente cercano","Habla con Kúli en el Agujero Chirriante","La triste noticia de la muerte de Nykr debe ser entrega a su pariente, un enano llamado Kúli, que está estudiando el comportamiento de las arañas.","Kuli está en el Agujero Chirriante, al sureste de Guardia Orca.\
\
Róarr te ha pedido que encuentres a Kúli en el Agujero Chirriante y le des las noticias de la muerte de Nykr."}},
[9293]={nameES="El pariente cercano",objectivesES={"Toma la cabra de Knakk para ir al campamento de Kúli y hablar con él sobre el medallón","El pariente cercano","La cabra de Knakk está junto a él.\\ n\
La cabra de Knakk puede llevarte de forma segura hasta el campamento de Kúli, cerca de la colmena de gredbyg en la caverna meridional de las Vetas del Cuerno Rojo.\
\
Knakk te ha pedido que busques a Kúli, le des la noticia de la muerte de Kafli y le pidas que traduzca el antiguo texto enano que se encuentra dentro del medallón.","La triste noticia de la muerte de Kafli debe ser comunicada a su pariente más cercano, un enano llamado Kúli, que acampa cerca de la colmena de gredbyg y busca minerales y riquezas en las cavernas meridionales de las Vetas del Cuerno Rojo."}},
[9294]={nameES="Nightmare's End",objectivesES={"Nightmare's End","Habla con Radagast","In the deepest recesses of the Sorrow-well, you have discovered a small, stone trinket in the shape of a bear. The moisture in the cavern has eroded the trinket, but as your fingers pass over it, you feel a number of shallow grooves on the back. Flipping it over, you discover the worn outlines of an inscription.\
\
After examining it for a time, you are able to make out the old writing carved into the trinket. It reads: \\qFor Amelina\\q.\
\
You should return the trinket to Atta.","Radagast can be found standing beside Ríkmar in Hultvís.\
\
You have found Radagast in Hultvís and should now speak to him.","Atta can be found in Hultvís.\
\
You have discovered a trinket bearing the name of Atta's long-deceased sister, Amelina. You should deliver it to Atta at once.","In the darkness of the Sorrow-well, you have discovered a curious trinket left behind by one of Úbil the Snatcher's victims.","Find Radagast in Hultvís","Deliver Amelina's trinket to Atta","Nodding at Ríkmar, Radagast seems to have been expecting your arrival","Radagast can be found somewhere in Hultvís.\
\
After Radagast came to Hultvís, he spoke to Atta about the Snatcher. Overcome with emotion at the return of his sister's trinket, Atta has vowed to spend his remaining days travelling Middle-earth."}},
[9295]={nameES="Pesadillas en el Abismo",objectivesES={"Ayuda a Mallas en sus esfuerzos en Skûmfil","Veúlfur se encuentra en la Sala Vigesimoprimera, al noroeste del Refugio Sombrío.\
\
Has ayudado con éxito a todos los agentes de Veúlfur en el Refugio Sombrío, ganándote su honor y respeto.","Mallas, Throstur y Gelirwen se encuentran en el Refugio Sombrío, al sureste de la Sala Vigesimoprimera.\
\
Veúlfur desea comprender mejor al enemigo que surge de los confines de la oscuridad. Te ha enviado al Refugio Sombrío para ayudar a sus agentes y aliados con diversas tareas destinadas a esclarecer los peligros y la naturaleza de la criatura maligna que allí se oculta.","En las zonas más profundas de Moria habitan criaturas extrañas y aterradoras. Veúlfur envió a varios de sus mejores agentes al Refugio Sombrío para reunirse allí con una compañía de elfos e investigar los rumores procedentes de las profundas tinieblas.","Ayuda a Mallas en sus esfuerzos en la Sala Decimosexta","Pesadillas en el Abismo","Regresa con Veúlfur a la Sala Vigesimoprimera","Ayuda a Throstur en sus esfuerzos en Skûmfil","Ayuda a Gelirwen en sus esfuerzos en las Excavaciones Tenebrosas"}},
[9296]={nameES="Niphredil y elanor",objectivesES={"Lleva flores a Maliriel en el Embarcadero","Bahanneth está en Talan Fanuidhol, al oeste de Cerin Amroth. Ambendel se encuentra en Echad Andestel, al suroeste de Cerin Amroth. Maliriel está en el Embarcadero, al este y al sur de Cerin Amroth, junto al río.\
\
Tuilinn te ha pedido que lleves flores de elanor y niphredil a Bahanneth, Ambendel y Maliriel, la Maestra del Festín.","Elanor y niphredil pueden encontrarse sobre la colina de Cerin Amroth y a su alrededor.\
\
Tuilinn te ha pedido que recojas elanor y niphredil.","Niphredil y elanor","Lleva flores a Bahanneth en Talan Fanuidhol","Habla con Tuilinn en Cerin Amroth","Tuilinn se encuentra en lo alto de la plataforma en Cerin Amroth.\
\
Deberías regresar junto a Tuilinn y contarle cómo su regalo ha levantado el ánimo de sus amigos.","Preocupada por todos los recientes trastornos que afectan a Lothlórien, Tuilinn ha tenido una idea para reforzar la moral de los Elfos en todo el bosque.","Lleva flores a Ambendel en Echad Andestel"}},
[9297]={nameES="Nirgambâr, the Restless Tomb -- Solo/Duo",objectivesES={"Defeat Sakhârshag","Andur's path leads you deeper into Nirgambâr. Who knows what might lie in wait next?","As Sakhârshag falls, Andur's path continues deeper into Nirgambâr.","Travelling deeper within Nirgambâr has revealed several ancient creatures. Who or what lies in the central chamber?","Explore the ancient, crumbling ziggurat-tombs of pale stone known as Nirgambâr. Follow Andur's path deeper within the ancient tomb.","With Andur's expedition into Nirgambâr at an end, perhaps Amalibi can see this place sealed so no others can enter.","Defeat Aratûg","Nirgambâr, the Restless Tomb -- Solo/Duo","The sands become still on the floor. Shouts can be heard deeper into Nirgambâr.","Defeat Imanak-tûr","In a sheltered valley in the north of Khûd Zagin stand ancient, crumbling ziggurat-tombs of pale stone collectively known as Nirgambâr. Scouts have reported that one of the Zidemel's men, Andur, is said to have entered Nirgambâr drawn there by dark whispers. Locate and stop Andur before he can unleash what lurks in this cursed place."}},
[9298]={nameES="Nirgambâr, the Restless Tomb -- Tier 1",objectivesES={"Defeat Sakhârshag","Andur's path leads you deeper into Nirgambâr. Who knows what might lie in wait next?","As Sakhârshag falls, Andur's path continues deeper into Nirgambâr.","Travelling deeper within Nirgambâr has revealed several ancient creatures. Who or what lies in the central chamber?","Explore the ancient, crumbling ziggurat-tombs of pale stone known as Nirgambâr. Follow Andur's path deeper within the ancient tomb.","With Andur's expedition into Nirgambâr at an end, perhaps Amalibi can see this place sealed so no others can enter.","Nirgambâr, the Restless Tomb -- Tier 1","Defeat Aratûg","The sands become still on the floor. Shouts can be heard deeper into Nirgambâr.","Defeat Imanak-tûr","In a sheltered valley in the north of Khûd Zagin stand ancient, crumbling ziggurat-tombs of pale stone collectively known as Nirgambâr. Scouts have reported that one of the Zidemel's men, Andur, is said to have entered Nirgambâr drawn there by dark whispers. Locate and stop Andur before he can unleash what lurks in this cursed place."}},
[9299]={nameES="Nirgambâr, the Restless Tomb -- Tier 2",objectivesES={"Defeat Sakhârshag","Andur's path leads you deeper into Nirgambâr. Who knows what might lie in wait next?","As Sakhârshag falls, Andur's path continues deeper into Nirgambâr.","Travelling deeper within Nirgambâr has revealed several ancient creatures. Who or what lies in the central chamber?","Explore the ancient, crumbling ziggurat-tombs of pale stone known as Nirgambâr. Follow Andur's path deeper within the ancient tomb.","With Andur's expedition into Nirgambâr at an end, perhaps Amalibi can see this place sealed so no others can enter.","Nirgambâr, the Restless Tomb -- Tier 2","Defeat Aratûg","The sands become still on the floor. Shouts can be heard deeper into Nirgambâr.","Defeat Imanak-tûr","In a sheltered valley in the north of Khûd Zagin stand ancient, crumbling ziggurat-tombs of pale stone collectively known as Nirgambâr. Scouts have reported that one of the Zidemel's men, Andur, is said to have entered Nirgambâr drawn there by dark whispers. Locate and stop Andur before he can unleash what lurks in this cursed place."}},
[9300]={nameES="Nirgambâr, the Restless Tomb -- Tier 3",objectivesES={"Defeat Sakhârshag","Andur's path leads you deeper into Nirgambâr. Who knows what might lie in wait next?","As Sakhârshag falls, Andur's path continues deeper into Nirgambâr.","Travelling deeper within Nirgambâr has revealed several ancient creatures. Who or what lies in the central chamber?","Explore the ancient, crumbling ziggurat-tombs of pale stone known as Nirgambâr. Follow Andur's path deeper within the ancient tomb.","With Andur's expedition into Nirgambâr at an end, perhaps Amalibi can see this place sealed so no others can enter.","Nirgambâr, the Restless Tomb -- Tier 3","Defeat Aratûg","The sands become still on the floor. Shouts can be heard deeper into Nirgambâr.","Defeat Imanak-tûr","In a sheltered valley in the north of Khûd Zagin stand ancient, crumbling ziggurat-tombs of pale stone collectively known as Nirgambâr. Scouts have reported that one of the Zidemel's men, Andur, is said to have entered Nirgambâr drawn there by dark whispers. Locate and stop Andur before he can unleash what lurks in this cursed place."}},
[9301]={nameES="Ninguna flecha se desperdicia",objectivesES={"Meredhrandir se encuentra en Mekhem-bizru, justo en la entrada oriental de Moria.\
\
Has llevado un fardo de flechas a Meredhrandir y deberías hablar con él sobre el viaje.","Ninguna flecha se desperdicia","Recoge un fardo de flechas junto a Celegúien","Has llevado algunas flechas a Celegúien y ahora quiere que las entregues a Meredhrandir en Mekhem-bizru.","Celegúien tiene un fardo de flechas para que lo recojas en las cajas junto a ella en Echad Andestel. Quiere que se las lleves a Meredhrandir en el campamento de Mekhem-bizru, muy cerca de la entrada de Moria. Te aconsejó que siguieras el camino hacia el oeste y luego al norte a través de Nanduhirion, y que tengas cuidado con los orcos en la ruta.\
\
Se te ha pedido que entregues flechas desde Echad Andestel hasta Mekhem-bizru."}},
[9302]={nameES="No Battle Left to Fight",objectivesES={"No Battle Left to Fight","The Field of Cormallen can be found far to the north in the north-western reaches of North Ithilien.\
\
Jarl Gurthilm has asked you to keep the Orcs and Easterlings in North Ithilien at bay as he and his men travel. He expects a report on your efforts near the Field of Cormallen.","Jarl Gurthilm and his company must be somewhere nearby the Field of Cormallen.\
\
You have arrived at the Field of Cormallen, but the Variags are nowhere to be found. You should search nearby for Jarl Gurthilm's company.","Search for Jarl Gurthilm's company near the Field of Cormallen","You discover Jarl Gurthilm and his company amidst a field of slain Khundolar!","Jarl Gurthilm can be found among his company on the banks of the Anduin in south-western North Ithilien.\
\
You have encountered a familiar party of Variags camped within North Ithilien and should speak to their Jarl.","You have arrived at the Field, but the Variags are nowhere to be found...","Jarl Gurthilm and his company can be found to the east of the Field of Cormallen.\
\
You have found Jarl Gurthilm and his company and should now speak to him.","After abandoning the Battle of the Pelennor Fields when defeat was inevitable, a company of Variags seeks to return to Khand and put the war behind them.","Talk to Jarl Gurthilm","While exploring the shores of the Anduin, you have discovered a company of Variags camped upon its bank.\
\
Upon closer inspection, you realize it is none other than Jarl Gurthilm and his men.\
\
Despite your terse interactions in Osgiliath, his men do not appear immediately hostile and he gestures for you to approach.","Meet Jarl Gurthilm at the Field of Cormallen"}},
[9303]={nameES="No Debate",objectivesES={}},
[9304]={nameES="No Exceptions",objectivesES={"Found a sword in Entwade","Found a shield in Entwade","No Exceptions","Thane Edric can be found inside the Mead Hall of Entwade in eastern Kingstead.\
\
Agelman has asked that you speak to Edric on his behalf about remaining in Entwade to combat the White Hand forces.","A sword and shield can be found scattered about Entwade.\
\
Agelman has asked that you arm him. He believes a sword can be found near the training dummies, and a shield can be found near the stable-master.","Agelman desires to earn Thane Edric's approval to take up arms against the White Hand and defend the Wade.","Find a sword in Entwade","Agelman can be found at your side or can be rallied to you by using your horn.\
\
Thane Edric has denied Agelman in his request to remain in Entwade and battle alongside the other warriors. You should now speak to Agelman about what is to be done next.","Talk to Agelman","Agelman can be found at your side or can be rallied with your horn.\
\
You have recovered a sword and shield for Agelman at his request, and should now return them to his keeping.","Talk to Thane Edric","Find a shield in Entwade"}},
[9305]={nameES="Sin hogar para los orcos",objectivesES={"Has destruido las construcciones y defensas del enemigo en Mudmul-charâf.","Completado","Los orcos han levantado tiendas y barricadas para bloquear el paso de Mudmul-charâf.","Sin hogar para los orcos","Puedes encontrar tiendas orcas y barricadas en Mudmul-charâf, un pasaje en el noroeste de Zelem-melek.\
\
Deberías destruir las construcciones y defensas improvisadas de los orcos.","Los orcos han levantado tiendas y barricadas para bloquear el paso de Mudmul-charâf.\
\
Deberías destruir las construcciones y defensas de los orcos para despejar el paso en favor de la expedición de los enanos.","Has destruido las construcciones y defensas del enemigo en Mudmul-charâf.\
\
Los enanos que transitan hacia y desde la Sala Vigesimoprimera quedarán en deuda contigo por esta buena acción."}},
[9306]={nameES="No Honour Among Goblins",objectivesES={}},
[9307]={nameES="No Hope, No Future",objectivesES={}},
[9308]={nameES="No Mercy for Traitors",objectivesES={"Maelona is outside her house near the entrance of Tûr Morva.\
\
Iwan has inadvisably tasted the toad-residue that he wants to coat the Falcon-clan's weapons with and is now sick. He has sent you to the healer Maelona to bring him something that will cure him.","Bring the root-powder to Iwan","Iwan believes the clans that have pledged themselves to Saruman deserve no mercy and plans to brew a poison with which to fight them.","No Mercy for Traitors","Iwan is sitting on the shore of the lake near the orchard of Tûr Morva.\
\
You have collected residue from the toads of Tâl Methedras and should bring it back to Iwan.","Bring the toad-residue to Iwan","Iwan is at the lake's edge near the orchards of Tûr Morva.\
\
Maelona has given you some powder that should cure Iwan of his digestive complaint.","Toads can be found throughout Tâl Methedras, on the far shore of the lake and the island in the middle of the water.\
\
Iwan has asked you to collect some of the residue from the skins of toads in Tâl Methedras.","Talk to Maelona in Tûr Morva"}},
[9309]={nameES="No Place for Ruffians",objectivesES={}},
[9310]={nameES="No Proper Grave",objectivesES={}},
[9311]={nameES="No Quarter for the Captured",objectivesES={}},
[9312]={nameES="No Quarter in the Westemnet",objectivesES={"Thane Edric can be found in the Mead Hall of Entwade in eastern Kingstead.\
\
You have defeated the remainder of Orc forces that fled into the Westemnet. You should inform Thane Edric of your success.","Talk to Thane Edric","Thane Edric grows increasingly concerned by the presence of queer Orcs that have fled into the Westemnet from the Sutcrofts.","No Quarter in the Westemnet","Orcs can be found to the south of Entwade near the shores of the river Entwash.\
\
Thane Edric's guard, Magenred, has asked you to slay Orcs that have fled into Kingstead from the Sutcrofts."}},
[9313]={nameES="No Rest for the Enemies",objectivesES={}},
[9314]={nameES="No Risk to the Messenger",objectivesES={}},
[9315]={nameES="No Safe Passage",objectivesES={"Rhadrog can be found in Henneth Annûn.\
\
You have laid many traps on behalf of the Rangers of Ithilien. You should now return to Rhadrog.","The Rangers of Ithilien often use traps to capture deer for venison, but to ensnare an encroaching Orc in times of war would be an even greater prize.","Talk to Rhadrog in Henneth Annûn","No Safe Passage","Ideal trap locations can be found around the eastern entrance to Henneth Annûn.\
\
Rhadrog has asked you to lay traps for deer and Orcs alike in the lands around Henneth Annûn."}},
[9316]={nameES="No Small Deed",objectivesES={"Talk to Lúka","Lúka has asked you to clean the wounds of injured scouts.\
\
The scouts are resting around Ashmargathâl.","The supply of twistbeard is running low for the soldiers at Ashmargathâl. Swamped with responsibilities, Lúka finds herself asking for aid.","Lúka has asked you to collect some twistbeard.\
\
Twistbeard can be found on rocks in Tharkh Shathur, to the south-east of Ashmargathâl.","You have collected all the twistbeard you could find.\
\
You should return to Ashmargathâl and give the twistbeard to Lúka.","You should let Lúka know that you have cleaned the scouts' wounds.","No Small Deed"}},
[9317]={nameES="No Survivors",objectivesES={}},
[9318]={nameES="¡Sin tiempo para recorridos!",objectivesES={"Habla con Cebadilla Mantecona dentro del Poney Pisador","Bree está amenazado desde muchas direcciones, y su gente necesita aventureros que arreglen las cosas.","Adso Henoloma se encuentra en su campamento en el camino al oeste de Bree, rumbo a Los Gamos.\
Celandine Brandigamo se encuentra en Los Gamos, al oeste de Bree y al otro lado del río desde la Comarca.\
El Vigilante Jefe Grimbriar se encuentra en una cabaña junto al camino al norte de Bree.","Habla con Celandine Brandigamo en Los Gamos, al oeste de Bree","Habla con el Vigilante Jefe Grimbriar en su cabaña junto al camino al norte de Bree","Habla con Adso Henoloma en su campamento en el camino al oeste de Bree","Habla con Cebadilla Mantecona dentro del Poney Pisador y averigua dónde se te necesita en las Tierras de Bree.","El Poney Pisador está ubicado en el lado norte de Bree, en lo alto de la colina sobre la cual se asienta la ciudad.\
\
Un guardia en la puerta de Bree te dijo que hablaras con Cebadilla Mantecona, propietario del Poney Pisador, si querías saber adónde podrías ir para ayudar a la gente de las Tierras de Bree.","El Poney Pisador está ubicado en el lado norte de Bree, en lo alto de la colina sobre la cual se asienta la ciudad."}},
[9319]={nameES="No Way Out",objectivesES={"Wood-trolls lurk all around you. The refugees could not defend against such creatures","Search west of the cave for a clear route","No Way Out","You should begin your search for a path out of the forest by scouting to the north, west, and east of the hidden cave in the Balewood.\
\
Húna has asked you to scout around the cave in hopes of finding a clear route for he and the other refugees of Byre Tor to escape the Balewood.","Search north of the cave for a clear route","Talk to Húna","You have encountered a glade of wandering Huorns. There is no safety here","The Orcs control the main pathway through Balewood. The refugees would not make it far this way","Húna can be found in the hidden cave in the southern reaches of the Balewood.\
\
You have discovered danger at every turn outside the cave and should now inform Húna that escape is unlikely, at least for the moment.","Húna and the other refugees are trapped within a cave in the Balewood, surrounded on all sides by terrible things, and wish to be free of the forest.","Search east of the cave for a clear route"}},
[9320]={nameES="No Word From Middlemead",objectivesES={"The road to Middlemead runs along the northern fork of the road west out of Entwade.\
\
Kenbert has asked that you patrol the road to Middlemead for the traders that often visited Entwade have not been seen in some time.","Thane Edric and his men have grown concerned about the Enemy's forces amassing outside Entwade and wish for you to investigate.","Patrol further along the road to Middlemead","Patrol the road to Middlemead","No Word From Middlemead","The road to Middlemead runs along the northern fork of the road west out of Entwade.\
\
You have found naught but a barren road. You should continue your patrol along the road to Middlemead.","You have discovered wrecked carts and ransacked goods littering the edges of the road","Uruks dart about atop dark horses, stealing goods from their recent kills","Kenbert can be found near the fork in the road outside the western end of Entwade. \
\
You have discovered the remains of traders as well as their destroyed carts and goods. You should return to Kenbert and inform him of this dire news.","The road here is barren, and nothing catches your eye","The road to Middlemead runs along the northern fork of the road west out of Entwade.\
\
You have discovered the remains of the traders' carts, but no sign of the traders. You should continue your patrol.","Talk to Kenbert"}},
[9321]={nameES="No Word from Minas Tirith",objectivesES={"Examine the fallen courier","The couriers of Minas Tirith are known to travel along the eastern road into Lossarnach.\
\
Lady Terenis has asked you to search for couriers of Minas Tirith and collect any letters they may bear.","The slain courier can be found off the side of the road to the south-east of Tumladen.\
\
You have discovered a fallen courier along the road into Lossarnach, and should search him for any letters he might yet bear.","No Word from Minas Tirith","Worried by the sudden lack of news from Minas Tirith, Lady Terenis fears for the safety of Steward Denethor and his people.","The letters can be found near the fallen courier in eastern Upper Lebennin.\
\
You have noticed a scattered trail of messages dropped by the courier as he fled the Haradrim. You should recover them.","Lady Terenis can be found in her hall in Tumladen.\
\
You have reclaimed the letters dropped by the slain courier, but it is unlikely that any more messages will arrive. You should return to Lady Terenis.","You see a fallen rider and horse in the distance...","Deliver the letters to Lady Terenis","The courier tried to escape the Haradrim, but was felled as he fled...","Search for the missing courier along the eastern road"}},
[9322]={nameES="Nobles hazañas",objectivesES={"Nobles hazañas","Todo tipo de problemas rodean la Posada Abandonada, y un alguacil retirado necesita ayuda para protegerla de las amenazas.","Los lobos se encuentran en el Paso de Moscagua. Los orcos merodean al norte, en las Colinas de los Vientos y el Paso de Moscagua. Los jabalíes vagan por Annunlos y las Colinas de los Vientos que rodean la Cima de los Vientos.\
\
Bram Hojafresno te pidió que ayudaras a proteger la Posada Abandonada eliminando la amenaza de lobos, orcos y jabalíes en la zona que rodea la posada.","Habla con Bram Hojafresno en la Posada Abandonada"}},
[9323]={nameES="Noises in the Dark",objectivesES={"DNT - Players will not see","Thane Edric has turned his attention to the defence of Entwade as he and his men rally against the threats that surround the town.","Talk to Womar","Womar can be found atop the raised landing inside the Mead Hall of Entwade.\
\
You have searched the privies and found peculiar things, including an Orc and a man who hid away to avoid travelling to Aldburg. You should return to Womar.","As the door creaks open, a snarling Orc bursts forth","Noises in the Dark","As you reach for the handle, a man steps forth from the privy","The privies can be found throughout Entwade.\
\
Womar has asked that you investigate queer noises coming from the privies in Entwade.","As you open the door, a chicken appears, clucks loudly, and skitters away"}},
[9324]={nameES="Vecinos ruidosos",objectivesES={"Lleva las patas de norbog a Hana la Joven","Los nerbyg se encuentran en Haragmar, al sur del Pantano Rojo, en un lugar llamado el Círculo de Sangre.\
\
Hana afirma que la mujer que su pueblo encontró en el pantano desea hacerle daño y utiliza a los nerbyg para llamarla y atraerla fuera de Ost Guruth. Hana te ha pedido que mates a estos insectos y le traigas sus patas para que sepa que ya no podrán llamarla.","Vecinos ruidosos","Desde que visitó Agamaur, el pantano al noreste de Ost Guruth, Hana la Joven tiene terribles pesadillas. Habló misteriosamente de una mujer en el pantano y del canto de los nerbyg."}},
[9325]={nameES="Noisome Vale",objectivesES={}},
[9326]={nameES="Noisome and Unrelenting",objectivesES={"Talk to Mithrandir at the Camp of the Host","Mithrandir can be found at the Camp of the Host on the border of the Wastes far to the north in North Ithilien.\
\
You have burned the noisome flowers outside Imlad Morgul, and you should now return to Mithrandir with news of your success.","The terrible flowers you and Mithrandir encountered in Imlad Morgul have sprung forth anew and now spread beyond the valley of the Dead City.","Noisome and Unrelenting","Noisome flowers can be found along the road into Imlad Morgul.\
\
Mithrandir has asked you to return to the border of Imlad Morgul and cull the noisome flowers that have begun to spread into Ithilien."}},
