[9766]={nameES="Prepare to Fall Back",objectivesES={"Prepare to Fall Back","The retreat has begun before the last trap has been constructed","Complete your work before the retreat begins","The Rohirrim are quickly losing ground behind the wall and must fall back to the interior of the Hornburg. The siege engineers have come forth to lay out some traps and important siege equipment to stall the enemy, while the soldiers make their defensive retreat.\
\
Merit Rating\
\
This quest starts with <rgb=#FFFF00>Partial</rgb> Merit Rating.\
\
<rgb=#00FF00>Major Merit Gain:</rgb>\
* Rohirrim constructs a barricade\
* Rohirrim constructs a range finder\
\
<rgb=#00FF00>Moderate Merit Gain:</rgb>\
* Rohirrim constructs a spike trap\
\
<rgb=#00FF00>Minor Merit Gain:</rgb>\
* Rohirrim constructs a jaw trap\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Major Merit Loss:</rgb>\
* Barricade destroyed\
* Range finder destroyed\
* Rohirrim engineer defeated\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Moderate Merit Loss:</rgb>\
* Placement banner destroyed","The Rohirrim siege engineers are working to place traps and target finders to help in the retreat back to the Hornburg. The engineers will place banners where they plan to construct an item, but will be vulnerable to attack while they work, and will not complete their work if their banners are destroyed."}},
[9767]={nameES="Prepared for the Worst",objectivesES={"Talk to Womar","The maps and papers can be found on a table near Síric.\
\
Síric has asked for you to review maps and notes from other settlements in Kingstead to better understand the situation before speaking with one of his men.","Talk to Síric","DNT -- Players will not see","Notes and a map of the Westemnet lay strewn about the table before you.\
\
The notes are primarily comprised of terse, unsent missives to Thane Mágla of Middlemead and Reeve Fastred of Snowbourn, but one in particular calls for able-bodied men to ride to Théoden King's side in the Westfold.\
\
The map is heavily marked with numerous forces being noted in central and eastern Kingstead, and it also depicts the path of Edric's people through south-eastern Kingstead into the Eastfold. The largest threats are marked to the west and north of Entwade and the road to the north-west has been marked as overrun.","Síric can be found inside the Mead Hall of Entwade, atop the raised landing.\
\
Thane Edric has sent you to speak with his guard-captain, Síric. He wishes for you to brief the captain on the threats you recently learned of and aid him in any way you are able.","Womar can be found near Síric on a raised landing inside the Mead Hall of Entwade.\
\
Having reviewed the notes and map on the table, you should now speak with Womar before returning to Síric.","Prepared for the Worst","Thane Edric can be found inside the Mead Hall of Entwade in eastern Kingstead.\
\
You have spoken with the guard-captain and one of his men and have been briefed on the happenings in the Westemnet. You should now speak with Thane Edric in the Mead Hall.","Síric can be found on the raised landing inside the Mead Hall of Entwade.\
\
You have reviewed the notes and map in the Mead Hall and spoken with Womar. You should now return to Síric to learn more of what is to be done.","Aided by your efforts, Thane Edric's people begin their journey to safety, and now the threats that dwell nearby must be handled.","Talk to Thane Edric","Examined the notes and map","Examine the notes and map of the Westemnet nearby"}},
