[9769]={nameES="Preparing for a Siege",objectivesES={}},
[9770]={nameES="Preparing for the Auction",objectivesES={}},
[9771]={nameES="Preparativos para la Oscuridad",objectivesES={"Habla con Frodo Bolsón en Rivendel","Habla con Gandalf en Rivendel","Bilbo Bolsón ha terminado su libro y quiere asegurarse de que sus recuerdos sobre los lugares y eventos importantes sean correctos.","Has hablado con Frodo Bolsón","Has hablado con Gandalf","Gandalf y Frodo están en la habitación de Bilbo, en el primer piso de la Última Morada, en Rivendel.\
\
Inseguro acerca de la tarea que te ha encomendado, Bilbo Bolsón quiere que hables con su sobrino, Frodo Bolsón, y con el mago Gandalf el Gris antes de emprender tu viaje.","Bilbo Bolsón se encuentra en el Salón del Fuego en la Última Morada de Rivendel.\
\
Gandalf y Frodo te advirtieron de los peligros que acechan en la caverna oscura. Debes regresar con Bilbo Bolsón y transmitirle sus opiniones.","Habla con Bilbo Bolsón","Preparativos para la Oscuridad"}},
[9772]={nameES="Preparing for the Departure",objectivesES={"Place barricades (0/5)","Thane Nothmar has asked you to place barricades around Gapholt.\
\
You will need to gather wood from around Gapholt with which to build the barricades.","Thane Nothmar has asked you to place barricades on the path leading up the cliff to Gapholt.\
\
With the wood you gathered, you should build the barricades on the south-west and eastern sides of town.","Fill Thane Nothmar's waterskin in the waterfall","Place barricades (3/5)","Placed barricades (4/5)","This is a good place to fill Nothmar's waterskin","Filled Thane Nothmar's waterskin in the waterfall","Take Nothmar's waterskin and fill it within the water fall near Gapholt.","Place barricades (2/5)","Thane Nothmar has asked you to place barricades near the bridge leading in to Gapholt.\
\
With the wood you gathered, you should build the barricades on the south-west and eastern sides of town.","Place barricades (1/5)","Speak with Nothmar","Placed barricades (3/5)","Placed barricades (5/5)","Place barricades (4/5)","Thane Nothmar is near the bridge leading into Gapholt.\
\
Return to Nothmar in Gapholt with the berries you collected.","Thane Nothmar is near the bridge leading into Gapholt.\
\
You should return to Thane Nothmar to see if he needs anything else done before departing for Woodhurst.","Placed barricades (1/5)","Placed barricades (2/5)","Thane Nothmar asked for berries that grow in the woods outside of town.\
\
Thane Nothmar asked for help gathering supplies for the men that will journey with him to aid Woodhurst.","Talk to Thane Nothmar","Thane Nothmar has agreed to aid Woodhurst, but first Gapholt needs to be better prepared to be defended by fewer men.","Thane Nothmar is near the bridge leading into Gapholt.\
\
You should return to Thane Nothmar with the supplies you helped gather for the journey to Woodhurst.","Preparing for the Departure"}},
[9773]={nameES="Preparándonos para el futuro",objectivesES={"Preparándonos para el futuro","Candaith te pide que busques entre el campamento orco de la Grieta Desolada cualquier cosa que pueda tener valor. Sugiere que podría ser algo que ayude a un grupo de personas con las que probablemente tratarás en el futuro.","Regresa las cajas dañadas a Candaith","La Grieta Desolada se encuentra al norte y al oeste del campamento de Candaith, en una separación cerca del pequeño arroyo que separa la Senda del Viento y las Colinas de los Vientos.\
\
Candaith te pidió que estuvieras atento a cualquier cosa que pudiera parecer valiosa en la zona de la Grieta Desolada y que se la devolvieras."}},
[9774]={nameES="Preparing for the Siege",objectivesES={"Bring the ore and wood you gathered to Goldwine at Eaworth","Adalmód asked you to aid the guards of Eaworth as they prepare for the coming Orc-siege.","Preparing for the Siege","Vale-ore can be found in the cliffs of the Vale, some distance north of Eaworth. Vale-branches can be gathered in the marshes just to the north and a little west of Eaworth.\
\
Goldwine has asked you to collect ore and wood to craft arms and armour with.","Goldwine is standing guard near the forge in Eaworth, south of the cliffs and marsh, in the Entwash Vale.\
\
You should bring the ore and branches you collected to Goldwine at once."}},
[9775]={nameES="Preparing for the Worst",objectivesES={"Grimmar is in the Mead Hall of Stoke.\
\
You should return to Grimmar and tell him that you have done all he asked.","Talk to Huthric","Talk to Captain Grimmar","There are places to post the conscription notices throughout Stoke.\
\
Grimmar wants you to post the conscription notices he gave you.","Spears, swords, shields, and armour can be collected from yards throughout Stoke.\
\
Captain Grimmar asked you to collect spears, shields, swords, and armour for the garrison.","Deliver the arms and armour to the armoury stockpile","The armoury stockpile is outside the Mead Hall of Stoke.\
\
Grimmar told you to bring the arms and armour to the armoury stockpile.","DNT -- Will not be seen","Huthric is outside the Mead Hall of Stoke.\
\
You should speak with Huthric and let him know that you have done as Captain Grimmar has asked.","Preparing for the Worst","War is afoot, and the town of Stoke is preparing for the inevitable siege."}},
[9776]={nameES="Preparing the Charge",objectivesES={"The time has come to prepare for the final charge out of the Glittering Caves. Dismantle the barricades and traps and clear the camps that the enemy has set up along the cave leading back out to the Deeping-coomb.\
\
Merit Rating\
\
This quest starts with <rgb=#FFFF00>empty</rgb> Merit Rating\
\
<rgb=#00FF00>Moderate Merit Gain:</rgb>\
- Barricade destroyed\
- Burning Debris Pile extinguished\
\
<rgb=#00FF00>Minor Merit Gain:</rgb>\
- Trap disarmed","<rgb=#FF0000>Before they gather for another assault</rgb>","Dismantle barricades, disable traps, and defeat the Uruk bosses set up on the path to the exit from the Glittering Caves","Preparing the Charge","<rgb=#FF0000>The Uruks have gathered their forces</rgb>"}},
[9777]={nameES="Preparing the Charge",objectivesES={"The time has come to prepare for the final charge out of the Glittering Caves. Dismantle the barricades and traps and clear the camps that the enemy has set up along the cave leading back out to the Deeping-coomb.\
\
Merit Rating\
\
This quest starts with <rgb=#FFFF00>empty</rgb> Merit Rating\
\
<rgb=#00FF00>Moderate Merit Gain:</rgb>\
- Burning Debris Pile extinguished\
- Barricade destroyed\
\
<rgb=#00FF00>Minor Merit Gain:</rgb>\
- Trap disarmed","<rgb=#FF0000>Before they gather for another assault</rgb>","Dismantle barricades, disable traps, and defeat the Uruk bosses set up on the path to the exit from the Glittering Caves","Preparing the Charge","<rgb=#FF0000>The Uruks have gathered their forces</rgb>"}},
[9778]={nameES="Preparing the Way",objectivesES={"Talk to Irodon","Haradrim woodworkers and their bridge-rafts can be found along the banks of the Erui in eastern Upper Lebennin.\
\
Irodon has asked you to cripple the efforts of the Haradrim to expand the Crossings of Erui.","Fearing a renewed Haradrim force in Lebennin and Lossarnach, Irodon hopes to put an end to the Haradrim's efforts to expand the Crossings of Erui.","Irodon can be found in Halach in south-eastern Upper Lebennin.\
\
You have defeated many of the Haradrim woodworkers and burned their bridge-rafts.","Preparing the Way"}},
[9779]={nameES="Preparing to Move",objectivesES={"Anborn has asked for help filling water-skins in Haerondir.\
\
Use the full bucket to fill water-skins.","Anborn can be found in Haerondir.\
\
You should speak with Anborn.","Preparing to Move","Anborn has asked for help filling water-skins in Haerondir.\
\
First, find an empty bucket to fill with water.","Anborn has asked for help packing up Haerondir supplies for the march.\
\
You should collect weapons from weapon racks and collect armour from barrels.","Return to Anborn","Anborn has asked for help filling water-skins in Haerondir.\
\
Fill the empty bucket with water at the Haerondir water source.","Anborn requires your help gathering what supplies remain in Haerondir to aid the Host of the West's march to the Black Gate."}},
[9780]={nameES="Preséntate al jefe",objectivesES={"Preséntate al jefe","El asiento de gobierno de Crannog está en Aughaire, al oeste de la isla central del asentamiento.\
\
Un guerrero de los Trév Gállorg te ha dicho que te presentes ante Crannog para que te encargue un Fém, un deber tribal respetado.","Un guerrero de los Trév Gállorg explicó la necesidad de demostrar tu valía a su tribu."}},
[9781]={nameES="Preserved for the Journey",objectivesES={"Golodir nods at the basket and beckons to you","Throw the wood on the fire","Idele is in Tûr Morva, south-east of the orchard.\
\
Idele is waiting for some of the apple-wood branches that Golodir collected from the orchard.","The fire Idele is using to smoke the meat for the journey south is by her in the middle of Tûr Morva.\
\
Idele has given you some wood to throw on the nearby fire.","Idele is in Tûr Morva.\
\
You have helped to smoke some of the meats for the journey of the Falcon south and should speak to the fire-tender, Idele.","Talk to Golodir in Tûr Morva","A basket of apples near Golodir in the orchard of Tûr Morva is ready for carrying to Idele.\
\
Idele has asked you to bring a basket of apples to her from the orchard of Tûr Morva.","Idele accepts the basket of apples with a smile","Preserved for the Journey","Golodir is in the orchard of Tûr Morva.\
\
You have brought back an empty basket to the orchard and should now speak with Golodir.","Talk to Golodir at Tûr Morva","Pick up an empty basket near Idele in Tûr Morva","Idele is in Tûr Morva.\
\
You have brought an armful of apple-wood to Idele, and she wants to speak with you.","Idele is in Tûr Morva.\
\
You have brought a basket of apples to Idele in Tûr Morva and should now speak with her.","Talk to Idele at Tûr Morva","The orchards of Tûr Morva are to the north-west.\
\
Idele has asked you to bring a basket of apples to her from the orchards where several of the Rangers are picking fruit.","Pick up a basket of apples near Golodir in the orchard","Idele is charged with collecting food and smoking meats for when the Falcon-clan must go to war.","Talk to Idele in Tûr Morva","Pick up an armful of wood from the orchard","There are empty baskets near Idele in Tûr Morva.\
\
Idele has asked you to pick up an empty basket and carry it back to Golodir in the orchard north-west of Tûr Morva.","Idele smiles as you arrive with the armful of wood"}},
[9782]={nameES="Preservando relatos antiguos",objectivesES={"Borgar se encuentra en Jazârgund, a lo largo del camino al este de Tharâkh Bazân.\
\
Búkk te ha pedido que lleves el relato de la batalla antigua a Borgar en Jazârgund, para que la historia pueda ser preservada para las generaciones futuras.","Habla con Borgar en Jazârgund","Búkk espera tu regreso en Tharâkh Bazân, aguardando cualquier noticia de las batallas de la antigua tradición.\
\
Arnod te ha pedido que lleves los relatos a Búkk, para que pueda conocer las conclusiones de las antiguas historias.","Arnod ha estudiado los textos antiguos de Khazad-dûm y desea que entregues la historia a otros.","Preservando relatos antiguos","Habla con Búkk en Tharâkh Bazân"}},
[9783]={nameES="Preservar los puentes",objectivesES={"Lleva los escombros a Ulfied en el Cruce de las Cenizas","Se pueden encontrar escombros en la zona bajo el Cruce de las Cenizas, bajo los enormes puentes que se elevan sobre la zona.\
\
Deberían recogerse escombros de piedra para las reparaciones de los cimientos de las Profundidades Llameantes.","Los puentes de las Profundidades Llameantes necesitan ser reparados. Los enanos están encontrando escasez de fuentes cercanas de piedra para completar este trabajo.","Preservar los puentes","Ulfied está en el Cruce de las Cenizas, en la parte occidental de las Profundidades Llameantes.\
\
Deberías entregarle los escombros que has recogido.","Los puentes de las Profundidades Llameantes necesitan ser reparados. Los enanos están encontrando escasez de fuentes cercanas de piedra para completar este trabajo.\
\
Debería haber abundantes escombros en la zona bajo el Cruce de las Cenizas, bajo los enormes puentes que se alzan sobre la zona."}},
[9784]={nameES="Pressed from All Sides",objectivesES={"Langfrith, of the Elfward, has scouted a tribe of Orcs rallying within the mountain passes to the east and worries that Faldham will be surrounded when the anticipated siege begins.","Langfrith prepares outside the mead hall of Faldham, west of the mountain pass.\
\
Langfrith is expecting news of your infiltration of the Orc camp.","Pressed from All Sides","The Orc tribe has been scouted along the south-east pass leading into the mountains.\
\
Langfrith has asked you to drive back the Orcs encroaching on the lands south-east of Faldham.","Speak to Langfrith about the Nink-hai Orcs"}},
[9785]={nameES="Pressed into Service",objectivesES={}},
[9786]={nameES="Pressing Onward",objectivesES={"There are only unremarkable Orc-tools in this crate","Talk to the bound Rohirrim","There is a crate near Frithstan in the western Orc-encampment.\
\
Frithstan would you like to search the nearby crate for a set of keys.","Search the crate near Frithstan","Search the Orc-camp for evidence of the lost warriors","Frithstan is bound to a pole among the Orc-tribe in the western Wailing Hills.\
\
Speaking with Frithstan may reveal the fate of the missing Rohirrim.","You have found a set of rusty iron keys. You should show them to Frithstan","Penda fears for the fate of his missing allies. He now believes that they have battled into the territory of the Orcs who dwell in the mountain-caves.","Pressing Onward","The Orcs dwell near the mountains to the north-west of Penda's camp.\
\
Penda has requested a search for evidence of his campmate's presence among the tents and crates of the Orc-tribe.","Frithstan remains bound in the western Orc-encampment in the Wailing Hills.\
\
You have found the keys that he has asked you to look for.","You have encountered a warrior who has been taken captive","Talk to Frithstan and release him from his shackles"}},
[9787]={nameES="¡Juerguistas Sedientos!",objectivesES={"El vino de primavera siempre es apreciado","El vino de primavera es muy apreciado","Arn Juncoso teme que los juerguistas del Festival de Primavera estén sedientos y no disfruten realmente de las actividades a menos que sus bebidas sean reabastecidas.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro cuando finalice el evento asociado.</rgb>","Recoge vino para la mesa del sureste","Recoge vino para la mesa del suroeste","Recoge vino para la mesa del noreste","Jarras de vino de primavera pueden encontrarse en las mesas centrales del Recinto del Festival.\
\
Arn Juncoso te pidió que llevaras jarras de vino a las mesas ubicadas en los bordes del Recinto.","Arn Juncoso espera escuchar si tus entregas de vino llevaron alivio a los juerguistas sedientos.","Jarras de vino de primavera pueden encontrarse en las mesas del centro del Recinto del Festival.\
\
Arn Juncoso te pidió que llevaras jarras de vino a las mesas ubicadas en los bordes del Recinto.","Habla con Arn Juncoso en el Recinto del Festival"}},
[9788]={nameES="Previniendo un asesinato",objectivesES={"Previniendo un asesinato","El laberinto de trigo de Wistmead se encuentra en el espacio del Festival de la Cosecha de Wistmead.\
\
Ermentrude Henoloma te ha pedido que ahuyentes a los cuervos exasperantes.","Ermentrude Henoloma, la maestra del laberinto de Wistmead, te ha pedido que ahuyentes a los corbeaux exasperantes dentro de las paredes de trigo.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando termine el evento con el que está asociada.</rgb>","El laberinto de trigo de Wistmead se encuentra en el espacio del Festival de la Cosecha de Wistmead.\
\
Deberías hablar con Ermentrude Henoloma en la entrada del laberinto de trigo.","Habla con Ermentrude Henoloma"}},
[9789]={nameES="Presa y depredador",objectivesES={"Brogdagnir está en Tinnudir, al oeste de Tham Nambarth.\
\
Brogdagnir estará complacido de oír que las ruinas que pertenecen a su familia están ahora vacías.","Los alces han invadido Tham Nambarth y pronto atraerán a depredadores más grandes.","Tham Nambarth está al este de Tinnudir.\
\
nBrogdagnir te ha pedido que te aventures en Tham Nambarth y ahuyentes a los alces que habitan allí.","Presa y depredador"}},
[9790]={nameES="Presas en la oscuridad",objectivesES={"Agatha Valleverde se encuentra cerca del Pabellón de Caza de Bree, al final del Callejón Embrujado en Bree.\
\
Debes regresar con Agatha Valleverde con noticias de tu éxito.","Agatha Valleverde habló de varias criaturas malignas que acechan los túmulos de Haudh Iarchith, Gwantham, Goetham y Haudh Nogbenn.","Haudh Iarchith, Gwantham, Goetham y Haudh Nogbenn están ubicados en las Quebradas de los Túmulos del sur.\
\
Agatha Valleverde te pidió que buscaras a una de estas tres criaturas —Brishzel el barghest, el espíritu maligno Faegfaer o Fergandir el hombre demacrado— y le dieras descanso.","Brishzel Derrotado","Fergandir Derrotado","Derrota a Brishzel, Faegfaer o Fergandir en Haudh Iarchith.","Habla con Agatha Valleverde en Bree.","Faegfaer Derrotado","Presas en la oscuridad"}},
[9791]={nameES="Pride for the Riders",objectivesES={}},
[9792]={nameES="Principled Interest",objectivesES={"Collect from Râhal scoundrel","You have managed to collect debts from some of the Corsairs in the Gut. This should help Zadok make a respectable getaway.","Zadok has asked you to help him collect on a few debts so that he can at least have enough to return to Gondor.\
\
Zadok's clients can be found wandering around Black Anchor, and the Baths.","Principled Interest","Zadok hoped to turn money lending into a profitable venture in a new city. Umbar, it seems, was not that city.","Collect from Râhal lazy-body","Talk to Zadok","Collect from Râhal drunkard"}},
[9793]={nameES="Principled Interest Part 2",objectivesES={"Zadok has re-organized his business efforts in Umbar. Perhaps he can make it work after all.","Confront the successful proprietor","Zadok has asked you to help him collect a debt from a respectable proprietor in the Gut.","You have bested the successful proprietor. You are free to collect his treasures.","Principled Interest Part 2","Talk to Zadok","Recoge el cofre del tesoro","You have the money that was promised to Zadok. You should return it to him."}},
[9794]={nameES="Prisca está inquieta",objectivesES={"Habla con Camelia en la calle Aguamiel y completa 'Escondiendo las pruebas'","Prisa Boffin está dentro del nº 8 de la calle Aguamiel, y te ha pedido que hables con ella. Oh-oh.","Prisca Boffin te ha pedido que colabores con Dinodas y Camelia para reparar el daño que se ha hecho a la fiesta de inauguración de la casa de Angélica.","Prisca Boffin está dentro del nº 8 de la calle Aguamiel, esperando escuchar que has reparado el daño hecho a la fiesta de inauguración de la casa de Angélica.","Prisca Boffin, matriarca del clan Boffin, no está contenta con que la fiesta de inauguración de la casa de su hija haya sido arruinada... ¡y te hace responsable de ello!","Prisca está inquieta","Habla con Dinodas en la calle Aguamiel y completa 'Boffins sueltos'","Habla con Prisca Boffin dentro del nº 8 de la calle Aguamiel"}},
[9795]={nameES="Prisoner of the Zhélruka",objectivesES={"Skálo and the Dourhand prisoner can be found at Grúmachath in Câr Bronach.\
\
After capturing a Dourhand warrior, Mézto hopes to undermine the Iron Crown. You should find Skálo and the Dourhand prisoner at Grúmachath.","Aid Rethvárd with 'Best-laid Plans: Skáilag'","Prisoner of the Zhélruka","Skálo can be found at Grúmachath.\
\
After returning from the tasks Rethvárd set for you, you have found Skálo wounded and Rethvárd is nowhere to be found. You should talk to Skálo.","A wounded Skálo lays beside a now-barren post. Rethvárd has escaped!","Aid Rethvárd with 'Best-laid Plans: Toll Oivas'","Talk to Skálo at Grúmachath","Your efforts have done much to hinder the Iron Crown's presence at Toll Oivas!","Find Skálo and the Dourhand prisoner at Grúmachath","After capturing a Dourhand, the Zhélruka at Grúmachath seek to undermine the Iron Crown in Câr Bronach.","Rethvárd can be found at Grúmachath.\
\
You have aided Rethvárd and hindered the Iron Crown in their efforts to raise the Dead of Câr Bronach. You should return to Rethvárd at Grúmachath.","As Skálo looks on, the Dourhand warrior strains against his shackles","Skálo can be found at Grúmachath.\
\
You have found Skálo and the Dourhand prisoner at Grúmachath. You should talk to Skálo.","Talk to Rethvárd at Grúmachath","Rethvárd can be found at Grúmachath.\
\
After finding little success questioning his prisoner, Skálo has invited you to speak to Rethvárd. You should talk to Rethvárd.","Your efforts have done much to hinder the Iron Crown's presence at Skáilag!","Rethvárd can be found at Grúmachath.\
\
In exchange for your aid in revealing the treachery of Angmar to the Dourhands, Rethvárd has offered you information about the Iron Crown. You should talk to Rethvárd and aid him with his tasks."}},
[9796]={nameES="Prisoners in Silk",objectivesES={"Prisoners in Silk","Return to Numûru in Ingar-garâsh with news of your victory.","Find the entrance to the caves of Jâr Obadal. Jâr Obadal can be found south-west of Ingar-garâsh.","Numûru has requested your aid in rescuing Subuzûri taken by the spiders at the nearby cave of Jâr Obadal.","Find the entrance to the caves of Jâr Obadal","Return to Numûru in Ingar-garâsh","Defeat spiders and search for missing Subuzûri warriors in Jâr Obadal."}},
[9797]={nameES="Prisoners of Olghakhósh",objectivesES={}},
[9798]={nameES="Prisoners of War",objectivesES={"The Haradrim prisoners can be found at Aelin Veren, in North Ithilien.\
\
Maendal has asked you to question the Haradrim prisoners and learn the reason for their surrender.","Prisoners of War","Talk to Maendal","Maendal can be found at Aelin Veren, in North Ithilien.\
\
You have spoken to the prisoners and while not all of them cooperated, you feel that some measure of understanding has been reached for the moment. You should speak to Maendal.","Never before known to yield in battle, a party of Haradrim have surrendered to the Rangers of Ithilien for reasons that remain unclear."}},
[9799]={nameES="Prisoners of the Dark Lord",objectivesES={"Free imprisoned Stout-axes from the dungeons of Barad-dûr (0/8)","After seventy-eight long years, you have freed the Stout-axes from their imprisonment in the dungeons of Barad-dûr.\
\
Although their kingdom of old has long laid in ruin, freedom may soon be won for all the Stout-axes of Mordor.\
\
You have allowed them to share in this hope and to reunite with their kin in Mordor.","When King Váskmun Greytooth was imprisoned by the Dark Lord, many of his most-trusted kin were brought to the dungeons of Barad-dûr as well.","Imprisoned Stout-axes can be found throughout the dungeons of Barad-dûr.\
\
In your search for King Váskmun Greytooth, you have found other Stout-axes imprisoned in Barad-dûr. You should free them.","Completado","While searching the ruins of Barad-dûr for King Váskmun Greytooth, you have spied several exhausted and plainly-clad Stout-axes held in the smaller cells of the dungeon.\
\
These must be the other Stout-axes that were taken when Sauron imprisoned King Greytooth seventy-eight years ago.\
\
You should free them from the dungeons of Barad-dûr and allow them to reunite with their kin in Lûghash.","Prisoners of the Dark Lord","You have freed all the Stout-axes from the dungeons of Barad-dûr."}},
[9800]={nameES="Prisoners of the Eye",objectivesES={"Mincham can be found at Tham Durlan, to the south of Ondoher's Folly in Dagorlad.\
\
You have freed as many of the captives as you were able, and you should now return to Mincham at Tham Durlan.","If not freed from the clutches of the Enemy, a cruel fate awaits those fallen captive to the Orcs of Mordor in Dagorlad.","Prisoners of the Eye","Talk to Mincham at Tham Durlan","Tortured captives can be found throughout Ondoher's Folly in north-western Dagorlad.\
\
Mincham has asked you to aid in freeing the Enemy's captives while you assault the hill of Ondoher's Folly."}},
[9801]={nameES="Prisoners of the Vale",objectivesES={"Prisoners of the Vale","Talk to Melril","Melril of Sardol fears for all in the vale who have gone into Tarlang's Crown, and worries that the Corsairs have begun to take prisoners.","DNT -- will not be seen","Prisoners from Blackroot Vale can likely be found near the northern end of Tarlang's Crown.\
\
Melril has asked you to search for prisoners in Tarlang's Crown after finding that more people have gone missing from Blackroot Vale.","Melril can be found at the northern end of Tarlang's Crown in Blackroot Vale.\
\
You searched for prisoners in Tarlang's Crown, but only discovered the remains of people of Gondor scattered about their camps. You should speak to Melril."}},
[9802]={nameES="Instancia Privada: Mente Bien Ordenada",objectivesES={"Dorset Roblealto te ha guiado hacia la cueva que alguna vez fue la biblioteca de su padre.","Encuentra la estantería que contiene el libro que Dorset Roblealto está buscando antes de que lleguen los campeones trasgos.","Dorset Roblealto está en la entrada de la cueva.\
\
Dorset está esperando que regreses con el libro que te pidió.","Instancia Privada: Mente Bien Ordenada","Esta cueva fue una vez la biblioteca del gran Benton Roblealto, y su sala principal está llena de estanterías.\
\
Dorset Roblealto está esperando que encuentres la estantería que contiene \\qSobre la Resistencia de los Animales en la Naturaleza\\q."}},
[9803]={nameES="Problematic Pests",objectivesES={"Problematic Pests","Assuming you came to her orchard looking for work, Meliri has tasked you with defeating the scather-flies in her orange groves.","Talk to Meliri","You have defeated scather-flies scattered throughout the orange groves of Burukíri in Ambarûl. You should return to Meliri.","You have been asked to defeat scather-flies scattered throughout the orange groves of Burukíri in Ambarûl."}},
[9804]={nameES="Pérdidas profundas",objectivesES={"Los huevos de araña se encuentran entre sus nidos en Amon Ros, al oeste de Ost Guruth.\
\
Tras contarte la pérdida de su esposa e hijo a manos de las arañas de Amon Ros, Tortwil te pidió que volvieras al valle y destruyeras cualquier saco de huevos que pudieras encontrar.","Tortwil espera tu regreso en Ost Guruth, al este de Amon Ros.\
\
Encontraste los sacos de huevos en las sombras de Amon Ros y los destruiste, tal como pidió Tortwil. Debes regresar a Ost Guruth con la noticia de tu éxito.","Desde mucho antes de que los orcos y los muertos se arrastraran hacia las Tierras Solitarias, los Eglain han tenido que lidiar con la amenaza de las arañas que habitan en las ruinas a lo largo del solitario tramo de Eriador. Ahora, a medida que las arañas son expulsadas de las profundidades de sus hogares en ruinas, se acercan cada vez más a Ost Guruth y amenazan a los Eglain que viven allí.","Pérdidas profundas"}},
[9805]={nameES="Prólogo, Capítulo 1: Algo Diferente",objectivesES={"Meneldir está junto a la puerta este de Musgovilla, junto al cuerpo de Madthrug.\
\
Tras tratar las heridas de algunos residentes de Musgovilla que resultaron heridos durante el ataque, debes regresar con Meneldir y ver qué ha averiguado.","Habla con Tegwyn en el Círculo de Derrota fuera de Musgovilla.","Encuentra el Círculo de Derrota situado al norte de Musgovilla.","Una multitud de niños se reúne alrededor de Tegwyn y la cruel hoja que ha encontrado.","Skardí asiente cuando entras en su tienda.","Tegwyn está dentro de la herrería en Musgovilla.","Recupera el pequeño objeto que Madthrug sostiene en su mano.","Prólogo, Capítulo 1: Algo Diferente","Los residentes heridos de Musgovilla se encuentran tendidos en el suelo cerca de aquí.\
\
Meneldir te dio un suministro de ungüentos y vendas con los que puedes tratar las heridas de los residentes heridos de Musgovilla.","El Círculo de Derrota más cercano está al norte de Musgovilla.\
\
Has aceptado (a regañadientes) enseñar a Tegwyn algunas lecciones básicas de aventura, y... ¿qué mejor lugar para empezar que el Círculo de Derrota local?","Habla con Meneldir junto al cuerpo de Madthrug.","Escuchas los gritos y exclamaciones emocionadas de los niños al noroeste.","Tegwyn observa el Círculo de Derrota. '¿Qué es esto?', te pregunta.","Una ruidosa multitud de niños se ha reunido al noroeste en Musgovilla. ¿Qué los tiene tan emocionados?","Este muñeco de entrenamiento ha visto su buena parte de batallas.","Un muñeco de entrenamiento situado justo fuera de la herrería en Musgovilla satisfará el entusiasmo de Tegwyn por el combate.","Entra en la herrería de Musgovilla y enseña a Tegwyn su utilidad.","Arrancas un trozo de pergamino del agarre mortal del Uruk.","Tegwyn está junto al Círculo de Derrota fuera de Musgovilla.","Madthrug, el líder de la partida Uruk, podría tener alguna pista sobre su propósito al atacar Musgovilla.","La herrería está en Musgovilla y es un lugar importante para los aventureros que buscan comprar nuevo equipo o reparar el viejo.","La gente de Musgovilla necesita tu ayuda para recuperarse de los daños causados por el reciente ataque Uruk contra su aldea.","Lee el trozo de pergamino que tomaste del cuerpo de Madthrug.","Habla con Tegwyn dentro de la herrería en Musgovilla.","Meneldir espera que le muestres el trozo de pergamino que recuperaste del cuerpo de Madthrug.","Tomaste un pequeño trozo de pergamino del cuerpo de Madthrug. ¿Qué secretos guarda?","Habla con Tegwyn","Tegwyn sonríe con picardía. 'Bueno, ¿vas a enseñarme o no?', te pregunta.","Parece que Tegwyn se ha llevado la cruel hoja que una vez blandió Madthrug.\
\
Tegwyn podría lastimarse a sí mismo o a alguien más si no logras quitarle el arma.","Tegwyn está junto al muñeco de entrenamiento en Musgovilla, ansioso por aprender más sobre aventura y combate.","Entrega el trozo de pergamino a Meneldir","Encuentra el muñeco de entrenamiento situado fuera de la herrería en Musgovilla.","Investiga qué ha emocionado tanto a los niños al noroeste, en Musgovilla.","Habla con Tegwyn en el muñeco de entrenamiento en Musgovilla"}},
[9806]={nameES="Prólogo, Capítulo 2: Habilidades de un Aventurero",objectivesES={"Tegwyn aceptó entregar la espada Uruk si logras impresionarlo con una demostración de tu habilidad en combate.","Tegwyn espera que demuestres tu habilidad en combate usando <rgb=#00ff00>Golpes Feroces</rgb> en el muñeco de entrenamiento.","Lleva la espada Uruk a Meneldir junto a la puerta este de Musgovilla.","Has demostrado cómo desatar la <rgb=#ffff00>Furia</rgb> de un Campeón usando la habilidad <rgb=#00ff00>Golpes Feroces</rgb>. ¿Te entregará Tegwyn la espada del Uruk, como acordó?","Prólogo, Capítulo 2: Habilidades de un Aventurero","Has usado <rgb=#00ff00>Ataque salvaje</rgb> en el muñeco de entrenamiento","Habla con Tegwyn junto al muñeco de entrenamiento.","Usa <rgb=#00ff00>Golpe Implacable</rgb>, <rgb=#00ff00>Defensa Súbita</rgb> o <rgb=#00ff00>Tormenta de Espadas</rgb> en el muñeco de entrenamiento.","Tegwyn te entrega a regañadientes la espada del Uruk.","Has demostrado un ataque básico de Campeón a Tegwyn. ¿Te entregará la espada del Uruk, como acordó?","Meneldir está junto a la puerta este de Musgovilla.\
\
Ahora que has recuperado la espada Uruk, debes llevarla a Meneldir.","Has usado <rgb=#00ff00>Golpe Implacable</rgb>, <rgb=#00ff00>Defensa Súbita</rgb> o <rgb=#00ff00>Tormenta de Espadas</rgb> en el muñeco de entrenamiento","Usa <rgb=#00ff00>Ataque salvaje</rgb> en el muñeco de entrenamiento.","Tegwyn espera que demuestres tu habilidad en combate usando <rgb=#00ff00>Ataque salvaje</rgb> en el muñeco de entrenamiento."}},
[9807]={nameES="Prólogo, Capítulo 2: Habilidades de un Aventurero",objectivesES={"Tegwyn aceptó entregar la espada Uruk si logras impresionarlo con una demostración de tu habilidad en combate.","Lleva la espada Uruk a Meneldir junto a la puerta este de Musgovilla.","Prólogo, Capítulo 2: Habilidades de un Aventurero","Habla con Tegwyn junto al muñeco de entrenamiento.","Tegwyn espera que demuestres <rgb=#00ff00>Puño Demoledor</rgb> o <rgb=#00ff00>Ven por Mí</rgb> en el muñeco de entrenamiento.","Tegwyn espera que demuestres tu habilidad en combate usando <rgb=#00ff00>Golpe Descendente</rgb> en el muñeco de entrenamiento.","Has cumplido tu parte del trato. ¿Te entregará Tegwyn la espada del Uruk, como acordó?","Has demostrado un ataque que genera <rgb=#ffff00>Temple</rgb> a Tegwyn. ¿Te entregará la espada del Uruk, como acordó?","Tegwyn te entrega a regañadientes la espada del Uruk.","Meneldir está junto a la puerta este de Musgovilla.\
\
Ahora que has recuperado la espada Uruk, debes llevarla a Meneldir.","Has demostrado un ataque que consume <rgb=#ffff00>Temple</rgb> en el muñeco de entrenamiento. ¿Te entregará Tegwyn la espada del Uruk, como acordó?"}},
[9808]={nameES="Prólogo, Capítulo 2: Habilidades de un Aventurero",objectivesES={"Has usado <rgb=#00ff00>Lamento de la sombra</rgb>, <rgb=#00ff00>Golpe Valeroso</rgb> o <rgb=#00ff00>Rugido de Elendil</rgb> en el muñeco de entrenamiento.","Has demostrado el <rgb=#00ff00>Grito de Batalla</rgb> del Capitán a Tegwyn. ¿Te entregará la espada del Uruk, como acordó?","Tegwyn aceptó entregar la espada Uruk si logras impresionarlo con una demostración de tu habilidad en combate.","Tegwyn espera que demuestres tu habilidad en combate usando <rgb=#00ff00>Grito de Batalla</rgb> en el muñeco de entrenamiento.","Lleva la espada Uruk a Meneldir junto a la puerta este de Musgovilla.","Prólogo, Capítulo 2: Habilidades de un Aventurero","Has usado <rgb=#00ff00>Grito de Batalla</rgb> en el muñeco de entrenamiento.","Tegwyn espera que demuestres tu habilidad en combate usando <rgb=#00ff00>Golpe Devastador</rgb> en el muñeco de entrenamiento.","Habla con Tegwyn junto al muñeco de entrenamiento.","Has cumplido tu parte del trato. ¿Te entregará Tegwyn la espada del Uruk, como acordó?","Has demostrado cómo seguir <rgb=#00ff00>Grito de Batalla</rgb> con un ataque poderoso como <rgb=#00ff00>Golpe Devastador</rgb>. ¿Te entregará Tegwyn la espada del Uruk, como acordó?","Usa <rgb=#00ff00>Grito de Batalla</rgb> en el muñeco de entrenamiento.","Tegwyn te entrega a regañadientes la espada del Uruk.","Meneldir está junto a la puerta este de Musgovilla.\
\
Ahora que has recuperado la espada Uruk, debes llevarla a Meneldir.","Usa <rgb=#00ff00>Lamento de la sombra</rgb>, <rgb=#00ff00>Golpe Valeroso</rgb> o <rgb=#00ff00>Rugido de Elendil</rgb> en el muñeco de entrenamiento."}},
[9809]={nameES="Prólogo, Capítulo 2: Habilidades de un Aventurero",objectivesES={"Tegwyn aceptó entregar la espada Uruk si logras impresionarlo con una demostración de tu habilidad en combate.","Tegwyn espera que demuestres tu habilidad en combate usando <rgb=#00ff00>Escarnio ígneo</rgb> en el muñeco de entrenamiento.","Lleva la espada Uruk a Meneldir junto a la puerta este de Musgovilla.","Has usado <rgb=#00ff00>Ira latente</rgb>, <rgb=#00ff00>Rayo Sustentador</rgb> o <rgb=#00ff00>Escrito de salud</rgb> en el muñeco de entrenamiento.","Prólogo, Capítulo 2: Habilidades de un Aventurero","Usa <rgb=#00ff00>Ira latente</rgb>, <rgb=#00ff00>Rayo Sustentador</rgb> o <rgb=#00ff00>Escrito de salud</rgb> en el muñeco de entrenamiento.","Habla con Tegwyn junto al muñeco de entrenamiento.","Has cumplido tu parte del trato. ¿Te entregará Tegwyn la espada del Uruk, como acordó?","Has usado <rgb=#00ff00>Palabras atronadoras</rgb> en el muñeco de entrenamiento.","Tegwyn te entrega a regañadientes la espada del Uruk.","Has demostrado la habilidad <rgb=#00ff00>Escarnio ígneo</rgb> a Tegwyn. ¿Te entregará la espada del Uruk, como acordó?","Tegwyn espera que demuestres <rgb=#00ff00>Palabras atronadoras</rgb> en el muñeco de entrenamiento.","Usa <rgb=#00ff00>Palabras atronadoras</rgb> en el muñeco de entrenamiento.","Meneldir está junto a la puerta este de Musgovilla.\
