[9997]={nameES="Racing to Agoroth",objectivesES={"Arvedui has shown you and Lothrandir the hidden entrance to Agoroth in Jä-reitti.\
\
You should talk to Lothrandir.","A powerful artifact awaits in the hidden fortress of Agoroth. You must reach it before the Witch-king's forces.","Surprisingly, Lothrandir has compelled Arvedui to accompany him to the Lossoth village. Lothrandir seems to be telling Arvedui a story, and has not noticed you approach.\
\
You should listen in on their conversation.","Lothrandir and Arvedui are outside Sûri-kylä.\
\
You should listen to their conversation in 'Instance: The Power of Oaths.'","Racing to Agoroth","Complete 'Instance: The Power of Oaths'","You approach and listen in on Lothrandir and Arvedui's conversation.","Salavahti can be found on the rise above Sûri-kylä.\
\
You should talk to Salavahti.","Salavahti gives you the key of Agoroth","Habla con Yrjänä","The Lossoth chieftain Yrjänä can be found in the Great Lodge of Sûri-kylä.\
\
You should ask Yrjänä if the Lossoth would be willing to trade for the key of Agoroth.","<rgb=#FF0000>Agree</rgb> to Yrjänä's terms","Yrjänä has asked you to promise to find a way to destroy the Oath-stone in exchange for the key of Agoroth.\
\
If you accept these terms, let Yrjänä know that you <rgb=#FF0000>agree</rgb>.","Talk to Salavahti","Salavahti has informed you that Lothrandir has returned to Sûri-kylä to meet you.\
\
You should talk to Lothrandir.","You agree to Yrjänä's terms in exchange for the key","Talk to Yrjänä in the Great Lodge of Sûri-kylä","You have agreed to destroy the Oath-stone in exchange for the key of Agoroth.\
\
You should talk to Yrjänä in Sûri-kylä.","Talk to Lothrandir in Jä-reitti","Talk to Lothrandir outside Sûri-kylä"}},
[9998]={nameES="Rage of the Erui",objectivesES={"Rage of the Erui","Talk to Lady Terenis in Tumladen","Deliver Castamir's armour to Angbor near the Crossings of Erui","Talk to Roamingstar, Maiden of Gilrain","Lady Terenis can be found in the Great Hall of Tumladen.\
\
You have delivered Castamir's armour to Angbor, and should now speak to Lady Terenis.","Angbor can be found on a hill to the west of the Crossings of Erui.\
\
You have aided Roamingstar and her Sisters in calming the Lone Lady's rage, and have also recovered pieces of Castamir's armour. You should bring the armour to Angbor near the Crossings of Erui.","The Sisters of Lebennin seek to calm their Sister's fury before it consumes both the Enemy and the people of Gondor alike.","Roamingstar can be found in her glade in north-eastern Dor-en-Ernil.\
\
Roamingstar has rallied her Sisters and is now prepared to confront the Lone Lady. You should speak to her when you are ready."}},
[9999]={nameES="Raid Gear: Burglar",objectivesES={"By completing this quest, you will receive a set of Raid Gear.","Raid Gear: Burglar","Talk to Avon to continue"}},
