[10016]={nameES="Raid on Rung-shakam",objectivesES={"Raise a banner of the Haban’akkâ of Thráin at Rung-shakam","Raid on Rung-shakam","The Haban'akkâ of Thráin will be victorious!","You have done much to hinder the Orcs and their vile allies at Rung-shakam.\
\
You should raise a banner of the Haban'akkâ of Thráin at Rung-shakam.","Upon the slopes of Zirakzigil at Rung-shakam, the trolls and goblins of Moria work together to rain great stones upon the Haban'akkâ of Thráin at Azanulbizar.","Orcs, goblins, trolls, and Orkish drums can be found at Rung-shakam.\
\
King Thráin has commanded you to join in the assault at Rung-shakam. You should aid the Haban'akkâ of Thráin."}},
[10017]={nameES="Raid: A New Queen for Deepest Helegrod",objectivesES={"Zaudru has made her lair in the caverns beneath the old dwarf-city of Helegrod, in the Misty Mountains. Atli Spider-bane is in the town of Archet, in Bree-land.\
\
Atli Spider-bane has told you the story of his encounter with Zaudru long years ago and has charged you with carrying out his vengeance.","Raid: A New Queen for Deepest Helegrod","Atli Spider-bane has, at long last, learned the location of his greatest foe, the cause of his deep hatred for the foul creatures.","Bring Zaudru's crimson mandible to Atli Spider-bane","Collected Zaudru's crimson mandible"}},
[10018]={nameES="Raid: An Evil Place, Crawling With Spiders",objectivesES={"Raid: An Evil Place, Crawling With Spiders","The Shadow-brood spiders in the caverns beneath Helegrod possess the venom Atli Spider-bane is seeking. Atli is in the town of Archet, in Bree-land.\
\
Atli Spider-bane has asked you to collect venom from the Shadow-brood of Helegrod."}},
[10019]={nameES="Raid: Beasts of Snow",objectivesES={}},
[10020]={nameES="Incursión: Bogbereth",objectivesES={"Lunathron te habló de una gran y vil araña, Bogbereth, que caza en Himbar.","Incursión: Bogbereth","Gath Forthnír está en la parte oriental de Himbar, al sur y al este de Torech-i-Bogbereth.\
\
Lunathron te pidió destruir a la gran araña, Bogbereth. Ahora que ya no existe, puedes regresar para reclamar tu victoria.","Bogbereth caza en el extremo noreste de Himbar, al oeste y luego al norte de Gath Forthnír.\
\
Lunathron te advirtió que no enfrentes a Bogbereth con menos que una partida de guerra completamente armada. Debe ser derrotada, o seguirá engendrando su vil prole."}},
[10021]={nameES="Raid: Captain-General Bordagor",objectivesES={}},
[10022]={nameES="Raid: Captain-General Harvestgain",objectivesES={"Captain-General Harvestgain, a târk, leads the forces within Lugazag.\
\
Soldier Súmtharb made it clear that the only objective is to strike down the enemy's leader.","Captain-General Harvestgain is the leader of the Free Peoples at Lugazag.","Raid: Captain-General Harvestgain","Defeat Captain-General Harvestgain and claim Lugazag. You must not be defeated when the Captain-General falls.","Angmar claims Lugazag!"}},
[10023]={nameES="Raid: Captain-General Lainedhel of Ost Ringdyr",objectivesES={}},
[10024]={nameES="Raid: Captain-General Meldún of Isendeep",objectivesES={}},
[10025]={nameES="Raid: Captain-General Mákan of Tol Ascarnen",objectivesES={}},
[10026]={nameES="Raid: Captain-General Verdantine",objectivesES={}},
[10027]={nameES="Raid: Culling the Brood",objectivesES={}},
[10028]={nameES="Raid: Drake-wrangler",objectivesES={}},
[10029]={nameES="Raid: Fangs for Nothing",objectivesES={"Worms and drakes have come to live within the central keep of Helegrod, the ancient dwarf-city in the Misty Mountains. Ormulf Worm-hunter is in Othrikar, in the North Downs.\
\
Ormulf Worm-hunter has tasked you with retrieving fangs from the drakes and worms that nest within the central keep of Helegrod. He has refused to offer you a reward for this expedition, insisting that the honour of the deed will be reward enough.","Raid: Fangs for Nothing"}},
[10030]={nameES="Raid: Giant-slayer",objectivesES={"Derrota a Storvâgûn","Defeated Storvâgûn","The giant-chieftain Storvâgûn and his kin have fallen under the sway of Angmar and guard the passes into Helegrod.","Raid: Giant-slayer","Storvâgûn, leader of the giants of Helegrod, has become corrupted by the forces of Angmar. His defeat will strike a terrible blow against the Iron Crown."}},
[10031]={nameES="Raid: Giants in Service of Angmar",objectivesES={"Giants in the service of Storvâgûn and his new masters can be found on the cliffs above Helegrod. Arifael is on Amon Nendir, south-west of Rivendell.\
\
Arifael has asked you to take the notched barter-sticks on which the giants recorded the wealth paid to them by robed Men of Angmar away from them. When you bring him enough of the barter-sticks, he will burn them.","Raid: Giants in Service of Angmar"}},
[10032]={nameES="Raid: Grounding Golloval",objectivesES={"Raid: Grounding Golloval","Taskmaster Bárzqhosh awaits your return within the Isendeep Mine.\
\
Golloval found his end at your will. You should return to Taskmaster Bárzqhosh with the news.","Golloval can be found south of the mine in an eagle-eyrie.\
\
Taskmaster Bárzqhosh tasked you with finding and slaughtering the eagle, Golloval.","Return to Taskmaster Bárzqhosh at the Isendeep Mine","Taskmaster Bárzqhosh wants you to ensure that the threat posed by the eagles and their leader, Golloval, are diminshed. He has ordered you to gather a great number and assail the eagle-lord at his eyrie in Arador's End."}},
[10033]={nameES="Asalto: Gwathrenost, la Ciudadela del Rey Brujo (Semanal)",objectivesES={"Antiguamente sede del Rey Brujo de Angmar, la temible ciudadela de Gwathrenost proyecta una larga sombra sobre la ciudad de Carn Dûm. Casi abandonada tras la deposición del Senescal de Angmar, los restos de la Corona de Hierro han salido de las sombras, buscando dominar un artefacto perdido del Rey Brujo y reclamar el dominio de Angmar.","Completa 'Gwathrenost, la Ciudadela del Rey Brujo'","Asalto: Gwathrenost, la Ciudadela del Rey Brujo (Semanal)","Grúmach se encuentra en Bail Avarc, en Angmar.\
\
Has vencido a los maestros de la Corona de Hierro en Gwathrenost y finalmente has liberado Angmar de su influencia. Deberías hablar con Grúmach.\
\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Bail Avarc solo se puede acceder inicialmente a través de las rutas de los maestros de establos. Bail Avarc se puede alcanzar a través de los maestros de establos en Esteldín, Gath Forthnír y los establos de Rivendel.</rgb>","Habla con Grúmach en Bail Avarc","Debes superar los males reunidos en Gwathrenost, la Ciudadela del Rey Brujo.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Debes completar 'Gwathrenost, la Ciudadela del Rey Brujo' en cualquier nivel de dificultad para avanzar en esta misión. Una vez que hayas completado 'Descubrimiento: Carn Dûm' viajando a Bail Avarc, utiliza el Buscador de Instancias para unirte a 'Gwathrenost, la Ciudadela del Rey Brujo'.</rgb>"}},
[10034]={nameES="Raid: Keep Them from Hatching",objectivesES={"Raid: Keep Them from Hatching","The central keep of Helegrod is a spawning ground for ice-hatchlings.\
\
Ormulf Worm-hunter has asked you to defeat the ice-hatchlings that are spawning within Helegrod's central keep."}},
[10035]={nameES="Raid: Reclaiming Eregion's Gift",objectivesES={"Bring Mírdanant to Gonediad","Raid: Reclaiming Eregion's Gift","Gonediad of Rivendell is worried that Thorog will not long stay behind the walls of Helegrod.","The dragon Thorog has been spotted behind the walls of Helegrod, Mírdanant still buried within his neck.\
\
Gonediad of Rivendell has asked you to try and recover the axe of Durin, lost in ancient battle with Thorog at Helegrod."}},
[10036]={nameES="Raid: Servants of Angmar",objectivesES={"Raid: Servants of Angmar","Lord Elrond has alerted you to the presence of three servants of Angmar in Helegrod.","Grisgart, Adhargal, and Breosal keep the forces of evil under control behind the walls of Helegrod.\
\
Lord Elrond has charged you with defeating the three Angmarim apparently keeping the evils within Helegrod under control and organized.","Adhargal has been defeated by Storvâgûn","Defeated Grisgart","Defeat Grisgart","Habla con Elrond en la Última Morada","Defeat Adhargal","Defeat Breosal","Breosal has been defeated by Zaudru","Master Elrond is in the library of Rivendell.\
\
The three servants of Angmar within Helegrod have been defeated. Elrond should be told of your success."}},
[10037]={nameES="Raid: Spider Squasher",objectivesES={}},
[10038]={nameES="Raid: Storvâgûn the Traitor",objectivesES={"Arifael has told you the tale of Storvâgûn, the new leader of the giants above Helegrod.","Raid: Storvâgûn the Traitor","Bring Storvâgûn's emblem of loyalty to Arifael","The giant Storvâgûn is on the cliffs above Helegrod, the ancient dwarf-city in the Misty Mountains. Arifael is on Amon Nendir, south-west of Rivendell.\
\
Arifael has asked you to take Storvâgûn's emblem of loyalty away from him. Robed Men of Angmar gave the emblem to him in exchange for the service of the giants.","Collected Storvâgûn's emblem of loyalty"}},
[10039]={nameES="Raid: The Corcur of Helegrod",objectivesES={"Bring Helegrod Corcur talismans to Elladan","Elladan has long fought the Corcur of the Trollshaws and the Misty Mountains, and fears their new allegiance to Angmar.","Raid: The Corcur of Helegrod","The Corcur of Helegrod can be found within its walls, far north of Imladris in the Misty Mountains. Elladan is at Thorenhad, his camp among the Bruinen Gorges west of Rivendell.\
\
Elladan has told you that each of the Corcur within Helegrod carry talismans from which they believe their strength comes. If enough of these talismans can be taken from their grasp, the will of the Corcur may be broken."}},
[10040]={nameES="Raid: The Hiddenhoard of Abnankâra (Weekly)",objectivesES={"You have completed 'The Hiddenhoard of Abnankâra'!","The Hiddenhoard of Abnankâra can be found in the Clovengap in Mount Gundabad.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: You must complete 'The Hiddenhoard of Abnankâra' on any difficulty Tier to advance this quest. Once you have completed 'Discovery: The Hiddenhoard of Abnankâra', use the Instance Finder to join 'The Hiddenhoard of Abnankâra'.</rgb>","You have completed 'The Hiddenhoard of Abnankâra'.","Complete 'The Hiddenhoard of Abnankâra'","Zóva, advisor to Prince Ingór, has requested your aid in the continued efforts to reclaim Mount Gundabad.","Raid: The Hiddenhoard of Abnankâra (Weekly)","Your deeds at Abnankâra have proven instrumental in the reclamation of Mount Gundabad.","Completado"}},
[10041]={nameES="Raid: The Long Reach of Angmar",objectivesES={"Elrohir is troubled by the presence of Angmarim in Helegrod, the old dwarf-city in the mountains north of Rivendell.","Bring Helegrod Angmarim emblems to Elrohir","Raid: The Long Reach of Angmar","Angmarim inside Helegrod, the old dwarf-city in the Misty Mountains, bear emblems that reveal their loyalties. Elrohir is at Thorenhad, his camp among the Bruinen Gorges west of Rivendell.\
\
Elrohir has asked you to defeat Angmarim inside Helegrod and take from them the emblems they carry."}},
[10042]={nameES="Incursión: El Amo de Imlad Balchorth",objectivesES={"Incursión: El Amo de Imlad Balchorth","Has encontrado la guarida de Ferndúr","Eiláf está de regreso en Myrkworth, al este de la guarida de Ferndúr.\
\
Con Ferndúr muerto, debes regresar con Eiláf para contarle la historia de tus hazañas.","Eiláf cree que el hechicero Ferndúr se ocupa de los espíritus malignos que habitan en el área no muy lejos del Caldero de la Muerte.","Haz salir y derrota a Ferndúr","Hay espíritus malignos en una zona en ruinas no muy lejos del Caldero de la Muerte, en la isla central de Imlad Balchorth.\
\
Ferndúr debe ser destruido para dispersar la amenaza maligna en esta tierra maldita."}},
[10043]={nameES="Incursión: Las amenazas errantes de Gondor Central",objectivesES={"The Roving Threats Quartermaster of Central Gondor asks you to band together and vanquish the Roving Threats of Central Gondor.","The Hardened enemies of Central Gondor have banded together to stand off against those who oppose them.","Speak to the Roving Threats Quartermaster of Central Gondor","Incursión: Las amenazas errantes de Gondor Central","The Roving Threats Quartermaster of Central Gondor can be found in Central Gondor.\
\
You should speak with the Roving Threats Quartermaster of Central Gondor."}},
[10044]={nameES="Incursión: Las amenazas errantes de Gondor Central",objectivesES={"Defeated Render","Defeat Scythe-jaw","Defeat Render","Defeated Luruyak","Defeated Gundash","Incursión: Las amenazas errantes de Gondor Central","Defeat Abrakhòr","Defeat Du-kalon","Defeated Scythe-jaw","Defeated Abrakhòr","The Hardened enemies of Central Gondor have banded together to stand off against those who oppose them.","Defeated Anbúrz","Defeated Du-kalon","Defeat Keterang","Defeated Keterang","Defeat Luruyak","Push the Orkish forces further into the mountain.","Defeat Anbúrz","Defeat Ripper","Defeated Ripper","Defeat Gundash"}},
[10045]={nameES="Raid: Thorog Defeated",objectivesES={"Raid: Thorog Defeated","The dragon Thorog has been seen atop the walls of Helegrod, in the Misty Mountains.\
\
Greip and Sigrun have seen Thorog from their small camp north of the source of the Bruinen and have charged you with his defeat."}},
[10046]={nameES="Raid: Tyrant Barashish",objectivesES={"A powerful Orc warrior, the Tyrant Barashish has taken command of Tirith Rhaw. Sergeant-at-Arms Hesten has enlisted your talents in removing the Orc from the tower.","The Free People reclaim Tirith Rhaw!","Raid: Tyrant Barashish","Speak with Sergeant Hesten","Sergeant-at-Arms Hesten awaits your return at Glân Vraig.\
\
You defeated the Tyrant Barashish to reclaim Tirith Rhaw, You should return to Sergeant-at-Arms Hesten with the news.","The Tyrant Barashish is at Tirith Rhaw, north of Glân Vraig, in the centre of the Coldfells.\
\
Sergeant-at-Arms Hesten at Glân Vraig directed you to seek out and defeat the Orc Tyrant, Barashish who holds command at Tirith Rhaw.","Defeat Tyrant Barashish and reclaim Tirith Rhaw. You must not be defeated when the Tyrant falls."}},
[10047]={nameES="Raid: Tyrant Bûrzgoth",objectivesES={}},
[10048]={nameES="Raid: Tyrant Durgrat",objectivesES={}},
[10049]={nameES="Raid: Tyrant Gundzor",objectivesES={"Defeat Tyrant Gundzor and claim the Grimwood Lumber-yard. You must not be defeated when the Tyrant falls.","The Free Peoples claim the Grimwood Lumber-yard","Raid: Tyrant Gundzor","Sergeant-at-Arms Hafthor awaits news of your victory over the Tyrant Gundzor at Glân Vraig.\
\
You met the Tyrant Gundzor within the lumber-yard and defeated him and his forces, taking the yard back for the Free Peoples. You should return to Sergeant-at-Arms Hafthor with the news.","Within the depths of the Grimwood there is a grove where the trees have been cleared and a small lumber-camp built. The grove has fallen to the Ongbûrz and must be reclaimed.","The Grimwood Lumber-yard lay near the centre of Hithlad.\
\
Sergeant-at-Arms Hafthor asked you to find and defeat the troll-tyrant Gundzor at the Grimwood Lumber-yard."}},
[10050]={nameES="Raid: Tyrant Tharbil",objectivesES={}},
[10051]={nameES="Raid: Tyrant Trintrû",objectivesES={"Tol Ascarnen, once the citadel responsible for the manufacture and storage of Rhudauran weapons and armour, lay to the north and west of Glân Vraig.\
\
Sergeant-at-Arms Thurimbent directed you to kill Tyrant Trintrû at Tol Ascarnen.","Raid: Tyrant Trintrû","Speak with Sergeant-at-Arms Thurimbent at Glân Vraig","Tol Ascarnen has fallen to the Enemy. You have been tasked by Sergeant-at-Arms Thurimbent at Glân Vraig to find and defeat Tyrant Trintrû within the walls of Tol Ascarnen.","Sergeant-at-Arms Thurimbent awaits your return at Glâin Vraig.\
\
Facing down the enemy, you destroyed the Tyrant at Tol Ascarnen. You should return to Sergeant-at-Arms Thurimbent with the news.","Defeat Tyrant Trintrû and reclaim Tol Ascarnen. You must not be defeated when the Tyrant falls.","The Free People reclaim Tol Ascarnen!"}},
[10052]={nameES="Raid: Zaudru's Brood",objectivesES={"The caverns beneath Helegrod are riddled with cracks and crevices, home to Zaudru's hatchlings.\
\
Atli Spider-bane has asked you to slay as many Shadow-brood hatchlings as you can find beneath Helegrod.","Raid: Zaudru's Brood"}},
[10053]={nameES="Raiders From the West",objectivesES={"Collect Jerath's cutlass","Return to Elder Roshat in Khûtra","Elder Roshat asks that you deal with raiders west of Khûtra in order to prove worthy of a greater task.","Defeat Jerath in the raider camp and retrieve his cutlass. Then return to Elder Roshat in Khûtra.","Elder Roshat asks that you deal with Jerath and his raiders. Their camp can be found along the road west of Khûtra.","Raiders From the West","Jerath's cutlass acquired"}},
[10054]={nameES="Raiders in Máttugard",objectivesES={}},
[10055]={nameES="Raiders in the Hills",objectivesES={}},
[10056]={nameES="Saqueadores de Barad Tharsír",objectivesES={"Habla con Adleithian","Un saqueador de tumbas intenta detenerte","Saqueadores de Barad Tharsír","Adleithian le preocupa que los saqueadores de tumbas hayan tomado el control de las ruinas de Barad Tharsír, en el Barandalf.","Barad Tharsír se encuentra al sureste del Coloso, en el Barandalf, al otro lado del Brandivino.\
\
Adleithian  te ha pedido que encuentres una habitación oculta en las ruinas de Barad Tharsír y descubras qué hay dentro. Si algo te molesta, debe ser eliminado.","Investiga las ruinas","Adleithian está en el campamento de Montaraces en el Coloso, al noroeste del Barandalf y al oeste de Parth Aduial.\
\
Adleithian está esperando escuchar lo que has encontrado en la sala de objetos confiscados.","Saqueador de tumbas derrotado"}},
[10057]={nameES="Asaltantes en el Camino Verde",objectivesES={"Habla con el Maestro Buencorazón al sureste de las Ruinas de la Guardia del Sur","Asaltantes en el Camino Verde","Asaltantes bandidos causan problemas en el Camino Verde donde pasa hacia las Tierras de Bree.","Maestro Buencorazón está al sudeste de las Ruinas de Guardia del Sur.","Maestro Buencorazón, ciudadano preocupado, quiere que hagas algo con respecto a los asaltantes en el Camino Verde."}},
[10058]={nameES="Raiders to the North",objectivesES={"Raiders to the North","The Elders of Lhan Rhos spoke of terrible creatures that they call the Abominations.","Talk to Anurin in the Dunbog","Anurin is on the northern lines of the Avanc-lûth.\
\
Elder Déin instructed you to speak with Anurin once you have defeated the waves of Abomination Orcs.","The Abominations attack Lhan Rhos from the north.\
\
Elder Déin has asked you to stop the Abomination invasions."}},
[10059]={nameES="Raiding the Larder",objectivesES={"Raiding the Larder","The largest larder is within the guard-house, atop a short stair within the southernmost point of the ring-wall, right by the entrance to Isengard.\
\
Morflak's lackey wants you to get some of the good food from the guard-house and to bring it to Morflak, north-west of the southern entrance and south-west of Orthanc.","Find the guard-house by the southern gate and pick up some good food","Talk to Morflak","Morflak's lackey is very pleased about your delivery of the food to Morflak.","Morflak's lackey has told you that the best food is saved for the guards at the gate, but Morflak wants some of it.","Delivered the food to Morflak","You have delivered the food to Morflak and should speak with him.","Talk to Morflak's lackey"}},
[10060]={nameES="Rain of Arrows from the Brockbridge Siege",objectivesES={}},
[10061]={nameES="Rain of Death",objectivesES={}},
[10062]={nameES="Rain of Death",objectivesES={}},
[10063]={nameES="Raised Notices",objectivesES={"Raised Notices","With the Dale-lands as lively as ever, Captain Álarr has asked you to aid him in posting more guards' notices and orders from the Master throughout Lake-town.","Collect the stack of notices in the guards' barracks","You have gathered the notices, and should now begin posting them","Talk to Álarr","Captain Álarr can be found in the Guards' Barracks in Lake-town.\
\
You should return to Álarr and inform him that the notices are posted.","The stack of notices is in the guards' barracks in Lake-town.\
\
You should collect the stack of notices.","Notices can be posted in places all around Lake-town.\
\
You should post notices around Lake-town."}},
[10064]={nameES="Raising a Rumpus",objectivesES={"You have slapped two cow rumps, but there are yet more rumps that need slapping.\
\
You should slap more cow rumps at Ritherstad, in northern Pinnath Gelin.","The threat of goblins would be enough to make most folk seek safety until the dangerous creatures could be beaten back into their mountain holes. That is not the case for all residents of Pinnath Gelin, however.","She swishes her tail irritably at you, but runs off","Nordach has sent you on to Ritherstad in search of Varbris.\
\
Ritherstad is in northern Pinnath Gelin.","After a very judgemental side eye, she trots away","Slap Brúlen's rump","Slap Glúsi's rump","You have slapped one cow rump, but there are yet more rumps that need slapping.\
\
You should slap more cow rumps at Ritherstad, in northern Pinnath Gelin.","Return to Varbris","Slap Alo's rump","She ponders biting you, but then hustles away","Talk to Varbris","Slap Griga's rump","Your hand stings and you have stepped in something squishy and yet - there remain still more rumps that need slapping!\
\
You should slap more cow rumps at Ritherstad, in northern Pinnath Gelin.","Raising a Rumpus","You have slapped enough cow rumps to consider it a new profession of yours, but one rump yet remains unslapped!\
\
You should slap one more cow rump at Ritherstad, in northern Pinnath Gelin.","Brúlen huffs in surprise and gallops off","You have successfully driven off the cows of Ritherstad. You should let Varbris know his beloved girls are safe from goblins for the moment.\
\
Varbris is at Ritherstad.","Varbris has asked you to slap the rumps of his cows and shoo them away from the farm so that they might not fall prey to the goblins.\
\
You should slap cow rumps at Ritherstad, in northern Pinnath Gelin.","With a stomp of her hooves, she charges off","Slap Elester's rump"}},
[10065]={nameES="Raising the Tents",objectivesES={"Raising the Tents","Return to Sângal in Iridír and let him know you have finished setting up the tents for the displaced people to use. They no longer have to sleep in the open weather and cold.","Sângal is worried that the displaced people in Iridír have no place to sleep. You can gather supplies nearby to help construct the tents.","Return to Sângal","Help Sângal set up tents for the displaced people in Iridír.","Sângal is worried that the displaced people in Iridír have no place to sleep. He has asked that you help construct tents to be used as temporary shelters."}},
[10066]={nameES="Provocando la ira de los huargos",objectivesES={"El Viejo Artemisa cree que si los huargos se enfadan, enviarán a su líder.","Habla con el Viejo Artemisa","El Viejo Artemisa está en el campamento en el extremo este de Minas Eriol.\
\
Los huargos seguramente están enfadados ahora, dados tus logros en Nain Enidh, y el Viejo Artemisa debe ser informado de tu éxito.","Se pueden encontrar huargos en el Gran Camino del Este, en el extremo de Nain Enidh, cerca de Ost Cyrn.\
\
El Viejo Artemisa cree que si enfadas a suficientes huargos, llamarán a su líder.","Provocando la ira de los huargos"}},
[10067]={nameES="Raking the Woods",objectivesES={}},
[10068]={nameES="Rakothúrz y Horm",objectivesES={"La Ciudad de los Trasgos está al noreste del campamento de Glóin, y la sala del trono debería hallarse al final de los numerosos túneles.\
\
Tralli Buscagemas te ha pedido que encuentres y derrotes al troll y al trasgo, Horm y Rakothúrz, en la sala del trono del Gran Trasgo.","Tralli Buscagemas está en el campamento de Glóin, en las Montañas Nubladas, justo fuera de la entrada a la Ciudad de los Trasgos.\
\
Deberías volver con Tralli Buscagemas y contarle tu éxito.","Habla con Tralli Buscagemas","Rakothúrz y Horm","La información obtenida de las cartas que recuperaste en Lengua Negra llevó a Glóin a ofrecer recompensas por derrotar a Rakothúrz y Horm, un domador de trasgos y un terrible troll de las cavernas que se encuentran en la sala del trono del Gran Trasgo, en la Ciudad de los Trasgos."}},
[10069]={nameES="Rally the Warriors",objectivesES={"Rally the Warriors","Ghai-buri-Sêk will lead his warriors against the Uruk-hai of Kala-gijak. He has asked for your help in gathering them.","Talk to Ghai-buri-Sêk","Ghai-buri-Sêk can be found in the village Bhol Rûdh.\
\
You should talk to Ghai-buri-Sêk.","Drúedain villagers can be found in Bhol Rûdh.\
\
You should gather Drúedain villagers."}},
[10070]={nameES="Grito de arenga",objectivesES={"Ánimo de Eldur levantado","Lythur se pone firme al verte acercar. Te cuenta sus recientes encuentros en Moria y le ofreces palabras de ánimo.\
\
Al escucharte, parece tranquilizarse y se relaja visiblemente.","Levanta el ánimo de Eldur","Levanta el ánimo de Skafti","Muchos Barbiluengos que luchan por recuperar Moria se han visto desalentados por la tarea aparentemente imposible que tienen ante sí.","Garnyd se encuentra en Anazârmekhem, en las Profundidades Llameantes.\
\
Ahora que has levantado el ánimo de los enanos, es momento de regresar junto a Garnyd.","Ánimo de Lythur levantado","Levanta el ánimo de Lythur","Habla con Garnyd en Anazârmekhem","Eldur puede encontrarse en la Bodega Putrefacta, justo al oeste de las Profundidades Llameantes. Lythur está en el Umbral de Durin, en el borde occidental de la Gran Excavación, al norte de las Vetas del Cuerno de Plata. Skafti está en Jazârgund, en medio del Camino de Durin, en las zonas septentrionales de Moria.\
\
Garnyd te ha pedido que levantes el ánimo de tres soldados enanos dispersos por Moria: Eldur, Lythur y Skafti.","Grito de arenga","Los ojos de Eldur se iluminan tenuemente al verte acercarte. Escuchas el relato de su derrota reciente y le recuerdas que la muerte no es más que otro paso en el viaje de uno a través de las eras.\
\
Al oír esto, su ánimo mejora y asiente lentamente.\
\
'Gracias, capitán. Me has devuelto la fortaleza del corazón que me había sido arrebatada hace apenas unos días.'","Ánimo de Skafti levantado"}},
[10071]={nameES="Rallying a Defence",objectivesES={"Rallying a Defence","Garvir can be found in Linhir in eastern Dor-en-Ernil.\
\
You have readied the defences of Linhir and rallied the frightened Men who abandoned their posts. You should now speak to Garvir.","Warriors of Linhir can be found outside Linhir in eastern Dor-en-Ernil.\
\
Garvir has asked you to rally warriors that fled when Aragorn and the Grey Host passed through Linhir.","DNT -- will not be seen","Barricades can be found along the borders of Linhir in eastern Dor-en-Ernil.\
\
Garvir has asked you to aid in repairing the defences of Linhir before the Corsairs and Haradrim can rally against the settlement once more.","In the wake of Aragorn and the Grey Host's passing, Garvir struggles to once again ready the defences of Linhir for battle.","Talk to Garvir"}},
[10072]={nameES="Rallying a Militia",objectivesES={"Wuscrad spoke of abandoned homes just north of the town of Elthengels, beyond the gates of town.\
\
The Elthengels garrison commander has asked you to secure provisions from the nearby recently abandoned homes.","Potential recruits can be found within the walls of the town of Elthengels.\
\
Wuscrad has asked you to speak with refugees to Elthengels and to convince them to volunteer to join the militia.","Wuscrad can be found in the town of Elthengels.\
\
Wuscrad awaits news of the potential recruits for the Elthengels militia.","Rallying a Militia","Wuscrad, the garrison commander, has asked you to help raise a militia from the refugees and locals of Elthengels.","Return to Wuscrad with news of the new recruits","Return to Wuscrad with the provisions","Wuscrad can be found in the town of Elthengels.\
\
You should return the recovered provisions to Wuscrad in the town of Elthengels."}},
[10073]={nameES="Ramblings Decoded",objectivesES={"Pick up the translated journal","Málur Keenword has finished his translation of the madman's journal.","Bring the journal to Mother Amma","Talk to Málur Keenword","Mother Amma is in Bazanmanar.\
\
You should bring the translated journal to Mother Amma.","Ramblings Decoded","Málur is located in Bazanmanar.\
\
Mother Amma has asked you to see how far Málur Keenword has come in deciphering the journal.","The journal is on the table beside Málur in Clovengap.\
\
You should pick up the translated journal."}},
[10074]={nameES="Bestias desbocadas",objectivesES={"Malthenor de Rivendel se ha instalado en las Montañas Nubladas para montar guardia en el campamento de Glóin.\
\
Malthenor está complacido de oír que has derrotado a muchas bestias de las nieves.","Las bestias de las nieves se encuentran por todas las Montañas Nubladas y son un peligro para cualquier viajero que las atraviese.","Derrota bestias de las nieves","Bestias desbocadas","Las bestias de las nieves se encuentran en las Montañas Nubladas, especialmente cerca del nacimiento del Bruinen.\
\
Derrota bestias de las nieves donde quiera que las encuentres para hacer los pasos de montaña más seguros para los viajeros."}},
[10075]={nameES="Rampant Anger",objectivesES={"You bandaged Broda's wounds","Talk to Broda","Bandage Broda's wounds","Talk to the healer in Woodhurst","Broda is in the field behind the stable.\
\
You should speak with Broda again, before moving on.","Tensions in the city are rising. Those with Dunlending blood feel that great injustices have been committed against their kind and harbor ill will towards anyone with obvious Rohirrim heritage.","Broda, the injured stable-hand, is in the field behind the stable by the eastern gate of Woodhurst.\
\
You should bring the healer's pack to Broda at once.","Rampant Anger","Look for the stable-hand","The healer gives you her pack of supplies","The healer is in the shop behind the inn that faces the fountain in the centre of Woodhurst.\
\
Broda asked you to seek help for him from the town healer.","The stable-hand is in the field behind the stable.\
\
A guard saw a local stable-hand being followed by a rowdy group of men and has asked you to check on him."}},
[10076]={nameES="Un encontronazo con los osos",objectivesES={"Un grupo de saqueadores de tumbas tuvo un encontronazo con los osos de Nan Orngon, al este de Ost Forod en Tyrn Fornech.\
\
Robin Sotopardo te ha pedido que encuentres los cuerpos de los saqueadores de tumbas de Nan Orngon y recuperes cualquier artefacto que pudieran haber robado.","Un encontronazo con los osos","Robin Sotopardo ha compartido contigo su alegría por la mala suerte de una banda de saqueadores de tumbas, y quiere que recuperes cualquier artefacto que estuvieran transportando.","Recupera la reliquia robada del cuerpo de un saqueador de tumbas","Robin Sotopardo está en Ost Forod, al oeste de Nan Orngon, en Tyrn Fornech.\
\
Has recuperado un fragmento de estatua antigua de un saqueador que tuvo algunos problemas con los osos de Nan Orngon. Robin Sotopardo te ha pedido que vuelvas con cualquier reliquia que encuentres a Ost Forod.","Lleva la estatuilla rota a Robin Sotopardo"}},
[10077]={nameES="Ranger in the Ettenmoors",objectivesES={"No seas derrotado","Your patrol is complete","Patrol the Ettenmoors for 60 minutes","Patrol the Ettenmoors.","Ranger in the Ettenmoors","Patrol the Ettenmoors in search of the Enemy. You must patrol for 60 minutes. After 60 minutes you will be returned to your post."}},
[10078]={nameES="Ranger in the Ettenmoors",objectivesES={"Patrol the Ettenmoors","No seas derrotado","Your patrol is complete","Patrol the Ettenmoors.","Ranger in the Ettenmoors","Patrol the Ettenmoors in search of the Enemy. You must patrol for 60 minutes. After 60 minutes you will be returned to your post."}},
[10079]={nameES="Ranger in the Ettenmoors",objectivesES={"Patrol the Ettenmoors","No seas derrotado","Your patrol is complete","Patrol the Ettenmoors.","Ranger in the Ettenmoors","Patrol the Ettenmoors in search of the Enemy. You must patrol for 60 minutes. After 60 minutes you will be returned to your post."}},
[10080]={nameES="Ranger in the Ettenmoors",objectivesES={"Patrol the Ettenmoors","Your patrol is complete","Patrol the Ettenmoors.","Ranger in the Ettenmoors","Patrol the Ettenmoors in search of the Enemy. You must patrol for 60 minutes. After 60 minutes you will be returned to your post."}},
