\
'The enemy has taken control of part of the Morgai, in Lhingris. A brave adventurer is needed to claim this area for Gondor.'","Reclaiming Lhingris: The Morgai","The enemy controls this location. You should claim this area for Gondor.","Claim the first encampment for Gondor","Claim the third encampment for Gondor","Claim the final encampment for Gondor","You have successfully claimed this area for Gondor!","Has reclamado el campamento","Completado"}},
