[10176]={nameES="Reclaiming Talath Úrui: The Eastern Ghâshghurm",objectivesES={"Claim this land for Gondor!","Claim the second encampment for Gondor","Claimed this area for Gondor!","Completado","The enemy controls this location. You should claim this area for Gondor.","Claim the first encampment for Gondor","Claim the third encampment for Gondor","Claim the final encampment for Gondor","You have successfully claimed this area for Gondor!","Has reclamado el campamento","Reclaiming Talath Úrui: The Eastern Ghâshghurm","A notice is pinned to the board, stamped with the royal seal of Gondor:\
