[10179]={nameES="Reclaiming Udûn: Maudhúl Târ Overlook",objectivesES={"Claim this land for Gondor!","Claim the second encampment for Gondor","Claimed this area for Gondor!","The enemy controls this location. You should claim this area for Gondor.","Claim the first encampment for Gondor","Claim the third encampment for Gondor","A notice is pinned to the board, stamped with the royal seal of Gondor:\
\
'The enemy has taken control of the overlook above the encampment of Maudhúl Târ, in Udûn. A brave adventurer is needed to claim this area for Gondor.'","Claim the final encampment for Gondor","You have successfully claimed this area for Gondor!","Has reclamado el campamento","Completado","Reclaiming Udûn: Maudhúl Târ Overlook"}},
[10180]={nameES="Reclaiming Udûn: Mornaur Look-out",objectivesES={"Claim this land for Gondor!","Claim the second encampment for Gondor","Claimed this area for Gondor!","Reclaiming Udûn: Mornaur Look-out","The enemy controls this location. You should claim this area for Gondor.","Claim the first encampment for Gondor","Claim the third encampment for Gondor","Claim the final encampment for Gondor","You have successfully claimed this area for Gondor!","Has reclamado el campamento","Completado","A notice is pinned to the board, stamped with the royal seal of Gondor:\
\
'The enemy has taken control of a look-out just outside of Mornaur's walls, in Udûn. A brave adventurer is needed to claim this area for Gondor.'"}},
[10181]={nameES="Recuperando un legado",objectivesES={"Habla con Haflith en Mekhem-bizru","Istash se encuentra en Uruk-gashan, al sur de Mekhem-bizru.\
\
Haflith cree que la Piedra de Durin nunca estará segura hasta que Istash, un líder orco, sea derrotado.","Haflith se encuentra en Mekhem-bizru, al norte de Uruk-gashan.\
\
Haflith estará encantado de saber que Istash ha sido derrotado y que la Piedra de Durin sigue a salvo.","Derrota a Istash","Istash ha sido derrotado","Recuperando un legado","El legado de la Piedra de Durin ahora está amenazado por una última fuerza: Istash, un poderoso orco de las profundidades de Moria."}},
[10182]={nameES="Reclaiming the Fallen",objectivesES={}},
[10183]={nameES="Reclaiming the Gap",objectivesES={"Ages ago, a great sundering shook loose the ceiling of this massive cavern. Once opened to the sky, Clovengap became an emerald swath of tiered gardens, unique among the dwarves. Gone now are those gardens, replaced by dark forests and thick mists, in which prowl those with murderous intent.","Reclaiming the Gap","Gunvald is in a camp in the south-western area of Clovengap.\
\
You should let Gunvald know you have culled the Warg population of Clovengap.","Return to Gunvald","Wargs can be found in western Clovengap.\
\
Gunvald has asked for your assistance in thinning the Warg packs in Clovengap."}},
[10184]={nameES="Reclaiming the Grey",objectivesES={}},
[10185]={nameES="Reclaiming the Grey (Advanced)",objectivesES={}},
[10186]={nameES="Reclaiming the Grey (Final)",objectivesES={}},
[10187]={nameES="Recuperar la granja",objectivesES={"Ida se encuentra en su campamento, al este de Voi-teltta, cerca de la entrada a los cañones de hielo que conducen al sur.\
\
Has recuperado Voi-teltta para los Lossoth. Deberías regresar con Ida e informarle de tu éxito.","Fëoc ha sido expulsado de Voi-teltta","Lauri se encuentra en Pynti-peldot, en lo alto de una colina al norte y al oeste, siguiendo el camino desde el campamento de Ida.\
\
Ida te ha pedido que informes a Lauri de que has recuperado la granja de Voi-teltta.","Recuperar la granja","Habla con Lauri, el Maestro de Exploradores","Ida te ha dicho que una granja cercana está siendo aterrorizada por Fëoc, un Gauradan.","Derrota a Fëoc cerca de Voi-teltta","Fëoc se encuentra en Voi-teltta, al oeste del campamento de Ida, siguiendo el camino.\
\
Ida te ha encargado derrotar al Gauradan Fëoc, que se ha apoderado de Voi-teltta y ha expulsado a los exploradores lossoth."}},
[10188]={nameES="Reclaiming the Mountain-hold (Weekly)",objectivesES={"Your efforts have truly assisted those who work to reclaim the mountain-home of Gundabad. You will certainly be rewarded for your accomplishments.","Zóva, advisor to Prince Ingór, has requested your aid in the continued efforts to reclaim Gundabad for all dwarves.","Reclaiming the Mountain-hold (Weekly)","Gundabad: Reclaiming the Mountain-hold quests are available from Zádokh Flint-eye, Agátur the Boastful, and Bráthi at Zidir-nesad, The Steepset.\
\
You should talk to these dwarves as soon as you are able.","Completado","Completed many Gundabad: Reclaiming the Mountain-hold quests assisting in Reclaiming the Mountain-hold."}},
[10189]={nameES="Reclamar la plataforma",objectivesES={"Thalfar se encuentra en el campamento minero central de las Vetas del Cuerno de Plata.\
\
Deberías volver a ver a Thalfar e informarle de que la plataforma ya está despejada, por ahora.","Thalfar te ha pedido que patrulles la enorme plataforma minera de Menem-berej, al sur.\
\
Necesita que la despejes de criaturas para que los mineros puedan buscar mitril con seguridad.","Menem-berej se encuentra justo al sur del campamento minero central, en las Vetas del Cuerno de Plata.\
\
Debes limpiar la plataforma y sus alrededores de cualquier criatura peligrosa.","Reclamar la plataforma","Vuelve con Thalfar"}},
[10190]={nameES="Reclamación",objectivesES={"Los dos clanes de los Hijos de la Tierra en las Quebradas del Norte han comenzado a entrar en guerra entre sí. Los pacíficos Suuri-lehmä ahora están enfrentados con los belicosos Rauta-lehmä.","Reclamación","Devuelve las armas de los Hijos de la Tierra a Iivari","Las armas robadas pueden encontrarse en los Hijos de la Tierra hostiles de Rauta-lehmä en Nan Amlug, al este de Rusfold.\
\
Debes recuperar las armas robadas de los Hijos de la Tierra hostiles y devolverlas a Iivari en Rusfold.","Iivari está en Rusfold.\
\
Debes llevar las armas recuperadas a Iivari."}},
[10191]={nameES="Reclamación",objectivesES={"Reclamación","Orchalwë ha regresado a Tinnudir y desea hablar contigo.","Orchalwë está en Tinnudir, al norte de Annúminas.\
\
Se te ha ordenado que hables con Orchalwë."}},
[10192]={nameES="Reuniendo lazos",objectivesES={"Covell puede encontrarse en uno de los campamentos Montebruno al norte y al este del campamento maderero de Combe.\
\
Maida Carpintero te envió a hablar con la condestable Wren, quien sugirió que Covell se unió a los Montebruno y probablemente se encuentre cerca de uno de sus campamentos en el bosque de Chet.","Habla con Covell Carpintero","Maida Carpintero está de vuelta en Combe.\
\
Se debe informar a Maida Carpintero que su hijo Covell se ha unido a los bandidos Montebruno.","La condestable Wren patrulla cerca de la casa de guardia en la colina al sur del campamento maderero y al este de Combe.\
\
Encontraste a Covell Carpintero en el camino que atraviesa el bosque de Chet, y te atacó. Aunque lo derrotaste, escapó más adentro del bosque. La condestable Wren querrá saber de tu encuentro con el bandido.","La condestable Wren está en la casa de guardia, al este de Combe.\
\
Maida Carpintero te ha pedido que hables con la condestable Wren sobre el paradero de su hijo, Covell.","Maida Carpintero tuvo una discusión con su hijo Covell, y no lo ha visto desde entonces. La actividad de los Montebruno en la zona la ha puesto nerviosa, y está buscando noticias de él.","Reuniendo lazos"}},
[10193]={nameES="Recording Recollections",objectivesES={"You have finished interviewing all three people and taken notes.\
\
You should bring the notes to Jihan in the gardens outside Dâr Tabib.","Talk to Jihan in the gardens","How can one hope to wrest back the broken narrative of an entire city?","Recording Recollections","Jihan has tasked you with interviewing three individuals in the Tor-gardens.\
\
Imêna works at The Din of Arms to the south-west. Sophân waits by the Gate of Steps to the south. Nûr can be found to the south-east outside the Dahâl Huliz.","Talk to Sophân at the Gate of Steps","Talk to Nûr at the Dahâl Huliz","Talk to Imêna at The Din of Arms"}},
[10194]={nameES="Registros de los Tiempos Oscuros",objectivesES={"Registros de los Tiempos Oscuros","Arnod está acampado en Tharâkh Bazân, al oeste de Jazârgund.\
\
Arnod quiere ayudar a comprender la historia detrás de los relatos que encontraste.","Arnod está acampado en Tharâkh Bazân, en el Camino de Durin.\
\
Búkk está interesado en los relatos de las batallas que los enanos perdieron contra los orcos. Cree que Moria aún guarda estos secretos y que Arnod podría saber dónde encontrarlos.","Moria aún guarda los secretos del pasado, incluidos los relatos de las grandes derrotas de los enanos a manos de los orcos de Azog.","Las páginas se encuentran en las cámaras al norte y al sur de Salab Nurjundul, al oeste de Jazârgund.\
\
Arnod cree que los antiguos relatos todavía están en Moria.","Habla con Arnod en Tharâkh Bazân","Habla con Arnod en los jardines de Tharâkh Bazân"}},
[10195]={nameES="Recovering from the Fallen",objectivesES={"Return to Dráttur","Fallen dwarves are strewn across the field near Durin's Stone.\
\
You should retrieve arms and armour from the fallen.","Recovering from the Fallen","Dwarf-bodies litter the battlefield around Durin's Stone. Their arms and armour must not fall into the hands of the enemy.","Dráttur is located in Amdân.\
\
Bring the arms and armour to Dráttur."}},
[10196]={nameES="Recuperar la hoja perdida",objectivesES={"Encontraste la hoja de papel perdida","Ronald Dwalkien ha extraviado una hoja de papel importante.","Habla con Ronald Dwalkien","Recuperar la hoja perdida","Ronald Dwalkien recuerda haber dejado caer su papel en algún lugar de Dwaling, al norte del Prado del Toro Bramador.\
\
Ronald Dwalkien te ha pedido que encuentres su hoja de papel perdida.","Ronald Dwalkien está en la casa de Hob Cimacolina, en el Prado del Toro Bramador de Dwaling.\
\
Debes devolver la hoja de papel a Ronald Dwalkien.","Encuentra la hoja de papel perdida"}},
[10197]={nameES="Recovering the Manifest",objectivesES={}},
[10198]={nameES="Recuperando el pasado",objectivesES={"Busca al líder de los Barkhûshim, Katrakhi Mâta, cerca del centro de Dûl Zidur","Recuperando el pasado","Los Barkhûshim se llevaron consigo artefactos históricos y pergaminos cuando huían de Kûr Anzar. Tu tarea es recuperar estos artefactos y derrotar a cualquier Barkhûshim que intente detenerte.","Derrota a Katrakhi Mâta","Busca al líder de los Barkhûshim, Katrakhi Mâta, cerca del centro de Dûl Zidur.","Katrakhi Mâta se lanza hacia ti, con la sed de sangre en sus ojos","Derrota a los sectarios del que Todo lo Ve y recupera los documentos y artefactos históricos."}},
[10199]={nameES="Recruiting for the Grishúlvosh",objectivesES={"Orcs who dwell at Drushkála have been invited to join the crew of a ship named Grishúlvosh, but first they must slay the existing crew.","The killer of the second mate of the Grishúlvosh escaped into the water following the deed","Examine the parchments strewn upon the barrel near the entrance of Drushkála","This low-ranking deckhand of the Grishúlvosh was slain out in the open. None aided him","Parchments left atop a barrel within the encampment of Drushkála draw your attention:\
\
\\qHear now the words of ZAUMOZ THE BLACK WIND!\
\
'I desire only the very best warriors to crew my ship Grishúlvosh. Do you believe you can stand with ZAUMOZ?\
\
'Many of my crew live and work here in Drushkála. Free up your own spot on my deck by killing these weaklings. Only the strongest deserve to sail with me!'\\q","The chief mate of the Grishúlvosh suffered numerous wounds; his attackers were many","You should search for slain Orcs in Drushkála to see what you can learn of the Grishúlvosh's crew.","It would appear that at least four new Orcs have joined the crew of the Grishúlvosh, and these are perhaps more bloodthirsty than the sailors they replaced.\
\
You quietly give thanks that your own crew of the Wave-hunter was not selected in this Orc-fashion. You also wonder how Zaumoz the Black Wind can retain his own position as captain in such an environment.","Zaumoz the Black Wind, captain of the ship Grishúlvosh, has invited Orcs of Drushkála to join his crew.","Completado","The Grishúlvosh must now have at least four new crew members.","The third mate of the Grishúlvosh was attacked from the tall grasses","Recruiting for the Grishúlvosh"}},
[10200]={nameES="Red Skies on the Burning Mountain",objectivesES={"You have successfully braved the mountain and defeated many Merrevail there.","Mineral riches await those who brave the perilous cliff road circling Mount Doom.","Candúr se encuentra en Udûn.\
\\Deberías hablar con Candúr.","Complete The Burning Mountain: Red Skies","Red Skies on the Burning Mountain","Completed The Burning Mountain: Red Skies.","Completado","An urgent notice is pinned to the board:\
\
'Merrevail have been spotted on Mount Doom. A brave adventurer is needed to defeat foes on the mountain. Seek out Candúr in Udûn to learn more.'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Warning: This quest requires The Burning Mountain: Blood Wings to be underway. If that quest has been completed or failed, you will be unable to exit and re-enter this instance in order to complete this quest.</rgb>"}},
[10201]={nameES="Redeem the Abominations",objectivesES={}},
[10202]={nameES="Redención de los profanados",objectivesES={"Los Montaraces de aquí intentaron negociar y hacer tratos con Angmar.","Los cadáveres deberían ser retirados de las jaulas de cuervos para permitir que los caídos descansen en paz.","Orchalwë se alegrará al ver que sus hermanos deshonrados ahora descansarán en paz.","Redención de los profanados","Habla con Orchalwë"}},
[10203]={nameES="Reducing the Threat",objectivesES={}},
[10204]={nameES="Reducing the Threat -- Repeatable",objectivesES={"Reducing the Threat -- Repeatable","Khoblún Utot lies to the south of Maur Tulhau.\
\
Iolo Brochtû has asked you to return to Khoblún Utot and drive out the bugan.","Iolo Brochtû is at Maur Tulhau, north of Khoblún Utot.\
\
You should return to Iolo Brochtû with news of your success.","After learning that the 'hobbits' of the neighbouring village were actually a breed of wild goblin called the bugan, Mayor Brochtû declared a blood feud against them.","Talk to Iolo Brochtû at Maur Tulhau"}},
[10205]={nameES="Reflexionando sobre el pasado",objectivesES={"Reflexionando sobre el pasado","Habla con Simbi en la Sala Vigesimoprimera","Al colocar este espejo de nuevo en su posición, ayudarás a restaurar el antiguo sistema de iluminación en las oscuras y peligrosas salas de Moria. Es una pequeña victoria para la expedición de los enanos, pero una victoria al fin y al cabo.","Simbi se encuentra en la Sala Vigesimoprimera en Zelem-melek.\
\
Deberías informar a Simbi de que has restaurado el sistema de iluminación en Zelem-melek.","Los espejos de Moria suelen desalinearse debido a los indeseados habitantes de las profundidades."}},
[10206]={nameES="Reflejo de la llama",objectivesES={"Los habitantes de las Profundidades Llameantes parecen odiar el espejo; aborrecen la luz que refleja. Pero los enanos necesitan esa luz, pues muestra el camino y hace que la exploración y la minería sean más seguras.","Thórgnyr se encuentra en Anazârmekhem, al norte del Cruce de las Cenizas.\
\
Querrá saber que has realineado el espejo.","Reflejo de la llama","El espejo de las Profundidades Llameantes es perturbado constantemente por gusanos de las profundidades, dragoncillos llameantes y los Ghâsh-hai. Mantenerlo correctamente alineado es una tarea casi imposible.","Habla con Thórgnyr en Anazârmekhem"}},
[10207]={nameES="Reflejos en las vías",objectivesES={"Si vuelves a colocar este espejo en su sitio, debería volver a entrar un poco de luz en Khazad-dûm. Una vez hecho esto, debes buscar al enano Thettmárr en el Descenso Profundo.","Los espejos enanos de Khazad-dûm iluminaban antaño las salas subterráneas, pero muchos de ellos han quedado deteriorados o se han desalineado con el paso del tiempo.","Habla conThettmárr en el Descenso Profundo","Thettmárr se encuentra en el Descento Profundo.\
\
Deberías contarle a Thettmárr tus continuos esfuerzos por hacer que Khazad-dûm vuelva a ser un lugar seguro.","Reflejos en las vías"}},
[10208]={nameES="Reflejos de los árboles de piedra",objectivesES={"Los enanos mantienen la Puerta Este de Moria en Nud-melek.\
\
Ve a informar a un guardia de tus esfuerzos por volver a iluminar Khazad-dûm.","Volver a colocar este espejo debería restaurar algo de luz a las salas de Khazad-dûm. Una vez que hayas terminado, deberías buscar a alguien en la Puerta Este de Moria en Nud-melek.","Los espejos de los enanos de Khazad-dûm una vez iluminaron las salas subterráneas, pero muchos de ellos han caído en mal estado o han sido derribados.","Habla con un guardia en la Puerta Este de Moria en Nud-melek","Reflejos de los árboles de piedra"}},
[10209]={nameES="Reflections on Azanulbizar (Daily)",objectivesES={}},
[10210]={nameES="Reflections on Gundabad (Daily)",objectivesES={"Complete any instance at the Gundabad Reflecting Pool","Reflections on Gundabad (Daily)","In order to gain an advantage in Gundabad, you have decided to reflect upon some of what you have experience in the mighty dwarf-city.","Talk to Agátur the Boastful at Steepset","Agátur can be found at Steepset in Máttugard.\
\
You should talk to Agátur.","The Gundabad Reflecting Pool can be found at Zidir-nesad, The Steepset.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: Complete any instance at the Gundabad Reflecting Pool to advance this quest.</rgb>"}},
[10211]={nameES="Reflexiones sobre la guerra",objectivesES={"A wax-sealed letter, delivered in haste, contains a personal request from Glóin, father of Gimli and hero of the Lonely Mountain.","Talk to Glóin at Annâk-khurfu","Glóin can be found in the war-room at Annâk-khurfu in Elderslade.\
\
You should talk to Glóin.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: Mission Recruiters are available to deliver you there with haste. Mission Recruiters can be found at Thorin's Gate, Gondamon, Bree-town, The Twenty-first Hall, Othrikar, Gabilshathûr, Glóin's Camp, Hrimbarg, Galtrev, The Dolven-view, Magh Ashtu, Járnfast, Erebor, and Minas Tirith (Midsummer).</rgb>","Reflexiones sobre la guerra"}},
[10212]={nameES="Reflejo del Cuerno Rojo",objectivesES={"El espejo en las Vetas del Cuerno Rojo que solía reflejar la luz e iluminar la mina ha sido desviado, probablemente por los orcos que rondan cerca de él. Los enanos tendrán difícil explorar con seguridad si no pueden ver.","Auti está acampado justo al norte de la colmena grodbog, al oeste del espejo, en la caverna al sur de las Vetas del Cuerno Rojo.\
\
Auti se alegrará de oír que el espejo de las Vetas del Cuerno Rojo ha sido reajustado.","Habla con Auti cerca de la colmena grodbog","El espejo en las Vetas del Cuerno Rojo está siendo constantemente desviado por los orcos de la Mano Blanca que dominan la mina.","Reflejo del Cuerno Rojo"}},
[10213]={nameES="Reforging a Kingdom",objectivesES={"King Thorin III can be found in the Hall Under the Mountain.\
\
You have done much to aid King Thorin and his folk, and you should now return to him.","Aid King Thorin III with 'Forging Trust'","Aid Bráthi with 'Essays of Old'","Talk to King Thorin III","Reforging a Kingdom","Aid Dís with 'The Ravens of the North'","King Thorin III hopes to restore the Lonely Mountain to its former glory, but deadly conflicts and an inexplicable loss in crafting skill have plagued the Dwarves of Durin's Folk.","King Thorin III and Bráthi can be found in the Hall Under the Mountain. Dís can be found at Raven Hill, to the south-west of Erebor.\
\
King Thorin III has asked you to aid him in restoring Erebor and unifying the Stout-axes and Longbeards."}},
[10214]={nameES="Refuge in Tumladen",objectivesES={"The gate-warden can be found immediately outside Tumladen in northern Upper Lebennin.\
\
The gate-warden of Tumladen has questioned your intent. You should kneel and declare your loyalty to the people of Gondor.","Fearing for his father's safety as well as his own, Faltharan has urged you follow him to the mountain refuge of Tumladen.","Talk to the gate-ward of Tumladen","Tumladen can be found in northern Upper Lebennin.\
\
Faltharan has asked you to meet him in Tumladen in Upper Lebennin.","You have arrived at the fortified settlement of Tumladen!","Kneel before the gate-ward and swear your loyalty to Gondor","Faltharan can be found somewhere within Tumladen.\
\
You have been granted entry to Tumladen and should now seek out Faltharan.","Travel to Tumladen in Upper Lebennin","Find Faltharan in Tumladen","The gate-warden can be found immediately outside Tumladen in northern Upper Lebennin.\
\
You have arrived at Tumladen and have been sighted by one of the gate-wardens. You should speak to him before attempting to enter the refuge.","Refuge in Tumladen"}},
[10215]={nameES="Refuge in the East",objectivesES={"You have discovered Erynos still free of the Corsairs!","Talk to someone in Erynos about the Corsair threat","Erynos can be found far to the east of Ost Anglebed near the confluence of the rivers Celos and Sirith.\
\
You have discovered Erynos unharmed by the forces of the Enemy and should now speak to one of its inhabitants.","Nimithil of Pelargir grows concerned for the people of Erynos after the sacking of Lornost and bids you travel to their aid in the east.","Travel east to Erynos","Erynos can be found far to the east of Ost Anglebed near the confluence of the rivers Celos and Sirith.\
\
Nimithil has asked you to travel to Erynos to learn if the people there are still safe from the Corsair occupation of Pelargir.","Refuge in the East"}},
[10216]={nameES="El refugio de los elfos",objectivesES={"El refugio de los elfos","Habla con Elrond en Rivendel","Te han convocado en Rivendel, en el Bosque de los Trolls, pues allí hay mucho por hacer.","Rivendel se encuentra oculto en un valle al este del Bosque de los Trolls."}},
[10217]={nameES="Refugio en Talan Haldir",objectivesES={"Meredhrandir en Mekhem-bizru está preocupado por tu bienestar con todos los orcos de Moria tan agitados en el Valle del Arroyo Sombrío. Te ha recomendado que busques refugio en Lórien y apeles a la buena voluntad de Haldir en su talan, que está oculto.","Refugio en Talan Haldir","El talan de Haldir se encuentra en las orillas del Nimrodel, al sur del camino que conduce al puente roto.\
\
Meredhrandir en Mekhem-bizru te ha instado a buscar la protección de Haldir antes de que sufras algún daño tan cerca de la boca agitada de Moria.","Habla con Haldir en su talan"}},
[10218]={nameES="Refugees: Foodstuffs of Langhold",objectivesES={"Cíllan is waiting in the Refugee Camp outside Harwick.\
\
You should bring the food you gathered to Cíllan.","The refugees from Langhold find themselves hungry in their makeshift camp outside of Harwick.","The ruins of Langhold may yet hold some food left behind by the refugees ere they fled.\
\
You should search the homes of Langhold for unspoiled food that may have been left behind.","Refugees: Foodstuffs of Langhold","Bring the unspoiled food to Cíllan"}},
[10219]={nameES="Reacondicionando el Agujero Municipal",objectivesES={"Recoge la bolsa de dinero","Los enanos salieron del Pantano de los Juncos hacia el este, entre Ojo de Aguja y Sobrecolina. Su campamento está en algún lugar cercano, detrás de altas empalizadas de madera.\
\
Hablaste con Griffo Boffin sobre el dinero desaparecido, como pidió el asistente Albo, y descubriste que unos enanos rufianes podrían haberlo robado. Griffo pidió que buscaras el campamento de los enanos, recuperaras la bolsa de dinero y se la llevaras al asistente Albo en Cavada Grande.","Habla con Griffo Boffin","Reacondicionando el Agujero Municipal","Encontraste el dinero desaparecido, así que ahora debe ser entregado al asistente Albo en Cavada Grande.","Lleva la bolsa de dinero al asistente Albo","Griffo Boffin se puede encontrar en su casa cerca del centro de Ojo de Aguja, al norte de Cavada Grande. La carretera más fácil hacia Ojo de Aguja va hacia el norte desde El Cruce, la encrucijada al este de Cavada Grande.\
\
El asistente del alcalde Pieblanco te ha pedido que investigues la desaparición del dinero que se había reservado para reacondicionar el Agujero Municipal en Cavada Grande.","El dinero que se había reservado para reacondicionar el Agujero Municipal en Cavada Grande ha desaparecido, presumiblemente robado."}},
[10220]={nameES="Regrets and Consolation",objectivesES={"Talk to Ingmar in the infirmary of Eaworth","Lady Tóla is at Ingmar's house in the northern part of Eaworth.\
\
Ingmar asked you to bring reassurance to Lady Tóla in light of his victory and his grandmother's betrayal.","Lord Ingmar lies wounded in the infirmary of Eaworth.\
\
Reeve Ingbert has asked you to check on the well-being of his son and to convey his pride to him.","Regrets and Consolation","Talk to Tóla at Ingmar's house in Eaworth","Talk to Ingbert in the Mead Hall of Eaworth","Ingmar's attack on Maustazg was a success, but he was severely wounded in the battle.","Reeve Ingbert is in the Mead Hall of Eaworth.\
\
Tóla asked you to leave her alone. You should return to Reeve Ingbert and let him know the welfare of his son and Tóla's distress."}},
[10221]={nameES="Regrets and Consolation",objectivesES={"Talk to Ingmar in the infirmary of Eaworth","Lady Tóla is at Ingmar's house in the northern part of Eaworth.\
\
Ingmar asked you to bring reassurance to Lady Tóla in light of his victory and his grandmother's betrayal.","Lord Ingmar lies wounded in the infirmary of Eaworth.\
\
Reeve Ingbert has asked you to check on the well-being of his son and to convey his pride to him.","Regrets and Consolation","Reeve Ingbert is in the Mead Hall of Eaworth.\
\
Tóla asked you to let Reeve Ingbert know that her heart is at peace.","Talk to Tóla at Ingmar's house in Eaworth","Talk to Ingbert in the Mead Hall of Eaworth","Ingmar's attack on Maustazg was a success, but he was severely wounded in the battle."}},
[10222]={nameES="Regroup and Reassess",objectivesES={"Rhadrog can be found at Viznak's hideout in southern Agarnaith.\
\
You should go check on Rhadrog.","Viznak can be found in his hideout.\
\
You should talk to Viznak.","Regroup and Reassess","Talk to Rhadrog","Talk to Faeron","Faeron can be found in Viznak's hideout.\
\
You should talk to Faeron.","After dealing with the Uruk threat, Parsâ-dhug-Bhêr shares what she knows about Seregost. It is time to return to Viznak's hideout to regroup and come up with a plan.","Talk to Viznak"}},
[10223]={nameES="Reinforcements for Woodhurst",objectivesES={"Speak with Thane Nothmar","Speak with Gifemund","Reinforcements for Woodhurst","The reinforcements from Gapholt have arrived, and between Nothmar and Gifemund's men it may be possible to reclaim the throne of Woodhurst.","Gifemund is in the ore refinery building near the centre of Woodhurst.\
\
Herubrand has asked that you speak with Gifemund to gather and prepare his men for a battle for the mead hall in Woodhurst.","Nothmar is with Herubrand in the cellar of the farmhouse in Woodhurst.\
\
Herubrand has asked that you speak with Thane Nothmar to be sure his men are prepared for a battle for the mead hall in Woodhurst."}},
[10224]={nameES="Libera a los lobos",objectivesES={"Libera a los lobos","Vuelve con Linnet","Linnet se encuentra en la zona centro-sur del Bosque Salvaje.\
\
Deberías volver con Linnet.","Unos cazadores furtivos han asaltado una madriguera de lobos y se han llevado a los cachorros.","En el sureste del Bosque Salvaje hay cazadores furtivos.\
\
Linnet te ha pedido que rescates a unos cachorros de lobo que han sido capturados por cazadores furtivos."}},
[10225]={nameES="Relics Abound",objectivesES={}},
[10226]={nameES="Reliquias y monedas",objectivesES={"El Tesoro Olvidado se encuentra en Menem-berej, directamente al sur del Descenso Profundo. \
\
Debes buscar entre los orcos y cualquier ruina saqueada reliquias o monedas del Tesoro Olvidado. Hafberg preferiría que no desentierras ninguna que aún pueda estar intacta.","Reliquias y monedas","El Tesoro Olvidado alberga una gran cantidad de riquezas descubiertas o extraídas en Moria en los días antiguos. Asegurarse de que estos vestigios del pasado se mantengan para los enanos es un deber que vale la pena emprender.","Entrega las monedas y reliquias a Hafberg en el Descenso Profundo"}},
[10227]={nameES="Relics from the Dead",objectivesES={}},
[10228]={nameES="Reliquias en Barad Tharsír",objectivesES={"Lleva reliquias antiguas a Astiul","Reliquias en Barad Tharsír","Armonía Hijogrís está en el campamento de los montaraces en la isla de Tinnudir, al noroeste de Barandalf y al oeste de Parth Aduial.\
\
Astiul ha expresado su gratitud por tus esfuerzos y quiere que le des las gracias a Armonía de su parte.","Lleva reliquias antiguas a Armonía Hijogrís","El montaraz Astiul está en el campamento de los montaraces en la isla de Tinnudir, al noroeste de Barandalf y al oeste de Parth Aduial.\
\
Armonía Hijogrís te ha pedido que lleves las reliquias que has recolectado a Astiul, ya que él apreciará su importancia.","Armonía Hijogrís se ha ofrecido como voluntaria para ayudar a los montaraces a recolectar reliquias de las ruinas de Barad Tharsír.","Armonía Hijogrís está en el campamento de los montaraces en la isla de Tinnudir, al noroeste de Barandalf y al oeste de Parth Aduial.\
\
Has reunido varias reliquias de las ruinas de Barad Tharsír y deberías volver con Armonía Hijogrís.","Barad Tharsír se encuentra al sureste de Tinnudir, en Barandalf, al otro lado del Brandivino.\
\
Armonía Hijogrís quiere que le lleves cualquier reliquia que puedas encontrar en Barad Tharsír."}},
[10229]={nameES="Reliquias de Barad Tharsír",objectivesES={"Daerol está en el campamento de Montaraces del Coloso, al noroeste del Barandalf y al oeste de Parth Aduial.\
\
Has recogido varias reliquias de las ruinas de Barad Tharsír y deberías llevarlas de vuelta a Daerol.","Recoge una vasija","Reliquias de Barad Tharsír","Escudo recogido","Recoge un escudo","Lleva las viejas reliquias a Daerol en el Coloso","Espada recogida","Recoge una espada","Vasija recogida","Barad Tharsír fue una vez un importante puerto comercial que conectaba Evendim con el sur a través del Baranduin.","Barad Tharsír está al sureste del Coloso, en el Barandalf, en la orilla opuesta del Brandivino.\
\
Daerol quiere que le traigas cualquier reliquia que puedas encontrar en Barad Tharsír."}},
[10230]={nameES="Relics of King Ilkún",objectivesES={}},
[10231]={nameES="Reliquias de reinos perdidos",objectivesES={"Reliquias de reinos perdidos","Completa \\qLos salones en ruinas de Glynafon\\q","Completa misiones en el Ángulo para Narnien:\
\
\\qLos tesoros perdidos de Haudh Erthaid\\q\
\\qLos salones en ruinas de Glynafon\\q","Bajo los campos y las colinas onduladas del Ángulo, yacen los restos de batallas libradas hace mucho tiempo. Hay quienes han venido a saquear el Ángulo, y hay quienes desean proteger y estudiar sus reliquias.","Completa \\qLos tesoros perdidos de Haudh Erthaid\\q","Vuelve con Narnien","Narnien se encuentra en Gaerond, en la parte norte del Ángulo.\
\
Deberías decirle a Narnien que has encontrado suficientes artefactos para que continúe con sus estudios."}},
[10232]={nameES="Reliquias de Meluinen",objectivesES={"Las reliquias de Meluinen están en posesión de los trasgos u ocultas en el centro de Nan Wathren, al sur de las Quebradas del Norte.\
\
Debes recuperar las reliquias robadas de Meluinen, para que algún día sean devueltas.","Se ha sabido que los trasgos de Nan Wathren están en posesión de valiosas reliquias élficas saqueadas de un lugar desconocido llamado Meluinen.\
\
Debes recuperar las reliquias de los trasgos y sus escondites, en la esperanza de que algún día sean devueltas a Meluinen.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Se recomienda una pequeña Compañía.</rgb>","Reliquias de Meluinen","Has derrotado a varios trasgos de Nan Wathren, y reclamado las reliquias de la antigua Meluinen. Has honrado la memoria de los Elfos que una vez hollaron estas tierras.","Completado","Se ha sabido que los trasgos de Nan Wathren están en posesión de valiosas reliquias élficas saqueadas del refugio de Meluinen.","Has derrotado a varios trasgos de Nan Wathren.","Las reliquias de Meluinen están en posesión de los trasgos u ocultas en el centro de Nan Wathren, al sur de las Quebradas del Norte.\
\
Debes recuperar las reliquias robadas de Meluinen, para que algún día sean devueltas.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Se recomienda una pequeña Compañía.</rgb>"}},
[10233]={nameES="Relics of Old",objectivesES={"Agorin is at Ost Galadh, west of Minas Gîl.\
\
You should bring the relics you found to Agorin.","Relics of Old","Talk to Agorin at Ost Galadh","Agorin believes that relics of the Silvan Elves might remain within Minas Gîl, from the time when it served as an observatory studying the heavens above Ost Galadh.","Relics might be found within Minas Gîl, east of Ost Galadh.\
\
Agorin has asked you to recapture Silvan relics from the sorcerers in Minas Gîl."}},
[10234]={nameES="Reliquias de Rhudaur",objectivesES={"Arienh está acampada a la entrada del lugar llamado Garth Agarwen. Te ha pedido que busques en las zonas exteriores de los galgals, el arboreto y la fortaleza de Garth Agarwen baratijas que ayuden a los Eglain a sobrevivir.\
\
Arienh te ha pedido que busques reliquias de los días antiguos cuando estés en Garth Agarwen.","Lleva las reliquias a Arienh","Los Eglain dependen del comercio de reliquias antiguas para obtener alimentos y otras necesidades básicas. Arienh cree que Garth Agarwen contiene tal abundancia de reliquias que su pueblo no carecerá de nada durante muchos años.","Reliquias de Rhudaur"}},
[10235]={nameES="Relics of Victory",objectivesES={"Deliver the relics to Artamir at Haerondir","Relics can be found throughout Dol Acharn in eastern Dagorlad.\
\
You have arrived at Dol Acharn and discovered relics that might be of interest to Artamir. You should gather them and deliver them to him when you are able.","Dol Acharn was once a great monument to victory over the Wainriders, but now it has been reduced to ruins and forever tarnished by time and the Enemy.","Artamir can be found at Haerondir in the Wastes.\
\
You have gathered many relics from Dol Acharn and should now deliver them to Artamir at Haerondir.","While exploring the ruins of Dol Acharn, you have encountered relics of significant age. It remains unclear if they are of old Gondorian make or were given as a gift by the North-men who came to Gondor's aid in times of strife.\
\
You decide to collect the relics in the hope that Artamir can identify them.","Relics of Victory"}},
[10236]={nameES="Relics of the Fallen",objectivesES={"Defeat giants to recover a relic","The giant encampments may be found far to the south of Zudrugund.\
\
Frithgeir has asked you to recover a relic from the giants in Thrór's Coomb.","The ruins among which the giants have made their encampments also house lost relics of the exiles from Erebor, who dwelt here once long ago.","Defeat giants to recover relics","Talk to Frithgeir at Zudrugund","Recovered a relic","Relics of the Fallen","Frithgeir is at Zudrugund, north of the giant encampments.\
\
You should bring the relic that you recovered to Frithgeir."}},
[10237]={nameES="Relieving the Guard",objectivesES={"Relieving the Guard","Talk to Lóssi","Guards have become injured in the fight against the Jangovar, outside Hammerstead.\
\
You should aid injured guards.","Many of Hammerstead's guards have been injured by the Jangovar Easterlings. Lóssi has asked you to do what you can to help them.","You should talk to Lóssi, who can be found defending Hammerstead."}},
[10238]={nameES="Mercancías restantes",objectivesES={"Lleva los suministros recuperados a Daegennan","Daegennan cree que pueden encontrarse más de los suministros perdidos en el camino a Rivendel, al este de Gwingris.\
\
Daegennan te ha pedido que recuperes más de los suministros perdidos.","Mercancías restantes","El paquete de suministros que has traído a Gwingris inquietan a Daegennan enormemente."}},
[10239]={nameES="Remains of the Kill",objectivesES={}},
[10240]={nameES="Remedios contra los males",objectivesES={"Has encontrado el camino hacia el nivel inferior de la bótica. Pero Indagir no se encuentra por ningún lado.\
\
Deberías despejar el camino y encontrar a Indagir.","Continúa más allá en la bótica","Encuentra a Indagir en Thaurisgar","La puerta parece estar cerrada","La puerta se ha abierto. Deberías explorar la sala principal de la bótica y tratar de encontrar a Indagir.","Derrota a los Gemelos - Kurja y Karsija","Ve a la sala principal","Has derrotado a los Gemelos, pero parece que Indagir solo te estaba usando para conseguir lo que quería.","Desbloquea la puerta","Habla con Torvendor en Thaurisgar","Encuentra un camino al nivel inferior","Indagir debe estar en la sala principal","Thaurisgar ha sido dejado a su suerte, con todo tipo de experimentos retorcidos y repugnantes libres para pudrirse y correr salvajemente. Un experimento desastroso dejó una gran parte del espacio inutilizable o invadido por sus víctimas marcadas.","Indagir debe estar más allá de la puerta","Torvendor ha presenciado la traición de Indagir. Sospechaba de él desde el principio. Deberías hablar con Torvendor.\
\
Torvendor se puede encontrar en Bail Avarc, fuera de Carn Dûm.","Indagir te ha pedido que despejes el camino antes de poder explorar más a fondo la bótica.\
\
Encuentra el camino al nivel inferior.","Has encontrado a Indagir en la sala principal de Thaurisgar. Pero parece que los experimentos más retorcidos le bloquean el camino.","Remedios contra los males","Indagir te pide tu ayuda para explorar dentro de Thaurisgar, la bótica infame. Deberías hablar con Indagir si deseas ayudarlo.\
\
Indagir se puede encontrar en Bail Avarc, fuera de Carn Dûm.","Habla con Indagir","Indagir te ha pedido que lo encuentres en Thaurisgar, la bótica infame.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Usa el Buscador de Instancias para entrar en Thaurisgar, la bótica infame.</rgb>"}},
[10241]={nameES="Remedios para la Enfermedad",objectivesES={"Las bayas de acebo a veces pueden encontrarse en los ucornos y trolls silvanos que acechan Eregion Occidental.","Lleva las bayas de acebo a Lornel en Idhobel","Lornel está junto a la fogata en Idhobel.","Remedios para la Enfermedad","Lornel necesita bayas de acebo para varios de sus remedios medicinales."}},
[10242]={nameES="Remembering Thrymm",objectivesES={"Speak with Gárwig","Cyneberg is impressed with your actions and how you helped Forlaw in these gloomy times. She would like to tell you about how you remind her of Thrymm.","Listen to Cyneberg recount a story of Thrymm's past","Gárwig also enjoyed listening to the tale of Thrymm defending Forlaw. It is rare to hear stories of hope these days.","Cyneberg tells you of the first attack on Forlaw by the White Hand. Not long ago, while Cyneberg was in Scylfig and before Thrymm left to join her, Thrymm and the twin sons of Gárwig courageously defended Forlaw from a large Orc attack.","Remembering Thrymm"}},
[10243]={nameES="Recordando las canciones de antaño",objectivesES={"Hamall está en Jazârgund, al oeste de Fehem-dûm y Hadâd-dûm.\
\
La moral de Hamall crecerá enormemente gracias a las antiguas canciones de los enanos que has recuperado.","La moral de los enanos de Jazârgund está muy baja, y muchos piensan que unas canciones alegres podrían ayudar a mejorar su ánimo.","Las partituras del enano bardo han sido dispersadas por los campamentos orcos de Fehem-dûm y Hadâd-dûm.\
\
Habiendo fallado su plan, Hamall querría levantar los ánimos de sus compañeros enanos de Jazârgund. Cree que recuperando las canciones de antaño perdidas por el bardo enloquecido logrará su objetivo.","Lleva las partituras a Hamall","Recordando las canciones de antaño"}},
[10244]={nameES="Remmorchant, the Net of Darkness -- Tier 1",objectivesES={"Defeat Rûkhor the Pale Herald","Thossulun the Massive, daughter of Shelob and Queen of all gredbyg, must be defeated to stem the tide of insects harassing your allies.","Defeat Bratha Tasakh, Lady of Many Venoms","Remmorchant, the Net of Darkness -- Tier 1","The Ungoladan chieftain, Bratha Tasakh, Lady of Many Venoms, bars your path deeper into the Remmorchant.","The last challenge is finally upon you: defeat Ungwetári herself!","Defeat Thossulun the Massive","Defeat Shelob the Great, Last Child of Ungoliant","Celeborn leads a company of brave adventurers into the depths of the Remmorchant seeking to bring about the final defeat of his ancient foe. Meanwhile, Rûkhor the Pale Herald is enacting his vile plan to unleash the unending hunger of Shelob the Great upon all of Middle-earth.","Rûkhor the Pale Herald has unveiled his nefarious scheme to you. You must defeat him and his Bloodless captain, Zabothak, to prevent Shelob from being unleashed!"}},
[10245]={nameES="Remmorchant, the Net of Darkness -- Tier 2",objectivesES={"Defeat Rûkhor the Pale Herald","Thossulun the Massive, daughter of Shelob and Queen of all gredbyg, must be defeated to stem the tide of insects harassing your allies.","Defeat Bratha Tasakh, Lady of Many Venoms","The Ungoladan chieftain, Bratha Tasakh, Lady of Many Venoms, bars your path deeper into the Remmorchant.","The last challenge is finally upon you: defeat Ungwetári herself!","Defeat Thossulun the Massive","Defeat Shelob the Great, Last Child of Ungoliant","Remmorchant, the Net of Darkness -- Tier 2","Rûkhor the Pale Herald has unveiled his nefarious scheme to you. You must defeat him and his Bloodless captain, Zabothak, to prevent Shelob from being unleashed!","Celeborn leads a company of brave adventurers into the depths of the Remmorchant seeking to bring about the final defeat of his ancient foe. Meanwhile, Rûkhor the Pale Herald is enacting his vile plan to unleash the unending hunger of Shelob the Great upon all of Middle-earth."}},
[10246]={nameES="Remmorchant, the Net of Darkness -- Tier 3",objectivesES={"Defeat Rûkhor the Pale Herald","Thossulun the Massive, daughter of Shelob and Queen of all gredbyg, must be defeated to stem the tide of insects harassing your allies.","Defeat Bratha Tasakh, Lady of Many Venoms","Remmorchant, the Net of Darkness -- Tier 3","The Ungoladan chieftain, Bratha Tasakh, Lady of Many Venoms, bars your path deeper into the Remmorchant.","The last challenge is finally upon you: defeat Ungwetári herself!","Defeat Thossulun the Massive","Defeat Shelob the Great, Last Child of Ungoliant","Celeborn leads a company of brave adventurers into the depths of the Remmorchant seeking to bring about the final defeat of his ancient foe. Meanwhile, Rûkhor the Pale Herald is enacting his vile plan to unleash the unending hunger of Shelob the Great upon all of Middle-earth.","Rûkhor the Pale Herald has unveiled his nefarious scheme to you. You must defeat him and his Bloodless captain, Zabothak, to prevent Shelob from being unleashed!"}},
[10247]={nameES="Remmorchant, the Net of Darkness -- Tier 4",objectivesES={"Defeat Rûkhor the Pale Herald","Thossulun the Massive, daughter of Shelob and Queen of all gredbyg, must be defeated to stem the tide of insects harassing your allies.","Defeat Bratha Tasakh, Lady of Many Venoms","The Ungoladan chieftain, Bratha Tasakh, Lady of Many Venoms, bars your path deeper into the Remmorchant.","The last challenge is finally upon you: defeat Ungwetári herself!","Defeat Thossulun the Massive","Defeat Shelob the Great, Last Child of Ungoliant","Celeborn leads a company of brave adventurers into the depths of the Remmorchant seeking to bring about the final defeat of his ancient foe. Meanwhile, Rûkhor the Pale Herald is enacting his vile plan to unleash the unending hunger of Shelob the Great upon all of Middle-earth.","Rûkhor the Pale Herald has unveiled his nefarious scheme to you. You must defeat him and his Bloodless captain, Zabothak, to prevent Shelob from being unleashed!","Remmorchant, the Net of Darkness -- Tier 4"}},
[10248]={nameES="Remmorchant, the Net of Darkness -- Tier 5",objectivesES={"Defeat Rûkhor the Pale Herald","Remmorchant, the Net of Darkness -- Tier 5","Thossulun the Massive, daughter of Shelob and Queen of all gredbyg, must be defeated to stem the tide of insects harassing your allies.","Defeat Bratha Tasakh, Lady of Many Venoms","The Ungoladan chieftain, Bratha Tasakh, Lady of Many Venoms, bars your path deeper into the Remmorchant.","The last challenge is finally upon you: defeat Ungwetári herself!","Defeat Thossulun the Massive","Defeat Shelob the Great, Last Child of Ungoliant","Celeborn leads a company of brave adventurers into the depths of the Remmorchant seeking to bring about the final defeat of his ancient foe. Meanwhile, Rûkhor the Pale Herald is enacting his vile plan to unleash the unending hunger of Shelob the Great upon all of Middle-earth.","Rûkhor the Pale Herald has unveiled his nefarious scheme to you. You must defeat him and his Bloodless captain, Zabothak, to prevent Shelob from being unleashed!"}},
[10249]={nameES="Remnants of Evil",objectivesES={}},
[10250]={nameES="Remnants of the Captain's Forces",objectivesES={}},
[10251]={nameES="Remnants of the Fallen",objectivesES={"Talk to Garsind","The belongings of the victims of the wargs can be found scattered in Shathur-munzu. You believe the people of Arhaim would be grateful to have them back.","Woodmen belongings can be found scattered around Shathur-munzu.\
\
You should collect Woodmen belongings.","Garsind, the chieftain of Arhaim, would be interested in these belongings.\
\
You should talk to Garsind in Arhaim.","Remnants of the Fallen"}},
[10252]={nameES="Remnants of the Hunt",objectivesES={"Find the item at the first patrol point","Find the item at the second patrol point","Bring the recovered items to Ardwyn at Forthbrond","The items Ardwyn has requested lie along a path through the vallet to the west of Forthbrond.\
\
Ardwyn has asked you to recover the belongings of his missing patrol.","Remnants of the Hunt","Find the item at the third patrol point","Found the item at the third patrol point","Ardwyn is at Forthbrond, east of the valley.\
\
You should deliver the items you recovered to Ardwyn.","Ardwyn told you of a patrol that went missing a while back and how the Dunlendings appear to have left personal belongings on the trail as evidence of their attack on the patrol.","Found the item at the second patrol point","Found the item at the first patrol point","The items Ardwyn has requested lie along a path through the valley to the west of Forthbrond.\
\
Ardwyn has asked you to recover the belongings of his missing patrol."}},
[10253]={nameES="Remnants of the Past",objectivesES={"The Lich Bluffs are the final resting place of many of the fallen from the Algraig clans. However, a dark force has emerged from the shadows, bringing forth wights to attack the living.","Mincham is located south and slightly east of the large Gondorian ruins in the Lich Bluffs.\
\
You should return to Mincham and let him know that you have defeated many wights.","Talk to Mincham in the Lich Bluffs","These creatures move among many of the barrows in the southern reaches of the Lich Bluffs. \
  \
Mincham has asked you to seek out and defeat any wights that you might encounter.","Remnants of the Past"}},
[10254]={nameES="Restos de las ruinas",objectivesES={"Restos de las ruinas","Lleva los fragmentos de mithril a Sigir en Anazârmekhem","Las forjas de Khazad-dûm se encuentran al suroeste de Anazârmekhem.\
\
Sigir te pidió que recolectaras fragmentos de mithril de las fuerzas del Enemigo que ahora habitan las forjas de Khazad-dûm.","Las forjas de Khazad-dûm fueron en su día el corazón herrero de Moria. Allí, los inigualables herreros enanos trabajaban el mithril y forjaban sus mayores maravillas. Desde su caída, las forjas de Khazad-dûm se han visto inundadas por enormes aludes de lava y pobladas por los orcos de Moria y sus trols y trasgos. Allí, el ejército orco trabaja sin cesar, construyendo armas y máquinas de asedio en preparación para la guerra contra Lothlórien."}},
[10255]={nameES="Remnants of the Éothéod",objectivesES={}},
[10256]={nameES="Removing Rotten Provisions",objectivesES={"Spoiled food can be found in Díngarth.\
\
You should remove any spoiled food found in Díngarth.","Ohtar can be found in Díngarth.\
\
You should talk to Ohtar.","Talk to Ohtar","Removing Rotten Provisions","Ohtar, Esquire of Isildur, has noticed some of the provisions in Díngarth have become spoiled from sitting too long in the stores."}},
[10257]={nameES="Sacando el aguijón",objectivesES={"Habla con Glamodúd en Echad Glamodúd","Glamodúd está en Echad Glamodúd, al norte y un poco al este de Ashúrz Maufulug.\
\
Deberías volver a ver a Glamodúd con la noticia de tu victoria.","Los orcos de Ashúrz Maufulug han colocado muchas trampas alrededor de su campamento, siendo estas solo una de sus muchas defensas.","Sacando el aguijón","Los arqueros orcos pueden encontrarse patrullando en los alrededores de Ashúrz Maufulug, al sur y un poco al oeste de Echad Glamodúd.\
\
Glamodúd te ha pedido que derrotes a los arqueros orcos que defienden Ashúrz Maufulug."}},
[10258]={nameES="Disipando las sombras de Sâd Meryrn",objectivesES={"Has plantado el brote","Planta el brote de mallorn en Sâd Meryrn","You now carry a gift of light and hope for the corrupted Mirk-huorns of Sâd Meryrn. However evil they now seem, these old creatures of Mirkwood stir pity, for their long memory has not let them forget the taste of clean air and sunlight, when life was greener.","Nenedhel awaits news of Nífdir's endeavour at Estolad Mernael, east of Nífdir's encampment.\
\
You should speak with Nenedhel and inform him that Nífdir's task is complete.","Habla con Nenedhel en Estolad Mernael","Disipando las sombras de Sâd Meryrn","Sâd Meryrn can be found due south of Nífdir's camp, but you should strike north and west to reach the glade.\
\
Nífdir has asked you to plant the mallorn seedling in Sâd Meryrn."}},
[10259]={nameES="Renewed Patronage",objectivesES={}},
[10260]={nameES="Renewing the Attack",objectivesES={"DNT -- will not be seen","The last page of orders can likely be found on a Corsair captain in Hata Khezrat.\
\
Gorroch has asked you to seek one last page of orders from the Corsairs at Hata Khezrat.","Orders can be found in Hata Khezrat to the north and slightly east of Linhir.\
\
Gorroch has asked you to recover orders from the Corsairs to aid the warriors of Dor-en-Ernil in preparing for a renewed assault on Linhir.","Bring the notes you found to Gorroch","You have deftly slipped the orders from a drunk captain's hand","These orders detail a plan for setting siege to Lebennin along its southern coast","Talk to Gorroch","Gorroch can be found in Hata Khezrat to the north and slightly east of Linhir.\
\
You have recovered two pages of the Corsairs' orders and should now return them to Gorroch.","Gorroch can be found in Hata Khezrat to the north and slightly east of Linhir.\
\
You have found and read the last of the Corsairs' orders, and should now tell Gorroch of what you have learned.","Search for the last page of the Corsairs' orders","The orders can be found in your inventory.\
\
You have skilfully taken the orders from a drunk Corsair and should now read them.","Aware of the Corsairs' desire to strike against Linhir once more, Gorroch hopes to discover their plans before they can be put in motion.","Read the Corsair orders","These appear to be orders for the initial attack on Linhir, made trivial by the arrival of the Dead","Renewing the Attack"}},
[10261]={nameES="Ordenando las órdenes",objectivesES={"Vuelve con Saeloril","Ordenando las órdenes","Las órdenes recuperadas de los cuerpos de los jinetes fuera de Nímbarth pueden cambiar las tornas de la amenaza contra Cardolan.","Deberías decirle a Saeloril que has colocado las órdenes falsas.\
\\Saeloril está cerca de Nímbarth en Cardolan.","Saeloril te ha pedido que coloques las órdenes falsas donde puedan ser vistas en Nímbarth.\
\
Nímbarth se encuentra en el sudeste de Cardolan."}},
[10262]={nameES="Repair the North Tower",objectivesES={}},
[10263]={nameES="Repair the Portcullis",objectivesES={"Repair the Portcullis","The broken portcullis mechanism must be repaired so that the passageway can be sealed off and the intruders denied passage. The men working to repair the portcullis will require protection from serious harm if they are to succeed in their task.","A mechanism has been destroyed!","The portcullis for one of the passages through the upper gate-house has been damaged and refuses to lower. Rohirrim workers will work to repair the control mechanism and attempt to close the portcullis, but will be vulnerable to enemy assault while they concentrate on their repairs. They will need to receive the proper tools and supplies if they are to fix the portcullis securely.\
\
Merit Rating\
\
This quest starts with <rgb=#FFFF00>Partial</rgb> Merit Rating.\
\
<rgb=#00FF00>Major Merit Gain:</rgb>\
* Supplies delivered to the labourers\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Major Merit Loss:</rgb>\
* Rohirrim labourer is defeated\
* Rohirrim guard is defeated","Workers are making progress on the portcullis"}},
[10264]={nameES="Reparando los Puentes de Glyn Helyg",objectivesES={"Dale la madera a Ponta","Ponta Gochelgar te ha pedido que tales árboles con los que fabricar tablones para reparar los puentes\
\
Los árboles pueden encontrarse a lo largo del río bajo los acantilados de Glyn Helyg","Reparando los Puentes de Glyn Helyg","Deberías llevar la madera a Ponta.\
\
Ponta Gochelgar está en Glyn Helyg.","Ahora que has inspeccionado los puentes de Glyn Helyg, puede comenzarse el trabajo para reparar aquellos que han sufrido podredumbre y desgaste por el clima"}},
[10265]={nameES="Reparando la catapulta",objectivesES={"Las fuerzas de Angmar dejaron atrás una catapulta en el risco sobre el puente del Colos. Los Montaraces tienen la intención de utilizarla.","Reparando la catapulta","Rollos de cuerda, trozos de madera de deriva, pequeños volantes y bolsas de aceite pueden encontrarse en la ribera del Baranduin.\
\
Sardan te ha pedido que reúnas algunos suministros para ayudar a reparar una catapulta.","Cudhaer está en un risco al sur del Coloso.\
\
Cudhaer estará ansioso por usar estos suministros para reparar la catapulta.","Lleva los objetos a Cudhaer, cerca del Coloso"}},
[10266]={nameES="Repairs and Restorations",objectivesES={}},
[10267]={nameES="Reparando los raíles",objectivesES={"Reparando los raíles","Las cribas robas se encuentran en las bases de las vías suspendidas en las Vetas del Cuerno Rojo, al sureste de Guardia Orca.\
\
Auti te ha pedido que te aventures en las Vetas del Cuerno Rojo y repares las cribas que los orcos de la Mano Blanca han roto. Cumplir esta misión no tendrá una repercusión inmediata, pero una vez que las prospecciones vuelvan a iniciarse serán utilizadas para cribar el mineral.","Las cribas utilizadas para filtrar el mineral están dañadas y rotas.","Lleva de vuelta la palanca a Auti en Guardia Orca","Auti está en Guardia Orca, al noroeste de las Vetas del Cuerno Rojo.\
\
Auti se alegrará de oír que las cribas han sido reparadas."}},
[10268]={nameES="Repel the Reinforcements",objectivesES={"Ânghum-maudhûl lies to the south-east of Mithechad.\
\
Harchador has asked you to journey to Ânhum-maudhûl to defeat the Orcs and collect the grim tokens they bear.","Talk to Harchador at Mithechad","Repel the Reinforcements","With the defeat of Darúk, the forces of Ânghum-maudhûl have fallen into disarray, providing the perfect opportunity for the Malledhrim to strike.","Harchador is at Mithechad, north-west of Ânghum-maudhûl.\
\
You should return to Harchador with news of your success."}},
[10269]={nameES="Repetir: Una reliquia en Lumul-nar (Solo)",objectivesES={"Habla con Bróin y viaja a las Salas de los Espejos de Lumul-nar","Repetir: Una reliquia en Lumul-nar (Solo)","La entrada a las Salas de los Espejos de Lumul-nar está afuera, en Zirakzigil, cerca del cráter en ruinas donde yace el Balrog humeante.\
\
Bróin cree que una de las reliquias que Gorothúl dejó en Moria fue dada a los merrevail que infestan las Salas de los Espejos de Lumul-nar y quiere que la destruyas.","Habla con Bróin en la Senda Pacífica","Bróin está en la Senda Pacífica, ubicada entre Zirakzigil y el Camino de Durin.\
\
Has destruido la reliquia que Gorothúl dio a los merrevail en Lumul-nar y ahora deberías regresar con Bróin.","Bróin cree que Gorothúl dio una reliquia de maldad a los merrevail que infestan los Espejos de Lumul-nar."}},
[10270]={nameES="Repetir: Una reliquia en Nalâ-dûm (Solo)",objectivesES={"Bósi está en la Cámara de la Encrucijada, ubicada en el Camino de Durin.\
\
Has destruido la reliquia dejada en Nalâ-dûm por Gorothúl y deberías informar de tu éxito a Bósi.\
\
Has destruido la reliquia que Gorothúl dio a los merrevail en Lumul-nar y ahora deberías regresar con Bróin.","La entrada de Nalâ-dûm se encuentra en las obras hidráulicas de Moria.\
\
Bósi informa que una reliquia de Gorothúl se encuentra entre las Ruedas de Agua de Nalâ-dûm y requerirá un uso cuidadoso de los mecanismos para llegar a ella y destruirla.","Bósi cree que otra de las reliquias de Gorothúl puede encontrarse en el fondo de Nalâ-dûm, donde las grandes ruedas de Khazad-dûm yacen inactivas.","Repetir: Una reliquia en Nalâ-dûm (Solo)","Bósi está en la Cámara de la Encrucijada, ubicada en el Camino de Durin.\
\
Bróin te ha dicho que hables con su tío sobre las Ruedas de Agua de Nalâ-dûm.","Habla con Bósi y viaja a las Obras Hidráulicas de Nalâ-dûm","Habla con Bósi en la Cámara de la Encrucijada"}},
[10271]={nameES="Informe desde Entibo",objectivesES={"El segundo vigilante Heathstraw está en la Fuente del Jabalí en Bree, al norte y al oeste de Entibo.\
\
El vigilante Hierbaroja te ha pedido que entregues su mensaje al segundo vigilante Heathstraw.","Lleva el informe de Hierbaroja al segundo vigilante Heathstraw","Informe desde Entibo","Habla con el segundo vigilante Heathstraw en Bree","El vigilante Hierbaroja quiere que lleves noticias de tu victoria contra los trasgos al segundo vigilante Heathstraw de Bree."}},
[10272]={nameES="Informa al Capitán Helecharroyo",objectivesES={"Con tu ayuda, Ned Pruner logró interrogar al prisionero, Calder Cob.\
\
Ned te pidió que presentaras tus hallazgos al Capitán Helecharroyo.","Debe completarse antes de la \\qIntroducción.\\q","Habla con el Capitán Helecharroyo","Ned Pruner te pidió que informaras tus hallazgos al Capitán Helecharroyo.","Informa al Capitán Helecharroyo"}},
[10273]={nameES="Report to Dâr-gazag, Maggot",objectivesES={}},
[10274]={nameES="Report to Estolad Lân",objectivesES={"Anborn can be found at Estolad Lân in Rath Dúath.\
\
You should talk to Anborn at Estolad Lân.","Talk to Anborn","Banám Lugaun can be found in Rath Dúath.\
\
You should scout Banám Lugaun.","Damrod needs someone to report to Estolad Lân and brief Anborn on all that has been learned about Rath Dúath and Imlad Morgul.","Scout Banám Lugaun","Banám Lugaun is located strategically between Minas Morgul and Cirith Ungol","Report to Estolad Lân"}},
[10275]={nameES="Report to Lugazag",objectivesES={"If the tower has not been taken by the enemy, you should find Soldier Gazlup at Lugazag, south and east of Gramsfoot, in the greener sections of the Steps of Gram.\
\
Soldier Nartul directed you to speak with Soldier Gazlup at Lugazag.","Report to Lugazag","Talk to Soldier Gazlup at Lugazag","You have been ordered to make your presence known to Soldier Gazlup at Lugazag."}},
[10276]={nameES="Report to North-torr",objectivesES={"Report to Guthferth, Sergeant at North-torr","Report to North-torr","Before you left Floodwend, Etta mentioned a report of Easterlings invading the Wold just north of the city. North-torr is all that stands in the way of this Easterling invasion reaching Floodwend and laying it to ruin.","North-torr is a fort north of Floodwend, and is the last defence standing in the way of the Easterlings assaulting Floodwend directly.\
\
You should find North-torr and speak with Guthferth, the sergeant of that outpost."}},
[10277]={nameES="Report to Twickenburg",objectivesES={"Report to Twickenburg","Sergeant Tidlac is stationed at Twickenburg, an outpost on main road running through the Wold. The watch-tower of Twickenburg has a good vantage point of the Wold cross-roads.","Find Sergeant Tidlac at Twickenburg","The fort of Twickenburg is north of Floodwend along the main road between Harwick and Floodwend.\
\
You should seek the sergeant in charge of Twickenburg to see how they fare."}},
[10278]={nameES="Informando los hallazgos",objectivesES={"Entrega la muestra al capataz Indrith en la Gran Rueda","Kaldi se encuentra en su campamento, fuera de la Fauce Vil, al oeste de la Gran Rueda.\
\
El capataz Indrith no le gustó lo que vio en el agua y te envió de regreso a Kaldi con un mensaje especial.","Informando los hallazgos","El capataz Indrith se encuentra en la Gran Rueda, al este de la Fauce Vil.\
\
Kaldi te devolvió la muestra y te envió a hablar con Indrith sobre lo que está mal con el agua y para averiguar qué se debe hacer en la Fauce Vil.","Las Obras Hidráulicas son un sitio de importancia para los enanos que desean permanecer en Moria. Uno de esos enanos, el capataz Indrith, se ha propuesto la misión de reparar el canal allí.","Habla con Kaldi en la Fauce Vil"}},
[10279]={nameES="Reputación: Cañas de pescar",objectivesES={"Los Eglain piden que todos los carpinteros artesanos entreguen cañas de pescar en su campamento situado en las ruinas de Ost Guruth. Los Eglain esperan poder utilizar las cañas de pescar para alimentar a su pueblo con los pocos estanques que hay en las Tierras Solitarias.","Fabrica una caña de pescar y llévasela a Léoflac al campamento de Ost Guruth.\
\
Los Eglain han pedido que se fabriquen cañas de pescar y se les lleven para ayudarles a sobrevivir al duro clima de las Tierras Solitarias.","Reputación: Cañas de pescar","Lleva la caña de pescar de tejo a Léoflac"}},
[10280]={nameES="Reputación: Buscador de enemigos",objectivesES={"Reputación: Buscador de enemigos","Las arañas suelen envenenar a los miembros de los Eglain, por lo que desean controlar mejor la población de arañas cerca de su hogar y de los yacimientos arqueológicos repartidos por las Tierras Solitarias. Para lograrlo, solicitan a los eruditos que les fabriquen Cantos del arco para localizar enemigos.","Entrega el Canto del arco: Buscador de enemigos menor a Léoflac.","Fabrica ocho Cantos del arco: Buscador de enemigos menor, y llévaselos a Léoflac al campamento de los Eglain en Ost Guruth.\
\
Los Eglain necesitan Cantos del arco: Buscador de enemigos para prepararse mejor para luchar contra las arañas de las Tierras Solitarias."}},
[10281]={nameES="Reputación: Hacha arrojadiza de Gondor",objectivesES={"Fabrica tres hachas arrojadizas de Gondor y llévaselas a Léoflac al campamento de los Eglain, cerca de Ost Guruth.\
\
Las hachas arrojadizas de Gondor permitirán a los proveedores de los Eglain suministrar alimentos suficientes a su pueblo.","Las hachas arrojadizas son una forma que tienen los Eglain de procurarse la caza necesaria para alimentar a sus numerosas bocas. Han pedido a los armeros que les ayuden fabricando hachas arrojadizas para lograr este objetivo.","Entrega las hachas arrojadizas de Gondor a Léoflac","Reputación: Hacha arrojadiza de Gondor"}},
[10282]={nameES="Reputación: Sopa de cebolla consistente",objectivesES={"Reputación: Sopa de cebolla consistente","Prepara dos raciones de sopa de cebolla sustanciosa y llévalas a Léoflac, al campamento de los Eglain en Ost Guruth.\
\
Con el fin de contener la enfermedad, los Eglain han pedido a los cocineros que les preparen sopa de cebolla sustanciosa.","Al vivir en medio de tierras enfermas, los Eglain hicieron un llamamiento pidiendo a los cocineros que les prepararan sopa de cebolla para poder contener la enfermedad.","Entrega la sopa de cebolla consistente a Léoflac"}},
[10283]={nameES="Reputación: Capa pesada de algodón",objectivesES={"Los Eglain han perdido la mayor parte de sus telas y artículos de cuero en las últimas semanas, y han pedido a los sastres que confeccionen diversos artículos para poder comenzar a restaurar el comercio que es el sustento de su comunidad.","Reputación: Capa pesada de algodón","Lleva la Capa pesada de algodón a Léoflac","Elabora una Capa pesada de algodón y llévasela a Léoflac, al campamento de los Eglain, cerca de Ost Guruth.\
\
Para poder reactivar su negocio textil, los Eglain necesitan una gran cantidad de Capas pesadas de algodón."}},
[10284]={nameES="Reputación: Anillo de voluntad con rubí",objectivesES={"Reputación: Anillo de voluntad con rubí","Fabrica un Anillo de voluntad con rubí y llévaselo a Léoflac al campamento de los Eglain, cerca de Ost Guruth.\
\
Los Eglain están hartos de que las arañas ataquen a su pueblo. Creen que si encuentran artesanos capaces de crear Anillos de voluntad con rubíes, podrán protegerse lo suficiente.","Lleva el Anillo de voluntad con rubí a Léoflac","Las arañas son un peligro temible para los Eglain, por lo que han pedido a los joyeros que les creen anillos de voluntad con rubíes para defenderse de las arañas que pululan por las Tierras Solitarias. Los anillos harán a los Eglain más fuertes contra las arañas de las Tierras Solitarias.","Anillo de voluntad con rubí fabricado","Fabrica un Anillo de voluntad con rubí"}},
[10285]={nameES="Reputación: Herramientas del explorador experto",objectivesES={"Trae las herramientas del explorador experto a Léoflac","Desde la invasión de sus tierras, los Eglain han perdido muchos objetos y herramientas que necesitan para despejar las ruinas de las Tierras Solitarias, y necesitan picos de minero y hachas de leñador.","Reputación: Herramientas del explorador experto","Fabrica herramientas de explorador experto y llévaselas a Léoflac al campamento de Ost Guruth.\
\
Los Eglain han pedido que se fabriquen herramientas de explorador experto y se les lleven para ayudarles a sobrevivir al duro clima de las Tierras Solitarias."}},
[10286]={nameES="Rescata las gallinas de Dora",objectivesES={"Dora Rizopardo está en el centrode El Cruce.\
\
Dora Rizopardo estará encantada de que le devuelvas a sus gallinas, a salvo de la amenaza de los lobos que rondan su granja. Deberías volver a verla de inmediato.","Las gallinas de Dora están en su granja al norte de El Cruce, al final del primer camino de piedra a la derecha de la carretera principal.\
\
Fuiste a El Cruce para ayudar a Dora Rizopardo a instancias de Peony Cavada. Dora, a su vez, te ha pedido que rescates a sus gallinas de su granja, que ha sido invadida por los lobos.","Los lobos han invadido la Comarca y algunos de ellos han echado a Dora Rizopardo de su granja y han empezado a alimentarse de sus gallinas.","Lleva las gallinas a Dora Rizopardo","Rescata las gallinas de Dora"}},
[10287]={nameES="Rescue Rangers",objectivesES={"Defeat Ulúrilz","Find Viznak","Viznak has been freed","Viznak has been found in the Orc village of Faltor Gâm, tied to an altar.\
\
You should help Viznak escape the altar.","Viznak has been found in the Orc village of Faltor Gâm, tied to an altar.\
\
You should rescue Viznak by defeating Ulúrilz!","Help Viznak","Rescue Rangers","Viznak is tied to an altar. Infected Orcs chant over him","Viznak is free and has returned to his hideout.\
\
You should talk to Viznak.","Rhadrog's condition grows worse, and the Ranger's medical supplies have failed. Your last option to try and save Rhadrog's life is to hope that the goblin Viznak, wasn't lying when he said he knew how to cure the disease. But where is Viznak?","Viznak the goblin is being held somewhere in the infected Orc village of Faltor Gâm.\
\
You should find Viznak.","Talk to Viznak"}},
[10288]={nameES="Rescate en Gha Nêkha",objectivesES={"Derrota a Upóha","Has recuperado Gha Nêkha para la gente. El capitán ordâkhai ha salido a desafiarte. Deberías aceptar su desafío.","Una banda de Ordâkhai ha invadido Gha Nêkha y está atacando a los habitantes.","Derrota a los Ordâkhai que acosan a los habitantes de Gha Nêkha.","Rescate en Gha Nêkha"}},
[10289]={nameES="Rescue at Pahor Boha",objectivesES={"Upokhir has asked you to rescue some fellow dissenters in Pahor Boha.\
\
Pahor Boha can be found in the south-east of Pinnath Gelin.","You to have rescued the imprisoned warriors within Pahor Boha and should report your success.\
\
Talk to Upokhir in Ost Arndir.","Rescue at Pahor Boha","Talk to Upokhir","Many dissenters have been imprisoned at Pahor Boha. Upokhir would have you rescue them.","The warrior flees","The warrior merely inclines his head at you before fleeing"}},
[10290]={nameES="Rescate en Tham Amothir",objectivesES={"Rescate en Tham Amothir","Habla con Pervinca","Gildor tiene algo que añadir.","Gildor necesita que causes una distracción para que él pueda rescatar a Pervinca.\
\
Derrota semiorcos en Tham Amothir.","Pervinca espera hasta que está segura de que tiene tu atención, entonces extiende un puño cerrado hacia ti. Con una sonrisa traviesa, revela un puñado de baratijas de metal brillante. Los objetos son muy antiguos y están deformados más allá de lo reconocible... reliquias de otro tiempo.\
\
'¡Encontré estos mathoms en las ruinas! El Sr. Gildor dijo que era muy afortunada. Hum, también dijo que era muy peligroso, y que debía pedirte disculpas, así que... ¡perdón!'","Has causado suficiente distracción.\
\
Vuelve con Gildor fuera de Tham Amothir.","Pervinca te saluda entusiasmada","Gildor sonríe a Pervinca con aprobación","Vuelve con Gildor al exterior de Tham Amothir","Habla con Gildor","Gracias a tu ayuda, Gildor ha rescatado con éxito a Pervinca de Tham Amothir.\
\
Parece que Pervinca tiene algo que quiere enseñarte.","Con Gildor, has rastrado a Pervinca hasta las ruinas de Tham Amothir."}},
[10291]={nameES="Rescate a la luz de la luna",objectivesES={"<rgb=#FF0000>Avorthal debe sobrevivir</rgb>","Avorthal, el príncipe de los Elfos de Celondim, ha sido capturado por los trasgos y entregado a los malvados enanos Duramano. Se le ha transportado del campamento Duramano a la ciudad portuaria de Kheledûl, donde pronto se le subirá a bordo de un barco destinado hacia el norte, lejos de cualquier esperanza de rescatarlo.","Avorthal está en la cubierta de la Piedra de la Ira, aún amarrada en Kheledûl. Debes liberar a Avorthal.","Avorthal está retenido en la Piedra de la Ira, el barco amarrado en el puerto de Kheledûl.\
\
A menos que lo liberes esta noche, la Piedra de la Ira llevará a Avorthal lejos del rescate y condenará a Ered Luin a una guerra entre enanos y Elfos.","Los Duramano controlan la ciudad portuaria de Kheledûl, donde Avorthal pronto será llevado a bordo de un barco con destino al norte. Este bastión Duramano también es donde se almacenan las cajas de tesoro robadas a los Barbaslargas por los Duramano.","Defiende a Avorthal","Libera a Avorthal","Rescate a la luz de la luna","Has recogido las cajas de tesoro y eliminado a muchos de los ocupantes Duramano de Kheledûl. Ahora debes llegar a la Piedra de la Ira, el barco que se prepara para llevar a Avorthal a un puerto desconocido en el norte.","Localiza la Piedra de la Ira"}},
[10292]={nameES="Rescate en Nûrz Ghâshu",objectivesES={"Habla con Corunir en Norbar","<rgb=#00FF00>Torech Ruin ha sido destruido. Las puertas al Coliseo y a Golodir están abiertas</rgb>","Una antigua fumarola, Torech Ruin, ha entrado en erupción y está bloqueando vuestro camino. Debéis encargaros de ella para poder continuar","Corunir debe sobrevivir","Golodir se ha aventurado en las profundidades de Nûrz Ghâshu, y su íntimo amigo Corunir está desesperado por salvarlo","Erebún ha sido derrotado y Golodir ha sido liberado","Erebún, un antiguo Rogmul, ha impuesto su voluntad sobre la mente de Golodir. Si es derrotado, tal vez la locura nacida del dolor de Golodir se disipe.","Golodir ha sido apaciguado por ahora. El origen de su locura no estará complacido","Dirigíos a Norbar","<rgb=#00FF00>Torech Lach ha sido destruido. El camino está despejado.</rgb>","<rgb=#FF0000>Corunir ha caído</rgb>","Erebún ha sido derrotado y la mente de Golodir está despejada una vez más. Deberíais hablar con él ahora.","Habla con Golodir","Corunir se ha aventurado en el interior de Norbar. Seguidle y habladle del rescate de Golodir.","Golodir se encuentra al otro lado de Norbar","Corunir está preocupado por las acciones de su amigo. Hablad con él dentro de Norbar","Derrotad a Erebún","Rescate en Nûrz Ghâshu","Una fuerza misterosa de Nûrz Ghâshu ha enloquecido a Golodir. Debe ser derrotada.","<rgb=#00FF00>Torech Naur ha sido destruido. El camino está despejado</rgb>","Golodir debe sobrevivir","Destruid Torech Lach","Corunir os espera para hablar fuera de Norbar, en las profundidades de Nûrz Ghâshu","Calmad a Golodir","<rgb=#FF0000>Golodir ha caído</rgb>","Destruid Torech Naur","Habla con Corunir","Desruye Torech Luin","Golodir se encuentra en Norbar. Debéis llegar hasta él lo antes posible."}},
[10293]={nameES="Rescate en Nûrz Ghâshu - Incursión",objectivesES={"Completa 'Rescate en Nûrz Ghâshu' con un grupo de incursión","Golodir se ha aventurado en las profundidades de Nûrz Ghâshu, y su íntimo amigo Corunir está desesperado por salvarlo","Rescate en Nûrz Ghâshu - Incursión"}},
[10294]={nameES="Rescatando a Eluna",objectivesES={"Deryn va a guiar al grupo de exploradores hacia el noroeste.\
\
Habla con Deryn en lo alto de una colina al noroeste.","Rescatando a Eluna","Completa 'Rescatar a Eluna: Enemigo Formidable'","Habla con Deryn en lo alto de una colina al noroeste de la Cuencasangre.","Deryn y sus compañeros esperan encontrar a su líder, Eluna.","Completa 'Rescatar a Eluna: Una Última Distracción'","Completa 'Rescatar a Eluna: Incursión del Explorador Guerrero'","Marget y Murig están siguiendo el rastro de Eluna.\
\
Ayuda a Marget y Murig.","El camino está despejado y deberías regresar a Lhan Garan."}},
[10295]={nameES="Rescatando a Eluna: Enemigo Formidable",objectivesES={"Un explorador guerrero lidera a la partida de búsqueda Draig-lûth.\
\
Derrota a la exploradora guerrera Draig-lûth.","Exploradora guerrera Draig-lûth derrotada","Has derrotado a una exploradora guerrera Draig-lûth.\
\
Regresa con Marget.","Unos cuantos lugartenientes particularmente fuertes están liderando la búsqueda de Eluna. Interrumpe la búsqueda derrotando a cualquiera de ellos.","Rescatando a Eluna: Enemigo Formidable","Derrota a una exploradora guerrera Draig-lûth.","Habla con Marget"}},
[10296]={nameES="Rescatando a Eluna: Una Última Diversión",objectivesES={"Habla con Eluna","Atrae y derrota a un guerrero Draig-lûth.","Atrae y derrota al segundo guerrero Draig-lûth","Un guerrero Draig-lûth es atraído hacia tu ubicación","Rescatando a Eluna: Una Última Diversión","Eluna ha sido localizada, pero es probable que el camino hacia Lhan Garan esté siendo vigilado.","Derrotaste al primero de los Draig-lûth. ¡Vamos por el siguiente!","Eluna y sus estudiantes ya deberían haber regresado a Lhan Garan.\
\
Habla con Eluna","Marget quiere que atraigas a los guerreros del Clan Dragón hacia el sur, hasta la base de las colinas.\
\
Marget te ha pedido que uses su cuerno para atraer a los guerreros del Clan Dragón lejos del río.","Usa el cuerno Dunlendino para alejar a los enemigos de Eluna y sus exploradores guerreros.\
\
Derrota a los guerreros del Clan Dragón."}},
[10297]={nameES="Rescatando a Eluna: Incursión del Explorador Guerrero",objectivesES={"Rescatando a Eluna: Incursión del Explorador Guerrero","Habla con Marget","Marget necesita que luches contra algunos enemigos en su lugar.","Un grupo de guerreros Draig-lûth está buscando a Murig y a Eluna.\
\
Derrota a los guerreros Draig-lûth.","Has causado bastantes problemas a los perseguidores Draig-lûth.\
\
Regresa con Marget."}},
[10298]={nameES="Rescatando la venganza",objectivesES={"Lagorlam resultó herido mientras llevaba a cabo su venganza contra los trolls. Con su ira saciada, ha ofrecido dejar Taur Gonwaith contigo.","Has escoltado a Lagorlam a salvo.","Escolta a Lagorlam a salvo.","Rescatando la venganza","Lagorlam, miembro de la compañía de elfos que vino al norte con Gildor Inglorion, entró en Taur Gonwaith buscando venganza contra los trolls que atacaron Lin Giliath.","Thaliollang está en Lin Giliath, al noroeste de Taur Gonwaith.\
\
Thaliollang se alegrará de saber que rescataste a Lagorlam del bosque de Taur Gonwaith."}},
[10299]={nameES="Rescuing the Knight",objectivesES={}},
[10300]={nameES="El rescate de los Scurloc",objectivesES={"Rescata a Arwel","Has conseguido liberar a todos los Scurloc. Deberías volver con Edrud y decirle que están todos a salvo.\
\
Edrud está en la granja Scurloc, en el noreste de Cardolan.","Edrud Scurloc te ha pedido que rescates a su marido y sus hijos, quienes fueron a la granja Hove a luchar contra los trasgos.\
\
La granja Hove está en el noreste de Cardolan.","Vuelve con Edrud","Rescata a Cledd","Rescata a Tom","El rescate de los Scurloc","Rescata a Tomur"}},
[10301]={nameES="Rescatando los vegetales",objectivesES={"Has rescatado una docena de los vegetales robados de Corbo del túnel de musarañas bajo las tierras agrícolas de Entibo. Debes devolverlos a él en el centro del pueblo de Entibo, en las Tierras de Bree.","Rescatando los vegetales","Las musarañas ladronas han robado los vegetales de Corbo Tunelero.","Corbo te ha pedido que recuperes algunos de sus vegetales si te encuentras en el túnel de musarañas ubicado al sureste del centro del pueblo de Entibo, en las Tierras de Bree.","Devuelve los vegetales a Corbo Tunelero"}},
[10302]={nameES="Reserves of Courage",objectivesES={"Talk to Echadon at the south end of the Second Circle","Parchments posted by the Withered Tree and despairing citizens who read their messages can be found throughout the First and Second Circles of the city.\
\
Echadon, the Captain of the Garrison, has asked you to help raise the morale of the people of Minas Tirith in any way you can.","You recount the tale of the mighty dragon Thorog, animated by forbidden rituals but once more defeated at Helegrod","Talk to Celonor at the north end of the Second Circle","You tell the men how you bravely returned to Sammath Gûl to face the evil sorcerer Gorothúl","Celonor looks especially worried and downcast.","Celonor and other men of the garrison are at the north end of the Second Circle, and need tales of courage to inspire them.","Echadon is at the south end of the Second Circle of the city.\
\
You have raised the spirits of Celonor and the other men of the garrison.","Echadon is in the Second Circle of the city.\
\
You have sought to raise the spirits of people in the lower Circles of the city.","You speak of the courageous final stand of the dwarves of Moria, as recounted in the Book of Mazarbul","You wonder which tale of your adventures might lift the spirits of these men","You speak of the mighty creature you faced in the depths of Nûrz Ghâshu, and how you survived","A group of guards huddle in a knot. They speak in low, sorrowful voices","You regale the men with tales of courage in the face of great evil","Recount some tales of your adventures to the men of the garrison","You speak quietly of facing the Nazgûl, and sending it formlessly back to Mordor","Reserves of Courage","You speak of the Hidden Guard and Achardor's noble sacrifice before Dol Guldur","Echadon, the Captain of the Garrison, is worried about the effect a group called the Withered Tree might be having on the morale of his soldiers.","Echadon is concerned about the morale of a group of his men on the north end of the Second Circle of the city.\
\
A feeling of hopelessness has begun to spread throughout the city, and it has affected not just the common folk, but the men of the garrison as well.","You speak of the similarly-hopeless Battle of the Hornburg, and are careful to note the sun rose on victory","You speak of the long conflict between the Hillmen of Rhudaur and the Kingdom of Arthedain, and how it ended","Find the group of unhappy guards Echadon mentioned, at the north end of the Second Circle"}},
[10303]={nameES="Determinación",objectivesES={}},
[10304]={nameES="Resonating Fear",objectivesES={"Resonating Fear","The láthbear menace resides within the wooded areas east of Faldham.\
\
Inhere believes that sounding the Rohirrim horn within the clearings among the trees will frighten the láthbears into retreating.","Inhere ponders the sudden appearance of the láthbear sloth and formulates a plan to scare them back to their origin.","Inhere awaits at the northern edge of the trees, east of Faldham.\
\
Inhere must be informed that the láthbears have not recoiled at the sounds of the Rohirrim horn.","This is an ideal location for sounding the horn","Talk to Inhere about the unyielding láthbears"}},
[10305]={nameES="Resourceful Scrounger",objectivesES={"Dabôr the Breaker has requested that you assist Yâshri in gathering goods from Ghâr Mejet. When sold, these goods provide Harkhaphâr with much needed income to support the settlement.","Resourceful Scrounger","Seek out Yâshri, located near Ghâr Mejet, and see if you can lend her aid.","Talk to Yâshri near Ghâr Mejet"}},
[10306]={nameES="Respect for the Fallen",objectivesES={"Writhendowns Bow-masters roam too near Wilsig's memorial, and must be driven off.","Completado","Respect for the Fallen","Writhendowns Bow-masters can be found near Wilsig's memorial.\
\
You should defeat the Bow-master riders.","Defeat Writhendowns Bow-masters near Wilsig's memorial","Wilsig's memorial has been cleansed of the White Hand presence."}},
[10307]={nameES="Respected by Sul Madásh",objectivesES={"You honour the Kintai and assist them with the efforts to preserve Adagím. You should return to their settlement of Sul Madásh to speak with the quartermaster to be recognized for your efforts.","Your renown grows among the Kintai of Sul Madásh.","Speak with Aralath at Sul Madásh","Reach Respected standing with the Kintai of Sul Madásh","Your renown grows among the Kintai of Sul Madásh. Return now to the quartermaster—they have readied a boon in thanks for your labours.","Respected by Sul Madásh"}},
[10308]={nameES="Respected by the Phetekâri",objectivesES={}},
[10309]={nameES="Respected of Hamât Renewed",objectivesES={"Mizâdi knows your strength and honour and looks to your assistance again as she takes her battle directly to the Ordâkhai.","Respected of Hamât Renewed","Reach Respected standing with the Hamât Renewed","Speak to Lumgâna at Mizâdi's encampment","As Hamât rises anew, you have proven an invaluable ally. Mizâdi and her agents look to you for further assistance. You should return to Mizâdi's encampment and treat with Lumgâna.","Your renown grows among the Hamât Renewed. Return now to the Quartermaster—they have readied a boon in thanks for your labours."}},
[10310]={nameES="Respecting The Fallen",objectivesES={"Slain warriors can be found in Arandor.\
\
You should bury the bodies of any slain warriors you come across.","Buried many slain warriors in Arandor.","Respecting The Fallen","Completado","The soldier Calion wants to give those who sacrificed their lives in battle a proper burial.","The bodies of the slain will be given a proper burial, and you know that this small toil will have a great effect upon the morale of the soldiers who still live and fight for the Great Alliance."}},
[10311]={nameES="Respeto a los gobernantes",objectivesES={"Orchalwë se alegrará de saber que sus antiguos reyes han sido honrados.","Habla con Orchalwë","Las antorchas que arden a lo largo del puente se utilizan para honrar a los líderes caídos de Annúminas.","Respeto a los gobernantes","Quema incienso en las antorchas del puente que conduce a Tyl Annûn."}},
[10312]={nameES="Respite in Shonith",objectivesES={}},
[10313]={nameES="Rest Easy",objectivesES={}},
[10314]={nameES="Rest and Relaxation",objectivesES={"You feel refreshed and reinvigorated","Rest and Relaxation","Talk to Yosarin in the Lower Ward","Yosarin is by the baths in the Lower Ward.","Enter the waters of the Baths of Kadax in the Lower Ward","<rgb=#00FF00>Sit</rgb> in the baths of Kadax in the Lower Ward","Yosarin was right! You cannot relax even for two minutes!","Relax within the baths without leaving","The water is warm and soothing","Yosarin asked you to sit in the baths nearby and relax. She does not think you will be able to do it!","Yosarin has challenged you to relax. Can you do it?","Yosarin challenged you to remain in the baths for two minutes, enjoying the water and not thinking about your daily cares."}},
[10315]={nameES="Por fin, descanso",objectivesES={"Has derrotado a Gostoth","Habla con Narthan en Ost Haer","Narthan está en Ost Haer.\
\
Has registrado las ruinas al oeste de Ost Haer y has descubierto a la criatura Gostoth. Ahora debes volver con Narthan y decirle que su hermano ha vuelto a descansar en paz.","Derrota a Gostoth","Gostoth se encuentra en las ruinas al oeste de Ost Haer.\
\
Narthan te ha pedido que busques a la criatura Gostoth y la destruyas para que él pueda saber que el cuerpo de su hermano descansa en paz.","Por fin, descanso"}},
[10316]={nameES="Rest for a Weary Shield-maiden",objectivesES={"Orc-corpses can be found throughout Grimnesberg.\
\
You should burn the Orcs that Cyneberg slaughtered.","Rest for a Weary Shield-maiden","Cyneberg has reclaimed Grimnesberg, but is now exhausted. You should burn the corpses of the Orcs she killed as she fought through the town.","You have cleaned up Grimnesberg after Cyneberg's heroic efforts to drive out the Orcs.","Completado"}},
[10317]={nameES="Rest for the Unrest",objectivesES={}},
[10318]={nameES="Descansa, hermano mío",objectivesES={"Entrega el anillo a la sombra en Bree","La Sombra Errante en las Quebradas de los Túmulos te pidió entregar el anillo que recogiste en la tumba de su hermano en Bree.","El hermano de la Sombra Errante ahora vaga por las calles de Bree. Si el sol brilla, la sombra puede ser invocada perturbando su tumba; por la noche, busca en los callejones a la sombra.\
\
Una tumba descansa en algún lugar de Bree, y una sombra deja su confinamiento por la noche para rondar las calles. La Sombra Errante desea que lleves su anillo a su hermano.","Descansa, hermano mío"}},
[10319]={nameES="Resting Place",objectivesES={"You have found the second inscription","The location of the final resting place of Cadelhin's father Fernvael has been lost over the years. There are a series of inscriptions which denote his tomb that, once deciphered, will reveal his location.","Resting Place","You have found the correct inscription","Locate the second inscription","Talk to Cadelhin at Crug Cadelhin","This appears to be Crug Fernvael","The second cairn-marker may be found outside a barrow to the south of the Hall of Sanctuary.\
\
Lhudd instructed you to find the cairn-markers which denote the house of Fernvael, bearing the mark of a crowned boar. This symbol may also be found among the barrows of Fernvael's followers.","The first cairn-marker may be found outside a barrow to the north of the Hall of Sanctuary.\
\
Lhudd instructed you to find the cairn-markers which denote the house of Fernvael, bearing the mark of a crowned boar. This symbol may also be found among the barrows of Fernvael's followers.","Locate the last inscription","Cadelhin is at Crug Cadelhin in the Lich Bluffs.\
\
Lhudd told you to bring news of Crug Fernvael's location to the shade Cadelhin.","The third cairn-marker may be found outside a barrow further to the south of the Hall of Sanctuary.\
\
Lhudd instructed you to find the cairn-markers which denote the house of Fernvael, bearing the mark of a crowned boar. This symbol may also be found among the barrows of Fernvael's followers.","Locate the correct inscription","You have examined the inscription"}},
[10320]={nameES="Resting Place",objectivesES={"Resting Place","Bledhun awaits your return at his camp to the east and north of the cairn-entrances.\
\
You should return to Bledhun and let him know what you found.","The cairn-entrances lie to the south and west of Bledhun's camp.\
\
Bledhun has asked you to examine the entrances of the cairns to see if you can discern what power is behind the raising of the wights.","Talk to Bledhun at his encampment in the Bonevales","The resting places of the honoured dead in the Bonevales have been defiled in some manner, causing the Dead to rise."}},
[10321]={nameES="Restless Guardians of the Nest",objectivesES={}},
[10322]={nameES="Nido inquieto",objectivesES={"Algo ha hecho que los murciélagos cerca de Scary salgan de sus cuevas y ataquen a los hobbits en las afueras del pueblo.","Prisca Sotomonte está en Scary, cerca de la entrada al pueblo.\
\
Prisca estará encantada de saber que has hecho tu parte para aliviar la amenaza de los murciélagos fuera de Scary.","Prisca Sotomonte está en la entrada de Scary.\
\
Prisca Sotomonte quiere que te ocupes de los murciélagos al sur de Scary que se han vuelto hostiles y atacan incluso durante el día.","Nido inquieto"}},
[10323]={nameES="Reabasteciendo el Mercado",objectivesES={"Sperling Tuk necesita tu ayuda en Delagua. Tiene varias tareas para ti que debes completar.\
\
Ayuda a Sperling Tuk con una tarea de reabastecimiento.","Reabasteciendo el Mercado","Ayuda a Sperling Tuk a completar una tarea de reabastecimiento","Dado el gran éxito de la Feria de los Granjeros, muchos de los puestos de comida se están quedando sin provisiones. Será necesario hacer viajes a varias granjas para reponer existencias.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando finalice el evento con el que está asociada.</rgb>"}},
[10324]={nameES="Restocking the Skins",objectivesES={"You have collected the skins of defeated crocodiles in the sewers beneath the Sail-haven of Umbar Baharbêl. You should bring them to Eshéra at Hêbatokh, her camp in Ilmabiri.","Eshéra has suggested you defeat crocodiles to collect their skins in Ilmabiri, beneath the Sail-haven of Umbar Baharbêl.","Eshéra has a plan to make some extra coin for you both by selling crocodile skins to a dealer at the market in Umbar-môkh.","Talk to Eshéra","Restocking the Skins"}},
[10325]={nameES="Restocking the Wings",objectivesES={"Restocking the Wings","Eshéra has suggested you defeat bats to collect their wings in Ilmabiri, beneath the Sail-haven of Umbar Baharbêl.","Eshéra has a plan to make some extra coin for you both by selling bat wings to a dealer at the market in Umbar-môkh.","Talk to Eshéra","You have collected the wings of defeated bats in the sewers beneath the Sail-haven of Umbar Baharbêl. You should bring them to Eshéra at Hêbatokh, her camp in Ilmabiri."}},
[10326]={nameES="Restoring Arms",objectivesES={"Restoring Arms","Bring the time-worn swords to Sigênik in Western Khanâg","You have gone to Shukabad and collected the time-worn swords there. You should bring them to Sigênik in Western Khanâg.","Sigênik has asked you to travel to  Shukabad, west of Western Khanâg, and collect time-worn swords there.","Sigênik, a craftsman in Western Khanâg, has told you his plan to reuse the metal from lost swords in Shukabad."}},
[10327]={nameES="Restoring Edhellond's Flowers",objectivesES={"Cellineth has given you a bag of seeds to plant into empty flower beds.\
\
You can find these flower beds scattered around Edhellond.","Talk to Cellineth","One type of flower in Edhellond has been dying out in the months since the war's end.","Restoring Edhellond's Flowers","You have filled every flower bed you could find with seeds.\
\
You should return your bag of seeds to Cellineth in Edhellond."}},
[10328]={nameES="Restoring Morale",objectivesES={"You have been given a powerful mead to bring to the Rohirrim that guard the gates of Snowbourn. Gates can be found at the north, east, and south sides of Snowbourn.","Bring the mead to Ermenrad at the south gate","Talk to Alwyn","You have refreshed the soldiers and should now return to the crofter in Snowbourn.","Bring the mead to Sigbald at the east gate","Éosig looks thrilled and more importantly, refreshed","Bring the mead to Éosig at the north gate","Talk to Fastred","Bring the mead to Ithamar at the east gate","Talk to Alwyn in the Snowbourn Kitchen","Give the mead to Sigbald","Give the mead to Ithamar","Alwyn can be found inside the kitchen of Snowbourn.\
\
Fastred has praised the mead of Alwyn, a local crofter. He hopes to have mead delivered to his guards stationed at the edges of town in hopes that their spirits will be renewed.","Fastred can be found inside the Mead Hall of Snowbourn.\
\
Having delivered the mead to the gate guards of Snowbourn, Fastred will be pleased to know that morale has been restored to his people.","Give the mead to Ermenrad","Ithamar looks thrilled and more importantly, refreshed","Alwyn can be found inside the kitchen of Snowbourn.","Sigbald looks thrilled and more importantly, refreshed","Restoring Morale","Ermenrad looks thrilled and more importantly, refreshed","Alwyn of Snowbourn wishes to aid in boosting the morale of the Rohirrim defending the city.","Hops can be found in the crofts just south of Snowbourn.","Give the mead to Éosig"}},
[10329]={nameES="Restoring Pride",objectivesES={}},
[10330]={nameES="Restaurando el equilibrio",objectivesES={"Restaurando el equilibrio","Los linces que merodean por la Puerta de Thorin son demasiados para que la tierra los sustente. Atacan a los viajeros y a los zorzales, amigos de los enanos desde hace mucho tiempo."}},
[10331]={nameES="Restaurando el equilibrio",objectivesES={"Restaurando el equilibrio","Lleva los pelajes de lince a Nos Grimsong en el Patio de Frerin","Los <rgb=#ffff00>cachorros de las tierras altas</rgb> y los <rgb=#ffff00>merodeadores de las tierras altas</rgb> se encuentran en las zonas boscosas al norte o al este del Patio de Frerin.\
\
Nos Grimsong te pidió que derrotaras a los linces de la Puerta de Thorin y trajeras sus pelajes.","Nos Grimsong está en la esquina noroeste del Patio de Frerin.\
\
Lleva los pelajes de lince que recogiste a Nos Grimsong.","Los linces que merodean por la Puerta de Thorin son demasiados para que la tierra los sustente. Atacan a los viajeros y a los zorzales, amigos de los enanos desde hace mucho tiempo."}},
[10332]={nameES="Restoring the Gardens",objectivesES={}},
[10333]={nameES="Restoring the Glory",objectivesES={"Build a barricade in front of the Aldburg training hall","Repaired the fallen beams on the stable","Repair the fallen beams on the stable","Restoring the Glory","The city of Aldburg is beginning to decay, due to a lack of adequate leadership caused by Éomer's absence.","Talk to Téothic","Mend Bertred's fence","Wilflad is at the stable of Aldburg.\
\
The beams have been repaired, and now more horses will be able to be housed in the stable. You should speak with Wilflad to let her know of your progress.","Wilflad asked for the beams of the stable to be repaired in order to bring more stalls into use.","Talk to Arcil","Built a barricade in front of the Aldburg training hall","Mended Bertred's fence","Téothic has asked you to build a barricade to help with the defence of the training hall.","Téothic is at the training hall of Aldburg in the eastern part of the town.\
\
Arcil asked you to aid the people of Aldburg as they try to bring back the glory of the old capital, starting with Téothic.","Bertred is at his house in the western part of Aldburg.\
\
You should let Bertred know that you have mended his fence.","Talk to Bertred","Talk to Wilflad","Wilflad is at the stable of Aldburg.\
\
Téothic suggested that Wilflad might need help at the stable.","Bertred has asked for assistance mending his fence.","Thane Arcil is at the Mead Hall of Aldburg.\
\
You should return to Thane Arcil and inform him that you have aided the people of Aldburg.","Bertred, Quartermaster of Aldburg, is at his house in the western part of the city.\
\
Wilflad believes that the Quartermaster might also be able to use some assistance, though she is not sure what his needs are.","Téothic is at the training hall of Aldburg in the eastern part of the city.\
\
You should speak with Téothic and let him know your work is finished."}},
[10334]={nameES="Restoring the Lighthouse",objectivesES={"Talk to Erchar at Dol Brannor","Lainil wants you to speak to Erchar at Dol Brannor for more information on the restoration of Barad Rill.\
\
Dol Brannor is west of Linhir in Dor-en-Ernil.","Lainil has asked you to report to the beacon of Dol Brannor to aid in the restoration of Barad Rill.","Restoring the Lighthouse"}},
[10335]={nameES="Restaurando los guisantes",objectivesES={"Las plantas de guisante se pueden encontrar en las tierras de cultivo fuera de la ciudad de Donnvail, al noreste de Fail-á-Khro.\
\
Cána te ha encargado recuperar las plantas de guisante de las granjas cercanas a Donnvail.","Restaurando los guisantes","Lleva las plantas de guisante a Cána","Cána está preocupada porque los Trév Duvárdain y sus amos Angmarim se están beneficiando de la tierra que legítimamente pertenece a los Trév Gállorg.","Cána está en Fail-á-Khro, en el camino al norte de Aughaire.\
\
Has cosechado plantas de guisante de las granjas cercanas a Donnvail para evitar que caigan en manos de los enemigos de los Trév Gállorg."}},
[10336]={nameES="Restoring the Three Kingdoms",objectivesES={"In the aftermath of the War of the Ring, the Kingdoms of Erebor, Eryn Lasgalen, and Dale struggle to rebuild and restore their former splendour.","Restoring the Three Kingdoms","Quests to aid the Strongholds of the North can be found in Dale, Erebor, Felegoth, Lake-town, Loeglond, and Ravenhill.\
\
Dale, Erebor, and Eryn Lasgalen are in need of aid to restore their Kingdoms to their former splendour. You should aid them."}},
[10337]={nameES="Resupplying Kafagur's Hunters",objectivesES={"Rúkbag has asked you to hunt in Jeb Lipha, east of Kafagur.\
\
The hunters require phials of acid from drakelings, as well as hide from the larger drakes.","There aren't enough uninjured hunters in Kafagur able to hunt for fresh supplies in Jeb Lipha.","You've collected enough supplies for the Kafagur hunters.\
\
You should return to Rúkbag at Kafagur.","Resupplying Kafagur's Hunters","Talk to Rúkbag at Kafagur"}},
[10338]={nameES="Reabasteciendo la baliza",objectivesES={"Busca rastros de lo que haya destruido las cajas","Kantâ-vilkku reaprovisionado","El Kantâ-vilkku está al este y un poco al sur de Sûri-kylä en Jä-rannit, en los ventisqueros que bordean la bahía de Forochel.\
\
Además de reabastecer el Kantâ-vilkku, Matti te ha pedido que busques cerca de él signos de qué ha podido dañar las cajas.","Reabasteciendo la baliza","Matti está en Sûri-kylä, al oeste y un poco al norte de Kantâ-vilkku.\
\
Deberías volver a ver a Matti para darle tu informe.","El Kantâ-vilkku está al este y un poco al sur de Sûri-kylä en Jä-rannit, en los ventisqueros que bordean la bahía de Forochel.\
\
Matti te ha pedido que vayas hasta el Kantâ-vilkku y repongas los suministros desaparecidos.","Reaprovisiona el Kantâ-vilkku","Según Matti, el Kantâ-vilkku debe ser abastecido con combustible y provisiones para los Lossoth que lo custodian.","Has encontrado huellas de jabalí y comida a medio devorar"}},
[10339]={nameES="Resupplying the Line",objectivesES={"The tower has been resupplied","Resupplying the Line","Deliver the arrows to the south-west tower","The arrows are at the top of a tower to the east and need to be carried to a tower at the south-west of town.","<rgb=#FF0000>Completing Aiding the Eastemnet will cancel this quest</rgb>","The archers in the southern towers of Eaworth are running out of arrows.","Talk to Cendal","Cendal is in Eaworth.\
\
Cendal will be pleased to hear the south-west tower has been resupplied with arrows.","Resupply the south-western tower"}},
[10340]={nameES="Recuperar la Cima de los Vientos.(comunidad)",objectivesES={"Disfruta de la versión comunitaria de la instancia Recuperar la Cima de los Vientos.","Disfruta de la versión comunitaria de la instancia Recuperar la Cima de los Vientos","Ahora puedes disfrutar de la versión comunitaria de la instancia Recuperar la Cima de los Vientos cuando quieras.","Completado","Recuperar la Cima de los Vientos.(comunidad)"}},
[10341]={nameES="Recuperar la Cima de los Vientos (solo)",objectivesES={"Completado","Ahora puedes disfrutar de la versión para un solo jugador de la instancia Recuperar la Cima de los Vientos cuando lo desees.","Disfruta de la versión para un solo jugador de la instancia Recuperar la Cima de los Vientos","Disfruta de la versión para un solo jugador de la instancia Recuperar la Cima de los Vientos.","Recuperar la Cima de los Vientos (solo)"}},
[10342]={nameES="Retake Weathertop -- Redux",objectivesES={"Candaith is at his camp at the north-west foot of Weathertop.\
\
Candaith is waiting to discuss with you the strange events that occurred atop Amon Sûl.","Habla con Candaith","Retake Weathertop -- Redux","Candaith saw a company of Orcs climbing to the summit of Weathertop, preparing fortifications and barricades as they went. The Orcs have foul plans for the hill and must be defeated before they work some great mischief.","Candaith is at his camp at the north-west foot of Weathertop in the Lone-lands, far to the east of Bree.\
\
You have been asked to assist him in driving a company of Orcs from Weathertop. He told you to gather allies and return to him when you are prepared.","Habla con Candaith y recupera la Cima de los Vientos"}},
[10343]={nameES="Retaking Dol Amroth",objectivesES={"Retaking Dol Amroth","Speak to the commander to begin the assault.","Dol Amroth has been taken by corsairs. Select the area of the city you wish to retake then speak to the commander to begin.","Speak to the Commander to begin the assault","Before the operation can begin, you must select which area of the city you wish to retake.","Speak to the soldiers and select your target building"}},
[10344]={nameES="Retaking Maurûsh",objectivesES={}},
[10345]={nameES="Retaking Parth Duin",objectivesES={}},
[10346]={nameES="Retomando Pelargir",objectivesES={}},
[10347]={nameES="Retomando Pelargir - Comunidad",objectivesES={}},
[10348]={nameES="Retaking River-watch",objectivesES={"The River-watch is a place of strategic importance near the Ford of Isen.\
\
Grimbold has commanded you to take the control of the River-watch.\
\
You can call for the aid of Rohirrim soldiers from the banner on the northern path into River-watch.","The River-watch is a place of strategic importance near the Ford of Isen.\
\
Grimbold has commanded you to take the control of the River-watch. You should call forth a band of Rohirrim wardens to charge the top of the Riverwatch and defeat the Dunlending captain, Neilun.","The foothold of River-watch is a place of strategic importance to both the Rohirrim and the Dunlendings.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>During the course of this quest, you may summon warriors at Rohirrim banners to aid you.</rgb>","Talk to Grimbold at the Ford of Isen","Summon Rohirrim soldiers at the western gate and defeat Neilun","The River-watch is a place of strategic importance near the Ford of Isen.\
\
Grimbold has commanded you to take the control of the River-watch. Your first step is to eliminate the sentries that guard the western approach.","Grimbold is at the Ford of Isen.\
\
You should inform Grimbold that the Rohirrim have retaken the River-watch.","Defeated Neilun","Retaking River-watch"}},
[10349]={nameES="Retaking Torngroth",objectivesES={"The recently-abandoned refuge of Torngroth has been claimed by the Orcs of Mordor and they now stand between the Rangers and valuable supplies.","Retaking Torngroth","Torngroth can be found far to the north of Henneth Annûn.\
\
Mablung has asked you to defeat the Orcs that have laid claim to Torngroth and recover supplies that were left behind.","Mablung can be found in Henneth Annûn.\
\
You have defeated many of the invading Orcs in Torngroth and recovered as many supplies as you could bear. You should now deliver them to Mablung.","Deliver the supplies to Mablung"}},
[10350]={nameES="Retaking the Northern Rammas",objectivesES={}},
[10351]={nameES="Retribution at the Lighthouse",objectivesES={"Dolgimil can be found somewhere in Barad Rill.\
\
Summon and confront Dolgimil.","Summon and confront Dolgimil at Barad Rill","Dolgimil's stare sends a chill through your spine","Retribution at the Lighthouse","Now that Dolgimil has been located, Aras calls upon you to infiltrate Dolgimil's stronghold at Barad Rill and stop him before he sends forces to Linhir.","Herion can be found at his encampment in western Dor-en-Ernil.\
\
You should speak with Herion.","Dolgimil steps out into the room and beckons you to speak with him","Defeat Dolgimil's Haradrim lieutenant","Aras can be found at encampment in western Dor-en-Ernil.\
\
You should speak with Aras.","Dolgimil has been defeated","Speak with Herion at his encampment","Enter the stronghold at Barad Rill","You enter the heavily guarded grounds of a once great lighthouse","Dolgimil's lieutenants can be found in the stronghold at Barad Rill.\
\
Defeat Dolgimil's lieutenants.","Barad Rill is located at the southern tip of Dor-en-Ernil.\
\
Enter the stronghold at Barad Rill.","Speak with Aras at Herion's encampment","Defeated Dolgimil's lieutenant"}},
[10352]={nameES="La venganza de los árboles",objectivesES={"La venganza de los árboles","Los orcos han estado talando parte del Bosque Salvaje y hay que detenerlos antes de que diezmen el bosque.","Habla con Mantoespino","Mantoespino está en el sur del Bosque Salvaje.\
\
Deberías hablar con Mantoespino.","Puedes encontrar taladores y prendefuegos Tarkrîp en el centro del Bosque Salvaje.\
\
Mantoespino te ha pedido que derrotes a los orcos que están causando estragos en el Bosque Salvaje."}},
[10353]={nameES="Recupera Fragmentos Rúnicos",objectivesES={"Derrota a Glúmir y recupera los fragmentos rúnicos","Recupera Fragmentos Rúnicos","Rútur está en la Mansión de Thorin, al norte de Sarnúr, justo fuera del Cuartel de la Piedra Azul.\
\
Debes llevar el fragmento rúnico a Rútur y contarle sobre la derrota de Glúmir.","Fragmento rúnico recuperado","Se rumorea que quedan muchas reliquias de los días antiguos en Sarnúr, que los Duramano intentan recuperar.","Habla con Rútur en la Mansión de Thorin","Glúmir puede encontrarse en Sarnúr, al sur de la Mansión de Thorin, accediendo a través de las ruinas de Orodost.\
\
Rútur te ha pedido que encuentres al Duramano Glúmir, lo derrotes y recuperes cualquier fragmento rúnico que puedas encontrar."}},
[10354]={nameES="Devuélveles su inmundicia",objectivesES={"Dindirith quiere que devuelvas a los orcos la suciedad que limpiaste de las riberas del Nimrodel.","Dindirith se encuentra en Echad Andestel, el campamento al norte del camino fuera de Lórien y al este de Nanduhirion.\
\
Te has deshecho de la inmundicia orca y ahora deberías regresar con Dindirith.","Los campamentos orcos de Uruk-gashan, Drû-garmadh y Athmadhul se encuentran a lo largo del camino que atraviesa Nanduhirion, al oeste y al norte de Echad Andestel.\
\
Dindirith te ha pedido que quemes la inmundicia orca que recogiste en uno de los fuegos que los orcos han encendido en sus campamentos en Nanduhirion.","Devuélveles su inmundicia","Quema la inmundicia orca en un fuego dentro de uno de los campamentos orcos de Nanduhirion"}},
[10355]={nameES="Devuelve la barrica",objectivesES={"Bregedúr pasa su tiempo en el mercado de artesanos de Celondim.\
\
Brethilwen prensó las uvas que recolectaste para hacer un vino fino y se lo envió a su amigo Bregedúr en Celondim.","Devuelve la barrica","Brethilwen desea agradecer a Bregedúr por su amabilidad.","SHOULD NEVER BE SEEN","Lleva la barrica de vino a Bregedúr"}},
[10356]={nameES="Return to Barad Rill",objectivesES={"Herion wants you to talk to Garvir at Barad Rill to see if he needs help.\
\
Garvir can be found in Barad Rill to the south.","Herion asks you to venture to Barad Rill where Garvir is overseeing the efforts to rebuild the ruined lighthouse.","Talk to Garvir at Barad Rill","Return to Barad Rill"}},
[10357]={nameES="Return to Carn Dûm Allowance",objectivesES={}},
[10358]={nameES="Return to Dubarâkh",objectivesES={}},
[10359]={nameES="Return to Edhellond",objectivesES={"Talk to Lathlorn in Edhellond","Return to Edhellond","The scout Dolvir kept a collection of Elf-relics from Edhellond safe during the war. Now that the war has passed, it is time to return them.","Gilanor has asked you to deliver the Elf-relics to Lathlorn in Edhellond.\
\
Edhellond is located to the north-west of Ost Lontir."}},
[10360]={nameES="Return to Floodwend",objectivesES={}},
[10361]={nameES="Regresa a Isla Remota",objectivesES={"Regresa a Isla Remota","Ikhajât se ha ofrecido a llevarte de vuelta a la tropical Isla Remota durante el Festival del Solsticio de Verano.","Habla con Ikhajât","Continúa hablando con Ikhajât si deseas regresar a Isla Remota."}},
[10362]={nameES="Return to Girhâzi's Lodge",objectivesES={}},
[10363]={nameES="Volver a Río Nevado",objectivesES={"Winsig is heartened that Walstow will now be able to stand against the Orc-invasion.","Talk to Fastred in Snowbourn","Fastred can be found inside the mead-hall of Snowbourn.","Volver a Río Nevado"}},
[10364]={nameES="Regresa a Thorenhad",objectivesES={"Descubriste la presencia de un hombre demacrado en las ruinas de Nan Tornaeth y lo eliminaste, asegurando así las zonas más septentrionales del Bosque de los Trolls.","Elrohir está en Thorenhad, al cual se llega siguiendo el sendero hacia el este y luego al sur desde el campamento de Calenthon.\
\
Calenthon te sugirió llevarle un informe a Elrohir en Thorenhad.","Habla con Elrohir","Regresa a Thorenhad"}},
[10365]={nameES="Return to Your Cairns",objectivesES={}},
[10366]={nameES="Return to the Elders",objectivesES={"Blaire is greatly worried about the presence of Saruman in the Dunbog and fears that the Avanc-lûth will be attacked shortly.","Talk to Elder Déin at Lhan Rhos","Elder Déin is at Lhan Rhos, south of the Boar-clan encampment.\
\
Blaire has asked you to talk to Elder Déin and call an assembly of the Avanc-lûth.","Return to the Elders"}},
[10367]={nameES="Return to the Royal Quarters",objectivesES={}},
[10368]={nameES="Returning What Belongs",objectivesES={"Thandor, the Gondorian Captain, can be located in the market east of Tol Ciryarani.\
\
You should speak with Thandor.","The stolen army supplies can be found in the abandoned district to the north-east of Tol Ciryarani.\
\
You should reclaim the stolen supplies.","DNT - Not Used","Many supplies went missing during the Battle at Pelargir, and Thandor has asked you to locate where they went.","Returning What Belongs","Talk to Thandor"}},
[10369]={nameES="Returning the Favour",objectivesES={"Returning the Favour","The Warg-riders use poison on their arrows that is designed to slow their targets when used in small amounts, but a lot can be deadly. A versatile weapon of this potency should not be left in the hands of the enemy...","Completado","The poison has been placed, and the Orcs in Edsig's Farm will hopefully not realize the source of the problem for some time.","New pups are being raised as Warg-mounts for riders in the back of Edsig's Farm. The Warg pups have supplies of meat and water that the Orcs placed for them. These would be effective places to put the poison you gathered.","These barrels are filled with deadly poison used for the Warg-riders' arrows. Taking the poison will make their weapons less effective, and it could be used for another purpose...","Barrels of poison, a favoured weapon of the Warg-riders, are stored around Edsig's Farm.","The Warg-riders' poison has been put to good use. The Warg-trainers hopefully won't find the poison you placed until it's too late!"}},
[10370]={nameES="Regreso con Wald",objectivesES={"George parece mucho mas tranquilo que antes. Deberías hablar con Wald Arenilla.","Wald Arenilla está en el corral de la Granja Arenilla.\
\
Deberías regresar con Wald Arenilla e informarle de tu éxito.","Regreso con Wald"}},
[10371]={nameES="Revela al Desatado",objectivesES={"Encuentra la fuente de la amenaza de los Huargos.","El Uruk dejó caer un pergamino extraño. Las marcas te resultan desconocidas.\
\
Muestra el pergamino a Haerlendir en el camino al sur de Tham Celechir.","Entrega el pergamino a Rhovandis en Idhobel.","Haerlendir te pidió mostrar el pergamino extraño a Rhovandis en Idhobel.\
\
Regresa con Rhovandis.","Tham Celechir puede encontrarse al noreste de Idhobel.\
\
Haerlendir te ha pedido derrotar Uruk-hai en Tham Celechir.","Este pergamino debe tener más información.","El Uruk dejó caer un pergamino extraño.","Le diste el pergamino a Rhovandis.","Derrota al Capitán Uruk-hai","Entrega el pergamino a Rhovandis.","Revela al Desatado","Habla con Haerlendir","Obtén información de los Uruk-hai","Busca un capitán Uruk-hai dentro de Tham Celechir."}},
[10372]={nameES="Revealing the Truth",objectivesES={"Search around the Nink-hai camp for evidence of the Uruk-hai's location","This coil of rope seems strong enough to safely bind the hands of the routed Dargum.","The note reveals that the emissary may be found to the east, along the river","Revealing the Truth","The Nink-hai Orc-tribe can be found south-west of Odda's tent.\
\
Odda has asked you to search among the Nink-hai tents for evidence leading to the location of the Uruk-hai.","Defeat Dargum, the White Hand emissary","Odda has observed a White Hand Uruk-hai among the Nink-hai. He believes there may be evidence as to the Uruk's location among the Orc-tribe tents.","Search Dargum's camp for something with which to bind him","You have beaten Dargum in combat","The Uruk-hai may be bound with the rope on the ground near his tent.\
\
With Dargum defeated, he must be bound and escorted in custody to Stangard.","The Uruk-hai, Dargum, may be found along the Limlight River to the south-east.\
\
You have discovered a note which reveals the name and location of the Uruk-hai emissary who has swayed the Nink-hai to ally with Isengard."}},
[10373]={nameES="Venganza desde la tumba",objectivesES={"Habla con Nökkvi en el Refugio Sombrío","Nökkvi exige venganza en nombre de los enanos caídos a los que se han estado alimentando los Sinnombre.","Nökkvi se encuentra en el Refugio Sombrío, en las Fundaciones de Piedra.\
\
Deberías regresar a Nökkvi y contarle sobre tu victoria contra Trancociego.","Derrota a Trancociego","Venganza desde la tumba","Mazam-dûm se encuentra en la orilla este del lago que baña las Fundaciones de Piedra.\
\
Nökkvi te ha pedido que regreses a la guarida de las criaturas sinnombre y derrotes a la más grande de ellas. Su muerte debería servir como una declaración decisiva para las demás.","Has derrotado a Trancociego"}},
[10374]={nameES="La venganza de los borrachos",objectivesES={"Un Frontero te ha visto...","Bebe una cerveza para compadecerte del pobre borracho reprendido","Vuelve con el borracho e infórmale de tu éxito contra los Fronteros","La venganza de los borrachos","Parece que el borracho tiene una cerveza en la mano.\
\
El borracho te invita a servirte un poco de cerveza para compadecerte de las desgracias de los borrachos de la Feria.","Un borracho de la feria fue reprendido por un Frontero, y ahora se ha quedado bebiendo solo y a escondidas. Quiere vengarse de los Fronteros que le arruinaron la diversión con tanta crueldad.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando finalice el evento con el que está asociada.</rgb>","Ahora que has disfrutado de una pequeña venganza contra los Fronteros, deberías volver con el borracho.\
\
El borracho se encuentra cerca de la Posada del Dragón Verde en Delagua durante la Feria de los Granjeros."}},
[10375]={nameES="Reversal of Sabotage",objectivesES={"The Nink-hai powder kegs can be found within their camp, east of Faldham.","Reversal of Sabotage","Speak to Langfrith about the ignited powder kegs","The Orcs have a collection of dangerous powder kegs within their camp. To overcome the threat of the Nink-hai's black powder kegs, it is possible to ignite their fuses while they remain within the enemy's grasp.","The Nink-hai powder kegs can be found within the Orc camp east of Faldham.\
\
You plan to disrupt the Nink-hai plans by detonating their stores of dangerous powder kegs.","Langfrith can be found outside the meadhall of Faldham.\
\
Langfrith awaits the results of your actions with the Nink-hai powder kegs.","The Nink-hai have stockpiled barrels of explosive black powder and threaten to use them against the walls of Faldham. Having infiltrated the Orc encampment, you have gained an opportunity to ignite the powder kegs while they still remain within enemy territory.","Ignite powder kegs at the Nink-hai camp"}},
[10376]={nameES="Revolt in the Deeps",objectivesES={}},
[10377]={nameES="Reward for the Noble Soul",objectivesES={}},
[10378]={nameES="Rhosgobel: Calming the Farm",objectivesES={"Calm the upset cat","The goat is feeling better now","The sheep is feeling better now","Upset animals can be found throughout the Vales of Anduin.\
\
You should calm upset animals.","Calm the upset cow","The pig is feeling better now","The horse is feeling better now","The cat is feeling better now","Calm the upset chicken","Habla con Radagast","Calm the upset pig","Radagast can be found in Rhosgobel.\
\
You should talk to Radagast.","Calm the upset sheep","Rhosgobel: Calming the Farm","The chicken is feeling better now","Calm the upset goat","Calm the upset horse","Many farm animals in the Vales of Anduin are upset and could use kind and calming hand.","The cow is feeling better now"}},
[10379]={nameES="Rhosgobel: Calming the Wilds",objectivesES={"Calm the upset squirrel","Calm the upset deer","The aurochs is feeling better now","The shrew is feeling better now","The deer is feeling better now","The rabbit is feeling better now","The fox is feeling better now","Upset animals can be found throughout the Vales of Anduin.\
\
You should calm upset animals.","Calm the upset fox","Calm the upset aurochs","Calm the upset bird","Calm the upset shrew","Habla con Radagast","Rhosgobel: Calming the Wilds","Calm the upset rabbit","Radagast can be found in Rhosgobel.\
\
You should talk to Radagast.","The bird is feeling better now","The squirrel is feeling better now","Many wild animals in the Vales of Anduin are upset and could use a kind and calming hand."}},
[10380]={nameES="Rhosgobel: Cleaning the Anduin",objectivesES={"Bring a rusty axe to Radagast","Bring the refuse to Radagast","Acquired a rusty sword","War has taken a toll on the Anduin, leaving rusted debris choking the Great River.","Acquired a rusty dagger","Bring a rusty mace to Radagast","Bring a rusty dagger to Radagast","Acquired a rusty axe","Acquired a rusty mace","Bring a rusty sword to Radagast","Radagast can be found in Rhosgobel.\
\
You should talk to Radagast.\
\
<rgb=#00FF00>Refuse can be fished up in the Gladden Fields and under the Hadhodiant.</rgb>","Rhosgobel: Cleaning the Anduin"}},
[10381]={nameES="Rhosgobel: Cleaning the Tributaries",objectivesES={"Bring the refuse to Radagast","Acquired a rusty hammer","Acquired an old boot","War has taken a toll on the Anduin, leaving rusted debris along the tributaries of the great river.","Bring an old boot to Radagast","Rhosgobel: Cleaning the Tributaries","Bring an old glove to Radagast","Acquired a ball of gunk","Acquired an old glove","Bring a ball of gunk to Radagast","Radagast can be found in Rhosgobel.\
\
You should talk to Radagast.\
\
<rgb=#00FF00>Refuse can be fished up in the Gladden Fields and under the Hadhodiant.</rgb>","Bring a rusty hammer to Radagast"}},
[10382]={nameES="Rhosgobel: Radagast's Garden",objectivesES={"Habla con Radagast","Radagast's garden can be found in Rhosgobel near Radagast's Cottage.\
\
You should gather fruits and vegetables from Radagast's garden.","An empty basket can be found just outside Radagast's Cottage.\
\
You should deposit the vegetables that you have collected into the empty basket.","Radagast can be found in Rhosgobel.\
\
You should talk to Radagast.","Put the vegetables in the empty basket outside of Radagast's cottage","Rhosgobel: Radagast's Garden","There are many fruits and vegetables in Radagast's garden that are ripe for the picking."}},
[10383]={nameES="Rhosgobel: The Daily Egg",objectivesES={"Habla con Radagast","Rhosgobel: The Daily Egg","Chicken nests can be found in Rhosgobel.\
\
You should collect chicken eggs from nests in Rhosgobel.","The hens that roost in Rhosgobel are constantly laying eggs.","Radagast can be found in Rhosgobel.\
\
You should talk to Radagast.","Place the eggs in the warming chest outside Radagast's cottage","A warming chest can be found just outside Radagast's cottage in Rhosgobel.\
\
You should place the eggs that you have collected in the warming chest."}},
[10384]={nameES="Los traidores de Rhudaur",objectivesES={"Los traidores de Rhudaur","Ahora que Dannasen ya no está bajo el control de Neven, no solo busca cumplir la maldición que lo mantiene con vida, sino también vengarse de los Montañeses de Rhudaur, que sirven a la enigmática Doncella Roja de Garth Agarwen.","Entregar las mochilas a Dannasen","Los Montañeses de Rhudaur están acampados en el extremo noreste de Agamaur. Dannasen está en el campamento de los Eglain, al suroeste de los Montañeses.\
\
Dannasen te ha pedido que le lleves las mochilas del Rhudaur para encontrar las pruebas que necesita y recordar a sus hermanos del sur la maldición que los une a la Tierra Media."}},
[10385]={nameES="Cintas y Lazos",objectivesES={"Los hobbits envuelven todos sus regalos de Yule con coloridas cintas.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando finalice el festival actual.</rgb>","Lleva los regalos a Daisy Boffin","Cintas y Lazos","Daisy Boffin se encuentra junto al Árbol de la Fiesta.\
\
Daisy Boffin estará encantada de recibir las cintas, las bayas y las flores y comenzar a trabajar en los regalos para el festival de Yule de este año.","Las cajas de cintas se pueden encontrar a lo largo del camino que conduce hacia el norte, en dirección a Sobrecolina. Las bayas rojas y las flores azules se encuentran en los bosques al nordeste del Árbol de la Fiesta.\
\
Daisy Boffin te pidió que reunieras las cajas de cintas perdidas y que recolectaras bayas rojas y flores azules para teñir las cintas."}},
[10386]={nameES="Riches Left To Rot",objectivesES={}},
[10387]={nameES="Previniendo la enfermedad",objectivesES={"Ymar se encuentra en el Refugio Sombrío, al noroeste de Skûmfil.\
\
Llegaste a Skûmfil y eliminaste a los rascacuevas de allí, lo que frenó la propagación de la enfermedad que transmiten.","Habla con Ymar en el Refugio Sombrío","Skûmfil se encuentra al sureste del Refugio Sombrío.\
\
Ymar te contó que se le encomendó la tarea de erradicar de Skûmfil los rascacuevas portadores de enfermedades que habitan allí.","Skûmfil no es más que un vertedero, un lugar donde se arrojan a los orcos muertos de Moria cuando empiezan a apestar. Es allí donde dos enemigos se han reunido, cada uno con la intención de usar los cadáveres para sus propios fines. Los kergrim y otros carroñeros los utilizan como fuente de alimento, y los insectos, como lugar para poner sus huevos y engendrar futuras generaciones.","Derrota al invocador kergrim","Previniendo la enfermedad"}},
[10388]={nameES="Adivinanzas en las llamas",objectivesES={"Has encontrado otra de las placas de Falgeirr Lengua Retorcida en Anazârmekhem, en las Profundidades Llameantes.","Una adivinanza, escrita en el extraño lenguaje rúnico de Falgeirr:\
\
Peso en mi vientre,\
Árboles en mi espalda,\
Clavos en mis costillas,\
Pies no tengo.","Has resuelto la adivinanza del barco","La solución a la adivinanza de Lengua Retorcida probablemente se encuentra en algún lugar de las Profundidades Llameantes.\
\
Has encontrado otra de las adivinanzas de Lengua Retorcida:\
Peso en mi vientre,\
Árboles en mi espalda,\
Clavos en mis costillas,\
Pies no tengo.","Resuelve la adivinanza de Lengua Retorcida","Adivinanzas en las llamas","Este no es el casillero correcto"}},
[10389]={nameES="Acertijos en la biblioteca",objectivesES={"Estos documentos están llenos de runas desconocidas traducidas a la Lengua Común. Aunque su contenido no te dice nada, los extraños caracteres llaman la atención porque no se parecen a ningún idioma que conozcas. Los papeles están firmados por \\qFalgeirr Lengua Retorcida.\\q","Sót, el bibliotecario del campamento del Mirador de la Gran Excavación, podría saber más sobre los documentso que encontraste. Deberías hablar con él.","Acertijos en la biblioteca","Lleva las extrañas runas a Sót al Mirador de la Gran Excavación","Encontraste unos documentos extraños en la biblioteca de Katûb-zahar y deberías llevárselos a un enano que pueda darte más información."}},
[10390]={nameES="Acertijos en la piedra",objectivesES={"Has encontrado una extraña marcada con runas dentro del cofre","Puedes encontrar a Öndótt en la Antigua Ciudad del Cuerno de Plata, en las Vetas del Cuerno de Plata.\
\
Dile a Öndótt que has resuelto un antiguo acertijo y has descubierto una llave.","Esta placa tiene inscrito un acertijo en la extraña lengua de Falfeirr.\
\
Por la noche llego sin que me llamen.\
De día, aunque me pierdo, no me he ido.\
Todos me conocen, pero solo el océano atiende a mi llamada.","Habla con Öndótt sobre la llave que has encontrado","Has resuelto el primer acertijo, lo que te ha llevado a una placa marcada con una serpiente. Al adentratse en dicha sala, descubrirás una nueva placa con un acertijo escrito por la mano de Falgeirr.","Este no es el cofre que buscas","Acertijos en la piedra","Resuelve el acertijo de Lengua Retorcida eligiendo el cofre correcto:\
\
Por la noche llego sin que me llamen.\
De día, aunque me pierdo, no me he ido.\
Todos me conocen, pero solo el océano atiende a mi llamada.","Elige el cofre marcado con la placa que resuelve el acertijo"}},
[10391]={nameES="Enigmas bajo el sol",objectivesES={"Resuelve el último de los enigmas de Lengua Retorcida para encontrar el tesoro:\
\
Una sala en sombras sin puerta\
Ni madera ni azulejo forman mi suelo\
El arte de la naturaleza esculpió mis columnas\
En mi vientre los osos han muerto de hambre\
\
Baja mucho y mira el agua\
Sigue tu pie derecho y traza el camino\
Hacia el atardecer y grandes rocas emparejadas:\
Lengua Retorcida se preocupaba por su familia.","Tu recompensa se encuentra dentro del cofre en la cueva de Falgeirr.","Has resuelto una larga serie de enigmas planteados por Falgeirr Lengua Retorcida, y tu viaje te ha llevado a través de Khazad-dûm y fuera de la Puerta Este, hacia el Valle del Arroyo Sombrío.","Recoge tu recompensa del cofre","Este cofre es antiguo pero resistente, y no está cerrado con llave.","Este lugar coincide con la descripción del último enigma de Lengua Retorcida","El último de los enigmas de Falgeirr está colgado en la pared exterior de Moria, bajo el sol. Dice:\
\
Una sala en sombras sin puerta\
Ni madera ni azulejo forman mi suelo\
El arte de la naturaleza esculpió mis columnas\
En mi vientre los osos han muerto de hambre\
\
Baja mucho y mira el agua\
Sigue tu pie derecho y traza el camino\
Hacia el atardecer y grandes rocas emparejadas:\
Lengua Retorcida se preocupaba por su familia.","Encuentra la respuesta al último enigma de Lengua Retorcida","Enigmas bajo el sol"}},
[10392]={nameES="Adivinanzas en la tumba",objectivesES={"La adivinanza de Falgeirr te ha llevado en un largo viaje por los grandes salones de Moria, y al fin has llegado a las piezas finales del rompecabezas.","Una adivinanza, en el extraño lenguaje escrito de Falgeirr:\
\
El enano camina sobre,\
El enano camina bajo,\
En tiempo de guerra,\
El enano arde por completo.","Adivinanzas en la tumba","Resuelve la adivinanza de Falgeirr","Esta placa no es la respuesta al acertijo","Resuelve la adivinanza de Falgeirr:\
\
El enano camina sobre,\
El enano camina bajo.\
En tiempo de guerra,\
El enano arde por completo.\
\
Ulfkell cree que la respuesta a la adivinanza de Falgeirr se encuentra en algún lugar dentro de la gran Cámara de los Registros, también conocida como la Cámara de Mazarbul."}},
[10393]={nameES="Adivinanzas en las paredes",objectivesES={"Endrith se encuentra en Anazârmekhem, en las Profundidades Llameantes.\
\
Deberías contarle a Endrith sobre tus extraños descubrimientos.","Has elegido la palanca incorrecta","Este acertijo está en la parte trasera de la puerta que elegiste cuando resolviste el Acertijo del Barco.\
\
Giro una vez,\
Lo que está afuera no entrará.\
Giro una vez más,\
Lo que está adentro no saldrá.\
\
Hay tres palancas en el espacio del armario detrás de la puerta marcada con un barco. Cada una de ellas está marcada con una placa que lleva un símbolo diferente.\
\
Debajo de la palanca izquierda hay una placa con huellas; en el medio hay una serpiente. A la derecha hay una llave.","Has adivinado correctamente y has resuelto otro de los acertijos de Falgeirr","La última adivinanza de Falgeirr Lengua Retorcida es la siguiente:\
\
Giro una vez,\
Lo que está afuera no entrará.\
Giro una vez más,\
Lo que está adentro no saldrá.\
\
Selecciona la palanca que mejor responda a esta adivinanza. Las palancas están en Bhraf-ru, en las Profundidades Llameantes.","Adivinanzas en las paredes","Otro acertijo te esperaba dentro del armario, junto con tres palancas marcadas con placas.","Habla con Endrith en Anazârmekhem","Tira de la palanca que coincide con la placa correcta para responder al acertijo de Lengua Retorcida"}},
[10394]={nameES="Ride Against the Goblins",objectivesES={"Bring Baldmund's advice to Reeve Fríthild","Ride Against the Goblins","Reeve Fríthild is in the Mead Hall of Stoke.\
\
Baldmund asked you to bring his advice to Reeve Fríthild in the hopes that she will see the wisdom of the plan and not be biased by his lowly station.","Talk to Reeve Fríthild","Reeve Fríthild is in the Mead Hall of Stoke.\
\
You should speak with Reeve Fríthild regarding the recent battle against the Warg-riders.","The Council of Stoke determined that Reeve Fríthild should take to the field and lead her people against their aggressors, but now it must choose what front to focus upon.","You have helped Reeve Fríthild against the Warg-riders in the east"}},
[10395]={nameES="Ride for Harding",objectivesES={"You have arrived at a camp of rugged but friendly-looking warriors, with one man standing out from the rest","Thrymm Red-beard is at his camp in the northern Writhendowns.\
\
You should speak with Thrymm Red-beard at his camp.","Ride for Harding","Speak with Thrymm Red-beard","Find people of Wildermore in the north-eastern Writhendowns","A camp of Wildermore's folk can likely be found near the northern border of the Wold and the Writhendowns.\
\
You should ride to the north, and then turn west to cross the border into Wildermore.","Harding has not heard from the people of Wildermore in some time, and he grows worried that something has gone amiss in those feral lands."}},
[10396]={nameES="Ride for Vengeance",objectivesES={"Thane Ordlac seemed outraged by the poison that you found upon Grimlac's person.","Bring the token to Thane Ordlac","Defeat brigand captain","You have found Lúfa, Ordlac's young wife, at the gate of Stoke","Ride for Vengeance","You found an unusual token upon one of the brigands and should bring it to Thane Ordlac","Defeated brigand captain","Lúfa is at Stoke's north-east gate.\
\
You should speak at once with Lúfa.","Thane Ordlac is in the Mead Hall of Stoke.\
\
You should bring the token you discovered to Thane Ordlac.","Grimlac's allies might be found somewhere outside the north-east gate.\
\
Thane Ordlac asked you to ride out against Grimlac's companions.","Talk to Lúfa","<rgb=#00FF00>A guard tells you that a visitor has asked to speak with you at the north-east gate before you return to Thane Ordlac with the token</rgb>"}},
[10397]={nameES="Riders Afoot",objectivesES={}},
[10398]={nameES="Jinetes en el Valle",objectivesES={"Ótam se encuentra en Mekhem-bizru, al noroeste de Athmadhul.\
\
Ótam estará encantado de saber que los jinetes de huargos trasgos han sido derrotados.","Jinetes en el Valle","Los jinetes de Moria se encuentran en Athmadhul, al sureste de Mekhem-bizru.\
\
Ótam quiere que derrotes a los trasgos que se están entrenando para convertirse en nuevos jinetes de huargos.","Habla con Ótam en Mekhem-bizru","Los jinetes de huargos del Valle del Arroyo Sombrío han estado aterrorizando el campamento enano de Mekhem-bizru. Con los huargos reducidos, ahora es el momento de atacar a los jinetes."}},
[10399]={nameES="Jinetes de Nímbarth",objectivesES={"Jinetes de Nímbarth","Burl Siempreviva te ha pedido que encuentres a su exploradora Saeloril cerca de Nímbarth.\
\
Nímbarth se encuentra en el sudeste de Cardolan.","Vuelve con Saeloril","Consigue órdenes de los jinetes","Órdenes recogidas","Saeloril te ha pedido que acabes con los jinetes de Nímbarth y traigas las órdenes que portan.\
\
Los jinetes pueden encontrarse en Nímbarth.","Gente extraña ha estado cabalgando entre Tharbad y Nímbarth. Conseguir sus órdenes podría ayudar a quienes intentan asentarse pacíficamente en la zona.","Busca a Saeloril"}},
[10400]={nameES="Tarea de los Jinetes de Rohan: Orejas quemadas",objectivesES={"Se busca: Orejas quemadas de la región de Anórien Lejano.","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir orejas quemadas.","Tarea de los Jinetes de Rohan: Orejas quemadas","Alguien ha publicado una tarea para recoger orejas quemadas. Se pueden entregar a cambio de una recompensa.","Se busca: Orejas quemadas de la región de Anórien Lejano. Recógelas para ganar una recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista en Anórien Lejano.","Entrega las orejas quemadas en una caja de recolección","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú."}},
