[10487]={nameES="Routine Cleansing",objectivesES={"Thárnar has tasked you with stopping the blight that has crept its way into Sul Madásh before it can spread further. Look for any signs of rot and burn them away.","Found signs of rot","Reach rotting area","Return to Thárnar in Sul Madásh to return his torch and let him know that you have burned away the rot found in the settlement.","Return to Thárnar","Routine Cleansing","Thárnar has tasked you with stopping the blight that has creeped its way into Sul Madásh before it can spread further. Look for any signs of rot and burn them away."}},
[10488]={nameES="Grito de retirada",objectivesES={"Cuerno de Nanulg recogido","Recoge el cuerno de Nanulg","Nanulg se encuentra en Hurmulkezer, al sur del Patio de Durin, a lo largo del borde meridional de las Profundidades Llameantes.\
