[10493]={nameES="Routing the Spies",objectivesES={"Burn the goblin notes in the fire pit","The Beorning Langhár is weary of spies encroaching upon Zarkul-sulûn and wishes to defeat them before they learn of the dwarves' war plans.","A fire pit is located at Zarkul-sulûn.\
