[10501]={nameES="Roving Threat: Bloodtooth Still Hungers",objectivesES={"Bring Bloodtooth's fang to Nazâkh in Zajâna","Nazâkh has asked you to hunt the great jázga plaguing eastern Kighân known as Bloodtooth. It is recommended you fight her with a large fellowship, as Bloodtooth is quite dangerous.","Bring Bloodtooth's fang to Nazâkh in Zajâna to collect your reward.","Defeat Bloodtooth and collect her mighty fang","Nazâkh has requested your aid in defeating Bloodtooth, a great jázga who roams east of Zajâna. Nazâkh says she has been seen near the watering hole of Dân Shatagan, north-east of Zajâna.","Roving Threat: Bloodtooth Still Hungers"}},
