[10543]={nameES="Roving Threats of The Misty Mountains",objectivesES={"Speak with Authi","In your absence, new threats have come to The Misty Mountains. Authi, an explorer in Glóin's Camp, seeks assistance if he is ever to finish exploring the peaks and caverns of the Misty Mountains.","Roving Threats of The Misty Mountains","Authi can be found in Glóin's Camp.\
\
You should speak with Authi.","Authi requires assistance as The Misty Mountains are once again under threat."}},
[10544]={nameES="Royal Guard",objectivesES={"The Rohirrim tower Súth-torr has fallen to the Easterlings and their leaders. The guards of this tower should be defeated.","Royal Guard","Return to Guthferth, Sergeant of North-torr","Sergeant Guthferth is at North-torr just north of Floodwend.\
\
You should speak with Sergeant Guthferth.","The fallen Rohirrim watch-tower is in the north-east corner of their large encampment of Jóshkhin Orda to the north of North-torr.\
\
You should defeat the guards of Súth-torr."}},
[10545]={nameES="Ruby Firefly Lanterns",objectivesES={}},
[10546]={nameES="Rufianes en Páramo Rojizo",objectivesES={"Después de pensarlo, Alwena cree que el reciente aumento de rufianes en Páramo Rojizo es culpable de su falta de clientela en el Salón de Artesanías.","Rufianes en Páramo Rojizo","Tiene cierto parecido familiar, pero tal vez sea tu imaginación","Habla con Alwena fuera del Salón de Artesanías en Herne","El nuevo guardia contratado por Alwena se encuentra dentro del Salón de Artesanías.","Alwena está fuera del Salón de Artesanía en Herne.","Habla con el guardia recién contratado en el Salón de Artesanías","Se pueden encontrar rufianes por todo Páramo Rojizo, y son un peligro para la gente de la zona."}},
[10547]={nameES="Ruffians and Rascals",objectivesES={}},
[10548]={nameES="Ruin the Stockpile",objectivesES={"Talk to Harchador at Mithechad","Blighted wood stockpiles may be found at Ânghum-maudhûl, south-east of Mithechad along the central road.\
\
Harchador has asked you to find and destroy the Orcs' blighted wood stockpiles.","Ruin the Stockpile","Harchador is at Mithechad, north-west of Ânghum-maudhûl.\
\
You should speak with Harchador and let him know that the Orcs' blighted wood stockpiles have been destroyed.","The Enemy's forces of Ânghum-maudhûl have been felling wood in the Ashenslades area in an attempt to procure the blighted wood for spears and other wooden implements."}},
[10549]={nameES="Ruinous Men",objectivesES={"Talk to Roamingstar","DNT - will not be seen","Ruinous Men","Corsair vandals and stolen tribute baskets can be found on the outskirts of Roamingstar's glade.\
\
Roamingstar has asked you to punish the Men encroaching on her glade and dishonouring her people.","Yet unpunished for their treachery, the Corsairs of Umbar have laid waste to the lands of Dor-en-Ernil and stolen away the goods of its people.","Roamingstar can be found in her glade in north-eastern Dor-en-Ernil.\
\
You have defeated many of the Corsairs threatening Roamingstar's glade and retrieved the baskets woven for her by the people of Gondor. You should now return to Roamingstar."}},
[10550]={nameES="Ruinas de Arthedain",objectivesES={"El rostro de este monumento está marcado por lo que parecen ser grandes marcas de dientes, como si varias criaturas humanoides hubieran decidido roer la piedra.\
\
Aunque la mayor parte de la inscripción ha sido destruida, puedes distinguir las palabras 'Ost Ardúlin' en la parte superior del monumento, y al pie la frase: 'para que podamos retirarnos de nuestras preocupaciones y hallar consuelo en tal belleza'","El rostro del monumento está inscrito con palabras desvanecidas:\
\
Duintham\
\
Fundada en el año 1249 de la Tercera Edad.\
\
'En este lugar, el Rey Celebrindor fundó la ciudad de Duintham, para que su gente pudiera cultivar la tierra y alimentar al pueblo de su reino.'","Piedra Fundacional de Ost Ardúlin localizada","Encuentra las Piedras Fundacionales restantes.","Vuelve con Istuienn para contar la historia de tu exploración.","En la portada de este libro está estampado el título: 'De Arthedain y sus Asentamientos.'La cubierta del libro está desgastada, como si muchas manos lo hubieran sostenido. Se abre fácilmente en una página doblada, que dice:\
\
'...En aquellos días, el noreste de Arthedain estaba dominado por cinco grandes asentamientos, conocidos comúnmente como las Cinco Ciudades. Estas eran Henneth Rhún, al sur de Fornost; Duintham, junto a un antiguo arroyo; Carnoglin, en las colinas del norte; Ost Ardúlin, en las tierras de lagos; y Dolindîr, ahora llamada Esteldín.\
\
'Entre los Montaraces de las Quebradas del Norte, alentamos a nuestra gente a visitar las cinco ciudades y descubrir la ubicación de sus Piedras Fundacionales. Es importante recordar quiénes somos...'","Pregunta a Istuienn sobre el Libro de las Cinco Ciudades.","Piedra Fundacional de Dolindîr localizada","Ruinas de Arthedain","Encuentra la Piedra de Duintham","Piedra Fundacional de Carnoglin localizada","El rostro del monumento está inscrito con palabras desvanecidas:\
\
Henneth Rhún\
\
Establecida en el primer año del reinado de Araphor, hijo de Arveleg.\
\
'La gente se reunirá donde el comercio prospere.'","Has encontrado un libro que describe las Piedras Fundacionales de las Cinco Ciudades de Arthedain. Ahora en su mayoría en ruinas, estas ciudades son: Henneth Rhún, al sur de Fornost; Duintham, junto a un antiguo arroyo; Carnoglin, en las colinas del norte; Ost Ardúlin, en las tierras de lagos; y Dolindîr, ahora llamada Esteldín.","Habla más con Istuienn sobre el Libro de las Cinco Ciudades.","Encuentra la Piedra Fundacional de Dolindîr, ahora llamada Esteldín.","Encuentra la Piedra de Carnoglin","Encuentra la Piedra de Ost Ardúlin","Piedra Fundacional de Henneth Rhún localizada","Este antiguo monumento está bien conservado, libre de suciedad y enredaderas. En su rostro hay una inscripción:\
\
'Aquí se alzó antaño la ciudad y Piedra Fundacional de Dolindîr, en el reino de Arthedain, que ya ha pasado.\
\
'En este lugar se estableció el refugio de Esteldín, por Arassuil, hijo de Arahad, para que estas tierras nunca más quedaran sin vigilancia.'","Encuentra la Piedra de Henneth Rhún","El rostro del monumento está inscrito con palabras desvanecidas:\
\
Carnoglin\
\
\
\
Fundada en nombre de Malvegil, Rey de Arthedain. Con la habilidad de Thorhaddur el Enano y su parentela fue construida esta ciudad.\
\
'Unidos en propósito, que enanos y Hombres estén siempre ligados por la amistad.'","Piedra Fundacional de Duintham localizada"}},
[10551]={nameES="Ruins of Ost Ringdyr",objectivesES={"Ruins of Ost Ringdyr","Lieutenant Ingi is at Ost Ringdyr, north and east of Glân Vraig.\
\
Sergeant-at-Arms Ascwyn directed you to report to Ost Ringdyr to learn about the allies of Angmar's Army from Lieutenant Ingi.","Lieutenant Ingi at Ost Ringdyr may be able to tell you what you can do to support the Free Peoples in the Ettenmoors."}},
[10552]={nameES="Ruins of the Ancestors",objectivesES={"Talk to Gori","Gori Stonesetter se puede encontrar en Amdân.\
\
Gori te ha pedido que hables con él en Amdân.","Ruins of the Ancestors","Talk to Gori to travel to the ruins","Gori Stonesetter can be found in Amdân.\
\
Gori has asked you to accompany him to the bridge that crosses the Kibil-nâla.","Gori Stonesetter wishes to walk among the ruins his ancestors built ages past."}},
[10553]={nameES="Rumblings From Leitstáth",objectivesES={"Talk to Órug at Leitstáth","Ir a Leitstáth","Leitstáth can be found in south east Câr Bronach.\
\
You should travel to Leitstáth.","Talk to Kúzun at Leitstáth","Órug can be found at Leitstáth.\
\
You should talk to Órug.","Leitstáth, the small encampment of dwarves in Câr Bronach has been tasked with keeping an eye on nearby stone-giants.","Kúzun can be found at Leitstáth.\
\
You should talk to Kúzun.","Rumblings From Leitstáth","Kúzun and Órug greet you as you enter the small encampment"}},
[10554]={nameES="Rumblings at Hammerstead",objectivesES={}},
[10555]={nameES="Rumblings in the East",objectivesES={"Go to Nâmbadir, the Span of Princes to the east of Kûr Anzar and search for signs of Orcs.","Return to Numûru in Urmâkh with your report","You hear war drums in the distance and smell burning flesh","What remains of the river moves lazily below you","You see Orcs and Orkish weapons strewn about","Go to Nâmbadir, the Span of Princes and search for signs of Orcs","Go two-thirds of the way onto the span of Nâmbadir and scout east, towards Urash Dâr.","Go a third of the way onto the span of Nâmbadir and scout south.","Go two-thirds of the way onto Nâmbadir and scout east, towards Urash Dâr","You see nothing but the impressive bridge before you","Return to Numûru in Urmâkh with your report.","Go a third of the way onto Nâmbadir and scout south","Make your way to Nâmbadir, the Span of Princes, and scout along it. Numûru fears the Orcs are increasing in number and streaming in from Urash Dâr.","Go half of the way onto Nâmbadir and scout north","Rumblings in the East","Go half of the way onto the span of Nâmbadir and scout north."}},
[10556]={nameES="El acertijo restante de Rebuscón",objectivesES={"El acertijo restante de Rebuscón","Hunfredo Rebuscón está junto a las ruinas de Tollobel en Tyl Ruinen.\
\
Has obtenido el símbolo de la sierpe de un cofre en Tyl Ruinen. Llévalo de vuelta a Hunfredo Rebuscón si crees que es la solución al acertijo.","Hay cofres escondidos por toda Tyl Ruinen, y uno de ellos contiene la solución al acertijo de Rebuscón.\
\
El acertijo dice así:\
\
Baja estirpe de la prole de Ancalagon\
Garras afiladas y fauces de perdición.\
\
Las lágrimas de Scatha seguro fluirán al ver\
A sus hijos tan bajo caer.","La llave se rompe en tu mano","El maestro del saber Hunfredo Rebuscón debe saber algo de las salamandras de Tyl Ruinen, aunque parece que está ocultando algún tipo de secreto.","Resuelve el acertijo de Hunfredo Rebuscón","Símbolo de la sierpe recuperado","Lleva el símbolo de la sierpe a Hunfredo Rebuscón"}},
[10557]={nameES="La determinación de Rebuscón",objectivesES={"Lleva el símbolo del huargo a Hunfredo Rebuscón","El maestro del saber Hunfredo Rebuscón te ha propuesto un segundo acertijo, insistiendo en que si lo resuelves te contará lo que sabe.","La determinación de Rebuscón","Hay cofres ocultos por toda Tyl Ruinen, y uno de ellos contiene la solución al acertijo de Rebuscón.\
\
El acertijo dice así:\
\
Grandes y viles bestias de garras afiladas;\
Pelajes negros y temibles dentelladas;\
Rondan los bosques buscando a sus presas;\
Cuyo tormento acaba en muertes funestas.","Hunfredo Rebuscón está junto a las ruinas de Tollobel en Tyl Ruinen.\
\
Has obtenido el símbolo del huargo de un cofre en Tyl Ruinen. Llévalo de vuelta a Hunfredo Rebuscón si crees que es la solución al acertijo.","Símbolo del huargo recuperado","La llave se rompe en tu mano","Resuelve el acertijo de Hunfredo Rebuscón"}},
[10558]={nameES="La ridícula petición de Rebuscón",objectivesES={"La ridícula petición de Rebuscón","El maestro del saber Hunfredo Rebuscón debe saber algo sobre las salamandras de Tyl Ruinen, pero parece que esconde algún tipo de secreto. Debe haber alguna forma de hacer que te diga lo que sabe.","Símbolo del murciélago recuperado","Resuelve en enigma de Hunfredo Rebuscón","La llave se rompe en tu mano","Hunfredo Rebuscón está en las ruinas de Tollobel, en Tyl Ruinen.\
\
Has encontrado el símbolo del murciélago en un cofre de Tyl Ruinen. Llévaselo a Hunfredo Rebuscón si crees que es la solución a su acertijo.","Hay cofres escondidos por toda Tyl Ruinen, y uno de ellos contiene la solución al acertijo de Rebuscón.\
\
El acertijo es el siguiente:\
\
Jirones aleteantes del manto nocturno;\
Bestias horrendas que huyen del sol diurno;\
Moran en sombras, de vuelo taciturno;\
Nublan las estrellas en su viaje nocturno.","Lleva el símbolo del murciélago a Hunfredo Rebuscón"}},
[10559]={nameES="Rumores en los túneles",objectivesES={"Wegil está fuera de la puerta trasera de Snaga-maudhûl.\
\
Debes hablar con Wegil mientras avanzas hacia el este a través de la Gran Excavación.","Rumores en los túneles","Los mensajeros trasgos se pueden encontrar corriendo por Snaga-maudhûl, el campamento de trasgos en la carretera oeste de la Gran Excavación.\
\
Debes derrotar a los mensajeros maliciosos para que dejen de informar sobre los movimientos de los enanos por los caminos.","Los mensajeros trasgos han estado ocupados transportando información de un lado a otro sobre los movimientos de los enanos recién llegados a Moria.","Encuentra a Wegil al otro lado de Snaga-maudhûl"}},
[10560]={nameES="Rumores del Norte",objectivesES={"Rumores del Norte","Glóin explicó con más detalle los escritos encontrados en el legajo de papeles que recuperaste, los cuales mencionaban la visita de emisarios de Angmar.","Devuelve las órdenes a Glóin en su campamento, fuera de la Ciudad de los Trasgos","Glóin te espera en su campamento, justo fuera de la Ciudad de los Trasgos.\
\
Debes llevarle los documentos que recuperaste para que pueda evaluarlos.","Órdenes recuperadas","Recupera las órdenes","La Ciudad de los Trasgos se encuentra al noreste del campamento de Glóin.\
\
Glóin te ha enviado de vuelta a la Ciudad de los Trasgos para encontrar las órdenes que los uruks de Angmar llevan a los trasgos. Deberás localizar el lugar dentro de la Ciudad de los Trasgos donde los uruks se han establecido."}},
[10561]={nameES="Maestro Rúnico: Significado sobre Significado",objectivesES={"Dardúr está en Gondamon, en Ered Luin.\
\
Se te ha indicado que busques la sabiduría del Maestro Rúnico Dardúr.","Habla con Dardúr en Gondamon","Reúnete con Dardúr para continuar tu entrenamiento como Maestro Rúnico","Maestro Rúnico: Significado sobre Significado","Los secretos del saber rúnico se abren ante ti. Capa tras capa de significado yace en ellos, y su poder canta en tu sangre."}},
[10562]={nameES="Maestro Rúnico: El Camino de la Runa de Restauración",objectivesES={"Márus se encuentra en algún lugar dentro de las Fundaciones de Piedra en Moria.\
\
Se te ha indicado buscar la guía del Maestro Rúnico Márus.","Márus te ha hecho llamar.","Habla con Márus en las Fundaciones de Piedra","Maestro Rúnico: El Camino de la Runa de Restauración"}},
[10563]={nameES="Conocedor de runas",objectivesES={"Regresa con Regin.","Lleva los registros a Regin.","Conocedor de runas","Regin estará interesado en escuchar este relato.","Regin está en Othrikar, en las Quebradas del Norte.\
\
Los registros antiguos han sido traducidos, pero aparentemente se necesita un mapa para que las instrucciones tengan sentido. Deberías regresar con Regin con los registros descifrados.","Se pueden encontrar enanos por todo Othrikar.\
\
Seguramente alguno de ellos podrá traducir los registros mineros élficos.","Busca a alguien que pueda traducir los registros mineros.","Regin no puede entender las runas en los registros mineros que encontraste. Curiosamente, parecen estar escritas en una escritura élfica."}},
[10564]={nameES="Runes of Protection",objectivesES={}},
[10565]={nameES="Running Interference",objectivesES={"Maenhador seeks to disrupt the lines of communication among the Orcs attempting to assault Lothlórien.","Running Interference","The Orc-scouts can be found running to and fro throughout eastern Fanuidhol, to the north of Talan Fanuidhol.\
\
The scouts that have accompanied the expeditionary force of Moria Orcs into Fanuidhol are quick and clever. They ensure that the Orc-leaders are well-informed, enabling them to make deadly decisions. Maenhador has asked you to put an end to them.","Maenhador is at Talan Fanuidhol, south of Fanuidhol.\
\
You should return to Maenhador with news of your success.","Habla con Maenhador en Talan Fanuidhol"}},
[10566]={nameES="Running Them Off",objectivesES={"Talk to Gísling at the Mead Hall of Garsfeld","Gísling can be found inside the Mead Hall of Garsfeld, south-west of Krash-bálum.\
\
You should return to Gísling with news of your victory.","Gísling has noticed more mounted goblins circling Garsfeld and hopes that you can dispatch them before they are able to launch a full attack upon the town.","Goblin riders can be found circling the half-orc camp, Krash-bálum, to the north-east of Garsfeld.\
\
Gísling asked you to hunt down the goblin riders which have been raiding the crofts.","Running Them Off"}},
[10567]={nameES="Running Towards Nothing",objectivesES={"Judging by the light snow cover on the rucksack, you believe that survivors may still be found nearby. After gathering your wits, you decide to set off in search of the Byre Tor refugees.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This instance quest is meant to be run Solo and cannot be run in a group.</rgb>","Cerdic has asked you to explore the Balewood in hopes of locating the lost refugees of Byre Tor.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This instance quest is meant to be run Solo and cannot be run in a group.</rgb>","The refugees and their belongings can likely be found in southern Balewood off the eastern side of the Orc-roadway.\
\
Cerdic has asked that you venture into the Balewood now that the Warg-riders have passed. He hopes you will find some sign of the Byre Tor refugees that fled into the frozen forest.","You have stumbled upon a snow-covered rucksack in the Balewood. If you move quickly, it is possible you may find some of the refugees of Byre Tor nearby.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This instance quest is meant to be run Solo and cannot be run in a group.</rgb>","The rucksack can be found off the eastern side of the Orc-roadway in Balewood.\
\
You have discovered a rucksack belonging to what must be a refugee of Byre Tor, but the owner is nowhere to be found.","Search for any sign of the Byre Tor refugees in the Balewood","The rucksack can be found off the eastern side of the Orc-roadway in Balewood.\
\
The light snowfall on the rucksack leads you to believe that the refugee must still be nearby. You should prepare yourself before travelling deeper into the Balewood.","A small rucksack in the distance catches your eye","Examine the rucksack","You have rescued several refugees of Byre Tor, and they now take shelter in a nearby cave in the Balewood. You should speak to Húna and see if you can aid them further.","Running Towards Nothing","Talk to Húna in the hidden cave"}},
[10568]={nameES="Running Wild",objectivesES={}},
[10569]={nameES="Rurik Fennel, cerrajero",objectivesES={"El condestable Vadosalvia espera noticias sobre la implicación de Rurik cerca del centro de Combe.\
\
Parece que Rurik Fennel ha sido un peón involuntario y acosado por los Montebruno.","Rurik Fennel, cerrajero","Rurik Fennel, un cerrajero local, vive en la carretera que va hacia el sur, pasando la posada de la Comba y la Cresta, en Combe.\
\
El condestable Vadosalvia quiere que confrontes a Rurik Fennel por las coincidencias que rodean a los bandidos del Montebruno y por el hecho de que su nombre e iniciales aparezcan en sus cajas y en las cartas que llevan.","Habla con el condestable Vadosalvia en Combe","Habla con Rurik Fennel en Combe","Tras descubrir una carta en el supervisor de los bandidos en la granja del Viejo Bauman, la entregaste al condestable Vadosalvia, quien descubrió que la identidad de \\qR.F.\\q es Rurik Fennel, un cerrajero en Combe."}},
[10570]={nameES="Óxido y escarcha",objectivesES={"The trail of rust continues to the north-west...","Talk to King Thorin III","King Thorin III can be found before his throne in the Hall Under the Mountain.\
\
You have learned that Karazgar passed into the Grey Mountains in pursuit of Vethúg Wintermind. You should inform King Thorin of what you learned.","Follow the trail of rust towards the Grey Mountains","A trail of rust leads to the north-west...","The trail of rust can be found to the south-west of Ravenhill.\
\
You have discovered a trail of rust leading north-west towards the Grey Mountains and should follow to see where it leads.","Talk to Arcah","The trail abruptly ends along the path into the Grey Mountains, but a lone raven rests nearby...","Search the path into the Grey Mountains for signs of Karazgar","Signal the raven to return to Ravenhill","The lone raven can be found near the path into the Grey Mountains.\
\
You followed a trail of rust and discovered another of Arcah's ravens. You should signal it to return to its kin at Ravenhill.","In the aftermath of Vethúg Wintermind's attack on Erebor, King Thorin III remains uneasy about Karazgar.","The raven flies towards Ravenhill, but what did it see?","Arcah can be found at Ravenhill.\
\
The raven you found may know where Vethúg and Karazgar have gone in the wake of the attack on Erebor. You should talk to Arcah and learn what it saw.","Karazgar passed near to Ravenhill when he departed the lands of the North.\
\
King Thorin III has asked you to search the lands surrounding Ravenhill for signs of Karazgar's passage into the Grey Mountains.","Óxido y escarcha"}},
[10571]={nameES="Obras Oxidadas",objectivesES={"Habla con Ansurr en Hulwul-nefekh","Obras Oxidadas","Las antiguas ruedas de agua están en gran parte oxidadas y cubiertas de hongos, lo que dificulta su movimiento.","Los gusanos luminosos se encuentran al noroeste, en las Obras Hidráulicas.\
\
Ansurr te pidió que recogieras glándulas de ácido de los gusanos luminosos. Con ellas, puede fabricar un aceite para restaurar las ruedas de agua.","Ansurr está en Hulwul-nefekh, en el centro de las Obras Hidráulicas.\
\
Ansurr estará encantado de ver que has reunido todas las glándulas de ácido que necesita para crear su aceite."}},
[10572]={nameES="Ruthless and Ramshackle",objectivesES={"Ruthless and Ramshackle","Agnar Brokentooth can be found at Ifbar-athrâkh.\
\
You have collected many Orkish orders and also recovered a missive from Gorgar the Ruthless. You should deliver them to Agnar Brokentooth.","The Orcs of Gundabad carry many orders into battle, but the most closely-guarded plans of Gorgar the Ruthless are held by his trench-commanders.","Collect a missive from a Gundabad trench-commander","You find a hastily-sealed missive on the defeated trench-commander","Deliver the missive and Orkish orders to Agnar Brokentooth","Gundabad trench-commanders and Orkish orders can be found in the trenches around Zudramdân in the War of Three Peaks.\
\
In addition to seeking to intercept a missive from Gorgar the Ruthless, Agnar Brokentooth has also asked you to collect Orkish orders from the forces of Gundabad."}},
[10573]={nameES="Râkh Mathán: Howling Beasts",objectivesES={"The hillside at Râkh Mathán is home to many Wargs. Their dens extend up into the hills where the beasts are bred and trained by cruel Orcs. These Wargs, and the Orcs who train them, must be cleared out if the woods of Rath Dúath are to ever be safe for Faramir's scouts.","Defeated Rukhuk","You did much to hinder the Wargs in Râkh Mathán. Those who fight for Gondor in the Morgul Vale surely thank you for your efforts.","Warg dens litter the hills of the Rath Dúath, but the wargs are not alone. Orcs have bred and trained the beasts to follow their master's lash.","Defeat Rukhuk","Defeat many wargs and warg-masters in Râkh Mathán.","Wargs and warg-masters can be found in Râkh Mathán in Rath Dúath.\
\
You should defeat wargs and warg-masters in Râkh Mathán.","Completado","Râkh Mathán: Howling Beasts","Defeat wargs and warg-masters in Râkh Mathán"}},
[10574]={nameES="Râkh Mathán: Runes of Darkness",objectivesES={}},
[10575]={nameES="Râkh Mathán: Vile Provisions",objectivesES={}},
[10576]={nameES="Sabotage in the Cisterns",objectivesES={"Found the valve gear","Found the valve rod","Repair the main drainage valve","Rathon can be found outside the cistern entrance on the Fourth Circle of Minas Tirith.\
\
You should speak with Rathon.","Find the valve chain","Speak with Rathon","Sabotage in the Cisterns","Rathon has been tasked with maintaining many of the cisterns in Minas Tirith by himself and has come to find one of the main drainage valves suspiciously broken.","Find the valve rod","The main drainage valve can be found outside the cisterns on the Fourth Circle of Minas Tirith.\
\
You should repair the main drainage valve for Rathon.","Found the valve chain","Find the valve gear","The missing parts of the main cistern valve can be found within the cisterns.\
\
You should find and collect these parts for Rathon."}},
[10577]={nameES="Sabotaging Kûr Anzar",objectivesES={"They've taken him into Angar Aragín. We must save him!'","Speak with Razâl near the tower in Kûr Anzar","Mizâdi has asked you to accompany Razâl and Numûru on a mission into Kûr Anzar to weaken the Barkhûshim.","Sabotaging Kûr Anzar","Speak with Mizâdi in Urmâkh when you are ready.","Speak with Razâl near the tower in Kûr Anzar.","Speak with Mizâdi when you are ready to go"}},
[10578]={nameES="Sabotaging the Smithy",objectivesES={}},
[10579]={nameES="Saquear Bolg Maufulug",objectivesES={"Lleva las pertenencias robadas a Bahanneth en Talan Fanuidhol","Bolg Maufulug se encuentra al oeste y un poco al norte de Talan Fanuidhol.\
\
Bahanneth te ha pedido que entres en Bolg Maufulug y derrotes a los Orcos allí. También te ha pedido que recojas cualquier pertenencia robada que encuentres.","Los Orcos de Moria han comenzado a reunirse en Fanuidhol para prepararse para asaltar Lothlórien.","Bahanneth está en Talan Fanuidhol, al este y un poco al sur de Bolg Maufulug.\
\
Debes regresar a Bahanneth con las pertenencias robadas que recuperaste y las noticias de tu victoria contra los Orcos.","Saquear Bolg Maufulug"}},
[10580]={nameES="Saqueando Drûmaudhul",objectivesES={"Saqueando Drûmaudhul","Lleva las pertenencias robadas a Bahanneth en Talan Fanuidhol","Bahanneth está en Talan Fanuidhol, al sureste de Drûmaudhul.\
\
Debes regresar a Bahanneth con las pertenencias robadas que recuperaste y las noticias de tu victoria contra los Orcos.","Los Orcos de Moria han comenzado a reunirse en Fanuidhol para prepararse para asaltar Lothlórien.","Drûmaudhul se encuentra al noroeste de Talan Fanuidhol.\
\
Bahanneth te ha pedido que entres en Drûmaudhul y derrotes a los Orcos allí. También te ha pedido que recojas cualquier pertenencia robada que encuentres."}},
[10581]={nameES="Saqueando Mokûrz Gundul",objectivesES={"Lleva las pertenencias robadas a Bahanneth en Talan Fanuidhol","Los Orcos de Moria han comenzado a reunirse en Fanuidhol para prepararse para asaltar Lothlórien.","Bahanneth está en Talan Fanuidhol, al sureste de Mokûrz Gundul.\
\
Debes regresar a Bahanneth con las pertenencias robadas que recuperaste y las noticias de tu victoria contra los Orcos.","Mokûrz Gundul se encuentra al noroeste de Talan Fanuidhol.\
\
Bahanneth te ha pedido que entres en Mokûrz Gundul y derrotes a los Orcos allí. También te ha pedido que recojas cualquier pertenencia robada que encuentres.","Saqueando Mokûrz Gundul"}},
[10582]={nameES="Saqueando Nardur-stazg",objectivesES={"Bahanneth está en Talan Fanuidhol, al este y un poco al sur de Nardur-stazg.\
\
Debes regresar a Bahanneth con las pertenencias robadas que recuperaste y las noticias de tu victoria contra los Orcos.","Lleva las pertenencias robadas a Bahanneth en Talan Fanuidhol","Saqueando Nardur-stazg","Los Orcos de Moria han comenzado a reunirse en Fanuidhol para prepararse para asaltar Lothlórien.","Nardur-stazg se encuentra al noroeste de Talan Fanuidhol.\
\
Bahanneth te ha pedido que entres en Nardur-stazg y derrotes a los Orcos allí. También te ha pedido que recojas cualquier pertenencia robada que encuentres."}},
[10583]={nameES="Sacred Bull",objectivesES={"This ornamented wooden ox would seem to be a shrine of some kind.\
\
Perhaps one of the Rangers of the Grey Company will know more about it.","Talk to a Ranger at Echad Idhrenfair","You found an ornamented wooden ox in the wilds of the Gloomglens. Perhaps it was intended to be a shrine of some kind.","Sacred Bull","There are Rangers at Echad Idhrenfair to the south-west of the shrine.\
\
You should ask one of the Rangers of the Grey Company about the ox-shrine you discovered."}},
[10584]={nameES="Ofrenda a la Corona de Hierro",objectivesES={"Ofrenda a la Corona de Hierro","Los Angmarim, siervos del Señor Oscuro, amenazan a los Montaraces de Gath Forthnír.\
\
Tras haber robado sus armas, debes devolver sus fragmentos a los altares Angmarim para demostrarles tu fuerza.","Los Montaraces de Gath Forthnír te esperan en su campamento al este de Carn Dûm.\
\
Has quebrado la moral de los Angmarim con tu demostración de fuerza y determinación. Pasará un tiempo antes de que recuperen su voluntad de luchar.","Los altares de los Angmarim pueden encontrarse por todo Himbar, cerca del camino o dentro de los campamentos Angmarim.\
\
Areneth te ha dicho que una muestra de fuerza podría quebrar el espíritu de los Angmarim leales a Mordor. Te ha pedido que coloques las armas capturadas en los altares de los Angmarim, en señal de intimidación."}},
[10585]={nameES="Sadauk-kala: Enemy Supplies",objectivesES={}},
[10586]={nameES="Saddle and Shoes",objectivesES={"Saddle and Shoes","Dringrod doesn't have any horseshoes or iron to make them. He suggested you gather abandoned tools from the quarry at the back of Ost Rimmon, which he can melt and forge into shoes.","Return to Bargwen","You should go speak with Sithgar now that a saddle and shoes are being provided for his horse.","Talk to Bargwen in Ost Rimmon about acquiring a new saddle.","Return to Sithgar","Find the blacksmith in Ost Rimmon and see if he can provide Sithgar with shoes for Witherbreca.","Talk to Bargwen","You should return to Dringrod with the quarry tools you have gathered, so that he can forge them into horseshoes.","You should gather deer hides from the deer that can be found by the Firien Wood, in the western Beacon Hills, so that Bargwen can craft a saddle for Sithgar.","Talk to the blacksmith","Help Sithgar reshoe and saddle his unruly horse.","Bring the deer hides back to Bargwen in Ost Rimmon, so that she can craft a saddle for Sithgar.","Return to Dringrod"}},
[10587]={nameES="Saddled with the Stock",objectivesES={"Horses can be found wandering among the trees and fields to the south of Middlemead.\
\
Déorwald has asked for your aid in recovering his stock. You should find his wayward horses and ride them back to his tent in Middlemead.","Saddled with the Stock","Déorwald struggles to locate his stock after all of his horses were frightened away from their stables in Middlemead.","Talk to Déorwald","Déorwald can be found in Middlemead at the traders' pavillion.\
\
You have returned many of Déorwald's wayward horses to his keeping. You should now speak to him."}},
[10588]={nameES="Llamado de Saeradan",objectivesES={"Recibiste una carta de un Montaraz llamado Saeradan solicitando tu presencia en su refugio a lo largo del Camino Verde, al norte de Bree.","Entrega la nota que recibiste a Saeradan","La cabaña de Saeradan se encuentra al norte, a lo largo del Camino Verde, entre Bree y las Quebradas del Norte. Encontrarás su cabaña en un pequeño bosquecillo junto a una colina empinada, al este de la granja de Espinar.\
\
Debes ir de inmediato con Saeradan y saber en qué puedes ayudarlo.","Llamado de Saeradan"}},
[10589]={nameES="Paso seguro a Gaerond",objectivesES={"Habla con Rúdhan en Gaerond","Paso seguro a Gaerond","Habla con Onora en Gaerond","Rúdhan se siente lo bastante bien como para caminar, pero él y su esposa necesitarán que el camino hacia el norte esté despejado si quieren sobrevivir al resto del viaje.","Muchas son las bestias peligrosas que se interponen entre los refugiados dunlendinos y la seguridad de Gaerond, en la frontera norte del Ángulo del Mitheithel. Has accedido a intentar despejar un camino para que puedan llegar al campamento a salvo.","Habla con Elladan en Gaerond","Elladan permanece en el campamento de Gaerond, en el Ángulo.","Rúdhan y Onora han llegado a salvo a Gaerond, pero el futuro que se abre ante ellos está lleno de misterios y peligros."}},
[10590]={nameES="Safe Travels",objectivesES={}},
[10591]={nameES="Salvaguarda (Opcional)",objectivesES={"Sadreda se encuentra en el Refugio Sombrío, en las Fundaciones de Piedra, al noroeste de las Excavaciones Tenebrosas.\
\
Regresa con Sadreda para contarle sobre tu victoria.","Salvaguarda (Opcional)","El Capitán Demente habita en las Excavaciones tenebrosas, al sureste del Refugio Sombrío en las Fundaciones de Piedra.\
\
Sadreda te ordenó que usaras el amuleto tosco que te dio para invocar y derrotar al Capitán Demente.","Habla con Sadreda en el Refugio Sombrío","Invoca y derrota al Capitán Demente","Capitán Demente derrotado","Sadreda ha descubierto que el Vigilante Oscuro al que mataste no era más que un siervo de una criatura aún más malvada conocida como el Capitán Demente."}},
[10592]={nameES="Salvaguardar el paso",objectivesES={"No ves ningún huargo, pero deberías continuar más al este por el camino","Habla con Glorfindel","Este es el cruce que describió Ivoreth","Vuelve con Ivoreth a su campamento en el Ángulo del Mitheithel y dile que el camino está despejado.","Continúa tu búsqueda más al este, hacia Tham Lumren","Continúa más hacia el este por el camino hasta Tham Lumren, vigilando cualquier amenaza que pueda dificultar el viaje de Ivoreth y Barhador.","Divisas más adelante a un elfo alto y hermoso, de poderosa presencia, que te llama","Has divisado al señor elfo Glorfindel cerca del puente de Tham Lumren, y te está llamando. Deberías hablar con Glorfindel.","Busca amenazas a lo largo del camino","Sigue el camino hacia el este en dirección a Tham Lumren, hasta el cruce a veces peligroso que describió Ivoreth, mientras vigilas cualquier amenaza que pueda dificultar su viaje.","Ivoreth está preocupada por la seguridad de Barhador mientras viajan hacia el este rumbo a Tham Lumren y te ha pedido que explores el camino que hay por delante.","Vuelve con Ivoreth a su campamento","Salvaguardar el paso"}},
[10593]={nameES="Safety and Shelter",objectivesES={}},
[10594]={nameES="Safety for the Meek",objectivesES={"Léoflad can be found near the waggons outside the Mead Hall of Entwade.\
\
You have spoken to numerous groups of people in Entwade and have sent them to gather at Léoflad's side. You should now speak to Léoflad and inform her that her people are ready.","The people of Entwade can be found throughout the settlement.\
\
Léoflad has sent you to gather the people of Entwade in hopes that they can soon depart for the Eastfold.","Léoflad, wife of Thane Edric, seeks to lead her people south to Eastfold where they will seek safety in the settlement of Aldburg.","Safety for the Meek","DNT -- Will not be seen","Talk to Léoflad"}},
[10595]={nameES="Sagroth, Lair of Vermin -- Solo/Duo",objectivesES={"A heavily injured Gárvadach has fled deeper into the sewers.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: You can use the 'Call Lágsaith' skill to call Lágsaith to your side.</rgb>","Pick up the summoning horn and call Lágsaith to your side","Sagroth, Lair of Vermin -- Solo/Duo","Many dangerous creatures have called the sewers of Carn Dûm home. Some have remained rumours, nothing more. Others, however, may be of interest to the scattered remnants of the Iron Crown.","Explore the sewers and confront Gárvadach","Gárvadach has been discovered, and he is not happy about this untimely interruption.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: You can use the 'Call Lágsaith' skill to call Lágsaith to your side.</rgb>","Defeat Gárvadach","Explore the sewers and confront Gárvadach (again)","Lágsaith has begun her tale.\
\
You should pick up the summoning horn to call her to your side.","With the heavy Angmarim presence in the sewers, Gárvadach cannot be far.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: You can use the 'Call Lágsaith' skill to call Lágsaith to your side.</rgb>","Defeat Rádarríg","Gárvadach has met his demise at the hands of a... giant rat? It seems this \\qking of rats\\q will not stand for more trespassers!\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: You can use the 'Call Lágsaith' skill to call Lágsaith to your side.</rgb>"}},
[10596]={nameES="Sagroth, Lair of Vermin -- Tier 1",objectivesES={"Gárvadach has been discovered, and he is not happy about this untimely interruption.","Gárvadach has met his demise at the hands of a... giant rat? It seems this \\qking of rats\\q will not stand for more trespassers!","Many dangerous creatures have called the sewers of Carn Dûm home. Some have remained rumours, nothing more. Others, however, may be of interest to the scattered remnants of the Iron Crown.","Explore the sewers and confront Gárvadach","Defeat Gárvadach","Explore the sewers and confront Gárvadach (again)","A heavily injured Gárvadach has fled deeper into the sewers.","Lágsaith has begun her tale. With the heavy Angmarim presence in the sewers, Gárvadach cannot be far.","Defeat Rádarríg","Sagroth, Lair of Vermin -- Tier 1"}},
[10597]={nameES="Sagroth, Lair of Vermin -- Tier 2",objectivesES={"Gárvadach has been discovered, and he is not happy about this untimely interruption.","Gárvadach has met his demise at the hands of a... giant rat? It seems this \\qking of rats\\q will not stand for more trespassers!","Explore the sewers and confront Gárvadach","Defeat Gárvadach","Explore the sewers and confront Gárvadach (again)","A heavily injured Gárvadach has fled deeper into the sewers.","Lágsaith has begun her tale. With the heavy Angmarim presence in the sewers, Gárvadach cannot be far.","Defeat Rádarríg","Sagroth, Lair of Vermin -- Tier 2","Many dangerous creatures have called the sewers of Carn Dûm home. Some have remained rumours, nothing more. Others, however, may be of interest to the scattered remnants of the Iron Crown."}},
