[10599]={nameES="Sagroth, Lair of Vermin -- Tier 4",objectivesES={"Sagroth, Lair of Vermin -- Tier 4","Gárvadach has met his demise at the hands of a... giant rat? It seems this \\qking of rats\\q will not stand for more trespassers!","Gárvadach has been discovered, and he is not happy about this untimely interruption.","Explore the sewers and confront Gárvadach","Defeat Gárvadach","Explore the sewers and confront Gárvadach (again)","A heavily injured Gárvadach has fled deeper into the sewers.","Lágsaith has begun her tale. With the heavy Angmarim presence in the sewers, Gárvadach cannot be far.","Defeat Rádarríg","Many dangerous creatures have called the sewers of Carn Dûm home. Some have remained rumours, nothing more. Others, however, may be of interest to the scattered remnants of the Iron Crown."}},
[10600]={nameES="Sagroth, Lair of Vermin -- Tier 5",objectivesES={"Gárvadach has been discovered, and he is not happy about this untimely interruption.","Gárvadach has met his demise at the hands of a... giant rat? It seems this \\qking of rats\\q will not stand for more trespassers!","Sagroth, Lair of Vermin -- Tier 5","Explore the sewers and confront Gárvadach","Defeat Gárvadach","Explore the sewers and confront Gárvadach (again)","A heavily injured Gárvadach has fled deeper into the sewers.","Lágsaith has begun her tale. With the heavy Angmarim presence in the sewers, Gárvadach cannot be far.","Defeat Rádarríg","Many dangerous creatures have called the sewers of Carn Dûm home. Some have remained rumours, nothing more. Others, however, may be of interest to the scattered remnants of the Iron Crown."}},
[10601]={nameES="Sagroth, Lair of Vermin Tier 2 through 5 Completion!",objectivesES={}},
[10602]={nameES="Sagroth: La atención a los detalles",objectivesES={"Usa el Buscador de Instancias para entrar en 'Sagroth, la guarida de las alimañas' en cualquier dificultad.","Entra en 'Sagroth, la guarida de las alimañas' en cualquier dificultad","La falta de interés de Lágsaith en mencionar los peligros sanitarios de las alcantarillas molesta a Avlath.","Lágsaith ha contado, con detalles atroces, la asquerosa inmundicia que ella y sus camaradas encontraron en las alcantarillas.\
\
Debes contárselo a Avlath en Bail Avarc.","Montones de inmundicia no identificable se pueden encontrar en 'Sagroth, la guarida de las alimañas.'\
\
Debes destruirlos.","Sagroth: La atención a los detalles","Habla con Avlath en Bail Avarc"}},
[10603]={nameES="Sagroth: Probando las Aguas",objectivesES={"Usa el Buscador de Instancias para entrar en 'Sagroth, la guarida de las alimañas' en cualquier dificultad.","Lágsaith ha descrito con gran detalle el líquido fétido que corre por las alcantarillas.\
\
Debes contárselo a Náchtan en Bail Avarc.","Entra en 'Sagroth, la guarida de las alimañas' en cualquier dificultad","Un líquido fétido se encuentra en 'Sagroth, la guarida de las alimañas'.\
\
Debes recoger algunas muestras.","Mientras Eávair y Borgach intentan resolver el problema de la limpieza de las alcantarillas, Náchtan dirige sus esfuerzos hacia la difusión de información y, con suerte, obtener algunas respuestas.","Habla con Náchtan en Bail Avarc","Sagroth: Probando las Aguas"}},
[10604]={nameES="Sagroth: Teatro de la Mente",objectivesES={"Usa el Buscador de Instancias para entrar en 'Sagroth, la guarida de las alimañas' en cualquier dificultad.","Entra en 'Sagroth, la guarida de las alimañas' en cualquier dificultad","El diseño de las alcantarillas de Carn Dûm es un desastre. El mapa de Aighrig está en progreso, pero también podría ayudarte a visualizar mejor la historia de Lágsaith.","Habla con Aighrig en Bail Avarc","Puntos de cartografía se pueden encontrar en 'Sagroth, la guarida de las alimañas.'\
\
Debes encontrarlos para completar el mapa de las alcantarillas.","Sagroth: Teatro de la Mente","Gracias al mapa de Aighrig, el relato de Lágsaith se volvió un poco menos confuso de seguir.\
\
Debes devolver el mapa a Aighrig en Bail Avarc."}},
[10605]={nameES="Sailing into Memory",objectivesES={"Collect Círgon's model ship of Umbar from his cart","Círgon's cart can be found near the Baths of Belecthor in the Fourth Circle.\
\
Círgon has offered to let you place one of his ships into the Baths.","Círgon is standing at the Baths of Belecthor in the Fourth Circle.\
\
You have arrived at the Baths and should now talk to Círgon.","Círgon spends his days sailing the model ships he built with his father, but has become withdrawn from his family in his father's absence.","The Baths of Belecthor can be found to the north in the Fourth Circle.\
\
You have picked up one of Círgon's ships and should now place it in the Baths.","Mílien can be found outside her home in the Fourth Circle.\
\
Círgon has asked you to tell his mother that he will come home for supper once he finishes packing up his ships.","Sailing into Memory","Talk to Mílien","The ship of Umbar is of impressive size and detail for a model...","Meet Círgon at the Baths of Belecthor in the Fourth Circle","Place the model ship of Umbar in the Baths' waters","Talk to Círgon","Círgon is standing near the Baths, where a model ship of Gondor now floats calmly...","The Baths of Belecthor can be found in the northern part of the Fourth Circle.\
\
Círgon has asked you to join him at the Baths of Belecthor where he sails his model ships.","Círgon is standing at the Baths of Belecthor in the Fourth Circle.\
\
You have set down the ship in the Baths and should now talk to Círgon.","The ship floats gently in the waters of the Baths..."}},
[10606]={nameES="Salamanders Hate Fire",objectivesES={}},
[10607]={nameES="Echar sal a la herida",objectivesES={"Las Obras Hidráulicas están muy al suroeste de las Fundaciones de Piedra, en Moria.\
\
Debes matar a muchos gusanos en las Obras Hidráulicas y recoger sus glándulas acre. Cuando tengas suficientes, regresa con Dithrik en las Fundaciones de Piedra.","Echar sal a la herida","Regresa con Dithrik en las Fundaciones de Piedra","Dithrik te ha pedido reunir glándulas de gusanos que se encuentran por todas las Obras Hidráulicas."}},
[10608]={nameES="Saludos a los días de la feria",objectivesES={"Completa 'Diversión en la feria (intro)'","Cada año se celebra el Festival de la Feria Agrícola para celebrar los largos días y la abundancia del clima cálido. ¡Participa en las festividades para ayudar a difundir el buen ánimo!\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>(Hay doce días de misiones de participación en 'Un día soleado de feria' y 'Diversión en la feria'. ¡Planifica en consecuencia!)</rgb>","Completa 'Diversión en la feria (intermedia)'","Puedes encontrar a Campanula Redondo cerca del Árbol de la Fiesta, en La Comarca.\
\
Ve a hablar con Campanula Redondo.","Habla con Campanula Redondo","Saludos a los días de la feria","Completa 'Diversión en la feria (final)'","Cada día hay algo que hacer durante el Festival de la Feria Agrícola. ¡Ven y únete a todos y participa en muchas actividades de la Feria Agrícola durante cuatro días!"}},
[10609]={nameES="Rescatar una rueda",objectivesES={"Recupera la rueda de carro","Mattie Bosquerudo y Noll Tobbit se toparon con los orcos, pero consiguieron escapar ilesos. Su carro sin embargo no corrió tanta suerte y necesita una nueva rueda si van a usarlo para llevar madera de vuelta a Puente de Caballetes.","Rueda de carro recuperada","Las carretas rotas fueron arrastradas por los orcos a su campamento fuera de Nan Wathren.\
\
Algunos granjeros, mientras escapaban de los orcos, fueron asaltados y sus carretas resultaron destruidas. Mattie espera que entre los restos de las carretas de los granjeros encuentres una rueda que pueda usar para arreglar su carro.","Rescatar una rueda"}},
[10610]={nameES="Salvage for the Greater Good",objectivesES={}},
[10611]={nameES="Salves for a Ravaged Land, Part 1",objectivesES={"Find Dag Usakâra, Usakâr's home east of Vartúlin","Thórvilon greets you cautiously.\
\
'Though you are an outsider, you have the look of someone capable. I am quite desperate, enough so that I would turn to a stranger for our salvation. This grove you see is dying. My people are dying. My wife... my wife is struggling. She is wearying, fading before my very eyes. I cannot bear it.\
\
'These eyes have seen such sights... countless miracles over thousands of years. Never did I think I would see such nightmares as these. The land cursed, the ground parched, forests as dry and white as bone. All my friends, all those I love, destined to fade and be forgotten.\
\
'I will not fade so easily. I will not let this grove crumble to dust. That is not my path. I have a desperate idea, and you seem capable. Will you help me - will you help our people?'","This odd man before you must be Usakâr","Speak with Usakâr and offer him the oranges","Speak with Grove-tender Ulthral about a poultice for Thórvilon's wife, Milingor. She can be found on the higher level of Vartúlin, near the bridge.","Speak with Milingor in her Veróth","Go to the grove Avadhril mentioned east of Vartúlin and obtain some oranges for Usakâr.","Thórvilon has requested your help in searching for a cure to the Lâg Dávrit, the Pale Blight afflicting Vartúlin and greater Imhûlar.","Speak once more with Grove Elder Thórvilon at the edge of Vartúlin.","Speak with Avadhril in Vartúlin","Speak with Milingor, Thórvilon's wife, in her Veróth across the bridge from Thórvilon in Vartúlin.","Prune dead Sarláshi limbs from Milingor's Veróth.","Find Dag Usakâra, Usakâr's home. Avadhril mentioned it was east of Vartúlin, where the mountain ridge meets an open meadow.","Speak with Grove Elder Thórvilon and learn more of Vartúlin","Speak with Grove Elder Thórvilon and ascertain what is troubling him.","Speak once more with Grove Elder Thórvilon","Salves for a Ravaged Land, Part 1","Speak with Avadhril to ascertain the details of contacting Usakâr the Hermit.","Speak with Grove-tender Ulthral in Vartúlin about Milingor's poultice","Speak with Usakâr and offer him the oranges."}},
[10612]={nameES="Salves for a Ravaged Land, Part 2",objectivesES={"Speak with Usakâr at the mouth of the cave","Find your way to the third point Usakâr has marked","Speak with Usakâr and he will mark your map with the route to Cúridwan's home.","Usakâr has agreed to show you the way to the home of Cúridwan, the Golden Maiden, to try to find a cure for the Lâg Dávrit, the Pale Blight sweeping through the woods of Imhûlar.","A passing group of Ordâkhai has spotted you!","Speak with Usakâr at the mouth of the cave.","Find your way to the first point Usakâr has marked on your map.","Find your way to the second point Usakâr has marked on your map.","Speak with Usakâr at Dag Usakâra to mark your map","Salves for a Ravaged Land, Part 2","Find your way to the first point Usakâr has marked","A pack of jackals breaks towards you!","Find your way to the second point Usakâr has marked","Find your way to the third point Usakâr has marked on your map.","Several servals sneak their way near you, looking to pounce"}},
[10613]={nameES="Salves for a Ravaged Land, Part 3",objectivesES={}},
[10614]={nameES="Salves for a Ravaged Land, Part 4",objectivesES={"Take Cúridwan's salve.","Speak with Cúridwan before you leave","Take Cúridwan's salve","The water shimmers briefly before the current whisks the salve away to Vartúlin","Speak with Usakâr in Kûgrun","Salves for a Ravaged Land, Part 4","Return to Cúridwan in Kûgrun","Use the salve on the river to heal Vartúlin","Speak with Cúridwan before you leave.","Speak with Usakâr in Kûgrun.","Curidwan has tasked you with destroying Ordâkhai founding stones at Ghât Lor. Ghât Lor can be found far to the east of Kûgrun.","Cúridwan has tasked you with destroying three great founding stones brought to Imhûlar by the Ordâkhai.","Return to Cúridwan in Kûgrun.","Use the first phial of salve on the river behind Cúridwan's cottage to heal Vartúlin."}},
[10615]={nameES="Salves for a Ravaged Land, Part 5",objectivesES={}},
[10616]={nameES="Salves for a Ravaged Land, Part 5",objectivesES={"Thórvilon has gathered with some others around Milingor's Veróth. You should join them.","Speak with Avadhril nearby.","Listen to Thórvilon and Usakâr's conversation.","Listen to Thórvilon","Comfort Thórvilon.","Speak with Avadhril nearby","Listen to Thórvilon.","Salves for a Ravaged Land, Part 5","Comfort Thórvilon","Listen to Thórvilon and Usakâr's conversation","Join Thórvilon near Milingor's Veróth","Speak with Thórvilon and let him know the good news about finding a cure for the Lâg Dávrit.","Thórvilon turns quickly before you can comfort him"}},
[10617]={nameES="Sambrog",objectivesES={"Los muertos ancestrales se han alzado en el Gran Túmulo.","Sambrog se puede encontrar en las mayores profundidades del Gran Túmulo.","Sambrog","Sambrog derrotado","Derrota a Sambrog"}},
[10618]={nameES="Prueba la hierba para pipa",objectivesES={"Usa la pipa para probar la primera bolsa de hierba para pipa","La hierba para pipa fresca tiene un sabor suave y delicado","La primera bolsa de hierba para pipa está en la mesa.\
\
Deberías recoger algo de hierba para pipa de la primera bolsa.","Tomaste una muestra de la primera bolsa","Usa la pipa para probar la tercera mezcla de hierba para pipa.","Toma una muestra de la tercera bolsa de hierba para pipa","La segunda bolsa de hierba para pipa está en la mesa.\
\
Deberías tomar algo de hierba para pipa de la segunda bolsa.","Deberías usar la pipa que te dieron para probar la hierba para pipa.","Tomaste una muestra de la tercera bolsa de hierba para pipa","Tus pulmones arden ante el sabor áspero y denso","Usa la pipa para probar la segunda mezcla de hierba para pipa","La hierba para pipa es algo que los hobbits se toman muy en serio. Un mercado nunca recibiría visitas a menos que tuviera un suministro y variedad adecuados.","Prueba la tercera mezcla de hierba para pipa","Esta sigue siendo suave, pero el sabor es profundo y persistente","Prueba la hierba para pipa","Florencia Gamyi está en la Plantación de hierba para pipa de la Granja de Cotonorte.\
\
Florencia Gamyi querrá saber qué te parecieron las mezclas de hierba para pipa.","Usa la pipa que te dieron para probar la segunda bolsa de hierba para pipa.","Toma una muestra de la primera bolsa","Devuélvele la pipa a Florencia Gamyi","Tomaste una muestra de la segunda bolsa","Toma una muestra de la segunda bolsa","La tercera bolsa está en el mostrador.\
\
Deberías tomar una muestra de hierba para pipa de la tercera bolsa."}},
[10619]={nameES="Muestreo de los acechadores del pantano",objectivesES={"Derrota al enfurecido del matorral de Adagím","Enfurecido del matorral de Adagím derrotado","Muestreo de los acechadores del pantano","Tu misión es viajar a Lhámuth y recolectar muestras de la Plaga Pálida de los acechadores del pantano para los eruditos de Sul Madásh."}},
[10620]={nameES="Sanctified Remains",objectivesES={"Okhtâr Ghôlkhas is waiting inside Dâr Laja.\
\
You have paid your respects to the long-departed ancestor by dropping coins to the sea. Hopefully Rashâm has returned the Ghôlkhas armour by now. You should see if Okhtâr has news.","Kheb Hanût is in the north-western corner of Tâkhdar.\
\
The fence, Rashâm, has suggested you search for fallen coins in the black market of Kheb Hanût. He wants to pay a symbolic token of apology for the Ghôlkhas tomb-robbing.","Speak with Okhtâr Ghôlkhas","You let the coins slip through your fingers into the waves","The fence, Rashâm, wishes to return the Ghôlkhas armour, and would like help in paying respects to the noble family from whom it was stolen.","A good spot facing the sea is south of the Fisherfold in Umbar Baharbêl.\
\
Rashâm has asked you to drop old coins into the ocean by the Fisherfold in remembrance of a fallen hero whose tomb was robbed.","Drop the coins into the sea","Sanctified Remains","Coins can be found with a bit of searching","Old and forgotten coins will be found in Kheb Hanût, in the north-west of Tâkhdar.\
\
Rashâm would like you to collect some keepsake coins in the black market that no one will miss to represent a funerary token.","Enter Kheb Hanût"}},
[10621]={nameES="La santidad de los soberanos",objectivesES={"Ayuda a Maladan con Kergrim de Haudh Valandur","Hay mucho que hacer en las tumbas abiertas del Camino de los Reyes.","Ayuda a Rodlam con Órdenes de la Corona de Hierro","Ayuda a Nimbellas con Ladrones de Haudh Eärendur","Ayuda a Maladan con El cetro de Valandur","Habla con las Nimbellas en el Camino de los Reyes","La santidad de los soberanos","Se han abierto varias tumbas y criptas en el Camino de los Reyes.","Ayuda a Nethrandir con El anillo de Arantar","Nimbellas se encuentra en el campamento de Montaraces del Camino de los Reyes.\
\
Nimbellas querrá hablar sobre el trabajo realizado en las criptas abiertas del Camino de los Reyes.","Ayuda a Nethrandir con Saqueadores de Haudh Arantar","Ayuda a Rodlam con Rastreadores de Haudh Eldacar","Ayuda a Nimbellas con Enterrado en Haudh Eärendur"}},
[10622]={nameES="Sand In The Sky",objectivesES={"The sand here is damp and contains small clumps of soil","Charzâd is by the old observatory above the city, waiting for you to return to her with your discoveries.","Sand In The Sky","The sand here is coarse and granular","Bring the sand you collected to Charzâd by the old observatory","Collect sand from the spider-haunted ruins east of the city","The sand here is very fine, and sifts easily through your fingers","Collect sand to the west of one of the farms outside the city","Charzâd asked you to collect sand from several different locations outside the city.","Charzâd stands by the old observatory above the city, musing about the stars in the sky and the sand in the desert.","Collect sand from the hills north-east of the farms outside the city","Collect sand south-east of the farms outside the city, near the river","The sand here shines and sparkles with a variety of colours"}},
[10623]={nameES="Arena para la llama",objectivesES={"Lleva la arena blanca a Mundarico Hojarena","Lleva la arena blanca a Mundarico Hojarena en Dwaling","Mundarico Hojarena está en casa de Hob Cimacolina en Prado del Toro Bramador en Dwaling, al sur de las Marisma de Arena.\
\
Deberías volver con Mundarico Hojarena para llevarle la arena blanca.","Se necesita arena en el arte del soplado, y la arena blanca de las Marisma de Arena es la mejor.","La arena blanca se puede encontrar en las Marismas de Arena, al norte de Dwaling.\
\
Mundarico Hojarena te ha pedido que recojas algo de arena blanca para él.","Arena para la llama"}},
[10624]={nameES="Sant Lhoer, the Poison Gardens -- Solo/Duo",objectivesES={"When you defeated Tarkka-oka and Cráthair, you acquired the key to the North Gate.\
\
You should unlock the North Gate and continue on.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: You can use the 'Call Forba' skill to call Forba to your side in Sant Lhoer.</rgb>","Unlock the North Gate","You have defeated Tarkka-oka and Cráthair","You should explore Sant Lhoer and look for the sorceress Oganuin.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: You can use the 'Call Forba' skill to call Forba to your side in Sant Lhoer.</rgb>","Sant Lhoer, conocido como los Jardines Emponzoñados de Carn Dûm, es un lugar húmedo repleto de plantas, árboles y flores mortales, como pocas o ninguna se han visto antes en la Tierra Media. Más allá de las aguas fétidas de color verde berilo que fluyen por Sant Lhoer, se alzan inmensas estructuras de cristal, incluyendo Bâr Heledh, la Casa de Cristal. Es aquí donde la hechicera Oganuin practica su arte, experimentando con criaturas, plantas y personas por igual. ¿Con qué fin y para qué propósito? Solo se pueden suponer los más oscuros designios.","Pick up the summoning horn and call Forba to your side","Search for Oganuin within Sant Lhoer","You have entered the Poison Gardens of Carn Dûm, Sant Lhoer.\
\
You should use the nearby summoning horn to call an ally, Forba, to your side.","Within Sant Lhoer you have come across an Angmarim sorcerer, Cráthair, and his companion, the Jorthkyn Tarkka-oka. The latter is like nothing you have ever seen before. This must be one of Oganuin's foul experiments! You should defeat the pair.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: You can use the 'Call Forba' skill to call Forba to your side in Sant Lhoer.</rgb>","Defeat Oganuin","You have defeated Oganuin","Sant Lhoer, the Poison Gardens -- Solo/Duo","You stand before Bâr Heledh, the Glass House of Carn Dûm. Within its metal and glass walls the sorceress Oganuin practices her fell crafts, creating abominations and twisting living things towards unnatural ends.\
\
You should defeat Oganuin.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: You can use the 'Call Forba' skill to call Forba to your side in Sant Lhoer.</rgb>","The North Gate opens!","Defeat Tarkka-oka and Cráthair"}},
[10625]={nameES="Sant Lhoer, the Poison Gardens -- Tier 1",objectivesES={"Unlock the North Gate","You stand before Bâr Heledh, the Glass House of Carn Dûm. Within its metal and glass walls the sorceress Oganuin practices her fell crafts, creating abominations and twisting living things towards unnatural ends.\
\
You should defeat Oganuin.","You have defeated Tarkka-oka and Cráthair","Sant Lhoer, conocido como los Jardines Emponzoñados de Carn Dûm, es un lugar húmedo repleto de plantas, árboles y flores mortales, como pocas o ninguna se han visto antes en la Tierra Media. Más allá de las aguas fétidas de color verde berilo que fluyen por Sant Lhoer, se alzan inmensas estructuras de cristal, incluyendo Bâr Heledh, la Casa de Cristal. Es aquí donde la hechicera Oganuin practica su arte, experimentando con criaturas, plantas y personas por igual. ¿Con qué fin y para qué propósito? Solo se pueden suponer los más oscuros designios.","You have defeated Tarkka-oka and Cráthair, and acquired the key to the North Gate.\
\
You should unlock the North Gate and continue on.","Dentro de Sant Lhoer has encontrado a un mago angmarim, Cráthair, y su compañero, el Jorthkyn Tarkka-oka. El último es como nada que hayas visto antes. ¡Esto debe ser uno de los horribles experimentos de Oganuin! Deberías derrotar a ambos.","Defeat Oganuin","You have defeated Oganuin","The North Gate opens!","Defeat Tarkka-oka and Cráthair","Sant Lhoer, the Poison Gardens -- Tier 1"}},
