[10645]={nameES="La Huida de Sarnemil",objectivesES={"Derrota a Sarnemil","La Huida de Sarnemil","Desde las alturas de Cirith Ulunn viste a la sierpe de las rocas Sarnemil huir hacia el sur siguiendo el curso del Bruinen.","Sarnemil está en Torech Ullug, al sur de Echad Candelleth y en la orilla oriental del río, junto a los rápidos que fluyen desde Tâl Bruinen.\
\
Has derrotado a Sarlug y a muchas sierpes de las rocas, pero Sarnemil escapó; sin embargo, la viste huir hacia el sur siguiendo el curso del Bruinen. Deberías descender de nuevo las laderas hasta el Bruinen y buscar hacia el sur por las orillas su guarida.","Has derrotado a Sarnemil","Daervellas está en Echad Candelleth, el campamento élfico en Tâl Bruinen, al norte de Torech Ullug.\
\
Has derrotado a Sarnemil y acabado con la amenaza de sus crías. Ahora deberías volver con Daervellas para darle esta noticia.","Deberías descender de nuevo las laderas hasta el Bruinen y buscar hacia el sur por las orillas la guarida de Sarnemil","Habla con Daervellas"}},
[10646]={nameES="Saruman's Folly",objectivesES={}},
[10647]={nameES="Sauron's Presence Upon Kingsland",objectivesES={}},
[10648]={nameES="Sauron's Presence Upon Parth Daenath",objectivesES={}},
[10649]={nameES="Savage Hunters",objectivesES={}},
[10650]={nameES="Savage Intruders",objectivesES={"The number of Orcs remaining at Minas Rant has been reduced, due to your efforts.","Discover Minas Rant","The tower of Minas Rant can be found at the western end of the stream that cuts across the Norcrofts.\
\
The number of Orcs remaining in the area has been reduced, due to your efforts.","A company of Orcs has taken to the ruins of the ancient tower, Minas Rant, and have begun to use it as an outpost from which to attack the neighbouring homes.","Savage Intruders","Completado","The tower of Minas Rant can be found at the western end of the stream that cuts across the Norcrofts.\
\
The Orcs inhabiting the ancient tower of Minas Rant have begun using it as a base from which to attack the neighbouring homes."}},
[10651]={nameES="Salva a Arifael",objectivesES={"El gigante Arifael está en Amon Nendir, al suroeste de Rivendel.\
\
El señor Elrond te ha pedido que hables con Arifael sobre los gigantes que al parecer han jurado lealtad a Angmar y ahora protegen Helegrod para sus nuevos amos.","Salva a Arifael","El señor Elrond solo confía en un gigante: Arifael de Amon Nendir."}},
[10652]={nameES="Save the Lumber-yard",objectivesES={"The lumber-yard lies along the road to Fenmarch, north-east of Aldburg.\
\
The panicked Rohirrim woman told you to seek out Guthláf within the lumber-yard.","Find the back entrance to the lumber-yard","Defeated the Orc lieutenant","Found the back entrance of the lumber-yard","The panicked Rohirrim woman has asked for assistance liberating the lumber-yard from the attacking Orcs.","Talk to Guthláf","Save the Lumber-yard","Guthláf awaits you north of the orchard.\
\
The Orc-lieutenant has been defeated and the orchard is safe. You should return to Guthláf and report the good news.","The orchard lies to the south, within the lumber-yard, east of Aldburg.\
\
Guthláf overheard the Orc's plan to burn the orchard. He suggested that you head to the orchard and defeat the lieutenant of the Orcs there.","A hardy warrior stands ahead...this must be Guthláf","Find Guthláf","Guthláf is in the lumber-yard, north-east of Aldburg.\
\
You should speak with Guthláf about how to reclaim the lumber-yard.","The back entrance can be found downhill from the panicked Rohirrim woman, towards the water.\
\
The panicked Rohirrim woman recommended entering the lumber-yard through the back entrance in the hopes of sneaking in unnoticed.","Defeat the Orc lieutenant"}},
[10653]={nameES="Saving Sterkist",objectivesES={"You have escaped the Taurogrim and rescued Sterkist.\
\
You should talk to Langhár and Sterkist.","The cart belonging to the Beornings was left behind here","Speak with Langhár and complete \\qDeep in the Darkening Wood\\q","You have escaped the Taurogrim and rescued Sterkist.\
\
You should talk to Thorlind.","Find Langhár","Saving Sterkist","Habla con Langhár","Langhár has run further into the woods, to the north.\
\
You should find Langhár.","Find any sign of Sterkist","Sterkist has been taken by the Taurogrim!\
\
You should save Sterkist!","One of the Beornings has been found, but Sterkist is still missing. Langhár needs your help rescuing him from the clutches of the Taurogrim.","Talk to Thorlind","The Taurogrim took Sterkist further north.\
\
You should look for Sterkist.","The Beorning prints continue in this direction","Talk to Sterkist"}},
[10654]={nameES="Saving The Crops",objectivesES={}},
[10655]={nameES="Salvando las manzanas",objectivesES={"Musarañas ladronas han robado las manzanas de Habbo Maltaverde.","Has recogido una docena de manzanas de Habbo. Deberías devolvérselas en el centro del pueblo de Entibo, en las Tierras de Bree.","Devuelve las manzanas a Habbo Maltaverde","Habbo te ha pedido que te aventures en el túnel de las musarañas y salves sus manzanas de su destino incierto. La entrada del túnel se encuentra al sureste del centro del pueblo de Entibo, en las Tierras de Bree.","Salvando las manzanas"}},
[10656]={nameES="Saving the Beasts",objectivesES={}},
[10657]={nameES="Saving the Orchard",objectivesES={"Tolwin can be found in the hall of Crithost.\
\
You should speak with Tolwin.","You see signs that the farmers are still alive and should rescue them from the Orcs","Travel to Eryn Cordovath and assess the situation","Farmers can be found around Eryn Cordovath.\
\
You should rescue any farmers you find.","The farmer thanks you and wishes for you collect saplings if you have the time","Saving the Orchard","The farmer understands and makes her way to Crithost","Travel to Eryn Cordovath and assess the situation.","One of the farmers wishes for you to gather saplings so that Crithost can tend to some of the orchard's crops even if the orchard is lost.\
\
You should gather saplings.","A look-out has spotted a band of Orcs headed for Eryn Cordovath, a nearby orchard that is in the process of being evacuated, and Tolwin wishes for you to ride out there and assist the farmers.","The nervous farmer wishes you luck and scurries to Crithost","The farmer is thankful and urges you to rescue any others","Talk to Tolwin"}},
[10658]={nameES="Saving the Scholars",objectivesES={}},
[10659]={nameES="Saving the Twisted",objectivesES={"Talk to Delwin at the Boar-clan encampment","Abomination Dunlendings can be found at Lhan Colvarn, north of the Boar-clan encampment.\
\
Delwin wants you to save the abomination Dunlendings from the killing ways of her companions by warning them to flee.","The Dunlending abomination looks at you with a wary eye, cowering slightly. It is not sure if you mean it harm or help.\
\
As you approach, it tenses, looking at you with a blank stare....","Saving the Twisted","Delwin is at the Boar-clan encampment, south of Lhan Colvarn.\
\
You should return to Delwin and let her know that you have saved many of the Dunlending abominations.","Delwin believes that the abominations are not truly monsters. They were once people. She wants you to speak with them and give them one last chance to escape before the Boar Clan destroys the camp."}},
[10660]={nameES="Saving the Wilds",objectivesES={"Saving the Wilds","Talk to Thurindol","Thurindol has asked you to put out brush fires around North Ithilien.","Thurindol can be found in Henneth Annûn.\
\
You should return to Thurindol with news of your success.","Brush fires have sprung up across North Ithilien. \
\
Thurindol has asked you to search North Ithilien for brush fires and put them out before they spread further."}},
[10661]={nameES="Amenaza Escamosa",objectivesES={"Los dragonzuelos se encuentran al este de Gabilshathûr, en el valle de Dolroth\
\
Ansurr te pidió que reduzcas el número de dragonzuelos","Amenaza Escamosa","El Guardia Ansurr te contó que en el pasado los dragonzuelos de Dolroth amenazaban a Gabilshathûr. Teme que, al no tener tiempo para reducir su número, vuelvan a representar un peligro.","El Guardia Ansurr está en Gabilshathûr, muy al oeste del valle de Dolroth\
\
Has derrotado a muchos dragonzuelos y deberías regresar con el Guardia Ansurr para informarle de tu éxito"}},
[10662]={nameES="Scales in Ost Amondal",objectivesES={"Abartârik has asked you to lessen the worm population in Ost Amondal.\
\
Ost Amondal is in southern Belfalas.","You should let Abartârik know that you defeated many worms at Ost Amondal.\
\
Abartârik is in Dol Amroth.","Scales in Ost Amondal","The ruins of Ost Amondal are home to fierce and dangerous creatures which threaten travel on the nearby roads.","Return to Abartârik"}},
[10663]={nameES="Escamas del Enemigo Terrenal",objectivesES={"Lleva las escamas a Melthindir","Deberías recolectar escamas de las sierpes de Ram Dúath. Tales objetos pueden utilizarse para reforzar armaduras débiles y pueden ser de utilidad para los Montaraces de Esteldín.","Melthindir está en Esteldín.\
\
Deberías llevar las escamas que recolectaste a Melthindir.","Se pueden encontrar sierpes en el paso occidental de Ram Dúath, al noreste de Esteldín.\
\
Deberías recolectar escamas de sierpe en Ram Dúath.","Escamas del Enemigo Terrenal","Deberías recolectar escamas de las sierpes de Ram Dúath.","Recolecta escamas de sierpe"}},
[10664]={nameES="Scara-pack Blessings",objectivesES={}},
[10665]={nameES="Scarred Wood",objectivesES={}},
[10666]={nameES="Scars of Battle",objectivesES={"Dori can be found in Skarháld.\
\
You have travelled to Skarháld with Dori and Company alongside Ingór, son of Vékun, and the Zhélruka. You should now speak to Dori.","Scars of Battle","Talk to Dori at Skarháld","Dori can be found at Dôm Goru.\
\
You have learned that Vethúg Wintermind crashed upon the slopes of Winterstith, one of the Grey Mountains. You should follow Dori to the end of the Bitter Scar to learn the fate of Vethúg Wintermind.","Talk to Dori at Dôm Goru","After learning that Vethúg Wintermind fell upon the foothills of Winterstith, Dori and Company have decided to seek the fallen cold-drake and discover some final proof of his demise."}},
[10667]={nameES="Scars of the Pelennor",objectivesES={"Talk to Anborn","Wounded Rangers can be found within Henneth Annûn.\
\
You have gathered the kingsfoil and should now use it to heal the Rangers as best you can.","The Rangers of Ithilien lost many of their number in the Battle of the Pelennor Fields. Even as the War rages on, those that survived and returned to North Ithilien are in dire need of healing.","Scars of the Pelennor","Kingsfoil can be found in North Ithilien to the west of Henneth Annûn.\
\
Anborn has asked you to gather kingsfoil in the hope that it might be used to heal his fellow Rangers.","Anborn can be found at Henneth Annûn.\
\
You have healed the wounded Rangers as much as you were able, and should now report back to Anborn."}},
[10668]={nameES="Scatha Awakens",objectivesES={}},
[10669]={nameES="Scatha's Legacy",objectivesES={}},
[10670]={nameES="Scatter the Ashes",objectivesES={"Undisturbed cairns lie to the east of Echad Naeglanc, along the southern ridge.\
\
Naeglanc has asked you to scatter ashes before undisturbed cairns in the Bonevales.","Scatter the Ashes","Naeglanc and his allies continue to battle the foul wights arising within the Bonevales.","Seek out an ally among the cairns to the far eastern reaches of the Bonevales.\
\
You should speak with Mair","Talk to Mair among the cairns"}},
[10671]={nameES="Pertenencias esparcidas",objectivesES={"Pertenencias esparcidas","Aglardir está en Lin Giliath, el claro en la frontera de la Dehesa del Rey y Meluinen.\
\
Aglardir espera que regreses con las posesiones que recuperaste de las cajas rotas esparcidas por Meluinen.","Aglardir ha asumido la difícil tarea de devolver la paz a Lin Giliath tras el ataque de los trolls de piedra.","Lleva provisiones para Lin Giliath a Aglardir","Se pueden encontrar barriles rotos esparcidos por los pantanos que llevan a Taur Gonwaith, al sur de Lin Giliath.\
\
Aglardir te ha pedido que recuperes todas las provisiones que puedas de los barriles que los trolls de piedra esparcieron por los pantanos."}},
[10672]={nameES="Scattered Companions",objectivesES={"Caron's companions can be found east of his position, possibly near Bledhun's camp.\
\
Caron has asked you to seek out his companions and help them.","Find and talk to Eiluned","Talk to Bledhun at his encampment in the Bonevales","Bledhun is encamped east and slightly north of Caron's companions.\
\
Caron asked you to let Bledhun know that the few survivors of Caron's band are safe.","Scattered Companions","Several Dunlendings have been assisting members of the Grey Company as they search for a safe and secret path through Dunland. Recently, their camp was attacked, and they have hidden themselves in the valley.","Find and talk to Glundur"}},
[10673]={nameES="Scattered Delivery",objectivesES={"Talk to Andras in the Starkmoor","Aid Andras with The Broken Wheel","Aid Andras with The Smashed Crate","Andras is on the northern road leading out of Starkmoor.\
\
Andras will be pleased to hear that his cart has been repaired and most of his goods returned.","Aid Andras with The Shredded Bag","Andras' caravan has been attacked by Dragon-clan raiders. All of his valuables have been taken. They must be reclaimed if he is to make it to auction successfully.","Aid Andras with The Torn Ledger","The scattered pieces of Andras' caravan are on the northern road in Starkmoor.\
\
Andras asked you to judge the state of the caravan and retrieve whatever goods you can from the Dragon-clan raiders encamped to the east.","Scattered Delivery"}},
[10674]={nameES="Scattered Friends",objectivesES={}},
[10675]={nameES="Scattered History",objectivesES={}},
[10676]={nameES="Scattered and Shaken",objectivesES={}},
[10677]={nameES="Scattered in the Forest",objectivesES={}},
[10678]={nameES="Dispersos en el cementerio",objectivesES={"Recoge los picos enanos que quedaron dispersos cuando fue atacado el convoy de suministros con destino a Zigilgund. Thórth dijo que probablemente se encuentren en el cementerio de mamuts cercano y sus alrededores.","Devuelve los picos enanos a Thórth","Dispersos en el cementerio","De camino al puesto avanzado enano de Zigilgund, un convoy que transportaba suministros vitales, especialmente picos de minería, fue atacado y su carga quedó dispersa.","Has encontrado los picos enanos que Thórth te envió a recuperar. Deberías devolvérselos en Zigilgund."}},
[10679]={nameES="Scattering Westward",objectivesES={}},
[10680]={nameES="Scavenge for Weapons",objectivesES={}},
[10681]={nameES="Saqueadores de Barad Tharsír",objectivesES={"Habla con Adleithian en el Coloso","Saqueadores de Barad Tharsír","Adleithian está en el campamento de Montaraces en el Coloso, al noroeste del Barandalf y al oeste de Parth Aduial.\
\
Adleithian está esperando escuchar que has derrotado a los saqueadores de Barad Tharsír.","Adleithian le preocupa que los saqueadores de tumbas hayan tomado el control de las ruinas de Barad Tharsír en el Barandalf.","Barad Tharsír está al sureste del Coloso, en el Barandalf, en la orilla opuesta del Brandivino.\
\
Adleithian te ha pedido que derrotes a miembros de la banda de saqueadores que se ha apoderado de Barad Tharsír."}},
[10682]={nameES="Los carroñeros de nuestros muertos",objectivesES={"Tu misión es viajar a Khazâda y reducir el número de chacales en la zona, así como quemar los cadáveres de los viajeros caídos que han sido profanados por las bestias.","Los carroñeros de nuestros muertos","Los chacales en los surcos se alimentan de los muertos. Es su naturaleza, pero la profanación de los aliados caídos no puede ser tolerada por la coalición."}},
[10683]={nameES="Scavenging the Battlefield",objectivesES={}},
[10684]={nameES="Olor de la colmena",objectivesES={"Thórhall espera estudiar la anatomía de los gredbyg para aprender más sobre ellos y poder combatirlos mejor en el futuro.","Los gredbyg pueden encontrarse en una colmena en el Palacio de Náin.\
\
Se te ha pedido que recojas elementos de interés anatómico de los gredbyg para su estudio.","Lleva las glándulas olorosas a Thórhall","Thórhall se encuentra en el pequeño campamento enano de Lamab-dûm, en la Gran Excavación.\
\
Deberías llevarle las glándulas olorosas que has recogido para que pueda estudiarlas.","Olor de la colmena"}},
[10685]={nameES="Schemes and Misadventures",objectivesES={"Schemes and Misadventures","Deliver Shâr Bârshud's message to Mizâdi in Kûr Anzar","Speak with Nimasi when you are ready to go","Working with Nimasi, you have traced the banner attacks to a large camp in southern Imhûlar. Investigate the camp without being seen to discover the source of these attacks.","Deliver Shâr Bârshud's message to Mizâdi in Kûr Anzar.","Speak with Nimasi outside the camp when you are ready to go."}},
[10686]={nameES="Escritos Eruditos — Introducción",objectivesES={"Entrega tus escritos eruditos a Cachúnir en Rivendel","Cachúnir desea llevar consigo al Oeste tanto conocimiento e historia de la Tierra Media como le sea posible.","Cachúnir está en Rivendel, en el Bosque de los Trolls.\
\
Cachúnir te ha pedido que redactes escritos eruditos para preservarlos en las bibliotecas de Valinor cuando los Elfos de Rivendel zarpen hacia el Oeste.","Escritos Eruditos — Introducción"}},
[10687]={nameES="Scholar: Tome of Winter Survival",objectivesES={"A skilled scholar such as yourself can help the refugees of Wildermore by scribing a tome of winter survival for them.","<rgb=#FF0000>Completing Wildermore's Recovery will cancel this quest.</rgb>","Hildelith is in Forlaw.\
\
You have scripted a tome of winter survival, and should now deliver it to Hildelith.","Hildelith has given you a recipe for a tome of winter survival.\
\
You should craft a tome of winter survival for the survivors of Wildermore's bitter winter.","Deliver the tome of winter survival to Hildelith","Scholar: Tome of Winter Survival"}},
[10688]={nameES="Scholarly Study",objectivesES={"Kordh Gúrat is located to the south-west of Aslíf, a level below the middle tier.\
\
Hórskur has asked for samples from each type of drakeling there.","You have collected a few samples from each type of drakeling.\
\
Hórskur is waiting for you in Aslíf on the upper tier to return with the samples.","Talk to Hórskur in Aslíf","Hórskur's next area of study involves drakelings, but he doesn't have the samples he needs.","Scholarly Study"}},
[10689]={nameES="Scholars Gone Missing",objectivesES={"You found the missing scholars. Orthél will want to know of their fate","You see lifeless bodies in scholar's clothing","Return to Orthél with the scholars' notes","You found scholars who have fallen to the blight. See if they have the notes Orthél mentioned to confirm they are the ones who went missing.","Scholars Gone Missing","You find crumpled notes worn by the weather","Inspect scholar","Search for missing scholars","You find his notes safely tucked into his satchel","Orthél has asked you to find a group of scholars who went to study the blight outside of Sul Madásh and have yet to return.","Return to Orthél in Sul Madásh with the notes recovered from the missing scholars and inform her of their fates.","You find meticulous notes tucked into her robes"}},
[10690]={nameES="Vástago del invierno",objectivesES={"King Thorin III can be found before his throne in the Hall Under the Mountain.\
\
You have triumphed over Vethúg Wintermind, but at great cost. You should speak to King Thorin III.","Talk to King Thorin III","After spending countless years within Thikil-gundu, Vethúg Wintermind, comes to seek a new vengeance upon Durin's Folk.","King Thorin III can be found before his throne in the Hall Under the Mountain.\
\
King Thorin III has received word that Vethúg Wintermind draws near to Erebor. When you are prepared, you should speak to the King under the Mountain.","Vástago del invierno"}},
[10691]={nameES="Tierra Quemada",objectivesES={"You are being attacked by fell mirages, seemingly caused by Ishími, the Anguished Wind.\
\
You should defeat the mirages!","It seems that Ishími, the Anguished Wind haunts the Dawn-warden.\
\
You should find the Aradûni officer in charge of the camp.","Unusâli, Sorkamâl, and Hidâti have gone ahead to the Dawn-warden.\
\
You should continue west and find the Dawn-warden.","Talk to Unusâli","Unusâli and Sorkamâl will be travelling to the Dawn-warden with you to meet with the Aradûni.\
\
You should talk to Unusâli.","Defeat the mirages","The wind picks up, and with it comes the whispers...","You once again hear the whispering of the Anguished Wind","Tierra Quemada","To make contact with the Aradûni, you and Mizâdi's envoys must travel west, and cross the perilous dry lake-bed.","Continue to the Dawn-warden","Find Unusâli, Sorkamâl, and Hidâti","Talk to Captain Hanâbu","Unusâli, Sorkamâl, and Hidâti have gone ahead.\
\
You should meet them near Ushumût, the Grave of Serpents.","Ishími departs, and the whispering ceases"}},
[10692]={nameES="Scorpion Extermination",objectivesES={"Travel to Dul Râkh","Nâmi has asked you thin out the number of scorpions in Dul Râkh to the west.","Reached Dul Râkh entrance","Return to Nâmi","Scorpion Extermination","Defeat scorpions inside the cave at Dul Râkh for Nâmi at the Dumûri camp in Urash Dâr.","Return to Nâmi in Urash Dâr and let her know you have thinned the number of scorpions in Dul Râkh.","Nâmi has asked you to travel to the cave in Dul Râkh and thin the number of scorpions in the area."}},
[10693]={nameES="Scour the Walls Clean",objectivesES={}},
[10694]={nameES="Azote del Valle",objectivesES={"Dulgurz se encuentra en Athmadhul, al sureste de Mekhem-bizru.\
\
Ótam te habló de un jinete de huargos particularmente peligroso, Dulgurz, que ya no debe ser permitido vagar por el Valle del Arroyo Sombrío.","Dulgurz ha sido derrotado","Dulgurz ha aterrorizado a los enanos del Valle del Valle del Arroyo Sombrío desde que establecieron su campamento.","Ótam se encuentra en Mekhem-bizru, al noroeste de Athmadhul.\
\
Ótam querrá saber sobre la derrota de Dulgurz.","Derrota a Dulgurz","Habla con Ótam en Mekhem-bizru","Azote del Valle"}},
[10695]={nameES="Scouring for Relics",objectivesES={}},
[10696]={nameES="Inspeccionando el camino",objectivesES={"Maedlathron está en Gwingris, a cierta distancia al noroeste del campamento abandonado.\
\
Deberías llevar la bolsa con hierba para pipa que has encontrado a Maedlathron.","Investiga el camino de la Comunidad","Después de algo de tiempo, Elrond Medio-Elfo envió exploradores a los campos de Eregion para seguir el camino de la Comunidad que partió de Rivendel y asegurarse de que no quedaran signos de su paso que el Enemigo pudiera encontrar.","Bolsa de hierba para pipa recuperada","Habla con Maedlathron en Gwingris","El campamento está enclavado en la base de unos grandes pedruscos, a cierta distancia al sureste de Gwingris, más allá de Sâd Rechu, al sur del camino hacia Pembar.\
\
Maedlathron te ha pedido que busques un lugar que pueda haber sido el campamento utilizado por la Comunidad. Cualquier signo del paso de la Comunidad debe ser eliminado.","Inspeccionando el camino"}},
[10697]={nameES="Scouring the Wood",objectivesES={"You have arrived at the fourth patrol point","The fifth patrol point is east of the fourth.\
\
Idhrenfair has asked you to patrol the paths of the Gloomglens with instructions to keep an eye out for any signs of the Enemy's minions.","The Rangers of the Grey Company seek to ensure the secrecy of their purpose and their passage through Enedwaith.","Scout the fourth patrol point","The second patrol point is north-west of the first.\
\
Idhrenfair has asked you to patrol the paths of the Gloomglens with instructions to keep an eye out for any signs of the Enemy's minions.","Scout the fifth patrol point","Scouring the Wood","You have discovered a village of strange creatures","Scout the first patrol point","You have arrived at the third patrol point","You have arrived at the first patrol point","The third patrol point is south-west of the second.\
\
Idhrenfair has asked you to patrol the paths of the Gloomglens with instructions to keep an eye out for any signs of the Enemy's minions.","You have arrived at the second patrol point","The first patrol point is north-east of Echad Idhrenfair.\
\
Idhrenfair has asked you to patrol the paths of the Gloomglens with instructions to keep an eye out for any signs of the Enemy's minions.","Scout the third patrol point","Scout the second patrol point","Idhrenfair is at Echad Idhrenfair in the Gloomglens of Enedwaith, north-west of the fifth patrol point.\
\
You should return to Idhrenfair with news of your discoveries.","The fourth patrol point is south of the third.\
\
Idhrenfair has asked you to patrol the paths of the Gloomglens with instructions to keep an eye out for any signs of the Enemy's minions.","Talk to Idhrenfair at Echad Idhrenfair"}},
[10698]={nameES="Explora más allá de las Piedras Aullantes.",objectivesES={"Encuentra la colina al sudeste de las Piedras Aullantes mencionada por Eleri.","Desde este punto de observación, la cuenca por la que discurre el Viejo Camino del Sur parece estar en gran medida tranquila.","Eleri te pidió que <rgb=#00FF00>miraras</rgb> a la distancia desde la colina al sudeste de las Piedras Aullantes, al este de Musgovilla.","Habla con Eleri en el lado este de Musgovilla.","<rgb=#00FF00>Mira</rgb> desde la cima de la colina al sudeste de las Piedras Aullantes.","Explora más allá de las Piedras Aullantes.","Preocupada por el reciente ataque de los Uruks contra Musgovilla, Eleri quiere que vigiles si hay más de estas criaturas más allá del cercano campamento de lobos.","Esta parece ser la colina que Eleri describió.","Eleri está en el lado este de Musgovilla, a la vista de la puerta."}},
[10699]={nameES="Scout Gwâl Draig",objectivesES={"Scouted the eastern entrance of Gwâl Draig","Scout the eastern entrance of Gwâl Draig","Talk to Gronu at his camp","Scouted the western entrance of Gwâl Draig","Scout the southern entrance of Gwâl Draig","The Draig-lûth have created a village on the northern shore of the river, presenting a danger to travellers in the area.","Scout the western entrance of Gwâl Draig","Gwâl Draig lies on the southern shore of the river, north-east of Gronu's camp.\
\
Gronu has asked you to scout out the entrances to the camp and dispatch any guards you might encounter.","Gronu is at his camp south-east of Gwâl Draig.\
\
You should seek out Gronu and let him know what lies within the village of Gwâl Draig.","Scouted the southern entrance of Gwâl Draig","Scout Gwâl Draig"}},
[10700]={nameES="Explora las Puertas de Tharbad.",objectivesES={"Explora las Puertas de Tharbad.","Este parece ser el lugar que Eleri describió.","Eleri te pidió que <rgb=#00FF00>mires</rgb> en busca de la marca de la Mano Blanca en las puertas de Tharbad, al noroeste de Musgovilla. Fue muy insistente en que evitaras el combate si los enemigos parecían demasiado peligrosos.","<rgb=#00FF00>Mira</rgb> en las puertas de Tharbad en busca de la marca de la Mano Blanca.","Habla con Eleri en el lado este de Musgovilla.","Los duros gritos de los Orcos pueden oírse dentro de Tharbad, pero no ves señales de la Mano Blanca.","Encuentra las puertas de Tharbad, al noroeste de Musgovilla.","Eleri tiene ahora una petición más peligrosa para ti, pero si Tharbad sirve de campamento para los Uruks que asaltaron Musgovilla, quiere saberlo.","Eleri está en el lado este de Musgovilla, a la vista de la puerta."}},
[10701]={nameES="Explora el Viejo Camino del Sur.",objectivesES={"Eleri cree que el Viejo Camino del Sur es una bendición para Musgovilla, pero si acelera el avance de los Uruks a través de la Ciénaga de los Cisnes, quiere saberlo.","Eleri te pidió que <rgb=#00FF00>miraras</rgb> a la distancia en la intersección del Viejo Camino del Sur con el sendero que sale de Musgovilla por la puerta norte de la aldea.","Algunos tramos del camino están cubiertos de maleza y carecen de adoquines, pero no ves señales de saqueadores.","Habla con Eleri en el lado este de Musgovilla.","Explora el Viejo Camino del Sur.","Eleri está en el lado este del pueblo, a la vista de la puerta.","Encuentra la intersección del sendero que sale por la puerta norte de Musgovilla y el Viejo Camino del Sur.","Este cruce de caminos es el que Eleri describió.","<rgb=#00FF00>Mira</rgb> a la distancia en la intersección del sendero que sale por la puerta norte de Musgovilla y el Viejo Camino del Sur."}},
[10702]={nameES="Scout the Swamp",objectivesES={}},
[10703]={nameES="Scout Ânug-stazg",objectivesES={"Ânug-stazg can be found east and slightly north of Mithechad.\
\
Perindúr has asked you to scout out the path leading into Ânug-stazg and the camp-fires at the edges of the camp.","Scout Ânug-stazg","Scouted the western camp-fire","Talk to Perindúr at Mithechad","Scout the western camp-fire","The Orc-camp at Ânug-stazg is the primary sentry-post for the Enemy's forces in the Ashenslades.","Scout the eastern camp-fire","Scout the path to Ânug-stazg","Scouted the eastern camp-fire","Perindúr is at Mithechad, west and slightly south of Ânug-stazg.\
\
You should return to Perindúr with your report of the Enemy's forces at Ânug-stazg.","Scouted the path to Ânug-stazg"}},
[10704]={nameES="Exploración avanzada",objectivesES={"Encuentra a Wigfast, el explorador en Gazatmur","Exploración avanzada","Los trasgos han establecido un gran campamento en Gazatmur, lo cual preocupa a los enanos del Mirador de la Gran Excavación.","El campamento de trasgos se encuentra bajo el Mirador de la Gran Excavación, en Gazatmur. Se pueden encontrar buenos puntos de observación al norte y al sur del campamento.\
\
Slagvi te ha pedido que explores un gran campamento de trasgos. Te advirtió que evitaras ser visto."}},
[10705]={nameES="Explorando Arthobel",objectivesES={"Ves unos pocos rastros, pero nada reciente. Parece que los saqueadores de tumbas tampoco han logrado entrar","Encuentra las ruinas de Arthobel","Arthobel está al suroeste del campamento de los Montaraces en el Camino de los Reyes.\
\
Maladan te ha pedido que explores las ruinas de Arthobel para ver si los saqueadores de tumbas las están usando activamente.","<rgb=#FF0000>Mira</rgb> a tu alrededor en busca de signos de actividad","Explorando Arthobel","Has localizado las ruinas de Arthobel","Arthobel se asienta en lo alto de las colinas sobre el Camino de los Reyes. Si los saqueadores lograran entrar, les proporcionaría un punto de vista muy estratégico.","Habla con Maladan","Maladan está en el campamento de los Montaraces en el Camino de los Reyes.\
\
Maladan se alegrará de saber que los saqueadores de tumbas no han conseguido acceder a Arthobel."}},
[10706]={nameES="Scouting Pahor Boha",objectivesES={"Scout the south-east gate","The south-west gate has a commanding view of the area. Any attackers will be easily spotted.","Torthril has asked you to scout the Pahor Boha's entrances.\
\
Pahor Boha can be found in the south-east of Pinnath Gelin.","Scouting Pahor Boha","The south-east gate faces trees and large boulders. These obstacles could be used to hide an approaching force.","Talk to Torthril","You to have scouted Pahor Boha's defences and should report your success.\
\
Talk to Torthril in Ost Arndír.","Scout the south-west gate","Torthril has asked you to scout the defences at Pahor Boha."}},
[10707]={nameES="Scouting Parth Daenath",objectivesES={"Talk to Thranduil","Thranduil can be found at Echad-in-Edhil.\
\
You should talk to Thranduil.","Scouting Parth Daenath","Thranduil has asked you to scout Parth Daenath.","Thranduil requires more knowledge of the Enemies' movements throughout the Corpse-fields of Parth Daenath."}},
[10708]={nameES="Scouting Shadows",objectivesES={"Oathbreakers have appeared across Parth Celebrant. Medwine has told you to scout the camps to the east and west of Idmar's encampment to understand the force they face.","As you scout the west camp, you notice a white tree adorning the garb of the Oathbreakers","Scout the northern Oathbreaker camp","As you scout the east camp, you note a moderately-sized force of Oathbreakers","Talk to Medwine","Talk to Idmar","Scouting Shadows","Scout the Oathbreaker camp to the west of Idmar's encampment","Medwine is camped outside the Oathbreaker camp in northern Parth Celebrant.\
\
Idmar has advised you to seek out Medwine.","Scout the Oathbreaker camp to the east of Idmar's encampment","Your discovery of a crazed Oathbreaker and the attacks upon his own party have caused Idmar a great deal of concern.","Idmar is at his camp along the road in central Parth Celebrant.\
\
You should return to Idmar with news of your discoveries.","As you approach the nearby Oathbreakers, you hear the voice of a man coming from somewhere nearby"}},
[10709]={nameES="Scouting Skarháld",objectivesES={}},
[10710]={nameES="Scouting Tâl Bruinen",objectivesES={"Scouting Tâl Bruinen","Scouted the Forgotten Monument","Scout the Forgotten Monument","Echad Candelleth lies in Tâl Bruinen, south of the Trollshaws, far to the south and east of the North Downs.\
\
Handarod has asked you to begin your patrol at the camp of Echad Candelleth.","Echad Gauradan lies in Tâl Bruinen, south of the Trollshaws, far to the south and east of the North Downs.\
\
Handarod has asked you to scout the encampment of Echad Gauradan.","The Forgotten Monument lies in the eastern area of Tâl Bruinen, south of the Trollshaws, far to the south and east of the North Downs.\
\
Handarod has asked you to scout the overlook marked by the Forgotten Monument. It provides a commanding view of the surrounding lands.","Echad Candelleth lies in Tâl Bruinen, south of the Trollshaws, far to the south and east of the North Downs.\
\
Handarod has asked you to complete your patrol by returning to Echad Candelleth.","Handarod is at Esteldín in the North Downs, far to the west and north of Tâl Bruinen.\
\
You should report to Handarod and tell him what you have seen in the wilds of Tâl Bruinen.","Scouted Echad Candelleth","Scouted Echad Gauradan","Scout Echad Candelleth","Scout Echad Gauradan","Talk to Handarod","Handarod is concerned for the safety of the hidden valley of Rivendell."}},
[10711]={nameES="Scouting Weathertop",objectivesES={"Echad Sûl is a small hill that lies north of Weathertop in the Lone-lands, far to the east of Bree-land.\
\
Nidgyl has asked you to scout the ruins of Echad Sûl.","Scouted Weatherfoot","Scouting Weathertop","Scout Glumhallow","Scouted Echad Sûl","Nidgyl is concerned with the movements of goblins, Orcs, and brigands in the surrounding areas.","Weathertop is in the Lone-lands, far to the east of Bree-land.\
\
Nidgyl has asked you to climb Weathertop itself to examine the surrounding lands.","Scouted Glumhallow","Weatherfoot lies far to the east of Bree-land, near Weathertop in the Lone-lands.\
\
Nidgyl has asked you to scout the Orc-encampment at Weatherfoot.","Nidgyl is at Bree-town in Bree-land, far to the west of Weathertop.\
\
You should report to Nidgyl and tell them what you have seen from the heights of Weathertop.","Scout Weatherfoot","Scout Echad Sûl","Talk to Nidgyl","Scouted Weathertop","Glumhallow is far to the east of Bree-land, near Weathertop in the Lone-lands.\
\
Nidgyl has asked you to scout the Orc-encampment at Glumhallow.","Scout Weathertop"}},
[10712]={nameES="Scouting for the Scout",objectivesES={"Scout the southern section of the camp","Numerous foul smelling cages and siege structures","Zarkul-sulûn is in southern Elderslade.\
\
Laugi has asked you to scout Zarkul-sulûn.","Gunvald is in Annâk-khurfu in Elderslade.\
\
You have enough information to make a report to Gunvald.","Scouting for the Scout","An army would be spotted from far off by anyone in this watch-tower","More cages, supplies, and a dead end","Examine the back of the camp","Another watch-tower, and plentiful supplies","The scout Laugi needs assistance completing his survey of the nearby enemy camp.","Scout the lower camp","Talk to Gunvald","Scout the east portion of the camp"}},
[10713]={nameES="Scouting in Force",objectivesES={"Handelen is at Thangúlhad in Gathbúrz.\
\
You should return to Handelen with the report of your patrol.","Patrol the third point in northern Gathbúrz","Talk to Handelen at Thangúlhad","Patrol the first point in northern Gathbúrz","Handelen fears that the Orcs are mustering their forces in the northern reaches of Gathbúrz.","Patrol the second point in northern Gathbúrz","Scouting in Force","Patrol the fourth point in northern Gathbúrz","You have scouted this area","The first point is north-east of Thangúlhad. The second point is to the north-west of the first, direcdly north of Kúfuzg. The third point is directly north of Thangúlhad, a little south of Búrzkala. The fourth point is just north-west of Thangúlhad.\
\
You should scout the waypoints of the patrol that Handelen has asked you to undertake and defeat any enemies you might find there."}},
[10714]={nameES="Scouting the Blight",objectivesES={"Complete Quest 'Creatures of the Mire'","Legolas has asked you to scout areas in the Noman-lands and destroy any blighted wildlife you encounter.","Complete Quest 'Culling the Blighted'","Scout the Northern Noman-lands","Scouted the Northern Noman-lands","Return to Legolas","Scout the Southern Noman-lands","Complete two quests for Legolas while exploring the Noman-lands.\
\
Legolas has asked you to scout areas in the Noman-lands and destroy any blighted wildlife you find.","Explora la Ciénaga de los Muertos","Scouting the Blight","Legolas can be found at the Camp of the Host, on the northern edge of North Ithilien.\
\
You should return to Legolas.","Find three survey locations around the Noman-lands.\
\
Legolas has asked you to scout areas in the Noman-lands and destroy any blighted wildlife you find.","Scouted the Dead Marshes","Scouted the Southern Noman-lands"}},
[10715]={nameES="Scouting the Circle of Sorrow",objectivesES={"Scout the north-eastern side of the Circle of Sorrow","The withered gardens smell of rot and decay","The ancient theatre is now a torture pit, a den of great evil","Find the Song-house of Lindalírë","Damrod wishes to patrol the Circle of Sorrow in Minas Morgul to assess the difficulties that the Rangers of Ithilien will have to overcome.","Eyes of the Dead watch your every step","Shadows cast from above darken the Morgul stone","Damrod has asked you to scout the Circle of Sorrow in Minas Morgul.","The ancient forge creaks and ghostly sounds echo throughout","Damrod can be found in Barad Orhant in Minas Morgul.\
\
You should talk to Damrod.","Talk to Damrod in Barad Orhant","Scout the western side of the Circle of Sorrow","Find Búrzangh, the Shrouded Forge","Find Dâr Grazadh, the Hall of Rot","Scouting the Circle of Sorrow","Scout the north-western side of the Circle of Sorrow","The hall is teeming with the Dead"}},
[10716]={nameES="Scouting the Conflict",objectivesES={}},
[10717]={nameES="Scouting the Dale",objectivesES={"The pass could prove a valuable route of attack for the Haban’akkâ","Investigate Muru Azog","A deadly perch from which trolls bombard those below with boulders","Watch-towers and heavy fortifications bar the road","Investigate Cloudyhead Pass","Investigate Kamaz-kala","With Thrain's scouts recovering, their duties must be taken up by another.","Talk to Sárgo","Scouting the Dale","Investigate Dursh Hûl","Investigate Rung-shakam","The Orcs have taken over these ruins","The hills are crawling with the enemy","Sárgo is in Zirakazhâr.\
\
You should return to Sárgo.","Locations to be scouted can throughout Azanulbizar.\
\
Sárgo Stiffbeard has asked you to take over the duties of the scouts that you rescued."}},
[10718]={nameES="Scouting the Enemy",objectivesES={}},
[10719]={nameES="Scouting the Enemy",objectivesES={}},
[10720]={nameES="Scouting the Harlond",objectivesES={"Complete Quest, The Harlond: Black Hearts","Dindal the scout can be found high up in a secluded look-out, which can be reached by turning north off the east road from Imloth Melui.\
\
You should return to Dindal and let him know all that you have seen.","The Orc forces are camped in the Harlond, on the northern edge of Lossarnach and south of the Rammas Echor.\
\
Dindal the scout has encouraged you to go into the Harlond and survey the Orc forces to learn what can be done.","Complete Quest, The Harlond: Fell Tools","Speak with Dindal","The noxious vapours of the Orc defilers' work waft out from the ruined structures","The Orcs have fully blocked the southern gate. Siege equipment has been constructed here and there along the wall","Investigate the Rammas Echor wall","Investigate the piers","Inspect the northern structure","A large Orc force occupies the Harlond and the Rammas Echor's southern gate.","Look-outs stand at key locations near the Harlond's entrance","Scouting the Harlond","The Harlond's piers are lightly guarded; they clearly expect no trouble from this direction","Complete Quest, The Harlond: Cruel Eyes","Investigate the entrance"}},
[10721]={nameES="Scouting the Incursion",objectivesES={"Mizâdi has asked you to scout the Orc camp near the Span of Danagír, sabotaging the Orkish weapons racks as you go.","Return to Mizâdi in Urmâkh with your report.","Scout the bend in the Orc camp","Scout deeper in the camp","You see many Orcs milling around the camp","There are fewer Orcs and more weapons here","Scout the entrance to the Orc camp","Scout the back of the camp","Derrota al Devastador Utûgi.","Mizâdi asks you to scout the Orc camp near the Span of Danagír. If possible, destroy the Orkish weapons in their racks.","Scout the back of the Orc camp.","Return to Mizâdi in Urmâkh","You hear an enormous roar as a shiver goes up your spine","There are many Orcs over here, and something large near the back","Derrota al Devastador Utûgi","Scouting the Incursion"}},
[10722]={nameES="Explorando los Pantanos",objectivesES={"Las Piedras Hundidas están ubicadas al sureste de la granja de Eldo Swatmidge, al este de Entibo. Las Ruinas de la Cueva de Trasgos están mucho más al este y al sur de las Piedras Hundidas.\
\
El vigilante Hierbaroja quiere que visites dos ruinas en el sur de los Pantanos de Moscagua y derrotes trasgos en cada ubicación para evaluar la amenaza que representan para la seguridad de Entibo.","Bill Musgopié está apostado al sureste de las ruinas de los Pantanos de Moscagua.\
\
Hierbaroja te dijo que informaras tus hallazgos en las ruinas a Bill Musgopié.","Habla con Bill Musgopié","El vigilante Hierbaroja te ha pedido ayuda para ocuparte de los trasgos que se han instalado en los Pantanos de Moscagua.","Explorando los Pantanos"}},
[10723]={nameES="Explorando las montañas",objectivesES={"Las noticias de Arifael fueron motivo de gran preocupación para Ringhul.","La exploradora Gwaemithrin está en las tierras altas al norte y al este de Rivendel, en el campamento de Glóin.\
\
Ringhul te ha pedido que lleves la advertencia de Arifael a Gwaemithrin y averigües qué sabe sobre los gigantes de las Montañas Nubladas.","Explorando las montañas","Habla con Gwaemithrin"}},
[10724]={nameES="Scouting the North-gate",objectivesES={}},
[10725]={nameES="Explorando Ram Dúath",objectivesES={"Los Montañeses han establecido un pequeño campamento más allá de Ram Dúath","Explora el paso por el Ram Dúath occidental","Melthindir espera tu informe en Esteldín.\
\
Las fuerzas Angmarim han enviado una pequeña compañía de Montañeses a la entrada sureste de Ram Dúath. En la entrada suroeste de Ram Dúath, descubriste evidencia de muchas sierpes y dragonzuelos. Debes regresar con tu informe a Melthindir.","Explorando Ram Dúath","Explora el campamento de los Montañeses en el Ram Dúath oriental","Regresa con Melthindir","El Ram Dúath occidental es hogar de sierpes y dragonzuelos","El campamento de los Montañeses está al noreste de Esteldín. El paso está al oeste del campamento, al noroeste de una formación de rocas espinosas.\
\
Melthindir te ha pedido que explores el campamento de los Montañeses y el paso por el que se acercaron para determinar la gravedad de la amenaza que representan, para que los Montaraces puedan planear una defensa contra ellos.","Orcos salieron de Ram Dúath y arrasaron las Quebradas del Norte. Tras su paso, Montañeses de Angmar cruzaron el paso y acamparon más allá de los acantilados y senderos traicioneros."}},
[10726]={nameES="Explorando las Ruinas",objectivesES={"Elladan está más allá de la puerta al este de Dorongúr Espinablanca.\
\
Dorongúr Espinablanca te ha enviado a hablar con Elladan, hijo de Elrond.","Explorando las Ruinas","Habla con Elladan en Edhelion.","Dorongúr Espinablanca te envió a hablar con Elladan, uno de los hijos gemelos de Elrond, enviado a Ered Luin para descubrir el significado de la oscura visión de su padre sobre el futuro."}},
[10727]={nameES="Scouting the Stores",objectivesES={"Scouting the Stores","Talk to Eirien at Mithechad","Eirien is at Mithechad, south-west of Garmadh-maudhûl.\
\
You should bring the discarded ore to Eirien. Perhaps she will be able to see if this ore has been affected by the blight.","Garmadh-maudhûl lies to the north-east of Mithechad.\
\
Eirien has asked you to collect some of the ore discarded by the Orcs of Garmadh-maudhûl.","Scouts of the Malledhrim witnessed the Orcs of Garmadh-maudhûl discarding piles of ore."}},
[10728]={nameES="Scouting the Way",objectivesES={"You have found the first patrol point","You found the third patrol point","You found the fourth patrol point","Find the first patrol point","You found the second patrol point","Nan Curunír stretches forth beyond Dagoras' camp.\
\
Dagoras has suggested that you scout the southern part of Nan Curunír.","Scouting the Way","Talk to Dagoras at his camp in Nan Curunír","Dagoras is encamped near the entrance to Nan Curunír.\
\
You should return to Dagoras and let him know what you have found.","The Vale of Nan Curunír lies before you. Tales described it as a lush and green valley, but the devastation stretched out before you tells a dark tale. You must learn more of the land before you proceed further.","Find a friend near Nan Curunír","Find the second patrol point","Find the third patrol point","Find the fourth patrol point","Nan Curunír lies to the north of the Ford of Isen.\
\
Grimbold has sent you to the Vale of Nan Curunír and suggested that you might find a friend awaiting you there."}},
[10729]={nameES="Scouting the Way-crossing",objectivesES={"A Gondorian guard coming from the west arrives at the way-crossing","The way-crossing is west of Tadrent.\
\
Guard Osbenn was supposed to go to the way-crossing west of Tadrent and <rgb=#00FF00>look</rgb> to ensure the roads were clear of danger, but now he is too exhausted to make the trip and asked you to do it.","Wait for the newcomer to arrive","Someone approaches along the road.","The road seems clear of danger, but someone approaches","Go to the way-crossing west of Tadrent, in King's Gondor, and <rgb=#00FF00>look</rgb> for danger on the road","Guard Osbenn was supposed to scout the way-crossing west of Tadrent, but he is too tired to do it now.","Talk to Guard Dalmann at the way-crossing west of Tadrent, in King's Gondor","Guard Dalmann has arrived at the way-crossing west of Tadrent.","Scouting the Way-crossing"}},
[10730]={nameES="Explorando lo Salvaje",objectivesES={"Habla con Barachen","Baraches está en su campamento al este del Último Puente, en una colina al sur del camino\
\
Alphlanc te pidió que lleves noticias a Barachen de que ningún mal ha entrado al Bosque de los Trolls mientras ella ha estado vigilando el Último Puente, aunque tampoco ha salido ninguno.","Encuentra la señal de los Elfos","Los Elfos colocaron una piedra blanca como señal a lo largo del camino para guiar a los amigos hacia el campamento de Barachen.\
\
Alphlanc te dijo que buscaras una piedra blanca como señal hacia el este, siguiendo el camino.","Las marcas sobre esta piedra apuntan al sur del camino, indicando la dirección del campamento de Barachen.","Alphlanc vigila el camino que cruza el Último Puente, por si algún siervo del Enemigo intenta entrar —o salir— del Bosque de los Trolls.","Explorando lo Salvaje"}},
[10731]={nameES="Scouting Ânghum-maudhûl",objectivesES={"Scout the northern camp","Scout the eastern approach","Scouted the eastern approach","Talk to Harchador at Mithechad","Scouting Ânghum-maudhûl","Ânghum-maudhûl lies to the south-east of Mithechad.\
\
Harchador has asked you to explore the western and eastern approaches to the camp and a small camp directly across from the main rallying point at Ânghum-maudhûl.","In the southern reaches of the Ashenslades, Ânghum-maudhûl stands as the central rallying point for Orcs in the area.","Scouted the western approach","Harchador is at Mithechad, north-west of Ânghum-maudhûl.\
\
You should return to Harchador and give your report on Ânghum-maudhûl.","Scouted the northern camp","Scout the western approach"}},
[10732]={nameES="Exploradores en las Gargantas del Bruinen",objectivesES={"Habla con Narlinn","Exploradores en las Gargantas del Bruinen","Narlinn y Fimgris están acampados junto al camino, al este del campamento de Barachen.\
\
Barachen está impresionado con tu habilidad y determinación, y te ha pedido que prestes tu ayuda a los hijos de Elrond, quienes vigilan el Bosque de los Trolls desde su campamento cerca de las Gargantas del Bruinen. Te dijo que Narlinn y Fimgris podrán guiarte hasta Thorenhad, donde residen los hijos de Elrond.","Muchos exploradores fueron enviados por el Bosque de los Trolls para vigilar cualquier señal de maldad por orden de Elladan y Elrohir, los hijos de Elrond."}},
[10733]={nameES="Scouts of the Enemy",objectivesES={"Scouts of the Enemy","After the recent attack on Wakenflood, tensions are high at this outpost. The commander wishes to deflect future attacks from Easterlings by ousting the scouts who prowl the bounds.","Find Sergeant Hubyrt at Wakenflood","Sergeant Hubyrt can be found at Wakenflood.\
\
You should find Sergeant Hubyrt and offer your help to him.","Defeated a scouting party","Find and defeat an Easterling scouting party","Easterling scouting parties can be found between Wakenflood and the Easterling encampment at the Anduin's edge.\
\
You should find and defeat an Easterling scouting party.","Sergeant Hubyrt is at Wakenflood, attempting to hold a badly weakened outpost.\
\
You should return to Sergeant Hubyrt with news of the scouting party you defeated.","Return to Sergeant Hubyrt of Wakenflood"}},
[10734]={nameES="Scouts on the Move",objectivesES={"Talk to Rothulf, who seems to have something important to tell you","Rothulf suspects that a threatening presence can be found around Wynmar's camp in the south of Thinglad.\
\
You should search for and defeat any threats to the Rohirrim hunters.","Stop the scouts' leader from sounding the alert","The scout has escaped...this does not bode well for the Rohirrim","Rothulf stands near Wynmar at the southern Rohirrim camp.\
\
Wynmar is distracted by his love for Noriel, but Rothulf has asked for a word with you.","Rothulf is in Wynmar's camp in southern Thinglad.\
\
You should return to Rothulf with the dire news of the escaped scout.","Scouts on the Move","With Wynmar distracted by his admiration for Noriel, Rothulf is deeply concerned about the movements of Orcs on the fringes of the camp.","A hardy leader of the Orc-scouts' initiative is likely somewhere near Wynmar's camp.\
\
You should try to defeat the scouts' leader before he can alert the attackers of the Rohirrim's whereabouts.","Return to Rothulf with news of the Orc-threat"}},
[10735]={nameES="Jirones de sombra",objectivesES={"Jirones de sombra","Has encontrado la cueva de los murciélagos","La entrada a la cueva de los murciélagos está al sureste de la entrada de Zirakzigil.\
\
Kalman te ha pedido que des caza a los murciélagos que infestan el Camino de Durin.","Kalman está en el puesto avanzado cerca de la entrada a Zirakzigil, en el Camino de Durin, al noroeste de la cueva de los murciélagos.\
\
Deberías volver a ver a Kalman para informarle de que has tenido éxito.","Habla con Kalman en la entrada a Zirakzigil","La entrada a la cueva de los murciélagos está al sureste del Cruce de Durin.\
\
Kalman te ha pedido que des caza a los murciélagos que infestan el Camino de Durin.","Habla con Kalman en la Puerta de las Nubes","Encuentra la cueva de los murciélagos","Algo está agitando a los murciélagos, para preocupación de los enanos de Moria.","Kalman se encuentra en el pequeño puesto avanzado de la entrada a Zirakzigil en el Camino de Durin."}},
[10736]={nameES="Scratching the Surface",objectivesES={"As you look down, you find a remnant of a fallen branch. The bark appears to be ashen-coloured and smells of decay, though something still speaks of an ancient beauty it may once have possessed.\
\
Perhaps you should bring this to Himeinior at Barad Angol to see if he can tell you anything about the branch.","Himeinior is at Barad Angol, a small camp at a tower overlooking Sâd Doldúr.\
\
You should seek out Himeinior and give him the branch you found. Perhaps he can discern more about what is happening to the trees in the Ashenslades.","Bring the blighted branch to Himeinior","Scratching the Surface","You discovered a blighted branch in the Ashenslades, corrupted by an unknown disease."}},
[10737]={nameES="Scroll Delivery",objectivesES={"Scroll Delivery","You have been asked to deliver blank papyrus scrolls to a woman named Amâsu, who is in Iridír, a town in Ambarûl east of Mehêtur.","Deliver the scrolls to Amâsu in Iridír","Sûlmur has blank papyrus scrolls that need to be delivered."}},
[10738]={nameES="Scurrying Scamps",objectivesES={"You should let Abartârik know that you defeated many rats at Hashadir.\
\
Abartârik is in Dol Amroth outside of the Swan-knight's Keep.","Lothíriel has asked you to speak with Abartârik to see what they discovered at Hashadir.\
\
Abartârik is in Dol Amroth outside of the Swan-knight's Keep.","Talk to Abartârik","Scurrying Scamps","Abartârik has asked you to help drive out the rat population that has erupted in Hashadir.\
\
Hashadir is south of Dol Amroth.","The vermin who have taken up residence at Hashadir stand to pose a serious threat to the citizens of Dol Amroth.","Return to Abartârik"}},
[10739]={nameES="Scuttling Through the Narrows",objectivesES={"Habla con Radagast","Ríkmar has heard troubling stories concerning Blómgard, a small Woodman settlement in the southern reaches of Laerlad.","Odahild can be found in Blómgard.\
\
You should talk to Odahild, the leader of Blómgard.","Travel to Blómgard in Laerlad","Radagast can be found in Blómgard.\
\
You should talk to Radagast.","Find Odahild, the leader of Blómgard","Blómgard can be found at the edge of the southern wood of Laerlad in the Vales of Anduin.\
\
You should travel to Blómgard and see if you could be of any help there.","Scuttling Through the Narrows","The folk of Blómgard barely seem to notice you","Odahild is deep in conversation with Radagast, the Brown Wizard","Talk to Odahild, leader of Blómgard"}},
[10740]={nameES="Scylfig: A Celebration Feast",objectivesES={"<rgb=#FF0000>Do not allow time to expire</rgb>","The Event Coordinator is standing next to Wulfherr.\
\
You should speak with the Event Coordinator when you are ready to begin.","Tables with food may be found outside the gates of Scylfig.\
\
Eat as much food as possible before time runs out.","Talk to Event Coordinator","<rgb=#FF0000>Completing Wildermore's Recovery will cancel this quest.</rgb>","Speak with Wulfherr or Gyric.","Scylfig: A Celebration Feast","The people of Scylfig celebrate the end of the giant Núrzum.","Gyric is waiting for your decision in Forlaw.\
\
You should speak with Gyric when you are ready to travel to Scylfig in the Writhendowns and talk to Wulfherr to join the festivities.","Talk to Gyric to travel to Scylfig in the Writhendowns and speak with Wulfherr","<rgb=#FF0000>Time has expired</rgb>","Talk to Wulfherr or Gyric."}},
[10741]={nameES="Scylfig: Target-shooting",objectivesES={"<rgb=#FF0000>Do not allow time to expire</rgb>","Use the Scylfig bow","Used the Scylfig bow","Gyric is waiting for your decision in Forlaw.\
\
You should speak with Gyric when you are ready to travel to Scylfig in the Writhendowns and talk to Wulfherr to join the festivities.","<rgb=#FF0000>Completing Wildermore's Recovery will cancel this quest.</rgb>","Talk to Gyric to travel to Scylfig in the Writhendowns and speak with Wulfherr","<rgb=#FF0000>Time has expired</rgb>","Scylfig: Target-shooting","The people of Scylfig celebrate the end of the giant Núrzum.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>This quest requires Mounted Combat</rgb>\
\
<rgb=#00FF00>Note: This quest auto-completes upon beating the course.</rgb>","Use the bow Wulfherr gave you to obtain your skills.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Note: This quest auto-completes upon beating the course.</rgb>","Targets may be found throughout the course in the Writhendowns.\
\
Destroy targets to gain points towards the success of the celebration event.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Note: This quest auto-completes upon beating the course.</rgb>"}},
[10742]={nameES="Seal the Path",objectivesES={"The goblin-cave lies to the north of Cadthorn's position, along the ridge.\
\
Cadthorn has asked you to collapse the entrance of the goblin-cave.","Collapse the cave entrance","Cadthorn and his companions were attacked by goblins as they journeyed to Forthbrond from Edoras with important messages.","Ardwyn is at Forthbrond, south of the goblin-cave.\
\
Cadthorn asked you to return to Ardwyn with news of your success.","Collapsed the cave entrance","Seal the Path","Talk to Ardwyn at Forthbrond"}},
[10743]={nameES="Sellando los túmulos",objectivesES={"El túmulo de Thorún ha sido sellado","El túmulo de Brungúr ha sido sellado","Sella el túmulo de Thorún","Sellando los túmulos","Ivorel teme que los daños causados por los maestros demacrados no puedan revertirse, pero los túmulos deben sellarse para evitar que más Muertos emerjan y amenacen a los Malledhrim.","Los túmulos se encuentran al noreste del campamento de Ivorel.\
\
Ivorel te ha pedido que cierres los túmulos de las Hondonadas Enmarañadas y coloques sobre ellos sellos de manufactura élfica para impedir que los espíritus malignos de Morgoth se alcen como espectros.","Sella el túmulo de Brungúr","El túmulo de Mordeloth ha sido sellado","Ivorel se encuentra en su campamento, al suroeste de los túmulos.\
\
Deberías regresar junto a Ivorel con la noticia de tu éxito.","Habla con Ivorel en su campamento","Sella el túmulo de Mordeloth","NO DEBERÍAS VER ESTO"}},
[10744]={nameES="Sealing the City",objectivesES={}},
[10745]={nameES="Sellar la puerta",objectivesES={"Jarmárr quiere eliminar el campamento de trasgos recientemente descubierto. Snaga-maudhûl es una amenaza para todos los que viajan desde la Puerta de Acebeda hacia el resto de Moria.","Habla con Wegil en el lado nordeste de Snaga-maudhûl","Wegil se encuentra en el lado nordeste de Snaga-maudhûl, vigilando el camino.\
\
Deberías encontrarlo y hablar con él.","Sellar la puerta","El campamento de trasgos se encuentra en los túneles más allá de la grieta sobre las escaleras orientales.\
\
Los enanos quieren poner fin al dominio de los trasgos en los túneles inferiores para garantizar la seguridad de su posición."}},
[10746]={nameES="Sellando el Pacto",objectivesES={"El intendente Orgrin está en Othrikar, al noroeste de Rusfold.\
\
Iivari te ha pedido que realices una última tarea para él: desea que entregues una alforja de hierbas a Orgrin, el proveedor en Othrikar, como cumplimiento de un pacto entre los Hijos de la Tierra y los enanos.","Existe un pacto entre los Suuri-lehmä y los Enanos de Othrikar, por el cual cada uno brindaría ayuda al otro.","Lleva la alforja de hierbas de Iivari al intendente Orgrin","Sellando el Pacto"}},
[10747]={nameES="En busca de los desaparecidos",objectivesES={"Los dos enanos, Knakk y Kafli, deberían encontrarse en algún lugar al este, en los alrededores o más allá del territorio de los orcos.\
\
Te han pedido que encuentres a los enanos Knakk y Kafli.","Knakk y Kafli se dirigieron hacia el este cuando la compañía de enanos se separó al pie de las escaleras de la Guardia Orca. Consideraban que los orcos no eran más que un pequeño obstáculo y que podrían abrirse paso a través de su territorio y acampar al otro lado de las Vetas del Cuerno Rojo.","Busca a los enanos que se dirigieron hacia el este","En la mano fría y rígida de este enano hay un medallón bellamente tallado a mano. Tras manipularlo un rato, te has dado cuenta de que no es un medallón normal y que no se abre con facilidad. Deberías llevárselo al compañero de este enano caído, que tal vez continuó sin él y debería encontrarse en algún lugar al este.","En busca de los desaparecidos","Recogiste el medallón que Kafli sujetaba cuando murió.","Knakk debió de continuar después de que Kafli cayera en manos de los orcos, pero quizás no esté muy lejos. Seguro que no habría querido abandonar a su amigo...","Aquí yace Kafli... ¿eso que tiene agarrado en la mano es un collar?","Encuentra a Knakk"}},
[10748]={nameES="Searchers",objectivesES={}},
[10749]={nameES="Rastreadores de Haudh Eldacar",objectivesES={"Rastreadores de Haudh Eldacar","Habla con Rodlam en el Camino de los Reyes","Angmar ha mostrado interés por Haudh Eldacar.","Haudh Eldacar se encuentra al suroeste del campamento de los Montaraces, en el Camino de los Reyes.\
\
Rodlam te ha pedido que te adentres en Haudh Eldacar y derrotes a los Angmarim que se encuentran allí.","Rodlam se encuentra en el campamento de los Montaraces, en el Camino de los Reyes.\
\
A Rodlam le interesará saber que derrotaste a muchos Angmarim en Haudh Eldacar."}},
[10750]={nameES="Searching For Diamonds",objectivesES={}},
[10751]={nameES="Searching For Gold",objectivesES={}},
[10752]={nameES="Searching For Sapphires",objectivesES={}},
[10753]={nameES="Searching For Treasures",objectivesES={"Bráthi the Master Prospector is in search of rare treasures in Gundabad.","Deliver the dwarf-made treasure to Bráthi","Searching For Treasures","Dwarf-made treasure can be found on chests, packs, and corpses throughout Gundabad.\
\
You should return to Bráthi when you have collected enough dwarf-made treasures."}},
[10754]={nameES="Searching for Cyneberg",objectivesES={}},
[10755]={nameES="Searching for Eagles",objectivesES={"You have arrived at Talan Brethil","You have arrived at Talan Fanuidhol","You scan the horizon, but do not see any Great Eagles","Searching for Eagles","You have arrived at Talan Gwilith","<rgb=#FF0000>Look</rgb> into the distance from Talan Gwilith","Talk to Cúvroval at Talan Revail","Cúvroval has received orders that every flet must be on the look-out for a sighting of one of the magnificent Great Eagles who hail from the northern Misty Mountains.","Cúvroval is at Talan Revail, north-east of Cerin Amroth.\
\
You should return to Cúvroval to report that empty skies were all you saw from the telain.","<rgb=#FF0000>Look</rgb> into the distance from Talan Fanuidhol","The sky is empty of any Great Eagle, as far as you can see","<rgb=#FF0000>Look</rgb> into the distance from Talan Brethil","You are unable to spot any bird larger than a hawk","Talan Brethil is to the south-east of Talan Revail, along the banks of the Anduin. Talan Gwilith and Talan Fanuidhol are well west and a bit south of Talan Revail, along the border of Fanuidhol where the Orcs have recently emerged from Moria.\
\
Cúvroval wants you to go to three of the telain and <rgb=#FF0000>look</rgb> into the distance from atop all three of them to search for a Great Eagle in the sky. She was not told why this look-out had to be kept, only that it was essential."}},
[10756]={nameES="Searching for Erkenbrand",objectivesES={"Searching for Erkenbrand","Marton is destroyed! You should search for survivors who might yet be nearby","Gather news of Erkenbrand in Marton","You have decided to begin your search for Erkenbrand in the town nearest the Fords of Isen: Marton.","Marton is north-west of Helm's Dike in the Westfold.\
\
You should head to Marton to begin your search for Erkenbrand and the other missing lords of the Westfold.","It is likely that any survivors from Marton fled north of town into the trees and stony hills.\
\
You should search north of Marton in the stony hills for any refugees who may have survived.","Find survivors who escaped Marton","This part of the woods looks to have many promising hiding spots...."}},
[10757]={nameES="Buscando manantiales frescos",objectivesES={"La entrada del Bosque Viejo está al este, y el campamento de Adso está al norte desde allí. \
\
Adso te envió al Bosque Viejo a buscar agua, pero sin nada en las manos. Baya de Oro te ha dado un cubo en el que llevar agua de vuelta al campamento de Adso y te ha concedido permiso para sacar agua de su estanque, pero advierte que el Bosque es peligroso.","Habla con la hermosa mujer en el manantial","Encuentra el manantial","Graham Larkspur desea hablar contigo de nuevo.","Graham Larkspur es uno de los trabajadores de Adso. Él y sus compañeros se están quedando sin agua y necesitan ayuda para reponer su suministro.","Has traído el agua de vuelta a Graham Larkspur","Al encontrar el manantial al que Graham Larkspur te envió, notaste a una mujer hermosa pero de aspecto extraño de pie debajo del roble en la orilla occidental del río. Quizás ella posea los medios para que lleves agua de vuelta al campamento de Adso.","Recoge el cubo","Hay una mujer extraña y hermosa de pie cerca del manantial","La entrada al Bosque Viejo está al sur del campamento de Adso. El manantial se encuentra hacia el oeste dentro del bosque. \
\
Graham Larkspur te ha pedido que traigas agua del manantial que sus cazadores encontraron.","Buscando manantiales frescos"}},
[10758]={nameES="Searching for Hope",objectivesES={"Frustrated at her failure to locate the Dubarâkh, Girhâzi needs a moment to herself and sent you to talk to Amâsu instead.","Talk to Girhâzi","Complete Instance: Searching for Hope","Talk to Amâsu","You accompanied Girhâzi to explore the abandoned salt mine of Ashunûg in search of the Dubarâkh. Instead of a library, you found a cult and Khûldim Umûn found death at the hands of his would-be rescuers.","Khûldim Umûn has informed Girhâzi that the Dubarâkh is inside an abandoned salt mine. You are invited to join them as they search the caves for the lost library of Ambarûli culture and history.","Searching for Hope","Talk to Girhâzi when you are ready to travel to the salt mine in search of the Dubarâkh."}},
[10759]={nameES="Searching for Iphantemel",objectivesES={"You should return to Thranduil in Felegoth.","Track the wounded spider","Thranduil's chief hunter, Thorlind, has also been on Iphantemel's trail.","Find the spiders by the Rhachló","Search for Iphantemel's den","An old rocky pass leads downward into a shadow-covered gorge","The trail of spider blood begins near the banks of Rhachló and will hopefully lead right to the den of Iphantemel.\
\
You should track the wounded spider.","Thorlind has spotted spiders harvesting sap along the river-banks of the Rhachló.\
\
You should seek out the spiders that Thorlind found.","The dripping trail of blood from the spider continues deeper into the forest","Approach one of the spiders","The wounded spider flees!","Talk to Thranduil","Searching for Iphantemel","Talk to Thorlind","Thorlind has spotted spiders harvesting sap along the river-banks of the Rhachló.\
\
You should approach one of these sap-harvesting spiders.","You should talk to Thorlind, in Felegoth, about what he has found.","A spider has noticed you!","You should talk to Thorlind by the banks of the Rhachló.","You should talk to Thorlind where he stands just outside Torech Emel."}},
[10760]={nameES="Searching for Signs",objectivesES={"Mincham is at his camp north of the barrows.\
\
You should return to Mincham and deliver the intact corrupted phial you collected.","The foetid liquid you discovered in the barrows of the Lich Bluffs may yet provide a clue to the mystery of the Dead in that place.","Return to Mincham with the corrupted phial","Wights can be found in great numbers among the southernmost barrows of the Lich Bluffs.\
\
Mincham has asked you to try and recover an intact phial of the foetid liquid from the wights of the Lich Bluffs.","Collected an intact corrupted phial","Searching for Signs","Collect an intact corrupted phial from the wights of the Lich Bluffs"}},
[10761]={nameES="Searching for Survivors",objectivesES={"The path north will be difficult but if there are survivors, you must try and rescue them.","The injured farmer can be found at the northern gate of the Rammas.\
\
You should kneel and listen to what the injured farmer has to say.","You should patrol the road north and search for survivors in Talath Anor.","This Easterling appears to have been slain recently.","Searching for Survivors","A slain body nearby catches your attention","Ingold can be found at the northern gate of the Rammas.\
\
You should speak with Ingold.","Patrol the road north and search for survivors","Approach and examine the body","Speak with Ingold","You see no signs of survivors yet and should press on","Ingold has learned of an injured farmer who has made his way to the North-gate!","The farmer's breaths are short but his words are heavy","Continue to patrol the road north and search for survivors","The slain body is located on the road in Talath Anor.\
\
You should examine the body.","<rgb=#FF0000>Kneel</rgb> and listen to the injured farmer"}},
[10762]={nameES="Searching for Swimming Spots",objectivesES={"The water in the channel is calm and warm","Not a bad place to swim, but it is quite public","Searching for Swimming Spots","Swim in the southern cove","Swim off the south-western beach","This is a nice, quiet place to swim","The water is warm and perfect for swimming","The water is cold and the waves are a bit much","Swim at the west side of the harbour","Merkhâma has asked you to test various swimming spots around Furtherholm and then share your opinions with her.","Visitors often ask Merkhâma where the best places to swim are, but she doesn't know.","You have tested various swimming spots around Furtherholm. You should return to Merkhâma outside of The Cracked Flagon and share your opinions with her.","Talk to Merkhâma","Swim in the northern channel","Swim off the western beach"}},
[10763]={nameES="Searching for Swimming Spots",objectivesES={"Searching for Swimming Spots","Swim in the southern cove","The water is deep and people are just watching you possibly drown!","This would be a lot nicer if the water was more shallow","Swim off the south-western beach","Merkhâma has asked you to test various swimming spots around Furtherholm and then share your opinions with her.","It's all right here, but way too deep","Swim at the west side of the harbour","There is entirely too much water here!","Visitors often ask Merkhâma where the best places to swim are, but she doesn't know.","You have tested various swimming spots around Furtherholm. You should return to Merkhâma outside of The Cracked Flagon and share your opinions with her.","Talk to Merkhâma","Swim in the northern channel","What a dangerous place - this was a mistake!","Swim off the western beach"}},
[10764]={nameES="Searching the Debris",objectivesES={}},
[10765]={nameES="Searching the Sacks",objectivesES={}},
[10766]={nameES="Seashells by the Seashore",objectivesES={"Celethon asked you to help them collect seashells by the seashore.\
\
Collect seashells on the beach near Linhir.","This seashell seems to be prettier than others, though whether it counts as 'double-pretty' remains to be seen","Celethon examines each shell with what appears to be a jeweller's loupe before tucking them in his pockets.\
\
'The shells aren't for me, they're for my mum.\
\
'Every summer, Miss Túrith would make a necklace out of shells and give it to my mum, but Miss Túrith still hasn't come home from the war. Mum's really sad about it, so I want to try making one instead.\
\
'I promise I'll come home soon. Please don't tell my mum what I'm doing here. I want it to be a secret.'","You have collected enough seashells.\
\
Talk to Celethon on the beach near Linhir.","Seashells by the Seashore","Collect a pearlescent seashell","Talk to Celethon","You have secured a promise from Celethon to return home. It's time to tell Meligrien.\
\
Talk to Meligrien in Linhir.","Talk to Meligrien","Collect a vibrant seashell","This seashell seems sufficiently pearlescent","Collect a 'double-pretty' seashell","This seashell seems sufficiently vibrant","Meligrien would like for you to check on her child near the beach along Linhir's southern coast.","Meligrien has asked you to look for her child, Celethon. She suspects he can be found by the beach near Linhir.\
\
Talk to Celethon."}},
[10767]={nameES="Seasonal Boss from the Vaults: Thrâng Allowance",objectivesES={}},
[10768]={nameES="Estacional: Las Riquezas de Storvâgûn",objectivesES={"Storvâgûn aparece durante el Festival de Yule en Jefe del Pasado: Storvâgûn.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión solo puede progresarse en el nivel 2 de Jefe del Pasado: Storvâgûn. Además, solo puede completarse una vez por Festival de Yule.</rgb>","Entrega las monedas de oro viles a Verbena Manoverde en Risco Invernal","Estacional: Las Riquezas de Storvâgûn","Verbena Manoverde se encuentra en Risco Invernal.\
\
Has juntado unas cuantas monedas de oro viles y ahora debes entregárselas a Verbena Manoverde.","Los Hombres de Angmar otorgaron grandes riquezas a Storvâgûn. Aunque muchas de sus baratijas portan la corrupción del Rey Brujo de Angmar, los aventureros valientes podrían descubrir las riquezas más preciadas de Storvâgûn."}},
[10769]={nameES="Estacional: Las Monedas de Naruhel",objectivesES={"Extiendes las monedas que has reunido. El Sargento Tom las acepta y asiente solemnemente.\
\
'Estas son sin duda las mismas monedas de las que habló aquel juglar. Gracias, por atreverte a entrar en ese lugar terrible con la esperanza de ayudar al pueblo de las Tierras Solitarias.\
\
'Aquí, toma este obsequio. Es lo menos que puedo hacer. ¡Disfruta el resto del Festival de Primavera!'","Las monedas de oro ensangrentadas pueden obtenerse derrotando a Naruhel una vez al día durante el Festival de Primavera en Jefa de las Cámaras: Naruhel.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión solo puede progresar en Tier 3 de Jefa de las Cámaras: Naruhel. Además, solo puede completarse una vez por Festival de Primavera.</rgb>","Estacional: Las Monedas de Naruhel","El Sargento Tom se encuentra en el Recinto del Festival, en los Campos de Caballos de Bree.\
\
Has reunido varias monedas de oro ensangrentadas y ahora debes entregárselas al Sargento Tom.","El Sargento Tom ha oído relatos de aventureros que enfrentaron a Naruhel la Doncella Roja y quiere que le lleves pruebas de tus hazañas.","Entrega las monedas al Sargento Tom en el Recinto del Festival"}},
[10770]={nameES="Estacional: Las monedas de la Falla",objectivesES={"Las monedas forjadas con hierro de la Falla se pueden ganar derrotando a Thrâng una vez por día durante el Festival de verano en Señor de los cofres: Thrâng.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión solo se puede avanzar en el nivel 2 de Señor de los cofres: Thrâng. Además, esta misión solo se puede completar una vez por Festival de verano.</rgb>","Entrega las monedas a Campanula Redondo en el Árbol de la Fiesta","Campanula Redondo ha escuchado la historia de aventureros que se atreven a entrar en la Falla de Nûrz Ghâshu y le gustaría que le trajeras evidencia de este terrible lugar.","Estacional: Las monedas de la Falla","Tienes en tus manos las monedas que has reunido. Campanula las acepta, una amplia sonrisa se extiende por su rostro.\
\
'¡Estas son sin duda las mismas monedas que vi ese día en el Dragón Verde! ¡Así que la historia era cierta! Gracias, por haber desafiado ese terrible lugar por el bien de la curiosidad de esta vieja hobbit.\
\
'Aquí, toma este regalo. Es lo mínimo que puedo hacer. ¡Disfruta el resto del Festival de verano!'","Puedes encontrar a Campanula Redondo en el Árbol de la Fiesta en la Comarca.\
\
Has recogido varias monedas forjadas con hierro de la Falla y ahora debes entregárselas a Campanula Redondo."}},
[10771]={nameES="Carne de Res Sazonada con Coliflor — Introducción",objectivesES={"Carne de Res Sazonada con Coliflor — Introducción","El Maestro Cocinero también es el escribiente de la Sociedad de los Mathoms, y ha estado tan ocupado que no podrá preparar la próxima cena de la Sociedad.","Lleva la carne de res sazonada con coliflor a Baldwin Colazorro","Baldwin Colazorro está en la Casa de los Mathoms, en Cavada Grande, en la Comarca.\
\
Baldwin te ha pedido que le traigas carne de res sazonada con coliflor para los cocineros de la Sociedad de los Mathoms."}},
[10772]={nameES="Asiento del Gran Trasgo -- Nivel 1",objectivesES={"Derrota al Gran Trasgo","Grudom derrotado","Asiento del Gran Trasgo -- Nivel 1","Se ha corrido la voz desde las Montañas Nubladas de que los Trasgos de la Ciudad de los Trasgos se unen una vez más a su maestro.","Derrota a la mascota del Gran Trasgo, Grudom","El Gran Trasgo derrotado","Impide que los habitantes de la Ciudad de los Trasgos se reúnan bajo el mando del Gran Trasgo."}},
[10773]={nameES="Asiento del Gran Trasgo -- Nivel 2",objectivesES={"Derrota al Gran Trasgo","Grudom derrotado","Se ha corrido la voz desde las Montañas Nubladas de que los Trasgos de la Ciudad de los Trasgos se unen una vez más a su maestro.","Impide que los habitantes de la Ciudad de los Trasgos se reúnan bajo el mando del Gran Trasgo.","Asiento del Gran Trasgo -- Nivel 2","Derrota a la mascota del Gran Trasgo, Grudom","El Gran Trasgo derrotado"}},
[10774]={nameES="Segundo Desayuno",objectivesES={"Willem Bigotes está junto a una alforja sucia que parece haber sido propiedad de un orco. El lince te mira con orgullo, y recoges la alforja.\
\
Le echas un vistazo rápido al interior, y su contenido te hace reír pese a ti mismo. Decides llevársela a Bingo en la Posada Embrujada.","El estómago de Bingo le ha hecho completamente imposible concentrarse en seguir escribiendo su libro, y necesita que hagas algo respecto a esta situación de hambre.","Bingo quiere encontrarse contigo fuera de la puerta de Caras Galadhon, en Lothlórien.\
\
Bingo ya ha visto suficiente del Bosque Negro y ha decidido viajar contigo de vuelta a Lothlórien.","Willem Bigotes te mira con orgullo. ¿Quizá la alforja contiene algo útil para Bingo, después de todo?","Bingo está en la Posada Embrujada, situada en los Troncosombríos del Bosque Negro.\
\
Has recuperado una alforja orca encontrada por Willem Bigotes, y deberías llevársela a Bingo.","Willem Bigotes está dentro del muro exterior de Dol Guldur, subiendo una pendiente al norte de Fennas Guldur.\
\
Has encontrado a Willem, y parece que él ha encontrado una alforja sucia de algún tipo.","Calengoth está en los muelles de Lothlórien, al oeste de Imlad Lalaith.\
\
Bingo cree que ha caído víctima de una maldición que le provoca punzadas de hambre antinaturales, y quiere que pidas disculpas a Calengoth por el engaño que permitió al hobbit cruzar el río hacia el Bosque Negro.","Encuentra a Willem Bigotes en algún lugar del Bosque Negro","Habla con Calengoth en los muelles de Lothlórien","Regresa con Bingo a la Posada Embrujada con la alforja que encontró Willem","Lleva el paquete de lembas a Bingo fuera de Caras Galadhon, en Lothlórien","Recoges la alforja orca, y Willem ronronea satisfecho","Bingo está fuera de la puerta de Caras Galadhon, en Lothlórien.\
\
Calengoth te dio un pequeño paquete de lembas para entregárselo a Bingo y también perdonó al hobbit por su engaño.","Recoge la alforja que encontró Willem y dile que regrese a la Posada Embrujada","Habla con Bingo fuera de Caras Galadhon, en Lothlórien","Ves una figura familiar delante de ti: ¡Willem Bigotes!","Segundo Desayuno","Willem Bigotes está en algún lugar del Bosque Negro. Si preguntas por la Posada Embrujada y por otros lugares del bosque, quizá puedas averiguar adónde se ha marchado el lince.\
\
Bingo quiere que encuentres a Willem Bigotes y lo envíes de vuelta a la Posada Embrujada, ¡con desayuno si es posible!"}},
[10775]={nameES="Second Chance",objectivesES={"Talk to Andur","Find Andur","You have found Andur exactly where he is supposed to be, but the donkey is wounded. Andur is caring for the donkey and has asked you to collect the semi-precious stones from the pebbles for him. You have collected the stones, and should now talk to Andur.","Talk to Tibira in Western Khanâg","Second Chance","You have found Andur exactly where he is supposed to be, but the donkey is wounded. Andur is caring for the donkey and has asked you to collect the semi-precious stones from the pebbles for him.","You have found Andur exactly where he is supposed to be, tending to the wounded donkey. You collected the semi-precious stones for him, which he said he will carry back to the town. You returned to Tibira and as you were giving her an update, Andur arrived. You should talk to Andur.","Tibira gave a donkey and some supplies to Andur, formerly a soldier of Ordâkh and then a bandit, and sent him to collect some of the semi-precious gemstones that can be found in the desert. She says he should have returned by now and has asked for your help in finding what became of him.","You have found Andur in the hills east of Western Khanâg, exactly where he is supposed to be. You should talk to Andur.","You have found Andur exactly where he is supposed to be, tending to the wounded donkey. You collected the semi-precious stones for him, which he said he will carry back to the town. You returned to Tibira and as you were giving her an update, Andur arrived. You should continue talking to Tibira.","Andur is supposed to be in the hills east of Western Khanâg. You should go there and look for him.","Bring the colourful stones to Andur","You have found Andur exactly where he is supposed to be, tending to the wounded donkey. You collected the semi-precious stones for him, which he said he will carry back to the town. You should return to Tibira and give her an update.","Talk to Tibira","Andur found!"}},
[10776]={nameES="Secret Stashes in Ost Amondal",objectivesES={"A wily merchant is displeased by the opening of the roads which pass by Ost Amondal.","Return to Balgam","Secret Stashes in Ost Amondal","Balgam has asked you to retrieve crates that he has stashed about the ruins of Ost Amondal.\
\
Ost Amondal is in southern Belfalas.","You have managed to retrieve a great many of Balgam's stashed crates.\
\
You should deliver them to him outside of Ost Amondal, in southern Belfalas."}},
[10777]={nameES="Secretos largamente olvidados (opcional)",objectivesES={"Usa la piedra rúnica para invocar a Helegfan","Márus ha determinado que la piedra rúnica que encontraste ha sido corrompida por un espíritu maligno en las profundidades de Moria.","Habla con Márus en el Refugio Sombrío","Secretos largamente olvidados (opcional)","Márus se encuentra en el Refugio Sombrío, al sur de la Sala Decimosexta.\
\
Deberías regresar junto a Márus con noticias de tu victoria.","Helegfan puede encontrarse en la Sala Decimosexta, al norte del Refugio Sombrío, en el extremo sur de Nud‑melek.\
\
Márus te ha pedido que entres en la Sala Decimosexta y derrotes al espectro sombrío Helegfan para purificar la piedra rúnica de la corrupción del espíritu.","Derrota a Helegfan","Helegfan ha sido derrotado"}},
[10778]={nameES="Secrets of Skarháld",objectivesES={"Rúni, a Lore-master from Erebor, has journeyed to the Grey Mountains seeking lost history and knowledge. He suspects that even the fortress of Skarháld may hold secrets.","This chest is empty","Bring the old maps to Rúni","There is nothing useful in this chest","Old chests may be hidden in Skarháld.\
\
You should search any old chests that you find in Skarháld.","You found an old map!","Whatever was in here is just dust now","Secrets of Skarháld","Rúni can be found in Skarháld.\
\
You should bring the old maps to Rúni.","Rúni pores over the old maps.\
\
'Oh, this is too good not to share. I will have to show the Zhélruka as well! Do you know what these maps contain? One map is of Thikil-gundu, an old keep north-west of here.  Another map is of Glitgróf, a mine to the north. The third map is of Stormlind, a crafting hall north-east of here. These maps will assist in planning expeditions. You have found something very helpful, very helpful indeed!'","That may have been food once...","There is nothing of interest in this chest"}},
[10779]={nameES="Secrets of the Order",objectivesES={"Spakorth can be found at the Stout-axe barracks on the central level of Lûghash.\
\
You have discovered the location of the King of the Stout-axes by reading the missives and should now deliver them to Spakorth.","You have gathered three missives from the Order of the Eye and should now read them.","This missive details rumours concerning the fates of the Rings borne by the Nazgûl...","Deliver the missives to Spakorth in Lûghash","Collect a missive from a Mordath expedition-leader","Collect a missive from a Dor Amarth expedition-leader","You wrest a piece of parchment from the fallen expedition-leader...","This missive details artifacts rumoured to be held in a secret vault within the Black Pits of Mordath...","Collect a missive from a Lûghash expedition-leader","Secrets of the Order","The Order of the Eye has sent many of its followers into Dor Amarth hoping to uncover the resting places of Sauron's most powerful artifacts.","Order of the Eye expedition-leaders can be found patrolling outside Lûghash, upon the broken plains of Dor Amarth, and among the ruins of Barad-dûr that have sunken into the Mordath.\
\
Spakorth has asked you to retrieve missives from the Order of the Eye expedition-leaders searching the lands of Dor Amarth. Spakorth hopes they might reveal the whereabouts of the lost King of the Stout-axes.","This missive warns of Mistress Zôreth's motivations and her attempts to free a dwarf-king from Barad-dûr..."}},
[10780]={nameES="Secure the Landing of Kûr Anzar",objectivesES={"Defeat a Barkhûshim sorceress in Kûr Anzar","Mizâdi has asked you to lead the charge to secure the lower ward of Kûr Anzar. Once successful, Mizâdi can set up a foothold outside Kûr Anzar.","Secure the Landing of Kûr Anzar","Report your success to Mizâdi in Urmâkh.","Find and defeat Rokóbu in Kûr Anzar","Defeated a Barkhûshim sorceress","Report your success to Mizâdi in Urmâkh","Rokóbu lets out a strangled cry and collapses, defeated","Ready yourself for battle, then move swiftly into Kûr Anzar and defeat the forces of the All-seeing. Find and defeat the loathsome Barkhûshim leading them, Rokóbu. Kûr Anzar is located east of Urmâkh."}},
[10781]={nameES="Asegurando Kûr Anzar",objectivesES={"Destruye las fortificaciones y derrota a las fuerzas del que todo lo ve.","Asegurando Kûr Anzar","Encuentra y derrota a Usóhi, líder de los invasores Barkhûshim","Derrota a Usóhi, líder de los invasores Barkhûshim","Usóhi deja escapar un gruñido y levanta su bastón en desafío hacia ti"}},
[10782]={nameES="Securing Our Past",objectivesES={"Talk to Idmar","Securing Our Past","The brigands are located in the large camp to the south. It is likely that the thieves who carry these relics will be hard to detect, even among their fellows.\
\
Idmar has asked you to recover relics of Gondor from the brigands in Parth Celebrant.","Idmar is at his camp along the road in central Parth Celebrant.\
\
You should bring the relics you recovered to Idmar.","Idmar has considered Doron's plea and has chosen to take action against the brigands of Parth Celebrant."}},
[10783]={nameES="Asegurando el botín",objectivesES={"Ves un destello de acero.\
¡El Capitán de la tripulación de los Leales está bloqueando tu camino!","Regresa a tu barco con los suministros","Debes derrotar al Capitán de los Leales para poder regresar a tu barco.","Recoge los suministros recuperables que han llegado a la playa para que no caigan en manos de los Herederos de Castamir.","Derrota al Capitán de los Leales","Un barco que transportaba armas y suministros se ha hundido y la carga está llegando a la costa en las Islas del Escudo. Recoge los suministros recuperables para que no caigan en manos de los Herederos de Castamir.","Regresa a tu barco con los suministros que has recogido.","Asegurando el botín"}},
[10784]={nameES="Securing Stoke",objectivesES={}},
[10785]={nameES="Securing Vengeance",objectivesES={"You have reclaimed the Boar of Everholt's skull. The Orcs were worshipping it, driven by their hatred of Folca King and extending their ire to his descendents as well.\
\
This will be a nice decoration for the Mead Hall of Beaconwatch.","You have taken the Boar of Everholt's skull from the Boar-tribe.","Collect the Great Boar of Everholt's skull","Collected the Great Boar of Everholt's skull","While you are in the lair of the Boar-tribe Orcs, you should remove the skull of the Boar of Everholt and bring it to Beaconwatch.","Completado","Securing Vengeance","The symbol of vengeance that has driven the Boar-tribe Orcs hangs from a crudely put together totem. You should take the skull and bring it to Cútha in Beaconwatch."}},
[10786]={nameES="Asegurando el Agua",objectivesES={"Asegurando el Agua","Prueba la muestra de agua de la Cuencasangre","La pasta se dispersa en el agua, dándole un tono marrón que es mejor no describir con más detalle.","Murig podría usar tu ayuda para asegurar agua para los exploradores guerreros.","Has puesto a prueba todas las muestras de agua.\
\
Habla con Murig","Murig está junto a la orilla del río, cuesta abajo desde la Cuencasangre.\
\
Habla con Murig","Prueba la muestra de agua tomada lo más lejos posible de Cuencasangre","La mezcla se hunde hasta el fondo del agua sin dispersarse en absoluto.","Murig necesita muestras de agua de distintos puntos a lo largo del río.\
\
Recoge agua de la orilla del río.","Prueba la muestra de agua tomada a una distancia moderada de la Cuencasangre","Habla con Murig","Murig ha dispuesto tres recipientes de agua.\
\
Prueba cuál de los recipientes tiene el agua más limpia usando cada uno de los tres recipientes.","La pasta se dispersa un poco, enturbiando ligeramente el agua."}},
[10787]={nameES="Securing the Approach",objectivesES={"Talk to Glóin at Annâk-khurfu","Aid Glóin with 'Beyond the High-threshold'","Securing the Approach","Aid Glóin with 'After the Fall'","Aid Glóin with 'At the Gates'","Glóin can be found in the keep of Annâk-khurfu.\
\
Glóin has asked you to aid him and his scouts in securing the approach to Mount Gundabad.","Glóin has sent several scouts into Elderslade to aid the Gabil'akkâ in securing the approach to Mount Gundabad."}},
[10788]={nameES="Securing the Culvert",objectivesES={"Saruman's forces have used their black powder to create an opening at the culvert and have begun to infiltrate through the gap in the wall. \
\
Merit Rating\
\
This quest starts with <rgb=#FFFF00>Full</rgb> Merit Rating.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Major Merit Loss:</rgb>\
* Worker defeated\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Moderate Merit Loss:</rgb>\
* Too much time has passed before sealing the culvert \
* Every 15 seconds after the initial time penalty","Securing the Culvert","The Orcs have blasted a hole into the culvert upon the wall and are infiltrating through the gap. Assist the Rohirrim workers as they attempt to seal the opening to prevent further enemies from getting through the defences."}},
[10789]={nameES="Securing the Culvert",objectivesES={"Saruman's forces have used their black powder to create an opening at the culvert and have begun to infiltrate through the gap in the wall.  The Rohirrim labourers must be defended as they work to seal the culvert with nearby stones.\
\
Merit Rating\
\
This quest starts with <rgb=#FFFF00>Partial</rgb> Merit Rating.\
\
<rgb=#00FF00>Major Merit Gain</rgb>\
* Defeat Madhash\
* Defeat Vogalash\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Major Merit Loss:</rgb>\
* Labourer defeated\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Moderate Merit Loss:</rgb>\
* Excessive time has passed without the culvert being sealed (5 minutes)\
* Additional time has passed after the initial penalty (every 20s)","Securing the Culvert","The Orcs have blasted a hole into the culvert upon the wall and are infiltrating through the gap. Assist the Rohirrim labourers as they attempt to seal the opening to prevent further enemies from getting through the defences."}},
[10790]={nameES="Securing the Front",objectivesES={}},
[10791]={nameES="Asegurar la biblioteca",objectivesES={"Sót se encuentra en el Mirador de la Gran Excavación, al suroeste de Katûb-zahar.\
\
Deberías llevarle el tomo que has encontrado. Estará deseando examinarlo.","Algunos de los antiguos archivos del Pueblo de Durin se encuentran en la Gran Excavación, o eso dice un diario que encontraste en el camino.","Encuentra el tomo antiguo","Tomo antiguo encontrado","Esta página del diario describe la esperanza de alcanzar las antiguas bibliotecas de Khazad-dûm, conocidas como Katûb-zahar. El enano que poseía este libro buscaba un antiguo texto que, según se rumorea, detalla los métodos antiguos de combinar el mithril con otros metales, junto con muchos otros secretos sobre su correcta forja.\
\
Parece una búsqueda digna. Deberías continuar la misión del enano caído.","Asegurar la biblioteca","Lleva el tomo antiguo a Sót en el Mirador de la Gran Excavación","La biblioteca llamada Katûb-zahar indicada en el diario se encuentra al norte de Gazatmur, al nordeste del Mirador de la Gran Excavación.\
\
Deberías buscar el tomo antiguo en las antiguas bibliotecas de Khazad-dûm."}},
[10792]={nameES="Securing the Outskirts",objectivesES={"Dilûsu has asked you to help him deal with another group of brigands nearby that have been attacking people trying to flee.","Dilûsu has asked you to help him deal with a group of brigands near Zikrum-dûl who have been attacking people as they flee the Orcs.","Return to Dilûsu near Zikrum-dûl","Securing the Outskirts","Return to Dilûsu now that you have made the area safer from the brigands."}},
[10793]={nameES="Securing the Past",objectivesES={}},
[10794]={nameES="Securing the Savings",objectivesES={}},
[10795]={nameES="Securing the Wade",objectivesES={"Talk to Thane Edric","Securing the Wade","Thane Edric can be found outside the Mead Hall of Entwade in eastern Kingstead.\
\
Éowyn has asked you to travel to Entwade to assist Thane Edric in securing the Wade as his people evacuate to a more defensible shelter.","As Théoden King rides to war with Saruman, Éowyn commences her efforts to gather the people of Kingstead to Edoras.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Note: This quest will fail if you complete 'In the King's Wake' before speaking to Thane Edric.</rgb>"}},
[10796]={nameES="Securing the Way",objectivesES={}},
[10797]={nameES="Semillas para el futuro",objectivesES={"Celebrandir está en Gwingris, al norte de Glâd Ereg.\
\
Celebrandir está esperando las semillas que has conseguido.","La corrupción que ha afectado a Glâd Ereg y la destrucción provocada por los siervos del Enemigo han arruniado el bosque.","Semillas para el futuro","Lleva las semillas a Celebrandir en Gwingris","Las semillas de acebo pueden encontrarse en los arbustos que creen bajo los árboles en Glâd Ereg, al sur de Gwingris.\
\
Celebrandir te ha pedido que has consigas semillas de acebo, para que pueda replantar el bosque."}},
[10798]={nameES="Seeds for the Mother Tree",objectivesES={}},
[10799]={nameES="Seeds of Hope",objectivesES={"Seedlings can be found throughout the Vale of Nan Curunír.\
\
Dagoras asked you to gather up the seedlings struggling to survive in the Vale of Nan Curunír.","Bring the seedlings to Dagoras' ally","Seeds of Hope","The ally Dagoras mentioned might be up the ridge to the north-east from Dagoras' camp.\
\
Dagoras asked you to bring the seedlings to Dagoras' mysterious ally.","Dagoras has hinted that there is a potentially powerful ally to be found in Nan Curunír, but he was unwilling to say much of it."}},
[10800]={nameES="Semillas del Pasado",objectivesES={"Devuelve las semillas conservadas a Gailthin","El bosquecillo del que habla Gailthin está a poca distancia de ella.\
\
Gailthin te pidió que buscaras entre los montones de hojas alguna semilla conservada que pueda usarse para restaurar el bosque a su antigua belleza.","Los árboles de Edhelion, dormidos desde la partida de los Elfos, dejaron caer sus semillas hace mucho tiempo. Los Elfos del refugio creen que aún hay vida en las semillas conservadas que se encuentran entre los montones de hojas bajo las ramas secas.","Semillas del Pasado"}},
[10801]={nameES="Seeing the All-seeing",objectivesES={"Free Razâl from his bonds so you both can escape","Investigate the outskirts of Kûr Anzar for signs of Razâl","Razâl, Mizâdi's trusted scout, hasn't reported back in a day. Investigate the eastern outskirts of Kûr Anzar for signs of Razâl. Kûr Anzar is located east of Urmâkh.","Free Razâl from his bonds so you both can escape before the Barkhûshim notice you.","Scout the third outlook into Kûr Anzar","You have found Razâl. Free him quickly!","Speak with Mizâdi in Urmâkh","It's difficult to see clearly, but you finally count twelve All-seeing from your vantage point","Scout the second outlook into Kûr Anzar","Seeing the All-seeing","Find the three locations Razâl mentioned on the western outskirts north of where he was captured and scout Kûr Anzar from each of them.","Speak with Mizâdi in Urmâkh.","Scout the first outlook into Kûr Anzar","It's hard to see between the crumbling walls, but you finally count ten All-seeing cultists","Mizâdi's trusted scout, Razâl, has gone missing. She has asked you to search the western outskirts of Kûr Anzar for signs of his whereabouts.","You count nine Barkhûshim moving along the winding path into Kûr Anzar"}},
[10802]={nameES="Seek the Citadel",objectivesES={"Viznak directs you to return to Rhadrog and Faeron in Zajâna, convinced that the Blight Lady they pursue has arrived here in Adagím.","After speaking with Rhadrog, he is resolved to seeking out Lhaereth and asks that you inform Faeron at the fountain in Zajâna.","Seek the Citadel","Speak with Rhadrog at Zajâna","Viznak is concerned that the Blight Lady has come to these lands. He directs you to return to Rhadrog and Faeron at Zajâna.","Speak with Faeron near the fountain in Zajâna"}},
[10803]={nameES="Buscador de conocimiento",objectivesES={"Biblioteca de Tham Mírdain encontrada","Los elfos de Echad Mirobel han rastreado a las fuerzas de Angmar en Eregion hasta una antigua biblioteca.","Encuentra la Biblioteca de Tham Mírdain","Buscador de conocimiento","La Biblioteca de Tham Mírdain se encuentra en Mirobel, en la región suroeste de Eregion.\
\
Ornras de Echad Mirobel te ha pedido que encuentres la entrada a una antigua biblioteca."}},
[10804]={nameES="Buscador de conocimiento",objectivesES={"By completing this quest, you will be marked as completing Seeker of Knowledge","Buscador de conocimiento","Grants completion of quest: Seeker of Knowledge","Talk to Javatar to complete Seeker of Knowledge"}},
[10805]={nameES="En busca de respuestas",objectivesES={"Lleva las ramas podridas a Lithuifin","Lithuifin está en las Agujas de la Linde, en la orilla noroeste del lago Evendim.\
\
Debes llevarle las ramas podridas que has recogido.","La Arboleda Retorcida está al suroeste de las Agujas de la Linde.\
\
Lithuifin te ha pedido buscar indicios del poder que ha corrompido la Arboleda Retorcida. Te pidió recoger ramas podridas y llevárselos.","Ramalarga cree que algún poder maligno podría estar retorciendo el bosque con fines oscuros.","En busca de respuestas"}},
[10806]={nameES="Seeking Dúrossul",objectivesES={"You freeze in your place as a pain enters your chest. The cold stone conjures unbidden words to swell up inside you. Unknowingly you say 'power' followed by 'Borangos,' and 'Dúrossul.'\
\
You close your eyes to cope with the pain and an image of an armoured Rogmul towers over you next to a volcanic vent. Your eyes shoot open as the images burn away.\
\
Able to breathe again, you gather your thoughts. It seems the watching stone assumes you want to forge a treaty with Borangos and has shown you one of his lieutenants to speak to instead.","The Watching Stone can be found in Nargroth.\
\
You should return to the Watching Stone.","Destroy a more prominent vent and defeat Dúrossul","Return to the Watching Stone","Vents can be found in Nargroth.\
\
You should destroy vents to attract Dúrossul's attention.","The watching stone is motionless and the air smells strange and foul.\
\
You feel a sense of searching and piercing eyes all around you.","Dúrossul appears before you!","Seeking Dúrossul","The Watching Stone unwillingly divulges more information about the structure of Borangos' forces in Nargroth. You can use this to your advantage.","Defeated Dúrossul"}},
[10807]={nameES="Buscando Gloria",objectivesES={"Tórth se encuentra fuera del Cuartel de la Piedra Azul, cerca de la cascada en la Mansión de Thorin.\
\
El Capitán de Guardia Unnarr te ha pedido que hables con Tórth para ayudar en la lucha contra los Duramano.","Buscando Gloria","El Capitán de Guardia Unnarr te ha pedido que hables con Tórth fuera del Cuartel de la Piedra Azul."}},
[10808]={nameES="Seeking Hides",objectivesES={}},
[10809]={nameES="Seeking More Aid",objectivesES={}},
[10810]={nameES="Seeking Nargúr",objectivesES={"Destroy a more prominent pillar and defeat Nargúr","The watching stone is motionless and there seems to be a fine dust coating the air.\
\
You feel a sense of dread and piercing eyes all around you.","Seeking Nargúr","Defeated Nargúr","Pillars can be found in Nargroth.\
\
You should destroy pillars to attract Nargúr's attention.","Nargúr appears before you!","The Watching Stone can be found in Nargroth.\
\
You should return to the Watching Stone.","Return to the Watching Stone","You freeze in place as a pain enters your chest. The cold stone conjures unbidden words to swell up in you. Unknowingly you say 'power' followed by 'Borangos,' and 'Nargúr.'\
\
You close your eyes to cope with the pain and an image of an armoured Rogmul towers over you next to an ornate pillar. Your eyes shoot open as the images burn away.\
\
Able to breathe again, you gather your thoughts. It seems the watching stone assumes you want to forge a treaty with Borangos and has shown you one of his lieutenants to speak to instead.","The Watching Stone unwillingly divulges more information about the structure of Borangos' forces in Nargroth. You can use this to your advantage."}},
[10811]={nameES="Seeking Narthalum",objectivesES={"Seeking Narthalum","Destroy a more prominent statue and defeat Narthalum","The Watching Stone can be found in Nargroth.\
\
You should return to the Watching-stone.","Return to the Watching Stone","The watching stone is unmoving and silent.\
\
You feel a sense of confusion and piercing eyes all around you.","Statues can be found in Nargroth.\
\
You should destroy statues to attract Narthalum's attention.","Defeated Narthalum","You freeze in place as a pain enters your chest. The cold stone conjures unbidden words to swell up in you. Unknowingly you say 'power' followed by 'Borangos,' and 'Narthalum.'\
\
You close your eyes to cope with the pain and an image of an armoured Rogmul towers over you next to a vile statue. Your eyes shoot open as the images burn away.\
\
Able to breathe again, you gather your thoughts. It seems the watching stone assumes you want to forge a treaty with Borangos and has shown you one of his lieutenants to speak to instead.","The Watching Stone unwillingly divulges more information about the structure of Borangos' forces in Nargroth. You can use this to your advantage.","Narthalum appears before you!"}},
[10812]={nameES="En busca de salitre",objectivesES={"Cam Barroso está en su casa, en el centro de Bolgovado.\
\
El primer ingrediente que Hyacinth Tuk te ha enviado a buscar es el salitre. Te ha sugerido que vayas a ver a su amigo Cam Barroso, un criador de cerdos en Bolgovado.","En busca de salitre","Dado que Lobelia Sacovilla-Bolsón pagó para adquirir los ingredientes de sus fuegos artificiales, Hyacinth Tuk te ha reclutado para ayudarla a reunirlos."}},
[10813]={nameES="Seeking Signs",objectivesES={"Seeking Signs","The Elves of the Golden Host are concerned with the continuing presence of Orcs in the Mirk-eaves and in procuring supplies for the Malledhrim in the east.","The road to the Gostannon lies to the north of Amon Angeled, leading eastwards.\
\
Dannaswen has asked you to patrol the road to the Gostannon in order to determine the strength of the Enemy there.","Bring the Malledhrim weapons to Dannaswen atop Amon Angened","Dannaswen is at the Elf-waypost atop Amon Angened, south of the Gostannon.\
\
You should bring the Malledhrim weapons you found back to Dannaswen and explain where you discovered them."}},
[10814]={nameES="Seeking Slats",objectivesES={"Return to Rusgwen","You should bring the cut wood you gathered back to Rusgwen in Calembel.","Rusgwen has asked you to gather cut wood from the tree dotted areas around Calembel.","A maker of barrels in Calembel needs help gathering chopped wood from the surrounding forests.","Seeking Slats"}},
[10815]={nameES="¡Buscando a los Bugans del Tesoro!",objectivesES={"Teodoro Tojo está buscando sus tesoros robados.","Teodoro Tojo, un buscador de tesoros con experiencia, está buscando muchos de los tesoros que le fueron robados en sus numerosas aventuras.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión será eliminada de tu registro cuando finalice el evento asociado.</rgb>","Habla con Teodoro Tojo en Bree, Rivendel o en la Sala Vigesimoprimera","Teodoro Tojo está buscando sus tesoros robados y puede encontrarse en Bree, Rivendel y en la Sala Vigesimoprimera.\
\
Debes hablar con Teodoro Tojo.","Teodoro Tojo, un buscador de tesoros con experiencia, está buscando los muchos tesoros robados a lo largo de sus aventuras.","Completa 'El Bugan del Tesoro'","Teodoro Tojo está buscando sus tesoros robados.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Los Bugans del Tesoro pueden encontrarse en muchas de las Instancias de Escalado.</rgb>"}},
[10816]={nameES="Seeking a Solution",objectivesES={"The earth is disturbed at the foot of the Tree of Tribute, south-west of the Rohirrim scout-camp.\
\
Saeradan told you to follow the clues to the source of the evil in the Gravenwood. You should dig in the disturbed earth.","You have discovered another evil token, but are attacked by a Cuthraul","Seeking a Solution","You should use the pick Saeradan gave you to dig at the disturbed roots of the tree.","Dig in the disturbed earth at the foot of the Tree of Tribute","You discovered that the earth has been disturbed at the roots of the second tree Saeradan sent you to scout.","Defeated Nulchulth"}},
[10817]={nameES="Seeking the Heirs",objectivesES={"These orders detail a plan for the Havens of Belfalas","These torn orders focus on the Anfalas to the west","Search for any further communication between Azruthor and the Scourge","The missive before you contains detailed information about Azruthor's forces in Tarlang's Crown, including a planned assault into the Anfalas to the west. Finally, it concludes with a vague, ominous mention of the Scourge's plans for Gondor.\
\
You decide to continue looking over these notes for much may be learned from them that could aid the people of Gondor.","DNT -- will not be seen","The Heirs of Castamir have a yet unknown plan for Tarlang's Crown, and Harnion seeks to expose it by stealing their orders.","Orders can be found through the main Corsair encampment in Tarlang's Crown.\
\
Harnion has asked you to seek out orders from Azruthor in an effort to learn more of the Heirs' plan in Tarlang's Crown.","These orders seem to focus on the sacking of Blackroot Vale","Seeking the Heirs","A missive to Azruthor can likely be found in the largest tent in the Corsair encampment in Tarlang's Crown.\
\
You have found numerous plans for the Corsairs amidst their camp, and should now search for any missives to Azruthor himself."}},
[10818]={nameES="Buscando a los exploradores",objectivesES={"Has encontrado a los dunlendinos cerca de Nímbarth.\
\
Deberías hablar con su líder, Meriona.","Dos exploradores toman sus armas, pero el tercero niega con la cabeza para detenerlos","Riderch te ha pedido que busques a sus exploradores cerca de Nímbarth.\
\
Nímbarth se encuentra al noreste del campamento de Siempreviva.","Habla con Meriona","Un explorador dunlendino herido se ha separado de su gente.","Encuentra a los dunlendinos cerca de Nímbarth","Buscando a los exploradores"}},
[10819]={nameES="Buscando la fuente",objectivesES={"Vuelve junto a Reynold Potts","Puedes encontrar al profanador Blogmal en las ruinas de la ciudad de Fornost, al este del campamento de los cazatesoros.\
\
Reynold Potts te ha pedido que mates al profanador Blogmal para poner fin a la corrupción de la fauna local.","Reynold Potts está en el campamento de los cazatesoros de Fornost.\
\
Potts estará aliviado de saber que el profanador Blogmal ha encontrado su final a tus manos, acabando con la amenaza de su influencia corruptora.","Buscando la fuente","Derrota al profanador Blogmal","Reynold Potts sospecha que los orcos Blogmal tienen un profanador entre sus filas, envenenando las tierras de su alrededor y causando terribles desfiguraciones en los animales de pasto.","Has derrotado al profanador Blogmal"}},
[10820]={nameES="Sejer-tharâkh: Una historia de madera",objectivesES={"El gran almacén de madera de Sejer-tharâkh alberga una enorme reserva de madera de gran valor que la Guarnición de Hierro desea utilizar en la recuperación de Moria. Además de la madera, Torfi de la Guarnición de Hierro pretende obtener los registros conservados en Sejer-tharâkh para comprender mejor a los artesanos enanos de épocas pasadas.","Lleva los registros de entrega a Torfi","Sejer-tharâkh: Una historia de madera","La entrada a Sejer-tharâkh se encuentra en Mezer-serej.\
\
Torfi te ha pedido que entres en Sejer-tharâkh y busques cualquier libro de registro antiguo que permanezca en el almacén."}},
[10821]={nameES="Sejer-tharâkh: Todo acaba bien",objectivesES={"Habla con Torfi en Mezer-serej","La entrada a Sejer-tharâkh se encuentra en Mezer-serej.\
\
Torfi te ha pedido que derrotes al líder de los intrusos en Sejer-tharâkh.","Sejer-tharâkh: Todo acaba bien","Con una base establecida en la Sala Vigesimoprimera, la Guarnición de Hierro ha comenzado la recuperación de los almacenes, bibliotecas y minas olvidados de Moria. El almacén de madera de Sejer-tharâkh es uno de esos lugares.","Derrota al líder de los intrusos en Sejer-tharâkh","Se te ha acabado el tiempo...","Has derrotado al líder de los intrusos en Sejer-tharâkh","Torfi se encuentra en Mezer-serej.\
\
Tras la derrota de su líder, la moral de los intrusos de Sejer-tharâkh se ha debilitado. Deberías regresar con Torfi y comunicarle tu victoria."}},
[10822]={nameES="Sejer-tharâkh: Golpear y hendir",objectivesES={"Habla con Torfi en Mezer-serej","Sejer-tharâkh: Golpear y hendir","La Guarnición de Hierro se esfuerza por recuperar los olvidados almacenes de Moria. Por orden de sus superiores, Torfi intenta expulsar a los intrusos de Sejer-tharâkh. Como sus intentos anteriores no han tenido éxito, Torfi ha recurrido a otros aventureros de Moria para ayudarle en su tarea.","Torfi se encuentra en Mezer-serej, en las salas orientales de Zelem-melek.\
\
Deberías regresar con Torfi para recibir una recompensa por tus esfuerzos.","La entrada a Sejer-tharâkh se encuentra en Mezer-serej.\
\
Torfi te ha pedido que le ayudes a limpiar Sejer-tharâkh de los intrusos que hay en su interior."}},
[10823]={nameES="Self-sacrifice: Support the Poor",objectivesES={"Tell Gareth Rust of the Mayor's desire to expose him","Gareth Rust and Daley Utteridge are in the workers' area in Winter-home.\
\
You should tell the workers of your success in manipulating the mayor. Things are looking up for the workers of Winter-home!","Gareth Rust is in the workers' area in Winter-home, ever toiling.\
\
You should tell Gareth Rust that the mayor wants you to spy on him so he will lose his job.","Ted Ives is ecstatic about this turn of fate","Jack Judson is ecstatic about this turn of fate","Defend yourself from the banker of Frostbluff","Find out what the mayor wants from you","Tell Jack Judson that he may have his old job back","Your search is over; all evidence of the mayor's corruption is on this receipt","The mayor is in the town of Winter-home, in Frostbluff.\
\
You should return to the mayor with the evidence you collected of his corruption.","Guard Frostway has been driven off... but the door of the fort opens of its own accord","The mayor wants you to betray the workers, but you would never stoop so low!","Tell Barrett Nowell that he may have his old job back","A piece of paper has swirled into your hand as the banker of Frostbluff fled from his post.\
\
You should examine this piece of paper.","Talk to Gareth Rust of all that you have achieved on behalf of the workers","The banker has been driven off... and a curious piece of paper swirls into your hand as he flees","The beggars, now re-hired for the former positions, are around the town.\
\
You should quickly tell the beggars that their period of despair is at an end at last.","The mayor stands in the centre of Winter-home, overseeing the events of the Yule Festival.\
\
You should speak with the mayor and find out what he wants from you, though it sounds like he has a sleazy scheme brewing.","Bring the proof of the mayor's corruption to Mayor Goodnough","Examine the piece of paper dropped by the banker","Barrett Nowell is ecstatic about this turn of fate","Regina Judson is ecstatic about this turn of fate","Use the door to gain access to the store-house","Tell Ted Ives that he may have his old job back","Investigate the fort in Frostbluff where the mayor stores his funds and records","The fort on the frozen lake is east of Winter-home in Frostbluff.\
\
You should go to the fort on the frozen lake and find what evidence you can of the Mayor's corruption, as Gareth Rust is sure the town's money is being put to corrupt use.","Tell Bill Hyde that he may have his old job back","Tell Regina Judson that she may have her old job back","Bill Hyde is ecstatic about this turn of fate","Sometimes you must put others before yourself, especially when those others have great need. Charity is a wonderful thing!\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This quest will be removed from your quest log when the current festival ends.</rgb>","You demand that the mayor sets the wages right for the workers, and gives the beggars back their jobs","Self-sacrifice: Support the Poor"}},
[10824]={nameES="Selling History",objectivesES={"Porókho has told you that there are places in Ilmabiri where relics of ancient Númenor can still be found. He said that if you bring him some, he will give you coin for them.","Selling History","Porókho believes Númenórean relics may be found in the eastern part of Ilmabiri, beneath the Sail-haven of Umbar Baharbêl. You should go there and collect them.","Talk to Porókho","You have collected Númenórean relics found in the sewers. You should bring them to Porókho at Hêbatokh, his camp in Ilmabiri."}},
[10825]={nameES="Sellswords and Turncoats",objectivesES={}},
[10826]={nameES="Envíalos de vuelta a casa",objectivesES={"Habla con Listein en la Puerta de las Nubes","Envíalos de vuelta a casa","Listen está en la Puerta de las Nubes, cerca de la entrada de Zirakzigil.\
\
Deberías llevas las cartas de los enanos de vuelta a Listein.","Las merrevail que rondan los túneles de Khazad-dûm han robado muchas cartas de los enanos que han caído en combate en el Camino de Durin.","Las cartas pueden encontrarse en las merrevail que han saqueado los cuerpos de los enanos caídos en los salones del Camino de Durin.\
\
Listein te ha pedido que reclames las cartas de los enanos antes de que las merrevail se las lleven."}},
[10827]={nameES="Sending a Message",objectivesES={"Eirien is at Mithechad, south-west of Garmadh-maudhûl.\
\
You should return to Eirien and let her know that Ukhurk has been defeated and his standard destroyed.","Ukhurk and his standard can be found in Garmadh-maudhûl to the north-east of Mithechad.\
\
Eirien has asked you to defeat Ukhurk, leader of the Orcs at Garmadh-maudhûl and cast down his standard.","In the deepest reaches of Garmadh-maudhûl, the Orc-leader Ukhurk rallies his troops.","Talk to Eirien at Mithechad","Defeat Ukhurk","Defeated Ukhurk","Destroy Ukhurk's battle-standard","Destroyed Ukhurk's battle-standard","Sending a Message"}},
[10828]={nameES="Desafío del Centinela I",objectivesES={"Narshpug derrotado","Grakâmâb derrotado","Desafío del Centinela I","Rilhathel se encuentra en Caras Galadhon, esperando saber si has completado su desafío con éxito.","Habla con Rilhathel en Caras Galadhon","Rilhathel está decidida a cantar canciones sobre tus esfuerzos en defensa de Lórien y te ha planteado un desafío además de simplemente rechazar a los orcos: derrotar a uno de los dos combatientes de retaguardia que aparecen en el campo de batalla.","Derrota a Narshpug o a Grakâmâb antes de que abandonen el campo y aun así gana la batalla.","Rilhathel te ha pedido no solo ganar la batalla por Lórien, sino también derrotar a Narshpug o a Grakâmâb antes de que abandonen el campo de batalla.","Completa con éxito la Batalla de Lórien"}},
[10829]={nameES="Desafío del Centinela II",objectivesES={"Desafío del Centinela II","Habla con Rilhathel en Caras Galadhon","Rilhathel está decidida a cantar canciones sobre tus esfuerzos en defensa de Lórien y te ha planteado un desafío además de repeler a los orcos: evitar que Belvagor sufra heridas graves.","Rilhathel se encuentra en Caras Galadhon esperando saber si has completado su desafío con éxito.","Completa con éxito la Batalla de Lórien","Evita que Belvagor sufra daños graves y aun así gana la batalla.","Rilhathel te ha pedido no solo ganar la batalla por Lórien, sino también evitar que Belvagor sufra heridas graves."}},
[10830]={nameES="Desafío del Centinela III",objectivesES={"Rilhathel está decidida a cantar canciones sobre tus esfuerzos en defensa de Lórien y te ha planteado un desafío además de repeler a los orcos: ¡ganar la batalla en treinta minutos!","Completa con éxito la Batalla de Lórien en menos de treinta minutos","Gana la Batalla de Lórien en menos de treinta minutos","Gana la batalla en treinta minutos","Habla con Rilhathel en Caras Galadhon","Rilhathel te ha pedido no solo ganar la batalla por Lórien, sino hacerlo rápidamente: ¡en treinta minutos!","Rilhathel se encuentra en Caras Galadhon esperando saber si has completado su desafío con éxito.","Desafío del Centinela III"}},
[10831]={nameES="Sentries Outside of Madh-fushaum",objectivesES={}},
[10832]={nameES="Sentries in the Shadows",objectivesES={}},
[10833]={nameES="Sentries of Dol Guldur",objectivesES={"Talk to Handelen at Thangúlhad","Search Cargûl sentries for clues","Agorin is at Ost Galadh in Emyn Lûm, west of Thangúlhad.\
\
Handelen instructed you to bring the engraved dagger you found to Agorin, the Malledhrim Lore-master in Emyn Lûm.","There are many watching stones placed in and around Dol Guldur, guarded by Cargûl sentries. Anyone who foolishly approaches too close to one of these stones is struck with a black curse that sunders the will.","Handelen is at Thangúlhad in Gathbúrz.\
\
You should bring the engraved dagger you found to Handelen.","Watching stones and their Cargûl sentries can be found throughout Gathbúrz.\
\
Handelen has asked you to defeat a number of the Cargûl sentries found near the watching stones in Gathbúrz to learn if a way might be found to protect the Malledhrim from the effects of the stones.","YOU SHOULD NOT SEE THIS","Found an engraved dagger","Sentries of Dol Guldur","Bring the engraved dagger to Agorin","Handelen is at Thangúlhad in Gathbúrz.\
\
You should return to Handelen and tell him what you have learned from Agorin about the Watchers of Dol Guldur.","Talk to Handelen in Thangúlhad"}},
[10834]={nameES="Sentries of the White Hand",objectivesES={"White Hand sentries can be found near the Pillar of the Hand, not far from Dagoras' camp.\
\
Dagoras has asked you to defeat several of the sentries guarding the southern end of Nan Curunír.","Talk to Dagoras at his camp in Nan Curunír","Dagoras is at his camp in Nan Curunír.\
\
You should tell Dagoras that many of the White Hand sentries have been driven off.","Unusual half-orcs wearing the mark of the White Hand are guarding the southern end of the Vale of Nan Curunír.","Sentries of the White Hand"}},
[10835]={nameES="Sergeant-at-Arms' Patches",objectivesES={}},
[10836]={nameES="Serpents at Minlos",objectivesES={"<rgb=#FF0000>Othor must not be defeated</rgb>","Serpents at Minlos","You have defended the bridge into Arnach!","Talk to Othor","Talk to Lady Terenis","Othor can be found at Minlos in eastern Upper Lebennin.\
\
You have successfully defended Arnach from attack and should now speak to Othor.","Othor can be found at Minlos in eastern Upper Lebennin.\
\
Othor has asked for your aid in defending Arnach from the Haradrim. You should speak to him when you are ready.","Lady Terenis can be found in her hall in Tumladen.\
\
Othor has asked you to return to Lady Terenis and warn her of the Haradrim forces readying to cross into Lossarnach.","In spite of their dwindling numbers, the Haradrim forces in Upper Lebennin are poised to spill forth into Lossarnach through the settlement of Arnach."}},
[10837]={nameES="Siervo de la Mano Blanca",objectivesES={"El teniente de la Mano Blanca se encuentra en Gazatmur, al noreste del Mirador de la Gran Excavación.\
\
Debes derrotar al teniente de la Mano Blanca.","Informa a Wigfast de la presencia de la Mano Blanca","Derrota al teniente de la Mano Blanca","Este escudo de trasgo lleva la marca de la Mano Blanca, algo extraño de encontrar en Moria... o quizás no tan extraño. Seguramente un sirviente de la Mano Blanca está cerca, responsable de agitar el mal en Gazatmur. Si ese sirviente es eliminado, quizás la presencia de los trasgos se disipe en la Gran Excavación.","Wigfast está en su escondite cerca de la entrada de Gazatmur.\
\
Debes buscar a Wigfast e informarle sobre la corrupción de la Mano Blanca que descubriste y eliminaste de un solo golpe.","Siervo de la Mano Blanca","Un Uruk al servicio de la Mano Blanca ha aparecido en el campamento de trasgos de Gazatmur. Claramente, planea someter a los trasgos a su voluntad y conducirlos contra los enanos del Mirador de la Gran Excavación en gran número.","Derrotado el teniente de la Mano Blanca"}},
[10838]={nameES="Servants of Saruman",objectivesES={"Isengard is littered with strange devices which have some role in Saruman's preparations for war. These machines are frequently maintained by goblins or by human apprentices who have been trained in their operation by Saruman.","Dagoras is within the Ring of Isengard.\
\
You should return to Dagoras with news of your success.","Servants of Saruman","Talk to Dagoras within the Ring of Isengard","Saruman's apprentices can be found in Isengard.\
\
Dagoras has asked to you to hunt down any of Saruman's apprentices that you come across in Isengard."}},
[10839]={nameES="Servants of Saruman",objectivesES={}},
[10840]={nameES="Servants of Urudanî",objectivesES={}},
[10841]={nameES="Servants of War",objectivesES={"Talk to Múta","Captured Longbeards can be found in Tûr Ágal, the tower in the centre of Caivád Sâr.\
\
Múta has discovered several Longbeards held captive in Tûr Ágal. You should free them.","Servants of War","Although they seem curiously uninterested in the Stout-axes and Zhélruka, the Dourhands have captured several Longbeards and taken them as prisoners and servants at Caivád Sâr.","Múta can be found in Tûr Ágal, the tower in the centre of Caivád Sâr.\
\
You have freed all of the captured Longbeards that you could find. You should return to Múta."}},
[10842]={nameES="Siervos de la Corona de Hierro",objectivesES={"While scouting Elderslade, you have discovered a settlement of Angmarim still loyal to the Iron Crown.\
\
Although the Witch-king of Angmar has been defeated, these remnants of Angmar continue to spread their wickedness through Middle-earth.\
\
You should defeat the Angmarim of the Iron Crown who dwell in Caivád Sâr, and its tower, Tûr Ágal.","You have defeated many of the wicked Angmarim of the Iron Crown dwelling in Caivád Sâr, and its tower, Tûr Ágal.\
\
The Iron Crown remains the last vestige of Angmar's resurgence, but it, too, shall meet its end in time.","Siervos de la Corona de Hierro","You have defeated many of the wicked servants of the Iron Crown dwelling in Caivád Sâr, and its tower, Tûr Ágal.","Servants of the Iron Crown can be found in Caivád Sâr and Tûr Ágal.\
\
You have discovered a settlement of wicked Angmarim still loyal to the Iron Crown at Caivád Sâr. You should defeat the Angmarim of the Iron Crown dwelling in Caivád Sâr, and its tower, Tûr Ágal.","Although the Witch-king of Angmar has been defeated, servants of the Iron Crown dwelling in Elderslade continue to spread their wickedness through Middle-earth.","Completado"}},
[10843]={nameES="Servants of the Master",objectivesES={"A large pack of Cun Annun haunt the barrows of the Lich Bluffs, presenting a danger to those that would call Enedwaith home.","Talk to Mincham in the Lich Bluffs","Servants of the Master","Mincham's camp is south and slightly east of the large Gondorian ruins in the Lich Bluffs.\
\
You should return to Mincham and let him know that you have located and dispatched a pack of Cun Annun.","Cun Annun can be found in the southern reaches of the Lichbluffs. \
\
Mincham has asked you to find and defeat as many Cun Annun as you are able."}},
[10844]={nameES="Servants of the White Hand",objectivesES={}},
[10845]={nameES="Serving the Summons, Part I",objectivesES={"Grimmar is in the Mead Hall of Stoke.\
\
Fríthild told you to speak with Grimmar and obtain the signets with which to summon the Thanes of the Broadacres.","Talk to Grimmar in the Mead Hall of Stoke","Gained entrance to the Mead Hall of Oserley","Serving the Summons, Part I","Bring the signet of Oserley to Ordlac","Gain entrance to the Mead Hall of Oserley","Oserley lies along the road north-east from Stoke.\
\
Fríthild has asked you to deliver a signet to Ordlac of Oserley, summoning him to her aid.","Stoke is crowded with refugees from outlying farms and even bordering parts of Kingstead and the Stonedeans. Livestock and horses join the press. All the while, Reeve Fríthild struggles to secure her town against the White Hand's siege.","Thane Ordlac is within the Mead Hall of Oserley.\
\
Éoric afforded you access to the Mead Hall of Oserley to speak with Thane Ordlac."}},
[10846]={nameES="Serving the Summons, Part II",objectivesES={"Apparently, Tordag was forced to retreat from Torsbury, for this is his encampment","Tordag is at his encampment just north of the road between Torsbury and Stoke.\
\
Fríthild sent you to bring the signet of Torsbury to Tordag, summoning him to Stoke's aid.","Serving the Summons, Part II","Your duties done at Oserley, it is time to continue your mission for Reeve Fríthild.","Torsbury lies to the west of Oserley, near the border of the Stonedeans.\
\
Ordlac bade you hurry by the straightest route to Torsbury to aid Tordag and bring him Fríthild's summons.","Torsbury has been overrun. There are signs that Tordag retreated south and east","Bring the signet of Torsbury to Thane Tordag"}},
[10847]={nameES="Sesión - Rivendel",objectivesES={"Viaja al Bosque de los Trolls y encuentra un caballo en Thorenhad.","Habla con Roheryn en los establos de Rivendel","Roheryn se encuentra en los establos de Rivendel.","Un caballo en Ost Guruth desea tener una audiencia contigo.","Encuentra el caballo en Ost Guruth","Sesión - Rivendel"}},
[10848]={nameES="Sesión — Esteldín",objectivesES={"Encuentra un caballo de los Montaraces en Esteldín","Sesión — Esteldín","Habla con la montura del Montaraz en Esteldín","Trampa para caballos destruida","El enemigo está usando terribles trampas para caballos, y pueden encontrarse en los pasos hacia Dol Dínen.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Si te derrotan o se acaba el tiempo, regresarás a la Granja Hengstacer.</rgb>","Sientes que un conflicto en Esteldín te atrae de alguna manera, como si tu propósito estuviera ligado a él. Buscas un caballo que pueda instruirte sobre tácticas y estrategias de guerra desde la perspectiva de una montura.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Si eres #-1:{derrotado[m]|derrotada[f]} o se acaba el tiempo, regresarás a la Granja Hengstacer.</rgb>","Los sonidos y olores de la guerra ahuyentarían a la mayoría de los caballos, pero a ti te atraen como una polilla a la lumbre. Buscas encontrarte con un caballo acostumbrado al conflicto, con la esperanza de que pueda darte alguna pista sobre tu propósito...","La montura del Montaraz se encuentra en Esteldín.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Si eres #-1:{derrotado[m]|derrotado[f]} o se acaba el tiempo, regresarás a la Granja Hengstacer.</rgb>","Destruye las trampas para caballos"}},
[10849]={nameES="Sesión — Bosque de los Trolls",objectivesES={"Destruir los trofeos que dejó el enemigo ha apaciguado tu furia, por ahora. Una fuerza poderosa intervino para ahuyentar a esta criatura, y quedó gravemente herida hasta morir aquí.\
\
Antes no podías percibirlo porque el hedor del mal llenaba tus fosas nasales. Al regresar al cadáver, sientes la otra energía, distinta de algún modo.\
\
Permanece aquí como una ola en retirada que deja pequeños charcos sobre la arena. ¿Qué pudo haber hecho esto a una criatura tan poderosa? Debes encontrar la fuente de esta energía.","Examina una vez más la montura negra caída","Un olor maligno te atrae hacia lo profundo del Bosque de los Trolls","Una poderosa fuerza dejó una energía misteriosa alrededor del cadáver de la montura negra, como una ola en retirada que deja pequeños charcos en la arena.\
\
La montura negra no pudo haber llegado muy lejos tras sufrir una herida tan grande. La fuente de un poder así debe encontrarse en algún lugar del Bosque de los Trolls.","Los trofeos dejados por la montura negra caída y su jinete han sido destruidos.\
\
Con tu furia apaciguada, la curiosidad te invade. ¿Qué pudo matar a esta montura, y hacia dónde se dirigía su jinete?","Has destruido una parte de armadura negra","Trophies of the evil steed can be found in the area where it met its death.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>If defeated or time expires, you will return to the horsefields.</rgb>","Has destruido un trozo de tela negra","Sesión — Bosque de los Trolls","Destruye un fragmento de armadura negra","Encuentra la fuente de aquello que ahuyentó a la montura negra","Tus sentidos agudos te atraen hacia una fuente de mal detectada en el Bosque de los Trolls.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Si eres #-1:{derrotado[m]|derrotado[f]} o se acaba el tiempo, regresarás a los Campos de Caballos.</rgb>","Has encontrado la fuente del mal que te atrajo hasta aquí. Este fue una vez un caballo criado para servir a las fuerzas de Sauron. Existen muchos caballos al servicio del Enemigo, pero esta criatura era la montura de un Nazgûl, uno de los Nueve.\
\
El hedor del mal aquí aviva un fuego que nunca antes habías sentido, y sabes que este caballo era un archienemigo. Su muerte es agridulce; habrías preferido enfrentarte tú mismo con él.\
\
El enemigo dejó fragmentos de armadura y tiras de capa. Destruir estos trofeos del mal saciará tu ira ante la existencia de semejante criatura. Busca por la zona y destruye los trofeos de este enemigo caído.","Has encontrado el Vado del Bruinen, la misma fuente del poder que envió a los caballos de los Nueve a su perdición","Destruye un trozo de tela negra"}},
[10850]={nameES="Sesión — Cima de los Vientos",objectivesES={"Los corceles de los Campos de Caballos mencionaron a un misterioso caballo acompañado de un mago con especial afinidad por los animales, ambos residentes en las Tierras Solitarias.","Encuentra hierbas en la cima de la Cima de los Vientos","La hierba rara que busca el caballo de Radagast solo crece en lugares de gran altitud. El único sitio lo bastante alto en millas alrededor de Ost Guruth es la cima de la Cima de los Vientos.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Si eres #-1:{derrotado[m]|derrotada[f]} o se acaba el tiempo, regresarás a los Campos de Caballos.</rgb>","Has encontrado hierbas.","Lleva las hierbas de vuelta al caballo de Radagast","El caballo de Radagast se encuentra en Ost Guruth.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Si eres #-1:{derrotado[m]|derrotada[f]} o se acaba el tiempo, regresarás a los Campos de Caballos.</rgb>","Dirígete a Ost Guruth y encuentra allí un caballo","Sesión — Cima de los Vientos","Hay un caballo en Ost Guruth que sientes la necesidad de buscar.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Si eres #-1:{derrotado[m]|derrotada[f]} o se acaba el tiempo, regresarás a los Campos de Caballos.</rgb>"}},
[10851]={nameES="Session: Life on the Other Side",objectivesES={"You are experiencing Kotráka Saiya's story from her point of view.\
\
You should use your Diplomatic Words to convince Góramul Sai to leave.","Check on your daughters","My daughters should be in bed at this hour, but I noticed that my youngest, Khêjiba, was missing. I asked my eldest, Lokóya, if she knew where she was.\
\
'She said she was bored and went to explore. I tried to stop her, but she ran off before I could block the door. I think she went to the garden. Sorry, mother. Please don't be too angry with her.'","You are experiencing Kotráka Saiya's story from her point of view.\
\
You should find Otibúk in the southern bed-chamber.","Listen to the conversation","Talk to Lokóya","Use your Diplomatic Words to convince your husband","Session: Life on the Other Side","You are experiencing Kotráka Saiya's story from her point of view.\
\
You should use Icy Glare on Ratúlko the Bloody to let him know how you feel.","I asked Khêjiba who she was speaking to, growing increasingly concerned.\
\
'I don't really know. We call her the Pale Lady. She talks to me sometimes.'\
\
I was alarmed, and asked if my other daughters knew about her.\
\
'Yes. She talks to all three of us. I've seen her staring at Otibúk before, too. Do you think she can help him?'","My husband's lapdog does not deserve my attention","Otibúk's condition is much the same. His whole body glistens with sweat, fighting both his wounds and an ever-returning fever. He occasionally thrashes in the bed, softly moaning. Is he having nightmares of the battle? I could not know, and was being consumed by my helplessness. How can a mother watch her son suffer so?","Find your husband","Talk to your sister","Find Khêjiba in the central garden","You are experiencing Kotráka Saiya's story from her point of view.\
\
You should hear Góramul Sai's response.","Eavesdrop on your husband's conversation","You are experiencing Kotráka Saiya's story from her point of view.\
\
You should return Khêjiba to the northern bed-chamber.","You are experiencing Kotráka Saiya's story from her point of view.\
\
You should approach Góramul Sai and listen to the conversation.","You are experiencing Kotráka Saiya's story from her point of view.\
\
You should hear what Dark Priestess Barkhuráni has to say to Góramul Sai.","You are experiencing Kotráka Saiya's story from her point of view.\
\
You should talk to Dark Priestess Barkhuráni in the banquet hall.","I inquired as to just who this dark ally is, and why I was not made aware of an important guest in the palace before this.\
\
'My apologies, sister! I would have thought your husband would have informed you. If he has not explained, he must not want to trouble you with it, and I would not want to displease the Sai.\
\
'All you need to know is we have a powerful ally on our side, who will ensure a prosperous future for us and the empire.'\
\
She flashes an innocent smile, but does not elaborate any further.","My family and I only recently arrived in Emax Dûl. Life was not so different at first, trading one palace for another, but recently something has changed. Of late I felt a growing unease, as if something was hidden from me. Two days ago, I decided it would be necessary to act, to save the lives of my children.","Góramulâ's eyes welled with tears. Somewhere inside, he knew he was losing the fight, both for Mûr Ghala and for his own mind.\
\
'Kotráka... I am sorry.'","Use your Icy Glare on Ratúlko","You are experiencing Kotráka Saiya's story from her point of view.\
\
You should talk to Góramul Sai in the banquet hall.","Listen to your husband's words","I demanded answers. Yes, my husband is the crown prince, but something was deeply wrong, and I would not allow it to threaten my children.\
\
'You forget yourself, Kotráka. I have everything under control.'","I asked Lokóya if she knew about the Pale Lady. She turned white as a sheet at the mention of the name.\
\
'I... Yes. I don't know what she is or what she wants. She has appeared to all of us. Aunt Barkhuráni warned us not to mention her to anyone, so I haven't....'\
\
She starts to cry.\
\
'Mother, I'm afraid to leave our bedroom! Can we please go back to Ordâkh?'","Check on your son","You are experiencing Kotráka Saiya's story from her point of view.\
\
You should find your daughters in the northern bed-chamber.","You are experiencing Kotráka Saiya's story from her point of view.\
\
You should find Khêjiba. She is hiding somewhere in the royal living quarters.","Talk to your husband","You are experiencing Kotráka Saiya's story from her point of view.\
\
You should find Góramul Sai in your shared bed-chamber, to the rear of the living quarters."}},
[10852]={nameES="Set in Stone",objectivesES={}},
[10853]={nameES="Coloca la trampa (Opcional)",objectivesES={"Coloca la trampa (Opcional)","Drâgh se encuentra en la Gran Escalera, al este de las Vetas del Cuerno Rojo y al noroeste del Refugio Sombrío, en las Fundaciones de Piedra.\
\
Derrota a Drâgh en la Gran Escalera para evitar que siga interfiriendo en la expedición de los enanos en Moria.","Derrota a Drâgh","Regresa con Armbeald en las Vetas del Cuerno Rojo","Drâgh ha sido derrotado","Armbeald se encuentra en la Guardia Orca, al noroeste de las Vetas del Cuerno Rojo.\
\
Regresa con Armbeald y cuéntale que Drâgh ha sido derrotado gracias a tus esfuerzos y a los de tus amigos.","El líder de los orcos de la Mano Blanca, Drâgh, se encuentra en la Gran Escalera de Moria, sembrando el terror por donde pasa. Uno de los enanos de la expedición ha sido asesinado, y Armbeald te ha pedido que vengues al inocente acabando con ese malvado enemigo."}},
[10854]={nameES="Set to Task",objectivesES={"Set to Task","Speak with Akúlhun at Gramsfoot","Speak with War-tyrant Akúlhun about available tasks.","The War-tyrant has a set of tasks for you and offers rewards if you can complete them."}},
[10855]={nameES="Setting Back the Smugglers",objectivesES={}},
[10856]={nameES="Setting Traps",objectivesES={"Wynfor has fashioned three traps from the avanc-jaws that you brought him and wants you to set them out for the mysterious intruder.","You have used up all the traps and should return to Wynfor","You found footprints on the far shore of the lake, north-west of the eyot and beneath the cliffs west of the shore, and now Wynfor wants you to set three traps he made at those locations.\
\
Wynfor has given you three traps he has made, and he wants you to set them in the vicinity of the footprints you found earlier.","Wynfor is in Tûr Morva.\
\
You have set the traps for Wynfor and should now return to him.","Find a suitable place to set the traps near the footprints","Talk to Wynfor at Tûr Morva","This would be a suitable place to set the traps.","Setting Traps","You have placed the snap-jaw traps in Tâl Methedras, as Wynfor wanted."}},
[10857]={nameES="Poniendo en marcha el taller",objectivesES={"Las hojas desafiladas se encuentran en los armeros en el Ala Norte del Umbral de Durin.\
\
Debes recoger varias hojas desafiladas para restaurarlas en la forja recién encendida.","Poniendo en marcha el taller","Athils busca ayuda para poner en funcionamiento una vieja forja en el Ala Norte.","Athils se encuentra en el Ala Norte del Umbral de Durin, supervisando el trabajo que se realiza allí.\
\
Debes llevar las hojas recién restauradas a Athils.","Lleva las hojas recién restauradas a Athils","La forja del Ala Norte se encuentra cerca de Athils.\
\
Debes usar la forja para restaurar las hojas que has recogido."}},
[10858]={nameES="Setting the Stage",objectivesES={"Habla con Robbo Moliespalda","The Hall of Air can be found in the northern section of the Fifth Circle of Minas Tirith.\
\
Polla is displeased, but willing to try a different theatre at Gord's request. You should meet the Cloudyheads at the Hall of Air.","The sound of Hollur's drumming is a bit muffled, but still acceptable...","Hollur's drums are nearly muted by the wind coursing along the theatre's edge!","Hollur's drumming can be heard clearly","Polla Stoutley can be found just outside the Stone Theatre in Minas Tirith.\
\
Gord Dunley has requested that the band perform in another space as he feels his voice is lacking in the Stone Theatre.","You have found a fancy theorbo with fine strings and intricate detailing","Talk to Polla Stoutley","Talk to Hollur","Displeased with the theatre in the First Circle, the Cloudyheads have chosen to explore another before putting on their show.","You have found a lute with a detailed grille and beautiful maple shell","Gord Dunley can be found just outside the Stone Theatre in Minas Tirith.\
\
Gord Dunley has voiced concerns about performing in the Stone Theatre and Polla has asked you to investigate.","Robbo Gristback is in the Hall of Air in Minas Tirith.\
\
Hollur has asked you to speak to Robbo about an idea he had on the way to the Hall of Air.","You have found a fine horn crafted of steel and plated with gold","Polla Stoutley can be found in Hall of Air.\
\
You have delivered the instruments to Robbo in the Hall of Air. Robbo has informed you that Polla would like to talk to you.","Ornate instruments can be found at various markets in Minas Tirith.\
\
Robbo Gristback hopes to purchase instruments of finer make to help his band put on a better show in Minas Tirith. He has provided the gold and has asked you to peruse the markets of the City.","The Hall of Air can be found in the Fifth Circle.\
\
Polla Stoutley has asked you to sit in various seats in the Hall of Air to help Hollur ensure that the sound is even throughout the theatre.","Robbo Gristback can be found in the Hall of Air in the Fifth Circle of Minas Tirith.\
\
You have acquired several new instruments for the Cloudyheads and should now deliver them to Robbo.","Hollur can be found in the Hall of Air.\
\
You have tested various seats in the theatre and much to your dismay, it seems there is a wide range of quality in the available seating.","Setting the Stage","Talk to Gord Dunley","You have found an ornate drum depicting the Tree of Gondor on its head","Meet the Cloudyheads at the Hall of Air","You have found the band busily exploring the theatre...","Deliver the instruments to Robbo Gristback","Polla Stoutley can be found in the Hall of Air in the Fifth Circle of Minas Tirith.\
\
You have arrived at the Hall of Air and should now talk to Polla.","Hollur can be found in the Hall of Air.\
\
Polla has asked you to speak to Hollur about testing the theatre's acoustics.","Talk to Polla Stoutley in the Hall of Air"}},
[10859]={nameES="Setting the Table",objectivesES={}},
[10860]={nameES="Tendiendo la trampa",objectivesES={"Habla con Hal Gamyi","Has conseguido el cebo que Hal Gamyi te sugirió que usaras para atraer al líder de los lobos.","Colmihueso derrotado","Hal Gamyi está en el centro de Avenal.\
\
Debes volver con Hal Gamyi con las noticias de tu victoria.","Mata a Colmihueso","Tendiendo la trampa","El campamento de los lobos se encuentra al noreste de Avenal.\
\
Ahora que has traido la carne de alce, Hal Gamyi sugiere que es hora de tener la trampa para el gran lobo colocando la carne fuera de su cueva."}},
[10861]={nameES="Corta la Mano Blanca",objectivesES={"Corta la Mano Blanca","Naerost se encuentra justo al este de la Cima de los Vientos, al norte de Hunulf Mascador.\
\
Hunulf Mascador teme que los semiorcos sirvan a un poder mayor, quizá incluso a Mordor. Te ha pedido que entres en Naerost y derrotes a su líder y a sus guardias con la esperanza de que los demás huyan.","Derrota a Hontimûrz","A la sombra de Amon Sûl, en el borde de Nain Enidh, yacían unas ruinas arnorianas. Esas ruinas ofrecían a los Eglain de Ost Guruth abundante material para comerciar con coleccionistas de las Tierras de Bree... hasta la llegada de semiorcos procedentes del sur.","Hunulf Mascador espera tu regreso en su campamento al este de Minas Eriol, al sur de Naerost.\
\
Aunque los semiorcos no huyeron, su líder y sus guardias han sido derrotados. Debes volver a informar a Hunulf Mascador.","Habla con Hunulf Mascador","Hontimûrz ha sido derrotado"}},
[10862]={nameES="Several Mendings",objectivesES={"Lady Raenemel is at her house in the Fourth Circle, near the Finding Place.\
\
You have found Lady's Raenemel's house and she is outside. Now you should talk to her.","Return to Lady Raenemel's house","Stroll to the garden near Lady Raenemel's home in the northern half of the Fourth Circle.\
\
Lady Raenemel will stroll with you around her neighbourhood. Use the small whistle to call her, if you get separated.","Stroll up onto the wall near Lady Raenemel's home in the northern half of the Fourth Circle.\
\
Lady Raenemel will stroll with you around her neighbourhood. Use the small whistle to call her, if you get separated.","The Old Guest-house lies in the First Circle, just south of the City Gates.\
\
The mysterious woman stands before the Old Guest-house, talking to Bergil.","Lady Raenemel's house is in the Fourth Circle, near the Finding Place.\
\
Bergil wants to take you to Lady Raenemel's house.","Here is the spot where the goblins broke into the cisterns","Talk to Bergil","Learn more about what happened in the Cisterns and the mysterious woman you found there.","You can enter the cisterns at the southern end of the First Circle.\
\
The mysterious woman has bade you repair the breach where the goblins entered the cisterns before you speak further. Use the stones you've gathered to block up the hole.","Walk to the fountain by the Baths near Lady Raenemel's home in the northern half of the Fourth Circle.\
\
Lady Raenemel will stroll with you around her neighbourhood. Use the small whistle to call her, if you get separated.","Talk to Lady Raenemel","Lady Raenemel dashes ahead and begins to speak with Bergil in hushed tones","Return to Raenemel's home","You can enter the cisterns at the southern end of the First Circle.\
\
The mysterious woman has bade you repair the breach where the goblins entered the cisterns before you speak further.","Lady Raenemel's house is in the Fourth Circle, near the Finding Place.\
\
Lady Raenemel wishes to speak with you alone.","Stroll with Lady Raenemel","Lady Raenemel's house is in the Fourth Circle, near the Finding Place.\
\
Lady Raenemel wishes to speak with you alone... outside her home.","Lady Raenemel will accompany you within the Fourth Circle of the City. Use the small whistle to call her, if you get separated.\
\
Talk to Lady Raenemel and see what she has to say next.","Several Mendings","You have arrived at Lady Raenemel's house","Lady Raenemel's house is in the Fourth Circle, near the Finding Place.\
\
You should follow Lady Raenemel back to her house.","Block up the breach","Return with Lady Raenemel to her home in the northern half of the Fourth Circle.\
\
Lady Raenemel will stroll with you around her neighbourhood. Use the small whistle to call her, if you get separated.","Continue to stroll up on the wall near Lady Raenemel's home in the northern half of the Fourth Circle.\
\
Lady Raenemel will stroll with you around her neighbourhood. Use the small whistle to call her, if you get separated.","Lady Raenemel and Bergil are speaking intently in hushed tones","Talk to the mysterious woman","You can enter the cisterns at the southern end of the First Circle.\
\
The mysterious woman has bade you repair the breach where the goblins entered the cisterns before you speak further. You should gather nearby stones for the task.","Bergil stands outside Lady Raenemel's house in the Fourth Circle.\
\
Lady Raenemel and Bergil were speaking as you approached. Now Bergil seems to have something to say to you.","The breach is within the cisterns, which can be entered at the southern end of the First Circle.\
\
Bergil has come up just as you finished blocking up the breach.","Go to Lady Raenemel's house","Bergil comes up just as you finish your work","Return to the breach in the cisterns","Step away from Lady Raenemel's House"}},
[10863]={nameES="Cortando el brazo armado",objectivesES={"Habla con Glamodúd en Echad Glamodúd","Has debilitado a los orcos de Ashúrz Maufulug desarmando sus trampas, dejándoles vulnerables ante un ataque.","Cortando el brazo armado","Has derrotado a Morsharpat en Ashúrz Maufulug","Derrota a Morsharpat en Ashúrz Maufulug","Morsharpat está en Ashúrz Maufulug, al sur y poco al oeste de Echad Glamodúd.\
\
Glamodúd te ha pedido que derrotes a Morsharpat, el capitán de los orcos en Ashúrz Maufulug.","Glamodúd está en Echad Glamodúd, al norte y un poco al este de Ashúrz Maufulug.\
\
Deberías volver a ver a Glamodúd con la noticia de tu victoria contra Morsharpat."}},
[10864]={nameES="Shade Over Kidzul-kâlah",objectivesES={"Defeated many foes at Kidzul-kâlah.","Shade Over Kidzul-kâlah","Explore Kidzul-kâlah","An unpleasant darkness has settled upon the Vales of Anduin. Spirits drift upon the Gladdenmere and through the old dwarf ruins of Kidzul-kâlah. These fell beings should be defeated if the Vales are to remain safe.","Kidzul-kâlah can be found alongside the Gladdenmere.\
\
You should destroy shadow sources and defeat any foes you find at Kidzul-kâlah.","You have defeated many foes at Kidzul-kâlah, making the Vales of Anduin safer.","Completado","Lost spirits move throughout the old dwarf ruins of Kidzul-kâlah."}},
[10865]={nameES="Shades in the Swamp: Ghostly Figures",objectivesES={"Badwila disappeared somewhere in the north-western reaches of the Gladden Fields.","An injured hunter lies among the remains of a dozen Orcs","One of the hunters from the village of Hultvís may know what has disturbed the shades in the Gladden Fields.","Talk to one of the hunters in Hultvís","Shades in the Swamp: Ghostly Figures","Eurik asked you to defeat the Orcs he encountered at Avabárg while you search for his son.","You hear a faint voice calling from the north-western reaches of the Gladden Fields!","Eurik believed that you might find his son among the shades of the Gladden Fields if you did not find him with the Orcs of Avabárg.","Talk to Badwila among the Orc corpses","Look for Badwila in the north-west of the Gladden Fields","Grimbeorn has tasked you with investigating the increased presence of ghostly figures within the Gladden Fields, for his neighbours among the Woodmen may be threatened by these apparitions.","You have found Eurik's son Badwila. He has been injured, but he is surrounded by the corpses of Orcs much less fortunate than he."}},
[10866]={nameES="Shades in the Swamp: Only Half-Remembered",objectivesES={"Shades in the Swamp: Only Half-Remembered","You have done as the Maiden of the Gladden asked. Will she now help you uncover the cause of the darkness that has settled upon the Gladden Fields?","The Maiden of the Gladden waits for you by the flooded dwarf-hold of Kidzul-kâlah.","Talk to Gultháva and follow her into the flooded dwarf-hold of Kidzul-kâlah"}},
[10867]={nameES="Shades in the Swamp: The Maiden of Gladden",objectivesES={"Shades in the Swamp: The Maiden of Gladden","The Maiden motions at the encircling hills with one slender arm.\
\
'Many are they who seek to harm my friend. Long have I kept him safe, granting him the peaceful slumber he needs. How am I to know you wish him well?'\
\
The Maiden falls silent, but her words hang in the air like ripples on the surface of a pond. Then she crouches and picks up a handful of soil, letting the dirt fall back to the ground between delicate fingers.\
\
'So many of my friends have gone away. Merillif and Braiglad, Silloth and Lenhwest... they planted flowers among the vales, and now their flowers are troubled by the encroaching darkness. Sprinkle this pure soil upon their flowers, in memory of my lost friends, and I will know you can be trusted.'\
\
As the Maiden gazes off to the north, beyond the still waters, images rise unbidden in your mind's eye. You see flowers growing among the camps of your foes in the Vales of Anduin, and hastily mark them on your map.","The Maiden's former distrust is gone. Now she gazes at you with fondness, and her smile sparkles like sunshine on the water.\
\
'I delight to know you have honoured my friends, though they went away so long ago. The passions of Lenhwest could not be quenched, and were not; she was the first to leave, and I missed her most of all. Merillif had a beauty all her own, and as she walked among her gardens there were none who did not love her. Silloth's laughter echoed in the dell, leaping from hearer to hearer, arousing happiness in each one. Wild Braiglad was the last to leave; she drew pleasure from even the most untamed of regions, and delighted in ferocity.\
\
'You have the trust of Gultháva. Perhaps you can help my friend.'","Sprinkle soil of purity on Silloth's flower","The Maiden of the Gladden stares at you with enigmatic eyes.","Sprinkle soil of purity on Braiglad's flower","Talk to Gultháva, the Maiden of the Gladden","The Maiden of the Gladden has reappeared further along the western path through Gladdenmere.","Catch up to the Maiden of the Gladden further to the west along the path through Gladdenmere","Pick up the soil of purity","The flower shines with renewed vigour","Return to Gultháva near the flooded dwarf-hold of Kidzul-kâlah","The Maiden stares at you with enigmatic eyes","The Maiden of the Gladden waits for you by the flooded dwarf-hold of Kidzul-kâlah.","The Maiden of the Gladden stares at you cryptically.","The Maiden of the Gladden asked you to pick up the soil of purity and sprinkle it on flowers planted by her friends throughout the Vales of Anduin.","Once more she disappears, and reappears further to the west","The Maiden regards you with distrust.\
\
'Few only come this way,' she says, and her voice puts you in mind of a sighing breeze among the reeds. 'My friend is not to be disturbed. Go, and let him remain at peace.'","The Maiden stares at you cryptically","The Maiden of the Gladden has reappeared further to the west along the path that runs through Gladdenmere.","Catch up to the Maiden of the Gladden further to the west in Gladdenmere","The Maiden's eyes are deep, still wells. She regards you silently, and disappears.","Sprinkle soil of purity on Merillif's flower","You found the Maiden of the Gladden, a figure out of Woodmen legend, and followed her into the flooded wilderness. Does she have something to do with the darkness that has settled upon the Gladden Fields?","The soil feels fertile and rich between your fingers","The flower sparkles with renewed vitality","The flower shimmers with renewed health","Sprinkle soil of purity on Lenhwest's flower","The Maiden waits for you to pick up the fertile soil","The Maiden of the Gladden asked you to find the flowers planted by her long-lost friends throughout the Vales of the Anduin and sprinkle the soil of purity on them. You have marked the locations she gave to you on your map:\
\
Merillif's Flower grows within the camp of Lúlstrok.\
Braiglad's Flower grows behind a house in Waldfast.\
Silloth's Flower grows on the sloping path that climbs up through Brafulug.\
Lenhwest's Flower grows in the camp outside the cave of Fil Sulmog.","The flower glimmers with renewed energy"}},
[10868]={nameES="Shades in the Swamp: The Wanderer Sought",objectivesES={"Search Sharkey's Slough for Vagári the Wanderer","Talk to Gultháva, the Maiden of the Gladden","The Island of the Flowers is quiet and still","You feel a watchful presence from the western side of the Gladden Fields","Gandalf believes that the reappearance of Vagári the Wanderer may be related in some way to the darkness that has fallen on the Gladden Fields, and he has sent you to find the mysterious shade.","There is no sign of Vagári among the Orcs","Shades in the Swamp: The Wanderer Sought","The Maiden of the Gladden stands by the rocky path in Gladdenmere, watching you carefully.","You feel a watchful presence to the west","Search atop the cliff path to the north-west for the new presence","There is no sign of Vagári among the half-orcs","Search Tûn Melen for Vagári the Wanderer","You felt something watching you from the western side of the Gladden Fields. Could it be the shade you seek?","You felt another watchful presence up the cliff path to the north-west of where you encountered Vagári the Wanderer.","The Maiden stares at you, her face betraying no emotion. At last she speaks, and her voice is like the sound of water falling over and among stones.\
\
'What has brought you to this place?' she asks quietly.","There is no sign of Vagári among the reeds","Search Lúlstrok for Vagári the Wanderer","Habla con la sombra","As you approach the shade, you are overwhelmed by a sensation of dread","This must be the Maiden of the Gladden of whom the Woodmen spoke","Search for Vagári the Wanderer on the western side of the Gladden Fields","You have found a watchful presence that seems to match Badwila's description of Vagári the Wanderer on the western side of the Gladden Fields.","The shade of Vagári the Wanderer begins to fade from view.","The shade of Vagári the Wanderer begins to fade from view","Gandalf has asked you to explore several locations in the Gladden Fields, defeating shades you find, and to search for Vagári the Wanderer.","Search Tol Send for Vagári the Wanderer","Vagári disappears from view, but you feel another presence up the cliff path to the north-west"}},
[10869]={nameES="Shades in the Swamp: Vágari The Wanderer",objectivesES={"Gandalf is inside the Beorninghús, studying the Black Book of Mordor.","Talk to Gandalf inside the Beorninghús","Talk to Elrond outside the Beorninghús","Elrond is outside the Beorninghús.","Gandalf is inside the Beorninghús.","Talk to Gandalf inside the Beorninghús and tell him of Badwila's frightening encounter","Badwila had a frightening experience in the Gladden Fields, and he related to you that something about the shade he encountered seemed different than Marhairu Winter-hair's encounter with Vagári the Wanderer.","Shades in the Swamp: Vágari The Wanderer"}},
[10870]={nameES="Sombras de días pasados",objectivesES={"Has derrotado a muchas sombras en el oeste de los Campos de Fornost.","Completado","Las sombras de Perjuros, malditas a permanecer aun tras extinguirse su vida, acechan en los Campos de Fornost. Son mortiferas con su odio hacia todas las cosas que viven y respiran.","Las sombras se encuentran en el oeste de los Campos de Fornost.\
\
Debes derrotar a sombras en los Campos de Fornost.","Sombras de días pasados"}},
[10871]={nameES="Shades of the Past",objectivesES={}},
[10872]={nameES="Sombra sobre la esperanza",objectivesES={"Hadâd-mezer se encuentra al sureste de Anazârmekhem de las Profundidades Llameantes.\
\
Debes derrotar a los orcos en Hadâd-mezer.","Has logrado reducir el número de orcos en Hadâd-mezer, facilitando así la entrada y salida de los enanos de Anazârmekhem.","Sombra sobre la esperanza","Derrota a los orcos Ghâsh-hai en Hadâd-mezer","Completado","Al llegar a Hadâd-mezer, se observa que los orcos controlan firmemente esta zona, lo que dificulta la entrada y la salida.\
\
Las fuerzas orcas son poderosas y su número debe ser reducido.","Al llegar a Hadâd-mezer, se observa que los orcos controlan firmemente esta zona, lo que dificulta la entrada y la salida."}},
[10873]={nameES="Shadow of the Iron Crown",objectivesES={"Defeated Lasairë","Tûr Fúar, the Drearspire can be found at Agal Dûn.\
\
You should defeat Claghórd in Tûr Fúar.","Defeat Lasairë","Tûr Fúar, the Drearspire can be found at Agal Dûn.\
\
You should defeat High Priestess Ásachal in Tûr Fúar.","Summon Múta to your side.","Tûr Fúar, the Drearspire can be found at Agal Dûn.\
\
You should talk to Múta in the upper reaches of Tûr Fúar.","Defeated Curcúan","Múta suggests pushing further into the Drearspire, for Brathar Crack-helm has been truthful in his word, thus far.","Tûr Fúar, the Drearspire can be found at Agal Dûn.\
\
You should talk to Múta in Tûr Fúar.","Talk to Múta in Tûr Fúar","Claghórd beckons you nearer","Defeat High Priestess Ásachal","Múta rushes to your side!","Talk to Múta inside the entrance of Tûr Fúar","Defeat Claghórd","Claghórd flees the battle","Defeated High Priestess Ásachal","Talk to Múta in the upper reaches of Tûr Fúar","Summon Múta to your side","The tower is like a vertical labyrinth!","Shadow of the Iron Crown","Summon Claghórd","Enter Tûr Fúar, the Drearspire","Tûr Fúar, the Drearspire can be found at Agal Dûn.\
\
You should enter Tûr Fúar.","Tûr Fúar, the Drearspire can be found at Agal Dûn.\
\
You should defeat Curcúan and Lasairë in Tûr Fúar.","Defeat Curcúan"}},
[10874]={nameES="Sombra de la Mano Blanca",objectivesES={"Grimbriar se encuentra en la casa de piedra, cerca de El Cruce, fuera de Bree.\
\
Las notas del espía confirman bien lo que decía la carta de los bandidos, a saber, que Zarquino no es un bandido, sino un hombre influyente del sur. Sería bueno avisar a Grimbriar.","El espía te ha entregado un manojo de notas","Reúnete con el espía de Grimbriar","Tu descubrimiento corrobora lo que el espía de Grimbriar le ha estado diciendo. Grimbriar ha organizado un intercambio de documentos importantes.","El espía de Grimbriar te encontrará cerca de una roca gris en un pequeño bosque, al norte de Bree.\
\
Grimbriar te ha enviado a reunirte con un espía que ha infiltrado entre los bandidos con la esperanza de que revele información sobre Zarquino y sus planes.","Lleva las notas del informador a Grimbriar","Sombra de la Mano Blanca","Habla con el Jefe de vigilancia Grimbriar"}},
[10875]={nameES="Shadow-roost: Abandoned Eggs",objectivesES={}},
[10876]={nameES="Shadows of Fear",objectivesES={"Talk to Grufudh at Gavar Cadlus","You have found the evidence Grufudh requires","The goat-herds graze the land to the west of Gavar Cadlus.\
\
Grufudh asked you to investigate the evil shadows he and his fellow goatherds saw among their herds. They only seem to come at night, but may be found elsewhere during the day.","Druggavar have appeared among the herds of the Uch-lûth, west of Gavar Cadlus.\
\
Grufudh asked you to find a way to banish the Druggavar from their lands.","Grufudh is at Gavar Cadlus in the Windfells of Enedwaith, east of the goat-herd.","The Uch-lûth goatherd Grufudh accepted the gift of the Rangers, but he still does not trust you.","Shadows of Fear","Search for signs of the Druggavar among the goat-herds"}},
[10877]={nameES="Shadows of Fear -- Repeatable",objectivesES={"Shadows of Fear -- Repeatable","Iuan is at Gavar Cadlus in the Windfells of Enedwaith, east of the goat-herd.\
\
You should return to Iuan with news of your victory.","Druggavar haunt the lands to the west of Gavar Cadlus.\
\
Iuan has asked you to hunt down and banish the Druggavar of Enedwaith.","Impressed by your apparent power over the evil Druggavar of Enedwaith, the Uch-lûth seek your aid once more.","Talk to Iuan at Gavar Cadlus"}},
[10878]={nameES="Shadows of Ithilien",objectivesES={"In years past, the Rangers held many refuges within the lands of North Ithilien from which to combat the Enemy's forces. Now, only Henneth Annûn remains and the rest lie abandoned or in the hands of the Enemy.","Mablung can be found at Henneth Annûn in North Ithilien.\
\
You have scouted the abandoned Ranger refuges and should now tell Mablung of what you discovered.","Patrol the abandoned refuge of Thurindath","Talk to Mablung","Patrol the abandoned refuge of Torngroth","Shadows of Ithilien","Patrol the abandoned refuge of Adab Dolen","Spiders have overrun the refuge!","Thurindath can be found far to the south-east of Henneth Annûn, Adab Dolen can be found to the north of Henneth Annûn, and Torngroth can be found far to the north-west of Henneth Annûn.\
\
Mablung has asked you to scout the old Ranger refuges of Thurindath, Adab Dolen, and Torngroth. You should seek them out and take note of what you discover.","You see Orkish trappings within the refuge, and something glints in the dark nearby...","Moss creeps in from the cave's entrance, but someone or something has been here recently..."}},
[10879]={nameES="Shadows of Moria",objectivesES={}},
[10880]={nameES="Shadows on the Wall",objectivesES={"Continue searching Crypts of Esh-kimâkhi south of Urmâkh for signs of Mizâdi's missing husband, Eshtali. Mizâdi said he would be wearing crimson robes.","Search around Esh-kimâkhi for clues as to Eshtali's whereabouts","Mizâdi has received word from her spies that her missing husband, Eshtali, has been sighted near the Crypts of Esh-kimâkhi. Make your way there and look for clues to his whereabouts.","Search the Crypts of Esh-kimâkhi south of Urmâkh for signs of Mizâdi's missing husband, Eshtali. Mizâdi said he would be wearing crimson robes.","Examine the man to determine if he is Eshtali","Examine the man to determine if he is Eshtali.","Give Mizâdi in Urmâkh news of her husband's death","You spot something - it looks like a man tossed in the dirt","Shadows on the Wall","Give Mizâdi in Urmâkh news of her husband's death.","You search the disturbed ground here, but you find nothing","You have found Eshtali - he is dead","Search three spots around Esh-kimâkhi for clues as to Eshtali's whereabouts"}},
[10881]={nameES="Shadows on the Wall",objectivesES={"Mizâdi has received word from her spies that her missing husband, Eshtali, has been sighted near the Crypts of Esh-kimâkhi. Make your way there and look for clues to his whereabouts.","Continue searching around Esh-kimâkhi - Eshtali may be close","Search the Crypts of Esh-kimâkhi south of Urmâkh for signs of Mizâdi's missing husband, Eshtali. Mizâdi said he would be wearing crimson robes.","Examine the man to determine if he is Eshtali","Examine the man to determine if he is Eshtali.","You find a fashionable robe, burned and blood-stained","Continue searching the Crypts of Esh-kimâkhi south of Urmâkh for signs of Mizâdi's missing husband, Eshtali.","Shadows on the Wall","You find a ballad detailing the fall of Kûr Anzar to the Barkhûshim","Speak with Razâl at the edge of Esh-kimâkhi","You find a piece of chest armour, gouged and warped","Meet with Razâl, Mizâdi's scout, outside of Esh-kimâkhi. The Crypts of Esh-kimâkhi can be found south-east of Urmâkh.","Meet with Razâl outside of Esh-kimâkhi","Bring Mizâdi in Urmâkh her husband's effects, and news of his death","Give Mizâdi in Urmâkh news of her husband's death, and what you found of his possessions.","You spot something - it looks like a man tossed in the dirt","You find a sword and shield, both broken beyond use","Speak with Razâl at the edge of Esh-kimâkhi.","You have found Eshtali - he is dead","A member of the Restless Dead, with fresh sword strikes carved into its bones"}},
[10882]={nameES="Shadowy Debts",objectivesES={"Sâdikiz says he can repay his debts by selling the glands of rock-worms found at the Pools of Taridím, west of Khanâg Gur, and the Seething-wells in northern An Shêru.","Shadowy Debts","Bring the rock-worm glands to Sâdikiz the Sky-hungry","Sâdikiz has asked for your help to carry out his plan for a way to pay his debts.","You have collected the rock-worm glands that Sâdikiz requested. You should bring them to him at Khanâg Gur."}},
