[10889]={nameES="Shakalush, the Stair Battle -- Tier 4",objectivesES={"Secure the eastern and western gate controls","Secured the western gate control","Shakalush, the Stair Battle -- Tier 4","Defeated Zhurmat and Groz-and-Ulk","Defeat Zhurmat and Groz-and-Ulk and secure the Gate of Winds","Zhurmat and his fearsome mount - the horrible two-headed troll Groz-and-Ulk - have begun to amass forces for use against the Gabil'akkâ in the valley below. Óli has asked for your assistance in routing the forces outside Bagûd-mekhem, the Gate of Wind.","Defeat Azbauz and Maugrush","Secured the eastern gate control","Defeat Shatarkha","Speak with Óli","Defeat Zhurmat and Groz-and-Ulk"}},
[10890]={nameES="Shakalush, the Stair Battle -- Tier 5",objectivesES={"Secure the eastern and western gate controls","Secured the western gate control","Defeated Zhurmat and Groz-and-Ulk","Defeat Zhurmat and Groz-and-Ulk and secure the Gate of Winds","Zhurmat and his fearsome mount - the horrible two-headed troll Groz-and-Ulk - have begun to amass forces for use against the Gabil'akkâ in the valley below. Óli has asked for your assistance in routing the forces outside Bagûd-mekhem, the Gate of Wind.","Defeat Azbauz and Maugrush","Secured the eastern gate control","Defeat Shatarkha","Speak with Óli","Shakalush, the Stair Battle -- Tier 5","Defeat Zhurmat and Groz-and-Ulk"}},
