[10960]={nameES="Shákoth, Scourge of Glimmerdeep",objectivesES={"Shákoth, Scourge of Glimmerdeep has been defeated. You have removed a significant threat.","Shákoth, Scourge of Glimmerdeep","Defeated Shákoth, Scourge of Glimmerdeep","You have encountered Shákoth","Shákoth poses a great threat to all that enter Glimmerdeep to remove resources while under his watch.","Defeat Shákoth, Scourge of Glimmerdeep","Completado","Shákoth poses a great threat to all that attempt to remove resources while under his watch in Glimmerdeep."}},
[10961]={nameES="Shákrug's Last Stand",objectivesES={"Shákrug is not pleased to see you but seems willing to talk. You notice Bregdal locked in a nearby cage","Bregdal is outside of Maudhúl Grak.\
\
You should speak with Bregdal.","Rescue Bregdal","Shákrug's stronghold is located in Maudhúl Grak.\
\
You should find and defeat Shákrug.","Ghân-buri-Ghân can be found in Drû Bhûta.\
\
You should return to Ghân-buri-Ghân with the head of Shákrug.","Shákrug's Last Stand","Speak with Bregdal outside of Maudhúl Grak","Speak with Ghân-buri-Ghân","Bregdal is in Shákrug's stronghold.\
\
You should rescue Bregdal.","Examining the body of one of the Key-Warden's underlings, you find a torn patch of an Errand-rider!\
\
Now that you have the keys, you should be able to get into Shákrug's quarters. Perhaps the Orc captain will divulge information about this Errand-rider patch you found after a little persuasion.","Shákrug should not be able to escape now that you know his whereabouts.","Shákrug has been defeated!","Find and defeat Shákrug"}},
[10962]={nameES="Sick Enemies are Weak Enemies",objectivesES={"Return to Guto at his encampment","Sick Enemies are Weak Enemies","Guto is at his small encampment in the southern fields of Trum Dreng.\
\
You should return to Guto with news of your success.","Guto has asked you to spoil the food-stores at the White Hand encampment, hoping that this will serve to weaken the enemy.","Food-stores can be found within the White Hand encampment in Trum Dreng.\
\
You should break into the encampment and spoil all the food-stores you find there."}},
[10963]={nameES="Enfermedad de la tierra",objectivesES={"Laergil espera en el noroeste del Haudh Lin.\
\
Debes volver con Laergil y comunicarle tu éxito.","Enfermedad de la tierra","La tranquilidad y la protección de Duillond, el refugio de los Elfos, no llegan tan al norte como el Haudh Lin. Como resultado, criaturas malévolas han comenzado a infiltrarse en ese lugar de paz.","Arañas infestan el noreste del Haudh Lin, muy más allá de Duillond.\
\
Laergil te ha pedido que elimines tantas arañas como puedas."}},
[10964]={nameES="Sickle-flies by the Lagorduin",objectivesES={"You have done as Branach asked. Return to him.\
\
Branach can be found at his farm, Cornworth, north-west of Gnatstead.","Sickle-flies by the Lagorduin","Branach has asked you to exterminate an overgrowth of sickle-flies.","Talk to Branach","Branach has asked you to defeat sickle flies.\
\
The sickle-flies in question can be found to the south-west of Branach's farm, Cornworth."}},
[10965]={nameES="Guadañas entre los juncos",objectivesES={"Moscas guadaña agresivas que aman festejarse con juncos valiosos están asolando los estanques cerca de Herne.","Regresa con Aerona","Aerona te ha pedido que reduzcas el número de moscas guadaña que zumban alrededor de los estanques y cursos de agua al este de Herne.\
\
Herne está en el oeste de Cardolan.","Deberías informarle a Aerona que menos moscas guadaña molestarán a los juncos de los estanques cerca de Herne.\
\
Aerona está en Herne.","Guadañas entre los juncos"}},
[10966]={nameES="Side Passages",objectivesES={}},
[10967]={nameES="Siege Escalated",objectivesES={"Herefara is in Brockbridge.\
\
Herefara would like to thank you for your aid in the battle.","The stalemate in Brockbridge was only temporary, as the enemy is marching to assault the city, and war drums can be heard in the distance to announce their approach.","Siege Escalated","Talk to Herefara to aid the defence of Brockbridge.","Talk to Herefara"}},
[10968]={nameES="Siege Under Fire",objectivesES={"Saruman's forces have sent out their siege weapons to wreak havoc upon the battlefront. While the men on the wall focus on surviving the boulders raining down upon them, foes have crept into the deep and are planning on using black powder to destroy one of the siege-towers from below.","Aragorn has moved to guard the siege-tower's base from sappers in the deep, while the men upon the wall have braced themselves for a hail of fire from the enemy's catapults.\
\
Merit Rating\
\
This quest starts with <rgb=#FFFF00>Full</rgb> Merit Rating.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Major Merit Loss:</rgb>\
* Powder keg is detonated at tower base","Siege Under Fire"}},
[10969]={nameES="Siege in Disrepair",objectivesES={"Siege in Disrepair","Eärtur, the Prince of Belfalas, has noted that the siege equipment in Adambel has fallen into disrepair from lack of use.","Talk to Eärtur","Eärtur can be found at Adambel.\
\
You should talk to Eärtur.","Siege equipment in disrepair can be found at Adambel.\
\
You should repair the siege equipment."}},
[10970]={nameES="Siege of Eaworth: Catapults",objectivesES={}},
[10971]={nameES="Siege of Eaworth: Uruks of the Vale",objectivesES={"Dernstan is at Eaworth.\
\
Dernstan will be pleased to hear that you defeated many Uruks while defending Eaworth.","The Uruk-encampment to the south of Eaworth launches almost daily assaults upon the town.","Siege of Eaworth: Uruks of the Vale","<rgb=#FF0000>Completing Aiding the Eastemnet will cancel this quest</rgb>","Uruks are besieging Eaworth.\
\
Dernstan asked you to aid in defending Eaworth from the Uruks encamped to the south.","Talk to Dernstan"}},
[10972]={nameES="Siege of Faldham: Holding the Line",objectivesES={"Aldbéort is at Cliving.\
\
Aldbéort will be pleased to hear Faldham has been defended and the attackers driven back.","Goblins and Wargs can be found at the farmsteads around Faldham.\
\
Aldbéort asked you to aid in the defence of Faldham.","Siege of Faldham: Holding the Line","<rgb=#FF0000>Completing Aiding the Eastemnet will cancel this quest</rgb>","The Enemy is marching towards the small township of Faldham.","Talk to Aldbéort"}},
[10973]={nameES="Siege of Faldham: Inferno",objectivesES={"The Enemy is setting the farmhouses of Faldham ablaze.","Bring water to the south-west farmhouse","The flames at the north-east farmhouse have been slightly abated","Bring water to the north farmhouse","Siege of Faldham: Inferno","Bring water to the central farmhouse","The flames at the north farmhouse have been slightly abated","The flames at the central farmhouse have been slightly abated","The flames at the east farmhouse have been slightly abated","Bring the bucket to a burning building","Bring water to the east farmhouse","<rgb=#FF0000>Completing Aiding the Eastemnet will cancel this quest</rgb>","Aldbéort is at Cliving.\
\
Aldbéort will be pleased to hear that you helped put out the fires.","The flames at the south-west farmhouse have been slightly abated","Bring water to the north-east farmhouse","Burning houses can be found at farmsteads around Faldham.\
\
Aldbéort has asked you to aid in the defence of Faldham by bringing water to burning farmsteads.","Talk to Aldbéort"}},
[10974]={nameES="Asedio de Gondamon: Incursión",objectivesES={"Gondamon es una de las fortalezas más poderosas de los Barbasluengas en las Montañas Azules. Los Duramano y sus aliados trasgos buscan apoderarse de ella.","Asedio de Gondamon: Incursión","Completa 'Asedio de Gondamos' con un grupo de incursión"}},
[10975]={nameES="Siege the Morgul-host",objectivesES={}},
[10976]={nameES="Siege-breakers of Madh-fushaum",objectivesES={}},
[10977]={nameES="Maestro de asedio",objectivesES={"Has derrotado al Maestro de Asedio Pakonka","Te adentraste en el corazón del campamento orco en Dol Dínen y derrotaste al maestro de asedio troll, Pakonka.","El troll acorazado Pakonka se encuentra dentro de Hîsuk, a la sombra de la montaña que domina el valle de Dol Dínen, muy al sureste de Esteldín.\
\
Debes buscar al capitán acorazado de los trolls en Dol Dínen. Con la muerte de su capitán, los trolls quedarán sumidos en el caos.","Se ha visto a un gran troll acorazado caminando entre las armas de asedio que dominan el acceso a las colinas en las zonas más meridionales de Dol Dínen. Este gran bruto lidera a los trolls que mantienen las máquinas de asedio en Dol Dínen.","Maestro de asedio","Completado","Te adentraste en el corazón del campamento orco en Dol Dínen y derrotaste al maestro de asedio troll, Pakonka. Su pérdida obstaculizará al ejército orco al menos por un tiempo.","Derrota a Pakonka, Maestro de Asedio"}},
[10978]={nameES="Artes de asedio",objectivesES={"Artes de asedio","Has desactivado el equipo de asedio en Dol Dínen, obstaculizando la marcha de los Ongbúrz hacia la guerra. Los Montaraces de Esteldín estarán agradecidos por tus esfuerzos.","Las catapultas, los trabucos y las ballestas se pueden encontrar en las colinas y terrenos elevados, en lo profundo del campamento orco en Dol Dínen, al sureste de Esteldín.\
\
Debes desactivar o destruir las catapultas, los trabucos y las ballestas.","Completado","Las catapultas, los trabucos y las ballestas se pueden encontrar en las colinas y terrenos elevados, en lo profundo del campamento orco en Dol Dínen, al sureste de Esteldín.\
\
Debes destruir el equipo de asedio en Dol Dínen."}},
[10979]={nameES="Sifting for Survivors",objectivesES={"Speak with Imrahil","Sifting for Survivors","The siege of Minas Tirith has left the lower tiers in utter ruin, trapping many Gondorians who tried to flee.","You should free any trapped Gondorians that you come across in the First Circle in Minas Tirith.","Imrahil can be found outside the front gates of Minas Tirith.\
\
You should speak with Imrahil."}},
[10980]={nameES="Sifting for a Solution",objectivesES={"Thurindol has a plan, but needs black powder from the scrap scattered about the Slag-hills in order to proceed.","Thurindol can be found at a small Ranger outpost hidden in the Slag-hills.\
\
You should return to Thurindol with the black powder you gathered.","Black powder may be found within the rubble surrounding the Slag-hills.\
\
You should collect black powder for Thurindol.","Bring the black powder to Thurindol","You find nothing of use here","Sifting for a Solution"}},
[10981]={nameES="Sigil of the Rhi Helvarch",objectivesES={}},
[10982]={nameES="Sigils of Imlad Ithil for Motes",objectivesES={"Talk to the White Company Quartermaster to trade Sigils of Imlad Ithil for Motes.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>This quest can be completed weekly.</rgb>","The White Company has a small quantity of Motes available.","Collect 100 Sigils of Imlad Ithil to trade with the White Company Quartermaster.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>This quest can be completed weekly.</rgb>","Sigils of Imlad Ithil for Motes","Deliver the Sigils of Imlad Ithil to the The White Company Quartermaster"}},
[10983]={nameES="Sigils of Sorrow",objectivesES={}},
[10984]={nameES="Sign of the Malledhrim",objectivesES={"There are many positions throughout Gathbúrz that remain contested by both sides of the conflict in Southern Mirkwood.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This quest will fail on logout, make sure to turn in before you leave the game.</rgb>","Place a Malledhrim war-banner in a contested camp","Defend the Malledhrim war-banner","You have placed the Malledhrim war-banner in a contested camp","You have defended the Malledhrim war-banner with honour","Sign of the Malledhrim","You were unable to defend the Malledhrim war-banner","Contested camps can be found in Gathbúrz.\
\
Rodelleth has asked you to place a Malledhrim war-banner at a contested camp.","Rodelleth is at Thangúlhad in Gathbúrz.\
\
You should return to Rodelleth with news of your success.","You have abandoned the Malledhrim war-banner to the Enemy","Talk to Rodelleth at Thangúlhad","Defend the Malledhrim war-banner at the contested camp in Gathburz."}},
[10985]={nameES="Sign of the Past, Symbol of the Future",objectivesES={}},
[10986]={nameES="Sign of the White Hand",objectivesES={"This banner bears the symbol of the White Hand, the charge of the traitor Saruman. Saeradan will certainly wish to know of this.","Near the place called Gwyllion's Gate, you found a banner bearing the symbol of the White Hand.","Talk to Saeradan at Echad Saeradan","Saeradan is at Echad Saeradan, west from Gwyllion's Gate.\
\
You should tell Saeradan of the banner you discovered.","Sign of the White Hand"}},
[10987]={nameES="Signal to the South",objectivesES={"Tol Ascarnen is under the control of the Free Peoples, but their forces are still scattered to the corners of the Ettenmoors.","Wolves can be found throughout the forests south and east of Tol Ascarnen. Drakes can be found to the north in Arador's End. Aurochs can be found in the pastures south and east of Tol Ascarnen.\
\
In an effort to call defenders to the central keep of Tol Ascarnen, Sergeant-at-Arms Iafileg has asked you to collect hides to weave into banners that will call the defenders to their posts at the southern bridge.","Return the leather hides to Sergeant-at-Arms Iafileg at Tol Ascarnen","Signal to the South"}},
[10988]={nameES="Signal to the West",objectivesES={"Tol Ascarnen is under the control of the Free Peoples, but their forces are still scattered to the corners of the Ettenmoors.","Return the leather hides to Sergeant-at-Arms Iafileg at Tol Ascarnen","Signal to the West","Wolves can be found throughout the forests south and east of Tol Ascarnen. Drakes can be found to the north in Arador's End. Aurochs can be found in the pastures south and east of Tol Ascarnen.\
\
In an effort to call defenders to the central keep of Tol Ascarnen, Sergeant-at-Arms Iafileg has asked you to collect hides to weave into banners that will call them to their posts at the western bridge."}},
[10989]={nameES="Signs Among the Ashes",objectivesES={"Half-orcs can be found throughout Nan Laeglin, especially where they have raided Uch-lûth farmsteads.\
\
There must be some bosses driving the half-orc raiders into Nan Laeglin. It is possible that among them one may be carrying equipment with the sigils of Isengard upon it.","Talk to Guladus Brehures at the Brenin's Hall","Find equipment on Half-orc Bosses (0/2)","You have discovered a helm of the White Hand","Half-orc raiders from the mountains have attacked a number of small farmholds around Nan Laeglin. Guladus Brehures suspects that forces from Isengard may be behind the attacks, but she needs evidence before she dares speak openly of it in council.","You have found a sword of the White Hand","Find equipment on Half-orc Bosses (1/2)","Guladus Brehures is at the Brenin's Hall in Lhanuch.\
\
Having found gear bearing the sign of the White Hand upon the half-orcs raiding Nan Laeglin, you may return to Guladus Brehures with the evidence she needs to speak out against Isengard in the Council of Brehur.","Half-orcs can be found throughout Nan Laeglin, especially where they have raided Uch-lûth farmsteads.\
\
There must be some leaders driving the half-orc raiders into Nan Laeglin. It is possible that among them one may be carrying equipment with the sigils of Isengard upon it.","Signs Among the Ashes"}},
[10990]={nameES="Signs Among the Ashes -- Repeatable",objectivesES={}},
[10991]={nameES="Signs of Hope",objectivesES={"Bring the signs of hope to Borhador","The chickens are still productive, laying eggs for the village","This mountain flower blossoms, even without the sun","Signs of Hope","This banner holds the prosperous symbol of the Vale, a gold trout on blue field","Borhador has a melancholic disposition and could use a reminder of the beauty that the Vale still holds.","Borhador can be found in The Crossing-hall.\
\
You should bring the signs of hope to Borhador.","Signs of hope may be scattered around Ringló Vale near Ethring.\
\
Search for signs of hope."}},
[10992]={nameES="Signos de lucha",objectivesES={"Entrega las tiras de tela a Andreg en el Viejo Fuerte del Camino Verde","Los Montaraces, que vigilan los movimientos de los enemigos del norte y del sur, están preocupados por la aparición de un enemigo al que han luchado durante mucho tiempo en el norte.","Signos de lucha","Los orcos pueden encontrarse a lo largo de la frontera oriental del Camino Verde, al norte del Viejo Fuerte del Camino Verde. Andreg espera tu regreso en su puesto cerca del Viejo Fuerte del Camino Verde.\
\
Andreg te pidió que registraras a los orcos a lo largo de las fronteras orientales del Camino Verde en busca de señales de una lucha contra los Hombres de las Quebradas del Norte. Aunque los Montaraces esperan que los orcos no hayan atacado a los Hombres de las Quebradas del Norte, desean investigar y asegurarse de que no sea el caso."}},
[10993]={nameES="Signs of Trouble",objectivesES={"You have been asked to go back into the woods of Thinglad to investigate more signs of trouble, now that the Rohirrim have departed.","Find Renfaer in Thinglad","Thinglad's scout can be found south-east from Haldirith.\
\
Limfind has asked you to find and help the scout Renfaer.","Signs of Trouble"}},
[10994]={nameES="Silence at the Homestead",objectivesES={"Look at the fields for sign of the Enemy","Folcbur can be found at the traders' pavillion in central Middlemead.\
\
You have defeated the traitorous warrior Folcbur sent you to meet, and should now reveal what you have learned of the homestead.","Search the farmhouse","The farmhouse is at the centre of the homestead to the south-east of Middlemead.\
\
You have found no sign of the Enemy and should rejoin Torwulf inside the farmhouse.","Talk to Folcbur","Talk to Torwulf at the homestead south-east of Middlemead","This is a good place to look","You see nothing amidst the swaying crops below","The windmill can be found at the southern end of Folcbur's homestead south-east of Middlemead.\
\
You have met with Torwulf and are now to scout the homestead for sign of the Enemy. You should look from atop the windmill.","Find Torwulf","Torwulf is somwhere inside the farmhouse at the homestead south-east of Middlemead.\
\
You have heard noises from within the farmhouse. You should try to find Torwulf.","Silence at the Homestead","Folcbur has heard little from her homestead to the south-east of Middlemead, and fears that something is afoot at the farm.","Scout the windmill at the homestead","Torwulf can be found outside the farmhouse at the homestead south-east of Middlemead.\
\
Concerned by a lack of shipments, Folcbur has sent you to investigate the farm south-east of town and meet with a town guard also stationed there.","Defeated Torwulf","As you approach the door, you hear voices inside"}},
[10995]={nameES="Silencio de los huargos",objectivesES={"Los jinetes de huargos del Valle del Arroyo Sombrío han estado acosando el campamento enano de Mekhem-bizru desde que se estableció.","Ótam se encuentra en Mekhem-bizru, al noroeste de Athmadhul.\
\
Ótam estará encantado de saber que los huargos alrededor de Athmadhul han sido reducidos.","Silencio de los huargos","Habla con Ótam en Mekhem-bizru","Los huargos se encuentran en Athmadhul, al sureste de Mekhem-bizru.\
\
Ótam quiere que reduzcas el número de huargos para que haya menos jinetes de huargos que molesten a los enanos."}},
[10996]={nameES="Silence the Scouts",objectivesES={}},
[10997]={nameES="Silence the Sentries",objectivesES={"There are two small encampments that the Draig-lûth established. These men are dangerous and prey upon the Uch-lûth.","Silence the Sentries","Gronu's camp lies almost due north of Harndirion.\
\
You should return to Gronu and let him know that you have defeated many of the sentries near Pruv Cadlus and Sarf Cadlus.","Talk to Gronu at his camp","The Draig-lûth camps are east and north-east of Harndirion.\
\
Gronu has asked you to seek out Pruv Cadlus and Sarf Cadlus on the eastern slope below Harndirion and defeat sentries at each of the camps.","Discovered Sarf Cadlus","Discovered Pruv Cadlus","Discover Pruv Cadlus","Discover Sarf Cadlus"}},
[10998]={nameES="Silence the Sentries -- Repeatable",objectivesES={"There are two small encampments that the Draig-lûth established. These men are dangerous and prey upon the Uch-lûth.","Gronu's camp lies almost due north of Harndirion.\
\
You should return to Gronu and let him know that you have defeated many of the sentries near Pruv Cadlus and Sarf Cadlus.","Talk to Gronu at his camp","The Draig-lûth camps are east and north-east of Harndirion.\
\
Gronu has asked you to seek out Pruv Cadlus and Sarf Cadlus on the eastern slope below Harndirion and defeat sentries at each of the camps.","Discovered Sarf Cadlus","Silence the Sentries -- Repeatable","Discovered Pruv Cadlus","Discover Pruv Cadlus","Discover Sarf Cadlus"}},
[10999]={nameES="Silencing the Outposts",objectivesES={"Reached the western Orc outpost","Defeat the Orcs at the western outpost to help Galâmka in their preparations for the battle in Maurûsh.","Defeat the Orcs at the southern outpost to help Galâmka in their preparations for the battle in Maurûsh.","Find the Orc outpost to the east of Maurûsh that was discovered by the scouts.","Return to Galâmka in Ub Nishir","Defeat the Orcs at the eastern outpost to help Galâmka in their preparations for the battle in Maurûsh.","Find the Orc outpost to the south of Maurûsh that was discovered by the scouts.","Find the western Orc outpost","Reached the southern Orc outpost","Silencing the Outposts","Galâmka has asked you to clear out the outposts the Orcs have set up outside of Maurûsh to prevent them from calling for help when the attack begins.","Find the southern Orc outpost","Reached the eastern Orc outpost","Return to Galâmka in Ub Nishir to the north of Maurûsh and inform him that the outposts have been cleared out.","Find the Orc outpost to the west of Maurûsh that was discovered by the scouts.","Find the eastern Orc outpost"}},
[11000]={nameES="Silencing the Silent One",objectivesES={"Find and defeat the Silent One","Silencing the Silent One","Muddy bootprints seem to lead toward the mouth of a cavern in Dath Nethryn!","The Silent One lies defeated, and you claim his armour!","You and Legolas have tracked the Silent One into Dath Nethryn. The Silent One lurks somewhere in this foetid swamp, seeking to regain his advantage.","The Silent One can be found somewhere within Dath Nethryn.\
\
You and Legolas have tracked the Silent One to Dath Nethryn. You should now search for the Silent One in the swamp.","As you examine the corpse of Aithrist the Blighted, an arrow barely misses your head!","Legolas can be found above the swamp of Dath Nethryn in Lhingris.\
\
You have defeated the Silent One and taken his armour. You should now return to Legolas.","The Silent One can be found somewhere within Kâm Lagúrz in Dath Nethryn.\
\
You have followed the Silent One's tracks into Kâm Lagúrz where the corpse of an enormous spider now rests. You should search for the Silent One.","Find and follow the Silent One's path in Dath Nethryn","Deliver the Silent One's armour to Legolas near Dath Nethryn"}},
[11001]={nameES="Pies silenciosos",objectivesES={"Niko, el Maestro de la Caza, duda que seas capaz de moverte en silencio sin espantar a la presa, y mucho menos de cazar bien.","Habla con Niko","Las manadas de uros se encuentran al norte y al sur y suroeste de Jänis-leiri.\
\
Niko te ha indicado que encuentres y desactives algunas de las trampas de los Gauradan para proteger a las manadas de uros.","No mates a ninguna hembra mantonieve","Niko se encuentra en Jänis-leiri, al norte de las manadas de uros, cerca del camino.\
\
Deberías regresar con Niko y comunicarle tu éxito.","Has matado a una de las hembras mantonieve de los Lossoth","Pies silenciosos"}},
[11002]={nameES="Pasos silenciosos",objectivesES={"Busca indicios de Gollum en las Aguas Reptantes","Busca indicios de Gollum en la Bajamarisma","Habla con Miluimil en el campamento de Ivorel","Las espinas de peces recientemente devorados cubren la orilla de este estanque","Gollum podría encontrarse en uno de los varios lugares sugeridos por Miluimil.\
\
Miluimil te ha pedido que busques cualquier rastro de Gollum en las Hondonadas Enmarañadas. Deberías empezar por el Estanque de la Tranquilidad.","Gollum podría encontrarse en uno de los varios lugares sugeridos por Miluimil.\
\
Miluimil te ha pedido que busques cualquier rastro de Gollum en las Hondonadas Enmarañadas. Quizá deberías probar en la Bajamarisma.","Miluimil se encuentra en el campamento de Ivorel en las Hondonadas Enmarañadas.\
\
Deberías regresar con Miluimil y contarle lo que has descubierto sobre el paradero de Gollum.","Algo se mueve en las telarañas cercanas","Gollum podría encontrarse en uno de los varios lugares sugeridos por Miluimil.\
\
Miluimil te ha pedido que busques cualquier rastro de Gollum en las Hondonadas Enmarañadas. Quizá deberías probar en las Aguas Reptantes.","Pasos silenciosos","Uno de los exploradores de los Malledhrim informó de una criatura similar a un goblin en los barrancos, no muy distinta de Gollum.","Busca indicios de Gollum en el Estanque de la Tranquilidad","No has encontrado rastro alguno de Gollum"}},
[11003]={nameES="Silent Harvest",objectivesES={"Silent Harvest","Talk to Gísil in the Mead Hall of Garsfeld","Thane Gísil can be found at Garsfeld, among the northernmost crofts of the Sutcrofts.\
\
Léofmar wishes for you to travel to Garsfeld in the Sutcrofts and aid his brethren.","The Thane of Garsfeld, Gísil, is a strong leader, but has faced untold opposition from numerous enemy forces and struggles to maintain control of his croftlands."}},
[11004]={nameES="Silent Riders",objectivesES={"Assist Cuthric with Charge of the Ox","Assist Cuthric with Heading off the Stampede","Assisted Cuthric with Heading off the Stampede","Assist Thurbald with Pulling the Dragon's Teeth","Thurbald is hiding outside a Dragon-clan encampment, north of the Rohirrim scout-camp.\
\
Thurbald needs your help with several tasks.","Assisted Thurbald with Breath of the Dragon","Cuthric is hiding outside an Ox-clan encampment, west of the Rohirrim scout-camp.\
\
Cuthric needs your assistance with some tasks.","Assisted Cuthric with Prime Cut","Talk to Elfrith","Léofward is at the Rohirrim scout-camp.\
\
You should return to Léofward with the information provided to you by the Rohirrim scouts.","The Rohirrim scouts Thurbald and Cuthric are somewhere in the northern reaches of the Gravenwood, while Elfrith returned south to watch the road into Wulf's Cleft.\
\
Léofward has asked you to find the scouts he sent out into the Gravenwood and make sure they are well.","Silent Riders","Assisted Elfrith with Trophies of the Enemy","Assisted Thurbald with Pulling the Dragon's Teeth","Talk to Cuthric","Assisted Cuthric with Charge of the Ox","Assist Thurbald with Breath of the Dragon","Assisted Thurbald with Into the Dragon's Maw","Assisted Elfrith with Clear-cutting Orcs","Assisted Elfrith with Wanton Destruction","The Rohirrim scouts Thurbald and Cuthric are somewhere in the northern reaches of the Gravenwood, while Elfrith returned south to watch the road into the Isendale.\
\
Léofward has asked you to find the scouts he sent out into the Gravenwood and make sure they are well.","Assist Elfrith with Trophies of the Enemy","Assist Elfrith with Clear-cutting Orcs","Assist Thurbald with Into the Dragon's Maw","Elfrith is hiding outside and Orc-camp, south-west of the Rohirrim scout-camp.\
\
Elfrith needs your assistance with some tasks.","Assist Cuthric with Prime Cut","Assist Elfrith with Wanton Destruction","Talk to Thurbald","Talk to Léofward at the Rohirrim scout-camp","Théodred, son of King Théoden of Rohan, has led a small party of scouts into the Gravenwood to determine the movements and motives of the Dunlendings."}},
[11005]={nameES="Silk and Stingers",objectivesES={}},
[11006]={nameES="Hilos de Seda",objectivesES={"Lleva la seda de araña a Aarnikka","Hay arañas por todo Ram Dúath.\
\
Aarnikka te ha pedido que recolectes seda de las arañas de Ram Dúath.","Hilos de Seda","Los Hijos de la Tierra, rudos, prácticos y terrenales como son, hacen un uso extensivo de la seda, que obtienen casi exclusivamente de las arañas."}},
[11007]={nameES="Hilos de Seda",objectivesES={"Las arañas pueden encontrarse por toda la región de las Hondonadas Enmarañadas en el Bosque Negro.\
\
Legindir te ha pedido que recojas telarañas sin defecto de las arañas y de los alrededores de las Hondonadas Enmarañadas.","Hilos de Seda","Habla con Legindir en Ost Galadh","YOU SHOULD NOT SEE THIS","La seda de las arañas en las Hondonadas Enmarañadas es muy resistente y útil para una gran variedad de propósitos."}},
[11008]={nameES="Silver Coins of Gundabad for Motes",objectivesES={}},
[11009]={nameES="Silver Tongued",objectivesES={"Trumsele wants you to convince Ordwacer to be reasonable","Talk to the quartermaster about the shipment of mouldings","Trumsele can be found at the merchant's area in Cliving, just west of the fountain.\
\
The quartermaster has informed you that the delivery is not to be expected anytime soon. Trumsele will need to find another way to appease his client.","Talk to Trumsele about what to do next","Ordwacer has been causing a disturbance with the guards in regard to an order that the silversmith of Cliving, Trumsele, failed to deliver.","Ordwacer can be found at his estate east of the central fountain in Cliving.\
\
Trumsele has asked you to offer Ordwacer the ability to negotiate bargains with him, in exchange for his tolerance of the unfulfilled order.","Trumsele can be found at the merchant's area in Cliving, just west of the fountain.\
\
Ordwacer has asked you to demand the purchased items from Trumsele, or he will be forced to deal with the town guard.","Talk to Trumsele the silversmith about Odwacer's order","Silver Tongued","Talk to Ordwacer","The quartermaster does not believe the mouldings will arrive soon","The quartermaster of Cliving can be found south of the fountain, not far from the main entrance to the city.\
\
Trumsele has requested that you inquire with the quartermaster as to when the arrival of the mouldings being transported to Cliving from Edoras is to be expected."}},
[11010]={nameES="Remedio de Brillo Plateado",objectivesES={"Remedio de Brillo Plateado","<rgb=#00e4ff>¡Esta misión ha sido restaurada para los Servidores Legendarios!</rgb>\
\
'No resistiré mucho si... si no se encuentra ayuda para mí. Por suerte, conozco algo que podría servir. Hay arbustos que crecen en el valle justo al noreste del Patio de Frerin llamados nestadalas.\
\
'Ve al noreste del Patio de Frerin y recoge hojas de estos arbustos. Se dice que tienen propiedades curativas. Bien podrían ser mi única oportunidad.\
\
'Ahora apúrate y no te pierdas.'","Bolli necesita las hojas del arbusto de nestadalas para purgar el veneno que los Duramano le dieron.","Los arbustos de nestadalas se encuentran al noreste del Patio de Frerin.\
\
Bolli mencionó que las hojas del arbusto de nestadalas eran necesarias para su cura y te pidió que recogieras algunas para él.","Lleva las hojas de nestadalas a Bolli"}},
[11011]={nameES="Simple Leathers, Nothing More",objectivesES={}},
[11012]={nameES="Simple Salves, Part 1",objectivesES={"Simple Salves, Part 1","Investigate suspicious areas in the marsh","Return to Heshra, the herbalist","Return to the herbalist Heshra in the Elder Hall.","Heshra is investigating the source of the disease afflicting Khûtra. He has asked you to investigate the marsh near Khûtra for anything unusual.","Heshra has asked you to investigate the marsh east of Khûtra near the shore for anything unusual."}},
[11013]={nameES="Simple Salves, Part 2",objectivesES={"Heshra has asked you to collect various herbs for a simple salve to treat the disease.","Simple Salves, Part 2","Return to Heshra, the herbalist","Administer the simple salve to the afflicted villagers. They can be found on the rocks just outside Khûtra, to the east near the shore.","Return to Heshra the herbalist in the Elder Hall.","Heshra, the herbalist, has asked you to collect various herbs for a simple salve to treat the disease. These herbs can be found in the hills north of Khûtra."}},
[11014]={nameES="Simple Salves, Part 3",objectivesES={"Return to Heshra the herbalist in the Elder Hall","Talk to Ziriha the merchant and acquire rare ingredients","Administered third experimental salve to a diseased goat","Harvest sponge mushrooms that grow in the hills east of Khûtra.","Speak with Ziriha the merchant about the rare ingredients Heshra needs. She can be found near the fishing pier.","Simple Salves, Part 3","Administered first experimental salve to a diseased goat","Administer first experimental salve to diseased goat","Heshra has asked you to test various healing salves on diseased goats in Khûtra.","Administer second experimental salve to a diseased goat","Return to Heshra with the ingredients","Administer third experimental salve to a diseased goat","Administered second experimental salve to a diseased goat","Return to Heshra, the herbalist","Administer the new salves to afflicted goats. They can be found outside the Elder Hall."}},
[11015]={nameES="Cantando a los retoños",objectivesES={"Orthir se encuentra a corta distancia al oeste de Cerin Amroth, junto al camino.\
\
Mallendathor quiere que hables con Orthir, el Erudito de los Árboles, para ver si sabe cómo curar la dolencia de los retoños.","La corteza de este retoño parece muy quebradiza","<rgb=#FF0000>Canta</rgb> a un retoño de malbrethil (2/4)","Habla con Sendiel en Gelirdor","<rgb=#FF0000>Canta</rgb> a un retoño de malbrethil (0/4)","El tronco de este retoño parece más sano","Este retoño parece demasiado delicado","Sendiel se encuentra en Gelirdor, al suroeste de los árboles de malbrethil, al este de Cerin Amroth.\
\
Orthir te ha indicado que informes a Sendiel de tu éxito.","Los retoños de malbrethil se encuentran alrededor de Cerin Brethil en Taur Hith, al noreste de Cerin Amroth.\
\
Orthir cree que los retoños, privados de la música cotidiana del bosque ahora más silencioso, podrían revivir si les cantas.","Mallendathor te ha pedido que recojas semillas de Malbrethil por la zona de Taur Hith, al noreste de Certin Amroth. Son difíciles de encontrar, pero las musarañas hambrientas que corretean por el bosque suelen acumular bastantes.","Habla con Orthir","<rgb=#FF0000>Canta</rgb> a un retoño de malbrethil (3/4)","Las ramas de este retoño parecen algo más firmes","Las hojas de este retoño parecen desgarradas en los bordes","Cantando a los retoños","Este retoño parece algo menos deteriorado","Mallendathor quiere que vuelvas a cantarles a varios retoños de Malbrethil para ayudar a que crezcan sanos, y que le traigas de vuelta algunas semillas.","<rgb=#FF0000>Canta</rgb> a un retoño de malbrethil (1/4)","Las ramas de este retoño están claramente caídas","Este retoño ahora parece más robusto"}},
[11016]={nameES="Sinister Barrels",objectivesES={}},
[11017]={nameES="Nada o húndete",objectivesES={"Habla con Bingo en la posada de la Perca Dorada y acompáñale mientras aprender a nadar","Habla con Bingo en la posada de la Perca Dorada, en el pueblo de Cepeda","Bingo ha decidido que necesita dominar una habilidad más antes de comenzar su viaje. Debe aprender a nadar.","Bingo está en la posada de la Perca Dorada, en el pueblo de Cepeda","Bingo está en la posada de la Perca Dorada, en el pueblo de Cepeda. Está esperando que hables con él cuando tentas todo listo para practicar el arte de la natación.","Nada o húndete"}},
[11018]={nameES="Sinking the Fleet",objectivesES={}},
[11019]={nameES="Sire and Dam",objectivesES={}},
[11020]={nameES="Sister of the Gilrain",objectivesES={"Garvir can be found in Linhir in eastern Dor-en-Ernil.\
\
You have prevented the Ruthless Dead from crossing into Lebennin and should return to Garvir to tell him of your deeds with Roamingstar.","Talk to Roamingstar","Roamingstar can be found in her glade in north-eastern Dor-en-Ernil.\
\
You have aided Roamingstar in banishing the Ruthless Dead and should now speak to her.","Sister of the Gilrain","Talk to Garvir in Linhir","DNT -- will not be seen","Roamingstar can be found in her glade in north-eastern Dor-en-Ernil.\
\
Roamingstar has agreed to aid you in preventing the Ruthless Dead from crossing into Lebennin. You should speak to her when you are ready.","As thanks for your aid and to protect the lands of Gondor, Roamingstar seeks to prevent the Ruthless Dead from crossing into Lebennin."}},
[11021]={nameES="Sentado en el muelle",objectivesES={"Los hobbits que celebran el Festival del Lithe necesitan muchos peces para su estanque. Los Elfos te han concedido permiso para pescar algunos en el puerto de Celondim.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando finalice el festival actual.</rgb>","Sentado en el muelle","Atrapa tantos peces como puedas en veinte minutos","Los muelles se encuentran en Celondim, en Ered Luin, muy al oeste de Bree y de la Comarca.\
\
Los muelles de Celondim han sido durante mucho tiempo un lugar popular entre los pescadores elfos. Te han concedido algo de tiempo para pescar peces para el Festival del Lithe de los hobbits."}},
[11022]={nameES="Situational Update",objectivesES={"Talk to Girhâzi in Iridír","Ningêna has asked you to return to Girhâzi and update her on the situation at Sûru.","Situational Update","You have completed many tasks to support the Dumûri at Sûru."}},
[11023]={nameES="Sala Decimosexta - Sin hacer daño",objectivesES={"En la Sala Decimosexta, profanadores y otros orcos, ligados a algún poder oscuro, envenenan a los suyos con una enfermedad fúngica. El origen de este mal se halla muy por debajo de la superficie de esta fortaleza, antaño habitada por los enanos. Los enanos de Moria desean tan solo expulsar a los orcos y erradicar el mal de la Sala Decimosexta de su antiguo reino.","No mates a los obreros fúngicos","Sala Decimosexta - Sin hacer daño","El Descarriado ha sido derrotado","Derrota al Descarriado","El Descarriado se encuentra debajo de la Sala Decimosexta, al sureste de la Sala Vigesimoprimera.\
\
Se te ha desafiado a demostrar tu gran valía derrotando al Descarriado sin facilitar la pelea matando a los gredbyg invocados.","El enano Sigurd se encuentra en la Sala Vigesimoprimera, al noroeste de la Sala Decimosexta.\
\
A Sigurd le impresionará mucho saber que has superado su desafío de derrotar al Descarriado, a pesar de que los gredbyg no dejaron de acosarte.","Regresa con Sigurd en la Sala Vigesimoprimera","Uno de los obreros fúngicos ha muerto"}},
[11024]={nameES="Sala Decimosexta - Limpieza en los pasillos",objectivesES={"Regresa con Geirr en la Sala Vigesimoprimera","En la Sala Decimosexta, profanadores y otros orcos, ligados a algún poder oscuro, envenenan a los suyos con una enfermedad fúngica. El origen de este mal se halla muy por debajo de la superficie de esta fortaleza, antaño habitada por los enanos. Los enanos de Moria desean tan solo expulsar a los orcos y erradicar el mal de la Sala Decimosexta de su antiguo reino.","Sala Decimosexta - Limpieza en los pasillos","Los Globsnaga propagan su veneno en la Sala Decimosexta, al sureste de la Sala Vigesimoprimera de donde viniste.\
\
Se te ha pedido que mates a tantos Globsnaga como puedas para garantizar la seguridad de los enanos de Moria."}},
[11025]={nameES="Sala Decimosexta: La carne del Desviado",objectivesES={"En la Sala Decimosexta, profanadores y otros orcos, ligados a algún poder oscuro, envenenan a los suyos con una enfermedad fúngica. El origen de este mal se halla muy por debajo de la superficie de esta fortaleza, antaño habitada por los enanos. Los enanos de Moria desean tan solo expulsar a los orcos y erradicar el mal de la Sala Decimosexta de su antiguo reino.","Sala Decimosexta: La carne del Desviado","El Desviado se encuentra bajo la Sala Decimosexta, al sureste de la Sala Vigesimoprimera, donde se halla Eilíefr.\
\
Has sido desafiado a demostrar tu gran valía derrotando al Desviado y regresando con su piel como trofeo de tu victoria.","Devuelve la piel a Eilíefr en la Sala Vigesimoprimera"}},
[11026]={nameES="Skelstrand: Clattering Claws",objectivesES={}},
[11027]={nameES="Rozando la Superficie",objectivesES={"Fenton Marshley está preocupado por el reciente aumento en la población local de moscas de pantano.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Esta misión será cancelada si completas o te saltas 'Introducción: El Asalto en Archet'.</rgb>","Las moscas de pantano pueden encontrarse cerca del lago al este de Archet.\
\
Fenton Marshley te ha pedido que caces las moscas de pantano que plagan Archet.","Fenton Marshley está cerca de la Cabaña del Cazador, al este de Archet.\
\
Debes regresar con Fenton Marshley para recibir tu recompensa.","Rozando la Superficie","Habla con Fenton Marshley en la Cabaña del Cazador"}},
[11028]={nameES="Despellejando Bestias",objectivesES={"Piel de Huargo blanco recogida","Despellejando Bestias","Lleva las pieles de huargo a Odbjórn","Los huargos se encuentran en Urugarth, al oeste de Tármunn Súrsa. Odbjorn está en Tármunn Súrsa.\
\
Odbjórn necesita pieles de huargo para fabricar nuevas armaduras para la resistencia. Deberías llevar varias pieles, además de la piel del líder de los huargos, y entregárselas a Odbjórn.","Recoge piel de huargo blanco","Obtuviste algunas armas del Enemigo en Urugarth, que Throst el enano planea refundir para uso de los Montaraces."}},
[11029]={nameES="Omitir Introducción",objectivesES={"Si decides omitir la experiencia introductoria del tutorial, serás transportado a Archet después de que haya sido incendiado y no podrás viajar allí antes de esos eventos.\
