[11087]={nameES="Esclavos del Hielo",objectivesES={"Habla con Arre","Al caer el espectro, ves un extraño objeto plateado alrededor de su cuello....","Lleva la amuleto congelado a Arre","Derrota espectros en Kibilzahar (9/10)","Launo te ha contado que le ha llegado el rumor de que las antiguas ruinas enanas de Kibilzahar han sido infestadas por espíritus crueles.","Esclavos del Hielo","Recoge una amuleto congelado","Arre se encuentra en Kuru-leiri, al sureste de Kibilzahar.\
\
Deberías llevarle la amuleto congelada que encontraste en Kibilzahar. Quizá pueda contarte algo más sobre ella.","Arre se encuentra en el campamento de Kuru-leiri, en las regiones septentrionales del gran glaciar occidental.\
\
Launo te ha pedido que hables con Arre acerca de los espíritus crueles de los que informó.","Kibilzahar se encuentra en la ladera norte del glaciar, al noroeste de Kuru-leiri.\
\
Arre te ha pedido que explores las ruinas de Kibilzahar. Tal vez puedas resolver el misterio que se oculta tras la aparición de los espíritus crueles.","Has recogido un amuleto congelado","Kibilzahar se encuentra en la ladera norte del glaciar, al noroeste de Kuru-leiri.\
\
Mientras explorabas Kibilzahar, descubriste que algunos de los espectros que vagan por sus ruinas llevaban extrañas amuletos. Deberías conseguir uno de ellos para Arre."}},
[11088]={nameES="Slaves of the White Hand",objectivesES={"Assist Kai in Barnavon","Slaves of the White Hand","Assist Lhur in Barnavon","Gwilum is a member of the Dunlending resistance against the influence of Saruman the White upon the clans of Dunland and seeks to undermine that influence within Barnavon.","Kai, Lunwen, Lhur, and Eres may be found within Lower Barnavon.\
\
Gwilum has asked you to lend aid to the Boar-clan dwelling in Lower Barnavon.","Assist Lunwen in Barnavon","Talk to Gwilum in Barnavon","Assist Eres in Barnavon","Kai, Lhunwen, Lhur, and Eres can be found within Lower Barnavon.\
\
Gwilum has asked you to lend aid to some of the inhabitants of Barnavon."}},
[11089]={nameES="Slaves to the Conquered",objectivesES={"Slaves can be found on the Corsair ships moored by the West Seagate in Pelargir. These ships can be reached by using nearby rowing boats.\
\
Firiondur has asked you to rescue any slaves that still have not been found on the ships in the harbour of Pelargir.","Firiondur can be found inside the lighthouse at Aerthir.\
\
You have rescued several enslaved Gondorians and should now report your success to Firiondur.","Slaves to the Conquered","Talk to Firiondur inside the lighthouse at Aerthir","Although the Corsairs have been defeated by Aragorn and the Grey Host, many slaves still await their freedom from the emptied ships in Pelargir."}},
[11090]={nameES="Slaying Slavers",objectivesES={}},
[11091]={nameES="Slaying the Slicer",objectivesES={"Defeated Dulkoth the Slicer","Gráfar Splitstone waits to hear of your encounter with Dulkoth the Slicer.","Dulkoth the Slicer lurks somewhere in the tunnels in the north-eastern corner of the Pit of Stonejaws.","Gráfar Splitstone has warned you of a deadly foe lurking in the north-eastern corner of the Pit of Stonejaws.","Slaying the Slicer","Defeat Dulkoth the Slicer","Habla con Gráfar Partipiedra"}},
[11092]={nameES="Slighted Hand",objectivesES={"Speak with Tébakh","Thromur can be found in Amdân.\
\
Talk to Thromur.","Speak with Thromur once more","Thromur has been charged with looking after his Master's belongings, but a most important item has gone missing.","Slighted Hand","Zebena is in Amdân.\
\
Tébakh has asked you to speak with Zebena.","Speak with Zebena","Strázhek is in Amdân.\
\
Thromur has asked you to speak with Strázhek.","Talk to Strázhek","Tébakh is in Amdân.\
\
Strázhek has asked you to speak with Tébakh.","Talk to Thromur"}},
[11093]={nameES="Babosas viscosas",objectivesES={"You have slain many slugs in the marshy muck of Agarnaith. You are not sure if this accomplished anything besides making Viznak a little happier.","Completado.","Viznak has asked you to cull some of the slugs from the Agarnaith swamp. Apparently, they are competition for the food he likes.","Babosas viscosas","Slimy blood-slugs can be found in the wilds of Agarnaith.\
\
You should defeat slimy blood-slugs."}},
[11094]={nameES="Slippery Ship Pins",objectivesES={"Return to the wharf master","A portion of this rope is threadbare","A light touch makes this pin slip out of its post!","This pin looks secure and strong","This rope is frayed, and the slightest strain will shred it","Examine the fifth pin","Examine the first rope bundle","Examine the second rope bundle","This pile of rope looks sturdy and strong","Examine the third pin","Annúngil has asked you to inspect ropes and pins on the Rosigil.\
\
The Rosigil is moored in the Dol Amroth bay.","The threads on this pin have been filed smooth","Examine the second pin","Though Dol Amroth is no longer under siege, the wharf master has noticed odd happenings being reported on ships docked in the bay.","Examine the fourth pin","Examine the first pin","Slippery Ship Pins","Examine the sixth pin","This pin's threads have been stripped – no, filed down!","Examine the third rope bundle","You should let wharf master Annúngil know that you have examined many pins and piles of rope on the Rosigil.\
\
The wharf master is on a dock in the Dol Amroth bay."}},
[11095]={nameES="Slipping Through the Fingers of the White Hand",objectivesES={"The escaped Dunlending prisoner is at a camp of Ox-clan merchants outside of Isengard in Nan Curunír.\
\
Gwin asked you to speak with a Dunlending who escaped from the dungeons of Orthanc during your own flight from there with Baldgar, after the Falcon-clan's betrayal.","Talk to the escaped Dunlending prisoner in Nan Curunír","Slipping Through the Fingers of the White Hand","The hunter of the Avanc-lûth named Gwin, who brought you safely to Carreglyn through Wulf's Cleft, met you in Galtrev and asked you to seek out a Dunlending who escaped captivity from the dungeons of Orthanc."}},
[11096]={nameES="Slithering Too Near",objectivesES={}},
[11097]={nameES="Slithering Upland",objectivesES={"Guards can be found at the beacon Minlos in eastern Upper Lebennin.\
\
You have defeated many Haradrim scouts and should report to a guard at Minlos.","Slithering Upland","Haradrim scouts have been sighted near the beacon Minlos, which overlooks the river Erui in eastern Upper Lebennin.\
\
Lady Terenis has asked you to investigate the Haradrim presence near Minlos and defeat them.","Talk to a guard at Minlos","Concerned by the Haradrim forces stalking Upper Lebennin, Lady Terenis hopes to ensure the safety of Tumladen and Arnach."}},
[11098]={nameES="Slithering Upland, Again",objectivesES={"Defeat Sadúkh","Sadúkh defeated","The defender at Minlos beacon has asked you to defeat Corsairs at a camp west of the beacon, along the road.\
\
Follow the road west to find Sadúkh's camp.","Talk to the Minlos defender","The defender at Minlos beacon remembers you and has asked you to help fend off the remnant Corsairs in Upper Lebannin.","The defender at Minlos beacon should know that the road west to Tumladen is safe from Sadúkh's Corsairs.\
\
The defender can be found at Minlos beacon to the east.","Slithering Upland, Again"}},
[11099]={nameES="Slopes of Amon Hen",objectivesES={"Ramdir is concerned about the massive presence of Orcs on Amon Hen and wants you to scout the hilltop to see how many Orcs gather on Amon Lhaw.","You see distant fires and camps of the Orcs on Amon Lhaw: a great force gathers there","<rgb=#FF0000>Look</rgb> across the river at Amon Lhaw","Ramdir is at Hestil's camp near Parth Galen.\
\
You have seen evidence of a large massing of Orcs on Amon Lhaw and should report it to Ramdir.","Slopes of Amon Hen","The Seat of Seeing is located atop Amon Hen, east of Parth Galen.\
\
Ramdir has asked you to climb Amon Hen, defeating Orcs as you go, and to stand at the Seat of Seeing and <rgb=#FF0000>look</rgb> across the river.","Climb Amon Hen and stand at the Seat of Seeing","Talk to Ramdir"}},
[11100]={nameES="Slugs for the Slaughter",objectivesES={}},
[11101]={nameES="Pequeños comienzos",objectivesES={"Deberías ayudar a Cadi a cosechar semillas de los frutos de haya.","Cadi te ha pedido que recolectes frutos de haya cerca de Dientelupino, al noroeste de Herne.","Unas pocas semillas pueden ser el comienzo de algo nuevo.","Las semillas de haya se han cosechado.\
\
Deberías hablar con Cadi.","Habla con Cadi","Pequeños comienzos","Has recolectado varios frutos de haya para Cadi.\
\
Te espera en casa de Rendal en la esquina sudoeste de Herne."}},
[11102]={nameES="Smarter than Average",objectivesES={"Discover the láthbear den","Handling the láthbear with tactics and cunning has proven to be unsuccessful. Desperation calls for brute force as a response to a fearless foe.\
\
The láthbears' malevolent plans are unknown. They may be rallying a host to assail the farms while the riders of Faldham are preoccupied with the advances of the Orcs. Strike against them before they are ready for such an endeavour, and thin their numbers to prevent them from amassing such a force.","You have dealt a severe blow to the láthbear sloth that had risen as threat to the east of Faldham.","Handling the láthbear situation with tactics and cunning has proven to be unsuccessful. Desperation calls for the adoption of brute force as a final response to a foe.","The láthbears reside in a den in the valley east of Faldham.\
\
Strike against the láthbears while they are unaware of your interference and prevent them from amassing a large attacking force.","With their numbers hindered, any vengeful plots against the Rohirrim will be slow to develop. The people of Faldham have been afforded a reprieve from the danger of an imminent láthbear attack thanks to your actions.","Completado","The láthbears reside in the valley and den to the east of Faldham.\
\
The láthbears must be approached as an unavoidable threat. Attacking the creatures directly may be the only method of dealing with such a twisted foe.","Smarter than Average"}},
[11103]={nameES="Smaug's Remains",objectivesES={"Investigate the strange pile on the raft","In his defeat, Burudâur mentioned yet another scheme... in Lake-town!","This is a good place to <rgb=#FF0000>look</rgb> at the Bones of Smaug","You should investigate the strange pile on one of the rafts in Esgaroth-of-old.","Confront Burudâur","You should confront the leader of the excavation, who is located on a raft at the edge of Esgaroth-of-old.","Now, is there any talk here of Smaug's bones?","The unruly crowd can be found in Lake-town.\
\
You should find out why someone in the unruly crowd spoke the name of Smaug.","<rgb=#FF0000>Look</rgb> at the Bones of Smaug","Smaug's Remains","Travel to Lake-town","Lake-town can be found in the Dale-lands.\
\
You should look for anyone in Lake-town who is concerned with Smaug's bones.","You should travel to Lake-town, north of Esgaroth-of-old.","You should talk to Thorlind, who can be found just outside of Esgaroth-of-old.","You tell Thorlind of Burudâur's words and all you saw. He ponders deeply.\
\
'I see. It sounds as if there is some other scheme afoot, somewhere in Lake-town. There we have another piece of the puzzle, and yet I still cannot guess at the whole! Will you go to Lake-town and uncover what you may? I must report back to Felegoth without delay, and your swift action might prevent whatever harm is planned.'","Talk to Skerri","Talk to Thorlind","Thorlind has spotted a raft bearing a man who might be the leader of this strange plot, approaching Esgaroth.","It is a pile of... rust?","Smaug's bones are in the water, in Esgaroth-of-old.\
\
You should find a good vantage place to inspect Smaug's bones.","Smaug's bones remain unmoved","Among the shouts of an unruly mob, you catch the word 'Smaug'","Search for talk of Smaug's bones"}},
[11104]={nameES="Smiting Scorpions",objectivesES={}},
[11105]={nameES="Smiting the Smothercap",objectivesES={"Golodhril is located in Bazanmanar.\
\
You should tell Golodhril that you have removed many of the smothercap mushrooms.","Smothercap can be found in northern Clovengap.\
\
Golodhrim has asked you to destroy smothercap mushrooms.","A deadly fungus spews poisons on the banks of the Kurdushâlak.","Return to Golodhril","Smiting the Smothercap"}},
[11106]={nameES="Smoke In Their Eyes",objectivesES={"Talk to Klúso","Klúso will want to hear how well his plan to hide your movements is proceeding.","Klúso has a plan to deal with the towers near Shakhajât.","Large towers in front of Shakhajât will serve as fine targets for Klúso's smoke bombs.","Smoke In Their Eyes"}},
[11107]={nameES="Smoke and Ashes",objectivesES={"The place where Béortnoth recalled seeing the ashes and smoke lies to the west of Thornhope.\
\
Thane Béortnoth has asked you to investigate the cause of the smoke he saw.","Smoke and Ashes","Now that his mind is beginning to clear, Thane Béortnoth recalls seeing smoke and ashes in the air near the eaves of Fangorn when he was wandering back to Thornhope from the forest.","You have come upon a battlefield where the bodies of the Orcs were piled and burned. Here you found a mysterious old man","Investigate the smoke and ashes near the eaves of Fangorn"}},
[11108]={nameES="Smoke and Suspicions",objectivesES={}},
[11109]={nameES="Humo en el horizonte",objectivesES={"Comprueba qué ha sido de Ida en el campamento de provisiones","Humo en el horizonte","Lauri informó de que una de sus exploradoras, Ida, lleva desaparecida algún tiempo y de que recientemente se ha visto humo en el cielo cerca de una de las granjas lossoth, al oeste de Pynti-peldot.","El campamento de provisiones de Ida se encuentra al sur de Pynti-peldot, junto a la carretera y cerca de la entrada a los cañones de hielo.\
\
Lauri te ha pedido que investigues el campamento de provisiones de Ida y te asegures de que no esté herida."}},
[11110]={nameES="Humo sobre el agua",objectivesES={"Habla con Wal Simpkins en Rantost","Humo sobre el agua","Se pueden encontrar botes de remos por la costa de Rantost.\
\
Wal Simpkins te ha pedido que quemes los botes de remos alrededor de la isla.","Wal Simpkins está en un pequeño campamento en la esquina sureste de Rantost.\
\
Wal Simpkins se alegrará de saber que los botes de remos han sido quemados.","La isla de Rantost es donde los saqueadores de tumbas han establecido su campamento central. Allí se guarda gran parte de la historia."}},
[11111]={nameES="Estofado de oso ahumado",objectivesES={"Estofado de oso ahumado","Henbran tiene gustos y antojos bastante peculiares.","Regresa con Henbran","Has recogido todos los objetos que Henbran te pidió reunir para su receta de sopa.\
\
Deberías llevárselos en el Bosque Viejo.","Henbran te ha pedido que recojas carne de oso, quitina de araña y ramas de ucorno de las criaturas del Bosque Viejo.\
\
El Bosque Viejo está en el norte de Cardolan."}},
[11112]={nameES="Restos humeantes",objectivesES={"Vuelve a ver a Ruidhriel","Restos humeantes","Ruidhriel te ha pedido ayuda para disimular lo ocurrido en la Colina Quemada.","La madera carbonizada puede encontrarse en la Colina Quemada, al oeste de Ruidhriel.\
\
Ruidhriel te ha pedido que consigas madera carbonizada para estudiarla, con la esperanza de encontrar qué ocurrió allí."}},
[11113]={nameES="Smuggled Goods",objectivesES={"Talk to Dagrun","The Lake-town Smugglers are notorious for their black market trading. Dagrun has asked you to destroy any ill-gotten goods you find while inside the smugglers' hideout.","Smuggled goods can be found inside the smugglers' hideout in Lake-town.\
\
You should destroy smuggled goods.","Smuggled Goods","Dagrun can be found in the Trade Commission Headquarters.\
\
You should talk to Dagrun."}},
[11114]={nameES="Smuggler's Creed",objectivesES={"Rescued second kidnapped noble","Return to Khôltekh in Dâr Laja, the Hall of the Kindred.","Khôltekh has asked you to go to Deshûkh, the Blood Market, to rescue a group of kidnapped Umbari nobles.","Rescue third kidnapped noble","Talk to the Temámir Guard Captain Nûru in Mekab-kuphâr, in southern Khabârkhad","Rescued first kidnapped noble","Rescued third kidnapped noble","Nuru has told you that the Blood Market is located south-west of here, in Dil-irmíz, the Berths.","Rescue second kidnapped noble","Return to Khôltekh in the Hall of the Kindred","Khôltekh has asked you to go to Deshûkh, the Blood Market, to rescue a group of kidnapped Umbari nobles. First you must go see the Guard Captain Nûru in Mekab-kuphâr, the Temámir guard outpost in Khabârkhad.","Rescue first kidnapped noble","Smuggler's Creed"}},
[11115]={nameES="Snakes in the Trap",objectivesES={"The captain of the Rangers in Aelin Veren can be found amongst his kin, guarding a group of Haradrim prisoners.\
\
You have discovered a group of Rangers holding four Haradrim captive at Aelin Veren. You should investigate and see if your aid is needed.","Talk to the captain of the Rangers at Aelin Veren","After a party of Haradrim surrendered to their forces at Aelin Veren, the Rangers of Ithilien must weigh what is to be done.","As you journey through North Ithilien, you come upon a curious sight: a group of Rangers of Ithilien holding four Haradrim as prisoners.\
\
The Rangers of Ithilien have never been known to take prisoners, so perhaps there is a reason that this party of Haradrim has been spared.\
\
You should find the captain of the Rangers at Aelin Veren and speak to him about the Haradrim.","Snakes in the Trap","The captain can be found somewhere among the Rangers at Aelin Veren, in central North Ithilien.\
\
You have arrived at Aelin Veren and have heard the voices of Rangers and Southrons nearby. You should investigate and see if you can aid the Rangers."}},
[11116]={nameES="Sopa de tortuga mordedora",objectivesES={"Las tortugas mordedoras se encuentran en las islas y a lo largo de la orilla de Nen Harn, al este de la granja Hengstacer. Emma Rosaspina está en la granja Hengstacer, al oeste de Nen Harn.\
\
Emma Rosaspina te pidió que le llevaras algunos caparazones y carne de tortuga mordedora para su sopa.","Emma Rosaspina te ha pedido ayuda para cazar tortugas mordedoras por sus caparazones y carne para su famosa sopa.","Lleva los caparazones y la carne a Emma Rosaspina","Sopa de tortuga mordedora"}},
[11117]={nameES="Snappers in the Shallows",objectivesES={}},
[11118]={nameES="Sneaking Stones",objectivesES={"Someone has been mixing inferior blocks into the piles of fine stone the dwarves have brought from their mines.","Sneaking Stones","You should let Dingási know that you have pulverized many blocks of shoddy stone.\
\
Dingási is in the Harlond.","Dingási has asked you to find and destroy the yellowed blocks that have been snuck into piles of superior stone across the Harlond.","Return to Dingási"}},
[11119]={nameES="Sniff Them Out",objectivesES={"Find the second hidden Orc scout in the stable ruins","Find the third hidden Orc scout in the noble's house ruins","Find the first hidden Orc scout in the stable ruins","Hidden Orc scouts can be found in the inn ruins.\
\
Venture into the ruins in Noman-lands with Faroth and find hidden Orc scouts.","Hidden Orc scouts can be found in the store house ruins.\
\
Venture into the ruins in Noman-lands with Faroth and find hidden Orc scouts.","The hidden Orc scout attacks!","Mablung has asked you to venture into the Noman-lands ruins with Faroth and search for hidden Orc scouts. Defeat as many as you can.","Sniff Them Out","Find the second hidden Orc scout in the farm house ruins","Find the first hidden Orc scout in the store house ruins","Find the first hidden Orc scout in the farm house ruins","Find the third hidden Orc scout in the farm house ruins","Hidden Orc scouts can be found in the merchant's shop ruins.\
\
Venture into the ruins in Noman-lands with Faroth and find hidden Orc scouts.","The Hidden Orc Scout Attacks!","Find the first hidden Orc scout in the merchant's shop ruins","Find the second hidden Orc scout in the noble's house ruins","Find the second hidden Orc scout in the store house ruins","Return to Mablung","Find the second hidden Orc scout in the merchant's shop ruins","Mablung can be found at the Camp of the Host, on the northern edge of North Ithilien.\
\
You should return to Mablung.","Find the first hidden Orc scout in the noble's house ruins","Find the first hidden Orc scout in the inn ruins","Hidden Orc scouts can be found in the farm house ruins.\
\
Venture into the ruins in Noman-lands with Faroth and find hidden Orc scouts.","Hidden Orc scouts can be found in the noble's house ruins.\
\
Venture into the ruins in Noman-lands with Faroth and find hidden Orc scouts.","Hidden Orc Scouts can be found in the stable ruins.\
\
Venture into the ruins in Noman-lands with Faroth and find hidden Orc scouts.","Find the second hidden Orc scout in the inn ruins","Find the third hidden Orc scout in the store house ruins"}},
[11120]={nameES="Sniffing Out a Rat",objectivesES={"There is nothing of interest in this container","Sniffing Out a Rat","This container has some herbs that could be used to create a poison","Search for whatever contained the ingested substance","You found a dead rat in the cellar of the tower. Some foam around the mouth indicates that it may have died of unnatural causes. You should search for whatever may have caused dead rats to appear in a tower occupied by healthy men.","Search for possible ingredients of the ingested substance","Whatever caused the rat to die can be found somewhere in the tower.\
\
You should search for whatever the rat ingested that would have caused it to die.","A glass on this shelf has a green foam in the bottom","The rat's body is contorted as if it died in pain, but there are no obvious signs of external damage. A green foam around its mouth seems suspicious. You should search for signs of what the rat may have ingested to cause its death.","None of these glasses stand out to you"}},
[11121]={nameES="Sniffing for Truffles",objectivesES={}},
[11122]={nameES="Nieve para un Yule Blanco",objectivesES={"Glói quiere compartir el espíritu de Yule con los Hombres de Bree llevándoles algo de nieve desde las montañas de Ered Luin.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando finalice el festival actual.</rgb>","Lleva los montones de nieve a Glói","Nieve para un Yule Blanco","Los montones de nieve se encuentran al oeste del Patio de Frerin, al sur de las puertas de la Mansión de Thorin.\
\
Glói te ha pedido que reúnas nieve de varios montones fuera de la Mansión de Thorin.","Glói se encuentra dentro de la Mansión de Thorin.\
\
Glói estará ansioso por llenar su carro con la nieve que has reunido."}},
[11123]={nameES="Ceguera por nieve",objectivesES={"The refugees from Byre Tor holed up in the Balewood are fearful of the Orcs invading the forest, but also of the threat of freezing.","The Orcs appear to be transporting felled trees north along the road","Scout the roadway for sign of an Orc-leader","Ceguera por nieve","Húna can be found in the hidden cave in southern Balewood.\
\
You have scouted the path along the eastern border of the Orc roadway and destroyed a substantial number of torches. You should return to Húna and inform him of what you have seen.","Wood-trolls besiege the roadway, delaying the Orcs","You have found no sign of the Orc-leader, but the largest among the force seem to know of him","Talk to Húna","Húna has asked that you scout the eastern edge of the Orc roadway through the Balewood and steal torches from their keeping.","Search the roadway for any foes the Orcs face","Search the roadway for signs of the Orcs' plans"}},
[11124]={nameES="Snuff out the Flame",objectivesES={}},
[11125]={nameES="Snuffing Them Out",objectivesES={"Mordor Firestarters have begun to set North Ithilien's revitalized flora aflame. Slay them before they burn the entirety of North Ithilien!","Thurindol can be found in Henneth Annûn.\
\
You have defeated many of the encroaching Mordor Firestarters. You should speak to Thurindol with news of your success.","Mordor Firestarters can be found in the wilds of Ithilien, south of Cair Andros. \
\
You should defeat Mordor Firestarters.","Snuffing Them Out","Talk to  Thurindol"}},
[11126]={nameES="So Shall We Cleanse",objectivesES={"So Shall We Cleanse","Submerge the artifact in the courtyard fountain","The artifact must soak for some time","Jâbex can be found in the cross-roads of Umbar-môkh.\
\
Jâbex will doubtlessly be relieved to have the artifact back in his possession.","Douse the artifact in water, ensuring its curious mechanisms are thoroughly cleansed of all power.","Jâbex, a former cultist of the All-Seeing Eye, has asked you to search for a mysterious artifact the cult is using to threaten his peaceful life as a free man.","Search the cultists' coffer in their camp in the centre of Tâkhdar","Jâbex is waiting by in the cross-roads of Tâkhdar","The artifact sparks, fizzles, and dies with a sound like an apple being cored","Jâbex is waiting in the south-western side of Tâkhdar, at the cross-roads.\
\
Jâbex will be pleased to learn he is finally free of the artifact's hold.","The artifact emits an unpleasant aura, like it is somehow aware of your every breath","Return to Jâbex with news of the artifact","Jâbex's artifact lies within the cultists' coffer at their camp somewhere near the centre of Tâkhdar.","Defeat cultists guarding the mysterious artifact throughout Tâkhdar, the Cellars of Umbar.","The fountain can be found in the cross-roads on the western side of Tâkhdar.\
\
Jâbex has asked you to negate the artifact's power and end its hold on him by submerging it in a fountain inside the cross-roads courtyard.","This must be the fountain Jâbex mentioned"}},
[11127]={nameES="Sold Out",objectivesES={"Patrol further along the road to the Stonedeans","Béored's stock has been snatched up by a wealthy Rohirrim in the Stonedeans, but fears for its passage as the road west is fraught with danger.","The road to the Stonedeans can be found at the western edge of Middlemead in northern Kingstead.\
\
You have begun your patrol of the road, but have yet to encounter a cart. You should continue your patrol.","Search the ruined cart","You have discovered a broken fence and marks of a cart barrelling off the road","Patrol the road west out of Middlemead","The stock can be found inside or nearby the ruined cart along the road west from Middlemead.\
\
You have discovered the cart's stock largely intact, and should recover it for Béored.","Béored can be found at the traders' pavillion in central Middlemead.\
\
You have recovered what you could of Béored's stock, and prevented the Dunlendings from stealing more of his goods. You should now return to Béored.","Blade marks line the barrel, hinting the weapons are now in other hands","Sold Out","The road to the Stonedeans can be found at the western edge of Middlemead in northern Kingstead.\
\
Béored has asked you to investigate the progress of his shipment. You should patrol the road west of Middlemead in pursuit of the cart.","The ruined cart can be found off the north side of the road to the Stonedeans from Middlemead.\
\
You have encountered a damaged fence and marks of a cart rumbling off the roadway. You should now approach the cart.","You see no sign of the cart and should continue your patrol","Talk to Béored","The empty barrel can be found near the wrecked cart off the road west of Middlemead.\
\
You have recovered what you could of the stock. You should now examine the empty barrel to discern its contents and their whereabouts.","Examine the empty barrel at the wrecked cart","You discover the majority of the stock intact but one barrel is curiously empty"}},
[11128]={nameES="Únicos supervivientes",objectivesES={"Muchos enanos fueron enviados a las Profundidades Llameantes para expulsar a los orcos invasores de los salones, pero la llegada de refuerzos enemigos inesperados les supuso problemas.","A lo lejos se pueden oír débiles sonidos de batalla en Hadâd-mezer","Hadâd-mezer se encuentra al sureste de Anazârmekhem en las Profundidades Llameantes, o al noroeste del campamento de Bensi.\
\
Debes seguir los sonidos de batalla y buscar supervivientes en Hadâd-mezer.","Los sonidos de batalla se intensifican a medida que te aproximas a Hadâd-mezer.","Mientras examinas a este enano caído en busca de señales de vida, notas en su mano un pergamino a medio escribir.\
\
Lamentablemente, ningún enano sobrevivió a este ataque, pero el pergamino debe ser investigado, pues seguramente era importante para este pobre enano.","Únicos supervivientes","Una voz grita mientras los sonidos de batalla cesan abruptamente...","Sigue los sonidos de batalla hasta Hadâd-mezer","Has llegado a Hadâd-mezer, debes buscar señales de supervivientes."}},
[11129]={nameES="Instancia Individual: Paso Rojo",objectivesES={"Habla con Radagast para ver si hay algo más que desee que hagas.\
\
Radagast ha expulsado al Señor Demacrado Ivar de Agamaur y ha detenido sus nefastos planes... por ahora.","Instancia Individual: Paso Rojo","El trono de Neven se encuentra más al norte, dentro de las ruinas.\
\
Neven ejerce cierta influencia sobre el capitán de las sombras, Dannasen. Quizá si hablas con él puedas hallar un modo de alterar las órdenes de Dannasen.","Las ruinas del antiguo reino de Rhudaur, retorcidas por el tiempo y el contacto de un mal oscuro, se alzan ante ti. Junto a Radagast el Pardo, debes encontrar a Elsa y Eriac y ayudarlos contra el Señor Demacrado, Ivar Manosangrienta, y sus súbditos no muertos.","La puerta hacia Garth Agarwen se encuentra al norte.\
\
Elsa te ha enviado a buscar a Ivar en Garth Agarwen y ponerle fin.","El líder de las sombras reside en el campamento Eglain aparentemente abandonado.\
\
La derrota de Raizamarga ha abierto el camino hacia las ruinas occidentales, donde moran las sombras de las que habló Radagast. Radagast te ha pedido que parlamentes con Dannasen, su líder, para obtener su ayuda.","Habla con Elsa para saber más sobre sus batallas en Agamaur.\
\
Gracias a Dannasen y a sus hombres, se abrió el camino hacia el oeste en Agamaur, y pudiste llegar hasta Elsa y Eriac.","Sigue a Radagast más profundamente en Agamaur.","Habla con Radagast","Has viajado con Radagast hacia el pantano corrompido de Agamaur. Ayúdalo mientras se dirige al campamento Eglain al oeste.","Dannasen permanece en el campamento Eglain, al sur del trono de Neven.\
\
Neven, el comandante de las sombras, era en realidad un tumulario invocado por Ivar para contenerlas. Con su destrucción, es posible que Dannasen esté ahora dispuesto a ayudarte.","Sigue a Radagast mientras se adentra más profundamente en Agamaur.\
\
Dannasen, renovado, llamó a sus hombres a la batalla y abrió el camino hacia el oeste. Puede que ahora puedas alcanzar a Elsa y Eriac.","Habla con Dannasen"}},
[11130]={nameES="Una seguridad relativa",objectivesES={"El agua de las Obras Hidráulicas se encuentra al oeste de la Bodega Putrefacta.\
\
Sylfa te dijo que tomaras la banda de tela blanca que te dio y la sumergieras en el agua de las Obras Hidráulicas.","Sylfa está en la Bodega Putrefacta, al este de las Obras Hidráulicas.\
\
Has sumergido la banda de tela blanca en el agua y se ha vuelto verde. Deberías llevarla a Sylfa sin demora.","Usa la banda de tela blanca para probar el agua","Sylfa quiere conocer el alcance y la extensión de la propagación de este parásito fúngico. Teme que el agua sea la causa de un extraño hongo que se está extendiendo por las Obras Hidráulicas.","Una seguridad relativa","Parece un buen lugar para usar la banda de tela blanca","La banda de tela blanca se vuelve verde a medida que el agua la empapa","Encuentra un buen lugar para probar el agua","Lleva la banda de tela verde empapada a Sylfa, en la Bodega Putrefacta","Te doy la bienvenida a la Bodega Putrefacta, pero no te acomodes demasiado. Un extraño hongo se está propagando por estas profundidades, y amenaza el éxito de la expedición. No estamos seguros de dónde vino, pero tengo una sospecha. Creo que el hongo se está propagando a través del agua. Debemos saber de dónde viene este crecimiento.\
\
'Toma esta banda de tela y sumérgela en las aguas de abajo. Si cambia de color, entonces las cosas están realmente mal.\
\
'Regresa a mí con los resultados.'"}},
[11131]={nameES="El Hacha de otro",objectivesES={"Encuentra al desafortunado dueño del hacha que encontraste","Huel el Leñador está esperando justo dentro de la entrada sur de Tharbad noticias del dueño del hacha.","Manchas de sangre tiñen la tierra aquí, y las huellas llevan hacia el suroeste","Vuelve a donde encontraste el hacha en el suroeste de Tharbad","La tierra está pisoteada hacia el suroeste. ¿Quizás el dueño del hacha fue por allí?","La tierra está pisoteada hacia el suroeste.","Busca hacia el suroeste al dueño desaparecido del hacha","Habla con Huel el Leñador justo dentro de la entrada sur de Tharbad","Huel el Leñador te pidió que volvieras a donde encontraste el hacha, en el suroeste de Tharbad, y que vieras si puedes encontrar y ayudar a su dueño desaparecido.","El dueño del hacha se topó con los orcos en Tharbad y pereció","El Hacha de otro"}},
[11132]={nameES="Alguien digno",objectivesES={"Alguien digno","Después de permitir que Starkath le quitara el arco, Celairant ahora está convencido de que no es digno del arma élfica.","Penglir está en Duillond, al sureste de Gondamon.\
\
Celairant te pidió que regreses con Penglir en Duillond y le expliques por qué se siente indigno de portar el arco, habiéndolo perdido ya una vez frente al enano bandido Starkath."}},
[11133]={nameES="Something Blue",objectivesES={}},
[11134]={nameES="Something Fishy",objectivesES={}},
[11135]={nameES="Something Floral",objectivesES={}},
[11136]={nameES="Something Foul",objectivesES={"Something Foul","You should return to Echad Naeglanc","Investigate Plas-maru","Naeglanc is at Echad Naeglanc in the Bonevales.\
\
You should speak with Naeglanc when you are ready to leave for Plas-maru.","Plas-maru appears to be a focus for the evil spreading across the Bonevales.","Speak to Naeglanc in Echad Naeglanc.","Speak to Naeglanc in Echad Naeglanc"}},
[11137]={nameES="Something Left Behind",objectivesES={"Rodwen listens as you describe the boat you found hidden away from the shore.\
\
'Yes, we found that boat. Someone went to some trouble to hide it. Isteron said he has never seen a boat like that, but he thinks it must have come from the land of the Elves, up-river. I have no reason to doubt it: it seems like the sort of boat Elves would make.\
\
'Another curiosity: these Elves went to the trouble of hiding their boat, and then must have set off on foot. But they left many of their supplies behind: food, tools, garments, medicines. Why did they leave these items behind? What could compel them to leave such useful items behind? And where did they go?'","Someone nearby may know something about the boat hidden away from the shore near Parth Galen.","You have found a boat of Elf-make hidden behind a boulder away from the shore.","Find someone near the hidden boat who may know something about it","Something Left Behind","You have found an Elf-made boat from Lothlórien hidden behind a large stone away from the shore. Several packs containing supplies and other small items rest in the bottom of the boat.\
\
It is clear from the distance to the shore that someone carried the boat here to hide it from watchful eyes. Several of the packs in the bottom of the boat seem to have been rifled recently. If you can find whoever did it, he or she may be able to shed some light on how the boat came to be hidden there."}},
[11138]={nameES="Something Misplaced, Something Blue",objectivesES={"During Midsummer, many revellers gather in the Blue Theatre of Minas Tirith to attend plays and musical performances.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This quest will be removed from your quest log when the current festival ends.</rgb>","Talk to Duillam","Duillam can be found in the Blue Theatre in Minas Tirith (Midsummer).\
\
You have done your best to direct the members of the Cloudyheads to the stage of the Blue Theatre. You should talk to Duillam.","The members of the Cloudyheads can be found throughout the Blue Theatre in Minas Tirith (Midsummer).\
\
Duillam has asked you to find and direct the members of the Cloudyheads to the stage in the Blue Theatre.","Something Misplaced, Something Blue"}},
[11139]={nameES="Something Moves Down There...",objectivesES={}},
[11140]={nameES="Something Rotten",objectivesES={}},
[11141]={nameES="Something Spoils The Fish",objectivesES={"Bring the stolen fish-hooks to Bôdo in the village of Khûtra","The box is mostly empty, but a few unpleasant fish-hooks like the first one remain inside","You found the box Bôdo described among the hills north-west of Khûtra, and should now search it for some clue to its purpose.","Rukân is east of the Mâkhda Khorbo, north-west of Umbar Baharbêl.","Talk to Bôdo in the village of Khûtra","Talk to Rukân east of the Mâkhda Khorbo, north-west of Umbar Baharbêl","Goblins or their Corsair allies must have taken away the contents of the box. You should recover as many of the cruel fish-hooks as you can.","Rukân is waiting for you to return from the shore with anything you might have discovered about the dead fish.","Bring the dead fish and the unpleasant fish-hook to Rukân south-east of the Mâkhda Khorbo","Rukân asked you to inspect the dead fish that have washed up on the shore to the south-west.","Bôdo told you he saw a box with similar decorations to the unpleasant fish-hook among the hills to the north-west of Khûtra.","Something Spoils The Fish","Search the box of unpleasant design among the hills north-west of Khûtra","The fisherman Bôdo in the village of Khûtra may know something about the unpleasant fish-hook you found.","Rukân is concerned about a new spate of dead fish washing up on the nearby shore.","Find the box of unpleasant design among the hills to the north-west of Khûtra","Bôdo will be glad to have the fish-hooks out of the hands of the goblins and their corsair allies, even if it means he must now dispose of the unpleasant artifacts.","You retrieve a hook of unpleasant design from the mouth of this dead fish","Retrieve dead fish from the shore to the south-west (3/4)","The grass near the unpleasant box has been trampled by goblins"}},
[11142]={nameES="Algo Malvado",objectivesES={"En las regiones más profundas de Moria, hay criaturas extrañas y aterradoras. Veúlfur envió a un grupo de sus mejores agentes al Refugio Sombrío para reunirse con los Elfos allí y investigar los rumores sobre la oscuridad profunda.","Devuelve el barril a Veúlfur en la Sala Vigesimoprimera","Algo Malvado"}},
[11143]={nameES="Algo Malvado",objectivesES={"Langhár is in a small glade north of the path in Eryn Lasgalen.\
\
You should talk to Langhár.","You have found Langhár alone in a glade north of the path.\
\
You should talk to Langhár.","Langhár is being ambushed by wood-trolls!\
\
You should defeat the wood-trolls!","Find the Beornings","After finding evidence that Glenneth was attacked, you and Thorlind separated. You must continue alone to find the lost Beornings before the same fate befalls them!","Langhár stands alone in this glade","The Beorning prints continue in this direction","The Beornings are lost somewhere in Eryn Lasgalen, north of the path.\
\
You should find the Beornings.","Algo Malvado","Habla con Langhár"}},
[11144]={nameES="Un objeto imposible de encontrar",objectivesES={"Lleva el anillo brillante a Narthan","Antes del comienzo de la Tercera Edad, los reinos de Rhudaur, Arthedain y Cardolan se encontraban enfrentados en el cruce de las Tierras Solitarias. Cuando la corrupción llegó a Rhudaur, algunas personas fueron consideradas responsables de la profanación de la tierra, y llevan mucho tiempo esperando la oportunidad de redimirse.","El anillo de Narthan debe estar en manos de uno de los tumularios que merodean al oeste de Ost Haer.\
\
Narthan te habló de su difunta esposa y del anillo que llevaba en su memoria. Te pidió que se lo recuperarás.","Un objeto imposible de encontrar"}},
[11145]={nameES="Something in the Shadows",objectivesES={"Something in the Shadows","Cuilion can be found at Taen Orwath.\
\
One of the Rangers at Taen Orwath appears to have been awaiting your arrival. You should talk to Cuilion.","Talk to Cuilion","The Rangers have begun to investigate Falch Gurth, a newly-discovered pass which purportedly leads to Thuringwath, the Valley of Secret Shadow.","Travel to Taen Orwath","Seemingly awaiting your arrival, Cuilion beckons you over","Taen Orwath can be found in the southern eastern hills of Rath Dúath.\
\
Candúr has asked you to travel to Taen Orwath and aid the Rangers of Ithilien preparing to venture into Thuringwath."}},
[11146]={nameES="Algo en el agua",objectivesES={"El agua burbujea y brilla por un momento antes de que regresen la oscuridad y las tinieblas","Este es el estanque bajo la Arboleda Maldita","Remmenylf está en las Agujas de la Linde, al noreste de la Arboleda Maldita. Remmenylf se consternará al saber que las lágrimas de Ent no purificaron las aguas.","La Arboleda Maldita tiene un estanque de agua debajo que alimenta las raíces de los árboles y a los trolls silvanos que hay allí.","La Arboleda Maldita está al suroeste de las Agujas de la Linde. Remmenylf te pidió que fueses a la Arboleda Maldita y virtieses la lágrima de Ent en el estanque que hay debajo.","Vierte el vial en el agua","Llega al estanque bajo la Arboleda Maldita","Habla con Remmenylf en las Agujas de la Linde","Algo en el agua"}},
[11147]={nameES="Son of a Merchant Man",objectivesES={"Andras has told you about his homestead in the north-west of the Starkmoor.","Andras' homestead is in the north-west of the Starkmoor.\
\
Andras asked you go to his homestead and give the ledger to his son.","Talk to Andras' son at his farmstead","Son of a Merchant Man"}},
[11148]={nameES="El canto del descanso",objectivesES={"El aullido siniestro te da escalofríos","Busca hacia el este","Después de encontrar un cadáver corrompido, pudiste disipar la voz maligna en el aire con una canción alegre. Deberías continuar hacia el este y buscar en las criptas cualquier otra cosa notable.","Los susurros inquietantes llenan tu corazón de temor","Los Temamir de Jiret-menêsh quieren saber qué ha causado que los muertos se levanten en las criptas de Gadim-ûn.","Has encontrado un cadáver corrompido rodeado de un resplandor verde y el sonido de una voz atormentada. Tal vez deberías cantar una canción alegre para ti mismo para alejar esos siniestros susurros.","El canto del descanso","Tu canción ha disipado la corrupción","Calma a los muertos angustiados","Los susurros fantasmales te revuelven el estómago","Busca otra pista más al este","Has descubierto un tercer cadáver corrompido. Deberías cantar una canción alegre para ti mismo para alejar esos siniestros susurros, como hiciste las veces anteriores.","Busca otra pista hacia el oeste","Has llegado a las criptas de Gadim-ûn para buscar una señal de lo que pudo haber causado que los muertos se levantaran en An Shêru. Deberías comenzar buscando hacia el este.","Después de encontrar dos cadáveres corrompidos, pudiste disipar la voz maligna en el aire con una canción alegre. Deberías viajar hacia el sur y continuar buscando en las criptas.","Busca otra señal hacia el sur","Los lamentos de agonía te aprietan el pecho de ansiedad","Has encontrado otro cadáver corrompido. Deberías cantar una canción alegre para ti mismo para alejar esos siniestros susurros, como hiciste la última vez.","Ahora has encontrado tres cadáveres corrompidos, cada uno rodeado de un resplandor verde y el sonido de una voz atormentada. Cada vez, pudiste disipar la voz maligna con una canción alegre. Deberías viajar hacia el oeste y continuar buscando en las criptas."}},
[11149]={nameES="Canción del Corazón Esperanzado",objectivesES={"Habla con Erling y hazle saber que Pada le envía sus saludos.","Erling está encantado con tu canción","Toca una canción para Erling Buenavista en Bree","Pada está en las Fundaciones de Piedra, en Moria.\
\
Debes regresar con Pada y decirle que su amigo Erling Buenavista quedó muy complacido con la canción que interpretaste.","Habla con Erling Buenavista","Erling Buenamigo se encuentra en la calle principal, frente al Poney Pisador.\
\
Pada, un Juglar muy respetado, te ha pedido que alegres a un amigo suyo de Bree usando el gran instrumento que recuperaste recientemente.","Regresa con Pada","Canción del Corazón Esperanzado","Ahora que has recuperado el instrumento, Pada te ha pedido viajar a Bree y usarlo para alegrar el ánimo de algunos de los vecinos del lugar."}},
[11150]={nameES="Canciones para los retoños",objectivesES={"Orthir se encuentra a corta distancia al oeste de Cerin Amroth, junto al camino.\
\
Mallendathor quiere que hables con Orthir, el Erudito de los Árboles, para ver si sabe cómo curar la dolencia de los retoños.","Canciones para los retoños","La corteza de este retoño parece muy quebradiza","<rgb=#FF0000>Canta</rgb> a un retoño de malbrethil (2/4)","Habla con Sendiel en Gelirdor","<rgb=#FF0000>Canta</rgb> a un retoño de malbrethil (0/4)","El tronco de este retoño parece más sano","Este retoño parece demasiado delicado","Sendiel se encuentra en Gelirdor, al suroeste de los árboles de malbrethil, al este de Cerin Amroth.\
\
Orthir te ha indicado que informes a Sendiel de tu éxito.","Los retoños de malbrethil se encuentran alrededor de Cerin Brethil en Taur Hith, al noreste de Cerin Amroth.\
\
Orthir cree que los retoños, privados de la música cotidiana del bosque ahora más silencioso, podrían revivir si les cantas.","Habla con Orthir","Mallendathor no tenía información que compartir sobre la dolencia de los retoños.","<rgb=#FF0000>Canta</rgb> a un retoño de malbrethil (3/4)","Las ramas de este retoño parecen algo más firmes","Las hojas de este retoño parecen desgarradas en los bordes","Este retoño parece algo menos deteriorado","<rgb=#FF0000>Canta</rgb> a un retoño de malbrethil (1/4)","Las ramas de este retoño están claramente caídas","Este retoño ahora parece más robusto"}},
[11151]={nameES="Sons of Pelargir",objectivesES={"After learning of a great battle in Pelargir, Nimithil grows concerned for her husband, Faltharan, who remained behind in the city to challenge the Corsairs.","Talk to Faltharan in Pelargir","Sons of Pelargir","Faltharan can be found somewhere in Pelargir.\
\
Nimithil has grown concerned for her husband after hearing news of a great battle in Pelargir. You should seek out Faltharan."}},
[11152]={nameES="Sons of the Usurper",objectivesES={"Erchar can be found in Linhir in eastern Dor-en-Ernil.\
\
Jajax has asked you to rally Garvir's brothers to Hata Kebir so they may seek vengeance against Azgarzôr.","Seeking to put an end to the reign of the Heirs of Castamir, Jajax prepares himself for an uneasy and hopefully brief alliance with Garvir's brothers.","Nimithil can be found in Ost Anglebed.\
\
After dispatching Azgarzôr, Erchar and Herion suggested you return to the people of Lebennin. You should speak to Nimithil.","Talk to Nimithil","DNT -- will not be seen","Sons of the Usurper","Talk to Erchar"}},
[11153]={nameES="Soothing the Herd",objectivesES={"Give salve to Biscuit","Lurâkha, a rancher in Sormedân, asked if you would be willing to help care for the ailing cattle in the fields east of Sormedân.","Give salve to Bela","Give salve to Bailey","Give the salve to injured cattle in Sormedân.","Bela is strangely calm, as though she knows a secret she is unwilling to tell","Return to Lurâkha in Sormedân","Blossom narrows her eyes, then gives you a look of stern approval","Biscuit moos happily, enjoying the sunshine","Butters moos in appreciation, then goes back to sleep","Bailey looks at you distrustfully, as though you have wronged him previously","Speak with Elder Jurmêna to obtain the salve","Speak with Elder Jurmêna to obtain the salve for injured cattle.","Give salve to Butters","Return to Lurâkha in Sormedân with news of the effects of the salve on her cattle.","Give salve to Blossom","Soothing the Herd"}},
[11154]={nameES="Sorcerers in the Tower",objectivesES={"Candúr believes there are Black Númenórean sorcerers gathering within the Towers of the Teeth.","Return to Candúr","Black Númenórean sorcerers can be found within the Towers of the Teeth.\
\
You should defeat Black Númenórean sorcerers.","Sorcerers in the Tower","You should return to Candúr, who can be found at a small Ranger outpost hidden in the Slag-hills."}},
[11155]={nameES="Sorcerers of Rhûd Vorn",objectivesES={"Defeat Easterling Sorcerers in Rhûd Vorn.","The Sorcerers in Rhûd Vorn are a corrupting and malign force, dangerous to the Easterlings and Gondor alike.","Sorcerers of Rhûd Vorn","Defeated Easterling Sorcerers in Rhûd Vorn.","Completado","You defeated a number of sorcerers in Rhûd Vorn, ridding a corrupting and perilous threat from the Easterlings and from Gondor alike.","Though the Easterling Men may step back from their alliance with Evil, now that the influence of Sauron has been dispelled, their Sorcerers among them remain deadly and zealous in dark dealings. Those within Rhûd Vorn therefore pose a threat within and without."}},
[11156]={nameES="Hechiceros del Lobo",objectivesES={"Los ritualistas gauradan pueden encontrarse en Echad Gauradan, al sur de Echad Candelleth.\
\
Debes derrotar a los ritualistas gauradan y eliminar la amenaza que representan para quienes habitan en Tâl Bruinen.","Mientras buscabas en las ruinas de Echad Gauradan a Tim Rastrojal y sus figurines robados, descubriste que entre ellos hay ritualistas poseídos de cierto poder hechicero.","Debes derrotar a los ritualistas gauradan y eliminar la amenaza que representan para quienes habitan en Tâl Bruinen","DNT -- will not be seen","Hechiceros del Lobo","Completado","Has derrotado a los ritualistas gauradan y eliminado la amenaza que representaban para quienes habitan en Tâl Bruinen.","Derrota ritualistas gauradan","Los ritualistas gauradan pueden encontrarse en Echad Gauradan, al sur de Echad Candelleth.\
\
Mientras buscabas en las ruinas de Echad Gauradan a Tim Rastrojal y sus figurines robados, descubriste que había ritualistas entre ellos poseedores de un poder hechicero. Debes derrotar a estos malvados hechiceros y eliminar la amenaza que representan para quienes habitan en Tâl Bruinen."}},
[11157]={nameES="Sorceresses of the Black Tower",objectivesES={"Brúnfair, recently dispatched to the north, brings ill tidings and carries a heavy concern on his careworn shoulders. Recent events within the black citadel of Barad Gúlaran have forced him into action.\
\
He has requested that you gather assistance from your fellows in seeking the destruction of a cabal of sorceresses who are attempting to see Amarthiel's will carried forth.","Find the three Sorceresses within Barad Gúlaran and defeat them. If they are stopped, then there will be no others to carry out the will of Amarthiel.\
\
Brúnfair asked you to search through the halls of Barad Gúlaran in search of the sorceresses left in charge of carrying out Amarthiel's will. Find them and destroy them.","Sorceresses of the Black Tower","You have defeated the sorceresses within Barad Gúlaran. Return to Brúnfair at the Ranger encampment in the north-eastern section of Angmar and tell him of your success.\
\
Searching through the halls of Barad Gúlaran you discovered and defeated the sorceresses responsible for carrying out the machinations of Amarthiel in Angmar."}},
[11158]={nameES="La expedición de Sori",objectivesES={"Al parecer, Sori, un explorador del Descenso Profundo, pasó por el campamento de Menem-berej en su camino hacia el sur.","Encuentra a Sori en los túneles del sur","La expedición de Sori","Sori se dirigió hacia el sur desde Menem-berej, y debería encontrarse en algún lugar del túnel que se adentra hacia el sur a través de las Vetas del Cuerno de Plata.\
\
Deberías encontrar a Sori y ofrecerle tu ayuda."}},
[11159]={nameES="Sorrow Subsides",objectivesES={"The Boar-tribe Orcs have been defeated, Cúthing is on the mend, and it appears that Meregyth may have a reason to let go of her feelings for Éomer.","Talk to Thane Cútha","Sorrow Subsides","Meregyth stands near Cúthing, outside the Mead Hall of Beaconwatch.\
\
Cúthing informed you that Meregyth wants to have a word with you before speak with his father.","Talk to Meregyth","Thane Cútha is in the Mead Hall of Beaconwatch.\
\
Cúthing told you to speak with his father, Thane Cútha."}},
[11160]={nameES="Clasificación de piezas",objectivesES={"Reliquias medianas clasificadas sobre el tapete","Clasifica las reliquias grandes en el tapete","Clasifica las reliquias medianas en el tapete","Clasifica las reliquias pequeñas en el tapete","Devuelve la bolsa de cerámica a Astiul","Astiul está en Tinnudir, en la región de Parth Aduial en Evendim.\
\
El montaraz Astiul estará encantado de que hayas clasificado las reliquias y fragmentos de cerámica que has recuperado de las orillas del lago Nenuial.","Reliquias grandes clasificadas sobre el tapete","Clasificación de piezas","Has recuperado un buen número de fragmentos de cerámica y otras reliquias de los restos arrastrados a las orillas del lago Nenuial, y ahora el montaraz Astiul quiere que separes los trozos valiosos del resto.","Hay dispuestas reliquias y fragmentos de cerámica en los tapetes junto a Astiul en Tinnudir, en la región de Parth Aduial en Evendim.\
\
Astiul te ha pedido que clasifiques por tamaño en los tapetes que utiliza para tal propósito los fragmentos de cerámica y reliquias que has recuperado de las orillas del lago Nenuial.","Reliquias pequeñas clasificadas sobre el tapete"}},
[11161]={nameES="Clasificando la hierba para pipa",objectivesES={"Clasificando la hierba para pipa","Los barriles de hierba para pipa están junto a Florencia Gamyi.\
\
La hierba para pipa debe clasificarse antes de secarse.","Florencia Gamyi está en la Granja de Cotonorte.\
\
Florencia Gamyi querrá saber que la hierba para pipa ha sido clasificada.","Habla con Florencia Gamyi","La hierba para pipa es algo que los hobbits se toman muy en serio. Nadie visitaría un mercado a menos que tuviera un suministro y variedad adecuados."}},
[11162]={nameES="Source of the Corruption",objectivesES={"Find the root of the disturbance in Wódscrafen","Find the missing soldier near Wódscrafen","The frightened soldier is outside of Wódscrafen in the Wold.\
\
You should return to the frightened soldier and tell him of the Ringwraith you saw in Wódscrafen.","Source of the Corruption","North of Twickenburg is the highest point in the Wold, Cracabor, and over that hill is the ancient cave of Wódscrafen.\
\
You should explore the cave north of Twickenburg.","The cave of Wódscrafen has been quiet for ages, but recently there has been a sense of disturbance about that ancient place.","Dead creatures walk as if alive; explore further to find what disturbed them","Investigate the old cave","Return to the frightened soldier","You hear something unusual in the room ahead, and should go up the stairs to investigate...","North of Twickenburg is the highest point in the Wold, Cracabor, and over that hill is the ancient cave of Wódscrafen.\
\
You should head to Wódscrafen and search for the soldier who went that way.","The cave of Wódscrafen can be found north of Twickenburg in the Wold.\
\
You should explore the cave of Wódscrafen to find out what disturbed the dead there."}},
[11163]={nameES="Source of the Song",objectivesES={"Edâkhi has asked you to investigate behind the waterfall for the home of the Idâmi.","Speak with the Idâmi in her home behind the waterfall in Ilûritu.","Speak with Enârshan, the Idâmi","Edâkhi asks you to investigate behind the waterfall for more signs of Enârshan.","Found the home of the Idâmi","Investigate the waterfall for an entrance","Source of the Song"}},
[11164]={nameES="Source of the Unrest",objectivesES={"Mincham is at his camp, north of the barrows.\
 \
You should return to Mincham and report what you found at the ancient barrows.","Find the first skeleton pile","The barrows Mincham wants you to investigate are located to the east of the road, along the southern border of the Lich Bluffs.\
\
Mincham has asked you seek out the entrances to some of the barrows and investigate the corpses of the recently disturbed dead.","Find the third skeleton pile","Talk to Mincham in the Lich Bluffs","Found the third skeleton pile","Recently, several barrows in the Lich Bluffs have been disturbed. The bodies of the dead have been removed from their crypts and desecrated.","Find the second skeleton pile","Found the second skeleton pile","Source of the Unrest","Found the first skeleton pile"}},
[11165]={nameES="Engendro del Sur",objectivesES={"Líder semiorco derrotado en Andrath","Derrota al líder semiorco en Andrath","El Vigilante Robledales está en el extremo este de la parte norte de la Atalaya Sur.\
\
Has derrotado al líder semiorco en lo más profundo del campamento enemigo en Andrath y ahora debes regresar con el Vigilante Robledales.","Engendro del Sur","Habla con el Vigilante Robledales","El Vigilante Robledales habló en voz baja sobre una criatura particularmente vil que lidera a los mestizos desde el sur.","El líder semiorco puede encontrarse justo dentro de la puerta sur, en el Valle de Andrath.\
\
El Vigilante Robledales te ha pedido que derrotes al líder de los semiorcos del sur."}},
[11166]={nameES="Sowing Mayhem",objectivesES={}},
[11167]={nameES="Sowing Mayhem",objectivesES={}},
[11168]={nameES="Sowing for the Storm",objectivesES={"Gather bags of seeds to help Ashnân plant extra crops in Burukíri.","Sowing for the Storm","Plant the seeds in the locations at which the soil has already been tilled around Burukíri.","Return to Ashnân in Burukíri","With news of the assaults led by Bârshud II, Ashnân wants to plant extra crops to ensure they have the supplies needed for their troops.","Return to Ashnân in Burukíri and inform him that you have planted the crop seeds for him."}},
[11169]={nameES="Sowing the Fields",objectivesES={}},
[11170]={nameES="Sembrando las semillas",objectivesES={"Derrota a tantos Ghâsh-hai como sea posible mientras colocas las estatuas sobre los altares.","Has derrotado a varios orcos en los alrededores del Cruce de las Cenizas mientras protegían sus altares.","Los Ghâsh-hai protegerán los altares a toda costa. Derrota a tantos Ghâsh-hai como puedas mientras colocas las piedras sobre los altares.","Sembrando las semillas","Completado","Los orcos Ghâsh-hai se encuentran protegiendo los altares ubicados alrededor del Cruce de las Cenizas.\
\
Deberías derrotar muchos orcos en las áreas que rodean el Cruce de las Cenizas.","Derrota a los orcos Ghâsh-hai que protegen los altares que rodean el Cruce de las Cenizas"}},
[11171]={nameES="Sembrando el miedo",objectivesES={"Ingifast está en Guardia Orca, al noroeste de la Fosa de las Garras.\
\
Ingifast estará impaciente por ver los restos que has recuperado de la anterior expedición de la Mano Blanca.","Recupera la armadura de la Mano Blanca","Recupera la calavera de la Mano Blanca","Estandarte ajado de la Mano Blanca recuperado","Sembrando el miedo","La expedición de la Mano Blanca estaba explorando la Fosa de las Garras, al sureste de Guardia Orca.\
\
Ingifast te ha pedido que localices los restos de la anterior expedición y se los traigas de vuelta en la bolsa que te ha dado.","Lleva los restos a Ingifast en la Guardia Orca","Ingifast cree que los orcos de la Mano Blanca pueden ser ahuyentados si se encuentran con los restos de la anterior expedición.","Recupera el estandarte ajado de la Mano Blanca","Calavera de la Mano Blanca recuperada","Recupera el fémur de la Mano Blanca","Fémur de la Mano Blanca recuperado","Armadura de la Mano Blanca recuperada"}},
[11172]={nameES="Siembra en el Bosque Salvaje",objectivesES={"Puedes encontrar semillas y brotes para repoblar el Bosque Salvaje en medio del bosque.\
\
Mantoespino te ha pedido que recojas semillas y brotes para ayudar a restaurar el bosque.","Siembra en el Bosque Salvaje","Mantoespino necesita ayuda para recolectar semillas y brotes que ayuden a restaurar el mermado Bosque Salvaje.","Habla con Mantoespino","Mantoespino está en el este del Bosque Salvaje.\
\
Deberías hablar con Mantoespino."}},
[11173]={nameES="Despertando el interés",objectivesES={"Has despertado cierto interés en el espectáculo de fuegos artificiales","Regresa con los jóvenes hobbits en la zona del Espectáculo de Fuegos Artificiales de Bree y infórmales de tus acciones.","Busca lugares ideales para las demostraciones de fuegos artificiales por toda la ciudad de Bree. Inspecciona el suelo en estos lugares, y puedes realizar una demostración de fuegos artificiales para los espectadores.","Despertando el interés","Habla con los jóvenes hobbits en la zona del Espectáculo de Fuegos Artificiales de Bree","Dos jóvenes hobbits te han pedido que difundas la noticia de los espectáculos de fuegos artificiales encendiendo algunos fuegos artificiales individuales para la gente de Bree.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando termine el festival actual.</rgb>"}},
[11174]={nameES="Bengalas resplandecientes — Opcional",objectivesES={"Bengalas resplandecientes — Opcional","Deberías dar las bengalas de Gandalf a los niños de Bree."}},
[11175]={nameES="Sparring in Minas Tirith",objectivesES={}},
[11176]={nameES="Cría del Norte",objectivesES={"Hay dragonzuelos que habitan al este del Páramo Alto, en el Bosque de los Trolls.\
\
Mientras estés en el valle de los gigantes, deberías intentar ahuyentar a los dragonzuelos que han descendido desde las Montañas Nubladas.","Dragonzuelos han descendido desde las Montañas Nubladas para habitar entre los gigantes al este del Páramo Alto.","Cría del Norte"}},
[11177]={nameES="Spawning Evil",objectivesES={"Spawning Evil","Worm-eggs can be found throughout the Teeming Nest.\
\
You should destroy worm-eggs in the Teeming Nest to slow the rate of spawn of the vile worms in Eorlsmead.","Sabert awaits you at the front gate of Stangard.\
\
You should return to Sabert.","Worms have completely taken over a northern stretch of Eorlsmead, and they have been spawning without any intervention at all.","Return to Sabert"}},
[11178]={nameES="Speaker for the Lost",objectivesES={"Imladir can be found at the barracks near the entrance to Tumladen in northern Upper Lebennin.\
\
A guard of Tumladen has directed you to a man named Imladir. You should find and speak to him.","Speaker for the Lost","Lady Terenis can be found in the great hall of Tumladen in north-western Upper Lebennin.\
\
Imladir has informed you that Lady Terenis, the sister of Steward Denethor, has placed herself in charge of Tumladen.","Guards can be found throughout Tumladen in northern Upper Lebennin.\
\
Faltharan has asked you to seek out a guard of Tumladen and determine who speaks for the people of the settlement.","Faltharan seeks to learn who leads the people of Tumladen and hopes they can guide you back to Lord Angbor and his host.","Talk to Imladir in Tumladen","Talk to a guard in Tumladen","Talk to Lady Terenis in the great hall of Tumladen"}},
[11179]={nameES="Speaking the Truth",objectivesES={}},
[11180]={nameES="Spears for Defence",objectivesES={"The Dunlending attacks have hindered the supply lines of the Rohirrim, leaving the Horse-lords woefully under-equipped.","Dunlending sentries can be found at Brôntrig, west and south of Forthbrond.\
\
Ardwyn has asked you to seize spears from the Dunlending sentries at Brôntrig and bring them back to Forthbrond.","Spears for Defence","Bring the Dunlending spears to Ardwyn at Forthbrond","Ardwyn is at Forthbrond, north and east of Brôntrig.\
\
You should bring the spears you recovered to Ardwyn."}},
[11181]={nameES="Spears of War",objectivesES={}},
[11182]={nameES="Entrega Especial",objectivesES={"Lleva el paquete a Hethuwen en el Refugio Sombrío","Entrega Especial","Puedes encontrar a Hethuwen en el Refugio Sombrío, en la zona sudeste de Moria.\
\
Hasta te ha pedido llevar el paquete a su amiga Hethuwen en el Refugio Sombrío.","Hasta te ha pedido entregar los especímenes que reuniste a su amiga Hethuwen en el Refugio Sombrío.","Entrega el paquete a Hethuwen en el Refugio Sombrío"}},
[11183]={nameES="Espectro del Jinete Negro",objectivesES={"Las pocilgas de Odovacar Bolger están en la parte sur de Bolgovado, junto al arroyo.\
\
Odovacar Bolger te ha pedido que investigues los informes de sus jornaleros yendo a sus pocilgas. Fue muy específico en que debías ir de noche.","El \\qJinete Negro\\q está intentando amenazar las pocilgas de Bolger.\
\
Este \\qJinete Negro\\q parece mucho menos amenazante de lo esperado. Deberías enfrentarlo y averiguar qué está pasando realmente.","Odovacar Bolger está en su casa, en lo alto de la colina en el centro de Bolgovado.\
\
Odovacar Bolger te envió a investigar las afirmaciones de sus jornaleros sobre un Jinete Negro merodeando por sus pocilgas. Lo que encontraste fue un hobbit vestido con una capa negra. Deberías informar tu descubrimiento a Odovacar.","Espectro del Jinete Negro","Has encontrado al \\qJinete Negro\\q","Enfrenta al \\qJinete Negro\\q","Busca al Jinete Negro de noche","Los jornaleros de Odovacar Bolger informaron que vieron una figura oscura merodeando por las pocilgas del Sr. Bolger por la noche."}},
[11184]={nameES="Spider Assault",objectivesES={"The fighting in the Glittering Caves has awoken and angered a large nest of cave spiders. They will attempt to cover the large glowing crystal in the central chamber in the north eastern part of the cave with webbing, as the light it emits blinds and angers them.\
\
Merit Rating\
\
This quest starts with <rgb=#FFFF00>Full</rgb> Merit Rating.\
\
<rgb=#00FF00>Minor Point Gain</rgb>\
- Rohirrim freed from cocoon\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Major Point Loss</rgb>\
- Every 25% of Central Crystal's health","The Central Crystal has been covered in webbing","Defeat Scimgrit","Protect the central crystal from being covered in webbing by the waves of cave spiders. Search the spiders' tunnel for trapped Rohirrim and defeat the cave spider queen, Scimgrit.","You were forced to fall back before the spiders could be contained!","Spider Assault","Scimgrit defeated"}},
[11185]={nameES="Spider Assault",objectivesES={"The fighting in the Glittering Caves has awoken and angered a large nest of cave spiders. They will attempt to cover the large glowing crystal in the central chamber in the north eastern part of the cave with webbing, as the light it emits blinds and angers them.\
\
Merit Rating\
\
This quest starts with <rgb=#FFFF00>Full</rgb> Merit Rating.\
\
<rgb=#00FF00>Minor Point Gain</rgb>\
- Rohirrim freed from cocoon\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Major Point Loss</rgb>\
- Every 25% of Central Crystal's health","The Central Crystal has been covered in webbing","Defeat Scimgrit","Protect the central crystal from being covered in webbing by the waves of cave spiders. Search the spiders' tunnel for trapped Rohirrim and defeat the cave spider queen, Scimgrit.","You were forced to fall back before the spiders could be contained!","Spider Assault","Scimgrit defeated"}},
[11186]={nameES="Gemas de Araña",objectivesES={"Gemas de Araña","La bolsa perdida de gemas está en algún lugar de la zona llamada las Trampas, al sur de Esteldín.\
\
Holger Curtidor, un mercader que escapó de un ataque de arañas, te ha pedido que recuperes la bolsa de gemas perdida de sus compañeros en la guarida de las arañas.","Lleva las gemas a Holger Curtidor","Reúne la bolsa de gemas","Has reunido la bolsa de gemas","Holger Curtidor es el superviviente de un grupo de mercaderes emboscados por arañas en los Páramos del Rey. Los mercaderes llevaban una valiosa bolsa de gemas, que las arañas arrastraron junto con uno de los cuerpos.","Holger Curtidor está en Esteldín.\
\
Holger Curtidor, un mercader que escapó de un ataque de arañas, te ha pedido que recuperes la bolsa de gemas perdida de sus compañeros."}},
[11187]={nameES="Spider Harvesters",objectivesES={"Escort Caragdal to the Grimwood Lumber Camp","You did not protect Caragdal during her patrol","Return to Soldier Golb with news of your success","Soldier Golb is in the Grimwood Lumber Camp.\
\
You should return to Soldier Golb with the news that Caragdal is on the move.","Caragdal has been slain","The Grimwood is secured for Angmar's purposes. To ensure that it remains this way, we must grow our forces and support. \
\
You must draw the web-weavers from the nearby tower to come to Angmar's aid at the Grimwood Lumber Camp.","Caragdal has arrived to fortify the Grimwood!","Caragdal can be found in the ruins near the Grimwood Lumber Camp, nesting amongst her broodlings.\
\
Caragdal must be escorted safely to the Grimwood Lumber Camp.","Spider Harvesters"}},
[11188]={nameES="La plaga de arañas",objectivesES={"Mercancía recuperada","El carro de Otho Anchocinto está justo al noreste de Sobrecolina, junto a las cataratas.\
\
Otho Anchocinto necesita que recuperes la mercancía que traía de Bree del carro que abandonó a las afueras de Sobrecolina.","La plaga de arañas","Recupera la mercancía","Otho Anchocinto, un comerciante que transportaba mercancías desde Bree, vio cómo su carro era invadido por arañas.","Lleva la mercancía de vuelta a Otho Anchocinto"}},
[11189]={nameES="Spider Sedative",objectivesES={"Kúlthrak is in need of spider venom for wound-numbing purposes.","You have collected enough spider venom.\
\
You should give the phials to Kúlthrak at Kafagur.","Spider Sedative","Talk to Kúlthrak at Kafagur","Kúlthrak has asked you to hunt down spiders for venom.\
\
Spiders can be found at Maj Khibi, which is located north-west of Kafagur."}},
[11190]={nameES="Matarañas",objectivesES={"Iornaith derrotada","Matarañas","Una antigua reina araña ha perseguido a Atli Matarañas hasta Archet e invadido la granja de Cal Sprigley.","Derrotar a Iornaith","La granja de Sprigley está al sur del Capricho de Bronwe. Una entrada a los túneles de arañas está en la bodega del cobertizo de Sprigley, mientras que la otra está en la boca de la cueva al oeste del Refugio del Cazador.\
\
Para evitar que la prole de Iornaith invada Archet, Atli Matarañas te ha pedido que encuentres y elimines a la reina araña. Atli sugiere buscar en las cuevas de arañas bajo la granja de Sprigley una entrada secreta a la guarida de Iornaith.","Atli Matarañas se encuentra en el extremo norte de Archet, al oeste de la cueva de arañas y al noroeste de la granja de Sprigley.\
\
Deberías llevarle la noticia de la derrota de Iornaith.","Habla con Atli Matarañas en Archet"}},
[11191]={nameES="Matarañas",objectivesES={"Matarañas","Derrotaste a una reina araña que invadió las cavernas bajo Archet.","Esta reina de la prole es mucho más temible que cualquier araña con la que te hayas encontrado antes y parece estar manipulando muchos de los acontecimientos en torno a Archet.\
\
El enano Atli es conocido como Atli Matarañas. Seguramente querrá ver pruebas de la muerte de esta criatura.","Atli Matarañas se encuentra en Archet.\
\
Luchaste y derrotaste a Iornaith, una araña de gran poder, mientras explorabas los túneles al oeste de Archet. Sabiendo que el enano Atli suele ser conocido como Atli Matarañas, deberías llevar pruebas de tus hazañas a Archet para mostrárselas al enano.","Habla con Atli Matarañas en Archet"}},
[11192]={nameES="Recompensa por Arañas",objectivesES={"Recompensa por Arañas","Los Montaraces han solicitado ayuda para asegurar las tierras alrededor de Esteldín y alejar cualquier amenaza.","Muchas viles arañas habitan en el sureste de los Páramos del Rey, cerca de la montaña, y han sido durante mucho tiempo una amenaza y una plaga para Esteldín. Los parientes de los Montaraces están muy dispersos por las Quebradas del Norte y más allá en misiones de gran importancia, y no pueden ocuparse de esta amenaza.\
\
Cualquiera que mate arañas en el sureste de los Páramos del Rey será recompensado.","Has ayudado a los Montaraces de Esteldín en su vigilancia diaria, asegurando que las tierras de las Quebradas del Norte estén libres del control enemigo.","Completado","Las repugnantes arañas residen en la zona sureste de los Páramos del Rey, a la sombra de la montaña.\
\
Debes rastrear y matar a las arañas que asolan la zona."}},
[11193]={nameES="Infestación de arañas",objectivesES={"Es una lucha constante mantener el número abrumador de arañas al mínimo.","Infestación de arañas","Klintur se encuentra en el Refugio Sombrío, al oeste de Tunzelgund.\
\
Debes regresar a Klintur con noticias de tu éxito.","Habla con Klintur en el Refugio Sombrío","Se pueden encontrar arañas alrededor de Tunzelgund, al este del Refugio Sombrío.\
\
Klintur te ha pedido que derrotes a muchas arañas en las Fundaciones de Piedra."}},
[11194]={nameES="Prismas de patas de araña",objectivesES={"Los postes de lámpara vacíos se pueden encontrar por todo Gabil-munz, al suroeste de la Bodega Putrefacta.\
\
Thrand quiere que coloques las patas de araña de cristal pulidas dentro de los postes para repararlos.","Thrand ha pulido las patas de araña de cristal y las ha preparado para ser colocadas dentro de los postes de lámpara vacíos.","Habla con Thrand en la Bodega Putrefacta","Thrand se encuentra en la Bodega Putrefacta, al noreste de Gabil-munz.\
\
Regresa allí para decirle que las patas de araña de cristal funcionaron y que los postes de lámpara han sido reparados.","Prismas de patas de araña"}},
[11195]={nameES="Reina-araña",objectivesES={"La reina-araña de la Dehesa del Rey está en algún lugar de la guarida al sur de Esteldín.\
\
Debes derrotar a la reina de las arañas que amenaza a la gente de Esteldín, reduciendo así el peligro que representan esas criaturas viles.","Una raza monstruosa de arañas ha construido un nido al sur de Esteldín, amenazando la seguridad de los habitantes del puesto de avanzada.\
\
Debes derrotar a la reina de las arañas en las Trampas.","Derrota a la reina-araña","Reina-araña","Una raza monstruosa de arañas ha construido un nido al sur de Esteldín, amenazando la seguridad de los habitantes del puesto de avanzada.","Dagoras está en Esteldín.\
\
Debes hablar con Dagoras e informarle que has derrotado a la reina-araña."}},
[11196]={nameES="Spider-spawn",objectivesES={"Spiderlings crawl all over the forest floor in the Silkenhold.\
\
You should defeat the spiderlings, for even the young are as evil and fell as their elders, and these monsters do not grow better with age.","Spider-spawn","Tiny spiderlings crawl all over the Silkenhold of Fangorn, threatening to grow into larger, crueler, hungrier foes.","Stairs lead up to a forebidding area near the Huorn you rescued in northern Fangorn.\
\
You should climb to stairs to investigate, for you suspect an infestation of spiders.","You have squashed many of the swarming spiderlings in the Silkenhold of Fangorn. The trees in this choked part of the forest may rest assured that the promise of future evil has been somewhat lessened.","Climb the stairs near the Huorn","The distressed Huorn paces unhappily at the base of some stairs in a quadrant of the forest that fills you with some fear.\
\
You should investigate what lies atop the stairs, for you suspect a significant spider problem in this area. It appears that these foes are spilling out of their nest.","Completado","As you suspected, this part of Fangorn is overrun with spiders"}},
[11197]={nameES="Arañas y Moscas",objectivesES={"Encuentra y libera a todos los elfos capturados en capullos.","Muchos de los exploradores de Thranduil enviados al sur del Bosque Negro han desaparecido, probablemente capturados por las arañas.","Arañas y Moscas","Habla con Limgarag en la entrada de las Hondonadas Enmarañadas.","Habla con Limgarag"}},
[11198]={nameES="Arañas y moscas -- Nivel 2",objectivesES={"Encuentra y libera a todos los elfos capturados en capullos.","Muchos de los exploradores de Thranduil enviados al sur del Bosque Negro han desaparecido, probablemente capturados por las arañas.","Arañas y moscas -- Nivel 2","Habla con Limgarag en la entrada de las Hondonadas Enmarañadas.","Habla con Limgarag"}},
[11199]={nameES="Spiders at Dâr Matum",objectivesES={}},
[11200]={nameES="Arañas en las Murallas",objectivesES={"Busca al cazador desaparecido","Atli Matarañas se encuentra frente al Refugio del Cazador.\
\
Mientras despejabas las arañas del Viejo Camino del Este, encontraste al primer cazador que Atli había enviado, muerto por las arañas. En la mano del cazador estaba el hacha de Atli, pero se rompió durante la batalla. Deberías regresar con Atli para darle la mala noticia.","Debe completarse antes de la \\qIntroducción.\\q","Arañas en las Murallas","Lleva el hacha a Atli Matarañas","Atli Matarañas pidió a uno de los cazadores de Jon Helecharroyo que despejara algunas de las arañas que han invadido el Viejo Camino del Este, pero aún no ha regresado.","El Viejo Camino del Este está al oeste del Refugio del Cazador.\
\
Sospechando que el cazador de Jon Helecharroyo se fue a tomar una cerveza en lugar de cumplir con el deber por el que fue contratado, Atli te pidió que fueras y despejaras las arañas. También mencionó que deberías buscar al cazador desaparecido mientras estás allí.","Las marcas de mordedura en el cuello del cazador revelan que fue víctima del veneno de las arañas en el Viejo Camino del Este. En su mano, ves el hacha de la que habló Atli Matarañas. Tomas el hacha de su mano.","Hacha de Atli recolectada"}},
[11201]={nameES="Arañas en Moscagua",objectivesES={"Edda Ramaje sigue preocupada de que las criaturas de los Pantanos de Moscagua representen un peligro ignorado para la gente de Entibo.","La presencia de los vigilantes de la prole se encuentra entre el antiguo Fuerte de Aguas Pantanosas y las Ruinas del Borde del Bosque en los Pantanos de Moscagua.\
\
Según Edda Ramaje, una nueva y mortal raza de araña ha aparecido en el norte de Agua Próspera, y te ha pedido que reduzcas su número.","Habla con Edda Ramaje","Derrota a la reina del pantano","Edda Ramaje se encuentra al sureste de las ruinas en el norte de los Pantanos de Moscagua.\
\
Edda Ramaje estará complacida de saber de tu éxito contra los mortales vigilantes de la prole del pantano y su reina en los Pantanos de Moscagua.","Reina del pantano derrotada","Arañas en Moscagua"}},
[11202]={nameES="Arañas en la cantera",objectivesES={"Lirio Ganapié está en Scary, observando la cantera.\
\
Lirio Ganapié temía que las arañas que los canteros desenterraron invadieran Scary y te pidió ayuda para eliminar la amenaza. Se alegrará al saber de tu éxito.","Arañas en la cantera","Los trabajadores de la cantera en Scary han abierto una cámara oculta que contenía un nido de arañas, y las criaturas ahora han invadido toda la cantera.","Las arañas se encuentran por toda la cantera y la cueva de la que salieron, excavada en el acantilado junto a Scary.\
\
Lirio Ganapié, preocupada de que las arañas de la cantera puedan salir del agujero rocoso y apoderarse de su pueblo, te ha pedido que elimines a las criaturas."}},
[11203]={nameES="Arañas en la cantera",objectivesES={"Has derrotado a la mayoría, si no a todas, de las arañas en la cantera, pero la araña más importante aún permanece. Debes encontrar y derrotar a la Reina de los Campos Verdes.","Las arañas se pueden encontrar en toda la cantera y en la cueva de la que salieron, excavada en la cara del acantilado por Scary.","Arañas en la cantera","Derrota a la Reina de los Campos Verdes","Los trabajadores de la cantera en Scary han abierto una cámara oculta que contenía un nido de arañas, y las criaturas ahora han invadido toda la cantera."}},
