[11205]={nameES="Spiders of Fangorn: I",objectivesES={}},
[11206]={nameES="Arañas del Valle",objectivesES={"Tralli Puño de Martillo está en el campamento de enanos más allá de la barricada, en la entrada norte de Rath Teraig.\
\
Debes regresar con Tralli Puño de Martillo para informarle de tu éxito.","Tralli Puño de Martillo te ha pedido ayuda para destruir a las arañas que acechan más allá de la barricada en Rath Teraig.","Hay arañas más allá de la barricada al sur del campamento de enanos.\
\
Tralli Puño de Martillo, que tiene pavor a las arañas, te ha pedido que elimines algunas de esas criaturas por él.","Habla con Tralli Puño de Martillo","Arañas del Valle"}},
[11207]={nameES="Spiders of the Winding Stair",objectivesES={}},
[11208]={nameES="Spies From Gundabad",objectivesES={}},
[11209]={nameES="Espías y ladrones",objectivesES={"Rantost está al noroeste de Ost Forod.\
\
Basilio te ha enviado a reunirte con varios espías que tiene en el campamento de los saqueadores de tumbas en la isla de Rantost.","Habla con Eliot Bencroft en Rantost","Espías y ladrones","La isla de Rantost es donde los saqueadores de tumbas han establecido su campamento central. Allí se guarda gran parte de la historia."}},
[11210]={nameES="Spies on the Crest",objectivesES={"Find the largest craban to carry the beaks back to Saruman","Spies on the Crest","Completado","Crebain can be found all over the peaks of the western High Knolls.\
\
You should defeat crebain in the High Knolls.","Crebain dot the peaks in the western High Knolls -- Saruman's spies, reporting all that goes on back to their corrupted master.","You feel unfriendly eyes on you in this part of the Knolls wherever you go.\
\
Crebain dot the peaks in the western High Knolls -- Saruman's spies, reporting all that goes on back to their corrupted master.","The crebain-roost is on the Lonely Height in the north-west High Knolls.\
\
You should find the biggest craban on the Lonely Height in the High Knolls, and send the beaks you collected with him to Saruman as a message of defiance.","Defeat crebain and collect their beaks","Saruman will see that his cruelty has been defied in Wildermore","This craban is bigger than the others, and seems to know that you have a message for it to bear to Saruman. These little spies are most perceptive.\
\
You wrap the beaks in a cloth, tie them to the craban, and shoo him off.\
\
Saruman must be taught that all will resist, all will defy him, wherever he imposes his cruel will.","Crebain can be found all over the peaks of the western High Knolls, especially near the Lonely Height in the north-west.\
\
You should defeat crebain in the High Knolls and collect their beaks to send back to Saruman.","You have defied Saruman as best you could from this remote location.\
\
Hopefully he will be vexed by the affront."}},
[11211]={nameES="Espíritus caídos y terribles",objectivesES={"Espíritus caídos y terribles","Espíritus caídos y espectros amenazan la paz de Tyrn Gorthad.","El Montaraz Faradan está al suroeste de Calarphel en Tyrn Gorthad.","Habla con el Montaraz Faradan al suroeste de Calarphel en Tyrn Gorthad","El Montaraz Faradan está preocupado por los espíritus que animan a los muertos en Tyrn Gorthad."}},
[11212]={nameES="Spirits and Summoners",objectivesES={"Talk to Hórin outside Bagud-dum","Hórin can be found outside the dwarf-fort Bagud-dum.\
\
You should talk to Hórin.","Angmarim of the Cult of Drugoth and the fell spirits they have summoned can be found in Bagud-dum.\
\
You should defeat Angmarim and fell spirits in Bagud-dum.","Spirits and Summoners","Bagud-dum has become the main stronghold of the Cult of Drugoth in the Welkin-lofts. It is imperative that their numbers be lessened."}},
[11213]={nameES="Espíritus en flor",objectivesES={"Lleva flores a Maliriel en el Embarcadero","Bahanneth está en Talan Fanuidhol, al oeste de Cerin Amroth. Ambendel está en Echad Andestel, al suroeste de Cerin Amroth. Maliriel está en El Embarcadero, al este y al sur de Cerin Amroth, cerca del río.\
\
Tuilinn te ha pedido que lleves flores de elanor y niphredil a Bahanneth, a Ambendel y a Mariliel, la encargada del banquete.","Lleva flores a Bahanneth en Talan Fanuidhol","El elanor y el niphredil se pueden encontrar en Cerin Amroth y sus alrededores.\
\
Tuilinn te ha pedido que recojas más elanor y niphredil.","Tuilinn, encantada por el éxito de su plan para levantar la moral de sus amigos, desea que los visites con regularidad llevándoles flores de Cerin Amroth.","Espíritus en flor","Habla con Tuilinn en Cerin Amroth","Tuilinn se encuentra en lo alto de la plataforma en Cerin Amroth.\
\
Deberías regresar junto a Tuilinn y contarle cómo su regalo ha levantado el ánimo de sus amigos.","Lleva flores a Ambendel en Echad Andestel"}},
[11214]={nameES="Spirits of Dunland",objectivesES={"Cuthraul can be found in the Slade of Shadows, south of Andreg's position.\
\
Andreg has instructed you to defeat the Cuthraul in the Slade of Shadows.","Spirits of Dunland","The Slade of Shadows appears to be a focal point for the evil that is growing within the Gravenwood."}},
[11215]={nameES="'Espíritus antiguos",objectivesES={"Imlad Balchorth es el hogar de una multitud de espíritus crueles, sirvientes de Angmar.","Hay espíritus crueles en Imlad Balchorth, en los altos pasos del sur, al sur y al oeste de Valleoscuro. Gautar está en Valleoscuro.\
\
Gautar te ha pedido que enfrentes a los espíritus crueles para aprender si podría haber una forma de desterrarlos de la Tierra Media.","Lleva los símbolos de vuelta a Gautar"}},
[11216]={nameES="Spirits of Sorrow",objectivesES={}},
[11217]={nameES="Espíritus del Valle Sagrado",objectivesES={"Espíritus del Valle Sagrado","Ellen Fremedon can be found outside the Mead Hall of Underharrow.\
\
You have searched the nearby trees and discovered Orcs adorned with skeletal markings and masks. You should return to Ellen Fremedon.","In the wake of strange happenings, the people of Underharrow fear the spirits of the White Mountains now haunt the Harrowdale.","Trees can be found to the west and south of Underharrow.\
\
Ellen Fremedon has asked you to investigate her peoples' claims that spirits have begun to haunt the nearby trees.","Talk to Ellen Fremedon"}},
[11218]={nameES="Spirits of the Taken",objectivesES={"Spirits of the Taken","Talk to Atta","Hundreds of years ago, a terrible creature dwelt within the ruins of Avabárg and devoured those unfortunate enough to cross its path.","Spirits can be found in Avabárg.\
\
Atta has asked you to travel to Avabárg and put to rest the spirits of the unfortunate Woodmen that were taken by a terrible creature long ago.","Atta can be found in Hultvís.\
\
You have defeated many of the spirits in Avabárg."}},
[11219]={nameES="Spitpyre, Scourge of Talath Úrui",objectivesES={}},
[11220]={nameES="Disgregar las filas",objectivesES={"Disgregar las filas","Derrota al capitán Ghâsh-hai de Ânghumu-ru","Derrota al capitán Ghâsh-hai","Has derrotado al capitán Ghâsh-hai, causando confusión y desorden en las filas de los orcos.","Completado","El capitán Ghâsh-hai es responsable de liderar y comandar a las fuerzas Ghâsh-hai en Âmghumu-ru. Derrotarlo fragmentará al enemigo y lo sumirá en el caos.","El capitán Ghâsh-hai puede encontrarse en el centro de Ânghumu-ru.\
\
Deberías derrotar al capitán Ghâsh-hai.","Has derrotado al capitán Ghâsh-hai"}},
[11221]={nameES="Splintered Light",objectivesES={"Plant a banner of Belfalas atop Barad Rill","Herion can be found in Linhir in eastern Dor-en-Ernil.\
\
You have recovered the relics and planted a banner atop the ruins of Barad Rill. You should now return to Herion.","Deliver the relics to Herion in Linhir","You have planted the banner!","Barad Rill, a crucial tower of the Prince's lands, has fallen into the hands of the Enemy, and Herion hopes to reclaim what was lost.","Splintered Light","Barad Rill can be found far to the south-west of Linhir in Dor-en-Ernil.\
\
Herion has asked you to recover relics from Barad Rill as well as plant a banner of Belfalas atop its ruins."}},
