\
Opal Buenavista tiene una de las tartas estropeadas de Holly que debes devolverle lo antes posible. Asegúrate de que ningún hobbit hambriento huela la tarta, ya que a Holly no le gusta que la molesten pidiéndole una porción, especialmente porque tiene que hornear tartas frescas para todos sus clientes.","Un hobbit hambriento ha olido la tarta"}},
[11236]={nameES="Incursión de saqueadores",objectivesES={"Gatson está de vuelta en su granja, al noreste del campamento orco.\
\
Deberías contarle a Gatson tu éxito reduciendo la amenaza orca en Gurzlum.","Gurzlum está demasiado cerca de la granja de Gatson, amenazando las últimas tierras habitadas de las Quebradas del Norte.\
\
Debes derrotar orcos en Gurzlum para rechazar la amenaza enemiga en la Dehesa del Rey.","El campamento orco Gurzlum está al suroeste de los campos de Gatson.\
\
El granjero Gatson está seguro de que los orcos atacarán su granja de nuevo si no se les disuade antes.","Incursión de saqueadores","Gurzlum está demasiado cerca de la granja de Gatson, amenazando las últimas tierras habitadas de las Quebradas del Norte."}},
[11237]={nameES="Echando a perder el botín",objectivesES={"Echando a perder el botín","Derrota a Fotkûrz, maestro de sierpes","Fotkûrz, maestro de sierpes, derrotado","Lengliel está en Echad Eregion, al suroeste de Pembar.\
\
Deberías volver a ver a Lengliel y contarle que has destruido un buen número de huevos de sierpe y derrotado a Fotkûrz, maestro de sierpes, como te pidió.","Mientras estabas diezmando las filas de los semiorcos de Saruman en Pembar, has descubierto muchos más huevos de sierpe de los que los Elfos tenían constancia. Esto ha sido una causa de gran preocupación para Lengliel.","Los huevos de sierpe se encuentran en los nidos de las ruinas de Pembar, al noreste de Echad Eregion.\
\
Lengliel te ha pedido que destruyas tantos huevos de sierpe en Pembar como puedas. Fotkûrz, maestro de sierpes, puede encontrarse deambulando por Pembar.","Habla con Lengliel en Echad Eregion"}},
[11238]={nameES="Spoils Reclaimed",objectivesES={}},
[11239]={nameES="Spoils for Sharkey",objectivesES={"Sharkey is said to reward those who find suitable treasure in the Gladden Fields, but it is certain that he punishes those who fail him.","Tautila can be found in the warrens of Tûn Melen.\
\
You have recovered a strange collection of items stolen by Sharkey's Men in the Gladden Fields. You should return to Tautila.","A cracked crystal likely stolen from an abandoned dwarf-hold","This mouldering tome has a crude 'S' carved into its cover","Spoils for Sharkey","This barrel of pipe-weed is tremendously old and its contents are stale","A worn, old painting depicting what appears to be a hobbit","Stolen treasures can be found in the warrens of Tûn Melen.\
\
Tautila told you Sharkey's Men have been stealing and collecting odd objects to impress Sharkey. He has asked you to recover the stolen 'treasures'.","Deliver the 'treasures' to Tautila in the warrens of Tûn Melen","Someone has attempted to polish this rusted old necklace","Sharkey's men seem to have made off with one of the totems of the Woodmen","Tautila looks over what you have found and a weak smile spreads across his face.\
\
'It might not be much, but at least Sharkey will never have it.'"}},
[11240]={nameES="Spore and Soil",objectivesES={"Return the blighted mushrooms to Tálbiral","Spore and Soil","You have gathered the mushrooms that Tálbiral requested. Return to him in Laivárth so that he can begin his studies.","Tálbiral is in need of new mushrooms to study and asked you to gather some for him. He mentioned the ones he needs can be found just outside of Laivárth."}},
[11241]={nameES="Spousal Strife",objectivesES={"Introduce yourself to Hanâth's husband","You spy a man deep into his cups while onlookers avoid him","Speak with Hanâth's inebriated spouse","Talk to Hanâth at The Din of Arms","Hanâth's husband is probably in Tâkhdar in the black market at Kheb Hanût.\
\
Search for someone who seems particularly inebriated in the cellars.","Search for Hanâth's husband in Tâkhdar","Hanâth's husband is somewhere in Tâkhdar, likely in Kheb Hanût.\
\
A frantic woman is looking for her husband, who has gotten himself banned from every wine-house for drunken behaviour. She suspects he is still drinking somewhere in Tâkhdar.","The troublesome woman can be found at The Din of Arms in the Tor-gardens, in the western side of Umbar Baharbêl.\
\
A wine-merchant has asked you to speak with a woman who seems to have lost her husband.","Find and speak with Hanâth at The Din of Arms in the Tor Gardens.\
\
Shemâya, a wine-merchant of Umbar Baharbêl has come to Dâr Laja to file a complaint against a frequent visitor to the shop. She suggests first meeting with his wife, Hanâth at The Din of Arms in the Tor Gardens.","Hanâth's husband is drinking himself blind in Tâkhdar at Kheb Hanût.\
\
You have found Hanâth's husband in the cellars. You should greet him and see if he is sober enough to ascend.","Search for a drunken man in Kheb Hanût","This region seems safe enough for a drunken husband to spend his time","Spousal Strife"}},
[11242]={nameES="Spreading the Corruption",objectivesES={"Draugar have begun to spill from the mouth of a cave near the spot where the salamanders show signs of corruption. The dead should be slain anew, for it is a bad sign when those who have passed walk the earth once more.","Discover the source of corruption","Spreading the Corruption","Return to Céolstan at the Harwick Stables","Dwolung Hole can be found in the bog west of Harwick where the salamanders grow corrupted.\
\
You should defeat the Draugar who begin to spill from the mouth of Dwolung Hole, spreading the pollution of death to the living.","Céolstan can be found within Harwick's stables.\
\
You should speak with Céolstan of the draugar in Dwolung Hole.","Draugar have begun to spill from the mouth of a cave near the spot where the salamanders show signs of corruption."}},
[11243]={nameES="¡Las instancias de temporada de primavera han llegado!",objectivesES={"Juega las instancias de temporada de primavera durante el Festival de Primavera"}},
[11244]={nameES="Haciendo saltar las trampas",objectivesES={"Haciendo saltar las trampas","Habla con Glamodúd en Echad Glamodúd","Las trampas orcas podrían encontrarse en cualquier lugar entre Echad Glamodúd y Ashúrz Maufulug, al suroeste.\
\
Glamodúd te ha pedido que encuentres y desarmes cualquier trampa que los orcos hayan podido colocar en los Lindes Oscuros. Ahora que has visto una de las trampas orcas, el resto debería ser mucho más fácil de encontrar.","Los elfos de la Hueste Dorada han descubierto que los orcos de Dol Guldur han establecido un campamento en Ashúrz Maufulug, no muy lejos de Echad Sirion.","Glamodúd está en Echad Glamodúd, al noreste de Ashúrz Maufulug.\
\
Has desarmado muchas de las trampas orcas y ahora deberías volver a ver a Glamodúd para informarle.","Ahora que has visto una de las trampas de los orcos, sabes lo que estás buscando","Las trampas orcas podrían encontrarse en cualquier lugar entre Echad Glamodúd y Ashúrz Maufulug, al sur y un poco hacia el este.\
\
Glamodúd te ha pedido que encuentres y desarmes cualquier trampa que los orcos hayan podido colocar en los Lindes Oscuros.","Encuentra una trampa orca"}},
[11245]={nameES="Sprucing up the Walk",objectivesES={}},
[11246]={nameES="Se ha Producido una Fuga",objectivesES={"Lleva los ingredientes del mortero a Tindr.","Se ha Producido una Fuga","Tindr está en el patio frente a la Mansión de Thorin. La arena se encuentra en la Fosa Barrigapétrea, al sureste del Patio de Frerin, en un lugar llamado Cumbre Invernal. El yeso y las piedras pequeñas pueden encontrarse en los Túneles Piedramusgo, sobre el Patio de Frerin, al noroeste.\
\
Tindr, el Maestro Constructor de la Mansión de Thorin, te ha pedido que reúnas varios ingredientes para preparar un mortero con el que reparar una fuga en la pared del canal.","Se ha abierto una fisura en el gran canal enano que desciende desde la Mansión de Thorin, amenazando con inundar el Valle de Thráin."}},
[11247]={nameES="Spying From the Hillock",objectivesES={"Turgon can be found at the South-gate of the Rammas.\
\
You should speak with Turgon.","The Hillock can be found in Pelennor Fields, north-east of the South-gate.\
\
You should defeat enemies upon the Hillock.","Speak with Turgon","Spying From the Hillock","Turgon is concerned about Haradrim forces that have taken the nearby Hillock and wishes to drive them off the best vantage point on Pelennor Fields."}},
[11248]={nameES="Espiando a los trasgos",objectivesES={"Acércate al hombre angustiado","El hombre que necesita ayuda se puede encontrar justo fuera de la fortaleza trasgo en el centro de las Tierras Altas del Norte.\
\
Deberías hablar con él.","Explora el campamento trasgo","<rgb=#FF0000>Evita a los trasgos</rgb>","El tiempo de sigilo ha terminado, pues un hombre cercano necesita tu ayuda","Espiando a los trasgos","Los trasgos han establecido un campamento en las colinas del sur de Annúndir, al este de Amon Raith.\
\
Amarion te ha pedido que explores el campamento trasgo y evalúes la amenaza que representa para quienes están bajo su cuidado. Te ha advertido que tengas cuidado. Si un trasgo te ve, podría seguirte hasta Amon Raith.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Procura no ser visto por el enemigo.</rgb>","Amarion está preocupado por la presencia de trasgos en el sur de Annúndir y teme lo que sucederá si las criaturas se enteran de los refugiados en Amon Raith."}},
[11249]={nameES="Puertas Chirriantes",objectivesES={"Habla con Merion en la puerta este de Musgovilla","Una buena cantidad de grasa aplicada a las bisagras ha puesto fin al chirrido.","Las bisagras de la puerta interior de Skardí han empezado a chirriar.","La puerta de la tienda del curandero en la plaza del pueblo necesita aceite.","Skardí Doblafilos está dentro de la herrería en el centro del pueblo.","Merion se pregunta si la vida diaria de un guardia de Musgovilla está a punto de cambiar..... pero hasta entonces, la gente del pueblo se queja de puertas chirriantes, y hay que hacer algo al respecto.","Aplica algo de grasa a las bisagras de la puerta interior de Skardí y pon fin al chirrido","Qué extraño. El chirrido solo se vuelve más fuerte","Las bisagras chirriantes de la puerta de la casa de Cadogan están al oeste de la plaza del pueblo en Musgovilla.","Aplica algo de grasa a las bisagras de la puerta de la tienda del curandero y pon fin al chirrido","Puertas Chirriantes","Has puesto fin al chirrido de la puerta de la tienda del curandero","Merion, de la guardia del pueblo, está en la puerta este de Musgovilla, esperando escuchar tu éxito contra las puertas chirriantes del pueblo.","Aplica algo de grasa a las bisagras de la puerta de la casa de Cadogan y pon fin al chirrido","Habla con Skardí Doblafilos en su herrería","Has puesto fin al chirrido, aunque no de la forma que Merion pretendía"}},
[11250]={nameES="La Mano del Mozo de Cuadra",objectivesES={"Has limpiado uno de los establos de Bill Rosewood","Gaelm te ha dicho que, a cambio de realizar tareas para los Maestros de Establo de Bree, te concederá el privilegio de montar una de sus monturas. Aunque carecen de la fuerza y resistencia de los caballos de su padre, los caballos de Gaelm son más mansos y fáciles de montar.","La Mano del Mozo de Cuadra","Saca agua de la Fuente del Jabalí.","Bill Rosewood está en el establo cerca de la Puerta Sur de Bree.\
\
Has limpiado uno de los establos de Bill Rosewood, pero mencionó que Bert Goldenleaf, quien se ocupa de los establos junto a la Puerta Sur de Bree, podría necesitar el mismo servicio. Deberías hablar nuevamente con Bill Rosewood antes de irte.","La Fuente del Jabalí está al sur de la Posada del Poney Pisador, en Bree. Bert Goldenleaf está en el establo junto a la Puerta Sur de Bree.\
\
Bill Rosewood te dijo que sacaras algo de agua de la Fuente del Jabalí en Bree y la usaras para limpiar uno de los establos de Bert Goldenleaf.","Bert Goldenleaf está en su establo cerca de la Puerta Sur de Bree.\
\
Debes hablar con Bert Goldenleaf para ver si hay algo más que desee que hagas.","Has limpiado uno de los establos de Bert Goldenleaf","Recoge un saco de grano.","La Fuente del Jabalí está al sur de la Posada del Poney Pisador, en Bree.\
\
Bill Rosewood te pidió que sacaras agua de la Fuente del Jabalí en Bree y la usaras para limpiar uno de sus establos junto a la Puerta Oeste de Bree.","Bill Rosewood está en los establos cerca de la Puerta Oeste de Bree, al sur de la Granja Hengstacer.\
\
Debes hablar con Bill Rosewood en su establo.","El saco de grano está cerca del silo en la Granja Hengstacer, al este de Gaelm.\
\
Gaelm te indicó que recogieras un saco de grano cerca del silo en la Granja Hengstacer y lo llevaras a Bill Rosewood, el Maestro de Establo cerca de la Puerta Oeste de Bree.","Regresa con Gaelm a la Granja Hengstacer, en los campos de Bree, al norte de Bree.\
\
Has hecho todo lo que los Maestros de Establo de Bree te pidieron. Ahora puedes regresar con Gaelm y ver si te permitirá montar una de sus monturas domadas.","Habla con Gaelm"}},
[11251]={nameES="La Mano del Mozo de Cuadra",objectivesES={"Has limpiado uno de los establos de Bill Rosewood","Gaelm te ha dicho que, a cambio de realizar tareas para los Maestros de Establo de Bree, te concederá el privilegio de montar una de sus monturas. Aunque carecen de la fuerza y resistencia de los caballos de su padre, los caballos de Gaelm son más mansos y fáciles de montar.","La Mano del Mozo de Cuadra","Saca agua de la Fuente del Jabalí.","Saca un poco de agua de la Fuente del Jabalí en Bree y úsala para limpiar uno de los establos de Bert Goldenleaf. Los establos de Bert Goldenleaf se encuentran junto a la Puerta Sur de Bree.","Has limpiado uno de los establos de Bert Goldenleaf","Recoge un saco de grano.","Recoge un saco de grano cerca del silo, al este de Gaelm, en la Granja Hengstacer. Una vez que lo tengas, llévalo a Bill Rosewood, el Maestro de Establo que se encuentra cerca de la Puerta Oeste de Bree.","Habla con Bill Rosewood en sus establos cerca de la Puerta oeste de Bree.","Bill Rosewood te ha pedido que saques agua de la Fuente del Jabalí en Bree y la uses para limpiar uno de sus establos junto a la Puerta Oeste de Bree.","Habla con Bill Rosewood en los establos junto a la Puerta Oeste de Bree.\
\
Has limpiado uno de los establos de Bill Rosewood, pero mencionó que Bert Goldenleaf, que se encarga de los establos junto a la Puerta Sur de Bree, podría necesitar el mismo servicio.","Habla con Bert Goldenleaf para ver si hay algo más que quiera que hagas.\
\
También limpiaste uno de los establos de Bert Goldenleaf, como hiciste para Bill Rosewood.","Regresa con Gaelm a la Granja Hengstacer, en los campos de Bree.\
\
Ya hiciste todo lo que los Maestros de Establo de Bree te pidieron, así que ahora puedes regresar con Gaelm y ver si te permitirá montar una de sus monturas domadas.","Habla con Gaelm"}},
[11252]={nameES="Entibo Asediado",objectivesES={"Completa la misión: Salvando las manzanas","Has hecho todo lo que puedes para ayudar a los hobbits de Entibo. Deberías regresar con el Condestable Tanglerush para recibir la recompensa que te prometió.","Entibo Asediado","Aunque el Condestable Tanglerush no puede hacer nada personalmente para ayudar a los hobbits de Entibo con su problema actual, ella siente compasión por ellos y te ha ofrecido una recompensa por ayudarlos en su lugar.","Completa la misión: Objetos desaparecidos","El Condestable Tanglerush sugiere hablar con algunos de los hobbits alrededor de Entibo y ver si hay algo que puedas hacer para ayudarlos con sus problemas actuales.","Habla con el Alguacil Tanglerush en Entibo","Completa la misión: Ahuyentando a las musarañas","Completa la misión: Hobbits perdidos","Completa la misión: Rescatando los vegetales","Completa la misión: Expulsa a los Rascacuevas"}},
[11253]={nameES="Entibo Pide Ayuda",objectivesES={"Habla con el Alguacil Tanglerush en Entibo","Entibo Pide Ayuda","Humbert afirma que Entibo está bajo ataque y te ha pedido que vayas allí a ayudar a la aldea. Deberías ir allí y preguntarle a uno de los alguaciles qué está ocurriendo. Entibo está en las Tierras de Bree, justo al sureste de Bree.","Humbert Espinaguera ha venido desde Entibo en busca de personas valientes que ayuden a su aldea en este momento de necesidad."}},
[11254]={nameES="Staging a Collapse",objectivesES={"Cúthing has been working on a plan to strike at the Boar-tribe Orcs.","The cave-entrances lie to the west of Beaconwatch.\
\
Cúthing asked you to collapse the entrances of the Orcs' caves.","Cúthing is standing near Meregyth, outside the Mead Hall of Beaconwatch.\
\
You should return to Beaconwatch and let Cúthing know about your success.","Cúthing is standing near Meregyth, outside the Mead Hall of Beaconwatch.\
\
Meregyth asked you to speak with Cúthing and learn what he has planned.","Staging a Collapse","Talk to Cúthing"}},
[11255]={nameES="Stalactites Over the Bridge",objectivesES={"Protect the barricades at the end of the island bridge and stop the enemy from damaging Gamling's ballista.","Stalactites Over the Bridge","Gamling has fallen back to man the ballista near the centre of the Glittering Caves. He can fire the ballista into the opposite wall to cause stalactites to fall upon the centre bridge. Use the signaling flags near the bridges to indicate to Gamling to drop stalactites on the near, centre, or far end of the bridge.\
\
Merit Rating\
\
This quest starts with <rgb=#FFFF00>Full</rgb> Merit Rating.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Major Point Loss</rgb>\
- Every 25% health of the ballista\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Moderate Point Loss</rgb>\
- Barricades destroyed\
- Signaling flag destroyed\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Minor Point Loss</rgb>\
- Supply crate destroyed","<rgb=#FF0000>The ballista must not be destroyed</rgb>"}},
[11256]={nameES="Stalactites Over the Bridge",objectivesES={"Protect the barricades at the end of the island bridge and stop the enemy from damaging Gamling's ballista.","Stalactites Over the Bridge","Gamling has fallen back to man the ballista near the centre of the Glittering Caves. He can fire the ballista into the opposite wall to cause stalactites to fall upon the centre bridge. Use the signaling flags near the bridges to indicate to Gamling to drop stalactites on the near, centre, or far end of the bridge.\
\
Merit Rating\
\
This quest starts with <rgb=#FFFF00>Full</rgb> Merit Rating.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Major Point Loss</rgb>\
- Every 25% health of the ballista\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Moderate Point Loss</rgb>\
- Barricades destroyed\
- Signaling flag destroyed\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Minor Point Loss</rgb>\
- Supply crate destroyed","<rgb=#FF0000>The ballista must not be destroyed</rgb>","Defeat the trolls"}},
[11257]={nameES="Acechados por sombras",objectivesES={"The swamp-cats of the Drownholt prowl hungrily about, stalking any that move about unawares. They are causing the Elves of Estolad Mernael great unease.","Swamp-cats can be found in the drowned lands of the Drownholt, all around Estolad Mernael.\
\
Laidhriel has asked you to defeat many of the hunting swamp-cats that stalk the camp.","Habla con Laidhriel en Estolad Mernael","Acechados por sombras","Laidhriel can be found at Estolad Mernael, the Malledhrim camp in the Drownholt.\
\
You should speak with Laidhriel and tell her of your success against the evil swamp-cats of the drowned lands."}},
[11258]={nameES="Stalker Thimmoth",objectivesES={"Stalker Thimmoth can be found scouting the Circle of Madness.\
\
You should defeat Stalker Thimmoth","Defeated Stalker Thimmoth","A powerful and stealthy morvul stalks the Circle of Madness.","Stalker Thimmoth","Defeat Stalker Thimmoth","Stalker Thimmoth has fallen by your hand, further protecting the Star-gazers' Spire from the eyes of your enemies.","Completado","You have found a powerful morvul scouting the Circle of Madness. Stalker Thimmoth should be defeated before he discovers the Ranger encampment in the Stargazers' Spire."}},
[11259]={nameES="Acechador de Haudh Iarchith",objectivesES={"Habla con Broderic Saucedales en Bree","Acechador de Haudh Iarchith","Gwigon Derrotado","Broderic Saucedales se encuentra cerca del Pabellón de Caza en el Callejón Embrujado en Bree.\
\
Debes regresar con Broderic Saucedales con noticias de tu éxito.","Haudh Methernil, el Túmulo de Ringdor y el Túmulo de Taradan están dispersos por las Quebradas de los Túmulos del norte.\
\
Broderic Saucedales te pidió que viajaras a lo profundo de Haudh Methernil, el Túmulo de Ringdor y el Túmulo de Taradan y derrotaras a Gwigon la araña, Tuétano el kergrim o Umnen el aguanegras.","Umnen Derrotado","Derrota a Gwigon, Umnen o Tuétano en Haudh Iarchith","Tuétano Derrotado","Broderic Saucedales habló de varias criaturas viles que habitan en las profundidades de Haudh Methernil, el Túmulo de Ringdor y el Túmulo de Taradan."}},
[11260]={nameES="Stalker of the Scrublands",objectivesES={"Mablung can be found at the Camp of the Host.\
\
You should return to Mablung and tell him you have defeated Múgbakh, The Stalker.","Defeated Múgbakh, The Stalker","Find and defeat Múgbakh, the Stalker, with the help of Faroth.\
\
Faroth must be present to find Múgbakh.  If you lose track of him, use the hound-calling whistle to summon him back.","Warg tracks can be found near the Camp of the Host.\
\
Follow the trail to find The Stalker.","Return to Mablung","Stalker of the Scrublands","Defeat Múgbakh, The Stalker","Mablung has asked you to track down a vicious Warg known as The Stalker with the help of Faroth. He is lurking somewhere in the Noman-lands."}},
[11261]={nameES="Acechadores y adiestradores de Altacima",objectivesES={"Thithrand se encuentra en la Guardia Orca, al suroeste de la Gran Escalera.\
\
Debes regresar con Thithrand, en la Guardia Orca, y decirle que has derrotado a los trasgos.","Los jinetes de huargos se abren paso por los riscos de las montañas y entran y salen de las sombras de Moria con facilidad. En la Gran Escalera, un líder y su envejecida montura han acudido a doblar la rodilla ante Igash el Fanático y Mazog.","Acechadores y adiestradores de Altacima","Los exploradores y adiestradores de los jinetes de huargos pueden encontrarse en la Gran Escalera, al noreste de la Guardia Orca.\
\
Thithrand teme que las fuerzas de los jinetes de huargos se conviertan en una unidad temible si no se les impide completar sus objetivos.","Habla con Thithrand en la Guardia Orca"}},
[11262]={nameES="Stalking to Gaerlond",objectivesES={"Defeat Burnalg within Gaerlond","Talk to Cúdor in Barad Rill","Cúdor has asked you to travel to Gaerlond and find the Orc's armour. Once there, ring the bell he gave you and defeat the Orc.\
\
Gaerlond is north-east of Barad Rill.","Cúdor will be thrilled to hear that the threat of the Orcs has stopped here.\
\
Cúdor can be found in Barad Rill.","Stalking to Gaerlond","You have defeated Burnalg","Cúdor has tracked the last of the Orc war band to Gaerlond and has asked you to finish them."}},
[11263]={nameES="Stalled Along the Road",objectivesES={"Assisted Fraid with thieves at the Galtrev Lumber-camp","Talk to Fraid at his waggon","Assist Fraid with stolen stacks of lumber","A shipment of wood from the lumber-camp was meant to arrive at Galtrev quite a while ago, but was stalled somewhere along the the road.","Stalled Along the Road","The driver of the wood-waggon has become lost somewhere between Galtrev and the nearby Galtrev Lumber-camp to the north.\
\
You should search for the missing driver and help the missing shipment reach Galtrev.","Fraid lies injured by his broken waggon in Pren Gwydh, near the Galtrev Lumber-camp.\
\
You should speak with Fraid again, now that you have helped to allay the threat of the Dragon-clan at the Galtrev Lumber-camp.","Assisted Fraid with stolen stacks of lumber","Assist Fraid with thieves at the Galtrev Lumber-camp"}},
[11264]={nameES="Aplastando al Enemigo",objectivesES={"Los gertheryg desolladores residen en los Bails de Himbar y sus alrededores.\
\
Maerchiniath te ha pedido que diezmes los números de los gertheryg desolladores.","Gath Forthnír está al oeste de Himbar, en las montañas.\
\
Tras derrotar a un buen número de gertheryg, debes volver a ver a Maerchiniath e informarle de que has tenido éxito.","Maerchiniath te ha pedido que diezmes los números de los gertheryg en los Bails de Himbar y sus alrededores.","Aplastando al Enemigo"}},
[11265]={nameES="Defensa en Amon Sûl",objectivesES={"Un enfrentamiento entre los Nazgûl y el mago Gandalf ha atraído a los sirvientes del Rey Brujo a la Cima de los Vientos. Con el fin de derrotar al Cargûl que guía a las fuerzas oscuras hacia las ruinas de Amon Sûl, el montaraz Candaith ha preparado una emboscada.","<rgb=#00FF00>El Cargûl ha sido vencido, y Candaith ha sobrevivido para llevar la noticia a Rivendel</rgb>","El líder de las fuerzas del Enemigo y artífice de este ataque ha hecho finalmente su aparición en el campo de batalla. Derrota a este siervo de los Nueve.","Informa a Candaith de tu llegada","<rgb=#00FF00>El segundo asalto ha sido rechazado. Tenéis unos momentos antes de que llegue el siguiente</rgb>","El tercer asalto ha comenzado. El poder del Enemigo mengua bajo el esfuerzo de sostener este ataque sobrenatural.","El segundo asalto ha comenzado. Fuerzas oscuras y poderosas están en juego.","El primer asalto ha comenzado. El Enemigo no se detendrá ante nada para destruir a Candaith y recuperar lo que perdió.","Candaith debe sobrevivir al asalto","Derrota al Cargûl","El Enemigo ha comenzado a avanzar","Candaith ha estado preparando las defensas en la Cima de los Vientos. Habla con él para confirmar el plan para repeler el inminente asalto.","<rgb=#00FF00>El primer asalto ha sido repelido. Solo hay unos breves instantes antes de que el Enemigo lo intente de nuevo</rgb>","Repele el segundo asalto","<rgb=#00FF00>El tercer asalto ha sido repelido. El Cargûl hace su entrada</rgb>","Defensa en Amon Sûl","Repele el tercer asalto","<rgb=#FF0000>Candaith ha sido derrotado</rgb>","Repele el primer asalto"}},
[11266]={nameES="Resistencia en Amon Sûl: Incursión",objectivesES={"Un enfrentamiento entre los Nazgûl y el mago Gandalf ha atraído a los sirvientes del Rey Brujo a la Cima de los Vientos. Con el fin de derrotar al Cargûl que guía a las fuerzas oscuras hacia las ruinas de Amon Sûl, el montaraz Candaith ha preparado una emboscada.","Resistencia en Amon Sûl: Incursión","Completa 'Resistencia en Amon Sûl' con un grupo de incursión"}},
[11267]={nameES="Defensa de Ost Galadh -- Diaria",objectivesES={"Párate en Ost Galadh","Defensa de Ost Galadh -- Diaria"}},
[11268]={nameES="Stangraf: A Glint in the Dark",objectivesES={"Stangraf has long been a source of iron and other metals commonly used for weapons, armour, and construction. Occasionally this mine has uncovered rarer veins, and it appears the new residents have uncovered a few. Perhaps Quickbeam would have some use for it.","Collect uncommon ore found within Stangraf for Quickbeam.","Stangraf: A Glint in the Dark"}},
[11269]={nameES="Stangraf: Driver in the Tunnels",objectivesES={"You should return to Quickbeam and inform him of your success within Stangraf.\
\
Quickbeam can be found at Derndingle.","Talk to Quickbeam","Defeated the leader of the invaders in Stangraf","You gather your belongings and prepare for the journey to Stangraf.","Defeat the leader of the invaders in Stangraf","Stangraf is no longer empty, and Quickbeam has sent you to the mine with the task of defeating the leader of whatever resides in the miners' worksite.","Eliminate the leader of the forces of Isengard within Stangraf.","Stangraf: Driver in the Tunnels"}},
[11270]={nameES="Stangraf: Squatters in the Mine",objectivesES={"Stangraf: Squatters in the Mine","Stangraf has acquired new residents since the mine was evacuated. The new squatters need to be evicted to prevent the enemy from taking the resources within.","Upon entering Stangraf, it is clear that the mine is no longer empty. The forces of Saruman must not claim the resources found within Stangraf."}},
[11271]={nameES="Stanric's Stand",objectivesES={"Help Stanric and Gadda to take a stand","Gadda is outside of the Mead Hall in Stangard.\
\
You should speak with Gadda.","Talk to Gadda","Stanric's Stand","Gadda wishes to thank you for your hard work on behalf of Stangard."}},
[11272]={nameES="Colores puros",objectivesES={"Lleva los materiales de vuelta a Menassiel en Cerin Amroth","Colores puros","Menassiel, en Cerin Amroth, quiere que recojas tiza y bayas rojas para crear los colores puros que hacen tan llamativo el arte élfico.\
\
Podrás extraer tiza de las rocas blancas situadas al norte, y recolectar las bayas de los arbustos que crecen en los bosques hacia el oeste.","Menassiel es una artista encargada de suministrar pigmentos a sus compañeros en Caras Galadhon. Te ha pedido ayuda para reunir los ingredientes base que necesita para elaborar algunos de sus colores más llamativos.","Una vez reunidas las materias primas para los pigmentos blanco y rojo, llévalas de vuelva a Menassiel en Cerin Amroth."}},
[11273]={nameES="Colores intesos",objectivesES={"Menassiel es un artista que tiene la tarea de suministrar pigmentos a otros creadores en Caras Galadhon. Te ha pedido ayuda para reunir los ingredientes básicos de algunos de los colores más intensos que va a elaborar.","Menassiel, en Cerin Amroth, desea que recojas tiza y bayas rojas para crear esos colores intensos que hacen que el arte élfico sea tan llamativo.\
\
Puedes extraer la tiza de las rocas blancas situadas al norte. Recolecta las bayas rojas de los arbustos que se encuentran en los bosques hacia el oeste.","Una vez reunidas las materias primas para los pigmnentos blanco y rojo, llévalas de vuelva a Menassiel en Cerin Amroth.","Colores intesos","Lleva los materiales de vuelva a Menassiel en Cerin Amroth"}},
[11274]={nameES="Starlight and Shadows",objectivesES={"The sorcerer responsible for the corruption of Minas Gîl may be found atop the pinnacle of that tower.\
\
Agorin has instructed you to gather allies and defeat the sorcerer responsible for the corruption of Minas Gîl and put an end to his sorcery.","Agorin has asked you to gather a group of companions in order to launch an assault upon the summit of Minas Gîl, where some powerful sorcery is underway.","Talk to Agorin at Ost Galadh","Agorin is at Ost Galadh.\
\
You should return to Ost Galadh with news of your victory.","Starlight and Shadows","Talk to Agorin to travel to Minas Gîl"}},
[11275]={nameES="Stars of Merit Allowance",objectivesES={}},
[11276]={nameES="Starving Them Out",objectivesES={}},
[11277]={nameES="Starving in the Snow",objectivesES={"You ask the man if he needs any assistance, since you are passing through.\
\
'No thank ye... I keep to meself up here, and I like it that way. But if ya want to know what's amiss up on this tor, the wildcats are more vicious than usual.\
\
'Ye might want to look into the matter, if ye have time. Oh... and watch out for them crows. They're new.'","The snowcats in the western High Knolls have become extremely aggressive.","You have examined many starved goats in the western hills of the High Knolls. The signs of an epic struggle to survive are apparent all over Wildermore.","Goats can be found in the hills of the western High Knolls.\
\
You should examine the goats.","Completado","Starving in the Snow"}},
[11278]={nameES="Starving the Shapag-hai",objectivesES={}},
[11279]={nameES="Statement of Purpose",objectivesES={}},
[11280]={nameES="Status Report",objectivesES={}},
[11281]={nameES="Conteniendo el Flujo",objectivesES={"Has logrado derrotar a los herreros montañeses de Angmar que vinieron a fortalecer a los Rauta-lehmä.","Se están forjando armas especiales en los campamentos orientales para los Rauta-lehmä por los montañeses de Angmar, que descienden desde la boca del Ram Dúath.\
\
Debes derrotar a los herreros montañeses en su campamento, pues representan una gran amenaza para los pueblos libres de las Quebradas del Norte.","Se están forjando armas especiales en los campamentos orientales para los Rauta-lehmä por los montañeses de Angmar, que descienden desde la boca del Ram Dúath.","Derrota a los herreros montañeses","Los herreros montañeses están acampados al sureste del Ram Dúath.\
\
Debes derrotar a los herreros antes de que puedan forjar más armas para los Rauta-lehmä.","Completado","Conteniendo el Flujo"}},
[11282]={nameES="Manteniéndose ágil",objectivesES={"Manteniéndose ágil","Habla con Eija","Eija se encuentra en Kauppa-kohta, a orillas del lago.\
\
Mainio te sugirió que hablaras con su madre, Eija, para saber si podría necesitar tu ayuda.","Los trineos —o kelkka, como los llaman los Lossoth— hechos de madera y hueso son una visión habitual en los campamentos lossoth. Los Lossoth los usan para transportar mercancías y suministros entre sus asentamientos, principalmente porque pueden soportar el peso de la carga sin hundirse en la nieve. Los Lossoth necesitan estos trineos de manera constante."}},
[11283]={nameES="Staying Prepared",objectivesES={"You have repaired the barricades protecting Sûru. You should return to Ningêna.","Talk to Ningêna","The barricades protecting Sûru from Ordâkhai attacks were damaged in recent fighting.","Staying Prepared","Ningêna has asked you to repair the barricades protecting Sûru."}},
[11284]={nameES="Recuperando lo robado",objectivesES={"Varias bolsas de monedas han desaparecido de los viajeros que se encontraron con los trasgos de Snaga-maudhûl.","Wegil se encuentra en el lado noreste de Snaga-maudhûl en la Gran Excavación.\
\
Debes llevar las monedas que recuperaste a Wegil.","Lleva las monedas que recuperaste a Wegil","Los goblins ladrones se pueden encontrar en Snaga-maudhûl, en la zona occidental de la Gran Excavación.\
\
Debes recuperar las monedas de los viajeros enanos que han sido robadas por los trasgos emboscadores.","Recuperando lo robado"}},
[11285]={nameES="Stealing From Their Own",objectivesES={"Deliver the stolen goods to Eshmun at the Harbour-warden's Tower","Eshmun, Captain of the Haven, can be found at the Harbour-warden's Tower in the Sail-haven of Umbar Baharbêl.\
\
You have recovered many of the goods stolen by the Heirsworn in the Sail-haven. You should return to Eshmun.","Stolen goods can be found on ships crewed by Heirsworn Corsairs in the Sail-haven.\
\
Eshmun has asked you to recover goods stolen from Umbari merchants and from the markets of Umbar Baharbêl.","Stealing From Their Own","Determined to pillage the Free City before making their escape to the Shield Isles or more distant shores, the Heirsworn have taken to robbing merchants and raiding the markets of Umbar Baharbêl."}},
[11286]={nameES="Stealing History",objectivesES={"Corsairs of Umbar can be found throughout Edhellond in north-western Belfalas.\
\
Dolvir has asked you to recover any Elvish relics you can find from the raiding Corsairs in Belfalas.","Stealing History","DNT -- will not be seen","Talk to Dolvir","Dolvir can be found on a hilltop to the east of Edhellond.\
\
You have recovered many stolen Elvish relics, and should now return them to Dolvir.","In addition to threatening the lives of countless Gondorians, the Corsairs of Umbar seek to steal anything of value in Edhellond, including relics of the Elves who once dwelt there."}},
[11287]={nameES="Robando reservas",objectivesES={"Los granjeros de Donnvail producen tanta comida como pueden en esta tierra hostil, pero los Angmarim se apoderan de la mayor parte para ellos y su ejército.","Las reservas de comida se guardan dentro de la ciudad de Donnvail, al noreste de Fail-á-Khro.\
\
Ekhagan te ha pedido que robes reservas de comida de la ciudad de Donnvail, donde se guardan para el ejército de Angmar, para que él pueda distribuirlas entre los hambrientos de su tribu.","Robando reservas","Lleva las reservas de comida a Ekhagan"}},
[11288]={nameES="Stealing a Soul",objectivesES={}},
[11289]={nameES="Stealing and Squealing",objectivesES={}},
[11290]={nameES="Stealing from the Enemy",objectivesES={"Orcs have been hard at work chopping down trees and harvesting wood for their siege-weapons in Nîn-stazg.","Orcs build siege-weapons in the forest south-east of Floodwend.\
\
You should gather wood from the encampment where the Orcs have been chopping down trees.","Stealing from the Enemy","Completado","The supplies you captured from the Orcs will be put to far better use in the hands of Floodwend's people. You did well to retrieve the wood stockpiles from the grip of Mordor."}},
[11291]={nameES="Steeds of the Orc-chieftains",objectivesES={"Defeat Ogarbur","Defeat Mangáth","Defeated Mangáth","Steeds of the Orc-chieftains","Valdi can be found in Amdân.\
\
You should talk to Valdi.","Return to Valdi","Defeat Zaugnakh","Defeated Zaugnakh","Defeated Grámoz","Warg champions can be found in eastern Azanulbizar.\
\
Valdi has asked you to defeat Warg champions.","Among the hills of Azanulbizar, deadly Wargs vie for the privilege of being steed to the Orc-chieftains.","Defeated Ogarbur","Defeat Grámoz"}},
[11292]={nameES="Stem the Tide",objectivesES={"The camp at Sâd Doldúr proved to be a terrible place, full of sorcerers and fell spirits. Worse yet, it appears to be the source of the blight in the Ashenslades.","Faerchiril is at Barad Angol.\
\
Himeirion has asked you to tell the Elf-scholar Faerchiril about your findings in Sâd Doldúr.","Talk to Faerchiril at Barad Angol","Stem the Tide"}},
[11293]={nameES="Stemming a Blighted Tide",objectivesES={"Return to Elder Jurmêna in Sormedân","Return to Elder Jurmêna in Sormedân with the report of your success.","Elder Jurmêna in Sormedân has asked you to burn blighted saplings near Shádhag, to stem the tide of blight overflowing from Adagím.","Stemming a Blighted Tide","Burn the afflicted saplings near Shádhag. Shádhag can be found north-west of Sormedân."}},
[11294]={nameES="Steps Within the Dead City",objectivesES={"Help Dorgam with 'Weaken the Barricades'","Dorgam and Dolenthol ventured into the fortifications to the east to gather more information about the Orcs.\
\
You should search for Dorgam and discover what he has learned.","Help Damrod with 'Clear the Path'","Talk to Damrod","Help Dolenthol with 'A Hasty Escape'","Find Dorgam","Dorgam has asked that you assist the Rangers in Zhar Dushgoi.\
\
You should complete 'Weaken the Barricades' to help the Rangers in the Circle of Wrath.","Dorgam has sent you ahead to locate and assist Dolenthol in the Circle of Wrath.\
\
You should find Dolenthol.","Find Dolenthol","Steps Within the Dead City","Dolenthol requires your aid in completing several tasks while deep behind enemy lines.\
\
You should complete quests to help the Rangers in the Circle of Wrath.","Damrod has asked that you find and support two Rangers that have gone westward into the outer tier of Minas Morgul.","Damrod can be found in Barad Angarth, in the Circle of Wrath.\
\
You should talk to Damrod and apprise him of the situation amongst Gothmog's Orcs.","Help Dolenthol with 'Thin the Ranks'","Help Dolenthol with 'Orders from Above'","With your tasks completed, you should return to Dolenthol.","Talk to Dolenthol","Damrod has asked that you assist the Rangers in Zhar Dushgoi.\
\
You should complete 'Clear a Path' to help the Rangers in the Circle of Wrath."}},
[11295]={nameES="Los peldaños de la Gran Escalera",objectivesES={"Ayuda a Ossur con los trolls de la Gran Escalera","Avar, Ossur y Thithrand se encuentran en la Guardia Orca.\
\
Avar te ha pedido que completes las diversas tareas necesarias para recuperar la Gran Escalera antes de enviarte de vuelta con Narfi a la Sala Vigesimoprimera.","Ayuda a Thithrand con los jinetes de huargos de la Gran Escalera","Ayuda a Thithrand con los orcos de la Mano Blanca de la Gran Escalera","Habla con Avar en la Guardia Orca","Ayuda a Ossur con los orcos de fuego de la Gran Escalera","Avar se encuentra en la Guardia Orca.\
\
Los enanos de la Guardia Orca están satisfechos de que las fuerzas orcas de la Gran Escalera ya no representen una amenaza para Lothlórien.","La Gran Escalera se alzaba antaño al pie de un gran cruce de caminos dentro de Moria. En el apogeo de la gran ciudad, conducía a todas las zonas de las salas y era una maravilla majestuosa de contemplar. Ahora ha quedado bajo el control de Igash, un lugarteniente de Mazog, el líder de los orcos de Moria. Igash ha reunido en un solo lugar a las fuerzas de orcos y trolls de Moria y ha recaudado tributos de cada uno para llevarlos algún día al líder de los orcos. Por ahora, cada tribu pugna por ganarse el favor del lugarteniente, un seguidor fanático de Mazog.","Los peldaños de la Gran Escalera","Ayuda a Avar con los orcos de Moria de la Gran Escalera"}},
[11296]={nameES="Steward of the Dead",objectivesES={"Harnion can be found along the road through Tarlang's Crown, to the north of Edhellond in Belfalas.\
\
You have defeated the oathbreaker, Nerzus, for a third time and weakened Azruthor's hold on Tarlang's Crown. You should now return to Harnion.","Talk to Harnion","A grim leader of the Dead has revealed himself in Tarlang's Crown, pledging those who follow him to service of the Heirs of Castamir.","The leader of the Dead can be drawn forth by defeating many of the Dead in the main encampment in Tarlang's Crown.\
\
Gondren has asked you to seek out the leader of the Dead in Tarlang's Crown, hoping that it will weaken the alliance between the Dead and the Heirs of Castamir.","Nerzus has been defeated once more!","DNT -- will not be seen","Draw forth and defeat the leader of the Dead in Tarlang's Crown","Steward of the Dead"}},
[11297]={nameES="Sticks and Stones",objectivesES={"Taskmaster Dromdas is at Gramsfoot.\
\
You should return to Taskmaser Dromdas and inform him that you did the work he requested done.","Sticks and Stones","Taskmaster Dromdas is at Gramsfoot.\
\
Angmar's army wishes to dislodge the Free Peoples from the Ettenmoors and have enlisted the assistance of trolls to undertake the endeavour. Of course, the work of Angmar must continue and the troll's work must be completed. If you wish to help the trolls, you should speak with Taskmaster Dromdas again.","Talk to Taskmaster Dromdas at Gramsfoot and complete a patrol through the Ettenmoors as a Troll (Cost: 500 Commendations)","Talk to Taskmast Dromdas at Gramsfoot","Angmar's inability to destroy the Free Peoples holed up in the farthest reaches of the Ettenmoors has prompted the army's leaders to summon more trolls from the north."}},
[11298]={nameES="Sticky-fingered Spiders",objectivesES={"Return to Ilzhâna","Ilzhâna, a perfectly legitimate trader in Tilmakhím, has asked you to recover some missing parcels and slay the spiders who stole them. She asked you not to look inside.","Spiders and their captured prey can be found in Shak Phêlex, on the eastern side of Tâkhdar.\
\
Slay spiders throughout Tilmakhím and collect Ilzhâna's missing probably-not-contraband parcels. The spiders probably dragged them back to their nest in Shak Phêlex.","Ilzhâna can be found at Tilmakhím on the western side of Tâkhdar.\
\
Return to Ilzhâna with the parcels.","Sticky-fingered Spiders"}},
[11299]={nameES="Stilling the Wade",objectivesES={"Éowyn can be found outside Meduseld in Edoras.\
\
You have bested the White Hand at Entwade and returned to Edoras. You should speak to Éowyn.","Talk to Éowyn outside Meduseld","Talk to Éowyn and defend Entwade","Éowyn can be found outside Meduseld in Edoras.\
\
Éowyn has asked you to ride with her to Entwade to combat the White Hand forces. You should speak to her when you are ready.","Stilling the Wade","Hoping to cut down the White Hand invaders once and for all, Éowyn rides to Entwade with vengeance in her heart."}},
[11300]={nameES="Moscas Punzantes",objectivesES={"Las moscas guadaña han infestado el Páramo Alto, en el Bosque de los Trolls.\
\
Canaddal te ha pedido que purgues el Páramo Alto de moscas guadaña.","Canaddal ha acampado en el Páramo Alto, en el Bosque de los Trolls.\
\
Deberías regresar con Canaddal y hacerle saber que has hecho lo que pidió.","Habla con Canaddal","Moscas Punzantes","Las moscas guadaña se extienden por el Páramo Alto, trayendo la amenaza de enfermedad... y posiblemente la causa del comportamiento feral de los linces."}},
[11301]={nameES="Provocando Problemas",objectivesES={"Aeglas, el Elfo, no está dispuesto a permanecer ocioso en su celda: tiene un plan para revertir la situación contra los trasgos de la Ciudad de los Trasgos.","Recogida una estaca afilada","Recoge una estaca afilada de los túneles sobre la prisión de la Ciudad de los Trasgos","Lleva la estaca afilada a Aeglas en su celda en la prisión de la Ciudad de los Trasgos","Provocando Problemas","Hay montones de postes atados en los túneles principales de la Ciudad de los Trasgos.\
\
Aeglas cree que puede hacer que orcos y trasgos se enfrenten entre ellos, pero su plan requiere que le traigas una estaca afilada."}},
[11302]={nameES="Stirring the Nest",objectivesES={}},
[11303]={nameES="Agitación en Helegrod",objectivesES={"Agitación en Helegrod","Anornaneth ha observado un incremento en el nivel de actividad en los muros de Helegrod, la ciudad enana perdida en las Montañas Nubladas, y está preocupada sobre lo que podría significar.","El Señor Elrond está en la librería de su casa en Rivendel.\
\
Anornaneth te ha pedido que le comuniques sus miedos sobre Helegrod a Elrond."}},
[11304]={nameES="Stocking for the Siege",objectivesES={"Baldmund is at the inn in Stoke.\
\
You should return to Baldmund and let him know that you have done as he requested.","Deliver provisions to the provision stockpile","Meat and ivory can be collected from the aurochs to the south and west and the deer to the north, south, and east. Hides can be collected from wolves, deer, and aurochs.\
\
Baldmund has asked you to help provision the town for the coming siege.","Talk to Baldmund","Stocking for the Siege","The provision stores are in Stoke, outside the inn.\
\
You should bring the provisions you gathered to the provision stockpile.","DNT -- Will not be seen","War is afoot, and the town of Stoke is preparing for the inevitable siege."}},
[11305]={nameES="Abasteciendo la Despensa",objectivesES={"Las manadas de uros se encuentran por todas las colinas al oeste del Patio de Frerin.\
\
Mata algunas de las bestias y lleva su carne de vuelta a Bogi.","Bogi está preocupado porque los barbiluengos no tienen suficiente comida para una estancia prolongada. Necesita carne de uro para ayudar a abastecer la despensa en la Mansión de Thorin.","Abasteciendo la Despensa","Lleva la carne de uro a Bogi"}},
[11306]={nameES="Reabasteciendo el estanque",objectivesES={"Los peces más apreciados por los Hombres pueden encontrarse pescando en el estanque, cerca de la granja de Pierson, al sur de la ciudad de Bree.\
\
Deberías reunir peces en Bree para ayudar a abastecer el Festival del Lithe en la Comarca.","Reabasteciendo el estanque","Los peces más apreciados por los Elfos pueden encontrarse pescando a lo largo de los muelles de Celondim, en Ered Luin.\
\
Deberías reunir peces en Celondim para ayudar a abastecer el Festival del Lithe en la Comarca.","Los peces que mejor representan a los enanos se encuentran dentro de la Mansión de Thorin.\
\
Deberías ir a la Mansión de Thorin y recoger peces para el Festival del Lithe.","Busca el mejor lugar en Celondim para atrapar luillim","Busca el mejor lugar para atrapar corvinas","Habla con Neddie Cavada en Delagua","Neddie Cavada espera tu variada colección de peces en Delagua, en la Comarca.\
\
Deberías llevar los peces a Neddie Cavada para que Delagua esté debidamente abastecida para el Festival del Lithe.","Este parece un excelente lugar para pescar","El Festival del Lithe ha comenzado, pero sin suficientes peces en el estanque, sin duda será un desastre.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando finalice el festival actual.</rgb>","Busca el mejor lugar para atrapar serviolas","Neddie Cavada espera tu variada colección de peces en Delagua, en la Comarca.\
\
Deberías llevar los peces a Neddie Cavada para que el estanque esté bien abastecido para el Festival del Lithe."}},
[11307]={nameES="Los robustos habitantes del oeste",objectivesES={"Busca a los enanos que se encuentran cerca de una cueva en el centro de las Tierras Solitarias, cerca de unas ruinas ocupadas por los Duramano.\
\
Hunulf mencionó que varios enanos han atravesado recientemente las Tierras Solitarias.","Hunulf te informó de que hay gente del oeste que vagaba por las Tierras Solitarias, algunos se detuvieron en su campamento en Ost Guruth y decidieron que valía la pena investigar los rumores que habían oído sobre sus hermanos ocupando unas ruinas. Te envió a su ubicación.","Los robustos habitantes del oeste"}},
[11308]={nameES="Stolen Gems",objectivesES={}},
[11309]={nameES="Stolen Keepsake",objectivesES={}},
[11310]={nameES="Stolen Livelihood",objectivesES={"Stolen Livelihood","Bring the sacks of rice to Turizi","The bandits that stole the farmers rice can be found north of Ekagar in Ambarûl.","You have recovered the stolen rice. You should return to Turizi at Ekagar in Ambarûl.","Turizi has asked you to retrieve the stolen bags of rice from bandits."}},
[11311]={nameES="Stolen Mementos",objectivesES={"Speak with Rashâm in Kheb Hanût.","Search the bandit camp for the Ghôlkhas patriarch's armour","Search for clues as to the armour's whereabouts","Speak with Rashâm in Kheb Hanût","Bandits tend to lurk in north-west Tâkhdar.\
\
Okhtâr Ghôlkhas, head of a prominent family, has asked you to retrieve heirloom armour a group of bandits called the Denjâri stole from the family tomb. He has asked you to retrieve it.","Defeat Denjâri bandits.","The patriarch of the Ghôlkhas noble family has asked you to retrieve a set of armour stolen from his family during the days of the Heirs of Castamir.","Steely-eyed brigands leap to defend their encampment","Look for Rashâm in the black market of Kheb Hanût","Rashâm can be found in the black market of Kheb Hanût.\
\
A letter from the Denjâri bandits' leader says she has sold the Ghôlkhas's stolen armour to a black market fence named Rashâm.","You found a letter: the stolen armour was sold to a black market fence named Rashâm","Stolen Mementos","Rashâm should be here somewhere"}},
[11312]={nameES="Moral robada",objectivesES={"Has encontrado un gran saco de levadura robada en el campamento minero fuera de Thurûm, con señales de haber pertenecido antes a Othrikar.","Hornbori está en Othrikar.\
\
Debes llevar la levadura robada a Hornbori.","Lleva la levadura a Hornbori","Has encontrado un gran saco de levadura robada en el campamento minero fuera de Thurûm, con señales de haber pertenecido antes a Othrikar. Los buenos enanos de Othrikar seguramente echarán de menos el ingrediente clave para su cerveza.","Se pueden encontrar sacos de levadura alrededor de los campamentos en Thurûm, al norte de Othrikar.\
\
Debes recoger sacos de levadura robados de Othrikar.","Moral robada"}},
[11313]={nameES="Notas Robadas",objectivesES={"Devuelve las notas a Oddvarr","Los orcos Tarkrîp de los alrededores de Cirith Nûr, al oeste y noroeste de Oddvarr en los campos del norte de Bree, han robado las valiosas notas de Oddvarr. Oddvarr se encuentra al sureste de la Granja Hengstacer, cerca de las ruinas.\
\
Las notas de Oddvarr han desaparecido, y él sospecha que los orcos Tarkrîp se las llevaron. Uno de los orcos debe tenerlas, si tan solo puedes descubrir cuál.","La mochila de Oddvarr fue recuperada, pero no está mejor. Las notas que escribió están desaparecidas, y sospecha que algunos orcos se las llevaron.","Notas Robadas"}},
[11314]={nameES="Hierba para pipa robada",objectivesES={"Himloc Grouse está en la plaza del pueblo de Entibo.\
\
Recuperaste la hierba para pipa de Himloc de los bandidos Montebruno, tal como pidió el Condestable Bolger. Deberías devolvérsela a Himloc lo antes posible.","Lleva el barril de hierba para pipa robada a Himloc Grouse","Recolecta la hierba para pipa robada","La hierba para pipa robada de Himloc debería estar en las ruinas ocupadas por bandidos en Ost Baranor, al sur y ligeramente al oeste de la casa del Condestable Bolger.\
\
El Condestable Bolger te ha pedido que recuperes la hierba para pipa de Himloc de los bandidos.","Lleva la hierba para pipa robada a Himloc Grouse en Entibo","El Condestable Bolger quiere evitar recibir más cartas de Himloc Grouse y está decidido a detener los robos en los campos de Himloc.","Hierba para pipa robada"}},
[11315]={nameES="Stolen Pride",objectivesES={"Eowils is outside Atburg in the Rushgore, south-east of Aculf's camp.\
\
Aculf told you to report your successes to the scout Eowils.","Bring the relics you recovered to Eowils outside Atburg in the Rushgore","Aculf and his border-guard discovered the location of the brigands raiding Parth Celebrant for relics.","Relics of the Rohirrim can be found throughout the camp and on the treasure-seekers at Atburg, south-east of Aculf's camp in the Rushgore.\
\
Aculf has asked you to recover relics of the Rohirrim from the brigand treasure-seekers.","Stolen Pride"}},
[11316]={nameES="Stolen Pride of Dunland",objectivesES={}},
[11317]={nameES="Stolen Pride of the East",objectivesES={}},
[11318]={nameES="Cráneos robados",objectivesES={"Los cráneos de uro probablemente estén en Skathmur, en la parte este de Ram Dûath.\
\
Santtu te ha pedido que recuperes un cráneo de uro robado.","Al parecer, los cráneos de uro tienen un significado especial para los Hijos de la tierra de Suuri-lehmä, y algunos les han sido robados.","Lleva el cráneo de uro de vuelta a Santtu en Lehmä-koti","Cráneos robados"}},
[11319]={nameES="Stolen Stacks of Lumber",objectivesES={}},
[11320]={nameES="Stolen Supplies",objectivesES={"A lone boot rests on the path","Find the thief","The trail has led you to a young goblin standing by the path.\
\
You should confront the thief.","Faeron can be found at Viznak's hideout.\
\
You should talk to Faeron.","Talk to Faeron","While out scouting, someone rifled through the Ranger camp and stole all of Rhadrog and Faeron's supplies. Follow the trail and track down the thief.","The goblin thief has run east, deeper into the swamp.\
\
You should chase after the thief!","Find third clue","A thief stole supplies from the Agarnaith Ranger camp and fled into the swamp.\
\
You should follow the thief's trail.","You see the goblin being stuffed into a sack and carried away by an Orc","An empty sack lies in the road","Find fourth clue","Find Viznak's hideout","The goblin has been carried off, but Rhadrog seems to have found his hideout nearby.\
\
You should find Viznak's hideout.","Someone took a bite out of this loaf and then discarded it","Confront the thief","While chasing the goblin thief, you were ambushed by crazed Orcs.\
\
You should defeat your ambushers!","A dagger was left behind here","Find first clue","Stolen Supplies","Find second clue"}},
[11321]={nameES="Stolen Sweets",objectivesES={}},
[11322]={nameES="Tesoros robados",objectivesES={"Bolso de Ann Granger recolectado","Tesoros robados","Lleva el bolso a Ann Granger","Recolecta el bolso de Ann Granger","Cuando Ann Granger, miembro de la guarnición del Capitán Helecharroyo, fue expulsada de sus tierras por los Montebruno, perdió un bolso que contenía cosas valiosas para ella.","El Nido de los Montebruno se encuentra en las ruinas al sur del Refugio del Cazador.\
\
Ann Granger te pidió que fueras a la guarida de los Montebruno y recuperaras su bolso robado."}},
[11323]={nameES="Stolen is as Good as New",objectivesES={}},
[11324]={nameES="Un estómago de hierro",objectivesES={"Skûmfil se encuentra al sureste del Refugio Sombrío.\
\
A Pentlenn le gustaría examinar las entrañas de los gredbyg de Skûmfil para ver si hay alguna enfermedad en ellos que pueda estar afectando a los orcos.","Skûmfil no es más que un vertedero, un lugar donde se arrojan a los orcos muertos de Moria cuando empiezan a apestar. Es allí donde dos enemigos se han reunido, cada uno con la intención de usar los cadáveres para sus propios fines. Los kergrim y otros carroñeros los utilizan como fuente de alimento, y los insectos, como lugar para poner sus huevos y engendrar futuras generaciones.","Llévale las vísceras a Pentlenn en el Refugio Sombrío","Un estómago de hierro"}},
[11325]={nameES="Pisotea musarañas - Una musaraña enorme",objectivesES={"Otro héroe ha derrotado a la musaraña enorme en esta ronda","Asigna las botas para pisotear musarañas a tu barra de habilidades y espera el ataque","Toma las botas para pisotear musarañas de la caja cercana","Las molestas musarañas se encuentran en el centro del Jardín del Festival de Duillond, y las botas para pisotearlas están en tu inventario.\
\
Debes localizar las botas en tu inventario y asignarlas como habilidad. Con estas botas podrás pisotear a las fastidiosas musarañas que infestan el jardín. Cuando lo hayas hecho, espera en el centro del jardín, pues Dinedhrín te ha desafiado a derrotar a la gran y feroz musaraña que aparece en cada ronda del juego.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Para asignar las botas como habilidad, arrastra el objeto 'Botas Enormes' desde tu inventario a tu barra de habilidades.</rgb>\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Las musarañas molestas son inmunes a cualquier otro ataque o maniobra ofensiva.</rgb>","Se te ha acabado el tiempo","Habla con Dinedhrín","Las botas necesarias para pisotear musarañas pueden encontrarse cerca de las escaleras del Jardín del Festival.\
\
Debes recoger las botas de la caja y arrastrarlas a tu barra de habilidades, pues las necesitarás para ahuyentar a las musarañas.","Dinedhrín se encuentra en el Jardín Élfico de Duillond.\
\
Debes hablar con Dinedhrín y contarle tu victoria contra las musarañas.","Entra en el recinto del jardín","Has entrado en el jardín. Asegúrate de tener las botas para musarañas asignadas a tu barra de habilidades","La musaraña enorme puede encontrarse en el centro del Jardín del Festival de Duillond.\
\
Dinedhrín te ha pedido que derrotes a la musaraña enorme, que solo aparece una vez por ronda.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Para asignar las botas como habilidad, arrastra el objeto 'Botas Enormes' desde tu inventario a tu barra de habilidades.</rgb>\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Las musarañas molestas son inmunes a cualquier otro ataque o maniobra ofensiva.</rgb>","La musaraña enorme ha sido expulsada... por ahora","Pisotea musarañas - Una musaraña enorme","Las botas enormes son excelentes para pisotear musarañas enormes.","Has recogido botas para pisotear musarañas","Los Elfos de Duillond tienen un jardín que debería lucir espléndido para el Festival de Primavera. Lamentablemente, ha sido invadido recientemente por musarañas.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro cuando finalice el festival actual. </rgb>"}},
[11326]={nameES="Patea una musaraña para la jardinera relajada",objectivesES={"Asigna las botas para pisotear musarañas a tu barra de habilidades y espera el ataque","Toma las botas para pisotear musarañas de la caja cercana","Patea una musaraña para la jardinera relajada","Arrastra las botas a tu barra de habilidades y entra al jardín","Las musarañas molestas se encuentran en el centro del Jardín del Festival de Duillond.\
\
Maengamiel te ha pedido que derrotes muchas musarañas a tu propio ritmo.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Para asignar las botas como habilidad, arrastra el objeto 'Botas de Poder Imaginable' desde tu inventario a tu barra de habilidades.</rgb>\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Las musarañas molestas son inmunes a cualquier otro ataque o maniobra ofensiva.</rgb>","Maengamiel está en el Jardín Élfico de Duillond.\
\
Debes hablar con Maengamiel y contarle tu victoria contra las musarañas.","Habla con Maengamiel","Las botas necesarias para pisotear musarañas pueden encontrarse cerca de las escaleras del Jardín del Festival.\
\
Debes recoger las botas de la caja y arrastrarlas a tu barra de habilidades, pues las necesitarás para ahuyentar musarañas.","Has entrado en el jardín. Asegúrate de tener las botas para musarañas asignadas a tu barra de habilidades","Las musarañas molestas se encuentran en el centro del Jardín del Festival de Duillond, y las botas para pisotearlas están en tu inventario.\
\
Debes localizar las botas en tu inventario y asignarlas como habilidad. Estas botas pueden usarse para pisotear a las musarañas que infestan el jardín. Maengamiel te ha pedido que derrotes muchas musarañas en el jardín.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Para asignar las botas como habilidad, arrastra el objeto 'Botas de Poder Imaginable' desde tu inventario a tu barra de habilidades.</rgb>\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Las musarañas molestas son inmunes a cualquier otro ataque o maniobra ofensiva.</rgb>","Has recogido botas para pisotear musarañas","Los Elfos de Duillond tienen un jardín que debería lucir hermoso para el Festival de Primavera. Lamentablemente, hace poco fue invadido por musarañas.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro cuando finalice el festival actual. </rgb>","Estas son unas buenas botas para trabajar en el jardín..."}},
[11327]={nameES="Patea una Musaraña para el jardinero experimentado",objectivesES={"Esta ronda ha terminado; no terminaste a tiempo","Estas botas están hechas para pisotear musarañas.","Asigna las botas para pisotear musarañas a tu barra de habilidades y espera el ataque","Toma las botas para pisotear musarañas de la caja cercana","Derrota musarañas antes de que termine la ronda","Habla con Brangloth","Las botas necesarias para pisotear musarañas pueden encontrarse cerca de las escaleras del Jardín del Festival.\
\
Debes recoger las botas de la caja y arrastrarlas a tu barra de habilidades, pues las necesitarás para ahuyentar musarañas.","Las musarañas molestas se encuentran en el centro del Jardín del Festival de Duillond.\
\
Brangloth insiste en que derrotes muchas musarañas antes de que el evento llegue a su fin.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Para asignar las botas como habilidad, arrastra el objeto 'Botas de Poder Imaginable' desde tu inventario a tu barra de habilidades.</rgb>\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Las musarañas molestas son inmunes a cualquier otro ataque o maniobra ofensiva.</rgb>","Has entrado en el jardín. Asegúrate de tener las botas para musarañas asignadas a tu barra de habilidades","Brangloth está en el Jardín del festival de Duillond.\
\
Debes hablar con Brangloth para contarle lo que sucedió con las musarañas molestas.","Has recibido botas para pisotear musarañas; debes asignarlas como habilidad y entrar al jardín","Patea una Musaraña para el jardinero experimentado","Has recogido botas para pisotear musarañas","Los Elfos de Duillond tienen un jardín que debería lucir hermoso para el Festival de Primavera. Lamentablemente, hace poco ha sido invadido por musarañas.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro cuando finalice el festival actual. </rgb>","Las musarañas molestas se encuentran en el centro del Jardín del Festival de Duillond.\
\
Debes localizar las botas en tu inventario y asignarlas como habilidad. Estas botas permiten pisotear a las musarañas que infestan el jardín. Cuando lo hayas hecho, espera en el centro del jardín a que aparezcan las musarañas. Brangloth insiste en que derrotes muchas musarañas antes de que el evento termine.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Para asignar las botas como habilidad, arrastra el objeto 'Botas de Poder Imaginable' desde tu inventario a tu barra de habilidades.</rgb>\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Las musarañas molestas son inmunes a cualquier otro ataque o maniobra ofensiva.</rgb>"}},
[11328]={nameES="Stone Dead",objectivesES={"Return to TBD Ziggurat Mason","Stone Dead","The harathar samples can be found in the TBD of TBD.\
\
A mason named TBD would like to get a closer look at some harathar outcroppings. He has asked you to collect some samples for him.","A mason named TBD has asked for your assistance in collecting several samples of bright green harathar stone from a small mine in TBD Location.","TBD Ziggurat Mason can be found TBD Location.\
\
You have acquired several good samples of harathar. It is time to return to TBD Ziggurat Mason for him to inspect the goods."}},
[11329]={nameES="Stone-biters",objectivesES={"Stone-biters","Foreman Brumbur can be found among the ruined mines of Járnfast.\
\
You have collected a number of harnessed stone-biters in the Ironfold and should deliver them to Foreman Brumbur in Járnfast.","Harnessed stone-biters can be found along the Emyn Engrin in the Ironfold.\
\
Foreman Brumbur has asked you to defeat and collect harnessed stone-biters that have inadvertently burrowed out of Járnfast.","As they find them useful in clearing less valuable stones, the Dwarves of the Ironfold have begun to share their mines with the cave-claws of the Emyn Engrin.","Deliver the harnessed stone-biters to Foreman Brumbur in Járnfast"}},
[11330]={nameES="Las provisiones de Siempreviva",objectivesES={"Burl Siempreviva te ha pedido que recuperes provisiones robadas de los orcos de Tharbad.\
\
Tharbad está en el sur de Cardolan.","La expedición de Burl Siempreviva a Tharbad se ha visto truncada por los orcos que han hecho de las ruinas su hogar.","Las provisiones de Siempreviva","Deberías llevar las provisiones recuperadas a Burl Siempreviva.\
\
Burl se encuentra cerca de Tharbad, en el sur de Cardolan.","Vuelve con Burl Siempreviva"}},
[11331]={nameES="Stonejaws Samples",objectivesES={"Exposed crystals can be found throughout the Pit of Stonejaws.\
\
You should hit exposed crystals with Fúni's pick and collect the crystal samples that break off.","You have collected samples of the crystals found in the Pit of Stonejaws.\
\
You should return to Fúni Gem-cutter in Bárgstad.","Talk to Fúni Gem-cutter","Fúni Gem-cutter has asked you to collect crystal samples from the Pit of Stonejaws.","Stonejaws Samples"}},
[11332]={nameES="Stonejaws: Leader of the Frost",objectivesES={"Defeat Anioch","Defeated Krigash","You should return to Zádokh Flint-eye and apprise him of your efforts.","Defeated Anioch","You ran out of time...","Ancient moon-letters are waiting to be uncovered by those who brave the long forgotten halls, deep within the Pit of Stonejaws.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Warning: This quest has a one hour time limit. The timer will begin upon accepting the quest.</rgb>","Defeat Anioch or Krigash.","Talk to Zádokh Flint-eye","Stonejaws: Leader of the Frost","Defeat Krigash"}},
[11333]={nameES="Stonejaws: The Frost-horde",objectivesES={"Ancient moon-letters are waiting to be uncovered by those who brave the long forgotten halls, deep within the Pit of Stonejaws.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Warning: This quest requires Stonejaws: Leader of the Frost to be underway. If that quest has been completed or failed, you will be unable to exit and re-enter this instance in order to complete this quest.</rgb>","The scout gives you a missive to defeat Angmarim or hobgoblins.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Warning: This quest requires Stonejaws: Leader of the Frost to be underway. If that quest has been completed or failed, you will be unable to exit and re-enter this instance in order to complete this quest.</rgb>","Stonejaws: The Frost-horde","Defeat Angmarim or hobgoblins."}},
[11334]={nameES="Stonejaws: The Moon-letters",objectivesES={"Ancient moon-letters are waiting to be uncovered by those who brave the long forgotten halls, deep within the Pit of Stonejaws.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Warning: This quest requires Stonejaws: Leader of the Frost to be underway. If that quest has been completed or failed, you will be unable to exit and re-enter this instance in order to complete this quest.</rgb>","Collect moon-letters.","The scout gives you a missive to collect moon-letters.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Warning: This quest requires Stonejaws: Leader of the Frost to be underway. If that quest has been completed or failed, you will be unable to exit and re-enter this instance in order to complete this quest.</rgb>","Stonejaws: The Moon-letters"}},
[11335]={nameES="Piedras para la sauna",objectivesES={"Las piedras que Kaleva necesita se pueden encontrar en la bahía de hielo, al este de Sûri-kylä, cerca de la orilla.\
\
Kaleva te ha pedido que consigas algunas rocas para la sauna.","Habla con Kaleva","La sauna de los Lossoth está en Sûri-kylä, al noreste de la bahía de hielo de Forochel.\
\
Kaleva te ha indicado que coloques las piedras de la bahía en montículos cerca del fuego, junto a la sauna Lossoth.","Coloca las piedras de la bahía junto al fuego","Piedras para la sauna","Kaleva está en Sûri-kylä.\
\
Ahora que has colocado las piedras, deberías hablar con Kaleva.","La sauna es una parte importante de la cultura Lossoth, pero han gastado casi todas las rocas que tenían para calentarlas y no han podido ir a buscar más."}},
[11336]={nameES="Stonewall Fandmau",objectivesES={}},
[11337]={nameES="Stoors for the Winter",objectivesES={"White stags can be found wandering throughout the Gloomglens in Enedwaith.\
\
Caradog Henbuch has asked you to hunt white stags and bring him the meat.","Caradog Henbuch is at Maur Tulhau in the Gloomglens of Enedwaith.\
\
You should bring the meat you collected back to Caradog Henbuch.","Stoors for the Winter","Talk to Caradog Henbuch at Maur Tulhau","Caradog Henbuch is the village butcher of Maur Tulhau. As winter approaches, he finds himself in greater need of meat for the village's stores."}},
[11338]={nameES="Stoors for the Winter -- Repeatable",objectivesES={"Talk to Caradog Henbuch at Maur Tulhau","Impressed by your abilities and grateful for the meat you provided him, Caradog Henbuch has become a trusted friend.","Caradog Henbuch is in Maur Tulhau in the Gloomglens fo Enedwaith.\
\
You should bring the meat and antlers you collected to Caradog Henbuch.","Stoors for the Winter -- Repeatable","White stags can be found throughout the Gloomglens.\
\
Caradog Henbuch has asked you to collect more stag-meat for himself and antlers for Rhosun Turio."}},
[11339]={nameES="Stop the Motion",objectivesES={}},
[11340]={nameES="Detener la producción",objectivesES={"Encuentra y derrota a Samûku","Detener la producción","Encuentra y derrota a Samûku en Zikrum-dûl.","Tu misión es viajar a Zikrum-dûl para derrotar a los boticarios y su líder, así como destruir sus estaciones de trabajo.","Samûku derrotado","Boticarios bandidos están convirtiendo el veneno de los usan-kûni. Necesitas destruir sus estaciones de trabajo y derrotar a los boticarios y su líder."}},
[11341]={nameES="Detén a los exploradores",objectivesES={"Regresa a Hannar","Los Duramano, una antigua familia enana en declive, fueron recientemente expulsados de los Salones de Thorin y de las minas de Othrikar por su traición al Pueblo de Durin, los barbiluengos. El clan rebelde sigue siendo una molestia en los North Downs.","Hay exploradores Duramano dispersos por la zona al norte de Othrikar.\
\
Para reducir la amenaza de que los Duramano se conviertan en algo más que una molestia, Hannar te ha pedido que pongas fin al espionaje sin restricciones de los exploradores Duramano.","Detén a los exploradores","Hannar está en Othrikar.\
\
Deberías regresar con Hannar."}},
[11342]={nameES="Stop the Spread",objectivesES={"Defeat Orthadban","Talk to Faerchiril at Barad Angol","Faerchiril is at Barad Angol, north of Sâd Doldúr.\
\
You should speak with Faerchiril and regale her with stories of your victory.","Orthadban can be found upon the topmost tier of Sâd Doldúr, south of Barad Angol.\
\
Faerchiril has asked you to defeat the foul sorcerer Orthadban.","Defeated Orthadban","On the topmost reaches of the ruins of Sâd Doldúr stands Orthadban, the foul sorcerer that the Malledhrim believe to be responsible for the summoning of fell spirits to the Ashenslades.","Stop the Spread"}},
[11343]={nameES="Detener la propagación de ucornos cortezasombría",objectivesES={"Los ucornos cortezasombría han sido derrotados, pero la oscuridad que los retorció sigue siendo un misterio.","La Encina Malvada puede ser invocada quemando la corteza sombría en la cima de una colina en el suroeste del Bosque Salvaje.\
\
Mantoespino te ha pedido que derrotes a la Encina Malvada.","Invoca y derrota a la Encina Malvada","Regresa con Mantoespino","Detener la propagación de ucornos cortezasombría","Encina Malvada derrotada","Mantoespino está en el sur del Bosque Salvaje.\
\
Deberías hablar con Mantoespino."}},
[11344]={nameES="Deteniendo el asedio",objectivesES={"Los orcos Blogmal están construyendo equipo de asedio en su campamento a las afueras de la antaño gran ciuda de Fornost.","Gareth Cope está en el campamento de los Pueblos Libres en las afueras, en el extremo sur de Fornost.\
\
Deberías volver junto a Gareth Cope para informarle de que has destruido un buen número de partes de armas de asedio.","Los orcos Blogmal están construyendo equipo de asedio en su campamento a las afueras de la antaño gran ciudad de Fornost.\
\
Sea cual sea su propósito no puede ser nada bueno. Deberías destruir el equipo de asedio.","Deteniendo el asedio","Informa a Gareth Cope de las armas de asedio que has destruido.","Están montando las partes de armas de asedio en el campamento orco del norte de Fornost.\
\
Deberías destruir las partes de las armas de asedio que los orcos Blogmal están montando."}},
[11345]={nameES="Parando la propagación",objectivesES={"Habla con Maeriel","Parando la propagación","Merruth te ha pedido que hables con su hermana, Maeriel, para ver qué se puede hacer con los huargos enfermos.\
\
Maeriel está en la Pradera de Juncos, en Cardolan.","Deberías decirle a MAeriel que has acabado con muchos huargos enfermos.\
\
Maeriel está en la Pradera de Juncos, en Cardolan.","La hermana de Merruth, Maeriel, te ha dicho que acabes con huargos enfermos antes de que se propague la enfermedad.\
\
Los huargos enfermos pueden encontrarse en la Pradera de Juncos."}},
[11346]={nameES="Stores for Hultvís",objectivesES={"Although the Woodmen survived the long siege of Hultvís during the War, many hunters fell to the Orcs of the Misty Mountains.","Madelgard can be found in Hultvís.\
\
You have gathered many cuts of meat from the boars at Málvang and should now deliver them to Madelgard.","Deliver the cuts of boar meat to Madelgard","Boars can be found at Málvang in southern Woodsedge.\
\
Madelgard has asked you to hunt boars at Málvang and gather meat for the Woodmen of Hultvís.","Stores for Hultvís"}},
[11347]={nameES="Stores for Winter",objectivesES={}},
[11348]={nameES="Reservas para el invierno",objectivesES={"El invierno en Ost Forod es largo y peligroso. Los vientos invernales soplan con fuerza desde Forochel al norte.","Varios de los habitantes de Ost Forod tienen trabajo que debe hacerse antes de que llegue el invierno.\
\
Basilio Resinas te dijo que antes de hacer lo que los Montaraces quieren, primero deben atenderse varias de las necesidades del pueblo.","Ayuda a Ballard Wilmer","Reservas para el invierno","Basilio Resinas está en Ost Forod.\
\
Basilio Resinas se alegrará de saber que Ost Forod está abastecido y preparado para un largo invierno.","Habla con Basilio Resinas en Ost Forod","Ayuda a Rowena Guardacotos","Ayuda a Clark Cercapiedra","Ayuda a Poppy Silleras"}},
[11349]={nameES="Cuento histórico: Empalizada de Helm",objectivesES={"Talk to Thenca atop Helm's Dike","Saruman's Orcs have advanced upon the eastern side of Helm's Dike, and you must stand against them with Cenric, Thenca, and Gamling.","Thenca stands atop Helm's Dike, awaiting your attention.","Cuento histórico: Empalizada de Helm","Talk to Cenric by the stable at Helm's Dike","As the soldiers of Rohan fight the invading Orcs on the western side of the Dike, Gamling has called you to him.","Thenca, one of the Rohirrim defenders of Helm's Dike, has asked for your help carrying bolts to the forward ballista.","Talk to Thenca by the stables near Helm's Dike","Cenric has stopped by the stables, despite the imminent arrival of Saruman's armies.","As you hurry between the defensive encampments at Helm's Dike alongside Gamling and other soldiers of Rohan, you have spotted the great war machine with which Saruman's forces hope to destroy the gate.","Follow Gamling to the far side of the Dike","Thenca is pleased you took the time to free the horses stabled at Helm's Dike, for the Orcs will soon be upon them.","Talk to Cenric at the forward ballista","Follow the soldiers of Rohan to the gate in Helm's Dike","Talk to Gamling on the western side of Helm's Dike","Saruman's forces march toward the fortress of Helm's Deep. Only one barrier stands in the way of Saruman's armies: the rampart of Helm's Dike, built across the trench through which Saruman's forces must pass. If the gate is broken, the green expanse before the wall will be laid bare to Rohan's approaching foes.","Cenric despairs that the steeds of the Rohirrim stabled at Helm's Dike will be slain by the invading Orcs, and he seeks your help untying the proud creatures so they may fight back against the aggressors.","Saruman's Orcs have advanced upon the western side of Helm's Dike, and you must stand against them with Cenric, Thenca, and Gamling.","Talk to Thenca at Helm's Dike","Fight alongside Cenric at Helm's Dike","Fight alongside Thenca at Helm's Dike","Pick up one of the ballista bolts near Thenca","Gamling has called for you at the eastern side of Helm's Dike.","Gamling has called for your assistance as he hurries to the far side of the Dike, there to combat Saruman's forces before they can crush the Rohirrim defenders.","Cenric accepted the bolts you and Thenca brought to the forward ballista, but he wears a worried expression, and his face is lined with fear.","Gamling has ordered you and the other soldiers of Rohan to fall back from the defence of Helm's Dike."}},
[11350]={nameES="Cuento histórico: El Muro del Bajo",objectivesES={"Talk to Egláf by the rock trap on the Deeping Wall","Legolas stands atop the Deeping Wall, ready for battle.","Push ladders away from the wall","Two more rock traps have been loaded atop the Deeping Wall, and Egláf waits for you to release their deadly contents onto the Orcs below.","Orcs have gained access to one of the towers and dealt Egláf a grievous blow. Protect him from their weapons!","Talk to Legolas atop the Deeping Wall","Drop the readied stones from the west trap","Defeat the Orcs on top of the tower above the Deeping Wall","Talk to Thenca atop the tower above the Deeping Wall","Orcs have climbed onto the top of the tower, and Egláf has sent you to clear them away.","Saruman's assault upon the defenders of Helm's Deep has begun, his forces scaling the Deeping Wall seeking to put an end to the people of Rohan.","Patrol the wall and defeat Orcs as they climb up and attack","There seems to be no end to Saruman's Orcs, but Thenca has sworn to defend the Deeping Wall and will do so with his life, if that proves necessary.","Orcs climb up the ladders leaning against the Deeping Wall and must be defeated. Legolas also asked you to push down as many of the ladders as you can.","The surprise Orc attack knocked Egláf down, but he has recovered from the surprise and wishes to speak to you.","Egláf has called for you to come to his aid.","Drop the readied stones from the remaining traps","Cuento histórico: El Muro del Bajo","Thenca has followed you onto the top of the tower above the Deeping Wall.","Thenca has followed you onto the top of the tower","Defend Thenca and keep him alive","Egláf has loaded the western rock trap on the Deeping Wall and waits for you to set it off.","Orcs continue to climb up the ladders leaning against the Deeping Wall and must be defeated. You should continue to knock down their ladders, slowing their progress.","Defend Egláf from the Orcs"}},
[11351]={nameES="Cuento histórico: El Valle del Bajo",objectivesES={"Talk to Burnoth in the Deeping-coomb","Saruman's foul craft has claimed the lives of both his own Orc-warriors and Rohirrim defenders on the Deeping Wall. Now his forces seek to gain access to the valley through the wreckage that remains.","Aragorn has asked you to defeat the Orcs and Dunlendings that have passed through the hole in the Deeping Wall and threaten the Rohirrim within the Deeping-coomb. He also wants you to extinguish the lit fuses on any black powder devices you find.","Egláf needs your help to retreat further into the Deeping-coomb.","Cuento histórico: El Valle del Bajo","The Orcs have set more devices containing black powder near the hole in the Deeping Wall, and the fuses have nearly reached the end of their short, dangerous lives!","The black powder within has been rendered harmless","Help Egláf to his feet","You have fought bravely against the forces of Saruman with the Riders Four in the Deeping-coomb, and now their captain Burnoth wishes to speak with you.","Talk to Aragorn in the Deeping-coomb","The Riders Four (and Friend) have achieved their victory!","Aragorn has returned from his sortie with Éomer, and now he has an urgent task for you.","Egláf is injured and needs your help to get away!","Léofdag and the rest of the Riders Four delight to stand alongside you in defence of their land, and together they hope to push back Saruman's forces.","Talk to Léofdag in the Deeping-coomb"}},
[11352]={nameES="Storied Tale: The Glittering Caves",objectivesES={"Éomer is waiting to hear of your success in the Glittering Caves.","Reassured sheltering folk within the Glittering Caves (4/4)","Talk to Ardith in the Glittering Caves","A woman in the Glittering Caves has heard your reassurances but still has questions for you.","Gimli calls for your attention from nearby","Spiders have trapped some of Éomer's scouts and must be slain if the men are to be freed.","Gimli is in the Glittering Caves, attempting to balance his awe at its beauty with the dangers contained within.","Talk to Gimli in the Glittering Caves","Léofa, a child of the Westfold who helped you defeat Lheu Brenin in the Glittering Caves, wishes to speak with you.","Some of Saruman's allies have discovered tunnels behind Helm's Deep, and threaten the sheltering Rohirrim in the haven they believed safe. Éomer and Gimli need your help to close off these tunnels and prevent such craven attacks.","Éomer has asked you to reassure the folk sheltering within the Glittering Caves that Théoden's warriors will keep them safe.","Éomer has come to the Glittering Caves and his anger at Lheu Brenin's attempted attack on his people knows no bounds.","Reassure sheltering folk that they will be safe (3/4)","Talk to Léofa in the Glittering Caves","You and Gimli have fought a number of enterprising Orcs and found Éomer deep within the Glittering Caves, at the passage where his scouts disappeared.","Talk to Éomer in the Glittering Caves","Storied Tale: The Glittering Caves"}},
[11353]={nameES="Storied Tale: The Hornburg",objectivesES={"Théoden leads a charge of his riders down the causeway into the waiting Orcs, and he has requested that you ride with him.","The fuse on the black powder bomb has been quenched, and the immediate danger has been avoided. Aragorn wishes to speak with you.","Aragorn refuses to give in to despair. He intends to defend the Hornburg even as the Orcs threaten to overrun the fortress.","Talk to Háma","Habla con Aragorn","King Théoden has slain a mighty war-troll, but the beast carried a black powder bomb with a lit fuse!","Quench the fuse on the black powder bomb","Háma, el guardián de la puerta de Théoden, se alza frente a Cuernavilla. Se prepara para recibir noticias de la batalla.","Ride with Théoden down the causeway into the waiting Orcs","Mount your travelling steed and talk to Théoden","Talk to Théoden","Listen to Aragorn and Théoden and decide what can be done","The defenders have thrown back another of Saruman's assaults, but ten thousand Orcs remain outside the walls. Aragorn and Théoden must decide if anything can be done.","Théoden stands atop the fortress, surveying his seemingly insurmountable foes.","In the hours before dawn, the forces of Saruman show no sign of relenting. The defenders have retreated into the Hornburg, uncertain of their ability to long survive against the forces of Isengard.","Storied Tale: The Hornburg","Théoden has asked you to join his riders on their assault from the Hornburg.\
\
<rgb=#00FF00>Mount your travelling steed and speak to Théoden.</rgb>"}},
[11354]={nameES="Storied Tales of Helm's Deep",objectivesES={}},
[11355]={nameES="Tormenta en Methedras",objectivesES={"aptura la choza de Gwyllion","Tormenta en Methedras","<rgb=#FF0000>Saeradan ha caído</rgb>","Saeradan espera para hablar contigo en el sendero que asciende por Methedras.","Captura la puerta del patio exterior","<rgb=#00FF00>Gwyllion y Echrud han sido derrotados, eliminando así la amenaza de la Vieja Mujer de Rohan</rgb>","Habla con Saeradan.","Captura la puerta del patio interior","Con la puerta al patio exterior bajo tu control, es hora de romper la resistencia enemiga en el patio exterior y abrirte paso hasta la puerta del patio interior y la choza de Gwyllion.","Has acompañado a los Montaraces Saeradan y Amlan para enfrentarte a la bruja Gwyllion, llamada la Vieja Mujer de la Montaña por los habitantes locales de las Tierras Brunas, en su hogar en la cima del Methedras, una gran montaña que domina el valle de Nan Curunír e Isengard.","Habla con Saeradan","El patio ha caído. Ahora solo queda derrotar al líder del asalto y romper el asedio.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Nota: Los místicos del clan del Jabalí contrarrestarán las mejoras que Gwyllion ha puesto sobre sus siervos, pero no combatirán.</rgb>","<rgb=#FF0000>Saeradan debe sobrevivir</rgb>","La puerta hacia el patio interior ha sido asegurada. Ahora puede asaltarse el patio interior y la choza de Gwyllion más allá.","errota a Gwyllion y Echrud en la entrada de la choza de Gwyllion y reclama el punto de control final","Toma el control de la puerta hacia el patio exterior de la morada de Gwyllion."}},
[11356]={nameES="Tormenta en Methedras -- Incursión",objectivesES={"Completa «Tormenta en Methedras» en un grupo de incursión","Gwyllion, la Vieja Mujer de la Montaña, busca alzar un ejército de espíritus funestos y espectros para ayudar a Isengard contra Rohan.","Tormenta en Methedras -- Incursión","Has acompañado a Saeradan y Amlan para enfrentarte a la bruja Gwyllion, llamada la Vieja Mujer de la Montaña por los habitantes dunlendinos, en su hogar en la cima del Methedras, una gran montaña que domina el valle de Nan Curunír e Isengard."}},
[11357]={nameES="Storming Shakhajât",objectivesES={"Talk to Kyrstig","Shakhajât is well-defended by hobgoblins, so there will be no shortage of enemies for you to face inside.","Storming Shakhajât","Kyrstig will want to hear how many hobgoblins you faced in Shakhajât.","Kyrstig has given you the difficult task of storming the hobgoblin fortress of Shakhajât and facing its defenders."}},
[11358]={nameES="Storming Shrak Mauruk",objectivesES={"Melethon is at the Causeway Forts.\
\
You should speak to Melethon.","Speak with Melethon","Storming Shrak Mauruk","Shrak Mauruk is located on the Eastern side of Osgiliath.\
\
You should defeat enemy guards within Shrak Mauruk.","Melethon has ordered you to defeat enemy guards at Shrak Mauruk in hopes of capturing their stronghold."}},
[11359]={nameES="Storming Stazg Vozag",objectivesES={"Talk to Klúso near Stazg Vozag","Hobgoblins working from the out-camp of Stazg Vozag pose a grave danger to the dwarves in the Pit of Stonejaws.","Klúso is scouting near Stazg Vozag.","Defeated Captain Zúrthrug, who did not live up to his whispered legend","Storming Stazg Vozag","The out-camp of Stazg Vozag is slightly north-east of the centre of the Pit of Stonejaws.","Defeat the fearsome Captain Zúrthrug, about whom the whispers gather"}},
[11360]={nameES="Storming the Castle!",objectivesES={}},
[11361]={nameES="Storvâgûn the Traitor (Tier 1)",objectivesES={"High in the cliffs above Helegrod, the traitorous Storvâgûn has pledged the giants of the Misty Mountains to the service of Angmar in exchange for vast riches.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This quest will be removed from your quest log when you leave the instance.</rgb>","Has regresado a lo alto de los riscos sobre Helegrod para enfrentarte a Storvâgûn.","<rgb=#66b3ff>Recompensa diaria — Tier 1</rgb>","Storvâgûn the Traitor (Tier 1)"}},
[11362]={nameES="Storvâgûn the Traitor (Tier 2)",objectivesES={"High in the cliffs above Helegrod, the traitorous Storvâgûn has pledged the giants of the Misty Mountains to the service of Angmar in exchange for vast riches.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This quest will be removed from your quest log when you leave the instance.</rgb>","Has regresado a lo alto de los riscos sobre Helegrod para enfrentarte a Storvâgûn.","<rgb=#66b3ff>Daily Reward -- Tier 2 (Cap Level)</rgb>","Storvâgûn the Traitor (Tier 2)"}},
[11363]={nameES="Polizón 01: Un Comienzo Indigno",objectivesES={"Habla con el polizón y escucha bien su historia. Este es el comienzo de su vida en el mar.","Habla con el polizón y permítele terminar de relatar los sucesos de aquella noche lejana.","Polizón 01: Un Comienzo Indigno","El hombre comienza a tejer su historia y tú escuchas para que, en sus momentos finales, no esté solo.","Completa la miniaventura: Llamado del Mar"}},
[11364]={nameES="Polizón 02: El Primer Viaje",objectivesES={"Completa la miniaventura: Ataque a Pelargir","Polizón 02: El Primer Viaje","El relato del polizón continúa con detalles de su primer viaje.","El marinero desea hablar contigo para concluir este capítulo.","El relato del marinero continúa con detalles de un asalto a la ciudad portuaria de Pelargir."}},
[11365]={nameES="Polizón 03: La marea cambiante",objectivesES={"Polizón 03: La marea cambiante","El relato del marinero continuará mientras rememora el ataque a los Corsarios que encontraron en las orillas de Tolfalas.","Falnavar desea contarte los acontecimientos que ayudaron a trazar el rumbo de su vida.","Sabiendo ahora cómo se desarrolló la batalla en la orilla, deberías hablar con el marinero.","Completa la miniaventura: La orilla de Tolfalas"}},
[11366]={nameES="Polizón 04: Hermandad",objectivesES={"Después de oír cómo el capitán y el marinero se volvieron cercanos, es momento de hablar con el marinero una vez mas.","Polizón 04: Hermandad","Completa la miniaventura: Mi Amigo del Alma","Hay mas en la historia de Falnavar y él desea compartirla contigo. Habla con cariño de su pasado.","Aun queda mas en la historia del marinero. Te pide que escuches cómo él y el capitán se volvieron amigos inseparables."}},
[11367]={nameES="Polizón 05: El Incidente",objectivesES={"Completa la miniaventura: La Nenglor","Conoces el destino de esa noche y el incidente que cayó sobre el capitán y el marinero. Regresa con el marinero para escuchar mas.","Un giro en los acontecimientos de sus vidas; el Capitán y Falnavar se enfrentan a grandes desventajas contra Yarikh y su tripulación.","Polizón 05: El Incidente","Hay algo mas en la historia del marinero mientras su semblante se vuelve sombrío."}},
[11368]={nameES="Polizón 06: Atados a Tierra",objectivesES={"Con la Nenglor reconstruida, la historia del marinero parece tomar un giro distinto.","Polizón 06: Atados a Tierra","Tras una dura reprimenda por la pérdida de su barco, el capitán se dispuso a construir la Nenglor una vez mas.","Falnavar y el capitán emprenden el regreso a Pelargir después de perder su barco, pero no todo está bien cuando llegan.","Completa la miniaventura: La Nenglor Renacida"}},
[11369]={nameES="Polizón 07: Demasiado Lejos",objectivesES={"El capitán parecía estar perdiendo el juicio, de alguna manera. Regresa ahora con el marinero y escucha sus pensamientos.","Escucha la historia que cuenta el marinero; claramente algo salió mal después de que la Nenglor fue reconstruida.","Falnavar reconoce que el cambio en el Capitán es mayor de lo que anticipó, y ahora la tripulación está en peligro.","Polizón 07: Demasiado Lejos","Completa la miniaventura: El Sermón"}},
[11370]={nameES="Polizón 08: Ya no en servicio",objectivesES={"Polizón 08: Ya no en servicio","Completa la miniaventura: Tramar la venganza","Con ira en su voz, el marinero continúa su relato. Escucha más.","Falnavar recuerda los acontecimientos después de la casi incursión en las aguas de Umbar y el duro castigo impuesto contra el Capitán.","Ahora comprendes la intención del asalto, y el marinero continuará su historia."}},
[11371]={nameES="Polizón 09: Ligados a la Venganza",objectivesES={"La historia de Falnavar toma un giro distinto mientras describe la persecución de Yarikh, Hilâma y Akhât, los Corsarios que habían arruinado su noble vida en el mar.","La historia continúa con la persecución del Corsario, aparentemente llegando a su fin.","Una tragedia cayó sobre el marinero, pero el relato se siente extraño; algo en la narración es... inconsistente.","Polizón 09: Ligados a la Venganza","Completa la miniaventura: Marcado"}},
[11372]={nameES="Polizón 10: En costas extrañas",objectivesES={"Los relatos de Falnavar cambian otra vez, esta vez hacia los años posteriores a la derrota de la tripulación corsaria que puso fin al Capitán.","Polizón 10: En costas extrañas","Completa la miniaventura: La bestia","La bestia está derrotada, pero se revela un misterio. Regresa con el marinero y cuéntale lo que descubriste."}},
[11373]={nameES="Polizón 11: Yo, Marinero",objectivesES={"Lee la nota que recogiste de Falnavar.","Falnavar ha muerto.","Regresa con el marinero y habla con él para informarle que el cometido está completo.","El estado de Falnavar está deteriorándose y su ultimo deseo es que tomes la venganza que él ya no puede reclamar.","Habla con Falnavar","Falnavar se ha ido.\
\
En su mano sostiene una nota arrugada escrita en el reverso del viejo cartel de reclutamiento.","La muerte de Falnavar es trágica, pero te dejó una nota final.","Polizón 11: Yo, Marinero","To you, who listened to my tale, I give you my haversack; provided that you retrieved it from Yarikh and his crew.\
\
As you likely now know, I am the Captain in my tale. My obsessions led me here - not the call of water. I came to avenge the death of the boy I recruited and befriended and loved as a son. The horror and pain of his loss and the death of my crews is ended.\
\
You have given peace and a final kindness to one who likely did not deserve such.\
\
I go to my final rest with a mind at ease; a desire fulfilled, the scent of salt in my nose, and the sound of the babbling river to send me to my dreams.\
\
Thank you, stranger.\
\
Falnavar","Completa la miniaventura: Una Venganza Final","La ultima solicitud? Quizás. Habla con el marinero para ir al lugar donde está Yarikh y derrota al villano Corsario de una vez por todas."}},
[11374]={nameES="Clandestino: El Viejo en la Orilla",objectivesES={"Falnavar hizo una pausa, pero parece que tiene más que decir. Pídele que continúe.","Las indicaciones del capitán Aranhir te llevaron a buscar bienes perdidos en su naufragio. Lo que no esperabas encontrar era a un hombre herido a lo largo de las orillas del gran río. El hombre tiene una historia que contar.","Habla con Falnavar","Habla con el hombre","El anciano está gravemente herido y parece que no hay esperanza de cerrar sus heridas. Su petición es simple: quedarse y escuchar su historia para que no sea olvidado. ¿Lo harás?","Continúa hablando con Falnavar","Falnavar hizo una pausa nuevamente. Quizás deberías ver si hay más que él desea contarte.","Clandestino: El Viejo en la Orilla","Sigue escuchando la historia de Falnavar."}},
[11375]={nameES="Stragglers at the Foothill",objectivesES={"Stragglers at the Foothill","Return to Tharnion","You should let Tharnion know that you greatly lessened the Orc population at Roz Ladâr.\
\
Tharnion is in Calembel.","A growing Orc presence at Roz Ladâr, near the foothills of the nearby mountains near Calembel promises to become a threat.","Tharnion is concerned about the growing number of Orcs who have started to gather west of the city of Calembel.\
\
You should defeat Orcs at Roz Ladâr, their camp in western Lamedon."}},
[11376]={nameES="Stranded Sailors",objectivesES={"Stranded Sailors","Talk to Celebros","Nasar has asked you to bring up the Corsairs' predicament with Lord Sirgon.\
\
Sirgon's manor is located in the north-west corner of East Pelargir.","A guard has gestured for you to stop.\
\
You should talk to him outside Sirgon's East Pelargir manor.","Stuck in a foreign land with no connections, Nasar looks to you for help.","Talk to the guard in the courtyard","Celebros seems interested in hearing what you have to say.\
\
You should talk to her about Nasar's request outside Sirgon's East Pelargir manor.","A guard gestures for you to stop","Go to Lord Sirgon's manor"}},
[11377]={nameES="Stranded on the Great River",objectivesES={"The marooned ship and its crew can be found to the south-west of Aerthir upon the Anduin. A rowing boat on the shore will allow for swifter passage.\
\
Aerin has asked you to help recover pillage from the Corsairs that have become trapped on shoals in the Anduin.","Deliver the pillage to Aerin at Aerthir","Stranded on the Great River","Marooned by a foolish captain, Corsairs have stranded themselves and their pillage on a shoal along the Anduin.","Aerin can be found in the lighthouse at Aerthir in southern-central Lebennin.\
\
You have recovered a great deal of pillage from the marooned Corsairs and should now bring it to Aerin."}},
[11378]={nameES="Strangbera",objectivesES={}},
[11379]={nameES="Strange Accoutrements",objectivesES={"Answith reports that the Dunlendings have begun wielding vicious weapons that inflict terrible damage upon their victims.","The strange weapons Answith spoke of may be found on the Dunlendings who dwell at Brôntrig.\
\
Answith has asked you to recover the strange weapons from the Dunlendings at Brôntrig.","Bring the strange weapons to Answith in the Isendale","Answith is encamped near the tower west of Brôntrig.\
\
You should bring the weapons you recovered to Answith.","Strange Accoutrements"}},
[11380]={nameES="Strange Arrivals",objectivesES={"Scout Caivád Sâr","Strange Arrivals","Múta can be found somewhere within Tûr Ágal, the tower in the centre of Caivád Sâr.\
\
You have scouted Caivád Sâr and should now find and aid Múta in Tûr Ágal.","As Agnar feared, a mighty force of Dourhands now dwells among the Angmarim at  Caivád Sâr!","Talk to Múta in Tûr Ágal","Múta can be found beside the staircase to the right of the entrance of Tûr Ágal, the tower in the centre of Caivád Sâr.\
\
You have aided Múta in assessing the danger posed by the Dourhands and freed Longbeards captured and held at at Caivád Sâr. You should report back to Múta.","Múta kneels in the shadows beside a stairway leading higher into Tûr Ágal","Neither allied with Gorgar the Ruthless nor truly opposing him, the Dourhands and their mysterious leader have rallied to Caivád Sâr where they now dwell amongst the remnants of the Iron Crown.","Múta can be found beside the staircase to the right of the entrance of Tûr Ágal, the tower in the centre of Caivád Sâr.\
\
Múta has asked you to aid her in Tûr Ágal.","Aid Múta with 'Disloyal to the Crown'","Caivád Sâr can be found in the northern reaches of Elderslade in the War of Three Peaks.\
\
Agnar Brokentooth has ordered you to aid Múta in assessing and eliminating the danger posed by Dourhands who recently arrived at Caivád Sâr.","Aid Múta with 'Servants of War'","Find Múta in Tûr Ágal","Múta can be found beside the staircase to the right of the entrance of Tûr Ágal, the tower in the centre of Caivád Sâr.\
\
You have found Múta in Tûr Ágal. You should talk to her and learn what is to be done."}},
[11381]={nameES="Strange Ash",objectivesES={"Sâd-en-Dagor is in Dol Guldur, north-east of Helethir.\
\
Stirnir has asked you to enter Sâd-en-Dagor and recover the strange ash from the Black Númenórean sorcerers there.","The Black Númenórean sorcerers in Dol Guldur use a strange ash in their foul rituals.","Strange Ash"}},
[11382]={nameES="Bestias extrañas",objectivesES={"Tasgall ha intentado detener la propagación de las bestias de las colinas por todo Fasach-larran, pero las criaturas son demasiado numerosas para que él pueda manejarlo solo.","Las bestias de las colinas merodean por las pendientes de Nád Nathair, al noroeste del campamento de Tasgall, en Fasach-larran.\
\
Tasgall te ha pedido que derrotes a tantas bestias de las colinas como puedas mientras él piensa en alguna forma de combatirlas más eficazmente.","Bestias extrañas","El campamento de Tasgall se encuentra al norte de Aughaire y al sureste de Nád Nathair.\
\
Has derrotado a un gran número de bestias de las colinas y deberías volver a ver a Tasgall."}},
[11383]={nameES="Strange Company",objectivesES={"The Rangers of Ithilien had much to contend with before Osgiliath fell to the forces of Mordor, but nothing more curious than a strange group of travellers in Ithilien.","Anborn can be found in Henneth Annûn.\
\
Mablung has asked you to speak to Anborn about the strange travellers that passed through Ithilien before the battle brought them to Osgiliath.","Strange Company","Talk to Anborn in Henneth Annûn"}},
[11384]={nameES="Criaturas Extrañas",objectivesES={"Hasta te ha pedido investigar los informes sobre criaturas extrañas que acechan en las Obras Hidráulicas.","Regresa con Hasta","Criaturas Extrañas","Se rumorea que las criaturas sospechosas pueden encontrarse al sur y al oeste del Sótano Putrefacto.\
\
Hasta te ha pedido confirmar los informes de criaturas extrañas en las Aguas de Tratamiento trayendo pruebas suficientes de su existencia."}},
[11385]={nameES="Strange Meat",objectivesES={}},
[11386]={nameES="Strange Passers-by",objectivesES={"See what can be seen in the depths of the Ent's gaze","Strange Passers-by","Talk to Ashlimb","You believe you understand what just happened: you were given a memory from deep within the eyes of the Ent, something he saw that he wants to know about.\
\
This Ent has grown too sleepy, too tree-ish to solve the riddle of this memory. Will you help him?","It is clear to your travel-wary eyes that this is no ordinary tree. This is an Ent!\
\
He is strangely silent compared to others that you have seen. His eyes are sleepy, but he holds your own eyes with a searching green depth.\
\
You gaze bemused at this quiet creature's eyes, and soon strange thoughts begin to seep into your mind.","You have the sensation of recalling a memory that is not your own....","The sleepy Ent is along the faint path at the southern edge of Fangorn Forest.\
\
You should speak with Ashlimb.","You have happened upon an Ent in the Eaves of Fangorn, a foreboding forest on the edge of Rohan."}},
[11387]={nameES="Strange Relics of Ethillorn",objectivesES={"The presence of the Ruthless Dead is having a foul influence on the Ruins of Ethillorn.\
\
In particular, you notice some relics appear to be saturated with unnatural power.\
\
It would be safest to destroy them.","Discover the camp of the Ruins of Ethillorn","Strange items within the ruins of Ethillorn have become possessed of an unseemly power.\
\
Destroy corrupted relics in the Ruins of Ethillorn, south of Linhir.","The Ruins of Ethillorn have become host to the Ruthless Dead.\
\
Reach the Ruins of Ethillorn, south of Linhir.","Strange Relics of Ethillorn","The presence of the Ruthless Dead has had a curious effect on the Ruins of Ethillorn.","Hopefully this action will diminish the powers of the Ruthless Dead, but only time will tell.","You have destroyed many relics."}},
[11388]={nameES="Strange Sights on the Horizon",objectivesES={"Strange Sights on the Horizon","The strange spires on the landscape can be found north, south, and south-west of the cross-roads in the south-eastern Whitshaws.\
\
You should scout the southern-most spire of ice in the Whitshaws.","Cyneberg has ridden ahead to Dunfast, which lies westward along the Whitshaws road from Forlaw.\
\
You should meet up with Cyneberg at Dunfast.","The strange spires on the landscape can be found north, south, and south-west of the cross-roads in the south-eastern Whitshaws.\
\
You should scout the northern ice-spire at the lake's edge in the Whitshaws.","This place is clutched in the grips of a particularly violent lingering winter","Search the strange spire to the south-west of the cross-roads","The strange spires on the landscape can be found north, south, and south-west of the cross-roads in the south-eastern Whitshaws.\
\
You should scout the western-most ice-spire in the southern Whitshaws.","A dead horse lies at this spire; you should examine it","Search the strange spire to the north","The winter weather here is especially cruel, and ice-shards pierce the earth like shining knives","Search the strange spire to the south","Strange spires pierce the flat lands to the north and south of the road, landmarks that Cyneberg declares are entirely new to the plains of the Whitshaws.","Find Cyneberg at Dunfast"}},
[11389]={nameES="Strange Sigil",objectivesES={}},
[11390]={nameES="Baba Extraña",objectivesES={"Regresa a Hasta con las notas de Hethuwen","Hethuwen ha examinado el contenido del paquete que le llevaste y ha descubierto una sustancia inquietante. Te ha pedido que lleves la muestra, junto con sus extensas notas, de vuelta a Hasta en las Obras Hidráulicas.","Hasta se encuentra en la Bodega Putrefacta, en las Obras Hidráulicas, muy al oeste del Refugio Sombrío.\
\
Hethuwen te ha entregado una redoma con la sustancia que descubrió durante su análisis, junto con abundantes notas. Te ha pedido que lleves todo esto a Hasta en las Obras Hidráulicas.","Lleva las notas de Hethuwen a Hasta","Hasta toma la redoma y lee la nota con intensa atención.\
\
'¡Esto es realmente extraño! Hethuwen es una maestra del saber, muy versada en conocimientos. Si esta sustancia es desconocida incluso para ella, como parece ser el caso, estoy preocupado.'","Baba Extraña"}},
[11391]={nameES="Strange Waters",objectivesES={"Gladden gloomwaters can be found along the river Gladden.\
\
You should defeat Gladden gloomwaters.","Defeated many Gladden gloomwaters.","Strange Waters","A strange darkness has come to the Vales of Anduin. Vile gloomwaters move along the river Gladden. These creatures should be defeated if the Vales are to remain safe.","Completado","Gloomwaters move along the river Gladden.","You have defeated many gloomwaters along the river Gladden, making the Vales of Anduin safer."}},
[11392]={nameES="Strangled Rest",objectivesES={}},
[11393]={nameES="Strangling Webs",objectivesES={}},
[11394]={nameES="Strapped for Straps",objectivesES={"Drakes can be found in Arador's End, north of Tol Ascarnen.\
\
Sergeant-at-Arms Caddafrith has asked you to assist her in crafting a horn to call forces to fight against Angmar's army when they assail Tol Ascarnen. To do this, she asks that you collect sinews from the drakes of Arador's End with which to bind the Horn of Tol Ascarnen. She suggests you take allies.","Deliver the sinew to Sergeant-at-Arms Caddafrith","Strapped for Straps","Battle in the Ettenmoors is uncertain, with forces losing footholds as easily as they gain them. The Free Peoples have taken Tol Ascarnen but now must hold the location. To do this, they will need to strengthen their position as best they can."}},
[11395]={nameES="Vino Dulce de Fresa — Introducción",objectivesES={"Vino Dulce de Fresa — Introducción","Baldwin Colazorro está en la Casa de los Mathoms, en Cavada Grande, en la Comarca.\
\
Baldwin te ha pedido que le lleves cinco botellas de vino dulce de fresa para los cocineros de la Sociedad de los Mathoms.","Lleva el vino dulce de fresa a Baldwin Colazorro","La Sociedad de los Mathoms tiene muy poco vino dulce de fresa en sus reservas y no ha tenido tiempo de preparar más."}},
[11396]={nameES="Strength and Fury",objectivesES={"Langhár can be found at Zarkul-sulûn.\
\
You should talk to Langhár.","The Beornings have kept their word to assist the dwarves in their time of need!","Yrsa Spearwife can be found at Shakal-atrâd.\
\
You should talk to Yrsa Spearwife at Shakal-atrâd.","Langhár and Varthmath can be found at Zarkul-sulûn.\
\
You should assist Langhár and Varthmath.","Talk to Yrsa Spearwife at Shakal-atrâd","Confront the raiding party of the Drekvath River","Word has reached the dwarves of a potential threat approaching the battlefield from the east.","Assist Varthmath at Zarkul-sulûn","Talk to Langhár at Zarkul-sulûn","Strength and Fury","The Drekvath River can be found east of Shakal-atrâd.\
\
You should talk to Yrsa Spearwife by the Drekvath River.","Talk to Yrsa Spearwife on the road","Assist Sighild at Shakal-atrâd","There is no raiding party to be found, only Beornings!","Assist Thyra at Shakal-atrâd","Shakal-atrâd can be found in Elderslade.\
\
You should give Beorining-made spears to the dwarves at Shakal-atrâd.","Thyra, Sighild, and Hertha can all be found at Shakal-atrâd.\
\
You should assist the Beornings at Shakal-atrâd.","Assist Hertha at Shakal-atrâd","Assist Langhár at Zarkul-sulûn","Find and aid Skarding Wargsbane","Skarding Wargsbane can be found somewhere on the battlefield.\
\
You should find and aid Skarding Wargsbane.","The path across the Drekvath River can be found east of Shakal-atrâd.\
\
You should confront the raiding party of the Drekvath River."}},
[11397]={nameES="Strength of Many",objectivesES={"Speak with Agazi near the rockslide to the west","Defeat spiny lizards near the rockslide blocking the path to Ambarûl.","Speak with Agazi near the rockslide on the road to Ambarûl to the west.","Speak with Balgiba near the Channel of Bâdizal to the south of Maurûsh.","Return to Galâmka in Ub Nishir","Return to Galâmka in Maurûsh and update him on Agazi and Balgiba.","Agazi has pledged her help in retaking Maurûsh","Speak with Balgiba in the Channel of Bâdizal","Balgiba has asked you to gather tortoise shells for him near the Channel of Bâdizal for the armour he is trying to craft.","Bring the tortoise shells back to Balgiba in the Channel of Bâdizal.","Strength of Many","Balgiba has pledged his help in retaking Maurûsh","Return to Agazi near the rockslide blocking the path to Ambarûl in the west.","Galâmka has realized that he needs additional help to take back Maurûsh and asked you to go speak with some of his associates and get them to join the fight.","Return to Balgiba with the tortoise shells","Return to Agazi"}},
[11398]={nameES="Fuerza de la piedra",objectivesES={"Fuerza de la piedra","Las máquinas de guerra -- torres de asedio y catapultas -- de los Angmarim están en la parte oriental de Ram Dúath.\
\
Tuokki te ha pedido que ayudes a destruir las torres de asedio y catapultas de los Angmarim.","Los Hijos de la Tierra han estado destruyendo las máquinas de asedio de los Angmarim mientras las transportan por Ram Dúath, pero ahora están demasiado bien custodiadas para que los Hijos de la Tierra puedan alcanzarlas.","El líder Tuokki está en el campamento Suuri-lehmä en Ram Dúath.\
\
Debes regresar con Tuokki para informarle de tu éxito."}},
[11399]={nameES="Fuerza de la tierra",objectivesES={"Tras descubrir indicios de malas artes entre la horda de orcos cercana, Brazofero te ha pedido que busques a Frosti Sacudetierra, un enano sabio versado en muchos saberes, para averiguar más sobre los orcos de la Mano Blanca y su comportamiento.","Entrega los objetos a Frosti Sacudetierra en la Mansión de Thorin","Regresa con Brazofero en las Vetas del Cuerno Rojo","Fuerza de la tierra","Frosti Sacudetierra está en la Mansión de Thorin, junto a los subastadores al sur del trono.\
\
Deberías llevarle las piezas a Frosti Sacudetierra para que pueda arrojar algo de luz sobre lo que podría estar sucediendo","Brazofero se encuentra en la Guardia Orca, en las Vetas del Cuerno Rojo de Moria.\
\
Frosti Sacudetierra te ha dado una efigie con runas que podría ayudarte a llamar la atención del espectro orco. Deberías regresar con Brazofero en Moria y él te dirá qué hacer a continuación."}},
[11400]={nameES="Strengthening the Numbers",objectivesES={"Talk to Angbor","You should talk to Angbor, who can be found at Aragorn's pavilion on the after-battle Pelennor.","Strengthening the Numbers","You should bring the armour to the soldiers in and around Aragorn's Pavilion, on the after-battle Pelennor.","Angbor has been tasked with arming the men who will march east and wishes to deliver new armour to the soldiers."}},
[11401]={nameES="Ataque contra Dannenglor",objectivesES={"Reclama la terraza este","Reclama la entrada sur","Reclama el puente oeste","Abre el patio superior","Ataque contra Dannenglor","El corazón de Dannenglor es un gran patio abierto con una puerta al sur, un puente al oeste y una terraza al este. Deberéis controlar los tres para poder avanzar.","<rgb=#00FF00>El patio superior está bajo tu control y las puertas de la cámara del hechicero se han abierto</rgb>","<rgb=#00FF00>El patio inferior es tuyo. El enemigo no lo dejará así voluntariamente</rgb>","Las puertas de Dannenglor han sido selladas. Para infiltraros en las antiguas ruinas, tendréis que entrar por el patio inferior y ascender.","El pequeño patio superior es lo único que te separa del hechicero.","Para tomar Dannenglor para la Hueste Dorada y liberar a sus prisioneros, el hechicero que reside allí debe ser derrotado y su cámara reclamada.","<rgb=#00FF00>El hechicero y la amenaza de Dannenglor han sido derrotados. Audaghaim y la Hueste Dorada están a salvo</rgb>","Reclama el patio inferior","Varios elfos y exploradores han sido hechos prisioneros por un hechicero en las antiguas ruinas élficas de Dannenglor.","Derrota al hechicero y reclama la cámara del hechicero"}},
[11402]={nameES="Ataque contra Dannenglor: Incursión",objectivesES={"Varios elfos y exploradores han sido hechos prisioneros por un hechicero en las antiguas ruinas élficas de Dannenglor.","Completa 'Ataque contra Dannenglor' con un grupo de incursión","Ataque contra Dannenglor: Incursión"}},
[11403]={nameES="Strike Back",objectivesES={}},
[11404]={nameES="Strike Out",objectivesES={}},
[11405]={nameES="Strike the Colours",objectivesES={"Talk to Garrun in the Isendale","Garrun is at his camp, north of Cuvnerth and the mountain passes.\
\
You should report to Garrun and let him know that the banners have been removed.","Banners can be found at the mouths of the mountain passes, south of Garrun's camp.\
\
Garrun has asked you to destroy the Dunlending banners posted along the mountain passes.","The Dunlendings have posted banners throughout the Isendale which mark the marching route for the host gathering in Wulf's Cleft.","Strike the Colours"}},
[11406]={nameES="Striking Back",objectivesES={"Each time the Orcs of Durshulot attack Aslíf, they erode the Gabil'akkâ's resources.","Orkish weapons can be found around Durshulot to the north-west, on the middle tier.\
\
Rékkur has asked you to destroy these weapons and sabotage the Orcs' periodic skirmishes with the Gabil'akkâ.","Talk to Rékkur in Aslíf","Striking Back","You have destroyed weapons around Durshulot.\
\
Rékkur in Aslíf will be glad to hear the news."}},
[11407]={nameES="Striking Eastward",objectivesES={"Winsig is in the mead-hall in Walstow.","Striking Eastward","Fastred wants you to travel to the town of Walstow to the east and meet with Winsig, the Thane. He is concerned about the number of Orcs that have been pouring into the Sutcrofts and hopes that the town has held.","Talk to Winsig","Fastred wants you to defeat riders on your journey to Walstow.\
\
Goblin and Orc riders can be found just off the road to the east."}},
[11408]={nameES="Striking Grytholm",objectivesES={}},
[11409]={nameES="Striking Shafts",objectivesES={"Striking Shafts","Deliver the kindling to Soldier Glat at Tol Ascarnen","Search the area of Hithlad for the kindling needed to make the arrow shafts. Hithlad and the Grimwood forest are south of Tol Ascarnen.\
\
In an effort to better fortify Tol Ascarnen, the War-tyrant has called to the goblins at Grothum and told his soldiers to craft bolts for the goblins to shoot into the tunnel at the mouth of the keep. It falls to you to collect the wood for the shafts.","Angmar seeks to reinforce Tol Ascarnen, employing the assistance of goblin-archers, who hide behind the walls and launch deadly attacks at the Free Peoples foolish enough to enter the tunnel leading to the inner courtyard."}},
[11410]={nameES="Striking Their Supplies",objectivesES={"Striking Their Supplies","Found the northern Orc supplies","Find the Orc supplies in the northern part of Maurûsh","Find the Orc supplies in the western part of Maurush","Speak to Galamka","Sabotage the Orc supplies you have found in the northern area of Maurûsh.","Found the western Orc supplies","Find the supplies the Orcs are using in the western area of Maurûsh.","Galâmka has asked you to sabotage the supplies the Orcs are using in Maurûsh.","Sabotage the Orc supplies you have found in the western area of Maurûsh.","Find the supplies the Orcs are using in the northern area of Maurûsh.","Return to Galâmka in Ub Nishir and inform him of your success."}},
[11411]={nameES="Stringy Innards",objectivesES={"The Wintersebb-drakes are found north, in sections near the Hoarwell's source and at the foot of the Misty Mountains.\
\
Angmar's forces at Tol Ascarnen are crafting a great horn to call reinforcements to the fight when the Free Peoples return to assault the area. Kaasak has tasked you with collecting sinew from the Wintersebb-drakes to secure the many horns that will adorn the post.","Building a horn to summon reinforcements at Tol Ascarnen requires that several pieces are collected and assembled for an Orc to watch over and use when the Free Peoples make their assault against the fort.","Talk to Soldier Kaasak at Tol Ascarnen","Stringy Innards"}},
[11412]={nameES="Stripping it Bare",objectivesES={}},
[11413]={nameES="Strong Pins and Well-woven Ropes",objectivesES={"Wharf master Annúngil has asked you to replace the damaged ropes and pins on the Rosigil. You should pick up the box of pins and bundles of new rope.\
\
The box of pins and the rope are next to Annúngil, on the docks in the Dol Amroth bay.","Return to Annúngil","An investigation revealed that many of the post pins and bundles of rope on the Rosigil and docks were intentionally damaged. They must be replaced, for if left in their current state they could endanger the crew.","You should let Annúngil know that you have replaced the damaged pins and piles of rope on the Rosigil.\
\
The wharf master is on a dock in the Dol Amroth bay.","Strong Pins and Well-woven Ropes","Pick up the bundle of rope","Pick up the box of pins","You are now armed with fresh pins and tightly woven ropes. You should replace the pins on the Rosigil and the rope on the docks.\
\
The Rosigil is moored in the Dol Amroth bay."}},
[11414]={nameES="Stronger Competition",objectivesES={"Find Mostun and challenge him to combat","You have defeated Gaenor in combat","Stronger Competition","Mair has asked you to challenge some of the Falcon-clan's best fighters for the purpose of training.","Mair is by a large rock in the northern half of the village of Tûr Morva, in Tâl Methedras.\
\
You have defeated both Mostun and Gaenor, and the pair have learned some of your fighting skills.","Find Gaenor and challenge her to combat","Mostun and Gaenor are somewhere in the village of Tûr Morva, in Tâl Methedras.\
\
Mair wants you to challenge two masters of the fighting arts in Tûr Morva, so that they may learn from your fighting skills.","You have defeated Mostun in combat","Talk to Mair in Tûr Morva"}},
[11415]={nameES="Strongest Among Them",objectivesES={}},
[11416]={nameES="La fortaleza de los trasgos",objectivesES={"Krum se encuentra al norte de la Cámara de la Encrucijada, cerca de Ninknakh Faltor.\
\
Líkmund te ha pedido que hables con Krum sobre el campamento de trasgos que ha encontrado y le ayudes como puedas.","Krum ha explorado el campamento","Encuentra a Krum y habla con él","Líkmund está en la Cámara de la Encrucijada, al sur de Ninknakh Faltor.\
\
El campamento de Ninknakh Faltor era grande y estaba bien fortificado, y solo pudiste explorarlo en parte. Deberías informar a Líkmund de lo que has averiguado.","La fortaleza de los trasgos","Habla con Líkmund en la Cámara de la Encrucijada","Krum, uno de los enanos de Líkmund, ha descubierto a un gran grupo de trasgos en Ninknakh Faltor, en el extremo oeste del Camino de Durin."}},
[11417]={nameES="Strongholds of the North - Dwarves of Erebor",objectivesES={}},
[11418]={nameES="Strongholds of the North - Elves of Felegoth",objectivesES={}},
[11419]={nameES="Strongholds of the North - Men of Dale",objectivesES={}},
[11420]={nameES="Strongholds of the North Allowance",objectivesES={}},
[11421]={nameES="Struggle for Freedom",objectivesES={"Thandor, the Gondorian Captain, can be located in the market east of Tol Ciryarani.\
\
You should speak with Thandor.","Thandor has asked you to board the Corsair ships, and free the remaining slaves.","Struggle for Freedom","Talk to Thandor","The Corsair ships can be reached using the boat to the south of Thandor.\
\
You should board the Corsair ships and free the captured slaves.","DNT Not Used"}},
[11422]={nameES="Discípulo del enemigo",objectivesES={"Los elfos de Echad Mirobel han rastreado a las fuerzas de Isengard en Eregion hasta una antigua escuela.","Escuela de Tham Mírdain encontrada","La Escuela de Tham Mírdain se encuentra en Mirobel, en la región suroeste de Eregion.\
\
Gelriwen de Echad Mirobel te ha pedido que encuentres la entrada a una antigua escuela.","Encuentra la Escuela de Tham Mírdain","Discípulo del enemigo"}},
[11423]={nameES="Discípulo del enemigo",objectivesES={}},
[11424]={nameES="Estudios de lo Desconocido — Introducción",objectivesES={"Tus estudios sobre lo Desconocido son de gran interés. Ojalá todos esos enigmas pudieran explorarse en el tiempo que nos queda, pero aun con todo el tiempo del mundo, la tarea permanecería inconclusa. Debemos estar agradecidos por aquello que sí podemos completar. Yo —y todo Rivendel— te agradecemos tus esfuerzos.'","Estudios de lo Desconocido — Introducción","Cachúnir desea llevar consigo al Oeste toda la historia y el saber de la Tierra Media que pueda cuando los Elfos de Rivendel zarpen hacia el Oeste.","Entrega tus Estudios de lo Desconocido a Cachúnir en Rivendel","Cachúnir está en Rivendel, en el Bosque de los Trolls.\
\
Cachúnir te ha pedido que redactes estudios sobre lo Desconocido y se los lleves."}},
[11425]={nameES="Un análisis del problema",objectivesES={"Las arañas fúngicas se encuentran en el rincón noreste y en el lado este de las Vetas del Cuerno Rojo.","Regresa con Knakk","La parte oriental de las Vetas del Cuerno Rojo está infestada por algún tipo de hongo, y las arañas tienen algo que ver con ello. La propagación se produce a un ritmo alarmante...","Knakk acampa en la pasarela elevada que está en el rincón noreste de las Vetas del Cuerno Rojo.\
\
Knakk se alegrará de examinar las muestras del hongo que has recogido. Tendrá que dejar a un lado el rompecabezas del medallón para analizarlas.","Un análisis del problema","Mata a una araña globsnaga","Las arañas fúngicas están esparciendo esporas producto de sus mutaciones. El hongo que crece en ellas parece haberlas transformado en algo muy diferente. Sería conveniente recoger algunas muestras y llevarlas a Knakk para estudiarlas más a fondo."}},
[11426]={nameES="El estudio de la fauna local",objectivesES={"Puedes encontrar sapos, lagartos y arañas por todas las Obras Hidráulicas de Moria.\
\
Águti quiere saber más sobre la fauna local. Te ha pedido que le traigas muestras de los sapos, lagartos y arañas de las Obras Hidráulicas.","Habla con Águti en la Bodega Putrefacta","Habla con Águti","Águti se encuentra en el campamento de la Bodega Putrefacta, en las Obras Hidráulicas.\
\
Águti quiere ver las muestras mientras aún están frescas, ya que espera aprender de ellas.","El estudio de la fauna local","Águti tiene curiosidad por la naturaleza de la fauna de las Obras Hidráulicas y busca a alguien para investigar al respecto."}},
[11427]={nameES="Stuffing the Stuffed",objectivesES={}},
[11428]={nameES="Stumbling in the Dark",objectivesES={}},
[11429]={nameES="Soldados suculentos",objectivesES={"Campamento de Ekhamâti alcanzado","Los refuerzos llegaron y evitaron tu escape","Sabragêsh derrotado","Derrota a Sabragêsh","Soldados suculentos","Has atraído a las arañas sobre los soldados. ¡Escapa antes de que lleguen los refuerzos!","Tu misión es causar disturbios en una cueva conocida por sus arañas, pero que ahora está ocupada por soldados de Ekhamâti. Apaga los fuegos de los soldados y activa sus alarmas para atraer a las arañas sobre ellos."}},
[11430]={nameES="Sudden Farewell",objectivesES={"Mundsunu, son of Runald and Cadsterre, waits at the southern entrance to Elthengels.\
\
Like his parents before him, Mundsunu would request a favour of you before leaving his home.","Not everyone is willing to risk their own life and the lives of their loved ones to save the village of Elthengels. Another family plans to leave for safer lands and requires assistance in their final preparations.","Hereléof can be found at the well in the western section of the village of Elthengels.\
\
Runald would like you to ask Hereléof to watch over his home, once he departs.","Talk to Runald near the south-western gate","Cadsterre can be found with her family at their waggon near the southern gate to Elthengels.\
\
Frithynd has asked you to thank Cadsterre for her kindness and friendship and to wish her good fortune upon her journey.","Return to Runald to finalize the preparations","Hereléof has agreed to watch over Runald's home and its new inhabitants","Runald and his family can be found at the southern gate to the village of Elthengels.\
\
Hereléof has agreed to look after the home until the day that Runald or his kin may come to reclaim it.","You have told Frithnyd of Cadsterre's hidden gift and bid her farewell on Cadsterre's behalf","Talk to Runald near the southern gate of Elthengels","Return to Cadsterre near the gate","Talk to Frithnyd by the fountain in Elthengels","Talk to Hereléof outside his home in Elthengels","Barcyne has agreed to take care of Mundsúnu's toy","Cadsterre can be found with her family at the southern gate of Elthengels.\
\
Cadsterre would care to ask a favour of you as she prepares to leave her home.","Frithynd can be found contemplating at the fountain in Elthengels, outside the tavern.\
\
Cadsterre has asked you to say farewell to Frithynd, as she cannot bear to do so herself, and to inform her of the gift she has left behind.","Runald and his family can be found at their waggon near the southern entrance to Elthengels.\
\
With all of the preparations and favours completed, you should speak to Runald one last time before his departure.","Talk to Barcyne in Elthengels","Barcyne can be found at her home in the south-east part of the village of Elthengels.\
\
Mundsúnu has asked that you bring his doll to his friend Barcyne.","Sudden Farewell","Talk to Cadsterre, wife of Runald","Talk with Mundsúnu, son of Runald","Runald and his family can be found with their waggon at the southern entrance to Elthengels.\
\
Thane Mildrith has asked you to assist Runald and his family so that they may finish their final preparations in leaving Elthengels safely."}},
[11431]={nameES="Suitable Structures",objectivesES={}},
[11432]={nameES="Sully the Stores",objectivesES={}},
[11433]={nameES="¡Las instancias de temporada de verano han llegado!",objectivesES={"Juega las instancias de temporada de verano durante el Festival de Verano."}},
[11434]={nameES="Summons of the White Hand",objectivesES={}},
[11435]={nameES="Sundergrót: Biting Insects",objectivesES={}},
[11436]={nameES="Sundergrót: Evaluating the Hold",objectivesES={}},
[11437]={nameES="Sundergrót: Goblin Supplies",objectivesES={}},
[11438]={nameES="Sundergrót: Mining Sappers",objectivesES={}},
[11439]={nameES="Sundergrót: The Intruders",objectivesES={}},
[11440]={nameES="Sundering the Snowreap",objectivesES={"Snowreap-goblins inhabit Grothum, a village they established east of the Isendeep Mine in Arador's End.\
\
Ned Claybrick asked you to assail the goblins in their home to deter them from future raids on Hoarhallow.","Return to Ned Claybrick at Hoarhallow","Goblins have been the main foe the Hobbits of Hoarhallow have contended with in all their years. They believe with the aid of the Tall Folk they can score a final victory against the Snowreap-goblins.","Sundering the Snowreap","Ned Claybrick awaits your return at Hoarhallow, south and west of Grothum.\
\
You found the Snowreap-goblins in Grothum and defeated them at their village. You should return to Ned Claybrick with the news."}},
[11441]={nameES="Laberinto Sumergido -- Nivel 1",objectivesES={"Defeat the Half-troll Abomination, Muzgásh","Defeated Dagron","Defeat the Troll Abomination, Dagron","Laberinto Sumergido -- Nivel 1","You constructed a crude barrier to block a tunnel passage","Defeated Muzgásh","Explore the tunnels and culverts for signs of Faramir.","Algo se agita en los túneles y pasadizos bajo las ruinas en ruinas de Osgiliath."}},
[11442]={nameES="Laberinto Sumergido -- Nivel 2",objectivesES={"Defeat the Half-troll Abomination, Muzgásh","Defeated Dagron","Defeat the Troll Abomination, Dagron","Laberinto Sumergido -- Nivel 2","You constructed a crude barrier to block a tunnel passage","Defeated Muzgásh","Explore the tunnels and culverts for signs of Faramir.","Algo se agita en los túneles y pasadizos bajo las ruinas en ruinas de Osgiliath."}},
[11443]={nameES="Sunken Sails",objectivesES={"Tawardan has asked you to retrieve lengths of black sails from the sunken ships in the bay of the Harlond.","Return to Tawardan","Sunken Sails","You should bring the waterlogged sail fabric to Tawardan.\
\
Tawardan is in the Harlond.","A toymaker and souvenir crafter asks for assistance fetching a special, sunken, item."}},
[11444]={nameES="Naufragio sumergido",objectivesES={"Los restos del naufragio están esparcidos a lo largo del Baranduin, que discurre hacia el sur desde el Coloso.\
\
Gaelnarthan te ha pedido que nades en el Baranduin y recuperes algunos contenedores de antiguos naufragios.","Gaelnarthan está en el Coloso, al noroeste de las ruinas del faro.\
\
Gaelnarthan querrá ver los contenedores que has recuperado del lecho del río.","Lleva los contenedores a Gaelnarthan","Naufragio sumergido","La página que encontraste indicaba a un naufragio en el río que podría contener algo de valor."}},
[11445]={nameES="Urnas hundidas",objectivesES={"Orchalwë querrá echar un vistazo a los jarrones.","Varias urnas antiguas siguen bajo el agua, protegidas de las olas por las ruinas de los edificios inundados.","Urnas hundidas","Lleva las urnas a Orchalwë","Orchalwë vio algunas urnas bajo las olas."}},
[11446]={nameES="Supplies For Echad-in-Edhil",objectivesES={"Supplies For Echad-in-Edhil","Bring the supplies to Amroth in Echad-in-Edhil","The encampment of Echad-in-Edhil is in need of additional supplies.","Supplies can be found in Díngarth.\
\
You should gather supplies.","Amroth can be found in Echad-in-Edhil.\
\
You should bring the gathered supplies to Amroth."}},
[11447]={nameES="Suministros y demandas",objectivesES={"Suministros y demandas","Devuelve los objetos a Buckley Sheppard","Buckley Sheppard te habló de la actividad de los bandidos en el campamento de Adso y de cómo muchos trabajadores han perdido sus bolsas de monedas o les han robado herramientas desde que esos bribones empezaron a intimidarlos. Algunos trabajadores han huido, pero muchos confían en que los esfuerzos de Adso puedan arreglar las cosas.","Los bandidos con las herramientas y bolsas robadas están en la Vieja Granja Dulcésped, al noreste del campamento de Adso.\
\
Buckley Sheppard te pidió que recuperes las herramientas y bolsas de monedas que los bandidos robaron a los trabajadores del campamento de Adso."}},
[11448]={nameES="Supplies and Stockades",objectivesES={}},
[11449]={nameES="Supplies for Arhaim",objectivesES={"The supplies for Arhaim can be found at the Beorning watchpost between the Gladden Fields and Duskenvale.\
\
You should collect the supplies for Arhaim before heading into Duskenvale.","Collect the supplies for Arhaim","Garsind, the Chieftain of Arhaim, will accept the supplies.\
\
You should deliver the supplies to Garsind in the village of Arhaim.","Supplies for Arhaim","Deliver the supplies to Garsind","Collected the supplies for Arhaim","Orc activity on the road between the Gladden Fields and Duskenvale has halted trade. The trader Lúfred has asked you to deliver supplies to the village of Arhaim in his stead."}},
[11450]={nameES="Suministros para Clorhir",objectivesES={"Recoge la caja de suministros","Has entregado con éxito la caja de suministros a Harthadril","El intendente Badhordam está en Echad Garthadir, el campamento de los montaraces en el corazón de Annúminas.\
\
Has entregado una caja de suministros a Harthadril en el campamento de los montaraces en Clorhir, el patio frente a la entrada de los estanques de Glinghant.","Suministros para Clorhir","Los montaraces han tomado el patio de Clorhir frente a los estanques de Glinghant.","Harthadril está en el campamento de los montaraces en el patio de Clorhir, frente a la entrada de los estanques de Glinghant, en un nivel superior de la ciudad.\
\
El intendente Badhordam te ha pedido que lleves una caja de suministros a Harthadril en el puesto de avanzada de Clorhir. Te recomendó que llevaras algunos aliados fuertes para que te protejan mientras llevas la caja, pues los angmarim seguramente intentarán interrumpir este intento de reabastecimiento."}},
[11451]={nameES="Suministros para Echad Garthadir",objectivesES={"Recoge la caja de suministros","Badhordam está en Echad Garthadir, el campamento de los montaraces en el corazón de Annúminas.\
\
Cuguminuial te ha pedido que lleves una caja de suministros a Badhordam, el intendente de Echad Garthadir, en Annúminas. Te advirtió que no dejes que la caja se moje y que traigas una compañía que puedan protegerte mientras la llevas. Le preocupa que, a menos que los Dúnedain controlen la puerta en el patio de Gwaelband, es posible que no puedas encontrar una ruta segura a Echad Garthadir.","Suministros para Echad Garthadir","Badhordam está en el campamento de los montaraces de Echad Garthadir, en Annúminas.\
\
Has entregado una caja de suministros desde Tinnudir a Echad Garthadir y ahora deberías hablar con Badhordam, el intendente del campamento.","Has entregado con éxito la caja de suministros a Badhordam","Los montaraces en Annúminas necesitan suministros para continuar su lucha allí."}},
[11452]={nameES="Suministros para Tirband",objectivesES={"Recoge la caja de suministros","Suministros para Tirband","Los montaraces han tomado el control de Tirband, el patio frente a la gran torre de vigilancia en el nivel superior de la ciudad.","Badhordam está en Echad Garthadir, el campamento de los montaraces en el corazón de Annúminas.\
\
Has entregado una caja de suministros a Legrindavor en el patio de Tirband y ahora deberías regresar al intendente Badhordam.","Legrindavor está en Tirband, el patio en el nivel superior de la ciudad, desde el cual la gran torre de vigilancia domina el lago Nenuial.\
\
El intendente Badhordam te ha pedido que lleves una caja de suministros a Legrindavor en el patio de Tirband, en el nivel superior de la ciudad.","Has entregado con éxito la caja de suministros a Legrindavor"}},
[11453]={nameES="Suministros para el carro de suministros",objectivesES={"Minda te está esperando en el Embarcadero de los Comerciantes.\
\
Deberías hablar con Minda Matosos.","Consigue herramientas de carpintero","Habla con Minda Matosos","Suministros para el carro de suministros","Cotfast se encuentra en el centro del Bosque Salvaje.\
\
Minda Matosos te ha pedido que vayas a Cotfast a buscar materiales para reparar su carro.","Herramientas de carpintero conseguidas","Minda Matosos está lista para partir hacia Bree, pero tiene una última petición antes de poder emprender el viaje de vuelta a casa."}},
[11454]={nameES="Supplies for the War Effort",objectivesES={"Assist in gathering supplies for the army","Feeding, outfitting, and arming an entire army takes vast resources.","Return to Valdi","Supplies for the War Effort","Valdi can be found in Amdân.\
\
You should return to Valdi.","Goods and supplies can be found across Azanulbizar.\
\
Valdi has tasked you with gathering meat, furs, and supplies for the army."}},
[11455]={nameES="Supplies from the Sea",objectivesES={}},
[11456]={nameES="Supplies in the Hallows",objectivesES={"Bring the supplies to Andûmu","The Jatsakóri of Gadim-ûn are running low on the basic necessities they need to continue living in An Shêru.","Andûmu believes there may be more supply caches hidden many years ago inside the Crypts of Gadim-ûn by Ordâkhai soldiers. You have gone there at his request and collected supplies, as well as defeating some of the wights. You should return to Andûmu inside the hall at Gadim-ûn.","Supplies in the Hallows","Andûmu believes there may be more supply caches hidden many years ago inside the Crypts of Gadim-ûn by Ordâkhai soldiers. He has asked you to enter the crypts and search for them. You should also defeat some of the wights while you are there. The entrance to the Crypts of Gadim-ûn is at the north-west end of the hall at Gadim-ûn."}},
[11457]={nameES="Supplies in the Swamp",objectivesES={"Return to Tálbiral in Laivárth","Supplies in the Swamp","Bring the gathered flowers, berries, and missing notebook pages back to Tálbiral in Laivárth.","Find missing pages","Tálbiral needs help gathering flowers and berries near Laivárth so that he can check how the blight is affecting them as well as recovering the missing pages of his notebook.","Found missing pages"}},
[11458]={nameES="Suministros en las Quebradas del Sur",objectivesES={"Lleva la carne de jabalí y las pieles de lince a Sirvellon en Sírlond","Haerandir está fuera de Haudh Nirui, en las Quebradas del Sur.","Sirvellon está en Sírlond, al este de Caranost propiamente dicho.","Los jabalíes y linces de las Quebradas del Sur pueden proporcionar los suministros que Haerandir solicitó.","Lleva la carne de jabalí y las pieles de lince a Haerandir fuera de Haudh Nirui","Suministros en las Quebradas del Sur","Haerandir quiere que le ayudes a recolectar los suministros necesarios para reabastecer el campamento de su hermana y su esposo."}},
[11459]={nameES="Supply Run",objectivesES={"Deliver supplies to the resting Ranger","Deliver supplies to the nervous Ranger","Deliver supplies to the tracking Ranger","Rangers of Ithilien can be found in the western cliffs of Cirith Ungol.\
\
You should deliver supplies to any Rangers you find. Mírthel said there were five.","Deliver supplies to the famished Ranger","Deliver supplies to the ill Ranger","Talk to Mírthel","Mírthel has asked you to deliver supplies to Rangers in the field in Cirith Ungol.","The crate of Ranger supplies can be found in Echad Taerdim.\
\
You should collect the supplies to take to the Rangers in Cirith Ungol.","Mírthel can be found in  Echad Taerdim, the Ranger camp in Cirith Ungol.\
\
You should talk to Mírthel.","Collect the Ranger supplies","Collected the Ranger supplies","Supply Run"}},
[11460]={nameES="Supply Run - DNT",objectivesES={}},
[11461]={nameES="Supply Sabotage",objectivesES={}},
[11462]={nameES="Supplying Demand",objectivesES={"Talk to Halshûm at Khanâg Gur","Supplying Demand","Talk to Zarzûmir in Zajâna","Upon seeing you return with the crates, Halshûm laughs.\
\
'You did it! If you want to become a Khanda-khêl, let me know. I think you would fit in well.\
\
'I do not want those rations, though. My men have finer tastes than Ordâkhai soldiers do, and I do not expect the dullards to buy them for a third time.'\
\
He chuckles before waving his hand in the air dismissively.\
\
'Do with them what you will. Just get them out of here.'\
\
'Now, on with our business. In Zajâna there is a man named Zarzûmir. You will find him lingering in one of the marketplaces. He would give your jeweller a fair price, and he has caravans that pass through An Shêru, so he could pick up the goods.\
\
'I do business with him myself. He pays me to ensure his caravans make it through An Shêru without being attacked by bandits. Which is very easy to do. I just order them to leave him alone.'\
\
Halshûm laughs again at his own cleverness.\
\
'Anyway, tell Zarzûmir Khanda-mashár sent you, and he will not refuse your offer.'","After helping Halshûm, he gave you the name of a merchant in Zajâna, Zarzûmir, who will do business with Tekâmi. He did not want the Ordâkhai rations that you helped the soldiers of Kôth Rau 'lose' and said you can do whatever you want with them. You should give them to the Jatsakóri in north-eastern An Shêru, as they are always in need of supplies.","Tekâmi has asked you to go to Khanâg Gur and speak with their leader on her behalf about the possibility of a business partnership.","Return to Tekâmi in Jiret-menêsh","Bring the rations to Halshûm at Khanâg Gur","You met with Zarzûmir in Zajâna, and he agreed to trade with Tekâmi. You should return to Jiret-menêsh and tell Tekâmi of your success.","Bring the rations to Nabatínu in Gadim-ûn","You went to Khanâg Gur to ask Halshûm if he wanted to do business with Tekâmi. He did not, but he will find someone who does if you do something for him. He wants you to go to Kôth Rau and take back the rations that he recently sold to them, so that they will need to buy more. Kôth Rau is in southern An Shêru.","Tekâmi is worried that she will not be able to find a trade partner, while other dwarves are sending out trade emissaries.","You went to Khanâg Gur to ask Halshûm if he wanted to do business with Tekâmi. He did not, but he will find someone who does if you do something for him. You went to Kôth Rau and took back the ration crates he recently sold to them, so that they will need to buy more. You should return to Halshûm at Khanâg Gur in central An Shêru.","After helping Halshûm, he gave you the name of a merchant in Zajâna, Zarzûmir, who will do business with Tekâmi. You first gave the Ordâkhai rations to the Jatsakóri at Gadim-ûn, and should now go to Zajâna in search of Zarzûmir, who is said to always be in one of the markets."}},
[11463]={nameES="Supplying the Ranks",objectivesES={"Gather crate of swords","Some new recruits have volunteered in Iridír after news of the attacks. Bâdarul has asked that you help supply them with weapons so they can begin their training.\
\
Gather supplies of weapons from crates nearby.","Arm the recruits in Iridír with the weapons they desire so that they can begin their training.","Crate of spears gathered","Some new recruits have volunteered in Iridír after news of the attacks. Bâdarul has asked that you help supply them with weapons so they can begin their training.","Gather crate of bows","Crate of bows gathered","Return to Bâdarul","Supplying the Ranks","Gather crate of spears","Return to Bâdarul in Iridír and inform him that you have armed the new recruits and they are not ready to begin training.","Crate of swords gathered"}},
[11464]={nameES="Support Góda",objectivesES={"Lady Góda stands near Reeve Ingbert in the Mead Hall of Eaworth.\
\
Ingbert has asked you to speak with his mother, Lady Góda, and learn the heart of her arguments.","Reeve Ingbert, still undecided about what course of action he should take regarding the Orcs in the Entwash Vale, has put his faith in your advice.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>You should accept both Support Góda and Support Ingmar to learn their positions, but you may only complete one of them. The other will fail. Which quest you complete will determine who you will support throughout the story arc.</rgb>","If Góda's reasoning seems greater to you than Ingmar's, you should speak with Ingbert on her behalf","Reeve Ingbert stands near Góda in the Mead Hall of Eaworth.\
\
You should consider Góda's argument. If her reasoning seems preferable to Ingmar's, you should speak with Reeve Ingbert on her behalf.","<rgb=#FF0000>If you complete Support Ingmar, this quest will fail</rgb>","<rgb=#FF0000>Support Góda failed</rgb>","Talk to Ingbert in the Mead Hall of Eaworth","Talk to Góda in the Mead Hall of Eaworth","You take a moment to convey your support of Góda's position to Reeve Ingbert.\
\
'I understand my son's desire to ride into battle...in my youth, I was much the same. Few beyond Rohan comprehend what it is to earn glory in the heat of battle.\
\
'However, my mother's advice, as you say, seems the greater. My mind is decided: we shall follow Lady Góda's advice.'","Support Góda"}},
[11465]={nameES="Support Ingmar",objectivesES={"<rgb=#FF0000>If you complete Support Góda, this quest will fail</rgb>","Reeve Ingbert, still undecided about what course of action he should take regarding the Orcs in the Entwash Vale, has put his faith in your advice.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>You should accept both Support Góda and Support Ingmar to learn their positions, but you may only complete one of them. The other will fail. Which quest you complete will determine who you will support throughout the story arc.</rgb>","Support Ingmar","Lord Ingmar stands near Reeve Ingbert in the Mead Hall of Eaworth.\
\
Ingbert has bidden you speak with Ingmar regarding his plan, to learn whether the greater wisdom is to follow his son into battle.","Talk to Ingmar in the Mead Hall of Eaworth","You take a moment to convey your support of Ingmar's plan, igniting the passion for glory within Ingbert's heart.\
\
'Aye! I will not remain holed up within these walls like a coward!'\
\
His manner calms a little.\
\
'It is true that we have the opportunity to scatter these Orcs like chaff on the wind... but only if we attack first. I have made my decision.'","Talk to Ingbert in the Mead Hall of Eaworth","If you believe Ingmar's reasoning to be greater than Góda's, you should bring your support of his plan to Ingbert","Ingbert stands near Ingmar in the Mead Hall of Eaworth.\
\
If you believe that Ingmar's reasoning is greater than Góda's, you should bring your support of his plan to Ingbert.","<rgb=#FF0000>Support Ingmar failed</rgb>"}},
[11466]={nameES="Paquete de Colaborador: Rivendel mejorado",objectivesES={"Esta misión te recompensa por tu compra del Paquete de Colaborador de Rivendel Mejorado.","Paquete de Colaborador: Rivendel mejorado","Disfruta tu recompensa por ser un colaborador.","Obtén el objeto de adjudicación del paquete de colaborador."}},
[11467]={nameES="Paquete de Colaborador: Rivendel Exuberante",objectivesES={"Paquete de Colaborador: Rivendel Exuberante","Esta misión te recompensa por tu compra del Paquete de Colaborador de Rivendel exuberante.","Disfruta tu recompensa por ser un colaborador.","Obtén el objeto de adjudicación del paquete de colaborador."}},
[11468]={nameES="Paquete de Colaborador: Rivendel simple",objectivesES={"Paquete de Colaborador: Rivendel simple","Disfruta tu recompensa por ser un colaborador.","Esta misión te recompensa por tu compra del Paquete de Colaborador de Rivendel simple.","Obtén el objeto de adjudicación del paquete de colaborador."}},
[11469]={nameES="Ayuda a los exploradores",objectivesES={"Dirígete a las ruinas de Dol Vaeg y habla con Cwendreda. Las ruinas se encuentran al noreste del Gran Camino del Este, en una gran colina.\
\
Fridéric el Anciano te ha pedido que vayas a ver a Cwendreda en Dol Vaeg.","Ve a ver a Cwendreda en Dol Vaeg.","Ayuda a los exploradores","«Sigue el camino hacia el este y busca la colina más alta, al norte. Allí se encuentra Dol Vaeg.'","Fridéric te ha pedido que vayas a ver a Cwendreda, en las ruinas de Dol Vaeg. Esta guerrera se dedica a vigilar a los muertos y a impedir que se extiendan por las ruinas de Nan Dhelu."}},
[11470]={nameES="Supporting the Bulwark",objectivesES={"You should talk to the Dumûri captain, Dalagín, on the south side of Iridír, near the river.","Supporting the Bulwark","Talk to Dalagín","Girhâzi has suggested you assist the Dumûri defending Iridír near the river."}},
[11471]={nameES="Casi en la meta",objectivesES={"El montaraz Culang ha sabido de un gran tesoro enterrado hace mucho tiempo por un terrateniente Dúnadan y quiere recuperarlo antes de que sea encontrado por los saqueadores de tumbas.","El tesoro podría estar bajo otro hito de piedra en algún lugar de Evendim, según el acertijo:\
\
  \\qDesde esta orilla, Rantost puedes divisar,\
  un corto nado es lo que te separa de este lugar.\\q\
\
Debes examinar el hito cuando lo encuentres en busca de alguna pista sobre la localización del tesoro.","Casi en la meta","Encuentra la solución al acertijo","La inscripción en este hito de piedra es apenas legible, pero se pueden distinguir las siguientes palabras:\
\
\
  \\qDesde esta orilla, Rantost puedes divisar,\
  un corto nado es lo que te separa de este lugar.\\q\
\
Este nuevo acertijo podría revelar la verdadera localización del tesoro.","El hito de piedra está rodeado de signos de excavación. Si una vez marcaba la localización del tesoro, seguro que ha sido encontrado.\
\
El hito lleva una inscripción, desgastada por el paso del tiempo.","La inscripción en este hito de piedra es apenas legible, pero se pueden distinguir las siguientes palabras:\
\
  \\qDesde esta orilla, Rantost puedes divisar,\
  un corto nado es lo que te separa de este lugar.\\q\
\
Este nuevo acertijo podría revelar la verdadera localización del tesoro."}},
[11472]={nameES="Hierba para Pipa Inesperada",objectivesES={"Lleva la bolsita de hierba para pipa a alguien en Rivendel","Este barril yace a un lado del camino que atraviesa Tâl Bruinen, pero lo más curioso es que está lleno de hierba para pipa. Ya es raro ver carros pasar por aquí, pero carros que transporten hierba para pipa lo son aún más.\
\
Tomas una bolsita de hierba para pipa del barril y decides llevarla a la cercana Rivendel. Quizás alguien allí sepa qué ha provocado que este barril terminara aquí.","Has encontrado un barril lleno de hierba para pipa justo al costado del camino que atraviesa Tâl Bruinen. Algo muy inusual...","Hierba para Pipa Inesperada","Alguien en Rivendel, al norte de Tâl Bruinen, podría saber cómo acabó un barril de hierba para pipa a un lado del camino en medio de la naturaleza.\
\
Has encontrado un barril de hierba para pipa abandonado y has tomado una bolsita para mostrársela a alguien en Rivendel."}},
[11473]={nameES="Surveying Glittengrof",objectivesES={"Deliver the broken crystal shards to Spall","As you step deeper into Glittengrof, Spall mumbles something to himself","Among the long-abandoned caverns of Gloomingtarn lies Glittengrof, the ancient crystal-lodes of Durin the Deathless.","Glittengrof can be found to the south-west of Watchers' Roost in Gloomingtarn.\
\
Spall has asked you to join him in exploring Glittengrof. You should travel to Glittengrof.","Spall can be found at your side in Gloomingtarn.\
\
You have collected a number of broken crystal shards in Glittengrof. You should deliver them to Spall.\
\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: If you become separated from Spall, use the horn he gave you to call him to your side.</rgb>","Spall can be found at your side in Gloomingtarn.\
\
You have begun your survey of Glittengrof and it appears Spall wishes to speak to you. You should talk to Spall.\
\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: If you become separated from Spall, use the horn he gave you to call him to your side.</rgb>","Surveying Glittengrof","Broken crystal shards can be found in Glittengrof in Gloomingtarn.\
\
Spall has asked you to collect broken crystal shards from Glittengrof.","Talk to Spall","Explore Glittengrof with Spall"}},
[11474]={nameES="Surveying Ormgren",objectivesES={"Among the long-abandoned caverns of Gloomingtarn lies Ormgren, the ancient ore-lodes of Durin the Deathless.","Surveying Ormgren","Ormgren can be found to the east of Watchers' Roost across Durthuzâram in Gloomingtarn.\
\
Spall has asked you to join him in exploring Ormgren. You should travel to Ormgren.","Spall can be found at your side in Gloomingtarn.\
\
You have begun your survey of Ormgren and it appears Spall wishes to speak to you. You should talk to Spall.\
\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: If you become separated from Spall, use the horn he gave you to call him to your side.</rgb>","Explore Ormgren with Spall","As you step deeper into Ormgren, Spall calls you over","Deliver the glow-worm gizzards to Spall","Glow-worm gizzards can be harvested from adult glow-worms in Ormgren.\
\
Spall has asked you to extract glow-worm gizzards from the glow-worms inhabiting Ormgren.","Talk to Spall","Spall can be found at your side in Gloomingtarn.\
\
You have collected a number of glow-worm gizzards in Ormgren. You should deliver them to Spall.\
\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: If you become separated from Spall, use the horn he gave you to call him to your side.</rgb>"}},
[11475]={nameES="Surveying Seregost",objectivesES={"This looks like a good location for the climb","This must be the source of Agarnaith's disease","Complete: Yet Another Bad Plan","Find a suitable location for Viznak to climb up","Survey the eastern side of Seregost","Viznak has a few ideas for getting into Seregost.\
\
You should complete quests for Viznak.\
\
If Viznak wanders off, you can call him back with the goblin-caller.","Surveying Seregost","Talk to Viznak","Somewhere along Seregost's walls should be a suitable location for the climb.\
\
You should find a suitable location for Viznak to climb up.\
\
If Viznak wanders off, you can call him back with the goblin-caller.","Complete: Another Bad Plan","Your next task is to work with Viznak to discover a way into Seregost. He, of course, has some ideas.","Seregost can be found at the northern end of Agarnaith.\
\
You should survey locations of Seregost's walls.\
\
If Viznak wanders off, you can call him back with the goblin-caller.","Survey the western side of Seregost","Viznak can be called with the goblin-caller.\
\
You should talk to Viznak.","Viznak can be found in his hideout.\
\
You should talk to Viznak when you are ready to go.","There doesn't appear to be an entrance here","Complete: A Bad Plan","Survey central Seregost"}},
[11476]={nameES="Surveying the Morannon",objectivesES={"Surveying the Morannon","Narchost overlooks much of the western Slag-hills","The entrance does not seem to be heavily guarded","Good vantage points can be found around the Slag-hills.\
\
You should survey the Black Gate and the Towers of the Teeth.","Survey the base of Narchost","You relate to Thurindol what you saw.\
\
'The Morannon has not changed? That is as I expected. The movements you describe around Narchost are interesting. I do not know what to make of it. And Carchost is heavily guarded, you say? That must mean there is something of great importance within the tower now.'","Thurindol requires more information on the structures within the Slag-hills, and wishes for you to survey the territory.","Survey the base of Carchost","You should return to Thurindol, who can be found at the small Ranger outpost hidden in the Slag-hills.","Survey the tower of Carchost","Return to Thurindol","Travelling any closer to Morannon would surely lead to a swift death","The entrance to the tower seems to be guarded by the entire Orc encampment","Survey the Black Gate","Survey the tower of Narchost","Carchost overlooks much of the eastern Slag-hills"}},
[11477]={nameES="Explorando las tierras salvajes",objectivesES={"Habla con Nellie Bosquejo","El Cruce de Marl, Guardanorte, la Casa del Viejo Risco, el Salón Sobrevino y Guardasur están en el Bosque Salvaje.\
\
Deberías explorar el Bosque Salvaje para la Hermandad de los Leñadores y acabar con cualquier orco o bandido que encuentres.","Habla con Aran Verduno","Las ruinas del Salón Sobrevino ya no están abandonadas","Explora la Casa del Viejo Risco","Habla con Aggy Cavazaña","Guardansur está infestado de enemigos","La Casa del Viejo Risco es un puesto de vigilancia para los enemigos del Bosque Salvaje","Explorando las tierras salvajes","Explora el Salón Sobrevino","Guardanorte está infestado de enemigos","Los enemigos de las Quebradas del Norte usan el Cruce de Marl para entrar en el Bosque Salvaje","Explora Guardanorte","Aggy Cavazaña, el guardia Otley, Giles Chadwick y Nellie Bosquejo están en Puente de Caballetes.\
\
Deberías hablar con Aggy Cavazaña, el guardia Otley, Giles Chadwick y Nellie Bosquejo cuanto antes.","Explora Guardasur","La Hermandad de los Leñadores desea explorar el Bosque Salvaje de las Tierras de Bree para identificar tanto los recursos como las amenazas que se esconden entre las colinas boscosas.","Habla con Giles Chadwick","Explora el Cruce de Marl","Aran Verduno se encuentra en Puente de Caballetes.\
\
Deberías hablar con Aran Verduno.","Habla con el guardia Otley"}},
[11478]={nameES="Supervivencia -- Quebradas de los Túmulos fase 1",objectivesES={"Has sobrevivido durante cinco minutos","A los habitantes de los Quebradas de los Túmulos no les gustan los invitados no deseados.","Supervivencia -- Quebradas de los Túmulos fase 1","Sobrevive durante cinco minutos"}},
[11479]={nameES="Supervivencia -- Quebradas de los Túmulos fase 2",objectivesES={"A los habitantes de las Quebradas de los Túmulos no les gustan los invitados no deseados.","Has sobrevivido durante diez minutos","Supervivencia -- Quebradas de los Túmulos fase 2","Sobrevive durante diez minutos"}},
[11480]={nameES="Supervivencia -- Quebradas de los Túmulos fase 3",objectivesES={"A los habitantes de las Quebradas de los Túmulos no les gustan los invitados no deseados.","Supervivencia -- Quebradas de los Túmulos fase 3","Has sobrevivido durante quince minutos","Sobrevive durante quince minutos"}},
[11481]={nameES="Supervivencia -- Quebradas de los Túmulos fase 4",objectivesES={"Sobrevive durante veinte minutos","A los habitantes de los Quebradas de los Túmulos no les gustan los invitados no deseados.","Has sobrevivido durante veinte minutos","Supervivencia -- Quebradas de los Túmulos fase 4"}},
[11482]={nameES="Supervivencia -- Quebradas de los Túmulos fase 5",objectivesES={"Has sobrevivido durante veinticinco minutos","A los habitantes de los Quebradas de los Túmulos no les gustan los invitados no deseados.","Sobrevive durante veinticinco minutos","Supervivencia -- Quebradas de los Túmulos fase 5"}},
[11483]={nameES="Supervivencia -- Quebradas de los Túmulos fase 6",objectivesES={"A los habitantes de los Quebradas de los Túmulos no les gustan los invitados no deseados.","Has sobrevivido durante treinta minutos","Sobrevive durante treinta minutos","Supervivencia -- Quebradas de los Túmulos fase 6"}},
[11484]={nameES="Survival Instincts",objectivesES={"You have caught Zogmauk's attention.\
\
You should talk to him in Kafagur.","Talk to Nargai","Talk to Zogmauk","Nargai has asked you to find and talk to Zogmauk in Kafagur.\
\
They suggested clearing your throat to alert him to your presence first.","Find and alert Zogmauk to your presence with a soft <rgb=#00ff00>ahem</rgb>","Survival Instincts","Zogmauk has asked you to return to Nargai with some fruit and his apologies.\
\
Nargai can be found in Kafagur.","Recognition briefly washes over Zogmauk's face as he glances over","Echoes of the violence that the Gundabad Orcs experienced run deeper than mere wounds."}},
[11485]={nameES="Survival of the Fittest",objectivesES={"Survival of the Fittest","Frogildi is at the Woodman camp in the heart of the Rushgore.\
\
You should bring the items you collected to Frogildi.","The Woodmen stranded in the Rushgore are in need of provisions and supplies to see them through their ordeal until they can patch their boats.","Turtles can be found throughout the Rushgore.\
\
Frogildi asked you to hunt the turtles of the Rushgore for their meat, hides, and shells.","Bring the turtle-meat, hides, and shells to Frogildi at the Woodman camp in the Rushgore."}},
[11486]={nameES="Surviving in the Darkness",objectivesES={"Deliver the recovered goods to Echil","Supply-stores can be found hidden throughout Osgiliath.\
\
Echil has asked you to seek out hidden supply-stores and return them to the Rangers of Ithilien within Osgiliath.","Trapped within the tunnels below Osgiliath, the Rangers of Ithilien struggle to survive as their supplies dwindle.","Surviving in the Darkness","Echil can be found in the tunnels beneath Osgiliath.\
\
You have recovered many hidden supply-stores from Osgiliath, and should now deliver them to Echil."}},
[11487]={nameES="Survivor at Flodgeheld",objectivesES={"This slain Rohirrim has nothing of use left upon him","Talk to Wilberth","You helped wrap the wounds, but Wilberth will need more time to heal","This Rohirrim tried to escape on foot, but was shot down from behind","Flodgeheld lies along the Swiftwater River to the south-west of Brockbridge.\
\
Herefara has asked you to go to Flodgeheld.","You find that Flodgeheld has been attacked recently and should search for survivors","Talk to the injured Rohirrim","This man has wounds from many weapons. He must have fought valiantly to his death","Survivor at Flodgeheld","Find Flodgeheld","Help bandage Wilberth's wounds","One of the two slain Rohirrim you found earlier should have supplies that would aid Wilberth, the injured man you found.","The healing supplies you found will stop Wilberth's health from declining due to the injuries, but it will take some time for him to fully recover.","An injured Rohirrim appears to have hidden himself near the old palisade.\
\
You should speak with the injured Rohirrim and learn what happened at this place.","Flodgeheld lies to the west of Brockbridge.\
\
Flodgeheld appears to have been attacked by the forces of the White Hand. You should scout the area for survivors.","Wilberth would like to thank you for your aid, as he would probably have died not too long from now without help.","You found a pack with healing supplies","Search slain Rohirrim for healing supplies","Herefara has found that the map contains markings for an old fortification called Flodgeheld. It seems likely to have been attacked by the White Hand as was Brockbridge."}},
[11488]={nameES="Survivors From the Fords",objectivesES={"Bring the news of Grimbold to Hildith","Elfhelm is in his camp in the passage through the mountains in the southern Westfold.\
\
You should speak with Elfhelm before he departs for Meduseld.","Speak with Elfhelm","Gandalf is at Elfhelm's Camp in the passage through the mountains in the southern Westfold.\
\
You should speak with Gandalf.","Hildith is pale as you relay Elfhelm's harsh account of Grimbold's failed decisions at the Fords of Isen.\
\
'He wanted to stay because he had nothing to lose. I cursed my husband when he left, he who has always been kind to me.\
\
'My poor husband must be suffering much, if he is still alive. First I withdrew my support, and then Elfhelm followed in the heat of battle. He will be shattered....'","Observe the end of the Second Battle of the Fords","Hildith is in the Mead Hall of Grimslade.\
\
You should return to Hildith with the news of her husband.","Habla con Gandalf","You have found Elfhelm, one of the missing lords from the Fords of Isen. He will have word of the other lords who went missing when the fords fell to the enemy.","Survivors From the Fords","Elfhelm is willing to tell you of the last time he saw Grimbold"}},
[11489]={nameES="Suspicious Characters in Dol Amroth",objectivesES={"The third suspicious character, possibly a Corsair in disguise, can be found somewhere around the warehouses of Dol Amroth.\
\
You should investigate the third suspicious character.","Lothíriel has heard reports of Corsair scouts who may have infiltrated the great city of Dol Amroth.","Investigate the suspicious person in the Court of the Fount","Speak with the swan-knight guard outside the door","The second suspicious character, possibly a Corsair in disguise, can be found somewhere around the wharf of Dol Amroth.\
\
You should investigate the second suspicious character.","You have defeated the disguised Corsair in the Court of the Fount, but his threats were unsettling...","Suspicious Characters in Dol Amroth","The swan-knight guard can be found outside of the Great Hall of the Prince.\
\
You should ask the swan-knight guard where suspicious folk are being investigated.","Evidently the suspicious characters have been searching for you...","The first suspicious character, possibly a Corsair in disguise, can be found somewhere around the Court of the Fount.\
\
You should investigate the first suspicious character.","Captain Abedec's threats are severe indeed, but empty thus far","Investigate the suspicious person at the wharf","Investigate the suspicious person at the warehouses"}},
[11490]={nameES="Rastros sospechosos en el Ángulo",objectivesES={"Quienquiera que haya levantado este campamento puede haber dejado algo atrás.\
\
Deberías registrar el campamento en busca de información.","Examina la hoguera","Examina las huellas","Habla con Lagordal","Has encontrado un par de rastros de vida en este campamento.\
\
Deberías examinar las huellas para obtener más información.","Puede que esté teniendo lugar alguna actividad funesta bajo las narices de los Montaraces.","Un saco a medio llenar con provisiones podridas yace flácido en el suelo","En el momento en que intentaste examinar las huellas del campamento, un dunlendino te atacó.\
\
Deberías volver a Lagordal con estas noticias.","Lagordal te ha pedido que investigues un campamento sospechoso en lo alto de un acantilado.\
\
El acantilado se encuentra al sureste, junto a la cascada que hay frente a Tornhad.","La tierra cubre parte de esta hoguera, como si alguien hubiera intentado enterrarla a toda prisa","Encuentra el campamento sospechoso","Rastros sospechosos en el Ángulo","Examina el saco","El campamento ha sido abandonado"}},
[11491]={nameES="Sospechoso por naturaleza",objectivesES={"Los Angmarim recorren Eregion en busca de cualquier vestigio del pasado que pueda reforzar aún más sus fuerzas. El pequeño grupo de elfos que se encuentra en Echad Mirobel desea conservar las ruinas tal y como están, y te ha pedido que les ayudes en esta misión.","Sospechoso por naturaleza","En Mirobel, en la región suroeste de Eregion, hay un herrero.\
\
Ornras de Echad Mirobel te ha pedido que derrotes a los enemigos de esa región y, con suerte, encuentres a alguien que lleve la Marca de Angmar. La presencia de un gran herrero oculto entre los enemigos de menor rango explicaría por qué algunos de los líderes de este ejército del norte llevan consigo un mineral poderoso y maligno.","Devuelve la Marca a Ornras en Echad Mirobel"}},
[11492]={nameES="Sutcrofts Tents: Enhancements I",objectivesES={}},
[11493]={nameES="Sutcrofts Tents: Enhancements II",objectivesES={}},
[11494]={nameES="Sutcrofts Tents: Inhabitants",objectivesES={}},
[11495]={nameES="Sutcrofts Tents: Rebuild",objectivesES={}},
[11496]={nameES="Guardasur: Destrucción de barricadas",objectivesES={"Las barricadas que se encuentren en Guardasur deben destruirse para debilitar las defensas de tus enemigos en el Bosque Salvaje.","Destruye barricadas en Guardasur","En Guardasur, en el Bosque Salvaje, hay barricadas.\
\
Debes destruir las barricadas de Guardasur.","Los enemigos de los Pueblos Libres han fortificado la torre de Guardasur en el Bosque Salvaje. Si destruimos las barricadas de este lugar, debilitaremos las defensas de Guardasur.","Guardasur: Destrucción de barricadas"}},
[11497]={nameES="Guardasur: Enemigos de los Pueblos Libres",objectivesES={"Acaba con enemigos en Guardasur","Es necesario derrotar a los enemigos de los Pueblos Libres que se encuentran en Guardasur para proteger a los habitantes del Bosque Salvaje.","Guardasur: Enemigos de los Pueblos Libres","En Guardasur, en el Bosque Salvaje, hay enemigos.\
\
Debes derrotar a los enemigos en Guardasur.","Los enemigos de los Pueblos Libres se han apoderado de la torre de Guardasur, en el Bosque Salvaje. Derrotarlos aquí contribuirá a devolver la paz al Bosque Salvaje."}},
[11498]={nameES="Habitante del pantano",objectivesES={"Othran se encuentra en su campamento, en la parte occidental de Malenhad.\
\
Deberías volver a Othran para contarle la historia de tu victoria contra el temido Antiguo Escamahierro.","El raro Antiguo Escamahierro se puede encontrar a veces entre sus hermanos menores en el pantano de Malenhad.\
\
Othran te ha desafiado a ti y a tus compañeros a matar al temido Antiguo Escamahierro, señor de las tortugas maléficas de Malenhad.","Habitante del pantano","El pantano de azufre de Malenhad también alberga una terrible bestia, que los montañeses llaman el \\qAntiguo Escamahierro\\q."}},
[11499]={nameES="Tarea de la Ciénaga de los Cisnes: Ramas sin punta",objectivesES={"Se busca: ramas sin punta de los terribles trolls silvanos y otros árboles particularmente enfadados en la Ciénaga de los Cisnes. ¡Se ofrece una recompensa adecuada en el momento de la entrega!","Tarea de la Ciénaga de los Cisnes: Ramas sin punta","Entregar las ramas sin punta en un buzón de recogida","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir ramas sin punta.","Un habitante de la Ciénaga de los Cisnes ha publicado una tarea para recoger ramas sin punta."}},
[11500]={nameES="Tarea de la Ciénaga de los Cisnes: Dagas rotas",objectivesES={"Un habitante de la Ciénaga de los Cisnes ha publicado una tarea para recoger dagas rotas.","Entregar las dagas rotas en un buzón de recogida","Tarea de la Ciénaga de los Cisnes: Dagas rotas","Se busca: dagas rotas de bandidos y otra gente de mala reputación en la Ciénaga de los Cisnes. ¡Se ofrece una recompensa adecuada en el momento de la entrega!","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir dagas rotas."}},
[11501]={nameES="Tarea de la Ciénaga de los Cisnes: Hachas rotas",objectivesES={"Tarea de la Ciénaga de los Cisnes: Hachas rotas","Entregar las hachas rotas en un buzón de recogida","Un habitante de la Ciénaga de los Cisnes ha publicado una tarea para recoger hachas rotas.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Se busca: hachas rotas de bandidos y uruks en la Ciénaga de los Cisnes. ¡Se ofrece una recompensa adecuada en el momento de la entrega!","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir hachas rotas."}},
[11502]={nameES="Tarea de la Ciénaga de los Cisnes: Vainas de espada rotas",objectivesES={"Entregar las vainas de espada rotas en un buzón de recogida","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir vainas de espada rotas.","Se busca: vainas de espada rotas de bandidos y otra gente de mala reputación en la Ciénaga de los Cisnes. ¡Se ofrece una recompensa adecuada en el momento de la entrega!","Un habitante de la Ciénaga de los Cisnes ha publicado una tarea para recoger vainas de espada rotas.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Tarea de la Ciénaga de los Cisnes: Vainas de espada rotas"}},
[11503]={nameES="Tarea de la Ciénaga de los Cisnes: Escamas sucias",objectivesES={"Un habitante de la Ciénaga de los Cisnes ha publicado una tarea para recoger escamas sucias.","Se busca: escamas sucias de los sierpes de Eregion que han vagado por la Ciénaga de los Cisnes. ¡Se ofrece una recompensa adecuada en el momento de la entrega!","Tarea de la Ciénaga de los Cisnes: Escamas sucias","Entregar las escamas sucias en un buzón de recogida","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir escamas sucias."}},
[11504]={nameES="Tarea de la Ciénaga de los Cisnes: Caparazones ligeros",objectivesES={"Entregar los caparazones ligeros en un buzón de recogida","Un habitante de la Ciénaga de los Cisnes ha publicado una tarea para recoger caparazones ligeros.","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir caparazones ligeros.","Se busca: caparazones ligeros de las arañas, moscas de la hoz, acechadores de pantanos y niquebriques de la Ciénaga de los Cisnes. ¡Se ofrece una recompensa adecuada en el momento de la entrega!","Tarea de la Ciénaga de los Cisnes: Caparazones ligeros","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú."}},
[11505]={nameES="Tarea de la Ciénaga de los Cisnes: Pelajes enmarañados",objectivesES={"Se busca: pelajes enmarañados de todo tipo de las bestias de la Ciénaga de los Cisnes, pero especialmente de las musarañas. ¡Se ofrece una recompensa adecuada en el momento de la entrega!","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir pelajes enmarañados.","Tarea de la Ciénaga de los Cisnes: Pelajes enmarañados","Un habitante de la Ciénaga de los Cisnes ha publicado una tarea para recoger pelajes enmarañados.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Entregar los pelajes enmarañados en un buzón de recogida"}},
[11506]={nameES="Tarea de la Ciénaga de los Cisnes: Alas pequeñas",objectivesES={"Se busca: alas pequeñas de los crebain invasores que molestan a la gente de la Ciénaga de los Cisnes. ¡Se ofrece una recompensa adecuada en el momento de la entrega!","Tarea de la Ciénaga de los Cisnes: Alas pequeñas","Un habitante de la Ciénaga de los Cisnes ha publicado una tarea para recoger alas pequeñas.","Entregar las alas pequeñas en un buzón de recogida","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir alas pequeñas."}},
[11507]={nameES="Tarea de la Ciénaga de los Cisnes: Masas blandas",objectivesES={"Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir masas blandas.","Se busca: masas blandas de arañas, sapos y esos insufribles Niquebriques en la Ciénaga de los Cisnes. ¡Se ofrece una recompensa adecuada en el momento de la entrega!","Entregar las masas blandas en un buzón de recogida","Un habitante de la Ciénaga de los Cisnes ha publicado una tarea para recoger masas blandas.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Tarea de la Ciénaga de los Cisnes: Masas blandas"}},
[11508]={nameES="Tarea de la Ciénaga de los Cisnes: Pieles rotas",objectivesES={"Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir pieles rotas.","Entregar las pieles rotas en un buzón de recogida","Se busca: pieles rotas de todo tipo de las bestias de la Ciénaga de los Cisnes. ¡Se ofrece una recompensa adecuada en el momento de la entrega!","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Un habitante de la Ciénaga de los Cisnes ha publicado una tarea para recoger pieles rotas.","Tarea de la Ciénaga de los Cisnes: Pieles rotas"}},
