[11511]={nameES="Swaying the Match",objectivesES={"Find a suitable place to <rgb=#FF0000>Cheer</rgb> or <rgb=#FF0000>Laugh</rgb> at the fighters","Thorzhaf can be found in Talath Úrui.\
\
You should find a suitable place to help sway the current fighting match.","Swaying the Match","This looks like a good place to <rgb=#FF0000>Challenge</rgb> or <rgb=#FF0000>Roar</rgb> at the fighters","A conniving goblin sees opportunity in your presence and seeks an unlikely pact.","You have successfully swayed the fight!","The fighter has gained confidence","Párgrub can be found near Thorzhaf.\
\
You should speak with Párgrub about the match.","Talk to Párgrub","Find a suitable place to <rgb=#FF0000>Challenge</rgb> or <rgb=#FF0000>Roar</rgb> at the fighters","This looks like a good place to <rgb=#FF0000>Cheer</rgb> or <rgb=#FF0000>Laugh</rgb> at the fighters","This looks like a good place to <rgb=#FF0000>Cheer</rgb> or <rgb=#FF0000>Roar</rgb> at the fighters","The fighter has lost confidence","Find a suitable place to <rgb=#FF0000>Cheer</rgb> or <rgb=#FF0000>Roar</rgb> at the fighters"}},
[11512]={nameES="Sweeping for Stragglers",objectivesES={}},
[11513]={nameES="Té Dulce de Arándano",objectivesES={"Celandine Brandigamo cree que las propiedades medicinales de los arándanos harán un excelente té para combatir la aparente infección de Amdir.","Celandine olió arándanos junto al agua al este de Archet cuando pasó anoche.\
\
Debes recolectar arándanos, pues hacen un té dulce que combate la infección, o eso dice la sabiduría hobbit.","Celandine Brandigamo te espera en el centro de Archet.\
\
Debes llevarle a Celandine los arándanos que recolectaste, pues piensa preparar un dulce té medicinal para ayudar a fortalecer la voluntad de Amdir.","Lleva los arándanos a Celandine","Esta misión no puede completarse fuera de la introducción.","Té Dulce de Arándano"}},
[11514]={nameES="Sweet Extras",objectivesES={"Bring the honeycombs to Meliri","You have visited each of the five beehives around the orange groves of Burukíri in Ambarûl, from which you collected honeycombs. You bring them to Meliri.","Meliri informed you they keep beehives around the orchard to pollinate the trees. They produce enough extra honey that they are able to sell some of it at the market.","Meliri has tasked you with visiting each of the five beehives around the orange groves of Burukíri in Ambarûl, from which you are to collect honeycombs.","Sweet Extras"}},
[11515]={nameES="Sweet Treats",objectivesES={}},
[11516]={nameES="Sweet Water",objectivesES={"Bring the water back to the Vineyards' cistern","Maliriel has asked you to help her companions finish preparations for the upcoming banquet.","Sweet Water","The spring lies directly west of the Vineyards of Lórien.\
\
The Elves of Lothlórien draw water for their feasts from the clearest and sweetest spring in the forest. Glasnír has asked you to draw some water and return it to the cistern in front of the Vineyards.","Glasnír is at the Vineyards of Lórien, east of the spring.\
\
You should speak with Glasnír regarding your task.","Habla con Glasnír en los Viñedos de Lórien"}},
[11517]={nameES="Swift Revenge",objectivesES={"Enswith awaits at her farmstead, north-east of the meadhall of Faldham.","Return to Enswith with news of Gat's defeat","You have defeated Gat","Defeat Gat, the Orc brute","Enswith seeks revenge against the Orc-marauder who was responsible for the loss of her husband.","Gat and his Orc allies have been seen wandering the hills north and west of the mead hall.\
\
Enswith has described the Orc brute, Gat, and has encouraged you to defeat the Orc, in order to avenge her belated husband.","Swift Revenge"}},
[11518]={nameES="Golpe veloz",objectivesES={}},
[11519]={nameES="Sword of the Fathers",objectivesES={"Sword of the Fathers","Bring Helvorlim to Thane Béortnoth","Helvorlim should be in a coffer or box somewhere in Thornhope.\
\
Thane Béortnoth has asked you to find Helvorlim, his family's heirloom sword.","You have found Helvorlim","Helvorlim is not here","Thane Béortnoth was rendered half-mad, following the Orcs' assault on Thornhope.","Thane Béortnoth is encamped outside of Thornhope.\
\
You should bring Helvorlim to Béortnoth at once.","Search for Helvorlim, the heirloom sword of Béortnoth's family"}},
[11520]={nameES="Swords in the Shadows",objectivesES={"Talk to Klúso near Stazg Vozag","Orc spies surround the out-camp of Stazg Vozag, carrying swords of jagged metal.","Swords in the Shadows","Klúso is scouting near Stazg Vozag.","Orc-spies near Stazg Vozag carry the weapons Klúso will need for the plan."}},
[11521]={nameES="Sworn Oaths",objectivesES={"Léofcetel can be found at the western watch-tower, just west of Cliving.\
\
Garmund has asked you to convince the Rider Léofcetel to join him on his errand.","Léofcetel has refused to go against the orders of Reeve Athelward","Garmund believes that the men in his éored must act for the sake of the Norcrofts, even against the will of Reeve Athelward. Not all men share his sentiments, and some refuse to disobey the Reeve.","Ride with Captain Garmund across the plains","Talk to Captain Garmund","Captain Garmund can be found at the western watch-tower, just west of Cliving.\
\
Garmund wishes to convey thanks after the difficult encounter on the fields outside Cliving.","Captain Garmund can be found at the western watch-tower, just west of Cliving.\
\
Léofcetel has refused to ride along with Garmund and his men and has asked the Captain to consider the consequences.","Talk to Captain Garmund outside Cliving","Sworn Oaths","Talk to Léofcetel and convince him to ride along with Captain Garmund","Captain Garmund can be found at the western watch-tower, just west of Cliving.\
\
Captain Garmund wishes to set forth at once, to prevent further destruction to the farms of the crofters of Cliving."}},
[11522]={nameES="Sworn to Secrecy",objectivesES={"Angbor can be found outside Tumladen in Upper Lebennin.\
\
You have delivered Terenis's warning to Lord Angbor. He bears a missive from Aragorn that must be brought to the Lady at once.","Talk to Angbor","Lady Terenis can be found in her hall in the rear of Tumladen in Upper Lebennin.\
\
You have delivered Aragorn's missive to Lady Terenis, and should now aid her as Lord Angbor requested.","At the request of Aragorn, Lord Angbor has come to Tumladen to privately deliver a message of victory to Lady Terenis.","Talk to Lady Terenis","Sworn to Secrecy"}},
[11523]={nameES="Symbols of Conquest",objectivesES={}},
[11524]={nameES="Symbols of the Stained",objectivesES={"The Orcs of Faltor Gâm seem to worship someone or something, and their totems give you a bad feeling. Faeron has asked you to destroy them while you are there.","Symbols of the Stained","Talk to Faeron","Stained Totems can be found in Faltor Gâm, the village of the Infected Orcs.\
\
You should destroy Stained Totems.","Faeron can be found at Viznak's Hideout.\
\
You should talk to Faeron."}},
[11525]={nameES="Sinóminos para siniestro",objectivesES={"Encuentra la parte del manuscrito que habla de la partida de Bingo de la Comarca","Tom Bombadil podría haber dejado el manuscrito de Bingo fuera, cerca de su casa, y Bingo te ha preguntado si puedes buscarlo.","Caléndula y Prisca Boffin están en el exterior de su casa en Norburgo, y cada una de ellas desea hablar contigo.","Le preguntas a Tom qué pensó del manuscrito de Bingo, pero el extraño individuo parece confuso.\
\
'Tus palabras están todas revueltas, joven. Tom recuerda muchas cosas: el sol en la mañana, las brisas del mediodía, el bochorno de la tarde y el fresco de la noche; pero no sabe nada de las páginas de las que hablas. ¡No es necesario escribir! Si pasas todo el día escribiendo, ¡es un día que has perdido!\
\
'¡No pongas esa cara! Estoy seguro de que las páginas aparecerán. Puede que lo haya dejado fuera. Hay tantas cosas que ver, distracciones felices todas ellas, y a veces las cosas se pierden. ¡Al final todo aparece, ja!'","Bingo quiere llevar a Caléndula de vuelta a su casa en Norburgo antes de continuar su viaje.","Habla con Caléndula en el exterior de la casa de Tom Bombadil","Has encontrado las páginas sobre la lección de natación de Bingo","Habla con Tom Bombadil y recupera el manuscrito de Bingo","Bingo te ha dicho que se reuniría contigo en el exterior de la casa de su prima Prisca en Norburgo una vez que terminaras en las Quebradas de los Túmulos.","Habla con Prisca Boffin en el exterior de su casa en Norburgo","Deberías llevar estas páginas de vuelta a Bingo","Habla con Caléndula Boffin en el exterior de la casa de su madre en Norburgo","Has encontrado algunas páginas del manuscrito de Bingo en el sendero que lleva hacia el norte desde la casa de Tom Bombadil. ¿Quizá el viento haya arrastrado más páginas en esa dirección?","Has encontrado algunas páginas del manuscrito de Bingo, pero todavía faltan algunas páginas. Deberías volver a hablar con Bingo y Caléndula en el exterior de la casa de Tom Bombadil para decidir el curso de acción.","Busca al norte de la casa de Tom Bombadil más páginas del manuscrito de Bingo","Has encontrado algunas de las páginas de Bingo. Quizá el viento llevó las otras hacia el norte.","Habla con Bingo en el exterior de la casa de Tom Bombadil","Habla con Bingo en el exterior de la casa de Prisca, en Norburgo","Bingo está en el exterior de la casa de su prima Prisca, en Norburgo, al otro lado del Puente del Brandivino viniendo desde la Comarca.","Bingo está en el exterior de la casa de Tom Bombadil. Deberías darle las malas noticias de que Tom ha perdido su manuscrito.","Sinóminos para siniestro","Has encontrado las páginas que trataban sobre la partida de Bingo de la Comarca","El viento ha arrastrado algunas páginas del manuscrito de Bingo al norte de las Quebradas de los Túmulos, y debes buscarlas. Caléndula te ha pedido también que derrotes barghests y gusanos mientras buscas.","Tom ha dejado por descuido en algún lugar el manuscrito de Bingo","Encuentra el manuscrito de Bingo en algún lugar cerca de la casa de Tom Bombadil","Encuentra la parte del manuscrito que habla de la lección de natación de Bingo","Habla con Bingo en el exterior de la casa de Prisca Boffin, en Norburgo","Tom Bombadil está en el exterior de su casa en el Bosque Viejo durante el día, y dentro durante la noche.\
\
Bingo te ha pedido que recuperes su manuscrito de Tom Bombadil y averigües qué piensa de él tras leerlo."}},
[11526]={nameES="Sâd Torech: Pitched Battle",objectivesES={"Pitch is used to waterproof boats and coat arrows so they will burn.","Vases can be found in Sâd Torech.\
\
Aldbéort has asked you to collect pitch-filled vases from Sâd Torech.","<rgb=#FF0000>Completing Aiding the Eastemnet will cancel this quest</rgb>","Sâd Torech: Pitched Battle","Aldbéort is at Cliving.\
\
Aldbéort will be pleased to receive the pitch-filled vases.","Talk to Aldbéort"}},
[11527]={nameES="Sâd Torech: Sinking Feeling",objectivesES={"Drakelings and bats have settled in the remains of Sâd Torech.","Sâd Torech: Sinking Feeling","Drakelings and bats can be found at Sâd Torech.\
\
Aldbéort asked you to clear some of the drakelings and bats from Sâd Torech.","<rgb=#FF0000>Completing Aiding the Eastemnet will cancel this quest</rgb>","Aldbéort is at Cliving.\
\
Aldbéort will be pleased to hear the drakeling and bat population in Sâd Torech has been thinned.","Talk to Aldbéort"}},
[11528]={nameES="Sûhalar on the Forant",objectivesES={"Easterlings can be found across the River Forant in southern Talath Anor.\
\
You should defeat Sûhalar patrols and destroy Easterling barricades.","Ingold can be found at the northern gate of the Rammas.\
\
You should speak with Ingold.","Sûhalar on the Forant","Speak with Ingold","The discovery of a northern army and strange axe-wielding Easterlings concerns Ingold and threatens his ability to hold the North-gate."}},
[11529]={nameES="Tactic I: Strength in Leadership",objectivesES={"This man disagrees with Agelwyn, and wishes to defend Marton","Agelwyn is in the refugees' hiding spot north of Marton.\
\
You should speak with Agelwyn.","This man agrees with Agelwyn","This woman is relieved to go to Helm's Deep and avoid a skirmish with the invading Orcs","This woman respects Lady Agelwyn's position as acting Thane","This man does not seem to speak much, but he bows his assent. He has not left Agelwyn's side, and it seems that he is as loyal to her as he was to Gladsúnu.","This man does not respect Agelwyn's decision","The people of Marton can be found in the refugees' hiding spot north of town.\
\
You should deliver Agelwyn's decree to the people of Marton.","This man agrees with Agelwyn, for he wishes to defend the King","Gladsúnu's loyal soldier is silent, but bows his assent","Speak with Agelwyn","You believe that Agelwyn should take a firm stand and make a decision for her people, regardless of their feelings.","This woman resents that she has been commanded to abandon her home","This woman disagrees with the choice to go to Helm's Deep, which she deems is too far","Tactic I: Strength in Leadership"}},
[11530]={nameES="Tactic II: The Will of the People",objectivesES={"This man wishes to retreat to Helm's Deep","This man wishes to go to Helm's Deep to defend the King","This woman respects Lady Agelwyn's position as acting Thane, and will follow her will","This man firmly believes in remaining at Marton, and is contemptuous towards Agelwyn for considering anything else","This man wishes to defend Marton","Agelwyn is in the refugees' hiding spot north of Marton.\
\
You should speak with Agelwyn.","Gladsúnu's loyal soldier is silent, but bows his loyalty to Agelwyn","This man does not seem to speak much, but he bows his assent. He has not left Agelwyn's side, and it seems that he is as loyal to her as he was to Gladsúnu.","Tactic II: The Will of the People","You believe that Agelwyn should ask her people what they think, and let the majority of them decide the fate of Marton's refugees.","For myself, I should not be travelling so far in my old age. I believe we should attempt to remain in Marton.\
\
'It is foolish to ride across the plains when our home is right here.'","Speak with Agelwyn","This woman votes not to abandon Marton","The people of Marton can be found in the refugees' hiding spot north of town.\
\
You should ask the people of Marton what they think should be done: Retreat to Helm's Deep, or fight to with back the town.","This woman very much wishes to avoid a skirmish with the invading Orcs, voting for Helm's Deep","This woman prefers to remain in Marton"}},
[11531]={nameES="Tactic III: Wisdom of Counsel",objectivesES={"This man wishes to retreat to Helm's Deep","This man wishes to go to Helm's Deep to defend the King","This woman respects Lady Agelwyn's position as acting Thane, and will follow her will","This man firmly believes in remaining at Marton, and is contemptuous towards Agelwyn for considering anything else","This man wishes to defend Marton","Agelwyn is in the refugees' hiding spot north of Marton.\
\
You should speak with Agelwyn.","Tactic III: Wisdom of Counsel","You believe that Agelwyn should listen to everyone, but ultimately make her own decision.","Gladsúnu's loyal soldier is silent, but bows his loyalty to Agelwyn","This man does not seem to speak much, but he bows his assent. He has not left Agelwyn's side, and it seems that he is as loyal to her as he was to Gladsúnu.","For myself, I should not be travelling so far in my old age. I believe we should attempt to remain in Marton.\
\
'It is foolish to ride across the plains when our home is right here.'","Speak with Agelwyn","This woman votes not to abandon Marton","This woman very much wishes to avoid a skirmish with the invading Orcs, voting for Helm's Deep","This woman prefers to remain in Marton","The people of Marton can be found in the refugees' hiding spot north of town.\
\
You should ask the people of Marton what they think Agelwyn should do next."}},
[11532]={nameES="La Petición de Tad",objectivesES={"Tad Cortahoja se encuentra frente al Pabellón de Caza de Bree, al oeste de la Puerta Sur.\
\
Tad Cortahoja ha pedido que los aventureros de Bree vayan a hablar con él.","Tad Cortahoja ha pedido que los aventureros de Bree vayan a hablar con él.","La Petición de Tad"}},
[11533]={nameES="Tailor: Fur Blankets",objectivesES={"Tailor: Fur Blankets","<rgb=#FF0000>Completing Wildermore's Recovery will cancel this quest.</rgb>","A skilled tailor such as yourself can help the refugees of Wildermore by stitching warm blankets for them.","Hildelith is in Forlaw.\
\
You have stitched fur blankets, and should now deliver them to Hildelith.","Hildelith has given you a recipe for fur blankets.\
\
You should stitch fur blankets for the cold refugees at Forlaw.","Deliver the fur blankets to Hildelith"}},
[11534]={nameES="Tainted Lands, Tainted Legacy",objectivesES={"Uruk-hai pillagers can be found along the edges of the road to the south-west of Entwade.\
\
Thane Edric has asked that you clear the road south of foes as his wife, Léoflad, continues to prepare her people to journey south to Aldburg.","Thane Edric can be found outside the Mead Hall of Entwade in Kingstead.\
\
You have defeated many Uruk-hai along the road south of Entwade and have secured safe passage for Léoflad and her people. You should return to Thane Edric.","Talk to Thane Edric","Tainted Lands, Tainted Legacy","Uruks have recently begun to attack and pillage travellers upon the southern road through Kingstead. Such attacks threaten the journey of Léoflad and the people of Entwade.","DNT -- Players will not see"}},
[11535]={nameES="Jarra Contaminada",objectivesES={"Has robado la famosa receta de la Cerveza de Gunderic","Jónar, un habitante siniestro y hosco de la Mansión de Thorin, se ha vuelto cada vez más amargado ante el creciente éxito de la Liga de las Posadas.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando finalice el festival actual.</rgb>","Roba la receta de la Cerveza de los Helechos","Jarra Contaminada","Lleva las recetas robadas a Jónar en la Mansión de Thorin","TBD","Roba la receta de la Cerveza de Gunderic","Las valiosísimas recetas de la Liga de las Posadas pueden encontrarse repartidas por toda la Comarca: en Cepeda, fuera de la Perca Dorada; en los Grandes Smials de Alforzaburgo; en la Oficina de la Guardia de Tejonera; y en El Cruce.\
\
El enano Jónar te ha pedido que robes las recetas de las ya célebres bebidas maestras de la Liga de las Posadas: la Cerveza de los Helechos, la Cerveza de Gunderic, el Porter de Perry y la Sidra de Nudoraíz.","Jónar te espera con impaciencia en la posada de la Mansión de Thorin.\
\
Deberías regresar y llevarle las recetas robadas, pues querrá oír todo lo sucedido durante tus encuentros con los miembros de la Liga de las Posadas.","Has robado la escurridiza receta de la Cerveza de los Helechos","Has robado la célebre receta de la Sidra de Nudoraíz","Roba la receta del Porter de Perry","Roba la receta de la Sidra de Nudoraíz","Has robado la codiciada receta del Porter de Perry"}},
[11536]={nameES="Tainted Stores",objectivesES={"Enârshan has asked you to sabotage the supplies in Khûn Sagaz with the Idâmi concoction as well as take as many of their weapons as you can.","Tainted Stores","Return to Enârshan","Return to Enârshan in the Falls of Ilûritu and let her know you have used her concoction on the supplies and taken what weapons you could.","Enârshan has provided you with the Idâmi concoction to use on the supplies in Khûn Sagaz to weaken them. She also instructed you to take from them any weapons you find."}},
[11537]={nameES="Take Back the Watch-tower",objectivesES={"Elain awaits you at the watch-tower in the centre of Trum Dreng, long held by the Stag-clan. The watch-tower has likely been captured by the Dragon-clan invaders.","Find Elain at the watch-tower","Take Back the Watch-tower","Elain awaits you at the watch-tower in Trum Dreng, on a hill to the east of Lhan Tarren.\
\
You should join Elain at the watch-tower and see what can be done about the Dragon-clan invaders there."}},
[11538]={nameES="Take Heart, Men of Gondor",objectivesES={"Join Golasgil and the men in toasting to those who fell on the Pelennor.","Talk to Golasgil","Join Golasgil in singing Authlin's Song to lift the hearts of the gathered men.","Golasgil can be found in the Camp of the Host, on the northern edge of North Ithilien.\
\
The celebration has gone off without a hitch. Now you should talk to Golasgil.","Take Heart, Men of Gondor","Golasgil can be found in the Camp of the Host, on the northern edge of North Ithilien.\
\
You should speak with Golasgil and tell him the kegs and soldiers have been gathered.","<rgb=#FF00FF>Toast</rgb> with Golasgil","Golasgil can be found in the Camp of the Host, on the northern edge of North Ithilien.\
\
Lord Aragorn has asked you to talk to Golasgil.","<rgb=#FF00FF>Cheer</rgb> at Golasgil","<rgb=#FF00FF>Sing</rgb> with Golasgil","Aragorn wishes to do something to lift the spirits of the remaining soldiers.","You can find soldiers and kegs in the Camp of the Host, on the northern edge of North Ithilien.\
\
Golasgil has asked you to gather soldiers and kegs of ale."}},
[11539]={nameES="Take Out the Look-outs",objectivesES={"Faeron can be found outside Kala-gijak.\
\
You should talk to Faeron.","Kala-gijak has archer towers all around the perimeter where look-outs search for intruders. You need to find a way to remove these look-outs before your Drúadan friends are spotted.","Talk to Faeron","Kala-gijak look-outs can be found in the archer towers in Kala-gijak.\
\
You should defeat Kala-gijak look-outs.","Take Out the Look-outs"}},
[11540]={nameES="Taking Arms",objectivesES={"Talk to Lanbert at the Cuthstan-camp","The tribe of Orc vandals is south-west of the Cuthstan.\
\
Lanbert has asked you to search defeated Orcs for suitable weapons and to return them to him at his camp.","The men at the Cuthstan-camp are short on supplies, and the camp's leader has turned to scavenging weapons from fallen Orcs.","Lanbert is at the Rohirrim-camp at the base of the Cuthstan.\
\
Lanbert is awaiting your return with suitable weapons taken from the Orcs.","Taking Arms"}},
[11541]={nameES="Taking Back the Land",objectivesES={"Tolwin can be found in the hall of Crithost.\
\
You should speak with Tolwin.","Taking Back the Land","Orcs can be found with Eryn Cordovath.\
\
You should defeat Orcs in the orchard.","Travel to Eryn Cordovath and assess the situation","Eryn Cordovath is located north-west of Crithost.\
\
Travel to Eryn Cordovath and assess the situation.","The Orkish patrol has already made it to the orchard and must be dealt with","A look-out has spotted a band of Orcs headed for Eryn Cordovath, a nearby orchard that is in the process of being evacuated. Tolwin wishes for you to ride out there and assist the farmers.","Talk to Tolwin"}},
[11542]={nameES="Taking Down Lugadúr",objectivesES={"Go to Glúkroz and destroy goblin weapon racks and defeat Lugadúr, chieftain to the goblins. Glúkroz can be found north-east of Sen Chatâk.","Return to Ahâto in Sen Chatâk","Defeat Lugadúr in Glúkroz","Ahâto, a local hunter in Sen Chatâk, has asked you to hunt down Lugadúr, goblin chieftain to the marauding goblins of Glúkroz.","Taking Down Lugadúr","Return to Ahâto in Sen Chatâk to report on Lugadúr's demise."}},
[11543]={nameES="Taking Inventory",objectivesES={}},
[11544]={nameES="Taking Matters Into Their Own Hands",objectivesES={"Find Tomos in the wild","Taking Matters Into Their Own Hands","An elderly warrior of Galtrev, infuriated by the unwillingness of Isengard's guards to protect Pren Gwydh from the violence of the Dragon-clan, has decided to take matters into his own hands.","Tomos has escaped his forced labour to look into doing something about the Dragon-clan menace in Pren Gwydh.\
\
You should seek out Tomos and help him so that he can return before the White Hand Overseers notice that he is gone."}},
[11545]={nameES="Taking Notices",objectivesES={}},
[11546]={nameES="Taking What Remains",objectivesES={"While aiding the people of Sardol, you have come across fishing nets in the river Blackroot. Because Malthellam has urged the people to remain in their villages and their hunters have largely gone missing, it is likely that their food supply will begin to dwindle the longer the conflict continues in Gondor.\
\
You should gather fish to add to their supply in Sardol.","Fish can be found in nets in the Blackroot outside Sardol in south-western Blackroot Vale.\
\
You have discovered fishing nets in the river Blackroot and should gather fish to aid the people of Sardol.","Taking What Remains","Completado","You have recovered many fish from the nets along the river Blackroot.","DNT -- will not be seen","You have recovered as many fish as you are able to bear back to Sardol. While the people who dwell there still have a supply of food, it will certainly dwindle the longer the Dead and Orcs plague the vale.\
\
You have done well to secure the health of Sardol for days to come.","With the hunters of Sardol missing, fish from the river Blackroot may be the only choice left for their survival if the danger in the vale continues to escalate."}},
[11547]={nameES="Transmitir la información a Calargyl",objectivesES={"Transmitir la información a Calargyl","Maeriel necesita saber lo que su compañero montaraz sabe de los jabalíes enfermos y los huargos agresivos.","Habla con Calargyl","Maeriel te ha pedido que hables con su compañero montaraz, Calargyl, sobre lo que habéis visto y hecho en la Pradera de Juncos.\
\
Calargyl está cerca de Amon Firn, en el noreste de Cardolan."}},
[11548]={nameES="Taking a Rest",objectivesES={"Go to the Rangers' camp","Khagâmi is tired from her travels west through An Shêru, and is ready to settle in for the night.","As you and Khagâmi talked at the camp-fire, you were attacked by a group of bandits. You were able to defend yourself with unexpected help from Faeron, Ranger of the Grey Company. You should talk to Khagâmi about the evening's adventure.","Faeron invited you to his camp atop the nearby hill, and there you found his companion, Rhadrog. You should talk to him.","Talk to Rhadrog","Complete Instance: Taking a Rest","Khagâmi, who wanted a travelling companion in An Shêru, would like to set up camp and rest here for the night.","Talk to Khagâmi","Taking a Rest","You see a familiar face","Instance: Taking a Rest completed","After defending your encampment with unexpected help from Faeron, the Ranger invited you to his camp atop the nearby hill."}},
[11549]={nameES="Taking a Stand",objectivesES={"Taking a Stand","You found all of Léofward's scouts and reported back to him. Now Léofward prepares to act upon your discoveries.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>This instance can only be run solo.</rgb>","Léofward is at the Rohirrim scout-camp in the Gravenwood.\
\
You should let Léofward know when you are ready to depart for the Mustering Tree.","Accompany Léofward to the Mustering Tree","Léofward is at the Rohirrim scout-camp in the Gravenwood.\
\
You should return to Léofward to discuss the battle at the Mustering Tree.","Talk to Léofward at the Rohirrim scout-camp"}},
[11550]={nameES="Taking the Blame",objectivesES={"Agelman can be found at your side or can be rallied by sounding your horn.\
\
You have readied the horse, and should now speak to Agelman before sending him back to Entwade.","The horses can be found near the farmhouse at Pendlac's Farm in south-eastern Kingstead.\
\
Agelman has asked that you ready a horse for him as he prepares Léoflad's body for travel back to Entwade.","Talk to Agelman","Readied the horse at Pendlac's Farm","Ready the horse at Pendlac's Farm","Agelman hopes to return Léoflad to Edric's side and persuade the Thane not to abandon his charge in the wake of such a tragedy.","Taking the Blame"}},
[11551]={nameES="Taking the Fight To Them",objectivesES={"Taking the Fight To Them","Return and report your success to Azagâya outside of the Shorakhúna in Zajâna.","Report back to Mizâdi outside the Shorakhúna in Zajâna","Azagâya wishes for you to prove your friendliness to Zajâna by defeating Ordâkhai in Zajâna near the Hall of Lajór.","Speak with Doorward Azagâya outside of the Shorakhúna in Zajâna.","Defeat Ordâkhai forces near the Hall of Lajór in Zajâna. The Hall of Lajór is located in the eastern end of Zajâna.","Report back to Mizâdi outside the Shorakhúna in Zajâna.","Speak with Azagâya outside of the Shorakhúna in Zajâna"}},
[11552]={nameES="La conquista del puente de Morvith -- Diaria",objectivesES={"Toma del puente de Morvith","La conquista del puente de Morvith -- Diaria"}},
[11553]={nameES="Taking the Ornendil Bridge",objectivesES={"The Ornendil Bridge is located in Northern Osgiliath over the Anduin River.\
\
You should defeat enemy guards on the Ornendil Bridge.","Taking the Ornendil Bridge","Edenos has tasked you with taking back the Ornendil Bridge in Northern Osgiliath by defeating enemy guards.","Edenos is at the Palace of Eldacar.\
\
You should speak to Edenos.","Speak with Edenos"}},
[11554]={nameES="Talbot redimido",objectivesES={"El Capitán Pasolargo se puede encontrar en Puente de Caballetes.\
\
Talbot Hinton te pidió que le mostraras al Capitán Pasolargo la extraña poción elaborada por los Orcos cerca de Nan Wathren.","Regresa con el Capitán Pasolargo","Talbot Hinton está en Puente de Caballetes.\
\
Deberías hablar con Talbot Hinton.","Has liberado al guardia inocente de su injusta prisión","El Capitán Pasolargo se puede encontrar en Puente de Caballetes.\
\
Deberías hablar una vez más con el Capitán Pasolargo.","Muestra el somnífero elaborado por los Orcos al Capitán Pasolargo","Libera a Talbot Hinton de la picota","Talbot Hinton está en la picota en Puente de Caballetes.\
\
Deberías liberar a Talbot Hinton de sus ataduras, pues su inocencia está probada.","Talbot te ha pedido que le muestres el somnífero que encontraste al Capitán Pasolargo.","Habla con Talbot Hinton","El Capitán Pasolargo escucha tu explicación y toma una profunda inhalación del frasco de la poción.\
\
'¿Los Orcos elaboraron esto, ¿verdad? No es bueno para nosotros. Parece que han comenzado a usar el sabotaje cuando sus incursiones han sido frustradas por nuestras defensas en Los Caballetes.\
\
'Supongo que Talbot puede ser liberado de sus ataduras. Pero los guardias deben estar alerta ante cualquier viajero sospechoso a partir de este momento. Es un día triste para Puente de Caballetes....'","Talbot redimido"}},
[11555]={nameES="Tales From Naerband",objectivesES={"Akhrûn, a former slave, has just escaped from the prison fortress of Naerband and may reluctantly seek aid in escaping further south to Nurn.","Talk to Akhrûn","The woman seems apprehensive about speaking to you.\
\
'You are not from here, I can see. I am Akhrûn. I have prayed for freedom each day. Now it is here but not the freedom of my dreams.\
\
'My freedom led me and my brethren to flee from our slavers in Udûn. We felt that freedom for the first time when the tower fell and fires spilled from out of the mountain.\
\
'I wished to return to my family in Nurn, but we were enslaved again by those who dwell in Naerband. I resisted so they threw me into the prison. The rest are still being held outside the fortress.\
\
'Now I do not know what to do.'","It seems Akhrûn isn't accustomed to talking for extended periods of time. She catches her breath and continues.\
\
'Naerband is a prison that no one leaves. We were meant to be rotting in cells, sometimes tortured or worse. \
\
'I alone escaped. I found a loose brick in my cell. Behind the brick were some metal shavings that I was able to use to pick the lock to my cell. From there, I found an old forgotten passage that led to the outside.\
\
'I want to rescue the rest of my fellow Nurnhoth from Naerband, but I cannot do it alone. Will you help us retain our newly found freedom?'\
\
You agree to assist Akhrûn.\
\
'I am thankful for your help. First we will need to defeat many of these Orcs of fire who patrol from here to Naerband.'","Akhrûn can be found just outside of Orodir, next to Naerband.\
\
You should speak with Akhrûn.","Ghâsh-hai patrollers can be found in Talath Úrui near Naerband.\
\
You should defeat Ghâsh-hai who patrol the path to Naerband.","Tales From Naerband","As Akhrûn pauses, your gaze catches the citadel of Naerband looming above you","Akhrûn can be found near Naerband in Talath Úrui.\
\
You should speak with Akhrûn.","Speak with Akhrûn"}},
[11556]={nameES="Tales of Battle and Woe",objectivesES={"You have listened to many stories from the soldiers in the Swan-knight's Keep. You should bring these stories to Fingaer who is waiting for you in Harper's Court.","Fingaer has asked you to speak with soldiers in the Keep of the Swan-knights.\
\
The Keep of the Swan-knights is in Dol Amroth.","A bard of Harper's Court would like to compose songs about the Battles in which the city's swan-knights partook.","Talk to Celudir","Talk to Ríaneth","Talk to Gloril","Tales of Battle and Woe","Talk to Nennion","Return to Fingaer","Talk to Brithben"}},
[11557]={nameES="Tales of Harad",objectivesES={"Jubuya can be found at Aelin Veren in central North Ithilien.\
\
You have spoken to the other prisoners and should now speak to Jubuya once more.","Talk to Jubuya","Jubuya, a sorcerer of Harad, has offered to tell the Rangers of his homeland and culture in exchange for leniency.","Talk to Daugha-tûm","Tales of Harad","The Haradrim prisoners can be found at Aelin Veren in central North Ithilien.\
\
After questioning Jubuya, he has asked you to speak to his fellows about their lives in Harad.","Talk to Thai-chât"}},
[11558]={nameES="Tales of Hope and Glory",objectivesES={"Bands of soldiers, Rangers, and warriors can be found throughout Haerondir.\
\
Elladan has asked you to gather the soldiers of the Host of the West stationed in Haerondir in the hope that he and his brother might ease their worries through the telling of an old victory over the Enemy.","Talk to Elladan at Haerondir","Elladan can be found on the eastern ramparts of Haerondir.\
\
You have gathered many soldiers, rangers, and warriors and should now return to Elladan and Elrohir.","Tales of Hope and Glory","After seeing the weight of the burden resting on the soldiers in the Host of the West, Elladan and Elrohir seek to inspire hope by telling them a tale of victory over the Enemy."}},
[11559]={nameES="Tales of the Travelled",objectivesES={"Enkárvo has encouraged you to talk to the Easterling refugees so you can judge the truth for yourself.","Defeat Tungváka","Defeated Tungváka","You should return to Enkárvo in the Dorwinion refugee camp, in the hills east of Dale.","Tales of the Travelled","Return to Enkárvo","The wolves can be found south and east of the refugee camp hills.\
\
You should find and defeat wolf pack leader Tungváka, and a number of his pack, to stop them from being bold enough to attack the Easterling refugees.","You should talk to refugees of Dorwinion and the Chayasír in their camps in the hills to the east of Dale."}},
[11560]={nameES="Talons at the Talan",objectivesES={"Talons at the Talan","Prepare to defend Talan Revail","The crebain have been driven off","Cúvroval is at Talan Revail.\
\
You should speak with Cúvroval regarding the craban-attack on Talan Revail.","Talk to Cúvroval at Talan Revail","Cúvroval is at Talan Revail.\
\
A flock of crebain is descending upon Talan Revail from the West. Cúvroval has asked you to help defend the talan and drive the crows off!","Cúvroval wants you to help her defend flet against an incursion of angry crows."}},
[11561]={nameES="Talons of the Falcon",objectivesES={}},
[11562]={nameES="Apaciguamiento del Bosque Salvaje",objectivesES={"Se pueden encontrar enredaderas amargas, hierba fétida y brotes de tejo silvestre en el norte del Bosque Salvaje.\
\
Mantoespino te ha pedido que te encargues de algunos problemas botánicos en el bosque.","Apaciguamiento del Bosque Salvaje","Un Ent furioso bloquea el paso al Bosque Salvaje, pero se le podría convencer, con algo de persuasión, para que deje entrar en el bosque a los habitantes de Puente de Caballetes.","Habla con Mantoespino","Mantoespino se encuentra en la parte central del Bosque Salvaje.\
\
Deberías ir a hablar con Mantoespino."}},
[11563]={nameES="Tangled Underfoot",objectivesES={}},
[11564]={nameES="Atrapado en la telaraña",objectivesES={"Acompaña a Bersi fuera de la guarida de las arañas, defendiéndolo de ellas.","Habla con Bersi","Atrapado en la telaraña","Has encontrado a Bersi de Gondamon, que fue a recoger hierbas cerca de una guarida de arañas y se encontró atrapado.","Has rescatado a Bersi"}},
[11565]={nameES="Tapiz de las Hazañas — Introducción",objectivesES={"Tapiz de las Hazañas — Introducción","Techeron está en Esteldín, en las Quebradas del Norte.\
\
Techeron te ha pedido que tejas un tapiz que relate las hazañas de los caídos, para alentar a quienes aún permanecen.","Entrega el Tapiz de las Hazañas a Techeron en Esteldín","Muchos de los Montaraces de Esteldín han caído en la guerra contra Angmar, y el ánimo de quienes quedan se ve amenazado."}},
[11566]={nameES="Tarkrîp Blessings",objectivesES={}},
[11567]={nameES="Orcos Tarkrîp fortalecidos",objectivesES={"Aventurarse en lo profundo de Nan Wathren te ha revelado razas incluso más fuertes de orcos Tarkrîp.","Aventurarse en lo profundo de Nan Wathren te ha revelado razas incluso más fuertes de orcos Tarkrîp.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Se recomienda una Comunidad.</rgb>","Orcos Tarkrîp fortalecidos","Los Tarkrîp enfurecidos, Tiradores de Élite Tarkrîp y Maestros de Combate Tarkrîp se encuentran en el centro de Nan Wathren.\
\
Debes derrotar varios de estos violentos orcos en Nan Wathren.","Has respondido al desafío de los luchadores Tarkrîp en el centro de Nan Wathren, venciendo a estos terribles enemigos.","Completado"}},
[11568]={nameES="Tarlang's Crown - A Dangerous Thirst",objectivesES={"Barrels of ale can be found throughout Tarlang's Crown, especially near Corsair tents.\
\
Elaglar has asked you to destroy barrels of ale in Tarlang's Crown in hopes that it will throw the Corsairs into disarray.","Elaglar can be found in Dol Amroth.\
\
You have destroyed many barrels of Corsair ale, and should report your success to Elaglar.","DNT -- will not be seen","Talk to Elaglar","Tarlang's Crown - A Dangerous Thirst","The Corsairs of Umbar have stocked Tarlang's Crown with ale that could easily be turned against them."}},
[11569]={nameES="Tarlang's Crown - Carried Downriver",objectivesES={"In the wake of numerous thefts in Blackroot Vale, many supplies have been ferried downriver into Tarlang's Crown.","Tarlang's Crown - Carried Downriver","Elaglar can be found in Dol Amroth.\
\
You have retrieved many stolen barrels from Tarlang's Crown and should deliver them to Elaglar.","Barrels can be found throughout Tarlang's Crown and the river Blackroot.\
\
Elaglar has asked you to recover barrels stolen from Blackroot Vale in Tarlang's Crown.","DNT -- will not be seen","Deliver the stolen barrels to Elaglar"}},
[11570]={nameES="Tarlang's Crown - Servants of the Heirs",objectivesES={"Corsairs can be found throughout Tarlang's Crown.\
\
Elaglar has asked you to thin the numbers of the Corsair forces in Tarlang's Crown.","Elaglar can be found in Dol Amroth.\
\
You have slain many Corsairs and should now report to Elaglar.","The Corsairs of Umbar work in service of The Scourge and his ally, Azruthor, in Tarlang's Crown and present a constant threat to the people of Gondor.","DNT -- will not be seen","Talk to Elaglar","Tarlang's Crown - Servants of the Heirs"}},
[11571]={nameES="Tarlang's Crown - Waters of the Blackroot",objectivesES={"Swelling from the waters of the Blackroot, darkwaters now wander Tarlang's Crown in service of the Heirs of Castamir.","DNT -- will not be seen","Darkwater can be found in and along the river Blackroot throughout Tarlang's Crown.\
\
Elaglar has asked you to venture to Tarlang's Crown and defeat the darkwater under the thrall of the Heirs of Castamir.","Talk to Elaglar","Tarlang's Crown - Waters of the Blackroot","Elaglar can be found in Dol Amroth.\
\
You have defeated darkwater lurking in Tarlang's Crown and should report to Elaglar."}},
[11572]={nameES="Tarea: Fichas de Heroísmo",objectivesES={"Tarea: Fichas de Heroísmo","Lleva Fichas de Heroísmo al viajero curtido","El viajero curtido te ha llevado a una vía peligrosa a través de la Tierra Media. Representa a una facción de montaraces que guían a quienes desean recorrer las Vías del Valor.\
\
A medida que luches contra enemigos por los campos y montañas de la Tierra Media, es posible que encuentres alguna que otra Ficha de Heroísmo tras tus victorias.\
\
El viajero curtido se ha ofrecido a recibir estas Fichas de Heroísmo a cambio de mejorar tu reputación en las Vías del Valor.","Reúne Fichas de Heroísmo en tus batallas por toda la Tierra Media."}},
[11573]={nameES="Tarea: Fichas de Heroísmo (Nivel 2)",objectivesES={"Lleva Fichas de Heroísmo al viajero curtido","El viajero curtido te ha llevado a una vía peligrosa a través de la Tierra Media. Representa a una facción de montaraces que guían a quienes desean recorrer las Vías del Valor.\
\
A medida que luches contra enemigos por los campos y montañas de la Tierra Media, es posible que encuentres alguna que otra Ficha de Heroísmo tras tus victorias.\
\
El viajero curtido se ha ofrecido a recibir estas Fichas de Heroísmo a cambio de mejorar tu reputación en las Vías del Valor.","Tarea: Fichas de Heroísmo (Nivel 2)","Reúne Fichas de Heroísmo en tus batallas por toda la Tierra Media."}},
[11574]={nameES="Tarea: Fichas de Heroísmo (Nivel 3)",objectivesES={"Lleva Fichas de Heroísmo al viajero curtido","El viajero curtido te ha llevado a una vía peligrosa a través de la Tierra Media. Representa a una facción de montaraces que guían a quienes desean recorrer las Vías del Valor.\
\
A medida que luches contra enemigos por los campos y montañas de la Tierra Media, es posible que encuentres alguna que otra Ficha de Heroísmo tras tus victorias.\
\
El viajero curtido se ha ofrecido a recibir estas Fichas de Heroísmo a cambio de mejorar tu reputación en las Vías del Valor.","Tarea: Fichas de Heroísmo (Nivel 3)","Reúne Fichas de Heroísmo en tus batallas por toda la Tierra Media."}},
[11575]={nameES="Taste Test",objectivesES={"Talk to Halvar","You have picked some harthrót, and should take the plants back to Halvar in Ashmargathâl.","Halvar has asked you to collect some harthrót plants for him to work with.\
\
Harthrót can be found along the road at Tharkh Shathur, south-east of Ashmargathâl.","Taste Test","In an attempt to make better-tasting rations, the dwarf Halvar is willing to experiment."}},
[11576]={nameES="Taste of Elf",objectivesES={}},
[11577]={nameES="El Sabor de Hobbiton: ¡A la carrera!",objectivesES={"Habla con Dore Dospiés para recibir dos entradas gratuitas para El Sabor de Hobbiton.","Habla con Dore Dospiés en El Sabor de Hobbiton","El Sabor de Hobbiton: ¡A la carrera!","Puedes recibir un par de entradas gratuitas para El Sabor de Hobbiton (accesible tomando un caballo desde Cavada Grande).\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando finalice el festival actual. </rgb>"}},
[11578]={nameES="Tasty Little Farmers and Gardeners",objectivesES={}},
[11579]={nameES="Tasty Little Legs",objectivesES={"Hoarhallow lay to the south on the eastern side of the Hoardale river.\
\
Taskmaster Fikdag at Dâr-gazag has grown fond of the flesh found on the bones of the rat-folk, and he has asked you to collect some of their legs.","Though the Rat-folk have proven a thorn in the side of Angmar's Army, they have also proven a viable source of food. Not only do the rat-folk have seemingly endless food-stores, but their flesh is sweeter than Man's.","Tasty Little Legs","Return to Dâr-gazag and speak with Taskmaster Fikdag"}},
[11580]={nameES="Tasty Little Toes",objectivesES={"Return the hobbit-feet to Bok in Grothum","Bok captured himself one of the rat-folk one day, and he has proven a great asset. His toes tasted good when the goblin ate one, but the little man is a better cook than anything, and so they keep him alive to cook their meals. But this does not deter Bok from wanting to eat more rat-folk toes.","Tasty Little Toes","Hoarhallow is far to the south-west on the eastern bank of the Hoardale River.\
\
Bok waits for you to return to him with the hobbit-feet you were sent to harvest."}},
[11581]={nameES="Tasty Morsels",objectivesES={}},
[11582]={nameES="Tasty Slug Goo",objectivesES={}},
[11583]={nameES="Teach Them a Lesson",objectivesES={}},
[11584]={nameES="Enseñar a Pescar",objectivesES={"Henry Robletón ha preparado un envío de suministros para Joy Florecido, una pescadora local, y necesita que alguien le lleve un mensaje.","Enseñar a Pescar","Habla con Joy Florecido","Joy Florecido está en Entibo, al este de Bree.\
\
Henry Robletón te ha pedido que hables con su socia, Joy Florecido, y la tranquilices asegurándole que su envío llegará pronto."}},
[11585]={nameES="Tears of Minas Ithil",objectivesES={"Talk to Dornach","Sorrowful shades can be found throughout the Circle of Despair.\
\
Dornach has asked you to try comforting the sorrowful spirits of Minas Morgul so they might reveal the fate which befell them.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: If you lose sight of Dornach, you can summon him to your side with his horn.</rgb>","Dornach can be found in the Circle of Despair.\
\
You have tried to comfort the sorrowful spirits of Minas Morgul. You should talk to Dornach.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: If you lose sight of Dornach, you can summon him to your side with his horn.</rgb>","Weeping in endless torment, shades of the Dead wander the Circle of Despair.","Tears of Minas Ithil"}},
[11586]={nameES="Lágrimas de pureza",objectivesES={"Habla con Erchiel en las Agujas de la Linde","Este parece ser el estanque del que habló Erchiel","Vierte las lágrimas de Ent en el estanque","Los Saltos del Crepúsculo son una serie de pozas y cascadas por las que fluye el agua del deshielo de Forochel antes de entrar en el Lago del Crepúsculo.","El estanque está en la cima de los Saltos del Crepúsculo, al noreste de las Agujas de la Linde.\
\
Erchiel te pidió que te aventures hasta el estanque más alto de los Saltos del Crepúsculo y viertas algunas lágrimas de Ent en su interior para purificar las aguas.","Las aguas se calman y brillan suavemente. Se sienten frescas en tus piernas","Erchiel se encuentra en las Agujas de la Linde, al suroeste de los Saltos del Crepúsculo.\
\
Erchiel se alegrará de saber que las lágrimas han purificado el agua.","Encuentra el estanque en la parte superior de los Saltos del Crepúsculo","Lágrimas de pureza"}},
[11587]={nameES="Tears of the Gladden",objectivesES={"Gladdens can be found throughout the Gladden Fields, but Radagast is especially interested in those that have grown near the Gladden Falls.\
\
Radagast is concerned something has befouled the waters of the Gladden. You should examine gladdens near the Gladden Falls and see if they show any signs of corruption.","The sparrow can be found near the Gladden Falls in the Gladden Fields.\
\
You have found many blighted gladdens, but it appears that not all of them have succumbed. You also filled a phial with water from the Gladden Falls and you should bring it to the sparrow.","The Gladden Falls can be found in the western reaches of the Gladden Fields.\
\
Radagast has asked you to fill a phial with water from the Gladden Falls in the hope that it might help him identify and cleanse the blight creeping into the Gladden Fields.","Fill Radagast's phial with water from the Gladden Falls","The petals of these gladdens are marked with round patches of an unidentifiable blight","The sparrow appears to have awaited your return. It points its beak at its leg, and you realize it intends to return to Radagast with the scroll and the small phial of water you collected. You gently tie the phial of water to one of the sparrow's legs and produce the scroll Radagast prepared for you.\
\
You turn over the scroll and begin to write on the side Radagast left blank. You tell Radagast that many of the gladdens near the Gladden Falls have become blighted, but a few still show no signs of disease. You also note that the water of the Gladden Falls appears to be sullied, but you are uncertain as to the source of the pollution.\
\
You roll the scroll and bind it to the sparrow's other leg. It chirps in what you take to be a friendly farewell and flies off.","As you stand and curiously look at the sparrow, it lowers its beak to point at a small scroll bound to its leg. You take the scroll and begin to read it.\
\
The scroll contains hasty writing which you swiftly identify as the writing of Radagast the Brown. As you read on, Radagast explains that in his travels he spoke to many of the creatures of the Vales of Anduin. Many among them told of a strange blight creeping into the western reaches of the Gladden Fields, perhaps even in the waters of the Gladden itself. After searching the eastern reaches of the Gladden Fields, he discovered a number of tainted gladdens, but he fears the blight will be even more severe nearer to marsh-tender nest known as Gilvamyr and beneath the Gladden Falls. Before concluding, Radagast notes that his friend has, and very kindly he adds, borne an empty phial to the Gladden Fields that you might retrieve a sample of the water of the Gladden Falls.\
 \
As the sparrow appears content to remain perched nearby, you decide to investigate the disturbances at Gilvamyr and search for signs of the blight Radagast encountered among the gladdens near the Gladden Falls.","You note a faint, green tinge in the water collected from the Gladden Falls","This is a good location to fill the phial","Examine gladdens near the Gladden Falls (7/8)","After discovering creatures driven to madness in the Gladden Fields, Radagast is concerned something has befouled the waters of the Gladden.","These gladdens appear free of blight. Perhaps there is still hope for the Gladden Fields!","Deliver the phial of water to the sparrow","Tears of the Gladden"}},
[11588]={nameES="Técnicas de los Maestros",objectivesES={"Entrega el libro a Asikko","Lleva el libro de Asikko a Gondranc","Libro de Asikko recuperado","Técnicas de los Maestros","El libro de Asikko está escondido en algún lugar del campamento de la facción traidora Rauta-lehmä en Nan Amlug, al este del campamento de los Suuri-lehmä.\
\
Asikko duda en ir él mismo a recuperar el libro de los Rauta-lehmä por miedo a provocar la guerra demasiado pronto. En su lugar, te ha pedido que recuperes el libro por él.","Gondranc te espera en Esteldín.\
\
Has recuperado con éxito el libro de Asikko del campamento de los Rauta-lehmä. El líder de los Hijos de la Tierra te ha pedido que se lo entregues a Gondranc, cumpliendo así su promesa al Montaraz.","El Montaraz Gondranc te envió al campamento de los Hijos de la Tierra para recoger un libro sobre el trabajo del cuero de Asikko, el líder de los Hijos de la Tierra. Sin embargo, cuando llegaste al campamento, Asikko te dijo que el libro había sido robado.","Recupera el libro de Asikko"}},
[11589]={nameES="Teeth of the Jangovar",objectivesES={}},
[11590]={nameES="Habla con el Frontero Redondo",objectivesES={"Mientras buscabas a Daffodil, la vaca de Filibert Bolger, en la Loma del Troll, encontraste a la pobre criatura muerta. Al parecer fue víctima de algún tipo de bestia grande. Filibert culpa al enano Olwir tanto de robar la vaca como de dejarla en el pantano.","El Frontero Redondo se encuentra en el lado sur de Ojo de Aguja.\
\
Filibert Bolger, enfadado por la muerte de su vaca, te ha pedido que hables con el Frontero Redondo sobre el incidente.","Habla con el Frontero Redondo"}},
[11591]={nameES="Temair la terrible",objectivesES={"Vuelve con Arienh a su campamento en la entrada de Garth Agarwen.\
\
Encontraste a Temair exactamente donde Arienh te dijo que estaría. Deshacerte de Temair resultó ser relativamente simple y ahora debes volver con Arienh.","Arienh sabe que hay una líder entrelos Créoth en las ruinas de Garth Agarwen, una terrorífica mujer que los Hombres reverencian como a una intermediaria de la Doncella Roja.\
\
Te ha pedido que pruebes que se trata de una falacia derrotando a la mujer para que los Créoth vean que su fe no está en el lugar correcto.","Temair se encuentra en la entrada al Arboreto y la Fortaleza, en Garth Agarwen.\
\
Arienh te ha pedido que lleves a la líder de los Créoth, una terrible mujer llamada Temair, a la justicia. Ella predica dentro de los confines de Garth Agarwen.","Has derrotado a Temair la Devota","Temair la terrible","Vuelve con Areinh","Derrota a Temair la Devota"}},
