<rgb=#ff0000>All Elven Menders must not falter</rgb>","As you enter Thûr Hin, the Lair of the Children, the smell hits you. Dust and copper, like blood in your mouth. A dozen wars were born here, along with thousands of soldiers. In the distance, you can hear two Utûgi arguing amongst themselves, their voices echoing through the musty hall.","Temple of Utug-bûr: Thûr Hin, Lair of the Children -- Tier 1","Defeat the Utûgi","As you enter, you see a lone figure on a commanding throne","Defeat Kormoltur, Lord of Terror.","Daikhag has returned! He lets out a mighty roar as a challenge","Heal Legolas!","Listen to Kormoltur, Lord of Terror.","Press deeper into Thûr Hin","Defeat Daikhag","Listen to Khablag and Legolas","Investigate deeper into Thûr Hin, Lair of the Children\
