[11601]={nameES="Tempting Fate",objectivesES={"You rode forth with the Riders Four and defeated a large patrol of Khundolar Easterlings in the hope of convincing Aldor Harding that his assumed fate can be avoided.","You relate the tale of your battle against the Easterlings to Harding, and he nods, impressed.\
\
'You have acquitted yourself well, but that was your fate. Mine is to die at the hands of the Easterlings while defending the people of the Eastemnet. This cannot be changed.\
\
'I am afraid that your efforts, as I told you before, were in vain.'","Tempting Fate","Aldor Harding is in the Mead Hall of Harwick.\
\
Burnoth has asked you to go to Aldor Harding and convince him of the folly of omens and the wisdom of sending the women and children away to safety.","Talk to Harding in the Mead Hall of Harwick"}},
[11602]={nameES="Temámir Hospitality",objectivesES={"Temámir Hospitality","Talk to Zadók if you liked the meal, and Alem if you did not","Gírma has caught your attention.","Gírma looks at you expectantly","Zadók can be found in the Kitchens of Furukzahar if you enjoyed the meal, and if you did not you were told to voice your displeasure to Alem outside the fortress instead.","Gírma smiles broadly. 'It was good, then?' he asks","Served plates of food (4/4)","You have satisfied the Temámir custom of serving a meal before eating your own, and can now enjoy it yourself.","Set plates of food down on the counters in the Furukzahar feasting-hall (3/4)","You were given plates of food to leave on the counters in the Furukzahar feasting-hall before you can eat your own meal.","Zadók is very excited for you to experience some Temámir hospitality... and as a side dish he may be fishing for compliments about his cooking.","Gírma has some advice for you.","Eat the meal you delivered to the feasting-hall","Talk to Gírma"}},
[11603]={nameES="Tend to the Deer",objectivesES={}},
[11604]={nameES="Tending What Remains",objectivesES={}},
[11605]={nameES="Tending the Garden",objectivesES={"Fertile soil can be found throughout Ithilien, especially above Henneth Annûn and near the ruins of Aelin Veren, Thargelon, and Bâr Tarnaher.\
\
Ereblen has asked you to plant various seeds in the fertile soil of North Ithilien.","With an abundance of seeds and seedlings in the care of the Rangers, they now seek to heal the wounds dealt to Ithilien by the Enemy.","Tending the Garden","Ereblen can be found in Henneth Annûn.\
\
You have planted all the seeds and should now return to him in Henneth Annûn.","Talk to Ereblen in Henneth Annûn"}},
[11606]={nameES="Cuidando del Rebaño",objectivesES={"La cabra nerviosa parece un poco menos nerviosa","Seren te pide ayudar a tranquilizar a los animales.","Calma a la vaca alterada","Calma a la cabra nerviosa","Calma a la gallina ansiosa","Habla con Seren","La gallina no parece menos ansiosa, pero hiciste lo mejor que pudiste.","La vaca ahora está solo ligeramente alterada en lugar de completamente alterada.","Los animales nerviosos pueden encontrarse en el corral cerca de la puerta oriental de Musgovilla.\
\
Seren te ha pedido calmar a algunos de los animales nerviosos de Musgovilla.","Cuidando del Rebaño"}},
[11607]={nameES="Tending the Ill",objectivesES={"Check on the injured Kinta","Return to Lóburdith and let her know you have tended to the scouts and administered medicine to the ones who needed it.","Give medicine to the injured Kinta scout","Tending the Ill","Lóburdith in Sul Madásh has asked for your assistance in checking on the Kinta scouts who have returned but have fallen ill from the pale blight and providing medicine if necessary.","The scout is resting and appears to not be in pain","The scout shows signs of relief as the medicine takes effect","Retrieve medicine","Return to Lóburdith","He appears to be suffering greatly and needs medicine","Medicine retrieved","Signs of the blight are still present, but he is not in pain"}},
[11608]={nameES="Tending the Wounded",objectivesES={"Wounded guards can be found along the northern lines of the Avanc-lûth.\
\
Anurin has asked you to patch up some guards and heal them quickly.","Talk to Anurin in the Dunbog","Tending the Wounded","You have found Anurin tending to the wounded guards north of the village.","Anurin is at the northern lines of the Avanc-lûth.\
\
You should return to Anurin and tell him that you have healed the guards."}},
[11609]={nameES="Tending the Wounded",objectivesES={}},
[11610]={nameES="Tending to Crithost",objectivesES={}},
[11611]={nameES="Ocuparse de lo que queda",objectivesES={"Te has ocupado de las plantas en el jardín.\
\
Deberías volver con Cadi. Te espera en casa de Rendal en la esquina sudoeste de Herne.","Muchos retoños no han sido atendidos desde hace unos días.","Habla con Cadi","Los retoños y los árboles pueden encontrarse fuera de la casa de Rendal.\
\
Cadi te ha pedido que riegues los retoños y hables con los árboles.","Ocuparse de lo que queda"}},
[11612]={nameES="Terrible Fang",objectivesES={}},
[11613]={nameES="Veinteneros rebeldes",objectivesES={"Habla con Emma Matorralverde en el Laberinto de Setos","Emma Matorralverde está de pie fuera del Laberinto de Setos, en los Campos de Caballos de Bree.\
\
Debes informar a Emma Matorralverde que has reprendido a varios veinteneros por su comportamiento revoltoso.","El joven hobbit se detiene a escucharte mientras lo reprendes con firmeza y te lanza una mirada desafiante.\
\
'¡Ni siquiera estaba haciendo tanto ruido!'","Veinteneros rebeldes","Los revoltosos hobbits veinteneros pueden encontrarse correteando por el Laberinto de Setos.","Jóvenes hobbits en la veintena han venido al Laberinto de Setos, y desde entonces no ha habido ni un momento de paz.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro cuando finalice el festival actual.</rgb>"}},
[11614]={nameES="Terror Below",objectivesES={}},
[11615]={nameES="Terror From the Floodfells",objectivesES={"Varthmath can be found at the Beorninghús.\
\
You should talk to Varthmath about the collar you found.","Varthmath can be found at the Beorninghús.\
\
You should talk to Varthmath.","Pick up the unusual collar and bring it to Varthmath for his opinion on it.","Terror From the Floodfells","The warg who once wore the dwarf-collar must be somewhere in the Beorning-lands.\
\
You should find and defeat the warg leader.","Pick up the unusual collar","The large collar you found on the road to the Floodfells appears to be dwarf-made. You recall that Varthmath spent some time around dwarves when he journeyed beneath the mountains, and he might be able to tell you something about the abandoned collar.","A terrible menace stalks the waving fields of the Beorninglands.","Find and defeat the warg leader","Talk to Varthmath at the Beorninghús","You have defeated Borzhorug"}},
[11616]={nameES="Terror en Ost Heryn",objectivesES={"Terror en Ost Heryn","Ha llegado el amanecer... has fracasado","Derrota a Miluidir antes del amanecer","Torogethir está en su campamento, al noreste de Ost Heryn.\
\
Deberías regresar a Torogethir con noticias de tu éxito.","Miluidir está en Ost Heryn, al suroeste por el camino desde el campamento de Torogethir.\
\
Torogethir te ha pedido que ahuyentes a la sombra de Miluidir en las ruinas de Ost Heryn.","Torogethir desea mostrar piedad a los saqueadores de Ost Heryn y quizá mostrarles el error de sus actos librándolos del capitán sombra Miluidir.","Has derrotado a Miluidir"}},
[11617]={nameES="Terror en el cielo",objectivesES={"Los cuervos sangrientos se encuentran a lo largo del Gran Camino del Este, que está al sur de Ost Guruth.\
\
Stanric te pidió que buscaras cuervos sangrientos a lo largo del Gran Camino del Este y recolectaras sus ojos como prueba de que ya no podrán espiar a la gente de Ost Guruth.","Entrega los ojos de cuervo sangriento a Stanric en Ost Guruth","Terror en el cielo","A pesar de contar con un pequeño suministro de armas y armaduras, Stanric de los Eglain intenta organizar al menos una defensa mínima contra las bestias salvajes y peligrosas y otros enemigos que acechan las ruinas que los Eglain llaman su hogar."}},
[11618]={nameES="Terror de las profundidades",objectivesES={"The avanc has been defeated","Fish up and defeat the creature","Héalac is at Snowbourn.\
\
Héalac will be pleased to know the avanc that was eating his fishermen has been dealt with.","Terror de las profundidades","<rgb=#FF0000>Completing Aiding the Eastemnet will cancel this quest</rgb>","A marsh-avanc has taken the bait!","An avanc has been preying upon the fishermen of the Entwash.","The creature can be found in the shallows of the Entwash just west of Snowbourn.\
\
Héalac asked you to fish up a creature from the Entwash that is eating fishermen and defeat it.","Talk to Héalac"}},
[11619]={nameES="Terror of the Drownholt",objectivesES={"Mirefang has been defeated","Laidhriel awaits you at the entrance to Estolad Mernael in the Drownholt, east of Mirefang's lair.\
\
You should return to Laidhriel and inform her of your defeat of Mirefang.","A large and wary panther called Mirefang stalks near the Pool of Creeping Death, feeding upon the corpses of those who have died there.","Habla con Laidhriel en Estolad Mernael","The vicious cat Mirefang can be found to the west of Estolad Mernael, near the Pool of Creeping Death.\
\
You should summon and defeat this vicious hunter before he decides to hunt you, for his attack is sure to be deadly.","Terror of the Drownholt","Summon Mirefang and defeat him"}},
[11620]={nameES="Terrors of Bel Inzûl",objectivesES={}},
[11621]={nameES="Test Infamy Quest Reward",objectivesES={}},
[11622]={nameES="Test the Boundaries",objectivesES={}},
[11623]={nameES="Test: Ost Galadh Shortcut",objectivesES={}},
[11624]={nameES="Testing Their Strength",objectivesES={}},
[11625]={nameES="Testing the Defences",objectivesES={"You should talk to Angbor, who can be found at Aragorn's Pavilion on the after-battle Pelennor.","Talk to a soldier at the sparring area in Aragorn's pavilion","Talk to Angbor","Soldiers with new armour can be found in the sparring area in Aragorn's Pavilion, on the after-battle Pelennor.\
\
Soldiers are ready to spar with you in an effort to improve their skills and test their armour.","Angbor has successfully provided armour to the soliders but is uncertain of the armour's quality.","Testing the Defences","Talk to another soldier at the sparring area in Aragorn's pavilion"}},
[11626]={nameES="Thadúr el Devastador",objectivesES={"Derrota a Thadúr el Devastador","Los muertos ancestrales se han alzado en el Gran Túmulo.","Thadúr el Devastador derrotado","Thadúr el Devastador","Thadúr el Devastador, un antiguo guerrero, se ha alzado en las profundidades inundadas del Gran Túmulo."}},
[11627]={nameES="Tham Andalath",objectivesES={"Colabora con Nadfaron","Nadfaron, Brogdagnir y Gúrhebnir están todos en Tinnudir.\
\
Orchalwë te ha pedido que trabajes con otros tres Montaraces para expulsar a los trasgos de Tham Andalath.","Tham Andalath","Colabora con Brogdagnir","Tham Andalath es la propiedad más alejada de Tinnudir. Lo que en su día fue una de las casas más opulentas de todo Evendim, ahora está profanada por los trasgos.","Orchalwë está en Tinnudir.\
\
Orchalwë se alegrará de saber que Tham Andalath ha sido liberado de los trasgos.","Colabora con Gúrhebnir"}},
[11628]={nameES="Tham Andalath",objectivesES={"Tham Andalath","Tham Andalath se encuentra al noreste de Tinnudir y al este de Tham Ornen.\
\
El diario de Orchalwë menciona a continuación Tham Andalath, las ruinas de la casa de un gran herrero, ahora profanadas por los trasgos.","Tham Andalath es la propiedad más alejada de Tinnudir. La que en su día fue una de las mansiones más opulentas de todo Evendim está ahora devastada por los trasgos."}},
[11629]={nameES="Tham Nambarth",objectivesES={"Tham Nambarth","Colabora con Nadfaron","Orchalwë está en Tinnudir.\
\
Orchalwë estará complacido de oír que Tham Nambarth debería estar segura a corto plazo.","Tham Nambarth es la mejor conservada de las ruinas que se enccuentran en los Campos del Crepúsculo.","Colabora con Brogdagnir","Nadfaron, Brogdagnir y Gúrhebnir están todos en Tinnudir.\
\
nOrchalwë te ha pedido que colabores que tres de los otros montaraces para ayudar a Tham Nambarth.","Colabora con Gúrhebnir"}},
[11630]={nameES="Tham Nambarth",objectivesES={"Tham Nambarth","Tham Nambarth es la propiedad en ruinas más cercana y nuestra principal prioridad. Aunque las amenazas que se ciernen sobre ella no son graves, no hay que subestimar su importancia, ya que la propia naturaleza está recuperando Tham Nambarth.\
\
Tham Nambarth fue en su día un gran palacio, como se puede ver en lo que aún se conserva hoy en día. Sin embargo, esto no durará mucho, y no por culpa de saqueadores o trasgos. ¡Es la hiedra! Crece profundamente en las grietas de las paredes y poco a poco separa los ladrillos hasta que no queda nada en pie.\
\
También se ve amenazada por una fuente que en sí misma no es amenazante: una manada de alces se ha instalado entre sus muros. No son un problema en sí mismos; sin embargo, pronto atraerán a depredadores: lobos, ladrones hambrientos, huargos y trasgos de las colinas del norte.","Tham Nambarth se encuentra en los Campos del Crepúsculo, al este de Tinnudir.\
\
El diario de Orchalwë detalla varias amenazas que acechan actualmente las ruinas de Tham Nambarth.","Tham Nambarth es la propiedad mejor conservada de entre todas las que yacen en ruinas en los Campos del Crepúsculo."}},
[11631]={nameES="Tham Ornen",objectivesES={"Ayuda a Gúrhebnir","Nadfaron, Brogdagnir y Gúrhebnir están todos en Tinnudir.\
\
Orchalwë te ha pedido que colabores con otros tres montaraces para descubrir las intenciones de Angmar en Tham Ornen.","Ayuda a Nadfaron","Ayuda a Brogdagnir","Tham Ornen","Orchalwë está en Tinnudir.\
\
A Orchalwë le interesará saber lo que descubriste en Tham Ornen.","Tham Ornen ha sido ocupada por las fuerzas de Angmar. Se desconoce qué valor ven en las ruinas."}},
[11632]={nameES="Tham Ornen",objectivesES={"Tham Ornen se encuentra al noreste de Tinnudir.\
\
El diario de Orchalwë menciona a continuación Tham Ornen, unas ruinas que ahora están bajo el control de una fuerza de exploración procedente de Angmar.","Tham Ornen","Tham Ornen ha sido ocupada por las fuerzas de Angmar. Se desconoce qué valor ven en las ruinas."}},
[11633]={nameES="Tham Varan",objectivesES={"Tham Varan","Tham Varan, el dominio al sureste, está envuelto en misterio. Su identidad se ha perdido con el tiempo y los saqueadores dejan el lugar con menos pistas que seguir cada día.","Colabora con Nadfaron","Nadfaron, Brogdagnir y Gúrhebnir están todos en Tinnudir.\
\
Orchalwë te ha pedido que colabores con tres de los otros montaraces para recuperar la identidad de Tham Varan.","Orchalwë está en Tinnudir.\
\
Orchalwë estará encantado de saber que la identidad de Tham Varan ha sido revelada y su historia protegida.","Colabora con Brogdagnir","Colabora con Gúrhebnir"}},
[11634]={nameES="Tham Varan",objectivesES={"Tham Varan","Tham Varan, la propiedad situada al sureste, está envuelta en misterio. Su identidad se ha perdido en el tiempo, y los saqueadores se llevan cada día más pistas.","Tham Varan se encuentra al este de Tinnudir y Tham Nambarth.\
\
El diario de Orchalwë menciona a continuación Tham Varan, unas ruinas de propiedad desconocida asediadas por saqueadores de tumbas."}},
[11635]={nameES="Thane Léoferth of Brockbridge",objectivesES={"Talk to Dunith","Thane Léoferth is inside the mead hall which is near the centre of Brockbridge.","There is a pile of dirty dishes near Thane Léoferth's bed.\
\
Dunith asked you to collect the dirty dishes.","Collect dirty dishes","Thane Léoferth oversaw the defence of Brockbridge when the White Hand first arrived, until his body gave out. He cannot fight and is barely able to speak, but his fighting spirit is an inspiration to Brockbridge in such dark times.","Dunith has long been Thane Léoferth's hand-maiden, and stays near his side to aid him in his regressing health.\
\
You should speak with Dunith.","Collected dirty dishes","Talk to Thane Léoferth","Thane Léoferth of Brockbridge","The kitchen is in the corner of the Mead Hall in Brockbridge.\
\
Dunith asked you to take the dirty dishes to the cook to be washed.","Bring dishes to the cook"}},
[11636]={nameES="Thanking the Dhûrghud",objectivesES={}},
[11637]={nameES="Thankless Tasks",objectivesES={"TBD Frustrated Carpenter can be found at TBD.\
\
You have collected a reasonable amount of supplies TBD Frustrated Carpenter can use to repair the walls of Jirush. Return to him with your findings.","Materials to repair the walls can be found scattered throughout TBD.\
\
TBD has asked for your help playing courier and collecting supplies from around the city.","TBD, a carpenter, is frustrated by the repairs to Jirush's battlements and the lack of a proper crew to help him out. Collect supplies from around the city for him.","Thankless Tasks","Return to TBD Frustrated Carpenter"}},
[11638]={nameES="Tharrkirîn's Baubles",objectivesES={}},
[11639]={nameES="That Special Shine (Daily)",objectivesES={}},
[11640]={nameES="Lo que más valoro",objectivesES={"Calenglad está en el campamento de montaraces de la isla de Tinnudir, al este y ligeramente al norte de Valcorriente, en Evendim.\
\
Gwindeth ha accedido a permitirte el acceso a la tumba de Elendil, donde podrás recuperar el Silithar para Aragorn.","Lo que más valoro","Le has dado a Gwindeth lo que más desea: respeto","La Dama Azul está en Gwindethrond, tras la cascada de Valcorriente en el oeste de Emyn Uial, en Evendim.\
\
Le has dado a Gwindeth lo que más valora, que fue lo que los reyes de Arnor le dieron... respeto. Está esperando para hablar contigo.","Dale a Gwindeth lo que más desea","Gwindeth te ha pedido una última tarea: quiere que le des lo que para ella tiene más valor."}},
[11641]={nameES="Thatching a Plan",objectivesES={}},
[11642]={nameES="Thaurisgar, the Vile Apothecary -- Solo/Duo",objectivesES={"The doors to the lower levels of Thaurisgar seem to be locked.\
\
Find the mechanism that unlocks the door.","In the depths of Thaurisgar, countless foul and twisted experiments roam the shadows--the terrible legacy of Aniochán the Harrower. Before the fall of Carn Dûm, Aniochán worked tirelessly to outdo his rivals and win the favour of the Steward of Angmar. Chief among his tools in shaping his fell creations was a curious ichor known only as the Bile of Ifrinn. Thought to be lost after a disastrous experiment claimed Aniochán's life, now this foetid and vile substance is in danger of being let loose into the world.","Explored the halls of Thaurisgar","The way is open","The door to the apothecary has opened","You have defeated Kurja and Kârsija","You found another door, but there is no keyhole. Perhaps there is a mechanism that can open this door.\
\
Look for clues for how to open the door to the main apothecary.","Thaurisgar, the Vile Apothecary -- Solo/Duo","The apothecary has been overrun by the alchemists' most twisted experiments. They are protecting the vital research left by Aniochán the Harrower.\
\
You should defeat the twins.","Unlock the door to the lower levels","Thaurisgar houses many a foul and twisted creature and the vile ingredients of Angmarim alchemy. You should investigate all that this apothecary contains.","Explore the halls of Thaurisgar","Find a way to open the apothecary doors","Find and defeat Kurja and Kârsija"}},
