[11693]={nameES="¡La Búsqueda del Tesoro del Aniversario está aquí!",objectivesES={"Para celebrar otro año más en la Tierra Media, los hobbits de la Comarca han colgado divertidas listas de cosas por hacer del Árbol de la Fiesta. ¡Ven a celebrarlo!","Visita el Árbol de la Fiesta y descubre qué búsquedas del tesoro están disponibles.","Para celebrar otro año más en la Tierra Media, los hobbits de la Comarca han colgado divertidas listas de cosas por hacer del Árbol de la Fiesta."}},
[11694]={nameES="The Anthems of Éomer",objectivesES={"Lothíriel's curiosity about Éomer has been ever increasing since she heard a tale of him at the wedding of Aragorn and Arwen.","Toss a coin to the second harper","You listened to many tales and ballads of Éomer for the lady, Lothíriel. You should return to her in the Court of the Prince, in Dol Amroth.","A ballad of how Éomer lent horses to the future king and his fellowship during a time of need","Toss a coin to the fifth harper","Toss a coin to the third harper","Toss a coin to the fourth harper","Return to Lothíriel","The bard sings a dark song of Éomer being imprisoned at the behest of Gríma Wormtongue","You hear a tale of Éomer's bravery upon many battlefields","An ode of how the love between Éomer and his sister Éowyn called the Lady back to life as she lay in the Houses of Healing","The bard sings a rousing song about an éored galloping horses across the fields of Rohan","The Anthems of Éomer","Toss a coin to the first harper","Lothíriel has asked you to listen to songs about the Rohirrim, and report back with what you hear. You should toss a coin to the minstrels in Harper's Court.\
\
Harper's Court is in Dol Amroth."}},
[11695]={nameES="Yunque Invernal",objectivesES={"Habla con Hórin","Survive the Expedition into the Anvil","Karazgar has come to the Anvil of Winterstith to bolster his forces by laying claim to the Herald of Winter and her Frost-horde. If he succeeds, he will have the means to wipe out not only the expedition of dwarves in Ered Mithrin, but to lay siege to all of the Northern Kingdoms.","Yunque Invernal","Hórin is standing by outside the Anvil.\
\
You should talk to Hórin."}},
[11696]={nameES="Yunque Invernal",objectivesES={"Hórin wishes to speak with you.\
\
He can be found within Skarháld.","Complete the Anvil of Winterstith","The Stout-axes would like to join the company traveling into the Withered Heath.\
\
You should talk to Hórin.","Word has reached you that Karazgar is on the move, and the Zhélruka in Skarháld are concerned he may return soon. Hórin is leading a company to investigate, and has asked for you by name.","Yunque Invernal","Talk to Nori","You carve a small bone from the fallen drake","Scouts have spotted Karazgar flying toward the Withered Heath. It is clear his schemes are not yet at an end.","Talk to Nori at the Wyrmgap","Report to Hórin in Skarháld","Hórin is standing by outside the Anvil, East of here.\
\
You should talk to Hórin.","Náth would like to speak with you.\
\
You should talk to Náth.","Claim a bone from the corpse of Vethúg Wintermind","The dwarves are going ahead to find a way to the Anvil of Winterstith.\
\
You should discover the entrance to the Anvil of Winterstith in the Withered Heath.","Nori can be found at the Wyrmgap, waiting to hear news of your expedition.\
\
You should return to Nori now that you have slain Vethúg Wintermind.","Discover the entrance to the Anvil of Winterstith","Habla con Hórin","Talk to Hórin at the Wyrmgap","Náth steps forward to speak to you","Enter the Anvil of Winterstith through the Instance Finder panel.\
\
Claim a bone from the corpse of Vethúg Wintermind, and survive your expedition into the Anvil.","Nori would like you speak with you.\
\
You should talk to Nori.","Four familiar faces step forward behind you","Talk to Náth","Hórin has gone to the Wyrmgap to meet his scout.\
\
You should head to the Wyrmgap and speak to Hórin."}},
[11697]={nameES="The Anvil of Winterstith (Tier 1)",objectivesES={"Karazgar, the Weeping Warrior, has ventured into the Anvil to claim the Herald of Winter and her Frost-horde.  You must find and defeat him before that can happen.","Defeat Karazgar the Weeping Warrior","Isvítha the Gluttonous, a massive frost worm, guards the entrance to the Anvil of Winterstith. You must defeat her to gain entrance.","Dragon-spell spectres of the Zhélruka kings who died seeking the fabled Thafar-gathol haunt the Anvil of Winterstith, blocking your passage.","Survive your encounter with Hrímil Frost-heart","Defeat the Thirteen Kings","The Anvil of Winterstith (Tier 1)","You have completed the Anvil of Winterstith on Tier 1","Karazgar has come to the Anvil of Winterstith to bolster his forces by laying claim to the Herald of Winter and her Frost-horde. If he succeeds, he will have the means to wipe out not only the expedition of dwarves in Ered Mithrin, but to lay siege to all of the Northern Kingdoms.","Hrímil Frost-heart, the Herald of Winter, is one of the most powerful and ancient creatures in Middle-earth, and you have just stumbled into her lair.","Completed: The Anvil of Winterstith (Tier 1)","Defeat Isvítha the Gluttonous"}},
[11698]={nameES="The Anvil of Winterstith (Tier 2)",objectivesES={"Karazgar, the Weeping Warrior, has ventured into the Anvil to claim the Herald of Winter and her Frost-horde.  You must find and defeat him before that can happen.","Karazgar has come to the Anvil of Winterstith to bolster his forces by laying claim to the Herald of Winter and her Frost-horde. If he succeeds, he will have the means to wipe out not only the expedition of dwarves in Ered Mithrin, but to lay siege to all of the Northern Kingdoms.","Defeat Karazgar the Weeping Warrior","Isvítha the Gluttonous, a massive frost worm, guards the entrance to the Anvil of Winterstith. You must defeat her to gain entrance.","Dragon-spell spectres of the Zhélruka kings who died seeking the fabled Thafar-gathol haunt the Anvil of Winterstith, blocking your passage.","You have completed the Anvil of Winterstith on Tier 2","Survive your encounter with Hrímil Frost-heart","Defeat the Thirteen Kings","The Anvil of Winterstith (Tier 2)","Hrímil Frost-heart, the Herald of Winter, is one of the most powerful and ancient creatures in Middle-earth, and you have just stumbled into her lair.","Defeat Isvítha the Gluttonous","Completed: The Anvil of Winterstith (Tier 2)"}},
[11699]={nameES="The Anvil of Winterstith (Tier 3)",objectivesES={"Karazgar, the Weeping Warrior, has ventured into the Anvil to claim the Herald of Winter and her Frost-horde.  You must find and defeat him before that can happen.","Karazgar has come to the Anvil of Winterstith to bolster his forces by laying claim to the Herald of Winter and her Frost-horde. If he succeeds, he will have the means to wipe out not only the expedition of dwarves in Ered Mithrin, but to lay siege to all of the Northern Kingdoms.","You have completed the Anvil of Winterstith on Tier 3","Defeat Karazgar the Weeping Warrior","Dragon-spell spectres of the Zhélruka kings who died seeking the fabled Thafar-gathol haunt the Anvil of Winterstith, blocking your passage.","Survive your encounter with Hrímil Frost-heart","Defeat the Thirteen Kings","Isvítha the Gluttonous, a massive frost worm, guards the entrance to the Anvil of Winterstith. You must defeat her to gain entry.","Hrímil Frost-heart, the Herald of Winter, is one of the most powerful and ancient creatures in Middle-earth, and you have just stumbled into her lair.","Completed: The Anvil of Winterstith (Tier 3)","Defeat Isvítha the Gluttonous","The Anvil of Winterstith (Tier 3)"}},
[11700]={nameES="The Apprentices Attack",objectivesES={"Talk to Kyrstig","You show Kyrstig the note left by Ausma.\
\
'She went in there by herself, and told us to stay here! But is that really the right thing to do?'","Troubling portents abound! Where is Ausma?","Ausma has decided that stopping the Angmarim cult from raising the entirety of the Houses of Rest in undeath is to be top priority.","The Apprentices Attack","Complete 'Instance: The Apprentices Attack'","It is time for you to carry out Ausma's plan.","My scouts,\
\
Your attack on the Angmarim has proven distraction enough to set my own plan into motion. I am going into Shakhajât alone. If we are fortunate, I will return with the warlord's head. You three are to stay put!\
\
Ausma","Talk to Krystig","Kyrstig awaits your unhappy tidings.","Find a clue to Ausma's whereabouts"}},
[11701]={nameES="The Approach of Dawn",objectivesES={"You and Baradal survived one encounter with the warg chieftain, Ránulur, but another may be unavoidable, and un-survivable.","Baradal has been taken to the Galadhrim camp on the border of Lothlórien.\
\
You should talk to Baradal.","Talk to Baradal","Baradal is now free, but she is injured from the warg attack.\
\
You should talk to Baradal to begin Instance: Dawn's Arrival.","Complete: 'Instance: Dawn's Arrival'","The Approach of Dawn"}},
[11702]={nameES="Los Accesos a Caras Gelebren",objectivesES={"El río supone una barrera natural contra incursiones desde esta dirección","Esta pendiente asciende hacia las ruinas de la ciudad, ya repletas de enemigos","Encuentra el puente al norte de Caras Gelebren","Ilarion te ha pedido que explores varios accesos a Caras Gelebren: el puente al norte, la orilla del río al suroeste y la colina en pendiente al sudeste.","Habla con Ilarion en Echad Terthas","Ilarion está en Echad Terthas, esperando tu informe.","Encuentra la pendiente al sudeste de Echad Terthas","Encuentra la orilla del río al suroeste de Echad Terthas","Los Accesos a Caras Gelebren","Ilarion desea que explores los accesos a Caras Gelebren.","El puente está libre de amenazas desde el norte... por ahora"}},
[11703]={nameES="La Arena de Maethad",objectivesES={"La Arena de Maethad","Al noreste de Gabilshathûr hay un lugar llamado \\qMaethad\\q. Aquí, los trolls y sus maestros gorthorog se entrenan para luchar y liderar los ejércitos de Angmar.","La arena de Maethad está al norte y al este de Gabilshathûr.\
\
Hwati te ha pedido que encuentres la arena y reduzcas el número de gertheryg y trolls que se entrenan allí.","Hwati está de regreso en Gabilshathûr, al oeste y al sur de Maethad.\
\
Tras haber derrotado a varios gertheryg y trolls, deberías regresar con Hwati."}},
[11704]={nameES="The Armourer's Assistant",objectivesES={"The blacksmith's forge is in Eaworth, near the Mead Hall.\
\
Goldwine asked you to forge spears for the guards of Eaworth.","The guards of Eaworth can be found throughout the city.\
\
Goldwine asked you to bring the spears you crafted to the guards of Eaworth.","Talk to Goldwine","Impressed by your courage and willingness to assist the people of Eaworth, Goldwine has decided to offer you another task.","Craft spears for the guards of Eaworth","Goldwine stands guard near the blacksmith's forge in Eaworth.\
\
You should let Goldwine know that you have delivered the spears to the guards of Eaworth.","The Armourer's Assistant"}},
