[11712]={nameES="El aroma de almuerzos pasados",objectivesES={"Habla con Wingard Barroso","Wingard está revisando los textos que has recuperado cuando de repente se pone a cantar desafinando y a bailar con torpeta.\
\
'¡Oh! ¡Ayudante! ¡Estás aquí todavía!\
\
...\
\
\
'No has visto u oído nada de eso.\
\
...\
\
'Ajam.\
\
'¡Ayudante! He hecho un descubrimiento incríble. Un arbusto que crece en esta zona era utilizado como hierba culinaria. \
Recogeré un poco en mi camino de vuelta a Gamwich y haré algunos platos de prueba. Te pediría que recogieras una cantidad mayor y me la lleves a Gamwich.'","Recoge algunas hierbas cerca del río al este de Gamwich. Llévalas de vuelta a Wingard Barroso en el pueblo.","El aroma de almuerzos pasados","Wingard Barroso está de vuelta en Gamwich.\
\
Vuelve con Wingard Barroso.","Wingard Barroso necesita ayuda para reunir ingredientes."}},
[11713]={nameES="La llegada de los Alboespino",objectivesES={"Vuelve con Waltney Alboespino III","Se puede recoger carne de jabalí cazando en el Ángulo.\
\
Waltney Alboespino III te ha pedido que recojas carne fresca de jabalí para ayudar a llenar su despensa antes de que lleguen sus padres.","Waltney Alboespino III, apodado Espino, está en Tornhad.\
\
Deberías llevarle la carne fresca a Espino.","Waltney Alboespino III está en Tornhad.\
\
Garan Alboespino te ha pedido que avises a su hijo de que sus padres están a punto de llegar a Tornhad.","Habla con Waltney Alboespino III","La llegada de los Alboespino","Waltney y Garan Alboespino se acercan a Tornhad, pero ¿está su hijo, Waltney Alboespino III, preparado para su llegada?"}},
[11714]={nameES="The Arrogant Huntsman",objectivesES={"The Arrogant Huntsman","The renowned huntsman Caddabrand is seeking skilled adventurers to become his apprentice and share in his profits.","Norcrofts brown bears dwell among the trees and rocks east along the river.\
\
Caddabrand has asked you to collect hides from brown bears to prove that you are capable of more profitable ventures.","Caddabrand waits at his encampment, west and south of the river crossing.\
\
You have collected the brown bear-hides sought by the scout Caddabrand.","Return to Caddabrand with the brown bear-hides"}},
[11715]={nameES="The Assistant and the Wine",objectivesES={"You have found Belhax's wine delivery, but not him. A trail of wine droplets leads you further around the Tor-gardens pool.\
\
You should follow it.","Akhamâl has told you to check the north-western entrance of the Dahâl Huliz for Belhax.","The droplet trail seems to loop around part of the pool","This must be Belhax!","After you relay the story of Belhax and the wine, Akhamâl huffs in amusement.\
\
'I am equal parts disgruntled, amused, and impressed. He managed to drink a good amount of wine before falling asleep.\
\
'Thank you for checking on him, and for giving me a story to tell my friends. For now, however, it is time that I woke him. He has a mess to clean up.'","You have found a leaking crate at the Dahâl Huliz's north-western entrance. Belhax is nowhere in sight.\
\
You should examine it and the puddle it's leaving.","You have found Belhax at the gazebo in the center of the Tor-gardens pool!\
\
You should try to talk to him.","Despite your best efforts to wake him, the assistant seems to have fallen into a deep sleep.\
\
Next to him lies a discarded, empty wine bottle. The glass on its side has cracked; perhaps this was what caused the puddle next to the crate. Rather than let the wine go to waste, Belhax might have run off to drink the rest.\
\
It might be kindest to let him continue sleeping while you report back to Akhamâl.","You spot a trail of wine droplets leading north-east...","Akhamâl's assistant has not returned with a wine delivery.","Examine the crate","The Assistant and the Wine","You've found Belhax safe and sound.\
\
You should tell Akhamâl back at the Dahâl Huliz.","The crate holds bottles of wine sourced from local shops","Talk to Belhax","Examine the puddle","The puddle smells distinctly of fermented grapes","You find an unattended crate leaking some kind of liquid...","Follow the wine droplet trail","Check the Dahâl Huliz's north-western entrance","Talk to Akhamâl at the Dahâl Huliz"}},
[11716]={nameES="The Auction",objectivesES={}},
[11717]={nameES="The Auctioneer",objectivesES={"The Auctioneer","Bedwur is in the centre of Avardin at the auction-platform.\
\
Andras asked you to speak with Bedwur regarding the auction.","Avardin is run by Bedwur, a leader among the Ox-clan who runs the auctions and controls the local economy.","Talk to Bedwur in Avardin"}},
[11718]={nameES="The Avanc",objectivesES={}},
[11719]={nameES="The Awkward First Step",objectivesES={}},
[11720]={nameES="The Bait Ball",objectivesES={}},
[11721]={nameES="The Bandit Camp's Ruins",objectivesES={"A villager wants to know what might be found at the nearby bandit camp.\
\
Investigate the bandit camp west of Dínadab.","Tell Peran that you have examined the supplies at the camp.","Someone has laid out good clothing and leather armour","The Bandit Camp's Ruins","Examine the barricade","A villager wants to know if there are salvageable materials in the nearby bandit camp.","You aren't entirely sure what this barricade is meant to accomplish","Examine the lumber pile","Examine the cloth","Talk to Peran","The smell of rot wafts up from the pile of lumber. It is of no use to anyone"}},
[11722]={nameES="The Bandit's Stash",objectivesES={}},
[11723]={nameES="The Bane of Hunulf's Existence",objectivesES={"A particularly mischievous wolverine has stolen honey cakes from Hunulf on several occasions.","Return to Hunulf","Defeated Hunulf's Bane","Defeat Hunulf's Bane","The Bane of Hunulf's Existence","A particularly mischievous wolverine has stolen honey cakes from Hunulf on several occasions. He hopes for a just resolution to his problem.","You should return to Hunulf, who can be found in Skoghús, in the Thornholt woods.","You should find and defeat the wolverine."}},
[11724]={nameES="El Daño de Rhûn, Azote de Mordor",objectivesES={"Una vez fue un gran rey en tierras lejanas al este, acostumbrado a gobernar y reacio a inclinar la rodilla ante cualquier otro. Pero luego vino un dador de regalos y un prometedor de poder, y al aceptar estos señuelos, el gran rey cambió. Ya no gobernaba sus tierras con misericordia, y tampoco permanecía en su propio reino. Se convirtió en el Daño de Rhûn, y con ese nombre llegó a ser conocido como el Daño de Rhûn, y en otros lugares.","The Great Alliance of Elves and Men stood in defiance of Sauron for long years of siege, but even their bravest heroes came to fear his deadliest servants. These were the Nazgûl, and their number was Nine. They stalked the battlefield of Mordor Besieged, and were its most dangerous scourges.\
\
Once he was a great king in lands far to the east, accustomed to rule and unwilling to bend the knee to any other. But then came a giver of gifts and a promiser of power, and upon accepting these lures, the great king changed. No longer did he rule his lands with mercy, and neither did he remain in his own kingdom. He became Rhûn's bane, and by that name came he to be known as the Bane of Rhûn, and elsewhere.","The Great Alliance of Elves and Men stood in defiance of Sauron for long years of siege, but even their greatest heroes came to fear his deadliest servants. These were the Nazgûl, and their number was Nine.","El Daño de Rhûn, Azote de Mordor","The Bane of Rhûn, defeated but enduring","Defeat the Bane of Rhûn in Mordor Besieged","The Bane of Rhûn has been defeated... for now","The Bane of Rhûn suffered defeat on the battlefield of Mordor Besieged, but it was not to be a lasting death... not while Sauron endured. The Nazgûl would return, for his was an existence beyond ending."}},
[11725]={nameES="The Bane of the Bog",objectivesES={}},
[11726]={nameES="Las Orillas del Gran Río",objectivesES={"Encuentra la Guarida de Fauces-Hediondas, al sureste de Haldirith","Habla con Maervadhor en Haldirith","Ahora que tiene el estómago lleno, Bingo está entusiasmado por continuar su viaje hacia las tierras al sur de Lothlórien, a lo largo de las orillas del Gran Río.","Busca a un elfo en Haldirith dispuesto a ayudarte con la falta de tinta de Bingo","Bingo está en el puesto élfico de Haldirith, en Thinglad junto al Gran Río.\
\
Has repuesto la tinta de Bingo y deberías averiguar qué desea hacer a continuación.","Maervadhor recomendó a Bingo explorar las Viejas Madrigueras, al sur de Haldirith, y la Guarida de Fauces-Hediondas, al sureste de Haldirith, si busca aventuras dignas de ser escritas.","Muele los ingredientes hasta obtener pigmento usando la piedra de molienda en Haldirith","Mueles los ingredientes hasta obtener un pigmento oscuro","Maervadhor está en el puesto élfico de Haldirith, en Thinglad, junto a las orillas del Gran Río.\
\
Bingo quiere pedir a Maervadhor recomendaciones de lugares emocionantes para visitar a lo largo del Gran Río.","La Guarida de Fauces-Hediondas apesta a oso y carne en descomposición. Bingo escribe frenéticamente.","Lleva la tinta a Bingo en Haldirith","Las Orillas del Gran Río","Maervadhor te ha pedido reunir varios ingredientes que puedes usar para hacer una tinta de alta calidad. El siguiente paso consiste en molerlos hasta obtener un pigmento en una piedra de Haldirith.","Bingo está en el puesto élfico de Haldirith, en Thinglad, junto a las orillas del Gran Río.","Las Viejas Madrigueras han sido invadidas por huargos. Bingo escribe frenéticamente.","Añades el pigmento al agua, formando una tinta espesa","Bingo ha decidido viajar por las orillas del Gran Río, al sur de Lothlórien, y quiere encontrarse contigo en el puesto élfico de Haldirith, en Thinglad.","Habla con Bingo en Haldirith, en Thinglad junto al Gran Río","Habla con Bingo en Haldirith","Bingo te ha pedido que hables con los elfos de Haldirith, en Thinglad junto al Gran Río, sobre la posibilidad de pedir prestado un tintero.","Los juncos de ribera y el barro oscuro se pueden encontrar al noreste de Haldirith, junto a las orillas del Gran Río.","Maervadhor te explicó el proceso de fabricación de la tinta, y el siguiente paso es añadir el pigmento que creaste al cubo de agua cercano.","Agrega el pigmento que creaste al cubo de agua en Haldirith","Encuentra las Viejas Madrigueras, al sur de Haldirith"}},
[11727]={nameES="El estandarte de Uzbad-bakân",objectivesES={"Rûgh y su estandarte se encuentran en los barracones de Uzbad-bakân, en Zelem-melek.\
\
Deberías derrotar a Rûgh y quemar su estandarte.","Rûgh derrotado","Derrota a Rûgh","Destruye el estandarte de Rûgh","Has derrotado al líder de Uzbad-bakân, un malvado orco llamado Rûgh. Con su estandarte destruido y su cántico constante silenciado, los orcos de Zelem-melek estarán menos organizados en sus ataques.","El estandarte de Uzbad-bakân","Completado","Has encontrado los barracones de Uzbad-bakân, en los que se encuentra un violento líder orco y su estandarte de combate que da ánimos a los soldados de Moria.","Has destruido el estandarte de Rûgh","Derrota a Rûgh y quema su estandarte"}},
[11728]={nameES="The Banners of Gorgar",objectivesES={"Gorgar's forces flock to Durshulot, waving his banners proudly. Rékkur has an idea for what to do with them.","The Banners of Gorgar","Rékkur is stationed in Aslíf and will want to hear that the deed is done.","Talk to Rékkur in Aslíf","Durshulot lies on the middle tier to the north-west of Aslíf.\
\
Rékkur believes that burning the Orkish banners at Durshulot will diminish the morale among Gorgar's forces."}},
[11729]={nameES="The Banquet and the Breach",objectivesES={}},
[11730]={nameES="The Barbed Lash",objectivesES={"Durshâtaz can be found at Krul Lugu, below Iavassúl's Watch.\
\
Iavssúl has asked you to find and defeat the Orc-leader Durshâtaz. He suggests trying to attract his attention as he roams between the two fortresses.","Defeated Durshâtaz","Iavassúl is at Iavassúl's Watch, above Krul Lugu.\
\
You should return to Iavassúl with news of your victory.","A powerful Orc named Durshâtaz keeps his underlings in Taur Morvith in line with strength and a cruel lash, but without his domineering will to force them to battle, the Orcs there will likely fall to chaos, giving the Elves a free hand to act in the area.","Talk to Iavassúl at Iavassúl's Watch","The Barbed Lash","Defeat Durshâtaz"}},
[11731]={nameES="The Bask-master",objectivesES={}},
[11732]={nameES="La batalla ante el Rammas Deluon",objectivesES={"Viaja con Faelbenn a los Rammas Deluon","Faelbenn está cerca de Gath Forthnír.\
\
Faelbenn espera hablar contigo de nuevo.","La ira de Mordirith contra los Trév Gállorg no se ha disuadido. Refuerzos de Carn Dûm y Urugarth están tratando de marchar a través del Rammas Deluon hacia el pueblo de Aughaire.","Habla con Faelbenn","La batalla ante el Rammas Deluon","Faelbenn está cerca de Gath Forthnír.\
\
El montaraz Faelbenn te ha pedido que le ayudes a derrotar a las hechiceras de Angmar que están fortaleciendo las piedras centinelas de Rammas Deluon y a enfrentarte a los refuerzos angmarim a su lado."}},
[11733]={nameES="The Battle at Frostbluff",objectivesES={"Talk to Corr","The Battle at Frostbluff","Capture the Tower of Grumpwood!","Grumpwood Tower has been secured from the cold!","Talk to Liddy","Talk to the Queen of Cluckland","Talk to Griff","Talk to the children of Winterhome.","Capture Fortress of Frostlake!","Frostlake Fortress has been secured from the cold!","Capture the Keep of Cluckland!","Talk to Una","Cluckland Keep has been secured from the cold!","Talk to Wyn"}},
[11734]={nameES="The Battle at Frostbluff -- Daily",objectivesES={}},
[11735]={nameES="The Battle for Anatrâd",objectivesES={"Anatrâd is in north-eastern Clovengap.\
\
You should defeat hobgoblins at Anatrâd.","The ruins of Anatrâd have been overrun by hobgoblins. The ancient fortress is essential to the success of the dwarves.","The Battle for Anatrâd","The ruins of Anatrâd have been overrun by hobgoblins."}},
[11736]={nameES="La batalla por Aughaire",objectivesES={"Mordirith, el Intendente de Angmar ha regresado, y su ira contra los Montañeses de Aughaire es terrible.","Firingal está cerca de Gath Forthnír.\
\
Deberías hablar con Firingal sobre la defensa de Aughaire.","Viaja con Firingal a Aughaire","Habla con Firingal","La batalla por Aughaire","Firingal está cerca de Gath Forthnír.\
\
El ejército de Mordirith se acerca a Aughaire en las regiones occidentales de Angmar. El montaraz Firingal te ha pedido que ayudes a defender Aughaire."}},
[11737]={nameES="The Battle for Dol Guldur",objectivesES={"Rodelleth is encamped at the captured tower of Thangúlhad in Gathbúrz, east of Ost Galadh.\
\
Fuirgam has asked you to join Rodelleth's forces in battle against the Orcs of Gathbúrz before the gates of the tower of Dol Guldur.","Report to Rodelleth in Gathbúrz","Fuirgam has asked you to lend your aid to Rodelleth as she launches her assault upon Gathbúrz on the slopes before Dol Guldur.","The Battle for Dol Guldur"}},
[11738]={nameES="La batalla por Erebor",objectivesES={"Los estandartes orientales bordean las escaleras, cada uno estableciendo un término diferente para la batalla que se llevará a cabo.","El ejército oriental ha sido destrozado","La batalla por Erebor","Los campeones Olog-hai deben ser derrotados para que se rompa el asedio.","Ha llegado el momento de desafiar a los campeones Olog-hai del ejército oriental. Si pueden ser derrotados de forma convincente, el asedio puede romperse.","Derrota a los campeones Olog-hai"}},
[11739]={nameES="La batalla por Erebor",objectivesES={"Los estandartes orientales bordean las escaleras, cada uno estableciendo un término diferente para la batalla que se llevará a cabo.","El ejército oriental ha sido destrozado","La batalla por Erebor","Los campeones Olog-hai deben ser derrotados para que se rompa el asedio.","Ha llegado el momento de desafiar a los campeones Olog-hai del ejército oriental. Si pueden ser derrotados de forma convincente, el asedio puede romperse.","Derrota a los campeones Olog-hai"}},
[11740]={nameES="La batalla por Erebor - Desafío",objectivesES={"Los estandartes orientales bordean las escaleras, cada uno estableciendo un término diferente para la batalla que se llevará a cabo.","El ejército oriental ha sido destrozado","Define tus términos antes de comenzar la lucha","Los campeones Olog-hai deben ser derrotados para que se rompa el asedio.","Ha llegado el momento de desafiar a los campeones Olog-hai del ejército oriental. Si pueden ser derrotados de forma convincente, el asedio puede romperse.","Derrota a los campeones Olog-hai","La batalla por Erebor - Desafío","Desafío fallido - Comienza la lucha"}},
[11741]={nameES="The Battle for Garânashmar",objectivesES={"Rúdin is in Bazanmanar in north-eastern Clovengap.\
\
You should tell Rúdin that you have defeated many of the Angmarim.","Return to Rúdin","Garânashmar perches across Kurdushâlak, in north-western Clovengap.\
\
Rúdin has asked you to defeat Angmarim at Garânashmar.","Garânashmar, the ancient homestead of Forstóri's Line, has been overrun by Angmarim.","The Battle for Garânashmar"}},
[11742]={nameES="The Battle for Imhûlar, Part 1",objectivesES={"Speak with Mizâdi on the battlefield.","Mizâdi asks your help in expelling the cruel Bârshud II. War has come to Imhûlar!","Place Mizâdi's standard in the first encampment of Bârshud's forces","Speak with Mizâdi on the battlefield","Place Mizâdi's standard just within the gates of Nisigurûm","Regroup near Mizâdi on the battlefield","Speak with Mizâdi in southern Imhûlar outside Bârshud's camp of Nisigurûm.","Defeat Ekhamâti and plant Mizâdi's banner in each area.","The Battle for Imhûlar, Part 1","Regroup near Mizâdi on the battlefield.","Place Mizâdi's standard outside the gates of Nisigurûm","Speak with Mizâdi in southern Imhûlar outside Nisigurûm"}},
[11743]={nameES="The Battle for Imhûlar, Part 2",objectivesES={"Search for Bârshud II near the red tents to the west in Nisigurûm and challenge him to a duel.","Mizâdi asks your help in finding and defeating Bârshud II within Nisigurûm, so that the Ekhamâti forces may crumble and flee with their leader slain.","Continue searching for Bârshud near the eastern tents further in Nisigurûm","Antagâl runs off, wounded, behind the main tent. Pursue him!","The Battle for Imhûlar, Part 2","Bârshud is nowhere to be found here","You find no sign of Bârshud here","Defeat Antagâl, Bârshud's Umûni!","You see Antagâl, Bârshud's Umûni. Defeat him!","Antagâl is wounded. He scuttled behind the main tent in Nisigurûm. Interrogate Antagâl about where Bârshud really is.","Search for Bârshud II near the western tents in Nisigurûm","Continue searching for Bârshud II near the eastern tents further in Nisigurûm and challenge him to a duel.","Search for Bârshud II near the main tent in Nisigurûm and challenge him to a duel.","Search for Bârshud II near the main tent in Nisigurûm","Find Mizâdi on the battlefield and give her this grim news","Find Mizâdi on the battlefield and give her this grim news.","Defeat Antagâl, Bârshud's Umûni","Interrogate Antagâl about where Bârshud really is"}},
[11744]={nameES="The Battle for Osgiliath",objectivesES={}},
[11745]={nameES="The Battle for Utterby",objectivesES={"Akh-gulûkh has asked you to join him and the other Jangovar leaders inside the Utterby Town Hall.\
\
You should speak with Kunchat and enter Instance: The Lone Dwarf.","The Battle for Utterby","The dwarf attack on Utterby is imminent. Through your efforts, the innocent Easterlings have fled. The time has come to take on the Jangovar.","Speak with Kunchat to enter Instance: The Lone Dwarf","Lord Náin is outside Utterby.\
\
You should talk to Lord Náin.","Talk to Lord Náin"}},
[11746]={nameES="La batalla en la torre",objectivesES={"<rgb=#00FF00>Has conquistado la Sala de Reunión Inferior. Los engranajes rechinan hacia el sur al abrirse la puerta hacia la Sala de Reunión Superior</rgb>","Con la Sala de Entrada y la Sala de Audiencias conquistadas, podéis comenzar a ascender la Torre y tratar de conquistar la Sala de Reunión Inferior.","La Sala de Entrada está asegurada, y Sigileth se encargará de que nada entre por detrás. El siguiente objetivo es la Sala de Audiencias al otro lado del pasillo.","Reclamar la Sala de Reunión Superior","<rgb=#00FF00>Has conquistado la Sala de Audiencias. Los engranajes rechinan hacia el este al abrirse la puerta hacia la Sala de Reunión Inferior</rgb>","<rgb=#FF0000>Bróin ha sido derrotado</rgb>","Para asegurar la Torre, primero se debe conquistar la Sala de Entrada.","Reclamar la Armería","Reclamar la Sala de Reunión Inferior","<rgb=#00FF00>Has conquistado la Sala de Entrada. Los engranajes rechinan hacia el sur al abrirse la puerta hacia la Sala de Audiencias</rgb>","Reclamar la Sala de Audiencias","<rgb=#00FF00>Has conquistado la Sala de Reunión Superior. Los engranajes rechinan hacia el oeste al abrirse la puerta hacia la Armería</rgb>","La batalla en la torre","El Enemigo está atrincherado en la Torre de Dol Guldur. Es el momento de golpearles en el corazón.","Reclamar la Sala de Entrada","Con las Salas de Reunión conquistadas, es el momento de tomar la Armería y recuperar Zigilburk.","La Sala de Reunión Superior está justo encima de la Inferior... al conquistarla, el Enemigo quedará confundido y cualquier refuerzo, mal armado.","Bróin debe sobrevivir a la batalla","<rgb=#00FF00>Has conquistado la Armería y recuperado Zigilburk</rgb>"}},
[11747]={nameES="La Batalla en la Torre - Incursión",objectivesES={"La Batalla en la Torre - Incursión","El Enemigo está atrincherado dentro de la Torre de Dol Guldur. Es hora de atacar su corazón","Completa 'La Batalla en la Torre' con un grupo de incursión","The Enemy is entrenched within the Tower of Dol Guldur. It is time to strike them at their heart."}},
[11748]={nameES="The Battle of Azgh-buzru",objectivesES={"Aid Náin the Slakeless with 'A Master of Two Minds'","Mézto stands over several defeated Orcs, his axe slick with black blood","Náin the Slakeless, Dréri, Mézto, and Órug can be found at Drenghól in the War of Three Peaks.\
\
Náin the Slakeless has ordered you to press the attack on the garrison at Bagûd-mekhem. You should speak to Náin the Slakeless, Dréri, Mézto, and Órug and aid them.","The Battle of Azgh-buzru","Find and aid Dréri with 'Death's Breath'","Dréri has taken a defensive position with several wounded Longbeards and Stout-axes","Náin the Slakeless can be found at Drenghól in the War of Three Peaks.\
\
You have aided Dréri, Mézto, and Órug at Azgh-buzru. You should report to Náin and inform him of your success.","Órug peers into the distance where the shapes of several trebuchets punctuate the horizon","Find and aid Mézto with 'Vengeance in Kind'","Dréri, Mézto, and Órug can be found among the forces of the Gabil'akkâ at Azgh-buzru.\
\
Náin the Slakeless has commanded you to rally with his forces at Azgh-buzru, the war-fell and aid them in overcoming the forces of Mount Gundabad.","Aid Dréri with 'No Quarter for the Captured'","Náin the Slakeless can be found at Drenghól in the War of Three Peaks.\
\
You have aided Náin the Slakeless and the dwarves of the Gabil'akkâ in overcoming the garrison at Bagûd-mekhem. You should report to Náin with news of your victory at Bagûd-mekhem.","Find and aid Órug with 'Engines of Destruction'","Aid Mézto with 'To Stoke A Cold Fire'","Talk to Náin the Slakeless at Drenghól","It is at the Battle of Azgh-buzru that the coming days of the War of Three Peaks are to be decided. The Gabil'akkâ must rout the forces of Gorgar the Ruthless and the Frost-horde or all hopes of mounting an attack on the gates of Mount Gundabad are lost.","Aid Órug with 'The Lieutenants of Gorgar'"}},
[11749]={nameES="The Battle of Dol Baran",objectivesES={}},
[11750]={nameES="La Batalla de Lórien",objectivesES={"Habla con Belvagor y comienza la defensa de Lothlórien","La Batalla de Lórien","Belvagor se encuentra en Caras Galadhon, esperando a que reúnas aliados y hables con él para comenzar la defensa de Lothlórien.","Habla con Belvagor en Caras Galadhon","Belvagor te espera en Caras Galadhon para hablar contigo sobre la defensa de Lothlórien frente a los orcos.","Belvagor cree que el ataque de los orcos contra Lórien es inminente y espera que tus preparativos —y la fuerza de tu voluntad— sean suficientes para impedir la victoria del enemigo."}},
[11751]={nameES="The Battle of Ost Celebrant",objectivesES={"Complete 'An Omen from the East'","The Battle of Ost Celebrant","Talk to Doron","Doron, leader of the Oathbreakers in Parth Celebrant, has directed you to assault Ost Celebrant. Along with his aid, he hopes that you will rid these once-great ruins of the taint that has befallen them.","Doron is among his men at the Field of Celebrant, atop a hill in western Parth Celebrant.\
\
You should speak with Doron once more.","Talk to Idmar","Summon Doron","Talk to Doron at the Field of Celebrant","Travel to Ost Celebrant","You have arrived in Ost Celebrant and now must summon Doron to your side","Idmar is at his camp along the road in central Parth Celebrant.\
\
You should bring news of your victory to Idmar.","Ost Celebrant is the large fortress in south-east Parth Celebrant.\
\
Doron wishes to meet you on the bridge at Ost Celebrant.","You should speak with Doron regarding your assault on Ost Celebrant.","Ost Celebrant is the large fortress in south-east Parth Celebrant.\
\
Doron hopes to aid you by directing your assault as you move towards the heart of the ruins."}},
[11752]={nameES="La batalla de Rhunendin",objectivesES={"Habla con Tordoron","La batalla de Rhunendin","Tordoron está cerca de Gath Forthnír.\
\
Tordoron te ha pedido que le ayudes a montar un asalto contra las fuerzas de Angmar que se reúnen en Rhunendin.","Tordoron está cerca de Gath Forthnír.\
\
Deberías hablar con Tordoron sobre tu victoria contra los Angmarim en Rhunendin.","Mordirith sigue decidido a arrasar Aughaire y reúne sus fuerzas en Rhunendin para lanzar una ofensiva masiva contra los Trév Gállorg.","Viaja con Tordoron a Rhunendin"}},
[11753]={nameES="The Beacon of Eaworth",objectivesES={"The Beacon of Eaworth is just north of the Mead Hall along the river.\
\
The timbers of the Beacon of Eaworth must be examined to ensure they are undamaged and secure.","<rgb=#FF0000>Completing Aiding the Eastemnet will cancel this quest</rgb>","Cendal is at Eaworth.\
\
Report back to Cendal and inform him that the beacon appears to be structurally sound.","Climb to the top of the Beacon of Eaworth","You have reached the top of the beacon. The timbers all the way up appear secure, solid and undamaged","Talk to Cendal","The Beacon of Eaworth","The Beacon of Eaworth is lit when the Eastemnet is under assault."}},
[11754]={nameES="The Bears of Brochos",objectivesES={"The Elves of Lothlórien subsist mostly upon the flowering bounty of Lothlórien, but there are those among them that enjoy the chase of the hunt and a finely cooked roast upon special occasions as well.","Bears can be found in the dens of Brochos, which is a ways to the west of the Vineyards of Lórien.\
\
Farasdúr has asked you to hunt the bears of Brochos and return with rich meat.","The Bears of Brochos","Talk to Farasdúr near the Vineyards of Lórien","Farasdúr is near the Vineyards of Lórien in Egladil, east of Brochos.\
\
You should bring the bear-meat you have collected to Farasdúr."}},
[11755]={nameES="The Beast Tamer Ezôti",objectivesES={"A woman attending the show is trying to get your attention.\
\
Speak to the woman across the way in the Upper Ward.","A strange man puts on a 'show' in the Upper Ward of Umbar Baharbêl.","The crowd disperses as Ezôti finishes his show","Gûshida has asked you to pretend to befriend Ezôti in order to gain information from him.\
\
Speak to Ezôti in the Upper Ward.","Talk to Ezôti in the Upper Ward","The Beast Tamer Ezôti","Talk to Gûshida across the way from Ezôti"}},
[11756]={nameES="La bestia de Belfalas",objectivesES={"Derrota a Tarasâd, la bestia de Belfalas","Tarasâd, la bestia de Belfalas, derrotado","Los rumores hablan de una gran bestia como ninguna otra. Se encuentra en lo profundo de las Islas Escudo, cazando tanto a corsarios como a filibusteros. Aventúrate y trata de domar a la poderosa bestia.","La bestia de Belfalas","Encuentra y derrota a Tarasâd, la bestia de Belfalas."}},
[11757]={nameES="The Belegiant Bridge Belongs to Mordor",objectivesES={}},
[11758]={nameES="Las campanas de Valle -- Nivel 1",objectivesES={"Derrota a Skrizg","Derrota a los lugartenientes del Señor Oscuro en Valle y toca las campanas.","Tabî-kohin derrotado","Los Orientales se preparan para asediar Valle y la Montaña Solitaria. Las campanas de Valle deben sonar para indicar a los habitantes que se retiren a Erebor.","Skrizg derrotado","Derrota a Tabî-kohin","Las campanas de Valle -- Nivel 1"}},
[11759]={nameES="Las campanas de Valle -- Nivel 2",objectivesES={"Derrota a Skrizg","Derrota a los lugartenientes del Señor Oscuro en Valle y toca las campanas.","Tabî-kohin derrotado","Los Orientales se preparan para asediar Valle y las Montañas Solitarias. Las campanas de Valle deben sonar para indicar a los habitantes que se retiren a Erebor.","Skrizg derrotado","Derrota a Tabî-kohin","Las campanas de Valle -- Nivel 2"}},
[11760]={nameES="The Best Bait",objectivesES={"Return to the fisher Kôrzan in Sen Chatâk with the gathered herbs and crab meat.","Return to Kôrzan in Sen Chatâk","Harvest fresh dill and collect crab claws from the ponds of Charganpâta.","Kôrzan has asked you to gather crab meat and herbs for use as fishing bait on the shores of the White-wrath River, near an area infested with zizani.","The Best Bait"}},
[11761]={nameES="The Best Butter",objectivesES={}},
[11762]={nameES="La mejor defensa",objectivesES={"La mejor defensa","Assisted Lady Góda with Evidence of Evil","Assist Lady Góda with Sowing Mayhem","After hearing from both Lord Ingmar and Lady Góda, you brought your support of Góda's plan to Reeve Ingbert.","Reeve Ingbert is in the Mead Hall of Eaworth, in the Entwash Vale.\
\
You should return to Ingbert and let him know that Góda's preparations are complete.","Assisted Lady Góda with Espying the Vale","Assist Lady Góda with Blinding the Enemy","Assist Lady Góda with Evidence of Evil","Assisted Lady Góda with Sowing Mayhem","Assist Lady Góda with Espying the Vale","Talk to Ingbert in the Mead Hall of Eaworth","Lady Góda stands near Reeve Ingbert in the Mead Hall of Eaworth.\
\
Ingbert has instructed you to lend aid to Lady Góda as she plans the defence of Eaworth.","Assisted Lady Góda with Blinding the Enemy"}},
[11763]={nameES="La mejor defensa",objectivesES={"La mejor defensa","Assist Ingmar with Blinding the Enemy","Ingmar stands near Ingbert in the Mead Hall of Eaworth.\
\
Ingbert instructed you to offer your services to his son, Ingmar, while he and Góda continue siege-preparations in Eaworth.","Assist Ingmar with Evidence of Evil","After hearing from both Lord Ingmar and Lady Góda, you brought your support of Ingmar's plan to Reeve Ingbert.","Assist Ingmar with Espying the Vale","Ingbert is in the Mead Hall of Eaworth, in the Entwash Vale.\
\
You should return to Ingbert and let him know that preparations for the attack on the Orcs are complete.","Assisted Ingmar with Espying the Vale","Assisted Ingmar with Evidence of Evil","Assisted Ingmar with Blinding the Enemy","Talk to Ingbert in the Mead Hall of Eaworth","Assist Ingmar with Sowing Mayhem","Assisted Ingmar with Sowing Mayhem"}},
[11764]={nameES="El gran oso negro",objectivesES={"Lleva carbón a Hyacinth Tuk","El montón de leña de Hart Holeman se encuentra al norte, más allá del muro y un pequeño campamento maderero.\
\
Hart Holeman está dispuesto a proporcionarte el carbón que Hyacinth Tuk ha solicitado, pero primero quiere que ahuyentes a un gran oso negro que ha hecho de su montón de leña su hogar.","Hart Holeman está en su casa en el centro de Sobrecolina.\
\
Hart Holeman te había pedido que te ocuparas del gran oso negro que se había instalado en su pila de leña, mientras él preparaba un paquete de carbón para Hyacinth Tuk. Le alegrará saber que el oso ya no le causará más problemas.","El gran oso negro","Hyacinth Tuk está en Alforzaburgo, cerca de los Grandes Smials.\
\
Mientras estabas fuera, lidiando con el gran oso negro en el montón de leña de Hart Holeman, Hart estuvo ocupado preparando un paquete de carbón para que se lo llevaras a Hyacinth Tuk.","Un gran oso negro ha decidido usar el montón de leña de Hart Holeman como su hogar, lo que no deja de causarle problemas a Hart."}},
[11765]={nameES="The Bigger Ones",objectivesES={"Find Tantafod's clutch and defeat Tantafod","Defeated Tantafod","Tantafod's clutch can be found on the western border of Thrór's Coomb, almost due south of Nár's Peak.\
\
Frithgeir has asked you to seek out Tantafod's clutch and destroy it. Tantafod herself may need to be dispatched as well.","Defeated Harcennun","Find Harcennun's clutch and defeat Harcennun","Harcennun's clutch can be found west of Tantafod's clutch, near a large rock outcropping.\
\
Frithgeir asked you to seek out Harcennun's clutch and destroy it. You may have to dispatch Harcennun herself as well.","Frithgeir is at Zudrugund within Nár's Peak, north of the gwibers' clutches.\
\
You should return to Frithgeir and tell him of your heroic deeds.","Talk to Frithgeir at Zudrugund","Among the broken rocks of Thrór's Coomb, the feared gwiber Tantafod and Harcennun make their nests. These matrons are fiercely protective of their nests.","The Bigger Ones"}},
