Debes montar un corcel para comenzar la carrera: un poney si eres de baja estatura o un caballo si eres más alto.","The Bree-fields Yule Run","The Yule Run is a time-honoured tradition in the Horsefields of Bree. Many challenges have been laid down to present a tricky course for the brave riders of Middle-earth who wish to demonstrate their mettle on horseback.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This quest will be removed from your quest log when the current festival ends. </rgb>","Corre hacia la quinta puerta","Corre por la tercera puerta alta sobre el salto precario","Has perdido la carrera","Corre por la sexta puerta baja a través del barro pegajoso","Corre por la sexta puerta alta sobre el salto precario","Monta un caballo de carrera","Las puertas se encuentran siguiendo la pista de carreras en los Campos de Festival de Bree.\
\
Debes correr por todas las puertas antes de que se acabe el tiempo.","Ha empezado la carrera","Habla con Sally Trilla","Corre hacia la segunda puerta","Corre hacia la primera puerta","Corre por la tercera puerta baja a través del barro pegajoso"}},
[11817]={nameES="The Breeders of Nathból",objectivesES={}},
[11818]={nameES="The Brenin's Council",objectivesES={"Dufrig is in the brenin's hall in Lhanuch.\
\
You should speak with Dufrig to enter the brenin's hall and observe the deliberations of the Council of Brehur.","The brehur of Lhanuch are in the brenin's hall in Lhanuch.\
\
Dufrig has told you to earn the favour of the brehur of Lhanuch before Glynn Brenin's council comes to a decision on whether to bow to the demands of Isengard.","Complete 'Signs Among the Ashes'","Convince Glynn Brenin to reject the emissary's demands","The chieftains of Nan Laeglin will soon hold a council under Glynn Brenin to decide how to treat with the emissaries of Isengard and the passage of the Grey Company through Enedwaith.","Complete 'A Weapon of Old'","The Brenin's Council","Complete 'The Half-orcs'","Complete 'Where There is Smoke....'"}},
[11819]={nameES="Los Puentes de Glyn Helyg",objectivesES={"Examina el quinto puente","Examina el segundo puente","Este puente está en buen estado","Las tablas de este puente están desgastadas por el tiempo","Examina el cuarto puente","Examina el sexto puente","Durante generaciones, la familia Gochelgar ha estado encargada del cuidado de los puentes de Glyn Helyg.","Esta tabla está podrida y necesita ser reemplazada","Examina el primer puente","Informa de vuelta a Ponta","Ponta Gochelgar te ha pedido que examines los puentes de Glyn Helyg en busca de signos de podredumbre y desgaste.\
\
Los puentes cruzan los tramos entre los acantilados de Glyn Helyg.","Deberías informar a Ponta sobre el estado de los puentes\
\
Ponta Gochelgar está en Glyn Helyg","Examina el tercer puente","Los Puentes de Glyn Helyg","Las tablas están firmes y seguras"}},
[11820]={nameES="The Brigand King",objectivesES={"Speak with Katâl outside the caves of Hurum Kâna. Hurum Kâna can be found in Kighân to the north of Zajâna, just off the Great Road.","Speak with Katâl outside Hurum Kâna","The Brigand King","Doorward Azagâya has requested your aid in defeating a self-styled brigand king, Barlat the Bold. He makes his home in the caves of Hurum Kâna."}},
[11821]={nameES="The Brigands of Thama Aklam",objectivesES={"Discover the camp of Thama Aklam","Thama Aklam has become home to a number of brigands, many of whom are bored and hope for a fight worthy of their skills.\
\
Defeat brigands in Thama Aklam.","Approach the camp at Thama Aklam to determine possible goings on.","As you approach the brigand camp, you begin to hear rumblings of frustration and discontentment.\
\
'It's been days since we had a good scrap,' you hear one complain.\
\
Perhaps you could satiate their boredom with a light scuffle or twelve.","Thama Aklam has become home to a number of brigands.","You have defeated many brigands in Thama Aklam.","You have tussled with many bandits. Perhaps they will be less inclined to start trouble along the road.","Completado","The Brigands of Thama Aklam"}},
[11822]={nameES="The Brigands of the Wold",objectivesES={"The brigands of Eastmund's Lair in the northern Wold are of a hostile nature, and pose a threat to the upstanding folk of Langhold.\
\
You should defeat many brigands in an effort to drive them out.","Brigands have returned to the Wold after having been recently driven across the Great River.","Tell Dala of the brigand encampment that has emerged to the south-west","Find the small band of brigands who robbed the farmer","The farmer indicated that the brigands may have wandered south-west from his farm after robbing him.\
\
You should find the small band of brigands who robbed the farmer at dawn.","The brigands in the northern Wold seems overly confident despite their recent banishment by Utred and the Riders of Langhold.","This outpost is much more worrisome than a mere band of robbers....","Dala can be found at the north gate of Langhold.\
\
You should return to Dala.","The Brigands of the Wold"}},
[11823]={nameES="Los pantanos de azufre",objectivesES={"Othran se encuentra en Tyrn Lhuig, el campamento de cazadores en la esquina suroeste de Malenhad, al este de Fasach-larran.\
\
Taraghlan te ha pedido que lleves las provisiones a su pariente Othran en el campamento de cazadores de Malenhad.","Taraghlan te habló de un campamento de cazadores llamado Tyrn Lhuig, que se encuentra en el extremo suroeste del gran pantano de Malenhad.","Lleva las provisiones a Othran","Los pantanos de azufre"}},
[11824]={nameES="The Broadacres Betrayed",objectivesES={"Thane Torferth is in the Mead Hall of Stoke.\
\
You should speak with Thane Torferth regarding Ordlac and his treachery.","Thane Torferth is at Tordag's encampment near Torsbury.\
\
You should speak with Thane Torferth when you are ready to march upon Stoke.","Talk to Torferth to march upon Stoke","The Broadacres Betrayed","Stoke has been freed and Reeve Fríthild's children saved from Ordlac","Talk to Torferth","At Lúfa's behest, you brought Thane Ordlac's token to Thane Torferth at Torsbury. He received it with great wrath."}},
[11825]={nameES="The Broken Benches of Danakh-khêj",objectivesES={"Benches are scattered about the park","Empty, crumbling benches line the paths of the Danakh-khêj park.","The fountains of Danakh-khêj still flow!","Danakh-khêj is in northern Clovengap.\
\
You should explore Danakh-khêj park.","Return to Gerja","Search for the park","The Broken Benches of Danakh-khêj","You found Danakh-khêj park!","Gerja Defthand is in north-east Clovengap.\
\
You should let Gerja Defthand know what you found in the park.","Danakh-khêj is in northern Clovengap.\
\
You should search for the ruins of the Danakh-khêj park.","Explore the park","This dwarf-made memorial stone is weathered but has stood strong against time and the elements. The runes read, 'Rest well, Azagh Gamz, my fierce warrior.'\
\
Beneath the runes is a small, carved, paw-print."}},
[11826]={nameES="The Broken Family",objectivesES={"You hear Fastred's voice echo down from the second floor","The Broken Family","Upon your return to Snowbourn, you learned that Fastred discovered that his son has been taken by an unknown force. Meanwhile, you now know that Walstow faces a full-scale assault.","Talk to Fastred","Find Fastred in his home","Fastred can be found inside his home in Snowbourn.\
\
While this is not the best moment to intrude upon his time, you must warn Fastred of the coming danger.","Talk to Gísling","Gísling can be found in central Snowbourn.\
\
Since Fastred will not hear you, you should speak with Gísling.","Fastred is inside his home in Snowbourn.\
\
Despite Cynelac's warnings, you should warn Fastred of the impending attack on Walstow."}},
[11827]={nameES="The Broken Houses",objectivesES={"Shalgoth fled to Gorthad Nûr.\
\
You should follow Shalgoth.","Defeat Broglok, overseer of Dáru Lagúrz","The Broken Houses","The broken houses of Dáru Lagúrz have been taken by the kergrim","Kergrim can be found in Rath Dúath.\
\
You should defeat kergrim in Rath Dúath and seek out Dáru Lagúrz.","Follow the path to Gorthad Nûr","As Broglok falls, his leader watches from the path to the north","Talk to Thurindol outside Gorthad Nûr","Broglok can be found in Dáru Lagúrz.\
\
You should defeat Broglok.","The Kergrim of the Morgul Vale have taken control of the old burial houses Gondor had once constructed for Minas Ithil.","Seek out Dáru Lagúrz","These barrows are much older than those of Dáru Lagúrz","Thurindol can be found outside Gorthad Nûr.\
\
You should talk to Thurindol."}},
[11828]={nameES="The Broods of Lhingris",objectivesES={"The Broods of Lhingris","Ichor can be harvested from various creatures in Lhingris.\
\
Legolas has asked you to gather ichor from the many insects and spiders of Lhingris.","Deliver the phials of ichor to Legolas near Dath Nethryn","Legolas can be found beside the road above the swamps of Dath Nethryn.\
\
You have gathered a great deal of ichor from the creatures of Lhingris and should now return to Legolas.","After exploring much of Lhingris, Legolas has become unnerved by similarities he has noticed in the many creatures and insects of the Ephel Dúath."}},
[11829]={nameES="The Brutes of Sammath Gûl",objectivesES={"The Brutes of Sammath Gûl","Sammath Gûl, a tower deep within Dol Guldur, is in the Eastern reaches of southern Mirkwood.\
\
Naerdolen has asked you to enter Sammath Gûl and defeat many Guldur Brutes.","Naerdolen has asked you to go into Sammath Gûl and destroy the protective Black Uruks that attempt to stop all intruders."}},
[11830]={nameES="The Brutes of Stonejaws",objectivesES={"Hobgoblin brutes have ventured out from the Pit of Stonejaws and into Máttugard.","Talk to Voina","Voina can be found at Zidir-nesad, the Steepset, in Máttugard.\
\
You should talk to Voina.","The Brutes of Stonejaws","Hobgoblin brutes and hobgoblin wards can be found in western Máttugard.\
\
You should defeat hobgoblin brutes and destroy their wards."}},
[11831]={nameES="The Burdens of Underharrow",objectivesES={"Éowyn seeks to ready her people to travel south to Dunharrow, but the path through the Harrowdale must be prepared before their travels can begin.","The Burdens of Underharrow","DNT -- Will not be seen","Talk to Ellen Fremedon in Underharrow","Ellen Fremedon can be found outside the Mead Hall of Underharrow in the Harrowdale.\
\
Éowyn has asked that you aid Ellen Fremedon in preparing for the people of Kingstead as they journey to Dunharrow."}},
[11832]={nameES="The Buried Treasure of Elbery",objectivesES={"Return to Húrwen","From a hill overlooking a large farm, a woman waits for help recovering her stolen coin.","The Buried Treasure of Elbery","Húrwen has asked you to search for sacks of coin that her father secreted about her farm.\
\
Elbery Farm is located in north-western Pinnath Gelin.","You have recovered multiple sacks of coins from Elbery Farm.\
\
You should bring the sacks of coin to Húrwen, who is waiting on the road west of Elbery, in Pinnath Gelin."}},
[11833]={nameES="The Buried Truth",objectivesES={"The Buried Truth","Defeat the captor Daegul located deep within the crypt","The captor Daegul has been defeated.","Locate the crypt in the middle of Lake Isingmere","The captor Daegul is not pleased that it has been disturbed.","Open the wailing Daegul's casket deep within the crypt","The wailing Daegul is bound to this location and cannot leave until it is freed by defeating its captor located within an island crypt.","Now that the captor Daegul has been defeated, the wailing Daegul will no longer be bound to the lighthouse.","Speak with the wailing Daegul","You have located the crypt on Lake Isingmere.","Enter the crypt and look for the the wailing Daegul's casket located deep within.","You have opened the casket of the wailing Daegul. The captor appears to find out who is disturbing its rest.","Head to the island in the middle of Lake Isingmere and find the crypt located there."}},
[11834]={nameES="La isla ardiente",objectivesES={"Investiga Tyl Ruinen","Multitud de extrañas criaturas han empezado a aparecer en Evendim, entre las que destacan las temibles salamandras.","La isla ardiente","La isla de Tyl Ruinen en el lado oeste del lago, enfrente de Tinnudir, está infestada de salamandras.\
\
Calatherdir te ha pedido que viajes hasta Tyl Ruinen y a las ruinas de Tollobel para investigar el origen de las salamandras."}},
[11835]={nameES="The Burning Mountain: Black Fire",objectivesES={"Return to Candúr with the obsidian ore.","The Burning Mountain: Black Fire","Gather obsidian ore","Mineral riches await those who brave the perilous cliff road circling Mount Doom.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Warning: This quest requires The Burning Mountain: Blood Wings to be underway. If that quest has been completed or failed, you will be unable to exit and re-enter this instance in order to complete this quest.</rgb>","Gather obsidian ore.","Bring the obsidian ore to Candúr"}},
[11836]={nameES="The Burning Mountain: Blood Wings",objectivesES={"The Burning Mountain: Blood Wings","You ran out of time...","Defeat The Blood-blade.","Talk to Candúr","You should return to Candúr and apprise him of your efforts.","Defeat The Blood-blade","Defeated The Blood-blade","Mineral riches await those who brave the perilous cliff road circling Mount Doom.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Warning: This quest has a one hour time limit. The timer will begin upon accepting the quest.</rgb>"}},
[11837]={nameES="The Burning Mountain: Red Skies",objectivesES={"You should return to Candúr and inform him of your deeds on Mount Doom.","Defeat Merrevail on Mount Doom","Talk to Candúr","Defeat Merrevail on Mount Doom.","Mineral riches await those who brave the perilous cliff road circling Mount Doom.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Warning: This quest requires The Burning Mountain: Blood Wings to be underway. If that quest has been completed or failed, you will be unable to exit and re-enter this instance in order to complete this quest.</rgb>","The Burning Mountain: Red Skies"}},
[11838]={nameES="The Burning Plains of Dor Amarth",objectivesES={"Talk to Ingold","Habla con Gimli","Few have braved beyond the borders of Udûn","Travel to the Ruins of Díngarth in Dor Amarth","Gimli and Ingold can be found at the Ruins of Díngarth in Dor Amarth.\
\
When you have completed all you wish to do in Udûn you should speak to Gimli and Ingold.","The Ruins of Díngarth is located near Udûn in Dor Amarth.\
\
You should travel to the Ruins of Díngarth.","When you have completed all you wish to do in Udûn you should speak to Gimli and Ingold about Dor Amarth.","The Burning Plains of Dor Amarth"}},
[11839]={nameES="The Burrowers",objectivesES={}},
[11840]={nameES="The Business of Spiders",objectivesES={"Legolas is waiting for you in Echad Taerdim, the Ranger camp in Cirith Ungol.\
\
You should talk to Legolas.","The Straight Stair marks the start of your journey into Cirith Ungol.\
\
You can find it through a pass just behind Halhir, who is stationed along the Morgul-road.","Find the Straight Stair","The Straight Stair climbs into the heights","The Business of Spiders","Talk to Mablung","Talk to Gladhir","Legolas has come to Cirith Ungol to address some unfinished business. What has become of Shelob, her brood, the Mirkwood spiders, and the tower of Cirith Ungol?","Talk to Mírthel","Echad Taerdim, the Ranger camp in Cirith Ungol under command of Mablung, can be found at the top of the Straight Stair.\
\
You should travel to Echad Taerdim.","Legolas can be found at Echad Taerdim, the Ranger camp in Cirith Ungol.\
\
You should talk to Legolas.","Legolas waves to you as you approach the camp","You relay to Legolas all of the information the Rangers shared with you.\
\
'Interesting. I am glad to have such skilled Rangers at our disposal. They have saved us a great deal of time.'\
\
Legolas' attention briefly drifts away as he considers all you have said.\
\
'Several mysteries now need to be unravelled. Why did the Uruk-hai pass this way? Did they come from the city or somewhere else? If they were headed to the tower, does that mean the pass from the east is no longer accessible to them? What are these spiders that sequester themselves from the others? What do these strange footprints mean, where Men can suddenly disappear mid-stride? We have much to consider, and much ground to cover.'","Find Echad Taerdim","Habla con Legolas.","Legolas believes the first course of action is to gather information from the Rangers of Ithilien stationed at Echad Taerdim.\
\
You should talk to Mablung, Mírthel, and Gladhir."}},
[11841]={nameES="The Butcher of Lumrog",objectivesES={"A fearsome hill-troll, Torask-rúm, has long made Lumrog its home. Known as the Butcher of Lumrog, this creature has kept its minions in check. Defeating this creature should break the resolve of the underlings.","Find Lumrog","Completado.","Deep within Lumrog, a fearsome hill-troll keeps the other creatures there in line. This beast is Torask-rúm, the Butcher of Lumrog, and if he is defeated the resolve of his underlings may waver.","Torask-rúm, the Butcher of Lumrog, is a fearsome hill-troll keeps the other creatures within Lumrog in line. Defeating this creature should break the resolve of his underlings.","You have slain the Butcher of Lumrog and broken his control over the beasts he commanded. Theirs was a loyalty borne of fear; now free of it, it is your hope they will find it difficult to mount successful raids upon travellers in Misthallow.","Torask-rúm, the Butcher of Lumrog, is no more","Completado","Defeat Torask-rúm, the Butcher of Lumrog","The Butcher of Lumrog"}},
[11842]={nameES="The Butcher of Snowbourn",objectivesES={"Follow Fastred's trail of slaughtered Orcs","Its legs slashed, this Orc looks to have attempted to flee before being run down","Talk to Fastred","As you explore, you notice a Rohirrim caked in black blood standing in the distance","Another slaughtered Orc lays at your feet. This one appears to have had two blades thrust through its skull","Gísling recommends setting out to the east of Snowbourn in search of Fastred or any Orcs that he has slain in his wake.\
\
Gísling suggests that you try to find Fastred in the field and persuade him to return to Snowbourn.","Below you, an Orc lays brutally slain and dismembered... perhaps you have found Fastred's trail","Follow Fastred's trail outside of Snowbourn","The Butcher of Snowbourn","Black blood still pours from the neck of this recently beheaded Orc... Fastred must be nearby","Fastred can be found near Dagred's grave to the west and slightly north of Snowbourn.\
\
You should deliver Gísling's message to Fastred.","You have followed Fastred's trail of slaughter far into the Sutcrofts. He must be nearby.\
\
You should search for Fastred.","Find Fastred","Gísling has discovered where Fastred routinely hunts the Orcs of the Sutcrofts on his own."}},
[11843]={nameES="The Butchered Herd",objectivesES={"The Uch-lûth were greatly displeased by the gift of meat presented to them, for they suspect the Grey Company of slaughtering their herds.","This ox does indeed appear to have been slain by a great boar","Defeat the Black Sow of the Windfells","Defeated the Black Sow of the Windfells","The Black Sow wanders the wilds of the Windfells.\
\
Having determined that a great boar did indeed slay the oxen of the Uch-lûth, you should hunt down the Black Sow of the Windfells.","Alun is at Uch Cadlus in the Windfells of Enedwaith.\
\
You should return to Alun with news of your success.","The Butchered Herd","There may be dead oxen among the herds of the Uch-lûth at Uch Cadlus in the Windfells.\
\
Alun has asked you to examine the dead oxen among the herds of the Uch-lûth to determine what may have slain them.","Talk to Alun at Uch Cadlus"}},
[11844]={nameES="El Cairn de Honor",objectivesES={"El Cairn de Honor","Arzhur ha regresado a Aughaire. Debes llevarle la piedra que recuperaste y prepararte para el próximo desafío.","Obtén una piedra del Cairn de Honor","El Cairn de Honor está en el centro de Fasach-Falroid, al norte de Aughaire. Se encuentra en la cima de una alta colina, al oeste del camino norte, y de noche el sendero está iluminado por antorchas.\
\
Arzhur te ha pedido que obtengas una piedra del Cairn de Honor. No debes derramar sangre de los montañeses que patrullan la zona.","Evita matar a los montañeses","Tomas una piedra del Cairn de Honor","Otro desafío fue enviado al clan de Arzhur. Antes de aceptar el desafío, debe presentarse otro símbolo de honor.","Lleva la piedra del Cairn a Arzhur","Has matado a un montañés: ¡Misión fallida!"}},
[11845]={nameES="The Call of Cirith Ungol",objectivesES={"Talk to Halhir","Legolas has asked that you come to Cirith Ungol when you are able to assist him with some unfinished business.","Halhir can be found somewhere along the Morgul-road, somewhere to the west.\
\
You should find Halhir.","The Call of Cirith Ungol"}},
[11846]={nameES="The Call of Our Fathers",objectivesES={"The Call of Our Fathers","Frithgeir is at Zudrugund within Nár's Peak, north of the ruins, through the mountain pass.\
\
You should return to Frithgeir and present him with the rubbings of these pillars.","The ruins on the southern hills lie to the south of Nár's Peak, through the mountain pass.\
\
Frithgeir has asked you to seek out the ruined pillars among the ancient dwarf-ruins and take rubbings of the runes found upon them.","Talk to Frithgeir at Zudrugund","Among the ruins in the southern reaches of Thrór's Coomb, several pillars with rune-carvings still stand. The messages on the pillars may speak of lost knowledge and should be recovered."}},
[11847]={nameES="El Llamado del Mar",objectivesES={"Se han reportado desapariciones de marineros en las Islas Escudo del norte. Investiga las islas y descubre qué les está sucediendo a estos marineros.","Derrota a Sadâjah la Cruel","Investiga la isla","El Llamado del Mar"}},
[11848]={nameES="La llamada de la aventura",objectivesES={"La biblioteca de los Grandes Smials está en el pueblo de Alforzaburgo, al este de Cavada Grande.\
\
No habiéndole inspirado tu informe sobre la deliciosa comida a la venta en el mercado, Bingo piensa que quizá un libro de cocina le dé la inspiración que necesita.","La Casa de los Mathoms de Cavada Grande está en una colina al suroeste del agujero hobbit de Bingo Boffin.\
\
Bingo te ha pedido que lleves el mapa que cayó del libro de recetas de la biblioteca a la Casa de los Mathoms en Cavada Grande. No lo quiere.","Donnamira te sonríe y escribe tu nombre en un trozo de pergamino","Bingo Boffin está fuera de su agujero hobbit, al norte del mercado de Cavada Grande, al otro lado del Agujero Municipal.\
\
Has juzgado la calidad de algunos productos del mercado de Cavada Grande, y ahora debes informar a Bingo Boffin.","El mercado de Cavada grande está al sur del agujero hobbit de Bingo.\
\
Bingo Boffin ha decidido organizar una cena para sus vecinos para aliviar un poco su soledad, y quiere que eches un vistazo a la comida disponible en el mercado. Espera que eso le inspire para saber qué platos servir a sus invitados.","Las patatas estarían muy bien cocidas, en puré o estofadas","Bingo ha subido corriendo la colina a la Casa de los Mathoms a una velocidad de vértigo, y ahora está exhausto. ¿Que puede querer?","Lleva el libro de recetas a Bingo, en el exterior de su agujero hobbit","Bingo Boffin disfruta de una vida pacífica en su agujero hobbit en Cavada Grande, pero se siente solo y quiere más actividad para sus días.","Bingo está fuera de su agujero hobbit en Cavada Grande, justo al norte del Agujero Municipal.\
\
Has tomado prestado un buen libro de recetas de la biblioteca de los Grandes Smials y debes llevárselo a Bingo.","El pastel huele maravillosamente... pero pertenece a Hugo","Vuelve con Bingo y dale tu informe","Bingo te ha pedido que te reúnas con él de nuevo fuera de su agujero hobbit al noreste de la Casa de los Mathoms, al norte del Agujero Municipal.\
\
El mapa dibujado a mano que encontraste ha inspirado a Bingo, aunque no para organizar una cena. En vez de eso, ¡quiere irse de aventuras!","La selección de verduras luce apetitosa","Bingo recoge el mapa y lo mira con entusiasmo","La llamada de la aventura","Bingo ha subido corriendo la colina tras de ti, y parece exhausto","Viaja a la biblioteca de los Grandes Smials, en Alforzaburgo, y habla con la bibliotecaria","Las manzanas parecen casi maduras, firmes y deliciosas","Revisa uno de los libros de recetas que se encuentran detrás de Donnamira Tuk","Habla con Bingo en el camino que sube a la colina de la Casa de los Mathoms","Habla con Bingo Boffin fuera de su agujero hobbit","Donnamira Tuk, la bibliotecaria de los Grandes Smials, te ha recomendado un libro de recetas de la estantería que se encuentra detrás de ella.","Lleva el mapa al conservador Brombard Colazorro, en la Casa de los Mathoms"}},
[11849]={nameES="The Camps of Stazg Vozag",objectivesES={"Klúso has been sent to investigate the hobgoblin out-camp called Stazg Vozag.","Talk to Klúso","Klúso needs your help.","Complete 'Storming Stazg Vozag'","Complete 'Sentries from the Out-camp'","The Camps of Stazg Vozag","Find Klúso","Klúso is east of Out-camp Stazg Vozag, spying on the hobgoblins.\
\
You should find Klúso and help him however you can.","Complete 'Enemy Intelligence'","Complete 'Swords in the Shadows'","By order of Warlord Dushtalbúk,\
\
All raids on the Angmarim settlements are to cease immediately. The Frost-bound and the Cult of Drugoth are negotiating a deal. Anyone who has a problem with this should report to Loknashra at their own risk!","Find information about Loknashra","Klúso is east of Out-camp Stazg Vozag, spying on the hobgoblins."}},
[11850]={nameES="El Cabo de Belfalas",objectivesES={"El Cabo de Belfalas","Visit the Cathlond, the cape docks","Falastír, the friendly lighthouse keeper of the Cape of Belfalas, has agreed to show you around the coast.","This is certainly the largest house you have seen in quite some time","Esta casa es muy impresionante","Visit one of the standard sized houses on the Cape","The house is stately and large","Visit the Court of Anglind","Nothing better than being so close to the water","The view of Tolfalas is impressive","Visit one of the largest houses on the Cape","Falastír wants you to see the sites of the Cape of Belfalas.","Falastír is located at the lighthouse on the Cape of Belfalas.\
\
You should let Falastír know that you have toured the Cape as he suggested.","Visit the interior of Narvindon","The sounds and sights of the shore are refreshing","Take a boat to one of the islands off the coast","The old man is happy to know you have seen the sights","Habla con Falastír","You admire the craftsmanship of the lighthouse","Visit one of the smaller houses on the Cape"}},
[11851]={nameES="The Captain of Makham Mijann",objectivesES={"You have defeated Tabadam","Tabadam can be found at the corsair camp Makham Mijann.\
\
Find and confront Tabadam at Makham Mijann.","Speak with Bruidis in the village of Tadrent","Bruidis can be found in the village of Tadrent.\
\
You should report back to Bruidis and inform her of Tabadam's defeat.","Find and confront Tabadam at Makham Mijann","Now that Bruidis understands Captain Tabadam's plans, she has asked you to enter Makham Mijann, defeat him, and bring the camp to its knees.","The Captain of Makham Mijann"}},
[11852]={nameES="El capitán de Sâd Rechu",objectivesES={"Habla con Inufileg en Gwingris","Tudur derrotado","Inufileg está en Gwingris, al oeste de Sâd Rechu.\
\
Debes regresar a Gwingris y contarle a Inufileg sobre tu éxito.","Usa el cuerno de batalla para invocar a Tudur y derrotarlo","El cuerno de batalla está en el campamento al este del estanque en Sâd Rechu, al este de Gwingris.\
\
Inufileg te ha indicado que uses el cuerno de batalla de los dunlendinos para desafiar a su líder, Tudur.","El capitán de Sâd Rechu","Los dunlendinos han establecido un campamento maderero en la zona boscosa de Sâd Rechu, donde recolectan madera para uso de los lacayos de Saruman."}},
[11853]={nameES="The Captains of Madh-fushaum",objectivesES={}},
[11854]={nameES="The Captains of Mornaur Look-out",objectivesES={}},
[11855]={nameES="The Caravan to Snowbourn",objectivesES={"The Caravan to Snowbourn","Talk to Gísil","Pressured by foes from all sides, Gísil has prepared the crofters of Garsfeld to journey to the south and seek shelter within Snowbourn.","Gísling can be found in northern Snowbourn.\
\
You have successfully brought the crofters of Garsfeld to safety inside the walls of Snowbourn and should now speak to Gísling.","Gísil can be found inside the Mead Hall of Garsfeld.\
\
Gísil has ordered you and Gísling to escort the people of Garsfeld to safety in the south. He is waiting for you to make any final preparations.","Talk to Gísling"}},
[11856]={nameES="The Caretaker",objectivesES={}},
[11857]={nameES="El maullido del gato",objectivesES={"El maullido del gato","La guarida abandonada debería estar al norte del refugio del cazador, cerca de las piedras erguidas.\
\
Thrasi se lastimó la pierna al rescatar a un lince herido de los hendrevail y te pidió que recuperaras a los cachorros sobrevivientes.","Saca al cachorro de lince de su guarida","Saca al cachorro de lince de su guarida.\
\
Con los hendrevail derrotados, el cachorro de lince parece sentirse lo suficientemente seguro como para salir de su guarida.","Lleva al cachorro de lince a Thrasi","Busca en la antigua guarida de osos","Con palabras tranquilizadoras logras que el cachorro asustado salga de la seguridad de su guarida.","Thrasi, un cazador enano, rescató a una madre lince mientras cazaba osos. Fue atacado por una bandada de hendrevail y tuvo que dejar atrás a los cachorros de la madre.","Hay hendrevail por todo el bosque.\
\
Un cachorro de lince asustado se acurruca en una vieja guarida, demasiado asustado para aventurarse a salir a la luz. Debes derrotar a los hendrevail que merodean cerca para demostrar que no les quieres hacer daño.","Asomas la cabeza en la antigua guarida de osos y oyes el maullido lastimero de un cachorro de lince hambriento y asustado.\
\
El pobre tiene miedo de salir de la seguridad de la guarida, por temor a ser atacado por los hendrevail.","El cachorro de lince sale de su guarida","Thrasi está de regreso en el refugio del cazador, al sur de aquí.\
\
Recuperaste al cachorro de lince como Thrasi lo solicitó. Entrégaselo en el refugio del cazador."}},
[11858]={nameES="El Caldero de la Muerte",objectivesES={"Oflár cree que el Caldero de la Muerte se encuentra cerca del lago central de Imlad Balchorth.","Encuentra el Caldero de la Muerte.","Has derrotado al guardián del Caldero.","Derrota al guardián del Caldero.","El Caldero de la Muerte y su guardián se encuentran frente al lago central de Imlad Balchorth, al oeste de Myrkworth.\
\
Oflár te ha pedido que luches hasta el Caldero de la Muerte y destruyas a su guardián. Sugirió que reunieras aliados.","Oflár se encuentra en Myrkworth, al este del Caldero de la Muerte.\
\
Con el gigante de hierro destruido, el Caldero de la Muerte ha dejado de vomitar tumularios... al menos por ahora. Debes regresar y informar a Oflár de tu éxito.","El Caldero de la Muerte","Has encontrado el Caldero de la Muerte."}},
[11859]={nameES="The Cave, the Cage, the Key",objectivesES={"Igerna has been found alive, but injured and captive. Her freedom must be gained, but the door to her rusted metal cage sits firmly locked.","Talk to Igerna","Retrieve the key to Igerna's cage","Igerna has asked you to find the key to her cage. She suggests the overseers may be the ones to carry the keys.\
\
Goblin overseers can be found throughout the cave and in Krauzhaf, in Pinnath Gelin.","After battling through the halls of Krauzhaf, you recovered an iron key that looks like it will fit the lock on Igerna's cage door.\
\
You should unlock Igerna's cage, in the cave at Krauzhaf, in Pinnath Gelin.","Unlock Igerna's cage","You have unlocked Igerna's cave, and she is now waiting to speak with you.\
\
Igerna is in a cave in Krauzhaf, in northern Pinnath Gelin.","The Cave, the Cage, the Key","This goblin had the key!"}},
[11860]={nameES="The Chambers of Kidzul-kâlah",objectivesES={"Destroyed many shadow runes in Kidzul-kâlah's depths.","Shadow runes and torches can be found within Kidzul-kâlah's depths.\
\
You should destroy the shadow runes and torches that you find.","Shadows haunt the ruins of Kidzul-kâlah. The darkness has set in to even the old statues and obelisks that decorate the aqueducts of the dwarf-made water-house. The shadow must be purged from these old ruins if exploration is to continue.","The Chambers of Kidzul-kâlah","You have destroyed the mysterious shadow runes that plague Kidzul-kâlah's depths. In return you have made the interior of Kidzul-kâlah safer to explore. Varthmath will be pleased with your efforts.","Completado","Enter Kidzul-kâlah","Shadows haunt the ruins of Kidzul-kâlah and must be purged."}},
[11861]={nameES="La Campeona de Minas Agar",objectivesES={"La Campeona de Minas Agar","Informa a Lindir.","Lindir tradujo el texto que encontraste de la Lengua Negra al Oestron.","Invoca y derrota al Campeón de Minas Agar.","Lindir está en la Sala del Fuego en Rivendel, en el Bosque de los Trolls, muy al sur.\
\
Viajaste a Minas Agar y llamaste a su campeón. Tras una dura batalla, lo derrotaste. Deberías regresar con Lindir para informarle de tu victoria.","Minas Agar se alza en el lado occidental de Barad Gularan, al sur de Gath Forthnír.\
\
Debes viajar a Barad Gularan y lanzar un desafío a los Angmarin dentro de Minas Agar."}},
[11862]={nameES="El Campeón de Minas Angos",objectivesES={"Informa a Lindir.","Lindir está en la Sala del Fuego en Rivendel, en el Bosque de los Trolls, muy al sur.\
\
Viajaste a Minas Angos y llamaste a su campeón. Tras una dura batalla, lo derrotaste. Deberías regresar con Lindir para informarle de tu victoria.","Lindir tradujo el texto que encontraste de la Lengua Negra al Oestron.","El Campeón de Minas Angos","Invoca y derrota al Campeón de Minas Angos.","Minas Angos se alza en el lado occidental de Barad Gularan, al sur de Gath Forthnír.\
\
Debes viajar a Barad Gularan y lanzar un desafío a los Enanos Malvados dentro de Minas Angos."}},
[11863]={nameES="El Campeón de Minas Caul",objectivesES={"Informa a Lindir.","El Campeón de Minas Caul","Lindir tradujo el texto que encontraste de la Lengua Negra al Oestron.","Invoca y derrota al Campeón de Minas Caul.","Lindir está en la Sala del Fuego en Rivendel, en el Bosque de los Trolls, muy al sur.\
\
Viajaste a Minas Caul y llamaste a su campeón. Tras una dura batalla, lo derrotaste. Deberías regresar con Lindir para informarle de tu victoria.","Minas Caul se alza en el lado occidental de Barad Gularan, al sur de Gath Forthnír.\
\
Debes viajar a Barad Gularan y lanzar un desafío a los Orcos dentro de Minas Caul."}},
[11864]={nameES="El Campeón de Minas Maur",objectivesES={"Lindir está en la Sala del Fuego en Rivendel, en el Bosque de los Trolls, muy al sur.\
\
Viajaste a Minas Maur y llamaste a su campeón. Tras una dura batalla, lo derrotaste. Deberías regresar con Lindir para informarle de tu victoria.","Informa a Lindir.","Lindir tradujo el texto que encontraste de la Lengua Negra al Oestron.","Minas Maur se alza en el lado occidental de Barad Gularan, al sur de Gath Forthnír.\
\
Debes viajar a Barad Gularan y lanzar un desafío a los Trasgos dentro de Minas Maur.","Invoca y derrota al Campeón de Minas Maur.","El Campeón de Minas Maur"}},
[11865]={nameES="The Champions of the Wargs",objectivesES={"The Champions of the Wargs","Defeat the goblin courier","Valdi can be found in Amdân.\
\
You should talk to Valdi.","Defeat goblin-courier defender","Return to Valdi","Defeated goblin-courier defender","The goblin courier can be found on Gabilthurkhu, the Great-way, between Dursh Hûl and Kamaz-kala.\
\
Valdi has asked you to retrieve a missive from the goblin courier.","Defeated goblin courier","Recovered the champion missive","The enemy has been carefully watching the competition between the Wargs of Azanulbizar. The competition has narrowed down to two champions.","Recover the champion missive"}},
[11866]={nameES="The Chase Begins",objectivesES={"The Chase Begins","The Lower Ward is bustling with chatter. The trap is set. Rumours abound that Khâshap plans to defend his honour before finally making his way to his master.","Khâshap plans to confront the rumours head on by appearing before the Gut. Hadorion believes we should spring the trap now.\
\
Meet Hadorion outside the Stonecliff Market in the Gut.","Khâshap has gathered his cohorts to clear his name. He must be stopped here and now.","Talk to Hadorion at the Stonecliff Market entrance","Crash Khâshap's Assembly","Khâshap has fled into the alleys of the Gut under the protection of his Jephai Corsairs. Find Hadorion at the entrance of the Stonecliff Market to discuss our next move.","Talk to Hadorion outside the Stonecliff Market"}},
[11867]={nameES="La Carrera de Gallinas",objectivesES={"La Carrera de Gallinas","Cada año, los hobbits sueltan gallinas en el laberinto, y deben recogerse antes de que atraviesen los setos y se escapen hacia los campos.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro cuando finalice el festival actual.</rgb>","Ranúncula Nortuk está de pie frente a la entrada del laberinto en los Campos de Caballos.\
\
Deberías hablar con Ranúncula Nortuk y contarle todas las maravillosas cosas que lograste dentro del laberinto.","Cada hora, se sueltan gallinas dentro del laberinto de setos de Bree. Solo permanecen allí durante quince minutos de cada hora, ¡así que atrápalas mientras puedas!\
\
Debes recoger gallinas mientras corren alocadamente por el laberinto de setos.","Habla con Ranúncula Nortuk fuera del laberinto en los Campos de Caballos"}},
[11868]={nameES="Las elecciones del Maestro Samsagaz",objectivesES={}},
[11869]={nameES="El mejor corte",objectivesES={"Recoge la costilla del gran alce silvano de treinta puntas","Cenlieg se encuentra en Kauppa-kohta, al este de donde encontraste al alce macho.\
\
Deberías regresar con Cenlieg con la costilla de alce que hayas recogido.","El mejor corte","Cazaste el alce como te pidió Cenlieg, pero el amigo oso del sabio no quedó satisfecho con la carne que le diste.","Lleva la costilla del gran alce silvano de treinta puntas a Cenlieg","Has recogido la costilla del gran alce silvano de treinta puntas","El gran alce puede encontrarse al suroeste de Kauppa-kohta.\
\
Cenlieg te ha pedido que mates al gran alce y le lleves una de sus costillas."}},
[11870]={nameES="The Circle of Death",objectivesES={"The Circle of Death","Talk to Candúr in Barad Arthir","Candúr can be found in Barad Arthir.\
\
You have aided Prince Faramir and secured the Circle of Death in Minas Morgul.","Aid Prince Faramir in 'A Waxing Moon'","You should complete quests in the Circle of Death and aid Faramir in his plans.","While you worked to secure the Circle of Despair, Prince Faramir led a company of Rangers of Ithilien into the Circle of Death."}},
[11871]={nameES="El círculo de la desesperación",objectivesES={"Dornach can be found in the Circle of Despair outside Barad Arthir.\
\
Candúr has asked for your aid in securing the Circle of Despair and has sent you to join Dornach's company. You should talk to Dornach.","Candúr can be found in Barad Arthir in Minas Morgul.\
\
You should talk to Candúr.","Talk to Candúr in Barad Arthir","After gaining a foothold in Barad Arthir, Prince Faramir himself has arrived to lead the Rangers of Ithilien in securing the Circle of Despair and the Circle of Death.","You should aid Dornach in securing the Circle of Despair.","El círculo de la desesperación","Talk to Dornach in the Circle of Despair","Aid Dornach in securing the Circle of Despair"}},
[11872]={nameES="The Circle of Madness",objectivesES={"Candúr can be found in Barad Arthir in Minas Morgul.\
\
You should talk to Candúr.","You should complete quests in the Circle of Madness in Minas Morgul.","Talk to Candúr in Barad Arthir","The Circle of Madness","Standing upon the Circle of Madness, Rhadrog believes that the merrevail invasion must contested before it is safe to continue the infiltration of Minas Morgul.","Enter Barad Arthir, the Lofty Watch-fort","Rhadrog can be found in Barad Elenath in Minas Morgul.\
\
You should talk to Rhadrog.","Talk to Rhadrog in Barad Elenath","The entrance to Barad Arthir can be found in the Circle of Despair.\
\
You should enter the tower of Barad Arthir.","Complete 'Instance: Into the Circle of Despair'"}},
[11873]={nameES="The Circle of Sorrow",objectivesES={"The Circle of Sorrow","The entrance to Barad Elenath can be found in the Circle of Sorrow.\
\
You should enter the tower of Barad Elenath.","Enter Barad Elenath, the Star-gazers' Spire","Talk to Damrod in Barad Orhant","Damrod can be found in Barad Orhant in Minas Morgul.\
\
You should talk to Damrod.","You should complete quests in the Circle of Sorrow in Minas Morgul.","Complete 'Instance: Into the Circle of Madness'","Rhadrog can be found in Barad Elenath in Minas Morgul.\
\
You should talk to Rhadrog.","Talk to Rhadrog in Barad Elenath","Standing upon the Circle of Sorrow, Damrod believes that there is much to do in this cursed section of the city before it is safe for the Rangers to continue their infiltration of Minas Morgul."}},
[11874]={nameES="The Circle of Wrath",objectivesES={"Damrod can be found in Barad Orhant.\
\
You should talk to Damrod.","Complete 'Instance: Into the Circle of Sorrow'","Talk to Damrod in Barad Orhant","The Circle of Wrath is the lowest of the levels of Minas Morgul.\
\
You should complete quests in the Circle of Wrath.","Damrod can be found at the tower of Barad Angarth.\
\
You should talk to Damrod.","Enter Barad Orhant, the Tower of the Treegarth","Talk to Damrod in Barad Angarth","The Circle of Wrath","Damrod believes there is much to do in the Circle of Wrath before it is safe to continue infiltrating the Dead City.","The entrance to Barad Orhant can be found in the Circle of Wrath.\
\
You should enter the tower of Barad Orhant."}},
[11875]={nameES="La ciudad en el hielo",objectivesES={"La ciudad en el hielo","Viaja lejos hacia el noreste hasta encontrar Sûri-kylä, la Ciudad en el Hielo.","Fotri ha accedido a darte indicaciones para llegar a la famosa capital de los Lossoth, Sûri-kylä.","Habla con Lothrandir en Sûri-kylä"}},
[11876]={nameES="The City of Dol Amroth",objectivesES={"Here is a great old library, filled with ancient tomes and records of Gondor.","The Keep of the Swan-knights is in north Dol Amroth.\
\
You should make your way to the Keep of the Swan-knights.","The wharf is on the eastern side of Dol Amroth.\
\
You should make your way to the wharf.","Speak with someone in the Harper's Court","You have found the wharf of Dol Amroth","The Scholar's Quarter is in southern Dol Amroth.\
\
You should speak with someone in the Scholar's Quarter.","Inzibel's Walk is in north-east Dol Amroth.\
\
You should make your way to Inzibel's Walk.","You have found the Harper's Court","Speak with Laegened","Speak with someone in the Scholar's Quarter","The Court of the Fount is in the centre of Dol Amroth.\
\
You should speak with someone at the Court of the Fount.","You have found the Mason's Court","The Artisan's Quarter is in north Dol Amroth.\
\
You should make your way to the Artisan's Quarter.","Lothíriel is in the Great Hall of the Prince.\
\
You should speak with Lothíriel.","The Scholar's Quarter is in southern Dol Amroth.\
\
You should make your way to the Scholar's Quarter.","You have found the Scholar's Quarter","Speak with someone in the Court of the Fount","Speak with Anírwen","The Harper's Court is in western Dol Amroth.\
\
You should make your way to the Harper's Court.","You have come to the beautiful coastal city of Dol Amroth, and the gate-guard has suggested that you tour the sights.","Anírwen is at the wharf on the east side of Dol Amroth.\
\
You should speak with Anírwen.","The City of Dol Amroth","You have found the Court of the Fount","Find the Harper's Court","Speak with someone in the Artisan's Quarter","Speak with a swan-knight","You have found the Keep of the Swan-knights","The Harper's Court is in western Dol Amroth.\
\
You should speak with someone in the Harper's Court.","Find the Artisan's Quarter","The Mason's Court is in southern Dol Amroth.\
\
You should make your way to the Mason's Court.","Find the Scholar's Quarter","Find the wharf","The Court of the Fount is in the centre of Dol Amroth.\
\
You should make your way to the Court of the Fount.","Find Inzibel's Walk","Laegened, the master stone-mason, can be found in the Mason's Court.\
\
You should speak with Laegened.","Find the Library of Saphadzîr","Speak with Lothíriel","The Artisan's Quarter is in north-east Dol Amroth.\
\
You should speak with someone at the Artisan's Quarter.","The Keep of the Swan-knights is in north Dol Amroth.\
\
You should speak with one of the swan-knights.","You have found the Artisan's Quarter","Find the Keep of the Swan-knights","Find the Mason's Court","Find the Court of the Fount","You have come to a quiet and secluded part of the city, breathtakingly lovely","The Library of Saphadzîr is just south of the centre of Dol Amroth.\
\
You should make your way to the Library of Saphadzîr."}},
[11877]={nameES="La ciudad de sus padres",objectivesES={"La ciudad de sus padres","Elrond te ha hablado del viaje que Aragorn hizo a Annúminas en su juventud y te ha dado su aprobación para que Narsil sea reforjada.","Aragorn está en uno de los cuartos de invitados de la Casa de Elrond.\
\
El Maestro Elrond te ha hablado de la juventud de Aragorn y ha accedido a que Narsil sea reforjada. Ha decidido otorgar un nombre a la nueva espada: Andúril, la Llama del Oeste.","Habla con Aragorn en Rivendel."}},
[11878]={nameES="The City of Zajâna",objectivesES={"Entering the city of Zajâna is awe-inspiring. The weight of centuries dwells within her walls, and her people look to build a future free of tyranny. You are sure to become an ally.","Speak with Valakhâri in Zajâna","Your introduction to the quartermaster is complete. Return to Valakhâri and tell her you are ready to assist the city and her people.","Speak with Quartermaster Alahamâr at Zajâna","The City of Zajâna","You have spoken to Alahamâr","The leaders of Zajâna are not as welcoming as others may be. Too many times has an open hand quickly turned to a shackle. Valakhâri directed you to introduce yourself to the Alahamâr for further instruction."}},
[11879]={nameES="The City: Alone With His Thoughts",objectivesES={"Driftwood has likely wandered the surrounds outside the city. You should look for him and see how he is feeling.","Driftwood asked you to leave him alone with his thoughts for a time, and you should respect his wishes.","Leave Driftwood alone with his thoughts","Talk to Driftwood somewhere outside the city","The City: Alone With His Thoughts","Driftwood asked you to give him some time to think in peace."}},
[11880]={nameES="The City: An Ideal Nesting Place",objectivesES={"You understand that he wants you to find a good place for him to build a nest somewhere near the fruit trees to the south-east, by the farms, and to call him with the whistle when you have found one.","The nest looks perfect! But what does Gwallang think?","Gwallang the Limlinn flutters briefly out of sight and then returns with a small item clutched in one of his feet. He drops it on the ground and you pick it up. Surprisingly, it appears to be Leafshade's whistle, which you had not known the Limlinn had brought with him.\
\
He flies into the air and faces toward the distant fruit trees to the south-east, near the farms, and you understand that he wants you to find a good place for him to build a nest somewhere near those trees, and to call him with the whistle when you have found one. It will be a hike, because you cannot fly as the Limlinn does.","Help Gwallang construct his ideal nest","You take a generous fistful of grass and hay from the haystack","Gwallang descends from the sky and lands softly on a nearby rock","Stand by the lone tree to the south-east, by the farms, and blow the whistle","Collect a fistful of grass and hay from the haystack to the north-east","The haystack to the north-east might provide the materials Gwallang will need to construct his nest.","The City: An Ideal Nesting Place","Gwallang's potential nesting place is by the lone tree to the south-west of the haystack.","Talk to Gwallang by his new nest","Gwallang hops around excitedly, and you know he likes your choice of location for his nest. Now he needs a fistful of grass or hay with which to build it, if you can find such a thing nearby.","Gwallang the Limlinn has come a long way from his home, and now is the time for him to either make a nest or give up on the idea.","The fruit trees far to the south-east, by the farms outside the city, are of interest to Gwallang the Limlinn.","Gwallang flies in a grand circle around your head, chirping all the while. At last he lands safely in his nest and sings a trilling song, and you know that he enjoys the location and the smell of the sea-breeze. He seems very happy, but you imagine that his happiness is partially due to the knowledge that if the desire to explore the seas comes upon him again, he has ready access to any of the vessels docked in the City of the Corsairs, and any of them can take him on exciting adventures... should the mood strike him.\
\
Gwallang chirps happily at you, and you know you have made a friend for life.","Gwallang waits expectantly for you to construct his nest for him.","Talk to Gwallang by the tree he likes","Gwallang has arrived and hops around excitedly on a rock by the tree.","Gwallang seems very pleased with his new nest."}},
[11881]={nameES="The City: Elves, Dwarves, and Trouble",objectivesES={"The Harbour Warden's assistant nods to you as you approach","Talk to dock-workers in the Sail-haven about the Kindred of the Coins","Talk to Legolas across the bridge in the Sail-haven","Gimli and Legolas have begun their investigation into the Kindred of the Coins in the Sail-haven.","Talk to Legolas in the Sail-haven","The Harbour Warden's assistant is outside the tall blue tower located in the water south of the Sail-haven.","Talk to Gimli across the bridge in the Sail-haven","Gimli asked you to speak with nearby dock-workers about the Kindred of the Coins.","Legolas stands in an alley in the Sail-haven.","The office of the harbour warden is in the tall blue tower out in the water south of the Sail-haven.","Find the office of the Harbour Warden in the tall blue tower","The City: Elves, Dwarves, and Trouble","Gimli and Legolas stand across the bridge from the Harbour Warden's tower.","Talk to Eshmun's assistant outside the tall blue tower south of the Sail-haven"}},
[11882]={nameES="The City: Galengam's First Customer",objectivesES={"Talk to Azagath Sea-shadow at Galengam's market stall","Galengam's market stall is to the north, in the Sail-haven.","If Cruel Dancer kills him now, your plan to rescue Thorongil will be endangered!","That man was Azagath Sea-shadow, the leader of the Kindred of the Coins!","Talk to Galengam at his market stall","A richly-dressed man has commented on the notice you just posted.","Post notices for Galengam's market stall (0/3)","<rgb=#00FF00>Look</rgb> for Cruel Dancer in the vicinity of Galengam's market stall","Azagath said he would visit Galengam's market stall to the north. Is Cruel Dancer nearby? If she kills her target now, you might never see Thorongil again!","Galengam has asked you to put up notices for his new stall to the south, within the Sail-haven.","Galengam has wasted no time and is ready to open his market stall in Umbar Baharbêl.","There is no sign of Cruel Dancer... for what that is worth","Azagath Sea-shadow moves away and is lost in the crowd.","Post the notices for Galengam's market stall (2/3)","Posted notices for Galengam's market stall (2/3)","Posted notices for Galengam's market stall (1/3)","Galengam's market stall is in the Sail-haven.","Wait for Azagath to leave","Galengam does not know this is Azagath Sea-shadow","Post the notices for Galengam's market stall (1/3)","The City: Galengam's First Customer","A man standing nearby comments on the notice you just posted","Talk to the richly-dressed man staring at the notice you just posted"}},
[11883]={nameES="The City: Gangur Farwend Finds Answers",objectivesES={"The City: Gangur Farwend Finds Answers","Gangur Farwend is eager to speak with Carver Gírma at the Old Bastion Inn.","Find the Old Bastion Inn to the south-west of the Shoreward Stone, in the Fleet-fast","Gangur Farwend is frustrated to learn that the dwarf-quarter of the city, the Shoreward Stone, is shut to outsiders.","Wait to see what happens","Carver Gírma offered to speak with you and Gangur Farwend at the Old Bastion Inn to the south-west, in the Fleet-fast.","A nearby dwarf of the Temámir calls for your attention","Carver Gírma is at the Old Bastion Inn.","Talk to Gangur Farwend at the Old Bastion Inn","Talk to Carver Gírma at the Old Bastion Inn","Carver Gírma has called for your attention.","Gangur Farwend is feeling frustrated.","Talk to Carver Gírma outside the Shoreward Stone","Gangur Farwend is at the Old Bastion Inn."}},
[11884]={nameES="The City: Sigileth's Curiosity",objectivesES={"Talk to the Lower Ward resident outside the Cat's Grin Tavern about Khâsha","Sigileth wanted you to <rgb=#00FF00>listen</rgb> for mention of Khâsha to the north, outside the Black Anchor Tavern in the Lower Ward.","You think you have overheard the name \\qKhâsha\\q and should ask the Lower Ward resident for more information.","Sigileth is helping you investigate the mystery of Khâsha in the Lower Ward.","Sigileth wanted you to <rgb=#00FF00>listen</rgb> for mention of Khâsha further north, outside the Cat's Grin Tavern in the Lower Ward.","Talk to Khâsha in the Lower Ward","Sigileth has come with you to meet with Phêlex in the Lower Ward.","Talk to Sigileth in the Lower Ward","Talk to Phêlex by the Guild Hall in the Lower Ward","Khâsha lives in the Lower Ward, north-east of the Cat's Grin Tavern.","Did that woman just mention someone named Khâsha?","Phêlex is by the Guild Hall in the Lower Ward.","The City: Sigileth's Curiosity","Khâsha says you can find Phêlex by the Guild Hall and he will tell you... if you can be trusted","Someone named Khâsha lives to the north-east, in the Lower Ward.","You were told you might find Phêlex near the Guild Hall in the Lower Ward.","Find Phêlex outside the Guild Hall in the Lower Ward","<rgb=#00FF00>Listen</rgb> for mention of Khâsha further north, outside the Cat's Grin Tavern in the Lower Ward","<rgb=#00FF00>Listen</rgb> for mention of Khâsha to the north, outside the Black Anchor Tavern in the Lower Ward","Sigileth overheard someone mention the name \\qKhâsha.\\q Is it possible this could be the same Khâsha mentioned in the note you found in the Shield Isles?","Find the Khâsha who lives in the Lower Ward","You hear nothing specifically about anyone named Khâsha","Talk to Sigileth by the Guild Hall in the Lower Ward","You found Phêlex, the author of the note you recovered, and he is alive"}},
[11885]={nameES="The City: Sirgon's Wound",objectivesES={"Sirgon seems to ignore the nearby guards, and keep his eyes on Mêshka.","Mêshka waits for you outside her home, surrounded by guards","Mêshka stares at Sirgon for a long moment... and then motions for her guards to stand down.\
\
'We were all wounded on that night, Sirgon, and none of us knew how deeply. Your words ring true to me. I have spent years dwelling upon my hatred of you for the treatment suffered by Belondor at your hands, and at the hands of Gondor, and though that land is ruled now by a King and not a Steward, I believe in my heart that it would be no different if those events happened today and not long years ago. I did not forgive you then, and I do not forgive you now.'\
\
Mêshka shakes her head, and for the first time today you see her smile.\
\
'But men are weak, Sirgon. Know this: when the streets of Umbar Baharbêl filled with soldiers of Ordâkh and the Heirs of Castamir sailed with the Corsairs to Gondor, my husband Belondor weighed his hatred for Gondor against them... and he dispatched a ship for Pelargir, bearing a warning for you. I counselled against it, but it seems it did not matter, for the ship never arrived. No doubt it was sunk by the Heirs, and no warning ever came to you.\
\
'My first husband was a good man, slain by Ordâkh. My second husband, Belondor, helped to overthrow those who killed my first, and he established a new order in Umbar, the Kindred of the Coins, which will usher in an era of prosperity and peace. If he has any fault, it is that he forgives too readily, and is pleased to forget the sins of Gondor if it means Umbar will have a fresh beginning; this is not a fault that I share! Therefore I give you your life, Sirgon, but I banish you from the Upper Ward. If I see you return I will order my guards to slay you where you stand. Now begone. Our business here is done.'","Mêshka and Belondor live to the north-east, in the Upper Ward.","Mêshka stares at Sirgon coldly.","Mêshka hurries away.","You learned that Belondor's wife Mêshka was recently spotted on her way to one of the markets in the Upper Ward or the Sail-haven.","Talk to Mêshka at her home in the Upper Ward","Sirgon walks away, and does not look back","Sirgon has asked you to speak to residents of the Upper Ward so you may learn where Belondor now lives.","You learned that Belondor's wife Mêshka was recently spotted on her way south, perhaps to one of the markets of the Upper Ward or in the Sail-haven.","Talk to residents of the Upper Ward and learn where Belondor lives","Sirgon has been banished from the Upper Ward. You should speak with him to the south-west, in the Sail-haven.","Talk to Mêshka at one of the markets in the Upper Ward or in the Sail-haven","Wait for Sirgon to arrive","The City: Sirgon's Wound","Sirgon steps forward and Mêshka's eyes go cold","Talk to Mêshka at one of the markets in the Upper Ward or the Sail-haven","Mêshka goes inside her home, the conversation concluded","Sirgon stands outside the home of Mêshka and Belondor in the Upper Ward.","Wait for Mêshka to leave","Talk to Sirgon to the south-west, outside the Upper Ward","Mêshka and Belondor live in the north-eastern reaches of the Upper Ward.","Sirgon is reluctant to face his unpleasant history with Belondor of the Kindred, but he knows that he must.","Talk to Sirgon outside Mêshka's home in the Upper Ward","Meet with Mêshka at her home in the Upper Ward"}},
[11886]={nameES="The City: The Eyes of Nauriel",objectivesES={"Nauriel asked you to linger by the clay jar to the south-west so you can observe the movement of guards within the Fleet-fast.","Talk to Nauriel to the north-east, outside the Fleet-fast","Linger by the clay jar to the south-west, in the Fleet-fast","Nauriel asked you to linger by a clay jar so you can observe the movement of guards within the Fleet-fast.","Talk to the Fleet-fast guard","Linger by the clay jar further to the west","Nauriel asked you to linger at a clay jar further to the west so you can observe the movement of guards within the Fleet-fast.","Nauriel has asked you to learn the guard assignments within the Fleet-fast as she prepares a plan to gain access to the Citadel of Winds.","Nauriel waits for your report where you left her, to the north-east outside the Fleet-fast.","A guard of the Fleet-fast calls out to you","Observe the movement of guards within the Fleet-fast","Linger by a clay jar further to the west","Nauriel asked you to linger by a clay jar further to the west so you can observe the movement of guards within the Fleet-fast.","The City: The Eyes of Nauriel","A suspicious guard of the Fleet-fast has called you over to him."}},
[11887]={nameES="The City: The Short Straw",objectivesES={"Daxamat is outside the arena in the Tor-gardens, considering his friend's likely fate if he faces Rothog the Storm in battle.","The guard comes back outside","The Guard of the Gaol has gone inside to speak with Itûr.","The City: The Short Straw","The various match-ups for the arena can be found in the Tor-gardens.","You should see how bad things may be for Itûr by speaking to people familiar with the arena in the Tor-gardens.","Give Daxamat's money-purse to the Guard of the Gaol in the Fleet-fast","The guard goes inside","Only the guard outside the gaol in the Fleet-fast can save Itûr now.","Talk to Daxamat outside the arena in the Tor-gardens","Examine the arena match-ups in the Tor-gardens","The guard of the gaol has finally come back outside.","Daxamat stands outside the gaol in the Fleet-fast.","Daxamat has learned that his good friend Itûr, currently held in the gaol in the Fleet-fast, may have volunteered for something unwise.","Talk to Daxamat outside the gaol in the Fleet-fast","Wait for the guard to come back outside","A guard stands watch outside the gaol in the Fleet-fast.","Talk to the Guard of the Gaol in the Fleet-fast","Daxamat's friend Itûr is scheduled to battle Rothog the Storm in the arena","Daxamat hands you his money-purse and encourages you to hurry"}},
[11888]={nameES="The City: The Strategist and the Swan-knight",objectivesES={"Talk to Bruidis by the south-eastern gate in the Fleet-fast","Bruidis has asked you to <rgb=#00FF00>appraise</rgb> the defences of the barracks, and the eastern and western ends of the bridge that spans the Fleet-fast.","You appraise the number and quality of guards that patrol the western end of the Fleet-fast bridge","Talk to Rossaran in the Lower Ward","Bruidis is located by the south-eastern gate in the Fleet-fast.","You appraise the readiness of the guards stationed at the Fleet-fast barracks","Bruidis has taken on the responsibility for appraising the defences of the Fleet-fast, since her husband Rossaran's armour stands out too much for him to move about freely in this part of the city.","<rgb=#00FF00>Appraise</rgb> the eastern side of the Fleet-fast bridge","<rgb=#00FF00>Appraise</rgb> the barracks in the Fleet-fast","Rossaran is to the north of the Fleet-fast, in the Lower Ward.","You appraise the quality and number of guards that patrol the eastern end of the Fleet-fast bridge","The City: The Strategist and the Swan-knight","<rgb=#00FF00>Appraise</rgb> the western side of the Fleet-fast bridge"}},
[11889]={nameES="The City: Today's Endings",objectivesES={"Talk to Driftwood outside the arena in the Tor-gardens","Driftwood has asked to you meet you in the Tor-gardens.","Driftwood asked you to speak with visitors to the Tor-gardens about what the future might hold for such a man as he.","Talk to Driftwood in the Tor-gardens","You found Driftwood wandering through the Upper Ward, wrestling with himself about a personal matter.","The City: Today's Endings","Driftwood is by the arena in the Tor-gardens.","Meet up with Driftwood in the Tor-gardens"}},
[11890]={nameES="The City: Watched and Watchful",objectivesES={"Elladan and Elrohir were approached by a man in the Lower Ward who claimed to have information for them, but the brothers are not certain he can be trusted.","Talk to Elrohir by one of the farms to the east, outside the city","You have successfully defended the Elves from their attackers","The City: Watched and Watchful","Elladan is by the White Gate on the eastern side of the Lower Ward.","Talk to Elladan outside the White Gate on the eastern side of the Lower Ward","Talk to Elladan at the White Gate on the eastern side of the Lower Ward","Elladan and Elrohir agreed to meet you back outside the White Gate on the eastern side of the Lower Ward of the city.","Elladan and Elrohir have decided to investigate the man's information, meeting him beside one of the farms outside the city.","Talk to Elrohir outside the White Gate on the eastern side of the Lower Ward","You have failed to protect the Elves!"}},
[11891]={nameES="La purificación de Tharbad",objectivesES={"Los orcos han infestado las ruinas de la antigua ciudad de Tharbad. ¡Cadwallon Nevit, alcalde de Herne, no permitirá que continúe esta profanación!","La purificación de Tharbad","Deberías llevar las orejas de orco cortadas al alcalde Cadwallon Nevit.\
\
El alcalde Nevit ha vuelto a Herne, en el centro de Cardolan.","El alcalde Cadwallon Nevit te ha pedido que acabes con los orcos en las ruinas de Tharbad.\
\
Tharbad se encuentra en el sudoeste de Cardolan.","Lleva las orejas al alcalde Nevit"}},
[11892]={nameES="The Cleft Rumbles",objectivesES={"Garrun is encamped against a cliff face far to the west of Forthbrond, north of Cuvnerth.\
\
Ardwyn has asked you to seek out the scout Garrun at the western edge of the Isendale and lend him your aid.","The Cleft Rumbles","Talk to Garrun in the Isendale","Following the rout at Brôntrig, Ardwyn proposes shifting his forces' focus in the Isendale."}},
[11893]={nameES="The Climb",objectivesES={}},
[11894]={nameES="El Sendero Hendido",objectivesES={"Habla con Gil Plover fuera del laberinto en los Campos de Caballos","La salida del laberinto de setos está por aquí en algún lugar... ¿o no?\
\
Deberías intentar encontrar la salida antes de que se acabe el tiempo. Gil Plover salió en un instante comparado con el tiempo que te han dado.","Gil Plover está de pie cerca del laberinto de setos, que está muy cerca del recinto del festival de las Tierras de Bree, al norte de Bree.\
\
Deberías hablar con Gil Plover, para demostrarle que pudiste superar su reto y atravesar el laberinto en un tiempo admirable.","Has encontrado la salida","Encuentra la salida antes de que se acabe el tiempo","La entrada al laberinto de setos está cerca del recinto del festival en los Campos de Caballos, al norte de Bree.\
\
Gil Plover te ha retado a atravesar el laberinto, de principio a fin, antes de que se acabe el tiempo.","Gil Plover, el Maestro del Laberinto de Bree, te ha retado a atravesar el laberinto antes de que se acabe el tiempo. ¡No te demores dentro de los muros de setos!\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu bitácora de misiones cuando termine el festival actual. </rgb>","Se te ha acabado el tiempo","El Sendero Hendido","Entra al laberinto"}},
[11895]={nameES="The Clutch Collapses",objectivesES={"Frithgeir is at Zudrugund, north of the gwiber-nests. \
\
You should return to Frithgeir and inform him that you have destroyed many gwiber-eggs.","Talk to Frithgeir at Zudrugund","Gwiber-nests may be found to the south of Zudrugund.\
\
Frithgeir has asked you to hunt down nests of gwiber-eggs and destroy them.","The Clutch Collapses","In the valley below, in the eastern reaches of Thrór's Coomb, gwiber have begun building nests to swell their numbers."}},
[11896]={nameES="Los colores de los cristales",objectivesES={"Öndótt ha visto una luz extraña que proviene de un extremo lejano de la Vieja Ciudad del Cuerno de Plata y quiere que averigües de dónde viene.","Los colores de los cristales","Öndótt se encuentra en lo alto de la escalera de la Vieja Ciudad del Cuerno de Plata.\
\
Deberías volver a ver a Öndótt con los cristales que has conseguido.","La extraña luz provenía del extremo más alejado de la Vieja Ciudad del Cuerno de Plata, desde donde se encuentra Öndótt.\
\
Deberías encontrar el origen de esa extraña luz.","Lleva los cristales a Öndótt"}},
[11897]={nameES="The Coming Storm",objectivesES={"The Coming Storm","Norbald awaits at the north-west part of Enswith's farm.\
