[11900]={nameES="The Commander of Zudramdân",objectivesES={"The Commander of Zudramdân","Commander Mozgúth can be found at Zudramdân.\
\
You should find and defeat Commander Mozgúth.","You have successfully defeated Commander Mozgúth.","When conflict broke out, Zudramdân was the first hold to be lost to the Orkish forces of Gundabad.","Commander Mozgúth has been defeated","You have successfully defeated Commander Mozgúth. Those with the war effort will be pleased with what you have accomplished today.","Find and defeat Commander Mozgúth","Completado"}},
[11901]={nameES="The Common Enemy",objectivesES={"Eiricháv can be found in north west Câr Bronach.\
\
You should complete quests for the hillmen in Eiricháv.","Complete: 'Cave Growth' with Fuisach","Eiricháv can be found in north west Câr Bronach.\
\
