[11910]={nameES="The Cost of Corruption",objectivesES={"The Cost of Corruption","Defeat the Angmarim overseers","Brágha Fellwinder has gone to the tower of Caivád Sâr, in central Elderslade.\
\
You should defeat Brágha Fellwinder before she can pass on the knowledge of the crystals and the corruption her spells bring.","Brágha Fellwinder must be defeated before she can pass on her fell knowledge.","Borghild is in the Angmarim tower of Caivád Sâr in central Elderslade.\
\
Talk to Borghild.","Defeated the Angmarim overseers","Defeat Natmoz","Talk to Borghild","Defeated Brágha Fellwinder","Defeated Natmoz","Defeat Brágha Fellwinder"}},
[11911]={nameES="The Cost of Loyalty",objectivesES={"Talk to Doron","The Cost of Loyalty","After looking over the crude symbol you recovered from the brigands, Doron has decided to share how he and his men came to be cursed.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This instance quest is meant to be run Solo and cannot be run in a group.</rgb>","Doron is among his men on the Field of Celebrant.\
\
Doron wishes to tell you the tale of the Oatbreakers' curse.","Doron is among his men on the Field of Celebrant.\
\
You should speak with Doron regarding the tale he told you."}},
[11912]={nameES="The Costs of Mutiny",objectivesES={"The Costs of Mutiny","Disgusting harbour-filth and the bodies of Heirsworn traitors can be found in the waters of the Sail-haven.\
\
Eshmun has asked you to help cleanse the waters of the Sail-haven by clearing it of filth and the bodies of Heirsworn traitors.","In the aftermath of the Sea-stone Munity, the waters of the Sail-haven have been befouled by filth and the corpses of those found to still harbour loyalties to the Heirs of Castamir.","Talk to Eshmun at the Harbour-warden's Tower","Eshmun, Captain of the Haven, can be found at the Harbour-warden's Tower in the Sail-haven of Umbar Baharbêl.\
\
You have done a great deal to cleanse the waters of the Sail-haven. You should return to Eshmun."}},
[11913]={nameES="The Council of Gondor",objectivesES={"The Dome of the Sun is filled with the scattered notes of the recent meeting of the Council.\
\
Arodor asked if you would gather up the scattered papers within the Dome of the Sun.","Arodor is in the Dome of the Sun, writing resolutions recently decided by the Council of Gondor.","Talk to Arodor in the Dome of the Sun","Arodor is in the Dome of the Sun.","Talk to Parthadan, Warden of the Green, in the south-east section of the Sixth Circle","Bring scattered papers to Arodor in the Dome of the Sun","Deliver the resolution to Celephir in the Citadel","Wait for Arodor to finish writing the Council Resolutions","Parthadan, the Warden of the Green, can be found in the Sixth Circle of the city.\
\
Echadon asked you to find Parthadan once you finished delivering the Council resolutions throughout the city.","Arodor is in the Dome of the Sun, writing out the resolutions of the Council.","You have agreed to deliver resolutions of the Council to several leaders of the city throughout Minas Tirith:\
\
Torchún, the Warden of the Houses of Healing.\
Echadon, the Captain of the Garrison.\
Celephir, the Warden of the Coffers.\
Mirudil, the Warden of the Stores.","Deliver the resolution to Mirudil in the south-east section of the Fifth Circle","Arodor is in the Dome of the Sun.\
\
You have gathered up the scattered papers that remained behind after the meeting of the Council of Gondor, and should bring them to Arodor.","The Council of Gondor meets within the Dome of the Sun to decide matters of state. Their meetings have been more frequent of late as the situation in Gondor worsens.","The Council of Gondor meets inside the Dome of the Sun on the Sixth Circle of Minas Tirith.\
\
Othnar has invited you to enter the Dome of the Sun and lend your assistance to Arodor, chief scribe of the Council.","Bring the grim report to Thalhír in the north-east section of the Second Circle","Enter the Dome of the Sun, where the Council of Gondor holds its meetings","Arodor is in the Dome of the Sun, on the Sixth Circle of Minas Tirith.\
\
Thalhír asked you to deliver Parthadan's grim report to Arodor for filing.","Deliver the resolution to Torchún in the south-east section of the Sixth Circle","Arodor looks up from his work","A model of the White City stands in the centre of the room","Deliver the resolution to Echadon in the south section of the Second Circle","Bring the grim report to Arodor in the Dome of the Sun","Thalhír, the Warden of Laws, can be found in the Second Circle of the city.\
\
Parthadan gave you a grim report of the situation in the Pelennor to show to Thalhír.","The Council of Gondor"}},
[11914]={nameES="The Council of Herubrand",objectivesES={"Herubrand is in the cellar of the farmhouse near the farm fields of Woodhurst.\
\
Herubrand is gathering his advisors for a council meeting, at which you should be present.","The Council of Herubrand","Herubrand has decided to meet with his council to discuss what should be done in the aftermath of the attack on the mead hall of Woodhurst.","Herubrand is in the cellar of the farmhouse.\
\
The council meeting has ended, and Herubrand wishes to speak with you.","Talk to Herubrand"}},
[11915]={nameES="The Council of Stoke",objectivesES={"Ordlac and Grimmar are in the Mead Hall of Stoke. Baldmund is at the inn in Stoke. Dudsig is at the Oserley encampment outside the north-east gate of Stoke. Alfbert stands outside Reeve Fríthild's house.\
\
Fríthild has asked you to summon the leaders of Stoke to council and deliver a letter to Alfbert at her house.","Talk to Grimmar","Talk to Reeve Fríthild","Reeve Fríthild is in the Mead Hall of Stoke.\
\
You should return to Reeve Fríthild and let her know that all is ready for the council.","The leaders of Stoke are at odds as to the best course of action to be taken to protect the town and drive the enemy from the Broadacres.","The Council of Stoke","Deliver Reeve Fríthild's letter to Alfbert","Talk to Baldmund","Talk to Reeve Fríthild to join the Council of Stoke","Talk to Dudsig","Reeve Fríthild is in the Mead Hall of Stoke.\
\
You should speak with Reeve Fríthild regarding the course she has chosen.","The Council of Stoke has ended","DNT -- Will not be seen","Talk to Thane Ordlac"}},
[11916]={nameES="El Concilio del Norte",objectivesES={"El Concilio del Norte","Habla con Annábla de Gath Forthnír.","Arohir de Esteldín te ha pedido que busques el campamento oculto de Gath Forthnír, en el lejano norte, en algún lugar al este de las puertas de Carn Dûm, y que una vez allí hables con Annábla."}},
[11917]={nameES="Los Valientes Peones de Granja",objectivesES={"Wil Trigal está en la granja de Cal Sprigley, al sur de Archet, aguardando noticias de sus compañeros de trabajo y de su padre.\
\
Debes dar a Wil la noticia de que su padre y los otros peones fueron asesinados en su valiente persecución de los Montebruno.","Walt Trigal ha sido asesinado por los Montebruno","Bill Lanzaheno ha sido asesinado por los Montebruno","Busca a Walt Trigal","Busca a Thornton Bosquedal","Algunos valientes peones de granja ahuyentaron a los bandidos que atacaron la granja de Sprigley, pero aún no han regresado, y Wil Trigal teme lo peor.","Busca a Bill Lanzaheno","Esta misión no puede completarse fuera de la introducción.","Los Valientes Peones de Granja","Los peones de la granja de Cal Sprigley se dirigieron hacia el este tras unos bandidos Montebruno que atacaron.\
\
Debes buscar a los peones desaparecidos y traerlos de vuelta sanos y salvos a la granja para que Wil y Cal puedan aliviar sus temores.","Thornton Bosquedal ha sido asesinado por los Montebruno","Regresa con Wil Trigal con las trágicas noticias"}},
[11918]={nameES="The Court of Seregost -- Tier 1",objectivesES={"The Morroval Twins have been defeated!","Deep within Seregost, Lhaereth the Stained keeps her plague cauldrons. They contain a new, more virulent Great Plague, which she intends to release upon the realms of the Free Peoples. As you and the Rangers Faeron and Rhadrog are the few resistant to the plague, you must enter the Court of Seregost together and attempt to disrupt Lhaereth's plans.","Lhaereth's plans have been disrupted!","Disrupt Lhaereth the Stained","Dulgabêth has been defeated!","Disrupt Lhaereth's plans to distribute the Great Plague.","The Court of Seregost -- Tier 1","Defeat The Morroval Twins","Defeat Dulgabêth the Broken"}},
[11919]={nameES="The Court of Seregost -- Tier 2",objectivesES={"The Morroval Twins have been defeated!","Deep within Seregost, Lhaereth the Stained keeps her plague cauldrons. They contain a new, more virulent Great Plague, which she intends to release upon the realms of the Free Peoples. As you and the Rangers Faeron and Rhadrog are the few resistant to the plague, you must enter the Court of Seregost together and attempt to disrupt Lhaereth's plans.","Lhaereth's plans have been disrupted!","The Court of Seregost -- Tier 2","Disrupt Lhaereth the Stained","Dulgabêth has been defeated!","Disrupt Lhaereth's plans to distribute the Great Plague.","Defeat The Morroval Twins","Defeat Dulgabêth the Broken"}},
[11920]={nameES="The Court of Song",objectivesES={"You have defeated the vile Kargríp and provided a great service to the White Company. Their efforts to reclaim Minas Ithil are now ever closer thanks to you.","The vile Kargríp has taken Lírband, the Court of Song. If the White Company is to gain control over the city, this minion of Lhaereth the Stained must be removed quickly.","The vile Kargríp has taken Lírband and must be removed.","Defeat Kargríp","The Court of Song","Kargríp can be found at Lírband upon the Circle of Madness.\
\
You should defeat Kargríp.","Defeated Kargríp.","Defeated Kargríp","Completado"}},
[11921]={nameES="El arte del Enemigo",objectivesES={"Dos de las tribus de orcos de Angmar, los Blogmal y los Tarkrîp, están en conflicto por los derechos de minería en Bornabar.","Derrota a Zurm","Zurm ha sido derrotado","Derrota a Barz","Jónsi se encuentra en el campamento de Iorelen.\
\
Debes regresar a Jónsi y contarle tu victoria contra Barz y Zurm.","El arte del Enemigo","Barz ha sido derrotado","Barz y Zurm están en Bornabar, dentro del sello derrumbado bajo el campamento de Iorelen.\
\
Jónsi te ha pedido que entres en las minas de los Orcos y derrotes a los supervisores gorthorogs, Barz y Zurm."}},
[11922]={nameES="Los crebain de Caradhras",objectivesES={"Crebain, procedentes de las Tierras Brunas y al servicio de Saruman, espían los resquicios de la Puerta del Cuerno Rojo, poniendo en riesgo los esfuerzos de los Elfos en Eregion.","Los crebain se pueden encontrar al noreste de Echad Dúnann en la Puerta del Cuerno Rojo.\
\
Authlanc te ha pedido que derrotes a los Crebain en la Puerta del Cuerno Rojo.","Authlanc se encuentra en Echad Dúnann, al sureste de la Puerta del Cuerno Rojo.\
\
Debes regresar con Authlanc y contarle sobre tu éxito.","Habla con Authlanc en Echad Dúnann","Los crebain de Caradhras"}},
[11923]={nameES="La Sombra Reptante",objectivesES={"Puede haber señales del paso de la criatura en la orilla oriental. Deberías seguir buscando indicios de la criatura","Advierte a los habitantes de la cabaña del peligro cercano","Los habitantes de la cabaña parecen ilesos, pero deberían ser advertidos del peligro","La cabaña está en la orilla occidental del río.\
\
Deberías advertir a los habitantes de la cabaña del peligro cercano.","La cabaña está en la orilla occidental del río.\
\
Has encontrado huesos de pescado roídos. La criatura debe de estar cerca, así que quizá haya entrado en la cabaña en la orilla occidental.","Seguiste el rastro de la criatura que devoró al ciervo blanco a lo largo del río hasta perderlo. Puede que la criatura haya cruzado a la orilla oriental.","Sigue buscando indicios de la criatura","Algo ha roído toda la carne de estos huesos de pescado","Puede haber señales del paso de la criatura en la orilla oriental.\
\
Deberías seguir buscando indicios de la criatura.","La Sombra Reptante","Registra la cabaña en la orilla occidental en busca de señales de la criatura"}},
[11924]={nameES="The Creeping Wood: A Fear of Spiders",objectivesES={}},
[11925]={nameES="The Creeping Wood: Cocooned",objectivesES={}},
[11926]={nameES="The Crew: Brothers of the Queen",objectivesES={}},
[11927]={nameES="The Crew: Carver of Distant Stone",objectivesES={"The Crew: Carver of Distant Stone","Gangur Farwend stormed from Zarsatrâd after being embarrassed by the dwarves there. It looked to you as if he was heading in the direction of Erynos, but he likely wishes to stay away from people.","Gangur Farwend will be more likely to join your crew if you help him, so you agree","Gangur Farwend, the carver of distant stone, has joined your crew!","Gangur Farwend is at the outpost of Zarsatrâd, south of Furukzahar.","You have found Gangur Farwend at Zarsatrâd","Talk to Gangur Farwend north of Erynos, in King's Gondor East","The dwarves at Zarsatrâd agreed to tell Gangur Farwend something about the strange gemstone he saw at Furukzahar if he aided them by defeating beasts near the outpost, and you agreed to help.","Talk to Gangur Farwend in Zarsatrâd","Gangur grunts in recognition as you approach","Gangur storms off, leaving Zarsatrâd and hurrying to the south-east","Find Gangur Farwend at Zarsatrâd, to the south of Furukzahar","Find Gangur Farwend somewhere to the south-east of Zarsatrâd","Gangur Farwend is south-east of Zarsatrâd and north of Erynos, in King's Gondor East.","Kutúkh told you that Gangur Farwend mentioned stopping at the outpost of Zarsatrâd to the south before continuing his journey.","Caebar believes Gangur Farwend, the dwarf who warned you about Khôltekh the Cunning during your stay at Furukzahar, might be willing to join your crew."}},
[11928]={nameES="The Crew: Dweller of Tumbamálë",objectivesES={"Stand near the caged songbird and blow the whistle given to you by Leafshade","Talk to Leafshade in Tumbamálë","Gwallang is in Tumbamálë, and apparently wants to tell you something.","Is it possible the caged songbird in Sirgon's room of keepsakes could be Gwallang?","Gwallang trills a lovely song.","The Crew: Dweller of Tumbamálë","Find Leafshade's friend Gwallang the Limlinn","Gwallang the Limlinn, dweller of Tumbamálë, has joined your crew!","Talk to Sirgon in his room of keepsakes about the caged songbird","Gwallang jumps around, chirping and trilling. After several minutes of this, Leafshade rumbles in satisfaction and calls you over to him.","The caged songbird tilts his head and hops excitedly. Is this Gwallang?","The caged songbird at the far end of Sirgon's room of keepsakes may be Gwallang.","Leafshade thinks an old sailor might have sailed away with his friend Gwallang, a songbird of the Limlinn species. If you could find him, Leafshade's whistle will apparently remind the bird from where he came.","Sirgon is in his manor's room of keepsakes.","The songbird flies out of the cage, circles the room, and vanishes outside","Leafshade the Ent is in Tumbamálë, in south-western Anfalas.","Leafshade is in Tumbamálë.","Talk to Gwallang the Limlinn in Tumbamálë","Open the cage and free the songbird in Sirgon's room of keepsakes","The caged songbird certainly appeared to recognize the whistle. Sirgon has given you permission to open the cage and free the bird.","Caebar has an interest in learning more about Leafshade, and while the Ent is unlikely to join your crew, perhaps he will know of something that might be of use to you."}},
[11929]={nameES="The Crew: Knight of the Green Hills",objectivesES={"King Elessar suggested that you recruit the Lady Nauriel for the mission to Umbar.","Retrieve Nauriel's shield from the armoury in Ost Arndír","Carandolion ties a small handkerchief to the hilt of his wife's sword","Retrieved Nauriel's shield","The Crew: Knight of the Green Hills","Nauriel's sword and shield have been made ready for the voyage, and can be found on the lowest level of Ost Arndír.","Nauriel is in the main hall, on the upper level of Ost Arndír.","Nauriel's husband Carandolion is on the lowest level of Ost Arndír.","Talk to Carandolion on the lowest level of Ost Arndír","Nauriel, Knight of the Green Hills, has joined your crew!","Retrieve Nauriel's sword from the armoury in Ost Arndír","Bring her sword and shield to Nauriel in Ost Arndír","Retrieved Nauriel's sword"}},
[11930]={nameES="The Crew: She Who Remained",objectivesES={"Look for Sigileth somewhere on the road to the Dark Door, north of Morlad in King's Gondor West","Sigileth has come to the Blackroot Vale, in King's Gondor West, in search of her brother Corudan.","King Elessar suggested that you recruit Corudan's sister Sigileth for the mission to Umbar.","Wait for the newcomer to arrive","Sigileth is not here, but you have found a friendly face: the Swan-knight Rovalang","The Swan-knight Rovalang asked for your help making safe the Blackroot Vale in King's Gondor West.","The Crew: She Who Remained","If you really expect Sigileth to pass through the Paths of the Dead, you should look for her on the road to the Dark Door, north of Morlad in the Blackroot Vale, in King's Gondor West.","Someone approaches from the direction of the Dark Door.","The Elf-warrior Sigileth has answered your call","Sigileth of the Hidden Guard, she who remained, has joined your crew!","The Swan-knight Rovalang stands by the road to the Dark Door, in King's Gondor West.","Talk to Sigileth on the road to the Dark Door in the Blackroot Vale, in King's Gondor West","Talk to Rovalang by the road to the Dark Door in the Blackroot Vale, in King's Gondor West"}},
[11931]={nameES="The Crew: The Boon Companions",objectivesES={"Talk to Elestren in Melgobas","King Elessar suggested that you recruit Legolas and Gimli for the mission to Umbar.","Talk to Legolas in Melgobas","Elestren has a home in Melgobas and may know how to make a sea-sickness remedy for Gimli.","Bring the flowers and assorted beast parts to Elestren in Melgobas","Elestren has a home in Melgobas and is waiting for you to return to her with the flowers and beast parts she requested.","Legolas is outside the home of Elestren in Melgobas.","Langstrand wild-flowers can be found north of Melgobas, in the grass alongside the road. Crawlers, oxen, and crabs can be found outside the village.","The Crew: The Boon Companions","Legolas and Gimli, the boon companions, have joined your crew!"}},
[11932]={nameES="The Crew: The Corsair Jajax",objectivesES={"Prince Imrahil's scouts reported seeing Jajax near Abadec's Watch to the south-east of Dol Amroth, in King's Gondor West.","Talk to Daxamat outside Abadec's Watch, in King's Gondor West","Daxamat, one of the Corsair brothers, has joined your crew!","King Elessar suggested that you recruit the Corsair Jajax, if you think he can be trusted to help.","Daxamat stands outside Abadec's Watch, in King's Gondor West.","Talk to Jajax outside Abadec's Watch","Imrahil's scouts spoke true: Jajax stands outside Abadec's Watch","Daxamat is being held prisoner inside Abadec's Watch, in King's Gondor West.","Talk to Jajax outside Abadec's Watch, in King's Gondor West","Wait for Daxamat to escape","Find Jajax at Abadec's Watch, south-east of Dol Amroth, in King's Gondor West","You have freed Daxamat from his bonds.","Your rescue of Daxamat from Abadec's Watch will require you to defeat the Corsairs camped inside.","Free Daxamat inside Abadec's Watch","Jajax stands outside Abadec's Watch, in King's Gondor West.","The Crew: The Corsair Jajax"}},
[11933]={nameES="The Crew: The King's Own Merchant",objectivesES={"Talk to Bandron by the brazier in Calembel, in King's Gondor West","Galengam is inside his shop in Calembel, in King's Gondor West.","You burn Galengam's notices to ash in the brazier","Talk to Galengam inside his shop in Calembel, in King's Gondor West","The brazier by the southern entrance to Calembel, in King's Gondor West, will be an effective way to dispose of Galengam's notices.","The Crew: The King's Own Merchant","Galengam, the King's own merchant, has joined your crew!","Bandron, standing nearby, has attracted your attention.","Burn Galengam's notices in the brazier located near the southern entrance of Calembel, in King's Gondor West","Caebar believes the merchant Galengam might prove a useful member of the crew, if he can be convinced to join your cause.","Galengam's notices can be found throughout Calembel, in King's Gondor West."}},
[11934]={nameES="The Crew: The Sea-longing Lord",objectivesES={"Celebros and Faltharan are in Sirgon's manor, and will want to speak to you.","Talk to Faltharan in Sirgon's manor","King Elessar suggested that you recruit Sirgon, former Lord of Lebennin, for the mission to Umbar.","Pick up Sirgon's trunk in the southern dining room","Talk to Sirgon inside his room of keepsakes","Sirgon already packed his trunk, and he wants you to carry it to him from the southern dining room.","The Crew: The Sea-longing Lord","Sirgon is delighted you have brought him his trunk","Talk to Celebros in Sirgon's manor","Sirgon is inside his keepsake room in the northern part of his manor.","Sirgon, the sea-longing lord, has joined your crew!"}},
[11935]={nameES="The Crew: The Swan-knight",objectivesES={"The Swan-knight Rossaran is at Tadrent in King's Gondor West, preparing for the voyage.","Rossaran and Bruidis, the Swan-knight and the strategist, have joined your crew!","Talk to Rossaran north-east of Tadrent, in King's Gondor West","The Crew: The Swan-knight","Bring the Belfalas wild-flowers to Rossaran outside Makham Mijann, in King's Gondor West","The Swan-knight Rossaran is just outside the eastern entrance of Makham Mijann, in King's Gondor West.","Rossaran's wife Bruidis is at Tadrent, in King's Gondor West, and she will have the final word on whether her husband joins the crew of the Wave-hunter.","Talk to Rossaran at Tadrent, in King's Gondor West","The Swan-knight Rossaran left Tadrent heading north-east.","The Swan-knight Rossaran has (conditionally) joined your crew!","Wild-flowers grow in the camp of Makham Mijann, north of Tadrent, in King's Gondor West.","The Swan-knight Rossaran will be a good addition to the crew of the Wave-hunter, if his wife Bruidis can be convinced to permit it.","Talk to Bruidis at Tadrent, in King's Gondor West"}},
[11936]={nameES="La barca de la anciana",objectivesES={"The River-woman may be found along the banks of the river in the Mournshaws.\
\
You should return to the River-woman with the Cun Annun teeth that you have collected.","Talk to the old woman of the river in the Mournshaws","Bring the Cun Annun teeth to the River-woman in the Mournshaws","Tûm, a mystic of the Algraig clans known as a Derudh, told you of an old woman who plies the waters of the river. He believes this crone may know more about the spirits they call the Forest Lords than any other.","Cun Annun can be found throughout the Mournshaws.\
\
The River-woman has offered you passage along the river's length if you can bring her the teeth of the Cun Annun that haunt the forest in the Mournshaws.","La barca de la anciana","The old woman Tûm spoke of can occasionally be found along the banks of the river that passes through the Mournshaws.\
\
Tûm suggested you find the old woman who plies the river of the Mournshaws. It is possible that she knows something of the Forest Lords."}},
[11937]={nameES="The Crow-thief",objectivesES={"Myve, the child who seemed to covet the shiny toy, is somewhere in Galtrev.\
\
You should speak with Myve to see if she is hiding the shiny ball from its rightful owner.","Talk to Myve in Galtrev about the missing toy","Search Galtrev for someone with information about the toy ball","Someone who may have witnessed the pilfering of Envus's toy would likely be in Galtrev.\
\
You should look around and see if anyone saw someone make off with the shiny ball.","The Crow-thief","Find the crow that stole the child's toy ball","A child's toy ball seems to have gone missing, and a witness is positive it was stolen by a crow.","It would appear that a crow has flown off with the shiny ball","The crow that stole the ball was seen flying to the north-west.\
\
You should head north-west to try and recover Envus' favourite toy.","Myve had no interest in the toy, but perhaps someone else in Galtrev saw something"}},
[11938]={nameES="The Crows of Iáphel",objectivesES={"The bird seems to say, 'Drive me off, I care not. My belly is full. I have already won.'","Talk to Miruhir","The Crows of Iáphel","Pesky birds are feasting on wine grapes in Iáphel.","Miruhir has asked you to shoo away birds that are eating valuable wine grapes at his vineyard in Iáphel.\
\
Shoo away birds.","You are confident that birds cannot cry, but this bird sounds like it is crying","The bird swears vengeance with a sharp cry. 'You have won this day, but my revenge shall be terrible.'","The bird flies away, forlorn and distraught","You should tell Miruhir that you have shooed the birds away.\
\
Miruhir can be found in Iáphel.","The bird seems to say 'Curse you! I wasn't done eating!'"}},
[11939]={nameES="Las torres en ruinas de Caranost",objectivesES={"Torre este descubierta","Torre central descubierta","Torre sudoeste descubierta","Aunque ahora están en ruinas, las torres de Caranost alguna vez vigilaron la tierra a lo largo de kilómetros y kilómetros.","Las torres en ruinas de Caranost","Descubre las torres perdidas de Caranost","Descubre la torre este","Torre noroeste descubierta","Descubre la torre central","Descubre la torre sudoeste","Debes descubrir las torres en ruinas de Caranost.\
\
Caranost se encuentra en el oeste de Cardolan.","Descubre la torre noroeste","Hace mucho tiempo cayeron las torres de Caranost, pero su orgullosa vigilancia fue larga."}},
[11940]={nameES="Las salas en ruinas de Glynafon",objectivesES={"Llévale la piedra a Narnien","Las salas en ruinas de Glynafon","Los agujeros abandonados de Glynafon están en el este del Ángulo.\
\
Deberías explorar los agujeros abandonados y llevarle a Cedivor cualquier cosa de interés.","Narnien se encuentra en Gaerond, en el norte del Ángulo.\
\
Deberías decirle a Narnien que has encontrado un extraño artefacto.","Explora los agujeros abandonados","Cedivor Hedgerow, un renombrado historiador y experto en artefactos, busca protección mientras se adentra en las salas en ruinas de Glynafon.","Cedivor Hedgerow se encuentra a las afueras de Glynafon, en el este del Ángulo.\
\
Deberías llevarle la piedra a Cedivor.","Muéstrale la piedra a Cedivor"}},
[11941]={nameES="The Cryptic Note",objectivesES={}},
[11942]={nameES="The Crystal Journal",objectivesES={"Lost pages from the journal of an Angmarim sorceress are scattered across Elderslade.","Lost pages from the Crystal Journal can be found across Elderslade.\
\
You should look for more pages from the Crystal Journal.","Collect the third page","Collected the Crystal Journal's tenth page","Collect the second page","Collect the sixth page","Collected the Crystal Journal's seventh page","Collected the Crystal Journal's sixth page","Collected the Crystal Journal's ninth page","Collected the Crystal Journal's fifth page","Collect the tenth page","The Crystal Journal","Bring your findings to Mother Amma","Collect the fourth page","Collect the seventh page","Collect the new journal","Collect the fifth page","Collected the Crystal Journal's third page","From across the wasted lands of Elderslade you have gathered the missing pages of the Crystal Journal, as well as the sorceress' new records.\
\
Bring your findings to Mother Amma in the forge at Annâk-khurfu.","Collected the Crystal Journal's eighth page","Collect the first page","Collected the Crystal Journal's second page","Collected the Crystal Journal's first page","Collect the eighth page","Collect the ninth page","Collected the Crystal Journal's fourth page","Collected the new Crystal Journal"}},
[11943]={nameES="La Purga",objectivesES={"Derrota a los orcos Ghâsh-hai en Hurmulkezer","Has derrotado a varios orcos Ghâsh-hai en Hurmulkezer, debilitando sus fuerzas y asegurando que ya no representen una amenaza.","Los Ghâsh-hai de Hurmulkezer son bastante fuertes, lo que convierte a las Profundidades Llameantes en un lugar mortal para los enanos que han intentado recuperarlas.","Debes derrotar a los orcos Ghâsh-hai en Hurmulkezer para diezmar sus filas, ya que representan una amenaza mortal para los enanos de las Profundidades Llameantes.","La Purga","Los orcos Ghâsh-hai se encuentran en Hurmulkezer, al sur del Patio de Durin, en el extremo sureste de las Profundidades Llameantes.\
\
Debes derrotar a los orcos en Hurmulkezer.","Completado"}},
[11944]={nameES="The Cure",objectivesES={"Faeron and Rhadrog can be found in Viznak's hideout.\
\
You should give the disgusting concoction to both of the Rangers.","Viznak mentioned he had a mixing bowl in his hideout.\
\
You should mix the ingredients together in the mixing bowl.","Talk to Faeron","Rhadrog seems less tense almost immediately","Drink the disgusting concoction","The disgusting concoction has been created and awaits you in Viznak's hideout.\
\
You should bravely attempt to ingest the disgusting concoction.","Viznak has been rescued and decides to help you save Rhadrog. Gather ingredients from the wilds of Agarnaith and brew a concoction to counteract the virulent disease.","It is the worst thing you have ever tasted!","Talk to Viznak","Faeron can be found in Viznak's hideout.\
\
You should talk to Faeron about Viznak's proposition.","The Cure","Mix disgusting concoction in mixing bowl","The ingredients mush together into a thick, foul-smelling liquid","Viznak can be found in his hideout.\
\
You should talk to Viznak.","Help Rhadrog take the concoction","Viznak has provided a list of ingredients that can be found in the wilds of Agarnaith.\
\
Infected livers can be collected from gore-crows, wolves, boars, and rats. Infected insect guts can be collected from sickle-flies, nerbyg, and swarming flies. You should collect infected livers, plague mushrooms, swamp water, and infected insect guts."}},
[11945]={nameES="The Cure is Flame",objectivesES={"Return to Tálbiral in Laivárth","The Cure is Flame","Tálbiral has asked that you raze the ground surrounding Laivárth and any blighted saplings you encounter to prevent the spread from getting closer to the grove.","Tálbiral will want to know that you successfully removed the saplings and razed the ground again. Return to him in Laivárth."}},
[11946]={nameES="The Curse of Thikil-gundu",objectivesES={"In the minds of Durin's Folk, a terrible curse has fallen upon Thikil-gundu. Whatever truth there is to this curse, an unseen evil must command the Dead that now dwell within the halls of the Steel Keep.","Dwarf-wights can be found within Thikil-gundu.\
\
Nori has asked you to seek out","The Curse of Thikil-gundu","Return to Thikil-gundu and complete 'In Death's Grasp'","DNT"}},
[11947]={nameES="The Cursed Chest",objectivesES={}},
[11948]={nameES="The Cursed Hill",objectivesES={"Dol Acharn can be found in eastern Dagorlad.\
\
Faramir has asked you to approach the hill to confirm his suspicions about the Wainriders. You should scout the hill carefully.","Talk to Faramir near Dol Acharn","Faramir can be found due west of Dol Acharn in Dagorlad.\
\
You attempted to reach the hill-top of Dol Acharn but found your efforts repelled by an unseen force that sapped your will to press onward. You should return to Faramir and tell him of what you have experienced.","The Wainriders have claimed the hill of Dol Acharn, but they must be challenged if you are to stand between them and the Host of the West.","The Cursed Hill","<rgb=#FF0000>An unseen force saps your will to press forth and your morale begins to waver!</rgb>","Attempt to approach the hill-top of Dol Acharn"}},
[11949]={nameES="El Jinete Maldito, Azote de Mordor",objectivesES={"The Cursed Rider, defeated but enduring","Defeat the Cursed Rider in Mordor Besieged","Se movía rápidamente por el campo de batalla, persiguiendo a los guerreros que se atrevían a enfrentarse a él, cada vez menos a medida que avanzaba el asedio. Era el Jinete Maldito, y el sonido de su acercamiento convertía incluso la sangre más valiente en agua. En años posteriores comandaría ejércitos desde dentro de los muros de Dol Guldur, pero durante la Segunda Edad prefería luchar desde el lomo de su corcel negro, solo.","El Jinete Maldito, Azote de Mordor","The Great Alliance of Elves and Men stood in defiance of Sauron for long years of siege, but even their greatest heroes came to fear his deadliest servants. These were the Nazgûl, and their number was Nine.","The Cursed Rider suffered defeat on the battlefield of Mordor Besieged, but it was not to be a lasting death... not while Sauron endured. The Nazgûl would return, for his was an existence beyond ending.","The Cursed Rider has been defeated... for now","The Great Alliance of Elves and Men stood in defiance of Sauron for long years of siege, but even their bravest heroes came to fear his deadliest servants. These were the Nazgûl, and their number was Nine. They stalked the battlefield of Mordor Besieged, and were its most dangerous scourges.\
\
He moved at speed across the battlefield, running down the warriors who dared stand against him, fewer as the siege went on. He was the Cursed Rider, and the sound of his approach turned even courageous blood to water. In later years he would command armies from within the walls of Dol Guldur, but during the Second Age he preferred to fight from the back of his black steed, alone."}},
[11950]={nameES="The Cursed Stone",objectivesES={}},
[11951]={nameES="The Cursed Vale",objectivesES={"After aiding the villages of Alagrant and Sardol, you have uncovered dangerous new threats to Blackroot Vale that you must reveal to Malthellam and Rosfin.","Talk to Rosfin","Talk to Malthellam in Morlad","The Cursed Vale","Talk to Malthellam","Malthellam can be found in Morlad, outside his home.\
\
Malthellam has asked you to speak with him and Rosfin about what you encountered in Alagrant and Sardol.","DNT -- will not be seen","Malthellam can be found outside his home in Morlad in north-western Blackroot Vale.\
\
You have been urged to return to Malthellam by Gordir, who hopes that your experiences in Alagrant and Sardol will goad the Steward into taking action.","Lady Rosfin can be found outside Malthellam's home in Morlad.\
\
You have finished speaking with Lady Rosfin and Malthellam about the threats you encountered in the south, and should now speak to Rosfin."}},
[11952]={nameES="The Daily Feed",objectivesES={}},
[11953]={nameES="El Desafío",objectivesES={"Alla vitorea mientras te acercas.","Habla con Alla en el noreste de Musgovilla.","Alla te ha dado cinco minutos para llegar al lugar indicado al borde del Aguaestancada, al norte de Musgovilla.","Alla está junto a un pajar en el noreste de Musgovilla. ¡Solo tienes cinco minutos para el viaje de regreso!","El Desafío","Alla está junto a un pajar en el noreste de Musgovilla.","<rgb=#FF0000>No te quedes sin tiempo antes de llegar al lugar correcto</rgb>","Regresa con Alla en el noreste de Musgovilla sin quedarte sin tiempo.","Se te ha acabado el tiempo","Llega al lugar marcado en el borde del Aguaestancada sin quedarte sin tiempo.","Un niño de Musgovilla ha sido desafiado por el bravucón del pueblo a realizar una carrera peligrosa, y quiere asegurarse de que sea posible antes de intentarlo.","Este es el lugar que Alla describió. De manera extraña, hay aquí una canasta con un ovillo de hilo dentro."}},
[11954]={nameES="The Dark Apprentice",objectivesES={"Talk to Ianudirel","Defeat Mâb Rhûnadan","Destroy the corrupted altar","The altar remains undamaged as a cold air sweeps through the ruins...","The Dark Apprentice","The Cargûl, Mâb Rhûnadan, dwells among the ruins of Sâd Morangol, using a corrupt altar to summon fell spirits to Taur Morvith.","Mâb Rhûnadan and his altar may be found at Sâd Morangol.\
\
Ianudirel has asked you to destroy the altar of Mâb Rhûnadan or defeat the Cargûl himself.","Ianudirel is just south of the bridge at Krul Lugu.\
\
You should return to Ianudirel with news of your success.","Defeated Mâb Rhûnadan"}},
[11955]={nameES="The Dark Depths of Anglach",objectivesES={}},
[11956]={nameES="The Dark Lord's Blight",objectivesES={"Speak with Mílgamel","A workbench can be found at Henneth Annûn.\
\
You should bring the phials of poison to Henneth Annûn for study.","This grey goo is similar but contains bits of what appear to be a lichen in it","Mílgamel can be found at Henneth Annûn.\
\
You should take the poisons and what you have learned to her.","Mílgamel is concerned with a decaying corpse of one of the animals brought in from the wilds. She believes Cair Andros may hold the key.","Study the phials of viscous poison at Henneth Annûn","This grey goo is acidic and watered down","Study the phials of refined poison at Henneth Annûn","The Dark Lord's Blight","Phials of poison can be found on Uruks and Orcs in Cair Andros.\
\
You should collect phials of poison."}},
[11957]={nameES="The Darkened Pool",objectivesES={}},
[11958]={nameES="La oscuridad sobre Lebennin",objectivesES={"La oscuridad sobre Lebennin","Talk to the Night-jewel deckhand","Meet the Scourge at the peak of Barad Rill","Balakhôr and the Black Blade of Lebennin can be found atop Barad Rill.\
\
Daxamar is describing the meeting between one of the Nine and Balakhôr. You should listen to his tale.","Balakhôr can be found atop Barad Rill.\
\
Daxamat then went into Barad Rill to seek Balakhôr at the top.","The Night-jewel deckhand can be found on the shore of Barad Rill.\
\
Daxamat made landfall with his brethren at Barad Rill and then spoke to a deckhand.","After shattering the lighthouse at Barad Rill, Balakhôr the Scourge has called Daxamat to the peak to look upon the lands he intends to claim.","Balakhôr seems lost in thought as his gaze falls on Dor-en-Ernil, but he swiftly notices your presence.","Observe the meeting of the Black Blade and Balakhôr","The peak of Barad Rill can be found by climbing the stairs in the ruin.\
\
Daxamat searched Barad Rill for Balakhôr and climbed toward the top of the ruin.","Talk to Balakhôr the Scourge","The lighthouse of Barad Rill can be found at the centre of the small shoal off the southern coast of Dor-en-Ernil.\
\
The deckhand has directed Daxamat to enter the lighthouse and speak to the Scourge at his request.","Enter the lighthouse of Barad Rill"}},
[11959]={nameES="La oscuridad sobre Lebennin",objectivesES={"La oscuridad sobre Lebennin","Talk to Daxamat in Hata Kebir","After shattering the lighthouse at Barad Rill, Balakhôr the Scourge has called Daxamat to the peak to look upon the lands he intends to claim.","Daxamat can be found in the northernmost part of Hata Kebir in eastern Lebennin.\
\
Daxamat has finished telling the tale of his encounter with the Black Blade of Lebennin. You should speak to him.","Daxamat can be found in the northernmost part of Hata Kebir in eastern Lebennin.\
\
Daxamat has asked to share his account of an upsetting meeting he witnessed in Dor-en-Ernil. You should listen to his tale.","Listen to Daxamat's recounting of his journey through Dor-en-Ernil"}},
[11960]={nameES="The Darkness Remains",objectivesES={"Find where the Rhachló flows through Caras Tilion","When you listen, you can hear the sound of running water","The waters are still befouled","A strange pile of rust catches your eye","Caras Tilion can be found in the mountains on the southern border of Eryn Lasgalen.\
\
Search Caras Tilion for dark artifacts.","Caras Tilion can be found in the mountains on the southern border of Eryn Lasgalen.\
\
The Rhachló must flow through Caras Tilion.","Radagast has suggested that you should return to Caras Tilion, in the mountains on the southern border of Eryn Lasgalen.","Radagast believes that another source hidden in the ruins of Caras Tilion darkens the Rhachló.","Radagast can be found at the tree nursery just outside of Felegoth.\
\
You should return to Radagast and tell him all that you saw in Caras Tilion.","Could someone have gotten here before you?","Habla con Radagast","There is nothing inside the chest","Caras Tilion can be found in the mountains on the southern border of Eryn Lasgalen.\
\
Search Caras Tilion for anything from Dol Guldur that isn't broken.","Continue searching","The Darkness Remains","This artifact is broken","Return to Caras Tilion"}},
[11961]={nameES="The Darkness in Caras Tilion",objectivesES={"Explored the eastern overlook","Explored the southern overlook","The Darkness in Caras Tilion","Having explored and dealt with the shadows, you should reconvene with Oroniel in Caras Tilion.","Caras Tilion can be found in the mountains at the southern edge of Eryn Lasgalen.\
\
You should investigate Caras Tilion and defeat any of the darkness within its crumbled walls.","You should investigate Caras Tilion, which can be found in the mountains at the southern edge of Eryn Lasgalen.","You hear Oroniel shout your name from somewhere nearby!","Enter Caras Tilion","Explored the central courtyard","Explored the northern courtyard","Explore the eastern overlook","Reconvene with Oroniel","You should go quickly to Oroniel, where she called out for aid in Caras Tilion.","Explore the central courtyard","Explore the southern overlook","Oroniel suspects the growing corruption of the river Rhachló may come from the abandoned ruins of Caras Tilion.","Come to Oroniel's aid","Explore the northern courtyard","The ruins lie deep in shadow. Things move among the darkness."}},
[11962]={nameES="The Darkness of Númenor",objectivesES={"Talk to Harnion","Umbarrim sorcerers can be found in Corsair encampments in Tarlang's Crown.\
\
Gondren has asked you to defeat Umbarrim sorcerers to prevent them from bringing forth any more fell spirits in Tarlang's Crown.","The Darkness of Númenor","Harnion can be found along the road through Tarlang's Crown, to the north of Edhellond in Belfalas.\
\
You have defeated many Umbarrim sorcerers and stopped them from summoning more vile fell spirits into Gondor. You should now return to Harnion.","DNT -- will not be seen","Vile sorcerers of Umbar serve Azruthor tirelessly and seek to bring forth more fell spirits in Tarlang's Crown."}},
[11963]={nameES="The Daughters of Iphantemel",objectivesES={"Defeat Iárvereth","The Daughters of Iphantemel are lurking somewhere in Taurlingol.\
\
You should defeat Lhothbad, Iárvereth, and Saeriel.","Defeated Iárvereth","Legolas can be found on a hill near Taurlingol.\
\
You should talk to Legolas.","Iphantemel's own daughters hide in Taurlingol, attempting the retain control of the Mirkwood spiders.","Defeated Lhothbad","The Daughters of Iphantemel","Habla con Legolas.","Defeat Lhothbad","Defeat Saeriel","Defeated Saeriel"}},
[11964]={nameES="El día que vino el gigante",objectivesES={"Cyneberg hopes that the people from Dunfast will be able to recall what happened when Núrzum arrived, now that their survival is assured.","Gifemund can be found at the refugees' hideout in the Whitshaws.\
\
You should talk to Gifemund to find out more about the refugees' story.","Cyneberg is at the refugees' hideout south-west of Dunfast.\
\
You should speak with Cyneberg.","Speak with Cyneberg","El día que vino el gigante","Listen to Gifemund's tale"}},
[11965]={nameES="Los Días Venideros",objectivesES={"Langlas te ha dado un pergamino para llevar a Bregar en Duillond. Bregar reconoció el poema como el \\qLamento de Nimrodel\\q y se dio cuenta de que un pasaje del Lamento podría ser suficiente para convencer a Toronn de permanecer en la Tierra Media.","Toronn está en Celondim, al sur de Duillond.\
\
Bregar te ha pedido que lleves el pergamino a Toronn con la esperanza de que convenza a su hermano de quedarse.","Lleva el \\qLamento de Nimrodel\\q a Toronn en Celondim","Los Días Venideros"}},
[11966]={nameES="The Dead Descend",objectivesES={"Arvaethor can be found near a mountain pass in the north-western part of Ringló Vale.\
\
You should speak with Arvaethor.","Strange standing stones can be found north of the river Ringló.\
\
You should destroy any strange standing stones you find.","Arvaethor has asked you to destroy any mysterious stones found within Ringló Vale and then meet him near the newly discovered mountain encampment of the Dead.","Arvaethor can be found in the village of Ethring in Ringló Vale.\
\
You should speak with Arvaethor.","Speak with Arvaethor","The Dead Descend"}},
[11967]={nameES="Los muertos guardan sus secretos",objectivesES={"Busca en los alrededores de Adakûr cerca de las criptas de Esh-kimâkhi señales del cuarteto de viajeros.","Adâru-guzi deja escapar un rugido de desafío","Algunos viajeros han desaparecido después de aventurarse cerca de las criptas de Esh-kimâkhi. Se te ha encomendado investigar el área alrededor de las criptas en busca de señales de estos viajeros.","Derrota al espectro temible Adâru-guzi en Esh-kimâkhi.","Busca en los alrededores de Adakûr","Busca en las grandes tumbas de Esh-kimâkhi cualquier señal del último viajero","Busca en las grandes tumbas de Esh-kimâkhi cualquier señal del último viajero.","Derrota al espectro temible Adâru-guzi","Encuentras a tres viajeros muertos y escuchas el chillido de horrores de las criptas inquietos cerca de ti","Los muertos guardan sus secretos"}},
[11968]={nameES="The Dead Pool",objectivesES={}},
[11969]={nameES="El Pináculo De Los Caídos",objectivesES={"Lleva los fragmentos de piedra a Tobold Cortahoja","El Pináculo De Los Caídos se encuentra al sur de la entrada norte de las Quebradas de los Túmulos. Tobold Cortahoja te espera entre los Altos de las Quebradas de los Túmulos y el Bosque Viejo.\
\
Tobold Cortahoja quiere que recojas fragmentos de piedra con inscripciones rúnicas cerca de el Pináculo De Los Caídos y se los lleves.","Tobold Cortahoja, un anciano y acomodado residente de Bree, estaba interesado en aprender la historia de las Quebradas de los Túmulos y se unió a la expedición que se dirigía hacia allí.","El Pináculo De Los Caídos"}},
[11970]={nameES="The Dead That Linger",objectivesES={}},
[11971]={nameES="The Dead and the Living",objectivesES={"Egnir appears lost in thought.\
\
Perhaps it is best if you finish collecting the glimmering dust he mentioned.","Talk to Egnir","Uidor can be found in Morlad, in the Blackroot Vale.\
\
Sarnir informed you that Egnir intended to meet with Ludhír, another bowman of the Blackroot Vale. You should return to Uidor and learn where Ludhír might be found.","With a bitter gaze fixed upon the Ruthless Dead, Egnir barely acknowledges your approach","Ludhír can be found along the road to the north of Morlad that leads to Fennas Dûr, in the Blackroot Vale.\
\
Uidor informed you that Ludhír patrols the road leading to Fennas Dûr and the Paths of the Dead. You should seek out Ludhír and see if Egnir is with him.","Egnir can be found near Fennas Dûr, in the Blackroot Vale.\
\
You have found Egnir, but he seems almost entirely focused on the Ruthless Dead and there is an anger behind his eyes. You should talk to Egnir.","The Dead and the Living","Egnir appears lost in thought.","Find Egnir near Fennas Dûr","After learning that the wayward bowman, Egnir, passed through Alagrant, your search continues across the Blackroot Vale.","Talk to Ludhír","Egnir can be found near Fennas Dûr, in the Blackroot Vale.\
\
Ludhír informed you that Egnir has gone to Fennas Dûr to confront the Ruthless Dead. You should find Egnir and ask him to return to Morlad.","Glimmering dust can be collected from the Ruthless Dead near Fennas Dûr, in the Blackroot Vale.\
\
Egnir has asked you to collect glimmering dust from the Ruthless Dead.","Talk to Uidor","Deliver the glimmering dust to Egnir","Egnir can be found near Fennas Dûr, in the Blackroot Vale.\
\
You have collected a great deal of glimmering dust from the Ruthless Dead. You should deliver it to Egnir."}},
[11972]={nameES="The Dead of Dagorlad",objectivesES={}},
[11973]={nameES="El golpe más letal es el primero",objectivesES={"Brom Barbadehalcón ha oído decir que otro Luchador como tú fue visto viajando por las Tierras de Bree, rumbo al norte.","Lleva la carta a Hunward en el Muelle de los Comerciantes","El golpe más letal es el primero","Brom Barbadehalcón te escribió para pedirte que busques a un Luchador rohirrim llamado Hunward. Se vio a Hunward dirigiéndose hacia el Muelle de los Comerciantes, en el Bosque Salvaje."}},
[11974]={nameES="Las Camadas Letales",objectivesES={"Las Camadas Letales","Thoroniel cree que los Valles Trenzados están infestados por dos camadas distintas de arañas, y ha ideado un plan para enfrentarlas a ambas.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Esta misión está pensada para una comunidad completa.</rgb>","Dos camadas de arañas habitan los Valles Trenzados del Bosque de los Trolls Norte, al norte del campamento de Thoroniel.\
\
Thoroniel te ha pedido que recojas colmillos de las dos camadas distintas de arañas en el Bosque de los Trolls Norte."}},
[11975]={nameES="The Deadly Freeze",objectivesES={}},
[11976]={nameES="El Monte de los Muertos",objectivesES={"Un antiguo montículo, el Monte de los Muertos de Amon Firn, indica el lugar donde reyes y ejércitos lucharon, sangraron y perecieron. Ahora los muertos se han levantado y se han alzado en armas fantasmales de nuevo, Minetras tanto, un grupo de hombres con harapos han intentado acampar en la zona.","Calargyl te ha pedido que acabes con enemigos en Amon Firn.\
\
Amon Firn está en el noreste de Cardolan.","Vuelve con Calargyl","El Monte de los Muertos","Deberías decirle a Calargyl que has acabado con enemigos en Amon Firn.\
\
Calargyl está cerca de Amon Firn, en el este de Cardolan."}},
[11977]={nameES="The Death of Scatha",objectivesES={}},
[11978]={nameES="The Decimation of Maudhúl Grak",objectivesES={}},
[11979]={nameES="The Decimation of the Land",objectivesES={"Since the enemy breached the eastern Rammas, many Gondorian farms have been overtaken by foes. Ingold has noticed that some enemies have set up a small encampment upon the wreckage of Pel Forod.","Defeated Chulûr","Pel Forod can be found in the northern section of Pelennor Fields.\
\
You should defeat enemies gathered on the destroyed farmlands.","Speak with Ingold","Ingold can be found at the North-gate of the Rammas.\
\
You should speak with Ingold.","Defeat Chulûr","The Decimation of the Land"}},
[11980]={nameES="El pergamino descifrado",objectivesES={"Habla con Rhiangar","El pergamino descifrado","Melynis ha terminado de descifrar el pergamino antiguo que encontraste en la base de la estatua de Luilloth.","Melynis le ha dado el pergamino descifrado a Rhiangar, quien quiere hablar contigo.\
\
Rhiangar está en el círculo de caravanas, en el norte de Cardolan.","El pergamino es la prueba de la princesa regente Luilloth de Dol Ernil, y ensalza su carácter y sus hazañas.\
\
\\qPor aquel entonces, una niebla cubría la región, desde la que surgió una plaga de muertos vivientes que acabaron con todos. El más temido de todos era una figura espectral conocida como Hithrengor, el Miedo Gris, quien aterrorizó Dol Ernil. Luilloth llevó a su hijo pequeño Ostir a Fornost para su protección, mientras su marido, el príncipe Ostecthel, acababa con la fuente del mal.\
\
El príncipe Ostecthel se adentró en la niebla como un poderoso guerrero, solo para salir de ella tambaleándose como si hubiera envejecido décadas. Casi sin aire anunció que el mal había sido expulsado de estas tierras y la región estaba a salvo. Angustiada pero orgullosa, Luilloth volvió y sirvió como princesa regente hasta la mayoría de edad de Ostir. La gente la amaba, pues era bondadosa y gobernó sabiamente.\
\
¡Pero las palabras de Ostecthel estaban equivocadas! El gran mal no se había ido, pues volvió en el peor momento de Cardolan. Llamado para la defensa de Amon Sûl, el príncipe Ostir cabalgó al norte con muchos de los suyos. En su ausencia, el Miedo Gris volvió a atacar, y Ostir volvió para encontrarse Dol Ernil en ruinas, su gente masacrada y Luilloth desaparecida.\
\
\\qUna vez más, los muertos se alzaron y asolaron Cardolan, mientras Ostir y sus pocos caballeros se retiraron al norte. No se sabe dónde había estado Luilloth, pero las historias cuentan que cuando Ostir y su ejército no regresaron, ella fue en su ayuda. Solo encontró al perro fiel de su hijo ladrando en las Quebradas, y Luilloth supo que Ostir estaba muerto, pues Astoryn nunca abandonaría a su maestro.\
\
\\qLuilloth juró acabar con los tormentos que asolaron la tierra y a su familia. Ella y Astoryn fueron al norte en busca de consejo, siguiendo los rumores de un gran poder que moraba más allá de las lindes del bosque. Nunca fue vista de nuevo, pero los muertos desaparecieron en la niebla.\
\
\\qEl destino de la princesa Luilloth se desconoce, pero aquellos a quienes dejó atrás construyeron esta estatua en honor a su sacrificio.\\q","Rhiangar te ha sugerido que leas el pergamino descifrado, que está en el banco a su lado en la caravana al sur de Andrath. Deberías hablar con Rhiangar cuando lo hayas leído.","Rhiangar está esperando para hablar contigo en el círculo de caravanas, en el norte de Cardolan.","Lee el pergamino descifrado"}},
[11981]={nameES="Las Hazañas de Durin",objectivesES={"Las Hazañas de Durin","El señor Elrond cree que debe advertirse al enano Glóin sobre el mal que podría ocultarse en Helegrod, no muy al norte de su campamento en las Montañas Nubladas.","Glóin está en su campamento en las Montañas Nubladas, al norte de Rivendel.\
\
El señor Elrond te ha pedido que adviertas a Glóin de la amenaza que, según los rumores, crece dentro de los muros de Helegrod."}},
[11982]={nameES="The Deep Barrow",objectivesES={}},
[11983]={nameES="The Deep Dark",objectivesES={"The Deep Dark","The western entrance to Nimrond is located atop the mountain encampment of Dâr Matum.\
\
Enter the western side of the Nimrond caverns.","Arvaethor is nowhere to be found. Perhaps he already went further into the caves","Arvaethor has been captured by a band of ruthless dead and corrupt White Mountain Orcs","Search deeper into the caverns of Nimrond for Arvaethor","After taking the camp, Arvaethor has asked you to follow him into the maw of the mountain and stop the source of the monsters descending into the Vale.","Arvaethor is located somewhere in the caverns of Nimrond.\
\
Search deeper into the caverns of Nimrond for Arvaethor.","Enter Nimrond cavern"}},
[11984]={nameES="El Descenso Profundo espeera",objectivesES={"El Descenso Profundo espeera","Usa la cabra de Öndótt para viajar hacia el norte y hablar con Thettmárr","La cabra de Öndótt está junto a él en la Vieja Ciudad del Cuerno de Plata.\
\
Deberías usar la cabra para regresar rápidamente al Descenso Profundo y hablar con Thettmárr.","Ahora que has hecho todo lo posible por los enanos de las Vetas del Cuerno de Plata, Öndótt quiere que le digas a Thettmárr y a los enanos del Descenso Profundo que por fin se ha descubierto mithril."}},
[11985]={nameES="Los tambores de las profundidades",objectivesES={"Los tambores de las profundidades","Ossur se encuentra en la Guardia Orca.\
\
Ossur te ha pedido que lo ayudes contra los orcos y trolls de la Gran Escalera. Una vez que quede satisfecho, obtendrás parte del respeto necesario para ganarte su favor y cumplir con Avar y su tarea de vigilar la Gran Escalera.","Derrota a los orcos y trolls en la Gran Escalera","Habla con Ossur en la Guardia Orca","Completa la tarea relacionada con los adiestradores de trolls en la Gran Escalera","Ossur se encuentra en la Guardia Orca.\
\
Debes regresar con Ossur y decirle que has completado las tareas centradas en los trolls de Moria.","La Gran Escalera se alzaba antaño al pie de un gran cruce de caminos dentro de Moria. En el apogeo de la gran ciudad, conducía a todas las zonas de las salas y era una maravilla majestuosa de contemplar. Ahora ha quedado bajo el control de Igash, un lugarteniente de Mazog, el líder de los orcos de Moria. Igash ha reunido en un solo lugar a las fuerzas de orcos y trolls de Moria y ha recaudado tributos de cada uno para llevarlos algún día al líder de los orcos. Por ahora, cada tribu pugna por ganarse el favor del lugarteniente, un seguidor fanático de Mazog."}},
[11986]={nameES="The Deeping Wall",objectivesES={"Defend the Deeping Wall","Aragorn, Legolas, Gimli, Gamling and Eómer must survive","Saruman's army has come to Helm's Deep. The wall must be held lest the fortress fall.","The full weight of Saruman's army prepares to crash down upon the valiant defenders atop the ramparts of the Deeping Wall.\
\
