\
This quest starts with <rgb=#FFFF00>Full</rgb> Merit Rating.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Major Merit Loss:</rgb>\
- Commander defeated\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Moderate Merit Loss:</rgb>\
- Soldier defeated\
- Banner burned","The Deeping Wall"}},
[11987]={nameES="The Deeping Wall - Fellowship",objectivesES={"The dike has been overrun. Now, the full weight of Saruman's army prepares to crash down upon the valiant defenders upon the ramparts of the Deeping Wall. The wall must stand or the fortress will surely fall.","The Deeping Wall - Fellowship","Protect the Dike"}},
[11988]={nameES="The Deeping Wall - Raid",objectivesES={}},
[11989]={nameES="The Deeping Wall - Small Fellowship",objectivesES={"The dike has been overrun. Now, the full weight of Saruman's army prepares to crash down upon the valiant defenders upon the ramparts of the Deeping Wall. The wall must stand or the fortress will surely fall.","The Deeping Wall - Small Fellowship","Protect the Dike"}},
[11990]={nameES="El Valle del Bajo",objectivesES={"El Valle del Bajo","Saruman's sorcery destroyed the Deeping Wall and has driven the disorganized, retreating Rohirrim into the Deeping-coomb.\
\
Merit Rating\
\
This quest starts with <rgb=#FFFF00>Full</rgb> Merit Rating.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Major Merit Loss:</rgb>\
- Commander defeated\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Moderate Merit Loss:</rgb>\
- Soldier defeated\
- Banner burned","Aragorn, Eómer, Gamling, Gimli, and Legolas must survive","Hold the Deeping-coomb while the Rohirrim retreat into the Hornburg and Glittering Caves"}},
[11991]={nameES="The Deeping-coomb - Raid",objectivesES={"The Deeping-coomb - Raid","Saruman's foul sorcery has destroyed the Deeping Wall and driven the Rohirrim into the Deeping-comb. The retreat to the Glittering Caves and the Hornburg must be secured if there is to be any hope.","Protect the Dike"}},
[11992]={nameES="The Deeping-coomb - Small Fellowship",objectivesES={"Saruman's foul sorcery has destroyed the Deeping Wall and driven the Rohirrim into the Deeping-comb. The retreat to the Glittering Caves and the Hornburg must be secured if there is to be any hope.","The Deeping-coomb - Small Fellowship","Protect the Dike"}},
[11993]={nameES="The Defence of Arnach",objectivesES={}},
[11994]={nameES="The Defence of Faldham",objectivesES={}},
[11995]={nameES="The Defence of Fanuidhol",objectivesES={"Habla con Bahanneth en Talan Fanuidhol","The Defence of Fanuidhol","You have been acknowledged as a friend of Lothlórien through your efforts on behalf of the Elves.","Bahanneth is at Talan Fanuidhol to the north.\
\
You have been instructed to speak with Bahanneth, who will tell you how best you might aid the defenders there in thwarting the Orcs that foray out of Moria."}},
[11996]={nameES="La defensa de Galtrev",objectivesES={"La defensa de Galtrev","Scouts report that forces of the White Hand have been seen marching on Galtrev, surely as an act of revenge for what was done to the Overseers of Galtrev.","Talk to Bron to defend Galtrev","Bron is at Galtrev.\
\
Talk to Bron to defend Galtrev.","Bron is in Galtrev at the milestone marker in the centre of town.\
\
You should speak with Bron to collect your reward for assisting in the defence of Galtrev.","Talk to Bron in Galtrev"}},
[11997]={nameES="The Defence of Hammerstead",objectivesES={"The sight of Náin the Slakeless shakes Tuhâl to his core","Grámi Hornhelm can be found in Hammerstead.\
\
You should talk to Grámi Hornhelm.","Help Grámi Hornhelm with 'Weapon Repossession'","Bring Tuhâl before Lord Náin","Lord Náin needs to know about the Jangovar threat.\
\
You should bring Tuhâl before Lord Náin in Járnfast.","Talk to Tuhâl","Help Lóssi with 'The Head of the Snake'","Grámi Hornhelm can be found in Olin's Forge, in Hammerstead.\
\
You should talk to Grámi Hornhelm.","Help Lóssi with 'Withstanding the Marauders'","Tuhâl is preparing to stand before Lord Náin and speak his piece.\
\
You should talk to Tuhâl.","Return to Járnfast with Tuhâl","You tell Lóssi that the convoy was destroyed and the weapons stolen. Only Vílur Strayfoot survived.\
\
'Curse these Easterlings! There is not time to grieve. Go up the road to Olin's Forge and speak with the Master Smith, Grámi Hornhelm. We can hold them off for now.'","Talk to Grámi Hornhelm","You tell Grámi all that the Easterling has said. \
\
'Just as I thought; they are arming themselves for another attack. Return to Járnfast with haste and inform Lord Náin! And take that prisoner with you. The last thing I need is some useless oaf taking up space!'","Help Lóssi with 'Relieving the Guard'","There is work to do in defence of Hammerstead.\
\
You should complete quests in Hammerstead.","Tuhâl looks wonderstruck at the sight of Járnfast","An Easterling is being held prisoner in Hammerstead.\
\
You should talk to the Easterling prisoner.","Talk to the Easterling prisoner","You should talk to Grámi Hornhelm, who can be found in Hammerstead.","The Defence of Hammerstead","Lord Náin needs to know about the Jangovar threat.\
\
You should return to Járnfast with Tuhâl.","Hammerstead, a small community of miners and smiths in the Ironfold, is under attack. Help the dwarves defend it from the Jangovar!"}},
[11998]={nameES="La defensa de la Casa Brumbar",objectivesES={"Naethmunn está en el campamento de montaraces de Tinnudir, en Evendim, al suroeste de la Casa Brumbar.\
\
Has defendido la Casa Brumbar del grupo de boggarts que lo amenazaba y ahora deberías volver a Naethmunn con el relato de tu éxito.","Habla con Pantescal","Naethmunn te ha pedido que ayudes al montaraz Pantescal, defendiendo las ruinas de la Casa Brumbar en Parth Aduial.","Los vestigios de la casa Brumbar están en Parth Aduial, al noreste de Tinnudir. Naethmunn te ha pedido que cruces el puente hacia tierra firme y sigas la línea de la costa hacia el norte hasta que veas algunos del os muros que quedan de la Casa Brumbar.\
\
Naethmunn te ha pedido que ayudes a Pantescal, quien está actualmente planeando la defensa de un punto importante de los Dúnedain contra una horda de boggarts.","Has defendido con éxito la Casa Brumbar de los boggarts","La defensa de la Casa Brumbar"}},
[11999]={nameES="La defensa de Minas Tirith",objectivesES={"<rgb=#FF0000>Duilin has fallen!</rgb>","<rgb=#FF0000>Golasgil has fallen!</rgb>","<rgb=#FF0000>Imrahil and the Lords of Gondor must survive the battle</rgb>","The War for Gondor begins as the hosts of Minas Morgul and Mordor make for Minas Tirith.\
\
Merit Rating\
\
This quest starts with <rgb=#FFFF00>empty</rgb> Merit Rating.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Gain Merit from:</rgb>\
- Keep soldiers of Gondor alive\
- Defend supplies and armaments\
- Protect siege weapons and barricades\
- Topple the Enemy's siege towers\
- Defeat the Enemy's mightiest servants","<rgb=#FF0000>Forlong has fallen!</rgb>","The Enemy has begun the siege of Minas Tirith. You must hold against the Enemy's forces.","<rgb=#FF0000>Prince Imrahil has fallen!</rgb>","The battle is not over. You should await Mithrandir and Imrahil's command.","La defensa de Minas Tirith","<rgb=#FF0000>Parthadan has fallen!</rgb>","<rgb=#FF0000>Hirluin has fallen!</rgb>","Defend the walls of Minas Tirith from the Enemy","<rgb=#FF0000>Ingold has fallen!</rgb>","<rgb=#FF0000>Húrin has fallen!</rgb>","Talk to Mithrandir when you are ready to begin","<rgb=#FF0000>Duinhir has fallen!</rgb>","<rgb=#FF0000>Derufin has fallen!</rgb>","<rgb=#FF0000>Dervorin has fallen!</rgb>","<rgb=#FF0000>Echadon has fallen!</rgb>","Mithrandir is standing near the baths of Minas Tirith.\
\
The Enemy has begun the siege of Minas Tirith. You should speak to Mithrandir before the battle begins."}},
[12000]={nameES="La defensa de Minas Tirith",objectivesES={"The Enemy has begun the siege of Minas Tirith. You must hold against the Enemy's forces.","Defend the walls of Minas Tirith from the Enemy","The War for Gondor begins as the hosts of Minas Morgul and Mordor make for Minas Tirith.\
\
Merit Rating\
\
This quest starts with <rgb=#FFFF00>empty</rgb> Merit Rating.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Gain Merit from:</rgb>\
- Keep soldiers of Gondor alive\
- Defend supplies and armaments\
- Protect siege weapons and barricades\
- Topple the Enemy's siege towers\
- Defeat the Enemy's mightiest servants","Mithrandir is standing near the baths of Minas Tirith.\
\
The Enemy has begun the siege of Minas Tirith. You should speak to Mithrandir before the battle begins.","Talk to Mithrandir when you are ready to begin","The battle is not over. You should await Mithrandir and Imrahil's command.","La defensa de Minas Tirith"}},
[12001]={nameES="The Defence of Trestlebridge -- Redux",objectivesES={"Habla con Halbarad","Halbarad is at Esteldín in the North Downs.\
\
Handarod has asked you to speak with Halbarad and lend him your aid in defending Trestlebridge. The townsfolk will not be able to defend against the Orcs alone. Handarod suggested that you take allies with you.","The Defence of Trestlebridge -- Redux","Habla con Nellie Bosquejo","Handaron has told you that Halbarad requires the aid of a band of warriors to help bolster the defence of Trestlebridge against an assault by the Orcs.","Nellie Bosquejo se encuentra en Puente de Caballetes.\
\
Junto a Halbarad, ayudaste a defender Trestlebridge de los orcos que intentaban destruirla. Al final de la batalla, Nellie Bosquejo pidió hablar contigo."}},
[12002]={nameES="El Defensor de los Pueblos Libres: Echando una mano",objectivesES={"Las Excavaciones Tenebrosas se encuentran en la zona sureste de las Fundaciones de Piedra.\
\
Ingthor te ha pedido que ayudes a otro Guardián a completar su tarea final en las Excavaciones Tenebrosas.","Ingthor se encuentra justo afuera de las Excavaciones Tenebrosas.\
\
Con Brillanoche derrotado, deberías regresar con Ingthor con noticias de tu éxito.","Derrota a Brillanoche","El Defensor de los Pueblos Libres: Echando una mano","Brillanoche ha sido derrotado","Muchos Guardianes desean convertirse en Defensores de los Pueblos Libres, pero no todos pueden alcanzar sus objetivos solos.","Regresa con Ingthor"}},
[12003]={nameES="The Defiler",objectivesES={"The Defiler","Frithstan is waiting at his camp along the road west of Stangard.\
\
Frithstan awaits news of your attack against the Defiler, Dushatár.","Defeated Dushatár the Defiler","Return to Frithstan at his camp","Dushatár dwells in the depths of the Mor-hai cave to the north-west.\
\
Frithstan has asked you to gather allies in order to put an end to Dushatár and his schemes of brewing deadly poisons.","Defeat Dushatár the Defiler","The Mor-hai defiler, Dushatár, is brewing poison made from spider's venom to be used against the Men of Stangard."}},
[12004]={nameES="El profanador de Puente de Caballetes",objectivesES={"El profanador Tarkrîp está en Nan Wathren al sur de las Quebradas del Norte.\
\
Debes derrotar al profanador Tarkrîp, ya que pociones han sido usadas para provocar el desastre en Puente de Caballetes.","El puesto de destilación del profanador se encuentra en Nan Wathren, en lo más profundo de una garganta inundada.\
\
Debes destruir el puesto de destilación del profanador.","Destruye el puesto de destilación","Encuentra y derrota al profanador Tarkrîp","En algún lugar de Nan Wathren hay un fabricante de pociones enemigo, mortífero en su oficio.\
\
Debes buscar y encontrar al profanador Tarkrîp.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Se recomienda una Compañía.</rgb>","Has derrotado al profanador responsable de fabricar el somnífero que condujo a la catástrofe en Puente de Caballetes.","Has destruido el puesto de destilación utilizado por el profanador Tarkrîp","Completado","El profanador Tarkrîp está en Nan Wathren al sur de las Quebradas del Norte.\
\
Debes derrotar al profanador Tarkrîp, ya que pociones han sido usadas para provocar el desastre en Puente de Caballetes.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Se recomienda una Compañía.</rgb>","En algún lugar de Nan Wathren hay un fabricante de pociones enemigo, mortífero en su oficio.","Has derrotado al profanador Tarkrîp","El profanador de Puente de Caballetes"}},
[12005]={nameES="Las minas: Destrucción de suministros",objectivesES={"Los enemigos de los Pueblos Libres están almacenando suministros en las entradas de las Mina Este y occidental del Bosque Salvaje. Destruir estos suministros debería debilitar a los enemigos de esta zona.","Las cajas de suministros se encuentran en las Mina Este y occidental del Bosque Salvaje.\
\
Debes destruir las cajas de suministros de las Mina Este y occidental.","Destruye cajas de suministros en la Mina Este y en la mina occidental","Las minas: Destrucción de suministros","Los suministros que se encuentran en las Mina Este y occidental deben destruirse para debilitar a tus enemigos en el Bosque Salvaje."}},
[12006]={nameES="Las minas: Enemigos de los Pueblos Libres",objectivesES={"Encontrarás enemigos en la Mina Este y en la mina occidental del Bosque Salvaje.\
\
Debes derrotar a los enemigos de la Mina Este y de la mina occidental.","Acaba con enemigos en la Mina Este y en la mina occidental","Las minas: Enemigos de los Pueblos Libres","Los enemigos de los Pueblos Libres se han apoderado de las entradas a la Mina Este y occidental del Bosque Salvaje. Derrotarlos aquí contribuirá a devolver la seguridad al Bosque Salvaje.","Encontrarás enemigos en las Mina Este y en la mina occidental del Bosque Salvaje.\
\
Debes derrotar a los enemigos de la Mina Este y de la mina occidental.","Hay que derrotar a los enemigos de los Pueblos Libres que se encuentran en la Mina Este y occidental para proteger a quienes se encuentran en el Bosque Salvaje."}},
[12007]={nameES="La carrera de Aniversario de los Campos de Cavada",objectivesES={"Cruza la línea de meta antes de que se acabe el tiempo","Ganas velocidad gracias a tu ágil maniobra","Corre hacia la cuarta puerta","Corre hacia la octava puerta","La Carrera del Festival es una tradición bastante nueva en los Campos de Cavada de la Comarca. Se han preparado muchos desafíos para presentar un recorrido complicado para los valientes jinetes de la Tierra Media que deseen demostrar su valía a caballo.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando termine el festival actual. </rgb>","Tu corcel se ve ralentizado por un lodazal pegajoso...","Monta un poney de carrera","La carrera de Aniversario de los Campos de Cavada","Las monturas del festival se encuentran cerca de los establos de la pista de carreras de los Campos de Delagua.\
\
Debes montar una montura para comenzar la carrera: un poney si eres de estatura más baja, o un caballo si eres de complexión más alta.","Carl Ganapié está junto a la línea de meta en la pista de los Campos de Cavada.\
\
