[12014]={nameES="The Den of Wargs",objectivesES={"You have discovered that Shathur-munzu is the den of the Wargs of the Vales, and feel you must do what you can to rid the land of this threat.","Completado.","Completado","Duskenvale has become a haven of the foul Wargs of the Vales.\
\
You should defeat wargs in Duskenvale and Shathur-munzu.","Defeat Wargs in Duskenvale","You have done much to cleanse Duskenvale of the warg menace. The people of the Vales are safer for your actions.","The Den of Wargs","Now that you have seen what lies inside Shathur-munzu, you feel it is your responsibility to deal with the warg threat as much as you are able. You should defeat as many wargs as possible in the wilds of Duskenvale and Shathur-munzu."}},
[12015]={nameES="La madre de la guarida",objectivesES={"La madre de la guarida puede encontrarse en una isla cerca de la orilla occidental del lago.\
\
Urho te ha pedido que localices a la madre de la guarida de la manada de lobos y la derrotes.","Derrota a la madre de la guarida","Habla con Santtu","La madre de la guarida","La madre de la guarida ha sido derrotada","Tras hacer retroceder a los lobos hasta los confines del bosque, los Lossoth están convencidos de que estas bestias no causarán más daños si la madre de la guarida es abatida.","Santtu se encuentra en Kauppa-kohta, en la orilla oriental del lago.\
\
Ahora que has derrotado a la madre de la guarida de los lobos, deberías regresar con Santtu para anunciarle tu victoria."}},
[12016]={nameES="The Depth of the Problem",objectivesES={"The bridge to another section of the Glimmerdeep is out and something looms across the divide","You should continue surveying the Glimmerdeep and defeating foes you find.","Orkish scaffolding has been erected all over the mine","Glimmerdeep is overrun with Orcs.","Continue to survey the Glimmerdeep","This is a good place for surveying","You should talk to Hórin.","You should survey the Glimmerdeep and defeat foes you find there.","Survey another part of the Glimmerdeep","The Depth of the Problem","Habla con Hórin","Survey the Glimmerdeep","Enter the Glimmerdeep","You should enter the Glimmerdeep, which lies on Mount Thrumfall north of Skarháld.","Large gem formations glimmer high above"}},
[12017]={nameES="Las profundidades de Kidzul-kâlah",objectivesES={"Habla con Glorfindel","Glorfindel has asked that you try to question Gultháva, the Maiden of the Gladden, about the fate of Kidzul-kâlah.\
\
You should talk to Gultháva.","Elrond's stance has relaxed considerably after hearing Gultháva's story.\
\
'It appears my suspicions were correct, but her reasoning was sound. She was benevolent enough to give the dwarves time to escape before acting. If she requires assistance clearing this place of evil, she will have it.'","Find Elrond and Glorfindel at Kidzul-kâlah","In the depths of Kidzul-kâlah, something evil has taken root. Elrond has asked you to help him investigate the matter, and hopes to learn how the Maiden of the Gladden is involved.","Elrond and Glorfindel have travelled to Kidzul-kâlah to seek answers from the Maiden of the Gladden.\
\
You should find them somewhere near the entrance to Kidzul-kâlah.","Gandalf has asked you to speak to Elrond. He can be found outside the Beorninghús.","Complete The Depths of Kidzul-kâlah","Habla con Elrond","Talk to Gultháva","Complete The Depths of Kidzul-kâlah on any difficulty mode.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>You may enter this instance by using the Instance Join panel. </rgb>","Elrond would like to speak with you.\
\
He is standing by outside Kidzul-kâlah.","Gultháva can be found either outside Kidzul-kâlah or inside after defeating the Grasping Maw.\
\
You should talk to Gultháva.","The Maiden of the Gladden waits to hear if you will help her cleanse Kidzul-kâlah.\
\
You should talk to Gultháva.","Glorfindel beckons you to speak with him","Las profundidades de Kidzul-kâlah","Glorfindel would like to speak with you.\
\
He can be found outside Kidzul-kâlah.","Elrond appears lost in thought as you approach. He turns to greet you.\
\
'Gandalf was kind to send you. Indeed, something troubles me still, and my thoughts dwell on the years following the War of the Last Alliance.\
\
'In the early years of the Third Age, Khazad-dûm was still a thriving kingdom. Durin's Bane had not yet awoken. Despite this, I have memories of dwarves seeking refuge fleeing from a mining colony in the mountains at a time when all should have been well. It was known as Kidzul-kâlah. Many dwarves were waylaid on the road by Orcs and goblins as they attempted to reach Durin's halls or other nearby forts. They told us of a great flood, perhaps the same flood that caused the Gladden Fields to become the marsh it is today. Perhaps it is as simple as that, an earthquake and a flood....\
\
'And yet, I cannot help but think the Maiden of the Gladden may be involved. The Gladden is her domain, and the waters would answer her call. I would like to travel to Kidzul-kâlah and question Gultháva myself. I would ask you and Glorfindel to accompany me. We will travel to the Gladdenmere and seek her. Find us there.'"}},
[12018]={nameES="The Depths of Kidzul-kâlah -- Solo/Duo",objectivesES={"Defeat the Grasping Maw","Defeated the Grasping Maw","The Depths of Kidzul-kâlah -- Solo/Duo","Habla con Elrond","Now that you have passed the Maid's test, it is time to confront the darkness within the mines.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> If Elrond or Glorfindel will not answer the call of the Beacon of Imladris, try using the chat command /pet release twice to dismiss them, and then re-summon them with the Beacon. </rgb>","Passed the Test of the Maiden","Elrond would like to speak with you.\
\
If he is no longer with you, you may call him to your side with the Beacon of Imladris.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> If Elrond or Glorfindel will not answer the call of the Beacon of Imladris, try using the chat command /pet release twice to dismiss them, and then re-summon them with the Beacon. </rgb>","In the depths of Kidzul-kâlah something evil has taken root. The Maiden of the Gladden has asked for your help in removing the corruption.","Elrond and Glorfindel are standing by.\
\
You should talk to Elrond.","The Maid wishes to test your strength before allowing you passage into the mines of Kidzul-kâlah.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> If Elrond or Glorfindel will not answer the call of the Beacon of Imladris, try using the chat command /pet release twice to dismiss them, and then re-summon them with the Beacon. </rgb>","Pass the Test of the Maiden"}},
[12019]={nameES="The Depths of Kidzul-kâlah -- Tier 1",objectivesES={"The Maid wishes to test your strength before allowing you passage into the mines of Kidzul-kâlah.","Defeat the Grasping Maw","Defeated the Grasping Maw","In the depths of Kidzul-kâlah, something evil has taken root. The Maiden of the Gladden has asked for your help in removing the corruption.","The Depths of Kidzul-kâlah -- Tier 1","Passed the Test of the Maiden","Now that you have passed the Maid's test, it is time to confront the darkness within the mines.","Pass the Test of the Maiden"}},
[12020]={nameES="The Depths of Kidzul-kâlah -- Tier 2",objectivesES={"The Maid wishes to test your strength before allowing you passage into the mines of Kidzul-kâlah.","Defeat the Grasping Maw","Defeated the Grasping Maw","In the depths of Kidzul-kâlah, something evil has taken root. The Maiden of the Gladden has asked for your help in removing the corruption.","Now that you have passed the Maid's test, it is time to confront the darkness within the mines.","Passed the Test of the Maiden","Pass the Test of the Maiden","The Depths of Kidzul-kâlah -- Tier 2"}},
[12021]={nameES="The Depths of Kidzul-kâlah -- Tier 3",objectivesES={"The Maid wishes to test your strength before allowing you passage into the mines of Kidzul-kâlah.","Defeat the Grasping Maw","Defeated the Grasping Maw","In the depths of Kidzul-kâlah, something evil has taken root. The Maiden of the Gladden has asked for your help in removing the corruption.","Now that you have passed the Maid's test, it is time to confront the darkness within the mines.","Passed the Test of the Maiden","Pass the Test of the Maiden","The Depths of Kidzul-kâlah -- Tier 3"}},
