[12028]={nameES="The Devourer",objectivesES={"Meriun is in the Orc-mines.\
\
You should return and tell Meriun that you have slain the Devourer.","The Devourer","One of the pit-worms has grown to gigantic size and has been known to crawl out of the pits below and prey upon unwary slaves.","Defeat the Devourer","You defeated the Devourer","The Devourer dwells somewhere in the Orc-mines.\
\
Meriun asked you to find and defeat the Devourer, an enormous pit-worm that hunts unwary slaves within the mine.","Talk to Meriun in the Orc-mines"}},
[12029]={nameES="The Disease",objectivesES={"You tell Faeron that your attempts to heal Rhadrog have all failed.\
\
'This is dire. If our medicines cannot help him, we may need to seek out the goblin.'","Attempt to heal Rhadrog with Kingsfoil","Maiden's Helm doesn't seem effective","Kingsfoil doesn't seem effective","Attempt to heal Rhadrog with Maiden's Helm","Rhadrog has fallen ill from his exposure to the local flora of Agarnaith. Try to help him by finding the stolen medical supplies among the goblin's things.","Rhadrog is becoming increasingly ill in Viznak's hideout.\
\
You should try and heal Rhadrog using the medical supplies.","Attempt to heal Rhadrog with Wanderbeard","Faeron can be found at Viznak's hideout.\
\
You should talk to Faeron.","Rhadrog is becoming increasingly ill in Viznak's Hideout.\
\
You should try and heal Rhadrog using the medical supplies.","Talk to Faeron","The Disease","The stolen medical supplies are hidden in Viznak's hideout.\
\
You should find and collect the medical supplies.","Wanderbeard doesn't seem effective"}},
[12030]={nameES="The Dog-catcher",objectivesES={"Return to Barûl in Urmâkh with the cloth and rope you have collected.","The Dog-catcher","Return to Barûl in Urmâkh with the items you've found","The local dog-catcher, Barûl, has asked for your help in acquiring some supplies with which to catch stray dogs in Urmâkh.","Barûl has asked for your help in collecting discarded cloth to treat wounds and loose rope for leashes for the stray dogs of Urmâkh. You can find discarded cloth and loose rope around Urmâkh."}},
[12031]={nameES="The Dog-catcher, Part 2",objectivesES={}},
[12032]={nameES="The Dog-catcher, Part 3",objectivesES={"Return to Niriga in Urmâkh with what you have learned.","Speak with Sûdakh and Ghemûna in Urmâkh.","Speak with Niriga in Urmâkh to determine the best course of action.","Speak with Niriga when you are ready to go","Return to Niriga in Urmâkh","Speak with Sûdakh in Urmâkh","Speak with Ghemûna in Urmâkh","Speak with Niriga in Urmâkh","The Dog-catcher, Part 3","Return to Niriga in Urmâkh and tell her what happened in Shakhdag.","Niriga, a resident of Urmâkh, is worried about her husband, Namâkh, who didn't come home last night."}},
[12033]={nameES="The Dog-catcher, Part 3",objectivesES={}},
[12034]={nameES="The Dog-catcher, Part 4",objectivesES={"Search Urmâkh for Namâkh's personal effects for clues as to Namâkh's location.","Comfort Niriga as best you can.","Speak with Niriga when you are ready to go","Return to Niriga in Urmâkh","Niriga is worried her husband has been kidnapped by Barûl, the dog-catcher. Search for clues as to Namâkh's whereabouts.","Speak with Niriga when you are ready to go.","Return to Niriga with the items and report the location you found them.","Comfort Niriga","The Dog-catcher, Part 4"}},
[12035]={nameES="The Dog-catcher, Part 4",objectivesES={}},
[12036]={nameES="La Cúpula de las Estrellas -- nivel 1",objectivesES={"The Black Blade of Lebennin poses a grave threat, not only to the Rangers of Ithilien but also to Aragorn and his host, for he holds a valued prisoner atop Osgiliath and will soon fly to the black sails upon the Anduin in search of the Scourge. Unknown to him, the Scourge has already been defeated, and now Aragorn sails east in secret - a secret that, if discovered, could doom all.","Defeat Upâl-keng","Upâl-keng has been defeated!","Derrota a la Espada Negra de Lebennin","Defeat the Black Blade of Lebennin before he can learn of Aragorn's gambit.","La Cúpula de las Estrellas -- nivel 1"}},
[12037]={nameES="La Cúpula de las Estrellas -- nivel 2",objectivesES={"The Black Blade of Lebennin poses a grave threat, not only to the Rangers of Ithilien but also to Aragorn and his host, for he holds a valued prisoner atop Osgiliath and will soon fly to the black sails upon the Anduin in search of the Scourge. Unknown to him, the Scourge has already been defeated, and now Aragorn sails east in secret - a secret that, if discovered, could doom all.","Defeat Upâl-keng","Upâl-keng has been defeated!","Derrota a la Espada Negra de Lebennin","La Cúpula de las Estrellas -- nivel 2","Defeat the Black Blade of Lebennin before he can learn of Aragorn's gambit."}},
[12038]={nameES="The Dominion of Zôreth",objectivesES={"Aid Freki","Spakorth can be found within Lûghash in Dor Amarth.\
\
You have aided the Stout-axes of Lûghash in completing many of Zôreth's tasks and have also discovered the whereabouts of their imprisoned lord. You should now speak to Spakorth.","Aid Dréri","Spakorth and his folk can be found within Lûghash.\
\
Spakorth has asked you to aid him and the other Stout-axes of Lûghash in easing the burdens laid upon them by Zôreth.","Aid Spakorth","Talk to Spakorth in Lûghash","The Stout-axes have longed served the Mistress of Lûghash, Zôreth, but her rule has become only more cruel and oppressive in the absence of the Dark Lord.","The Dominion of Zôreth","Aid Sversting"}},
[12039]={nameES="La perdición de Sarch Vorn",objectivesES={"Habla con Gorwen","La habitación de Luilloth se encuentra en Sarch Vorn.\
\
Tras expulsar al Miedo Gris, Gorwen ha oído un ruido que resonaba en los pasillos de Sarch Vorn. Debes volver con Luilloth.","Acaba con el Miedo Gris en Sarch Vorn, la Tumba Negra","Reúnete con Gorwen fuera de Sarch Vorn","Con el apoyo de Baya de Oro, tu búsqueda te lleva a Sarch Vorn, el último destino conocido de Luilloth. El camino hasta allí está oculto y protegido por la oscuridad. Sin embargo, hay alguien que conoce los caminos secretos que serpentean por la montaña.","Has vencido al Miedo Gris y has dado descanso a los restos de Luilloth en Sarch Vorn. Ahora debes regresar con Rhiangar.\
\
Rhiangar se encuentra en la posada de Herne.","Habla con Gorwen en la habitación de Luilloth en Sarch Vorn\
<rgb=#ff0000>¡Habla con Gorwen antes de seguir adelante!</rgb>","Entra en Sarch Vorn y busca algún rastro de Luilloth","El Miedo Gris se encuentra en Sarch Vorn.\
\
Debes derrotar al Miedo Gris en Sarch Vorn antes de que su maldad se extienda por Cardolan y las tierras de los Pueblos Libres.","Gorwen se encuentra en Sarch Vorn.\
\
Has liberado los restos de Luilloth del control del Miedo Gris. Deberías hablar con Gorwen.","Gorwen se encuentra en Sarch Vorn.\
\
Has desterrado al Miedo Gris. Deberías hablar con Gorwen.","Liberados del control del Miedo Gris, los restos de Luilloth vuelven a descansar en paz.","Habla con Baya de Oro en Sarch Vorn","Investiga la habitación de Luilloth en Sarch Vorn","Gorwen se encuentra cerca de la entrada a Sarch Vorn.\
\
Sarch Vorn se encuentra al oeste de la caravana de Gerwyn en Cardolan, y está construido sobre una colina de piedra negra. Deberías hablar con Gorwen.","Gorwen se encuentra ante un gran arco de piedra negra y parece inquieta.","Para tu sorpresa y alivio, Baya de Oro ha venido a Sarch Vorn","La perdición de Sarch Vorn","Para tu horror, has encontrado a Luilloth, ¡pero sus restos han sido profanados por el Miedo Gris!","Gorwen se encuentra en Sarch Vorn.\
\
Tras encontrarte con Baya de Oro en las profundidades de Sarch Vorn, has visto los restos de Luilloth descansando por fin en paz. Deberías hablar con Gorwen.","Acaba con Luilloth en Sarch Vorn, la Tumba Negra","Luilloth se encuentra en Sarch Vorn.\
\
Has descubierto los restos de Luilloth, animados por algún espíritu maligno en las profundidades de Sarch Vorn. Debes liberar a Luilloth del Miedo Gris y devolver sus restos al descanso eterno.","Habla con Gorwen en la habitación del Miedo Gris en Sarch Vorn","Sarch Vorn se encuentra al oeste de la caravana de Gerwyn en Cardolan, y está construido sobre una colina de piedra negra.\
\
Deberías reunirte con Gorwen en la entrada de Sarch Vorn en Cardolan.","Baya de Oro se encuentra en Sarch Vorn.\
\
Tras expulsar al Miedo Gris, descubriste que Baya de Oro también viajó a Sarch Vorn. Deberías hablar con Baya de Oro.","Habla con Rhiangar","Rhiangar te ha pedido que sigas los últimos pasos de Luilloth hasta Sarch Vorn. Ella desconoce el camino, pero sospecha que el montaraz Gorwen podría saber cómo llegar al lugar donde se encuentra la tumba.\
\
Deberías hablar con Gorwen en la caravana al sur de Andrath.","Habla con Gorwen en Sarch Vorn","Es probable que los restos de Luilloth o algún otro indicio de sus aventuras de antaño se encuentren en algún lugar de Sarch Vorn.\
\
Deberías buscar algún indicio de Luilloth en Sarch Vorn."}},
[12040]={nameES="El guardián de las puertas de la Cámara Interior",objectivesES={"El Númenóreano negro que ocupa Ost Elendil se llama Balhest. Es un enemigo poderoso, pero no es el único mal que reside ahora en ese lugar. Hemos sabido que el pasillo a la sala del trono donde Balhest dirige a sus fuerzas está guardado por el Cargûl conocido como Guloth. Si quieres derrotar a Balhest, primero necesitas encargarte de Guloth.\
\
Posee algún terrible poder sobre las criaturas de la sombra, tomando su fuerza de la oscuridad con la que los comanda a su voluntad. Debes cortar de alguna forma la capacidad de fortalecer a los espíritus malvados bajo su control.\
\
Ost Elendil está cruzando el puente de Ariant. Ve hasta allí solo si te crees capaz no solo de enfrentarte a Balhest, teniente de Amarthiel, sino también a Guloth el Cargûl. Si la batalla me reclama en otro lugar mientras vuelves, informa de tu victoria al capitán general Daerdan en Echad Garthadir, el campamento de los montaraces aquí en la ciudad.","El guardián de las puertas de la Cámara Interior","El Cargûl Guloth está en el interior de Ost Elendil, más allá del puente de Ariant en el nivel superior de Annúminas.\
\
Legrindavor te ha advertido que Balhest está defendido por un temible Cargûl, llamado Guloth, que controla las criaturas de la sombra."}},
[12041]={nameES="The Doorstep of Cair Andros",objectivesES={"Jal Kepir is located next to Cair Andros.\
\
You should defeat enemies at Jal Kepir.","You, Dúneth, and Tolwin enter Jal Kepir, an enemy encampment across the river from Cair Andros, in order to make a path to the fallen Gondorian stronghold.","Speak with Dúneth","Dúneth can be found outside of Jal Kepir.\
\
You should speak with Dúneth.","Travel to Jal Kepir","Speak with Tolwin","Dúneth's camp is located in Talath Anor's eastern woods.\
\
You should speak with Dúneth at her camp.","Jal Kepir is located next to Cair Andros.\
\
You should travel to Jal Kepir in north-eastern Talath Anor.","Speak with Tolwin.","The Doorstep of Cair Andros"}},
[12042]={nameES="The Dourhand Proposition",objectivesES={"Talk to Rethvárd outside Eiricháv","Agal Dûn can be found in central Câr Bronach.\
\
You should travel to Agal Dûn.","Free another hillman","Brathar beckons you closer","The Dourhand Proposition","Free a hillman","Freed a hillman!","Eiricháv can be found in north west Câr Bronach.\
\
You should talk to Uzvát outside Eiricháv.","Talk to Brathar Crack-helm","Seek out Brathar Crack-helm","Eiricháv can be found in north west Câr Bronach.\
\
You should talk to Rethvárd outside Eiricháv.","Brathar Crack-helm can be found just south of Agal Dûn in Câr Bronach.\
\
You should seek out Brathar Crack-helm.","The escaped Dourhand, Rethvárd, carries a missive and proposition from his commander, Brathar Crack-helm.","Many under the Iron Crown defend the walls of Agal Dûn","Travel to Agal Dûn","Freed another hillman","Múta can be found at Agal Dûn.\
\
You should talk to Múta at Agal Dûn.","Agal Dûn can be found in central Câr Bronach.\
\
You should defeat foes at Agal Dûn and rescue the two hillmen held as captives.","Now is the time to strike the Drearspire!","Talk to Uzvát outside Eiricháv","Talk to Múta at Agal Dûn"}},
[12043]={nameES="The Dragon and the Storm -- Solo/Duo",objectivesES={"Secure the courtyard outside of the Citadel of the Winds.","With Ragrekhûl slain, the City of Umbar can now begin to count their dead and rebuild damaged portions of the city","Defeat Ragrekhûl","As Ragrekhûl's escapes, the storms surrounding the creature light fires all around the arena. A Tempestuous Flame has flickered to life","With the approach secured, you may now enter the courtyard held by the cult of the All-Seeing Eye","Secure the approach to the Citadel of the Winds","Ragrekhûl's rampage across Umbar has endangered the Umbari citizens. Defeat Ragrekhûl in the Courtyard of the Citadel of the Winds before more perish.","Defeat the All-Seeing Eye cultists","Defeat the Tempestuous Flame","During the commotion, members of the cult of the All-Seeing Eye have taken the opportunity to attack the city. With Ragrekhûl circling the Citadel of the Winds, you must now secure the approach to the Citadel of the Winds.","With Ragrekhûl's escape, a Tempestuous Flame has appeared within the arena. Defeat the creature so it does not cause additional damage and loss of life.","As the cultist falls, Ragrekhûl makes his approach. High Cultists emerge and begin to attempt to gain control of the powerful creature","Talk to Rothog the Storm in the Arena","Rothog has summoned you to witness the unveiling of his latest spectacle for the Arena. Speak to him.","Dahâl Huliz has long been home to many spectacular contests, pitting capable gladiators against all forms of opponents. Rothog has summoned you to witness the unveiling of his latest spectacle for the Arena.","The Dragon and the Storm -- Solo/Duo","With the Tempestuous Flame defeated, cries of help are heard throughout the city from Ragrekhûl's wrath. Leave the arena and seek out Ragrekhûl"}},
[12044]={nameES="The Dragon and the Storm -- Tier 1",objectivesES={"Secure the courtyard outside of the Citadel of the Winds.","As Ragrekhûl's escapes, the storms surrounding the creature light fires all around the arena. A Tempestuous Flame has flickered to life","Defeat Ragrekhûl","With Ragrekhûl slain, the City of Umbar can now begin to count their dead and rebuild damaged portions of the city","The Dragon and the Storm -- Tier 1","Secure the approach to the Citadel of the Winds","With the approach secured, you may now enter the courtyard held by the cult of the All-Seeing Eye","Ragrekhûl's rampage across Umbar has endangered the Umbari citizens. Defeat Ragrekhûl in the Courtyard of the Citadel of the Winds before more perish.","Defeat the All-Seeing Eye cultists","Defeat the Tempestuous Flame","During the commotion, members of the cult of the All-Seeing Eye have taken the opportunity to attack the city. With Ragrekhûl circling the Citadel of the Winds, you must now secure the approach to the Citadel of the Winds.","With Ragrekhûl's escape, a Tempestuous Flame has appeared within the arena. Defeat the creature so it does not cause additional damage and loss of life.","As the cultist falls, Ragrekhûl makes his approach. High Cultists emerge and begin to attempt to gain control of the powerful creature","Talk to Rothog the Storm in the Arena","Rothog has summoned you to witness the unveiling of his latest spectacle for the Arena. Speak to him.","Dahâl Huliz has long been home to many spectacular contests, pitting capable gladiators against all forms of opponents. Rothog has summoned you to witness the unveiling of his latest spectacle for the Arena.","With the Tempestuous Flame defeated, cries of help are heard throughout the city from Ragrekhûl's wrath. Leave the arena and seek out Ragrekhûl"}},
[12045]={nameES="The Dragon and the Storm -- Tier 2",objectivesES={"As Ragrekhûl's escapes, the storms surrounding the creature light fires all around the arena. A Tempestuous Flame has flickered to life","Defeat Ragrekhûl","With Ragrekhûl slain, the City of Umbar can now begin to count their dead and rebuild damaged portions of the city","With the approach secured, you may now enter the courtyard held by the cult of the All-Seeing Eye","Secure the approach to the Citadel of the Winds","Defeat the All-Seeing Eye cultists","Defeat the Tempestuous Flame","During the commotion, members of the cult of the All-Seeing Eye have taken the opportunity to attack the city. With Ragrekhûl circling the Citadel of the Winds, you must now secure the approach to the Citadel of the Winds.","With Ragrekhûl's escape, a Tempestuous Flame has appeared within the arena. Defeat the creature so it does not cause additional damage and loss of life.","The Dragon and the Storm -- Tier 2","As the cultist falls, Ragrekhûl makes his approach. High Cultists emerge and begin to attempt to gain control of the powerful creature","Talk to Rothog the Storm in the Arena","Rothog has summoned you to witness the unveiling of his latest spectacle for the Arena. Speak to him.","Ragrekhûl's rampage across Umbar has endangered the Umbari citizens. Defeat Ragrekhûl in the Courtyard of the Citadel of the Wind before more perish.","Dahâl Huliz has long been home to many spectacular contests, pitting capable gladiators against all forms of opponents. Rothog has summoned you to witness the unveiling of his latest spectacle for the Arena.","Secure the courtyard outside of the Citadels of the Winds.","With the Tempestuous Flame defeated, cries of help are heard throughout the city from Ragrekhûl's wrath. Leave the arena and seek out Ragrekhûl"}},
