[12048]={nameES="The Dragon and the Storm -- Tier 5",objectivesES={"Secure the courtyard outside of the Citadel of the Winds.","As Ragrekhûl's escapes, the storms surrounding the creature light fires all around the arena. A Tempestuous Flame has flickered to life","Defeat Ragrekhûl","With Ragrekhûl slain, the City of Umbar can now begin to count their dead and rebuild damaged portions of the city","With the approach secured, you may now enter the courtyard held by the cult of the All-Seeing Eye","Secure the approach to the Citadel of the Winds","Ragrekhûl's rampage across Umbar has endangered the Umbari citizens. Defeat Ragrekhûl in the courtyard of the Citadel of the Winds before more perish.","Defeat the All-Seeing Eye cultists","Defeat the Tempestuous Flame","With Ragrekhûl's escape, a Tempestuous Flame has appeared within the arena. Defeat the creature so it does not cause additional damage and loss of life.","During the commotion, members of the cult of the All-Seeing Eye have taken the opportunity to attack the city. With Ragrekhûl circling the Citadel of the Winds, you must now secure the approach to the Citadel of the Winds.","As the cultist falls, Ragrekhûl makes his approach. High Cultists emerge and begin to attempt to gain control of the powerful creature","Rothog has summoned you to witness the unveiling of his latest spectacle for the Arena. Speak to him.","Talk to Rothog the Storm in the Arena","Dahâl Huliz has long been home to many spectacular contests, pitting capable gladiators against all forms of opponents. Rothog has summoned you to witness the unveiling of his latest spectacle for the Arena.","With the Tempestuous Flame defeated, cries of help are heard throughout the city from Ragrekhûl's wrath. Leave the arena and seek out Ragrekhûl","The Dragon and the Storm -- Tier 5"}},
[12049]={nameES="El huevo de dragonzuelo",objectivesES={"El huevo de dragonzuelo","Se ha planteado un desafío al clan de Arzhur, pero se requiere un símbolo de honor antes de que el pueblo de Aughaire pueda cumplir sus obligaciones legales con los otros clanes de Angmar.","Lleva el huevo de dragonzuelo a Arzhur","Huevo de dragonzuelo recolectado","La guarida de los dragonzuelos es Nád Nathair, al norte de Aughaire. Nád Nathair se reconoce no solo por los dragonzuelos sino por las muchas bestias de las colinas en la zona.\
\
El cantor de historias Arzhur te ha pedido que obtengas un huevo de dragonzuelo. El huevo se necesita como símbolo para que los hombres de Aughaire lo presenten a los otros clanes de las colinas. Te ha advertido que evites a los dragonzuelos al buscar el huevo.","Recolecta un huevo de dragonzuelo"}},
[12050]={nameES="La nidada de la reina de los dragonzuelos",objectivesES={"La reina de los dragonzuelos gobierna las tierras salvajes de Urugarth, engendrando nidadas de crías que asolan el campo.","La reina de los dragonzuelos y su nidada de huevos se encuentran en Urugarth, al oeste de Tármunn Sûrsa.\
\
Esmë te aconsejó destruir los huevos de la reina de los dragonzuelos.","La nidada de la reina de los dragonzuelos","Esmë está en Tármunn Súrsa, al este de Urugarth.\
\
Deberías regresar con Esmë para contarle tu éxito."}},
[12051]={nameES="The Drake-slayer",objectivesES={"Scoutmaster Ausma has sent you a special crossbow to help you take down flying cold-drakes.\
\
You should use the Drake-slayer crossbow to defeat flying cold-drakes.","A secret weapon to wield against the drakes has been brought to you!","Talk to Hórin in Fellgát","The drake-slayer has lived up to its name!\
\
You should talk to Hórin in Fellgát after the battle is over.","Pick up 'The Drake-slayer'","The Drake-slayer"}},
[12052]={nameES="The Drakes of Belfalas",objectivesES={"Speak to Abartârik","Therien has asked you to lessen the drake population in Belfalas.\
\
Drakes can be found in the countryside of Belfalas.","You should let Abartârik know that you defeated drakes in Belfalas.\
\
Abartârik is in Dol Amroth.","The Drakes of Belfalas","Sightings of huge flying scaled beasts have been reported in the Belfalas countryside."}},
[12053]={nameES="La Sequía de la Cerveza",objectivesES={"Jónar, un habitante siniestro y hosco de la Mansión de Thorin, se ha vuelto cada vez más agrio ante el éxito creciente de la Liga de las Posadas.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando finalice el festival actual.</rgb>","Los toneles de la Liga de las Posadas pueden encontrarse repartidos por toda la Comarca. Deberías ir a El Pájaro y el Bebé en Cavada Grande, al Árbol de la Fiesta en Hobbiton, al Dragón Verde en Delagua, al Tronco Flotante en Los Ranales, a Casa del Bosque, a Bolgovado y a la Perca Dorada en Cepeda.\
\
Jónar ha insistido en que vacíes varios toneles de la Liga de las Posadas para sabotear a la liga de amantes de la cerveza, que crece demasiado rápido.","La Sequía de la Cerveza","Jónar se encuentra en un rincón oscuro de la posada de la Mansión de Thorin.\
\
Deberías regresar de inmediato junto a Jónar para contarle las noticias de tu éxito contra los hobbits y su facción rival.","Habla con Jónar en la Mansión de Thorin"}},
[12054]={nameES="The Dreaded Day",objectivesES={"You have located Meregyth. She is just ahead on the dock","Thane Sparhafoc is in the Fenmarch Mead Hall.\
\
After receiving her father's distressing news, a devastated Meregyth ran off. You should inform Thane Sparhafoc that you have delivered the unfortunate tidings.","Meregyth will most likely be found just west of the Mead Hall in Fenmarch.\
\
You have gathered an impressive bouquet of Arrowhead to give to Meregyth. Now you must deliver it and Thane Sparhafoc's message.","Arrowhead grows in Fenmarch, east of Aldburg.\
\
Thane Sparhafoc has asked you to deliver a message to his daughter Meregyth, but he first wants you to collect an arrangement of arrowhead to help soften the disappointment she is certain to feel.","Meregyth can be found on a dock west of the Fenmarch Mead Hall.\
\
Deliver the arrowhead-arrangement and the message from her father, Thane Sparhafoc, regarding the unlikelihood that Éomer will still wed her now that he is heir to the throne of Rohan.","Talk to Thane Sparhafoc","Meregyth accepts the flowers from you and listens intently to what you have to say.\
\
'Éomer will not marry me...?'\
\
Meregyth hangs her head as a tear rolls off her cheek and onto the dock.","Talk to Meregyth","The Dreaded Day","Find Meregyth","Thane Sparhafoc cannot bring himself to tell his daughter, Meregyth, that Éomer will most likely not wed her, now that he is heir to the throne of Rohan."}},
[12055]={nameES="The Drinking Challenge",objectivesES={"Drank mysterious liquor (5/6)","Drink mysterious liquor (4/6)","Drinks can be found in the tavern of Lothgobel in central Lamedon.\
\
You should drink quickly to best the drinking champion of Jajax's Corsairs.","Drank mysterious liquor (6/6)","The Drinking Challenge","Drank mysterious liquor (4/6)","Drink mysterious liquor (1/6)","Liquor can be found in the tavern of Lothgobel.\
\
You should quickly drink the liquor in the tavern to challenge Damkalb.","Drink mysterious liquor (5/6)","Drink mysterious liquor (3/6)","Drank mysterious liquor (2/6)","You have a fixed amount of time in which to drink as much as Damkalb, the current drinking champion of the Corsairs under Jajax.","Drink mysterious liquor (2/6)","Se te ha acabado el tiempo","Drink mysterious liquor (0/6)","Drank mysterious liquor (1/6)","Drank mysterious liquor (3/6)"}},
[12056]={nameES="El Bosque Ahogado",objectivesES={"Habla con Laidhriel en el Bosque Ahogado","El Bosque Ahogado","La segunda parte de la Hueste Dorada partió hacia el sur, hacia la zona anegada del bosque conocida como el Bosque Ahogado.\
\
Deberías buscar Estolad Mernael, el campamento de los elfos en el Bosque Ahogado, para que los elfos destinados en Troncosombríos puedan mantener la comunicación con sus hermanos cercanos.","Athradnir, un Galadhrim destinado en la Posada Embrujada, desea transmitir un mensaje a Laidhriel en Estolad Mernael."}},
[12057]={nameES="The Drum Beats Louder",objectivesES={"Continue following the bootprints that lead away from the banner south-west.","Look for clues you find and follow where they lead","Speak with Nimasi outside of the camp","You see a large camp in the distance - and Nimasi beckoning you at its edge","Examine the banner Nimasi found","Speak with Nimasi in southern Imhûlar.","Look for clues you find to determine where they lead","Speak with Nimasi in southern Imhûlar","The bootprints turn south-west here, winding around the trees","Speak with Nimasi outside of the camp.","The bootprints veer due north-west here, toward a copse of dying trees","Continue following the bootprints that lead away from the banner north-west.","Follow the bootprints that lead away from the banner south-west and see where they lead.","Mizâdi has asked you to accompany the southern scout Nimasi to search for the missing Hamati scout Surâsh.","You notice a series of bootprints moving away from the banner to the south-west","Look for clues to the south-west","Examine the banner Nimasi found.","The Drum Beats Louder"}},
[12058]={nameES="The Drumming of the Grey Wood",objectivesES={"You see nothing here that looks suspicious","Retrieve the strange staff","The Drumming of the Grey Wood","Speak with Ceveneth","The staff does not look Orkish in nature","The strange staff can be found in the woods outside Crithost next to the Grey Wood.\
\
You should pick up the staff and bring it to Ceveneth.","The Grey Wood is west of Crithost.\
\
You should scout the edge of the Grey Wood for evidence of Orcs.","You see nothing here but an old, weathered Púkel-men statue","You hand the staff to Ceveneth.\
\
'What a peculiar and very small staff! This isn't from an Orc, but where have I seen it before? Let me think...\
\
'Ah yes, from children's tale of the Woses! Do you know of these stories? They're about small creatures that live in the woods and love nature.\
\
'Perhaps there is more to this tale than I thought! That would certainly explain those strange, old Púkel-men statues about the edge of the forest! Well, I am glad there isn't an army of Orcs in the Grey Wood after all!'","Ceveneth has heard the sound of drums coming from the Grey Wood and believes Orcs may be planning to attack Crithost from the west.","<rgb=#FF0000>Look around</rgb> the woods outside Crithost next to the Grey Woods","<rgb=#FF0000>Look around</rgb> the Grey Wood near the stream that cuts through the woods","Something nearby catches your eye","<rgb=#FF0000>Look around</rgb> the Grey Wood near the Púkel-men statue","Ceveneth can be found in the hall of Crithost.\
\
You should speak with Ceveneth.","Take a <rgb=#FF0000>look around</rgb>"}},
[12059]={nameES="The Drunkards' Mess",objectivesES={}},
[12060]={nameES="Un invitado sospechoso",objectivesES={"Rhiangar te ha pedido que le lleves vino a su padre, el alcalde, y que intentes averiguar si ha pasado algo importante.\
\
El vino está en la cocina de la casa del alcalde, en Herne.","Los ojos de Rhiangar brillan con lágrimas mientras toma suavemente el diario.","Habla con Osian","Osian suspira y te mira de arriba abajo con desdén.","Mientras volvías a montar la cama del alcalde, llegó una persona nueva y está hablando con él.","Recoge la botella de vino","Llévale el diario a Rhiangar","Rhiangar te ha pedido que le traigas el diario de su madre de la biblioteca.\
\
La biblioteca está en la casa del alcalde, en Herne.","Mientras se cocina el guiso, Rhiangar te ha pedido que te reúnas con ella en la posada de Herne, La Posada de la Encrucijada.","El alcalde te mira con los ojos entrecerrados, pero acepta el vino.","Rhiangar te ha pedido que le lleves vino a su padre, el alcalde, y que intentes averiguar si hay algo importante.\
\
El alcalde está en la mesa del comedor, en su casa, en Herne.","Habla con Rhiangar","El diario es viejo y está muy usado.","Deberías llevar el diario a Rhiangar.\
\
Rhiangar está en la cocina de la casa del alcalde, en Herne.","Busca el diario en la biblioteca","Habla con el alcalde Nevit","Deberías contarle a Rhiangar lo que has averiguado de Osian y el alcalde.\
\
Rhiangar está en la cocina de la casa del alcalde, en Herne.","Un invitado sospechoso"}},
[12061]={nameES="The Dwarf-smiths of Anglach",objectivesES={"A note hangs from the board, signed by Mulnír:\
 \
'Dwarves have been seen entering Anglach with a host of Orcs and goblins. They must be loyal to the Captain of the Pit, and are surely aiding in the re-building of his war machine. I need someone to enter the foundry and defeat their leaders. Seek out Candúr at the Udûn Foothold for passage into Anglach.'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Warning: This quest requires Anglach: The Great Foundry to be underway. If that quest has been completed or failed, you will be unable to exit and re-enter this instance in order to complete this quest.</rgb>","Defeat Forge-master Svartárn","Dwarves loyal to the Captain of the Pit can be found within Anglach: The Great Foundry.\
\
You should defeat Dwarf-forgeworkers and their leaders.","Defeat Counsellor Grárnath","The Dwarf-smiths of Anglach","Dwarves loyal to the Captain of the Pit have been seen within Anglach, aiding his war machine.","Defeated Forge-master Svartárn","Defeated Counsellor Grárnath"}},
[12062]={nameES="The Dwarves of Mordor",objectivesES={"Talk to Spakorth at Blozronk","After discovering the Dwarves of Mordor escaped Sauron's wrath, Gimli seeks to reunite with his long-lost kin.","The Dwarves of Mordor might be found somewhere along the causeway to Barad-dûr.\
\
Overjoyed that his kin have escaped Sauron's wrath, Gimli has asked you to search for the Dwarves of Mordor.","The Dwarves of Mordor","Spakorth can be found at Blozronk in Dor Amarth.\
\
A dwarf named Spakorth has led the dwarves to the muddied waters of Blozronk. You should speak to him.","You have found a company of exhausted dwarves gathered near a muddied cistern!","Patrol the causeway towards Barad-dûr and search for the Dwarves of Mordor","The dwarves can be found at Blozronk along the causeway to Barad-dûr to the south-east of the Ruins of Díngarth in Dor Amarth.\
\
You have found a company of wounded dwarves in Dor Amarth. You should aid them as Gimli requested."}},
[12063]={nameES="Los Enanos de Ojo de Aguja",objectivesES={"Ulfar está en los edificios de los enanos al norte de Ojo de Aguja.\
\
Para evitar enfadar a los enanos con acusaciones de robo, el frontero Redondo te pidió que obtuvieras la ayuda de los enanos a través de su capataz, Ulfar. Redondo cree que Ulfar podría señalar a cualquier posible ladrón entre los suyos.","Órdenes recogidas","Lleva las órdenes a Ulfar","Los Enanos de Ojo de Aguja","Recoge las órdenes","Los cazadores enanos merodean por las zonas norte y este del Pantano de los Juncos. El pantano se encuentra al sureste de Ojo de Aguja.\
\
Cuando le contaste a Ulfar la historia de la vaca de Filibert y la implicación de Olwir, no se sorprendió. Últimamente han pasado por Ojo de Aguja varios enanos de mala reputación, y Olwir parecía ser el peor de todos. Ulfar te ha pedido que consigas cartas de los cazadores enanos que sospecha que trabajan para Olwir.","Según Filibert Bolger, su vaca, Daffodil, fue robada por un enano llamado Olwir; sin embargo, el frontero Redondo duda en acusar a un enano de robo de vacas sin pruebas."}},
[12064]={nameES="The Dwarves' Demise",objectivesES={}},
[12065]={nameES="El Ave Madrugadora",objectivesES={"Wald Arenilla te contó que Billina, la mejor gallina del Granjero Arenilla, ha dejado de poner huevos, y que el Granjero Arenilla considera sacrificarla si no vuelve a poner.","Billina está en el patio de la Granja de los Arenilla.\
\
Wald Arenilla te ha pedido ver si puedes descubrir qué le pasa a Billina.","Wald Arenilla puede encontrarse en la Granja de los Arenilla, al norte y este de Cavada Grande.\
\
Ahora que has descubierto qué aquejaba a Billina, debes hablar de nuevo con Wald Arenilla.","Examina a Billina","Billina te mira y luego comienza a picotear el suelo. Parece que intenta mostrarte algo...\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>ADVERTENCIA: Esta misión inicia una misión especial de sesión. Serás desconectado de tu personaje normal y asumirás el papel de un PNJ amigable para jugadores. No podrás abandonar la Comarca con este personaje y tendrás un conjunto de habilidades únicas para esta sesión especial.</rgb>","El Ave Madrugadora"}},
[12066]={nameES="El Ave Madrugadora",objectivesES={"Billina está en el patio de la Granja de los Arenilla, al oeste de los Campos de los Arenilla.\
\
Ahora que has recogido algunas lombrices, debes hablar con Billina.","Billina tiene hambre de lombrices.","Rasca el suelo para revelar lombrices en el campo del Granjero Arenilla.","El Ave Madrugadora"}},
[12067]={nameES="The Ears of Ugrukhôr",objectivesES={}},
[12068]={nameES="Los Hijos de la tierra de Lehmä-koti",objectivesES={"Los Hijos de la tierra de Lehmä-koti","Habla con los Hijos de la tierra de Lehmä-koti","Lehmä-koti se encuentra muy al este de Tinnudir, más allá de Ram Dúath.\
\
Los Montaraces te han enviado a Lehmä-koti para que hables con los Hijos de la tierra.","Lehmä-koti es un pequeño campamento de los Hijos de la tierra situado justo al otro lado de la frontera de Angmar."}},
[12069]={nameES="The East Gate: Defenders",objectivesES={}},
[12070]={nameES="The East Gate: Enhancements I",objectivesES={"There is much work to do to rebuild the town of Hytbold.","The East Gate: Enhancements I","Bring the Tokens of Hytbold to Warin"}},
[12071]={nameES="The East Gate: Enhancements II",objectivesES={"There is much work to do to rebuild the town of Hytbold.","The East Gate: Enhancements II","Bring the Tokens of Hytbold to Fréamar"}},
[12072]={nameES="The East Gate: Rebuild",objectivesES={"There is much work to do to rebuild the town of Hytbold.","The East Gate: Rebuild","Bring the Tokens of Hytbold to Oseg"}},
[12073]={nameES="The Easterling Menace",objectivesES={"You have found the weapons convoy sacked, and many dwarves dead.\
\
You should talk to the survivor, Vílur Strayfoot.","This is what remains of the weapons convoy","Talk to Járnfast Citizens","Talk to Lord Náin","Talk to Vílur Strayfoot","The convoy of weapons was coming from Hammerstead, north-west of Járnfast.\
\
You should find some sign of the convoy on the path from Hammerstead.","Find any sign of the convoy","Hammerstead is under attack!","You should talk to Lord Náin, who can be found at his seat in Járnfast.","Talk to Féli","Lord Náin has asked you to speak to his advisors in Járnfast.\
\
You should talk to Aldin, Hógur, and Féli.","Vílur Strayfoot has warned you that an attack on Hammerstead is imminent!\
\
You should travel to Hammerstead!","Travel to Hammerstead","Náin the Slakeless, Lord of Járnfast, has many decisions to make regarding the Easterling host that occupies his lands.","Lord Náin has asked you to gauge the opinions of the citizens of Járnfast.\
\
You should talk to Járnfast citizens.","The Easterling Menace","TBD","Talk to Aldin","The Dwarves of Járnfast have not reached a consensus of opinion","Talk to Lóssi","Talk to Hógur","Hammerstead is under attack by the Easterlings!\
\
You should find the captain of the guard, Lóssi."}},
[12074]={nameES="The Eastern Stretch",objectivesES={}},
[12075]={nameES="The Eastward Path",objectivesES={"This poor woman looked as though she attempted to flee the massacre, but sadly she did not make it far....\
\
She is dead.","You have checked for signs of life amongst the fallen refugees along the road, but there are none.\
\
Every last one of this party fleeing the Stonedeans has been brutally slain.","The Eastward Path","This man appears to have been ridden down as he attempted to run towards the charred shelter of Marton. No breath stirs in his lifeless form.","You detect no pulse on this poor man.","The refugees can be found on the north-south road that lies east of Marton.\
\
You should check the refugees for signs of life.","A small company of refugees from the Stonedeans has walked down the road leading by Marton, but they seem to have met trouble upon the road.","Check for signs of life among the refugees","You cannot detect any signs of life in this poor man lying face-down in the tall grasses.\
\
He has many wounds from Orkish weapons. He fled this way to find sanctuary in Helm's Deep, and found only death.","This woman, surrounded by her scattered belongings, died here. These people fled the Stonedeans to find sanctuary in the Westfold.\
\
How could they know that they were only walking deeper into danger?","Completado","A small company of refugees from the Stonedeans has walked down the road leading by Marton, but they seem to have met trouble upon the road.\
\
You should check for signs of life among the fallen refugees."}},
[12076]={nameES="The Edge of the Wild",objectivesES={"Approach the gates of Lhanuch","Himeinior told you that the Dúnedain are not welcome in the halls of Lhanuch, for the Uch-lûth are wary of strangers.","The guard is at the entrance to the Brenin's Hall of Lhanuch.\
\
The guard at the village gate instructed you to speak with the guard before the Brenin's Hall of Lhanuch.","Lhanuch lies to the south-east of Echad Idhrenfair, in Nan Laeglin.\
\
Himeinior has asked you to seek entry into the Uch-lûth village of Lhanuch.","Speak with the guard before the Brenin's Hall in Lhanuch","The Edge of the Wild"}},
[12077]={nameES="The Elders",objectivesES={"Talk to Tûm at Gwaed Brun","The Elders","Enit was greatly angered and shamed by the spirit's rejection of her demands.\
\
In her anger she has told you to speak with her elders upon a great hill in the centre of the forest.","Tûm, the elder of the Derudh, is at Gwaed Brun, south of Galar Culch.\
\
Enit has instructed you to speak with Tûm, the Derudh elder."}},
[12078]={nameES="The Eldest House",objectivesES={"The Eldest House","Within the deepest reaches of Gloomingtarn, the Angmarim of the Iron Crown have unwittingly discovered a long-forgotten passage rumoured to conceal the greatest secret of Gloomingtarn.","Talk to Hersegg","Hermáth Stormhammer can be found at Watchers' Roost.\
\
After thwarting the Iron Crown at Mîn Lorg, you have returned to Watchers' Roost with a curious dwarf named Thrástan—much to the surprise of Hermáth Stormhammer and his expedition. You should talk to Hermáth Stormhammer.","Hersegg can be found at Mîn Lorg, within the encampment of Lochan Dúv in Gloomingtarn.\
\
Hersegg has asked you to accompany her into Mîn Lorg and confront the Iron Crown before they can pilfer anything else from Gloomingtarn.","Talk to Hermáth Stormhammer"}},
[12079]={nameES="Los Eldgang",objectivesES={"Los Eldgang","Iorelen fue enviado a la Grieta de Nûrz Ghâshu para investigar las actividades de Angmar en la zona y la existencia de un hongo mortal que podría ser utilizado por el Enemigo para crear un arma terrible. También busca una raza de gigantes de la que se enteró a través de Glorfindel en Rivendel.","Iorelen se encuentra en el campamento de Iorelen.\
\
Debes regresar a Iorelen y contarle lo que encontraste en la Falla.","Aprender más sobre los Eldgang","Los Eldgang se pueden encontrar en lo profundo de la Grieta de Nûrz Ghâshu.\
\
Iorelen te ha pedido que busques señales de los Eldgang, los legendarios gigantes de fuego de Nûrz Ghâshu."}},
[12080]={nameES="La piedra élfica",objectivesES={"Los Elfos de Ered Luin permanecen para prepararse para el último viaje de los Elfos desde la Tierra Media, pero también para proteger la Tierra Media de los males que permanecen.","La piedra élfica","Glamir habita las ruinas situadas al noreste de Gondamon, en el extremo sur del lago de las Aguas Lúgubres.\
\
Gailthin te ha dado una piedra élfica y te ha pedido que vayas a ver a un Elfo llamado Glamir, que podría ayudarte contra los tumularios de Haudh Lin.","Lleva la piedra élfica a Glamir"}},
[12081]={nameES="La espada élfica",objectivesES={"Lleva la espada élfica a Celairant","Encuentra Elvellon, la espada élfica","La espada élfica","La espada Elvellon puede encontrarse en una lápida entre los montículos de los Edain, al noreste de Gondamon. Celairant está en el refugio del cazador, al oeste de Kheledûl. \
\
Penglir te ha pedido que recuperes una espada que colocó junto a la tumba de su compañero hace mucho tiempo y que se la lleves a Celairant.","Después de permitir que Starkath le quitara el arco, Celairant ahora está convencido de que no es digno del arma élfica.","Has encontrado Elvellon, la espada élfica"}},
[12082]={nameES="The Elfward",objectivesES={"Speak to Thane Elfmar about the preparations of the Elfward","Thane Elfmar resides in the mead hall at the centre of Faldham.\
\
Elfmar awaits word regarding the resolution of Lanfrith's concerns.","Nothwulf can be found inside the mead hall at the centre of Faldham.\
\
Elfmar believes that Nothwulf is distracted by matters that will hinder his skill in the coming battle, and has asked you to help dispatch his concerns.","Aid Nothwulf, of the Elfward, with his concerns","The Elfward","Nothwulf's concern has been resolved","Aid Langfrith, of the Elfward, with his concerns","Thane Elfmar resides in the mead hall at the centre of Faldham.\
\
Elfmar awaits word regarding the resolution of Nothwulf's concerns.","Thane Elfmar resides in the mead hall at the centre of Faldham.\
\
Elfmar awaits word regarding the resolution of Osin's concerns.","Langfrith's concerns have been resolved","Osin can be found outside the mead hall at the centre of Faldham.\
\
Thane Elfmar wants Osin's distractions resolved, so that he may focus on the coming White Hand siege.","Thane Elfmar believes that the Elfward are distracted with concerns besides the ravaging White Hand army from the north, and wishes them to resolve their agitations to focus on the task at hand.","Langfrith prepares outside of the mead hall at the centre of Faldham.\
\
Elfmar believes that Langfrith will be distracted in the coming battle, if his concerns are not first dealt with.","Osin's concern has been resolved","Aid Osin, of the Elfward, with his concerns","Talk to Thane Elfmar about the preparations of the Elfward"}},
[12083]={nameES="Las elhudan de Tyrn Gorthad",objectivesES={"Deberías decirle a Gurthern que has acabado con muchas esferas siniestras atrayentes.\
\
Gurthern está en Tyrn Gorthad, en el noroeste de Cardolan.","Tyrn Gorthad está encantado por elhudans, espíritus que atraen a los niños y hacen que los viajeros desaparezcan.","Las elhudan de Tyrn Gorthad","Vuelve con Gurthern","Gurthern te ha pedido que reduzcas el número de elhudan en Tyrn Gorthad.\
\
Tyrn Gorthad se encuentra en el noroeste de Cardolan."}},
[12084]={nameES="Los Elfos de Eregion",objectivesES={"Habla con Daegennan en Gwingris","Daegennan está en Gwingris, en Eregion.\
\
Te indicaron que buscaras al Elfo Daegennan.","Los Elfos de Eregion necesitan la ayuda de aventureros experimentados.\
\
Un Explorador de Eregion te ha pedido que viajes al puesto avanzado élfico de Gwingris en Eregion, al sur de Rivendel. Una vez allí, debes buscar al Elfo Daegennan.","Los Elfos de Eregion"}},
[12085]={nameES="Los Elfos de Eregion",objectivesES={"Habla con Daegennan en Gwingris","Daegennan está en Gwingris, en Eregion.\
\
Te indicaron que buscaras al Elfo Daegennan.","Los Elfos de Eregion necesitan la ayuda de aventureros experimentados.\
\
Un Explorador de Eregion te ha pedido que viajes al puesto avanzado élfico de Gwingris en Eregion, al sur de Rivendel. Una vez allí, debes buscar al Elfo Daegennan.","Los Elfos de Eregion"}},
[12086]={nameES="Los Elfos de Rivendel",objectivesES={"Habla con Imyl de Rivendel.","Los Elfos de Rivendel","Broderic Saucedales, un hombre de Bree, te ha pedido que busques a Imyl en la Última Casa Acogedora de Rivendel y le ofrezcas ayuda si puedes."}},
[12087]={nameES="El emisario",objectivesES={"Bhoghad está en la sala del trono del Gran Trasgo dentro de la Ciudad de los Trasgos, al noreste del campamento de Glóin.\
\
Tralli parecía satisfecho con todo lo que has hecho por Glóin y te ofreció una recompensa por rastrear y derrotar al emisario uruk Bhoghad en la Ciudad de los Trasgos.","Tralli Buscagemas está en el campamento de Glóin, en las Montañas Nubladas, al suroeste de la entrada a la Ciudad de los Trasgos.\
\
Entraste en la sala del trono del Gran Trasgo y encontraste a Bhoghad negociando con los trasgos. Derrotaste al uruk, y ahora debes regresar con Tralli Buscagemas para darle la noticia.","Habla con Tralli Buscagemas","La información obtenida de las cartas en Lengua Negra que recuperaste llevó a Glóin a ofrecer recompensas por derrotar al emisario uruk enviado por Angmar.","El emisario"}},
[12088]={nameES="The Encrypted Note",objectivesES={"A shy librarian of Imloth Melui has gone missing, along with numerous invaluable medical texts from the Hall of the Gentle Hand.","The Encrypted Note","Talk to Therien","Merenir has asked you to speak with Chief Healer Brunil in Imloth Melui's Hall of the Gentle Hand.","Talk to Atharon","Talk to Brunil","Upon reading the encrypted note, Atharon has suggested that you check the market to speak with merchants Rendis mentioned she was going to see.\
\
You should talk to the bag maker and the provisioner in the Imloth Melui market.","After speaking with Therien and Brenion, you gained some information about Rendis's actions the day she disappeared. You should let Atharon know what you've learned.\
\
Atharon is in the Hall of the Gentle Hand.","Brunil has asked you to bring a note written in a medical shorthand to Atharon, who she thinks can decipher the script.\
\
Atharon is in the potions wing of the Hall of the Gentle Hand.","Return to Atharon","Brunil has asked you to pick up the encrypted note.\
\
The note is next to Brunil, in the Hall of the Gentle Hand.","Talk to Brenion","Pick up the note"}},
[12089]={nameES="¿Es el final?",objectivesES={"Anlaf el Despojado te ha pedido que lleves algunos suministros del exterior de la Posada Abandonada abajo, al almacén de la bodega.","Recoge una cesta de huevos en el exterior de la Posada Abandonada","Anlaf el Despojado querrá saber que has bajado las provisiones al almacén.","Bingo está fastidiado por la aburrida conclusión de la caza del tesoro, y se pregunta si en realidad todo acaba aquí, o si es simplemente otro acertijo.","Sostén el pergamino frente al fuego en la Posada Abandonada","Habla con Teodoro Tojo fuera de la tienda en Ost Guruth","Dejas la caja de mercancías en el suelo","Teodoro Tojo está enfrente de la tienda de Haley Pradodulce en Ost Guruth.","Haley Pradodulce es la verdadera maestra buscadora de tesoros, y está lista para hablar contigo en Ost Guruth.","Encuentra el lugar mencionado en el pergamino de las tres palabras y reúnete con Bingo allí","Habla con el maestro buscador de tesoros","Al calentarse con el fuego, ¡aparecen letras en el pergamino!","Bingo te ha pedido que sujetes el pergamino de las tres palabras junto al fuego en la Posada Abandonada.","Anlaf el Despojado es el propietario de la Posada Abandonada, y se le puede encontrar tras el mostrador del establecimiento.\
\
Para Bingo, la caza del tesoro ha llegado a un fin decepcionante, y está convencido de que hay más por descubrir.","Habla con Bingo en la Posada Abandonada","Haley Pradodulce sale de la tienda","Recoge una caja de mercancías en el exterior de la Posada Abandonada","Teodoro Tojo ha venido a Ost Guruth con Bingo, y está emocionado por conocer a quien quiera que haya estado dejándoos estos acertijos.","Anlaf el Despojado te ha pedido que lleves algunos de los suministros del exterior de la Posada Abandonada abajo, al almacén.","Bingo te ha dicho que el pergamino con 'ES EL FINAL' escrito en él contenía la siguiente la localización, ¡y que se reuniría allí contigo cuando lo averiguases!","Bingo está en la Posada Abandonada, en las Tierras Solitarias.","Bingo está en la Posada Abandonada, peleándose con el significado de las tres palabras del pergamino que recuperaste.","Bingo sonríe ampliamente mientras te acercas. '¡Lo has averiguado! dice alegremente","Bingo te entrega el pergamino con las tres palabras, con una expresión de emoción en su rostro","Habla con Bingo fuera de la tienda en Ost Guruth","Habla con Anlaf el Despojado en la Posada Abandonada","Has descifrado la serie de letras en el pergamino y seguido la pista hasta Ost Guruth. Bingo está aquí también, y desea hablar contigo.","Bingo está en el exterior de la tienda de Haley Pradodulce en Ost Guruth.","Dejas la cesta de huevos en el suelo"}},
[12090]={nameES="El fin de la cuestión",objectivesES={"Hyacinth Tuk está en su casa en Alforzaburgo, cerca de los Grandes Smials.\
\
El paladín Tuk te estaba agradecido por haber ayudado a destruir los fuegos artificiales robados. Te ha encargado que le cuentes la noticia a Hyacinth Tuk.","Ahora que los fuegos artificiales de Hyacinth han sido destruidos, no quedan para la fiesta de cumpleaños de Lobelia Sacovilla-Bolsón.","El fin de la cuestión"}},
[12091]={nameES="The Enduring Menace",objectivesES={"The men of the trader's outpost have noticed a large force of Uruk-hai establishing themselves within the region. These Uruks and their leader have broken away from the main Uruk-army to plan further assaults against Elthengels.","The Uruk-hai camp lies to far to the east and south beyond the river.\
\
The Guard-captain has asked you to infiltrate the Uruk-hai establishment and to overthrow the commander of the force.","Ofrith resides at the trader's outpost, along the road west of Elthengels.\
\
Ofrith awaits at the trader outpost for news of your endeavours within the Uruk-hai camp.","Defeated Mauhúr","The Guard-captain of the trader's outpost can be found outside his tent, within the camp.\
\
Ofrith has asked you to discuss the Uruk-hai presence with the Guard-captain and to inquire as to what should be done.","Discover the leader of the Uruk-hai camp to the south-east","Return to Ofrith at the merchant-camp","The Enduring Menace","The Uruk-hai camp lies to far to the east and south beyond the river.\
\
The Guard-captain has asked you to infiltrate the Uruk-hai encampment and to overthrow the commander of the force.","Talk to the Guard-captain in the merchant-camp","You have encountered the leader of the Uruk-hai camp","Defeat Mauhúr"}},
[12092]={nameES="The Enemies' Loss is Our Gain",objectivesES={"Put weapons in the weapon cache","The enemies patrolling or holding the line were thinned out, and you helped re-stock Brockbridge's weapon supply by salvaging their weapons. This should help sway the battle in the defenders' favour.","The cache of weapons is near Herefara, on the southern side of Brockbridge.\
\
You should bring the weapons you collected to the weapons cache in Brockbridge.","Collect Dunlending Weapons (0/6)","There are many Dunlending warriors along the perimeter around Brockbridge.\
\
You should defeat Dunlending warriors in the perimeter around Brockbridge and collect their weapons.","Everyone in Brockbridge has prepared for a long siege. Despite any amount of preparation, however, there is always a need for more weapons.","Weakening the perimeter gives the town a fighting chance to survive the siege, or at least maintain the stale-mate.","Put weapons into the Brockbridge weapon cache","The Enemies' Loss is Our Gain","Completado","Everyone in Brockbridge has prepared for a long siege. Despite any amount of preparation, however, there is always a need for more weapons. You should defeat Dunlending warriors in the perimeter around Brockbridge and collect their weapons."}},
[12093]={nameES="The Enemy Has Taken Mate Isernore",objectivesES={"Mate Isernore was once a mine owned by Gifemund, but it has been uverrun by a party of White Hand warriors from Madh-fushaum.","Two of the Uruk-hai leaders of the White Hand were seen lashing the Dunlendings in their party who work the mine. The largest Uruk-hai among them is overseeing the mine's operation.","Defeat White Hand overseers (0/2)\
Defeat the White Hand captain","Defeat the White Hand captain","The Enemy Has Taken Mate Isernore","The party of White Hand warriors from Madh-fushaum that crossed the Swiftwater River are led by formidable Uruk-hai.","The party of White Hand warriors that crossed the Swiftwater River and overran Mate Isernore is led by fierce Uruk-hai. One such creature is clearly the leader, while the other two appear to be acting as mine-overseers.","Defeating the Uruk-hai in charge of the mine will disrupt the operations of the mine.","Completado","Defeated the White Hand captain"}},
[12094]={nameES="The Enemy Line",objectivesES={"Thandor, the Gondorian Captain, can be located in the market east of Tol Ciryarani.\
\
You should speak with Thandor.","Defeat the Corsair Task-master","DNT Not Used","A band of surviving Corsairs has rallied in the bay of the Anduin, and Thandor has requested your help in dealing with them.","The Corsair ships can be reached using the boat to the south of the Gondorian Captain.\
\
You should board the ships and defeat the remaining Corsair forces.","Defeated the Corsair Task-master","The Enemy Line","Talk to Thandor"}},
[12095]={nameES="The Enemy That Was",objectivesES={"This tree was forcefully pulled from the ground and used as a crude club...","Quickbeam's Huorn suddenly slows to a halt behind you. Looking at the ground nearby, you notice it marred by enormous foot-prints littered with chipped stone.\
\
The foot-prints continue far into the distance, and despite the sudden sense of dread creeping over you, you decide to follow the trail.","DNT -- Players will not see","Talk to Quickbeam's Huorn","The Enemy That Was","Grim reminders of a long-departed beast litter the forest floor, terrifying the creatures nearby.","The creature was thought to have travelled through the western part of Fangorn Forest.\
\
You have discovered reminders of a creature that once wandered through Fangorn Forest. You should seek out more signs of its presence.","You have discovered all that you could find of this giant creature, and thankfully, it appears he has been away from the forest for some time. Quickbeam's Huorn does not seem to know what to make of these discoveries.\
\
A sense of familiarity with this mysterious figure claws at the back of your mind, but you decide to press on through the forest.","You have found all the evidence you could find of the mysterious creature that travelled through Fangorn Forest.","This footprint could only belong to a giant of significant size..."}},
[12096]={nameES="The Enemy at Maudhúl Grak",objectivesES={}},
[12097]={nameES="El Enemigo al este",objectivesES={"Los Malledhrim de Echad Sirion han descubierto la localización de otro campamento enemigo más.","Mothelen is at Echad Mothelen, far to the north-east from Amon Angened.\
\
Dannaswen has suggested you speak with Mothelen regarding the recently discovered enemy encampment in the western Dourstocks.","Habla con Mothelen en Echad Mothelen","El Enemigo al este"}},
[12098]={nameES="The Enemy is Upon Us!",objectivesES={"Dannaswen is at Amon Angened, atop Amon Angened to the north, above Echad Mothelen.\
\
Glamodúd has asked you to speak with Dannaswen regarding the Orc-camp near the Gostannon in the north.","The Enemy is Upon Us!","The presence of goblin-spies in the Mirk-eaves also infers the presence of multiple enemy encampments somewhere in the vicinity of the Mirk-eaves.","Talk to Dannaswen atop Amon Angened"}},
[12099]={nameES="The Enemy of My Enemy",objectivesES={}},
[12100]={nameES="Las Armas del Enemigo",objectivesES={"Throst está en Gath Forthnír, al este de Carn Dûm.\
\
Deberías regresar con Throst y contarle sobre tu victoria.","La resistencia en Gath Forthnír necesita equipo si quiere hacer frente a Carn Dûm.","Urugarth está en Carn Dûm, al oeste de Gath Forthnír.\
\
Throst ideó un plan astuto para robar suministros al Enemigo y usarlos para equipar a la resistencia en Gath Forthnír.","Lleva las armas a Throst","Las Armas del Enemigo"}},
[12101]={nameES="El punto de observación del enemigo",objectivesES={"Habla con Maedhril en Sírlond","Esta es la torre que preocupa a Maedhril","El punto de observación del enemigo","La torre que preocupa a Maedhril está al poniente cruzando el puente desde Sírlond.","Maedhril está en Sírlond, al este de Caranost propiamente dicho.","Maedhril está preocupada de que los orcos tengan una buena línea de visión al campamento de su esposo en Sírlond desde las alturas de Caranost.","Encuentra la torre que domina el puente con una buena vista de Sírlond","Maedhril tiene razón. Los arqueros orcos pueden ver fácilmente Sírlond desde esta posición","<rgb=#00FF00>Mira</rgb> en dirección a Sírlond desde la torre sobre el puente de Caranost"}},
[12102]={nameES="The Enmity of Shelob",objectivesES={"As countless spiders flood into Cirith Ungol, it has become clear that the arrangement between the Orcs of Cirith Ungol and Shelob is at an end. If Cirith Ungol is to hold against Shelob's children, you must defeat many of the spiders that now skitter in the shadows of the fortress.","The Enmity of Shelob","Spiders of Shelob's brood can be found throughout Cirith Ungol.\
\
You have encountered many spiders in Cirith Ungol. You should defeat them and allow the Orcs to regain control of Cirith Ungol.","You have defeated many spiders of Shelob's brood in Cirith Ungol.","Completado","You have defeated many spiders of Shelob's brood in Cirith Ungol. Although her broods seem to flood into Cirith Ungol without end, you have done well to hinder them as they move to overtake the tower.","As countless spiders flood into Cirith Ungol, it has become clear that the arrangement between the Orcs of Cirith Ungol and Shelob is at an end."}},
[12103]={nameES="The Entwalk: Creatures of the Forest",objectivesES={}},
[12104]={nameES="The Entwalk: Orcs in the Trees",objectivesES={"The Entwalk: Orcs in the Trees","Dernstan is at Eaworth.\
\
Dernstan will be pleased to hear that the Orcs within the Entwalk have been thinned.","<rgb=#FF0000>Completing Aiding the Eastemnet will cancel this quest</rgb>","Orcs can be found in the Entwalk.\
\
Dernstan has asked you to venture within the Entwalk and defeat the Orcs pillaging the forest.","Talk to Dernstan at Eaworth","Orcs are maurading through the Entwalk, cutting down the forest to create their encampments and siege-weapons."}},
[12105]={nameES="La envidia de las Cuadernas",objectivesES={"La envidia de las Cuadernas","Adso Henoloma es un hobbit con una visión que necesita ayuda para montar una posada a lo largo del camino que va de la Comarca a Bree. Sus asistentes están buscando ayuda en Los Gamos.","Se pueden encontrar setas silvestres a lo largo de las orillas orientales del Brandivino, al norte de Gamoburgo.\
\
Trumric Agripalma te ha pedido que recojas setas silvestres en las orillas del Río Brandivino. Te ha informado de que las setas se utilizarán para ayudar a crear un menú digno de la Comarca en la posada de Adso Henoloma.","Lleva las setas a Trumric Agripalma en Los Gamos"}},
[12106]={nameES="Búsqueda del Tesoro del Aniversario en Eriador — Año Ocho",objectivesES={"Hay tarjetas colgadas del Árbol de la Fiesta. Cada una contiene una búsqueda del tesoro para completar a tu propio ritmo. Cuando completes una búsqueda, lleva la tarjeta completada a Odilia Retumbo para recibir una recompensa.","Búsqueda del Tesoro del Aniversario en Eriador — Año Ocho","Puedes encontrar a Odilia Retumbo junto al Árbol de la Fiesta en la Comarca.\
\
Debes hablar con Odilia Retumbo para recibir tu recompensa por completar una tarjeta de búsqueda del tesoro.","Habla con Odilia Retumbo","Cada año, en primavera, tiene lugar la Búsqueda del Tesoro del Aniversario para celebrar una ocasión muy especial.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Esta versión de la misión incluye solo objetivos ubicados dentro de Eriador y está disponible para jugadores de todos los niveles.</rgb>\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión será eliminada de tu registro cuando termine el festival actual.</rgb>"}},
[12107]={nameES="Búsqueda del Tesoro del Aniversario en Eriador — Año Once",objectivesES={"Hay tarjetas colgadas del Árbol de la Fiesta. Cada una contiene una búsqueda del tesoro para completar a tu propio ritmo. Cuando completes una búsqueda, lleva la tarjeta completada a Odilia Retumbo para recibir una recompensa.","Búsqueda del Tesoro del Aniversario en Eriador — Año Once","Puedes encontrar a Odilia Retumbo junto al Árbol de la Fiesta en la Comarca.\
\
Debes hablar con Odilia Retumbo para recibir tu recompensa por completar una tarjeta de búsqueda del tesoro.","Habla con Odilia Retumbo","Cada año, en primavera, tiene lugar la Búsqueda del Tesoro del Aniversario para celebrar una ocasión muy especial.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Esta versión de la misión incluye solo objetivos ubicados dentro de Eriador y está disponible para jugadores de todos los niveles.</rgb>\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión será eliminada de tu registro cuando termine el festival actual.</rgb>"}},
[12108]={nameES="Búsqueda del Tesoro del Aniversario en Eriador — Año Cinco",objectivesES={"Cada año, en primavera, tiene lugar la Búsqueda del Tesoro del Aniversario para celebrar una ocasión muy especial.\
\
>Esta versión de la misión incluye solo objetivos ubicados dentro de Eriador y está disponible para jugadores de todos los niveles.</rgb>\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión será eliminada de tu registro cuando termine el festival actual.</rgb>","Búsqueda del Tesoro del Aniversario en Eriador — Año Cinco","Puedes encontrar a Odilia Retumbo junto al Árbol de la Fiesta en la Comarca.\
\
Debes hablar con Odilia Retumbo para recibir tu recompensa por completar una tarjeta de búsqueda del tesoro.","Habla con Odilia Retumbo","Hay tarjetas colgadas del Árbol de la Fiesta. Cada una contiene una búsqueda del tesoro que puedes completar a tu propio ritmo. Cuando completes una búsqueda, lleva la tarjeta completada a Odilia Retumbo para recibir una recompensa."}},
[12109]={nameES="Búsqueda del Tesoro del Aniversario en Eriador — Año Cuatro",objectivesES={"Hay tarjetas colgadas del Árbol de la Fiesta. Cada una contiene una búsqueda del tesoro para completar a tu propio ritmo. Cuando completes una búsqueda, lleva la tarjeta completada a Odilia Retumbo para recibir una recompensa.","Búsqueda del Tesoro del Aniversario en Eriador — Año Cuatro","Cada año, en primavera, tiene lugar la Búsqueda del Tesoro del Aniversario para celebrar una ocasión muy especial.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Esta versión de la misión incluye solo objetivos ubicados dentro de Eriador y está disponible para jugadores de todos los niveles.</rgb>\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión será eliminada de tu registro cuando termine el festival actual.</rgb>","Puedes encontrar a Odilia Retumbo junto al Árbol de la Fiesta en la Comarca.\
\
Debes hablar con Odilia Retumbo para recibir tu recompensa por completar una tarjeta de búsqueda del tesoro.","Habla con Odilia Retumbo"}},
[12110]={nameES="Búsqueda del Tesoro del Aniversario en Eriador — Año Nueve",objectivesES={"Hay tarjetas colgadas del Árbol de la Fiesta. Cada una contiene una búsqueda del tesoro para completar a tu propio ritmo. Cuando completes una búsqueda, lleva la tarjeta completada a Odilia Retumbo para recibir una recompensa.","Búsqueda del Tesoro del Aniversario en Eriador — Año Nueve","Puedes encontrar a Odilia Retumbo junto al Árbol de la Fiesta en la Comarca.\
\
Debes hablar con Odilia Retumbo para recibir tu recompensa por completar una tarjeta de búsqueda del tesoro.","Habla con Odilia Retumbo","Cada año, en primavera, tiene lugar la Búsqueda del Tesoro del Aniversario para celebrar una ocasión muy especial.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Esta versión de la misión incluye solo objetivos ubicados dentro de Eriador y está disponible para jugadores de todos los niveles.</rgb>\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión será eliminada de tu registro cuando termine el festival actual.</rgb>"}},
