[12117]={nameES="La bolsa de monedas extraviada",objectivesES={"Mochila de Lolo Wendingway recolectada","Recupera la mochila de Lolo Wendingway del oso que la robó","Lolo quiere reanudar el lucrativo comercio de Burl Beeman entre Combe y Entibo, pero un oso se llevó su mochila y la bolsa de monedas que había dentro.","La bolsa de monedas extraviada","Lolo Wendingway está en el camino entre Combe y Entibo.\
\
El oso que se llevó la mochila de Lolo Wendingway la arrastró hasta el valle al este de él. Debes devolverle la mochila en quince minutos; de lo contrario, perderá los buenos precios de la hierba para pipa en Entibo.","Lleva la mochila a Lolo Wendingway"}},
[12118]={nameES="The Examination",objectivesES={"Ethring tavern is located in Ringló Vale.\
\
You should question a patron of the tavern.","Ethring tavern is located in Ringló Vale.\
\
Have a drink with Jajax.","Question the barkeep","Ethring tavern is located in Ringló Vale.\
\
You should speak with Jajax.","Question a patron","You ask the patron if he knows anything about the body you recently found.\
\
'I am a little confused. You think I know something? Look, I come here every evening to have a pint. That's all I know. You should speak with the barkeep. He's a good man. Keeps me from getting too thirsty. He knows the whole lot of the town. Everyone who comes through Ethring stops here. I wish I could help more, really.'","Though a little belligerent, you are fairly certain of the patron's innocence","Have a drink with Jajax","Speak with Jajax","Laerind wants Jajax to tell you what he knows of the body, for Jajax's freedom may be at stake","Laerind is located in Ethring village.\
\
You should speak with Laerind.","Ethring tavern is located in Ringló Vale.\
\
You should question the barkeep.","Forgetting for a moment about the body, you start telling Jajax a story of your most recent adventure","Jajax seems to be deflecting your questions but perhaps he is just tired from his recent battles","Question Jajax","You are certain of the barkeep's innocence","Laerind has asked you to question the various locals and learn more about the mysterious death of one of the villagers.","Ethring tavern is located in Ringló Vale.\
\
You should question Jajax.","Ethring tavern is located in Ringló Vale.\
\
You should question Jajax again.","Speak with Laerind","The Examination","Remembering again your task at hand you ask Jajax if he knows anything about the body you recently found.\
\
'This does not sound like something that I am interested in, friend. Please do not bother me with these things. Talk about something more interesting such as sailing ships or climbing mountains.'","Question Jajax again"}},
[12119]={nameES="The Exiled Giant",objectivesES={"Crágan Bris can be found in the hills west of Hlídborg in Câr Bronach.\
\
You should travel to Crágan Bris.","A lone giant sits, surrounded by rams","The Exiled Giant","Crágan Bris can be found in the hills west of Hlídborg in Câr Bronach.\
\
You should feed the rams at Crágan Bris.","Talk to Skálgrund at Crágan Bris","Mézto and be found at Grúmachath in central Câr Bronach.\
\
You should return to Mézto.","Talk to Skálgrund, the Exile at Crágan Bris","Crágan Bris can be found in the hills west of Hlídborg in Câr Bronach.\
\
You should talk to Skálgrund at Crágan Bris.","A lone stone-giant has been spotted sitting upon the old ruins of Crágan Bris.","Travel to Crágan Bris","Return to Mézto with what you have learned"}},
[12120]={nameES="The Expedition of the Mighty Court",objectivesES={}},
[12121]={nameES="La Magnitud de la Amenaza",objectivesES={"Elrond está en su biblioteca en Rivendel.\
\
Sigrun te ha pedido que regreses ante Elrond con noticias sobre la magnitud de la amenaza que ahora acecha dentro de Helegrod.","Habla con Elrond en Rivendel","La Magnitud de la Amenaza","Sigrun y Greip descubrieron que el mal que ha tomado Helegrod es mucho peor de lo que Glóin había sospechado."}},
[12122]={nameES="The Extracts of Ithilien",objectivesES={"Lush oxlip, horsetail, and vetchling can be found nearby Ereblen in north-western Ithilien.\
\
Ereblen has asked you to gather lush oxlip, horsetail, and vetchling, so that you might learn more of their uses.","Deliver the bundles of horsetail, oxlip, and vetchling to Ereblen","The Extracts of Ithilien","Ereblen can be found to the west of Henneth Annûn.\
\
You have harvested many of Ithilien's flowers and herbs, and you should now return to Ereblen.","The flowers and herbs of Ithilien have many potent medicinal uses, and gathering them would aid the Host of the West as well as the wounded of Gondor and Rohan."}},
[12123]={nameES="The Eyes and The Blind",objectivesES={}},
[12124]={nameES="The Eyes of Gorgar",objectivesES={"Náin the Slakeless can be found at Drenghól in the War of Three Peaks.\
\
You have defeated many of the roaming war-trolls of Gundabad at Azgh-buzru. You should return to Náin.","Deployed to protect the gates of Mount Gundabad and uncover the hidden refuge of Drenghól, mighty trolls roam the war-fell of Azgh-buzru.","Talk to Náin at Drenghól","The Eyes of Gorgar","Gundabad war-trolls can be found at Azgh-buzru.\
\
Náin has asked you to defeat roaming war-trolls of Gundabad at Azgh-buzru."}},
[12125]={nameES="The Fabled Fortune",objectivesES={"The contents of the treasure were more troubling than valuable: an intact skull, and a metallic tooth like Kotheret's.\
\
You should return to her in Mâr Naphra and seek answers.","An unnatural chill sets in...","Open the treasure chest","Try as you might, you cannot find Kotheret anywhere","The shade fades into nothingness","Kotheret Glint-grin seems to have vanished from Mâr Naphra. You may have your suspicions about what you discovered, but it seems your questions will never be put to rest.","Trying to open the treasure chest caused an angry shade to attack you.\
\
Now that you've vanquished it, you should try to open the chest again.","Kotheret Glint-grin seems to have vanished from Mâr Naphra.","Try to open the treasure chest","You've discovered what appears to be the treasure Kotheret told you about.\
\
You should try to open it.","Search for the rumoured treasure in Bax Garâkh","Completado","You hit something solid and unearth it!","Rumours of a treasure cache that once belonged to a Corsair captain have reached your ears.","You have discovered the possible location of the treasure cache.\
\
You should dig into the sand mound.","The ground here bears signs of past treasure-seekers","The Fabled Fortune","Find Kotheret Glint-grin in Mâr Naphra","The amount of coins in the chest barely comes close to what you were expecting -- or rather, hoping for.\
\
What truly catches your attention, however, is the preserved skull that sits among the coins. It greets you with an eternal, lipless smile.\
\
Hidden among the shining coins is a metallic tooth, one that looks eerily similar to Kotheret Glint-grin's...","Kotheret Glint-grin told you about the rumoured treasure. Whether the treasure is real, she cannot say.\
\
It may have been buried somewhere in Bax Garâkh, east of Mâr Naphra.","Dig into the sand mound"}},
[12126]={nameES="The Fading Grove",objectivesES={"Found Laivárth. Speak with Tálbiral","The Fading Grove","Speak with Tálbiral","Samítai has told you how to reach Laivárth in Adagím to the north-east. You are to speak with Tálbiral when you arrive at the grove.","You have found Laivárth in Adagím. Find and speak to Tálbiral and let him know that Samítai sent you.","Find Laivárth","Samítai has told you how to reach Laivárth in Adagím. You are to speak with Tálbiral when you arrive at the grove."}},
[12127]={nameES="The Fading of the Forests",objectivesES={"The Fading of the Forests","Talk to Agalûnu","Upset that she has been asked to leave Arwáth, Agalûnu wishes to speak to Shanathar directly.","Agalûnu has asked you to take her to meet the warden of Arwáth. You should tell her when you are ready to go.","You escorted Agalûnu to meet with Shanthar. He explained why she should not clear-cut trees, especially in Ambarûl. You should talk to Agalûnu and find out what she is thinking.","Complete Instance: The Fading of the Forests"}},
[12128]={nameES="Entrega fallida",objectivesES={"El cuerpo está frío al tacto, pero las heridas parecen recientes, aunque la falta de sangre alrededor del cadáver es inquietante. En su mano, el hombre sostiene una nota.\
\
Su posición y el rastro de tierra removida hacen parecer que atravesó la penumbra de las Quebradas de los Túmulos para llegar hasta aquí. La nota está mordisqueada y arrugada, y las únicas palabras legibles son: 'entre el Bosque Viejo y las Quebradas de los Túmulos del Norte. Envíen ayuda.'","Habla con Bob en el campamento de refugiados entre el Bosque Viejo y las Quebradas de los Túmulos del Norte","Encuentra el campamento de los supervivientes entre el Bosque Viejo y las Quebradas de los Túmulos del Norte","Te topaste con un pobre aventurero en las afueras de las Quebradas de los Túmulos del Norte. En la mano del cadáver encontraste una nota dirigida a Cebadilla Mantecona. Al parecer, su asistente Bob vino a los Túmulos para buscar a su hija y terminó en el oeste, entre las Quebradas de los Túmulos y la oscuridad implacable del Bosque Viejo.","Habla con uno de los supervivientes de la desafortunada expedición a las Quebradas de los Túmulos","Entrega fallida"}},
[12129]={nameES="The Faint-hearted",objectivesES={"The warrior does not agree with Aragorn's plan","Speak with Duinhir near Cair Andros","Aragorn learns of a group of the Enemy, camped inside the island fortress of Cair Andros.","Duinhir shows renewed strength in his role as a leader of these men","Duinhir is still shattered after the loss of his sons","Cair Andros is an island fortress in the Anduin River, bordering North Ithilien and Talath Anor.\
\
You should scout the entrance of Cair Andros.","Speak with Aragorn at the Host of the West encampment","Habla con Duinhir","Scout the entrance of Cair Andros","Aragorn can be found at the Host of the West encampment, on the border of North Ithilien and Dagorlad.\
\
You should speak with Aragorn.","Speak with Damrod","The warrior is just a farmer and is too frightened to continue","The warrior injured his ankle and believes he will just slow everyone down","Speak to the uncertain warrior","The Faint-hearted","Duinhir can be found near Cair Andros.\
\
You should speak to Duinhir.","Speak to the injured warrior","Duinhir, though uncertain, accepts the leadership of the Faint-hearted","Duinhir can be found at the Host of the West encampment, on the border of North Ithilien and Dagorlad.\
\
You should speak with Duinhir.","Damrod can be found to the north-east of Cair Andros at Caladuil.\
\
You should speak to Damrod.","Speak to a scared warrior","The entrance to the island is heavily guarded","Speak to Duinhir at the Host of the West encampment","Duinhir and soldiers of Gondor can be found at the Host of the West encampment, on the border of North Ithilien and Dagorlad.\
\
You should speak to some of those who have expressed concern with marching to the Black Gate."}},
[12130]={nameES="The Fall of Khazad-dûm (Weekly)",objectivesES={"Dáin can be found at Amdân.\
\
You should talk to Dáin.","Complete 'The Fall of Khazad-dûm'","Talk to Dáin at Amdân","The Fall of Khazad-dûm (Weekly)","After many long years, the fearsome Balrog known as Durin's Bane still lurks within the shadows of Khazad-dûm.","Dáin continues the story of Nafni, now near its ending.\
\
'And so Khazad-dûm was abandoned. Thráin I became king, barely older than I am now, and eventually he led our people to Erebor. Nafni earned his title \\qThe Unslain\\q for surviving his second encounter with the Balrog, and he would become a wise advisor and trusted friend to King Thráin. He was a great and noble dwarf of Durin's Folk.'\
\
Dáin appears even more pleased with his most recent recounting of the tale of Nafni the Unslain.\
\
'Khazad-dûm may have been abandoned, but the spirit of Durin's Folk has never dimmed!'","Complete 'The Fall of Khazad-dûm' on any difficulty.\
\
Use the Instance Finder to enter this instance."}},
[12131]={nameES="La caída de Khazad-dûm - Nivel 1",objectivesES={"King Náin I has ordered a final stand against the Balrog Durin's Bane.\
\
You must attempt to defeat the ancient fiend, and if that fails, survive!","En el año 1981 de la Tercera Edad, los Barbiluengos hicieron su última resistencia contra el Balrog conocido como 'El Daño de Durin'. Los valientes enanos que desafiaron el terror ese día serían los salvadores de su pueblo, pero el destino de su reino estaba sellado.","Survive the wrath of Durin's Bane","La caída de Khazad-dûm - Nivel 1"}},
