[12136]={nameES="The Fall of Khazad-dûm Raid Deeds!",objectivesES={}},
[12137]={nameES="La caída de Moria",objectivesES={"La caída de Moria","Habla con Ráthwald","Como has ayudado enormemente a los enanos de la expedición de Bósi y Brogur, quieren asegurarse de que conoces la historia de la caída de Moria antes de seguir colaborando con ellos.","Ráthwald está junto al arco, cerca del campamento de Echad Dúnann en Eregion.\
\
Ráthwald te ha contado la historia de la caída de Moria y está esperando para hablar contigo.","Ráthwald está junto al arco, cerca del campamento de Echad Dúnann en Eregion.\
\
Has ayudado mucho a los enanos de la expedición y ahora deberías regresar con Ráthwald para oír la historia de la caída de Moria.","Habla con Ráthwald y escucha la historia de la caída de Moria","Ráthwald está junto al arco, cerca del campamento de Echad Dúnann en Eregion.\
\
Ráthwald ha aceptado contarte la historia de la caída de Moria."}},
[12138]={nameES="La caída de Moria",objectivesES={"La caída de Moria","Skygni desea contarte la historia de la caída de Moria para que puedas apreciar mejor lo que ha logrado la expedición.","Habla con Skygni y escucha la historia de la caída de Moria","Habla con Skygni","Skygni se encuentra en la Sala Vigesimoprimera de Moria.\
\
Skygni te ha contado la historia de la caída de Moria y está esperando para hablar contigo.","Skygni se encuentra en la Sala Vigesimoprimera de Moria.\
\
Skygni ha accedido a contarte la historia de la caída de Moria."}},
[12139]={nameES="La caída de Thaurlach",objectivesES={"Habla con Glorfindel","Elrond se encuentra en la Última Morada en Rivendel, en el Bosque de los Trolls, lejos al sur de Angmar.\
\
Has derrotado al Balrog Thaurlach y deberías informar a Elrond Medio-Elfo de tus hazañas.","Has derrotado a Thaurlach y tienes en tu posesión un eslabón roto de la gran cadena que una vez mantuvo al Balrog en su prisión.","Glorfindel se encuentra afuera de la Última Morada, junto al Bruinen.\
\
Elrond te sugirió que hablaras con Glorfindel sobre la derrota de Thaurlach, ya que la historia le concierne mucho.","La caída de Thaurlach"}},
[12140]={nameES="La Caída de los Mírdain",objectivesES={"Tarandir se encuentra en las ruinas de una antigua torre de vigilancia en Caras Gelebren, en Ciénaga de los Cisnes.\
\
Has encontrado a un solitario elfo vistiendo una ornamentada armadura, de pie entre las ruinas de Caras Gelebren. El elfo, Tarandir, se ha ofrecido a contarte la historia de la perdición de Caras Gelebren.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Para avanzar en esta misión, debes completar la Escaramuza: La perdición de Caras Gelebren. Si aún no has completado el tutorial de Escaramuza, debes visitar cualquier Campamento de Escaramuza y hablar con el Capitán de Escaramuza. Estos campamentos pueden encontrarse por toda la Tierra Media, en lugares como Bree, la Puerta de Thorin, Ost Guruth y Rivendel.</rgb>","Escucha la historia de Tarandir y completa 'La perdición de Caras Gelebren'","Tarandir se encuentra en las ruinas de una antigua torre de vigilancia en Caras Gelebren, en Ciénaga de los Cisnes.\
\
Has hecho lo que Tarandir te pidió, escuchando ante las ruinas de la Casa de los Mírdain. Debes volver con Tarndir.","Tarandir se encuentra en las ruinas de una antigua torre de vigilancia en Caras Gelebren, en Ciénaga de los Cisnes.\
\
Has escuchado el relato de Tarandir sobre la perdición de Caras Gelebren. Debes hablar con Tarandir.","Habla con Tarandir","Viaja a las ruinas de la Casa de los Mírdain","Las ruinas de la Casa de los Mírdain se encuentran en el punto más oriental de Caras Gelebren.\
\
Tarandir te ha pedido que te pongas frente a las ruinas de la Casa de los Mírdain y escuches para honrar la memoria de su gente. Debes encontrar las ruinas de la Casa de los Mírdain y escuchar para honrar la memoria de los Mírdain.","Hace mucho tiempo, los elfos de Tham Mírdain liderados por Celebrimbor crearon obras grandiosas, pero cuando fueron engañados por el Enemigo, la ruina cayó sobre ellos.","No escuchas nada salvo el viento y el gentil chapoteo cercano del agua...","Las ruinas de la Casa de los Mírdain se alzan frente a ti","La Caída de los Mírdain","<rgb=#00ff00>Escucha</rgb> en las ruinas de la Casa de los Mírdain"}},
[12141]={nameES="La caída de las Quebradas del Norte",objectivesES={"La caída de las Quebradas del Norte","Saeradan está en su cabaña, al sur del Viejo Fuerte del Camino Verde.\
\
Andreg te pidió que hablaras con Saeradan sobre la expansión de los orcos desde las Quebradas del Norte.","Habla con Saeradan en su cabaña","Andreg está preocupado por los orcos que han vulnerado las fronteras de las Tierras de Bree desde las Quebradas del Norte."}},
[12142]={nameES="The Fallen Grove",objectivesES={"Tûm is at the grove atop Gwaed Brun in the Mournshaws, north of Oirnad Culch.\
\
You should return to Tûm with news of your success.","A maddened elhudan spirit has claimed Oirnad Culch, south of Gwaed Brun.\
\
Tûm has asked you to defeat the wild spirits that have overrun the grove the Derudh once called their own.","Talk to Tûm at Gwaed Brun","Defeat the maddened elhudan at Oirnad Culch","Defeated the maddened elhudan","The Derudh Tûm claims that the spirits of the forest have been angered and have driven away the rest of the Derudh. He hopes to reclaim their grove and perhaps help you find the way into the Huntsman's hall.","The Fallen Grove"}},
[12143]={nameES="The Fallen King Renewed",objectivesES={"The Fallen King Renewed","With the Host of the West on the march, Angbor has been given orders to mend the Statue of the Fallen King.","The statue finally shines after many years of neglect and vandalism","Suitable stone can be found in and around after-battle Osgiliath. Suitable water can be found along the Anduin nearby.\
\
You should collect some stone for mending the Statue of the Fallen King and water for washing away the scrawls and filth.","Talk to Angbor","The statue is at the after-battle Cross-roads.\
\
You should clean the Gondorian posts around the Statue of the Fallen King.","Talk to Arandol","The statue is at the after-battle Cross-roads.\
\
You should clean the Statue of the Fallen King.","You should talk to Arandol, who  can be found at the after-battle Cross-roads.","You should talk to Angbor, who can be found at the Cross-roads.","Clean the scrawls and filth from off the statue","You should talk to Arandol, who can be found at the after-battle Cross-roads."}},
[12144]={nameES="The Fallen King in Ruin",objectivesES={"Talk to Arandol","You should talk to Arandol, who can be found by the statue at the after-battle Cross-roads.","The Fallen King in Ruin","Retrieve the statue's original head","The statue is at the after-battle Cross-roads.\
\
You should retrieve the original head of the Statue of the Fallen King.","The statue is at the after-battle Cross-roads.\
\
You should place the original head upon the Statue of the Fallen King.","You should talk to Arandol, who can be found at the after-battle Cross-roads.","Place the original head upon the statue","With the Host of the West on the march, Angbor has been given orders to mend the Statue of the Fallen King.","The statue is at the after-battle Cross-roads.\
\
You should break the defiled head upon the Statue of the Fallen King.","The statue is at the after-battle Cross-roads.\
\
You should remove the Orkish poles placed around the Statue of the Fallen King.","Break the defiled statue head"}},
[12145]={nameES="The Fallen Kings -- Tier 1",objectivesES={}},
[12146]={nameES="The Fallen Kings -- Tier 2",objectivesES={}},
[12147]={nameES="The Fallen Kings -- Tier 3",objectivesES={}},
[12148]={nameES="The Fallen Palace",objectivesES={"The prince has retreated into the Palace of Ekal-nêbi. He must be pursed and defeated for Mizâdi to claim victory.","Góramul Sai has been defeated, and Thothril the Entangler has retreated.\
\
You should talk to Mizâdi.","Complete 'Ekal-nêbi, the Fallen Palace' on any difficulty","Talk to Mizâdi","The Fallen Palace","Mizâdi has requested your help tracking down and defeating Góramul Sai inside the palace.\
\
You should complete 'Ekal-nêbi, the Fallen Palace' on any difficulty using the Instance Finder."}},
[12149]={nameES="The Fallen Stars",objectivesES={"Search for the lost Ranger inside the Dome of Stars","The Fallen Stars","The Ranger's body is battered and contorted as if he were dropped from a great height...","Golthor can be found outside the old Houses of Healing in north-eastern Osgiliath.\
\
You found the Ranger, but it was too late to save him. You should return to Golthor with these grim tidings.","The Dome of Stars can be found in central Osgiliath.\
\
Golthor has asked you to seek a Ranger who travelled toward the Dome of Stars. You should begin your search by the eastern bridge onto the island.","Talk to Golthor","You have found the bridge and should now search for the lost Ranger","Fearing for the life of his fellow, Golthor sends you to investigate the ruined Dome of Stars, a once-beautiful palace now twisted into a vile stronghold of the Enemy.","Search for the eastern bridge to the Dome of Stars","The Ranger is likely somewhere within the Dome of Stars.\
\
You did not find the Ranger outside the Dome of Stars, and should now carefully search within it."}},
[12150]={nameES="The Fallen Within",objectivesES={"The Fallen Within","Corrupted Gondorian Soliders can be found deep within Anglach: The Great Foundry.\
\
You should put these poor souls to rest.","A notice hangs from the board, stamped with the royal seal of Gondor:\
\
'It has been discovered that some of Captain Lachír's men remain in Anglach, corrupted beyond hope. It is with sadness we request an adventurer enter Anglach and put these poor souls to rest. Seek out Candúr at the Udûn Foothold for passage into Anglach.'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Warning: This quest requires Anglach: The Great Foundry to be underway. If that quest has been completed or failed, you will be unable enter this instance in order to complete this quest.</rgb>","Gondorian soldiers have fallen to the corruption within Anglach. An adventurer is needed to brave the depths and put these poor souls to rest."}},
[12151]={nameES="The Fallow Deer",objectivesES={"You brought the deer to Raphûz. He bound his wound and said he would take the deer back to Iridír and secure medicine to heal the deer. He asked you to visit him in Iridír.","The deer lay before you, injured, but alive. You dealt with the serval. You should lift the fallow deer and deliver it to Raphûz.","Speak with Raphûz outside of the serval sire's den","Defeat the serval sire, Buzanbûri","Raphûz is injured and asked you to rescue the deer","The Fallow Deer","Speak with Raphûz at Iridír","The deer stirs and begins to follow you.\
\
Bring the deer to Raphûz.","You delivered the deer to Raphûz","Raphûz recounts a tale he overheard while travelling to Iridír of a woman searching for her pet deer traded to a man meant to free her mother's spirit from the creature.","Buzanbûri, the serval sire, has been defeated","You fought your way through the servals. Find Raphûz outside of the den and speak with him.","Raphûz asked you to assist him in saving a deer from being sacrificed to a serval sire in a den north-west of Iridír. He will meet you near the den where the deer is kept.","Raphûz is injured and cannot assist with fighting the serval. He asked you to enter the den to defeat the serval and recover the deer.","Rescue the deer and bring it to Raphûz"}},
[12152]={nameES="El Fanático y su Devoto",objectivesES={"Derrota a Igash","Avar se encuentra en la Guardia Orca, al suroeste de la Gran Escalera.\
\
Debes regresar con Avar e informarle de que has dado muerte a Igash y a su Devoto.","Igash derrotado","Igash y su Devoto se encuentran en lo alto de la Gran Escalera, al noreste de la Guardia Orca.\
\
Avar te ha pedido que avances y derrotes a Igash y a su Devoto.","Habla con Avar en la Guardia Orca","Derrota al Devoto","Los orcos de Moria controlan la Gran Escalera, liderados por Igash el Fanático y su Devoto esbirro. Junto a ellos se alza una hueste de temibles orcos procedentes de lo más profundo de Moria.","El Devoto derrotado","El Fanático y su Devoto"}},
[12153]={nameES="The Fane of Screaming",objectivesES={"The hill once known as Ondoher's Folly has been fortified into a horrific shrine of the Enemy where Orcs torture and kill their prisoners.","Talk to Laeglaw at Tham Durlan","Laeglaw can be found due north of Haerondir at Tham Durlan.\
\
You have defeated many of the Orcs at Ondoher's Folly and should now return to Laeglaw.","The Fane of Screaming","Orcs can be found throughout Ondoher's Folly in north-western Dagorlad.\
\
Laeglaw has asked you to assault the hill of Ondoher's Folly and defeat the Orcs who have claimed it."}},
[12154]={nameES="La Mano que Alcanza Lejos",objectivesES={"Frith-vailë está en la parte noreste de Ram Dúath.\
\
El líder Tuokki, esperando desanimar a los Orcos y a los Angmarim, te ha pedido que derrotes al Capitán de los Angmarim en Ram Dúath.","El líder Tuokki está en el campamento Suuri-lehmä en Ram Dúath.\
\
Ahora que has derrotado al Capitán de la Corona de Hierro, regresa con el líder de los Hijos de la Tierra y cuéntale de tu hazaña.","El líder Tuokki está preocupado de que los Angmarim que comandan a los Orcos los envíen a luchar contra los Hijos de la Tierra.","La Mano que Alcanza Lejos"}},
[12155]={nameES="¡La Feria de los Granjeros ha llegado!",objectivesES={"Prepárate para viajar y disfrutar de la Feria de los Granjeros de este año. ¡Date prisa y únete a los festejos!\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Completar esta misión te permitirá viajar automáticamente al pueblo de Delagua en la Comarca.</rgb>","Viaja a Delagua en la Comarca para participar en la celebración de la Feria de los Granjeros","Cada año, los Hobbits de Delagua celebran el final del verano y la abundancia de la cosecha anual organizando una espectacular Feria de los Granjeros en el centro del pueblo. ¡Ven a visitarla y únete a la diversión!","El mercado rebosa de actividad y el sol calienta. ¡La feria está en todo su esplendor!","Viaja a Delagua"}},
[12156]={nameES="The Farms of the Norcrofts",objectivesES={"<rgb=#FF0000>Completing Aiding the Eastemnet will cancel this quest</rgb>","Hwitnyd is at Cliving.\
\
Hwitnyd will be pleased to hear that you have driven the Orcs from the farms of the Norcrofts.","Mounted Orcs are razing the farms of the Norcrofts.","Talk to Hwitnyd","Mounted Orcs can be found in the farms of the Norcrofts.\
\
Hwitnyd asked you to ride out into the farms of the Norcrofts and defeat the mounted Orcs rampaging through the fields.","The Farms of the Norcrofts"}},
[12157]={nameES="The Farms of the Sutcrofts",objectivesES={"Daggaric is at Snowbourn.\
\
Daggaric will be pleased to hear that many of the Warg-riders have been driven from the farms of the Sutcrofts.","The Farms of the Sutcrofts","<rgb=#FF0000>Completing Aiding the Eastemnet will cancel this quest</rgb>","Warg-riders can be found at the farms of the Sutcrofts.\
\
Daggaric asked you to head to the farms of the Sutcrofts and defeat the Warg-riders rampaging through the fields.","Goblin-riders are riding through the farms of the Sutcrofts, destroying needed food and crops.","Talk to Daggaric"}},
[12158]={nameES="El Pergamino de la Reina de la Moda",objectivesES={"Lleva el pergamino de la Reina de la Moda a un sastre para intercambiarlo por el paquete que la Reina dejó para ti. Puedes encontrar sastres en Celondim, Cepeda, Puente de Caballetes, Othrikar, Rivendel, la Mansión de Thorin, Cavada Grande y Bree.","En algún momento llamaste la atención de la Reina de la Moda, quien juzgó tu apariencia y la encontró deficiente.","Este pergamino, redactado con gran elegancia, te indica que lo lleves a un sastre, quien lo intercambiará por un paquete que la Reina de la Moda dejó para ti. El texto continúa diciendo que puedes encontrar sastres en Celondim, Cepeda, Puente de Caballetes, Othrikar, Rivendel, la Mansión de Thorin, Cavada Grande y Bree.","Lleva el pergamino de la Reina de la Moda a un sastre","El Pergamino de la Reina de la Moda"}},
[12159]={nameES="El Pergamino de la Reina de la Moda",objectivesES={"En algún momento llamaste la atención de la Reina de la Moda, quien evaluó tu apariencia y te encontró deslumbrante, ¡un verdadero parangón de la moda!","Este pergamino, redactado con gran elegancia, te indica que lo lleves a un sastre, quien lo intercambiará por un paquete que la Reina de la Moda dejó para ti. También señala que puedes encontrar sastres en Celondim, Ceoeda, Puente de Caballetes, Othrikar, Rivendel, la Mansión de Thorin, Cavada Grande y Bree.","Lleva el pergamino de la Reina de la Moda a un sastre para intercambiarlo por el paquete que la Reina dejó para ti. Puedes encontrar sastres en Celondim, Cepeda, Puente de Caballetes, Othrikar, Rivendel, la Mansión de Thorin, Cavada Grande y Bree.","El Pergamino de la Reina de la Moda","Lleva el pergamino de la Reina de la Moda a un sastre"}},
[12160]={nameES="El Pergamino de la Reina de la Moda",objectivesES={"Lleva el pergamino de la Reina de la Moda a un sastre para intercambiarlo por el paquete que la Reina dejó para ti. Puedes encontrar sastres en Celondim, Cepeda, Puente de Caballetes, Othrikar, Rivendel, la Mansión de Thorin, Cavada Grande y Bree.","El Pergamino de la Reina de la Moda","En algún momento llamaste la atención de la Reina de la Moda, quien juzgó tu apariencia y la encontró deficiente.","Este pergamino, redactado con gran elegancia, te indica que lo lleves a un sastre, quien lo intercambiará por un paquete que la Reina de la Moda dejó para ti. El texto continúa diciendo que puedes encontrar sastres en Celondim, Cepeda, Puente de Caballetes, Othrikar, Rivendel, la Mansión de Thorin, Cavada Grande y Bree.","Lleva el pergamino de la Reina de la Moda a un sastre"}},
[12161]={nameES="El Pergamino de la Reina de la Moda",objectivesES={"Lleva el pergamino de la Reina de la Moda a un sastre para intercambiarlo por el paquete que la Reina dejó para ti. Puedes encontrar sastres en Celondim, Cepeda, Puente de Caballetes, Othrikar, Rivendel, la Mansión de Thorin, Cavada Grande y Bree.","El Pergamino de la Reina de la Moda","En algún momento llamaste la atención de la Reina de la Moda, quien juzgó tu apariencia y la encontró deficiente.","Este pergamino, redactado con gran elegancia, te indica que lo lleves a un sastre, quien lo intercambiará por un paquete que la Reina de la Moda dejó para ti. El texto continúa diciendo que puedes encontrar sastres en Celondim, Cepeda, Puente de Caballetes, Othrikar, Rivendel, la Mansión de Thorin, Cavada Grande y Bree.","Lleva el pergamino de la Reina de la Moda a un sastre"}},
[12162]={nameES="The Fatal Prize",objectivesES={"Return to Mulnír at the Foothold","You have found Captain Lachír. He, in turn, has found ingots of metal he believes are imbued with great power, and ordered his men to gather all they could find.","The Fatal Prize","Return to Mulnír","Talk to Captain Lachír","You should talk to Captain Lachír in Anglach, in Udûn, to learn what will happen next."}},
[12163]={nameES="The Fate of Durthang",objectivesES={"Patrol the gate of Durthang in Lhingris","You have discovered the terrible aftermath of a battle between the warriors of Durthang and the spiders of Lhingris...","The Fate of Durthang","Talk to the dying Uruk at Durthang","After realising that Orcs were fleeing Durthang into Lhingris, Legolas desires to learn what happened at the gate of the fortress.","The gate of Durthang can be found on the road in Lhingris to the north of the ruined encampment.\
\
Legolas has asked you to patrol Durthang and learn what has transpired between the Orcs and spiders there.","The dying Uruk can be found near the gate of Durthang in Lhingris.\
\
You have arrived to find the aftermath of a bloody battle between the warriors of Durthang and the spiders of Lhingris. An Uruk nearby with grave wounds may be able to explain what happened."}},
[12164]={nameES="The Fate of Honey-bell",objectivesES={"Haldis can be found at the Beorninghús.\
\
You should talk to Haldis about where she found Honey-bell.","Find some sign of Honey-bell in the Beorning-lands","Honey-bell can be found at the Beorninghús.\
\
You should give Honey-bell a good pat.","Sterkist can be found at the Beorninghús.\
\
You should talk to Sterkist.","The Fate of Honey-bell","What a friendly cow!","Talk to Haldis","This bell belonged to Honey-bell, but its presence belies her absence","Give Honey-bell a good <rgb=#00FF00>pat</rgb>","Honey-bell is probably somewhere in the Beorning-lands, beyond Sterkist's sight.\
\
You should find some sign of Honey-bell's wanderings.","Talk to Sterkist","Sterkist has been tasked with feeding the cows, but he has run into a bit of a snag: one of them is missing.","Bring Honey-bell's bell to Sterkist","Sterkist can be found at the Beorninghús.\
\
You should show Sterkist the bell you found."}},
[12165]={nameES="The Fate of Lornost",objectivesES={"Nimithil can be found in Ost Anglebed in north-central Lebennin.\
\
You have searched Lornost thoroughly and discovered the cause for its fall. You should return to Nimithil and tell her what you have learned.","The note, crafted by the people of Lornost, contains a determined refusal to surrender","The Fate of Lornost","Travel to Lornost to the south-east of Ost Anglebed","The note is speared into a man's chest in the north-western corner of Lornost in Lebennin.\
\
You have not found any survivors, but you have discovered a note on a fallen man. You should examine it before returning to Ost Anglebed.","This paper is singed beyond recognition...","Lornost can be found to the south-east of Ost Anglebed in Lebennin.\
\
You have not found any sign of survivors or the Enemy outside of a paper from the Scourge. You should continue your search deeper in Lornost.","You have arrived at Lornost and should investigate the sacked settlement","You discover a slain man with a note speared to his chest...","Collect the note from the fallen man of Lornost","Deliver the news of Lornost to Nimithil in Ost Anglebed","Search deeper in Lornost","Brought to ruin by a combined force of Corsairs and Haradrim, Lornost was once a beautiful settlement of Lebennin.","Lornost can be found to the south-east of Anglebed across the river Sarni.\
\
Nimithil has asked you to search the sacked settlement of Lornost for any sign of survivors or the Enemy.","Singed papers can be found throughout Lornost in Lebennin.\
\
You have not found any survivors, but singed papers swirl through the air nearby. You should see if they contain any useful information.","This paper details an offer of peace if the people of Lornost surrender their lands"}},
[12166]={nameES="El destino de Prunella Boffin",objectivesES={"El destino de Prunella Boffin","Fosco Boffin está en Scary, cerca del centro del pueblo.\
\
Fosco se mostró inquieto cuando recuperaste el paraguas de su tía Prunella; sin embargo, una vecina le informó que en realidad la había estado visitando todo el día y que Prunella había perdido su paraguas horas antes. Fosco hace señas para que te acerques.","Puede haber trasgos en el noroeste de los Campos Verdes. Si uno de ellos se llevó el paraguas de la tía Prunella, podría estar en alguno de sus campamentos.\
\
Prometiste a Fosco Boffin que buscarías el paraguas de su tía Prunella. Él teme que ella se haya topado con trasgos.","Recoge el paraguas de Prunella","Encuentra el paraguas de la tía Prunella","Entrega el paraguas de Prunella a Fosco Boffin","Fosco Boffin está en Scary, cerca del centro del pueblo.\
\
Prometiste a Fosco Boffin que buscarías el paraguas de su tía Prunella. Él teme que ella se haya encontrado con trasgos.","Fosco Boffin, en Scary, está preocupado por su tía, una hobbit respetable llamada Prunella."}},
[12167]={nameES="The Fate of the Dissenters",objectivesES={}},
[12168]={nameES="El destino del Ectheldur",objectivesES={"El destino del Ectheldur","Has llegado a las Agujas de la Linde y ahora puedes inspeccionar el Lago Evendim","Viaja a las Agujas de la Linde","Viaja a Men Erain","Saqueadores de tumbas derrotados en Rantost (8/8)","Inspecciona el Lago Evendim desde Tyl Ruinen","Los Montaraces del Norte en Evendim han buscado durante mucho tiempo los restos del Ectheldur, el antiguo navío-insignia de Annúminas, pero sus esfuerzos no han pasado desapercibidos por un grupo de saqueadores de tumbas del sur.","Tarneth se encuentra en Tinnudir, a orillas del Lago Evendim.","Deberías examinar el mapa de Naegir y ver si notas algo más que Tarneth haya pasado por alto.","Habla con Tarneth","En efecto, el Lago Evendim parece haber subido, pero estas marcas apuntan a Annúminas","Has inspeccionado el Lago Evendim desde las Agujas de la Linde","Viaja a Tyl Ruinen","Inspecciona el Lago Evendim desde Tinnudir","Has inspeccionado el Lago Evendim desde Men Erain","Has llegado a Tinnudir y ahora puedes inspeccionar el Lago Evendim","Tarneth te ha pedido inspeccionar el Lago Evendim desde varios lugares usando su catalejo.\
\
Debes viajar a Tinnudir, las Agujas de la Linde, Men Erain y la isla de Tyl Ruinen para inspeccionar el Lago Evendim. Puedes inspeccionar el lago cerca de los maestros de muelle en cada uno de estos lugares.","Has inspeccionado el Lago Evendim desde Tyl Ruinen","Inspecciona el Lago Evendim desde las Agujas de la Linde","Examina el mapa de Naegir","Entrega el extraño mapa a Tarneth en Tinnudir","Habla con Tarneth y busca los restos del Ectheldur","Habla con Tarneth en Tinnudir","Has llegado a Tyl Ruinen y ahora puedes inspeccionar el Lago Evendim","Inspecciona el Lago Evendim desde Men Erain","Has inspeccionado el Lago Evendim desde Tinnudir","Has llegado a Men Erain y ahora puedes inspeccionar el Lago Evendim","Los saqueadores de tumbas se encuentran en Rantost, en las islas del norte del Lago Evendim.\
\
Tarneth te ha pedido derrotar a los saqueadores de tumbas en Rantost y averiguar por qué han comenzado a buscar en las viejas ruinas."}},
[12169]={nameES="The Fate of the Gladden Fields",objectivesES={"Radagast can be found in the Gladden Fields.\
\
After learning of several concerning matters, Radagast has asked you to meet him in the Gladden Fields.","The Fate of the Gladden Fields","Talk to Radagast in the Gladden Fields","Concerned by new threats and unfamiliar names come to the Vales of Anduin, Radagast has enlisted your aid to help mend the hurts done to the Gladden Fields.","Meet Radagast at the Gladden Fields","Radagast gazes solemnly into the distance","Radagast can be found in the Gladden Fields.\
\
You have found Radagast standing on a small bluff on the marshy banks of the Anduin."}},
[12170]={nameES="The Fate of the Livestock",objectivesES={}},
[12171]={nameES="The Fate of the Wastes",objectivesES={"Mílgamel can be found at Haerondir.\
\
You have planted the various mushrooms and herbs in the soil you gathered and should now speak to Mílgamel.","Habla con Mílgamel","Mílgamel can be found at Haerondir.\
\
The slag-water ruptured the planting box and dripped into the soil at Haerondir. You should speak to Mílgamel.","The slag-water begins seeping out of newly-formed cracks in the planting box!","Wait with Mílgamel","The planting boxes can be found near Mílgamel in Haerondir.\
\
Mílgamel has asked you to plant the flowers and herbs she carried from Ithilien in the soil of Dagorlad you brought to Haerondir. She also wishes for you to re-plant the mushrooms in the soil.","Although the Wastes have long laid desolate, Mílgamel holds hope that these barren lands can again be restored to their long-vanished beauty.","Mílgamel is at Haerondir.\
\
Mílgamel has added a splash of the slag-water to one of the planting boxes, and has asked you to wait with her and observe the results.","The Fate of the Wastes","Talk to Mílgamel at Haerondir"}},
[12172]={nameES="The Fates of the Damned",objectivesES={"Dernaith can be found at the foot of the statue of Sauron near the Oath-taker's Horn in Dor Amarth.\
\
Megoril has asked you to speak to Dernaith about the fates of the dwarf-rings and their bearers.","Gimli can be found outside the Oath-taker's Horn in Dor Amarth.\
\
Dernaith has told you of a confrontation he had with an echo of the Dark Lord, a glamour, bound to the statue of Sauron. The glamour spoke cryptically, but told of the damned in the Mordath - the Black Pits of Mordor. You should return to Gimli and see if he has come to a decision about what is to be done about the Firehorns and King Váskmun Greytooth.","Talk to Gimli outside the Oath-taker's Horn","The Fates of the Damned","Talk to Dernaith outside the Oath-taker's Horn","Upon the plains of Dor Amarth, you have found two Elves, Dernaith and Megoril, who have come to Mordor in search of their long-lost companion."}},
[12173]={nameES="The Father of the Sutcrofts",objectivesES={"Fastred wishes to speak to you in private at the site of his father's grave. He has expressed a desire to explain his father's legacy and his hopes for the future of his people.","Talk to Fastred","The Father of the Sutcrofts","Fastred can be found inside the mead hall of Snowbourn.\
\
Having spoken to Fastred at his father's grave, and fended off a strange, powerful foe, you should speak to Fastred in Snowbourn.","Fastred can be found in the mead hall of Snowbourn.\
\
Fastred has asked you to accompany him to the site of his father's grave, where he wishes to speak to you in private."}},
[12174]={nameES="El filón principal",objectivesES={"Regin está en Othrikar.\
\
Encontraste una formación rocosa que coincide con la descripción que Regin compiló a partir del mapa y los antiguos registros. Deberías llevar la muestra de mineral que tomaste del sitio de vuelta a Regin.","Lleva la muestra de mineral a Regin.","El filón principal está en algún lugar al noroeste de Othrikar.  Encuentra al padre en la roca virgen\
  El filón yace entre altas colinas\
  Halcones feroces surcan los cielos y\
  Linces salvajes custodian los desfiladeros\
  Brilla la plata, reluce el oro\
  Los riscos del acantilado guardan el secreto\
\
Los antiguos registros combinados con el mapa minero sugirieron a Regin la ubicación del filón principal, pero las instrucciones estaban lejos de ser precisas. Regin te ha pedido que encuentres una formación rocosa adecuada y tomes una muestra de mineral.","Con el mapa que recuperaste del Capataz Nyrad y las runas de los antiguos registros, Regin puede haber determinado la ubicación general del filón principal.","Has tomado una muestra de mineral.","Ubica el filón principal y toma una muestra de mineral.","El filón principal"}},
[12175]={nameES="The Feast",objectivesES={"Pick up wheat from Gadir, the farmer. He can be found along the road to the Elder Hall.","Pick up jugs of khôrob from Ziriha, the merchant","Return to Elder Roshat in the centre of Khûtra.","Talk to Elder Roshat about the feast","Give jugs of khôrob to Ekhmun","Give fish to Ekhmun","Pick up jugs of khôrob from Ziriha, the merchant. She can be found by the fishing pier.","The Feast","You have healed Khûtra. Now Roshat is throwing a feast, and you are the guest of honour. Don't be late!","Deliver ingredients to Ekhmun, the cook. He can be found near Ziriha.","Pick up sheaf of wheat from Gadir, the farmer","Pick up fish from Umaris, the fisher. She can be found by the fishing pier.","Give all the gathered ingredients to Ekhmun, the cook","Give sheaf of wheat to Ekhmun","Pick up fish from Umaris, the fisher"}},
[12176]={nameES="The Feast",objectivesES={"Take your place as the guest of honour","Take your place as the guest of honour where the feast has been laid out.","You have healed Khûtra. Now Roshat is throwing a feast, and you are the guest of honour. Don't be late!","Listen to Elder Roshat, then cheer with him","The Feast","Listen to Elder Roshat, then cheer with him."}},
[12177]={nameES="The Feast of the Running Stag",objectivesES={"Talk to Elder Riagán","The Feast of the Running Stag","Elder Riagán is in Lhan Tarren.\
\
You should speak with Elder Riagán.","Talk to Riagán to attend the Feast of the Running Stag","The time is nigh for the annual Feast of the Running Stag. You have been asked to be present for the rites as an honoured guest of Lhan Tarren.","You should speak with Elder Riagán in Lhan Tarren.\
\
The Elder of the Stag-clan has looked forward to inviting you to the festival."}},
[12178]={nameES="¡El Festival del Solsticio de Verano ha llegado!",objectivesES={"A medida que se acerca el día del solsticio de verano, los pueblos de la Tierra Media se reúnen para el Festival del Solsticio. Se ha corrido la voz de que habrá una gran celebración en Minas Tirith y que todos están invitados.\
\
¡Disfruta del baile, la alegría y el amor con tu familia y amigos!\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Nota: Luego de aceptar esta misión, recibirás un mapa. Utilízalo para viajar a Minas Tirith y unirte a la celebración del Solsticio de Verano. También hay festejos más pequeños en Ered Luin, las Tierras de Bree, la Comarca e Isla Remota.</rgb>","A medida que se acerca el día del solsticio de verano, los pueblos de la Tierra Media se reúnen para celebrar el gran Festival del Solsticio. ¡Disfruta del baile, la alegría y el amor con tu familia y amigos!"}},
[12179]={nameES="The Fiddle and the Drum",objectivesES={"Lady Fremedon of Underharrow finds herself at odds with Éowyn as she makes ready for the impending migration to Dunharrow.","Ellen Fremedon can be found outside the Mead Hall of Underharrow.\
\
You have spoken to Ellen Fremedon of her family and Underharrow. You should now speak to her of other matters.","Talk to Ellen Fremedon","The Fiddle and the Drum","DNT -- Players will not see","Ellen Fremedon can be found outside the Mead Hall in Underharrow.\
\
You have arrived at Underharrow and met with Ellen Fremedon, the settlement's acting leader. You should now speak to Ellen to learn more of her and her burdens."}},
[12180]={nameES="El Quinto Engranaje",objectivesES={"Lleva el quinto engranaje a Bávor","Bávor está en la Mansión de Thorin.\
\
Bávor estará complacido de ver que has recuperado el quinto y último engranaje.","El Quinto Engranaje","Quinto engranaje perdido encontrado","Encuentra el quinto engranaje perdido","El quinto engranaje está en un cofre en una guarida de arañas al norte y al este de Kheledûl, en el este de Haudh Lin.\
\
Bávor te ha pedido que recuperes el quinto y último engranaje de una terrible guarida de arañas.","Bávor es un mecánico encargado de reparar el gran mecanismo que da acceso a la legendaria Bóveda de la Montaña."}},
[12181]={nameES="The Fight Goes On",objectivesES={"Help Sorkamâl with 'Implements of Evil'","Help Numûru with 'Barging into the Barracks'","Help Numûru with 'Cleaning the Streets'","Help Sorkamâl with 'Return to the Royal Quarter'","The Fight Goes On","Help Razâl with 'Orkish Allies'","You have done much to win the battle at Emax Dûl.\
\
You should return to Numûru in Nashûbu.","Help Razâl with 'Consuming Madness'","Help Hanâbu with 'The Boon of Aradûn'","Your allies at Nashûbu have requests to complete to further the war effort.\
\
You should complete quests to help win the battle in Emax Dûl.","Talk to Numûru","You have done much to further the war effort in Emax Dûl.\
\
You should return to Numûru in Nashûbu for instructions.","(Optional) Use the Hamâti War-horse to quickly travel back to camp","Numûru believes you should return to camp to assess what actions can best win the battle in Emax Dûl.\
\
You can return to Nashûbu quickly using the nearby Hamâti War-horse.","There is still more to do to win the battle in Emax Dûl.","Return to Nashûbu"}},
[12182]={nameES="La lucha por Carn Dûm (Diaria)",objectivesES={"Muirál se encuentra en Bail Avarc, en Angmar.\
\
Has hecho mucho para ayudar a los que se oponen a la Corona de Hierro en Carn Dûm. Debes hablar con Muirál.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Bail Avarc no es accesible inicialmente, solo a través de rutas de maestros de establo. Bail Avarc se puede alcanzar a través de los maestros de establos en Esteldín, Gath Forthnír y los establos de Rivendel.</rgb>","Completa 'Sant Lhoer, los Jardines Envenenados', 'Thaurisgar, el boticario infame', 'Sagroth, la Guarida de las Alimañas' o 'Gwathrenost, la Ciudadela del Rey Brujo'","La lucha por Carn Dûm (Diaria)","Los montañeses de Angmar y sus aliados trabajan para oponerse a los restos de la Corona de Hierro que vuelven a habitar dentro de los muros de Carn Dûm.","Debes ayudar a los Montañeses de Angmar y trabajar para oponerte a la Corona de Hierro en Carn Dûm.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Para avanzar en esta misión, debes completar una de las siguientes en cualquier tamaño de grupo o nivel de dificultad: 'Sant Lhoer, los Jardines Envenenados', 'Thaurisgar, el boticario infame', 'Sagroth, la Guarida de las Alimañas' o 'Gwathrenost, la Ciudadela del Rey Brujo'.</rgb>","Habla con Muirál en Bail Avarc"}},
[12183]={nameES="The Final Blockade",objectivesES={"Defeat the enemies assaulting the barricades and ballistae protecting the Hornburg. Aragorn will aid in the defence, but if he or the blockade fall, the Hornburg will surely be lost to your foes.","The Final Blockade","The enemy has sent a group of Orcs and trolls to destroy the ballistae on the tower above the gate-house and to breach the last fortifications along the walkway to the Hornburg. The ballistae and barricades have served to aid in the defence of the fortress and will be a heavy loss if destroyed by the enemy.\
\
Merit Rating\
\
This quest starts with <rgb=#FFFF00>Full</rgb> Merit Rating.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Major Merit Loss:</rgb>\
- Ballista structurally damaged\
- Barricade structurally damaged\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Minor Merit Loss:</rgb>\
- Rohirrim guard defeated"}},
[12184]={nameES="The Final Captain",objectivesES={"Shumug can be found roaming the after-battle Pelennor.\
\
You should find and defeat the Orc captain Shumug.","Habla con Éomer","Defeat Shumug","The Final Captain","Defeated Shumug, the bane of the Rohirrim","You should talk to Éomer, who can be found at Aragorn's pavilion on the after-battle Pelennor.","An Orc captain remains on the Pelennor, determined to fight to the last and bring as many Men down with him as he can."}},
[12185]={nameES="El desafío final",objectivesES={"El desafío final","El jefe Walraig está con los suyos en Tór Gailvin, un campamento al noreste de Aughaire.\
\
El cantor de historias Arzhur te ha pedido que asaltes el fuerte de los montañeses al noreste. Si logras derrotar al jefe Walraig, podrías evitar una guerra entre los clanes.","Enfurecido por sus repetidas derrotas en duelos, el jefe Walraig de los montañeses hostiles ha declarado una enemistad contra los hombres de Aughaire.","Arzhur está en Aughaire, al suroeste del campamento del jefe Walraig.\
\
Debes regresar con Arzhur para informarle de tu victoria sobre el jefe Walraig."}},
[12186]={nameES="The Final Cut",objectivesES={"Sûbodal is slain","You are to travel south and west into the Haradrim camp of Grijâti once again. This time, however, you are seeking the sorcerer Sûbodal, one of the Haradrim leaders. You are to eliminate him and return to Girgish at Jax Phanâl when the effort is complete.","Return to Girgish at Jax Phanâl","The Final Cut","Girgish informs you that a Haradrim leader has been identified at Grijâti, the camp to the south-west. She directed you to eliminate the sorcerer, Sûbodal, and also to speak with Rothog's emissary to ensure that you eliminate all of the Haradrim leadership.","Defeat Sûbodal, the Haradrim sorcerer at Grijâti","The sorcerer is slain. You should return to Girgish at Jax Phanâl and tell her of your success."}},
[12187]={nameES="The Final Keepsake",objectivesES={"Reach the battlefield Shubârza described","Shubârza has asked that you find the sword once wielded by her brother, Iregâr, who fell in battle nearby in an Ekhamâti assault.","Find Zigûli","This sword does not match Shubârza's description","Return to Shubârza in Amalíbi's camp near Iridír with her brother's sword.","You found a sword matching Shubârza's description. This must be Zigûli","You see many dropped weapons. One must be Zigûli","The Final Keepsake","Return to Shubârza with Zigûli","You have reached the battle-ground about which Shubârza told you. There are many weapons scattered around. One of these must be the sword once wielded by her brother, Iregâr, who fell in battle nearby in an Ekhamâti assault."}},
[12188]={nameES="La Ofensiva Final",objectivesES={"La Ofensiva Final","Los huargos y los jinetes de Athmadhul han sido derrotados. Ahora es el momento de destruir el campamento de entrenamiento en sí.","Ótam se encuentra en Mekhem-bizru, al noroeste de Athmadhul.\
\
Ótam estará encantado de saber que la pista de entrenamiento ha sido destruida.","La pista se encuentra en Athmadhul, al sureste de Mekhem-bizru.\
\
Ótam quiere que regreses a Athmadhul, pero esta vez desea que desmanteles las cercas de la pista que los jinetes de huargos usan para entrenar.","Habla con Ótam en Mekhem-bizru"}},
[12189]={nameES="The Finest Furs in Zamarzîr",objectivesES={}},
[12190]={nameES="El mejor escudo de todos",objectivesES={"Lleva el escudo roto a Nef","Escudo de Nef encontrado","Nef ha perdido su escudo mientras escapaba de una peligrosa criatura en la tundra de Forochel.","Nef cree que perdió su escudo en Jä-rannit, en una encrucijada en el camino a Itä-mâ.\
\
Nef te ha pedido busques el escudo que ha perdido y se lo lleves de vuelta.","Encuentra el escudo de Nef","Nef está en Sûri-kylä, al norte de Itä-mâ, en la bahía de hielo de Forochel.\
\
Deberías devolver cuanto antes a Nef su escudo.","El mejor escudo de todos"}},
[12191]={nameES="Los moradores del fuego",objectivesES={"Ossur se encuentra en la Guardia Orca.\
\
Ossur te ha encomendado ayudarlo contra los trolls y los Ghâsh-hai de la Gran Escalera.","Ossur se encuentra en la Guardia Orca, al suroeste de la Gran Escalera.\
\
Debes regresar con Ossur, en la Guardia Orca, e informarle de que las tareas relativas a los Ghâsh-hai han sido completadas.","Ocúpate del líder de los Ghâsh-hai en la Gran Escalera","Habla con Ossur en la Guardia Orca","La Gran Escalera se alzaba antaño al pie de un gran cruce de caminos dentro de Moria. En el apogeo de la gran ciudad, conducía a todas las zonas de las salas y era una maravilla majestuosa de contemplar. Ahora ha quedado bajo el control de Igash, un lugarteniente de Mazog, el líder de los orcos de Moria. Igash ha reunido en un solo lugar a las fuerzas de orcos y trolls de Moria y ha recaudado tributos de cada uno para llevarlos algún día al líder de los orcos. Por ahora, cada tribu pugna por ganarse el favor del lugarteniente, un seguidor fanático de Mazog.","Ocúpate de la hueste de guerra de los Ghâsh-hai en la Gran Escalera","Los moradores del fuego"}},
[12192]={nameES="Los fuegos de Smaug",objectivesES={"Derrota al Sombrío que alimenta el horno de los Orientales antes de que explote","No permitas que demasiado humo llene las cuevas","Las cuevas se han llenado de humo nocivo","Los Orientales han construido una vil máquina para llenar los túneles y cuevas de la Montaña Solitaria con humo y vapores nocivos y mortales.","El Sombrío ha sido vencido y la Colina del Cuervo está segura","Los fuegos de Smaug","El sombrío ha explotado y llenado las cavernas","Acércate al Sombrío y comienza la batalla."}},
[12193]={nameES="Los fuegos de Smaug",objectivesES={"Derrota al Sombrío que alimenta el horno de los Orientales antes de que explote","No permitas que demasiado humo llene las cuevas","Las cuevas se han llenado de humo nocivo","Los Orientales han construido una vil máquina para llenar los túneles y cuevas de la Montaña Solitaria con humo y vapores nocivos y mortales.","El Sombrío ha sido vencido y la Colina del Cuervo está segura","Los fuegos de Smaug","El sombrío ha explotado y llenado las cavernas","Acércate al Sombrío y comienza la batalla."}},
[12194]={nameES="Los fuegos de Smaug - Desafío",objectivesES={"No permitas que entre más de una bocanada de humo en las cuevas","Derrota al Sombrío que alimenta el horno de los Orientales","Los Orientales han construido una vil máquina para llenar los túneles y cuevas de la Montaña Solitaria con humo y vapores nocivos y mortales.","El humo ha entrado en las cuevas","Los fuegos de Smaug - Desafío","El Sombrío ha sido vencido y la Colina del Cuervo está segura"}},
[12195]={nameES="The First Assault",objectivesES={"Gísling has decided that Snowbourn must be protected from the looming threat of Crúmgam, regardless of Fastred's orders.","Gísling can be found in northern Snowbourn.\
\
Gísling is frustrated by Fastred's distraction from the danger at hand, even with the disappearance of his son. He wants you to travel to Walstow with haste to aid Winsig and her people.","Winsig can be found inside the Mead Hall of Walstow.\
\
The Orc-force has been repelled, and Walstow is safe for the moment. You should speak with Winsig in the aftermath of the battle.","The First Assault","Talk to Winsig","Talk to Gísling"}},
[12196]={nameES="The First Blade",objectivesES={}},
[12197]={nameES="The First Bounty",objectivesES={"Kaupur defeated","The First Bounty","Elta is waiting in Aslíf for your return with the \\qarmour.\\q","Lure out and defeat Kaupur","Though she can no longer hunt alone, Elta still wishes to claim her final bounties in Gundabad.","Elta has offered to split the bounty for defeating Kaupur at Kordh Gúrat.\
\
Kordh Gúrat lies on the level below the middle tier, to the south-west of Aslíf.","Talk to Elta in Aslíf"}},
[12198]={nameES="El Primer Desafío",objectivesES={"Has salido victorioso","El cantor de historias Arzhur está satisfecho de que el huevo de dragonzuelo que le llevaste servirá como prueba de honor para el desafío del clan rival.","Aidan espera en Fail-á-Khro al noreste de Aughaire.\
\
El cantor de historias Arzhur te ha pedido que lleves el huevo de dragonzuelo a Aidan y luego luches a su lado contra los retadores de los clanes leales a Angmar.","El Primer Desafío","Llevar el huevo de dragonzuelo a Aidan","Arzhur está en Aughaire, al suroeste de Fail-á-Khro.\
\
Debes regresar con Arzhur e informarle de tu victoria en el primer desafío.","Aidan está en Fail-á-Khro al noreste de Aughaire.\
\
Lucha junto a Aidan contra los retadores de un clan hostil leal a Angmar."}},
[12199]={nameES="The First Decisions of a New Thane",objectivesES={}},
[12200]={nameES="El Primer Engranaje",objectivesES={"Encuentra el primer engranaje","Bávor está en la Mansión de Thorin.\
\
Bávor estará complacido de ver que has conseguido el primer engranaje.","Primer engranaje encontrado","El Primer Engranaje","Lleva el engranaje a Bávor","El primer engranaje perdido está en una cueva en la Cumbre Invernal, al sureste de la Mansión de Thorin.\
\
Bávor te ha pedido que ayudes a reconstruir el mecanismo enano que abre la Bóveda.","Bávor es un mecánico encargado de reparar el gran mecanismo que da acceso a la legendaria Bóveda de la Montaña."}},
[12201]={nameES="The First Stone",objectivesES={"The clues have led you to a key.\
\
You should return to the chamber in the Grey Mountains and try it on the door.","Retrieve the first stone","The vision shows you a square stone on this pedestal. This first stone must be out there somewhere, waiting for you to find it. You swear you can hear faint whispers, bidding you to look more closely.","The missing stone is out there somewhere, waiting to be found.","The key fits the lock and opens the door","Unlock the door in the chamber","You hear stones shifting somewhere nearby","Inspect the illusion of the first stone","Find the first stone","Return the stone to its pedestal","You have found one of the missing stones!\
\
You should return it to its rightful place in the Crown Chamber.","An illusion has appeared before you in the Crown Chamber.\
\
You should inspect the illusion of the first stone.","The stones must be returned to their rightful places in the Crown Chamber.","The first stone is yours!\
\
You should retrieve it from the chamber in the Grey Mountains.","You hear a distant grinding sound...","The First Stone","You have found the key!","The first stone is yours!"}},
[12202]={nameES="El Secreto del pescador",objectivesES={"Medwyn dice que te revelará el secreto de la pesca exitosa si tienes paciencia.","El Secreto del pescador","Medwyn sacude la cabeza, decepcionado. 'Solo tenías que ser paciente', dice","Medwyn está complacido con tu paciencia.","Medwyn tiene un secreto: un secreto sobre la pesca.","Ten paciencia y aprende el secreto de Medwyn","Parecía que el momento nunca llegaría... pero Medwyn está listo para revelar su secreto","Habla con Medwyn en la Pradera de Juncos"}},
[12203]={nameES="Los Pescadores Otra Vez",objectivesES={"Has terminado de salar el pescado como se te pidió.\
\
Regresa con Madog al muelle en Lhan Garan.","Teilo Gwyniad está sentado en el muelle en Lhan Garan.\
\
Teilo Gwyniad te hace una seña para que hables con él.","Hay cajones de pescado secándose en el muelle en Lhan Garan.\
\
Teilo Gwyniad te pidió que salaras los cajones de pescado en el muelle.","Los Pescadores Otra Vez","Habla con Teilo Gwyniad","Madog te ha pedido que conserves algo de pescado salándolo."}},
[12204]={nameES="The Fishermen: A Quiet Life",objectivesES={}},
[12205]={nameES="The Fishermen: Burying For Another Day",objectivesES={"The Fishermen: Burying For Another Day","Smala has asked you to bury supplies in the hope that they may return when the plains are safe from Núrzum's threat.","Smala can be found at the fishermen's encampment in the north-eastern Whitshaws.\
\
You should tell Smala that you have buried his supplies where he wished.","The fishermen's home can be found south-west of their encampment on the lake.\
\
You should bring the supplies to the homestead and bury them, in hopes that they will be useful in the future.","The fishermen's supplies can be gathered around their camp in the north-eastern Whitshaws.\
\
You should gather the supplies.","Return to Smala"}},
[12206]={nameES="The Fishermen: Drawing the Nets",objectivesES={"The Fishermen: Drawing the Nets","The man nods his gratitude and takes the fish you pulled in from the shore.\
\
'Aye, this will do. Now we shall have food for our packs, if we can get Morcar to heed yer advice.'","The fishermen can be found at the north-eastern edge of the Whitshaws on the edge of the Isingmere.\
\
You should bring the fish to the fishermen so that they will have food for their journey to Forlaw.","The fish of today's catch can be found in nets along the northern edge of the Isingmere in the Whitshaws, near the fishermen's encampment.\
\
You should draw in the nets to gather fish for the two men's journey to Forlaw, for they will need fuel for their trek.","Bring the fish to Smala","Today's fishing catch should be drawn in and packed so that the fishermen may swiftly evacuate to Forlaw."}},
[12207]={nameES="The Fishermen: Harrying Riders",objectivesES={}},
[12208]={nameES="The Fishermen: Meat for a Cold Journey's End",objectivesES={}},
[12209]={nameES="The Fishermen: Unaware of the Threat",objectivesES={}},
[12210]={nameES="El rincón de pesca",objectivesES={"Atrapa tantos peces como puedas en diez minutos","El rincón de pesca","El estanque se encuentra al norte de Delagua.\
\
Neddie Cavada te ha invitado a pescar en el estanque del Festival del Lithe. Todos los peces capturados volverán al agua, pero cuanto más pesques, mayores serán tus recompensas."}},
[12211]={nameES="The Fist of Ice",objectivesES={"The troll Shataz was last seen by an Elvish scout on the slopes east of Orod Laden in the Misty Mountains, far to the south and east of the North Downs.\
\
Handarod has asked you to find the troll Shataz and defeat him.","Handarod is at Esteldín in the North Downs, far to the west and north of the Misty Mountains.\
\
You should return to Handarod and tell him of Shataz' defeat.","Defeated Shataz","The Rangers of Esteldín have told you of a troll named Shataz, who is attempting to raise a raid against Rivendell.","Talk to Handarod","The Fist of Ice","Defeat Shataz"}},
[12212]={nameES="The Fists of Ugrukhôr",objectivesES={}},
[12213]={nameES="The Five Stones",objectivesES={"Find the second missing stone","Another vision appears before you: the Secret Stone placed on one of the five pedestals in the chamber. As you contemplate the vision, you realize you can feel the stone vibrating in its satchel. You lift the stone from King Thorin's satchel and feel the pleasing warmth of it in your hand. Can this be possible? Is this the stone's purpose, to return to this chamber with the other four of its missing brethren? They must be found and reunited.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> This difficult treasure hunt will require community teamwork and resources outside of the game itself. Good luck! </rgb>","The first missing stone has been restored to its pedestal","The Shadowed King has been released from his prison.\
\
You must tell King Thorin what has happened!","The third missing stone has been restored to its pedestal","The Five Stones","Their purpose remains unknown, but the path before you is clear.\
\
You must find the four missing stones.","Return the Secret Stone to its pedestal","The only thing left to do is return the Secret Stone itself to its pedestal. Do what you must.","Find the third missing stone","The second missing stone has been restored to its pedestal","It has become clear that the Secret Stone is one of five stones with unknown purposes, but it seems clear it was intended to return to the Crown Chamber.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>This difficult treasure hunt will require community teamwork and resources outside of the game itself. Good luck!</rgb>","Only one stone remains. The Secret Stone.\
\
Do what you must.","Talk to King Thorin","The fourth missing stone has been restored to its pedestal","Find the fourth missing stone","Find the first missing stone"}},
[12214]={nameES="The Flame of Ancalamír",objectivesES={"Habla con Finnoth Filoviento","Purchase the Flame of Ancalamír from one of the High-enchanters","The Flame of Ancalamír","Purchased the Flame of Ancalamír","The dagger crumbles before your eyes","Narthavron, master smith of the Noldor, has a proposition for you. For your help in purging the corruption of this land, he will craft powerful equipment for you.","Use the Flame of Ancalamír to disenchant the Morgul-steel Dagger","Narthavron can be found in the Udûn Foothold.\
\
You should talk to Narthavron.","High-enchanters can be found in many camps around Gorgoroth, including the Udûn Foothold.\
\
Purchase the Flame of Ancalamír from one of the High-enchanters.","Finnoth Sharp-wind can be found at the Udûn Foothold.\
\
You should talk to Finnoth Sharp-wind.","You can purchase the Flame of Ancalamír from one of the High Enchanters.\
\
Use the Flame of Ancalamír to reduce the Morgul-steel Dagger to Motes of Enchantment.","Talk to Narthavron"}},
[12215]={nameES="The Flames of Mornaur",objectivesES={}},
[12216]={nameES="Las llamas de la resistencia",objectivesES={"Derrota a Potók Dólo","Las llamas de la resistencia","Has incendiado las tiendas y los estandartes enemigos en Onabóha y has atraído a su capitán, Potók Dólo. Debes derrotarlo.","Has venido a Onabóha para incendiar las tiendas de los Ordâkhai y las estandartes de Ordâkh con la esperanza de que la destrucción los motive a mover su campamento a otro lugar.","Potók Dólo derrotado","Los Temámir de Jiret-menêsh quieren deshacerse del campamento ordâkhai en Onabóha."}},
[12217]={nameES="Las Profundidades Ardientes",objectivesES={"En lo más profundo de las salas de Moria, las llamas brotan de charcos aceitosos. Aquí es donde los Ghâsh-hai tienen su hogar. Una facción de ellos está aliada con Mazog, el señor de Moria, y ha acudido a la Gran Escalera para pagar tributo a su líder.","Las Profundidades Ardientes","Habla con Ossur en la Guardia Orca","Los orcos Ghâsh-hai pueden encontrarse en la Gran Escalera, al noreste de la Guardia Orca.\
\
Ossur te envió a enfrentarte a las fuerzas orcas de las profundidades ígneas de Moria, que acudieron a la Gran Escalera para pagar tributo a Igash, un orco devoto de Mazog.","Ossur se encuentra en la Guardia Orca, al suroeste de la Gran Escalera.\
\
Debes regresar con Ossur e informarle de que has derrotado a muchos de los Ghâsh-hai."}},
[12218]={nameES="The Fleeing Symphony",objectivesES={}},
[12219]={nameES="The Fleet of Gondor",objectivesES={}},
[12220]={nameES="Posada del Tronco Flotante",objectivesES={"Ponto Hopsbloom, posadero de la Posada del Tronco Flotante en los Ranales, participa en la Fiesta de la Cerveza de las Cuatro Cuadernas.","Lleva el lúpulo a Ponto Hopsbloom","Posada del Tronco Flotante","El lúpulo de rana crece en el pantano al norte de los Ranales. La Posada del Tronco Flotante está en los Ranales, al sur del Pantano de la Rana.\
\
Ponto Hopsbloom te ha pedido que recojas algo de lúpulo de rana para su famosa cerveza."}},
[12221]={nameES="The Flow of Battle",objectivesES={"The Flow of Battle","Talk to Durnir","Tancestel can be found near the river's edge in Linhir in eastern Dor-en-Ernil.\
\
Garvir has bid you speak to Tancestel, an old and superstitious man of Dor-en-Ernil, in the hope that he may have insight on these dire times.","Glanion can be found in Linhir in eastern Dor-en-Ernil. Durnir can be found overlooking the Gilrain in Linhir.\
\
Garvir has asked you to speak to two of his captains, Glanion and Durnir, about the encroaching ruthless Dead and how Linhir might best defend itself.","Garvir can be found in Linhir in eastern Dor-en-Ernil.\
\
Glanion and Durnir had but a few ideas of what can be done and seem demoralized. You should speak to Garvir.","DNT -- will not be seen","Talk to Glanion","Talk to Tancestel","After learning that the ruthless Dead have infiltrated Dor-en-Ernil and plan to sweep eastward to Mordor, Garvir hopes to find some means of slowing their advance.","Talk to Garvir"}},
[12222]={nameES="El flujo de mercancías",objectivesES={"Lleva los bienes al Vigilante Rosecane","El flujo de mercancías","Los bandidos que atacan las granjas y los caminos de las Tierras de Bree se han llevado muchos de los bienes necesarios para mantener abastecida a la aldea.","Los bienes robados están siendo guardados por los bandidos en la Atalaya de los Bandidos.\
\
El vigilante Rosecane te pidió que registraras la Vigía de los Bandidos en busca de bienes robados de los caminos y las granjas de las Tierras de Bree."}},
[12223]={nameES="El Flujo hacia Noglond",objectivesES={"El Flujo hacia Noglond","Geitir está en Noglond, al sur por el camino desde la Mansión de Thorin.\
\
Tindr te ha pedido que hables con Geitir en Noglond para saber si el flujo de agua en el canal ha vuelto a la normalidad.","Tindr espera que las reparaciones al canal en la Mansión de Thorin hayan restablecido el flujo de agua hacia Noglond, la estación de paso en el Valle de Thráin."}},
[12224]={nameES="The Folly of Nagakhêdi - Tier 1",objectivesES={"Defeat the Legion of Lhaereth","Defeat Badharál the Gorger","Defeat Zamâktar the Putrescent","For over a hundred years, the Kintai Elves have battled a mysterious blight, seemingly brought on by the Din of Stone. It has already consumed once-beautiful Adagím, and now threatens the rest of the Elven glades. An investigation by the Rangers Faeron and Rhadrog has tracked the source of the blight to The Folly of Nagakhêdi, but what dangers lurk inside the ancient and abandoned wonder?","The Folly of Nagakhêdi - Tier 1","Defeat the threats that lurk within The Folly of Nagakhêdi.","Defeat Maukhorn"}},
[12225]={nameES="The Folly of Nagakhêdi - Tier 2",objectivesES={"Defeat the Legion of Lhaereth","Defeat Badharál the Gorger","Defeat Zamâktar the Putrescent","For over a hundred years, the Kintai Elves have battled a mysterious blight, seemingly brought on by the Din of Stone. It has already consumed once-beautiful Adagím, and now threatens the rest of the Elven glades. An investigation by the Rangers Faeron and Rhadrog has tracked the source of the blight to The Folly of Nagakhêdi, but what dangers lurk inside the ancient and abandoned wonder?","Defeat the threats that lurk within The Folly of Nagakhêdi.","The Folly of Nagakhêdi - Tier 2","Defeat Maukhorn"}},
[12226]={nameES="The Folly of Nagakhêdi - Tier 3",objectivesES={"Defeat the Legion of Lhaereth","Defeat Badharál the Gorger","Defeat Zamâktar the Putrescent","For over a hundred years, the Kintai Elves have battled a mysterious blight, seemingly brought on by the Din of Stone. It has already consumed once-beautiful Adagím, and now threatens the rest of the Elven glades. An investigation by the Rangers Faeron and Rhadrog has tracked the source of the blight to The Folly of Nagakhêdi, but what dangers lurk inside the ancient and abandoned wonder?","Defeat the threats that lurk within The Folly of Nagakhêdi.","The Folly of Nagakhêdi - Tier 3","Defeat Maukhorn"}},
[12227]={nameES="The Folly of the Frightened",objectivesES={"Talk to Gonodil in Barad Rill","Gonodil wants to keep the building efforts organized around Barad Rill.","The Folly of the Frightened","You should tell Gonodil that you have collected all the tools.\
\
Gonodil can be found in Barad Rill.","Gonodil has asked you to collect all the worker's tools that have been left abandoned."}},
[12228]={nameES="The Fool's Letter",objectivesES={"Hadhelen has written a letter to Andiriniel, whom he was supposed to meet at the Lady's Rest.","The Fool's Letter","Andiriniel is at the Lady's Rest, south-west of the gates of Caras Galadhon.\
\
Hadhelen asked you to deliver his letter to Andiriniel.","Deliver the sealed letter to Andiriniel at the Lady's Rest"}},
[12229]={nameES="Las huellas de los enemigos",objectivesES={"Recoge flechas orcas","Numerosas flechas orcas cubren el suelo de la Sala Vigesimoprimera cerca del arco que conduce hacia el este.\
\
Deberías recoger las flechas orcas y mostrárselas a Mögr en la Sala Vigesimoprimera como prueba de que los enemigos pasaron por aquí no hace mucho.","Flechas orcas cubren el suelo de la Sala Vigesimoprimera cerca del arco este.","Has guardado muchas flechas orcas para mostrárselas a Mögr en la Sala Vigesimoprimera.\
\
Deberías regresar con Mögr con las flechas que has recogido.","Lleva las flechas orcas al capataz Mögr","Las huellas de los enemigos","Puedes encontrar flechas orcas cerca del arco este de la Sala Vigesimoprimera.\
\
Deberías recoger flechas orcas para mostrárselas a los enanos de la Sala Vigesimoprimera."}},
[12230]={nameES="The Forbidden Pool",objectivesES={"Anborn can be found at Henneth Annûn in North Ithilien.\
\
You have listened to Anborn's tale and should now ask if he knows more of the Halflings.","Anborn can be found at Henneth Annûn in North Ithilien.\
\
Anborn has offered to tell you more of the Halflings that passed through Ithilien.","Listen to Anborn's tale","Anborn recalls the tense exchange when the gangrel-creature came unbidden to the Forbidden Pool beneath Henneth Annûn.","The Forbidden Pool","Talk to Anborn in Henneth Annûn"}},
[12231]={nameES="El Vado del Bruinen",objectivesES={"Habla con Elrohir en el Vado de Bruinen","<rgb=#00FF00>Habéis repelido el segundo asalto. Disponéis de unos breves instantes para recobrar el aliento antes del siguiente.</rgb>","El segundo asalto ha comenzado. El Enemigo no flaquea.","El asalto final ha comenzado y el líder de las fuerzas enemigas entra en batalla. Acabad con él para detener la invasión.","Elrohir debe sobrevivir","El primer asalto ha comenzado. Debéis proteger el vado y a los hijos de Elrond.","<rgb=#00FF00>El tercer asalto ha sido rechazado. La batalla se inclina a vuestro favor.</rgb>","<rgb=#00FF00>El primer asalto ha sido rechazado. Tenéis unos instantes de respiro antes del próximo ataque.</rgb>","<rgb=#00FF00>El cuarto asalto ha sido repelido. La batalla final comienza.</rgb>","El Vado de Bruinen es el último baluarte que conduce al valle oculto de Rivendel. Los orcos al servicio de Angmar asedian el vado, buscando quebrantar las defensas de Imladris.","Rechaza el asalto final","Elrohir y Elladan, los hijos de Elrond, están listos para enfrentarse al ejército que intenta cruzar el Bruinen. Elrohir espera vuestra llegada.","Repele el segundo asalto","Repele el cuarto asalto","El Vado del Bruinen","El tercer asalto ha comenzado. La moral del enemigo parece flaquear y sus fuerzas se reducen.","Repele el tercer asalto","<rgb=#FF0000>Uno de los hijos de Elrond ha caído.</rgb>","El asalto final comienza mientras el líder de las fuerzas del Enemigo entra en combate. Derrotadlo y la invasión fracasará.","Elladan debe sobrevivir","Repele el primer asalto"}},
[12232]={nameES="The Ford: An Army from the East",objectivesES={"The Ford: An Army from the East","Wulfin can be found in Harwick.\
\
Wulfin will be pleased to hear you disrupted the Easterling-camp at the Ford.","The Easterlings can be found at the Ford.\
\
Wulfin has asked you to venture to the Ford and defeat the Easterlings encamped there.","<rgb=#FF0000>Completing Aiding the Eastemnet will cancel this quest</rgb>","The Easterlings have set up a massive encampment along the eastern shore of the Anduin.","Talk to Wulfin"}},
[12233]={nameES="The Ford: Defiled Runes",objectivesES={"Wulfin is in Harwick.\
\
Wulfin will be pleased to hear that you destroyed several runes before they were able to defile the land.","The runes that the Cargûl drop seep into the land and defile it.","<rgb=#FF0000>Completing Aiding the Eastemnet will cancel this quest</rgb>","Talk to Wulfin","Runes can be found on the paths the Cargûl of the Ford walk.\
\
Wulfin asked you to destroy the runes the Cargûl drop before they defile the land.","The Ford: Defiled Runes"}},
[12234]={nameES="The Forest Beneath the Mountain",objectivesES={"The Forest Beneath the Mountain","Sadorwen is located in Bazanmanar.\
\
Golodhril has asked you to speak to her sister Sadorwen on her behalf.","A pair of Elven sisters are on a journey to tour Middle-earth before leaving for the West.","Talk to Sadorwen","Return to Golodhril","Golodhril is sulking in Bazanmanar.\
\
Sadorwen has suggested that you help Golodhril."}},
[12235]={nameES="The Forest Burns",objectivesES={}},
[12236]={nameES="The Forest Gate",objectivesES={"Many of the Beornings' supplies were lost in the woods.\
\
You should help Sterkist gather his supplies by completing \\qScattered in the Forest.\\q","Talk to Thranduil","Langhár and Sterkist have gone to The Forest Gate, at the western end of Eryn Lasgalen.\
\
You should talk to Langhár and Sterkist.","The Forest Gate","The Beornings are safely on their way, and the Taurogrim have been exposed.\
\
You should report these events to King Thranduil.","Help Sterkist gather his supplies","You tell Thranduil of the events that have transpired and the Taurogrim's return.\
\
'In the spiders' absence, an ancient foe returns. This is troubling news, indeed. Thank you for assisting Thorlind in this matter. I will think on our next steps, but I assure you, our reaction to this new threat will be... aggressive.'","Talk to Sterkist","The reunited Beornings must head back towards The Forest Gate and then their home in the Vales of Anduin.","Habla con Langhár"}},
[12237]={nameES="The Forest Turns Against Us",objectivesES={"Málacál has asked that you travel to the east of Sul Madásh and help her and her hunters thin the number of blighted Huorns that can be found.","Return to Málacál near Sul Madásh and report your success of defeating Huorns in eastern Adagím.","Return to Málacál","The Forest Turns Against Us"}},
[12238]={nameES="The Forges of Isengard",objectivesES={"Saruman is devising his own legendary items to supply his war-efforts. His forges must be shut down.","Investigate the Forges of Isengard","Bron is in Galtrev.\
\
You should speak with Bron to tell her of your success against Saruman's attempts to forge legendary weapons.","Bron is in Galtrev.\
\
You should speak with Bron to travel to the Forges of Isengard.","Return to Bron in Galtrev","The Forges of Isengard"}},
[12239]={nameES="El Enano Olvidadizo",objectivesES={"Mochila recuperada","Oddvarr te espera al sur de las ruinas.\
\
Encontraste la mochila de Oddvarr en las antiguas ruinas al norte.","Oddvarr te pidió que buscaras en las ruinas al norte.\
\
Oddvarr dejó su mochila en algún lugar de la zona y no parece recordar dónde.","Oddvarr está junto a los montones de heno al sur de las ruinas donde encontraste la mochila.\
\
Encontraste la mochila de Oddvarr con sus provisiones tan necesarias.","Recupera la mochila de Oddvarr","Devuelve las provisiones de Oddvarr","El Enano Olvidadizo","Ves una mochila.","Busca la mochila de Oddvarr en las ruinas","Conociste a un viejo enano llamado Oddvarr, que parece algo distraído. Es un explorador de cierto renombre... o al menos eso dice él."}},
[12240]={nameES="The Forgotten Quarry",objectivesES={"Though the quarry has been abandoned by Men for generations, there are signs of recent activity","The Forgotten Quarry","Nardol Quarry is located in south-western Taur Drúadan.\
\
You should investigate Nardol Quarry.","Enemies and the source of these Dheghûn can be found at Nardol Quarry.\
\
You should defeat foes and explore Nardol Quarry.","Investigate Nardol Quarry","Find the area where the Dheghûn are coming from","A chilling draft escapes from the crevasse. Strange sounds can be heard from within","Rhûd-pulo-Drât can be found in Nardol Quarry.\
\
You should speak with Rhûd-pulo-Drât.","Rhûd-pulo-Drât has figured out where the Dheghûn are coming from and wants to investigate.","Speak with Rhûd-pulo-Drât at Nardol Quarry"}},
[12241]={nameES="The Forgotten Son",objectivesES={"Collect food for the prisoner in the Snowbourn prison","Talk to Fastred","Fastred can be found in the mead-hall of Snowbourn.","The Forgotten Son","Deliver the food to the prisoner","Fastred wants you to speak to a recently apprehended prisoner in Snowbourn. The prisoner has been without food for some time now, so Fastred wants you to bring food to the cell as well.","You have found a dingy plate of food, provided by the Rohirrim guards of Snowbourn","The prisoner can be found in the prison-house just outside the mead-hall in Snowbourn.","Fastred wants you to bring a plate of food to a prisoner of Snowbourn.  The food can be found in the prison, near the prisoner's cell."}},
[12242]={nameES="Tesoro Olvidado: Una reliquia de tiempos pasados",objectivesES={"Falgir se encuentra en el Descenso Profundo de Moria.\
\
Garthar te contó un poco de la historia de las cámaras acorazadas en Moria, lo que contenían y cómo teme que una de ellas haya sido violada. Ahora desea que le cuentes a Falgir lo que has aprendido.","Habla con Garthar en el Descenso Profundo","Garthar se encuentra en el Descenso Profundo de Moria.\
\
Falgir te confió sobre el descubrimiento de cristales que se creían perdidos hace mucho tiempo, pero que ahora aparecen por toda Moria. Te ha pedido que hables con Garthar para ver si puede arrojar algo de luz sobre el asunto.","Habla con Falgir en el Descenso Profundo","Has hablado con Garthar","Tesoro Olvidado: Una reliquia de tiempos pasados","Se han descubierto cristales en Moria que portan las marcas del Tesoro Olvidado, lo que ha despertado el interés de algunos enanos que ahora desean excavar el lugar y salvar su contenido de los orcos saqueadores dentro de Moria."}},
[12243]={nameES="Tesoro Olvidado: Conoce a tu enemigo",objectivesES={"Tesoro Olvidado: Conoce a tu enemigo","Lleva los objetos a Falgir en el Descenso Profundo","El Tesoro Olvidado se encuentra al sur y sureste del Descenso Profundo.\
\
Falgir te pidió que eliminaras a los orcos y trasgos entre el Descenso Profundo y el Tesoro Olvidado para prepararte para la tarea de liberar la cámara. También te pidió que recogieras retazos de tela de los orcos y trasgos.","Se han descubierto cristales en Moria que portan las marcas del Tesoro Olvidado, una cámara sellada que oculta una considerable cantidad de riquezas. Este hallazgo ha despertado el interés de algunos enanos, que ahora desean descubrir la cámara y salvar su contenido de los orcos saqueadores."}},
[12244]={nameES="The Former Guardians",objectivesES={}},
[12245]={nameES="The Former Guards",objectivesES={}},
[12246]={nameES="El Despojador Proscrito, Azote de Mordor",objectivesES={"Desde el lejano sur llegó, trayendo miedo y fuego a cada costa que espiaba con su cristal. Su reinado era de sangre, y la extraía de todos los que vivían a la vista y al olor del Mar. ¿Fue esa la razón por la que Sauron le dio el anillo Khânto, que es el Dador de Dolor? Con el poder de él, el Despojador Proscrito no podía ser detenido, y su risa se extendía tierra adentro con vientos funestos; estaba entre los sirvientes más rápidos y crueles de Sauron.","The Forsaken Reaver, defeated but enduring","The Great Alliance of Elves and Men stood in defiance of Sauron for long years of siege, but even their greatest heroes came to fear his deadliest servants. These were the Nazgûl, and their number was Nine.","The Great Alliance of Elves and Men stood in defiance of Sauron for long years of siege, but even their bravest heroes came to fear his deadliest servants. These were the Nazgûl, and their number was Nine. They stalked the battlefield of Mordor Besieged, and were its most dangerous scourges.\
\
From the distant south he came, bringing fear and fire to every coast he spied with his glass. His was a reign of blood, and he drew it from all who lived in sight and scent of the Sea. Was that the reason Sauron gave to him the ring Khânto, which is Pain-giver? With the power of it, the Forsaken Reaver could not be stopped, and his laughter carried inland on fell winds; he was among Sauron's swiftest servants, and the cruelest.","El Despojador Proscrito, Azote de Mordor","Defeat the Forsaken Reaver in Mordor Besieged","The Forsaken Reaver has been defeated... for now","The Forsaken Reaver suffered defeat on the battlefield of Mordor Besieged, but it was not to be a lasting death... not while Sauron endured. The Nazgûl would return, for his was an existence beyond ending."}},
[12247]={nameES="The Forsaken of Mordor",objectivesES={"Aid Náth with 'A Costly Journey'","The Forsaken of Mordor","Ambassador Spakorth can be found in the Hall Under the Mountain.\
\
You have aided many of the Stout-axes in settling into their new home, and you should now return to Spakorth.","Talk to Ambassador Spakorth","Aid Spakorth with 'Forged in Flames'","Aid Spakorth with 'Carving Out A Home'","Spakorth, Náth, and Dréri can be found in the Hall Under the Mountain.\
\
Gimli has asked you to aid the Stout-axes in joining with Durin's Folk in Erebor. You should speak to Ambassador Spakorth and his warriors, Náth and Dréri.","Aid Dréri with 'Hunting the North'","Through King Thorin's mercy, the Stout-axes of Mordor have found a new home in the North, but first, they must find their place in Erebor."}},
[12248]={nameES="La fortaleza de Olnathron",objectivesES={"Mincham te espera en su campamento.\
\
Mincham se alegrará al saber que el espíritu maligno Olnathron ha sido enviado de vuelta al abismo.","El caballo de Mincham te llevará de regreso","Enfrenta al espíritu maligno Olnathron","Tham Lorn, en los Campos occidentales de Fornost, se puede alcanzar tomando el caballo del Campamento de Mincham.\
\
Deberías viajar a Tham Lorn para enfrentar a Olnathron de una vez por todas.","Toma el caballo del campamento de Mincham hacia Tham Lorn","La fortaleza de Olnathron","Has llegado a Tham Lorn; Olnathron debe estar cerca.","Olnathron puede encontrarse al oeste de las tumbas de su esposa e hijo.\
\
Temiendo por la fortaleza de su voluntad, Mincham te ha pedido que encuentres y enfrentes al espíritu maligno que ha tomado la apariencia de su esposa.","Regresa con Mincham","Mincham cree que Olnathron puede encontrarse en unas ruinas antiguas en los Campos occidentales de Fornost.","Has derrotado a Olnathron"}},
[12249]={nameES="The Fortunes of Umbar Baharbêl (Weekly)",objectivesES={}},
[12250]={nameES="The Forward Bastion",objectivesES={}},
[12251]={nameES="The Foulest of the Stag-clan's Foes",objectivesES={}},
[12252]={nameES="El Texto fundacional",objectivesES={"Belco Tejonera se encuentra al norte del centro de Alforzaburgo, en lo alto de la colina y a la derecha del camino.\
\
A su pesar, Adelard Tuk reveló que no tiene el Texto fundacional. Un granjero local, Belco Tejonera, es quien encontró el Texto fundacional, pero se niega a entregárselo a Adelard hasta que alguien le ayude con su granja.","El Texto fundacional","Adelard Tuk ha informado de que se ha descubierto una copia del Texto fundacional, el documento que estableció los límites de la Comarca. El documento original fue entregado a los hermanos Albo, Marcho y Blanco, por el viejo rey.","Adelard Tuk se encuentra en los Grandes Smials de Alforzaburgo.\
\
Brombard Colazorro, el conservador de la Casa de los Mathoms, ha oído hablar del hallazgo de Adelard Tuk y te ha pedido que intentes conseguir la copia del Texto fundacional de Adelard."}},
[12253]={nameES="The Foundry -- Tier 1",objectivesES={"Thwart Saruman's plans within the Foundry by destroying his Ring-forge and defeating his lieutenants.","Defeated Gurbák in the Bellows Room","The Foundry of Isengard houses  the mighty Ring-forge where Saruman plies the knowledge of Ring-smithy he has acquired down through the ages.","Defeated Dhâr in the Smelting Room","Thwart Saruman's plans within the Foundry","The Foundry -- Tier 1","Defeat Dhâr in the Smelting Room","Defeat Gurbák in the Bellows Room","Destroyed the Ring-forge of Orthanc and its protectors"}},
[12254]={nameES="The Foundry -- Tier 2",objectivesES={"Thwart Saruman's plans within the Foundry by destroying his Ring-forge and defeating his lieutenants.","Defeated Gurbák in the Bellows Room","The Foundry -- Tier 2","Defeated Dhâr in the Smelting Room","Thwart Saruman's plans within the Foundry","The Foundry of Isengard houses the great Ring-forge where Saruman plies the knowledge of Ring-smithy that he has acquired down through the ages.","Defeat Dhâr in the Smelting Room","Defeat Gurbák in the Bellows Room","Destroyed the Ring-forge of Orthanc and its protectors"}},
[12255]={nameES="The Fountain of the Lady",objectivesES={"The Fountain of the Lady","Pick up a pitcher for the gathering of musicians","Pick up a pitcher for the House of Celeborn","Pitchers can be found on the terrace near Nembes, and there are three locations to which she would have you bring pitchers of water: parched Elves beneath Telain Neduil, at the base of the ladder that climbs up to the House of Celeborn, and at a gathering of musicians north of Celúrlin.\
\
Nembes has asked you to deliver pitchers of cool water to parched Elves.","Pick up a pitcher for Telain Neduil","Nembes watches over the fountain of the Lady Galadriel.","Talk to Nembes at Celúrlin","Nembes is at Celúrlin, Galadriel's fountain in the centre of Caras Galadhon.\
\
You have delivered pitchers of cool water to parched Elves throughout the city and should return now to Nembes."}},
[12256]={nameES="El cuarto engranaje",objectivesES={"Cuarto engranaje perdido encontrado","Encuentra el cuarto engranaje perdido","El cuarto engranaje","Bávor está en la Mansión de Thorin, lejos al noroeste de Kheledûl.\
\
Bávor estará complacido de ver que has conseguido el cuarto engranaje.","Bávor es un mecánico encargado de reparar el gran mecanismo que da acceso a la legendaria Bóveda de la Montaña.","El cuarto engranaje está en un cofre en el puerto duramano de Kheledûl, al este de Gondamon.\
\
Bávor te ha pedido que recuperes el cuarto engranaje perdido de los Duramano en Kheledûl.","Lleva el cuarto engranaje a Bávor"}},
[12257]={nameES="The Fourth Stone",objectivesES={"Give Márus the required items","The missing stone is out there somewhere, waiting to be found.","With the protection rune-stone and the original chisel, you can now dismantle the trap.\
\
You should return the chamber in the Paths of the Dead and remove the rune-stone trap.","You have found a hidden chamber in the Paths of the Dead.\
\
You should investigate the chamber.","The Fourth Stone","Take the fourth stone","An ancient chisel was left on a monument here. Could it be the chisel you are looking for?","Find someone to help you remove the rune-stone","Márus has asked you for several ingredients to make a protective rune-stone.\
\
His list included these items: powerful fire-enchanted chisel, copper and obsidian rune-stone base, polished dwarrowgleam.","Investigate the chamber","Open the door","The fourth stone is yours!\
\
You should return it to its rightful place in the Crown Chamber.","You hear the echo of stones shifting somewhere in the cavern","Find the fourth stone","A rune-stone trap stands in your way of the fourth stone.\
\
You should find someone who may be able to help.","Márus hands you the completed rune-stone","With the rune-stone removed, you can now safely open the door.\
\
You should open the door in the chamber.","Inspect the illusion of the fourth stone","The chisel pierces the rune-stone. It clatters to the floor in pieces","Remove the rune-stone trap","The fourth stone is yours!","You have found the key to this chamber's lock, but judging by the charred bones and blast marks, you should not attempt to use it right away. Below the lock, a rune-stone adorns the door, its carvings glowing an ominous red. If you are going to safely open the door, you will need to find some way to remove the rune-stone.","You have found a hidden chamber in the White Mountains.\
\
You should investigate the chamber.","The vision shows you an oval stone on this pedestal. This fourth stone must be out there somewhere, waiting for you to find it. You swear you can hear faint whispers, bidding you to look closer at the illusion.","The fourth stone is yours for the taking!\
\
You should take the fourth stone.","Márus has told you that you must find the original chisel to have any hopes of dismantling the rune-stone trap.\
\
You should find the original chisel.","Return the stone to its pedestal","Find the original chisel","The stones must be returned to their rightful places in the Crown Chamber."}},
[12258]={nameES="El Zorro en el Gallinero",objectivesES={"El Zorro en el Gallinero","Entrega la carta a un pregonero y escucha lo que tenga que decir sobre el granjero preocupado.\
\
Has recibido una carta de un granjero preocupado.","Habla de nuevo con el pregonero","Un granjero preocupado te ha enviado una nota pidiendo tu ayuda y solicitándote que busques a un pregonero.","Entrega la carta a un pregonero","Los pregoneros advierten en contra de ello, pero sí tienen una tarea que puede realizarse en nombre del granjero preocupado."}},
[12259]={nameES="El Zorro en el Gallinero... Otra Vez",objectivesES={"El Zorro en el Gallinero... Otra Vez","Entrega la carta a un pregonero y escucha lo que tenga que decir sobre el granjero preocupado.\
\
Has recibido una carta de un granjero preocupado.","Sabes que ya leíste esto antes. Un granjero preocupado. Necesita ayuda. Habla con un Pregonero. Ya leíste esto antes, ¿cierto?","Los pregoneros lo desaconsejan, pero tienen una tarea que puede realizarse para un granjero preocupado.","Entrega la carta a un Pregonero","Habla de nuevo con el Pregonero"}},
[12260]={nameES="El cristal fracturado",objectivesES={"En Moria se pueden encontrar muchos cristales, pero este parece diferente a los demás. Oscurecido por el paso del tiempo y con aspecto de estar quemado, quizá haya algo que aprender de este cristal que se le cayó a un orco de Moria.","Falgir está en el Descenso Profundo.\
\
Deberías llevar el cristal que encontraste a un enano que quizá sepa algo al respecto.","Habla con Falgir en el Descenso Profundo","El cristal fracturado","Este cristal, hallado en uno de los orcos de Moria, parece ser diferente a cualquier otro cristal encontrado en Moria. Deberías llevárselo a alguien que pueda saber algo sobre su origen.\
\
Quizá podrías hablar con Falgir en el Descenso Profundo. Es posible que él tenga alguna información sobre un cristal de este tipo."}},
[12261]={nameES="La Gente Libre",objectivesES={"El líder Crannog te ha enviado con el Cantor de Historias Arzhur para aprender algo sobre la Gente Libre de Angmar.","La Gente Libre","Arzhur está en Aughaire, al noreste del líder Crannog.\
\
El líder Crannog te ha enviado a hablar con el Cantor de Historias Arzhur para escuchar la historia de su clan."}},
[12262]={nameES="The Frill of Them All",objectivesES={}},
[12263]={nameES="The Frost-horde",objectivesES={"Defeated many of the Frost-horde upon the battlefield.","The Frost-horde has sworn their lives to the wills and ideals of Hrímil Frost-heart. You must defeat any of the Frost-horde that you come across upon the battlefield to secure victory for the Gabilakkâ.","The Frost-horde has sworn their lives to the wills and ideals of Hrímil Frost-heart.","The Frost-horde","Completado","The Frost-horde can be found upon the battlefield.\
\
You should defeat any of the Frost-horde you find upon the battlefield.","You have defeated many of the Frost-horde upon the battlefield and have done a great service to the war efforts."}},
[12264]={nameES="The Frost-horde (Final)",objectivesES={"Defeated many of the Frost-horde upon the battlefield.","The Frost-horde has sworn their lives to the wills and ideals of Hrímil Frost-heart. You must defeat any of the Frost-horde that you come across upon the battlefield to secure victory for the Gabilakkâ.","You have defeated many of the Frost-horde upon the battlefield, and have done a great service to the war efforts.","The Frost-horde (Final)","The Frost-horde has sworn their lives to the wills and ideals of Hrímil Frost-heart.","Completado","The Frost-horde can be found upon the battlefield.\
\
You should defeat any of the Frost-horde you find upon the battlefield."}},
[12265]={nameES="The Frost-horde Attacks",objectivesES={"The Battle of Uzdarulzahar has begun!\
\
You should defeat drakes in Uzdarulzahar.","The Frost-horde has come to assist the hobgoblins in the Battle of Uzdarulzahar.","Completado","The drakes of the Frost-horde have arrived to assist the hobgoblins in the Battle of Uzdarulzahar. You should defeat them to ensure victory for the Gabil'akkâ!","The Battle of Uzdarulzahar proceeds!","The Frost-horde Attacks","You have defeated many drakes of the Frost-horde in Uzdarulzahar, turning the tide of battle in favour of the Gabil'akkâ!"}},
[12266]={nameES="El Teatro de Barranca Escarchada",objectivesES={"Talk to the Announcer","Attended a performance","El Teatro de Barranca Escarchada","Attend a performance in the Frostbluff Theatre.","Attend a performance in the Frostbluff Theatre","Speak with the hobbit outside the Frostbluff Theatre in Winter-home.\
\
You should tell the hobbit about the performance you saw.","A hobbit working for the G.L.O.B.E. has asked you to attend a showing of 'An Ode to Old Bloodtusk' and return with your thoughts.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> NOTE: This quest will be removed from your quest log when the current festival ends. </rgb>"}},
[12267]={nameES="El Teatro de Barranca Escarchada",objectivesES={"Talk to the Announcer","Attended a performance","El Teatro de Barranca Escarchada","Attend a performance in the Frostbluff Theatre.","Attend a performance in the Frostbluff Theatre","Speak with the hobbit outside the Frostbluff Theatre in Winter-home.\
\
You should tell the hobbit about the performance you saw.","A hobbit working for the G.L.O.B.E. has asked you to attend a showing of 'An Ode to Old Bloodtusk' and return with your thoughts.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> NOTE: This quest will be removed from your quest log when the current festival ends. </rgb>"}},
[12268]={nameES="La guerra congelada",objectivesES={"La guerra congelada","Los Lossoth de Forochel se han visto arrastrados por la creciente marea de la guerra en su reino septentrional, pues los Angmarim han avivado el antiguo odio entre los Lossoth y los Gauradan. Con la esperanza de forjar una alianza con los Lossoth, representantes de hombres y enanos del sur han llegado a Forochel para ofrecer su ayuda.","Habla con Vämmä en Sûri-kylä","Dile a Vämmä que los marcadores de territorio de los Gauradan han sido destruidos. Se encuentra en Sûri-kylä.","Los marcadores gauradan se extienden en una línea al norte del campamento gauradan de Barad Gaurhoth, cerca de Zigilgund. Estas protecciones se hallan muy al otro lado de la bahía, al suroeste de Sûri-kylä.\
\
Vämmä te ha pedido que lleves a cabo un ataque simbólico contra las protecciones que definen las fronteras del territorio ancestral de los Gauradan."}},
[12269]={nameES="The Fruits of Your Labour",objectivesES={"Zuhûr asked you to speak with merchants at the Waterway Market and find out if anyone has any apricots for her to purchase.","Zuhûr gives you a small pouch containing her \\qapricot money\\q","Zuhûr is at the Waterway Market, looking for apricots.","Bring her apricots to Zuhûr in the Lower Ward","The Dawn Market is located east of the city walls.","Zuhûr just wants apricots. Is that too much to ask?","Find someone at the Dawn Market who will sell you apricots for Zuhûr","Zuhûr will be delighted that you found her some apricots","The Fruits of Your Labour","Zuhûr is on a bench by the Waterway Market in the Lower Ward.","Talk to Zuhûr at the Waterway Market"}},
[12270]={nameES="The Funeral in Forlaw",objectivesES={"Go to the funeral with Cyneberg","Speak with Cyneberg","Many were lost in the recent battles at Scylfig and Forlaw. Gárwig has lost many of his sons, but none were more important to the people of Wildermore than their hero Thrymm Red-beard. A funeral is being planned by Gárwig and Cyneberg so that the people of Forlaw can pay their respects and say good-bye to those who lost their lives.","Cyneberg is back in Thrymm's home near the southern gate of Forlaw.\
\
Thrymm and the others are now buried, and the time has come for the people of Forlaw to try to move on from their passing.","The Funeral in Forlaw","Cyneberg is keeping close to Gárwig in Lornsettle, the mead hall of Forlaw.\
\
Funeral preparations are being made and the townspeople are getting ready to gather at the graveyard."}},
[12271]={nameES="El hongo entre nosotros",objectivesES={"Zarza derrotado","El hongo entre nosotros","Aunque el fuego parecía destruir las estructuras fúngicas, Tyki cree que se debería poner fin al líder de los Orcos Globsnaga.","Derrota a Zarza","Tyki se encuentra en el Refugio Sombrío, al norte de Dalgum-ru.\
\
Debes regresar a Tyki para informarle de la muerte de Zarza, el líder de los Orcos.","Habla con Tyki en el Refugio Sombrío","El líder de los Globsnaga se encuentra en Dalgum-ru, al sur del Refugio Sombrío.\
\
Tyki quiere que encuentres al líder de los Orcos en Dalgum-ru y pongas fin a su existencia ofensiva."}},
[12272]={nameES="El hongo entre nosotros",objectivesES={"El hongo entre nosotros","Regresa con Glorelloth en el Refugio Sombrío","La Sala Decimosexta es una zona infestada de orcos, muchos de los cuales padecen una terrible enfermedad que provoca crecimientos similares a hongos en sus cuerpos.\
\
Mallas, un elfo aliado de los enanos, cree que hay algo oculto bajo la Sala Decimosexta y desea descubrir el verdadero propósito y el origen de la plaga.","El hongo del que te habló Glorelloth se encuentra al noreste de la Sala Decimosexta.\
\
Glorelloth quiere que recojas el hongo para poder examinarlo más de cerca y determinar su naturaleza."}},
[12273]={nameES="The Further Defence of Mûr Ghala (Weekly)",objectivesES={}},
[12274]={nameES="The Fushaum Conflict",objectivesES={}},
[12275]={nameES="The Fushaum Resolution",objectivesES={"Talk to Thâng or Khirgi","Reach a Neutral standing with Fushaum Bal South","The Fushaum Resolution","Reach an Enemy standing with Fushaum Bal North","Talk to Thurindol","You should talk to Thâng or Khirgi.","In order to turn the various factions in Fushaum Bal against each other, you will need to earn their favour first.","In order to turn the various factions in Fushaum Bal against each other, you will need to disrupt both their efforts.","The camp of Fushaum Bal is a lawless home to evil men once under the command of Sauron.","Reach an Enemy standing with Fushaum Bal South","Thurindol can be found on the border of Talath Úrui and Dor Amarth.\
\
You should speak with Thurindol.","Reach a Neutral standing with Fushaum Bal North"}},
[12276]={nameES="The Gambit at the Highest House",objectivesES={"Assisted Náth","(Optional) Use the battle horn to summon the scout trio","Hórin needs your assistance defeating Hárkyrta the Frigid in Uzdarulzahar.\
\
This will be a difficult fight! Use the battle horn at the gate of Uzdarulzahar to summon the scout trio if they have left your side.","The drake has been slain! You should talk to Hórin.\
\
Use the battle horn at the gate of Uzdarulzahar to summon the scout trio if they have left your side.","The hobgoblin forces have not yet been found, so they must be at the very peak of the mountain. The time for battle is soon at hand.","Find and assist Dréri with his opponent","Defeated Hárkyrta the Frigid","Klúso will fight at your side","Hórin has gathered the dwarf reinforcements and is waiting for you at the stairs to the ruins of Uzdarulzahar.\
\
You should meet Hórin and complete 'Instance: The Warlord's Gambit'.","Find and assist Náth with his opponent","The battle has been won!\
\
You should return to Fellgát and talk to Hórin.","Molkha will fight at your side","Climb the Father's Path and meet up with Hórin by the steps leading to the ruins of Uzdarulzahar","(Optional) Talk to Hórin at Uzdarulzahar to quickly travel to Fellgát","Hórin is waiting for you at the gate of Uzdarulzahar.\
\
You should talk to Hórin.","Assist Hórin by defeating Hárkyrta the Frigid","The Gambit at the Highest House","Talk to Hórin at Uzdarulzahar","Complete 'Hobgoblins at the Highest House' for Hórin","Talk to Hórin in Fellgát","Find and assist Kyrstig with her opponent","The Battle of Uzdarulzahar has begun!\
\
You should complete objectives in Uzdarulzahar and find and assist your dwarf allies.","Find and assist Klúso with his opponent","Complete 'Dwarves in Arms' for Hórin","Kyrstig will fight at your side","Assisted Dréri","Find and assist Molkha with her opponent"}},
[12277]={nameES="The Gap, Mapped",objectivesES={"The Gap, Mapped","Deliver the map to Thyfli","Thyfli is in a small camp north of Bazanmanar.\
\
Gerja has asked you to bring a copy of the completed map to Thyfli.","The map is on a table beside Gerja in Bazanmanar.\
\
You should pick up the map.","Pick up the map of Clovengap","With your assistance, Gerja has created a detailed map of Clovengap. The war will go more smoothly now, thanks to your scouting."}},
[12278]={nameES="El jardín de las plagas",objectivesES={"Habla con Maengamiel en el jardín de Duillond","El jardín de las plagas","El Festival de Primavera ha terminado por este año","Los elfos de Duillond han creado un nuevo jardín, pero no esperaban verse tan acosados por las plagas. Son tiempos oscuros de veras, en los que criaturas entrometidas interfieren en las festividades de primavera de la celebración de Ethuilwereth.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando termine el festival actual. </rgb>","Maengamiel está en el Jardín del Festival en Duillond, cerca de la zona del festival de allí.\
\
Deberías hablar con Maengamiel para introducirte a los eventos de primavera que tienen lugar en Ered Luin este año."}},
[12279]={nameES="The Garsfeld Guppy",objectivesES={"Garsfeld guppies can be found in the river just north of Garsfeld. The fish is elusive though and rarely stays in the same location for very long.\
\
Héalac asked you to catch several Garsfeld guppies.","Bring the Garsfeld guppies to Héalac","Héalac is at Snowbourn.\
\
Héalac will be eager to begin de-boning the Garsfeld guppies you caught.","<rgb=#FF0000>Completing Aiding the Eastemnet will cancel this quest</rgb>","The stream just north of Garsfeld is the breeding ground for a type of guppy unique to Rohan. The rib-bones of this fish are strong yet pliable, making for perfect needles for stitching wounds.","The Garsfeld Guppy"}},
[12280]={nameES="The Gates of Isengard",objectivesES={"Talk to Dagoras at his camp near Isengard","Dagoras is at his camp near Isengard.\
\
Dagoras asked you to accompany the Grimbold's emissary to the gates of Isengard. You should speak with Dagoras when you are ready to meet the emissary.","Dagoras is at his camp near Isengard.\
\
You should tell Dagoras what transpired at the meeting between Ordwaer and Saruman before the gates of Isengard.","Talk to Dagoras to accompany Grimbold's emissary","The Gates of Isengard","Grimbold's emissary has come north to speak with Saruman and demand to know why Orcs and goblins have been seen gathering in numbers near Isengard, and why the Wizard is meddling in the affairs of the Dunlendings and Rohirrim."}},
[12281]={nameES="The Gates of Naerband",objectivesES={"Akhrûn looks out across the span towards Orodir.\
\
'I was taken here with my brethren in cages. We were told that we did not uphold the great laws that Sauron has put in place over Mordor. Our punishment was to be bound by chains.\
\
'Orodir has many of the Orcs of fire, known as Ghâsh-hai. I hear that they came to Naerband soon after the tower fell. I do not know why though.\
\
'We must rescue as many Nurnhoth as we can and stop Naerband from abducting those who deserve their freedom.'","Enter Orodir","Talk to Akhrûn","Orodir is located next to Naerband.\
\
You should complete quests within this encampment.","Orodir is located next to Naerband.\
\
You should enter the encampment.","Akhrûn is not able to turn her back on her fellow Nurnhoth still imprisoned by servants of Naerband, and asks for your help in freeing them.","Complete Breaking the Chains","Akhrûn can be found just outside of Orodir, next to Naerband.\
\
You should speak with Akhrûn.","The Gates of Naerband","Complete Freeing the Nurnhoth","This place seems to be a staging area for bringing captured prisoners into Naerband","Complete For the Oppressed"}},
[12282]={nameES="The Gathering Storm, Part 1: An Audience with the Storm",objectivesES={"Rothog has requested your presence for a petition of one of his nobles.","Speak to Rothog about the audience.","Following the audience, Rothog would like a word regarding the petition.","Members of the Kindred of the Coins take petitions from nobles throughout Umbar. Rothog has summoned you to his chambers to hear one specific complaint.","The Gathering Storm, Part 1: An Audience with the Storm","Talk to Rothog in Dâr Laja","Talk to Rothog","Travel with Rothog to the audience"}},
[12283]={nameES="The Gathering Storm, Part 2: Hunter Hunted",objectivesES={"Talk to Rothog in Dâr Laja","Talk to Rothog","The Gathering Storm, Part 2: Hunter Hunted","Speak to Rothog regarding the petition from Zarzíra Dawn-star.","After your conversation with Shaidal and the surprising ambush, speak to Rothog regarding the encounter.","Rothog has asked that you travel to within Dahâl Huliz, inside the the gladiator residences and speak to Shaidal about the situation.","Within the halls of Dahâl Huliz, the gladiators make their home. Rothog has asked that you question Shaidal."}},
[12284]={nameES="The Gathering Storm, Part 3: Steps Closer",objectivesES={"Located Makhil's passage near Hulzidâr. The path heads to the west","Makhil's footsteps seem to lead northward towards Jâx Ugikh","Makhil's tracks head east near Kên Taghlim","Talk to Makhil east of Kên Taghlim","Search Hulzidâr, a small encampment beneath the arena, for Makhil's path.","Continue your search for Makhil's path, west of Hulzidâr.","Locate Makhil's passage north of the cross-roads","Locate Makhil's passage near Hulzidâr","Speak to Makhil's about the information that he recovered from Zarzíra Dawn-star's estate.","The Gathering Storm, Part 3: Steps Closer","Locate Makhil's passage west of Hulzidâr","Makhil's tracks head northwards towards Kên Taghlim","Continue your search for Makhil's path, north of the cross-roads, west of Hulzidâr.","Shaidal has requested that you seek out Makhil who has fled into Kamrabezûr to escape Zarzíra Dawn-star and her Khadeji.","Continue your search for Makhil's path, near Kên Taghlim in Kamrabezûr.","Locate Makhil's passage near Kên Taghlim"}},
[12285]={nameES="The Gathering Storm, Part 4: The Wight Evidence",objectivesES={"Makhil has requested that you recover a series of evidence parcels hidden throughout Ghâr Mejet, an ancient crypt teeming with Wights in Kamrabezûr.","The Gathering Storm, Part 4: The Wight Evidence","Return to Dâr Laja and speak to Shaidal","Return to Dâr Laja and speak to Shaidal about the evidence that you recovered."}},
[12286]={nameES="The Gathering Storm, Part 5: The Storm Abated",objectivesES={"Rothog has requested that you present the evidence that you have gathered regarding Shaidal's actions.","Travel with Rothog to the audience chamber","Rothog the Storm asks you to approach with your findings.","Talk to Rothog in Dâr Laja","Talk to Rothog","The Gathering Storm, Part 5: The Storm Abated","Following the audience, Rothog would like a word.","Armed with proof of Shaidal's innocence, you approach Rothog the Storm with your findings."}},
[12287]={nameES="The Gathering Storm, Part 6: A Line Crossed",objectivesES={"You present the recovered goods to Rothog the Storm.\
\
'I see that my trust in you was not misplaced. My hope was that those who betrayed us may have learned an important lesson. Perhaps they will. Once again your work is exemplary, and your hand in my spectacle will not be forgotten by me.\
\
'Thank you for your help!'","Rothog the Storm has requested that travel into the catacombs to Harkhaphâr and do several tasks. He requests that you thin the number of gladiators there, gather their metal chains, and recover food stuffs from the camp.","Rothog awaits you in the Dâr Laja Meeting Hall","The Gathering Storm, Part 6: A Line Crossed","Rothog the Storm has requested that you travel into the catacombs below Dahâl Huliz and recover a precious shipment that was important to him.","Rothog awaits you in the Dâr Laja Meeting Hall.\
\
Return with the stolen objects and inform him of your victory."}},
[12288]={nameES="The Gathering Storm, Part 7: Steps Closer",objectivesES={"Sâkhariz provides a container with expertly crafted bolts.","Travel to Kheb Hanût and speak to Sâkhariz there to gather reinforced bolts to secure the creature.","Return to Rothog and meet him in the Dâr Laja Meeting Hall.","Talk to Rothog in Dâr Laja Meeting Hall","The Gathering Storm, Part 7: Steps Closer","Travel to The Dûlkar and speak to Nadima","Rothog the Storm has requested your aid in travelling to retrieve needed supplies for his next spectacle. Travel to Kheb Hanût and The Dûlkar, speak to Rothog's contacts, and return.","Travel to The Dûlkar and speak to Nadima and retrieve apothecary supplies.","There appears to be some slight damage to the wrapping of the package, but it is otherwise intact","Speak to Sâkhariz regarding the requested goods"}},
[12289]={nameES="The Gathering Storm, Part 8: Rothog's Fury",objectivesES={"Speak to Rothog the Storm about the situation","Travel with Rothog to the audience chamber","The Gathering Storm, Part 8: Rothog's Fury","Following Zarzíra's actions in his chambers, Rothog asks to speak to you.","Talk to Rothog in Dâr Laja","Talk to Rothog","Rothog has requested your attendance in his questioning of Zarzíra Dawn-star.","Now with proof of her treachery, Rothog calls forth Zarzíra Dawn-star for questioning."}},
[12290]={nameES="Los hombres demacrados de Dol Ernil",objectivesES={"Medi te ha pedido que derrotes a los hombres demacrados en Dol Ernil.\
\
Dol Ernil está en el norte de Cardolan.","Deberías informar a Medi de que hay muchos menos hombres demacrados que acechan sus sueños.\
\
Medi está en el convoy de Gerwyn.","Entre las ruinas de Dol Ernil, los muertos inquietos deambulan por la piedra derruida.","Los hombres demacrados de Dol Ernil","Regresa con Medi"}},
[12291]={nameES="Los Gauredain de Emyn Uial",objectivesES={"Robin Sotopardo está en Ost Forod, en la región de Tyrn Fornech de Evendim, al sureste de Emyn Uial.\
\
Has derrotado a un buen número de los Gauredain que mataron a Nat Rapkins y has recogido algunas de sus inusuales armas. Robin Dunkley querrá oír el relato de lo ocurrido.","Robin Sotopardo te ha pedido que derrotes a los Gauredain de Emyn Uial y vuelvas con sus armas.","Los Gauredain de Emyn Uial","Los Guaredain acechan en las colinas y bosques de Emyn Uial, al noroeste.\
\
Robin Sotopardo desea venganza por la muerte de Nat Rapkins y quiere que derrotes a estos malvados hombres que lo mataron. También te ha pedido que le lleves algunas de las inusuales armas de los Gauredain.","Llega las garras rudimentarias a Robin Sotopardo"}},
[12292]={nameES="El Fantasma de Bâr Faroth",objectivesES={"Examina el cadáver del trasgo","Entrega las reservas de Montaraces a Anthandir en el Salón de los Cazadores en Bâr Faroth","Has descubierto los restos de un trasgo en el exterior de las ruinas abandonas del Salón de los Cazadores en Bâr Faroth.","Anthandir se encuentra en el Salón de los Cazadores, en Bâr Faroth.\
\
Tras entrar en el Salón de los Cazadores, has descubierto a un Montaraz del Norte, Anthandir, y a su fiel compañero viviendo en las viejas ruinas. Habla con Anthandir y averigua su propósito en Bâr Faroth.","Un viento helado sopla a través de una grieta en las puertas del Salón de los Cazadores en Bâr Faroth","Mientras explorabas Bâr Faroth, has descubierto los restos de un trasgo asesinado frente a las ruinas del antiguo Salón de los Cazadores. Parece que pocos trasgos se han atrevido a acercarse demasiado a sus puertas, pero no está claro por qué se han vuelto tan temerosos de acercarse.\
\
Debes entrar en las ruinas del Salón de los Cazadores e intentar descubrir quién ha estado actuando contra los trasgos de Bâr Faroth.","Los lugares idóneos para colocar trampas se encuentran por todo Bâr Faroth. Anthandir ha marcado en tu mapa la ubicación de varias reservas de Montaraces en Bâr Faroth.\
\
Anthandir te ha pedido ayuda para colocar trampas para los trasgos que invaden Bâr Faroth. Además, te ha encargado recuperar varias reservas de Montaraces de las ruinas antes de que sean descubiertas por los trasgos.","El Fantasma de Bâr Faroth","Thorvellon agita la cola alegremente","Mientras los trasgos continúan su avance sobre Bâr Faroth, un aliado inesperado aparece en la lucha para expulsarlos de la Comarca Allende.","Explora el campamento en el interior del Salón de los Cazadores en Bâr Faroth","Habla con Anthandir en el Salón de los Cazadores en Bâr Faroth","El Salón de los Cazadores en Bâr Faroth se encuentra en los confines del norte de la Comarca Allende.\
\
Tras descubrir un cadáver de trasgo en el exterior del Salón de los Cazadores, sospechas que alguien está actuando contra los trasgos de Bâr Faroth. Debes investigar el Salón de los Cazadores en Bâr Faroth.","El Salón de los Cazadores en Bâr Faroth se encuentra en los confines del norte de la Comarca Allende.\
\
Tras entrar en el Salón de los Cazadores, has descubierto la luz de una hoguera. Debes investigar la hoguera del campamento dentro del Salón de los Cazadores en Bâr Faroth.","Entra en el Salón de los Cazadores en Bâr Faroth","Anthandir se encuentra en el Salón de los Cazadores, en Bâr Faroth.\
\
Has colocado trampas para trasgos y recuperado varias reservas de Montaraces como Anthandir te pidió. Debes entregar las reservas a Anthandir en el Salón de los Cazadores en Bâr Faroth.","En lo profundo de las ruinas invadidas por la vegetación del Salón de los Cazadores, percibes la luz de una hoguera de campamento","Un Montaraz del Norte y su fiel compañero parecen habitar en el Salón de los Cazadores"}},
[12293]={nameES="The Ghost of Old Mad Ubb",objectivesES={"Search barrels and crates for the ghost","The Ghost of Old Mad Ubb","Odulf can be found in Blómgard.\
\
You should show the squirrel to Odulf.","The crate is empty","<rgb=#00FF00>Scold</rgb> Vulmar","Vulmar feels bad about what he did","According to Odulf, the ghost of Old Mad Ubb is somewhere in Blómgard.\
\
You should search the barrels and crates to make Odulf feel better.","Nothing in there","Radagast can be found in Laerlad.\
\
You should bring the squirrel to Radagast.","The squirrel can be found in Blómgard.\
\
You should pick up the squirrel.","Bring the squirrel to Radagast","A ghost seems to be terrorizing the children of Blómgard.","Vulmar can be found in Blómgard.\
\
You should <rgb=#00FF00>scold</rgb> Vulmar.","Something is in there! Is that a squirrel?","Show the squirrel to Odulf","Pick up the squirrel","The squirrel is surprisingly friendly"}},
[12294]={nameES="La forja fantasma",objectivesES={"La forja fantasma","Encontrarás a Fastarr en el campamento del Mirador de la Gran Excavación, en Moria.\
\
Fastarr te ha pedido que hables con él cuando estés dispuesto a buscar la forja, aunque advierte que una fuerza sobrenatural parece haberse apoderado de ella.","Lleva un zafiro infundido a Fastarr","Fastarr sabe de una forja donde puedes crear el núcleo de las cualidades que buscas, pero los enanos temen que esté infestada de espectros malignos.","Encontrarás a Fastarr en el campamento del Mirador de la Gran Excavación, en Moria.\
\
Debes regresar con él para completar la mejora de tu arma.","Habla con Fastarr para viajar a la Forja de los Espectros","Fastarr te ha pedido que le lleves un zafiguro infundido, indispensable para otorgar a tu arma las cualidades que deseas.","Lleva el zafiro potenciado a Fastarr"}},
[12295]={nameES="Los caminos fantasmales siguen y siguen",objectivesES={"Sigue el camino","Derrota al capitán buscador de reliquias","Vuelve con la pareja de ancianos","Los buscadores y expoliadores de reliquias se encuentran en la parte suroeste del Ángulo.\
\
Deberías derrotar a los buscadores y expoliadores de reliquias.","El montón de tierra está cerca del camino al sur de Eitheldir.\
\
Deberías investigar el montón de tierra.","La tierra ha sido removida aquí","Waltney y Garan Alboespino se encuentran en la parte suroeste del Ángulo.\
\
Deberías avisar a Waltney y Garan de que el bandido que fingía ser un fantasma ha sido derrotado.","Examina la tierra removida","El camino se encuentra en la parte suroeste del Ángulo.\
\
El bandido vigilaba un pequeño camino. Deberías investigarlo.","El afloramiento rocoso está en la parte suroeste del Ángulo.\
\
Has derrotado a un hombre que se hacía pasar por un fantasma y has encontrado una bolsa con una lata de pintura blanca. Sigue buscando pistas en el afloramiento rocoso para descubrir por qué intentaba asustar a la gente para que se alejara de esta zona.","Sigue buscando pistas","Busca a la figura fantasmal","El avance de Waltney y Garan Alboespino se ve detenido una vez más por un espectro fantasmal.","Los caminos fantasmales siguen y siguen","El afloramiento rocoso está en la parte suroeste del Ángulo.\
\
Has derrotado a un Hombre que se hacía pasar por un fantasma. Busca pistas en la zona del afloramiento rocoso por donde merodeaba para descubrir por qué intentaba asustar a la gente para que se alejara de esta zona.","Busca en el afloramiento rocoso","La figura fantasmal se encuentra cerca del camino al sur de Eitheldir, en la parte occidental del Ángulo.\
\
Deberías buscar a la figura fantasmal."}},
[12296]={nameES="The Giant Boar",objectivesES={}},
[12297]={nameES="The Giants of Hlídborg",objectivesES={}},
[12298]={nameES="El Valle de los Gigantes",objectivesES={"Los gigantes han descendido desde las Montañas Nubladas y se han reunido en un valle al este del Páramo Alto, quebrantando los tratados que tenían con los Elfos de Rivendel.","El Valle de los Gigantes","Hay gigantes reuniéndose en un valle al este del Páramo Alto, en el Bosque de los Trolls.\
\
Mientras estés en el valle de los gigantes, deberías intentar ahuyentar a los gigantes que han descendido desde las Montañas Nubladas."}},
[12299]={nameES="El regalo",objectivesES={"Ravaedron ha visto algo que le ha disgustado","Recoge hierbas silvestres para Idhrien (4/5)","Maddoc Astaciervo se encuentra fuera de su casa, contemplando el regalo.","Ravaedron ha visto algo junto a la cabaña que le ha inquietado bastante.","Recogiste hierbas silvestres para Idhrien (5/5), y ves que Ravaedron está muy cerca","Habla con Ravaedron en la Cabaña del Helechal","Incapaz de contener su entusiasmo, Ravaedron ya ha entregado su regalo","Reúnete con la montaraz Idhrien fuera de Glynafon","Descubre qué ha disgustado a Ravaedron","La recolección de hierbas te ha llevado muy cerca de Ravaedron. Le alegrará llevarle el fruto de tu trabajo a Idhrien.","Ravaedron ha terminado el cuadro para Maddoc y Glenys Astaciervo, y está deseando dárselo.","La montaraz Idhrien sugirió que podrías ayudarla a recoger algunas de las hierbas silvestres que necesita para hacer cataplasmas y otros remedios curativos para los Dúnedain.","Ravaedron guarda silencio, con la mirada perdida hacia el este.","El regalo","Habla con Ravaedron junto a la Cabaña del Helechal","Reúnete con Ravaedron fuera de la Cabaña del Helechal","Habla con Maddoc Astaciervo fuera de su casa","Ravaedron está en la Cabaña del Helechal, radiante de felicidad.","Ravaedron está junto a la cabaña de sus amigos, dolido por el rechazo de su regalo.","Llévale las hierbas silvestres que recogiste a Ravaedron","Ravaedron te ha pedido que te reúnas con él en la Cabaña del Helechal, donde le dará el cuadro a sus amigos.","El regalo que pintó Ravaedron ha sido desechado sin contemplaciones junto a la cabaña","Ravaedron se encontró con la montaraz Idhrien de camino a la Cabaña del Helechal y cree que deberías ayudarla si puedes."}},
[12300]={nameES="The Gift of Greenleaves",objectivesES={"While waiting for Grimbeorn's answer, Legolas recalls a recent story told to him by King Thranduil.","Talk to Legolas at the Beorninghús","Legolas can be found at the Beorninghús in the Beorning-lands.\
\
You should talk to Legolas.","The Gift of Greenleaves","Habla con Legolas."}},
[12301]={nameES="The Gift of Peace",objectivesES={}},
[12302]={nameES="The Glades of Egladil",objectivesES={}},
[12303]={nameES="Las Cavernas Centelleantes",objectivesES={}},
[12304]={nameES="The Glittering Caves - Small Fellowship",objectivesES={}},
[12305]={nameES="The Gloom in the East",objectivesES={"Erianir can be found in Sarnhad in western Lebennin.\
\
You have lit many lanterns to aid in illuminating the Dawnless Day and comforted those too young to understand the trials of Gondor. You should speak to Erianir.","Sarnhad can be found due east of Linhir in Lebennin.\
\
Erchar has asked you to travel into Lebennin and provide aid where you are able.","Children of Sarnhad can be found throughout Sarnhad in western Lebennin.\
\
Erianir has asked you to bring hope to the children of Sarnhad before they fall into despair.","The Gloom in the East","Lanterns can be found throughout Sarnhad in western Lebennin.\
\
Erianir has asked you to light the lanterns in Sarnhad.","Greatly troubled by the recent attack in Linhir and the loss of his brother, Erchar hopes to secure Lebennin before seeking vengeance against the Heirs of Castamir.","Talk to Erianir in Sarnhad","Talk to someone in Sarnhad about the troubles of Lebennin","DNT -- will not be seen"}},
[12306]={nameES="La Languidez de Nurn, Azote de Mordor",objectivesES={"The Great Alliance of Elves and Men stood in defiance of Sauron for long years of siege, but even their greatest heroes came to fear his deadliest servants. These were the Nazgûl, and their number was Nine.","The Great Alliance of Elves and Men stood in defiance of Sauron for long years of siege, but even their bravest heroes came to fear his deadliest servants. These were the Nazgûl, and their number was Nine. They stalked the battlefield of Mordor Besieged, and were its most dangerous scourges.\
\
None can say what ship bore him hither to Middle-earth before Númenor was lost, but once he accepted Sauron's gift he could no longer be counted among the Men of that land. He dwelt in Thaurband, a fortress in southern Mordor, not far from the inland Sea. It was from that keep that the fear of him spread, giving him a new title to replace the name he no longer needed. He became the Gloom of Núrn, though he did not stay there, and roved far and wide at Sauron's command.","The Gloom of Núrn, defeated but enduring","Defeat the Gloom of Núrn in Mordor Besieged","La Languidez de Nurn, Azote de Mordor","Nadie puede decir qué barco lo llevó a la Tierra Media antes de que Númenor se perdiera, pero una vez que aceptó el regalo de Sauron, ya no podía ser contado entre los Hombres de esa tierra. Habitó en Thaurband, una fortaleza en el sur de Mordor, no lejos del Mar Interior. Desde esa fortaleza se extendió el miedo hacia él, dándole un nuevo título para reemplazar el nombre que ya no necesitaba. Se convirtió en la Languidez de Núrn, aunque no permaneció allí, y vagó por todas partes bajo el mando de Sauron.","The Gloom of Núrn has been defeated... for now","The Gloom of Núrn suffered defeat on the battlefield of Mordor Besieged, but it was not to be a lasting death... not while Sauron endured. The Nazgûl would return, for his was an existence beyond ending."}},
[12307]={nameES="The Glory of the Malledhrim",objectivesES={"The Glory of the Malledhrim","Defend the banner of the Malledhrim","Dannaswen is at the Elf-waypost atop Amon Angened, south of the Gostannon.\
\
You should return to Dasswen with news of your victory.","You have been defeated","Plant the banner at the Gostannon","Talk to Dannaswen atop Amon Angened","<rgb=#FF0000>Do not fall before the Enemy</rgb>","Planted the banner at the Gostannon","Defended the banner of the Malledhrim","You have left the banner undefended","The Elves of the Golden Host are concerned with the continuing presence of Orcs in the Mirk-eaves and in procuring supplies for the Malledhrim in the east.","The Gostannon lies to the north of Amon Angened.\
\
Dannaswen asked you to defend the banner you planted in the enemy encampment at the Gostannon.","The pile of stones is atop a small rise in the Orc-camp at the Gostannon, north-east of Amon Angeled.\
\
Dannaswen has asked you to plant the banner of the Malledhrim at the Orc-camp near the Gostannon and defend it against the Orcs.","<rgb=#FF0000>Do not leave the banner undefended</rgb>"}},
[12308]={nameES="The Glow from Rolanthir",objectivesES={"Rolanthir can be found just south of Faramir's Look-out in Southern Ithilien.\
\
You should investigate Rolanthir. Arodor has seen strange and ghastly lights coming from these ruins.","The Glow from Rolanthir","Faramir's Look-out is located south-east of Osgiliath.\
\
You should speak with Arodor at Faramir's Look-out.","Return the water sample to Arodor","Investigate the ruins of Rolanthir","Rolanthir can be found just south of Faramir's Look-out in Southern Ithilien.\
\
You should defeat Darkwaters and collect samples of water from the Morgulduin River.","It appears that foul spirits bound to the Morgulduin congregate in the ruins","Arodor has asked you to investigate strange lights coming from ruins on the other side of the Morgulduin River."}},
[12309]={nameES="Los árboles sombríos del Bosque Ahogado",objectivesES={"Nenedhel parted ways with Nífdir to the west of Estolad Mernael.\
\
Nenedhel, leader of the Malledhrim in the Drownholt, has asked you to seek Nífdir in the swamp-lands.","Busca a Nífir en el Bosque Ahogado","Habla con Nenedhel en Estolad Mernael","Nenedhel is at Estolad Mernael, east of Nífdir's small camp.\
\
You should speak with Nenedhel and assure him that Nífdir is safe, but not yet ready to rejoin his companions.","The Elves of the Drownholt are missing one of their own -- a curious Elf who fancied he heard the sorrow of the trees as they made their way through the swamplands. He has not returned, and his companions yearn for news of him.","Los árboles sombríos del Bosque Ahogado"}},
[12310]={nameES="El trasgo granjero",objectivesES={"El trasgo granjero","Bethan Hove te ha pedido que acabes con los trasgos que se han hecho con la granja de su familia.\
\
La granja de la familia Hove está en el norte de Cardolan.","Acaba con Lukglob"}},
[12311]={nameES="El líder de los trasgos",objectivesES={"El líder de los trasgos, Nishrûk, vive en una fortaleza de trasgos construida entre las ruinas al sureste de la Posada Abandonada.\
\
El ayudante Osmann te pidió que mataras a Nishrûk, el líder de los trasgos que causan problemas en la Posada Abandonada.","Derrota a Nishrûk","El líder de los trasgos","Nishrûk derrotado","Habla con el ayudante Osmann","Los trasgos de Minas Eriol están liderados por una criatura terrible llamada Nishrûk.","El ayudante Osmann te espera al otro lado del puente, en el extremo oriental de las ruinas de Minas Eriol.\
\
Entraste en las ruinas y derrotaste a Nishrûk, tal como pidió el ayudante Osmann. Deberías volver con él para darle la noticia de tu éxito."}},
[12312]={nameES="The Goblins at War",objectivesES={"Langhár can be found in Vegbár, the Beorning outpost in northern Wolf-denes.\
\
You should talk to Langhár.","The stage is set for a battle between the goblin forces.\
\
You should complete 'Instance: Revenge of the Great Goblin.'","Battle is about to erupt outside of Vegbár. The Beornings can only hope the goblins will do enough damage that the small force of Beornings can overwhelm the survivors.","Talk to Skalla and ready the ambush","The Goblins at War","Habla con Langhár"}},
[12313]={nameES="La fuente de los trasgos",objectivesES={"Hay arañas en los Páramos del Norte, al sur de Dwaling.\
\
Bob Hojasverdes te pidió que salieras y mataras arañas, con la esperanza de que los trasgos se vayan.","Habla con Bob Hojasverdes en Dwaling","Bob Hojasverdes está en Dwaling, al norte de los Páramos del Norte.\
\
Deberías regresar a Bob Hojasverdes con las noticias de tu éxito.","La fuente de los trasgos","Bob Hojasverdes está confundido por tus descubrimientos en los campamentos de trasgos."}},
[12314]={nameES="El tesoro de los trasgos",objectivesES={"Has recuperado varias gemas semipreciosas robadas a los Suuri-lehmä por los trasgos de Ram Dûath.\
\
Debes devolverlas a Aslak en Lehmä-koti.","El tesoro de los trasgos","Lleva las gemas de los trasgos de vuelta a Aslak en Lehmä-koti","Aslak de los Suuri-lehmä te dijo que los trasgos han reunido montones de gemas en la fortaleza que comparten con los Angmarim en el paso noreste de Ram Dûath.","Los trasgos de Ram Dûath han robado varios tesoros de los Suuri-lehmä.\
\
Aslak te ha dicho que las gemas pueden encontrarse en cofres dentro de la fortaleza Angmarim al noreste."}},
[12315]={nameES="The Golden Dwarf",objectivesES={"You spoke with the guard","You spoke with the innkeeper","Speak with Ledger-keeper Zarai at the courtyard in Jax Phanâl","You spoke with the dock-master","Speak with the innkeeper at the central outer courtyard","Return to Girgish at Jax Phanâl","Speak with Gadnith in the easternmost outer courtyard","You spoke with the auctioneer","Girgish represents Khôltekh, a leader of the Kindred of the Coins. She has requested that you make yourself known to some of the citizens in Jax Phanâl.","Speak with the auctioneer","Speak with the dock-master on the shore west of the outpost","Having spoken with important members of the town, you should return to Khôltekh's emissary and let her know that you now have introduced yourself to those she recommended you meet.","Girgish directed you to make your way around the outpost of Jax Phanâl to familiarize yourself with the citizens dwelling here. She then bids you return to her after meeting all the important folk in the outpost.","The Golden Dwarf"}},
[12316]={nameES="El Salón Dorado de Erebor",objectivesES={"Visita el barrio de Erebor.","Visita la Casa de Provisiones y Artesanía de Erebor","Ves una pequeña morada que, con las decoraciones adecuadas, podría resultar muy acogedora","Habla con Gárthi Guardallaves","Visita el mirador central","Visita una casa lujosa a lo largo de la Vía de Escudo de Roble o el Camino de Pie de Hierro","Visita una casa modesta a lo largo del Puente del Tesoro de Sierpe","Debes regresar a la entrada del barrio y hablar con Gárthi Guardallaves.","Ves una casa imponente con múltiples patios","Pasas junto a un jardín inusual y ves una casa aún más inusual","El Salón Dorado de Erebor","Visita la Geoda del Camino de Pie de Hierro","Este pasillo serpenteante alberga varios servicios de la ciudad","Visita el salón de hermandad","El gran salón se alza ante ti, refulgente en verde y oro.","Descubres una finca magnífica, llena de posibilidades","Grandes calzadas se extienden hacia el norte, llevando al salón de hermandad","Las puertas del último tesoro dorado de Smaug están abiertas, y los Enanos de Erebor buscan habitar una vez más este gran salón.","La entrada al tesoro dorado se encuentra junto a los muros occidentales de Tumnu-dûm, los Salones-Vivienda de Erebor.\
\
Deberías visitar y explorar el salón recién restaurado."}},
[12317]={nameES="La Perca Dorada",objectivesES={"Lleva la levadura a Gunderic Cavada","Gunderic Cavada, posadero de la Perca Dorada, participa en la Feria de la Cerveza de las Cuatro Cuadernas.","Consigue la levadura","La Perca Dorada","Levadura obtenida","El campamento de los bandidos está en las colinas al sur de Casa del Bosque, más o menos a mitad de camino entre Alforzaburgo y la granja de Maggot. La posada de la Perca Dorada está en Cepeda, al este de Casa del Bosque.\
\
Gunderic Cavada te ha enviado a buscar en un campamento de bandidos su paquete de levadura perdido."}},
[12318]={nameES="El buen tocino",objectivesES={"Encuentra al explorador cerca de la entrada de Shakhdag.","Suginzi, el jabalí de la plaga te ha encontrado","Consigue lonchas sanas de jabalí y elimina a los jabalíes enfermos de la manada.","Derrota a Suginzi, el jabalí podrido","Consigue lonchas sanas de jabalí para que un cocinero las convierta en su famosa receta de tocino para la hambrienta gente de Urmâkh.","Encuentra al explorador cerca de la entrada de Shakhdag","El buen tocino","Derrota a Suginzi, el jabalí podrido."}},
[12319]={nameES="The Good Will of the Galadhrim",objectivesES={"Haldir awaits news of your good deeds towards the dwarves upon his flet near the River Nimrodel, on the western border of Lothlórien.\
\
You should seek Haldir and inform him of all that passed while you assisted the dwarves.","Habla con Haldir en Talan Haldir","Hrólfur is in the Chamber of the Cross-roads, in Durin's Way.\
\
You should speak with Hrólfur and accept his two charges: the conquering of Nalâ-dûm, where the water-wheels are, and Lumul-nar, the Hall of Mirrors.","Help the dwarves regain control of Nalâ-dûm","Hrólfur, an important overseer, can likely be found in the Chamber of the Cross-roads in Moria, in Durin's Way.\
\
Haldir has pressed you to bring an important message from Celeborn to Hrólfur after a previous attempt to make contact was spurned by the proud dwarf.","Bring Celeborn's letter to Hrólfur","The Good Will of the Galadhrim","Help the dwarves regain control of Lumul-nar","The Galadhrim of Lothlórien feel the pressing of danger upon their borders from many sides, but never so violently as the recent attacks from Moria since the arrival of a secret company in the Golden Wood. Haldir, a marchwarden of the Nimrodel, wishes to secure a friendship with the dwarves of Khazad-dûm so that the evils of Moria may be kept at bay, for the safety of both lands."}},
[12320]={nameES="La Gran Escalera - Igash Desatado",objectivesES={"No mates al Devoto","No mates a Gothgaash","No mates a la Bestia","Antaño uno de los cruces de caminos más grandes y hermosos de Moria, la Gran Escalera es ahora un vil refugio para muchas de las tribus orcas congregadas allí. Igash, considerado líder por todos esos grupos diversos, recauda tributos de cada tribu para entregárselos a Mazog, el más poderoso y temible de los orcos de Khazad-dûm. Los enanos desean expulsar a los orcos de Igash de la Gran Escalera y evitar que Mazog reciba esos valiosos y perversos obsequios.","El enano Sigurd se encuentra en la Sala Vigesimoprimera, al noroeste de la Gran Escalera.\
\
Has derrotado a Igash sin matar a ningún otro miembro de las tribus de orcos de Moria. Sigurd espera noticias de tu incursión.","Muchas tribus de orcos merodean por la Gran Escalera, al sureste de la Sala Vigesimoprimera.\
\
Geirr te ha pedido que derrotes a Igash en la Gran Escalera sin matar a ningún otro miembro de las tribus de orcos de Moria. Al hacerlo, contribuirás a los esfuerzos por recuperar esa encrucijada para los enanos y demostrarás tu gran valía a Sigurd.","La Gran Escalera - Igash Desatado","Regresa con Sigurd en la Sala Vigesimoprimera","No mates a Glothrok"}},
[12321]={nameES="La Gran Escalera - El látigo de Igash",objectivesES={"Igash puede encontrarse en lo alto de la Gran Escalera, al sureste de la Sala Vigesimoprimera, donde Eilífr ocupa su puesto.\
\
Eilífr te ha pedido que derrotes a Igash y recojas su látigo para ayudar en los esfuerzos por recuperar ese cruce de caminos para los enanos. Desea ver el látigo como prueba de tus actos.","Devuelve el látigo a Eilíefr en la Sala Vigesimoprimera","Antaño uno de los cruces de caminos más grandes y hermosos de Moria, la Gran Escalera es ahora un vil refugio para muchas de las tribus orcas congregadas allí. Igash, considerado líder por todos esos grupos diversos, recauda tributos de cada tribu para entregárselos a Mazog, el más poderoso y temible de los orcos de Khazad-dûm. Los enanos desean expulsar a los orcos de Igash de la Gran Escalera y evitar que Mazog reciba esos valiosos y perversos obsequios.","La Gran Escalera - El látigo de Igash"}},
[12322]={nameES="La Gran Escalera - Marca del Maestro",objectivesES={"La Gran Escalera - Marca del Maestro","Antaño uno de los cruces de caminos más grandes y hermosos de Moria, la Gran Escalera es ahora un vil refugio para muchas de las tribus orcas congregadas allí. Igash, considerado su líder por todos esos grupos diversos, recauda tributos de cada tribu para entregárselos a Mazog, el más poderoso y temible de los orcos de Khazad-dûm. Los enanos desean expulsar a los orcos de Igash de la Gran Escalera y evitar que Mazog reciba esos valiosos y perversos obsequios.","Devuelve las marcas a Eilífr en la Sala Vigesimoprimera","Muchas tribus de orcos merodean por la Gran Escalera, junto a sus líderes, al sureste de la Sala Vigesimoprimera.\
\
Eilífr te ha pedido que derrotes a los líderes orcos de la Gran Escalera para ayudar en los esfuerzos por recuperar ese cruce de caminos para los enanos. Desea ver sus marcas como prueba de tu hazaña."}},
[12323]={nameES="La Gran Escalera - Limpiando las escaleras",objectivesES={"Regresa con Geirr en la Sala Vigesimoprimera","Muchas tribus de orcos merodean por la Gran Escalera, al sureste de la Sala Vigesimoprimera.\
\
Geirr te ha pedido que derrotes a muchos orcos en la Gran Escalera para ayudar a los enanos a recuperar el cruce de caminos.","Geirr se encuentra en la Sala Vigesimoprimera, al noroeste de la Gran Escalera.\
\
Geirr querrá saber de tu victoria contra los orcos en la que una vez fue una hermosa encrucijada de los enanos.","Antaño uno de los cruces de caminos más grandes y hermosos de Moria, la Gran Escalera es ahora un vil refugio para muchas de las tribus orcas congregadas allí. Igash, considerado líder por todos esos grupos diversos, recauda tributos de cada tribu para entregárselos a Mazog, el más poderoso y temible de los orcos de Khazad-dûm. Los enanos desean expulsar a los orcos de Igash de la Gran Escalera y evitar que Mazog reciba esos valiosos y perversos obsequios.","La Gran Escalera - Limpiando las escaleras"}},
[12324]={nameES="The Grasp of the Dead",objectivesES={"The Grasp of the Dead","Orodir can be found in Lancrath, to the south of Tingobel in Blackroot Vale.\
\
You have defeated the Orc-leader, Ulkfrúm, in the Tingobel mine. You should return to Orodir and tell him of the Orc's defeat.","Travel to the Tingobel mine","Ulkfrúm has been defeated","Ulkfrúm must be deeper in the mine, so perhaps finding something valuable will draw him forth","The Tingobel mine can be found in the rear of Tingobel to the north of Lancrath.\
\
Orodir has asked that you slay the leader of the Orc forces encamped in Tingobel.","Talk to Orodir","Search for something valuable to draw forth Ulkfrúm and defeat him","The leader of the Rashat-hai Orcs can be found somewhere in the Tingobel mine.\
\
You have entered the Tingobel mine, but have not yet found the Orc. You should search for something valuable to draw his attention.","DNT -- will not be seen","The leader of the Rashat-hai Orcs in Tingobel has taken control of the mine and now seeks to exploit the vale's resources on behalf of the Enemy."}},
[12325]={nameES="The Grave of Gladsúnu",objectivesES={}},
[12326]={nameES="La Tarea de la Gran Alianza: Lanzas agrietadas",objectivesES={"Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir lanzas agrietadas.","Se busca: lanzas agrietadas, en memoria de la Gran Alianza.","Se busca: lanzas agrietadas, en memoria de la Gran Alianza. Recógelas para ganar una recompensa adecuada para los coleccionistas.","La Tarea de la Gran Alianza: Lanzas agrietadas","Alguien ha publicado una tarea para recoger lanzas agrietadas, en memoria de la Gran Alianza. Se pueden entregar a cambio de una recompensa.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Entregar las lanzas agrietadas en un buzón de recogida"}},
[12327]={nameES="La Gran Bestia",objectivesES={"Tasgall ha asado las larvas que le trajiste. Puedes volver con él para conocer el siguiente paso de su plan para derrotar a la Madre de las Bestias.","Las extrañas bestias de las colinas se han convertido en un problema serio últimamente. Parece que están gobernadas por una matriarca secreta que sirve a los dragonzuelos. Si puede ser derrotada, quizá la amenaza de las bestias de las colinas desaparezca.","Has colocado la carne de larva asada","Has derrotado al vengativo Señor de las Bestias y salvado la vida de Tasgall. Habla con él.","Atrae y derrota a la Madre de las Bestias","La Gran Bestia","Lleva la carne de larva a Tasgall","Las larvas se pueden encontrar en la zona general, no muy al norte de Aughaire.\
\
Caza larvas para obtener su carne y tráela a Tasgall para que la ase.","La roca en la guarida de las bestias de las colinas está en la entrada del valle, no muy al norte de Aughaire.\
\
Tasgall te ha dado carne de larva asada, que debes llevar a cierta roca en las guaridas de las bestias de las colinas.","Tras derrotar con éxito a la Madre de las Bestias, debes regresar al campamento de Tasgall y hablar con él.","Habla con Tasgall"}},
[12328]={nameES="The Great Beorning Signature",objectivesES={"Add the honey to the mixture","A mortar and pestle can be found at the Beorninghús.\
\
You should crush the wheat and seeds that you have collected.","The Great Beorning Signature","The oven can be found at the Beorninghús.\
\
You should put your cake in the oven.","All that is left to do is to wait and watch it bake","Show Hállkell your perfect honey cake","Wait and watch your cake","The oven can be found at the Beorninghús.\
\
You should take your cake out of the oven.","Wild wheat and seeds can be found north and east of the Beorninghús.\
\
You should collect wheat and seeds for your honey cake.","Bake your batter in the oven","The mortar and pestle can be found at the Beorninghús.\
\
You should add the honey to the mixture you have made.","Hállkell can be found at the Beorninghús.\
\
You should show your perfect honey cake to Hállkell.","It does look quite good!","A cake stand can be found inside Grimbeorn's lodge.\
\
You should present your cake on the stand.","The oven can be found at the Beorninghús.\
\
You should wait by the oven for your cake to bake.","The batter now has a good consistency","Hállkell has decided to enlist you in making the perfect honey cake.","Take your honey cake out of the oven","That is a nice looking cake!","Time to take out your cake!","Use the mortar and pestle at the Beorninghús to crush the wheat and seeds","Present your perfect honey cake inside Grimbeorn's lodge"}},
[12329]={nameES="La Gran Fuga",objectivesES={"Glóin está justo fuera de la entrada a la Ciudad de los Trasgos.\
\
Con tu ayuda, Aeglas y Glorwen escaparon a un lugar seguro. Oghûk demostró ser tan traicionero como cualquier trasgo. Debes informar de tu éxito a Glóin.","Después de recuperar la llave maestra del torturador trasgo, Aeglas decidió que era hora de abandonar la Ciudad de los Trasgos.","Habla con Glóin en su campamento fuera de la Ciudad de los Trasgos","La Gran Fuga","Debes proteger a Aeglas mientras intenta conducir a Glorwen y Oghûk a un lugar seguro. Depende de ti defenderlo en el trayecto.","Aeglas y Glorwen han encontrado el camino a la libertad","Habla con Aeglas"}},
[12330]={nameES="El Gran Salón de Durin",objectivesES={"Habla con Dómárr","El Gran Salón de Durin","Dómárr ha encontrado muchas situaciones desagradables durante sus viajes por Zelem-melek.","Escucha la historia de Dómárr","Dómárr se encuentra en el Gran Salón de Durin.\
\
Deberías hablar con Dómárr.","Reinn se encuentra en el Gran Salón de Durin.\
\
Deberías hablar con Reinn."}},
[12331]={nameES="El gran rescate de los hobbits",objectivesES={"El gran rescate de los hobbits","May Gamyi se separó de sus amigos dentro del Agujero Embrujado, ya que desaparecieron de su lado uno por uno.\
\
Deberías buscar a los amigos de May y empujarlos hacia la puerta.","May Gamyi está fuera del Agujero Embrujado, cerca del Árbol de la Fiesta.\
\
Deberías regresar con May Gamyi para informarle que todos sus amigos están bien.","Regresa con May Gamyi para informarle sobre sus amigos","Pobre pequeña May Gamyie se encontró completamente sola después de entrar al Agujero Embrujado con un gran grupo de amigos.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando finalice el evento con el que está asociada. </rgb>"}},
[12332]={nameES="La Gran Pesca de Mathoms",objectivesES={"Los hobbits de la Comarca han creado un evento especial de limpieza del hogar en el que los mathoms viejos se arrojan al lago y pueden pescarse para quedarse con ellos.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando termine el festival actual.</rgb>","El estanque está al norte de Delagua.\
\
Billard Pott te ha hablado de una oportunidad increíble para pescar mathoms en el estanque de Delagua.","La Gran Pesca de Mathoms","Pesca tantos mathoms como puedas antes de que se acabe el tiempo","Habla con Melia Pott para comenzar"}},
[12333]={nameES="The Great Moots of the Thing-fold",objectivesES={"Examined the statue of The Third Great Moot","Kyrstig can be found just outside Ibdêkh-buzru, the Thing-fold.\
\
You should talk to Kyrstig.","Examined the statue of The Seventh Great Moot","Talk to Kyrstig","Seven statues representing the Great Moots can be found in Ibdêkh-buzru, the Thing-fold.\
\
You should examine the statues.","The Great Moots of the Thing-fold","Examine the statue of The Fifth Great Moot","Examine the statue of The Seventh Great Moot","Examine the statue of The Second Great Moot","Examine the statue of The First Great Moot","Examined the statue of The Fourth Great Moot","The Thing-fold is a landmark of great historic significance for the dwarf-clans. It is a location where dwarf-kings have met to discuss matters of grave importance for thousands of years.","Examined the statue of The Sixth Great Moot","Examine the statue of The Sixth Great Moot","Examined the statue of The Second Great Moot","Examined the statue of The First Great Moot","Examined the statue of The Fifth Great Moot","Examine the statue of The Fourth Great Moot","Examine the statue of The Third Great Moot"}},
[12334]={nameES="The Great Orc-hunt",objectivesES={"Orcs can be found throughout Azanulbizar.\
\
King Thráin has asked you to slay Orcs at Azanulbizar.","The Haban'akkâ of Thráin struck fear into the hearts of the Orcs across Middle-earth.","The Great Orc-hunt","King Thráin can be found at Amdân.\
\
You have slain many of the Orcs at Azanulbizar. You should talk to King Thráin.","Talk to King Thráin at Amdân"}},
[12335]={nameES="El Gran Mundo Abierto",objectivesES={"Viaja a Minas Tirith","El Gran Mundo Abierto","El Granjero Arenilla no está mirando. Ahora es tu oportunidad de escapar.","Este puede ser un momento maravilloso para explorar la Tierra Media.","Minas Tirith es un lugar encantador.","Alza el vuelo desde la proa de Minas Tirith"}},
[12336]={nameES="El Gran Mundo Abierto",objectivesES={"Piensas que quizás ha llegado el momento de escapar del gallinero del Granjero Arenilla.","Examina a George","George parece increíblemente agitado por algo y bate las alas con desenfreno.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>¡ADVERTENCIA: Esta misión inicia una misión especial de sesión. Cerrarás sesión con tu personaje normal y adoptarás la apariencia de un pnj amistoso para el jugador. Obtendrás un conjunto de habilidades únicas para este personaje especial!</rgb>","El Gran Mundo Abierto","Tras haber probado un poco de libertad, deseas más.","George bate las alas con frenesí."}},
[12337]={nameES="The Gredbyg of Torech Ungol",objectivesES={"Many gredbyg have responded to the call of Shelob and taken up residence in her lair.\
\
You should defeat gredbyg inside Torech Ungol.","The other children of Shelob, the Gredbyg, have also taken up residence in Torech Ungol.","Legolas is standing by outside Torech Ungol.\
\
You should talk to Legolas.","Habla con Legolas.","The Gredbyg of Torech Ungol"}},
[12338]={nameES="The Greed of Trolls",objectivesES={"Handarod is in Esteldín, north of Dol Nendir.\
\
You should return to Handarod and tell him of Gurmagath's defeat.","The Greed of Trolls","Defeated Gurmagath","Talk to Handarod","The Stone-troll chieftain Gurmagath is in the forests south-east of Dol Nendír.\
\
Handarod has asked you to find Gurmagath and defeat him. He suggested that you take allies with you.","Handarod told you that the Stone-troll chieftain known as Gurmagath has been boldly raiding nearby Elvish settlements in order to amass enough wealth and food to sate his enormous greed and appetite. The Elves have asked for the aid of the Rangers of Esteldín in stopping his thievery.","Defeat Gurmagath"}},
[12339]={nameES="El Desafío Verde",objectivesES={"El Desafío Verde","La salida del laberinto parece estar a leguas y leguas de donde te encuentras ahora.\
\
Si puedes caminar sin caerte, deberías intentar alcanzar la salida antes de que se acabe el tiempo.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión fallará al cerrar sesión.</rgb>","Tob aRENAS está fuera del laberinto de setos en los Campos de Caballos, en Bree.\
\
Deberías hablar con Tob para averiguar exactamente por qué entraste al laberinto en primer lugar.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión fallará al cerrar sesión.</rgb>","El laberinto de setos está en los Campos de Caballos, al norte de Bree.\
\
Parece que Tob Arenas te dio un desafío, aunque no está del todo claro cuál era. Deberías explorar el centro del laberinto para encontrar alguna pista que aclare qué ha planeado este miembro de la Liga de las Posadas.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión fallará si cierras sesión antes de completarla y entregarla.</rgb>","Busca un objeto de la Liga de las Posadas dentro del laberinto","Encuentra la salida antes de que se acabe el tiempo","La Liga de las Posadas siempre procura hacer la vida en la Tierra Media más agradable para quienes disfrutan de los buenos tragos. El desafío de Tob Arenas de la Liga de las Posadas hará que tu recorrido entre la vegetación sea aún mejor.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro cuando finalice el festival actual. </rgb>","Habla con Tob Arenas"}},
[12340]={nameES="El Dragón Verde",objectivesES={"El barril perdido está en algún lugar al noroeste de Sobrecolina. La posada El Dragón Verde está en Delagua, al sureste de Sobrecolina.\
\
Barmy Nudoraíz, el ayudante de posadero en El Dragón Verde, te ha enviado a buscar un barril de brandy perdido.","Barril enano recogido","Recoge el barril enano","Lleva el barril de vuelta a Barmy Nudoraíz","Gerd Pieblanco, posadero de El Dragón Verde en Delagua, participará en la reunión de cerveceros de las Cuatro Cuadernas.","El Dragón Verde"}},
[12341]={nameES="The Green Sadness",objectivesES={}},
[12342]={nameES="Los bandidos del Camino Verde",objectivesES={"Los bandidos que están en el camino de Andrath están asaltando a los viajeros.","Vuelve con Gerwyn","Los bandidos del Camino Verde","Gerwyn te ha pedido que acabes con los bandidos que les persiguieron fuera de Andrath.\
\
Los bandidos están al sur de Andrath, en el norte de Cardolan.","Acaba con asaltantes del Camino Verde","Deberías decirle a Gerwyn que has acabado con varios bandidos del Camino Verde.\
\
Gerwyn está en el círculo de caravanas, en el norte de Cardolan."}},
[12343]={nameES="The Grey King",objectivesES={"The Grey King","Iolo Brochtû is at Maur Tulhau, north-east of the Grey King's lair.\
\
You should return to Iolo Brochtû with news of the Grey King's defeat.","Talk to Iolo Brochtû at Maur Tulhau","The entrance to the Grey King's lair lies in a gully to the south-west of Maur Tulhau.\
\
Iolo Brochtû has asked you to rid his village of the threat of the Grey King.","Iolo Brochtû has told you of a legendary creature they call the Grey King who haunts the bluffs of the Gloomglens, crushing passers-by with great stones.","Find and defeat the Grey King"}},
[12344]={nameES="The Grey Wrack",objectivesES={"<rgb=#FF00FF>Look</rgb> into the Grey Wrack from Stánbalk, the Stone Wall","Thikil-gundu can be found beyond the Grey Wrack.\
\
You have made your way to Thikil-gundu and should now search for some sign of Nori and his expedition.","Talk to Dori atop Stánbalk, the Stone Wall","Deliver Nori's axe to Dori atop Stánbalk, the Stone Wall","The Grey Wrack","Ingór, son of Vékun can be found in the Grey Wrack.\
\
You have found Ingór, son of Vékun while searching the Grey Wrack, but he appears to be wounded. You should speak to Ingór, son of Vékun.","Search for Nori before the gates of Thikil-gundu","Stánbalk, the Stone Wall can be found to the south of Thikil-gundu.\
\
Dori has asked you to scale Stánbalk, the Stone Wall and scout for nearby foes.","Slain dwarves and dwarf-wights can be found throughout the Grey Wrack.\
\
Fearing that none of their bodies can be recovered, Ingór, son of Vékun has asked you to burn the remains of his fallen companions as well as the remains of the terrible dwarf-wights that wander the Grey Wrack.","Before Thikil-gundu lies the Grey Wrack, a waste-land of ice and death wrought by Vethúg Wintermind and Hrímil Frost-heart.","Scale the ruins of Stánbalk, the Stone Wall","You have not found any of the slain Longbeards or Zhélruka that Ingór described!","Talk to Ingór, son of Vékun in the Grey Wrack","The Grey Wrack lies between Stánbalk, the Stone Wall and Thikil-gundu.\
\
Dori has asked you to search the Grey Wrack for signs of Nori and his expedition.","Flakes of rust fall from the blade of Nori's axe, but it remains unblemished...","Search the Grey Wrack for signs of Nori's expedition","Blurred shapes move in the distance, but Stánbalk appears to be free of foes...","You have discovered Nori's axe amid a pile of rust before the gates of Thikil-gundu!","You have found no sign of Nori's expedition, but you spot a familiar dwarf amid the Wrack...","Talk to Dori on the road to Thikil-gundu","Reclaim Nori's axe before the gates of Thikil-gundu","Dori can be found on a hilltop overlooking Stánbalk, the Stone Wall of Thikil-gundu.\
\
You have scaled Stánbalk, the Stone Wall, and you have found it empty of foes. You should now speak to Dori.","Dori can be found atop Stánbalk, the Stone Wall.\
\
Dori and Company have made camp atop Stánbalk, the Stone Wall. You should now speak to Dori.","Dori can be found atop Stánbalk, the Stone Wall.\
\
You have found Nori's axe amid a pile of Karazgar's rust. You should return to Dori at once.","You have reached the location Dori described!","Nori's axe can be found outside the gates of Thikil-gundu.\
\
You have discovered Nori's axe amid a pile of Karazgar's rust. You should collect Nori's axe."}},
[12345]={nameES="El Sureño Sombrío, Azote de Mordor",objectivesES={"Defeat the Grim Southron in Mordor Besieged","The Grim Southron has been defeated... for now","The Great Alliance of Elves and Men stood in defiance of Sauron for long years of siege, but even their greatest heroes came to fear his deadliest servants. These were the Nazgûl, and their number was Nine.","El Sureño Sombrío, Azote de Mordor","Pocos entre los vivos lo han oído hablar, pero su rostro era conocido y temido. Lo llamaban el Suderon siniestro y, aunque los Hombres se acobardaban a su paso durante la Segunda Edad, durante la Tercera la leyenda de su maldad solo había crecido. En años posteriores fue él a quien Lhaereth la Manchada siguió en secreto a Dol Guldur, donde descubrió a Sauron y le ayudó a recuperarse, por un precio. ¿El Señor Oscuro le dio una recompensa o un castigo por esta falta a su Nazgûl? Pero eso fue mucho más tarde. Durante la Segunda Edad, el Suderon siniestro solo era conocido por ser paciente, leal y silencioso.","The Grim Southron suffered defeat on the battlefield of Mordor Besieged, but it was not to be a lasting death... not while Sauron endured. The Nazgûl would return, for his was an existence beyond ending.","The Grim Southron, defeated but enduring","The Great Alliance of Elves and Men stood in defiance of Sauron for long years of siege, but even their bravest heroes came to fear his deadliest servants. These were the Nazgûl, and their number was Nine. They stalked the battlefield of Mordor Besieged, and were its most dangerous scourges.\
\
Few among the living ever heard him speak, but his visage was well-known, and feared. They called him the Grim Southron, and while Men quailed at his approach during the Second Age, during the Third the legend of his malice had only grown. In later days it was he that Lhaereth the Stained followed in secret to Dol Guldur, where she discovered Sauron and helped him recover, for a price. Did the Dark Lord deal out reward or punishment for his Nazgûl's lapse? But that was much later. During the Second Age, the Grim Southron was known only to be patient, loyal, and silent."}},
[12346]={nameES="The Grim Vale",objectivesES={"Orc sentries and corpses can be found in Rath Dúath.\
\
You should defeat Orc sentries and examine any Orc corpses that you find.","The Grim Vale","Footprints can be found leading away from the Orc corpse.\
\
You should follow the footprints.","The trail leads to a group of gruesome kergrim devouring bodies","Seek out another Orc corpse in Rath Dúath","Footprints lead away from this recently-slain Orc","This Orc has been freshly mauled by some sort of beast","Thurindol can be found at Echad Uial in Rath Dúath.\
\
You should talk to Thurindol.","Thurindol requires assistance in discovering what is killing nearby Orc sentries of Minas Morgul.","Talk to Thurindol at Echad Uial","Another Orc corpse can be found closer to Echad Uial in Rath Dúath.\
\
You should seek out another Orc corpse to examine.","The trail leads further into the shadowy hills","Find the creature that is attacking Orcs","Examine the Orc corpse on the road to Minas Morgul"}},
[12347]={nameES="The Grip of Mordor",objectivesES={"You have defeated many of the Enemy's forces in North Ithilien and made clear the way for the Host of the West.\
\
While their numbers will likely return in time, you have routed them for the moment.","In the absence of the Rangers of Ithilien during the Battle of the Pelennor Fields, North Ithilien has been overrun with the forces of the Enemy.","Orcs and Easterlings can be found throughout North Ithilien.\
\
Orcs and Easterlings pose a grave threat to the Rangers of Ithilien and the Host of the West. You should defeat them to aid in the protection of Gondor's lands.","While adventuring in North Ithilien, you have come upon many of the Enemy's forces in the old ruins of North Ithilien and in the foot-hills of the Ephel Dúath.\
\
The Enemy's forces suffered a setback in Gondor, but the Dark Lord is far from bested.\
\
You should defeat the Enemy's forces in North Ithilien and make clear the way for the Host of the West.","The Grip of Mordor","You have defeated many Orcs and Easterlings in North Ithilien.","Completado"}},
[12348]={nameES="Los Peligros Crecientes de Sharmokal",objectivesES={"Deberías avisarle a Eirlys Dringarth que has derrotado a muchos enemigos en Sharmokal.\
\
Eirlys está en Lintrev","Los Uruk-hai de Sharmokal se vuelven más audaces cada día. A medida que su número aumenta, también lo hace su inclinación hacia la violencia.","Regresa con la Alcaldesa Dringarth","Los Peligros Crecientes de Sharmokal","La alcaldesa Eirlys Dringarth te ha pedido que derrotes enemigos en Sharmokal.\
\
Sharmokal se encuentra en el sur de la Ciénaga de los Cisnes."}},
[12349]={nameES="The Growing Might of Gundabad",objectivesES={"There is conflict to the south and the hills faintly tremble","<rgb=#00FF00>Look</rgb> at the lands to the east","Gwaihir the Wind-lord can see all that transpires in the Vales of Anduin.","The Eyrie can be reached from the Carrock in the Beorning-lands.\
\
You should look out over the Eyrie at the lands below.","Gwaihir the Wind-lord can be found at the Eyrie.\
\
You should talk to Gwaihir.","Meneldor can be found at the Eyrie.\
\
You should talk to Meneldor.","Meneldor can be found at the Eyrie.\
\
You should be polite to Meneldor.","All is peaceful in the Beorning-lands","Talk to Gwaihir the Wind-lord","Cordially <rgb=#00FF00>bow</rgb> to Meneldor","This is a good place to survey the lands to the east","Landroval can be found at the Eyrie.\
\
You should talk to Landroval.","<rgb=#00FF00>Look</rgb> at the lands to the north","Silent wisps of smoke from distant machines billow above the foothills","Talk to Meneldor","Landroval can be found at the Eyrie.\
\
You should be polite to Landroval.","Talk to Landroval","Cordially <rgb=#00FF00>bow</rgb> to Landroval","This is a good place to survey the lands to the north","<rgb=#00FF00>Look</rgb> at the lands to the south","The Growing Might of Gundabad","This is a good place to survey the lands to the south"}},
[12350]={nameES="The Gríma Influence",objectivesES={"You should observe Gríma reprimanding the leaders of Madh-fushaum for what appears to be failures on their part. You may be able to learn what involvement he has in the situation in the Stonedeans.","The Gríma Influence","What you observed of Gríma Wormtongue's business with the leaders of Madh-fushaum and the role he has played in the Stonedean's turmoil would be wise to share with Herubrand.","Talk with Herubrand","You once again encounter Gríma Wormtongue, this time reprimanding the leaders of Madh-fushaum for what appear to be failures on their part. He clearly had business to attend to here before departing for Isengard.","Gríma has finished his business in Madh-fushaum and now departs for Isengard.","The discussion has ended, and you should talk to Herubrand about what you saw","You find Gríma Wormtongue in a heated discussion with the leaders of Madh-fushaum. It is pretty clear he is unhappy about something, and you should see what he has to say....","It appears that Gríma Wormtongue does indeed have business in Madh-fushaum, and his journey this far north was no coincidence. He may yet have a role to play in the struggle in the Stonedeans.","Observe Gríma reprimanding the White Hand leaders"}},
[12351]={nameES="The Guarded Court",objectivesES={"The vile Ongûl has taken Thoremband, the Guarded Court. If the White Company is to gain control over the city, this minion of Minas Morgul must be removed.","The Guarded Court","The vile Ongûl has taken Thoremband and must be removed.","You have defeated the vile Ongûl and provided a great service to the White Company. Their efforts to reclaim Minas Ithil are now ever closer thanks to you.","Defeated Ongûl","Defeated Ongûl.","Completado","Ongûl can be found at Thoremband upon the Circle of Death.\
\
You should defeat Ongûl.","Defeat Ongûl"}},
[12352]={nameES="The Guards of Barad-dûr",objectivesES={}},
[12353]={nameES="Los guardias de Sâd Rechu",objectivesES={"Los dunlendinos han establecido un campamento maderero en el bosque de Sâd Rechu, donde recolectan madera para el uso de los lacayos de Saruman.","Habla con Inufileg en Gwingris","Inufileg se encuentra en Gwingris, al noroeste del campamento de los dunlendinos.\
\
Debes informar a Inufileg sobre tu éxito contra los dunlendinos.","Los dunlendinos se pueden encontrar al sureste de Gwingris.\
\
Inufileg te ha pedido que derrotes a los dunlendinos que están devastando el bosque de Sâd Rechu.","Los guardias de Sâd Rechu"}},
[12354]={nameES="The Guards' Mess",objectivesES={"Mud can be found throughout the guards' barracks in Lake-town.\
\
You should clean up splotches of mud left by uncleanly guards in the guard's barracks.","Talk to Álarr","Captain Álarr can be found in the guards' barracks in Lake-town.\
\
You should talk to Álarr.","Desperate to impress the Master, Captain Álarr has asked for your aid in cleaning the filthy guards' barracks.","The Guards' Mess"}},
[12355]={nameES="La saga del Bosque Viejo",objectivesES={"Rhiangar cree que las respuestas las tiene una saga anciana que vive en la oscuridad del Bosque Viejo","La saga del Bosque Viejo","Encuentra a la saga del Bosque Viejo","Henbran toma el pez con alegría","Henbran te ha pedido que le lleves el pez del río.\
\
El río está cerca de Sarch Vorn, cerca del Bosque Viejo.","Lleva el pez a Henbran","Rhiangar te ha pedido que busques a la saga del Bosque Viejo.\
\
El bosque Viejo está en el noroeste de Cardolan.","Deberías llevarle el pez que has pescado a Henbran Amon.\
\
Henbran está en el Bosque Viejo, en el noroeste de Cardolan."}},
[12356]={nameES="The Half-orcs",objectivesES={"Bands of savage half-orcs have set upon the folk living on the outskirts of Lhanuch. Siorus Brehur of the Council of Thanes has asked if you have the strength to aid the people of Lhanuch and defeat these raiders before they destroy more homesteads. If you can do so, he will argue in council against the demands of Isengard.","Talk to Siorus Brehur in the Brenin's Hall","Defeated Bûzog","Defeat Bûzog","Siorus Brehur is at the Brenin's Hall in the village of Nan Laeglin.\
\
You should return at once to Siorus Brehur with news of your success.","The Half-orcs","Half-orcs can be found throughout Nan Laeglin, especially where they have raided Uch-lûth farms.\
\
Siorus Brehur has asked you to repel the half-orc raiders and their leader Bûzog from Nan Laeglin."}},
[12357]={nameES="The Half-orcs -- Repeatable",objectivesES={"Bands of savage half-orcs have set upon the folk living on the outskirts of Lhanuch. Siorus Brehur has asked if you have the strength to aid the people of Lhanuch and defeat these raiders before they destroy more homesteads.","Talk to Siorus Brehur in the Brenin's Hall","Siorus Brehur is at the Brenin's Hall in the village of Nan Laeglin.\
