[12369]={nameES="The Harrowing of Morgul-- Solo",objectivesES={"Destroyed the second barricade","Dolenthol has a plan.","Defeated Dargásh","Defeated Shaktur","You should seek out Shaktur, the leader of Ugrukhôr's forces, and defeat him.","Defeat Dargásh","You should seek out Dargásh, the leader of Gothmog's forces, and defeat him.","Dolenthol asked you to travel to the second barricade and destroy it.","The Harrowing of Morgul-- Solo","The Harrowing of Morgul is underway, and two Orc-armies do battle, each intent on seizing control of the Circle of Wrath for their master.","Destroy the first barricade","Destroy the second barricade","Talk to Dolenthol","Destroyed the first barricade","Find and defeat Shaktur","Dolenthol asked you to travel to the first barricade and destroy it."}},
