[12374]={nameES="The Haunted Forest",objectivesES={"Find Daervunn in the Mournshaws","You have learned that an unknown Ranger of the Grey Company has entered the Mournshaws in search of a hidden path to the south. \
\
The Algraig firmly believe this forest is haunted by powerful and fey spirits. Only the Derudh of Nan Laeglin and a few brave hunters dare enter the place.\
\
Even fewer return....","Find Daervunn the Ranger who has wandered into the northern reaches of the Mournshaws.\
\
It is uncertain whether he still lives, but if so it is possible he has found a path into Dunland that is unwatched by enemy eyes.","The Haunted Forest"}},
