Go to the High Hall, House of Remedies, or House of Rest and tend to patients.","Minas Tirith's healers are overwhelmed by the number of wounded soldiers in need of care.","Ioreth can be found in the High Hall of the Houses of Healing, on the Sixth Circle of Minas Tirith.\
\
You should let Ioreth know that you have treated many patients, although there were some possessed of a strange ailment you were unable to treat.","This patient does not respond to your care. You cannot tell what even ails him.","Return to Ioreth"}},
