[12381]={nameES="The Heart of the Mother",objectivesES={"Spiders scurry out of the woods!","Blómgard can only survive so many raiding parties of vicious spiders before all that is left of the town is complete ruin.","Blómgard can be found in Laerlad in the Vales of Anduin.\
