[12384]={nameES="The Heirs' Legacy",objectivesES={"Azruthor's tent can be found in Azruthor's Rue in Tarlang's Crown.\
\
Although Azruthor's encampment was left in ruins, the Corsairs of Umbar have taken up in it. You should search for Azruthor's tent.","You notice a small encampment that has clearly been abandoned by the Corsairs of Umbar","Tarlang's Crown can be found by following the road south from Sardol, in the Blackroot Vale.\
\
Bregon has informed you that the Corsairs of Umbar have returned to Tarlang's Crown. You should follow the road into Tarlang's Crown and begin your search for them.","You find nothing of note as Azruthor's tent has been pillaged and left in ruin","Tarlang's Crown can be found by following the road south from Sardol, in the Blackroot Vale.\
\
You have found a small abandoned encampment on the road through Tarlang's Crown. You should examine it.","Examine the damaged barricade","Follow the road through Tarlang's Crown","You notice a damaged and mouldering barricade left behind from Azruthor's campaign","Tarlang's Crown can be found by following the road south from Sardol, in the Blackroot Vale.\
\
You have found a damaged barricade on the road through Tarlang's Crown. You should examine it.","Amathon can be found in Sardol, in the Blackroot Vale.\
\
You have found no sign that the Corsairs of Umbar seek to do anything but pillage the remains of Azruthor's encampment in Tarlang's Crown. You should return to Amathon.","Tarlang's Crown can be found by following the road south from Sardol, in the Blackroot Vale.\
\
Bregon has informed you that the Corsairs of Umbar have returned to Tarlang's Crown. You should continue to follow the road deeper into Tarlang's Crown.","Although Azruthor, one of the Heirs of Castamir, was defeated at his encampment in Tarlang's Crown, it is believed that the Corsairs of Umbar may seek to avenge his death and advance his yet-unfinished designs against Gondor.","It appears this camp was ransacked and its heraldry torn apart after Azruthor's campaign failed","The Heirs' Legacy","Follow the road deeper into Tarlang's Crown","Examine the abandoned encampment","It seems the Corsairs have abandoned this barricade, perhaps lacking the men to hold it","Talk to Bregon in Sardol","Bregon can be found at Sardol in the Blackroot Vale.\
\
Amathon has asked you to speak with Bregon, a seemingly-reformed freebooter from the Blackroot Vale, and learn if he knows what the Corsairs have planned in Tarlang's Crown.","Find Azruthor's tent and search for any evidence of a new plot against Gondor","The abandoned encampment can be found in Tarlang's Crown.\
\
You have found a small encampment abandoned by the Corsairs in Tarlang's Crown. You should examine it.","It seems a company of Corsairs has taken up in what remains of Azruthor's encampment!","Talk to Amathon in Sardol"}},
[12385]={nameES="The Hermit",objectivesES={"Collected the second half of the broken amulet","Bring the two halves of the amulet to Lhudd at the Hall of Sanctuary","Lhudd the hermit dwells at the Hall of Sanctuary, west of the main road and south-west of Mincham's camp.\
\
Mincham told you to bring both halves of the amulet to Lhudd the hermit.","The second half of the broken amulet may be found on shades throughout the Lich Bluffs.\
\
When you locate the other half of the broken amulet, seek out and locate the hermit Lhudd in a small grove of trees to the west of the road called the Hall of Sanctuary.","Mincham is interested in finding the remaining fragments of the amulet you brought him, in hopes that a local hermit might be able to decipher the mystery it represents.","Collect the second half of the broken amulet","The Hermit"}},
[12386]={nameES="The Hermit of Zikrum-dûl",objectivesES={"Speak with the hermit at his camp in Zikrum-dûl.","Speak with the hermit","Seek out the hermit of Zikrum-dûl","Return to Lukíd in Ub Nishir","The Hermit of Zikrum-dûl","Return to Lukíd in Ub Nishir to the north of Maurûsh and tell him that you found the hermit and what you saw in Zikrum-dûl.","Lukíd has asked you to investigate Zikrum-dûl and seek out the mythical hermit.","Found Old Cloud-Shouter","Lukíd has asked you to investigate Zikrum-dûl. He claims there is a hermit in the area that may be in need of your help."}},
[12387]={nameES="The Hidden Fortress",objectivesES={"The Hidden Fortress","You have reclaimed Dun Shûma from the Ekhamâti forces.\
\
You should talk to Mizâdi.","Talk to Mizâdi","Use the Instance Finder to complete 'Dun Shûma, the King's Fortress' on any difficulty.","Complete 'Dun Shûma, the King's Fortress' on any difficulty","The hostile forces of Ekhamât have claimed Dun Shûma, the hidden fortress of Shâr Shûma III, seeking the lost crown of Aragín the Queller.","Completed 'Dun Shûma, the King's Fortress'"}},
[12388]={nameES="Los Hogares Ocultos de los Holbytlan",objectivesES={"Debes regresar con Almetha en el mercado del valle","Visita los muros de Alto Sundergrót","Los Hogares Ocultos de los Holbytlan","Visita una madriguera cómoda","Las antiguas murallas de Sundergrót han protegido durante mucho tiempo los valles de los Holbytlan","Una gran madriguera con bellas vistas del valle residencial a tus pies","Una madriguera cálida aparece escondida en lo alto de un paso traicionero","Los sonidos del mercado y de los artesanos llenan el aire","Los hogares de los Holbytlan se encuentran al suroeste del pueblo de Lyndelby. Almetha Ditchel te ha pedido que explores los valles de su gente y regreses con ella cuando hayas visto los parajes del valle.","Escondidos en los bordes orientales de las Montañas Nubladas, los valles ocultos de los Holbytlan han abierto sus puertas a visitantes y nuevos residentes por igual.","Visita una madriguera cómoda escondida","Un paso estrecho conecta las madrigueras con Lyndelby","Regresa con Almetha en el mercado del valle","Una madriguera cómoda se alza ante ti, esperando convertirse en tu hogar","Visita el mercado del valle","Visita la entrada del valle","Visita una madriguera humilde escondida","Visita una gran madriguera","Una madriguera pequeña pero acogedora se alza ante ti, lista para que te mudes","Una joya escondida y espaciosa, con hermosas vistas de Lyndelby en el valle al norte","Visita una madriguera humilde"}},
