[12400]={nameES="El Risco Alto",objectivesES={"Larus y Vighar están en un pequeño campamento en Risco Alto, al este del campamento de Glóin.\
\
Glóin te ha pedido que encuentras a sus amigos Larus y Vighar en el campamento de Risco Alto y les ayudes.","El Risco Alto","Glóin ha enviado varios enanos como avanzadilla para establecer un pequeño campamento en el Risco Alto."}},
[12401]={nameES="El Sumo Hechicero de Harad, Azote de Mordor",objectivesES={"The High Sorcerer of Harad, defeated but enduring","The Great Alliance of Elves and Men stood in defiance of Sauron for long years of siege, but even their greatest heroes came to fear his deadliest servants. These were the Nazgûl, and their number was Nine.","El Sumo Hechicero de Harad, Azote de Mordor","The Great Alliance of Elves and Men stood in defiance of Sauron for long years of siege, but even their bravest heroes came to fear his deadliest servants. These were the Nazgûl, and their number was Nine. They stalked the battlefield of Mordor Besieged, and were its most dangerous scourges.\
\
They called him the High Sorcerer of Harad, but for most of those who fought against Sauron it was just a name. He rarely left the dungeon fastnesses of Mordor, for he delighted in the working of foul rituals and the mastery of fell magics, and gave his thought to little else. But when the Dark Lord saw fit to send him forth, Men and Elves knew to give him a wide berth, or suffer. It was Mêbat he wore, the Mirth-eater, and wherever he went there was an end to laughter, and only the onset of grief.","The High Sorcerer of Harad suffered defeat on the battlefield of Mordor Besieged, but it was not to be a lasting death... not while Sauron endured. The Nazgûl would return, for his was an existence beyond ending.","They called him the High Sorcerer of Harad, but for most of those who fought against Sauron it was just a name. He rarely left the dungeon fastnesses of Mordor, for he delighted in the working of foul rituals and the mastery of fell magics, and gave his thought to little else. But when the Dark Lord saw fit to send him forth, Men and Elves knew to give him a wide berth, or suffer. It was Mêbat he wore, the Mirth-eater, and wherever he went there was an end to laughter, and only the onset of grief.","The High Sorcerer of Harad has been defeated... for now","Defeat the High Sorcerer of Harad in Mordor Besieged"}},
[12402]={nameES="El Salteador de Caminos",objectivesES={"Las patrullas Angmarim transportan con frecuencia órdenes y cajas de caudales a través de Imlad Balchorth.","Recolecta órdenes Angmarim.","Entrega las órdenes y la caja de caudales a Birgir","El Salteador de Caminos","Las patrullas Angmarim pueden encontrarse en los caminos de Imlad Balchorth, al oeste de Myrkworth.\
\
Birgir te ha pedido que embosques a las patrullas Angmarim y recuperes cualquier orden o caja de caudales que puedan estar transportando.","Recolecta la caja de caudales","Caja de caudales recolectada","Órdenes Angmarim recolectadas"}},
[12403]={nameES="Los Montañeses de Minas Agor",objectivesES={"Los Montañeses de Minas Agor","Los Corcur, descendientes de los montañeses de Rhudaur, han acampado en las ruinas de Minas Agor, en el sur del Bosque de los Trolls.","Los Corcur están acampados en las ruinas de Minas Agor, en el sur del Bosque de los Trolls.\
\
Mientras estés en el sur del Bosque de los Trolls, deberías encargarte de los Corcur que se han asentado allí."}},
[12404]={nameES="Los montañeses de Rhudaur",objectivesES={"Los montañeses de Rhudaur","Los Corcur han comenzado a invadir Nan Tornaeth, en el Bosque de los Trolls.\
\
Mientras estés en Nan Tornaeth, deberías expulsar a los Corcur que han venido al Bosque de los Trolls para reclamar sus antiguas tierras.","Los Corcur, descendientes de los montañeses de Rhudaur, han descendido desde Angmar buscando reclamar sus antiguas tierras por orden del Señor Oscuro."}},
[12405]={nameES="The Hills Above",objectivesES={"Reach Khûn Sagaz","Locate where weapons are kept in Khûn Sagaz","Locate where supplies are kept in Khûn Sagaz","Return to Enârshan behind the waterfall in Ilûritu","Enârshan has asked you to investigate Khûn Sagaz nearby and find out more about it.","Investigate Khûn Sagaz near the Falls of Ilûritu for Enârshan the Idâmi.","Reached Khûn Sagaz","Return to Enârshan in her home behind the waterfall in Ilûritu.","Located the weapons in Khûn Sagaz","Enârshan has asked you to travel to Khûn Sagaz at the top of the hill nearby to investigate.","The Hills Above","Located the supplies in Khûn Sagaz"}},
[12406]={nameES="Las colinas tienen ojos",objectivesES={"Los saqueadores de tumbas han huido a las colinas sobre el Camino de los Reyes. Desde allí, alertan a las fuerzas de Angmar, sus nuevos aliados, sobre las acciones de los Montaraces.","Ayuda a Maladan a explorar Arthobel","Nimbellas está en el campamento de los Montaraces a lo largo del Camino de los Reyes.\
\
Las colinas han sido despejadas de amenazas. Deberías regresar de inmediato a Nimbellas.","Las criptas bordean el Camino de los Reyes que conduce a Annúminas.\
\
Antes de que los Montaraces puedan moverse para investigar el estado de las criptas en el Camino de los Reyes, deben asegurar las colinas de los saqueadores de tumbas restantes. Nimbellas te ha pedido que hagas esto.","Ayuda a Nethrandir con los espejos de Tham Sarch","Ayuda a Rodlam con los arcos largos de Tham Laegamon","Habla con Nimbellas en el Camino de los Reyes","Ayuda a Rodlam con los ladrones de Tham Laegamon","Las colinas tienen ojos","Ayuda a Nethrandir con los ladrones de Tham Sarch"}},
[12407]={nameES="El rebaño de hirvi",objectivesES={"Ilmo es pastor y requiere algunos suministros que ya ha encargado para cuidar de su rebaño.","Consigue la montura de Rauno","Has conseguido la montura de Rauno","Ilmo te ha pedido que consigas una montura de Rauno, reinas de Matti y una piedra de sal de Kaleva, en Sûri-kylä.","Has conseguido la piedra de sal de Kaleva","Lleva los objetos a Ilmo","Consigue las riendas de Matti","El rebaño de hirvi","Ilmo está en el exterior de Sûri-kylä con su rebaño de alces.\
\
Debes llevarle inmediatamente los objetos que has conseguido.","Consigue la piedra de sal de Kaleva","Has conseguido las riendas de Matti"}},
[12408]={nameES="The History of Aldburg",objectivesES={"Arcil is at the Mead Hall of Aldburg.\
\
You have explored Aldburg and learned a little about its history. You should now return to Arcil.","Explored the Quartermaster's house","The Quartermaster's house is located in the western portion of Aldburg.\
\
Wilflad suggested that you visit the Quartermaster of Aldburg.","Arcil suggested that you explore the former capital city of Rohan, Aldburg and learn something of its history.\
\
You should seek out Éothain and speak with him first.","Talk to Téothic","The History of Aldburg","Wilflad is near the stable of Aldburg.\
\
Wilflad may be able to provide more information about the stable.","Explore the Aldburg training hall","Explored the Aldburg stable","Talk to Arcil","Explore the Quartermaster's house","Bertred is at his house in the western part of Aldburg.\
\
Wilflad told you to speak with Bertred, Quartermaster of Aldburg, to learn more of the city's history.","Explore the Aldburg stable","Talk to Bertred","Talk to Wilflad","The training hall is in the eastern part of Aldburg.\
\
Éothain recommended starting your exploration of Aldburg at the training hall.","Téothic is at the training hall in Aldburg.\
\
You should speak with Téothic about the Aldburg training hall.","The stable of Aldburg is to the north-west of the training hall.\
\
Téothic recommended that you go see the stable next.","Upon arriving in Aldburg and speaking with Thane Arcil, he recommends exploring Aldburg to learn more about the former capital of Rohan and to speak with some of its inhabitants in the process.","Talk to Éothain","Explored the Aldburg training hall"}},
[12409]={nameES="The History of Avabárg",objectivesES={}},
[12410]={nameES="La reina de la colmena",objectivesES={"Thórhall cree que las glándulas olorosas que has recogido podrían atraer a la reina de la colmena y hacer que se revele, permitiendo así acabar con ella.","Invoca y derrota a la reina de la colmena grodbog","La guarida de los grodbog se encuentra en el Palacio de Náin, al norte de Lamâb-dûm.\
\
Thórhall te pidió que llevaras las glándulas olorosas hasta la colmena de los grodbog y las aplastaras. El olor resultante debería hacer surgir a la reina de la colmena.","Thórhall se encuentra en el pequeño campamento enano de Lamab-dûm, al sur del Palacio de Náin.\
\
Deberías informar a Thórhall de tu éxito.","Has aplastado una glándula olorosa de grodbog","La reina de la colmena","Habla con Thórhall en Lamab-dûm"}},
[12411]={nameES="El caballito de madera va a Herne",objectivesES={"El caballito de madera va a Herne","Mellanion te ha pedido que lleves su caballito de madera a Cai.\
\
Cai está en la posada, en Herne.","Lleva el caballito de madera a Cai","Mellanion desea forjar un vínculo de amistad con el joven que su madre atrajo."}},
[12412]={nameES="El poder del collar",objectivesES={"Salva a Umín del poder del collar.","El poder del collar","Umín parece estar poseído por ese collar que lleva puesto. Debes quitarle ese collar a toda costa."}},
[12413]={nameES="The Hollowed of Dath Nethryn",objectivesES={"You have defeated and burned many of the Zhavár-hai in Dath Nethryn.","The Hollowed of Dath Nethryn","The Zhavár-hai of Dath Nethryn have grown mightier and possess thicker hides than their untainted, Orkish brethren.","Completado","It seems the longer the Zhavár-hai bond with Shelob's children, the more potent their might and the thicker their flesh.\
\
You have done well to defeat and burn many of the Zhavár-hai in Dath Nethryn. They can no longer pose a threat to any who venture into Lhingris, and can no longer hinder Legolas's quest to find the spider-queen, Ungwetári -- now known as Shelob.","Zhavár-hai can be found in the shallows of Dath Nethryn in southern Lhingris.\
\
Legolas has spotted numerous Zhavár-hai roaming the foetid swamp of Dath Nethryn in Lhingris. Even if the Orcs are slain, the insects and spiders within them pose a great threat, so he has advised you to burn them after defeating them."}},
[12414]={nameES="The Hordes of Ungol",objectivesES={"Complete Kála-murg: The Hordes of Ungol","Completed Kála-murg: The Hordes of Ungol.","As the unrelenting forces of Ungol pour from the mountain, few Orcs remain in Lhingris.","Candúr se encuentra en Udûn.\
\\Deberías hablar con Candúr.","The Hordes of Ungol","A notice is posted on the board. It sounds urgent:\
\
'The unrelenting forces of Ungol pour from the mountain and attack anyone in Lhingris. A brave adventurer is needed to defeat spiders there. Seek out Candúr in Udûn to learn more.'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Warning: This quest requires  Kála-murg: The Final Stand to be underway. If that quest has been completed or failed, you will be unable to exit and re-enter this instance in order to complete this quest.</rgb>","Completado","You have successfully defeated many spiders in Lhingris."}},
[12415]={nameES="La Cuernavilla",objectivesES={"The Hornburg is the final layer of Rohan's defences at Helm's Deep. If it falls, then all hope is lost.","Aragorn and Legolas must survive the battle","Protect the Hornburg","La Cuernavilla","The Hornburg is all that prevents the fall of Rohan. Aragorn stands defiant upon the ramparts of the gate-house.\
\
Merit Rating\
\
This quest starts with <rgb=#FFFF00>Full</rgb> Merit Rating.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Major Merit Loss:</rgb>\
- Soldier defeated\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Moderate Merit Loss:</rgb>\
- Commander defeated\
- Banner burned"}},
[12416]={nameES="The Hornburg - Fellowship",objectivesES={}},
[12417]={nameES="El ganso espantoso",objectivesES={"El ganso simplón debe estar todavía en el pueblo de Quiebra Larga.\
\
Busca en Quiebra Larga y descubre hacia dónde se ha dirigido.","El ganso anda suelto y fue visto por última vez en el pueblo de Quiebra Larga.\
\
Busca al ganso.","El hobbit desprevenido se encuentra en el pueblo de Quiebra Larga.\
\
Ayuda al hobbit desprevenido.","Busca al ganso suelto en El Toro Bramador","El Toro Bramador se encuentra en el pueblo de Quiebra Larga.\
\
Recoge el desastre provocado por el ganso en El Toro Bramador.","Sal de El Toro Bramador y continúa buscando al ganso","Con la cantidad de animales que Prunella Valeoro cuida voluntariamente, ¡ha perdido de vista a un ganso particularmente pendenciero!","Registra Quiebra Larga en busca del ganso suelto","Ayuda al hobbit desprevenido","Redahild Bienbueno se encuentra en El Toro Bramador en el pueblo de Quiebra Larga.\
\
Habla con Redahild Bienbueno en El Toro Bramador.","El ganso simplón debe estar todavía en el pueblo de Quiebra Larga.\
\
Sal de El Toro Bramador y continúa buscando al ganso.","Prunella Valeoro se encuentra en el pueblo de Quiebra Larga.\
\
Habla con Prunella Valeoro.","El espantoso ganso se ha dirigido al límite del pueblo de Quiebra Larga.\
\
Busca al ganso en los límites de Quiebra Larga.","El ganso anda suelto y fue visto por última vez cerca de El Toro Bramador en el pueblo de Quiebra Larga.\
\
Busca en El Toro Bramador al ganso.","Registra Quiebra Larga y averigua adónde ha ido el ganso","Los repollos robados de los hobbits desprevenidos se encuentran en el extremo del pueblo de Quiebra Larga.\
\
Recupera los repollos robados.","El hobbit desprevenido se encuentra en el pueblo de Quiebra Larga.\
\
Devuélvele los repollos robados.","Devuelve los repollos robados","Busca al ganso en el límite del pueblo de Quiebra Larga","El espantoso ganso se ha dirigido al límite del pueblo de Quiebra Larga.\
\\Registra Quiebra Larga y encuentra al ganso.","Registra Quiebra Larga en busca del espantoso ganso","Habla con Redahild Bienbueno en El Toro Bramador","El ganso espantoso","Habla con Prunella Valeoro"}},
[12418]={nameES="The Horsefields Derby",objectivesES={}},
[12419]={nameES="The Horseless Rider",objectivesES={"Find the runaway horse","You found the runaway steed in the Beacon Hills. Now you should lead her back to the stables in Ost Rimmon.","Talk to Sithgar","Lead the horse to Ost Rimmon","The Horseless Rider","Sithgar has lost his steed and won't be able to re-join his Éored until he finds it.","Sithgar stands by the Ost Rimmon stables, in the Beacon Hills.\
\
Now that you have led his horse back to the stables, you should talk to Sithgar.","With patience and a gentle hand, you guide the horse back to the Ost Rimmon stables","Search the Beacon Hills for Sithgar's runaway steed.","You have found Sithgar's steed far from Ost Rimmon"}},
[12420]={nameES="The Hound-master",objectivesES={"This collar was taken from a slain hound in the Heathfells. Crafted of heavy leather, studded with crude iron, it is clearly of Dunlending-make.\
\
The Dunlending Hound-masters leash their beasts upon such collars, and if these dogs wear them, then their master cannot be far away. Perhaps you can defeat him and scatter his hounds.","The Dunlending Hound-master has set camp somewhere in the Heathfells.\
\
You should find the Dunlending Hound-master and defeat him and his hounds.","You have defeated the Hound-master","You found a heavy, studded collar upon a slain Dunlending war-hound. If the beasts still wear collars as they roam these hills, then their master must be somewhere nearby.","Defeat the Hound-master","Captain Cadfrith is at the encampment in north-west Heathfells.\
\
You should inform Captain Cadfrith of the Dunlending Hound-master's defeat.","Talk to Cadfrith","The Hound-master"}},
[12421]={nameES="The Hounds",objectivesES={"Talk to Captain Cadfrith at the Rohirrim encampment","Captain Cadfrith is at the Rohirrim encampment in the north-west Heathfells.\
\
You should return to Captain Cadfrith with your report.","The Dunlendings have released packs of war-hounds into the wild to harry Rohirrim scouts.\
\
You must drive these beasts off lest they harry the Rohirrim attempts to track the Dunlending's movements in the Heathfells, and waylay messengers.","War-hounds can be found throughout the Heathfells.\
\
Captain Cadfrith has asked you to defeat packs of Dunlending war-hounds that have been released into the Heathfells.","The Hounds"}},
[12422]={nameES="The Howling",objectivesES={"The calmed hound heads for the Camp of the Host","Complete quest 'Hidden Dangers' with Faroth","Good-bye, Faroth!","Faroth deserves some praise from all his hard work! Why don't you give him a pat?\
\
If you should get separated from your hound, blow the hound-calling whistle to summon him back.","<rgb=#FF00FF>Pat</rgb> Faroth because he's a good dog","Talk to Mablung","He thought it sounded like it was coming from the hills to the west of the Camp of the Host, in the Noman-lands.\
\
Mablung has asked you to find the source of the howling sound.","Mablung can be found in the Camp of the Host, on the northern edge of North Ithilien.\
\
The hound has returned to the Camp of the Host. You should return to Mablung and tell him of your success.","Find the source of the howling sound","The source of the howling sound was actually an injured hound.\
\
You should find a way to calm the injured hound.","Mablung can be found in the Camp of the Host, on the northern edge of North Ithilien.\
\
Now that Faroth's work in the Noman-lands is finished, you should return to Mablung.","Complete quest 'Sniff Them Out' with Faroth","Completed quest 'Stalker of the Scrublands' with Faroth","You have found the source of the howling sound! It's not a fearsome beast at all, but a scared and possibly injured hound. Does he belong to the Rangers?\
\
You should try to calm it down and then return to Mablung.","Talk with Faroth to part ways for now.\
\
If you should get separated from your hound, blow the hound-calling whistle to summon him back.","Mablung, Captain of the Rangers of Ithilien, would like you to find the source of the howling sound that has been bothering the men in the Camp of the Host.","Return to Mablung","Completed quest 'Sniff Them Out' with Faroth","Faroth wags his tail enthusiastically!","Complete quest 'Stalker of the Scrublands' with Faroth","Say good-bye to Faroth","<rgb=#FF00FF>Calm</rgb> the frightened hound","Mablung would like you to work with Faroth to complete quests in the Noman-lands.\
\
If you should get separated from your hound, blow the hound-calling whistle to summon him back.","Faroth looks up at you happily. It seems he enjoys life as a Ranger hound!","Completed quest 'Hidden Dangers' with Faroth","The Howling"}},
[12423]={nameES="The Howling Menace",objectivesES={}},
[12424]={nameES="El Foso Aullante",objectivesES={"Habla con Náin","Náin can be found at the entrance to the Howling Pit in Járnfast.\
\
You should talk to Náin.","Náin can be found in Járnfast.\
\
You should talk to Náin.","El Foso Aullante","Deep under Járnfast, chief fortress of the Iron Hills, is a place where the red stone once cracked, revealing a horrible abyss beneath the Dwarf-halls."}},
[12425]={nameES="The Howling Regiment",objectivesES={"The Howling Regiment","The Wargs of the Enemy will present the greatest threat to the Malledhrim when it comes time for the Golden Host to withdraw from Mirkwood, for they would be able to overtake the Elves swiftly.","Talk to Rodelleth at Thangúlhad","Wargs can be found in Gathbúrz.\
\
Rodelleth has asked you to defeat several of the Wargs prowling through Gathbúrz to help ensure a safe retreat for the Malledhrim.","Rodelleth is at Thangúlhad in Gathbúrz.\
\
You should return to Rodelleth and let her know that many Wargs fell beneath your assaults."}},
[12426]={nameES="The Hunger of Shelob",objectivesES={"The Hunger of Shelob","Legolas has grown concerned that if Cirith Ungol falls, Shelob shall soon venture forth into Mordor and lands beyond to sate her hunger.","Legolas can be found in the turret of the Tower of Cirith Ungol.\
\
You have aided Legolas in hindering Shelob's siege of Cirith Ungol and should now meet him in the turret of the tower as he asked.","Legolas can be found beside the road to Cirith Ungol.\
\
Legolas has asked for your aid in hindering Shelob's siege of Cirith Ungol. You should speak to him and learn what must be done.","Find Legolas in the turret of the Tower of Cirith Ungol"}},
[12427]={nameES="La caza del tesoro continúa",objectivesES={"El montaraz Culang ha sabido de un gran tesoro enterrado hace mucho tiempo por un terrateniente Dúnadan y quiere recuperarlo antes de que sea encontrado por los saqueadores de tumbas.","La inscripción en este hito de piedra es apenas legible, pero se pueden distinguir las siguientes palabras:\
\
   \\qPara zanjar disputas, en el círculo de piedra se ha de luchar.\
Fuera del muro, mi hito se esconde en algún lugar.\\q\
\
Este nuevo acertijo podría revelar la verdadera localización del tesoro.","El tesoro podría estar bajo otro hito de piedra en algún lugar de Evendim, según el acertijo:\
\
  \\qPara zanjar disputas, en el círculo de piedra se ha de luchar.\
Fuera del muro, mi hito se esconde en algún lugar.\\q\
\
Debes examinar el hito cuando lo encuentres en busca de alguna pista sobre la localización del tesoro.","Encuentra la solución al acertijo","El hito de piedra está rodeado de signos de excavación. Si una vez marcaba la localización del tesoro, seguro que ha sido encontrado.\
\
El hito lleva una inscripción, desgastada por el paso del tiempo.","La caza del tesoro continúa","La inscripción en este hito de piedra es apenas legible, pero se pueden distinguir las siguientes palabras:\
\
  \\qPara zanjar disputas, en el círculo de piedra se ha de luchar.\
Fuera del muro, mi hito se esconde en algún lugar.\\q\
\
Este nuevo acertijo podría revelar la verdadera localización del tesoro."}},
[12428]={nameES="The Hunt For Gazathrug",objectivesES={"Lieutenants of Gazathrug can be found in the southern part of Máttugard.\
\
You should defeat Gazathrug's Lieutenants and retrieve their orders.","Read the second lieutenant's orders","Read the first lieutenant's orders","Retrieve the third lieutenant's orders","Retrieve the second lieutenant's orders","Gazathrug's outpost can be found in the southern part of Máttugard.\
\
You should talk to Hetbrúda at Gazathrug's outpost.","Defeated the lieutenant and retrieved the Orc's orders","Talk to Hetbrúda at Gazathrug's outpost","Hetbrúda searches for Gazathrug, the captain of the upper reaches of Máttugard.","The Orc outpost has been abandoned","Search Gazathrug's outpost for signs of the Orc Captain","Gazathrug's outpost can be found in the southern part of Máttugard.\
\
You should search Gazathrug's outpost for signs of the Orc Captain.","Read the orders","Retrieve the first lieutenant's orders","Read the third lieutenant's orders","You should read Gazathrug's orders to his lieutenants.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Note: The orders can be found in your inventory.</rgb>","The Hunt For Gazathrug"}},
[12429]={nameES="¡La Búsqueda del Tesoro Enterrado!",objectivesES={"Los Enanos de Ered Luin han descubierto un campo lleno de tesoros enterrados, y la gente acude en masa para poner a prueba su suerte desenterrando hallazgos raros."}},
[12430]={nameES="La caza de Gollum",objectivesES={"Habla con Miluimil en las Hondonadas Enmarañadas","La caza de Gollum","Miluimil se encuentra en el campamento de Ivorel en las Hondonadas Enmarañadas, al norte de Ost Galadh.\
\
Fuirgam te ha pedido que informes al explorador Miluimil de que Gollum podría haber llegado al norte, a las Hondonadas Enmarañadas, y que ofrezcas toda la ayuda que puedas para encontrarlo y capturarlo.","Fuirgam cree que Gollum ha huido a los retorcidos senderos de las Hondonadas Enmarañadas para evitar su captura y desea que ayudes a sus exploradores a rastrear a la escurridiza criatura antes de que escape o caiga en manos del Enemigo en Dol Guldur."}},
[12431]={nameES="The Hunt for Hardfang",objectivesES={}},
[12432]={nameES="The Hunt for Hedâkha",objectivesES={"A vicious growl fills the air...","Rúkbag has asked you to find Lumbag.\
\
She last saw him at Dor Pherkha, south-east of Kafagur.","Hedâkha has been defeated.\
\
You should check on Lumbag at Dor Pherkha.","As you approach, Lumbag narrows his eyes","Find Lumbag at Dor Pherkha","You have found Lumbag hiding at Dor Pherkha.\
\
You should talk to him.","Lumbag lets out a shaky breath -- almost like he's been holding it this entire time, waiting for you to return.\
\
'It's gone... heh. Rúkbag was right; I couldn't fight Hedâkha alone after all. After I saw it tear through everyone...' He gulps.\
\
'Thanks for the help. I'll return to Kafagur to rest.'","The Hunt for Hedâkha","The sabre-tooth known as Hedâkha has been a thorn in Kafagur's side for too long.","Talk to Lumbag","Lumbag has given you some raw boar meat that might lure out Hedâkha.\
\
You can find a good spot to place the bait somewhere in Dor Pherkha.","Hedâkha defeated","Lure out and defeat Hedâkha"}},
[12433]={nameES="The Hunt for Nêjagil",objectivesES={}},
[12434]={nameES="The Hunt for Ogarkha",objectivesES={"Deliver the golden ring to Shulum in Ub Nishir","Shulum in Ub Nishir has asked you to slay Ogarkha to the north-east of Maurûsh, near the Gorge of Woe, and bring him a trophy as proof.","Retrieved Ogarkha's ring","The Hunt for Ogarkha","Shulum in Ub Nishir has asked you to slay Ogarkha to the north-east of Maurûsh, near the Gorge of Woe and bring back a trophy of your conquest.","Bring the golden ring to Shulum in Ub Nishir","Return to Shulum in Ub Nishir and give him the trophy you took from Ogarkha.","Defeat Ogarkha and retrieve his golden ring"}},
[12435]={nameES="The Hunt for Scatha",objectivesES={"You come across another wind-worn cairn","The old cairn can be found in Elderslade.\
\
You should examine the cairn.","Fróthi brought Scatha's tooth with him to Annâk-khurfu.\
\
You should examine Scatha's tooth.","This cairn looks quite old!","You come across another wind-worn cairn by the river's edge","The rocky pass heads north along the river","Talk to Léothred on the shores of Dvergvát","Léothred and Fróthi look to unearth a piece of lost history in Elderslade.","The shores of the Dvergvát lie west of Annâk-khurfu.\
\
You should search Dvergvát's shores for the location where Fram's map begins.","The shores of the Dvergvát lie west of Annâk-khurfu.\
\
You should search the old dwarf-dock for any signs that this is the beginning of Fram's map.","You find another singular, worn stone","Talk to Léothred","Search for signs that this is where Fram's map begins","Léothred can be found at Annâk-khurfu.\
\
You should talk to Léothred at Annâk-khurfu.","Talk to Fróthi at Annâk-khurfu","Whomever made the other cairns must have also made this one","The Hunt for Scatha","You find a singular, worn stone but no cairn","Perhaps this old dwarf-dock is the location?","The next mark on the map lies somewhere in Elderslade.\
\
You should travel east to search for the next location on the map.","The next mark on the map lies somewhere in Elderslade.\
\
You should travel south east to search for the next location on the map.","As you start cleaning the dust-coated tooth, you see some small, hand-carved markings","Examine Scatha's tooth","Léothred can be found following Fram's map in Elderslade.\
\
You should talk to Léothred.","Fróthi can be found at Annâk-khurfu.\
\
You should talk to Fróthi at Annâk-khurfu.","Talk to Léothred at Annâk-khurfu","Search for the next location on the map","This cairn looks very similar to the first cairn that you found","The next mark on the map lies somewhere in Elderslade.\
\
You should travel north-east to search for the next location on the map.","Examine the second cairn","The shores of the Dvergvát lie west of Annâk-khurfu.\
\
You should talk to Léothred there.","Search Dvergvát's shores for the location where Fram's map begins"}},
[12436]={nameES="La caza ha comenzado",objectivesES={"Los cazadores lossoth quedaron impresionados por tu actuación contra el huargo, aunque no lo reconozcan abiertamente.","Los huargos pueden encontrarse en las estribaciones del suroeste.\
\
Valtteri te ha ordenado adentrarte en el bosque y cazar huargos, recogiendo la grasa de sus vientres para que los Lossoth puedan usarla más tarde.","La caza ha comenzado","Valtteri se encuentra junto a su jaula de huargos en Kauppa-kohta.\
\
Deberías devolverle a Valtteri la grasa de huargo que te pidió.","Habla con Valtteri"}},
[12437]={nameES="The Hunter King?",objectivesES={"The Hunter King?","Talk to Daervunn at Echad Daervunn in the Mournshaws","According to Prestadir, the medallion you found says something about a Hunter King and the Mournshaws.","Daervunn is at Echad Daervunn in the Mournshaws, far to the south of Echad Idhrenfair.\
\
Prestadir suggested you take the sigil you found to Daervunn in the Mournshaws."}},
[12438]={nameES="El Camino del Cazador",objectivesES={"Gytha Lainey, una cazadora de gran destreza, se encuentra en las Tierras de Bree, en el Campamento de Adso, sobre el Gran Camino del Este entre Bree y Los Gamos.\
\
Gytha está esperando para hablar contigo sobre tu victoria contra Colmilloamarillo en el Bosque Viejo.","El Camino del Cazador","Gytha Lainey, una cazadora de gran destreza, se encuentra en las Tierras de Bree, en el Campamento de Adso, en el camino entre Bree y Los Gamos.\
\
Se te ha indicado que hables con Gytha Lainey para recibir instrucción en el arte del cazador.","Gytha Lainey, una cazadora de gran destreza, se encuentra en las Tierras de Bree, en el Campamento de Adso, sobre el Gran Camino del Este entre Bree y Los Gamos.\
\
Gytha está esperando para hablar contigo sobre el viaje al Bosque Viejo.","Para un verdadero cazador, la velocidad y la precisión lo son todo. La falta de una trae mala fortuna. La falta de ambas, desastre.","Viaja con Gytha Lainey al Bosque Viejo"}},
[12439]={nameES="La Grieta Helada",objectivesES={"<rgb=#00FF00>El plan de Angmar ha sido frustrado. Evendim está a salvo, por ahora.</rgb>","El hechicero de Angmar está llevando a cabo su ritual en la cueva próxima. Debemos detenerlo para poder salvar Evendim.","Toma el primer cañón","La Grieta Helada","El tercer desfiladero está más adelante. Para poder continuar debemos tomarlo.","<rgb=#00FF00>El tercer desfiladero ha caído bajo tu control. La caverna está justo después.</rgb>","El primer desfiladero está más adelante. Para seguir adelante, debemos tomarlo.","El segundo desfiladero está más adelante. Para poder continuar debemos tomarlo.","Toma el segundo cañón","Derrota al hechicero de Angmar y reclama la caverna","Toma el tercer cañón","Angmar intenta usar poderes oscuros para convocar una ventisca que congele Evendim.","<rgb=#00FF00>El primer desfiladero ha caído bajo tu control. Parece que hay algunos desfiladeros más por delante antes de la caverna.</rgb>","<rgb=#00FF00>El segundo desfiladero ha caído bajo tu control. La caverna parece estar justo después del tercer desfiladero.</rgb>"}},
[12440]={nameES="La Grieta Helada - Raid",objectivesES={"Completa 'La Grieta Helada' en un grupo de raid","Angmar intenta usar poderes oscuros para convocar una ventisca que congele Evendim.","La Grieta Helada - Raid"}},
[12441]={nameES="The Ikorbâni, the People of Shagâna",objectivesES={}},
[12442]={nameES="La cueva desafortunada",objectivesES={"La cueva desafortunada","La mina parece estable. Encuentra y retira la joya brillante en la parte más profunda de Jid Phêsi.","Joya recogida. ¡La cueva comienza a temblar!","La cueva parece estable. Recoge la gran joya de la zona más profunda de la cueva","Los enanos de Temámir han estado excavando una cueva en el Cabo en busca de piedras preciosas, pero las paredes resultaron ser demasiado débiles. ¡Ayuda a los enanos a escapar del derrumbe!","La mina se derrumbó"}},
[12443]={nameES="El festín desafortunado",objectivesES={"Léothred can be found at Hlithseld.\
\
You should talk to Léothred at Hlithseld.","Léothred, the Rohirric scholar, wishes to learn more of the political tensions that arose during Fram's reign over the Ai-thúda.","Talk to Léothred at Hlithseld","Léothred can be found at Framsburg.\
\
You should talk to Léothred at Framsburg.","Talk to Léothred at Framsburg","El festín desafortunado"}},
[12444]={nameES="La ilusión del liderazgo",objectivesES={"Lleva la nota carbonizada a Teitur en Anazârmekhem","El fuego ha dañado terriblemente esta nota, pero algunos fragmentos aún transmiten un significado, que es aterrador y claro: Igash y Kranklûk eran de hecho algo más nefasto de lo que parecían. Mazog puede saber lo que son, pero no es consciente de su lealtad al verdadero Enemigo. El general Talug de Fil Gashan no es más que un regalo de los uruks negros a Mazog. \
\
La nota continuaba explicando que el ejército del general Talug estaba creciendo cada día más y pronto estaría listo para algún tipo de transformación.\
\
Deberías llevar esto a Teitur, el agente de Narfi encargado de vigilar Fil Gashan en Anazârmekhem.","La ilusión del liderazgo","Una nota carbonizada y arrugada, encontrada en el cadáver de Kranklûk, confirmó algunas sospechas que tenían los agentes enanos que vigilaban las Forjas de Khazad-dûm. Lo peor es que mencionaba que Talug, el general de Fil Gashan, no era más que una marioneta.","Teitur se encuentra en Anazârmekhem.\
\
Has descubierto esta nota en el cadáver del Uruk Kranklûk, y después de descifrar lo que pudiste, quedó claro que debería ser llevada a Teitur, quien vigila Fil Gashan en Anazârmekhem."}},
[12445]={nameES="The Impostor King",objectivesES={"The cage-waggons can be found to the south-east of Ondoher's Folly.\
\
Faramir has asked you to dismantle the cage-waggons making for Ondoher's Folly and free any slaves you encounter. He also hopes you can learn the identity of the true master of Ondoher's Folly.","The Impostor King","Artamir can be found to the south outside Ondoher's Folly in Dagorlad.\
\
You damaged the cage-waggons and learned much of the master of Ondoher's Folly, but you were unable to rescue any slaves. You should return to Artamir and tell him what has happened.","Talk to Artamir outside Ondoher's Folly","In his time wandering the Wastes, Faramir has learned the identity of the true master of Ondoher's Folly: a vile Black Númenórean bearing a perverted banner of Gondor.","Free slaves from the cage-waggons"}},
[12446]={nameES="La sorpresa de los infiltradores",objectivesES={"Habla con Artie Root","Artie Root está en su casa en Bree y quiere agradecerte por venir a su pequeña fiesta.","La sorpresa de los infiltradores","Benegar Vallelargo escuchó a un grupo que se hacía llamar 'los infiltradores' planear una sorpresa para Bree y quiere que los detengas antes de que terminen sus preparativos.","Habla con Otis Bosquero y explora el escondite de los infiltradores"}},
[12447]={nameES="La excavación de la Liga de las Posadas",objectivesES={"No debes dejar caer el vino añejo","Cora Rizopardo encontró algo maravilloso cuando se aventuró en el Agujero Embrujado de Bilbo: una botella de delicioso, caro, excelente y valioso vino. Le gustaría tener un poco más, pero tiene un poco de sueño.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando termine el evento con el que está asociada. </rgb>","Cora Rizopardo se encuentra fuera del Agujero Embrujado, cerca del Árbol de la Fiesta.\
\
Deberías darle el vino a Cora Rizopardo.","La excavación de la Liga de las Posadas","Recoge el preciado vino... Mmm","No pudiste llevar el vino a un lugar seguro","Habla con Cora Rizopardo","El excelente vino de Bilbo se encuentra en el Agujero Embrujado, pero debe ser transportado con cuidado o se caerá y se romperá.\
\
Debes llevar el vino a Cora Rizopardo, que te espera en el Árbol de la Fiesta."}},
[12448]={nameES="The Inner Circle",objectivesES={"Ausma is ready to infiltrate the fortress.","Complete 'Instance: The Inner Circle\\q","Talk to Scout-master Ausma","You have successfully infiltrated Shakhajât.\
\
You should talk to Scout-master Ausma in Bárgstad.","The Inner Circle","Scout-master Ausma thinks the time is right to enter Shakhajât with stealth and learn more about the hobgoblin leadership."}},
[12449]={nameES="The Integrity of the Rammas",objectivesES={"Master Builder Curugond has tasked you with surveying the damage at the southern and northern Rammas. He believes you may be able to lend a hand to the men stationed on the Out-wall.","Turgon can be found at the South-gate of the Rammas. Ingold can be found at the North-gate of the Rammas.\
\
You should speak with Turgon and Ingold and assist them with protecting the Rammas.","The Integrity of the Rammas","Speak with Ingold","Speak with Turgon"}},
[12450]={nameES="The Investigation",objectivesES={"Complete: Smuggled Goods","Talk to Skótmun","Talk to Mervárth","The guards' barracks can be found near the entrance to Lake-town.\
\
You should find the Lake-town guards' barracks.","Dagrun can be found in the Trade Commission Headquarters.\
\
You should talk to Dagrun.","Complete: Clean-up Duty","Complete: Taking Notices","The crime scene investigation is complete.\
\
You should talk to Mervárth and decide what to do next.","There's a rumour spreading around Lake-town that the Master was murdered! Join Mervárth on his investigation to uncover the truth.","Mervárth quickly explains that you found a Lake-town Smuggler kerchief at the murder location. Dagrun grins and slams her hands flat on her desk.\
\
'This is it! This evidence, combined with the illegal goods you found in Esgaroth, is enough to bring in Skótmun for questioning - that louse! Mervárth, get into that warehouse and bring him in. I doubt he will come easily, so bring your friend. At last, we've got him!'","The Investigation","Skótmun can be found in the holding cell in the Trade Commission Headquarters.\
\
You should talk to Skótmun.","With access to the location of the murder, you can now begin the investigation into the Master's unexpected demise.\
\
You should investigate the murder location with Mervárth.","Find the Lake-town guards' barracks","Found the Lake-town guards' barracks","Captain Álarr can be found inside the guards' barracks in Lake-town.\
\
You should talk to Álarr.","Captain Álarr has agreed to give you access to the location of the murder in return for taking care of some unpleasant work for him.\
\
You should complete quests for Captain Álarr.","Talk to Captain Álarr","Dagrun can be found in the Trade Commission Headquarters.\
\
You should complete quests for Dagrun.","Mervárth can be summoned to your side if you were separated.\
\
You should talk to Mervárth.","Complete: The Smugglers' Den","Talk to Álarr, The Captain of the Guard","Talk to Dagrun","Mervárth can be found near the Master's Manor in Lake-town.\
\
You should talk to Mervárth.","Complete: The Site of the Murder","Find the Trade Commission Headquarters","Complete: Breaking Up the Gang","The Trade Commission Headquarters can be found in Lake-town.\
\
You should find the Trade Commission Headquarters."}},
[12451]={nameES="El collar de hierro",objectivesES={"Muestra el collar a alguien en el campamento de los cazadores de tesoros","La leyenda cuenta que un poderoso huargo recibió la oportunidad de gobernar a todos los huargos a cambio de servir a la Corona de Hierro. Se forjó un collar de hierro y se usaron poderosos hechizos para encantar el objeto. La gran bestia fue abatida y el collar retirado, pero las historias sobre la bestia se han transmitido entre los Hombres de las Quebradas del Norte a lo largo de las eras.","Will Saucedal está en el campamento de los cazadores de tesoros fuera de la ciudad de Fornost, en el norte de las Quebradas del Norte.\
\
Deberías hablar con Will Saucedal.","El collar de hierro","Recuerdas la leyenda del rey de los huargos, Krithmog. El campamento de los cazadores de tesoros, ocupado por gente interesada en Fornost, sería un buen lugar para llevar el collar de hierro que descubriste."}},
[12452]={nameES="The Isles: Bruidis and Rossaran",objectivesES={"The wildflowers vanish beneath the surface of the water, but nothing changes","Rossaran and Bruidis have a plan to help those who were wounded during the storm and the Wave-hunter's arrival on the Shield Isles.","Bruidis is by the Wave-hunter on the Shield Isles.","Rossaran is on the Wave-hunter where it has run aground in the Shield Isles.","Add the herbs to the tub of water by the Wave-hunter on the Shield Isles","The herbs sink into the water. Now what?","Rossaran gives you the scales from the several fish he has caught","Talk to Rossaran on the Wave-hunter in the Shield Isles","The Isles: Bruidis and Rossaran","Add the wild-flowers to the tub of water by the Wave-hunter on the Shield Isles","The tree-bark sinks into the water, but nothing obvious changes","The tub of water where Bruidis plans to brew the salve is to the south-east, near the Wave-hunter on the Shield Isles.","The fish scales join everything else in the tub. Is the salve complete?","Add the fish scales to the tub of water by the Wave-hunter on the Shield Isles","Add the tree-bark to the tub of water by the Wave-hunter on the Shield Isles","Bruidis sent you to look for herbs, flowers, and tree bark at several different locations throughout the Shield Isles.","Talk to Bruidis by the Wave-hunter on the Shield Isles"}},
[12453]={nameES="The Isles: Driftwood",objectivesES={"Driftwood's eyes light with recognition and surprise","Return to Voyage's End and check on your crew","Manadhon told you the man called Driftwood might be found on the lower level of Halrax, on the south-western side of the inlet.","Having defeated many supporters of the Heirs of Castamir throughout the Shield Isles, you should return to the Wave-hunter.","Despite his parting words, Driftwood has come to the Wave-hunter","Horn stares at the Elf, his mouth agape. 'Sigileth... the sister of Corudan!'","Sigileth has joined you in Halrax.","Driftwood stands on the lower level of Halrax.","Talk to Driftwood at Voyage's End","Manadhon, the bartender of Halrax, has given you a lead on the man called Driftwood.","Many Corsairs throughout the Shield Isles support the Heirs of Castamir, and Driftwood has asked you to continue his work of making things difficult for them.","The Isles: Driftwood","The man called Driftwood is deep in his cups on the lower level of Halrax, on the south-western side of the inlet.","Find Driftwood on the lower level of Halrax","Driftwood, troubled by his past and seeking to do right, has joined your crew!","Driftwood stands suddenly, knocking his chair to the floor.","The man called Driftwood is deep in his cups","Wait for Driftwood to acknowledge your presence","Driftwood stands by the Wave-hunter in the Shield Isles.","Talk to Sigileth in Halrax","Talk to Driftwood on the lower level of Halrax"}},
[12454]={nameES="The Isles: Driftwood",objectivesES={"Talk to Driftwood on the upper level of Halrax","Return to Voyage's End and check on your crew","Despite his parting words, Driftwood has come to the Wave-hunter","Having satisfied Driftwood's request, you should return to the Wave-hunter.","Corsairs throughout the Shield Isles carry money-purses that Driftwood recovers and donates to Manadhon.","Driftwood, hoping to make up for something in his past, has joined your crew!","Talk to Driftwood at Voyage's End","Manadhon, the bartender of Halrax, has given you a lead on the man called Driftwood.","The Isles: Driftwood","Manadhon told you the man called Driftwood might be found somewhere to the east in Halrax.","Driftwood has directed you to bring the money-purses to Manadhon on the upper level of Halrax.","Driftwood stands by the Wave-hunter in the Shield Isles.","Bring the money-purses to Manadhon on the upper level of Halrax"}},
[12455]={nameES="The Isles: Elladan and Elrohir",objectivesES={"Elladan and Elrohir have saved Yahîm from danger, and he waits to speak with you in Bakhjâd.","This must be the sword Yahîm left behind when the Elves rescued him","The Isles: Elladan and Elrohir","Elladan and Elrohir have rescued a resident of the Shield Isles from danger, and he may share useful information with you if you help him further.","Elladan and Elrohir have returned to the Wave-hunter in the Shield Isles.","Talk to Yahîm by Elrohir in Bakhjâd","Bring Yahîm his sword at his home by the water on the eastern side of Mâr Naphra","Yahîm waits for you to return his sword to him near his home by the water on the eastern side of Mâr Naphra.","Talk to Elladan at Voyage's End","Retrieve Yahîm's sword from the kergrim-infested ruins","Yahîm has asked you to retrieve his sword from the kergrim den where he lost it, and to slay any of the creatures you can.","Talk to Elrohir at Voyage's End"}},
[12456]={nameES="The Isles: Galengam's Scheme",objectivesES={"Galengam may be interested in this one","Galengam is north of Halrax.","Find the vendor on the eastern side of the inlet","Salamanders and toads can be found east of Halrax in the Shield Isles, and Galengam believes their legs might prove delicious for his customers... or for the crew of the Wave-hunter.","Galengam will be interested in this one","Talk to Galengam outside Halrax","Galengam has asked you to <rgb=#00FF00>look</rgb> at several vendors within Halrax, to assess the level of his competition.","Galengam could be interested in this one","Galengam has asked you to clear away some of the dense vegetation near his gathered supplies.","Bring the salamander and toad legs to Galengam at Voyage's End","Find the first vendor's stall as you enter Halrax","Galengam might be interested in this one","<rgb=#00FF00>Look</rgb> at the vendor by an intersection in Halrax","Find the vendor near the base of the sloping road in Halrax","Galengam has not been in the Shield Isles for long and the merchant is already up to something.","This vendor is conveniently-located right by the eastern docks in Halrax","Galengam has returned to the Wave-hunter in the Shield Isles.","<rgb=#00FF00>Look</rgb> at the first vendor's stall as you enter Halrax","A lovely turquoise awning protects this vendor's goods from the weather","Hard to see from the road, this vendor should be little competition for Galengam","<rgb=#00FF00>Look</rgb> at the vendor near the base of the sloping road in Halrax","The Isles: Galengam's Scheme","<rgb=#00FF00>Look</rgb> at the vendor's goods on the eastern side of the inlet","This vendor serves a variety of fresh fruits collected from the nearby isles","Find the vendor by a major intersection in Halrax"}},
[12457]={nameES="The Isles: Gangur's Vision",objectivesES={"Gangur asked you to defeat worms and drakes in the high places of an island to the south, and to search their lair for corroded rock samples that might prove interesting to him.","Gangur Farwend has asked you to retrieve the pick-axe and satchel he lost when he fell overboard. Additionally, he wants you to bring him rock samples from the island onto which he washed ashore.","Bring Gangur's satchel, pick-axe, and rock samples to him on the island where he washed ashore","Gangur Farwend has returned to the Wave-hunter on the Shield Isles and waits for you to bring him the corroded rock samples he requested.","You found Gangur's pick-axe. Fortunately it has not been damaged","Retrieve Gangur's pick-axe from the coast nearby","Retrieve Gangur's satchel from the coast nearby","The Isles: Gangur's Vision","Gangur Farwend is lucky to be alive, but his experience has left him all the more eager to accomplish his mission.","Bring corroded rock samples to Gangur at Voyage's End","Gangur Farwend waits for you to bring him his items on the island where he washed ashore.","You found Gangur's satchel, water-logged but still usable"}},
[12458]={nameES="The Isles: Gimli and Legolas",objectivesES={"Bring the meat you collected to Gimli at the northern tip of Zamarzîr","Legolas intended to return to the Wave-hunter in the Shield Isles.","Gimli and Legolas have begun to gather food to help your crew survive among the Shield Isles, and they could use your help.","Various beasts of the Shield Isles can provide your crew the food necessary to their survival.","Talk to Legolas at the northern tip of Zamarzîr","Legolas has felled a number of birds throughout Zamarzîr, and asked you to retrieve their meat and his arrows.","Gimli has returned to the Wave-hunter, in the Shield Isles.","Bring the birds and arrows to Legolas at Voyage's End","Gimli is at the northern tip of the island of Zamarzîr.","Legolas is at the northern tip of Zamarzîr.","Talk to Gimli at Voyage's End","The Isles: Gimli and Legolas"}},
[12459]={nameES="The Isles: Gwallang the Limlinn",objectivesES={"Find Gwallang the Limlinn among the islands west of Voyage's End","The Isles: Gwallang the Limlinn","As you arrive, a huge shadow passes overhead, blanketing the immediate area in darkness. Gwallang jumps up and down with fright. He shakes out his feathers, and while you cannot understand his language the message is clear: the Shield Isles are not a suitable place for him to build a nest.\
\
Gwallang's journey will continue, and perhaps when you leave the Shield Isles the next place he tries will be free of noise, bog-lurkers, and giant birds.","Find Gwallang the Limlinn along the coast of Zamarzîr","Gwallang chirps a welcome at you","Gwallang the Limlinn is among the islands west of Voyage's End.","The ground beneath Gwallang has proved unstable!","The ground beneath Gwallang suddenly shakes!","Gwallang the Limlinn flew to the south-east, and you should look for him along the coast of Zamarzîr.","Talk to Gwallang the Limlinn along the coast of Zamarzîr","Gwallang chirps a welcome at you.","Gwallang the Limlinn is on one of the north-western islands of the Shield Isles.","Meat from the nearby beetles on the western side of the island may help feed Gwallang the Limlinn.","Bring the beetle-meat to Gwallang the Limlinn in the north-western Shield Isles","Gwallang flies away to the south-east","Gwallang the Limlinn flew to the south-east, and you should look for him among the islands to the west of Voyage's End.","Gwallang perches atop a sandy mound, chirping happily at you. He peers around at the surrounding area, taking it all in, apparently deciding if this is a good place to build a nest.","Gwallang pecks at some of the beetle meat, but it is impossible to gauge his reaction. After a few bites, he flutters into the air and peers away southward. Something in that direction seems to bother him.","Gwallang flies away","Gwallang the Limlinn is along the coast of Zamarzîr in the Shield Isles.","Gwallang the Limlinn hops up and down before flying to several nearby trees and testing their branches, scrutinizing the bark and leaves closely with his tiny, sharp eyes. You can't be quite sure, but it feels to you as if he is looking for a suitable place to build a nest!\
\
If so, he'll want easy access to meat. Perhaps the meat of nearby beetles on the western side of the island will suffice. You should bring some to him and see if he likes it.","Gwallang the Limlinn might like meat from the nearby beetles on the western side of the island.","Help Gwallang","The shoal-tender stands up and Gwallang flies away to the south-east, chirping in protest","Gwallang the Limlinn seems to be searching for a new home among the dangerous Shield Isles.","Gwallang chirps at you.","Talk to Gwallang the Limlinn among the islands west of Voyage's End"}},
[12460]={nameES="The Isles: Keen-eyed Sigileth",objectivesES={"This sailor has been long-dead, revealing the wreck to be many years old","Sigileth wants to search the various wrecks that populate Shedax Khîn to ensure none of them carried her brother to his death.","Search the shipwrecks of Shedax Khîn for some sign of Corudan","At some point during the long years, this wreck fell onto its side","Talk to Sigileth further south of the wrecks you investigated in Shedax Khîn","Sigileth hands you the note she removed from the sealed bottle","Sigileth asked you to search several of the shipwrecks at Shedax Khîn in search of her brother.","Sigileth handed you a note she found within a bottle discovered on one of the wrecks in Shedax Khîn.","Talk to Sigileth south of the wrecks you investigated in Shedax Khîn","Read the note Sigileth discovered inside a bottle in one of the wrecks of Shedax Khîn","The stern of this wrecked ship has risen from the water here for many years","Sigileth is south of the wrecks you investigated in Shedax Khîn.","Powerful storms embedded the prow of this boat in the sand","Sigileth is further south of the wrecks you investigated in Shedax Khîn.","The Isles: Keen-eyed Sigileth"}},
[12461]={nameES="The Isles: Sirgon the Explorer",objectivesES={"Even islands such as these are home to ancient ruins","Sirgon is located at Voyage's End on the Shield Isles.","Find the beach of the island to the north-west of Voyage's End","The sound of Orkish voices drifts from the high cliffs of the island to the west","Sirgon has asked you to <rgb=#00FF00>look</rgb> over your surroundings at three separate locations: the beach across the lagoon to the south of Sirgon, the beach to the north-west of the Wave-hunter, and the beach on the western side of the island.","Find the beach across the lagoon to the south","<rgb=#00FF00>Look</rgb> to the south on the beach across the lagoon from Voyage's End","Sounds of fighting and revelry drift over the trees from the south. A settlement?","Talk to Sirgon at Voyage's End","Sirgon wants to make use of his experience sailing around the Shield Isles to help you learn the geography with which you must now deal.","Find the western beach of the island to the north-west of Voyage's End","<rgb=#00FF00>Look</rgb> at the beach of the island to the north-west of Voyage's End","<rgb=#00FF00>Look</rgb> towards the island to the west","The Isles: Sirgon the Explorer"}},
[12462]={nameES="The Isles: The Corsair Daxamat",objectivesES={}},
[12463]={nameES="The Isles: The Knight Nauriel",objectivesES={"If you are to get an audience with Saklaphêl, you will need to attract the attention of the residents of Mâr Naphra.","Heed these words, and profit by them!\
\
For the CAPTURE or DEATH of each of the following leaders of the so-called \\qKindred of the Coins,\\q the generous Heirs of Castamir offer the following rewards:\
\
<rgb=#FFFF00>Azagath the Sea-shadow</rgb> --- five chests of gold phârzi, and two of silver gîmli\
\
<rgb=#FFFF00>Belondor of the Fleet-fast</rgb> --- one chest of gold phârzi, and one of silver gîmli\
\
<rgb=#FFFF00>Hármelak Golden-hand</rgb> --- her weight in silver gîmli, multiplied by five hundred\
\
Know that the CAPTURE or DEATH of any others who claim to belong to the Kindred of the Coins will be rewarded. Speak with Galadaith within Mâr Naphra for more information.\
\
So it is ordered,\
\
Saklaphêl, Wife of Balakhôr the Scourge and True Ruler of Umbar Baharbêl and the Surrounding Lands","Talk to Galadaith from atop the tall buildings on the western side of Mâr Naphra","A voice calls for you from atop a tall building on the western side of Mâr Naphra","Have you made enough of a commotion in Mâr Naphra?","Nauriel stands outside Mâr Naphra, considering the bounty posted on the Kindred of the Coins by the Heirs of Castamir.","A man called Galadaith has called for you from atop a tall building on the western side of Mâr Naphra.","Examine the posted notice outside Mâr Naphra","Talk to Nauriel outside Mâr Naphra","Nauriel has no patience for any delays, and has come to Mâr Naphra in search of information that will help her rescue her son Thorongil from the Kindred of the Coins.","Wait for someone to notice the ruckus you created","The Isles: The Knight Nauriel","Nauriel stands by a posted notice outside Mâr Naphra.","Nauriel waits for you outside Mâr Naphra."}},
[12464]={nameES="The Ithil-stone",objectivesES={"Talk to Ingold","The Ithil-stone","Ingold can be found back at the Ruins of Díngarth.\
\
You should talk to Ingold.","Talk to Hithgol","Hithgol can be found at the Ruins of Díngarth.\
\
You should talk to Hithgol.","You should talk to Ingold.","Ingold is concerned that in defeat, Dulgabêth and his followers may direct their wrath upon Gondorians in Mordor.","Talk to Lômazar","Lômazar is located at the Ruins of Díngarth.\
\
You should speak with Lômazar."}},
[12465]={nameES="The Ithilduin",objectivesES={"Retrieve the urn from the hills of eastern Rath Dúath","Retrieved an urn","Foulness is purged from the vessel as you pour the water into it","Talk to Rauniel by the bridge to Eithel Gwaur","The Ithilduin","The urns Rauniel seeks can be found in the hills of eastern Rath Dúath and from outside the barrows of Gorthad Nûr.\
\
You should retrieve the urns for Rauniel.","Rauniel can be found by the bridge to Eithel Gwaur in Rath Dúath.\
\
You should talk to Rauniel.","Complete: Dwelling in the Hills","A strange woman seeks to help you cure that which plagues the Morgulduin River.","Pour water into a vessel upon the bridge to Eithel Gwaur","Retrieve the urn from outside the barrows of Gorthad Nûr","Vessels for the water of the urns can be found upon the bridge to Eithel Gwaur in Rath Dúath.\
\
You should pour water into the vessels for Rauniel."}},
[12466]={nameES="El carcelero",objectivesES={"El carcelero","Ned Pruner está en la cárcel, al norte y al este de la puerta de la ciudad.\
\
El condestable Cardoso sugirió que podrías ayudar a Ned Pruner a descubrir lo que Calder Cob contó a los bandidos Montebruno.","Ned Pruner es el carcelero de Archet. Es un buen hombre encargado de descubrir los secretos que Calder Cob entregó a los bandidos Montebruno.","Debe completarse antes de la \"Introducción.\""}},
[12467]={nameES="The Jangovar Threat",objectivesES={"You should look for sign of the missing refugees, south from Dale's eastern gates, and defeat any Jangovar that may have been involved in their disappearance.","The Jangovar Threat","Tay Yoldash can be found south-east of the city of Dale in the Dale-lands.\
\
You should defeat Jangovar and free refugees from Tay Yoldash.","There are rumours that the new Easterling refugees may be joining, or perhaps being kidnapped, by the remaining Jangovar.","You should talk to Easterling refugees in Dale and learn the truth of the rumours.","You should return to Orphón with news of your success, just outside Tay Yoldash.","Search for the missing refugees","Return to Orphón"}},
[12468]={nameES="La Joya de Hielo",objectivesES={"La Joya de Hielo","Menikko te ha hablado de un tesoro lossoth perdido que ha vuelto ahora a la luz.","Habla con Esko en Pynti-peldot","Esko se encuentra en Pynti-peldot, justo al sur de la gran bahía.\
\
Menikko te ha pedido que hables con un hombre llamado Esko para conocer la historia del tesoro lossoth perdido."}},
[12469]={nameES="The Journey Through the Floodfells",objectivesES={"Léothred has asked you to defeat Orcs and Wargs in the Floodfells.\
\
You should defeat Orcs and Wargs in the Floodfells.","The shape of the White Mare is unmistakable, a wonder of the craft","Léothred, the Rohirric scholar, seeks to follow the northern migration of his ancestors as they passed through the Floodfells.","Léothred can be found at the White Mare.\
\
You should talk to Léothred.","Visit the White Mare in the Floodfells","The White Mare can be found in the Floodfells.\
\
You should visit the White Mare.","Talk to Léothred at the White Mare","The Journey Through the Floodfells"}},
[12470]={nameES="The Journey to Erebor",objectivesES={}},
[12471]={nameES="El viaje hacia el Abismo de Helm",objectivesES={"Agelwyn is in the ravine north of Marton.\
\
You should speak with Agelwyn.","Gamling is at Helm's Dike in the south-western Westfold.\
\
You should speak with Gamling.","Speak with Gamling","Help Agelwyn and her people reach Helm's Deep","It is time to make for Helm's Deep with Agelwyn and the refugees. You have chosen the safest path, but it will still be dangerous, for the Westfold is overrun.","El viaje hacia el Abismo de Helm"}},
[12472]={nameES="The Joyous Court",objectivesES={"Defeat Shorábakh","You have defeated the vile Shorábakh and provided a great service to the White Company. Their efforts to reclaim Minas Ithil are now ever closer thanks to you.","Defeated Shorábakh","The Joyous Court","Defeated Shorábakh.","Completado","The vile Shorábakh has taken Meremband and must be removed.","The vile Shorábakh has taken Meremband, the Joyous Court. If the White Company is to gain control over the city, this minion of Minas Morgul must be removed.","Shorábakh can be found at Meremband upon the Circle of Death.\
\
You should defeat Shorábakh."}},
[12473]={nameES="El Guardián Garthamendir",objectivesES={"El Guardián Garthamendir","Tu constante hostigamiento a los Angmarim no ha pasado desapercibido. Los Montaraces desean llevar la lucha hasta las puertas mismas de Carn Dûm y derrotar al líder de los Angmarim en Himbar.","Areneth está en Gath Forthnír, al este de Carn Dûm.\
\
Garthamendir fue derrotado y sus fuerzas, destruidas. Deberías regresar con Areneth para darle la noticia."}},
[12474]={nameES="La carrera de salto de barriles",objectivesES={"Observa la carrera y anima al participante que elegiste.","La carrera de salto de barriles","Espera a que empiece la carrera","Mira la carrera para ver si tu participante gana","Has abandonado la zona de la carrera","Habla con Arnar para elegir a un participante de la carrera","No abandones la zona de la carrera","Habla con Arnar y elige a tu participante favorito para la próxima carrera."}},
[12475]={nameES="Los kergrim acechan en Haudh Valandil",objectivesES={"Derrota a Muelespinillas","Muelespinillas derrotado","Los Kergrim acechan en Haudh Valandil, la tumba en la isla más allá del puente de Ariant, en Annúminas.\
\
Glangilith te ha pedido que derrotes a los kergrim que acechan en las profundidades de Haudh Valandil, incluyendo a su líder, Muelespinillas.","Los kergrim acechan en Haudh Valandil"}},
[12476]={nameES="The Key and the Keyhole",objectivesES={"You found a dwarf in Othrikar who knows about the Secret Stone, but he cannot help you unless you know whom to ask for.\
\
You should discover whom to ask for in Othrikar.","Rúnvarth is an ancient dwarf, but you have the feeling that great wisdom has come with his age. He silently assesses you for a moment, and then speaks:\
\
'I am Rúnvarth, and I have what you seek, but it is impossible to simply hand it to you. Three items you must bring me, and only then can your quest continue.'","Talk to King Thorin III","Collect the items for Rúnvarth","Now that you have the key, you must find the keyhole.\
\
You should find the keyhole.","You have discovered the name of the dwarf in Othrikar.\
\
You should ask for Rúnvarth.","An old piece of parchment was left behind here. It appears to have been written very quickly:\
'Forced to flee. Seek me in Othrikar.'","You found a note in Moria pointing you towards Othrikar.\
\
You should find someone who knows something about the Secret Stone in Othrikar.","Find someone in Othrikar who knows about the Secret Stone","The Key and the Keyhole","Talk to Rúnvarth","Talk to Lúki","Rúnvarth has told you that he needs three items from you.\
\
You should discover what these items are.","Discover whom to ask for in Othrikar.","Find the keyhole","You need to ask for Rúnvarth!","You ask Lúki to see Rúnvarth. He nods solemnly.\
\
'As you wish!'","You have found the Secret Stone inside Erebor!\
\
You should claim the Secret Stone!","King Thorin III has asked you to try to locate an ancient relic known as the Secret Stone. But what dangers did the poem warn about? Can you solve this mystery on your own?\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>This difficult treasure hunt will require community teamwork and resources outside of the game itself. Good luck! </rgb>","You hear someone enter the chamber behind you","Claim the Secret Stone!","Rúnvarth can be found in Othrikar.\
\
You should talk to Rúnvarth.","King Thorin III can be found in Erebor.\
\
You should bring the Secret Stone to King Thorin.","He quickly goes inside and then returns, followed by another dwarf."}},
[12477]={nameES="The Key to Chaos",objectivesES={"Attempted to free many prisoners in Naerband.","Naerband is located in Talath Úrui.\
\
You should collect keys from jailers in Naerband.","After opening numerous prison doors to free prisoners in Naerband, you realize that Thraknûl is not just capturing Nurnhoth, but also many of the Orcs and Uruks formerly under the command of Sauron. Either Thraknûl is vying for power or he has gone mad.","Naerband is located in Talath Úrui.\
\
You should free prisoners in Naerband.","The prison fortress of Naerband is populated by vile acts and jailed denizens.","The Key to Chaos","Many prisoner voices wail through the walls of Naerband. Perhaps if you could find some jailer keys, you might be able to let loose some of the denizens of Naerband.","Collect keys from jailers in Naerband","Completado"}},
[12478]={nameES="The Key to Freedom",objectivesES={}},
[12479]={nameES="La clave de su codicia",objectivesES={"Thórth se encuentra en Zigilgund.\
\
Deberías regresar junto a Thórth con noticias de tu victoria.","Thórth sospecha que quienquiera que lidere a los Duramanos en las Minas de Arrancahielo se esconde en una zona cerrada con llave dentro de las minas.","Consigue una llave de un Duramano en las antiguas Minas de Arrancahielo","Lleva la llave a Thórth","La clave de su codicia","Has encontrado una llave torcida","Las Minas de Arrancahielo se encuentran al suroeste de Zigilgund.\
\
Thórth te ha pedido que expulses a los Duramanos de las Minas de Arrancahielo.","Consigue una llave de un Duramano en las Minas de Arrancahielo"}},
[12480]={nameES="¡Los Kharum-ubnâr te necesitan!",objectivesES={"Habla con Vorthur Alientohumo en Akrâz-zahar","(Opcional) Preséntate ante un reclutador de miniaventuras","Has llegado a Akrâz-zahar","A instancias del rey Thorin Yelmo de Piedra, los enanos de los Kharum-ubnâr buscan la ayuda de aventureros expertos para asegurar las Moradas de los Enanos más lejanos y preparar al príncipe Durin y a la Gabil'akkâ para la victoria en la inminente reconquista del Monte Gundabad.\
\
Si deseas ayudar a los Kharum-ubnâr, deberías presentarte ante uno de los reclutadores de miniaventuras repartidos por toda la Tierra Media. Te llevarán a Akrâz-zahar, la sala de los Kharum-ubnâr en Erebor, la Montaña Solitaria. Puedes encontrar reclutadores de miniaventuras en la Puerta de Thorin, Gondamon, la ciudad de Bree, la Sala Veintiuno, Othrikar, Gabilshathûr, el Campamento de Glóin, Hrimbarg, Galtrev, el Mirador de la Gran Excavación, Magh Ashtu, Járnfast, Erebor y Minas Tirith (solsticio de verano).","A instancias del rey Thorin Yelmo de Piedra, los Kharum-ubnâr han reclutado la ayuda de aventureros expertos para asegurar las Moradas de los Enanos más lejanos y garantizar el éxito del príncipe Durin y la Gabil'akkâ en la inminente reconquista del Monte Gundabad.","Debes presentarte en Akrâz-zahar, en Erebor. Los reclutadores de miniaventuras están a tu disposición para llevarte allí a toda prisa.\
\
Puedes encontrar reclutadores de miniaventuras en la Puerta de Thorin, Gondamon, la ciudad de Bree, la Sala Veintiuno, Othrikar, Gabilshathûr, el Campamento de Glóin, Hrimbarg, Galtrev, el Mirador de la Gran Excavación, Magh Ashtu, Járnfast, Erebor y Minas Tirith (solsticio de verano).","Puedes encontrar a Vorthur Alientohumo en Akrâz-zahar, en Erebor.\
\
A instancias del rey Thorin Yelmo de Piedra, los Kharum-ubnâr han reclutado la ayuda de aventureros expertos para asegurar las Moradas de los Enanos más lejanos y garantizar el éxito del príncipe Durin y la Gabil'akkâ en la inminente reconquista del Monte Gundabad.","Viaja a Akrâz-zahar en Erebor"}},
[12481]={nameES="The Khundolar",objectivesES={}},
[12482]={nameES="The Killing Crofts",objectivesES={"The Killing Crofts","This cow was slain viciously by an armed attacker...suddenly an Orc strikes","Scout the croft to the east of Garsfeld","Scout the croft to the south-west of Garsfeld","Scout the croft to the south of Garsfeld","There is widespread devastation on this croft; the crops are completely torn apart","Talk to Gísling","This croft has suffered massive damage; nothing remains to save","Gísling is in the Mead Hall of Garsfeld.\
\
You should return to Gísling with news of your discoveries.","Gísling is uncertain how widespread the devastation of the local crofts has become. He requests that you search the crofts for any signs of life.","The crofts can be found to the east, south, and south-west of Garsfeld.\
\
Gísling wishes for you to scout the three largest crofts around Garsfeld to discover how much damage has been dealt to this season's crops."}},
[12483]={nameES="The Kin of Winter",objectivesES={"Fólnith the Pale smells fresh meat and begins to descend!","This goat meat may serve as a suitable lure for the hunting drake","Talk to Molkha in the valley","Defeat Grimdóth the Bitter","The two elder drakes have been slain! You should report your success to Molkha.\
\
Molkha can be found on the frozen lake south-west of Fellgát.","The Kin of Winter","Place a fresh ram to lure Fólnith the Pale from the sky and defeat him","Two siblings of Vethúg Wintermind have been found living in the Welkin-lofts, and the dwarves have placed a bounty on their heads for the protection of the Gabil'akkâ.","Defeated Fólnith the Pale","Defeated Grimdóth the Bitter","Molkha has asked you to slay Fólnith the Pale and Grimdóth the Bitter, siblings of Vethúg Wintermind.\
\
One can be found at the top of Flogalith, the other flies over the frozen lake and will need to be lured from the sky."}},
[12484]={nameES="The King of the Sekbiri",objectivesES={}},
[12485]={nameES="The King's Banners",objectivesES={"Return to Langwen","Langwen has asked you to replace shredded banners atop the towers of Rammas Echor in the Harlond. You should pick up the nearby bag full of banners.\
\
The bag is next to Langwen, in the Harlond.","Talk to Langwen","Atop the towers of the great wall, Rammas Echor, fly the black banners of King Elessar. Time, weather, and war have ripped and shredded their once proud edges.","Pick up the bag full of banners","You have taken down the tattered banners and replaced them with proud black flags bearing the white tree of Gondor. You should let Langwen know that her new banners fly from the towers' heights.\
\
Langwen is in the Harlond.","Othanar has asked you to speak with Langwen, who has been asking for assistance.\
\
Langwen can be found by a fountain in one of the gardens in the Harlond.","The King's Banners","Langwen has asked you to replace shredded banners atop the towers of Rammas Echor in the Harlond."}},
[12486]={nameES="The Kintai of Sul Madásh",objectivesES={"Quartermaster Aralath informed you of how you can assist the Kintai and bid you return to Dithúrim for final instruction and a gift.","You have spoken to Quartermaster Aralath","Speak with Dithúrim in Sul Madásh","The Kintai of Sul Madásh","Welcomed by the Kintai of Sul Madásh, your reputation with an alliance in the North endears you to the Elves, and they look to you for assistance in preserving what remains of the Emerald Wood.","Speak with Quartermaster Aralath in Sul Madásh","After speaking with Dithúrim, she directed you to speak with Quartermaster Aralath. He will provide further information in how we can assist the Kintai in Adagím."}},
[12487]={nameES="El secreto del cuchillo",objectivesES={"El secreto del cuchillo","Busca el volumen perdido de 'Crónicas de los Tarsâri'.","Recupera las Crónicas de los Tarsâri, Vol. II","Recupera las Crónicas de los Tarsâri, Vol. IV","Este libro relata la llegada de los Tarsâri a Kighân, hace varios siglos","Todavía se sabe poco sobre los Tarsâri, aquellos que se hacen llamar los Encargados. Investiga el Cuerno de la Hoja en busca de nuevas pistas sobre su historia y alcance.","Derrota al Encargado Velado","Derrota al Encargado Velado en el Cuerno de la Hoja.","Este libro explica los procedimientos y el reclutamiento de los nuevos discípulos de los Tarsâri","Recupera las Crónicas de los Tarsâri, Vol. I","Recupera textos históricos sobre los Tarsâri en Bâdrasag, el Cuerno de la Hoja.","Este libro detalla la línea de sucesión de los Tarsâri, que se detiene hace apenas cincuenta años","Busca el volumen perdido de 'Crónicas de los Tarsâri'"}},
[12488]={nameES="The Lady and the Mirror",objectivesES={"You have entered the Court of Celeborn and should now speak to Lady Galadriel!","Lady Galadriel stands beside the Mirror...","The Court of Celeborn can be found within Caras Galadhon.\
\
King Thranduil has asked you to seek the counsel of Lady Galadriel in Caras Galadhon.\
\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: If you have not previously entered Caras Galadhon, you may use a rope near the entrance to enter the city. If you have not begun the Court of Lothlórien allegiance, you may speak to one of the Galadhrim beneath the great mallorn in the centre of Caras Galadhon to enter the Court of Celeborn.</rgb>","Concerned that none of the visions granted to you by the Green Lady have come to pass, King Thorin III has asked you to seek the guidance of King Thranduil.","Talk to King Thranduil","Lady Galadriel is standing in her garden.\
\
You have arrived at Galadriel's Garden and should now speak to Lady Galadriel and learn what she has seen.","Talk to Lady Galadriel","The Lady and the Mirror","Travel to Galadriel's Garden","Travel to Caras Galadhon and seek Lady Galadriel in the Court of Celeborn","Lady Galadriel can be found in the Court of Celeborn.\
\
You have come to the Court of Celeborn and should now seek Lady Galadriel's counsel.","King Thranduil can be found within Felegoth.\
\
Concerned that none of the visions you were granted have come to pass, King Thorin III has asked you to seek King Thranduil's counsel on what is to be done.","Galadriel's Garden can be found in the south-eastern reaches of Caras Galadhon.\
\
Lady Galadriel has decided to consult the Mirror of Galadriel to determine if Karazgar has indeed returned to Dol Guldur."}},
[12489]={nameES="The Lady's Champion",objectivesES={}},
[12490]={nameES="The Lady's Cunning",objectivesES={"Lord Angbor can be found just outside Tumladen in northern Upper Lebennin.\
\
Lady Terenis has threatened to imprison you unless you or Lord Angbor tell her the truth of the battle at Pelargir.","The Lady's Cunning","After threatening to imprison you, it is clear that Lady Terenis desires to learn of the truth of Pelargir at any cost.","Talk to Angbor outside Tumladen"}},
[12491]={nameES="The Lady's Favour",objectivesES={"Torferth is in Torsbury, west of Oserley.\
\
When you come to Torsbury, you should deliver Lúfa's favour to Torferth.","When you come to Torsbury, you should deliver Lúfa's favour to Torferth.","You should bring Lúfa's favour to Torferth at Torsbury","Torferth is in Tordag's camp, west of Oserley.\
\
You should deliver Lúfa's favour to Torferth.","The Lady's Favour","Bring Lúfa's favour to Torferth at Torsbury","Bring Lúfa's favour to Torferth in Tordag's camp","Torsbury is overrun, and the people have retreated south and east","Lady Lúfa had given you her favour to deliver to Torferth of Torsbury as a token of her faithful but forever unrequited love.","Bring Lúfa's favour to Torferth in Torsbury"}},
[12492]={nameES="The Lady's Gratitude",objectivesES={}},
[12493]={nameES="The Lady's Protector",objectivesES={"The Lady's Protector","Talk to Dudsig and obtain the key to Ordlac's house","Dudsig is near the stables in Oserley.\
\
Ordlac has instructed you to obtain the key to his house from Dudsig.","DNT -- Will not be seen","Ordlac's house is near the Oserley stable, on the road to the Mead Hall.\
\
Dudsig gave you the key to Thane Ordlac's house and bade you fulfill your duty there.","You found a note upon the corpse of one of the half-orc commanders detailing plans to murder Thane Ordlac's wife in their own home.","Talk to Lúfa at Ordlac's house"}},
[12494]={nameES="The Lady's Sorrow",objectivesES={"Talk to Lúfa in Ordlac's house","Lúfa is at Thane Ordlac's house in Oserley.\
\
Lúfa has finished her tale and wishes to speak with you again.","Collect wine from the table","The Lady's Sorrow","Thane Ordlac sent you to his house to protect his young wife Lúfa from the would-be assassins which the half-orcs intend to use against her.","Lúfa is at Thane Ordlac's house in Oserley.\
\
Lúfa awaits the wine she requested from you.","The wine is on the table in Thane Ordlac's house.\
\
Lúfa has asked you to bring her a cup of wine to ease her thirst while she tells you her tale.","Bring the cup of wine to Lúfa","Collected wine from the table"}},
[12495]={nameES="La guarida de las alimañas",objectivesES={"No hace mucho tiempo, un grupo de Trév Duvárdain derrotó a un mago de la Corona de Hierro en los alcantarillados de Carn Dûm. La historia es, como Lágsaith querría que muchos creyeran, bastante extraña.","Completa 'Sagroth, la guarida de las alimañas'","La guarida de las alimañas","Lágsaith ha concluido su historia.\
\
Deberías hablar con ella en Bail Avarc.","Completa 'Sagroth, la guarida de las alimañas' en cualquier dificultad.\
\
Usa el Buscador de Instancias para entrar en 'Sagroth, la guarida de las alimañas'.","Completa 'Sagroth, la guarida de las alimañas' en cualquier dificultad","Habla con Lágsaith en Bail Avarc"}},
[12496]={nameES="The Last Beacon",objectivesES={"The Last Beacon","In the distance, the Corsairs have made landfall in the ancient Elf-harbour of Edhellond","Edhellond can be viewed to the north of Amon Lontir.\
\
Boradan has asked you to look from the beacon to Edhellond.","Boradan can be found on the beacon, Amon Lontir, just outside Ost Lontir.\
\
You have looked upon Edhellond and should now speak to Boradan.","This seems like a good place to <rgb=#FF00FF>look</rgb> at Edhellond","<rgb=#FF00FF>Look</rgb> to Dol Amroth in the west from Amon Lontir","Talk to Boradan","Boradan can be found on the beacon, Amon Lontir, just outside Ost Lontir.\
\
You have looked upon Dol Amroth and should now speak to Boradan.","<rgb=#FF00FF>Look</rgb> to Edhellond in the north from Amon Lontir","DNT -- will not be seen","Dol Amroth can be viewed to the west of Amon Lontir.\
\
Boradan has asked you to look from the beacon to Dol Amroth.","In the distance, the shining city of Dol Amroth overlooks the Bay of Belfalas","From the beacon of Amon Lontir, the threats to Gondor have become well-known, but it is less known how the people of Ost Lontir will address them.","This seems like a good place to <rgb=#FF00FF>look</rgb> at Dol Amroth"}},
[12497]={nameES="The Last Bit of Green",objectivesES={"Morgul Defilers can be found in Eryn Lothad.\
\
You should defeat defilers to protect the orchard from being ravaged.","The Last Bit of Green","Ingold can be found at the North-gate of the Rammas.\
\
You should speak with Ingold.","Speak with Ingold","Ingold, captain of the Out-wall, refuses to leave his post. In his vigilance he has seen enemy troops head towards the nearby orchard."}},
[12498]={nameES="The Last Bounty",objectivesES={"You should continue looking for signs of Bothin in Skrizagáf.","More blood has been tracked further in","Time passes...","The Orc's body has sustained large bite marks that could not have been inflicted by most of the worms here. This corpse must be what's encouraging Bothin to stay inside the cave.\
\
Bothin hasn't made an appearance, but pretending to steal its food may enrage it into emerging.","Talk to Elta near Shataz-kordh","Bothin has not appeared.\
\
You should talk to Elta and come up with a different plan together.","Finding the final creature on Elta's list might be trickier than it seems....","Elta has suggested to wait and see if Bothin will appear.","Bothin defeated","Orkish blood has been splattered on the ground","The Last Bounty","Find signs of Bothin","You have found a dead Orc in Skrizagáf.\
\
You should examine the corpse.","You have defeated Bothin and obtained its hide.\
\
Elta waits for you outside of Shataz-kordh.","A partially-eaten Orc lies on the ground","Talk to Elta","Find more signs of Bothin","Wait with Elta","Elta has asked you to find Bothin alone.\
\
You should venture into the cave Skrizagáf, on the eastern side of Shataz-kordh.","Lure out and defeat Bothin","You should pretend to steal the Orc corpse and trick Bothin into emerging.","Examine the Orc corpse"}},
[12499]={nameES="The Last Captain",objectivesES={"Chills run down your spine, for the terrible presence of Abedec has appeared behind you","Jajax is in the large tent at Abedec's Watch in southern Belfalas.\
\
You should speak with Jajax.","Speak with Jajax","Captain Abedec is on a mission to have the heads of Jajax and yourself for your offences to the Corsairs.","You have defeated Abedec, the last of the vengeful Corsair Captains","Try to free Jajax from his bonds","The Last Captain","Tell Lothíriel of all that transpired","Abedec has won....","Jajax is in Abedec's Watch, the Corsair encampment in the ruins south of Dol Amroth.\
\
You should free Jajax from his bonds.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This quest will fail on defeat.</rgb>","<rgb=#FF0000>Do not let Abedec defeat you</rgb>","Lothíriel is in the Great Hall of the Prince in Dol Amroth.\
\
You should speak with Lothíriel."}},
[12500]={nameES="El Último Desafío",objectivesES={"Habla con Alla en el lado noreste de Musgovilla.","Bevan, guardia del pueblo de Musgovilla, ha oído que los niños de la aldea se están planteando desafíos y pruebas cada vez más peligrosos, y espera que puedas hacer algo al respecto.","Dai debe estar en algún lugar de Musgovilla, y con los bolsillos llenos de queso es probable que esté en serios problemas con la población de roedores del pueblo.","Dado el problema reciente de roedores en Musgovilla, Dai podría estar en serios problemas.","Quizá la niña Alla te diga qué planean los niños.","Musgovilla tiene varios proveedores, pero uno de ellos suele estar afuera de su almacén en el lado oeste de la plaza del pueblo.","El Último Desafío","Encuentra a Dai en Musgovilla y habla con él.","Alla está junto al pajar en el lado noreste de Musgovilla.","Habla con uno de los proveedores en el lado oeste de la plaza del pueblo de Musgovilla."}},
[12501]={nameES="La última granja",objectivesES={"La última granja","Los orcos han entrado en las Quebradas del Norte desde el norte. Los granjeros de la región huyeron al sur, excepto el viejo Gatson, que está decidido a defender su tierra contra los orcos.","Gatson te espera en su granja al este de Ost Lagoros.\
\
Orthonn admitió que Gatson les había abastecido a menudo, pero te dijo que los Montaraces no tenían suficientes números para defender las granjas de las Quebradas del Norte. Te pidió que regresaras con Gatson y exhortaras al granjero y a sus trabajadores a huir de inmediato.","Orthonn puede encontrarse en las ruinas de Ost Lagoros, al noroeste de la granja de Gatson junto al río.\
\
El granjero Gatson te dijo que ha estado ayudando a los Montaraces con provisiones durante muchos años y ahora espera que le ayuden a proteger su granja. Te ha enviado a hablar con el Montaraz al que entrega la comida, un hombre llamado Orthonn."}},
[12502]={nameES="La última amistad",objectivesES={"Habla con Ravaedron frente a la Cabaña del Helechal","Has llegado a la Cabaña del Helechal, hogar de los Astaciervo","Ravaedron se encuentra en el camino que va hacia el sur desde el Bosque de los Trolls hasta el Ángulo.","Ravaedron se encuentra frente a la Cabaña del Helechal, el hogar de sus amigos, al sureste de la antigua aldea de Glynafon.","Habla con Ravaedron en el camino que viene del Bosque de los Trolls","En el camino que lleva hacia el sur desde el Bosque de los Trolls hasta el Ángulo del Mitheithel, encontraste a un elfo que solicitaba tu ayuda.","La Cabaña del Helechal, el hogar de los amigos de Ravaedron, se encuentra al sureste, más allá de la aldea de Glynafon en el Ángulo del Mitheithel.","La última amistad","Enemigos peligrosos acechan los bosques rocosos del Ángulo, y Ravaedron desea que lo ayudes a combatirlos.","Busca la Cabaña del Helechal, el hogar de los amigos de Ravaedron, más allá de la aldea de Glynafon al sureste"}},
[12503]={nameES="The Last Great Stronghold",objectivesES={"Ask Gamling for news","Éomer wishes to speak with you.\
\
You should speak with Éomer.","Habla con Éomer","Gamling the Old can be found at Helm's Dike in the southern Westfold.\
\
You should ask Gamling for news of the Westfold.","Éomer is at Helm's Dike in the south-eastern Westfold.\
\
You should speak with Éomer.","Learn of the events that changed Théoden's course","Éomer wishes to relay the counsel of Gandalf, and the news they received upon the road.\
\
You should speak with Éomer.","You regretfully tell Gamling that you have had no news at all of Erkenbrand","You cannot help but wonder why the king turned south to the keep of Helm's Deep, rather than ride down his enemy upon the plains of the Westfold.","You ask Éomer why the Rohirrim do not attempt to ride the enemy down on the plain, since the riders have such a great advantage on horseback.\
\
'It is true that we are far stronger than any foe on foot, but....'\
\
Éomer trails off.","The Last Great Stronghold","Éomer is reluctant to speak his thoughts"}},
[12504]={nameES="El Último Lingote",objectivesES={"Lleva el cofre enano antiguo a Larus Fragmentoagudo","El Último Lingote","El lingote robado podría estar dentro del cofre de Hjortur, dentro de los muros de Gabilazan.\
\
Has derrotado a Hjortur Duramano y ahora deberías revisar el cofre que custodiaba para encontrar el lingote robado.","Revisa el cofre de Hjortur para encontrar el lingote robado","Halmur Modelapiedra está en la tumba de su ancestro, en la colina a la izquierda al acercarte a la fortaleza enana en el paso de Gabilazan desde el norte.\
\
Halmur Modelapiedra está esperando que regreses con el lingote de oro enano robado que recuperaste del descendiente del ladrón que lo robó hace mucho tiempo.","El segundo cofre está dentro de la tumba de Halmur Modelapiedra, en el paso de Gabilazan. Larus Fragmentoagudo se encuentra en un campamento al norte del Risco Alto.\
\
Después de ayudar a Halmur Modelapiedra a recuperar el lingote robado y cumplir el juramento de su familia, te ha permitido llevar el cofre a Larus Fragmentoagudo.","El lingote robado podría encontrarse dentro de los muros de Gabilazan.\
\
Halmur Modelapiedra te sugirió buscar el lingote robado allí.","Lingote de oro enano robado reunido","Reúne el lingote de oro enano robado","Halmur Modelapiedra, descendiente del Halmur original, hijo de Vithurr, ha sido encargado de custodiar el cofre que buscas hasta que todo su contenido sea devuelto.","Encuentra a Hjortur Duramano","Cofre enano antiguo reunido","Lleva el lingote de oro enano robado a Halmur Modelapiedra"}},
[12505]={nameES="The Last Refuge",objectivesES={"Henneth Annûn can be found in north-central North Ithilien.\
\
Mablung has asked you to patrol around the borders of Henneth Annûn for possible threats to the refuge.","As the last remaining refuge of the Rangers of Ithilien, the secrecy of Henneth Annûn has never been more critical to the continued presence of the Rangers in North Ithilien.","Talk to Mablung","Mablung can be found in Henneth Annûn.\
\
You have scouted the lands surrounding Henneth Annûn and should now report back to Mablung.","A Ranger stumbles out of the bush!","Arrows of Ranger make protrude from the flesh of this fallen Orc...","Only the calls of nearby birds break the silence at the Forbidden Pool...","The Enemy's forces may have recently passed through this location, but none remain...","The lowlands to the west of Henneth Annûn are still, but your foes have passed through recently...","The Last Refuge","The roadway south of Henneth Annûn is clear of foes..."}},
[12506]={nameES="The Last Refuge -- Redux",objectivesES={"The Last Refuge -- Redux","Speak to Gimli","Handarod has asked you to gather some allies and seek out the Dwarf Gimli. Gimli will accompany you to the dwarf-keep where the Nazgûl and Skorgrím may be hiding. Gimli is staying in one of the guest rooms along the road that winds up the southern slope of the Vale of Imladris.","Glóin is at his camp in the Misty Mountains, north of Rivendell.\
\
The Nazgûl left the dwarf-keep, commanding Skorgrím to slay you. Fortunately, you were able to defeat Skorgrím, but a fell spirit emerged from his corpse and cursed the Longbeards before vanishing. You should tell Glóin all that has transpired.","Habla con Glóin","Handarod told you of the trials of the dwarves at Glóin's camp in the Misty Mountains and of the plans to finally assault the ancient dwarf-hold of Gabilazan"}},
[12507]={nameES="The Last Thread",objectivesES={}},
[12508]={nameES="El último tesoro",objectivesES={"Teodoro Tojo está en la Posada Abandonada.\
\
Has encontrado el tesoro que Teodoro Tojo no pudo encontrar, pero solo era un pergamino con un mensaje críptico. Deberías llevárselo con la triste noticia de que no había ningún tesoro.","Teodoro Tojo está en la Posada Abandonada.\
\
Bingo quiere que sepas si Teodoro Tojo, autoproclamado maestro buscador de tesoros, le enseñaría la profesión.","Teodoro te entrega un pequeño pergamino con un acertijo en él.","Encuentra la caja fuerte oculta que Teodoro no puedo encontrar, en algún lugar de las Tierras Solitarias","Habla con Teodoro Tojo en la Posada Abandonada","Teodoro recibe el mensaje críptico de tus manos y lo examina sin poder ocultar su emoción","Teodoro te ha dado un pergamino con un acertijo escrito en él, aparentemente una pista sobre la localización de un tesoro en las Tierras Solitarias. El pergamino dice:\
\
Un torrente bajo la sombra de la mañana fluía,\
mientras desde lo alto lo observaba el vigía.\
La ardilla roja trepó desafiante aquel umbral,\
pero el Tiempo todo lo abate, pues nada es inmortal.'","Bingo ha venido a las Tierras Solitarias en busca de aventuras, y la gente de la Posada Abandonada seguro que se las proporcionan.","Habla con Bingo en la Posada Abandonada","Teodoro Tojo y Haley Pradodulce han atraído la atención de Bingo en la Posada Abandonada, y quiere saber más sobre ellos.","El último tesoro","Habla con Haley Pradodulce en la Posada Abandonada","La caja fuerte está vacía salvo por un solo pergamino que contiene frases crípticas","Bingo está en la Posada Abandonada, en las Tierras Solitarias.","Lleva el mensaje críptico a Teodoro Tojo en la Posada Abandonada","Bingo Boffin está en la Posada Abandonada."}},
[12509]={nameES="The Last Vestiges",objectivesES={"The Last Vestiges","Talk to Rongal atop Amon Angened","The road to the Gostannon lies to the north of Amon Angeled, leading eastwards.\
\
Rongal has asked you to utterly destroy the Enemy at the Gostannon.","The Elves of the Golden Host are concerned with the continuing presence of Orcs in the Mirk-eaves and in procuring supplies for the Malledhrim in the east.","Rongal is at the Elf-waypost atop Amon Angened, south of the Gostannon.\
\
While the Enemy encamped at the Gostannon is greatly weakened, they are still stronger than Rongal surmised. You should return to Rongal with the tidings."}},
[12510]={nameES="The Last Wishes of My Kin",objectivesES={}},
[12511]={nameES="Los últimos fuegos artificiales",objectivesES={"Brombard Colazorro está en la Casa de los Mathoms en Cavada Grande, al oeste de Alforzaburgo.\
\
Adelard Tuk te ha pedido que vayas a la Casa de los Mathoms en Cavada Grande y le pidas al guardián Colazorro el cohete que envió allí.","Los últimos fuegos artificiales","El escenario de Methel está en el lado sur de la carretera que sale de Delagua hacia el oeste.\
\
Adelard Tuk te ha pedido que lances el cohete desde el escenario de Methel en Delagua, con la esperanza de que la vista de este último cohete apacigüe al fantasma del Viejo Tuk.","Subes al escenario de Methel","Al ordenar su biblioteca, Adelard Tuk se topó con un cohete de la última fiesta del Solsticio de verano del Viejo Tuk. Lo envió a la Casa de los Mathoms en Cavada Grande, pero cree que eso podría haber molestado al fantasma del Viejo Tuk.","Has lanzado el último de los cohetes.","Lanza el cohete","Encuentra el escenario de Methel en Delagua","Adelard Tuk se encuentra en los Grandes Smials de Alforzaburgo.\
\
Debes volver con Adelard Tuk y hacerle saber que has hecho lo que te pidió."}},
[12512]={nameES="El último de los Silithair",objectivesES={"Aragorn está en uno de los cuartos de invitados de la Casa de Elrond en Rivendel.\
\
Calenglad te ha dado el Silithar para que se lo lleves a Aragorn. Su luz será usada para reforjar la espada que fue quebrada.","Has recuperado el último de los Silithair, diamantes brillantes fabricados por los elfos de la casa de Feänor en los días antiguos. Debe ser utilizado para reforjar la hoja que fue quebrada.","Lleva el Silithar a Aragorn en Rivendel","El último de los Silithair"}},
[12513]={nameES="La amistad duradera",objectivesES={"Ravaedron se encuentra fuera de la Cabaña del Helechal.","Habla con Maddoc Astaciervo dentro de la Cabaña del Helechal","La amistad duradera","Entra en la Cabaña del Helechal y mira dónde se expondrá el cuadro","El segundo cuadro de Ravaedron cuelga con orgullo en la Cabaña del Helechal","Habla con Ravaedron y ayuda al apenado artista a intentar arreglar las cosas","Habla con Ravaedron fuera de la Cabaña del Helechal","Maddoc Astaciervo te ha invitado a entrar para ver dónde se expondrá el nuevo cuadro de Ravaedron.","Maddoc Astaciervo desea hablar contigo dentro de su cabaña.","Ravaedron ha tenido otra idea, y una vez más necesita tu ayuda.","Decidido a arreglar las cosas, Ravaedron necesita tu ayuda una vez más."}},
[12514]={nameES="The Late Fisherman",objectivesES={"Lindil needs your help finding her missing spouse.","The Late Fisherman","You do not see Tirneldir within \\qThe Brew and Bounty\\q in Lond Cirion. The guard sitting at the table may know where he went.","Search for Lindil's spouse in \\qThe Brew and Bounty\\q near the docks","You don't see Tirneldir. The guard nearby may have information","Lindil has asked you to check \\qThe Brew and Bounty\\q for her spouse, Tirneldir, in lower Lond Cirion near the northern lift."}},
[12515]={nameES="The Lay of the Dry Land",objectivesES={"The Lay of the Dry Land","Mizâdi is ready to meet with her allies and plan her strategy for Idagâl.\
\
You should speak to Mizâdi at her camp near the border of An Shêru to begin the meeting.","Complete 'Instance: The Lay of the Dry Land'","Talk to Mizâdi","Mizâdi Shâra-ingari has come to Idagâl with a small force, seeking to confront her rival, Bârshud, and to find a way to push the Ordâkhai from their stronghold in Mûr Ghala.","Mizâdi is ready to put her plan into motion.\
\
You should speak to Mizâdi at her camp near the border of An Shêru to begin the meeting."}},
[12516]={nameES="The Leader of the Pack",objectivesES={"Morglok is at Naur-hoit, south of Mithechad.\
\
Perindúr has asked you to seek out and defeat the Warg-packleader Morglok.","Talk to Perindúr at Mithechad","The Wargs of Naur-hoit are led by a great pack-leader called Morglok. The Elves of the Golden Host believe that his defeat may be the key to driving forth the Wargs from the ruins.","The Leader of the Pack","Defeated Morglok the Warg-packleader","Perindúr is at Mithechad, north of Naur-hoit.\
\
You should return at once to Perindúr and let him know that Morglok has been defeated.","Defeat Morglok the Warg-packleader"}},
[12517]={nameES="El Líder de los asaltantes",objectivesES={"Maelgun Garrarroja ha jurado responder con la muerte a cualquiera que toque un desafío en el cuerno que dejó al oeste de la puerta de las Ruinas de la Guardia del Sur.","Habla con el Maestro Buencorazón al sureste de las Ruinas de la Guardia del Sur","Habla con Melona junto al Camino Verde","El Maestro Buencorazón está al sureste de la entrada a las Ruinas de la Guardia del Sur.","Desafía a Maelgun Garrarroja a la batalla con el cuerno al oeste de la puerta de las Ruinas de la Guardia del Sur, y derrótalo","El Maestro Buencorazón, ciudadano preocupado, ha descubierto que el líder de los bandidos acepta desafíos a su liderazgo.","La cazarrecompensas Melona ha subido por el Camino Verde, y ahora se encuentra al sureste de las Ruinas de la Guardia del Sur.","Qué extraño. El Maestro Buencorazón no está","El Líder de los asaltantes","Maelgun Garrarroja derrotado"}},
[12518]={nameES="La Liga del Hacha (Diaria)",objectivesES={"La Liga del Hacha necesita ayuda con sus actividades en el Bosque Salvaje de la Tierra de Bree.","Completa misiones sin facción en el Bosque Salvaje para ayudar a la Liga del Hacha.","La Liga del Hacha (Diaria)","Completado","Has ayudado a la Liga del Hacha en sus esfuerzos por todo el Bosque Salvaje de la Tierra de Bree. Todos los miembros de la Liga te agradecen tu ayuda.","Has ayudado a la Liga del Hacha"}},
[12519]={nameES="El mínimo esfuerzo",objectivesES={"Edhan está justo fuera de la puerta trasera de la Posada de la Encrucijada.","Las cajas que estaban destinadas a la Posada de la Encrucijada fueron dejadas a lo largo del camino del este que sale de Herne, y Edhan te pidió que las llevaras al almacén dentro de la posada.","Edhan está exhausto por el trabajo que ya ha realizado, y se pregunta si le ayudarás con el resto.","Entregas la caja. Una menos, falta una","Recoge la caja restante junto al camino del este que sale de Herne","Habla con Edhan fuera de la Posada de la Encrucijada","Depositas la caja. ¡Esa era la última!","El mínimo esfuerzo","Recoge una de las cajas junto al camino del este que sale de Herne"}},
[12520]={nameES="The Ledger",objectivesES={"Talk to Andras in Avardin","The Ledger","Gather the items on the fourth page of the ledger","Andras is at Avardin, south-east of Andras' homestead.\
\
