[12526]={nameES="The Legacy of Barad-dûr",objectivesES={"Many lesser artifacts can be found scattered across Dor Amarth. Lômazar may have additional information about Dulgabêth's loyal.\
\
You should find any lesser artifacts you can while searching for Dulgabêth's loyal.","Lômazar explains to you all he knows of Dulgabêth's plans.","Complete Treasures Forgotten","Complete Edge of The Abyss","You find nothing here","Talk to Lômazar","Thwarted Glúrugoth, the Hole-warden","Talk to Ingold","Thwarted Sapakár the Cleaver","Complete The Wrath of Glúrugoth","Ingold can be found at the Ruins of Díngarth.\
\
You should speak with Ingold.","Lômazar is located at the Ruins of Díngarth.\
\
You should speak with Lômazar.","The Legacy of Barad-dûr","Thwarted Krassa-phûrsa, Bringer of Tears"}},
[12527]={nameES="The Legacy of Durin's Folk",objectivesES={"Talk to King Thorin III","King Thorin III has planned a great celebration for the Dwarves of Durin's Folk.","King Thorin III can be found in the Hall Under the Mountain.\
\
You have attended the celebration of Durin's Folk and should now speak to King Thorin III.","King Thorin III can be found in the Hall Under the Mountain.\
\
King Thorin III has invited you to a great celebration of Durin's Folk.","The Legacy of Durin's Folk"}},
[12528]={nameES="The Legacy of Sirgon",objectivesES={"Faltharan is located at the steps to Tol Ciryarani.\
\
You should speak with Faltharan.","Assisted Lorvegil","Assist Siriel","Talk to Faltharan","Assist Celebros","DNT - Not Used","Faltharan listens intently to what his family told you.\
\
'Hmm... I understand. I'm not that surprised by how they all feel. There is much I would love to do before departing the city, but we do not have the time for everything.\
\
'I will be attending to the preparations. If my family has any tasks for you, then I would ask that you offer your assistance.'","Assist Lorvegil","Assisted Siriel","Faltharan is concerned with how his family feels about recent events, as well as their thoughts on the location of Lord Sirgon.","Assisted Celebros","The Legacy of Sirgon","Faltharan's family is located in the market east of Tol Ciryarani.\
\
You should assist Faltharan's kin with their tasks."}},
[12529]={nameES="The Legend of Folca",objectivesES={"Meregyth stands near the Mead Hall of Beaconwatch.\
\
You should speak with Meregyth and let her know what you thought of the tale of King Folca the Hunter and his battle with the Boar of Everholt.","Meregyth stands near the Mead Hall of Beaconwatch.\
\
Meregyth has offered to tell you the story of King Folca and his battle with the Great Boar of Everholt.","Meregyth is reminded by the Boar-tribe Orcs of the story of King Folca and his battle with the Boar of Everholt.","The Legend of Folca","Talk to Meregyth"}},
[12530]={nameES="The Legend of the Tempest",objectivesES={"You and Ithurga have confirmed that the replica was likely a misdirect and the real hammer is still out there.","The giant seems to be agitated by something stuck in its eye.","Find the island of legend","Talk to Hûrlub the Bellower","The Legend of the Tempest","You have found a long path up a tall peak. The journey will be dangerous.","Climb to the top of the peak","A giant stands before you","Ithurga explained that he has deduced the final location of Marâkh, Mother of Tempests. It is in an island in northern Jeb Khâtel.","There is a long path leading up the peak"}},
[12531]={nameES="The Letter",objectivesES={"Fuirion's satchel appears to have been picked over by the bandits at the back of the encampment.","The bandit who looted Fuirion's satchel is at the back of their encampment in north-west Lamedon.\
\
You should reclaim Fuirion's goods from the bandit.","The Letter","Recover Fuirion's satchel","You have reclaimed Fuirion's letter from the bandit who looted it.\
\
You should read the letter to see if it sheds any light upon his strange situation.","You have reclaimed Fuirion's possessions from the bandits, and should now take extra care that the letter does not fall into the wrong hands.","You have found the letter at which the brigand has been so rudely laughing","Fuirion's satchel appears to have been picked over by the bandits at the back of the encampment.\
\
The men who stand here laugh heartily at some joke, hardly noticing your approach.","Read Fuirion's letter to try to understand his predicament","The bandits who have looted Fuirion's satchel are gathered at the back of their encampment in north-west Lamedon.\
\
You should reclaim Fuirion's goods from the bandits.","Fuirion had good reason to wish to recover this, for it could create a great deal of tension within his family if discovered before he leaves Lamedon","Reclaim Fuirion's belongings from the bandits","Fuirion's letter sheds a great deal of light on his predicament.","Completado"}},
[12532]={nameES="The Lhingris Threat",objectivesES={"Talk to Ingold","You find nothing to report to Ingold here","You have fled the battle!","All is quiet here","The Lhingris Threat","Ingold can be found at the Ruins of Díngarth in Dor Amarth.\
\
You should speak with Ingold.","You should defeat the incoming spider swarm!","<rgb=#FF0000>Do not flee from where you stand</rgb>","Scout the location for spiders","You have successfully defeated the spider swarm","Scouting locations are along the base of the Morgai in Dor Amarth.\
\
You should scout the location.","Ingold has been getting reports that bands of spiders are crossing the Morgai from Lhingris into Dor Amarth. He asks you to patrol the border.","Stand your ground and defeat the spider swarm","You see a swarm of spiders approaching from the Morgai!"}},
[12533]={nameES="La Biblioteca de Acero",objectivesES={"Mundgeirr te ha dicho que la calidad que deseas otorgar a tu arma solo puede realizarse en la forja dentro de la Biblioteca de Acero.","Lleva una adamantita infundida a Mundgeirr","La Biblioteca de Acero","Mundgeirr se encuentra en el campamento del Mirador de la Gran Excavación, en Moria.\
\
Debes regresar a Mundgeirr para completar la mejora de tu arma.","Mundgeirr te ha pedido que le traigas una adamantita infundida, con el cual podrá ayudarte a otorgar una calidad a tu arma. Desafortunadamente, no sabe dónde encontrar tal piedra.","Habla con Mundgeirr para viajar a la Biblioteca de Acero","Lleva la adamantita potenciada a Mundgeirr","Mundgeirr se encuentra en el campamento del Mirador de la Gran Excavación, en Moria.\
\
Mundgeirr te ha pedido que busques la Biblioteca de Acero, pero te advierte que una banda de orcos de fuego provenientes de las profundidades de Moria han tomado el control de la biblioteca."}},
