[12539]={nameES="The Lieutenants of Gorgar",objectivesES={"Lieutenant Gádhmal has been defeated!","Talk to Órug at Drenghól","Defeat Lieutenant Ogarbuk","The Lieutenants of Gorgar","Defeat Lieutenant Gádhmal","Lieutenant Ogarbuk has been defeated!","In an effort to overcome the dwarves of the Gabil'akkâ, Gorgar has sent three of his mightiest lieutenants to oversee his forces at Bagûd-mekhem.","Lieutenants Ogarbuk, Bauzmát, and Gádhmal can be found at Bagûd-mekhem.\
\
After learning of their arrival at Bagûd-mekhem, Órug has asked you to defeat the lieutenants of Gorgar.","Defeat Lieutenant Bauzmát","Órug can be found at Drenghól in the War of Three Peaks.\
\
You have defeated lieutenants Ogarbuk, Bauzmát, and Gádhmal at Bagûd-mekhem. You should report to Órug.","Lieutenant Bauzmát has been defeated!"}},
[12540]={nameES="La Vida de un Guardia",objectivesES={"Lleva las ramas adecuadas a Merion en la puerta este de Musgovilla.","Puedes encontrar ramas adecuadas para reparar las defensas del pueblo al noroeste de Musgovilla, en la base de los árboles.","La Vida de un Guardia","Merion, uno de los guardias del pueblo de Musgovilla, intenta ayudar a reparar las defensas de la aldea tras la incursión Uruk.","Merion está esperando junto a la puerta este de Musgovilla."}},
[12541]={nameES="The Light Outside Starkhaven",objectivesES={"Find Isamó somewhere near the chimneys on the western side of Starkhaven","Engéru asked you to find his wife Isamó somewhere among the chimneys on the western side of Starkhaven and to give her his message.","Examine the banner outside Starkhaven","The woman watches you silently, but when you give her Engéru's message she cries out.\
\
'We must return and save him from the soldiers! He will not try to fight them, but you can!'\
\
You shake your head and tell Isamó that it was her husband's only wish that she escape Starkhaven, and that she is to carry out the plan they devised. There will be little time before the soldiers find her, unless she leaves now.\
\
'I cannot do this by myself,' she says, and you cannot tell if she refers to the escape plan or to the unknown days ahead, without Engéru.","Standing outside the entrance to Starkhaven, your eye is drawn by the great light-house to the east.","Isamó stands in an alley between buildings on the western side of Starkhaven.","<rgb=#00FF00>Look</rgb> to the south at the ships under construction","The south-eastern side of the light-house will give you a better view of the ship-yard","Standing outside the entrance to Starkhaven, your eye is drawn by the great light-house across the bridge to the east. Climbing the steps in front of the light could lead to a good vantage point from which you could observe the mighty fleet and the ship-yard at which it was constructed.","Engéru gazes out over the vast fleet before speaking again.\
\
'Look for Isamó among the buildings with the chimneys to the east and south of here, friend. Please go.'","A mighty light-house stands guard outside Starkhaven, providing a good view of the surrounding lands and aiding the passage of the ships that sail at Sûg Nidar.","Your study of the ships is interrupted by the feeling that you are being watched","A man with a furtive air watches you from the shadows.","A woman in the alley between the buildings watches you carefully","From atop the steps that lead to the light-house you might obtain a good view of the ship-yard of Starkhaven.","Talk to Isamó in the alley","The Light Outside Starkhaven","The man has a furtive air as he looks you up and down.\
\
'This is not your place, stranger. I have lived here for all the years of my life, as did my father before me. I am Engéru. Mine is a family of ship-builders; we have known nothing else. But you have climbed to this height with ruin in your eye. You wish to see the Song destroyed.\
\
'No, do not deny it! I said I was a ship-builder, and that is true. But I am not a soldier. For decades we worked here in Starkhaven, and every new ship that was added to the fleet seemed a trophy for my family. I did not believe they would ever sail, but now a man of Umbar has come to Sûg Nidar, and he commands hundreds of Corsairs. The woman Nakási orders that new weapons be mounted upon the ships, weapons that breathe terrible blue fire. The Orcs have always been here, but they used to keep to themselves across the lake; now we are expected to work alongside them?\
\
'My wife Isamó and I decided to leave Starkhaven, but I am being watched. I will be pressed into service upon one of the war galleys once I descend from this light. Will you meet with my wife and tell her I cannot join her? She must carry out our plan without me. I have eyes only for Isamó; my heart goes with her, even as we must part.\
\
'See you the chimneys to the east and south of here? That is where we intended to meet. Go now and guide my wife from this place, I beg of you. I will decide how to descend from this light: swiftly, on my own terms, or slowly, pressed into service aboard the weapons I helped create. Either way, I want to know my Isamó was given a chance to escape. Thank you, my friend.'","If you walk to the south-eastern side of the light-house you will have a better place from which to <rgb=#00FF00>look</rgb> at the ship-yard.","Climb the steps leading to the light-house","Find a good vantage point on the south-eastern side of the light-house","Talk to the man with the furtive air","The woman watches you carefully."}},
[12542]={nameES="The Light and the Shadow Part 1: The Missing Chest",objectivesES={"The Light and the Shadow Part 1: The Missing Chest","Return to Khôltekh in Dâr Laja with the missing chest","Search for Khôltekh's missing chest in Deshûkh","Speak with the merchant Rathâni in the Sail-haven","Return to Khôltekh in Dâr Laja, Hall of the Kindred, with the missing chest.","Khôltekh has asked you to talk to a merchant friend of his, Rathâni in the Sail-haven, about a missing chest.","Search for Khôltekh's missing chest in Deshûkh in Dil-irmíz.","Recovered Khôltekh's chest","Khôltekh has asked you to speak with Rathâni about a missing chest. She can be found near the market by the docks in the Sail-haven."}},
[12543]={nameES="The Light and the Shadow Part 2: An Audience with the Hall-father",objectivesES={"Khôltekh has taken you into his trust, for now. He's asked you to accompany him to his house to speak more about his plans for Umbar.","Speak with Khôltekh when you are ready to go","The Light and the Shadow Part 2: An Audience with the Hall-father"}},
[12544]={nameES="The Light and the Shadow Part 3: A Flash of Gold",objectivesES={"Return to Zihârax with the ring","Zihârax has asked you to get his ring back from hoodlum in the market stands to the east.","The market cutthroats strike, attacking you!","Speak with Khôltekh's contact Zihârax in the Dûlkar, the Shadow Market in Dil-irmíz. The Dûlkar is located south-east of Mekab-kuphâr.","Speak with Khôltekh's contact Zihârax in the Dûlkar in Dil-irmíz","Find the hoodlums that took Zihârax's ring","The Light and the Shadow Part 3: A Flash of Gold","Return to Zihârax with the ring.","Speak with Nûru in Mekab-kuphâr about Sêkhta","Fight off the market cutthroats that have attacked you!","Speak with Nûru in Mekab-kuphâr in southern Khabârkhad about Sêkhta.","Khôltekh has asked you to speak with Nûru in Mekab-kuphâr in Khabârkhad. Nûru has information from an Umbar-môkh contact about Sêkhta.","Fight off the market cutthroats that have attacked you"}},
[12545]={nameES="The Light and the Shadow Part 4: Thick as Thieves",objectivesES={"Search for Amârbo in Deshûkh","The Light and the Shadow Part 4: Thick as Thieves","You should investigate Deshûkh for signs of Amârbo. Deshûkh is located north-west of the Dûlkar.","Search for Amârbo in Deshûkh, the Blood Market.","Zihârax, Khôltekh's contact, has told you an associate of Sêkhta's, Amârbo, has been seen in Deshûkh. You should investigate Deshûkh for Amârbo.","Return to Khôltekh in Dâr Laja, Hall of the Kindred, with this information.","Ask Amârbo what he knows of Sêkhta and his whereabouts.","Return to Khôltekh in Dâr Laja with this information","Ask Amârbo what he knows of Sêkhta and his whereabouts"}},
[12546]={nameES="The Light and the Shadow Part 5: A Lock with No Key",objectivesES={"The Light and the Shadow Part 5: A Lock with No Key","The lock has a series of deep, narrow grooves carved into the stone","Look for a door within Dar Sêkhta with a suspicious lock","Look for an alcove or door with an unconventional lock.","Find Dar Sêkhta in Dil-irmíz","Examine the strange lock for clues as to its key.","You have found Dar Sêkhta!","Accompany Khôltekh to his house, so he may think clearly on this key.","Khôltekh has asked you to investigate the area Amârbo told you about, where you will hopefully find Dar Sêkhta, and a clue as to Sêkhta's whereabouts.","Return to Dâr Laja with your description of the lock. Perhaps Khôltekh has a clue as to its key.","You see a nearby alcove with strange indentations in the wall","Return to Dâr Laja and tell Khôltekh your description of the lock","Speak with Khôltekh when you are ready to go","Khôltekh has asked you to look for Dar Sêkhta, and a suspicious lock there that might fit a mysterious key. According to Amârbo, it is located south of Deshûkh in Dil-irmíz.","Examine the strange lock for clues as to its key"}},
[12547]={nameES="The Light and the Shadow Part 6: A Helping Hand",objectivesES={"Go back to Dâr Sêkhta and insert the pristine wight's hand into the lock","Khôltekh has asked you to go to Sektakhâb in Khabârkhad and find a pristine wight's hand. He believes this is the key to Dâr Sêkhta that will open the way and find Sêkhta or necessary clues about him.","Khôltekh has asked you to find a pristine wight's hand in Khabârkhad. He believes that to be the key that is \\qscarce\\q but \\qquite valuable\\q that will open the way to Dâr Sêkhta's hidden area.","Return to Khôltekh in Dâr Laja with the clues you have found","Find a pristine crypt-walker's hand by defeating crypt-walkers","Enter the hidden area of Dâr Sêkhta","You hear a lock click behind the brick wall to your right, opening the way","You have found a pristine wight's hand","Enter the hidden area of Dâr Sêkhta.","Return to Khôltekh in Dâr Laja with the clues you have found.","The Light and the Shadow Part 6: A Helping Hand","Go back to Dâr Sêkhta and insert the pristine wight's hand into the lock."}},
[12548]={nameES="The Light and the Shadow Part 7: A Candle Flickers in the Dark",objectivesES={"Return to Khôltekh in Dâr Laja with the book.","Speak with Ephrâti in Tilmakhím in Tâkhdar","Return to Khôltekh in Dâr Laja with the book","Khôltekh has asked you to go find a bookseller in Tilmakhím. He believes she may have the missing volume to 'A History of Castamir and His Heirs' that you found in Dâr Sêkhta.","Speak with Khôltekh about his revelation","Find a bookseller named Ephrâti in Tilmakhím, in Tâkhdar. Khôltekh is looking for the missing volume from the set you found in Dâr Sêkhta.","Accompany Khôltekh to the Tor-gardens.","Speak with Khôltekh when you are ready to go","Speak with Khôltekh outside the Pot and Quill in the Tor-gardens about his revelation.","The Light and the Shadow Part 7: A Candle Flickers in the Dark"}},
[12549]={nameES="The Light and the Shadow Part 8: And Is Extinguished",objectivesES={}},
[12550]={nameES="La Luz de la Esperanza",objectivesES={"Uthagan está en la ciudad de Donnvail, al noreste de Fail-Á-Khro.\
\
Morven te ha dicho que hables con Uthagan, pero con precaución: su familia fue tomada recientemente por Muiráthakh, y ella no cree que hayan sido vistos desde entonces.","Morven está dentro de la ciudad de Donnvail, al noreste de Fail-Á-Khro.\
\
Garvan te dio el nombre de alguien que podría simpatizar con la causa, diciéndote que buscaras a Morven más adentro en la ciudad.","Uthagan derrotado","Búdan te envió a la ciudad de Donnvail para hablar con los Trév Gállorg que podrían levantarse contra los Angmarim.","Uthagan habló de Una, que se encuentra en algún lugar de la ciudad de Donnvail, al noreste de Fail-Á-Khro.\
\
Aunque intentó matarte, Uthagan te dio sin querer el nombre de alguien con quien podrías hablar: una mujer llamada Una.","La Luz de la Esperanza","Habla con Uthagan","Garvan está en la ciudad de Donnvail, al noreste de Fail-Á-Khro.\
\
Búdan te habló de los tres líderes enviados a Donnvail por Carn Dûm: Fûshath la Bestia, Muiráthakh la Jueza Silenciosa y Gillë Andras el Señor de las Fronteras del Oeste. También te dijo que hablaras con un hombre llamado Garvan más adentro en la ciudad de Donnvail."}},
[12551]={nameES="The Limlight Gorge",objectivesES={"Captain Agelbrit stands guard at a lonely gate-house on the upper edge of the Limlight Gorge. His duty is as much to keep unwary travellers out of the Gorge as it is to keep the beasts within from climbing out to threaten the folk of Stangard.","The Limlight Gorge","Sigelm is near the Limlight Gorge Guardhouse.\
\
Captain Agelbrit has asked you to listen to Sigelm's tales of the Limlight Gorge before you explore the dangerous valley.","Talk to Captain Agelbrit","Speak with Captain Agelbrit at the Limlight Gorge Guard-house.","Talk to Sigelm"}},
[12552]={nameES="The Limlight Mill",objectivesES={"You should find the old sawmill in the Limlight Gorge and learn if Armund and his companions are still alive.","The dwarves sent a small expedition to try and rebuild the old sawmill in Limlight Gorge.","Talk to Armund in the old sawmill","The Limlight Mill"}},
[12553]={nameES="The Line in the Sand",objectivesES={"Javish has asked you to initiate negotiations between a renegade Corsair group which poses a threat to the status quo in Mâr Naphra.\
\
The meeting location should be among the shallows to the south-east.","Javish is troubled by a group of renegade Corsairs who refuse to play nice with rules of Mâr Naphra.","Javish has no choice but to take Adranax's actions as an act of sedition. He asks that we punish the Corsairs before they can cause further chaos.\
\
Khataj Mârsa can be found south-east of Mâr Naphra.","The Corsairs at Khataj Mârsa have been punished. You should report to Javish your success.\
\
Javish can be found in Mâr Naphra.","Adranax planned to betray Javish all along. Javish should know that you had no choice but to defend yourself.\
\
Javish can be found in Mâr Naphra.","Talk to Javish","Talk to Javish in Mâr Naphra","Talk to Adranax at the agreed upon location","The Line in the Sand"}},
[12554]={nameES="The Lingering Threat (Daily)",objectivesES={}},
[12555]={nameES="The Lion's Eye",objectivesES={"Talk to Twiga at Etheburg in the Brown Lands","It is clear that the wild cats of the Brown Lands are anything but wild, and Twiga has a plan to do away with them.","The trainer of the Khundolar battle-cats may be found at Lashkarg, south-east of Etheburg in the Brown Lands.\
\
Twiga asked you to hunt down the trainer of the Khundolar battle-cats and defeat him.","The Lion's Eye","Defeated Sherkóz","Twiga is at Etheburg in the Brown Lands, north-west of Lashkarg.\
\
You should return to Twiga with tidings of your victory.","Defeat Sherkóz"}},
[12556]={nameES="The Little Bird",objectivesES={"The Roc, Raghda-gûn, has taken in a little bird of another species.","Talk to Raghda-gûn","The Little Bird","You have gathered enough insects to feed little Berkha.\
\
Return to Raghda-gûn.","Raghda-gûn asked you to gather insects to feed to her little adoptee.\
\
Insects can be found underneath little stones scattered around the Raghda-gûn's nest."}},
[12557]={nameES="The Little Lost Elf",objectivesES={}},
[12558]={nameES="The Little Things",objectivesES={"The falls of Everholt lie to the south-west of Beaconwatch.\
\
Lady Answith wants to go to the falls in Everholt and collect several stones that would be suitable for skipping.","Lady Answith, the Thane's wife, knows that he can be unpleasant, but only because he allows himself to be consumed by duty and forgets the little things in life that he enjoys.","The Little Things","Talk to Lady Answith","Lady Answith is on a porch above the vendor's area north of the Mead Hall in Beaconwatch.\
\
You have collected skipping stones at the Everholt Falls and should now bring them back to Lady Answith."}},
[12559]={nameES="The Living Deep: Black Powder",objectivesES={}},
[12560]={nameES="The Living Deep: Goblin-sappers",objectivesES={"Dernstan is at Eaworth.\
\
Dernstan will be pleased to hear you defeated several goblins within the Living Deep.","The Living Deep: Goblin-sappers","Goblins can be found in the Living Deep.","<rgb=#FF0000>Completing Aiding the Eastemnet will cancel this quest</rgb>","Talk to Dernstan","The goblins within the Living Deep are attempting to destroy the forest from below."}},
[12561]={nameES="La fauna local es mortal",objectivesES={"Habla con Águti en la Bodega Putrefacta","Águti se encuentra en la Bodega Putrefacta.\
\
Águti estará contento de escuchar que la población de sapos profundos ha sido reducida.","Los sapos profundos se pueden encontrar por todas las Obras Hidráulicas.\
\
Águti cree que cuando los sapos sean eliminados los lagartos y las arañas se comerán entre sí.","Águti ha determinado que los sapos profundos son la clave de la cadena alimenticia en las Obras Hidráulicas.","La fauna local es mortal"}},
[12562]={nameES="El libro de cuentas del leñador",objectivesES={"Libro de cuentas de Mason Espino recogido","Mason Espino está en el campamento de leñadores, al norte y este de la casa de guardia.\
\
Ted Abrojos te pidió que hablaras con Mason Espino, el capataz del campamento de leñadores de Combe. Puede que recuerde qué árbol era el Árbol de la Horca.","Mason Espino te espera en el campamento de leñadores que está al este y norte de Combe, al sur del bosque de Chet.\
\
Espino te envió a recuperar su libro de cuentas de los bandidos Montebruno acampados junto al camino. Debes devolverle el libro de inmediato.","El libro de cuentas del leñador","Lleva el libro de cuentas a Mason Espino","Recoge el libro de cuentas de Mason Espino","Ted Abrojos se angustió mucho cuando le dijiste que el Árbol de la Horca y todos los árboles que lo rodeaban habían sido talados.","Habla con Mason Espino en el campamento de leñadores de Combe"}},
[12563]={nameES="The Lone Lady",objectivesES={"Attempt to talk to the Lone Lady","Talk to Glassiel","River-stones can be found at the Crossings of Erui in eastern Upper Lebennin.\
\
You have found only a drowned Haradrim and should now search for the Lone Lady of Erui.","Glassiel can be found in Halach in south-eastern Upper Lebennin.\
\
The Lone Lady has given her waters form using pieces of ancient armour and has banished you from the Erui. You should bring these dire tidings to Glassiel.","The Lone Lady","The Lone Lady's face flushes with anger, and she does not respond to your words.","The waters of the Erui churn violently as the Lone Lady appears!","The Crossings of Erui can be found far to the north of Halach in eastern Upper Lebennin.\
\
Glassiel has asked you to search the Crossings of Erui for any sign of the mysterious Lone Lady.","This Haradrim lies drowned near a pile of river-stones as his brethren battle nearby...","Disturb the nearby pile of river-stones","Search the Crossings of Erui for sign of the Lone Lady","Distraught by many of the recent happenings in Lebennin, Glassiel hopes to call upon one of the Five Sisters for aid in these dire times.","The Lone Lady can be found at the Crossings of Erui in eastern Upper Lebennin.\
\
After disturbing a pile of river-stones, the Lone Lady has appeared in a rage. You should attempt to speak to her."}},
[12564]={nameES="The Lonely Dog",objectivesES={"Handir has given you some meat with which to feed the lonely dog.","The dog happily bites into her meal","Feed the lonely dog","The Lonely Dog","The dog watches the horizon, only sparing you a quick glance at your approach. Then she returns to her vigil.","You have found a lonely dog in East Pelargir.\
\
A nearby guard, Handir, has called out to you.","Talk to Handir","A nearby guard calls out to you","A lonely dog sits on a pier in Pelargir, always watching the horizon.","You have fed the lonely dog.\
\
You should talk to Handir."}},
[12565]={nameES="The Lonely Look-out",objectivesES={"<rgb=#FF00FF>Look</rgb> next to Coldan","A vast and foreboding edifice rises against the mountain face","You should continue up the road that winds north from western Udûn.","Righted another Gondorian banner","You should continue up the road that winds north from western Udûn, righting any other banners that you find.","The soldier Coldan has asked you to stand beside him and look up toward the looming face of Ered Lithui.","Captain Lachír's search party wandered the basin of Udûn, leaving men here and there to search in vain for some imagined treasure. After that, Lachír backtracked, leading his remaining company up the rising northward road.","The Gondorian banner stands proudly once again","Talk to the look-out","You should raise the fallen Gondorian banner that you found on the road that winds north from western Udûn.","The Lonely Look-out","A small, knocked-down Gondorian banner catches your eye - probably Captain Lachír's doing","Search the northward road","A lone look-out stands on a rocky outcropping south of the road","Raise the Gondorian banner","Continue up the road","You should talk to the look-out on the outcropping off the road that winds north from western Udûn, and learn what he knows of Captain Lachír.","Coldan the look-out stands on the outcropping off the road that winds north from western Udûn.\
\
You should talk to Coldan again, now that you looked and have seen the great edifice against the mountains.","This is the rising road that Captain Lachír took","Talk to Coldan","Continue up the road, fixing any other fallen banners you find","You should follow the road that winds north from western Udûn."}},
[12566]={nameES="El camino a Quiebra Larga",objectivesES={"El camino a Quiebra Larga","<rgb=#FF0000>Evita a los Fronteros de Lotho</rgb>","Habla con Fredegar Bolger en el agujero-almacén secreto","Le has enseñado una lección... ¿pero le servirá de algo?","Habla con el Frontero Tugo en Quiebra Larga","Enfréntate a Bill Helechal","La Guardia de Allende necesitará suministros para poner fin a los planes de Lotho.","Los suministros de la Guardia de Allende se encuentran en el agujero-almacén secreto en el bosque entre Gamwich y Quiebra Larga.\
\
Debes llevar los suministros de la Guardia de Allende a un Frontero en Quiebra Larga.","Hay un agujero-almacén secreto de la Guardia de Allende en el bosque entre Gamwich y Quiebra Larga.\
\
Debes hablar con Fredegar Bolger en el agujero-almacén.","Recupera los suministros de la Guardia de Allende del agujero-almacén secreto","Un Frontero de la Guardia de Allende se encuentra en Quiebra Larga.\
\
Debes hablar con el Frontero Tugo en Quiebra Larga.","Bill Helechal se encuentra cerca de Quiebra Larga en la Comarca Allende.\
\
Debes enfrentarte a Bill Helechal."}},
[12567]={nameES="The Long Reach of Gundabad",objectivesES={"The Long Reach of Gundabad","You have destroyed many Orkish trebuchets and ballistae at Hanksar-mokh and Kulûg-mokh.","You have destroyed many Orkish trebuchets and ballistae at Hanksar-mokh and Kulûg-mokh.\
\
In addition to aiding the Gabil'akkâ, you also provided Darfin ample opportunity to escape his predicament unscathed.","Within the twin encampments of Hanksar-mokh and Kulûg-mokh, terrible siege-engines stand ready to fire on any who would dare to approach Mount Gundabad.","Completado","Orkish trebuchets and ballistae can be found in Hanksar-mokh and Kulûg-mokh.\
\
Darfin has asked you to destroy the siege-engines deployed in Hanksar-mokh and Kulûg-mokh. You should destroy Orkish trebuchets and ballistae."}},
[12568]={nameES="The Long Road to Woodhurst",objectivesES={"Mate Isernore is along the road between Gapholt and Woodhurst.\
\
White Hand scourge should be wiped out of Mate Isernore and out of the northern Stonedeans. The mine and its resources were not theirs to take.","Westan is on the bridge leading into Gapholt.\
\
Westan saw you coming and called for your attention.","The time has come to leave Gapholt and return to Woodhurst. You will need to pass over the bridge to begin your return journey.","Cross the bridge to leave Gapholt","Westan calls for your attention","The Long Road to Woodhurst","Westan tries to get your attention as you pass by...","Herubrand is in the cellar of the farmhouse in Woodhurst.\
\
You should return to Herubrand to inform him of your success in bringing aid from Gapholt and defeating the White Hand forces in Mate Isernore.","Thane Nothmar is ready to aid Woodhurst, as he promised. He will depart for Woodhurst shortly after speaking with those who will coordinate the defence of Gapholt during his absence.","Travel to Mate Isernore","Mate Isernore is along the road between Gapholt and Woodhurst.\
\
Mate Isernore was once a mine owned by Gifemund, but was taken by the White Hand who crossed the Swiftwater River.","Talk to Herubrand"}},
[12569]={nameES="The Long Wait",objectivesES={"The Long Wait","Soldiers can be found at Adambel.\
\
You should talk with the soldiers to pass the time.","Fire pits can be found at Adambel.\
\
You should stoke the fires.","Habhûk can be found at Adambel.\
\
You should talk to Habhûk.","Habhûk does not like to remain idle for too long. The lull in battle has him on edge.","Talk to Habhûk"}},
[12570]={nameES="Los colmillos más largos",objectivesES={"Niko se encuentra en Jänis-leiri, al oeste de Leijona-kotin.\
\
Deberías regresar con Niko y comunicarle tu éxito.","Niko te ha desafiado a cazar a los kalpa-kita que acechan en Leijona-kotin, una zona boscosa al este de Jänis-leiri.","Los kalpa-kita pueden encontrarse en Leijona-kotin, al este de Jänis-leiri.\
\
Niko quiere que reduzcas el número de kalpa-kita de la zona y que, en especial, derrotes a un felino feroz llamado Pitkä-hammas.","Los colmillos más largos","Pitkä-hammas derrotado","Habla con Niko","Derrota a Pitkä-hammas"}},
[12571]={nameES="The Looming Strife",objectivesES={"The Looming Strife","Porókho would like to speak with you privately. Porókho is in Hêbatokh, the clan Morutágya camp in Ilmabiri, beneath the Sail-haven of Umbar Baharbêl.","Talk to Belondor in Dâr Laja","After helping the grateful Morutágya clan with their requests, you feel that you have been dismissed. You should return to Belondor in Dâr Laja, the Meeting Hall and tell him what you learned.","Your work in the southern part of Ilmabiri, the sewers beneath the Sail-haven of Umbar Baharbêl, appears to be complete.","Talk to Porókho","Porókho pulls you aside and speaks to you quietly.\
\
'I want to thank you for humouring us with these tasks. Even Gajóta,' he says with a warm chuckle. 'We really should get him a cat. Unfortunately, dark times lie ahead for us Morutágya. Tumúldo was our leader by right of birth, but he was also a great hero to our people and was well-loved. We would have readily followed Nakási, but she seems to have abandoned us for that khmêg Azagath.\
\
You can see on his face that Nakási's flight weighs heavy upon his heart.\
\
'They have a child, Umisúm, who would now be our leader by right of birth, but she will not go unchallenged. She is in her teen years and has yet to prove herself to our people. I hope for her sake that she is as cunning as her father and as fierce as her mother or she may not make it to adulthood. You know how families are.\
\
'I wanted to thank you for bringing us the letter from that ugly Gondorian. It is better to know than to be left wondering. There are difficult times ahead for all Morutágya, but we have survived worse. Now go. Leave these sewers and visit the baths. You stink.'\
\
He waves you off and you are clearly being dismissed."}},
[12572]={nameES="The Lord of Moria",objectivesES={"Talk to King Thráin at Muru Azog","Talk to Dáin at Muru Azog","Dáin can be found just outside Muru Azog at Azanulbizar.\
\
Azog has been slain at last, but victory was won at great cost. You should talk to Dáin.","King Thráin can be found just outside Muru Azog at Azanulbizar.\
\
Azog has been slain at last, but Dáin has fallen silent. You should talk to King Thráin.","The Lord of Moria","Talk to Dáin","After the horn-call of Grór sounded, Náin and the Dwarves of the Iron Hills charged forth to challenge Azog and put an end to the battle.","Dáin says nothing, his face still pale and etched with unease.","Dáin can be found at Durin's Stone.\
\
After overcoming Azog's forces at Durin's Stone, Náin Orcsfoe and the Iron-folk prepare to again make for the gates of Moria. You should talk to Dáin."}},
[12573]={nameES="El Señor de los Pinos",objectivesES={"El Señor de los Pinos","Followers of the Brotherhood of the Pinioned can be found throughout Osgiliath, and often wander far from their Easterling brethren.\
\
You recall Echil's mentioning of a \\qLord of Pinions\\q among the Easterlings who now form a brotherhood under him. You should seek out and defeat his followers to learn more of his whereabouts.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: You must defeat all five groups of Easterling followers to unlock the optional Lord of Pinions encounter.</rgb>","The Lord of Pinions can be found in the north-eastern corner of Osgiliath.\
\
You have weakened the Brotherhood of the Pinioned, and should now confront the Lord of Pinions in Osgiliath.","Reuniendo un pequeño pero ferozmente leal grupo de seguidores entre las fuerzas de los Orientales gracias a su inexplicable afinidad con los crebain, un hombre extraño ha llegado a Osgiliath y busca desatar sus talentos contra aquellos que lo negarían.","Defeat the Lord of Pinions"}},
[12574]={nameES="El señor de Porth Cadlus",objectivesES={"Habla con Glavroleth en Echad Dúnnan","Gâmzhurm derrotado","El uruk Gâmzhurm se encuentra al sur y ligeramente al oeste de Echad Dúnann, al otro lado del Nan Sirannon.\
\
Debes usar el cuerno de desafío para invocar a Gâmzhurm, el líder de los dunlendinos, y derrotarle.","Glavroleth está en Echad Dúnann, al norte y ligeramente al este de Porth Cadlus.\
\
Deberías volver a ver a Glavroleth con las noticias de la muerte de Gâmzhurm.","Los dunlendinos siguen en Eregion a pesar de su derrota, lo que indica la presencia de un poderoso líder.","El señor de Porth Cadlus","Utiliza el cuerno de desafío para invocar a Gâmzhurm y derrótale"}},
[12575]={nameES="El señor de las Marcas Occidentales",objectivesES={"Soltakh está en Fail-á-Khro, al norte de Aughaire y al sur de Dún Covád.\
\
Has derrotado a Gillë Andras, el Señor de las Marcas Occidentales, y ahora deberías llevar la noticia de tu triunfo a Soltakh.","Gillë Andras, el Señor de las Marcas Occidentales, se encuentra en la ciudad de Dún Covád, en las colinas occidentales al norte de Fail-á-Khro.\
\
Soltakh te ha pedido a ti y a tus aliados que derrotes a Gillë Andras, el Señor de las Marcas Occidentales.","El señor de las Marcas Occidentales"}},
[12576]={nameES="The Lord's Edict",objectivesES={"Talk to Malthellam in Morlad","Darkened by the absence of those lost in the War of the Ring, the Blackroot Vale has become a grim and mournful place, but hope remains that this new peace portends a better future under the rule of King Elessar.","Malthellam can be found outside his home in Morlad in the Blackroot Vale.\
\
You have been told to travel to Morlad to seek an audience with the Steward of the Vale, Malthellam, and gain the Lord's permission to remain in the Blackroot Vale.","The Lord's Edict"}},
[12577]={nameES="The Lost Croft",objectivesES={"The Lost Croft","The Orcs can be found at the southernmost croft of Garsfeld, south-west of the town.\
\
Gísil wants you to take back the southernmost croft of Garsfeld.","Talk to Gísil","Gísil can be found inside the Mead Hall of Garsfeld.\
\
You should return to Gísil with news of your success.","Gísil fears that the Orcs have already sacked the southernmost croft completely, but wants to try to gather any stragglers before the long journey south."}},
[12578]={nameES="Los Enanos Perdidos",objectivesES={"Hay muchos enanos dentro de Gabilshathûr.\
\
Has descubierto el asentamiento oculto de los enanos en Angmar, Gabilshathûr. Deberías hablar con alguien dentro del asentamiento y transmitir el mensaje de Torcuil.","Habla con el líder de Gabilshathûr.","El asentamiento enano está al este de Rammas Deluon y al sur de Duvuinen.\
\
El mercader Torcuil te pidió que busques a los enanos perdidos y obtengas su alianza.","Encuentra el asentamiento oculto de los enano","Los Enanos Perdidos","Torcuil agradeció la ayuda que has brindado a su gente y te contó que necesitan aliados adicionales si quieren sobrevivir bajo el duro dominio de Angmar. Te habló de una historia que ha escuchado sobre enanos que viven bajo la sombra de Angmar, y se pregunta si podrían convertirse en aliados en el futuro."}},
[12579]={nameES="Los Enanos Perdidos",objectivesES={"Búdan te ha dicho que hay otras personas que podrían necesitar tu ayuda en Angmar. Se habla de una enclave oculta de los enanos al este de Rammas Deluon. Si la leyenda es cierta, los enanos se han escondido bien, pero Búdan teme que Angmar no tarde mucho en descubrirlos.","El líder de los enanos se encuentra en Gabilshathûr.\
\
Has descubierto Gabilshathûr, el enclave secreto de los enanos en Angmar. Busca al líder de los enanos e intenta hablar con él.","Habla con el líder de Gabilshathûr.","Encuentra el asentamiento oculto de los enanos","Los Enanos Perdidos","El enclave de los enanos se encuentra al este de Rammas Deluon y al sur de Duvuinen.\
\
Búdan te habló de un enclave oculto de los enanos en Angmar y sugiere que los enanos podrían necesitar tu ayuda."}},
[12580]={nameES="Los exploradores perdidos",objectivesES={"A small party of explorers set off for Dannenglor and have not yet returned, and Fernachar is anxious for word of their fate.","Talk to Fernachar at the Haunted Inn","Los exploradores perdidos","Dannenglor is to the north of the Haunted Inn.\
\
Fernachar has asked you to search the ruins of Dannenglor for signs of the Elf-scouts who went that way. You should approach Dannenglor cautiously, following the road where the Elf explorers went.","Search near Dannenglor for the Malledhrim scouts","This blade surely belonged to an Elf, but it lies near a great stain of blood","Fernachar awaits you in the Haunted Inn in the Dourstocks, south of Dannenglor.\
\
You should speak with Fernachar and tell him of the worrying scene you beheld when you approached Dannenglor."}},
[12581]={nameES="La comunidad perdida",objectivesES={"La comunidad perdida","Forochel se encuentra al norte de Evendim, a través de Cirith Rhiw, al norte de Tyrn Fornech. Deberías comenzar tu búsqueda en el pueblo de Kauppa-kohta.\
\
Helegdir te ha pedido que busques a un miembro de una comunidad de aventureros que se dirigió al Forochel, pasando por Aughaire, en Angmar.","Habla con Cenlieg","Helegdir te ha pedido que le ayudes a velar por la seguridad de un grupo de individuos conocidos como la Comunidad Perdida."}},
[12582]={nameES="The Lost Harbour",objectivesES={"Gilanor of Ost Lontir seeks to assault the Corsair forces stationed at Edhellond, and has sent his scout, Dolvir, to learn more of their plots.","DNT -- will not be seen","Dolvir can be found on a hilltop to the east of Edhellond.\
\
Gilanor has asked you to seek Dolvir outside Edhellond in hopes you can weaken the Corsairs' hold on the coast.","Talk to Dolvir","The Lost Harbour"}},
[12583]={nameES="The Lost Hunter",objectivesES={"Find Umfrë in the Mournshaws","You have rescued Umfrë","Talk to Umfrë at Echad Daervunn","The Lost Hunter","Daervunn has befriended a Dunlending hunter by the name of Umfrë on the fringes of the Mournshaws after the hunter rescued him from a pack of vicious hounds. However, Umfrë has recently disappeared into the Mournshaws after giving chase to one of the hounds, and Daervunn is concerned that he may be in some danger...or even dead.","Umfrë is lost somewhere in the Mournshaws.\
\
Daervunn asked you to find Umfrë the hunter, who disappeared into the forest, hunting for a Cun Annun that had been terrorizing his village.","Umfrë is at Echad Daervunn in the Mournshaws.\
\
You should return to Daervunn's camp and speak with Umfrë."}},
[12584]={nameES="The Lost Keepsake",objectivesES={}},
[12585]={nameES="El mapa perdido",objectivesES={"El Capataz Nyrad puede encontrarse en el campamento duramano al norte de Othrikar. Regin está en Othrikar.\
\
Regin cree que Nyrad, el capataz anterior, robó el mapa, pero dejó los registros, ya que no podía leer las runas. Regin ha sugerido que podrías encontrar el mapa en la tienda del Capataz Nyrad o en el propio Nyrad.","Has encontrado el mapa robado por el Capataz Nyrad.","Las runas en los antiguos registros mineros hacen referencia a un mapa que parece estar perdido.","El mapa perdido","Devuelve el mapa a Regin."}},
[12586]={nameES="The Lost Message",objectivesES={"Cabed has asked you to find something very important to him that he hid near Ost Celebrant during the Battle of the Field of Celebrant.","Cabed is atop a small hill along the southern road of Parth Celebrant.\
\
You should bring the red-tipped arrowhead to Cabed.","Cabed has sent you in search of a trinket he once carried. The trinket is located somewhere outside Ost Celebrant.","Find Cabed's lost trinket","The Lost Message","Talk to Cabed","You have found the rotting remains of a red-tipped arrow"}},
[12587]={nameES="The Lost Pages",objectivesES={"Find the lost pages of the tome","King Thorin III thinks the lost pages of the tome may point the way to the Secret Stone.\
\
Perhaps one of the pages is inside Erebor.","Completado.","The missing pages of the tome have given you many clues to follow, but this is not the end of your adventure. The Secret Stone awaits!","King Thorin III thinks the lost pages of the tome may point the way to the Secret Stone.\
\
You should follow the clues of the rune scraps.","The Lost Pages","Completado","King Thorin III has asked you to try to locate an ancient relic known as the Secret Stone. But what dangers did the poem warn about? Can you solve this mystery on your own?\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>This difficult treasure hunt will require community teamwork and resources outside of the game itself. Good luck! </rgb>"}},
[12588]={nameES="The Lost Pendant",objectivesES={"Talk to Náin the Slakeless","Deep in the Howling Pit, you found a strange artifact.","The Lost Pendant","Give Ashmâr-abân to Náin the Slakeless","The pendant you found in the Howling Pit has been revealed to be a lost artifact of Durin's Folk.\
\
You should give Ashmâr-abân to Náin the Slakeless.","Náin takes the pendant from you, holds it close to his heart, and murmurs something in Khuzdul you can't quite hear. The pendant begins to glow with a soft light. At the same time you notice that the pendant also emits a low tone, a soft humming sound. Náin hands it back to you.","The pendant gently thrums in your hand. Some ancient magic has awoken within it.\
\
'Ashmâr-abân has awoken once more. It belongs to you now. May it be a guiding light in the darkness.'","Ashmâr-abân has been transformed!\
\
You should talk to Náin the Slakeless."}},
[12589]={nameES="The Lost Scout",objectivesES={"The Rohirrim must surely be nearby. You should try to find this Man, and see if he has strength enough to return to Walstow.","Winsig will be most interested to learn of this man's assault against you. \
\
Winsig can be found in the mead-hall of Walstow.","The Rohirrim snaps out of his stupor and looks deeply perplexed","Talk to Aldstan","You have happened upon more of the missing Rohirrim's belongings. If he can be found, Winsig would surely like to know of his findings at the East Wall.","Talk to Winsig","You have found more of the Rohirrim's trappings. You should seek out the Rohirrim nearby, and see if he has survived the Orc attacks.","The Lost Scout"}},
[12590]={nameES="The Lost Spear",objectivesES={"You relay the information to Coldan.\
\
'I cannot believe these words! To think this relic and pride of Elves has been recovered. I know what I must do then. I shall depart at once and inform those in Lothlórien of this news.'","Talk to Hithgol","Hithgol can be found at the Ruins of Díngarth.\
\
You should speak with Hithgol.","Hithgol is convinced the spear you found is indeed the mythical Aiglos.","Habla con Legolas.","The Lost Spear","Talk to Coldan","Coldan can be found at the Udûn Foothold. Legolas can be found at the Ruins of Díngarth.\
\
You should talk to Coldan and Legolas."}},
[12591]={nameES="La estatua perdida",objectivesES={"Coloca la estatua de Elendil en el pedestal","La estatua perdida","Hay un pedestal en las islas de Tyl Ruinen, en el medio del lago Nenuial, donde la estatua de Elendil que portas una vez se alzó. Tyl Ruinen está cruzando el lago desde la isla de Tinnudir.\
\
Mientras viajabas para reunirte con Gwindeth, Robin Sotopardo se ha encargado de reconstruir la estatua rota que recuperaste de los saqueadores en Tyrn Fornech. Esta es la estatua que una vez se alzó en Tyl Ruinen.","Robin Sotopardo te ha dado la estatua de Elendil que ha reconstruido a partir de los fragmentos que le trajiste cuando estuviste en Ost Forod."}},
[12592]={nameES="La Herramienta Perdida",objectivesES={"Encuentra el pico perdido de Flosi","La cueva está al sudeste del Mansión de Thorin, en las Cumbres Invernales.\
\
Convencido de que estaba cerca de una veta de oro antes de ser expulsado de la cueva, Flosi te pidió que recuperes su pico y que, además, elimines a algunos de los Rascacuevas de la cueva","Flosi está en las escaleras frente a la puerta principal del Mansión de Thorin.\
\
Debes devolverle el pico a Flosi y hacerle saber al viejo minero que ya debería ser seguro regresar a la cueva.","Flosi, un enano minero anciano, perdió su pico mientras excavaba en una vieja cueva infestada de Rascacuevas.","Has encontrado el pico de Flosi","La Herramienta Perdida","Devuelve el pico a Flosi"}},
[12593]={nameES="The Lost Towers",objectivesES={}},
[12594]={nameES="Los tesoros perdidos de Haudh Erthaid",objectivesES={"Recoge un artefacto antiguo del Ángulo","Narnien se encuentra en Gaerond, en la parte norte del Ángulo.\
\
Deberías llevarle los artefactos antiguos a Narnien.","El Ángulo ha sido escenario de innumerables batallas a lo largo de los años. ¿Qué tesoros perdidos yacen bajo la tierra de Haudh Erthaid, la Tumba de los Reinos?","Recoge un artefacto antiguo.","Vuelve con Narnien","Este es un buen lugar para buscar artefactos antiguos","Se pueden encontrar artefactos antiguos en Ost Waeren y Tham Lumren.\
\
La elfa Narnien te había pedido que buscaras artefactos antiguos.","Los tesoros perdidos de Haudh Erthaid"}},
[12595]={nameES="The Lost of the Balewood",objectivesES={"Bruises and wide wounds mark this refugee. This must be the work of Wood-trolls...","Talk to Léodwald","This refugee met his end at the hands of Orcs...","This refugee of Byre Tor succumbed to the cold...","The Lost of the Balewood","Refugees from Byre Tor have taken shelter in a cave within the Balewood, but not all came there safely.","You have found a refugee of Byre Tor","Léodwald has asked you to seek out other refugees that fled into the Balewood and help them find the cave.","The cave can be found to the east of the Orc roadway through the Balewood.\
\
You have found the six refugees of which Léodwald spoke. You should return to the cave and inform him of those that fell in the wilds."}},
[12596]={nameES="The Lumber Mill: Enhancements I",objectivesES={"There is much work to do to rebuild the town of Hytbold.","The Lumber Mill: Enhancements I","Bring the Tokens of Hytbold to Oseg"}},
[12597]={nameES="The Lumber Mill: Enhancements II",objectivesES={"The Lumber Mill: Enhancements II","There is much work to do to rebuild the town of Hytbold.","Bring the Tokens of Hytbold to Oseg"}},
[12598]={nameES="The Lumber Mill: Enhancements III",objectivesES={"The Lumber Mill: Enhancements III","There is much work to do to rebuild the town of Hytbold.","Bring the Tokens of Hytbold to Hereswith"}},
[12599]={nameES="The Lumber Mill: Enhancements IV",objectivesES={"Bring the Tokens of Hytbold to Warin","There is much work to do to rebuild the town of Hytbold.","The Lumber Mill: Enhancements IV"}},
[12600]={nameES="The Lumber Mill: Enhancements V",objectivesES={"There is much work to do to rebuild the town of Hytbold.","Bring the Tokens of Hytbold to Fréamar","The Lumber Mill: Enhancements V"}},
[12601]={nameES="The Lumber Mill: Inhabitants I",objectivesES={}},
[12602]={nameES="The Lumber Mill: Inhabitants II",objectivesES={}},
[12603]={nameES="The Lumber Mill: Rebuild",objectivesES={}},
[12604]={nameES="The Lumber Mill: Superior Workbench",objectivesES={}},
[12605]={nameES="The Mad Dwarf",objectivesES={"You have found a mad dwarf in Thorin's Hall that may somehow be related to the Secret Stone.\
\
He asked you to find something in Nud-melek, inside Moria.","The Nauthlandir flower can possibly be found somewhere in Fangorn Forest.\
\
You should find the Nauthlandir flower.","Talk to Orring","Galathril resides within Lothlórien.\
\
You should talk to Galathril.","Orring can be found in Thorin's Hall.\
\
You should bring the medicine to Orring.","Talk to Galathril","Find the Nauthlandir","King Thorin III has asked you to try to locate an ancient relic known as the Secret Stone. But what dangers did the poem warn about? Can you solve this mystery on your own?\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>This difficult treasure hunt will require community teamwork and resources outside of the game itself. Good luck! </rgb>","Find someone who knows something about the flower sketch","Find a clue in Nud-Melek","The Mad Dwarf","You gently dig up the Nauthlandir flower","Inside Moria, you found an old sketch of a flower.\
\
You should find someone who knows something about this flower.","You have found a very old dwarf, sitting in the dark by himself. His eyes are glazed over, and he rambles to himself.\
\
'The Stone.... The Stone! Where did I?.... Who's there?!'\
\
You manage to calm him down, but he is no less incoherent in his ramblings.\
\
'Nud-melek.... Find it in Nud-melek!'\
\
He slumps down and becomes unresponsive."}},
[12606]={nameES="The Madman's Journal",objectivesES={"Bring the journal to Málur Keenword","The foul and fell scribblings of a madman may be the key to stopping the further spread of the corrupted crystals.","Talk to Rúni","The Madman's Journal","Málur Keenword is in Bazanmanar.\
\
Lore-master Rúni has directed you to speak with Málur about the journal.","Rúni is in Bazanmanar.\
\
Mother Amma has asked you to speak to Lore-master Rúni."}},
[12607]={nameES="La historia del loco",objectivesES={"La ira del guardián de la tumba ha sido apaciguada","Le preguntas a Colbert el Loco qué ocurrió aquí después de que intentara saquear las tumbas de Amon Amrûn.\
\
'Dos entraron y uno salió. Pero yo nunca salí, no realmente. Las sombras que se agitaron cuando tomamos el botín ahora se agitan en mi mente, siempre.\
\
'Nunca podré dejar Amon Amrûn. Como las sombras. Pronto no seré más que un fantasma errante, igual que ellas.'","Dile a Colbert el Loco que las sombras agitadas han vuelto a descansar","Has descubierto un cofre robado que seguramente enfureció a las sombras, y nada menos que el hermano de Colbert... muerto","Colbert te espera en su mirador al sur de Amon Amrûn.\
\
Deberías hablar con Colbert.","Encuentra el cofre de la herencia y devuélvelo a su tumba","La historia del loco","Amon Amrûn se encuentra en los Campos orientales de Fornost en las Quebradas del Norte.\
\
Deberías buscar en Amon Amrûn signos de lo que ocurrió para hacer que Colbert enloqueciera.","Colbert el Loco te ha seguido hasta Amon Amrûn, donde algo le hizo perder la razón tras despertar a las furiosas sombras de su tumba al intentar saquearla."}},
[12608]={nameES="The Madness Spreads",objectivesES={}},
[12609]={nameES="The Madness at Damudûr",objectivesES={"Arshûk is at Khanâg Gur.","Glorfindel asked you to approach Damudûr and <rgb=#00FF00>look</rgb> for some sign of the Thardúth.","Emotion wars upon Arshûk's face as he wrestles with his fear","Ulishár is at Khanâg Gur.","Retrieved fancy Ordâkhai blade from the camp of Kôth Rau","Glorfindel is at Khanâg Gur.","The Ordâkhai have established the camp of Kôth Rau outside Damudûr","Glorfindel catches your eye","The Madness at Damudûr","Arshûk takes a deep breath and gathers his courage","Arshûk stares at you with wild, terrified eyes","Climb the path south of Khanâg Gur toward Damudûr","Arshûk gathers his courage.","Retrieve a fancy Ordâkhai blade from the camp of Kôth Rau","Talk to Arshûk at Khanâg Gur","Bring the fancy Ordâkhai blade to Arshûk at Khanâg Gur","Glorfindel suggested you meet at Khanâg Gur north of Damudûr.","Meet up with Glorfindel at Khanâg Gur","Glorfindel suspects that Damudûr may have hidden the entrance to a lost vault of the Thardúth.","<rgb=#00FF00>Look</rgb> towards the Ordâkhai camp outside Damudûr","Glorfindel believes that if you retrieve a fancy Ordâkhai blade from Kôth Rau, you will convince Arshûk to tell you what he saw.","Talk to Ulishár at Khanâg Gur","Glorfindel calls you over to him","Talk to Glorfindel at Khanâg Gur","Wait for Arshûk to gather his courage","Ulishár is at Khanâg Gur, waiting to speak with you."}},
[12610]={nameES="The Madness of Thraknûl",objectivesES={}},
[12611]={nameES="The Madness of Vanyalos",objectivesES={"Lady Vanyalos has returned to her hall in Imloth Melui.","Merenir is waiting by the centre fountain in Imloth Melui to speak with you in order to arrange the rescue of Lady Vanyalos.","Seemingly disturbed, Lady Vanyalos has left Imloth Melui, speaking strangely of dreams and visions to any she passed.","Talk to Merenir by the centre fountain in Imloth Melui","The Madness of Vanyalos","Talk to Lady Vanyalos in her hall"}},
[12612]={nameES="La Majestuosidad del Solsticio de Verano",objectivesES={"A medida que se acerca el día del solsticio de verano, los pueblos de la Tierra Media se reúnen para celebrar el gran Festival del Solsticio. ¡Disfruta del baile, la alegría y el amor con tu familia y amigos durante tres días!","A medida que se acerca el día del solsticio de verano, los pueblos de la Tierra Media se reúnen para celebrar el gran Festival del Solsticio. ¡Disfruta del baile, la alegría y el amor con tu familia y amigos por tres días más!","La Majestuosidad del Solsticio de Verano","Habla con Faeleth en Minas Tirith (Solsticio de Verano)","Completa 'Una Afición por las Festividades (Avanzado)'","Completa 'Una Afición por las Festividades (Intermedio)'","Habla con el capitán Khâtaphos en Isla Remota, en las Islas Escudo","Has participado en innumerables celebraciones del Solsticio de Verano y has difundido un gran espíritu festivo.\
\
Deberías regresar con Faeleth en Minas Tirith (Solsticio de Verano) o con el capitán Khâtaphos en Isla Remota.","Completa 'Una Afición por las Festividades (Final)'","Completa 'Una Afición por las Festividades (Intro)'","A medida que se acerca el día del solsticio de verano, los pueblos de la Tierra Media se reúnen para celebrar el gran Festival del Solsticio. ¡Disfruta del baile, la alegría y el amor con tu familia y amigos durante los últimos tres días!"}},
[12613]={nameES="La majestuosidad de los árboles de piedra",objectivesES={"<rgb=#FF0000>Mira</rgb> hacia el este desde un nivel inferior de Khadar-zarâm","Svanr se encuentra en las escaleras de Khadar-zarâm, en el oeste de Nud-melek.\
\
Debes volver a ver a Svanr.","Vuelve con Svanr","Un indicio de un olor desagradable te distrae de la vista hacia el sur","Los puntos de observación para contemplar la Segunda Sala se encuentran en las escaleras de Khadar-zarâm.\
\
Debes <rgb=#FF0000>mirar</rgb> los majestuosos árboles de piedra de la Segunda Sala, ya que esta es una oportunidad para contemplar algunas de las mejores obras de los enanos de la época de Durin.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión requiere emotes.</rgb>","<rgb=#FF0000>Mira</rgb> hacia el norte desde Khadar-zarâm","A través de las ramas de piedra, ves grandes y altos enanos tallados en la pared","<rgb=#FF0000>Mira</rgb> hacia el sur desde Khadar-zarâm","Svanr te ha pedido que observes los majestuosos árboles de piedra de la Segunda Sala.","La majestuosidad de los árboles de piedra","Este es un buen punto de observación","La vista es magnífica, pero (como el resto de Moria) la Segunda Sala está llena de enemigos"}},
[12614]={nameES="The Making of a Happy Donkey",objectivesES={"Groom the tired donkey","The Making of a Happy Donkey","You have watered and fed the tired donkey. Next, you should brush the dust from his coat.","Bring a bucket of water to the tired donkey","You have done everything you can think of to fulfil the donkey's needs. You should talk to his owner, Bangud, in Western Khanâg.","You have watered, fed, and groomed the tired donkey. Donkeys are social animals. Perhaps you should also talk to him and give him a compliment?","You have given the donkey some refreshing water. Next, you should find some fresh straw and give him something to eat. There is a stack of donkey feed on the north-west side of Western Khanâg.","Tell the donkey that he is very handsome","Water seems to be the donkey's most immediate need. There is a bucket of water near the north-eastern fountain in Western Khanâg.","Bangud, a traveller resting in Western Khanâg, has injured his back and is unable to tend to his tired donkey.","Bring fresh straw to the tired donkey","Talk to Bangud"}},
[12615]={nameES="La malicia de las luces",objectivesES={"Usa el brebaje para fortalecer tu determinación antes de entrar en el estanque","Nestawen ha convertido las hierbas que trajiste en una tintura que disipará los venenos malignos del estanque prohibido. Ha llegado el momento de expulsar la fuente de la enfermedad para que no pueda seguir causando daño a los viajeros desprevenidos.","El estanque contaminado se encuentra justo al sur de Estolad Mernael.\
\
Nestawen quiere que ahuyentes a las luces de pantano que habitan en el Bosque Ahogado y te ha proporcionado un brebaje que te protegerá de los efectos nefastos del agua.","Habla con Nestawen en Estolad Mernael","La malicia de las luces","Nestawen te dio un brebaje para tu inventario que te protegerá de las luces malignas que lentamente absorben la vida de todo lo que las rodea.\
\
Nestawen quiere que bebas la tintura que ha preparado para que te fortalezcas contra las luces del pantano.","Los efectos del agua no deberían interferir ahora","Nestawen se encuentra en Estolad Mernael, al norte del estanque contaminado.\
\
Vuelve con Nestawen de inmediato e infórmale de tu victoria contra las luces malignas del estanque."}},
[12616]={nameES="The Man on the Inside",objectivesES={"Gadda has a longstanding friendship with a guard at the tower near the abandoned farm.","Talk to Swithulf","The Man on the Inside","Swithulf is at the tower near the farmstead.\
\
Gadda wants you to speak with his friend Swithulf and learn what transpires at the tower."}},
[12617]={nameES="The Many Colours of Ruin",objectivesES={"The entrance to the depths of Isengard can be found through the door to the north of Orthanc.\
\
You have searched all that remains above ground in Isengard, but you should search the depths before returning to Quickbeam.","The Many Colours of Ruin","The remains of the ring of Isengard can be found surrounding Orthanc in northern Nan Curunír.\
\
You have searched the gate-house and should now search the flooded ring of Isengard for any sign of Orcs or other foes.","DNT -- Players will not see","Quickbeam grows concerned that the White Hand might yet recover from their defeat, and seeks your aid in exploring what remains of Isengard.","Search the depths of Isengard for Orcs","Slain by grievous wounds or crushed by debris, no Orcs remain here","Naught but crushed, damp tents and rubble remain outside Orthanc","Talk to Quickbeam","Search the flooded tents and wreckage for Orcs","Search the ring of Isengard for Orcs","Search the gate-house of Isengard for Orcs","The gates of Orthanc stand shut and impenetrable","The gate-house can be found inside the southern entrance of Isengard.\
\
Quickbeam wants you to search what remains of Isengard for any sign of Orcs.","Search Orthanc's doorway for Orcs","Only shredded banners line the broken road that once surrounded Orthanc","The flooding depths shelter a few wounded Orcs, but little else...","Quickbeam can be found across the river Isen outside the eastern side of Isengard.\
\
You have thoroughly searched the ruins of Isengard and found only wounded and slain foes. You should return to Quickbeam."}},
[12618]={nameES="The Many Opinions of Floodwend",objectivesES={"Etta is in the Mead Hall of Floodwend.\
\
You should speak with Etta.","This guard, like Etta, wishes to see the town well defended","This guard wishes to defend the town from attacks, as Etta counsels","Speak with Etta","Orcs cling to the forest in great numbers, but do not set foot beyond the trees' edge","The Many Opinions of Floodwend","Soldiers of Floodwend can be found guarding the three gates of the town.","The young Thane relents, and his mother appears satisfied that her counsel was taken","Speak with Etta and hear her counsel","Thane Radwig of Floodwend and his mother Etta are not in agreement about the best approach for handling the enemies surrounding their town.","Etta believes that Radwig will fail if he rides into battle","There is a tower behind the Floodwend Mead Hall that offers a view of the forest.\
\
You should climb the tower and <rgb=#FF0000>look</rgb> for something unusual.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>You must perform an emote to advance this quest.</rgb>","Etta is in the Mead Hall of Floodwend.\
\
You should speak with Etta and hear her opinion.","This is a good location to <rgb=#FF0000>look</rgb> toward the forest","Return to Thane Radwig","Radwig, Thane of Floodwend, awaits you in the Mead Hall.\
\
You should speak with Radwig and tell him of the information you gathered.","The guard seems to be of the same mind as Radwig","Climb the tower behind the Mead Hall and <rgb=#FF0000>look</rgb> to the forest"}},
[12619]={nameES="The Many Tales of Fram",objectivesES={}},
[12620]={nameES="The March of Minas Morgul",objectivesES={"The Morgul-host has constructed a crude span, allowing great beasts and siege weapons to cross!","Meldir can be found along the south-western walls of Osgiliath.\
\
You have discovered a great, crude span that can bear the weight of siege equipment now covering the ruined Great Bridge. You should return to Meldir.","The Great Bridge crosses over the Anduin in central Osgiliath.\
\
Meldir has asked you to investigate how the host of Minas Morgul is ferrying siege equipment across the once-broken bridge.","The March of Minas Morgul","Patrol the Great Bridge of Osgiliath","Concerned by the renewed advance of siege equipment across the Anduin, Meldir asks you to investigate the Great Bridge.","Talk to Meldir"}},
[12621]={nameES="The March of the Gabil'akkâ",objectivesES={"Completado","You have planted banners of Gabil'akkâ across the War of Three Peaks.","If the Gabil'akkâ are to reclaim Mount Gundabad, they must gain ground in the War of Three Peaks.","You have planted banners of the Gabil'akkâ from Zarkul-sulûn to Azgh-buzru, and in so doing, advanced the War of Three Peaks into the very shadow of Mount Gundabad.\
\
What trials remain before you?","The March of the Gabil'akkâ","Good locations for banners can be found along the path to Mount Gundabad in the War of Three Peaks.\
\
Glóin has asked you to plant banners of the Gabil'akkâ across the War of Three Peaks as you march to Mount Gundabad.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: It is recommended that you complete this quest as you adventure across the War of Three Peaks.</rgb>"}},
[12622]={nameES="The March to North Ithilien",objectivesES={"You should talk to Thurindol, who can be found in North Ithilien near the after-battle Cross-roads.","Talk to Mablung","Angbor receives word that it is time to march onward to North Ithilien.","Talk to Angbor","Seek out Thurindol in North Ithilien","The March to North Ithilien","You should talk to Mablung, who can be found in after-battle Osgiliath.","You should talk to Angbor, who can be found at the after-battle Cross-roads."}},
[12623]={nameES="The March to Osgiliath",objectivesES={"Talk to Mablung","Talk to Arodor","Search for Rangers of Ithilien within after-battle Osgiliath.","You should talk to Mablung, who can be found at the main Ranger encampment in after-battle Osgiliath.","Talk to Gladhir","The March to Osgiliath","Aragorn hopes there are still Rangers of Ithilien hidden within Osgiliath who could help guide his army on their northward march.","Talk to Mírthel","Gladhir, Mírthel, and Arodor can be found at the main Ranger encampment in after-battle Osgiliath.\
\
You should speak with the other Rangers.","Search for Rangers in Osgiliath"}},
[12624]={nameES="The March to the Cross-roads",objectivesES={"View the statue at the after-battle Cross-roads.","The March to the Cross-roads","Talk to Angbor","This is a good place to <rgb=#FF0000>look</rgb> at the statue","With Osgiliath safe for passage, Mablung sends you on to assist Angbor at the Cross-roads.","Talk to Angbor at the Cross-roads","The statue is certainly in need of repair","You should travel to the Cross-roads, which lie east of after-battle Osgiliath.","<rgb=#FF0000>Look</rgb> at Statue of the Fallen King","Travel to the Cross-roads","You should talk to Angbor, who can be found at the after-battle Cross-roads."}},
[12625]={nameES="El Guardián del Camino del Páramo Alto",objectivesES={"El Guardián del Camino del Páramo Alto","Habla con Ringhul","En estos tiempos oscuros, los guardianes del camino custodian los rutas que llevan al valle oculto de Imladris.","Ringhul está en su puesto en el Páramo Alto, muy al norte y al este de Echad Candelleth.\
\
Candelleth te pidió hablar con Ringhul, Guardián del Camino del Páramo Alto, para obtener acceso a Rivendel."}},
[12626]={nameES="El mercado de problemas",objectivesES={"Las obras de reconstrucción de Puente de Caballetes continúan.\
\
Deberías supervisar la reconstrucción de Puente de Caballetes.","Habla con el vendedor servicial","Supervisa la reconstrucción de Puente de Caballetes","El mercado de problemas","Habla con Aran Verduno","El vendedor se encuentra a las afueras de Cotfast, en el Bosque Salvaje.\
\
Deberías hablar con el vendedor.","Revisa el último puesto del mercado","El dueño de la fruta venenosa salió corriendo del pueblo en dirección al Bosque Salvaje.\
\
Deberías ir en su búsqueda e intentar alcanzarlo.","La Hermandad de los Leñadores ha accedido a ayudar a Puente de Caballetes a organizar un mercado de productos agrícolas en el centro de la ciudad.","Deberías seguirle para dar caza al vendedor que huye","En Puente de Caballetes se han instalado los puestos de los posibles vendedores.\
\
Deberías echar un vistazo a los productos de los vendedores.","En Puente de Caballetes se han instalado los puestos de los posibles vendedores.\
\
Deberías hablar con el campesino más cercano al puesto donde se encuentra la fruta en mal estado.","Aran Verduno se encuentra en Puente de Caballetes.\
\
Deberías hablar con Aran Verduno.","Enfréntate al bandido problemático","El rastro de huellas conduce al Bosque Salvaje","El bandido problemático ha sido derrotado","Encuentra y sigue el rastro de ese hombre"}},
[12627]={nameES="The Marking of the Shadow",objectivesES={}},
[12628]={nameES="The Master of Beasts",objectivesES={}},
[12629]={nameES="The Master of Kamaz-kala",objectivesES={}},
[12630]={nameES="The Master of Lake-town",objectivesES={"Something is amiss in Lake-town.\
\
You should talk to the guard at the Master's manor.","You hear a familiar whistle from somewhere nearby","Talk to Mervárth","Talk to the guard at the Master's manor","Something is amiss in Lake-town.\
\
You should make your way to the Master's manor.","Lake-town citizens are milling about in front of the manor","Make your way to the Master's manor","You have just arrived at Lake-town, but it seems something is amiss. Make your way to the Master's manor to find out what happened.","The Master of Lake-town","Mervárth can be found near the Master's manor.\
\
You should talk to Mervárth."}},
[12631]={nameES="The Master of Tûr Ágal",objectivesES={"Find some sign of Bandrauth Adder-fang in Tûr Ágal","Examine the pedestal and remain ready to confront Bandrauth Adder-fang","The dusty pedestal can be found in the highest chamber of Tûr Ágal.\
\
You have not found Bandrauth Adder-fang, but you have discovered a curious, dusty pedestal inscribed with Angmarim runes. You should examine the pedestal more closely.","You have found no sign of the sorcerer, but a dusty pedestal draws your gaze...","Bandrauth Adder-fang can be found within Tûr Ágal at Caivád Sâr.\
\
Múta has asked you to find and defeat the Angmarim sorcerer, Bandrauth Adder-fang, in Tûr Ágal. You should search the tower for any sign of him.","Although his plans remain unknown to the dwarves of the Gabil'akkâ, scouts have discovered a terrible sorcerer of the Iron Crown, Bandrauth Adder-fang, overseeing the forces at Caivád Sâr.","Múta can be found outside Caivád Sâr in northern Elderslade.\
\
You wounded Bandrauth Adder-fang, but he was able to escape from his encounter with you. You should return to Múta and inform her of what has happened.","Talk to Múta at Caivád Sâr","The Master of Tûr Ágal","With the aid of fell sorcery, Bandrauth Adder-fang flees!","A harsh shout echoes nearby as Bandrauth Adder-fang attacks!"}},
[12632]={nameES="The Master of the Roost",objectivesES={}},
[12633]={nameES="El Maestro de las Ruinas",objectivesES={"El Maestro de las Ruinas vaga por las ruinas de Nan Dhelu, al norte de Dol Vaeg.\
\
Cwendreda te ha recomendado que seas muy prudente al explorar Nan Dhelu y te ha prometido una recompensa si logras derrotar al monstruo.","Las ruinas de Nan Dhelu nunca han gustado mucho a los Eglain, pero desde la aparición de los Muertos en ellas, su preocupación va en aumento. Cwendreda, una valiente guerrera, fue enviada a investigar las ruinas; ahora, su misión recae sobre ti, mientras el terror comienza a hacerse palpable en estas salas que en otro tiempo fueron magníficas.","Habla con Cwendreda en Dol Vaeg","Derrota al Maestro de las Ruinas","El Maestro de las Ruinas","Maestro de las Ruinas derrotado","Cwendreda se encuentra en Dol Vaeg.\
\
Cwendreda espera tu regreso, estará encantada de saber que has vencido al Maestro de las Ruinas."}},
[12634]={nameES="The Master's Dilemma",objectivesES={"<rgb=#FF0000>Talk</rgb> to the crowd gathered outside the manor about Smaug's bones","A crowd of people are gathered outside of the Master's manor in Lake-town.\
\
With Dagrun's reputation improved, now would be a good time to speak to the Men of Lake-town about Smaug's bones, on behalf of the Master.","Dagrun can be found in the Master's manor in Lake-town.\
\
You should assist Dagrun with her troubles.","The Master's manor stands before you","The Master of Lake-town should hear of this. That much is true","Find the Master of Lake-town","Complete <rgb=#FF0000>'Underbelly of Deceit'</rgb>","The crowd has heard your words to leave Smaug's bones be and agrees","There is a lively debate among its residents about transporting Smaug's bones to Lake-town.","You should speak some more with Dagrun, who can be found in the Master's manor in Lake-town.","Complete <rgb=#FF0000>'A Question of Bloodline'</rgb>","You should speak with Dagrun, who can be found in the Master's manor in Lake-town.","This is a good place to speak to the crowd","Talk to Dagrun again","You should speak with Dagrun, who can be found in the Master's Manor in Lake-town.","Dagrun pauses and looks towards one of the windows","The Master's Dilemma","Talk to Stafhild","Stafhild can be found in the unruly group in Lake-town.\
\
You should hear what Stafhild has to say.","Talk to Dagrun","Complete <rgb=#FF0000>'The Master's Murder' quest arc</rgb>","You should assist the Men of Lake-town.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>The Trail of Rust quest arc will continue after completing The Master's Murder quest arc which begins with the Lake-town guard in front of the Master's manor in Lake-town.</rgb>","Find the Master of Lake-town."}},
[12635]={nameES="El Secuaz de la Mente Maestra",objectivesES={"Cada año, en primavera, tiene lugar la Búsqueda del Tesoro del Aniversario para celebrar una ocasión muy especial. Pero ¿quién o qué ha sido responsable de estos curiosos sucesos?\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión será eliminada de tu registro cuando termine el festival actual.</rgb>","Has descubierto la identidad de la mente maestra detrás de las tarjetas colgadas del Árbol de la Fiesta y ahora deberías regresar con Waldo Retumbo.","Lobelia Sacovilla-Bolsón te ha llamado, claramente con intención de decirte unas cuantas cosas.","Estuvo cerca, pero lograste recuperar el pergamino para Waldo Retumbo.","Lobelia Sacovilla-Bolsón te lanza una mirada sospechosa y desconfiada","Busca cerca de Bolsón Cerrado a la figura sospechosa","Tienes en tu poder un pergamino misterioso que podría contener una pista para descubrir la identidad del misterioso organizador que llenó el Árbol de la Fiesta con cintas y tarjetas.","Lleva el pergamino desechado a Waldo Retumbo junto al Árbol de la Fiesta","Sigue las pistas del pergamino para resolver el misterio","Has encontrado a Ebrulf Sacovilla junto a un montón de pergaminos al noroeste de Sobrecolina, en el Bosque del Fardo. ¿Es él el responsable de las travesuras que han preocupado tanto a Waldo Retumbo y al Comité de Organización de Fiestas?","Habla con Waldo Retumbo junto al Árbol de la Fiesta","Waldo Retumbo está junto al Árbol de la Fiesta, esperando encontrar alguna pista sobre la identidad de la figura sospechosa que vio.","Un pergamino como los que cuelgan del Árbol de la Fiesta ha caído junto al sendero","Waldo Retumbo vio una figura extraña merodeando cerca del Árbol de la Fiesta a primeras horas de la mañana, pero huyó colina arriba hacia Bolsón Cerrado cuando él se acercó.","Un pequeño pergamino ha caído junto al sendero cerca de Bolsón Cerrado. Parece muy similar a las tarjetas colgadas del Árbol de la Fiesta.","Habla con Lobelia Sacovilla-Bolsón","El Secuaz de la Mente Maestra","Recoge el pergamino desechado cerca de Bolsón Cerrado","Habla con Ebrulf Sacovilla"}},
[12636]={nameES="Los Maestros del Mamut",objectivesES={"Golhador te ha advertido sobre los grandes mamuts de las Montañas Nubladas, algunos de los cuales parecen haberse aliado con los gigantes.","Golhador está en el campamento del Risco Alto.\
\
Golhador espera que regreses con anillos de colmillo que puedan arrojar luz sobre la naturaleza de la alianza entre los mamuts y los gigantes de las Montañas Nubladas.","Se pueden encontrar mamuts por todas las Montañas Nubladas, pero especialmente en zonas donde caminan los gigantes.\
\
Golhador ha expresado su preocupación de que los mamuts y los gigantes hayan formado una alianza y te ha pedido que le traigas los anillos de colmillo de plata que llevan los mamuts para examinarlos.","Los Maestros del Mamut","Lleva anillos de colmillo de plata a Golhador"}},
[12637]={nameES="The Materials of War",objectivesES={"The Materials of War","Las provisiones deben ser requisadas antes de que los corsarios puedan usarlas.","Los corsarios han comenzado a transportar suministros a Dol Amroth."}},
[12638]={nameES="La matrona y el maestro",objectivesES={"El campamento de Tasgall está al norte de Aughaire y al sureste de Nád Nathair.\
\
Tasgall  y tú habéis tenido éxito en vuestra cacería de Bangrath y Murragrath. Te está esperando para hablar contigo.","El campamento de Tasgall está al norte de Aughaire y al sureste de Nád Nathair.\
\
Tasgall te está esperando para ir contigo en busca de Bangrath y Murragrath.","La matrona y el maestro","Rona está en la isla central de Aughaire, al este del trono de Crannog.\
\
Tasgall ha quedado satisfecho con la ayuda que le prestaste y quiere que le digas a su hermana Rona que pronto volverá al asentamiento.","Habla con Tasgall para viajar a Nád Nathair","Tasgall ha trazado un plan en el que él y tú atraeréis a Bangrath y Murragrath para poner fin a la amenaza que suponen."}},
[12639]={nameES="El colmillo de la matrona",objectivesES={"Derrota a la Matrona del Colmillo","Tu misión es matar arañas en Ushbarab y vencer a la Matrona del Colmillo cuando salga a defender su nido.","Al noroeste de Maurûsh las arañas se vuelven más fétidas y fuertes. Hay un llamado de la coalición en Ub Nishir para eliminar a la matrona que lidera el nido.","Has derrotado a la Matrona del Colmillo","Encuentra y derrota a la Matrona del Colmillo en Ushbarab.","El colmillo de la matrona"}},
[12640]={nameES="La cama del alcalde",objectivesES={"Habla con Rhiangar","Lleva algo de tiempo, ¡pero la cama está montada de nuevo!","Desmonta la cama","Después de algún tiempo y esfuerzo, la cama ha sido desmontada.","La dolencia del alcalde Nevit ha empeorado, lo que le obliga a pasar largas horas durmiendo sobre un duro saco de dormir.","Rhiangar te ha pedido ayuda para desmontar la cama de su padre y poder bajarla al piso de abajo.\
\
La cama del alcalde se encuentra en la casa del alcalde, en Herne.","Has desmontado la cama de la habitación de arriba de la casa del alcalde. Ahora debes volver a montarla abajo, en su despacho.\
\
El despacho del alcalde está en su casa, en Herne.","Deberías decirle a Rhiangar que has trasladado la cama de su padre a la biblioteca.\
\
Rhiangar está en la cocina de la casa del alcalde en Herne.","La cama del alcalde","Monta de nuevo la cama del alcalde"}},
