[12664]={nameES="The Meaning of Alliance",objectivesES={"The Meaning of Alliance","Tomos is at the outskirts of the Dragon-clan's encampment in western Pren Gwydh.\
\
You should speak with Tomos to travel to Galtrev.","Talk to Mari","It has become apparent to many that the White Hand alliance with the folk of Galtrev is not a fruitful one for the people of Pren Gwydh.","Accompany Tomos to establish a fair alliance between the people of Galtrev and the White Hand","Mari is in Galtrev, the main village of Pren Gwydh.\
\
You should speak with Mari in Galtrev."}},
[12665]={nameES="La pelea en la plaza",objectivesES={"Derwent Correhuela se encuentra fuera del pueblo de Altapiedra, en Annúndir, en las Quebradas del Norte.","A Brom Barbadehalcón le gusta presentarse como un Luchador duro y despreocupado, pero cuanto más trabajas con él, más te das cuenta de que su rudeza exterior es en gran parte una actuación.","Derwent Correhuela se encuentra en el pueblo de Altapiedra, en las Quebradas del Norte.","La pelea en la plaza","Habla con Brom Barbadehalcón en la Cárcel de Bree.","Derwent Correhuela se encuentra fuera del pueblo de Altapiedra, al noreste de Amon Raith, en las Quebradas del Norte.","Brom Barbadehalcón se encuentra en la Cárcel de Bree.","Habla con Derwent Correhuela fuera del pueblo de Altapiedra","Habla con Derwent Correhuela de Altapiedra"}},
[12666]={nameES="The Men That Were Taken",objectivesES={}},
[12667]={nameES="La amenaza enfrentada",objectivesES={"El campamento de Callum está en el extremo occidental del Pantano de la Rana, al oeste de Bolgovado.\
\
A la luz de las revelaciones obtenidas del diario de Callum, Wilimar Bolger te ha pedido que vayas al campamento de Callum y lo detengas antes de que lleve a cabo su venganza.","Wilimar Bolger se encuentra cerca de su agujero en el lado noroeste de Bolgovado.\
\
Cuando llegaste al campamento de Callum, lo encontraste herido. Consumido por el dolor, contó cómo había huido de su escondite cerca de la casa de Wilimar, solo para asustar a un jabalí salvaje, que lo corneó. Siente que pronto sucumbirá a sus heridas y te dijo que le hicieras saber a Wilimar que no tiene nada más que temer.","La amenaza enfrentada","Al leer el diario recompuesto, Wilimar ha descubierto que fue escrito por un Hombre llamado Callum. El antepasado de Callum fue asesinado en una gran batalla por el antepasado de Wilimar, y la familia ha llevado esa muerte como una mancha negra durante siglos. Callum ha decidido borrar la marca viniendo a la Comarca y matando a un descendiente de ese hobbit."}},
[12668]={nameES="The Merchant Gone Missing",objectivesES={"Dagarm has returned to the trader's outpost along the road west of Elthengels.\
\
You have freed Dagarm, and he has asked you to speak with him upon your return to the trader's outpost.","Guthléod can be found within the trader's outpost west of Elthengels.\
\
Ofrith has suggested asking Guthléod about Dagarm's last known whereabouts.","Talk to Guthléod about Dagarm's whereabouts","You have discovered a trader bound to a post","Talk to Dagarm at the trader's outpost","Ofrith has noticed that one of the men of the trader's outpost has been missing from camp for quite some time. Some have begun to worry that he has become lost or captured by Orcs.","Dagarm appears to have been captured by the Uruks in the camp beyond the river.\
\
Dagarm wishes to be released from his captivity within the Uruk-hai camp. You may be able to undo the ropes that bind him.","You have unbound Dagarm from the post","Search for the missing trader, Dagarm","Guthléod thinks that Dagarm travelled south-east along the stream","The Merchant Gone Missing","Free Dagarm from capture","Dagarm was last known to be heading south and east, beyond the river.\
\
Guthléod believes that Dagarm may have headed beyond the river and towards known enemy territory. He has cautioned you to be careful as you search."}},
[12669]={nameES="El mensaje",objectivesES={"Narnûlubat y Zogtark se pueden encontrar dentro de Noruidor.\
\
Tortrygg te ha pedido que encuentres y derrotes a dos de los líderes de los Ghâshfra, Narnûlubat y Zogtark.","Tortrygg está preocupado por la invasión de Norbar por los Orcos.","Derrota a Narnûlubat","Derrota a Zogtark","Tortrygg se encuentra en el campamento de los Eldgangs dentro de la Grieta de Nûrz Ghâshu.\
\
Debes regresar a Tortrygg con noticias de tu victoria contra Narnûlubat y Zogtark.","Zogtark derrotado","El mensaje","Narnûlubat derrotado"}},
[12670]={nameES="The Message Riders",objectivesES={"Return to Déorwine","Return to Déorwine in the camp in Taur Drúadan and tell him of the Warg-rider message-bearers you defeated.","Find and defeat Warg-rider message bearers in the Beacon Hills.","The Message Riders","You should defeat any Warg-rider message-bearers you find in the Beacon Hills."}},
[12671]={nameES="El golpe más poderoso",objectivesES={"Has dejado caer tu poderoso garrote de enano por el shock de la vergüenza y la derrota","Esta ronda ha terminado; no pudiste superar a tus compañeros a tiempo","Ahora deberías colocar tu garrote como una habilidad: la pelea comenzará pronto","No abandones los límites de la arena de combate","Coloca el garrote de enano en tus habilidades y espera a que comience la pelea","La arena de combate es el espacio reducido en el centro del salón, marcado por estandartes verdes. El garrote de enano está en tu inventario.\
\
Gísli Garrotefuerte te ha dado un arma excelente para defender tu premio. Debes entrar en la arena de combate mientras empuñas tu poderoso garrote de enano.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>ADVERTENCIA: Si abandonas la arena de combate después de entrar, soltarás tu garrote. El garrote no puede usarse fuera de los límites de la arena.</rgb>","Recoge la cerveza gloriosa antes de que los demás consigan la última gota","Habla con Gísli Garrotefuerte antes de que se acabe el tiempo","No entraste en la arena de combate a tiempo","No abandones la arena de combate","Se ha acabado el tiempo","El golpe más poderoso","Las personas codiciosas en la arena de combate reducida desean robar la gloriosa cerveza.\
\
¡Dale a los codiciosos que te rodean unos buenos golpes por su impertinencia! Ahora debes hacer lo que sea necesario para recoger la cerveza gloriosa para ti, pero ten cuidado: si abandonas la arena de combate por cualquier motivo, serás descalificado.","Gísli Garrotefuerte está en la arena de la Mansión de Thorin.\
\
Debes hablar con Gísli Garrotefuerte para presumir de tu excelencia en la recolección de la cerveza gloriosa.","Te han desafiado a recoger la cerveza más gloriosa de la Tierra Media, el premio de las celebraciones en la Mansión de Thorin.","Entra en la arena de combate antes de que comience la pelea. No abandones los límites","Los límites de la arena de combate se encuentran en el centro de la sala de cerveza de la Mansión de Thorin, marcados por estandartes verdes.\
\
Debes esperar a que comience el combate.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>ADVERTENCIA: Si abandonas los límites de la arena después de entrar, soltarás tu poderoso garrote de enano. El garrote de enano no puede usarse fuera de los límites de la arena.</rgb>","Has recogido la cerveza gloriosa","Has salido de la arena de combate. Puedes intentarlo de nuevo en 10 minutos, cuando comience la siguiente ronda"}},
[12672]={nameES="El golpe más poderoso (Básico)",objectivesES={"Se te ha acabado el tiempo","Esta ronda ha terminado; no pudiste superar a tus compañeros a tiempo","Ahora deberías colocar tu garrote como una habilidad: la pelea comenzará pronto","Los límites de la arena de combate se encuentran en el centro de la sala de cerveza de la Mansión de Thorin, marcados por estandartes verdes.\
\
Espera a que comience el combate.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>ADVERTENCIA: Si abandonas la arena de combate una vez comenzado el concurso, fallarás la misión.</rgb>","Coloca el garrote de enano en tus habilidades y espera a que comience la pelea","Gísli Garrotefuerte está en la arena de la Mansión de Thorin.\
\
Deberías hablar con Gísli Garrotefuerte para presumir de tu excelencia en el evento de la cerveza gloriosa.","Se te ha desafiado a participar en el concurso de la cerveza gloriosa de la Mansión de Thorin, donde los más poderosos compiten por premios y gloria.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando termine el festival actual. </rgb>","Habla con Gísli Garrotefuerte antes de que se acabe el tiempo","La arena de combate es el espacio reducido en el centro de la arena, marcado por estandartes verdes. El garrote de enano está en tu inventario.\
\
Gísli Garrotefuerte te ha dado un arma excelente para usar durante el concurso. Debes entrar en la arena de combate mientras empuñas tu poderoso garrote de enano.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>ADVERTENCIA: Si abandonas la arena de combate después de entrar, el garrote no podrá usarse fuera de sus límites.</rgb>","Entra en la arena de combate antes de que comience la pelea. No abandones los límites","El golpe más poderoso (Básico)","No entraste en la zona de combate a tiempo"}},
[12673]={nameES="El golpe más poderoso (Experto)",objectivesES={"Te han desafiado a recoger la cerveza más gloriosa de la Tierra Media, el premio de las celebraciones en la Mansión de Thorin.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando termine el festival actual. </rgb>","Se te ha acabado el tiempo","Esta ronda ha terminado; no pudiste superar a tus compañeros a tiempo","Los competidores en la arena de combate reducida desean robar la cerveza gloriosa para sí mismos.\
\
¡Dale a los codiciosos que te rodean unos buenos golpes por su impertinencia! Ahora debes hacer lo que sea necesario para recoger la cerveza gloriosa, pero ten cuidado: si abandonas la arena de combate por cualquier motivo, serás descalificado.","Ahora deberías colocar tu garrote como una habilidad: la pelea comenzará pronto","No abandones los límites de la arena de combate","Coloca el garrote de enano en tus habilidades y espera a que comience la pelea","Has dejado caer tu poderoso garrote de enano bajo el impacto de la vergüenza y la derrota","Recoge la cerveza gloriosa antes de que los demás consigan la última gota","Habla con Gísli Garrotefuerte antes de que se acabe el tiempo","No abandones la arena de combate","La arena de combate es el espacio elevado en el centro de la arena, marcado por estandartes verdes. El garrote de enano está en tu inventario.\
\
Gísli Garrotefuerte te ha dado un arma excelente para ganar tu premio. Debes entrar en la arena de combate mientras empuñas tu poderoso garrote de enano.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>ADVERTENCIA: Si abandonas la arena de combate después de entrar, soltarás tu garrote. El garrote no puede usarse fuera de los límites de la arena de combate.</rgb>","El golpe más poderoso (Experto)","Has abandonado la arena de combate. Puedes intentarlo de nuevo en 10 minutos, cuando comience la próxima ronda","Gísli Garrotefuerte está en la arena de la Mansión de Thorin.\
\
Debes hablar con Gísli Garrotefuerte para presumir de tu excelencia en la recolección de la cerveza gloriosa.","Entra en la arena de combate antes de que comience la pelea. No abandones los límites","Los límites de la arena de combate se encuentran en el centro de la sala de cerveza de la Mansión de Thorin, marcados por estandartes verdes.\
\
Debes esperar a que comience el combate.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>ADVERTENCIA: Si abandonas los límites de la arena después de entrar, soltarás tu poderoso garrote de enano. El garrote de enano no puede usarse fuera de los límites de la arena.</rgb>","No entraste en la zona de combate a tiempo"}},
[12674]={nameES="El golpe más poderoso (Intermedio)",objectivesES={"La arena de combate es el espacio reducido en el centro de la arena, marcado por estandartes verdes. El garrote de enano está en tu inventario.\
\
Gísli Garrotefuerte te ha dado un arma excelente para usar durante el concurso. Debes entrar en la arena de combate mientras empuñas tu poderoso garrote de enano.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>ADVERTENCIA: Si abandonas la arena de combate después de entrar, soltarás tu garrote. El garrote no puede usarse fuera de los límites de la arena.</rgb>","Se te ha acabado el tiempo","Gísli Garrotefuerte está en la arena de la Mansión de Thorin.\
\
Deberías hablar con Gísli Garrotefuerte para presumir de tu excelencia en la recolección de la cerveza gloriosa.","Esta ronda ha terminado; no pudiste superar a tus compañeros a tiempo","Ahora deberías colocar tu garrote como una habilidad: la pelea comenzará pronto","No abandones los límites de la arena de combate","Coloca el garrote de enano en tus habilidades y espera a que comience la pelea","Se te ha desafiado a participar en el concurso de la cerveza gloriosa de la Mansión de Thorin, donde los más poderosos compiten por premios y gloria.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando termine el festival actual. </rgb>","Has dejado caer tu poderoso garrote de enano bajo el impacto de la vergüenza y la derrota","Habla con Gísli Garrotefuerte antes de que se acabe el tiempo","No abandones la arena de combate","Has abandonado la arena de combate. Puedes intentarlo de nuevo en 10 minutos, cuando comience la próxima ronda","El golpe más poderoso (Intermedio)","Entra en la arena de combate antes de que comience la pelea. No abandones los límites","Los límites de la arena de combate se encuentran en el centro de la sala de cerveza de la Mansión de Thorin, marcados por estandartes verdes.\
\
Debes esperar a que comience el combate.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>ADVERTENCIA: Si abandonas los límites de la arena después de entrar, soltarás tu poderoso garrote de enano. El garrote de enano no puede usarse fuera de los límites de la arena.</rgb>","No entraste en la zona de combate a tiempo"}},
[12675]={nameES="Los mineros de Menem-berej",objectivesES={"Thalfar se encuentra en el campamento situado en el centro de las Vetas del Cuerno de Plata, con vistas a Menem-berej.\
\
Deberías volver con Thalfar.","A Thalfar le gustaría reparar los engranajes de Menem-berej, una plataforma situada en las Vetas del Cuerno de Plata que ha sido saqueada por los trasgos.","Los engranajes se encuentran en la plataforma de Menem-berej, en el centro de las Vetas del Cuerno de Plata.\
\
Thalfar te ha pedido que repares las ruedas dentadas de la plataforma de Menem-berej.","Los mineros de Menem-berej","Vuelve con Thalfar"}},
[12676]={nameES="Los secuaces de Muiráthakh",objectivesES={"Muiráthakh, el Juez Silencioso, comanda la lealtad de muchos guerreros enviados desde Carn Dûm. Artagan quiere que sean eliminados.","Los secuaces de Muiráthakh","Los guerreros y ballesteros de la Corona de Hierro se encuentran en el barrio más allá del arco este de los aliados de Una.\
\
Artagan quiere que socaves el dominio de Muiráthakh en Donnvail derrotando a sus sirvientes.","Artagan está en la ciudad de Donnvail, entre los aliados de Una.\
\
Has derrotado a muchos de los sirvientes de Muiráthakh y debes llevarle noticias de tu éxito a Artagan."}},
[12677]={nameES="El cocinero extraviado",objectivesES={"El cocinero extraviado","Bersi, un enano cocinero, se fue a recoger hierbas cerca de una gran guarida de arañas malvadas al noreste de Kheledûl, pero nunca regresó.","Encuentra a Bersi","Bersi probablemente esté en o cerca de la guarida de las arañas al noreste de Kheledûl.\
\
Nithi te ha pedido que busques a su amigo Bersi, que fue a recoger hierbas cerca de una guarida de arañas malvadas. Te recomendó que te dirigieras al noreste antes de llegar a Kheledûl para no arriesgarte a un encuentro con los Duramano."}},
[12678]={nameES="The Missing Beornings",objectivesES={"Thorlind can be found on the path south of Felegoth.\
\
You should talk to Thorlind.","Talk to Thorlind","The Missing Beornings","Beorning travellers and an Elf scout are missing in the forest. Thorlind, the chief hunter of Felegoth, is concerned that something troubling is afoot.","Thorlind can be found on the path south of Felegoth.\
\
You should find Thorlind.","Find Thorlind on the path south of Felegoth","Thorlind waves you over as you approach"}},
[12679]={nameES="El niño desaparecido de Herne",objectivesES={"El niño desaparecido de Herne","Habla con Gurthern","Moll afirma haber visto a Cai sonámbulo y te ha dicho que corrobores la historia con su padre.\
\
El padre de Moll, Rodric, está en la posada de Herne.","Pregunta si alguien en Herne ha visto a Cai","Una madre desesperada necesita ayuda para encontrar a su hijo perdido.","Rodric ha sugerido que le preguntes a Gurthern, el Dunlendino, si ha visto al niño desaparecido.\
\
Gurthern tiene una habitación arriba, en la posada de Herne.","Habla con Rodric","El hijo de Wenna, Cai, ha desaparecido, pero a lo mejor algún vecino le ha visto. Quiere que preguntes a la gente a ver si el niño está con ellos.\
\
Los vecinos de Wenna se encuentran en Herne."}},
[12680]={nameES="Los fragmentos perdidos",objectivesES={"El erudito Deluros está en la biblioteca de la Casa de Elrond en Rivendel.\
\
Has recuperado algunos fragmentos irregulares de reliquia. Quizá Deluros pueda usarlos para reconstruir el antiguo jarrón.","Lleva fragmentos irregulares de reliquia a Deluros","Los fragmentos perdidos","Los acechadores de nieve se encuentran cerca de la fuente del Bruinen y los ventisqueros de la zona también pueden contener los fragmentos irregulares de reliquia que busca Deluros.\
\
El erudito Deluros te ha pedido que recojas fragmentos irregulares de reliquia cerca de la fuente del Bruinen para que pueda reconstruir el jarrón que Glorenglir descartó tan fácilmente.","Los fragmentos que recuperaste de los acechadores de nieve de las Montañas Nubladas son de interés para el erudito Deluros, aunque Glorenglir no entendió su significado."}},
[12681]={nameES="The Missing Goatherd",objectivesES={"Free Ubdun","You have found the brigand camp, and saw that they are holding a prisoner. You should defeat the brigands and free their prisoner.","You have freed Ubdun from being taken prisoner by brigands. He has returned to tend his goats and asked you to talk to Zidek in Western Khanâg.","You have found some goats","Talk to Ubdun","You found the brigand camp, and they are holding a prisoner","You have defeated the brigands and freed their prisoner, Ubdun the goatherd. You should return to where you saw the goats near Jirush and talk to Ubdun.","<rgb=#00FF00>Look</rgb> for the goatherd","Look near Jirush, to the south-east of Western Khanâg, for the missing goatherd.","Near Jirush, you have found goats without a goatherd. Was he harmed by brigands, as Zidek feared? You should find the camp Zidek mentioned.","Find the missing goatherd","Find the nearby brigand camp","Zidek's partner, Ubdun, is out herding goats but should have returned by now. The butcher has asked you to ensure the goatherd is all right and thinks he may have gone in the direction of Jirush.","The Missing Goatherd","Talk to Zidek in Western Khanâg","There is nobody about","You have found goats near Jirush. You should look for the goatherd."}},
[12682]={nameES="The Missing Librarian",objectivesES={"The cover of this book reads 'To Break and to Bind,' and seems to be about setting bones and how to make splints.","You found a cave-mouth","Return to Brunil","The binding of this slim book shows signs of heavy use, and its pages are dog-eared and creased. The title is 'Midnight in the Garden,' and its contents are enough to make one's cheeks redden.","Search the hillside for caves","After speaking with a couple of merchants in Imloth Melui, Rendis's intentions have become clearer. The path she chose to tread is one of danger, however, and it's unclear whether she or the precious tomes she carried away have survived.","Search for Rendis","This appears to be a compendium of various ancient texts, and presents and overview of medicine as it was practiced in ages long past. Flipping to a random page, you pause as you read a suggestion for applying spoiled sheep's milk mixed with week-old fish guts directly to a wound.","The Missing Librarian","The binding of this ancient book is cracked and warped with age. Its title has been worn away and lost with time, but its pages are full of drawings displaying organs and other things that are possibly better left inside one's body.","While searching the hills west of Imloth Melui, you have come across a cave-mouth. You should explore the cave for any sign of Rendis or her books.","Rendis has been found and has promised to return to the city of Imloth Melui. She has asked you to inform Brunil of her whereabouts and plans.\
\
Brunil is in the Halls of Healing, in Imloth Melui.","This is 'Gondorian Herbology,' a book on remedies made from plants and herbs found across Gondor.","Atharon has suggested that Rendis may be hiding out in a nearby cave. You should search the forest west of Imloth Melui.","This slim, unassuming book is entitled, 'Poisonous Plants of Pelennor and Beyond.'"}},
[12683]={nameES="El Explorador Perdido",objectivesES={"Encuentra y defiende a Malloval","El Explorador Perdido","El halcón ha sido herido por una flecha y salta inquieto. Debe ser defendido de sus enemigos, o sin duda perecerá.","La presencia conjunta de tumularios y Corcur sugiere que los hombres de las colinas están aliados con quien sea —o lo que sea— que ha alzado a los Muertos. Uno de los hombres de las colinas podría portar un emblema o símbolo que indique a quién sirven...","Este sería un buen lugar para usar el silbato de Calenthon","Calenthon envió hace tiempo a su halcón Malloval a explorar las ruinas de Rhudaur en Nan Tornaeth, pero Malloval no ha regresado.","Las ruinas están sobre el campamento de Calenthon, al que se llega tomando el sendero hacia el norte y el este desde su campamento.\
\
Tras usar el silbato de Calenthon, oíste el grito de un halcón sobre las ruinas cerca del puente de Thoniant en Nan Tornaeth.","Localiza a Malloval","Completado","Has defendido con éxito a Malloval","Usa el silbato de Calenthon en la ladera sur","La ladera al sur de Calenthon sería un lugar ideal para soplar el silbato que te dio y llamar a Malloval.\
\
Calenthon te dio un silbato para invocar a su halcón, Malloval."}},
[12684]={nameES="The Missing Scouts",objectivesES={"Find whoever is responsible for this terrible act","The scouting party was last seen somewhere in central Elderslade.\
\
You should search for any signs of the scouting party.","The trail of blood seems to point in the direction of the ruins of Shakal-atrâd","The scouting party was last seen somewhere in central Elderslade.\
\
You should follow the trail of blood.","This does not bode well for the scouts","Examina la sangre","The Angmarim priest is performing a ritual with the recently slain!","Search for any signs of the scouting party","Shakal-atrâd can be found in central Elderslade.\
\
You should find who ever is responsible for killing the members of the scouting party.","Lóssi, a captain of the guard, is worried about a scouting party that has yet to report back to him.","Follow the trail of blood","Rásmar Blood-rue has been defeated!","It would seem the scouting party was killed and their bodies brought to Shakal-atrâd","Lóssi can be found at Annâk-khurfu.\
\
You should report back to Lóssi.","There was bloodshed here","Defeat Rásmar Blood-rue","Rásmar Blood-rue can be found in Shakal-atrâd.\
\
You should defeat Rásmar Blood-rue.","The Missing Scouts","The blood has been smeared across the old dwarf-watch","The scouting party was last seen somewhere in central Elderslade.\
\
You should examine the blood.","Report back to Lóssi at Annâk-khurfu"}},
[12685]={nameES="The Missing Stable-boy",objectivesES={}},
[12686]={nameES="The Missing Trinket",objectivesES={"Collect Ithamar's missing trinket","Collected Ithamar's missing trinket","Return the trinket to Ithamar at the Cuthstan-camp","The Missing Trinket","Ithamar can be found at the Cuthstan-camp in Wailing Hills.\
\
Ithamar waits for the return of his treasured trinket.","Ithamar has lost a small trinket while on patrol and wishes to have his personal keepsake returned to him.","Ithamar believes that he lost his trinket in a skirmish that took place south-west of the road that leads east to Stangard.\
\
Ithamar would like for you to find his missing trinket and return it to him at the Cuthstan-camp."}},
[12687]={nameES="The Missing Waggon",objectivesES={"Bring the supplies to Hertha","You have successfully defended the supplies!","The waggon is on the main road in Elderslade.\
\
You should defend the supplies from the raiders.","Hertha can be found at Shakal-atrâd.\
\
You should bring the supplies to Hertha.","<rgb=#FF0000>Do not leave the supplies unguarded</rgb>","You have left the supplies unguarded","The waggon is on the main road in Elderslade.\
\
You should collect the supplies.","The waggon is on the main road in Elderslade.\
\
You should more closely inspect the waggon.","The waggon is somewhere on the main road in Elderslade.\
\
You should search for the waggon.","This dwarf has been slain by an Orkish arrow!","Search for the waggon in Elderslade","Defend the supplies from the raiders","Make a closer inspection of the waggon","Hertha worries that a waggon of supplies from Limlók has not reached Elderslade yet.","The Missing Waggon","It looks as if the waggon broke down"}},
[12688]={nameES="The Mission to Goblin-town",objectivesES={"The Mission to Goblin-town","Skalla can be found in Vegbár, the Beorning outpost in northern Wolf-denes.\
\
You should talk to Skalla.","Help Langhár with 'Thinning Their Ranks'","Help Langhár with 'Interlopers from the North'","The Beorning scout near the Goblin-gate can escort you into Goblin-town.\
\
You should enter Goblin-town to disrupt the hobgoblins' takeover.","The goblins have split their loyalty between the Great Goblin and the hobgoblin invaders from Gundabad. An escalation to war is imminent, but it is in the best interest of the Free Peoples to make sure the Great Goblin has a fighting chance.","Langhár has asked you to find a way into Goblin-town to disrupt the hobgoblins inside.\
\
You should complete 'Watchers at the Gate' and find the Beorning scout near the Goblin-gate.","This warlord must be the leader here","The Beorning scout whistles to get your attention","Now that you have access to the Goblin-town throne room, you should do what you can to interfere with the hobgoblins' efforts there.\
\
You should complete quests inside Goblin-town, and find the hobgoblins' leader.","Skalla can be found in Vegbár.\
\
You should talk to Skalla.","Enter Goblin-town by speaking to the Beorning Scout","Talk to Skalla","Find the hobgoblins' leader","Help Langhár with 'Watchers at the Gate'","Find the Beorning scout","Help Langhár with 'Informing the Masses'"}},
[12689]={nameES="Las Montañas Nubladas",objectivesES={"Las Montañas Nubladas","Glóin ha acampado en las Montañas Nubladas y está intentando acabar con las amenazas del lugar.\
\
Glóin se encuentra en su campamento en el suroeste de las Montañas Nubladas.","Habla con Glóin en las Montañas Nubladas","Glóin está atendiendo múltiples problemas en las Montañas Nubladas y le vendría bien algo de ayuda."}},
[12690]={nameES="Los esclavos del mithril",objectivesES={"Lleva el granate potenciado a Mundgeirr","Mundgeirr sabe de una antigua mina de mithril que alberga una forja de fundición, donde podrás sentar las bases de la calidad que buscas otorgar a tu arma. Desafortunadamente, una banda de orcos especialmente salvajes se ha apoderado de la mina y ha esclavizado a sus propios hermanos trasgos para explotar los filones agotados, con la esperanza de conseguir unos pocos y míseros fragmentos de mineral de mithril para sus amos.","Mundgeirr te ha pedido que le lleves un granate imbuido con el que poder ayudarte a otorgar una calidad a tu arma. Sin embargo, no sabe dónde encontrar tal piedra.","A Mundgeirr se le puede encontrar en el Campamento del Mirador de la Gran Excavación, en Moria.\
\
Mundgeirr te ha pedido que vuelvas a hablar con él cuando estés listo para buscar la forja, pero te advierte de que una despiadada banda de orcos y sus esclavos trasgos se han apoderado de la mina de mithril.","A Mundgeirr se le puede encontrar en el Campamento del Mirador de la Gran Excavación, en Moria.\
\
Debes regresar con Mundgeirr para completar la mejora de tu arma.","Lleva un granate infundido a Mundgeirr","Los esclavos del mithril","Habla con Mundgeirr para viajar a la mina de mithril"}},
[12691]={nameES="The Moon-land Falls",objectivesES={}},
[12692]={nameES="The Moon-runes of Veluk-zámok",objectivesES={"Hórin, a Zhélruka Dwarf tasked to dealing with outsiders, seeks assistance in deciphering an ancient moon-letter.","You should search in the Grey Mountains for the third location, described in moon-runes, on Hórin's parchment.","You tell Hórin how you followed the clues and learned the location of the Stave of Veluk-zámok. His eyes widen.\
\
'In Glimmerdeep, of all places, among the treasure of a dragon! Yet dragon and treasure are not to be found? And why not? Centuries upon centuries have passed. And yet dragons live longer than centuries....\
\
'Perhaps, perhaps not all hope is lost.'","This must be the location of the Stave!","You should search in the Grey Mountains for the location hinted at in Hórin's parchment.","Look for a clue in the Glimmerdeep","Read the moon-runes","It seems no dragon or its hoard remain here","The Moon-runes of Veluk-zámok","You should search in the Grey Mountains for the second location, described in moon-runes, on Hórin's parchment.","You should inspect the parchment that Hórin gave you.","You should read the moon-runes on the parchment.","Solve the parchment's second riddle","The Glimmerdeep can be found north of Skarháld in the Grey Mountains.\
\
You should examine the location in the Glimmerdeep mentioned on Hórin's parchment.","Inspect the parchment","Habla con Hórin","Solve the parchment's riddle","This must be the location","As you read, additional text appears!","Hórin may be in Skarháld or adventuring with you.\
\
You should talk to Hórin.","Solve the parchment's third riddle"}},
[12693]={nameES="The Morgul Holdout",objectivesES={"The enemy hideout is in the culverts beneath the ruins of after-battle Osgiliath.\
\
You should enter the culverts and find the enemy hideout.","Defeated Kamábhil","Defeat Kamábhil","Return to Mablung","The raiding party hides in the culverts of after-battle Osgiliath.\
\
You should defeat the Morgul raiding party.","You should return to Mablung, who can be found at the Ranger encampment in after-battle Osgiliath.","The Morgul Holdout","With the claims of the Variags confirmed, Mablung has asked you to defeat the enemies hiding within the culverts of Osgiliath.","Search the culverts for the enemy hideout","A large Morgul raiding party is hiding down here"}},
[12694]={nameES="The Morgul-sheen",objectivesES={}},
[12695]={nameES="The Morgulduin",objectivesES={"Gather water from the Morgulduin, further upstream","The Morgulduin","The water appears to be somewhat clean","Speak to Rauniel by the banks of the Morgulduin","Sample water from a tributary into the Morgulduin","Sample water from the Morgulduin closer to its source","The Morgulduin River runs through Rath Dúath.\
\
You should find tributaries into the Morgulduin and sample the water there.","The Morgulduin River runs through Rath Dúath.\
\
You should sample the water of the Morgulduin, further upstream, past its tributaries.","Sample water from another tributary into the Morgulduin","Gather water from a northern tributary into the Morgulduin","Rauniel can be found by the banks of the Morgulduin in northern Rath Dúath.\
\
You should speak to the mysterious woman.","Gather water from a southern tributary into the Morgulduin","Someone watches you as you examine the corrosive and vile waters","Arodor seeks to know more about the Morgulduin River. He is specifically interested in finding a way to cure its putrid waters."}},
[12696]={nameES="Las morroval proscritas",objectivesES={"Lleva el zafiro potenciado a Mundgeirr","Encontrarás a Mundgeirr en el campamento del Mirador de la Gran Excavación, en Moria.\
\
Regresa con él para completar la mejora de tu arma.","Mundgeirr te ha hablado de una antigua forja donde antaño se creaban algunas de las mejores armas de Moria. Sin embargo, poco después de que los enanos la redescubrieran, una horda de merrevail expulsadas de sus propias cavernas empezó a saquearla, llevándose las herramientas y los materiales de su interior.","Habla con Mundgeirr para viajar a la forja antigua","Mundgeirr te ha pedido que le lleves un zafiro potenciado para poder mejorar tu arma. Por desgracia, no sabe exactamente dónde encontrarlo.","Encontrarás a Mundgeirr en el campamento del Mirador de la Gran Excavación, en Moria.\
\
Te ha pedido que busques la forja de la que te habló, pero advierte que una banda desesperada de morroval parias se ha hecho con el control del lugar. Habla con él cuando estés listo para partir.","Lleva un zafiro imbuido a Mundgeirr","Las morroval proscritas"}},
[12697]={nameES="The Most Valuable Commodity",objectivesES={"Collect Orders from Durthúl","Collect Orders from Rhanarch","The Most Valuable Commodity","Faeron has asked you to find merrevail lieutenants and uncover orders from Lhaereth.\
\
You should find and defeat Ogolúm, Durthúl, and Rhanarch within the Circle of Madness.","The Circle of Madness has been invaded by Lhaereth's forces. Faeron thinks it prudent to discover what it is the winged-folk seek.","Faeron can be found in Barad Elenath, the Star-gazers' Spire.\
\
You should talk to Faeron.","Collect Orders from Ogolúm","Dolenthol can be found in Barad Elenath, the Star-gazers' Spire.\
\
You should talk to Dolenthol.","Talk to Faeron","Talk to Dolenthol"}},
[12698]={nameES="The Moving Hills",objectivesES={}},
[12699]={nameES="The Mustering",objectivesES={"Help Grimbold rally his spirits","Grimbold is at the Fords of Isen in the Westfold.\
\
You should help Grimbold to rally his spirits and answer the call to arms once more.","You must attempt to motivate Grimbold to rise again and fight, for the king and for Rohan.","The Mustering","You urge Grimbold to rouse himself.\
\
'Why? Why should I? Nobody will stand with me. Everyone has retreated, and the enemy cannot be kept out.'","Habla con Gandalf","Gandalf is at Erkenbrand's camp in the western Westfold.\
\
You should speak with Gandalf."}},
[12700]={nameES="The Mysteries of Mullach Cagar",objectivesES={"The staff remains unbroken.\
\
You cannot leave it in the possession of the Angmarim, for they will use it for some evil purpose. You must take it with you. Perhaps Hórin will know of a place where this artifact can be made safe?","Once again examine the mysterious staff on the table in the Angmarim tent","You have found a mysterious staff in the main tent of Mullach Cagar. You feel it must be a powerful evil artifact.\
\
You should destroy the mysterious staff.","Search inside the tents at Mullach Cagar","This ornate staff has been placed in a prominent position in this central tent, surrounded by a runic circle and many-faceted crystals. What ill-intentioned ritual were the Angmarim performing here?\
\
Standing beside the staff makes you feel unpleasantly queasy; you are overcome with a sensation of great distrust. The purple glow of the gem mounted atop the staff fills your vision and you are falling, falling....\
\
You snap from your reverie. This is an artifact of evil, and you should destroy it if you can.","Find Mullach Cagar, the Angmarim camp south of Fellgát","The staff has completely rebuffed your attack.\
\
You should investigate the staff again.","You now have the mysterious staff in your possession. The nausea and paranoia it causes is slowly increasing.\
\
You should return to Hórin and Molkha on the frozen lake south-west of Fellgát.","The Angmarim have made camp south of Fellgát.\
\
You should find Mullach Cagar.","The Angmarim have been allowed passage into Welkin-lofts by the Frost-horde, but for what purpose did they come to these high peaks?","The staff is unaffected by your attack","Destroy the mysterious staff","You have found a strange staff. You feel uneasy standing near it.","Talk to Hórin in the valley","You have discovered the Angmarim camp of Mullach Cagar.\
\
You should search the camp for clues to the Angmarim's purpose here.","You have found the Angmarim camp called Mullach Cagar","The Mysteries of Mullach Cagar","Examine the mysterious staff on the table in the Angmarim tent","As you pick up the staff, you hear faint whispering but cannot make out the words","You have found a strange staff in Mullach Cagar.\
\
You should investigate it more closely.","Take the mysterious staff from the table in the Angmarim tent","The mysterious staff cannot be destroyed through any means you currently have at your disposal.\
\
You have decided you must take the mysterious staff with you."}},
[12701]={nameES="La Misteriosa Aflicción",objectivesES={"Talk to Nestawen at Estolad Mernael","Nestawen can be found at Estolad Mernael, the Malledhrim camp in the Drownholt.\
\
You should speak with Nestawen immediately and tell her of the particularly fell pool in the Drownholt.","There is a terrible rancour about this particular pool","One of the horses travelling with the Malledhrim has fallen ill, and the Elves begin to lose hope that he can be healed. His illness began as they passed through the Drownholt and has grown steadily more grave over time.","Nestawen rode upon Alagos on her route to Estolad Mernael.\
\
You should explore possible routes Nestawen may have travelled and look for anything out of the ordinary that could have induced the steed's strange illness.","Explore the Drownholt for the source of illness","La Misteriosa Aflicción"}},
[12702]={nameES="The Mysterious Dheghûn",objectivesES={}},
[12703]={nameES="The Mysterious Thief",objectivesES={}},
[12704]={nameES="The Mysteriously Dwindling Flock",objectivesES={"Rook is at his hut in Pren Gwydh.\
\
You should bring the eggs you collected to Rook in Pren Gwydh.","Craban roosting spots can be found in the lands of Pren Gwydh not far from Rook's Hut.\
\
You should search for crow-eggs so that Rook may train another flock of crebain from chicks.","The Mysteriously Dwindling Flock","Bring the eggs to Rook","Now that you have used most of his trained flock feathers, Rook wishes to retrain a new flock, and looks for a collection of eggs to hatch."}},
[12705]={nameES="The Mystery Deepens",objectivesES={"Gwyllion's Gate, the entrance to the path which leads to Gwyllion's hut, lies to the south of Gavar Cadlus.\
\
Grufudh told you to speak with Gwyllion, the Old Woman of the Mountain, if you wished to know the source of the White Hand banner.","Talk to Grufudh at Gavar Cadlus","Talk to Saeradan at Echad Saeradan","Saeradan is at Echad Saeradan, west of Gwyllion's Gate.\
\
You should return to Saeradan with news of your discovery of the Uruk-hai Filskûm at Gwyllion's hut.","The Mystery Deepens","Grufudh is at Gavar Cadlus, north-east of Echad Saeradan.\
\
Saeradan instructed you to speak with Grufudh about the banner of the White Hand that you found near Gwyllion's Gate.","Gwyllion's Hut","Talk to Gwyllion at her hut","Using the items and information you brought to him, Saeradan believes that it is a certainty that Saruman the White has a hand in the strange happenings in the Windfells."}},
[12706]={nameES="The Mystery Supplier",objectivesES={"The townspeople of Halach have been receiving help from someone, but no one knows who.","Irodon has asked you to investigate a boar wallow to the north-east of Halach.","Investigate the boar-wallow near Halach","Talk to Asórkho near the boar wallow","A Haradrim man calmly holds up his empty hands","You have found a Haradrim man near the boar wallow.\
\
You should talk to him.","The Mystery Supplier"}},
[12707]={nameES="The Narrow Way",objectivesES={"Iavassúl is at Iavassúl's Watch in Taur Morvith.\
\
You should report to Iavassúl regarding his sister's rescue.","Ianudirel may be found on the far side of the river from Krul Lugu.\
\
Iavassúl has asked you to find Ianudirel, his sister, and help her to return safely, if she still lives.","Talk to Iavassúl at Iavassúl's Watch","Talk to Ianudirel to assist in her escape","The Narrow Way","The Elven scout Ianudirel was sent ahead to explore the far side of the river from Krul Lugu, but she has not yet returned."}},
[12708]={nameES="The Necklace of Undoing",objectivesES={}},
[12709]={nameES="The Need to Survive",objectivesES={"Talk to Gísling at the Mead Hall of Garsfeld","Food-stores can be found scattered about Garsfeld and inside the homes of the town.\
\
Gísling wants you to gather food-stores in preparation to evacuate Garsfeld. He has asked that you try to avoid the attention of the crofters so as not to incite panic.","Gísling awaits your return in the Mead Hall of Garsfeld.\
\
You should bring the rations you collected to Gísling.","The Need to Survive","Gísling requests your aid in making ready to evacuate the crofters from Garsfeld."}},
[12710]={nameES="The Nelegroth Broodmother",objectivesES={"The Nelegroth Broodmother","The Offering Stone can be found in one of the caverns of Torech Ungol, beneath Nelegroth.\
\
You should place the spider remains on the Offering Stone and then defeat the Nelegroth Brood-mother.","Defeat the Nelegroth Brood-mother","A note hangs from the board, signed by Legolas:\
\
'I have located a particularly elusive foe, the Brood-mother of Nelegroth. She does not reveal herself easily, but I have seen the local Orcs leaving their dead at an offering stone for her. It is then that she leaves her lair to feed. I suspect if you slay some of the Ungol spiders nearby and leave them on that stone, she will appear. Then, you can strike her down and rid Lhingris of another powerful enemy.'","Legolas has devised a plan for defeating the Nelegroth Broodmother and requests an adventurer's aid.","Ungol Weavers can be found in one of the caverns of Torech Ungol, beneath Nelegroth.\
\
You should defeat Ungol Weavers and collect their remains.","The Nelegroth Brood-mother descends from the shadows!","Place the remains on the Offering Stone","Defeated the Nelegroth Brood-mother"}},
[12711]={nameES="The Nests of Nathból",objectivesES={}},
[12712]={nameES="The New Recruit",objectivesES={"Defeat enemies in Emyn Duir.","Assist Huneric at Adambel with: Heraldry of The Thíuda","Take the new recruit with you as you assist those in Díngarth.","Take the new recruit with you as you assist those in Echad-in-Edhil.","Use the whistle to summon the new recruit if you become separated","Assist Huneric at Adambel with: Turning Defectors","A new recruit has come to Díngarth.\
\
You should speak with the recruit.","Assist Radigond at Díngarth","You have been entrusted to train and mentor a new soldier.","The New Recruit","Speak to the new recruit.","Assist Hildvar at Díngarth","Assist Durin IV at Echad-in-Edhil with: Sauron's Presence Upon Parth Daenath","Assist Gelvira at Díngarth","After so many years besieging Mordor, the Great Alliance is still in need of new recruits. Upon entering Díngarth you receive a missive: you have been entrusted with a new soldier in hopes that you can mentor and train the young man. You should seek him out as soon as you are able.","Speak to the new recruit","Assist Durin IV at Echad-in-Edhil with: Heraldry of Durin IV","Take the new recruit with you as you assist those in Adambel."}},
[12713]={nameES="The Next Shipment",objectivesES={}},
[12714]={nameES="The Next Stages of Grief",objectivesES={}},
[12715]={nameES="The Nine",objectivesES={}},
[12716]={nameES="The Noble Gate",objectivesES={"From this watch-post you can make out the old gardens of Vâr Nuchur","Maergrind, the Noble Gate of Máttugard, can be found in Gundabad.\
\
You should familiarize yourself with the foothold at Maergrind.","The Noble Gate","Greeted Quartermaster","From the watch-post you can just make out the Shalakibal, the old Water-square","The middle of Máttugard recedes into darkness, the pit of Ablak-zibdîn","The path from Maergrind to the Gates of Gundabad are well guarded","Prince Ingór has established a foothold at Maergrind in Máttugard.","Prince Ingór can be found at Maergrind in Máttugard.\
\
You should talk to Prince Ingór.","Talk to Prince Ingór at Maergrind"}},
[12717]={nameES="The Noble Guard",objectivesES={"Speak with Grimgar, grandson of Reeve Gárwig","Grimgar feels that Scylfig is well-prepared for the White Hand Orc assault","Speak with Cyneberg","The Noble Guard","A number of nobles from the Reeve's family have taken up arms for the coming attack on Scylfig.","Cyneberg can be found sharpening her sword in Scylfig.\
\
You should speak with Cyneberg.","Gársig valiantly upholds his duty as a noble protector of Wildermore","The kin of the Reeve of Wildermore can be found in Scylfig.\
\
You should see if the Reeve's son or grandsons need any assistance.","Speak with Humbald, grandson of Reeve Gárwig","Humbald is excited to assist in the defence of Scylfig","Speak with Gársig, son of Reeve Gárwig"}},
[12718]={nameES="El camino a Nobotella",objectivesES={"Le has enseñado una lección a Harry Madreselva... ¿pero le servirá de algo?","El camino a Nobotella","Enfréntate a Harry Madreselva","<rgb=#FF0000>Evita a los Fronteros de Lotho</rgb>","Fredegar Bolger se encuentra en el pueblo de Nobotella.\
\
Debes hablar con Freder Bolger en Nobotella.","Los suministros de la Guardia de Allende se encuentran en agujero-almacén secreto en el bosque entre Gamwich y Quiebra Larga.\
\
Debes llevar los suministros para la Guardia de Allende a Salga Pastoverde en Nobotella.","Salga Pastoverde se encuentra en Nobotella.\
\
Debes hablar con Salga Pastoverde en Nobotella.","Harry Madreselva se encuentra cerca de Nobotella en la Comarca Allende.\
\
Debes enfrentarte a Harry Madreselva.","Habla con Salga Pastoverde en Nobotella","Habla con Fredegar en Nobotella","La Guardia de Allende necesitará suministros si quiere parar los descabellados planes de Lotho.","Recupera los suministros de la Guardia de Allende del agujero-almacén secreto"}},
[12719]={nameES="El ruido de los gredbyg",objectivesES={"El ruido de los gredbyg","Es probable que se encuentre una colonia de gredbyg en una colmena del Palacio de Náin, al norte de Lamab-dûm en la Gran Excavación.\
\
Thórhall quiere que elimines a tantos gredbyg como puedas.","Regresa con Thórhall en Lamab-dûm","Thórhall está inquieto por los extraños sonidos que se oyen por todo Lamab-dûm y teme que procedan de los gredbyg que reptan por la zona.","Thórhall se encuentra en su campamento en Lamab-dûm, en la Gran Excavación.\
\
Deberías regresar con Thórhall e informarle de que la presencia de grodbog en la colmena del norte se ha reducido en cierta medida."}},
[12720]={nameES="The North Rammas: Banners",objectivesES={}},
[12721]={nameES="The North Rammas: Captains",objectivesES={}},
[12722]={nameES="The North Rammas: Hooks",objectivesES={}},
[12723]={nameES="The North Rammas: Supplies",objectivesES={}},
[12724]={nameES="The North Rammas: Sûhalar",objectivesES={}},
[12725]={nameES="El primo del norte",objectivesES={"Myrkworth se encuentra en Imlad Balchorth, en lo alto de una colina al norte de Gabilshathûr.\
\
Hwati te ha pedido que viajes a Myrkworth y hables con su primo, Eiláf.","Hwati en Gabilshathûr cree que su primo al norte, en Myrkworth, podría necesitar tu ayuda.","El primo del norte"}},
[12726]={nameES="The Northern Front",objectivesES={"Melril can be found along the path leading through Tarlang's Crown, to the south-west of Sardol in Blackroot Vale.\
\
Harnion has asked you to seek Melril in northern Tarlang's Crown and aid the people of Blackroot Vale.","Talk to Melril in northern Tarlang's Crown","Harnion of Dol Amroth grows concerned that the forces in Tarlang's Crown will assault Blackroot Vale before moving on to the rest of Gondor.","The Northern Front","DNT"}},
[12727]={nameES="Los Perjuros",objectivesES={"En los dias de la guerra contra Angmar hace mil años, un grupo de hombres del Rey Arvedui renegó al ser llamados a las armas. Arvedui maldijo a estos hombres, diciendo que no conocerían descanso hasta que cumplieran su deber. Hasta hoy, han caminado por los Campos de Fornost, atormentados por sus errores.\
\
'Ha llegado la hora para que estas sombras sean libres al fin. Reúne a tus aliados y busca al capitán Perjuro. Podrás encontrarle bajo los mismos muros de Fornost, al noreste de aquí en algunas viejas y desmoronadas ruinas de Arthedain.\
\
'Aunque ten cuidado: el suyo fue un destino aciago, y podría no ser amistoso con aquellos que le recuerden sus juramentos traicionados.'","Has derrotado al capitán Perjuro","La sombra del capitán Perjuro se encuentra al noreste del campamento de Mincham, en unas ruinas dispersas junto a los muros de Fornost.\
\
Mincham te ha pedido que encuentras a la sombra del capitán Perjuro y que lo instes, junto a sus seguidores, a cumplir su antiguo deber.","En los días del Rey Arvedui, el último rey de Fornost, una compañía de hombres del rey traicionó sus juramentos a Arthedain, permitiendo que Fornost cayera a los ejércitos de Angmar. Arvedui maldijo a estos hombres para que nunca descansaran hasta que hubieran cumplido sus juramentos.","Los Perjuros","Habla con Mincham","Habla con la sombra del capitán Perjuro","Mincham te espera en su campamento.\
\
El capitán Perjuro te dijo que él y sus seguidores habían jurado lealtad a alguien llamado Amarthiel. Mincham podría saber qué significa esto."}},
[12728]={nameES="The Oathbreakers of Parth Celebrant",objectivesES={"Idmar is at his camp along the road in central Parth Celebrant.\
\
You should return to Idmar with news of your dealings with the maddened shades.","Upon noticing you, the Oathbreaker appears puzzled.\
\
'I am Thinnas, captain of the eastern front. What purpose do you have, coming here?'\
\
You question the Oathbreaker about his curse.\
\
'We did not think anyone would find out. But lord Cirion did... and he made certain we would never forget what we had done.\
\
'What need have you for this? Do you only seek to torment us more?'","As you acquire the Oathbreaker's attention, he glares in your direction.\
\
'Another? Why will you not leave us be?'\
\
Melethron's face contorts into a rage.","Melethron is at the northern Oathbreaker camp among his fallen men.\
\
Idmar asked you to speak with the shade of Melethron.","Defeated Camlann","Confront and defeat Thinnas","The Oathbreakers of Parth Celebrant","As you approach Camlann, he looks visibly upset.\
\
'You have invaded our lands and slaughtered my men, and yet, you expect me to speak with you?\
\
'The frivolity of your charge is matched only by your foolishness. The fate that befell us is ours alone to face.'","Talk to Idmar","Thinnas is at the eastern camp of Oathbreakers near the Rushgore.\
\
Idmar has asked you to speak with the shade of Thinnas.","Defeated Melethron","Camlann is at the western camp of Oathbreakers near the border to Eorlsmead.\
\
Idmar asked you to speak with the shade of Camlann.","Confront and defeat Camlann","Medwine has attempted to converse with several of the Oathbreakers in the newly-risen force. However, he has only been met with violence.","Confront and defeat Melethron","Defeated Thinnas"}},
[12729]={nameES="El Anciano",objectivesES={"Fonn está de vuelta en Tyrn Lhuig.\
\
Tras derrotar a Ulkrank, Bethad te pidió que le contaras a su amigo Fonn tus hazañas.","El explorador Bethad ha descubierto que la cueva de las sierpes es el hogar de un venerado anciano Gorthorog llamado Ulkrank.","El Anciano","Ulkrank, el antiguo Gorthorog, se encuentra en algún lugar en las profundidades de la cueva.\
\
Bethad te ha pedido que explores la cueva hasta que puedas encontrar y derrotar a Ulkrank en persona."}},
[12730]={nameES="El favorito del Viejo Tuk",objectivesES={"El favorito del Viejo Tuk","Adelard está esperando en los Grandes Smials, en Alforzaburgo.\
\
Después de que hayas recuperado las costillas que necesitaba Edilina Ganapié, ha preparado un plato de costillas de jabalí especiadas para que se las des a Adelard. Deberías llevárselas para que pueda intentar apaciguar al fantasma del Viejo Tuk.","Con el fantasma que aún molesta su biblioteca, Adelard ha ideado otra forma de apaciguar al Viejo Tuk: la comida. Se sabe que al Viejo Tuk le encantaban las costillas de jabalí especiadas, y Adelard cree que si le presenta un plato de estas costillas al fantasma en la biblioteca, este volverá a su descanso.","Se pueden encontrar jabalíes en las colinas al este de Alforzaburgo. La casa de Edilina Ganapié está justo al este de Alforzaburgo.\
\
Edilina Ganapié dijo que podía preparar las costillas de jabalí especiadas que quiere Adelard para apaciguar al fantasma del Viejo Tuk, pero que le faltaban las costillas. Te pidió que le trajeras algunas costillas de los jabalíes de las colinas más allá de Alforzaburgo.","Costillas de jabalí especiadas recolectadas","Lleva las costillas de jabalí especiadas a Adelard Tuk","Recoge costillas de jabalí especiadas","Lleva las costillas de jabalí a Edilina Ganapié","El agujero de Edilina Ganapié está al este de los Grandes Smials.\
\
Adelard te ha enviado a ver a su sobrina, Edilina Ganapié, para que prepare un plato de costillas de jabalí especiadas para apaciguar al fantasma del Viejo Tuk, pero te ha advertido que no le digas la razón. No quiere causar pánico."}},
[12731]={nameES="The Old Woman and the Sea",objectivesES={}},
[12732]={nameES="The Old Woman of the Mountain",objectivesES={}},
[12733]={nameES="The Olog-hai Lord",objectivesES={"Ingold has asked you to defeat the leaders of Fushaum Tûm.","Defeat Thorakó, the Hewer","Defeated Shatúrro, the Spear","Defeated Thorakó, the Hewer","A notice is pinned to the board, signed by Ingold:\
\
'We have detected a large presence of Olog-hai at Fushaum Tûm, and believe the leaders are planning an attack. A brave adventurer is needed to infiltrate the camp and defeat these powerful foes.'","Ingold, a soldier of Gondor, has scouted Dor Amarth and is concerned with the growing numbers of foes gathering at the encampment of Fushaum Tûm.","The Olog-hai Lord","Defeat Shatúrro, the Spear"}},
[12734]={nameES="The Once and Future King-slayer",objectivesES={"You see the silhouette of what appears to be an enormous boar","Find the trail of the rumoured boar","The boar was last rumoured to be in the wooded hills to the east of Aldburg.\
\
Arcil has asked that you follow the tales of a great boar, not unlike the Boar of Everholt, to see if it truly exists.","Talk to Arcil","The trail continues south into the woods.\
\
You should follow the trail of the great boar.","Arcil is in the Mead Hall of Aldburg, west of the woods.\
\
You should return to Arcil and let him know what you found in the woods.","Arcil is concerned about the rumours of a great boar wandering the woods, the likes of that which defeated King Folca long ago.","Search for evidence of the great boar","It was not an enormous boar, but this totem was made to appear as such","You saw the silhouette of what appears to be an enormous boar nearby and should approach with caution.","Found the trail of the rumoured boar","Continue to follow the trail of the great boar","The Once and Future King-slayer","The trail continues east into the woods.\
\
You should follow the trail of the great boar.","Follow the trail of the great boar deeper into the woods","The trail of the rumoured boar leads up the hill, to the south."}},
[12735]={nameES="The One Who Lingers",objectivesES={"Lothrandir is with the shade of Arvedui at the shipwreck of the Thoroval.\
\
You should talk to Lothrandir.","Lothrandir is prepared to travel to the shipwreck of the Thoroval to meet Arvedui.\
\
Speak with Lothrandir at Sûri-kylä to enter 'Instance: Dúnedain Past and Present'.","Talk to Lothrandir","Lothrandir can be found outside the village of Sûri-kylä in Forochel.\
\
You should find Lothrandir and explain Elrond's request.","Habla con Elrond","Complete 'Instance: Dúnedain Past and Present'","The One Who Lingers","Find Lothrandir in Forochel","Elrond can be found in his library in the Last Homely House.\
\
You should talk to Elrond.","Aragorn is concerned that his ancestor Arvedui lingers still in Middle-earth, haunting the wreck of the Thoroval."}},
[12736]={nameES="Los Ongbúrz y la Corona de Hierro",objectivesES={"Guirmán se encuentra en el Búth Luikh de Aughaire, al sur de Dún Covád.\
\
Has derrotado a muchos Orcos de los Ongbúrz y a sus aliados de la Corona de Hierro, y ahora deberías regresar a Guirmán para informarle de tus victorias.","Los Ongbúrz y la Corona de Hierro","Orcos de la tribu de los Ongbúrz y sus aliados de la Corona de Hierro se encuentran en la ciudad de Dún Covád y sus alrededores, al norte de Aughaire, en las colinas del oeste.\
\
Guirmán te ha pedido que combatas a los enemigos de los Trév Gállorg que se encuentran en Fasach-falroid.","Guirmán de los Trév Gállorg de Aughaire ha regresado de Fasach-falroid con noticias preocupantes de esa tierra."}},
[12737]={nameES="The Only Solution",objectivesES={}},
[12738]={nameES="La amenaza orca",objectivesES={"Gatson está en su granja, al norte de los campos.\
\
Has encontrado y derrotado a muchos orcos en los campos del sur de Gatson. Deberías regresar con Gatson y contarle tu éxito.","La amenaza orca","Se pueden encontrar orcos en los campos del sur de Gatson.\
\
El granjero Gatson acepta que los Montaraces no pueden ayudarle, pero aún le preocupa la seguridad de sus trabajadores. Espera que, al encargarte de los exploradores orcos que han estado robando en sus campos, puedas disuadir un ataque violento a su granja.","Exploradores orcos han estado merodeando por la granja de Gatson, robando comida, y Gatson está seguro de que es solo cuestión de tiempo antes de que ataquen su granja con fuerza."}},
[12739]={nameES="La incursión Orca",objectivesES={"El capitán de la guardia Gisur está en Gabilshathûr.\
\
Ayudaste a rechazar el ataque orco y deberías hablar con Gisur, ahora que el peligro ha pasado.","La incursión Orca","Los Orcos se están movilizando contra Gabilshathûr.\
\
El capitán de la guardia Gisur te ha pedido que ayudes a defender Gabilshathûr de un ataque orco.","Gabilshathûr está en peligro. Un grupo de incursión orco se dirige hacia el refugio enano y podría arrasarlo."}},
[12740]={nameES="The Orcs Above",objectivesES={"You should let Horndir know that you have defeated many of the Orcs who were gathering and trying to regroup north-west of the Harlond.\
\
Horndir is in the Harlond.","The Orcs Above","Return to Horndir","Stragglers driven from the Battle of the Pelennor Fields have scattered throughout Lossarnach. Though their numbers have been decimated, they still stand to pose a threat and must be eliminated.","Horndir has asked you to deal with the Orc presence at Taustrok before it grows in strength enough to threaten the Harlond.\
\
The Orcs have gathered at a small camp, north-west of the Harlond."}},
[12741]={nameES="The Orcs Attack",objectivesES={}},
[12742]={nameES="The Orcs Have Orders",objectivesES={"Artamir has asked you to defeat Orcs throughout the Dead Marshes, for the creatures seem to have followed him here and are making completion of his errand more difficult. Furthermore, if Frodo did come this way, the Orcs drawn here by Artamir's presence could complicate matters.","Defeat Orcs in the Dead Marshes (7/8)","You rescue a crumpled parchment from the Orc before the swamp claims it","You found a parchment in the clutches of an Orc in the Dead Marshes, and should bring it to Artamir at his camp.","The Orcs Have Orders","You have faced many Orcs in the Dead Marshes, but there are more out there and you should defeat them for Artamir.","Bring the crumpled parchment to Artamir at his camp in the Dead Marshes","Artamir son of Ilcamir has come to the Dead Marshes, and the sooner he leaves them the better!"}},
[12743]={nameES="The Orcs of Hanksar-mokh",objectivesES={}},
[12744]={nameES="The Orcs of Jeb Khâtel",objectivesES={"Zagdúr clears her throat, causing Shúkurz to smile sheepishly","Find the Orcs of Jeb Khâtel","You feel the weight of many eyes scrutinizing your every move...","A man named Phocas seems intent on tracking down Orcs in Jeb Khâtel.","Talk to Zagdúr","You have found Kafagur's elder, as well as a familiar Orc by her side -- Shúkurz.\
\
You should talk to him.","Zagdúr has politely interrupted your reunion with Shúkurz.\
\
You should talk to her in Kafagur.","Your presence in Kafagur has not gone unnoticed, but many of the Orcs seem unwilling to talk to you.\
\
You should find someone who is willing.","Find someone in Kafagur who is willing to talk to you","You've found an Orc in Kafagur named Grúshul who wishes to speak with you.\
\
You should talk to her.","The Orcs of Jeb Khâtel","Talk to Shúkurz","Grúshul has given you permission to meet with the elder, Zagdúr.\
\
You should find her in Kafagur.","The large Orc beckons you over with a grimace","Find Zagdúr in Kafagur","Talk to Grúshul","With a start, you recognize the Orc next to the elder","Phocas has asked you to head north to Jeb Khâtel and find the Orcs that dwell there."}},
[12745]={nameES="Los orcos de Nan Wathren",objectivesES={"Los orcos se encuentran en Nan Wathren, al sur de las Quebradas del Norte.\
\
Debes derrotar a un buen número de orcos en Nan Wathren.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Se recomienda una Pequeña Comunidad.</rgb>","Los orcos de Nan Wathren","Has derrotado a un buen número de orcos en el oeste de Nan Wathren.","Has derrotado a un buen número de orcos de Nan Wathren.","Completado","Al dirigirte al extremo de la garganta de Nan Wathren, ves que ha caído completamente en las manos de los orcos Tarkrîp.\
\
Un sendero traicionero y difícil continúa más allá del puente.\
\
Debes derrotar a los orcos de Nan Wathren, pero lleva compañeros contigo si vas más allá de este punto, ya que el peligro es mortal a partir de aquí.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Se recomienda una Pequeña Comunidad.</rgb>","Los orcos se han apoderado de los cañones de Nan Wathren, y deben ser expulsados."}},
[12746]={nameES="Los orcos de Nan Wathren",objectivesES={"Los orcos de Nan Wathren","Has derrotado a un buen número de orcos de Nan Wathren.","Los orcos de Nan Wathren se vuelven más fuertes y crueles a medida que avanzas por el paso.\
\
Debes derrotar a los Degolladores y Luchadores Tarkrîp que encuentres en tu camino a través del extremo oriental de Nan Wathren.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Se recomienda una Comunidad.</rgb>","Has derrotado a un buen número de los orcos más fuertes de Nan Wathren oriental. Estos enemigos eran duros y numerosos, y tu valiente empeño por rechazarlos te ha granjeado gran renombre entre los Pueblos Libres de la Tierra Media.","Completado","Los Degolladores y Luchadores Tarkrîp se encuentran en Nan Wathren oriental, en el sur de las Quebradas del Norte.\
\
Debes derrotar a un buen número de Degolladores y Luchadores Tarkrîp en Nan Wathren.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Se recomienda una Comunidad.</rgb>","Los orcos de Nan Wathren se vuelven más fuertes y crueles a medida que avanzas por el paso."}},
[12747]={nameES="The Orkish Path",objectivesES={"Arvaethor has asked you to accompany him to the White Mountain Orc camp and destroy any signs of Orc encroachment upon the Vale.","You should speak with Arvaethor.","Orc structures can be found north-east of Ethring.\
\
Destroy Orkish structures in Ringló Vale.","The Orkish Path","Speak with Arvaethor"}},
[12748]={nameES="The Ornendil Bridge Belongs to Mordor",objectivesES={}},
[12749]={nameES="El Otro Cofre",objectivesES={"Larus Fragmentoagudo descubrió que había un segundo cofre, que aún permanece perdido.","Larus Fragmentoagudo cree que el segundo cofre está dentro de un edificio en la colina a tu izquierda al acercarte a la fortaleza controlada por los Duramano en el paso de Gabilazan desde el norte. Gabilazan está al sur del campamento donde se encuentra Larus.\
\
Larus Fragmentoagudo está muy preocupado de que Heikki Vigilaoro registre cosas poco favorables sobre él si no logras recuperar un segundo cofre enano desde las Montañas Nubladas.","Reúne el segundo cofre","El Otro Cofre"}},
[12750]={nameES="The Outcast",objectivesES={"The Outcast","A boar is hitched outside of the tavern. Sâdikiz is probably inside.","Sâdikiz the Sky-hungry can be found at Khanâg Gur. Mêshaget said to look for Sâdikiz's boar.","Talk to Sâdikiz the Sky-hungry","Instance: The Outcast completed","Sâdikiz the Sky-hungry can be found at Khanâg Gur. You should go there to find him.","Travel to Khanâg Gur","You saved Sâdikiz from being beaten by two bullies who claimed he owed them money. You should talk to Sâdikiz in Khanâg Gur, outside of the tavern.","Mêshaget said he received encouragement to fight for the opening of the doors of Jiret-menêsh through correspondence with Sâdikiz the Sky-hungry, a Temámir who was banished by Châmelek Gêta many years ago. Mêshaget thinks you should meet Sâdikiz, whom he considers a dear friend.","Complete Instance: The Outcast","You have arrived at Khanâg Gur"}},
[12751]={nameES="The Overdue Scout",objectivesES={"Laugi should be somewhere near Zarkul-sulûn in southern Elderslade.\
\
Gunvald has asked you to look for his missing brother.","Find the missing scout","The Overdue Scout","A wayward brother who went scouting should have checked in quite some time ago."}},
[12752]={nameES="The Overgrown Vineyard",objectivesES={"The Overgrown Vineyard","The vineyards may be in eastern Clovengap.\
\
Gerja has asked you to locate the fabled vineyards of Clovengap.","Overgrown trellises stretch across multiple tiers","The vineyards of Gundabad were once renowned throughout Middle-earth.","Gerja Defthand is in Hagbuth, in eastern Clovengap.\
\
You should let Gerja Defthand know that you found the vineyards.","Talk to Gerja in Hagbuth","Search for the vineyards"}},
[12753]={nameES="The Overseer's Post",objectivesES={"Kurtil stands near the dwarves and corpse, behind a cart high up the path in northern Udûn, above Maudhúl Vôr.\
\
Hear what Kurtil has to say.","The dwarves stand behind a cart high up the path in northern Udûn, above Maudhúl Vôr.\
\
The trail of footprints led straight from signs of a bloody struggle to two dwarf-forgeworkers standing over a corpse. You should speak to them.","Talk to the dwarves","Search for Ushkbál","You should search for Ushkbál the Overseer in the great foundry, on the northern side of Udûn, above Maudhúl Vôr.","The corpse and dwarves are behind a cart high up the path in northern Udûn, above Maudhúl Vôr.\
\
You should inspect the overseer's corpse to verify the dwarves' claim that he bears sword-wounds, while they hold only hammers.","This footprint is fresh - you are on the trail","Clear signs of a struggle and of bloody deeds! A conspicuous footprint lies nearby","The wounds are indeed incisions, not made by blunt instruments","Talk to Kurtil","The Overseer's Post","Talk to Slárnur","This is the place - now to find the Overseer","It seems an overseer named Ushkbál is the key to this mysterious meeting, somehow.","The dwarves are behind a cart high up the path in northern Udûn, above Maudhúl Vôr.\
\
You should talk to the dwarves, now that you have verified that the overseer's corpse bears sword and not blunt wounds.","Talk to Stéthi","You have not found Ushkbál the Overseer, but you have found signs of a bloody struggle. You should follow the footprints leading from the place and see where they lead.","Kurtil arrives just behind you to witness the scene. 'Talk before fight,' he hisses.","Inspect the corpse","Follow the footprints"}},
[12754]={nameES="The Pact of Paws and Wings",objectivesES={"Cordially <rgb=#00FF00>bow</rgb> to Anórohir","Travel to the Eyrie with Anórohir","Gwaihir the Wind-lord can be found at the Eyrie.\
\
You should talk to Gwaihir.","Cordially <rgb=#00FF00>bow</rgb> to Gwaihir","Travel to the Carrock","The Carrock can be found on the western edge of the Beorning-lands in the Vales of Anduin.\
\
You should seek out Varthmath atop the Carrock.","Talk to Varthmath atop the Carrock","The Pact of Paws and Wings","Anórohir can be found atop the Carrock.\
\
You should travel to the Eyrie with Anórohir.","Atop the wind-swept peak you see some familiar friends","Gwaihir the Wind-lord can be found at the Eyrie.\
\
You should be polite to Gwaihir.","Habla con Grimbeorn","Grimbeorn can be found at the Beorninghús in the Beorning-lands.\
\
You should talk to Grimbeorn.","Varthmath must have already climbed to the top of the Carrock","Talk to Gwaihir the Windlord","Gwaihir awaits your word","Grimbeorn looks to the skies for assistance in the Vales of Anduin.","Anórohir is on the Carrock.\
\
You should be polite to Anórohir."}},
[12755]={nameES="The Pain of Regret",objectivesES={"Léofmar will be all right. It would be wise to continue your search for sleeping Ents","Another Ent sleeps here, surrounded by smoke, fires, and grief. What harries this poor creature's home?","Léofmar is in Fangorn.\
\
You should speak with Léofmar.","Talk to Léofmar again","Léofmar's horse has responded at once to your summons, ready and willing to bear his master to safety.","You should search for other sleeping Ents in the forest, heading north-east from Léofmar's location.","You should whistle for the horse you met earlier, now that you have found his lost master","The horse you met appears, clearly relieved to be reunited with his master","Find a new sleeping Ent in the north","<rgb=#FF0000>Whistle</rgb> for Léofmar's horse","Listen to Léofmar's tale","Léofmar is ashamed of his behaviour, wracked by guilt. Could his crimes have been so great that he deserves the curse he believes is coming to claim him?","You should <rgb=#FF0000>whistle</rgb> for Léofmar's horse.\
\
You must be standing near Léofmar in order to do this.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>You must perform an emote to advance this quest.</rgb>","Léofmar is in Fangorn.\
\
You should speak with Léofmar and hear his tale.","Léofmar is in Fangorn.\
\
You should talk to Léofmar once more.","Reassure Léofmar that you do not think his crime so terrible","The Pain of Regret"}},
