[12782]={nameES="The People of Elthengels",objectivesES={"Help Adnoth, the stable-hand","Return to Thane Mildrith at the Mead Hall of Elthengels","Thane Mildrith's people are located within the walls of Elthengels in the eastern section of the Norcrofts.\
\
Thane Mildrith has asked you to aid her people in their tasks of protecting the town from further attack.","You have helped Elfwyn with his task","You have helped Adnoth with his task","Thane Mildrith is found at the Mead Hall of Elthengels.\
\
Thane Mildrith has promised to reward you for helping her people with their various tasks.","The People of Elthengels","Thane Mildrith of Elthengels needs aid in managing the many pressing issues of her people in the wake of the Orc-assaults.","Help Baldthorne, the blacksmith","You have helped Wuscrad with his task","Help Wuscrad, the garrison commander","Help Elfwyn, the healer","You have helped Baldthorne with his task"}},
[12783]={nameES="El picnic perfecto",objectivesES={"Llega al arroyo con Penny y refréscate. No te dejes atrapar por hobbits parlanchines. ¡Solo te retrasarán!","Reúne los suministros del picnic.","Llega al lugar perfecto para el picnic con Penny. ¡El trébol a lo largo del camino podría distraerla y causar un retraso!","<rgb=#FF0000>¡Oh no! ¡Toda tu comida se ha arruinado!</rgb>","Carga a Penny con los suministros del picnic","Disfruta de un maravilloso picnic","El picnic perfecto","Descarga el poney","De alguna manera, las provisiones sobrevivieron al calor, al agua, a los espejismos y al camino sinuoso por la carretera y la colina en perfectas condiciones. Rápidamente, y con hambre, colocas las cosas sobre la manta que el alcalde Pieblanco ha extendido.","Refrescarse en el siguiente punto de agua","Habla con Fosco Campolejano","Llega al lugar perfecto para el picnic","Carga tus provisiones en Penny.","<rgb=#FF0000>¡No dejes que tu comida sea devorada por hobbits hambrientos, insectos o arruinada y empapada por la lluvia!</rgb>","<rgb=#FF0000>Penny ha sucumbido al calor!</rgb>","Haz un picnic en la manta de picnic","Llega al punto de agua con Penny y refréscate un poco más.","Elimina el trébol que distrae del camino","El picnic se ha salvado. ¡La lluvia incluso refrescó un poco el ambiente!","Has quitado algo de trébol","Haz un picnic en la manta de picnic.","Ahuyenta a los hobbits hambrientos con una ligera <rgb=#00ff00>bofetada</rgb>","<rgb=#FF0000>¡Penny no debe sucumbir al calor!</rgb>","Llega al arroyo y refréscate","Frustra a los hobbits parlanchines","Has llegado al lugar del picnic y has encontrado a Will Pieblanco esperándote. ¡Es hora de desempacar las cosas del picnic y preparar el festín!","Habla con Will Pieblanco","Disfruta de un picnic encantador sin una sola interrupción.","Dale algunas zanahorias a Penny","Habla con el granjero Fosco Campolejano y el alcalde Will Pieblanco.","Dale algunas zanahorias a Penny."}},
[12784]={nameES="El pícnic perfecto - Diario",objectivesES={"El pícnic perfecto - Diario","Completa \\qEl pícnic perfecto\\q","Un pícnic al día - ¡qué mejor manera de pasar el verano!","Completado \\qEl pícnic perfecto\\q"}},
[12785]={nameES="El pícnic perfecto - Incursión",objectivesES={"El pícnic perfecto - Incursión","Completa \\qEl pícnic perfecto\\q en un grupo de incursión","Completa \\qEl pícnic perfecto\\q en un grupo de incursión."}},
[12786]={nameES="El regalo perfecto",objectivesES={"Tílsa Pasofuerte necesita ayuda para elegir un regalo.","Habla con el cartero Ciervotrébol","Tílsa Pasofuerte está en las afueras de Campotieso.\
\
Vuelve con Tílsa Pasofuerte.","Pregunta a la gente de Campotieso sobre qué sería un buen mathom.","Habla con Frothard Tuk","El regalo perfecto","Habla con Tílsa Pasofuerte","Habla con Henepa Nudotorcido"}},
[12787]={nameES="La Receta Perfecta",objectivesES={"El día de la fiesta de Bingo finalmente ha llegado.","Bingo está fuera de su agujero hobbit en Cavada Grande, al norte del Ayuntamiento.\
\
La cena de Bingo fue un éxito rotundo, y desea agradecerte toda tu ayuda.","La Receta Perfecta","Habla con Bingo fuera de su hogar en Cavada Grande","Habla con Bingo dentro de su agujero hobbit para preparar la fiesta","Bingo está dentro de su agujero hobbit en Cavada Grande, al norte del Ayuntamiento."}},
[12788]={nameES="The Perilous Pact",objectivesES={"Talk to Léothred","Examine the strange rock","The Perilous Pact","The strange rock reminds you of something. It reminds you of the trail of rust left behind by Karazgar. This however is hardened, like a stone. You touch the rust-coloured rock and a suddenly a vision overcomes you.","For Léothred and Fróthi, the truth of how Fram slayed Scatha begins to take form.","Léothred can be found following Fram's map in Elderslade.\
\
You should talk to Léothred.","A strange rock can be found near where Fram's map end.\
\
You should examine the strange rock."}},
[12789]={nameES="The Perilous Path",objectivesES={"It appears that this Zhélruka died fighting something large.","The path to Stormwall is north-east of Skarháld.\
\
You continue on the path to Stormwall, keeping an eye out for the missing Zhélruka.","Set out on the path to Stormwall","Find the missing Zhélruka (3/4)","This Zhélruka died from many bites","This Zhélruka has been mauled by some beast","The Perilous Path","Five unprepared Zhélruka have set out for Stormwall, against Agátur's dire warnings, in search for the lost realm of Thafar-gathol.","The path to Stormwall is north-east of Skarháld.\
\
You should set out on the path to Stormwall, keeping an eye out for the five Zhélruka.","This Zhélruka was burned by something","You see a dwarf up ahead!"}},
