[12796]={nameES="The Pit -- Battle III",objectivesES={"Do not leave the Culling Pit or become defeated","Defeat the giant Gethin","The banner is on the arena floor at Avardin in the Starkmoor.\
\
Use the banner to summon forth your first opponents, then defeat them.","Geralht is at the Culling Pit in Avardin.\
\
Geralht will be pleased to discuss your victory.","The Pit -- Battle III","You have failed the Culling Pit battle","The Pit in the Starkmoor serves as a proving ground for conscripts. Those strong enough to withstand it join the army in Wulf's Cleft; those too weak are sent to dig in the mines.","Talk to Geralht at the Culling Pit in Avardin"}},
[12797]={nameES="The Pit -- Battle IV",objectivesES={"Do not leave the Culling Pit or become defeated","The banner is on the arena floor at Avardin in the Starkmoor.\
