[12798]={nameES="El foso de hierro",objectivesES={"You should see if you can discover any sign of Ondor the Dwarf near the entrance to the Pit of Iron in the north-east Heathfells.","El foso de hierro","You spot something lying next to the cave entrance...","Find some sign of Ondor","Captain Féarn mentioned that one of his men spotted a dwarf poking around the entrance to a cave north-east of Dol Baran. From the description it sounds like it might have been Ondor.\
\
Knowing how excitable Ondor can be, there's a fair chance he's gotten himself in some sort of trouble up there, and it might be a good idea to scout out the entrance to that cave."}},
[12799]={nameES="The Pit of Stonejaws",objectivesES={"Talk to Molkha","You have located the hobgoblin fort in the Pit of Stonejaws.\
\
You should talk to Scout-master Ausma in Bárgstad.","The Pit of Stonejaws","Talk to Kyrstig","Scout-master Ausma has asked you to introduce yourself to her apprentices.\
\
You should talk to Kyrstig, Molkha, and Klúso in Bárgstad.","Find Shakhajât","Talk to Scout-master Ausma","Help Scout-master Ausma with \\qJust a Warm-up\\q","Somewhere in the heart of the Stonejaws is the hobgoblin fort Shakhajât.\
\
You should find Shakhajât and help Ausma with \\qJust a Warm-up\\q.","Scout-master Ausma and her apprentices have arrived in the Pit of Stonejaws to investigate the hobgoblins' seat of power.","Talk to Klúso","A large Orc-fort lies before you. This must be Shakhajât","Now that you have met the new scouts, you should decide upon your course of action in the Pit of Stonejaws.\
\
You should talk to Scout-master Ausma in Bárgstad."}},
