[12805]={nameES="The Plight of Limlók",objectivesES={"Vaskorn can be found at Limlók in the Floodfells.\
\
You should talk to Vaskorn.","Talk to Runerik Knotbeard in Limlók","Limlók, the last northern settlement of the Beornings, could fall to the forces of Gundabad at any moment.","Talk to Vaskorn in Limlók","Runerik Knotbeard can be found in Limlók.\
\
You should talk to Runerik Knotbeard.","The Plight of Limlók"}},
[12806]={nameES="The Plight of Rauniel",objectivesES={"The final vessel can be found upon the bridge to Eithel Gwaur in Rath Dúath.\
\
You should pour water into the vessel for Rauniel.","Rauniel can be found upon the bridge to Eithel Gwaur in Rath Dúath.\
\
You should talk to Rauniel.","The Plight of Rauniel","Retrieved an urn","Foulness is purged from the vessel as you pour the water into it","The urn Rauniel seeks can be found at Shakam Moz in the hills of eastern Rath Dúath.\
\
You should retrieve the urn for Rauniel.","Retrieve the urn from Shakam Moz","Talk to Rauniel upon the bridge to Eithel Gwaur","Pour water into a vessel upon the bridge to Eithel Gwaur","Rauniel, the maiden of the Ithilduin, needs your assistance in destroying the wards that block her escape from a treacherous prison."}},
[12807]={nameES="The Plight of the Innocent",objectivesES={"Completado.","The Plight of the Innocent","Poisoned animals can be found north of the path in Eryn Lasgalen.\
\
You should cure animals poisoned by the Taurogrim.","The animals of the forest have fallen victim to the vile poison of the Taurogrim.","Completado","As Thranduil expected, Thorlind's cure has continued to prove effective in curing the many sickened animals tainted by the Taurogrim in Eryn Lasgalen."}},
[12808]={nameES="The Plight of the Játsakori",objectivesES={"Talk to Faeron","Talk to the guard","Talk to Nabatínu","Faeron has offered to assist the Jatsakóri and will meet you back at the Rangers' camp south of Gadim-ûn. You should go to the Ranger camp and talk to Rhadrog.","The Plight of the Játsakori","Nabatínu, who leads the people inside Gadim-ûn, a place in north-eastern An Shêru, has identified himself as an enemy of Ordâkh, and recommends against going any further west into An Shêru. You should talk to Faeron about what Nabatínu has said.","Faeron suggested talking to these people to learn more about them. You should talk to the guard at Gadim-ûn, a place in north-eastern An Shêru.","Talk to Rhadrog at his camp","The guard has directed you to speak with his leader, Nabatínu, inside Gadim-ûn, a place in north-eastern An Shêru.","Nabatínu has told you that he and the others here were once thralls of the Ordâkhai and have now found their freedom. They work to free the others still bound in thralldom. You should discuss the situation with Faeron.","Faeron has asked Nabatínu, leader of the people inside Gadim-ûn in north-eastern An Shêru, if he knows of any areas of blight in An Shêru. You should talk to Nabatínu to hear his answer.","Following tracks in the sand has led you to a group of unknown people."}},
[12809]={nameES="El Arado y las Estrellas",objectivesES={"Halson Fondocuba, posadero de El Arado y las Estrellas, participa en la fiesta de fabricación de cerveza de las Cuatro Cuadernas.","Wilcome Tunelero está en Scary, al este de Tejonera. La posada El Arado y las Estrellas está en Tejonera, al oeste de Scary.\
\
Halson Fondocuba, de El Arado y las Estrellas, te ha enviado a Scary para buscar un envío de yeso que se ha extraviado.","Los trasgos que robaron la carreta que transportaba el yeso venían de los Valles Rasgados, al norte de Tejonera.\
\
Parece que los trasgos se han apoderado del yeso destinado a El Arado y las Estrellas. Deberías viajar a su campamento y buscar la carreta perdida.","Recogido el yeso en polvo","Recoge el yeso en polvo","El Arado y las Estrellas","Lleva el yeso a Halson Fondocuba"}},
[12810]={nameES="El puerto saqueado",objectivesES={"El puerto saqueado","Las cajas de tesoro se encuentran en el puerto fluvial de Kheledûl, al este de Gondamon.\
\
Askell ha ideado un nuevo plan para castigar a los Duramano por la muerte de Gellir. Te Ha pedido que asaltes la ciudad portuaria de kheledûl Y recuperes las cajas de tesoro robadas a los barbiluengos por los Duramano.","Lleva las cajas de tesoro a Askell","Insatisfecho con la muerte de los Duramano que mataron a su hermano, askell Quiere ahora perjudicar aún más a los Duramano Recuperando sus tesoros robados."}},
[12811]={nameES="The Plunderers' Crown",objectivesES={}},
[12812]={nameES="The Point of It All",objectivesES={"Talk to Doron","Cabed hopes that the Easterling-blade and the red-tipped arrow will force action to be taken against the inhabitants of Ost Celebrant.","Idmar is horrified that an Easterling lurks in Parth Celebrant and demands that you speak with Doron","Talk to Idmar","The Point of It All","Idmar is at his camp along the road in central Parth Celebrant.\
\
You should bring the items to Idmar.","Doron is among his men on the crest of the hill in western Parth Celebrant.\
\
Idmar wants you to speak with Doron regarding the Easterling."}},
[12813]={nameES="The Poison Test",objectivesES={"Feed Spearflower to one of the goats in Imloth Melui","Talk to Brunil in the Hall of the Gentle Hand","Feed Dusk-flower to one of the goats in Imloth Melui","The goat did not enjoy the Maresfoot! Is this ingredient to blame?","The goat readily eats the herb out of your hand. You watch it closely after it's done.","The goat stares at you blandly.","The Poison Test","Brunil can be found in the Hall of the Gentle Hand, on the western side of Imloth Melui.\
\
You fed all the ingredients in the draught to the goats, and the Maresfoot seemed to be disagreeable. You should return to Brunil with what you have learned.","Feed Maresfoot to one of the goats in Imloth Melui","The goats can be found north-east of the Hall of the Gentle Hand, at the bottom of the long stairs.\
\
Brunil has asked you to feed each ingredient in the healing draught to a goat, one after another.","Brunil has isolated the ingredients in the medicine that worsened the condition of her patients, and she thinks one of them might be poisoned.","The goat stares at you for a moment, but you are unable to hold its attention."}},
[12814]={nameES="The Poison's Cure",objectivesES={"The Poison's Cure","The poisoned patients can be found throughout the Hall of the Gentle Hand in Imloth Melui.\
\
You should administer the compounded cure to the patients who drank the poison.","Talk to Brunil in the Hall of the Gentle Hand","Bubbles form in the cure as you add the Dewleaf to the mixture","The healer's workbench is right by Brunil in the Hall of the Gentle Hand. It is where she makes all of her medicines.\
\
Brunil has prepared the cure, and it will be complete once you add the Dewleaf. The cure waits for you on the healer's workbench.","Return to Brunil in the Hall of the Gentle Hand","Brunil wants you to hurry and help her cure the patients that drank the tainted healing draught.","Merenir has come to the Hall of the Gentle Hand with a troubling report.","Brunil can be found in the Hall of the Gentle Hand, in Imloth Melui.\
\
You should tell Brunil that the cure has been administered to all the poisoned patients.","Talk to Merenir in the Hall of the Gentle Hand","Brunil can be found in the Hall of the Gentle Hand, on the western side of Imloth Melui.\
\
You have collected as much Dewleaf as you could find, and should bring it to Brunil.","Dewleaf can be found on the bluff above River Erui, south-west of the entrance to Imloth Melui.\
\
Brunil has asked you to fetch as much Dewleaf as you can in order to counteract the poison her patients consumed.","Add the Dewleaf to the cure at the healer's workbench in the Hall of the Gentle Hand"}},
[12815]={nameES="The Poisoned Mind",objectivesES={}},
[12816]={nameES="El estanque",objectivesES={"Los Hombres de Bree desean ayudar a los hobbits en su concurso anual de pesca permitiendo a los pescadores capturar peces del estanque junto a la granja.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando finalice el festival actual.</rgb>","Atrapa tantos peces como puedas en veinte minutos.","El estanque de pesca se encuentra al este de la granja de Andrath.\
\
Will Marjacierva te ha pedido que captures peces para el Festival del Lithe de los hobbits.","El estanque"}},
[12817]={nameES="The Power to Rebuild",objectivesES={"Himril takes full account of all the materials you delivered.\
\
'Many thanks, traveller.\
\
'This should account for the missing materials from my ledger. You may go on your way.'","All of these building materials should account for what is missing from Himril's records. You should return to Himril.\
\
Himril is in Imloth Melui.","Talk to Himril","The Power to Rebuild","An Elf surveys building materials in an effort to hasten the progress with which the land is restored.","Himril has asked you to travel to Arnach to the south and search for building materials."}},
[12818]={nameES="The Practiced Arm",objectivesES={"Find and challenge Sors,  Eiviona, or Owein","You have beaten the experienced Dunlending fighter","Mair is by a large rock in the northern half of the village of Tûr Morva in Tâl Methedras.\
\
You have defeated an experienced fighter of the Falcon-clan and should return to Mair.","Mair has asked you to teach the warriors of the Falcon-clan fighting skills from the North.","You have beaten the youthful Dunlending fighter","Talk to Mair in Tûr Morva","Mair is by a large rock in the northern half of the village of Tûr Morva in Tâl Methedras.\
\
You have easily defeated a youthful fighter of the Falcon-clan and should return to Mair.","Find and challenge Yevan, Olwen, or Wundod","Yevan, Olwen, and Wundod can be found in Tûr Morva.\
\
Mair has challenged you to defeat one of the youthful fighters of the Falcon-clan in combat.","Sors, Eiviona, and Owein can be found somewhere in Tûr Morva.\
\
Mair has challenged you to defeat one of the more accomplished fighters of the Falcon-clan in Tûr Morva.","The Practiced Arm"}},
[12819]={nameES="The Price They Pay",objectivesES={"Talk to Idmar","The Price They Pay","Doron is concerned that no action will be taken against the brigands which rob the Field of Celebrant and has implored you to defeat many of the wicked Men.","The brigands have gathered to the south inside of a large camp known as Hordfierd.\
\
Doron has asked you to defeat many of the brigands which have invaded Parth Celebrant.","Idmar is at his camp along the road in central Parth Celebrant.\
\
Doron sent you to speak with Idmar, following your attack upon the brigands."}},
[12820]={nameES="El precio del progreso",objectivesES={"Mientras la vil hechicería del Señor Oscuro eleva Barad-dûr cada vez más sobre las tierras de Mordor, terribles temblores han desprendido las piedras de la Torre Oscura.","Estás destinado a servir mediante el trabajo al Señor Oscuro.","Se pueden encontrar escombros caídos por todas las mazmorras de Barad-dûr.","El precio del progreso"}},
[12821]={nameES="The Prison of Rauniel",objectivesES={}},
[12822]={nameES="The Prisoner Problem",objectivesES={"Talk to Khûldim Umûn","The Prisoner Problem","Talk to Girhâzi","You have found the prisoner, Khûldim Umûn","Amâsu has told you that she believes Khûldim Umûn knows the location of the Dubarâkh, a hidden library archiving the history and culture of the Ambarûli people. You have talked to the prisoner and should now return to Girhâzi.","Talk to Amâsu","Girhâzi has asked you to speak to Amâsu about the prisoner.","Girhâzi has asked for your help in dealing with an Ordâkhai prisoner, the former overseer of Ambarûl, Khûldim Umûn.","Amâsu has told you that she believes Khûldim Umûn knows the location of the Dubarâkh, a hidden library archiving the history and culture of the Ambarûli people. She has asked you to talk to the prisoner in the cell on the west side of the lodge and see what you can learn.","Find where the prisoner is held"}},
[12823]={nameES="The Prisoner Returns",objectivesES={"Use the horn to draw Dargum's attention and defeat Grazadh","The Nink-hai leader can be found at the end of the mountain pass in the mountains.\
\
Langfrith has asked you to infiltrate the Orc camp and defeat the leader of the tribe.","The Prisoner Returns","You have defeated Grazadh, but Dargum has escaped","Explore the Nink-hai camp along the mountain path east of Faldham.\
\
Langfrith has asked you to infiltrate the Orc camp and overthrow the leader of the tribe.","Langfrith awaits oustide the mead hall of Faldham.\
\
Langfrith will wish to know of the events that transpired when you confronted the Nink-hai leader.","You have encountered Dargum, the Nink-hai leader","Enter the Nink-hai camp and locate their leader","The Nink-hai threat looms ever present. Langfrith believes that the only solution will be to defeat the Nink-hai Orc's task-master.","Return to Langfrith and inform him of Dargum's escape","The horn has drawn Dargum's attention"}},
[12824]={nameES="El Prisionero de Barad Morlas",objectivesES={"Habla con Dornhador","Salva a Anurandir","Anurandir ha escapado de Barad Morlas","Anurandir fue capturado por semiorcos, y depende de ti salvarlo.","Regresa a Dornhador en Echad Eregion.\
\
Informa a Dornhador que has rescatado a Anurandir.","Lleva a Anurandir a un lugar seguro.","El Prisionero de Barad Morlas"}},
[12825]={nameES="The Problem with the Lumber Camp",objectivesES={"Talk to Dervorin","Dervorin wants to know why lumber production is so slow.\
\
Talk to Dravron about why his camp is not putting out lumber.","Dravron mentioned that his leadership of the camp stems from a land claim passed down through his family.\
\
Report this finding to Dervorin in Ethring.","Talk to Dravron","Dervorin is frustrated with the lack of output from the nearby lumber camp.","The Problem with the Lumber Camp"}},
[12826]={nameES="La Promesa de los Girasoles",objectivesES={"La Promesa de los Girasoles","Habla con Edlothon en el campo cerca de Casa del Bosque","Habla con Haerandel en el Recinto del Festival","Edlothon está junto a una hilera de girasoles en un campo no muy lejos del pueblo hobbit de Casa del Bosque.","Haerandel está en el Recinto del Festival de las Tierras de Bree.","Habla con Marjoram Cosechalana en el pueblo de Casa del Bosque","Encontraste a Edlothon antes de que su compañía de Elfos alcanzara su destino, y ha decidido prestarte atención en este asunto de pétalos, flores y relatos.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro cuando finalice el evento asociado.</rgb>","Investiga la cuestión de la Anarlossë en el pueblo de Casa del Bosque","Habla con Edlothon en el pueblo de Casa del Bosque","Marjoram Cosechalana te contó que flores del sol bordean un campo agrícola al norte de Casa del Bosque.","Una hilera de girasoles bordea el campo, y Edlothon las observa con asombro en los ojos.","Este cuadro sí se asemeja bastante al Anarlossë descrito por Haerandel.","Edlothon te ha pedido que hables con los hobbits de Casa del Bosque para averiguar si la legendaria Anarlossë logró sobrevivir al declive del Reino del Norte.","Una hobbit cercana ríe alegremente y hace una reverencia entusiasta.","Edlothon te ha acompañado al pueblo hobbit de Maderzal, donde encontraste indicios de una flor que recuerda al legendario Anarlossë.","Marjoram Cosechalana desea hablar contigo y con Edlothon.","Encuentra los girasoles en el campo al norte de Casa del Bosque"}},
[12827]={nameES="The Prospector's Shack",objectivesES={"You should find the prospector's shack down in the Limlight Gorge.","Find the prospector's shack","Prospectors have dared the dangers of the Limlight Gorge, determined to reap the mineral bounty of the Gorge.","You should speak with the remaining prospector from the expedition.","Talk to Brid","The Prospector's Shack","You found the prospector's shack"}},
[12828]={nameES="The Provisioner's Assistant",objectivesES={"Assisted Offram with Blankets for the Winter","Assisted Offram with Making Meat-pies","Talk to Offram outside the Vendor Hall in Eaworth","Assist Offram with Making Meat-pies","Assist Offram with Blankets for the Winter","The Provisioner's Assistant","Assist Offram with Horns for Battle","Offram was pleased with your hunting prowess and offering of meat, hides, and ivory from the aurochs of the Vale.","Assisted Offram with Horns for Battle","Offram stands guard outside the Vendor Hall at Eaworth.\
\
Offram has asked you to help provision the garrison and town of Eaworth.","Offram stands guard outside the Vendor Hall in Eaworth.\
\
You should return to Offram with news of your successes."}},
[12829]={nameES="La Bóveda enigma",objectivesES={"Bávor Piedraroja está al otro lado de la Mansión de Thorin, hacia el sur.\
\
Ahora que has resuelto el acertijo de la bóveda enigma, deberías recoger el tesoro y llevarlo de vuelta con Bávor Piedraroja.","Recoge el contenido de la bóveda enigma","La bóveda está al otro lado de la Mansión de Thorin, al norte y subiendo las escaleras.\
\
Acciona las palancas de la bóveda en el orden correcto. Si cometes un error, vuelve con Bávor Piedraroja para reiniciar los engranajes.","La Bóveda enigma","Lleva el contenido de la bóveda enigma a Bávor Piedraroja","Tomas una gran roca negra y tosca de la bóveda.","Acciona la segunda palanca","Ahora que has ensamblado todos los engranajes, es hora de abrir la bóveda.\
\
Encontraste estas pistas grabadas en las caras de los engranajes:\
\
El hacha muerde profundo antes del primer amanecer.\
\
El sol se alza después de que la luna se ha ocultado.\
\
Una joya puede encontrarse a la luz del sol.\
\
Las joyas solo se encuentran tras mucho esfuerzo.\
\
Antes que todo, puede verse la luz plateada de la luna.","Acciona la tercera palanca","Acciona la cuarta palanca","Acciona la primera palanca"}},
[12830]={nameES="La intendente",objectivesES={"La llegada masiva de refugiados a Archet ha causado una escasez de suministros, y la intendente del capitán Helecharroyo, Peg Pruner, tiene dificultades para abastecer a los refugiados.","Debe completarse antes de la \\qIntroducción.\\q","La intendente","Peg Pruner está en el extremo norte de la plaza de Archet.\
\
El condestable Cardoso mencionó que Peg Pruner podría necesitar ayuda para reunir comida para los habitantes desplazados de Archet."}},
[12831]={nameES="The Quays of the Harlond -- Tier 1",objectivesES={"Defeated Kálmok and his squadron","Regroup with Aragorn.","<rgb=#FF0000>Halbarad must survive</rgb>","Regroup with Aragorn","<rgb=#FF0000>Legolas must survive</rgb>","Elladan has fallen in battle!","<rgb=#FF0000>Elrohir must survive</rgb>","Make your way through the Harlond with Aragorn","Defeat Kálmok and his squadron","The Quays of the Harlond -- Tier 1","Clear the Enemy off the of the blockaded bridge.","Defeat Orcs with Gimli and Halbarad","<rgb=#FF0000>Gimli must survive</rgb>","Derrota al Despojador Proscrito","Defeated the Forsaken Reaver","Aragorn and his army have landed in the Harlond, unbeknownst to the enemy and many of the men who fight for Gondor.","Help Legolas, Elladan, and Elrohir defeat a Mûmak.","Gimli has fallen in battle!","Open the southern gate of the Rammas Echor so that Aragorn's men may make haste to the battle.","Defeat Orcs with Gimli and Halbarad.","Legolas has fallen in battle!","Elrohir has fallen in battle!","Help Legolas, Elladan, and Elrohir defeat a Mûmak","<rgb=#FF0000>Elladan must survive</rgb>","Aragorn has fallen in battle!","Make your way through the Harlond with Aragorn's forces.","<rgb=#FF0000>Aragorn must survive</rgb>","Halbarad has fallen in battle!"}},
[12832]={nameES="The Quays of the Harlond -- Tier 2",objectivesES={"Defeated Kálmok and his squadron","Regroup with Aragorn.","<rgb=#FF0000>Halbarad must survive</rgb>","Regroup with Aragorn","<rgb=#FF0000>Legolas must survive</rgb>","Elladan has fallen in battle!","<rgb=#FF0000>Elrohir must survive</rgb>","Make your way through the Harlond with Aragorn","The Quays of the Harlond -- Tier 2","Defeat Kálmok and his squadron","Clear the Enemy off the of the blockaded bridge.","Defeat Orcs with Gimli and Halbarad","<rgb=#FF0000>Gimli must survive</rgb>","Derrota al Despojador Proscrito","Defeated the Forsaken Reaver","Aragorn and his army have landed in the Harlond, unbeknownst to the enemy and many of the men who fight for Gondor.","Help Legolas, Elladan, and Elrohir defeat a Mûmak.","Gimli has fallen in battle!","Open the southern gate of the Rammas Echor so that Aragorn's men may make haste to the battle.","Defeat Orcs with Gimli and Halbarad.","Legolas has fallen in battle!","Elrohir has fallen in battle!","Aragorn has fallen in battle!","<rgb=#FF0000>Elladan must survive</rgb>","Help Legolas, Elladan, and Elrohir defeat a Mûmak","Make your way through the Harlond with Aragorn's forces.","<rgb=#FF0000>Aragorn must survive</rgb>","Halbarad has fallen in battle!"}},
[12833]={nameES="The Queen of Boars",objectivesES={}},
[12834]={nameES="The Queen of Bones",objectivesES={"Râsabur has worked up the courage to challenge Eshen-erêz, the Bone-queen.","(Optional) Use the Aradûni Horn to call for Râsabur and begin the fight","Râsabur needs your help defeating Eshen-erêz, the Bone-queen.\
\
You should go to the centre of Ushumût, signal Râsabur by blowing the Aradûni Horn, and then defeat Eshen-erêz, the Bone-queen.","Talk to Râsabur","Defeated Eshen-erêz, the Bone-queen","Defeat Eshen-erêz, the Bone-queen","The Queen of Bones","You have defeated the Bone-queen.\
\
You should regroup with Râsabur near the rock where you first met."}},
[12835]={nameES="La cámara de la reina",objectivesES={"Nud-heden nunca se recuperará hasta que la reina grodbog sea eliminada.","Reina grodbog derrotada","Habla con Auti en Guardia Orca","La reina grodbog está en Nud-heden, en el interior del Agujero Chirriante, al sureste de Guardia Orca.\
\
Auti está convencido de que la infestación grodbog no será resuelta hasta que su reina sea derrotada.","Derrota a la reina grodbog","Auti está en Guardia Orca, al noroeste de Nud-heden.\
\
Auti se alegrará de oír de que la reina grodbog ha sido derrotada y que los insectos han abandonado Nud-heden.","La cámara de la reina"}},
[12836]={nameES="La cámara de la reina",objectivesES={"Nud-heden tiene ahora la oportunidad de ser reclamada por alguien que no sea los gredbyg. ¿Volverán los enanos a llamar este sitio su hogar?\
\
Khazad-dûm no recuperará su gloria de una sola vez, pero, piedra por piedra, volverá a brillar.","Nud-heden nunca se recuperará hasta que la reina grodbog sea eliminada.","Reina grodbog derrotada","La reina grodbog de Nud-heden está poniendo huevos y cuidando de las larvas. Está creando un enjambre para protegerse, mientras sigue reproduciéndose ilesa.\
\
Debes derrotar a la reina grodbog de Nud-heden.","Derrota a la reina grodbog","La reina grodbog fue derrotada","Mientras la reina grodbog siga viva, los enanos nunca recuperarán su antiguo y honorable hogar. Hay que acabar con ella. Solo entonces este lugar podrá estar en paz.","La cámara de la reina"}},
[12837]={nameES="El Camino Más Rápido",objectivesES={"No lograste llegar a la rueda de agua a tiempo","Llega a la rueda de agua situada en el fondo del barranco antes de que se acabe el tiempo","Dervel Crintach te desafió a llegar, antes de que se acabe el tiempo, a la rueda de agua situada en el fondo del barranco en el que está construido Glyn Helyg","El Camino Más Rápido","Addo Benchuth está esperando para hablar contigo sobre tu logro","Dervel Crintach ha hecho una apuesta y quiere involucrarte en ella","Habla con Addo Benchuth junto a la rueda de agua"}},
[12838]={nameES="The Race",objectivesES={}},
[12839]={nameES="The Raiding Parties",objectivesES={}},
[12840]={nameES="The Raiding Party",objectivesES={"An elite raiding party of Uruk-hai wander the Beacon Hills searching for the Rohirrim. Their tracking has taken them to the main road towards Taur Drúadan and soon they will be upon the Rohirrim War-stead if they are not dealt with swiftly.","You have defeated the Uruk-hai raiding party, and protected the Beacon Hills and the Rohirrim from their blades and arrows.","An elite raiding party of Uruk-hai can be found in the eastern edge of the Beacon Hills.\
\
You should defeat the Uruk-hai raiding party.","Defeated the Mordor Warleader","Completado","An elite raiding party of Uruk-hai have been wandering the Beacon Hills, searching for the Rohirrim.","Defeat the Mordor Warleader","The Raiding Party","Defeated the Uruk-hai raiding party."}},
[12841]={nameES="The Raiding Party",objectivesES={"Huneric, Lord of the Thíuda, has noticed forces gathering at Mokh Darga and wishes to halt the imminent raid before it can form.","Talk to Huneric","Soldiers can be found sleeping in their tents in Adambel.\
\
You should summon the soldiers for Huneric.","Huneric can be found in Adambel.\
\
You should talk to Huneric.","The Raiding Party"}},
[12842]={nameES="El Rastro del Montaraz",objectivesES={"Tras un largo viaje de muchas millas, has llegado por fin a la aldea de Archet. Aragorn fue visto recientemente viajando en las cercanías de este tranquilo pueblo.","El Rastro del Montaraz","Habla con Jon Helecharroyo frente a los restos de la taberna, en la aldea de Archet","Jon Helecharroyo está frente a los restos de la Taberna del Tejón Loco, en la aldea incendiada de Archet.\
\
Letty Colazorro te ha dicho que hables con Jon Helecharroyo sobre el paradero de Aragorn, quien dejó la aldea de Archet poco antes de que fuera atacada por los bandidos Montebruno. Jon está a cargo de reconstruir la aldea ahora que su padre ha muerto.","Ayudando a la gente de las Tierras de Bree te volverás lo bastante fuerte como para encontrar a Aragorn"}},
[12843]={nameES="Los Montaraces de Esteldín",objectivesES={"Los Montaraces de Esteldín","Nethúr está en Esteldín, lejos al este de Evendim.\
\
Calenglad te envió a hablar con Nethúr.","Calenglad de Tinnudir te ha pedido que hables con Nethúr de Esteldín, en las Quebradas del Norte, acerca de los Montaraces de Esteldín y de las fuerzas orcas que descienden desde Angmar."}},
[12844]={nameES="The Rangers of the South",objectivesES={"Duindir is located in the western section of Southern Ithilien.\
\
You should speak to the Ranger on the path outside of the ruins.","The Western Post can be found on top of the western cliffs in Southern Ithilien.\
\
You should search tents at the Western Post for information as to the Rangers' whereabouts.","Luntil beckons you to speak with her.","You hear the sounds of men coming from the nearby ruins","A Ranger has been bound and interrogated by the Haradrim!","The path from the Western Post leads north-east, further into Southern Ithilien.\
\
You should explore further up the road into South Ithilien. Perhaps you will find the elusive Rangers there.","Luntil offers to row you across the Anduin to the tree-covered hills of South Ithilien. There, you hope to make it to Osgiliath without significant delay.","Duindir is located in the western section of Southern Ithilien.\
\
You should rescue the Ranger from the Haradrim.","Duindir is located in the western section of Southern Ithilien.\
\
You should investigate the sounds coming from the ruins.","The Western Post can be found on top of the western cliffs in Southern Ithilien.\
\
You should speak with a Ranger at the Western Post.","Search for any Rangers","Duindir is located in the western section of Southern Ithilien.\
\
You heard signs of a struggle there, but found only Haradrim. You should search the ruins for signs of any Rangers.","Rescue the captured Ranger","Luntil insists that the Rangers will help provide safe travels through Ithilien","You hear sounds of a struggle as you enter the ruins. The place is crawling with Haradrim!","Luntil's boat can be found hidden amongst the reeds on the shores of the Anduin in Lossarnach.\
\
Luntil has asked you to step aboard her boat when you are ready to travel to Southern Ithilien.","Luntil can be found on the shores of the Anduin in Southern Ithilien.\
\
You should speak to Luntil about the favour she asked in exchange for ferrying you across.","Speak to Luntil","The Rangers of the South","You find nothing of interest","There doesn't seem to be anyone at the camp-site","Explore further up the road","Speak with Gladhir","Cross the river by boat","Speak to a Ranger at the nearby camp-site","Investigate the sounds coming from the ruins"}},
[12845]={nameES="El rescate de Angmar",objectivesES={"Lleva las órdenes de los Angmarim a Esko","Los Angmarim están acampados cerca del Mur de Hierro, al noreste de Pynti-peldot.\
\
Esko te ha pedido que registres los campamentos de los Angmarim en busca de pruebas de la Joya de Hielo.","Los Angmarim están acampados cerca del Mur de Hierro, en las montañas de Forochel, muy al este de la bahía.\
\
Esko te ha pedido que registres los campamentos de los Angmarim en busca de alguna prueba de la Joya de Hielo.","Busca pruebas de la Joya de Hielo","Esko te contó la historia de la Joya de Hielo y cómo los Angmarim la están utilizando como instrumento de presión contra los Lossoth.","Esko se encuentra en Pynti-peldot, al suroeste del Mur de Hierro.\
\
Has encontrado un conjunto de órdenes que indican cuándo y dónde será introducida la Joya de Hielo en Forochel. Deberías llevarlas a Esko de inmediato.","Has encontrado órdenes relacionadas con la Joya de Hielo","El rescate de Angmar"}},
[12846]={nameES="The Ransomer's Rival",objectivesES={"To ensure the return of her sons, Glánhar requires Jarl Akhiz's brooch to complete the ransom.","Found the stolen brooch","The rival Jarl's camp is near the Firien Wood, west of Ost Rimmon.\
\
Search for the stolen brooch among the camp.","Now that you have the stolen brooch, you should bring it to Gondrad, who waits near the camp in the Firien Wood.","Searched the chest","You have found the rival captain's camp","Talk to Gondrad","Find the stolen brooch","Find the rival Jarl's camp near the Firien Wood, in the western Beacon Hills.","The Ransomer's Rival","Meet Gondrad near the rival captain's camp"}},
[12847]={nameES="The Ravages of the Taurogrim",objectivesES={"Talk to Thorlind","The Ravages of the Taurogrim","Thorlind can be found near Tholkát in Eryn Lasgalen.\
\
You should talk to Thorlind.","Scarred trees can be found near Tholkát in Eryn Lasgalen.\
\
You should heal scarred trees.","The Taurogrim are a destructive force, poisoning wildlife and destroying plants as they spread. Thorlind has asked you to heal the trees that have been scarred by their ravaging."}},
[12848]={nameES="El cuervo",objectivesES={"El cuervo te mira con expresión desolada, pero de pronto bate las alas con furia y se lanza hacia una abertura en las rocas.","El cuervo de Cenlieg está ahora a salvo.","Encuentra y rescata al cuervo de Cenlieg","Habla con Cenlieg","Cenlieg, el Sabio, ha perdido a sus compañeros y se encuentra varado en Kauppa-kohta. Envió a su cuervo para encontrar rastros de ellos, pero el ave no ha regresado.","El cuervo de Cenlieg puede encontrarse cerca de un afloramiento rocoso al suroeste de Kauppa-kohta.\
\
Cenlieg te ha pedido que encuentres a su cuervo desaparecido.","El cuervo","Cenlieg se encuentra en Kauppa-kohta, al noreste del afloramiento rocoso donde encontraste al cuervo.\
\
Has encontrado al cuervo de Cenlieg, pero se ocultó rápidamente presa del pánico. Tal vez deberías volver a hablar con Cenlieg."}},
[12849]={nameES="The Ravens of the North",objectivesES={"The Ravens of the North","Deliver the trinkets to Dís at Ravenhill","Dís has long tended the ravens that still dwell in the heights of Ravenhill, but the once-strong friendship between the ravens and Durin's Folk has faded nearly to naught.","Trinkets are carried by many of the Jangovar in the North.\
\
Dís has suggested that renewing the old practice of offering shiny trinkets to the ravens might aid in rebuilding a friendship between Durin's Folk and their kind.","Dís can be found at Ravenhill.\
\
You have gathered many trinkets from the Jangovar and should now deliver them to Dís."}},
[12850]={nameES="The Reach of Justice",objectivesES={"Return to Erna","Talk to Víthog","Bring the memory-cloth to Turáh","You should return Queen Regent Erna, in the Great-keep in Dale, with the news that Athálrik chose death over justice.","You should bring the memory-cloth back to Sangemêkh Turáh, in the refugee camps in the hills east of Dale.","You should talk to Víthog, the old forester in the highlands west of Lake-town.","The old forester Víthog will lead you to Athálrik, where you can confront him for his accused crimes.","You should talk to Víthog, who has approached after your confrontation with Athálrik.","The Reach of Justice","The Queen Regent and young king listen to your account.\
\
'The news you bear is grave indeed. It is troubling that Athálrik could not be brought to face due and proper justice.\
\
'However, I judge your dealings in the matter honest, and your course of action the necessary one. And for your service in the protection of Dale, we thank you.'"}},
[12851]={nameES="The Rebuilding Process",objectivesES={"A fresh shipment of building materials has arrived in Halach.","The Rebuilding Process","Gorhir has asked you to take a crate to Irodon, who is supervising rebuilding efforts in the centre of Halach.\
\
You can take the crate from the pile next to Gorhir.","Talk to Gorhir","Pick up a heavy crate from the pile","You've delivered the crate to Irodon.\
\
You should confirm with Gorhir at Halach's harbour."}},
[12852]={nameES="The Reclamation of Talath Anor",objectivesES={"Travel to Parth Gladló to search for Haradrim","With renewed spirit, Éomer, King of Rohan, has decided to send Elfhelm to lead an attack against a band of Haradrim who has fled into Talath Anor.","Talk to Elfhelm at Parth Gladló","Habla con Éomer","Many Haradrim are encamped here","You should talk to Elfhelm at Parth Gladló, north of the after-battle Pelennor.","Travel to Parth Gladló, north of the after-battle Pelennor, to search for Haradrim.","The Reclamation of Talath Anor","You should talk to Éomer at Aragorn's Pavilion on the after-battle Pelennor.","You should defeat Haradrim at Parth Gladló, north of the after-battle Pelennor."}},
[12853]={nameES="The Red Fields",objectivesES={"Talk to Reeve Athelward at the Mead Hall of Cliving","The Red Fields lie to the south-east of the city, in the area between Cliving and Elthengels.","The Red Fields","Reeve Athelward resides in his Mead Hall, at the eastern edge of Cliving.\
\
You have overcome the mounted Orc-archers that have been terrorizing people in the Red Fields.","The bands of Orc-archers that roam across the fields between Cliving and Elthengels have been terrorizing the people of the Norcrofts. Their territory has become so dangerous and violent that it has been nicknamed the Red Fields."}},
[12854]={nameES="El Paso Rojo (comunidad)",objectivesES={"Ahora puedes disfrutar de la versión comunitaria de la instancia El Paso Rojo cuando lo desees.","El Paso Rojo (comunidad)","Experimenta la versión comunitaria de la instancia El Paso Rojo","Completado","Experimenta la versión comunitaria de la instancia El Paso Rojo."}},
[12855]={nameES="El Paso Rojo (solo)",objectivesES={"Experimenta la versión para un solo jugador de la instancia El Paso Rojo..","Experimenta la versión para un solo jugador de la instancia El Paso Rojo.","Ahora puedes disfrutar de la versión para un solo jugador de la instancia El Paso Rojo cuando lo desees.","El Paso Rojo (solo)","Experimenta la versión para un solo jugador de la instancia El Paso Rojo","Completado"}},
[12856]={nameES="The Reeve Restored",objectivesES={"The pendant can be found on a table next to Fastred inside the Mead Hall of Snowbourn.","Talk to Fastred","The Reeve Restored","Pick up Fastred's pendant","Fastred wishes to speak with you about your victories in the Sutcrofts, and the great work you have done for the safety of his people.","Fastred can be found inside the Mead Hall of Snowbourn.\
\
You should speak again with Fastred.","The delicate pendant has beautiful etchings of wheat wreathing a bold red gemstone... a true token of the Sutcrofts"}},
[12857]={nameES="The Reeve of the Entwash Vale",objectivesES={"The Reeve of the Entwash Vale","Burnoth awaits you outside the Mead Hall of Eaworth.\
\
You should speak with Burnoth when you are ready to accompany him into the Mead Hall.","You have met up once more with the Riders Four outside the Mead Hall of Eaworth.","Burnoth awaits you outside the Mead Hall of Eaworth.\
\
You should speak with Burnoth regarding Reeve Ingbert's response.","Talk to Burnoth to accompany him into the Mead Hall of Eaworth","Burnoth has agreed to help the Reeve in exchange for a conscription to the muster of the Eastemnet","Talk to Burnoth outside the Mead Hall of Eaworth"}},
[12858]={nameES="The Reeve of the Norcrofts",objectivesES={"Talk to Burnoth in Cliving","The Riders Four have come to Cliving to warn Reeve Athelward of the impending invasion of the Khundolar.","Reeve Athelward is in the Mead Hall of Cliving.\
\
Burnoth has asked you to relate his message regarding the Khundolar invasion to Reeve Athelward.","Burnoth is encamped with his Riders outside the Mead Hall of Cliving.\
\
You should return to Burnoth with Athelward's reply.","The Reeve of the Norcrofts","Talk to Athelward at the Mead Hall of Cliving"}},
[12859]={nameES="The Reeve of the Sutcrofts",objectivesES={"Burnoth stands outside the Mead Hall of Snowbourn.\
\
You should speak with Burnoth and discover what to do next.","Talk to the doorwarden at the Mead Hall of Snowbourn","The Reeve of the Sutcrofts","You have encountered the Riders Four once more in Snowbourn, capital of the Sutcrofts.","Talk to Burnoth outside the Mead Hall of Snowbourn","The doorwarden stands before the doors to the Mead Hall of Snowbourn.\
\
You should seek entrance to the Mead Hall of Snowbourn."}},
[12860]={nameES="The Reeve of the Wold",objectivesES={"Talk to Burnoth at the refugee camp outside Harwick","The Reeve of the Wold","Harding sighs.\
\
'I know what message you would deliver on behalf of Burnoth and his Riders, and it is futile.\
\
'The strength of the Khundolar is not unknown to me -- already I prepare to defend the Eastemnet from their advance, and I will die defending Rohan. In truth, I know this, for I have seen the omens.\
\
'Go now and leave me to my work.'","Aldor Harding is at the Mead Hall of Harwick.\
\
Burnoth has asked you to speak with Aldor Harding and deliver news of the Easterlings' true strength.","Burnoth and the Riders Four have been unable to secure an audience with Harding, Reeve of the Wold and Aldor of the Eastemnet.","Burnoth is at the refugee camp, outside of Harwick.\
\
You should return to Burnoth with Harding's reply.","Talk to Harding at the Mead Hall of Harwick"}},
[12861]={nameES="The Reeve's Family",objectivesES={"As you enter, you see an older Woman to your left, and the noises of a child upstairs","Beneath the veil of this Rohirric bassinet, you see a small boy. He coos inquisitively at your presence, but then appears to lull himself back to sleep.","Fastred has set out a drink on the table in front of him inside of the Mead Hall of Snowbourn.\
\
Reeve Fastred bids you drink with him.","Talk to Folcred","Talk to Fastred","Talk to Elflád","As you finish your drink, Fastred looks as if he has more yet to say","Share a drink with Fastred","After meeting with Fastred's family, you should now return to him in the Mead Hall","Fastred can be found inside the Mead Hall of Snowbourn.\
\
Reeve Fastred desires to speak with you.","Elflád can be found on the second floor of Fastred's home in central Snowbourn.","Fastred has appreciated your labour thus far and wishes for you to meet his family before speaking further with him.","Elflád's words are bold, mirroring the resolve of her husband","Talk to Théodhild","Talk to Fastred in the Mead Hall of Snowbourn","Folcred can be found on the second floor of Fastred's house near Elflád.","Fastred's home can be found slightly south and east of the Mead Hall.","Théodhild can be found inside Fastred's home in central Snowbourn.","Fastred can be found inside the Mead Hall of Snowbourn.\
\
Cynelac has informed you that Fastred wants to speak with you after you have finished meeting with his family.","The Reeve's Family","Fastred's mother grows concerned by her son's leadership, but will say no more","Enter Fastred's home"}},
[12862]={nameES="The Refugees of Garsfeld",objectivesES={}},
[12863]={nameES="The Reluctant Captive",objectivesES={"You should speak with the Black Númenórean captive.","The captive flinches","It seems the captive's will is starting to break","Intimidate the Black Númenórean captive","The Reluctant Captive","Talk to the captive","Try talking to the captive again","Gondorian soldiers have intercepted a Black Númenórean fleeing from Barad-dûr.","You should intimidate the Black Númenórean captive.","You should intimidate the Black Númenórean captive again.","The captive looks worried","The captive does nothing","Talk to the Black Númenórean captive","You question the captive. The man seems to have no interest in anything you tell him or any question you ask."}},
[12864]={nameES="The Remnants of Grárik",objectivesES={"Dwarves of Nori's expedition might be found in Skarháld.\
\
After learning that a small company of Longbeards has remained in Skarháld, Dori has asked you to speak to them and learn if his brother has abandoned his quest.","After learning that a small company of Longbeards has made camp in Skarháld, Dori hopes to learn more of the fate of his brother's expedition.","Find the dwarves of Nori's expedition in Skarháld","Dori can be found at the stables in eastern Skarháld.\
\
Troubling tales have been spreading among the Zhélruka in Skarháld. You should return to Dori and tell him what you have learned.","You discover the dwarf, Órug, standing among a few of his kin...","Talk to Dori at Skarháld","The Remnants of Grárik","Órug can be found in the heights of Skarháld.\
\
You have discovered the dwarf, Órug, standing with a small company of Longbeards, but you have not found Nori. You should speak to Órug.","Órug can be found in the heights of Skarháld.\
\
You have gathered a great deal of meat and firewood for the Longbeards in Skarháld. You should now deliver the supplies to Órug.","Zhélruka can be found throughout Skarháld.\
\
Órug informed you that Nori continued the expedition to Thikil-gundu, but he knows little else. You should speak to the Zhélruka and try to pry information out of them.","Meat can be collected from any of the beasts in the Ered Mithrin, and fallen branches can be found within the Thornholt.\
\
Órug has asked for your aid in supplying his group, but he is uncertain if he can help Dori and Company.","Talk to Órug","Deliver the meat and firewood to Órug at Skarháld"}},
[12865]={nameES="The Remnants of Orcs",objectivesES={"Reniaril beckons you to her.\
\
'You look like you can take care of yourself.'\
\
She studies you intently, while being aware of her surroundings.\
\
'My name is Reniaril. I'm in charge of patrols along these roads. We could use someone of your ability if you could help. Imloth Melui has got its hands full with restoration efforts, and we have supplies being carted all along these roads. Sometimes these supplies get lost. I'm concerned that Dindal's Overlook has been overrun by remnant Orcs. I used to oversee the supply routes from there but I can no longer patrol in peace.\
\
'Just follow the road east until you see a path through the forest to the north into the cliffside. Perhaps you could do us all a favour and clear the way.'","Reniaril is concerned that Dindal's Overlook has been overrun by remnant Orcs.","Talk to Reniaril","The Remnants of Orcs","Reniaril has asked you to defeat any Orcs you find along the path to Dindal's Overlook.\
\
Dindal's Overlook can be found east of Imloth Melui.","You should inform Reniaril that Dindal's Overlook has been cleared of remnant Orcs.\
\
Reniaril can be found south of Imloth Melui and north-east of Arnach."}},
[12866]={nameES="The Remnants of Urûshoba",objectivesES={"The Jangovar encampment of Urûshoba struggles to rebuild enough to set siege to the Dale-lands once more.","Siege engines and banners can be found in the encampment of Urûshoba.\
\
You should destroy siege engines and banners.","The Remnants of Urûshoba","Completado","You have destroyed many siege engines and banners.","You have destroyed many siege engines and banners in the Jangovar encampment of Urûshoba. You have dealt a terrible blow to the Jangovar's efforts to rebuild."}},
[12867]={nameES="The Rescue in Cuthbald's Farm",objectivesES={"This is around where Oter said you should summon him to you, if you are ready to go to Cuthbald's Farm","Talk to Oter","Oter's brother must be on or around Cuthbald's Farm somewhere. With Wargs and Warg-riders around he likely didn't make it far.","Make your way to Cuthbald's Farm","Since his brother has been saved and has safely returned to Thrymm's Farm, Oter will be eager to speak with you there.","Speak with Oter","Speak with Ragnold","Ragnold will meet you back at Thrymm's Farm","The Rescue in Cuthbald's Farm","Now that he is with you, speak to Oter before heading to Cuthbald's Farm.","Use the horn on the road south of Thrymm's Farm","Speak with Oter at Thrymm's Farm","Cuthbald's Farm is the closest of the outlying farms to Thrymm's Farm, where those working the farms were supposed to meet should the outlying farms be attacked. Oter made it there and is worried because his brother Ragnold has not yet arrived.","Find Cuthbald's Farm","Find and help Oter's brother","Oter's brother was trapped under debris, but appears to be all right. He looks eager to leave Cuthbald's Farm quickly, but would like to speak to you first.","Cuthbald's Farm is south-east of Thrymm's Farm.","Oter asked you to call him over to you on your way to Cuthbald's Farm. On the road south of Thrymm's Farm is likely a good spot to summon him.","Oter's brother, Ragnold, has gone back to Thrymm's Farm. You should speak to Oter about saving his brother.","Cuthbald's Farm appears to be destroyed! Where is Oter's brother?"}},
[12868]={nameES="The Restless Dead",objectivesES={}},
[12869]={nameES="Los orcos inquietos del borde del abismo",objectivesES={"Papeles chamuscados recogidos","Se pueden encontrar orcos alrededor del Borde del Abismo en Nud-melek, cerca del puente destruido de Khazad-dûm.\
\
Debes interrogar a los orcos para descubrir qué sucedió en el puente de Khazad-dûm para causar tal inquietud.","Svanr te ha pedido que te acerques al campamento de orcos en el Borde del Abismo para ver si hay alguna evidencia de por qué el puente de Khazad-dûm está destruido.","Svanr se encuentra en el puente destruido de Khazad-dûm, en el borde oeste del abismo en Nud-melek.\
\
Debes hablar con Svanr.","Lleva los papeles chamuscados a Svanr","Los orcos inquietos del borde del abismo","Svanr lee los papeles chamuscados que le entregas.\
\
'Interesante... Veo la palabra \\qGhâsh\\q -- eso es fuego. Y miedo, terror, escrito en lengua común. Este grupo particular de orcos parece estar en movimiento, rápido, hacia el Valle del Arroyo Sombrío, ya que no son de aquí, ni desean quedarse aquí. Creo que buscan un breve respiro antes de continuar su camino.\
\
'Algo ciertamente los ha puesto inquietos, pero me pregunto qué podría haberlos hecho superar su miedo al fuego y al sol para seguir este camino. ¿Por qué se dirigen hacia el Valle?'"}},
[12870]={nameES="The Retaking of Cair Andros",objectivesES={}},
[12871]={nameES="The Return to Echad Taerdim",objectivesES={"Talk to Felgúr","Felgúr has been taken prisoner, and is being kept in Echad Taerdim.\
\
You should talk to Felgúr.","Felgúr has asked you to propose a deal to Mablung on his behalf.\
\
You should talk to Mablung in Echad Taerdim.","Complete Instance: Ambush at Echad Taerdim","Talk to Mablung","You have discovered much in Cirith Ungol, and the time has come to regroup with the Rangers of Ithilien.","Talk to Atli","Legolas wishes to return to Echad Taerdim with an injured Atli Spider-bane.\
\
You should speak with Legolas near Taurlingol to begin the journey.","The Return to Echad Taerdim","Atli Spider-bane is resting at Echad Taerdim.\
\
You should see how Atli is faring after Rûkhor's assault.","Felgúr calls to you as you turn away from Legolas","Habla con Legolas.","Legolas can be found in Echad Taerdim, the Ranger camp in Cirith Ungol.\
\
You should talk to Legolas.","Legolas has returned to Echad Taerdim, the Ranger camp in Cirith Ungol.\
\
You should talk to Legolas."}},
[12872]={nameES="The Return to Seregost",objectivesES={"Word has reached you that Faeron of the Grey Company has a plan for penetrating the defences of Seregost, and has asked for you by name. You should return to Agarnaith and see how you can help.","Faeron and Rhadrog stand before a large door","Complete: The Court of Seregost - Tier 2","Talk to Faeron","Faeron and Rhadrog are somewhere inside Seregost.\
\
You should find the Rangers.","The time to strike at the heart of Seregost has come. Meet with Faeron to discuss how you can help.","Faeron can be found at the Agarnaith Ranger camp.\
\
You should talk to Faeron.","Find the Rangers in Seregost","Complete: The Court of Seregost","Faeron is outside the Court of Seregost, in Agarnaith.\
\
You should talk to Faeron.","Talk to Rhadrog","The Return to Seregost","Faeron is waiting for you at the Agarnaith Ranger camp.\
\
You should talk to Faeron.","Complete: The Bloody Watchers","Complete: The Court of Seregost."}},
[12873]={nameES="El regreso a la Falla",objectivesES={"Muchos años atrás, valientes aventureros se enfrentaron a Thrâng, el jefe de los Ghâshfra en esta misma arena. ¿Puedes resistir las llamas y derrotarlo?","El regreso a la Falla","Thrâng derrotado","Completado.","En lo profundo de la Grieta de Nûrz Ghâshu, Thrâng, el jefe de los Ghâshfra, está listo para enfrentarse a todos los que desafíen su poder.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando abandones la instancia.</rgb>","Completado","Te has encontrado en la arena de Thrâng.\
\
¡Debes derrotar a Thrâng!","Derrota a Thrâng"}},
[12874]={nameES="The Rhudaur-stone",objectivesES={"Tûr Fúar, the Drearspire can be found at Agal Dûn.\
\
You should talk to Domongart, Chieftain of the Trév Duvárdain, at the top of Tûr Fúar.","Talk to Mézto at the top of Tûr Fúar","Talk to Domongart at the top of Tûr Fúar","Tûr Fúar, the Drearspire, can be found at Agal Dûn.\
\
You should talk to Hraubrek, Chieftain of the Grímklettar, at the top of Tûr Fúar.","Reach the top of Tûr Fúar, the Drearspire","Talk to Brathar Crack-helm at the top of Tûr Fúar","Talk to Rethvárd at the top of Tûr Fúar","Talk to Prince Ingór at the top of Tûr Fúar","Tûr Fúar, the Drearspire can be found at Agal Dûn.\
\
You should talk to Múta, Mézto, Prince Ingór, and Glóin at the top of Tûr Fúar.","The Rhudaur-stone","Tûr Fúar, the Drearspire, can be found at Agal Dûn.\
\
You should talk to Brathar Crack-helm and Rethvárd at the top of Tûr Fúar.","Talk to Múta at the top of Tûr Fúar","Talk to Glóin at the top of Tûr Fúar","The Rhudaur-stone is gone!","Talk to Hraubrek at the top of Tûr Fúar","Atop of the broken tower of the Drearspire sits the powerful Rhudaur-stone.","Tûr Fúar, the Drearspire, can be found at Agal Dûn.\
\
You should reach the top of Tûr Fúar."}},
[12875]={nameES="The Riches of Rhûn",objectivesES={"Jarl Gurthilm and his company have travelled to the stronghold of Uya Hujûm to deal their vengeance upon Zarhal Kôz and the Khundolar.","Jarl Gurthilm can be found to the south-east of Aragorn's camp on the border of Dagorlad.\
\
You have defeated the Khundolar and their treacherous leader and should now speak to Jarl Gurthilm.","The Riches of Rhûn","Talk to Jarl Gurthilm in the southern reaches of Dagorlad","Jarl Gurthilm can be found across the river to the south-west of Uya Hujûm.\
\
You have rallied to Jarl Gurthilm's side and should now aid him and his company in seeking vengeance against the Khundolar.","Talk to Jarl Gurthilm"}},
[12876]={nameES="El Buscador de Acertijos",objectivesES={"Lindir ha encontrado un nuevo acertijo para que resuelvas. Una vez más, está seguro de que la respuesta se encuentra en algún lugar de Imladris.","Lleva la insignia de Boromir a Lindir","Lindir está con Bilbo en el Salón del Fuego en Rivendel.\
\
Bilbo te dijo que Lindir tiene un nuevo acertijo para ofrecer, uno que proviene de Gondor.","Habla con Lindir","La respuesta al acertijo de Lindir se encuentra en algún lugar de Rivendel.\
\
Lindir te ha pedido que encuentres un objeto que responda a su acertijo.\
\
\
Se necesita aliento\
Advertencia atendida\
Algunos llegarán\
Con espada y cuchillo\
Mi labor termina\
Hasta que se me necesite otra vez.","Encuentra la respuesta al acertijo de Lindir en algún lugar de Rivendel","Lindir está con Bilbo en el Salón del Fuego de La Última Morada.\
\
Boromir te ha dado un símbolo que responde al acertijo de Lindir y te ha pedido que se lo lleves a él.","El Buscador de Acertijos"}},
[12877]={nameES="Juego de Acertijos",objectivesES={"Bilbo te ha pedido que lo ayudes en un juego de acertijos que está jugando con Lindir:\
\
A menudo sostengo tu mano,\
Pero no tengo manos con las que sostener.\
A menudo duermo en verano,\
Pero doy lo mejor de mí cuando hace frío.\
A menudo pierdo a mi pareja,\
Pero no siento pena, si he de ser sincero.","La respuesta al acertijo de Lindir está en algún lugar de La Última Morada en Rivendel. Lindir espera tu regreso en el Salón del Fuego.\
\
Lindir está esperando que le lleves la respuesta a su acertijo.","Habla con Lindir","Encuentra un objeto que resuelva el acertijo de Lindir","Encontraste un par de guantes de trabajo.","Lleva los guantes a Lindir en La Última Morada","Lindir está con Bilbo en el Salón del Fuego de La Última Morada\
\
Bilbo te ha pedido que hables con Lindir sobre el acertijo que le presentó al viejo hobbit.","Juego de Acertijos"}},
[12878]={nameES="El Hacedor de Acertijos",objectivesES={"Se ha encontrado una escoba de ramitas.","Bilbo está junto a Lindir en el Salón del Fuego\
\
Lindir te dijo que era el turno de Bilbo de presentar un acertijo y que deberías hablar con él.","Lleva la escoba de ramitas a Bilbo Bolsón en el Salón del Fuego","Habla con Bilbo","El Hacedor de Acertijos","Encuentra un objeto que resuelva el acertijo de Bilbo","La solución al acertijo de Bilbo se encuentra en algún lugar de La Última Morada, en Rivendel. Bilbo espera tu regreso en el Salón del Fuego.\
\
Bilbo está esperando que le lleves el objeto que resuelve su acertijo.","Bilbo tiene un acertijo propio para que lo resuelvas:\
\
Larga barba tengo de cerdas duras,\
Mas ni mentón ni mejilla en que posar.\
Muchas manos me toman, sin una caricia,\
Mas siempre soy la primera en limpiar la porquería."}},
[12879]={nameES="El Maestro / La Maestra de los Acertijos",objectivesES={"Entrega el legado de Celebrían a Elrond","Glorfindel no sabe dónde se encuentra el legado de Celebrían para Arwen, pero te ha dado algunos consejos que pueden ayudarte a encontrarlo.","Elrond está en la biblioteca de Rivendel.\
\
Glorfindel te pidió que llevaras el legado de Arwen a Elrond.","Recoge el legado de Celebrían","La cámara élfica perdida está en algún lugar del Bosque de los Trolls, en las cercanías de Rivendel, probablemente en el Páramo Alto. Glorfindel espera tu regreso fuera de la casa de Elrond, junto a la cascada.\
\
Glorfindel te dijo que buscaras la cámara en el Páramo Alto y te aconsejó colocar una mano sobre una roca junto a la entrada de la cámara élfica y recitar los versos del acertijo. El legado de Celebrían para Arwen, una joya blanca, debería estar en algún lugar dentro de la cámara.","Legado de Celebrían encontrado","Lleva el legado de Celebrían a Glorfindel"}},
[12880]={nameES="El Buscador de Acertijos",objectivesES={"Habla con Glorfindel","Habla con Elrond","Glorfindel está fuera de la casa de Elrond, junto a la cascada.\
\
Elrond te ha indicado que hables con Glorfindel sobre el acertijo.\
\
La joya de la luna,\
Consagrada en el agua,\
De madre a hija\
Se otorga una bendición.\
Naves zarpan al oeste,\
Olvidando toda pena,\
Arriban al día siguiente,\
A las islas de los benditos.","Bilbo está parado junto a Lindir en el Salón del Fuego, en La Última Morada.\
\
Lindir te dijo que hablaras con Bilbo para conocer el acertijo sin resolver.","Un último acertijo que concierne a la Casa de Elrond en Rivendel aún no ha sido resuelto.","Elrond está en su biblioteca en La Última Morada.\
\
Bilbo cree que Elrond puede saber más sobre el acertijo.\
\
La joya de la luna,\
Consagrada en el agua,\
De madre a hija\
Se otorga una bendición.\
Naves zarpan al oeste,\
Olvidando toda pena,\
Arriban al día siguiente,\
A las islas de los benditos.","Habla con Bilbo","El Buscador de Acertijos"}},
[12881]={nameES="El jinete y su montura",objectivesES={"Derrota a Glothrok el Infame","Derrota a Forzunk","Glothrok el Infame se encuentra en la Gran Escalera, al noreste de la Guardia Orca.\
\
Thithrand parecía inquieto ante la visión de un poderoso trasgo montado sobre un huargo de aspecto aún más imponente. La pareja entró en la Gran Escalera al frente de los jinetes de huargos y no ha vuelto a ser vista desde entonces.","El jinete y su montura","Los jinetes de huargos se abren paso por los riscos de las montañas y entran y salen de las sombras de Moria con facilidad. En la Gran Escalera, un líder y su envejecida montura han acudido a doblar la rodilla ante Igash el Fanático y Mazog.","Habla con Thithrand en la Guardia Orca","Glothrok el Infame derrotado","Thithrand se encuentra en la Guardia Orca, al suroeste de la Gran Escalera.\
\
Deberías regresar con Thithrand para comunicarle la noticia de tu victoria.","Forzunk derrotado"}},
[12882]={nameES="The Rider's Errand",objectivesES={"Speak with Bregdal at the War-stead of the King's Men","Mordor Orcs can be found throughout Taur Drúadan.\
\
You should defeat Mordor Orcs to allow Bregdal safe passage to the Rohirrim encampment.","Bregdal is atop Amon Dîn.\
\
You should speak with Bregdal.","Bregdal needs your assistance in tracking down the Rohirrim that ride to aid Gondor.","Bregdal is at the War-stead of the King's Men, near Eilenach.\
\
You should speak with Bregdal.","Speak with Bregdal atop Amon Dîn","Hike to the top of Amon Dîn","After a hard climb, you make it atop the rocky Amon Dîn","Amon Dîn is located in eastern Taur Drúadan.\
\
You should climb atop Amon Dîn and meet with Bregdal.","The Rider's Errand"}},
[12883]={nameES="The Riders Four",objectivesES={}},
[12884]={nameES="The Riders Three",objectivesES={"Shoe Brynmód","Ulf is at Ost Rimmon.\
\
You have spoken to Hutha and should now speak to Ulf as well.","The Riders Three","Talk to Ulf","Shoed Brynmód","Shoe Flyting","Once known as the Riders Four, the company of Burnoth, Hutha, and Ulf struggle to ready and ride for war while still feeling the loss of their long-time friend, Léofdag.","Shoed Gesith","The steeds of the Riders Three can be found at the stables of Ost Rimmon.\
\
You have collected enough horseshoes and should now shoe the steeds of the Riders Three.","Talk to Burnoth in Ost Rimmon","Shoe Gesith","Shoed Flyting","Talk to Hutha","Hutha is at Ost Rimmon.\
\
You have shoed the steeds and should now speak to Hutha as Burnoth asked.","Sets of horseshoes can be found within Ost Rimmon in the Beacon Hills.\
\
Burnoth has asked you to aid him in shoeing the horses before he and his fellows set off.","Burnoth can be found within Ost Rimmon in the Beacon Hills.\
\
You have destroyed the caltrops and should now return to Burnoth.","Caltrops can be found on and around the road outside of Ost Rimmon.\
\
Variags have laid traps along the road to slow the forces of Rohan. You should disarm these traps before any more horses are wounded."}},
[12885]={nameES="The Ringing of the Hammer",objectivesES={"The Ringing of the Hammer","Andras asked you to enter Saruman's Foundry and defeat his acolyte, Penrith, a Dunlending who has forsaken the ways of the clans and has embraced the world of the foul magic called 'industry' which Saruman espouses.","Andras is afraid that Saruman is forging weapons of great power in his personal Foundry beneath Isengard... though he knows not what form those weapons are taking.","Defeated Penrith","Defeat Penrith"}},
[12886]={nameES="The Rings of Isengard",objectivesES={"Andras has asked you to enter the tower of Orthanc and wrest Saruman's rings from him and dispose of them before the curse of the Nazgûl can fall upon any of his people.","The Rings of Isengard","Your discovery in the Foundry caused Andras great alarm. Even the wild men of Dunland have tales of the Walking Shadows -- the Nazgûl, Ringwraiths under the domination of Sauron -- and he does not wish for such evil to come upon his people.","Take Saruman's rings and destroy them","You have destroyed the rings, but Saruman remains anything but powerless...."}},
[12887]={nameES="The Rising Tide of Dead",objectivesES={"Return to Khôltekh in Dâr Laja, the Hall of the Kindred.","The Rising Tide of Dead","Return to Khôltekh in the Hall of the Kindred","Khôltekh has asked you to venture into Sektakhâb and cull the rising population of the Dead.","Khôltekh has asked you to venture into Sektakhâb and cull the rising population of the Dead. You can find them west of Mekab-kuphâr, the Temámir guard outpost in southern Khabârkhad."}},
[12888]={nameES="El rito de Clúcath",objectivesES={"El rito de Clúcath","Regalo de Tasgall recogido","Osbail está junto al trono de Crannog en Aughaire, Camran está en la isla central del asentamiento, y Tasgall sigue cazando bestias de las colinas al norte de Aughaire y al sureste de Nád Nathair.\
\
Crannog te ha aconsejado hablar con el pueblo de Aughaire para aprender lo que puedas sobre el desafío que se avecina: el Clúcath con los Trév Duvárdain.","El plan de Crannog ha sido revelado: tu Fém consiste en representar a los Trév Gállorg en el Clúcath contra los Trév Duvárdain y sus amos Angmarim.","Crannog está en su trono en Aughaire, al oeste de la isla central del asentamiento.\
\
Crannog te espera para hablar contigo y poder viajar juntos a Fail-á-Khro para el Clúcath con los Trév Duvárdain.","Habla con Crannog y viaja a Fail-á-Khro","Crannog está en su trono en Aughaire, al oeste de la isla central del asentamiento.\
\
Has hablado con algunos de los Trév Gállorg y deberías regresar a ver a Crannog como te aconsejó.","Habla con Crannog"}},
[12889]={nameES="The River Provides",objectivesES={"Talk to Ingelfled","The River Provides","Ingelfled can be found in the village of Arhaim in Duskenvale.\
\
You should deliver the moss and reeds to Ingelfled.","Many useful plants grow along the river Anduin. Ingelfled has asked you to gather some to help the village of Arhaim.","Anduin moss and river reeds can be gathered from the river-banks of the Anduin in Duskenvale.\
\
You should collect Anduin moss and river reeds."}},
[12890]={nameES="The River Watch Patrol",objectivesES={"The second southernmost watch-tower can be found on the edge of the Great River in the northern Wold, south-east of Langhold.\
\
You should ride to the watch-tower and ensure that all is well.","The southern tower reports no danger","The central tower reports no danger","The men of this tower have spotted Easterling movement at the ford","The highest watch-tower can be found on the tallest hill overlooking the Great River in the northern Wold, slightly north of the first tower.\
\
You should ride to the watch-tower and ensure that all is well.","Speak to a watchman at the northern central tower","The central watch-tower can be found on the edge of the Great River in the northern Wold, slightly north of the first tower.\
\
You should ride to the watch-tower and ensure that all is well.","Utred has long kept watch against the passage of foes across the ford, and he has asked you to perform a regular patrol of the River Watch forts.","Speak to a guard at the second southernmost watch-tower","The River Watch Patrol","The watch-tower at the Great River's edge can be found north of the high tower, down the slopes towards the water.\
\
You should speak with the watchman at the river-edge tower.","Speak to a guard at the central watch-tower","Speak to the watchman guarding the northernmost tower"}},
[12891]={nameES="The River's Sting",objectivesES={"Return to Kôrzan in Sen Chatâk with news of your success.","Return to Kôrzan in Sen Chatâk","The River's Sting","The fisher Kôrzan tells you that the local zizani have muscled the fishers of Sen Chatâk out of their spots along the White-wrath River. Defeat these zizani so that the fishers may return.","The fisher Kôrzan has requested you deal with the nearby zizani, who have moved into the best fishing spots along the White-wrath river. The zizani can be found clustered near the foetid ponds of Charganpâta. Charganpâta is north-east of Sen Chatâk."}},
[12892]={nameES="El camino está despejado",objectivesES={"El camino está despejado","Albin Cotonorte está en la Granja de Cotonorte.\
\
Albin Cotonorte se alegrará de saber que Nibs está listo y el camino está despejado.","Se ha despejado el camino y se ha derrotado al lobo.","Habla con Albin Cotonorte"}},
[12893]={nameES="El Camino es Nuestro",objectivesES={"El Camino es Nuestro","Los enanos del Mirador de la Gran Excavación desean marcar la Extensión Solitaria como un paso ahora propiedad de los enanos, y de ninguna otra criatura de Moria.","Planta una bandera para reclamar la Extensión Solitaria para los enanos","Sót está en el Mirador de la Gran Excavación de Moria.\
\
Debes regresar con Sót ahora que el puente hacia la Sala Vigesimoprimera ha sido reclamado por la expedición de enanos.","Se ha plantado una bandera de enano en la Extensión Solitaria","La Extensión Solitaria se encuentra siguiendo el camino hacia el este más allá de la Cámara de Enfriamiento desde el campamento del Mirador de la Gran Excavación.\
\
Debes dirigirte a la Extensión Solitaria y plantar una bandera de los enanos allí.","Regresa con Sót en el Mirador de la Gran Excavación"}},
[12894]={nameES="The Road to An Shêru",objectivesES={}},
[12895]={nameES="The Road to Dunharrow",objectivesES={"Talk to Éowyn outside Meduseld","The Road to Dunharrow","Éowyn can be found outside Meduseld in Edoras.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>You must complete the quests 'Edoras: In Need of Cheering-up', 'Book 12, Chapter 5: Eyes of Edoras', and 'Book 12, Chapter 6: Through the Net' before Éowyn's people can depart for Dunharrow.</rgb>","Éowyn can be found outside Meduseld in Edoras.\
\
You have finished readying Éowyn and her people. You should now speak to Éowyn.","Talk to Éowyn at Dunharrow","Prepare Éowyn and her people to journey to Dunharrow","Prepared Éowyn and her people to journey to Dunharrow","Éowyn, Mágla, and Ellen Fremedon have made their preparations, and now, they stand ready to guard the people of Kingstead as they travel to Dunharrow.","Talk to Éowyn","DNT -- Players will not see","Éowyn can be found outside Meduseld in Edoras.\
\
You have prepared the people of Middlemead and the Harrowdale for their journey to Dunharrow. You should now speak to Éowyn.","Éowyn can be found with the people of Kingstead on the Firienfeld at Dunharrow.\
\
You have defended the people of Rohan as they made shelter. You should speak to Éowyn."}},
[12896]={nameES="The Road to Emyn Lûm",objectivesES={"Athradnir is anxious to hear what has become of the Malledhrim host who marched east to Emyn Lûm, for the closer the Elves draw to Dol Guldur, the more perilous the journey becomes.","Fuirgam should be among the Malledhrim at their stronghold in Emyn Lûm.\
\
You should seek Fuirgam and establish a line of communication between the Elves of Emyn Lûm and the Dourstocks.","Talk to Fuirgam in Emyn Lum","The Road to Emyn Lûm"}},
[12897]={nameES="The Road to Thornhope",objectivesES={"Mounted uruks can be found on the Road to Thornhope.\
\
Holenmal has asked that you clear mounted uruks from the Road to Thornhope.","Mounted uruks are marauding across the north of the Entwash Vale, closing off the road to Thornhope and threatening any effort to reclaim the town.","Talk to Holenmal at Eaworth","Holenmal is at Eaworth.\
\
Holenmal is waiting to speak with you about your victories along the road to Thornhope.","<rgb=#FF0000>Completing Aiding the Eastemnet will cancel this quest</rgb>","The Road to Thornhope"}},
[12898]={nameES="El camino a la Montaña Solitaria",objectivesES={"Habla con Glorfindel en Rivendel","Instancia La batalla por Erebor completada","El Maestro Elrond te convoca a la Última Morada","Espera a que Elrond te convoque.","Completa la instancia La batalla por Erebor","A Gandalf el Gris le preocupan los recientes movimientos en el Este. Se pregunta qué ha sido de sus aliados y enemigos del pasado.","Deberías reunir a tus aliados y emprender las misiones que te han encomendado Glorfindel, Legolas y Boromir.\
\
Glorfindel desea que rescates un huevo de águila de los gigantes de piedra de las Montañas Nubladas. Legolas te ha pedido que encuentres a los exploradores de Thranduil en las Hondonadas Enmarañadas. Boromir sugiere que invadas la Ciudad de los Trasgos y te ocupes del nuevo Gran Trasgo.","Instancia Huida a la Montaña Solitaria completada","Habla con Boromir en la casa de huéspedes de Rivendel","Glorfindel está cerca del arroyo fuera de la Última Morada. Legolas y Boromir están en las Casas de Huéspedes en Rivendel.\
\
El Maestro Elrond te sugirió que hablaras con sus invitados Glorfindel, Legolas y Boromir sobre el paradero y los tratos de los amigos y enemigos que participaron en la gran batalla en la Montaña Solitaria.","Instancia Las Campanas de Valle completada","Completa la instancia escalada del Asiento del Gran Trasgo","Habla con el Maestro Elrond en la Última Morada en Rivendel","Habla con Elrond en La Última Morada en Rivendel","Completa la instancia Los fuegos de Smaug","El camino a la Montaña Solitaria","Completa la instancia Huida a la Montaña Solitaria","El Maestro Elrond está en la Última Morada en Rivendel.\
\
Gandalf te ha enviado a hablar con el Maestro Elrond sobre los problemas en el Este.","Completa la instancia escalada del Pico de Iorbar","Habla con Legolas en la casa de huéspedes de Rivendel","Deberías reunir a tus aliados y emprender las misiones de Gimli para ayudar a Valle y la Montaña Solitaria.","Habla con Gandalf el Gris en la Última Morada en Rivendel","El Maestro Elrond está en la Última Morada en Rivendel.\
\
Deberías volver con el Maestro Elrond para recibir más instrucciones.","Gandalf el Gris está en la Última Morada en Rivendel.\
\
Elrond te dijo que le llevaras tus noticias a Gandalf el Gris.","Completa la instancia escalada de las Telarañas Enmarañadas","Gimli está en la Casa de Huéspedes en Rivendel.\
\
Elrond te pidió que hablaras con Gimli sobre el emisario del Señor Oscuro que vino a Erebor.","El Maestro Elrond está en la Última Morada en Rivendel.\
\
Deberías volver con el Maestro Elrond con noticias de tus éxitos.","El Maestro Elrond está en la Última Morada en Rivendel.\
\
Deberías volver con el Maestro Elrond y contarle tu historia.","Espera a que el Maestro Elrond te convoque de nuevo","Completa la instancia Las campanas de Valle","Instancia Los fuegos de Smaug completada"}},
[12899]={nameES="Los caminos cerca de Herne",objectivesES={"Encuentra el cruce de caminos al oeste de Herne","Los caminos cerca de Herne","Brioc está en los confines del norte de la ciudad de Herne, esperando tu informe.","Brioc te pidió <rgb=#00FF00>buscar</rgb> amenazas para Herne en dos cruces de caminos cerca de la ciudad: uno al oeste y otro al norte.","Habla con Brioc en Herne","Este es uno de los cruces de caminos que Brioc quería que explorases","Brioc quiere que explores en busca de peligros potenciales en el camino que rodea Herne.","<rgb=#00FF00>Busca</rgb> peligros para Herne en el cruce de caminos occidental","No hay amenazas evidentes en este cruce de caminos al noroeste de Herne","Encuentra el cruce de caminos al noroeste de Herne","<rgb=#00FF00>Busca</rgb> peligros para Herne en el cruce de caminos del norte","Todo está tranquilo en este cruce de caminos al oeste de Herne"}},
[12900]={nameES="The Roaming Threat",objectivesES={}},
[12901]={nameES="The Roar of the Woses",objectivesES={}},
[12902]={nameES="The Roaring Stones",objectivesES={"Talk to Kyrstig","Kyrstig can be found near Ibdêkh-buzru, the Thing-fold.\
\
You should talk to Kyrstig.","The Roaring Stones","Defeated Stormbár","Defeat Stormbár","Snow-beasts have made their home in Grymmclúd, the Roaring Stones.","A pack of snow-beasts has been discovered in Grymmclúd, near the Clovengate.\
\
You should defeat snow-beasts and their pack-leader, Stormbár, in Grymmclúd."}},
[12903]={nameES="Los saqueadores de Barad Tharsír",objectivesES={"Barad Tharsír se encuentra al sureste de Tinnudir, en Barandalf, al otro lado del Brandivino.\
\
Unitaria Tilden te ha pedido que derrotes a los miembros de la banda de saqueadores que ha tomado Barad Tharsír, así como a sus miembros más infames: Anselmo Boscoso y Ogden Roblealto.","Unitaria Tilden está en el campamento de los montaraces en la isla de Tinnudir, al noroeste de Barandalf y al oeste de Parth Aduial.\
\
Unitaria está esperando a que le comuniques que has derrotado a los saqueadores en Barad Tharsír.","Derrota a Anselmo Boscoso","Ogden Roblealto derrotado","Anselmo Boscoso derrotado","Los saqueadores de Barad Tharsír","Unitaria Tilden teme que los saqueadores de tumbas hayan tomado el control de las ruinas de Barad Tharsír en Barandalf.","Derrota a Ogden Roblealto"}},
[12904]={nameES="Los ladrones de Rantost",objectivesES={"Habla con Eliot Bencroft en Rantost","Eliot Bencroft está en la esquina sureste de Rantost.\
\
Eliot Bencroft querrá oír que Rantost se ha debilitado hasta el punto de quedar expuesto a un asalto mayor.","Ayuda a Eliot Bencroft en Rantost","Los ladrones de Rantost","La isla de Rantost es donde los saqueadores de tumbas han establecido su campamento central. Allí se guarda gran parte de la historia.","Ayuda a Wal Simpkins en Rantost","Ayuda a Leighton Kipps en Rantost","Hay varias cosas que hacer en Rantost para perturbar las operaciones de los saqueadores de tumbas."}},
[12905]={nameES="The Roc",objectivesES={"Talk to Raghda-gûn","The Roc","A stranger has offered you coin for stealing a Roc's egg.","Itho has asked you to steal a roc's egg, a most heinous act.\
\
You should warn any rocs you find. Rocs may found at Aklâradum, a cliff south of Halrax."}},
[12906]={nameES="El árbol de los nidos",objectivesES={"El árbol de los nidos","Los crebain del norte de Eregion se han establecido en estas tierras, encontrando buenos lugares para anidar.","El árbol de los nidos de los crebain se encuentra en el valle al este de Gwingris.\
\
Thaliondir te ha pedido que quemes el árbol de los nidos de los crebain.","Habla con Thaliondir en Gwingris","Destruye el árbol de los nidos","Thaliondir está en Gwingris, al oeste del árbol de los nidos.\
\
Deberías volver a ver a Thaliondir con las noticias de tu éxito."}},
[12907]={nameES="La raíz del problema",objectivesES={"Weth se encuentra en Zigilgund, al sur de las fuentes de vapor.\
\
Has derrotado a la gran sierpe Ringdagnir. A Weth le complacerá saberlo.","Ringdagnir derrotada","Ringdagnir se encuentra en la parte oeste de los manantiales termales cerca de Zigilgund.\
\
Weth te ha pedido que derrotes a la gran sierpe invernal Ringdagnir.","Vuelve a ver a Weth con las noticias de tu éxito","La raíz del problema","Derrota a Ringdagnir","La raíz del problema con las grandes sierpes invernales que han estado atacando los canales enanos parece estar en una sierpe particularmente violenta apodada Ringdagnir."}},
[12908]={nameES="La raíz del problema",objectivesES={"Bring the Uruks' orders to Quickbeam","The tent of the Uruk-commander lies somewhere in the Vale below Quickbeam's home.\
\
You should search for orders in the tent of the Uruk-commander.","Quickbeam is at his home upon the north-eastern slopes above Nan Curunír.\
\
You should bring the Uruks' orders to Quickbeam.","Quickbeam feels that to get at the root of the Orc-problem, he will need to learn more about the Uruks' purposes... and those of Saruman.","The Uruk-commander is at his tent.\
\
You have been discovered by the Uruk-commander.","You examined the Uruks' orders, but you hear a sound behind you...","La raíz del problema","You defeated the Uruk-commander"}},
[12909]={nameES="The Roots of Fangorn",objectivesES={"You have discovered a band of Orcs in the lower stretches of the cavern.\
\
You must locate their leader and defeat him in battle in order to drive the rest from the caverns.","The Roots of Fangorn","Protect the roots of Fangorn","Thickbark believes that something may be awry within the caves that cut beneath the Limlight Falls, where the roots of Fangorn gather to drink from the pure waters of the river.","You have discovered the entrance to the roots of Fangorn","Thickbark has asked you to gather your fellowship and explore the interior of the caves that stretch beneath the Limlight Falls.\
\
These caves can be found a short way from the Limlight Glade, on the western side of the river.","Discover the roots of Fangorn"}},
[12910]={nameES="The Rot Runs Deep",objectivesES={"Return to Tálbiral in Laivárth","Spiders and Huorns in the area are threatening Laivárth. Tálbiral has asked you to thin their numbers and destroy any blighted spider eggs you find.","Return to Tálbiral and inform him that you have reduced the number of spiders and Huorns threatening Laivárth.","The Rot Runs Deep"}},
[12911]={nameES="Las amenazas errantes de Angmar",objectivesES={"Cánnakh se encuentra en Aughaire.\
\
Deberías hablar con Cánnakh.","Habla con Cánnakh","Cánnakh necesita ayuda, pues Angmar vuelve a estar bajo amenaza.","Durante tu ausencia, nuevas amenazas han surgido en Angmar. Cánnakh, un erudito de Aughaire, busca la ayuda de un héroe valiente mientras trabaja para desenterrar un oscuro secreto del pasado.","Las amenazas errantes de Angmar"}},
[12912]={nameES="The Roving Threats of Eastern Gondor",objectivesES={}},
[12913]={nameES="The Roving Threats of Evendim",objectivesES={"Brangil requires assistance as Evendim faces a renewed threat.","In your absence, new threats have come to Evendim. Brangil, a Ranger in Tinnudir, seeks the assistance of a brave hero as he works to stop the advancement of the enemy upon Annúminas.","Speak with Brangil","Brangil can be found in Tinnudir.\
\
You should speak with Brangil.","The Roving Threats of Evendim"}},
[12914]={nameES="The Roving Threats of Forochel",objectivesES={"Ostasänt requires assistance as Forochel is once again under threat.","Ostasänt can be found in Sûri-kylä.\
\
You should speak with Ostasänt.","In your absence, new threats have come to Forochel. Ostasänt, a warrior from Sûri-kylä, seeks assistance in defeating the threats that she has recently encountered.","The Roving Threats of Forochel","Speak with Ostasänt"}},
[12915]={nameES="The Roving Threats of Southern Mirkwood",objectivesES={}},
[12916]={nameES="The Roving Threats of The North Downs",objectivesES={"Othwen can be found in Esteldín.\
\
You should speak with Othwen.","Speak with Othwen","In your absence, new threats have come to The North Downs. Othwen, a defender of Esteldín, seeks the assistance of a brave hero as she works to halt the Angmarim's efforts in the north.","Othwen requires assistance as The North Downs is once again under threat.","The Roving Threats of The North Downs"}},
[12917]={nameES="The Roving Threats of Western Gondor",objectivesES={}},
[12918]={nameES="The Royal Banner",objectivesES={}},
[12919]={nameES="La manada del Páramo Rojizo",objectivesES={"Líder de la manada del páramo derrotado","La manada de lobos que vivía al norte de Herne es víctima de un frenesí mortal.","Acaba con el líder de la manada del páramo","Vuelve con Maddoc","Deberías decirle a Maddoc que has acabado con muchos lobos iracundos cerca de Herne.\
\
Maddoc está dentro de la posada de Herne.","Maddoc te ha pedido que reduzcas el número de lobos que habitan en Dientelupino, al norte de Herne.\
\
Dientelupino está en el oeste de Cardolan.","La manada del Páramo Rojizo"}},
[12920]={nameES="La Ciudad Arruinada -- Nivel 1",objectivesES={"Defeat the Haradrim Captain Jukotor","La Ciudad Arruinada -- Nivel 1","Defeat the maddened troll, Thrug","Follow the mysterious figure.","Defeated Thrug","You have pursued a mysterious figured dressed in Faramir's cloak ever since you saw it exiting the tunnels under Osgiliath. Is it truly Faramir? You will never know unless you catch up with it.","Defeated Jukotor","The mysterious figure has been revealed to be the Ranger Lúmithil, stabbed with a Morgul-blade and changed into a Cargûl.","Pursue the mysterious stranger","Defeated Lúmithil","Defeat the Cargûl Lúmithil"}},
[12921]={nameES="La Ciudad Arruinada -- Nivel 2",objectivesES={"Defeat the Haradrim Captain Jukotor","Follow the mysterious figure.","Defeat the maddened troll, Thrug","Defeated Thrug","You have pursued a mysterious figured dressed in Faramir's cloak ever since you saw it exiting the tunnels under Osgiliath. Is it truly Faramir? You will never know unless you catch up with it.","Defeated Jukotor","La Ciudad Arruinada -- Nivel 2","The mysterious figure has been revealed to be the Ranger Lúmithil, stabbed with a Morgul-blade and changed into a Cargûl.","Pursue the mysterious stranger","Defeated Lúmithil","Defeat the Cargûl Lúmithil"}},
[12922]={nameES="The Ruins of Brangobel",objectivesES={}},
[12923]={nameES="Las ruinas de Eitheldir",objectivesES={"En lo alto, sobre las aguas del río Mitheithel, se alzan las ruinas de Eitheldir. Lo que fue una fortaleza de los Noldor, hoy cobija entre sus cúpulas a hordas de orcos y forajidos que se disputan estas tierras. Sin embargo, los ojos de los elfos aún vigilan el lugar, y la exploradora Merileg aguarda agazapada entre las sombras, más abajo en el camino.","Las ruinas de Eitheldir","Merileg está en el camino a Eitheldir, en el norte del Ángulo.\
\
Deberías volver con ella.","Derrota al capitán de Eitheldir","Vuelve con Merileg","Eitheldir está en el norte del Ángulo.\
\
Deberías derrotar a los enemigos en Eitheldir."}},
[12924]={nameES="Las ruinas de Minas Vrûn",objectivesES={"Los saqueadores podrían haber escondido las reliquias perdidas por Minas Vrûn, en el oeste de Annúndir.\
\
Debes buscar en Minas Vrûn las reliquias perdidas, en caso de que los saqueadores las enterraran para recuperarlas después.","Tras examinar la estatua arnoriana en Minas Vrûn, te das cuentas de que varias pequeñas piezas han desaparecido.","Cuando miras a la antigua estatua, te das cuenta de que parecen faltar varias piezas pequeñas significativas, dejando huecos donde debería haber reliquias.\
\
La estatua parece haber sido saqueada, no hace mucho. Quizá estos tesoros perdidos pueda encontrarse cerca; los saqueadores podrían haberlas enterrado para recuperarlas después.","Busca las reliquias perdidas","Amarion está en Amon Raith.\
\
Debes llevar las reliquias que has encontrado a Amarion.","Lleva las reliquias de la estatua a Amarion","Las ruinas de Minas Vrûn"}},
[12925]={nameES="Las ruinas de Pembar",objectivesES={"Las ruinas de Pembar se han convertido en el refugio de semiorcos al servicio de Saruman el Blanco, quien ha sucumbido al mal. Lo que buscan en las antiguas ruinas élficas es todavía un misterio.","Faenhilith está en Echad Eregion, al suroeste de Pembar.\
\
Deberías volver a ver a Faenhilith y contarle lo que has encontrado en Pembar.","Las ruinas de Pembar","Habla con Faenhilith en Echad Eregion"}},
[12926]={nameES="La oveja fugada",objectivesES={"Habla con Hulfryn en Herne","Las huellas de cascos llevan al noroeste, fuera de Herne.\
\
Deberías seguirlas","Hay leves huellas en la hierba.","Has visto unas leves huellas cerca del comedero fuera de la casa de Hulfryn.\
\
Deberías examinarlas.","Parece que una oveja ha huido de Herne.","Una oveja en pánico escapó del redil hacia el noroeste.","Un rastro de sangre continúa hacia el norte.\
\
Deberías seguirlo.","La oveja ha muerto hace poco","Examina las huellas de la oveja.","La oveja fugada","Examina la sangre","Espectro derrotado","Por desgracia has encontrado a la última oveha de Hulfryn.\
\
Deberías examinar su cadáver.","Las huellas de cascos que has estado siguiendo acaban de golpe en un charco de sangre.\
\
Deberías examinar la sangre.","Sigue el rastro de huellas","Lo último que hizo la oveja perdida antes de huir fue comer del comedero fuera de la casa de Hulfryn.\
\
Deberías examinar la zona en busca de huellas.","El rastro de sangre continúa hacia el norte","Las huellas continúan hacia el noroeste.","Sigue el rastro de sangre","Has acabado con el tumulario que mató a la oveja de Hulfryn.\
\
Deberías volver a Herne y decírselo.","El olor de carne en descomposición te invade mientras un tumulario avanza hacia ti.","El rastro se para de golpe en este charco de sangre","Un rastro de sangre continúa hacia el norte","Busca huellas cerca del comedero fuera de la casa de Hulfryn","Examina a la oveja muerta"}},
[12927]={nameES="The Runes of Malice",objectivesES={}},
[12928]={nameES="The Ruthless Dead of Ethillorn",objectivesES={"A battle-worn soldier would like your help to disperse the Ruthless Dead.","The Ruthless Dead of Ethillorn","Talk to the battle-worn soldier outside the Ruins of Ethillorn","A battle-worn soldier stands guard outside the Ruins of Ethillorn. Dirt marks his face. Sweat mats down his hair in clumps. There are scrapes across his armour, as if some beast tried to claw the heart from his chest.\
\
But he's beaming as you approach him.\
\
'Hail, traveller!'\
\
You feel his eyes assess your worth, and when he judges you a capable adventurer, he beams wider.\
\
'I have been tasked with dispersing the Ruthless Dead from within the walls of Ethillorn. I am in the middle of a respite, but if you would like a turn, you are more than welcome.'","A battle-worn soldier has offered you the chance to defeat the Ruthless Dead in the Ruins of Ethillorn, south of Linhir.\
\
Defeat the Ruthless Dead.","You have defeated many of the Ruthless Dead, and should report to the battle-worn soldier standing outside the Ruins of Ethilllorn south of Linhir.\
\
Talk to the soldier outside the Ruins of Ethillorn."}},
[12929]={nameES="The Salmon Run",objectivesES={}},
[12930]={nameES="The Sangemêkh",objectivesES={}},
[12931]={nameES="The Scaled Problem",objectivesES={"Rathon has been tasked with maintaining many of the cisterns in Minas Tirith by himself and has come to find cave-lizards who have infested the cisterns.","Cave-lizard nests and Old Stone-tail can be found within the cisterns.\
\
You should remove the cave-lizard infestation from the cisterns.","The Scaled Problem","Rathon can be found outside the cistern entrance on the Fourth Circle of Minas Tirith.\
\
You should speak with Rathon.","Speak with Rathon","Defeat Old Stone-tail","Defeated Old Stone-tail"}},
[12932]={nameES="The Scattered Lords of the Westfold",objectivesES={"Éomer counsels you to shelter in the Hornburg","Éomer está en la Puerta de Helm.\
\
Debes hablar con Éomer.","Ask Aragorn how you can help the Westfold","Aragorn is at Helm's Gate.\
\
You should speak with Aragorn.","Take leave of King Théoden","Ask Éomer how you can help the Westfold","The Scattered Lords of the Westfold","Théoden is at Helm's Gate.\
\
You should speak with Théoden.","Apparently much hope lies heavily on Erkenbrand and the lords of the Westfold -- Grimbold, Elfhelm, and Dúnhere. The Hornburg needs strong arms to defend it, but Gandalf may need help finding Erkenbrand.","Aragorn believes that hope lies in Gandalf, and in finding Erkenbrand"}},
[12933]={nameES="The Scattered Tales of Audaghaim",objectivesES={"Examine the blank gravestone more closely this time","You have found the lost leaves from the book of records","Habla con Prestadír en la Posada Embrujada","The Scattered Tales of Audaghaim","Examine the blank gravestone more closely","Prestadír is at the Haunted Inn in the Dourstocks, north of the graveyard.\
\
You should tell Prestadír of your encounter with the condemned Record-keeper who appeared when you searched his grave.","You have found a book of records buried in the ruins of Audaghaim, but many pages are missing from the period when Sauron returned to Mirkwood.","The blank gravestone is in the graveyard to the south of Audaghaim and the Haunted Inn.\
\
You should search the area of the uninformative gravestone again for anything you may have missed."}},
[12934]={nameES="El aroma del mithril",objectivesES={"Bothwar está en el puente en el centro de Gabilshathûr, al sur de Imlad Balchorth.\
\
Has devuelto a Arngrim a sus sentidos y deberías informar a Bothwar.","Arngrim está buscando mithril en la cima de una cresta en las regiones más al sur de Imlad Balchorth, al norte de Gabilshathûr.\
\
Bothwar está preocupado de que Arngrim, un poco despistado en el mejor de los casos, pueda haberse metido en problemas en las regiones del sur de Imlad Balchorth.","Encuentra a Arngrim","El aroma del mithril","El enano Arngrim ha desaparecido después de decirle a algunos de los otros mineros que estaba seguro de conocer la ubicación de una veta de mithril en las colinas de Imlad Balchorth.","Has hecho entrar en razón a Arngrim"}},
[12935]={nameES="The Schemes of the Pale Herald",objectivesES={"Talk to Felgúr","Legolas has asked you to unbind Felgúr and send him on his mission.\
\
You should talk to Felgúr in Echad Taerdim.","Find Rûkhor's second orders to Zabothak","Felgúr taps your shoulder, attempting to get your attention","Find the Ungoledain with Felgúr","Felgúr has begun tracking the other Ungoledain.\
\
You should travel with Felgúr.","Zabothak, my most loyal servant.\
\
Belzagar has sent word. The tower must be reinforced at once or be lost to the spider-horde. Rally with Ugrukhôr's forces and re-take the tower, or Shelob may be set loose upon Gorgoroth or the Morgul Vale. Do not fail me.","The Schemes of the Pale Herald","You untie Felgúr and let him know it is time to begin tracking down the rest of the Ungoledain. He looks around sheepishly, still not entirely trusting of the Rangers or of Legolas. When he is at least mostly convinced he is not about to be shot full of arrows, he nods to you.\
\
'I will find them! Let us start by heading east.'","Find Rûkhor's first orders to Zabothak","Felgúr would like to speak with you.\
\
You should talk to Felgúr.","Find Rûkhor's third orders to Zabothak","Legolas has asked you to find evidence of Rûkhor's plans in Kaslokroz.\
\
You should find written orders to the Uruk lieutenants.","Felgúr sniffs the air and points south-east","Legolas has appeared near an Uruk camp in eastern Cirith Ungol.\
\
You should talk to Legolas.","Zabothak,\
\
Fear not, my servant. I lay the blame for this defeat on the traitor Ugrukhôr. If he had delivered the forces he promised me, the tower would be secure. His excuses do nothing but tire me. We owe no allegiance to the Lady of Blight. I care nothing for the false king Gothmog. I will be formulating a new plan. Stand by to receive new orders.","Zabothak,\
\
Thus far, we have been unable to locate Shelob's den in the maze of tunnels in Torech Ungol, but we may finally have a solution. The scouts have located a tribe of primitive Men recently arrived to the west. They have been seen skin-changing into spiders! I believe these may be the Ungoledain that Karazgar mentioned. And if they have come all the way here... perhaps they also hear the call of the Spider-queen. Prepare for a delegation.","Legolas is waiting near Kaslokroz.\
\
You should talk to Legolas.","Felgúr nods at you and points south","Legolas calls to you from nearby","The time has come to track the Ungoledain and Rûkhor the Pale Herald with the aid of Felgúr.","Felgúr grimaces and points north","Find Rûkhor's fourth orders to Zabothak","Habla con Legolas.","Zabothak,\
\
I have had an epiphany. Perhaps Shelob is not a problem we can solve. Perhaps she is not a problem at all.\
\
Rally the Bloodless. We will enter the Morgul Vale. We will enter Torech Ungol. We will find Her Ladyship Ungwetári and rouse her from her den."}},
[12936]={nameES="The Scourge's Bounty",objectivesES={}},
[12937]={nameES="The Scourge's Captains",objectivesES={"Confront Krûha","Confront Sikaru","The Scourge's Captains","Medêshi, Grizagâr, Jakham, Krûha, Sikaru, and Akhâd can be found throughout the Sail-haven, either upon the decks of their ships in the harbour or lurking at one of the local taverns.\
\
Eshmun has asked you to find, confront, and defeat Balakhôr the Scourge's loyal captains in Umbar Baharbêl.","Confront Jakham","Confront Medêshi","Eshmun, Captain of the Haven, can be found at the Harbour-warden's Tower in the Sail-haven of Umbar Baharbêl.\
\
You have defeated all of Balakhôr the Scourge's loyal captains in the Sail-haven. You should return to Eshmun.","Confront Akhâd","Confront Grizagâr","Talk to Eshmun at the Harbour-warden's Tower","Despite the success of the Sea-stone Mutiny, several captains still loyal to Balakhôr the Scourge have managed to entrench themselves in the Sail-haven of Umbar Baharbêl."}},
[12938]={nameES="The Scourge's Gambit",objectivesES={}},
[12939]={nameES="El explorador se convierte en cazador",objectivesES={"El explorador se convierte en cazador","Los trasgos representan una amenaza para la gente de las Quebradas del Norte y deben ser castigados por vagar tan lejos de sus tierras.","El campamento trasgo está al este de Amon Raith, en las colinas del sur de Annúndir.\
\
Deberías entrar en el campamento trasgo y derrotar allí a un buen número de ellos.","El montaraz Amarion está en Amon Raith, al oeste de Annúndir.\
\
Amarion está esperando noticias sobre tu ataque a los trasgos de Annúndir."}},
[12940]={nameES="El informe del explorador",objectivesES={"Los exploradores de la Mano Blanca te han visto","Coloca la bolsa con los restos en la caja","La caja está cerca del Agujero Chirriante, al sureste de Guardia Orca.\
\
Ingifast quiere que coloques la bolsa que contiene los restos de la anterior expedición de la Mano Blanca en una superficie elevada, como una caja, cerca de la ruta de las patrullas de los exploradores de la Mano Blanca.","Bolsa con los restos colocada en la caja","Habla con Ingifast en Guardia Orca","No dejes que los exploradores de la Mano Blanca te vean","Ingifast está en Guardia Orca, al noroeste del Agujero Chirriante.\
\
Ingifast se alegrará de oír que las pruebas han sido colocadas en la caja para que el explorador las encuentre.","Entre los restos que has traído a Ingifast había algunos objetos útiles para el siguiente paso de su plan.","El informe del explorador"}},
[12941]={nameES="El informe del explorador",objectivesES={"Las tribus de orcos compiten por las enormes riquezas de las Vetas del Cuerno Rojo. Es probable que cada tribu reúna información sobre la otra para ganar ventaja.","Encuentra el informe de la tribu de Moria","Entrega los informes a Ingifast cerca de la Guardia Orca","El informe de reconocimiento está escondido en el campamento de cada tribu.\
\
Cada tribu ha estado explorando las defensas de la otra, la ubicación de los puntos estratégicos y las operaciones mineras.","El informe del explorador","Encontraste un informe sobre la otra tribu de orcos. Es información fundamental, ya que se trata de un buen registro de las fortalezas y debilidades de su tribu. A los enanos de la Guardia Orca les resultará de gran utilidad.","Encuentra el informe de la tribu de la Mano Blanca","El campamento de Ingifast se encuentra en las escaleras de la Guardia Orca.\
\
Ingifast se alegrará de ver los informes que has reunido.","Informe de la tribu de Moria encontrado","Informe de la tribu de la Mano Blanca encontrado"}},
[12942]={nameES="Los Reclutas Exploradores de Lhan Garan",objectivesES={"Habla con Eluna en Cuencasangre, hacia el este.","Eluna espera contar con tu ayuda para sus muchas tareas.","Eluna viajará a una pequeña zona al este del campamento de Huargos conocida como Cuencasangre.\
\
Reúnete con Eluna al este de Cuencasangre.","Los Reclutas Exploradores de Lhan Garan"}},
[12943]={nameES="The Search for Abedec",objectivesES={"You have found Hashadîr, and Corsairs are everywhere...","Lothíriel has heard reports of Corsair scouts who may have infiltrated the great city of Dol Amroth.","<rgb=#FF0000>Look</rgb> for Abedec from the south-eastern watch-tower","You see no signs of Captain Abedec from this vantage point","Jajax is nowhere to be found. Something must have gone wrong...","Jajax's meeting place is where the roads meet between the two Corsair encampments -- one leads from the south-west, from Hashadîr, and the other leads from the ruins to the south.\
\
You should meet Jajax at the cross-roads.","Search for Jajax in the ruins to the south","Good vantage points for searching for signs of Abedec can be found atop the watch-towers in Hashadîr, south-west of Dol Amroth.\
\
You should climb the watch-towers on the beach and <rgb=#FF0000>look</rgb> for signs of Abedec.","Jajax is likely somewhere in the ruins to the south of Dol Amroth.\
\
You should search for Jajax, for he is probably in need of rescue.","The Corsairs have landed on a beach south-west of Dol Amroth.\
\
Jajax has asked you to search for Abedec at the beach-side landing spot, while he searches some ruins to the south.","Find the beach upon which the Corsairs have landed","Este es un buen punto de vista","Meet Jajax at the cross-roads","The Search for Abedec","<rgb=#FF0000>Look</rgb> for Abedec from the north-western watch-tower"}},
[12944]={nameES="The Search for Dolvir",objectivesES={"Find Dolvir near Abadec's Watch","The Search for Dolvir","You have found an injured Dolvir amongst the trees north of Abadec's Watch.\
\
You should make sure he's alright.","The scout Dolvir left Ost Lontir to assess the situation at Abadec's Watch, but has not been heard from since.","Talk to Dolvir","An injured Dolvir catches your attention","Gilanor has sent you to find Dolvir.\
\
Dolvir may be somewhere near Abadec's Watch, which lies south-west of Ost Lontir."}},
[12945]={nameES="The Search for Dúneth",objectivesES={"Tolwin can be found in the hall of Crithost.\
\
You should speak with Tolwin.","The Orcs seem to think that you just killed their captain","<rgb=#FF0000>Look around</rgb> for signs of Dúneth at the first farmhouse","Tolwin's mother Dúneth, has been missing since the attack on Cair Andros and he fears the worst, though Tolwin still has hope that you might be able to find her hiding in one of the still standing farm buildings in Talath Anor.","Find and defeat the captain at Parth Lisc","Parth Lisc is located in north-eastern Talath Anor and Parth Duin is located in eastern Talath Anor.\
\
You should travel to the Parth Lisc and Parth Duin and search for Dúneth.","<rgb=#FF0000>Look around</rgb> for signs of Dúneth at the fourth farmhouse","The Search for Dúneth","It looks like the camp's captain was recently killed and some lowly warrior has stepped up to take his place","Find and defeat the captain at Parth Duin","<rgb=#FF0000>Look around</rgb> for signs of Dúneth at the second farmhouse","This farmhouse is a good place to <rgb=#FF0000>look around</rgb> for signs of Dúneth","<rgb=#FF0000>Look around</rgb> for signs of Dúneth at the third farmhouse","Talk to Tolwin","No one's been here recently"}},
[12946]={nameES="The Search for Dúneth Continues",objectivesES={"<rgb=#FF0000>Look around</rgb> for signs of Dúneth at the first farmhouse","Orcs have begun using the farm as a staging ground for building machines of war","The woods can be found in eastern Talath Anor.\
\
You should follow the mysterious figure into the woods.","<rgb=#FF0000>Look around</rgb> for signs of Dúneth at the second farmhouse","Speak with Tolwin.","Parth Gladló is located in southern Talath Anor.\
\
You should search buildings at Parth Gladló.","Tolwin is afraid that he may never find his mother","Dúneth was never in need of rescuing and instead has been secretly keeping Crithost safe","The trail of footprints leads deeper into the woods","Speak with Dúneth","You come across a small makeshift encampment and the woman standing there smiles","Tolwin has asked you to accompany him on the search to find his missing mother, Dúneth.","The trail of footsteps leads deeper into the woods.\
\
You should follow the trail to find this mysterious figure.","No one's been here recently, but you hear an Orc captain shouting orders nearby","No one has been here recently as all the buildings are boarded up","Travel to Parth Gladló","Dúneth is located at her camp.\
\
You should speak with Dúneth.","Search Parth Forant for Dúneth","You notice a trail of footprints leading deeper into the woods","No one has been here recently","As Gúrdru falls you notice a human figure run away from Gúrdru's perch towards the woods","Gúrdru can be found in Parth Gladló.\
\
You should find and defeat Gúrdru.","Follow the trail of footprints deeper into the woods","Enter the woods in pursuit of the mysterious figure","Parth Forant is located in Talath Anor on the banks of the River Forant.\
\
Your should search Parth Forant for Dúneth.","Find and defeat Gúrdru","Parth Gladló is located in southern Talath Anor.\
\
Your best chance at finding Dúneth is searching Parth Gladló.","Speak with Tolwin","This farmhouse is a good place to <rgb=#FF0000>look around</rgb> for signs of Dúneth","The Search for Dúneth Continues"}},
[12947]={nameES="The Search for Erchar",objectivesES={}},
[12948]={nameES="La Búsqueda de Lalia",objectivesES={"Has encontrado a Lalia","Según la historia de Cebadilla Mantecona, el Túmulo del Último Príncipe se encuentra entre el Túmulo del Norte y el Pináculo de los Caídos, cerca de una gran piedra erguida.\
\
Bob te ha pedido que busques en las Quebradas de los Túmulos a su hija desaparecida, que probablemente vino aquí en busca del legendario “Último Príncipe”.","Encuentra a la hija de Bob, Lalia","La hija de Bob, Lalia, ha desaparecido. Bob, temiendo que haya ido en busca del \\qÚltimo Príncipe\\q, un personaje de una de las historias que Cebadilla Mantecona cuenta a los viajeros, se unió a una expedición a las Quebradas de los Túmulos para buscar a su hija.","La Búsqueda de Lalia"}},
[12949]={nameES="The Search for Meregyth",objectivesES={"Free Meregyth","You find another flower along the road. Meregyth might be leaving a trail to help locate her","The trail of flowers leads to the south.\
\
It is very clear that Meregyth is leaving a trail in order to locate her. She may be in trouble after all. You should continue following the flowers in hopes of locating Meregyth.","There is a flower on the road that resembles the ones you gave to Meregyth","The trail of flowers goes off the road and runs adjacent to the stream.\
\
You should continue to follow Meregyth's trail.","The trail of flowers goes up a narrow path that leads behind the waterfall.\
\
You should follow the path that winds around the waterfall.","Meregyth has been gone far too long, and Thane Sparhafoc is concerned for his daughter's safety.","It seems clear now that the Orcs were responsible for Meregyth's disappearance","The Search for Meregyth","Meregyth was last seen heading along the road south towards Beaconwatch.\
\
Thane Sparhafoc asked you to find Meregyth and watch over her.","It is clear now that Meregyth was taken by the Orcs.\
\
You should find her and free her from the clutches of the Orcs.","This flower's placement indicates that Meregyth went up the path that leads behind the waterfall","Look for the trail of flowers Meregyth left behind","You found another flower. Meregyth must be nearby","Find Meregyth","Follow Meregyth's trail along the stream","Follow the road that leads south and look for Meregyth","Another flower from Meregyth leads you up a narrow path","Follow the narrow path that leads behind the waterfall","The trail of flowers leads to the south.\
\
It is possible that Meregyth is leaving a trail in order to locate her. She may be in trouble after all. You should continue following the flowers in hopes of locating Meregyth."}},
[12950]={nameES="The Search for Sapakár",objectivesES={"Talk to Sapakár","Lômazar explains of Sapakár the Cleaver, a powerful ally of Dulgabêth.","Off in the distance you spy a small group of enemies entering the ruins of Barad-dûr","The Search for Sapakár","Ingold has seen a foe matching Sapakár's description","Sapakár stands before you on the edge of the chasm of Mordath","Sapakár can be found somewhere in Barad-dûr.\
\
You should seek out Sapakár.","Talk to Ingold","Enter Barad-dûr and seek out Sapakár","Sapakár can be found somewhere in Barad-dûr.\
\
You should confront Sapakár.","You should travel to the last known location of Sapakár.","You come across a large footprint belonging to Sapakár","Ingold can be found at the Ruins of Díngarth.\
\
You should speak with Ingold to learn anything you can about Sapakár.","Seek out Sapakár","You describe Sapakár as best as you can to Ingold.\
\
'Men under my command have reported a large creature similar in description to this Sapakár that you mention. The monster was last seen near Barad-dûr. I hope this assists you on your search, my friend.'","<rgb=#FF0000>Look Around</rgb> for signs of Sapakár at his last known location","Sapakár can be found deep within the bones of Barad-dûr.\
\
You should seek out Sapakár.","This is the last known location where Ingold said he saw someone matching Sapakár's description"}},
[12951]={nameES="The Search for Shákrug",objectivesES={}},
[12952]={nameES="The Search for Tharrkirîn",objectivesES={"A cluster of large, pale crystals","Tharrkirîn is in northern Gundabad.\
\
Gerja has asked you to discover Tharrkirîn.","Return to Gerja","Flutes of dark grey basalt","An ancient troll, turned to stone","Search for Tharrkirîn","Rocks on display! This must be Tharrkirîn!","High above the River Kurdushâlak an ancient collection of stone from across Gundabad waits to be discovered.","Gerja is located in Bazanmanar.\
\
You should let Gerja know what you found in Tharrkirîn.","This platform is empty","A glittering stalagmite from Stonejaws","The Search for Tharrkirîn","Tharrkirîn is in northern Clovengap.\
\
You have found Tharrkirîn, a plateau with stone-topped display platforms. You should explore the museum."}},
[12953]={nameES="The Search for Thrymm",objectivesES={"Pick up the object that caught your eye","Thrymm was hurled north-west by Núrzum.\
\
You should <rgb=#FF0000>look</rgb> north-west of Scylfig for signs of Thrymm.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This quest requires emotes.</rgb>","Gárwig, the Reeve of Wildermore, can be found in Forlaw.\
\
Cyneberg has asked you to deliver Thrymm's horn to Gárwig.","Cyneberg has recovered enough to ask that Thrymm's body be recovered for a proper burial.","This unlucky fellow is clearly not Thrymm. The hero of Wildermore is nowhere to be found","See if the body on the road below is Thrymm","Cyneberg is in Scylfig.\
\
You should return to Cyneberg and show her the horn.","A body lies below the horn in the north-western Writhendowns, upon the road.\
\
You should investigate the body, for it is likely Thrymm's.","You cannot see Thrymm's body, but something nearby catches your eye. Could it be Thrymm's horn?","Search for Thrymm's body north-west of Scylfig","The item that caught your eye (a horn, perhaps) is just to the west of your last vantage point.\
\
You should examine the item you spotted in the snow.","Bring Thrymm's horn to Gárwig, Reeve of Wildermore","The Search for Thrymm","Bring the horn to Cyneberg","You recognize the horn instantly as Thrymm's own -- the horn he carries with him always... and below, upon the road, you see a body!","This is a good place to look for Thrymm"}},
[12954]={nameES="En busca de una cura",objectivesES={"En busca de una cura","Las plantas se pueden encontrar cerca del espantoso estanque del Bosque Ahogado, al sur de Estolad Mernael.\
\
Deberías darte prisa en llegar al estanque y recolectar muchas hierbas allí, ya que estas podrían tener alguna propiedad que pueda curar al caballo Alagos.","Nestawen se encuentra en Estolad Mernael, cuidando de su corcel enfermo, Alagos.\
\
Deberías llevarle a Nestawen las plantas y flores que has recogido para ver si le pueden servir de algo.","Habla con Nestawen en Estolad Mernael","Los antídotos suelen crecer en el mismo suelo que los venenos. Recolecta las hierbas que crecen cerca del estanque contaminado para que los elfos puedan examinarlas y determinar sus propiedades medicinales."}},
[12955]={nameES="The Search for an Antidote",objectivesES={}},
[12956]={nameES="The Search for the Elf-warrior",objectivesES={}},
[12957]={nameES="The Search for the Missing Man",objectivesES={"You ask Gifemund about Iothete, the man who no longer lived at Dunfast. The draughty home piques your interest once again.\
\
'Oh, Iothete? A senile old fool. He kept insisting that he was given a cursed relic, and then he left town when no one believed him.\
\
'He holes himself up in the northern woods, now.'","The Search for the Missing Man","An inhabitant of Dunfast has left and abandoned his home, and you cannot help but hope that he may have information for you.","Cyneberg is at the refugees' hideout in the Whitshaws.\
\
You should speak with Cyneberg.","Based on the memories of the townsfolk, Iothete likely headed north into the woods from Dunfast.\
\
You should search for Iothete, the man with the empty home.","Find Iothete, the owner of the empty home","Talk to Cyneberg"}},
[12958]={nameES="The Search of Gárferth's Farm",objectivesES={"Torwulf's father must be on or around Gárferth's Farm somewhere. With many Warg-riders roaming the area, he probably didn't make it far.","Torwulf has gone back to Thrymm's Farm, and will want to have a word with you.","Now that he is with you, speak to Torwulf before heading to Gárferth's Farm.","This is around where Torwulf said you should summon him to you, if you are ready to go to Gárferth's Farm.","Use the horn on the road south of Thrymm's Farm","Speak with Torwulf back at Thrymm's Farm","Make your way to Gárferth's Farm.","Torwulf asked you to call him to you on your way to Gárferth's Farm. On the road south of Thrymm's Farm is likely a good spot to summon him.","Gárferth's Farm is one of the three smaller farms, and was abandoned recently when the others were attacked by the White Hand. Torwulf managed to escape, but his father never made it to Thrymm's Farm.","Speak with Torwulf","The Search of Gárferth's Farm","Winerad was barely hanging on, but didn't make it. Torwulf is likely in shock from what has happened, but he wants to have a word with you at the location of his father's death.","Gárferth's Farm is down the road south of Thrymm's Farm.","Speak to Torwulf","You arrived at Gárferth's Farm, and it has been ransacked! Torwulf's father should be nearby...","You hear something approaching...","Find Gárferth's Farm","You hear the old farmer's last breath rattle from his lungs as you kneel down to check on him. A peaceful look creeps across his face, in that final moment. He must have been on the verge of death for some time. He may have found peace knowing he was found, or from catching a glimpse of his last living son.","Find Torwulf's father"}},
[12959]={nameES="The Search of Gársig's Farm",objectivesES={"Return to Siric at Thrymm's Farm","Manléof, who was left behind at Gársig's Farm, is in very poor condition. He isn't likely to live much longer.","Approaching Manléof, you hear pattering feet and hungry growls getting closer...","Gársig's Farm is on the far eastern side of the Fallows, near the Wold.","The Search of Gársig's Farm","Manléof has passed away from his injuries...","Gársig's Farm is in a remote location of the Fallows, and was recently abandoned. Siric made his way to Thrymm's Farm, where those escaping the outlying farms were supposed to escape to. But his friend Manléof, a fellow farmer, has not yet arrived.","Manléof didn't survive the encounter with Warg-riders at Gársig's Farm. You should let Siric know what has happened, and he is awaiting your return at Thrymm's Farm.","Find Manléof at Gársig's Farm","Check on Manléof's injuries and defeat any nearby foes","Manléof is severely injured, but still has a faint pulse... for now"}},
[12960]={nameES="The Search: Fennas Gost",objectivesES={"At the urging of Captain Róglarg, you are to continue your search for the Elf-warrior at the gate to Imlad Morgul, Fennas Gost. Even if you do not intend to find the \\qElf-warrior\\q, you might still learn more of Gothmog's plans in Minas Morgul.","Fennas Gost can be found due south of Cirith Ungol in the heights of the Ephel Dúath.\
\
Captain Róglarg has asked you to patrol the gate to Imlad Morgul, Fennas Gost, in search of the Elf-warrior on the run in Lhingris. You should travel to Fennas Gost.","You have patrolled Fennas Gost.","Completado","The dread gate of Imlad Morgul looms before you...","The Search: Fennas Gost","Beyond this gate lies Imlad Morgul, where Gothmog now hides in fear of King Elessar.\
\
If the day comes to set siege to the Dead City of Minas Morgul, the bridge from Ithilien into the vale shall either have to be rebuilt or the gate of Fennas Gost must be thrown down.","Patrol Fennas Gost \\qin search of the Elf-warrior\\q"}},
[12961]={nameES="The Search: Iant Angos",objectivesES={"At the urging of Captain Róglarg, you are to continue your search for the Elf-warrior at the south-bridge, Iant Angos. Even if you do not intend to find the \\qElf-warrior\\q, you can still learn more of the evils in Lhingris and Talath Úrui.","Iant Angos is a tremendously valuable and strategic holding for the Orcs of Lhingris.\
\
If it were to come to ruin, the forces of Lhingris and Talath Úrui would be separated almost entirely by the Morgai, save through the passes of Durthang and Lugvarg.","The bridge is intact and allows forces from Lhingris and Talath Úrui to swiftly unite...","The Search: Iant Angos","Iant Angos can be found to the south-east of Cirith Ungol in Lhingris.\
\
Captain Róglarg has asked you to patrol Iant Angos in search of the Elf-warrior on the run in Lhingris. You should travel to the bridge of Iant Angos.","Completado","You have patrolled Iant Angos.","Patrol Iant Angos \\qin search of the Elf-warrior\\q"}},
[12962]={nameES="The Search: Torech Ungol",objectivesES={"You have patrolled Torech Ungol.","At the urging of Captain Róglarg, you are to continue your search for the Elf-warrior at the gate to Imlad Morgul, Fennas Gost. Even if you do not intend to find the \\qElf-warrior\\q, you might aid Legolas in learning more about the caverns where Shelob dwells.","Patrol Torech Ungol \\qin search of the Elf-warrior\\q","Amid the shadows of Torech Ungol, you see webbing coating nearly every stone around you...","The shadowed tunnels of Torech Ungol loom before you, but the largest tunnel appears to be sealed by rocks and debris.\
\
If Shelob still dwells within, it is likely that she has become trapped in the aftermath of Sauron's downfall.","Completado","The Search: Torech Ungol","Torech Ungol can be found up the pathway south-west of Cirith Ungol in the heights of the Ephel Dúath.\
\
Captain Róglarg has asked you to patrol Torech Ungol, Shelob's Lair, in search of the Elf-warrior on the run in Lhingris. You should travel to Torech Ungol, but remain on guard."}},
[12963]={nameES="La Estación de la Alegría",objectivesES={"La Estación de la Alegría","Saervereth se encuentra en Duillond, en la zona del festival.\
\
Saervereth estará ansiosa por ver el muérdago y reflexionar sobre el verdadero significado de Yule.","Puedes encontrar muérdago en los jóvenes abetos a lo largo del camino del norte hacia el Refugio de caza de Thrasi.\
\
Saervereth te pidió que recolectaras algo de muérdago para que pudiera recordar el verdadero significado de Yule.","Lleva el muérdago a Saervereth en Duillond","Los elfos celebran el festival de Yule recolectando muérdago de los jóvenes abetos.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando finalice el festival actual.</rgb>"}},
[12964]={nameES="The Seat of Two Kings",objectivesES={"The Seat of Two Kings","You see the crumpled body of a Man in the distance...","Talk to Halhir","Search the Palace of Eldacar for the lost Ranger","Worried that his fellow has not yet returned, Halhir sends you to investigate the abandoned Palace of King Eldacar.","The Palace of Eldacar can be found due west of Halhir in western Osgiliath.\
\
You have spotted a crumpled body in the distance. You should examine it before leaving the Palace.","Examine the slain Ranger","The Palace of Eldacar can be found due west of Halhir in western Osgiliath.\
\
You have not found Halhir's ally, and should now search within the ruins of the Palace.","Halhir can be found due east of the Palace of Eldacar in western Osgiliath.\
\
You have found Halhir's slain ally, and should now return to him bearing the news of his friend's passing.","Strange wounds mark the man's lifeless body and a blunted Morgul-blade lies nearby...","You have not found the Ranger, but the air grows heavy and dreadful near the palace...","The Palace of Eldacar can be found due west of Halhir in western Osgiliath.\
\
Halhir has asked you to search near the Palace of Eldacar for a lost ally.","Search for the lost Ranger outside the Palace of Eldacar"}},
[12965]={nameES="The Second Bounty",objectivesES={}},
[12966]={nameES="El Segundo Desafío",objectivesES={"Has salido victorioso","Acepta el desafío de Donnan","El segundo símbolo de honor, la piedra del Túmulo de Honor, fue más difícil de obtener, ya que requirió entrar en territorio hostil sin combatir.","Arzhur está en Aughaire.\
\
Debes regresar con Arzhur para informarle de tu victoria en el segundo desafío.","Donnan y su hermano están en Aughaire, en el lado oeste del pueblo de los montañeses, esperando tu respuesta a su desafío.\
\
Arzhur te ha pedido una vez más que luches contra los retadores de un clan hostil leal a Angmar.","El Segundo Desafío"}},
[12967]={nameES="El segundo engranaje",objectivesES={"El segundo engranaje","Lleva el segundo engranaje a Bávor","Encuentra el segundo engranaje perdido","Bávor es un mecánico encargado de reparar el gran mecanismo que da acceso a la legendaria Bóveda de la Montaña.","Segundo engranaje perdido encontrado","Bávor está en la Mansión de Thorin.\
\
Bávor estará complacido de ver que has conseguido el segundo engranaje.","El cofre que contiene el segundo engranaje puede encontrarse en el lado sur de las ruinas infestadas de trasgos en el Valle de Thráin, al sur de la Mansión de Thorin y al oeste de Noglond.\
\
Bávor descubrió la ubicación del segundo engranaje y te ha enviado a buscarlo mientras él repara el primero."}},
[12968]={nameES="The Second Stone",objectivesES={"Talk to the Emissary and 'Speak the Words'","Find the third remnant","You place the remnants in the Emissary's still open hand. They absorb into its flesh and disappear. You once again hear the booming voice inside your head.\
\
'Now, you must speak the words.'\
\
The Emissary senses your confusion and emits a low rumbling sound that you think might be laughter.\
\
'You cannot understand the whispers. Your mind is closed. Seek the Mighty Ones, and speak the words when you are ready.'","Our hatred will consume you","The missing stone is out there somewhere, waiting to be found.","Find the seventh remnant","Find the fifth remnant","The spirit of evil lingers still","The Nameless being towers over you, but shows no hostility. As it turns its gaze towards you, you feel the hairs on the back of your neck stand on end. It slowly moves its hand in your direction, as if waiting for you to hand something to it. A booming voice fills your mind.\
\
'Bring me the remnants. Remnants from the fallen ones. Prove your worth.'\
\
It continues to hold out its hand to you.","Find the fourth remnant","The remnant whispers to you in a language you do not understand","An illusion has appeared before you in the Crown Chamber.\
\
You should inspect the illusion of the second stone.","The Second Stone","Find the second remnant","Find the first remnant","You have collected the remnants for the Emissary.\
\
You should return to the Emissary and 'Speak the Words'.","The Emissary has asked you to find the \\qRemnants of the Fallen Ones\\q and return them.","Talk to the Emissary","The vision shows you a pear-shaped stone on this pedestal. This second stone must be out there somewhere, waiting for you to find it. You swear you can hear faint whispers, bidding you to look closer at the illusion.","You have found one of the missing stones!\
\
You should return them to their rightful place in the Crown Chamber.","Find the second stone","You have found a hidden chamber in the Mountains of Shadow, but a Nameless entity stands in your way.","Return the stone to its pedestal","Inspect the illusion of the second stone","The war with the Valar is eternal","Find the sixth remnant","The stones must be returned to their rightful places in the Crown Chamber.","The switch has revealed a hidden door"}},
[12969]={nameES="El secreto de las profundidades",objectivesES={"Descubre y elimina el motivo de la preocupación de Lar","La Sala Decimosexta es una zona infestada de orcos, muchos de los cuales padecen una terrible enfermedad que provoca crecimientos similares a hongos en sus cuerpos.\
\
Mallas, un elfo aliado de los enanos, cree que hay algo oculto bajo la Sala Decimosexta y desea descubrir el verdadero propósito y el origen de la plaga.","Regresa con Lar en el Refugio Sombrío","La Sala Decimosexta se encuentra al noreste del Refugio Sombrío.\
\
Lar te ha pedido que te adentres en lo más profundo de la Sala Decimosexta y trates de encontrar el origen de su inquietud.","El secreto de las profundidades","Has matado al Descarriado","Lar se encuentra en el Refugio Sombrío, al suroeste de la Sala Decimosexta.\
\
Vuelve con Lar y dile lo que has descubierto y matado: una terrible criatura sin cabeza en las profundidades de la sala, acechando en una habitación llena de esporas y baba."}},
[12970]={nameES="The Secret Ingredient",objectivesES={"An affable woman pulls you aside.\
\
'You there! Are you looking for work?'\
\
You begin to answer, but she doesn't let you finish.\
\
'Of course you are!'\
\
She pushes a cloth-lined basket into your hands.\
\
'There is an herb that grows outside the western gate of Pelargir. It has broad leaves and a distinct smell, like the rind of a sour fruit. I would go get it myself, but as you can see we have a lot of hungry customers to feed.'\
\
She leans in and whispers in a conspiratorial tone.\
\
'Onjópo is a great cook, but he doesn't do well under pressure. I need to make sure he doesn't burn anything.'\
\
She sends you off with a wink.","Jódha needs some help preparing for a rush of customers at her food stall.","You have found enough herbs to satisfy Jódha.\
\
Deliver the savoury herbs to Jódha.","With a sweep of her arm, Jódha gestures to the line of hungry patrons waiting in front of the grill.\
\
'We started out feeding just the shipbreakers and shipbuilders, but before we knew it half of Pelargir has come lining up for our food! We never expected to be so popular. Thank you for the herbs. They're one of the most important ingredients in our marinade.\
\
'You'll... keep that a secret, won't you?'","The Secret Ingredient","Talk to Jódha","Jódha has asked you to pick some savoury herbs outside of Pelargir.\
\
Find herbs in the fields west of Pelargir."}},
[12971]={nameES="The Secret Passage",objectivesES={"Exit into the Fourth Circle","The Finding Place lies near the cisterns' exit in the Fourth Circle.\
\
The children have spotted something they call the \\qFinding Place.\\q Walk over to it and see what it is. If you get separated, use Bergil's whistle to call the children to you.","Found the key","Meet Bergil back at the Old Guest-house","The Wrights' Fellow-hall lies on the far southern end of the First Circle.\
\
Bergil knows of a second, unwatched door into the Cisterns, which might grant the children passage directly to the Fourth Circle. A key to it was lost near the Wrights' Fellow-hall recently. Search for it in that area.","The door can be found near the Wrights' Fellow-hall, in the southern stretch of the First Circle.\
\
Enter the cisterns through the hidden door.","Talk to Bergil","Bergil and his friends seek a new way to reach the city's upper circles, now that the Second Circle is barred to them.","Checked location for the key","You think you can see the spot Gelwen is pointing at, some yards off","Reaching your hand into the crevice, you discover a letter!","Gelwen stands in front of the Old Guest-house, in the First Circle, just south of the City Gates.\
\
Bergil says two other children, Gelwen and Glatham, would like to join you in searching the cisterns for the secret passage. He suggested that you speak with Gelwen herself, first.","Found the key!","Bergil, Gelwen, and Glatham arrive nearly on your heels","Found the way up to the Fourth Circle","Talk to Gelwen","Bergil waits in front of the Old Guest-house, in the First Circle, just south of the City Gates.\
\
Tell Bergil you found the key to the cisterns' hidden door. With it, the children might find passage directly to the Fourth Circle.","The Old Guest-house lies in the First Circle, just south of the City Gates.\
\
Meet Bergil and the other children back at the Old Guest-house.","Search for a way up","If you get separated from the children, use Bergil's whistle to call them to you.\
\
Explore the cisterns with Bergil, Gelwen, and Glatham, and search for a passage up to the Fourth Circle of Minas Tirith.","Enter the cisterns through the hidden door","The Secret Passage","Found the key.","Fourth Circle - Players' Tier","If you get separated from the children, use Bergil's whistle to call them to you.\
\
You have met Bergil, Gelwen, and Glatham in the cisterns. Gelwen has something to say.","If you get separated from the children, use Bergil's whistle to call them to you.\
\
Show Bergil the slightly crumpled letter you found in the crevice of the Finding Place.","If you get separated from the children, use Bergil's whistle to call them to you.\
\
You have come out of the secret passage through the cisterns, to the Fourth Circle of the City. Gelwen again appears to have something she wishes to say.","Investigate the Finding Place"}},
[12972]={nameES="The Secret Ritual",objectivesES={"The Angmarim cultists have taken over the dwarf-fort Bagud-dum.\
\
You should complete objectives in Bagud-dum to prevent their plans from reaching fruition.","Talk to Hórin just outside the door to the keep in Bagud-dum","The ancient dwarf-fort known as Bagud-dum has been taken over by the Angmarim. There they plan to perform an ancient ritual which might reveal their true motives.","Hórin is standing by outside Bagud-dum.\
\
You should speak to Hórin and complete 'Instance: The Secret Ritual'.","Loknashra and the staff are gone!","Talk to Hórin outside Bagud-dum","Talk to Hórin outside Bagud-dum and go with him to investigate","Complete 'Spirits and Summoners' for Hórin","Find Loknashra inside the keep of Bagud-dum","The Secret Ritual","Hórin is waiting for you outside Bagud-dum.\
\
You should talk to Hórin.","Hórin has dragged you out of Bagud-dum.\
\
You should talk to Hórin.","Complete 'Apprentices of the Cult' for Hórin"}},
[12973]={nameES="The Secret Shadow",objectivesES={"Talk to Mithrandir in Thuringwath","Talk to Mithrandir","Mithrandir can be found in Falch Gurth.\
\
Mithrandir has asked you to accompany him into Thuringwath. You should talk to Mithrandir when you are prepared.","Mithrandir can be found in Thuringwath.\
\
You have passed through Falch Gurth into Thuringwath with Mithrandir. You should talk to Mithrandir.","The Secret Shadow","Thuringwath, the Valley of Secret Shadow, has remained hidden among the slopes of Ephel Dúath since the Second Age of the world."}},
[12974]={nameES="The Secret Stone",objectivesES={"Talk to King Thorin III","An old tome found in Erebor leads to the mystery of The Secret Stone. What does it mean?","The Secret Stone","A tome rests on this bench, left behind by someone.  It seems ancient, like it might just turn to dust if handled too roughly. Several pages have been torn out and are missing. A poem is written on the page that was left open:\
\
Beneath the Misty Mountains, deep,\
The ancient shadows hold their keep.\
Came Durin King, his crown of stars,\
To carve new halls, claim kingdom ours.\
Above the dwarf-made forges glow,\
While unknown dangers lurk below.\
\
For many thousand years it slept,\
In darkened depths, where fell-things crept.\
And then, one day, the stone was found,\
Dark as night, and perfectly round.\
Its beauty beckons but a glance,\
But ensnares the mind in a trance.\
\
Many were lost, driven insane,\
And then we unearthed Durin's Bane.\
From Moria, the Longbeards flee\
In hand, the stone-that-should-not-be.\
By King Thráin's orders, it is sealed,\
By secret door never revealed.\
\
Just the line of Durin may know,\
Of Secret Stone, born of shadow.\
Heed this warning, do not seek it,\
This fell thing you cannot outwit!\
The stone must remain locked away\
Do not seek the hidden doorway!\
\
King Thorin III is in the line of Durin. Perhaps he would be willing to share more about this Secret Stone.","You very gently pick up the tome","King Thorin III can be found at his seat in Erebor.\
\
You should bring the tome to King Thorin III.","Collect the dusty tome"}},
[12975]={nameES="The Secret of Stormwall",objectivesES={"The Secret of Stormwall","Talk to Agátur","Beyond the corpse of a spider lies a large crack in the old dwarf crafting halls of Stormwall. Singed webbing coats the abyss. You wonder what could lie within these ancient spider tunnels. Perhaps the spider in front of you has more clues.","You should return to Agátur, back in Skarháld.","Deep within Stormwall lies a fiery secret, slumbering in the shadows.","A spider corpse can be found deep within Stormwall, high in the mountains north-east of Skarháld.\
\
You should examine the spider corpse.","Examine the spider corpse","As you look at the spider remains, you hear sounds in the tunnel. Not the sounds of spiders, but the sounds of drakes and other dragon-kind. They are drawing near. Prepare to defend yourself!"}},
[12976]={nameES="The Secret of Tuntham",objectivesES={}},
[12977]={nameES="El secreto del collar",objectivesES={"Puede que un Elfo esté acampado cerca de Casa del Bosque, al sur de Bolgovado.\
\
Linda Bolger quedó desconcertada por tu hallazgo de un collar donde ella había visto al gran lobo. No pudo leer las letras del collar, pero pensó que quizá el Elfo que Milo creyó ver podría descifrarlas.","El secreto del collar","Lleva el collar con runas al Elfo cerca de Casa del Bosque","Has encontrado un collar inscrito con runas que no puedes leer, aparentemente enterrado por el lobo inusualmente grande que Linda Bolger vio la noche en que los lobos atravesaron Bolgovado."}},
[12978]={nameES="El secreto del Consejo",objectivesES={"Geirfast se encuentra en la Sala Vigesimoprimera.\
\
Deberías regresar de inmediato con Geirfast.","Habla con Geirfast en la Sala Vigesimoprimera","Habla con Geirfast y descubre los secretos de tu misterioso destino","El secreto del Consejo","Lenglammel se encuentra acampada en el Refugio Sombrío.\
\
Geirfast te sugirió que hablaras con la elfa Lenglammel.","Geirfast se encuentra en la Sala Vigesimoprimera, al noroeste de la Sala Segunda.\
\
Deberías regresar con Geirfast para contarle dónde se halla la cámara.","Habla con Geirfast","Has descubierto la cámara secreta","La entrada se encuentra en algún lugar de Nud-melek, al sureste de la Sala Vigesimoprimera, quizá en la Sala Segunda.\
\
Geirfast te ha pedido que encuentres la entrada a la cámara secreta representada en el mapa de sombras.","Geirfast se encuentra en la Sala Vigesimoprimera.\
\
Deberías hablar con Geirfast cuando estés listo para viajar.","Habla con Lenglammel en el Refugio Sombrío","Descubre la entrada a la cámara secreta","Según la descripción del mapa que la antorcha proyectó en la pared, Geirfast cree que la cámara secreta debe encontrarse en algún punto de Nud‑melek, quizá en la parte sur de la Sala Segunda."}},
[12979]={nameES="El secreto de las espadas",objectivesES={"El secreto de las espadas","Hay muchas viejas historias olvidadas en Angmar, pero Nethraw solo está interesado en una.","El maestro del saber Nethraw se encuentra en el Krúsle Lannan, a una considerable distancia al este de Gabilshathûr.\
\
Banfuir te sugirió que hablaras con el maestro del saber Nethraw."}},
[12980]={nameES="The Secrets of Gloomingtarn",objectivesES={"The Secrets of Gloomingtarn","Hersegg rushes to your side!","Scout Lochan Dúv with Hersegg","Hersegg can be found at the entrance to Mîn Lorg within Lochan Dúv in Gloomingtarn.\
\
You have found the entrance to Mîn Lorg. You should talk to Hersegg.","Lochan Dúv can be found to the west of Lugun-nâla in Gloomingtarn.\
\
Hersegg has asked you to accompany her in combatting the Iron Crown at Lochan Dúv. You should travel to Lochan Dúv with Hersegg.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: If you become separated from Hersegg, use the horn she gave you to summon her back to your side.</rgb>","Talk to Hersegg at Mîn Lorg","Lochan Dúv has been thrown into disarray!","The Iron Crown commander can be found at Lochan Dúv. Hersegg can be found at your side.\
\
You should defeat the Iron Crown commander at Lochan Dúv and aid Hersegg with her task.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: If you become separated from Hersegg, use the horn she gave you to summon her back to your side.</rgb>","Within the cavern, you hear distant Angmarim voices...","Defeat the Iron Crown commander at Lochan Dúv","The entrance to Mîn Lorg can be found somewhere within Lochan Dúv in Gloomingtarn.\
\
The Iron Crown commander held orders demanding an excavation of Mîn Lorg before the arrival of his master, Allaban the Collector. You should search for the entrance to Mîn Lorg.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: If you become separated from Hersegg, use the horn she gave you to summon her back to your side.</rgb>","After learning that the Angmarim of the Iron Crown appear to have uncovered a secret passage known as Mîn Lorg, Hersegg resolves to stop them and discover the secrets of Gloomingtarn for the Gabil'akkâ.","Hersegg can be found at your side.\
\
You have defeated the Iron Crown commander and helped to sow discord at Lochan Dúv. You should talk to Hersegg.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: If you become separated from Hersegg, use the horn she gave you to summon her back to your side.</rgb>","Talk to Hersegg","Determined to discover lost artifacts, the Angmarim of the Iron Crown toil within Lochan Dúv","As the Iron Crown commander falls defeated, Hersegg swiftly collects the scroll-case he carried","Hersegg can be found at your side.\
\
You have found the entrance to Mîn Lorg. You should talk to Hersegg.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: If you become separated from Hersegg, use the horn she gave you to summon her back to your side.</rgb>","Aid Hersegg with 'Curious Captives'","Hersegg can be found at your side.\
\
You have entered Lochan Dúv with Hersegg. You should talk to Hersegg.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: If you become separated from Hersegg, use the horn she gave you to summon her back to your side.</rgb>","Find the entrance to Mîn Lorg"}},
[12981]={nameES="Los secretos de Sarch Vorn",objectivesES={"Rhiangar te ha pedido que estés atento a cualquier señal de que su madre pudo haber visitado Sarch Vorn.\
\
Sarch Vorn está en el norte de Cardolan.","Busca pistas","Los secretos de Sarch Vorn","Lleva el collar a Rhiangar","Hace muchos años, la madre de Rhiangar desapareció. ¿Podrían estar escondidas en Sarch Vorn pistas sobre su paradero?","Has encontrado un viejo collar en el esqueleto desgastado por el clima de una mujer. Sospechas que Rhiangar estaría interesada en este objeto.\
\
Deberías llevarle el collar a Herne."}},
[12982]={nameES="The Secrets of Seregost",objectivesES={"Talk to the Uruk Prisoner","Rhadrog is right next to you!\
\
You should talk to Rhadrog.","You have managed to escape with Rhadrog and Viznak.\
\
You should talk to Rhadrog.","Run!","Screams and moans from many different creatures echo around in the chamber before you","Find an entrance into Seregost","Viznak is somewhere deeper in the prison.\
\
Now that you have the information you need, you should find Viznak.","Talk to Viznak","You and Viznak are prepared to enter Seregost. What secrets and what dangers can be found within?","Talk to Rhadrog","Defeated the Blood-witch","Viznak can be found near Seregost.\
\
You should talk to Viznak.","Defeat the Blood-witch","Living prisoners can be found inside the prison.\
\
You should talk to these prisoners.","Find Viznak","Rhadrog is standing by inside the prison.\
\
You should talk to Rhadrog.","The merrevail have Viznak tied to an altar","Talk to the Easterling prisoner","Bolvág the Cursed is chasing you!\
\
You should run!","Viznak has been ambushed by merrevail on Seregost's terrace!\
\
You should defeat the merrevail.","The Secrets of Seregost","The Blood-witch can be found in the deepest chamber of Seregost's prison.\
\
You should defeat the Blood-witch and her merrevail.","Viznak has been taken into Seregost.\
\
You should find a way inside.","Talk to the Nurnhoth prisoner","Bolvág the Cursed roars behind you, but you are safe for now"}},
[12983]={nameES="The Secrets of Sundergrót",objectivesES={"Rúzat, Agátur, and Náth can be found at Limlók.\
\
You should talk to the three dwarves.","Sundergrót can be found in the Floodfells.\
\
You should talk to Agátur outside of Sundergrót.","Talk to Agátur at Limlók","Talk to Agátur outside of Sundergrót","The Secrets of Sundergrót","Talk to Náth at Limlók","The goblins of Sundergrót have set up a secret meeting within the old dwarf ruins.","Talk to Rúzat at Limlók"}},
[12984]={nameES="The Secrets of the Dead",objectivesES={"This person was buried with what looks like an ornate dog collar","This person was buried with what looks like a board game, the pieces carved from stone","Andûmu has asked you to examine the grave goods buried with the people in north-eastern An Shêru to learn something of who they were and what their lives were like. You started at Naxar Dâl, north of Gadim-ûn, and next went to the Crypts of Khâb Daku, examining grave goods at each location. You should return to Andûmu in Gadim-ûn and tell him what you discovered.","This person was buried with a small statue that looks Gondorian in style","This person was buried with jewellery, some of which is of Temámir-make","This person was buried with weapons similar to those used by Shagâni today","Andûmu has asked you to examine the grave goods buried with the people in north-eastern An Shêru to learn something of who they were and what their lives were like. You started at Naxar Dâl, north of Gadim-ûn, and next went to the Crypts of Khâb Daku, to the south, where you defeated some of the wights there, clearing some space for yourself.","The Secrets of the Dead","This person was buried wearing clothes interwoven with gold","Andûmu has asked you to examine the grave goods buried with the people in north-eastern An Shêru to learn something of who they were and what their lives were like. You should start at Naxar Dâl, north of Gadim-ûn, and defeat some wights there to clear some space for yourself.","This person was buried with wine bottles, now dusty and dry","Many wights have risen from the grave in An Shêru, but who were they?","Andûmu has asked you to examine the grave goods buried with the people in north-eastern An Shêru to learn something of who they were and what their lives were like. You started at Naxar Dâl, north of Gadim-ûn, and defeated some of the wights, clearing some space for yourself.","This person was buried with a collection of scrolls, the paper crumbling and unreadable","Talk to Andûmu in Gadim-ûn","Andûmu has asked you to examine the grave goods buried with the people in north-eastern An Shêru to learn something of who they were and what their lives were like. You started at Naxar Dâl, north of Gadim-ûn, and should now go to the Crypts of Khâb Daku, to the south. Defeat some of the wights there to clear some space for yourself."}},
[12985]={nameES="La Semilla de la Putrefacción",objectivesES={"La Semilla de la Putrefacción","Completa «El infortunio del sauce» en cualquier nivel de dificultad","«El infortunio del sauce» completada","Hob Guardacercas vigila el Portal del Este.\
\
Deberías contarle lo que ha sucedido desde la última vez que lo viste.","Tom te ha dicho que la espada se encuentra cerca del Viejo Hombre Sauce.\
\
Deberías colaborar con Marigold para encontrar la espada y destruirla.","Habla con Hob Guardacercas","Habla con Marigold","Completa «El infortunio del sauce» en cualquier nivel de dificultad.\
\
A partir del nivel 20, usa el Buscador de instancias para entrar en El infortunio del sauce.","Depende de ti proteger el Bosque Viejo, para que no sea invadido por trolls silvanos y espíritus malignos."}},
[12986]={nameES="The Seeping Poison",objectivesES={"Grind up the digestive roots at the grinding stone north of Herestan","The Seeping Poison","The grinding stone is at the armour-making pavillion north of Herestan.\
\
You now have some digestive roots and need to grind them into powder.","Herestan has suffered a poisoned wound from a Dunlending blade and needs your help to brew an antidote.","Herestan is to the south of the grinding stone, by the lake's edge, where you left him.","You grind the roots into a powder","Bring the digestive root-powder to Herestan","Digestive roots can be found throughout Tâl Methedras, around the shores of the lake and on the eyot in the middle of the water, at the base of trees."}},
[12987]={nameES="The Sekbiri of Ghar Jâdam",objectivesES={"Sekbiri have attacked Zamarzîr. A local guard would like to cull down their numbers to prevent another attack from happening.","A worried guard at the gate of Halrax has asked you to cull down the sekbir population in their den on the north side of the island.\
\
Sekbiri may be found at Ghar Jâdam to the north of Zamarzîr.","The Sekbiri of Ghar Jâdam"}},
[12988]={nameES="The Sequestered Spiders",objectivesES={"Atli moves to a safer location to tend to his injury","Help Atli with 'Before They Become a Problem'","Find Taurlingol","According to the Rangers, the spider-infested forest of Taurlingol can be found in eastern Cirith Ungol.\
\
You should find Taurlingol.","Atli Spider-bane is engaged in combat with a giant spider!","You hear shouts nearby!","Legolas has asked for your assistance with tasks in Taurlingol.\
\
You should complete 'The Daughters of Iphantemel,' 'The Trees of Taurlingol,' 'Before They Become a Problem,' and 'The Only Solution.'","Atli has moved to a safe location nearby.\
\
You should find and talk to Atli Spider-bane.","Help Atli with 'The Only Solution'","Help Legolas with 'The Daughters of Iphantemel'","Find the source of the shouting","Legolas wishes to next investigate the spider-infested woods in eastern Cirith Ungol, Taurlingol.","You have found Atli Spider-bane in combat with a giant spider of Taurlingol.\
\
You should help Atli defeat the spider!","Help Legolas with 'The Trees of Taurlingol'","You should inform Legolas of your success defeating the Mirkwood Spiders.\
\
Legolas can be found on a hill near Taurlingol.","Talk to Atli Spider-bane","Help Atli defeat the spider","Habla con Legolas.","The Sequestered Spiders","Legolas is tending to Atli Spider-bane's injuries on an overlook near Taurlingol.\
\
You should talk to Legolas.","As you entered Taurlingol, you heard someone shouting.\
\
You should find the source of the shouting."}},
[12989]={nameES="The Setting Sun",objectivesES={}},
[12990]={nameES="The Settling of Misthallow",objectivesES={"Léothred, the Rohirric scholar, seeks to complete the journey his ancestors took north, from the Vales of Anduin through Misthallow.","Thokvist can be found in the south of Misthallow.\
\
You should travel to Thokvist.","Orcs can be found in Misthallow.\
\
You should defeat Orcs in Misthallow.","Talk to Léothred at Thokvist","The camp's occupants glance and nod towards you and Léothred as you enter","Léothred can be found at Thokvist.\
\
You should talk to Léothred.","The Settling of Misthallow","Travel to Thokvist in Misthallow"}},
[12991]={nameES="Las siete espadas",objectivesES={"Las estatuas de los Siete Centinelas se encuentran en el Templo de los Siete Centinelas, al este de Gabilshathûr.\
\
Las siete espadas deben ser entregadas a los Siete Centinelas en el orden correcto antes de que se abra la bóveda.","Entrega la Espada de la Vigilia a la estatua correcta","Entrega la Espada de la Masacre a la estatua correcta","Colocas la espada en la mano de la estatua","Entrega la Espada de Rhudaur a la estatua correcta","Has recogido el tesoro de los Siete Centinelas","Parece que esta no es la estatua correcta","Se han recuperado las siete espadas de los Siete Centinelas, y Nethraw realiza los preparativos finales para abrir la bóveda de los Siete Centinelas.","Las siete espadas","Lleva el tesoro de los Siete Centinelas de vuelta a Nethraw","Entrega la Espada de Arvedui a la estatua correcta","Esto no parece ser la estatua correcta","Recoge el tesoro de los Siete Centinelas","Entrega la Espada del Dolor a la estatua correcta","Entrega la Espada del Crepúsculo a la estatua correcta","Has resuelto el enigma de los Siete Centinelas, así que ahora es el momento de entrar en la bóveda y recuperar el tesoro.","Entrega la Espada de Gondor a la estatua correcta"}},
[12992]={nameES="Las siete espadas",objectivesES={"Protege a Nethraw","Nethraw se encuentra en Kruslë Lannan, al este de Gabilshathûr.\
\
Debes colocar las siete espadas en sus pedestales para abrir Kruslë Lannan.","Coloca las siete espadas en sus pedestales","Nethraw derrotado","Las siete espadas","Escapa de Kruslë Lannan","Has venido con Nethraw al corazón de Kruslë Lannan.","Debes escapar de Kruslë Lannan con Nethraw.","Busca Kruslë Lannan con Nethraw.","Derrotaste la sombra de Ánraig"}},
[12993]={nameES="Las siete espadas",objectivesES={"Nethraw se encuentra en Kruslë Lannan, al este de Gabilshathûr.\
\
Nethraw te ha pedido que lo acompañes dentro del sitio.","Acompaña a Nethraw dentro de Kruslë Lannan.","Las siete espadas","Nethraw se encuentra en Kruslë Lannan, al este de Gabilshathûr.\
\
Nethraw te ha pedido que encuentres aliados y lo acompañes dentro del sitio.","Nethraw se encuentra en Kruslë Lannan, al este de Gabilshathûr.\
\
Deberías hablar de nuevo con Nethraw.","Habla con Nethraw","Has encontrado las siete espadas de Kruslë Lannan."}},
[12994]={nameES="The Severed Hand",objectivesES={}},
[12995]={nameES="La Sombra Cae",objectivesES={"Elrond puede encontrarse en Rivendel, en el Bosque de los Trolls, al sureste de las Quebradas del Norte.\
\
Istuienn te dijo que lleves las empuñaduras de morgul a Elrond el Medio Elfo para que sean destruidas.","Has recuperado las cuatro empuñaduras de morgul de los espectros en las ruinas de Fornost. Istuienn te ha pedido ayuda para encontrar una forma de destruirlas.","La Sombra Cae","Lleva las empuñaduras de morgul a Hemeldir","Hemeldir se encuentra en las Fraguas de Rivendel, fuera de los Salones de Elrond.\
\
Elrond te dijo que lleves las empuñaduras de morgul a su maestro herrero, Hemeldir."}},
[12996]={nameES="The Shadow Over Shathur-munzu",objectivesES={"Now that you have the key, you should return to Baradal's cage and try to open it.","The lock springs open, freeing Baradal","The lock resists your attempts","The Shadow Over Shathur-munzu","Baradal has been freed from her cage.\
\
You should talk to Baradal.","Complete 'Instance: The Shadow Hunter'","Find Baradal","This key looks like it may open the lock on Baradal's cage","Defeat the Orc jailor","You find yourself in a den of wargs and Orc-kind. Baradal is nowhere to be seen, and it is very likely she is in grave danger.\
\
You should make your way through Shathur-munzu and find her before it is too late. Be wary; Ránulur the warg chieftain, or the 'Shadow-hunter', as he is known to the locals, may still be near.","It seems this lock is too sturdy to be opened by force. You will need to find the key. It is probably being carried by an Orc or goblin somewhere inside Shathur-munzu.","Somewhere inside Shathur-munzu, an Orc holds the key to Baradal's cage.\
\
You should find and defeat the Orc jailor.","Attempt to break the lock","Completado.","Talk to Baradal","Baradal is somewhere inside Shathur-munzu. She may be in danger.\
\
You should find Baradal.","The time has come to enter Shathur-munzu.\
\
You should complete 'Instance: The Shadow Hunter.'","The time has come to see what lies inside Shathur-munzu. Whatever awaits, your goal is to clear it of danger for Lady Arwen's arrival.","Acquire the crude iron key","Open the strong lock","Defeated the Orc jailor","Baradal is locked inside a cage in Shathur-munzu, injured and in danger.\
\
You should attempt to break open her cage.","Completado"}},
[12997]={nameES="La sombra se extiende",objectivesES={"La sombra se extiende","Nadfaron se encuentra en Tinnudir, al suroeste de Tham Ornen.\
\
Nadfaron querrá examinar las órdenes que encontraste en el campamento angmarin de Tham Ornen.","Tham Ornen ha sido ocupada por las fuerzas de Angmar. Se desconoce qué valor ven en las ruinas.","Tham Ornen se encuentra al noreste de Tinnudir.\
\
Nadfaron te pidió que fueras a Tham Ornen y recogieras órdenes del campamento angmarin."}},
[12998]={nameES="La Sombra de Mordor",objectivesES={"Habla con Lethi","La Sombra de Mordor","Habla con Dwalin en la Mansión de Thorin","Lethi puede encontrarse en las mazmorras de Barad-dûr.\
\
Los Hachetones han comenzado a rebelarse dentro de la Torre Oscura. Deberías hablar con Lethi.","A medida que la sombra de Mordor se alarga sobre la Tierra Media, el Enemigo ordena la liberación de un prisionero misterioso, provocando intrigas y revueltas en Barad-dûr.","Dwalin puede encontrarse en la Mansión de Thorin.\
\
Has pasado muchos meses ayudando a deshacer el daño causado en la Mansión de Thorin por los Duramano. Deberías hablar con Dwalin."}},
[12999]={nameES="The Shadow of Narchraw",objectivesES={"Examine the food scraps","Narchraw was said to be imprisoned in the jails of Barad-dûr.\
\
You should follow the trail of scratch marks.","Examined the chamber.","It looks as if the cloth has been ripped apart by large claws","While the marks show that the beast already escaped, you should continue to press ahead","The Shadow of Narchraw","It looks as if there was a violent scuffle here","The chamber is scattered with debris.\
\
You should inspect the various debris in the chamber.","Examine the tattered cloth","Lômazar tells you of the ancient beast, Narchraw, that Dulgabêth wishes to treat with.","While the food is moldy, the beast must have escaped during a feeding","Follow the trail of scratch marks","You notice large scratch marks on a nearby wall","While you do not notice anything out of the ordinary, the beast known as Narchraw must be very powerful.\
\
You decide to think about your next course of action.","Examine the rubble","Completado","Enter Barad-dûr","Barad-dûr is located in eastern Dor Amarth.\
\
You should enter Barad-dûr.","You come across a very old chamber"}},
[13000]={nameES="Los sabuesos de la sombra",objectivesES={"Los barguests pueden encontrarse en el oeste de los Campos de Fornost.\
\
Debes derrotar barghests en los Campos de Fornost.","Completado","Has derrotado a muchos barghests en el oeste de los Campos de Fornost.","Los sabuesos de la sombra","Barghests malvados y corruptos merodean por los Campos de Fornost. Siguen a los muertos y dejan muerte a su paso."}},
[13001]={nameES="The Shadowed King",objectivesES={"By your hand, a terrible Nameless entity has been released. By your hand, he must fall.","Inspect the note from Frethi","The Shadowed King has been vanquished!\
\
You should return to King Thorin and inform him of your victory.","The Shadowed King awaits within the Shadowed Cave.\
\
You should complete Askâd-mazal, the Chamber of Shadows, on any difficulty.","You tell King Thorin of your victory over the Shadowed King, and he smiles with pride and relief.\
\
'Thank you for your bravery, hero. You have undoubtedly saved us from a terrible fate. This incident has proven yet again that we must be ever watchful, for there are still terrible evils lurking in the depths, and secrets yet to be uncovered. We at least know the name of one now: Throkhâr. May the day never come that I must send you to defeat THAT monster.'","Complete Askâd-mazal, the Chamber of Shadows","The Shadowed King must be found and defeated, but first, you must find Frethi.\
\
You should return to the Crown Chamber in the Foundations of Stone.","Frethi is missing, but a note addressed to you lies on the floor","Frethi has left you a note in the Crown Chamber.\
\
You should read the note.","Frethi left you a note saying he had gone to investigate the Shadowed Cave.\
\
You should find the Shadowed Cave in the Foundations of Stone.","Return to the Crown Chamber","Find Frethi near the Shadowed Cave","Talk to King Thorin","The Shadowed King"}},
[13002]={nameES="The Shattered Crown",objectivesES={"The other hunter can likely be found further along the road into Tarlang's Crown.\
\
You have discovered the remains of one of the hunters, but it is possible the other survived. You should search for them.","Gordir can be found on the dock on the river Blackroot to the west of Sardol.\
\
You have found the remains of two hunters from Sardol and evidence of a massing corsair force in Tarlang's Crown.","The missing hunters can be found somewhere along the road through Tarlang's Crown.\
\
Gordir has grown worried about two hunters that ventured into Tarlang's Crown and has asked you to seek them out.","Patrol the road deeper into Tarlang's Crown","You see tents of strange make and numerous men in the distance","The road through Tarlang's Crown can be found to the south of Sardol in Blackroot Vale.\
\
Having found both hunters slain, you hope to find out what brought about their demise in Tarlang's Crown.","DNT -- will not be seen","Search Tarlang's Crown for the missing hunters","Talk to Gordir","You have discovered a hunter of Sardol, felled as he tried to flee","You were too late to save this hunter who bears grievous bite wounds","The road through Tarlang's Crown has long served as a route to Dol Amroth, but now Gordir of Sardol fears it serves a new, more sinister purpose.","Search Tarlang's Crown for the other missing hunter","The Shattered Crown"}},
[13003]={nameES="The Shattered Lord",objectivesES={"Grimbold can possibly be found at the Fords of Isen, where the stones make paths across the river.\
\
You should search the Fords of Isen for Grimbold.","Grimbold can likely be found near the Fords of Isen.\
\
You should search around the Fords of Isen for signs of Grimbold.","The Shattered Lord","Search the hill to the south-east of the Fords","Grimbold can likely be found somewhere at the Fords of Isen in the far west of the Westfold.\
\
You should search for Grimold.","Hildith has asked you to look for her husband Grimbold at the Fords of Isen and tell him that he is still loved, despite the harsh words that passed between them.","Search for Grimbold at the river crossing","This side of the cliff is crawling with hostile Uruks","Death is everywhere, and looters defile the bodies of the slain....","Search the hill to the north-east of the Fords","This side of the cliff is crawling with hostile Dunlendings","Find Grimbold at the fords"}},
[13004]={nameES="El pasado roto",objectivesES={"El pasado roto","Desde el despertar del mal en Agamaur, los espíritus malignos han agitado las aguas, tomando la forma de aguaoscura.","El aguaoscura se encuentra por todas partes en Agamaur y Garth Agarwen, muy al norte.\
\
Aric el Intérprete de piedras desea ayudar a los hombres malditos de Arthedain y te ha pedido que destierres el aguaoscura que se encuentra en Agamaur. También te ha pedido que le traigas sus espadas para exhibirlas y fortalecer el espíritu decaído de los hombres malditos.","Lleva las espadas de aguaoscura a Aric el Intérprete de piedras"}},
[13005]={nameES="The Shattered Plateau",objectivesES={"Scout the northern end of Fushaum Bal","Thurindol can be found on the border of Talath Úrui and Dor Amarth.\
\
You should talk to Thurindol.","The Haradrim and Sûhalar here are not quick to attack you","Scout the southern end of Fushaum Bal","Bregdal, a soldier of Gondor, has gone as far into Mordor as any, but is concerned with what lies ahead.","Talk to Thurindol","Complete quests in Fushaum Bal","The Khundolar here seem to abide by some law or code","Dâr Mauzur and Fushaum Bal can be found in Talath Úrui.\
\
You should scout these locations for Thurindol.","You tell Thurindol everything you have seen.\
\
'The encampment of Dâr Mauzur seems mostly vacated? Perhaps it was a staging area for the armies who we fought at the Black Gate.\
\
'Fushaum Bal concerns me. The men there are trying to organize. We will need to maintain vigilance should their efforts progress.\
\
'Still, there are other structures deeper into Mordor that concern me even more.'","Scout Dâr Mauzur","Thurindol can be found on the border of Talath Úrui and Dor Amarth.\
\
You should speak with Thurindol.","The encampment seems largely unoccupied","The Shattered Plateau"}},
[13006]={nameES="The Shield-Maiden's Training",objectivesES={"Talk to Ides","The Shield-Maiden's Training","Ides has planned a training excursion to hunt bears in the nearby woods. She believes that fighting live opponents will give her much-needed experience.","Ides can be found training at the mill, north of the Rohirrim training grounds, at the northern edge of the Norcrofts.\
\
Ides wishes to speak with you following your dangerous training excursion.","Ides can be found training at the mill, north of the Rohirrim training grounds, at the northern edge of the Norcrofts.\
\
Ides would like you to accompany her and to provide assistance in her training venture."}},
[13007]={nameES="The Ship-slaves",objectivesES={}},
[13008]={nameES="The Shredded Pack",objectivesES={"In a newly blasted cave, you found a pack, shredded and rumpled, on the floor. Could it belong to the missing scout? Its contents may shed some much needed light upon her whereabouts.","Continue searching the pack","Lúmar is waiting to speak with you about what was written on the note you found.\
\
Lúmar is in Ost Arndír.","You found a mostly clean shirt","Read the hastily scrawled note","You should search through the pack for clues.\
\
The pack is on the table next to Lúmar, in Ost Arndír.","Search the pack","Place the pack on the table","The Shredded Pack","While searching through Igerna's pack, you found a hastily scrawled note addressed to Lúmar. You should read the note.\
\
The note is on the table next to Lúmar, in Ost Arndír.","You found a crumpled note!","You should continue searching through the pack for clues.\
\
The pack is on the table next to Lúmar, in Ost Arndír.","You should search the pack","Lúmar,\
\
I was right, there are goblins in Pinnath Gelin! They've been hounding me for hours, but I managed to slip their grasp thus far. I overheard one mentioning a farm with lots of four legged, spotted, dinners walking around. I can only imagine this is referring to Varbris's poor cows. I must go first to Winbury and see what fate has befallen Nordach. I will leave this message with - wait, something draws near\
\
---\
\
The message abruptly cuts off.","Lúmar has asked you to search through the shredded pack that you found for any information that might tie it to Igerna.\
\
You can search through the pack on the table next to Lúmar, in Ost Arndir.","Speak to Lúmar"}},
[13009]={nameES="The Sickle, the Lotus, and the Lion",objectivesES={"You have brought the leaders of Ambarûl, Khûd Zagin, and Imhûlar together in Iridír. Mizâdi has much to do before Girhâzi and Amalíbi trust her or her leadership.","Speak with Mizâdi in Iridír when you are ready to go","Speak with Mizâdi in Iridír","Speak with Mizâdi in Iridír when you are ready to go.","The Sickle, the Lotus, and the Lion","Speak with Mizâdi in Iridír."}},
[13010]={nameES="El asedio de Barad Morlas",objectivesES={"Perimbant te ha pedido que le traigas un zafiro imbuido que podría permitir que tu arma adquiera una cualidad élfica. El elfo no sabe dónde puedes encontrar un zafiro así.","Lleva el zafiro potenciado a Perimbant","Los elfos de Rivendel han enviado un pequeño contingente de soldados para recuperar las ruinas de Barad Morlas de manos de los dunlendinos del sur. En esas ruinas se encuentra una de las antiguas forjas donde, en tiempos pasados, se forjaron muchos objetos de gran poder.","Lleva un zafiro imbuido a Perimbant","Habla con Perimbant para viajar a Barad Morlas","El asedio de Barad Morlas","Perimbant se encuentra en Echad Dúnann, al oeste de las puertas de Moria.\
\
Perimbant te ha pedido que hables con él cuando tengas todo listo para viajar a Barad Morlas, donde una compañía de elfos ha quedado atrapada por un ejército de dunlendinos procedentes del sur.","Encontrarás a Perimbant en Echad Dúnann, al oeste de las puertas de Moria.\
\
Debes volver a ver a Perimbant para completar la mejora de tu arma."}},
[13011]={nameES="The Siege of Emax Dûl",objectivesES={"The Siege of Emax Dûl","Mizâdi's allied forces are in place. You must now infiltrate the city with Razâl and open the gates to Emax Dûl.\
\
Talk to Razâl at Mizâdi's hidden camp, Nashûbu, and complete 'Instance: The Siege of Emax Dûl'.","Mizâdi's forces now have a foothold of control in Emax Dûl, but Góramul Sai and Bârshud have escaped.\
\
You should talk to Mizâdi outside of Emax Dûl's palace, Ekal-nêbi.","The time has come to bring the fight to the Ordâkhai's own doorstep.","Talk to Mizâdi","Complete 'Instance: The Siege of Emax Dûl'"}},
[13012]={nameES="El asedio de Gondamon",objectivesES={"El tercer asalto del ataque final ha comenzado. Intentan pasar por la última puerta.","<rgb=#FF0000>¡Mathi ha muerto!</rgb>","Id a ver a Mathi, comandante de Gondamon.","Rechazad el tercer asalto.","El asedio de Gondamon","Rechazad el segundo asalto.","El último asalto ha comenzado. Son cada vez menos, pero cada vez más feroces. Sobrevivid a esta tormenta, eliminad a su líder, y Gondamon conservará su libertad.","<rgb=#00FF00>El primer asalto ha sido rechazado. Tenéis unos instantes de respiro antes del próximo ataque.</rgb>","Mathi debe sobrevivir al ataque.","<rgb=#00FF00>Habéis rechazado el segundo asalto. Aprovechad unos instantes de respiro antes del próximo ataque para recuperar el aliento.</rgb>","Rechazad el primer asalto.","Contened el asalto final.","Gondamon es una de las fortalezas más poderosas de los Barbasluengas en las Montañas Azules. Los Duramano y sus aliados trasgos buscan apoderarse de ella.","El segundo asalto del ataque final ha comenzado. El enemigo intenta abrirse paso por la fuerza a través de otra puerta.","Mathi ha liderado la defensa de Gondamon durante todo el asedio. Es vital que os presentéis ante él y descubráis en qué podríais ser de utilidad.","<rgb=#00FF00>Han intentado abrirse paso por las tres puertas. El próximo asalto será sin duda el último, pero también el más violento.</rgb>","El primer asalto del ataque final ha comenzado. El enemigo no debe derribar los muros."}},
[13013]={nameES="The Sights of Gondor's Garden",objectivesES={"Find the central fountain","Find the Erui overlook, south-east of the Hall of the Gentle Hand","Lady Vanyalos has asked you to appreciate the many beautiful sights within Imloth Melui.","Where the Erui comes down from the mountains in great cascades, noise and peacefulness blend into one.","Lady Vanyalos insists that the gardens and arbors of Imloth Melui recall the grandeur of Gondor in its youth, and wants you to remind her of their varied beauties.","Find the tall stone steps in the north","Return to Lady Vanyalos in her hall","The Sights of Gondor's Garden","Lady Vanyalos is in her hall on the north-east rise of Imloth Melui, waiting for you to return with descriptions of her city.","Clear water laughs loudly as it spills into the central fountain. Ancient arches peer from behind flower-laden trees.","Here the River Erui courses widely through great arches, crashing in a great fall on its journey south.","It is cool in the shaded path and branches of the pines seem to whisper of things long forgotten.","Find the shaded path that overlooks the River Erui","Blossom, river, and stonework alike are watched over by slope-side ranks of mountain pine.","Find the bridge by the source of the Erui, north-west of Imloth Melui"}},
[13014]={nameES="The Silent Mouth",objectivesES={"The Silent Mouth","Captain Hanâbu has sent you to find his scout, Arâniz.\
\
You should find him hidden somewhere outside the prison, Esh Mêkag.","Talk to Hidâti","Find Arâniz outside Esh Mêkag","Talk to Sorkamâl the Forbearing","People from across Shagâna have been captured by the Ordâkhai and sent to work in Esh Mêkag, the Silent Mouth. If freed, these people may be willing to join Mizâdi's cause.","Captain Hanâbu has asked for your getting his soldiers out of Esh Mêkag, the Silent Mouth.\
\
You should talk to your allies before you depart.","Talk to Unusâli"}},
[13015]={nameES="The Silent One",objectivesES={"Legolas can be found at the ruined encampment in northern Lhingris.\
\
You found the Silent One's victims presented as some kind of offering to the spiders of Lhingris before the Silent One attacked you and fled back into the shadows. You should return to Legolas.","An Orc known as the Silent One has betrayed the inhabitants of Durthang to the children of Shelob, casting the lands of Lhingris and Udûn into turmoil.","Talk to Legolas at the ruined encampment","Follow the trail of Orkish blood in pursuit of the Silent One","Many slain Orcs have been laid at the foot of a massive cluster of spider eggs...","The Silent One can likely be found off the road to the south of Durthang with the slain Orcs he took from Durthang.\
\
A dying Uruk has asked you to kill the Silent One, an Orc who has seemingly aligned himself with the spiders of Lhingris.","Dark drops of Orkish blood lead away from Durthang...","The Silent One"}},
[13016]={nameES="The Silent Street -- Tier 1",objectivesES={"As the Gloom of Nurn departs, spirits of fallen Gondorians appear along the Silent Street!","Derrota a la Languidez de Nurn","Search for Beregond in Rath Dínen","Members of the Withered Tree block your advance!","You should return the risen Kings and Stewards of Gondor to rest before pursuing the Gloom of Nurn.","You should search Rath Dínen for signs of Beregond.\
\
Rath Dínen, the Silent Street, is the final resting place for the Kings and Stewards of Gondor.","Confront and defeat the Withered Tree","You must defeat the Gloom of Nurn before he can claim the crown of the King for Gothmog.","Defeat the risen Kings and Stewards of Gondor","In his haste to save Faramir, Beregond has thrown open the Fen Hollen and makes for the House of the Stewards. In his wake, the enemies of Gondor descend on Rath Dínen, the Silent Street, all hoping to bring the rule of the Stewards to an end.","With the risen again put to rest, the path to the House of the Kings lies open!","The Silent Street -- Tier 1","You should confront and defeat the members of the Withered Tree that have come to depose the Steward."}},
[13017]={nameES="The Silent Street -- Tier 2",objectivesES={"The Silent Street -- Tier 2","As the Gloom of Nurn departs, spirits of fallen Gondorians appear along the Silent Street!","Search for Beregond in Rath Dínen","Members of the Withered Tree block your advance!","You must defeat the Gloom of Nurn before he can claim the crown of the King for Gothmog.","You should return the risen Kings and Stewards of Gondor to rest before pursuing the Gloom of Nurn.","You should search Rath Dínen for signs of Beregond.\
\
Rath Dínen, the Silent Street, is the final resting place for the Kings and Stewards of Gondor.","Confront and defeat the Withered Tree","Derrota a la Languidez de Nurn","Defeat the risen Kings and Stewards of Gondor","In his haste to save Faramir, Beregond has thrown open the Fen Hollen and makes for the House of the Stewards. In his wake, the enemies of Gondor descend on Rath Dínen, the Silent Street, all hoping to bring the rule of the Stewards to an end.","With the risen again put to rest, the path to the House of the Kings lies open!","You should confront and defeat the members of the Withered Tree that have come to depose the Steward."}},
[13018]={nameES="The Silken Gift",objectivesES={"Completed Kála-murg: The Silken Gift.","The Silken Gift","You have successfully gathered much silk from the valley of Lhingris.","As the unrelenting forces of Ungol pour from the mountain, few Orcs remain in Lhingris.","Candúr se encuentra en Udûn.\
\\Deberías hablar con Candúr.","Completado","Complete Kála-murg: The Silken Gift","A notice is posted on the board. It sounds urgent:\
\
'Spider silk can be found in Lhingris. A brave adventurer is needed to gather silk from deadly valley. Seek out Candúr in Udûn to learn more.'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Warning: This quest requires  Kála-murg: The Final Stand to be underway. If that quest has been completed or failed, you will be unable to exit and re-enter this instance in order to complete this quest.</rgb>"}},
[13019]={nameES="The Silver Court",objectivesES={"Defeat Girwael","Girwael can be found at Celeband upon the Circle of Despair.\
\
You should defeat Girwael.","You have defeated the vile Girwael and provided a great service to the White Company. Their efforts to reclaim Minas Ithil are now ever closer thanks to you.","The vile Girwael has taken Celeband, the Silver Court. If the White Company is to gain control over the city, this minion of Minas Morgul must be removed.","Defeated Girwael","The vile Girwael has taken Celeband and must be removed.","Completado","Defeated Girwael.","The Silver Court"}},
[13020]={nameES="The Sisters' Return",objectivesES={"Disturb the pile of river-stones","Tell Lendithil the <rgb=#FF0000>story</rgb> of your encounter with Roamingstar","The pile shifts slightly and trembles, but Roamingstar does not appear...","Barchir can be found in Malbarth in western Lebennin.\
\
Although you could not call Roamingstar forth, Arvaeth still believes your tale. You should return to Barchir.","Heartened by your tales of the Sister of the Gilrain, the people of Lebennin hope to draw her forth and beg her aid.","The pile of river-stones can be found on the banks of the Gilrain to the north-west of Malbarth.\
\
Arvaeth has asked you to disturb the pile of river-stones in an attempt to draw Roamingstar forth once more.","Talk to Barchir in Malbarth","Talk to Arvaeth","Talk to Arvaeth by the Gilrain","Arvaeth can be found to the north-west of Malbarth along the banks of the Gilrain in Lebennin.\
\
Roamingstar did not come to the river's edge. You should speak to Arvaeth about what is to be done.","Tell Melawen the <rgb=#FF0000>story</rgb> of your encounter with Roamingstar","Melawen and Lendithil can be found in Malbarth.\
\
Arvaeth has asked you to tell the people of Malbarth of your supposed meeting with the fabled Sister of the Gilrain.","The Sisters' Return","Arvaeth can be found to the north-west of Malbarth in Lebennin.\
\
You have told the folk of Malbarth and should now return to Arvaeth near the banks of the Gilrain."}},
[13021]={nameES="The Site of the Murder",objectivesES={"A mysterious patch of rust coats the ground","Talk to Mervárth","The murder location can be found somewhere in central Lake-town.\
\
You should find the murder location.","The location of the murder can be found somewhere in central Lake-town.\
\
You should investigate the murder location.","Find the murder location","Talk to one of the guards at the murder location","The location of the murder can be found somewhere in central Lake-town.\
\
You should talk to one of the guards at the murder location.","Captain Álarr has allowed you access to the location of the murder. Join Mervárth in investigating the Master's murder!","A red kerchief has been left behind","Is this the murder weapon?","The murder location can be found somewhere in central Lake-town.\
\
You should talk to one of the guards at the location of the murder.","This appears to be the location of the murder","The murder investigation is complete.\
\
You should talk to Mervárth.","The Site of the Murder","Investigate the murder location"}},
[13022]={nameES="The Skulls of the Dead",objectivesES={}},
[13023]={nameES="The Sky Has Fallen",objectivesES={"The Sky Has Fallen","Nâtatharr is in eastern Clovengap.\
\
You should search for Nâtatharr.","Gerja Defthand is at Bazanmanar, in north-east Clovengap.\
\
You should let Gerja Defthand know that you found Nâtatharr.","When the mountain was sundered, the ceiling of Clovengap crashed to the valley below.","A very large rock! From the ceiling!","Search for Nâtatharr","Talk to Gerja in Bazanmanar","Much of the wording has faded with time, but it seems to be a poem describing the sundering of Gundabad, and the crumbling of the ceiling of Clovengap and of Nâtatharr, the Ceiling Rock, crashing to the ground below alongside countless other pieces. The latter were used in the construction of the tiers and ramps of Clovengap."}},
[13024]={nameES="¡El cielo se nos cae encima!",objectivesES={"Billina eriza las plumas y empieza a emitir agudos sonidos de cacareo. Parece que está preocupada por algo.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>ADVERTENCIA: Esta misión da comienzo a una misión de sesión especial. Se cerrará tu sesión con tu personaje normal y asumirás la apariencia de un PNJ aliado del jugador. No podrás salir de la Comarca con este personaje y obtendrás un conjunto de habilidades únicas para este personaje especial.</rgb>","Billina está en el corral de la Granja de Arenilla.\
\
Deberías comprobar cómo está Billina.","Billina parece un poco menos agitada que antes, pero parece que estuviera esperando algo.","Billina está en el corral de la Granja de Arenilla.\
\
Deberías intentar averiguar qué le pasa a Billina. Es una gallina bastante inteligente.","Billina la gallina parece estar alterada, deberías intentar averiguar qué le pasa.","Examina a Billina","Wald Arenilla está en el corral de la Granja de Arenilla.\
\
Deberías volver con Wald Arenilla y contarle tu éxito."}},
[13025]={nameES="¡El cielo se nos cae encima!",objectivesES={"Hay gallineros en la Granja de los Rizopardo, en el camino al este y un poco al norte hacia Aguja, la Granja de los Coto, al este en Delagua, y la Granja del Granjero Maggot, al este y al sur a lo largo del río Brandivino.\
\
Billina te ha pedido que adviertas a los otros gallineros de la Comarca sobre la amenaza de los lobos.","Visita el gallinero de los Coto.","Billina está convencida de que una plaga de lobos ha llegado a la Comarca y está robando gallinas.","Visita el gallinero de los Rizopardo.","Billina está en el patio de la Granja de los Arenilla.\
\
Billina desea hablar contigo.","Visita el gallinero de los Maggot."}},
[13026]={nameES="Las colinas de escoria",objectivesES={"Return to Candúr","Candúr has asked you to gauge the enemy presence in the Slag-hills before dealing with any other nearby threats.","Many foes can be found in and around the Slag-hills.\
\
You should defeat foes within the Slag-hills.","You should return to Candúr, who can be found at a small Ranger outpost hidden in the Slag-hills.","Las colinas de escoria"}},
[13027]={nameES="The Slain Scout",objectivesES={}},
[13028]={nameES="The Slave-horde of Dannenglor",objectivesES={"Talk to Puiguil at the Haunted Inn","The Slave-horde of Dannenglor","Morvul-slaves can be found in Dannenglor, to the north of the Haunted Inn in the Dourstocks.\
\
Puiguil has asked you to defeat many morvul-slaves in Dannenglor and collect the tokens of bondage that can be found on them.","Dangerous morvul-slaves stalk the city of Dannenglor, protecting their kind from intruders.","Puiguil is at the Haunted Inn, in the Dourstocks of Mirkwood, south of Dannenglor.\
\
You should speak with Puiguil and bring him the tokens of the mervyl's allegiance to their family."}},
[13029]={nameES="The Slop",objectivesES={"There is still slop to be cleaned up in the kitchens beneath Isengard.","The slop bucket is in the kitchens.\
\
Barkh wants you to squeeze out the rag you used to clean up the slop into the slop bucket in the kitchens.","Your Uruk-hai overseer wants to talk to you.","Return the dirty rag to Barkh","Piles of slop litter the floor of the kitchens beneath Isengard.\
\
Barkh has given you a rag and the unenviable task of cleaning up after the Uruk-hai.","Barkh is waiting to speak to you in the kitchens beneath Isengard.","Talk to Barkh","You tip the slop into the bucket, and it makes a sickening sound","Talk to your Uruk-hai overseer","Get some slop from the slop bucket in the kitchens","Barkh wants you to get some slop from the slop bucket in the kitchens and bring it to the bucket in the dungeons. The entrance to the dungeons is in the north-west wall of the main cavern.","Barkh manages the kitchens in the south-west wall of the cavern beneath Isengard.\
\
Your overseer wants you to report to the kitchens beneath Isengard for work.","Talk to Baldgar in the dungeon","The Slop","One of the prisoners has tried to get your attention. You should talk to him.","Barkh is in the kitchens beneath Isengard, waiting to speak to you.","There is work to be done in the kitchens beneath Isengard.","Use the slop bucket in the kitchens to squeeze out the dirty rag"}},
[13030]={nameES="The Slovenly Work of Mange-rider",objectivesES={"Luned is in Galtrev, waiting anxiously to hear of the vicious Wargs that roam the landscape of late.\
\
You should tell Luned that you have brought down many Wargs and their riders and hopefully rooted out the source of the evil that entered these lands.","At the source of the Wargs in Pren Gwydh are goblins training the vicious monsters as steeds, which are then carelessly released into the wild to roam as they wish.","Goronu can be found outside of the Howling Caverns in Pren Gwydh.\
\
You should inform Goronu that you have defeated the chief of the Warg-riders.","The chief of the Warg-riders is somewhere within the Howling Caverns.\
\
You should defeat Mange-rider, the chief of the Warg-riders.","The Slovenly Work of Mange-rider","Talk to Goronu","Talk to Luned in Galtrev","Defeat Mange-rider","Defeated Mange-rider"}},
[13031]={nameES="The Slow Hunt",objectivesES={"The Slow Hunt","Bráthur can be found at Khadâsh-gâra in Elderslade.\
\
You have set many traps on the outskirts of Khadâsh-gâra. You should return to Bráthur.","Talk to Bráthur","One of the Want-kin, Bráthur, is an accomplished trapper and enjoys hunting the beasts of Elderslade.","Khadâsh-gâra can be found in eastern Elderslade.\
\
Bráthur has asked you to set traps on the outskirts of Khadâsh-gâra."}},
[13032]={nameES="The Sly Beasts of the Dourstocks",objectivesES={"Prestadír can be found in the Haunted Inn in the Dourstocks, near the abandoned village of Audaghaim.\
\
You should bring the wolf-pelts you have collected to Prestadír, for he wishes to examine them.","Darkrage wolves wander the Dourstocks, harassing the Malledhrim and their efforts. These bold creatures attack at every opportunity, then swiftly vanish into the black trees beyond the sight of the sharp-eyed Elves.","The Sly Beasts of the Dourstocks","Darkrage wolves can be found throughout the Dourstocks and in Audaghaim.\
\
The Ranger Prestadír has asked you to collect the pelts of several of the evil wolves that harass the Malledhrim-guards.","Bring the wolf-pelts to Prestadír"}},
[13033]={nameES="El olor de la revuelta",objectivesES={"Fredegar Bolger ha estado fabricando y almacenando bombas fétidas alrededor de Nobotella, por si surgiera la necesidad.\
\
Debes recoger todas las bombas fétidas para Fredegar Bolger.","Los planes de Lotho para cambiar las fronteras de la Comarca Allende deben ser detenidos.","Los Fronteros de Lotho se encuentran en la Comarca Allende.\
\
Debes lanzarles bombas fétidas a los Fronteros de Lotho.","El olor de la revuelta","Fredegar Bolger se encuentra en el pueblo de Nobotella.\
\
Debes hablar con Fredegar Bolger.","Habla con Fredegar en Nobotella","El Frontero de Lotho huye, ¡pero la peste persiste!"}},
[13034]={nameES="The Smithy: Enhancements I",objectivesES={}},
[13035]={nameES="The Smithy: Enhancements II",objectivesES={}},
[13036]={nameES="The Smithy: Inhabitants",objectivesES={}},
[13037]={nameES="The Smithy: Rebuild",objectivesES={}},
[13038]={nameES="The Smithy: Superior Forge",objectivesES={}},
[13039]={nameES="The Smoke Lures",objectivesES={"Noises soon appear nearby.\
\
Someone is coming!","The Smoke Lures","There are wooded areas west of the Harlond and the road leading up to it.\
\
Dindal has suggested that you start smoky fires at old camp-fire sites in wooded areas near the Harlond, in order to lure Orc raiding parties to you in small groups.","Dindal the scout can be found high up in a secluded look-out, which can be reached by turning north off the east road from Imloth Melui.\
\
You should return to Dindal and let him know that his plan worked.","Dindal fears the Orc raiding parties that come out from Harlond. Though they are small, they may discover Lossarnach's weak points and report back to the larger force.","Talk to Dindal"}},
[13040]={nameES="The Smugglers' Den",objectivesES={}},
[13041]={nameES="Los Cepos",objectivesES={"Las arañas se encuentran en los Cepos, al sur de Esteldín en la Dehesa del Rey.\
\
Debes derrotar arañas tan rápido como puedas, antes de que el tiempo se acabe.","Los Cepos","No has derrotado suficientes arañas a tiempo","Las arañas de los Cepos en la Dehesa del Rey han cubierto este pequeño valle de telarañas pegajosas, creando una trampa potencial para cualquiera lo suficientemente desafortunado para entrar por descuido a este lugar. Sería imprudente permanecer aquí más tiempo del necesario.\
\
Debes derrotar a un buen número de arañas tan rápido como puedas.","Has derrotado rápidamente a un buen número de arañas de la Dehesa del Rey en los Cepos, ayudando a hacer el área cerca de Esteldín más segura y libre de la influencia del mal.","Las arañas de los Cepos en la Dehesa del Rey han cubierto este pequeño valle de telarañas pegajosas, creando una trampa potencial para cualquiera lo suficientemente desafortunado para entrar por descuido a este lugar. Sería imprudente permanecer aquí más tiempo del necesario.","Completado"}},
[13042]={nameES="The Snarling Den",objectivesES={}},
[13043]={nameES="The Snatcher",objectivesES={"The Snatcher","When Atta was a boy, the creature known as the Snatcher returned to the Vales of Anduin and once again sought to prey on the weak and helpless.","Talk to Atta","Atta can be found in Hultvís.\
\
You have heard the tale of Atta's encounter with Úbil the Snatcher. You should talk to Atta.","Atta can be found in Hultvís.\
\
Atta has offered to tell you the tale of the night he encountered Úbil the Snatcher."}},
[13044]={nameES="The Sniffling Snuffler",objectivesES={"You see nothing unusual. Whatever was here must have gone","Visit the goats south-west of Magla and search for what frightened him","Goats mill about the Wailing Hills in their enclosures to the north and to the south-west of Magla.\
\
Magla had a frightening experience near the goats of the Wailing Hills and wants you to see if there is any sign of what so frightened him.","Visit the goats north of Magla and search for what frightened him","The Sniffling Snuffler","Magla is near the two goat enclosures in the Wailing Hills.\
\
You visited the goats milling about the Wailing Hills but found no sign of the creature that so frightened Magla.","Magla heard something sniffing around the goats in the Wailing Hills, and he cannot explain what about the experience filled him with such terror."}},
[13045]={nameES="The Snows Come Again",objectivesES={"Entra en la cueva","You have discovered a cave","A cave full of grim-looking people stands in the High Knolls north of Byre Tor.\
\
You should speak with one of the people.","Head North-east away from Byre Tor, to the tallest peak","Find out what caused the strange weather to appear in Byre Tor","Strange weather has cropped up in Byre Tor.\
\
Something is wrong....","The snows have begun again in Byre Tor...a fierce storm, which likely means one thing. Núrzum is near.","You suddenly realize that this sudden burst of frosty air might not be mere coincidence.\
\
You begin to shiver.","A tall craggy peak stands to the north-east.\
\
You should head to the high peak, away from Byre Tor, where your vantage point will be better.","You brace yourself as a rush of cold air passes you.","The Snows Come Again"}},
[13046]={nameES="The Soldiers of the Second Battle",objectivesES={}},
[13047]={nameES="The Solitary Beacon-warden",objectivesES={"Bruidis has asked you to check on Halnith.\
\
Halnith guards the beacon Nendath, which stands to the east of Tadrent.","The Solitary Beacon-warden","Guard duty can be a lonely job.","Talk to Halnith at Nendath"}},
[13048]={nameES="The Sons Redeemed",objectivesES={}},
[13049]={nameES="Los Hijos de Elrond",objectivesES={"Habla con Elrohir o Elladan en Thorenhad","Elladan y Elrohir se encuentran en Thorenhad, al este y al norte del campamento de Narlinn. Puede llegarse a las ruinas siguiendo el camino hacia el este hasta la piedra blanca y tomando el sendero del norte hacia el risco.\
\
Narlinn te ha pedido que lleves noticias de los trolls y del lobo sombrío a Elladan y Elrohir, los hijos de Elrond.","El descubrimiento de los trolls de las cavernas cerca de Thorenhad y del ancestro lobo sombrío ha traído gran preocupación a Narlinn y a Fimgris.","Los Hijos de Elrond"}},
[13050]={nameES="The Sons of Hraubrek",objectivesES={}},
[13051]={nameES="The Sorcerer's Council",objectivesES={}},
[13052]={nameES="The Sound of Rushing Boots",objectivesES={}},
[13053]={nameES="La Fuente",objectivesES={"Has recogido una muestra pura","Hasta te ha pedido encontrar una muestra pura de la sustancia descubierta por Hethuwen, quien investigó a las extrañas criaturas que según rumores se hallan en las Obras Hidráulicas.","Encuentra la fuente de la extraña sustancia","Hasta está en la Bodega Putrefacta, en las Obras Hidráulicas, al noreste de Gabil-munz.\
\
Ahora que has encontrado la fuente de la extraña sustancia y has extraído otra muestra, debes llevársela a Hasta para un estudio más exhaustivo.","Lleva la muestra a Hasta","La Fuente","La mayor concentración de criaturas puede encontrarse cerca de Gabil-munz, la gran estructura al suroeste.\
\
Hasta te ha pedido que encuentres el origen de la extraña sustancia y traigas una muestra pura para un análisis más profundo."}},
[13054]={nameES="The Source of the Dragons",objectivesES={"Guto can be found at his encampment in the southern fields of Trum Dreng.\
\
You should tell Guto what you saw when you scouted the encampment.","It would appear that Isengard and the Dragon-clan are working together","This spot has an adequate view","Return to Guto at his encampment","According to the map you captured from the Dragon-clan invaders, a major rallying point lies somewhere nearby.\
\
You should see if you can find the rallying point and <rgb=#FF0000>look</rgb> for any signs of the Dragon-clan.","<rgb=#FF0000>Look</rgb> for the Dragon-clan's rallying point nearby","Guto studied the map and realized that the Dragon-clan invaders planned to both rally and retreat at one secluded piece of land in Trum Dreng.","The Source of the Dragons","You were spotted by the Dragon-clan","<rgb=#FF0000>Do not let the enemy see you first</rgb>"}},
[13055]={nameES="The Source of the Madness",objectivesES={"Find the draug-cave","You should scour the Wódfen for clues to the source of the madness that has overcome the wildlife there.","Draugar can be found in their cave, as well as in the Wódfen at night.\
\
You should purge the Wódfen of the draug-threat.","The Source of the Madness","Something has caused the creatures of the Wódfen to go mad","Discover the source of the madness in the Wódfen","The madness in the Wódfen appears to have been caused by a strange form of the Dead like none you have seen before","Something has driven the creatures of the Wódfen mad... some to the point of death.","Found the draug-cave","The entrance to the draugar's cave must be somewhere in the Wódfen.\
\
You should seek the entrance to the draugar's cave.","Something has driven the creatures of the Wódfen mad... some to the point of death.\
\
You should find the source of the madness."}},
[13056]={nameES="The Source of the Mist",objectivesES={"This corpse has been dumped unceremoniously into the water","Oldheart's little bird-friend is dead.\
\
You have found a great deal of filth from the slovenly horde of Orcs and Uruks who have gathered temporarily in this sector of Fangorn.\
\
This poor pond is polluted beyond recognition. The water is not water, but poison. The servants of the White Hand are cruel in even their carelessness.","The tiny bird has died from the fumes of the Orcs' filth","The Source of the Mist","You suspect that the little bird sought by Oldheart inhaled the fumes of this foetid pond, and likely died of the poisons.\
\
You should search for the little bird.","This unidentifiable goop has a horrific odour","Search for the bird around the pond","The Orcs and Uruks passing through this area have left filth all around the edges of this poor little pond.\
\
You should investigate what manner of filth pollutes this water.","This pile of Orc-refuse is made up of horrors you don't want to imagine","The source of the mist can likely be found to the west of Oldheart.\
\
You should search for the source to the ugly-looking mist that hangs above the trees.","Found a pond, sweet to look upon, but foul to smell. Orcs have settled here...","You spotted an unwholesome-looking mist not far to the west of the hill, and should investigate its source.","You have found a great deal of filth from the slovenly horde of Orcs and Uruks who have gathered temporarily in this sector of Fangorn.\
\
This poor pond is polluted beyond recognition. The water is not water, but poison. The servants of the White Hand are cruel in even their carelessness.","Find the source of the mist","The Ent gives you a slow and silent stare, his eyes filled to the brim with concern.\
\
You should investigate the source of the unwholesome mist lingering above the treetops, for it creeps awfully close to this fine meadow where Oldheart has set his roots.","Completado"}},
[13057]={nameES="The Southern Great Guest-house",objectivesES={"The Southern Great Guest-house is near the Citadel.\
\
You should collect dirty cloths from the baths.","The Southern Great Guest-house is near the Citadel.\
\
You should seek out the baths in the Southern Great Guest-house.","The Southern Great Guest-house","Iorlas has been tasked with tidying up the baths at the Southern Great Guest-house. He is upset to receive such a lowly task but is glad to have your company in getting the job done as quick as possible.","Speak with Iorlas","The Southern Great Guest-house is near the Citadel.\
\
You should rinse the cloths in a water bucket.","Iorlas shakes his head at the baths as you enter","Seek out the baths in the Southern Great Guest-house","The Southern Great Guest-house is near the Citadel.\
\
You should clean the cloths in a bucket.","Iorlas can be found at the Southern Great Guest-house near the Citadel.\
\
You should speak to Iorlas."}},
[13058]={nameES="The Southern Visitor",objectivesES={"You should travel to the Wrackwade and talk to Ningêna.","Talk to Ningêna","Ningêna has sent a Dumûri to find you and relay her request for you to come talk to her at the Wrackwade.","The Southern Visitor"}},
[13059]={nameES="The Southern Way",objectivesES={"Concerned by the unusual tactics of the Haradrim, Lady Terenis hopes you and Lord Angbor can uncover their vile designs before it is too late.","Lord Angbor can likely be found somewhere near the Crossings of Erui in eastern Upper Lebennin.\
\
Lady Terenis has asked you to speak to Lord Angbor about the Haradrim forces near the Erui.","You have arrived at Halach, but it lies in ruin...","Travel south to Halach","Search the ruins of Halach for any survivors","Survivors may be found somewhere within Halach in south-eastern Upper Lebennin.\
\
You have arrived at the ruined settlement of Halach, and should now search for survivors.","Halach can be found in south-eastern Upper Lebennin along the Anduin.\
\
Angbor has asked you to secure the southern settlements of Upper Lebennin and uncover the plans of the Haradrim before rejoining him in Lossarnach.","The Southern Way","Talk to Angbor near the Crossings of Erui"}},
[13060]={nameES="The Spared of Mordor",objectivesES={"Search for survivors at The Raided Crofts","Talk to Sigeric","The Spared of Mordor","Gísling hopes that the Orcs have not yet slain his people to the south, but fears that it may already be too late. He wishes for you to try and rescue any crofters that have escaped the Orc invasion.","Talk to Gísil","The Raided Crofts can be found far to the south-west of Garsfeld.","As you loosen Sigeric's bonds, he begins to run towards Garsfeld","You have spotted a captured crofter amongst the Orcs that have sacked this croft. It is curious that he has been left alive thus far, but it is probable that will change once the Orcs finish stripping resources from the area.","Gísil can be found inside the mead-hall of Garsfeld.","These crofters also met a grisly end, but in the distance you can see a man slumped against a pole of a house","You have found slain crofters... aid has come too late, but perhaps others can be rescued"}},
[13061]={nameES="The Spectre and the Shadow",objectivesES={"Khaljûn has requested your aid in investigating disturbing sounds coming from the Blade-horn, an ancient and mysterious structure north of Sormedân. Khaljûn fears something evil has taken hold there.","Investigate the area for more information about the mysterious spirit.","Investigate the area around the disturbed spirit.","Investigate the area around the disturbed spirit","Investigate the area outside the Blade-horn for clues","There seems to be something poking out of the dust","Return to Khaljûn in Sormedân and show him the journal you've found.","It appears to be a journal of some kind, although whose is a mystery","The Spectre and the Shadow","You hear a sharp cry, a voice seemingly in pain!","Return to Khaljûn in Sormedân and show him the journal","Khaljûn, a villager in Sormedân, has requested you investigate the strange sounds coming from near Bâdrasag, the Blade-horn.","Pick up the dusty book in the dirt"}},
[13062]={nameES="The Spectre and the Shadow, Part 2",objectivesES={}},
[13063]={nameES="The Spectre and the Shadow, Part 3",objectivesES={}},
[13064]={nameES="The Spectre and the Shadow, Part 4",objectivesES={}},
[13065]={nameES="The Spectre and the Shadow, Part 5",objectivesES={"Speak with Khaljûn at Khamósh-engar.","Bow to pay your respects to Mashâr.","Give Khaljûn space for his thoughts at Khamósh-engar","Gather stones for Khaljûn suitable to making a stele in remembrance of his brother.","The Spectre and the Shadow, Part 5","Join Khaljûn at Khamósh-engar","Join Khaljûn at Khamósh-engar. Khamósh-engar can be found just outside of Sormedân on the hill.","Help Khaljûn craft the finished stone to honour Mashâr","Speak with Khaljûn at Khamósh-engar","Give Khaljûn space for his thoughts at Khamósh-engar.","Help Khaljûn craft the finished stone to honour Mashâr.","Bow to pay your respects to Mashâr","Khaljûn has asked for your help in creating a memorial stele for his brother, Mashâr."}},
[13066]={nameES="El lenguaje de los animales",objectivesES={"Habla con Clothar Hojarena en el Campamento de Adso","El lenguaje de los animales","Clothar Hojarena dice que la gente del campamento de Adso ha estado aterrorizada por un gran oso que anda merodeando por el Bosque Viejo.","Clothar Hojarena se encuentra en el Campamento de Adso. Lo ayudaste a rastrear al gran oso que lo había aterrorizado y también ayudaste al oso a encontrar consuelo.\
\
Clothar ahora sabe que perteneces a la estirpe de Beorn y le está costando adaptarse a ese conocimiento.","Clothar Hojarena se encuentra en el Campamento de Adso y quiere que investigues al gran oso que lo aterrorizó.","Habla con Clothar Hojarena y te mostrará dónde vio al gran oso"}},
[13067]={nameES="The Spice Flow",objectivesES={}},
[13068]={nameES="The Spider-horde of Torech Ungol",objectivesES={"The spider-horde has completely overrun Torech Ungol.\
\
You should defeat spiders in Torech Ungol.","The Spider-horde of Torech Ungol","Legolas is standing by outside Torech Ungol.\
\
You should talk to Legolas.","Habla con Legolas.","Shelob's lair has become infested with her spider children. Legolas has asked you to thin their numbers."}},
[13069]={nameES="El nido de arañas",objectivesES={"A Fastarr se le puede encontrar en el Campamento del Mirador de la Gran Excavación, en Moria.\
\
Fastarr te ha pedido que viajes a la armería de sus antepasados y rescates a sus parientes, atrapados en su interior por las voraces arañas que los han capturado.","A Fastarr se le puede encontrar en el Campamento del Mirador de la Gran Excavación, en Moria.\
\
Deberías regresar con Fastarr para completar la mejora de tu arma.","El nido de arañas","Lleva el diamante potenciado a Fastarr","Una antigua armería abandonada que perteneció a los antepasados de Fastarr alberga un yunque que sería idóneo para otorgar la habilidad que buscas para tu arma. Ya se ha enviado una expedición de enanos para segurarla.","Habla con Fastarr para viajar al nido de arañas","Lleva un diamante imbuido a Fastarr","Fastarr te ha pedido que le traigas un diamante imbuido que él pueda preparar para otorgar una calidad a tu arma. Desafortunadamente, no sabe dónde se puede encontrar una piedra así."}},
[13070]={nameES="El esplendor de la primavera",objectivesES={"Todos los días hay algo que hacer durante el Festival de Primavera. ¡Únete a todo el mundo y participa en las diversas actividades del Festival de Primavera durante cuatro días!","Completa 'Una primavera ajetreada (intermedio)'","You have participated in Spring Festival activities for twelve days! You should talk to either Sergeant Tom at the Bree-land Festival Grounds or TBD near the Stable-master in Clegur.","Completa 'Una primavera ajetreada (introducción)'","Todos los días hay algo que hacer durante el Festival de Primavera. ¡Únete a todo el mundo y participa en las muchas actividades del Festival de Primavera durante cuatro días más!","Completa 'Una primavera ajetreada (final)'","Habla con el sargento Tom","El esplendor de la primavera","Talk to TBD","Todos los días hay algo que hacer durante el Festival de Primavera. ¡Únete a todo el mundo y participa en las diversas actividades del Festival de Primavera durante cuatro días más!"}},
[13071]={nameES="The Spoils of Thama Aklam",objectivesES={"Thama Aklam has many coffers in it, likely home to ill-gotten gains.","Discover the camp of Thama Aklam","You have inspected many coffers.","At first glance, the chest appears empty, but a seasoned adventurer knows that looks can be deceiving.\
\
You knock on the bottom of the chest. It rings hollow.\
\
Aha! A false bottom.\
\
You pry it open with your fingers to reveal a hidden compartment that is also...\
\
Empty.","The Spoils of Thama Aklam","You spy some coffers in Thama Aklam that are probably filled with ill-gotten gains.\
\
Investigate these coffers to see what has been keeping the brigands so busy.","Thama Aklam has become home to a number of brigands.","You open the chest, anticipating gold and glittering jewels, but are instead met with the sight and smell of an old, mouldy shirt.\
\
Why would anyone keep this?","Within this coffer is a small supply crate.\
\
You pry open the lid, revealing a strongbox.\
\
The strongbox, in turn, contains a thick canvas sack.\
\
You peer into the bag only to find a small chest.\
\
You open the chest, expecting to find something precious, something worth something to anyone, but it is empty.\
\
And then you realize, the containers were the real treasures all along.","Among the mundane items in this coffer, you find a stack of neatly folded papers.\
\
Perhaps these are missives, plans for attacking nearby settlements or travellers on the road.\
\
A cursory examination reveals them instead to be love letters -- poorly written love letters best not read by anyone. Ever.","Thama Aklam is host to many suspicious coffers.\
\
Inspect coffers in Thama Aklam."}},
[13072]={nameES="The Spoils of War",objectivesES={}},
[13073]={nameES="El maestro espía",objectivesES={"Derrota a Pizumu, maestro de espías","Pizumu, el maestro espía, se encuentra al noreste de Echad Dúnann, por la carretera que serpentea hacia la Puerta del Cuerno Rojo.\
\
Authlanc te ha pedido que elimines al maestro espía de Saruman.","Authlanc está en Echad Dúnann, al suroeste de la Puerta del Cuerno Rojo.\
\
Debes regresar a Authlanc e informarle de tu éxito.","Habla con Authlanc en Echad Dúnann","El maestro espía","Has eliminado a muchos crebain en la Puerta del Cuerno Rojo, pero Authlanc teme que los pájaros estén guiados por una amenaza más inmediata.","Pizumu, maestro espía, derrotado"}},
[13074]={nameES="The Stable: Enhancements I",objectivesES={}},
[13075]={nameES="The Stable: Enhancements II",objectivesES={}},
[13076]={nameES="The Stable: Entwash Vale Horses",objectivesES={"There is much work to do to rebuild the town of Hytbold.","Bring the Tokens of Hytbold to Egmund","The Stable: Entwash Vale Horses"}},
[13077]={nameES="The Stable: Norcrofts Horses",objectivesES={"There is much work to do to rebuild the town of Hytbold.","Bring the Tokens of Hytbold to Segwine","The Stable: Norcrofts Horses"}},
[13078]={nameES="The Stable: Rebuild",objectivesES={}},
[13079]={nameES="The Stable: Sutcrofts Horses",objectivesES={"There is much work to do to rebuild the town of Hytbold.","The Stable: Sutcrofts Horses","Bring the Tokens of Hytbold to Harsterre"}},
[13080]={nameES="The Stable: Wold Horses",objectivesES={"There is much work to do to rebuild the town of Hytbold.","The Stable: Wold Horses","Bring the Tokens of Hytbold to Hargar"}},
[13081]={nameES="The Stacking Game",objectivesES={"Talk to Yared","Collect the pivotal crate","Collected the pivotal crate","Make your way to the top of Yared's stack of crates and set the pivotal crate there to win The Stacking Game.","The Stacking Game","Yared is waiting for you below.","Yared has asked you to pick up the pivotal crate and attempt to win The Stacking Game.","Win the Stacking Game by placing the pivotal crate at the winning spot","Yared is engaged in a contest with some others of his folk, and he is very worried that without your help he will lose.","Cheers (and a few groans) erupt from below as you win The Stacking Game for Yared's team"}},
[13082]={nameES="The Stag-clan of Trum Dreng",objectivesES={"You have collected a vicious-looking spear, its point tipped with old blood","You hold in your hands a lock of hair from the tail of a horse","Find the third piece of the ritual set","Bring the pieces of the ritual set to Elder Riagán","The items for the ritual feast can be found somewhere in Lhan Tarren.\
\
You should help Elder Riagán find the items that he has lost, for they will be needed tonight at the feast, and it seems as though his old mind has forgotten their whereabouts.","Find the second piece of the ritual set","You have picked up a crudely-hewn crown made of sticks and rocks","Find the first piece of the ritual set","The Stag-clan of Trum Dreng","You have passed into Dunland and now find yourself welcomed into the homes of the simple folk of Lhan Tarren, a small village inhabited by the Caru-lûth, the Stag-clan.","Elder Riagán can be found in Lhan Tarren, musing over the whereabouts of the items you found.\
\
You should bring the pieces of the ritual set to Elder Riagán for tonight's feast."}},
[13083]={nameES="The Stalker of Skelstrand",objectivesES={"Find evidence of Old Skárhogg's presence at Skelstrand","Examine the slain Angmarim","A sudden bubbling and clattering heralds the arrival of Old Skárhogg","Old Skárhogg might be found stalking the waters around Skelstrand.\
\
You have discovered an Angmarim slain by a massive ukhrash, likely Old Skárhogg. You should remain alert and defeat Old Skárhogg.","You find a slain Angmarim marked with wounds alike the claws of an ukhrash","The Stalker of Skelstrand","Old Skárhogg falls defeated!","Talk to Orti","Orti can be found at Watchers' Roost in Gloomingtarn.\
\
Although it seemingly posed an equally dire threat to the Iron Crown in Gloomingtarn, you have defeated Old Skárhogg and made the western banks of Durthuzâram safe once again. You should return to Orti.","Old Skárhogg might be found stalking the waters around Skelstrand.\
\
Orti has asked you to find evidence of Old Skárhogg's presence at Skelstrand and put an end to the dangerous ukhrash before it can hinder the Gabil'akkâ in Gloomingtarn.","After narrowly escaping a massive ukhrash at Skelstrand, Orti fears that the ukhrash, Old Skárhogg, may pose a threat to the Gabil'akkâ and any who seek to pass through Gloomingtarn."}},
[13084]={nameES="The Stalking Squawk",objectivesES={"The squawking of a nearby crow catches your attention","Bertred has been having conversations with a crow, lending to the impression others have that he is mad.","The talking crow is in the western part of Aldburg.\
\
Bertred asked to to attempt to speak with the talking crow.","The Stalking Squawk","Bertred is at his home in Aldburg.\
\
The decision lies with you: speak with the child and let him go or speak with Bertred and bring the wrath of the mad Quartermaster down upon the child.","Talk to Bertred","There is a child hiding behind the bush near the crow.\
\
You should speak with the child.","Talk to the meddling child","You notice a rustling behind a nearby bush","Find the talking crow","The crow was last seen in the western portion of Aldburg.\
\
Bertred wants you to find his talking crow and attempt to speak with it in order to prove that he is not mad.","Speak with the talking crow"}},
[13085]={nameES="La Piedra Erguida",objectivesES={"La Piedra Erguida se desbloquea. ¡Recoge tu recompensa rápidamente!","Recibe tu recompensa de la Piedra Erguida","<rgb=#FF0000>Completa el ritual, ¡rápido!</rgb>","Ves un texto garabateado en la piedra. Dice:\
\
'Acércate. El ritual para desbloquear mi botín es el siguiente:\
\
'John,\
'Marla Shelton,\
'Sargento de armas Irminric,\
'Bragi Mazorroca,\
'Gapi.'","La Piedra Erguida","Desbloquea la piedra erguida para recibir tu recompensa.","El ritual fue incorrecto","Has encontrado una piedra erguida misteriosa.","Recoge tu recompensa de la Piedra Erguida"}},
[13086]={nameES="Las piedras erguidas de Tyrn Gorthad",objectivesES={"Deberías llevar el liquen que recogiste a Hafren.\
\
Hafren está en el convoy de Gerwyn, en el norte de Cardolan.","Vuelve con Hafren","Las piedras erguidas de Tyrn Gorthad","Hafren te ha pedido que recojas liquen de las piedras erguidas.\
\
Las piedras erguidas se encuentran en Tyrn Gorthad.","Las piedras erguidas de Tyrn Gorthad están cubiertas con un liquen de lenta expansión."}},
[13087]={nameES="La piedra erguida",objectivesES={"Lleva la piedra élfica a la piedra erguida y vence a su guardián","Derrotado el Señor de los montículos","Nada sucede","Presenta la piedra élfica en la piedra erguida","Los tumularios rondan las antiguas tumbas de los Edain, en los confines orientales de Haudh Lin, anunciando la llegada de un gran mal a Ered Luin.","La piedra erguida blanca se encuentra entre las antiguas tumbas de los Edain, al noreste de la casa de Glamir, cerca de las ruinas de un viejo edificio.\
\
Glamir te ha dicho que lleves la piedra élfica a las tumbas de los Edain y la coloques sobre la piedra erguida más grande. Cree que la criatura cuya voluntad gobierna a los seres reanimados de Haudh Lin podría ser atraída por su presencia.","Vence al Señor de los montículos","Glamir se encuentra dentro de las ruinas, al suroeste de las antiguas tumbas de los Edain.\
\
Tal como predijo Glamir, la piedra élfica atrajo al amo de los seres reanimados. Deberías volver a ver a Glamir para contarle tu victoria sobre la criatura.","La piedra erguida","La piedra élfica verde brilla en tu mano.","Lleva la piedra élfica a Glamír"}},
[13088]={nameES="El Favor de las Estrellas",objectivesES={"Ayuda a Byrski Proadura a contruir un barco","El Favor de las Estrellas","Byrski Hardprow se encuentra en Mekhem-bizru en el Valle del Arroyo Sombrío.\
\
Lo has ayudado a presenciar la Corona de Durin en el Lago Espejo. Debes hablar con Byrski Proadura.","Debes ayudar a Byrski Proadura a construir un barco para su expedición.","Habla con Byrski Proadura","Byrski Proadura se encuentra en Mekhem-bizru en el Valle del Arroyo Sombrío.\
\
Has construido con éxito un barco adecuado para tu expedición al Lago Espejo. Debes hablar con Byrski Proadura.","Debes ayudar a Byrski Proadura a construir un barco para su expedición, pero quizá esta vez deberías esforzarte un poco más.","Ayuda a Byrski a construir un barco digno de presenciar la Corona de Durin","Los orcos y las tablas de madera de Iles puede encontrarse en Uruk-gashan, en el Valle del Arroyo Sombrío.\
\
Byrski Proadura te ha pedido ahuyentar a los orcos que acechan en el valle y recolectar tablas de madera de acebo.","Entrega las tablas de madera de acebo a Byrski Proadura en Mekhem-bizru.","Byrski Proadura se encuentra en Mekhem-bizru en el Valle del Arroyo Sombrío.\
\
Has recogido varias tablas de madera de acebo y ahuyentado a muchos orcos en Uruk-gashan. Debes regresar con Byrski Proadura.","Byrski Proadura se encuentra en Mekhem-bizru en el Valle del Arroyo Sombrío.","Byrski Proadura se ha ofrecido a buscar la Corona de Durin en el Lago Espejo, con la esperanza de que anuncie un final auspicioso para la reclamación de Khazad-dûm por parte de la Guarnición de Hierro."}},
[13089]={nameES="The State of the Expedition",objectivesES={"Assist with affairs in Thornholt","Assist at Stormwall","Talk to Stráhek the Stout","The State of the Expedition","Help out in all major affairs in the Dwarf-holds, including: 'Into the Ironfold', 'An Audience with the Boy King', 'An Unexpected Story', 'Scars of Battle', 'Across the Chasm', 'In the Halls of Thikil-gundu', and 'Etterfang.'","Stráhek can be found in Skarháld in the Grey Mountains.\
\
You should talk with Stráhek the Stout about the Zhélruka efforts to establish themselves in the Grey Mountains.","Help out in all major affairs in the Dwarf-holds.","Assist in the Steel Keep","There is much to do in the Dwarf-holds, after all is said and done.","Complete each of the major story-lines for the Dwarf-holds","Follow Nori's trail","Assist Náin with Hammerstead and Utterby","Assist in the Glimmerdeep mines","Complete 'Into the Ironfold'"}},
[13090]={nameES="The State of the Sewers",objectivesES={"Nashôn has asked you to report to Belondor in Dâr Laja, the Meeting-hall in Umbar Baharbêl with news of the guards' progress in the sewers beneath the Sail-haven.","Talk to Belondor","You have helped the guards that Belondor sent to the sewers beneath the Sail-haven of Umbar Baharbêl.","The State of the Sewers"}},
[13091]={nameES="The Statue of Helm Hammerhand",objectivesES={"The statue of Helm has been destroyed","Helm Hammerhand's statue must be defended from the enemies seeking to desecrate his memorial and dishearten the soldiers guarding the dike.","The Statue of Helm Hammerhand","Helm Hammerhand's memorial stands upon the Dike at the location where he perished. The Rohirrim draw inspiration and courage from the sight of the statue raised above the trench wall. The enemy cannot be allowed to destroy the statue while the men of Rohan still stand to defend Helm's Dike.\
\
Merit Rating\
\
This quest starts with <rgb=#FFFF00>Full</rgb> Merit Rating.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Major Merit Loss:</rgb>\
* Statue is dealt heavy damage\
* Rohirrim guards defeated","<rgb=#FF0000>Do not allow Helm's statue to be destroyed</rgb>"}},
[13092]={nameES="The Statue of Helm Hammerhand",objectivesES={}},
[13093]={nameES="The Stinging Bog",objectivesES={}},
[13094]={nameES="The Stinging Harvest",objectivesES={"The swarm catches the scent of honey!","You should place the honeypot a ways away from the barrel of grapes.\
\
A good spot for the honeypot can be found at Bergraw in Pinnath Gelin.","Pick up the honey pot","Collect yeast","Collected yeast","Leithiel has asked you to distract a swarm of bees with some honey. You should pick up the jar of honey.\
\
The honey is next to Leithiel at Bergraw in Pinnath Gelin.","You should bring the yeast you've collected to Leithiel at her vineyard in Pinnath Gelin.","Place the honeypot","With local farms under various forms of attack, wine makers in Pinnath Gelin have had to become resourceful in their methods.","Bring the yeast to Leithiel","The Stinging Harvest"}},
[13095]={nameES="La protección pestilente",objectivesES={"Gelirwen se encuentra en el Refugio Sombrío.\
\
Descubriste un objeto en el señor de Skûmfil. Es posible que la otra mitad del objeto repose en el otro combatiente del lugar.","Este fragmento, hallado sobre el rey kergrim, parece haber sido partido en dos. Es posible que este objeto pueda unirse con otro similar.\
\
Deberías encontrar la segunda mitad del objeto y mostrar ambas piezas a Gelirwen en el Refugio Sombrío.","La protección pestilente","La protección pestilente, hallada rota sobre el cadáver del líder de Skûmfil, podría ser un medio para adentrarse en las profundidades del área plagada de kergrim e insectos.","Lleva los fragmentos a Gelirwen en el Refugio Sombrío"}},
[13096]={nameES="La protección pestilente",objectivesES={"Este fragmento, hallado sobre la reina grodbog, parece haber sido partido en dos. Es posible que este objeto pueda unirse con otro similar.\
\
Deberías encontrar la segunda mitad del objeto y mostrar ambas piezas a Gelirwen en el Refugio Sombrío.","La protección pestilente","Gelirwen se encuentra en el Refugio Sombrío.\
\
Descubriste un objeto en la reina grodbog de Skûmfil. Es posible que la otra mitad del objeto repose en el otro combatiente del lugar.","Lleva los fragmentos a Gelirwen en el Refugio Sombrío","La protección pestilente, hallada partida sobre el cadáver del líder de Skûmfil, podría ser un medio para adentrarse en las profundidades del área plagada de kergrim e insectos."}},
[13097]={nameES="El Almacén",objectivesES={"You have found the Narghâk workshop in Starkhaven","Talk to Corudan at the Narghâk workshop in Starkhaven","Bring the bottles of Narghâk to Corudan at the workshop in Starkhaven","This weapon is used to launch Narghâk through the air with explosive force","What did the engineer think to retrieve from the marked barrel by the Narghâk workshop?","Corudan has learned that Heirsworn Corsairs throughout Sûg Nidar may carry small glass bottles containing quantities of Narghâk.","Corudan is concerned about the development of Narghâk weapons that might be used by the Song of Waves and Wind.","Plans nearby may describe the construction process for designing such Narghâk weapons as those located at the Starkhaven workshop. You should examine the plans and defeat any who try to stop you.","El Almacén","An engineer of Ordâkh bellows with rage and attacks!","The barrel is empty, but there are traces of Narghâk smeared at the bottom","Examine the plans for the Narghâk weapons intended for use by the Song, and defeat anyone who tries to stop you","The engineer perishes attempting to reach a nearby marked barrel","You should examine one of the unusual-looking weapons at the Narghâk workshop on the western shore of the Fearwater, in Starkhaven.","Corudan waits for word of your success at the Narghâk workshop on the western shore of the Fearwater, in Starkhaven.","Find the Narghâk workshop in Starkhaven, on the western shore of the Fearwater","This barrel is also empty of Narghâk. As you stand up, Corudan arrives","Examine another marked barrel by the Narghâk workshop","Examine the marked barrel by the Narghâk workshop","Corudan wants to search for the Narghâk workshop he believes to be located somewhere among the buildings on the western shore of the Fearwater, in Starkhaven.","Examine one of the unusual-looking weapons at the Narghâk workshop","Corudan has come to the Narghâk workshop at Starkhaven."}},
[13098]={nameES="The Stolen Gift",objectivesES={"Côs Braen can be found in the southern edge of Laerlad.\
\
You should defeat those you find in Côs Braen.","The Ungoledan presence is most visible, and it darkens the wood","Radagast can be found in Blómgard.\
\
You should talk to Radagast.","Regretting the allowance of skin-changing secrets falling into the wrong hands, Radagast seeks to end the Ungoledain presence in Laerlad for good.","Habla con Radagast","Seek out the Ungoledan encampment in Laerlad","Odahild can be found in Blómgard.\
\
You should talk to Odahild.","The Stolen Gift","Côs Braen can be found in the southern edge of Laerlad.\
\
You should seek out the Ungoledan encampment of Côs Braen in Laerlad.","Talk to Odahild"}},
[13099]={nameES="The Stolen Hoards of Angmar",objectivesES={}},
[13100]={nameES="El adorno robado",objectivesES={"Recolecta el adorno roto","Gurmagath tiene en su poder un adorno que perteneció a Lachenn, Maestro de Lin Giliath.","Lleva el adorno roto a Thaliollang","Gurmagath se encuentra en una loma en la zona noreste de Taur Gonwaith, al sureste de Lin Giliath.\
\
Thaliollang te pidió, en memoria de Lachenn, que cazases al caudillo de los trolls de piedra, Gurmagath, y recuperases el adorno de Lachenn para devolverlo a un lugar de honor.","Thaliollang está en Lin Giliath, al noroeste de Taur Gonwaith.\
\
Thaliollang espera tu regreso con el adorno que recuperaste de Gurmagath.","El adorno robado","Adorno roto recolectado"}},
[13101]={nameES="Las Piedras Robadas",objectivesES={"Habla con Tóki Barbablanca","Las Piedras Robadas","Los rascacuevas infestan las ruinas de Ost Dúrgonn, al norte del camino y del campamento de Barachen.\
\
Heithur Puñohierro cree que los rascacuevas de Ost Dúrgonn podrían haberse llevado las piedras y quizás atacaron con tal fuerza que lograron derrotar a los enanos.","Busca las piedras robadas en Ost Dúrgonn","Heithur Puñohierro está en el campamento de Barachen, al este del Último Puente y al sur del camino, en una colina inclinada bajo la sombra de altos acantilados.\
\
Has sabido por Tóki Barbablanca que las piedras que su compañía transportaba fueron robadas por trolls, aparentemente con ayuda del monstruoso rascacueva que derrotaste.","Los enanos de la compañía de Heithur Puñohierro han sufrido una desgracia cerca del Último Puente, y las piedras que transportaban para Glóin en Rivendel se han perdido."}},
[13102]={nameES="The Stolen Sword",objectivesES={"In an act of brashness, the scout Einar has lost his sword to an Angmarim.","The Stolen Sword","Draw out and defeat Akhún","You have reclaimed Einar's sword.\
\
You should return it to its rightful owner at Drenghól.","Dûn Traikh lies west of Drenghól.\
\
Einar suggested meddling with the Angmarim weapon stores to draw Akhún out so that you can reclaim his sword.","Found Einar's sword","Deliver the sword to Einar"}},
[13103]={nameES="Pisotea musarañas - el desafío",objectivesES={"Las musarañas molestas se encuentran en el centro del Jardín del Festival de Duillond, y las botas para pisotearlas están en tu inventario.\
\
Debes localizar las botas en tu inventario y asignarlas como habilidad. Estas botas pueden usarse para pisotear a las musarañas que infestan el jardín. Cuando lo hagas, espera en el centro del jardín a que comience el juego de musarañas.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Para asignar las botas como habilidad, arrastra el objeto 'Botas de Poder Imaginable' desde tu inventario a tu barra de habilidades.</rgb>\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Las musarañas molestas son inmunes a cualquier otro ataque o maniobra ofensiva.</rgb>","Asigna las botas para pisotear musarañas a tu barra de habilidades y espera el ataque","Toma las botas para pisotear musarañas de la caja cercana","Derrota musarañas antes de que termine la ronda","Logethuil está en el Jardín de Duillond.\
\
Debes llevarle noticias de tu éxito a Logethuil.","No abandones el centro del jardín","Habla con Logethuil","Has salido del jardín","Las botas necesarias para pisotear musarañas pueden encontrarse cerca de las escaleras del Jardín del Festival.\
\
Debes recoger las botas de la caja y arrastrarlas a tu barra de habilidades, pues las necesitarás para ahuyentar musarañas.","Has entrado en el jardín. Asegúrate de tener las botas para musarañas asignadas a tu barra de habilidades","Las musarañas molestas se encuentran en el centro del Jardín del Festival de Duillond.\
\
Logethuil te ha pedido que derrotes muchas musarañas y plantes plantitas para que el jardín prospere.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Para asignar las botas como habilidad, arrastra el objeto 'Botas de Poder Imaginable' desde tu inventario a tu barra de habilidades.</rgb>\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Las musarañas molestas son inmunes a cualquier otro ataque o maniobra ofensiva.</rgb>","Esta ronda ha terminado; no derrotaste a las musarañas a tiempo","Pisotea musarañas - el desafío","Has recibido botas para pisotear musarañas; debes asignarlas como habilidad y entrar al jardín","Has recogido botas para pisotear musarañas","Las musarañas molestas se encuentran en el centro del Jardín del Festival de Duillond.\
\
Logethuil te ha pedido que derrotes muchas musarañas y también que protejas las tiernas plantas jóvenes que intentan crecer en este entorno hostil.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Para asignar las botas como habilidad, arrastra el objeto 'Botas de Poder Imaginable' desde tu inventario a tu barra de habilidades.</rgb>\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Las musarañas molestas son inmunes a cualquier otro ataque o maniobra ofensiva.</rgb>","Los Elfos de Duillond tienen un jardín que debería lucir hermoso para el Festival de Primavera. Lamentablemente, hace poco ha sido invadido por musarañas.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro cuando finalice el festival actual. </rgb>"}},
[13104]={nameES="The Stone Nest",objectivesES={}},
[13105]={nameES="The Stone of Friendship",objectivesES={"The Stone of Friendship","Lanbert is in charge of the Rohirrim camp at the Cuthstan in Wailing Hills.\
\
Gadda has asked you to seek out Lanbert at the Cuthstan.","Talk to Lanbert at the base of the Cuthstan in the Wailing Hills","Gadda is looking for someone to help a camp of men sent to protect the Cuthstan, the Stone of Friendship, in Wailing Hills, from vandals."}},
[13106]={nameES="The Stone-smashers",objectivesES={}},
[13107]={nameES="El Intérprete de piedras",objectivesES={"Encuentra a Aric viajando al sur a través del Gran Camino del Este y más allá de Talath Gaun. Adéntrate en Harloeg, tan al sur en el pantano como puedas viajar hasta las ruinas allí.\
\
Frideric te ha enviado a hablar con Aric, el Intérprete de piedras.","El Intérprete de piedras","Frideric te ha enviado a Aric, el Intérprete de piedras de los Eglain, en Harloeg."}},
[13108]={nameES="El señor de Portepiedra",objectivesES={"Señor de Portepiedra derrotado","Has derrotado al señor de Portepiedra, eliminando la mayor parte de la amenaza trasgo en Annúndir.","El señor de Portepiedra yace en el centro de todas las travesuras trasgo en Annúndir. Deberías derrotar al señor de Portepiedra y enviar un mensaje contundente a los trasgos que amenazan estas tierras.","Derrota al señor de Portepiedra","Encuentra y derrota al señor de Portepiedra","El señor de Portepiedra está en el campamento trasgo en las colinas del sur de Annúndir, al este de Amon Raith.\
\
Deberías encontrar y derrotar al señor de Portepiedra.","Completado","El señor de Portepiedra","Señor de Portepiedra encontrado","El señor de Portepiedra está en el campamento trasgo en las colinas del sur de Annúndir, al este de Amon Raith.\
\
Deberías derrotar al señor de Portepiedra."}},
[13109]={nameES="The Stones of Erebor",objectivesES={"Ambassador Spakorth wishes to offer the finely-honed skills of Stout-axe rune-carvers to Erebor.","Crude stones can be found along the western slopes of Erebor.\
\
Ambassador Spakorth has asked you to gather crude stones from the slopes of Erebor that they might be carved into rune-stones by the Stout-axes.","As Ambassador Spakorth asked, you delivered many stones of Erebor to the Stout-axe rune-carvers. Through their skill, they will be able to create impressive rune-stones for King Thorin III and Durin's Folk.","Stout-axe rune-carvers can be found in Erebor.\
\
You have gathered many stones from the slopes of Erebor and should now deliver them to the Stout-axe rune-carvers in Erebor.","You have delivered many crude stones to the Stout-axe rune-carvers.","Completado","The Stones of Erebor"}},
[13110]={nameES="The Storming of Gwathrenost (Tier 1)",objectivesES={"Completed: Gwathrenost, the Witch-king's Citadel (Tier 1)","Antiguamente sede del Rey Brujo de Angmar, la temible ciudadela de Gwathrenost proyecta una larga sombra sobre la ciudad de Carn Dûm. Casi abandonada tras la deposición del Senescal de Angmar, los restos de la Corona de Hierro han salido de las sombras, buscando dominar un artefacto perdido del Rey Brujo y reclamar el dominio de Angmar.","Destroy the Shard of Tauressar","Severed from the Vandassar of Rhudaur, the shard of Tauressar is possessed of a terrible enchantment capable of swaying the hearts and minds of those who swear oaths upon it—willingly or not.\
\
You must destroy the shard of Tauressar.","With the destruction of the shard of Tauressar and the final downfall of the Iron Crown, a new day dawns in Angmar.\
\
You have completed 'Gwathrenost, the Witch-king's Citadel' on Tier 1.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: You may keep this quest in your Quest Log to access each of the encounters in Gwathrenost, or you may abandon it to reset your progress. This quest will automatically reset on Monday, Thursday, and Saturday.</rgb>","Tham Mornarcham can be found atop Gwathrenost.\
\
You must ascend Gwathrenost and reach Tham Mornarcham to confront the leaders of the Iron Crown.","The Castellan's chambers can be found atop a set of winding stairs within Gwathrenost.\
\
You must find the Castellan's chambers and defeat Castellan Obáshurz if you are to confront the leaders of the Iron Crown.","Ascend Gwathrenost and enter the Castellan's chambers","The Storming of Gwathrenost (Tier 1)","Defeat Castellan Obáshurz","Ascend Gwathrenost and enter Tham Mornarcham","High Priestess Ásachal and High Chieftain Claghórd await in Tham Mornarcham, the Seat of the the Witch-king.\
\
High Priestess Ásachal and High Chieftain Claghórd must be defeated before they can wield the shard of Tauressar to subjugate the Free Peoples of Middle-earth.","Gurkrak keeps watch on Gwathrenost and brutally dispatches those foolish or daring enough to enter the Witch-king's citadel unbidden.\
\
You must defeat Gurkrak and enter Gwathrenost.","Defeat High Priestess Ásachal and High Chieftain Claghórd","Defeat Gurkrak and enter Gwathrenost","One of the last remnants of the reign of the Steward of Angmar, Castellan Obáshurz tends Gwathrenost and dutifully serves his masters: High Priestess Ásachal and High Chieftain Claghórd.\
\
You must defeat Castellan Obáshurz."}},
