[13115]={nameES="The Story Behind the Death",objectivesES={"Men of Stangard can be found throughout the town.\
\
You should question many men about the death of Stanric, for Gadda suspects treachery on Sithric's part.","Gadda wishes for you to ask around Stangard about the death of Stanric, hoping that someone will know if Sithric was involved.","Athulf notes that Stanric died just as he grew inspired to incite change in Stangard","The Story Behind the Death","Sabert guards the front gate of Stangard.\
\
You should speak with Sabert at once about all that transpired during your questioning.","Talk to Sabert, your one remaining friend at Stangard","Wada once supported Sithric, but begins to suspect corruption and treachery","Sabert, your friend at Stangard, still guards the gate.\
\
You should speak with Sabert upon your return to Stangard.","Ask Wada about the death of Stanric","You have knocked the guard unconscious as he tried to arrest you. It would be best to move along quickly","Return to Sabert at the front gate","You have knocked the guard unconscious as he tried to arrest you -- best to move along quickly","Ask Adalbert about the death of Stanric","Ask Byrnstan about the death of Stanric","Sabert fears the truth in Gadda's suspicion of murder, but is afraid to speak of it to anyone","Byrnstan does not know much, but finds it strange that Stanric died so suddenly","Ask Uthrad about the death of Stanric","Ask Athulf about the death of Stanric"}},
[13116]={nameES="The Story of a Strange Stone",objectivesES={"Talk to Iothete","Iothete is in his hut in the woods in the Whitshaws.\
\
You should speak with Iothete and hear his tale.","Listen to Iothete's tale","Iothete is in his hut in the woods in the Whitshaws.\
\
You should speak with Iothete.","Iothete wishes to speak with you about a strange event that took place a year ago.","The Story of a Strange Stone"}},
[13117]={nameES="The Straw Men of Ost Rimmon",objectivesES={"You should bring the helms, swords, and cloth for the straw-men to Glánhar in the centre of Ost Rimmon.","Return to Lady Glánhar","The Straw Men of Ost Rimmon","Bargwen is south-west of Lady Glánhar in Ost Rimmon.\
\
Bring the materials for Lady Glánhar's straw men to Bargwen for assembly.","You should return to Lady Glánhar in Ost Rimmon with the sticks and trampled grass you gathered for her straw-man project.","Lady Glánhar has asked you to go out of Ost Rimmon and gather sticks and trampled grass for her straw-man project.","Bring the materials to Bargwen","Ask Narvellon the Beacon-keeper in Ost Rimmon for weapons, helms, and rough cloth for Lady Glánhar's straw men.","Lady Glánhar desires to make Ost Rimmon appear more well-defended than it is by outfitting straw men-at-arms.","Helms and swords can be found throughout Ost Rimmon. Rough cloth can be found in Ost Rimmon's store-house.\
\
Gather helms, swords, and rough cloth for Lady Glánhar's straw men.","Return to Glánhar","You should tell Lady Glánhar that Bargwen has begun work on her straw men-at-arms.","Talk to Narvellon"}},
[13118]={nameES="The Streets of Râhal Bakh -- Solo/Duo",objectivesES={"Utho has been defeated","Khâshap has left you to deal with his most trusted cohort, Utho the Grasper.\
\
Defeat Utho the Grasper.","He's getting away!","Khâshap has fled deeper into the back streets. Continue your pursuit before he delivers the Bile of Ifrinn!","The Streets of Râhal Bakh -- Solo/Duo","Khâshap has been cornered at the Gate of Storms. You must defeat him before he can make his final attempt at delivering this Bile of Ifrinn to his master.","Chase Khâshap to the Gate of Sorrow!","He's cornered!","From the apothecaries of Carn Dûm to Langstrand all the way to Umbar, Indagir now known as Khâshap has been transporting a draught of the vilest make. We now grasp at his heels as he makes his final attempt to deliver this substance to his master. We will not fail. We cannot. Khâshap must be stopped, now!","Defeat Khâshap, Irinn's Abomination","Defeat Utho the Grasper","Khâshap can't have gone far!","Follow Khâshap to the Gate of Storms","Khâshap has taken to the Fleetfast. He is running out of places to run. You must corner him at last!","Pursue Khâshap!","Khâshap has lured you into the Gut, and has turned the streets against you. Give chase as he makes his way to his master!","Khâshap and the Bile of Ifrinn are no more"}},
