[13176]={nameES="The Temámir of Jiret-menêsh",objectivesES={}},
[13177]={nameES="El terrible secreto de las salamandras",objectivesES={"Habla con Calatherdir en Tinnudir","Hunfredo Rebuscón está junto a las ruinas de Tollobel en Tyl Ruinen.\
\
Hunfredo Rebuscón está esperando que le cuentes tu victoria sobre las dos salamandras originales que trajo a Tyl Ruinen.","El terrible secreto de las salamandras","Ahora que has derrotado a Hunfredo Rebuscón en su juego de acertijos, por fin podría estar dispuesto a contarte el terrible secreto de las salamandras.","Las dos salamandras originales se encuentran en el sótano de Tollobel, en Tyl Ruinen.\
\
Hunfredo Rebuscón ha confesado que él era el responsable de la plaga de salamandras en Tyl Ruinen y te ha dado la llave del sótano donde encerró a las dos criaturas originales. Te ha pedido que mates a las dos salamandras originales para ayudar a reducir su número.","Lleva la llave del sótano a Hunfredo Rebuscón","Calatherdir está en el campamento de montaraces en la isla de Tinnudir, al este de Tyl Ruinen.\
\
Ahora que has descubierto el origen de las salamandras y ayudado a ralentizar su proliferación, debes volver a Calatherdir para contarle la historia de tus hazañas."}},
[13178]={nameES="El terror que representaba Azog",objectivesES={"La última vez que se vio a Arnfinn, se dirigía al este hacia Jazârgund.\
\
Búkk teme por la seguridad de uno de sus amigos, Arnfinn, que fue visto por última vez aventurándose para obtener información sobre Mazog y los Orcos de Moria.","Encuentra y habla con Arnfinn","El terror que representaba Azog","Arnfinn se aventuró fuera de Tharâkh Bazân para recopilar información sobre Mazog y aún no ha regresado.","Búkk está en Tharâkh Bazân, al oeste de Jazârgund.\
\
Búkk estará contento de saber que Arnfinn está a salvo.","Habla con Búkk en Tharâkh Bazân"}},
[13179]={nameES="The Thane of Langhold",objectivesES={"Thane Utred is in the Mead Hall of Langhold.\
\
You should return to the Thane now that you have received the proper welcome of his house.","You have been offered food and drink by the kind wife of Thane Utred.\
\
You should pledge your goodwill to the folk of Langhold by partaking of their mead and bread.","Return to Thane Utred","Utred, the Thane of Langhold, has invited you to eat and drink in his hall, a mark of welcome to guests of his city.","The Thane of Langhold","You have broken bread at the table of the Thane","Hear out Cíllan's gesture of welcome","Now that you are a guest, find a task or errand in Langhold","Cíllan bids you welcome on condition of your goodwill","Cíllan, wife of the Thane, can be found in the Mead Hall of Langhold.\
\
You should speak with Cíllan to receive a formal Rohirrim welcome.","You have tasted mead from the table of the Thane","Cíllan stands in the Mead Hall of Langhold.\
\
You should <rgb=#FF0000>bow</rgb> to Cíllan to thank her for her kindness and her greeting.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>This quest requires emotes. You must select the intended target and perform the emote.</rgb>","Utred bids you to leave and find your own manner of entertainment in town","Eat the bread of Langhold","Cíllan accepts your gesture graciously","Drink the mead of Langhold","<rgb=#FF0000>Bow</rgb> to Cíllan to thank her for her hospitality","Now that you have received the welcome of Thane Utred, you should venture out into Langhold to find something to do.\
\
Surely some of the townsfolk or guards could use some help from a seasoned traveller such as yourself."}},
[13180]={nameES="The Thief of Dannenglor",objectivesES={"Talk to Mírdiniel at the Haunted Inn","The primary thief among the merrevail can be found in Dannenglor, north of the Haunted Inn in the Dourstocks.\
\
You should confront the morroval who hoards the priceless Elf-treasure and attempt to reclaim it for the Elves.","The Thief of Dannenglor","Mírdiniel of the Malledhrim wishes you to search Dannenglor one last time -- this time for the most priceless remnants of the days when Elves lived there, before the merrevail took hold.","Collect the priceless Elf-treasure","Mírdiniel awaits you at the Haunted Inn in the Dourstocks, south of Dannenglor.\
\
You should bring the priceless Elf-treasure to Mírdiniel so that she may send it to be kept by the Galadhrim in Lothlórien, where it will remain safe as long as the Elves exist to watch over it.","You have collected the priceless Elf-treasure","Defeat the greedy morroval-thief"}},
[13181]={nameES="Los Cazadores de Ladrones",objectivesES={"Los Cazadores de Ladrones","Habla con Eliot Bencroft en RantosT","Eliot Bencroft está en la esquina sureste de Rantost.\
\
Eliot Bencroft se alegrará al saber que la isla ha sido despejada.","Los saqueadores de tumbas están amenazando la paz de Evendim, profanando los lugares antiguos de los Dúnedain.","Los saqueadores de tumbas han establecido un campamento en Rantost, una isla al norte de Tinnudir en el lago Nenuial.\
\
Eliot Bencroft quiere que derrotes a algunos de los saqueadores de tumbas."}},
[13182]={nameES="La pista de los ladrones",objectivesES={"La pista de los ladrones","Encuentra a los semiorcos que llevan el objeto del campamento de la Compañía","Has descubierto que los semiorcos saquearon los vestigios de un campamento, llevándose algo consigo.","Thlûk derrotado","Los semiorcos fueron vistos al este y un poco al sur de Echad Eregion, casi al sur del campamento de la Compañía.\
\
Golgallon te dijo que persiguieras a los semiorcos y recuperaras lo que se llevaron del campamento.","Golgallon se encuentra en Echad Eregion, al oeste y al norte de donde encontraste a Thlûk.\
\
Debes regresar a Golgallon con noticias de tu encuentro con Thlûk.","Habla con Golgallon en Echad Eregion"}},
[13183]={nameES="The Thieving of the Shrew",objectivesES={"Bring the stolen pipe-weed pouch to Gladmeldis","The Thieving of the Shrew","You find the pipe-weed pouch! Some of the pipe-weed has been used to make a shrew-nest","A thieving shrew has made off with Pippin's pipe-weed pouch.","Find the stolen pipe-weed pouch","The shrew ran off to the north of the Company's Pavilion.\
\
A shrew has run off with Pippin's pipe-weed pouch, and you should find it before the hobbit awakes.","Gladmeldis is at the Company's Pavilion in Caras Galadhon.\
\
You have recovered Pippin's pipe-weed pouch and should bring it to Gladmeldis at once."}},
[13184]={nameES="The Things They Left Behind",objectivesES={}},
[13185]={nameES="Las cosas en la oscuridad",objectivesES={"Habla con Moggi en el Refugio Sombrío","En las profundidades más oscuras de Moria, hay un lugar donde la única luz que brillaba provenía de las lámparas de enanos y hongos luminiscentes. Ahora estos túneles son más tenues que nunca y hogar de criaturas que existen solo en pesadillas. Sin embargo, ahí están, y los agentes de Veúlfur enviados al Refugio Sombrío encuentran poco consuelo al saber que hay algo en las Excavaciones Tenebrosas que ordena a los orcos a envenenarse de una manera que los entrega a una voluntad superior.","Las cosas en la oscuridad","Moggi se encuentra en el Refugio Sombrío, muy al noroeste de las Excavaciones Tenebrosas.\
\
Te abriste paso hasta las Excavaciones Tenebrosas y allí derrotaste a muchos de los horrores sin nombre. Ahora deberías regresar al Refugio Sombrío e informar a Moggi de tu éxito.","Las Excavaciones Tenebrosas se encuentran muy al sureste del Refugio Sombrío.\
\
Moggi mencionó las lámparas que los enanos colocaron en las Excavaciones Tenebrosas y cómo estas podrían ahuyentar a algunos de los sinnombre, pero cree que hay otros que no temen a esa luz. Actúa con cautela al llevar a cabo esta misión."}},
[13186]={nameES="El tercer engranaje",objectivesES={"Lleva el tercer engranaje a Bávor","Bávor está en la Mansión de Thorin.\
\
Bávor estará complacido de ver que has conseguido el tercer engranaje.","El tercer engranaje está en un cofre dentro de las ruinas de una cripta antigua en Emyn Hoedh, los túmulos de Haudh Lin, al noreste de Gondamon.\
\
Bávor te ha pedido que recuperes el tercer engranaje perdido para la Bóveda de la Montaña. Te advirtió sobre los rumores de la presencia de tumularios de túmulo entre los antiguos túmulos.","Tercer engranaje perdido encontrado","Encuentra el tercer engranaje perdido","El tercer engranaje","Bávor es un mecánico encargado de reparar el gran mecanismo que da acceso a la legendaria Bóveda de la Montaña."}},
[13187]={nameES="The Third Stone",objectivesES={"As you peer into the illusion of the third stone, vivid imagery appears in your mind.\
\
You see a cave troll entering the chamber and breaking down the door with a massive club. He sees the stone on the pedestal and pauses, becoming transfixed. It entrances him, and he takes the stone and leaves.\
\
It is clear you must track down this troll in order to find the stone.","Unfortunately, it WAS found. Mordirith, Steward of Angmar, came looking for the missing cultists carrying a powerful artifact. The water did not obscure the stone to one such as he. The dark powers of the Nameless glow like a beacon to the eyes of a wraith.\
\
If the stone was taken by Mordirith, it may be somewhere in Angmar.","The Third Stone","The missing stone is out there somewhere, waiting to be found.","The illusions have become more vivid. When you peer into the illusion of the stone, the frozen moment in time springs to life. This time, you can hear it as well.\
\
You see the Blue Crag goblins emerging from the mountains. They look around nervously, muttering to each other. You hear a twig snap somewhere nearby. They pause, and pull out their weapons. A gauradan howls and charges at them from a higher slope. He bellows something at the goblins, but you cannot make out the words. The goblins try to fight back, but are quickly overpowered by the hulking beast-man. The gauradan notices the strange stone still clutched in the hand of the dead goblin. He begins to peer into it, but then winces, and looks away, disgusted by the foul magic attempting to enter his mind. Still careful to look away, he picks up the stone, and hides it in a pouch under his furs. He then runs off toward his village.\
\
It is clear you must track down the gauradan in order to find the stone.","The illusion shows you the Ranger's end. He rode through the Fields of Fornost as fast as his mount would carry him.\
\
'If I can make it to the Greenway, I should be safe!', he mutters urgently. But then a pack of barghests began to close in on him, barking and snapping at his heels. When they reached the shallow pond, the moon's reflection spooked the horse, who reared up, knocking the Ranger to the ground. The Ranger tried to fend off the beasts, but it was the end of them both. As a final act, the Ranger hurled the stone into the pond, hoping no one would find it.","Inspect the illusion of the third stone","An illusion has appeared before you in the Crown Chamber.\
\
You should inspect the illusion of the third stone.","You hear stones shifting somewhere nearby","The illusions next show you a different gauradan tribesman negotiating with two Angmarim cultists. You are now able to hear their conversation with surprising clarity.\
\
'You were wise to inform us of this, wolf-man. This will bring you great favour with Angmar.'\
'I care little for your favours, cultist of Angmar. Take that dark magic far from here!'\
\
The Angmarim turn and leave. Surprisingly, this time when the stone changed hands, no bloodshed occurred. It is clear you must track down the Angmarim in order to find the stone.","Find the third stone somewhere in Angmar","The vision shows you a triangular stone on this pedestal. This third stone must be out there somewhere, waiting for you to find it. You swear you can hear faint whispers, bidding you to look closer at the illusion.","You have found one of the missing stones!\
\
You should return it to its rightful place in the Crown Chamber.","You peer into the illusion of the stone within the hand of the troll. Vivid imagery appears in your mind once more.\
\
The troll, stumbling around in a stupor induced by the stone, broke through the ice and became trapped. Come morning's light, he was turned to stone. There the Third Stone waited for some time, until a Dourhand Dwarf chanced upon the statue. You see the Dourhand climbing the troll, chiselling the precious artifact from its stone hand. He grins wildly as he looks deep into its black surface, and runs off with it under his arm.\
\
It is clear you must track down this Dourhand in order to find the stone.","Find the third stone.","The third stone is yours!","This must be where the third stone was kept, but it is missing. The door was broken down and the stone stolen, but it is unclear how long ago this happened.\
\
Suddenly, the Secret Stone begins to react in its pouch. A new illusion appears before you: the third stone as it had been on its pedestal. You can just make out whispers on the edge of your hearing. They bid you to look closely.","The illusion now shows you the moment that the Angmarim cultists were ambushed at the cross-roads by Rangers of Eriador. They were both easily brought down by their arrows. The Rangers carefully look through the cultists' belongings, and find the stone.\
\
'Oh ho, what is this? Some hidden treasure?'\
'I've never seen anything like it. Let me look at it more closely....'\
'Snap out of it! This thing had you completely entranced! Put it away, quickly!'\
'This is clearly some artifact of immense evil. Just being in its presence puts me on edge.'\
'What should we do? This may be too dangerous to bring back to camp.'\
'It must be brought to Aragorn, right away.'\
'But he is in the field! You would have to travel past Fornost!'\
'It must be done. I will ride as swiftly as I can. You two must return to camp.'\
\
It is clear you must track down the mounted Ranger in order to find the stone.","The missing stone was found by Mordirith, and must be somewhere in Angmar.","Return the stone to its pedestal","The stones must be returned to their rightful places in the Crown Chamber.","You have found the decayed corpse of a Dourhand Dwarf. You are unsure how long it has been here, but the illusion of the third stone in its hand clearly indicates this is the dwarf for which you were looking.\
\
You peer into the illusion of the stone within the hand of the dead dwarf. Vivid imagery appears in your mind once more.\
\
You see him running along the road alone at night. He is trying to get the stone somewhere in a hurry. Suddenly, he is ambushed by a trio of Blue Crag goblins! He evades them, running north toward the mountains. Eventually, he is cornered against the cliff. The goblins kill him, and steal the stone.\
\
It is clear you must track down these goblins in order to find the stone.","Find the third stone"}},
[13188]={nameES="La amenaza del fuego",objectivesES={"Bill Musgopié está en su campamento en los Pantanos de Moscagua, al sureste de las Ruinas de los Pantanos de Moscagua.\
\
Las noticias de tu éxito contra los zapadores trasgos deberían aliviar algunas de las preocupaciones de Bill Musgopié.","Los zapadores trasgos se han infiltrado en la extensión sur de los Pantanos de Moscagua.\
\
Bill Musgopié te ha encargado derrotar a los zapadores de Moscagua antes de que puedan llevar su aceite ardiente mortal a Entibo.","Habla con Bill Musgopié","El aceite ardiente que llevan los trasgos zapadores que se han infiltrado en los Pantanos de Moscagua preocupa especialmente a Bill Musgopié, encargado de la defensa de Entibo.","La amenaza del fuego"}},
[13189]={nameES="La Amenaza de las Embestidas",objectivesES={"Los jabalíes salvajes del sur del Bosque de los Trolls se han vuelto numerosos y peligrosos, atacando a menudo a los viajeros del camino.","La Amenaza de las Embestidas","Hay jabalíes que habitan en el sur del Bosque de los Trolls.\
\
Mientras estés en el sur del Bosque de los Trolls, deberías reducir su número, quizás disminuyendo la amenaza que representan para los viajeros del camino."}},
[13190]={nameES="The Three Trees",objectivesES={"The Three Trees","DNT -- Players will not see","Quickbeam can be found to the east of Isengard in Nan Curunír.\
\
You have recovered all three seeds from Nan Curunír and should now return them to Quickbeam's keeping.","Plant Lassemista's seed at the base of Orthanc","Talk to Quickbeam at Derndingle\
<rgb=#FF0000>The Huorn outside Isengard can guide you to Derndingle</rgb>","Talk to Quickbeam","Found Lassemista's seed","Search for Lassemista's seed","Determined to honour their memory, Quickbeam seeks to find what remains of his fallen friends at the edge of Fangorn Forest.","Search for Orofarnë's seed","You have planted Lassemista's seed at the base of Orthanc","Found Carnimírië's seed","A good spot to plant Lassemista's seed can be found at the southern base of Orthanc.\
\
Quickbeam has asked that you plant Lassemista's seed outside Orthanc to spite Saruman and bring forth new life in Nan Curunír.","The seeds of Orofarnë, Lassemista, and Carnimírië can be found along the borders of Nan Curunír and Fangorn Forest.\
\
Quickbeam wants you find the seeds of his fallen friends in Nan Curunír so he can honour their memory.","Search for Carnimírië's seed","Quickbeam can be found at Derndingle in Fangorn Forest, which can be reached with the aid of the Huorn outside Isengard.\
\
You have planted Lassemista's seed at the base of Orthanc, and should now meet Quickbeam in Fangorn Forest.","Found Orofarnë's seed"}},
[13191]={nameES="El cuerno sonado tres veces",objectivesES={"Evita que los exploradores hagan sonar sus cuernos tres veces.","Corsair scouts have snuck up from behind and spotted our position. If they can get off three blows of their horn, reinforcements will come running! (Three scouts, one after the other, will attempt to blow their horn three times.)\
\
This quest starts with <rgb=#FFFF00>empty</rgb> Merit Rating.\
\
<rgb=#00FF00>Merit Gain:</rgb>\
* Defeat scouts before third horn-blow \
  (with as few horn-blows as possible)","El cuerno sonado tres veces"}},
[13192]={nameES="The Thriving Horde",objectivesES={}},
[13193]={nameES="The Throne of Zidir-nesad",objectivesES={"Repair the Throne of Zidir-nesad with the marble","You have repaired the throne with the marble","The Throne of Zidir-nesad","You have repaired the throne with the amethyst","The Throne of Zidir-nesad can be found at the Steepset in Máttugard.\
\
You should repair the Throne of Zidir-nesad under Rísti Graver's supervision.","Rísti Graver can be found at the Steepset in Máttugard.\
\
You should talk to Rísti Graver.","Talk to Rísti Graver","Repair the Throne of Zidir-nesad with the amethyst","Repair the Throne of Zidir-nesad with copper ore","The three types of stone Rísti Graver seeks can be found in Máttugard.\
\
You should collect copper, marble, and amethyst for Rísti Graver.","You have repaired the throne with the copper ore","Zidir-nesad, the seat of Gundabad’s lord, has been broken and stripped of its seven sacred jewels."}},
[13194]={nameES="The Tiers of Clovengap",objectivesES={"The Tiers of Clovengap","Speak to Mother Amma","Mother Amma is in Stókkset, in south-west Clovengap.\
\
You should talk to Mother Amma.","Ages ago, a great sundering shook loose the ceiling of this massive cavern. Once opened to the sky, Clovengap became an emerald swath of tiered gardens, unique among the dwarf-holds. Gone now are those gardens, replaced by dark forests and thick mists, in which prowl those with murderous intent."}},
[13195]={nameES="Los lazos que nos unen",objectivesES={"Kaj está ahora preparado para emprender el ritual lossoth que ha jurado completar.","Habla con Kaj","Habla con Pinja","Kaj se encuentra en Pynti-peldot.\
\
Deberías hablar con Kaj cuando estés listo para ayudarle con su ritual.","Pinja se encuentra fuera de su casa en Lumi-talletta, al suroeste de Pynti-peldot, en Itä-ma.\
\
Deberías hablar con Pinja de inmediato.","Los lazos que nos unen"}},
[13196]={nameES="La Tintura",objectivesES={"Oflár está preocupado por la propagación de los tumularios en Imlad Balchorth y ha desarrollado un plan para deshacerse de ellos.","La Tintura","Lleva las plantas de belladona de vuelta a Oflár","La planta de belladona crece al norte y al este de Maethad, al sureste de Myrkworth.\
\
Oflár te ha pedido que recojas plantas de belladona para preparar una tintura que espera sea útil contra los tumularios de Imlad Balchorth."}},
[13197]={nameES="The Tipping Point",objectivesES={"Complete 'Three Faction Battle!' for Klúso","A battle between the Orcs and hobgoblins has erupted in the ice-giant settlement of Thyrstáth.\
\
You should complete objectives in Thyrstáth for both Klúso and Hórin.","Talk to Klúso near Bazan-medan","Find the door to the main keep in south-east Thyrstáth","Klúso calls to you as you approach","Complete 'The Unyielding and the Overwhelming' for Klúso","Find Klúso near Bazan-medan","Klúso, another of Ausma's apprentices, has witnessed a disagreement about what to do concerning the local ice-giants.","Klúso is ready to give his scouting report.\
\
You should talk to Klúso and complete 'Instance: The Tipping Point'.","You have defeated the Orcs and hobgoblins, and possibly earned some favour with the ice-giants.\
\
You should find the door to the main keep, in the south-eastern reaches of Thyrstáth.","Call Hórin and help him with 'Caught In The Middle'","Hórin can be found next to Klúso, west of Bazan-medan.\
\
You should talk to Hórin.","A flare shoots up to the right of Bazan-medan, the gate to Clovengap","Klúso can be found west of Bazan-medan.\
\
You should talk to Klúso.","Klúso can be found near Bazan-medan.\
\
You should talk to Klúso.","Talk to Hórin near Bazan-medan","Hórin thinks the best course of action is to continue higher into the Welkin-lofts in search of Ausma's apprentices.\
\
You should continue south and find Klúso.","The Tipping Point","Call Hórin and talk to him","This is the door to the main keep of Thyrstáth","You should talk to Hórin.\
\
Use the summoning horn to call Hórin to your side.","Talk to Klúso and hear his report"}},
[13198]={nameES="The Tomb at Halifirien",objectivesES={"Guthláf has asked you to visit the tomb at Halifirien in the Beacon Hills, and take note of what you see.","The Tomb at Halifirien","Return to Guthláf","You found the tomb. It is swarming with looters!","Find the tomb at Halifirien","Defeat the tomb robbers at the tomb","You should return to Guthláf and tell him how you saw the tomb at Halifirien and defended it from pillagers.","Defend the tomb at Halifirien.","Visit the tomb at Halifirien, where the Oath of Eorl established the eternal bond between Rohan and Gondor."}},
[13199]={nameES="La tumba de Elendil",objectivesES={"Calenglad está en el campamento de montaraces de Tinnudir, en Evendim.\
\
Calenglad está esperando que hables con él sobre tus aventuras en la tumba de Elendil.","Calenglad está en el campamento de montaraces de Tinnudir, en Evendim.\
\
Calenglad está esperando que hables con él para viajar a la tumba de Elendil y reclamar el Silithar para Aragorn.","Gwindeth ha accedido a retirar las aguas que inundaban la tumba de Elendil para que puedas recuperar el Silithar para Aragorn.","La tumba de Elendil","Habla con Calenglad y viaja a la tumba de Elendil"}},
[13200]={nameES="La tumba de Haudh Eglan",objectivesES={"Habla con Enid Picortiga en el Embarcadero de los Comerciantes","Busca en el baúl de Addy sus pertenencias personales","Habla con Enid Picortiga en Writhenset","Devuelve las reliquias al cofre ceremonial","El cofre ceremonial se encuentra en Haudh Eglan.\
