[13204]={nameES="El Campo de Torneo: Tutorial de combate montado",objectivesES={"Speak with Seoca at the tourney field directly south of Harwick.","El Campo de Torneo: Tutorial de combate montado","Speak with Anmar at the Harwick Mead-hall","You have obtained your first war-steed!","Complete the riding course upon the tourney field","Speak with Anmar, guard at the Mead-hall of Harwick in the Wold.","Speak with Seoca to complete your war-steed training.","You have been sent for training in the handling of a Rohirrim warhorse by the riding instructor Seoca upon the Tourney Field south of Harwick.","Obtain a war-steed by helping Langhold","You may not obtain a war-steed until you finish assisting the town of Langhold.\
\
To begin the lesson, you must first obtain a war-steed.","Speak to Seoca at the Tourney Field"}},
[13205]={nameES="El Campo de Torneo: Tutorial de combate montado",objectivesES={"Fence Course Completed!","Run the flags course as directed by Seoca.\
\
On the first round, you must pass through the blue flags.\
\
On the second round, you must pass through the red flags.\
\
On the third round, you must pass through both sets of flags at once.\
\
<rgb=#00FF00>Tip: This course is not timed, but if you miss a flag, the flag count will restart on your next lap.\
\
Tip: If you find the flags are too closely spaced to pass through at full speed, try slowing down a little.\
\
Tip: Using the mouse to turn allows finer control than the the keyboard.</rgb>","Follow the direction of Seoca as you circle the tourney field and learn to control your steed.\
\
You must make two full circuits of the outer track in order to proceed.","Lap Completed!","Blue flags passed!","Mount your war-steed near the outer starting line","Run the flags course as directed by Seoca.\
\
On the first round, you must pass through the blue flags.\
\
On the second round, you must pass through the red flags.\
\
On the third round, you must pass through both sets of flags at once.\
\
<rgb=#ffff00>- Tip: This course is not timed, but if you miss a flag, the flag count will restart on your next lap.\
\
- Tip: If you find the flags are too closely spaced to pass through at full speed, try slowing down a little.\
\
- Tip: Using the mouse to turn allows finer control than the the keyboard.</rgb>","Speak with Seoca to complete your training.","You have begun a short training tutorial at the Harwick Stables to teach you how to control your war-steed.","Speak with Seoca.","Run the flags course as directed by Seoca.\
\
On the first round, you must pass through the blue flags.\
\
On the second round, you must pass through the red flags.\
\
On the third round, you must pass through both sets of flags at once.\
\
<rgb=#0000FF>Important: This course is not timed, but if you miss a flag, the flag count will restart on your next lap.</rgb>\
\
<rgb=#00FF00>Tip: If you find the flags are too closely spaced to pass through at full speed, try slowing down a little.\
\
Tip: Using the mouse to turn allows finer control than the the keyboard.</rgb>","Flag course completed!","Ride through the blue flags","Begin your instruction in how to ride a war-steed by speaking with Seoca.","This is the combat skill course.\
\
Ride back and forth between the target dummies at either end of the field, striking each in turn.\
\
<rgb=#ffff00>- Tip: Queue your attacks before you reach your target.\
\
- Tip: Slowing down before a turn allows you to turn much faster.</rgb>","Red flags passed!","Speak with Seoca near the jousting course in the middle of the field.","Jump each of the fences as you ride around the track.\
\
If you miss a fence, your count will reset when you cross the start line and you can keep going.","Speak with Seoca","Mount your war-steed near the outer track starting line.","Speak with Seoca to begin the next training course.","El Campo de Torneo: Tutorial de combate montado"}},
