[13207]={nameES="The Tower by the Stream",objectivesES={"Infiltrate the Gondorian tower and defeat the leader of the Orc forces","The Tower by the Stream","You have defeated the Orc leader","Minas Rant is west of Springview Estate, at the edge of the stream that runs across the Norcrofts.\
\
Cyneswith believes that the commander of the Orcs inhabiting the farmsteads has likely established his base within the Gondorian tower of Minas Rant.","Speak to Cyneswith","Cyneswith awaits at the Springview Estate to the east of Minas Rant.\
\
Cyneswith is eager to hear of your stirke against the commander of the invading Orc forces.","The leader of the Orc forces pressing for control of the lands in the western plains of Norcrofts has fortified himself within the ancient Gondorian tower, Minas Rant."}},
