[13210]={nameES="The Town of Stoneheight",objectivesES={"Se ha encontrado al trasgo Gundúl y a sus esbirros","Búbhosh-grat ha huido hacia su Maestro","Busca entre los restos del pueblo a los comandantes de los mercenarios rebeldes.","Búbhosh-grat ha sido encontrado","Búbhosh-grat es otro de los esbirros de Ivar en Altapiedra. Este uruk-hai debe ser derrotado para expulsar a los bandidos del pueblo.","Derrota a Gundúl","Derrota a Búbhosh-grat","Busca a los esbirros de Ivar en Altapiedra","El Señor demacrado Ivar, ayudado por una banda de mercenarios, arrasó el pueblo de Altapiedra en busca de su yelmo perdido. Cuando alcanzó sus objetivos, abandonó el pueblo al cuidado de los despiadados mercenarios.","Dale Truitt es el último de los mercenarios al servicio de Ivar. Debes eliminar al líder mercenario para liberar a Altapiedra de las garras de los vándalos.","Descubre la ubicación del líder de los mercenarios","Derrota a Dale Truitt","Busca por el pueblo a los líderes de los esbirros mercenarios que aún permanecen en Altapiedra.","Busca más esbirros de Ivar","Aún no se ha visto al líder de los mercenarios de Ivar. Este hombre debe ser vencido para poner fin a la ocupación de Altapiedra.","Has encontrado a Dale Truitt, otro sirviente de Ivar","Dale Truitt ha sido derrotado","Has derrotado a Gundúl","The Town of Stoneheight","Gundúl es uno de los esbirros del Señor demacrado Ivar que permanecen en el pueblo de Altapiedra. Derrótalo y pon fin al mal causado por los mercenarios trasgo."}},
[13211]={nameES="El Rastreador",objectivesES={"Willem está celoso de toda la atención que Bingo le está dando a Crinloca. Cualquiera podría verlo.","Habla con Egwylf fuera del Salón de Hidromiel de Cliving","Bingo quiere viajar a la ciudad de Cliving, en los Norcrofts de Rohan Oriental, y te ha pedido derrotar a los enemigos de Rohan en el Páramo y los Norcrofts durante el viaje.","Bingo está fuera de la entrada de la ciudad de Cliving, en los Norcrofts, en el Rohan Oriental.","Bingo ya está muy encariñado con Crinloca y está listo para comenzar su travesía por los vastos campos de Rohan.","Recoge el broche del Ojo Sangriento detrás de las tiendas","Willem no parece convencido, y Crinloca parece no darse por enterado.","Has encontrado un broche con una gema roja sobre un tronco detrás de unas tiendas, en la zona oriental de Cliving, y deberías recogerla.","Egwylf está fuera del Salón de Hidromiel de Cliving, en los Norcrofts.","Bingo está fuera de la entrada de la ciudad de Cliving, en los Norcrofts, en Rohan Oriental.","Bingo está fuera del Salón de Hidromiel de Cliving, en los Norcrofts.","El broche contiene una gema roja y te recuerda a la Piedra de Roth.","Habla con Bingo fuera de la entrada de Cliving, en los Norcrofts","El Rastreador","Camina hasta la entrada del Salón de Hidromiel en Cliving","Puede que agentes del Culto del Ojo Sangriento hayan llegado a la ciudad de Cliving, en los Norcrofts.\
\
Egwylf te pidió que busques en la ciudad cualquier indicio de la presencia de los agentes del Ojo Sangriento.","Averigua qué le ocurre a Willem Bigote","Le cuentas a Bingo que Willem está celoso de Crinloca.","Willem ignora la voz de Bingo y no se da vuelta.","Encuentra algún indicio de que los agentes del Ojo Sangriento están en Cliving","No hablas el lenguaje de los linces, pero incluso sin esa habilidad es fácil comprender qué le ocurre a Willem Bigote: ¡está celoso del nuevo amigo de Bingo, Crinloca!","Un broche con una gema roja ha sido dejada sobre un tronco apartado.","Egwylf está fuera del Salón de la Hidromiel de Cliving, en los Norcrofts.\
\
Has encontrado un broche con una gema roja abandonado en un rincón de Cliving, detrás de unas tiendas.","El Salón de Hidromiel de Cliving está en la esquina noreste de la ciudad.\
\
Bingo quiere caminar hasta el Salón de Hidromiel de Cliving y averiguar cuál es la situación para los aventureros en los Norcrofts.","Bingo ha visto un rostro familiar fuera del Salón de Hidromiel.","Lleva el broche del Ojo Sangriento a Egwylf fuera del Salón de Hidromiel de Cliving","Habla con Bingo fuera del Salón de Hidromiel de Cliving","Willem Bigote está fuera de la entrada de la ciudad de Cliving en los Norcrofts, en Rohan Oriental."}},
[13212]={nameES="The Tracks of Winged Men",objectivesES={"You found the mysterious footprints","The Ungoladan attacker has been defeated.\
\
You should talk to Legolas.","Find the mysterious footprints","Legolas draws his weapons!","Legolas would like to speak with you.\
\
You should talk to Legolas.","Attempt to take an Ungoladan prisoner","The Ungoladan slumps to the ground, unconscious","The mysterious footprints of which the Rangers spoke can be found north-west of Echad Taerdim.\
\
You should find the footprints with Legolas.","Find a safe place to regroup near Cadar Skûs","You are being ambushed!\
\
Defeat the attacker!","Legolas would like to regroup in a safer location.\
\
You should find a safer spot to talk south of Cadar Skûs.","Legolas would like to talk to you about these strange footprints.\
\
You should talk to Legolas.","Find the Ungoledain","You have discovered a camp of Ungoledain","You have discovered an Ungoledain camp within Cirith Ungol. Legolas has decided a prisoner may yield some useful information.\
\
You should attempt to take an Ungoladan prisoner within Cadar Skûs.","Legolas has decided to first pursue the tracks the Rangers believe to be left by \\qwinged men\\q.","Defeat the attacker!","Legolas would like to speak to you about the Ungoledain camp you discovered.\
\
You should talk to Legolas.","You have discovered evidence of an Ungoledain presence in Cirith Ungol.\
\
You should follow the tracks to find the Ungoledain.","The Ungoladan did not respond to you, and died fighting","The Tracks of Winged Men","Habla con Legolas."}},
[13213]={nameES="The Tracks of an Army",objectivesES={"The Tracks of an Army","Return to Déorwine","Help Déorwine's scouts and cover any tracks left by the Rohirrim in the Beacon Hills.","Déorwine has requested help in aiding his rearguard to cover the tracks left behind by the Rohirrim.","Return to Déorwine in the camp in Taur Drúadan and tell him that you have covered many of the Rohirrim tracks in the Beacon Hills."}},
[13214]={nameES="The Trade Must Flow",objectivesES={"Now that the route from Felegoth to Lake-town has been made safe, trade can resume! Return to Loeglond to tell the raft-elves the good news.","Talk to Thranduil","Talk to Lorndúr","King Thranduil can be found within Felegoth.\
\
You should talk to Thranduil.","The Trade Must Flow","Lorndúr can be found in Loeglond.\
\
You should talk to Lorndúr"}},
[13215]={nameES="The Trail Begins",objectivesES={"The Trail Begins","You read:\
\
'Brother, the last group of captives has been secured deep within the waterfall. These foul invaders have infested our land, harry our men, and will be taught a lesson.\
\
'The filth in our cages will be a fitting tribute for our masters in among the crags to the east.  The weaker ones can be traded to the giants for protection. \
\
'Send a few men to the waterfall to guard the prisoners, when you have a chance.'\
\
Someone should be told of this letter.","This note describes a hideous end for any that would fall into the clutches of the Draig-lûth, which have come north out of Dunland.","Gronu can be found at his camp north of Harndirion, at the foot of the mountain.\
\
You should seek out Gronu and give him the message that you found.","Bring the note to Gronu at his camp"}},
[13216]={nameES="The Trail Ends",objectivesES={"According to a note that you discovered, the members of Gronu's hunting-party may still be alive and held in a secret cave beneath a waterfall.","The dungeon is behind the second waterfall, east of Gronu's camp.\
\
Gronu has asked you to find the dungeon where the Draig-lûth hold their prisoners and free his companions.","Talk to Gronu at his camp","Discover the cavern and save the captives","The Trail Ends","Gronu is at his camp, west of the waterfall.\
\
You should return to Gronu and let him know that all of the captives that could be found have been freed."}},
[13217]={nameES="La sala de entrenamiento",objectivesES={"Encontrarás a Falstarr en el campamento de Dolven-view, en Moria.\
\
Falstarr te ha pedido que vuelvas a hablar con él cuando estés listo para buscar la antigua armería, pero te advierte que una banda bien organizada de orcos de Moria se ha hecho con el control de la sala.","Fastarr sabe de un yunque antiguo donde puedes forjar el núcleo con la calidad que buscas para tu arma, pero los exploradores informan que la antigua armería en la que se encuentra ha sido invadida recientemente por una fuerza bien organizada de orcos de Moria, incluso ahora se están entrenando para prepararse para su próximo asalto para expulsar a los enanos de Moria.","Lleva un granate imbuido a Fastarr","La sala de entrenamiento","Lleva el granate imbuido a Fastarr","Encontrarás a Fastarr en el campamento del Mirador de la Gran Excavación, en Moria.\
\
Debes regresar con él para completar la mejora de tu arma.","Fastarr te ha pedido que le lleves un granate imbuido para ayudarte a imbuir de poder tu arma. Sin embargo, no sabe dónde puedes encontrar una piedra así.","Habla con Fastarr para viajar a la antigua armería"}},
[13218]={nameES="The Traitor's Loyalty",objectivesES={"The emblem of loyalty crumbles in your hands...","You have emerged victorious from Helegrod, and freed the giants of the Misty Mountains from the traitorous Storvâgûn!","High in the cliffs above Helegrod, the traitorous Storvâgûn has pledged the giants of the Misty Mountains to the service of Angmar in exchange for vast riches.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This quest will be removed from your quest log when you leave the instance.</rgb>","Collect Storvâgûn's tarnished emblem of loyalty","Has regresado a lo alto de los riscos sobre Helegrod para enfrentarte a Storvâgûn.","The Traitor's Loyalty","You have triumphed over Storvâgûn at Helegrod.","Completado","At the behest of Arifael, brave adventurers once faced Storvâgûn, a giant of the Misty Mountains who pledged his people to the service of Angmar in exchange for vast riches. He must be defeated once more, and the emblem of loyalty he bears must be taken from him!"}},
[13219]={nameES="The Trappings of Nobility",objectivesES={"Tilmakhím is to the south of Tâkhdar.\
\
Lay the traps in various locations around Tilmakhím.","Mâramit can be found at Tilmakhím, to the south of Tâkhdar.\
\
Speak with Mâramit and inform her the traps have been laid. She will want you to deliver a message to Hármelak to receive payment for her services.","Speak with Mâramit","Mâramit can be found at Tilmakhím, to the south of Tâkhdar.\
\
Ask Mâramit for more traps to place in order to capture pests. Hármelak will pay her later.","Hármelak is waiting in Dâr Laja.\
\
Return to Hármelak to convey Mâramit's good wishes, and inform her the traps have been set.","Return to Hármelak","Traps received","Tilmakhím is to the south of Tâkhdar.\
\
Hármelak has asked you to acquire more traps from Mâramit to ensnare more pests in Tâkhdar.","Ask Mâramit for more traps","The Trappings of Nobility","Spoke with Mâramit"}},
[13220]={nameES="El Bugan del Tesoro",objectivesES={"El Bugan del Tesoro","<rgb=#FF0000>¡No dejes que el Bugan escape!</rgb>","<rgb=#FF0000>¡El Bugan escapó!</rgb>"}},
[13221]={nameES="¡El Evento del Bugan del Tesoro está aquí!",objectivesES={"Teodoro Tojo, aventurero extraordinario, ha descubierto que los traviesos Bugan del Tesoro han comenzado a aparecer en lugares peligrosos por toda la Tierra Media.","El autoproclamado aventurero extraordinario Teodoro Tojo está siguiendo el rastro de los Bugan del Tesoro en algunos lugares peligrosos de la Tierra Media. Reúnente con él para iniciar una asociación provechosa.","Completa para recibir tu primera Moneda del Bugan","Teodoro Tojo puede encontrarse en cualquiera de estas instancias:\
Barad Guldur\
Sangre de la Serpiente Negra\
Mazmorras de Dol Guldur\
Eithel Gwaur\
Huida hacia la Montaña Solitaria\
