[13222]={nameES="La búsqueda del tesoro",objectivesES={"Culang el montaraz ha sabido de un gran tesoro enterrado hace mucho tiempo por un terrateniente Dúnadan y quiere recuperarlo antes de que lo encuentren los saqueadores de tumbas.","Un hito de piedra en Evendim podría esconder un tesoro. Culang ha compartido contigo este acertijo, que podría contener una pista de la localización del hito:\
\
   \\qVerdes campos dos caminos surcan,\
   y bajo la mirada de cuatro reyes se cruzan.\\q\
\
Debes examinar el hito cuando lo encuentres en busca de alguna pista sobre la localización del tesoro.","Encuentra la solución al acertijo","El hito de piedra está roeado de signos de excavación. Si una vez marcó la localización del tesoro, seguro que ha sido  econtrado.\
\
El hito tiene una inscripción, desgastada por el paso del tiempo.","La búsqueda del tesoro"}},
[13223]={nameES="The Treasure of Rohan",objectivesES={"You have defended the wild herd from slaughter","The mysterious old man is at Éomer's Vengeance, near the eaves of Fangorn, in the Entwash Vale.\
\
You should speak again with the mysterious old man if you are willing to defend the herd of wild horses.","The mysterious old man is at Éomer's Vengeance, on the eaves of Fangorn, in the Entwash Vale.\
\
You should return to the mysterious old man with news of your success.","Let the mysterious old man know that you will defend the herd","The old man is gone","Having returned from Thrug-unur victorious, the mysterious old man reveals another task that is more vital to the Rohirrim than the death of any Orc or goblin.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This instance is meant to be run with Mounted Combat. It may be run on foot, but will be considerably harder.</rgb>","Talk to the mysterious old man at Éomer's Vengeance","Talk to Thane Béortnoth outside of Thornhope","The Treasure of Rohan","Thane Béortnoth is encamped beyond the walls of Thornhope, east of Éomer's Vengeance.\
\
You should return to Thane Béortnoth and tell him of the mysterious old man."}},
[13224]={nameES="The Trees Are Twisted",objectivesES={}},
[13225]={nameES="The Trees of Taurlingol",objectivesES={"Mirkwood spiders have killed and webbed many trees in Taurlingol.\
\
You should burn webbed trees.","Legolas can be found on a hill near Taurlingol.\
\
You should talk to Legolas.","Habla con Legolas.","The Mirkwood spiders have only recently arrived, but already they taint the forests in Cirith Ungol.","The Trees of Taurlingol"}},
[13226]={nameES="The Trickster Skull",objectivesES={}},
[13227]={nameES="El guardián de trolls",objectivesES={"Thaliollang está en Lin Giliath, al noroeste de Taur Gonwaith.\
\
Thaliollang se alegrará de saber que tenía razón en su creencia: había un emisario de Angmar entre los trolls. Para beneficio de todos, lo has derrotado.","Alguien maligno ha agitado a los trolls de piedra, incitándolos a sembrar el caos en los hermosos claros de Meluinen.","El emisario de Angmar debe residir en lo profundo de la cueva en Taur Gonwaith, al sureste de Lin Giliath.\
\
Debes derrotar al emisario de Angmar que ha ganado la lealtad de los trolls de piedra.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Se recomienda una comunidad para esta misión.</rgb>","Has descubierto las Cuevas de Etten en Taur Gonwaith. Sea lo que sea que haya incitado a los trolls, sin duda se oculta en estas vastas cavernas.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Se recomienda una comunidad para esta misión.</rgb>","Busca en las Cuevas de Etten al líder de los trolls.","El guardián de trolls"}},
[13228]={nameES="Los Trolls de Ost Thondol",objectivesES={"Los Trolls de Ost Thondol","Trolls de piedra han descendido desde las Montañas Nubladas hacia las Gargantas del Bruinen, en el Bosque de los Trolls.","Hay trolls de piedra asentados en las ruinas de Ost Thondol, en las Gargantas del Bruinen del Bosque de los Trolls.\
\
Mientras explores Ost Thondol, deberías encargarte de los trolls de piedra que se han establecido allí."}},
[13229]={nameES="Los trolls de Taur Gonwaith",objectivesES={"Los trolls de Taur Gonwaith","Has derrotado a un buen número de amenazadores y mortíferos trolls en los bosques de Taur Gonwaith.","Un buen número de trolls deambulan por los bosques de Taur Gonwaith. Estas son peligrosas y malvadas criaturas, siervas del enemigo. ¿Quién los ha despertado de las profundas cavernas donde permanecían en letargo?","Los trolls merodean por Taur Gonwaith en Meluinen, al sur de las Quebradas del Norte.\
\
Debes derrotar a los mortíferos trolls de Taur Gonwaith.","Completado"}},
[13230]={nameES="The Trolls of Vatug-ronk",objectivesES={"Vatug-ronk, home to the fiercest Orcs in Gundabad, also plays host to a number of trolls who are tougher than average. Defeating them as quickly as possible before they cause deaths on the battlefield would be best.","Defeating the trolls of Vatug-ronk as quickly as possible before they cause deaths on the battlefield would be best.","You have defeated a number of trolls in Vatug-ronk. The less the Gabil'akkâ has to deal with the trolls, the better.","Defeat trolls in Vatug-ronk","The trolls of Vatug-ronk remain a sizeable threat to the Gabil'akkâ","The Trolls of Vatug-ronk","Vatug-ronk, home to the fiercest Orcs in Gundabad, also plays host to a number of trolls who are tougher than average.","Completado","You have defeated a number of trolls in Vatug-ronk."}},
[13231]={nameES="El problema con las moscas de la cosecha",objectivesES={"Hay un nido de moscas de la cosecha en la Colina Yale, a una distancia al sur y este de Bolgovado, no muy lejos al noreste de Casa del Bosque. La colina está marcada por tres pilares en su cima.\
\
Bingo Bolger está preocupado por la agresividad aumentada de las moscas de la cosecha y te ha pedido ayuda para lidiar con ellas.","El problema con las moscas de la cosecha","Las moscas de la cosecha generalmente solo son una molestia para los cultivos, pero recientemente han comenzado a atacar hobbits en el Marjala.","Bingo Bolger está en Bolgovado, junto a un corral de cerdos en la ladera baja del pueblo.\
\
Bingo Bolger informó sobre el aumento de la agresividad entre las moscas de la cosecha en el Marjala y te pidió que te encargues de ellas. Debes regresar con él para informarle sobre tu éxito."}},
[13232]={nameES="El problema con los sureños",objectivesES={"El problema con los sureños","Ahora que conoces Bree, Graeme Tenderlarch ha decidido pedirte ayuda real en las afueras del pueblo.","Habla con el Vigilante Jefe Grimbriar fuera de Bree.","El Vigilante Jefe Grimbriar está en una cabaña de piedra junto al camino, fuera de la Puerta Oeste de Bree y hacia el norte por el Camino Verde.\
\
Graeme Tenderlarch, el alcalde de Bree, te pidió que hablaras con el Vigilante Jefe Grimbriar sobre los bandidos que amenazan la seguridad de las Tierras de Bree."}},
[13233]={nameES="The Troubles of Stangard",objectivesES={"Stanric seems to be a good man and has asked you to help the toiling Men of Stangard with their chores.","Talk to Gadda, Stanric's most trusted guard","Byrnstan guards the Mead Hall door of Stangard. Gadda stands not far from the Mead Hall. Sabert guards the north gate down below.\
\
You should speak with Gadda and see how you may assist the men of Stangard.","Help Byrnstan find what was stolen from him","The Troubles of Stangard","Gadda guards the Mead Hall in Stangard.\
\
You should speak with Gadda about what to do to assist the Men of Stangard.","Tell Gadda of the hardships you observed","Gadda is outside the Mead Hall in Stangard.\
\
You should tell Gadda of the many problems and hardships you observed in life at Stangard.","Help Gadda give food rations out to the men","Help Sabert by performing a long-overdue watch-tower duty"}},
[13234]={nameES="The Trove of Irkhadâr",objectivesES={}},
[13235]={nameES="Los verdaderos ladrones",objectivesES={"Tóki Barbablanca te dijo que los trolls robaron las piedras que llevaba su compañía.","Busca las piedras robadas entre los trolls de piedra.","Has encontrado las piedras robadas.","Los trolls de piedra están apostados en un sendero al norte del camino, más hacia el este desde el Último Puente.\
\
Tóki Barbablanca te pidió que dieras caza a los trolls que robaron las piedras y que recuperes el tesoro de los enanos.","Los trolls de piedra están apostados en un sendero al norte del camino, más hacia el este desde el Último Puente.\
\
Tóki Barbablanca te pidió que dieras caza a los trolls que robaron las piedras y que recuperaras el tesoro de los enanos.","Heithur Puñohierro se encuentra en el campamento de Barachen, al sur del camino, hacia el oeste del campamento de los trolls de piedra.\
\
Debes llevar las piedras robadas a Heithur Puñohierro de inmediato.","Los verdaderos ladrones","Los trolls de piedra están apostados en un sendero al norte del camino, más hacia el este desde el Último Puente.\
\
Tóki Barbablanca te pidió que dieras caza a los trolls que robaron las piedras y que recuperaras el tesoro.","Lleva las piedras robadas a Heithur Puñohierro","Busca las piedras robadas entre los trolls de piedra del Bosque de los Trolls."}},
[13236]={nameES="The Trust of Lórien",objectivesES={}},
[13237]={nameES="The Truth of the Matter",objectivesES={"Náin has asked to speak with you in Aslíf.","Habla con Náin","With the Orc taken as prisoner, Náin and Féli prepare to interrogate him.","Náin waits for you in Aslíf.","The Truth of the Matter"}},
[13238]={nameES="The Turtle or the Egg",objectivesES={"Turtle-eggs can be found throughout the southern Dunbog.\
\
Rhodri has asked you gather turtle-eggs from all over the southern bog so that the turtles can be saved.","Rhodri is worried about the endless slaughtering of turtles and feels that eventually there will be no more turtles in all of the Dunbog.","The Turtle or the Egg","Talk to Rhodri at the hunters' camp"}},
[13239]={nameES="Las propiedades del Crepúsculo",objectivesES={"Habla con Orchalwë en Tinnudir","Las propiedades del Crepúsculo","Lee el diario de Orchalwë y recupera Tham Andalath","Lee el diario de Orchalwë y recupera Tham Nambarth","Tienes la sensación de que Tham Nambarth está bajo control. La siguiente página del diario habla de Tham Varan","Tienes la sensación de que Tham Varan está bajo control. La siguiente página del diario habla de Tham Ornen","Lee el diario de Orchalwë y recupera Tham Varan","Las propiedades al este de Tinnudir, en los Campos del Crepúsculo, pertenecieron en su día a familias de gran riqueza y prestigio del Reino del Norte.","Sientes que has hecho todo lo que podías en Tham Ornen. La siguiente página del diario habla de Tham Andalath","El diario de Orchalwë se encuentra entre tus pertenencias.\
\
El diario de Orchalwë detalla lo que hay que hacer para recuperar los Campos del Crepúsculo.","Lee el diario de Orchalwë y recupera Tham Ornen","Los trasgos han huido, aterrorizados por lo que sea que merodee en la oscuridad. Has llegado al final del diario. Deberías regresar con Orchalwë."}},
[13240]={nameES="Los Cordeles que Unen",objectivesES={"Deluraw, el zapatero del evento de pisoteo de musarañas, se encuentra en Duillond, cerca de los hornos.\
\
Debes llevar el cordel que recogiste a Deluraw.","Lleva el cordel a Deluraw","El cordel elaborado por los Elfos puede encontrarse en Celondim, sobre y alrededor de los muelles.\
\
Debes recoger cordel en Celondim para la fabricación de las botas usadas en el evento de pisoteo de musarañas.","Los Cordeles que Unen","El zapatero del evento de pisoteo de musarañas necesita cordel para terminar su último lote de botas.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro cuando finalice el festival actual. </rgb>"}},
[13241]={nameES="El Corazón Retorcido",objectivesES={"Ramalarga está en las Agujas de la Linde, en la orilla noroeste del lago Evendim.\
\
Ramalarga te pidió que lo acompañaras contra el Corazón Retorcido.","Ramalarga está en las Agujas de la Linde, en la orilla noroeste del lago Evendim.\
\
Deberías hablar otra vez con Ramalarga.","Acompaña a Ramalarga contra el Corazón Retorcido","El Corazón Retorcido","Habla con Ramalarga en las Agujas de la Linde","Ramalarga cree que algún poder maligno podría estar retorciendo el bosque con fines oscuros."}},
[13242]={nameES="The Twisted Heart -- Redux",objectivesES={"Ramalarga está en las Agujas de la Linde, en la orilla noroeste del lago Evendim.\
\
Deberías hablar otra vez con Ramalarga.","Acompaña a Ramalarga contra el Corazón Retorcido","Hoom! Hom! It has been ever so long since my blood has run with such heat and fervour! That was well fought, Little One! Indeed while I have little love for axes and swords, I had forgotten the enjoyable haste of battle. Ta-room!\
\
'Even now though, I feel the anger of the forest subsiding as the Twisted Heart's influence fades. Soon some measure of peace shall return here, I think.\
\
'Ta-rum! My thanks to you, little one. Your aid was most welcome. Please forgive my rudeness when first we met.","The Ent Longbough believes that some evil power may be twisting the wood to dark ends.","The Twisted Heart -- Redux","Longbough is at the Eavespires, on the north-west shore of Lake Evendim.\
\
Handarod has asked you to speak with the Ent Longbough and assist him against the Wood-trolls of Evendim.","Talk to Longbough"}},
[13243]={nameES="Las dos posadas",objectivesES={"Le das a Cebadilla algunas monedas de parte de Bingo y las acepta gentilmente.\
\
'Oh, muchas gracias, es muy generoso de vuestra parte. Es un honor y un placer servir a gente tan amable como el señor Bingo y usted, y el señor Buenavista es un parroquiano habitual, por supuesto. Vuestro grupo ha sido muy agradable. A veces necesito bajar a la gente que se sube a las mesas a bailar, pateando la vajilla por todas partes, ¡pero ustedes han sido unos clientes excelentes!'","Bingo está dentro de la poco acogedora sala común de la Posada Abandonada, en las Tierras Solitarias.","Habla con Cebadilla Mantecona dentro del Poney Pisador","Bree está al este del camino desde Norburgo.\
\
Bingo está listo para continuar su viaje, y quiere caminar contigo hasta la puerta oeste de Bree.","Quizás a Cebadilla le vendrían bien unas monedas más, después de todo","Viaja a la Posada Abandonada, en las Tierras Solitarias","Bingo y tú habéis sido invitados a uniros a la fiesta en el Poney Pisador. Deberías hablar con su propietario, Cebadilla Mantecona.","La siguiente etapa del viaje de Bingo le lleva a Bree, donde los hobbits y la Gente Grande viven juntos en la colina de Bree.","Cebadilla Mantecona está en el Poney Pisador, y tus recientes hazañas de baile te han convencido de que quizá merece unas cuantas más de las monedas de Bingo.","Lleva unas cuantas monedas más de Bingo a Cebadilla","La Posada Abandonada está en las Tierras Solitarias, al este de Bree.\
\
Bingo ha decidido que sería lo mejor continuar su viaje antes de pasar más tiempo de fiesta en el Poney Pisador.","Las dos posadas","Habla con Bingo en la Posada Abandonada","Encuentra a Bingo en algún lugar del exterior del Poney Pisador","El interior de esta posada es oscuro, silencioso y poco acogedor","Bingo está disfrutando de su estancia en la sala común del Poney Pisador.","Habla con Bingo en el Poney Pisador","Bingo te da su monedero para que puedas pagar a Cebadilla","Bingo te ha invitado a comer, beber y cantar en la sala común del Poney Pisador.","Viaja a la Puerta Oeste de Bree","Milo Buenavista busca llamar tu atención en el Poney Pisador.","Milo Buenavista está esperando para hablar contigo en el Poney Pisador.","Lleva el monedero de Bingo a Cebadilla Mantecona","Milo te ha dicho que Bingo ha salido fuera para tomar un poco el aire, y podría estar durmiendo en uno de los fardos de heno en los establos cerca del Poney Pisador.","Habla con Milo Buenavista en la Puerta Oeste de Bree","Cebadilla Mantecona es el propietario del Poney Pisador, y Bingo te ha dado su monedero para asegurar que su hospitalidad sea bien recompensada.","Bingo ha hecho un nuevo amigo en la Puerta Oeste de Bree.","Bingo y Milo se sienten como en casa en la sala común del Poney Pisador.","Bingo lo está pasando de maravilla en la sala común del Poney Pisador.","Súbete a la mesa y <rgb=#FF0000>baila</rgb>","Habla con Milo Buenavista en el Poney Pisador","Milo Buenavista está en la puerta oeste de Bree.\
\
Bingo ha hecho un nuevo amigo, un hobbit de Bree llamado Milo Buenavista, y deberías hablar con él.","Habla con Bingo en la Puerta Oeste de Bree","Has llegado a la Puerta Oeste y Bingo ya ha hecho un nuevo amigo"}},
[13244]={nameES="The Ufúrzrak Undone",objectivesES={"The Haban'akkâ of Thráin will be victorious!","Raise a banner of the Haban'akkâ of Thráin at Muru Azog","Before Nud-mekhem, the old East-gate of Khazad-dûm, Azog's clan, the Ufúrzrak, dwell to defend their would-be realm from the Haban'akkâ of Thráin.","The Ufúrzrak Undone","You have done much to hinder the Ufúrzrak at Muru Azog.\
\
You should raise a banner of the Haban'akkâ of Thráin at Muru Azog.","Orcs, thrug-hai, and banners of the Ufúrzrak clan can be found at Muru Azog.\
\
King Thráin has commanded you to join in the assault at Muru Azog. You should aid the Haban'akkâ of Thráin."}},
[13245]={nameES="The Ultimatum to Guard-captain Thurferth",objectivesES={"The wealthy merchant Gifemund has determined that he feels Thurferth is a direct threat to his designs for the seat of Woodhurst. A confrontation is imminent.","Bring the letter to Herubrand","Herubrand is in the cellar of the farmhouse.\
\
Herubrand would probably like to see the letter Gifemund prepared for Thurferth.","Bring the letter to Guard-captain Thurferth","Guard-captain Thurferth is near the fountain around the centre of Woodhurst.\
\
You should bring the letter to Guard-captain Thurferth.","The Ultimatum to Guard-captain Thurferth"}},
[13246]={nameES="The Underbelly of Deceit",objectivesES={"The briber in Lake-town has accidentally left a trail of coins behind him.\
\
You should follow the trail of coins to catch the briber.","Someone has been posting notices in Lake-town, making false claims such as those about Dagrun's bloodline.","Put a stop to the slanderous gossip in Lake-town.","The briber flees but tears his gold pouch in the process!","Utûkel can be found in Lake-town's underbelly.\
\
You should defeat the one behind the slanderous gossip in Lake-town.","Find the briber","The briber was taking orders from an Easterling!","A pile of rust, just like the one you found in Esgaroth-of-old!","Follow the trail of coins","You notice something nearby the defeated Easterling","You should examine what you noticed lying near the defeated Easterling, Utûkel, in Lake-town's underbelly.","The coins mark a clear enough path!","Someone in Lake-town is bribing people to spread rumours. You should find the briber.","Confront the briber","You have defeated Utûkel and put a stop to the slanderous gossip in Lake-town. Seeing the same pile of rust in both Esgaroth-of-old and the underbelly of Lake-town has made you wonder if there is some connexion between the two groups of evil men operating in the Dale-lands. It would seem this Akshir, whoever he is, may be behind it all!","Examine the thing","Discrediting notices can be found around Lake-town.\
\
You should find and remove any slanderous notices that you come across.","The Underbelly of Deceit","Suspicious characters can be found around Lake-town.\
\
You should find suspicious characters in Lake-town who look to be putting up the slanderous notices.","Completado","Defeat Utûkel"}},
[13247]={nameES="The Underground Harvest",objectivesES={"Bring the mushrooms to the rations chest","The Underground Harvest","Mushrooms can be found within the cisterns.\
\
You should collect mushrooms for Rathon.","Rathon can be found outside the cistern entrance on the Fourth Circle of Minas Tirith.\
\
You should speak with Rathon.","Speak with Rathon","Rathon has been tasked with maintaining many of the cisterns in Minas Tirith by himself but continues to work towards helping his fellow Gondorians where he can.","The Foodmongers' Fellow-hall on the First Circle of Minas Tirith.\
\
You should bring the mushrooms to a rations chest outside of the Foodmongers' Fellow-hall."}},
[13248]={nameES="El sendero inexplorado",objectivesES={"Bilbo Bolsón ha terminado su libro y desea asegurarse de que sus recuerdos sobre los lugares y sucesos importantes sean correctos.","Habla con Bilbo Bolsón","Bilbo Bolsón está en el Salón del Fuego en la Última Morada de Rivendel, al sur de la Ciudad de los Trasgos.\
\
Encontraste la cueva de Gollum en las profundidades de la Ciudad de los Trasgos y descubriste una choza improvisada en una isla en el lago. Una vez allí, escribiste lo que viste. Ahora debes regresar con Bilbo Bolsón.","La cueva de Gollum está en lo profundo de los túneles de la Ciudad de los Trasgos, más allá del salón central.\
\
Bilbo Bolsón te entregó materiales de escritura y te envió a encontrar la cueva de Gollum, con la instrucción de verificar los detalles que ha escrito en su libro sobre ese lugar.","El sendero inexplorado","Has completado la descripción que Bilbo te pidió","Has encontrado la cueva de Gollum","Escribe una descripción de la cueva de Gollumn con el material de escritura de Bilbo"}},
[13249]={nameES="The Undying Beast",objectivesES={"Fara can be found in Hultvís.\
\
You have slain Drokstaz the Undying and should now return to Fara.","Haunted by a massive warg that slew her husband at Avabárg, Fara seeks to put an end to the demon-beast that lurks in the old keep of the North-men.","Bathed in shadow, an enormous warg rushes forth!","The Undying Beast","Find and defeat Drokstaz the Undying in Avabárg","Drokstaz the Undying can be found somewhere in the depths of Avabárg.\
\
Desperate to avenge her husband, Fara has begged you to defeat the terrible warg known as Drokstaz the Undying.","As the beast falls defeated, the sunken chambers of Avabárg seem to darken...","Talk to Fara"}},
[13250]={nameES="The Unfortunate Trainers",objectivesES={"Search the corpse for additional information","Talk to Prince Ingór","Upon the Angmarim corpse you find a short missive:\
\
'Devoted servants of the Crown,\
\
A rift with Gorgar has become clear. The Azhorn under Orc control are lost to us. Go to Khorroz through the secret path and subdue more beasts for our purpose. Through our will, our new Azhorn will serve only the Iron Crown.\
\
You have your orders.'\
\
The missive is unsigned.\
\
It would seem the Angmarim sent here failed their objective. You decide to make sure the Angmarim are unable to learn of the whereabouts of these slain servants.","Dead Angmarim can be found at Khorroz in Máttugard.\
\
You should burn the Angmarim corpses at Khorroz.","Voices of Men can be heard coming from the back of Khorroz!","The dead Angmarim can be found at Khorroz in Máttugard.\
\
You should search the corpse for additional information as to the Angmarim's presence here.","Angmarim have captured many cave-beasts with the purpose of training them to become deadly Azhorn.","The Angmarim supply of beasts to train into Azhorn had run low","The body of a recently mauled Angmarim can be found in the far depths of Khorroz. The Angmarim was indeed killed by one of the cave-beasts lurking in this passage. Why an Angmarim was here at all is a question that will need answering, however. Perhaps there is some additional information to be found on this corpse.","Prince Ingór can be found at Maergrind and Lóssi can be found at Imrêkh-guthlu.\
\
You should talk to Prince Ingór or Lóssi.","Voices can be heard at Khorroz in Máttugard.\
\
You should investigate the voices heard in Khorroz.","Investigate the voices heard in Khorroz","The Unfortunate Trainers","Iron Crown Sentinels can be found at Khorroz in Máttugard.\
\
You should defeat the Iron Crown Sentinels and destroy any evidence of your deeds.","You explain to Prince Ingór about the Angmarim you found at Khorroz.\
\
'I thank you for this information. If the war has indeed divided the Orcs and Angmarim further, our success in Gundabad may come sooner than we initially planned!'","More Angmarim!","Talk to Lóssi"}},
[13251]={nameES="The Unlocking Trade",objectivesES={"You hear approaching footsteps","The third door to test is to the north-east of Dâr Laja, the Meeting-hall, and is the entrance to a palatial manor within the Upper Ward.","Yamin is at the Grand Market in the Upper Ward.","The lock remains true, and the door does not open","Bring the rocks and crocodile teeth to Kîflu at the Shoreward Stone","The second door to test is to the north-east of the Grand Market, within the walls of an enclosed estate in the Upper Ward.","The lock remains steadfast, and the door stays shut","You hear approaching footsteps.","The lock rattles loosely, and feels close to breaking free of the door","Test the lock on the door to the north-east of the Grand Market, in the yard of an enclosed estate","Talk to Khôltekh at the Shoreward Stone","Khôltekh walks away, chuckling to himself","A familiar-looking dwarf of the Temámir rounds the corner","Rocks with shiny flakes and crocodiles with sharp teeth can be found near Bâlakhat, outside the city and along the south-eastern shore.","Khôltekh nods to you in greeting, summoning you to speak with him outside the Shoreward Stone.","Test the lock on the door to the north-east of the Grand Market, by the Stable-master","Kîflu can be found at the Shoreward Stone, waiting to accept delivery of the items you collected for Yamin.","Talk to Yamin by the Grand Market in the Upper Ward","Yamin has had work piling up ever since his last apprentice left, and he would like you to help him with some of it.","The Unlocking Trade","Test the lock on the door to the palatial manor north-east of Dâr Laja","The first door to test is to the north-east of the Grand Market, by the Stable-master in the Upper Ward.","Khôltekh regards you silently.\
\
'It is very important to have a lock on your door, my friend. Does it not warm your heart to know you are safe and secure in your own bed, behind strong walls? It is the pride of the Temámir to aid our local locksmiths and key-makers by supplying the molds with which they fashion all such devices. It is the least we can do.'\
\
You ask Khôltekh if this means the Temámir know how to open all of the locks that are made in the city, and he smiles broadly.\
\
'I like you, friend. You amuse me.'","Talk to Yamin in the Grand Market of the Upper Ward","The dwarf sizes you up in silence. When you present the items you have brought, his expression changes completely.\
\
'Our key-making friend has another request? Ah! I see you have some crocodile teeth! I will make certain he gets the supplies that he needs!\
\
'It is good that he continues to honour our deal.'"}},
[13252]={nameES="El aventurero desafortunado",objectivesES={"Encuentra el campamento de Reginard en la ciénaga","Examina las huellas","Los trasgos podrían haber capturado a Reginard y haberlo llevado a Lhúngobel.\
\
Intenta encontrarlo allí.","La mayoría de estas pisadas deben haber sido hechas por trasgos, pero un par podría pertenecer a un hobbit. No encuentras signos de resistencia.\
\
Quizá sería mejor continuar tu investigación en Lhúngobel al norte.","El hobbit se debate desesperadamente para liberarse de sus ataduras","Los trasgos tienen a Reginard cautivo en Lhúngobel.\
\
Habla con él.","Habla con Reginard","El hobbit Reginard ha desaparecido.\
\
Podrías encontrar pistas de su paradero en su campamento en la ciénaga al oeste de Campotieso.","Reginard no está por ninguna parte, pero ves huellas en el barro...","Has encontrado el campamento de Reginard, pero no a él.\
\
Examina las huellas en el campamento.","Un hobbit llamado Reginard se marchó de Campotieso y no ha vuelto. ¿Dónde ha ido?","El aventurero desafortunado","Encuentra a Reginard en Lhúngobel"}},
[13253]={nameES="The Unnatural Pact",objectivesES={}},
[13254]={nameES="The Unruly Stallion",objectivesES={"The steed seems drawn to this rock formation. Why have you been guided here?","Adnoth, the stable-hand, has asked you to help him with an unruly horse that has recently come into his stable.","Your mount is pulling you onwards towards the rock cluster, further to the north","The unruly horse is waiting at the Elthengels stable in the Norcrofts.\
\
The stable-hand, Adnoth, has asked you to take the unruly horse for a ride, in the hopes that it might relax and slowly become more amenable to handling.","Return to Adnoth and talk to him about your discovery","The steed seems determined to head towards the cluster of trees north along the cliff wall","You uncover what can only be the steed's former owner. Upon this discovery, the steed seems at ease","Mount the unruly steed and ride until it calms down","Elthengels' stable-hand, Adnoth, is awaiting your return at the stables near the south-west entrance to Elthengels.\
\
The unruly steed led you to discover the body of its former owner. It has since become calmer, and the stablemaster must be informed of this development.","The steed appears to be eagerly guiding you towards the nearby gate out of Elthengels","The Unruly Stallion"}},
[13255]={nameES="The Untamed Wilds",objectivesES={"Talk to Vaskorn","Talk to Vaskorn in Limlók","The Untamed Wilds","Runerik Knotbeard can be found in Limlók.\
\
You should talk to Runerik Knotbeard.","Patrol the wilds west of the river","Patrol the wilds near the White Mare","The raiding party is still nowhere to be found","Vaskorn has asked you to patrol the wilds north of Limlók.\
\
You should patrol the wilds north of the White Mare.","All is clear","Vaskorn can be found in Limlók.\
\
You should talk to Vaskorn.","Vaskorn has asked you to patrol the wilds north of Limlók.\
\
You should patrol the wilds near the White Mare.","Vaskorn can be found in the north wilds of the Floodfells.\
\
You should talk to Vaskorn.","Patrol the wilds north of the White Mare","Talk to Runerik Knotbeard in Limlók","Vaskorn has asked you to patrol the wilds north of Limlók.\
\
You should patrol the wilds west of the river.","Runerik Knotbeard fears an assault upon Limlók may be imminent.","Talk to Vaskorn at Limlók","There are no signs of a raiding party"}},
[13256]={nameES="The Untended Wood",objectivesES={"The Untended Wood","Wood-trolls and Huorns can be found to the south, east, and west of Stonecliff.\
\
Tithenolf wants you to defeat corrupted Wood-trolls and Huorns of the Balewood and examine their remains in hopes of understanding what has driven them to such aggression.","Tithenolf wants you to discover what is causing the Wood-trolls and Huorns of the Balewood to become so aggressive.","Talk to Tithenolf","Tithenolf can be found in northern Balewood at Stonecliff near the path to the Limlight Gorge.\
\
You should return to Tithenolf with news of the unnatural chill surrounding the Wood-trolls and Huorns of the Balewood."}},
[13257]={nameES="The Unwelcome Guest",objectivesES={"Find a set of footprints on the western shore of the lake, north-west of the eyot","You find a set of deep footprints at the base of the rock","The footprints appear to have been made by someone not wearing shoes","The Unwelcome Guest","You find a set of shallow footprints in the mud","There may be footprints on the far side of the lake, and there certainly are avanc.\
\
Wynfor wants you to look for footprints on the far side of the lake in Tâl Methedras. He also wants you to slay avanc and bring him their jaws.","Wynfor is at Tûr Morva, in Tâl Methedras.\
\
You have scouted the far shore of the lake for footprints and have also collected the jaws of the avanc that live there. You should bring them to Wynfor as he requested.","Bring avanc-jaws to Wynfor","Find a set of footprints beneath the rocky cliffs west of the western shore","Wynfor has seen someone sneaking around the far shore of the lake in Tâl Methedras and wants you to investigate."}},
[13258]={nameES="The Unyielding and the Overwhelming",objectivesES={}},
[13259]={nameES="The Ushkútoz Trenches",objectivesES={}},
[13260]={nameES="The Vale Left Behind",objectivesES={"Deliver word of King Elessar's gratitude to the people of Sardol","Talk to Malthellam in Morlad","After learning that King Elessar will not visit the Blackroot Vale, many of its people believe they have been cast aside and forgotten, left only to mourn those they lost in the War of the Ring.","Deliver word of King Elessar's gratitude to the people of Alagrant","Deliver word of King Elessar's gratitude to the people of Tingobel","Deliver word of King Elessar's gratitude to the people of Lancrath","Alagrant can be found to the south of Morlad, Tingobel can be found to the east of Morlad, Sardol can be found far to the south-west of Morlad near Tarlang's Crown, and Lancrath can be found far to the south-east of Morlad near Tarlang's Neck, in the Blackroot Vale.\
\
Malthellam has asked you to deliver word of King Elessar's gratitude to the people of the Blackroot Vale. You should travel to the hamlets of Alagrant, Tingobel, Sardol, and Lancrath.","Malthellam can be found outside his home in Morlad, in the Blackroot Vale.","The Vale Left Behind"}},
[13261]={nameES="El Valle de Andrath",objectivesES={"El Valle de Andrath","El campamento de los bandidos se encuentra en el extremo sur del Valle de Andrath, al sur del Camino Verde, muy lejos de El Cruce del Camino Verde. Los hombres de Grimbriar, los vigilantes Hojafrágil y Robledales, estarán escondidos en algún lugar cercano.\
\
El jefe de vigilancia Grimbriar ha sabido que los hombres de Zarquino y sus aliados semiorcos han bloqueado el Valle de Andrath. Te ha pedido que viajes hacia el sur para apoyar a sus hombres.","Los hombres de Zarquino y sus aliados semiorcos del sur han bloqueado el Valle de Andrath, impidiendo el comercio con las naciones del sur.","Encuentra a los exploradores de Grimbriar"}},
[13262]={nameES="The Valley of Locked Doors",objectivesES={}},
[13263]={nameES="The Valorous",objectivesES={}},
[13264]={nameES="El valor de la alimaña",objectivesES={"Malenhad, el vil pantano de azufre de Angmar, está lleno de criaturas viles y repugnantes, pero incluso las más extrañas de estas criaturas tiene sus usos para los Montaraces de Angmar.","Los merodeadores de pantano y las moscas de pantano se pueden encontrar por todo el pantano cerca del campamento de los cazadores.\
\
Othran te ha pedido que recolectes patas de merodeador de pantano y alas de mosca de pantano, que su gente utiliza para su beneficio.","El valor de la alimaña","Lleva los trofeos a Othran"}},
[13265]={nameES="The Value of an Estuarine Crocodile",objectivesES={"The Value of an Estuarine Crocodile","Speak with the engraver Dorshet","Tevurin asked that you visit the three expert assistants to learn about the crocodiles and other creatures that make the beaches of the Cape of Umbar their home. When you have learned what the experts know, you are to return to Tevurin so that he can provide you further direction.","Speak with the outfitter Karbah","Speak with the cook Zerkho","You spoke with the visiting specialists from Umbar Baharbêl. Return to Tevurin and tell her that you are prepared for her requests.","You visited Tevurin, the shore hunter, and were instructed to speak with his assistants to learn more about the fauna that make the shoreline of the eastern Umbar Cape their home."}},
[13266]={nameES="The Vanguard Defilers",objectivesES={"The enemy has brought totems of destruction to Helm's Deep. They must be stopped before they are able to cause destruction to all upon the wall.","A powerful White Hand defiler, Dagrí, has ordered his followers to place vile totems atop the wall. These totems are meant to bring destruction and cause widespread damage to the defenders still standing on the wall. \
\
Merit Rating\
\
This quest starts with <rgb=#FFFF00>Full</rgb> Merit Rating.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Major Merit Loss:</rgb>\
- White-hand Totem planted on the wall\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Moderate Merit Loss:</rgb>\
- White-hand Totem spews its foul energy","The Vanguard Defilers","You have allowed the wall to be overwhelmed with totem spew"}},
[13267]={nameES="The Vanguard Defilers",objectivesES={"Dagrí is fleeing from the battle","Do not allow Dagrí enough time to escape from the wall","The Orc defiler Dagrí has brought his totems of destruction to Helm's Deep. He must be stopped before he is able to cause destruction to all upon the wall and defeated before he can flee from the battlefield.","Defeat the Orc Defiler, Dagrí","A powerful White Hand defiler, Dagrí, has lead his followers onto the centre wall section at Helm's Deep. Dagrí means to use his totems of destruction and his defiler allies to cause widespread damage to the defenders still standing on the wall. If enough time passes, Dagrí will attempt to flee from the chaos upon the wall.\
\
Merit Rating\
\
This quest starts with <rgb=#FFFF00>Full</rgb> Merit Rating.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Major Merit Loss:</rgb>\
* Elemental Totem Explodes","The Vanguard Defilers"}},
[13268]={nameES="The Variag Variable",objectivesES={}},
[13269]={nameES="La amenaza velada",objectivesES={"Wilimar Bolger se encuentra cerca de su agujero en el lado noroeste de Bolgovado.\
\
En la zona que Wilimar Bolger te pidió buscar, encontraste un campamento abandonado y un diario. Quizás este diario contenga información útil para Wilimar. Deberías llevárselo.","Cuando Wilimar Bolger se despertó esta mañana, encontró una flecha amenazante clavada en la puerta de su casa. La punta de la flecha era de fabricación hobbit, aunque muy antigua, mientras que el asta parecía hecha por Hombres.","Lleva el diario a Wilimar Bolger","Diario recogido","Recoge el diario","La amenaza velada","La flecha vino de la zona cerca de la puerta del seto que lleva a los Campos del Puente, al norte de la casa de Wilimar Bolger.\
\
Wilimar Bolger te ha pedido que busques en el lugar de donde cree que vino la flecha, con la esperanza de encontrar alguna señal de la persona que la disparó y lo que podría significar.","Busca al norte de la casa de Wilimar Bolger","Ves un diario en el suelo"}},
[13270]={nameES="La Vigilia",objectivesES={"Derrota a Vance Waithman","Habla con Himloc Grouse en Entibo","Vance Waithman derrotado","Himloc Grouse está seguro de que los bandidos Montebruno que han estado robando su cultivo de hierba para pipa no se rendirán simplemente porque recuperaste parte de él.","La Vigilia","Himloc Grouse está en la plaza del pueblo de Entibo.\
\
Himloc estará complacido de saber que has impedido que los Montebruno roben más de su hierba para pipa.","El campo de hierba para pipa de Himloc Grouse está en la colina sobre la casa de Eldo Swatmidge, al este de Entibo.\
\
Himloc está seguro de que los bandidos Montebruno seguirán robando su cultivo de hierba para pipa a menos que puedas derrotarlos mientras lo intentan. Himloc cree que puedes encargarte de estos ladrones en soledad y te aconsejó que los busques en su campo, pero ten cuidado con el líder."}},
[13271]={nameES="El Comité de Vigilancia",objectivesES={"El Comité de Vigilancia","Bamfurlargo, la granja de Maggot, está al sur por el camino del río, en la Marjala.\
\
Mat Harfoot te ha pedido que busques a Violeta Sotomonte y te ha sugerido que hables primero con el viejo granjero Maggot.","Mat Harfoot te dijo que uno de los miembros de su \\qComité de Vigilancia\\q, Violeta Sotomonte, ha desaparecido."}},
[13272]={nameES="Los infectados viles",objectivesES={"Los Gusanos pueden encontrarse en la Sala Decimosexta, al noreste del Refugio Sombrío.\
\
Ymar parece verse afectado de forma diferente a todos los demás que vigilan el Refugio Sombrío. Está atormentado por visiones de gusanos y desea que los mates mientras te encuentres en la Sala Decimosexta.","La Sala Decimosexta es una zona infestada de orcos, muchos de los cuales padecen una terrible enfermedad que provoca crecimientos similares a hongos en sus cuerpos.\
\
Mallas, un elfo aliado de los enanos, cree que hay algo oculto bajo la Sala Decimosexta y desea descubrir el verdadero propósito y el origen de la plaga.","Ymar se encuentra en el Refugio Sombrío, al suroeste de la Sala Decimosexta.\
\
Has matado a muchos, muchísimos gusanos viles y deberías informar a Ymar de que la amenaza pesadillesca ha pasado.","Regresa con Ymar en el Refugio Sombrío","Los infectados viles"}},
[13273]={nameES="The Vilest Offender",objectivesES={}},
[13274]={nameES="The Village Burns",objectivesES={"Throw water on the fire at the north-east edge of town","Another fire burns at the north-east corner of Lhan Tarren. The bucket can be found by the river that runs near the town.\
\
You should throw water on the fire at the flaming hut at the north-east edge of the village.","Lhan Tarren burns! The servants of the White Hand did not take kindly to the Elder's refusal, and their vengeance has been frightfully swift and cruel.","As Lhan Tarren burns, the river still flows with quelling water astride the village. The flames are beginning to spread....\
\
You should search the banks of the river for a way to carry water to the fires, starting with the nearest fire at the tree by the bridge.","Use the bucket to douse the fire at the Elder's hut","Guto can be found in Lhan Tarren, mourning the loss of his grandfather the Elder.\
\
You should return to Guto in Lhan Tarren.","Return to Guto","Another fire burns in the middle of Lhan Tarren. The bucket can be found by the river that runs near the town.\
\
You should throw water on the fire at the flaming hut in the middle of the village.","Throw water on the fire at the hut in the middle of town","Use the bucket to throw water on the flaming tree","You have dampened the flames","Another fire burns at the Elder's hut. The bucket can be found by the river that runs near the town.\
\
You should throw water on the fire at the flaming hut where the Elder once stood.","The Village Burns"}},
[13275]={nameES="El Vino de la Guerra",objectivesES={"El Vino de la Guerra","Bruicheron espera que su querido amigo Belvagor deje la lucha contra los Orcos a otros y en su lugar comparta una visita relajante con ella.","Bruicheron está en Telain Glorelloth, en Caras Galadhon.\
\
Belvagor ha decidido que su deber requiere que permanezca de guardia contra los Orcos por el momento, y lamentablemente no puede unirse a Bruicheron para un día de descanso. Debes regresar con las noticias a Bruicheron.","El vinatero Glasnír está fuera de los Viñedos de Lórien, al sureste de Caras Galadhon.\
\
Bruicheron te ha pedido que recuperes un vino especial del vinatero y se lo lleves a su amado Belvagor, con la solicitud de que se una a ella para un día de descanso.","Lleva el vino especial a Bruicheron","Belvagor está custodiando las puertas de Caras Galadhon.\
\
Glasnír te ha dado el vino especial solicitado por Bruicheron, y ahora deberías entregárselo a Belvagor.","Habla con Glasnír en los Viñedos de Lórien","Lleva el vino a Belvagor en la entrada de Caras Galadhon"}},
[13276]={nameES="The Visage of Mam Murgwid",objectivesES={"The Visage of Mam Murgwid","You have destroyed many spider totems in Cadar Skûs.\
\
You should talk to Legolas.","Legolas has asked you to destroy the Ungoladan totems in Cadar Skûs.","Habla con Legolas.","Legolas has asked you to destroy spider totems in Cadar Skûs, for fear they may be conduits for foul magic."}},
[13277]={nameES="La Voz en el Aire",objectivesES={"Idhremmin ha escuchado una voz extraña proveniente de los Campos de Fornost, y has decidido investigar.","Idhremmin está en el Campamento de Mincham en las Quebradas del Norte, en el extremo suroeste de los Campos de Fornost.\
\
Deberías consultar con Idhremmin sobre lo que escuchaste.","Medita para escuchar cualquier sonido extraño","Idhremmin se encuentra en el Campamento de Mincham, en el borde de los Campos de Fornost.\
\
Deberías regresar con Idhremmin al Campamento de Mincham.","Idhremmin mira más allá de ti, sus ojos recorren los campos lúgubres","La canción provenía del noroeste del Campamento de Mincham, en los Campos de Fornost.\
\
Deberías buscar la fuente de la extraña canción.","Regresa con Idhremmin","Idhremmin está en el Campamento de Mincham en las Quebradas del Norte, en el extremo suroeste de los Campos de Fornost.\
\
Deberías esperar y escuchar señales de lo que ha captado la atención de Idhremmin durante tanto tiempo.","Dile a Idhremmin que escuchaste la voz escalofriante en el aire","Idhremmin está en el Campamento de Mincham en las Quebradas del Norte, en el extremo suroeste de los Campos de Fornost.\
\
Deberías <rgb=#FF0000>meditar</rgb> y escuchar señales de lo que ha captado la atención de Idhremmin durante tanto tiempo.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión requiere gestos. Escribe el comando '/meditate' y presiona enter.</rgb>","Le dices a Idhremmin que has escuchado la extraña voz, y te mira bruscamente. Sus palabras salen vacilantes, como si la Lengua Común le resultara extraña.\
\
'Escuchas la canción retorcida. Un gran mal yace más allá de la luz de este fuego. ¿Buscas la muerte? Si no, quédate y escucha desde lejos.'","De repente percibes, apenas, una canción lejana, fantasmal e inquietante","Pregunta a Idhremmin qué escucha en los Campos de Fornost","Has ahuyentado al espíritu maligno Olnathron de Idalene","<rgb=#FF0000>Medita</rgb> para escuchar cualquier sonido extraño","Le preguntas a Idhremmin qué escucha, pero no responde. Su expresión es levemente molesta, como si lo hubieras interrumpido en algo importante.","La Voz en el Aire","Idhremmin rompe su silencio para advertirte que no busques la voz","Idhremmin está en el Campamento de Mincham en las Quebradas del Norte, en el extremo suroeste de los Campos de Fornost.\
\
Deberías preguntarle a Idhremmin qué escucha.","Encuentra la fuente de la canción inquietante"}},
[13278]={nameES="The Voices of Fangorn",objectivesES={"The sapling bristles at your touch, noting it is fearful of what troubles Fangorn","The trees Quickbeam's Huorn wishes to find can be found to the south-east of Derndingle.\
\
Quickbeam's Huorn has expressed a desire to speak to the trees near his home, south of Derndingle.","The Huorn uproots itself and wanders about, clearly unwilling to be caught unawares","The enormous tree stands still as a cool breeze flows through its leaves","Quickbeam's Huorn takes a moment to stand nearby the enormous tree, and suddenly a breeze passes through their leaves. This breeze is not unlike the one you heard when Quickbeam spoke to his Huorn, but perhaps this is just a coincidence.\
\
After realizing you have been trying to get its attention, the Huorn returns to your side and appears ready to press onward.","<rgb=#FF00FF>Poke</rgb> a Fangorn sapling","Talk to Quickbeam's Huorn","The Voices of Fangorn","You have attempted to speak to each of the trees to which Quickbeam's Huorn directed you.","The trees of Fangorn have long laid silent, but with recent upheaval of the forest, they may once again have need to speak.","<rgb=#FF00FF>Hug</rgb> an enormous tree","As you approach the area where you found Quickbeam's Huorn sleeping, you realize the Huorn has become restless. Despite its queer behaviour, for once the Huorn seems clear in its intentions. It has begun wandering to various trees and seemingly attempting to speak with them. However, its fairly rapid darting between them suggests it has not been successful.\
\
Perhaps you can aid it in gaining the attention of the nearby flora and discern what brought distress to the Huorn.","DNT -- Players will not see","<rgb=#FF00FF>Cough</rgb> at a Fangorn tree"}},
[13279]={nameES="The Vow to Cair Andros",objectivesES={}},
[13280]={nameES="Las carretas de la guerra",objectivesES={"Tu misión es interceptar una caravana de carretas llenas de suministros y armas, derrotar a los soldados que la protegen y entregar la caravana a las fuerzas de Mizâdi.","Asegura la primera carreta","Dôlo de Ekhamâti derrotado","Tercera carreta asegurada","El dôlo de Ekhamâti ha llegado para defender la caravana. Encuéntralo y dérrotalo.","Asegura la cuarta carreta","Derrota al dôlo de Ekhamâti","Asegura la tercera carreta","Cuarta carreta asegurada","Las carretas de la guerra","Primera carreta asegurada","Asegura la segunda carreta","El dôlo de Ekhamâti ha llegado para defender la caravana.","Segunda carreta asegurada"}},
[13281]={nameES="La mujer que llora",objectivesES={"Habla con alguien que pueda conocer a la mujer elfa","Gurthern te ha sugerido que hables con los elfos acampados en Sírlond, al otro lado del río desde Caranost.\
\
Deberías buscar Sírlond en el centro de Cardolan.","La mujer que llora"}},
[13282]={nameES="The Wainriders of Dol Acharn",objectivesES={"The Wainriders of Dol Acharn","The Wainriders of Dol Acharn were not easily bested, but through your efforts, the Host of the West shall remain unknown to them.","You have defeated many of the Wainriders at Dol Acharn.","After suffering a crushing defeat in days long past, the Wainriders have returned to Dagorlad in force, and so too has their hatred for the Men of Gondor.","Completado","In the wake of turmoil within Mordor and the march of the Host of the West, the Wainriders that fell upon the battle plain have risen to stand against the Men of Gondor once again.\
\
They have not yet moved against the Host of the West, and to ensure that this remains so, you should confront them at Dol Acharn and draw their attention away from the Host.","The Wainriders can be found at Dol Achcarn in eastern Dagorlad.\
\
You have arrived at Dol Acharn and should now defeat the Wainriders to keep them from discovering the Host of the West."}},
[13283]={nameES="The Waiting List",objectivesES={"Maukatish can be found at Thorzhaf.\
\
You should speak with Maukatish.","Wait for a slot to open in the pit-fighting tournament","Complete A Small Task","Maukatish can be found in Thorzhaf.\
\
You should either complete a task for Maukatish or wait your turn to get your name added to the pit-fighting tournament.","The Waiting List","Talk to Párgrub","Párgrub can be found near Thorzhaf.\
\
You should speak with Párgrub.","An Uruk in charge of the list of fighters for the pit-fighting tournament has a system of rules and is hard to sway.","Talk to Maukatish","Perhaps you will be able to add your name to the tournament list now"}},
[13284]={nameES="The Walking Shadow",objectivesES={"Other than the Dead, it appears that nothing has disturbed the hill recently","Clearly not made by the circling Dead nearby, the footprints denote heavy boots of foreign make","The Stone of Erech stands untouched, but you notice curious footprints near its base","The path to the Stone of Erech lies upon the west path out of the southern end of Lancrath.\
\
Gúrion has asked you to search the Hill of Erech for any sign of the dark figure he spotted.","Examine the strange footprints near the base of the Stone","DNT -- will not be seen","Search the Stone of Erech for sign of the dark figure","The Walking Shadow","The Stone of Erech can be found atop the Hill of Erech in central Blackroot Vale.\
\
You have spotted something unusual near the base of the Stone of Erech and should examine it more closely.","Gúrion can be found in Lancrath in south-eastern Blackroot Vale.\
\
You have searched the hill, and found strange footprints in the shadow of the Stone of Erech. You should return to Gúrion with this news.","Your searches in Sardol and Lancrath align as Gúrion believes he is also pursuing the mysterious invader from Tarlang's Crown.","Search the Hill of Erech for sign of the dark figure","Talk to Gúrion","The Stone of Erech can be found atop the Hill of Erech in central Blackroot Vale.\
\
You have searched the path from Lancrath to the hill and found no evidence of the dark figure's passing. You should now search near the Stone of Erech."}},
[13285]={nameES="The Waning Beacon",objectivesES={"The beacon of Eilendoth is located south-west of Ethring in Ringló Vale.\
\
You should speak with Authest, the caretaker at Eilendoth.","Speak with Authest","The beacon of Eilendoth is located south-west of Ethring in Ringló Vale.\
\
Defeat spiders at Eilendoth.","The beacon's caretaker cowers from spiders that have infested the beacon","Climb the hill to the beacon of Eilendoth","The Waning Beacon","The beacon of Eilendoth is located south-west of Ethring in Ringló Vale.\
\
You should climb the hill to the beacon.","Borhador asks for you to tend to the beacon of Eilendoth."}},
[13286]={nameES="The Want-kin",objectivesES={"The Want-kin","Talk to Nagli Want-kin at Khadâsh-gâra","Nagli Want-kin can be found at Khadâsh-gâra.\
\
Nagli Want-kin and his companions would like to see you off from Khadâsh-gâra. You should talk to Nagli Want-kin.","Nagli Want-kin can be found at Khadâsh-gâra.\
\
Nagli Want-kin and most of his companions kindly bid you farewell at an unexpected party of sorts. You should talk to Nagli Want-kin.","Talk to Nagli Want-kin","Neither Longbeards, Zhélruka, nor Stout-axes, a company of clanless dwarves known only as the Want-kin have made camp in Elderslade."}},
[13287]={nameES="¡La expedición de guerra te necesita!",objectivesES={"Habla con Durin","Debes presentarte en Annâk-khurfu, en el Valle Ancestral. Los maestros de establos reclutadores de miniaventuras están a tu disposición para llevarte allí a toda prisa.\
\
Puedes encontrar maestros de establos reclutadores de miniaventuras en la Puerta de Thorin, Gondamon, la ciudad de Bree, la Sala Vigesimoprimera, Othrikar, Gabilshathûr, el Campamento de Glóin, Hrimbarg, Galtrev, el Mirador de la Gran Excavación, Magh Ashtu, Járnfast, Erebor y Minas Tirith (solsticio de verano).","Preséntate ante el príncipe Durin en la sala de guerra, en el nivel superior de Annâk-khurfu.","(Opcional) Preséntate ante un reclutador de la expedición de guerra","Entra en Annâk-khurfu, en el Valle Ancestral","Preséntate ante el comandante Glóin en la sala de guerra, en el nivel superior de Annâk-khurfu.","Habla con uno de los guardias en Annâk-khurfu para que te indique el camino.","Has llegado a Annâk-khurfu","Habla con Glóin","Habla con uno de los guardias en Annâk-khurfu","El príncipe Durin de los Barbiluengos ha declarado su intención de reconquistar Gundabad para los enanos. ¡Necesita a héroes como tú para ganar esta guerra!"}},
[13288]={nameES="The War Effort: A Great Leap (Weekly)",objectivesES={"Speak to Stálskeg Ironbeard to be given a small token of his esteem for your assistance.","The War Effort: A Great Leap (Weekly)","Stálskeg Ironbeard has requested your aid in securing a foothold outside of Gundabad for the Gabil'akkâ, the Unified Army of Dwarves. He has enlisted Hlóthi to gather several ongoing tasks that need to be completed throughout the area.","Talk to Stálskeg Ironbeard","Your assistance has truly assisted the Gabil'akkâ in its attempt to rescue our fallen homeland.","Stálskeg Ironbeard has requested your aid in securing a foothold outside of Gundabad for the Gabil'akkâ, the Unified Army of Dwarves.","Talked to Stálskeg Ironbeard"}},
[13289]={nameES="The War Effort: Missions for the Cause (Weekly)",objectivesES={"The War Effort: Missions for the Cause (Weekly)","Speak to Elóf","Seek out and push forward the war effort by completing 'The War Effort: Missions for the Cause' several times.","Seek out and speak to Elóf regarding your completion of several missions.","The Gabil'akkâ, the Unified Army of Dwarves, has requested your assistance in completing a series of missions on their behalf."}},
[13290]={nameES="The War Effort: Threats to the Battlefield",objectivesES={}},
[13291]={nameES="The War Nearly Won",objectivesES={"Habla con Hórin","Habla con Durin","Your contribution to the war effort has turned the tide in favour of the dwarves!","The dwarves wish to thank you for your hard work!\
\
You should talk to Ausma and Hórin in Annâk-khurfu.","Habla con Ausma","The War Nearly Won","Prince Durin wishes to reward you for your hard work.\
\
You should talk to Durin in Annâk-khurfu."}},
[13292]={nameES="The War of the Wine Shops",objectivesES={"Two wine shop owners suspect each other of dishonest business practices.","Read the manifest at The Full Belly in the Upper Ward","Akhmâra plans to confront her brother, Mutâz, at his shop.\
\
Go to The Drowned Prince in the Sail-haven of Umbar Baharbêl to witness the confrontation.","Mutâz said that Akhmâra is the one guilty of underhanded business practices and has asked you to investigate her.\
\
Search for clues around Akhmâra's shop, The Full Belly, in the Upper Ward of Umbar Baharbêl.","Talk to Mutâz at the Drowned Prince in the Sail-haven","Akhmâra asked you to investigate her business rival.\
\
His shop, The Drowned Prince, can be found in the Sail-haven of Umbar Baharbêl.","The War of the Wine Shops has reached a peaceful conclusion... for today, at least","Akhmâra storms off to confront her brother Mutâz","Read the manifest at The Drowned Prince in the Sail-haven","In familiar, chunky handwriting, you read the following:\
\
1 cask Mereham Rose 3014\
2 cask Bergraw White 3012\
1 casks Winbury Red 3013\
2 cask Iáphel Red 3014\
\
All goods paid for\
- Captain Nishak","In hasty, chunky handwriting, you read the following:\
\
1 cask Mereham Rose 3014\
1 cask Bergraw White 3012\
2 casks Winbury Red 3013\
1 cask Iáphel Red 3014\
\
All goods paid for\
- Captain Nishak","Talk to Akhmâra at The Full Belly in the Upper Ward","The War of the Wine Shops","There is nothing suspicious in The Drowned Prince's latest shipping manifest. Perhaps a conversation with its proprietor would yield some clues.\
\
The proprietor, Mutâz, can be found outside his shop in the Sail-haven of Umbar Baharbêl.","The Full Belly's import manifest looks shockingly similar to its rival's.\
\
Akhmâra can be found outside her wine shop, the Full Belly, in the Upper Ward of Umbar Baharbêl.","Talk to Akhmâra at The Drowned Prince in the Sail-haven"}},
[13293]={nameES="The Ward of Esteldín",objectivesES={"Scout Ost Crithlanc","Scout Dol Nendír","Dol Nendir lies to the south-west of Esteldín, in the North Downs.\
\
Handarod has asked you to scout the ruins of Dol Nendír.","Scouted Dol Nendír","Kar Lak lies in the hills well to the east of Esteldín, in the North Downs.\
\
Handarod has asked you to scout the Earth-kin village of Kar Lak.","Ost Crithlanc lies to the north-east of Esteldín, in the North Downs.\
\
Handarod has asked you to scout the Angmarim-outpost of Ost Crithlanc.","Scouted Kar Lak","The Ward of Esteldín","Scouted Ost Galumar","Scouted Ost Crithlanc","Scout Ost Galumar","Scout Kar Lak","Talk to Handarod","Handarod is concerned with the threatened safety of Esteldín.","Ost Galumar lies to the north-west of Esteldín, in the North Downs.\
\
Handarod has asked you to scout the ruins of Ost Galumar.","Handarod is at Esteldín in the North Downs.\
\
You should report to Handarod and tell him what you have seen during your patrol around Esteldín."}},
[13294]={nameES="The Warden of the Grove",objectivesES={"Shanthar has asked you to return to Agalûnu and tell her to leave Arwáth.","Shanthar of the Kintai is the ever-vigilant protector of Arwáth. It is his sworn duty to protect the trees of the grove.","Talk to Agalûnu","You bow to the stranger and introduce yourself as an Elf-friend.\
\
'It does not interest me that you are a friend of the Eldar. Will you prove a friend of the Kintai? We are not the Elves that you know. Shanthar is my name. Whether you have my friendship will depend greatly on why you have come here. Tell me.'\
\
You tell him of Agalûnu, whom you found injured by an arrow, and ask Shanthar if he was the one who shot her.\
\
'It was. I dislike taking such actions, but this woman is resilient. Most Men do not come here at all. Those who do usually leave once they meet one of the Väiri, one of my departed elders. This woman is unafraid. I tried many times to cause her enough distress that she would leave the wood, but none of my efforts had borne fruit. I could not stand by idle while she felled trees of Arwáth. So yes, I loosed an arrow upon her. But know this Elf-friend, had I wanted to slay her, slain she would be. I only want her to leave.\
\
'I am the warden of this grove, and it is my sworn duty to my elders that the trees of Arwáth be protected from harm. I will ask you to please return to this Agalûnu and ask her to leave me and the trees of Arwáth in peace.'","The Warden of the Grove"}},
[13295]={nameES="Los Guardianes de Annúminas",objectivesES={"Los Guardianes de Annúminas","Arohir de Esteldín te ha pedido que busques el campamento de Tinnudir, en la orilla oriental del Lago Evendim, y que allí hables con Cannuion.","Cannuion está en el campamento de los Montaraces en Tinnudir, en Evendim, al oeste de las Quebradas del Norte.\
\
Arohir te ha enviado a hablar con Cannuion en Evendim."}},
[13296]={nameES="El Huargo y el Maestro",objectivesES={"Rhovandis te pidió atraer y derrotar al Maestro de Huargos.","Usa el Estandarte de la Mano Blanca para desafiar al Maestro de Huargos.","El campamento está ubicado al noreste de Tham Celechir.\
\
Derrotar a los huargos invasores podría atraer al Maestro de Huargos fuera de su escondite.","Has derrotado a Kalugat, el maestro huargo.\
\
Debes regresar con Rhovandis en Idhobel y contarle tu éxito.","Habla con Rhovandis","El Huargo y el Maestro","Captura el Estandarte de la Mano Blanca para desafiar al Maestro de Huargos y hacer que salga de su escondite.\
\
El estandarte se encuentra en el campamento del Maestro de Huargos, ubicado al noreste de Tham Celechir."}},
[13297]={nameES="El Huargo de Bolgovado",objectivesES={"Laugfût se encuentra entre la manada de lobos en las ruinas al este de Bolgovado, más allá de la granja de Milo y Linda Bolger.\
\
Linda Bolger te envió a mostrar el collar a los Elfos en Casa del Bosque. Orthir reveló la identidad del lobo misterioso -- Laugfût, un Huargo de Angmar -- y te pidió que lo enfrentes y derrotes al jefe Huargo.","El Huargo de Bolgovado","Linda Bolger está en Bolgovado, en el camino más abajo de la colina.\
\
Orthir te dijo que hablaras con Linda Bolger después de haber derrotado a Laugfût. Linda estará complacida de saber que la amenaza del Huargo ha sido eliminada.","Orthir, el Elfo acampado sobre Casa del Bosque, reveló que el gran lobo era, en realidad, uno de los grandes y malvados Huargos de Angmar."}},
[13298]={nameES="Los fosos de huargos de Hîgropor",objectivesES={"Los huargos criados por trasgos ahora infestan Hîgropor, en lo profundo de Nan Wathren. Debes eliminar a los malvados huargos y destruir sus barriles de comida.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Se recomienda una Comunidad.</rgb>","Has derrotado a los huargos de Hîgropor, y te has asegurado de que no regresen al quemar sus fuentes de alimento.","Completado","Los huargos criados por trasgos ahora infestan Hîgropor, en lo profundo de Nan Wathren. Debes eliminar a los malvados huargos y destruir sus barriles de comida.","Se pueden encontrar huargos en Hîgropor, en el sureste de Nan Wathren.\
\
Debes derrotar a los huargos y destruir sus barriles de comida.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Se recomienda una Comunidad.</rgb>","Los fosos de huargos de Hîgropor","Derrota huargos en Hîgropor"}},
[13299]={nameES="The Warg-rider's Fang",objectivesES={}},
[13300]={nameES="Los jinetes de huargos",objectivesES={"Ayuda a Thithrand a reducir el número de jinetes de huargos en la Gran Escalera","Ayuda a Thithrand a derrotar al líder de los jinetes de huargos","La Gran Escalera se alzaba antaño al pie de un gran cruce de caminos dentro de Moria. En la época de esplendor de la gran ciudad, conducía a todas las zonas de las salas y era una maravilla majestuosa de contemplar. Ahora ha pasado a estar bajo el control de Igash, un lugarteniente de Mazog, el líder de los orcos de Moria. Igash ha reunido en un solo lugar a las fuerzas de orcos y trolls de Moria y ha recaudado tributos de cada uno para entregarlos algún día al líder de los orcos. Por ahora, cada tribu compite por ganarse el favor del lugarteniente, un seguidor fanático de Mazog.","Habla con Thithrand en la Guardia Orca","Thithrand se encuentra en la Guardia Orca, al suroeste de la Gran Escalera.\
\
Debes regresar con Thithrand y decirle que todas sus tareas relacionadas con los jinetes de huargos han sido completadas.","Los jinetes de huargos","Thithrand se encuentra en la Guardia Orca.\
\
Thithrand es responsable de vigilar y contener la amenaza que representan los jinetes de huargos en la Gran Escalera. Deberías ayudarlo completando las tareas que te encomiende."}},
[13301]={nameES="Los huargos de Hîgropor",objectivesES={"Los huargos de Hîgropor","Has derrotado a un buen número de huargos de Nan Wathren.","Completado","Los huargos de Hîgropor se encuentran en Nan Wathren, al sur de las Quebradas del Norte.\
\
Debes eliminar tantas de estas bestias corruptas como puedas, pues son malvadas.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Se recomienda una Pequeña Comunidad.</rgb>","Varios huargos, criados en Hîgropor, acechan ahora en los cañones de Nan Wathren.","Varios huargos, criados en Hîgropor, acechan ahora en los cañones de Nan Wathren.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Se recomienda una Pequeña Comunidad.</rgb>"}},
[13302]={nameES="The Wargs of the Wolf-denes",objectivesES={"Hertha, Keeper of the Pass, has asked you to clear out a pack of wargs that plague the road into the Beorning-lands.","Defeat Sháraha","Hertha can be found along the road to the High Pass in the Wolf-denes.\
\
You should talk to Hertha.","The Warg Clearing can be found north-west of Vegbár.\
\
You should defeat the wargs and their leader.","Talk to Hertha","Defeated Sháraha","The Wargs of the Wolf-denes"}},
[13303]={nameES="The Warriors of Dol Guldur",objectivesES={"Defeated Durkâr","Defeat Urcheron","The Warriors of Dol Guldur","Defeat Carchrien","Urcheron, Carchrien, and Durkâr in Sâd-en-Dagor in Dol Guldur, north-east of Helethir.\
\
Torist has asked you to slay Urcheron, Carchrien, and Durkâr, three champions of Dol Guldur.","Defeated Carchrien","Sâd-en-Dagor, the training-grounds of Dol Guldur, are overseen by three champions of the Lieutenant of Dol Guldur.","Talk to Torist at Helethir","Defeated Urcheron","Defeat Durkâr","Torist is at Helethir, south-west from Dol Guldur.\
\
You should return to Torist for your reward."}},
[13304]={nameES="The Wastes Endgame Allowance",objectivesES={}},
[13305]={nameES="The Watch of the Cross-roads",objectivesES={"Talk to Arodor","Faramir's Look-out is located south-east of Osgiliath.\
\
You should look at the Morgul Vale from Faramir's Look-out.","Speak with Mírthel","You see the glow of Mordor rising over the mountains, casting a dim light on the Morgul Vale","Faramir's Look-out is located south-east of Osgiliath.\
\
You should speak with Gladhir at Faramir's Look-out.","Faramir's Look-out is located south-east of Osgiliath.\
\
You should talk to Arodor at Faramir's Look-out about what you saw.","You see the rubble and ruins of a once great city, now occupied by The Morgul-host","Faramir's Look-out is located south-east of Osgiliath.\
\
You should talk to Mírthel at Faramir's Look-out about what you saw.","Faramir's Look-out is located south-east of Osgiliath.\
\
You should look at Osgiliath from Faramir's Look-out.","This is a good place to <rgb=#FF0000>look</rgb> at the Morgul Vale","Speak with Gladhir","<rgb=#FF0000>Look</rgb> at Osgiliath","This is a good place to <rgb=#FF0000>Look</rgb> at Osgiliath","<rgb=#FF0000>Look</rgb> towards the Morgul Vale","The Watch of the Cross-roads","Arodor asks you to survey the damage done by the Morgul-host."}},
[13306]={nameES="La vigilancia de la Comarca",objectivesES={"La vigilancia de la Comarca","Thornegil está en el cruce del Vado de Sarn, al sureste de la Comarca.","Andy Tejonera es el vendedor de casas en Cavada Grande y se puede encontrar al noroeste del Vado de Sarn, junto a los Campos de Cavada.","Cruza el río al noroeste del Vado de Sarn y habla con Andy Tejonera en la Comarca","Thornegil teme que el terrible mal que cruzó a la Comarca ponga en peligro a los hobbits, y quiere que los visites.","Habla con Thornegil en el Vado de Sarn"}},
[13307]={nameES="The Watcher of Ered Lithui",objectivesES={}},
[13308]={nameES="El Velador de la Determinación: Echando una Mano",objectivesES={"Derrota a Dientefisura","Dientefisura derrotado","El Velador de la Determinación: Echando una Mano","Muchos Juglares desean convertirse en Veladores de la Determinación, pero no todos pueden alcanzar sus metas por sí solos.","Skûmfil está al este de las Fundaciones de Piedra.\
\
Bassela te ha pedido ayudar a otro Juglar a completar su tarea final en Skûmfil.","Habla con Bassela","Bassela está justo afuera de Skûmfil, al este del Refugio Sombrío en las Fundaciones de Piedra.\
\
Con Dientefisura derrotado, debes regresar con Bassela con la noticia de tu éxito."}},
[13309]={nameES="The Water-wheels: To Stagnant Nalâ-dûm",objectivesES={"The Water-wheels: To Stagnant Nalâ-dûm","Investigate Nalâ-dûm for information","Nalâ-dûm is south of the Chamber of the Cross-roads, in the Water-works.\
\
Hrólfur wishes for you to investigate the ancient waterway of Nalâ-dûm and recover any lost information about the water-wheels that once fuelled Moria of old.","Hrólfur is in the Chamber of the Cross-roads, in Durin's Way.\
\
You should bring the ancient records you found to Hrólfur, who will be excited to find a ledger of records of the lore that was lost when Moria fell.","Haldir of Lórien has sent you to the aid of Hrólfur in Moria, a deed that may in turn provide some security for the Elves. Hrólfur and Haldir hope to see the legendary water-wheels of Nalâ-dûm functioning as they did long ago, in Durin's Day.","Bring the records to Hrólfur at the Chamber of the Cross-roads","Collected ancient records"}},
[13310]={nameES="The Way It Catches the Light, Part 1",objectivesES={"Khaltâg has asked you to find his wife's necklace. Investigate Sektakhâb, the area of Khabârkhad Khaltâg described.","You are close to the area Khaltâg described","Khaltâg has asked you to inform Pharida, his daughter, that her mother's necklace has been found. She can be found working in the Dûlkar, in Dil-irmíz.","Investigate Sektakhâb for Khaltâg's wife's necklace","Return to Mekab-kuphâr to give Khaltâg his wife's necklace","The Way It Catches the Light, Part 1","Find Khaltâg's daughter Pharida and share the good news","Find and pick up Khaltâg's necklace","Investigate Sektakhâb for Khaltâg's wife's necklace. Sektakhâb is located west of Mekab-kuphâr in Khabârkhad.","Search nearby for any sign of Khaltâg's wife's necklace.","The necklace feels ice-cold to the touch","Return to Mekab-kuphâr to give Khaltâg his wife's necklace."}},
[13311]={nameES="The Way It Catches the Light, Part 2",objectivesES={"Return to Khaltâg in Mekab-kuphâr and relay Pharida's message","Ask Muntâkh, the merchant, if he knows where Khaltâg went.","Ask Khaltâg why he came to Sektakhâb.","Return to Khaltâg in Mekab-kuphâr and relay Pharida's message.","Pharida, Khaltâg's daughter, has asked you to relay her concerns about the necklace to her father. Khaltâg is in Mekab-kuphâr, in Khabârkhad.","Investigate Sektakhâb for signs of Khaltâg.","Save Khaltâg from being torn apart by crypt-walkers!","The Way It Catches the Light, Part 2","Khaltâg has disappeared from where you last spoke","Investigate Sektakhâb for signs of Khaltâg","Ask Muntâkh if he knows where Khaltâg went","Ask Khaltâg why he came to Sektakhâb"}},
[13312]={nameES="The Way It Catches the Light, Part 3",objectivesES={"Throw the necklace into the Bay from the wharf past the harbour-warden's tower","Go to the Sail-haven. On the western docks past the Harbour-warden's tower there is a wharf jutting into the Bay. The deep waters of the Bay of Belfalas should hide the necklace for an age.","Aid Khaltâg","The necklace disappears from view, lost once more","Speak with Khaltâg.","The Way It Catches the Light, Part 3","Protect Khaltâg and fight off the crypt-walkers that have appeared!","Pick up the heavy necklace","Speak with Pharida in the Dûlkar in Dil-irmíz about the fate of her father.","Speak with Khaltâg","Pick up the heavy necklace.","Aid Khaltâg.","Speak with Pharida about the fate of her father","Khaltâg has run into Sektakhâb, claiming his wife is calling him to her. Help him if you can."}},
[13313]={nameES="The Way South",objectivesES={"You should take a stabled horse to the southern fortress of Rakhatâb. There you are to meet with the foreman, Nûrut. He has been told of your arrival and all the deeds you have done to assist the citizens of Jax Phanâl.","Speak with the stable-master and ride to Rakhatâb","The Way South","Khôltekh's emissary suggests that you have done enough for the citizens of Jax Phanâl and directs you to the stable-master to journey to Rakhatâb to the south.","Speak with Nûrut","Khôltekh's emissary directed you to the stable-master in Jax Phanâl to purchase a ride south along the road to Rakhatâb."}},
[13314]={nameES="El Camino de los Reyes",objectivesES={"El Camino de los Reyes","Ayuda a Nimbellas con \"La puerta este de Annúminas\"","Los montaraces del campamento del Camino de los Reyes necesitan ayuda para explorar los alrededores.","Los gobernantes de la gran ciudad de Annúminas están enterrados en el Camino de los Reyes.","Ayuda a Rodlam con \"Maldad de las profundidades\"","Ayuda a Maladan con \"Las llaves de las criptas\"","Habla con Nimbellas en el Camino de los Reyes","Nimbellas se alegrará de saber que el Camino de los Reyes ha sido explorado a fondo.","Ayuda a Maladan con \"Portales al pasado\"","Ayuda a Nethrandir con \"Saqueadores de la historia\""}},
[13315]={nameES="The Way of the Enemy",objectivesES={"Travel to the summit of Amon Dîn","Talk to Hutha in Taur Drúadan","Amon Dîn can be found far to the south-east of the War-stead of the King's Men.\
\
Hutha has asked you to travel to the summit of Amon Dîn and light the extinguished beacon.","Hutha can be found within the War-stead of the King's Men.\
\
Burnoth has asked you to speak with Hutha about his plan for crossing through the Enemy's blockade beneath Amon Dîn.","The Riders Three can be found at the Field of Onslaught.\
\
You have cleared a passage to the Pelennor Fields for the Riders Three and should now journey to their side.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Note: You must complete Book 5, Chapter 8 of Volume IV to advance this objective.</rgb>","Meet the Riders Three at the Field of Onslaught","Talk to Burnoth at the Field of Onslaught","The Way of the Enemy","A suitable torch can be found on the beacon at Amon Dîn.\
\
You have reached the summit of Amon Dîn and should now light the beacon to distract the Enemy's forces below.","As the pyre takes flame, your foes turn their attention to the newly-lit beacon","Light the beacon of Amon Dîn","Burnoth can be found somewhere on the Pelennor Fields.\
\
You have arrived at the Pelennor Fields and should now seek out the Riders Three.","If the Riders Three hope to rejoin their allies on the Pelennor Fields, they shall need to pass swiftly through the heart of the Enemy's forces in Taur Drúadan.","You have arrived at the summit of Amon Dîn and should now light the beacon!"}},
[13316]={nameES="The Way to the Glimmerdeep",objectivesES={}},
[13317]={nameES="The Wayward Bowman",objectivesES={"The carving can be found on a tree to the south-west of Alagrant, in the Blackroot Vale.\
\
Sarnir spied Egnir making a carving into a tree outside Alagrant. You should find the carving and examine it.","One of Lord Duinhir's most skilled bowmen, Egnir, has unexpectedly taken leave of his duties in Morlad.","Examine the defaced carving","Although the carving has been defaced by deep slashes, it still clearly reads: 'E+D'","Find the carving on a tree outside Alagrant","You see no sign of Egnir among the hunters of Alagrant...","Talk to Calennen","The defaced carving can be found on a tree to the south-west of Alagrant, in the Blackroot Vale.\
\
You have spotted the carving on a nearby tree outside Alagrant, but it has been defaced. You should examine it.","Find Egnir in Alagrant","The Wayward Bowman","Sarnir can be found in Alagrant, in the Blackroot Vale.\
\
You have found a carving reading 'E+D', but it is unclear why Egnir defaced it. You should return to Sarnir.","Calennen can be found in Alagrant, in the Blackroot Vale.\
\
Having found no sign of Egnir, you should talk to the hunters of Alagrant and learn if he passed through the hamlet on some errand. You should talk to Calennen.","You spot what appears to be a defaced carving on a nearby tree","Egnir can likely be found in Alagrant, in the Blackroot Vale.\
\
Uidor has asked you to find Egnir, one of Lord Duinhir's most skilled bowmen, after he took an unexpected leave of his duties in Morlad.","Sarnir can be found in Alagrant, in the Blackroot Vale.\
\
Calennen recalls that Egnir visited Alagrant, but left after a short time. He thinks Sarnir might know more about Egnir's whereabouts. You should talk to Sarnir.","Talk to Sarnir"}},
[13318]={nameES="El alce descarriado",objectivesES={"Encuentra al alce descarriado","El alce descarriado","El alce descarriado podría estar cerca, en las montañas al norte de Suri-kylä y el campamento de Ilmo.\
\
Ilmo teme que su mejor alce haya sido víctima de los peikko y te ha pedido que lo busques.","Ilmo está en el exterior de Suri-kylä, al norte de sus puertas.\
\
Deberías volver a ver a Ilmo y hacerle saber que su alce ha vuelto sano y salvo.","El alce parece estar dispuesto a seguirte.","Habla con Ilmo","Ilmo ya te dio las gracias por tu ayuda contra los peikko, pero parece que los problemas le buscan constantemente.","Has escoltado con éxito al alce descarriado de vuelta a Ilmo"}},
[13319]={nameES="El hijo errante",objectivesES={"Pregunta a los niños hobbit cerca de la Posada El Codo Levantado","El hijo errante","Reúnete con Gildor fuera de Tham Amothir","No has obtenido información útil...","Gildor te está esperando en la puerta oeste de Campotieso.\
\
Comparte lo que has descubierto con él.","Habla con Gildor en la puerta oeste de Campotieso","Gildor ha sugerido que os reagrupéis en el exterior de las ruinas de Tham Amothir, al suroeste de Campotieso.","Gildor te asiente con la cabeza según te acercas","Has encontrado a Gildor en el exterior de Tham Amothir.\
\
Habla con él para decidir qué hacer a continuación.","Los otros niños podrían saber dónde ha ido Pervinca.\
\
Están todos jugando cerca de la Posada El Codo Levantado.","No has obtenido ninguna información útil...","El juego del escondite ha terminado mal. Os toca a Gildor y a ti encontrar a Pervinca.","Habla con Gildor"}},
[13320]={nameES="El compañero extraviado",objectivesES={"Lagorlam, miembro de la compañía de elfos que vino al norte con Gildor Inglorion, entró en Taur Gonwaith buscando venganza contra los trolls que atacaron Lin Giliath. No ha regresado, lo que preocupa a Thaliollang.","El compañero extraviado","Busca a Lagorlam en Taur Gonwaith","Lagorlam ha ido al bosque de Taur Gonwaith, al sureste de Lin Giliath.\
\
Thaliollang te envió a buscar a Lagorlam y asegurarte de que está bien."}},
[13321]={nameES="El alcalde tozudo",objectivesES={"Busca al alcalde desaparecido.","Has descubierto al alcalde desaparecido, pero parece que está inconsciente. Debes hablar con el alcalde.\
\
El alcalde está en Tharbad, en el sudeste de Cardolan.","Habla con el alcalde","Consigue el bastón del alcalde","Rhiangar Nevit te ha pedido que encuentres a su padre, el alcalde Cadwallon Nevit, en Tharbad.\
\
Tharbad se encuentra en el sudoeste de Cardolan.","El alcalde tozudo","El alcalde Cadwallon Nevit te ha pedido que le traigas el bastón que ha lanzado.\
\
El bastón está en el camino cerca del alcalde, en Tharbad.","Has rescatado al alcalde tozudo, Cadwallon Nevit. Deberías hablar con el alcalde y decirle que su hija le espera.\
\
El alcalde Nevit está en Tharbad, en el sudeste de Cardolan.","Dale el bastón al alcalde","El alcalde de Herne ha desaparecido, y su hija está desesperada por encontrarle."}},
[13322]={nameES="The Wayward Wager",objectivesES={"Ighâz will not let you have the wager he 'rightfully' stole!","Recover the wayward wager and defeat the upstart who stole it","Mokhlêsh is eager to receive his winnings from a recent wager.","The Wayward Wager","Talk to Khâhir the Quick outside the arena","The upstart who stole the wager can be found outside the Raven and Albatross in the Upper Ward.","Mokhlêsh asked you to collect his winnings from Khâhir the Quick outside the arena.","Mokhlêsh is at the Baths of Ilmai Iforikh in the Upper Ward.","Bring the wager to Mokhlêsh at the Baths of Ilmai Iforikh in the Upper Ward","Return the wayward wager to Khâhir the Quick outside the arena","Khâhir the Quick is outside the arena.","You have defeated Ighâz and recovered the wager he stole"}},
[13323]={nameES="La confianza en la riqueza",objectivesES={"Explora el Risco de Helva","Los enemigos han invadido la Mina este","Explora el Mirador del Cazador","Explora la Mina oeste","La Liga del Hacha desea cazar en los bosques y extraer minerales de las colinas del Bosque Salvaje de la Tierra de Bree, una vez que se haya explorado debidamente el bosque.","Habla con Enid Picortiga","Explora la Pradera de Blomley","Explora la Mina este","Las manadas pastan en el Mirador del Cazador","La Pradera de Blomley, el Risco de Helva, el Mirador del Cazador, la Mina este y la Mina oeste se encuentran en el Bosque Salvake.\
\
Mientras exploras el Bosque Salvaje, debes recoger muestras de minerales y pieles de alces, lobos, osos y jabalíes para la Liga del Hacha.","Los enemigos han asegurado la Mina oeste","Las bestias campan a sus anchas en la Pradera de Blomley","Las bestias campan a sus anchas en el Risco de Helva","La confianza en la riqueza","En el Embarcadero de los Comerciantes se pueden encontrar trampas rotas y picos romos.\
\
Deberías reparar estos objetos para la Liga del Hacha.","Enid Picortiga se encuentra en el Embarcadero de los Comerciantes\
\
Deberías hablar con Enid Picortiga."}},
[13324]={nameES="The Weeping Warrior",objectivesES={"Talk to the guard on the southern bridge out of Dale and find out if he has seen Bryn.","Talk to the southern bridge guard in Dale","You should speak with both King Bard II and Prince Bryn, who can be found in the Great-keep in Dale.","Look for a guard on the southern bridge","Tell Bryn a <rgb=#FF0000>Story</rgb> of your adventures","Erna is worried about her son Bryn, who has become increasingly distant and sullen.","Talk to the guard on the southern bridge out of Dale.","Talk to Prince Bryn","You should speak with Queen Regent Erna, who can be found in the Great-keep in Dale.","Talk to Erna","You see the guard, but Bryn is nowhere to be seen","Talk to King Bard II","Bryn fled to the south in Dale.\
\
Look for a guard on the southern bridge of Dale to see if he has stopped Bryn.","Bryn can be found in the Great-keep in Dale.\
\
You should tell Prince Bryn stories of your adventures.","You attempt to tell Bryn a great tale","The Weeping Warrior"}},
[13325]={nameES="The Weight of Defeat",objectivesES={}},
[13326]={nameES="The Weight of Promise",objectivesES={}},
[13327]={nameES="The Welcoming of Guests",objectivesES={"Return to Dale.","Talk to the Easterling Man","The young King's face darkens and emotions struggle unconcealed across it as you describe all you saw and heard among his folk. He looks to you, then back to his mother in doubt.\
\
Before he can speak, a messenger appears, bowing low.","You should go to the location where you heard shouting, in the lower markets, in the south-eastern quarter of Dale.","Hear what's going on in Dale","The Dale-men have encircled the unarmed Easterling man in the lower markets, in the south-east of Dale.\
\
You should persuade the Dale-men to leave the Easterling man alone.","You should return to King Bard II, who can be found in the Great-keep in the north of Dale, and bring word of all you saw and heard among the Dale-folk.","Return to King Bard II","Talk to folk in Dale about the Easterling refugees.","The Welcoming of Guests","Learn how the folk of Dale feel about newly-arrived Easterling refugees.","Find the cause of the shouting","Several Dale-men stand around an unarmed Easterling","Shouts rise up from lower markets, in the south-east quarter of Dale","You should talk to the Easterling refugee, whom you rescued in the south-eastern quarter of Dale."}},
[13328]={nameES="The Well-marked Path",objectivesES={}},
[13329]={nameES="The Wellspring",objectivesES={"A noxious blight is seeping from these broken stones. Patch up the stones and seal the wellspring!","Investigate the southern cliffs near the Mâkhda Khorbo","Talk to Elder Roshat","Elder Roshat has asked you to go to the hills east of Khûtra, to the cliffs facing south near the ruins of the Mâkhda Khorbo and investigate the source of the disease.","The Wellspring","Talk to Heshra, the herbalist in the Elder Hall.","Talk to Heshra, the herbalist","Talk to Elder Roshat in the Elder Hall.","Elder Roshat has tasked you with going into the hills to the east, near the Mâkhda Khorbo, to a cliff where purple honeywort grows. Heshra is convinced that is where the disease originates. Find the source of the disease and seal it up if you can."}},
[13330]={nameES="The West Gate: Defenders",objectivesES={}},
[13331]={nameES="The West Gate: Enhancements I",objectivesES={"There is much work to do to rebuild the town of Hytbold.","The West Gate: Enhancements I","Bring the Tokens of Hytbold to Warin"}},
[13332]={nameES="The West Gate: Enhancements II",objectivesES={"There is much work to do to rebuild the town of Hytbold.","Bring the Tokens of Hytbold to Fréamar","The West Gate: Enhancements II"}},
[13333]={nameES="The West Gate: Rebuild",objectivesES={"There is much work to do to rebuild the town of Hytbold.","Bring the Tokens of Hytbold to Oseg","The West Gate: Rebuild"}},
[13334]={nameES="The West Option",objectivesES={"Return to Cúfaron and tell him of your success","The West Option","Hestil asked Cúfaron to find another route through the East Wall that will improve their chances of survival.","The pass to the Sutcrofts is located south-west of Parth Galen and has been barricaded by the Orcs.\
\
You need to defeat the Orcs to allow Hestil's company to pass.","You have spoken with Cúfaron","Cúfaron is waiting to speak with you.\
\
You have defeated Orcs at the barricade into the Sutcrofts and should return to tell Cúfaron."}},
[13335]={nameES="The Westfold: To the King's Aid",objectivesES={"You have spotted a gathering of people on the road in the centre of the Westfold.\
\
You should speak with someone in this company to get word of Gandalf or King Théoden.","King Théoden, along with Éomer, Aragorn, Legolas, and Gimli, have begun a journey towards the Fords of Isen.\
\
You should meet the king and his company upon the east-to-west road in the Westfold to lend them aid at the brink of war.","Search the road in the Westfold for signs of Théoden's company","The Westfold: To the King's Aid","Search for Théoden at Helm's Dike","The terrified people make for Helm's Deep, the last stronghold -- perhaps the king did the same.","Ask the refugees if they need any assistance","King Théoden indicated upon leaving Edoras that he would ride to the Fords of Isen. You should ride to the road in the Westfold and meet the king's company and search for Gandalf.","You have spotted a gathering of people on the road in the centre of the Westfold.\
\
You should ask the refugees if they need assistance.","You ask the man if he or his fellows need any assistance.\
\
'I thank you, stranger, but no. We hope to reach the Hornburg by nightfall. The enemy will not dare to strike us there!\
\
'We shall make good time when our horses are rested.'","Helm's Deep is in the valley in the south-western corner of the Westfold.\
\
You should ride with all speed to the gate of the stronghold of Helm's Deep.","You have found a small gathering of people upon the road","Speak with someone in the small company on the road","These hardy folk decline your aid -- you should now make for Helm's Deep, and seek the king!","You spot a small gathering of people upon the road"}},
[13336]={nameES="The Westward Path",objectivesES={"Something on the western side of Marton has been felling trees north-west of town. This does not bode well for the western route to Helm's Deep.","The source of the felled trees can be found north-west of Marton.\
\
You should discover the source of the felled trees.","Felled trees can be found north-west of Marton.\
\
You should follow the trail of felled trees to discover what has been destroying them.","The Westward Path","Completado","Trolls...a huge camp of them, too near the western route to Helm's Deep","Follow the trail of felled trees leading north-west","You have discovered a large encampment of trolls, too close to Marton for your comfort. This path is certainly not safe for the refugees.","Discover the source of the felled trees"}},
[13337]={nameES="The White Hand Army in Madh-fushaum",objectivesES={"You have left a mark upon those that remain in Madh-fushaum, having seen their fellows soundly defeated. You took them by surprise, and they will not soon forget this day.","The army gathered within Madh-fushaum is mostly comprised of ragtag Dunlendings, but they are mingled with Orcs and Uruk-hai. You should defeat as many as possible.","Defeat enemies in Madh-fushaum (0/24)","The White Hand Army in Madh-fushaum","Completado","There are far too many of the enemy gathered in Madh-fushaum for one to handle alone. However, those that remain will never forget the day the you stepped foot in Madh-fushaum.","The army that built and now resides within Madh-fushaum has destroyed Flodgeheld and is responsible for the attacks and siege on Brockbridge. The time has come to go on the offensive."}},
[13338]={nameES="The White Hand Reaches Far",objectivesES={"The White Hand Reaches Far","The enemies in this part of the forest bear the mark of Saruman. You wish to expose the Wizard's fall to evil to anyone who will take notice, and thus collect tokens of proof as you slay his minions.","Defeat a servant of Saruman","Symbols of the White Hand are on the Orcs and Uruks at the pond near Oldheart's meadow.\
\
You should collect tokens of proof of the Wizard's betrayal while you rid the forest of his servants.","Bring the evidence to Oldheart","Oldheart is in his meadow at the foot of a flower-spotted hill in Fangorn's western eaves.\
\
You should bring the proof of Saruman's wrongdoing to Oldheart.","The Ent stares with some shock at the burdens you present.\
\
'Sa...ru...man....'\
\
Oldheart understands.","The emblems and marks of Saruman are plain to see on all of his fell servants.\
\
You should collect tokens of proof of the Wizard's betrayal while you rid the forest of his servants.","Defeated a servant of Saruman"}},
[13339]={nameES="El Acercamiento de la Mano Blanca",objectivesES={"Has obtenido una piel de Huargo.","Rhovandis puede encontrarse en Idhobel, ubicado en el Eregion Occidental y al noreste de Echad Terthas.\
\
Duindil te ha pedido entregar la piel de Huargo a Rhovandis.","Habla con Duindil","Has obtenido una piel de Huargo. Esto debería ser útil para la investigación de Duindil. Duindil puede encontrarse en Echad Terthas, fuera de Caras Gelebren.\
\
Regresa con Duindil.","El sitio de los ataques de Huargos puede encontrarse al norte de Echad Terthas, al otro lado del río.\
\
Duindil te ha pedido derrotar cualquier Huargo en la zona.","Entrega la piel a Rhovandis en Idhobel.","Entrega la piel a Rhovandis","Entrega la piel a Rhovandis en Idhobel","Le diste la piel a Rhovandis","El Acercamiento de la Mano Blanca","Probablemente debas obtener una prueba de tu éxito.","Obtén una piel de Huargo como prueba","Duindil está preocupado por los recientes ataques de Huargos en la zona."}},
[13340]={nameES="El Ciervo Blanco",objectivesES={"Flechas recogidas del cadáver del ciervo blanco","Wistan te habló del ciervo blanco al que siguió por muchas tierras y cree haberlo abatido al fin, aunque no pudo encontrar el cuerpo.","Recoge flechas del cadáver del ciervo blanco","Wistan cree que la carcasa debe de estar en algún lugar al oeste de Echad Candelleth, entre los asentamientos de los Gauredain y los trolls silvanos.\
\
Wistan te ha pedido que busques la carcasa del ciervo blanco, al que siguió por todo el Bosque de los Trolls, y que regreses a Echad Candelleth con ella y con las flechas con las que lo abatió.","El Ciervo Blanco"}},
[13341]={nameES="The Widow of Edsig",objectivesES={"You paid your respects to Edsig, Gárferth, and both of their families. Hereswith will appreciate your help.","Pick up Gárferth's shield","Acquired Gárferth's shield","The path to the graveyard of Forlaw is just outside Forlaw's southern gate.","Hereswith is inside Edsig's house, near the stables and centre of Forlaw. Hereswith is trying to stay busy with household tasks, and not focus on the events of the day.","Speak to Hereswith","Place Gárferth's shield at Edsig's grave","One of the three widows is Hereswith. She cannot fathom life without her husband, Edsig, who fell in the Battle at Forlaw's Gate. However, she must find a way to go on as she is now raising their two daughters, Luba and Sigburga, alone.","Respects have been paid to Edsig.","Completado","Gárferth's shield is kept in the bedroom of Edsig's home.","The Widow of Edsig"}},
[13342]={nameES="The Widow of Gárferth",objectivesES={"Place Edsig's helmet at Gárferth's grave","Take Edsig's helmet","One of the three widows is Ebba. She is reeling from the death of her husband, Gárferth, who fell in the Battle at Forlaw's Gate. Her kindness is unwavering as she cares for the orphans, Ansith and Cuthmar, as if they were her own children.","The path to the graveyard of Forlaw is just outside Forlaw's southern gate.","Edsig's helmet is kept on a shelf in the main room of Gárferth's home.","Acquired Edsig's helmet","Respects have been paid to Gárferth.","The Widow of Gárferth","Completado","You paid your respects to Gárferth, Edsig, and both of their families. Ebba will appreciate your help.","Ebba is inside Gárferth's house, near the centre of Forlaw. Ebba and Ansith are preparing dinner after the long day.","Speak to Ebba"}},
[13343]={nameES="The Widow of Gársig",objectivesES={"Speak to Burghild","You paid your respects to Gársig for his family. Burghild will appreciate your help.","One of the three widows is Burghild. She and her youngest son Gárwald were devastated by losing three of their family in the Battle at Scylfig.","The path to the graveyard of Forlaw is just outside Forlaw's southern gate.","Take Gársig's sword","Acquired Gársig's sword","Respects have been paid to Gársig.","Place Gársig's sword at his grave","Gársig's sword is kept on the dresser in the sleeping quarters of Gársig's Home.","Completado","Burghild is inside Gársig's house on the western side of Forlaw. Burghild is doing anything she can to keep herself from falling apart entirely, as she must keep it together for her only remaining son.","The Widow of Gársig"}},
[13344]={nameES="The Wild Captain",objectivesES={"<rgb=#FF0000>Reeve Fríthild was defeated</rgb>","You have successfully defended Reeve Fríthild from Cledwun and his minions","Use the camp-fire to summon Reeve Fríthild and her companions","The Wild Captain","Reeve Fríthild's encampment lies to the west of Stoke.\
\
Reeve Fríthild instructed you to meet her party at her encampment.","The Council of Stoke determined that Reeve Fríthild would take to the field and lead her people against their aggressors, but now it must chose what front to focus upon.","Reeve Fríthild is at her encampment, west of Stoke.\
\
You should speak with Reeve Fríthild regarding the recent battle.","Reeve Fríthild is in the Mead Hall of Stoke.\
\
You should bring Dudsig's recommendation to Reeve Fríthild's attention.","Talk to Reeve Fríthild","Reeve Fríthild is in the Mead Hall of Stoke, east of her encampment.\
\
Reeve Fríthild has asked you to speak with her in Stoke.","<rgb=#FF0000>Reeve Fríthild must not be defeated</rgb>","Talk to Reeve Fríthild in Stoke"}},
[13345]={nameES="The Wild Hunt",objectivesES={"The Wild Huntsman is at the Huntsman's Hall.\
\
Having completed the Wild Hunt, you should return and speak with the Huntsman on behalf of the Dúnedain.","Hunt Lavaneth's spirit","Hunt Gwenaewen's spirit","Arassiel is at the Huntsman's Hall.\
\
One last spirit remains to be challenged. You should speak with Arassiel and hunt as she bids you.","The servants of the Wild Huntsman are in the Huntsman's Hall.\
\
The Huntsman has bidden you complete the tasks that the his hand-maidens set before you.","Hunt Arassiel's spirit","Talk to the Wild Huntsman in the Huntsman's Hall","Having finally found an entrance to the court of the Wild Huntsman, you have come upon a number of powerful spirits -- some of whom look upon you with disdain. Now you must prove yourself before them if you are to find a way through the haunted forests of the Mournshaws for the Grey Company.","The Wild Huntsman resides in the Huntsman's Hall.\
\
You have been instructed to approach the Huntsman and ask that the Grey Company be allowed to pass through the southern Mournshaws into Dunland.","Hunt Munfaeril's spirit","The Wild Hunt"}},
[13346]={nameES="The Wild Hunt: Arassiel's Spirit",objectivesES={"The stag-spirit of Arassiel dwells in the southern reaches of the Mournshaws.\
\
Arassiel has charged you with challenging her stag-spirit servant.","Arassiel is in the Huntsman's Hall.\
\
You should return to Arassiel with news of your success.","As you kneel by the waters of the pool, a strangely mesmerizing glow emanates from the waters.\
\
Feeling dazed as you stare into the glowing water, you reach down to cup a handful and bring it to your lips....\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>This is a Solo quest, and cannot be completed with a Fellowship.</rgb>","The Wild Hunt: Arassiel's Spirit","Challenge Arassiel's spirit","Talk to Arassiel at the Huntsman's Hall","Arassiel has sent you forth to challenge the last of the spirits of the Wild Hunt in a test of wisdom."}},
[13347]={nameES="The Wild Hunt: Gwenaewen's Spirit",objectivesES={"Challenge Gwenaewen's spirit","Talk to Gwenaewen at the Huntsman's Hall","As you kneel by the waters of the pool, a strangely mesmerizing glow emanates from the waters.\
\
Feeling dazed as you stare into the glowing water, you reach down to cup a handful and bring it to your lips....\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>This is a Solo quest, and cannot be completed with a Fellowship.</rgb>","Gwenaewen's spirit dwells in the heart of the Mournshaws.\
\
Gwenaewen has charged you with hunting her falcon-spirit servant.","The Wild Hunt: Gwenaewen's Spirit","Gwenaewen is at the Huntsman's Hall.\
\
You should return to Gwenaewen and tell her that you have overcome her challenge.","Gwenaewen has bidden you challenge an ancient spirit as a test of quickness in the Wild Hunt that the Huntsman has set before you."}},
[13348]={nameES="The Wild Hunt: Lavaneth's Spirit",objectivesES={"Lavaneth is at the Huntsman's Hall.\
\
You should return to Lavaneth and tell her of your successful challenge against the boar-spirit.","Talk to Lavaneth at the Huntsman's Hall","As you kneel by the waters of the pool, a strangely mesmerizing glow emanates from the waters.\
\
Feeling dazed as you stare into the glowing water, you reach down to cup a handful and bring it to your lips....\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>This is a Solo quest, and cannot be completed with a Fellowship.</rgb>","The Wild Hunt: Lavaneth's Spirit","Lavaneth's spirit roams in the north-west eaves of the Mournshaws.\
\
Lavaneth has bidden you hunt her boar-spirit.","The Wild Huntsman has tasked you with hunting the spirit servants of his hand-maidens.","Challenge Lavaneth's spirit"}},
[13349]={nameES="The Wild Hunt: Munfaeril's Spirit",objectivesES={"Munfaeril is at the Huntsman's Hall.\
\
You should return to Munfaeril and tell her of your success in the challenge of endurance.","As you kneel by the waters of the pool, a strangely mesmerizing glow emanates from the waters.\
\
Feeling dazed as you stare into the glowing water, you reach down to cup a handful and bring it to your lips....\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>This is a Solo quest, and cannot be completed with a Fellowship.</rgb>","The ox-spirit dwells beneath the north-east eaves of the Mournshaws.\
\
Munfaeril has bidden you challenge her ox-spirit servant.","Munfaeril has bidden you challenge an ancient spirit as a test of endurance in the Wild Hunt that the Huntsman has set before you.","Challenge Munfaeril's Spirit","Talk to Munfaeril at the Huntsman's Hall","The Wild Hunt: Munfaeril's Spirit"}},
[13350]={nameES="La caza del Bosque Salvaje",objectivesES={"Derrota a las legendarias bestias del Bosque Salvaje","Linnet Encinarroja se plantea el reto de cazar las presas más feroces y escasas del Bosque Salvaje.","Vuelve con Linnet","Linnet se encuentra en la zona centro-sur del Bosque Salvaje.\
\
Deberías volver con Linnet.","La caza del Bosque Salvaje","Las grandes bestias se encuentran por todo el Bosque Salvaje.\
\
Linnet te ha pedido que derrotes al ciervo blanco Gwengorn, al gran jabalí Brundurch, al alce negro Dúgar y al huargo plateado Lhudblath."}},
[13351]={nameES="El Bosque Salvaje de las Tierras de Bree",objectivesES={"Habla con Aran Verduno","El Bosque Salvaje es una zona salvaje poco transitada, situada mucho más allá de los Campos de Bree, que rebosa de recursos sin explotar.","El Bosque Salvaje de las Tierras de Bree","Habla con Enid Picortiga","Aran Verduno puede encontrarse en Puente de Caballetes y Enid Picortiga puede encontrarse en el Embarcadero de los Comerciantes.\
\
Deberías hablar con Aran Verduno y Enid Picortiga."}},
[13352]={nameES="The Will of Ugrukhôr",objectivesES={"You find nothing of note","The Will of Ugrukhôr","Deliver the orders from Ugrukhôr to Dornach","Ugrukhôr's Orcs have made a series of unsuccessful forays into the Circle of Despair, and Dornach hopes they might still hold orders from the Captain of Pit.","Search slain Orcs and Uruk-hai for orders from Ugrukhôr","Dornach can be found in the Circle of Despair.\
\
You have found orders from Ugrukhôr carried by a slain Uruk-hai. You should deliver them to Dornach.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: If you lose sight of Dornach, you can summon him to your side with his horn.</rgb>","Slain Orcs and Uruk-hai can be found in the Circle of Despair.\
\
You should search fallen Orcs and Uruk-hai for orders from Ugrukhôr.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: If you lose sight of Dornach, you can summon him to your side with his horn.</rgb>","You find a crumpled missive!","Search slain Orcs and uruks for orders from Ugrukhôr"}},
[13353]={nameES="El sendero serpenteante",objectivesES={"Wárr está probablemente inquieto por recibir noticias del resto de los enanos de la expedición. Un gran pasaje natural y serpenteante conecta la Sala Vigesimoprimera con la Cámara de los Cruces.","Wárr se encuentra en la Cámara de Mazarbul, al norte de la Sala Vigesimoprimera, muy al este de la Cámara de los Cruces.\
\
Líkmund te ha pedido que hables con Wárr y le transmitas lo que sabes sobre los acontecimientos recientes en la Cámara de los Cruces.","Encuentra la puerta occidental de la Sala Vigesimoprimera","El sendero serpenteante","Wárr se encuentra en la Cámara de Mazarbul, justo al norte de la Sala Vigesimoprimera, muy al este de la Cámara de los Cruces.\
\
Debes viajar hacia el este desde la Cámara de los Cruces, a través del gran camino serpenteante que conduce a la Sala Vigesimoprimera."}},
[13354]={nameES="The Window of the Sunset",objectivesES={"Dornach can be found along the road to the north of Aelin Veren in North Ithilien.\
\
Dornach has asked you to sit near him, so he can blindfold you for your journey to Henneth Annûn.","Travel with Dornach to Henneth Annûn","Talk to Dornach at Henneth Annûn","Dornach is leading you to the hidden refuge of Henneth Annûn.","Dornach has agreed to bring you to Henneth Annûn, but only by secret ways.","The Window of the Sunset","<rgb=#FF00FF>Sit</rgb> near Dornach and allow him to blindfold you","Dornach pulls a cloth from his armour and begins to blindfold you...","Dornach can be found within Henneth Annûn.\
\
Dornach has led you to the hidden refuge of Henneth Annûn. You should now speak to him.","You have arrived at Henneth Annûn!"}},
[13355]={nameES="The Wine Cellar",objectivesES={}},
[13356]={nameES="La Hueste Alada",objectivesES={"La Hueste Alada","Himbar está plagado por las merrevail y sus parientes, los murciélagos. Estas criaturas atacan sin piedad a los Montaraces de Gath Forthnír.","Las merrevail y los murciélagos cazan por todo Himbar, las tierras al oeste de Gath Forthnír.\
\
Thoriel te advirtió sobre las merrevail, monstruos alados al servicio del Enemigo. Atacan a los Montaraces y deben ser destruidos, junto con sus parientes menores, los murciélagos.","Thoriel te espera en Gath Forthnír, el campamento oculto de los Montaraces al este de Himbar.\
\
Has derrotado a los sirvientes alados del Enemigo y ahora puedes regresar para reclamar la victoria."}},
[13357]={nameES="The Wisdom of Zôreth",objectivesES={"After defeating the Firehorns within the Oath-taker's Horn, Gimli and Spakorth now hope to discover where King Greytooth has led his folk in search of the Dwarf-ring, Manthríf.","The Wisdom of Zôreth","This page makes reference to a passage within Barad-dûr that leads into the Mordath...","Spakorth can be found in Zôreth's chambers within the Oath-taker's Horn.\
\
You have found much of Zôreth's research into the locations of Sauron's artifacts. You should deliver the pages you recovered to Spakorth.","This page lists the names of the seven dwarf-rings, but four are marked with unsettling notes...","Zôreth's chambers can be found upon the highest level of the Oath-taker's Horn.\
\
Gimli has asked you to seek out Zôreth's research in her chambers of old in the hope that it might lead you to King Greytooth and the Firehorns.","This page makes note of the key King Greytooth bore during his imprisonment...","This page speaks of a vault within the depths of the Black Pits of Mordath...","Deliver to Zôreth's research to Spakorth in the Oath-taker's Horn"}},
[13358]={nameES="The Wise Voyagers",objectivesES={"Find Dejeni's father Mulúgu by the throne of Furukzahar","Talk to Dejeni in the feast-hall of Furukzahar","The Wise Voyagers","Dejeni's father Mulúgu fought in the Battle of Azanulbizar and will tell you about it if you find him by the throne of Furukzahar.","Dejeni, historian of the Temámir, is eager for you to learn more about his people during your stay in Furukzahar.","Mulúgu was sleeping, and you chose not to bother him. Perhaps Dejeni will tell you about the Battle of Azanulbizar instead.","Mulúgu sleeps peacefully on one of the benches, and you decide not to wake him"}},
[13359]={nameES="La Mujer Sabia",objectivesES={"Lirio Sotomonte está preocupada por el informe que le llevaste de parte de Longo Daegmund.","El pozo del pueblo de Entibo está en el centro del pueblo. Para encontrar el Manantial de Aguas Plateadas, toma el camino al este desde la plaza hasta la granja de la Viuda Froghorn, luego al sur hasta la casa del Condestable Bolger. El manantial está al sureste de allí.\
\
Saca un cubo de agua del pozo y llévalo a Cancióndesauce.","Cancióndesauce está en el Manantial de Aguas Plateadas.\
\
Sacaste un cubo de agua del pozo del pueblo de Entibo y lo llevaste a Cancióndesauce.","Saca agua del pozo del pueblo de Entibo","La Mujer Sabia","Lleva el cubo de agua envenenada a Cancióndesauce"}},
[13360]={nameES="The Witan",objectivesES={"Completed The Witan: The Battle for Hytbold","The Lords of the Eastemnet have decided to hold a Witan in the newly rebuilt Hytbold.","Complete The Witan: Lords of the Eastemnet","Completed The Witan: Lords of the Eastemnet","The Witan is being held at the Mead Hall of Hytbold.\
\
The Lords of Rohan have decided to hold a Witan in Hytbold to determine the fate of the Eastemnet.","Edgal is at the Mead Hall of Hytbold.\
\
Edgal will want to speak to you about what has just happened.","Complete The Witan: The Battle for Hytbold","Edgal is at the Mead Hall of Hytbold.\
\
Hytbold has come under assault from an unknown enemy.","The Witan","Talk to Edgal"}},
[13361]={nameES="The Witan: Lords of the Eastemnet",objectivesES={"The Witan has begun and the Lords are discussing the future of the Eastemnet.","The Lords of the Eastemnet are holding a Witan to decide the fate of their lands.","The Witan has been interrupted. Something is happening outside","Attend and observe the Witan","The Witan: Lords of the Eastemnet","The Witan is being held in Hytbold.","The Witan has begun","Talk to Harding to signal the beginning of the Witan"}},
[13362]={nameES="The Witan: The Battle for Hytbold",objectivesES={"Derrota al troll","Join Ingbert on the south flank","Defend the south flank","Defend Hytbold at all costs.","Talk to Harding","Athelward has weakend the troll. Defeat it","Hytbold -- and the Witan -- have fallen under siege by a great army of the Enemy.","Defend the south flank with Ingbert, Fastred, Elfmar, and Mildrith","Harding waits to speak with you.","Join Ides in the centre","Radwig and Gísil have fallen! Join Ides in defending the centre","Ingbert calls out for aid on the south flank","Defend the north flank with Harding, Gísling, Edgal, and Winsig","The troll has fallen. Hytbold is saved, though the cost was great.","Regroup with the Lords of the Eastemnet","The Witan: The Battle for Hytbold","Join Harding on the north flank","Defend the centre","Defend the north flank"}},
[13363]={nameES="El Rey Brujo, Señor de los Nazgûl, Azote de Mordor",objectivesES={"The Witch-king has been defeated... but his ultimate fate lies with another","The Witch-king, Lord of the Nazgûl, defeated but enduring","The Great Alliance of Elves and Men stood in defiance of Sauron for long years of siege, but even their greatest heroes came to fear his deadliest servants. These were the Nazgûl, and their number was Nine.","The Witch-king suffered defeat on the battlefield of Mordor Besieged, but it was not to be a lasting death... not while Sauron endured. The Lord of the Nazgûl would return, for his ultimate fate rested in the hand of another still to come, thousands of years hence.","The Great Alliance of Elves and Men stood in defiance of Sauron for long years of siege, but even their bravest heroes came to fear his deadliest servants. These were the Nazgûl, and their number was Nine. They stalked the battlefield of Mordor Besieged, and were its most dangerous scourges.\
\
Greatest and most feared of the Nine, the Witch-king stalked the battlefield but rarely, leaving the fortresses of Mordor only at Sauron's most pressing command. In later years the Lord of the Nazgûl would raise from nothing the Land of Angmar, wielding it in furtherance of the Dark Lord's aim to destroy the northern kingdom of Arnor, but at the close of the Second Age that was still far off in the mists of Time. During the Siege of Barad-dûr, the Witch-king could be found testing the weaknesses of the armies arrayed against his master, seeking the most valuable prize of all: information.","El Rey Brujo, Señor de los Nazgûl, Azote de Mordor","El más grande y temido de los Nueve, el Rey Brujo acechaba el campo de batalla pero rara vez, dejando las fortalezas de Mordor solo bajo la orden más urgente de Sauron. En años posteriores, el Señor de los Nazgûl levantaría de la nada la Tierra de Angmar, utilizándola para avanzar en el objetivo del Señor Oscuro de destruir el reino del norte de Arnor, pero al final de la Segunda Edad eso aún estaba lejos en las brumas del Tiempo. Durante el Asedio de Barad-dûr, el Rey Brujo se encontraba probando las debilidades de los ejércitos alineados contra su maestro, buscando el premio más valioso de todos: la información.","Defeat the Witch-king in Mordor Besieged"}},
[13364]={nameES="The Withered Tree",objectivesES={"Some of the citizens of Gondor in the Fourth Circle may actually be supporters of the Withered Tree.","Investigate the Fourth Circle of the city for supporters of the Withered Tree","Destroy the parchment containing the new pass-words","The Withered Tree","Some of the citizens of Gondor in the Second Circle may actually be supporters of the Withered Tree.","Deliver the new pass-word to Linharn at the Gate of the Citadel","You destroy the parchment containing the new-passwords","Some of the citizens of Gondor in the Third Circle may actually be supporters of the Withered Tree.","Deliver the new pass-word to Doronir at the Gate of Stars","Lamlor, the Captain of Tidings and Spy-master of Gondor, has come down to the gate in the First Circle.","Deliver the new pass-word to Garthor at the Gate of Stones","Investigate the Third Circle of the city for supporters of the Withered Tree","You carry new pass-words for the Gate of the Citadel, the Gate of Stones, and the Gate of Stars.\
\
Húrin has sent you to deliver new pass-words for the gates in the upper Circles of the city.\
\
<rgb=#00FF00>Minas Tirith is besieged! You may examine the model of the city in the Dome of the Sun to travel between states of the city.</rgb>","You carry new pass-words for the Gate of the Citadel, the Gate of Stones, and the Gate of Stars.\
\
Húrin has sent you to deliver the new pass-words for the gates in the upper Circles of the city.\
\
<rgb=#00FF00>Minas Tirith is besieged! You may examine the model of the city in the Dome of the Sun to travel between states of the city.</rgb>","Talk to Húrin in the besieged city, in the Dome of the Sun","Investigate the Second Circle of the city for supporters of the Withered Tree","Húrin is in the besieged city, in the Dome of the Sun.\
\
Lamlor believes you should ask Húrin to change the pass-words for the gates in the upper Circles of the city.\
\
<rgb=#00FF00>Minas Tirith is besieged! You may examine the model of the city in the Dome of the Sun to travel between states of the city.</rgb>","Talk to Lamlor at the City Gates, in the First Circle","With the siege now fully underway, the group calling itself the Withered Tree has become even more brazen. The Council of Gondor has tasked you with helping curb its rise."}},
[13365]={nameES="La Amargura de Khand, Azote de Mordor",objectivesES={"The Great Alliance of Elves and Men stood in defiance of Sauron for long years of siege, but even their bravest heroes came to fear his deadliest servants. These were the Nazgûl, and their number was Nine. They stalked the battlefield of Mordor Besieged, and were its most dangerous scourges.\
\
He was the Woe of Khand, and with the blessing of Sauron he strode across the unconquered lands and claimed them for the Dark Lord. The ring gifted to him was called Adâsh, and many were the foes it made, many the proud warriors he brought low. He found great joy in the bringing of war, and always had done so, but with the power given to him by Sauron, the Woe of Khand became ever more deadly, more relentless, and more unforgiving.","Defeat the Woe of Khand in Mordor Besieged","The Great Alliance of Elves and Men stood in defiance of Sauron for long years of siege, but even their greatest heroes came to fear his deadliest servants. These were the Nazgûl, and their number was Nine.","Era la Amargura de Khand y, con la bendición de Sauron, avanzó por las tierras no conquistadas y las reclamó para el Señor Oscuro. El anillo que se le otorgó se llamaba Adâsh, y muchos fueron los enemigos que creó, muchos los orgullosos guerreros que abatió. Encontraba gran alegría en provocar la guerra, y siempre lo había hecho, pero con el poder otorgado por Sauron, la Amargura de Khand se volvió cada vez más mortal, más implacable y más despiadada.","The Woe of Khand, defeated but enduring","The Woe of Khand suffered defeat on the battlefield of Mordor Besieged, but it was not to be a lasting death... not while Sauron endured. The Nazgûl would return, for his was an existence beyond ending.","La Amargura de Khand, Azote de Mordor","The Woe of Khand has been defeated... for now"}},
[13366]={nameES="El Páramo",objectivesES={"Receive the formal welcome of the Thane","You have received a summons to go to Rohan, and the first city you encountered here was Langhold.","El Páramo","Thane Utred, leader of the northernmost town of the Wold, is in the Mead Hall of Langhold.\
\
You should speak with Thane Utred at once to receive a proper welcome to the town."}},
[13367]={nameES="El lobo en exilio",objectivesES={"Dora Rizopardo piensa que un admirador suyo ha ido a intentar matar al líder exiliado de los lobos cerca de El Cruce.","Jolly Madriguera puede estar tras el lobo que fue visto al otro lado de la carretera de la guarida del lobo, al norte de la granja de Dora Rizopardo.\
\
Dora Rizopardo está preocupada porque su vecino, Jolly Madriguera, puede estar en problemas y le ha pedido que lo encuentre.","Dora Rizopardo está en el centro de El Cruce.\
\
A Dora le alegrará saber que has rescatado a Jolly Madriguera y derrotado al líder marcado de los lobos que han estado acosando su granja y su pueblo.","El lobo en exilio","Encuentra a Jolly Madriguera"}},
[13368]={nameES="Los Lobos de Drauglad",objectivesES={"Habla con Fimgris","Estos lobos parecen venir del sur de Thorenhad y sus huellas regresan hacia la carretera principal","Sigue el rastro de los lobos hacia el sur, fuera de la carretera","Los lobos parecen venir de algún lugar al sur de Thorenhad.\
\
Deberías seguir a los lobos hasta su guarida.","Parece que has encontrado la guarida de los lobos. Sientes un escalofrío, como si un gran mal estuviera presente aquí. Deberías avanzar más en la guarida","Sigue el rastro de los lobos hacia el este por la carretera","La guarida continúa hacia el oeste, hacia los acantilados.\
\
Deberías buscar más adentro en las guaridas el origen de la presencia maligna.","El sendero gira hacia el sur, alejándose de la carretera principal","Los lobos parecen venir de algún lugar al sur de Thorenhad. Su rastro ha girado hacia el sur, alejándose del camino.\
\
Deberías seguir a los lobos hasta su guarida.","Fimgris está en el campamento de Narlinn, al oeste por la carretera principal desde la entrada a Drauglad.\
\
Deberías regresar con Fimgris con noticias de tu descubrimiento en Drauglad.","Ante ti ves un lobo como ninguno que hayas visto antes. Sin duda, esta terrible criatura es la fuente del mal que percibiste","Los lobos parecen venir de algún lugar al sur de Thorenhad. Su rastro parece continuar hacia el este a lo largo de la carretera.\
\
Deberías seguir a los lobos hasta su guarida.","Los lobos han dejado cadáveres casi enteros esparcidos alrededor de su guarida. Esto no es propio de ellos; algo terrible ocurre aquí","El sendero continúa hacia el este a lo largo del camino","Cazaste a los lobos en el valle entre la carretera y Thorenhad y descubriste que no eran de ese valle: venían de algún lugar al sur.","Has derrotado al lobo sombrío anciano","Sigue el rastro de los lobos hacia el sur, hasta la carretera principal","Los Lobos de Drauglad","Derrota al lobo sombrío anciano","Sigue el rastro de los lobos hasta su guarida","El lobo sombrío anciano está en Drauglad, al este del campamento de Narlinn y al sur de la carretera.\
\
Deberías intentar derrotar al lobo sombrío anciano.","Busca más adentro en la guarida de los lobos el origen del mal"}},
[13369]={nameES="Las Hojas de Reyes de los Lobos",objectivesES={"Iach puede encontrarse cerca de la puerta oriental de Musgovilla.\
\
Regresa con Iach.","El sanador Iach te pide recoger más Hoja de Reyes. Desafortunadamente, se encuentra en el hábitat de los lobos.","Las Hojas de Reyes de los Lobos","Habla con Iach","Las Hojas de Reyes pueden encontrarse en las Piedras Aullantes al sureste de Musgovilla.\
\
Recolecta Hojas de Reyes."}},
[13370]={nameES="El maestro de los lobos",objectivesES={"Derrota a Nûkhud, maestro de lobos","El maestro de los lobos","Nûkhud, maestro de lobos derrotado","Nûkhud, maestro de lobos, se encuentra en Barad Morlas, al suroeste de Echad Eregion.\
\
Dornhador te ha pedido que encuentres y derrotes a Nûkhud, maestro de lobos, el líder de los guardianes de lobos en Barad Morlas.","Dornhador se encuentra en Echad Eregion, al noreste de Barad Morlas.\
\
Debes regresar a Dornhador con noticias de la caída de Nûkhud.","Habla con Dornhador en Echad Eregion","Has derrotado a muchos guardianes de lobos en Barad Morlas, pero Dornhador aún tiene una tarea más para ti."}},
[13371]={nameES="The Wood of Greenleaves",objectivesES={"Return to Radagast","Fertile soil and dead trees can both be found throughout Eryn Lasgalen.\
\
You should clear away the dead trees and plant the saplings in fertile soil around the forest.","You should return to Radagast, who can be found at the tree nursery just outside of Felegoth.","The saplings Radagast has been cultivating are ready for replanting.","The Wood of Greenleaves","Saplings can be found just south of Felegoth.\
\
You should gather saplings that are to be planted around the forest."}},
[13372]={nameES="El relato del leñador",objectivesES={"Lleva los hongos, la savia y la madera a Toly Tejonera","Has recogido un balde de savia de arce","Los hongos se encuentran en la parte occidental del Bosque Viejo, entre el Claro de la Hoguera y la Colina Calva. La madera se puede recolectar de la pila de secado del leñador, al este del Claro de la Hoguera y un poco al sur. La savia se puede recoger del viejo arce que crece en la Colina Calva, al este del Claro de la Hoguera.\
\
Como Toly Tejonera, el leñador, se ha torcido el tobillo, te ha pedido que recolectes hongos, madera y savia de arce para él.","Recoge madera sazonada","Has recogido madera sazonada","Recoge un balde de savia de arce","Entrega la savia, la madera y los hongos a Toly Tejonera junto a los establos fuera de Casa Brandi.\
\
El Bosque Viejo te ha cedido su botín; ahora debes regresar con Toly Tejonera.","El leñador se ha torcido el tobillo y no puede terminar sus tareas del día. Jura que el Bosque Viejo lo hizo tropezar a propósito.","El relato del leñador"}},
[13373]={nameES="The Wood-trolls of Shulgmokh",objectivesES={}},
[13374]={nameES="La Hermandad de los Leñadores (Diaria)",objectivesES={"La Hermandad de los Leñadores (Diaria)","Has ayudado a la Hermandad de los Leñadores en sus labores por todo el Bosque Salvaje de las Tierras de Bree. Todos los miembros de la Hermandad te agradecen tu ayuda.","Completa misiones sin facción en el Bosque Salvaje para ayudar a la Hermandad de los Leñadores.","La Hermandad de los Leñadores necesita ayuda con sus actividades en el Bosque Salvaje de las Tierras de Bree.","Has ayudado a la Hermandad de los Leñadores.","Completado"}},
[13375]={nameES="The Woodfolk of Arhaim",objectivesES={"The villagers of Arhaim have taken notice of your deeds","The chieftain of Arhaim, Garsind, has asked you to help the village.\
\
You should complete quests in Duskenvale to earn the villagers' trust. Lúfred, Ingelfled, Goslim and Tassila may have quests for you.","Talk to the suspicious villager","Baradal has asked you to gather information from the villagers in Arhaim.\
\
You should attempt to talk to the villagers.","Baradal can be found in Arhaim, the woodmen village in Duskenvale.\
\
You should tell Baradal that the woodmen need to be convinced of your trustworthiness.","Garsind can be found in Arhaim, the woodmen village in Duskenvale.\
\
You should talk to Garsind.","Garsind has told you of Shathur-munzu, the dwarf ruin to the west, and of the monster known as the Shadow Hunter.\
\
You should relay this information to Baradal.","Talk to the superstitious villager","Talk to Garsind","Talk to Baradal","Talk to the frightened villager","One of the villagers suggested that you speak to Arhaim's chieftain for information.\
\
You should talk to Garsind.","You have travelled with Baradal to the village of Arhaim. The Woodfolk of the village are distrustful of strangers, and will need to be convinced of your intentions.","The Woodfolk of Arhaim"}},
[13376]={nameES="The Word of Mazog",objectivesES={"Shapag-hai can be found at Lúlstrok in the north-western reaches of the Gladden Fields.\
\
You have encountered more of the Shapag-hai in the Gladden Fields. You should defeat them and drive them back into Moria.","After discovering an encampment of Shapag-hai in the Gladden Fields, you recall Mazog's last words in the Tower of Dol Guldur:\
\
'Wherever your people catch a glint of gold, or silver, or gems beneath the mountains there will be an Orc to slay him, every one. That is my vow! That is the word of Mazog!'\
\
It seems that Mazog's words have not gone unheeded by the Orcs of Moria. You should defeat them and drive them from the Vales of Anduin.","Even after his defeat at Dol Guldur, the word of Mazog has not gone unheeded by the Pûlpum and Shapag-hai who now seek to slay the dwarves of Middle-earth.","You have defeated many of the Shapag-hai at Lúlstrok.","Completado","The Word of Mazog","With many of the Shapag-hai slain or driven back into Moria, you have helped to make safe the Vales of Anduin."}},
[13377]={nameES="La Palabra de un Sanador",objectivesES={"Habla con Huldar y ayuda en la defensa de Othrikar","El Maestro Rúnico Huldar está en Othrikar, en las Quebradas del Norte.\
\
Se te ha dicho que el enano Huldar podría enseñarte sobre las runas de sanación más beneficiosas.","Los Maestros Rúnicos son expertos en la palabra escrita, y las palabras de sanación capturadas en forma rúnica son especialmente poderosas y útiles en un mundo peligroso.","Huldar está en Othrikar, en las Quebradas del Norte.\
\
El enano Huldar ha accedido a enseñarte lo que sabe sobre las runas de sanación si lo ayudas a repeler un ataque de los Duramano.","La Palabra de un Sanador","Huldar está en Othrikar, en las Quebradas del Norte.\
\
Fuiste de gran ayuda para los enanos de Othrikar durante el ataque de los Duramano, y ahora deberías hablar con Huldar, tal como acordaron.","Habla con Huldar en Othrikar"}},
[13378]={nameES="The Work is Never Done",objectivesES={"Habla con Grimbeorn","Grimbeorn's three tasks can be found in and around the Beorninghús as well as close by in the Beorninglands.\
\
You should complete the three tasks that Grimbeorn has asked you to complete.","Grimbeorn can be found at the Beorninghús.\
\
You should talk to Grimbeorn.","The path for Léothred leads north from Avabárg, where a stop at the Beorninghús is in order.","Complete the quest \\qCatching Chickens\\q","Complete the quest \\qChopping Wood\\q","Complete the quest \\qPicking Berries\\q","The Work is Never Done","Talk to Grimbeorn at the Beorninghús"}},
[13379]={nameES="The Work of a Huntsman",objectivesES={}},
[13380]={nameES="El cazador de sierpes",objectivesES={"Machan el cazador debería estar en algún lugar de la región de Sálgaitë al sureste.\
\
El cazador Murdaigán te ha pedido que localices a Machan, que estaba cazando sierpes de fuego en Malenhad.","Encuentra al cazador Machan","Has encontrado a Machan","Machan el cazador ha desaparecido después de jurar regresar con las pieles de los temibles sierpes de Malenhad.","El cazador de sierpes"}},
[13381]={nameES="El Lamento del Cazasierpes",objectivesES={"El Lamento del Cazasierpes","Sigrun te ha hablado de Ormulf Cazasierpes, un enano de Othrikar conocido por su valentía frente a los gusanos y dragonzuelos que merodean entre las grietas de las Quebradas del Norte.","Ormulf Cazasierpes está en Othrikar, muy al oeste, en la zona norte-central de las Quebradas del Norte.\
\
Sigrun ha visto a la distancia que la fortaleza de Helegrod parece estar infestada de gusanos y dragonzuelos, y te ha pedido que consultes a Ormulf Cazagusanos sobre lo que debe hacerse."}},
[13382]={nameES="El guardián de los sierpes",objectivesES={"Arzgât derrotado y nota recogida","El guardián de los sierpes","Arzgât habita cerca de una pequeña cadena montañosa, en la ladera de Carchres al sur del camino a Rivendel, al este de Gwingris.\
\
Calelloth te ha instruido para que vayas y derrotes al semiorco Arzgât.","Los semiorcos ladrones de huevos están siendo supervisados por una criatura particularmente viciosa llamada Arzgât.\
\
Calelloth te ha pedido que te dirijas a la ladera norte de Carchres y mates a Arzgât.","Lleva la nota a Calelloth en Gwingris","Derrota a Arzgât y registra su cuerpo"}},
[13383]={nameES="El señor de los sierpes",objectivesES={"Brunanc derrotado","Habla con Daegennan en Gwingris","Los huevos de sierpe pertenecientes a la prole de Brunanc se encuentran en las laderas al sureste de Gwingris.\
\
Daegennan te ha pedido que destruyas los huevos de los gusanos para atraer a su líder, Brunanc.","Daegennan se encuentra en Gwingris, al noroeste del nido de Brunanc.\
\
Debes regresar a Daegennan con noticias de tu victoria.","El sierpe Brunanc y su prole aterrorizan los caminos que van de Rivendel a Gwingris.","El señor de los sierpes","Derrota a Brunanc"}},
[13384]={nameES="The Worst Winter in Memory",objectivesES={"Thrymm is concerned about the the damage the prolonged cold and snow has had on the Writhendowns, and would like to see how severe its impact upon the region has been.","Ponds can be found near Thrymm's Camp in the north-eastern Writhendowns.\
\
You should investigate the effects of the cold and snow around the frozen ponds of the Writhendowns.","This pond is frozen solid -- an unusual occurrence in this area of Middle-earth","Thrymm's face is lined with worry as you relay your findings to him.\
\
'I do not like this at all. I am a warrior, and I will drive the Orcs off. But we are a simple farming folk here in Wildermore. We live off of this land. Even if we are safe from Orcs, we cannot escape this strange weather.'","Speak with Thrymm Red-beard","This situation appears more dire than originally thought. Thrymm Red-beard will be waiting back at his camp.","The Worst Winter in Memory","Unused to this harsh new climate, this tree has died","This creature appears to have succumbed to the cold, lying frozen in the snow"}},
[13385]={nameES="The Worth of Earth and Fire",objectivesES={}},
[13386]={nameES="The Would-be Shanty-man",objectivesES={"Anyâmat rushes to your side","The Would-be Shanty-man","Summon Anyâmat with the whistle and complete 'Fightin' Freebooters'","Summon Anyâmat with the whistle and complete 'Zamarzîr Treasure Hunt'","Summon Anyâmat with the whistle and talk to her","Summon Anyâmat with the whistle and complete 'What if We Fight a Giant Crab?'","Anyâmat has asked you to help her become a great shanty-caller by bringing her along for some adventures.","Anyâmat runs off to await your whistle","Anyâmat harbours aspirations of being a great shanty-man.","Anyâmat has asked you to help her become a great shanty-caller by bringing her along for some adventures.\
\
While in Zamarzîr, use Anyâmat's whistle from your inventory to summon Anyâmat to your side.","Wait a moment"}},
[13387]={nameES="The Wounded Glade",objectivesES={"You should now work to heal the glade with the water of the Gilrain","Talk to Roamingstar","Search for a bucket near the mere outside Roamingstar's glade","The Wounded Glade","War-torn earth can be found in and around Roamingstar's glade.\
\
Roamingstar has asked you to aid her in healing the lands of Dor-en-Ernil.","A bucket can be found on the banks of the Gilrain in north-eastern Dor-en-Ernil.\
\
Roamingstar has asked you to aid her in healing the lands of Dor-en-Ernil by using the waters of the Gilrain.","DNT -- will not be seen","Saddened by the harm inflicted on the Gilrain's banks, Roamingstar hopes to heal the lands of Gondor before confronting the Ruthless Dead.","Roamingstar can be found in her glade in north-eastern Dor-en-Ernil.\
\
You have healed the earth wounded by the war in Gondor and should now return to Roamingstar."}},
[13388]={nameES="The Wounded Path",objectivesES={}},
[13389]={nameES="The Wounds Must Be Staunched",objectivesES={}},
[13390]={nameES="The Wrath of Glúrugoth",objectivesES={"Examine the chamber of Narchraw again","Escape Barad-dûr","It would seem Narchraw has indeed escaped Barad-dûr and perhaps escaped from Dor Amarth as well. At a dead end, you decide to examine your surroundings again in the hope that more information about Narchraw's destination surfaces.","Escape Barad-dûr and fight off Glúrugoth's guards.","You notice that on your way into the chamber you forgot to inspect the door","At a dead end, you decide to inspect your surroundings again.","You should escape while Glúrugoth is incapacitated","Talk to Lômazar","Inspect the chamber door","Barad-dûr is located in eastern Dor Amarth.\
\
You should examine the chamber of Narchraw again.","The Wrath of Glúrugoth","Lômazar can be found at the Ruins of Díngarth.\
\
You should speak with Lômazar.","While you inspect the door, you hear footsteps coming around the corner"}},
[13391]={nameES="The Wrath of the Taurogrim",objectivesES={}},
[13392]={nameES="The Wreck of the Kêl Tezhor",objectivesES={}},
[13393]={nameES="The Writhing Glade",objectivesES={"Approach the largest Mirk-huorn and attempt to speak with it","The Wrathful Huorn stands in Sâd Meryrn.\
\
One Mirk-huorn does not seem as malicious as the rest; you should approach it and learn what you can from it.","Habla con Nífdir en su campamento","Nífdir can be found at a small camp to the west of Estolad Mernael.\
\
Nenedhel has asked you once again to seek out Nífdir in the heart of the Drownholt.","This Huorn's twigs shiver menacingly as you draw near, but it does not attack. It is a very old tree, and its will is strong. Surely this is the tree that the Elves perceived as they passed Sâd Meryrn.\
\
As you stand at its roots, your mind is impressed with recollections of a fair green forest full of new life, and of a shadow of fear, ever-growing. The green life withers, blackens, and dies. Evil poisons consume the very water and air.","Huorns can be found in Sâd Meryrn, due south of Nífdir's small camp. You should travel north and west to reach their glade.\
\
You should approach Huorns and attempt to speak with them, but Nífdir has advised you to be prepared for much open hostility.","Nífdir wishes to learn what ails the violent trees of the Drownholt, and help them if it is possible to do so.","The Writhing Glade","Nífdir is at the camp overlooking Sâd Meryrn from the north.\
\
You should speak with Nífdir and tell him of the strange conversation of sorts that passed between yourself and the Mirk-huorn."}},
[13394]={nameES="The Yule Celebration of Winter-home",objectivesES={"Visit Ona Kay, the Eating Contest Announcer","Your tour has finished, but there is more of the town to be seen ahead....","Explore the other corner of Winter-home, for it looks interesting","The mayor and his wife, hosts of the Yule Festivities, are in the centre of the celebration.\
\
You should speak with the mayor about the various events of the festival, for he wishes to greet all who arrive.","Cecil Voller is at the Snowball Field, north of the town.","It seems you've not explored the south-west corner of the town; you should explore it before returning to the mayor....","You have arrived in Winter-home, and Guard Kember has offered to give you a tour of the many sights to be seen.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> NOTE: This quest will be removed from your quest log when the current festival ends. </rgb>","Mayor Goodnough is in the centre of town.\
\
You should return to Mayor Goodnough now that you have finished your tour of Winter-home's many events.","Return to Mayor Goodnough to finish your tour","The mayor's wife is standing near the mayor, Winston Goodnough, watching over the festivities.\
\
The mayor's wife wishes to speak with you.","Speak with the mayor's wife","A man standing near Gareth Rust beckons you.\
\
You should speak with the man near Gareth Rust.","Speak with Cecil Voller at the Snowball Field","You should return to the mayor, for you have now seen more of Winter-home than intended....","Speak with someone from Winter-home to continue your tour","The Eating Contest begins at Ona Kay, the first Announcer.","Speak with the hobbit-announcer about the Theatre Event","Speak with the man near Gareth Rust; he seems to have something to say","You are welcomed with open arms to the fine Yule Festival of Winter-home","You should find your next destination on your tour of the town. Maybe one of the helpful servants knows what you should look at next?","Mabel Mitford has suggested that you might like to visit the Snowball Fight","The hobbit-announcer of the travelling theatre can be found in Winter-home.\
\
You should speak with the hobbit-announcer about the Theatre event.","The Yule Celebration of Winter-home","Speak with the mayor of Winter-home about the festivities","The workers here seem bitter cold, and their faces show signs of hunger"}},
[13395]={nameES="The Zhélruka Clan: Gathering Gems",objectivesES={}},
[13396]={nameES="Theft Beyond Measure",objectivesES={}},
[13397]={nameES="Their Best Interests",objectivesES={"The Uruk-hai named Matum, Urbhár, and Golb can be found somewhere within the Ring of Isengard.","You have defeated your opponent","Morflak's lackey is waiting to speak with you.","The Uruk-hai named Gluthrak, Hoital, and Farmak can be found somewhere within the Ring of Isengard.\
\
Morflak's lackey wants you to fight one of the Uruk-hai named by his boss in order to quell any challenges to his power.","Morflak's lackey has some more names for you.","Morflak's lackey has given you the names of some Uruk-hai his boss does not trust and that he wants you to punish.","Find and challenge Gluthrak, Hoital, or Farmak","Their Best Interests","Find and challenge Matum, Urbhár, or Golb","Talk to Morflak's lackey"}},
[13398]={nameES="Sus Propias Armas",objectivesES={"Envenena los sacos de huevos de las arañas","Deberías usar los colmillos que recogiste para envenenar los sacos de huevos de las arañas de los Valles Trenzados","Sus Propias Armas","Los sacos de huevos de las proles trampilla y roñecarne se encuentran en los Valles Trenzados, en la esquina noroeste del Bosque de los Trolls Norte, al norte del campamento de Thoroniel.\
\
Deberías usar los colmillos que recogiste para envenenar los sacos de huevos de las arañas de los Valles Trenzados","Los sacos de huevos de las proles trampilla y roñecarne se encuentran en los Valles Trenzados, en la esquina noroeste del Bosque de los Trolls Norte, al norte del campamento de Thoroniel.\
\
Deberías usar los colmillos que recogiste para envenenar los sacos de huevos de las arañas de los Valles Trenzados\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Nota: Esta misión está pensada para una comunidad completa.</rgb>","Las proles de los Valles Trenzados podrían ser vulnerables al veneno de la otra.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Nota: Esta misión está pensada para una comunidad completa.</rgb>"}},
[13399]={nameES="Historia de una ida y una vuelta",objectivesES={"Culang el montaraz ha sabido de un gran tesoro enterrado hace mucho tiempo por un terrateniente Dúnadan y quiere recuperarlo antes de que lo encuentren los saqueadores de tumbas.","Percibes algo en lo que no reparaste en tu primer examen del hito de piedra... un pequeño bloque extraíble de la parte trasera del mismo hito.\
\
Dentro del hueco hay un libro mohoso.","Lleva el libro mohoso a Culang","Libro mohoso recuperado","La inscripción de este hito de piedra es apenas legible, pero consigues descrifrar estas palabras:\
\
   \\qEl final de tu búsqueda está donde empezaste.\
   Mi tesoro siempre estuvo ahí, pero en él no reparaste.\\q\
\
Este nuevo acertijo podría revelar la verdadera localización del tesoro.","Encuentra la solución al acertijo","El tesoro podría estar bajo otro hito de piedra en algún lugar de Evendim, según dice este acertijo:\
\
   \\qEl final de tu búsqueda está donde empezaste.\
   Mi tesoro siempre estuvo ahí, pero en él no reparaste.\\q\
\
Debes examinar el hito cuando lo encuentres en busca de alguna pista sobre la localización del tesoro.","Culang está en el campamento de montaraces de la isla de Tinnudir, al oeste de la encrucijada de Canadiach.\
\
Has encontrado un compartimento en el interior del hito de piedra que creías que marcaba la localización del tesoro y has recuperado un libro mohoso del escondite. Deberías llevar este libro a Culang.","Historia de una ida y una vuelta"}},
[13400]={nameES="Historia de un Cacareo ida y vuelta",objectivesES={"Piensas que quizás ha llegado el momento de escapar del gallinero del Granjero Arenilla.","Examina a George","George parece increíblemente agitado por algo y bate las alas con desenfreno.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>¡ADVERTENCIA: Esta misión inicia una misión especial de sesión. Cerrarás sesión con tu personaje normal y adoptarás la apariencia de un pnj amistoso para el jugador. Obtendrás un conjunto de habilidades únicas para este personaje especial!</rgb>","Historia de un Cacareo ida y vuelta","Tras haber probado un poco de libertad, deseas más.","George bate las alas con frenesí."}},
[13401]={nameES="Historia de un Cacareo ida y vuelta",objectivesES={"Viaja a La Carroca","Viaja a Erebor, La Montaña Solitaria","Erebor es un lugar encantador.","Historia de un Cacareo ida y vuelta","El Granjero Arenilla no está mirando. Ahora es tu oportunidad de escapar.","Este puede ser un momento maravilloso para explorar la Tierra Media.","Encuentra la Casa de Beorn","Siéntate en el trono bajo la montaña","Bueno, entonces es hora de volver a casa","Los Valles del Anduin son un lugar encantador."}},
[13402]={nameES="There is Gold in the Hills",objectivesES={"Frithgeir is at Zudrugund in Thror's Coomb in Enedwaith.\
\
Ariene found a powerful weapon in the hills of Enedwaith and believes Frithgeir may know where to find more.","Talk to Frithgeir at Zudrugund","There is Gold in the Hills","There are tales of powerful weapons and armour in the hills of Enedwaith that might prove to be useful in the battles to come."}},
[13403]={nameES="No hay lugar como el hogar",objectivesES={"Ahora tienes un lugar al que llamar hogar, pero se vería aún mejor con algunas bonitas decoraciones.","Barthavron se encuentra en la plaza del mercado de la residencia de Falathlorn.\
\
Barchiril te ha enviado para que hables con su amigo Barthavron.","No hay lugar como el hogar"}},
[13404]={nameES="Ahí está el problema",objectivesES={"Los gusanos de las profundidades de las Profundidades Llameantes se han estado reproduciendo a un ritmo alarmante. La población de estas criaturas debe mantenerse bajo control.","Ölfun está en el Cruce de las Cenizas, al sureste de Tanunshush.\
\
Ölfun querrá saber que has destruido muchos huevos de gusanos de las profundidades, contribuyendo a reducir su población en las Profundidades Llameantes.","Ahí está el problema","Los gusanos de las profundidades guardan sus huevos en Tanunshush, al noroeste del Cruce de las Cenizas, al norte de La Escalera Ardiente.\
\
La población de gusanos de las profundidades debe mantenerse bajo control destruyendo sus huevos.","Habla con Ölfun en el Cruce de las Cenizas"}},
[13405]={nameES="Hay algo en estos pasillos",objectivesES={"Entrega los picos enanos a Henir en Iorvinas.","Los orcos se pueden encontrar en Iorvinas.\
\
Henir cree que hay algo de valor dentro de las ruinas donde se esconde. No cree que los orcos puedan conseguir los materiales por sí mismos y quiere saber si los Duramano les están proporcionando las herramientas necesarias para su trabajo.","Preocupados por la posibilidad de que los Duramano y los orcos hayan llegado a algún acuerdo, los enanos de una expedición a Rivendel han venido hacia el oeste para investigar unas ruinas.","Hay algo en estos pasillos"}},
[13406]={nameES="There's Always One...",objectivesES={"Defeated the traitor","Find and defeat the traitor","There's Always One...","Someone within Dol Amroth has sold the city out and sided with the Corsairs.","The traitor is likely hanging around near the Great Hall."}},
[13407]={nameES="No hay lugar como el hogar",objectivesES={"Ahora tienes un lugar al que llamar hogar, pero sería aún mejor con algunas buenas decoraciones","Rambi se encuentra en la plaza del mercado dentro de la residencia del Mansión de Thorin.\
\
Rúni te ha dicho que hables con su amigo Rambi sobre cómo adquirir bienes para tu casa.","No hay lugar como el hogar"}},
[13408]={nameES="No hay lugar como el hogar",objectivesES={"Ahora tienes un sitio al que llamar hogar, pero sería aún mejor con unas buenas decoraciones.","Rolf Ciñatiesa está en la plaza del mercado de la residencia de Cavada Grande\
\
Andy Tejonera te ha pedido que hables con Rolf Ciñatiesa, un decorador que podría ayudarte a amueblar tu hogar.","No hay lugar como el hogar"}},
[13409]={nameES="No hay lugar como el hogar",objectivesES={"Ahora tienes un lugar al que llamar hogar, pero sería aún más agradable con algunas buenas decoraciones.","Bill Ramaje está en la plaza del mercado de la residencia de Bree.\
\
Nan Pollomadera te ha enviado a hablar con Bill Ramaje con la esperanza de que pueda ayudarte a amueblar tu casa.","No hay lugar como el hogar"}},
[13410]={nameES="These People Be Pests",objectivesES={}},
[13411]={nameES="These Trees are Alive!",objectivesES={}},
[13412]={nameES="They All Fall Down",objectivesES={"A piece of falling stone nearly misses you!","Examine the first site","Examine the third site","These braces are under stress","Return to Birási","The stone has shifted, but the brace is holding","This wall is stable","Examine the fourth site","Examine the fifth site","Though the repair crew has worked tirelessly to shore up the walls and crumbled buildings of the Harlond, time, weather, and underlying issues can still lead to instabilities.","An angry buzzing fills the air!","You have examined Birási's assigned inspection sites. You should let him know what you found.\
\
Birási is in the Harlond.","This wall looks structurally sound","They All Fall Down","Examine the second site","Examine the sixth site","Birási has asked you to inspect the braces supporting walls and other stonework at various sites in the Harlond."}},
[13413]={nameES="They Deserve a Better Fate",objectivesES={"Free the farmers (0/4)","The farmers have been through enough and should be freed from captivity. Their captor, Laudh, must be close by. Perhaps the farmers can sneak out unnoticed once freed.","After being freed, the farmers have likely made their way back to the safety of Forlaw. You should head to the tavern since after surviving such an ordeal, some ale would look promising to anyone.","They Deserve a Better Fate","Speak with Gárwig in Lornsettle","Gárwig is in Lornsettle, the mead hall of Forlaw. He will be happy to know the farmers have safely returned.","The farmers of the Fallows were captured by the Lieutenant of Núrzum at Thrymm's Farm. If they still live, they are probably being held captive somewhere in Gárnoth's Farm.","The farmers survived their capture at Thrymm's Farm. They appear to be relatively healthy, all things considered. After all they have been through, they should at least have their freedom."}},
[13414]={nameES="Minaron demasiado rápido",objectivesES={"Habla con Gufi en Menem-berej","Gufi se encuentra en el campamento de Menem-berej, en el centro de las Vetas del Cuerno de Plata.\
\
Deberías hablar con Gufi para viajar hasta el posible yacimiento minero.","Gufi se encuentra en el campamento de Menem-berej, en el centro de las Vetas del Cuerno de Plata.\
\
Deberías hablar con Gufi sobre la expedición de exploración.","Habla con Gufi para viajar a la mina","A pesar del miedo que sentiste, Gufi quiere que explores una antigua mina que fue asaltada por la expedición de Balin.","Minaron demasiado rápido"}},
[13415]={nameES="Espían desde las alturas",objectivesES={"Naethmunn está en el campamento de montaraces de la isla de Tinnudir, en Evendim, al suroeste de Barad Rath.\
\
Debes informar de tu victoria sobre Jabo Sotosombrío a Naethmunn.","Naethmunn te ha pedido que derrotes a Jabo Sotosombrío, un líder de los saqueadores de tumbas que a menudo planea sus actividades desde lo alto de Barad Rath, en Tyrn Fornech.","Jabo Sotosombrío planea los ataques de su banda desde lo alto de Barad Rath, un promontorio plano de piedra sobre las altas colinas de Tyrn Fornech, al noreste de Tinnudir y al norte de Tham Ornen.\
\
El montaraz Naethmunn te ha pedido que encuentres y derrotes a Jabo Sotosombrío, el líder de una banda de los saqueadores de tumbas que han sido una plaga para los montaraces de Evendim durante mucho tiempo.","Espían desde las alturas"}},
[13416]={nameES="Piel Gruesa",objectivesES={}},
[13417]={nameES="El Azote de los Ladrones",objectivesES={"Habla con Eliot Bencroft en Rantost","Habla con Leighton Kipps y ayuda a los Montaraces","Leighton Kipps está en el campamento de los espías en el sureste de Rantost.\
\
Leighton Kipps está esperando para dar la señal a los Montaraces para asaltar Rantost.","El Azote de los Ladrones","Eliot Bencroft está en el sureste de Rantost.\
\
Eliot Bencroft se alegrará de saber que los Montaraces pudieron recuperar sus reliquias y que los espías pueden regresar a Ost Forod.","Un grupo de Montaraces está preparado para lanzar un asalto sobre la isla de Rantost, actualmente en manos de saqueadores de tumbas."}},
[13418]={nameES="Recompensa del Cazador de Ladrones",objectivesES={"Recompensa del Cazador de Ladrones","Saqueadores de tumbas y bandidos abundan en Evendim, saqueando las tumbas de los Dúnedain.","Esto parece que podría ser una trampa...","El campamento de los ladrones está en una pequeña isla en la desembocadura del río Brandivino en el lago Evendim.\
\
Tras haber derrotado a los bandidos en la isla de Rantost, te han enviado a otro pequeño campamento de bandidos, con la esperanza de que puedas recuperar más tesoros robados.","Has descubierto una emboscada de saqueadores de tumbas.","Recupera el tesoro robado","Balchelos está de regreso en Tinnudir.\
\
Has logrado superar la emboscada de los saqueadores de tumbas y debes informar del incidente a Balchelos."}},
[13419]={nameES="Robo y Travesura",objectivesES={"<rgb=#00FF00>Has recuperado el patio</rgb>","Reclama el callejón embrujado","Reclama el patio","<rgb=#00FF00>Has recuperado el Ayuntamiento y liberado el sur de Bree.</rgb>","<rgb=#00FF00>Has recuperado la Puerta Sur de Bree.</rgb>","Con la Puerta Sur recuperada, puedes avanzar hacia el patio sur y el Salón de Subastas, un centro crucial de comercio.","Reclama el Salón de Subastas","El camino hacia el norte ha sido bloqueado y atrincherado con enormes montículos de nieve; tendrás que dirigirte al oeste por el callejón embrujado.","Solo queda reclamar el Ayuntamiento y ver ondear sobre él la bandera de Bree.","Robo y Travesura","<rgb=#00FF00>Has recuperado el callejón embrujado.</rgb>","Recuperar la Cárcel proporcionará un lugar adecuado para encerrar a quienes queden cuando la ciudad vuelva a estar bajo control de los Pueblos Libres.","Mientras los Montaraces del Norte estaban distraídos en el Sur, unos bandidos aprovecharon la oportunidad para arrebatar el control de Bree....","Reclama el Ayuntamiento","eclama la Cárcel","Sin el control del patio, no puedes esperar asaltar y recuperar el Ayuntamiento.","<rgb=#00FF00>Has recuperado la Cárcel.</rgb>","Reclama la Puerta Sur","<rgb=#00FF00>Has recuperado el Salón de Subastas</rgb>","El primer paso para expulsar a los bandidos de Bree es recuperar la Puerta Sur y obtener acceso a la ciudad."}},
[13420]={nameES="Robos y travesuras: Incursión",objectivesES={"Robos y travesuras: Incursión","Mientras los Montaraces del Norte estaban distraídos en el Sur, unos bandidos aprovecharon la oportunidad para arrebatar el control de Bree....","Completa 'Robos y travesuras' con un grupo de incursión"}},
[13421]={nameES="Thievery on the River",objectivesES={}},
[13422]={nameES="Thievery on the Thoroughfare",objectivesES={}},
[13423]={nameES="Thieves Among the Webs",objectivesES={"You have left the Kinta bracelet in the strongbox at Laivárth, where it can be retrieved by one of the people to whom it should be entrusted.","You find a bracelet engraved with Kinta writing clutched in the hand of the corpse","You pry open the webbed cocoon, but the spiders' victim has already succumbed to death. You decide to rid Narchásh of these many-legged killers, and to seek for any survivors.","Thieves Among the Webs","The nearest grove of the Kintai should be Laivárth, located to the north-east of Narchásh. The Elves there will have a strongbox in which you can deposit the Kinta bracelet.","Examine the cocooned body","Leave the Kinta bracelet in a strongbox at Laivárth, the Kinta grove to the north-east","The spiders of Narchásh snare their victims in cocoons.","Examine another cocooned body at Narchásh","You have decided to combat the spiders of Narchásh and search for any survivors of their deadly hunger.","Completado","You add the Kinta bracelet you found at Narchásh to the strongbox, leaving it with your wish that it will be claimed by one of the Kintai who will admire its beauty and find meaning in its craftsmanship.","At Narchásh, as elsewhere in Middle-earth, folk run afoul of the spiders, losing their lives and their possessions."}},
[13424]={nameES="Thieves From Harad",objectivesES={}},
[13425]={nameES="Thieves and Trophy-takers",objectivesES={"Completado","Collect trophy-beards from the Ufúrzrak at Muru Azog","Although the halls of Khazad-dûm still teem with Orcs, you have done much to avenge the defilement of your kin and cousins' remains at Azanulbizar. The Orcs will take no trophies from the Haban'akkâ!","Thieves and Trophy-takers","Trophy-beards are carried by the Ufúrzrak at Muru Azog, before the East-gate of Nud-mekhem at Azanulbizar.\
\
You should collect trophy-beards from the Ufúrzrak.","The Orcs of the Ufúrzrak take the beards of fallen dwarves as trophies to bear into battle against the Haban'akkâ.","You have collected many trophy-beards from the Orcs of the Ufúrzrak at Muru Azog.","Encamped in the very shadows of Nud-mekhem, the East-gate, the Orcs of the Ufúrzrak have laid claim to Khazad-dûm in the name of their chieftain, Azog. It has been discovered that many of the Orcs have taken to severing the beards of slain dwarves to carry as trophies into battle at Azanulbizar. It is a dishonour to the dead and all the dwarves of the Haban'akkâ!\
\
You should collect trophy-beards claimed by the Orcs of the Ufúrzrak at Muru Azog."}},
[13426]={nameES="Thieves at the Galtrev Lumber-camp",objectivesES={"Thieves at the Galtrev Lumber-camp","Talk to Fraid at his waggon","Fraid awaits you near his broken waggon in Pren Gwydh, not far from the Galtrev Lumber-camp.\
\
You should speak with Fraid and let him know that the woods are a little safer now.","Dragon-clan brigands and thieves roam the Galtrev Lumber-camp.\
\
You should defeat a number of Dunlending thieves to secure the Galtrev Lumber-camp.","A shipment of wood from the Galtrev Lumber-camp was meant to arrive at Galtrev quite a while ago, but it was held up when the waggon-driver was attacked by hostile Dunlendings."}},
[13427]={nameES="Ladrones de la Antigüedad",objectivesES={"Los corsarios umbari están robando artefactos del lado de los Ambarûli del Muro de Telperiën.","Derrota a los corsarios ladrones para evitar que desentierren más artefactos y recoge las reliquias que ya han descubierto para devolverlas a los Ambarûli.","Ladrones de la Antigüedad"}},
[13428]={nameES="Thieves of Harad",objectivesES={"Gorhir can be found in Halach in south-eastern Upper Lebennin.\
\
You have recovered many of the stolen goods and should now return them to Gorhir in Halach.","Haradrim archers can be found to the east and north-east of Halach in Upper Lebennin.\
\
Gorhir has asked you to recover goods stolen by Haradrim archers in their last raid against Halach.","Thieves of Harad","The Haradrim in Upper Lebennin have taken much from the people of Halach, and now these folk would see it returned.","Deliver the recovered goods to Gorhir in Halach"}},
[13429]={nameES="Thieving Orcs",objectivesES={}},
[13430]={nameES="Thieving and Looting",objectivesES={}},
[13431]={nameES="Thikil-gundu, the Steel Keep (Tier 1)",objectivesES={"The remains of Frór, lost son of Dáin I, fall lifeless to the ground...","Athramóth has been defeated!","Defeat the inhabitants of Thikil-gundu, the Steel Keep.","Defeat Athramóth","In the wake of Vethúg Wintermind's defeat at Erebor, Nori set forth with a small company to reclaim the lost hoards of Thikil-gundu. However, great wealth is not all that remains hidden in its frozen halls, and the Dwarves of the North shall soon have to contend with the true master of Thikil-gundu.","Defeat Frór the Lost","Thikil-gundu, the Steel Keep (Tier 1)","Defeat Karkasht Crow-feeder","Karkasht Crow-feeder has been defeated!","Defeat Karazgar, the Weeping Warrior"}},
[13432]={nameES="Thikil-gundu, the Steel Keep (Tier 2)",objectivesES={"The remains of Frór, lost son of Dáin I, fall lifeless to the ground...","Athramóth has been defeated!","Defeat the inhabitants of Thikil-gundu, the Steel Keep.","Defeat Athramóth","In the wake of Vethúg Wintermind's defeat at Erebor, Nori set forth with a small company to reclaim the lost hoards of Thikil-gundu. However, great wealth is not all that remains hidden in its frozen halls, and the Dwarves of the North shall soon have to contend with the true master of Thikil-gundu.","Defeat Frór the Lost","Defeat Karkasht Crow-feeder","Karkasht Crow-feeder has been defeated!","Thikil-gundu, the Steel Keep (Tier 2)","Defeat Karazgar, the Weeping Warrior"}},
[13433]={nameES="Thikil-gundu, the Steel Keep (Tier 3)",objectivesES={"The remains of Frór, lost son of Dáin I, fall lifeless to the ground...","Athramóth has been defeated!","Defeat the inhabitants of Thikil-gundu, the Steel Keep.","Defeat Athramóth","Defeat Karazgar, the Weeping Warrior","Defeat Frór the Lost","In the wake of Vethúg Wintermind's defeat at Erebor, Nori set forth with a small company to reclaim the lost hoards of Thikil-gundu. However, great wealth is not all that remains hidden in its frozen halls, and the Dwarves of the North shall soon have to contend with the true master of Thikil-gundu.","Defeat Karkasht Crow-feeder","Karkasht Crow-feeder has been defeated!","Thikil-gundu, the Steel Keep (Tier 3)"}},
[13434]={nameES="Thikil-gundu: Culling the Gundabad",objectivesES={"Defeat invaders within Thikil-gundu","Deep within the Grey Mountains lies Thikil-gundu. It is home to tomes of knowledge, long thought lost.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Warning: This quest requires Thikil-gundu: Deep Inside the Keep to be underway. If that quest has been completed or failed, you will be unable to exit and re-enter this instance in order to complete this quest.</rgb>","Invaders within Thikil-gundu have been defeated.","Thikil-gundu: Culling the Gundabad","Completado"}},
[13435]={nameES="Thikil-gundu: Deep Inside the Keep",objectivesES={"Defeat Zánmog","Talk to Stráhek the Stout","You ran out of time...","Deep within the Grey Mountains lies Thikil-gundu. It is home to tomes of knowledge, long thought lost.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Warning: This quest has a one hour time limit. The timer will begin upon accepting the quest.</rgb>","You should return to to Stráhek the Stout in Skarháld and let him know of your success.","Defeated Zánmog","Thikil-gundu: Deep Inside the Keep","Defeat Zánmog within Thikil-gundu."}},
[13436]={nameES="Thikil-gundu: Long Thought Lost",objectivesES={"Deep within the Grey Mountains lies Thikil-gundu. It is home to tomes of knowledge, long thought lost.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Warning: This quest requires Thikil-gundu: Deep Inside the Keep to be underway. If that quest has been completed or failed, you will be unable to exit and re-enter this instance in order to complete this quest.</rgb>","Gather tomes of knowledge.","You have gathered tomes of knowledge.","Thikil-gundu: Long Thought Lost","Completado"}},
[13437]={nameES="Thin the Pack",objectivesES={"Thin the Pack","The Wargs make their den in Naur-hoit, south of Mithechad.\
\
Perindúr has asked you to hunt down and defeat the Wargs of the Ashenslades.","Talk to Perindúr at Mithechad","Perindúr is at Mithechad, north of Naur-hoit.\
\
You should return to Perindúr with news of your success against the Wargs of the Ashenslades.","Naur-hoit, the ruins south of Mithechad, is home to a roving pack of Wargs."}},
[13438]={nameES="Thin the Ranks",objectivesES={}},
[13439]={nameES="Objetos olvidados",objectivesES={"Objetos olvidados","Maedlathron teme que los hobbits o Gimli el enano puedan haber dejado caer algo más durante su viaje que pueda revelar al Enemigo el camino de su paso y la composición de la Compañía.","Golgallon se encuentra en Echad Eregion, al sureste de Gwingris.\
\
Maedlathron te ha pedido que adviertas a Golgallon que la Compañía puede haber dejado más señales de su paso en la naturaleza.","Habla con Golgallon en Echad Eregion"}},
[13440]={nameES="Think Like an Orc",objectivesES={}},
[13441]={nameES="Pensando por Adelantado",objectivesES={"Los osos y lobos pueden encontrarse en las colinas del norte de Annúndir, al oeste de Ost Lagoros.\
\
Orthonn desea enviar pieles calientes a los refugiados protegidos por Amarion en Amon Raith.","Orthonn te espera en Ost Lagoros, al sureste de Annúndir y al otro lado del río.\
\
Debes llevarle las pieles que has reunido.","Orthonn te ha pedido reunir pieles para enviarlas a los refugiados de Amon Raith en estos tiempos difíciles, y Annúndir está lleno de bestias salvajes con pieles ideales.","Pensando por Adelantado","Lleva las pieles que reuniste a Orthonn"}},
[13442]={nameES="Pensando por Adelantado",objectivesES={}},
[13443]={nameES="Thinning Their Ranks",objectivesES={}},
[13444]={nameES="Thinning the Force",objectivesES={}},
[13445]={nameES="Reduciendo la Horda",objectivesES={"Donaith se encuentra en Gath Forthnír.\
\
Regresa con Donaith en el este de Angmar y cuéntale tus hazañas.","El montañés llamado Donaith está preocupado por los orcos en las cercanías de Urugarth y Carn Dûm.","Reduciendo la Horda","Urugarth y Carn Dûm se encuentran al oeste de Gath Forthnír.\
\
Donaith te pidió que apoyaras la causa de su pueblo y derrotaras a los orcos que se reúnen en Urugarth o Carn Dûm."}},
[13446]={nameES="Thinning the Thornholt",objectivesES={"You have defeated many Taurogrim in Thornholt.","The Taurogrim are a vicious tribe of Wood-trolls that have infested the woods of Thornholt. The fewer there are, the safer it will be for the dwarves to gather wood here.","Completado","Thinning the Thornholt","The Taurogrim are a vicious tribe of Wood-trolls that have infested the woods of Thornholt."}},
[13447]={nameES="This Is Rakhatâb",objectivesES={}},
[13448]={nameES="This is Not the Work of a Cook",objectivesES={"Defeated the goblin-cook","This is Not the Work of a Cook","Spice the stew and defeat the goblin-cook","The insane goblin-cook who came up with the vile brew is a deadly threat to any living being.","Talk to Ondor in Nan Curunir","Ondor is encamped near the caves of western Nan Curunir.\
\
You should let Ondor know that the goblin-cook has cooked his last stew.","The dreadful goblin-cook is constantly at work in his kitchens in the caves of western Nan Curunir.\
\
Ondor suggests that if you can slip the goblin-cook's deadly spice into his stew-pot, it may weaken him enough that you can readily defeat him.","Wait for the goblin-cook to taste his brew"}},
[13449]={nameES="Hidromiel de cardo",objectivesES={"Lleva los cardos afilados a Thrasi","Hidromiel de cardo","Encontraste el cadáver de un conejo con el que alimentar a la madre lince. Pero aún no parece estar lo suficientemente bien para cazar por sí misma.","Hay cardos afilados alrededor del bosque al norte de la cabaña de Thrasi.\
\
Thrasi te pidió que recolectaras cardos afilados para preparar una pócima que cure las heridas de la madre lince."}},
[13450]={nameES="El nombre mancillado de Cardoso",objectivesES={"Thomas Cardoso ha recibido una carta de Anlaf el Despojado en la Posada Abandonada, hablando de una deuda y de un hombre que empleó para reunir artefactos de la región.","Entrega la carta de Cardoso a Anlaf el Despojado","Anlaf el Despojado se encuentra en la Posada Abandonada, al este, a lo largo del Gran Camino del Este.\
\
Thomas Cardoso te ha pedido que lleves una carta a Anlaf el Despojado, propietario de la Posada, prometiendo el pago de una deuda contraída por un hombre que contrató para reunir reliquias antiguas en su nombre.","El nombre mancillado de Cardoso"}},
[13451]={nameES="Tholmuzog: Blades of Gorgar",objectivesES={}},
[13452]={nameES="Tholmuzog: Supply Lines",objectivesES={}},
[13453]={nameES="La Última Esperanza de Thorgest",objectivesES={"Lleva el antídoto Colmillo de Hielo a Afwald","Averigua si Jakka de los Gauredain lleva un antídoto","Thorgest está en su morada, junto con Afwald.\
\
Afwald te ha dicho que Thorgest se desvanece rápidamente y que debes administrarle el antídoto antes de que sea demasiado tarde.","Los campamentos gauradan están al sur de la morada de Thorgest.\
\
Afwald te ha pedido que busques al gran invocador espiritual de los Gauredain con la última esperanza de que posea la cura para el veneno que está matando lentamente a Thorgest.","La Última Esperanza de Thorgest","Thorgest gime casi inaudiblemente, y no has encontrado nada que alivie su sufrimiento.","Administra el antídoto Colmillo de Hielo a Thorgest","Thorgest ha sido envenenado por los Gauredain, y Afwald, el asistente de Thorgest, cree que el gran invocador espiritual de los Gauredain podría tener la clave para curarlo.","Has encontrado el antídoto Colmillo de Hielo","Afwald está en la morada de Thorgest, al norte de los campamentos gauradan.\
\
Debes llevar el antídoto Colmillo de Hielo a Afwald antes de que Thorgest sucumba al veneno."}},
[13454]={nameES="Thorin's Hall I",objectivesES={}},
[13455]={nameES="Thorin's Hall II",objectivesES={}},
[13456]={nameES="Thorin's Hall III",objectivesES={}},
[13457]={nameES="Thorin's Hall IV",objectivesES={}},
[13458]={nameES="Tarea de la Mansión de Thorin: Piel de albino",objectivesES={"Has aceptado la tarea de entregar la piel de albino de los sierpes que se encuentran en los confines orientales de las Montañas Nubladas a Afwald. Afwald se puede encontrar dentro de las ruinas de Hrimbarg, también en las Montañas Nubladas.","Afwald, el aprovisionador de la ruina enana de Hrimbarg, espera el regreso de la piel de albino.","Se busca: Piel de albino de los sierpes en los confines orientales de las Montañas Nubladas. Puedes entregar estos artículos a Afwald dentro de las ruinas de Hrimbarg en las Montañas Nubladas.","Tarea de la Mansión de Thorin: Piel de albino","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Se busca: Piel de albino de los sierpes en los confines orientales de las Montañas Nubl-adas.","Entregar la piel de albino a Afwald dentro de las ruinas de Hrimbarg en las Montañas Nubladas"}},
[13459]={nameES="Tarea de la Mansión de Thorin: Dagas Rotas",objectivesES={"Tarea de la Mansión de Thorin: Dagas Rotas","Se busca: Dagas rotas de los Duramano en Ered Luin.","Entregar las dagas rotas a Dorri en Gondamon","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir dagas rotas. Debes entregárselas a Dorri en la puerta oeste de Gondamon para ganar el favor de la Mansión de Thorin.","Se busca: Dagas rotas de los Duramano en Ered Luin. Recógelas y entrégaselas a Dorri en Gondamon para ganar el favor de la Mansión de Thorin.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Dorri quiere dagas rotas. Se puede encontrar a Dorri de pie en la puerta oeste de Gondamon."}},
[13460]={nameES="Tarea de la Mansión de Thorin: Mandobles rotos",objectivesES={"Se busca: Mandobles rotos de los orcos que rodean Gabilshathûr. La entrega de los artículos debe hacerse a Avar en el puesto de avanzada enano.","Los enanos de Gabilshathûr esperan que se le haga una entrega de mandobles rotos a Avar.","Has aceptado una tarea para recolectar y entregar mandobles rotos de los orcos que rodean Gabilshathûr a Avar en el puesto de avanzada enano.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Se busca: Mandobles rotos de los orcos que rodean Gabilshathûr.","Tarea de la Mansión de Thorin: Mandobles rotos","Entrega los mandobles rotos a Avar en Gabilshathûr en Angmar"}},
[13461]={nameES="Tarea de la Mansión de Thorin: Mandobles rotos",objectivesES={"Has aceptado la tarea de recoger y entregar mandobles rotos de los Duramano y Gauredain que rodean Zigilgund en Forochel. Los artículos deben ser entregados al supervisor enano Fotri acampado en el hogar de los enanos.","Se busca: Mandobles rotos de los Duramano y Gauredain que rodean el hogar de los enanos de Zigilgund. Entregue los artículos a Fotri, supervisor del asentamiento.","Tarea de la Mansión de Thorin: Mandobles rotos","Fotri, supervisor de los enanos de Forochel, espera la entrega de mandobles rotos en el hogar de los enanos de Zigilgund.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Entrega los mandobles rotos a Fotri en Zigilgund en Forochel"}},
[13462]={nameES="Tarea de la Mansión de Thorin: Mandobles rotos",objectivesES={"Entregar los mandobles rotos a Afwald dentro de las ruinas de Hrimbarg en las Montañas Nubladas","Se busca: Mandobles rotos de los Gauredain y trasgos en los confines orientales de las Montañas Nubladas. Puedes entregar estos artículos a Afwald dentro de las ruinas de Hrimbarg en las Montañas Nubladas.","Se busca: Mandobles rotos de los Gauredain y trasgos en los confines orientales de las Montañas Nubladas.","Has aceptado la tarea de entregar mandobles rotos de los Gauredain y trasgos que se encuentran en los confines orientales de las Montañas Nubladas a Afwald. Afwald se puede encontrar dentro de las ruinas de Hrimbarg, también en las Montañas Nubladas.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Afwald, el aprovisionador de la ruina enana de Hrimbarg, espera el regreso de los mandobles rotos.","Tarea de la Mansión de Thorin: Mandobles rotos"}},
[13463]={nameES="Tarea de la Mansión de Thorin: Alabardas rotas",objectivesES={"Se busca: Alabardas rotas de los Hombres y trasgos de toda la Fuente del Bruinen. \
\
Los enanos de las Montañas Nubladas han solicitado una colección de alabardas rotas.","Se busca: Alabardas rotas de los Hombres y trasgos de toda la Fuente del Bruinen.","Tarea de la Mansión de Thorin: Alabardas rotas","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Las cajas de recolección para esta tarea se pueden encontrar en los campamentos dentro de las Montañas Nubladas.\
