[13525]={nameES="Aquellos que nunca salieron",objectivesES={"Completado","Las flores se pueden encontrar creciendo al sol en el Valle del Arroyo Sombrío, cerca de la Puerta Este de Moria.\
\
Debes recoger flores hermosas para tu tributo a tus compañeros caídos.","Se pueden encontrar viejos jarrones sin usar a lo largo de las escaleras este fuera de Moria, en el Valle del Arroyo Sombrío.\
\
Debes plantar las flores que recogiste en los jarrones para conmemorar a los enanos que perdieron la vida sin llegar a pasar la puerta este.","Has conmemorado adecuadamente a los enanos caídos de la expedición.\
\
Las flores brillantes crecerán aquí como la esperanza y el valor encendidos en el corazón de cada enano. Pueden haber perdido la vida, pero su legado vivirá.","Recoge flores para conmemorar a los enanos caídos","Debes recoger flores en el Valle del Arroyo Sombrío y plantarlas en la escalera este para conmemorar a los enanos que nunca lograron atravesar Moria.","Aquellos que nunca salieron","Has conmemorado adecuadamente a los enanos caídos de la expedición."}},
[13526]={nameES="Pensamientos del Hogar",objectivesES={"Bingo está en el camino que atraviesa la ciudad arruinada de Marton, en el Folde Oeste.","Te reuniste con Bingo y Crinloca, pero la experiencia aterradora ha dejado al hobbit con un nudo en el estómago y un anhelo por la comida de su hogar.","Habla con Bingo frente a la muralla del Abismo de Helm","Habla con Bingo fuera de Marton, en el Folde Oeste","Ella asiente a regañadientes y accede a ir a Bosque Oscuro, para buscar un nuevo hogar","La mujer te mira con los ojos llenos de lágrimas, y entiendes al instante que nunca vivió en otro lugar que no fuera Marton. Con palabras suaves, le dices que no estará a salvo aquí y le pides que vaya contigo y con Bingo a Bosque Oscuro, al sureste.\
\
'Mi hogar...', dice con tristeza.","Bingo nunca había visto antes a esta mujer, pero tú ya la has encontrado más de una vez. Su mirada es aturdida, y Clemencia contempla ahora la destrucción que las huestes de Saruman causaron en Marton, con el dolor marcado en su rostro.\
\
'No sabía a dónde ir', te dice, y nada más. Le dices que podría encontrar seguridad y un hogar propio en Bosque Oscuro, si está dispuesta a ir.","Habla con Bingo en el centro de Bosque Oscuro, en el Folde Oeste","Bingo quiere viajar al pueblo de Marton, al noreste del Abismo de Helm, en el Folde Oeste, para buscar algo de comida que calme su estómago hambriento.","Habla con Bingo en la ciudad de Marton, en el Folde Oeste","Revisas los escombros, pero no encuentras nada","Pensamientos del Hogar","Egwylf asiente en despedida y se dirige hacia la fortaleza","Egwylf ha decidido que ha llegado el momento de informar a Erkenbrand sobre el resultado de su misión buscando a los cultistas del Ojo Sangriento","Bingo está fuera de la gran muralla de la fortaleza del Abismo de Helm.","Bingo aprieta los puños con rabia","Bingo está en el centro de Bosque Oscuro, en el Folde Oeste.","Bingo está devastado por las pruebas de la destrucción de Marton y quiere que busques entre las ruinas a cualquier superviviente atrapado. También desea que derrotes a los enemigos que amenacen el Folde Oeste.","Habla con Egwylf frente a la muralla del Abismo de Helm","Bingo quiere reunirse contigo dentro del Salón de Hidromiel de Bosque Oscuro, ubicado en lo alto de la colina en el centro de Bosque Oscuro.","Clemencia no responde, pero vuelve a mirar hacia las ruinas ardientes","Bingo encontró a una mujer vagando entre las ruinas de Marton, en el Folde Oeste. Te pidió decirle que la llevarán a salvo a la ciudad de Bosque Oscuro.","Habla con Bingo dentro del Salón de Hidromiel de Bosque Oscuro","Habla con la mujer aturdida fuera de Marton"}},
[13527]={nameES="Thrain's Missing Scouts",objectivesES={}},
[13528]={nameES="Enhebrando las agujas (Diario)",objectivesES={"Entrega una caja de armadura tejida al líder del Gremio de Sastres de Umbar.","Fabrica una caja de armadura tejida para el Gremio de Sastres de Umbar.","El gremio de sastres de Umbar Baharbêl suministra ropa y tapices históricos por toda la ciudad. Estás poniendo de tu parte para ayudarles.","La receta necesaria para completar esta misión está disponible para su compra. <rgb=#00f000>Compra la receta de la misión al líder del gremio.</rgb>\
\
Empaqueta una caja de armadura tejida.","Proporciona la caja de armadura tejida al líder del Gremio de Sastres de Umbar.","Encajonada una caja de armadura tejida para el Gremio de Sastres de Umbar.","Enhebrando las agujas (Diario)"}},
[13529]={nameES="Enhebrando las agujas (Diario)",objectivesES={"Entrega una caja de armadura tejida al líder del Gremio de Sastres de Umbar.","Fabrica una caja de armadura tejida para el Gremio de Sastres de Umbar.","El gremio de sastres de Umbar Baharbêl suministra ropa y tapices históricos por toda la ciudad. Estás poniendo de tu parte para ayudarles.","La receta necesaria para completar esta misión está disponible para su compra. <rgb=#00f000>Compra la receta de la misión al líder del gremio.</rgb>\
\
Empaqueta una caja de armadura tejida.","Proporciona la caja de armadura tejida al líder del Gremio de Sastres de Umbar.","Encajonada una caja de armadura tejida para el Gremio de Sastres de Umbar.","Enhebrando las agujas (Diario)"}},
[13530]={nameES="Threads of Silk",objectivesES={}},
[13531]={nameES="Hilos del pasado",objectivesES={"El jirón de tapiz que has encontrado es antiguo y raído pero algunos detalles todavía se pueden distinguir. Quizá si encuentras más, podría ser de interés para los Montaraces de Tinnudir.","Lleva los fragmentos de tapices a Nadfaron","Los tapices descoloridos de Tham Nambarth hablan de una heráldica perdida hace mucho tiempo en Evendim.","Tham Nambarth está al este de Tinnudir.\
\
Debes buscar fragmentos de antiguos tapices para los Montaraces de Tinnudir.","Los Montaraces están en Tinnudir, al oeste de Tham Nambarth.\
\
Uno de los Montaraces de Tinnudir estará interesado en examinar los fragmentos de tapices que has recuperado.","Hilos del pasado"}},
[13532]={nameES="La amenaza del norte",objectivesES={"Ayuda a Erchiel con las reliquias de los Gauredain","Los Gauredain han empezado a avanzar poco a poco cada vez más hacia el sur, y ahora amenazan incluso las Agujas de la Linde.","Ayuda a Erchiel a cazar a los cazadores","La amenaza del norte","El campamento de los Gauredain está al norte de las Agujas de la Linde.","Ayuda a Remmenylf con las protecciones de los Gauredain","Erchiel está en las Agujas de la Linde.\
\
Erchiel querrá saber que las primeras tareas se han completado."}},
[13533]={nameES="La amenaza venida del sur",objectivesES={"La amenaza venida del sur","Lleva las armas de los Angmarim a Pasi","El campamento de los Angmarim está al sureste de Sûri-kylä, cerca del paso de Forodwaith.\
\
Pasi te ha pedido que le ayudes a derrotar a los Angmarim invasores.","Pasi está en Sûri-kylä, al noroeste del campamento Angmarim.\
\
Deberías volver inmeditamente a ver a Pasi y mostrarle las armas de los Angmarim.","Los Lossoth culpan al duro invierno de la invasión de los Angmarim y te han pedido tu ayuda para expulsarlos."}},
[13534]={nameES="Amenaza de fuego",objectivesES={"Los Orcos de los Ghâshfra se pueden encontrar por toda la Grieta de Nûrz Ghâshu.\
\
Hyrrokkin te ha pedido que derrotes a los Ghâshfra que han invadido la Grieta de Nûrz Ghâshu.","Amenaza de fuego","Los Ghâshfra, una raza de Orcos de fuego de Angmar, han invadido la Grieta de Nûrz Ghâshu."}},
[13535]={nameES="La amenaza de un buen puñetazo",objectivesES={"Habla con Derwent Correhuela y ayúdalo con su problema","Derwent Correhuela se encuentra fuera de la Cárcel de Bree.","Derwent Correhuela se encuentra en algún lugar fuera de la Cárcel de Bree, esperando que alguien lo ayude con una situación complicada.","Brom Barbadehalcón se encuentra en la Cárcel de Bree.","La amenaza de un buen puñetazo","Habla con Derwent Correhuela fuera de la Cárcel de Bree","Los Luchadores tienen fama en todas las tierras de la Tierra Media de estar siempre metidos en problemas, pero a veces pueden evitar males mayores con solo hacerse presentes."}},
[13536]={nameES="Threat of the Taurogrim",objectivesES={"Threat of the Taurogrim","Talk to Thorlind","Thorlind can be found near Tholkát.\
\
You should talk to Thorlind.","The Taurogrim have taken over an area of Eryn Lasgalen called Tholkát. Thorlind has asked you to defeat them so their evil cannot spread.","Taurogrim wood-trolls can be found in Tholkát, in northern Eryn Lasgalen.\
\
You should defeat wood-trolls in Tholkát."}},
[13537]={nameES="Threatening the Vandals",objectivesES={"Talk to Lanbert at the Cuthstan-camp","Lanbert is at the Rohirrim-camp at the base of the Cuthstan.\
\
You have thinned the numbers of the Orc-tribe, and Lanbert awaits your return.","The tribe of Orc-vandals is south-west of the Cuthstan.\
\
Lanbert has asked you to thin out the numbers of the Orc-tribe, in the hopes of scaring them from the area.","A band of disorganized Orcs has roamed into the areas south of the Cuthstan and has vandalized the monument. The leader of the Rohirrim there hopes that thinning the tribe's numbers may scare the rest of the Orcs into retreating from the area.","Threatening the Vandals"}},
[13538]={nameES="Amenazas y consecuencias",objectivesES={"Derrota a Dirk Espino","Dirk Espino está en el lado sur del muro en ruinas, al pie de las colinas que rodean las Quebradas de los Túmulos, al este del campamento de Adso.\
\
Adso teme que el líder bandido, Dirk Espino, regrese y mate a sus trabajadores durante la noche, y te pidió que te ocuparas de esta amenaza antes de que cumpla su amenaza.","Habla con Adso Henoloma","Adso espera tu regreso en su campamento junto al Gran Camino del Este.\
\
Los bandidos en el muro en ruinas demostraron no ser una verdadera amenaza y fueron eliminados con facilidad.","Dirk Espino derrotado","Amenazas y consecuencias","Los problemas de Adso se agravan a medida que los bandidos se vuelven más agresivos hacia el pobre hobbit."}},
[13539]={nameES="Threats to the Battlefield: Grush-and-Flak",objectivesES={"A fearsome two-headed troll Grush-and-Flak has been attacking a wide array of troops throughout the countryside. Find the creature and drive it from the battlefield.","Threats to the Battlefield: Grush-and-Flak","A fearsome two-headed troll named Grush-and-Flak has been routing a wide array of troops throughout the countryside. Find the creature and drive it from the battlefield.","Defeat Grush-and-Flak","Let Hlóthi know that Grush-and-Flak has been driven off.","The fearsome two-headed troll Grush-and-Flak has been attacking a wide array of troops throughout the countryside. Find the creature and drive it from the battlefield.","Within the troops pushing towards our encampment, the monstrous two-headed troll Grush-and-Flak has battered the forces of the Gabil'akkâ throughout the region. This horrific beast is said to have consumed several patrols during its reign of terror.","Defeated Grush-and-Flak","Speak to Hlóthi"}},
[13540]={nameES="Threats to the Battlefield: Hoshkhor, the Cruel Barb",objectivesES={"Hoshkhor has become a scourge throughout Elderslade. The Gabil'akkâ has learned to fear the creature as the field turns cold in its presence.\
\
This foul creature has routed several patrols throughout the area and has hindered supply lines for the war effort. The troops have been beset time and time again.\
\
You should seek out and defeat Hoskhor, the Cruel Barb.","With the routing of Hoshkhor, the Gabil'akkâ should be able to secure the supply lines throughout the region.","Hoshkhor, has become known to the gathered forces of Gabil'akkâ. This foul captain has routed several patrols throughout the area and has hindered supply lines for the war effort.","Hoshkhor, the Cruel Barb, has become known to the gathered forces of Gabil'akkâ. This foul creature has routed several patrols throughout the area, and has hindered supply lines for the war effort.","Hoshkhor has been defeated for now","Hoshkhor has become known to the gathered forces of Gabil'akkâ. This foul creature has routed several patrols throughout the area and has hindered supply lines for the war effort.","Defeat Hoshkhor","Speak to Hlóthi","Threats to the Battlefield: Hoshkhor, the Cruel Barb"}},
[13541]={nameES="Threats to the Battlefield: Mozlut",objectivesES={"The ferocious Warg Mozlut has been rampaging across Elderslade. This beast has struck fear in the hearts of many proud dwarves and feasted upon several patrols.\
\
Drive back this foul creature, so that patrols may resume throughout the area.","Defeat Mozlut","Threats to the Battlefield: Mozlut","Drove off Mozlut","Speak to Hlóthi","Find Hlóthi and inform him that you were able to drive off the beast.","Mozlut is an enormous Warg who has been rampaging across the battlefield. Drive off this foul beast."}},
[13542]={nameES="Threats to the Battlefield: Svalblóth",objectivesES={"Drive off Svalblóth","A foul drake that goes by Svalblóth has emerged from Gundabad. The survivors from several patrols claim that this creature ate half of their group and continued to maraud across the battlefield.","With this foul beast driven off, the Gabil'akkâ can continue its push toward the gates of Gundabad.","With Svalblóth driven off, return to Hlóthi, and let him know that deed has been done.","Drove off Svalblóth","Threats to the Battlefield: Svalblóth","Defeat Svalblóth","A foul drake that goes by Svalblóth has emerged from Gundabad. This creature is said to have decimated a series of patrols, and laid waste to several groups of proud dwarf warriors.\
\
Seek out this creature and drive it away from the battlefield.","Speak to Hlóthi"}},
[13543]={nameES="Three Dangerous Spots",objectivesES={"Talk to Scout-master Ausma","You have aided the dwarf scouts with their missions.\
\
You should talk to Scout-master Ausma in Bárgstad.","Three Dangerous Spots","Complete 'Lair of the Frost-horde' from Ausma","Ausma has sent her apprentices to several points of interest around the Pit of Stonejaws to investigate the plans of the hobgoblins and Angmarim.","Complete 'The Tombs of Akhaldarâg' from Ausma","Scout-master Ausma's apprentices have been sent to points of interest around the Pit of Stonejaws.\
\
You should find Kyrstig, Molkha, and Klúso and assist them with their missions.","Complete 'The Camps of Stazg Vozag' from Ausma"}},
[13544]={nameES="Three Faction Battle!",objectivesES={}},
[13545]={nameES="Three Proofs",objectivesES={"Having secured the pledge from the Easterling Lord Khôpol, you should return to Kurtil and the other forge-workers where they had been, on the height above Maudhúl Vôr.","You deliver the hail correctly and presently an Easterling Lord appears with several men","You begin to explain the case of the forge-workers, but he quickly interrupts you.\
\
'You speak as if the Eye was fallen. You speak as if the Cause was lost. This is not so and cannot be. How could it be, for the Black Gates still stand and the great banner still waves like a lone wing above the parade grounds. Why, only this morning I sent an Orc with a letter to the Black Word's commissary in Maudhúl Vôr. As sure as the ground I stand on, it has been delivered and needed provisions are on their way.'\
\
When you do not back down, he stares hard at you.\
\
'Folly! There is deceit afoot, if not by you, then by someone. I will send Yordam. He will go with you so that the truth may be known to me. Go.'","This is a good spot to hail the Easterlings","You should talk to the Easterling Lord who responded to your hailing, outside Rhûd Vorn, on the northern slopes of Udûn.","You have agreed to petition the Easterlings for a meeting with the forge-workers, so that they may beg safe passage out of Udûn.","Three Proofs","You should lead Yordam the Easterling to a view of the Black Gates, the Great Flag on the parade grounds, and seek the letter dispatched to Maudhúl Vôr.\
\
If you get separated from Yordam, wind his horn to call him back to you.","Now that you have found the fallen banner, the dead letter-bearer, and the Black Gates broken, you should talk to Yordam.\
\
If you get separated from Yordam, wind his horn to call him back to you.","The Orc messenger lies dead, the letter still in his hand","Talk to the Easterling Lord","You should hail the Easterlings as Kurtil taught you before their camp, Rhûd Vorn, on the northern slopes of Udûn.","Find the letter","Now that you have collected the proofs, you should return to Khôpol before Rhûd Vorn, on the northern slopes of Udûn.","DNT find quartermaster loc","<rgb=#FF00FF>Hail</rgb> the Easterlings before Rhûd Vorn","Talk to Yordam","Return to Kurtil","DNT banner loc","Return to Khôpol","Bring Yordam to the Black Gate","Find the great banner","The great banner lies torn and muddied on the ground"}},
[13546]={nameES="Tres partituras al viento",objectivesES={"Encontrada la segunda partitura de Burgthryth","Tres partituras al viento","Encuentra la primera partitura de Burgthryth","Encuentra la segunda partitura de Burgthryth","Llévale a Burgthryth las partituras de su himno a Jänis-leiri","Encontrada la primera partitura de Burgthryth","Encontrada la tercera partitura de Burgthryth","Encuentra la tercera partitura de Burgthryth","Burgthryth cree que la primera de sus partituras fue sacada de su mochila por un oso de la tundra. Tendrás que dar caza a estos animales hasta que encuentres al que se la robó, suponiendo que no la haya devorado ya.\
\
Los osos de la tundra pueden encontrarse en la tundra de Länsi-mâ.","Burgthryth te ha dicho que un peikko curioso podría haber cogido la segunda partitura de su himno mientras ella tocaba.\
\
Tendrás que dar caza al peikko que se la robó.\
\
Hay muchos peikko en una pequeña cueva al este de Zigilgund.","Burgthryth piensa que probablemente la tercera partitura de su himno se le cayó cuando era perseguida por cazadores Gauredain. Tendrás que dar caza a los Gauredain y recuperar esa partitura antes de que la usen como pañuelo... o algo peor.\
\
Los Gauredain pueden encontrarse en la tundra de Länsi-mâ.","Después de separarse del resto de su comunidad a causa de una tormenta, Burgthryth fue perseguida por una variedad de bestias hostiles. Durante su huida, perdió algunas de sus más preciadas partituras y está desesperada por volver a encontrarlas.","Burgthryth está en Jänis-leiri.\
\
Has encontrado todas las partituras perdidas del himno de Burgthryth. Deberías devolvérselas cuanto antes."}},
[13547]={nameES="Emoción del peligro",objectivesES={"Emoción del peligro","Dithrik te ha encargado obtener materiales que ayudarán a desafiar un antiguo horror de eras pasadas.","Los seres Sinnombre y la antigua criatura merodean por los alrededores de las Fundaciones de Piedra, especialmente hacia el sureste de esta región.\
\
Dithrik te ha pedido que recojas doce cabezas intactas de los Sin Nombre de las Fundaciones de Piedra.","Regresa con Dithrik en las Fundaciones de Piedra"}},
[13548]={nameES="Throne of the Dread Terror Items and Deeds",objectivesES={}},
[13549]={nameES="Through The Lines",objectivesES={}},
[13550]={nameES="Through War-torn Lands",objectivesES={"Find Jarl Gurthilm and his company near Uya Hujûm","Jarl Gurthilm and his company can be found to the south-east of Uya Hujûm.\
\
You have followed Jarl Gurthilm's company to a trail of dead and should now seek the Variag company nearby.","Follow the roadway eastward towards Uya Hujûm","Follow the roadway northward towards Dagorlad","Talk to Jarl Gurthilm outside Uya Hujûm","The roadway north can be found far to north-west of Henneth Annûn.\
\
You are following the roadway and should continue to follow Jarl Gurthilm's company to the Khundolar encampment.","Even more Khundolar have fallen in the Variags' wake...","A trail of slain Khundolar leads to the north-east...","These Khundolar appeared to turn eastward to flee before they were slain...","Cair Andros can be found on the Anduin in north-western North Ithilien and its road leads northward towards Dagorlad.\
\
Jarl Gurthilm has asked you to follow the western roadway northward through Ithilien and follow his company to the Khundolar encampment.","A journey home has become a journey of vengeance as the Variags seek to avenge their fallen kin and slay their treacherous Khundolar benefactor.","More slain Khundolar are strewn across the bridge...","Continue to follow the roadway towards Dagorlad","Jarl Gurthilm's warriors pace restlessly as he peers across the river at Uya Hujûm","Jarl Gurthilm's company has cut a path through the Khundolar along the roadway!","The roadway travels eastward through North Ithilien can be found to the north of Henneth Annûn.\
\
The roadway has forked eastward and you should continue to follow Jarl Gurthilm's company to the Khundolar encampment.","Through War-torn Lands","Follow the western roadway northward from Cair Andros","Jarl Gurthilm can be found in north-eastern North Ithilien at the foot of Uya Hujûm.\
\
You have found Jarl Gurthilm and his company and should now speak to him."}},
[13551]={nameES="A Través del Bloqueo",objectivesES={"Bingo está listo para dejar Maur Tulhau y continuar su viaje hacia el norte.","Habla con Haley Pradodulce en Andrath","Bingo ha atravesado el bloqueo y ahora se encuentra en Andrath, en el extremo sur de las Tierras de Bree.","Habla con Teodoro Tojo en Andrath","Haley Pradodulce y Teodoro Tojo se encuentran ahora en Andrath, en el extremo sur de las Tierras de Bree.","Habla con Bingo en Andrath","Habla con Rhus Cornchúthur en la entrada de Maur Tulhau","Bingo está en la entrada de Maur Tulhau, en los Valles Sombríos.\
\
Bingo ya se ha despedido y ahora está listo para continuar su viaje hacia el norte.","Habla con Iola Isbrun en la entrada de Maur Tulhau","A Través del Bloqueo","Habla con Bingo en la entrada de Maur Tulhau","Bingo se está despidiendo de los hobbits de Maur Tulhau y dijo que se reuniría contigo en la salida sur del pueblo.","Habla con Bingo en la entrada de Maur Tulhau y continúa el viaje hacia el norte","Bingo se encuentra ahora en Andrath, en el extremo sur de las Tierras de Bree."}},
[13552]={nameES="Through the Eyes of Ravens",objectivesES={"Find the raven that spied upon the Grey Mountains","Talk to King Thorin III","The raven who spied the Grey Mountains can be found upon the western slopes of Erebor.\
\
You have found the lost raven and should now examine it.","Arcah can be found at Ravenhill.\
\
You found the ravens who failed to answer Arcah's call and should now return to her with these tidings.","Talk to Arcah","The missing raven would have flown from the Grey Mountains, so it can likely be found somewhere among the north-western slopes of Erebor.\
\
After it failed to return from spying in the Grey Mountains, Arcah has asked you to seek a lost raven on the slopes of Erebor.","A lone raven lies wounded upon the western slopes of Erebor...","To your relief, it appears the raven was only left stunned by a recent encounter with a foe, but escaped before a more serious wound could be inflicted.\
\
As you move to aid the raven, it lets out a bubbling croak in fear!","King Thorin III can be found before his throne in the Hall Under the Mountain.\
\
You have learned that Vethúg Wintermind has stirred in the Grey Mountains and now prepares to fly for Erebor. You should inform King Thorin III at once.","Having regained its strength, the raven flies for Ravenhill!","Arcah can be found at Ravenhill.\
\
You were able to rescue the raven that spied upon the Grey Mountains. You should now return to Arcah.","Through the Eyes of Ravens","Talk to Arcah at Ravenhill","Arcah can be found at Ravenhill.\
\
After learning that some of Arcah's ravens have begun to return from their spying, King Thorin III has asked you to seek the counsel of Arcah at Ravenhill.","Arcah, the raven-chief, has summoned her kin back to Ravenhill, but a few of her ravens have not answered her call.","The missing ravens can likely be found in the heights of Eryn Lasgalen and Dale or somewhere near the banks of the River Running.\
\
After they each failed to answer her call, Arcah has asked you to seek three ravens in the lands of the North and send them to Ravenhill.","Appearing to understand, the raven flies off towards Ravenhill!","Examine the wounded raven"}},
[13553]={nameES="A través del Paso de Rohan",objectivesES={"Rinneldor te ha pedido que busques a Limlaer, que vigila cerca de la frontera sur de Eregion.","Habla con Limlaer","Limlaer se encuentra al suroeste de Echad Dúnann, a lo largo del camino de Nan Sirannon.\
\
Debes informar tus hallazgos a Limlaer.","A través del Paso de Rohan","Encuentra la torre en la colina","La torre se encuentra en una colina, al suroeste de Limlaer, que se encuentra cerca del camino que conduce al suroeste desde Echad Dúnann.\
\
Limlaer te ha pedido que vayas a una torre cercana y <rgb=#FF0000>mires</rgb> señales del paso de la Compañía.","Busca señales de la Compañía","No ves ningún signo de la Compañía","Encontraste la torre en la colina"}},
[13554]={nameES="Through the Gardens of Gondor",objectivesES={"Heed the Ranger's orders","Talk to Thurindol at Henneth Annûn","A Ranger calls out to you and orders you to hold!","Aelin Veren can be found in central North Ithilien.\
\
You have arrived at Aelin Veren to find a party of Rangers in need of aid. Thurindol has asked you to aid them before meeting him further north along the road.","Thurindol can be found within Henneth Annûn in north-central North Ithilien.\
\
You have been brought to Henneth Annûn by Dornach and should now seek out Thurindol.","Dornach is standing along the main roadway in central North Ithilien.\
\
A Ranger named Dornach has asked you to heed his orders if you wish to travel to Henneth Annûn.","North Ithilien, home to the last refuge of the Rangers of Ithilien, is the border between Gondor and the lands of the Enemy.","Aid the Rangers at Aelin Veren as much as you are able, and when you are ready to move on, meet Thurindol along the road to the north","Thurindol can be found at Aelin Veren, far to the north of the Cross-roads in North Ithilien.\
\
Thurindol has asked you to aid him with a few tasks before meeting him at the baths of Aelin Veren.","Aid Thurindol with as many of his tasks as you are able, and when you are ready to move on, meet him at Aelin Veren","Through the Gardens of Gondor"}},
[13555]={nameES="Through the Vale",objectivesES={"Talk to Varthmath","Talk to Hállkell","Gírta, Sterkist, Varthmath, and Hállkell can all be found at the Beorninghús in the Beorning-lands.\
\
You should talk to Gírta, Sterkist, Varthmath, and Hállkell before you set out to explore the Vale.","Bring the trophies to Grimbeorn","Find a suitable trophy from Ylgraf","Grimbeorn, the leader of the Beornings, is worried about threats in the Vales of Anduin that are affecting his people and their way of life.","Talk to Gírta","The entrance to the Floodfells and Ylgraf can be found at the northern edge of the Beorning-lands.\
\
You should scout the entrance to the Floodfells and Ylgraf for Grimbeorn.","This Orc head will do well as a trophy for Grimbeorn","Grimbeorn can be found at the Beorninghús in the Beorninglands.\
\
You should talk to Grimbeorn.","Wargs are numerous here","Scout the entrance to the Floodfells","Orcs from Gundabad have blocked the road and few keep watch over the northern edge","Through the Vale","Find a suitable trophy from near the Floodfells","Talk to Sterkist","This warg hide will do well as a trophy for Grimbeorn","Scout Ylgraf"}},
[13556]={nameES="Throw the Yoke",objectivesES={"Plas-maru lies to the east of Ilar's camp.\
\
Ilar has asked you to defeat the wights guarding the entrance to Plas-maru and put to rest their captain.","Ilar is at his camp, west of Plas-maru.\
\
You should bring word to Ilar of your victory against the wights.","Talk to Ilar at his camp in the Bonevales","Plas Maru is a great cairn which was reserved for the ancient brenins and their brehur.","Defeat the Asgurn-capten","Defeated the Asgurn-capten","Throw the Yoke"}},
[13557]={nameES="Thrymm's Farm",objectivesES={"Speak with Gárwig","Help Oter prepare Thrymm's Farm","The farmers are desperate to get Thrymm's Farm growing crops again for Forlaw.  The supplies in Forlaw may not last much longer with this unnaturally long winter.","Thrymm's Farm was burned to the ground, and the farmers were captured by the Lieutenant of Núrzum, Laudh. Gárwig should be informed of what has happened.","Thrymm's Farm","Work has begun to repair Thrymm's Farm and it is almost time to begin working the fields."}},
[13558]={nameES="Thrymm's Farm: Cleansing",objectivesES={}},
[13559]={nameES="Thrymm's Farm: Reclaiming",objectivesES={}},
[13560]={nameES="Desafío de Thrâng - Nivel 1",objectivesES={"Derrotaste a Thrâng en el límite de nivel del Nivel 1","Completado.","Solo los héroes más poderosos pueden derrotar a Thrâng a esta fuerza. ¿Estás listo para el desafío?","Completado","Desafío de Thrâng - Nivel 1","Te has encontrado en la arena de Thrâng.\
\
¡Debes derrotar a Thrâng!","Derrota a Thrâng en el límite de nivel del Nivel 1","En lo profundo de la Grieta de Nûrz Ghâshu, Thrâng, el jefe de los Ghâshfra, está listo para enfrentarse a todos los que desafíen su poder.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando abandones la instancia.</rgb>"}},
[13561]={nameES="Desafío de Thrâng - Nivel 2",objectivesES={"Desafío de Thrâng - Nivel 2","Solo los héroes más poderosos pueden derrotar a Thrâng en todo su poder. ¿Quieres comenzar el desafío?","Completado.","Completado","Derrotaste a Thrâng en el límite de nivel del Nivel 2","Te has encontrado en la arena de Thrâng.\
\
¡Debes derrotar a Thrâng!","Derrota a Thrâng en el límite de nivel del Nivel 2","En lo profundo de la Grieta de Nûrz Ghâshu, Thrâng, el jefe de los Ghâshfra, está listo para enfrentarse a todos los que desafíen su poder.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando abandones la instancia.</rgb>"}},
[13562]={nameES="Thunder in the Deeps",objectivesES={}},
[13563]={nameES="Trueno en las Colinas",objectivesES={"Trueno en las Colinas","Trolls de piedra han descendido en gran número desde las Montañas Nubladas hacia el sur del Bosque de los Trolls.","Hay trolls de piedra acampados al norte del camino principal en el sur del Bosque de los Trolls.\
\
Mientras estés en el sur del Bosque de los Trolls, deberías encargarte de los trolls de piedra que se han asentado allí."}},
[13564]={nameES="Trueno en las Montañas",objectivesES={"Trueno en las Montañas","Habla con Golhador en el campamento del Risco Alto","Golhador está en el campamento del Risco Alto, en las Montañas Nubladas, al noreste de Rivendel.\
\
Deberías regresar con Golhador y hacerle saber que el Señor del Trueno ha sido derrotado.","Los gigantes de la Mesa de los Gigantes mencionaron al Señor del Trueno, a quien sólo puedes suponer como su líder. Tal vez, si el Señor del Trueno fuera derrotado, los gigantes podrían apartarse de su camino perverso.\
\
Es probable que el Señor del Trueno gobierne desde los confines más lejanos de Iorbar, al sur y al este de la Mesa de los Gigantes. Debes tener cuidado, pues debe de ser un oponente letal, y sólo un grupo decidido de guerreros podría esperar derrotarlo.","Se derrotó al Señor del Trueno","El Señor del Trueno, líder de los gigantes, ha ordenado a su pueblo marchar a la guerra. Si puede ser derrotado, esta amenaza podría caer con él.","El Señor del Trueno gobierna a los gigantes desde Iorbar, al sur y al este de la Mesa de los Gigantes, en las Montañas Nubladas.\
\
El Señor del Trueno es la fuente de la reciente hostilidad de los gigantes, y debe ser derrotado antes de que todos los gigantes de la región obedezcan sus órdenes. Necesitarás la ayuda de valientes aliados si esperas vencerlo.","Derrota al Señor del Trueno","Párate sobre la Mesa de los Gigantes"}},
[13565]={nameES="Thunder on Zirakzigil",objectivesES={"Thunder on Zirakzigil","You have done much to aid the Dwarves of the Landorrim, Narfanghoth, and Temámir at Rung-shakam.","Trolls of Moria and Orkish drums can be found at Rung-shakam. Trophy-bones can be collected from Orcs and some goblins at Rung-shakam.\
\
You should aid the Landorrim, Narfanghoth, and Temámir by defeating the Moria-trolls at Rung-shakam. You should also destroy Orkish drums and collect trophy-bones for the Haban'akkâ.","You raise a banner of the Haban'akkâ of Thráin in defiance of Azog!","Although the battle on Zirakzigil is not yet ended, your efforts have done much to aid the Dwarves of the Landorrim, Narfanghoth, and Temámir.","Scout Rung-shakam","Hoping to hinder the trolls of Moria laying siege to Azanulbizar, Dwarves of the Landorrim, Narfanghoth, and Temámir have made for the slopes of Zirakzigil.","King Agni the Wild, King Drógar Bloodwhisker, and King Jegín can be found at Zirakazhâr.\
\
You have arrived at Zirakazhâr. You should speak to the Kings of the Landorrim, Narfanghoth, and Temámir leading the assault on Rung-shakam.","Talk to King Drógar Bloodwhisker","Rung-shakam can be found to the north-west of Zirakazhâr.\
\
The Kings of the Landorrim, Narfanghoth, and Temámir have asked you to scout Rung-shakam and defeat Azog's forces upon Zirakzigil.","Talk to King Jegín","The Dwarves of the Landorrim, Narfanghoth, and Temámir have taken Zirakazhâr!","Raise a banner of the Haban'akkâ of Thráin at Rung-shakam","Talk to King Agni the Wild","Travel to Zirakazhâr","Dwarves of the Landorrim, Narfanghoth, and Temámir can be found at Zirakazhâr on the slopes of Zirakzigil to the north-west of Amdân.\
\
Dáin has asked you to travel to Zirakazhâr and aid the Dwarves of the Haban'akkâ.","Driven by Orc-drummers, Trolls of Moria lay siege upon the dale below from Rung-shakam","Completado","You have done much to hinder Azog's forces at Rung-shakam.\
\
You should raise a banner of the Haban'akkâ of Thráin at Rung-shakam."}},
[13566]={nameES="Thunder on the Plains",objectivesES={"The sûlok herd gathering at Modan Rôkh, the Beast-fields, has little access to food and water, making them more aggressive than usual and posing a threat to passers-by. Culling some of their numbers would be beneficial for both travellers as well as the herd.","You have culled some of the sûlokil in An Shêru, making it easier for the others to survive in this harsh wasteland.","Thunder on the Plains","You should defeat sûlokil in An Shêru. A herd can be found gathering at the Beast-fields in the south-eastern part of the region.","Sûlokil gather in large numbers on An Shêru's dusty southern plains. There are more of the large beasts here than the land can support.","Your culling of some of the sûlokil in An Shêru has made it easier for the others to survive in this harsh wasteland, while also making the nearby road a little safer for travellers.","Completado"}},
[13567]={nameES="La flecha de la suerte de Thurmaer",objectivesES={"Thurmaer se encuentra en Kuru-leiri, al norte del glaciar.\
\
Deberías devolverle la flecha a Thurmaer.","Flecha de la suerte de Thurmaer encontrada","Beleganc vaga a lo largo y ancho del gran glaciar, al sur de Kuru-leiri.\
\
Thurmaer te ha pedido que des caza a la sierpe de las nieves llamada Beleganc y recuperes su flecha de la suerte de ella.","Deuvelve la flecha a Thurmaer en Kuru-leiri","Encuentra a la sierpe Beleganc y recupera la flecha de Thurmaer de su cuerpo","Thurmaer ha perdido su 'flecha de la suerte' favorita durante una reciente cacería en Talvi-mûri. En ella tenía como objetivo a una sierpe de las nieves particularmente astuta y disparó justo cuando le emboscó un grupo de cazadores Gauredain que le forzaron a huir. Aunque consiguió ponerse a salvo, Thurmaer se torció el tobillo durante la huida.","La flecha de la suerte de Thurmaer"}},
[13568]={nameES="Thwarting Spying Eyes",objectivesES={}},
[13569]={nameES="¡Frustrar a los Bugan del Tesoro!",objectivesES={"Habla con Teodoro Tojo en Bree, Rivendel o la Sala Vigesimoprimera","Teodoro Tojo, un buscador de tesoros con experiencia, busca los muchos tesoros que le fueron robados en sus numerosas aventuras.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión será eliminada de tu registro de misiones cuando termine el evento asociado.</rgb>","Teodoro Tojo, un buscador de tesoros con experiencia, busca los muchos tesoros que le fueron robados en sus numerosas aventuras.","Teodoro Tojo busca sus tesoros robados y puede encontrarse en Bree, Rivendel y en la Sala Vigesimoprimera.\
\
Debes hablar con Teodoro Tojo.","Teodoro Tojo busca sus tesoros robados.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Los Bugan del Tesoro pueden encontrarse en muchas de las Instancias Escalables.</rgb>"}},
[13570]={nameES="Thwarting Their Plans",objectivesES={"Thwarting Their Plans","Free Khetúku","You have defeated many of the fugitives and freed Khetúku. You should return to Porókho at his camp in the sewers to bring him the news.","Porókho has told you that a group of forsaken Heirsworn and All-seeing Eye believers hiding in Ilmabiri have kidnapped his nephew Khetúku in an attempt to coerce the Morutágya clan into giving them transport out of Umbar. He tells you that if you rescue Khetúku, there will be a handsome reward.","You found the forsaken camp","Discover where the forsaken Heirsworn and Church of the All-seeing Eye are encamped. Porókho said they are in the southernmost part of Ilmabiri.","Find the forsaken camp","You have found the location of the camp of forsaken. You should defeat some of them so Khetúku will be able to escape.","Talk to Porókho"}},
[13571]={nameES="Thwarting the Dourhands",objectivesES={"Thwarting the Dourhands","Handarod is at Esteldín in the North Downs, south-east of Nan Amlug.\
\
You should return to Handarod and tell him of your battles against the Dourhands.","Talk to Handarod","Handarod is concerned with the growing threat of the Dourhands in western Nan Amlug.","Dourhands can be found throughout the hills of western Nan Amlug, north-west of Esteldín.\
\
Handarod has asked you to disrupt the Dourhand mining efforts in Nan Amlug."}},
[13572]={nameES="Thwarting the Iron Pass",objectivesES={}},
[13573]={nameES="Frustrando a los orcos de Moria",objectivesES={"Ayuda a Yngvi a derrotar al general Talug en Fil Gashan","Fil Gashan es el cuartel y punto de concentración de la invasión orca de Lothlórien. Oculto en lo más profundo de un paisaje ígneo y con una entrada adyacente a las Forjas de Khazad-dûm, los orcos se entrenan aquí bajo la atenta vigilancia del general Talug.","Ayuda a Vagun a desactivar las alarmas en Fil Gashan","Úlfur, Vagun y Yngvi se encuentran en Anazârmekhem.\
\
Teitur te indicó que hablaras con sus asistentes y completaras sus tareas antes de que le informe a Narfi que Fil Gashan ya no representa una amenaza.","Frustrando a los orcos de Moria","Ayuda a Úlfur a recopilar los planes de Fil Gashan","Teitur se encuentra en Anazârmekhem.\
\
Has completado con éxito cada una de las tareas que Úlfur, Vagun y Yngvi te dieron. Ahora deberías regresar con Teitur para informarle de tu progreso.","Ayuda a Vagun con los tenientes en Fil Gashan","Habla con Teitur en Anazârmekhem"}},
[13574]={nameES="Frustrando a la Mano Blanca",objectivesES={"Ayuda a Thithrand a derrotar a los líderes de los orcos de la Mano Blanca en la Gran Escalera","Thithrand se encuentra en la Guardia Orca, al suroeste de la Gran Escalera.\
\
Deberías regresar con Thithrand para informarle de tus éxitos en la Gran Escalera.","Habla con Thithrand en la Guardia Orca","Ayuda a Thithrand a debilitar el poder de la Mano Blanca en la Gran Escalera","La Gran Escalera se alzaba antaño al pie de un gran cruce de caminos dentro de Moria. En el apogeo de la gran ciudad, conducía a todas las zonas de las salas y era una maravilla majestuosa de contemplar. Ahora ha quedado bajo el control de Igash, un lugarteniente de Mazog, el líder de los orcos de Moria. Igash ha reunido en un solo lugar a las fuerzas de orcos y trolls de Moria y ha recaudado tributos de cada uno para llevarlos algún día al líder de los orcos. Por ahora, cada tribu pugna por ganarse el favor del lugarteniente, un seguidor fanático de Mazog.","Thithrand se encuentra en la Guardia Orca.\
\
Thithrand cree que la Mano Blanca se rebelará abiertamente contra los orcos de Moria, pero teme que puedan reunir la fuerza suficiente como para tomar el control por sí mismos. Para evitarlo, desea que completes una serie de tareas.","Frustrando a la Mano Blanca"}},
[13575]={nameES="Tarea de los Jinetes de Théodred: Pieles manchadas",objectivesES={"Tarea de los Jinetes de Théodred: Pieles manchadas","Se busca: Pieles manchadas de las bestias en el este de las Tierras Brunas.","Se busca: Pieles manchadas de las bestias en el este de las Tierras Brunas. Recógelas y entrégaselas al capataz en Forthbrond para ganar el favor de los Jinetes de Théodred.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Entrega las pieles manchadas al capataz en Forthbrond","Has aceptado la tarea de adquirir pieles manchadas. Debes entregárselas al capataz de los Rohirrim en Forthbrond.","El capataz de los Rohirrim quiere pieles manchadas. Se le puede encontrar en el campamento de los Rohirrim de Forthbrond en el Valle del Isen."}},
[13576]={nameES="Tarea de los Jinetes de Théodred: Vainas de espada decorativas",objectivesES={"Has aceptado la tarea de adquirir vainas de espada decorativas. Debes entregárselas al capataz de los Rohirrim en Forthbrond.","El capataz de los Rohirrim quiere vainas de espada decorativas. Se le puede encontrar en el campamento de los Rohirrim de Forthbrond en el Valle del Isen.","Tarea de los Jinetes de Théodred: Vainas de espada decorativas","Se busca: Vainas de espada decorativas de los enemigos en el este de las Tierras Brunas. Recógelas y entrégaselas al capataz en Forthbrond para ganar el favor de los Jinetes de Théodred.","Entrega las vainas de espada decorativas al capataz en Forthbrond","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Se busca: Vainas de espada decorativas de los enemigos en el este de las Tierras Brunas."}},
[13577]={nameES="Tarea de los Jinetes de Théodred: Pieles marcadas",objectivesES={"Entregar las pieles marcadas al capataz en Forthbrond","Se busca: Pieles marcadas de las bestias en el este de las Tierras Brunas. Recógelas y entrégaselas al capataz en Forthbrond para ganar el favor de los Jinetes de Théodred.","Tarea de los Jinetes de Théodred: Pieles marcadas","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Has aceptado la tarea de adquirir pieles marcadas. Debes entregárselas al capataz de los Rohirrim en Forthbrond.","El capataz de los Rohirrim quiere pieles marcadas. Se le puede encontrar en el campamento de los Rohirrim de Forthbrond en el Valle del Isen.","Se busca: Pieles marcadas de las bestias en el este de las Tierras Brunas."}},
[13578]={nameES="Tarea de los Jinetes de Théodred: Escudos perforados",objectivesES={"Tarea de los Jinetes de Théodred: Escudos perforados","El capataz de los Rohirrim quiere escudos perforados. Se le puede encontrar en el campamento de los Rohirrim de Forthbrond en el Valle del Isen.","Se busca: Escudos perforados de los enemigos en el este de las Tierras Brunas.","Has aceptado la tarea de adquirir escudos perforados. Debes entregárselos al capataz de los Rohirrim en Forthbrond.","Se busca: Escudos perforados de los enemigos en el este de las Tierras Brunas. Recógelos y entrégaselos al capataz en Forthbrond para ganar el favor de los Jinetes de Théodred.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Entrega los escudos perforados al capataz en Forthbrond"}},
[13579]={nameES="Tarea de los Jinetes de Théodred: Orejas moteadas",objectivesES={"Has aceptado la tarea de adquirir orejas moteadas. Debes entregárselas al capataz de los Rohirrim en Forthbrond.","Se busca: Orejas moteadas de las bestias en el este de las Tierras Brunas. Recógelas y entrégaselas al capataz en Forthbrond para ganar el favor de los Jinetes de Théodred.","Tarea de los Jinetes de Théodred: Orejas moteadas","El capataz de los Rohirrim quiere orejas moteadas. Se le puede encontrar en el campamento de los Rohirrim de Forthbrond en el Valle del Isen.","Entrega las orejas moteadas al capataz en Forthbrond","Se busca: Orejas moteadas de las bestias en el este de las Tierras Brunas.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú."}},
[13580]={nameES="Tidal Treasures",objectivesES={"Bring the seashells to Darôma","Darôma has offered to pay you for bringing seashells to her. She suggested looking on the island's northern shores, particularly in and around the channel.","You have collected many splendid-looking seashells from the beaches of Furtherholm. You should bring them to Darôma inside The Cracked Flagon to receive your reward.","Darôma wants seashells from the nearby beaches to decorate the inn.","Tidal Treasures"}},
[13581]={nameES="Tidings of Anirin",objectivesES={}},
[13582]={nameES="Tidying Up",objectivesES={"Talk to Basil Wyndham","Tidying Up","Garbage can be found at each of the Eating Contest stations in Winter-home, and the servant Basil Wyndham deems himself above the task of cleaning it up.\
\
You should clean up garbage, spills, and dirty dishes around the Eating Contest's tables.","The festival patrons have left a lot of filth in their wake and tidying up is a rather unpleasant chore that must be performed.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> NOTE: This quest will be removed from your quest log when the current festival ends. </rgb>","Basil Wyndham can be found in Winter-home.\
\
You should return to Basil Wyndham now that you have cleaned up some of the mess from the Eating Contest."}},
[13583]={nameES="Tied Hands",objectivesES={"Thane Nothmar is near the bridge of Gapholt.\
\
The guard told you to take your concerns to Thane Nothmar.","Tied Hands","Talk to Hrothwaru","Hrothwaru is near the bridge of Gapholt.\
\
Thane Nothmar would not recant his position regarding entry into Gapholt.","Talk to Thane Nothmar","There is a Gapholt guard behind a mountain of papers.\
\
You should speak with a guard to see if there is an exception that can be made to help the refugees settle into Gapholt sooner.","Talk to the guard","The guards of Gapholt are not allowing entry without papers being checked and signed. This process is causing too much delay for the long line of refugees."}},
[13584]={nameES="Tier 01: Delving Zircon",objectivesES={"You left the instance and failed the delving","A malice spreads through the area...","The stone is inert. There is a clear fissure in the surface where one, with a little effort, could affix a gem of some sort. Perhaps you have such a gem in your possession.","Delving deeply into the world, the forces of the enemy are more powerful and vicious.","Without a delving zircon you cannot unlock the greater strength of the enemies in this space.","Tier 01: Delving Zircon","A malice spread from within the gemstone you affixed to the delving stone. You must defeat the enemies and complete the mission to rid the evil from the world.","You must place a delving zircon into the fissure in the delving stone. This will unlock the potency trapped within the gemstone and unleash it upon the world.","Complete the current mission and find the scout","Habla con la persona que te confió la miniaventura","The delving zircon fits into the fissure within the delving stone. The zircon cracks and the darkness within creeps out of the stone and moves into the air as a black tendril. A flash of dread fills you but passes.","Failure: Leave the instance","Having completed the mission with the malice affecting the denizens within, you should now make your way back to the mission giver and tell them of your success."}},
