[13599]={nameES="Tier 06: Delving Garnet",objectivesES={"You left the instance and failed the delving","The delving garnet fits into the fissure within the delving stone. The garnet cracks and the darkness within creeps out of the stone and moves into the air as a black tendril. A flash of dread fills you, but passes.","Without a delving garnet you cannot unlock the greater strength of the enemies in this space.","Tier 06: Delving Garnet","A forceful malice spread through the area...","You must place a delving garnet into the fissure in the delving stone. This will unlock the potency trapped within the gemstone and unleash it upon the world.","The stone is inert. There is a clear fissure in the surface where one, with a little effort, could affix a gem of some sort. Perhaps you have such a gem in your possession.","Delving deeply into the world, the forces of the enemy are more powerful and vicious.","A forceful malice spreads through the area...","Complete the current mission and find the scout","Habla con la persona que te confió la miniaventura","A malice spread from within the gemstone you affixed to the delving stone. You must defeat the enemies and complete the mission to rid the evil from the world.","Failure: Leave the instance","Having completed the mission with the malice affecting the denizens within, you should now make your way back to the mission giver and tell them of your success."}},
