[13626]={nameES="Timber from the Forest",objectivesES={"Talk to Skalla","Skalla can be found in Vegbár, the Beorning outpost in the Wolf-denes.\
\
You should talk to Skalla.","Skalla has asked you to gather fallen timber to repair the buildings in Vegbár.\
\
You should collect fallen timber from the area surrounding Vegbár.","Timber from the Forest","The Beornings of Vegbár must keep constant watch on both the High Pass and Goblin-town, and can do neither with their buildings and walls in disrepair."}},
[13627]={nameES="Time Enough for a Meal",objectivesES={"Lúksu can be found in the Tower of Cirith Ungol.\
\
Captain Róglarg has offered you a break, and now expects you to eat an Orkish meal. You should find Lúksu and do your best to pretend that you have eaten his food.","Lúksu can be found in the Tower of Cirith Ungol.\
\
You have done your best to pretend that you ate and enjoyed Lúksu's food. You should now speak to Lúksu.","Talk to Lúksu","Pretend to eat Blúgzor","Time Enough for a Meal","It's meat all right, wrapped in... innards?","Pretend to eat Zau","Pretend to eat Thrulbuz","Lúksu has set out three crates of repulsive food...","Crates of Blúgzor, Zau, and Thrulbuz can be found near Lúksu in the Tower of Cirith Ungol.\
\
You have found Lúksu and must now \\qsample\\q his cooking.","Find Lúksu in the Tower of Cirith Ungol","Mmm! This stew is certainly... crunchy!","After performing many of his tasks without question, Captain Róglarg has offered you a meal in Cirith Ungol.","The grubs are still wriggling in the crate. How exciting!"}},
[13628]={nameES="Time Management",objectivesES={}},
[13629]={nameES="Hora de un escudo nuevo",objectivesES={"Rauno está en Sûri-kylä, al oeste de Nef en la Gran Cabaña de Sûri-kylä.\
\
Nef te ha pedido que vuelvas a ver a Rauno y trates de convencerle de que le fabrique un nuevo escudo.","Habla con Nef","Lleva los huesos macizos y las escamas de sierpe a Rauno","Lleva el escudo a Nef","Los artesanos de los Lossoth están en la Gran Cabaña de Sûri-kylä, al oeste de Nef.\
\
Nef te ha pedido que hables con los artesanos Lossoth para saber si serían capaces de reparar su escudo roto.","Rauno está en Sûri-kylä, al norte de donde has conseguido los objetos que te pidió.\
\
Deberías llevarle los huesos macizos y escamas de sierpe a Rauno para completar el escudo de Nef.","Hora de un escudo nuevo","Nef está en Sûri-kylä, al este de la Gran Cabaña.\
\
Deberías volver a ver a Nef y decirle lo que te ha dicho Rauno.","Rauno está en Sûri-kylä.\
\
Deberías hablar con Rauno para ver si el escudo de Nef está listo.","Consigue el escudo de parte de Rauno","Habla con los artesanos Lossoth","Has encontrado el escudo de Nef, pero la bestia que lo ahuyentó lo ha destrozado.","Nef está en Sûri-kylä, al este de Rauno.\
\
Rauno te ha pedido que lleves el escudo que ha fabricado a Nef y le pidas que se vaya de Sûri-kylä.","El hueso macizo puede encontrarse en las bestias que habitan Jä-rannit. Las escamas de sierpe se pueden conseguir de las sierpes de la misma región.\
\
Rauno te ha pedido que consigas huesos macizos y escamas de sierpes para hacer un nuevo escudo para Nef.","Habla con Rauno"}},
[13630]={nameES="Hora de necesidad",objectivesES={"Los alijos de suministros están escondidos en lugares apartados de caminos principales en Annúminas.\
\
Dannassel te ha pedido que busques alijos de suministros escondidos por la ciudad y que le lleves sus contenidos. Te ha advertido que las patrullas Angmarim podrían ya haber descubierto y saqueado alguno de estos alijos.","Lleva los suministros recuperados a Dannassel","Dannassel está en Echad Garthadir, el campamento de montaraces en el corazón de Annúminas.\
\
Has recuperado algunos de los suministros de los alijos escondidos por Annúminas y deberías llevarlos de vuelta a Dannassel.","Hora de necesidad","Dannassel te ha dicho que en tiempos de paz se escondieron por la ciudad cierto número de alijos.","Alguien ya ha saqueado este alijo, pues está vacío."}},
[13631]={nameES="Time to Think",objectivesES={"Return to Ránmald","Reflections upon those who died come unbidden to your mind....","The voices you heard came from below your thinking spot in the northern High Knolls.\
\
You should climb down and see if you can find the women you heard.","Time to Think","Ránmald can be found in the cave north of Byre Tor.\
\
You should return to Ránmald.","A good resting spot might be north behind the mountain cave, away from Byre Tor.\
\
You should head north to the other side of the mountain and find a spot to rest.","Nearby, a rocky overlook offers a fine view of the north","Head north behind the mountain to find a place to rest","As you look out at the green hills of the Great River untouched by Núrzum, you are filled with overwhelming grief and anger at the plight of Wildermore","The dead are many, and the vision fills you with grief.\
\
The forces of Isengard -- Núrzum especially -- must pay for what they have done.","A good spot to stand and look beckons to you in the northern High Knolls.\
\
You should stand at the cliff's edge and look, and think on all the people who have been lost.","Memories of the dead come unbidden to your mind....","After all that has come to pass since setting foot in Wildermore, you find that it is rather a lot to bear. Some time to clear your head will be helpful.","The sound of women's voices from below startle you from your reverie","Find the women whose voices you heard","You wish the women luck on their journey -- but more importantly, there may be other survivors!","Stand and think at the cliff's edge"}},
[13632]={nameES="Time with the Dying",objectivesES={"Return to Aragorn in the High Hall of the Houses of Healing and tell him you have stayed with a number of dying men through their final moments.","The wounded and dying can be found in the High Hall, House of Remedies, and House of Rest, on the Sixth Circle of Minas Tirith.\
\
Find those wounded who do not have long in this world and stay with them while they are here.","Many among the wounded will never rise from their beds in the Houses of Healing, and have no one to spend their final moments with them.","Return to Aragorn","Time with the Dying","The wounded man has passed on"}},
[13633]={nameES="Tinnudir, vestigio de los Hombres",objectivesES={"Habla con Orchalwë en Tinnudir","Orchalwë está en Tinnudir, al norte y al oeste del Coloso.\
\
Después de agradecerte tu ayuda, los Montaraces del Coloso te han indicado cómo llegar a la isla de Tinnudir.","Tinnudir es donde los Montaraces tienen su base de operaciones en Evendim.","Tinnudir, vestigio de los Hombres"}},
[13634]={nameES="Tirith Rhaw Reinforcements",objectivesES={"Support must not be present at Tirith Rhaw","Glân Vraig lay to the south and east of Tirith Rhaw.\
\
After taking Tirith Rhaw away from the Enemy, the army of the Free Peoples sent you to Glân Vraig to request reinforcements for the tower.","Tirith Rhaw Reinforcements","Your mission has failed","Angmar's Army has taken Tirith Rhaw","Angmar's Army cannot control Tirith Rhaw","Another has informed the Captain-General, support arrives shortly","Inform Captain-General Tordúr that Tirith Rhaw needs reinforcements","Tirith Rhaw is once again under the control of the Free Peoples. The forces here are still meagre, and a strong show of force from the Enemy could mean that the tower is lost as quickly as it is taken.","You must reach Glân Vraig without being defeated"}},
[13635]={nameES="Titán de Tyl Annûn",objectivesES={"El Titán de Tyl Annûn debe caer.","Un terrible gorthorog se yergue en la terraza de Tyl Annûn, dominando todo el lago Evendim.","Titán de Tyl Annûn derrotado","Derrota al Titán de Tyl Annûn","Titán de Tyl Annûn","Orchalwë querrá hablar de la batalla contra el Titán de Tyl Annûn.","Habla con Orchalwë"}},
[13636]={nameES="Rumbo a Agamaur",objectivesES={"Agamaur es un lugar lleno de corrupción y grave peligro, hogar de un mal terrible.","Agamaur está al este y al norte de Ost Guruth, más allá del Paso Rojo, en el pantano de Haragmar.\
\
Frideric te ha pedido que vayas a Agamaur para hablar con Eriac el Fuerte.","Rumbo a Agamaur"}},
[13637]={nameES="Hacia Amon Raith",objectivesES={"Hacia Amon Raith","Amarion se encuentra en Amon Raith, al este del campamento de Mincham.\
\
Debes hablar con Amarion en Amon Raith.","Habla con Amaron en Amon Raith","Mincham te ha pedido que busques a Amarion, un compañero Montaraz, que actualmente protege a un grupo de refugiados, cerca de las ruinas de Amon Raith."}},
[13638]={nameES="To Annâk-khurfu",objectivesES={"Annâk-khurfu can be found in Elderslade.\
\
You should talk to Agátur the Boastful at Annâk-khurfu.","The Gabil'akkâ has secured Annâk-khurfu in Elderslade.","Assist Lúkhag with 'A Strange Encounter'","Rúzat has asked you to plant banners along the road leading to Annâk-khurfu and to investigate Khadâsh-gâra.\
\
You should plant banners along the road leading to Annâk-khurfu.","Annâk-khurfu can be found in Elderslade.\
\
You should journey to Annâk-khurfu.","Investigate Khadâsh-gâra","Assist Mother Amma with 'Hunting Crystals'","The dwarves at Khadâsh-gâra seem eager to talk with you","Journey to Annâk-khurfu","The stronghold is filled with many dwarves from across the lands","There is much to be done at Annâk-khurfu.\
\
You should assist the dwarves at Annâk-khurfu.","Assist Gunvald with 'The Overdue Scout'","Assist Lóssi with 'The Missing Scouts'","To Annâk-khurfu","Talk to Agátur the Boastful at Annâk-khurfu"}},
[13639]={nameES="A Bamfurlargo: Reposición de la tienda de champiñones",objectivesES={"Has recogido el cesto de champiñones","Has dejado caer los champiñones","Lleva el cesto de champiñones al Mercado de los Granjeros","Sperling Tuk, el proveedor de la Feria de los Granjeros, se encuentra en Delagua.\
\
Regresa a Delagua lo antes posible, y dale bocados al pastel para ayudarte cuando necesites un impulso de energía.","A Bamfurlargo: Reposición de la tienda de champiñones","Bamfurlargo está en el Marjala, en la parte más al sureste de la Comarca que aún queda al oeste del Brandivino.\
\
Debes correr hasta la famosa granja de champiñones y regresar con un cesto antes de que se acabe el tiempo.","Recoge el cesto de champiñones (come pastel para un impulso de energía)","Se ha acabado el tiempo"}},
[13640]={nameES="To Be His Eyes",objectivesES={"Gilded cage retrieved","Place the sand-sifter near Kûruna to summon the craban from the sky","Kûruna becomes docile","Galamê told you to collect the cage beside him before you head into the wild to collect a sand-sifter corpse to coax the largest craban, Kûruna, in Khûd Zagin.","You captured Kûruna. You should return the bird in the cage to Galamê at Jirush.","You retrieved the gilded cage. Galamê mentioned collecting the carcass of a sand-sifter to coax the craban, Kûruna, from the sky. You will find sand-sifters roaming the waste-plains of Khûd Zagin to the south.","Kûruna reluctantly steps into the cage.","Find a location to place the sand-sifter corpse to draw down the largest craban, Kûruna, from where the crebain circle in the sky south-east of Jirush.","Deliver Kûruna and the cage to Galamê in Jirush","Coax Kûruna into the cage","Kûruna is defeated and docile. Talk to the creature and draw it into the cage.","The craban moves to attack.","You collected a sand-sifter corpse","Defeat a sand-sifter in Khûd Zagin and collect its corpse","You cage Kûruna","Galamê explains Lord Igbâl wants a craban to train against the Ordâkhai. He has seen them use the creatures as spies and would do the same. He asks you to acquire the most impressive beast you can capture.","To Be His Eyes","Retrieve the gilded cage from beside Galamê"}},
[13641]={nameES="To Bribe and Reward",objectivesES={}},
[13642]={nameES="To Bring Light to The Dark",objectivesES={"To Bring Light to The Dark","With fresh flames dancing at their cores, the lanterns now hold the shadows at bay. Here, the darkness of Deepscrave does not feel so suffocating.\
\
Perhaps, in time, the dwarves shall see the rest of Deepscrave illuminated and claim it as their home once more.","Completado","You have lit the lanterns.","Thrúthug has asked you to light the lanterns near the main staircases circling 'Abad-nuhbu.\
\
Half of the lanterns can be found above Aslíf on the upper tier, and half below.","Light is scarce in Deepscrave. The lanterns around 'Abad-nuhbu have gone unlit for too long."}},
[13643]={nameES="A Bolgovado: Reponiendo el tocino",objectivesES={"Bolgovado se encuentra a dos pueblos al este de Delagua, pasando los Ranales por el Camino del Este.\
\
Corre a las granjas de cerdos en Bolgovado y regresa con una cesta de delicioso y salado tocino recién hecho antes de que se acabe el tiempo.","Cesta de tocino recogida","Sperling Tuk, el proveedor de la Feria de los Granjeros, se encuentra en Delagua.\
\
Regresa a Delagua lo antes posible, y dale bocados al pastel para ayudarte cuando necesites un impulso de energía.","Lleva la cesta de tocino al Mercado de los Granjeros","A Bolgovado: Reponiendo el tocino","Se te ha acabado el tiempo","Recoge la cesta de tocino (come el pastel para obtener un impulso de energía)"}},
[13644]={nameES="To Bâr Húrin",objectivesES={}},
[13645]={nameES="To Calembel",objectivesES={"Calembel is south of Lothgobel in Lamedon.\
\
You should make your way to Calembel.","You should go to Calembel and see if any refugees from Lothgobel have made their way there.","To Calembel","Speak with someone in Calembel"}},
[13646]={nameES="To Calembel",objectivesES={}},
[13647]={nameES="To Catch a Thief",objectivesES={"<rgb=#FF0000>Scold</rgb> the child","The child is very sorry for what he did and gives you the bracelet","Follow the child","A little thief has just stolen a priceless bracelet from a noblewoman!","Looks like this child has been taking various valuables and stashing them here","Return the bracelet to the noblewoman","The child has run off somewhere.\
\
Follow the child to get the bracelet for the noblewoman.","The child is in his hiding place.\
\
You should scold the child for stealing.","The noblewoman can be found near Pipers' Bend on the Fourth Circle of Minas Tirith.\
\
You should return the bracelet to the noblewoman.","To Catch a Thief"}},
[13648]={nameES="To Clovengap",objectivesES={"Ausma has sent word that reports of crystal-encrusted beasts and dragon-kind. You are to investigate the reports and do what you can to assist the efforts of our troops.\
\
Your orders are to look for Gunvald in southern Clovengap. He waits for you at a camp along the river called Stókkset.","A runner from Scout-master Ausma has found you. Your orders are to assist Mother Amma on the tiers of Clovengap!","To Clovengap","Talk to Gunvald in southern Clovengap, at a camp called Stókkset"}},
[13649]={nameES="A la Granja de Coto: Reponiendo repollos",objectivesES={"Dejaste caer la cesta","Sperling Tuk, el proveedor de la Feria de los Granjeros, se encuentra en Delagua.\
\
Regresa a Delagua lo antes posible, y dale bocados al pastel para ayudarte cuando necesites un impulso de energía.","Recoge la cesta de repollos (come el pastel para obtener un impulso de energía)","Lleva la cesta de repollos al Mercado de los Granjeros","A la Granja de Coto: Reponiendo repollos","Se te ha acabado el tiempo","Cesta de repollo recogida","La Granja de Coto está en Delagua, no muy lejos de la Feria de los Granjeros.\
\
Corre a la granja de Tolman Coto y regresa con una cesta de repollos antes de que se acabe el tiempo."}},
[13650]={nameES="To Câr Bronach",objectivesES={"Suspicious of Ingór's priorities, Durin has ordered you to join the Zhélruka expedition in Câr Bronach","Mur Shatraug, the Witch-gate can be found in the north-eastern reaches of the Pit of Stonejaws.\
\
Scout-master Ausma has informed you of the path taken by the scouts sent into Câr Bronach. You should travel to the Witch-gate in the Pit of Stonejaws and enter Câr Bronach.","Múta or her scouts might be found at Mur Shatraug, the Witch-gate in Câr Bronach.\
\
After passing through the Witch-gate, Múta and her scouts were to travel to join the Zhélruka expedition. You should search for some sign of Múta or her scouts at the Witch-gate.","Concerned by the news that Prince Ingór has sent a significant Zhélruka expedition into Câr Bronach, Prince Durin hopes to enlist you to discover their purpose and aid in their efforts against the remnants of the Iron Crown.","Beyond the harsh, black stone of the Witch-gate lies Câr Bronach, the Sorrowglen","Orders from Prince Durin can be found in your inventory.\
\
Scout-master Ausma has given you new orders from Prince Durin. You should read the orders.","You find one of Múta's scouts, Gárjan, wounded and taking shelter beside a rampart","Talk to Scout-master Ausma","To Câr Bronach","Read the orders sent to you by Prince Durin","As you pass out of Mount Gundabad into Câr Bronach, an uneasy chill runs up your spine","Scout-master Ausma can be found in the Pit of Stonejaws at Bárgstad.\
\
You have read the orders sent to you by Prince Durin. You should talk to Scout-master Ausma.","Gárjan can be found at Mur Shatraug, the Witch-gate.\
\
After passing through the Witch-gate, you have found one of Múta's scouts, Gárjan, injured and taking shelter beside a rampart. You should talk to Gárjan.","Travel through the Witch-gate, in the north-eastern reaches of the Pit of Stonejaws, and enter Câr Bronach","Search for any sign of Múta or her scouts at Mur Shatraug, the Witch-gate","Talk to Gárjan at Mur Shatraug, the Witch-gate","Travel to the threshold of the Witch-gate, in the north-eastern reaches of the Pit of Stonejaws"}},
[13651]={nameES="Hacia Hendidura Profunda",objectivesES={"Hacia Hendidura Profunda","Deepscrave is below Máttugard, in Gundabad.","Talk to Féli in Aslíf","Féli can be found in Aslíf, on the upper tier of Deepscrave.\
\
You should seek him out."}},
[13652]={nameES="Partir en Primavera",objectivesES={"Haerandel se ha llenado de asombro al oír que flores semejantes al legendario Anarlossë crecen en abundancia dentro de los límites de la Comarca.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro cuando finalice el evento asociado.</rgb>","Alcanza a Edlothon en el País de las Colinas Verdes de la Comarca, antes de que su compañía élfica parta","El campamento élfico no está abandonado... por ahora","El hermano de Haerandel, Edlothon, viaja con una compañía de Elfos por la ruta habitual de su pueblo a través de la Comarca en dirección a los Puertos Grises. Haerandel cree que los encontrarás en el País de las Colinas Verdes, en los bosques sobre la carretera. ¡Te instó a ir con prisa antes de que continúen su marcha!","<rgb=#FF0000>Debes alcanzar a Edlothon antes de que los Elfos partan</rgb>","Habla con Edlothon en el País de las Colinas Verdes","Partir en Primavera","Edlothon se encuentra en el País de las Colinas Verdes, viajando con un grupo de Elfos rumbo a Mithlond, los Puertos Grises, desde donde dejarán la Tierra Media y zarparán hacia el Oeste."}},
[13653]={nameES="To Drenghól",objectivesES={"Talk to Zádokh Flint-eye at Drenghól","Scout Kulûg-mokh","Scouted Kulûg-mokh","Drenghól can be found in Elderslade.\
\
You should talk to Zádokh Flint-eye at Drenghól.","The Gabil'akkâ has secured Drenghól in Elderslade.","Scout Dûn Traikh","Journey to Drenghól","Scout Hanksar-mokh","To Drenghól","The dwarves at Drenghól have asked you to scout the forces gathered near the outer walls of Gundabad.\
\
You should assist the dwarves at Drenghól.","Scouted Hanksar-mokh","This hidden cave gives those a chance to safely scout the outer walls of Gundabad","Scouted Dûn Traikh","Drenghól can be found in Elderslade.\
\
You should journey to Drenghól."}},
[13654]={nameES="Hacia las Tierras Brunas",objectivesES={}},
[13655]={nameES="To Durgors",objectivesES={"The Boar-clan is holed up in the fishing-village of Durgors.","The leaders of the Boar-clan can be found at Durgors, south-west of Lhan Rhos.\
\
Elder Déin has asked you to report to the leaders of the Boar-clan movement.","Talk to Tecwin at Durgors","To Durgors"}},
[13656]={nameES="To East Wall",objectivesES={}},
[13657]={nameES="To Eaworth",objectivesES={"To Eaworth","Reeve Ingbert is at Eaworth in the Entwash Vale, west of Faldham.\
\
Thane Elfmar has asked you to journey to Eaworth and offer your services to Reeve Ingbert.","Talk to Reeve Ingbert at Eaworth in the Entwash Vale","Thane Elfmar has heard rumours of trouble in the Entwash Vale."}},
[13658]={nameES="To Elthengels",objectivesES={"The presence of traders from the town of Elthengels to Harwick has been all but extinguished. Etta worries that the tragedies befalling Thane Mildrith of Elthengels have thrown the farmers of the Norcrofts into a state of peril.","Speak with Thane Mildrith of Elthengels, in the Norcrofts","Thane Mildrith resides in the town of Elthengels, in the Norcrofts, south-west along the road from Floodwend.\
\
Etta has suggested that you lend aid to Thane Mildrith of Elthengels.","To Elthengels"}},
[13659]={nameES="To Faramir's Look-out",objectivesES={"Speak with Arodor","Rangers man the look-out, but Faramir is nowhere in sight","You spot some Orcs moving about in the ruins below","The ruins of Tuntham can be found north-east of Bâr Húrin.\
\
You should locate the cairn on the western side of the ruins and look around.","Faramir's Look-out is located south-east of Osgiliath.\
\
You should travel to Faramir's Look-out.","You spot ruins on the crest of the next hill which must be where Faramir moved his camp.","<rgb=#FF0000>Look</rgb> for the Ranger outpost from the northern cairn","Faramir's Look-out is located south-east of Osgiliath.\
\
You should speak with a Ranger at Faramir's Look-out.","This is a good place to <rgb=#FF0000>look</rgb> for the Ranger outpost","Travel to Faramir's Look-out","The ruins of Tuntham can be found north-east of Bâr Húrin.\
\
You should travel to Tuntham and learn if Faramir is still there.","Travel to Tuntham","Anborn sends you on your way to the last known location of Faramir's camp.","As Anborn predicted, there is no trace of a Ranger camp","The ruins of Tuntham can be found north-east of Bâr Húrin.\
\
You should locate the cairn on the northern side of the ruins and look around.","To Faramir's Look-out","<rgb=#FF0000>Look</rgb> for the Ranger outpost from the western cairn"}},
[13660]={nameES="To Fight Another Day",objectivesES={"Talk to Lági Helmbiter","To Fight Another Day","Across the battlefield, dwarves of the Gabil'akkâ fight against the Orcs of Gundabad. However, even the halest dwarf can be laid low by the underhanded ploys of the Orcs, and those wounded in the field are in dire need of aid.","Lági Helmbiter can be found at Ifbar-athrâkh.\
\
You have aided several wounded dwarves on the battlefield and sent them to recover at Ifbar-athrâkh. You should report news of your success to Lági Helmbiter.","Wounded dwarves can be found on the battlefield around Zudramdân in the War of Three Peaks.\
\
Lági Helmbiter has received word that several wounded dwarves are trapped on the battlefield in the War of Three Peaks. You should aid them and send them to Ifbar-athrâkh."}},
[13661]={nameES="To Gloomingtarn",objectivesES={"To Gloomingtarn","Deep within Mount Gundabad lies Gloomgintarn, the hallowed caverns where Durin the Deathless is said to have awoken in the Elder Days.","Spall can be found at Zâram-mekhem, the tarn-gate, where Deepscrave meets Gloomingtarn.\
\
You have received word from a Longbeard messenger that Spall, a lore-master of Erebor, has requested your presence in Gloomingtarn. You should travel to Zâram-mekhem in Gloomingtarn and meet with Spall.","Accompanied by Hersegg, Spall appears to be studying the runes at Zâram-mekhem","Talk to Spall at Zâram-mekhem in Gloomingtarn"}},
[13662]={nameES="To Gondor's Garden",objectivesES={"Talk to Kholnedák","Garaphir has collapsed, winded, on the stairs","After collapsing on one of Imloth Melui's incredibly tall set of stairs, Garaphir was more than willing to point the finger at his employer, the noble, Maengar.\
\
You should look for Maengar at his warehouse in Imloth Melui, and look for proof he was behind the infiltration of shoddy stones.","Interrogate Garaphir","Merenir has suggested that you look for Garaphir in the market district in Imloth Melui.","After a brief chase through Imloth Melui, Garaphir has collapsed on a tall stair-case, panting for breath.\
\
You should talk to Garaphir.","Maengar has been defeated!","Talk to Merenir","Realizing he was found out, Maengar attacked you to keep his secrets safe. He was no match for you, however, and has been defeated. You should collect his accounts book and bring it to Merenir.\
\
The accounts book is in Maengar's warehouse.","Garaphir sees you and makes a run for it!","Pursue Garaphir through Imloth Melui!","You found a journal full of incriminating accounts","To Gondor's Garden","Examine Maengar's warehouse for evidence","You should bring the accounts book to Merenir in Imloth Melui.","The crumpled note you found mentioned someone named Garaphir, who Kholnedák thinks can be found in Imloth Melui.\
\
She has recommended that you go to Imloth Melui and speak with the Captain of the Guard, Merenir.","Talk to Garaphir","Pick up the accounts book","Shoddy stones have found their way into the stockpiles in Arnach - the work of someone named Garaphir. He must be stopped, lest he continue to taint the dwarves' supply chain and reputation.","Return to Merenir","You managed to find Garaphir in the marketplace, but he fled when you drew near.\
\
You should pursue Garaphir through Imloth Melui.","Merenir mentioned that someone had been looking for you while you were dealing with Maengar. You can find Kholnedák in Imloth Melui."}},
[13663]={nameES="Sanar a un sanador",objectivesES={"Sanar a un sanador","Vuelve con Hal para entregarle las hierbas curativas.","Hal necesita hierbas curativas: las mismas que le encargaron encontrar.","Entrégale las setas extrañas a Hal Doblehoja","Llévale las hierbas curativas a Hal Doblehoja","Hal te ha encargado recoger unas setas extrañas por los bosques del Ángulo.","Dicen que el amor nos vuelve idiotas a todos... pero a unos más que a otros.","Hal Doblehoja está junto al camino al norte de Glynafon, en el Ángulo."}},
[13664]={nameES="To Helm's Deep",objectivesES={"Grimbold is at his camp in the hills at the western edge of the Westfold.\
\
You should speak with Grimbold.","Gamling is at Helm's Dike in the south-western Westfold.\
\
You should hasten to Gamling before the battle begins.","Speak with Erkenbrand before you leave","Apresúrate a llegar con Gamling en la Puerta de Helm","King Théoden stands upon the walls of the Hornburg.\
\
You should offer your sword to King Théoden as the Hornburg steels itself for battle.","Gandalf believes that the siege at Helm's Deep will begin soon, and that you can make it there with more haste than he with so many foot soldiers in tow.","Say good-bye to Grimbold","Erkenbrand is at his camp in the hills at the western edge of the Westfold.\
\
You should speak with Erkenbrand.","To Helm's Deep","Offer your sword to Théoden"}},
[13665]={nameES="To Honour the Dead",objectivesES={"Talk to Nadiph by the memorial","Podría ser suciedad. Podrían ser excrementos. ¡Podrían ser ambos!","Talk to the man running errands","Talk to the energetic youth","Nadiph expressed a desire for help in cleaning the memorial. Perhaps you could secure pledges of assistance from people around the plaza.\
\
Talk to passersby around the plaza in the Upper Ward.","To Honour the Dead","Clean the second dirty spot","A young man stands in front of a memorial to those murdered by the Church of the All-Seeing. He seems to be cleaning it. Perhaps you should join him in his work.","Clean the third dirty spot","Talk to the idle guardsman","You were unable to secure regular assistance from anyone nearby, but perhaps it would cheer up Nadiph to know you tried.\
\
Return to Nadiph in the Upper Ward.","Look for Nadiph","A memorial to the victims of the Church of the All-Seeing could use a cleaning.","Looks to be dirt","Clean the first dirty spot","When you return, Nadiph is nowhere to be found, but there is a fresh stain atop the memorial. You wipe it clean with a scrap of cloth left behind for that purpose.\
\
You could not fix Nadiph's problem, but you tried to help. That will have to be enough this time.","Talk to the shopkeep in the Grand Market","A young man is cleaning a memorial by himself. Help him.\
\
The memorial can be found in the Upper Ward of Umbar Baharbêl.","You have helped a young man clean the memorial. He seems ready to speak to you.\
\
Speak to Nadiph in the Upper Ward.","There was a stain of some kind here... but it is gone now"}},
[13666]={nameES="To Hytbold",objectivesES={"To Hytbold","Hytbold is to the north-east of Snowbourn, along the hills of the East Wall.\
\
Edgal is awaiting your arrival in Hytbold.","Fastred has asked you to meet with Edgal in Hytbold, a burned-out town to the east of Snowbourn.","Talk to Edgal"}},
[13667]={nameES="A Hîgropor",objectivesES={"Derrota a Colmillosombrío","A Hîgropor","Encuentra Hîgropor","Derrota al Maestro de la manada Tarkrîp","Has peinado una gran parte de Nan Wathren, pero todavía hay un rincón sin explorar. Tu corazón te advierte de que esta última aventura a lo profundo del paso será peligrosa.","Colmillosombrío derrotado","El Capitán Pasolargo está en Puente de Caballetes.\
\
Debes volver con el Capitán Pasolargo y contarle que has tenido éxito mermando a las tropas que se están preparando para la guerra en Nan Wathren.","Has peinado una gran parte de Nan Wathren, pero todavía hay un rincón sin explorar. Tu corazón te advierte de que esta última aventura a lo profundo del paso será peligrosa.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Se recomienda una Comunidad.</rgb>","El gran huargo Colmillosombrío y su maestro de jauría se encuentran en Hîgropor, oculto en los niveles superiores en la esquina sureste del paso de Nan Wathren.\
\
Debes derrotar a los brutales terrores de Hîgropor, y destruir los ídolos que conducen hasta allí.","Informa al Capitán Pasolargo de tu éxito en Nan Wathren"}},
[13668]={nameES="Hacia Imlad Gelair",objectivesES={"Imlad Gelair se encuentra al sureste de la Última morada, bajo las Cataratas de Imladris.\
\
Se te ha indicado que hables con Atharbain en Imlad Gelair.","Hacia Imlad Gelair","Tras pasar un tiempo contigo, los Elfos de Rivendel están preparados para darte la bienvenida en las salas interiores de Imlad Gelair."}},
[13669]={nameES="To Lamedon!",objectivesES={"Inspired by your efforts in Blackroot Vale, Lady Rosfin of Morlad hopes you can aid the people of Lamedon.","Travel into Lamedon and speak to Gladion","DNT -- will not be seen","Gladion can be found in the village of Dínadab in Lamedon, across Tarlang's Neck.\
\
Lady Rosfin has asked you to seek out a man named Gladion. She hopes you can bring aid to the people of Lamedon as well.","To Lamedon!"}},
[13670]={nameES="To Lhan Colvarn",objectivesES={}},
[13671]={nameES="Hacia Lhan Garan",objectivesES={"Talfryn está en Lhan Garan, en la Ciénaga de los Cisnes.\
\
Habla con Talfryn.","Los dunlendinos de Lhan Garan necesitan ayuda para prepararse para el invierno que se acerca.\
\
Un dunlendino que encontraste en Musgovilla te habló de su asentamiento en Lhan Garan. Ve allí y conoce a su líder, Talfryn.","Hacia Lhan Garan","Habla con Talfryn en Lhan Garan"}},
[13672]={nameES="To Lhan Rhos",objectivesES={"To Lhan Rhos","Talk to Bain in Lhan Rhos","Bain is at Lhan Rhos, south-west of the scouts' camp.\
\
Alun has asked you to talk to Bain, but warned you that most of the inhabitants of his village will not trust you or speak with you.","Alun has become impressed with you and your performance and recommends you to the Elders of Lhan Rhos."}},
[13673]={nameES="A la granja de Longo Madriguerales: Reponiendo la hierba de pipa",objectivesES={"Lleva la cesta de hierba de pipa al Mercado de los Granjeros","Sperling Tuk, el proveedor de la Feria de los Granjeros, se encuentra en Delagua.\
\
Regresa a Delagua lo antes posible, y dale bocados al pastel para ayudarte cuando necesites un impulso de energía.","Cesta de hierba de pipa recogida","Recoge la cesta de hierba de pipa (come el pastel para obtener un impulso de energía)","A la granja de Longo Madriguerales: Reponiendo la hierba de pipa","La granja de Longo Madriguerales está en las Tierras de los Tuk, justo al sur de Delagua en la Comarca.\
\
Corre a la granja de Longo Madriguerales y regresa con una cesta de hierba de pipa antes de que se acabe el tiempo.","Dejaste caer la cesta","Se ha acabado el tiempo"}},
[13674]={nameES="To Léoflad's Side",objectivesES={"Ride along the road south toward Eastfold","The road to Aldburg can be reached by taking the southern fork on the road to the west of Entwade.\
\
You have found no sign of the people of Entwade, and should continue riding south.","Léoflad and the people of Entwade can be found along the road south into Aldburg.\
\
Léoflad and her people passed very recently. You should ride swiftly to reunite Agelman with them.","The road to Aldburg can be reached by taking the southern fork on the road to the west of Entwade.\
\
You have readied Agelman for the journey, and should now ride south.","The three farmhands can be found at Pendlac's Farm in south-eastern Kingstead.\
\
Having seen no sign of Léoflad, you should speak to the three farmhands and ask if the people of Entwade have already passed through.","The river Snowbourn can found flowing through southern Kingstead.","Talk to Smála","Talk to Gyrth","Agelman can be found near the horse at Pendlac's Farm.\
\
You have aided Agelman in preparing to return to Entwade, and should now speak with him.","Aided Agelman in returning to Entwade","Argue with Thane Edric on Agelman's behalf","Talk to Agelman in the Mead Hall of Entwade","Aid Agelman in returning to Entwade","Find Léoflad and the people of Entwade","Aid Agelman in burying the people of Entwade","You have seen no sign of Léoflad or her people and should continue riding south","Rally Agelman to your side","Agelman would like to speak with you about what he can offer the defences of Entwade.\
\
You have been ordered to bring Agelman south to Aldburg.","To Léoflad's Side","The time has come to journey south","Rally Agelman to your side by using the horn given to you by Thane Edric.\
\
Thane Edric has asked you to bring Agelman to rejoin with his people along the road south to Aldburg.","Ford the river Snowbourn","Poised to repel a White Hand assault, Thane Edric demands that Agelman be taken to safety in the south with Léoflad and the people of Entwade.","You have discovered a grim scene as the people of Entwade lay slain before you","Agelman can be found inside the Mead Hall of Entwade.\
\
Agelman prepares to ride back to Thane Edric with Léoflad's body. You should ride to Entwade and meet him in the Mead Hall.","The farmhouse can be found directly south of the river Snowbourn near the border of Eastfold and Kingstead.","As you cross, you spy a farmhouse in the distance","You have encountered a wrecked cart, clearly here before Léoflad set off","Talk to Pendlac","Aided Agelman in burying the people of Entwade","Agelman can be found at your side or can be rallied to you by using your horn.\
\
You have aided Agelman as best you could, and he is now ready to set off. You should speak to Agelman before he departs.","You discover three farmhands working amidst the fields","Agelman can be found at your side or can be rallied to you by using your horn.\
\
Agelman has asked you to aid him in recovering Léoflad's body and preparing for his return to Entwade.","Talk to Agelman at Pendlac's Farm","Agelman rushes to your side","Follow the road south toward Eastfold","Investigate the farmhouse along the road"}},
[13675]={nameES="To Misthallow",objectivesES={"Talk to Skarding Wargsbane at Thokvist","Fanglind can be found at Thokvist.\
\
You should talk to Fanglind.","Fanglind can be found at Thokvist.\
\
You should greet Fanglind.","Fanglind accepts your greeting","Talk to Fanglind at Thokvist","Skarding Wargsbane can be found at Thokvist.\
\
You should talk to Skarding.","Runerik Knotbeard, thane of Limlók, seeks to hear from Skarding Wargsbane and learn of the difficulties the lone Beorning may face in Misthallow.","The small Beorning encampment is occupied by a lone Beorning and an Eagle","Greet Fanglind with a <rgb=#FF0000>bow</rgb>","To Misthallow","Misthallow can be found north of the Floodfells.\
\
You should travel to Thokvist in the southern end of Misthallow.","Travel to Thokvist in Misthallow"}},
[13676]={nameES="A la Granja de Cotonorte: Reponiendo el vino",objectivesES={"Dejaste caer el vino","Sperling Tuk, el proveedor de la Feria de los Granjeros, se encuentra en Delagua.\
\
Regresa a Delagua lo antes posible, y dale bocados al pastel para ayudarte cuando necesites un impulso de energía.","A la Granja de Cotonorte: Reponiendo el vino","Barril de vino recogido","La Granja de Cotonorte está en Avenal, al norte de Tejonera, en el extremo más septentrional de la Comarca, cerca de Evendim.\
\
Corre hasta la granja y regresa con un barril de vino antes de que se acabe el tiempo.","Lleva el barril de vino al Mercado de los Granjeros","Recoge un barril de vino (come el pastel para obtener un impulso de energía)","Se te ha acabado el tiempo"}},
[13677]={nameES="To Ost Lontir",objectivesES={"Now that Tadrent is safe, Bruidis has asked you to go to Ost Lontir and learn more about the corsair threat in Edhellond.","To Ost Lontir","Travel to Ost Lontir and speak with Gilanor","Ost Lontir is located in Belfalas, in the foothills of Emyn Ernil.\
\
You should speak with Ost Lontir's leader, Gilanor."}},
[13678]={nameES="A la Granja de Arenilla: Reponiendo los huevos",objectivesES={"Lleva la cesta de huevos al Mercado de los Granjeros","Sperling Tuk, el proveedor de la Feria de los Granjeros, se encuentra en Delagua.\
\
Regresa a Delagua lo antes posible, y dale bocados al pastel para ayudarte cuando necesites un impulso de energía.","A la Granja de Arenilla: Reponiendo los huevos","Cesta de huevos recogida","Recoge la cesta de huevos (come el pastel para obtener un impulso de energía)","Se te ha acabado el tiempo","Dejaste caer la cesta","La Granja de Arenilla está justo al este de Cavada Pequeña.\
\
Corre a la granja de pollos y regresa con una cesta de huevos antes de que se acabe el tiempo."}},
[13679]={nameES="To Shield the Shepherds",objectivesES={"Mizâdi has decided to first visit Ahâba, the oasis settlement of the Beltáni people, to offer aid and try to form an alliance with their leader.","Defeated the Ordâkhai ambush","To Shield the Shepherds","The Beltáni shepherds you rescued asked you to enter Ahâba and speak to their chieftain.\
\
You should enter Ahâba and speak to Unusâli.","Mizâdi is going ahead with Numûru and Sorkamâl.\
\
You should meet her outside of Ahâba, north-west of her small camp.","Find Unusâli in Ahâba","Meet Mizâdi on the road to Ahâba","Someone is shouting and running toward you!","Someone is chasing the Beltáni shepherds in your direction!\
\
You should aid the shepherds.","Defeat the Ordâkhai ambush"}},
[13680]={nameES="To Stangard",objectivesES={"You have helped in Thinglad as much as was needed, and now it is time to offer your aid to the folk of Stangard.","To Stangard","Call at the northern gate of Stangard","Stangard is the city to the south of Thinglad, in Eorlsmead.\
\
You should attempt to gain entry to the city of Stangard."}},
[13681]={nameES="To Stoke A Cold Fire",objectivesES={"Talk to Mézto at Drenghól","Eager to erode the alliance between the forces of Gorgar the Ruthless and Hrímil Frost-heart, Mézto has devised a plan to turn Orc against Orc.","To Stoke A Cold Fire","Mézto can be found at Drenghól in the War of Three Peaks.\
\
You have done as Mézto asked and sown division between the forces at Bagûd-mekhem. You should report your success to Mézto.","Cold-whelplings can be found at Bagûd-mekhem.\
\
Mézto has asked you to slay cold-whelplings in Bagûd-mekhem and set their remains upon fires tended by the Orcs of Gundabad.","Fire-pits can be found at Bagûd-mekhem.\
\
Mézto has asked to slay cold-whelplings in Bagûd-mekhem and set their remains upon fires tended by the Orcs of Gundabad."}},
[13682]={nameES="To Survive the Night",objectivesES={}},
[13683]={nameES="To Tadrent",objectivesES={"The merchant Haelam has a message for you to deliver.","To Tadrent","Talk to Bruidis in Tadrent","Haelam has asked you to bring a list of delayed lumber orders to Bruidis.\
\
She can be found in Tadrent, south-west from Calembel."}},
[13684]={nameES="To Tame a New Guardian",objectivesES={}},
[13685]={nameES="To The Pit of Stonejaws",objectivesES={"To The Pit of Stonejaws","Talk to Scout-master Ausma in The Pit of Stonejaws","The Pit of Stonejaws is above Máttugard, in Gundabad.","Scout-master Ausma can be found at the encampment of Bárgstad in the Pit of Stonejaws.\
\
You should talk to Scout-master Ausma in The Pit of Stonejaws."}},
[13686]={nameES="Al Poney Pisador",objectivesES={"Gandalf te ha convocado para que te reúnas con él en el Poney Pisador en Bree","Gandalf el Gris te ha convocado para que te reúnas con él en el Poney Pisador en Bree para discutir asuntos que le conciernen.","Gandalf el Gris está en la Posada del Poney Pisador en Bree.\
\
Deberías darte prisa en reunirte con Gandalf el Gris.","Reúnete con Gandalf en el Poney Pisador en Bree","Habla con Gandalf el Gris en el Poney Pisador en Bree","Al Poney Pisador"}},
[13687]={nameES="To The Windfells: Saeradan's Encampment",objectivesES={"Saeradan is at Echad Saeradan in the Windfells, south of Echad Dagoras.\
\
Braigiar instructed you to find Saeradan and lend him your aid.","Talk to Saeradan at Echad Saeradan","To The Windfells: Saeradan's Encampment","Braigiar has asked you to forge ahead to find Saeradan's encampment in the Windfells to the south. The southern Dunlendings are reported to have a large watchtower and encampment in this region, watching the Great North Road for unwanted intrusion from the direction of Bree or the Shire."}},
[13688]={nameES="A Thorenhad",objectivesES={"Exploradores élficos están acampados en Thorenhad, encargados de patrullar el Bosque de los Trolls en busca de señales del mal.","Thorenhad es una ruina en lo alto de una colina, al norte de las guaridas de los osos en las Gargantas del Bruinen. Se halla al este del campamento de Barachen y a cierta distancia al oeste de Rivendel.\
\
Anhebir te ha enviado a Thorenhad para presentarte ante Elrohir, hijo de Elrond.","A Thorenhad"}},
[13689]={nameES="To Tirith Rhaw",objectivesES={}},
[13690]={nameES="To Tol Ascarnen",objectivesES={}},
[13691]={nameES="To Tomorrow",objectivesES={"Náin has asked you to help him apologize to Shúkurz.\
\
Shúkurz is preparing for the upcoming journey in an old home at the base of Buzra-salân, north of Aslíf.","You have delivered Náin's apology to Shúkurz.","Talk to Shúkurz","Náin has never been one for inaction, and Shúkurz deserves an apology.","To Tomorrow","You have delivered Náin's apology to Shúkurz. An uncertain future stands in the way of Shúkurz and his people, but they may yet find peace.","Completado"}},
[13692]={nameES="To Trum Dreng",objectivesES={}},
[13693]={nameES="A la Comarca Allende",objectivesES={"Salga Pastoverde se encuentra en el pueblo de Nobotella en el este de la Comarca Allende. Frothard Tuk se encuentra en la aldea de Campotieso en el centro de la Comarca Allende.\
\
Habla con Salga Pastoverde en Nobotella y Frothard Tuk en Campotieso.","Habla con Frothard Tuk en Campotieso","A la Comarca Allende","Mientras muchos consideran la Comarca Allende como un rincón perdido de la Comarca propiamente dicha, los pueblos que hay allí siempre dan la bienvenida a los viajeros cansados.","Habla con Salga Pastoverde en Nobotella"}},
[13694]={nameES="To Zarsatrâd",objectivesES={"Bring the crate to Irzeben","Tinído has asked you to bring a crate of chisel tips north to the dwarf-outpost of Zarsatrâd.","To Zarsatrâd","Pick up the crate of chisel tips","You should bring the crate of chisel tips to Irzeben.\
\
Irzeben is in northern Lebennin, at Zarsatrâd.","Nestled within the forest of northern Lower Lebennin, is the dwarf-outpost, Zarsatrâd. The outpost serves as a waypoint for the Dwarves of Furukzahar as they move supplies of heavy stone from the Aban-bazan quarry."}},
[13695]={nameES="To Zudramdân",objectivesES={"Journey to Zudramdân","The Gabil'akkâ has secured Zudramdân in Elderslade.","To Zudramdân","The dwarves here have just only recently secured Zudramdân","Zudramdân can be found in Elderslade.\
\
You should journey to Zudramdân.","Talk to Náth at Zudramdân","Zudramdân can be found in Elderslade.\
\
You should talk to Náth at Zudramdân.","Orkish forces can be found in Elderslade.\
\
You should assist the dwarves at Zudramdân.","Agátur the Boastful has asked you to plant banners along the road leading to Zudramdân.\
\
You should plant banners along the road leading to Zudramdân."}},
[13696]={nameES="A Manzanal: Reabasteciendo el puesto de manzanas",objectivesES={"Dejaste caer la cesta","Sperling Tuk, el proveedor de la Feria de los Granjeros, se encuentra en Delagua.\
\
Regresa a Delagua lo antes posible, y dale bocados al pastel para ayudarte cuando necesites un impulso de energía.","Recoge la cesta de manzanas (come el pastel para obtener un impulso de energía)","A Manzanal: Reabasteciendo el puesto de manzanas","Lleva la cesta de manzanas al Mercado de los Granjeros","El huerto de Manzanal está en Hobbiton, al oeste de la Colina y Bolsón Cerrado.\
\
Corre al célebre huerto de manzanas y regresa con una cesta antes de que se acabe el tiempo.","Se te ha acabado el tiempo","Cesta de manzanas recogida"}},
[13697]={nameES="A las colmenas: Reponiendo la miel",objectivesES={"A las colmenas: Reponiendo la miel","Sperling Tuk, el proveedor de la Feria de los Granjeros, se encuentra en Delagua.\
\
Regresa a Delagua lo antes posible, y dale bocados al pastel para ayudarte cuando necesites un impulso de energía.","Recoge un tarro de miel (come el pastel para obtener un impulso de energía)","Lleva el tarro de miel al Mercado de los Granjeros","Las colmenas de Alforzaburgo están al sur de Delagua.\
\
Corre hasta las colmenas que hay junto al camino hacia el sur y regresa con un tarro de miel antes de que se acabe el tiempo.","Dejaste caer la miel","Se te ha acabado el tiempo","Tarro de miel recogido"}},
[13698]={nameES="To the Bonevales",objectivesES={}},
[13699]={nameES="To the Broadacres",objectivesES={"Gandalf can be found near the main gate of Edoras.\
\
You were informed that Gandalf wishes to speak with you. You should go to him at once.","To the Broadacres","A scout has encountered Gandalf while riding in the Westemnet, and the wizard mentioned that he wishes to speak with you.","Speak with Gandalf in Edoras","Húlac can be found in the town of Stoke in the Broadacres.\
\
You should ride to Stoke and search for Húlac.","Find Húlac in the Broadacres"}},
[13700]={nameES="A la Cámara de la Encrucijada",objectivesES={"Habla con Líkmund","Thettmárr te ha pedido que verifiques el progreso de la expedición de enanos en la Cámara de la Encrucijada, en el Camino de Durin. Una vez allí, deberías hablar con Líkmund.","A la Cámara de la Encrucijada","Para llegar a la Cámara de la Encrucijada, dirígete al norte desde el Descenso Profundo hasta el campamento del Mirador de la Gran Excavación. Desde el Mirador de la Gran Excavación, sigue tu mapa y la carretera principal iluminada hacia la Cámara de la Encrucijada."}},
[13701]={nameES="Hacia el Descenso Profundo",objectivesES={"El Descenso Profundo se encuentra siguiendo el sendero sur desde el Mirador de la Gran Excavación, en el extremo norte de las Vetas del Cuerno de Plata.\
\
Debes tomar el sendero hacia el sur para descubrir el asentamiento enano del Descenso Profundo.","Deberías hablar con Thettmárr en el campamento de Descento Profundo en cuanto quieras para partir","A los Barbiluengos les queda mucho trabajo por delante para recuperar su antiguo hogar, Moria.","Hacia el Descenso Profundo","Habla con Thettmárr en el Descenso Profundo"}},
[13702]={nameES="Hacia el Mirador de la Gran Excavación",objectivesES={"El campamento del Mirador de la Gran Excavación se encuentra al este de Lamab-dûm, en un cruce de caminos algo central en la Gran Excavación.\
\
Debes seguir la carretera iluminada lo mejor que puedas hasta el Mirador de la Gran Excavación.","Habla con Slagvi en el Mirador de la Gran Excavación","Hacia el Mirador de la Gran Excavación","Thórhall te ha animado a dirigirte al este, hacia el campamento del Mirador de la Gran Excavación, el centro de operaciones de los enanos en la Gran Excavación."}},
[13703]={nameES="To the Dry-whelm",objectivesES={"Meet Mizâdi at her forward camp in Idagâl","To the Dry-whelm","Mizâdi is preparing to launch a campaign in Idagâl and asked for your aid.\
\
You should speak to Mizâdi at her camp near the border of An Shêru.","Mizâdi Shâra-ingari has asked for your aid in her campaign in Idagâl."}},
[13704]={nameES="To the Eastfold",objectivesES={"To the Eastfold","A scout has encountered Gandalf while riding in the Westemnet, and the wizard mentioned that he wishes to speak with you.","Speak with Gandalf in Edoras","Gandalf can be found near the main gate of Edoras.\
\
You should hasten to Edoras to begin helping the people of the Eastfold."}},
[13705]={nameES="To the Eastfold",objectivesES={"To the Eastfold","A scout has encountered Gandalf while riding in the Westemnet, and the wizard mentioned that he wishes to speak with you.","Speak with Gandalf in Edoras","Gandalf can be found near the main gate of Edoras.\
\
You should hasten to Edoras to begin helping the people of the Eastfold."}},
[13706]={nameES="Hacia el lugar de pesca",objectivesES={"Hay un evento de pesca en marcha en Delagua. Se te ha animado a participar antes de que finalice el festival.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando finalice el festival actual.</rgb>","Habla con Neddie Cavada en Delagua","Hacia el lugar de pesca","Neddie Cavada se encuentra cerca del gran estanque de Delagua, justo al este de Hobbiton.\
\
Deberías hablar con Neddie Cavada, quien te introducirá en los eventos de pesca del Festival del Lithe (y te enseñará a pescar, si aún no lo has hecho)."}},
[13707]={nameES="To the Floodfells",objectivesES={"To the Floodfells","Talk to Léothred at the Beorninghús before you depart","Limlók can be found in the Floodfells.\
\
You should travel to Limlók.","<rgb=#FF0000>Mourn</rgb> the passing of Hunulf","Grimbeorn should hear Hunulf's final words","Light a candle for Hunulf at the Carrock","Hunulf can be found at the front gate of the Beorninghús.\
\
You should mourn Hunulf's passing.","Grimbeorn knows the threat in the north moves ever closer to the lands and people he has sworn to protect.","The small village looks tattered and worn","Hunulf can be found at the front gate of the Beorninghús.\
\
You should talk to Hunulf.","Hunulf's death can not be in vain","Hunulf has passed","Grimbeorn can be found at the Beorninghús.\
\
You should talk to Grimbeorn.","Travel to Limlók in the Floodfells","The Carrock can be found in the Beorninglands.\
\
You should light a candle for Hunulf at the Carrock.","Runerik Knotbeard is the Thane of Limlók, in the Floodfells.\
\
You should talk to Runerik Knotbeard.","Léothred can be found at the front gate of the Beorninghús.\
\
You should talk to Léothred.","Talk to Runerik Knotbeard in Limlók","Deliver Hunulf's last words to Grimbeorn","Talk to Hunulf at the front gate of the Beorninghús"}},
[13708]={nameES="To the Glade",objectivesES={"The Pristine Glade lies to the west of Lhan Rhos, beyond a cave.\
\
Elder Déin has asked you to quickly go and help protect the last remaining secret of the Dunbog: the Pristine Glade.","To the Glade","Saruman is attempting to attack the sacred ground of the Dunbog, and the Avanc-lûth need your help.","Talk to Maugan at the Pristine Glade"}},
[13709]={nameES="To the Haven of Sailors",objectivesES={"Fimlothel has asked you to aid the new recruits by repelling the Corsair advance from Khatsûr.\
\
Khatsûr can be found at the western edge of Anfalas.","You have helped quell the numbers of Corsairs in Khatsûr. You should report to Marra.\
\
Marra can be found in Lond Cirion.","Talk to Marra in Lond Cirion","To the Haven of Sailors","Fimlothel expresses concern that new recruits in Lond Cirion may need help by fending off the Corsair incursion along the coast of Hathollant."}},
[13710]={nameES="A las carreras de caballos",objectivesES={"A las carreras de caballos","Carl Ganapié se encuentra en los Campos de Cavada de la Comarca, cerca de Gran Cavada. Sally Trilla está en las Campos de los Caballos de Bree, en el recinto del festival.\
\
Deberías hablar con Sally Trilla y Carl Ganapié para familiarizarte con las carreras del festival de esta temporada.","Habla con Carl Ganapié en los Campos de Cavada de la Comarca","Habla con Sally Trilla en las Tierras de los Caballos de Bree","Las carreras de caballos se encuentran tanto en los Campos de Cavada, cerca de Gran Cavada, como en los Campos de los Caballos de Bree. ¿Probarás suerte a ver si ganas un corcel esta temporada?\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando termine el festival actual. </rgb>"}},
[13711]={nameES="To the Hunt",objectivesES={"To the Hunt","You continue to earn the trust of the people of the Dunbog. The Avanc-lûth must constantly hunt and scavenge, or they will go hungry quickly.","Talk to Harri at the hunters' camp","The hunters' camp lies to the south-east of Lhan Rhos.\
\
Bain has asked you to talk to the hunters and aid them, with the hope that your success will convince the Elders of Lhan Rhos to speak with you."}},
[13712]={nameES="Hacia las carreras de barriles",objectivesES={"Las carreras de Barriles pueden encontrarse visitando al maestro de cuadra de la Mansión de Thorin para que te lleve hasta la zona de la carrera.\
\
Deberías dirigirte al maestro de cuadra de la Mansión de Thorin, quien te indicará cómo llegar a las carreras de barriles.","Habla con Jorfi (toma un caballo desde el maestro de cuadra de la Mansión de Thorin para visitar la carrera)","Hacia las carreras de barriles"}},
[13713]={nameES="Al Último Puente",objectivesES={"Alphlanc acampa en el extremo del Último Puente entre las Tierras Solitarias y el Bosque de los Trolls, muy al oeste de Rivendel.\
\
Anhebir te ha enviado para brindar toda la ayuda que puedas a la Elfa Alphlanc en el Bosque de los Trolls occidental.","Anhebir te ha enviado al Último Puente con la esperanza de que puedas ayudar a la exploradora Alphlanc.","Habla con Alphlanc","Al Último Puente"}},
[13714]={nameES="To the Last Drop",objectivesES={"The wedding planner Merilien is on the Seventh Circle of Minas Tirith.\
\
You should bring the cask to Merilien.","It's probably not possible to add more water to this 'wine'","To the Last Drop","A wine so sweet as to almost be syrupy. Good for dessert?","The Splintered Shield is located on the Second Tier of Minas Tirith.\
\
You should go to The Splintered Shield in Minas Tirith and sample wines.","Deliver the cask to Merilien","Find the correct wine for the wedding planner","A robust, heady taste... of wet dog","This sweet white tastes of smoke and apricot","This light-bodied, tart red tastes of strawberries, violets, and black pepper","Pick up the proper wine cask","Picked up the proper wine cask","So tart it makes your lips pucker and your eyes water","A fizzling effervescence on your tongue. This wine is not supposed to have bubbles...","This wine tastes like your great-aunt's mouldy cellar","This dry white has a crisp taste with a hint of flint","You have found the wine the wedding planner requested.\
\
You should pick up the wine cask and bring it to the wedding planner in Minas Tirith.","The wedding planner in Minas Tirith requests aid in picking the perfect vintage.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This quest will be removed from your quest log when the current festival ends.</rgb>","This is probably just vinegar","This wine has sapped all joy from your life","This dark red tastes of blackcurrant, leather, and anise"}},
[13715]={nameES="A la frontera solitaria",objectivesES={"A la frontera solitaria","Habla con el Capitán Pasolargo en Puente de Caballetes para solicitarle un caballo rápido a la Posada Abandonada en las Tierras Solitarias.","El Capitán Pasolargo de Puente de Caballetes ha recibido un mensaje de un viejo compañero suyo... el Condestable Bram Hojafresno, quien está en las Tierras Solitarias intentando contener una ola de anarquía y cosas peores.\
\
Habla con el Condestable Hojafresno en su nombre para ver qué ayuda puedes ofrecerle."}},
[13716]={nameES="To the Next Camp-fire",objectivesES={"Arrived at Sâr Marsag","You arrived in Sâr Marsag and see a scout named Tábai. Bring the supplies of the serum to him and let him know to distribute them.","Dáthlil has given you supplies of the serum that the Rangers concocted to resist the blight. Bring them to the scouts in Sâr Marsag to the south.","Travel to Sâr Marsag","To the Next Camp-fire","Speak with Tábai"}},
[13717]={nameES="A la Guardia Orca",objectivesES={"Ayudaste a Mögr en Zelem-melek, y él se ha enterado de que la Guardia Orca en las Vetas del Cuerno Rojo también necesita ayuda.","A la Guardia Orca","Habla con Avar en la Guardia Orca (hay una cabra disponible para el viaje, ya que el trayecto es difícil)","Avar se encuentra en la Guardia Orca, en las Vetas del Cuerno Rojo, a una gran distancia de la Sala Vigesimoprimera a través de los numerosos y sinuosos pasadizos de Zelem-melek.\
\
Mögr te ha invitado a ir a las Vetas del Cuerno Rojo montando una cabra si el viaje resulta demasiado difícil a pie."}},
[13718]={nameES="To the Pit of Stonejaws DNT NOT USED",objectivesES={"To the Pit of Stonejaws DNT NOT USED","Ausma has requested your aid in her mission in the Pit of Stonejaws.\
\
You will find Scout-master Ausma at the dwarf-camp Bárgstad.","A runner from Scout-master Ausma has found you. Your orders are to assist her and her scouts in the Pit of Stonejaws.","Talk to Ausma in Bárgstad"}},
[13719]={nameES="To the Starkmoor",objectivesES={"The Starkmoor is a land to the south of Pren Gwydh.","The Starkmoor is to the south-west of Pren Gwydh.\
\
You should search for Andras, the leader of a caravan, on the road from Pren Gwydh to the Starkmoor.","Find Andras in the Starkmoor","To the Starkmoor"}},
[13720]={nameES="To the Stonedeans",objectivesES={"A scout has just come from the Stonedeans, and it would seem that the people of that land are in need of aid.","Find Oter in the Stonedeans","To the Stonedeans","Oter can be found on the road in the Stonedeans, near Woodhurst.\
\
You should hasten to the Stonedeans and find out more from Oter."}},
[13721]={nameES="Hacia El Sabor de Hobbiton",objectivesES={"Habla con Dore Dospiés (toma un caballo desde las caballerizas de Cavada Grande hasta el Árbol de la Fiesta y, desde allí, otro caballo hasta El Sabor de Hobbiton).","Hacia El Sabor de Hobbiton","Se puede acceder a El Sabor de Hobbiton tomando un caballo en las caballerizas de Cavada Grande hasta el Árbol de la Fiesta, y desde allí otro caballo te llevará a El Sabor de Hobbiton. Los caballos solo están disponibles durante el evento.\
\
Debes dirigirte a las caballerizas de Cavada Grande, donde un caballo te llevará hasta el Árbol de la Fiesta."}},
[13722]={nameES="To the Welkin-lofts",objectivesES={"A runner from Scout-master Ausma has found you. Your orders are to assist Hórin in the peaks of the Welkin-lofts!","Ausma has sent word that the hobgoblins are moving into the Welkin-lofts.\
\
Your orders are to assist Hórin with tracking them down. You will find Hórin at a camp in the northern reaches of the Welkin-lofts called Fellgát.","Talk to Hórin in Fellgát, a camp in the northern reaches of the Welkin-lofts","To the Welkin-lofts"}},
[13723]={nameES="To the Westfold",objectivesES={}},
[13724]={nameES="To the Westfold",objectivesES={"Gandalf can be found upon the road in the centre of the Westfold.\
\
You should make haste and ride to Gandalf.","A scout has encountered Gandalf while riding in the Westemnet, and the wizard mentioned that he wishes to speak with you.","To the Westfold","Speak with Gandalf in the Westfold"}},
[13725]={nameES="A las guaridas de los lobos",objectivesES={"Langhár se puede encontrar en algún lugar de Vegbár.\
\
Deberías hablar con Langhár.","Travel to Vegbár","Langhár has been sent to the Wolf-denes to help deal with the goblins there. Sterkist believes she would be happy to accept your help in the matter.","Has encontrado Vegbár","A las guaridas de los lobos","Vegbár, the Beorning outpost in the Wolf-denes, can be found south-west of the Beorninghús.\
\
You should travel to Vegbár to find Langhár.","Habla con Langhár"}},
[13726]={nameES="Baba de sapo",objectivesES={"Baba de sapo","Los sapos que viven en las Obras Hidráulicas producen una baba con propiedades desconcertantes.","Gyrgir se encuentra en Hulwul-nefekh, en el centro de las Obras Hidráulicas.\
\
Deberías llevarle la baba de sapo que has recogido a Gyrgir.","Los sapos se pueden encontrar por todas las Obras Hidráulicas y al este de la Gran Rueda.\
\
Gyrgir cree que con algo de baba de sapo puede crear una solución al problema de los lagartos.","Habla con Gyrgir en Hulwul-nefekh"}},
[13727]={nameES="Guiso de Sapo",objectivesES={"Guiso de Sapo","Hay una piedra de moler junto a la hoguera de Indor en Echad Candelleth.\
\
Indor está esperando que muelas los ingredientes del guiso de sapo hasta hacerlos una pasta.","Encontrarás sapos a lo largo de las orillas de los ríos en Tâl Bruinen.\
\
Indor te ha pedido que le ayudes a reunir los ingredientes necesarios para preparar el guiso de sapo, una receta que le dio el enano Wéthorm. Te recordó que solo los sapos verdes del río tienen lenguas y patas de calidad.","Lleva los ingredientes del guiso de sapo a Indor","Indor está muy entusiasmado por probar una receta que el enano Wéthorm le dio, pero no tiene los ingredientes necesarios.","Mueles los pedazos de sapo hasta hacerlos puré","Muele los ingredientes del guiso de sapo en la piedra de moler","Lleva la pasta de sapo a Indor","Indor está en Echad Candelleth, el campamento élfico en Tâl Bruinen.\
\
Has recogido muchos trozos de sapo con los que Indor planea preparar su guiso. Deberías llevárselos.","Indor está en la hoguera de Echad Candelleth, en Tâl Bruinen.\
\
Has molido los pedazos de sapo hasta hacerlos una pasta y ahora debes entregárselos a Indor para que dé los toques finales al guiso."}},
[13728]={nameES="Together Now",objectivesES={}},
[13729]={nameES="Toil in Tingobel",objectivesES={"Toil in Tingobel","You set the crate down on the waggon, and the task is done!","Boradan can be found in Tingobel in the Blackroot Vale.\
\
You have helped Boradan by carrying a heavy crate of ingots to the waggon in Tingobel. You should return to Boradan.","With the Orcs of the White Mountains driven out of the Blackroot Vale, the people of Tingobel once again work to supply Gondor with iron.","Deliver the unrefined iron ore to Boradan in Tingobel","Pick up the crate of ingots in Tingobel","Talk to Rhúdon","Talk to Boradan","Rhúdon can be found near the entrance to the mine in Tingobel, in the Blackroot Vale.\
\
Boradan has asked you to check on his apprentice, Rhúdon, who has been slow to return from his duties in the mine. You should talk to Rhúdon.","The crate of ingots can be found near Boradan's forge in Tingobel, in the Blackroot Vale.\
\
Boradan has asked a favour of you: to bear the last, heavy crate of iron ingots to a waggon at the western end of the village. You should carry the crate of ingots to the waggon.","Piles of unrefined iron ore can be found in Tingobel, in the Blackroot Vale.\
\
After accidentally tipping over a mine cart, Rhúdon has asked for your help in collecting unrefined iron ore for Boradan. You should collect unrefined iron ore around Tingobel.","Boradan can be found in Tingobel in the Blackroot Vale.\
\
You have collected a great deal of unrefined iron ore. You should deliver it to Boradan on Rhúdon's behalf."}},
[13730]={nameES="Trabajo en la Torre Oscura",objectivesES={"En las mazmorras de Barad-dûr, los Hachetón son obligados a trabajar sin descanso para el Señor Oscuro de Mordor.","Se te ha ordenado trabajar en las mazmorras de Barad-dûr.","Zôreth puede encontrarse en las mazmorras de Barad-dûr.\
\
Has cumplido con todos tus deberes y ahora deberías informar a Zôreth.","Trabajo en la Torre Oscura","Preséntate ante Zôreth."}},
[13731]={nameES="Tokens of Fealty",objectivesES={"The Ranger Prestadír is very perturbed by the atmosphere around Audaghaim and is curious about the history of the town.","Habla con Prestadír en la Posada Embrujada","Prestadír can be found in the Haunted Inn in the Dourstocks, west of Audaghaim.\
\
You should return to Prestadír with the strange tokens you collected from the shades of Audaghaim.","Shades can be found in Audaghaim in the Dourstocks, just east of the Haunted Inn.\
\
You should confront shades and see if you can find anything out about why this ruined town feels so fell.","Tokens of Fealty"}},
[13732]={nameES="Tokens of Jajax",objectivesES={}},
[13733]={nameES="Tol Aduial - A Feast of Drakes",objectivesES={"A pair of drakes have roosted on the ruins of a small island off the coast of Dol Amroth, terrorizing the Gondorian fishermen.","Place the meat then defeat the drakes","Akalur has fallen!","Tol Aduial - A Feast of Drakes","Yaradec has fallen!","They are coming...","The drakes must be vanquished to protect the city.\
\
A boat in the harbour of Dol Amroth can take you to Tol Aduial."}},
[13734]={nameES="Tol Aduial - A Hunter's Prowess",objectivesES={"Before time expires","Placing the bait will cause the avanc to swarm.","Tol Aduial - A Hunter's Prowess","Defeated swarming avanc","The swarm is coming.","Place the bait","The challenge has begun. Dispatch as many avanc as you can before the time expires.","Avanc fill the coastal waters. With the right 'encouragement' they will swarm. True hunters of Gondor are able to dispatch of swaths of the beasts within a few very short, intense, moments.","Time has expired"}},
[13735]={nameES="Tol Aduial - Corsairs",objectivesES={}},
[13736]={nameES="Tol Aduial - Smoke Signals",objectivesES={}},
[13737]={nameES="Tol Fennas - Caught and Caged",objectivesES={}},
[13738]={nameES="Tol Fennas - Corsair Craftsmen",objectivesES={"Tol Fennas - Corsair Craftsmen","Glíreth is in Dol Amroth.\
\
Glíreth will be pleased to hear the workforce at Makham Jurrar has been noticeably reduced.","The Corsairs have set up Makham Jurrar, a lumber and shipyard camp on the north side of Tol Fennas.","Corsairs can be found at Makham Jurrar, the lumber and shipyard camp on the north side of Tol Fennas.\
\
Glíreth asked you to venture to Makham Jurrar and disrupt the lumber camp there. A boat in the harbour of Dol Amroth can take you to Tol Fennas."}},
[13739]={nameES="Tol Fennas - Floating Kindling",objectivesES={}},
[13740]={nameES="Tol Fennas - Hunting the Hunters",objectivesES={}},
[13741]={nameES="Tol Fennas - Planting Anew",objectivesES={"Tol Fennas - Planting Anew","Dimlas is in Dol Amroth.\
\
Dimlas will be pleased to hear a new crop of seeds has been planted.","The Corsairs are cutting down the trees on Tol Fennas in order to build more ships and boats.","Planting locations can be found all over Tol Fennas.\
\
Dimlas asked you to go to Tol Fennas and plant seeds to grow new trees. A boat in the harbour of Dol Amroth can take you to Tol Fennas."}},
[13742]={nameES="Tol Fennas - Ravens' Rookery",objectivesES={}},
[13743]={nameES="Tol Fennas - Snares",objectivesES={}},
[13744]={nameES="Tol Fennas - The Corsair Croup",objectivesES={}},
[13745]={nameES="Toll Oivas: Flight of the Dead",objectivesES={}},
[13746]={nameES="Toll Oivas: Vile Runes",objectivesES={}},
[13747]={nameES="Tolwin's Journey",objectivesES={"Tolwin asks for assistance as he patrols Talath Anor, searching for his mother who has been missing since minions of Mordor invaded the stronghold of Cair Andros.","Complete: Dismantling Their Efforts","Tolwin is in the hall at Crithost.\
\
You should speak with Tolwin.","Tolwin wishes for your help in his search for his missing mother, Dúneth.\
\
You should complete a number of tasks in Talath Anor, using the whistle to call your friend for help if you become separated.","Complete: The Search for Dúneth Continues","Talk to Tolwin to dismiss him","Complete: The Doorstep of Cair Andros","Complete: Protecting the Woods","Use the whistle to summon your new friend if you become separated","Speak with Tolwin","Tolwin's Journey","You should speak with Tolwin.","Tolwin has asked you to join him on his search for his mother, Dúneth"}},
[13748]={nameES="Bandas de tela de los Saqueadores de Tumbas — Introducción",objectivesES={"Bandas de tela de los Saqueadores de Tumbas — Introducción","Cannuion te habló de la terrible amenaza que los Angmarim y los saqueadores de tumbas representan para los Montaraces de Evendim.","Lleva las bandas de tela de los saqueadores de tumbas a Cannuion en Tinnudir.","Se pueden encontrar saqueadores de tumbas por toda Evendim. Cannuion se encuentra en Tinnudir.\
\
Cannuion te ha pedido que recojas las bandas de lealtad de los saqueadores de tumbas y se las lleves."}},
[13749]={nameES="Tombs of the Old Lords",objectivesES={"This is the tomb of Lóni II","Kyrstig is scouting near Akhaldarâg.","Investigate the sixth dwarf-lord's tomb","This is the tomb of Thekki Stonefist","Akhaldarâg is in the south-west side of the Pit of Stonejaws.\
\
Kyrstig asked you to investigate some of the tombs of dwarf-lords in the name of Longbeard scholarship.","Investigate the second dwarf-lord's tomb","This is the tomb of Althóf the Wise","Anár III rises from his tomb!","Investigate the third dwarf-lord's tomb","Nyráth Toothcrown rises from his tomb!","Investigate the fourth dwarf-lord's tomb","Investigate the fifth dwarf-lord's tomb","Tombs of the Old Lords","Investigate the first dwarf-lord's tomb","Brúni Trollbane rises from his tomb!","Kyrstig has asked you to investigate tombs she believes belong to note-worthy dwarves in Akhaldarâg.","Talk to Kyrstig near Akhaldarâg"}},
[13750]={nameES="Too Close for Comfort",objectivesES={"Glóin can be found in the war-room of Annâk-khurfu.\
\
You have found Glóin in the old keep of Annâk-khurfu. You should speak to Glóin.","The impressive dwarf-ruins of Annâk-khurfu loom overhead, but you see no sign of Glóin","Talk to Glóin at Annâk-khurfu","Find Glóin in the old keep of Annâk-khurfu","Annâk-khurfu can be found to the west of Khadâsh-gâra in Elderslade.\
\
Nagli Want-kin has suggested that you rejoin Durin's army at the dwarf-ruins of Annâk-khurfu. You should travel to Annâk-khurfu.","Too Close for Comfort","As the Want-kin bid you farewell, the conflict in Elderslade grows greater just beyond Annâk-khurfu.","Amidst the bustling war-room, you spy Glóin beside a table in the distance","Annâk-khurfu can be found to the west of Khadâsh-gâra in Elderslade.\
\
You have arrived at Annâk-khurfu and you should now enter the old ruins in search of Glóin.","Ir a Annâk-khurfu"}},
[13751]={nameES="Demasiado cerca de Lórien",objectivesES={"Hadroneth se encuentra en Talan Haldir, a orillas del Nimrodel, al sureste de Nanduhirion.\
\
Has prendido fuego a muchas de las barricadas orcas en Nanduhirion y ahora deberías informar a Hadroneth.","Habla con Hadroneth","Hadroneth está preocupado por los campamentos de orcos que se han establecido en Nanduhirion y quiere que destruyas las barricadas levantadas fuera de ellos.","Encontrarás barricadas al noroeste de Talan Haldir, fuera de los campamentos orcos de Uruk-gashan, Drû-garmadh y Athmadhul, a lo largo del camino que atraviesa Nanduhirion.\
\
Hadroneth te ha pedido que debilites la permanencia de los campamentos orcos en Nanduhirion quemando las barricadas que levantan fuera de ellos.","Demasiado cerca de Lórien"}},
[13752]={nameES="Too Far From Safety",objectivesES={"You do not see anything unusual here...","Ost Lontir can be found in central Belfalas.\
\
Mildir has asked you to search outside for signs of Corsairs approaching Ost Lontir.","The haystack can be found behind Mildir in Ost Lontir in central Belfalas.\
\
You have reported to Mildir, but now have heard a suspicious noise coming from a nearby haystack. You should investigate the haystack.","Talk to Mildir","Search the overlook to the west of Ost Lontir","Too Far From Safety","Behind Mildir, you suddenly hear a haystack sneeze","Examine the haystack","DNT -- will not be seen","Mildir can be found in Ost Lontir in central Belfalas.\
\
You have searched outside Ost Lontir and found little evidence of an impending Corsair attack.","Mildir can be found in Ost Lontir in central Belfalas.\
\
You have found a small child in the haystack, much to Mildir's obvious dismay. You should talk to Mildir.","Aside from a view into the bay, nothing catches your eye...","Suddenly, a small, laughing child leaps out of the haystack and runs away","Search the overlook to the east of Ost Lontir","Mildir laments the grim future that might await the people of Ost Lontir and grows increasingly paranoid that the town will fall in the coming days."}},
[13753]={nameES="Too Far Upriver",objectivesES={"The fishing-nets can be found along the river-banks of northern Thinglad.\
\
You should destroy the fishing-nets without letting the fishermen from Stangard see what you are doing.","Too Far Upriver","Talk to Noriel, who has joined her folk at Haldirith","Noriel has returned to Haldirith and awaits you there.\
\
You should return to Noriel and inform her that you have destroyed the forbidden fishing-nets laid out by the trespassers from Stangard.","Fishermen from Stangard seem to have moved too far upriver to spread their nets. They should be encouraged to return to their own lands, if possible."}},
[13754]={nameES="Too Late",objectivesES={"The Riders Four are in Edoras.\
\
Burnoth asked you aid him and his Riders as they prepare to depart Edoras.","Burnoth is in Edoras.\
\
You should return to Burnoth and give him the supplies he requested.","Complete Shoes for the Horses","Collect meat","Vendajes recogidos","Completed Shoes for the Horses","Too Late","Recolectar vendajes","Collect medicine","The Riders Four, delayed in their journey from Eaworth, arrived at Edoras too late to join Théoden's muster and now prepare to follow behind.","Collected water","Collected vegetables","Bring the supplies you collected to Burnoth","Complete Arrows for Hutha","Burnoth is in Edoras.\
\
You should return to Burnoth and let him know that you have done as he has asked.","Collect vegetables","Completed Armour from the Smith","Talk to Burnoth","Collect water","Collected medicine","Collected meat","Completed Arrows for Hutha","Complete Armour from the Smith","Hutha, Ulf, and Léofdag are in Edoras.\
\
Burnoth asked you to help his Riders complete their preparations as well."}},
[13755]={nameES="Too Many Friends",objectivesES={"Talk to Shêsha","Bring the bug parts to Aphila near the Fisherfold in the Sail-haven","Talk to Yosarin at the Baths of Kadax in the Lower Ward","Bring the foul-smelling unguent to Shêsha in the Lower Ward","The Baths of Kadax are located to the north-east in the Lower Ward of Umbar Baharbêl.","Bring the bag of coins to Aphila in the Fisherfold","Shêsha is to the south-west of the Baths of Kadax, in the Lower Ward.","The bug parts requested by Aphila can be found from arid sand-flies outside Umbar Baharbêl.","Aphila is near the Fisherfold in the Sail-haven.","Shêsha has adopted a new friend, but her new friend also has old friends.","Shêsha is to the south, in the Lower Ward.","Aphila is located near the Fisherfold in the Sail-haven, waiting for you to return with the bug parts you collected.","Too Many Friends"}},
[13756]={nameES="Too Many Legs",objectivesES={"Spiders can be found lurking in the shadows of the Tower of Cirith Ungol.\
\
Lúksu has asked you to slay the small spiders that have snuck into the Tower of Cirith Ungol.","As Lúksu asked, you have defeated many of the small spiders that snuck into the Tower of Cirith Ungol.","Too Many Legs","You have defeated many of the small spiders that made their way into the Tower of Cirith Ungol.","Completado","Annoyed that they've begun to steal Orkish food, Lúksu has asked you to slay small spiders that have snuck into the Tower of Cirith Ungol."}},
[13757]={nameES="Too Many Legs In Lhingroth",objectivesES={}},
[13758]={nameES="¡Demasiadas Tortugas Terribles!",objectivesES={"Regresa con Gwendrian","Las ruinas de Gwâl Cruban están infestadas de tortugas feroces.","Gwendrian te ha pedido que reduzcas el número de tortugas en Gwâl Cruban.\
\
Gwâl Cruban se encuentra en el norte de la Ciénaga de los Cisnes.","Deberías avisarle a Gwendrian que has reducido la cantidad de tortugas aterradoras en Gwâl Cruban.\
\
Gwendrian se encuentra en Echad Terthas."}},
[13759]={nameES="Demasiado festival",objectivesES={"Dedalera Tunelero ha extraviado algunos objetos mientras celebraba el Festival del Lithe.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando finalice el festival actual. </rgb>","Demasiado festival","Una vez encontrados todos sus objetos, regresa con Dedalera Tunelero al Árbol de la Fiesta, en la Comarca.","Dedalera Tunelero te ha dado una lista de los objetos que ha perdido para que recuerdes exactamente cuáles son. Dedalera puede encontrarse cerca del Árbol de la Fiesta, en la Comarca.\
\
Dedalera Tunelero quiere que encuentres los objetos que ha extraviado. Sabe que los dejó en algún lugar de la Comarca, pero no recuerda dónde.","Devuelve los cinco objetos a Dedalera Tunelero"}},
[13760]={nameES="Un Tuk y una torre",objectivesES={"Un Tuk y una torre","Paladin Tuk, el Thain, se encuentra en los Grandes Smials de Alforzaburgo.\
\
Esilia Tuk te envió a su casa para hablar con su primo, Gerebert. Gerebert te contó una historia fantástica sobre una terrible torre en tierras lejanas, donde vio a un extraño hombre con túnica llamado Zarquino. Te pidió que contaras su historia al Thain.","Esilia Tuk te dijo que Gerebert finalmente llegó a su casa y contó una historia fantástica sobre su viaje a bordo del carro de Longo."}},
[13761]={nameES="Tools for the Mine",objectivesES={}},
[13762]={nameES="Herramientas del pasado",objectivesES={"Herramientas del pasado","Las forjas de Khazad-dûm fueron en su día el corazón herrero en Moria. Allí, los inigualables herreros enanos trabajaban el mithril y forjaban sus mayores maravillas. Desde su caída, las forjas de Khazad-dûm se han visto inundadas por enormes aludes de lava y pobladas por los orcos de Moria y sus trols y trasgos. Allí, el ejército orco trabaja sin cesar, construyendo armas y máquinas de asedio en preparación para la guerra contra Lothlórien.","Las forjas de Khazad-dûm se encuentran al suroeste de Anazârmekhem.\
\
Sigir está indignado de que se utilicen herramientas enanas para forjar las armas de guerra de los orcos. Te encomendó la misión de rescatar dichas herramientas de su ignominioso destino dentro de las forjas de Khazad-dûm.","Habla con Sigir en Anazârmekhem"}},
[13763]={nameES="Tools of Destruction",objectivesES={}},
[13764]={nameES="Herramientas de los Orcos",objectivesES={"Herramientas de los Orcos","El campamento orco de Ongbishúk se encuentra al noreste de Gabilshathûr.\
\
Avar te pidió que tomes las herramientas de los Orcos para ayudar a frenar sus esfuerzos por construir armas de asedio.","Avar, el líder del puesto enano en Gabilshathûr, te habló de su situación desesperada. Los Orcos han descubierto su refugio oculto y están talando árboles al norte. Avar teme que estén usando la madera para construir armas de asedio, con las que podrían atacar y destruir el puesto.","Lleva las herramientas de los Orcos a Avar."}},
[13765]={nameES="Herramientas del oficio",objectivesES={}},
[13766]={nameES="Diente y escama",objectivesES={"A Mundarico Hojarena le preocupan las salamandras que se arrastran entre las dunas de Barandalf.","Mundarico Hojarena está en Dwaling.\
\
Has recogido los dientes que te pidió Mundarico Hojarena y has mermado la población de las salamandras letales que hacen peligrosas las arenas de Barandalf. Ahora deberías volver a él para que pueda estudiar los dientes.","Llévale los dientes a Mundarico Hojarena","Las salamandras se deslizan entre las dunas y arenas de Barandalf, al norte y al este de Dwaling.\
\
Mundarico Hojarena quiere que derrotes a las salamandras en Barandalf y le lleves sus dientes incrustados de arena.","Diente y escama"}},
[13767]={nameES="Top Dog",objectivesES={"The pack-leader of the Isen Wargs, a beast named Mangle-maw leads den-mates when they raid in the night. His death would trigger a battle for dominance among the pack that could cause many more casualties before a new leader arises.","You have defeated Mangle-maw","You must remain within the Circle of Fangs","Top Dog","Ondor is encamped near the caves of western Nan Curunír.\
\
You should tell Ondor of Mangle-maw's defeat in the Circle of Fangs.","The Circle of Fangs lies outside the caves in western Nan Curunír.\
\
Ondor has asked you to defeat the Warg pack-leader, Mangle-maw. Defeating a number of lieutenants in the Circle of Fangs may draw him forth.","Defeat Mangle-maw within the Circle of Fangs","Talk to Ondor in Nan Curunír"}},
[13768]={nameES="Top of the Chain",objectivesES={"The Boar-tribe leader is at their camp.\
\
You should defeat the Boar-tribe Orc-leader and send the Orcs into disarray.","The Boar-tribe Orc-leader has been defeated, creating confusion amongst the rest of the tribe.","Defeated the Boar-tribe Orc-leader","The Boar-tribe Orc-leader's defeat would certainly send the rest of the tribe into disarray.","Completado","Defeat the Boar-tribe Orc-leader","Top of the Chain"}},
[13769]={nameES="Atormentadores de Valle",objectivesES={"Lârz derrotado","Derrota a Graz","Atormentadores de Valle","Derrota a Lârz","Derrota a los atormentadores de Valle.","Graz derrotado","Los siervos del Señor Oscuro intentan capturar o matar a todos los habitantes de Valle."}},
[13770]={nameES="El deber de Torogethir",objectivesES={"El deber de Torogethir","Torogethir vigila el paso desde las Quebradas del Norte hacia Evendim y custodia las fortalezas de Fornost y Ost Heryn.","Habla con Torogethir en Parth Aduial","El campamento de Torogethir se encuentra junto al camino que lleva a las Quebradas del Norte, al este de Tinnudir y al norte de Ost Heryn.\
\
Orchalwë te pidió que encontraras a Torogethir y le ayudaras en sus esfuerzos por resolver los problemas a los que se enfrenta Ost Heryn."}},
[13771]={nameES="Torsbury Defeated",objectivesES={"Talk to Sidnoth","Bring the evidence to Torferth at Tordag's camp","The belongings of the Toringas and their allies can be found throughout Tordag's camp, north of the road between Torsbury and Stoke.\
\
Thane Torferth asked you to search the belongings of the Toringas and their allies for evidence of another traitor.","The captains of the Toringas and their allies may be found at Tordag's camp, north of the road between Torsbury and Stoke.\
\
Torferth has asked you to confront the captains of the Toringas and their allies and obtain their permission to search their belongings for evidence of treason.","Talk to Tidric","Talk to Dudsig","Talk to Wilsig","Thane Torferth is in Tordag's camp, north of the road between Torsbury and Stoke.\
\
You should bring the evidence you found to Torferth for his review.","With the defeat at Torsbury and the death of Thane Tordag, Torferth and his people regroup at Tordag's camp.","DNT -- Will not be seen","Torsbury Defeated"}},
[13772]={nameES="Torsbury Delayed",objectivesES={"The people of Torsbury are shattered by the loss of their Thane, and Torferth is consumed with discovering the mastermind of his father's murder.","Talk to Reeve Fríthild in the Mead Hall of Stoke","Reeve Fríthild is in the Mead Hall of Stoke, south-east of Tordag's camp.\
\
Torferth instructed you to return to Reeve Fríthild and let her know that the Torsbury garrison will be late coming.","Torsbury Delayed"}},
[13773]={nameES="Torso de Helgi Cazatrasgos",objectivesES={"Torso de Helgi Cazatrasgos","Se trata de un fragmento del torso de la estatua de Helgi Cazatrasgos que una vez se erigió frente a la Cámara de la Encrucijada.\
\
Los trasgos del Camino de Durin destruyeron la estatua, y sus partes se pueden encontrar dispersas por toda Moria. Un enano llamado Uxi se esfuerza por reensamblar esta estatua.","Has descubierto el torso de la estatua de Helgi Cazatrasgos.","Habla con Águti en la Bodega Putrefacta","Águti se encuentra en la Bodega Putrefacta, al norte.\
\
Águti querrá saber si encontraste un fragmento de la estatua destrozada."}},
[13774]={nameES="Toss a Coin",objectivesES={"Toss a coin to the journeyman lutist","Toss a coin to the bodhran minstrel","The famous flower peddler Ulthir is regretting the festivities of the night before.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This quest will be removed from your quest log when the current festival ends.</rgb>","Talk to Ulthir","Toss a coin to the journeywoman lutist","Noisy minstrels wander about the Splintered Shield, keeping Ulthir awake.\
\
You should toss a coin to noisy minstrels in the Splintered Shield in Minas Tirith.","Ulthir is trying to sleep it off in the bedchambers of the Splintered Shield.\
\
You should inform Ulthir that you've made the minstrels move on.","Toss a Coin","Toss a coin at the adept harper","Toss a coin to the journeyman harper","Toss a coin to the adept flutist"}},
[13775]={nameES="Totems and Banners",objectivesES={"Captain Garmund can be found at the western watch-tower, just west of Cliving.\
\
Garmund awaits the results of your attempt to destroy the Orc symbols marking the precious farmlands beyond Cliving.","Orc-totems and banners can be found around the farmsteads south of Cliving and west of the road.\
\
Captain Garmund has asked you to destroy many of the banners and totems the Orcs have placed across their sacked territory.","Captain Garmund is distressed by the presence of the many Orc-banners and totems being strewn across the once-peaceful farmlands outside of Cliving.","Talk to Captain Garmund outside of Cliving","Totems and Banners"}},
[13776]={nameES="Toque de corrupción",objectivesES={"Gandelin está de vuelta en Lin Giliath.\
\
Gandelin te pidió que mataras al profanador Ongbûrz y regresaras con las bolsas de veneno Ongbûrz.","Toque de corrupción","Lleva las bolsas de veneno Ongbûrz a Gandelin","Los orcos Ongbûrz se encuentran en las ruinas de Merenost, en el sur de Lin Giliath.\
\
Gandelin te pidió que mataras al profanador Ongbûrz y regresaras con las bolsas de veneno Ongbûrz.","Los orcos de Merenos, en Meluinen, usan veneno de araña para bañar sus espadas y flechas"}},
[13777]={nameES="Hacia los Eglain",objectivesES={"Frideric el Anciano se encuentra en Ost Guruth, al noreste de Refr Mercurio.\
\
Refr Mercurio está preocupado por la colaboración entre los orcos y los Duramano, y cree que se debe informar al líder de los Eglain sobre esta situación.","Los Duramano y los orcos están colaborando. Esta noticia no es bienvenida por Refr Mercurio, un enano que vive entre los Eglain de Ost Guruth.","Habla con Frideric el Anciano en Ost Guruth","Hacia los Eglain"}},
[13778]={nameES="Tower An Inferno",objectivesES={"Burned the Watch-tower Súth-torr","Picked up the torch","Tower An Inferno","Use a torch to burn the Watch-tower Súth-torr","The Easterlings have built a massive encampment on the bank of the Anduin river. This camp is growing at an alarming rate as more enemies flow down the river from the ford.","Return to Guthferth at North-torr","The fallen Rohirrim watch-tower is in the north-east corner of their large encampment of Jóshkhin Orda to the north of North-torr.\
\
You should search for a torch near the watch-tower and burn it to drive out the evil that dwells there.","Sergeant Guthferth is rallying the defences of North-torr just north of Floodwend, attempting to hold back the flood of Easterlings threatening to drown the Wold in chaos.\
\
You should speak with Sergeant Guthferth.","The note reads:\
\
'We have captured the tower Suth-torr from the horse-riding weaklings, and the dark one resides there now. The camp has been built, and it is from here that the attack upon Rohan shall be launched.\
\
'Complete production of the siege-weapons as soon as possible. Do not be late with them. They are instrumental in the siege.'"}},
