[13799]={nameES="Gigantescos campeones",objectivesES={"Golhador está en el campamento del Risco Alto, en la parte central de las Montañas Nubladas.\
\
Golhador estará encantado de saber que has derrotado a los poderosos campeones responsables de domar a los feroces mamuts.","La Aguja del Gigante se encuentra en el corazón de la zona de las Montañas Nubladas conocida como los Salones de los Gigantes, al sureste de la fortaleza enana de Gabilazan.\
\
Madfurr está al este de la Aguja del Gigante, en una grieta de la roca. Sukdyr está al noreste de la Aguja del Gigante, entre los senderos rocosos. Kulgurz está en las laderas altas sobre la Aguja del Gigante.\
\
El Elfo Golhador te ha indicado dónde se encuentran los poderosos campeones gigantes responsables de domar a los feroces mamuts.","Golhador ha identificado a los gigantes que tienen dominio sobre los mamuts de las Montañas Nubladas y te ha pedido que pongas fin a esta peligrosa alianza.","Gigantescos campeones"}},
[13800]={nameES="Towering Overseers",objectivesES={}},
[13801]={nameES="Towers of the Teeth: A Brush with Darkness",objectivesES={"While exploring The Towers of the Teeth, you notice some treasures from the lands of Rhûn.\
\
You take it upon yourself to collect samples of these Black Númenórean treasures for the Host of the West.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Warning: This quest requires The Towers of the Teeth: Guardian of the Depths to be underway. If that quest has been completed or failed, you will be unable to exit and re-enter this instance in order to complete this quest.</rgb>","Collect Black Númenórean artifacts","Collect Black Númenórean artifacts within The Towers of the Teeth.","You should collect Black Númenórean artifacts and bring them to Candúr.","Towers of the Teeth: A Brush with Darkness","Bring the Black Númenórean artifacts to Candúr"}},
[13802]={nameES="Towers of the Teeth: A Brush with Death",objectivesES={"Bring the gifts of Rhûn to Thurindol","Collect gifts of Rhûn","Towers of the Teeth: A Brush with Death","Collect gifts of Rhûn within The Towers of the Teeth.","While exploring The Towers of the Teeth, you notice some treasures from the lands of Rhûn.\
\
You take it upon yourself to collect samples of these gifts of Rhûn treasures for the Host of the West.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Warning: This quest requires Towers of the Teeth: Guardian of the Depths to be underway. If that quest has been completed or failed, you will be unable to exit and re-enter this instance in order to complete this quest.</rgb>>","You should collect gifts of Rhûn and bring them to Thurindol.","While exploring The Towers of the Teeth, you notice some treasures from the lands of Rhûn.\
\
You take it upon yourself to collect these gifts of Rhûn for the Host of the West.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Warning: This quest requires Towers of the Teeth: Guardian of the Depths to be underway. If that quest has been completed or failed, you will be unable to exit and re-enter this instance in order to complete this quest.</rgb>"}},
[13803]={nameES="Towers of the Teeth: Depths of Shadow",objectivesES={"You should return to Thurindol and inform him of your deeds within The Towers of the Teeth.","Defeat Uruk-hai within The Towers of the Teeth.","Talk to Thurindol","Defeat Uruk-hai in The Towers of the Teeth","To weaken the resolve of the invaders within The Towers of the Teeth, you take it upon yourself to thin their numbers.","Towers of the Teeth: Depths of Shadow","Those who dwell in The Towers of the Teeth are numerous. Driving off even a fraction of their number will better position the Host of the West to travel safely through The Wastes.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Warning: This quest requires Towers of the Teeth: Guardian of the Depths to be underway. If that quest has been completed or failed, you will be unable to exit and re-enter this instance in order to complete this quest.</rgb>"}},
[13804]={nameES="Towers of the Teeth: Foundation of Shadow",objectivesES={"Those who dwell in The Towers of the Teeth are numerous. Driving off even a fraction of their number will better position the Host of the West to travel safety through The Wastes.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Warning: This quest requires Towers of the Teeth: Guardian of the Teeth to be underway. If that quest has been completed or failed, you will be unable to exit and re-enter this instance in order to complete this quest.</rgb>","Defeat Black Númenóreans in The Towers of the Teeth","You should return to Candúr and inform him of your deeds within The Towers of the Teeth.","Talk to Candúr","Defeat Black Númenóreans within The Towers of the Teeth.","To weaken the resolve of the invaders within The Towers of the Teeth, you take it upon yourself to thin their numbers.","Those who dwell in The Towers of the Teeth are numerous. Driving off even a fraction of their number will better position the Host of the West to travel safely through The Wastes.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Warning: This quest requires Towers of the Teeth: Guardian of the Teeth to be underway. If that quest has been completed or failed, you will be unable to exit and re-enter this instance in order to complete this quest.</rgb>","Towers of the Teeth: Foundation of Shadow"}},
[13805]={nameES="Towers of the Teeth: Guardian of the Depths",objectivesES={"Thurindol has asked you investigate the The Towers of the Teeth and find a way to discourage the invaders from remaining there.","You ran out of time...","Defeated Kúrgrush","You should return to Thurindol and apprise him of your efforts.","Towers of the Teeth: Guardian of the Depths","Talk to Thurindol","Uruk-hai, dwelling beneath the Towers of the Teeth, could prove a mighty foe if left unchecked.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Warning: This quest has a one hour time-limit. The timer will begin upon accepting the quest.</rgb>","Defeat Kúrgrush"}},
[13806]={nameES="Towers of the Teeth: Guardian of the Teeth",objectivesES={"You ran out of time...","Towers of the Teeth: Guardian of the Teeth","Talk to Candúr","Defeat Gúrthrokh","You should return to Candúr and apprise him of your efforts.","Defeated Gúrthrokh","Candúr has asked you investigate The Towers of the Teeth and find a way to discourage the invaders from remaining there.","Uruk-hai, dwelling beneath the Towers of the Teeth, could prove a mighty foe if left unchecked.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Warning: This quest has a one hour time-limit. The timer will begin upon accepting the quest.</rgb>"}},
