[13812]={nameES="Townsfolk VI",objectivesES={}},
[13813]={nameES="Traces of Poison",objectivesES={"Return to Vaskorn","Search for clues along the edge of the lake in Thornholt","You begin to tell Vaskorn all you have seen, when he interrupts.\
\
'More poisoned creatures? Poison weapons? Spider-folk? Slow down, you're talking too fast for this Beorning. There is no doubt, you had an eventful expedition!'","You should carry on Vaskorn's search, continuing on to the outskirts of Thornholt, heading north towards the Steel Keep.","Search for the wielders of the poison weapons","Search for clues in Óinsbridge","Traces of Poison","The Beorning Vaskorn has scouted much of Thornholt searching for clues to the mysterious poisoning.","Vaskorn can be found in the Beorning dwellings of Skoghús, in Thornholt.\
\
You should hurry back to Vaskorn and alert him to your findings.","You should carry on Vaskorn's search, continuing on to the edge of the lake in Thornholt.","It appears these creatures were defeated with a deadly poison","Vaskorn has asked you to continue his search, beginning at Óinsbridge.","You should defeat the attackers at Kêr Bréin, on the north-western outskirts of Thornholt.","Even without the shade of trees, the darkness feels more oppressive here","These weapons appear to have a poisonous substance on them"}},
[13814]={nameES="Traces of the Enemy",objectivesES={"Traces of the Enemy","Scouted Tollobel","Scout the Eave-mere","Scout Tollobel","Handarod is concerned for the safety of the Wardens of Annúminas, who struggle to secure the ruined home of their forebears.","The Eave-mere lies in Evendim, far to the west of the North Downs, on the western side of Lake Evendim.\
\
Handarod has asked you to scout the Eave-mere, a small lake that feeds down into the much larger Lake Evendim.","The Even-rills lie in Evendim, far to the west of the North Downs, on the northern end of Lake Evendim.\
\
Handarod has asked you to scout the area around the Even-rills, one of the two major sources of water coming into Lake Evendim from the north.","Scouted the Eave-mere","Talk to Handarod","Scouted the Even-rills","Scout the Even-rills","Tollobel lies in Evendim, far to the west of the North Downs, in the south-west reaches of Lake Evendim.\
\
Handarod has asked you to scout the island of Tollobel. It could make an ideal location for the Angmarim to strike from should their hold on the city of Annúminas be weakened.","Handarod is at Esteldín in the North Downs, far to the east of Evendim.\
\
You should report to Handarod and tell him what you have found along the shores of Lake Evendim."}},
[13815]={nameES="Siguiendo a Luilloth",objectivesES={"Encuentra a la mujer misteriosa","Baya de Oro te ha pedido que coloques las flores de polvo en el agua, a la orilla del río.\
\
El río se encuentra en el Bosque Viejo.","Deberías hablar con Baya de Oro.\
\
Baya de Oro está junto al río, en el Bosque Viejo.","Henbran te ha sugerido que busques a una mujer misteriosa a orillas del río.\
\
La orilla del río se encuentra en el Bosque Viejo.","Siguiendo a Luilloth","Con el descubrimiento del grimorio se ha revelado más sobre los últimos días de Luilloth.","Lleva las flores a Baya de Oro","Coloca las flores en el agua","Baya de Oro te dijo que las flores de polvo prefieren crecer cerca de ruinas antiguas y en las partes elevadas del Bosque Viejo.","Habla con Baya de Oro","Vuelve con Rhiangar","Deberías llevarle las flores de polvo a Baya de Oro.\
\
Baya de Oro está junto al río, en el Bosque Viejo.","Debes decirle a Rhiangar que el grimorio de la familia de Henbran y Baya de Oro rastrearon la persecución de Luilloth al Miedo Gris hasta Sarch Vorn.\
\
Rhiangar se encuentra en el campamento de caravanas, al sur de Andrath."}},
[13816]={nameES="Tracking Some Hobbits",objectivesES={"The hobbits walked south-west, towards where they believed the Entwash to be.\
\
You should try to find the Entwash and search for signs of the two lost halflings.","Find a sign of Merry and Pippin's passage","Follow the path through the forest to search for signs of Merry and Pippin","You have come to the banks of the Entwash","This tree-ish Ent has decided that he is curious about the creatures he saw -- hobbits whom you know to be Meriadoc Brandybuck and Peregrin Took of the Shire. Ashlimb's inquisitive gaze speaks plainly: he wishes to know whither these hobbits have gone, and what fate they have met. Are they safe?\
\
You find yourself wondering the same thing.","Signs of the hobbits' passage may be found along the Entwash heading north-west, deeper into the forest.\
\
You should search for signs of the two lost halflings.","Climb the hill to try to see if you can spot the hobbits from above","Tracking Some Hobbits","Ashlimb has spotted two young hobbits whom you know to be Merry and Pippin of the Shire, friends you have met on your travels.","Find the Entwash and search for signs of the hobbits' passage","Found a hobbit-footprint in the mud","The hobbits veered north-east on the path running alongside the Entwash.\
\
You should search for signs of the two lost halflings.","This footprint points away from the river now, following a low path through the wood","The hobbits walked north along the Entwash.\
\
You should search for signs of the two lost halflings.","You have followed the hobbits to a strange hill in Fangorn that promises an overlook above the treetops.","It looks like a pair of hobbits may have paused here to wash their cares away in the clear water","You find some crumbs. Only a hobbit could stop for a nibble upon the discovery of such a strange hill. Surely they climbed this...."}},
[13817]={nameES="Rastreo de tesoros",objectivesES={"Celofa te ha enviado a las Profundidades Occidentales en busca de antiguos acertijos de estilo enano. Al parecer, pueden encontrarse pistas en las estanterías de allí, pero Celofa advierte que hacer demasiado ruido podría atraer a los orcos cercanos.","Esta estantería no contiene el pergamino que buscas.","Encuentra un pergamino de acertijos","Celofa se encuentra en las Fundaciones de Piedra, al sureste de las Profundidades Occidentales y de las Vetas del Cuerno Rojo.\
\
Deberías regresar junto a Celofa con el pergamino que encontraste.","Rastreo de tesoros","Pergamino de acertijos encontrado","Regresa junto a Celofa con el pergamino","Las Profundidades Occidentales se encuentran al noroeste de las Vetas del Cuerno Rojo. Celofa te sugirió que comiences tu búsqueda entre Gabil-mamach y el Salón del Agua que Fluye.\
\
Celofa te ha pedido que revises cualquier montón de pergaminos que encuentres en las Profundidades Occidentales, entre Gabil-mamach y el Salón del Agua que Fluye, pero te advirtió que tu búsqueda podría alertar a los orcos de la zona si no tienes cuidado."}},
[13818]={nameES="Tracking Trouble",objectivesES={}},
[13819]={nameES="Tracking the Enemy",objectivesES={"You pull a damp missive off Glupronk...","You are carrying a missive from Cirith Ungol. You should read it.","Find and confront Glupronk in Kála-murg","Tracking the Enemy","Deliver the missive to Legolas in Rath Cail","A gruesome figure shambles out of the shadows...","Desperate to capture an elusive Elf-warrior, the Orc-trackers of Kála-murg now keep a close watch on Rath Cail.","Read Glupronk's missive from Cirith Ungol","The missive warns of an Elf-warrior that slew the garrison of Cirith Ungol and stuck \\qShelob\\q!","Glupronk can likely be found deep within the Orc-hold of Kála-murg.\
\
The Orc, Glupronk, is in command of Kála-murg and seeks the Elf-warrior. Legolas hopes to learn more of the Orcs of Lhingris and of the hidden cavern where Shelob makes her home.","Legolas can be found in Rath Cail.\
\
You have read a troubling missive from the Captain of Cirith Ungol. You should deliver it to Legolas and see what he makes of it."}},
[13820]={nameES="Tracking the Invaders",objectivesES={}},
[13821]={nameES="Tracking the Lost",objectivesES={}},
[13822]={nameES="Rastreando al intruso",objectivesES={"Talk to Doron","Rastreando al intruso","Doron wishes for you to search for the Easterling's belongings while travelling through Ost Celebrant. He has described them as having a different look than any of the relics of Gondor that still lay in the ruins.","Doron has noticed strange relics and supplies strewn about the ruins of Ost Celebrant. He believes these to be the belongings of the Easterling that has taken control of the fortress."}},
[13823]={nameES="Tracking the Unknown",objectivesES={"Search for the invader's boot-prints near the river Blackroot","Suspicious and worried in the wake of Sardol's supplies being ferried down-river, Gordir hopes to uncover who has infiltrated Blackroot Vale.","Tracking the Unknown","You seem to have lost the trail, but suddenly, the river-water churns and bubbles","Search for more boot-prints across the river Blackroot","You find a single boot-print leading across the river to where maddened bears now dwell","DNT -- will not be seen","Gordir can be found on the dock on the river Blackroot to the west of Sardol.\
\
You have lost the trail of the invader, but were confronted by a foul spirit that rose out of the Blackroot.","More evidence of the invader can be found along the western bank of the river Blackroot.\
\
You have uncovered a single boot-print on the eastern bank of the Blackroot, and it appears to lead into the water.","Some evidence of the invader can likely be found along the eastern bank of the river Blackroot, to the south of Sardol.\
\
Gordir hopes to uncover the identity of the person who has been ferrying resources out of Blackroot Vale.","Talk to Gordir"}},
[13824]={nameES="Trading Fates",objectivesES={}},
[13825]={nameES="Camino sangriento",objectivesES={"El Clan del Cielo Rojo de Bhol Rûdh no tiene ninguna posibilidad contra las tropas de Seregost.","Completa Bhol Rûdh: Camino sangriento","Candúr se encuentra en Udûn.\
\\Deberías hablar con Candúr.","Has completado Bhol Rûdh: Camino sangriento","Completado","Camino sangriento","Has logrado salvar al Clan del Cielo Rojo y has derrotado a muchos orcos infectados en Agarnaith.","Hay una nota colgada en el tablón. Parece una emergencia:\
\
'¡El Clan del Cielo Rojo de Bhol Rûdh está siendo asediado por orcos infectados! Se busca aventurero valiente para vencer a nuestros enemigos en Agarnaith. Para más información, habla con Candúr, en Udûn'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Atención: esta misión requiere que «Bhol Rûdh: Asedio de la Corrupción» esté en curso. Si dicha misión se ha completado o ha fallado, te será imposible salir y volver a entrar en esta instancia para completar esta misión.</rgb>."}},
[13826]={nameES="Trail of the Worm",objectivesES={"The old cairn can be found in Elderslade.\
\
You should examine the cairn.","You hope that continuing north along the river is the correct route","Trail of the Worm","Talk to Fróthi","The next mark on the map indicates a location somewhere in Elderslade.\
\
You should travel north along the river to search for the next location on the map.","Search for the final location on the map","This seems to be where the map ends","Whoever built this cairn did not want it to be found without this map","You are assured that you are still heading in the correct direction","This cairn is as well hidden as the last that you found","Talk to Léothred","A cairn lies hidden in the rocks","There does not seem to be any sign of a cairn here","The next mark on the map lies somewhere in Elderslade.\
\
You should travel north along the river to search for the next location on the map.","The carved map has led Léothred and Fróthi to an unexplored region of Elderslade.","Léothred can be found following Fram's map in Elderslade.\
\
You should talk to Léothred.","Search for the next location on the map","Examine the old cairn","You almost did not see the cairn hidden along the path","The final mark on the map indicates a location somewhere in Elderslade.\
\
You should travel north along the river to search for the next location on the map.","Fróthi can be found following Fram's map in Elderslade.\
\
You should talk to Fróthi."}},
[13827]={nameES="Trained with Cruelty",objectivesES={"Some parts of Edsig's Farm seem to have been converted by the Orcs to help them breed Wargs and train future Warg-riders. Defeating the Orcs responsible for training and breeding the Wargs would help slow the enemy recruitment of new riders to their ranks.","The Warg-trainers have been defeated, but more Orcs will come to take their place. Edsig's Farm was not reclaimed from the enemy, but its usefulness to the White Hand has been reduced, for now.","Edsig's Farm appears to have been captured by the White Hand Warg-riders that are ravaging the Fallows' less populated areas.","The Warg-trainers have been defeated, but more Orcs are likely to eventually take their place. Edsig's Farm may still be in the hands of the enemy, however your efforts have reduced the usefulness of their outpost.","Edsig's Farm appears to have been captured by the White Hand Warg-riders that are ravaging the Fallows' less populated areas.\
\
Some parts of the farm further from the road seem to have been converted for breeding and training of new Wargs for future Warg-riders.","Trained with Cruelty","Edsig's Farm was recently abandoned and the Orcs have taken the opportunity to use the farm as an outpost. They now use it as a base of operation for their Warg-rider raids on the outlying farms.","Completado","Defeat White Hand Warg-trainers (0/6)"}},
[13828]={nameES="Entrenando para el viaje",objectivesES={"Lleva las manzanas a Bingo, en el exterior de su agujero hobbit en Cavada Grande","El Tío Gamyi vive en el número 3 de Bolsón de Tirada, a la mitad de camino de la Colina en Hobbiton, al noreste del agujero hobbit de Bingo.\
\
Bingo te ha pedido que consultes al Tío Gamyi para saber si aprendió algo sobre ir de aventuras de Bilbo Bolsón.","Entrenando para el viaje","Esmeralda Madriguerales te observa con recelo","Habla con Bingo en el exterior de su agujero hobbit en Cavada Grande","El Tío Gamyi está esperando que regreses de Manzanal con las manzanas para Bingo.","Bingo está emocionado por comenzar su viaje, pero sabe que necesitará entrenar para la aventura antes de partir.","Habla con Bingo en la torre de Cepeda, al sur del pueblo de Cepeda","Habla con Bingo en la posada de la Perca Dorada, en el pueblo de Cepeda","La posada del Pájaro y el Bebé está al suroeste del agujero hobbit de Bingo, en Michel Delving.\
\
Bingo no soporta las manzanas, y te ha pedido que las lleves a la posada del Pájaro y el Bebé y las dejes cerca del mostrador que hay dentro. Alguien se las comerá.","Esmeralda Madriguerales ha llamado tu atención en el interior de la posada del Pájaro y el Bebé. Le gustaría hablar contigo sobre algo.","Habla con Esmeralda Madriguerales en la posada del Pájaro y el Bebé","Bingo ha intentado subir a la torre de Cepeda, pero se ha rendido. Te ha dicho que se encontrará contigo en la posada de la Perca Dorada, en el pueblo de Cepeda, para continuar con su entrentamiento.","El huerto de Manzanal está subiendo la colina, al noroeste de Bolsón de Tirada.\
\
El Tío Gamyi te ha recomendado que recojas algunas manzanas caídas en el huerto de Manzanal, que serán un buen comienzo para que Bingo se aprovisione para su viaje.","El Tío te da una buena cesta en la que llevar las manzanas","Bingo está fuera de su agujero hobbit en Cavada Grande, justo al norte del Agujero Municipal.\
\
Has conseguido una buena selección de manzanas para Bingo provenientes de Manzanal en Hobbiton.","Bingo te ha pedido que te reúnas con él en la torre de Cepeda, al sur del pueblo de Cepeda. Planea subir a la torre para conseguir la destreza física que necesitará para su viaje.","Deja las manzanas junto al mostrador del interior de la posada del Pájaro y el Bebé","Vuelve con el Tío Gamyi en Bolsón de Tirada","Bingo está en su casa, al noreste de la posada del Pájaro y el Bebé.\
\
Has dejado la cest ade manzanas en la posada del Pájaro y el Bebé, pero en el proceso Esmeralda Mariguerales consiguió descubrir que Bingo está planeando un viaje.","Habla con el Tío Gamyi en Bolsón de Tirada, en Hobbiton"}},
[13829]={nameES="Training the Forces",objectivesES={"Spar with Ambassion","Spar with Faratúr","Spar with Hallatan","Estenan can be found in Díngarth.\
\
You should spar with Estenan.","Spar with Estenan","Tulcandur can be found in Díngarth.\
\
You should spar with Tulcandur.","Spar with Ostondil","Hildvar can be found in Díngarth.\
\
You should talk to Hildvar.","Armacar can be found in Díngarth.\
\
You should spar with Armacar.","Spar with Armacar","Hildvar, daughter of Huneric Hundred-slayer, has been tasked with training the soldiers before the Storm of Wrath strikes.","Celuher can be found in Díngarth.\
\
You should spar with Celuher.","Hallatan can be found in Díngarth.\
\
You should spar with Hallatan.","Ostondil can be found in Díngarth.\
\
You should spar with Ostondil.","Spar with Tulcandur","Training the Forces","Spar with Celuher","Talk to Hildvar","Ambassion can be found in Díngarth.\
\
You should spar with Ambassion.","Faratúr can be found in Díngarth.\
\
You should spar with Faratúr."}},
[13830]={nameES="Entrenamiento: La Carga del Capitán",objectivesES={"Habla con el entrenador de capitanes en la Atalaya de Edhelion\
\
Ahora que has usado exitosamente tu Golpe Devastador, deberías regresar con tu entrenador y contarle tu éxito.","Habla con el entrenador de capitanes en la Atalaya de Edhelion","Usa tu <rgb=#00ff00>Grito de Batalla</rgb> en el Muñeco de Entrenamiento, y luego golpéalo con tu habilidad <rgb=#00ff00>Golpe Devastador</rgb>","Has usado exitosamente Golpe Devastador","Entrenamiento: La Carga del Capitán","Usa <rgb=#00ff00>Golpe Devastador</rgb> en el Muñeco de Entrenamiento cercano.\
\
PISTA:\
\
Los Capitanes dependen de su <rgb=#00ff00>Grito de Batalla</rgb> para ponerse en un <rgb=#ffff00>Estado de Preparación para la Batalla</rgb>. Mientras estén en este estado, los Capitanes pueden usar habilidades especiales como <rgb=#00ff00>Golpe Devastador</rgb>, un ataque muy efectivo que inflige gran daño. Ataca al <rgb=#ff0000>Muñeco de Entrenamiento</rgb> con tu <rgb=#00FF00>Grito de Batalla</rgb> para entrar en <rgb=#ffff00>Estado de Preparación para la Batalla</rgb> y luego golpea al muñeco con tu <rgb=#00ff00>Golpe Devastador</rgb>."}},
[13831]={nameES="Entrenamiento: El Barrido de Escudo de un Guardián",objectivesES={"Habla con el Entrenador de Guardianes en el Puesto de Vigilancia de Edhelion","Has golpeado al Muñeco de Entrenamiento con 'Barrido de Escudo'","El Entrenador de Guardianes está en el Puesto de Vigilancia de Edhelion.\
\
Ahora que has usado con éxito tu habilidad recién aprendida, deberías regresar con tu entrenadora y contarle tu éxito.","Usa tu habilidad <rgb=#00ff00>Barrido de Escudo</rgb> en el muñeco de entrenamiento cercano.\
\
PISTA:\
\
Los Guardianes dependen de las <rgb=#ffff00>Habilidades Reactivas para infligir daño y generar <rgb=#ff0000>Amenaza</rgb> contra sus enemigos. <rgb=#00ff00>Barrido de Escudo</rgb> requiere que el Guardián <rgb=#ffff00>Bloquee</rgb> un ataque enemigo entrante antes de poder usar la habilidad. Dirígete a los <rgb=#ff0000>Muñecos de Entrenamiento</rgb> al norte del entrenador y ataca hasta que bloquees con éxito uno de sus ataques. Si tienes problemas para bloquear, intenta usar <rgb=#00ff00>Resguardo del guardián</rgb> para aumentar tus probabilidades de bloquear ataques enemigos. Una vez que hayas bloqueado un ataque, podrás usar tu habilidad <rgb=#00ff00>Barrido de Escudo</rgb>. Golpea al <rgb=#ff0000>Muñeco de Entrenamiento</rgb> con <rgb=#00ff00>Barrido de Escudo.</rgb>","Golpea al Muñeco de Entrenamiento con 'Barrido de Escudo'","Entrenamiento: El Barrido de Escudo de un Guardián"}},
[13832]={nameES="Entrenamiento: El Disparo perforante del Cazador",objectivesES={"Entrenamiento: El Disparo perforante del Cazador","Golpea el muñeco de entrenamiento con Disparo perforante","Habla con el entrenador de cazadores en Archet","Has golpeado el muñeco de entrenamiento con Disparo perforante","El entrenador de cazadores está en Archet, cerca de la puerta sur.\
\
Ahora que has usado tu habilidad con éxito, deberías regresar con tu entrenador y contarle tu éxito.","Usa <rgb=#00ff00>Disparo perforante en el muñeco de entrenamiento cercano.\
\
PISTA:\
\
Los Cazadores necesitan <rgb=#ffff00>Concentración</rgb> para usar algunos de sus disparos especiales, y <rgb=#00ff00>Disparo perforante</rgb> es una de esas habilidades. Usa tu habilidad <rgb=#00ff00>Disparo Rápido</rgb> hasta que tengas <rgb=#ffff00>3 puntos de Concentración</rgb>, y luego usa <rgb=#00ff00>Disparo perforante</rgb>."}},
[13833]={nameES="Entrenamiento: El Disparo perforante del Cazador",objectivesES={"Usa Disparo perforante contra el muñeco de entrenamiento","Entrenamiento: El Disparo perforante del Cazador","El entrenador de cazadores está en el Puesto de Vigilancia de Edhelion.\
\
Ahora que has usado tu habilidad con éxito, deberías regresar con tu entrenadora y contarle tu éxito.","Has golpeado el muñeco de entrenamiento con Disparo perforante","Usa <rgb=#00ff00>Disparo perforante en el muñeco de entrenamiento cercano.\
\
PISTA:\
\
Los Cazadores necesitan <rgb=#ffff00>Concentración</rgb> para usar algunos de sus disparos especiales, y <rgb=#00ff00>Disparo perforante</rgb> es una de esas habilidades. Usa tu habilidad <rgb=#00ff00>Disparo Rápido</rgb> hasta que tengas <rgb=#ffff00>3 puntos de Concentración</rgb>, y luego usa <rgb=#00ff00>Disparo perforante</rgb>.","Habla con el entrenador de cazadores en el Puesto de Vigilancia de Edhelion"}},
[13834]={nameES="Entrenamiento: El Compañero de un Sabio",objectivesES={"El Entrenador de Sabios está en el Puesto de Vigilancia de Edhelion.\
\
Ahora que has usado con éxito tu nueva habilidad, deberías regresar con tu entrenadora y contarle tu éxito.","Golpea el maniquí de entrenamiento con Brasas ardientes","Usa la habilidad <rgb=#00ff00>Brasas ardientes</rgb> en el muñeco de entrenamiento cercano.","Has golpeado el maniquí de entrenamiento con Brasas ardientes.","Entrenamiento: El Compañero de un Sabio","Habla con el Entrenador de Sabios en el Puesto de Vigilancia de Edhelion"}},
[13835]={nameES="Entrenamiento: La Balada Mayor de un Juglar",objectivesES={"El Entrenador de Juglares está en el Puesto de Vigilancia de Edhelion.\
\
Ahora que has usado tu habilidad con éxito, debes regresar con tu entrenador y contarle tu éxito.","PISTA:\
\
Los juglares usan <rgb=#ffff00>Baladas</rgb> para atacar a sus enemigos, sanar ligeramente a sus compañeros y potenciarse a sí mismos. Estas habilidades funcionan con un sistema de rotación que permite al juglar tener tres mejoras especiales sobre sí en todo momento. Después de aplicarse la tercera mejora, la siguiente <rgb=#ffff00>Balada</rgb> que se reproduzca sobrescribirá la primera, luego la segunda, y así sucesivamente.","Has usado la habilidad 'Balada Mayor' mientras estabas en combate con el Muñeco de Entrenamiento","Entrenamiento: La Balada Mayor de un Juglar","Habla con el Entrenador de Juglares en el Puesto de Vigilancia de Edhelion","Aprende la habilidad 'Balada Mayor' y úsala mientras estés en combate con un Muñeco de Entrenamiento"}},
[13836]={nameES="Entrenamiento: Las Palabras Ígneas de un Maestro Rúnico",objectivesES={"Entrenamiento: Las Palabras Ígneas de un Maestro Rúnico","Golpea al muñeco de entrenamiento con <rgb=#00ff00>Escarnio ígneo</rgb","Habla con el Entrenador de Maestros Rúnicos en el puesto de vigilancia de Edhelion","Usa tu habilidad <rgb=#00ff00>Escarnio ígneo</rgb> en el muñeco de entrenamiento.\
\
PISTA: Los Maestros rúnicos requieren <rgb=#ff0000>Afinidad de Combate</rgb> para usar habilidades ofensivas y <rgb=#00ff00>Afinidad de Curación</rgb> para lanzar hechizos de curación. La <rgb=#ffff00>Afinidad</rgb> se <rgb=#ff0000>incrementa</rgb> o <rgb=#00ff00>reduce</rgb> usando habilidades similares. Las habilidades ofensivas suelen tener fondo <rgb=#ff0000>rojo</rgb> y las de curación fondo <rgb=#00ff00>verde</rgb>.","Usa tu habilidad 'Escarnio ígneo' en el muñeco de entrenamiento cercano.","El Entrenador de Maestros Rúnicos está en el puesto de vigilancia de Edhelion.\
\
Ahora que has usado con éxito tu habilidad, deberías regresar con tu entrenadora y contarle de tu éxito."}},
[13837]={nameES="Entrenamiento: Las Palabras Ígneas de un Maestro Rúnico",objectivesES={"Entrenamiento: Las Palabras Ígneas de un Maestro Rúnico","Golpea al muñeco de entrenamiento con <rgb=#00ff00>Escarnio ígneo</rgb","Has golpeado al muñeco de entrenamiento con Escarnio ígneo","Usa tu habilidad <rgb=#00ff00>Escarnio ígneo</rgb> en el muñeco de entrenamiento.\
\
PISTA: Los Maestros rúnicos requieren <rgb=#ff0000>Afinidad de Combate</rgb> para usar habilidades ofensivas y <rgb=#00ff00>Afinidad de Curación</rgb> para lanzar hechizos de curación. La <rgb=#ffff00>Afinidad</rgb> se <rgb=#ff0000>incrementa</rgb> o <rgb=#00ff00>reduce</rgb> usando habilidades similares. Las habilidades ofensivas suelen tener fondo <rgb=#ff0000>rojo</rgb> y las de curación fondo <rgb=#00ff00>verde</rgb>.","El Entrenador de Maestros Rúnicos está en Archet.\
\
Ahora que has usado con éxito Escarnio ígneo, deberías regresar con tu entrenador y contarle de tu éxito.","Habla con el Entrenador de Maestros Rúnicos en Archet"}},
[13838]={nameES="Entrenamiento: El Golpe Hábil de un Vigilante",objectivesES={"Usa Golpe Hábil en el muñeco de entrenamiento cercano.\
\
PISTA: Los Vigilantes usan combinaciones de sus habilidades básicas, como <rgb=#00ff00>Estocada Rápida</rgb> y <rgb=#00ff00>Embestida con escudo</rgb>, para crear ataques de <rgb=#ffff00>Gambito</rgb> más poderosos. Para usar tu habilidad <rgb=#00ff00>Golpe Hábil</rgb>, ataca a un <rgb=#ff0000>Muñeco de Entrenamiento</rgb> con tu habilidad <rgb=#00ff00>Estocada Rápida</rgb> dos veces. Esto hará que tu habilidad <rgb=#00ff00>Gambito Predeterminado</rgb> se convierta en tu habilidad <rgb=#00ff00>Golpe Hábil</rgb>. Usa tu habilidad <rgb=#00ff00>Golpe Hábil</rgb> para golpear a un <rgb=#ff0000>Muñeco de Entrenamiento</rgb>.","Habla con el Entrenador de Vigilantes en el Puesto de Vigilancia de Edhelion","Entrenamiento: El Golpe Hábil de un Vigilante","Usa Golpe Hábil contra un Muñeco de Entrenamiento","El Entrenador de Vigilantes está en el Puesto de Vigilancia de Edhelion.\
\
Ahora que has usado con éxito tu Golpe Hábil, debes regresar con tu entrenador y contarle tu éxito.","Has golpeado al Muñeco de Entrenamiento con 'Golpe Hábil'"}},
[13839]={nameES="Entrenamiento: Desarmando a la Competencia",objectivesES={"Entrenamiento: Desarmando a la Competencia","El Entrenador de Saqueadores se encuentra en la Atalaya de Edhelion.\
\
Ahora que has usado exitosamente tu Golpe Sorpresivo, deberías regresar con tu entrenador y contarle tu éxito.","Habla con el Entrenador de Saqueadores en la Atalaya de Edhelion","Usa tu habilidad <rgb=#00ff00>Golpe sorpresivo</rgb> contra el Muñeco de Entrenamiento cercano.\
\
PISTA:\
\
Los Saqueadores se benefician enormemente de los <rgb=#ffff00>Golpes Críticos</rgb> y <rgb=#ffff00>Golpes Devastadores</rgb>. Conseguir este tipo de impactos les permitirá usar habilidades especiales como <rgb=#00ff00>Golpe de Doble Filo</rgb>. Además, muchas habilidades del Saqueador se benefician de estar en <rgb=#ffff00>Sigilo</rgb>.\
\
Intenta atacar a un <rgb=#ff0000>Muñeco de Entrenamiento</rgb> desde <rgb=#ffff00>Sigilo</rgb> con <rgb=#ffff00>Golpe Sorpresivo</rgb> para infligir aún más daño.","Golpea al Muñeco de Entrenamiento con <rgb=#00ff00>Golpe Sorpresivo</rgb>","Has golpeado al Muñeco de Entrenamiento con Golpe Sorpresivo"}},
[13840]={nameES="Entrenamiento: La emoción del combate",objectivesES={"Habla con el Entrenador de Campeones en la Atalaya de Edhelion.","Entrenamiento: La emoción del combate","Has golpeado al Muñeco de Entrenamiento con “Golpes Feroces.","Usa tu nueva habilidad <rgb=#00ff00>Golpes Feroces</rgb> sobre el Muñeco de Entrenamiento cercano\
\
PISTA:\
\
Los Campeones dependen del <rgb=#ffff00>Fervor</rgb> para activar algunas de sus habilidades, como <rgb=#00ff00>Golpes Feroces</rgb>. Usa tus habilidades <rgb=#00ff00>Golpe Veloz</rgb> y <rgb=#00ff00>Ataque salvaje</rgb> para generar <rgb=#ffff00>2 de Fervor</rgb> y luego golpea al <rgb=#ff0000>Muñeco de Entrenamiento</rgb> con tu habilidad <rgb=#ffff00>Golpes Feroces</rgb>.","Habla con el Entrenador de Campeones en la Atalaya de Edhelion.\
\
Ahora que has usado con éxito tu nueva habilidad, regresa con tu entrenador y cuéntale tu éxito.","Aprende la habilidad “Golpes Feroces” y úsala contra un Muñeco de Entrenamiento."}},
[13841]={nameES="Entrenamiento: La Emoción de la Lucha",objectivesES={"Naithador, el Entrenador de Luchadores, está en la Atalaya de Edhelion.\
\
Ahora que has usado exitosamente tu habilidad recién aprendida, regresa con tu entrenador y cuéntale tu éxito.","Habla con Naithador, el Entrenador de Luchadores, en la Atalaya de Edhelion","Entrenamiento: La Emoción de la Lucha","Usa tu nueva habilidad <rgb=#00ff00>Golpe Descendente</rgb> contra un Muñeco de Entrenamiento.\
\\Los Luchadores dependen del <rgb=#ffff00>Valor</rgb> para activar algunas de sus habilidades, como <rgb=#00ff00>Golpe Descendente</rgb>. Usa tu <rgb=#00ff00>Golpe Bajo</rgb> o <rgb=#00ff00>Gancho Diestro</rgb> para acumular <rgb=#ffff00>3 de Valor</rgb> y luego golpea al <rgb=#ff0000>Muñeco de Entrenamiento</rgb> con tu habilidad <rgb=#ffff00>Golpe Descendente</rgb>."}},
[13842]={nameES="Traidores entre nosotros",objectivesES={"Ilzkâl y Nardur pueden encontrarse en la Gran Escalera, al noreste de la Guardia Orca.\
\
Thithrand cree que los uruk-hai Nardur e Ilzkâl podrían estar planeando rebelarse contra Igash y robar para sí el tributo que se guarda en su sala del trono.","Nardur derrotado","Traidores entre nosotros","Se desconoce cómo encontraron el camino hasta Moria, pero las fuerzas de la Mano Blanca se han atrincherado en las comunidades orcas de Khazad-dûm. No obstante, a Thithrand le parece que desean reclamar para sí el liderazgo sobre Moria.","Habla con Thithrand en la Guardia Orca","Ilzkâl derrotado","Derrota a Nardur","Derrota a Ilzkâl","Thithrand se encuentra en la Guardia Orca, al suroeste de la Gran Escalera.\
\
Deberías regresar con Thithrand para comunicarle la noticia de tu victoria."}},
[13843]={nameES="Traitors to the Wilderfolk",objectivesES={"This Woodman appears to have been slain by Sharkey's Men, likely for cowardice or theft","This Woodman seems to have drowned when part of the tunnel collapsed","Talk to Tautila in the warrens of Tûn Melen","Traitors to the Wilderfolk","Vulfila flees in fear!","Hathus could not be turned from his loyalty to Sharkey","Traitorous Woodmen can be found in the warrens of Tûn Melen.\
\
Tautila has asked you to find and, if necessary, defeat his traitorous kinsfolk who have joined Sharkey's Men.","Far from unwilling prisoners, it seems several Woodmen have forsaken the Wilderfolk to join Sharkey's Men.","Tautila can be found in the warrens of Tûn Melen.\
\
You have found or defeated all of the traitorous Woodmen in service to Sharkey. You should return to Tautila.","Desperate to gain the riches Sharkey promised, Hoderna falls defeated!"}},
[13844]={nameES="Pezuñas Pisoteadoras",objectivesES={"Busca evidencia sobre la ubicación de los enanos","No encontraste más evidencia sobre la ubicación de los enanos.","Se puede encontrar una manada de jabalíes en el Bosque de los Trolls Sur, en un lugar llamado Lavanim, al oeste del campamento de Barachen.\
\
Barachen te pidió que buscaras a los enanos desaparecidos entre los jabalíes del Bosque de los Trolls Sur.","Lleva el trozo de tela que encontraste a Barachen","Barachen está en su campamento en el Bosque de los Trolls Sur, al sur del camino y bajo la sombra de altos acantilados.\
\
Barachen espera saber si encontraste alguna señal de los enanos desaparecidos entre los jabalíes del Bosque de los Trolls.","Se puede encontrar una manada de jabalíes en el Bosque de los Trolls Sur, en un lugar llamado Lavanim, al oeste del campamento de Barachen.\
\
Barachen te pidió que buscaras a los enanos desaparecidos entre los jabalíes al oeste de su campamento. Quizás encuentres más evidencia en los jabalíes de Lavanim.","El Elfo Barachen y sus compañeros han descubierto que una compañía de enanos en camino a Rivendel podría haber sufrido una desgracia.","Pezuñas Pisoteadoras","Este cadáver está gravemente mutilado, pero encontraste un pedazo de tela enganchado en uno de sus colmillos","Busca evidencia de la compañía enana entre los jabalíes de Lavanim"}},
[13845]={nameES="Trap-breaking",objectivesES={"Return the heavy stone to Déormund","Déormund is waiting to speak with you on the western shore of the lake in Tâl Methedras.","Trap-breaking","Déormund's leg was caught in a snap-jaw trap and the Rohirrim has been injured. He needs time to recover, and he wants you to destroy the other traps.","Snap-jaw traps have been placed in the undergrowth on the western shore of the lake in Tâl Methedras.\
\
Déormund has given you a heavy stone with which to smash the snap-jaw traps you find."}},
[13846]={nameES="Trapped Trees",objectivesES={}},
[13847]={nameES="Trapped in the Dale",objectivesES={}},
[13848]={nameES="Trapped in the Spider's Grasp",objectivesES={}},
[13849]={nameES="Trapping the Trackers",objectivesES={"Collect the crate of traps","Trapping the Trackers","Legolas has a plan to eliminate some of the Orc Trackers in Lhingris and needs a brave adventurer's help.","Ideal trap locations can be found in the Rath Cail.\
\
You should place traps in these locations, and then defeat the Mordor Trackers that stumble into them.","Legolas has hidden the crate of traps in the Rath Cail.\
\
You should collect the crate of traps.","Collected the crate of traps","A note and map are pinned to the board, signed by Legolas:\
\
'I have witnessed Orc Trackers from Cirith Ungol placing traps in the Rath Cail to halt our advance. I have removed these traps, but I believe we can use them to our advantage. On this map, I have marked the location where I hid the traps and ideal locations for you to place them on their scouting paths. Arm them, and lie in wait. The Trackers will stumble into them, and you can deal with them there.'"}},
[13850]={nameES="Traps for Rats",objectivesES={"Talk to Temámir Guard Captain Nûru in Mekab-kuphâr","Return to Khôltekh in Dâr Laja, the Hall of the Kindred.","Nûru told you to go far to the north, outside Khabârkhad, to Tilmakhím in Tâkhdar. There, a vendor named Mâramit will give you the traps Khôltekh asked you to place.","Talk to the vendor Mâramit in Tilmakhím","Traps for Rats","Go south of Tilmakhím, to the northern edge of Khabârkhad, near Lôkhalel, and deploy the traps Mâramit gave you.","Return to Khôltekh in the Hall of the Kindred","Khôltekh has asked that you deploy traps along the northern walls of Khabârkhad in the Umbar-môkh.","Khôltekh has asked that you deploy traps along the northern walls of Khabârkhad in the Umbar-môkh. He has directed you to speak with Nûru, who can be found in Mekab-kuphâr, a guard outpost in southern Khabârkhad."}},
[13851]={nameES="Trampas en la naturaleza",objectivesES={"Trampas en la naturaleza","Habla con Grun Muellecurvo","La Liga del Hacha utiliza trampas para capturar animales en el Bosque Salvaje, con el fin de obtener alimento y pieles.","En el Bosque Salvaje se pueden encontrar buenos lugares para colocar trampas.\
\
Debes colocar las trampas que te han dado en el Bosque Salvaje.","Grun Muellecurvo se encuentra en el Embarcadero de los Comerciantes.\
\
Deberías hablar con Grun Muellecurvo"}},
[13852]={nameES="Travel to Helethir",objectivesES={"Danfennas is at Helethir, north-east of Mithechad.\
\
Perindúr has asked you to speak with his friend Danfennas regarding the plague upon the trees of the Ashenslades.","Talk to Danfennas at Helethir","To the south of Dol Guldur, Danfennas seeks out information regarding the pale quality of the trees around the Ashenslades. He has joined several others in Helethir, a small camp to the south of Dol Guldur, to investigate the area.","Travel to Helethir"}},
[13853]={nameES="Travellers in Ithilien",objectivesES={"Travellers in Ithilien","Anborn can be found at Henneth Annûn in North Ithilien.\
\
You have listened to Anborn's tale and should now ask if he knows more of these travellers.","Listen to Anborn's tale","Anborn will not soon forget the doughty little Halflings who gave such cheek to his captain, Faramir.","Anborn can be found at Henneth Annûn in North Ithilien.\
\
Anborn has offered to tell you a tale of strange travellers that passed through Ithilien.","Talk to Anborn at Henneth Annûn"}},
[13854]={nameES="Travellers on the Dark Road",objectivesES={"The raven can be found atop an obelisk along the Men Angrún to the west of Óinsbridge.\
\
The path of hoof-prints led down the Men Angrún, but it appears that one of Arcah's ravens has perched atop an old obelisk along the dark road. You should direct the raven to fly to Dori at Óinsbridge.","Follow the roadway to Óinsbridge and rejoin Dori and Company","Dori can be found at Óinsbridge.\
\
You have directed the raven to fly to Dori at Óinsbridge. You should now return to Dori.","Direct the raven to fly to Dori at Óinsbridge","Talk to Ingór, son of Vékun","Óinsbridge can be found far to the south-west of Skarháld.\
\
You have spoken to Ingór, son of Vékun, and you should now follow the Men Angrún to Óinsbridge.","The hoof-prints lead ahead...","A trail of hoof-prints appears to lead back onto the Men Angrún...","Search the abandoned camp-site for signs of Nori's expedition","Travellers on the Dark Road","After learning that Nori and his expedition travelled to Thikil-gundu by way of the Men Angrún, Dori and Company must navigate the dark road through the Thornholt.","Appearing to understand, the raven takes flight over Óinsbridge...","You discover Bofur gazing into the distance from atop his goat!","Search Óinsbridge for signs of Nori's expedition","A thorn-ridden cloak of dwarf-make has been left behind...","Talk to Bofur at Óinsbridge","Dori can be found at Óinsbridge.\
\
You have arrived at Óinsbridge and should now speak to Dori.","A path of hoof-prints can be found on the Men Angrún to the west of Óinsbridge.\
\
Bofur has discovered another trail of hoof-prints leading onto the Men Angrún to the west of Óinsbridge. You should follow them.","Find Ingór, son of Vékun in the Keep of Tharrazhâr","Follow the path of hoof-prints leading away from the abandoned camp-site","Ingór, son of Vékun can be found in the Keep of Tharrazhâr.\
\
Dori has asked you to speak to Ingór, son of Vékun before following the Men Angrún to Óinsbridge.","Talk to Dori at Óinsbridge","A path of hoof-prints can be found in Óinsbridge.\
\
You have discovered a path of hoof-prints leading away from the abandoned camp-site. You should follow them.","Follow the path of hoof-prints leading away from Óinsbridge","Ingór, son of Vékun stands among his company of Zhélruka...","The abandoned camp-site can be found in Óinsbridge.\
\
You have found an abandoned camp-site in Óinsbridge. You should try to determine if this camp-site was built by Nori and his expedition.","Dori and Company have come to Óinsbridge!","You have found what appears to be an abandoned camp-site...","Bofur can be found at Óinsbridge.\
\
The path of hoof-prints has led you to Bofur and his goat. You should talk to Bofur.","The raven perches silently....","A raven sitting atop an old obelisk along the Men Angrún croaks at your approach...","Signs of Nori's expedition might be found at Óinsbridge.\
\
Dori has asked you to search Óinsbridge for signs of Nori's expedition.","Though extinguished, this camp-fire appears to have been built in the past few days..."}},
[13855]={nameES="Travellers' Terror",objectivesES={"The frightened merchant can be found on the southern part of the road leading towards the Norcrofts, at a small trading outpost.\
\
You should reassure the frightened man that the threat is lessened, and the Wargs will trouble his vulnerable outpost no more.","Wargs prowl the southern fields of the Wold near the border of the Norcrofts, south of the small trader outpost on the road.\
\
You should defeat the vicious Wold Wargs so that the travellers will be safe from harm.","Return to the merchants' outpost","A small group of travelling merchants out in the fields of the Wold hear the terrifying howls of Wargs in the fields to the south. They cannot see the beasts, but they shudder at the sounds.","Travellers' Terror"}},
[13856]={nameES="Travelling Through the Smoke",objectivesES={}},
[13857]={nameES="Hambre traicionera",objectivesES={"Hambre traicionera","Tasgall ha ideado un plan mediante el cual la amenaza de las bestias de las colinas puede reducirse considerablemente.","Se pueden encontrar rampantes en todo Fasach-larran.\
\
Tasgall te ha pedido que recojas los restos de los gusanos de Fasach-larran para que pueda preparar un cebo y atraer a Bangrath y Murragrath.","El campamento de Tasgall se encuentra al norte de Aughaire y al sureste de Nád Nathair.\
\
Has recogido los restos de varios gusanos de Fasach-larran, y ahora debes llevarlos a Tasgall.","Lleva los restos de los gusanos a Tasgall"}},
[13858]={nameES="Treachery in Esgaroth",objectivesES={"Talk to King Thorin III","Slain drakelings can be found near the bones of Smaug in Esgaroth-of-old.\
\
You have discovered the smuggled drakelings laid bare in Esgaroth-of-old as a means to incite the ire of the Herald of Winter.","You discover a gravely wounded cold-drake, gasping for what must be its final breaths...","Find Karazgar's agents and their cargo at Esgaroth-of-old","Follow the path of slain Men along the old bridge","King Thorin III can be found in the Hall Under the Mountain.\
\
A cold-drake has delivered a chilling threat against the people of the North. You should warn King Thorin III.","The path of slain Men can be found along the broken bridge to Esgaroth-of-old.\
\
You have not found any sign of the Weeping Warrior, but you discovered a path of slain Men leading down the old bridge of Esgaroth. You should see where it leads.","Upon the bones of Esgaroth-of-Old, the designs of Karazgar are at last revealed.","Treachery in Esgaroth","Esgaroth-of-old can be found to the east of Eryn Lasgalen on the banks of the Long Lake.\
\
Thranduil has learned that Karazgar's agents have returned to Esgaroth-of-old, and he seeks to put an end to the Weeping Warrior's plot against the North.","Karazgar might be found somewhere in Esgaroth-of-old.\
\
You should search for Karazgar in Esgaroth-of-old. He might be found near the bones of Smaug.","Patrol Esgaroth-of-old in search of the Weeping Warrior","Karazgar's agents have gathered the remains of young cold-drakes among the bones of Smaug...","Examine the dying cold-drake","A path of slain Men lines the broken bridge to Esgaroth-of-old...","The cold-drake can be found amid the bones of Smaug in Esgaroth-of-old.\
\
You have not found Karazgar, but a dying cold-drake stares towards the bones of Smaug from the old bridge. You should examine the cold-drake."}},
[13859]={nameES="Treason Exposed",objectivesES={"Treason Exposed","Walnoth awaits your return at the dungeon entrance below the Cliving mead hall.\
\
Ides has informed you that Walnoth has requested to speak with you regarding the outcome of your investigation.","Talk to Walnoth about Eldora's request","Talk to Walnoth at the Cliving Mead Hall dungeon","Walnoth has deduced  Athelward's guilt and Eldora's innocence","Walnoth has requested your presence in Cliving, to reevaluate the matters of the investigated crimes, and their resolution.","Eldora is being held in a cell in the Cliving dungeon, under the Mead Hall.\
\
Walnoth has asked you to inform Eldora of her confirmed innocence and that she is being set free.","Talk to Eldora in the dungeon","Walnoth waits at the dungeon below the Cliving Mead Hall.\
\
Eldora has asked you to convince Walnoth to grant healing and treatment to the soldier who was in her care."}},
[13860]={nameES="Treason Revealed",objectivesES={"Walnoth awaits your return at the dungeon entrance below the Cliving Mead Hall.\
\
Ides has informed you that Walnoth has requested to speak with you regarding the outcome of your investigation.","Walnoth has requested your presence in Cliving to re-evaluate the matters of the investigated crimes and their resolution.","Wigfugol is being held in a cell in the Cliving dungeon, under the Mead Hall.\
\
Walnoth has asked you to inform Wigfugol of his confirmed innocence and that he is being set free.","Walnoth has deduced  Athelward's guilt and Wigfugol's innocence","Talk to Wigfugol in the dungeon","Talk to Walnoth at the Cliving Mead Hall dungeon","Treason Revealed","Talk to Walnoth about Wigfugol's request","Walnoth waits at the dungeon below the Cliving Mead Hall.\
\
Wigfugol has requested that Walnoth gather a company of soldiers to retake the Norcrofts farmland lost to their Orcs."}},
[13861]={nameES="Treason Uncovered",objectivesES={"Walnoth awaits your return at the dungeon entrance below the Cliving Mead Hall.\
\
Ides has informed you that Walnoth has requested to speak with you regarding the outcome of your investigation.","Swithorne is being held in a cell in the Cliving dungeon, under the Mead Hall.\
\
Walnoth has asked you to inform Swithorne of his confirmed innocence and that he is being set free.","Walnoth has requested your presence in Cliving to re-evaluate the matters of the investigated crimes and their resolution.","Treason Uncovered","Walnoth waits at the dungeon below the Cliving Mead Hall.\
\
Swithorne has asked you to convince Walnoth erect a memorial statue in Cliving to honour the fallen soldiers.","Talk to Walnoth at the Cliving Mead Hall dungeon","Talk to Swithorne in the dungeon","Walnoth has deduced  Athelward's guilt and Swithorne's innocence","Talk to Walnoth about Swithorne's request"}},
