[14010]={nameES="Tutorial: Learning the Tools",objectivesES={"Talk to Durglob","Tutorial: Learning the Tools","Uglash has implored you to return to your trainers and learn how better to equip yourself for the battles to come.","Now that you have equipped some traits, speak with the corruptions trainer to learn more about corruptions in Monster Play.","Uglash has asked you to return to your trainers and learn more about what it takes to become a true soldier in the war against the Free Peoples.\
\
The trainers are back where you started your life as an Orc.","Now that you have learned how to best equip yourself in Monster Play, speak with Uglash again for final instructions.","Talk to Uglash to finish the tutorial","Having spoken with Dagalúr, you should now talk to the Corruptor to learn about traits.","Return to your trainers and learn how to improve your skills","Talk to Ashrokil, the Corruptor of Gramsfoot"}},
[14011]={nameES="Tutorial: Out of Angmar",objectivesES={"You are directed to speak with War-tyrant Akulhún, the leader of the forces in Gramsfoot. He awaits you at the totems and bonfires down the hill near the exit into the Ettenmoors proper.","Tutorial: Out of Angmar","Welcome to the Ettenmoors! It is time to learn your way around. Follow your orders and prepare to meet the enemy outside of the encampment at Gramsfoot!"}},
[14012]={nameES="Tutorial: Outfitted for Battle",objectivesES={}},
[14013]={nameES="Tutorial: Outfitted for Battle",objectivesES={}},
[14014]={nameES="Tutorial: Outfitted for Battle",objectivesES={}},
[14015]={nameES="Tutorial: El Poder de la Corrupción",objectivesES={"Malavin, el emisario de Angmar, te indicó que regresaras al lugar donde comenzaste tu viaje en las Landas de Etten para hablar con el corruptor allí.","Malavan sent you back to where your journey in the Ettenmoors began to speak with Lenathron the corruptor.","Return to your spawning den. Speak with Lenathron the Corruptor.","Tutorial: El Poder de la Corrupción"}},
[14016]={nameES="Tutorial: El Poder de la Corrupción",objectivesES={"Malavin, el emisario de Angmar, te indicó que regresaras al lugar donde comenzaste tu viaje en las Landas de Etten para hablar con el corruptor allí.","Tutorial: El Poder de la Corrupción","Return to your spawning den. Speak with Ashrokil the Corruptor.","Malavan sent you back to where your journey in the Ettenmoors began to speak with Ashrokil the corruptor."}},
[14017]={nameES="Tutorial: El Poder de la Corrupción",objectivesES={"Malavin, el emisario de Angmar, te indicó que regresaras al lugar donde comenzaste tu viaje en las Landas de Etten para hablar con el corruptor allí.","Malavan sent you back to where your journey in the Ettenmoors began to speak with Zagfra the Corruptor.","Return to your spawning den. Speak with Zagfra the Corruptor.","Tutorial: El Poder de la Corrupción"}},
[14018]={nameES="Tutorial: El Poder de la Corrupción",objectivesES={"Malavin, el emisario de Angmar, te indicó que regresaras al lugar donde comenzaste tu viaje en las Landas de Etten para hablar con el corruptor allí.","Malavin te indicó que regresaras con Cinaid, cerca de la puerta principal de Gramsfoot. Él te ayudará a seguir preparándote para luchar en las Landas de Etten.","Tutorial: El Poder de la Corrupción"}},
[14019]={nameES="Tutorial: Spinning the Web",objectivesES={"Return to safety and speak with Uglash","Tutorial: Spinning the Web","Tolothdal has ordered you to get into the fight already. She wants you to go speak with Chief Guard Duthúrz outside the gate to the south.  Leave the camp and speak with him immediately.","Get back to safety","Get your orders from Chief Guard Duthúrz","You are deemed unworthy by the Chief Guard. Speak with Uglash inside the camp to learn more about what you need to survive the Ettenmoors.","Having entered the Ettenmoors as a spider, you need to learn your way around. Follow your orders and do not get yourself killed by the Free Peoples who lurk around every corner."}},
[14020]={nameES="Tutorial: Spinning the Web",objectivesES={"Return to safety and speak with Uglash","Tutorial: Spinning the Web","Tolothdal has ordered you to get into the fight already. She wants you to go speak with Chief Guard Duthúrz outside the gate to the south. Leave the camp and speak with him immediately.","Get back to safety","Get your orders from Chief Guard Duthúrz","You are deemed unworthy by the Chief Guard. Speak with Uglash inside the base to learn more about what you need to survive the Ettenmoors.","Having entered the Ettenmoors as a spider, you need to learn your way around. Follow your orders and do not get yourself killed by the Free Peoples who lurk around every corner."}},
[14021]={nameES="Tutorial: The Keep at Dâr-Gazag",objectivesES={}},
[14022]={nameES="Tutorial: Robo y Travesuras",objectivesES={"<rgb=#00FF00>La Puerta Sur de Bree ha pasado a tu control. El siguiente lugar importante es la Casa de Subastas justo delante</rgb>","La habilidad de Soldado está en tu Panel de Habilidades, en la sección de Escaramuza. Necesitarás usarla para invocar a un Soldado que te ayude.","La bandera está en la Puerta Sur de Bree. Para reclamar este Punto de Control necesitas usar la bandera.","Toma el control de la Casa de Subastas de Bree","<rgb=#00FF00>Has tomado el control de la Casa de Subastas</rgb>","Toma el control de la casa de Bill Helechal y derrota a Dríthlorz","Usa el cuerno para aprender a llamar a un Soldado","Usa tu nueva habilidad para convocar a un Soldado","Mientras los Montaraces del Norte estaban distraídos en el Sur, unos bandidos aprovecharon la oportunidad para arrebatar el control de Bree....","El Segundo vigilante Heathstraw está en su campamento, justo fuera de la Puerta Sur de Bree. Está esperando a que informes.","El Segundo vigilante Heathstraw está justo fuera de la casa de Bill Helechal. Desea hablar contigo sobre vuestra victoria.","Un Soldado de los Pueblos Libres aparece para ayudarte en tu Escaramuza contra el Enemigo.","Usar el cuerno te ha enseñado la habilidad necesaria para llamar a un Soldado en una Escaramuza.","Tutorial: Robo y Travesuras","El Segundo vigilante Heathstraw está en su campamento, justo fuera de la Puerta Sur de Bree. Desea comentar contigo su plan para recuperar la ciudad.","El cuerno está sobre una caja junto al Segundo vigilante Heathstraw. Necesitarás usarlo para aprender a convocar a un Soldado al combate.","La Puerta Sur está justo al norte del campamento del Segundo vigilante Heathstraw. Necesitarás eliminar a todos los enemigos alrededor de la bandera para reclamarla.","La Casa de Subastas está al norte de la Puerta Sur de Bree. Los enemigos deben ser eliminados y la bandera utilizada para tomar este punto.","Usa la bandera para reclamar la Puerta Sur","<rgb=#00FF00>Dríthlorz ha sido derrotado y la casa de Bill Helechal está asegurada. Bree aún no es libre, pero se ha avanzado mucho</rgb>","Toma el control de la Puerta Sur de Bree","Informa de tu éxito al Segundo vigilante Heathstraw","Los monstruos de la Puerta Sur han sido eliminados. Usa la bandera para reclamar el Punto de Control.","Habla con el Segundo vigilante Heathstraw","La casa de Bill Helechal está al este de la Casa de Subastas. Debéis derrotar a Dríthlorz y sus aliados y usar la bandera para recuperar esta parte de Bree."}},
[14023]={nameES="Tutorial: Thrown to the Wargs",objectivesES={"Return to safety and speak with Uglash","Having entered the Ettenmoors as a Warg, you need to learn your way around. Follow your orders and do not get yourself killed by the Free Peoples who lurk around every corner.","Get your orders from Chief Guard Duthúrz","Get back to safety","Tutorial: Thrown to the Wargs","You are deemed unworthy by the Chief Guard. Speak with Uglash inside the base to learn more about what you need to survive the Ettenmoors.","Morsûm has ordered you to get into the fight already. He wants you to go speak with Chief Guard Duthúrz outside the gate to the south. Leave the camp and speak with him immediately."}},
[14024]={nameES="Tutorial: Thrown to the Wargs",objectivesES={"Return to safety and speak with Uglash","Having entered the Ettenmoors as a Warg, you need to learn your way around. Follow your orders and do not get yourself killed by the Free Peoples who lurk around every corner.","Get your orders from Chief Guard Duthúrz","Get back to safety","Tutorial: Thrown to the Wargs","You are deemed unworthy by the Chief Guard. Speak with Uglash inside the base to learn more about what you need to survive the Ettenmoors.","Morsûm has ordered you to get into the fight already. He wants you to go speak with Chief Guard Duthúrz outside the gate to the south. Leave the camp and speak with him immediately."}},
[14025]={nameES="Tutorial: Trial by Fire",objectivesES={"Tutorial: Trial by Fire","You are deemed unworthy by the Chief Guard. Speak with Uglash inside the fort to learn more about what you need to survive the Ettenmoors.","Return to safety and talk to Uglash","Get your orders from Chief Guard Duthúrz","Get back to safety","Having entered the Ettenmoors as an Orc, you need to learn your way around. Follow your orders and do not get yourself killed by the soldiers of the Free Peoples who lurk around every corner.","Soldier Gazfríb has ordered you to get into the fight already. He wants you to go speak with Chief Guard Duthúrz outside the gate to the south. Leave the camp and speak with him immediately."}},
[14026]={nameES="Tutorial: Trial by Fire",objectivesES={"Tutorial: Trial by Fire","Return to safety and speak with Uglash","Get your orders from Chief Guard Duthúrz","Get back to safety","Soldier Gazfríb has ordered you to get into the fight already. He wants you to go speak with Chief Guard Duthúrz outside the gate to the south. Leave the camp and speak with him immediately.","You are deemed unworthy by the Chief Guard. Speak with Uglash inside the base to learn more about what you need to survive the Moors.","Having entered the Ettenmoors as an Orc, you need to learn your way around. Follow your orders and do not get yourself killed by the Free Peoples who lurk around every corner."}},
[14027]={nameES="Tutorial: When Spiders Unite",objectivesES={"Tutorial: When Spiders Unite","Talk to Lenathron, a Corruptor of Gramsfoot","Return to your trainers and learn how to train your skills","Uglash has asked you to return to your trainers and learn more about what it takes to become a true soldier in the war against the Free Peoples.\
\
The trainers are back where you started your life as a spider. Speak with Lingemil first.","Talk to Nathrog","Uglash has implored you to return to your trainers and learn how better to equip yourself for the battles to come. He has sent you to your trainers to learn more.","Having spoken with Lingemil, you should now talk to the Corruptor to learn about traits.","Now that you have equipped some Traits, speak with Nathrog to learn more about Corruptions in Monster Play.","Now that you have learned how to best equip yourself in Monster Play, speak with Uglash again for final instructions.","Talk to Uglash to finish the tutorial"}},
[14028]={nameES="Twice the Threat",objectivesES={"You scouted the southern fortifications","The orcs on the western side of Minas Morgul have begun to fortify their defensive positions. Damrod asked if you would scout their encampment and find the best means of gaining entry.","Twice the Threat","Scout northern fortifications to the west of Barad Angarth","Dolenthol awaits your findings in the field.\
\
You should locate the Ranger and make your report.","An army has begun to fortify the area west of Barad Angarth.\
\
Scout several locations within the camp and you may gain additional information about your foe.","Scout southern fortifications to the west of Barad Angarth","You scouted the northern fortifications","You scouted the central fortifications","Talk to Dolenthol","Scout central fortifications to the west of Barad Angarth"}},
[14029]={nameES="El doble de tortugas",objectivesES={"Benegar Vallelargo fue a una isla en los Lagos cielo claro, al noroeste de Bree, a buscar tortugas para dárselas a Sig Mandrake.\
\
Has descubierto adónde fue Benegar Vallelargo y debes buscarlo para asegurarte de que está a salvo.","Encuentra a Benegar Vallelargo y habla con él entre los Lagos cielo claro","El doble de tortugas","Grobo Hierbaperro quiere que devuelvas las tortugas a Sig Mandrake y le preguntes al tendero si ha visto a su sobrino Benegar Vallelargo.","Sig Mandrake está en su tienda al este de la Puerta del Lodo, en Bree, ubicado en la sección suroeste del pueblo.\
\
Grobo Hierbaperro quiere que lleves la bolsa de tortugas a Sig Mandrake y que le preguntes si sabe algo del sobrino de Grobo.","Lleva la bolsa de tortugas a Sig Mandrake en su tienda"}},
[14030]={nameES="Twice-stolen Stores",objectivesES={"Twice-stolen Stores","Ceri, the leader of the small band of frightened outcasts, is at their tiny camp on the overlook just north-west of the herd-lands.\
\
You should return to Ceri whith the stolen goods you have collected so that his folk may survive their journey through these harsh lands.","Stolen food and supplies can surely be found on the Dragon-clan scouts who invaded the farm.\
\
You should steal food-stores back from them and bring them to the starving huddle of outcasts.","The herd-lands, recently captured by the Dragon-clan, had many food-stores that were meant to feed the peaceful inhabitants of Trum Dreng. The Dragon-clan invaders have stolen a great deal of it.","Bring the stolen food to the hiding Dunlendings"}},
[14031]={nameES="Twistbeard Antidote",objectivesES={"Poisoned warriors are resting in Amdân.\
\
Edash has tasked you with administering an antidote to the poisoned warriors.","Edash is located in Amdân.\
\
Bring the antidote pouch to Edash.","Edash was able to craft an antidote to the poison, but time is running out for the afflicted.","Talk to Edash","Twistbeard Antidote"}},
[14032]={nameES="Twisted Branches",objectivesES={"Wood-trolls can be found in north-western Fangorn Forest.\
\
Quickbeam's Huorn seeks to drive the cruel wood-trolls from the forest, and would benefit from your aid.","You have defeated many wood-trolls, freeing the forest from their vile influence.","Vile wood-trolls have taken hold of Fangorn Forest, seeking to harm the woodlands and mock the Ents that reside there.","In the distance, you have discovered a group of vicious wood-trolls. They have drawn much strength from the health and hardy soil of the great forest, but would no doubt use it to vile ends.\
\
Quickbeam's Huorn rustles and shakes, eager to attack them before they can cause any harm to Fangorn.","Twisted Branches","Talk to Quickbeam's Huorn","You have slain many wood-trolls in Fangorn Forest and brought renewed peace to the woods.\
\
The Huorn's continued strikes against a fallen wood-troll suggest that it has taken a certain amount of glee in ridding the forest of these twisted mockeries of the Ents.","DNT -- Players will not see"}},
[14033]={nameES="Bosque maldito",objectivesES={"Ayuda a Erchiel en la Arboleda Maldita","Bosque maldito","Ayuda a Lithuifin en la Arboleda Maldita","Habla con Ramalarga en las Agujas de la Linde","Los elfos de las Agujas de la Linde tienen algunos planes para la Arboleda Maldita.","Ayuda a Remmenylf en la Arboleda Maldita","La Arboleda Maldita fue antaño un lugar de descanso y paz.","Ramalarga está en las Agujas de la Linde.\
\
Ramalarga querrá saber que el mal en la Arboleda Maldita es más poderoso de lo que se pensaba anteriormente."}},
[14034]={nameES="Oro retorcido",objectivesES={"Entre las ruinas de Tham Lumren, espectros fantasmales se aferran a antiguos artefactos.","Echa los brazaletes y el ramo a la pira","Se pueden encontrar espíritus retorcidos en Tham Lumren, en el noreste del Ángulo.\
\
Glatharn te ha pedido que recojas brazaletes retorcidos de los espíritus retorcidos.","La raíz pútrida retorcida se encuentra a lo largo de las riberas de los ríos que bordean el Ángulo.\
\
Glatharn te ha pedido que recojas un ramo de raíz pútrida retorcida.","Glatharn se encuentra en Tham Lumren.\
\
Deberías hablar con él.","Glatharn se encuentra en Tham Lumren.\
\
Thalathril te ha sugerido que le ofrezcas tu ayuda.","Glatharn se encuentra en Tham Lumren.\
\
Deberías llevarle los brazaletes retorcidos.","La pira está en Tham Lumren, en el este del Ángulo.\
\
Glatharn te ha pedido que eches a la pira la raíz pútrida retorcida y los brazaletes.","Vuelve con Glatharn","El aire tiene un aroma fragante y se siente más ligero, de algún modo","Glatharn se encuentra en Tham Lumren.\
\
Deberías llevarle las flores de raíz pútrida retorcida.","Oro retorcido","Habla con Glatharn"}},
[14035]={nameES="Twisted Weaves",objectivesES={}},
[14036]={nameES="Dos jefes",objectivesES={"Derrota a Gurzrum","Los dos jefes, Gurzstâz y Gurzrum, probablemente se encuentren en las Ruinas de la Cueva de Trasgos, en el tramo sur de los Pantanos de Moscagua.\
\
Bill Musgopié cree que matar a los jefes trasgos hará que el resto huya.","Habla con el vigilante Hierbaroja en Entibo","Gurzstâz derrotado","Derrota a Gurzstâz","Bill Musgopié cree que estás cerca de asestar un golpe decisivo a los trasgos en los Pantanos de Moscagua.","Bill Musgopié está en el campamento en los Pantanos de Moscagua, al sureste de las Ruinas de los Pantanos de Moscagua.\
\
Bill Musgopié estará complacido de saber de tu éxito con los dos jefes trasgos que te pidió eliminar.","Habla con Bill Musgopié","Dos jefes","Gurzrum derrotado","El vigilante Hierbaroja está en el centro de Entibo.\
\
La derrota de los jefes trasgos en los Pantanos de Moscagua debería ser un gran alivio para el vigilante Hierbaroja."}},
[14037]={nameES="Dos problemas, una herramienta",objectivesES={"Las Obras Hidráulicas son un lugar de importancia para los enanos que desean permanecer en Moria. Uno de estos enanos, el capataz Indrith, se ha propuesto reparar el canal allí.","Dos problemas, una herramienta","El capataz Indrith se encuentra en la Sala de las Ruedas, bajo la Gran Rueda.\
\
Mientras eliminabas a los orcos de las Obras Hidráulicas, algunos de ellos mencionaron que tenían miedo de que los tentáculos los arrastraran al agua fría.","Habla con el capataz Indrith en la Sala de las Ruedas","Los orcos se pueden encontrar en las Obras Hidráulicas, al este y noreste de la Gran Rueda.\
\
El capataz Indrith quiere resolver dos problemas de una sola vez. Si los orcos en las Obras Hidráulicas tienen miedo de algo, pueden mencionarlo mientras luchan."}},
[14038]={nameES="Atar cabos sueltos",objectivesES={"Habla con Cariad","Thelgarth se encuentra al sur del Refugio de los Cuan-lûth.\
\
Deberías encontrar la base de los espías en Thelgarth.","Para evitar que los espías de Saruman descubran el paradero de los Cuan-lûth, debes viajar a Thelgarth.","Destruye los informes de la espía","A Cariad le gustaría hablar contigo.","Deberías hablar sobre los próximos pasos con Cariad.","Atar cabos sueltos","Cariad levanta la vista de los informes que hay sobre la mesa","Encuentra la base de los espías en Thelgarth","Deberías destruir los informes de la espía.","Cariad deja escapar un suspiro de alivio"}},
[14039]={nameES="Atando cabos",objectivesES={"Lleva la red a Adamanda","La botella de hidromiel está en la Aljaba Repleta, en Gamwich.\
\
Pello te ha dado permiso para recoger una botella de hidromiel del almacén.","La red está colgada junto a Ramsa en Gamwich.\
\
Recoge la red y llévasela a Adamanda.","Añade nudos a la red (1/80)","Habla con Ramsa Pozuelo","Nudos añadidos a la red (1/80)","Hay miel fresca en las colmenas de la casa de Ramsa en Gamwich.\
\
Ramsa Pozuelo te ha pedido que recojas miel de sus colmenas.","No hay miel en esta colmena","Habla con Ramsa","Has recogido la botella","Pello está en la Aljaba Repleta, en Gamwich.\
\
Debes llevar la miel a Pello Lenguaciervo y cambiarla por una botella de hidromiel.","Con un rollo nuevo de cuerda en mano, gracias enteramente a que te has dejado embaucar para que lo aceptaras a cambio, Adamanda está lista para el siguiente paso de su Gran Plan.","Van dos, faltan 78","Lleva miel a Pello","Adamanda Nortuk se encuentra cerca de Nobotella.\
\
Lleva la red a Adamanda.","Recolecta miel","Ramsa Pozuelo está en Gamwich. Adamanda Nortuk te ha pedido que lleves la cuerda a Ramsa Pozuelo para que la teja en una red.","Recoge la botella de hidromiel","Tienes el presentimiento de que esto va a llevarte un tiempo...","Añade nudos a la red (3/80)","Atando cabos","La red está colgada junto a Ramsa en Gamwich.\
\
Ramsa te ha pedido ayuda para terminar los nudos de la red que está haciendo para Adamanda.","Ramsa está en Gamwich.\
\
Habla con Ramsa.","Recoge la red completa","Ramsa está en Gamwich.\
\
Lleva la hidromiel a Ramsa Pozuelo.","Añade nudos a la red (2/80)","La risa de Adamanda se apaga hasta convertirse en una risita y se aclara la garganta, intentando esconder una sonrisa.\
\
'Ahora que tenemos la cuerda, ¡podemos continuar al siguiente paso de mi Gran Plan! ¡Necesitamos una red! Llévale la cuerda a Ramsa Pozuelo en Gamwich y pídele que nos haga una red, ¿vale? Voy a seguir estas huellas un poco y me encontraré contigo en su rastro más adelante.'","Vuelve con Ramsa","Miel recolectada","Añade nudos a la red (0/80)"}},
[14040]={nameES="Tâg Fógarrach: Splintered Foes",objectivesES={}},
[14041]={nameES="El jefe de Târ Stazg",objectivesES={"Llama a Akashpug con el cuerno y dérrotalo","El jefe de Târ Stazg","Habla con Palanaer","Akashpug se encuentra en Târ Stazg, al noreste de Echad Dúnann, a lo largo de las montañas antes de la Puerta del Cuerno Rojo.\
\
Palanaer te ha dado instrucciones de llamar a Akashpug con el cuerno y derrotarlo.","Palanaer se encuentra en Echad Dúnann, al suroeste de Târ Stazg.\
\
Debes regresar a Palanaer con noticias de la derrota de Akashpug.","Akashpug derrotado","Tu incursión en Târ Stazg ha tenido el efecto contrario al esperado: Târ Stazg se está preparando para un asalto contra los Elfos de Eregion."}},
[14042]={nameES="Túmir's Great Adventure",objectivesES={"You have collected Túmir's hand-drawn treasure map","Túmir's Great Adventure","Túmir is in his father's home in northern Lamedon.\
\
You should bring everything you gathered to Túmir.","Túmir's treasure-map and stick-sword can be found in his bedroom. The small stones can be collected outside the house.\
\
You should collect everything Túmir asked for.","Fuirion is in Gladion's home in northern Lamedon.\
\
You should bring Túmir's gift to Fuirion.","Bring Túmir's gift to Fuirion","You have collected the crude stick-sword carved by Túmir","Túmir, in hopes to cheer up his uncle Fuirion and help him heal faster, has planned a treasure-seeking adventure that they can do together when Fuirion is recovered.","Bring the toys and treasure map to Túmir"}},
[14043]={nameES="Tûl Zakana, the Well of Forgetting -- Solo/Duo",objectivesES={"Bahádring has run off again. You must be close to the Well itself. Can it really make you forget everything?","Defeat Mûkh Bahora, the Mouth of Forgetting","Deep in the war-torn lands of Imhûlar, locals warn you of an Ordâkhai encampment, a trading post of sorts. It is known as Tûl Zakana, the Well of Forgetting, whose waters will make you forget your troubles, and, if you drink enough, even who you are. But unless you are trading for this water, it's best to stay well clear of the Well, for many have vanished near it, never to be seen again. You are now tasked by the families of the vanished with investigating the Well and its secrets.","Explore the marketplace of the Tûl Zakana, the Well of Forgetting.","Your senses finally come to rest back at Tûl Zakana. You must press on","As Bahádring falls you remember where you are. You smash the well to rubble so its power cannot be used or corrupted by the evil of Men again","As the brothers fall, Bahádring rushes deeper into the Well. Follow him!","Bahádring's path leads you deeper into Tûl Zakana. Steel yourself for the dangers to come and press further into the Well of Forgetting.","Defeat Bahádring the Unmindful","Tûl Zakana, the Well of Forgetting -- Solo/Duo","Defeat the Pahór-korat, the Hands of Forgetting"}},
[14044]={nameES="Tûl Zakana, the Well of Forgetting -- Tier 1",objectivesES={"Bahádring has run off again. You must be close to the Well itself. Can it really make you forget everything?","Defeat Mûkh Bahora, the Mouth of Forgetting","Tûl Zakana, the Well of Forgetting -- Tier 1","Deep in the war-torn lands of Imhûlar, locals warn you of an Ordâkhai encampment, a trading post of sorts. It is known as Tûl Zakana, the Well of Forgetting, whose waters will make you forget your troubles, and, if you drink enough, even who you are. But unless you are trading for this water, it's best to stay well clear of the Well, for many have vanished near it, never to be seen again. You are now tasked by the families of the vanished with investigating the Well and its secrets.","Explore the marketplace of the Tûl Zakana, the Well of Forgetting.","Your senses finally come to rest back at Tûl Zakana. You must press on","As Bahádring falls you remember where you are. You smash the well to rubble so its power cannot be used or corrupted by the evil of Men again","As the brothers fall, Bahádring rushes deeper into the Well. Follow him!","Defeat Bahádring the Unmindful","Bahádring's path leads you deeper into Tûl Zakana. Steel yourself for the dangers to come and press further into the Well of Forgetting.","Defeat the Pahór-korat, the Hands of Forgetting"}},
[14045]={nameES="Tûl Zakana, the Well of Forgetting -- Tier 2",objectivesES={"Tûl Zakana, the Well of Forgetting -- Tier 2","Bahádring has run off again. You must be close to the Well itself. Can it really make you forget everything?","Defeat Mûkh Bahora, the Mouth of Forgetting","Deep in the war-torn lands of Imhûlar, locals warn you of an Ordâkhai encampment, a trading post of sorts. It is known as Tûl Zakana, the Well of Forgetting, whose waters will make you forget your troubles, and, if you drink enough, even who you are. But unless you are trading for this water, it's best to stay well clear of the Well, for many have vanished near it, never to be seen again. You are now tasked by the families of the vanished with investigating the Well and its secrets.","Explore the marketplace of the Tûl Zakana, the Well of Forgetting.","Your senses finally come to rest back at Tûl Zakana. You must press on","As Bahádring falls you remember where you are. You smash the well to rubble so its power cannot be used or corrupted by the evil of Men again","As the brothers fall, Bahádring rushes deeper into the Well. Follow him!","Defeat Bahádring the Unmindful","Bahádring's path leads you deeper into Tûl Zakana. Steel yourself for the dangers to come and press further into the Well of Forgetting.","Defeat the Pahór-korat, the Hands of Forgetting"}},
[14046]={nameES="Tûl Zakana, the Well of Forgetting -- Tier 3",objectivesES={"Bahádring has run off again. You must be close to the Well itself. Can it really make you forget everything?","Defeat Mûkh Bahora, the Mouth of Forgetting","Deep in the war-torn lands of Imhûlar, locals warn you of an Ordâkhai encampment, a trading post of sorts. It is known as Tûl Zakana, the Well of Forgetting, whose waters will make you forget your troubles, and, if you drink enough, even who you are. But unless you are trading for this water, it's best to stay well clear of the Well, for many have vanished near it, never to be seen again. You are now tasked by the families of the vanished with investigating the Well and its secrets.","Explore the marketplace of the Tûl Zakana, the Well of Forgetting.","Tûl Zakana, the Well of Forgetting -- Tier 3","Your senses finally come to rest back at Tûl Zakana. You must press on","As Bahádring falls you remember where you are. You smash the well to rubble so its power cannot be used or corrupted by the evil of Men again","As the brothers fall, Bahádring rushes deeper into the Well. Follow him!","Defeat Bahádring the Unmindful","Bahádring's path leads you deeper into Tûl Zakana. Steel yourself for the dangers to come and press further into the Well of Forgetting.","Defeat the Pahór-korat, the Hands of Forgetting"}},
