[14052]={nameES="Ugrukhôr's Coward",objectivesES={"After repelling many of Ugrukhôr's forces, the Rangers of Ithilien saw one of his Uruk-hai make for Bâr Maenath.","Ugrukhôr's Coward","The trail of blood leads through Bâr Maenath.\
\
You discovered a puddle of black blood trailing off into Bâr Maenath. You should follow it and defeat the Uruk that escaped Maendal and his men.","Follow the trail of black blood through Bâr Maenath","It seems the uruk that escaped Maendal's men met its end in Bâr Maenath","The Rangers of Ithilien need not fear the return of this uruk, but Ugrukhôr's forces still swell within the Dead City.","Enter Bâr Maenath","The black blood leads deeper into Bâr Maenath","You notice drops of black blood tracked through Bâr Maenath","Completado","You have found Ugrukhôr's uruk slain in Bâr Maenath.","Bâr Maenath can be found in the western reaches of the Circle of Death.\
\
Maendal has asked you to track one of Ugrukhôr's Uruks into Bâr Maenath and defeat it."}},
[14053]={nameES="Ugrukhôr's Loyal",objectivesES={"Orcs and Uruks can be found at Mauzur.\
\
You should defeat as many Orcs and Uruks as possible.","You have defeated many of the Orcs and Uruks who reside in Dâr Mauzur, weakening Ugrukhôr's forces.","Ugrukhôr's Loyal","The encampment stretches a great distance along the base of the Morgai. It is sparsely populated with many who served under Ugrukhôr before the fall of Sauron. These foes should be dealt with before Ugrukhôr is able to turn his attention to reclaiming his former forces.","Defeated many Orcs and Uruks at Dâr Mauzur.","Defeat Orcs and Uruks at Dâr Mauzur","Dâr Mauzur is sparsely populated with many who served under Ugrukhôr before the fall of Sauron.","Orcs and Uruks can be found at Dâr Mauzur.\
\
You should defeat as many Orcs and Uruks as possible.","Completado"}},
[14054]={nameES="Ugturu the Half-troll",objectivesES={"Defeat Ugturu the Half-Troll quickly","<rgb=#FF0000>Defeat Ugturu before he tires of fighting and leaves</rgb>","Defeat Ugturu the Half-Troll quickly, before he does colossal damage.","<rgb=#FF0000>You have left Ugturu unchallenged for too long.</rgb>","The Half-troll brute, Ugturu, has come into the area. If left unchecked he will wreak colossal havoc. Dispense with him as quickly as possible.\
\
This quest starts with <rgb=#FFFF00>empty</rgb> Merit Rating.\
\
<rgb=#00FF00>Merit Gain:</rgb>\
* Defeat Ugturu\
* Defeat Ugturu quickly","Ugturu the Half-troll"}},
[14055]={nameES="Ugturu the Half-troll",objectivesES={"Defeat Ugturu the Half-Troll quickly","<rgb=#FF0000>Defeat Ugturu before he tires of fighting and leaves</rgb>","Defeat Ugturu the Half-Troll quickly, before he does colossal damage.","<rgb=#FF0000>You have left Ugturu unchallenged for too long.</rgb>","The Half-troll brute, Ugturu, has come into the area. If left unchecked he will wreak colossal havoc. Dispense with him as quickly as possible.\
\
This quest starts with <rgb=#FFFF00>empty</rgb> Merit Rating.\
\
<rgb=#00FF00>Merit Gain:</rgb>\
* Defeat Ugturu\
* Defeat Ugturu quickly","Ugturu the Half-troll"}},
[14056]={nameES="Uiliúr, the Ancient Evil",objectivesES={"Defeat Uiliúr","You have slain Uiliúr and vanquished a threat to the safety of all those who brave Mordor.","Completado","Find Uiliúr","In disrupting the various forces gathered in Gorgoroth, a Caerog has risen out of the lava lake of Ghâshghurm. You should defeat this evil before someone else finds it and Uiliúr regains its full strength.","Uiliúr can be found somewhere in the Ghâshghurm.\
\
You should awake and defeat Uiliúr.","Defeated Uiliúr","The rocks begin to move as the Caerog springs to life","A strange rock formation stands in front of you","Uiliúr, the Ancient Evil","In disrupting the various forces gathered in Gorgoroth, a Caerog has risen out of the lava lake of Ghâshghurm.","You have defeated Uiliúr."}},
