[14059]={nameES="Tarea de Umbar: Garra tocada por la salmuera",objectivesES={"Entrega las garras tocadas por la salmuera en una caja de recolección","Se busca: garras tocadas por la salmuera de Umbar o de los confines de Gondor.","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir garras tocadas por la salmuera.","Se busca: garras tocadas por la salmuera de Gondor. Reúnelas para ganar una recompensa adecuada para los coleccionistas.","Se busca: garras tocadas por la salmuera de Umbar. Reúnelas para ganar una recompensa adecuada para los coleccionistas.","Tarea de Umbar: Garra tocada por la salmuera","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Alguien ha publicado una tarea para recoger garras tocadas por la salmuera. Se pueden entregar a cambio de una recompensa."}},
[14060]={nameES="Tarea de Umbar: Oreja tocada por la salmuera",objectivesES={"Se busca: orejas tocadas por la salmuera de Umbar o de los confines de Gondor.","Tarea de Umbar: Oreja tocada por la salmuera","Se busca: orejas tocadas por la salmuera de Gondor. Reúnelas para ganar una recompensa adecuada para los coleccionistas.","Entrega las orejas tocadas por la salmuera en una caja de recolección","Alguien ha publicado una tarea para recoger orejas tocadas por la salmuera. Se pueden entregar a cambio de una recompensa.","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir orejas tocadas por la salmuera.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Se busca: orejas tocadas por la salmuera de Umbar. Reúnelas para ganar una recompensa adecuada para los coleccionistas."}},
[14061]={nameES="Tarea de Umbar: Vainas de alfanje corroídas",objectivesES={"Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir vainas de alfanje corroídas.","Se busca: vainas de alfanje corroídas de Gondor. Reúnelas para ganar una recompensa adecuada para los coleccionistas.","Tarea de Umbar: Vainas de alfanje corroídas","Se busca: vainas de alfanje corroídas de Umbar o de los confines de Gondor.","Entrega las vainas de alfanje corroídas en una caja de recolección","Se busca: vainas de alfanje corroídas de Umbar. Reúnelas para ganar una recompensa adecuada para los coleccionistas.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Alguien ha publicado una tarea para recoger vainas de alfanje corroídas. Se pueden entregar a cambio de una recompensa."}},
[14062]={nameES="Tarea de Umbar: Masa salada",objectivesES={"Se busca: masa salada de Gondor. Reúnelo para ganar una recompensa adecuada para los coleccionistas.","Entrega los montones de masa salada en una caja de recolección","Se busca: masa salada de Umbar o de los confines de Gondor.","Se busca: masa salada de Umbar. Reúnelo para ganar una recompensa adecuada para los coleccionistas.","Tarea de Umbar: Masa salada","Alguien ha publicado una tarea para recoger masa salada. Se puede entregar a cambio de una recompensa.","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir masa salada.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú."}},
[14063]={nameES="Tarea de Umbar: Piel arrojada por el mar",objectivesES={"Alguien ha publicado una tarea para recoger pieles arrojadas por el mar. Se pueden entregar a cambio de una recompensa.","Se busca: pieles arrojadas por el mar de Umbar o de los confines de Gondor.","Tarea de Umbar: Piel arrojada por el mar","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir pieles arrojadas por el mar.","Se busca: pieles arrojadas por el mar de Gondor. Reúnelas para ganar una recompensa adecuada para los coleccionistas.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Entrega las pieles arrojadas por el mar en una caja de recolección","Se busca: pieles arrojadas por el mar de Umbar. Reúnelas para ganar una recompensa adecuada para los coleccionistas."}},
[14064]={nameES="Umbar and Osgiliath",objectivesES={"You beckon as Forlong indicated","The Houses of Lore are in the Fifth Circle.\
\
Forlong wants to hold his old war trophy, which is kept in the Houses of Lore.","The Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle.\
\
Try to <rgb=#FF0000>smoke</rgb> as Thorongil did, in front of Forlong and his friends in the Merry Swan.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This objective requires emotes.</rgb>","The Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle.\
\
Ask Forlong how you did with the impression.","The Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle.\
\
Hear Forlong's reply.","Try to <rgb=#FF0000>beckon</rgb> as Thorongil did","Listen to Hirluin","Listen to Neldir","Ask Imadan about the song","The Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle.\
\
Hear what Hirluin has to say.","The Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle.\
\
Gather knives from around the Merry Swan so that Hirluin can show how he threw them at corsairs in Umbar.","Talk to Forlong","Imadan, Golasgil, Aglarang, and Bariel can all be found in the Second and Third Circle of Minas Tirith.\
\
Speak to the people Forlong named and see if they can remember any of Authlin's song.","Ask Golasgil about the song","The Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle.\
\
Bring the knives to Hirluin, so he can show how he threw them at the Corsairs of Umbar.","Bring Hirluin the knives","Raise a glass","Ask Aglarang about the song","The Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle.\
\
Go tell Imadan the barkeep that Forlong wants another course of food.","The Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle.\
\
Bring the war trophy back to Forlong, in the Merry Swan.","Try to <rgb=#FF0000>sigh</rgb> as Thorongil did","Return to Forlong","Ask Imadan for another course","The Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle.\
\
Try to make a solemn face (<rgb=#FF0000>mood_solemn</rgb>) as Thorongil did, in front of Forlong and his friends in the Merry Swan.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This objective requires emotes.</rgb>","The Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle.\
\
Try to <rgb=#FF0000>sigh</rgb> as Thorongil did, in front of Forlong and his friends in the Merry Swan.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This objective requires emotes.</rgb>","You sigh in a grave, melancholy manner","The Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle.\
\
Listen to Forlong's reply.","The Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle.\
\
Try to <rgb=#FF0000>beckon</rgb> as Thorongil did, in front of Forlong and his friends in the Merry Swan.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This objective requires emotes.</rgb>","The Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle.\
\
Hear what Forlong has to say.","Try to show a solemn face, as Thorongil did","Listen to Forlong","Try to <rgb=#FF0000>smoke</rgb> as Thorongil did","Umbar and Osgiliath","You adopt a stern, brooding expression","The Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle.\
\
Return to Forlong, in the Merry Swan, to tell him food is on its way.","The Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle.\
\
Hear to what Hirluin has to say.","Forlong and his friends are in the Merry Swan, in the Third Circle of Minas Tirith.\
\
Raise a glass to friendship with Forlong and company.","The Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle.\
\
Hear what Neldir has to say.","The Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle.\
\
Return to Lord Forlong with what you have learned of the song.","Lord Forlong sits in the Merry Swan, drinking with his old friends Lord Hirluin and one Neldir of Minas Tirith. The conversation turns to stories of prior wars that Gondor has known, and the heroic roles they played in them.","The Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle.\
\
Ask Forlong how your impression came off.","Ask Bariel about the song","You smoke your pipe, squinting thoughtfully","You recite and hum what you were able to gather. Lord Forlong closes his eyes and thinks.\
\
'Yes, yes, my friend. I think it is enough. Let us see. Ahem!\
\
When o'er mountain sun comes rising\
With stirring heart and restless feet\
I'll find myself this home despising\
And yearn for distant lands to meet\
\
I'll fly away, I will not stay\
Seeking fortune, love, and war\
I'll fly away and further roam\
But I will never turn back home\
No I shall wend back there no more\
No more, no more, no more, no more....\
\
'There! So sad and sweet. There were other verses of course. Love was won and lost. Battles and fortunes, too.'","The Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle.\
\
See if Hirluin can remember any of the song.","Retrieved the war trophy","Retrieve the war trophy"}},
[14065]={nameES="Umbari Tâm for Embers",objectivesES={}},
[14066]={nameES="Unaccompanied Miners",objectivesES={"Unaccompanied Miners","Daf, Edar, Galvin, Hadun, and Idwal all live within Barnavon.\
\
Gwilum has instructed you to summon the workers Daf, Edar, Galvin, Hadun, and Idwal to the Barnavon Mine.","Many workers at the Barnavon Mine were wounded or slain when the mine was overrun by bugan. More miners are needed to restore operations.","Talk to Gwilum in Barnavon","Gwilum is at the gate to Barnavon.\
\
You should return to Gwilum with the workers' answers."}},
[14067]={nameES="Unbridled Wrath",objectivesES={}},
[14068]={nameES="Unbridled Wrath -- Repeatable",objectivesES={"Thane Béortnoth is camped outside the ruins of Thornhope.\
\
You should speak with Béortnoth regarding the last attack on Thornhope.","Thane Béortnoth is camped beyond the walls of Thornhope.\
\
You should speak with Béortnoth when you are ready to attack Thornhope.","Accompany Thane Béortnoth to the ruins of Thornhope","You have helped assail the Orcs at Thornhope","Talk to Thane Béortnoth outside Thornhope","Unbridled Wrath -- Repeatable","So great are the numbers of the Orcs that one assault on the ruins of Thornhope is not enough to drive out the Enemy."}},
[14069]={nameES="Unconvincing Innocence",objectivesES={"Idhrenfair's curiosity has been roused by the grave-stones. He believes that something went amiss in this town if it is filled with such restless shades.","Return to Idhrenfair with the evidence","Find a shade in Audaghaim who will speak with you","The Ranger Idhrenfair awaits you in the Haunted Inn in the Dourstocks, west of Audaghaim.\
\
You should return to Idhrenfair and convey the words of the shade to whom you spoke.","Shades can be found in Audaghaim, east of the Haunted Inn in the Dourstocks.\
\
Idhrenfair would like you to glean information from any shade in Audaghaim who is not hostile.","Unconvincing Innocence"}},
[14070]={nameES="Uncovering Battle Plans",objectivesES={"Return to Galâmka with the battle plans","Galâmka has asked that you venture into Maurûsh again, this time to defeat Orcs and gather any information you can about their battle plans.","Uncovering Battle Plans","Bring the battle plans back to Galâmka in Ub Nisihir to the north of Maurûsh.","Galâmka asked you to retrieve any battle plans you can from the Orcs in Maurûsh."}},
[14071]={nameES="Uncovering Supplies",objectivesES={}},
[14072]={nameES="Uncovering the Well",objectivesES={"Scout Tûl Zakana, the Well of Forgetting, from the north, west, and east. Tûl Zakana is far to the east of Dag Usakâra. It can be found south-east of the Crypts of Esh-kimâkhi.","Scout Tûl Zakana from the high rock across the way","Scout Tûl Zakana from the closer rock outcropping across from it","Return to Usakâr at Dag Usakâra with your report.","Usakâr asks you to scout the perimeter of Tûl Zakana, the Well of Forgetting, to learn more about it and the Shagâni who inhabit the Well.","Scout Tûl Zakana from the northern woods below it","Return to Usakâr at Dag Usakâra","You see a small outdoor market, where jugs of water are sold","Uncovering the Well","You see a bustle of people, traders and Ordâkhai","You see only high walls, with flashes of colour through the thick slats"}},
[14073]={nameES="Bajo ataque",objectivesES={"Kôkas-karju derrotado","Habla con Matti","El Kantâ-vilkku está al sur de Sûri-kylä en Jä-rannit, en los ventisqueros sobre la bahía de Forochel.\
\
Matti te ha pedido que busques en las cajas rotas signos del animal que atacó el Kantâ-vilkku, lo rastrees y termines con él.","Matti está en Sûri-kylä, al norte del Kantâ-vilkku.\
\
Deberías volver a ver a Matti con las noticias de tu éxito.","Bajo ataque","Inspecciona las cajas y derrota al animal","Has reabastecido el Kantâ-vilkku, pero Matti teme que otras balizas hayan sido dañadas."}},
[14074]={nameES="Under New Management",objectivesES={"Complete 'New Hires'","Talk to Dornach","Dornach asked you to help folks around the lumber camp.\
\
Complete quests in the lumber camp.","Dervorin would like you to speak to Dornach.\
\
Talk to Dornach at the lumber camp, east of Ethring.","Dravron has been arrested. The lumber camp has been handed over to the labourers, who know best how to operate it. Lumber is beginning to ship out to where it's needed at a more than fair price.","Complete 'Not All at Once'","Complete 'Wolves in the Woods'","Under New Management","Complete 'Ethring Herbs'","Complete 'Not on an Empty Stomach'"}},
[14075]={nameES="Under a Wicked Crown",objectivesES={"Eitur can likely be found in Zôreth's chambers on the highest level of the Oath-taker's Horn.\
\
You have found all of Spakorth's brethren except for Eitur. You should now seek him and defeat him if need be.","Under a Wicked Crown","Find Dréri","Confront Eitur","Dréri, Náth, and Freki can likely be found on the central level of the Oath-taker's Horn amidst the Firehorn barracks.\
\
Sversting proved fiercely loyal to King Greytooth's quest and fought you valiantly. You should now seek Dréri, Náth, and Freki in the Firehorn barracks above.","Tragically, Freki appears to have been slain by his own kin...","Sversting can likely be found about the forges on the lowest level of the Oath-taker's Horn.\
\
Spakorth has asked you to seek his brethren with the Oath-taker's Horn. Since you are entering at the lowest level of the Spire, you should first seek Sversting and see if he might be convinced to abandon Váskmun Greytooth's quest for the dwarf-rings.","Spakorth can be found in the doorway to Zôreth's chambers alongside Gimli.\
\
You have found all of Spakorth's brethren, but unfortunately Sversting and Eitur proved unwilling to abandon their King's quest. You should now speak to Spakorth in the Oath-breaker's Horn.","After King Greytooth seized control of the Flaming Spire, Spakorth fears what may have become of his brethren in the Oath-taker's Horn.","Regrettably, Sversting could not be turned from his loyalty to King Greytooth...","Find Freki","Talk to Spakorth in the Oath-breaker's Horn","Find Sversting","Ever the lickspittle, Eitur's eagerness to forsake his allegiances brought him to a sorry end...","Find Náth"}},
[14076]={nameES="Under the Crescent Moon",objectivesES={}},
[14077]={nameES="Under the Fires of Orodruin",objectivesES={}},
[14078]={nameES="Under the Mountain",objectivesES={"Under the Mountain","King Thorin III's throne can be found in the rear of the Hall Under the Mountain.\
\
You have been asked to join Gimli before King Thorin's throne in Erebor.","Erebor, the Lonely Mountain, has long been the home of the Dwarves of Durin's Folk.","Gimli is standing before King Thorin's throne in the Hall Under the Mountain.\
\
You have approached King Thorin's throne and found Gimli waiting patiently. You should speak to him.","Talk to Gimli before King Thorin III's throne","Approach King Thorin III's throne in the Hall Under the Mountain","You have found Gimli standing patiently before King Thorin's throne..."}},
[14079]={nameES="Under the Order",objectivesES={"Completado","You have stood firm against the Order of the Eye in Barad-dûr, and defeated many of their number.","Seekers, torturers, and wardens of the Order of the Eye can be found throughout the ruins of Barad-dûr.\
\
While searching for Váskmun Greytooth in the ruins of Barad-dûr, you have discovered a large assemblage of cultists serving the Order of the Eye. You should defeat them.","You have loosened the grip of the Order of the Eye on the bones of Barad-dûr as well as that of any prisoners still held in the dungeons of the Dark Lord.\
\
Although it is likely the Order shall send reinforcements soon, you have done well to disrupt their efforts in Dor Amarth.","While searching for King Váskmun Greytooth in the bones of Barad-dûr, you have discovered a large assemblage of cultists serving the Order of the Eye. Some of them appear to be frantically searching the crumbling dungeons and halls of the Dark Lord's tower, while others have still held to their duties as torturers and wardens in service of Sauron.\
\
You should defeat them and weaken their grip on the ruins of Barad-dûr.","Defeat an Order of the Eye warden in Barad-dûr","Under the Order","The Order of the Eye has seized what remains of Barad-dûr in search of its secrets, and the Order now holds the Dark Lord's prisoners as its own."}},
[14080]={nameES="Under the Shadow",objectivesES={"Talk to Steward Malthellim","Angered that the Corsairs have crossed the river Serni, Steward Malthellim hopes to drive them back to the coast.","Steward Malthellim can be found in the Lord's Hall in Ost Anglebed.\
\
You have defeated many Corsairs outside Ost Anglebed and weakened their advance across the river Serni.","Corsairs can be found to the south and east of Ost Anglebed.\
\
Steward Malthellim has asked you to defeat Corsairs that have crossed the Serni before they can invade Ost Anglebed.","Under the Shadow"}},
[14081]={nameES="Under the Watch of Carchost",objectivesES={"Enter the enemy encampment of Fushaum Gund","Defeated many Orcs in Fushaum Gund.","The Orc encampment of Fushaum Gund is located on the eastern slopes of the Slag-hills.\
\
You should defeat Orcs in the encampment.","Under the Watch of Carchost","Completado","You find the enemy encampment of Fushaum Gund is densely populated with the Orc forces of Mordor. Perhaps thinning their numbers will help the Rangers in the Slag-hills.","You have defeated many Orcs in Fushaum Gund. This should reduce their numbers around the Slag-hills.","You take it upon yourself to thin the number of Orcs gathered at the encampment of Fushaum Gund."}},
[14082]={nameES="Under the Watchful Eye",objectivesES={"Talk to Thane Cútha","Meregyth feels that it would be best to seek the assistance of Thane Cútha while within the walls of Beaconwatch before any further action is taken against the Boar-tribe Orcs.","Talk to Meregyth","Thane Cútha is in the Beaconwatch Mead Hall.\
\
Meregyth wants you to speak with Thane Cútha to see what sort of assistance he can provide to Fenmarch.","Under the Watchful Eye","Meregyth is in Beaconwatch, near the Mead Hall.\
\
Thane Cútha has refused to offer assistance to you and Meregyth or send aid to Fenmarch, but has allowed you to act as you see fit. You should return to Meregyth and give her the unfortunate news."}},
[14083]={nameES="Under the White Mountain",objectivesES={}},
[14084]={nameES="Underground Orcs",objectivesES={}},
[14085]={nameES="Undermining Ushkútoz",objectivesES={"Agnar Brokentooth can be found at Ifbar-athrâkh.\
\
You have aided Agnar's companions and scouted much of the battlefield in the War of Three Peaks. You should report to Agnar Brokentooth.","Talk to Agnar Brokentooth","Aid Agnar with 'Ruthless and Ramshackle'","Agnar Brokentooth can be found outside the western entrance to Ushkútoz.\
\
You have succeeded in defeating Kraznákh and undermining Gorgar's plans to keep the Gabil'akkâ locked in a bloody stalemate. You should talk to Agnar.","Scout the western entrance to Ushkútoz","Determined to break a bloody stalemate, Agnar Brokentooth has devised a plan to infiltrate the Orkish trench-tunnel of Ushkútoz.","Bloody fighting rages in the eastern pass, as dwarves work to undermine frost-tusks and siege engines","Aid Lági with 'To Fight Another Day'","Scout the eastern entrance to Ushkútoz","Aid Reithvald with 'Embedded in the Battlefield'","Agnar Brokentooth, Lági Helmbiter, and Reithvald Red-ember can be found at Ifbar-athrâkh. Zudramdân can be found to the north of the trenches outside Ifbar-athrâkh, and entrances to Ushkútoz can be found hidden in a trench near to Zudramdân and along the western road through Elderslade.\
\
Agnar Brokentooth has ordered you to aid the other veterans of the Sixth War of the Orcs and Dwarves in breaking a stalemate in the battlefield around Zudramdân. You should also scout the eastern and western passes by Zudramdân and learn more of the Orkish trench-tunnel, Ushkútoz.","Agnar Brokentooth can be found at Ifbar-athrâkh.\
\
Agnar, Lági, and Reithvald are ready to launch an attack on Ushkútoz in hopes of assassinating the Orc-captain, Kraznákh. You should talk to Agnar Brokentooth when you are prepared.","Scout the eastern pass around Zudramdân","Scout the western pass around Zudramdân","The Orcs' defences remain largely intact in the western pass","Nestled within a small trench, the eastern entrance to Ushkútoz is defended by a few Orcs","Tucked into a cleft beside the road to Gundabad, the western entrance to Ushkútoz is poorly-defended","Undermining Ushkútoz","Talk to Agnar Brokentooth at the western entrance to Ushkútoz"}},
[14086]={nameES="Restos sin perturbaciones",objectivesES={"Los osos de la tundra pueden encontrarse por toda Länsi-mâ.\
\
Mika te ha pedido que ahuyentes a varios osos de la tundra.","Restos sin perturbaciones","Mika se encuentra en Norsu-hauta.\
\
Ahora que has derrotado a muchos osos de la tundra, deberías regresar con Mika","Los grandes osos blancos de Länsi-mâ a menudo merodean entre los restos de mamuts, lo que puede hacer que las manadas se alejen.","Habla con Mika"}},
[14087]={nameES="Undying Memory",objectivesES={"Talk to Calendorion","Calendorion has asked you to pick a certain type of flower to put in the vase.\
\
You can find these beautiful flowers near the piers in Edhellond.","You should ask the Avorrim around Edhellond what kind of flowers to put in the now-empty vase.","Undying Memory","You should tell Calendorion that he need not worry about the vase's flowers for now.\
\
He can be found at one of the piers in Edhellond, facing the Bay of Belfalas.","In Edhellond, you discovered a vase filled with dead flowers.","Talk to Lathlorn","Place flowers in the empty vase","You have picked enough flowers to fill the vase.\
\
You should return to the tower in Edhellond to place them into the vase.","Talk to Breniriel","The vase is filled with beautiful flowers once more","The flowers in this vase have been dead for a while. As you discard the dead flowers, it occurs to you that you could replace them with fresher ones.\
\
Perhaps one of the Avorrim could suggest which flowers to use.","Talk to Cellineth","You have been advised to talk to an Elf named Calendorion.\
\
You can find him at one of the piers in Edhellond, facing the Bay of Belfalas."}},
[14088]={nameES="Unearthing Trouble",objectivesES={"Neeker-breekers have been digging under Fangorn Forest, loosening the soil and wreaking havoc on the trees above.","As you look around, you notice the earth beneath you has been violently disturbed. Before you can think on this further, a neeker-breeker burrows out from the ground under Quickbeam's Huorn and is almost immediately crushed by one its enormous roots.\
\
The soil displaced by the neeker-breeker appears dry and lifeless. You should investigate disturbed earth and prevent them from causing harm to the forest floor.","Despite inadvertently revealing a number of roots, you have successfully culled the population of neeker-breekers back to a more reasonable level, and Quickbeam's Huorn appears far less agitated. Through your efforts, the soil of Fangorn Forest shall remain rich and give rise to new life.","Neeker-breekers can be found in northern Fangorn Forest.\
\
Quickbeam's Huorn has asked for your aid in culling neeker-breekers before they can cause any more harm to the rich soil of the forest.","Talk to Quickbeam's Huorn","You have defeated many neeker-breekers and aided in preserving the forest's soil.","Unearthing Trouble","DNT -- Players will not see"}},
[14089]={nameES="Unexpected Allies",objectivesES={}},
[14090]={nameES="Unexpected Compliance",objectivesES={"Men who can help ready the town can be found near the front gate of Grimslade.\
\
You should give orders to ready for an attack.","The bedding is clean, and better than many prisoners would hope to receive","The prisoner anxiously calls you back","The half-orc prisoner is held captive in the jail of Grimslade.\
\
You should examine the cell of the prisoner for signs of maltreatment.","Speak with the half-orc prisoner","The prisoner is eager to be freed from his cell","Warn Frithferth","The half-orc prisoner is held captive in the jail of Grimslade.\
\
Say <rgb=#FF0000>bye</rgb> and take your leave of the prisoner.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>EMOTE: Select the target and perform the emote to advance this quest.</rgb>","Warn the guard at the front gate","The half-orc prisoner is held captive in the jail of Grimslade, which is behind the Mead Hall.\
\
You should speak with the half-orc prisoner.","The half-orc brought in by Húnbrit has asked to treat with you in the jail of Grimslade.","Speak with Hildith","Scraps of recently-eaten food are plainly visible on this plate","The half-orc prisoner is held captive in the jail of Grimslade.\
\
You should speak with the half-orc prisoner.","Hildith is in the Mead Hall of Grimslade.\
\
You should speak with Hildith.","Speak with the prisoner","Half-orcs are coming to burn Grimslade! There is no time to lose","Say <rgb=#FF0000>bye</rgb> and take your leave","The prisoner claims that the Rohirrim have mistreated him","Unexpected Compliance"}},
[14091]={nameES="Unexpected Executions",objectivesES={"Talk to Halhir","Determined to avenge the lost Rangers of Ithilien, Halhir sends you to Meneldil's Square to perform a few executions of your own.","Halhir can be found in the culverts of Osgiliath.\
\
You have defeated many of the half-troll executioners and should now return to Halhir.","Half-troll executioners can be found near Meneldil's Square in western Osgiliath.\
\
Halhir has asked you to defeat half-troll executioners in western Osgiliath to avenge his fallen brothers.","Unexpected Executions"}},
[14092]={nameES="Unexpected Help",objectivesES={"Unexpected Help","Aighrig keeps watch at the overlook near the Greylin River.\
\
You should let her know when you are ready to help with her task.","Talk to Rékkur","Talk to Aighrig","Aighrig, the person who led you to Gáfin's body, has asked you to help her prevent further Orkish attacks on dwarf supply trains.","There are fewer Orcs near the road now, thanks to your efforts and Aighrig's.\
\
You should check in with her.","Use the whistle to summon Aighrig to your side","Rékkur stands guard at Annâk-khurfu.\
\
He will want to hear what you've learned.","Gundabad scouts roam near the road east of Annâk-khurfu.\
\
The scouts are responsible for signaling attacks on dwarves' supply trains. Defeating them may make the road safer."}},
[14093]={nameES="Unexpected Stewards",objectivesES={"While the War of Three Peaks rages throughout Elderslade, you have discovered a large force of Dourhands occupying Caivád Sâr.\
\
Far fewer Angmarim loyal to the Iron Crown appear to dwell within the settlement, and the route by which the Dourhands arrived in Elderslade remains unclear. However, it seems the Dourhands' wickedness has not abated since your earlier encounters with them.\
\
You should defeat many of the wicked Dourhands occupying Caivád Sâr.","After mysteriously arriving in Elderslade during the War of Three Peaks, a force of Dourhands has occupied the Angmarim settlement of Caivád Sâr.","Dourhands can be found at Caivád Sâr and within Tûr Ágal.\
\
You have discovered a force of wicked Dourhands occupying Caivád Sâr. You should defeat them.","You have defeated many of the wicked Dourhands occupying Caivád Sâr.","Completado","You have defeated many of the wicked Dourhands occupying Caivád Sâr.\
\
It remains unclear where the Dourhands came from, but they seem to be many in number. It appears much has transpired since they sought to form an alliance with Angmar in the early days of the War of the Ring.","Unexpected Stewards"}},
[14094]={nameES="Un tesoro inesperado",objectivesES={"Has encontrado un peto ornamentado de una armadura pesada, antigua pero de magnífica artesanía y con marcas de garras, aparentemente abandonado. Quizá quieras averiguar más sobre él.","Un tesoro inesperado","Has encontrado un peto ornamentado de una armadura pesada, antigua pero de magnífica artesanía y con marcas de garras, aparentemente abandonado. Quizá quieras averiguar más sobre él.\
\
Quizás un enano de la Cámara de la Encrucijada pueda saber algo más.","Quizá quieras preguntarle a alguien en la Cámara de la Encrucijada sobre la armadura que has encontrado.","Habla con Rambi en la Cámara de la Encrucijada"}},
[14095]={nameES="Unfair Trade",objectivesES={"Unfair Trade","Kenbert of Entwade hopes to work against the Uruks of the White Hand in Kingstead and reclaim lost goods.","Talk to Thane Edric","Uruk-hai Ambushers can be found along the road to Middlemead to the north-west of Entwade.\
\
Kenbert has asked that you recover the goods stolen by the Uruk-hai along the trade route to Middlemead. He believes that the Uruks that patrol the road will have pillaged the carts of passers-by.","Thane Edric can be found inside the Mead Hall of Entwade in eastern Kingstead.\
\
You have recovered the goods stolen by the Uruk-hai along the road to Middlemead. You should now return them to Entwade and speak to Thane Edric."}},
[14096]={nameES="Unfinished Business",objectivesES={"Talk to Mekhnet","Mekhnet has decided to strike Atrad-zarakh with you.\
\
She waits at Ashmargathâl.","Unfinished Business","Mekhnet has something to say before Lúka can continue fretting.","You have returned to Ashmargathâl.\
\
Lúka will want to know everything that's happened.","Talk to Lúka","Mekhnet is intent on hunting down the goblin Thraunákh."}},
[14097]={nameES="Unfit for Orcs",objectivesES={"Fish-filled nets can be found along the river Entwash to the south-east of Entwade in eastern Kingstead. \
\
Magenred has asked that you recover any fish nets that have not been destroyed with the arrival of Orcs in the Kingstead.","Talk to Thane Edric","Thane Edric can be found in the Mead Hall of Entwade in eastern Kingstead.\
\
You have recovered a great many fish from the river Entwash. You should now return them to Thane Edric so they can be distributed to his men.","Unfit for Orcs","With dwindling supplies, the men of Kingstead cling to whatever rations and weapons they can muster."}},
[14098]={nameES="Unfortunate Accidents",objectivesES={"Hûzo asked that you look at the support beams around the fort for signs of wear or cracking. If you find any, Hûzo asked you to repair the damaged supports.","Unfortunate Accidents","Hûzo asked you to check the stone supports around the town for signs of wear and to repair any cracks.","Nearly all of the supports you examined were damaged or in a state of disrepair. You should return to Hûzo and inform him of this discovery."}},
[14099]={nameES="Cosecha desafortunada",objectivesES={"Los árboles corruptos pueden encontrarse en lo profundo de las Quebradas de los Túmulos del Sur, en las lindes del Bosque Viejo.\
\
Bob Cardorojo te pidió que te ocuparas de la amenaza de los árboles corruptos que se encuentran en las Quebradas de los Túmulos del Sur, donde los túmulos se encuentran con el Bosque Viejo.","Cosecha desafortunada","Bob Cardorojo está acampado en el Alto del Hombre Muerto.\
\
Bob Cardorojo espera tu regreso y la información sobre los árboles que te envió a destruir en las Quebradas de los Túmulos del Sur.","Habla con Bob Cardorojo en el Alto del Hombre Muerto","Árboles corruptos en las Quebradas de los Túmulos del Sur, liberados de los límites del Bosque Viejo, han caído en la corrupción."}},
[14100]={nameES="Unfortunate Orcs",objectivesES={}},
[14101]={nameES="Miradas hostiles en Ost Forod",objectivesES={"Miradas hostiles en Ost Forod","Te ha detectado un individuo hostil","Evita ser visto por individuos hostiles","El cofre de reliquias está en las tiendas del nivel superior de Ost Forod, al norte de Robin Sotopardo.\
\
Robin Sotopardo te ha pedido que encuentres un cofre de reliquias robadas y lo lleves al montaraz Astiul en Tinnudir, evitando las miradas de la gente hostil de Ost Forod.","Robin Sotopardo está preocupado por la presencia de reliquias robadas de Annúminas en Ost Forod y quiere que las devuelvas a sus legítimos propietarios, los montaraces de Tinnudir.","Astiul está en el campamento de montaraces de la isla de Tinnudir, en Evendim.\
\
Robin Sotopardo te ha pedido que hables con Asitul después de entregar el cofre de reliquias robadas.","Recupera el cofre de reliquias","Has entregado el cofre de reliquias a Astiul","Robin Sotopardo está en Ost Forod, al noreste de Tinnudir.\
\
El montaraz Astiul te ha pedido que vuelvas con Robin Sotopardo con su agradecimiento por la entrega de reliquias robadas."}},
[14102]={nameES="Deber incompleto",objectivesES={"Deber incompleto","Ost Heryn es una antigua fortaleza construida para apoyar a Fornost. Sin embargo, en momentos de necesidad, su líder traicionó su juramento.","Habla con Torogethir en su campamento en Parth Aduial","Ost Heryn está al sur del campamento de Torogethir.\
\
Torogethir te pidió que derrotaras a algunos de los saqueadores de tumbas que merodean por Ost Heryn.","Torogethir se encuentra en su campamento, al norte de Ost Heryn.\
\
Torogethir se alegrará de saber que varios saqueadores de tumbas han sido expulsados de Ost Heryn."}},
[14103]={nameES="Tesoro sin vigilancia",objectivesES={"Este cofre, una vez custodiado por un gran troll de Khadar-zarâm, ahora está solo. Debes examinarlo para ver qué hay dentro y llevar el contenido a Svanr.","Lleva el tesoro que encontraste a Svanr","Tesoro sin vigilancia","Has descubierto un tesoro que una vez fue custodiado por un troll de Khadar-zarâm.","Svanr se encuentra en la escalera de Khadar-zarâm en Nud-melek occidental.\
\
Debes llevar el contenido del cofre que examinaste a Svanr."}},
[14104]={nameES="Unhelpful Hounds",objectivesES={"Talk to the worried woman","Chase that hound!","This hound has no ring!","Unhelpful Hounds","Bring the ring back to the worried woman","Unhelpful hounds can be found on the Second Tier of Minas Tirith.\
\
You should chase the hound and retrieve the engagement ring.","The worried woman is located in Minas Tirith.\
\
You should bring the ring back to the worried woman.","You found the ring!","The hounds of Minas Tirith enjoy being chased almost as much as they enjoy stealing things.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This quest will be removed from your quest log when the current festival ends.</rgb>"}},
[14105]={nameES="Uniformity",objectivesES={"Uniformity","Unlike the local clansmen, the Dunlendings sent north by Saruman seem to wear a form of livery, denoting their service to Isengard.","Bring the uniforms to Dagoras","Dunlending deserters can be found throughout Fordirith, but especially at Lhe Lhechu, south-west of Echad Dagoras.\
\
Gather uniforms from the band of Dunlending deserters in Fordirith.","Dagoras is at Echad Dagoras, north-east of Lhe Lhechu.\
\
You should bring the uniforms you collected to Dagoras."}},
[14106]={nameES="Conocidos improbables",objectivesES={"El hombre herido te llama","Conocidos improbables","Rendal no ha vuelto, pero el hombre al que ayudaba, Watcyn, quiere hablar contigo.","Rendal te ha pedido que le ayudes a conseguir athelas.\
\
La athelas crece alrededor del estanque cerca de Sírlond, al este.","Los puntos de interés y los lugares peligrosos de Cardolan están marcados","Un hombre llamado Watcyn se encuentra en una situación extraña.","Vuelve con Rendal en Sírlond","Habla con Watcyn","Las pertenencias de Rendal te han dado una idea del tipo de persona que es.\
\
Deberías hablar con Watcyn.","Has recogido suficiente athelas.\
\
DEberías volver con Rendal en Sírlond.","Examina los mapas de Rendal","Watcyn te ha pedido que busques en las pertenencias de Rendal, al lado de la tienda.","El arco de Rendal y la daga están usados pero bien cuidados.","Examina las armas de Rendal"}},
[14107]={nameES="Amistades improbables",objectivesES={"Usa el silbato para llamar a Rendal a tu lado","Rendal cree que acabar con algunos capitanes hará que se lo piensen dos veces a la hora de cazar a los desertores.\
\
Debes acabar con capitanes en Gaervarad.","Amistades improbables","Watcyn necesita toda la ayuda posible.","Usa el silbato en Gaervarad para llamar a Rendal","Habla con Rendal cuando quieras entrar a Gaervarad.\
\
Te espera en el exterior.","Has acabado con suficientes capitanes.\
\
Deberías hablar con Rendal. Usa el silbato en Gaervarad para llamar a Rengar a tu lado.","Habla con Rendal"}},
[14108]={nameES="Unlocking Emyn Ernil",objectivesES={"Unlocking Emyn Ernil","Bring Silver Tokens to Tothlant","Once enough contributions have been received, the tunnels beneath Emin Ernil will be re-opened. With that, aspiring town guards of Dol Amroth will be able to curry favour with the Workshop district.","Tothlant has asked you to bring him Silver Tokens of Dol Amroth to help pay for unlocking Emyn Ernil."}},
[14109]={nameES="Unlocking History",objectivesES={"Talk to Girhâzi","Unlocking History","Intrigued by your discovery of a curious wall inside another salt mine tunnel, Amâsu has asked you to escort her there to see it for herself.","Girhâzi has agreed to accompany you and Amâsu to return to the odd wall in the tunnel you discovered. Talk to Girhâzi when you are ready to leave.","Amâsu has indicated that you should invite Girhâzi to also see what you discovered. You should talk to Girhâzi.","After guiding Amâsu and Girhâzi to the salt mine you discovered, they were able to locate and open the lost library, Dubarâkh. You should talk to Girhâzi.","Complete Instance: Unlocking History"}},
[14110]={nameES="Unlocking the Paths of the Dead",objectivesES={"Once enough contributions have been received, the lost caves of the Paths of the Dead will be opened. With that, aspiring town guards of Dol Amroth will be able to curry favour with the Swan-knights Barracks.","Unlocking the Paths of the Dead","Harniel has asked you to bring her Silver Tokens of Dol Amroth to help pay the labour for unlocking new areas of the Paths of the Dead.","Bring the Silver Tokens to Harniel"}},
[14111]={nameES="Unmasking the Messenger",objectivesES={"The messenger wants you to follow the road east, past the Hárveg Bridge. Before the road cuts into the Greylin River, there is an overlook to the south.\
\
Rékkur believes this next clue may reveal something new, and has asked you to check.","Examina las huellas","The overlook is empty, save for a set of fresh footprints.\
\
Examining them could offer some insight.","Go to the overlook","An unfamiliar woman approached you once you defeated the Angmarim at the overlook.\
\
Talking to her may answer some of the questions you have.","Talk to the woman","One cryptic note has led to a scout's corpse and another note, answering nothing but creating more questions. Who has been sending these?","An Angmarim rushes towards you!","There are fresh footprints in the earth","Footsteps approach, and a voice calls out from nearby","Unmasking the Messenger"}},
[14112]={nameES="Unmeasured Malice",objectivesES={"Scouted the eastern side of Madh-fushaum","Talk to Wilberth","Scouted the northern side of Madh-fushaum","Madh-fushaum lies just to the south-east of Flodgeheld.\
\
Wilberth has asked you to scout around the perimeter of the fortress of Madh-fushaum.","Unmeasured Malice","Scouted the southern side of Madh-fushaum","Wilberth is at Flodgeheld.\
\
The White Hand in Madh-fushaum have been distracted by your efforts for some time, and you should now return to Wilberth.","The White Hand built a large and impressive fortification in the southern Stonedeans called Madh-fushaum. This is a staging area for attacks and it supports their efforts to conquer all of the Stonedeans.","Wilberth asked that you create a distraction while he is able to heal, and one way to do that would be to create turmoil in the fortress of Madh-fushaum.","Scouted the western side of Madh-fushaum"}},
[14113]={nameES="Furia antinatural",objectivesES={"El camino al Claro de la Hoguera se encuentra justo después del Túnel del Bosque Viejo, en la frontera oriental de Los Gamos.\
\
El alguacil Hob Guardacercas te ha pedido que coloques tarros de una mezcla de olor nauseabundo a lo largo del camino para ahuyentar a la fauna agresiva.","Furia antinatural","Habla con Hob Guardacercas","Los Guardabosques se muestran desconcertados por la repentina agresividad de la fauna del Bosque Viejo.","El alguacil Hob Guardacercas está vigilando el Portal del Este, en Los Gamos.\
\
Deberías informarle de que ya has colocado los tarros en el Bosque Viejo."}},
[14114]={nameES="Unnatural Terrain",objectivesES={"Mírthel can be found at Haerondir.\
\
You should talk to Mírthel.","Gladhir has asked you to assist the Rangers working in stealth among the Slag-hills.","Candúr can be found at a small Ranger outpost hidden in the Slag-hills.\
\
You should talk to Candúr and hear his message.","Talk to Thurindol","Talk to Candúr","Talk to Mírthel","Travel to the small Ranger outpost in the Slag-hills","Thurindol can be found at a small Ranger outpost hidden in the Slag-hills.\
\
You should talk to Thurindol.","A small ranger outpost is hidden in the Slag-hills.\
\
You should find Candúr in the Ranger outpost hidden by the Slag-hills.","Candúr is worried about threats to the east","Thurindol is worried about threats near the Black Gate","Unnatural Terrain"}},
[14115]={nameES="Deudas impagas",objectivesES={"Recoge la caja fuerte de Montebruno","Caja fuerte de Montebruno recogida","Deudas impagas","Los Montebruno tienen muchos campamentos a lo largo del camino al este y norte de Combe. El condestable Vadosalvia está en Combe.\
\
El condestable Vadosalvia quiere que recuperes una caja fuerte de los bandidos de una de las hogueras de vigilancia en el bosque de Chet. Su contenido podrá usarse para compensar a quienes perdieron sus bienes por culpa de los Montebruno.","Lleva la caja fuerte al condestable Vadosalvia","Ahora que los bandidos Montebruno han sido expulsados en gran parte de Archet, el condestable Vadosalvia quiere redistribuir los bienes robados a quienes sufrieron por su culpa."}},
[14116]={nameES="Unravelling Webs",objectivesES={"Unravelling Webs","The people of Sardol have been beset by spiders living under Tarlang's Peaks, and a few of their number have gone missing in the night.","Sidharan can be found in Sardol in south-western Blackroot Vale.\
\
You have searched all of the cocoons you could find in Lhingroth and rescued a few inhabitants of Sardol. You should return to Sidharan with this news.","Talk to Sidharan","Cocoons can be found inside Lhingroth, slightly east of Sardol in southern Blackroot Vale.\
\
Sidharan has asked you to brave the spiders of Lhingroth in hopes of finding people that have gone missing from Sardol in recent days.","DNT -- will not be seen"}},
[14117]={nameES="Inquietud en Tham Lasgol",objectivesES={"Habla con Rhovandis","Tham Lasgol puede encontrarse al oeste de Idhobel.\
\
Rhovandis te ha pedido derrotar trolls silvanos en Tham Lasgol.","Encontraste y derrotaste a los intrusos trolls silvanos en Tham Lasgol. Debes informar a Rhovandis sobre los nuevos habitantes.\
\
Regresa con Rhovandis.","Inquietud en Tham Lasgol","Rhovandis sospecha de una nueva amenaza."}},
[14118]={nameES="Unrest in the Sail-haven",objectivesES={"Unrest in the Sail-haven","It appears Râmax was stabbed numerous times before succumbing to his wounds","Talk to Râmax at the southern shipyard","Examine Râmax","Countless labourers and shipmen work tirelessly to construct new ships in the Sail-haven","Appointed as Captain of the Haven by the Kindred of the Coins, Eshmun seeks to preserve the peace in the Sail-haven and make safe the Free City of Umbar Baharbêl.","Talk to Zemirah at the Sailors' Guild-hall","Râmax has been murdered, and the southern ship-yard is overrun by the Heirsworn!","Zemirah is at the Sailors' Guild-hall, Ahûd is at the northern shipyard, and Râmax is at the southern shipyard.\
\
Eshmun, Captain of the Haven, wants to assess the threat of the Heirsworn following the Sea-stone Mutiny.","Talk to Ahûd at the northern shipyard","The Sailors' Guild-hall is bustling with shipmen and other labourers","Eshmun, Captain of the Haven, can be found at the Harbour-warden's Tower in the Sail-haven of Umbar Baharbêl.\
\
You have spoken to Zemirah and Ahûd, but Râmax was slain by the Heirsworn in the Sail-haven. You should report to Eshmun.","Talk to Eshmun at the Harbour-warden's Tower"}},
[14119]={nameES="Unsafe Passage",objectivesES={"Hersegg and Spall can be found at Zâram-mekhem in Gloomingtarn.\
\
In exchange for your aid in combating the Orkish presence in Gloomingtarn, Hersegg has indicated that she is willing to escort Spall to Watchers' Roost. You should aid Hersegg and Spall.","After arriving at Zâram-mekhem, Spall has discovered that passage through Gloomingtarn is fraught with danger. Undaunted, however, Spall is determined to aid Hermáth Stormhammer's expedition and bear witness to the site where Durin the Deathless awoke in Mount Gundabad.","Talk to Hersegg at Zâram-mekhem","Aid Spall with 'Echoes of the Ancestors'","Hermáth Stormhammer can be found at Watchers' Roost in Gloomingtarn.\
\
After arriving at Watchers' Roost, you have spotted Hermáth Stormhammer among the warriors of the Gabil'akkâ. You should talk to Hermáth Stormhammer.","Watchers' Roost can be found in Gloomingtarn, along the thoroughfare between the Deepscrave and the Clovengap.\
\
After hindering the Orcs encamped at Drúkala, Hersegg told you to join the rest of her grandfather's expedition at Watchers' Roost. You should travel to Watchers' Roost.","Talk to Hermáth Stormhammer at Watchers' Roost","Follow the thoroughfare through Gloomingtarn and travel to Watchers' Roost","Hersegg can be found at Zâram-mekhem in Gloomingtarn.\
\
Spall hopes to join Lord Hermáth Stormhammer's expedition at Watchers' Roost in Gloomingtarn. You should talk to Hersegg on his behalf.","Aid Hersegg with 'Gorgar's Curse-breaker'","Among the Gabil'akkâ at Watchers' Roost, you spot the expedition's leader: Hermáth Stormhammer","Unsafe Passage"}},
[14120]={nameES="No visto",objectivesES={"Arnod se encuentra en el campamento de Tharâkh Bazân, los jardines al este de la Puerta de las Nubes.\
\
Búkk te ha recomendado que hables con Arnod, quien ha estudiado los mapas e historia de Khazad-dûm, sobre dónde empezar a buscar a los mervyl.","Búkk se encuentra en Tharâkh Bazân, los jardines hacia el este.\
\
Kalman te ha recomendado que hables con su amigo Búkk sobre los mervyl.","No visto","Kalman tiene poca idea de lo que son los mervyl, pero cree que se parecen a algo que su amigo Búkk le mencionó antes de partir a Tharâkh Bazân.","Habla con Búkk en Tharâkh Bazân","Habla con Arnod en Tharâkh Bazân"}},
[14121]={nameES="Unseen In the Ice",objectivesES={"A darkness pulls at you as the shade known as Angithanam appears!","Unseen In the Ice","The frozen waters Kúzun speaks of can found just west of Hlídborg in Câr Bronach.\
\
You should investigate the frozen waters for Kúzun.","Talk to Kúzun at Leitstáth","Defeated Angithanam!","Kúzun can be found at Leitstáth.\
\
You should talk to Kúzun.","The Zhélruka, Kúzun, is certain that something watches those who wander the rocky slopes of Câr Bronach.","Investigate the icy pile","You feel something watching you","Investigate the frozen waters for Kúzun"}},
[14122]={nameES="Unseen Terror",objectivesES={"Talk to Sarnir","Sarnir can be found in Alagrant in western Blackroot Vale.\
\
You have found evidence that the Dead at the Hill of Erech are responsible for the deaths of these creatures and  you should now inform Sarnir.","You discover a few animal corpses, but they bear the marks of a struggle","Fallen animals can be found far to the east of Alagrant, near the Hill of Erech.\
\
You have found numerous animals mauled, but nothing that suggests anything unusual. You should continue your search to the east.","The Hill of Erech can be found far to the east of Alagrant.\
\
You have discovered animals that appear to have been slain without a single wound. You should search for more felled beasts near the Hill of Erech.","Unseen Terror","Search further east for signs of fallen animals","Numerous beasts of the Blackroot Vale have been felled without a single wound, and Sarnir hopes to discover the cause.","DNT -- will not be seen","Amidst a few slain creatures, you discover some that bear no wounds","Search east of Alagrant for signs of fallen animals","Fallen animals can be found to the east of Alagrant, past where you discovered the fallen bear.\
\
Sarnir has asked you to examine more fallen animals on the fields of Blackroot Vale in hopes of discovering what has driven them to madness.","Search the base of the Hill of Erech for fallen animals","Seemingly slain by fear alone, fallen creatures bearing no wounds litter the ground"}},
[14123]={nameES="Unsettling Evidence",objectivesES={}},
[14124]={nameES="Unspoken Fears",objectivesES={"The transcript is written in a strange, unfamiliar tongue","Mithrandir is in the Court of the Fountain on the Seventh Circle of Minas Tirith.\
\
Maenir has asked you to seek Mithrandir's counsel in the hope that deciphering the content of the scroll might aid in capturing its thief.","Talk to Maenir","The theft of a mysterious, indecipherable scroll from the Houses of Lore has left its curators worried that it might be used to some vile end.","Unspoken Fears","Maenir can be found on the first floor of the Houses of Lore in the Fifth Circle.\
\
You have searched the collection of enemy trophies and collected the transcript of the stolen scroll. You should now return to Maenir.","The collection of enemy trophies can be found on the second floor of the Houses of Lore.\
\
Maenir has asked you to search the collection for signs of thievery before returning to him with the transcript of the stolen scroll.","Deliver the scrawled transcript to Mithrandir","Aside from the scroll's known theft, nothing else appears to be out of place","Collect the scrawled transcript in the Houses of Lore","Search the collection of enemy trophies for signs of thievery","The scrawled transcript can be found among the collection of enemy trophies in the Houses of Lore.\
\
You have searched the collection and should now return to Maenir after collecting the transcript of the stolen scroll."}},
[14125]={nameES="Unstilled Waters",objectivesES={"A long-dried fountain stands outside the entrance of the old bathhouse of Minas Ithil","Examine the glimmering brazier","Talk to Dornach","Explora las Aguas Siniestras","Find the old bathhouse in the Circle of Despair","The terrible darkwater sinks back into the baths and the waters ripple lightly","The old bathhouse, now named the Gloomwaters, can be found in the eastern reaches of the Circle of Despair.\
\
You have entered the old bathhouse and discovered a glimmering brazier. You should examine it.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: If you lose sight of Dornach, you can summon him to your side with his horn.</rgb>","The old bath-house of Minas Ithil fell into ruin long ago, but its waters still stream from rusted suits of armour that stalk the Circle of Despair.","The old bath-house can be found in the eastern reaches of the Circle of Despair. Wailing Ithil-guards can be found in the Circle of Despair.\
\
Dornach wants to investigate the old bath-house in the Circle of Despair. You should find the old bathhouse and defeat wailing Ithil-guards.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: If you lose sight of Dornach, you can summon him to your side with his horn.</rgb>","The old bath-house, now named the Gloomwaters, can be found in the eastern reaches of the Circle of Despair.\
\
Dornach wants to investigate the old bathhouse in the Circle of Despair. You should enter the old bathhouse.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: If you lose sight of Dornach, you can summon him to your side with his horn.</rgb>","A terrible darkwater rises from the baths!","Braziers stand before the pools of the old bathhouse","You have put an end to the vile darkwater among the Dead of the Gloomwaters. You should talk to Dornach.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: If you lose sight of Dornach, you can summon him to your side with his horn.</rgb>","Unstilled Waters"}},
[14126]={nameES="Pasos Inseguros",objectivesES={"Ruidhriel está acampado cerca del Tor Burnt, al noroeste de Echad Dúnann. Limlaer está acampado a lo largo del camino, al suroeste de Echad Dúnann.\
\
Rinneldor te ha pedido que hables con sus exploradores, Ruidhriel y Limlaer, y los ayudes si puedes.","Has ayudado a Ruidhriel","Habla con Rinneldor en Echad Dúnann","Has entregado el mensaje de Golgallon a Rinneldor, quien ahora tiene más tareas para ti.","Rinneldor está en Echad Dúnann, al sureste del Tor Burnt y al noreste del puesto de Limlaer.\
\
Debes regresar a Rinneldor y informarle de todo lo que has aprendido sobre los movimientos de la Compañía.","Pasos Inseguros","Ayuda a Ruidhriel","Ayuda a Limlaer"}},
[14127]={nameES="Unsuspecting Loyalty",objectivesES={"Unsuspecting Loyalty","Blodwen is at her hiding place amid the rocks of Trum Dreng's southern farm, the Herd-lands.\
\
You should tell Blodwen that you have disabled all of the traps that you could find.","Blodwen has asked you to help save the cattle from cruelty when they eventually wander back to their home. You must disable the traps set by the Dragon-clan meant to keep the returning herd from wandering.","The Dragon-clan set traps for the herd in the rocky fields on the west of the shallow river in the Herd-lands.\
\
You should disable the traps so that the herd may return without being brutally wounded for their loyalty.","Talk to Blodwen in the Herd-lands"}},
[14128]={nameES="Telarañas desenredadas",objectivesES={"Telarañas desenredadas","El nido de arañas que has descubierto está bloqueado por una masa monstruosa de telarañas, demasiado fuertes para cortarlas.","Gammer Boffin se encuentra en su casa, en el centro de Sobrecolina.\
\
El Oficial Madriguera te ha enviado a Sobrecolina para hablar con Gammer Boffin, una anciana hobbit con un gran conocimiento de las hierbas. Robin cree que podría saber algo para ayudar a eliminar las telarañas.","Se pueden encontrar babosas en el Pantano de los Juncos, al oeste de Sobrecolina. Gammer Boffin está en su casa, en el centro de Sobrecolina.\
\
Robin Madriguera estaba seguro de que Gammer Boffin conocería una mezcla que podría ayudar a eliminar las telarañas que obstruyen el nido de arañas del Bosque del Fardo. Fuiste a Sobrecolina y hablaste con Gammer, que te envió a buscar seis medidas de baba de babosa.","Lleva la baba de babosa a Gammer Boffin"}},
[14129]={nameES="Until the Time Comes",objectivesES={"Confront the Ruthless Dead","The Ruthless oathbreaker can be found inside the Corsairs' cave in north-central Dor-en-Ernil.\
\
You have discovered the Ruthless Dead are behind the deaths of the Corsairs and should endeavour to discover their purpose in Dor-en-Ernil.","Search the Corsairs' cave","You have defeated the Ruthless oathbreaker, but he shall soon return","Garvir can be found in Linhir in eastern Dor-en-Ernil.\
\
You have discovered that the Ruthless Dead intend to sweep eastward through Lebennin towards Mordor and should bring these ill tidings to Garvir.","Return to Garvir in Linhir","DNT -- will not be seen","The Ruthless Dead have escaped into Dor-en-Ernil!","After finding a slain group of Corsairs in the hills of Dor-en-Ernil, the situation grows more dire as a familiar foe returns.","As you examine the Corsair more closely, a familiar chill fills the air. Although you cannot see them, you sense that the Dead are nearby.\
\
If they have truly escaped the Ringló Vale, the people of Dor-en-Ernil will have far more to worry about than the Corsairs and Haradrim.\
\
You should investigate the cave further before returning to Garvir in Linhir.","Until the Time Comes","The Corsair hideout can be found in north-central Dor-en-Ernil along the mountainside.\
\
You have found slain Corsairs in their hideout and a sense of unease fills the air. You should investigate the cave further."}},
[14130]={nameES="Leyendas Secretas",objectivesES={"La Puerta de las Nubes se encuentra justo al oeste de Uflûmp-mur, en la entrada de Zirakzigil en el Camino de Durin.\
\
Has encontrado el escudo antiguo y debes devolverlo a Listein para su custodia.","Devuelve el escudo a Listein en la entrada de Zirakzigil","Uflûmp-mur se encuentra en el pequeño puesto avanzado en la entrada de Zirakzigil en el Camino de Durin.\
\
Listein te ha pedido que te dirijas al este hacia Uflûmp-mur para encontrar un escudo antiguo, para que pueda aprender qué leyendas secretas contiene.","Listein te ha pedido que recuperes una reliquia de tiempos antiguos en el cercano Uflûmp-mur.","Has recogido el escudo antiguo","Leyendas Secretas","Encuentra el escudo antiguo en Uflûmp-mur"}},
[14131]={nameES="Agresión inoportuna",objectivesES={"Orchalwë quiere hablar contigo.","La ira de Orchalwë contra las fuerzas de Angmar está impregnada de una historia profunda y dolorosa.","Agresión inoportuna","Los angmarim se pueden encontrar dentro de los límites de la ciudad de Annúminas.\
\
Orchalwë está desesperado por derrotar a los angmarim en Annúminas.","Habla con Orchalwë"}},
[14132]={nameES="Amigos Inusuales",objectivesES={"Habla con Langhár en el claro aislado","Busca a la mujer desaparecida al noroeste de Stangard, cerca del Campamento de Frithstan en las Colinas de los Lamentos","Bingo está en el claro aislado en la esquina noreste de las Colinas de los Lamentos.","Habla con Bingo en el claro aislado","Amigos Inusuales","Langhár está en el claro aislado en la esquina noreste de las Colinas de los Lamentos.","Habla con Bingo fuera del Campamento de Frithstan, en las Colinas de los Lamentos","Se pueden encontrar orcos por todas las Colinas de los Lamentos.\
\
Langhár te ha pedido que la ayudes a derrotar orcos en las Colinas de los Lamentos, más que para ayudar a los hombres de Stangard, para proteger su hogar en los Valles del Anduin.","Habla con Landroval en el claro aislado","Sabert rechazó a una mujer en la puerta de Stangard, y ahora Bingo quiere buscarla al noroeste del puesto para asegurarse de que está a salvo. Sabert cree que se dirigía hacia el Campamento de Frithstan.","Bingo está fuera de la puerta este de Stangard, en el Prado de Eorl junto al Gran Río.\
\
Sabert ha rechazado a Bingo con gran descortesía y no le ha permitido entrar al puesto avanzado de Stangard.","Sabert custodia la puerta este de Stangard, y Bingo quiere advertirle de la presencia enemiga que Landroval vio reunirse.","Habla con Langhár fuera del Campamento de Frithstan, en las Colinas de los Lamentos","Langhár está fuera del Campamento de Frithstan, en las Colinas de los Lamentos.\
\
Has derrotado a muchos orcos en las Colinas de los Lamentos y ahora deberías regresar con Langhár.","Habla con Bingo fuera de la puerta este de Stangard","Habla con Sabert en la puerta este de Stangard","Encuentra el claro aislado donde aterrizó el Águila","Una mujer alta se encuentra fuera del Campamento de Frithstan y te llama","Langhár vio un Águila descender en un bosquecillo en la esquina noreste de las Colinas de los Lamentos, en el borde de Thinglad, y cree que deberías ir a buscarla.","Langhár está fuera del Campamento de Frithstan, en las Colinas de los Lamentos.","Bingo está fuera del Campamento de Frithstan, en las Colinas de los Lamentos.\
\
Has derrotado orcos en las Colinas de los Lamentos y ahora deberías regresar con Bingo y Langhár fuera del Campamento de Frithstan.","Has recogido sacos de veneno de las arañas de las Colinas de los Lamentos y deberías regresar al Claro Aislado.","El guardián Sabert custodia la puerta este de Stangard, al sur de Haldirith.\
\
Bingo quiere hacer lo posible por mejorar las relaciones entre los elfos y los rohirrim, y desea viajar al sur, a Stangard.","Bingo Boffin está en un claro aislado en la esquina noreste de las Colinas de los Lamentos.\
\
Has encontrado al Águila Landroval, y Bingo parece estar completamente sobrecogido por la majestuosa criatura.","Lleva los sacos de veneno a Langhár en el claro aislado","Bingo quiere conocer a la gente que vive en el puesto avanzado de Stangard y enterarse de la situación a lo largo de las orillas del Gran Río.","Un águila enorme está posada sobre una roca en este claro","Langhár cree que deberías recolectar sacos de veneno de las arañas por todas las Colinas de los Lamentos, tanto para prestar un servicio útil como para darle a Bingo tiempo de hablar con Landroval.","Lleva la advertencia de Landroval a Sabert en la puerta este de Stangard","Bingo mira a Langhár con una mezcla de miedo y asombro","ingo está fuera de la puerta este de Stangard.\
\
Sabert no prestó atención a tu advertencia sobre un ejército en las Tierras Pardas."}},
[14133]={nameES="Unveiling the Threat",objectivesES={"You have gathered information regarding the Hakâri cultists and their plans. Bring what you have learned to Hênok located to the east of Ghâs Hejai.","Obtain any information you can from the Hakâri cultists that are gathered in Ghâs Hejai to the north of Jadambor.","Bôgalekh has requested that you go to Ghâs Hejai to the north of Jadambor to investigate the Hakâri cultists.","Unveiling the Threat","Arrived at Ghâs Hejai","Bôgalekh has asked you to go investigate the ruins of Ghâs Hejai to the north for more information.","Travel to Ghâs Hejai to investigate the area","Inform Hênok of what you have discovered"}},
[14134]={nameES="Unwelcome Foragers",objectivesES={"Unwelcome Foragers","Talk to Derva","Derva has asked you to defeat wood-trolls and pick mushrooms.\
\
Wood-trolls and the mushrooms she seeks can be found in the woods to the north-west.","Derva needs you to defeat wood-trolls and harvest mushrooms in the forest north-west of her farm.","Derva brushes some woodchips and twigs from your shoulder.\
\
'You had a little something on there. I take it the wood-trolls have been dealt with?'\
\
You nod and hand over the basket of mushrooms. She lifts them to her nose and inhales.\
\
'I've missed that musty smell. Thanks, adventurer. I hope your future journeys treat you well.'"}},
[14135]={nameES="Unwelcome Guests",objectivesES={}},
[14136]={nameES="Unwelcome Pests",objectivesES={}},
[14137]={nameES="Unwelcome Scrawls",objectivesES={"Unwelcome Scrawls","Those discontented with the newly-arrived refugees have continued to leave angry scrawls throughout Dale.","Talk to Gaumar","You should find angry scrawls on walls and doors throughout Dale and remove them.","You should return to Gaumar."}},
[14138]={nameES="Extraños Indeseados",objectivesES={"Entrega la producción a Wilmac Brandigamo","El stockade de los bandidos está al norte del camino, entre el Puente Brandivino y el campamento de Adso. Wilmac Brandigamo te espera dentro de la Puerta del Cerco en Nuevoburgo, Los Gamos.\
\
Wilmac Brandigamo te ha pedido que recuperes la producción del granjero Maggot de los rufianes que lo asaltaron.","Recoge la producción del granjero Maggot","La producción del granjero Maggot fue robada por bandidos. Su trabajador, su hijo y el amigo de su hijo escaparon, pero la producción destinada a Los Gamos fue llevada por los bandidos.","Extraños Indeseados","Recogida la producción del granjero Maggot"}},
[14139]={nameES="Tuneladores indeseables",objectivesES={"El nido de los rascabismos se encuentra en la Vieja Ciudad del Cuerno de Plata, en la parte sur de las Vetas del Cuerno de Plata.\
\
Debes derrotar a los rascabismos y limpiar la zona del nido.","Habla con Öndótt","Tuneladores indeseables","Unos amenazantes rascabismos parecen haber construido un nido en la Vieja Ciudad del Cuerno de Plata.","Öndótt se encuentra en lo alto de la escalera de la Vieja Ciudad del Cuerno de Plata.\
\
Deberías volver a ver a Öndótt y decirle que has hecho lo que te pidió."}},
[14140]={nameES="Unwelcoming Webs",objectivesES={"Talk to Vithin in Glittengrof","Vithin can be found in Glittengrof in Gloomingtarn.\
\
You have successfully rescued all of the Longbeard guards captured by the glass-spiders. You should return to Vithin.","A surprised, irritated goblin breaks free of the webs and attacks!","Much to the dismay of the Gabil'akkâ, the glass-spiders in Glittengrof have begun to prey upon unwelcome visitors—dwarf and goblin alike.","Unwelcoming Webs","Wriggling webs can be found in Glittengrof.\
\
Vithin has asked you to aid in the rescue of several Longbeard guards who were captured by the glass-spiders now dwelling in Glittengrof. You should rescue the Longbeard guards."}},
[14141]={nameES="Agua insalubre",objectivesES={"Agua insalubre","Longo Daegmund está convencido de que algo en el pozo del pueblo de Entibo causó la enfermedad de Gar.","La casa de Lirio Sotomonte está al este de la plaza del pueblo, pasando la granja de Cenagales.\
\
Longo Daegmund, preocupado por el pozo del pueblo de Entibo, te pidió que hables con Lirio Sotomonte.","Habla con Lirio Sotomonte en su granja"}},
[14142]={nameES="Unwilling Firewood",objectivesES={"Bring the hardy firewood to Mabel Mitford","Grouchy trees can be chopped down in the woods in the Grumpwood, a forbidding forest in the northern-most reaches of Frostbluff.\
\
You should use whatever force is necessary to get firewood from only the best trees.","Mabel Mitford is in Winter-home.\
\
You should bring the firewood you gathered to Mabel Mitford.","Unwilling Firewood","The mayor requires that the bonfires only use the best, most hardy wood available in the region and has mistaken the Wood-trolls for trees. It is a shame the Wood-trolls have the hardiest branches of any local tree.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> NOTE: This quest will be removed from your quest log when the current festival ends. </rgb>"}},
[14143]={nameES="Recolectores involuntarios",objectivesES={"Mientras los acechadores de nieve avanzan por la nieve, fragmentos de cerámica y viejas reliquias se enredan en sus patas parecidas a raíces. Si se recogieran suficientes, estos objetos podrían interesar a algunos eruditos en Rivendel.\
\
Recoge fragmentos de reliquia de los acechadores de nieve en las Montañas Nubladas.","Lleva fragmentos de reliquia a Glorenglir en Rivendel","Muchas reliquias se han perdido en las nieves de las Montañas Nubladas, enterradas bajo los ventisqueros por el viento y el tiempo.","Los acechadores de nieve trepan los ventisqueros cerca de la fuente del Bruinen en las Montañas Nubladas al norte de Rivendel.\
\
Mientras las criaturas avanzan por la nieve, fragmentos de cerámica y viejas reliquias se enredan en sus patas parecidas a raíces. Recoge fragmentos de reliquia de los acechadores de nieve en las Montañas Nubladas.","Recoge fragmentos de reliquia","Glorenglir está interesada en investigar estos fragmentos de reliquia recogidos en las Montañas Nubladas.\
\
Glorenglir puede encontrarse en Rivendel.","Recolectores involuntarios"}},
[14144]={nameES="Unwritten History",objectivesES={"Recovered writings and crumbling tomes can be found inside the High Archives in western Osgiliath.\
\
You have found Echil and should now search for recovered writings and valuable tomes before returning to Candúr.","Candúr can be found just outside the High Archives in western Osgiliath.\
\
You have found Echil and recovered many valuable pieces of writing from the High Archives. You should now return to Candúr.","Candúr has asked you to search the High Archives for the ranger, Echil, and recover any writings of value that haven't yet been set aflame.","Talk to Candúr","Unwritten History","Echil is somewhere inside the High Archives in western Osgiliath.\
\
Candúr has asked you to seek his lost fellow, Echil, and then recover any valuable writings that survived the sack of western Osgiliath.","Busca a Echil en los Altos Archivos"}},
[14145]={nameES="Unyielding Tide",objectivesES={}},
[14146]={nameES="Up from the Depths",objectivesES={}},
[14147]={nameES="Up in Smoke",objectivesES={}},
[14148]={nameES="Upokhir's Allies",objectivesES={"Though their foolhardy captain leads with an iron fist, Upokhir counts many brave warriors as trusted allies within Pahor Boha.","Upokhir's Allies","You to have delivered plans to Upokhir's trusted confidants within Pahor Boha, and should report your success.\
\
Talk to Upokhir in Ost Arndír.","Talk to Upokhir","Upokhir has asked you to deliver plans to his trusted confidants in Pahor Boha.\
\
Pahor Boha can be found in the south-east of Pinnath Gelin."}},
[14149]={nameES="Upon the Cliffs",objectivesES={"Ost Sarram is located upon the southern cliffs in the western side of Southern Ithilien.\
\
You should speak to Mírthel near Ost Sarram.","The Ranger Mírthel remains missing and Gladhir has sent you to the southern cliffs in search of his comrade.","Ost Sarram is located upon the southern cliffs in the western side of Southern Ithilien.\
\
You should destroy Haradrim ladders upon the cliffs to stop the flow of men and supplies.","Search for Mírthel","\\qSsh! The Haradrim will hear us. What business have you in this land?'\
\
You explain that Gladhir sent you in search of him.\
\
'I see. It is fortunate you arrived when you did. I have discovered how the Haradrim were able to gather in such great number here without our being aware. They have been constructing ladders along the cliffs to bring men and supplies over the Emyn Arnen. Without the ladders, they would need to pass through a chokepoint on the Harad road, which is closely watched. Needless to say, we must hinder these schemes immediately.'","Upon the Cliffs","Ost Sarram is located upon the southern cliffs in the western side of Southern Ithilien.\
\
You should search for Mírthel near Ost Sarram.","Speak with Mírthel","Mírthel motions you to come closer and make no noise","Ost Sarram is located upon the southern cliffs in the western side of Southern Ithilien.\
\
You should talk to Mírthel near Ost Sarram."}},
[14150]={nameES="En la orilla solitaria",objectivesES={"En la orilla solitaria","Núrelleth está en Telain Glorelloth, en uno de los flets que se extiende sobre la cerca que rodea Caras Galadhon.\
\
Has dejado la flecha de venganza en el árbol solitario como Núrelleth te lo pidió y ahora deberías regresar a ella.","Núrelleth quiere que la memoria de Faengris perdure en Lórien y hacer más que simplemente matar a algunos Orcos en su nombre.","El árbol solitario donde Núrelleth quiere que se coloque la flecha de venganza se encuentra en la orilla del Anduin, al este de Imlad Lalaith.\
\
Núrelleth quiere que los Elfos de Lothlórien recuerden a su marido Faengris, y para eso, preferiría que la flecha de venganza se mantuviera en su memoria en lugar de ser usada para matar a más Orcos.","Núrelleth suspira, su rostro es una máscara de tristeza.\
\
'El árbol solitario donde me gustaría que colocaras la flecha se encuentra al este de Imlad Lalaith, en las orillas del Anduin.'","Habla con Núrelleth en Telain Glorelloth","Coloca la flecha de venganza en la base del árbol solitario"}},
[14151]={nameES="Upper Crust of the Upper Ward",objectivesES={"The birthday boy is taken aback by the kind gesture","Renowned head-cook Brûdo needs help catering a party for Umbar's elite. Start by washing your hands.\
\
A hand-washing basin can be found near Brûdo.","Now that your hands are clean, pick up the first tray of food and take it to table three.\
\
The tray of food is on the table next to Brûdo.","Upper Crust of the Upper Ward","You have completed all your tasks and should speak to Brûdo.\
\
Brûdo can be found at the bath-house in the Upper Ward.","Carry the tray of food to table three","The guests thank you for your prompt service","Brûdo takes the dirty dishes from you and sets them down on the table.\
\
'I have one last task for you. One of the guests... it is his birthday! I wish I had known in advance so I could have prepared something special, but this semolina cake will have to do. He is the merchant at the long table just to the east! Please bring it to him. Tell him it is a gift from the chef.'","You have gathered the soiled plates. Bring them to Brûdo.\
\
Brûdo can be found in the bath-house of the Upper Ward.","Talk to Brûdo","Wash your hands in the wash-basin","Bring the dirty dishes to Brûdo","Your hands are clean now!","Brûdo has asked you to deliver a special semolina cake to a guest.\
\
Brûdo can be found at the bath-house in the Upper Ward.","You have made your first delivery. Speak to Brûdo to learn what to do next.\
\
Brûdo can be found at the bath-house in the Upper Ward.","Now that your hands are clean, speak to Brûdo to receive instructions.\
\
Brûdo can be found at the bath-house in the Upper Ward.","Brûdo is catering a gathering of Umbar's elite and would benefit from an extra set of hands, after you wash them of course.","Deliver the semolina cake to the guest","Brûdo told you to clean the dishes off tables four, five, six, and seven, near the dancing man.\
\
Brûdo still needs your help in the Upper Ward."}},
[14152]={nameES="Uprooting the Raiders",objectivesES={"Return to Blodwen in the Herd-lands","While you are attempting to set the farm to rights, Blodwen anticipates that you will encounter many Dragon-clan as you roam.","Blodwen can be found hiding among the rocks at the far southern edge of the Herd-lands in Trum Dreng.\
\
You should return to Blodwen and see if she has any more need of your assistance.","Dragon-clan invaders can be found all over the Herd-lands.\
\
You should defeat the Dragon-clan invaders as you wander throughout the farmlands.","Uprooting the Raiders"}},
