[14154]={nameES="Urgent Supplies for the Armoury",objectivesES={}},
[14155]={nameES="Urns of Aufaltor",objectivesES={}},
[14156]={nameES="Urshúlagar: Burning the Watch",objectivesES={}},
[14157]={nameES="Urshúlagar: Under the Gaze",objectivesES={}},
[14158]={nameES="Uruk-necklaces",objectivesES={"Uruks may be found in Sâd-en-Dagor in Dol Guldur, north-east from Helethir.\
\
Stirnir has asked you to collect necklaces from the uruks in Dol Guldur.","Uruk-necklaces","The uruks of Dol Guldur bear necklaces denoting their loyalty to the Enemy."}},
[14159]={nameES="Utterby: Continúa la lucha",objectivesES={"Habla con Náin","Many Jangovar can be found inside Utterby.\
\
You should defeat Jangovar outside Utterby and inside Utterby: Continue the Fight.","There are still many Jangovar stubbornly holding onto Utterby. Will you help the Ironfold Dwarves clear out the village?","Lord Náin can be found inside of the gates in Utterby.\
\
You should talk to Lord Náin.","Utterby: Continúa la lucha"}},
[14160]={nameES="Recompensa VIP por la Guerra de las Tres Cumbres",objectivesES={"En reconocimiento a tu estatus VIP, Wenda te ofrece un objeto especial para el hogar que te ayudará en tus viajes al Valle Ancestral.","Recompensa VIP por la Guerra de las Tres Cumbres","Habla con Wenda para aceptar su amable oferta."}},
[14161]={nameES="Recompensas VIP",objectivesES={"En reconocimiento a tu estatus VIP, Wenda te ofrece algunos objetos de utilidad para ayudarte en tus viajes.","Recompensas VIP","Habla con Wenda para aceptar su amable oferta."}},
[14162]={nameES="Recompensas VIP",objectivesES={"En reconocimiento a tu estatus VIP, Wenda te ofrece algunos objetos de utilidad para ayudarte en tus viajes.","Recompensas VIP","Habla con Wenda para aceptar su amable oferta."}},
[14163]={nameES="El cetro de Valandur",objectivesES={"Haudh Valandur se encuentra al oeste del campamento de los Montaraces, en el Camino de los Reyes.\
\
Maladan te ha pedido que te adentres en la tumba de Haudh Valandur y le traigas un cetro que tiene en su poder un kergrim que se encuentra allí.","El cetro de Valandur","Consigue el cetro del kergrim que se encuentra en Haudh Valandur","Lleva el cetro a Maladan en el Camino de los Reyes","Has recuperado el cetro de Valandur","Maladan se encuentra en el campamento de los Montaraces, en el Camino de los Reyes.\
\
Maladan estará deseando recibir el cetro de Valandur.","Valandur, rey de Annúminas, era conocido por su cetro."}},
[14164]={nameES="Vale of Shadow",objectivesES={"Speak with Arvaethor.","An injured man resting near a tree calls to you with great difficulty","Find and speak with any survivors","The man beckons you to come closer and whispers words into your ear.\
\
'I... tried to stop them *cough* but there... were too many. They came from across... the river.... *cough* and leading them... was... a...'\
\
His words trail off as he passes.","Arvaethor has asked you to scout out a nearby lumber camp for any survivors.","Vale of Shadow","The lumber camp is located east of Ethring in Ringló Vale.\
\
You should search the Lumber camp for any survivors and defeat any Orcs.","The dying man spoke of an Orc camp across the river","Speak with Arvaethor"}},
[14165]={nameES="Vale of Sorcery: The Reclamation Begins",objectivesES={"The White Company furthers their efforts in reclaiming Minas Ithil from the grasp of darkness.","Search for the recently stolen book","Thurindol, Ereblen, and Tordoron can be found at Echad Uial.\
\
You should talk to Thurindol, Ereblen, and Tordoron.","Talk to Thurindol","Find someone who may be able to enter Ghashan-kútot","This page has something to do with the Circle of Wrath","The Black Númenórean has been slain very recently. It is uncertain by whom, or what. The pages of the books you hold must have been important if both Thargaun and Dolguzigir both desire possession of the book. Perhaps you should bring the pages to Thurindol for closer inspection.","Convince someone to get the book you seek","The cisterns would be an ideal way to sneak around the city","Talk to Thurindol, Ereblen, and Tordoron","Ghashan-kútot can be found in Minas Morgul.\
\
You should attempt to enter Ghashan-kútot.","Bring the torn pages to the Black Númenórean cataloguer","The hall is locked and heavily guarded","The Black Númenórean cataloguer should still be near the Hall of Black Lore.\
\
You should bring the pages of the book to him for a trade.","You take Thargaun by surprise as he scatters the book to the winds","Vale of Sorcery: The Reclamation Begins","Attempt to enter Ghashan-kútot","This page has something to do with the Circle of Sorrow","There should be an entrance to the upper cisterns upon the Circle of Despair","This page has something to do with the Circle of Madness","This page has something to do with the Circle of Death","This page has something to do with the Circle of Despair","You have done much to aid those allies of the White Company in Imlad Morgul. Thurindol, a Ranger of Ithilien calls upon you to lead the charge in reclaiming Imlad Morgul from the dark grasp surrounding the once proud city of Minas Ithil. You should speak to Thurindol, Ereblen, and Tordoron at Echad Uial as soon as you are able.","The cataloguer's missing book is most likely still in Minas Morgul.\
\
You should search for the missing book, recently stolen from the Hall of Black Lore.","Habla con Tordoron","No one entered Ghashan-kútot from the doors or roof as both were well guarded","Thurindol can be found at Echad Uial.\
\
You should talk to Thurindol.","A figure stands near the entrance of the upper cisterns","The cataloguer seems to be searching for something","Talk to Ereblen","Scattered pages of a book can be found blowing around in Minas Morgul.\
\
You should collect the pages.","Someone who is able to enter Ghashan-kútot must be nearby.\
\
You should find someone who may be able to enter Ghashan-kútot."}},
[14166]={nameES="Vale of Sorcery: The Trial of Death",objectivesES={"Trap Thargaun with the stones of defeat!","A vision of the conflict is revealed","Examine the conflict around the altar","The corpse falls as Thargaun watches on in anger","Talk to Thurindol","Thargaun can be found at Ufurok in Thuringwath.\
\
You should trap Thargaun.","Enter the Altar of Death","If Thargaun is bound to the Vale in defeat, perhaps defeat itself prevents him from leaving","Thargaun can be found at Ufurok in Thuringwath.\
\
You should seek out Thargaun there.","There was a recent conflict here. The artifact is missing!","Rally points can be found throughout the Morgul Vale.\
\
You should seek out each rally point within the bounds of the Morgul Vale.","You are too late. The corpse rises out of the flame","Ufurok can be found in Thuringwath.\
\
You should defeat foes at Ufurok so that your confrontation with Thargaun will be met with fewer surprises.","Vale of Sorcery: The Trial of Death","Thargaun can be found at Ufurok in Thuringwath.\
\
You should confront Thargaun there.","Examine the altar","The Altar of Death can be found in the Circle of Death in Minas Morgul.\
\
You should examine the conflict around the altar.","The Altar of Death can be found in the Circle of Death in Minas Morgul.\
\
You should enter the Altar of Death.","Thargaun's ritual can be found at Ufurok in Thuringwath.\
\
You should stop Thargaun's ritual.","Destroy the Orb of Death","Thargaun howls as he disintegrates along with the artifact","Thurindol can be found at Echad Uial.\
\
You should talk to Thurindol.","Seek out Thargaun at Ufurok","The Altar of Death can be found in the Circle of Death in Minas Morgul.\
\
You should examine the altar.","Confront Thargaun","Stop Thargaun's ritual","For those reclaiming Minas Ithil from the grasp of darkness, a trial of death has begun.","Thargaun can be heard chanting atop the structure of Ufurok","The Orb of Death be found at Ufurok in Thuringwath.\
\
You should destroy the Orb of Death."}},
[14167]={nameES="Vale of Sorcery: The Trial of Despair",objectivesES={"Vale of Sorcery: The Trial of Despair","The Altar of Despair can be found in the Circle of Despair in Minas Morgul.\
\
You should make an etching of the plaque.","Talk to Thurindol","Examine the etching and map","The artifact rests upon its pedestal but is protected by a strange barrier","The barrier has been dispelled!","Set the etching down on the map table","You show Tordoron the etching.\
\
'I am not sure what to make of this etching. Perhaps I will be able to study it soon. Set it down on our map table for now so I will remember it later.'","The seven locations on the map can be found throughout Mordor.\
\
You should thoroughly search all seven.","You set the etching upon a map of Mordor and something odd catches your eye","Examine the plaque","Destroy the Orb of Despair","There does not seem to be any way to destroy the barrier","You hope that the Rangers will be able to assist you in deciphering this plaque","The map table can be found at Echad Uial.\
\
You should set the etching down on the map table.","The map table can be found at Echad Uial.\
\
You should examine the etching and map.","The guardian falls, and the artifact shatters","The Altar of Despair can be found in the Circle of Despair in Minas Morgul.\
\
You should examine the barrier protecting the artifact.","It looks as if the points on the etching match up with structures in Mordor!","The Altar of Despair can be found in the Circle of Despair in Minas Morgul.\
\
You should destroy the Orb of Despair.","The positioning of the gems upon the plaque is odd","Enter the Altar of Despair","A strange haze clouds your vision","Examine the barrier protecting the artifact","Habla con Tordoron","Thurindol can be found at Echad Uial.\
\
You should talk to Thurindol.","The Altar of Despair can be found in the Circle of Despair in Minas Morgul.\
\
You should examine the plaque next to the altar.","The Altar of Despair can be found in the Circle of Despair in Minas Morgul.\
\
You should enter the Altar of Despair.","The Altar of Despair can be found in the Circle of Despair in Minas Morgul.\
\
You should return to the the Altar of Despair.","Return to the Altar of Despair","For those reclaiming Minas Ithil from the grasp of darkness, a trial of despair has begun.","Tordoron can be found at Echad Uial.\
\
You should talk to Tordoron.","Make an etching of the plaque"}},
[14168]={nameES="Vale of Sorcery: The Trial of Madness",objectivesES={"Talk to Thurindol","Viznak can be found in Agarnaith near Seregost.\
\
You should talk to Viznak.","Viznak runs off","Viznak can be found in Agarnaith at his hideout.\
\
You should talk to Viznak.","Travel to Agarnaith with Viznak","For those reclaiming Minas Ithil from the grasp of darkness, a trial of madness has begun.","Viznak can be found at Barad Elenath.\
\
You should wait for Viznak.","Viznak can be found at Barad Elenath.\
\
You should talk to Viznak.","Viznak returns to Barad Elenath, panting heavily","Vale of Sorcery: The Trial of Madness","Talk to Viznak at Barad Elenath","Talk to Viznak in Agarnaith","Wait for Viznak to return","Thurindol can be found at Echad Uial.\
\
You should talk to Thurindol.","Talk to Viznak at his hideout","Viznak can be found in Agarnaith near Seregost.\
\
You should travel to Agarnaith and talk to Viznak."}},
[14169]={nameES="Vale of Sorcery: The Trial of Sorrow",objectivesES={"The artifact is not here","Vale of Sorcery: The Trial of Sorrow","The Orb of Sorrow can be found in Torech Ungol.\
\
Try to resist the visions of sorrow.","Talk to Thurindol","The artifact you seek can be found in Torech Ungol.\
\
You should find the artifact.","The scratch marks lead further into Torech Ungol","Shades and wights can be found in Minas Morgul.\
\
You should defeat shades and wights in Minas Morgul.","Thargaun must be somewhere in Minas Morgul.\
\
You should seek out Thargaun to learn more about the second artifact.","The Orb of Sorrow can be found in Torech Ungol.\
\
You should destroy the Orb of Sorrow.","Find and defeat Thargaun","Resist the vision of sorrow","There are no signs of the artifact ever being here","Follow the scratch marks into Torech Ungol","A scuttling noise approaches!","Thargaun appears from the flames!","Find the artifact you seek","Talk to Thargaun","The strange pile of dust can be found in Cirith Ungol.\
\
You should examine the pile of dust.","Thargaun is in Minas Morgul.\
\
You should talk to Thargaun.","A large pile of bones sits at a dead end","Examine the bones for any sign of the artifact","Search a second location where the artifact might be","Examine the pile of dust","For those reclaiming Minas Ithil from the grasp of darkness, a trial of sorrow has begun.","You have resisted the vision!","Something from Minas Morgul was devoured here, by a spider!","Destroy the Orb of Sorrow","You find nothing of interest","Thurindol can be found at Echad Uial.\
\
You should talk to Thurindol.","Search a location where the artifact might be","The artifact you seek is somewhere in Cirith Ungol.\
\
You should search one more location where the artifact might be.","Thargaun beckons you closer","Search a third location where the artifact might be","The scratch marks lead into Torech Ungol.\
\
You should follow the scratch marks.","The artifact you seek is somewhere in Cirith Ungol.\
\
You should search some locations where the artifact might be.","You notice something strange here","Search one more location where the artifact might be","A strange haze clouds your vision!","The spider had eaten the artifact!"}},
[14170]={nameES="Vale of Sorcery: The Trial of Wrath",objectivesES={"The path towards Nurn travels through Talath Úrui","Talk to Thurindol","The injured Orc can be found in Talath Úrui.\
\
You should find out what happened to this group of Orcs.","The path towards Nurn travels through Lhingris","Injured Orcs can be found upon the Circle of Wrath in Minas Morgul.\
\
You should question those Orcs that you have injured.","Vale of Sorcery: The Trial of Wrath","Track the group of the Orcs who make for Nurn","Talk to the injured Orc","The Orcs have been slain, and one barely clings to life","Thurindol can be found at Echad Uial.\
\
You should talk to Thurindol.","Orcs can be found upon the Circle of Wrath in Minas Morgul.\
\
You should defeat Orcs in Minas Morgul.","A group of Orcs found the artifact you seek and left the city.\
\
You should track the group of Orcs as they make their way towards Nurn.","For those reclaiming Minas Ithil from the grasp of darkness, a trial of wrath has begun."}},
