Glimmerdeep: grey mushrooms, old pitons\
Thrumfall: delver's plaster, dragon-stone","Wanted Pebbles: Crafter's Lead, Delver's Plaster, and Dragon-stone","Collected crafter's lead","Some needed secondary supplies may be found in the Grey Mountains.","Collected dragon-stone","Collected delver's plaster"}},
