[14282]={nameES="Wanted for Questioning",objectivesES={"Húnbrit has appeared nearby in Fushum Raus.\
\
You should speak with Húnbrit now that Dour Hal has been subdued.","Húnbrit has asked you to capture a half-orc who may have information about the movements of the enemy.","Speak with Húnbrit","Dour Hal can be found in Fushum Raus.\
\
You should do your best to capture Dour Hal and haul him in for questioning.","Capture Dour Hal for questioning","Wanted for Questioning","You have subdued Dour Hal"}},
