[14286]={nameES="Wanted: Spiders Dead!",objectivesES={"Many kinds of insects and spiders can be found in Lhingris.\
\
You should defeat spiders and insects.","Wanted: Spiders Dead!","An angry note hangs on the board, signed by Atli Spider-bane:\
\
'Wanted: Spiders Dead!\
If you travel into Lhingris, kill all the Shelob-spawn you can find! This includes all spider-kind and any other dangerous insects.'","Atli Spider-bane has requested that any adventurers travelling to Lhingris should destroy all the spiders they come across."}},
[14287]={nameES="Wanton Destruction",objectivesES={}},
[14288]={nameES="War Comes to Rohan",objectivesES={}},
[14289]={nameES="Fuerzas reunidas",objectivesES={"Fuerzas reunidas","Habla con Avar en la Guardia Orca","Avar se encuentra en la Guardia Orca, al suroeste de la Gran Escalera.\
\
Debes regresar con Avar para informarle de tu éxito.","Los orcos pueden encontrarse en la Gran Escalera, al noreste de la Guardia Orca.\
\
Avar te ha encargado derrotar a los orcos que custodian el trono de Igash.","Los orcos de Moria mantienen el control de la Gran Escalera y, al frente de ellos, se encuentran Igash el Fanático y su Devoto. Junto a ellos marcha una hueste de temibles orcos procedentes del corazón de Moria."}},
[14290]={nameES="Guerra y hambruna",objectivesES={"Montañeses de Angmar siguieron al ejército orco a través de Ram Dúath hasta las Quebradas del Norte y establecieron un campamento cerca de la entrada del paso. Estos montañeses mantienen abierto el paso desde Angmar.","Los Montaraces de Esteldín no están preparados para enfrentarse a una fuerza así de Ram Dúath, pues los montañeses están bien armados y equipados.\
\
Debes encontrar y destruir sus armas, escudos y reservas de comida. Esto puede retrasar el avance de los montañeses lo suficiente para impedirles montar un ataque importante.","Completado","Guerra y hambruna","Las reservas de comida, armas y escudos se encuentran en la parte norte del campamento de los montañeses, al noreste de Esteldín.\
\
Debes destruir las reservas de comida, armas y escudos de los montañeses, afectando su capacidad para hacer la guerra eficazmente.","Encontraste y destruiste las armas, armaduras y reservas de comida de los montañeses para frenar su avance y su capacidad de formar un verdadero ejército. Has prestado un gran servicio a los Montaraces de Esteldín."}},
[14291]={nameES="War is Coming",objectivesES={"Ordlac is in the Mead Hall of Stoke.\
\
You should wait for Ordlac's advice to be heard.","Grimmar and Ordlac are in the Mead Hall of Stoke. Baldmund is at the inn in the north-eastern part of Stoke. Dudsig is at the Oserley encampment outside the north-east gate of Stoke.\
\
Reeve Fríthild has asked you to speak with the leaders of the forces at Stoke and learn what their advice for her would be.","Talk to Grimmar","Fríthild is in the Mead Hall of Stoke.\
\
You should return to Fríthild with the town leaders' advice.","Talk to Baldmund","Talk to Fríthild","Talk to Dudsig","Talk to Ordlac","War is Coming","Completed Ordlac's Advice","Complete Ordlac's Advice","After receiving the Dunlending token you brought her, Fríthild is concerned that the scope of the invasion from the west is far greater than she first believed.","Baldmund, Grimmar, Ordlac, and Dudsig have need of your services. You should give them your aid.","DNT -- Will not be seen"}},
[14292]={nameES="War is Coming to Imhûlar",objectivesES={"Speak with Mizâdi in Kûr Anzar.","Deliver Usanâb's final message to Mizâdi in Kûr Anzar","Deposit supplies in the waggon outside the back gate.","Deliver Amalíbi's message to Mizâdi","War is Coming to Imhûlar","Speak with the messenger from Khûd Zagin near the back gate.","Speak with the messenger from Khûd Zagin near the back gate","Gather fallen weapons for the Subuzûri and provisions for the waggons going south from around Kûr Anzar.","Deliver Usanâb's final message to Mizâdi in Kûr Anzar.","Deposit supplies in the waggon outside the back gate","Speak with Usanâb from Khûd Zagin.","Speak with Usanâb from Khûd Zagin","Deliver Amalíbi's message to Mizâdi.","Speak with Mizâdi in Kûr Anzar","Nimasi is a traitor to Mizâdi, leading you right into Bârshud's trap. You should now aid Mizâdi in preparing for battle with Bârshud."}},
[14293]={nameES="War of Attrition",objectivesES={"Rodelleth is at Thangúlhad in Gathbúrz.\
\
You should return to Rodelleth with news of your success.","Orcs can be found throughout Gathbúrz.\
\
Rodelleth has bidden you lay waste to the Orc-soldiers garrisoning Gathbúrz, to hinder their own imminent assault upon Lothlórien.","Talk to Rodelleth in Thangúlhad","War of Attrition","The battle upon the slopes below Dol Guldur rages fiercely. As the Malledhrim attempt to lay siege to its walls, the Orcs of Gathbúrz launch one counterattack after another in an attempt to drive them back."}},
[14294]={nameES="War-hounds and Handlers",objectivesES={}},
[14295]={nameES="War-machines in the Brockbridge Siege",objectivesES={}},
[14296]={nameES="War-mongering Slaves",objectivesES={"Nîn-stazg is south-east of Floodwend, just out of sight of the town's walls.\
\
You should defeat Orcs at Nîn-stazg to thin their ranks.","War-mongering Slaves","The forces of Mordor will employ their Orc-slaves for any task, be it soldiers in war or mindless workers to chop wood and assemble weapons. As long as the Orcs endure, the Enemy will never cease to have power.","Nîn-stazg is full of Orcs from Mordor, all working hard to build a deadly offence to be railed against Floodwend.","Completado"}},
[14297]={nameES="Warband II: Arataus",objectivesES={"Defeat Arataus","<rgb=#FF0000>Completing Wildermore's Recovery will cancel this quest.</rgb>","Arataus and his band of riders roam the plains on the eastern side of The Fallows.","Núrzum has been defeated, but the enemy persists throughout much of Wildermore.","The Fallows farmland is safer now that Arataus has been taken care of, thanks to you. The people of Forlaw appreciate your efforts.","Warband II: Arataus","Completado","You have defeated Arataus"}},
[14298]={nameES="Warband II: Balcharan",objectivesES={"Balcharan has been defeated.","<rgb=#FF0000>Completing Wildermore's Recovery will cancel this quest.</rgb>","Núrzum has been defeated, but the enemy persists throughout much of Wildermore. Balcharan and his minions have been terrorizing the people of Writhendowns and must be dealt with.","You have defeated Balcharan!","Balcharan and his minions have been terrorizing the people of Writhendowns and must be dealt with.","Warband II: Balcharan","Completado","Defeat Balcharan"}},
[14299]={nameES="Warband II: Conog",objectivesES={"Núrzum has been defeated, but the enemy persists throughout much of Wildermore. Conog terrorizes the southern edge of the Whitshaws.","<rgb=#FF0000>Completing Wildermore's Recovery will cancel this quest.</rgb>","Warband II: Conog","You have defeated Conog","You have defeated Conog, earning the gratitude of the people of Wildermore.","Completado","Defeat Conog","Conog can be found patrolling the southern Whitshaws with a horde of White Hand minions."}},
[14300]={nameES="Warband II: Foulwing",objectivesES={"Foulwing has been defeated.","Warband II: Foulwing","<rgb=#FF0000>Completing Wildermore's Recovery will cancel this quest.</rgb>","You have defeated Foulwing!","Foulwing and his minions have been terrorizing the people of Writhendowns and must be dealt with.","Defeat Foulwing","Foulwing  and his minions have been terrorizing the people of Writhendowns and must be dealt with.","Completado","Núrzum has been defeated, but the enemy persists throughout much of Wildermore. Foulwing and his minions have been terrorizing the people of Writhendowns and must be dealt with."}},
[14301]={nameES="Warband II: Gîmtog",objectivesES={"Núrzum has been defeated, but enemies persist throughout much of Wildermore. Gîmtog terrorizes the eastern edge of the Whitshaws.","Warband II: Gîmtog","<rgb=#FF0000>Completing Wildermore's Recovery will cancel this quest.</rgb>","Gîmtog can be found patrolling the eastern edge of the Whitshaws with a pack of vicious wolves.","Completado","You have defeated Gîmtog, earning the gratitude of the people of Wildermore.","Defeat Gîmtog","You have defeated Gîmtog"}},
