[14303]={nameES="Warband II: Rottenheart",objectivesES={"Núrzum has been defeated, but enemies persist throughout much of Wildermore. The Huorn, Rottenheart, is an unruly force in Balewood beyond Leaflock's control.","Defeat Rottenheart","Warband II: Rottenheart","You have defeated Rottenheart and granted a small degree of peace to Balewood.","<rgb=#FF0000>Completing Wildermore's Recovery will cancel this quest.</rgb>","Rottenheart can be found in south-western Balewood atop a snowy hill.\
\
