[14304]={nameES="Warband II: Shaguk",objectivesES={"The Fallows farmland is safer now that Shaguk has been taken care of, thanks to you. The people of Forlaw appreciate your efforts.","<rgb=#FF0000>Completing Wildermore's Recovery will cancel this quest.</rgb>","Defeat Shaguk","Warband II: Shaguk","Núrzum has been defeated, but the enemy persists throughout much of Wildermore.","Shaguk and his band of riders roam the plains on the eastern side of The Fallows.","You have defeated Shaguk","Completado"}},
[14305]={nameES="Warband II: Shum",objectivesES={"Warband II: Shum","Shum is training some of Gajat's adolescent Warg pups how to hunt in a pack. They stalk the smoking ruins that were the farms of The Fallows.","<rgb=#FF0000>Completing Wildermore's Recovery will cancel this quest.</rgb>","You have defeated Shum","Núrzum has been defeated, but the enemy persists throughout much of Wildermore.","Completado","Defeat Shum","The Fallows farmland is safer now that Shum has been taken care of, thanks to you. The people of Forlaw appreciate your efforts."}},
[14306]={nameES="Warband II: The High Knolls Blizzard",objectivesES={"Warband II: The High Knolls Blizzard","<rgb=#FF0000>Completing Wildermore's Recovery will cancel this quest.</rgb>","Ventiscas de las Altas Cumbres vencidas","The High Knolls Blizzard can be found moving up and down the High Knolls area of Wildermore.","Derrota a la Ventisca de las Altas Cumbres","Completado","Núrzum has been defeated, but the enemy persists throughout much of Wildermore. The High Knolls Blizzard, a deadly cluster of frost grims, has settled into the hills of the High Knolls.","You have defeated the High Knolls Blizzard, earning the gratitude of the people of Wildermore."}},
[14307]={nameES="Warband II: Varg",objectivesES={"<rgb=#FF0000>Completing Wildermore's Recovery will cancel this quest.</rgb>","Warband II: Varg","Defeat Varg","You have defeated Varg and his warband, and secured a more peaceful future for the denizens of Balewood.","Núrzum has been defeated, but the enemy persists throughout much of Wildermore. The Uruk captain, Varg, is a brutal leader of the White Hand forces in Balewood and must be defeated.","Completado","You have defeated Varg and his warband.","Defeated Varg","Varg can be found roaming near the Orc roadway in northern Balewood.\
\
The Uruk leader, Varg, must be defeated before he can sow more havoc in Balewood."}},
[14308]={nameES="Warband II: Voz",objectivesES={"Voz has been defeated.","Voz and his minions have been terrorizing the people of Writhendowns and must be dealt with.","<rgb=#FF0000>Completing Wildermore's Recovery will cancel this quest.</rgb>","You have defeated Voz!","Warband II: Voz","Defeat Voz","Núrzum has been defeated, but the enemy persists throughout much of Wildermore. Voz and his minions have been terrorizing the people of Writhendowns and must be dealt with.","Completado"}},
