[14332]={nameES="Warband: Fen-skulk",objectivesES={"Defeat Fen-skulk","You have defeated Fen-skulk and the beast's warband.","You have defeated Fen-skulk and the beast's warband!","You have slain Fen-skulk and vanquished a threat to the safety of all that dwell within Old Anórien.","Completado","Fen-skulk can be found patrolling Talath Anor.\
\
