[14344]={nameES="Warband: Inras",objectivesES={"Inras and his pack of wolves are defeated, and no longer hunt the southern plains of the Stonedeans.","Defeated Inras","The plains north-west of Edoras were rich with wildlife, but the arrival of the White Hand reduced the amount of food for the local predators. One such predator is now almost rabid with hunger. Inras and his pack of wolves hunt the plains and attack anything that moves.","Inras, the biggest predator has been defeated and is likely to be replaced by another predator eventually. For now there is some semblance of peace in the land.","Warband: Inras","Defeat Inras","A large wolf has become the biggest predator in the southern plains of the Stonedeans. Inras and his pack of wolves are almost rabid with hunger.","Completado","Find Inras","The hungry wolf pack led by Inras is hunting in the southern plains of the Stonedeans."}},
