[14346]={nameES="Warband: Karkas",objectivesES={"Karkas se puede encontrar pisoteando las colinas de las Altas Cumbres.","Defeated Karkas","Karkas smashes across the High Knolls in the shadow of Núrzum's might, crushing as he goes.","Warband: Karkas","Defeat Karkas","You have defeated Karkas, earning the trust of the people of Wildermore.","Completado"}},
[14347]={nameES="Warband: Kasota",objectivesES={}},
[14348]={nameES="Warband: Keeper Shomushúk Cat-master of the Khundolar",objectivesES={"While exploring North Ithilien's northern reaches, you have encountered Keeper Shomushúk and his pack of battle-cats.\
\
This fierce Khundolar keeper and his pets pose a great threat to the Rangers and the Host of the West alike. He and his warband search the hills of North Ithilien for the last remaining Ranger refuge, and he must not be allowed to discover it.\
\
You should defeat Keeper Shomushúk and keep him from uncovering the hidden location of Henneth Annûn.","You have defeated Keeper Shomushúk.","Defeat Keeper Shomushúk","You have defeated Keeper Shomushúk and his many battle-cats!","Keeper Shomushúk can be found far to the north-west in North Ithilien.\
\
You have encountered Keeper Shomushúk and should defeat him and his battle-cats before your adventures take you beyond North Ithilien.","Completado","Keeper Shomushúk has many vicious battle-cats under his command and wields them against those who would oppose the Khundolar in North Ithilien.","The Khundolar pose a grave threat to the Rangers and the Host of the West alike. Even after their defeat at the Battle of the Pelennor Fields, their loyalty to the Dark Lord has proven to be unfailing.\
\
Their vicious battle-cats are bred for war, and to have defeated such a seasoned warrior as Keeper Shomushúk will hinder their efforts in North Ithilien and clear the path for the Host of the West.","Warband: Keeper Shomushúk , Cat-master of the Khundolar"}},
[14349]={nameES="Warband: Kramp",objectivesES={}},
[14350]={nameES="Warband: Krûghu",objectivesES={"Krûghu and his allies can be found patrolling the Drúadan Forest.\
\
You have encountered Krûghu's warband and should defeat them for the good of the people of Far Anórien.","Warband: Krûghu","Completado","Defeat Krûghu","You have encountered Krûghu, the mysterious Dheghûn. The strange beast has entered the woods from parts unknown with his allies and are threatening the balance of the forest.","Krûghu and his warband can be found roaming the Drúadan Forest. The strange Dheghûn have entered the woods from parts unknown and are threatening the balance of the forest.","You have defeated Krûghu and his warband!","You have defeated Krûghu and the Dheghûn's warband.","You have slain Krûghu and his allies and vanquished a threat to the safety of all that dwell within Far Anórien.","Krûghu can be found patrolling the Drúadan Forest.\
\
You have encountered Krûghu and his allies and should defeat them for the good of the people of Far Anórien."}},
