[14353]={nameES="Warband: Macsen",objectivesES={"Macsen and his band of riders have set ablaze the farms in the southern Stonedeans, and keep watch the road south-east of Brockbridge for trade or reinforcements.","Find Macsen","Macsen and his elite band of riders are now defeated, and can no longer ravage the plains in the eastern Stonedeans.","Warband: Macsen","Macsen and his band of riders have set ablaze the farms in the southern Stonedeans, and keep watch on the road south-east of Brockbridge for trade or reinforcements.","Macsen leads an elite band of riders out of Madh-fushaum, and was trained in combat on a horse by the Uruk-hai of the White Hand.","Defeat Macsen","Completado","With the mighty Macsen and his riders now defeated, it has left Madh-fushaum more susceptible to mounted attacks; though with the siege on Brockbridge, one may not come from the Rohirrim for some time.","Macsen is the leader of an elite band of Dunlending riders that are quite formidable despite the Dunlendings not having much history as riders of horses. They would give all but the most skilled Rohirrim trouble in battle.","Defeated Macsen"}},
