[14359]={nameES="Warband: Nûdît",objectivesES={"You have defeated Nûdît, sparing the men of Entwade another great assault on their river settlement. The people of Kingstead will rest more easily now that this threat has been quelled.","Defeat Nûdît","Nûdît can be found on the plains to the north of Entwade.\
\
You have encountered the mighty Uruk-hai, Nûdît, and his warband. You should defeat him before his forces reach Entwade.","Nûdît can be found on the plains to the north of Entwade.","Warband: Nûdît","Defeated Nûdît","A vile Uruk-captain stalks the fields near Entwade in hopes of claiming this crucial settlement for the White Hand.","While riding on the plains of Kingstead, you have encountered a mighty Uruk-hai rider leading his Orc forces toward the river-settlement of Entwade. You should defeat him to protect this pivotal location in Kingstead as well as the people of Rohan.","Completado","You have defeated Nûdît, and spared Entwade another brutal assault.","You have not yet defeated Nûdît, leaving his warband to roam freely across the King's lands."}},
[14360]={nameES="Warband: Ognir",objectivesES={"Ognir hunts the lands along the northern banks of the swiftwater river to the north-east of Brockbridge.","The ancient troll Ognir has been defeated, and will now only lurk in the nightmares of the people of the Stonedeans.","Find Ognir","Defeat Ognir","Ognir hunts the lands along the northern banks of the Swiftwater River to the north-east of Brockbridge.","Completado","Warband: Ognir","Ognir, a troll who seems as old as the mountains nearby, has long hunted the beasts along the northern banks of the Swiftwater River.","Stories of Ognir have long been told to the children in the Stonedeans, of an ancient troll who lurks near the northern banks of the Swiftwater River. Those who hunt the lands of the Stonedeans have learned to avoid the area, or risk finding themselves hunted.","Defeated Ognir"}},
