[14379]={nameES="Warband: Swertríper",objectivesES={"Warband: Swertríper","The fearsome láthbear, Swertríper, has left the confines of his den in order to ravage the countryside of the Norcrofts. All who cross his path face immense danger.","You have defeated Swertríper","The hulking láthbear, Swertríper, has been put to rest. His deadly claws and menacing teeth will cease to threaten the farmers of the Norcrofts.","Swertríper, has left the confines of his den in order to ravage the countryside of the Norcrofts.","Completado","Defeat the láthbear, Swertríper","The fearsome láthbear, Swertríper, has left the confines of his den to ravage the countryside of the Norcrofts. All who cross his path face immense danger."}},
