[14473]={nameES="Weakening the Influence",objectivesES={"There are several Boar-totems placed throughout the cave. Destroying them may lower the morale of the Boar-tribe.","Destroying the Boar-totems has lowered the morale of the Boar-tribe Orcs.","Completado","Weakening the Influence","Destroy Boar-totems"}},
[14474]={nameES="Debilitando la Marea",objectivesES={"Los Invocadores de Huesos Ongbúrz se pueden encontrar en las zonas más profundas de Dol Dínen, más allá de las máquinas de asedio, al sureste de Esteldín.","Debilitando la Marea","Completado","Has derrotado a un buen número de Invocadores de Huesos Ongbúrz en Dol Dínen.","Los Invocadores de Huesos Ongbúrz se pueden encontrar en las zonas más profundas de Dol Dínen, más allá de las máquinas de asedio, al sureste de Esteldín.\
\
Estos hechiceros entre los orcos de Dol Dínen deben ser derrotados."}},
[14475]={nameES="Wealth of the Dead",objectivesES={}},
[14476]={nameES="Weapon Repossession",objectivesES={"The dwarf-made weapons stolen by the Jangovar may still be nearby!\
\
You should recover stolen weapons.","Weapon Repossession","Talk to Grámi Hornhelm","Grámi Hornhelm has asked you to recover what stolen weapons you can, before the Jangovar retreat back to Utterby.","You should talk to Grámi Hornhelm, who can be found inside Hammerstead, in the northern Ironfold."}},
[14477]={nameES="Weapon-hoards of the Corsairs",objectivesES={}},
[14478]={nameES="Control de Armas (Diario)",objectivesES={"Entrega una caja de armas al líder del Gremio de Armeros de Umbar","Fabrica una caja de armas para el Gremio de Armeros de Umbar","El gremio de armeros de Umbar Baharbêl forja y mantiene armas para vendedores, guardias y marineros. Un representante del gremio pidió tu ayuda con todas las solicitudes.","Lleva la caja de armas al líder del Gremio de Armeros de Umbar.","La receta necesaria para completar esta misión está disponible para su compra. <rgb=#00f000>Compra la receta de la misión al líder del gremio.</rgb>\
\
Empaqueta una caja de armas para Umbar Baharbêl.","Control de Armas (Diario)"}},
[14479]={nameES="Control de Armas (Diario)",objectivesES={"Entrega una caja de armas al líder del Gremio de Armeros de Umbar","Fabrica una caja de armas para el Gremio de Armeros de Umbar","El gremio de armeros de Umbar Baharbêl forja y mantiene armas para vendedores, guardias y marineros. Un representante del gremio pidió tu ayuda con todas las solicitudes.","Lleva la caja de armas al líder del Gremio de Armeros de Umbar.","La receta necesaria para completar esta misión está disponible para su compra. <rgb=#00f000>Compra la receta de la misión al líder del gremio.</rgb>\
\
Empaqueta una caja de armas para Umbar Baharbêl.","Control de Armas (Diario)"}},
[14480]={nameES="Weapons For Zaumoz",objectivesES={"Examine the empty weapon rack in Drushkála","Find another weapon rack to the east in Drushkála","An empty weapon rack stands within Drushkála.","Orcs seeking to join the crew of the Grishúlvosh have been commanded to steal weapons from Drushkála for Zaumoz the Black Wind.","Find another weapon rack to the south-east in Drushkála","An ally of Zaumoz the Black Wind charges toward you!","Many of the weapons in Drushkála have been brought to the ship Grishúlvosh, strengthening the fighting power of Zaumoz and his crew.\
\
It is more important than ever that you find some means of hindering the Song of Waves and Wind, preventing ships such as Grishúlvosh from leaving Sûg Nidar.","After the battle, you realize someone has quietly removed the weapons from the rack","Like the first, this rack is empty. Many weapons have gone to the ship Grishúlvosh","Another weapon rack stands to the south-east in Drushkála. Does this one still bear weapons?","Weapons For Zaumoz","A small parchment is stuck to the empty weapon rack with a knife:\
\
\\qYou seek to join the crew of the Grishúlvosh? Then bring as many weapons as you can carry from Drushkála! Make yourself more valuable to ZAUMOZ, and he will reward you!\\q","Many of the weapons in Drushkála have been brought to the ship Grishúlvosh.","Completado","You might learn more about the Grishúlvosh if you find more weapon racks to the east in Drushkála."}},
[14481]={nameES="Weapons Unused",objectivesES={"Bring the forgotten weapons to Shegai in the Armoury","Shegai has asked you to retrieve the weapons that were left lying around Furukzahar.","Weapons Unused","Forgotten weapons have been discarded throughout Furukzahar and should be returned to the Armoury.","Shegai is in the Armoury of Furukzahar."}},
[14482]={nameES="Armas para Umbar (Semanal)",objectivesES={"Armas para Umbar (Semanal)","Los Armeros proveen a las masas de Umbar Baharbêl, y tú estás haciendo tu parte para ayudar.","Completaste muchas solicitudes de armeros de Umbar.","Completa las solicitudes del Gremio de Armeros de Umbar.\
\
Puedes adquirir estas misiones del líder del Gremio de Armeros de Umbar en la sala del gremio de artesanos de Umbar Baharbêl.","Completa las cuotas diarias para el Gremio de Armeros de Umbar.","Completado"}},
[14483]={nameES="Weapons for War",objectivesES={"Ingold has asked you to destroy weapon racks at Fushaum Tûm.","A notice is pinned to the board, signed by Ingold:\
\
'The encampment of Fushaum Tûm has amassed a collection of weapons. A brave adventurer is needed to destroy the weapons of battle that the encampment of Fushaum Tûm has acquired.'","Weapons for War","Ingold, a soldier of Gondor, has scouted Dor Amarth and is concerned with the growing numbers of foes gathering at the encampment of Fushaum Tûm."}},
[14484]={nameES="Weapons for the Return",objectivesES={"The weapons barrel can be found at Erchar's encampment in the western end of Dor-en-Ernil.\
\
Put the weapons in the barrel.","Erchar has asked you to retrieve weapons for his men so that they stand a fighting chance for the return to Linhir.","Weapons for the Return","A half-troll scout lunges from the brush","Erchar can be found at his encampment in the western end of Dor-en-Ernil.\
\
Return the weapons to Erchar.","Talk to Erchar at his encampment","Put the weapons in the barrel","Erchar can be found at his encampment in the western end of Dor-en-Ernil, south-west of Tungobel.\
\
Return the weapons to Erchar.","Fought off the half-troll scout","Corsair weapons can be found in the village of Tungobel.\
\
Steal weapons from Corsair forces."}},
[14485]={nameES="Weapons of War",objectivesES={"Return to Chieftain Torbok at the Grimwood Lumber-yard","To wage a war, one needs weapons. To sustain a war-machine, one needs the items to drive the war-machine.","Weapons of War","Wood can be found in the Grimwood Forest and metal can be found in the Isendeep Mine.\
\
Chieftain Torbok directed you to support the war effort by stripping the mines and forest bare."}},
[14486]={nameES="Weapons of the Enemy -- Redux",objectivesES={"Defeat Goeolgon","Weapons of the Enemy -- Redux","Report to Gwathryn","Handarod is at Esteldín in the North Downs.\
\
Handarod has bid you enter Barad Dúrgul and recover the ring Narchuil.","You defeated Goeolgon!","Gwathryn is at Tármunn Súrsa in Angmar.\
\
You should report to Gwathryn at once.","Handarod has told you that the Enemy holds the ring Narchuil at Barad Dúrgul. Though it is a minor essay in Ringcraft, it is dangerous nonetheless."}},
[14487]={nameES="Weapons of the Frost-bound",objectivesES={}},
[14488]={nameES="Weapons of the Guard",objectivesES={}},
[14489]={nameES="Weapons of the Marsh",objectivesES={}},
[14490]={nameES="Armas de los Orcos",objectivesES={"Tras examinar la torre de asedio, determinas que la única forma de destruirla es con fuego.","Busca una antorcha para quemar la catapulta","Torre de asedio quemada","Busca una antorcha para quemar la torre de asedio","Los Orcos estaban más avanzados en sus planes para construir armas de asedio con las que atacar Gabilshathûr de lo que Avar pensaba. Te dijo que habían construido dos armas de asedio y que las estaban ocultando en las cavernas de Grishbalt.","Tras examinar la catapulta, determinas que la única forma de destruirla es con fuego.","Armas de los Orcos","Avar está en Gabilshathûr, al sur de Duvuinen.\
\
Deberías regresar con Avar para informarle de tu éxito.","Las cavernas de Grishbalt se encuentran al norte de Gabilshathûr, a lo largo del lado este de Duvuinen.\
\
Avar te pidió que encuentres y destruyas las dos armas de asedio que los Orcos han escondido allí.","Catapulta quemada"}},
[14491]={nameES="Weapons of the Wose",objectivesES={"Dhôm-dhuga-Nôkh can be found in Bhol Rûdh.\
\
You should talk to Dhôm-dhuga-Nôkh.","Weapons of the Wose","Dhôm-dhuga-Nôkh, a villager of the Red Sky Clan, has asked for your help assembling spears for the attack on Kala-gijak.","Talk to Dhôm-dhuga-Nôkh","Spear-racks can be found in Bhol Rûdh, next to Dhôm-dhuga-Nôkh.\
\
You should assemble spears and place them on the spear-racks.","Dhôm-dhuga-Nôkh examines the spears you assembled. She looks pleasantly surprised.\
\
'Good! You must be skilled fighter.'","Spear-heads and spear-shafts have been hidden all over Bhol Rûdh.\
\
You should collect spear-heads and spear-shafts."}},
[14492]={nameES="Weapons out of Hand",objectivesES={}},
[14493]={nameES="Weaponsmith: Expert Ice-pick",objectivesES={"<rgb=#FF0000>Completing Wildermore's Recovery will cancel this quest.</rgb>","Deliver the expert ice-pick to Hildelith","A skilled weaponsmith such as yourself can help the refugees of Wildermore by forging an expert ice-pick for them.","Weaponsmith: Expert Ice-pick","Hildelith has given you a recipe for an expert ice-pick.\
\
You should forge an expert ice pick for the workers trying to break the ice left by Núrzum.","Hildelith is in Forlaw.\
\
You have forged an expert ice-pick and should now deliver it to Forlaw."}},
[14494]={nameES="Weaponsmithing Like a Dwarf",objectivesES={"The blade has been cooled and hardened","Weaponsmithing Like a Dwarf","Belg Thickshanks has asked you to help craft a dagger in Hammerstead.\
\
You should assemble the dagger at the assembly table.","Grámi Hornhelm has requested that you help craft a weapon.\
\
You should talk to Belg Thickshanks to proceed.","Re-heat the blade in the forge","The steel is now blade-shaped","Grámi examines your work with a discerning eye.\
\
'Acceptable work. We will put it with the others.'","Heat steel in the forge","The blade now has a sharp edge","Belg Thickshanks has asked you to help craft a dagger in Hammerstead.\
\
You should re-heat the blade in the forge.","The steel is red-hot and ready to be worked","Habla con Belg Zancagruesa","Quench the blade in the water tank","Belg Thickshanks has asked you to help craft a dagger in Hammerstead.\
\
You should use the forge to heat steel.","Belg Thickshanks has asked you to help craft a dagger in Hammerstead.\
\
You should hammer the steel on the anvil to shape it.","Hone the blade on the grindstone","The blade is now red-hot","Grámi Hornhelm is grateful for your aid with the Easterlings, and has offered to give you a small taste of the dwarf craft of weaponsmithing.","Hammer the steel on the anvil","Belg Thickshanks has asked you to help craft a dagger in Hammerstead.\
\
You should hone the edge of the blade on the grindstone.","Belg Thickshanks has asked you to help craft a dagger in Hammerstead.\
\
You should quench the red-hot blade in the water tank.","Talk to Grámi Hornhelm","Belg Thickshanks has asked you to help craft a dagger in Hammerstead.\
\
You should talk to Belg Thickshanks.","You should talk to Grámi Hornhelm, who  can be found in Hammerstead.","The dagger is now fully assembled!","Assemble the dagger at the assembly table"}},
[14495]={nameES="Tejedores bajo las ruinas",objectivesES={"Tejedores bajo las ruinas","Lleva ojos de araña a Hunulf Mascador","Las arañas de la valle bajo Minas Eriol han atacado a los Eglain durante mucho tiempo.","Las arañas se encuentran en la valle bajo Minas Eriol, al noroeste del promontorio de los Eglain.\
\
Hunulf Mascador cree que tú y tus aliados podéis arrancar los ojos de las arañas de las landas, privándolas así de su fuerza."}},
[14496]={nameES="El cortador de telas",objectivesES={"Pasa las telarañas de la Arboleda de Lob","Has logrado pasar las telarañas gruesas","Encuentra el árbol caminante","El cortador de telas","El árbol caminante se estremece cuando lo tocas. Pequeñas arañas trepan por todo él, sus telarañas cubren su corteza. Parece que el árbol caminante está en apuros.","Gammer Boffin ha preparado un desagradable brebaje con baba de babosa que debería permitirte atravesar las telarañas que protegen la guarida de arañas en el Bosque del Fardo.","El árbol caminante, si es que existe, probablemente se encuentra en algún lugar del nido de arañas.\
\
Has logrado abrirte camino hasta el nido usando el brebaje de Gammer Boffin. Ella también mencionó una historia para niños sobre un árbol caminante en el bosque que podría ayudarte a lidiar con las arañas, aunque te advirtió de que podría ser peligroso para ti también.","El nido de arañas se encuentra al noroeste del centro de Sobrecolina, más allá del muro y del aserradero.\
\
El Oficial Madriguera te envió a ver a Gammer Boffin en Sobrecolina para que consiguieras algo que disolviera las telarañas que bloqueaban el camino hacia el nido. Gammer te advirtió de que la mezcla se seca rápidamente, así que debes darte prisa. También mencionó una historia para niños sobre un árbol caminante en el Bosque del Fardo que podría servirte de aliado... si es que existe."}},
[14497]={nameES="Webbed Harvest",objectivesES={"Asilimu has asked you to gather ichor and silk from the spiders in Ushbarab.","Webbed Harvest","Return to Asilimu","Bring the spider ichor and spider silk back to Asilimu near Ushbarab","Asilimu has asked for your help gathering ichor and silk from nearby spiders in Ushbarab."}},
[14498]={nameES="Las telarañas de la tristeza",objectivesES={"Laergil está preocupado por las arañas que infestan Talath Ondren.","Las telarañas de la tristeza","Regresa con Laergil","Talath Ondren está al este de las Aguas Lúgubres. Derrota a las arañas que hay allí y recoge sus hileras.\
\
Laergil te ha pedido que elimines las arañas que infestan Talath Ondren para recoger sus hileras. Esto le ayudará a descubrir de dónde obtienen su fuerza estas criaturas infernales."}},
[14499]={nameES="Telarañas Enmarañadas -- Nivel 1",objectivesES={"Derrotaste al draug Beremud y sus esbirros","Un llamado oscuro y malévolo ha sido enviado a los antiguos esbirros del Señor Oscuro, convocándolos al servicio una vez más.","Telarañas Enmarañadas -- Nivel 1","Derrota al draug Beremud y sus esbirros","Derrota a los lugartenientes del Señor Oscuro en las Hondonadas Enmarañadas.","Derrota a la Gran Araña Dígelir","Derrotaste a la Gran Araña Dígelir"}},
[14500]={nameES="Telarañas Enmarañadas -- Nivel 2",objectivesES={"Derrotaste al draug Beremud y sus esbirros","Derrota al draug Beremud y sus esbirros","Un llamado oscuro y malévolo ha sido enviado a los esbirros del Señor Oscuro, convocándolos al servicio una vez más.","Derrota a los lugartenientes del Señor Oscuro en las Hondonadas Enmarañadas.","Derrota a la Gran Araña Dígelir","Telarañas Enmarañadas -- Nivel 2"}},
[14501]={nameES="Wedding Supplies",objectivesES={"Merilien is located on the Seventh Circle of Minas Tirith.\
\
You should bring the wedding supply crates to Merilien.","Wedding Supplies","The wedding planner in Minas Tirith seeks assistance retrieving a crate of event supplies.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This quest will be removed from your quest log when the current festival ends.</rgb>","Deliver the crates to Merilien","Wedding supply crates can be found on the Third Circle of Minas Tirith.\
\
The wedding planner has asked you to retrieve wayward supply crates needed for her events."}},
[14502]={nameES="Weed Invasion",objectivesES={"Breniriel has asked you to pull any invasive weeds you find in Edhellond.","You have pulled all the weeds you could find.\
\
You should talk to Breniriel in Edhellond.","Weed Invasion","Traces of the Corsairs' occupation of Edhellond persist in the form of an invasive plant.","Talk to Breniriel"}},
[14503]={nameES="Algas del río",objectivesES={"Los rondadores de la arena se pueden encontrar en el Barandalf, al sur del Coloso.\
\
Herthdúr te ha pedido que busques montones de algas mojadas en los rondadores de la arena del Barandalf.","Herthdúr está en el Coloso, al norte del Barandalf.\
\
Herthdúr estará ansioso por comenzar a preparar cataplasmas con las algas que has recogido.","Lleva las algas a Herthdúr","Pareece que cuando los rondadores de la arena digieren las algas del río en la parte alta del Baranduin, les confiere a las plantas una ligera capacidad de curación.","Algas del río"}},
[14504]={nameES="Weekly Conquest: Allegiance Quests",objectivesES={"Expedition Organizers can be found in Allegiance Halls.\
\
You should talk to your Expedition Organizer.","Talk to your Expedition Organizer","Allegiance quests can be found on Bounty Boards in Gorgoroth and Allegiance Halls.\
\
You should complete five Allegiance quests in each Region of Gorgoroth.","There is much to do for the Conquest of Gorgoroth to succeed. This week, you should focus your efforts on Allegiance quests.","Weekly Conquest: Allegiance Quests"}},
[14505]={nameES="Weekly Conquest: Group Instances",objectivesES={"Complete Dungeons of Naerband - Tier 2","Talk to your Expedition Organizer","There is much to do for the Conquest of Gorgoroth to succeed. This week, you should focus your efforts on group instances.","Complete Dungeons of Naerband","Complete Court of Seregost - Tier 2","Complete Court of Seregost","Group instances can be entered through the Instance Finder.\
\
You should complete group instances in Gorgoroth.","Expedition Organizers can be found in Allegiance Halls.\
\
You should talk to your Expedition Organizer.","Weekly Conquest: Group Instances"}},
