[14517]={nameES="Welcome to Harwick",objectivesES={"Welcome to Harwick","Talk to Harding","Harding has called a meeting in the Mead Hall of Harwick, and awaits your arrival.","In your last visit with Harding, he was not sure he could trust you, and was frustrated at the timing of your meeting. Since then you have done a service to Harwick and should have a more favourable meeting this time around.","Captain Agelmund is eager to take you for another meeting with the Thane of Harwick, Reeve of the Wold and Aldor of the Eastemnet.\
\
You should speak with Captain Agelmund to travel to Harwick for a meeting with Harding.","Meet Cíllan at the Mead Hall for an audience with Harding"}},
[14518]={nameES="Welcome to Hytbold",objectivesES={"Locate Hytbold's Norcrofts District","The various sections of Hytbold are spread throughout the ruined town.\
\
Edgal has asked you to take a quick look around the burned-out town of Hytbold.","While the river now flows by unchecked, once repaired this mill will bring great use to Hytbold","The Mead Hall of Hytbold is a large, impressive structure. There is much to be done to restore its glory, however","Welcome to Hytbold","Locate Hytbold's Farms","Locate Hytbold's Smithy","Locate Hytbold's Wold District","Locate Hytbold's Lumbermill","Locate Hytbold's Sutcrofts District","Locate Hytbold's Entwash District","While they are not scholars, the Rohirrim know the power and value of knowledge. This place was once that and can be again","Edgal is waiting at the Mead Hall in Hytbold.\
\
You should return to Edgal and speak to him about beginning the repairs.","The people of the Wold build strong defences. They will be a great boon to Hytbold if they return","The people of the Sutcrofts are experts at farming and assaulting the enemy. They will empower any town to outlast and destroy its enemies","Edgal has asked you to take a quick walk around Hytbold to assess the current state of the town.","Locate Hytbold's Study","Enough of the structure remains that, with a little work, this smithy could be put back to good use","Talk to Edgal","The people of the Norcrofts are unrivalled in their command of horses. They will be needed to defend Hytbold to the last","The farmhouses escaped mostly unscathed, but the farm itself did not. Repairing these will be a priority if anyone is to return","Locate Hytbold's Mead Hall","The people of the Entwash are renowned for their tales and songs. They will not allow any town to forget its past"}},
[14519]={nameES="Welcome to Iridír",objectivesES={"Welcome to Iridír","Iridír is along the north bank of the Ikorbân River in Ambarûl. You should go there and meet Girhâzi.","This formidable-looking woman must be Girhâzi, the apparent leader of the people here in Ambarûl. With a curious look, she silently assesses you for several uncomfortable heartbeats.","Introduce yourself to Girhâzi","A guard along the road has directed you to the village of Iridír, where you have been told to go and present yourself to Girhâzi."}},
[14520]={nameES="Welcome to Lyndelby",objectivesES={}},
[14521]={nameES="La bienvenida a Moria",objectivesES={"Thormóth, líder del grupo de expedición de enanos que sostiene el Umbral de Durin, te ha pedido que ayudes a su gente a establecerse después de la prueba en la puerta.","Gamli y Ráthulf están en el Umbral de Durin. Athils está en el Ala Norte del Umbral de Durin: sube las escaleras, hacia el norte y luego hacia el oeste.\
\
Thormóth te ha pedido que hables con algunos de los enanos que tienen dificultades para establecerse en el Umbral de Durin.","La bienvenida a Moria","Ayuda a Gamli","Ayuda a Ráthulf","Ayuda a Athils","Habla con Thormóth","Thormóth está en el Umbral de Durin.\
\
Habiendo prestado una mano amiga en este primer sitio de la expedición, ahora deberías regresar con su líder."}},
[14522]={nameES="Welcomed Provisions",objectivesES={"Talk to Ingold","Ingold worries that provisions will run out during the expedition into Mordor and asks you to acquire meats in Dor Amarth for him.","Welcomed Provisions","Store the cooked meats for Ingold","You should cook the raw meat at one of the burning fires nearby the Ruins of Díngarth.","Black goats and sûlokil can be found sparsely populating the plains and hills of Dor Amarth.\
\
You should gather meats from these beasts to help feed the conquest into Mordor.","Placed the cooked meats in a crate for curing","You should bring the cooked meats back to the Ruins of Díngarth and store them away.","Ingold can be found at the Ruins of Díngarth.\
\
You should speak with Ingold.","Gather meats"}},
[14523]={nameES="Mathoms Bien Conservados — Introducción",objectivesES={"Lleva el mathom bien conservado a Eustoma Riberalodosa","Eustoma Riberalodosa está en la Casa de los Mathoms, en Cavada Grande, en la Comarca.\
\
Eustoma Riberalodosa te ha pedido que le lleves mathoms bien conservados.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> Los mathoms bien conservados pueden obtenerse de Hombres, Enanos, orcos, trolls y Muertos de nivel 35 a 45 en todo el mundo.</rgb>","Eustoma Riberalodosa te dijo que la Sociedad de los Mathoms no tenía muchas piezas en condiciones de exhibición.","Mathoms Bien Conservados — Introducción","Recoge un mathom bien conservado","Mathom bien conservado recogido"}},
[14524]={nameES="Bien preparados",objectivesES={"Bien preparados","Northrim está en el campamento de los Eglain en Dol Vaeg, con vistas a Haragmar y Nan Dhelu.\
\
Stanric te envió con Northrim para completar más tareas necesarias para preparar a los Eglain para el sombrío futuro que les espera.","Habla con Northrim en Dol Vaeg","Los jabalíes se encuentran hacia el este, a lo largo del Gran Camino del Este, que está al sur de Ost Guruth.\
\
Northrim te envió a recolectar piernas y estómagos de jabalí para ayudar a los Eglain a llenar sus reservas para el invierno.","Lleva los estómagos y la carne de jabalí a Northrim en Dol Vaeg","A pesar de contar con un pequeño suministro de armas y armaduras, Stanric de los Eglain intenta organizar al menos una defensa mínima contra las bestias salvajes y peligrosas y otros enemigos que acechan las ruinas que los Eglain llaman su hogar."}},
[14525]={nameES="Well-supplied",objectivesES={"The Nink-hai Orc-tribe can be found south-west of Odda's tent.\
\
Odda has given you a torch which can be used to set fire to the supply-stores of the Orcs.","Odda is concerned about the number of supplies being moved into the Nink-hai camp and from whence the supplies might be coming.","Talk to Odda at his tent","Odda can be found near the road south of the Cuthstan.\
\
The Orcs' supply-stores have been destroyed by your actions, and Odda is awaiting news of your success.","You are near a Nink-hai supply-store","Well-supplied"}},
[14526]={nameES="West Gondor - Dol Amroth I",objectivesES={}},
[14527]={nameES="West Gondor - Dol Amroth II",objectivesES={}},
[14528]={nameES="West Gondor - Dol Amroth III",objectivesES={}},
[14529]={nameES="West Gondor - Dol Amroth IV",objectivesES={}},
[14530]={nameES="West Rohan - Eorlingas I",objectivesES={}},
[14531]={nameES="West Rohan - Eorlingas II",objectivesES={}},
[14532]={nameES="West Rohan - Eorlingas III",objectivesES={}},
[14533]={nameES="West Rohan - Eorlingas IV",objectivesES={}},
[14534]={nameES="West Rohan - Helmingas I",objectivesES={}},
[14535]={nameES="West Rohan - Helmingas II",objectivesES={}},
[14536]={nameES="West Rohan - Helmingas III",objectivesES={}},
[14537]={nameES="West Rohan - Helmingas IV",objectivesES={}},
[14538]={nameES="Wetlands of Southern Mirkwood",objectivesES={"Laidhriel is interested in collecting samples of water to keep for study upon her return to Lothlórien so that she can better understand the environs of Mirkwood's swamp-lands.","Laidhriel stands at the entrance to Estolad Mernael in the Drownholt.\
\
You should return to Laidhriel with the water-samples she requested of you.","Wetlands of Southern Mirkwood","Bring the phials to Laidhriel at Estolad Mernael","Samples of water can be collected throughout the many shallow pools of the Drownholt in Mirkwood.\
\
Laidhriel has asked you to wander among the pools of the Drownholt and collect several phials of water for her collection."}},
[14539]={nameES="What Ales You",objectivesES={"Merilien's ale barrels can be found in various taverns in Minas Tirith.\
\
The wedding planner has asked you to retrieve barrels of ale for her events.","Deliver the barrels to Merilien","The wedding planner in Minas Tirith seeks barrels of the city's finest ales for her events.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This quest will be removed from your quest log when the current festival ends.</rgb>","What Ales You","Merilien is located on the Seventh Circle of Minas Tirith. \
\
You should being the casks of ale to Merilien."}},
[14540]={nameES="Qué comen los Avanc",objectivesES={"A Culhuc le gustaría que recolectaras donde anidan los avanc en el Aguaestancada.","Los huevos de avanc pueden encontrarse en el Aguaestancada\
\
Recoge huevos de avanc","Culhuc está atendiendo el horno comunitario en Lhan Garan\
\
Habla con Culhuc.","Entrega huevos de avanc a Culhuc","Qué comen los Avanc"}},
[14541]={nameES="¿Qué Bestia?",objectivesES={"El rastro de la criatura parece terminar aquí... quizá cruzó hacia la orilla oriental","Encontraste el cadáver del ciervo blanco y recuperaste las flechas de Wistan, pero algo ya ha devorado gran parte del cuerpo.","Sigue el rastro de la criatura hacia el este, a lo largo de la ribera","as huellas de la criatura continúan hacia el este a lo largo de la ribera.\
\
Deberías seguir las huellas de la criatura.","La criatura que devoró al ciervo blanco puede haber dejado huellas cerca, que deberías <rgb=#FF00FF>mirar</rgb> para encontrarlas.\
\
Pudiste recuperar las flechas de Wistan, pero algo ha devorado ya gran parte del cadáver del ciervo blanco. Las marcas en el cadáver no parecen ser de un animal ni de un troll silvano. Algo más está rondando Tâl Bruinen, y deberías descubrir qué es.","El rastro de la criatura gira hacia el este a lo largo de la ribera","Sigue el rastro de la criatura hacia el noreste, en dirección al río","Pudiste recuperar las flechas de Wistan, pero algo ha devorado ya gran parte del cadáver del ciervo blanco. Las marcas en el cadáver no parecen ser de un animal ni de un troll silvano. Algo más está rondando Tâl Bruinen, y deberías descubrir qué es.","Deberías <rgb=#FF00FF>mirar</rgb> y encontrar las huellas de la criatura","Alguna criatura ronda Tâl Bruinen, y deberías descubrir qué es","Las huellas de la criatura continúan hacia el noreste en dirección al río.\
\
Deberías seguir las huellas de la criatura.","Encuentra el rastro de la criatura","Has encontrado las huellas de la criatura, y parecen conducir hacia el noreste, de regreso al río","La criatura que devoró al ciervo blanco puede haber dejado huellas cerca, que deberías <rgb=#FF00FF>mirar</rgb> para encontrarlas.\
\
Pudiste recuperar las flechas de Wistan, pero algo ha devorado ya gran parte del cadáver del ciervo blanco. Las marcas en el cadáver no parecen ser de un animal ni de un troll silvano. Algo más está rondando Tâl Bruinen, y deberías descubrir qué es","Las huellas continúan hacia el noreste en dirección al río","Las huellas de la criatura conducen hacia el noreste desde el cadáver del ciervo blanco, en dirección al río.\
\
Deberías seguir las huellas de la criatura."}},
[14542]={nameES="What Came to Pass",objectivesES={"Records might be found in the town of Audaghaim, east of the Haunted Inn in the Dourstocks.\
\
You should comb through the ruins of Audaghaim and try to uncover any records that may have been kept around the time of the Necromancer's influence.","Habla con Prestadír en la Posada Embrujada","Prestadír is at the Haunted Inn in the Dourstocks, west of Audaghaim.\
\
You should show Prestadír the book you unearthed in Audaghaim.","What Came to Pass","Search Audaghaim for town records","Uncovered a battered book with several leaves missing, buried in the foundation of an old building","Prestadír hopes to learn more of the history of Audaghaim and determine why the former inhabitants of this town are doomed to remain."}},
[14543]={nameES="What Could Do This?",objectivesES={"The barren patches of land in the Black Heart still bear the shades of terrible events in the past, long remembering the suffering of the trees.\
\
Where is the Ent you saw that once watched over these lands? If his realm has grown so dark, what has become of him?","Barren patches of land can be found throughout the Black Heart in Fangorn, especially in the deeper reaches of the wood.\
\
You should examine the barren patches to see why nothing will grow there.","Completado","The barren patches of land in the Black Heart still bear the shades of terrible events in the past, long remembering the suffering of the trees.","What Could Do This?","Find barren patches of land in the Black Heart","Many blackened swaths of land are barren even of the twisted plants that grow in the darkest part of the forest. What happened here to turn the Black Heart so rotten?"}},
[14544]={nameES="¿Qué más quedó atrás?",objectivesES={"Has recuperado el objeto tomado del campamento de la Compañía, que resultó ser nada más que una olla de cocina, pero Golgallon teme que puedan haber quedado otros signos más reveladores.","Habla con Rinneldor en Echad Dúnann","Rinneldor está en Echad Dúnann, a cierta distancia al sureste de Echad Eregion.\
\
Golgallon te ha pedido que hables con Rinneldor sobre los movimientos de la Compañía y los descubrimientos que has hecho."}},
[14545]={nameES="What Flies Beneath",objectivesES={}},
[14546]={nameES="What Grows Within",objectivesES={}},
[14547]={nameES="What Is That Smell?",objectivesES={"Reek-weeds grow along the river-banks of the Anduin to the north of Thinglad.\
\
You should crush reek-weed leaves along the river-banks to help dissuade the fishermen from setting up camp there.","What Is That Smell?","Noriel has an idea for making the woods near the river less attractive for the Rohirrim trespassers from Stangard.","Find Noriel at Haldirith","Noriel can be found in the watch-post Haldirith in northern Thinglad.\
\
You should return to Noriel and tell her that many horrid smells have been unleashed upon the forest."}},
[14548]={nameES="What Lies Beneath the Hills",objectivesES={"The sounds of Orcs echo from out of the cavernous maggot-holes","Candúr can be found at a small Ranger outpost hidden in the Slag-hills.\
\
You should talk to Candúr before you depart.","Find the entrance to Carchost","What Lies Beneath the Hills","You should return to Thurindol, who can be found at a small Ranger outpost hidden in the Slag-hills.","Thurindol believes that there are even more enemies beneath the Slag-hills and asks of you to investigate.","Find the entrance to Skoironk","Talk to Thurindol","Talk to Candúr","Enter Skoironk","Carchost and Skoironk are located in the Slag-hills.\
\
You should find the entrances and enter Carchost and Skoironk.","Thurindol can be found at a small Ranger outpost hidden in the Slag-hills.\
\
You should talk to Thurindol.","Enter Carchost","Many dangers may lie ahead within the tower of Carchost"}},
[14549]={nameES="Lo que se esconde en el interior...",objectivesES={"Tras completar una misión, has encontrado un zircón con una llamativa oscuridad dentro de la gema. Después de examinarlo con cuidado, has decidido buscar a alguien que pueda ser capaz de determinar por qué la oscuridad parece agitarse y moverse dentro de la gema. Quizá una de las personas que encomiendan las misiones sepan de qué se trata.","Lo que se esconde en el interior...","Examinas con cuidado la piedra y determinas que la oscuridad de su interior se mueve. No hay duda alguna. Se agita con la malevolencia de una violenta tormenta. Aunque parece peligroso, también hay algo en ella que resulta a la vez tentador y embriagador.\
\
Sacudes la cabeza para aclarar tus pensamientos antes de caer en un trance profundo provocado por la oscuridad que se agita en la piedra.\
\
Debe haber alguien que sepa qué es esto. Quizá quienes encomiendan las misiones en Cardolan y la Ciénaga de los Cisnes sepan algo.","Lleva el inquietante zircón a una persona encargada de encomendar misiones en Cardolan o la Ciénaga de los Cisnes","Después de examinar la piedra y casi caer bajo el influjo de los miasmas del interior de la gema, decides llevarla a uno de las personas que encomiendan las misiones. Quizá sea algo que hayan visto antes y puedan ayudarte a identificar la causa o el propósito de la oscura gema."}},
[14550]={nameES="What Makes them Stick?",objectivesES={}},
[14551]={nameES="What They Deserve",objectivesES={"Ordâkhai have reinforced the pit-mine in an attempt to quash the prison revolt.","What They Deserve","Talk to Ebuzâm","You have done much to aid the thralls revolting in Esh Mêkag.\
\
You should return to Ebuzâm.","Esh Mêkag is in a state of revolt.\
\
You should defeat Ordâkhai in the Esh Mêkag pit-mine."}},
[14552]={nameES="What Waits at Byre Tor",objectivesES={"Small gusts of frosty air have appeared in Byre Tor.\
\
You should examine the little bursts of cold.","Enter the village of Byre Tor","You should complete a thorough search of Byre Tor.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: To do this, you must accept the remotely bestowed quest.</rgb>","Complete your search of Byre Tor's homes","The Byre Tor banners have been defiled by Orcs! This does not bode well for the city....","Examine a frosty gust of air","You glimpse a Rohirric banner on the road ahead; the city of Byre Tor is near","Gárwig wants you to put aside your search for Saruman's vile stone, and look instead to the people of Byre Tor.","The banners of Byre Tor can be found along the road leading north into the High Knolls from the Whitshaws.\
\
You should approach the banners.","Byre Tor lies up the road in the southern High Knolls.\
\
You should go to Byre Tor and see what damage the enemy has done there.","Byre Tor can be reached by following the road from Forlaw all the way north through the Whitshaws, up into the craggy High Knolls.\
\
You should ride north to Byre Tor by way of the road.","Take the north road through the Whitshaws towards Byre Tor","Continue up the road","Defiled banners lie along the road to Byre Tor in the south-western High Knolls.\
\
You should destroy the defiled banners set by the Orcs.","Frosty gusts of air have appeared in Byre Tor. Perhaps it is nothing to worry about, but it is good to notice these things.","What Waits at Byre Tor"}},
[14553]={nameES="What Was Left Behind",objectivesES={"Approach Kakhât","Halnith has sighted smoke rising from a lit camp-fire in Makham Mijann. You should investigate.\
\
Makham Mijann is located to the north of Nendath.","Talk to Halnith","Investigate the lit camp-fire at Makham Mijann","You have found a dying Corsair hiding in a tent at Makham Mijann.\
\
You should talk to him.","Return to Halnith at Nendath","Kakhât softly barks at you","Kakhât sniffs your hand. Before the hound leaves his master's side, he looks to him -- for further commands, perhaps. But the Corsair utters no more words.","Use the whistle to summon Kakhât to your side","Kakhât abruptly trots over to Halnith's side and lies down. Something tells you that even if you used the whistle to call him, he would simply refuse to listen.","Check on Kakhât","Makham Mijann may not be fully abandoned.","There is nothing you can do for the dying Corsair, but he has asked you to take his war-hound Kakhât with you.\
\
You should approach Kakhât.","Upon arriving at Nendath, Kakhât barked at you.\
\
You should check on him.","The Corsair narrows his eyes at you","What Was Left Behind","You should return to Halnith at Nendath with your new companion.\
\
Nendath stands to the south of Makham Mijann.","You should tell Halnith what you found at Makham Mijann.\
\
She stands guard at Nendath.","Talk to the dying Corsair"}},
[14554]={nameES="What Was Spoken and What Revealed",objectivesES={"Talk to Kurtil","You should return to Barathron in the Foothold in Udûn and tell him all about the disastrous meeting and the hopes that died there.","Return to Barathron","You should talk to Kurtil, who has arrived at the meeting place in Maudhúl Ghûg.","What Was Spoken and What Revealed","The meeting between the discontent forge-workers and the Easterlings has been arranged, the meeting place prepared, and the flag raised. Now for the meeting to begin."}},
[14555]={nameES="What if We Fight a Giant Crab?",objectivesES={"Anyâmat thinks it would be a great idea to fight a giant crab named Shelly.\
\
Shelly may be found on Baj Khatûg, an island off the eastern shore of Zamarzîr.","Shelly has fallen! Talk to Anyâmat about what to do next.\
\
Anyâmat may be summoned by using Anyâmat's whistle from your inventory. Anyâmat may only be summoned while in and around Zamarzîr.","Defeat Shelly","What if We Fight a Giant Crab?","Anyâmat harbours aspirations of being a great shanty-man.","Talk to Anyâmat","Defeated Shelly"}},
[14556]={nameES="What of the Farmer?",objectivesES={"The farmer's son should also be somewhere in the herd-lands in Trum Dreng.\
\
There is only one Stag-clansman left to find, and he is not with the others: the herdsman's son Dilwun.","The farmer's family should be somewhere in the herd-lands.\
\
Whether dead or alive, you should find Trev's family before reporting back to Lhan Tarren.","Search for the farmer's son Dilwun","This man probably worked for the farmer, but he lies face-down in the water. It is obvious that he has not drawn breath for too long now....","You have discovered the last member of Trev's family, and he too is dead... murdered and left at the river-bank to be carried away when the rains come.\
\
The Elder will be sorely grieved by this news. The Stag-clan has now grown smaller and more vulnerable.","The farmhand Celun has been murdered and left at the bank of the river","Trev has been brutally slain during the Dragon-clan invasion","What of the Farmer?","Search for the Celun, the farmhand","Search for Trev, the chief herdsman","This is undoubtedly Trev, the chief herdsman in these lands.\
\
Trev appears to have been murdered during the invasion. His face and body are contorted as if he died in considerable pain; perhaps his were the screams heard on the night of the raid.","You helped some travellers who witnessed the sacking of the herd-lands, but it is now time to seek the farmer and his family. They have not been seen since the Dragon-clan came."}},
[14557]={nameES="What of the Herd-lands?",objectivesES={"Since the craban from the farm on the herd-lands returned injured and without the presence of its recipient, the people of Lhan Tarren have been worried about the herdsman Trev and his family.","The Elder is grateful that Elain, just returned, may be spared the danger this once","Tell the Elder that you volunteer yourself to investigate his missing clansmen","There seem to be hostile Dunlendings on the road. Try following the river","The herd-lands can be found by following the road south from Lhan Tarren.\
\
You should travel down the road in search of what may have intercepted the crow.","Elder Riagán is in Lhan Tarren.\
\
You should tell the troubled Elder that you volunteer your own strength and skill for the task of finding out what might be wrong in the south.","What of the Herd-lands?","Take the road south towards the herd-lands","You hear muffled voices, coming from the west bank"}},
[14558]={nameES="Lo que forjó el collar",objectivesES={"La ciudad de Herne es más segura ahora que el Miedo Gris ha sido derrotado. Pero, ¿comprenderá el alcalde Nevit el papel que jugó su hija en la caída de un mal que ha asolado el país durante cientos de años?","Habla con el alcalde Nevit","Rhiangar te ha pedido que le digas al alcalde Nevit que encontraste el cuerpo de su esposa en las afueras de Sarch Vorn.\
\
El alcalde Nevit está dentro de la Posada de la Encrucijada, en Herne.","Lo que forjó el collar"}},
[14559]={nameES="Lo que se ha perdido",objectivesES={"Toronn desea abandonar la Tierra Media, pero su hermano Bregar cree que deberían quedarse.","Lleva la espada rota a Bregar","Lo que se ha perdido","Has encontrado la espada rota","Bregar te espera en Duillond, al este de las ruinas de Dol Ringwest.\
\
Has recuperado una espada rota de un túmulo funerario en las ruinas élficas de Dol Ringwest.","La espada rota se encuentra sobre un túmulo de piedras en las ruinas de Dol Ringwest, al oeste de Duillond.\
\
Bregar te ha pedido que busques en las ruinas de Dol Ringwest el túmulo de piedras y la espada rota que contiene, y que se la lleves a él.","Busca en el túmulo de piedras la espada rota"}},
[14560]={nameES="¿Qué está comiendo Etta?",objectivesES={"Volver a Tam Tejobaya","Tam Tejobaya te ha pedido que recojas bayas rojas de los arbustos en las ruinas cerca del Campamento de Siempreviva.","El esposo de Etta Tejobaya está haciendo todo lo posible para mantener a su esposa, pero un ataque reciente de los orcos de Tharbad los ha dejado sin ninguno de los suministros que trajeron con ellos desde Bree.","Deberías llevar las bayas a Tam Tejobaya.\
\
Tam está en el Campamento de Siempreviva, en el sur de Cardolan."}},
[14561]={nameES="What's Guano?",objectivesES={"Guano piles can be found in the Lair of the Gloom-lord.\
\
You should collect guano piles because Viznak asked.","Viznak has asked you to collect some guano for him from the Gloom-lord's lair. You shudder to think why he wants it.","What's Guano?","Viznak can be found outside of Seregost once you have completed Surveying Seregost.\
\
You should talk to Viznak.","Talk to Viznak after completing Surveying Seregost"}},
[14562]={nameES="Cuando el Depredador se Vuelve Presa",objectivesES={"Los lobos pueden encontrarse junto al lago congelado, al noreste del Patio de Frerin.\
\
Nos Grimsong te ha pedido que reduzcas el número de lobos en la región.","Ahora que has reducido la población de linces, Nos te ha pedido que te ocupes de los lobos al noreste.","Cuando el Depredador se Vuelve Presa","Nos Grimsong está en la esquina noroeste del Patio de Frerin.\
\
Debes regresar con Nos Grimsong por tu recompensa.","Habla con Nos Grimsong en el Patio de Frerin"}},
[14563]={nameES="Cuando florecen las flores raras",objectivesES={"Durante un breve periodo cada año, florecen raras flores por toda la Tierra Media. Avery Manzanagria necesita tu ayuda durante este evento especial.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando termine el festival actual. </rgb>","Avery Manzanagria está en la Plaza del Mercado de Bree.\
\
Deberías hablar con Avery Manzanagria, ya que se te ha pedido que lo ayudes con una tarea muy difícil durante la temporada de floración.","Habla con Avery Manzanagria durante la temporada de floración","Cuando florecen las flores raras"}},
[14564]={nameES="Whence They Came",objectivesES={"Idmar is unsettled by the arrival of fallen warriors of Gondor at the Field of Celebrant.","Idmar is at his camp along the road in central Parth Celebrant.\
\
You should return to Idmar with news of your success.","Talk to Idmar","The Oathbreakers of Parth Celebrant can be found to the north, east, and west of Idmar's camp.\
\
Idmar has asked you to banish the shades from Parth Celebrant.","Whence They Came"}},
[14565]={nameES="¿De dónde vienen los Muertos?",objectivesES={"Ivorel desea conocer el origen de los Muertos que acechan en las regiones orientales de las Hondonadas Enmarañadas.","El campamento de Ivorel se encuentra al suroeste de los túmulos.\
\
Deberías regresar junto a Ivorel con las piedras grabadas que has encontrado.","Los túmulos se encuentran en las regiones orientales de las Hondonadas Enmarañadas, al noreste del campamento de Ivorel.\
\
Ivorel te ha pedido que estudies las piedras de los túmulos en busca de inscripciones que puedan describir su historia y dar alguna pista sobre la naturaleza de la amenaza que albergan."}},
[14566]={nameES="Where Fear Has Gone",objectivesES={"Where Fear Has Gone","The Dead can be found throughout Tarlang's Crown.\
\
You have encountered the Ruthless Dead and should defeat them before they can be wielded against the people of Gondor.","Drawn to Tarlang's Crown by Azruthor, the Ruthless Dead now strike fear into the enemies of the Heirs of Castamir.","You have defeated many Dead in Tarlang's Crown.","While searching for leader of the Dead that Gondren mentioned, you have encountered many other grim Oathbreakers in Tarlang's Crown. The fear these cursed Men could strike into the people of Gondor is unknowable, and would break many Gondorian forces before the Corsairs even drew their blades.\
\
If victory is to be won against Azruthor and his forces in Tarlang's Crown, they must be put to rest, even if only for a short while.","DNT -- will not be seen","Completado","You have defeated many of the Dead in Tarlang's Crown. Although their curse shall bring them forth once more, you have greatly weakened the forces in Tarlang's Crown, albeit temporarily."}},
[14567]={nameES="Where Has Treebeard Gone?",objectivesES={"Quickbeam can be found in Derndingle in south-eastern Fangorn.\
\
Quickbeam's Huorn has found no sign of Treebeard. As its agitation has not subsided by now, you should bring him to Quickbeam and have him explain where Treebeard has gone.","Since you cannot, perhaps Quickbeam can tell the Huorn where Treebeard has gone","According to Quickbeam's Huorn, Treebeard must be somewhere in Fangorn Forest.\
\
Quickbeam's Huorn wants to search for Treebeard as he could be of great help in maintaining order in the forest. You should aid the Huorn.","Talk to Quickbeam","Where Has Treebeard Gone?","Search for Treebeard in Fangorn Forest","Not knowing Treebeard has marched to war, Quickbeam's Huorn seeks to find the elder Ent in the forest.","DNT -- Players will not see","After arriving at a barren Wellinghall, Quickbeam's Huorn appears terrified that Treebeard is nowhere to be found. Its branches flail wildly as it desperately seeks him out nearby.\
\
Despite knowing the elder Ent has marched to war, you have no means to communicate with the Huorn and decide to aid in its search."}},
[14568]={nameES="Dónde Pisa Heleth",objectivesES={"Deberías avisarle a Heleth que has ocultado sus huellas.\
\
Heleth Bach está en Lintrev","Heleth Bach te ha pedido que alises y ocultes cualquier rastro que pudiera haber dejado junto al río.\
\
El río se encuentra al noroeste de Lintrev, en el sur de la Ciénaga de los Cisnes.","La seguridad de la pequeña aldea de Lintrev depende de que sus habitantes no dejen ningún rastro de su paradero para que lo encuentren sus vecinos indeseables.","Regresa con Heleth","Dónde Pisa Heleth"}},
[14569]={nameES="Where Light Cannot Shine",objectivesES={"You discover a patch of blackened roots","You have come upon a sickened stump covered in writhing worms","Tell Greenroot you wish to help","As you approach this Ent, you feel the weight of a heavy grief upon the air around him, like a grey mist. This Ent withers under the powerful sadness.\
\
It is clear that the sadness consumes the Ent Greenroot, but you cannot help him if you do not know why.\
\
You wait a moment for a memory to be impressed upon you, but Greenroot has retreated into his own slow thoughts.","Something near Greenroot has made him sad, but he has no memory to impress upon you.\
\
You should investigate nearby to see what has caused this Ent to wither under such a heavy cloud.","Greenroot is outside of the entrance to the Black Heart in Fangorn.\
\
You should return to Greenroot to tell him that you understand his pain, and wish to help if you possibly can.","You discover a dead young Huorn, fallen prey to some terrible anguish","The Ent Greenroot is tremendously sad, withering under the weight of his grief. If no one intervenes, you worry he will slowly become naught but dead wood.","You tell Greenroot that you saw the state of his herd: corrupted, twisted, polluted, blackened by evil influences in the forest. He closes his eyes sadly as you recount what you saw.\
\
You want nothing more than to help this lonely Ent be free from the pain of watching his trees turn so evil.","Where Light Cannot Shine","You have discovered the corpse of a fell-looking, blackened Huorn"}},
[14570]={nameES="Donde mueren los Norsu",objectivesES={"Devuelve el colmillo y la lanza a Sigrík","Encuentra al mamut atravesado por la lanza de Sigrík","Sigrík se encuentra en Zigilgund, al norte del cadáver del mamut.\
\
Deberías devolverle la lanza y el colmillo a Sigrík.","Sigrík perdió su lanza mientras cazaba mamuts.","Donde mueren los Norsu","El mamut debería encontrarse en algún lugar al sur de Zigilgund.\
\
Sigrík te ha pedido que encuentres su lanza perdida, que debería estar clavada en el cadáver de un mamut. También te ha pedido que recojas uno de sus colmillos.","Has recogido la lanza y el colmillo de mamut"}},
[14571]={nameES="Where Now the Horse and the Rider?",objectivesES={"Céola is at Etheburg in the Brown Lands, south of Helstor.\
\
You should bring the statue to Céola at once.","In the brigand's treasure-cave at Helstor, you found a golden statue of a horse and rider, which bears a strong resemblance to the Rohirrim.","This golden statue of a horse and rider bears a strong resemblance to the Rohirrim. Céola will almost certainly wish to see it.","Where Now the Horse and the Rider?","Bring the statue to Céola at Etheburg in the Brown Lands"}},
[14572]={nameES="Where Orcs Tread",objectivesES={"Return to Tálbiral in Laivárth","Tálbiral has asked that you head south from Laivárth to an Orc camp called Mokh Grazádh and look for signs that they may be spreading the blight.","Arrived at Mokh Grazádh","Reach Mokh Grazádh","Where Orcs Tread","Return to Tálbiral in Laivárth and let him know what you discovered of the Orcs plans in Mokh Grazádh."}},
[14573]={nameES="Where There is Smoke...",objectivesES={"This cartrev has been burned to the ground","Patrol Cartrev Rurith","The cartrevs of the Uch-lûth lie to the south of Lhanuch.\
\
Neirin Brehur has asked you to seek out the cartrevs of his people and learn if any survived the attacks of the half-orcs.","Patrol Cartrev Hamon","Neirin Brehur is at Lhanuch, north of the cartrevs.\
\
You should return to Neirin Brehur with news of your discoveries.","Neirin Brehur has asked that you ride out to the cartrevs south of Nan Laeglin and see if any of them have escaped destruction at the hands of the marauders that beset Nan Laeglin.","This cartrev appears to be abandoned","Where There is Smoke...","Patrol Cartrev Emlun","This cartrev remains inhabited","Patrol Cartrev Matho"}},
[14574]={nameES="Where the Blight Runs Deep",objectivesES={"Speak with Irsinith","You have arrived at the Hill of the Mother. Speak with Irsinith and show her the blight samples Tálbiral gave you from Laivárth.","Tálbiral has given you samples of the blight gathered in Laivárth and fears that the grove is succumbing to the blight. Bring the samples to Irsinith at the Hill of the Mother as she may be able to help.","Arrived at the Hill of the Mother","Where the Blight Runs Deep","Travel to the Hill of the Mother"}},
[14575]={nameES="¿Cuál Puso Primero?",objectivesES={"Las gallinas premiadas del Granjero Arenilla están en el corral de la Granja Arenilla.\
\
Wald Arenilla te ha pedido que devuelvas los huevos por él, para no ser descubierto. Debes colocar los huevos de vuelta en el orden en que fueron tomados, comenzando por el primero.","Colocaste el segundo huevo en el nido correcto","Wald Arenilla tomó una canasta de huevos de las gallinas premiadas de su padre, pero luego descubrió que tenían pollitos dentro.","Coloca el tercer huevo en el nido correcto","Colocaste el quinto huevo en el nido correcto","Wald Arenilla puede encontrarse en la Granja Arenilla, al norte y al este de Cavada Grande.\
\
Habiendo reemplazado todos los huevos, deberías regresar y hablar con Wald Arenilla.","Habla con Wald Arenilla","Las gallinas premiadas del Granjero Arenilla están en el corral de la Granja Arenilla.\
\
Coloca el segundo huevo en el nido correcto.","Las gallinas premiadas del Granjero Arenilla están en el corral de la Granja Arenilla.\
\
Coloca el quinto huevo en el nido correcto.","Las gallinas premiadas del Granjero Arenilla están en el corral de la Granja Arenilla.\
\
Coloca el cuarto huevo en el nido correcto.","Colocaste el primer huevo en el nido correcto","Colocaste el tercer huevo en el nido correcto","Coloca el cuarto huevo en el nido correcto","Coloca el segundo huevo en el nido correcto","Las gallinas premiadas del Granjero Arenilla están en el corral de la Granja Arenilla.\
\
Coloca el tercer huevo en el nido correcto.","Colocaste el cuarto huevo en el nido correcto","Coloca el quinto huevo en el nido correcto","La gallina sacó el huevo rodando del nido","Coloca el primer huevo en el nido correcto"}},
[14576]={nameES="Whispered Permission",objectivesES={"Sabert guards the north gate of Stangard, and Tatwine tends the stable near the Mead Hall, in Eorlsmead.\
\
You should assist Sabert and Tatwine with anything they might need that can be done without interference from Sithric.","Stanric has given you leave to do as you will in Stangard.","Tell Gadda of your successes in Stangard","Whispered Permission","Help Tatwine to better tend the horses","Help Sabert deal with the threat of vicious dogs in the plains","Gadda is near the Mead Hall in Stangard."}},
[14577]={nameES="Whispers and Signs",objectivesES={"Return to the lying slave","Under the signal flag, a slave of Nurn looks up at you with bright but pained eyes","DNT FLAG 3","DNT FLAG C","You should look for signal flags in the western half of the Udûn basin.","Whispers and Signs","The Nurnhoth slave is lying on the southern edge of the Udûn basin, up atop a wooden structure.\
\
You should return to the slave of Nurn you found by the signal flag.","Talk to Barathron","You should talk to Barathron in the Foothold camp in Udûn to learn more about the riddle he wishes to solve.","Word of a secret meeting among the dwellers of Udûn has reached the Foothold camp.","DNT FLAG D","DNT FLAG A","DNT FLAG B"}},
[14578]={nameES="Whispers in the Crypts",objectivesES={"El aullido siniestro te da escalofríos","Después de encontrar un cadáver corrompido, pudiste disipar la voz maligna en el aire con una canción alegre. Deberías continuar hacia el este y buscar en las criptas cualquier otra cosa notable.","Los susurros inquietantes llenan tu corazón de temor","Has encontrado un cadáver corrompido rodeado de un resplandor verde y el sonido de una voz atormentada. Tal vez deberías cantar una canción alegre para ti mismo para alejar esos siniestros susurros.","Tu canción ha disipado la corrupción","Gíshgi is still distressed by the presence of the Dead in An Shêru and has asked you to re-enter the crypt below to see if you can find any explanation as to why they aren't at rest in their graves. The entrance to the Crypts of Gadim-ûn is at the north-western end of the hall.","Calma a los muertos angustiados","You have found a total of four corrupted corpses, each surrounded by a green radiance and the sound of a tormented voice. Each time, you were able to dispel the foul voice with a lighthearted song. You should return to Gíshgi in Gadim-ûn and tell her what you found.","Los susurros fantasmales te revuelven el estómago","Busca otra pista más al este","Gíshgi is still distressed by the presence of the Dead in An Shêru and has asked you to re-enter the crypt below to see if you can find any explanation as to why they aren't at rest in their graves. You should head east and search the crypts for anything notable.","Search for a clue to the east","Has descubierto un tercer cadáver corrompido. Deberías cantar una canción alegre para ti mismo para alejar esos siniestros susurros, como hiciste las veces anteriores.","Whispers in the Crypts","Ahora has encontrado tres cadáveres corrompidos, cada uno rodeado de un resplandor verde y el sonido de una voz atormentada. Cada vez, pudiste disipar la voz maligna con una canción alegre. Deberías viajar hacia el oeste y continuar buscando en las criptas.","Search for another clue to the south","You have yet another corrupted corpse. You should again sing a lighthearted song to yourself to ward off the fell whispers.","Talk to Gíshgi","Después de encontrar dos cadáveres corrompidos, pudiste disipar la voz maligna en el aire con una canción alegre. Deberías viajar hacia el sur y continuar buscando en las criptas.","The wights in the Crypts of Gadim-ûn continue to encroach on the land of the living.","Los lamentos de agonía te aprietan el pecho de ansiedad","Has encontrado otro cadáver corrompido. Deberías cantar una canción alegre para ti mismo para alejar esos siniestros susurros, como hiciste la última vez.","Enter the Crypts of Gadim-ûn","Busca otra pista hacia el oeste"}},
[14579]={nameES="Whispers in the Forest",objectivesES={"Talk to Ulf","Whispers in the Forest","Variags can be found at the Eastern Blockade in Taur Drúadan.\
\
Ulf has asked you to recover stolen gold and spoils of war from the Variags in hopes that he might barter for information with one of their number.","Talk to Burnoth at his camp in Taur Drúadan","Burnoth can be found at his camp among the War-stead of the King's Men in in Taur Drúadan.\
\
You aided Ulf in recovering vital information from the Variag lord, and should now report back to Burnoth before continuing your journey.","Ulf is at his camp within the War-stead of the King's Men.\
\
Burnoth has asked you to speak to Ulf about a plan he has devised to uncover more information about Léofdag's killer.","In their quest to discover the agent of the Enemy embedded within the Rohirrim, the Riders Three decide to take a different route through Taur Drúadan.","Ulf can be found beyond the Eastern Blockade in Taur Drúadan.\
\
Ulf has asked you to meet him beyond the Eastern Blockade between the Variag and Orc forces in hopes that he might barter with one of the Variags.","Deliver the spoils to Ulf beyond the Eastern Blockade","As the Variag eyes you, Ulf indicates that you should remain and listen to what the Variag has to say"}},
[14580]={nameES="Whispers in the Pits",objectivesES={"Talk to Galadriel at Dol Dhannen","A weathered trap-door lies in the ruins of Dol Dhannen.\
\
You found a weather trap-door leading into Gostador. You should descend into Gostador beneath Dol Dhannen and search for Karazgar.","Enter the trap-door and search for Karazgar in Gostador","Whispers in the Pits","Galadriel can be found within Dol Dhannen.\
\
You have witnessed more of the shadowy impressions left upon the chamber by Sauron's evil and should now return to Galadriel.","Talk to King Thorin III","Gostador lies beneath the ruins of Dol Dhannen.\
\
You have come to Dol Dhannen and should now seek a way into Gostador.","Explore Dol Dhannen and find a way into the depths of Gostador","You have discovered a weathered trap-door leading down into Gostador!","King Thorin III can be found before his throne in the Hall Under the Mountain in Erebor.\
\
You have discovered that Karazgar did not return to Dol Guldur, but instead shadowy visions of his past remained among the lingering evils of Sauron within Gostador. You should return to King Thorin III and warn him that Karazgar may still lurk near to Erebor.","Galadriel is standing before Dol Dhannen.\
\
You have travelled to the ruins of Dol Guldur, now named Dol Dhannen, with Galadriel and her company. You should speak to her before beginning your search for Karazgar.","Although Galadriel remains doubtful that Karazgar has returned to the ruins of Dol Guldur, she has mustered a company to aid you in your search for the Weeping Warrior in the depths of Dol Dhannen."}},
[14581]={nameES="Whispers of Ered Lithui",objectivesES={}},
[14582]={nameES="Whispers of the Enemy",objectivesES={"Hoping to learn more of what has happened in Lhingris in the aftermath of Sauron's downfall, Legolas has asked you to eavesdrop on the Orc-trackers of Rath Cail.","<rgb=#FF00FF>Listen</rgb> to the Orc-trackers near Lugvarg","Talk to Legolas in Rath Cail","Eavesdrop on Orc-trackers in Rath Cail","Whispers of the Enemy","<rgb=#FF00FF>Listen</rgb> to the Orc-trackers near Kála-murg","Eavesdrop on Orc-trackers near Lugvarg","<rgb=#FF00FF>Listen</rgb> to the Orc-trackers in Rath Cail","Legolas can be found in the northern reaches of Rath Cail.\
\
You have carefully overheard the conversations of the Orc-trackers of Lhingris and should now return to Legolas.","Eavesdrop on Orc-trackers near Kála-murg","You can hear the hushed voices of the Orc-trackers. You should listen closely...","Orc-trackers can be found throughout Rath Cail, near the Orc-hold of Kála-murg, and near the watch-tower of Lugvarg.\
\
Legolas has asked you to eavesdrop on the Orcs in Rath Cail to learn more of what has happened in Lhingris since Sauron's fall.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: You must select at least one of the gathered Orcs at each location to advance this quest.</rgb>"}},
[14583]={nameES="Whispers of the Forge",objectivesES={}},
[14584]={nameES="Tarea de la Compañía Blanca: Suciedad repugnante",objectivesES={"Se busca: suciedad repugnante de Imlad Morgul.","Entrega la suciedad repugnante en una caja de recolección","Tarea de la Compañía Blanca: Suciedad repugnante","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir suciedad repugnante.","Alguien ha publicado una tarea para recoger suciedad repugnante. Se pueden entregar a cambio de una recompensa.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Se busca: suciedad repugnante de Imlad Morgul. Recógela para ganar una recompensa adecuada para los coleccionistas."}},
[14585]={nameES="Tarea de la Compañía Blanca: Pieles tocadas por la noche",objectivesES={"Alguien ha publicado una tarea para recoger pieles tocadas por la noche. Se pueden entregar a cambio de una recompensa.","Se busca: pieles tocadas por la noche de Imlad Morgul. Recógelas para ganar una recompensa adecuada para los coleccionistas.","Se busca: pieles tocadas por la noche de Imlad Morgul.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Tarea de la Compañía Blanca: Pieles tocadas por la noche","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir pieles tocadas por la noche.","Entregar las pieles tocadas por la noche en un buzón de recogida"}},
[14586]={nameES="Tarea de la Compañía Blanca: Pieles endurecidas",objectivesES={"Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir pieles endurecidas.","Alguien ha publicado una tarea para recoger pieles endurecidas. Se pueden entregar a cambio de una recompensa.","Se busca: pieles endurecidas de Imlad Morgul. Recógelas para ganar una recompensa adecuada para los coleccionistas.","Entrega las pieles endurecidas en una caja de recolección","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Tarea de la Compañía Blanca: Pieles endurecidas","Se busca: pieles endurecidas de Imlad Morgul."}},
[14587]={nameES="Tarea de la Compañía Blanca: Orejas con mechones",objectivesES={"Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir orejas con mechones.","Se busca: orejas con mechones de Imlad Morgul.","Se busca: orejas con mechones de Imlad Morgul. Recógelas para ganar una recompensa adecuada para los coleccionistas.","Entregar las orejas con mechones en un buzón de recogida","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Alguien ha publicado una tarea para recoger orejas con mechones. Se pueden entregar a cambio de una recompensa.","Tarea de la Compañía Blanca: Orejas con mechones"}},
[14588]={nameES="White Hand Blessings",objectivesES={}},
[14589]={nameES="Mensajero de la Mano Blanca",objectivesES={"The Pillar of the Hand lies to the east of Dagoras' camp.\
\
Dagoras has asked you to intercept a Dunlending messenger as he passes by the Pillar of the Hand. You should first eliminate the sentries by the Pillar.","Dagoras is encamped near the entrance to Nan Curunír, west of the Pillar of the Hand.\
\
You should return to Dagoras with news of your success.","Defeated Saruman's Messenger!","Dagoras has told you of a Dunlending messenger who is relaying information from Isengard to the clans in Dunland. The messenger is expected to pass by the Pillar of the Hand shortly.","Talk to Dagoras at his camp in Nan Curunír","Lie in wait by the Pillar of the Hand and defeat Saruman's messenger","Saruman's Messenger Approaches...","Mensajero de la Mano Blanca"}},
[14590]={nameES="Mano Blanca, Forja Roja",objectivesES={"Glavroleth está preocupado de que la Mano Blanca esté preparando un asalto a Echad Mirobel.","Mano Blanca, Forja Roja","Echad Mirobel está al oeste de Echad Dúnann, a lo largo del camino de Nan Sirannon.\
\
Se te ha instruido que adviertas a Echad Mirobel sobre la amenaza de la Mano Blanca.","Habla con Ornras en Echad Mirobel"}},
[14591]={nameES="White Mountain Plague",objectivesES={"Speak with Arvaethor.","The Orc forces can be found in the Orc camp, Gríshru.\
\
Defeat the Orc forces.","You have defeated the White Mountain captain","White Mountain Plague","Arvaethor has asked you enter the Orc encampment with him and oust the forces from the Vale.","The Orc camp of Gríshru is located in the north-eastern part of Ringló Vale.\
\
You should enter Gríshru.","Enter the Orc encampment.","It looks as if the Orc forces were expecting you","Defeat the White Mountain captain","Speak with Arvaethor"}},
[14592]={nameES="Whitshaws: Cruelty Towards Beasts",objectivesES={"Ealswith is in Forlaw.\
\
You should return to Ealswith.","Whitshaws: Cruelty Towards Beasts","<rgb=#FF0000>Completing Wildermore's Recovery will cancel this quest.</rgb>","Orcs have laid traps throughout the Whitshaws to ensnare the beasts that roam upon those icy plains.","Traps can be found on the icy plains of the central Whitshaws.\
\
You should destroy the traps laid by the Orcs.","Regresa con Ealswith"}},
[14593]={nameES="Whitshaws: Driving Back the Enemy",objectivesES={"The forces of Isengard can be found in the Whitshaws.\
\
You should ride to the Whitshaws and defeat the enemies of Wildermore.","Núrzum is dead, but the enemy still roams free throughout much of Wildermore.","Ealswith is in Forlaw.\
\
You should return to Ealswith.","<rgb=#FF0000>Completing Wildermore's Recovery will cancel this quest.</rgb>","Regresa con Ealswith","Whitshaws: Driving Back the Enemy"}},
