[14597]={nameES="Whitshaws: Mounted-fishing",objectivesES={"<rgb=#FF0000>Do not allow time to expire</rgb>","Talk to Gyric to travel to the Whitshaws and speak with Rilbert","Obtained nets from the sack","<rgb=#FF0000>Completing Wildermore's Recovery will cancel this quest.</rgb>","Whitshaws: Mounted-fishing","Gyric is waiting for your decision in Forlaw.\
\
You should speak with Gyric when you are ready to travel to the Whitshaws and talk to Rilbert to begin your trial.","<rgb=#FF0000>Time has expired</rgb>","Fish of varying sizes can be found throughout the ice pools in the Whitshaws.\
\
You should spear as many fish as possible to gain points and complete your trial.","Use the sack of nets Rilbert gave you to obtain your skills, then begin catching fish along the course.","In the wake of Núrzum's rampage, the folk of Wildermore seek the aid of skilled defenders.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>This quest requires Mounted Combat</rgb>\
\
<rgb=#00FF00>Note: This quest auto-completes upon beating the course.</rgb>","Use the net sack to obtain your skills"}},
[14598]={nameES="Whitshaws: Tails as Trophies",objectivesES={"The Warg-infested area of the Whitshaws can be reached by speaking with Dudoc in Forlaw.\
\
You should travel to the plains of the Whitshaws and defeat Warg-packs there, collecting the tails of larger Wargs as you go.","<rgb=#FF0000>Completing Wildermore's Recovery will cancel this quest.</rgb>","Warg-packs have moved onto the lake's edge of the Whitshaws, killing the moose that roam there.","Dudoc is in Forlaw.\
\
You should return to Dudoc.","Whitshaws: Tails as Trophies","Return to Dudoc in Forlaw"}},
[14599]={nameES="Whitshaws: Yst-arning",objectivesES={"Ride through the sixth red gate.","Ride through the fifth blue gate.","Ride through the eleventh red gate","Ride through the fifth red gate.","Ride through the fourth blue gate.","Gyric is waiting for your decision in Forlaw.\
\
You should speak with Gyric when you are ready to travel to the Whitshaws and talk to Rilbert to begin your trial.","Ride through the twelfth red gate","Rode through the fourth blue gate","Ride through the first red gate.","Ride through the fourth red gate.","Ride through the third blue gate.","Ride through the fourth red gate","Ride through the sixth blue gate","Ride through the eighth blue gate","Ride through the eighth red gate","Ride through the seventh red gate","Talk to Gyric or Rilbert","Rode through the second blue gate","Ride through the tenth red gate","Ride through the sixth blue gate.","Rode through the eighth red gate","Ride through the ninth blue gate.","Ride through the twelfth red gate.","Ride through the third red gate","Ride through the eighth red gate.","Ride through the ninth blue gate","Rode through the tenth red gate","Ride through the sixth red gate","Rode through the ninth red gate","<rgb=#FF0000>You have failed the race</rgb>","Rode through the fifth blue gate","Rode through the seventh red gate","<rgb=#FF0000>Completing Wildermore's Recovery will cancel this quest.</rgb>","Ride through the ninth red gate.","Ride through the seventh blue gate","Ride through the tenth red gate.","Ride through the first red gate","Rode through the sixth red gate","Ride through the second red gate","Ride through the second blue gate","Ride through the fourth blue gate","Rode through the first blue gate","Ride through the eighth blue gate.","Rode through the third red gate","Rode through the seventh blue gate","Rode through the first red gate","In the wake of Núrzum's rampage, the folk of Wildermore seek the aid of skilled defenders.","Rode through the fifth red gate","Rode through the twelfth red gate","Rode through the eleventh red gate","Rilbert is at the south end of the ice pools in the Whitshaws. Gyric is in Forlaw.\
\
