[14629]={nameES="Wildermore Introduction: Harding's Concern",objectivesES={"Wildermore Introduction: Harding's Concern","Rumours have begun to spread of a growing concern in the northern wild reaches of Rohan, a rough but lush land called Wildermore.\
\
The rumours are vague, but troubling also.\
\
Harding, Aldor of the Eastemnet, grows worried for the northern reaches of his realm, and has summoned you, a trusted ally, to investigate.","Harding, Aldor of the Eastemnet, is concerned by the silence on the roads to and from Wildermore, the wildest reaches of his realm in Rohan.","Speak with Harding about Wildermore","Harding has summoned you to Harwick to begin an investigation of Wildermore, the lands to the north-west of the Wold.\
\
You should speak with Harding at the Mead Hall of Harwick."}},
[14630]={nameES="Wildermore's Recovery",objectivesES={}},
[14631]={nameES="Tierras salvajes y vacío",objectivesES={"El asentamiento de Tornhad bulle de actividad","Glynafon lleva abandonada un sinfín de años, pero la gente hobbit vivió aquí antaño","Habla con Ravaedron en Glynafon","Reúnete con Ravaedron en Tornhad, el asentamiento de los Montaraces a orillas del Fontegrís, al oeste","Ravaedron ha sugerido que os reunáis en Tornhad, el asentamiento de los Montaraces en el Mitheithel, para alertarlos del peligro que suponen los huargos.","Habla con Ravaedron en Tornhad","Encuentra el hogar de Wenna","Según las huellas que descubriste, un gran número de huargos ha pasado por Glynafon en los últimos días.","Ha habido más huargos en Glynafon de los que has visto hasta ahora","Este era el hogar de una artista que enseñó a Ravaedron varias técnicas pictóricas que nunca antes había considerado","Examina las huellas de huargo en Glynafon","Ravaedron te ha pedido que derrotes a cualquier huargo que encuentres en el Ángulo, para garantizar mejor la seguridad de sus amigos Maddoc y Glenys Astaciervo, y la de los viajeros del Mitheithel.","Ravaedron ha llegado a Tornhad, el asentamiento de los Montaraces en el Ángulo.","Bestias amenazantes y otros enemigos acechan las tierras salvajes del Mitheithel, y Ravaedron quiere que reduzcas su número por el bien de sus amigos.","Este era el hogar de dos Fuertes a los que les encantaba pasear por los senderos a la luz de la luna mucho después de que los demás se hubieran dormido","Tierras salvajes y vacío","Has encontrado huellas de huargos en Glynafon, un descubrimiento desagradable pero nada sorprendente.","Reúnete con Ravaedron a las afueras de Glynafon, el hogar ancestral de los Fuertes","Absorto en sus recuerdos de una bulliciosa Glynafon, Ravaedron te ha pedido que contemples los lugares que él recuerda.","Encuentra el hogar de Meredud y Aderyn","Ravaedron quiere arreglar las cosas con Maddoc Astaciervo y su familia.","Ravaedron te pidió que te reunieras con él a las afueras de Glynafon, el hogar ancestral de los Fuertes, cuando terminaras tu tarea."}},
[14632]={nameES="Wildlife Management",objectivesES={"You have slain deer in Arwáth. You should return to Shanthar.","Shanathar has offered a lesson on Kintai forest stewardship.","Talk to Shanthar","Shanthar has requested you slay some of the deer in Arwáth to restore balance to the population.","Wildlife Management"}},
[14633]={nameES="Wildwood Allowance",objectivesES={}},
[14634]={nameES="Delicias del Bosque Salvaje",objectivesES={"Minda se encuentra cerca de un estanque en la zona central del Bosque Salvaje.\
\
Deberías hablar con Minda Matosos.","Habla con Minda Matosos","Delicias del Bosque Salvaje","Las ranas del Bosque Salvaje se pueden encontrar en zonas acuáticas del centro del Bosque Salvaje.\
\
Consigue ancas de rana de las ranas del Bosque Salvaje.","Minda Matosos necesita ayuda para conseguir un ingrediente especial para el banquete de su señora."}},
[14635]={nameES="Will of the Pale Herald",objectivesES={"Report to Captain Róglarg in Cirith Ungol","Captain Róglarg can be found in the courtyard of Cirith Ungol.\
\
Belzagar has informed you that Captain Róglarg and his garrison are forbidden from abandoning Cirith Ungol.","Captain Róglarg has grown irritated at having to play host to an emissary of the Gúrzyul at Cirith Ungol.","Report to Belzagar in the Tower of Cirith Ungol","Belzagar can be found in the turret of the Tower of Cirith Ungol.\
\
Captain Róglarg has ordered you to report to Belzagar in the Tower of Cirith Ungol. The emissary of the Pale Herald is curious to learn how you escaped the fall of the Towers of the Teeth.","Will of the Pale Herald"}},
[14636]={nameES="Will of the Stormhammer",objectivesES={"As Hersegg crosses back into the hall, she beckons you forth","King Thorin can be found at Vosh Torú.\
\
After introducing yourself, King Thorin has gestured for you to come speak with him. You should talk to King Thorin.","Will of the Stormhammer","Wait for Hersegg","As you enter, Hermáth turns to greet you","Determined to aid his son, Durin, and the Dwarves of the Gabil'akkâ to reclaim Mount Gundabad, King Thorin Stonehelm hopes to enlist the aid of an old friend.","Talk to Hersegg at Vosh Torú","<rgb=#FF00FF>Hail</rgb> Hermáth Stormhammer and introduce yourself","Hermáth looks at you appraisingly","King Thorin can be found at Vosh Torú.\
\
Hersegg has told you to come and speak with her grandfather. You should follow King Thorin and meet Hermáth Stormhammer.","Hersegg can be found at Vosh Torú.\
\
After arriving at Vosh Torú, you have learned that Hersegg's errand involves her grandather, Hermáth. You should talk to Hersegg.","King Thorin can be found at Vosh Torú.\
\
After speaking with Hermáth Stormhammer, King Thorin seems relieved. You should talk to King Thorin.","Hermáth Stormhammer can be found at Vosh Torú.\
\
You have met Hermáth Stormhammer and he seems eager to meet you in turn. You should hail Hermáth Stormhammer and introduce yourself.","Follow King Thorin and meet Hermáth Stormhammer","King Thorin and Hermáth Stormhammer can be found at Vosh Torú.\
\
After introducing yourself, King Thorin has asked to speak with Hermáth Stormhammer. You should listen.","Hermáth Stormhammer can be found at Vosh Torú.\
\
You have entered Vosh Torú and found Hermáth Stormhammer. You should meet Hermáth Stormhammer.","Talk to King Thorin at Vosh Torú","As their conversation comes to an end, King Thorin beckons you over","King Thorin can be found at Vosh Torú.\
\
You have come with King Thorin on an errand to Vosh Torú. You should talk to King Thorin.","Listen to King Thorin and Hermáth Stormhammer","Hersegg can be found at Vosh Torú.\
\
You should wait for Hersegg.","Meet Hermáth Stormhammer"}},
[14637]={nameES="Willem toma la delantera",objectivesES={"Willem Bigotes pasa corriendo junto a ti, corriendo hacia algo junto a la poza","Willem Bigotes está empapado y calado, pero parece contento. ¿Ha olfateado el rastro de Bingo?","Spalvi está en la Sala de Piedra de Jazârgund, a mitad del Camino de Durin, en Moria.","Ketill el Cartógrafo dijo que se reuniría contigo en Tharâkh Bazân, a lo largo del Camino de Durin, al noreste del Mirador de la Gran Excavación.","Willem toma la delantera","Un gran lince pasó corriendo junto a Ketill el Cartógrafo en Tharâkh Bazân, dirigiéndose hacia el este. ¿Podría ser Willem Bigotes?","Derrota merrevail en tu camino hacia la poza de Khulturg, en la Fosa de los Colmillos","Sigue a Willem Bigotes hacia el este hasta la Sala de Piedra de Jazârgund","Spalvi ha venido a la Fosa de los Colmillos. ¡A diferencia de Willem Bigotes, él no está aquí para echarse una siesta!","Habla con Bingo junto a la poza de Khulturg, en la Fosa de los Colmillos","Lleva la página mojada a Spalvi en la poza de Tharâkh Bazân","Habla con Ketill el Cartógrafo en Tharâkh Bazân, a lo largo del Camino de Durin","Encuentra a Willem Bigotes en algún lugar de Tharâkh Bazân","Willem Bigotes está acurrucado junto al mojón, echándose una siesta","Spalvi Corazonrecio ha venido a la poza en Tharâkh Bazân.\
\
Willem Bigotes encontró una página del manuscrito de Bingo y deberías enseñársela a Spalvi.","Sigue a Willem Bigotes hacia el este hasta la Fosa de los Colmillos","Bingo está sentado al borde de la poza de Khulturg, en la Fosa de los Colmillos, pero algo no parece estar del todo bien.","Habla con Spalvi en la Sala de Piedra de Jazârgund","Los merrevail pueden encontrarse en la Fosa de los Colmillos, en el extremo oriental del Camino de Durin, y se reúnen cerca de pozas como la de Khulturg.\
\
Spalvi cree que deberías dirigirte a la poza de Khulturg en la Fosa de los Colmillos, derrotando merrevail para demostrar a los enanos que eres de ayuda.","Willem está empapado, su pelaje pegado a la piel mientras nada en las frías aguas de la poza. Al acercarte más, ves que sujeta un trozo de pergamino mojado entre sus poderosas mandíbulas e intenta mantenerlo por encima del agua de la poza.\
\
Le retiras con cuidado el pergamino mojado, y él te mira fijamente.","Willem Bigotes ha corrido hacia el este desde la Sala de Piedra de Jazârgund tras un rastro. ¿Ha encontrado la pista de Bingo?","La búsqueda de Bingo Boffin continúa en las profundidades inexploradas de Khazad-dûm.","Willem ha seguido el rastro... hasta varios barriles llenos de pescado","Habla con Spalvi en la Fosa de los Colmillos","Has encontrado a Bingo, pero parece que ha perdido: ¡la memoria!","Spalvi Corazonrecio está en el campamento de enanos de la Fosa de los Colmillos.\
\
Has encontrado a Bingo Boffin, pero parece que ha perdido: ¡la memoria!","Willem Bigotes ha corrido hacia el este desde Tharâkh Bazân tras un rastro. ¿Ha encontrado la pista de Bingo?"}},
[14638]={nameES="Willem Bigote y el Ancho Mundo",objectivesES={"Has seguido a Willem por el Paso de Rohan hasta la entrada del Pantano Bruno. Ahora el lince se ha detenido y parece estar esperándote.","Willem te mira con gratitud y ronronea ruidosamente.","Willem Bigote está en su nido con su familia, en la esquina noreste del Pantano Bruno.","Willem Bigote ha encontrado un grupo de linces en la esquina noreste del Pantano Bruno, y muchos comparten su patrón y color. ¿Será su familia?","Habla con Bingo en la ciudad de Avardin, en el Páramo Desolado.","Willem ronronea aún más fuerte","Dejas la carne de sapo dentro del muro, y algunos de los cachorros la olfatean con interés. Willem parpadea lentamente al mirarte, y comprendes que es una despedida. Mira de ti a Bingo, y tú le aseguras que seguirás cuidando del hobbit aventurero.","Willem te ronronea con afecto","Willem parece feliz.","Willem baja las patas delanteras en una reverencia a su manera","Construye un muro protector para la familia de Willem","Willem sacude la cabeza con tristeza","Willem y su compañera parecen esperanzados, pero sus cachorros solo parecen tener sueño","Willem Bigote y el Ancho Mundo","Has reunido algunas cosas para hacer el hogar de Willem un poco mejor; deberías ir ahora a la zona noreste del Pantano Bruno para poner en marcha el plan de Bingo.","Willem ronronea ruidosamente, y el sonido retumba en el aire.","Sigue a Willem Bigote hacia el oeste, dentro del Pantano Bruno","Willem Bigote está en el Salón de Hidromiel de Bosque Oscuro, en el Folde Oeste.","A Bingo le preocupa que algo esté inquietando a Willem Bigote, y quiere averiguar qué puede ser.","Willem asiente hacia ti, un saludo propio de él.","Willem te ronronea con afecto.","Willem asiente hacia ti, a modo de saludo","Ves a Willem acurrucándose contra una hembra de lince y comprendes que es su compañera, y los linces pequeños acurrucados cerca son sus cachorros.","Willem te observa atentamente. Curiosamente, tienes la impresión de que está intentando decidir algo.","Has seguido a Willem Bigote hasta la entrada del Pantano Bruno, donde se ha detenido para esperarte.","Dale la carne de sapo a Willem en su nido","Bingo quiere que ayudes a convertir el Pantano Bruno en el hogar perfecto para Willem y su familia. Debes derrotar abominaciones orcas en el noroeste del Pantano Bruno, recolectar carne de sapo por todo el marjal y reunir piedras adecuadas para construir un refugio.","Habla con Bingo en el hogar de Willem, en la esquina noreste del Pantano Bruno.","Habla con Willem Bigote junto al árbol solitario en el Pantano Bruno","Bingo se ha despedido de Willem Bigote y quiere reunirse contigo en el pueblo más cercano del Páramo Desolado.","Willem corrió hacia el oeste, dentro del Pantano Bruno.","Habla con Bingo junto al árbol solitario en el Pantano Bruno","El muro resultó bastante bien y bloquea gran parte del viento","Willem te mira con expectación, y luego corre hacia el oeste. Parece querer que lo sigas al Pantano Bruno.","Bingo está en el Salón de la Hidromiel de Bosque Oscuro, en el Folde Oeste.\
\
Para sorpresa de Bingo, ¡Willem ha salido corriendo de repente!","Bingo está en el nido de Willem Bigote, en la esquina noreste del Pantano Bruno.","Sigue a Willem Bigote","Habla con Willem Bigote fuera del Pantano Bruno","Habla con Willem Bigote dentro del Salón de Hidromiel de Bosque Oscuro","Willem te mira con expectación.","Willem corre hacia un árbol solitario en medio del pantano","Habla con Bingo dentro del Salón de Hidromiel de Bosque Oscuro","Willem baja las patas delanteras en una reverencia","Willem asiente hacia ti y ronronea más fuerte","Willem te ha guiado por el Paso de Rohan hasta el Pantano Bruno","Bingo está junto al árbol solitario en la esquina noreste del Pantano Bruno, con la familia de Willem."}},
[14639]={nameES="Winches in the Windows",objectivesES={"The goblins must not be allowed to construct any winches in the gate-house windows, or the army will be able to raise ladders for fast entry. The wounded Rohirrim that have retreated to within the walls will be easy targets once the enemy has secured an entry point.","The assault against the upper gate-house has been unsuccessful for Saruman's armies. The small window openings only allow for small hooks and grapnels without space for attaching a ladder. The goblins have devised a plan to construct winches within the window openings for them to raise ladders; ladders which will allow for their brutal Uruk-hai companions to aid them in the slaughter.\
\
Merit Rating\
\
This quest starts with <rgb=#FFFF00>Full</rgb> Merit Rating.\
\
<rgb=#00FF00>Moderate Merit Gain</rgb>\
* Constructed pulley destroyed\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Major Merit Loss:</rgb>\
* Injured Rohirrim defeated\
* Rohirrim healer defeated\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Moderate Merit Loss:</rgb>\
* Pulley constructed\
* Ladder raised","Winches in the Windows"}},
[14640]={nameES="Wine When We Dine",objectivesES={"Talk to Glasnír in the Vineyards of Lórien","Grapes can be found growing upon trellises in the Vineyards of Lórien.\
\
Glasnír has asked you to collect some grapes for the new wine. No banquet would be complete without fine wine with which to toast, but making a fine wine takes time. Fortunately, the Elves make particularly fine vintners, for there is no lack of time in the long lives of these fair folk.","Glasnír is in the Vineyards of Lórien.\
\
You should let Glasnír know that you have collected grapes and crushed the berries as he wished.","Wine When We Dine","Crush the grapes in the tub","The tub is in the Vineyards of Lórien.\
\
You should take the grapes to tub to be crushed.","Maliriel has asked you to help her companions complete the preparations for the upcoming banquet."}},
[14641]={nameES="Winged Disease-carriers",objectivesES={}},
[14642]={nameES="Winged Pests",objectivesES={}},
[14643]={nameES="Alas de oscuridad y muerte",objectivesES={"El explorador de los Hijos de la tierra está escondido en un valle al este de Duvairë en Ram Dúath.\
\
Debes regresar con el explorador y contarle tu éxito contra las merrevail.","Alas de oscuridad y muerte","Las criaturas aladas que hirieron al explorador de los Hijos de la Tierra están en los barrancos orientales de Ram Dúath.\
\
El explorador te pidió que mataras a las feroces merrevail para que otros no resulten heridos o algo peor.","El explorador de los Hijos de la tierra ha sido atacado por extrañas criaturas que han llegado a Ram Dúath desde el norte. Te dijo que las mujeres con alas están aliadas con los Angmarim."}},
[14644]={nameES="Wings of Vigilance",objectivesES={"Dierna nods at you.\
\
'Well done.'\
\
Dierna's face is obscured, but you can sense a brief smirk.","The deserters have been freed and many bandits defeated. You should talk to Dierna.\
\
Dierna is in Arnach.","Wings of Vigilance","Dierna would like to investigate the recent appearance of bandits in Aegollant.","Dierna has asked you to investigate Aegollant, release captured deserters, and to cull the number of bandits in the area.\
\
Aegollant is south-west of Arnach.","The Ranger does not acknowledge your arrival.\
\
'We need to investigate Aegollant. Scouts have reported an increased presence of bandits in the area looting and pillaging travellers along those roads.\
\
'To make matters worse, deserters have been captured by these bandits. Release them, and send them back home.'\
\
The Ranger idles once again and looks past you as though you do not exist.","Talk to Dierna"}},
[14645]={nameES="Limpieza de invierno",objectivesES={"Habla con Nôra","Un viento terrible sopla desde Angmar, trayendo con él un invierno glacial.","Limpieza de invierno","Nôra está en Sûri-kylä.\
\
Deberías hablar con Nôra y contarle sobre tu victoria.","El oso Kylmä-Säri vive en la bahía de hielo, al sureste. Tuima-kitta, el peikko, se encuentra al norte de Sûri-kylä."}},
[14646]={nameES="Guantes de Invierno",objectivesES={"Lleva las pieles de lince al intendente Orgrin","Orgrin, el intendente de Othrikar, requiere tu ayuda para mantener las reservas del campamento.","Los linces merodean por las colinas que rodean Othrikar.\
\
Caza a los linces que merodean por las colinas alrededor de Othrikar, en el oeste de Nan Amlug, y llévalos al intendente Orgrin en la entrada de la mina enana.","Guantes de Invierno"}},
[14647]={nameES="Winter Nights Grow Cold",objectivesES={}},
[14648]={nameES="¡Las instancias de temporada de invierno han llegado!",objectivesES={"Juega las instancias de temporada de invierno durante el Festival de Yule"}},
[14649]={nameES="La Sabiduría de los Vigilantes",objectivesES={"La Sabiduría de los Vigilantes","Hrotha conoce a un Vigilante legendario que podría enseñarte grandes lecciones, pero primero debes estar debidamente equipado.","Por petición de Hrotha, debes hablar con Aragorn, hijo de Arathorn, para obtener la gran sabiduría de los Vigilantes.","Completa Un arma de poder y gloria","Aragorn se encuentra en Rivendel, en una de las habitaciones de huéspedes de la Casa de Elrond.\
\
Hrotha te aconsejó hablar con Aragorn, el Montaraz también conocido como Trancos.","Habla con Aragorn en Rivendel","Completa El segundo mejor aliado de un Vigilante","Hrotha está en Ost Guruth en las Tierras Solitarias."}},
[14650]={nameES="Pedir un deseo a una estrella",objectivesES={"Lleva las monedas a Orchalwë","Cuando las estrellas del cielo nocturno se reflejaban en las aguas de aquí, los Montaraces arrojaban monedas y pedían deseos.","Las monedas bajo las aguas son deseos que nunca tuvieron la oportunidad de cumplirse.","Pedir un deseo a una estrella","Orchalwë querrá llevarse las monedas que recogiste."}},
[14651]={nameES="With Love, From...",objectivesES={"You have delivered the mail to their rightful recipients. The messenger is gone by now, but you've carried out her instructions to the letter.","The messenger Ingvild has asked you to deliver mail to Ekhfás, Kólun, and Svíthi in Amdân.\
\
Ekhfás is at the Temámir camp, which is in the south-east corner of Amdân. Kólun at the Zhélruka camp, which is in the north-west corner. Svíthi at the Narfanghoth camp, which is near the centre of Amdân.","You have delivered the mail to their rightful recipients.","A messenger bearing deliveries needs help to find their recipients.","With Love, From...","Deliver mail to Ekhfás","Completado","Deliver mail to Kólun","Deliver mail to Svíthi"}},
[14652]={nameES="Withered Heath: A Deep Thaw",objectivesES={"Withered Heath: A Deep Thaw","Invaders in the Withered Heath have been defeated.","The Withered Heath is a barren, burned plain that lies between the two eastern arms of the Ered Mithrin, and was once home to many great dragons. Cold-drakes emerged from the Anvil's crack blackening the skies with their wings and the stones with their breath.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Warning: This quest requires Withered Heath: Weathering the Storm to be underway. If that quest has been completed or failed, you will be unable to exit and re-enter this instance in order to complete this quest.</rgb>","Defeat invaders in the Withered Heath","Completado"}},
[14653]={nameES="Withered Heath: A Harsh Pursuit",objectivesES={"The Withered Heath is a barren, burned plain that lies between the two eastern arms of the Ered Mithrin which was once home to many great dragons. Cold-drakes emerged from the Anvil's crack, blackening the skies with their wings and the stones with their breath.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Warning: This quest requires Withered Heath: Weathering the Storm to be underway. If that quest has been completed or failed, you will be unable to exit and re-enter this instance in order to complete this quest.</rgb>","Withered Heath: A Harsh Pursuit","You gathered sulfurous deposits.","Completado","Gather sulfurous deposits."}},
[14654]={nameES="Withered Heath: Weathering the Storm",objectivesES={"Defeat Jókull in the Withered Heath.","Defeated Jókull","The Withered Heath is a barren, burned plain that lies between the two eastern arms of the Ered Mithrin, and was once home to many great dragons. Cold-drakes emerged from the Anvil's crack blackening the skies with their wings and the stones with their breath.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Warning: This quest has a one hour time limit. The timer will begin upon accepting the quest.</rgb>","Talk to Stráhek the Stout","You ran out of time...","Withered Heath: Weathering the Storm","You should return to to Stráhek the Stout in Skarháld and let him know of your success in the Withered Heath.","Defeat Jókull"}},
[14655]={nameES="Withered and Wracked",objectivesES={"Mílien is outside her home in the Fourth Circle of Minas Tirith.\
\
Mílien is waiting for Círgon to return home. You should wait with her.","You have discovered two men having a heated conversation, and one is soaked!","The Baths of Belecthor can be found to the north in the Fourth Circle.\
\
Mílien has suggested you begin your search for Círgon where you last saw him - at the Baths.","The puddle lead away from the Baths of Belecthor in the Fourth Circle of Minas Tirith.\
\
You have attempted to comfort Círgon, and should now try to seek out the person responsible for this crime.","Talk to Ristagír","Círgon is standing near the Baths of Belecthor in the Fourth Circle of Minas Tirith.\
\
You have found Círgon, but he is in clear distress as one of his ships has been vandalised and broken.","Círgon can be found outside his home in the Fourth Circle of Minas Tirith.\
\
You have spoken to Círgon's family and should now speak to him.","Withered and Wracked","Follow the trail of puddles away from the Baths of Belecthor","Círgon is nowhere to be found...","Talk to Mílien","Search for Círgon near the Baths of Belecthor in the Fourth Circle","Círgon has delayed in returning home, and Mílien fears he has gotten himself into trouble.","You have found Círgon, but one of his model ships is battered and sunken!","Mílien is outside her home in the Fourth Circle of Minas Tirith.\
\
Círgon has not returned home as quickly as he suggested. You should now talk to Mílien.","Wait for Círgon to return home","Talk to Círgon","Talk to Ristagír outside Mílien's home","Ristagír and Mílien can be found outside her home in the Fourth Circle of Minas Tirith.\
\
Ristagír has asked you to meet him and his nephew at Mílien's home. You should speak to them upon your arrival.","The men are standing along the wall in the Fourth Circle.\
\
You have discovered two men, one of whom is wearing clothing soaked in water. You should confront them.","A trail of puddles leads away from the Baths..."}},
[14656]={nameES="Within Shakal-atrâd",objectivesES={}},
[14657]={nameES="Within the Bones of Barad-dûr",objectivesES={"After discovering that Váskmun Greytooth, the long-imprisoned King of the Stout-axes, lives still within the ruins of Barad-dûr, the Stout-axes hope to see him freed and returned to his folk in Lûghash.","Talk to King Váskmun Greytooth","Find King Váskmun Greytooth some food at the larder in Barad-dûr","Barad-dûr can be found to the south-east of Lûghash in Dor Amarth.\
\
You have entered Barad-dûr and should now seek the dungeons in the depths of the Dark Tower.","King Váskmun Greytooth can be found in his cell in the dungeons of Barad-dûr.\
\
You have found King Greytooth some food as well as his ornate, golden armour, but you were unable to find his lockbox. You should deliver his equipment to him in his cell in Barad-dûr.","Barad-dûr can be found to the south-east of Lûghash in Dor Amarth.\
\
King Váskmun Greytooth of the Stout-axes can be found somewhere deep within the dungeons of Barad-dûr. You should begin your search in the ruins of the Dark Tower.","It is no feast, but it will have to do...","The shadow-mantled ruins of Sauron's fortress still bear a twisted splendour...","Deep within Barad-dûr, you have found a haggard dwarf surrounded by slain Men and empty robes of the Unseen...","As you pass downward into the darkness of Barad-dûr, you discover a stone room lined with cells...","Find King Váskmun Greytooth's lockbox in Sauron's relic-chamber","Enter the ruins of Barad-dûr","King Váskmun Greytooth can be found in his cell in the dungeons of Barad-dûr.\
\
You have found the King of the Stout-axes at a curious moment. It appears he has overpowered his captors, and now means to escape. You should speak to him on behalf of Spakorth.","Search for the dungeons within the ruins of Barad-dûr","Talk to King Váskmun Greytooth in Lûghash","King Váskmun Greytooth can be found on the central level of Lûghash.\
\
You have returned to Lûghash with King Váskmun Greytooth and should now speak to him before he addresses his folk.","Find King Váskmun Greytooth's armour in the dungeon armoury of Barad-dûr","Within the Bones of Barad-dûr","You find no trace of the lockbox that King Greytooth described...","Find King Váskmun Greytooth in the depths of Barad-dûr","King Váskmun Greytooth's armour can be found among the collected weapons at the armoury, rations of some kind can be found in the larder within the dungeons of Barad-dûr, and his mithril lockbox can be found in a small chamber near the main gate of Barad-dûr.\
\
King Váskmun Greytooth has asked for you to aid in his escape by finding him some food, his old armour, and a mithril lockbox that was taken from him by Sauron.","You discover a dwarf-make set of glinting, gold-wrought armour!","Deliver the equipment to King Váskmun Greytooth in Barad-dûr","King Váskmun Greytooth can be found deep within the dungeons of Barad-dûr.\
\
You have found imprisoned Stout-axes, but you still have no found King Greytooth. You should proceed deeper into the dungeons of Barad-dûr and continue your search."}},
[14658]={nameES="Within the Looming Darkness",objectivesES={"The 'wall of shadow' can be found to the south of Torgris in Falch Gurth.\
\
Cuilion has asked you to enter Falch Gurth and learn what has become of the company of Rangers who sought to explore Thuringwath.","Talk to Mithrandir","The stone disappears into the shadows, making no sound as it clatters unseen upon the ground","Within the Looming Darkness","Mithrandir can be found in Falch Gurth.\
\
You have discovered the 'wall of shadow' of which Taurdir spoke, but it appears Mithrandir followed in your wake. You should talk to him.","Mithrandir can be found within Falch Gurth.\
\
After casting a stone into the shadows of Thuringwath, it appears to be gone from the world. You should talk to Mithrandir.","A stone can be found in Falch Gurth.\
\
Mithrandir has asked you to cast a stone into the shadows of Falch Gurth. You should pick up a nearby stone and cast it into the darkness.","Find the 'wall of shadow' in Falch Gurth","To your surprise, Mithrandir stands before the 'wall of shadow'","A small company of Rangers of Ithilien passed through what Taurdir described as a 'wall of shadow' in Falch Gurth.","Cast a stone into the shadows of Falch Gurth"}},
[14659]={nameES="Without a Hitch - A Celebratory Snack",objectivesES={"The crafting recipe for the strawberry buns can be bartered for from the marriage-wright, Melthend.\
\
Strawberry bun kits can be earned by completing Midsummer quests in Hobbiton-Bywater and at the Party Tree.","A beleaguered marriage-wright, Melthend, has asked you to bake some strawberry buns for an upcoming ceremony.","Melthend raises an eyebrow.","Without a Hitch - A Celebratory Snack"}},
[14660]={nameES="Without a Hitch - A Wedding Favour",objectivesES={"The crafting recipe for the wedding centrepieces can be bartered for from the marriage-wright, Melthend.\
\
Wedding centrepiece kits can be earned by completing Midsummer quests in Duillond.","Without a Hitch - A Wedding Favour","A beleaguered marriage-wright, Melthend, has asked you to assemble some wedding centrepieces for an upcoming ceremony."}},
[14661]={nameES="Without a Hitch - Banners for the Newly-wed",objectivesES={"Without a Hitch - Banners for the Newly-wed","The crafting recipe for the banners of the newly-wed can be bartered for from the marriage-wright, Melthend.\
\
Banner of the newly-wed kits can be earned by completing Midsummer quests in Bree-town.","A beleaguered marriage-wright, Melthend, has asked you to assemble some banners of the newly-wed for an upcoming ceremony."}},
[14662]={nameES="Without a Hitch - Drinking Horns",objectivesES={"The crafting recipe for a midsummer drinking horn can be bartered for from the marriage-wright, Melthend.\
\
Drinking horn kits can be found by completing Midsummer quests in Thorin's Hall.","Without a Hitch - Drinking Horns","A beleaguered marriage-wright, Melthend, has asked you to fashion some midsummer drinking horns for an upcoming ceremony."}},
[14663]={nameES="Withstanding the Marauders",objectivesES={}},
[14664]={nameES="Witnessed Accounts",objectivesES={"Forthere does not understand how lucky he is to be alive, and hates his neighbours for saving him","Ludeca is so hungry, cold, and afraid that he can recall nothing helpful","Gifemund believes the harvest has been spoiled by frost, and his folk starve without food","Cyneberg wants you to ask the people who escaped Dunfast what they saw.","Cyneberg is at the refugee's hideout south-west of Dunfast.\
\
You should speak with Cyneberg.","Tell Cyneberg of the survivors' plight","The refugees are huddled in their tiny camp south-west of Dunfast.\
\
You should ask the refugees if they observed any relic to cause the ice-spire to appear where Núrzum sat.","Léofburg saw nothing, and only rants about the bitter cold","Witnessed Accounts","Herethryth thinks of nothing but the poor cows that were left behind when the villagers fled"}},
[14665]={nameES="Wizard in the Woods",objectivesES={"Habla con Radagast","Wizard in the Woods","You should search the Thornholt woods, south of Skarháld, for the odd wizard Stráhek the Stout encountered.","Search for the wizard in the woods","Stráhek the Stout retreated after encountering a wizard in Thornholt while collecting supplies.","The wizard stands among the wood of Thornholt, south of Skarháld.\
\
You should talk to the not so odd, actually familiar wizard in the woods."}},
[14666]={nameES="El infortunio del Sauce — Solo",objectivesES={"Recoge el cuerno de invocación","Aunque los trolls silvanos han perdido a su líder, los espíritus malignos siguen acudiendo al Bosque Viejo.\
\
Deberías destruir la espada que ha estado invocando a los espíritus.","En el corazón del Bosque Viejo, una espada maligna invoca a los espíritus perversos de las Quebradas de los Túmulos. Solo destruyendo la espada podrás impedir que el azote de los trolls silvanos se propague y poner fin al sufrimiento del bosque.","Gulmúk Mohohúmedo derrotado","Has destruido la hoja mórgul","El infortunio del Sauce — Solo","Los trolls silvanos están corrompiendo el bosque.\
\
Deberías derrotar a su líder, Gulmúk Mohohúmedo.","El camino hacia el Viejo Hombre Sauce te ha llevado a lo más profundo del Bosque Viejo.\
\
Deberías recoger el cuerno de invocación para llamar a Marigold a tu lado.","Derrota a Gulmúk Mohohúmedo","Destruye la espada","Usa el cuerno de invocación para llamar a Marigold"}},
[14667]={nameES="El infortunio del Sauce — Nivel 1",objectivesES={"Aunque los trolls silvanos han perdido a su líder, los espíritus malignos siguen acudiendo al Bosque Viejo.\
\
Deberías destruir la espada que ha estado invocando a los espíritus.","En el corazón del Bosque Viejo, una espada maligna invoca a los espíritus perversos de las Quebradas de los Túmulos. Solo destruyendo la espada podrás impedir que el azote de los trolls silvanos se propague y poner fin al sufrimiento del bosque.","Gulmúk Mohohúmedo derrotado","Has destruido la hoja mórgul","El infortunio del Sauce — Nivel 1","Los trolls silvanos están corrompiendo el bosque.\
\
Deberías derrotar a su líder, Gulmúk Mohohúmedo.","Derrota a Gulmúk Mohohúmedo","Destruye la espada"}},
[14668]={nameES="El infortunio del Sauce — Nivel 2",objectivesES={"Aunque los trolls silvanos han perdido a su líder, los espíritus malignos siguen acudiendo al Bosque Viejo.\
\
Deberías destruir la espada que ha estado invocando a los espíritus.","En el corazón del Bosque Viejo, una espada maligna invoca a los espíritus perversos de las Quebradas de los Túmulos. Solo destruyendo la espada podrás impedir que el azote de los trolls silvanos se propague y poner fin al sufrimiento del bosque.","Gulmúk Mohohúmedo derrotado","Has destruido la hoja mórgul","Los trolls silvanos están corrompiendo el bosque.\
\
Deberías derrotar a su líder, Gulmúk Mohohúmedo.","Derrota a Gulmúk Mohohúmedo","Destruye la espada","El infortunio del Sauce — Nivel 2"}},
[14669]={nameES="El infortunio del Sauce — Nivel 3",objectivesES={"El infortunio del Sauce — Nivel 3","Aunque los trolls silvanos han perdido a su líder, los espíritus malignos siguen acudiendo al Bosque Viejo.\
\
Deberías destruir la espada que ha estado invocando a los espíritus.","En el corazón del Bosque Viejo, una espada maligna invoca a los espíritus perversos de las Quebradas de los Túmulos. Solo destruyendo la espada podrás impedir que el azote de los trolls silvanos se propague y poner fin al sufrimiento del bosque.","Gulmúk Mohohúmedo derrotado","Has destruido la hoja mórgul","Los trolls silvanos están corrompiendo el bosque.\
\
Deberías derrotar a su líder, Gulmúk Mohohúmedo.","Derrota a Gulmúk Mohohúmedo","Destruye la espada"}},
[14670]={nameES="Woes of Travelling",objectivesES={"Siliveth has asked you to check on their companion Luingil.\
\
Luingil can be found in Echad Lendir.","Siliveth would like you to check on her friends who are sequestered in Echad Lendir.\
\
Echad Lendir can be found to the west of Barad Faen.","Talk to Luingil in Echad Lendir","Woes of Travelling"}},
[14671]={nameES="Wold Tents: Enhancements I",objectivesES={}},
[14672]={nameES="Wold Tents: Enhancements II",objectivesES={}},
[14673]={nameES="Wold Tents: Inhabitants",objectivesES={}},
[14674]={nameES="Wold Tents: Rebuild",objectivesES={}},
[14675]={nameES="Caza de lobos",objectivesES={"Caza de lobos","Se pueden encontrar lobos en toda Eregion.\
\
Golgallon te ha pedido que busques y destruyas a los lobos que plagan Eregion.","Mientras las fuerzas de Saruman y Mordor recorren la tierra de Acebeda en busca del Portador del Anillo, criaturas malignas se infiltran en Eregion.","Habla con Golgallon en Echad Eregion","Golgallon está en Echad Eregion.\
\
Deberías volver a ver a Golgallon e informarle de tu éxito contra los lobos."}},
[14676]={nameES="Hombres lobo del norte",objectivesES={"Habla con Lithuifin en las Agujas de la Linde","Lithuifin está en las Agujas de la Linde, al suroeste de los Saltos del Crepúsculo.\
\
Lithuifin querrá saber que los Gauredain han sido expulsados de los Saltos del Crepúsculo.","Los Saltos del Crepúsculo están al noreste de las Agujas de la Linde.\
\
Lithuifin te pidió que te dirijas a los Saltos del Crepúsculo y derrotes a los Gauredain de allí.","Hombres lobo del norte","Los Saltos del Crepúsculo son una serie de pozas y cascadas por las que fluye el agua del deshielo de Forochel antes de entrar en el lago de Evendim.'"}},
[14677]={nameES="Pieles de lobo",objectivesES={"Pieles de lobo","Roger Hawkling ayuda a Adso Henoloma suministrando pieles y carne a la cabaña.","Hay lobos en el Bosque Viejo.\
\
Roger Hawkling te ha pedido que ayudes a repeler la amenaza de los lobos en la zona, entregándole sus pieles como prueba de tu trabajo.","Entrega las pieles de lobo a Roger Hawkling"}},
[14678]={nameES="El arco de Crestalupina",objectivesES={"El arco de Crestalupina","Vuelve con Hal","Recupera el arco robado de Hal","Deberías llevarle el arco robado a Hal Crestalupina.\
\
Hal se encuentra en el campamento en el norte de Tharbad en Cardolan.","Hal Crestalupina vino a Tharbad con la tarea de alimentar al grupo de Siempreviva, pero sin su arco, este cazador no puede cumplir con su deber.","Hal Crestalupina te ha pedido que recuperes su arco, que fue robado por orcos.\
\
El orco que robó el arco de Hal está en Tharbad, en Cardolan."}},
[14679]={nameES="Lobos en El Cruce",objectivesES={"La guarida de los lobos está junto a la carretera al norte de la granja de Dora Rizopardo y El Cruce.\
\
Dora Rizopardo está agradecida de que hayas rescatado a sus gallinas de los lobos, pero tiene miedo de volver a casa hasta estar segura de que los lobos no la molestarán más. Te ha pedido que vayas a la guarida y acabes con la amenaza.","Dora Rizopardo está en el centro de El Cruce.\
\
Dora Rizopardo estará encantada de saber que has hecho algo respecto a los lobos que amenazan la zona.","Los lobos invadieron la granja de Dora Rizopardo y representan una amenaza para El Cruce y las comunidades cercanas.","Lobos en El Cruce"}},
[14680]={nameES="Lobos de las Tierras Salvajes",objectivesES={"Lobos de las Tierras Salvajes","Hay Gauredain acampados en Echad Gauradan, en Tâl Bruinen, dentro del Bosque de los Trolls.\
\
Mientras estés en Tâl Bruinen, deberías derrotar a los Gauredain que se han establecido allí.","Los Gauredain provenientes de las tierras salvajes del norte de Forochel han venido hacia el sur, al Bosque de los Trolls, respondiendo al llamado de Mordor."}},
[14681]={nameES="Wolves at Our Walls",objectivesES={"Wolves at Our Walls","Emerald Twospade is in Hoarhallow.\
\
You scoured through the Grimwood and slew a large number of the Darktide-wolves. You should return to Emerald Twospade with the news.","Return to Emerald Twospade at Hoarhallow","Wolves can be found east and west of Hoarhallow, scattered throughout Hithlad and into the hills of the Steps of Gram.\
\
Emerald Twospade explained that the wolves of the Ettenmoors have long been the true threat against the Little Folk of Hoarhallow. She enlisted your aid in destroying the creatures and lessening their threat.","Hoarhallow has always been in a difficult position. Being a village of hobbits in a place so filled with corruption and death is difficult, but these hobbits had lived in quiet obscurity until the Ongbûrz poured through the mountains north of their home. With the arrival of evil, came new threats as the foes surrounding the village suddenly became aware of their presence."}},
[14682]={nameES="Lobos a Sus Espaldas",objectivesES={"Los exploradores elfos Narlinn y Fimgris te enviaron a advertir a los hijos de Elrond del peligro inminente para Rivendel, y éstos, a su vez, solicitaron tu ayuda.","Lobos a Sus Espaldas","Busca a Pothlorn","Pothlorn estaba explorando el sendero que lleva hacia el norte y el este a través de las Gargantas hasta Ost Thondol.\
\
Elladan te pidió que buscaras al explorador elfo desaparecido, Pothlorn, y averiguaras si aún vive."}},
[14683]={nameES="Lobos a la puerta",objectivesES={"Urho se encuentra en el camino del noroeste, junto a su puesto de guardia en ruinas.\
\
Has abatido a muchos lobos y ahora deberías regresar con Urho para informarle de tu éxito.","Habla con Urho","Lobos a la puerta","Lobos blancos han destruido la cabaña de vigilancia en el borde del bosque. Si los lobos siguen acercándose al campamento comercial, podrían poner en peligro el suministro procedente de los cazadores del norte.","Los lobos pueden encontrarse en gran parte de Taur Orthon.\
Urho te ha pedido que lo ayudes cazando a los lobos que destruyeron su tienda."}},
[14684]={nameES="Wolves at the Neck",objectivesES={"You have defeated a number of wolves at Eryn Asgath.","Much to the dismay of the people of Lancrath, a pack of wolves has made a den in the woodlands near Tarlang's Neck.","Wolves can be found in Eryn Asgath near Tarlang's Neck in the Blackroot Vale.","Wolves at the Neck","To the south-east of the Hill of Erech, you have discovered the wolf den of Eryn Asgath. Whether these wolves crept in from Lamedon or some hidden refuge in the hills, their presence in the vale has posed a continued threat to the hamlet of Lancrath and to all who would seek to travel the road through Tarlang's Neck.\
\
You should defeat wolves in Eryn Asgath to aid the people of Lancrath and make safe the road through Tarlang's Neck.","You have defeated a number of wolves at Eryn Asgath and made safe the road through Tarlang's Neck. Through your efforts, you have eased the fears of the good people of Lancrath and they will rest more soundly knowing that wolves do not stalk the vale so near to their homes in the night.","Defeat wolves in Eryn Asgath (0/12)","Completado","Wolves can be found in Eryn Asgath near Tarlang's Neck in the Blackroot Vale.\
\
You have discovered the den of the wolves that recently invaded the Blackroot Vale. You should defeat them and make safe the road through Tarlang's Neck."}},
[14685]={nameES="Lobos en los campos",objectivesES={"Cam Barroso, un granjero de cerdos en Bolgovado, tiene problemas con lobos que atacan sus pocilgas.","Hay lobos en los campos de Cam Barroso, al este de Bolgovado.\
\
Hyacinth Tuk te ha enviado a ver a Cam Barroso para pedirle que le entregue salitre para los fuegos artificiales de Lobelia Sacovilla-Bolsón. El granjero Barroso está dispuesto a entregar el salitre, pero primero quiere que limpies sus campos de lobos.","Lobos en los campos","Hyacinth Tuk está cerca de los Grandes Smials, en Alforzaburgo.\
\
Mientras ayudabas a limpiar los campos de Cam Barroso de lobos, el granjero de cerdos recogió un saco de salitre para que se lo llevaras a Hyacinth Tuk.","Lleva el salitre a Hyacinth Tuk","Cam Barroso está cerca de su casa en Bolgovado.\
\
Cam Barroso está dispuesto a enviar salitre a Hyacinth Tuk, pero primero te pidió que le ayudaras a limpiar sus campos de lobos. Con la amenaza de los lobos disminuida, deberías volver a verlo."}},
[14686]={nameES="Wolves in the Woods",objectivesES={"While the lumber camp lay dormant, wolves moved into the surrounding woods.","Talk to Dornach","Wolves in the Woods","Dornach has asked you to thin the number of wolves sharing the forest with his people.\
\
Defeat vale-wolves around the lumber camp east of Ethring.","You have defeated many wolves, and should report back to Dornach.\
\
Talk to Dornach at the lumber camp east of Ethring."}},
[14687]={nameES="Wolves of Isengard",objectivesES={"Warg-riders and wolves haunt the fields to the east of Stoke.\
\
Dudsig has asked you to deal with the threat of Warg-riders and wolves which plague the people of the Broadacres.","Dudsig is at the Oserley encampment outside the north-east gate of Stoke.\
\
You should return to Stoke and tell Dudsig of your victories.","Talk to Dudsig","Wolves of Isengard","War is afoot, and the town of Stoke is preparing for the inevitable siege."}},
[14688]={nameES="Lobos de Nen Hilith",objectivesES={"Lobos de Nen Hilith","Helhathel está en el campamento élfico, al noroeste de los parajes de los lobos.\
\
Has derrotado un buen número de lobos dentro del valle de Nen Hilith y debes regresar con Helhathel con tu informe.","Habla con Helhathel en Nen Hilith","Los lobos pueden encontrarse en Nen Hilith, al suroeste del campamento élfico.\
\
Helhathel te ha pedido derrotar lobos en Nen Hilith para restaurar el equilibrio en el valle.","Los lobos han encontrado su camino hacia el pacífico valle de Nen Hilith y han alterado el equilibrio de la naturaleza allí."}},
[14689]={nameES="Wolves of the Grimwood",objectivesES={"Place the talons on the stump","Emerald Twospade hopes to score two strikes at once against the enemies of Hoarhallow. The wolves scattered throughout the Ettenmoors have no respect for life in any form. She hopes that you can raise their ire enough and leave a trail that leads to the Grimwood to fight against the Orcs who now hold the lumber-yard as their own.","Wolves of the Grimwood","Scattered throughout the Ettenmoors are places prowled by the Darktide wolves.\
\
Emerald Twospade believes that the Darktide wolves can be coaxed into attacking the forces of Angmar camped at the Grimwood Lumber-camp. To this end, she has asked you to collect talons from the Darktide wolves.","The cut stump is on the outskirts of the Grimwood Lumber-camp.\
\
Emerald Twospade directed you to find the cut stump on the outskirts of the Grimwood Lumber Camp. She hopes that placing the talons on the stump will draw Darktide wolves to attack the forces at the camp.","Deliver the talons to Emerald Twospade at Hoarhallow"}},
[14690]={nameES="Madera para Vino",objectivesES={"La vinatera Brethilwen desea proporcionar suficiente vino para que dure los últimos viajes desde los Puertos Grises hacia el Occidente Remoto, pero necesita madera para toneles.","Madera para Vino","Buscas entre la pila de madera, pero solo encuentras vigas podridas","La madera puede encontrarse en el valle de Nen Hilith, al suroeste del campamento élfico.\
\
Glavrolnen te ha pedido que le lleves varias piezas de madera resistente.","Revisas la pila de madera y seleccionas una buena pieza de tronco","Lleva la madera a Glavrolnen en Nen Hilith","Glavrolnen se encuentra en el campamento élfico en Nen Hilith, al noreste de las pilas de madera.\
\
Buscando entre las pilas de madera, pudiste identificar cinco buenas piezas con las que puede construirse un tonel resistente. Ahora deberías regresar con Glavrolnen."}},
[14691]={nameES="Leña para el Fuego",objectivesES={"Habla con Nos Grimsong","Leña para el Fuego","La madera puede encontrarse al suroeste del Patio de Frerin.\
\
Nos Grimsong te ha pedido que reúnas madera para él.","Ahora que te has ocupado de la fauna local, Nos Grimsong te ha pedido que ayudes a reponer suministros para el Patio de Frerin.","Habla con Nos Grimsong en el Patio de Frerin","Nos Grimsong está en el Patio de Frerin, al noreste de donde reuniste la madera.\
\
Debes regresar con Nos Grimsong para recoger tu recompensa."}},
[14692]={nameES="Wood for the Walls",objectivesES={}},
[14693]={nameES="Wood from the Emyn Ernil",objectivesES={"Falastír, the keeper of the Cape of Belfalas lighthouse, could use some wood from the Emyn Ernil.","Habla con Falastír","Trees can be found on the slopes of the Emyn Ernil.\
\
You should chop down some trees to collect wood.","Falastír is located at the lighthouse on the Cape of Belfalas.\
\
You should bring Falastír the wood you gathered on Emyn Ernil.","Wood from the Emyn Ernil"}},
[14694]={nameES="Wood from the Past",objectivesES={"Volver a Jiret-menêsh","You have found several branches of sarláshi wood. You talk to Gôbezhir and give them to him.","You have found several branches of sarláshi wood. You should return to Jiret-menêsh so you can give them to Gôbezhir.","Bring the sarláshi branches to Gôbezhir","Gôbezhir Firmhand is hoping that usable wood from sarláshi trees can still be found at Zakhûr, where a Kinta grove once stood. He wants to use this wood to make the haft of the axe he is working on, his life's masterwork.","Gôbezhir has asked you to go to Zakhûr in eastern An Shêru to search for branches of sarláshi wood.","Wood from the Past"}},
[14695]={nameES="Figurillas de Madera — Introducción",objectivesES={"Marga Maderín está en el Pabellón de Caza de Bree, al oeste de la Puerta Sur.\
\
Maggie Maderín te ha pedido que encuentres figurillas de madera para venderlas a los mercaderes ambulantes.","Figurillas de Madera — Introducción","Lleva las figurillas de madera a Marga Maderín","Los carpinteros de Bree se enorgullecen de su artesanía."}},
[14696]={nameES="Woodhurst Has Fallen",objectivesES={"Speak with Herubrand","Those allied against the new claim for the throne have gathered and are ready to confront those who now hold the mead hall.","Speak with Gifemund","Woodhurst Has Fallen","Gifemund is in the ore refinery building near the centre of Woodhurst.\
\
The time has come to reclaim the throne of Woodhurst.","Herubrand is in his hideout in the cellar of the farmhouse in Woodhurst.\
\
Herubrand wishes to speak with you after the battle in the mead hall."}},
[14697]={nameES="Woodmen Astray",objectivesES={}},
[14698]={nameES="Woodworker: Long-burning Torch",objectivesES={"Hildelith has given you a recipe for a long-burning torch.\
\
You should craft a long-burning torch for the survivors of Wildermore who fear the dark and cold.","A skilled woodworker such as yourself can help the refugees of Wildermore by crafting a long-burning torch for them.","<rgb=#FF0000>Completing Wildermore's Recovery will cancel this quest.</rgb>","Woodworker: Long-burning Torch","Deliver the long-burning torch to Hildelith","Hildelith is in Forlaw.\
\
You have crafted a long-burning torch and should now deliver it to Hildelith."}},
[14699]={nameES="Word Among Ugrukhôr's Forces",objectivesES={}},
[14700]={nameES="Noticias de Calenglad",objectivesES={"Calenglad está en el campamento de los montaraces en la isla de Tinnudir, al suroeste de Ost Forod, en Evendim.\
\
El montaraz Calenglad ha enviado un mensaje indicando que desea hablar contigo.","Noticias de Calenglad","Calenglad ha enviado un mensaje a Robin Sotopardo diciéndole que ha vuelto de su viaje para reunirse con Gwindeth y que quiere hablar contigo."}},
[14701]={nameES="Word from Edoras",objectivesES={"Talk to Arcil","Aldburg is south-east of Edoras, nestled near the White Mountains.\
\
Follow the road that leads to Aldburg and keep an eye out for danger.","Look for danger along the road to Aldburg","Arcil can be found in the Mead Hall of Aldburg.\
\
Éothain recommended that you seek out the Thane, Arcil, who has been regent of Aldburg in Éomer's absence.","Word from Edoras","Another overturned supply waggon lies next to the road. Assess the damage done","Éomer has been released from the prison at Edoras, where he had been unjustly sent by Gríma Wormtongue.","Aldburg is south-east of Edoras, nestled near the White Mountains.\
\
Continue to follow the road that leads to Aldburg and keep an eye out for danger.","Éothain is at Aldburg in the Eastfold.\
\
You should seek out and speak with Éomer's cousin, Éothain.","Travelled to Aldburg","An overturned supply waggon lies next to the road. Assess the damage done","Keep an eye out for additional danger along the road to Aldburg","Talk to Éothain","Ir a Aldburg","Aldburg is south-east of Edoras, nestled near the White Mountains.\
\
Gandalf ask you to head to Aldburg and deliver the news of Éomer's release and the march upon Isengard."}},
[14702]={nameES="Word from Lamedon",objectivesES={"The village of Tadrent is located in eastern Belfalas, on the south side of the River Ringló.\
\
You should speak with Bruidis, the head merchant in Tadrent.","Speak with Bruidis on how you may be of assistance","Word from Lamedon","Bruidis is located near Haelam in Tadrent.\
\
Speak with Bruidis to discuss a plan.","Now that Jajax has tasked it upon himself to bury his loyal fallen, he sends you to Belfalas where these other Corsair captains that Hebil alluded to may be hiding.","Speak with Bruidis to discuss a plan","Speak with Haelam to learn more about the situation","Bruidis wishes you to speak with Haelam of his account on the road","Travel to Tadrent and speak with Bruidis","Haelam is located near Bruidis in Tadrent.\
\
Speak with Haelam to learn more about the Corsair situation."}},
[14703]={nameES="Noticias del Valle Sagrado",objectivesES={"Through your efforts in the Harrowdale, Ellen Fremedon and the people of Kingstead stand ready to travel to Dunharrow.","Noticias del Valle Sagrado","Talk to Éowyn in Edoras","Éowyn can be found outside Meduseld in Edoras.\
\
Ellen Fremedon has asked you to speak to Éowyn.","DNT -- Players will not see"}},
[14704]={nameES="Una Palabra de Advertencia",objectivesES={"Narlinn está en su campamento, hacia el oeste por el camino principal desde el campamento de Arrod.\
\
Arrod te pidió que llevaras a Narlinn noticias de tu descubrimiento en la cueva de los trolls.","Habla con Narlinn","Has descubierto que los trolls acampados en la cueva cercana no son trolls de piedra, sino trolls de caverna... una amenaza mucho mayor.","Una Palabra de Advertencia"}},
[14705]={nameES="Word of the Chieftain",objectivesES={"You've earned the trust of the Red Sky Clan and have been invited to enter their village and meet the chieftain, Parsâ-dhug-Bhêr. She asks for help preparing her people for war with the Uruk-hai.","Parsâ-dhug-Bhêr, the chieftain of the Red Sky Clan, can be found in the village Bhol Rûdh.\
\
You should talk to Parsâ-dhug-Bhêr.","Parsâ-dhug-Bhêr, the chieftain of the Red Sky Clan, can be found in the village Bhol Rûdh.\
\
You should find Parsâ-dhug-Bhêr.","Ghai-buri-Sêk can be found outside the mountain pass in north-east Agarnaith.\
\
You should talk to Ghai-buri-Sêk.","Complete: A Lost People's History","Complete: Rally the Warriors","Parsâ-dhug-Bhêr can be found in the village Bhol Rûdh.\
\
You should talk to Parsâ-dhug-Bhêr.","Parsâ-dhug-Bhêr stands before you","Talk to Ghai-buri-Sêk","Find Parsâ-dhug-Bhêr","Talk to Parsâ-dhug-Bhêr","Complete: Weapons of the Wose","Parsâ-dhug-Bhêr has asked you to help her warriors prepare for the coming battle.\
\
You should complete quests in Bhol Rûdh.","Word of the Chieftain"}},
[14706]={nameES="Word of the Wounded",objectivesES={"Visited Echadon, Captain of the Garrison","The High Hall, House of Remedies, and House of Rest are on the Sixth Circle of Minas Tirith.\
\
Visit the wounded on Torchún's list in the Houses of Healing and see how they are doing. Find Meriadoc the hobbit, Lord Faramir, Lady Éowyn of Rohan, Iorlas, and Echadon in the High Hall. Find Habdir, Bariel, Ormatar, and Thrymm of Rohan in the House of Rest. Find Gísling of Rohan,  Ulf of Rohan, and Húndil the Tavern Keep in the House of Remedies.","Visited Bariel, Master Hosteller","Visited Húndil, Tavern Keep of the Old Guest-house","Visited Ulf the Reaver","Visited Iorlas, Guard of the Citadel","Habdir is grievously wounded and unresponsive","Visited Ormatar, Captain of the Citadel Guard","Faramir sleeps deeply and should not be disturbed","Word of the Wounded","Merry lies in a deep and disquieting slumber","Visited Gísling of Garsfeld","You should return to Torchún, outside the House of Remedies, with news of everyone you visited.","Éowyn lies injured and deep in slumber","Torchún, Warden of the Houses of Healing, has promised to check in on a long list of the wounded but has spent more time sending well-wishers away.","Return to Torchún","Visited Thrymm Red-beard"}},
[14707]={nameES="Un mensaje para Anlaf",objectivesES={"Un mensaje para Anlaf","Ve a ver a Anlaf el Despojado en la Posada Abandonada.","«Esta petición puede que le resulte extraña, pero es necesaria.\
\
Hay una posada, entre los Pantanos de Moscagua y las Tierras Solitarias, llamada La Posada Abandonada, regentada por un hombre llamado Anlaf. Nos había reservado habitaciones, ya que teníamos previsto quedarnos allí unos días antes de regresar a Bree.\
\
Dados los recientes acontecimientos, está claro que no podremos hacer el viaje a través de las colinas hasta la posada. ¿Podrías ir allí y decirle al posadero que finalmente no podremos ir?","Dirígete hacia el sur, entre los Pantanos de Moscagua y las Tierras Solitarias, y ve a ver al dueño de la Posada Abandonada. Infórmale de que los cazadores ya no necesitan sus habitaciones.\
\
Sam Cardespina te ha pedido que vayas a la Posada Abandonada e informes a su posadero de que él y sus hombres ya no necesitan sus habitaciones.","Los cazadores de Bree que acampan cerca del Paso de Moscagua te han pedido que vayas a la Posada Abandonada para informar al dueño de que ya no necesitarán sus habitaciones."}},
[14708]={nameES="Mensaje a Puente de Caballetes",objectivesES={"El Capitán Pasolargo lidera a los habitantes de Puente de Caballetes, a lo largo del Camino Verde, al sur de los Campos de Fornost.\
\
La ciudad vive bajo una vigilancia constante y con el temor de que los orcos de la tribu de los Tarkrîp regresen y completen su masacre y destrucción de la ciudad. Las palabras de Mincham podrían convencer al Capitán Pasolargo de pedir ayuda a otros del sur. Mincham te ha ordenado que expliques el verdadero peligro que representa la tribu orca a la que se enfrenta el Capitán Pasolargo y la ciudad sitiada de Trestlebridge.","Mientras los Pueblos Libres de las Quebradas del Norte estaban ocupados con la amenaza del ejército orco en Dol Dínen, casi no se dieron cuenta del segundo ejército que marchó al oeste hacia Fornost.","Transmite las preocupaciones de Mincham al Capitán Pasolargo","Mensaje a Puente de Caballetes"}},
[14709]={nameES="Palabras hacia el sur",objectivesES={"Atrapar al cobarde Helechal y presentarlo ante Grimbriar habría establecido una mayor aceptación entre nosotros, pero me alegra saber que los orcos han sido sofocados por el momento.\
\
'Aun así, no podemos estar seguros de haber detenido sus esfuerzos por completo, y debo pedirte que continúes tus esfuerzos por ahora.'","Palabras hacia el sur","Aunque no capturamos a Helechal, detuvimos la amenaza por el momento. Esto complacerá a Saeradan, y debemos apresurarnos para informarle de este éxito.\
\
'Regresa a su cabaña, al sur por el Camino Verde, en el lado este del camino, y cuéntale lo que has logrado.'","Habla con Saeradan en su cabaña","Saeradan está en su cabaña, al sur del Viejo Fuerte del Camino Verde.\
\
Andreg te pidió que regresaras con Saeradan con noticias de tu éxito.","Los Montaraces, que vigilan los movimientos de los enemigos del norte y del sur, están preocupados por la aparición de un enemigo al que han luchado durante mucho tiempo en el norte."}},
[14710]={nameES="Palabras de coraje",objectivesES={"Shubârza has noticed that the morale of some of soldiers in the camp has been low. She asks that you help inspire them for the coming fight.","Palabras de coraje","Return to Shubârza in Amalíbi's camp","Return to Shubârza in Amalíbi's camp and let her know you managed to inspire some of the soldiers."}},
[14711]={nameES="Words of Encouragement",objectivesES={"Words of Encouragement","Maedal has a message for you to bring to Drafli Broadshield in his captivity.","Drafli Broadshield is being held captive in a cage partway up the slope of Amon Hen, in the East Wall. Maedal told you to follow the cliff from her position to the south and east until you see the Orc camp. A line of spiked posts lead the way to the camp.\
\
Maedal has given you a wooden figurine and a message to give to Drafli to help him through his imprisonment.","Defeat Orcs on Amon Hen until you find the other wooden figurine","Return to Maedal","Orcs and Uruks can be found all over Amon Hen, in the East Wall.\
\
Drafli Broadshield wants you to defeat Orcs and Uruks on Amon Hen until you find the other wooden figurine that Maedal was talking about.","Bring the wooden figurine to Drafli Broadshield","Maedal is on the slope of Amon Hen, in the East Wall.\
\
Dafli told you to return to Maedal and let her know that no other figurine could be found.","Drafli Broadshield is in a cage on Amon Hen, in the East Wall.\
\
You were unable to find any evidence of the existence of another wooden figurine and should return to Drafli.","You are starting to think there is no other figurine","Return to Drafli Broadshield"}},
[14712]={nameES="Palabras de Luz",objectivesES={"Examina una roca rúnica","Encuentra la roca rúnica","Palabras de Luz","Wéorn quiere que encuentres y examines una roca rúnica, sea lo que sea, aunque no sabe dónde encontrar una.","Wéorn ha descubierto registros de un objeto misterioso llamado 'roca rúnica', un objeto que le intriga.","Estás cerca de una roca rúnica","Wéorn se encuentra en el Refugio Sombrío.\
\
Debes regresar a Wéorn para informarle de tu descubrimiento.","La roca brilla con extrañas runas","Habla con Wéorn en el Refugio Sombrío"}},
[14713]={nameES="Words of the Enemy",objectivesES={"Talk to Gúldil in the Old Archives","Talk to Maenir","Alarmed by the text of the transcript from the Houses of Lore, Mithrandir advises you to seek out the thief at once before it can be used against the Men of Gondor.","Burn the scrawled transcript in the Houses of Lore","Words of the Enemy","Maenir can be found on the first floor of the Houses of Lore in the Fifth Circle.\
\
Mithrandir has expressed great concern about the lost scroll and urges you to speak to Maenir and destroy his transcript before it too falls into the wrong hands.","Maenir can be found on the first floor of the Houses of Lore in the Fifth Circle.\
\
You have burned the transcript at Maenir's urging and should speak to him again.","Gúldil can be found just inside the Old Archives in the tunnels of the Fifth Circle.\
\
Maenir has asked you to seek out Gúldil in the Old Archives as he fears the thief will soon find need of the ancient texts within.","The transcript folds and burns in the flames...","The fireplace can be found near Maenir in the Houses of Lore.\
\
Maenir has urged you to heed Mithrandir's advice and burn the transcript of the scroll."}},
[14714]={nameES="Worked to the Bone",objectivesES={"Rations can be found throughout the main level of Lûghash.\
\
Freki has asked you to gather rations for the exhausted smiths of Lûghash. You should gather the rations, and then proceed down to the depths of Lûghash to deliver them to the Stout-axe smiths.","Talk to Freki in Lûghash","Stout-axe smiths can be found on the lower level of Lûghash.\
\
You have gathered several rations and should now deliver them to the Stout-axe smiths in Lûghash.","Worked to the Bone","Freki can be found on the main level of Lûghash.\
\
You have delivered rations to many of the Stout-axe smiths in Lûghash and should now return to Freki.","The Stout-axes of Lûghash have long toiled for Zôreth, but her frantic search for the Dark Lord's keepings has pushed many into illness and death."}},
[14715]={nameES="Working the Mine",objectivesES={"The Mine Overseer appears to be taking advantage of your presence by having you perform additional tasks for him.","Repaired the tracks (3/3)","Repaired the tracks (2/3)","Working the Mine","Repair the tracks (1/3)","Repair the tracks (2/3)","Place ore in the second cart","The Mine Overseer is at the bottom of Wid Isernore.\
\
You should return to the Mine Overseer and inform him that you finished the tasks he assigned to you.","Talk to Gifemund","Placed ore in the second cart","Place ore in the first cart","Place ore in the third cart","Placed ore in the third cart","Repaired the tracks (1/3)","Talk to the Mine Overseer","The track runs from Wid Isernore towards Woodhurst.\
\
The Mine Overseer wants you to repair the track.","The workers in need of the new pick-axes are near the top of Wid Isernore.\
\
The Mine Overseer told you to take the new shipment of pickaxes to the workers in need of replacements.","Talk to the mine overseer","Gifemund awaits your return in the ore-refinery building near the centre of Woodhurst.\
\
The Mine Overseer instructed you to return to Gifemund.","The Mine Overseer is at the bottom of Wid Isernore for your next task.\
\
You should return to the Mine Overseer for your next task.","Placed ore in the first cart","Ore has been gathered at the bottom of Wid Isernore.\
\
You should load the collected ore into the carts.","Repair the tracks (0/3)","Collect ore","The new shipment of pickaxes is near the Mine Overseer, near the bottom of Wid Isernore.\
\
The Mine Overseer asked you to collect the new shipment of pickaxes.","The Mine Overseer is at the bottom of Wid Isernore.\
\
You should return to the Mine Overseer for your next task."}},
[14716]={nameES="Taller de los Alados",objectivesES={"El taller de los morrovals ha estado ocupado fabricando armas de guerra. Hadi tiene la tarea de poner fin a su labor.","Con los morrovals derrotados, ahora puedes destruir su arma de asedio","Hadi está en el campamento de la Fosa Colmilluda, al oeste del campamento de asedio de los morrovals.\
\
Hadi querrá saber que tu asalto con Erlar fue exitoso.","Destruye el arma de asedio de los morrovals","Habla con Hadi en el campamento de la Fosa Colmilluda","Habla con Erlar","Con el taller libre de morrovals, el arma de asedio cercana puede ser tratada.\
\
Hadi te ha pedido que ayudes a Erlar a asaltar el taller de armas de asedio de los morrovals.","Has destruido el arma de asedio de los morrovals","Taller de los Alados","Erlar se encuentra justo fuera del taller de los morrovals, al este del campamento de la Fosa Colmilluda.\
\
Hadi te ha pedido que hables con Erlar y le ayudes a asaltar el taller de armas de asedio de los morrovals. ¡Erlar debe sobrevivir!"}},
[14717]={nameES="Worm-Slayer",objectivesES={"Sand-worms can be found to the TBD Direction of TBD.\
\
TBD Lazy Scout has asked you to take over his task of ridding the TBD direction of sand-worms.","Return to TBD Lazy Scout","Worm-Slayer","TBD Lazy Scout has asked you to take over his task of ridding the TBD Direction of sand-worms.","TBD Lazy Scout can be found to the TBD Direction of TBD.\
\
Return to TBD Lazy Scout to inform him you have cleared the TBD Location of as many sand-worms as you could."}},
[14718]={nameES="Piel de sierpe",objectivesES={"Rodakhan el cazador ha dicho que pagará bien por las pieles de sierpe. Sin embargo, los gusanos son algunas de las bestias más peligrosas del pantano.","Los sierpes de fuego se pueden encontrar en la parte sureste de Malenhad. Rodakhan te ha pedido que le recolectes pieles de gusano de fuego y lo puedes encontrar en el campamento de Tyrn Lhuig.","Piel de sierpe","Lleva las pieles de sierpe de vuelta a Rodakhan"}},
[14719]={nameES="Sierpes en las Alturas",objectivesES={"<rgb=#FF0000>Mira</rgb> a lo lejos desde el monumento al oeste de Cirith Ulunn","Sarlug derrotado","Derrota a Sarlug","Sierpes en las Alturas","Este es un buen lugar desde el que <rgb=#FF00FF>mirar</rgb> en busca de Sarnemil","Cirith Ulunn, hogar de Sarlug, está directamente al este de Echad Candelleth, pero para llegar tendrás que subir el sendero inclinado al noreste, siguiendo la ruta de Tâl Bruinen hacia el norte y el este y cruzando a la orilla oriental del Bruinen. Al oeste de Cirith Ulunn, un monumento se alza al borde del acantilado.\
\
Daervellas te ha pedido viajar a Cirith Ulunn, derrotar a Sarlug y a muchas sierpes de las rocas que infestan Tâl Bruinen, y <rgb=#FF00FF>mirar</rgb> desde el monumento para localizar a la compañera de Sarlug, Sarnemil.","Las sierpes de las rocas que habitan en las alturas de Cirith Ulunn han aumentado en número y amenazan toda la vida de Tâl Bruinen.","A lo lejos, ves a Sarnemil arrastrarse hacia el sur siguiendo el Bruinen"}},
[14720]={nameES="Preocupaciones desde El Cruce",objectivesES={"Dora Rizopardo está en el centro de El Cruce, al noreste de Cavada Grande.\
\
Peony Cavada te ha pedido que ayudes a su amiga Dora con los lobos que se han apoderado de su granja.","Preocupaciones desde El Cruce","Peony Cavada ha recibido noticias de su amiga Dora Rizopardo, una granjera de gallinas en El Cruce, que los lobos han invadido la Comarca y están amenazando el pueblo."}},
[14721]={nameES="Preocupación por los sierpes",objectivesES={"La amenaza de los sierpes peludos ha ido en aumento tras las incursiones de los Gauredain.","Preocupación por los sierpes","Jyrki se encuentra en el puesto de caza del extremo norte de Talvi-mûri.\
\
Deberías regresar con Jyrki para contarle tu éxito.","Los sierpes de hielo pueden encontrarse por toda Talvi-mûri.\
\
Jyrki te ha pedido que derrotes a los gusanos peludos que amenazan los campamentos de los Lossoth."}},
[14722]={nameES="Worse for Wear",objectivesES={}},
[14723]={nameES="Worse for Wear",objectivesES={"Bring the items to Flint Oakhewer in Bree-town","You found an old horseshoe","A blacksmith has been found","Worse for Wear","Find a blacksmith to help fill the horseshoe order","The blacksmiths of Bree-town can be found near the West-gate.","Éogar can be found at his farm in the Horsefields of Bree.","Éogar has recently increased the number of horses housed at the farm, and his stock of horseshoes has been depleted of late. He could use some help replenishing the stock of shoes.","All of the items required by the blacksmith should be found here in Bree-town. The old horseshoe should be in the fields across the street. The scrap-metal can usually be found among the trash in Beggar's Alley, and the crates of nails should be in the Market Square.","Gave horseshoes to Éogar","Flint is near the Bree-town's West-gate, always busy shaping iron at his forge.\
\
Flint is prepared to make the horseshoes once you can bring the supplies he required back to him.","Find an old horseshoe","Return to Éogar with the horseshoes"}},
[14724]={nameES="Digno de morir por ello",objectivesES={"La Guardia Orca es el principal asentamiento de la Guarnición de Hierro en las Vetas del Cuerno Rojo, localizado en el lado oeste de esa zona.\
\
Hay muchos enanos en la Guardia Orca. Quizás uno de ellos sepa por qué el recientemente muerto Nykr valoraba tanto este pequeño medallón fabricado a mano.","Encuentra a alguien en la Guardia Orca que reconozca el medallón.","Las manos frías y rígidas de este enano sujetan un medallón de bella manufactura. Después de manipularlo un poco, se desvela su acertijo y se abre para revelar dos pequeños grabados: dos caras barbudas de enanos.","Digno de morir por ello"}},
[14725]={nameES="Digno de morir por ello",objectivesES={"Pertenencias de Knakk recogidas","Knakk acampa cerca de la Gran Escalera y está intentando descifrar el rompecabezas del medallón que Kafli llevaba consigo cuando murió. Parece que está a punto de resolver finalmente el intrigante rompecabezas.\
\
Llévale a Knakk sus herramientas.","Recoge las herramientas de Knakk de la caja que hay cerca","Knakk acampa cerca de la Gran Escalera y está intentando resolver el rompecabezas del medallón que Kafli llevaba consigo cuando murió.\
\
Cree que por fin lo ha resuelto, con un poco de ayuda de una herramienta que ha sacado de una caja cercana. Está ansioso por ver finalmente qué hay dentro y quizás descubrir por qué Kafli tenía tanto miedo de perderlo.","Vuelve con Knakk para ayudarle a abrir el medallón","Recuperaste un medallón de Kafli, que había muerto en manos de los orcos. Le entregaste este medallón a su mejor amigo, Knakk, quien viajaba con él. Knakk está tratando de averiguar qué tenía de especial este medallón como para que valiera la pena morir por él.","Digno de morir por ello"}},
[14726]={nameES="Worts, Weeds, and Wastes",objectivesES={"Collected twelve heavily-annotated pages of \\qWorts and Weeds\\q","Find Mílgamel at the Camp of the Host","Collected a surprisingly intact page of \\qWorts and Weeds\\q","Mílgamel can be found at the Camp of the Host in the far north of North Ithilien.\
\
You have finished binding the completed volume of \\qWorts and Weeds\\q and should now speak to Mílgamel.","You have bound the full volume of \\qWorts and Weeds\\q by Golgolas of Ithilien!","Habla con Mílgamel","Worts, Weeds, and Wastes","Mílgamel can be found at the Camp of the Host in the far north of North Ithilien.\
\
You have arrived at the Camp of the Host and should now speak to Mílgamel.","Amid the Orc-filth of Cair Andros, you have found a small pile of books. Most of them have various tears and tatters and a few have been burned.\
\
You sift through the pile of books and come across what seems to be a few singed pages bound to the spine and back cover of \\qWorts and Weeds.\\q The rest of the volume is missing, but you are able to collect five legible pages.","Bind the pages into Mílgamel's transcription of \\qWorts and Weeds\\q","After learning much from the poisons of the Enemy, Mílgamel hopes to devise a means to heal the blasted lands of the Wastes by studying the old herb-lore of Gondor.","While scouring the Halls of Healing in Osgiliath, you have found a decaying volume of \\qWorts and Weeds.\\q\
\
Judging by the crumbling remains of its covers, it seems likely that this could have been the original version written by Golgolas of Ithilien. The pages are largely in poor condition, and those that are still legible have sustained some water damage from the ruined cistern nearby.\
\
You carefully pick up the volume, mark the legible pages, and stow it away.","Collected five slightly singed pages of \\qWorts and Weeds\\q","Torngroth can be found far to the north in North Ithilien, Cair Andros can be found to the south-west of Henneth Annûn, Osgiliath can be found to the east of Minas Tirith, and Ioreth can be found in the High Hall within the Masters' Tier of Minas Tirith.\
\
Mílgamel has asked you to investigate Cair Andros, Osgiliath, and Torngroth in the hope of finding more pages from \\qWorts and Weeds.\\q She also has asked you to return to Ioreth to obtain Galathir's transcription of the book.","Mílgamel can be found at the Camp of the Host in the far north of North Ithilien.\
\
You have found many pages of \\qWorts and Weeds\\q and now surely have a completed volume between them. You should seek out Mílgamel at the Camp of the Host and deliver them to her.","Collected six slightly soggy pages of \\qWorts and Weeds\\q","Collected a slightly smudged page of \\qWorts and Weeds\\q","You have found Mílgamel and should tell her of the pages you found","Talk to Mílgamel at the Camp of the Host","Mílgamel's transcription of \\qWorts and Weeds\\q can be found beside her at the Camp of the Host.\
\
Mílgamel has asked you to bind the new pages into her transcription of \\qWorts and Weeds.\\q"}},
[14727]={nameES="Woses Are Wed",objectivesES={}},
[14728]={nameES="Preferiría minar",objectivesES={"Las rocas portadoras de gemas del tipo que Bothwar describió se pueden encontrar fuera de la entrada de Maethad. Te dijo que siguieras la carretera hacia el norte desde Gabilshathûr hasta que pudieras girar hacia el este y pasar por los árboles dispersos de Gorothlad.\
\
Bothwar está molesto porque lo sacaron de sus esfuerzos de minería para cumplir con la guardia y te ha pedido que termines su minería.","Bothwar está en el puente en el centro de Gabilshathûr, al suroeste de Gorothlad.\
\
Has extraído las rocas portadoras de gemas de las que Bothwar habló y deberías regresar a él con los frutos de tu trabajo.","Lleva las rocas portadoras de gemas a Bothwar","Bothwar de Gabilshathûr está afligido por haber perdido una oportunidad de extraer gemas de calidad.","Preferiría minar"}},
[14729]={nameES="Wounded in Action",objectivesES={}},
[14730]={nameES="Wounds of the Father",objectivesES={"Wounds of the Father","Consigue una hogaza de pan","Collected a loaf of bread","Faltharan and Lord Sirgon can be found in Tumladen in northern Upper Lebennin.\
\
You have gathered a loaf of bread and a great deal of kingsfoil and should now return to Faltharan.","Kingsfoil can be found along the roads and on the fields outside Tumladen. A loaf of bread can be found within Tumladen.\
\
Faltharan has asked for your aid in obtaining food and healing herbs for his father.","Deliver the kingsfoil and bread to Faltharan","Desperate to heal his father from his wounds at the hands of the Haradrim, Faltharan turns to the healing properties of food and lesser-known remedies."}},
[14731]={nameES="Ira y Ruina, Capítulo 1",objectivesES={"Bregdal se puede encontrar en el Campo de la Embestida.\
\
Deberías hablar con Bregdal.","En el fragor de la batalla en los campos del Pelennor, Bregdal, mensajero de Gondor, espera poder ayudarte en todo lo que pueda.","Théoden se puede encontrar en la instancia: Sangre de la Serpiente Negra.","La Serpiente Negra se puede encontrar en la instancia: Sangre de la Serpiente Negra.","Habla con Théoden","Habla con Bregdal","Ira y Ruina, Capítulo 1","Derrota a la Serpiente Negra","Mantente cerca de Théoden.","Deja que acontecimientos sigan su curso"}},
[14732]={nameES="Ira y Ruina, Capítulo 2",objectivesES={"Bregdal se encuentra en el Campo de Embestida.\
\
Deberías hablar con Bregdal.","En el fragor de la batalla en los campos del Pelennor, Bregdal, mensajero de Gondor, espera poder ayudarte en todo lo que pueda.","Bregdal se encuentra en la Muerte de los Reyes.\
\
Deberías hablar con Bregdal.","Habla con Bregdal","Habla con Bregdal cuando lo vuelvas a ver","El enemigo se encuentra en el Campo de Embestida, en los campos del Pelennor.\
\
Derrota a los enemigos en el Campo de Embestida.","Ira y Ruina, Capítulo 2"}},
[14733]={nameES="Ira y Ruina, Capítulo 3",objectivesES={"En el fragor de la batalla en los campos del Pelennor, Bregdal, mensajero de Gondor, espera poder ayudarte en todo lo que pueda.","Bregdal se puede encontrar en la Muerte de los Reyes.\
\
Deberías hablar con Bregdal.","Habla con Peregrin Tuk","La Languidez de Nurn se encuentra en la instancia de La calle silenciosa.","Mantente cerca de Gandalf.","Ira y Ruina, Capítulo 3","Gandalf y Peregrin Tuk se encuentran en la instancia de La calle silenciosa.","Habla con Gandalf","Derrota a la Languidez de Nurn","Deja que acontecimientos sigan su curso","Habla con Bregdal en la Muerte de los Reyes"}},
[14734]={nameES="Ira y Ruina, Capítulo 4",objectivesES={"El enemigo se encuentra en la Muerte de los Reyes, en los campos del Pelennor.\
\
Derrota a los enemigos en la Muerte de los Reyes.","En el fragor de la batalla en los campos del Pelennor, Bregdal, mensajero de Gondor, espera poder ayudarte en todo lo que pueda.","Bregdal se encuentra en la Muerte de los Reyes.\
\
Deberías hablar con Bregdal.","Ira y Ruina, Capítulo 4","Habla con Bregdal la próxima vez que lo encuentres","Habla con Bregdal","Bregdal se encuentra en la Defensa de los Jinetes.\
\
Deberías hablar con Bregdal."}},
[14735]={nameES="Ira y Ruina, Capítulo 5",objectivesES={"En el fragor de la batalla en los campos del Pelennor, Bregdal, mensajero de Gondor, espera poder ayudarte en todo lo que pueda.","Encuentra a Aragorn en la colina al otro lado del río.","Habla con Duinhir","Habla con Aragorn","Habla con Éomer","Habla con Bregdal en la Defensa de los Jinetes","Deja que acontecimientos sigan su curso","Derrota al Despojador Proscrito","Ira y Ruina, Capítulo 5","Bregdal se encuentra en las ruinas de Pel Dúven.\
\
Deberías hablar con Bregdal.","Bregdal se encuentra en la Defensa de los Jinetes.\
\
Deberías hablar con Bregdal.","Mantente cerca de Aragorn.","Habla con Bregdal en las ruinas de Pel Dúven","Duinhir, Aragorn y Éomer se encuentran en la instancia de los Muelles del Harlond.","El Despojador Proscrito se encuentra en la instancia de los Muelles del Harlond."}},
[14736]={nameES="Ira y Ruina, Capítulo 6",objectivesES={"Bregdal se puede encontrar en el Umbral de la Ciudad.\
\
Deberías hablar con Bregdal.","En el fragor de la batalla en los campos del Pelennor, Bregdal, mensajero de Gondor, espera poder ayudarte en todo lo que pueda.","Ira y Ruina, Capítulo 6","Habla con Bregdal en el Umbral de la Ciudad"}},
[14737]={nameES="Wrath of the Daegul",objectivesES={}},
[14738]={nameES="Wrath of the Reeve",objectivesES={"Reeve Athelward resides in his Mead Hall, at the eastern edge of Cliving.\
\
Athelward has asked you to accompany him onto the battlefield, so that he may set an example for his men and to witness your prowess.","Reeve Athelward resides in his Mead Hall, at the eastern edge of Cliving.\
\
Athelward would like to speak with you following your battle in the Norcrofts.","Wrath of the Reeve","Talk to Reeve Athelward","Reeve Athelward is not content with simply giving orders: he wishes to lead by example. He plans to take to the field alongside you, to observe your prowess firsthand."}},
[14739]={nameES="Coronas para Yule",objectivesES={"Anglalaith se encuentra en Duillond.\
\
Anglalaith estará complacido de recibir las ramas que recolectaste y comenzar a trabajar en más coronas.","Anglalaith desea confeccionar algunas coronas para conmemorar esta festividad de Yule.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando finalice el festival actual.</rgb>","Coronas para Yule","Los arbustos se encuentran al oeste de Duillond.\
\
Anglalaith te ha pedido que recolectes algunas ramas de varios arbustos para que pueda terminar de confeccionar sus coronas de Yule.","Lleva las ramas a Anglalaith"}},
[14740]={nameES="Wretched Webs",objectivesES={"New webs have been spun each day since Sauron's fall, and Práguk has tired of clearing them from the road leading to Cirith Ungol.","You have cleared the road to Cirith Ungol of webs, but it is likely that spiders shall soon return to spin new webs and further irritate Práguk.","Wretched Webs","You have cleared the road to Cirith Ungol of webs.","Webs can be found along the road to Cirith Ungol in western Lhingris.\
\
Práguk has asked you to clear webs from the road leading to Cirith Ungol.","Completado"}},
[14741]={nameES="Maestro de la Destrucción",objectivesES={"Habla con Dagfari en Mekhem-bizru","Derrota a Lûrkh","Maestro de la Destrucción","Lûrkh derrotado","Los enanos no creen que la amenaza del campamento de asedio se silencie hasta que el orco fabricante de armas que hace las máquinas sea derrotado.","Dagfari se encuentra en Mekhem-bizru, al noroeste de Drû-garmadh.\
\
Dagfari querrá saber sobre la derrota de Lûrkh y el fin del campamento de asedio.","Lûrkh se encuentra en Drû-garmadh, al sureste de Mekhem-bizru.\
\
Dagfari no cree que las máquinas de asedio se detendrán hasta que su cerebro, Lûrkh, haya sido derrotado."}},
[14742]={nameES="Writhendowns: Driving Back the Enemy",objectivesES={"Núrzum is dead, but the enemy still roams free throughout much of Wildermore.","Ealswith is in Forlaw.\
\
You should return to Ealswith.","<rgb=#FF0000>Completing Wildermore's Recovery will cancel this quest.</rgb>","The forces of Isengard can be found in the Writhendowns.\
\
You should ride to the Writhendowns and defeat the enemies of Wildermore.","Writhendowns: Driving Back the Enemy","Regresa con Ealswith"}},
[14743]={nameES="Writhendowns: Easterlings' Interest",objectivesES={}},
[14744]={nameES="Writhendowns: Hope Alight",objectivesES={"Writhendowns: Hope Alight","<rgb=#FF0000>Completing Wildermore's Recovery will cancel this quest.</rgb>","Ealswith is in Forlaw.\
\
You should return to Ealswith.","Regresa con Ealswith","When lit, the Watch-fires of the Writhendowns fill the people of Wildermore with hope.","Watch-fires can be found along the higher cliffs nearest the lake's edge in the south-western Writhendowns.\
\
You should light Watch-fires to let the watchmen of Forlaw know that the Writhendowns has not entirely fallen under enemy sway."}},
[14745]={nameES="Writhenset: Destrucción de capullos",objectivesES={"Las arañas acechan en las minas de Writhenset, bajo el Bosque Salvaje. Destruir sus repugnantes capullos debería debilitar a la prole y contribuir a que las minas vuelvan a ser seguras para los Pueblos Libres.","Los capullos de araña se pueden encontrar en Writhenset, en el Bosque Salvaje.\
\
Debes destruir los capullos de araña en Writhenset.","Los capullos de araña que se encuentran en Writhenset deben destruirse para debilitar la prole de arañas que acecha bajo el Bosque Salvaje.","Writhenset: Destrucción de capullos"}},
[14746]={nameES="Writhenset: Destrucción de suministros",objectivesES={"En Writhenset, en el Bosque Salvaje, hay cajas de suministros.\
\
Debes destruir las cajas de suministros de Writhenset.","Writhenset: Destrucción de suministros","Los suministros que encuentres en Writhenset deben destruirse para reducir la fuerza de tus enemigos en el Bosque Salvaje.","Los enemigos de los Pueblos Libres almacenan suministros en la mina de Writhenset, situada bajo el Bosque Salvaje. Destruir esas provisiones debería debilitar a los enemigos de esta zona."}},
[14747]={nameES="Writhenset: Enemigos de los Pueblos Libres",objectivesES={"Writhenset: Enemigos de los Pueblos Libres","Hay que derrotar a los enemigos de los Pueblos Libres que se encuentran en Writhenset para proteger a quienes habitan en el Bosque Salvaje.","Acaba con enemigos en Writhenset","Los enemigos de los Pueblos Libres se han apoderado de las minas de Writhenset, situadas bajo el Bosque Salvaje. Derrotarles en este lugar contribuirá a devolver la seguridad al Bosque Salvaje.","Encontrarás enemigos en Writhenset, en el Bosque Salvaje.\
\
Debes derrotar a los enemigos de Writhenset."}},
[14748]={nameES="Writings From Dalugronk",objectivesES={"Writings From Dalugronk","You have found a number of Orkish notes, each with varying degrees of usefulness to the Gabil'akkâ.\
\
Féli in Aslíf will be interested to hear of your findings. Aslíf is on the upper tier of Deepscrave.","Orkish notes with useful information may be scattered around Dalugronk.","Seeking notes from the Orcs in Dalugronk may grant some insight into the current morale of Gorgar's forces.","Talk to Féli in Aslíf","In barely-decipherable handwriting, this note mentions the writer's doubts about the future of Dalugronk. Worms from Skrizagáf have taken over part of the village, chasing out the Orcs and killing those who get too close. To make matters worse, hobgoblins often come to raid the villagers. Gorgar has not extended any support to his people.\
\
While this note may not be considered valuable intelligence, it does grant some insight into the current morale of Gorgar's forces. There may be other similar notes with useful information scattered around Dalugronk."}},
[14749]={nameES="Edictos de honor",objectivesES={"Torogethir se encuentra en su campamento, al norte de Ost Heryn.\
\
Torogethir querrá examinar los edictos y ver si hay alguna forma de cumplirlos.","Lleva los edictos de honor a Torogethir, en su campamento de Parth Aduial.","Edictos de honor","Ost Heryn es una antigua fortaleza construida para apoyar a Fornost. Sin embargo, en momentos de necesidad, su líder traicionó su juramento.","Ost Heryn se encuentra al sur del campamento de Torogethir.\
\
Torogethir te pidió que te adentraras en Ost Heryn y recogieras varios edictos de honor de los espíritus que allí habitan."}},
[14750]={nameES="Wyrm-father",objectivesES={"Defeat the Wyrm-father","You found the passage from the Wyrmdelf out onto Fang Tor.","You found the passage from the Wyrmdelf out onto Fang Tor.\
\
You should confront and defeat the Wyrm-father.","Defeated the Wyrm-father","Bring the Wyrm-father's scale to the Rohirrim at Eaworth","Wyrm-father","There are Rohirrim at Eaworth, south-west of the Wyrmdelf.\
\
You should return to Eaworth and tell someone of the Wyrm-father's defeat.","The Wyrm-father perches upon Fang Tor, outside the Wyrmdelf.\
\
You should defeat the great drake known as the Wyrm-father."}},
[14751]={nameES="Wyrm-father -- Repeatable",objectivesES={"Defeat the Wyrm-father","You found the passage from the Wyrmdelf out onto Fang Tor.","You found the passage from the Wyrmdelf out onto Fang Tor.\
\
You should confront and defeat the Wyrm-father","You should find and defeat the Wyrm-father","Defeated the Wyrm-father","Bring the Wyrm-father's scale to the Rohirrim at Eaworth","There are Rohirrim at Eaworth, south-west of the Wyrmdelf.\
\
You should return to Eaworth and tell someone of the Wyrm-father's defeat.","The Wyrm-father perches upon Fang Tor, outside the Wyrmdelf.\
\
You should defeat the great drake known as the Wyrm-father.","Wyrm-father -- Repeatable"}},
[14752]={nameES="Yarrow in the Snow",objectivesES={"Céolflad has asked that you search for yarrow to see if Aldstan's wound can be staunched.","Yarrow and snow can be found to the east of the refugees' cave in the northern High Knolls.\
\
You should collect yarrow and snow for a poultice to try to save the Thane.","Yarrow in the Snow","Céolflad can be found in the refugees' cave north of Byre Tor in the High Knolls.\
\
You should return to Céolflad with the yarrow and snow.","Bring the poultice ingredients to Céolflad"}},
[14753]={nameES="¿Sí o no?",objectivesES={"Habla con Bingo en el lado oeste de Harwick","Bingo está en el lado oeste de Harwick, cerca de la Sala de Artesanía.\
\
Bingo parece bastante encariñado con el poney que Cuthbald te ha mostrado.","Habla con Bingo en el establo de Cuthbald, en el lado este de Harwick","Cuthbald te ha pedido reunirte con él en el lado oeste de Harwick, cerca de la Sala de Artesanía.\
\
Cuthbald cree que puede tener una oportunidad más de encontrar una montura adecuada para que Bingo recorra Rohan.","Crinloca come una manzana con entusiasmo. ¡Has encontrado su comida favorita!","Bingo se encuentra en el lado oeste del pueblo de Harwick, cerca de la sala de artesanía.","Crinloca se niega a comer el queso.","Este caballo es muy hermoso, pero Bingo lo mira con desconfianza.","Bingo luce una enorme sonrisa. Este no parece darle miedo.","Bingo mira nerviosamente los altos hombros de este caballo y sacude la cabeza.","Crinloca se niega a comer la panceta.","Habla con Cuthbald en el lado oeste de Harwick, cerca de la Sala de Artesanía","Busca en Harwick comida que Crinloca quiera comer y llévasela al lado oeste del pueblo","Bingo está en el establo de Cuthbald, en el lado este de la ciudad de Harwick, en el Páramo.\
\
Bingo ha aceptado a regañadientes ver los caballos a la venta del mercader Cuthbald, pero ninguno de ellos lo convence.","Cuthbald te ha desafiado a buscar en Harwick comida que el quisquilloso Crinloca quiera comer.","Cuthbald está en el lado oeste de Harwick, cerca de la Sala de Artesanía.","Bingo ha admitido a regañadientes que quizá necesite un caballo si quiere explorar el reino de Rohan.","Este caballo está calmado para su cuidador, pero Bingo parece nervioso.","Cuthbald, el mercader de caballos, está en su establo en el lado este de Harwick, en el Páramo.","Hay varios buenos caballos disponibles para que los examines en el establo de Cuthbald, en el lado este de Harwick, en el Páramo.","Cuthbald está en el lado oeste de Harwick, cerca de la Sala de Artesanía.\
\
Has encontrado la comida favorita de Crinloca, y ahora Cuthbald estará encantado de darle el poney a Bingo.","Habla con Cuthbald en su establo en Harwick","Habla con Cuthbald en el lado oeste de Harwick","Bingo planea ir a ver a Cuthbald en el lado este de la ciudad de Harwick, en el Páramo.\
\
Bingo ha aceptado a regañadientes ver los caballos a la venta del mercader Cuthbald.","Crinloca se niega a comer los hongos.","Cuthbald te ha mostrado un poney en el lado oeste de Harwick, y debes decidir si sería una buena montura para Bingo.","Crinloca se niega a comer el repollo."}},
[14754]={nameES="Relatos del Año 1: Frodo",objectivesES={"Desde el elevado mirador sobre el Entaguas, las Colinas de las Almenaras se alzan silenciosas en la distancia","Tarjeta de búsqueda completada.","<rgb=#FF00FF>Acaricia</rgb> a Garra, el perro del granjero Maggot","<rgb=#FF00FF>Acaricia</rgb> a Colmillo, el perro del granjero Maggot","<rgb=#FF00FF>Desmáyate</rgb> en el campamento de los Montaraces bajo la Cima de los Vientos","Y aun mientras se desvanecía, alcanzó a ver a Trancos saltar con una antorcha encendida...","Esta tarjeta de búsqueda contiene una lista de cosas por encontrar. ¡Podrían estar en cualquier lugar!","Disfruta de una comida en la casa de Tom Bombadil","Has conversado con Lobelia","Las tarjetas cuelgan del Árbol de la Fiesta. Cada una contiene una búsqueda que puedes completar a tu propio ritmo.","La comida es abundante y reconfortante, y la bebida es agua clara y fría.","Habla con Frodo en la habitación de Bilbo en Rivendel","Saltó por los aires, rodó fuera de la mesa y luego ¡simplemente desapareció!","<rgb=#FF00FF>Siéntate</rgb> en la silla en lo alto de Amon Hen","Relatos del Año 1: Frodo","<rgb=#FF00FF>Baila</rgb> sobre una mesa en el Poney Pisador","Cada primavera se celebra la Búsqueda del Tesoro del Aniversario para conmemorar una ocasión muy especial.\
