[14787]={nameES="Yes Means Snow",objectivesES={"Carolyn Goodnough is pleased that you have come to visit Winter-home. She told you there is fun to be had all throughout Winter-home, even outside of the town.\
\
She recommends you talk to Virgil Greenfield out in the field. He has been building snowmen to fill out the Yule cheer of Winter-home and would love help making more of them.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> NOTE: This quest will be removed from your quest log when the current festival ends. </rgb>","Virgil Greenfield would like to teach you the simple pleasures of building a snowman.  Speak to him for guidance.","Yes Means Snow"}},
