[14809]={nameES="Zidir-nesad: Epilogue",objectivesES={"You hear not the sound of conflict, but the sound of lives being lived","When you arrive, Prince Ingór sits confidently upon the throne","This is a good place to <rgb=#FF0000>listen</rgb> to the sounds of Máttugard","Talk to Prince Ingór at Vérnozal","<rgb=#FF0000>Look</rgb> out over Máttugard at the Steepset","Rísti Graver can be found at the Steepset in Máttugard.\
\
You should talk to Rísti Graver.","Talk to Rísti Graver","<rgb=#FF0000>Listen</rgb> to the sounds of Máttugard at the Steepset","Examine the fully restored throne","The Steepset can be found in Máttugard.\
\
You should <rgb=#FF0000>look</rgb> out over Máttugard at Steepset.","Return to the throne of Zidir-nesad","Prince Ingór can be found at Vérnozal in Máttugard.\
\
You should talk to Prince Ingór.","The Steepset can be found in Máttugard.\
\
You should <rgb=#FF0000>listen</rgb> to the sounds of Máttugard at the Steepset.","You begin to see a home for the Zhélruka, for all dwarves, in this Mighty Court","The Throne of Zidir-nesad can be found at the Steepset in Máttugard.\
\
You should return to the Throne of Zidir-nesad.","The throne has been restored, as impressive as when it was newly-made","This is a good place to <rgb=#FF0000>look</rgb> out over Máttugard","Zidir-nesad, the seat of Gundabad's lord, has been restored.","Zidir-nesad: Epilogue","The Throne of Zidir-nesad can be found at the Steepset in Máttugard.\
\
You should examine the fully restored throne.","Talk to Prince Ingór upon the throne at Steepset","Prince Ingór can be found at the Steepset in Máttugard.\
\
You should talk to Prince Ingór."}},
[14810]={nameES="Zidir-nesad: The Jewel of Abhâr",objectivesES={"A silver drake can be found in the Welkin-lofts.\
