\
You should add the Jewel of Abhâr to the Throne of Zidir-nesad under Rísti Graver's supervision.","Collect the horn of a silver drake","<rgb=#FF0000>Give</rgb> the silver drake-horn to Mangur Bentpenny","Talk to Rísti Graver","Rísti Graver can be found at the Steepset in Máttugard.\
