\
You should <rgb=#FF0000>give</rgb> the Iron Crown treasures to Mangur Bentpenny.","Add the Jewel of Abhâr to the Throne of Zidir-nesad","Talk to Mangur Bentpenny about the Jewel of Abhâr","Mangur Bentpenny reluctantly hands you the Jewel of Abhâr","Mangur Bentpenny can be found in the Welkin-lofts.\
