[14822]={nameES="Óinsbridge: Exotic Arms",objectivesES={"Óinsbridge: Exotic Arms","Óinsbridge stands where the Forest River snakes into Mirkwood at the edge of the Thornholt,. A once-mighty span that has crumbled to a precipitous and treacherous skeleton athwart the water, now under siege by the regrouping Ungoledain.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Warning: This quest requires Óinsbridge: Scurrying Spiders to be underway. If that quest has been completed or failed, you will be unable to exit and re-enter this instance in order to complete this quest.</rgb>","Gather Ungoladan-weapons.","You gathered Ungoladan-weapons.","Completado"}},
[14823]={nameES="Óinsbridge: Infestation",objectivesES={"Defeat Ungoladan invaders in Óinsbridge.","Óinsbridge stands where the Forest River snakes into Mirkwood at the edge of the Thornholt,. A once-mighty span that has crumbled to a precipitous and treacherous skeleton athwart the water, now under siege by the regrouping Ungoledain.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Warning: This quest requires Óinsbridge: Scurrying Spiders to be underway. If that quest has been completed or failed, you will be unable to exit and re-enter this instance in order to complete this quest.</rgb>","Ungoladan invaders in Óinsbridge have been defeated.","Óinsbridge: Infestation","Completado"}},
[14824]={nameES="Óinsbridge: Scurrying Spiders",objectivesES={"Defeat Helghúr","Talk to Stráhek the Stout","You ran out of time...","Óinsbridge stands where the Forest River snakes into Mirkwood at the edge of the Thornholt,. A once-mighty span that has crumbled to a precipitous and treacherous skeleton athwart the water, now under siege by the regrouping Ungoledain.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Warning: This quest has a one hour time limit. The timer will begin upon accepting the quest.</rgb>","Defeat Helghúr in Óinsbridge.","Defeated Helghúr","Óinsbridge: Scurrying Spiders","You should return to to Stráhek the Stout in Skarháld and let him know of your victory at Óinsbridge."}},
